INSERT INTO `games` VALUES (1,'Nightmare Kart: The Old Karts',NULL,'Racing, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An upcoming free expansion to Nightmare Kart with a brand new mini-campaign, racers, karts, tracks, power-ups, and game modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d8y.jpg'),(2,'The Undying Beast','2020-04-13','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','There was a flash of light, a choir of glass, and the sound of sirens approaching. Then for what seemed like eternity, a black hollow void. Suddenly you found yourself within a new plane. Dead trees and fog is all that surrounds you. You hear no birds or signs of life, but strange cackles and moans sound from the distance. And then you notice out of the corner of your eye you may not be alone here.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hwv.jpg'),(3,'Sengoku Anthology','2009-09-01','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 2','Sengoku Anthology is a collection of three games in SNK\'s Sengoku arcade franchise, which includes Sengoku (1991), Sengoku 2 (1993), and Sengoku 3 (2001). In addition to playing the classic arcade games on PC and PS2, players can unlock artwork by completing each game in the collection. The Sengoku titles are classic scrolling beat \'em up action games. Up to two players can play simultaneously. One of the features of these games is the ability to collect power-ups to gain new weapons or transform your character into special characters. In Sengoku 3, players choose different characters with unique weapons and special attacks at the beginning of each level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bvbun2zofisapzrjlk71.jpg'),(4,'Rockman X: New Year 2023','2023-01-01','Shooter, Platform','Super Famicom','A small hack to celebrate the Chinese New Year 2023, Year of the Rabbit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lie.jpg'),(5,'Mario Kart Tour: Vancouver Tour','2020-02-12','Racing','Android, iOS','Juego de carreras perteneciente a la saga Mario Kart para móviles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mk2.jpg'),(6,'Microsoft Flight Simulator X: Steam Edition - Cessna C208B Grand Caravan','2018-05-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Developed by Carenado, the FSX: Steam Edition rendition of the Cessna C208B Grand Caravan is a hugely detailed and accurate aircraft. It comes in seven paint schemes, features accurate flight dynamics and realistic instruments including autopilot, custom weather radar and an original GNS 430.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85tp.jpg'),(7,'Everlasting Tower','2013-07-17','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Escape a fiery death by climbing this tower for as long as you can.\n\nA simple randomly-generated vertical platformer with a retro feel. See for how long you can endure the everlasting tower.\n\nHas 4 difficulty levels and local high-scores.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jbc.jpg'),(8,'King of Throwing','2023-12-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Author’s suggestion: Use a notepad to record the angles of your throws. Players can aim and throw by clicking the left mouse button, and control the character’s left and right movement by pressing A and D. Control the angle of your throw, you don\'t want to make a mistake','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e43.jpg'),(9,'Zia and the goddesses of magic','2016-09-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a world where magic is Queen, people lived happily and safely under the protection of the ten guardian goddesses. \nOut of the unknown came a powerful demon who brought trouble upon the world, and all the goddesses got captured and locked away. \nZia is a little girl who lives in a village in the mountains with her parents. \nWhen she was younger, she discovered a spell book and started to practice magic. \nAn old wise man came and told Zia about the existence of several spell books spread around the world. \nDuring her journey, Zia will discover the trapped goddesses. \nNow is your chance to help her rescue the goddesses from the evil creatures by casting magic spells!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7l2a.jpg'),(10,'Mortal Kombat 11: Kombat Pack','2019-04-23','Fighting','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"The Kombat Pack is the best way to upgrade your Mortal Kombat Standard Edition.\n\nThe Kombat Pack includes:\n- 6 new add-on playable characters including Shang Tsung, Nightwolf, Terminator T-800, Sindel, The Joker and Spawn\n- 1 week early access to all add-on characters\n- Skins & gear sets with each add-on character\n- 6 themed skin packs including the Klassic Arcade Ninjas, Klassic Arcade Fighters and more\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25dh.jpg'),(11,'Bomb Squad Academy','2017-03-27','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Save the world one wire at a time with Bomb Squad Academy, a puzzle game where you have to defuse bombs under a time constraint.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2332.jpg'),(12,'Enchanted in the Moonlight','2014-02-03','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Is he only after my power? Or is this love real…? Life as you know it changes forever when you\'re rescued by an otherworldly ayakashi. \"Give me your power and I\'ll protect you.\" If I agree, my body and soul are his…\n\nIncluded in the \"Love 365: Find Your Story\" app.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6627.jpg'),(13,'Steel Salvo','2021-04-07','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pilot a hulking mech and protect Triton from robot hordes. With the help of your team, vanquish the robot overlord!  \nExperience super-fast FPS mecha action in this short but challenging single-player game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xds.jpg'),(14,'Sexy Memory Puzzle: Gay Pool',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15,'Data Loss','2020-05-01','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Corporations suck!! Money\'Surance Corp especially sucks, so you\'re taking it upon yourself to hack the Money\'Surance Corp Tower, steal money from the higher ups, and erase the debts of everyone subject to its monopoly.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29t9.jpg'),(16,'Kidnapped','2015-08-04','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Kidnapped is a psychological story-driven horror game, featuring emphasis on exploration, puzzle solving and combat. Kidnapped dynamically changes as the player progresses, and aims to unnerve the player. Traverse a two hundred year old manor, dark damp caves, an eerie forest and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ab3g3rlsbjb45pn5iftd.jpg'),(17,'Hunter Hitman','2025-01-02','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hunt or be hunted. Execute stealth kills and survive in this action-packed assassin game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9op2.jpg'),(18,'Merge Games Horror Bundle','2023-10-27','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','What do dark Nordic fables, intergalactic cruises and Lovecraftian gore all have in common? Gruesome, gory and ghoulish monsters! Dive into the horror-themed worlds of Bramble: The Mountain King, Morbid: The Seven Acolytes and Slaycation Paradise - if you dare!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d6t.jpg'),(19,'Flashy Maze',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q64.jpg'),(20,'Wubble Bubbles',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(21,'Mortal Kombat','1994-04-01','Fighting','Sega CD','Mortal Kombat is a side-scrolling fighting game. Fighting is set as one-on-one combat, allowing each player to perform a variety of punches, kicks, and special moves in order to defeat their opponent. When the opponent faces their second round loss, the winner can perform a finishing move called a \"Fatality\" on the loser. The Fatality is a move unique to each fighter that graphically kills the loser in a blood-soaked finale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69zn.jpg'),(22,'Giant Mario Bros.','2021-12-08','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','This hack will make Mario and Luigi huge, twice their size.\n\nThe levels remain basically the same, but some changes have been made to accommodate the resizing of the player.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s6n.jpg'),(23,'Soul Rush','2024-11-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ofe.jpg'),(24,'The Tomb of Corruption','2024-07-11','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore procedurally generated dungeons and slash hordes of monsters in THE TOMB OF CORRUPTION! - A 3D action RPG with rogue-lite elements. Fully customize your melee and ranged weapon with hundreds of upgrades, unlock skills, upgrade your armor and get ready to enter the voxel dungeon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7uvf.jpg'),(25,'WekaInvaders','2017-12-12','Shooter','Sega Master System/Mark III','Each one of Weka Invaders\' 40 levels consists of a certain number of blocks which hide several Wekas that will eventually emerge and chase Waimanu, and even shoot at him sometimes.\n\nWaimanu should drive each Weka out of the blocks and eliminate them before the time runs out. Wekas can be eliminated by either shooting at them or by shaking them off the floor.\n\nPoints are awarded for each block destroyed and for each eliminated Weka. Also, points are given for destroying the passing UFO, for powerup pickups and for each second left after completing the level. An additional life is awarded when 25,000 points are reached and you can earn one more life every additional 50,000 points after that.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61wa.jpg'),(26,'Dark Castle','1991-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','The Genesis port of Dark Castle features colored graphics, and music during gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lhj.jpg'),(27,'Banners of Ruin: Iris','2023-09-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Summon spirits that augment your party with the haunted fox, Iris!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7185.jpg'),(28,'Lurking Danger','2025-03-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lurking Danger is a survival horror where Elena and Regina, two diner waitresses, uncover a dark secret. Reality twists into a nightmare as they face terrifying creatures. Play solo or in split-screen co-op, solve puzzles, and fight for survival in a haunting atmosphere.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9luh.jpg'),(29,'Mortal Kombat HD Arcade Kollection',NULL,'Fighting','PlayStation 3','Before the announcement of Mortal Kombat: Arcade Kollection, different online stores started listing Mortal Kombat HD: Arcade Kollection. It was supposed to include Mortal Kombat 1, Mortal Kombat II and Ultimate Mortal Kombat 3, just like the released version. However unlike the released version, the cancelled HD-Version also had new sounds and completely new graphics with new actors portraying the characters in HD.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20mf.jpg'),(30,'Soccer Cup 2022',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(31,'Moonlight Destiny','2001-07-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Chinese developed role-playing game that was later localized into Japanese by Nihon Falcom under the name Moonlight Destiny.\n\nYue Ying Chuan Shuo Jian Xia Qing Yuan Wai Zhuan is a role-playing game. Many years ago, two of the most famous people in Wulin were Yang Xilie and Shangguan Feilong. Yang Xilie, as his name implies, has a fierce personality, and often competes with Shangguan Feilong. But Shangguan Feilong is indifferent to fame and fortune and dislikes fighting with others, so he ignores his provocations, which makes Yang Xilie more and more angry. After a thrilling life-and-death struggle, Shangguan Feilong was defeated by Yang Xilie at last. But eventually the two men and up that. Ten years after those events Yang Yingfeng (Yang Xilie\'s son) is already a young man. He still remembers the scene ten years ago. Yang Yingfeng feels that he should go out for an adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mm1.jpg'),(32,'Naruto x Boruto: Ninja Tribes','2020-03-09','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser, Android, iOS','Naruto x Boruto: Ninja Tribes is based on the popular Naruto and Boruto anime series and brings together fan-favorite characters spanning multiple generations of both franchises for one-tap team-based battles.\n\nA turn-based RPG being developed by Bandai Namco, now planned for release on the Enza platform in Japan which includes PC and Mobile web browsers as well as standalone apps for iOS and Android.\n\nOriginal planned for release in 2018 as Naruto x Boruto: Borutical Generations, the game was delayed and eventually re-announced under a new title, Project: Tri, on May 15th 2019.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pwh.jpg'),(33,'Maid for Loving You','2019-03-29','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Average guy Yuuma suddenly finds his boring life becoming way more exciting when he encounters a mysterious woman named Eve. Join him as he discovers the joys of having a live-in maid in this heartwarming visual novel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6owy.jpg'),(34,'Tom Clancy\'s Ghost Recon: Wildlands - The Peruvian Connection','2017-12-31','Shooter, Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Travel to the high mountains of Bolivia to break the deadly alliance between the Santa Blanca and the Peruvian cartels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c7g.jpg'),(35,'Sesame Street Mecha Builders','2024-01-25','Sin género','Android, iOS','Embark on exciting adventures with Mecha Elmo, Cookie Monster, and Abby Cadabby! Explore science, engineering, creativity, and math through engaging games and activities designed for kids aged 2-6. Endless fun and learning await!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rrw.jpg'),(36,'LocoRoco Cocoreccho','2007-09-20','Platform, Puzzle','PlayStation 3','LocoRoco Cocoreccho! (or Oideyo LocoRoco!! BuuBuu Cocoreccho! (おいでよロコロコ！！ BuuBuu Cocoreccho!?), in Japan, meaning \"LocoRoco Come On Over(!)! BuuBuu Cocoreccho!\") is a video game in the LocoRoco series released on the PlayStation Network for PlayStation 3 on September 21, 2007.[1] Described as an \"interactive screensaver\",[2] LocoRoco Cocoreccho! features an autonomous two-dimensional environment in which the world and characters play even without input from the player.[3] The game is capable of running at full high-definition 1080p display resolution.[2]','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3irb.jpg'),(37,'The Sword of Hope II','2012-08-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, Game Boy','The Sword of Hope II is a role-playing game. Take on the role of young Prince Theo of Riccar and embark on a mission to find the truth behind a mystery that is threatening the kingdom. The key to solving the numerous puzzles and gimmicks is the use of commands like \"look,\" \"open\" and \"hit.\" You\'ll encounter many places and items during the adventure, plus some friends waiting to lend a hand along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9icz.jpg'),(38,'Hot Lap League: Deluxe Edition','2022-08-23','Racing, Sport, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Take complete control of your vehicle, perfect your driving, and prove your place in the Hot Lap League. Drift and race your car around 150+ mind blowing tracks, each requiring unique techniques and strategies. Improving your time by racing your best is the only way to the top.\n\nIt’s you, the track and the clock - no driving assist, no nonsense.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hep.jpg'),(39,'Way of the Samurai 3: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50tu.jpg'),(40,'Bombardier','2023-09-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bombardier is a quick and chaotic online multiplayer game which supports up to 8 players in an arena, or play locally with up to 4 of your closest friends and battle to be crowned the ultimate Bombardier!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5c2a.jpg'),(41,'NextDoor','2021-04-02','Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Short cinematic pixel horror game based on Junji Ito\'s manga.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78y5.jpg'),(42,'Adventure Academia: The Fractured Continent - Vol.2 Bonus Unit: Kiesel','2022-12-09','Strategy','Nintendo Switch','Description: Adds Kiesel, a main character from the storyline, into the game as a playable character.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(43,'Crossroad OS','2023-12-08','Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crossʀoad OS is a single-player adventure where you solve puzzles, meet strange creatures and explore a sacred operating system created as a junction between the human and spirit world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hmm.jpg'),(44,'Hentai Tales: Saimin Kouhai','2025-02-14','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','One day, in the club room, the protagonist downloaded a hypnosis app for some reason. Everything starts to change when the protagonist starts making jokes about it on Miyagami Yui. What will happen there?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oo8.jpg'),(45,'Castlevania Judgment','2009-01-15','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Wii','Castlevania Judgement is a first in many: it\'s the first Castlevania beat\'em up. It\'s also the first time old friends of the Belmont clan meet together in a full 3D environment.\n\nGalamoth pursues to change the course of fate by resurrecting a 10,000 year old demon, Time Reaper, to destroy Dracula. Aeon, a magician who discovers Galamoth\'s plan, summons past and present Castlevania heroes through a time rift to stop Galamoth.\n\nCastlevania Judgement is a 3D beat em up where you go one-on-one against friends or computer foes. Several different game modes like the usual beat em up modes of story, training and versus. In addition there\'s a Castle mode, where you must venture through Dracula\'s Castle before going face to face with Time Reaper. Survival mode has you fighting for time as there are no continues.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z4e.jpg'),(46,'Dead by Daylight: Steady Pulse','2025-05-06','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dead by Daylight’s Steady Pulse includes a new Survivor, Orela Rose onto the scene. Purchasing this add-on unlocks an exclusive Cosmetic: Black and White Blazer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rxx.jpg'),(47,'1187','2010-10-17','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Almost a decade after the black mesa incident which opened up the portal storms you find yourself trying to cope with its aftermath, creatures appeared which came out of what seemed to be thin air. They cam without warning and swept the world, it is during this time that you find yourself your apartment. Alone. For no apparent reason you\\\'ve been approached as in a dream by a man in a suit. Having no idea of what\\\'s going on all you can do is try to stay alive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84i3.jpg'),(48,'Kimi ga Ita Kisetsu','2001-08-03','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48ec.jpg'),(49,'Gunman Clive 2','2015-01-29','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gunman Clive returns in an all new adventure. Now in Color!\n\nGunman Clive 2 retains the same classic gameplay formula, but dials the action up a notch further, with improved and more colorful graphics, more dynamic levels and richer, more diverse environments, bigger bosses and tons of new enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2479.jpg'),(50,'Zombie Apocalypse','2017-02-15','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After a technological disaster, most of the world\'s population is turned into zombies. The cities are in ruins, but a small percentage of people survived, and are now hiding in shelters. You one of the survivors. Your task is to protect your shelter from the crowds of zombies and bloodthirsty mutants. You have a wide arsenal of weapons and upgrades at your disposal. You can also improve barricades at the shelter entrance, or create machine-gun towers that are very efficient against crowds of enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jlz.jpg'),(51,'Divinity: Original Sin 2 - Eternal Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ced.jpg'),(52,'Nature Escapes: Collector\'s Edition','2023-01-26','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Get ready to get lost in the wild beauty of Nature with this hidden object game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62x1.jpg'),(53,'She Turned Me Into a Newt!','2021-01-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'ve been turned into a newt by a necromantress! Your task is to find the way to turn back.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co410u.jpg'),(54,'Entangled','2021-07-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Entangled is a physics game where you solve puzzles with a grappling gun. It\'s a 2D platformer where you\'ll be immersed in a colorful environment while being entranced by a relaxing space ambient soundtrack. All this while you think your way through a number of cleverly crafted physics puzzles. These puzzles are challenging and were made specifically to evoke the aha moment in players when figuring out their secrets...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5h3d.jpg'),(55,'Reveal Fantasia','2002-03-20','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','Reveal Fantasia Is a Fantasy role playing video game released in 2002 for the PlayStation 2 console by Victor Interactive Software, Inc. in Japan. The game involved an innovative concept of a role playing game involving no battles or fighting. Its game play shows some influence from dating simulation games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99rg.jpg'),(56,'Space Tow Truck',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Space Tow Truck is a 100% pure physics puzzle game with a beautiful scifi narrative full of humor. You play as an astronaut that has to, after a painful car crash landing on the Moon, use the laws of mechanics to get out of trouble. Come and discover the Moon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41w9.jpg'),(57,'Starseeker: Astroneer Expeditions','2026-12-31','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Nintendo Switch 2, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','STARSEEKER is a new game set within the Astroneer universe with a focus on discovery, cooperative expeditions, and camaraderie. Exploring deep space on the ESS Starseeker, players will need to work together with the entire crew of the space station to complete planet- wide objectives across a multitude of star systems using cutting edge technology.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m4v.jpg'),(58,'V.H.S : Video.Horror.Story',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','V.H.S is a first person horror game where the player can change the frequency of the camera to reveal either the environment or the monsters. But only one at a time.\n\nV.H.S was made in 48h for the Global Game Jam 2017, at the Isart Digital in Paris. This is the post-jam version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co255u.jpg'),(59,'Woofice Chair!','2020-10-05','Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome to Goodboi Park! Help the park defenders defend it from body-builders with their swivelling chairs!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(60,'You Understand Kawaii','2021-03-18','Simulator, Indie','Web browser','Communicate with strangers\' dogs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4stt.jpg'),(61,'HoloSona5','2024-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Hololive fanmade RPG inspired by modern phantom thief games. You save the \"Poitter\" from being taken over by a millionaire. A 1-2 hour turn-based game where you explore dungeons and exploit weaknesses in combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oou.jpg'),(62,'Wizard Fire','2010-04-16','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Arcade, Zeebo','Wizard Fire was released in the US as such, although it is a direct sequel to Gate of Doom and Data East archives still refer to the game as Gate of Doom II. The series is known as Dark Seal in Japan.\n\nThe class types to choose from are wizard, bard, knight, elf or dwarf. Each of the heroes has a unique standard attack, access to magic and one passive ability. The wizard does maximum magic damage, the bard is resistant to poison, the knight is immune to disease, the elf has increased mobility and the dwarf is resistant to confusion. Unlike the previous game, magic attacks are not unique to each class, though specific characters have a higher chance of using certain attacks. There is also the chance, for any class except the wizard, that the spell will fail and you will transform into a pig for a short time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3to3.jpg'),(63,'Kaseki no Uta','2000-01-28','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kaseki no Uta is an adult romance adventure game released by âge on January 28, 2000.\nGod created man. And man created \"dolls. But what is the difference between these \"dolls\" and us humans?\n\nThis is a rare and monstrous work that mixes several motifs often used as popular elements in recent years, and then weaves them into a science fiction story!\n\nHowever, what is this inexpressible sadness that lingers deeply in the heart at the end...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ho9.jpg'),(64,'War for the Overworld: Anniversary Collection',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zro.jpg'),(65,'Hoi Hoi',NULL,'Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','A turn-based strategy-puzzle game released by Koei for the FM-7 and PC-88 in 1983, later remade as Stop That Roach for the Game Boy in 1994. The gameplay is similar to later tower defense games, with the goal being to protect confectionaries from cockroaches.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/urgevy4c5kyxcralcldi.jpg'),(66,'Minecraft: Angry Birds','2022-05-17','Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Pigs are back to their old tricks, and it\'s up to you to stop them! Playing as Red, Chuck, Bomb, and other members of The Flock, your mission is to rescue your friends, save the eggs, and stop the pesky Pigs\' grand plans. With each rescued bird, you\'ll unlock a new playable character with unique skills to help you pop more Pigs and topple more towers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co543e.jpg'),(67,'Dynasty Warriors 5: Xtreme Legends','2005-11-15','Tactical, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 2','Dynasty Warriors 5: Xtreme Legends is a standalone expansion to Dynasty Warriors 5.\n\nIt brings back Xtreme Mode and Legend Mode from Dynasty Warriors 4: Xtreme Legends while introducing Destiny Mode where players can fight under one of the three kingdoms as an edit officer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45su.jpg'),(68,'Jungle Strike: The Sequel to Desert Strike','1995-12-31','Shooter','Sega Game Gear','Some time after Operation Desert Strike, Ibn Kilbaba, son of Kilbaba Sr., threatens to annihilate America. After his father was killed, the people who were under his control sent his son running off, along with his father\'s money and nuclear weapons program. Kilbaba, more ruthless than his father, longs for revenge for his father\'s death and decides to shed the blood of those who killed him, the Americans. Already armed, Kilbaba hires Carlos Ortega to help him set up his nuclear weapons program, deep in South America. Carlos Ortega, the world\'s most notorious drug lord, also yearns to seek revenge. With his own private army, armed with the most hi-tech weapons, he\'s ready to fight America at all costs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a7r.jpg'),(69,'Escape Doodland','2018-11-30','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Death and destruction came into Doodland. This happy and joyful land is going to change. Forever. You play as one of Doodlers, a peaceful inhabitant of happy doodle world, attacked by a merciless monster. There are only two options: run as fast as you can or die.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hln.jpg'),(70,'Sonic Boom: Shattered Crystal','2014-11-11','Platform','Nintendo 3DS','In Sonic Boom: Shattered Crystal, Amy discovers a secret ancient language and manuscript detailing the history and whereabouts of a Lost Crystal of Power. The evil and vile villain, Lyric the Last Ancient, kidnaps Amy in his eagerness to get his claws on this long-forgotten power that has been hidden throughout the jungles and canyons of a mysterious new island. Sonic must team up with Tails, Knuckles and new friend Sticks the Badger to trace Amy’s footsteps and save her from the clutches of Lyric and his robot army. By trusting in their own abilities and working as a team, they will prove they are stronger together than they are apart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7be4.jpg'),(71,'Cursed Angel: Time Paradox','2023-01-12','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cursed Angel is a new time travel and time manipulation strategy game. It\'s a game where you can choose between life or death, good or evil, to change your fate, your future and your past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uew.jpg'),(72,'Silenced',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crossing the Kingdom destroyed by the \"devil\" and using wisdom to defeat the enemy like the tide But can ordinary people really do it? Does an uncelebrated adventure really make sense? Anyway, this quiet adventure on the road to death has quietly begun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47c6.jpg'),(73,'Castaway','2010-05-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Web browser','Stranded on a mysterious island, it is up to you to restore peace to its villagers. Become a powerful warrior - growing your powers and abilities through over 50 quests across a distinct and visually stylized world. Discover and raise loyal pets that will fight by your side in this unique action RPG. Customize your appearance as you gain new armor and weapons from wooden sticks to elemental swords.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4chn.jpg'),(74,'Zombie Tactics','2014-12-24','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Web browser','Tactical turn-based zombie survival game, featuring full story, survival mode, and alternative endings! Lead your team through the zombie apocalypse, earning items and skill points along the way. What ethical choices will you make later in the story?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8q9d.jpg'),(75,'Kick-the-Can','2001-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','A Flash game formerly featured on Cartoon Network\'s website in which characters featured on the channel play tag.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81kv.jpg'),(76,'Kaboom: The Suicide Bombing Game','2002-04-17','Simulator','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(77,'Sinjid: Battle Arena','2007-09-03','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser','Sinjid: Battle Arena is the first game in the Sinjid series. It is a role-playing action-adventure game made for flash. It has a turn based battle system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/f6b6qmniwpfrecjdguku.jpg'),(78,'Presidential Knockout','2006-07-15','Fighting','Web browser','Presidential Knockout is a comedic Flash-based fighting game developed by Miniclip. The game allows players to choose a presidential candidate to engage in a humorous boxing match, using simple keyboard controls for jabs, uppercuts, and blocking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94mg.jpg'),(79,'I Saw Her Standing There','2012-04-12','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','i saw her standing there is a game about a young man\'s relationship with his girlfriend who has turned into a zombie. This relationship is presented as a simple platformer with minimalistic graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sq9.jpg'),(80,'Mario Kart: Double Dash!! Matching Game','2003-12-31','Puzzle','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qty.jpg'),(81,'Rayman Legends','2021-11-23','Platform, Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','The Glade of Dreams is in trouble once again! The nightmares multiplied and spread, creating new monsters even more terrifying than before!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ma8.jpg'),(82,'Chocolate makes you happy: Valentine\'s Day','2019-01-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Casual colorful physical puzzle with sweets, jumpers, teleports, accelerators, reverse gravity, traps, treadmills, Cupids, hearts, Valentines art and explosions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o69.jpg'),(83,'Mario Party 4 Deluxe','2024-10-06','Card & Board Game','Nintendo GameCube','Mario Party 4 Deluxe is a mod of Mario Party 4 that expands the game by changing its item roster to one of a whopping 36 items. Does the Mini-Mega system get tiresome pretty quickly? Well, here\'s more items to play with to spice up the Mario Party 4 experience! Returning, important staples from the Mario Party series that were absent in vanilla Mario Party 4, include Mushrooms, Golden Mushrooms, Skeleton Keys and Plunder Chests! The items from Mario Party 3 are back, too; the Reverse Mushroom, Cellular Shopper, and Bowser Phone are now at your disposal. Items from newer Mario Parties and the Mario Party 1 dice blocks have also made their way into this mod, as well as 5 rare items that you can get if you\'re lucky enough (including the dreaded Wacky Watch)!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97bf.jpg'),(84,'Roguely','2021-06-25','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Roguely is a fantasy themed, top-down shooter, pixel art, action roguelite with some bullet hell thrown in. Fight and dodge your way through the randomly generated levels to rescue your friends. Find upgrades along the way and save up arcane fragments for permanent blessings from the gods.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b6r.jpg'),(85,'F-117A Stealth Fighter','2020-05-28','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, Nintendo Switch','It\'s the F-117A Stealth Fighter. And once you fly it, you\'ll see why no other flight simulator compares! Incredible 3-D graphics will keep you glued to your screen as you experience the same intense pressures that gripped America\'s Gulf War pilots. Penetrate enemy airspace without being seen! Tangle with the enemy in treacherous dogfights! Launch awesome firepower against fierce opponents! Your wait is over. The ultimate weapon has arrived. Now it\'s your turn to pilot the real Stealth Fighter!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gw6.jpg'),(86,'Hey, Girlie!',NULL,'Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','\"Hey, Girlie!\" is a free visual novel dating sim created by fans of Dimension 20\'s Fantasy High. Play as chosen cleric Kristen Applebees and attempt to romance six sapphic characters: Tracker, Gertie, Kipperlilly, Fig, Lucy, and Naradriel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rw4.jpg'),(87,'Puzzledom','2017-08-08','Puzzle','iOS','A collection of the best and most addictive logic puzzles, with minimalist graphics and unique level design!\n\n\"Puzzledom\" merges the best puzzles like Connect, Blocks, Rolling Ball and Escape, which are easy to learn and fun to master into one game collection.\nAs a puzzle lover, you don\'t need to spend much time on searching new brain teasers any more. We will give you a ONE-STOP game experience from now on! \n\n\"Puzzledom\" collection currently has:\nConnect \nConnect is a simple game involving connecting dots with the same color. When you draw the lines, please make sure the lines don\'t cross over each other. All the spaces should be filled. \n\nBlocks\nBlocks is a classic puzzle that you need to fill the entire board with different shapes of blocks. Just drag the right block, move it onto the board and match the right place. It\'s a perfect logic game for brain training.\n\nRolling Ball \nRolling Ball is a path guiding game that you need to slide the blocks to create a channel, making the white ball move from the starting point to the end point.\n\nEscape \nEscape is a well-known game, called Chinese Sliding-Block. The goal is to move the red block to the exit. This game will test your observation skills.\n\nMore puzzles coming soon\nWe are now working hard on developing new challenging puzzle games. Puzzledom will be the king of brain teasers!\n\n\nFEATURES\n• Tons of manually designed levels \nOver 8000 free levels inside and more funny levels are under development. \n\n• Easy but funny game play\nWe only put the best puzzles inside, which will make you cannot stop once you start playing.\n\n• Minimalist graphics\nThe art design is simple but beautiful. It\'s a game for all ages.\n\n• Playing the game with your friends\nWe will support online rank list soon! You can challenge your friends by achievements and the leader board. \n\n• No time limit\nUnlike Match 3 games, puzzledom does not have a time limit. You can play it anytime even without WIFI. You can use hints to unblock obstacles when you feel struggled in some levels.\n\nEnjoy the game with your family ;) \nIf you have any good ideas about Puzzledom, please send us an email in the game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/htkliznpbl6a6wvcshg5.jpg'),(88,'Cosmic Monsters 2 Enclaves Dawn',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Cosmic Monsters 2 Enclaves Dawn is a 2D RPG Game, explore the ORASIS Region and stop the Enclave!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5d4m.jpg'),(89,'Gnumz: Arcane Power','2017-05-29','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(90,'Northern Blade','2009-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Northern Blade is a dynamic action MMORPG from one of the oldest domestic developers. Its innovative combat system, powerful focus on PvP and vivid, realistic fantasy setting immerse the player in an atmosphere of global war, where the future of nations is decided by only one judge: your blade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xnf.jpg'),(91,'DragonFable','2005-11-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','DragonFable is a free-to-play, online, browser-based, single-player, fantasy, role-playing game developed by Artix Entertainment and updated on a weekly basis. Players may access locked game content by upgrading to a premium account for a one-time fee.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c6y.jpg'),(92,'Bad Dream: Purgatory','2023-06-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a hauntingly surreal landscape filled with unused characters from a cancelled project in Bad Dream: Purgatory. Will you give them purpose, or will they be doomed to suffer?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rbm.jpg'),(93,'Pinball FX3: Star Wars Pinball','2017-09-26','Simulator, Pinball','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A long time ago, in a galaxy far, far away.... Star Wars Pinball lets you relive the greatest moments of the Star Wars universe on a set of brand new pinball tables! \n \nIn Star Wars: Episode V The Empire Strikes Back lead the Rebellion with Luke Skywalker, Han Solo, Chewbacca, Princess Leia, Lando Calrissian, R2-D2, and C-3PO to defeat Darth Vader and the evil Emperor. In The Clone Wars, join Anakin Skywalker and Ahsoka Tano as they battle the most dangerous Sith assassins in the galaxy. On the Boba Fett table, the player takes on the role of the most feared bounty hunter in the Star Wars galaxy, working for sinister clients such as Darth Vader and Jabba the Hutt. \n \nMay the Force be with you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/chgtmhdtb3xsnefr1knw.jpg'),(94,'Goime 500','2011-06-24','Platform, Indie','Web browser','A platformer with a twist: players must earn 500 achievements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ntz.jpg'),(95,'Time Circuit','2024-07-12','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deep integration of city builder and tower defense. Time is the most crucial resource in this world. Lead your clan to construct a base in the dazzling circuit world and fend off waves of enemy attacks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ebh.jpg'),(96,'NBA Basketball 2000','1999-10-31','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Updated with stats, rosters and player ratings for the 1999-2000 season, NBA Basketball 2000 features every player from all 29 NBA teams, plus two all-star and rookie teams. You can play an entire NBA season or skip ahead to the playoffs. If you\'re not ready for team ball, you can go one-on-one with your favorite pros on an outdoor court. Real Fox Sports announcers including former Atlanta Hawks point guard Doc Rivers, call the action.\n\nUsing one or two Multi Tap adapters, up to eight players can join in a single game of NBA Basketball 2000. Along with the standard head-to-head game, you can play on the same team against the computer with up to five players, each controlling a different hoopster. Or you can play on rival teams with each gamer controlling a different basketball player.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gnnahqrlqo4koasd3lx0.jpg'),(97,'Mega Man at the Tokyo Olympics',NULL,'Shooter, Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(98,'Pinball FX3','2017-09-26','Simulator, Pinball, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Pinball FX3 is the biggest, most community focused pinball game ever created. Multiplayer matchups, user generated tournaments and league play create endless opportunity for pinball competition.\n\nFREE backwards compatibility! Bring your previous Pinball FX2 purchases with you to Pinball FX3 at no charge!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rio.jpg'),(99,'Lab',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Explore and escape a mutant infested lab. Collect weapons, health and armor upgrades and fight and try to survive the onslaught!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ts0.jpg'),(100,'StreamWare','2023-12-26','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In StreamWare, you have the unique opportunity to be both the star streamer and the avid viewer. Dive into a universe filled with fun and dynamic mini-games that will connect you in an unparalleled way with your favorite streamer or your loyal Twitch audience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fka.jpg'),(101,'Slide Stars','2020-11-10','Platform, Racing, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','It’s 2020, and Instagram, TikTok, and other social media platforms are where young people spend their day. Lion Castle brought all the leading influencers and role models of many countries together, reimagined them into Fortnite style visuals and put it all together in an already-proven game concept.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kgl.jpg'),(102,'Pop Up Story: Mahou no Hon to Seiju no Gakuen','2015-10-25','Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','A mobile RPG about raising students to become adventurers in a school set in a fantasy world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vmx.jpg'),(103,'Sonic: Frame by Frame',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ju1.jpg'),(104,'Bloodshot','1994-02-01','Shooter','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Sega CD','Bloodshot, known as Battle Frenzy in Germany, is a Sega Mega Drive and Sega Mega-CD game developed by Domark. It is notable for being a 3D first person shooter - one of the few available for the Sega Mega Drive and the only game of this genre for the Sega Mega-CD.\n\nThe game takes up most of the screen, with much smaller borders than similar games such as Zero Tolerance, a very impressive technical achievement. A two player splitscreen mode is also available. However, the game also suffers from slowdown and some of the texture data of the Mega Drive version looks corrupted but this was fixed with the Mega-CD version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gym.jpg'),(105,'The Five Covens','2021-11-17','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','In the land of Gaarth there are five families of warlocks, each with its own unique ability. Our character is a young witch belonging to the family that dominates levitation. The villain seeks to control the other powers to establish himself as absolute ruler. To this end, she invites our character to her castle with the premise of a celebration by way of deception. At the entrance she is arrested. She wakes up in a dungeon and must find a way to escape using her abilities. At all times we will be supported by our inseparable companion, the raven.\n\nTo face the challenges of the dungeons, including enemies and puzzles of all kinds, Brenda will strengthen herself before her final battle against the evil leader Kenot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ddz.jpg'),(106,'Sword of the Stars: The Pit Gold Edition - Necromancer',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(107,'Professor Layton and the Azran Legacy','2014-02-27','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Visual Novel','Nintendo 3DS','Journey across the globe aboard the airship Bostonius while solving mind-bending brainteasers themed to their environments. Can you help Professor Layton and his assistants solve the greatest puzzle mankind has ever faced and uncover the mystery surrounding the ancient Azran civilization?\n\nThe Professor Layton series couples brilliant puzzle games with a fascinating story to create a riveting formula that has provided great entertainment for mystery fans and puzzle-solving gurus alike. And now, you can complete the Professor Layton storyline with this brand new puzzle-driven narrative from LEVEL-5. This fun adventure can either stand on its own, or act as the glue that connects the two Layton trilogies into one epic story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wtu.jpg'),(108,'Space Shooter',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(109,'Deep Inside','2020-08-31','Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Nobody talks about the fire incident at Estmour mansion. As the new servant, you\'re bound to keep silence... will you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55co.jpg'),(110,'The Mean Greens: Plastic Warfare','2020-08-05','Shooter, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Take part of history\'s greatest battle of Green vs. Tan. Fight amongst and against others online. Jump, shoot and roll your way into victory with fast paced objective based gameplay. Sometimes the greatest battles are fought by the smallest of soldiers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1oiq.jpg'),(111,'The Same Crime','2018-03-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Same Crime is a VR secret room escape game(first part) developed by Fuzhou immersed Network Technology Co. Ltd. Play games in an abandoned mental hospital from the first person perspective, find props, unlock the organs, and find useful clues to unravel the mysteries.\n\nGame based on the original story,player not only escapes from the secret room, but also needs to find all kinds of clues to explore the truth.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(112,'Kitten Tales','2023-08-30','Platform, Racing, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on an exciting quest in Kitten Tales, solve puzzles to find your mother in story mode, and challenge up to 10 players in online races and multiplayer challenges. Do you have what it takes to be the bravest cat?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mw7.jpg'),(113,'EA Sports UFC Mobile','2015-04-21','Fighting, Simulator, Sport','Android, iOS','EA Sports UFC Mobile is a port of the mixed martial arts simulator for Android and iOS, featuring more than seventy fighters, real tricks, and strikes, development and training of athletes, real tournaments, and awards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e1o.jpg'),(114,'Hanako in the Abandoned School',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','This is a walking simulator game where the story takes place in an abandoned school.You must escape the curse of Hanako and escape alive.Explore the school and collect the materials left behind to uncover what once happened in this school and find a way to escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e2m.jpg'),(115,'Teddy\'s Haven: A Fantasy Inspired Shop Simulator','2025-05-06','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An enchanted shop sim at the edge of a magical world.\nIn Loving Dedication To The Memory Of My Best Friend Teddy Bear.\n\nTeddy’s Haven is a cozy fantasy shop simulator where you run a small, magical store nestled on the outskirts of a mysterious island. Specializing in potions, weapons, and enchanted curios, your humble haven draws in adventurers, wandering mages, and mystical creatures—each seeking something special beneath your warm, glowing lights.\n\nDiscover the Isle of Ursa\n\nYour shop rests at the edge of Ursa, a magical island filled with ancient forests, glimmering lakes, and forgotten wonders. The land itself is imbued with quiet magic, responding to your care and growing alongside you as your shop flourishes.\n\nAs you nurture your haven, the island’s secrets begin to reveal themselves, with each change you make encouraging the land to unfold new mysteries. Your presence is felt here—this shop is not just a place of business, but a part of the very soul of Ursa.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rvb.jpg'),(116,'Willy Morgan and the Curse of Bone Town','2022-03-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Third-person adventure game, set in a fantasy pirate-themed world with a modern touch. Combining the traditional point-and-click genre gameplay with a unique cartoon 3D graphics, Willy Morgan has the dreamy atmosphere, the humor and the freedom to explore typical of timeless classics such as Monkey Island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ozu.jpg'),(117,'Honey\'s Sweet Revenge','2024-06-07','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Honey\'s Sweet Revenge is a metroidvania with mechanics inspired by platform fighters. Customize your item loadout and defeat enemies and bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g5u.jpg'),(118,'Oreo O\'s Extreme Creme Control','2002-12-31','Puzzle','Web browser','A Flash game from Postopia in which players must create pipes that transport creme bits to a box of Oreo O\'s.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xob.jpg'),(119,'Bobby Carrot 3: Evolution','2006-06-01','Puzzle, Adventure','Legacy Mobile Device','The one game to take to a desert island.\nGrab your swimming trunks and prepare yourself for adventures with the super-bunny, Bobby Carrot. In this arcade-style puzzle game Bobby will not only challenge your strategic skills but also get his feet wet!\nAlready a smash hit in Europe with a huge cult following, for the first time Bobby Carrot is now coming to the US and chances are, he will also come to a cell phone near you!\nWith 65 levels of challenging gameplay, \"Bobby Carrot 3: Evolution\" is a brain-teaser that offers fun for all ages.\nBobby Carrot 3: Evolution\" has been showered with awards already and since the game contains no violence it is suitable for the entire family!\nFollowing Bobby the super-bunny, the player has to collect all the energy stars on each level before advancing to the next level. This is becoming increasingly tricky, however, as traps and blockers get in Bobby\'s way, making for a challenging gaming experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vu7.jpg'),(120,'Fantastic Contraption','2008-06-30','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy','Web browser','The original 2008 2D physics building game! With over 1.5 million players, Fantastic Contraption is a true classic.\n\nYour goal is simple: move the red ball from the blue building zone to the pink goal area.\n\nYour tools: wood rods (solid), water rods (pass through stuff), and wheels that turn clockwise or counterclockwise.\n\nYour solutions: NEAR INFINITE. Players have saved over 10 million unique designs, solving levels with everything from cars to catapults to conveyor belts or just pure gravity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3t4u.jpg'),(121,'Ars Vox Arcana','2025-04-11','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cast spells with your voice in a fantasy world shaped by language and will. Originally designed for VR, but fully playable on PC without a headset. Your voice is your power—no matter how you play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o8z.jpg'),(122,'Super Drift 3D','2011-07-22','Racing','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(123,'Robot Wants Fishy','2010-08-20','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','The third game in the \"Robot Wants\" series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nnv.jpg'),(124,'Meet\'N\'Fuck: The Plumber','2009-02-20','Visual Novel','Web browser','There is a classic porn story. Steven works as plumber in Springfield. You think it\'s dirty job? Yeah! But he loves it. Every day he has a chance to meet with another sexy housewife.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5izm.jpg'),(125,'Power Rangers Dino Thunder: Red Hot Rescue','2004-02-14','Fighting, Adventure, Arcade','Web browser','Tommy has been captured, so the Power Rangers must rescue him! To get past the guards, you will have to use each of the ranger\'s special abilities. Collect special icons to keep your strength, and others for power, extra life, or bonus points. Use your Dino Power Play! Do your best, and complete your mission!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4as5.jpg'),(126,'The Grandfather','2025-05-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The clock is ticking as the monster lurking in the shadows hunts you down. Find the missing pieces of the clock and fix it as fast and quietly as possible before it finds you as you try to piece together what happened to you. Beware the grandfather in a short first-person horror experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rxy.jpg'),(127,'Last Drop','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Last Drop is a story you need to experience. Welcome to Nykylä Finland 1994. Seppo Sahtivaara and friends are waiting for you. This is an openworld action game with a story that has an impact. We bring back old good games and action from the best movies from that era. We want you to enjoy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gpi.jpg'),(128,'The Dark Side of the Moon','2017-08-21','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The dark style independent online game, the return of China\'s traditional round system game, farewell to the lengthy development upgrade, the players compete equality, the common face of the dark side of humanity.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(129,'Labyrinth of the Demon King','2025-05-13','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Venture through the Labyrinth Of The Demon King, solving puzzles and fighting fearsome monsters in an epic quest to track down the demon who betrayed your lord and end it’s life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5i6q.jpg'),(130,'Galaxy Life Reborn','2019-10-11','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Galaxy Life Reborn was a fan project which aimed to revive the Pocket Edition of Galaxy Life by making a private server.\nGalaxy Life (developed by Ubisoft) is a real time strategy game where you gather two resources: minerals and gold. You start only with one planet, from which you can rebuild the mighty Starling Empire once again. But beware, the other players have the same goals as you.\nPlease note that Galaxy Life Reborn is not affiliated with Ubisoft.\nAs of February 15, 2022, Galaxy Life Reborn shut down its services.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94p6.jpg'),(131,'Angry Birds Flash',NULL,'Sin género','Web browser','Angry Birds Flash is a cancelled Angry Birds game that was shown at the Adobe MAX 2011 event by Andrew Stablow from Rovio Entertainment Corporation. A demo of the game created exclusively for the event was shown at the same event to announce the game. It was planned to release later that year, but it ended up getting canceled and replaced by Angry Birds Friends in 2012.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co636k.jpg'),(132,'Bad Midwife',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','You play as a pregnant woman kidnapped and trapped in an unknown place. Based on true events, survive a psychological horror journey where every step could cost your life, and your baby. Can you get the best final?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i4p.jpg'),(133,'Riddle School 2: Legacy Edition','2020-11-26','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Phil escapes school again--middle school this time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47ul.jpg'),(134,'Robot Wants Ice Cream','2010-09-25','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','The fourth and final game in the \"Robot Wants\" series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nnw.jpg'),(135,'Dear My Sun!! Musuko Ikusei Capriccio','2007-09-06','Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','A visual novel for PS2.\nYou play as the mother of a pair of twins, whose father has left on an expedition to Egypt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j9f.jpg'),(136,'Cartoon Cartoon Food Bash','2002-12-31','Shooter','Web browser','A Flash game formerly featured on the Cartoon Network website featuring characters from Johnny Bravo, Ed, Edd n Eddy, The Powerpuff Girls, and Samurai Jack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81ko.jpg'),(137,'Final Fantasy XV: Episode Ignis','2017-12-13','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','With fast-paced battles and multiple endings, experience untold events from one of the most dramatic parts of FINAL FANTASY XV.\n\nTold from the perspective of Noctis’s ally Ignis, the city of Altissia lies in ruins and Ignis must face the Niflheim Empire to protect Noctis at all costs.\n\nJoining Ignis is Ravus, high commander of the Empire, who is determined to save his sister, Lunafreya.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vj0.jpg'),(138,'Thing-Thing Arena 3','2009-03-05','Shooter','Web browser','Shoot your way through countless enemies, but this time, do it with style!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8psp.jpg'),(139,'Summer Catchers','2021-02-11','Platform, Racing, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Summer Catchers is a road trip arcade game with adventure elements about a northern girl and her epic journey to the South and summer warm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rgs.jpg'),(140,'Chronotron','2008-05-06','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','A puzzle-platformer about a robot that goes back in time to cooperate with itself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co529g.jpg'),(141,'Farm Frenzy: Hurricane Season','2015-07-03','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Slip on your overalls, grab your seed bag, and round up your four-legged friends for more frenzied fun as you rebuild your farm in the wake of a hurricane! Harvest a crop of Time Management thrills in Farm Frenzy: Hurricane Season!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zl5.jpg'),(142,'My Club Dino','2010-10-15','Simulator','Web browser','My Club Dino is an online fun and educational dinosaur game, targeted for young kids in between 5 and 12 years old. My Club Dino combines fun, education and interaction','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fzt.jpg'),(143,'Super Chick Sisters','2021-03-15','Platform','Web browser, Android, iOS','Pamela Anderson has been kidnapped by Colonel Sanders and his minions for revealing to the world that KFC\'s secret recipe is cruelty to chickens! Help the Super Chick Sisters save Pam before it\'s too late!\n\nA New Super Mario Bros. parody game published by PETA.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6350.jpg'),(144,'Mr. Bean Solitaire',NULL,'Card & Board Game','Sin plataforma','Who hasn\'t ever played the card game Solitaire? Now you can play the free online Mr Bean Solitaire game. You win the game when all four stacks are completed with their respective King! Boomerang is the best place for Mr Bean games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7f1p.jpg'),(145,'Diamond Hollow','2011-12-31','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Shoot, upgrade, conquer enemies, attempt achievements, collect gems, all in an attempt to escape an endless cave','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r9i.jpg'),(146,'Riddle School: Legacy Edition','2020-11-26','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This is everyone\'s journey--to escape from school.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47um.jpg'),(147,'SeppuKuties','2008-10-31','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','SeppuKuties is a 2-D puzzle platformer made by The-EXP (Anthony Lavelle) and The-Swain (Michael Swain), and produced by Armor Games. After the deforestation by the humans, the goal is to bring as many animals as possible to Paradise Meadows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d94.jpg'),(148,'Marippy','2007-12-01','Arcade','Web browser','Marippy is a Touhou fan game based on the arcade game Mappy. The game has the player play as Marisa Kirisame as she collects items from Alice Margatroid\'s house which Alice had stole.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kxr.jpg'),(149,'Epic Chef','2021-11-11','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Get ready to embark on a culinary journey as you take on the role of Zest; who must farm, craft and cook his way into legend!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2weh.jpg'),(150,'Bionic Ninja','1989-12-31','Fighting','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC','Aliens are attacking Icarus Earth Defence Base and within a hour and a half will occupy it, bringing bad news for the occupants of our planet. The solution is to send a android installed with the Oriental Disciplines of the East and destroy all the aliens over five levels to save Earth. You play the role of Bionic Ninja and you must use various martial arts as well as shruiken\'s and swords, to destroy or avoid the various occupants of the base. You are able to switch between any of the three attacking options by pressing the space bar at any time. If you are touched or shot by any of the enemy then you lose part of a power bar and if it empties then you lose one of five lives but extra power can be collected on the way. Each level is split into two sections and they must be completed within a time limit or it is game over.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fc1.jpg'),(151,'A Second Chance','2013-06-26','Simulator','Web browser','With great power comes great responsibility. Take control of all the crazy NASA Ground Control buttons on a mission to save the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4r4h.jpg'),(152,'Raceland','2018-01-05','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Raceland is the best car racing game for racing enthusiasts. Drift, change your vehicle and start the race! In the vote you must first use the tool you control and use it, complete the chapters, earn money, and unlock the locked vehicles.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(153,'Ensou','2020-10-29','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ensou is a top-down 2D Action game focused on fighting between samurai in Japan\'s Edo Period, with an attack and defense system based on timing and parries.\n\nAfter the fall of the Yamamoto school in the city of Isagawa, Hiroyuki Ishigame is tasked with eliminating Naosuke Wachi, the greatest pupil of the old martial arts master Gensuke. This task will make Ishigame take a new direction in his life: the Path of the Five Rings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l0u.jpg'),(154,'Chickenoidz Super Party','2023-08-08','Fighting, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Chickenoidz Super Party - multiplayer top-down arena shooter for up to 4 players. You can play local or altogether online via Remote Play. Steal the show using an array of incredible weapons, special equipment and even mutations. Smash your opponents to smithereens, rip everything around you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vnw.jpg'),(155,'Siege of Dungeon','2023-11-11','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','“Siege of Dungeon” is a strategic rogue-lite game, where players challenge strong, cunning monsters within a limited time by combining relics and skills to build up your team. What’s waiting for you deep down in the dungeon? Could it be a rare and precious treasure, or the beginning of despair...?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5l6m.jpg'),(156,'Seven Horns From Tilt',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Help Libby tilt through various obstacles in order for him to meet his parents on the other side.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40z4.jpg'),(157,'Raze 3','2014-07-10','Shooter, Platform, Indie','Web browser','Arm yourself with a vast array of weapons, equipment, and abilities to fight aliens, zombies and robots to save the earth. Or become the enemy and fight to destroy it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nu8.jpg'),(158,'Paradise','2024-04-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Paradise is a Boys Love visual novel and tells the story of a group of men who go on holiday on a deserted island. When things begin to go wrong, they realize to their horror that they are stranded. Turns out that’s only the start of their problems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7t6e.jpg'),(159,'Rally Championship','2003-02-07','Racing, Sport','Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Mud! Sweat! Gears!\nDirt! Snow! Rain!\n\n-25 officially licensed rally racing cars.\n-33 races in 6 prestigious rallies over 4 global regions.\n-4-Player simultaneous split-screen intense action.\n-Real car physics simulate all wheel & 2-wheel drive.\n-Extreme weather conditions test your driving skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m58.jpg'),(160,'Riddle School 4','2010-04-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Phil plans a fourth school escape, but what does his university have to offer?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61ow.jpg'),(161,'Spirits of Xanadu','2021-05-03','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','At the farthest edge of the explored universe, the research ship Xanadu slumbers in orbit around a mysterious planet. Her systems remain active but there has been no message from her crew for months. Now a lone operative has been sent to wake the Xanadu and bring her home to Earth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jog.jpg'),(162,'Academy Love Saga: Tennis Angels EX','2025-04-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become the coach of a prestigious sports academy\'s tennis club, filled with stunning girls who all dislike you. How will you handle it? Win them over, of course! Prepare for intense tennis matches with dynamic gameplay and powerful abilities. Prove your skills and earn their bodies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8n1p.jpg'),(163,'Dragon Ball Z: Earth Defender',NULL,'Arcade','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(164,'SpongeBob SquarePants: Reef Rumble',NULL,'Sin género','Web browser','Bikini Bottom\'s greatest (and not-so-greatest) martial artists have gathered to determine ocean floor suprema-sea! Remember, no eye-gouging or tentacle biting...now let\'s rumble! What kind of game do you want to play? Arcade or tournament? Choose a fighter: SpongeBob, Patrick, Sandy, Squidward, Larry or Mr.Krabs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zmw.jpg'),(165,'Doubutsu no Mori','2001-04-14','Simulator','Nintendo 64','Doubutsu no Mori is the name of the first installment in the Animal Crossing series. It was released only in Japan for the Nintendo 64. It was later remade for the GameCube in 2002, and released worldwide as Animal Crossing. This game is compatible with the Expansion P