tor, Indie','Web browser','A Flash falling sand game by onimatrix, hosted on Kongregate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zkp.jpg'),(171,'Super Smash Bros. for Wii U: Hyrule Castle','2015-07-31','Fighting, Platform','Wii U','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qtw.jpg'),(172,'A Night With: Brazilian Waifu','2025-06-06','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A provocative, explicit date-sim visual novel where you\'ll spend one steamy night seducing Lucia, your confident Brazilian dream girl. Flirt, tease, and charm your way into her heart—and her bed—in this immersive erotic experience.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(173,'Toys vs. Nightmares','2011-09-05','Point-and-click, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The nightmares have been unleashed from your closet and all you have are some books and toy soldiers….\n\nStrategize and defend yourself from the evil monsters lurking in your closet. Use robots, rubber frogs, and miners to stop the ghosts and make it through the night.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l22.jpg'),(174,'Nesquik Quest','2008-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fo0.jpg'),(175,'Mona','2018-06-26','Point-and-click, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mona is an English Yume Nikki fangame made for Dream Diary Jam 2. Explore Mona\'s subconscious, her past experience and how it is affecting her mental state.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rjz.jpg'),(176,'Soletrando','2008-12-31','Quiz/Trivia','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Soletrando segment, from Caldeirão do Huck, has now become a game! Soletrando is a super spelling competition for you and your entire family.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48lw.jpg'),(177,'Tiger Tank 59 I: Mission Pack 063','2021-06-24','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The classic tank battle game re-opens, guarding your base and defeating all enemy tanks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yp4.jpg'),(178,'Riddle School 3: Legacy Edition','2020-11-26','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The largest Riddle School yet; can you escape high school?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47uk.jpg'),(179,'Knuckleheads','2008-05-20','Platform, Arcade','Web browser','Play as two connected angry heads in this unique action game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8anr.jpg'),(180,'Toshoshitsu no Neversista','2010-12-29','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','During a stormy summer night, a student met his death.\n\nHe left to take a picture of the rising waters in the river and never returned. All that was left of him were his belongings and the camera by the riverbank. Even after days of desperate searches, all anyone could find was one of his shoes.\n\nIn the end, he was treated as a casualty of the river...but soon other, sinister rumors of his death began to emerge. That the five friends who used to live in \"The Haunted Tower\" with him -- one of them, some of them, all of them -- may have had something to do with his cursed death.\n\nEnter two people.\n\nOne, the student\'s older brother. He receives a mysterious letter about his brother\'s death, and as soon as he begins to investigate, he\'s hit by a blunt object and loses consciousness.\n\nOnly to wake up again in a dark room with five students surrounding him, interrogating him, and knowing that they will never let him leave...\n\nTwo, an idealistic assistant teacher who just arrived in town. He receives a cryptic warning from an intruder in his dorm, \"The Haunted Tower,\" to \"never think those five are children\" -- the poor, sad, well-behaved five students who undeservedly suffer from bad rumors.\n\nCaught between paranoia and the desire to trust