tracking, and a dynamic original soundtrack from Mustin (The OneUps) featuring guest tracks from Robbie Benson (Super Soul Bros.), experience the thrill and satisfaction of sinking a mayonnaise hole without tying a single knot. As you play, you\'ll travel to unique environments that pose added challenges. A moving hole, vertigo, wind, and many more surprises only possible in VR. Just how far does this mayonnaise hole go?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50ql.jpg'),(187,'The Tower of TigerQiuQiu','2020-09-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Tower of TigerQiuQiu is a maze-based action role-playing arcade game Player need break throught Tower resuce princesses and escape TigerQiuQiu as you get your way to the top of the TigerQiuQius Tower','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4457.jpg'),(188,'Dragon\'s Lair','1990-12-29','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','Dragon\'s Lair is a side-scrolling platform game based on the laserdisc game of the same name released for the Nintendo Entertainment System and developed by the MotiveTime group. Plotwise, the game is identical to the original.\n\nThe game is a side-scroller with the character walking slowly. Dirk can walk, crawl, or jump forward, and he has an array of weapons that he can discover and use to dispose of enemies. The controller layout is reversed from other mainstream NES titles, with Select functioning as the Pause-button while Start is used for the Candle object (which helps reveal hidden weapons). Also, B is used for jumping, and A for attacking (the input of the A & B buttons is almost always the opposite in similar NES games).\n\nTwo different versions were released later, first for the Famicom, with major improvements on playability and speed, and a second one for PAL regions, expanding upon the Famicom version with new enemies and cutscenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co790b.jpg'),(189,'Yeah Jam Fury','2022-07-06','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Yeah Jam Fury tests your speed and ingenuity in over 40 levels of smiling face blocks. Utilize all three of your egos to create blocks, scale walls, and destroy everything in the way of your righteous fruit!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59k0.jpg'),(190,'Rance X: Showdown','2018-02-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rance X: Showdown is the 13th and final game in Alicesoft\'s flagship Rance Series, marking the conclusion for the 28-year-old series. While initially set for a 2016 release, it was later delayed to and ultimately released on February 23, 2018.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gr6.jpg'),(191,'Meet\'N\'Fuck Kingdom','2009-11-13','Visual Novel','Web browser','We\'re going to the Middle Ages. There we meet our hero Murton. In Lavindor Kingdom he\'s known as the best healer. Today he\'s got a mission of great importance! Man\'s power of the King has gone out unexpectly in recent days. And you should make a special love potion which can bring back his potency. As a reward you\'ll get as much gold as you can carry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5izr.jpg'),(192,'Briley Witch Chronicles','2021-10-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Commodore C64/128/MAX','Follow the adventures of Briley, a modern day girl lost in a strange new world...\nTake control of Briley as she explores her new life, aided by Smokey, her grumpy talking cat - and best friend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kk5.jpg'),(193,'Willy the Worm',NULL,'Platform','Sin plataforma','Willy The Worm is a platform game for DOS. It was created by Alan Farmer and released in June, 1985.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ufvuusiqqcqsjvqsjgjp.jpg'),(194,'Micky\'s adventure','1998-03-31','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Web browser','Micky invites you to explore Alhomepage and all of the web. Will you reach the mysterious \"reboot\"?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3t5w.jpg'),(195,'Helicopter Game','2004-11-13','Arcade','Web browser','A browser game about flying a helicopter down an infinite corridor. See how far you can go without crashing. Only one button is used to fly. It has been re-released for mobile devices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4q10.jpg'),(196,'Witch & Hero','2019-03-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Witch & Hero is an 8-bit style action game. You play as a hero accompanied by a witch taking on the evil Medusa, whom has destroyed many villages and towns with the monsters that stand before her.\n\nMedusa turned the witch into stone, so she is no longer able to move. So it\'s up to the hero to defeat the monsters and collect their blood in order to recover the witch for a limited duration. The witch\'s destructive magic easily destroys monsters, but you will have to rely on the hero\'s will power primarily. He is able to try and try again, but the witch cannot, thus the hero must protect her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nab.jpg'),(197,'Christmas Cat','2015-12-10','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, Android, iOS','The Bonte cat jumps on top of the Christmas tree and sends the 20 red balls all around the house. Can you find all 20 balls by solving the puzzles?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95vh.jpg'),(198,'Kollywood: The Game','2025-04-14','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Kollywood: The Game is a stop motion video, comedy game with quick-time event fight scenes inspired by Tamil Cinema.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ock.jpg'),(199,'My Wife','2025-04-10','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Meet your new digital companion - an ultra-cute deskto