Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nightfire Open (formerly known as Afterburner) is a multiplayer Open-source reboot of James Bond 007: Nightfire on the Xash3D FWGS engine.\n\nThe game was originally released in alpha version 0.2 on Mod DB under the name Afterburner on November 27, 2019. Four years later the codebase of the game has moved to a new repository due to the original codebase being tied to the upstream engine\'s codebase, hence detrimental, and the game renamed to Nightfire Open. On August 8, 2023, v1 was released on Github.\n\nCurrently, the latest version is v5 and it was released on March 10, 2024 on Github for both Windows and Linux.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wbr.jpg'),(205,'Rampart','1992-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS)','Game Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pxe.jpg'),(206,'Sacred Seasons','2009-02-08','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser','Sacred Seasons was a free to play MMORPG. The game boasted 16 playable classes, with 4 classes available per season, each with their own unique skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yqk.jpg'),(207,'Meet\'N\'Fuck: Street Racing','2008-12-12','Visual Novel','Web browser','World of underground street racing filled with dangerous adventures. Expensive sport cars, gorgeous women and stunning tricks. All of that make your heartbeat faster. Beyond that, You don\'t even know what will happen this evening. Will you get laid with another amazing blonde or crash your favorite ride? Anyway, you should try this incredible mix of sex and illegal street racing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5if2.jpg'),(208,'TimeBomb90second',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7u8d.jpg'),(209,'Wario\'s Flashin\' Fruit Punch Splash','2002-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload