ll fries abilities to figure out how to get them back safely.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ed3.jpg'),(216,'Crash Test Launcher',NULL,'Arcade','Web browser','in this game players control a range of cars and bikes to crash test. once they have crashed it, they need to go as far as possible to get as much money which they can then use for gaining more cars and upgrades.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22ht.jpg'),(217,'Trumpet','2018-12-31','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Trumpet is a dark visual novel that deals with themes such a death.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/c7jjtslhducwzcoxym5p.jpg'),(218,'Neverending Light','2009-02-10','Adventure','Web browser','A guided tour goes horribly wrong when monsters eat everyone!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hqn.jpg'),(219,'Riddle School','2006-05-25','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is everyone\'s quest--to escape school.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61on.jpg'),(220,'Battle Gear 2','2009-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Tactical, Indie','Web browser','Take charge of military operations, enter enemy\'s territory from the air, sea and land, attack various parts of the world, battle for World Domination!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r8p.jpg'),(221,'Inferno','2010-06-23','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Web browser','Do you have what it takes to be the best firefighter ever? Fight the onslaught of fire in 20+ action-packed levels where you’ll have to outrun the clock and put the fire out before it consumes it all… even you! But beware: with a limited stash of water, you’ll need to use strategy and precision to make every drop count!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co736a.jpg'),(222,'Collection of SaGa: Final Fantasy Legend','2021-09-21','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Celebrate the 30th Anniversary of SaGa with one epic collection including the three original Game Boy titles, now updated with new features for Nintendo Switch.\n\nExperience the origins of the SaGa series with the COLLECTION OF SaGa FINAL FANTASY LEGEND, the first complete port of these hugely popular titles.\n\nThe collection includes new enhancements like high-speed mode as well as features unique to the Nintendo Switch, such as adjustable screen magnification and game screen background customization. Featuring compatibility with, of course, handheld mode, but also with TV mode and tabletop mode. Furthermore, this game also revives the nostalgia of playing the original by enabling vertical usage of the console after removing the Joy-Cons. Take your collection on the go with handheld mode, share your journey with your Nintendo Switch in TV mode, or remove the Joy-Cons and turn your Nintendo Switch vertically for a retro Game Boy experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mn6.jpg'),(223,'Corruption of Champions','2011-03-06','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rou.jpg'),(224,'Radio the Universe',NULL,'Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A blend of classic Zelda and dark science fiction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27fn.jpg'),(225,'Fortnite: Chapter 5 - Season 2: Myths & Mortals','2024-03-08','Shooter, Tactical','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Pandora’s Box has been opened on the Fortnite Battle Royale Island, bringing Olympus to the battlefield. Olympian legends — including Hades and the thunder god Zeus — now rule the Island in otherworldly rage. To make matters worse, they’ve brought their powers and weapons with them. Use their mythological means against them in Chapter 5 Season 2: Myths & Mortals!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7v8l.jpg'),(226,'Knot Me!','2021-03-12','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Knot Me! is a 3D action-adventure game designed to explore sexual kinks, sexual culture, sexual consent, and other taboo topics. The player controls Regina, a possum-girl, and Señor Edgar, her talking bondage rope. Using Señor Edgar’s ability to tie knots, swing from overhead fixtures, and whip a short distance in front of her, Regina explores the four floors of Red Velvet while on a mission to interview the elusive Spider Queen of Bondage. On the way, she must satisfy three boss characters by appealing to their sexual kinks, culminating with the Spider Queen herself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yxc.jpg'),(227,'Super Tofu Boy','2010-12-02','Platform','Web browser','A parody of Super Meat Boy / propaganda title made by the animal rights organization PETA. Save Bandage Girl from Meat Boy\'s bloody, jealous rage!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uva.jpg'),(228,'Dragon Ball Z Tournament','2001-12-13','Strategy','Web browser','In this strategy game the player chooses 1 of 8 characters from the series to compete in a martial arts tournament on Namek (Frieza becomes available after the game is completed once). The player battles their way through 7 opponents in order to collect all 7 dragon balls (one is recovered after every victory).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mee.jpg'),(229,'Spider-Man 2: The Snap Game','2004-12-31','Card & Board Game','Web browser','Spider-Man 2: The Snap Game was an online game by KFC Singapore as a part of the KFC Chicky Club, their online service of flash games for kids. The game was made to promote the movie Spider-Man 2.\n\nNo copies of the game have resurfaced ever since.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co717f.jpg'),(230,'Pokémon: Towering Legends','2007-12-31','Arcade','Web browser','Stack the biggest pile of the same element you can to get the highest combo possible. The round ends when all elemental tiles have been removed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4t1c.jpg'),(231,'Batman: Chaos in Gotham','2001-04-16','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Game Boy Color','The Batman returns on Game Boy Color with BATMAN: Total Chaos in Gotham City. Based on the popular animated BATMAN series, this single-player action game allows you to don the cowl of one of two Bat-heroes: Batman or Batgirl. Some of the Dark Knight\'s famous arch-villains have escaped and are causing serious trouble in Gotham, and it\'s up to you to put them back where they belong. Everyone from Poison Ivy to the Clown Prince of Crime the Joker himself is here to wreak havoc and keep the caped crusader busy. Grab your utility belt and assault 18 stages of varied action that take you on a tour of Gotham City. Much of the action is played from a side-scrolling perspective, but some levels have you taking out the Batmobile or the Batcycle in overhead high-speed excitement. Naturally, Batman and Batgirl are both packing their usual assortment of weapons and tools including the Batarang, the grappling hook, smoke bombs, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ipw.jpg'),(232,'Country Road VR','2020-03-12','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Country Road VR is a virtual petting farm which allows the user to wander the farm and pet many types of animals including a horse, cows, sheep, goats, and a few funny surprises. The animals respond with movement and their corresponding animal sound as the controllers vibrate.\n\nIn addition, you can walk into a sunflower field and atop a hill overlooking the entire farm. Also, there are butterflies all over, some which land in the palm of your hand! Current updates are underway which will make it even more interactive including the ability to feed the animals. This VR experience is currently on Steam for only $2.99 at https://store.steampowered.com/app/1188140/Country_Road_VR/ and available at VR Junkies (VR Arcades) at locations throughout the US. 20% of the net proceeds goes to Alzheimer\'s research. Country Road VR is suitable for ALL ages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m6u.jpg'),(233,'The Nightmare from Beyond','2017-09-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Nightmare from Beyond is a cosmic-horror third person platformer inspired by the works of H. P. Lovecraft. You take on the role of Sanja, a young woman from the D\'nyg race, as she explores a mysterious land in search for her sister, Dajana.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28db.jpg'),(234,'Madness Ambulation','2011-09-23','Shooter, Arcade','Web browser','Help Sandford and Deimos ride out to save Hank in this following-cam third person chase shooter! Survive all 10 waves if you\'ve got the stomach for it, but be warned...this game will never end. All you can do is survive the Madness for as long as you can grip that wheel for dear life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zhd.jpg'),(235,'Chrono Tales','2012-12-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chrono Tales is a Free 3D browser-based MMORPG. The new generation engine provides players with anime-styled 3D Graphics via browsers without huge downloads. Challenge immerse quests, tame mythological beasts, forge legendary gears and experience more! Chrono Tales is a free 3D browser-based MMORPG. The new generation engine provides players with anime-styled 3D graphics via browsers, without client download. Traveling through the time rift, players can explore in the fantasy world of Chrono Tales and save the realm from the resurgent evil. You can challenge immersive quest, forge legendary gear, tame mythological pets and experience much more mainstream MMO features in Chrono Tales.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gv2.jpg'),(236,'Crystal Crisis','2019-07-31','Fighting, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','An all-star cast of heroes has gathered to test their mettle in this cute and chaotic new color-matching combat game for Nintendo Switch. Crystal Crisis is presented like a one-on-one fighting game, but instead of pressing buttons to kick and punch, players arrange falling gems into matching colors to clear them from the screen and inflict damage on their opponents. It’s the ultimate puzzle battle throwdown!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26bw.jpg'),(237,'Vantage Master Portable','2008-04-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','PlayStation Portable','This PSP remake of Vantage Master features new characters from The Legend of Heroes: Trails in the Sky, and multiplayer mode using the PSP\'s wireless capabilities.\n\nFalcom announced the development of Vantage Master Portable for the PSP on December 20, 2007, which was released on the actual release data. Unlike the original Windows version, the interface is changed slightly for the PSP, meaning no PC mouse functionality. Otherwise, the game is essentially a complete 3D clone of the original Vantage Master with remastered orchestral music and corresponding gameplay mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4n9m.jpg'),(238,'Land of Wind and Shade','2010-02-10','Adventure','Web browser','Land of Wind and Shade is the second interactive flash game in the Homestuck web-comic. In the game, you play as John, who is exploring the Land of Wind and Shade while directed by an Exile.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59wl.jpg'),(239,'Maneater','2021-05-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','You were cut from your mother\'s body and left to die in the unforgiving waters of the Gulf Coast. Your only tools are your wits, your jaws, and an uncanny ability to evolve as you feed. Anything and everything is on the menu... provided you kill it before it kills you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1lx6.jpg'),(240,'Esgrima 2',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(241,'Candy Crush Saga','2012-04-01','Puzzle','Web browser','An Adobe Flash port of Candy Crush Saga that was playable on Facebook until it was replaced by a HTML5 version when Flash was discontinued.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kjn.jpg'),(242,'CrashTV','2013-12-12','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','Put your TV through a series of trail-and-error experiments in this puzzle platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rem.jpg'),(243,'Hop Top','2024-02-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Classic arcade action returns with a brand new look and feel!\n\nThe troublesome bugs of Insect Tower took Hop\'s wings! To get them back, you\'ll have to chase speedy Wasps and face three kinds of fearsome Flies through five floors of exciting shoot \'em up platforming action. It\'s up to you to help Hop the Dodo Bird as he hops to the top!\n\nWatch out for tricks and traps, special score items, and even power-up platforms that\'ll help you turn the tide! Master each insect\'s specific patterns to score big and blow \'em away!\n\nHOP TOP features 3 modes of play. In Campaign Mode, you\'ll guide Hop on his quest through the treacherous tower. In Endless Mode, you\'ll challenge countless waves of bugs and aim for the highest score! Finally, the Arcade Mode honors HOP TOP\'s arcade origins and shows what it could\'ve been if it really was released back then.\n\nWhichever mode you choose, pick-up-and-play fun awaits you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ugi.jpg'),(244,'Notebook Wars 3','2012-12-31','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Get ready for the ultimate notebook shooter!\nDestroy hundreds of enemies and bosses to earn enought money to buy better planes and weapons, you have 40 different planes and 20 upgradable weapons to buy, and a survival mode… have fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qbj.jpg'),(245,'Search All: Candy','2021-11-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Is a game in the genre of \"hidden object\", in which you need to find all the candies (candy wrappers) on a large location drawn in the style of \"doodling\". The game location displays an elven industrial town located in a forest where elves make their sweets','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ktu.jpg'),(246,'Aurora Flight','2025-02-20','Shooter, Simulator, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aurora Flight is an air combat simulation on the uncharted planet Zenoa. Realistic altitude and speed physics provide strategic depth, while flexible fighter customization shapes your approach. Experience diverse aerial battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fwm.jpg'),(247,'Shop, Don\'t Drop!',NULL,'Arcade','Web browser','A Flash game previously available to play on Postopia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ypo.jpg'),(248,'Big Beach Sports','2008-06-24','Sport','Wii','All of the games allow up to 4 players playing at the same time, or in the case of Bocce and Disc Golf, taking alternate turns. All the games use the Wii Remote only, no games require the use of the Nunchuck or any other peripheral.\n\nAfter creating a character, the player can compete in tournaments against increasingly tougher opponents in any of the sports. Playing Quick Play games and Tournament games earns the character Skill Points. These are then used to calculate the difficulty of the CPU opponent for future Quick Play matches. Hence, after completing all tournaments for all the sports in Big Beach Sports, where each game has a preset difficulty, the player can then return to Quick Play and continue to max out Skill Points (999 points) for each of the six sports. In the case of most of the sports, however, the game becomes extremely challenging and the AI opponents are much tougher to beat after reaching 900 skill points.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ptf.jpg'),(249,'Riddle School 5','2010-04-02','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Prepare yourself... for the Grand Finale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61ox.jpg'),(250,'Oiligarchy','2008-12-31','Simulator, Strategy','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Now you can be the protagonist of the petroleum era: explore and drill around the world, corrupt politicians, stop alternative energies and increase the oil addiction. Be sure to have fun before the resources begin to deplete.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qsf.jpg'),(251,'Mud and Blood 2','2008-08-31','Strategy','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mud and Blood 2 is a real-time tactical level strategy game. The player takes command of a squad of American soldiers during World War II (operation Lüttich, August 1944), who will face endless waves of German troops.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wtazcltfpckanlg88m7y.jpg'),(252,'Mmmmmm','2012-04-14','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','An homage by Stephen Lavelle to the gravity-manipulating platformer VVVVVV.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x1j.jpg'),(253,'Altered Beast','2010-06-01','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Tapwave Zodiac, PlayStation 3, Linux, Wii, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','The Sega Genesis/Mega Drive has different enemy layouts and input mechanics from the original arcade version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sqq.jpg'),(254,'Angry Birds Coca-Cola','2012-06-11','Arcade','Web browser','Angry Birds Coca-Cola was a game released on June 11, 2012. This version was made with the corporation of Rovio, Coca-Cola Chinese and \"The Chinese Olympic Games\' Team\". The story is centered at the London Olympic Games on July 27.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4roz.jpg'),(255,'Apple Bowl','1979-12-31','Sport','Apple II','Apple Bowl is a 1-player bowling game for the Apple II.\n\nPlayed from a 1st person perspective at a bowling alley, the player bowls in lane, while occasionally another member at the bowling alley will bowl in lanes. A throw indicator scrolls slowly along the bottom of the screen, and the player starts their bowl when the ball is in their preferred position. The player controls the power and spin of the ball using the game paddles, and the game attempts to accurately simulate the physics of bowling. Follows standard 10-pin bowling rules with a total of 10 frames of bowling.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61wf.jpg'),(256,'Soletrando: Nova Ortografia','2009-12-31','Quiz/Trivia','PC (Microsoft Windows)','With major changes happening to the Brazilian Portuguese orthography in 2009, Soletrando gets an updated version with those changes and new words that you and your family need to guess.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48pf.jpg'),(257,'Star Wars: Empire at War - Gold Pack','2007-08-15','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Command or corrupt an entire galaxy in the definitive Star Wars strategy collection. It is a time of galactic civil war. Will you take up the reins of the Rebellion, assume control of the Empire, or rule the Star Wars Underworld?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1q7z.jpg'),(258,'Reactance','2011-02-26','Arcade','Web browser','Unleash hell with tons of epic upgrades in this “colorblind friendly” top-down shooter with plenty of challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k9v.jpg'),(259,'Rig or Skill: PC Brawl','2018-03-09','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is an air hockey style arena humorously referring to internet culture. Attack your opponent\'s computer by decreasing its FPS capability.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yjo.jpg'),(260,'Code S-44 : Episode 1','2019-06-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are S-44, a pretty cool spider-bot able to climb everything. Sneak your way from the deepest slums to the highest heavily guarded buildings in order to save your best friend in the fantastic but dangerous town of New Bot City.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ncn.jpg'),(261,'Ultimate Flash Sonic','2004-02-21','Platform, Arcade','Web browser','Ultimate Flash Sonic is a 2-D side scroller made by Dennis-Gid. It was uploaded to Newgrounds on Febuary 21, 2004.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pp3.jpg'),(262,'Maidens of a Hollow Dream','2018-03-30','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fierce battles between loin cloth clad girls!\nThe one and only maebari themed Yuri side scrolling shooting game is finally here!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53bm.jpg'),(263,'Final Fantasy Sonic X: Episode 4','2005-08-01','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser','The fourth installment to the FFSX series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ka0.jpg'),(264,'Quake: Forgotten Sepulcher','2017-06-17','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Huge and intricately detailed map set in a medieval swampy environment. Loosely based on E1M3. New monsters, new textures, a new soundtrack, another great \"sock\" map pack. This map pack requires Arcane Dimensions to work (included) and should last an experienced player one hour of playtime.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mwa.jpg'),(265,'Achievement Unlocked','2008-12-17','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','A game all about the short, some might say meaningless, dopamine rush of getting an achievement.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zrm.jpg'),(266,'EpicDuel','2009-02-28','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','EpicDuel is a free to play browser MMORPG featuring PvP (Player vs Player) combat. Turn fantasy into reality by creating your custom character to fight your friends in turn-based real time strategy battles. And the best RPG gets better with new releases launching every week, so stay tuned to the Design Notes for behind-the-scenes MMO information and become the most epic dueler in all of EpicDuel!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s7p.jpg'),(267,'Battle Gear 3','2012-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Tactical, Indie','Web browser','The long awaited sequel to Battle Gear 2 is here! Get ready for the fight of your life! Battle Gear 3 takes the familiar formula from Battle Gear 2 and improves upon it by adding more units, more strategy, and a greater diversity of upgrades! The whole point of the game is to conquer the world one country at a time by carefully managing your troops! There are tons of upgrades and leveling up to do! How far can you get in this exciting strategy game? Good luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r8q.jpg'),(268,'SteamBirds','2010-03-03','Strategy','Web browser, Android, iOS','SteamBirds is a turn-based aircraft combat game set in an alternative XX century with a light steampunk flavour.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xqm.jpg'),(269,'Kirby Speed Eaters','2004-12-31','Arcade','Web browser','Kirby Speed Eaters is a Flash game based on the Speed Eaters minigame from Kirby & The Amazing Mirror.\n\nFour Kirbys are at a table. The table has a dish with a metallic lid on it. Occasionally, the dish is uncovered to reveal four apples or bombs. By pressing A, Kirby inhales the apples or bombs. Each apple gives the Kirby who inhaled and ate it one point, while any amount of bombs make the Kirby who inhaled it have to sit out for the next round. Whoever gets eight points first wins. If more than one Kirby presses A quickly, the four apples or bombs will be split between the Kirbys.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xfa.jpg'),(270,'Tank Operations: Diary of the War','2025-04-25','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience World War II\'s defining battles from a new perspective! In Tank Operations: Diary of the War, you command Allied forces through intense, turn-based warfare. Master battlefield tactics, upgrade your troops, and face an expansive campaign.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rxd.jpg'),(271,'Portal Panic','2012-04-28','Platform','Web browser','Pbot has gone on a rampage thanks to Blockheads lack of mental processing. You must venture forth and rescue your comrades who have been thrown into corrupt versions of their own domain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74hr.jpg'),(272,'Brute Wars','2008-05-07','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Web browser','Assemble a team of animal warriors to battle to the top of Mt. Asio. Unique turn-based battle system. Strategy/puzzle hybrid with some RPG elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kc0.jpg'),(273,'Robot Wants Kitty','2009-12-31','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','The first game in the \"Robot Wants\" series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nnd.jpg'),(274,'Tunguska: Slaughterhouse','2024-02-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A wave defense mode set in a new location in Tunguska. Stop the waves of minions from energizing the Dark Disciple and destroying the Zone. Arm and supply yourself with Soul Stones left by your fallen foes. Use your creativity with all the gears in the game to outgun a seemingly undefeatable enemy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87dr.jpg'),(275,'Sound of Slash',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(276,'The Youthdrainers','2016-09-18','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a side-scrolling horror game, with a good portion of adventure to it.\nThe game will begin with you in a room where you find a tape recorder with a woman\'s voice on it, who was the previous inhabitant of the room before you. The tape is a warning for other women who will be kidnapped, telling them what is going on and that she is going to kill herself before the evil little monsters burst through the door and take her baby.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(277,'Deep Sorrow','2017-11-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deep Sorrow is a horror/adventure game which leads you to a bunker and makes you feel desperate to get out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jro.jpg'),(278,'Action Arcade Wrestling','2022-02-09','Fighting, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Action Arcade Wrestling brings everything you love from 90\'s wrestling games with its own twist of chaos and fun. Join the action and step through the ropes in this fast-paced, arcade wrestling extravaganza to superkick the overly simulated wrestling games out of the ring!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uu1.jpg'),(279,'Defense Task Force','2018-06-19','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Defense Task Force is an infinite waves tower defense game for PC. The game that will appeal to gamers of all skill levels. Staged on a lifeless planet, with a breathable atmosphere called Delta Atheni, your role as commander is to defend the platform that\'s built to harvest energy and power Earth. You can defend by strategically building fortification towers, and attacking a large wave of continuous ailens called Kraken in various shapes and forms from destroying the harvesting platforms. As commander it\'s upto you how you use your resources against the Kraken.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(280,'Scrappers','2020-04-10','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','iOS','Scrappers is a game in which up to 4 players work together to collect garbage.\n\nIn the not too distant future, the robot team Scrappers collects trash in a city full of trash.\n\nCollaborate with your friends to pick up trash, throw it, stack it and load it on the truck!\n\nGarbage collection work is full of danger! Rival robots attack Scrappers aiming at garbage. It\'s up to you how to get through garbage collection and elimination of rivals!\n\nMaximize your garbage collection efficiency and receive higher rewards depending on your teamwork.\n\nUse your rewards to unlock new characters and customized parts!\n\nThis title was delisted form Apple Arcade n 2023 with the multiplatform release of PixelJunk Scrappers Deluxe','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2in1.jpg'),(281,'Thrasher Presents: Skate and Destroy','1999-11-15','Sport','Nintendo 64, PlayStation','Tour the world and ride open and interactive terrain through 12 levels of real-world skate spots from your hometown to New York, Los Angeles, San Francisco and international hotspots in the UK and Germany. The open-nature of the courses allow for constant mixing up of tricks on the quest to find the perfect line.\n\nChoose from six different fictional skaters with varying degrees of strength and weakness. For a tough and versatile skater, choose Axl or for a more balanced skater take Kahli on your mission. Each skater features their own skating and clothing style.\n\nAlthough each skater offers a different and varying skill level, their mission objectives are the same. Each player starts off as a wanna-be amateur skater with no sponsor or street credibility. Your goal is to turn your skater into the Thrasher Magazine Skater of the Year.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2roq.jpg'),(282,'M.U.D.S.: Mean Ugly Dirty Sport','1990-01-01','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','M.U.D.S.: Mean Ugly Dirty Sport is a fantasy sports game released on multiple computer systems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kse.jpg'),(283,'Quibble Race','2024-09-18','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Compete with the computer or your friends to earn the most money in a futuristic alien-horse racing game. Sponsor some of the quibbles or sabotage them to improve your odds.\n\nGame available on UFO 50.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vma.jpg'),(284,'Dr4x','2022-01-15','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fast paced dark fantasy turn based strategy game with horror elements In a world with many secrets to uncover... The game has simple, fun, fast paced gameplay full of tough choices where each of the many factions plays wildly differently and the world evolves and changes as you play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hin.jpg'),(285,'Portal Quest','2012-07-02','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','Escape from the laboratory using a portal gun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7y6s.jpg'),(286,'Royal Defense: Ancient Menace',NULL,'Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The dwarven kingdom struggles against the Ancient Menace, who only wants to crush the dwarves and claim their territory. To defeat the monstrous hordes, you must construct defensive towers and units and learn to wield powerful spells.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(287,'F1 2015','2015-06-12','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Race like a champion in F1 2015 and get closer than ever before to the experience of racing in the world’s most glamorous, exciting and prestigious motorsport. F1 2015 puts you in the heart of the action with a stunning new game engine that recreates the blisteringly fast and highly responsive racing cars of Formula One and features all-new ‘broadcast presentation’ that immerses you in the unique race day atmosphere.\n\nCompete as your favourite Formula One star in the new Championship Season and push yourself to the limit in the challenging Pro Season mode. Hone your skills in the new Online Practice Session, and then challenge your friends and racing rivals from across the world in Online Multiplayer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mzh.jpg'),(288,'Sanjijukugo Flash','2005-03-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle','Web browser','Sanjijukugo Flash is a free mini Flash game provided by GAMEDESIGN. It\'s very simular to Yojijukugo Flash. \"Sanjijukugo\" is a Japanese idiom consisting of 3 kanji.\nIn each stage, some kanji are randomly placed. The goal is to construct Sanjijukugo by rearranging them with a mouse in all 5 stages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2la9.jpg'),(289,'Territory War Online','2008-05-26','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Web browser','Defend your turf! They think they can take over your land? They have another thing coming...\n\nA throwback to classic games such as Worms and Scorched Earth, this turn-based battle game is off the chain; unleash ballistic destruction upon the invaders and shed no tears as they burst into dust.\n\nTest your skills online in this multiplayer edition -- Can you be the top dog? Jump online with your XGen account, or hit quickstart for instant action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nkl.jpg'),(290,'My Reaper Girlfriend','2020-07-21','Visual Novel','Android','One day, you\'re just an average high school student. The next day… A reaper\'s assistant?!\n\nYou were living a normal life as a student, but on the way home from school one day, you see the girl you have a crush on about to be hit by a car! You jump in and manage to save her just in time… But unfortunately, you take the hit! You wake up to find that your soul has left your body and two grim reapers, who happen to be very cute girls, show up to take you to the afterlife. Knowing that you saved your crush’s life, you\'re okay with moving on… However, the reapers are impressed by your sacrifice and decide to bring you back under one condition: You become their assistant reaper!\n\nYou agree to their proposal and wake up in bed back home, thinking it was all a dream. But when the two reapers show up asking you to report for duty, you quickly realize you might of bit off more than you can chew… Will you be able to help them with their mission to collect souls? Will you be able to find out why two cute girls like them became grim reapers? Will your crush discover your secret?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yql.jpg'),(291,'My Night Sun All Games','2023-11-10','Sin género','Xbox One','A Bundle containing all My Night Sun Games games.\nIncludes: 3 Xbox games and 3 Windows games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e2p.jpg'),(292,'Bronk\'s Skyglide Challenge',NULL,'Platform','Web browser','A Flash game featuring Bronk the dinosaur, formerly hosted by Postopia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2td2.jpg'),(293,'Frost Bite 2','2008-12-17','Platform','Web browser','Frost Bite 2 is the sequel to Frost Bite. The player controls a climber who is trying to reach the top of several different mountains, this time with caves!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8v9z.jpg'),(294,'Discontinue','2019-06-10','Music, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Discontinue is a competitive VR room-scale disc throwing game experience with over 8192 levels, your goal is to survive your chosen generated synthwave/cyberpunk style parkour and set a new high score. Are you up for this challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m9b.jpg'),(295,'Kremling Krushin','2000-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','Kremling Krushin was an online Flash game released to promote the Game Boy Color release of Donkey Kong Country. It could be played on the game\'s official website, which is currently no longer in use by Nintendo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rmy.jpg'),(296,'Fushigi no Dungeon: Fuurai no Shiren GB - Tsukikage-mura no Kaibutsu','1996-11-22','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy','Shiren the Wanderer GB: Moonlight Village Monster is a roguelike role-playing video game developed by Aquamarine, part of the Mystery Dungeon series. It was originally released for the Game Boy by Chunsoft in 1996.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5axq.jpg'),(297,'Road of Fury',NULL,'Arcade','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kdg.jpg'),(298,'Dangle','2007-07-09','Platform','Web browser','Extend your thread and swing around obstacles to reach the floor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bdq.jpg'),(299,'Meat Boy','2008-10-05','Platform','Web browser','Meat Boy is a platform game made in flash, being the precursor of the Super Meat Boy franchise. The game relies on very precise platforming, and it is known for being very challenging.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o8h.jpg'),(300,'Fall Minamo','2022-09-09','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is about you, Minamo-chan, being swept away by a waterfall.\n\nThe object of the game is to survive as long as possible, avoiding the attacks of the ferocious creatures that live in the waterfall.The longer you survive, the better your score, and you can enjoy a cute multi-ending based on your score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55dh.jpg'),(301,'Protectron 23 vs. the Alien Armada','2005-12-31','Platform','Web browser','Fight your way through waves of alien drones, to make it to the ALIEN BOSS and destroy it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86u9.jpg'),(302,'Obey! The Game','2009-12-17','Platform, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The rules are changing on you. Be prepared to obey or disobey the task at-hand. Survive as long as you can in this mashup up of microgaming and (strangely) Simon Says.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kqv.jpg'),(303,'Fox McCloud\'s Blazing Blueberry Blast Off','2002-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(304,'Nightmare Before Disney 2 April Fools','2017-04-01','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nightmare Before Disney 2 is an April Fools game made by StellaWisps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78zw.jpg'),(305,'Dead Frontier','2008-04-21','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dead Frontier is a free-to-play, browser-based MMO game which takes place in a post-apocalyptic, zombie-infested setting. Players can explore a huge world alone or with friends, and wield over 100 weapons to be used on zombies or players in PvP mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hol.jpg'),(306,'Steel Division 2: Nemesis - Battle of Rimini','2021-01-28','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nemesis: Battle of Rimini takes place during Operation Olive, set in mid-September 1944, which saw the Allies attempt to break through the German-held Gothic defensive line on the Adriatic coast.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rip.jpg'),(307,'Super Mario Bros. Crossover','2010-04-27','Platform, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super Mario Bros. Crossover is a fan-made crossover platform Flash video game launched on Newgrounds on April 27, 2010 by Exploding Rabbit. It is based mostly on the gameplay of Nintendo\'s Super Mario Bros. for the NES. The only major difference is the ability to control characters that debuted in other Nintendo Entertainment System games unrelated to the Mario series. The latest version available (3.1) was released on December 25, 2013.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u7k.jpg'),(308,'Keeper Of The Hell Gate','2020-04-16','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Medium-sized runic map. It is based on the progs_dump mod (included) and a few extra models and sounds as well as a music track by the author. The map source is included.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78ah.jpg'),(309,'Final Fantasy Sonic X: Episode 5','2006-01-10','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser','The fifth installment to the FFSX series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96hh.jpg'),(310,'Colony Defenders TD','2011-12-31','Indie, Arcade','Web browser','In this game you\'ll have to protect your base against your enemies. Arrange your troops near the path and get rid of the waves of enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r9h.jpg'),(311,'Billionaire Lovers','2021-07-03','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You’re a broke college graduate. Your rich, distant uncle has just shown up out of nowhere and given you 100 million dollars! You’re now one of the ultra-rich and getting ready to move into a downtown garden mansion. And right at this moment, four handsome men come into your life. Could this be… the romance you’ve been waiting for!? But wait, there’s something behind their smiles that says otherwise…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m5o.jpg'),(312,'Magneboy','2008-04-08','Puzzle','Web browser','Use the power of magnetism to push and pull platforms to reach the exit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85mg.jpg'),(313,'Human Guise','2021-12-27','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Human Guise, you, along with FBI agents, will have to investigate a series of brutal murders, find the culprit and put an end to this nightmare. However, the solution may be very unexpected.\n\nA dark point&click adventure where you become Ada Thornton, an FBI agent. She and her partner will investigate a series of murders in a small town. They are both professionals, focused and well-prepared. But don\'t forget that they are just people, with their own stories, secrets and fears. Get to know the locals, interrogate them and remember that everyone you meet may not be who they seem at first sight.\nInvestigate the case, uncover the truth, whatever it may be, but remember - you may regret it, this investigation will irrevocably change the lives of the protagonists.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49z6.jpg'),(314,'The Sims 3: Fast Lane Stuff','2010-09-08','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Shift gears and take your Sims for a spin with The Sims 3: Fast Lane Stuff. For the first time ever in a stuff pack, your Sims can get new cars along with furnishings, décor, and apparel in four distinct vehicle‐themed lifestyles. Will your Sims embody the speed demon way of life? Or cruise in classic luxury automobiles with the top down? Will they rebel against the establishment in pin‐up girl dresses and rockabilly tough guy attire? Whatever their lifestyle, this pack takes your Sims on the rides of their lives!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hgx.jpg'),(315,'FeedVid','2020-02-17','Puzzle','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Introducing FeedVid, a revolutionary new video-sharing website and social network. Our platform integrates an advanced neural-network based algorithm that automatically determines your viewing preferences. We serve you the content that you want to watch!\n\nUpdate from FeedVid Inc. CEO August Williams\n\nWe are aware of an issue affecting a small number of users in which our algorithm will recommend disturbing or highly unusual videos. We appreciate the support from the community and ask that you flag any such videos that you find in your feed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lo1.jpg'),(316,'Bronk\'s Jungle Adventure',NULL,'Platform','Web browser','A Flash platformer featuring Bronk the dinosaur, formerly hosted by Postopia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tkc.jpg'),(317,'Bedrock Snowball Bash Game',NULL,'Shooter','Web browser','A winter-themed snowball fight Flash game featuring the cast of The Flintstones, previously available to play on Postopia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tkk.jpg'),(318,'Rewrite','2017-03-23','Visual Novel','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable','Rewrite is an all-ages rated Japanese visual novel developed by Key. The story follows the life of Kotaro Tennoji, a high school student with superhuman abilities who investigates supernatural mysteries with five girls from his school. This ultimately leads him into the middle of a conflict between familiar summoners and superhumans searching for a familiar girl named Kagari who is the key to intelligent life and its destruction on Earth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4fga.jpg'),(319,'She and the Light Bearer','2019-06-06','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','She and the Light Bearer is a point and click adventure game inspired by fairy tales, accompanied by beautifully hand-drawn art and acoustic folk musics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sfx8honnt91lw6vqj88n.jpg'),(320,'Travel to USA','2020-05-02','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','After an exciting visit to Europe, the Hudson family is back home. But Jennifer met a new friend on the plane, and Mark invited the family to join him on a trip around the United States. Join Mark and the Hudson\'s on their new adventure; find hidden objects and solve challenging puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q8a.jpg'),(321,'Frogger','2011-10-01','Platform, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A PC port of Frogger that was released as a part of Konami\'s PC promotion with Taco Bell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80la.jpg'),(322,'Phantasmal Garrison','2000-05-13','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A four level wizard/medieval episode with a start map. Features exploding barrels, cutscenes and a few new monsters (dragons and boss).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8762.jpg'),(323,'Super Obama World','2008-11-04','Platform','Web browser','Super Obama World is a parody 2D platformer based on former president Barack Obama. The game is heavily based on Super Mario World.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bop.jpg'),(324,'Making Fiends: Pumpin Plunkin\'','2008-12-31','Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Pumpkin Plunkin\' is a Flash game made by Amy Winfrey for the Making Fiends website. It is also available at Nicktoons\' site.\n\nAt the beginning of the game, the rules are explained by both Charlotte and Vendetta. The overall objective is to throw pumpkins at Charlotte while she moves around the screen in various costumes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ade.jpg'),(325,'The Legend of Zelda Randomizer','2015-03-14','Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','Have you ever wanted to replay the Legend of Zelda, but played it so often that you can\'t get it out of your head? Similar to many other randomizers out there, this can shuffle the game as you like to allow you to re-experience Zelda each time that you play it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69w9.jpg'),(326,'Honey Dress Up','2023-05-13','Sin género','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','\'Honey Dress Up\' is a simple dress up game, but with a cute boy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f5q.jpg'),(327,'Chased by Darkness','2021-06-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chased by Darkness is a 1-4 players co-op survival horror. Your mission is to face supernatural entities and banish them to the spiritual plane. Explore, fight enemies and don\'t let the darkness reach you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30ry.jpg'),(328,'Magic Touch','2007-08-31','Arcade','Web browser, Android, iOS','Draw the symbols to pop the balloons and stop the beetleknights from landing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7j58.jpg'),(329,'Gravinaytor','2010-11-18','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','Gravinaytor is a puzzle/platformer with a twist, in which you have to manipulate gravity to solve different types of puzzles and escape from gravity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bgw.jpg'),(330,'The Deepest Sleep','2014-08-01','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Here you are, at the final depth. Danger lurks behind every corner, even the Shadow People are afraid of this place. Will you be able to get back to the surface and wake up? Or will you remain here forever?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co682u.jpg'),(331,'Heroes of Hellas Origins: Part Two','2022-09-28','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','With Hellas captured by evil, it is in desperate need of saving. Join Hades in this match-three puzzle game to transform the stone wasteland into a realm of justice and rid the people’s hearts of evil. Become the hero that saves Hellas!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hdr.jpg'),(332,'Indestructotank','2007-11-15','Arcade','Web browser','As the pilot of an indestructible tank, you have certain responsibilities - Kicking Butt! Use the enemies weapons against them as you catapult yourself through the air and destroy the enemy air force!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vgq.jpg'),(333,'Sega Ages: Sonic the Hedgehog 2','2020-02-20','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Hailed as one of the most successful games for the Genesis/Mega Drive, Sonic the Hedgehog 2 garnered critical acclaim swiftly after its 1992 release. Follow Sonic and Tails (in his series debut!) as they team up against the nefarious Dr. Eggman in order to save the Chaos Emeralds from the clutches of evil.\n\nThe new Drop Dash from Sonic Mania has been added to this version of the game, along with Super Sonic mode, the option to play with all the Chaos Emeralds from the start, and the 3DS version\'s Ring Keeper mode, where you only lose half the rings when damaged. It also includes Knuckles\' version of the game, Knuckles the Echidna in Sonic the Hedgehog 2, originally accessed by connecting Sonic the Hedgehog 2 with the Sonic & Knuckles cartridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24jn.jpg'),(334,'Drop Point: Alaska',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(335,'Zombie Sniper Shooting 3D','2014-05-12','Shooter, Simulator','Android','Feel like a real sniper! A zombie group has occupied city. Attack the zombies to save the civilians!\nTurn your android phone into a battle field and snipe all your enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7oiw.jpg'),(336,'Heroes Chronicles: The Fiery Moon','2000-11-15','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Heroes Chronicles: The Fiery Moon is the sixth episode of the Heroes Chronicles series. Alongside Heroes Chronicles: The World Tree, it was released as a bonus in downloadable format on 3DO\'s official website between the release of the first four Chronicles and The Final Chapters. \nThe campaign is a direct sequel, concluding the story arc commenced in The World Tree. As Vorr flees Enroth for a deserted, post-apocalyptic world, Tarnum and his Stronghold armies pursue, seeking to free the two remaining Ancestors from their imprisonment and destroy their insane counterpart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ohvn9ymtyb7dvdutzi86.jpg'),(337,'Connect the World',NULL,'Card & Board Game','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co873t.jpg'),(338,'Star Project','2010-09-09','Simulator, Visual Novel','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81m9.jpg'),(339,'Meet\'N\'Fuck Intensive Therapy','2008-08-06','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Today your adventure begins in hospital. Don\'t worry, you\'re okay, just a little shocked after car accident. You\'ll take a treatment in company of two delightful nurses!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5if9.jpg'),(340,'The Sims 2: Holiday Party Pack','2005-11-17','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Add some holiday joy to your Sims\' lives with The Sims 2: Holiday Party Pack. Get into the holiday spirit and deck out your Sims\' homes with 40 new objects and traditional décor items from around the globe. Indulge your Sims this season with this collection of 60 items of festive fun, from Germany to China!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hh9.jpg'),(341,'Newfound Courage','2019-03-22','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','You\'re a young man named Alex who arrives in the cliffside town of Silverpine. Explore the town\'s many mysteries and meet its colourful townsfolk, while you grow closer to a kind-hearted local named Jake. Can the two of you save the town from the impending doom brewing inside the mysterious Vault?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31v2.jpg'),(342,'Independence Day Break Head to Head','2021-06-11','Arcade','PlayStation 4','Independence Day Break Head to Head is a retro arcade game that lets 1 and 2 players play head to head in a competitive arcade environment. Unique animated pixel bricks tumble down toward the users paddle along with Mini-Bosses and Powerups. Collect powerups as you progress through the levels and defeat your opponent. Thirty Levels to compete in and battle mini bosses on your way to victory in single player and two player modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a2w.jpg'),(343,'Iji','2008-09-01','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Iji is an action-packed strategic platform shooter with a detailed story, large levels with multiple paths, powerful bosses and lots of secrets. There are alternate gameplay events, dialogues and scenes depending on what you do, a wealth of extras and bonus features, and seven stats to upgrade through a leveling system. Iji herself has superhuman strength and abilities, and can crack Nanotechnology, use her enemies\' most devastating weapons against them, and be a pacifist or a killer - the story adapts to how you play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bem.jpg'),(344,'Space Voyager',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Have fun and learn with this entertaining 3D application by exploring the universe with SPACE VOYAGER \n \nGet to know the solar system, galaxies and universe in an impressionanate journey through space, discover the regions and places of each planet. Visit the International Space Station and tour its facilities. \n \nBased on actual footage delivered by NASA, feel like a space explorer with this entertaining application Space Voyager. \nThis a 3D application that will allows you to know the solar system, galaxies and stars In an entertaining way. You can travel through space feeling like an astronaut while learning about the different regions and zones of space objects. Recommended for children and adults.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/kczc6ocbvla9to0inclt.jpg'),(345,'Transylmania','2005-10-01','Platform, Arcade','Web browser','Your castle has been invaded and you must clear out all of the pesky villagers by turning them into the walking dead!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73oz.jpg'),(346,'Buster Baxter: Lung Defender',NULL,'Arcade','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cu6.jpg'),(347,'Silent Hill 4: The Room','2004-09-17','Adventure','Xbox, PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Silent Hill 4: The Room is the fourth installment in the Silent Hill survival horror series. The game is similar to the past entries in terms of atmosphere, never letting the player know what\'s behind the next corner or down the street. Aside from the traditional third-person-view, there is now a first-person mode which is used to control the main character when he is in his apartment. Objects that can be interacted with are highlighted by eyeball icons. The previous games in the series have mostly been about exploring the town and solving puzzles, but this installment has much more combat involved. There are more enemies in a given area, spread in cramped spaces. The main character mostly uses a standard Silent Hill arsenal of weapons, such as the steel pipe, pistol and a golf club.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vyk.jpg'),(348,'Tomb of the Dead','2022-10-09','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight against endless waves of demons inside a flesh creature. Classic horde gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d3h.jpg'),(349,'Monster Seek',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Sci-fi 2D-adventure game. Help the genius scientist go back in time and make his main dream come true. On the way monsters, riddles and unexpected allies will be waiting for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lj7.jpg'),(350,'War Mahjong',NULL,'Puzzle, Card & Board Game','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(351,'Cala a Boca, Galvão!','2010-12-31','Arcade','Web browser','Cala a Boca, Galvão! is a whac-a-mole game based on the internet phenomena of the same name, where you \"shut up\" the Brazilian sports narrator Galvão Bueno by adding tape in his mouth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w1k.jpg'),(352,'Crypt Raider','2003-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','Move the mystical blue balls into the portal to escape the level!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zq3.jpg'),(353,'The Awkward Steve Duology','2017-07-17','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An FMV objet d\'art about opening doors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ob7.jpg'),(354,'Axe Prime','2019-02-15','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Axe Prime is a medieval / fantasy fighting game There are 6 levels each level gets progressively harder','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(355,'Ghost Motel 1','2002-11-13','Point-and-click, Adventure','Web browser','Joseph Winter has recently passed away and now must check into the Ghost Motel.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(356,'Treasure Hunter: History of Monastery Gold','2023-12-19','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Treasure Hunter is a Metal Detecting Simulator, with lots of humorous quests and exciting storyline based on true event. With 250 thousand findings on the map and big open world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mor.jpg'),(357,'Obama in the Dark',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Help president Obama solve the mystery of a creepy haunted house!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(358,'Tunche: Arena','2019-01-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Try the challenging Arena mode, a free standalone version of an upcoming hand-drawn beat\'em up adventure Tunche, a glorious return of classic 2D beat\'em up gameplay mixed with roguelike elements, hand-drawn 2D style and witchcraft.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(359,'Zafehouse: Diaries','2013-08-05','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Safehouse: Diaries is a fresh take on the zombie / survival horror genre. If you\'re sick of mindless shooters or generic-looking top down affairs that just don\'t get what the zombie genre is about, this is the game for you.About Screwfly Studios\nWe\'re a two-man developer based in Australia, dedicated to creating deep, innovative strategy games for PC. Zafehouse: Diaries is Screwfly\'s debut title and the spiritual successor to the highly-regarded Zafehouse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81fx.jpg'),(360,'Numbskull','2008-10-27','Puzzle','Web browser','Rotate selected ground to roll the skull head back to the rest of his body.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i6v.jpg'),(361,'Warfare 1917','2008-09-19','Tactical','Web browser','Warfare 1917 is the first game in the Warfare series, The game is set during the First World War, where the player, playing as either the British Army or the Imperial German Army, must defeat their enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3toj.jpg'),(362,'Rolley-Ball','2006-12-11','Puzzle','Web browser','Try to roll a ball out of several mazes/puzzles.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(363,'The Dancer: Definitive Edition',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Run from the most terrifying monster the world has ever seen - royalty free music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5n01.jpg'),(364,'Moai no Su','2005-12-16','Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82xc.jpg'),(365,'Solipskier','2010-08-29','Sport, Arcade','Web browser, Android, iOS','Solipskier is an iOS and Android game developed by Mikengreg (developers of Gasketball) that involves drawing a slope for a stick figure skier and attempting to fling that be-scarfed and be-headphoned skier through gates and tunnels while avoiding obstacles like cliffs and electric fences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bkydiippndjs0752tgit.jpg'),(366,'Alloy: Arena','2004-06-27','Shooter, Arcade','Web browser','Alloy: Arena is a game created by MindChamber and PsychoGoldfish. The minigame consists of using combos of guns, punches, and kicks to kill the gang known as \"Da \'Hood Rats\" and also the robotic cyber-dogs called \"Cyber Pit Bulls.\" The game has over 3 million views and features in the Flash Portal History 2004 Collection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8v96.jpg'),(367,'SpongeBob Moves In','2013-06-06','Simulator, Adventure','Android, iOS','Create Bikini Bottom, make food & keep everyone happy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uql.jpg'),(368,'LEGO The Robot Chronicles','2009-12-31','Racing','Web browser','In this game the player helps to defend LEGO City from Doctor Inferno and his robots. This is accomplished by doing missions for various LEGO characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62nk.jpg'),(369,'FrankenBob\'s Quest Pt 2','2009-10-01','Platform, Adventure','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fs3.jpg'),(370,'Transference','2018-09-18','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Oculus Rift, Xbox One','Transference is a psychological thriller. Meet a troubled family and solve their riddle through a multi-branching narrative by experiencing the limits of techno-psychology and escaping a maze-like puzzle concealing a corrupted truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yxu.jpg'),(371,'Treasure Island',NULL,'Point-and-click, Indie','Sin plataforma','\"If you really believe in something, it can be yours.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rmp.jpg'),(372,'Size Matters!',NULL,'Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(373,'Qingniao de Xuxiang','2004-10-20','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ewv.jpg'),(374,'A Small Car 2','2011-09-18','Racing','Web browser','Stay on the road and get the small car (that is hard to control) to the end of the level. Features two new cars that you can unlock.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k8h.jpg'),(375,'The Thought Police Hotline: Episode 1','2020-12-03','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you like comedy and sci-fi and want to try something new? This visual novel is the first episode and it\'s John\'s first day at the Thought Police Hotline. You can click to move the dialogue forward. Estimated 1h to 1h 45m reading time depending on reading speed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nde.jpg'),(376,'Skywire VIP','2010-02-09','Quiz/Trivia, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Guess the skywire celebrities in this spin off from the Skywire series!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d4t.jpg'),(377,'Nightmare Before Disney','2016-09-09','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nightmare Before Disney is a Five Nights at Freddy\'s fangame, a point and click horror game. Created by the SubwooferX3 with motivation from Blackout1912, Nightmare Before Disney is a official remake of Sub\'s 2015 NBD.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a6a.jpg'),(378,'Sonar Beat','2019-01-27','Music, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','In Sonar Beat, your most valuable ally is rhythm. Your super secret nuclear base is under attack and only the most intense musical defense can save it! Boost your senses and launch a counter attack to the music and save your base.\n\nBut don’t let your guard down: each new wave will be more intense than the last one, so hang in there as long as you can and keep fighting with your rhythm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rcj.jpg'),(379,'Uncharted 2: Among Thieves: Siege Expansion Pack','2010-04-22','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 3','The Siege Expansion Pack was a DLC pack that could be bought via the PlayStation Store to be used in the multiplayer of Uncharted 2: Among Thieves. It contained six skins, two new maps (\"The Highrise\" and \"Museum\"), and the Siege Co-op Arena Playlist.\n\nIt also added 11 new Trophies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l5w.jpg'),(380,'Checker Connector','2000-12-31','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Checker Connector is a single-player, strategy game that is played against the computer on 7 x 6 grid. It is a computer version of the classic board game Connect Four. This is a-turn based game in which the player and the computer take turns placing pieces on a board. The objective for each player is to create a line of four of their pieces, the one who accomplishes this first wins the game. The game is entirely mouse controlled. It is played in a window which cannot be re-sized. The game has sound, four levels of difficulty, in-game help screens, and a choice of playing piece, colour and screen background.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1k7e.jpg'),(381,'Slay','2001-12-31','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Legacy Mobile Device','Slay is a turn based strategy game where your goal is to conquer the island by buying men and using them to capture your enemies\' hexagons. By combining two men you can create a single more powerful man who is able to kill weaker men. The twist to the game is that the more powerful a man that you create is, the more expensive he is to maintain','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(382,'The Nerve Game','2001-12-31','Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser','You\'re running late for work. You\'ve got too much on. You\'re stressed and tense and you desperately dodge your way through friends, bosses and parties in a frantic attempt to hold your life together.\nSee your stress and depression rise to levels never seen before! Watch yourself collapse then explode! Explore the part of your life you\'d rather forget about!\nIt\'s all part of the fun of the Nerve Game...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4810.jpg'),(383,'Meet\'N\'Fuck Hawaiian Vacation','2008-10-29','Visual Novel','Web browser','Your hawaiian vacation dream has came true! 20 minutes ago, your plane arrived at the heavenly islands. Endless white sand beaches, warm ocean and a lots of sexy bikini girls! But first of all you should take your baggage and catch a taxi. Wait a minute, Who is this beautiful blonde? I think she could be a good begining for our story :)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5if5.jpg'),(384,'Color Spin',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(385,'Grand Theft Auto: New York','2024-04-16','Adventure','Web browser','Grand Theft Auto: New York is an unofficial Grand Theft Auto game for browsers developed and released by Kiz10. The game follows a set of missions the player has to achieve within the 3D world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co951n.jpg'),(386,'Sorcery','2012-05-23','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3','Sorcery is a magical fantasy adventure for the PlayStation 3 that transforms your Move controller into an incredible magic wand. The Nightmare Queen terrorizes the countryside, and only one of the fabled Sorcerers can stop her.\n\nCombine ancient, primal spells of the old world into devastating attacks as you battle the forces of darkness. Can you become a Sorcerer and save our world before it is plunged into Nightmare?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vpd.jpg'),(387,'Sonic Advent',NULL,'Platform','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(388,'Paladin: The Game','2007-12-23','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Web browser','Here it is! the PALADIN game! Play as Auron and experience the action of the PALADIN series first hand in this fast paced sidescroller.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ybz.jpg'),(389,'Go-Jin Senki','1998-08-06','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation','Go-Jin Senki is a tactical RPG game that takes place in a fantasy world where some evil forces controls some giant robots that they used to conquer all the lands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/z9wvsv3w70c10bpqlwep.jpg'),(390,'Circuits',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','a narrative journey through remembering, witnessing, and trauma','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(391,'Kawã na Terra dos Indígenas Maraguá','2024-01-10','Platform, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kawã na Terra dos Indígenas Maraguá is an educational platformer developed by the Federal University of São Carlos, under its LEETRA laboratory. It tells the story of a young indigenous boy who goes through the Wakaripé ritual. According to the tradition that marks the transition from childhood to adulthood, when boys turn ten, they must pass some tests to demonstrate their bravery. Then, at the age of 15, they face the even more challenging Gualipãg ritual, which entitles them to become \"chief hunter-warrior\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nac.jpg'),(392,'Powertrip','2021-09-08','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Powertrip is a 3D Platformer with a twist. You\'ve been captured by a cocky madman and if you want to escape, you\'ll have to complete his challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mlh.jpg'),(393,'MegaDrill','2010-12-31','Simulator, Arcade','Web browser','“I’m gonna be rich!”\nUpgrade that MegaDrill and dig down into the earth to salvage the treasures! You have 25 weeks to gather as much money as possible to buy the boat of your dream (maybe?) and go on a well earned vacation!\n\nTons of treasures, 12 trophies and 5 different endings based on your performances.\nPlay, upgrade and play again!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r91.jpg'),(394,'Lost Oasis','2025-03-15','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Embark on a serene journey through a vast desert, uncovering forgotten oases and hidden mysteries in this relaxing walking simulator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hi5.jpg'),(395,'Cloisterfuck','2018-11-09','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Large cloister/castle map combining Wizard/Medieval/Metal textures. Somewhat inspired by E2M5. It comes with a custom skybox.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77rw.jpg'),(396,'Dilberito','2000-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','A Flash game created to advertise the Dilberito, in which Dilbert must catch healthy foods while avoiding unhealthy foods while exercising to outlive his rival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a32.jpg'),(397,'WorldNeverland: Daily Life in the Elnea Kingdom - Pioneer Summer Outfit Set: Citrus','2023-07-06','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Comes with:\n- Pioneer Summer Outfit: Citrus \"Refreshingly cool summer wear often seen around the Nak Peninsula\'s southern frontier.\"\n- Summer Pioneer Kid\'s Wear: Cit \"Refreshingly cool kid\'s summer wear often seen around the Nak Peninsula\'s southern frontier.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sg8.jpg'),(398,'Tubby Toast','2004-12-31','Arcade','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gjh.jpg'),(399,'RoboSports VR','2016-11-07','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RoboSports is a vast collection of online multiplayer sports games!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(400,'The Coma: Cutting Class','2015-10-19','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Coma: Cutting Class is a survival horror adventure game. You are Youngho, a Korean high school student trapped and relentlessly pursued by a psychotic killer in the hellish corridors of Sehwa High. Run, hide, explore, and survive while piecing together the mystery of how and why you\'re here.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w0v.jpg'),(401,'Super Mario 63','2009-06-10','Platform','Web browser','A truly expansive Mario fangame based on Super Mario 64 that combines elements between it, Super Mario Sunshine, and Super Mario Galaxy. Released in 2009 and featuring 64 Shine Sprites and another 64 Star Coins to collect, it remains the largest-scale Flash-based Mario fangame to this day.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co637m.jpg'),(402,'F.E.A.R. Extraction Point','2006-10-24','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','F.E.A.R. Extraction Point is the first standalone expansion pack for the video game F.E.A.R. A prominent gameplay element new to this game is reflex time, an ability which slows down the game world while still allowing the player to aim and react at normal speeds. This effect is used to simulate the player character\'s superhuman reflexes, and is represented by stylized visual effects, such as bullets in flight that cause air distortion or interact with the game\'s particle system. Other new features include the ability to bash open doors by using the melee function, as well as blast them open with explosives, and the ability to smash crates, some of which contain supplies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1voy.jpg'),(403,'Go to Hell','2010-01-29','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','Web browser','Just go to hell and find out it\'s secret in this ultimate puzzle/arcade/platform game. You have to dig all the way down through caves filled with water, lava, boulders and enemies. You can avoid suffocating and kill enemies controlling flow of water and lava by digging holes in walls of caves. You can also push a boulder on the filthy worms and bats.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bid.jpg'),(404,'Avalon: The Legend Lives','1989-11-15','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser','Avalon is the longest running online roleplaying game in the world at 25 years (a world record). It is from Avalon that numerous contemporary genre-defining features such as cooldowns, player run organisations such as guilds, and the foundation of skill-driven player vs player combat originate.\n\nAn online text-based RPG ahead of its time ever since it began in 1989 as the first multiplayer roleplaying game online. Avalon is a fair meritocracy. You may quicken your pace but you cannot achieve excellence without deserving it and excellence in any area takes time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/b9fpuasapnlyivqah7ak.jpg'),(405,'Crazy Machines: Golden Gears','2014-03-27','Puzzle, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this \"Rube-Goldberg\" style puzzle game, experiment and build your wacky contraptions with physics action like never before! Experience dazzling visuals of explosives, fire, and true to life physics behavior when you put the experiment into motion.\n\nIncluding the Level Editor and Community for Crazy Machines Golden Gears!\nAre you a creator or do you just want to puzzle?\n\nThe level editor allows players to take control and put their minds to work! Build and create puzzles! Make videos, take screenshots and create crazy art to share with the community! Anyone can download your creations, play & rate them! Enjoy spectacular visuals, sharp shaders, textures, and backgrounds as the action unfolds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/quleeih68z8veqirgtcr.jpg'),(406,'Goken','2017-09-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','\"Action RPG\" A genre that defined adventure and represented the childhood of all gamers, revived, redefined, from Japan, on Steam. Goken will bring back everything that was right about gaming in an action packed open world environment and have the old school gamers tremble in nostalgia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2818.jpg'),(407,'Thin Ice','2012-10-31','Sport, Arcade','Web browser, Android, iOS','Cut ice with skating skills to sink the snow beasts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7u60.jpg'),(408,'Basket Random',NULL,'Sport, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Basket Random! Basketball is here with its most funny and random way. In Basket Random game, try to score a basket by using only one key with different variations from each other! Changing fields, changing players and changing balls do not surprise you! You can be the best of them all. You can play Basket Random game either against CPU or against a friend in 2 player gaming mode! The one who reaches 5 score first, wins the game. Have Fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ul2.jpg'),(409,'Big Cat Jigsaw Quest: Expansion Pack 2','2024-12-25','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unlock 16 brand-new puzzles and embark on a majestic adventure into the wild! Immerse yourself in the untamed beauty of lions and tigers as you piece together breathtaking scenes that showcase the raw power and grace of nature\'s most iconic predators.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mh0.jpg'),(410,'Meet\'N\'Fuck Denise Milani','2009-07-02','Visual Novel','Web browser','You\'ll play for a superhero, because today you\'re fated to save that awesome beauty. Then may be, she\'ll make an exception for you and you\'ll get unforgettable night with Denise Milani.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5izn.jpg'),(411,'Kill Lola Bunny',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f4i.jpg'),(412,'TrackMania 2: Stadium','2013-06-20','Racing, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','With over 12 million players, Stadium is the all time favorite racer on PC. A classic needs to stay true to its roots. The acclaimed gameplay of Stadium remains identical: same speed, same controls, same blocks!\n\nThis core experience is improved by ManiaPlanet: better graphics and more tools for the community. Lots of competitions, new maps and game modes. The most creative community on PC can now benefit from ManiaPlanet cutting edge technologies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6k7z.jpg'),(413,'PRIN-C1','2024-03-23','Platform, Racing, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','An Endless runner with a twist! Play as a dog named PRIN-C1 who can walk, trot and run but cannot stop.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u2o.jpg'),(414,'In the Dog House','2008-09-18','Puzzle','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nu6.jpg'),(415,'Bowmaster Prelude','2007-01-11','Strategy','Web browser','Bowmaster Prelude is a tactical warfare game which revolves around shooting arrows and training soldiers to destroy the opponent\'s castle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/n3xhieplbzim60jcy3d6.jpg'),(416,'Phantomphobia: Yijie','2005-02-19','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Fullmetal Alchemist fan-made game. It was intended to be the first part of a story which would be concluded in the second part: Phantomphobia Shinri. However, the latter ended up being a remake rather than a continuation. Though both games follow the same premise, the actual storylines are very different.\n\nAfter a failed alchemy experiment, Edward wakes up in a parallel world where alchemy is forbidden and Al has still his human shape. He soon gets into trouble with the military and the new Fuhrer, and is forced to work for them, investigating a secret organization. At the same time, he must find a way to return to his world.\n\nThe game includes light BL romance between Ed and either Al, Roy or Envy','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eww.jpg'),(417,'Surviving Titan',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','You\'ve crash landed on the planet Titan. Suffering from amnesia and armed with only a basic survival kit you begin exploring the planet looking for any signs of life. Can you craft, build, and survive long enough to discover the secrets of Titan and escape?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20n6.jpg'),(418,'UPIXO In Action: Mission in Snowdriftland','2006-12-01','Platform','Web browser','A platforming game created by Extra Toxic, with help from Nintendo. Doubling as a game and an advent calendar advertising different Nintendo products, every day from December 1 to December 24, 2006, an extra level was added to the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ayb.jpg'),(419,'Freeze-It',NULL,'Puzzle','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qz1.jpg'),(420,'The Road Less Taken','2007-12-31','Puzzle','Web browser','A self-competitive game in which, as the player moves up the grid on each level, their chosen path is used to block them in later rounds.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(421,'Enlisted: Direct Fire Bundle','2024-07-16','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','This Bundle includes:\n\n- A premium Pz.Sfl. Ic tank\n- A premium squad consisting of 3 tankers of level 4\n- A premium M8 A1 GMC tank\n- A premium squad consisting of 4 tankers of level 4\n- 400 Gold','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j63.jpg'),(422,'Tails of Iron & Tails of Iron 2: Standard Bundle','2025-01-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Rats exact revenge against the Frogs & Dark Wings with this ‘Tails’ bundle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d0w.jpg'),(423,'The Princess\' Heart','2015-07-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','With a style inspired by Earthbound and Final Fantasy 3, The Princess\' Heart features up to 15 hours of epic fantasy gameplay.  Follow Princess Aerin on a quest to defeat her demons, both literal and metaphorical, in this light-hearted tale of hope and love.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tbi.jpg'),(424,'Hara Katsu! 3: Kozukuri Business Haigyou no Kiki!?',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(425,'Hot Air','2005-12-06','Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Guide a hot air balloon through a series of levels filled with monsters, spikes, and other hazards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bu1.jpg'),(426,'Life The Game','2016-06-30','Indie','Web browser','Life: The Game on Poki is the best way to experience an entire journey, from birth to death, in game form! From study dates to actual dates, play Life: The Game and see if your life is delightful or disastrous. This Life game features different minigames for each stage of your life. As of 2020, there are four new fun mini games: Burger Madness, Study Session, Travel Puzzles & Rainbow Melody. You can play Life: The Game for free, but your bad decisions might cost you your in-game survival! Join thousands of Life: The Game online players and cycle through tons of fun minigames!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co978k.jpg'),(427,'Jigsaw','2006-10-25','Puzzle','Web browser','A Flash-based jigsaw puzzle game featured on Gaia Online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co314u.jpg'),(428,'The Fancy Pants Adventures: World 1 Remix','2014-12-31','Platform, Adventure','Web browser','Relive the nostalgia of The Fancy Pants Adventures: World 1 as you speed over spidery slopes and parkour your way to victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k5d.jpg'),(429,'Terminal Compression','2024-08-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eye.jpg'),(430,'Kingdom Hearts Integrum Masterpiece for Cloud','2022-02-10','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','Journey through the exciting world of Kingdom Hearts and follow Sora as he and his friends embark on new adventures through Disney and Pixar Worlds. Starting with Kingdom Hearts HD 1.5+2.5 ReMIX, the story of Kingdom Hearts unfolds as Sora , Donald, and Goofy battle the Heartless, making friends and having spectacular adventures along the way. The series culminates with Kingdom Hearts III + Re Mind, where our trio unite with iconic Disney-Pixar characters old and new to prevail against tremendous challenges and persevere against the darkness threatening their worlds.\n\nKingdom Hearts Integrum Masterpiece for Cloud includes:\n- Kingdom Hearts HD 1.5 + 2.5 ReMIX\n- Kingdom Hearts HD 2.8 Final Chapter Prologue\n- Kingdom Hearts III + Re Mind (DLC)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hb0.jpg'),(431,'Climberia','2016-04-05','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Android, iOS','Climberia is an action mobile game with amazing climbing gameplay. Players control both hands of a legless pirate using inertia to climb up and collect gold while running away from a greedy octopus. Fun yet challenging, be warned - you\'ll die a lot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/iefpp33wjvv37so33yof.jpg'),(432,'Atelier Escha & Logy: Alchemists of the Dusk Sky DX','2019-12-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The second title in the \"Dusk\" series. Escha, a girl focused on ancient alchemy, and Logy, a boy who studies contemporary alchemy, meet and are soon engrossed in the mystery of the \"Dusk\". Learn the truth as Escha or as Logy to bring the pieces together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wdq.jpg'),(433,'Pop Off 2','2023-09-15','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unleash fizzy chaos in \"Pop Off 2\"! Ascend the crater by flying between obstacles in this physics based platformer. Discover what mysteries this foreign landscape holds as you team up with friends, customize your character, and conquer the precarious unknown in this thrilling multiplayer adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76me.jpg'),(434,'Jen Saves Ben','2004-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Arcade','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6834.jpg'),(435,'Bonk.io','2016-04-08','Sin género','Web browser','A multiplayer browser game where the objective is to knock all of the opponents off the edge of the screen and be the last man standing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25l6.jpg'),(436,'Ninja Rinseout','2008-01-16','Sin género','Web browser','Use stealth and other ninja skills to rescue the princess.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co931j.jpg'),(437,'Dragon Question','2021-09-02','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Dragon Question is an edutainment software that combines mathematical exercises with the defense genre. You are Archmage Ryn, tasked with guarding the millennial kingdom of Mathateria. Defend the gates by solving math problems from hordes of monsters. Defend all four gates before a showdown with Isaac, the dragon of doom, and the main culprit behind the chaos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3btf.jpg'),(438,'Weapon of Choice DX','2021-09-02','Shooter, Platform, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Weapon of Choice DX is a high-energy, run \'n\' gun where each playable character is unique with their own special weapon and abilities! Blast insane aliens, find new player characters, and choose between branching paths! The world is being taken over by gene-combining beings from beyond the stars! Hideous new creatures are popping up everywhere, and it\'s up to the Solus Operatives to grab their unique weapons and split some disgusting alien skulls!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qi3.jpg'),(439,'Flipside','2008-11-14','Platform, Racing','Web browser','Two-player side on racing game with gravity-defying grip.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(440,'Shin Megami Tensei IV','2013-05-23','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo 3DS','Building on the styles of ATLUS\' Persona, Devil Summoner, and Devil Survivor titles, SMTIV is the first true successor to 2004\'s Shin Megami Tensei: Nocturne. The story of SMTIV revolves around the Samurai, the sacred protectors of the Eastern Kingdom of Mikado. As a newly appointed Samurai, players will struggle with factions that have nefarious designs on the world as they defend their home kingdom from a growing army of demons. Decisions players make throughout the course of the story will have lasting repercussions, as the fate of the world hangs in the balance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1n26.jpg'),(441,'Deeper Sleep','2013-09-20','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Will you be able to find a way out of this nightmare... again? Or, maybe on the contrary - will you go even deeper?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co682w.jpg'),(442,'Shin Seizonritsu 0%! Chikatetsu Kara no Dasshutsu','2014-04-18','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Shin Seizon Ritsu 0%! Chikatetsu Kara no Dasshutsu is the first suspense novel game from Voltage Inc. and is currently only available in Japanese.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66g7.jpg'),(443,'Avalanche','2009-12-22','Platform, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Avalanche (full name Avalanche: A Penguin Adventure) is a platform game Nitrome released for Miniclip December 22, 2009. Players control a penguin on a sled whose main goal is to outrun an avalanche.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vjd.jpg'),(444,'Dale and Peakot','2010-07-18','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','Play Dale And Peakot, a great action platform / puzzle game. Take two roles as Dale the farmer with a shotgun as well as Peakot his sidekick chicken with an attitude. Use Dale to take out bad guys, but the twist is you control Peakot at the same time to fly around and hit levers and switches. Try to solve your way out of eggy situations, and get back the stolen hens that have been captured by the coyotes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77an.jpg'),(445,'The Slaying of Sandy Hook Elementary','2013-11-30','Shooter, Simulator','Web browser','Based on the shootings at Sandy Hook Elementary, perpetrated by Adam Lanza.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66jx.jpg'),(446,'Will You Press the Button?','2013-03-31','Arcade','Web browser, Android, iOS','You are presented with a red button and two scenarios: one good and one bad. Both will happen if you Press The Button. Will You Press The Button? The choice is yours.\n\nDo you like to play games that make you think, laugh, and question your choices? If yes, then you will love Will You Press The Button? - the ultimate game of moral dilemmas!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co974h.jpg'),(447,'Immortal Souls: Dark Crusade','2011-08-09','Sin género','Web browser','In this action RPG game you try to destroy the monsters of the underworld. You can use various attacks, which come together to form chains. This causes that their power multiplies.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(448,'Riddle School 5: Legacy Edition','2020-11-26','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Riddle School 5: Legacy Edition is the last game of its series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47uo.jpg'),(449,'Dark Meadow: The Pact','2012-03-29','Adventure','Android, iOS','A dark fairytale of intrigue and mystery, where the sins of the past must be paid for…\n\nUsing fun and intuitive fully gesture-based controls, you explore the decaying ruins of Montclair Hospital, armed with your crossbow for long-range combat as well as your sword for up close and personal melee battles.\n\nThe best elements from role-playing games encourage exploration as a wide variety of items are secreted throughout the world – from hidden scraps of paper that reveal the mystery of your imprisonment, to weapons and items, to money which can be used to purchase better equipment and weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75hb.jpg'),(450,'Spider-Man','2001-06-29','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Nintendo 64, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation, Dreamcast','YOU DON\'T JUST PLAY IT... YOU LIVE IT\nHe spins a web, swings across the sky and lands with a somersault onto the Daily Bugle building. Who is this masked hero? It\'s you! Fight, jump and web-sling as Spider-Man as you take on a legion of sinister villains.\n\nThe city is depending on you. Start swinging...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xxq.jpg'),(451,'Fantastic Contraption Classic 1 & 2','2008-09-16','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The original physics building game is now on PC! Use minimal tools to build an infinite variety of puzzle-solving machines. Featuring over 70 THOUSAND user-generated levels, and includes the sequel Fantastic Contraption Classic 2!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3t4v.jpg'),(452,'Final Fantasy Sonic X: Episode 2','2004-11-01','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser','The second installment to the FFSX series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96hk.jpg'),(453,'Retrobooster','2014-06-05','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A reinvention of the cave-flyer for players who love games of skill. You control an extremely responsive ship, which opens up new possibilities for speed flying challenges, puzzles, and bullet hell scenarios. This game is set at 1980s difficulty--Survive it if you can.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yh4.jpg'),(454,'Avalon Code','2010-03-12','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo DS','Avalon Code plot, as well as the gameplay, revolves around the Book of Prophecy situated on the touch-sensitive lower screen of the Nintendo DS. In order to record a person, monster, plant, or weapon in its pages, the player performs a “Code Scan”, which is done by striking the target to be recorded with the Book itself (mapped to the B button at all times). The story centers on a young peasant who has been plagued with prophetic nightmares for weeks prior to the beginning of the story. His or her latest dream, shown in the opening cinematic, features a mysterious voice which reveals not only that the protagonist\'s world has undergone countless reincarnations in the past and is fated to continue the cycle of correction, destruction, and rebirth until “true enlightenment” is achieved, but also that the main character him- or herself has been tasked by the Powers-That-Be to deem the people, places, and things of the current world worthy (or unworthy) of being carried over into the next after the fiery purge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gad.jpg'),(455,'Bassin\'s Black Bass','1994-12-31','Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Bassin\'s Black Bass is a fishing game in which players aim to become a professional fisherman. It is part of Starfish\'s Black Bass fishing game series and their second title on the SNES. Originally titled Super Black Bass 2, the game was renamed for the US release and endorsed by the professional fishing champion Hank Parker. The object of the game is for the player to become a professional fisherman and can travel by themselves or along with Hank.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v5a.jpg'),(456,'Exmortis 2','2006-03-27','Point-and-click, Puzzle','Web browser','Exmortis II follows one of the last survivors, Mr. Hannay, who, following the words of an unknown entity at the resistance safe house, attempts to destroy the Cult of Exmortis once and for all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7put.jpg'),(457,'Daggan',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A sexy furry game where you reproduce to make big armies and build cities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cx6.jpg'),(458,'Mega','2022-09-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a short story about humanity\'s last attempt to resist nature. Cities lie in ruins, there are traces of huge claws everywhere - once disturbed by people, giants began to wreak havoc around the world. But is there a solution?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hx5.jpg'),(459,'Taiko no Tatsujin: Rhythm Festival','2022-09-22','Music','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Omiko City, the stage for Taiko no Tatsujin: Rhythm Festival! A city full of everyone’s favorite Taiko elements is gathered into one town! Together with DON-chan, meet your new friend, Kumo-kyun and aim to become a Taiko Master!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sq0.jpg'),(460,'PixArk','2018-03-27','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A sandbox game based on Ark: Survival Evolved developed by Snail Games (licensed by Studio Wildcard).\n\nEnter a world of mystery, danger, ancient dinosaurs, mythical beasts, and cubes! Work by yourself or with a tribe of others to gather materials, craft useful items, tame wild creatures, and build huge bases to survive in PixARK!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26cp.jpg'),(461,'Pharaoh Rebirth+','2016-03-17','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An ancient evil has been set loose, and Jonathan cursed in the process. Jonathan must now collect seven holy grails from around all of Egypt to cleanse himself of the curse of Sehur the first.\nBe delighted by the quirky humor, charming characters, and the beautifully designed world, in Pharaoh Rebirth+!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eqi.jpg'),(462,'Rocketboat - Pilot','2018-04-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Far beyond the reaches of the Milky Way, a great darkness is looming. A clandestine force using powerful social manipulation techniques is controlling the resources of star systems throughout the universe. Their only existential threat appears to be a rock band from the planet Earth.\n\nMeanwhile on Earth, while experimenting with new ways to promote their music, the band Rocketboat is about to find itself on a life-changing adventure.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(463,'Beventlaed','2011-01-14','Puzzle, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beventlaed is a singleplayer Touhou puzzle fangame in which you have to connect strings of three identically colored UFOs. Red colored UFOs extend your life meter, blue UFOs increase you score multiplie and the green ones intrease your Bomb meter, which helps you get rid of glass UFOs (which normally can only be gotten rid of by connecting adjacent UFOs).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60m1.jpg'),(464,'Stark Tower Defense','2010-02-11','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Oh no! The town is under attack in the Stark Tower Defense game. The Marvel superheroes have no other choice but to do their best to stop the villains from conquering their headquarters. The Stark Tower is the only thing keeping them close, so they have to defend it at any price.\n\nThere are various defenses you can opt for when protecting the city. Each one is based on one hero\'s superpower. It is on you to be the strategical mastermind behind the defense line. Without your bird\'s eye view of the problem, these superheroes will be lost!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q77.jpg'),(465,'Ultraman Fighting Evolution 0','2006-07-20','Fighting','PlayStation Portable','Ultraman Fighting Evolution 0 (ウルトラマン ファイティング エボリューション ゼロ) is a fighting game from the series Ultraman Fighting Evolution. It is the fifth and currently last entry in the series.\n\nThe game was released to coincide with the release of the film, Ultraman Mebius & the Ultra Brothers. Both the movie and the game were created to commemorate the 40th anniversary of Ultraman.\n\nStory mode for the Ultra Brothers takes place sometime before the movie while Ultraman Mebius\' story mode takes place after Ultraman, Ultraseven, Ultraman Jack and Ultraman Ace got stuck on Earth after fighting U-Killersaurus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yqp.jpg'),(466,'Island Farmer','2021-11-11','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Farms are set up in islands over calm and clear water. In this tiny fantasy experience, that is easy to do and very relaxing, just like a 3D jigsaw puzzle. Carefully observe the island, try to memorize it, then shuffle the blocks. Swap blocks to reproduce the desired island and it will compose the archipelago. There is no time limit, no logic challenges, nor resources to manage, so you can calmly just focus on the core mechanics while listening to a soothing soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5997.jpg'),(467,'Draw Wario','2004-12-31','Arcade','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p8e.jpg'),(468,'Fat Cat','2008-12-04','Shooter','Web browser','Play as both the owl and the pussy cat in the frantic puzzle shoot-em-up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8r2h.jpg'),(469,'Bomba','2008-11-03','Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Mouse avoider with a difference! Deformable ground and power-ups.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nkj.jpg'),(470,'Longest Monday: Unveiling','2018-05-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Longest Monday: Unveiling is a science fiction detective quest, where you have to uncover the secret of a robotic corporation while trying to break out of the time loop.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(471,'Raid Gaza!','2008-12-18','Real Time Strategy (RTS)','Web browser','Raid Gaza! is a short real-time strategy Flash game by Marcus Richert which satirizes the Israel–Palestine conflict from a pro-Palestinian perspective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vex.jpg'),(472,'Robot Wants Puppy','2010-05-14','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','The second game in the \"Robot Wants\" series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nnq.jpg'),(473,'Thanatophobia','2012-02-01','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Thanatophobia is an old-school, third person survival horror game that goes back to the roots of the genre. A thought-provoking journey into darkness and depravity, the game has a focus on puzzle solving and storytelling over intense action...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/udafm27hvbvcpd1qtn6e.jpg'),(474,'A Koopa\'s Revenge','2006-01-29','Platform','Web browser','For years the Mario Bros. & company have been stepping on Koopas and Goombas. Now it\'s time for one koopa to get his revenge. Play through 16 intense levels to achieve your goal of rescuing your Goomba friends and getting revenge on Mario.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6y1h.jpg'),(475,'Perfect Ball','2022-03-07','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You go on a long journey as a ball. All you have to do is get to the top.\n\nYou can\'t move alone. Because you\'re a ball without arms or legs. However, even if you can\'t move on your own, it\'s possible to move the ground you\'re standing on. Rotate and tilt the ground so that you can climb up!\n\nOf course, it will not be an easy journey. You can\'t stop or jump up wherever you want. Also, all kinds of obstacles will interfere with you.\n\nHowever, don\'t give up and go up. It doesn\'t matter how many times you fail. Even if it takes a lot of time, put all your strength into it, tilt the ground, and reach the top along with the tilted land.\n\nThe top of the lonely world will wait for you forever.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rmu.jpg'),(476,'Crypto Girl: The Visual Novel','2018-03-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Learn the story of an ordinary girl Dokkaebi who decided to become a miner and farm the crypto currency','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(477,'King\'s Quest: Chapter 2 - A Rubble Without a Cause','2015-12-15','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','King’s Quest - Rubble Without A Cause is the second of five chapters in the new, critically acclaimed reimagining of the classic King’s Quest game series. In this latest adventure, King Graham takes players back to his first test as ruler of Daventry. When a mischievous horde of goblins takes his kingdom hostage, a newly crowned and woefully unprepared Graham must rise up to free his people and prove himself the leader he was destined to become.\n\nWill Graham and his friends unearth a way to escape their rock-brained captors? Will he take for granite everything he learned as an adventurer? Does he have the stones to reclaim his mantle and lead his kingdom to safety? Will the hat make it out ok? It’s time to tell your story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ye7.jpg'),(478,'The Normal Thing','2020-12-11','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Normal Thing is a story about a dog who lost his memory. Sunless forests, strange gardens, weird inhabitants... Start a little journey to retrieve your memory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4401.jpg'),(479,'Oddworld: Soulstorm - Day 1 Oddition','2021-07-06','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Abe is not the typical hero you would expect. He does not carry weapons, nor is he trained in any martial art. Yet he will have to face an impossible threat from increasingly violent and manipulative powers that will try to destroy him and his race.\n\nThe Oddworld: Soulstorm Day One Oddition includes Oddworld: Soulstorm and one exclusive embossed metal case.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gu9.jpg'),(480,'Cooking Mama: Mama Kills Animals','2021-03-15','Simulator','Web browser, Android, iOS','A browser game created by People for the Ethical Treatment of Animals (PETA), an animal rights organization based in the United States. It\'s a parody of Cooking Mama created to advocate vegetarian and vegan diets. In it, PETA encouraged users to write to Cooking Mama developer Majesco Entertainment to create a version of the game with only vegetarian recipes. Mama Kills Animals consists of minigames related to the preparation of animal carcasses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g1w.jpg'),(481,'Unshaded','2021-07-21','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game from the creator of Within the Blade. Complete 100 hardcore stealth missions. Become a ninja master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ibt.jpg'),(482,'Meet and Fuck Leila','2008-05-23','Visual Novel','Web browser','Hey dude, Are you ready tonight for a new sexual adventure? Well, Listen to me. Do you see that pretty babe next to a bar table. I didn\'t see her here before. But I heard her name is Leila. Come to Leila and try to talk. Be smart enough and take her to your home. I think It will be a hot night with a hot babe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5i04.jpg'),(483,'Worm Food','2010-07-23','Arcade','Web browser','The tribe feels rumble under foot...they are worm food!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co975t.jpg'),(484,'Kill Justin Beaver',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f4j.jpg'),(485,'Volcano Princess','2023-04-21','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','After the war between humans and demons, you found a baby on the battlefield and became a father. You will Plan time and courses for her, bring her into contact with various roles, and raise her up. The daughter\'s future and the ending of the volcano country depends on each of your choices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f0e.jpg'),(486,'How to Raise a Dragon','2009-06-25','Adventure','Web browser','In How to Raise a Dragon, players guide a dragon through its life phases, shaping its abilities and behavior.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qps.jpg'),(487,'Candlelight','2022-05-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ed broke the curfew to visit his friends in order to find out the truth of his granddaughter\'s disappearance, but the truth was far more terrible than he thought.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cgu.jpg'),(488,'Divinia Chronicles: Relics of Gan-Ti','2015-09-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Divinia Chronicles: Relics of Gan-Ti is a single-player, classic-style Action-RPG with unique real-time combat system. Explore the islands around Oria, solve puzzles and fight a variety of creatures as Cyrus, Kira and Dyani work to destroy the relics of Gan-Ti and restore order to the land.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3j0c.jpg'),(489,'Notebook Wars','2010-12-31','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Get ready for the ultimate notebook shooter!\n\nDestroy hundreds of enemies and bosses to earn enough money to buy better planes and weapons, you have 40 different planes and 20 upgradable weapons to buy, and a survival mode… have fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qbf.jpg'),(490,'Meet\'N\'Fuck Subway Story','2008-06-22','Visual Novel','Web browser','Subway story is an erotic, romance game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5if0.jpg'),(491,'Donpen Beat','2009-12-31','Music','Web browser','Donpen Beat is a rhythm game by Japanese discount store Don Quijote. In the game, you control the store mascot, Donpen, who is on stage trying the gain the attention of the audience by dancing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dkj.jpg'),(492,'Naught','2020-07-31','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Naught is a platform videogame with a unique control where you rotate the environment to change gravity and guide the main character, Naught, through labyrinth levels full of challenges, hidden places and secrets.\n\nFeaturing varied, dynamic gameplay, Naught explores 70 levels where he must dodge danger and enemies arising from the shadows, discover hidden places, collect seeds of light that will help him access blocked areas, and recover the diamond fragments that possess enormous power.\n\nThroughout his adventure, he will be accompanied by the Spirit of the Tree, who will help him find his way through extremely narrow and complex labyrinths. You can also enjoy a time trial challenge on every level.\n\nIn Naught, you will discover an underground world full of lights and shadows, connected to the exciting story of our character: a soul awakened to face the shadows and protect what he loves the most.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31sp.jpg'),(493,'Avorion','2017-01-23','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Avorion is a procedurally generated sci-fi sandbox where players start out at the edge of the galaxy and must find their way to its core. Players build their own ships, which they will use to explore the galaxy, trade and fight. Space ships are mainly of large scale, with crews, turrets and energy systems that you will have to manage. The galaxy gets more hostile, but also more rewarding the closer players get to its core. You\'re free to play however you want, as a mercenary, freighter captain, admiral, scavenger or pirate, it\'s all up to you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1puf.jpg'),(494,'Riddle School 4: Legacy Edition','2020-11-26','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Phil Eggtree is now stuck in college. How will he escape this time?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47uj.jpg'),(495,'Mahou Shisho Ariana: Nana Eiketsu no Sho','2025-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Ariana the librarian’s mission is to restore the Books of the Seven Heroes, which have been tampered with. By using her special librarian magic to enter books, will Ariana be able to successfully repair all seven books and solve the mystery of the Library?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q8j.jpg'),(496,'Square Runner',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Square Runner is a fast-paced platformer where you try to go back to your home planet with the side effect of saving earth.\nWill you return home or will you be stuck on earth forever? Form a squad, explore the unknown Adamian archipelago and fight creatures in Square Runner','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oh8.jpg'),(497,'Club Penguin Online','2018-01-04','Arcade','Web browser','Club Penguin Online was an online multiplayer game that aimed to recreate the original Club Penguin experience.\n\nThe game was shut down in May 2020 by the City of London Police and Disney, after allegations of illegal activity against the games owner, Riley, had surfaced.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rvz.jpg'),(498,'Far Cry 3: Ultimate Edition','2013-01-15','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This Ultimate Edition includes all bonus DLC content: Monkey Business Pack, Lost Expeditions, Warrior Pack, and Predator Pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nlo.jpg'),(499,'Basho\'s Frogger','2000-12-31','Indie','Web browser','A short game based on one of the most famous haiku by Matsuo Basho.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5eug.jpg'),(500,'Mega Man Again','2024-04-15','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A classic adventure... Remade!\n\nRevisit the first of the many adventures of the blue bomber against the nefarious Dr. Wily in his full 8-bit glory, with features not available on the original.\n\nThe game currently includes Mega Man 1, currently working on both polishing current content and adding the entirety of Mega Man 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fnh.jpg'),(501,'Gerda: A Flame in Winter - Modstand Bundle','2023-05-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The Gerda: A Flame in Winter Modstand Bundle contains:\n\nGerda: A Flame in Winter (main game)\nGerda: A Flame in Winter - Liva\'s Story (DLC)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rzo.jpg'),(502,'Super Brawl','2010-12-31','Fighting','Web browser','The initial release of Nickelodeon\'s Super Brawl for browsers and PC executable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3sbm.jpg'),(503,'Renegade Racing','2013-02-07','Racing, Sport','Web browser','Complete various missions as you race through 18 adrenaline-packed stages, unlocking and upgrading 12 different vehicles along the way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99tb.jpg'),(504,'Snow Drift','2007-12-14','Platform','Web browser','Take out penguins and avoid the arctic enemies using your drifting abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7u61.jpg'),(505,'Adventures of Samuel: The Worst Game Ever Made',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','This game is an absolutely terrible platformer game that has nothing unique or interesting about it. While playing the game, leaving task manager open is advised. This game is not fun and can be damaging to mental health if played in large quantity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56z3.jpg'),(506,'Ice Breaker','2009-01-05','Puzzle','Web browser','Ice Breaker is a physics-puzzle game released January 4, 2009, and is the first installment of the Ice Breaker series. The player must use the mouse to cut ice and objects to get the vikings to their longboat. This game, along with twelve other games, was made a distributable game on August 25th, 2011, and was one of the first distributable games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s9a.jpg'),(507,'Raze 2','2011-12-11','Shooter, Platform, Indie','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nup.jpg'),(508,'Meet\'N\'Fuck Threesome Fun','2008-07-09','Visual Novel','Web browser','It\'s happened last summer. My good friend Chris was walking around the town. He\'s seen two pretty ladies staying in the rays of sun. Usually modest, at this time he stepped up and took on a challenge. Want to know what happened next? Let\'s play this dirty adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5if4.jpg'),(509,'Antheads: It Came from the Desert II','1990-01-01','Puzzle, Adventure','Amiga','A Cinemaware classic returns for round two.Date: January 1st, 1956. Place: Lizard Breath, California.For five years, rumours have abound that numerous giant ants were sighted in the hills around Lizard Breath, even though these have been dismissed as “delayed hysteria” by the city’s inhabitants. Nowadays, the inhabitants of the region are far more interested in the substantial amounts of money, which pour in by means of the nuclear test program sponsored by the government. Even the strange stories that are heard about the hospital in Melville are not taken seriously, as everyone hastily adapts to the “atomic” future.All that only changed when Brick Nash stole a plutonium-cartridge loaded truck and headed in the direction of the abandoned lab of Dr. Wells.Is the nightmare starting again?Can one safely go in the desert on the search for the lost submarine? And why do some people in town look so strange when faced with sugar cubes? You can find the answers in “Antheads: It Came from the Desert II”.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qdd.jpg'),(510,'Blocky San Andreas Police 2018',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(511,'Monster Evolution','2009-01-01','Platform','Web browser','Play as a monster. Create havoc, feed on humans, and evolve into 25 different monsters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gfq.jpg'),(512,'Borderlands 2: Game of the Year Edition','2013-10-11','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Borderlands 2 furthers the distinct blending of First Person Shooter and Role Playing genres to create the true evolution of the Role Playing Shooter. Team up with up to three other players for four-player online goodness or go old-school with two-player split-screen couch sharing mayhem as you spend hours leveling up your character and equipping them with one of the millions of badass weapons. Borderlands 2 features a new visually stunning array of procedurally generated guns, shields, grenades, artifacts, enemies and more. Choose one of the four new character classes to be taken through a carefully crafted and connected story to all new and surprising environments across the living planet of Pandora. Make new friends, arm them to the teeth and fight alongside them on your relentless quest for revenge and redemption.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k8e.jpg'),(513,'TU-46','2011-12-13','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','TU-46 is a sequel to the game TU-95. This time around you control a 1970s airline. You get to control the brand new passenger aircrafts from Tupolev. Deliver passengers around 6 countries, use upgrades to improve your plane\'s stability and try to shine in the daily newspaper, every airline has its deadline, be the last one to stick around.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mt8.jpg'),(514,'Radical Fishing','2010-03-01','Sport, Arcade','Web browser','Radical Fishing is an Adobe Flash-based game where a fisherman sits in a boat and casts his line into the water, pulls up fish into the air, and shoots them with a gun.\n\nVlambeer sold the Flash game to a browser games website in 2010 but kept the rights to produce a sequel for iOS, which they called Ridiculous Fishing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nd4.jpg'),(515,'Tales from the Borderlands: Episode 1 - Zer0 Sum','2014-11-25','Point-and-click, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One','A new episodic adventure set in the badlands of Pandora. This collaborative brain child, is set after the events of Borderlands 2 and is a part of the franchise\' official lore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vcq.jpg'),(516,'In Fear I Trust: Episode 2 - The Last Desk','2016-09-22','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','“In Fear I Trust” 2nd Episode tells us the story of Nikolay’s memories of horrific events that took place in the school. Nikolay finds a diary and a note from one of the students and recalls what strange things happened with the children, what experiments were carried out on them, which then influenced their aggressiveness. He finds a photo of the girl with whom he became friends and tries to remember what exactly happened to her, and why the school principal carried out all those experiments, and whether it is connected somehow with the VERSA company.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tql.jpg'),(517,'Spider Solitaire Online','2016-09-01','Puzzle','Web browser','Spider Solitaire Online is a new twist on the popular solitaire genre of games. In this version you have the ability to sign in as a guest or to link your Facebook account and play using Facebook features such as sharing or asking your friends for gifts and lives.\n\nThe game has over 300 unique levels that get progressively harder the further along you go. There are various bonus items that will help you on your way and these can be unlocked the further up the board you go.\n\nThe aim of the game is to remove all the cards from the board in a set amount of moves. On some levels there is a time limit as well as various obstacles that you have to overcome.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ma3r7lxc5siehbhf9re3.jpg'),(518,'Rubble Trouble Tokyo','2011-07-28','Puzzle','Web browser','Carefully Demolish buildings with new tools in this Rubble Trouble Follow up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co975l.jpg'),(519,'Coinbox Hero','2011-09-30','Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Man those coinboxes are trouble. Take this one down with everything you got! Hire hands to help you loot and plunder. When you’re ready to take it down…. a tactical nuke is just around the corner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zqu.jpg'),(520,'Skywire','2007-03-28','Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Carefuly navigate your passengers along the the treacherous, fun-filled cable car track.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bu2.jpg'),(521,'Tales from the Borderlands: Episode 4 - Escape Plan Bravo','2015-08-19','Point-and-click, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox 360, Xbox One','A new episodic adventure set in the badlands of Pandora. This collaborative brain child, is set after the events of Borderlands 2 and is a part of the franchise\' official lore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vcu.jpg'),(522,'2D Knock-Out',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','In this boxing game you\'ll have to take part in fights all over the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co976m.jpg'),(523,'Code: To Jin Yong',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Code: To Jin Yong is a tribute to well-known wuxia writer, Jin Yong. The new game is based on the world created in his wuxia novel series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yih.jpg'),(524,'Meet\'N\'Fuck: Star Mission','2010-04-15','Visual Novel','Web browser','The year is 3050. The male population has decreased dramatically as a result of long, bloody, intergalactic wars. Now all men are property of the United Galactic Federation and are used only for reproduction purposes. In special cryogenic capsules, male individuals are shipped to different parts of the universe for the settlement of new planets. Our hero Chuck is one of those guys. After awaking from hypersleep he decided that time of sexual revolution has came!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5eml.jpg'),(525,'Nanobots','2007-10-09','Shooter, Arcade','Web browser','Use three types of weapon to take out the hordes of micro enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kms.jpg'),(526,'Final Ninja Zero','2009-04-08','Platform','Web browser','Super-charged Prequel for the Ninja Swinging Series','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qsr.jpg'),(527,'Rewind to Fear: The Mansion','2023-11-22','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In \"Rewind to Fear - The Mansion\", you play as a brave woman returning to her late grandmother\'s home, discovering a trove of mysterious VHS tapes. When you press play on the vintage VHS player, you\'re transported into the memories of the person behind the camera. As you step into the shoes of an individual from the past, you\'ll unravel long-held family secrets, solve intriguing puzzles, and make choices that shape your history. Can you face the fear, confront the unknown, and connect the recorded memories to your own existence?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qqu.jpg'),(528,'The Lost Mythologies','2016-01-28','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Lost Mythologies is a Chinese styled action game with intense combat. Use various skills to defeat loads of enemies, explore the ruins of the fallen empire and finally face the notorious ancient weapon - the Black Rakshasa.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7f1b.jpg'),(529,'Wodopom','2024-09-04','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','it\'s a spaceship management simulation with space and crew combat, planetary visits, anomalous events, quests, and loot! Manage your crew and every aspect of your space vessel to rescue the galaxy from the Greystar!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rvy.jpg'),(530,'changeType()','2014-02-20','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','Swap all spikes with blocks or springs with coins. Rewire the Platformer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qz3.jpg'),(531,'Anarchy Reigns','2012-07-05','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Anarchy Reigns is an online multiplayer brawler, from the makers of Bayonetta and Vanquish, PlatinumGames.\n\nSet in the post-apocalyptic future, this is an over-the-top close combat fighting game, set in a massively open and fantastical world. Pick from an imaginative mix of human and cyborg characters and set out on a multiplayer challenge where anarchy reigns.\n\nWith a diverse range of multiplayer modes on offer, Anarchy Reigns pits players against each other in team co-op or last man standing battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gao.jpg'),(532,'Webkinz Friends','2012-05-04','Sin género','Web browser, iOS','Ganz brings the fun of Webkinz to Facebook with a new social twist, enabling parents and teens to build the Kinzville of their dreams with the added benefit of sending prizes to any Webkinz World account from Facebook.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(533,'Pixel Pop','2009-01-07','Music, Arcade','Web browser','Chop melons, smash the military and make animal noises to the beat!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s9d.jpg'),(534,'Insider Tales: The Stolen Venus 2',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','A world-renowned painting has been stolen! Help Francesca find the masterpiece and convict the culprit! The luxury cruise ship, The Empire, is boarded by rich tourists, a world-renowned art-exhibition, and a thief. Soon the highlight of the exhibition is stolen and Francesca di Porta, the famous detective, is disturbed in her well-earned holiday to investigate undercover and prevent a panic among the passengers in Insider Tales: The Stolen Venus 2! Solve the case using your Hidden Object talents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6h78.jpg'),(535,'Amanatsu','2022-07-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','DVD Player, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Surrounded by the blue sea and green mountains, the protagonist moved there.\nFor him, who has been struggling with the competitive society of the city, this is not a place to retreat, but a new battlefield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oxw.jpg'),(536,'Strider Hiryuu','1994-09-22','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','NEC Avenue\'s Strider Hiryuu is a port of the coin-op for the PC Engine. This port is infamous for its protracted development, as it was originally announced as a HuCard for the PC Engine SuperGrafx in 1990 before undergoing various format changes, ultimately being released as a CD-ROM game for the Arcade Card add-on in late 1994. Its most noticeable changes are new animated cutscenes, arranged Red Book-quality soundtrack, and an optional bonus mission between the first and second stages, set in a desert. Otherwise, the game plays similar to the coin-op. The new cutscenes appear to have inspired the later Strider 2, as both games use similar wireframe maps for their stage introductions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tth.jpg'),(537,'Three of Cards','2021-03-04','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Three Cards is a movie-like noir card action game. The magician has a horrible relationship with insurance company A. Help the magician to take revenge on the key characters who have plunged him into hell, and shed light on his path. Because the process will be very dark and terrible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44me.jpg'),(538,'Train Sim World 2','2021-08-19','Racing, Simulator','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The evolution of train simulation! Master iconic locomotives on high-speed services, long freight hauls or precise commuter traffic, and get creative with customisation tools in this advanced sequel. Climb into the cab in Train Sim World 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k5p.jpg'),(539,'Dive to the Titanic','2010-12-14','Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive in your submarine down through the deep 3-D sea to the legendary wreck of the Titanic. Navigate your camera robot through the many decks, rooms and aisles. Discover lost treasures and riches, and upgrade your equipment to complete more challenging missions through the wreck. With Dive to the Titanic, you can explore one of the world\'s most famous shipwrecks brought to life in stunning 3-D detail and with realistic sounds and effects. By completing more missions you can upgrade your underwater equipment, giving you access to more parts of the wreck. At a depth of almost 4,000 meters you must carefully watch the status of your batteries and communications equipment if you are to successfully complete your mission and return from the legendary wreck of the Titanic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3opg.jpg'),(540,'Red Ball','2009-06-23','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','Online Flash game made by Eugene Fedoseev. Roll the ball around each level and make it the flag to advance to the next level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hbd.jpg'),(541,'Acno\'s Energizer','2002-03-31','Puzzle','Web browser','Acno\'s Energizer is a flash game developed by Uselab and published on the Miniclip flash portal in 2000. Acno\'s Energizer is a puzzle game where the player maneuvers Acno, a little yellow sprite, around a room with goal of getting one or more red orbs into the portal to \"energize\" it and move to the next level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9abk.jpg'),(542,'Pokémon Sky Stacker','2007-03-31','Puzzle, Arcade','Web browser','The aim of each level is to reach the top of the screen by stacking blocks on top of each other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tar.jpg'),(543,'Powerup','2009-04-22','Puzzle','Web browser','Connect metal blocks to transfer energy between transformers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98db.jpg'),(544,'Don\'t Shoot the Puppy','2006-12-31','Puzzle, Indie','Web browser','A 2006 Flash game in which players must resist shooting a puppy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2egn.jpg'),(545,'Snailiad','2011-06-27','Platform, Indie','Web browser','Snailiad is a classic Metroidvania/platformer indie game created by Auriplane. The game features a secret-packed retro world with multiple bosses and equipment upgrades. It also features a boss rush mode, and \"Sluggy Slug\" mode where you cannot retreat to your shell as a shield. The game can be found on the game\'s official website, Newgrounds, and a few other places like Kongregate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j5v.jpg'),(546,'Pandora: Chains of Chaos','2020-09-26','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 17-year-old girl named Pandora has opened the box that could destroy the world. Kome Village, her home, is invaded by creatures spawned from the darkness and the legendary Titans. During the invasion, Pandora obtains an unusual weapon, an Umbrella, which allows her to defeat the Titans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qso.jpg'),(547,'Chisel 2','2011-03-16','Puzzle','Web browser','Planet digging follow up to our former title, now with the power to rocket jump!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co975q.jpg'),(548,'Colonel Kerfuffle in Tiki Treasure','2008-12-31','Adventure, Arcade','Web browser','Colonel Kerfuffle is in search of the legendary Tiki Treasure of Tiki Treasure Island!\n\nHelp him avoid The Terrible Tikis, Meddling Monkeys and other dangerous obstacles, to find the treasure before time runs out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bwg.jpg'),(549,'The Kill Kar II: Revenge','2009-12-02','Sin género','Web browser','The Kill Kar II: Revenge is a driving/horror Flash game and sequel to the Kill Kar created by JAZZA.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ybe.jpg'),(550,'FishVille','2009-06-11','Simulator','Web browser','Fish Ville is an addictive game where you raise cute baby fish, feed them as they grow, and decorate your fish tanks with friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d43.jpg'),(551,'What Walks on Four Legs','2020-06-23','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as Charles, an old journalist chasing down rumours of a strange phenomenon known as Portals that change anything that passes through them. An other-wordly mysterious light emits from the Lighthouse nearby. He had to see this for himself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qp3.jpg'),(552,'Flappy Bird Flash','2014-02-04','Arcade','Web browser','An unofficial remake of Flappy Bird for browsers made in Adobe Flash by maxblive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xet.jpg'),(553,'Claire a la Mode',NULL,'Platform, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Team up with a friend or go it alone into a sugar-high adventure! Bake your dessert masterpiece and collect new bakers as you rise through a high-stakes bake-off full of cheaters. Fend off their decadent lackeys and against all odds, come out on top in a worldwide baking frenzy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fy6.jpg'),(554,'Al Crepuscolo VR','2022-11-22','Music, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Oculus Rift','A relaxing experience in virtual reality where you use your kayak to travel through a magical corner of wildlife to locate the venue of a magical music festival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tn1.jpg'),(555,'Pokéwalker','2010-03-14','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Handheld Electronic LCD','The Pokéwalker is a pedometer device specifically for use with Pokémon HeartGold and SoulSilver that is able to interact with the games in various manners. It was released in Japan on September 12, 2009 bundled with every copy of Pokémon HeartGold and SoulSilver, and then later released with every localized copy of the games. The accessory has a Poké Ball design with a small monochrome LCD screen and three functioning buttons. The Pokéwalker supports infrared signals allowing players to interact within a short range with a game card of Pokémon HeartGold or SoulSilver while slotted in the Nintendo DS, or with another Pokéwalker.\n\nThe system records every time a step is taken, and the daily step count influences which wild Pokémon and items will appear. The player can transfer a Pokémon to the Pokéwalker from either HeartGold or SoulSilver, which gains experience for each step. Like the Pokémon Pikachu and Pokémon Pikachu 2 GS, the Pokéwalker uses a currency known as \"Watts\" (shortened to w); every 20 steps will earn the player one watt. Players can also catch various Pokémon and obtain items on the device, then transfer them to the game. Alongside the Johto Safari Zone, the Pokéwalker allows for Pokémon normally unavailable until after the player has traveled to Kanto, such as Murkrow, to be available before defeating the Johto League.\n\nMuch as HeartGold and SoulSilver are remakes of the original Gold and Silver, the Pokéwalker could be considered to be somewhat of a remake of Pokémon Pikachu 2 GS, which interacted in much the same way with the Generation II games. Unlike Pokémon Pikachu 2 GS, however, Pikachu is not the only Pokémon that can be interacted with, and Pokémon can actually be transferred to and from the Pokéwalker at any given time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yas.jpg'),(556,'Cosmic Cannon','2009-05-17','Shooter, Arcade','Web browser','Keep a ball in the air as long as possible by firing more balls into it.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(557,'Red Rogue','2012-12-04','Platform','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Red Rogue is a side-scrolling roguelike. Descend into the Dungeon of Chaos, retrieve the Amulet of Yendor, kill all who stand in your way and return with your prize.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qsk.jpg'),(558,'An Idle Nightmare 2: Sabbath','2024-11-17','Visual Novel','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The knotting of the twigs. Gnarled Obzhynki. Erde\'s Congregation. In the woods, a spark is lit. The black masses rise anew. A raven\'s nest in bloom. The Sabbath has begun.\nA few kilometers away from there, you enter the same shabby office building you have for the past year and a half, constrained to wither away your fickle little life on corporate work and cheap booze. The world is a contradiction, dull yet garish, numbing yet full of quiet panic. But it doesn\'t have to be.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iqf.jpg'),(559,'Stick RPG 2: Director\'s Cut','2011-04-19','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Thrust into an unfamiliar and bizarre city, find your place amongst the strange citizens by earning money, buying property and building up your stats. Collect the mysterious trans-dimensional artifacts to solve the mystery of Paper Thin City!\n\nThe Director\'s Cut contains tons of new content not available in the online version.\n\n• New areas to explore and new quests to complete\n• A total of 25 careers, including Lumberjack, Professor, Escort, Personal Trainer, Light Knight and Dark Lord\n• 18 new weapons\n• 3 new combat zones\n• All cheats unlocked\n• Online and offline saving\n• Expanded romance system\n• 2 new mini-games\n• 30 trophies to earn\n• Full original soundtrack in MP3 format','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ud6.jpg'),(560,'Alien Hominid','2002-08-07','Shooter, Platform','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qjt.jpg'),(561,'GT and the Evil Factory','2009-08-15','Arcade','Web browser','GT and the Evil Factory takes place in a factory where robots are enslaved by the cruel Lord Foreman to monotonous and grueling tasks. One day, a robot named GT decides its about time to start a revolution and destroy the wicked establishment of robotic slavery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z5h.jpg'),(562,'Mega Man Zero 1.5','2006-03-20','Sin género','Web browser','This game is a cross between Mega Man Zero I and Mega Man Zero II during a period when battles between reploids and humans have been ongoing for almost twenty years now.\nMegaman Zero 1.5 is a fan-made game developed by Haileon Games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4as4.jpg'),(563,'World of Diving','2014-08-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','World of Diving is the Oculus Rift-enabled online diving game that brings you an exhilarating multiplayer diving adventure, all without getting wet. access the game via Early Access and start playing straight away!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nec.jpg'),(564,'Truck Driver','2020-11-17','Racing, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Build your career as a Truck Driver! Fuel up and cruise through a vast open world in one of the most beautiful machines known to man. Start off as a contractor and work your way up by taking on jobs, earning money and making a name for yourself amongst the local community. Buy your own trucks, get new parts and hurtle down the roads! Do you have what it takes to become a respected Truck Driver?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s5a.jpg'),(565,'Vivaldia 2','2023-10-30','Fighting, Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Pitted against relentless robotic foes and navigating through dense and perilous jungles, scorching lava fields, and treacherous swamps, Vivaldia once again seems faced with an impossible challenge.   With the fate of the land in her hands – will Vivaldia rise to the occasion?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bux.jpg'),(566,'Alcohol & Ammo','2001-08-03','Shooter','Web browser','You go shootin\' with your friend Jeb.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7l0q.jpg'),(567,'Boxhead: The Rooms',NULL,'Shooter, Arcade','Web browser','How long can you survive against the zombie onslaught.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92gk.jpg'),(568,'Zombie Trailer Park','2010-12-31','Strategy','Web browser, iOS','Zombies have taken over and destroyed the Metropolis - luckily you were never much for city folk. But now the zombies have turned their sights on your trailer park! Manage your economy and train fighting units to defend your trailer park. Gather \'Yee-Haw\' power to activate super weapons. Submit and share your best stage times with your friends. Here come the zombies! Go go go!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e20.jpg'),(569,'Paper Mario: The Thousand-Year Door','2004-12-31','Puzzle','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p1w.jpg'),(570,'Behind the Frame: The Finest Scenery / The Star Named Eos','2025-08-07','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qfd.jpg'),(571,'Cosmic Leap','2016-03-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Time your jumps from planet to planet, avoid the obstacles thrown in your path and blast off to safety with your rocketship!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(572,'Mario Cart','2012-12-31','Racing','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fpn.jpg'),(573,'Meet\'N\'Fuck: Road Trip','2008-08-29','Visual Novel','Web browser','Today you\'ll take an amazing road trip in company of gorgeous busty blonde Jessica. Her car broke down in the middle of a road and only you could help her to take out of this situation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5if3.jpg'),(574,'Tiny Castle','2010-04-06','Puzzle','Web browser','Make your way through the ever changing level to save the princess?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co975n.jpg'),(575,'Space Hopper','2007-05-15','Platform','Web browser','Navigate varying planets in this gravity twisting space adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ak9.jpg'),(576,'Sonny 2','2009-02-23','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Dear Human,\n\nBy now you know what it\'s like to be a Zombie. To be hunted. To be hated. You fought to survive in a world that didn\'t make any sense.\n\nBut now you\'re getting used to it. Your senses have sharpened. You finally begin to understand. Why be the prey...\n\n...When you can be the predator?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qkxvqotzmxcplf8gsm4g.jpg'),(577,'The Transporter','2002-12-31','Racing, Arcade','Web browser','Guide the tricked-out BMW to the Eiffel Tower completing Frank\'s latest job as the transporter. Five collisions and the BMW is toast.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s7i.jpg'),(578,'A Good Hunch','2007-07-01','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','Every night, Tina and Harvey visit each other\'s dreams and make their way to their special place high up in the clouds.\n\nGuide these two colorful goats\' ascent through the summer sky and explore 20 dreamscapes full of moving platforms, teleports and daisy petals! Play Harvey until he reaches a level\'s exit, then jump back in time and switch to Tina, while Harvey\'s actions are simultaneously replayed. Cooperation and careful timing are the key to mastering the game\'s many puzzles - as Tina needs to jump on his back to reach high locations, always make sure Harvey is at the right place at the right time!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(579,'Goosebumps Ghouls Slime Slinger',NULL,'Shooter, Arcade','Web browser','A gallery shooter game featured on the Scholastic website.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nfi.jpg'),(580,'Luigi\'s Mansion Organ Game','2001-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pfk.jpg'),(581,'Teslagrad 2','2023-04-19','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Teslagrad 2 is the sequel to the original Teslagrad, developed by Rain Games and released in 2023. This 2D puzzle platformer builds upon the magnetic and electrical mechanics of its predecessor, with players once again using these abilities to solve puzzles and traverse complex environments. Set in a new region, the game introduces new powers, enemies, and challenges, while maintaining the visual storytelling and atmospheric design characteristic of the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6eo7.jpg'),(582,'Bittos+','2010-02-25','Puzzle, Simulator, Sport','Wii','Be smart, quick, and square with bittos+ on WiiWare.\n\nTired of the same old thing? Have you been waiting for the next big thing in casual/cross-over games? Well, guess what? The next big thing in games has arrived! Bittos+ is all about rotating, moving, and placing game pieces onto a game board to make squares. Yes, you heard right, squares! And more importantly squares within squares! Some of the most exciting square action ever! And all because making squares makes Bittos! The more squares, the more Bittos! What could be more fun? Playing Bittos+ provides hours and hours of entertainment for the whole family and boatloads of challenge and replay value for the most avid gamer. With multiple modes to unlock, game styles to suit every mood, multiple real-time reactive control methods, in-game Awards to collect, high scoreboards for both you and your household, Bittos+ sweeps you away, through luscious environments, and into a new game world, delivering on the commitment to a brand new gameplay experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ptt.jpg'),(583,'Hades Nebula','2023-06-13','Shooter, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hades Nebula is a futuristic vertical scrolling shooter set in the year 2124. As humanity searches for new habitable planets due to dwindling energy reserves, players pilot a small spacecraft on a mission to thwart the villainous Emperor Hades. The game unfolds against a backdrop of interstellar colonization and conflict, with players navigating through asteroid fields and waves of enemy forces. Gameplay focuses on skillful dodging and precise shooting, while power-ups enhance the ship\'s capabilities. With its blend of sci-fi narrative and classic arcade action, Hades Nebula offers a challenging space combat experience as players fight to secure humanity\'s future among the stars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86eg.jpg'),(584,'Falling Sands Fast','2011-10-04','Simulator, Indie','Web browser','A falling sand game by ajs11893 on Kongregate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38xz.jpg'),(585,'Riddle School 2','2006-11-13','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Phil escapes school... again!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61or.jpg'),(586,'Just a To the Moon Series Beach Episode','2024-09-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Beach Episode of To the Moon, Finding Paradise, and Impostor Factory. Or is it?\n...Yes, it technically is. Join familiar faces from To the Moon, Finding Paradise, and Impostor Factory in this narrative adventure filled with mini-games of varying elements, mysteries and relaxation, as well as... Wait, most of the characters here should already be dead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fi7.jpg'),(587,'Blosics','2009-12-16','Puzzle','Web browser','Blosics is a Flash-based puzzle-physics game where the player must shoot balls at green blocks to knock them off the screen. Doing this will award points and the player must meet a certain point threshold to move onto the next level. It cost points to shoot a ball, and the larger the ball, the more points it\'ll use up. The player must also refrain from knocking red blocks off the screen, as they subtract points from the score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6y66.jpg'),(588,'Smith and Winston','2019-07-26','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','When a strange signal is detected in deep space the Federation orders Smith and Winston to go and investigate. What they find, after a brief nap, is a shattered ring world, aliens and an evil overlord called the VOID.\n\nAfter crashing in to the ring world, due to a slight navigation error involving hitting an asteroid, you guide Smith and Winston through this strange new world.\n\nShippy, your ship, is there to help or maybe she’s there to kill you? Who knows? Either way, if you’re going to get home for another nap you’ll need to collect power cubes to repair Shippy!\n\nSmith and Winston is a twin stick shooter for Windows, macOS, Linux, PS4 and Nintendo Switch. Featuring hand built levels in a custom engine optimized for fun and destruction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41oz.jpg'),(589,'Dungeon Siege','2011-04-05','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dungeon Siege combines the immersive elements of a role-playing game with over-the-top intensity and non-stop action. Dungeon Siege plunges you into a continuous 3D fantasy world where you face off against an army of evil that has been unleashed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2348.jpg'),(590,'PetVille','2009-12-03','Simulator','Web browser','PetVille is a game where you raise, dress, and care for a pet that you create. Visit your friends\' houses and play with their pets to earn coins you can use to make your pet and house the coolest on the block!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j9m.jpg'),(591,'Age of Speed',NULL,'Racing, Sport','Sin plataforma','Master the race tracks of the future as you tackle loop the loops, huge jumps and corkscrews.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co976p.jpg'),(592,'Battlewrights','2025-12-31','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 4-player local party brawler with quirky characters, a unique movement system and fast, intense versus matches. Get back to the glory days of couch multiplayer and be ready to destroy some friendships.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lv6.jpg'),(593,'Puke the Pirate','2007-01-01','Platform','Web browser','Help Puke the Pirate run, jump, puke, and fart-fly his way through many levels of adventure!\nCollect as much of Black Barf\'s treasure as you can!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74iz.jpg'),(594,'Meet\'N\'Fuck: Ocean Cruise','2009-10-09','Visual Novel','Web browser','Nick Sanders is a beginner photographer from Springfield. Today he\'s got a really hot job. Erotic magazine Playdude is going to send him to the ocean cruise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5izj.jpg'),(595,'Hemo Racers','2014-08-16','Music, Racing, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A Flash-based rhythmic racing game. Hearts race in this 4-player beat-a-thon! Can you pump past the finish line? CAN YOU? Tap out the beat of a heart to get goin\'!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co404j.jpg'),(596,'Infested Planet: Trickster\'s Arsenal','2015-04-24','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This expansion for Infested Planet gives you several new ways to fight the bugs. Whether it\'s throwing cluster bombs into the alien swarms or calling in an airdrop, the power is at your fingertips. The aliens also get new toys, so brace yourself for new opposition.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(597,'Divinity: Dragon Commander - Imperial Edition','2013-08-06','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','More than \'just another\' strategy game, Dragon Commander seamlessly blends turn-based and real-time strategy, action gameplay and roleplaying into a grand adventure. Plot the political course of your empire, move your armies into key locations in the world, command troops on the battlefield, and decimate the opposition as a ferocious dragon.\n\nImperial Edition includes:\n- Digital soundtrack\n- Golden Dragon skin\n- Dragons on Earth campaign map\n- Behind the Scenes documentary','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wgx.jpg'),(598,'Interpoint','2019-04-15','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Interpoint is a first-person sci-fi mystery with elements of psychological horror. A secret organization made the discovery of parallel worlds. You are Harry G., a scientist, who took part in a project that was supposed to benefit all of humanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qfj.jpg'),(599,'Hot Air 2','2007-07-16','Platform, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Sequel to our balloon blowing original. Bosses and surprises galore!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d4r.jpg'),(600,'Super Robot Taisen T: Bonus Scenario Full Pack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Bundle with all extra scenarios, which includes:\n・ Armor Fight, Ready, Go!\n・ Vengeful Space\n・ Today is Bonus Day!\n・ Dynamic Reunion\n・ Pitch Black Stress\n・ Showdown! Cowboy vs CEO!\n・ Magic Knights and Battlers\n・ Paradise Gourmet Travelogue\n・ Where the Heart lies\n・ This is Paradise\n・ A Fairy Eventful Afternoon\n・ Decade-Long Trio\n・ Wandering Strangers\n・ Troubled Rivals\n・ Curse of the Superdeformed\n・ Who is the Protagonist?\n・ A Comet\'s Trajectory\n・ To the Future, Together\n・ Beautiful Criminals\n・ Special Section 3\'s Presentation','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bgb.jpg'),(601,'Johnny Upgrade','2012-04-14','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','In Johnny Upgrade, players will have to do exactly what the title says - upgrade! Each round you are given a limited amount of time to travel around the map and collect coins. The round ends when either time runs out, or players run into a trap located somewhere on the map.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r98.jpg'),(602,'Gunny Bunny: Double Sight','2005-01-18','Shooter','Web browser','Gunny Bunny: Double Sight is a shooting game where you use two weapons to eliminate all the enemies that cross your path.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mqo.jpg'),(603,'Achievement Unlocked 3','2012-05-29','Platform, Adventure','Web browser','Does reading this text earn you an achievement? Well, no, but 400 achievements await you in this latest installment in the AU franchise. Once again play as the Blue Elephant as he makes his way through complex puzzle maps in his quest to earn all achievements and escape to freedom.\n\nBut beware; King Hamster (who is actually a guinea pig... but don\'t tell him that) won\'t make it easy on you. And while spikes, flaming rodents, and perilous pits await you, ultimately your foe is time itself. So good luck on your most elephantastic adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bzz.jpg'),(604,'Brain Drain','2010-04-26','Sin género','Wii','Brain Drain is a puzzle game in which the player has to recreate a pattern, consisting of different symbols like apples or hearts, which is shown in the corner of the screen. The main playing field consists of said symbols, but randomly switched around. The player controls a frame which encloses four of the symbols. When pressing a button, the symbols are rotated clockwise around the frame. Of course the levels have to be solved within a time limit.\n\nIn the higher difficulty levels, the player also has to deal with so-called special effects which occasionally kick in during play, e.g. some symbols get hidden by \"?\" blocks, symbols rotate on their own or the controls are reversed. Three power-ups can be earned by completing bonus levels or finishing a level really fast: clock (stops time for 20 seconds), flash (skips the current level) and credit (gives a second try after time has run out). Clock and flash have to be activated manually; credits is applied automatically. Besides the regular playing mode, there is also the \"Brain Race\" available which involves solving a certain number of levels (depending on the difficulty) as fast as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pu2.jpg'),(605,'Bombing Quest','2020-03-04','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bombing Quest is a single player bomberman fantasy RPG, where the ancient machines of a civilization long gone, awaken you as the last protector of a mysterious ark. Dive deep into the mists, blasting your way through hordes of fierce foes and unravel the reason for your existence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p1x.jpg'),(606,'Scooby-Doo 2: Monsters Unleashed - Escape from the Coolsonian','2004-03-26','Point-and-click, Puzzle','Web browser','A spooky point and click game where you help Scooby and Shaggy escape from a museum which has a fiendishly effective jumpscare. Made to promote the Scooby-Doo 2: Monsters Unleashed movie.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99gv.jpg'),(607,'Walking in Circles','2002-06-30','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74ml.jpg'),(608,'Neon Race','2010-12-31','Racing, Indie','Web browser','In this car-racing game similar to Tron you\'ll drive a fast neon car and will have to crash into the red vehicles to destroy them. Avoid the purple ones and reach the goal in as little time as possible to unlock the next level and upgrade your car.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r9b.jpg'),(609,'Alien Story: Games for kids',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(610,'Kids Vehicles Fire Truck games',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(611,'Lullaby of Lost Soul',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lullaby of Lost Soul is an atmospheric horror game with anime-style graphics, built on Unreal Engine 5. Explore the eerie Academy, uncover its secrets, and face the ghost of a deceased girl. Solve puzzles, evade traps, and unravel the mystical story to break an ancient curse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fix.jpg'),(612,'Bratz Kids: Slumber Party','2008-12-11','Adventure','Wii, Nintendo DS','Welcome to the Bratz Kidz Slumber Party! Join your favourite Bratz Kidz characters for a game filled with all the fun of a late night party – no boys allowed!\n\nYasmin is hosting a sleepover. As our 4 girls look through Yasmin\'s photo album, they remember all their craziest times together and embark on an adventure based on each of the memories in the album! Explore the adventure mode or dip in and out of a series of fun mini games where you customise your favourite Bratz Kidz characters. You can also make a delicious pizza for your girlfriends, take stylish photos, create your very own clothes and much more in this sassy sleepover!\n\nSelect, customize and play with your favourite Bratz Kidz. Jade is really respectful, Sasha is very dynamic, Yasmin is self-confident and Cloe is sweet – and of course they\'re all sparky, adventurous and cool.\n\nJoin the Bratz Kidz Slumber Party in this sleepover themed world with an adventure based on Jasmine\'s photo album full of memories. The game stimulates the player\'s creativity and imagination with focus on fun, fashion and glamour! The kidz with a passion for fun are waiting for you to arrive…\n\nPlay 11 brilliant mini-games and activities including choreography, music and clothes design, Friendship tests and photo-sessions!\nCollect stars use them to buy items to customise your character in the Bratz Kidz shop\nFully customise with over 350 accessories options including hairstyle, make-up, manicure, clothes, shoes and jewellery – totalling 843750 different combinations!\nPlay in Freeplay or Album mode, then choose Competition or\nPlay with up to 3 friends in multiplayer mode. Exchange items, play mini-games and more!\nComplete all the mini-games and unlock exclusive scenes from the Bratz Kidz Sleep Over Adventure DVD','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pu3.jpg'),(613,'Milk Inside a Bag of Milk Inside a Bag of Milk','2020-08-26','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','A short story about what sort of challenges everyday little things can be. Help the girl buy milk, be the first not to disappoint her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66n4.jpg'),(614,'Neon Race 2','2012-12-31','Racing, Indie','Web browser','Race at super speeds through futuristic landscapes. More speed, more upgrades, more unlocks, more TURBO!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r9c.jpg'),(615,'Mastermind: World Conqueror','2008-10-05','Real Time Strategy (RTS)','Web browser','A real-time strategy game based on the Newgrounds web series Mastermind','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co752h.jpg'),(616,'Time Traveling Raptors',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','16-Bit inspired action exploration platformer about a girl trying to fix the timeline while fighting off dinosaurs.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(617,'Notebook Wars 2','2011-12-31','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','More than 30 different enemies, bosses and a lot of ships, weapons and upgrades to buy; make your custom ship to destroy everything in this piece of paper!\nA lot of new features like world map, different backgrounds and weathers, multipart bosses, etc!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qbh.jpg'),(618,'Queue','2010-02-21','Indie','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co480z.jpg'),(619,'Strawberry Blasted Sky Glide',NULL,'Platform','Web browser','A Flash platformer featuring Crazy Craving, the former mascot for Honeycomb. The game was featured on Postopia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tkh.jpg'),(620,'Life of a Space Force Captain','2022-05-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Live a full life in the future as a human, an alien, or even a robot as you rise through the ranks to become captain of your very own starship.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5iwi.jpg'),(621,'Bratz Babyz','2007-10-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Game Boy Advance','Stir up tons of trouble and go on wild adventures as you help Cloe Sasha, Jade, and Yasmin perform an emergency pet rescue!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hrrvrdig8hjl7ggplze5.jpg'),(622,'Brave: A Warrior\'s Tale','2009-08-04','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Wii, Xbox 360','Set in a fantastic world based upon the mythology of Native America, Brave: A Warrior\'s Tale plays as a series of flashbacks in which a now elderly Brave describes the events of his life. Between the warrior’s tales of his youth, the player takes control of Courage, a young boy who takes lessons from his elder\'s experiences to stop the current threat to their village. The game provides players expansive exploration and in-game interactivity on their quest to defeat the sources of evil, continuously offering a significant challenge to players as they advance through a world of untamed wilderness. Brave is able to transform into various animals, track prey, and battle enemies that stand in his way with bows and arrows, tomahawks and a variety of ancient powers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pu5.jpg'),(623,'Ooohh, Big Stretch!!!','2024-01-27','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ooohh, Big Stretch!!! is a block-pushing puzzle game with a few extra twists!\n\nStart your morning stretch (and never stop) as you collect treats and toys, growing ever longer and spreading through more and more of the house.\n\nWatch out for messes! If you don’t clean up, you’ll spread them everywhere!\n\nSticky-tricky puzzles stand between you and everything you need for your trip to the park.\n\nStretch your way to walkies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qk3.jpg'),(624,'Elana Champion of Lust','2019-05-27','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser','Elana Champion of Lust is a game where you will have to bring back the natural order to an island where the people have lost and forgotten all about lust and passions.\nYou will control Elana, a fairy who has found the energy of lust and passion that was once removed from the people.\nYour goal on this game is level Elana up by means of physical and magical actions, which will make her stronger. In turn she will evolve in order to turn all people of the island into lustful beings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4p16.jpg'),(625,'NES Classics','2005-12-31','Puzzle','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(626,'Forsaken Frontiers','2024-10-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the frozen unknown in Forsaken Frontiers, a cooperative analog horror adventure set in the unforgiving embrace of an everlasting winter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oxv.jpg'),(627,'Demon Demon','2024-02-22','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Silene has been searching for a long time for a certain love from her youth, after certain events she has found him again, but... Can they be together this time?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qab.jpg'),(628,'XI O\'Clock','2024-09-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to XI O\'Clock, a thrilling game where you must explore hallways to find hidden anomalies. Your goal is to reach XI o\'clock (11) by correctly identifying these strange occurrences.\n\nEvery time you spot an anomaly and pull the lever, you move one hour closer to your goal. But be careful—if you miss an anomaly, the clock resets, and you have to start over!\n\nCan you keep your cool and make the right choices? Test your skills in a game where every second matters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qk1.jpg'),(629,'2048 Pool with Dido Angel','2016-12-31','Puzzle, Strategy','Web browser','This crazy game of pool is like no other, play balls against equal values to combine them and move up a level. As each ball multiplies new ones are released, and eventually you\'ll unlock the full striptease!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66du.jpg'),(630,'TU-95',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','TU-95 is a flight simulator in which you control a Soviet TU-95. You control the flaps to carefully maintainaltitude and keep an eye on your speed. If one little part is off, it could spell the end for your flying career, and your pilot!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mtc.jpg'),(631,'About Face','2003-07-08','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ewt.jpg'),(632,'Dimension Warrior','2025-03-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dimension Warrior is an intense soulslike action adventure game in which you traverse various dimensions, facing powerful enemies in your quest to complete your dangerous mission and return to your own world. The core of the gameplay revolves around defeating powerful bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ho3.jpg'),(633,'Enjoy the Diner','2023-01-24','Point-and-click, Adventure, Visual Novel','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Why not enjoy the diner? The moon is as full as it\'ll ever be, and there\'s even a drink fountain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rxi.jpg'),(634,'Smoking Kills','2009-01-01','Shooter','Web browser','Follow an un-named gun-for-hire contracted to target smokers and smoking campaigns in this parody of assassin games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ivd.jpg'),(635,'Sticky Ninja Academy','2011-12-31','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Are you ready to enroll in the Sticky Ninja Academy? Do you think you can complete all of its courses, and have tons of fun becoming the next best ninja in it, graduate with top scores, and become a reputable hidden assassin in Japan? We hope so because that is the attitude you need to win this game and have fun with it, something we invite you to do right now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r9g.jpg'),(636,'My Friend Pedro: Arena','2014-12-23','Shooter, Arcade','Web browser','Use acrobatics, reflexes and a sh*t tone of bullets to gain the highest score in one of the six available levels! This game has all the exciting bits from the original \'My Friend Pedro\', but put in the new context of Arena-mode, a mode which will put your survival instinct to the test! How long will you survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ujy.jpg'),(637,'Treasure Seas Incorporated','2008-02-07','Strategy, Adventure','Web browser','Use your Submarine to Plunder all the Treasures of the Caribbean! Careful, though, Sharks eat Submarines.\n\nDiscover all three Trade Routes! Upgrade your Submarine to reach Deeper Depths! Follow Dolphin\'s advice and avoid the sharks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77vq.jpg'),(638,'Something is Weird','2025-02-10','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You rent a cheap but big house while you\'re on vacation. But something is weird. Really, really weird...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qqw.jpg'),(639,'Game Over Gopher','2014-10-01','Puzzle, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Tactical','Web browser','Hungry space gophers are after the prized carrot. Defend the carrot by placing units on a coordinate grid. Game Over Gopher is Common Core-compliant and addresses topics such as plotting coordinate pairs, differentiating negative coordinates from positive coordinates, and identifying the four quadrants.\n\nA finalist in the 2012 Serious Games Showcase & Challenge and gold winner in the 2013 International Serious Play Awards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kxd.jpg'),(640,'Dirk Valentine and the Fortress of Steam','2008-03-27','Shooter, Platform','Web browser','Use your chain cannon to create platforms in this steampunk world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co834b.jpg'),(641,'Sock and Awe','2008-12-18','Simulator','Web browser','Sock and Awe is a minimal 2008 Flash game created by British entrepreneur Alex Tew, recreating the Bush shoeing incident and putting the player in the shoes of journalist Muntadar al-Zaidi who flinged a shoe at George W. Bush during a news conference.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xtl.jpg'),(642,'Madness: Project Nexus - Classic','2012-03-25','Shooter','Web browser','A Run \'n Gun flash game based on Madness, a Newgrounds web series','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w2e.jpg'),(643,'Territory War 3','2012-12-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Web browser','Online sequel to the popular flash arena frag games, Territory War. Features new maps, new weapons, gameplay modes and new ways to earn XP, and level up. Including a new level editor, for you to create the arena of your dreams - and your friend\'s nightmares.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uco.jpg'),(644,'Warthog Launch','2007-09-25','Puzzle','Web browser, Xbox 360','Warthog Launch was a browser flash game created by Boll, a prominent member in the Halo community. Due to the popularity of the game, it was included as part of the Limited Edition and Legendary Edition of Halo 3 as a bonus minigame.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lmt.jpg'),(645,'Lunar Descent',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','You are in a sublunar capsule deep beneath the Moon surface.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l82.jpg'),(646,'The Last Campfire','2021-10-07','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Last Campfire is an adventure, a story of a lost ember trapped in a puzzling place, searching for meaning and a way home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4g71.jpg'),(647,'GemCraft Chapter One: The Forgotten','2008-06-11','Strategy, Adventure','Web browser','First game in the GemCraft series created by Game in a Bottle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zx4.jpg'),(648,'Dizzy Ball','2016-12-01','Indie','Android','Help Dizzy Ball by assisting it\'s movement through an incredible journey of shapes, colors, and fun.\n\nNever let the kingdom of spiky shapes deceive you, they can change their mood and color at every moment so a little glimpse of an eye could end everything you was fighting for. \n\nCollect keys to unlock a secret magic that can make you survive even longer.\n\nPaint your round hero however you want with the power of the stars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dbuvgsfmuqasqbyggfxn.jpg'),(649,'Vestige of the Past','2019-09-30','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vestige of the Past is a an open world game in which you are exploring an immersive world of alternative presence and trying to survive in an almost familiar but oddly different place. What is behind that contrast between what your eyes are telling you and your gut feeling? Well you will have more pressing matters to worry about at the beginning.\n\nFirst you will need to learn how to survive and make decisions that you might not be proud of. Or perhaps you will take such decisions you won’t need to be secretive about. It’s all up to you. Either way, you will be the one who will have to deal with the consequences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27g1.jpg'),(650,'Memes At War','2025-03-28','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Memes At War is a high quality first-person shooter that brings meme characters to life on the battlefield. Through multiple maps and game-modes you will be able to gain ranks on the leaderboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i4u.jpg'),(651,'Saint Seiya Shining Soldiers','2020-04-23','Sin género','Android, iOS','The quintessential Saint Seiya experience, brought to you with the highest quality in smartphone gaming history!\n\nBecome the most powerful warrior in Saint Seiya Shining Soldiers!\n\n■Heated battles against worldwide users!\n\nSaint Seiya Shining Soldiers uses a 1 on 1 command-based battle system. Dive into deep strategic combat with various characters\' affinities and skills!\n\nDeal massive damage by building up Cosmo and unleashing Seventh Sense Arts, complete with flashy visuals worthy of Saint Seiya!\n\nBattle against users all over the world in the first global PvP Saint Seiya game. Contend for the title of world’s strongest warrior!\n\n■Classic scenes re-imagined!\n\nExperience the Saint Seiya world with \"Cosmo Chronicle Episode\" Mode and take on any chapters you want. Scenario segments feature conversations between characters and famous scenes from the anime!\n\nEnter the soundscape of Saint Seiya with voiced battle lines and famous BGM tracks like “Pegasus Fantasy.”\n\n■Beloved characters brought to life in stunning 3D Models!\n\nSee your favorite characters in high quality 3D models, far superior to existing smartphone graphics!\n\nIn particular, the iconic Saint Seiya Cloths are rendered with dazzling metallic shine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20o3.jpg'),(652,'Unbroken','2025-02-20','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Brave the hostile lands in search of your goal. Forge your own path and discover the many secrets of the realm and the looming Township of Westfall. Unlock new abilities, perks and weapons. Soak in the atmosphere and head forth against all odds.\n\nA mood heavy action-adventure, Unbroken takes players on a grindhouse journey to Crests Edge in search of the traitor Nielsen. With multiple routes to achieve your goal (or even abandon it), the ascent to one of the multiple endings will be a memorable one.\n\nWith a unique lore structure and one of a kind audio visual composition, Unbroken will take players on a trip.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76se.jpg'),(653,'Tetris Gems','2019-03-01','Puzzle','Web browser','Tetris Gems is an all-new Tetris game variant designed to both challenge and entertain puzzle fans. Whether you\'re new to Tetris or a seasoned expert, Tetris Gems rewards players for clearing lines and uncovering Gems. An added element of luck helps level the playing field, making Tetris Gems the perfect puzzler for all Tetris fans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gcj.jpg'),(654,'Are You Kidding Me?',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','A slice of life adventure with a collection of narrative driven micro games all about the inhabitants of Nowhere Space - where all lost and forgotten things end up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co950q.jpg'),(655,'Doom','2019-07-26','Shooter','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Doom Classic is a sci-fi first-person shooter game developed by id Software and Nerve Software and published by Bethesda Softworks. It is an updated version of the original 1993 Doom that uses the Unity engine as a shell for the id Tech 1 engine.\n\nThis game, as well as Doom II Classic, was initially released in a suite of classic Doom ports for PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch, iOS, and Android, however, the ports were initially heavily criticized due to its poor quality and inaccuracies compared to the previous console generation ports while implementing an always-online DRM that required the player to sign into a Bethesda.net account (meant to unlock Slayers Club rewards) to play the game, despite these ports not having any online multiplayer features.\n\nAfter the initial criticism of the ports, Nerve Software eventually rectified the issues of the log-in requirements and problems with the ports through patches. A PC version of Doom Classic was released through Bethesda.net on January 9, 2020, which was later re-released through Steam on September 3, 2020 as a free update to existing owners of The Ultimate Doom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m5h.jpg'),(656,'Mega Man CX','2017-03-04','Shooter, Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Mega Man CX (Rockman CX) is a ROM hack/mod of Mega Man 2 for the Nintendo Entertainment System.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3jhq.jpg'),(657,'Slugterra: Slug it Out 2','2017-01-05','Puzzle, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Android, iOS','Connect to other Slugslingers; Add friends, duel, and send gifts!\n\nBecome the strongest slugslinger around with a powerful army of slugs!\n\nSolve puzzles, level up slugs, and duel your friends in this adventurous slug shooter game, Slugterra: Slug it Out 2! Travel through the different caverns, full of stories, enemies, and prizes, though be aware that some of these caverns are only available for a limited amount of time, so you\'d better hurry and explore them before it\'s too late.\n\nThere is a whole different world underneath the surface, known as Slugterra! Explore this luminous, high-tech world and venture into the nooks and crannies of the 99 Caverns. Along the way, you\'ll find slugs that have special talents that let them transform into powerful and magical beasts! Work with your slugs to defeat any enemies by training, evolving, and maybe even unlocking their fusion power! You may even be able to befriend the legendary ancestors of all the slugs, the Elementals!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co871n.jpg'),(658,'Crank It Up!',NULL,'Music','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cwj.jpg'),(659,'Bloom Defender','2011-11-14','Point-and-click, Strategy, Tactical','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','The Mother Tree, a sacred being capable of producing spiritual energy, is under attack! Defend her by planting and watering trees in this top-down tower-defense game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l1o.jpg'),(660,'Naya\'s Quest','2013-09-26','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','Go to the edge of the world, and see the truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ie9.jpg'),(661,'Pants Quest','2022-03-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Pants Quest is a tiny, lovingly crafted point & click adventure game about finding your way in life. And your pants. Sometimes just getting dressed & leaving the house feels like an impossible task. Follow one man\'s emotional journey to deal with the hurdles that life can throw at you on a bad day.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k95.jpg'),(662,'Corpse Collector','2023-02-20','Sin género','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are Java, one of the few survivors of a zombie outbreak. You go around collecting corpses... but what for...? As you collect the corpses, you\'ll go down memory lane...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qa9.jpg'),(663,'Grow Maze','2013-03-10','Puzzle, Adventure','Web browser','A dungeon crawler puzzle game in the format of EYEZMAZE\'s GROW series.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(664,'Yu Yu Hakusho: Spirit Detective','2003-12-09','Fighting, Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Yu Yu Hakusho tells the story of Yusuke Urameshi, a character who battles evil in both the living and spirit worlds. In Spirit Detective, you\'ll guide Yusuke through various adventures taken from the animated TV series. The game chronicles the first third of the hero\'s 112-episode journey. As any one of six characters, you\'ll battle evil enemies with signature attacks and weapons. Journey through the spirit world, conquer Yusuke\'s enemies, and master each quest to become a true spirit detective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49oq.jpg'),(665,'Petpet Park','2008-10-22','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xoe.jpg'),(666,'Luminary',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Luminary takes the Openworld RPG, and dials it in for a balanced accessible experience, with a procedural twist. Using a unique world level and character proficiency system, explore the vast lands together, uncover hidden treasures, defeat large scale bosses, and rid the world’s darkness with light.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a9d.jpg'),(667,'Headcase','2007-11-14','Platform','Web browser','Walk around surfaces and use your noggin to reach the goal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mvw.jpg'),(668,'Aargh! the Pirate in… Shark Attack Smackdown!','2007-12-31','Arcade','Web browser','Help AARGH the Pirate protect his treasure chests from the Sneaky Sharks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k5p.jpg'),(669,'Amazing Sonic Scene Creator 2','2007-01-21','Point-and-click','Web browser','Game Features- 16-bit, advanced, CD, Chaotix, and next-gen maps. Suggest playing in low quality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z47.jpg'),(670,'Pokémon Red, White, and Blue','2013-10-10','Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Web browser','Once again, PETA makes an Adobe Flash game parodying the iconic Pokemon franchise to boycott big name fast food restaurants.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qwl.jpg'),(671,'Black/Matrix','1998-08-27','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure','Sega Saturn','The original Black/Matrix title was released August 27, 1998 for the Sega Saturn console in Japan. There were two remake releases that add more detailed graphics and additional content: Black/Matrix AD (Advanced) for Sega Dreamcast was released in 1999 and Black/Matrix Cross for Sony Playstation was released in 2000.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zzp.jpg'),(672,'V-Tech Rampage','2007-05-12','Indie','Web browser','V-Tech Rampage is a controversial amateur action video game that recreates the 2007 Virginia Tech shooting on the campus of Virginia Tech in Blacksburg, Virginia, United States.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6t0a.jpg'),(673,'Meet\'N\'Fuck Office Romance','2009-01-29','Visual Novel','Web browser','Name of our today\'s hero is Philllip. He works as an analyst in the large company. All his job is just a boring routine. Everyday sitting at work he dreams about crazy sexual adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8prh.jpg'),(674,'Hyperdimension Neptunia Re;Birth2: Sister\'s Generation - Giant Island',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','The Giant\'s Island DLC brings exactly that - an island inhabited by stronger enemies! A perfect place to relax in the sun and grind!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(675,'Super Chipflake Ü: Quest for the Uncooked Schnitzel',NULL,'Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','In \"Super Chipflake Ü: Quest for the Uncooked Schnitzel\", your stomach is rumbling, and there\'s only one solution – find the ingredients and cook the world-famous schnitzel! But even in Schländ, the schnitzel-loving country, it won\'t be easy!\n\nEmbark on a quirky adventure filled with unexpected encounters, platforming challenges and a fun merging mechanic. Explore a world brimmed with secrets, strange characters, and even stranger problems. Dig, swing, and sprint your way through a lovingly designed environment, where surprises await around every corner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qqi.jpg'),(676,'Versus Umbra','2011-12-21','Shooter, Platform, Indie','Web browser','Fight hordes of enemies. Collect Inventium and loot. Craft crazy weapons, impractical armor and improbable gadgets. Level up your character and pick from a wide selection of perks. Level up your weapons and watch them evolve new stronger and stranger features. Complete challenges and achievements to unlock secret weapons and relics. Save the world from an ancient evil. So you know, the usual stuff.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ppj.jpg'),(677,'Area 86','2020-11-11','Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Area 86 is a smooth physics-based puzzle and exploration game set in space. \nControl your robot in an interactive environment. \nFind, combine, activate, pick up and throw different objects to solve puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20ej.jpg'),(678,'Red and Blue Balls','2009-12-31','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v32.jpg'),(679,'Touhou Spell Bubble: Touhou Eurobeat Pack Vol.2','2022-03-17','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','The Touhou Eurobeat Pack was so popular last time, we\'ve released a Volume 2! Enjoy a collection of Euro remixes that hold their own against Vol. 1!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4z54.jpg'),(680,'Batman','1990-10-12','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','Batman is an Action game, developed and published by SunSoft, which was released in Japan in 1990.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zcg.jpg'),(681,'Chicken Killer','2022-09-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Chicken Killer\" is a horror/comedy game based on the trashy horror movies of the 80\'s. Inspired by the low-budget chinese horror films.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xqx.jpg'),(682,'Dark Sector','2009-03-24','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Dark Sector thrusts players into the role of Hayden Tenno, a covert operative sent on a dangerous mission into Lasria, an Eastern European city on the brink of ruin that hides a deadly Cold War secret. In the midst of this mission, Hayden is attacked by an unknown enemy and infected by the Technocyte Virus, a brutal bio-weapon that twists its victims into mindless killing machines. Surviving this attack, Hayden finds that the Technocyte virus has granted him powerful, inhuman abilities unlike anything he has ever seen. Now, he must evolve with his powers, survive and become a hero.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hw6.jpg'),(683,'Samurai Warriors: Chronicles 2nd','2012-09-13','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Nintendo 3DS','Sengoku Musou Chronicle 2nd (戦国無双 Chronicle 2nd) is the revamp of Samurai Warriors Chronicles. According to the initial news report, it was made to answer the positive fan responses of the original title and is being revised to accommodate their requests. There are currently no plans to localize it in North America.\n\nThe producer says this title is not a completely new title; the main scenario, particular stages, and character movesets remain relatively unchanged. It is targeted towards consumers who may have played or interested fans who have not yet played Samurai Warriors Chronicles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ihu.jpg'),(684,'Mangút','2025-05-01','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Face the struggles of Gil, a tireless app delivery worker running against time to pay the bills. Swing across the platforms with a mechanical arm, dare to make tough decisions, and lead a revolution in Morro do Mangút.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90t3.jpg'),(685,'Leo Steel','2004-01-01','Platform','Web browser','Don\'t stop running! Dodge the obstacles and collect Aztec gold in these four stages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pbw.jpg'),(686,'TankTrouble Classic','2007-12-12','Arcade','Web browser','TankTrouble Classic is the iconic arcade-style tank game, where you drive in a maze and shoot a variety of wall-bouncing projectiles at your enemites.\n\nIn singleplayer mode, TankTrouble Classic pits you against Laika, a fierce cyborg dog that\'s sure to challenge your skills.\nYou can also challenge a friend or two in local multiplayer warfare!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qgg.jpg'),(687,'Carbrix',NULL,'Puzzle, Racing, Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Carbrix is a physics-based open-world vehicle building game\nwhere you the player can make almost any vehicle your heart desires','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co831q.jpg'),(688,'Spyro the Dragon','2019-09-03','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The first game in the Spyro series has been completely remade from the ground up. It stars the title character, a young purple dragon named Spyro, and his dragonfly friend, Sparx, who must journey across the Dragon Kingdom to defeat Gnasty Gnorc, who has overtaken the 5 dragon Homeworlds by trapping the other dragons in crystal and turning their hoard of gems into an army of minions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nt3.jpg'),(689,'Monster Hunter Rise: Extra DLC Pack','2022-11-23','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Enhance your Monster Hunter Rise experience! This is a special pack that contains a selection of popular DLC that has not been made available as a pack before!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(690,'Kirby Super Star','1996-12-01','Platform, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Wii, Wii U, Super Famicom','Kirby Super Star, released as Kirby\'s Fun Pak in PAL regions, is a platforming video game developed by HAL Laboratory and published by Nintendo. The game was advertised as featuring eight games: seven short subsections with the same basic gameplay, and two minigames. Kirby Super Star sees players take on the role of Kirby, who can float around the screen, inhale blocks and enemies and spit them out. By swallowing certain enemies after inhaling them, Kirby can copy their abilities and use them as his own, becoming able to perform a wide range of attacks. A unique feature of the game is the addition of helpers. When Kirby is in possession of an ability, he can choose to transform it into a helper character which can be controlled by a second player or the computer AI.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qyi.jpg'),(691,'Big-Time Butter Baron','2012-05-25','Puzzle, Arcade','Web browser','A.P. Butterworth runs the most successful butter factory in the world, but he can\'t remain the biggest of the Big-Time Butter Barons without the right staff! Clock in at the butter factory and slot together those butter shapes ready for delivery in this creamily-smooth puzzler!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8npa.jpg'),(692,'Brawl','2018-01-12','Fighting, Platform','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','The Open Source Mass Brawl Simulator! \n \nBrawl is a game about intense action with super realistic physics. You have to lead your gang to victory in a crime-infected town. \n \nYou have to improve your fighting skills continuously, learn to block attacks, punch or kick with the correct timing. Watch your health and energy state. You can pick up fainted opponents/friends and use guns. \n \nFEATURES \n \nIntense action \nFluid animation \n6 different scenes \nResponsive controls \nDozens of buddies and enemies \nBrawl is open-source, feel free to learn how to write muti-platform C games here : https://github.com/milgra/brawl','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j1b.jpg'),(693,'Super Street Fighter II: The New Challengers - Tiger Barcodzz','1994-12-31','Fighting','Handheld Electronic LCD','An LCD port of Super Street Fighter II with barcode scanning technology.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gji.jpg'),(694,'The Beggar\'s Ride','2016-05-05','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U','The Beggar\'s Ride is a unique and innovative Platform Puzzle Adventure Game where the player can manipulate the environment to solve puzzles in a deep and intriguing story of discovery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co432f.jpg'),(695,'Marvel Collect! by Topps','2019-04-11','Card & Board Game','Android, iOS','Collect & trade your favorite MARVEL characters with comic book fans around the world in MARVEL Collect! by Topps. Complete daily collector-based missions, trade 24/7, spin the Card Wheel, FUSE lower-tier cards for higher valued inserts, and customize your profile to showcase your collection!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co920j.jpg'),(696,'Valthirian Arc: Hero School Story 2','2023-09-14','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Not all heroes are born, many are forged by the finest Hero School. Take command of the faculty, nurture a unique and ever-growing roster of students, and earn your place among the most prestigious schools in the world of Valthiria.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46kn.jpg'),(697,'Namco Museum Vol. 2','2006-02-23','Arcade','PlayStation Portable','Includes King & Balloon, Bosconian, Xevious, Mappy, The Tower of Druaga, Grobda, Dragon Buster, Dig Dug II, Motos, Rolling Thunder and Dragon Spirit\nTwo new \"arrangement\" games are included, Pac-Man Arrangement Plus and Motos Arrangement','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4iik.jpg'),(698,'Race of Life','2022-09-10','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Race of Life is a college/street racing Adult Visual Novel. Take a peek into the underground racing scene, where suck, squeeze, bang, blow is about more than just your engine cycle. Race and upgrade your car to take control over your future. The more rubber you burn, the more money you earn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67rd.jpg'),(699,'Potion Pleasing','2024-09-01','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','How far are you willing to go to be accepted?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g9c.jpg'),(700,'Lobotomy Corporation','2018-04-09','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Monster Management Rogue-Lite Simulation game inspired by the monsters from game and movies such as SCP Foundation, Cabin in the woods and Warehouse 13. One disaster will cause another, and it will lead everything into chaos. Manage and Survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26qi.jpg'),(701,'Megami Meguri','2016-12-08','Simulator, Adventure, Card & Board Game','Nintendo 3DS','Megami Meguri is a IC Card-compatible free-to-play game developed by Capcom for the 3DS with item-based micro-transactions, It was released exclusively in Japan on December 8, 2016. The service ended on September 30th, 2020.\n\nThe game was designed to work with Japanese train passes. It focused on Tsukomo, a novice goddess. As players go from station to station, they partake in various events to help Tsukomo become a proper goddess.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x2c.jpg'),(702,'Rocket Delivery: Space Wok','2025-03-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A backpack building run-and-gun game! Fill your backpack with guns, blast away space bugs, and deliver noodles to hungry customers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nuj.jpg'),(703,'Camega','2010-12-08','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','The Camega is a handheld device released by H&B. It is a media player, digital camera and handheld video game console, with 15 built-in Sega Mega Drive games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sh2.jpg'),(704,'Elfin National Park','2024-10-01','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Elfin National Park! Once a wild and untamed land of creatures, we have now opened a portion to the public! Come on down and see the ever-changing sights of our forest. We have places for the whole family. Just please remember for the safety of you and your family to stay within the designated zones.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qjz.jpg'),(705,'Hundred Fires: The Rising of Red Star - Episode 3','2023-09-25','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Prepare for the climactic finale as Montenegro returns for one last mission. Use your stealth skills to rescue your beloved daughter, Merche, and unravel the trilogy\'s thrilling conclusion amidst intense action and suspenseful gameplay!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73pi.jpg'),(706,'The Incredible Hulk',NULL,'Sin género','Atari 2600','The Incredible Hulk was supposed to be a video game created by toy and game manufacturer Parker Brothers in 1983 for the Atari 2600.\n\nThe release of The Incredible Hulk was scheduled for Autumn 1983. However, this period coincided with the video game crash of 1983 (following E.T.\'s release in December 1982). During this crisis, numerous companies, including Parker Brothers, opted not to launch games that had already been developed for the Atari 2600. Consequently, The Incredible Hulk was never made available to the public.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98ij.jpg'),(707,'Night Light: Nightmare',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Welcome In the destroyed world of the Night Light: Nightmare, a polluted world has been changed by toxic bombs. Most of the people in the world have been infected by the Virus B1N3 and are mutated to Zombies. And you\'re on your own. Search food and other utensils. build to protect a Basic you in front of the Zombies.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(708,'Hockey Manager 20|20','2020-01-31','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enjoy the state of the art hockey management. Prove yourself as a manager and coach in the day-to-day business of ice hockey and lead your favorite club to fame and fortune.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ls5.jpg'),(709,'BS Zelda no Densetsu: Inishie no Sekiban - Dai-1-wa','1997-03-30','Adventure','Satellaview','The first part (week) of BS Zelda no Densetsu: Inishie no Sekiban.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40r6.jpg'),(710,'Super Munchers','1991-12-31','Puzzle','DOS','Super Munchers is a trivia action game. The player moves their muncher around a grid and eats words that fit a given clue or category. Incorrect words and a variety of critters get in the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8enq.jpg'),(711,'Corrupt Political',NULL,'Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Card & Board Game','Sin plataforma','Your wildest dreams will become reality in this political strategy and simulation game that shall introduce you into world known to a corrupt oligarch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5epq.jpg'),(712,'Gravity Heroes','2021-04-09','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Gravity Heroes gives you the ability to change gravity in a beautiful pixelated world. You can play the game alone challenging yourself to beat the best score, but you can also invite your friends and see who is the master of gravity. Play the game up to 4 players in any game mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hdo.jpg'),(713,'Call of the Sea: Norah\'s Diary Edition','2022-05-19','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Call of the Sea is a first-person adventure puzzle game set in the 1930\'s that tells the story of Norah, a woman on the trail of her missing husband\'s expedition. The search takes place on a strange but beautiful island in the South Pacific, filled with secrets waiting to be unearthed. It’s an otherworldly tale of mystery, adventure, and self-discovery.\n\nThis edition includes:\n- Special premium box\n- Travel ticket\n- 2 photos\n- Poster','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3u8l.jpg'),(714,'Test Drive','2002-12-31','Racing','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Test Drive is a racing game developed by Pitbull Syndicate. In Test Drive, you play as Dennis Black, a street racer who is contacted by a wheelchair-bound man and hired to race in his place in a series of underground street races known as \"test drives\".\n\nThis edition of Test Drive has some improvements over it\'s predecessor, Test Drive 6. This time around there is a story driven mode, called \"The Underground.\" You take the role of Dennis Black, an independent street racer who improves his standing in the underground street racing world with the help of a mysterious benefactor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61zp.jpg'),(715,'Batman: Arkham Origins - Deathstroke Challenge Pack','2013-10-25','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','You fought him. Now become him. Take control of Deathstroke - the world\'s deadliest assassin - when you download the Deathstroke Challenge Pack. Guide him through Arkham Origin\'s challenge maps as well as two brand new ones (No Money Down and 100 to 1) armed with unique gadgets and special moves. In addition to all this, gain access to a special challenge campaign and two bonus skins: Judas Contract Deathstroke and Injustice Deathstroke.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xgeu4xirnoqghuhz1vkk.jpg'),(716,'Nestle Close 3',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(717,'Unusual Farm Operations',NULL,'Puzzle, Simulator','Sin plataforma','You are an alien in a UFO, and you are tasked with abducting farm animals and collecting their samples.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ju8.jpg'),(718,'Shadow Warrior 3: Definitive Edition','2023-02-16','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Take an adrenaline-fueled journey through a mythical Japanese realm in the Definitive Edition of Shadow Warrior 3, packed with new features, and enjoy an ultraviolent blend of fast-paced gunplay, razor-sharp melee combat, and spectacular free-running movement.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67u3.jpg'),(719,'Bulb Out','2017-05-16','Arcade','Android, iOS','Lights On.. 3..2..1.. Lights Off..3..2..1.. Lights on..3.. WATCH OUT!! Whew!.. That was a close one! You almost hit that obstacle! Pay attention to the screen when the lights are on because when they shut off….you are on your own…! Tap the floating stars, balls, and coins to get extra boosts! Earn Achievements along the way! Play in dual screen mode if you dare! Test your reflexes in this casual fast paced arcade game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ubz0ofbvy5lmtxssa1ki.jpg'),(720,'The Lord of the Rings: The Two Towers','2003-07-02','Sin género','Legacy Mobile Device','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gxb.jpg'),(721,'Amneron\'s Legacy','2021-06-12','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Amneron\'s Legacy is a classic style RPG PC game that takes place on a world called Ellis. Heroes must come together to save the realm from darkness while uncovering what happened to the heroes of old.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lfu.jpg'),(722,'Madden NFL 18','2017-08-25','Sport','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Madden NFL 18 takes a significant visual leap with the power of the Frostbite engine. See stunning new stadium exteriors surrounded by vast cityscapes and watch the spectacle of NFL gameday come to life in the most photorealistic game to date. Play each matchup to your specifications by selecting from three new Play Styles or play the best real world match ups each week in Play Now Live! With the introduction of even more ways to play, coupled with your favorite modes, Madden Ultimate Team and Franchise, this is Madden like you’ve never seen before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27yv.jpg'),(723,'// Overdrive','2021-11-30','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','// Overdrive is an addictive arcade fast-paced procedural shooter rogue lite.\nClear each procedurally generated rooms, loot some precious upgrades, fight bosses and defeat the final boss!\nEnter your name in the glorious leaderboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49ev.jpg'),(724,'So Many Me','2015-07-16','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, Ouya, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','You play as an unassuming green blob named Filo, who has an incredible ability: to control his many, many clones -- referred to as the “ME”. These clones possess all sorts of fun abilities that can be used to solve puzzles throughout the game. As you progress further through Filo’s adventure, you will find a variety of new types of clones. Understanding and harnessing their unique powers are key to your success.\n\nFilo’s myriad of adventures take him to a whimsical universe. It features a colorful art genre filled with adorable characters in their world’s mysterious environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27vt.jpg'),(725,'Chuugen no Hasha: Sangoku Shouseiden','2006-02-06','Strategy','PlayStation Portable','Namco has tapped into its library and resurrected two classic Famicom titles for this PSP remake. Taking control of 400 different generals during the Sengoku era, your goal is to unite China as one by expanding your land through negotiations and war.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pdu.jpg'),(726,'Hit the Button',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hit the Button is a platform game in which the main objective is to press all the buttons in each level. It is a game comprised of jumping and platforming, puzzles and brain teasers.\nEach level presents a challenge as it has different design ranging from easy levels where you will have to perform simple jumps and difficult levels with more complex jumps, with puzzles and riddles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tk2.jpg'),(727,'Cadence of Hyrule: Crypt of the NecroDancer Featuring the Legend of Zelda - Character Pack','2020-07-20','Music, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','You\'ll be able to play as five additional characters in this DLC for Cadence of Hyrule: Crypt of the NecroDancer Featuring The Legend of Zelda. Play as Impa, Shadow Link, or Shadow Zelda from the Legend of Zelda series in addition to Frederick (the shopkeeper) and Aria (Cadence\'s grandmother) from Crypt of the NecroDancer. Each character has their own set of abilities - Impa can teleport behind enemies and Frederick comes back to life as a ghost!\n\nTake on All Character Mode\'s 21-floor dungeon and defeat Ganon with each character. Or, challenge yourself in Mystery Mode where all items and enemies are displayed as question marks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mot.jpg'),(728,'Robinson Alchemy','2025-01-09','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Robinson Alchemy is an alchemy game set on a deserted island where the objects you connect are the ones you first need to find and harvest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6umt.jpg'),(729,'The Batman: Gotham City Rescue','2003-01-08','Sin género','V.Smile','Use logic, spelling, geometry, math and spatial skills to rescue the mayor from the Joker, the Penguin, and Mr. Freeze.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/g4802spxuntxizcvlsb3.jpg'),(730,'Urban Explorers','2023-02-06','Shooter','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','An intriguing paranormal investigation roguelite where you must break into murky places in order to unravel the mysteries behind a town that was evacuated after a nuclear accident.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ih7.jpg'),(731,'Batman Beyond: Return of the Joker','2000-11-20','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Game Boy Color','Game Boy Color port of Batman Beyond: Return of the Joker.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6of7.jpg'),(732,'Escape It','2022-08-15','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A man has been trapped in a house. He doesn\'t remember anything, but he knows that he should leave the house as soon as possible. He encounters many unique challenges, which require his brain to work at its best. Will he be able to make it out? Or is he going to stay in the house forever?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5h6d.jpg'),(733,'More than u no','2019-12-08','Visual Novel, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','On an evening like any other in a small-town saloon, Hannah meets Charlotte and feels immediately drawn to her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5eo3.jpg'),(734,'Topatoi: Spinning Through the Worlds','2009-10-15','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 3','Raph, a brave explorer, and his companions have crash-landed in a mysterious corner of a strange planet. Now Raph must hunt for the spare parts needed to fix their skyship - and save his girlfriend too. Fortunately, our hero has access to the amazing GEMMA - the \'Gyroscopic Exploration Multidimensional Multiterrain Apparatus\'. It\'s a small explorer vehicle that works like a spinning top - which is perfect for the crazy part of the world our characters are trapped in. Controlling GEMMA needs some practice. It\'s spin needs to be controlled carefully, as the degree of spin - and therefore its overall speed - directly affects its movement and behaviour. GEMMA can also be upgraded with special abilities to help you on your journey, too. Sounds like a solid platform/puzzler, don\'t you think?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kpl.jpg'),(735,'Frights','2024-10-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Cute Retro-Style Horror Survival Adventure. After a long day at the Riverside Forest, you wandered far from your parents...too far. Now it\'s nighttime and you can\'t seem to find your way back. As you follow the sweet voice of a sheep(?!), you fall inside an old, haunted cavern.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kil.jpg'),(736,'NBA Live 08','2007-10-02','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','NBA Live 08 is the 2007 installment of the NBA Live series by EA Sports. It was released for the Xbox 360, PlayStation 3, Wii, PlayStation 2, Windows and PlayStation Portable. This is the first NBA video game to include all three next-generation consoles. It was the last NBA Live game for the Windows platform.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gnb.jpg'),(737,'Smart Factory Tycoon','2022-03-26','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Smart Factory Tycoon is a factory management and automatization simulator game about running your dream factory with robots. Design your dream factory, plan all steps of production, research new technologies and become a tycoon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qkr.jpg'),(738,'Binaries','2016-04-05','Platform, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Test your reflexes and awareness as you simultaneously guide two lovable balls through 101 brightly coloured challenges in the world\'s first concentration platformer. Control both at exactly the same time using the same set of controls and watch out for hazards. Oh, and there are jokes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26x6.jpg'),(739,'Dust Dasher','2016-06-30','Indie, Arcade','Web browser','A doomed cowboy runs through the desert, pursued by a mystic worm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2duh.jpg'),(740,'Scripted Souls','2022-05-20','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The title granted to those who choose to bravely fight against the corroded ones were known as the scripters. As a scripter solve and use the power of words to control your monsters and defeat your enemy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ksu.jpg'),(741,'Plush','2015-02-13','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Plush combines stuffed animal simulation with the imagination of a little girl to provide a unique puzzle experience. To successfully complete each level, the player must arrange the stuffed animals in such a way as to make them all \"happy\" before bedtime. Each stuffed animal has it\'s own preferences (and physics), so this is easier said than done. Despite the relaxing atmosphere, make no mistake, \'Easy\' difficulty is enjoyable for kids and casual gamers, \'Normal\' and \'Hard\' are a challenge that any puzzle gamer can appreciate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vbg.jpg'),(742,'The Professor Presents: Got Handles?','2017-04-13','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Have what it takes to go head to head with one of the greatest ball handlers of all time? #GotHandles puts you on the court with streetball legend The Professor to see if you can match him move for move. Interact, dribble, and compete to see how many of The Professor\'s moves you can complete.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(743,'Dream League Soccer 2024','2023-11-29','Sport','Android, iOS','Dream League Soccer 2024 puts you in the heart of the action with a fresh look and brand new features! Build your dream team from over 4,000 FIFPro licensed players and take to the field against the world’s best soccer clubs! Rise through 8 divisions whilst enjoying full 3D motion-captured player moves, immersive in-game commentary, team customisations and much more. The beautiful game has never been so good!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co970e.jpg'),(744,'Mists of Aiden','2020-07-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mists of Aiden is a first-person story driven horror game. You play as a thief trapped in an eerie mansion. Each choice can open a new mystery of the house and lead to a unique walkthrough and ending. Uncover final secret of the house. Uncover your own secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x6g.jpg'),(745,'Espgaluda II: Black Label','2010-02-25','Arcade','Xbox 360','Following closely behind Mushihime-sama Futari is another vertical shooter - Espgaluda II Black Label. Beautiful and colorful graphics mixed with popular characters, the sequel to Espgaluda will once again guide you to the exciting and fascinating fantasy world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s8u.jpg'),(746,'Project Arms','2002-03-28','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 2','Project Arms is a Action video game published by Bandai released on March 28, 2002 for the Sony PlayStation 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5paj.jpg'),(747,'Dragon Battle',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Can you defeat the Dragon King?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hj6.jpg'),(748,'Echelon','2001-04-15','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s the year 2351, and you\'re a pilot trying to rise through the ranks all the way to glory. As a member of the Galactic Federation, you\'ll be granted more than 20 weapons to use in each pass-fail mission. Your goal is to defend the planet from attacking alien forces, and you\'ll put your skills into play across more than 30 campaigns. There\'s a huge list of aircraft for you to tame ranging from helicopters and planes to high-tech hovercraft. With 100 vehicles in all, deadly enemies, and 3D graphics, ECHELON is one far out trip through the solar system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22po.jpg'),(749,'Batman: Arkham Asylum',NULL,'Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Wii','A Wii port of Batman: Arkham Asylum developed by Red Fly Studio that was cancelled during early development.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68ne.jpg'),(750,'Monster X Monster','2019-05-17','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a Rogue-like RPG card game. You team up 4 monsters to escape the castle defeating all the heroes. Monsters need freedom!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(751,'Digerati Presents: Make It Quick Bundle Vol. 1','2020-10-08','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','When you don\'t have time to spare, this trio of indie delights is perfect for a rapid round of pick-up and play action. This bundle contains Bleed, Chicken Assassin: Reloaded, and Don\'t Die, Mr Robot! DX. An action-platformer focused on stylish, acrobatic dodging and fluid, challenging gameplay. There\'s no filler – just you and your skills against seven levels of enemies, obstacles, breakneck set-pieces and inventive bosses! Fight your way as Mean Mcallister, the baddest chicken in town, through multiple hordes of enemies to save your girlfriend in this hilarious, strategic button-mashing, action- RPG. A remixed version of the much-loved arcade bullet-hell avoid ‘em up, completely remastered and rejuvenated for Nintendo Switch. Get the fruit. Avoid the enemies. Try not to die. (Spoilers: you will die)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57ed.jpg'),(752,'Simply Hard Platformer',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Permadeath platformer featuring 50 levels of frustrating goodness. Easy to play but hard to master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co414v.jpg'),(753,'Star Drifter','2016-06-01','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Star Drifter is a super hard and hectic space shooter, inspired by classics such as R Type, Xenon, Galaxian, Moon Cresta and Gradius.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jrk.jpg'),(754,'First Dwarf','2024-06-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','If there’s one thing dwarves are better at than grooming their beards, it\'s engineering. Jump into your mech, build a base and explore the crumbled fantasy world in this immersive action RPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p0b.jpg'),(755,'LEGO Dimensions: Tina Goldstein Fun Pack','2016-11-18','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Wii U, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w84.jpg'),(756,'Friagem','2020-12-22','Puzzle','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game that mixes the mechanics of pushing boxes to specific locations with elements of horror and suspense.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r4q.jpg'),(757,'Mega Man Star Force: Leo','2007-11-01','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo DS','Mega Man Star Force introduces a new lead character, a boy named Subaru Hoshikawa, who puts on special \"visualizer\" goggles left to him by his father, triggering a specific wave and summoning the presence of a mysterious alien life form named Warlock. Dangerous creatures from Warlock\'s planet have come to attack Earth, so they must join together to transform into Mega Man in order to defeat these menacing forces. Specific to the Leo version - turning up the heat, Fire Leo uses a special Flame Burner attack that can incinerate enemies in its path.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2049.jpg'),(758,'Final Fantasy V','1998-03-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','A port of Final Fantasy V for PlayStation that adds an opening and ending FMV cutscene as well as some gameplay improvements such as the ability to sprint.\n\nIt is largely similar to the Super Famicom version but due to the CD-ROM format of PlayStation it has longer load times in comparison to the Super Famicom version.\n\nIn Japan it was available as part of Final Fantasy Collection, while in North America and Europe it was available only as part of Final Fantasy Anthology. This is the first international release of Final Fantasy V as the Super Famicom version was only released in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p6u.jpg'),(759,'Board Defenders','2016-09-06','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Board Defenders is super-structuring the rules of the world’s most played game of all times - chess. A modern vision thrilling and fun fast action game, combining the pace of an arcade with the challenge of a logic puzzle - brain game, based on chess rules.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b9p.jpg'),(760,'Batman Forever','1996-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','DOS','The PC version of Batman Forever','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gyl.jpg'),(761,'W.O.L.F','2023-07-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become Wolf, a research staff member, and get to the \"place to return\". This is an action game that can be played easily with only the mouse! Clear about 50 challenging action scenes while repeating failures over and over again!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97vc.jpg'),(762,'Middle-earth: Shadow of Mordor - Legion Edition','2014-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3','ight through Mordor and uncover the truth of the spirit that compels you, discover the origins of the Rings of Power, build your legend and ultimately confront the evil of Sauron in this new chronicle of Middle-earth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zi7.jpg'),(763,'The Batman: Bring on the Batman','2006-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(764,'Batman Begins: Batarang','2005-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(765,'Beach Buggy Racing 2: Tesla Edition','2018-06-18','Racing','Linux','Exclusive to supported Tesla vehicles, Beach Buggy Racing 2: Tesla Edition features a whole new driving experience (while parked, of course!). Tesla owners can play their very own cars in the game, with their actual customization options like paint color and wheel rims. Cars can be controlled using the actual steering wheel and brake pedal, on-screen touch controls, or USB-connected gamepad controllers. You can even play 2-player split-screen with driver and passenger(s).','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(766,'Smasher','2023-10-01','Point-and-click, Music, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to SMASHER. You play as Trinity Tritone, a guitar wielding metal head who has a huge gig at the end of the day and a problem to solve before she gets there- she doesn\'t know how to play guitar. Enter the most unlikely guitar teacher...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gxo.jpg'),(767,'Buff Imposter','2021-09-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The imposter is after you! You are in a scary maze and need to find the milk that will give you the power to fight the buff imposter. The creepy buff impostor can hide behind any door, so be careful.\n\nIn this nightmare horror game we paid special attention to the difficulty levels, also the maze changes with every adventure! Only a few players will manage to beat this difficult horror game!\n\nYou have to be smart and avoid the buff imposter at all times. You will level up overtime, can you surpass the buff impostors strength?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47db.jpg'),(768,'Batman & Robin','1997-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Batman & Robin is an LCD game based on the Batman and Robin movie.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4t79.jpg'),(769,'Galactic Civilizations: Altarian Prophecy','2004-11-12','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Altarian Prophecy is an expansion pack to Galactic Civilization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fenxkhgxurhbohr0uvyr.jpg'),(770,'Hometown Story','2014-05-02','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, iOS','Originally announced as Project Happiness, HomeTown Story is a simulation game from Harvest Moon creator Yasuhiro Wada about a shopkeeper taking over their grandmother\'s shop.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95rd.jpg'),(771,'Saltsea Chronicles','2023-10-12','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','It begins with a kidnapped captain and a stolen ship. Where it leads next? That’s up to you… In this story-driven adventure game you will explore strange and wonderful communities, uncover a deep conspiracy, and chart a journey through twists and turns, difficulties and delights.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lmx.jpg'),(772,'Batman: Arkham Asylum - Crime Alley Challenge Map','2010-05-11','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','Crime Alley is a challenge map in Batman: Arkham Asylum. It is located in the Crime Alley. While all thugs start unarmed, they can still grab the two pipes off the walls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zgx.jpg'),(773,'Battlefield 1: Deluxe Collector\'s Edition','2017-02-06','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the Battlefield 1 Collector’s Edition. This is your chance to own a piece of Battlefield history. Enhance your setup with the 14” statue, which any true fan will be proud to own.\n\nGo behind the scenes to discover more about the game\'s creation through the concept art playing cards, uncover exclusive** DLC content with the messenger pigeon tube and join the fight wearing your very own Battlefield patch. Heck, you can even start recruiting allies with the cloth poster.\n\nThe Battlefield 1 Amazon Exclusive Collector\'s Edition includes:\n\nBattlefield 1 Deluxe Edition Base Game.\nCollector’s Edition Statue (14\" Tall).\nExclusive Steel book.\nExclusive cloth poster.\nDeck of playing cards.\nExclusive patch.\nPremium packaging.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ad2.jpg'),(774,'Grump\'s Dream Course','2016-10-01','Puzzle, Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','In the magical land of Attitude City, Daniel Avidan has stolen all the stars, making the night as dark as Ninja Brian\'s soul! You are Arin Hanson (\'cause Kirby don\'t give a damn about Attitude City), and you must play through over 150 golf courses to stop Danny and save Attitude City!\n\nGrump\'s Dream Course is a ROM hack of Kirby\'s Dream Course for the Super Nintendo, created by a large and dedicated group of fans for the let\'s play comedy channel Game Grumps. It features over 150 custom-made levels, as well as new or redesigned sprites, chiptune versions of songs from the bands of hosts Arin Hanson and Dan Avidan, and a rewritten opening cinematic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z0t.jpg'),(775,'Rango','2011-03-01','Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','The town of Dirt could use some cleaning up — and it\'ll take one tough-scaled reptile to do the job. Rango is the newest sheriff in town, and this pint-sized cowboy has big-time courage under his cap. Patrolling the Wild West atop roadrunners and desert bats, the little lizard is ready for action — and it\'s action he\'ll encounter when aliens threaten abduction, rogue rodents are let loose and other wacky mishaps ensue. Can the sheriff shoot \'em up, brawl the bad guys and save the day?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d0f.jpg'),(776,'Return Survival','2023-08-09','Adventure','Android','Go back six months before the world was destroyed?! Perhaps this is an opportunity? Or a recurring despair? The Great Plague that struck the earth is a zombie apocalypse. For three years, I persevered to survive dozens of deadly situations in a devastated land. In the end, I was cornered and, trapped among the zombies, died. And... when I opened my eyes again... I went back to that month before the zombie virus broke out in the world! In the next six months, this peaceful world will be destroyed. And only I know that the end is near! Is this the chance that was given to me to survive again in a shattered world?! Six months - is it hope or despair?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90h2.jpg'),(777,'Lodestar','2023-08-17','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lodestar sends you and your squad of friends on your own space odyssey. Transverse multiple planets in a journey to get home without losing yourself or your ship to the perils of the unknown! Gather resources, farm asteroids, and survive... with your own oh-so welcoming AI sidekick!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45dp.jpg'),(778,'Crime Boss: Rockay City - Baker\'s Bundle','2024-11-06','Shooter','Xbox One','Become the king of Crime Boss: Rockay City in style with this unique bundle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i3r.jpg'),(779,'Sexy Memory Puzzle: Gay Gloryhole',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(780,'Gangsta Underground: The Poker','2020-05-03','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gangsta Underground : The Poker is a gangsters heads up poker league which takes place in a dark backstreet. Win the game to take all bets from the loser and kill him with a gun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co416w.jpg'),(781,'Battlefield: Bad Company 2 - Onslaught','2010-06-23','Shooter','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Onslaught is a cooperative game-mode featured in Battlefield: Bad Company 2 as downloadable content, putting four players against enemy AI on redesigned variants of Valparaiso, Atacama Desert, Isla Inocentes and Nelson Bay, each having their own dedicated gameplay focus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80rx.jpg'),(782,'Talking Ginger','2012-09-15','Simulator','Android, iOS','Say hello to a world of fun with Talking Ginger, the perfect playtime friend!\n\nGinger loves to play fun games with friends! Brush your friend’s teeth, play with the bubbles and have fun popping them to unlock jigsaw pieces. Your friend needs you to help complete all of his funny jigsaw puzzles.\n\nInteract with Ginger! You can pet, tickle and talk to your funny friend. Turn on your microphone and say hello to Ginger','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9b6c.jpg'),(783,'Unclaimed World','2014-02-03','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','We take the colony sim genre into the near future, onto a lush planet where humans are making their first foothold. Characters and alien wildlife are brought to life through a rigorous simulation and the game plays out as a tug-of-war between humans and nature on a planet full of opportunities and dangers. \nUnderstanding the alien environment is crucial - discovered resources and crafting options enable you to adapt when food gets scarce, equipment breaks and alien animals attack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rec.jpg'),(784,'Barcode Battler II: Batman Returns - Catwoman',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c7v.jpg'),(785,'How to Make a Floating City','2024-10-18','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Manage and defend a \"floating city\" as its acting mayor! Featuring defensive shooting action with simple controls!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rpw.jpg'),(786,'Kaleidoeve','2015-01-22','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable','Otome game for the PlayStation Portable and Vita.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5js4.jpg'),(787,'Multi-Users in Middle-earth','1992-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','MUME, Multi-Users in Middle-earth, is a DikuMUD based upon J.R.R. Tolkien’s Middle-earth that has been continuously running, enhanced, and remastered since fall of 1991. In MUME, players are encouraged to role-play as they live in this meticulously crafted world exploring the conflict leading into the War of the Ring during the late Third Age. The action takes place nearly 100 years prior to The Hobbit but long after the loss of the One Ring by Sauron. The key to Erebor has just been found by Gandalf in Dol Guldur and all the epic tales narrated in The Lord of the Rings may take place.\n\nMUME covers 28,000+ original rooms from the mighty Dwarven Halls beyond the Gulf of the Lhûn in the West to the Mountains of Mirkwood in the East, and from the ruins of Fornost Erain in the North to the fortress of Isengard in the South.\n\nPlayers can choose among several different races, each with some unique characteristics. The races are separated into three striving factions. Dwarves, Elves, Half-Elves, Hobbits and Men — among them are the shapeshifting Beornings — are eternally at war with the Orcs, Trolls and Black Númenóreans. Moreover, the orkish tribe of the Zaugurz is trying to expand its territory at the expense of the Tarkhnarb Orcs of Goblin Gate. Most of this conflict takes place to the east and south of the town of Bree, but rare raids or solitary agents of the Red Eye have made it to as far west as the Dwarven homes in the Blue Mountains.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2f30.jpg'),(788,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Arcade Attack','2009-11-27','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Nintendo DS','This side-scrolling beat-em-up game is a tribute to the coin-op classics that made the Turtles video game legends. The Turtles make their return to clean up the crime-riddled streets of NYC. Shredder stands poised to take over the city - and only you can rally the might of the ninja brothers to put a stop to the threat in the present and the future...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nn9.jpg'),(789,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles','2003-11-21','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Game Boy Advance','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles is a 2003 Game Boy Advance video game, based on the 2003 TV series. In this game each Turtle has his own unique set of levels to complete. In addition to the traditional side-scrolling levels, there are third-person view races, a shell-glider level for Donatello and a bike race between Raphael and Casey Jones. The game was also issued in a double pack with it\'s sequel TMNT 2: Battle Nexus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lgb.jpg'),(790,'Batman Returns','1992-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','An LCD game based on the Batman Returns movie. It was released in 1992.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xji.jpg'),(791,'LEGO Batman Trilogy','2014-11-11','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4es7.jpg'),(792,'Sexy Memory Puzzle: Gay Jail',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(793,'The Forever Winter','2024-09-24','Shooter, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Forever Winter is a co-op tactical survival horror shooter where you and your squad must loot the dead to survive under the shadow of terrifying and gargantuan war machines locked in a never-ending conflict.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7siq.jpg'),(794,'Dungeon of Crawl','2021-07-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Dive into the ancient dungeons, filled with both treasures and dangers. Slash your foes with oversized axes, toast with fireballs hurled from magical wands or turn them into Swiss cheese with a pair of demonic daggers. Dungeon of Crawl is a modern take on classic sub-genre of RPG games - Dungeon Crawlers. Huge replayability is ensured thanks to many player classes, various ways and paths of character progression and equipment setup. Each challenge might require different approach and sometimes jumping straight into battle should be replaced with careful planning your steps. Don\'t let your guard down and get swarmed with monsters as each horde has a powerful leader who guards region\'s treasures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57m8.jpg'),(795,'The Classrooms','2022-10-28','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Classrooms is a procedural, liminal-space, found-footage, survival horror game. Explore The Classrooms and discover the various anomalies it contains; from malicious entities, to harmless oddities. And remember, it\'s different every time you play, so your found footage is uniquely yours.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88es.jpg'),(796,'The Ground Division',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','SteamVR','Are you still there? This will be our final attempt at contact. Uncertainty looms as the threshold nears. I\'m sorry, we cannot save you. Dreams in empty spaces, frozen in the same place, the voices - can you still hear them? DO NOT LEAVE TH -- End of Transmission','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49g2.jpg'),(797,'PalMz\' Insane Warfare Mod','2017-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game is pretty much the same, but sort of amplified with all the possible units implemented, 250 pop-limit and a special method to make bot send bigger forces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mca.jpg'),(798,'Superpopular',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Accumulate likes for no apparent reason whatsoever with the incremental game that is: Superpopular. With this game, EXTREME realism is GUARANTEED as you rake in fake validation for your dumb actions on social media JUST LIKE IN REAL LIFE !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42os.jpg'),(799,'Air Raiders','1982-12-31','Shooter, Simulator','Atari 2600','Air Raiders is an action game released for the Atari 2600 by Mattel in 1982. It received mixed reviews from critics.\nThe player has the view of an airstrip as seen from the cockpit of a jet fighter. In order to start the launch, it is required that the player presses the fire button. When the player pulls back on the joystick, the jet fighter becomes airborne. A feature of the game includes a horizontal tilt that happens when the jet fighter turns to the left or the right for realistic simulation. The goal is to fire at enemy aircraft. The player also has to worry about not making a quick dive after an enemy craft that would lead to a crash landing. There is also a bar that is located on the width of the screen that allows the player to keep track of the horizontal position. It is important to stay out of heavy gunfire zones because it can lead to a nosedive crash. It is possible to pull out of a nosedive, but it would be a better idea for the player to avoid flak.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zblfpsgcf7wrc6aatgpi.jpg'),(800,'Bad Ben','2021-10-19','Simulator, Adventure','Web browser','Experience the first Found Footage Video Game that isn’t about Slender Man (citation needed)! Based on the cult hit micro-micro-micro-budget film series, the Bad Ben game is here to take the beloved franchise digital. Take the role of Tom Riley—voiced by the man himself, Nigel Bach—as he once again makes the incredibly informed decision to buy a house sight unseen at a sheriff’s auction.\n\nObviously, the night does not go by un-ghosted. Soon after his arrival, paranormal happenings begin to plague the unflappable Tom. You’ll have to get to the bottom of these spectral shenanigans, mostly by finding keys. Because it’s an indie horror game.\n\nDo you have what it takes to survive the night?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co493y.jpg'),(801,'Star Dust: The Book of Earth (VR)','2017-05-11','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Star Dust: The Book of Earth is a VR sci-fi shooting game developed by Beijing Skylens Technology Co., Ltd. using Unreal Engine4, featuring amazing cinematic visual effects. In the game, you will explore awe-inspiring, mysterious galaxies, experience the spectacular scenes of Earth’s destruction, and engage in warfare on a scale never seen before – and all from an immersive first-person perspective. Take control of huge mechs with your own hands and immerse yourself in fierce space battles. The splendor of magnificent galaxies, giant spaceships, and diverse weapons combine to create a real and thrilling VR experience you’ll never forget. In the game, players use VR handles to control a giant mech in battle.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(802,'Crowalt: Traces of the Lost Colony','2022-01-06','Point-and-click, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A young adventurer Hugh Radcliff is in pursuit of one of the greatest mysteries of history: The Lost Colony. Deal with pirates, dive into native rituals, reveal conspiracies, and make tough choices on your difficult journey for unveiling this mystery!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j0z.jpg'),(803,'Hope Despair Chaos','2021-11-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Multiplayer realtime casual assasinating and investigating game. Talents and factions combination. Hope Despair Chaos all in one package.\n\nA game about Hope Cultivation programs and includes some of the Despair elements to stimulate the best outcome possiple. Join the program and may the fortune of luck let you be one among us, Symbols of Hope. Those remain evil will be chosen as Symbol of Despair, atempting to eliminate everything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co409d.jpg'),(804,'Sarah and the Lonely Key','2019-08-04','Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A short, Sokoban-style puzzle game with many doors, but only one key.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dkk.jpg'),(805,'Dark Sales','2020-05-29','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dark Sales is a 2D action RPG that takes place in a modern office setting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5czm.jpg'),(806,'Top Speed: Drag & Fast Racing','2020-03-17','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Nintendo Switch','Beat criminal overlords and become the biggest fish in the city. Head out and race as fast as you can. Choose any car you want from an astounding selection of 69 cars - you can drive classic stock rides, new heavily modded dragsters, and even national police vehicles from 5 different countries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t7d.jpg'),(807,'Dreamland','2017-08-09','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dreamland is a platformer game based on a young girls dreams it was made using pixel art and is the first of many games to come.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/r1mikac4patj6uyn41kf.jpg'),(808,'Motorsport Manager','2014-08-15','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Strategy','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Have you got what it takes to become the manager of a high-performance motorsport team? Motorsport Manager is a highly detailed, best-in-class management game for fans of motorsport. You’ll hire the drivers, build the cars and embed yourself in the dynamic world of racing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kgg.jpg'),(809,'Polar Games 2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','From the tropics to the poles, Polar Golfer Pineapple Cup and Polar Pool promise hilarious good times in the latest installment of Polar Games. Reunite with your Polar Games friends to stroll and shoot down tropical fairways in Polar Golfer Pineapple Cup. Ocean hazards, erupting volcanoes, and brand new comical characters make Pineapple Cup a hole in one! Swing away with one paw and improve your score with power rings that keep you sailing over scorching lava rock! Grab your favorite Hawaiian shirt and head for the green in Pineapple Cup. Take off your lei and travel down to the arctic in Polar Pool, a billiards game played only the way an inner-tubing polar bear can play! Send your bear sliding across the icy billiards table to slam balls into pockets in 8-ball, 9-ball and Power Pool! Play in single or multiplayer mode to unlock new characters and pool tables during play. Chalk up your cue and prepare for Polar Pool. Billiards like you\'ve never seen them played!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q2q.jpg'),(810,'The Batman: Batarang Battle','2005-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(811,'Fantastic Petty','2025-04-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An adorable, fantastic, poppy, and slightly bizarre 2D side-scrolling shooter game! Conquer all 5 stages in order to bring back spring to the island of Esideci!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pi1.jpg'),(812,'Cotton: Fantastic Night Dreams','1991-03-01','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade, Sharp X68000, Neo Geo Pocket, PlayStation 3, Neo Geo Pocket Color, PC (Microsoft Windows), TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','Cotton: Fantastic Night Dreams is a scrolling shooter arcade game, released on Sega\'s Sega System 16B Arcade system board in 1989. It is the first in the Cotton series of videogames.\n\nIt was ported to both the Sharp X68000 and the NEC TurboGrafx-CD in 1993. The TurboGrafx-CD version was released on Super CD-ROM and features an enhanced redbook audio soundtrack and voice acting on the Japanese release. The game was later ported to Sony PlayStation under the title Cotton Original in 1999. The PlayStation release combines the enhanced digital CD-ROM soundtrack of TurboGrafx-CD release and the gameplay/graphics of the original Arcade version. A version was ported to the Neo Geo Pocket Color in 2000. Due to hardware limitations the Neo Geo Pocket Color features less detailed graphics and sound compared to previous versions, however it is still a faithful version of the original in terms of gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52xf.jpg'),(813,'Pro Evolution Soccer 2018 Lite','2017-11-16','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','In Pro Evolution Soccer 2018 Lite, you can enjoy myClub mode, Pes League mode, Exhibition Match mode and Training mode in their basic version for free.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yvh.jpg'),(814,'Spheroid','2018-05-16','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hello, and welcome to Spheroid!​\nSpheroid is a game that you may have played before, but may not have seen before. Unlike most other games in the \'Marble Madness\'-like genre, Spheroid aims to be story-driven and more visually varied. You wont see levels that are made from plain colored geometry with stuff occasionally in the far distance, but rather, you can expect to see worlds with varying themes which play a major part in the level itself.​\neach level has an \"Activator Field\" game-play mechanic associated with it\'s theme, making for a unique- but never overly difficult- challenge.​\nThere are also no time limits or lives in spheroid, which shifts the focus from getting though the environment as fast as possible to strategically planning how to get through.\n\n\"What is a spheroid? Usually, a Spheroid is the term used to describe sphere-like, but not entirely spherical, objects. Here on the island, we use a somewhat different definition. Within our premises, a Spheroid is an advanced artificial intelligence contained within a spherical shell capable of traversing any situation a spherical object could possibly be in- our goal on the island is to continually improve the A.I, in hopes that one day, we will create the first perfect intelligence in the world.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ykb.jpg'),(815,'Iragon','2024-02-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Iragon is both a VR and non-VR story-driven action game, set in a fantasy medieval world filled with magic, elves, and wizards. The non-VR mode allows the player to experience it from a 3rd person’s perspective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ouj.jpg'),(816,'Holy Potatoes! A Spy Story?!','2018-11-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Holy Potatoes! A Spy Story?! is a wacky spy agency sim where you manage your very own potato spy headquarters, train an elite spy team, and strategise top-secret missions while uncovering the truth behind an evil spy corporation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hbf.jpg'),(817,'CubeLoop','2022-07-29','Puzzle, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','CubeLoop is a first-person puzzle game that you can play solo or cooperatively online. Will you be able to figure out what riddle is hidden behind each room? Or will you die and die in an endless loop? Only logic can save you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4trj.jpg'),(818,'Teredor',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Indie open-world MMORPG. Experience a world full of unsolved mysteries in a lovingly designed, handpainted setting. And the best thing about it: You have the chance to actively influence the whole game. You can add Quests, Items, Names and more! You are the Game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pkr.jpg'),(819,'Plot\'s!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(820,'Fighting Illusion: K-1 Grand Prix \'98',NULL,'Fighting, Sport','Sin plataforma','Fighting Illusion: K-1 Grand Prix \'98 is a kickboxing combat game for PlayStation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/a3dn3hl2h2g5hjctwhw1.jpg'),(821,'Batman: Wings of Steel',NULL,'Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xiy.jpg'),(822,'Jurassic World Evolution: Jurassic Park Edition','2019-12-16','Sin género','Xbox One','Place yourself at the heart of the Jurassic franchise and build your own Jurassic World. Bioengineer dinosaurs that think and face threats posed by espionage, breakouts and devastating tropical storms in an uncertain world where life always finds a way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3r3g.jpg'),(823,'Life is Strange: Before the Storm Remastered','2022-02-01','Adventure','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Life is Strange: Before the Storm returns with remastered visuals across characters & environments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vfx.jpg'),(824,'Escape from the Nuke','2021-05-18','Racing, Adventure','Android','Can you survive the Atomic bomb by traveling through parallel universes through portals as the world is destroyed by nuclear bombs? There are only seconds before the nuclear bombs explode. Can you find the portal doors before the bombs explode in maps and unmarked parallel universes? Since all vehicles have different strategic features, you should choose the vehicle you will use very well. In addition, enemy cars will try to prevent you from passing through the portals by causing you to crash. Also, since portals often change places, you should make a good escape plan every time you start the game. Also, realistic car damage and accident physics have been added to the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ct9.jpg'),(825,'Ballblazer','1988-12-31','Racing, Sport','Atari 7800, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari 5200, Apple II, Amstrad CPC, MSX','Ballblazer is a 1984 computer game created by Lucasfilm Games (later LucasArts Entertainment). It was originally released for the Atari 8-bit systems, such as the Atari 800 and the Atari 5200. It was also ported to other popular platforms of the day, such as the Apple II, ZX Spectrum (by Dalali Software Ltd), Amstrad CPC, Commodore 64, Atari 7800, and the NES. The Atari 800 version was called Ballblaster during development - pirated versions of the game went by this name as well. The principal creator and programmer of Ballblazer was David Levine.\n\nIn 1990, LucasArts and Rainbow Arts released a remake and follow-up to this game, called Masterblazer. This game was released for the Amiga, Atari ST, and PC DOS. A similar game inspired by Ballblazer called Space Football: One on One was developed and released by Triffix for the Super NES in 1992. Years later on March 31, 1997, a remake of the original titled Ballblazer Champions was released for the Sony PlayStation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zd5.jpg'),(826,'Wriggle 3D',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(827,'Puzzle Galaxy: Cuteness Overload','2022-07-22','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Discover more underwater fauna, playful dogs and charmy fairy tales princesses Puzzle Galaxy: Cuteness Overload adds 22 new jigsaw puzzles with ocean animals, dogs and princesses.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(828,'Hogwarts Legacy: Collector\'s Edition','2023-02-10','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This collector\'s edition comes with a floating wand and book case and the game in a steel case and collector\'s box.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63nn.jpg'),(829,'Iron Soldier','1994-12-31','Shooter, Simulator','Atari Jaguar','The player controls a robot spanning 42 feet or 13 metres in a series of 16 missions consisting of destroying certain enemies and buildings. Some missions require the player to obtain new weapons from an enemy base or destroy other robots.\n\nThe player has a wide variety of weapons like rocket launchers, a chainsaw, gatling gun, shield, and self-controlled rockets, which can be equipped on any part of the robot.\n\nThe gaming media reported that Iron Soldier would support two-player gaming via the Jaguar\'s dial-up internet link;[1] however, the Jaguar internet link was never completed or released, so Iron Soldier was released as a single-player game only.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rzp.jpg'),(830,'Birds Organized Neatly','2024-09-24','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this 2D puzzle game, you have the responsibility to arrange your avian friends in a way that fits the grid. Birds Organized Neatly comes with 80 different handcrafted levels and a whole bunch of birds in all shapes and sizes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ur2.jpg'),(831,'Room of Depression','2023-05-04','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"Same encounter, different world.\" Moon is a young woman who lives an ordinary city life as an office worker. However, because she suffers from depression, she reacts and deals with things in a way that is very different from regular city folk.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66dr.jpg'),(832,'Heather Wreath: The Reporter','2025-01-02','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game acts as the prologue to Heather Wreath: Shoban. In the shadow of a rundown estate, tormented by demented visions you must solve puzzles, fight dreadful monsters, and escape the masked man haunting every step. Inside a retro fixed camera narrative horror.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9onl.jpg'),(833,'Criminal Expert','2023-12-15','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','As a police investigator, you take on the task of explaining this mysterious event. Who is this person and what was she doing there? Will the circumstances of this case be easy to explain or is there something deeper going on in the story?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co613u.jpg'),(834,'Fridge Escape','2024-06-07','Platform','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Don\'t let anyone eat you. Run to save your life!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8aol.jpg'),(835,'12 Labours of Hercules VI: Race for Olympus','2016-12-21','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','This time, Hercules and Megara are involved in the detective story. Alarm at Olympus is showing the absence of Zeus, who rarely left the peak. A few clues reveal the fact that Zeus has been abducted. Hercules and Megara begin the investigation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tky.jpg'),(836,'Goodnight Meowmie','2019-06-04','Sin género','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A narrative game combining elements of both the virtual pet and horror genres.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kb0.jpg'),(837,'Cotton Guardian Force Saturn Tribute','2021-09-30','Shooter','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Shoot \'em up collection here we go!\n\nCotton Guardian Force Saturn Tribute is a collection of three Cotton games that were released back in the \'90s for Sega Saturn. Players all around the globe can experience and enjoy this collection because of its English language support!\n\nAre you ready to meet all your enemies and take them down into pieces in this shoot \'em up collection?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gny.jpg'),(838,'Sexy Memory Puzzle: Gay Gym',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(839,'Battlefield 1: Deluxe Edition Upgrade','2016-10-21','Shooter','PlayStation 4','Upgrade to Battlefield 1 Deluxe Edition and unlock the following additional content:\n\nRed Baron Pack\n• Vehicle Package: Red Baron’s Triplane\n• Sidearm: Red Baron’s P08\n• Emblem: Red Baron’s Flyer Pin\n\nLawrence of Arabia Pack\n• Horse: Lawrence of Arabia’s Black Stallion (new visual appearance for the horse)\n• Weapon: Lawrence of Arabia’s SMLE\n• Melee: Lawrence of Arabia’s Jambiya\n• Emblem: Lawrence of Arabia’s Emblem\n\nHellfighter Pack\n• Weapon: Hellfighter Trench Shotgun\n• Sidearm: Hellfighter M1911\n• Melee: Hellfighter Bolo Knife\n• Emblem: Hellfighter Insignia\n\nNew visual appearance of the Behemoths\n• Frontline Camouflage Train\n• Night Raid Airship\n• Dazzle Camouflage Dreadnought\n\n• Five Battlefield 1 Battlepacks containing stand-out weapon skins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3acy.jpg'),(840,'Where Winds Meet','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Where Winds Meet is an open world RPG set in the Ten Kingdoms period of medieval China. You take on the role of a swordsman who has grown up during war and conflict. Gameplay includes a mix of sword fighting, martial arts, and magic combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rxp.jpg'),(841,'Stay Alive, My Son','2024-05-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','Winner of the Producer\'s Guild Innovation Award and based on the novel by Yathay Pin, Stay Alive My Son is a virtual reality feature based on a true story of a Cambodian genocide survivor and father haunted by his past, to first-handedly experience an inspirational journey about family separation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7z6i.jpg'),(842,'Batman: Arkham Knight - 2008 Tumbler Batmobile Pack','2015-10-28','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This addon includes the Tumbler Batmobile and two themed racetracks inspired by the 2008 movie \'The Dark Knight’.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fxe.jpg'),(843,'Hide and Run','2021-05-28','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Hide and Run players are divided into two teams. Props are trying to hide long as possible with hunters trying to find them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42g0.jpg'),(844,'The Informant Chronicles: Chronicle 1 - Riverside Danger Part 1','2020-08-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Informant Red is assigned to a ten year old settlement on a river that is fearful in light of a massacre that left over half the village dead on a forest expedition. As she spends more time getting to know the locals, she discovers clues that suggest this incident was no accident.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5n50.jpg'),(845,'Star Wars: The Force Unleashed II - Collector\'s Edition','2010-11-26','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox 360','In Star Wars The Force Unleashed, the world was introduced to Darth Vader’s now fugitive apprentice, Starkiller...the unlikely hero who would ignite the flames of rebellion in a galaxy so desperately in need of a champion. In the sequel, Starkiller returns with over-the-top Force powers and embarks on a journey to discover his own identity and to reunite with his one true love, Juno Eclipse. Starkiller is once again the pawn of Darth Vader, but instead of training his protégé as a ruthless assassin, the dark lord is attempting to clone his former apprentice in an attempt to create the Ultimate Sith warrior. The chase is on. Starkiller is in pursuit of Juno and Darth Vader is hunting for Starkiller.\n\nThe collector\'s edition includes:\n- Premium collectible steelbook\n- Exclusive in-game content\n- Three exclusive challenge mode levels\n- Exclusive Ralph McQuarrie concept \"Deak Starkiller\" skin\n- Exclusive lightsaber crystal\n- Exclusive Mimobot USB designer drive preloaded with bonus content\n- Starkiller 2GB flash drive designed by Mimobot\n- Digital art book, featuring insights into the art of The Force Unleashed II','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yge.jpg'),(846,'Overthrown','2024-12-05','Platform, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Lift and throw anything as you build and manage your kingdom in this chaotic city builder for 1-6 players. Harness the power of your soul-stealing crown to defend your citizens from bandits and mutants, farm the land, and gather resources. Keep citizens happy or see them desert you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tco.jpg'),(847,'Transarctica','1993-12-31','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','The story is based on a post-apocalyptic science fiction saga La Compagnie des Glaces (The Ice Company) written by Georges-Jean Arnaud and the comic strip Le Transperceneige (The Snowpiercer) by Jacques Lob. \n \nIn the 21st century, mankind is being ravaged by the greenhouse effect. A last-ditch effort to counteract it is designed and executed. It works far too well. \n \nCenturies if not millennia later, the planet is entirely covered in a thick, opaque cloud layer. Giant wolf packs roam the frozen wastes, and the mammoth has re-emerged from the elephant stock. Mankind ekes out a living in a few handfuls of settlements, connected by a network of massive armored trains. The network in turn is in the hands of the gargantuan Viking Union, which is merciless towards threats to its power. A few radicals, though, are willing to attempt a change, and managing to hijack a train of the Union, the Transarctica, they set out in search of the \"sun\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29m7.jpg'),(848,'NHL 2K2','2002-02-14','Sport','Dreamcast','NHL 2K is a series of hockey games by 2K Sports for the Dreamcast, PlayStation 2, Nintendo GameCube, Xbox, iPhone, Xbox 360, PlayStation 3, and the Wii. Initially discontinued after the release of NHL 2K11 in 2010, the brand was revived on mobile devices in 2014. The games are officially licensed from the National Hockey League and NHL Players Association. While its games were released on consoles, its main competition was EA Sports\' NHL video games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co417s.jpg'),(849,'F1 2013','2014-03-06','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','The game features all eleven teams and twenty-two drivers competing in the 2013 season, as well as the nineteen circuits and Grands Prix. A \"Classic Edition\" of the game features additional drivers, cars and circuits from the 1980s and 1990s, including the Williams FW07B, FW12, FW14B, FW18, Ferrari F399, F1/87/88C, Lotus 98T, and 100T. Additional circuits include Estoril, Imola, Brands Hatch and Jerez.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hqs.jpg'),(850,'Gunpyre','2025-01-09','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hold your Gunpyres akimbo in this fast-paced twin-stick shooter, set in the Crypt Alchemist’s semi-procedural dungeon. Remember, Vampyres are your guns and blood types are your bullets, so be assured to brutally steal them from your enemies in order to collect upgrades and take down your target.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9on9.jpg'),(851,'Planet Zoo: Arctic Pack','2019-12-17','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join Bernie Goodwin on an epic Arctic adventure and explore new challenges, animals, and more! Alongside two new Scenarios in which you face new challenges as a zoo manager, there are four new animals and over 200 scenery pieces to make your parks as cool as ice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69vj.jpg'),(852,'Gooba Ball','2024-05-28','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A physics-based puzzle game where you combine colorful balls to achieve the ultimate form -- Goober! Combine two of a kind until, like I said, Goober… What more to do you freakin’ want?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co873d.jpg'),(853,'Saints Row 2: Corporate Warfare','2009-05-28','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','There is a civil war brewing within the Ultor Corporation. Dex, Ultor\'s newly appointed Head of Security, is running a black market nuclear weapons operation aided by Ultor management. Meanwhile, a defected Ultor executive offers the Saints a chance to bring the entire operation down.\nTake revenge in style with new transportation options for aircraft, exotic cars, and superbikes.\nRedefine your character with all new customization options including brand new outfits and facial bandanas to change your identity.\nTake the battle to the streets with brand new Strong Arm and Gangsta Brawl multiplayer maps or challenge your friends in an all new Co-op competitive mode.\nNow it\'s time to put a permanent end to Ultor\'s corruption.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bvd.jpg'),(854,'Command & Conquer: Red Alert','2008-03-27','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Travel to an alternate universe where dark experiments have permanently altered time. Or have they? Soviet tanks crush city after city while Allied cruisers shell bases. Spies lurk, landmines await, and strange new technologies aid both sides in the struggle for ultimate control. In this parallel reality, the mighty Soviet Empire has begun to “liberate” all of Europe. Cities fall and countries collapse before the overwhelming might of the Red Storm. The Allies are scrambling to meet the onslaught, but they have been caught by surprise. Red Alert puts the fate of the world in your hands!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nx0.jpg'),(855,'Kazarma','2019-09-10','Shooter, Indie','Android, iOS','The ancient bridge of Kazarma which connects the human colonies of the Galaxy, has been invaded by aliens. Traverse the bridge to drive away the invaders in this level based challenging mission.\n\nFly through exotic worlds, fighting alien lifeforms and machines. Unlock an array of space ships and upgrade them to reach your maximum fighting potential.\n\nFeatures:\n- Simple controls. Drag to move & shoot\n- Upgrades & Powers\n- Unlock new ships\n- Variety of worlds and colorful environments\n- Challenging gameplay. Easy to learn\n- hard to master!\n- 3d person perspective camera\n- Unique soundtrack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nt9.jpg'),(856,'Shiki Oni no Koku: Chuugoku-hen - Daiisshou','1992-07-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC-9800 Series','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co689w.jpg'),(857,'Ember Sword',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ember Sword, a modern rewrite of the games industry business model in favor of the user, and a love letter to MMORPG (Massively Online Role Playing Game) gamers.\n\nEmber Sword has the fast-paced combat of aRPGs, combined with the isometric view and skill-based abilities of MOBAs, set in a persistent MMORPG fantasy universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lyc.jpg'),(858,'Viking Heroes 5','2024-01-19','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a festive journey as the vikings prepare for Yule! Amidst enchanting festivities, the Viking siblings discover Odin has lost control over the threads of fate, prompting a mysterious journey throughout the famous realms of the nine worlds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qvb.jpg'),(859,'Shazabi and the Cantina Catacombs','2023-01-02','Fighting, Puzzle, Indie','Web browser','Enter the catacombs of the Cantina of Eight (that\'s the name of the community) and search for the Achtefakt!\nWhile you\'re at it save the Cantina residents who have been kidnapped by the zoo (which doesn\'t actually exist).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z7a.jpg'),(860,'Ashes of the Singularity: Escalation - Gauntlet',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','The war for control continues in Gauntlet! Featuring a new single-player scenario and some new maps for multiplayer, Gauntlet will have you beating your foes into submission in one exciting battle after the next.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(861,'Sexy Memory Puzzle: Futanari Sauna',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(862,'Saints Row 2: Ultor Exposed','2008-04-23','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Disgruntled Ultor microbiologist Tera Patrick holds the key to the corporation\'s illicit research activities and revenue generating schemes. Help Tera dismantle the Ultor Corporation by exposing the megacorp\'s seedy operations to the citizens of Stilwater.\nBattle through three all new co-op enabled missions.\nCommandeer new air and ground vehicles including attack aircraft and luxury sports cars.\nCustomize your character with new hairstyles, law enforcement uniforms, and all new clothes.\nOwn the streets in new Strong Arm and Gangsta Brawl multiplayer maps.\nThese are your Saints and this is your city like you\'ve never seen it before...fully exposed!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bvc.jpg'),(863,'Cloudbuilt','2014-03-20','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game of speed, precision and freedom, use all the abilities of your rocket-powered suit to avoid fatal hazards, dodge hostile robots and reach not just the finish line, but the top of the worldwide leaderboards. Carve your own path through a multitude of mysterious floating ruins high above the clouds and show everyone you\'re the best!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2565.jpg'),(864,'The French Open 1998',NULL,'Sport','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(865,'Fuz','2019-05-12','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This is a tiny adventure based directly on Fez, by Polytron Corporation. It is a fan work, and was not made in collaboration with or endorsed by them.\n\nFuz features a total of 8 distinct areas. Its visuals, mechanics, and puzzles are all based off those in the original.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pcv.jpg'),(866,'MultiVersus: Season 5','2025-02-04','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Season 5 marks the final update of MultiVersus before shutting down on May 30th, 2025. This season will include a free battlepass where you can unlock Aquaman, as well as a daily log-in that unlocks Lola Bunny.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fjs.jpg'),(867,'Fortnite: Chapter 3','2021-12-05','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The island from Chapter 2 has been turned upside down... literally. Step onto the new island and explore every corner of an undiscovered world in Fortnite Chapter 3 Season 1: Flipped.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4olj.jpg'),(868,'Microsoft Flight Simulator X: Steam Edition - Toposim Japan, Korea & Taiwan','2017-12-06','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Toposim Japan, Korea & Taiwan for FSX: Steam Edition provides LOD 11/19m Multi-LOD terrain mesh, improving the accuracy of the default terrain mesh and offering a marked improvement to the landscape profile.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85t7.jpg'),(869,'Pixel Blocked!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(870,'Vroom Data Disk','1992-12-31','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Atari ST/STE, Amiga','This data disc for Vroom adds 6 new Grand Prix circuits (Montreal, Monza, Hockenheimring, Estoril, São Paulo and Autódromo Hermanos Rodríguez).\n\nThis data disk requires original Vroom game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dfw.jpg'),(871,'Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine - Anniversary Edition','2021-09-23','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Released as a free update on the base game, this Anniversary Edition includes:\n\n• All DLC\n• The full soundtrack for the game\n• Classic and brand new wallpapers\n• The original manual (pdf)\n• The Official Strategy Guide (pdf)\n• Ringtone\n• The Collector\'s Edition Artbook (pdf)\n• Collectors cards (pdfs)\n• The original launch trailer','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b5y.jpg'),(872,'Snekman','2020-04-08','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Pacman and Snake! Two Arcade Classics Mashed together!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p34.jpg'),(873,'Hakai','2022-08-20','Fighting, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hakai is a momentum based aerial fighting game that takes cues from Dragonball Z.\nWin three rounds to beat your opponent. If the timer runs out, whoever has the lower amount of health wins, and if the players\' health are equal it\'s a draw.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r2b.jpg'),(874,'LightBike','2009-01-19','Racing, Sport, Arcade','iOS','LightBike is a 3D game application for iPhone. You drive the LightBike, which builds walls of light on your track, and beat enemies in cyberspace. Being easy and simple, LightBike excites you all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j3c.jpg'),(875,'Final Judgment - Damnation Day',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(876,'Fürst Marigor und die Tobis','2003-12-31','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A point-and-click adventure for children.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nxx.jpg'),(877,'Football Manager 2008','2007-10-18','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','Football Manager 2008 is the principal title of the 2008 edition of the Football Manager series of football management simulation games by Sports Interactive. The version for the United States and Canada is entitled Worldwide Soccer Manager 2008, while the South American version is Fútbol Manager 2008. There are over 5,000 playable teams from more than 50 countries. The demo for Football Manager 2008 was released on 30 September 2007.\n\nThe game was originally intended to be released on 19 October 2007, but due to early shipments by many retailers carrying their game, Sports Interactive moved the release date to 18 October 2007.\n\nSeveral problems surfaced in the game, most of which had been reported to SI Games via their issues forum, and as a result, a \"Beta Patch\" was released. This patch did not fix all problems but was released early to fix major issues. A full patch was set to be released on 9 November 2007 but was delayed, and was finally released on 22 November 2007. The second and final patch was released on 14 February 2008 and updated on 20 February to attempt to fix three major issues that remained in the game. As with previous games, the patch updates the game\'s database with all the latest transfers and fixes many of the game\'s remaining bugs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k75.jpg'),(878,'Pitfall: The Big Adventure','2008-09-23','Sin género','Wii','Set in the Peruvian jungle, Pitfall: The Big Adventure combines the action of reptile dodging and vine swinging with clever puzzles. The game will feature over 60 levels spanning lush rainforests, creature-filled caves, and glacial mountains. Within these dynamic worlds, players will explore cavernous jungles, discover lost treasures, battle shamen, narrowly escape treacherous traps and outwit creatures using innovative, accessible game mechanics developed specifically to take advantage of the Wii motion sensing controls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lwnblyhdwq76pdqlyhtg.jpg'),(879,'Die-abolical','2022-07-17','Puzzle, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Web browser','Move the dice to destroy all other dice in every level if your value is higher.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8edz.jpg'),(880,'Our Lady of the Drowned Lake, Zero Reporter','2022-07-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An amateur reporter encounters strange occurrences while trying to film a night fishing trip.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79m5.jpg'),(881,'Baby Panda\'s Hair Salon',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(882,'PixelOrb',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','A free and open source puzzle game made with godot engine','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(883,'PiratesBattle',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Pirate Ships Battle-royale game!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(884,'Fallen Knight','2021-06-23','Fighting, Platform, Strategy','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Take the role of an elite knight and battle your way through action-packed levels with intense sword fighting gameplay in this neo-classic side-scrolling action platformer. Save the city from a deadly terrorist organization hell-bent on exposing the truth you were sworn to protect.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30i0.jpg'),(885,'Pantheon: Rise of the Fallen','2024-12-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pantheon: Rise of the Fallen is a group-focused MMORPG based on challenging gameplay and open world high fantasy. It takes place in a world populated by deities and heroes, called Terminus. Join the denizens of Terminus to uncover the mysteries of a world divided by Celestial loyalty… and betrayal. Make strong allies, or even stronger foes while you explore a captivating landscape that has its own stories to tell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j7u.jpg'),(886,'Mortal Kombat vs DC Universe: Silver Shield Combo Pack',NULL,'Sin género','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42f0.jpg'),(887,'Heart vs HP','2023-03-21','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Avoid all incoming obstacles while managing your HP! There are only 2 ways to die. One, is be hit by an obstacle, and two, when your HP is 0. Try to get as many points as possible to renew your high score!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b3q.jpg'),(888,'Ronaldinho Campeonato Brasileiro 98','1998-12-31','Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Soccer game featuring brazilian teams. This game is a hack based on International Superstar Soccer Deluxe and was very popular in South America back in the 90\'s.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mr8.jpg'),(889,'IHF Handball Challenge 12','2014-03-21','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','IHF Handball Challenge 2012 is the handball action game sports fans have been waiting for many years. In this action-packed official IHF game, up to 5 players can experience the fascinating sport of handball and fight for national and international trophies. The best leagues of the world, the TOYOTA Handball-Bundesliga including 2nd league, the Spanish Liga ASOBAL and the IHF World Championship have been officially licensed.\n\nIHF Handball Challenge 12 is presented by international Handballstars Nikola Karabatic (World Champion and Most valuable player 2011), Filip Jicha (World Handball Player 2010) und Dominik Klein (Winner Champions-League 2010)\n\nIHF Handball Challenge 2012 offers 4 different game modes. Fans can replay the complete world championship 2011 in Sweden. All players have 11 different skills that have direct impact on the game.\n\nFast breaks, spectacular moves and pure emotions are some of the key elements that make handball the second most popular team sport in Europe. Handball Challenge combines successful features from well-known videogame franchises with highly innovative game play elements, thus creating a completely new sports game series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uui1qydhtxyodix1ljac.jpg'),(890,'Hyperdrive Horizon','2025-01-27','Racing, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hyperdrive Horizon is a high-speed space racer where you’ll dodge obstacles, collect boosts, and challenge advanced AI on dynamic tracks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ooy.jpg'),(891,'Song of Swords',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Song of Swords','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/axv9mkq2mdt4s0vzbnir.jpg'),(892,'Pizza Tycoon','1994-12-31','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, Amiga','Your goal in Pizza Tycoon is to build an empire of pizza parlors while dealing with competing restaurants, crooked police officers, or even ruthless gangsters! The object of the game is to control a minimum of five percent of the market share in all ten cities.\n\nIn order to succeed, you\'ll need to use demographic reports to determine the best location for your shop, contact banks to negotiate the lowest interest rates, decide which advertising to use (billboards, newspapers or TV commercials), and hire waiters, cooks or managers. Decide on your restaurant\'s decorations to attract new customers or develop new recipes to get a leg up on your competition. Not doing so well? Contact the underworld and start taking out other restaurants using sabotage!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xt9.jpg'),(893,'The Void Between',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','When one man\'s dream holiday turns into a nightmare, it\'s up to you save him from himself... VOID is an FMV style puzzle game that leads you through a labyrinth of mysterious challenges and puzzling obstacles. Can you uncover the keys that will unlock your freedom, or seal your fate...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xs7.jpg'),(894,'Friday Night Funkin\': Vs Ankha','2021-09-17','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vs. Ankha is a mod by Akirawave, the mod is based on a popular character from Zone Ankha and from Animal Crossing franchise. The mod has 3 Songs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bi4.jpg'),(895,'Lovely Quest: Unlimited','2014-03-27','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','Visual novel about the one man Lovely Smile Committee, and its search to find examples of pure love.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co305r.jpg'),(896,'Flick Pool',NULL,'Puzzle, Sport, Arcade','Sin plataforma','A billiards game from Tom Lake.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/i6ghxoue4q0rnf4eptot.jpg'),(897,'Endless','2020-10-23','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Endless - is a casual game where you control a dark cube and your main task is to dodge red obstacles. For each obstacle you pass, you get a point, but if you hit with at least one, you will immediately lose and you will have to start over. And how many points can you get?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pw1.jpg'),(898,'Happy VR Plantation Farm',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','This is a casual game that simulates planting. Players can plant a variety of plants, water and fertilize the plants themselves, while transforming their plant farms, while harvesting crops to resist hunger, maintain and replenish their own state.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e35.jpg'),(899,'Reformers Intl Ver','2018-06-05','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Reformers is a retro Role-Playing Game. There\'s no guide in the game, but plenty pleasures that waiting your exploration and discovery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ye5.jpg'),(900,'Manhunter: New York','1988-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','Apple IIGS, Atari ST/STE, Mac, DOS, Amiga, Apple II','It has been over 2 years since the agressive Orbs attacked the Earth. Now you work as a Manhunter, the highest post which can a human achieve in the Orb Aliance. Your job is to hunt down all humans who, in some way, have wronged the Aliance. Once you capture them, the Aliance will correct them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v4y.jpg'),(901,'The Dreadmill',NULL,'Sport, Arcade','Sin plataforma','It will slam you, it will crush you, and it will ALWAYS end you. You will never beat it. It will never stop.\nTap to jump, avoiding everything The Dreadmill can throw at you. Reach the top to reset the floor and push further, collecting as much loot as you can. With randomly generated floors, brutal traps and explosive gameplay, The Dreadmill will always have new ways to destroy you.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(902,'C out','2017-06-17','Arcade','Android','Find your way out!! \n \nOne-handed game, swipe to move!  \nDodge waves of bots and bullets! \nKey point is to attract fire to kill them!  \nWith time-slowing skills!  \nHong long can you survive? \n \nC OUT by 小薯製作 SiuShu Studio (marcochanyh) \n \nGame Features: \n - Over 10 types of bots and combination can be deadly (mini-gun, missile, laser etc.) \n - Unlock over 100 levels and an endless mode for brave challengers \n - Unlock 30 characters with different skills and rarity (time-slow, invisible, immortal etc.) \n - It also contains leaderboard to challenge other player\'s highscore! \n - Check our FB page to get a character in game! \n \n \nShare screenshots to friends and challenge them on different level and characters! \nSimple and fun, enjoy it anytime anywhere! \nSurvive and be the last one who stays! \n \n**********Credits*********( in no particular order) \nThanks for the following people who helped me testing the game and giving me ideas: \nRichard, Percy, Louis, Rocket, Banana, Au tsz, Edward, Kenneth, Longson, Billy, Fai, David, Kin, Mandy, Toffee, Fish, Patrick, Kimmy and the people who helped me during development !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2714.jpg'),(903,'Fire Pro Wrestling D','2001-04-01','Fighting, Simulator, Sport','Dreamcast','The legend lives on in 2001 with a new member in the Fire Pro family. Arguably the most respected wrestling franchise in Japan, Fire Pro revives itself after Human\'s (the original publisher) demise. The new features include the availability of objects to use as weapons inside and outside of the ring, an online network option, and support for up to eight players simultaneously over the net.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8iot.jpg'),(904,'TheHunter: Call of the Wild - Weapon Pack 2','2019-02-28','Shooter, Simulator, Sport, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A brand new shipment of weapons has just been delivered to our wardens, and they’re excited to present an incredible combination of new world finesse and old-school reliability with the Grelck Drilling Gun, the Solokhin MN1890 and the Mangiafico 410 / 45 Colt Revolver.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4x6h.jpg'),(905,'Warlock Bentspine: Toilet Edition','2020-10-28','Shooter, Platform, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a bleak sunny day in Stinker City and Warlock Bentspine and his corrupt mayor friend Burger Jeff are plotting new schemes to raise taxes on the paupers. Their diabolical scheming is soon interrupted however when a bomb goes off in a local news station. Looks like Crime Gang is at it once','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t6f.jpg'),(906,'Duskbound','2023-06-27','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Made for Otome Jam 2023.\n\nGothic horror otome with a yandere vampire LI.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ts8.jpg'),(907,'Ratz Instagib','2016-07-27','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ratz Instagib takes the concept of arena-based fps gaming and renders it down to its core essentials: namely, blasting your friends into tiny pieces with high-powered weaponry. Players take control of a railgun-toting rat in household-themed arenas, with every shot being a potential kill – no more shooting opponents repeatedly to little effect or suffering cheap deaths at the hands of people with an unfair advantage. It\'s every rat for themselves on an even playing field!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co221v.jpg'),(908,'Command & Conquer','1995-09-26','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Nintendo 64, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Experience the game that started it all! Enter a gritty, high-tech world and take advantage of electronic intelligence and covert surveillance to determine who reigns supreme. Join either the forces of the Global Defense Initiative (GDI) or the Brotherhood of Nod as you build bases, muster forces and dominate your enemies. All for the love of power. Play as the Brotherhood and obey the charismatic Kane’s every command or take control of GDI forces as they seek to save the world from Kane’s ambition. Gather Tiberium to produce tanks, infantry and more to decide the fate of the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88m7.jpg'),(909,'Keineged an nor','2018-10-04','Point-and-click, Adventure','Web browser','Parodic Point n\' click\nDie n\' retry adventure','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49zi.jpg'),(910,'BS Bokujou Monogatari: Dai-4-wa',NULL,'Simulator','Satellaview','The fourth and final episode of BS Bokujou Monogatari.\n\nBS Bokujou Monogatari is a Downloadable 4-part Soundlink game for the Satellaview that was broadcast in at least 2 runs between September 2, 1996 and November 30, 1996. The game is a life-simulation game and it comes as a pseudo-sequel to the earlier-broadcast (July 1996)/retail release Bokujou Monogatari, commonly known internationally as \"Harvest Moon\"; this has given the series the fan-nickname \"BS Harvest Moon\" as a result. Together with the game (typically immediately before and after), 10-minute broadcasts of a related nature were released entitled BS Bokujou Monogatari Torisetsu (a digital instruction manual) and Bokujou Monogatari no Kekka (a score/results program). It stars Yoshitake Tanaka as voice actor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co483j.jpg'),(911,'Mystic Vale','2020-03-11','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Mystic Vale is a deck-building card game, in which 1 to 4 players take on the role of druidic clans trying to cleanse the curse upon the land. Each turn, you play cards into your field to gain powerful advancements and useful vale cards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1iws.jpg'),(912,'Sani Yang\'s Laboratory','2024-12-22','Simulator, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Awaken in a world of furries, where your life takes an unexpected turn. After being saved by a mysterious laboratory, you’re pulled into their research on humans. But what lies beneath their seemingly noble intentions?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cvs.jpg'),(913,'Leggite Luta Livre','2021-02-13','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Nintendo Entertainment System','An arcade beat-em-up for the Nintendo Entertainment System.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o29.jpg'),(914,'Bleach: Soul Carnival 2','2009-12-10','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation Portable','The game follows the story of the manga from the start of the series, until Ichigo\'s victory over Ulquiorra Cifer. The game\'s story is told through voice acting and text. There are also some cinematics which were taken right from the anime that are shown most often during fights scenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h19.jpg'),(915,'Pieces of Cake','2018-12-10','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Make combos, bake cakes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xlr.jpg'),(916,'Grand Theft Auto: Anime',NULL,'Shooter, Racing, Adventure','PlayStation 2','Grand Theft Auto: Anime is an unlicensed mod of Grand Theft Auto: San Andreas that changes the game to be based around various anime, with edits to the character models, audio and the overall map.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83ry.jpg'),(917,'Formula One 04','2004-09-22','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 2','This licensed F1 game includes all official tracks, sponsors, drivers and cars of the FIA Formula One championship. The 2004 update includes all the latest changes to the teams, up-to-date driver rosters, and also the new Bahrain and China circuits. Online multiplayer is introduced and the singleplayer mode has been extended with time attack races against ghost cars, and historic cars that can be unlocked upon completing a full championship.\n\nThe career mode is another new addition. You start at the back of the grid and you have to impress sponsors and manager to earn a spot on a team. Success leads to lucrative deals, while failure gets you fired. There are four difficulty levels and gamers can race as themselves, with their name lined up on the starting grid.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4fgh.jpg'),(918,'Taboo Trial','2024-07-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','In the \"Forbidden Trial\", a Roguelike role-playing action game, you will play a girl Einherjar in the Spirit Hall of Norse mythology, and find the truth of the gods at dusk through fighting and exploration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xx0.jpg'),(919,'Stefanos Sizzilin Pizza Pie','2018-07-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Steffano needs your help! Someone broke the door to his kitchen and now bugs can smell his wonderful pizza! Protect Stefanos from the bugs while he creates his amazing pizza pies.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(920,'Nomad','2015-06-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nomad is a sandbox survival game. Hunt, craft, kill and survive! Find food, drink, weapons, ammo and medical supplies - or craft them! Build a base to protect yourself but also remember to protect the base from raiding players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o4k.jpg'),(921,'League Funny','2023-03-31','Indie, MOBA','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','A battle royale game with MOBA gameplay and customizable characters based on KOL internet celebrities. It was released for April fools by the Taiwanese website League Funny, or Game Smash, which is a social media site and video platform originally focused on promoting e-sports communities and discussion.\nThe game was available for a month before going offline but may be back next year according to the updated trailer description.\n\nThrilling battlefield, spectacular fights! With numerous unique and stylish characters, the \'Game Brawl\' is about to bring you an unprecedented fighting experience!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dh7.jpg'),(922,'Steps','2020-12-31','Adventure','Web browser','Steps is a small Minit-like game where instead of dying from time, you die after a certain amount of steps. Explore the cursed island, solve puzzles, and find the hidden coins. Try to run away from the island by finding the Icarus wings as it is the only way to escape the cursed island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co801s.jpg'),(923,'Ready Player Fuck','2017-10-06','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are Zachary Knoxville Touchdown, The ultimate geek. It\'s the future and the world\'s so overpopulated that you have to live in the stacks, a big-ass pile of cars. Since there\'s nowhere for your generation to go, you all live in a virtual reality game called \"The Oasis\", where the limits of reality... Are the limits... Of your own imagination.\n\nIn the Oasis you will be able to see things from your wildest dreams. Characters from film and TV and video games crossing over in unexpected ways. Huge interstellar explosions. Massive-scale fights between Transformers and Godzilla... You name it. And maybe along the way... You will find romance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vo4.jpg'),(924,'Reksio i Kretes: Sermageddon','2024-12-31','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The statue of the Cheese God has been stolen! The weather is going crazy… Could it be that the enraged Cheese God is bringing Cheesemageddon down upon the Earth? Who would dare commit such a sacrilege? Pirates? Aliens? One thing is certain — our heroes will be forced to return to the darkest location of all their adventures — Paris.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99nt.jpg'),(925,'Teikoku Kareido -Kakumei no Rondo-','2018-03-29','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61cz.jpg'),(926,'Assassin\'s Creed Brotherhood: The Da Vinci Disappearance','2011-03-17','Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The Da Vinci Disappearance is a downloadable content addition for Assassin\'s Creed: Brotherhood, bundled alongside Animus Project Update 3.0.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zlk.jpg'),(927,'Reditus',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Augustus knows he must go to the heart of the Heremus to the place his god hid his face from the world.\nBut is it worth the Cost?\nWill he trade his soul to become the Reditus?\n\nReditus blends the old with the new by bringing classic RPG scifi pixel art like Final Fantasy 6 with updated 3d graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z6t.jpg'),(928,'Russian Fishing 4: Amber Lake',NULL,'Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Amber Lake – This reservoir offers a large number of comfortable fishing spots and of course many exciting new carp species. All common methods and baits, that make carp fishing so special, will now be available. The new quad will enable you to comfortably reach even remote fishing spots.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(929,'Art is Boom','2023-12-14','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Let\'s create the art of explosions—different characters, different bombs. It\'s about the art of detonation and the creativity of crafting new bombs. Dive into the joyous game of various explosions!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dkp.jpg'),(930,'Stripper Anya 2: X-MiGuFighters','2018-03-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tired of everyone getting offended about everything?!? So are we! How about some Topless street fighting?! Your friends will judge you but we won\'t! This is a retro inspired 1 on 1 fighting game meant to be played lightheartedly with a comedic approach.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(931,'JoinDispatch',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(932,'X-Men Origins: Wolverine Uncaged Edition','2009-05-01','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','X-Men Origins: Wolverine is an epic action-adventure featuring a true-to-character Wolverine gameplay experience that takes gamers through and beyond the movie’s storyline. Set in a variety of vivid real-world locales, the title challenges players to hone their animal instinct as they uncover hidden dangers, hunt and destroy enemies, and take on seemingly insurmountable situations while discovering the truth about Wolverine’s tragic past. With razor-sharp adamantium claws unsheathed, the future X-Man enacts lightning-quick combat, evasive maneuvers, in-depth combo attacks, and an array of brutal finishing moves. Wolverine doesn’t just deliver massive damage, either – he also takes it, thanks to his mutant regenerative power that heals him in real time right before the player’s eyes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8f4l.jpg'),(933,'Project: G-216','2025-12-31','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Project: G-216 is a Horror themed Observation Game, where you monitor the CCTV feed of a cursed place to check it for supernatural annomalies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8okc.jpg'),(934,'Brutes.io','2025-01-21','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Frantic Online Multiplayer Evolution Brawler\n\nOriginal developed by BulletProof, now rereleased in January 2025 by the original developer, under Funk Games on itch.io: https://funkgames.itch.io/brutes','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bhb.jpg'),(935,'Arrow Sudoku','2021-05-21','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In Arrow Sudoku, every puzzle contains a handful of \"arrows\" laid out in unique patterns. The numbers found along the shaft of the arrow must sum up to the number at the base. This simple rule leads to endless variety in the puzzles you will conquer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lnz.jpg'),(936,'Pandadog in Lost Island',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(937,'Egg Venture','1997-06-01','Sin género','Arcade','One of the more \"kid-friendly\" animated gun-shooting games. Players use an optical gun to shoot at the \"bad eggs\" while avoiding shooting the \"good guy eggs\". Players advance stage by stage to different levels by shooting a certain number of targets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/iuqznz7ch6aembxnr2rz.jpg'),(938,'Look Mum No Computer','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Music meets mayhem in this twin-stick shooter action-RPG! Craft synthesizer modules to gain new weapons and experiment with the original music of Look Mum No Computer. Meet quirky NPCs, complete quests and battle huge bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jky.jpg'),(939,'Soldier Elite: Aurora Watching','2006-05-23','Tactical, Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Metropolis Software\'s Soldier Elite is like a low-budget, direct-to-video version of Metal Gear Solid. It doesn\'t have the big names, the peerless production values, or the engaging, intricate plot line. Instead, this Polish-developed third-person stealth action game is saddled with frustrating, half-realized sneaking mechanics, English-as-a-second-language voice acting, and very little inspiration or originality. In short, this is a bad facsimile of a much better game and has a hard time justifying its existence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zi8.jpg'),(940,'Crucial Throw','2018-03-23','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Outplay your enemies as you dash, juke and launch through arenas in this fast paced local multiplayer game for 2 or 4 players.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(941,'Mage Guard','2017-07-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mage Guard is one of the world\'s first truly gesture based spell casting games for VR. Take on the role of a Guild Mage, tasked with guarding the Guild’s most powerful relic, \"The Grimoire\".  Being the last of its kind, you will defend it against countless waves of enemies that are trying to obtain the precious relic. Use your Magic Powers to defeat those that oppose you. Level up and gain new spell abilities to aid you in intense spell casting combat.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(942,'Painkiller: Purgatory HD','2012-03-26','Shooter, Adventure','Android, iOS','Painkiller: Purgatory HD is an Android/iOS remake of 2004\'s classic PC horror game Painkiller.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h26.jpg'),(943,'_________ (What Even Is That Thing?)','2019-03-26','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Close your eyes.\n\nNow reach out, carefully, until you touch something. Feel it; examine its shape, its edges and contours.\n\nNow tell me what it is.\n\nThat is how you play ________.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ovg.jpg'),(944,'Witches Legacy: The Charleston Curse',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Casual Hidden object / Adventure game by EleFun Games','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/awt54qsmxkq08bfozty4.jpg'),(945,'Dig Dug','2013-02-14','Arcade','Family Computer Disk System, Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Family Computer, Wii U','The Famicom port of Dig Dug. It was originally only released in Japan, being first released overseas via the Wii Virtual Console.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dgh.jpg'),(946,'Find 101 Doomers','2024-04-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Find 101 Doomers is the first object search game in which you have to find all the yearning doomers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95j0.jpg'),(947,'Monster Mash',NULL,'Simulator, Indie, Arcade','SteamVR','A wacky VR monster city destruction game! Use kooky mutated weapons and eat delicious, high-powered snacks, delivered by alien invaders as you take revenge on the evil pharmaceutical corporation that created you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xfa.jpg'),(948,'Ghost of Tsushima: Iki Island','2021-08-20','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','The Iki Island expansion pack comes with a new story, new characters, new environments to explore, new armour for Jin and his horse, new mini-games, new techniques, new enemy types, among other additions. Sucker Punch has also added new animals that Jin can pet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gl4.jpg'),(949,'Zargon','1989-12-31','Shooter','Amiga','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jkbcrt8n5pxazkvfelsk.jpg'),(950,'Secret of Harrow Manor 2','2020-10-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Return to the town of Harrow Manor, this time the monsters are much more deadly. The keys and weapons are well hidden, see if you can make it out alive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40wu.jpg'),(951,'Secret Agent','2013-03-12','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','You are agent 006 - top agent of the government\'s secret organization committed to protecting the world against terrorists and power-mad criminals.\n\nYour mission: to parachute into a high -security island outpost and secure the plans to the ultimate satellite laser weapon, which was recently stolen from the government. In the wrong hands this weapon could mean world control by the DVS, the world\'s most dangerous terrorist organization. You will isolated from outside help as you parachute into the secret island fortress of the DVS. You will need to knock out the vast security system, bypass dozens of extreme traps, overcome hundreds of multi-talented guards (such as thugs, ninjas, sharp-shooters, knife throwers, sentries, dogs, and many robots), and find the missing blue prints. If possible, take out the devious leader of the DVS (sorry, no file picture available).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wnv.jpg'),(952,'Get Acc_E55','2019-10-08','Puzzle','Android, iOS, Mac','Isometric puzzle adventure with the mechanics of room rotation, room escape\n\nNow the near future, cyberpunk, and you are a local geek. Not a scientist or a genius, but a very talented inventor. For the past few years, you have been living in a rented workshop next door to a bar. The bartender is your good friend and soul mate, however it was his idea with an auction and with a very dubious lot \"time machine\", yes. In general, now she is in the garage, and not a little effort has already been spent on her, but, most importantly, this is the new T9 string engine. It remains to collect it, well, and a couple of little things ... Well? To the cause!\n\nGet aCC_e55 - isometric puzzle quest with the mechanics of rotating rooms. You have to open what is closed, correct what is broken, find a way out of the rooms and solve various kinds of tasks and puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91ad.jpg'),(953,'Yume Nyaki','2017-06-21','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yume Nyaki is a Yume Nikki fangame created for the 2017 Dream Diary Jam. Nyasuki has a dream about being asked by a mysterious person known as Cheru to aid an \"Administrator\" in some way, and to not harm the tree that Cheru is standing in front of. Then Nyasuki wakes up, and his adventure begins. Nyasuki\'s main goal is finding effects in the dream world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rfe.jpg'),(954,'Ballerburg: Castle Siege','2003-12-31','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ra2.jpg'),(955,'Give It Up!','2014-12-18','Music','iOS','Game for android and ios platform.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tv9bpkbtspbutkm9q9ac.jpg'),(956,'Capcom Arcade Stadium: Battle Circuit','2021-10-20','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Add Battle Circuit to your Capcom Arcade Stadium game line-up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64ul.jpg'),(957,'Command & Conquer: The Covert Operations','1996-01-01','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','Covert Operations is an add-on for Command & Conquer which features 15 new missions, new music tracks, and multiplayer maps. Unlike the original game, the missions of Covert Operations can be played at any time and in any order, and are not accompanied by mission briefing cut-scenes. It added two new units to the game, and the new missions are more difficult than those of the original. The add-on pack features the DOS version\'s soundtrack, which includes music that was absent from the Windows 95 (or Gold Edition) version. Covert Operations was originally needed to unlock secret missions, which were later enabled by a patch to the main game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ur1.jpg'),(958,'How to Survive 2','2016-09-08','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Dead or Alive? Make up your mind, stranger. We don’t like that undead business here in Louisiana… Survive solo or with friends as you look to fulfill your basic needs of food, water and shelter, crafting your own tools and weapons while you secure your camp and face flesh hungry zombies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j62.jpg'),(959,'PapiBlocks',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(960,'Exoprimal: Nimbus Alpha Kimen Set','2024-04-16','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This pack contains five cosmetic items, including a skin for the Support suit Nimbus α, which provides shotgun melee support. A demon mask imbued with mysterious power! Equip these cosmetic items and bewitch your way victory!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(961,'Frame of Mind','2021-01-19','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Frame of Mind, you are placed in a world where logic is escaping you. Each area of the game defies reason, requiring you to think outside the box in order to solve the illogical and escape madness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nvz.jpg'),(962,'Snowdreams -lost in winter-','2022-03-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','《Snowdreams》 is a romance visual novel game set in the eastern district of Taipei, narrating the difficulties that the main character Xie Zichen runs into whilst pursuing his dream of becoming a professional novelist, as well as his love story with Xia Qianfan and Xuejian. By combining refined illustrations, touching music, and exquisite acting, the game leads players on a touching experience of a story of dreams and yearning.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yof.jpg'),(963,'One Way Road',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take on the role of a Starfleet Command captain, participate in numerous space battles, travel through the galaxy, and fight for the survival of humanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jyy.jpg'),(964,'Roman Sands','2019-10-04','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A visual novel at the end of the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h8y.jpg'),(965,'Echoes of Elysium',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An aerial exploration and survival game, set in the procedural world of Elysium. Fire up the engines and take to the skies in your hand-crafted fleet of airships. Mechanical wonders clash with ancient mysteries in an untamed paradise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co814h.jpg'),(966,'Fire Rock','1988-07-20','Platform','Family Computer Disk System','Survive Fire Rock! The treasures within are hard to obtain, but you are the brave warrior sent to defeat the monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/txekybbsijtzba5byelr.jpg'),(967,'The Super Dimension Fortress Macross II',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Macross II is a horizontally-scrolling shooter based on the OVA of the same name.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/etg1oeulqeuh8ztd1yjz.jpg'),(968,'Your Sister\'s Drown\'d, Laertes','2020-01-24','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your Sister\'s Drown\'d, Laertes is a feverdream for at least four people. one of you will play ophelia, while the others decide who ophelia was and what she meant to them.\n\nin some ways, it is a game about grief.\n\nin another way, it is an examination of the manic pixie dream girl, and how there is a real person behind that title.\n\nit is heavily inspired by hamlet act v, scene i, in which hamlet and laertes leap into the open grave of ophelia to fight over who loved her more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2adv.jpg'),(969,'Halcyon Days','2024-01-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','While exploring ancient ruins, Teflon accidentally releases a mysterious woman and her guardian from their cryosleep. When it\'s revealed that they are from a lost civilization that shaped the world as it is today, an adventure of treasure, betrayal and friendship begins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ays.jpg'),(970,'Vigilance on Talos V','1996-12-31','Platform, Adventure','DOS','Essentially a Super Metroid clone, but for DOS. The player assumes the role of Killian Jaraad, a space mercenary searching for his kidnapped daughter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kga.jpg'),(971,'Yoomurjak\'s Ring','2009-04-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After his mother’s death, Jonathan Hunt, a young journalist from New York, decides to set off for Hungary for the first time in his life. While in the town of Eger, he discovers a peculiar legend involving an antique book and a doomed journey through time that stranded the writer\'s aide in the 16th century.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l5p.jpg'),(972,'Fell from another world',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Fell from another world is a visual novel with RPG elements, team recruitement, minigames and exploration. Travel from earth to this strange new world along with Eurys and reveal the secrets behind the head of the kingdom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59i9.jpg'),(973,'SingStar: Vasco','2009-12-18','Music','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 2','SingStar: Vasco is a karaoke game which exclusively features songs by Vasco Rossi. There are no changes to the gameplay formula: player(s) sing into a microphone and the game gives points based on the performance. The only basis of assessment is if the correct note is hit with the correct timing; the sung words or octave does not play into the result. The PS3 version allows access to the SingStore, an online shop for downloading additional songs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hpx.jpg'),(974,'Lords of the Fallen: Digital Deluxe Edition','2014-11-06','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get the Deluxe Edition of Lords of the Fallen now and receive exclusive bonus content!\n\nWorld Map: Discover the dark fantasy world of Lords of the Fallen. Follow Harkyn on his journey and travel to the center of war in the breach between dimensions on this intricately map depicting human and demonic realms.\n\nArtbook: Discover the designs of Lords of the Fallen in this unique 96-page Artbook. Each page sheds light on the meticulous process of translating a collage of ideas into the language of the game. Marvel at the concept art of many talented artists that joined together to create everything from breathtaking locations, powerful Rhogar Lords and their sly minions, to detailed armors, weapons and items that aid Harkyn on his journey to face the gravest threat of all – the Fallen God.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cwp.jpg'),(975,'Clash','1998-12-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','The discovery of an unknown land, Karkhan, presented a challenge to many adventure seekers. From the four corners of the world powerful armies started to converge. Each claimed the right to absolute mastery over the new world. However, none of the invaders presumed that Karkhan had long been inhabited by an equally technologically advanced nation. That was how the devastating conflict began, a clash between hundreds of power hungry warriors. Which side you take depends on you, the player. You can either play the part of one of the newcomers and strive to declare yourself \"emperor of Karkhan\" or become a general of the native army and once and for all repel the invaders, together with their beliefs and customs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1t1v.jpg'),(976,'Panama Joe',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(977,'Spearain','2024-10-12','Arcade','PlayStation 4','SPEARAIN is a fast-paced one-button game.\n\nYou are constantly running from side to side. Your goal is to avoid getting hit by the spears falling from the top. Hold a button to run faster and to slow down the spears. You score one point each time you bump into a wall and reverse your direction. Collect the falling coins to score additional points.\n\nThe game is over when you get hit by a spear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yrf.jpg'),(978,'Hoplegs','2021-11-12','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Hoplegs is a different kind of platformer with unconventional controls. Each of the four buttons on your gamepad where you usually jump, interact, crouch and change weapons are now your different legs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n0z.jpg'),(979,'La Salamanca','2024-06-24','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"La Salamanca\" is an inmersive first-person psychological horror experience, a story-driven game where you traverse different sections, solve puzzles, and survive the horrors lurking in the shadows of a twisted apartment complex. Inspired by an Argentine local urban legend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hc8.jpg'),(980,'The Falconeer: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3coz.jpg'),(981,'Bewilder House','2013-09-01','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bewilder House is a first-person puzzle game where you have to overcome a feeling of loss of bearings.\n\nTrapped in strange mazes where the walls open and close when you\'re not looking, you\'ll have to use your mind and first person controls in unusual ways to escape a deceptive funhouse that plays with both your perception, and your life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98xb.jpg'),(982,'Turtle Bay','2004-12-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After alien octopuses have taken over several bays in the Caribbean, Amazon and Antarctica, abducting and freezing Kroet\'s fellow sea creatures in the process, it is up to the player to stop their spread by propelling Kroet into the octopuses while they are pupating.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7m9f.jpg'),(983,'M.I.A. Missing in Action','1989-12-31','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Arcade','The player takes on the role of a US Army special operations soldier infiltrating enemy POW camps in Vietnam to find prisoners of wars and lead them to freedom. Like its predecessor, there are a total of six levels in the game: war-torn field, jungle, airstrip, rail-yard, POW camp, and escaping POW camp. M.I.A. can be played by up to two players, with Player 1 in green and Player 2 in blue.\n\nThroughout most of the game, the player\'s main weapon is a knife, which is capable of destroying any enemy in the game. By killing the red enemy soldiers, the player can acquire additional weapons. The available weapons consist of an assault rifle (12 rounds), a flamethrower (2 rounds), a bazooka (3 rounds), and grenades (3 rounds). Unlike Green Beret, the player can carry more than one weapon and switch between them at will. If the player loses a life, then only their currently equipped weapon will be lost.\n\nAt the end of each level, an assorted amount of troops on fixed machine gun positions (usually four) that must be eliminated. On the last mission of the game, the freed hostages are susceptible to being slain by enemies; if all the POW\'s get killed then \"MISSION FAILED\" flashes on the screen and the game is permanently over.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4isv.jpg'),(984,'9-nine-:Episode 1','2017-04-28','Simulator, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Izumi Tsubasu x Palette 14th project.\n\n9-nine- Episode 1 is the first volume in a series of supernatural mystery games, with Episode 1 telling a story centered around Miyako Kujo. The entries in the the 9-nine- series share the same setting and world, but each entry focuses on a different heroine. 9-nine- is a tale of the town of Shiromitsugawa, host to mysterious Artifacts and the superpowers they bestow on their Users. A tale of growing trust and budding romance between the protagonist and the heroine, and also a murder mystery where they hunt down the culprit behind a series of supernatural murders. Each game has an independent story that can be enjoyed on its own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2su1.jpg'),(985,'Knockout City: Season 5 - Greatest Hits','2022-03-01','Fighting, Shooter, Sport, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','We’re rolling into a non-stop block of all the chart-topping hits from Year 1 in Knockout City! There are no commercials and no fillers in Season 5: Greatest Hits! We’ve brought back five Playlists you know and love: one every two weeks! Plus, we scrambled up a twist on an old classic for the Mid-Season Event that’ll have you hopping wild. Each Limited-Time event will feature many of the cosmetics, Ultimate Holograms, Intro Poses and MVP Poses that you’ve been waiting for a chance to see in the Shop again, along with unique items that we’re releasing for the first time! There’s never been a better time to experience the best that this City has to offer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4om1.jpg'),(986,'Immure: Part Two','2020-12-17','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A new door creeks open within the mysterious mansion. As the nightmare continues, Will must investigate a family tragedy. Murder, lies and sorrow fill the air. Uncover the truth and decide the fate of those who remain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b8v.jpg'),(987,'Iron Assault','1995-01-01','Shooter, Simulator','DOS','Iron Assault is a futuristic battle simulator which utilizes state-of-the-art texture-mapping graphics to convey a world in which big business is threatening to take over the globe.\n\nWith over 50 missions, set in a variety of terrain and an awesome breadth of gameplay, you\'re going to need more than luck to win through. Play on your own, tactically deploying your troops, or link up to another PC and battle against a friend. Choose your missions with care and scavenge wreckage for new armaments. Above all, give no quarter. The fate of free Earth rests in your hands. Dare you take up the challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b1x.jpg'),(988,'Crisis in the Kremlin','2017-03-20','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Don’t let the Soviet Union collapse, and fall in the darkness of history or lead the Union by a new path – democracy and free market! But before you decide something, think – wouldn’t it cause more harm than good?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eox.jpg'),(989,'Kemono Friends Festival','2018-06-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, iOS','Kemono Friends Festival is a Kemono Friends mobile game developed by Goodroid. It is the second RPG in the Kemono Friends franchise, with the first being the Nexon game, and the fourth mobile game overall.\n\nIt\'s a vertical slingshot gacha game similar to Monster Strike with moe-style animal characters that can be collected and trained, each of which has their own special ability.\n\nThe game ceased receiving updates or maintenance following August 2020; however, it remained available to download until July 1st, 2024. That same day, Goodroid announced that Kemono Friends Festival would end service on October 31st, 2024.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99ot.jpg'),(990,'The Trials of Olympus','2018-12-13','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Banished to the mortal realm, Angelo must prove his worth to the Grecian king by building the most majestic palace. Play 79 thrilling match-3 levels in 5 unique worlds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co445l.jpg'),(991,'Valor','2022-11-03','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embark on a epic journey through a range of different environments and arenas. Upgrade, personalize and finetune your characters, overcome different challenges and bossfights to prove the single most important thing: your worth as a gladiator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co509c.jpg'),(992,'Justin Danger','2021-06-01','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Runventure awaits! Jump in to the action and explore mysterious lands in search of treasures. Avoid the danger, run through various locations. Jungles, temples, castles and many other places loaded with deadly traps and hordes of enemies. Use your reflexes to jump over hot lava, or rope swing over piranha pools escape the deadly skeletons and hungry wolves. - Super sharp vector graphics! - Explore mysterious lands with parallax backgrounds. - Tons of characters to unlock and level up - Great levels, obstacles and enemies to beat Build the team of experienced explorers, level them up, complete challenges and unlock precious treasures. Now it’s time for adventure, it’s time for Runventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59ad.jpg'),(993,'Future Reality',NULL,'Music, Racing, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Experience the future now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4txx.jpg'),(994,'GunGuru','2024-04-03','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game made by a real world US Marine Veteran Machine-gunner. Explore the ever evolving jungle of GunGuru, an ancient procedurally generated environment, full of magic and mystery. Unlock the secret of the Runes and find out what is hidden beneath.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91kf.jpg'),(995,'Freshly-Picked Tingle\'s Rosy Rupeeland','2006-09-02','Adventure','Nintendo DS','Freshly-Picked Tingle\'s Rosy Rupeeland is an adventure video game developed by Vanpool and published by Nintendo for the Nintendo DS handheld game console. It was first released in Japan, and was released in Europe on September 14, 2007, a year after its Japanese release.\nFreshly-Picked Tingle\'s Rosy Rupeeland stars Tingle, a character who has appeared in several games in The Legend of Zelda series starting from The Legend of Zelda: Majora\'s Mask for the Nintendo 64. It was commercially successful in Japan, selling 234,862 units by the end of 2007.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ymm.jpg'),(996,'Lovely Neko Girl','2023-04-06','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lovely Neko Girl is a soothing puzzle game that offers players a chance to unwind while solving puzzles. Complete each puzzle while enjoying beautiful pictures of hot girls and relaxing music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e3b.jpg'),(997,'Kung Fu Er San','2022-07-13','Fighting, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kung Fu Er San is an 2D retro pixel fighting game inspired by the old classics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5imw.jpg'),(998,'PiColumns','2021-04-14','Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','PiColumns is a port of the classic puzzle game Columns to Pico-8.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3j9l.jpg'),(999,'Kingdom Rush 5: Alliance - Colossal Dwarfare','2025-01-30','Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1000,'Graces: Posthumous Wish','2024-11-20','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aki is haunted by a curse. In search of salvation, she travels into the memories of a dead classmate, where she must witness three eerie mystical stories and figure out how to break the shackles of misfortune.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zfm.jpg'),(1001,'Sumy Shelltris: Iceblocks 3','2021-11-26','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tetris? Not! Mutant Tetris!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5omu.jpg'),(1002,'Europa Concept',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','An action-adventure shooter built for the 7DFPS competition. Discover the secrets of an unknown planet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qj7qmqrsaue73lgwiifx.jpg'),(1003,'Mental Hospital II HD','2013-12-20','Sin género','iOS','Are you ready to accept the gift of madness and understand the secrets of the deep? If yes — “Mental Hospital” is waiting for you.\nThe story of Mental Hospital begins with a banal event in the life of a young reporter. Agreed to film a special forces raid tasking at the Psychiatric Hospital, he started his work. But in an absurd accident he has been arrested at the office. In order to get at least something from such a bargain, you (as this reported) still hesitant to go to the hospital, and shoot for the scene at least something meaningful.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1004,'Gloop Deluxe',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1005,'Sonic Riders','2006-12-31','Racing','Game Boy Advance','Sonic Riders was a port of Sonic Riders to the Game Boy Advance. It was in development at the same time as the other Sonic Riders ports. The game used a Out-Run style game engine. When Sega of Japan insisted on adding more 3D to the game it was cancelled by Sega of USA as it could not be completed within the tight production schedule.\n\nInfo on the game was discovered on Keith Erickson’s portfolio and Arvin Bautista’s resume.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w7u.jpg'),(1006,'Devil\'s Island','2023-08-24','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Devil\'s Island is an FPS with elements of survival, maintained in a horror atmosphere with post-apocalyptic themes in a world that has already ended. This is a game whose history combines what has long been forgotten with what may yet come.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79nf.jpg'),(1007,'Galaxian2','1981-12-31','Shooter','Handheld Electronic LCD','A port for handheld devices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8itw.jpg'),(1008,'Magical Waifus Academy','2021-02-11','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Have your way with more than TWO DOZEN different species of monstergirls with fully handcrafted animations. Fun fact: this game plays 100% one-handed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3msk.jpg'),(1009,'The Last of Us Part I: Digital Deluxe Edition','2022-09-02','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 5','Experience the emotional storytelling and unforgettable characters in The Last of Us, winner of over 200 Game of the Year awards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90ci.jpg'),(1010,'Battle Bees Royale',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','~ BATTLE ROYALE WITH A FUN BEE POWERED TWIST ~Fight for survival in a top down, last blimp standing multiplayer Battle Royale!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59o8.jpg'),(1011,'Death Box',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Death Box is a labyrinth horror game where the goal is to escape the death box and manage to survive. You have to find the exit of a huge maze of secret rooms and doors without getting caught by zombies and traps. There are 2 types of enemies: fast and slow zombies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o9k.jpg'),(1012,'TS Marketplace: LMS P1&P2 LMS Late Coach Pack Add-On',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','The LMS P1&P2 LMS Late is a TS Marketplace for Train Simulator','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1013,'Craft Run - 3D Endless Mine Runner Game',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1014,'Macro Data Refinement Simulator: Shapes','2025-03-07','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game is a Macro Data Refinement terminal simulator with installed a puzzle game - Shapes. This is the favorite game of the assistant director of the Macro Data Refinement Department, in which the goal is to arrange successive layers of the same shapes. Will you be able to beat Miss H\'s record?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gvc.jpg'),(1015,'QuVerse',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','QuVerse is exciting and challenging action matching puzzle. Basic rule is very simple, Make top of Cube to same color. but this world\'s system is unstable, for matching color of Cube, you should move Logically and swiftly. Challenge your Limit, break the record!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ok0.jpg'),(1016,'True Game',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','\"True Game\" is a work of suspense reasoning. The work tells the story that people in trouble are taken to a closed space and ask to get chips from others through different competitions. This work has a high degree of brain burning, exquisite picture and strong sense of substitution.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44zz.jpg'),(1017,'In Your Face','1991-01-01','Sport','Game Boy','In Your Face is a Sports game, developed and published by Jaleco Entertainment, which was released in 1990.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hgl.jpg'),(1018,'Your Diary','2011-09-30','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your Diary is a visual novel game that explores the seven ways humans experience happiness in the stories of its seven heroines. What does it mean to be useful to someone? To be loved? To trust someone with your heart? Rediscover the importance of these everyday joys.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zxu.jpg'),(1019,'Pixel Puzzles Traditional Jigsaws: Pack - Variety Pack XS',NULL,'Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Pixel Puzzles, your number one place for digital jigsaws.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1020,'Cookie Story Crush',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1021,'Rhythm Hell','2023-07-17','Music, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Help a poor seal out by clapping back the rhythms shown! Clapping on cue makes the meter go up, missing cues makes the meter go down! Aim for the highest score as the difficulty slowly progresses!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s2e.jpg'),(1022,'Svoboda 1945: Liberation','2021-08-03','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','The horrors of World War II are over, but peace never came to the Czech village of Svoboda. You were sent to investigate a decades-old feud. Who can you trust to explain what happened? How was your family involved? Talk to witnesses to uncover the troubled past.\n\nSvoboda 1945: Liberation is a unique blend of adventure gameplay, full-motion video interviews with real actors and historically-accurate interactive memories of people who lived through the chaos of the aftermath of World War 2. Discover the secret history of your own family in a captivating story about reconciliation with the dark past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ybm.jpg'),(1023,'The Train','2013-12-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bghertdvzsjdlfo6cpnj.jpg'),(1024,'Star in the Hollow',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','A young girl who finds herself alone in a massive cave with no memory of how she arrived there. Aided by a mysterious talking bird, she must find her way out of the cave, and hopefully, return to a family that she can’t even remember.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58th.jpg'),(1025,'Demon Turf: The Tower','2023-03-06','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'ve been stripped of all your powers and there\'s only one way to regain them: Climb the Jester\'s impossibly high tower! Can you overcome all of the hazardous challenges and gain back your abilities, one by one? All it takes is one slip up and you\'ll have to start over... You\'ll be sweating, you\'ll be swearing but with each attempt you\'ll climb just a bit higher... And just that much closer to beating this incredibly tough challenge! Good luck, fellow demon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91p6.jpg'),(1026,'Infinitode 2: Infinite Tower Defense','2021-04-30','Strategy, Tactical, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Infinitode 2 - a strategy in the Tower Defense genre, in which the player will have to build towers to protect his base from endless waves of enemies. The game features huge maps, lots of towers, resource miners, upgrade tree and map editor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i7y.jpg'),(1027,'Xonox Double Ender: Artillery Duel/Ghost Manor',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1028,'Zombies Rocket Boom Boom','2023-01-30','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome in this casual game of Zombies Rocket Boom Boom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65ec.jpg'),(1029,'Glory of Rome','2020-12-17','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience the life of a city administrator as you expand the empire in the name of Rome. Build, manage and expand settlements in this resource driven city sim. You\'ll create resource, trade goods and take care of your citizens needs','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o6q.jpg'),(1030,'Capri Care',NULL,'Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Capri Care lets you care for and interact with adorable Capri creatures. Compete in fun minigames, breed new colors and traits, and explore a vibrant island. Feed, train, and bond with your Capri to unlock new adventures and surprises in this magical world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a09.jpg'),(1031,'Double Hits',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1032,'Tabletop Simulator: Pillars of Eternity - Lords of the Eastern Reach',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Pillars of Eternity: Lords of the Eastern Reach is a 1-4 player card game based on Obsidian Entertainment\'s award-winning and best-selling Pillars of Eternity computer role-playing game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1033,'Tom Clancy\'s Ghost Recon Predator','2010-10-01','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','PlayStation Portable','Tom Clancy\'s Ghost Recon Predator is a tactical shooter video game developed by Virtuos, published by Ubisoft for the PlayStation Portable, and released in 2010.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yhe.jpg'),(1034,'Para Bellum','2024-04-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Necromancer\'s army is gathering! But he can\'t afford Necronomicon Prime so his army can only use free medieval equipment set... We believe that one battle sister can solve them well. Go Forth, Sister Para, Blast your enemy in this survivor-like shooter game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83bs.jpg'),(1035,'Chornobyl Liquidators','2025-03-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Chornobyl Liquidators is not a fantastic tale of exploring the Zone. It\'s a story about real people facing a real threat — the CNPP disaster. Invisible radiation, KGB, difficult moral choices... Do you have enough courage and strength to take on this challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ap4.jpg'),(1036,'Orake','2016-06-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Orake is the new free to play MMORPG! In Orake there are many things to do, you wont even know were to start. First off there are so many skills to leveling up, mining, fishing, Cooking, Gathering and so much more. You wan to slay Ghost and other players? Thats where the \" BoneYard \" comes in. Fight or defeat other players and getting all of there stuff this can get you loads of money and experience but at the same time it is very risky cause once you die everything that you are carrying on wealth belongs to the other person, But wait this isn\'t the only thing you can do! You can also go on epic quest\'s and adventures with your friends fighting and defeating bosses together! You can also earn tokens from mini-games and unlock various amounts of cool things with the tokens such as Armour, Weapons , and more! You adventure starts now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/m1p6z9gjzgoubtbslisp.jpg'),(1037,'Maid Master',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Sin plataforma','In 2142 when Android and humans coexist,\n\nthe nursing robots called NURSEs became infected with the computer virus and suddenly began to threaten humanity.\n\nMAIDs, the only robots not affected by the virus, are humanity\'s only hope. Lead the MAIDs to fight against the NURSEs and to protect humanity!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a71.jpg'),(1038,'Not For Broadcast: Season Pass','2023-02-17','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Channel One is more than just the news! The Not For Broadcast Season Pass grants to access to all three of the upcoming episodes of Not For Broadcast as they release.\n\nEach episode is a self-contained story, set early into the events of the main game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bia.jpg'),(1039,'Tower!3D Pro: OMDB Airport',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Tower!3d Pro: OMDB Airport is an add-on airport for Tower!3D Pro.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1040,'My High School Cat Girlfriend','2020-10-06','Visual Novel','Android','Your parents have moved and you’ve had to transfer schools. Things at your new school seem to be going smooth until you start hearing people talk about purebreds and hybrids. Next, you hear people talking about their paws! You figure this must be some kind of weird terminology that people in this school use… Guess that’s what comes with moving to a new community?\n\nBut then, PE class starts… All of your classmates jump like they’re part-cat! Wait… part-cat…? Is that even possible? Turns out it is! You somehow have managed to transfer into a school made for cats that can turn into humans! You’ve got to protect your secret at all costs, but whether you like it or not, one of the cat girls is onto you…\n\nWill you be able to survive your time at a school dedicated for cats? Will you be able to discover why you were able to enter this school? Can cat girls and humans fall in love? Find out in My High School Cat Girlfriend!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wib.jpg'),(1041,'Ruzar: The Life Stone','2015-12-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ruzar - The Life Stone is a dungeon crawler RPG game in which you play an adventurer who needs to discover the powerful Life Stone. Do you have the skills to survive in the deadliest dungeons of the Mountain of Ruz and recover the legendary artefact?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ltb.jpg'),(1042,'Hack And Slash Fury: Gold Warriors Armor','2025-03-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Buy this armor to use it on the game while you are playing or seeing video scenes.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1043,'21 Steps to Soul','2016-10-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Classic old-school hardcore two dimensional horror platformer. Following Daniel in this God forsaken world, the players are going to collect the elements to open doors, run for their dear lives from the evil monsters and make their way further and further into the darkness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/leyotkjy0loqpi0oc9sn.jpg'),(1044,'Music On: Playing Piano','2010-10-18','Sin género','Nintendo DSi','Playing the piano has never been so easy and so much fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ovjkjp5itykmes3feyvi.jpg'),(1045,'Justice League Task Force','1995-10-27','Fighting','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Justice League Task Force is a fighting game produced by Sunsoft and distributed by Acclaim for the Super Nintendo Entertainment System and Genesis in 1995. The Super NES version was co-developed by Blizzard Entertainment and the Genesis version by Condor, Inc. (later known as Blizzard North).\n\nIt involves characters from DC Comics\' Justice League, including Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman, Green Arrow, The Flash, and Aquaman.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wc7.jpg'),(1046,'Three Digits','2015-08-14','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You are given 14 numbers less than 1000, and all you have to do is to choose two subsets with the same sum. Three Digits is the sequel to our first game Two Digits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h79.jpg'),(1047,'The Threshold Dweller',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Open World dark fantasy RPG with retro style - indie development, with total personalization of your character and companions. Explore the vast world, decide your own consequences by interacting with a complex quest system. Battle with your companions against multiple and diverse enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ndf.jpg'),(1048,'Dishwashing Simulator','2024-04-03','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A unique survival-farming-base-building-tycoon-horror game where you must survive through washing dishes. Explore mysterious depths, manage resources, and unravel a cryptic narrative. In DWS, a chore becomes a journey to freedom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81q8.jpg'),(1049,'World Senate Game - Free Online Multiplayer Game','2021-05-09','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','World Senate Game is an online multiplayer game in which you can have your own virtual life. You can join a country, buy vehicles, items, properties, open a political party, fight in wars, be a country president, join the world senate and be a world senator or representative, vote world issues and you can do many other activities.\n\nUpon joining World Senate Game a citizen is assigned to a virtual country citizenship based on they\'re choice when joined the game. Each of these countries are named after an actual country in the real world. World Senate Game tends to be a combined version of the real world with the fun of a game where citizens can play the game and also follow the footsteps of world politics where anyone can be a country senator or country president and they are chosen by direct vote from other citizens. Training, working, fighting in war and taking part in races is done on a daily basis. One of the main drawing points of the game is that it takes a mere \"15 minutes a day\" to participate but you decide the time you want to invest in it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x4w.jpg'),(1050,'Pinball Dreams','1993-06-03','Pinball','Game Boy','A portable version of Pinball Dream for the Game Boy. Only includes 3 of the 4 original tables with the removal of Beat Box.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wnt.jpg'),(1051,'Oneiric Gardens','2014-09-13','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','3D Junglegym thrown together from shards of memories and dreams, feelings and places.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wto.jpg'),(1052,'Spiritus','2023-11-03','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Albert and Rose investigate a manor with miscreants and broken souls. Stay together and survive the horror.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nwd.jpg'),(1053,'The Office: Somehow We Manage','2022-01-14','Simulator, Arcade','Android, iOS','The Office: Somehow We Manage lets fans play through hilarious moments from the critically-acclaimed Emmy award winning comedy, where they\'ll tap their way to record proﬁts at Dunder Mifflin, and get down to business with Michael Scott, Jim Halpert, Pam Beesly, Kelly Kapoor, Dwight Schrute, Stanley Hudson and others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5usa.jpg'),(1054,'Nainai\'s Recipe',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Open your fridge, choose the ingredients, examine, chop, seasoning, heat, and taste them. During the lockdown, you start to learn how to cook from your dear grandma.\n\nNainai’s Recipe is a game that captures the cooking feeling in stylized visuals. And a family story about how we lived together in a special way during 2020.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3924.jpg'),(1055,'Hyper Sentinel','2018-05-11','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hyper Sentinel is a pure shot of pixel-perfect nostalgia, fusing iconic shooter gameplay with contemporary systems and mechanics; repackaging the sights, sounds and feel of the arcade to deliver the ultimate neo-retro experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27p2.jpg'),(1056,'Super Dungeon Bros','2016-11-01','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Super Dungeon Bros is a rock-themed dungeon brawler where a band of mighty rock bros must navigate the fantasy realm of Rökheim and its hellish dungeons to seek out epic loot, fight hordes of evil undead and uncover the legends of long lost fabled Rock Stars!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rh4.jpg'),(1057,'Lost Planet 3','2013-08-27','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','The extreme and unpredictable conditions that characterized the Lost Planet series return, harsher than ever before. Lost Planet 3 reveals new truths about the foreboding planet and the colonial history of E.D.N. III.\n\nLost Planet 3 introduces Jim Peyton, a rig pilot who leaves Earth to take on a hazardous but lucrative contract on E.D.N. III. Working for Neo-Venus Construction (NEVEC) who are preparing the planet for colonization, Jim joins his fellow pioneers at the Coronis base and begins surveying the uncharted terrain and obtaining samples of the planet’s energy supply – Thermal Energy.\n\nWith NEVEC’s existing Thermal Energy reserve running low the fate of the Coronis mission depends on the natural source of the energy supply being located. Realizing that this is a great opportunity for a huge pay-off and early ticket home to his family, Jim braves the risk of the treacherous environment and threat of the indigenous Akrid.\n\nActing as a home away from home and boasting an array of tools that can assist Jim on the field, the utility rig provides Jim’s safety and is essential not only for his contract work but also his protection against the ever-changing climate.\n\nLost Planet 3 will deliver a diverse range of gameplay including on-foot battles and intense first person action. With a number of multiplayer modes and a compelling single player experience, Lost Planet 3 will delve deeper into the Lost Planet universe, uncovering hidden truths within the unique and dynamic environment of E.D.N. III.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w7n.jpg'),(1058,'Batman: The Animated Series','1992-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','An LCD game based on the animation Batman: The Animated Series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xj1.jpg'),(1059,'Pocket Rumble','2018-07-05','Fighting, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Pocket Rumble is a streamlined, beginner-friendly 2-button fighting game that retains all the gameplay elements that make traditional 2D fighters great, but reduces the level of execution and memorization necessary to the bare minimum.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tir.jpg'),(1060,'M.Stain','2020-07-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Always wanted that great job in the big city? Looking for the opportunity of a lifetime? Right this way. M. Stain has a position with your name on it.\n\nJourney into a nightmarish world of bizzare people and twisted locales as you unravel the mystery of eccentric business tycoon M.Stain\'s true nature. Can you get the job? Can you even survive? There are three unique endings and branching story paths. Make your choices carefully and be careful who you trust.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co305l.jpg'),(1061,'The Fast and The Furious','2004-07-28','Racing, Arcade','Arcade, Legacy Mobile Device','The Fast and the Furious (Wild Speed in Japan) is a racing video game licensed by the film of the same name. The game was released in several versions, first was the so-called \"2D version\" developed and published by I-Play for mobile phones and released on March 4, 2004 and then the so-called \"arcade version\" developed and published by Raw Thrills for Arcade in July 2004 (the game is a spiritual successor to the saga Cruis\'n; containing similar elements and the design of Eugene Jarvis), and later I-Play releases the so-called \"3D version\" developed by Juice Games for mobile phones in September 2005.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39vz.jpg'),(1062,'Pray Game','2023-09-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A classic style turn-based RPG. Play as Arcee, a young woman who\'s home mysteriously gets teleported to an island. Now she works to discover what happened, and find her way back home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mln.jpg'),(1063,'Throne of Darkness','2001-09-21','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Japanese mythology and fast-paced multiplayer mayhem combine to make Throne of Darkness a must-have title for action oriented role-playing fans. Players will control a team of seven unique samurai against a massive single player experience or in online cooperative and competitive play modes.\n\nGuide your seven unique samurai as they seek to overthrow the evil that has overtaken the kingdom and avenge their slain Daimyo. From the gates of the clan citadel to the spire of the Dark Warlord\'s castle, you\'ll face more than 30 varieties of fantastic creatures from Japanese myth, including legions of undead warriors, fearsome demons, and giant dragons - all animated in breathtaking 16-bit color. Ten unique levels and dozens of side quests combine to create a truly original combat experience.\n\nThrone of Darkness introduces an innovative multi-character control interface that allows for the simultaneous command of up to four characters through a series of tactical \"plays,\" or formations. Each play is designed to combine the unique strengths of each samurai - such as the ranged attacks of the archer and the two-sword technique of the berserker - into a distinct tactical advantage. Play calling allows for a high level of control and coordination between the player and computer-controlled samurai never before seen in the genre.\n \nIn Throne of Darkness\' multiplayer mode, up to 35 simultaneous players vie for the mantle of Dark Warlord in a king-of-the-hill style competition. Through competition and cooperation, four clans of seven samurai challenge the Dark Warlord, his seven lieutenants, and his countless minions, all of which can be controlled by a human player. Once the Dark Warlord is defeated, the conquering team becomes the new warlord.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co226f.jpg'),(1064,'Rugby Nations 16','2015-10-16','Sport','iOS, Mac','Celebrate the World Cup in style with the most realistic Rugby game on Mac - Rugby Nations 16!\n\nLive events and fantastic gameplay will get you into the celebratory spirit for the biggest Rugby event this year. Optimized Phoenix™ technology drives fantastic 3D visuals, enhanced gameplay and slick animations to deliver the most atmospheric Rugby experience on the Mac App Store. With fully loaded tournaments, new challenges and a captivating career mode it delivers all the authenticity of Rugby Union.\n\nWORLD CUP FEVER!\nExperience the thrill and excitement of the greatest Rugby tournament with all 20 qualified teams, group and knockout stages. Gameplay has never felt so real with enhanced tackle momentum, atmospheric crowds and official licensed content. Authentic pre-match build up and brand new commentary make you feel like you’re a part of the world cup squad.\n\nINTERACTIVE TOURNAMENTS WITH LIVE GAMES\nDon\'t miss a moment of the World Cup and play along with LIVE GAMES. Earn points for your team and lead them to victory whilst enjoying much improved celebration and try scoring animations.\n\nREALISTIC RUGBY GAMEPLAY\nMotion-captured animations, highly detailed players and stunning stadiums bring the match to life. Realistic AI developed with professional Rugby players lets you show your skills in all areas of the game with much improved mechanics and much more.\n\nGet involved with all things Rugby\nFacebook.com/rugbynations \nTweet us: @distinctivegame #RN16','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/eifxxoydod0hsyqbp2dz.jpg'),(1065,'Rote2: RoteSquare','2022-04-04','Music, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 6-key vertical scrolling rhythm game with a unique mechanic that allows notes to take up any number of lanes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5o2k.jpg'),(1066,'Farkle Friends','2017-10-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play farkle and get the highest score to win. Compete with your friends to see who can get the highest scores. It takes a good strategy and planning to win, can you beat your opponents and win? Farkle Friends is an addicting fun game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bcs.jpg'),(1067,'Goiken Muyou II','1998-10-29','Fighting','PlayStation','What\'s the fun in fighting? How to fight and be cool? Here is the answer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/oq4hy8cdmr2vehj2bung.jpg'),(1068,'Beyond Divinity','2004-04-27','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You were a disciple of the Divine, a servant of light on a never-ending crusade to fight evil. But fate has made a terrible turn on you. During an epic battle with a powerful necromancer, dreadful daemon named Samuel tricked you and dragged you to his dimension. There you were trapped and tortured. But like every typical daemon lord, he had a very twisted, sadistic sense of humour, so he decided to chain your soul to that of a Deathknight. Thus he cursed you to spend the rest of eternity bound to a creature you were fighting all you life. Now you must work together to escape your prison and find a way to break this curse!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qq6.jpg'),(1069,'Mystery of the Murderous Dreams','2020-07-15','Visual Novel','Android','A series of unfortunate events has forced you to move back to the countryside where you spent your childhood. Sadly, you don’t have many memories of the time you spent there. Things aren’t all bad, though - Chinatsu and Chifuyu, two adorable sisters at your new school are glad to have you! However, Chinatsu mentions an urban legend of “Ichika’s Mansion,” a supposedly cursed old mansion at the edge of town. You don’t think too much about it, but on the bus home, you have a terrifying dream…\n\nYou’re still on the bus… but each of the passengers is labeled with a way of dying and when the bus stops, the first passenger in line is murdered in the way their label states! You wake up thinking it was just a dream, but you hear news of a boy in your school being murdered last night. You take a look at a photo of him and… It’s the boy that was murdered in your dream! It doesn’t take long to realize that this isn’t just a nightmare. Every time you ride the bus, another passenger is murdered and your turn is coming up soon!\n\nChinatsu and Chifuyu, along with their older sister, Chiharu, explain to you that this is all part of Ichika’s Curse. Anyone who enters the mansion will be cursed by her spirit. But how could you be cursed if you’ve never been to the mansion? It seems Chiharu knows more about your past that she’s willing to disclose...\n\nWill you be able to stop the curse before it’s your turn? Will you be able to unlock the secrets of your past? Will you discover who Ichika truly is?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55rz.jpg'),(1070,'Time Master','2022-01-18','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Time Master is a fantasy themed time manipulation puzzle game. Rewind time and collaborate with your past self to solve dozens of hand-crafted puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4byr.jpg'),(1071,'The Way Things Work','1994-12-31','Point-and-click, Quiz/Trivia','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Way Things Work is an educational science game, developed and published by DK Multimedia in 1994. It explains how numerous inventions work using exploded diagrams and videos, often involving woolly mammoths.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bte.jpg'),(1072,'Gods and Nemesis: of Ghosts from Dragons','2017-04-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bizarre lands! Fantasy! Chaos!   \n \nYou start off with the main chapter centered in the bizarre alien land as described in the book Gods and Nemesis: Leviathan Seed. Additional chapters will be added allowing you to advance your character.  \n \nAs the chapters are added for you to explore, Gods and Nemesis: of Ghosts from Dragons will unravel into a multiplayer open sandbox RPG. One thing you will notice up front is every asset is crafted from scratch. Future chapters will include a survival-based world that will invite you and your friends to adventure the main storyline, find side quests, unravel secrets, or create and play your own epic quests within a truly alien environment. Once you get used to the asymmetrical world with its fresh layout within the first chapters, future chapters will be released that include giving an open world experience. Are you an explorer or dungeon crawler? Are you a survivalist or crafter? Maybe you want to begin creating your own quests as a modder-- the future chapters will give you incredible options. \n \nFeatures of this first chapter  \n• 1st chapter will be approximately one hour of average play  \n• Engaging storyline  \n• Intro to the alien world with in-game tutorials  \n• Several Side quests and Easter Eggs','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26wg.jpg'),(1073,'Unspoken Chronicles : Nora',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','It is said in the Viking tribes that brave warriors fallen in battle win a place in Valhalla. But what happens to others? \n \nNora, embarked despite herself in a raid that will go wrong, will find out at his expense. She, who is not a fighter, will have to cross the nine kingdoms and defeat the terrifying guardians of every world to restore her name to Odin. \n \nThis is the beginning of a delirious and thrilling epic through Nordic mythology. \n \n \nMixing platform, infiltration and enigma, Unspoken Chronicles: Nora makes you the exact opposite of a Viking warrior. Far from the usual brainless brutes, Nora is an agile, intelligent girl, but not brave. So you will have to cross the nine realms, avoiding your enemies or finding diverted ways to get rid of them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1klm.jpg'),(1074,'Great Houses of Calderia','2023-08-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Great Houses of Calderia is a Feudal Grand Strategy game focusing on family dynamics & stories. Use your family strengths to compete against rivals to rise in the ranks of Calderia - produce, trade, scheme, bribe, and battle to build your legacy of power!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v5a.jpg'),(1075,'Milo\'s Quest','2020-07-29','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Milo\'s Quest is a retro inspired, top-down, adventure puzzle game. The young puppy, Milo, is enjoying his time in the park and sees a delicious bone to chew on! This bone is cursed and sets free the Evil King Old Skull. Now it\'s up to Milo to go on an adventure to save the world by stopping the curse!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fly.jpg'),(1076,'Assassin\'s Creed Valhalla + Immortals Fenyx Rising Bundle','2021-03-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','This bundle includes two Ubisoft games: Assassin\'s Creed Valhalla and Immortals Fenyx Rising.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ka6.jpg'),(1077,'Chess? OK! - 3000 unique chess problems',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1078,'A Gummy\'s Life','2018-09-25','Fighting, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A Gummy’s Life is a local & online party multiplayer with candy-coated physics-based fights. Choose your favorite gummy, customize it to your taste and show who rules over the sugar! Play with friends, family or AIs in multiple manic game modes or battle online - as easy as taking candy from a baby.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4afj.jpg'),(1079,'Dry Path','2020-06-17','Platform, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore a desert without running out of water','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wfv.jpg'),(1080,'Space Runaway','2022-12-22','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Space Runaway, a compelling intergalactic journey soaked in bullet hell. Enemy vessels, lasers and larger than life bosses coming at you full speed in a 16-bit authentic arcade experience like no other. It was created as an arcade mini-game within Wanted: Dead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65d2.jpg'),(1081,'Battlefield 1: Standard Collector\'s Edition','2016-10-21','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the Battlefield 1 Collector\'s Edition. This is your chance to own a piece of Battlefield history. Enhance your setup with the 14” statue, which any true fan will be proud to own. Go behind the scenes to discover more about the game\'s creation through the concept art playing cards, uncover exclusive DLC content with the messenger pigeon tube and join the fight wearing your very own Battlefield patch. Heck, you can even start recruiting allies with the cloth poster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ad1.jpg'),(1082,'Whispering Hills','2018-12-04','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Whispering Hills is a Mod for Fallout 4 that aims to reproduce the look and feel of Silent Hill inside the Game of Fallout 4. It is made by Team Whisper and is to be considered a Fanmade free mod.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92na.jpg'),(1083,'Inko Beasts','2024-12-30','Indie','Android','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9in1.jpg'),(1084,'Sonic Dash Extreme','2015-09-01','Arcade','Arcade','Sonic Dash Extreme is an arcade version of the mobile phone game, Sonic Dash, developed by Sega Amusements and released by Sega. The arcade version features daily and all-time leaderboards and different control methods for large-sized d-pad controllers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yqy.jpg'),(1085,'Bullethead','2010-05-13','Arcade','Web browser','Co-op defence game with enemies and bullets galore!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co975r.jpg'),(1086,'The Witch and the Hundred Knight','2013-07-25','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3','Two powerful witches have been battling one another for over a hundred years. Now, the Swamp Witch has unleashed the legendary Dark Knights, and seeks to destroy the Forest Witch once and for all!\n\nAdopting high-res, fully 3D environments and characters, as well as a dark fantasy world brought to life by Takehito Harada, The Witch and the Hundred Knights will deliver a brand-new action RPG experience from Nippon Ichi Software.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rod.jpg'),(1087,'Code Carbon','2016-10-05','Simulator','Android, iOS','Take control of your very own planet! Balance energy with emissions in the face of a growing population and worsening climate change in this nerve-wracking simulation strategy game.\n\nThe swelling population is hungry for power and only you can supply what it needs to survive. Expand your infrastructure and invest in fossil fuels and renewable energy economically, politically, and environmentally. Increase your power production and multiply your global funds all the while limiting carbon emissions in order to develop a sustainable economy. Understand the mechanics of Climate Change better by playing our strategy game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uy9loaow9zjj4tpcrldh.jpg'),(1088,'Yukti','2015-11-15','Sin género','iOS','Yukti is a puzzle game in which you play with the tactics, creativity and imagination of your touch. All levels have a simple goal to land the asteroid onto the sun. You draw a stroke that travels in space with the speed and the path that you define. Your stroke repeats its pattern in space and travel to dodge the black holes in the space. Sun is surround by a shield that protects it from any other outer body, but if traveling asteroid absorbs the energy of other planets, it can penetrate the shield to enter the surface of sun. The game starts with easier puzzles that teach you to understand the tactics that you need to solve the puzzles.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1089,'Pro Basketball Manager 2021','2020-11-04','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take on the role of coach of your own team with Pro Basketball Manager 2021. Start your career as head of the team of your choice and lead your players to victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jx1.jpg'),(1090,'Battlefield 1: Premium Edition','2016-10-21','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience the dawn of all-out war in Battlefield 1. Fight your way through epic battles rangingfrom tight urban combat in a besieged French city to the heavily defended mountain forts in theItalian Alps or frantic combats in the deserts of Arabia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hmo.jpg'),(1091,'Bug Dates','2022-06-30','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Just like bugs, this game is cute, creepy, and a little bit eerie.\n\nLonely? Don\'t worry! Your best friend signs you up for a dating show without your permission. The fun part you\'re gonna date some bugs! Have fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xfv.jpg'),(1092,'The Adventures of Batman & Robin: Tiger Barcodzz','1994-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5a26.jpg'),(1093,'Ancient Battle: The Aztecs',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','An archaelogist gets into trouble while digging and now must defeat the enemies','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co976s.jpg'),(1094,'Batman: Laptop Bilíngue','2020-10-01','Quiz/Trivia','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xzs.jpg'),(1095,'Algarna','1991-02-08','Role-playing (RPG)','Sharp X68000','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f5w.jpg'),(1096,'Phantasy Star Online 2 New Genesis: Cloud Version',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1097,'Chigau!!!+: Premium Edition','2022-04-28','Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Mirai Minato, a boy student who attends Mokuyo High School, is woken up by a noisy childhood friend who takes care of him as usual.\n\nThis edition includes the following PS4 Game:\n- Chigau!!!+\n- B2 Tapestry\n- Original Soundtrack\n- Original Acrylic Key Chain','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oue.jpg'),(1098,'The Hobbit: Kingdoms of Middle Earth','2012-10-01','Strategy','Android, iOS','The battle for Middle-earth has just begun! Gandalf, Bilbo, Thorin and thousands of players require your help to pacify the Goblin threat in the new combat strategy game from Kabam. Play as an Elf or a Dwarf, build up your city, and destroy the Goblins. But remember - the rift between Elves and Dwarves runs deep!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96ti.jpg'),(1099,'Batman: The Caped Crusader','1988-12-31','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga, Apple II, Amstrad CPC','The penguin is back, and he\'s set himself up as a respectable umbrella merchant. Or has he? Could the umbrella factory be just a cover for his plot to take over the world with an army of robotic penguins? As Batman you must match clues you\'ve collected to locate the master computer and - POW! ZAP! CRUNCH! - Put an end to the demented squawkings of that overweight birdbrain.\n\nBut that\'s not all! As soon as you\'ve taken care of the Penguin, the Joker pulls off his greatest feat of sleight of hand - he kidnaps Robin! At the scene of the crime, you must gather all the facts. Then, while the trail is still hot, you\'re off on a crime solving adventure. Grab your batarang and rev up the Batmobile - because if you don\'t reach Robin in a hurry, the last laugh will be on you! HA, HA, HA, HA!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zlq.jpg'),(1100,'G.G Series Z.ONE','2010-12-27','Shooter','Nintendo DSi','A horizontal shmup for DSiWare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gr14shmnidy0gxtlvo6i.jpg'),(1101,'Jurassic World Evolution: Expansion Collection','2019-12-16','Sin género','Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k73.jpg'),(1102,'Assassin\'s Creed Antiquity Pack','2019-05-01','Sin género','Xbox One','Explore the epic beginnings of the Assassin\'s Brotherhood in this value pack that includes both Assassin\'s Creed Origins and Assassin\'s Creed Odyssey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kdo.jpg'),(1103,'Beautiful Sakura: Fitness Club','2024-03-13','Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A visual novel focused on mental health and personal identity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a5u.jpg'),(1104,'Ravengers','2017-11-01','Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','The evil vultures have invaded your home and taken everything you own and hold dear. But little did they know that no one messes with ravens, because the dark messengers are going to make them eat crow! \nIn \"Ravengers\" you\'ll assume the role of the vindictive raven who\'s going to teach the vultures a good lesson by trying not to fly as the crow flies! To this end you will chase the carrion-eating thieves around the globe, from the beautiful landscapes of Tokyo, through the streets of Tehran, and to the dark infernal depths volcanoes to get back what\'s yours from their unrelenting talons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vbhq14hz35nnbnfextmg.jpg'),(1105,'Gunnhildr','2020-11-17','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gunnhildr is a narrative shooter set in a Norse-inspired sci-fi world. Defy the gods and give Niflheim new life through fast paced first person combat in an ever-changing world full of powers and stories to uncover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2knv.jpg'),(1106,'Battlefield 1: Early Enlister Deluxe Edition','2016-10-21','Shooter','PlayStation 4','Battlefield 1 Early Enlister Deluxe Edition includes the Red Baron Pack and the Lawrence of Arabia Pack - containing themed weapons, vehicles and items. Plus five Battlepacks containing combinations of items. Exchanges the visual appearance on three of the largest vehicles in the game. This Early Enlister edition allows you to play Battlefield 1 three days earlier starting from October 18.\n\nExperience the dawn of all-out war in Battlefield 1. Fight your way through epic battles ranging from tight urban combat in a besieged French city to the heavily defended mountain forts in the Italian Alps or frantic combats in the deserts of Arabia. Discover a new world at war through an adventure-filled campaign, or join in epic multiplayer battles with up to 64 players, and adapt your tactics to the earth-shattering environments and destruction. Fight as infantry or take control of amazing vehicles on land, air and sea, from the tanks and bikes on the ground, to biplanes and gigantic battleships, and adapt your gameplay to the most dynamic battles in Battlefield history.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ad0.jpg'),(1107,'Call of Duty: Black Ops Cold War - Ultimate Edition','2020-12-16','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','The iconic Black Ops series is back with Call of Duty: Black Ops Cold War - the direct sequel to the original and fan-favorite Call of Duty: Black Ops. Black Ops Cold War will drop fans into the depths of the Cold War’s volatile geopolitical battle of the early 1980s. Nothing is ever as it seems in a gripping single-player Campaign, where players will come face-to-face with historical figures and hard truths, as they battle around the globe through iconic locales like East Berlin, Vietnam, Turkey, Soviet KGB headquarters and more.\n\nCall of Duty: Black Ops Cold War - Ultimate Edition includes:\n- Xbox One and Xbox Series X|S version of Black Ops Cold War\n- Land, Sea and Air Pack\n- Battle Pass Bundle\n- Confrontation Weapons Pack\n- Legendary Captain Price Operator Skin','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k3a.jpg'),(1108,'Jamie\'s Mod','2013-02-16','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','After Black Mesa plummeted into the ground 200 years after the incident, it was brought back to life by a group of Blue-Headed men all named \"Jamie\". Jamie and all his friends now work at the lab, and ironically enough the same exact thing that happened 200 years ago happens again. Even with Gordon Freeman brought back from the dead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5iqt.jpg'),(1109,'Just Dance 2025: Deluxe Edition','2024-10-15','Music','Xbox Series X|S, Nintendo Switch','The party never ends with the Deluxe Edition with four months of Just Dance+* and digital bonus unicorn pack.\n\nGet your friends and family together to let loose on Just Dance! Whether you want to party, exercise, or create special family moments, Just Dance 2025 Edition has something for everyone with 40 hot new songs, including an exclusive song pack with Ariana Grande.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e4j.jpg'),(1110,'Bass Landing','2000-10-07','Sport','PlayStation','Designed for the armchair angler in mind, Bass Landing captures the essence of being on an actual lake and boat without the hassle of reaching into your tackle box and pulling back a handful of slime! There are five different lakes in all, ranging from the murky Lunker Lake to the mountainous clarity of Crystal Lake. Each contains natural and manmade hazards (branches, poles, rocks) and different kind of fish--depending on the kind of fish you want, choose your lake accordingly. \n \nFor instance, the Silver Carp can only be found in dark, murky lakes or swamps and the Spotted Bass resides in the chilly, colder water areas. While the name of the game is bass, there are 14 different types of fish including the small but feisty Blue Gill, massively dynamic Carp, and the multiplying Rainbow Trout. \n \nIn addition to his or her game, the armchair fisherman will need to know how his fishing rod works and what lures to use on the various fish. There are fifty different tools in all ranging from Spinner Bait to the MHB-665 Bait Rod--one will want to know the functions of each lure and rig and choose an appropriate rod for the type of fish being hunted.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ilhrolte4trkjsjxdv8m.jpg'),(1111,'Rope','2020-07-24','Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rope is a short (~5 minutes) linear puzzle game with no story, a minimalist artstyle, and a philip glass-inspired soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gc8.jpg'),(1112,'Melo\'s Nightmare','2024-05-16','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Melo\'s Nightmare is a first-person perspective 3D escape horror game.\nPlayers find themselves trapped in corridors and must investigate puzzles to attempt escape.\nFulfilling the conditions to escape hidden passageways will unlock the next door.\nActivating or finding the correct puzzle triggers changes in the environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co858z.jpg'),(1113,'Monowave','2025-12-31','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Monowave is a whimsical puzzle-adventure platformer about the transformative power of emotions. Explore beautiful landscapes and empathize with its quirky denizens to restore harmony in an emotionally turbulent universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dpk.jpg'),(1114,'Batman: The Video Game','1990-04-13','Sin género','Game Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zch.jpg'),(1115,'Sayonara, Utsutsu.','2014-08-17','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"You have to save this world. That\'s not my whim, the world itself desires it.\"\nThe transfer student by the name Minayo said that and gave Kadzuki a syringe. By using it he traveled to a different world \"Mundos\" that, in some ways, resembles reality. There he fought, as a savior, against monsters called \"Mortalis\" that destroy the very fabric of the reality he knows. That brought an end to his \"role\" and \"everyday life\" he was so fed up with. Like mad he spent his time as a hero fighting for the world\'s salvation. A true story that from a first glance resembles drug-induced hallucinations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wzx.jpg'),(1116,'Dark Tales: From the Lost Soul','1999-10-28','Adventure','PlayStation','Dark Tales: From the Lost Soul is a Japanese horror-adventure game for the PlayStation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5y57.jpg'),(1117,'Kiss-iro','2022-01-28','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1i3k.jpg'),(1118,'Assassin\'s Creed Unity: Dead Kings','2015-01-14','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Dead Kings is a piece of downloadable content for Assassin\'s Creed: Unity. Set after the game, it follows Arno Dorian as he battles a group of raiders sacking the tombs of French kings in Saint-Denis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zno.jpg'),(1119,'Ninja Platformer','2020-12-30','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Legacy Mobile Device','Ninja Platformer is a very unique game. There are multiple modes including \"Battle Royal\", \"Platformer\", and more to come. All of these modes are side scroller. The game will always be free with many cool skins to buy!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1120,'The Glass Staircase','2019-03-30','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"The Glass Staircase is a 2019 survival horror game created by Puppet Combo. It is inspired by PS2 survival horror games (Silent Hill, Rule of Rose, the Clock Tower series) and Italian zombie movies. Specifically Burial Grounds: Nights of Terror, House by the Cemetery and The Beyond\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cea.jpg'),(1121,'Avernum 4','2006-03-02','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Avernum is one of the great tales of indie gaming, an epic series of fantasy role-playing adventurers set in an enormous, subterranean nation. Avernum is a land underground, a subterranean nation full of rogues, misfits, and brigands, struggling for survival and wealth in the monster-infested darkness. Avernum 4 is the first chapter in the Great Trials Trilogy, three games that tell the tale of your land’s struggles in the face of powerful forces that seek to destroy it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lsm.jpg'),(1122,'StormEdge: Wind of Change','2023-09-22','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Discover the origins of the Elemental Tempests in the StormEdge: Wind of Change, the prequel to the main game, StormEdge. Uncover the cause of the magical disturbance in the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co788y.jpg'),(1123,'Cossacks: Back to War','2002-10-17','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Back to War is the second expansion pack, and it can be played as a standalone. Cossacks: Back to War adds two new nations (Switzerland and Hungary) to the choices from Cossacks: European Wars and Cossacks: Art of War because of their influence on European history. There are also new maps, a tutorial campaign and a map-editor. It adds several units to various countries, new cannon types and alters some parameters such as building time, upgrade and building costs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nkt.jpg'),(1124,'Crunchies Munchies','2014-09-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Eat as much food as possible. Hitting each other or hitting a saw will cause you to barf it out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jyj.jpg'),(1125,'Journey to die','2024-12-30','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a Japanese visual novel produced by MUGnet.\nAnd this is their first work.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98lz.jpg'),(1126,'JaJaMaru Gekimaden: Maboroshi no Kinmajou','1990-06-29','Role-playing (RPG)','Family Computer','JaJaMaru Gekimaden is an action role-playing game, with gameplay similar to The Legend of the Zelda. Players control the protagonist character through towns, dungeons, and a world map. Each different type of map features top-down exploration. When moving through a dungeon, the protagonist will gradually recover health. The protagonist can equip different types of weapons and items that he can buy or find and use them during combat. Dungeons are made up of several rooms with enemies inside. Occasionally, an enemy will drop money when defeated, which can be used to buy items or heal health points at an inn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91r2.jpg'),(1127,'Life is Strange: Before the Storm - Deluxe Edition','2018-09-13','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Life is Strange: Before the Storm is a new three part standalone story adventure set three years before the events of the first game. This time play as Chloe Price, a rebel who forms an unlikely friendship with Rachel Amber in dramatic new story in the BAFTA award winning franchise.\n\nDeluxe Edition contains:\n\nThe main game (Episodes 1-3)\nBonus Episode: ‘Farewell’\nExclusive New Mixtape Mode\nExclusive outfit pack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uqo.jpg'),(1128,'Horse Isle 3: Infinite Wilds','2019-08-31','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome to the newest in our series of family friendly games made for horse fanatics! Clean, nonviolent fun, with some education tossed in! Grand adventure and real world horse genetics await you in this, our third installment.\n\nHI3 is fully 3D, yet retains the unique charm of the previous games. Your horse\'s performance and actual look are based on its genetics, just like the real world. No two horses look or behave alike. Come discover your special horses!\n\nAlong the way, make friends with some of our great playerbase. HI3 players are helpful and fun folks! This is a special place :)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s92.jpg'),(1129,'Leeds United Club Football','2003-10-10','Sin género','Xbox, PlayStation 2','Club Football is a soccer series designed to re-create the individual team experience. A total of 17 games released in the Club Football series are tailored to the specific European teams on which they are based, including character facial mapping from each of the 22 position players on the roster.\n\nEach game features bespoke content - including media archive clips of great goals and famous victories - and allows fans to add themselves to the 2003/04 starting line-up of their favourite side.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74ab.jpg'),(1130,'Turbo Shell','2023-11-15','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Turbo Shell is a fast-paced 2D platformer with a unique movement mechanic: instead of running and jumping, you push and pull yourself through levels with the help of a special device. Traverse through ever more challenging levels as Craig The Egg, collect rewards – and beat your friends\' best time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mt5.jpg'),(1131,'Totally Spies! Totally Party','2008-02-14','Card & Board Game','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','The game is primarily based upon a series of mini-games distributed around 10 boards and a showroom. On each board, 1 to 3 players will be able to face-off with a \"bad guy\". The players must win the mini-games in order to gain popularity points and lay traps against the bad guy. Watch out, the bad guys can also lay traps!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lfe.jpg'),(1132,'Shonen Adventure: The Dual Blades Hero','2021-12-01','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','SteamVR, Oculus Rift','Explore multiple worlds, fight creatures, level up, unlock powerful elemental skills, sell your loot, buy items to increase specific stats and more. Start from the bottom and become a hero with the shonen spirit. You can also rank yourself among all the other players and try to reach the top.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4129.jpg'),(1133,'CivCity: Rome','2007-06-17','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','CivCity: Rome, an innovative city builder, invites players to shift focus from building a multi-city empire and zoom-in on the great cities of the Roman Empire, culminating in Rome itself! Through dozens of missions, each offering an array of interesting decisions, players will be charged with building, nurturing and managing one of these great cities as they endeavor to lead the Roman Empire from its humble beginnings to its mighty apogee. Features players have enjoyed in the Civilization series, like research, city happiness, production and culture, can now be managed actively in the wonderfully immersive world of CivCity: Rome.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zsd.jpg'),(1134,'Maybe: Interactive Stories - Flower Lane: A Record of Romance','2019-05-29','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Flower Lane: A Record of Romance is an original maybe series. In it, you play as Taylor Jones, a new student of Bloomingdale University. After being kicked out by her landlord due to sudden renovations, she finds herself with nowhere to go, and must find a place to live in for one month before she\'s able to move back in. By chance, she meets the three top-most celebrities at her university... and they\'re willing to room with her! Will she be able to find love before time runs out?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sie.jpg'),(1135,'Shenzhen I/O','2016-11-17','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"BUILD CIRCUITS. WRITE CODE. RTFM.\n\n- Build circuits using a variety of components from different manufacturers, like microcontrollers, memory, and logic gates.\n- Write code in a compact and powerful assembly language where every instruction can be conditionally executed.\n- Read the included manual, which includes over 30 pages of original datasheets, reference guides, and technical diagrams.\n- Get to know the colorful cast of characters at your new employer, 深圳龙腾科技有限公司 (Shenzhen Longteng Electronics Co., Ltd.), located in the electronics capital of the world.\n- Get creative! Design and test your own games and devices in the sandbox.\n- Engineering is hard! Take a break and play a brand-new twist on solitaire.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uad.jpg'),(1136,'Yellow Submarine','1983-02-01','Sin género','Atari 5200','Yellow Submarine was a prototype coded by an unknown Atari programmer to demonstrate directional control and the ability to move off one side of the screen and reappear on the opposite side. The Beatles yellow submarine graphic was not used in any Atari 5200 video game and was perhaps nothing more than an inspiration by the original programmer. There is no game here only the ability to control the yellow submarine on and around the screen','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ycb.jpg'),(1137,'Iced','2017-05-15','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The protagonist goes winter fishing on a lake and is caught in a snowstorm. He decides to wait it out in a tent and falls asleep. When the cold wakes him up, he finds his burner empty, his tent cold, and the ice outside broken, leaving him with no way back to the shore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24wa.jpg'),(1138,'Bitter Exclusion','2013-09-20','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1139,'Evil Minds: Dirty Charades!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1140,'Batman: Arkham Origins - Black Mask Challenge Pack','2013-11-27','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Take on Gotham City\'s most notorious criminal kingpin in the Black Mask Challenge Pack. Unlock two all-new Black Mask-themed challenge maps: Lot Full and Hidden Facility. Play as either Batman or Deathstroke and show Black Mask who really runs Gotham!\n\nNote: To play as Deathstroke, you must own the Deathstroke Challenge Pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/f8cms4ehrzntq50oiqtl.jpg'),(1141,'Fortune Lover Trial Version: Keith Edition','2020-06-24','Visual Novel','Blu-ray Player','Included as a bonus disc in the Japanese My Next Life as a Villainess: All Routes Lead to Doom! Blu-ray Package Vol 2.\n\nA original Mini PC Game included in the Blu-ray releases of the My Next life as a Villainess: All Routes Lead to Doom! as a bonus disc. Each disc contains a 15-30 minute trial game, showing a preview of the events within the world of the original game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oiy.jpg'),(1142,'Batman: Arkham Shadow','2024-10-22','Adventure','Meta Quest 3','Gotham City is in danger. And you’re the only one who can save it.\n\nPrepare to enter Gotham for a new story set in the Batman: Arkham franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85hu.jpg'),(1143,'RiQa','2000-12-31','Adventure','Nintendo 64','In development by Bits Studios, RiQa was shown at E3 1999 and appeared to be heavily inspired by PlayStation title, Tomb Raider. It was a third-person perspective action and exploration game starring a female protagonist.\n\nThe game was only shown once, and then was delayed several times before being dropped, with very few details provided. However, it is believed that Bits Studios later used elements from RiQa in its multiformat 2003 title Rogue Ops.\n\nSome prototype builds were dumped and released onto the internet on April 2024.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8364.jpg'),(1144,'Jet Set Radio','2012-09-19','Platform, Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 3, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360','Jet Set Radio HD is the latest remaster in a string of Dreamcast \"hits\" to see new life on download platforms, but Sega has been insistent that they\'ve learned its lessons. The publisher has emphasized how hard it\'s trying to get things right this time, and for many, it couldn\'t have chosen a better game.\n\nJet Set Radio was part of Sega\'s onslaught of new properties with an emphasis on flash and style during the second wave of Dreamcast software, but it might be one of the more obscure. It\'s a game that almost everyone has heard of, but I think few have actually played. This was remedied somewhat with 2002\'s Xbox sequel Jet Set Radio Future. Unlike Sonic Adventure or the arcade hit Crazy Taxi, Jet Set Radio HD is the chance for many to finally play a game they\'ve only heard about.\n\nNostalgia has the side effect of high expectations though, and Jet Set Radio HD just can\'t meet them. While the flash and style of Jet Set Radio HD remains untouched and unvarnished by a dozen years of progress, the rest of it can\'t stand up to scrutiny. Squirrely controls, camera catastrophes, and nonsensical level design make Jet Set Radio HD a better memory than game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dzv.jpg'),(1145,'Horror Tale 2: Samantha','2023-10-26','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A chilling continuation of the adventure of Tom and his friends','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d3r.jpg'),(1146,'Touhou Spell Bubble: Side Story Pack - Yukari Arc','2021-05-06','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','Side Story Pack, vol. 3!\nThe title is, \"The Education of Spell Bubble - Yukari\'s Counterattack\"!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yz8.jpg'),(1147,'Her Nightmares: Redacted','2022-07-18','Point-and-click, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dwell deep into her nightmares & uncover the truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51x9.jpg'),(1148,'Batman Forever: The Arcade Game','1996-11-30','Fighting','DOS, Atari Jaguar CD, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yd0.jpg'),(1149,'Drop 4','2025-04-18','Simulator, Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Classic Game with a twist, where you must get 4 in a row by removing chips and using special chips like bombs and ice tokens to beat your opponent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f5s.jpg'),(1150,'Empire Idle',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1151,'Space Papers: Planet\'s Border','2022-11-03','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, Nintendo Switch','Attention, Earthwad! Welcome to Nations United by Convenience, the NUC. You have just called up for a great mission on Earth as an intergalactic border patrol officer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ehv.jpg'),(1152,'Battlefield 1: In the Name of the Tsar','2017-09-19','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A first glimpse of Battlefield 1 In the Name of the Tsar. Enter the war’s biggest front with the Russian army in the most extensive Battlefield expansion so far.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3aba.jpg'),(1153,'Beyond Mankind: The Awakening','2021-08-31','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Beyond Mankind: The Awakening is an Action RPG taking place in a post-apocalyptic world. The game sports a mature and deep narrative, rich exploration, tense combat, and immersive RPG mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45vs.jpg'),(1154,'Personal Trainer: Cooking','2008-12-24','Simulator','Nintendo DS','Personal Trainer: Cooking includes more than 200 recipes from around the world and transforms the Nintendo DS into an electronic, interactive cookbook, complete with a glossary of terms and even instructional videos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/z1rptftskvzwf0lwthfc.jpg'),(1155,'Popgoes 2015',NULL,'Point-and-click, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Popgoes 2015 was an original version of Popgoes game story. It was later changed into what is now in the released version of Popgoes.\n\nThe Popgoes lore went through a couple of major changes before the game was released. The original lore is being called Popgoes 2015, while the final version is called Popgoes 2016, as the main changes were established around the end of 2015.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6clk.jpg'),(1156,'Fanboy & Chum Chum: Arcade Raid','2010-12-31','Platform, Arcade','Web browser','Fanboy & Chum Chum: Arcade Raid is a web game by Nickelodeon based on the show Fanboy & Chum Chum.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53e0.jpg'),(1157,'Spaceship Tactics',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Spaceship Tactics is a sci-fi strategy autobattler. Build a mighty fleet, improve spaceships with powerful upgrades and find ways to fuse spaceships together. Decide battles by cleverly arranging your fleet!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ma7.jpg'),(1158,'Cheese Dreams New Moon','2013-12-05','Platform','Web browser','Bounce your way through the S.S Squeakstar and help save our solar system!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oyc.jpg'),(1159,'Watch Dogs 1 + Watch Dogs 2 Standard Editions Bundle','2017-02-06','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Purchase the Watch Dogs and Watch Dogs 2 bundle and gain access to these award-winning titles at a great price. In Watch Dogs, become Aiden Pearce and hack your way around Chicago to take down ctOS. In Watch Dogs 2, join Marcus Holloway and the Dedsec hacker group to expose a new digital conspiracy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ebz.jpg'),(1160,'Lumberhill','2021-06-13','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Lumberhill is an action multiplayer party game for up to 4 players. You can either play locally or join friends online, playing in Coop Mode or 2v2 Versus Mode. Working as a team, you and your fellow lumberjacks must cut down trees and fight side by side to get the job done.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i5t.jpg'),(1161,'My Final Cursed Days','2024-11-06','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1162,'Rush','2010-12-23','Arcade','Web browser','Four player one button platform racing with gravity flipping dynamics!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co975u.jpg'),(1163,'Batman: Arkham Knight - Prototype Batmobile Skin','2015-08-04','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This addon introduces a prototype skin for the Batmobile.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fx9.jpg'),(1164,'Picross 3D','2010-05-03','Puzzle','Wii U, Nintendo DS','Picross 3D is the sequel to the popular Picross DS puzzle game. The original game was a number-based grid puzzle that challenged players to reveal a hidden picture. Picross 3D moves the action into three dimensions. Picross 3D blends the logical challenge of a sudoku puzzle with the excitement of discovering the hidden images within.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dzy.jpg'),(1165,'DC Heroes United','2024-11-21','Arcade','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1166,'Your Call','2023-07-31','Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short visual novel about making an important call.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vz7.jpg'),(1167,'Oedipus In My Inventory','2015-02-18','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Relive the story of Sophocles\' \"Oedipus the King\" from the point of view of a humble shepherd who unexpectedly changed the course of history. A short project made in a single afternoon for a gamdev jam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ryz.jpg'),(1168,'Tennis Elbow Manager','2009-02-19','Sport','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Become a tennis coach and manage up to 4 tennis players : take care of training sessions, planning, sponsors, team members, and more ! Will you be able to lead your players to the top of the world hierarchy ? Tennis Elbow Manager features 3500 players evolving other 38 years, from 1990 to 2027, competing in more than 300 tournaments per year, both in singles and doubles ! \nThe game was Greenlit on Steam and later released on October 14, 2016','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xgw.jpg'),(1169,'White Album 2: Shiawase no Mukougawa','2012-12-20','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita','White Album 2: Shiawase no Mukougawa is an expanded port of both the Introductory Chapter and Closing Chapter of White Album 2 for PlayStation 3 and PlayStation Vita, which includes improvements and a brand new event CG and an additional chapter called \"Extra Episode\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w0z.jpg'),(1170,'HorrorCore: Maze and Pools of Horror','2025-02-14','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Instead of a traditional flashlight, a camera flash – a brief, flickering, blinding light that reveals dark secrets and leaves you in total darkness when it fades. Every step is a fight for survival, and the use of the flash completely redefines the way you explore dark locations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9led.jpg'),(1171,'Dagger Woods VR','2025-12-31','Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','Dagger Woods VR is inspired by true stories and local legends, offering players a psychological thriller experience that combines puzzle-solving, clue-finding, mystery, and adventure. Step into the shoes of Maggie Carmichael to find the truth behind the darkness within the snow-covered woods.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l9j.jpg'),(1172,'Aleya\'s Ascent',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aleya\'s Ascent: Explore the mountain, save the world. Play as Aleya, the girl chosen by fate and circumstance to enter the ancient mountain temple city and tame feral long forgotten deities in this 2D precision platformer from Ursa Minor Games, a one person dev team.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p16.jpg'),(1173,'Middle East Empire 2027',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Lead your Middle Eastern empire in an empire building turn based strategy war game. Are you ready to lead, Supreme Commander?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ff0.jpg'),(1174,'Dishonored 2: Steelbook Edition','2016-11-11','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Dishonored 2 is a first-person action video game and the sequel to Dishonored. It borrows many of the gameplay elements from the first opus: players define their own play style by blending action, assassination, stealth, mobility and combat. Combining tools at their disposal, players are allowed options to eliminate enemies, whether they choose to pursue them unseen or ruthlessly attack head on. Dishonored 2 features the same campaign style as its predecessor in which the protagonist must advance through a series of missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ils.jpg'),(1175,'Assassin\'s Creed: Syndicate - Big Ben Edition','2015-11-23','Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Assassin\'s Creed: Syndicate - Big Ben Edition includes:\n\nExclusive Big Ben Collector\'s Box. A 30cm-high Jacob\'s Big Ben Machinery Figurine. Double-sided London Map with street advertising on the back.\nA high quality art book including concept art that inspired the game.\nThe official game soundtrack.\nAn exclusive FuturPakTM.\nAn exclusive numbered Lithography chosen by the fans who pre-order (34x25,5cm). An exclusive premium hip flask.\nDigital Content: Season Pass included.\n\n2 additional single player missions for an extra hour of gameplay:\nThe Darwin and Dickens Conspiracy: Embark on two pulse-quickening missions that will take you into the inner sanctums of London\'s most influential men. Defend Charles Darwin\'s discoveries from those who would kill to silence him. And help a friend of legendary writer Charles Dickens keep a secret that could get him killed. Runaway Train: As a runaway train thunders through London at top speed, you must find and fix the train\'s critical flaws before you run out of time - or railway tracks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nbu.jpg'),(1176,'Mindlock: The Apartment','2024-11-26','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Colin’s apartment maze has puzzles, dialogues, and some dry humor waiting for you. A surreal adventure of a special kind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kze.jpg'),(1177,'Satella-Q: Mou Sugu Haru desu ne - Chotto Sate-Q Shimasen ka?','1998-03-15','Quiz/Trivia','Satellaview','A single-episode season of Satella-Q.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1178,'Assassin\'s Creed Valhalla: The Way of the Berserker','2020-11-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Leapster, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Way of the Berserker is a single-player downloadable content addition for Assassin\'s Creed: Valhalla and was released on 10 November 2020 as a pre-order bonus. The content consists of three missions in which Eivor joins a legendary Norse Berserker on his quest for revenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31ca.jpg'),(1179,'Assassin\'s Creed: Origins - Dawn of the Creed Edition','2017-10-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The ultimate edition wasn\'t enough? Then take a look at the Dawn Collector Edition for Assassin\'s Creed Origins. This one has a ton of cool collectibles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7oht.jpg'),(1180,'Batman: Arkham Knight - Original Arkham Batman Skin','2015-09-22','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This addon introduces the original Arkham Asylum Batman costume.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fvd.jpg'),(1181,'Splendor: The Cities',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','In Splendor: The Cities, set off to discover the greatest cities in Europe – Lyon, Florence or Seville. Become the only one to conquer a city or take over a city of greater value than your opponent\'s to win the game!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1182,'ToHeart2: AnotherDays','2008-02-29','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ToHeart2: AnotherDays is a spin-off from ToHeart2, taking place sometime after the events of the original game, its main storyline allows the player to pursue seven heroines consisting of both supporting female characters from To Heart 2 and new characters. In addition, it also contains two additional scenarios that extend storylines from the original game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6acx.jpg'),(1183,'Sunset','2015-05-21','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It\'s 1972 and a military coup has rocked Anchuria. You, Angela Burnes, are trapped in the metropolitan capital of San Bavón. Your paradise has turned into a warzone. You take up a job as a housekeeper. Every week, an hour before sunset, you clean the swanky bachelor pad of the wealthy Gabriel Ortega.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v5m.jpg'),(1184,'High Noon Revolver','2019-07-23','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','High Noon Revolver is a 2D Action Shooter; blast your way across 3 layers of platforming, collecting gold and obtaining upgrades helping you go from puny to powerhouse. Play as a cast of colorful characters, each with unique weapons and abilities!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bmh.jpg'),(1185,'Fly to Kuma Maker','2016-09-12','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"New stages are packed with contraptions to block the Kuma\'s progress!\nSolve the puzzles to get the Kuma to their destination!\nTry your hand at designing your own stages with Maker Mode!\nMake your own original stages and share them for players world wide to try!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1186,'Kao the Kangaroo: Round 2','2005-04-15','Platform, Racing, Adventure','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Play as Kao! The cutest and bravest kangaroo of all video games returns.\nExperience the joy of playing a classic 3D single-player platformer filled with various challenges, including fighting, racing and solving puzzles.\nBounce through 25 levels set in 5 unique, colorful worlds to rescue your animal friends captured by the evil Hunter and his henchmen!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vwj.jpg'),(1187,'Prison Boy The Adventure',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Help the boy Jake escape from a prison, which was considered a legend by the village where he lives with his mother, but it is very real.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9khu.jpg'),(1188,'Charade Maniacs','2018-08-09','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, iOS, PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Charade Maniacs is an otome visual novel full of romance, mystery, and adventure.\n\nIn the near future...\n\nSummer break was around the corner. Hiyori Sena, a sophomore in high school, was living a peaceful life. One day, as she was walking home with her childhood friend, a masked figure appeared before them. The two were abducted and taken to a strange world with two moons. When they awoke, they met nine others in the same predicament. In their confusion, the mysterious figure began to speak.\n\n\"Welcome to Arcadia!\" \"In this world, if you perform for us, your wildest dreams can come true!\"\n\nIn order to find their way home, the group was forced to work together and act in an assortment of scenes from a drama. They were also made aware that a traitor walked among them... What could be the motive of this traitor? And why are they all being forced to act?\n\nUnable to fully trust anyone, who\'s hand will she take in the end?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70tg.jpg'),(1189,'Taimumari 2',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','2D platformer, inspired by the best video games of the last century for people who are tired of metroidvanias. Someone has given the academy\'s students mysterious and dangerous powers, and Himari is about to find the truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46vp.jpg'),(1190,'Free Chess: Brutalist Set','2024-04-27','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','With a concrete aesthetic, these pieces would make any grown man cry once stood on.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1191,'Xump: The Final Run','2005-10-24','Puzzle','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Legacy Mobile Device, Dreamcast','XUMP is a puzzle game by Psilocybin Development. The game is simple but will keep you busy for hours, and thats a promise!\n\nThe game consists of a 20x12 playfield which is filled with various types of blocks. Your job is to make the blue blocks disappear from the playfield by stepping on them. There are five main types of block, each of which behave differently.\n\nThe first levels are for \'easy entertainment\'. At first the levels are small, then get bigger and harder at each stage. Even if you do not read the instructions here, you should be able to handle the game when you start at level 1. To make everything a bit more tricky keep track of the time, but don\'t panic.\n\nIf you solve a level without fault you will get a \'well done\'. This \'well done\' is worth one extra chance, otherwise you will just get a \'done\' without any bonus. A \'well done\' is the only possibility in this game to get an extra life.\n\nXump has participated in the 16 Days Coding Competition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c9q.jpg'),(1192,'Emaki','2012-06-12','Puzzle, Arcade','iOS','Marble popper mobile action-puzzle game designed for mobile devices. In this game, players embark on a challenging journey to assist a young artist in creating her magical masterpieces.\n\nThe objective of the game is to guide a carriage that can shoot and destroy incoming balls, which are imbued with magic paints. The player\'s task is to eliminate these balls before they reach a well and color the paintings they pass by.\n\nThis game offers a substantial amount of content, featuring a total of 25 levels within the adventure. Players can explore different game modes, collect jewels and power-ups, and strive to unlock various achievements. Success in \"Marble Popper\" requires precise aiming and strategic planning as players progress through increasingly challenging levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bue.jpg'),(1193,'Miko Monogatari!','2022-05-12','Visual Novel','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Miko Monogatari!\" is a medium-length novel game. You develop your character in the game. It was created in 2022 by \"R Man 44\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kyt.jpg'),(1194,'realMyst','2012-06-14','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Inviting you to explore a vast deserted island, Myst slowly reveals a haunting storyline involving a series of books that unlock alternate planes of reality. With only your wits as your guide, you must decode the hidden clues placed throughout the game\'s gorgeous 3D environments. Through text, video clips and tricky puzzles, you\'ll discover a world so real, you will be certain that it truly exists.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zb0.jpg'),(1195,'Automate It','2025-12-31','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Automate It is a factory building game that requires clever solutions to its size, power, and time constraints. Solve challenges, build and share your own levels, or open things up in sandbox mode. If you want to build it - Automate It.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92jj.jpg'),(1196,'Best of Merge Vol #2','2022-06-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yav.jpg'),(1197,'Dunamis 15','2012-07-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360','Dunamis 15 (デュナミス15 Dyunamisu 15?) is a suspense visual novel developed and published by 5pb. for the PlayStation 3 and Xbox 360. The game was released in Japan on September 15, 2011,[3] featuring five chapters and five main characters. A port for the PlayStation Portable was released on July 26, 2012.[4][5] The sequel title, Disorder 6, was released on August 22, 2013. This is the first title in Suspense-fiction Adventure series, a spinoff to famous Science Adventure series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53mw.jpg'),(1198,'Star Wars: Episode I - Battle for Naboo','2002-12-31','Shooter','Nintendo 64, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Attention defenders of Naboo! The Trade Federation must be stopped! Storm through more than 15 missions over land, sea and space as your freedom fighters rally against the droid armies. Take control of 7 vehicles: the Naboo starfighter, Gian speeder, and new craft like the heavy STAP, Trade Federation gunboat and more.\n\nMore than 15 missions: escape from Theed, search & destroy, sabotage, reconnaissance, convoy. Battle against Trade Federation droid starfighters, AATs, destroyer droids, battle droids.\nChange vehicles mid-mission through specially designated hangars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dy9.jpg'),(1199,'Rogue Monster Theolodorus','2025-03-10','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An entry for 7DRL Challenge 2025. A traditional roguelike (turn-based, grid-based, permadeath, no metaprogression) meets a deckbuilder cardbattler with win16 visuals and chip audio.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9izb.jpg'),(1200,'The Stone Cutter and the Mountain Spirit','2022-11-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When a poor stone cutter gets tired of his simple life, the Mountain Spirit make his wishes come true! A beautiful Interactive Fairy Tale about the Wills that move us and the Transformations we go through in our lives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ufa.jpg'),(1201,'Batman: Arkham Knight - Batman Inc. Skin','2015-06-16','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This addon introduces the Batman Inc. costume to Batman: Arkham Knight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ft0.jpg'),(1202,'Battlefield: Bad Company','2008-06-23','Shooter','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Set in the near future, the Battlefield: Bad Company single-player campaign drops gamers behind enemy lines as part of a squad of four soldiers - risking it all to go AWOL on a personal quest. Featuring a dramatic storyline flavoured with attitude, Battlefield: Bad Company leads gamers far from the traditional frontlines on a wild ride with a group of renegade soldiers who decide that sometimes the gratitude of a nation just isn’t enough.\n\nBattlefield: Bad Company is the first game built from the ground up for next-generation consoles using DICE’s bleeding-edge Frostbite game engine, delivering unrivalled graphics, effects and gameplay. Join Bad Company now.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xbe.jpg'),(1203,'The Typing of the Dead','2004-12-22','Shooter','Arcade, PC (Microsoft Windows), Dreamcast, PlayStation 2','The Typing of the Dead is an arcade game that was developed by WOW Entertainment and published by Sega for the NAOMI hardware. The game was released in Japanese arcades in 1999 and was ported to the Sega Dreamcast in 2001 by Smilebit. A Windows version was released in 2000 and a PlayStation 2 port followed in 2004.\nThe Typing of the Dead is a modification of Sega\'s 1998 light gun arcade game The House of the Dead 2 in which the gun is replaced by a computer keyboard. The player takes the role of a secret agent in a zombie-infested Venice and must quickly type letters, words and phrases in order to kill fast-advancing enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3tq7.jpg'),(1204,'Batman: Arkham Knight - Rocksteady Themed Batmobile Skin','2015-12-22','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','This addon includes Rocksteady themed skin for the Batmobile.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fxi.jpg'),(1205,'Super Monkey Ball: Banana Rumble - Dole Logo Sticker Ball','2025-01-08','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1206,'Batman Begins','2005-06-17','Sin género','Game Boy Advance','Game Boy Advance port of Batman Begins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xux.jpg'),(1207,'Watch Dogs 2: T-Bone Content Bundle','2016-12-22','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Get the style and the swagger of legendary hacker T-Bone Grady in the first Watch_Dogs 2 DLC bundle! Outfit Marcus with T-Bone\'s signature look, and plow a path of epic destruction through San Francisco in T-Bone\'s customized truck - specially equipped to lift and annihilate vehicles, enemies, and anything else in your way.\n\nBundle Includes;\n- T-Bone Truck available in the car-on-demand app\n- One complete T-Bone inspired outfit\n- New elite enemy class, armed with laser-guided grenade launchers\n- New co-op difficulty mode','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ec1.jpg'),(1208,'Crusader Kings III: Legends of the Dead','2024-03-04','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What good are grand accomplishments and heroic deeds if no one sings of them after you have gone? A royal legacy is only useful, after all, if it can provide cover and legitimacy for those who come after you. Live on in the memory of your subjects and rivals in Legends of the Dead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i6j.jpg'),(1209,'Five Nights at Candy\'s Remastered','2019-08-14','Point-and-click, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','No company is without a rival.\n\nFreddy Fazbear\'s New Pizzeria has closed for good. And so, another restaurant is going to take its place in the world of entertainment.\n\nWhat could go wrong?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v7s.jpg'),(1210,'Battlefield 1: Apocalypse','2018-02-20','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The fourth and final DLC for Battlefield 1, the Apocalypse DLC, is centered around some of the most brutal battles of the Great War.\nThe DLC was released on February 20, 2018, containing five maps, six guns, and a new game mode, among other additions. The three infantry-based maps of Apocalypse reflect three of the bloodiest battles of World War I; Caporetto set in present-day Slovenia, Passchendaele in Belgium, and River Somme in France. The DLC brought no new factions to the game, but introduced a new game mode titled \"Air Assault\" in the remaining two maps. These two maps, both only plane- and zeppelin-focused, are named \"Razor\'s Edge\" and \"London Calling.\" While both maps feature combat above detailed landscapes (Razor\'s Edge taking place in the Alps and London Calling occurring over the city of London), neither are based on factual battles. Apocalypse brought new weapons and gadgets to Battlefield 1 as well. The weapons released include the RSC SMG, Howell Automatic, lMG 08/18, Ross MkIII, M1917 Enfield, and Webley Revolver Mk VI. In addition, melee weapons including the Broken Bottle, Wine Bottle, Meat Cleaver, and Prybar were introduced to the game. DICE and the Battlefield team also added a number of other components to the game, including vehicles, gadgets for various infantry classes, and the stationary Livens Projector/Gaswurfminen, located on each of the three infantry-based maps. The DLC also features two new air vehicles, the Airco DH.10 and the Hansa-Brandenburg G.I.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3abd.jpg'),(1211,'The Sims 3: Expansion Bundle','2013-07-16','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In The Sims 3, you can create Sims with unique personalities, fulfill their desires, and control their lives within a customizable living neighborhood. Unlock all-new Karma Powers and unleash them on your Sims: help your Sim get lucky with the power of \"love connector\", bless them with the power of \"age defiler\" or \"instant beauty\" or curse them with an \"instant enemy\". Use these powers wisely, because they may have unexpected results! As you guide your Sims through life, you can complete challenges to unlock additional items, new buildings and landmarks. The Sims 3: Expansion Bundle includes a copy of the base game The Sims 3, as well as two expansion packs: World Adventures and Generations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hh7.jpg'),(1212,'Links Puzzle','2024-01-03','Puzzle, Strategy, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The goal is to move every tile (whose moves are determined by its links with another tiles) until create the pattern suggested.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nh2.jpg'),(1213,'Tennis no Ouji-sama: Doki-doki Survival Sanroku no Mystic','2006-12-21','Sport, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','Tennis no Ouji-sama: DokiDoki Survival - Sanroku no Mystic is an Adventure game, developed by WinkySoft and published by Konami, which was released in Japan in 2006.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4w48.jpg'),(1214,'Five Nights to Remember','2024-03-25','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s been three years since the tragedy. The newly established Fazbear Ent. has attempted to turn the public perception of the once-beloved Fredbear\'s Family Diner around with a hit show and a new line of animatronics, and they want you to join the Fazbear family as a night watchman.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xjf.jpg'),(1215,'Survive la France','2023-10-27','Puzzle, Adventure, Visual Novel','Web browser','A browser text-game in which you travel from city to city and try to manage your food, water and sleep in order to survive until you find a suitable city in France or the USA.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7abo.jpg'),(1216,'Exit Together','2025-12-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Exit Together is a 1-6 player co-op or single-player anomaly loop adventure game. Find anomalies, solve puzzles, and avoid traps. Set in a retro 1960s office atmosphere, observe your surroundings carefully to reach the next room. Will you reach Room 9 and exit, or remain trapped forever in the loop?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9grc.jpg'),(1217,'Rinbo','2024-07-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on an epic adventure of gliding and battling through mystical lands in RINBO, where discovery awaits at every turn!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lau.jpg'),(1218,'Super Monkey Ball: Banana Rumble','2024-06-25','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Join AiAi and friends in Super Monkey Ball Banana Rumble, where you and up to 16 players can compete online across multiple game modes as you aim to become Top Banana! You can also work together with your favorite bunch in 4 player cooperative mode, or slip into a wonderfully crafted story in the all-new Adventure Mode experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lf3.jpg'),(1219,'Sister Location 8-bit','2016-10-06','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An 8-bit game with 3 robot animatronics based in sister location.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8101.jpg'),(1220,'Monster Jam Showdown: Yeti','2025-01-09','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1221,'Mass Effect: Polish Collector\'s Edition','2007-11-23','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Collector\'s Edition for the PC version of the game was sold exclusively in Poland and it featured the following content:\n\n- A black cardboard box with a print depicting a planet on the bottom half of the box, as well as the Mass Effect logo and the words \"Edycji Kolekcjonerskiej\" (Collector\'s Edition in Polish).\n- A DVD box housing the English and Polish copies of the game, and a bonus DVD (possibly the same found in the Xbox 360 Limited Collector\'s Edition).\n- A N7 t-shirt.\n- An art book (possibly the same found in the Xbox 360 Limited Collector\'s Edition).\n- A guide to the game in Polish.\n- A mouse pad featuring the Normandy.\n- Three postcards.\n- A 2 GB USB flash drive with the Mass Effect logo printed on it.\n- A blue lanyard with the Mass Effect logo repeated all over its length.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bxj.jpg'),(1222,'Lexibook Batman Compact Cyber Arcade Portable Console','2024-03-06','Arcade','Handheld Electronic LCD','Introducing the Lexibook Batman Compact Cyber Arcade Portable Console, your gateway to a world of endless entertainment! With 150 exhilarating games at your fingertips, including 10 action-packed Batman adventures and 140 classic favorites spanning sports, logic, adventure, platforms, and more, this pocket-sized powerhouse guarantees hours of non-stop fun for everyone. Hunt menacing monsters, escape perilous zones, score incredible goals, and race to victory in wild competitions, all on the vibrant 2.5\" LCD color screen that brings every game to life with stunning visuals. Our portable console isn\'t just about gaming; it\'s a complete sensory experience. Immerse yourself in the Batman universe with its captivating design, celebrating the Dark Knight and enhancing every gaming session. The built-in speaker and volume control allow you to enjoy the immersive soundscapes without disturbance, making this console the ultimate gaming companion for on-the-go adventures. The Lexibook Batman Compact Cyber Arcade Portable Console isn\'t just a gaming device; it\'s a statement. Perfectly sized to accompany you wherever you roam, it fits effortlessly in your pocket or bag, ensuring that the excitement is always within reach. Whether you\'re a seasoned gamer or a casual player, this console offers something for everyone, from adrenaline-pumping action to brain-teasing challenges. Experience the future of gaming with this battery-operated wonder, and elevate your leisure time to a whole new level. With Lexibook Compact Cyber Arcade Portable Console, you\'re not just buying a toy; you\'re investing in unforgettable memories and endless entertainment. Don\'t miss your chance to own this unique piece of gaming history—grab yours now and embark on an epic adventure that will leave you craving for more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8amt.jpg'),(1223,'Kill Barney in Tokyo','1997-12-31','Sin género','ColecoVision','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95sk.jpg'),(1224,'Five Nights at Treasure Island: Anniversary Edition','2020-12-23','Point-and-click, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','For 6 years, Photo-Negative Mickey and his friends have terrified audiences across the internet. For one last time, you can experience that terror.\n\nOn December 1, 2014, Anart1996 would announce his FNaF fangame... \"Five Nights at Treasure Island.\"\n\nFNaTI would go on to pioneer the fangame scene and change the way we see Mickey Mouse and the Disney Corporation.\n\nFor the game\'s (late) birthday, the Radiance Team has decided to release a special version of FNaTI to commemorate the game. Enjoy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co662c.jpg'),(1225,'Gel-Tank','2021-04-28','Shooter, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Casual but profound! Simple, authentic 16-bit 2D style that will satisfy everyone from beginners to experts The action shooter is here! Dive into the soft and hard world of the ultimate 16-bit world, down to the resolution! Ugh!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oxx.jpg'),(1226,'The Way It Rains on Animals','2021-09-01','Sin género','Web browser','A short game that takes place in a pet cemetery. Get some umbrellas before it rains!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fuz.jpg'),(1227,'Fairy Tail 2: Outfit Set - Swimsuit',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1228,'Sector Strike','2012-11-09','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Windows Phone, Android, iOS','A futuristic shoot \'em up designed to challenge your reflexes and wits. Sector Strike combines the mechanics of old school space shooters and the aesthetics of modern 3D games. Great for fans of bullet hell games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w4d.jpg'),(1229,'Horizon Zero Dawn Remastered','2024-10-31','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Experience the critically acclaimed Horizon Zero Dawn with stunning new visuals and upgraded features. In a far future where colossal machines roam the Earth, pockets of humanity survive in unique tribes among the lush, overgrown ruins of our long-lost civilization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90ti.jpg'),(1230,'In Sound Mind: Deluxe Edition','2021-09-28','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','In Sound Mind is an imaginative first-person psychological horror with frenetic puzzles, unique boss fights, and original music. Journey within the inner workings of the one place you can’t seem to escape - your own mind. The Deluxe Edition also includes the full game, digital art book, and digital soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ytm.jpg'),(1231,'The Loveland Frog','2019-04-15','Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Myth, or A Legend?\n\nOnce a media cycle, the Loveland Frog cryptid makes their appearance to a select few. Though they may be three feet tall, an unusual size for a frog, they are truly a friendly character. However, people find the Frog menacing, and do not understand them. They run away from the Frog, and occasionally attempt to attack them in misguided fear...\n\nIt has been three years since the Loveland Frog was last seen, and tonight they have decided to shake things up. They wish to go for a stroll across a busy highway, where many people will be able to see that they really exist. However, due to their isolation from human culture, they do not understand \"vehicles\", and so do not know the danger they represent...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95on.jpg'),(1232,'Toziuha Night: Dracula\'s Revenge','2022-03-21','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Follow the story of Xandria, the iron alchemist. Seeking revenge, she accepts the dangerous mission to put an end to the evil that resides in Dracula\'s castle and torments the people of Transylvania. Fight with an iron whip in this retro-style & Classic-Vania adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nmd.jpg'),(1233,'Portal Touch','2019-03-04','Puzzle','Android','Portal Touch is a logical physics puzzle where you can create portals and use different mechanics to get the star cube to the finish. Sounds easy? Well, give it a try and you\'ll see. \n \nTry to complete individual levels as quickly as possible and with few as possible portals. Can your brain think logically enough to complete all the levels and earn all the stars? \n \nFeatures: \n \n◆ Realistic physics \n◆ Cubes \n◆ Portals \n◆ Mechanics that change the behavior of the environment \n◆ 20 levels with more to come \n \nMechanics: \n \n◆ Red bases that change the behavior of mechanics and the environment \n◆ Projectiles that change the behavior of the environment \n◆ Energy balls \n◆ Object destroyers \n◆ Bouncy walls \n◆ Light bridges \n \nSoon to come: \n \n◆ Lasers \n◆ Excursion beams \n◆ Gravity alteration \n◆ and more \n \nHave fun and enjoy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jl2.jpg'),(1234,'Five Nights at Candy\'s 3','2017-03-05','Point-and-click, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"I\'ve always liked it when it rains...\nthe rain makes the silence go away,\nit feels comfy and relaxing.\nI don\'t like the silence\nthe silence means they\'re hiding\nif they\'re hiding, they\'re coming closer\nand if they come closer\nthey\'ll hurt me, for what I did- didn\'t do...\nfor what I couldn\'t do\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62px.jpg'),(1235,'Star Wars: Outpost',NULL,'Simulator','Web browser, Android, iOS','Star Wars: Outpost is a canceled Star Wars game from LucasArts. It was a Star Wars version of FarmVille, allowing players to build empires. It had already gone through Q&A testing before being canceled. \n \nThe game had been planned for release on browsers and mobile platforms. Despite its similarities to FarmVille, the game included some \"very hardcore\" elements such as the ability to betray other players for resources and strategy-based gameplay inspired by titles such as Settlers of Catan and EVE Online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pvfqdvjvplypr3a0y6bh.jpg'),(1236,'Assassin\'s Creed Revelations - Signature Edition','2011-11-15','Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The pre-order version available at North American Gamestop locations.\n\nThe Signature Edition of the game includes:\n• A bonus singleplayer gameplay mission (Vlad the Impaler\'s Tomb)\n• An exclusive multiplayer character (Ottoman Jester)\n• Weapons capacity upgrades (Crossbow, bomb, and gun)\n• An animated short film based on the \"Assassin\'s Creed\" universe (Assassin\'s Creed Embers)\n• An \"Assassin\'s Creed Revelations\" original game score soundtrack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8his.jpg'),(1237,'Sonokuni','2025-03-24','Tactical, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Sonokuni is a hardcore high-speed action game. In a world of bio-science fiction and Japanese mythology, manipulate time and space to protect your dying country from the forces of a superpower. This experience is truly HIPHOP as you continue to struggle for a solution other than violence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5m3j.jpg'),(1238,'Dungeon Defenders: Quest for the Lost Eternia Shards Part 4',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','New Campaign missions, bosses, costumes, weapons, pets and challenges in the epic conclusion to the Quest for the Lost Eternia Shards.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1239,'Chica\'s Party World: Rebaked','2023-11-06','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chica\'s Party World: REBAKED is the official reboot / re-imagining of the original game from 2018 by PoisonousPastels and BonBun_Studios. The game sees you playing as a security robot designated with the task of watching over the building and running basic maintenance tasks until proper renovations begin. However (obviously) things aren\'t quite what they seem at first.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zxr.jpg'),(1240,'Gothic Classic','2023-09-28','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','For the first time, relive this amazing RPG on a handheld console and enjoy the game that revolutionized roleplaying games on the go. Dive into dark times and adventures with great performance and a well adapted UI and controls.\n\nWar has been waged across the kingdom of Myrtana. Orcish hordes invaded human territory and the king of the land needed a lot of ore to forge enough weapons, should his army stand against this threat. Whoever breaks the law in these darkest of times is sentenced to serve in the giant penal colony of Khorinis, mining the so much needed ore. You are thrown through the barrier into this prison colony. With your back against the wall, you have to survive and form volatile alliances until you can finally escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wt0.jpg'),(1241,'Vanguard','1981-10-01','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade, Atari 2600, Atari 5200','Vanguard is a shoot \'em up game which leads the player through five different zones to the City of Mystery where the creature Gond awaits him which he has to kill. The five zones run horizontally as well as vertically and are filled with different enemies for each zone. Being hit by an enemy, a projectile or the walls results in losing a life. There are, however, collectable items which grant the player a short time of invincibility.\nShooting differs somewhat from other shoot \'em ups: The player\'s ship is able to fire in all four directions depending on the direction the player steers his ship. However, in doing so, the ship flies in that direrction as well which may result in crashing into an obstacle. The ship is constantly running out of fuel which can be replenished by killing enemies. After defeating Gond the game starts anew on a higher difficulty level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qau.jpg'),(1242,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization: Beyond Earth','2014-10-24','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sid Meier\'s Civilization: Beyond Earth is a new science-fiction-themed entry into the award-winning Civilization series. Set in the future, global events have destabilized the world leading to a collapse of modern society, a new world order and an uncertain future for humanity. As the human race struggles to recover, the re-developed nations focus their resources on deep space travel to chart a new beginning for mankind.\n\nAs part of an expedition sent to find a home beyond Earth, you will write the next chapter for humanity as you lead your people into a new frontier and create a new civilization in space. Explore and colonize an alien planet, research new technologies, amass mighty armies, build incredible Wonders and shape the face of your new world. As you embark on your journey you must make critical decisions. From your choice of sponsor and the make-up of your colony, to the ultimate path you choose for your civilization, every decision opens up new possibilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1sr0.jpg'),(1243,'Crash Time II','2008-11-27','Racing, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Solve exciting criminal cases on the mean streets as member of the autobahn police force - or freely explore the open game world while chasing down high-octane racers. Escort politicians, transport precious goods or take down the criminal element with over 500HP and close to 200MPH. With fully destructible cars, arcade gameplay, outstanding graphics and stunning slow-mo effects, Crash Time 2 puts you right in the driver seat, ready to burn rubber.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j7p.jpg'),(1244,'Five Nights with Mac Tonight',NULL,'Point-and-click','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Five Nights with Mac Tonight is a fan-made Five Nights at Freddy\'s game made by Photo Negative Mickey, Lampz and ThatOneWankEngine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79yy.jpg'),(1245,'Mobius Evolution','2015-10-27','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Mobius Evolution is a heavy modification of Sonic the Hedgehog for the Sega Mega Drive created by Abyssal Leopard with the help of fellow members. The aim of this hack was initially to be a simple level layout hack, but it eventually acquired new features, such as innovative gimmicks, boss battles and other things the player might discover in gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qjd.jpg'),(1246,'Toki no Senshi: Chrono Soldier','1987-06-06','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','The mid-eighties saw the inception of a genre known as run-and-guns, which were popularized by the likes of Capcom\'s Commando and SNK\'s Ikari Warriors. At their base, these games were akin to shoot-em-ups, except they didn\'t take place in airplanes or starcrafts as was the norm of the time. Most of them did not scroll automatically and allowed the player a bit more breathing room hence, but they still pressured players with lots of bullets and aggressive enemies. Most big companies offered at least one top-down on-foot shooter, Sega naturally included. Their best-known contribution to that front in the eighties was Alien Syndrome, their tribute to the Alien series which involves two soldiers destroying frightening xenomorphs on derelict vessels. It was different from other Commando-likes in that you could move in any direction around the map and didn\'t just keep going up like most other such games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pjzvf2yfl4b3vqgqlqkv.jpg'),(1247,'Assassin\'s Creed Valhalla: A Fated Encounter','2021-12-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','A Fated Encounter was a virtual representation of one of Eivor Varinsdottir\'s genetic memories, relived by Layla Hassan in 2020 through the Portable Animus HR-8.5. It was added via Title Update 1.4.1.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vrs.jpg'),(1248,'Bug: Beetles Underground','2021-08-02','Puzzle, Racing, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bug: Beetles Underground is an open-world adventure game created in nine days for Game Jaaj 6, where you live in the life cycle of beetles known as true dung beetles - walk, roll, climb, fly, do quests, race, and upgrade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ong.jpg'),(1249,'Pet & Dog Simulator','2025-03-27','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Feed and grow your pet','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iae.jpg'),(1250,'Gamer Life','2019-10-11','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','meet jerry and on his adventure to become an epic gamer. go and use waldows. go to the gamer store to play demos from paralue','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v87.jpg'),(1251,'Insane Skulls','2020-08-31','Indie','Arduboy','Long ago, the Greeks and Romans would play a game called, \"Astragalus,\" which evolved into what Americans call, \"Jacks.\" There have been several variations of this game over time, but it started out being played with small, dried animal bones. In the 90\'s, there was a major Crazy Bones crazy, a game based off of astragalus with plastic figurines with weird and odd shapes, sizes, and faces.\n\nInsane Skulls is based off of games like Astragalus and Crazy Bones, where a player picks a team of 4 characters (or skulls), all with different stats and properties. Players take turns flicking their skulls at the opposing skulls, carefully aiming, giving a nice amount of upward or forward force, in hopes of knocking the other player\'s skulls over.\n\nInsane Skulls has 16 different characters, including guest characters like Circuit Dude and Dusty Argile, and supports either a single player mode against the CPU or head-to-head mode against another human.\n\nSee how many times you can beat the CPU in a row with the team you make to beat the high score!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6t6i.jpg'),(1252,'Mass Effect 2: Zaeed - The Price of Revenge','2011-01-18','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Zaeed - The Price of Revenge is a DLC pack for Mass Effect 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kxl.jpg'),(1253,'Legends of Dawn Reborn','2015-10-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Legends of Dawn Reborn invites players to the brutal northerly reaches of Narr. Survival depends on your magic, your sword, and your wits.\nLegends of Dawn Reborn takes place in a world of Narr and events take place before those from Wave of Darkness released on Steam Early Access in June.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21bi.jpg'),(1254,'Sudoku Zenkai','2022-01-13','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Sudoku Zenkai is a game for everyone, from beginning to advanced players. It brings a new dimension to sudoku - you can solve puzzles with your friends, wherever they are! You can start a new puzzle with a friend, or call one over to help when you get stuck.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co276d.jpg'),(1255,'Erenshor','2025-04-14','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Erenshor is a single player nod to the MMORPGs of the past. Created specifically for the nostalgic gamer who no longer wants to commit to online or scheduled play times, it offers unrestricted exploration, strategic battles, and countless weapons, armors, and spells to discover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hb6.jpg'),(1256,'Resin','2016-11-11','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Resin is a tough as nails 2D action-adventure with heavy emphasis on fighting. It has regressive leveling system, which means that every time you win a boss fight your character will become weaker, forcing you to adapt to new play styles and try out new strategies. It features a branching open world, multiple endings and bosses with different mechanics.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q67.jpg'),(1257,'Spelldrifter','2019-09-14','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Introducing Spelldrifter, a hybrid tactical role playing game and deck building game that features the best parts of both!\n\nSpelldrifter combines the puzzle-like positional tactics of a turn-based RPG battle with the deep customizability and replayability of a collectible card game. The result: a hybrid, wherein players must juggle the resources at their disposal using both time and space.\n\nWith Spelldrifter\'s innovative Tick System, players are challenged to think of card game strategy in a new light. With each character action, the turns interweave on a single timeline. With mastery of the timeline, players gain great advantage in battle and earn the satisfaction of decisive victory.\n\nSelect your party of heroes, build your decks, and embark on an adventure deep into Starfall as you search for the entrance to the mysterious Labyrinth!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4g6u.jpg'),(1258,'Shadows of Glory',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shadows of Glory is a free-to-play online roman gladiator combat multiplayer game for PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ieb.jpg'),(1259,'Nightmares Before Disney','2022-11-22','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a land where all your dreams come true, does the same apply to nightmares?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6aef.jpg'),(1260,'Furniture Service','2020-10-18','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It was 15 years ago that all the people disappeared from a street within a year. Meanwhile, the houses are dilapidated and should be demolished. Only a few pieces of furniture are left. A mover will remove them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oqe.jpg'),(1261,'Batman: Revenge of the Joker','1992-04-06','Sin género','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Precious metals are mysteriously missing from Gotham City mines. One of these metals has a highly toxic composition which is used to build explosives for missiles. Gotham City police have exhausted their resources and frantically call to Batman for help. He knows this scheme can only be the insane working of one criminal mastermind... The Joker seeks revenge! Batman must follow the trail leading to the location of the Joker\'s secret hideaway before it\'s too late. It won\'t be easy though. The Caped Crusader must use his new arsenal of weapons to foil The Joker\'s evil henchmen and rely on his acrobatic strength to overcome the obstacles that block his way. Gotham City is relying on you to stop the revenge of The Joker!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yv3.jpg'),(1262,'Pwnk','2022-01-24','Racing, Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pwnk has a wide variety of community games to engage your live audiences and grow your stream. Create your live game show using Pwnk\'s mini-game battle royale! Your audiences will be able to play with you in real-time, create funny content, and even help you battle against other streamers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4eaw.jpg'),(1263,'QV','2021-03-18','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Start a dimension-jumping adventure with Quby! In a universe, dimensions are connected to each other. In the center of the passages lies Dimensional Core, keeping the balance between dimensions.\n\nThis balance began to collapse when the Core stopped working. Unless someone gives a helping hand, soon the universe will follow. The Gate doesn\'t let anyone into the Dimensional Core. But Quby, as the last descendant of Chosen Ones, can access the Gate. To restore the balance between dimensions, Quby opens a portal to the Gate.\n\nWith Varon, the talking penguin, she must explore the long-forgotten ruins of her ancestors and find a way to reactivate the Core.\nLet the journey begin!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2leo.jpg'),(1264,'Train Sim World 4: London Overground Suffragette line: Gospel Oak - Barking Riverside Route Add-On','2024-03-19','Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','An Aventra Adventure awaits in Train Sim World 4! Discover North & East London boroughs aboard modern traction, traversing a newly electrified and extended line fit for future service. Become something of a driver yourself on Gospel Oak - Barking Riverside!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91x3.jpg'),(1265,'Nezha Legend','2025-03-18','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is an action shooting game. There will be 50 people on the game battlefield, including the player, but only one person can win in the end. The last remaining person can receive generous rewards. All in all, this game allows players to experience the thrilling atmosphere of the battlefield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9htx.jpg'),(1266,'New Super Abandoned: Discovery Island','2021-05-01','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','New Super A:DI VI.0 DX: Director\'s Cut DELUXE: Five Nights at Treasure Island: Found 2021 Revision 3 feat. Dante from the Devil May Cry series Final Mix Redux with New Funky Mode - A Fragmentary Passage and Knuckles Remastered (otherwise simply known as New Super Abandoned: Discovery Island) is a semi-serious self-parodying April Fools\' update to Abandoned: Discovery Island. Taking place in a separate continuity, the game features a mixture of improvements and additions, as well as joke additions and changes. This version is planned to receive updates as well as the DLC feature that were intended to be added to R1 and the original game, though it is not planned to entirely replace it at the moment nor will it be the game\'s last iteration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ad9.jpg'),(1267,'Major DS: Dream Baseball',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1268,'Mr. President','2025-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Can you face the challenges of the Oval Office? Find out in Mr. President, a sandbox simulation of the U.S. presidency. Pursue your legislative agenda. Compete with rivals Russia and China. Deal with crises from 9/11 to COVID-19; and direct the U.S. military against terror groups and rogue states.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f7k.jpg'),(1269,'Spaceship vs. Bricks',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1270,'ALTF4','2021-02-19','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ALTF4 is a 3rd person permadeath runner game where you play a clumsy knight who needs to overcome multiple traps in order to reach his goal. But the way to his destination won\'t be simple. There are no saves in this game, traps are constantly trying to kill you and character movements are filled with challenges. Do you have what it takes to clear the game in one go?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48gq.jpg'),(1271,'Ise & Kai: Chosen Throne',NULL,'Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','How do you fulfill fate if it’s recorded wrong? Ise & Kai: Chosen Throne is an otome with an interesting take on the isekai genre, where you forge the destiny of the realm and fight to escape a predestined fate. Play as Seina Kaimana, a descendant of the realm\'s goddess, as she discovers there’s more to her prophesied fate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lla.jpg'),(1272,'Dysmantle: Underworld','2022-08-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Answer to the Call of Mana and embark on a new adventure into a world beyond. Unlock new powerful abilities that will also help you on your journey on the main island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dyi.jpg'),(1273,'The Batman: Strength in Numbers',NULL,'Sin género','Leapster','The Batman: Strength in Numbers is a game for the Leapster','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ovi9dfornkn80yfconsp.jpg'),(1274,'Homerun: Spin-Off Forever',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1275,'Marvel Super Heroes','1997-10-02','Fighting, Arcade','Arcade, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Marvel Super Heroes is a 2D fighting game and the second Capcom title to feature characters from the Marvel comic universe. Each character starts with a set of gems. These can be activated during a fight to improve speed, power and defence, or provide special abilities to create crushing stone walls, open up a rift in space, or reverse the opponent\'s controls. The use of the gems is inspired by the The Infinity Gauntlet comic book series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fhd.jpg'),(1276,'Hello Kitty World','2012-04-09','Simulator','Android, iOS','Hello Kitty World is a real-time theme park simulation game created and developed by Sanrio (Nifty/Sanrio Wave Inc. ). Hello Kitty World was released on April 9, 2012 and is available to play on smart phones and iPad.\n\nIn Hello Kitty World, players can attempt to develop and create their own Sanrio Amusement Parks. Players are then able to expand their businesses and grow their theme park from the ground up, through a series of goals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f2n.jpg'),(1277,'Tails in Sonic the Hedgehog','2008-10-10','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Tails in Sonic 1 is a hack of Sonic the Hedgehog for the Sega Mega Drive/Genesis originally created by drx which featured Tails as a playable character instead of Sonic. Tails can fly, spindash and swim in the same way that he can in Sonic 3.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sbo.jpg'),(1278,'Dear Magi: Mahou Shounen Gakka','2019-06-06','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Nintendo Switch','Remake of the original mobile game with reworked plot and mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69s8.jpg'),(1279,'DJ Hero','2009-10-27','Music','PlayStation 3, Wii, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','DJ Hero primarily simulates turntablism, a musical style used by disc jockeys to create a new mashup song by incorporating one or more previously recorded songs played on record players along with sound effect generators. The game features score attack gameplay similar to the Guitar Hero games. The controller consists of a wireless deck consisting of a movable turntable that supports 3 \"stream\" buttons, an effects dial, a crossfader, and a \"Euphoria\" button; a hidden panel contains additional controller buttons to interact with the gaming console outside of the game. A portion of the controller can be detached and reattached to adapt the unit for left-handed players. Notes travel in an arc across a spinning record on screen, and the player holds down one of the 3 stream buttons to play notes; two buttons reflect the two songs used in that particular mix, and the third represents samples to add to the mix which can be adjusted with the effects dial. The player must also constantly adjust the crossfader to match onscreen symbols, which alters the relative volume of the songs as to bring one song to the forefront of the mix for a short time. Certain tracks are shown on screen as a series of up or down arrow, representing scratching sections, requiring the player to turn the turntable in the direction of the arrows while holding down the button to score points, mimicking the scratching of the record needle on vinyl albums. \"Euphoria\" is equivalent to Guitar Hero\'s Star Power, collected by successfully completing specific phrases in the song mix, called Perfect Regions, and can be released by pressing the Euphoria button, doubling the player\'s current multiplier as well as automatic crossfading when active. There is also a \"Rewind\" meter that builds through consistent successful playing, and once full, allows the player to rewind the song to fix errors in their performance. The player must continue to perform well or their performance meter will drop and the music track will cut out. Failing the song is not possible, unlike in Guitar Hero games.\n\nA single player career mode is available, as well both competitive and cooperative multiplayer modes (\"DJ vs DJ\"), playable locally or remotely. Ten songs have been specially mixed to also support gameplay with Guitar Hero and other compatible guitar controllers in a \"DJ vs Guitar\" mode. Players can also use a microphone for a non-scoring addition to the mix. A Party Play mode allows the game to automatically play the songs with the ability for a player to jump in and play at any time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ri1.jpg'),(1280,'Hyper Panda','2025-02-21','Platform','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','An exciting adventure in the classic style of old platform games. Face this adventure with a Panda who needs to reclaim his forest, challenging enemies and many obstacles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fwa.jpg'),(1281,'Satiszone','2024-11-26','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fhd.jpg'),(1282,'Discolored Bundle','2025-02-13','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1283,'Space Hulk: Ascension','2014-10-03','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Space Hulk: Ascension is a 3D, digital, turn based, strategy game, which re-interprets the classic board game experience, and adds new RPG style mechanics, new weapons and missions, new enemy types, 3 playable chapters and loads of other new features to the single player experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e46.jpg'),(1284,'Peria Chronicles',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','An ambitious anime-styled sandbox MMORPG from veteran Korean developer Nexon, with an emphasis on user-generated content. Players can not only craft towns, but also entire quest-lines where the quest-builder wins if the questers fail and vice versa.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sxpeoj4nufipjxkkis9f.jpg'),(1285,'Schrott',NULL,'Racing, Indie, Arcade','Sin plataforma','SCHROTT - the roguelite driving game: Pull off insane stunts, collect valuable loot, and customize your absurd vehicle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yyl.jpg'),(1286,'Gamebesh','2023-11-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gamebesh features two classes - Hiders and Hunters. Hiders can transform into various objects (like chairs, TVs, and more) while Hunters hunt for them. Both classes receive a special ability each round.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dgp.jpg'),(1287,'Pro Yakyuu Family Stadium','2008-05-01','Sport','Wii','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bc6.jpg'),(1288,'Fishing: North Atlantic','2021-06-30','Simulator, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Commercial fishing in the North Atlantic! Discover the majestic world of Canadian Nova Scotia while admiring the vast diversity of ocean life. Search for the ocean’s gold with upgradable fishing boats and various types of fishing gear as you progress in your career.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i8s.jpg'),(1289,'JaJaMaru Ninpouchou','1989-03-28','Role-playing (RPG)','Family Computer','\"JaJaMaru Ninpouchou\" is a ninja themed role-playing game. Play as Jajamaru and Princess Sakura as you explore around a world map visiting towns and dungeons. Fight against random encounters using the separate turn-based combat screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87nl.jpg'),(1290,'The Parallel Worlds','2008-06-18','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A huge and highly detailed base map with a unique twist - it is actually three levels in one, to be played in succession. Each exit leads to a different version of the same map with modified layouts/routes and monster placement.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77s1.jpg'),(1291,'Colorama Cubes','2024-08-02','Puzzle','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j5i.jpg'),(1292,'Theme Park Jam','2024-09-28','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Match 3 and ride the roller coaster','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x35.jpg'),(1293,'2 Expensive 2 Break','2018-03-20','Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','2 Expensive 2 Break - that name pretty much stands for itself. You are asked to control a wrecking ball - a very springy one - and break as much as possible in a given amount of time. Who cares about whose house was it anyway?\nIf you like simple, yet entertaining games, this one is just for you!\n\nFeatures:\nA very nice desert stylization\nA springy wrecking ball\nLots of house pieces\nExplosive barrels, which explode all right\nThis game already is a lot of fun, but we still plan to continue. So - stay tuned for more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bfam4ztzndlrwxrqbvxc.jpg'),(1294,'X Rebirth: VR Edition','2017-07-27','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','X Rebirth VR Edition is tailored to be an immersive VR experience, based on X Rebirth: Home of Light. TRADE, FIGHT, BUILD, THINK in the X Universe - the biggest sandbox this side of the galaxy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co273d.jpg'),(1295,'Jolly 3: Chapter 1','2017-12-25','Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Thirty-two years after the incident has happened, an indie entertainment company sets out on a mission to revive the unsolved mysteries of Freddy Fazbear\'s Pizza! This Halloween, they will open a horror attraction called \"Fazbear\'s Fright\" featuring ancient and original artifacts which made childhood memories who should never be spoken about again.\n\nThis time, they set out location to location to find more items to put in their attraction. Their first target would be in an abandoned factory where Jolly Entertainment used to be in! Conspiracy theorists nationwide are more than hyped! And hopes to find clues that will solve the mysteries once and for all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ncb.jpg'),(1296,'Zork III: The Dungeon Master','1986-12-31','Adventure','PDP-11, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, TRS-80 Color Computer, Atari ST/STE, Commodore 16, Mac, DOS, Tatung Einstein, Amiga, Apple II, TRS-80, Amstrad CPC, Commodore Plus/4, Amstrad PCW','In the third game of the adventure game series Zork, you are once again a nameless adventurer, only this time you won\'t travel through a beautiful magical land, but are immediately cast into a deep dungeon. Like in a dream, you hear a mysterious voice telling you that you have passed all the tests but one. When conscience returns to you, you find yourself on the endless spiral of stairs, with only your trusty lantern near you... will you be able to survive the horrors of the Dungeon?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zgd.jpg'),(1297,'Galencia','2018-07-17','Shooter','Commodore C64/128/MAX, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Galencia is a fixed-screen shooter released on the Commodore 64 in 2017.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28o8.jpg'),(1298,'Death Flash','2018-05-07','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game takes you to the boots of a lonesome guy who\'s suffering grandma needed an expensive operation. You being broke, took the graveyard shift of Cathiso Inc. where they handle and observe creatures also known as ULBs (Unidentified Living Beings). \n \nThe rest is for you to discover. \n \nBe careful, this game plays with you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/kxzwogsuxtptuthsdax7.jpg'),(1299,'Chou Aniki: Kyuukyoku Muteki Ginga Saikyou Otoko','2009-03-11','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 3, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Chou Aniki: Kyuukyoku Muteki Ginga Saikyou Otoko was released for the PlayStation the same year as the previous two titles. This game features digitized sprites instead of the hand-drawn anime-style art from the other titles. It was released for the Sega Saturn three months later and the PlayStation Network in Japan in 2009. The subtitle of this game loosely translates to \"The Ultimate, Most Strongest Man in the Milky Way\" or \"The Ultimate, Invincible, Most Galactically Powerful Man.\" The game is based on the engine of the first Cho Aniki. Idaten and Benten are again the main two characters. The game is often derided as having the worst play mechanics in the series. Even some of the most fervent fans of Cho Aniki claim that the campy fun is inhibited by poor control and impossible difficulty. Koji Hayama returned to score a few songs for the soundtrack, along with Don McCow, Taku Iwasaki and Sanae Kasahara.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60cb.jpg'),(1300,'Arachnophobia',NULL,'Simulator, Arcade','DOS, Amiga','Arachnophobia is a video game based on the film Arachnophobia. It was developed by BlueSky Software and Disney Software for the MS-DOS, Commodore 64, Amstrad CPC, and Amiga platforms.\n\nThe player assumes the role of Delbert McClintock, a bug-exterminator and character from the original film, fighting to save the USA from a horde of invading killer spiders. Delbert must go through houses in eight towns, killing spiders in each one. If Delbert succeeds in finishing all eight towns, the United Nations declares that the spider must become extinct, and commissions McClintock to work with Dr. Atherton to go to South America, home of the spiders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21ii.jpg'),(1301,'Five Nights at Candy\'s','2015-07-18','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','No company is without a rival.\n\nFreddy Fazbear\'s New Pizzeria has closed for good. And so, another restaurant is going to take its place in the world of entertainment.\n\nWhat could go wrong?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73kc.jpg'),(1302,'Reign of Guilds: Commoner','2024-09-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Continue your journey throughout Dwarrhan with more possibilities!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8urn.jpg'),(1303,'Super Pipeline','1984-03-01','Platform, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX','This is an action game created by Taskset. Your job in this game is to keep a pipeline flowing with water. This pipeline will be disrupted by a falling plug from above this line. Your workman assisting you to repair the possible plugs caused. Critters are around the pipeline and will kill you if they touch you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hy7iclpumnqbpdymxrdi.jpg'),(1304,'Crazy Hit',NULL,'Sin género','PlayStation','Crazy Hit is a game produced by U.F.O. Soft that was released together with Crazy Hit 2 (known as the Playstation Pokémon for using unlicensed art from the franchise) and a special controller to play both.\n\nIt is currently not possible to find the game or recordings of it available, so the only image of it available is the one on the back of the set\'s box. From the box art and the description on it (in addition to the use of the controller), it is possible to deduce that it shares the same gameplay as Crazy Hit 2 (a whack-a-mole like game), but without the use of Pokémon.\n\nIn Crazy Hit 2 it is possible to see on the initial screen that the game was made by Poho and Majorros, however without the file for this game, it is uncertain to say that this game was also produced by both developers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bqh.jpg'),(1305,'Tokyo Cooking: Cherry Blossom Set','2024-05-17','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1306,'Yoiyami Biscuit','2024-07-07','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fdw.jpg'),(1307,'Rento Fortune VR','2018-11-20','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rento Fortune is online VR multiplayer business board game. Between 2 and 6 players can play together.Trade lands, build houses, win auctions, roll wheel of fortune, risk in Russian Roulette and have fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yff.jpg'),(1308,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s 6: Freakshow','2021-10-30','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It has been more than 40 years since the horrible happenings at Freddy\'s, Fazbear Entertainment is Trying to recover from the bad reputation, trying to do another building as their last hope to being succesfull again.\nYou accept the work of a security guard, by a request from an old friend, but you are not there just for that, you have a purpose, a mission, get them all in.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pvj.jpg'),(1309,'Squirrelmageddon!','2021-10-11','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Squirrelmageddon! is an experimental satyric dark comedy of an impossible future. Genetically engineered Squirrels have overrun the planet. You are a soldier in the fight to reclaim the earth and prevent the extinction of all humankind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40et.jpg'),(1310,'Urban Flow: Diamond Edition','2023-11-10','Puzzle, Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1311,'Red Impact',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Defend entire planets against hostile invaders in this full 3D tower defense game. Manage resources and space while constructing weapons, defenses, and structures to withstand the destructive onslaught across multiple planets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7at3.jpg'),(1312,'Town Survival','2023-08-03','Strategy, Tactical','Android, iOS','Mayors, welcome to Town Survival: Zombie Games, a survival and town-building simulation game themed in zombie catastrophe.\nVirus leaked...zombies mutated...Mayors, now is your time to rebuild the town destoryed by zombies and protect residents. Make sure your residents stay survival!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gic.jpg'),(1313,'Cut the Rope: Magic','2015-12-17','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Join Om Nom’s newest adventure and transform him into magical forms to help the lovable little monster recover candy stolen by an evil wizard!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xuq.jpg'),(1314,'Being Beauteous','2015-08-28','Adventure, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Being Beauteous is a grim retelling of the classic fairytale Cinderella. It\'s a visual novel by Träumendes Mädchen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84tl.jpg'),(1315,'Defender','2003-06-13','Shooter','Legacy Mobile Device','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1316,'Maze and Fairy tale',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','This is a 2D style, survival and tower defense built ARPG game. Combine dungeon and tower defense construction, become a trap master, and punch unexpected Combo. The more days you survive, you will have the opportunity to travel through a complete fairy tale world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7w54.jpg'),(1317,'Mech Academy','2024-10-21','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It is the year 2075 and you are the pilot of a Guardian Mech. Gigantic war machines built to defend Earth from the Noxa, a ruthless alien race intent on conquering your planet. As a result of a mysterious experiment, you have been catapulted two centuries forward in time...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73mf.jpg'),(1318,'Fuu3: Minus3’s Lab','2024-08-29','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fuu3: Minus3’s Lab is a point-and-click game being created on the Clickteam Fusion 2.5 engine. Discover what you thought you knew about the titular Minus3, Fuu3’s sworn rival! Meet some extravagant characters, take systems down, and piece together who you were meant to be in this 2000s Newgrounds-inspired take on origin stories!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8smm.jpg'),(1319,'Helicopter Simulator: Rescue Sim','2024-03-01','Simulator, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Unleash your pilot instincts, soar through island skies: challenge yourself, complete missions!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7t5y.jpg'),(1320,'Tales of Arise: Beyond the Dawn - Deluxe Edition','2023-09-19','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Beyond the Dawn Deluxe Edition includes:\n• Tales of Arise\n• Beyond the Dawn Expansion\n• Classic Characters Costume & Arranged BGM Pack\n• Premium Travel Pack\n• Starter Pack\n\nWield the Blazing Sword and join a mysterious, untouchable girl to fight your oppressors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78fr.jpg'),(1321,'Piso Zero','1991-12-31','Arcade','ZX Spectrum, DOS, Amstrad CPC, MSX','Rather simplistic game that came out when the 8 bits were already surpassed by computers and 16-bit consoles.\n\nSimilar to \"Die Hard\" we will have to go through the 15 floors of a building rescuing the different hostages while we finish with the different enemies that come our way. There are 7 different types of enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78uf.jpg'),(1322,'Quetzal',NULL,'Quiz/Trivia','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Quetzal is a free online gaming platform that allows Twitch streamers to host live quizzes with their viewers without the need for them to leave the stream. Participants can simply respond in the chat to be automatically counted as players, without requiring any additional connection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84sg.jpg'),(1323,'Cursed Realms: Path Over The Abyss','2016-10-08','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cursed Realms - Path Over The Abyss is a single-level PWAD for Doom II and the GZDoom source port. It was created by StormCatcher.77 in 2016 and uses the music track \"Claustrophobia\" by Vladislav Baymurzin (ClumsyDoomer) from the Plutonia MIDI Pack. It was awarded third place in the Vine Mapping Contest 2016.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1324,'Fate/Hollow Ataraxia Remastered',NULL,'Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Remaster of the Fate/hollow ataraxia, a Japanese visual novel game and the sequel to Fate/stay night.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oj8.jpg'),(1325,'Spiderman 2','2004-12-31','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Family Computer','Spiderman 2 for the Famicom is a hack of Ninja Gaiden III: The Ancient Ship of Doom which changes all appearances of Ryu into Spider-Man. The game removes all traces of Tecmo\'s name on it and starts on the 2nd level of the game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1326,'The Grave Digger','2013-05-31','Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a third-person stealth action-adventure that\'s a curious blend of whimsical English comedy and grim Dickensian horror. Explore cemeteries, dig up treasure, then try and get out alive by avoiding the restless spirits you\'ve disturbed!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43tg.jpg'),(1327,'Overlord: Escape from Nazarick','2022-06-16','Platform, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The rich world of Overlord is yours to explore in this robust, story-driven Metroidvania.\nPlay as fan-favorite Clementine and delve into an entirely new chapter in the Overlord series, brought to life under the supervision of the original creator, Kugane Maruyama.\nWhether you’re new to the series or a diehard fan, there will be plenty for you to discover and enjoy in this dark fantasy action-adventure that ensnares you in a web of intrigue in typical Overlord fashion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4asg.jpg'),(1328,'Tsykial',NULL,'Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tsykial is a teaser game containing various logs, data files and images related to Five Nights at Treasure Island.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1329,'Afternoon in the House of Secrets','2009-07-18','Indie','Web browser','You have come to this enigmatic house in search of the secret that you know is here. You shall not leave until you find it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j8t.jpg'),(1330,'Jollibee\'s: Phase 1','2019-08-03','Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','20 years after the incident (aka, in 2037), the player (Justin Smith) is working the night-shift at Jollibee\'s. Every night, you must keep track of the animatronics to stop them from getting in your office. You must check the cameras to locate them. On the cameras, you can check for them throughout the building and in the vents by clicking the \"CHANGE FLOOR\" button. Aside from checking the cameras, you must shut vents, \"close\" lights, and flash your light to keep them away. There is a vent to your left, a door in front of your desk, and a window to your right. The vent and window require flashing the light to keep the characters from getting you into trouble. However, the door requires shutting the lights off so they think the office is an empty room.\n\nYou will have to defend yourself from five characters as the nights progress. The first animatronics active are Yum, Hetty, and Twirlie.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4asa.jpg'),(1331,'FNaF 4 Retro Edition','2023-07-20','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a complete recreation of FNaF 4 in an 8-bit art style!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c5d.jpg'),(1332,'The Fairy\'s Song','2023-06-16','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Marnie, a bored goth girl, accidentally stumbles upon a sleeping female knight in the forest. Together, the pair must work to break a centuries-old curse, while romantic feelings between them begin to grow.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pag.jpg'),(1333,'Academy of Magic: Ring of Darkness','2022-11-08','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9msa.jpg'),(1334,'Shrek the Third','2007-05-15','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','An action video game based from the third installment of the Shrek movie series.\n\nThe Frog King has died and Shrek has inherited the throne. Since Shrek\'s not a big fan of this idea, he and his friends journey to the Worcestershire academy to recruit Fiona\'s cousin, Artie, for the job. Unfortunately, while he\'s away the dastardly Prince Charming has big plans to take over the kingdom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p09.jpg'),(1335,'Galvanized',NULL,'Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fast paced, movement focused FPS in a foreboding, post-apocalyptic setting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qih.jpg'),(1336,'Shn!p','2017-04-25','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','An original puzzler with satisfying explosions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2daa.jpg'),(1337,'Rockman X3',NULL,'Shooter, Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qkr.jpg'),(1338,'Anna Girl','2023-05-25','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a casual jigsaw puzzle game, the game contains 28 sexy pictures. In the puzzle at the same time, accompanied by relaxing music, you can unconsciously view the sexy picture content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7omi.jpg'),(1339,'Demon Gaze','2014-04-25','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation Vita','A first-person RPG dungeon crawler that uses a team of five characters from five races with seven classes. The main character has a unique class while the other characters can be customized. The game uses turn-based combat with random and visible encounters, items can be used to summon monsters at set points in each dungeon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zz2.jpg'),(1340,'Lucky and a Life Worth Living: A Jigsaw Puzzle Tale','2020-05-20','Simulator, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A dog’s life nowadays. Discover happy moments from the daily life of the dog Lucky with his parents. A new minimalist jigsaw puzzle game, with 6 scenes illustrated by Katia Numakura with her cute art style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46o9.jpg'),(1341,'M.O.Z.I.',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','M.O.Z.I. - A post-apocalyptic FPS with elements of horror and tower defense. Deadly Wasteland, Dying Planet: radiation, mutants, aliens and savages are all out to get you. Defend yourself, gather food and resources, and upgrade your equipment. Survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c3i.jpg'),(1342,'Last Day to Die','2024-08-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game offers intense survival gameplay where you and your friends must battle zombies by night and fend off bandits by day in a post-apocalyptic world. Work together to survive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kjv.jpg'),(1343,'World of Warcraft: Dragonflight - Guardians of the Dream','2023-11-07','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Emerald Dream is a verdant and powerful place that serves as a source of life and hope and is essential to Azeroth\'s continued survival. It has been protected for centuries under the watchful eyes of the Green Dragonflight. In those centuries, they have fought off the Old Gods, the Burning Legion, and other threats. Now vulnerable to attack once again from Fyrakk and his forces, Azeroth\'s champions must pull together to save it from destruction at all costs.\n\nA special seed, planted by Tyrande, has grown into a new World Tree and is on the verge of crossing into Azeroth. Fyrakk and his forces, including his new allies—the Druids of the Flame, move beneath the boughs of the World Tree, inflaming the Dream denizens as they attempt to infuse the heart of the World Tree with fire and use it as a conduit to spread eternal flames throughout Azeroth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bvu.jpg'),(1344,'Ziggy','1987-12-31','Sin género','BBC Microcomputer System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kd3.jpg'),(1345,'The Settlers IV: Gold Edition','2002-03-01','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This edition includes the original The Settlers IV and its two expansions: The Settlers IV: The Trojans and the Elixir of Power and The Settlers IV Mission CD along with a random map generator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d9n.jpg'),(1346,'Nigudin Really Fought Against Furong Wangyuan','2024-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nicotine vs. Furong Wangyuan \"is a brain pumping game that takes place in a fantasy world called\" Litang County \". Players will play as\" Ding Zhen \", defeat Furong Wangyuan, and gradually uncover the truth about their ability to manipulate the level of Sharp Cut 5','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9prk.jpg'),(1347,'The Battle Robo: Daikyoutou Scramble',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1348,'Araya','2016-11-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Araya is a first person horror game. Players will get a new thrilling experience inside a Thai hospital. The story will be told from the perspectives of 3 different characters. Players will explore different areas of the hospital in order to piece together the mysterious murder case of Araya.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pfs.jpg'),(1349,'Mahoutsukai to Goshujin-sama: New Ground','2010-07-31','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable','Mahoutsukai to Goshujin-sama ~Wizard and the Master~ New Ground is the first remake of Mahoutsukai to Goshujin-sama ~Wizard and the Master~. The remake adds updated art and voice acting for the characters. This version was released on the PC, then later on the PSP.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54yi.jpg'),(1350,'Runner3','2018-05-22','Music, Platform, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Runner3 continues the joyous adventures of CommanderVideo from BIT.TRIP RUNNER and Runner2. Players will encounter quests, branching paths, new character moves, new Retro Challenges, and a roster of characters that somehow manages to rival the strangeness of Runner2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86bd.jpg'),(1351,'Luminous Nights',NULL,'Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on an adventure inspired by popular Fantasy Action RPGs. Travel to different realms fighting monsters and gaining new abilities as you seek to bring back peace to the Luminous Realms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gr7.jpg'),(1352,'NEET Nectar\'s Abysmally Small Assortment','2024-10-04','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A collection of very simple 1-3 input games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pre.jpg'),(1353,'Phantom Bound','2025-02-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Immerse yourself with this spine-chilling Ghost Hunting game. Navigate the haunted halls with your electric gadget and show the uninvited ghosts true hospitality! Are you ready to embrace the ghostly challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7z67.jpg'),(1354,'Night Crows','2024-03-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','In 13th-century Europe, where magic still exists, we created a new world in which fantasy meets reality. Night versus day, light versus darkness, order versus chaos, and oppression versus rebellion— everything clashes and collides in the lands of medieval Europe. Dive into the most realistic experience of the European continent, brought to life with Unreal Engine 5.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7w0w.jpg'),(1355,'Under the Island',NULL,'Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','A 2D Action RPG set in a fantasy world inspired by the 1990s. Explore an island, fight monsters, solve puzzles and uncover the mystery of an ancient civilization. Help the inhabitants and interact with the plants and animals of the island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pr8.jpg'),(1356,'Rogue Mansion',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Rogue Mansion is a survival horror game combined with the best of the roguelike genre! Explore a procedurally generated mansion that changes every time you play, and becomes more dangerous and unpredictable according to your level of fear.\n\nExperience the game in different ways, by choosing from multiple unique characters, each with their own equipment, specialist perks, and motivations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6t0v.jpg'),(1357,'Five Nights At Amendoca\'s','2024-07-26','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Five Nights At Amendoca\'s (or FNAA) is a Five Nights At Freddy\'s fangame created by furry productions inspired by the Amendo Gordo channel, the most scoundrel channel on YouTube','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d26.jpg'),(1358,'Omegalodon','2012-03-10','Simulator, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Omegalodon is a third-person multiplayer action game where players compete by attacking/defending the city. The Red Team is comprised of police and soldiers armed with an array of military vehicles and explosive weaponry. The Green Team is comprised of Omegalodon, a 100-foot shark monster, and the Enviros, equipped with a healing beam. The game plays like a backward tower-defense game, but with free-roaming capability and fast-paced, realtime action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/kvcer3pn036actex2xmo.jpg'),(1359,'Mythos Interactive Game Collection','2024-11-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mythos Interactive Game Collection is a diverse anthology of 9 indie games, each offering unique gameplay experiences across various genres. From thrilling action to mind-bending puzzles, this collection showcases the creative spirit of Mythos Interactive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pr8.jpg'),(1360,'Pinball Construction Set','1983-12-31','Pinball','Atari 8-bit, PC-9800 Series, PC-8800 Series, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Mac, DOS, Apple II','Pinball Construction Set created a new genre of video games - the \"builder\" or \"construction set\" class of games.\n\nUsers can construct their own virtual pinball machine, by dropping controls onto a table. Controls included bumpers, flippers, spinners and other standard pinball paraphernalia. Attributes such as gravity and the physics model could also be modified.\n\nUsers could then save their creations and develop custom artwork to go along with them. As Pinball Construction Set itself was not needed to play the tables, they could be freely traded online or on a floppy disk.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5waq.jpg'),(1361,'Mortal Trace',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Online PvP 3D \"snake\" game. Avoid yours\'s and your opponents\' growing tail or \"Trace\" and be the last left in the arena while trying to cut off and trap your opponents with your Trace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6arq.jpg'),(1362,'It’s A Game Changer','2024-11-06','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','t\'s A Game Changer is a fast-paced, single-player microgame roguelike inspired by WarioWare. Cycle through diverse 2D and 3D microgames like dodging the rain and fishing. Choose upgrades, face rapid-fire challenges, and enjoy endless replayability. Created by a passionate indie developer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kpe.jpg'),(1363,'Alienator',NULL,'Shooter, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1364,'One Turkey, Two Turkeys',NULL,'Arcade','Web browser','A game about counting turkeys. Inspired by the Rifftrax riff of \"One Turkey, Two Turkeys\".','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1365,'Backyard Baseball','2002-06-21','Sport','Game Boy Advance','In Backyard Baseball for the Gameboy Advance, create the baseball team of your dreams! It\'s great baseball action with the backyard kids and real pro players as kids. Pick your team, choose logos and playing fields. Play single games, an entire season or Home Run Derby. It\'s the chance of a lifetime to play with the pros right in your own backyard. Play single Games or a whole season, choose from all 30 Major League Baseball teams, create, save and trade custom players, practice your swing in the Home Run Derby, and track player and team stats in Season play. Also features a two-player multiplayer mode when linking up two Game Boy Advance units via a link cable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co229a.jpg'),(1366,'Monster Ops 2','2025-01-02','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','NSFW Gay Visual Novel Dating Sim! Black Ops soldiers Wraith and Tide know they must count on each other to survive. Will their bond as battle-brothers evolve into something more? Monster Ops: Military Special Forces Hunting Rogue Monsters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pqu.jpg'),(1367,'SharpShooter3D',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1368,'Demolish & Build Classic','2023-01-21','Simulator, Strategy, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Buy machines and discover new possibilities by modifying their equipment. Use specialized hand tools for finishing work.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60xd.jpg'),(1369,'Yo-Jin-Bo: The Bodyguards','2005-07-29','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Yo-Jin-Bo: The Bodyguards is a Japanese visual novel produced by Two-Five.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4p9c.jpg'),(1370,'Dormitabis Remastered','2023-07-31','Point-and-click, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dormitabis Remastered is a FNaF fangame that takes place shortly after FNaF3 where the good ending is not canon and therefore is not related to any FNaF games past FNaF SL.\nIt follows its own canon that works off of the basis of FNaF3\'s fire, with Springtrap dying shortly after it.\nWith a standard amount of deaths the game can take about 2 hours to beat in a standard session, even longer if playing casually.\nto 100% is also WAY longer as there are secret areas/minigames and other challenges that give you special rewards as well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pel.jpg'),(1371,'Top Spin 3','2008-06-20','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Top Spin 3 includes more than 25 of the world\'s top tennis superstars including Roger Federer, Andy Roddick, Maria Sharapova, James Blake, and many others. With all-new action-packed features including signature player animations and expressions, weather changes, situation-specific behaviors, along with revamped audio with enhanced crowd reaction, Top Spin 3 serves up a realistic and exciting tennis video game experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ssx.jpg'),(1372,'Fortnite: Chapter 4 - Season 4: Last Resort','2023-08-25','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A season of Fortnite: Chapter 4\n\nThe fate of the Island\'s at stake in Fortnite Battle Royale Chapter 4 Season 4, and thievery\'s the last resort. Are you in?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zt1.jpg'),(1373,'Bugs','1986-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Amstrad CPC','This little game came in a standalone cassette as a free game with the fourteenth issue of the Spanish magazine \"Todo Sobre El Amstrad\", which roughly translates to \"All About Amstrad\".\n\nIn this game, it\'s all about shooting down pesky bugs. Also, the music is from the game \"Flight Path 737\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f7y.jpg'),(1374,'Mobile Suit Gundam: Extreme Vs. Maxi Boost ON - Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Fighting','Sin plataforma','This edition includes the following PS4 Game: Mobile Suit Gundam: Extreme VS. MaxiBoost ON [Premium Sound Edition], HG 1/144 Extreme Gundam & Eclipse F Parts (EX VS. 10th Anniversary Color Ver.) Gunpla figure','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1375,'Lords of the Fallen 2','2026-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Lords of the Fallen 2, the highly anticipated sequel to the game released in 2023, is set to arrive in 2026. The team at Hexworks aims to create a sequel incorporating more commercial elements, particularly in visual design, to attract a broader audience of players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vw3.jpg'),(1376,'Kiborg: Arena','2024-08-13','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Fight for cash and glory in a prison planet’s Coliseum in this free prologue to KIBORG, the fast-paced action rogue-lite with brutal, cybernetic-enhanced combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8no5.jpg'),(1377,'Chop Chop Guys',NULL,'Platform, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join the madness in Chop Chop Guys, a wild competition of dim-witted characters racing through a world of zany traps. Lose your head? No problem! You don\'t need it to reach the finish line!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5y7q.jpg'),(1378,'Iconoclasts','2020-01-23','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Join renegade mechanic Robin and uncover the secrets of a dying planet. Explore a huge, open world filled with intricate puzzles, oddball characters and menacing bosses in a beautiful platform adventure telling a personal story about faith, purpose and whether the world is really worth saving.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ug9.jpg'),(1379,'Rockjack','2020-11-19','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A retro-inspired 2D space shoot-em-up. Mine asteroids! Shoot alien saucers! Get rich or die flying!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47a0.jpg'),(1380,'Pokémon Puzzle Challenge','2014-11-27','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy','Game Boy Color, Nintendo 3DS','In a rising pit of colored blocks, it\'s your task to continuously eliminate these tiles by switching two tiles\' positions on the horizontal row. When three or more tiles link up in a up/down or left/right fashion, they disappear. Gravity kicks in and settles the rest of the tiles into the bin ? this can cause a chain reaction to occur since other blocks of the same color can fall into place next to each other. It\'s up to you to continuously work the bin to wipe out tiles by making combination connections and chain reactions. That\'s the game in a nutshell, but there are several modes of play that\'ll keep your fingers busy. In the game\'s Challenge mode, for example, you\'re up against a computer opponent and you\'ll have to make combos and chain reactions to send garbage blocks to his unseen screen -- but keep in mind your opponent\'s doing the same to you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ywc.jpg'),(1381,'Jollibee\'s: Phase 2','2020-04-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The player plays/works as an employee of the shipping company, LBM Shipments, Inc. (LBM Shipments Inc Warehouse). Their job is to transport boxes each night shift. To do this, they must use the workstation panel on the left side of the office that controls the conveyor belts and security systems. On the first night, 50 boxes must be transported to their respective conveyer belts. The boxes and tracks are labelled by a letter (A, B, C, D, and E). To transport them, the player needs to click and drag the node to the other corresponding side. The number of boxes increases by 25 boxes each new night, reaching its maximum of 100 boxes on Night 3. It is recommended to keep track of the box/track labels, otherwise errors will be added to the counter on the bottom left corner of the area on the screen. Errors are counted when a box is ignored or misplaced. If the player gets 1 error, 50$ will be removed from the paycheck at the end of the night. The maximum amount of errors the player can get is 15. If any more are added, the result will be a GAME OVER screen.\n\nThe workstation panel also contains four tabs: Motion Detect, Cameras, Audio, and Hack. These systems decrease their stability the more you use them. The less the stability is, the higher the chance it can go offline. However, there is a maintenance panel at the right side of the office to reboot them. It takes about 3-5 seconds to reboot any system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4asb.jpg'),(1382,'Punch Chess','2023-11-08','Fighting','Atari 2600','A short game made for Atari 2600','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f7x.jpg'),(1383,'Dinosaur King','2005-12-31','Fighting, Arcade','Arcade','SEGA\'s second entry into the Arcade card game genre, Dinosaur king is a collectible card fighting game where you can put dinosaurs in fierce battles, with incredible graphics, and colorful and 00\'s accurate depictions of these prehistoric animals.\n\nIn it\'s story Max Taylor, his father Spike Taylor and Rex Owen found stone tablets on a fossil excavation site in Africa, the tablets suddenly bursts out voices of the past: Dinosaurs! They request that Max and Rex go back to the past to help them from the Alpha Gang who are capturing dinosaurs. Max and Rex used Dinosaurs and Move Cards and pushed back the Alpha Gang.\n\nFight with an enhanced Rock, Paper, Scissors formula where the winner can attack, and collect dinosaurs and moves to prove yourself as a Dinosaur King.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zfa.jpg'),(1384,'Celestia: Chain of Fate','2024-09-12','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A romance-fantasy visual novel that delivers a captivating player driven narrative. Enrol at Celestia Academy and uncover your heritage. Delve into a fantastical realm and unearth your magical potential as a hybrid. Forge new friendships and build affections based on your love interests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8m3y.jpg'),(1385,'My Sweet! Housemate','2024-08-27','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','My Sweet Housemate is an interactive visual novel style game that puts you into the shoes of a homeless adult struggling to find affordable housing in America. You\'re hit with a stroke of good - or maybe bad - luck when you finally find a totally not suspicious rental listing for a room in an apartment. The only catch is that your new landlord, Seung-min, seems to have something off about him.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d57.jpg'),(1386,'Borderlands 2: Mechromancer Pack','2012-10-09','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','This DLC grants the Mechromancer, a 5th playable character class who can summon a destructive robot named Deathtrap. In addition to this new class, this pack also includes bonus items which were included in the Borderlands 2 Premiere Club Pack, including the Gearbox Gold Gun Pack, a Golden Key, which unlocks rare items in the mysterious Sanctuary Loot Chest, and the Vault Hunter’s Relic, which boosts your gear-hunting fortunes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4btz.jpg'),(1387,'One Way Ticket','2022-10-12','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows)','I was heading for a new life and my train brought me here. Nice town: friendly people, corn cuisine, mysterious architecture...\n\nSo why am I sure that I need to get out of here as fast as possible?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94yv.jpg'),(1388,'Copernicus',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The second project from 38 Studios was a massively-multiplayer online game set in their Amalur universe, established in the singleplayer RPG Kingdoms of Amalur: Reckoning. After 38\'s collapse, it is unlikely to ever see release.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sr2rf5ffvysiw4iopl8y.jpg'),(1389,'Minecraft: Caves & Cliffs - Part I','2021-06-08','Simulator, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Minecraft: Caves & Cliffs - Part I is the first part, focused on blocks and mobs, of two major themed updates for Minecraft: Java Edition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mgn.jpg'),(1390,'Atan','2024-06-12','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Atan is an action-adventure game where you traverse a massive colossal. Use your climbing skills together with your bow and anchors to journey over the massive giant. But beware, because this rough terrain contains many challenges, for the colossal itself is still alive and in need of your help.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8grd.jpg'),(1391,'Five Nights at Treasure Island','2020-09-28','Point-and-click, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is an official reboot of the infamous FNaF fangame \"Five Nights At Treasure Island.\"\nThis reboot will complete what Anart1996 started with a whole new story included. This game will feature new and updated gameplay, as well as an interesting and terrifying atmosphere. Welcome to the island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co662b.jpg'),(1392,'Twinkle Star Sprites','2016-01-08','Shooter, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, Web browser, Neo Geo MVS, Linux, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Sega Saturn, Neo Geo CD, Dreamcast','Twinkle Star Sprites is a 1996 competitive scrolling shooter arcade game originally created by ADK. It was ADK\'s last production for the Neo-Geo platform. The gameplay, which can be characterized as a combination of a fixed shooter and a versus puzzle game, uses combinations of shots, as well as timed power-ups to attempt to damage the opponent. These attacks also serve as counters to the opponent\'s attack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a5h.jpg'),(1393,'Play Together: Starter Pack - Bear Girl','2025-03-05','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"We\'re not bratty, we just like to have a little fun!!\" Get the adorable Bratty Sister Bear costume, a vehicle, in-game currencies, and tools in one bundle at a low price! Enjoy life in Play Together with this Starter Pack that\'s jam-packed with must-have items!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1394,'Shoulders of Giants: Ultimate','2024-08-12','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Simultaneously control a sword-wielding robot and a gunslinging space frog in Shoulders of Giants, an explosively colourful sci-fi roguelike. Play alone, with a friend, or as part of a four-person team, cutting through waves of enemies on a quest to rescue the galaxy from the forces of Entropy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nyx.jpg'),(1395,'FNaF: Project Lockdown','2024-02-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dock to a space station with deadly animatronics and try to get out alive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tyu.jpg'),(1396,'Sable\'s Grimoire','2021-06-10','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Sable\'s Grimoire is a visual novel / dating sim featuring monster girls in a magic academy setting.\n\nPlay as Sable, an aspiring magic researcher, as he get sucked into the daily lives and troubles of his demi-human classmates.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co274w.jpg'),(1397,'Arkanoid: Eternal Battle','2022-10-27','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The return of the iconic block breaker game from prestigious Japanese video game company Taito!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p7e.jpg'),(1398,'Initial D Arcade Stage 4','2007-02-21','Racing','Arcade','Initial D Arcade Stage 4 (also known as Initial D 4 in Europe and the US) is a 2007 arcade racing game based on the Initial D series. It is the fourth game in the Initial D Arcade Stage series. It was the first Initial D game to feature online battles via Sega\'s ALL.net services exclusive to the Japanese release. A limited edition, called Initial D Arcade Stage 4 Kai, also exists. This is the last entry to have a full English localization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x0a.jpg'),(1399,'Game of Rollink','2025-03-04','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Game of Rollink is a PvP card game with auto-battler, where you play as a medieval lord to outwit sinister opponents on the gaming table and seize the supreme throne. Bet wisely because gold and countless lives of loyal soldiers are at stake. Make your best hand and may the odds be in your favor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6d49.jpg'),(1400,'Extra Evolution: L’Era del Primordiale',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Extra Evolution: L’Era del Primordiale is a Pokémon fangame made by DayanVS\nThe game, made in RPG Maker XP + Pokémon Essentials, is set in the brand new region of Liniles and features 160 new species of Pokémon','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rti.jpg'),(1401,'Opus Magnum','2017-12-07','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Master the intricate, physical machinery of the transmutation engine— the alchemical engineer’s most advanced tool— and use it to create vital remedies, precious gemstones, deadly weapons, and more.\n\nDesign Machines - Design and build machines that carry out alchemical processes using a variety of components.\nOpen-Ended Puzzles - Compete against your friends and the world to build the simplest, fastest, and most compact solutions. Export animated GIFs to show them off.\nSteam Workshop - Make and share your own puzzles with full Steam Workshop integration and an easy-to-use puzzle editor.\nSolitaire Minigame - Take a break with Sigmar’s Garden, an original alchemy-based solitaire game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uac.jpg'),(1402,'Aton','1987-12-31','Arcade','Amstrad CPC','You must find with your spaceship the survivors of the Acorn commando who have left on a perilous mission on the planet Araquis. You will have to be on alert to avoid being captured by the Raquis, voracious creatures, who terrorize the entire population. To destroy them, you will have to use your Blaster beam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f7z.jpg'),(1403,'DWK 5: Hinter dem Horizont','2008-10-31','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DWK 5: Hinter dem Horizont is a traditional point & click adventure game based on the movie Die wilden Kerle 5: Hinter dem Horizont. The young soccer players Leon, Vanessa, Maxi and Raban are practising in the woods - but suddenly Leon disappears. Of course his friends search for him and suddenly arrive in the land of vampires...\n\nThe player alternately takes the control of the four protagonists and solves item based puzzles. To do so he explores his surroundings, takes everything he finds, talks with people and combines items with each other. In each scene the player can instantly switch between day and night which alters the persons he meet and the items he can interact with. When stuck the player has access to a hint system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co916a.jpg'),(1404,'Qwepoi','2024-03-29','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Qwepoi is an arcade space shooter game using QWE IOP keys where you paint the Infantry ships before they enter the base.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8020.jpg'),(1405,'EFootball: Leo Messi Edition 2025','2024-09-11','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Bolster your team with Lionel Messi, the living legend.\nIntroducing the special edition of eFootball. No better time to start playing eFootball than now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f54.jpg'),(1406,'Karm','2022-03-17','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Karm brings back \'90s FPS look and feel in a lovecraftian world. Try to discover what lies behind the cult and make sure you don\'t lose your sanity!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88sw.jpg'),(1407,'Moomi & Spike',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience high-speed thrills and an engaging story in Moomi & Spike, a 3D platformer where agile gameplay and a captivating narrative collide in a vibrant adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ssh.jpg'),(1408,'Femme Fatale','2001-05-25','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Taisho era.\nMain character is a detective in Tokyo.\nHe returns to hometown to dispose of his father\'s legacy.\nLocal policeman tells him about a case of girl death from illness at a boarding school, but under suspicious conditions.\nDetective decides to investigate the incident as he needs to stay at the town for some time anyway.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tbg.jpg'),(1409,'Arcade Archives: Rainbow Islands','2024-01-25','Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Rainbow Islands is an action game released in 1987 by TAITO. A sequel to Bubble Bobble in which Bubby and Bobby, having returned to their human form, travel the Rainbow Islands using their rainbow magic to rescue the villagers from the clutches of the Boss of Shadow.\n\nRainbows can be used in various ways, like attacking enemies or as platforms to jump on. This game includes the updated Rainbow Islands Extra, featuring altered difficulty etc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92j9.jpg'),(1410,'Roll\'N With Da Punchez','2024-09-09','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Roll\'N With Da Punchez\" is a stylistic, physics-based platformer with a unique twist! Punch a ball through challenging obstacle courses, and reach the goal as fast as possible!\n\nBut stay alert of your surroundings, as one wrong move could send the ball plummeting back down!\n\nDon\'t let that get you down though! Roll With The Punches and Try Again!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ty0.jpg'),(1411,'Super Action Soccer','1984-06-01','Sport','ColecoVision','Super Action Soccer gives you the chance to be the most accomplished star player of any team that ever was. You will be the goal-keeper diving to make incredible saves, the full back with fierce last minute tackles, the mid-field \"general\" directing shrewd passes and the centre forward scoring great goals. You will be involved all the time in the most exciting moments of the game. You will score the winning goal!\n\nTeam Pixelboy released Super Action Soccer for the North American audience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co810a.jpg'),(1412,'Rune Factory 3 Special','2023-03-02','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Settle down in an idyllic fantasy town as a young adventurer with a monstrous secret in Rune Factory 3, remade for a new generation on Nintendo Switch and PC.\n\nFeatures brand new to Rune Factory 3 Special include Newlywed Mode, standalone adventures unlocked after marriage to each of the game\'s 11 eligible bachelorettes; and a \"Hell\" difficulty level to challenge even veteran players!\n\nWhether it\'s your first visit or you\'re returning after a long time away, experience the unforgettable story of Rune Factory 3 with improved graphics and redesigned 3D character models.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co692u.jpg'),(1413,'Kill Spree',NULL,'Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','First-person mayhem in grand stadiums.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co496u.jpg'),(1414,'Paranormal Snap Shot','2024-12-02','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A psychological horror game set in a Japanese school. Trapped in an endless looping building, can you find your way out by photographing all of the anomalies?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o7g.jpg'),(1415,'Tank vs. Tank: Prime Edition','2025-02-28','Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1416,'Deformed','2024-06-06','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Single player horror game set in a underground lab. Kill monsters and escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g83.jpg'),(1417,'Dice King','2019-11-05','Puzzle, Strategy, Card & Board Game','Windows Phone, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Merge the dice and become the Dice King!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4et3.jpg'),(1418,'Match Three Pirates! Heir to Davy Jones','2019-02-27','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Challenging and fun Match 3 Adventure game, where you enter a swashbuckling magic world of a legendary pirate. Bobby disappears in Davy Jones’ Locker... Can you save him in time?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5akc.jpg'),(1419,'Fallen Mage','2016-11-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fallen Mage is dynamic action, hack and slash game. The story and adventure drags you through many obstacles which you will face on the way to the goal. Play the rebellious mage Fellin and take a revenge !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p72.jpg'),(1420,'Blade & Soul Neo','2025-03-12','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blade & Soul NEO is a modern reinterpretation of Blade & Soul\'s iconic Wuxia-themed, fantasy world, offering unparalleled action-based combat and character customization. Players can reconnect with the original spirit of the free-to-play, open-world MMORPG in a richer, visually enhanced experience set in a world of Asian mythology where fast-paced combat collides with the stunning visual beauty.\n\nGamers will re-live the original storyline as a hero determined to restore honor to their clan that’s been wiped out by enemy forces. Players can pick one of four playable races based on animal lore, including the Dragon, Qilin, Phoenix and Turtle, and amongst seven classes, including Assassin, Blade Dancer, Blade Master, Destroyer, Force Master, Kung Fu Master, and Summoner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ir3.jpg'),(1421,'Alien Shooter 2: Reloaded','2006-09-07','Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','During the first half of the 21st century, the war on terror became a global phenomenon, as more blatant and frenzied attacks struck deeper into the lives of common people. Inevitably, the public outcry to stop the madness grew to an irresistible level; the military forces of the world slowly but steadily retooled their approach, weapons, and tactics to combat people who were willing to die for their cause. One of the consequences was the harassment of civilians on an unprecedented scale, leaving destruction and misery in its wake.\n\nThe world was soon rebuilt and a new age of prosperity and technological progress began. Science focused on creating a viable fusion power source and new technologies which would exploit this new power. A group of corporations was granted almost total freedom in order to pursue these goals. This may have seemed dangerous a hundred years ago, but in 2112 it was considered appropriate and was supposed to foster creativity and growth on an unprecedented scale. It didn\'t.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cra.jpg'),(1422,'SimIsle: Missions in the Rainforest','1996-12-31','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','Pack your bags, have the neighbors collect your mail, and take a working vacation in the rainforests of SimIsle. Build tourist hotels, exploit natural resources and develop industry in a land of beauty and danger. Can you become wealthy and keep native populations, tourists, and industry leaders happy? Or will your actions destroy the delicate balance of a fragile ecosystem?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6iue.jpg'),(1423,'Shovel Knight Showdown','2019-12-10','Fighting, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"Duel with up to 4 players and scramble after gems as your favorite heroic or villainous knight in Shovel Knight Showdown. All the classic Shovel Knight characters you know and love are playable, many for the first time ever! Gather your pals for endless multiplayer clashes, or take control of your favorite character and dig into Story Mode. Familiar controls, items, and mechanics return, making this a platform fighting game that anyone can jump into and try.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rat.jpg'),(1424,'Adabana Odd Tales','2021-12-16','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','\"This is a tale of \'flowers\' that never bloom.\" Shirohime, a girl who has lost her memory, and Kurofude, a mysterious boy, traverse through classic Japanese fairy tales within the land of Adabana, a realm of illustrated books. What awaits them after they mend the distorted tales?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21uv.jpg'),(1425,'Zumba: The Marble Shooter Tikki Adventure','2025-02-06','Shooter, Puzzle, Arcade, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Get ready to blast your way through 200 vibrant and challenging levels in Zumba - The Marble Shooter Tikki Adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bo9.jpg'),(1426,'First Contact','2022-04-20','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Linux, Mac','A time-loop based puzzle, adventure game inspired by Outer Wilds and Carl Sagan’s Contact.\n\nYou wake up in the middle of nowhere, on a deserted island, without your memories…\nYour curiosity drives you to find out where you are and why…\nIf you die, the day restarts, but your new memories remain!\nTime your decisions well, because some locations are only available early on!\nSolve puzzles in a 3D world, collect clues, and find out what’s behind the mistery!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8iz9.jpg'),(1427,'Nick Bounty: The Dame with the Blue Chewed Shoe.','2020-03-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A comedic film noir adventure. You play the down on his luck detective as he tries to discover who murdered the woman found naked in a local playground sandbox.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q46.jpg'),(1428,'Mortal Kombat: Deadly Alliance','2002-11-16','Fighting','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Mortal Kombat: Deadly Alliance is the first Mortal Kombat outing on the next-gen systems. New to DA is a completely revamped fight engine. The graphics are in full 3D and feature somewhat interactive environments. Each character now has different fighting stances, allowing them to be in an offensive stance or a fatality stance.\n\nReturning from past games are all your favorite fighters, and a host of new ones. Johnny Cage, Scorpion, Sub-Zero, Raiden, joined by such newcomers as Molloch and Quan Chi. Each character has their own specific fatalities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20kf.jpg'),(1429,'System Shock: Enhanced Edition','2015-09-22','Shooter, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Exactly twenty one years after its first release, System Shock is back! The Enhanced Edition adds a modern touch to this true classic gem, without taking anything from its unmistakable atmosphere. See for yourself that the game that has been called the benchmark for intelligent first-person gaming, has lost nothing of its ability to keep you on the edge of your seat.\n\nYou\'re a renowned hacker, the most notorious cyberspace thief in the corporate world. Caught during a risky break-in, you become indentured to Diego, a greedy Trioptium exec who bankrolls a rare cyberjack implant operation. After six months in a healing coma, you awaken to the twisted aftermath of a terrible disaster. Where are the surgeons? Why is the station in such disrepair? Slowly, the chilling realization that something is very wrong creeps over you.\n\nOnce a prime corporate research facility, Citadel now teems with mindless cyborgs, robots and terribly mutated beings, all programmed to serve SHODAN, a ruthless A.I. There\'s scarcely time to think before it unleashes the first terror...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co288f.jpg'),(1430,'Samus Goes to the Fridge to Get a Glass of Milk II','2020-07-19','Platform','Game Boy','Last time on Samus Goes to the Fridge to Get a Glass of Milk…\n\nShe fulfilled Adam’s deed, picking up the milk carton lying in the fridge. However, after gunning down the Omega Metroid, she looked around, finding no exit before the subzero temperatures knocked her out cold (pun somewhat intended). When she woke up, she found herself in her regular power suit, in a different area of the station. While she was all there in one piece, there was one problem–the milk wasn’t! And Samus knew better than to fail Adam’s orders at 3 AM.\n\nThis contest hack continues the tale of Samus’s venture to get Adam a glass of milk, this time as a hack of a game few have ever attempted making hacks for. Will Samus get through okay and recover the milk once again? Find out in Samus Goes to the Fridge to Get a Glass of Milk II!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sqt.jpg'),(1431,'Helion',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Are you ready to embark on an intergalactic journey like never before? Step into the thrilling world of \"Helion,\" where tactical teamwork, role-based strategy, and stunning stylized graphics collide in an epic sci-fi adventure. Get ready to experience the future of team-based third-person shooters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75v5.jpg'),(1432,'MultiVersus: Founder\'s Pack - Premium Edition','2022-07-19','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Grab a MultiVersus Founder\'s Pack for Instant Character Unlock Tokens, Exclusive Items, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51ye.jpg'),(1433,'Super Mario Bros. Star Scramble 2: Ghost Island',NULL,'Platform, Adventure','Web browser','In the Ghost Island game, you have to help Mario explore the new island he found.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55r7.jpg'),(1434,'My Lovely Daughter: ReBorn','2024-06-23','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Just like your homunculi, we’re breathing new life into My Lovely Daughter! Featuring brand new artwork and support for 4K resolution, this gothic fantasy is darker than ever!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1435,'Samurai Shodown NeoGeo Collection','2020-07-28','Fighting','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The ULTIMATE collection is here! Six NEOGEO titles as well as one mysterious, unreleased game are featured! Featuring Online Battle Modes as well as a Museum Mode and Music Player. This collection is a must-have for all SAMURAI SHODOWN fans across the globe!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29ku.jpg'),(1436,'The Backrooms Footage','2022-09-02','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have found a camera with a footage in it. For some reason you can\'t rewind the video, and as soon as you try winding it forward you find yourself in the Backrooms. Figure out whats in the footage and try to ESCAPE AS FAST AS POSSIBLE!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7igq.jpg'),(1437,'RRRR 2','2019-04-22','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RRRR 2 continuation of the game RRRR, the Reindeer is added to the team.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uma.jpg'),(1438,'Arctic Tale','2007-10-25','Adventure','Wii','The onset of global warming and the resultant changes in the world?s climate is having a devastating effect on the Arctic and the animals that live there. Based on the follow up to March of the Penguins, Arctic Tale follows the story of two of these amazing creatures as they face their daily battle to survive in the ever changing surroundings of the Arctic Circle. Control a polar bear and a walrus in a changing 3D environment. Each animal has varying attributes such as speed, stamina, strength and hunger that will change depending upon their condition and surroundings.\n\nEach of the animals has their own episode to play through, both of which consist of 12 stages taking you over snowy mountains, turbulent ice sheets and vast frozen oceans. Mini games help the animal to survive as they hunt for food, fight off predators and adapt to their environment.\n\nFeatures National Geographic information and presentation style which is not only educational, but will help you to work through the game. Throughout the game, situations events, warnings and educational information will be presented by the game\'s narrator. Uses the intuitive Nintendo Wii control schemes to immerse you in the game experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vvi.jpg'),(1439,'Succubus x Saint','2022-03-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After being tricked into participating in a ritual to resurrect an evil god, the candidate for sainthood, Liruna, must seek out the four Sealing Orbs. It\'s up to Liruna to end the ritual and save herself... and her world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jlv.jpg'),(1440,'Black Widow: Recharged','2021-10-28','Shooter, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The original cult classic arachnid-starring, twin-stick shooter returns! Just in time for Halloween, Black Widow: Recharged has been reimagined for modern gameplay, with vibrant visuals, powerful new abilities, and another original soundtrack from award-winning video game composer Megan McDuffee. Aim for a high score in the old school arcade mode and earn bragging rights with your name at the top of the leaderboard. Or test your skills and rank on the boards in one of 30 intensely creative challenges, which twist the gameplay in new and exciting ways. Collect cash from downed enemies to charge a powerful web blast, or pick up one of a dozen new power-ups including explosive blasts, spread-shots, and fear, trapping all enemies in your web. Every mode and level is playable in local co-op mode with a friend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z5l.jpg'),(1441,'Crawling Lab','2024-06-17','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Obtain ammo and upgrade your guns to defeat the Crawling Queen\'s minions. Escape from the lab.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82k7.jpg'),(1442,'Crysmalia: Dawn of Darkness','2020-06-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Something sinister is going on behind closed doors in the Kingdom of Lestyr, and it would have remained unbeknownst to its citizens and to the rest of the world... If it weren\'t for Siena, a nonchalant bandit, who stumbled upon the kingdom\'s hidden secret and lived to tell the tale.\n\nAlong with a runaway princess, a sharp-tongued knight, and a mysterious mage with a questionable past, Siena must now fight for his freedom and for the freedom of others, without knowing that this quest would also lead him to a long-lost legacy he never knew he shouldered.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r3i.jpg'),(1443,'Pixel Pirates','2025-03-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pixel Pirates is an action-adventure game where you\'ll take on the role of the reluctant hero, James Flint.\n\nThe cursed Captain Blackwood has unleashed chaos in his pursuit for power, and it’s up to you to rise to stop him. Battle creatures and fearsome pirates on land and sea, explore and uncover secrets across handcrafted islands, collect unique items, seek treasure, and embark on a thrilling quest to save the world — all in this byte-sized, swashbuckling adventure.\n\nThis game is currently in Early Access and is actively in development.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iio.jpg'),(1444,'CanvasCraft','2016-12-22','Puzzle','Windows Mobile, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fun and addictive puzzle game! Mix and Match Colors! Infinite Gameplay!\n\nARCADE MODE:\nRace against the time to match your canvas with an automatically generated one. Complete the canvas as fast as you can to earn more points!\n\nPRACTICE MODE:\nPlay casually and take all the time you need when mixing and matching your colors on your canvas.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1445,'Betrayed',NULL,'Shooter, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter Betrayed, a 3-16 player party shooter where trust is scarce, and deception is paramount. Navigate diverse maps, use proximity voice chat to strategize, and earn currency for traitorous tools. Will you prove innocence or master deception? Gather your friends for suspense and laughter!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81n7.jpg'),(1446,'MindHunt','2022-11-14','Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','MindHunt is a solo/multiplayer detective like game (1-10 players), where you as an agent try to find out which androids are infected in order to shut them down! Well, if you are the infected one, you better blend with other androids and complete all tasks necessary!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5plf.jpg'),(1447,'Sinthome',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Sin plataforma','Sinthome is a first-person 3D action RPG game that blends Roguelike elements. You revive time and time again in an enigmatic mansion room, venturing solo into the basement to face horrifying monsters, seemingly never finding an end...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9khx.jpg'),(1448,'Carmageddon: Splat Pack','1998-12-31','Racing','DOS','Carmageddon: Splat Pack is the only official expansion pack for Carmageddon. Released in 1997, it added several new cars, power-ups and levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ibr.jpg'),(1449,'SeaBed','2017-12-20','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','SeaBed is a yuri-themed mystery visual novel told through the perspectives of three separate characters: Mizuno Sachiko, a designer plagued by hallucinations of her past lover; Narasaki Hibiki, Sachiko\'s friend and a psychiatrist researching the workings of human memories; and Takako, Sachiko\'s former lover who has been rapidly forgetting her past, including how or why the two women drifted apart despite being together since childhood.\n\nAll three live in different worlds, but seek the same goal. To separate truth from illusion. To make sense of their own lives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21n4.jpg'),(1450,'Peg','2017-10-01','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Peg is a minimalist take to the traditional solitaire game of the same name. The goal of the game is to leave two pieces on the board (one of each color) by following the rule: \"Blue eats blue, red eats red.\" A puzzler that is deceptively simple but hard to master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jrd.jpg'),(1451,'Midvinter','2016-05-05','Point-and-click, Music, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this cozy little point-and-click fairy-tale, you are a gnome on an abandoned farm. When you realize that humans have come to live there once more, you find yourself useful again - but also that you might have to work harder than ever to keep them safe from the dark creatures that lurk out in the forest. You might even have to call on some of the fair folks for help. Their aid, however, does not come without a price...\n\nThe game draws heavily from Swedish folk lore, with art inspired by artists such as John Bauer and Alvaro Tapia. It uses puzzles and riddles to tell its story, and there are several different ends to it. The player will also get to experience unique music and compelling voice over, as well as discover part of Sweden\'s history, since the game takes place in the 19th century - a time where over a million people left the country to avoid starvation and build a new life for themselves.\n\nThis game was created by one person, Anna Jenelius, over 6 months - plus composer Douglas Holmquist who made the wonderful music. It fits anyone who would like to experience an atmospheric and cozy fairy-tale, that might remind you of the stories you heard as a child.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/iuabc2sbj0isqxc37txm.jpg'),(1452,'Pixel Transit','2025-04-07','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pixel Transit is a game where you construct a transit system in an infinitely vast, tile-based world. Your goal is to design efficient transportation networks that enable people to reach their destinations as quickly as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n9h.jpg'),(1453,'Escape from the Collector',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','In \"Escape from the Collector\", you will be trapped in an old house full of puzzles and secrets. Explore its rooms searching clues that will guide your adventure. Each puzzle solved brings you closer to freedom or dooms you to be trapped in the Collector\'s sinister game. Will you be able to escape?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88d6.jpg'),(1454,'Peril','2023-07-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Peril you play as Robyn, the Daughter of one of the Ranger\'s who were first sent in through the Slip-gates.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1455,'Speedboat Challenge','2016-10-05','Sin género','Xbox One','Take the challenge and drive against the best pilots of the world!\n\nSpeedboat Challenge is a high quality motorboat race simulation. Make your driving career in the powerboat league. You drive a configurable high power speedboat on different race tracks through amazing landscapes.\n\n- singleplayer league, practice and treasure hunt\n- high-end autopilot with lifelike computer driving, like real players\n- impressive real-time physics with realistic movements and reactions\n- light model with sunshine, artificial light, darkness and real-time shadows\n\nTake a introduction in tutorial and gather additional experience in practice with your coach. Your first race can start very soon. Collecting your win bonus enables you to upgrade your boat and be competitive in higher league levels.\n\n- 19 race tracks\n- 5 landscapes\n- 8 weather variations\n- 7 boats simultaneously\n- 5 configurable boat parameters\n- 10 levels\n- 50 racing goals\n\nYour speedboat pilot career brings you to diverse race tracks in amazing landscapes around the world:\n\n- Norway Fiord\n- Bavaria Water Speed Park\n- Metropia City Maze\n- Alpine Canyon\n- Caribbean Islands\n\nEach landscape has a charm of its own. Take the time to watch the details and enjoy the atmosphere of unique water tracks in different weather conditions.\n\n- ocean, river and channel tracks\n- underground city sewerage\n- underground thunder dome\n- mountain canyon and tunnel\n- ocean and river islands\n- waterfalls and waves\n- ramps and fire challenges\n- rocks and shelf\n- jurassic beach\n\nSpeedboat Challenge is a race game. It does not include any fighting, killing or violence.\n\nDriving a powerboat, even in a simulation, is a task that needs to be learned and practiced. With the help of the trainer and by upgrading your boat, you can improve your skills step by step and become an experienced driver in an amazing high sophisticated league.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sfrzyg9bbxocyz7w2xpl.jpg'),(1456,'Tokimeki Memorial: Densetsu no Ki no Shita de','1996-02-09','Simulator','Super Famicom','Tokimeki Memorial is a dating sim by Konami and the first game in the Tokimeki Memorial series.\n\nThe first game in the series is particularly notable for its \"bomb\" feature, where neglected, infrequently-dated girls would eventually become angry and gossip to their friends, severely reducing love meters across the board. In the middle of the game, when the number of known girls was high, these \"bombs\" became the primary concern of the player, forcing careful planning and strategies like round-robin dating. Although the feature was still present in the later games, it was considerably reduced in importance and the difficulty in avoiding it.\n\nIn 1996, it was ported to the Super Famicom as Tokimeki Memorial: Densetsu no Ki no Shita de, and although drastically reduced in graphic and sound quality (the only voice clips were available during loading), included an exclusive CD with a radio drama and new arrangement of the ending theme, \"Futari no Toki\", this time sung by the majority of the girls, instead of just Shiori Fujisaki (the heroine of the first game).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ngh.jpg'),(1457,'Heileen 2: The Hands Of Fate','2014-05-03','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The game picks up directly after the end of the first game taking place on a mysterious Caribbean island where Heileen was shipwrecked with her friends.\n\nHeileen soon discovers a deck of tarot cards representative of the seven deadly sins and the seven heavenly virtues. The cards have the power to change both her dreams and her reality, and will help Heileen discover many hidden things from her past, and ultimately what she wants to be? A saint, or a sinner?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co429a.jpg'),(1458,'TIC\'s Revenge',NULL,'Shooter, Arcade','Web browser','TIC\'s CPU is being invaded by rival fantasy computers: hold them off through four levels using the built-in zapper. Each level lasts for a minute and you have four \'lives\' in total. Shouldn\'t be too difficult to complete and get a score of 10,000+.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1459,'Eighteen','2022-06-08','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You awaken in a house that is not yours. You are haunted by a past that you hope is not yours. You are given a name that you fear can never truly be yours.\n\nYou are Tohya Hachijo.\n\n...Or are you?\n\nIn this short interactive experience, take control of an amnesiac looking to find his footing in the home of a strange woman, as he discovers his past -- or runs from it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80tf.jpg'),(1460,'Payday 3: Boys In Blue - Chapter 2','2024-06-28','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Chapter 2 - Boys in Blue is the second DLC as part of the Silver & Gold editions.\nThis chapter contains:\nThe Boys in Blue Heist\nThe Boys in Blue Tailor Pack\nThe Boys in Blue Weapon Pack\n\nWhat would you do if some corrupt cops raided your completely legitimate business, planted some evidence, and showed every sign of wanting to keep the gold they “confiscated”? Well, in Vlad’s case, he got in touch with his old friends in the Payday Gang to enact revenge and get his damn gold back.\nThe Boys in Blue Heist tasks the gang with breaking into a secure holding facility of the NYPD on Vlad’s behalf. He wants his gold back, and the gang has never let him down before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8euj.jpg'),(1461,'X-Men vs. Street Fighter','1996-10-04','Fighting, Arcade','Arcade, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','X-Men vs. Street Fighter is a fighting game originally released as a coin-operated arcade game in 1996. It is Capcom\'s third fighting game to feature Marvel Comics characters and the first game to match them against their own, with characters from Marvel\'s X-Men franchise being matched against the cast from the Street Fighter series.\n\nIt was the first game to blend a tag team style of combat with the Street Fighter gameplay, as well as incorporating elements from Capcom\'s previous Marvel-themed fighting games, X-Men: Children of the Atom and Marvel Super Heroes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8poj.jpg'),(1462,'Video World','2021-01-22','Music, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Video World is a Halloween synth-pop musical about working at a video store. It is a companion video-game to the EP \'Video World\' from Australian synth-pop artist Monster Mansion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2otn.jpg'),(1463,'Deadly Contagion','2024-01-22','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In 2006, three forest rangers and a mysterious ABIN agent are sent to a mansion in a small town. Upon arrival, strange events begin to unfold. Manage your inventory, investigate the mysteries of the mansion, and survive if you can.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82e1.jpg'),(1464,'Disney\'s Atlantis: The Lost Empire - Trial by Fire','2001-05-18','Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unlock the secrets and unleash the adventure. Your rite of passage begins with Disney\'s Atlantis: The Lost Empire, Trial By Fire CD-ROM. You assume the role of Milo in the single-player mode, and, aided by several members of the Atlantis exploration team, undergo intense trials based upon the four elements of ancient Greek philosophy: fire, water, air, and earth. Bravely making your way through mind-bending puzzles, diabolical traps, and the formidable denizens of Atlantis, your ultimate quest in this first-person action adventure is to save the legendary city from certain destruction by a cataclysmic volcanic eruption.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6iec.jpg'),(1465,'Nemoto Harumi Eizou Play','2003-07-17','Simulator','PlayStation 2','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bh9.jpg'),(1466,'Dice With Death','2025-05-07','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dice With Death is a Dicebuilding Roguelike – Unfortunately you have already died. Fortunately, Death is up for some friendly competition. Collect new dice and their paired relics, create damage stacking combos, and even cheat Death himself to emerge victorious.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fwj.jpg'),(1467,'Unending Dawn',NULL,'Sin género','Android, iOS, PlayStation 5','The anime open-world action RPG \"Unending Dawn\" under development by Chinese studio Parcae’s Fate Studio. it will launch for PlayStation 5, iOS and Android.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co848x.jpg'),(1468,'Dragonica Mama','2025-02-11','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jdi.jpg'),(1469,'Yuzusoft Collection',NULL,'Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yuzusoft Collection includes:\n-Sabbat of the Witch\n-Parquet\n-Riddle Joker\n-Café Stella and the Reaper\'s Butterflies\n-Senren * Banka','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4txu.jpg'),(1470,'Starl Metaverse Project','2022-07-01','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A grassroots space-themed metaverse and gaming project, the STARL Metaverse Project was built from the ground up by a team of community-sourced and AAA game developers and designers. It contains rich and sometimes outlandish designs, themes, environments, and characters that go beyond the mainstream and standard metaverse projects.\n\nStarting out as a crypto token, it has evolved into a full-fledged game and environment built in Unreal Engine 5 and utilizing both on-chain and offchain assets so users can choose their level of involvement with blockchain technology. As the project\'s theme indicates, \"Be Yourself\" is the goal, and deep customization extends beyond characters to ships and environments.\n\nThere are portals within the STARL environment connecting to many aspects of the environment, such as the MMO Space flight, battle, and trading game Warp Nexus, live events arenas, living modules to conquer solar systems, meditation rooms, themed lounges, and the goal of integrating education into the environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wyt.jpg'),(1471,'Hyrule Warriors: Age of Calamity','2020-11-19','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','See Hyrule 100 years before the Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild game and experience the events of the Great Calamity.\n\nJoin the struggle that brought Hyrule to its knees. Learn more about Zelda, the four Champions, the King of Hyrule and more through dramatic cutscenes as they try to save the kingdom from Calamity. The Hyrule Warriors: Age of Calamity game is the only way to see firsthand what happened 100 years ago.\n\nBattle hordes of Hyrule’s most formidable foes. From barbaric Bokoblins to towering Lynels, menacing monsters have emerged in droves. In addition to Link and Zelda, take control of characters like the four Champions and a young Impa. Use their distinct abilities to carve through hundreds of enemies to save Hyrule from the impending Calamity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p4a.jpg'),(1472,'Eyeless','2013-01-28','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Mario has lost his eyes. He must finds his eyes in this surreal SMW romhack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75ow.jpg'),(1473,'Estate Empire',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Estate Empire is a multiplayer strategic game inspired by classic board games. Compete against your friends and develop your own strategy to win, and try to dismantle your friend\'s empire. Invest in the same street as your friends, use your cards or become the mayor to create new laws against them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7clu.jpg'),(1474,'Mottainai Ghost','2025-07-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Don\'t allow food waste! A horror-flavored, exploration-based gluttonous adventure game where you aim to escape the apartment while running from the MOTTAINAI GHOST!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o4b.jpg'),(1475,'Kamen Rider: Battride War','2013-05-23','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3','Kamen Rider: Battride War is a video game based on the Kamen Rider Series, released for the PlayStation 3 on May 23, 2013. Done in the style of Dynasty Warriors, the player controls one of the Kamen Riders as he battles through a series of enemies. The game mainly features the protagonists of the Heisei era of Kamen Rider, starting with 2000\'s Kamen Rider Kuuga and featuring up to 2013\'s Kamen Rider Wizard. Showa-era Kamen Riders were originally meant to be released as downloadable content, but only two alternate versions of characters were released instead. A limited edition of the game was released that has a soundtrack that includes the original theme songs from the TV series and films.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jz9.jpg'),(1476,'The Shattering','2020-04-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Shattering is a first-person, story-driven, psychological thriller that takes place in the pristine white aesthetic of protagonist John Evans\' own dream. Players must piece together the fragments of the past and present, following the voice of the \'Doctor\' as he guides them deeper into John’s mind.\nPlayers will experience the key moments of John\'s life that have defined and shaped him - they will be tasked with discovering the truth, shattering the lies and, ultimately, finding out what happened to him... and to remember her name.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m7k.jpg'),(1477,'Grog \'n Glory',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Avast, ye scallywags! Dive headfirst into the rollicking world of \"Grog \'n Glory,\" which thrusts you into the heart of the high seas as a cunning captain. Manage your crew, customize your ship, and navigate the treacherous waters as you plunder and raid your way to infamy. Live the pirate\'s life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wib.jpg'),(1478,'Aa! Megami-sama','1997-12-12','Adventure','PC-FX, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','The game is a remake of the computer game of the same name. It adds an animated intro, voice-overs, and two mini-games.\n\nThe story is based on the manga/anime series Ah! My Goddess, depicting the adventures of Keiichi, a Japanese teenager who accidentally summoned the Norse goddess Verdandi (misspelled \"Belldandy\" in the romanization) and made a wish for her to stay with him forever, which led to all kinds of troubles. What\'s more, other powerful beings out there are seeking to harm Keiichi\'s divine girlfriend, so a simple date ends in an unexpected way...\n\nThe game is a \"digital comic\", meaning that the adventure elements are reduced to the bare minimum: being able to choose dialogue lines or make other decisions from time to time. The mini-games are a timed exercise of putting puzzle pieces together, and a card-matching game against two female opponents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xc8.jpg'),(1479,'A Difficult Game About Rolling: ReUpRise','2024-04-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a difficult game about Rolling.\nEmbark on an unparalleled journey to the summit through an unforgiving landscape of mountains, waterfalls, and ancient ruins, all surrounded by the vast, unending ocean.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co854s.jpg'),(1480,'Battlefield: Bad Company 2 - Digital Deluxe Edition','2010-03-02','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This edition includes Battlefield: Bad Company 2 game and Battlefield: Bad Company 2 - Vietnam expansion pack. It also features instant access to four vehicle unlockables and three weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gjq.jpg'),(1481,'Ao Oni 3D','2022-12-21','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unreal Engine 5 Remake of the \"Ao Oni\" RPG maker game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zor.jpg'),(1482,'Deme Game','2024-05-06','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fangame made for a twitch streamer and vtuber deme. Currently in early development since February 2023.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co861e.jpg'),(1483,'The Doorway Effect','2025-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Doorway Effect is a 1-4-player co-op psychological horror roguelike. Explore the inner world of a dying man\'s mind, racing through door after door in a labyrinth of nightmares. Encounter traumas incarnate, and discover the secrets locked within. If you can survive long enough...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tqn.jpg'),(1484,'Northrealm Tribes',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Northrealm Tribes\" is an exciting strategy game that immerses you in the captivating world of the Vikings. In this game, you take on the role of a tribal leader and delve into the rugged and thrilling era of the Norsemen. Your task is to establish, expand, and protect a flourishing settlement while meeting the needs and desires of your inhabita...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lay.jpg'),(1485,'1D Game','2021-02-08','Sin género','Web browser','A first-person game from the perspective of a 2D life form, which makes it a 1D game. Try to make it to level 5 without getting a headache!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f95.jpg'),(1486,'Jurassic Life: Tyrannosaurus Rex Dinosaur Simulator','2014-06-29','Simulator, Adventure','Android, iOS','Travel back in time to a lost world of dinosaurs and live life as a ferocious Tyrannosaurus Rex! Explore a vast prehistoric jungle filled with danger at every turn. Raise a family, hunt down food, and battle for your life against legendary dinosaurs like the Pterodactyl, Triceratops, Velociraptor and many more!\n\nYou\'ll need to maintain your health, hunger, thirst and energy if you\'re going to survive in a hostile prehistoric jungle! Use your powerful jaws, ferocious roar, and swift speed to catch a tasty snack and fight dangerous foes! Find a mate to bond with and raise your very own family of dinosaurs to help you hunt! Watch your babies grow in size and assist you in combat! Gain experience by defeating other dinosaurs and level up your T. Rex family to increase their health, attack damage, and even unlock new attacks! Look to your handy survival guide for information on enemy dinosaurs, a map of the island, and a bonus fossil scavenger hunt! Your T. Rex is free to roam a massive open-world tropical island filled with dangerous dinosaurs, towering trees, and hidden treasures!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co306m.jpg'),(1487,'Yu-Gi-Oh! Monster Capsule: Breed and Battle','1998-07-23','Simulator, Strategy, Card & Board Game','PlayStation','Yu-Gi-Oh! Monster Capsule: Breed and Battle, frequently abbreviated \"MCBB\", is the first Yu-Gi-Oh! video game, released by Konami on July 23, 1998 for the Playstation. It features a more well-developed variant of the Capsule Monster Chess game from the manga.\n\nMonster Capsule: Breed and Battle is the only video game to feature Capsule Monster Chess, though Yu-Gi-Oh! Monster Capsule GB features a modified version of the game and many of the monsters from MCBB, and Yu-Gi-Oh! Capsule Monster Coliseum features the spinoff game Capsule Monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xnk.jpg'),(1488,'The Sims 2','2005-12-07','Simulator','PlayStation Portable','The PlayStation Portable version of the game is played in third person. The game contains elements of role-playing games and has more of a solid storyline the player is required to navigate through in order to unlock most of the things available in the other versions.\n\nThe option to build your own home is replaced by a pre-built home where you can customize the furniture and decor. Conversations and jobs are carried out via a mini-game function. The player\'s character does not age, nor are they able to marry or have children, but they can have a significant other and \"WooHoo\".\n\nRelationships are mainly used for the point of solving goals, though a close friend may move in with the player after progressing in the game. When the player completes a goal their sanity meter, represented as a Plumbob, will fill up slightly and if the player actively doesn\'t complete their goals the sanity meter will rapidly deplete until the player is hospitalised or abducted by aliens.\n\nThe player can also earn \"Sanity Points\" by completing goals which they can use to unlock special perks. Another feature unique to this, and the Nintendo DS, version are \"Secrets\" which the player can find scattered around Strangetown or by socialising with characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g19.jpg'),(1489,'The 3rd Birthday','2010-12-22','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation Portable','The game is an action role-playing game described by Square Enix as a \"cinematic action RPG\". Director Hajime Tabata noted that the gameplay and plot are intertwined due to a newly introduced ability called \"Overdive,\" an ability that lets the player switch bodies with one of their team members, allowing them to control friendly NPCs. Teammates can be ordered either to target specific enemies or to defend themselves in combat. The player is able change their controlled character in real-time, intermixed with their combat actions. The game is played over-the-shoulder, comparable to games such as Resident Evil 4, Dead Space and the Mass Effect series. An array of different costumes will be available for Aya to choose from throughout the game, but only after they are unlocked by completing the game in various difficulty modes. Clothing in the game deteriorates due to battle damage, revealing Aya\'s skin to various degrees.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tmw.jpg'),(1490,'Weird creatures','2016-12-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blow-up your mind with the easy fantasy shooting simulator. You will travel across forests, deserts and snowy mountains, accompanied by a powerful ally vehicle to care of. Various weird inhabitants resist you to collect art pieces. Ever struggle to be rewarded.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1491,'Chronicon','2020-08-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Use the magical device known as the Chronicon to travel into the souls and memories of fallen heroes to re-live their grand tales! Epic adventures full of loot and monsters await!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pqx.jpg'),(1492,'Hyper Lode Runner','1990-02-01','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','Game Boy','Your objective is to gather gold that is scattered on the brick platforms, which are connected by ladders. You are chased by robots (cyborgs) that end your character\'s life if they catch him, though you can stand on their heads. Your main weapon is the ability to dig both to the left and right of your character. The holes you dig are only temporary and fill themselves in. A robot that falls into one of your holes will be destroyed if the hole fills in before it can escape. Your character can also suffer this same fate, ending his life. Destroyed robots are replaced with new ones that appear from the top of the screen. The robots can also carry gold which they drop if they fall into a hole. The robot\'s movements are dependent on yours, and a significant facet of the game play is figuring out how to use the robot\'s movements to your advantage in clearing a stage. Besides bricks and ladders, levels also consist of blocks (which can\'t be dug into), rope (to traverse platform chasms) and crumbling bricks (which you fall through). Once all gold has been retrieved a missing segment of ladder will appear allowing your character to escape to the next level. Some levels contain keys and doors which provide an alternate way to leave a level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hgi.jpg'),(1493,'Heroes of Maidan 3','2019-12-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','“We face a difficult combat task - to cleanse our land from Russians” Take part in the liberation of the occupied territories of the Crimean peninsula','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42d1.jpg'),(1494,'Funko Fusion: Universal Monsters Pack Bundle','2025-02-14','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Experience a festival of fandom like never before in Funko Fusion!\n\nPlay through iconic worlds and mashup characters inspired by some of your favorite franchises in an action-adventure game with uniquely authentic, irreverent humor from the creative minds of 10:10 Games.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1495,'Gunbug',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1496,'Mnemonic',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1497,'Army Men','1998-01-01','Strategy, Tactical, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Army Men is a mission-based combat game that has you guiding a green plastic commando named Sarge in warfare against a tan-colored toy army. Soldiers use bazookas, grenades, flamethrowers, mortars, automatic rifles, and land mines to trash each other. You can also drive jeeps and tanks across the varied terrain. To help you learn the controls, a boot camp option offers a series of eight training missions.\n\nOnce you are ready, choose from two campaigns: desert and alpine. Review your objectives before each mission on the briefing screen, and prepare for battle against an onslaught of plastic troops. A mission will fail if you exceed the time limit, allow your rivals to win, or let Sarge die. The options screen lets you view current objectives, consult a strategic map, exit vehicles, and abort your mission. You can also adjust the control scheme, select a difficulty level, and toggle music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yq2.jpg'),(1498,'Football, Tactics & Glory','2018-06-01','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Football, Tactics & Glory is a football management game for strategy lovers.\n\nFootball, Tactics & Glory reinvents the basics of the football management genre, making it appealing to everyone, not just the most hardcore football management aficionados. The game skips the boring parts of football management games – all those endless tables, numbers, routine and micromanagement. But it is deep enough to keep players engrossed for hundreds of hours.\n\nIf you enjoy turn-based gameplay, strategy or tycoon games, you will love Football, Tactics & Glory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y5s.jpg'),(1499,'Adventure Time: Finn and Jake Investigations','2015-10-20','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Adventure Time: Finn & Jake Investigations is an upcoming action adventure video game developed by Vicious Cycle Software under license from Cartoon Network Interactive. This is the fourth game based on the animated television series Adventure Time following The Secret of the Nameless Kingdom, and the first action adventure title in the series presented in full 3D graphics.\n\nIn this game, players can check out \"Land of Ooo locales, talk to characters, sharpen their creative puzzle-solving skills, defeat bad guys and just have fun.\" Loosely based on the TV show\'s sixth season, the game features \"a focus on exploring, investigating, and puzzle-solving. Thanks to the discovery of an assignment printing machine called the \'tickertype,\' Finn and Jake decide to become detectives like Joshua and Margaret (Finn and Jake\'s parents). Finn\'s sword will see a bit of action too, allowing players to fill the Tree House treasure room full of enemy drops.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vh7.jpg'),(1500,'The Nights on Arcade',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','In The Nights on Arcade, Axel searches for his sister in the spooky Arcade World. Face your fears and reveal dark secrets in this nightmare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e72.jpg'),(1501,'Game Dev Arcade','2022-05-09','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Game Dev Arcade is a collection of indie mini-games developed by Bulwark Creative. The source code will be available so you can see how they were developed! Play the games yourself, and then check out all the nitty gritty details that go in to making simple video games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51ze.jpg'),(1502,'Heroes of Might and Magic V: Bundle','2006-05-19','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63l0.jpg'),(1503,'Dangerous Relationship','2016-08-23','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','\"Dangerous Relationship\" is a game where you can enjoy the dangerous world of dating a celebrity. Get seduced while you\'re on the job and try to keep your relationship a secret!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2y08.jpg'),(1504,'Cursed Ones','2024-10-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cursed Ones is a 1-2 player co-op horror survival game.\nPlay as the Crane siblings as you continue your late parents\' legacy to purge the world of sinister spirits.\nTrack down the items used to summon the spirit by any means necessary.\n\nMake sure you both don\'t die in the process.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8usl.jpg'),(1505,'Super Cursor','2025-05-16','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Start your journey in Cursor Ville, where you\'ll be tested in your precision, agility, patience, and determination! Will you be able make your ways through the treacherous world and save your beloved princess? Aim, dodge, move, and most importantly, never give up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8apc.jpg'),(1506,'Drive Up','2023-11-02','Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a thrilling journey in \'Drive Up.\' Scale the floating objects on a mysterious island in the ocean. There are no saves; one fall, and you\'re back to square one. How high can you climb?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bpe.jpg'),(1507,'The Monarch','2024-04-03','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Monarch is a 3D lane-defence game where you control a monarch, expand your kingdom, and defend against The Evil Queen and her undead army by strategically managing gold resources, recruiting diverse units, and exploring a world filled with mythical threats.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co817k.jpg'),(1508,'Project X Zone: Limited Edition','2013-07-04','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Project X Zone is a crossover tactical role-playing game for the Nintendo 3DS developed by Monolith Soft with assistance from Capcom and Red Entertainment and published by Namco Bandai Games. The game is a follow up to the 2005 video game Namco × Capcom and features characters from Namco Bandai, Capcom, and Sega. The game was released on October 11, 2012 in Japan; June 25, 2013 in North America; and July 5, 2013 in Europe. The game received mixed to positive reviews on release; praise went towards the game\'s cast, combat system, and presentation, but criticism was directed at its repetitive gameplay and confusing storyline.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ssz.jpg'),(1509,'Project Downfall','2019-03-15','Fighting, Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','An overdose of reality can have dire consequences… Descend down the rabbit hole and embrace your Downfall in a trippy, brutal and stylized adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p6m.jpg'),(1510,'Kidou Senshi Z-Gundam: Away to the NewType','1996-03-01','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy','Super Famicom','Kidou Senshi Z-Gundam: Away to the NewType is a Strategy game, published by Bandai, which was released in Japan in 1996.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a3b.jpg'),(1511,'Ghost Town','2021-10-04','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','This story game brings a unique and fun twist to choose your own story adventures. you\'ll love making choices in this interactive story game!\nOne choice can change everything!\nImmerse yourself in a mysterious story where you make the choices and decide the ultimate fate of other people!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8at8.jpg'),(1512,'The Grass of Genesis',NULL,'Fighting, Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','This third-person action-adventure seems to be akin to the beloved Tomb Raider series and the adrenaline-packed John Wick film franchise. The gameplay video showcases a prototype that introduces various gameplay elements and engaging animated cinematic sequences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dlk.jpg'),(1513,'World Champions: Decathlon','2021-08-30','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','World Champs is a series of retro style sports games for whole Family. Includes all favorite disciplines: 100 m, Long jump, Shot put, High jump, 400 m, 110 m hurdles, Discus throw, Pole vault, Javelin throw and 1500 m. Compete with time in Single Player or in PvP Mode both - Online and Local!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3r63.jpg'),(1514,'Corrupted Sector','2020-04-08','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Medium-sized base map. Comes with a few new sounds, a custom skybox and a music track. The map source is included.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co781n.jpg'),(1515,'Rabbids Travel in Time 3D','2011-04-12','Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Rabbids are bwaaack and this time they have an infallible plan: travel back in time and invade human history! Plunge into the past with the wacky Rabbids and revisit the greatest moments of history like the discovery of fire, the broken nose of the Sphinx or the legend of Arthur. Uncover how Rabbids wreaked havoc and changed the course of history...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6iyr.jpg'),(1516,'Wheelchair Simulator','2018-06-12','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wheelchair Simulator is a comedic game about a serious issue. Learn how it feels like to ride a wheelchair through a city that\'s completely ignorant to your needs. Profits go to charity!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1517,'Lord of Darkness','2008-12-24','Simulator, Strategy','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Wii, Super Famicom','Nobunaga\'s Ambition: Lord of Darkness is the fourth game in the Nobunaga series (but only the third one to have been localized in English). The story of Nobunaga takes place during the Japanese civil war of the 16th century. In a wartime strategy game, 15 different warlords are represented across several territories. One to eight human players can play, controlling different leaders and factions. Gameplay is done in one of two scenarios; the beginning of the civil war in 1555 or Nobunaga surrounded by his enemies in 1571. Management of population, supplies and military are the gameplay and successful manipulation of these numbers in the right combination to attack and defend against hostile intentions is what will bring your forces to victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3sjq.jpg'),(1518,'Apple Bag',NULL,'Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Working the late-night shift as a cashier in a small town, you starts to form good relations with your regulars. Between flirtations and friendly banter, the specter of a mysterious disappearance haunts your nights as you’re exposed to more and more suspicious behaviors. Are your regulars linked to the missing student, and, more importantly, will you secure a Halloween date?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7irw.jpg'),(1519,'Abridge','2022-10-14','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Abridge is an abstract, Sokoban puzzle game. Select pieces to move, pull and shift them around into a goal. The colorful shapes on them determine their movement and abilities. Remove them all from the board to solve these hand-crafted, challenging puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57h1.jpg'),(1520,'Mystical Mushrooms','2025-01-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Mystical Mushrooms you play as Cyne, a pink mushroom girl. You explore the hidden world Bhokniva which is infected with a mysterious disease. Its not deadly, but the people don\'t act normal anymore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pr4.jpg'),(1521,'Grass Simulator','2015-04-01','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Strap it on and lock \'n\' load in Grass Simulator, where you will Shoot, Loot and MOO! your way through multiple game modes revolved around...GRASS! Grass Simulator will revolutionize the way you look at grass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jdk.jpg'),(1522,'Soul Master','1997-11-20','Role-playing (RPG), Card & Board Game','PlayStation','The player enters a magic school as an apprentice wizard.\nThe player is sent to an area where monsters are running rampant and exterminate them.\nThe monsters are placed at the top of a pyramid, and the four players advance from the four corners to the top.\nThe first player to exterminate the monsters wins the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co482z.jpg'),(1523,'Cats in Cozy Rooms','2025-12-31','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A charming room-decorating game with a feline twist! Hand-drawn art, unique cat clients, and endless creativity—decorate rooms based on each cat’s likes and dislikes to make their dream home! A relaxing, artistic game full of charm and creativity!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g1l.jpg'),(1524,'Mussoumano: Saving Latifas','2014-04-28','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Ouya, Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Mussoumano: Saving Latifas is an endless runner where the rapper and YouTuber Mussoumano must save his fans who have been kidnapped by haters and trolls while he was playing video games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pzk.jpg'),(1525,'FromWithin',NULL,'Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A top down ole school shooter with great graphics','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1526,'American Truck Simulator: Steampunk Paint Jobs Pack','2023-04-18','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This pack is the perfect way to add some personality and style to your rig, with a single unique paint job for every truck, three common paints for all trucks, and two corresponding variants for ownable trailers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t6i.jpg'),(1527,'Star Wars: DroidWorks','1998-10-21','Quiz/Trivia','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Star Wars: DroidWorks is a 1998 edutainment computer game and the premiere title from LucasArts subsidiary Lucas Learning. It uses the same engine as LucasArts\' previous title Star Wars: Jedi Knight. The creators aimed to create a game that would be both appealing and nonviolent. The game\'s original release date was moved up by months, which resulted in the development team cutting some planned game features.\n\nThe game\'s plot involves the player saving the galaxy by manufacturing droids with specific abilities, such as the ability to see in the dark or jump, to complete missions. The educational portions of these missions teach players about concepts such as energy, force, motion, simple machines, light, and magnetism.\n\nStar Wars: DroidWorks received high praise from critics, sold well, and won numerous awards and accolades.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74jb.jpg'),(1528,'Harvest Moon: Friends of Mineral Town','2003-04-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Wii U, Game Boy Advance','Turn a long-neglected field of rocks and weeds into a successful farm in this rustic role-playing game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25u5.jpg'),(1529,'Distorted world',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Distorted World – is an indie first-person shooter with horror elements. The action in this game takes place in a parallel reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3op9.jpg'),(1530,'Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition - Dynasties of India','2022-04-28','Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This expansion brings three new civilizations of India plus three full new campaigns to Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition for the first time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yca.jpg'),(1531,'School of Talent: Suzu-Route','2017-02-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The \"Untalented\" one\'s \"Talent\", that surpasses all things.\n\nWelcome to Mikage Academy, a famed educational institute that prides itself on being the home school of prime ministers, world-renowned artists, great businessmen, and all sorts of other movers and shakers of society. What\'s their secret? They accept only students with Talents – special powers that border on magic, granted by the divine, said to only occur in one in every ten thousand people by the time they reach adolescence.\n\nI\'m in love with this girl, Yuki Suzu, the dorm leader of the elites on campus, the White Lilies. And you know where I am on the pecking order? The very bottom of the Black Roses, a pack of slackers and rejects. And you guessed it – our dorms get along like cats and dogs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jcd.jpg'),(1532,'10 Second Escape','2024-04-23','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','10 Second Escape is a cyber styled skill based platformer where you have to beat the clock to progress, because you only have 10 seconds to get to a checkpoint.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rq8.jpg'),(1533,'Poop Killer 7','2023-06-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Poop Killer 7 is a sequel inspired by the trash horror movies of the 80\'s and 90\'s. Using references from the movie \"Scary Movie\" among others... Mixing horror and comedy creating a bizarre and funny experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l0d.jpg'),(1534,'Silent Hill Exotica','2016-12-31','Sin género','Xbox','Silent Hill Exotica is a mod for the Xbox version for Grand Theft Auto: Vice City that is based on the Silent Hill series. The mod was considered lost media for years, often times just being considered a myth, until it later resurfaced in 2023.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9138.jpg'),(1535,'Go Fish by Webfoot',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1536,'Arrow Busters',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1537,'Ultra Hard! Spot the Difference Challenge','2024-06-27','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1538,'Harvest Moon: Another Wonderful Life','2005-07-26','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Nintendo GameCube','Another Wonderful Life\'s gameplay is very similar to its predecessors, involving growing crops while taking care of the variety of animals inhabiting the farm.\n\nThe game also includes the ability to court three bachelors and marry one of them by the end of the first chapter of the story. The game progresses through 6 chapters in the game, which shows the player character going from young adulthood to old age.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xk8.jpg'),(1539,'Foul Repercussion','2023-10-01','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Challenged by his friends, this young boy stayed overnight at school and successfully overcame evil entities... or so he said. Little did he know, everything he told his friends was coming to reality. Will he manage to survive just like what he said in his lies?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lb3.jpg'),(1540,'GB Corp.','2021-10-01','Simulator','Game Boy','GB Corp. is an incremental / idle game for the Game Boy, that rewards you for playing it on several console models. Hire consoles from the Game Boy line (Original GB, GB Pocket, GB Color and Super Game Boy), and they work for your \"push-button\" company. When you have earned enough money, you can hire more employees, and upgrade the ones you have so they bring back more income. Also, you must be careful of their power levels: change the batteries of your employees when they are empty!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5afw.jpg'),(1541,'The Curse of Elmwood','2024-07-20','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You hear quiet whispers from deep inside the house, but no one sees. You begin to feel that you are not alone in this house. Curse of Elmwood is an atmospheric horror where you find yourself trapped in a gloomy 18th century mansion, steeped in mystery and horror.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8k1e.jpg'),(1542,'Undead Line','1992-01-20','Shooter','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','In the beginning, the world was inhabited by gods and giants who fought over which race would rule. To win, the giants created four \"living weapons\" who were so fearsome and effective, both sides lost. The day of the monsters\'s creations would come to be called Ragnarök. Ages later, Count Brahzen, a leader of demons, invaded the Gitane Kingdom, who were able to defend themselves solely by tactical decisions made by their King Fahrenheit II... only to discover Count Brahzen is seeking the Spirit of Roshufa in order to revive one of the four legendary monsters. You are Leon, a fighter chosen by the King to obtain the Spirit before Count Brahzen does.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co988h.jpg'),(1543,'La Guerra de las Vajillas','1988-12-31','Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC','Conversational adventure game, parody in the style of the Mel Brooks movie \"Spaceballs\".\n\nThe video game puts us in the shoes of Martin Luke Skywalker in his ancestral fight against the empire led by the Emperor Karapalo and his second, the fearsome Darth Water.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yh8.jpg'),(1544,'The Little Brave','2025-02-25','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a brave hero and embark to the dangerous journey though mysterious forbidden lands. Reveal secrets of the legendary past, find the last pieces of gone magic and gain courage to slay the terrible monster!\n\nThe Little Brave is a 2D action-adventure immersive metroidvania about a little boy Keely. Get ready for an exciting adventure. Uncover the secrets of an old tale, gain bravery and strength on the path!\n\nKeely lives in a world in which a long time ago there was magic. But one day a terrible curse distorted the magical places. Keely dreams of embarking on a journey to discover the mystery of forbidden lands and the secrets of the First Wardens past. Once fate gives him such a chance...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99hb.jpg'),(1545,'Tales of Arise: Ultimate Edition','2021-09-10','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','300 years of tyranny. A mysterious mask. Lost pain and memories. Wield the Blazing Sword and join a mysterious, untouchable girl to fight your oppressors. Experience a tale of liberation, featuring characters with next-gen graphical expressiveness!\n\nThe Ultimate Edition includes:\n• Tales of Arise (full game)\n• Premium Travel Pack\n• Adventurer\'s Pack\n• Collaboration Costume Pack\n• 18 additional costumes','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3t5d.jpg'),(1546,'Project Hopes',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jsx.jpg'),(1547,'The Amazing Spider-Man','1990-12-31','Platform, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','In The Amazing Spider-Man, Spider-Man has to rescue his girlfriend Mary Jane who was been kidnapped by the supervillain Mysterio. The whole game takes place in a film set studio.\n\nThis game is primarily a platforming game in which Spider-Man fights against various enemies. Those can be stunned by Spider-Man\'s iconic web substance, but touching them or other hazards in the game world will decrease his health. Another important part of the gameplay is puzzles, mostly with the goal to deactivate some of Mysterio\'s gimmicks to clear the path. Spider-Man can climb walls and shoot grappling hooks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89oi.jpg'),(1548,'The Secret Door',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The Secret Door is a first person psychological horror game. Possessed by demons you once hunted, survive 7 nights in a mind-bending labyrinth. Solve puzzles, evade relentless entities, and unlock The Secret Door to escape. Will you emerge sane?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7eiq.jpg'),(1549,'Knight Crawlers','2023-05-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Knight Crawlers is a dungeon crawling ARPG with physics based ragdoll combat. Each crawl is made unique through dozens of skill cards to choose from. Hunt for loot, craft powerful equipment, and fight your way back home through strange worlds. How deep can you crawl through the endless realms?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4un4.jpg'),(1550,'Fire Emblem: Thracia 776','1999-09-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','Wii, Wii U, New Nintendo 3DS, Super Famicom','Fire Emblem: Thracia 776 is a Japanese tactical role-playing game developed by Intelligent Systems and published by Nintendo, and the fifth installment in the Fire Emblem series. It is also the third and final Fire Emblem series title to be released on the Super Famicom.\n\nFire Emblem: Thracia 776 takes place between Chapters 5 and 6 of the previous game, Fire Emblem: Seisen no Keifu. Several characters from Fire Emblem: Seisen no Keifu appear, such as Leaf, Fin, and Nanna. It takes place in the Thracian peninsula in southeastern Jugdral.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25w5.jpg'),(1551,'All Noobs Must Die','2023-09-14','Shooter, Platform, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A place where wishes come true! You just need to protect the obsidian portal from zombies. Mine resources with your pickaxe, build traps, and put them to use — let them grind the zombies into a juicy green porridge! Funny meme endings!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73r8.jpg'),(1552,'Twelve Sky2 Global','2024-08-08','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Twelve Sky 2 Global\" is a classic version of a large-scale 3D MMORPG online game developed based on \"Twelve Sky 2\" and exclusively operated by BacN Network Technology (Hong Kong) Co., Limited. In addition to continuing the complete game structure of the previous game, it also has more Rich game content, exquisite art expression and fast-paced battle scenes allow players to truly experience the world\'s grudges and never-ending hearty feelings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95tj.jpg'),(1553,'ModularWeaponsGame',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1554,'Panda Pop: Bubble Shooter','2013-12-11','Puzzle, Arcade','iOS','The best bubble shooter game! Blast bubbles, save baby pandas! Play now for free!\n\nPlan your every pop to rescue cute baby pandas! An evil baboon has kidnapped & trapped precious panda pups in the jungle. Blast, match, and pop bubbles to help beat him & return the cubs to their worried mother!\n\nWork your way through increasingly challenging puzzles and employ the power of the elements to help you in your Panda Pop quest. Use epic bubble shooter power ups to free the pups… combine them for even greater effect!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hw7s1gidhmmudh9do6lu.jpg'),(1555,'Ratchet & Clank: Rift Apart - Launch Edition','2021-06-11','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 5','Blast your way through an interdimensional adventure with Ratchet and Clank. This edition includes the Carbonox Armor from 2003\'s Ratchet & Clank: Going Commando and the Pixelizer weapon, which appeared in the 2016 Ratchet & Clank.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yso.jpg'),(1556,'Natures Ascendancy','2024-12-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Natures Ascendancy\" is an exhilarating open-world survival game where players explore a mysterious alien planet, uncover ancient secrets, and survive its treacherous environments. With stunning visuals and immersive gameplay mechanics, embark on an unforgettable journey of discovery and survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co938p.jpg'),(1557,'Be A Rock','2023-03-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A unique 3rd-person exploration game set in a beautiful open world. Your spirit is born in the form of a rock as you explore canyons, deserts, and volcanic lands in order to uncover secrets of the past. The game features puzzle solving, and a distinct storytelling style. For fans of Journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dow.jpg'),(1558,'Euro Truck Simulator 2: West Balkans','2023-10-19','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Discover, deliver and expand your trucking company to the countries of Albania, Bosnia and Herzegovina, Croatia, Kosovo, Montenegro, North Macedonia, Serbia, and Slovenia.\n\nFrom large bustling cities to the countryside filled with beautiful nature, you will be able to explore what the Western Balkans have to offer.\n\nYou can look forward to many new things that these countries have to offer. Whether in terms of the industry, nature, landmarks, road networks, or a lot of other exciting content!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fvu.jpg'),(1559,'City Patrol: Police','2018-11-29','Racing, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','City Patrol: Police is a state-of-the-art Simulation game mashed up with racing gameplay and narrative features. Follow the police work of the eponymous City Patrol, led by the dauntless cops Patrick and Tom, and delve into a twisted story revolving around a terrorist threat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n6y.jpg'),(1560,'TrainClicker Idle Evolution','2021-02-12','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Relaxing idle train game. Enjoy a journey from steam to modern locomotives in clicker style!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44uh.jpg'),(1561,'Temple of the Green Moon',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Temple of the Green Moon is a psychological thriller that will send you into the heart of a mystical journey full of mysteries and incredible discoveries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ygy.jpg'),(1562,'Crazy Taxi','2014-03-13','Racing, Arcade','Arcade, PlayStation 3, Nintendo GameCube, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox 360, Dreamcast, PlayStation 2','Hey hey, come on over and have some fun with Crrrrrazy Taxi! Barrel through traffic packed streets, hurdle off parking garages, and Crazy Combo your way to Crazy Money in a wild frantic race to scare up the most fares. In Crazy Taxi, time is money, and only the Craziest Cabbies come out victorious.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jt6.jpg'),(1563,'Guitar Hero III: Legends of Rock','2008-05-22','Music, Simulator','PlayStation 3, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Rock out to the third entry in in Red Octane\'s music series for guitar gods! Songs for Guitar Hero III include Barracuda by Heart, Sabotage by Beastie Boys, Rock And Roll All Nite by Kiss, and much more! In addition, players can experience an incredible number of added features and explosive content including a new multiplayer action-inspired battle mode, grueling boss battles, a bevy of exclusive unlockable content and authentic rock venues.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wqm.jpg'),(1564,'My Days with the Demoness','2021-12-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A rom-com visual novel which follows a NEET mechanic who accidentally brings the demon lord’s daughter to earth; as not to be indebted to him, she decides to stay with him to improve his “miserable life”; meanwhile he tries his best to fix the portal before time runs out. Will they be successful?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rpm.jpg'),(1565,'Aliens: Infestation','2011-11-11','Adventure','Nintendo DS','GAME OVER, MAN! The Xenomorph, the ultimate killing machine, returns. Only the Universe\'s toughest, the Colonial Marines, can exterminate the galaxy\'s most feared species. Can you fight off the terror of the alien infestation?\n\n-Choose you squad and watch the dynamic story system adapt\n-Pick up where the Aliens crew left off and fight through the U.S.S. Sulaco, planet LV-426, and more!\n-Load up with iconic weapons from the film, including pulse rifles, smart guns, and flamethrowers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dfr.jpg'),(1566,'Mizen Tantei: The Protea Cases','2022-10-13','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Gather information and deduce how to prevent predicted incidents before they occur. In Shinjuku City, various incidents will occur, such as assault, theft, and murder. The protagonist will team up with the detective agency’s director and detectives to confront these heinous incidents. And their bonds will gradually deepen…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74g4.jpg'),(1567,'Davey','2022-11-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DAVEY is a fun, addictive platform puzzle game in anime styled 3D with realistic jumps and movements using motion capture and voice acting. Help Davey escape the facility after being kept prisoner for his unique invisibilty ability.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5d0g.jpg'),(1568,'At Tony\'s','2023-12-05','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','At Tony\'s is a first-person horror experience taking place in a haunted pizzeria.\n\nThe last night shift worker vanished mysteriously, it\'s your turn to step in to help the family\'s business.\n\nWill you survive your shift, cooking pizzas while unveiling the restaurant\'s mysteries?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gos.jpg'),(1569,'Questprobe featuring Spider-Man','1984-12-31','Adventure','BBC Microcomputer System, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Acorn Electron, Commodore 16, DOS, Apple II, Commodore Plus/4','The second in Scott Adams\' series of Questprobe text adventures, starring Spider-Man.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97qk.jpg'),(1570,'Kamen Rider: Climax Heroes','2009-08-06','Fighting','PlayStation 2','Kamen Rider: Climax Heroes is a 3D crossover fighting game featuring the heroes of 10 different Kamen Rider TV series, from Kuuga through to Decade. The story is set in the Decade universe, where the worlds of the other nine Riders are all combining into one, and they must work together to save their worlds before they are completely destroyed.\n\nThe game plays much like other 3D fighters such as Tekken, with the major addition being the so-called \"Form Change\" system that allows each Rider to transform during battle, and even in the middle of a combo. The main story mode is \"Decade Mode\", where the player must complete various missions with different characters to proceed through the story. There are also standard Versus, Survival, and Training modes. The game also includes a simple control option for younger players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fjj.jpg'),(1571,'Birdsong','2014-12-09','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It\'s finally time to leave the nest. The whole wide world sprawls out before you(conveniently squeezed into just one screen), waiting to be explored. Can you learn to fly?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v76.jpg'),(1572,'The Block','2022-12-16','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Block is the world\'s smallest city builder. Place randomly generated buildings on a square and watch your tiny city block come to life!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wfm.jpg'),(1573,'Might & Magic: Duel of Champions - Forgotten Wars','2014-07-22','Strategy','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Enter the legendary universe of Might & Magic with Duel of Champions Forgotten Wars, the online strategy card game. Choose your hero and assemble an army to attack fierce opponents on the battleground. Play your creatures, spells, fortunes, buildings and events wisely to unleash killer combos and gain the upper hand. With more than 650 unique cards to collect and 100+ hours of game content to unlock and explore, the adventures you can have are unlimited!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hbcaqvggfkpgccd9jisb.jpg'),(1574,'Unnamed Arcade','2025-03-09','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game is a creative 3rd person shooter / platformer, where players can earn rewards by completing challenges, or craft their own in game rewards by creating challenges for other players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ml1.jpg'),(1575,'Neverwinter Nights 2: Storm of Zehir','2008-11-18','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the aftermath of the defeat of the King of Shadows, the Sword Coast is in the midst of an uneasy economic recovery. Trade syndicates have sprung up to exploit the post-war confusion for their own ends and the players\' party will wade into this uncertain environment. In order to increase their own fortunes, they can either ally with a syndicate to create a trade empire, or cut their own path through Faerun by preying upon caravans and selling the goods on the black market. As they attempt to extend their influence, players will become aware of a new\nfaction working behind the scenes: the evil, shape-shifting, serpentine Yuan-Ti.\n\nIn addition to trading and economic manipulation, the Neverwinter Nights 2: Storm of Zehir Overland Map allows players to explore the Chultan Peninsula and Sword Coast in a non-linear manner never before seen in any of the\nNeverwinter Nights games. Exploration will take players from well-known locations, like Neverwinter and Crossroad Keep, to more exotic areas, such as the xenophobic jungle nation of Samarach. Groups of highwaymen and monsters populate the Overland Map and the farther from civilization the player roams, the more difficult the encounters become.\n\nThe 15-hour campaign in Neverwinter Nights 2: Storm of Zehir is also packed with new classes, spells, creatures, and playable races.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1sye.jpg'),(1576,'Dawn of Titans','2015-03-11','Strategy','Android, iOS','Selected App Store EDITORS’ CHOICE, Dawn of Titans showcases the BEST graphics on mobile!\nBattle COLOSSAL TITANS and THOUSANDS OF WARRIORS in monumental wars, all under your CONTROL.\nCAPTURE enemy lands, grow your ARMY, and come to FIGHT, because in Dawn of Titans you either GO BIG or you GO HOME!\nJoin your friends and PLAY FOR FREE! In the most massive ACTION-STRATEGY game on mobile!\n----------\nDawn of Titans begins a new era for Action Strategy, with console-quality graphics and ultra-addictive gameplay.\nKey Features:\nConsole-Quality Graphics\n· Build your kingdom and fight enemies in a stunning 3D fantasy world.\nDominate with Massive Titans\n· Equip colossal warriors with powerful gear and lead them into epic PvP battles.\nReal-Time Battle Control\n· Go to war with thousands of troops, all under your direct control.\nNonstop Events & Campaigns\n· Remember to check back for daily quests, unique campaigns, and alliance events.\nForge an Unstoppable Alliance\n· Unite with friends to strategize in real-time MMO chat and dominate other kingdoms.\nBuild the Ultimate Kingdom\n· Clash against the masses, to capture land and rise up the world ranks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rxm.jpg'),(1577,'Drive Ahead! Carcade','2024-11-07','Fighting, Platform, Racing, Arcade','iOS, Mac','In Drive Ahead! Carcade, you win by knocking your opponents on the head in cars with just one hit, it’s that simple!\n\nExperience a brand new evolution of the Drive Ahead! world, filled with real time multiplayer chaos and crazy unforgettable moments where anything can happen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jjo.jpg'),(1578,'007 Racing','2000-11-17','Racing','PlayStation','In 007 Racing you can get behind the wheel of James Bond\'s car.\n\nYou must complete missions which range from collecting an object and getting out alive, to much harder and more complicated things. Your car is armed with many weapons including mines, rockets, lasers, smokescreens, and more.\n\nThen, if you get bored playing alone, you can eliminate your opponent in multiplayer missions where you have to destroy the other car, or a game mode called \"Pass the Bomb\", where you must pass the bomb to the other car by touching it before you blow up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dup.jpg'),(1579,'Pompeii: The Legacy','2025-12-31','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rebuild the city of Pompeii and climb the social ladder. Roman society is full of intrigues that you have to solve in order to become a powerful ruler.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8soy.jpg'),(1580,'Stronghold Crusader II: The Emperor and The Hermit','2015-05-13','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Angel of Death hovers over your castle! The Emperor & The Hermit DLC introduces two extra AI opponents and an all-new Crusader Trail campaign. Spiritual successors to The Emperor and The Abbot from the original Stronghold Crusader (2002), The Emperor and The Hermit are driven by religious fervour. Backed by zealots who follow their cause without question, be it just or corrupt, both leaders represent a dangerous new threat to all sides in the Crusader conflict. The next expansion for Stronghold Crusader 2, The Emperor & The Hermit adds seven missions, two AI opponents, 10 achievements, additional player shields and new castle designs unique to The Emperor and The Hermit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fovqphvdk35u4ifnytek.jpg'),(1581,'Tunnel Boat Terror',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Sport','Sin plataforma','Drive terrifyingly fast and iconic power boats each with unique; design, destruction, customizations, tuning, turning, throttling, and trim. Improve your skill and equipment in your pursuit of becoming a power boat racing legend. A brand-new racing experience for enthusiasts and newcomers alike.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wpf.jpg'),(1582,'Hong Kong Mahjong','1991-12-31','Sin género','DOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38qv.jpg'),(1583,'Zombie Panic in Wonderland','2010-06-03','Shooter','Wii','A sudden wave of zombies is attacking Wonderland. To save your friends from the spell of the \"amorous zombies,\" you\'ll have to solve the mystery of the \"scented dwarves\" in time and put an end to the evil power hidden in the castle in the northern city. Game features include cut scenes, music with lyrics, seven playable characters, hidden levels, final bosses, multiple weapons, nonstop zombie attacks, explosions, demolitions and fire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pcg.jpg'),(1584,'Cape\'s Escape Game 4th Room','2021-10-28','Puzzle, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Cape\'s Escape Game 4th Room is a short adventure game in the Cape\'s Escape series, which you can complete in an hour or so. Solve the mystery and escape from the Japanese hot springs inn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zds.jpg'),(1585,'Oasis','2024-07-12','Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a game about thoughts and the need to stop a little bit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i6p.jpg'),(1586,'Dragon Ball: Ultimate Swipe','2014-04-10','Fighting','Android, iOS','DragonBall Ultimate Swipe is a touch-based fighting game for mobile devices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zoj.jpg'),(1587,'Second Stellar',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Follow Asphodene and Eridani on their star-spanning adventure to portend the mysteries of their existence. Actively wield myriad weapons and their abilities in symphony to defeat those who would bar your path. Throughout your journey, court intriguing and vibrant passengers as you venture beyond the stars above.\n\nThis adventure won\'t be easy- Hordes of foes will stand in your way, and you must answer their challenge to progress. Emerging triumphant against these foes will reward experience, catalyzed into unique items and upgrades to bolster your offense.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xyj.jpg'),(1588,'Mystic Pillars','2021-06-03','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Mystic Pillars is an original blend of intriguing puzzles and an immersive storyline set in Ancient India, providing you with a unique gameplay experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wor.jpg'),(1589,'Project: Obscurion',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Project: Obscurion is an immersive spot-the-difference horror game. Use security cameras to explore detailed locations and uncover hidden anomalies. Test your perception and unravel the truth in this captivating horror experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kpj.jpg'),(1590,'TerraForge',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You must manage your mining operation, collect resources, and craft items to sell for profit. Upgrade your mining tools, unlock mysterious blueprints, discover powerful relics, and as you progress towards your goal, travel farther lands, purchase better mining licences and go deeper and deeper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co775f.jpg'),(1591,'Infectonator 3: Apocalypse',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A campy, crazy pixelart zombie apocalypse arcade sim where you\'re the bad guy. Drop your virus and spread it across the globe while you unlock a whole horde of bizarre undead to do your bidding.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1i70.jpg'),(1592,'Gold','2024-11-07','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This is an idle game! You can randomly drop a gold bag when you idle! Click on the gold bag to open it and you can get gold! The value of gold depends on its weight! The heavier it is, the rarer it is!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rbg.jpg'),(1593,'Escape Floor Zero','2024-11-25','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Trapped in an infinite parking lot, your only escape is through Floor Zero.\nDetect subtle anomalies and make crucial decisions in this mind-bending, psychological horror experience.\nDare to escape the unescapable?\nIf you see an anomaly... turn back.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7my0.jpg'),(1594,'Match Three Pirates! II','2021-12-20','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Enjoy the great Match 3 Pirate Adventure. Form groups of three or more crabs, canons, steering wheels, explosives and other pirate items to unlock powerful boosters and complete all level goals. Use the right strategy, earn coins and build your own great theme park on Pirate Island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ahw.jpg'),(1595,'Girl Card Battle','2025-02-15','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A card collection game, with a simple logic, in which you will have to unlock sensual images for your museum and new cards to continue playing, unlocking 100 levels around the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oic.jpg'),(1596,'BS F-Zero Grand Prix 2','1997-08-10','Racing','Satellaview','This is the SoundLink version of BS F-Zero Grand Prix 2, which is the direct sequel to the original F-Zero game released for the Super Famicom via the Satellaview. Two versions were released - a non-SoundLink game and a SoundLink game. Little is known about this SoundLink version outside of surviving videos, but it was distributed in two halves in August 1997 and had a similar announcer and redone soundtrack as the previous Satellaview entry. At least the first week rearranged a few courses, and replaced two with new locations called \"Forest I\" and \"Forest II\". Presuming no areas were repeated, this likely means the SoundLink version had twice as many courses total. In addition, it can be seen that the player cannot choose between Grand Prix and Practice modes in the SoundLink version; as it was a live broadcast, the player is forced to play each course in a timed Practice mode, and then the Grand Prix race.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nfk.jpg'),(1597,'WWE 2K22: Amazon Steelbook Edition','2022-03-11','Fighting, Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','WWE 2K returns with all the features you can handle in WWE 2K22, the twenty-sixth professional wrestling game in the WWE game franchise and the ninth game in the WWE 2K series! Get ripped out of the stands and hit with complete control of the WWE Universe. Throw down with the biggest and most realistic-looking WWE Superstars and Legends. Relive pivotal moments in Rey Mysterio\'s iconic career in 2K Showcase. Hitting this hard has never been so easy!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1598,'The Last Stand Legacy Collection','2021-07-15','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive the zombie apocalypse and make humanity\'s last stand in this three-game legacy bundle, revamped for modern hardware. Explore, build, and survive for as long as you can in The Last Stand, The Last Stand 2, and The Last Stand: Union City.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43wr.jpg'),(1599,'Shock Troopers','1997-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Neo Geo MVS','Shock Troopers is a 1-2 player game where players select one of eight characters to play as. Each character has their own attack. Players also have to choose one of three routes to take. The object of the game is to go toward the end of the level and defeat the end-of-level boss, which is usually a huge vehicle. Crates that are scattered throughout the levels can be broken into to reveal new weapons and power-ups.\n\nThere is a team mode where players have to select three characters. The characters can be switched on-the-fly during gameplay, which is useful if one of them is badly injured. Players can use the other teammates until life-ups can be found.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z3g.jpg'),(1600,'Animaddicts 4','2022-06-01','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this game you have to climb climbing the objects in the scenario to try to climb as high as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57vs.jpg'),(1601,'James Bond 007: Nightfire','2004-03-28','Shooter','Game Boy Advance','Step into the shoes of the world’s most famous secret agent in James Bond 007: Nightfire for the Game Boy Advance. This thrilling action-adventure game plunges you into a globe-trotting mission filled with espionage, high-tech gadgets, and explosive action.\n\nNavigate through 10 challenging levels set in exotic locations, from the snowy peaks of the Austrian Alps to the depths of the South Pacific. Utilize Bond\'s signature arsenal of gadgets and weapons to outsmart enemies and complete your objectives. With a mix of first-person shooting, stealth, and puzzle-solving gameplay, each mission offers a unique and immersive experience.\n\nEngage in intense shootouts and undertake covert operations to uncover a sinister plot threatening global security. The game’s intuitive controls and detailed graphics make for an engaging handheld adventure that captures the essence of the James Bond universe.\n\nChallenge your friends in multiplayer mode, where you can test your skills in various competitive scenarios. With its captivating story, diverse gameplay, and iconic Bond elements, James Bond 007: Nightfire for the Game Boy Advance delivers a compelling spy experience that you can enjoy on the go. Ready your gadgets and save the world, Agent 007!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gx9.jpg'),(1602,'Classic NES Series: Ice Climber','2004-07-09','Platform, Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Twenty years after their debut on the NES, mountain climbers Popo and Nana return to scale the heights as part of the NES Classic Series for the Game Boy Advance. As Popo (player two plays as Nana), you must use your trusty mallet to work your way up the mountain by chipping away at the blocks overhead and then jumping through the resulting hole. Your mallet is also useful for eliminating pesky enemies, including polar bears, seals, and mountain men.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kye.jpg'),(1603,'Eggs: All Guns Broken','2024-09-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warning: This game starts 6 minutes long but can go on forever. Eggs is a slow-paced casual rail shooter that places you in a desert loop to face endless variations of baddies. Fly as far as you can!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tev.jpg'),(1604,'Oodlescape - The Apocalypse','2017-02-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Oodlescape - The Apocalypse is a unique Adventure-Escape experience for the HTC Vive which embraces being a videogame in a cube-filled world of wackiness. Randomized puzzle solutions ensures the game is a fresh challenge on each attempt. Burn and blast your way through the nuclear base in an escape against the clock!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1605,'Pong & Teddy',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1606,'Go Go Ackman 3','1995-12-15','Platform, Adventure','Super Famicom','Go Go Ackman 3 is an Action game, developed by Aspect and published by Banpresto, which was released in Japan in 1995. It is the third and final Go Go Ackman game for the Super Famicom.\n\nThis is the first game in which the series Nemesis, Tenshi, is playable. But due to the fact that Tenshi is an angel he will not collect the souls of the enemies.\n\nGo Go Ackman was created by famous mangaka Akira Toriyama, known for his work on Dragon Ball as well as games such as Chrono Trigger and Dragon Quest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kfq.jpg'),(1607,'Galactic Annihilation',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1608,'Jamping Fish','2022-05-05','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','All you have to do is control the fish with your keyboard to jump over moving stones, plates, cars and more, and avoid starfish or cats to reach the top of the statue.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rf1.jpg'),(1609,'Space Channel 5 VR: Kinda Funky News Flash','2020-10-12','Music, Simulator','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR, SteamVR, Oculus Quest','Space Channel 5 is SEGA’s legendary Dreamcast rhythm game first released 19 years ago and now brand new stories, characters, stages and sounds… NEW station 5 is going to be on the air soon! Identical twin sisters, Rookie reporters - Lou & Kee assigned to cover a breaking dance news story as your avatars. Come and experience the return of Ulala for yourselves!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co235e.jpg'),(1610,'Fighting in Aden Gulf','2012-06-05','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fighting in Aden Gulf is an indie FPS game. Story of this game is about the battle of Iranian Navy and Somalian Pirates. Fighting in Aden Gulf was developed in 2010 made with Unity 3.4 and was released in 2011. It is the best-selling FPS video game of Iran. There were 7 levels in this game and also had 2 hours of gameplay. This game was introduced in Unite 2012 as one of the top games of that year.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pvsvuffq74sbdftpa4p9.jpg'),(1611,'RBO',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','INTRUDERS steal loot from PROTECTORS (house owners), and from each other in this physics-powered heist / home alone game by the creator of Hello Neighbor','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wck.jpg'),(1612,'Viridi','2015-08-19','Simulator, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Viridi is a simulation video game developed by Ice Water Games. It tasks players to look after a pot of succulents.\n\nWhile not fully realistic (they\'re very forgiving), your succulents will require some maintenance and can die from over- or under-watering. Name your favorite plants, give them special care and attention, and they might even flower for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ihy.jpg'),(1613,'Tom Clancy\'s The Division 2: Warlords of New York - Season 11','2023-02-27','Shooter, Tactical','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A new manhunt has begun with the launch of Season 11: Reign of Fire!\nHere is all you need to know about Season 11 - the third and final season for Year 4 of The Division 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r96.jpg'),(1614,'Super Robot Taisen MX Portable','2005-12-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PlayStation Portable','This is the PSP port of the PS2 game Super Robot Wars MX.\nIt\'s pretty much the same game with some minor gameplay tweaks.\n\nAlthough the game itself isn\'t too hard, it has improved several aspects of the game, most notably the presentation of attacks which gives the game even more of an \"anime\" feel than before.\nThis game also has a series list that would please American fans, with 4 featured\ntitles already released in America; Gundam: Char\'s Counterattack, Nadesico:\nPrince of Darkness, Rahxephon and Neon Genesis Evangelion.\nNew systems, such as\nthe Double Attack system and Favourite System are also thrown in as Banpresto\ncontinue to refresh their series again and again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a5x.jpg'),(1615,'Lesson: The Game','2017-06-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take a lesson to the fear!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27za.jpg'),(1616,'Astropulse: Reincarnation',NULL,'Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Set on a war-torn future Earth where the planet\'s biological evolution was drastically altered by a meteorite strike','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1617,'Magician Lord','2007-10-29','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, PlayStation 3, Neo Geo MVS, Wii, PlayStation Portable, Neo Geo CD','Magician Lord is a side-scrolling platform game that was a launch title for both the Neo-Geo MVS (arcade) and AES (home) systems, and was one of the pack-in games for the Neo-Geo AES.\n\nThe game was re-released through the Virtual Console download service in Europe and Australia on October 26, 2007, and in North America on October 29, 2007. It was later released for the PlayStation 3 and PlayStation Portable through the PlayStation Store. It was previously included in SNK Arcade Classics Vol. 1, released for the Wii, PlayStation 2 and PlayStation Portable in North America on May 1, 2008.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47z6.jpg'),(1618,'Alpen Ghoul',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Alpen Ghoul is an exploration/stealth game. Sliding might grant you a quick escape, but the price of safety is high. It may cost you all of your progress. There are multiple routes with varying difficulties, so if you\'re struggling, keep trying different paths. You will die, more than once, but with each death you will be able to explore further, hide better, and slide faster.\n\nCan you find everything the mountain hides?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65ra.jpg'),(1619,'Pitch Silent','2023-01-17','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Earth has withered away. Guided by an angel in the dark. You must brave the underground of Eden to find the all forms of creation to rekindle the light.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yay.jpg'),(1620,'A Simple Garbage Sorting Game','2025-01-21','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','We are recruiting a large number of testers from around the world to participate in an unprecedented secret experiment.. Join us and embark on this journey of exploration that is crucial to survival. In this unknown experiment, your choices will determine the fate of the Earth','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c3a.jpg'),(1621,'GreenBulb',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1622,'The Inheritance','2013-01-20','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Having learned of the Courier\'s exploits, a dying man contacts the player in hopes of employing him/her to deliver a mysterious package. Upon accepting the job, the Courier will soon find himself/herself making unwilling allies and dangerous enemies, all jockeying to claim the same prize.\n\nThe Inheritance is a compact, lore-friendly quest mod for Fallout New Vegas, designed to offer new avenues to experience combat and role-playing for high-level characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kt2.jpg'),(1623,'Downtown Nekketsu Monogatari EX','2004-03-05','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Game Boy Advance','This game is the remake of Downtown Nekketsu Story (the original Japanese version of River City Ransom). It was later ported as River City Ransom EX for Western audiences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i1y.jpg'),(1624,'Tecmo\'s Deception: Invitation to Darkness','1997-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PlayStation','Should you enter Tecmo\'s Deception you should be warned! You must decide who lives and who dies. As in life, Tecmo\'s Deception will hold you responsible for your actions. Everything you do, everywhere you go, everyone you meet has a reason. Are you seeking revenge, resurrection, or redemption? It\'s your decision.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xdu.jpg'),(1625,'Imposters: Countdown','2021-01-10','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Complete tasks & mini-games. Report bodies. Call voting sessions. Hack the station. Overload the reactor. Betray your friends. An online party game of teamwork and betrayal for 4-12 players...in third person! Escape the ship before the countdown runs out! Don\'t get fooled by the rogue AI.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61t3.jpg'),(1626,'DiRT Rally 2.0: Digital Deluxe Edition','2019-02-26','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','DiRT Rally 2.0 Deluxe Edition Content Pack includes:\nThe Porsche 911 RGT Rally Spec, Upgraded \'My Team\' starter cars, x5 Early vehicle unlocks added to your team garage (Ford Escort Mk II, Lancia Stratos, Subaru Impreza 1995, AUDI Sport quattro S1 E2 and Ford Fiesta OMSE SuperCar Lite.),\n\nThe DiRT Rally 2.0 Deluxe Content Pack also includes: Dirt Season 1: x3 tracks, x5 cars, In-Game Bonuses, High reward events. Plus Dirt Season 2: x3 tracks, x5 cars, In-Game Bonuses, High reward events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r50.jpg'),(1627,'Tales of Ancients','2025-02-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tales of Ancients is an atmospheric exploration game that tells the story of a man struggling to survive in a deserted town while tracing an ancient cult. In this world filled with heavy rain and mysterious rituals, you will uncover dark secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dwz.jpg'),(1628,'Hana Awase Complete','2019-11-22','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Collection of all four volumes of Hana Awase for PC/Mac along with the series\' soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6k3j.jpg'),(1629,'Whimsical Wizardry','2024-07-01','Fighting, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Whimsical Wizardry is multiplayer party game about casting spells at your friends. Turn eight maps and four game modes into a chaotic battlefield as you scramble for victory! Who will be the best worst wizard of them all?\n\nCast 20 unique spells at your friends and enemies, each with their own wacky effects! Customize your wizard before heading into battle.\n\nWhimsical Wizardry is developed by Silver Standard Studios, an independent game studio based out of Ottawa, Ontario.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8a8l.jpg'),(1630,'Chicken Invaders Universe','2021-04-16','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chicken Invaders needs no introduction.\n\nWell, fine, if you insist. Chicken Invaders is the most successful chicken game of this millennium (not to mention the previous one). The game puts you at the forefront of a battle against invading intergalactic chickens, bent on revenge against the human race for our oppression of Earth chickens.\n\nIn Chicken Invaders Universe, you assume the role of a new recruit in the United Hero Force (UHF), mankind\'s last hope against the fowl Henpire. You start your UHF career deployed in some backwater galactic star system, and it\'s up to you to advance through UHF ranks and earn your place in the honorary annals of Heroes Academy. Travel across the galaxy, explore strange new worlds, seek out new life and new civilizations, and exterminate any Henpire forces that cross your path. And do so in style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uti.jpg'),(1631,'Unlimited',NULL,'Racing, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Forget the track, skip the turns, and discover what \'speed\' really means with Unlimited.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8alb.jpg'),(1632,'Neoathlon','2023-12-15','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A sci-fi racing title aimed at being a highly polished and fun experience for players and spectators alike. Neoathlon utilizes style and substance with its custom physics mechanics to make the most robust and enjoyable hover racing experience possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hzu.jpg'),(1633,'Mazin Saga: Mutant Fighter','1993-02-28','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','A beat em\'up/versus fighting game based on the MazinSaga manga by Go Nagai, which was in turn a spin-off of Nagai\'s original Mazinger Z.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s57.jpg'),(1634,'You\'re Watching Icebox!','2020-05-19','Point-and-click, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You\'re watching Icebox! The coolest show on the box. I\'m your host Reggie Plunkett, and have we got a show for you.\n\nYou\'ll have to try to keep your cool in this point and click adventure, as you host a disastrous episode of failing 80\'s variety show, Icebox!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co697z.jpg'),(1635,'Hexa Attack Puzzle: Shoot n Merge Numbers','2020-03-10','Shooter, Puzzle','Android','Hexagons attack puzzle: shoot and merge numbers is a brand new match-3 puzzle game. Just shoot and merge numbers. \n \nIt is an easy but challenging numbers game. Shoot numbers and defend your board against bad hexagons attack. Do not give up even you are surrounded. \n \nBad hexagons have no values. New row of bad hexagons will be generated every 6 times of no matches. But do not be afraid, you can beat them by having 3 successive matches. Every 3 successive matches, you can remove 1 row of bad hexagons and reset their timer. \n \nHow to play: \n- Tap screen on a specific column to shoot the number OR touch and move to that column, then release to shoot the number. \n- 3 or more same adjacent numbers will be merged into the next higher number. \n \nSimple rules: \n- New row of bad hexagons will be generated every 6 times of no matches. \n- You can remove 1 row of bad hexagons and reset their timer every 3 successive matches. \n- Every match gives 1 star. \n- It costs 100 stars to remove an hexagon from the board using the Delete button. \n- It is your responsibility to save your progress to resume it later using the Save button. \n- The game is over when you run out of tries and stars. \n \n \nEvery new level: minimum and maximum generated numbers are increased by 1. So try to match all the minimum numbers before the next level because they will not be generated again. \n \n \nPlay, enjoy and have fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tc2.jpg'),(1636,'Touhou Chireiden: Subterranean Animism','2008-09-16','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Touhou Chireiden: Subterranean Animism is the eleventh main game of the Touhou Project scrolling shooter series.\nSubterranean Animism features two playable characters, each with three weapon types representing a youkai assisting them from above ground. Like Mountain of Faith, collecting power items adds up to four \"option\" satellites around the character, which behave differently according to the character and weapon type, and can be sacrificed for a bomb effect. However, unlike Mountain of Faith, each bomb has a different behavior, and some cause special gameplay effects to occur.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bpp.jpg'),(1637,'Honkai: Star Rail - Through the Petals in the Land of Repose','2025-04-09','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Version 3.2 of Honkai: Star Rail, which includes:\n• New characters: Castorice and Anaxa\n• New Trailblaze Mission: \"Through the Petals in the Land of Repose\"\n• New areas: Demigod Council and Dragonbone City\n• Two-year anniversary celebrations and QoL features\n• …and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m0a.jpg'),(1638,'Power Rangers: Dino Thunder','2004-09-14','Adventure','Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','A Power Rangers action game based on the latest iteration of the series featuring dinosaur Zords. Whenever Dinos threaten mankind, count on the Power Rangers to be there! With more than 20 levels and loads of puzzles and action, Power Rangers: Dino Thunder will give fans of the action team plenty to shout about. Released ahead of its console cousins, Power Rangers: Dino Thunder mixes puzzles and action for a unique brand of gameplay. Use special attacks and weapon power-ups to beat the competition and collect Dino Gems to control the Dino Zords.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pe6.jpg'),(1639,'Game Over Please',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1640,'Good N Dead',NULL,'Shooter, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Sin plataforma','The dead are closing in on the last of the living, but you still have a few tricks up your sleeve. From barbed wire and flamethrowers to Tesla coils, your ability to build defensive structures in a pinch is unmatched. Go it alone or play with up to 4 friends fighting off increasingly larger waves of the dead in this zombie survival couch co-op tower defense shooter.\n\n*Features:*\n\n- Post-apocalyptic setting featuring a mix of indoor and outdoor levels with different challenges and enemies\n- Unlockable characters and weapons\n- Upgradable turrets and other defensive structures with unique abilities and effects\n- Open, grid-based building system for unlimited base designs\n- Local multiplayer for up to 4 players, including campaign co-op\n- Endless mode and global high score leaderboard on every level','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2iou.jpg'),(1641,'Into the Inferno','2023-10-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A retro-style first-person dungeon crawler RPG where you rescue kidnapped children from an underground demon horde.\n\nLead a party of four adventurers through the wilderness, a hostile Orc village, a town of violent Gnolls, and many levels of winding caverns and burning brimstone tunnels. Gather experience and equipment to improve your chances of defeating the demon horde to rescue the children and return them home where they belong. Help recover the remains of the lost miners to give their families closure, and eliminate the demon threat once and for all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ffu.jpg'),(1642,'How the Cossacks searched for Mona Lisa','2005-12-22','Point-and-click, Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Ukrainian point & click adventure game. It is based on cartoons made in the USSR at the KievNauchFilm film studio by director Vladimir Dakhno.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jdc.jpg'),(1643,'Corpse Party D2: Depths of Despair','2013-11-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Corpse Party D2: Depths of Despair is an RPG Maker VX Ace game based on the original NEC PC-9801 version of CORPSE-PARTY featuring influences and designs from Corpse Party for the PlayStation Portable. The game was written by Jackkel Dragon and illustrated by Hiragi-HOUX, and was released on November 15, 2013. It is known under the abbreviation CPD2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kp2.jpg'),(1644,'Grimstone Valley',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1645,'Spectre','2023-07-24','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Employ stealth tactics as the Spectres, or defend your objectives as the heavily armed Reapers in this thrilling teamwork-driven multiplayer action experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mbb.jpg'),(1646,'Omakase! Savers','1996-02-23','Adventure','Sega Saturn','Omakase! Savers is a comedy adventure game featuring live-action scenes. The player takes the role of the girls\' classmate, who appears as a small ghost, and must guide the girls in their quest to seal the spirits again and restore their classmate to his human form. This primarily takes the form of exploring the town on foot, talking to the townsfolk and investigating to find the whereabouts of the spirits causing trouble. Occasional combat takes a semi-real-time format, with the player moving around freely but pausing to perform attacks.\n\nThe game is divided into four chapters, each focusing on a specific spirit that must be defeated and captured. The characters in the game are represented both by anime-style sprites and digitized photo portraits of real actors, while numerous live-action cutscenes drive the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c17.jpg'),(1647,'Dungeon Hunter 2','2010-12-09','Adventure','Android, iOS','The second part of the game is a continuation of a large-scale epic adventure in the style of dark fantasy\nTake a journey to the Gothic era, 25 years after the events of the first part, as the son of an immortal king. Reveal the secret of a conspiracy against your kingdom, breaking through large dungeons and even more ferocious monsters. The game captures with its amazing graphics, physics and gameplay. There are more rivals, they have become smarter, and the world itself has increased almost 5 times. The game has a multiplayer. Three players, a representative of each class (warrior, thief and magician) will cut and burn their way through the long-suffering world of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fke.jpg'),(1648,'Zombie Driver HD','2012-10-17','Racing, Indie','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Insane mix of cars, speed, explosions, blood and zombies! Fight through an epic narrative campaign or test yourself in the Slaughter and Blood Race modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cp9.jpg'),(1649,'Panzer Campaigns: Sicily \'43',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A war game based around the invasion of Sicily in 1943.\n\nBy July 1943, the tides of war had turned on the Germans. Tunsia fell in May leaving no Axis territory in North Africa. On July 5th, they launched their last great offensive on the Russian Front at Kursk and were nearing their \"highwater mark\" when the Allies struck at the \"soft underbelly\" of Europe by invading Sicily. The Invading American and British forces took 38 days to capture the island due to skillful defense and fighting withdrawal in some of the most difficult terrain in the war prompting one author, Carlo D\'Este to call this battle a \"Bitter Victory\". Can you capture the island faster? Should the Allies have opted to have Patton invade western Sicily instead of covering Monty\'s flank? Find out with Sicily \'43.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rgyczdf9nfszwung4vuo.jpg'),(1650,'Necromunda: Hired Gun - Gang Wars Cosmetics Bundle','2021-11-23','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Pick a side or die alone, there’s no in between. Get the Gang Wars Cosmetics Bundle to receive all three Gang Wars skin set DLCs and embody an Escher, Goliath, or Nautican with exclusive skins for your outfit, knife, mastiff and chew toy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pzs.jpg'),(1651,'Cryptark','2017-06-20','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Cryptark is a 2D roguelike shooter that challenges players with boarding and neutralizing procedurally generated alien starships to earn income for their Privateering enterprise. Purchase improved equipment and weapons to tackle more dangerous targets, but be cautious as failure will result in a loss of investment and profit. The decaying alien arks will defend themselves from intruders with a wide arsenal of cyborg monstrosities, robotics, and security systems, all obstacles that must be surpassed to achieve victory, the destruction of the ship’s central System Core.\n\n- Complex, procedurally generated alien space-hulks to board and defeat.\n- Challenging, re-playable campaign that tests your strategy and tactics.\n- Over 60 weapons and items, including frag-cannons, tractor-beams, flamethrowers and nukes.\n- High-score leader boards to rank your skills.\n- Fully lip-synced voice acting brings your fellow shipmates to life.\n- Blood-pumping soundtrack perfect for intense firefights.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23nb.jpg'),(1652,'H&SB2: Twilight Gem - Hunter\'s Quest','2015-10-20','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','The second Demo of Hunter\'s Quest, featuring five new worlds and a lot of new levels for Hunter and his \"ego\" to traverse through. Follow the funny story of Hunter and his ridiculous quest to obtain power and be better than his pal, Scorpion! But beware, a third opponent may show up to steal the glory all for himself.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1653,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s: Help Wanted - Full Time Edition','2023-11-21','Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation VR2, PlayStation 5','Five Nights at Freddy’s: Help Wanted - Full Time Edition is a combined version of the best selling Five Nights at Freddy’s: Help Wanted, and it’s DLC, Curse of Dreadbear EXCLUSIVELY for the PS5 & PSVR2. This new edition includes all content from the original Help Wanted, plus the Halloween DLC, Curse of Dreadbear, giving you over 50 scary-fun minigames in one terrifying package.\n\nFace your fears in VR or Standard non-VR modes, and see if you’ve got what it takes to be an upstanding, committed member of the Fazbear team!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7j9e.jpg'),(1654,'Death and the Fly','2011-04-01','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Players will control two very different characters, Death and the Fly. Each character has special skills that must be used to navigate the many traps and puzzles contained in each level. With many interesting ways to die and numerous opponents to face, the player will be challenged and entertained for hours.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o9f.jpg'),(1655,'Neogeo Arcade 1','2025-06-03','Sin género','Evercade','Explore one of the greatest arcade systems of all time with this collection of NEOGEO hits for Evercade. Includes METAL SLUG, THE KING OF FIGHTERS 2000, SHOCK TROOPERS, MAGICIAN LORD, SENGOKU and IRONCLAD.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lx7.jpg'),(1656,'Tear of Time: Lost Memory','2022-03-01','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Is an adventure game. You play as a character who, waking up in a house on a remote island, realizes that she has lost her memory. Player will have to find out the reason for the loss of memory, explore the island, find ancient treasures, explore the ruins with secret locations and solve puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mfs.jpg'),(1657,'Summertime Madness','2021-06-17','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Summertime Madness is a single-player first-person puzzle game.\nThe player, in the role of a painter who has made a deal with the devil, has to find his way back to the real world after being cheated and trapped into one of his canvases. A dreamlike journey into a surreal world of the artist’s own creations where the atmospheric gameplay provides mysteries to discover, puzzles to solve and artistic landscapes to explore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vve.jpg'),(1658,'My Dear Prince','2021-04-30','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A sweet and light yuri story about an airheaded daydreamer and a tomboy set on a quaint Japanese island filled with cute bunnies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co470a.jpg'),(1659,'PlatinumS','2024-08-22','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','PlatinumS is a roguelite top-down arena shooter that brings the ultimate hero\'s party-building experience to life, empowering heroes to conquer dungeons. Players have the option to select from a range of items and buffs to craft their own distinctive builds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qgj.jpg'),(1660,'James Bond 007: The Stealth Affair','1990-12-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','007 James Bond: The Stealth Affair, also known as Operation Stealth in Europe, is an adventure game from Delphine Software International, released in 1990. The game is mainly the work of Paul Cuisset (programming) and Jean Baudlot (sound).\n\nThe game was released with the Bond license in the United States, although this led to some inconsistencies as the MI6 agent appeared to be taking his orders from the CIA.\n\nThe Stealth Affair mainly features a point-and-click style of gameplay reminiscent of many of the LucasArts adventures of the time, as well as a number of more action-oriented elements including an overhead viewed maze section and a scene in which Glames/Bond attempts to escape from an underwater cavern before he runs out of oxygen.\n\nThe cracked Amiga version of the game featured a primitive synthesized voice that would perform all the dialogue in the game if 1MB or more RAM was installed. Unfortunately the crack featured a bug which meant that if the player attempted to click the mouse button in order to skip through the speech faster the game would freeze and have to be rebooted. For this reason many seasoned players would actually remove the memory expansion before playing the game for any extended period of time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dx2.jpg'),(1661,'Carnival Games VR','2016-10-27','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Oculus Rift','Carnival Games VR brings an immersive virtual reality experience, allowing you to explore the park, interact with patrons and play up to 12 different games. Enter a themed Carnival Alley where you can play a game and earn tickets for virtual prizes or unlock another game. Whether it\'s scaling a castle in Climbing Wall or rolling for a high score in Alley Ball - there is a game for everyone!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pno.jpg'),(1662,'Potions: A Curious Tale','2024-03-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Potions: A Curious Tale is an adventure-crafting game where your wits are your greatest weapons and combat is not always the answer. Encounter fairy tale characters and stories from around the world as you play as Luna, a young witch who overcomes obstacles with the potions she brews.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co740n.jpg'),(1663,'Drift King: Survival','2016-11-24','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The first racing survival game with an absolutely unbelievable atmosphere! Test yourself in three complicated drifting modes. Tune your car as nobody else to survive on the track. Taste the freedom of drift in super freestyle mode. Get up to the top in ranking and prove that you are the DriftKing!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1664,'House Builder: The Atomic Age DLC','2024-04-18','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hope for the best, but prepare for the worst Build new 3 houses! A house prepared to test the power of nukes, a shelter to hide from them, and a UFO house for all other unpredictable events. All that in \"The Atomic Age\", the first DLC to House Builder.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1665,'Wyrmhole: The Forbidden Knowledge',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A daemon spawned by a lab accident steals the Sacred Texts of Fauna Akademia and vanishes into the tunnels beneath. As the Head Librarian May, and with a team of laboratory researchers, conquer the tunnels and demand on time book returns.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ipm.jpg'),(1666,'Succubus Waifu','2019-11-27','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Erica and John are Newlyweds, and lived a variety of sweet and loving cohabitation after honeymoon.John recently took a big project and was very tired after work. Erica decided to support John with her own succubus ability. They worked together to usher in a bright future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42km.jpg'),(1667,'Dungeon Hunter Champions','2018-05-03','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Rally your Champions and lead the charge to save the Multiverse from the greatest threat it has ever known. Switch easily between PC and Mobile devices, and keep fighting wherever you go with this cross-platform hack \'n\' slash!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vux.jpg'),(1668,'Daily Chthonicle: Editor\'s Edition','2016-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game lets you try on the role of a Supernatural Newspaper Agency boss and editor. The world it takes place in is a dark and haunted one, with ghosts, zombies, monsters and even shapeshifting murderers, pretending to be human after they have stolen their victims\' bodies or infiltrated the humanity. It was inspired heavily by the works of H.P.Lovecraft and it builds on the atmosphere of uncertainty and noir of the 1940s.\n\nSend your sextet of weathered journalists, detectives and occult specialists to investigate murder, affair, and horror in the Town.\n\nEach time, the story will be different. Sometimes, a werewolf is shredding innocent (and less innocent) victims to pieces and it is your task to unmask the creature. Other times, it will be a body stealing alien from outer space, a mummy that some misfortunate archaeologist has excavated and is now haunting them. Perhaps it will be Jack the Ripper, still mysteriously alive and lurking in the streets at night.\n\nOr maybe there is a really bad big tentacled monster hidden in the cellar of the University?\n\nIt is for you to find out and entertain your readers while bravely standing up against ancient evil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1kvp.jpg'),(1669,'Island Party Chaos','2024-07-22','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Island Party Chaos: Dive into a hilarious multiplayer adventure! Navigate whimsical obstacles, conquer wild challenges, and outsmart rivals in the race to be the ultimate party champion. Get ready for laughter, strategy, and unpredictable mayhem – let the chaos begin!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83l1.jpg'),(1670,'Sketch Tales','2015-09-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Descend into creative madness with Sketch Tales, a sandbox action RPG where what you draw becomes what you play! Build imaginative worlds, creatures, and weapons and watch your drawings come to life. Share your created worlds and maps with friends and battle it out in multiplayer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nnla9fdfxjvhhepdmeiu.jpg'),(1671,'Wicked Seed','2025-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Battle monstrous threats in this blend of survival horror and turn-based action RPG. Customize and upgrade your equipment, solve puzzles, and fight monsters as you work to uncover the truth behind their appearance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mos.jpg'),(1672,'Snow Board Championship','1997-06-01','Sport','Arcade','Snowboard Championship is a 2D arcade snowboarding game on courses with gameplay similar to Zigurat\'s World Rally games. Using a side-scrolling bird\'s-eye view the snowboarder moves forward automatically and the player has to react quickly to turns and obstacles as signalled by arrows. There are three riders to choose from, representing Europe, Japan and USA, and several courses player either in the Beginner of the Championship mode.\n\nMost of the focus is used on the steering, but a single button is used to run and get extra speed after slowing down, for instance after bumping into a board. The racing is always done alone, but each course consists of a qualifying run followed by a real race. To qualify, the course needs to be finished not exceeding the time limit. After completing a course it is possible to do the same course again or to move on to the next course. Next to regular races there are slower slalom races with smaller paths and more focus on steering. Some courses have optional elements such as loopings or jumps that provide bonus points.\n\nThe game supports two player racing each other taking turns for the best time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rkk.jpg'),(1673,'Offroad Mechanic Simulator','2023-07-24','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Service off-road vehicles and take them for a drive! Offroad Mechanic Simulator lets you modify many classic off-road vehicles and prepare them for daunting tasks that no normal car could ever hope to complete. Test your work and climb steep cliffs or drive through rivers and deep layers of mud.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qjr.jpg'),(1674,'Gnomdom','2024-12-11','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Gnomdom is a point & click puzzle game where you find little gnomes stuck in various places and help them return to their home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qb8.jpg'),(1675,'Fire Emblem: Three Houses - Fódlan Collection',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z4x.jpg'),(1676,'Sixty Four','2024-03-04','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dive into the world of Sixty Four, where you transform simple machines into a thriving factory. Each advancement brings new challenges and a deeper understanding of an extraordinary universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7u87.jpg'),(1677,'Crime Opera Collection','2025-02-26','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1678,'Exanimum: The Silent Call','2024-03-11','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Exanimum: The Silent Call\" is a first-person psychological horror game. In this chilling experience, you will find yourself confronting terrifying mysteries and chilling secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81sq.jpg'),(1679,'Call Sign is Magic Liner','2023-10-03','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Call Sign is Magic Liner is an old school Shmup with a new twist. You can strategically draw lines and defeat your enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7860.jpg'),(1680,'A Traveler\'s Photo Album','2020-12-31','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You will play a traveler, strayed into a castle, the owner of the castle is a candid expert, in the different world travel around the use of magic candid, have a thick album, which is full of treasures! You find the photo album, but the photos in the album are sealed in the room, you need to open it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kwe.jpg'),(1681,'Thor: Son of Asgard','2011-05-10','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','iOS','Thor: Son of Asgard features Marvel\'s superhero in a mobile game released shortly after the movie \"Thor\" in 2011. In this game you can play as mighty Thor and defend Odin\'s Kingdom of Asgard from her enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/llohrrclurix5guwxjb7.jpg'),(1682,'Tom Clancy\'s H.A.W.X','2009-03-03','Shooter, Simulator','PlayStation 3, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox 360','Tom Clancy\'s H.A.W.X. is primed to revolutionize the way we think about combat in the sky. Cutting-edge technology, devastating firepower, and intense dogfights award this new title a deserving place in the prestigious Tom Clancy Franchise. Soon, flying at Mach 3 becomes a right, not a privilege.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yh8.jpg'),(1683,'Train Simulator 2021: BNSF Dash 9 Loco','2012-08-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Dash 9 brings some heavy hauling to Train Simulator 2021, and with a great mix of liveries it is perfect for North American railfans.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1684,'Metal Max 3','2010-07-29','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo DS','Metal Max 3 (メタルマックス3 Metaru Makkusu Surī) is the seventh entry in the Metal Max series (besides Metal Saga series). It is a vehicle combat RPG produced by Cattle Call and co-published by Kadokawa Games, Enterbrain, and Crea-Tech for the Nintendo DS exclusively in Japan in 2010.\n\nIn 1993, Metal Max 2 was published by Data East, who retained the trademark rights to series until its closure in 2003 and the liquidation of its intellectual properties in 2004. In April 2009, Enterbrain (Kadokawa\'s subsidiary) obtained the rights and published Metal Max 3 the next year. It is the first numbered entry in the series in 17 years. A remade version in DS of Metal Max 2 was published in 2011, and used Metal Max 3\'s engine.\n\nSimilar with its predecessors, the game is open-ended and non-linear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8l0k.jpg'),(1685,'Power Pointer','2025-03-27','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9irf.jpg'),(1686,'Red\'s Revenge',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Red\'s Revenge is a chilling power-washing game. Explore a haunted hospital and discover it\'s secrets and what happened to Little Red.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ai2.jpg'),(1687,'BattleHeights','2025-01-16','Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BattleHeights is a multiplayer party game combining elements of aerial combat, fantasy, and physics-based mechanics.\n\nPlayers engage in matches across floating maps, using abilities like double jumps, grappling hooks, and wind spells to outmaneuver and outwit their opponents. The gameplay revolves around creative movement, strategic use of terrain, and team-based objectives in modes like King of the Hill, Team Deathmatch and other fun activities, like a Grappling Race.\n\nThe game features cartoony physics, emphasizing fun and laughter over competitive intensity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98f1.jpg'),(1688,'9 Days','2024-03-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have 9 days before the final fight. At your current state, you do not stand a chance! Explore this Open World to gain new skills and abilities for the battle. Choose where you go, what you do carefully. You cannot waste time! You have 9 days.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yli.jpg'),(1689,'Monomyth','2024-10-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Monomyth is the ultimate first-person dungeon crawler, bringing back the classic virtues of the genre. Inspired by Arx Fatalis, Ultima Underworld and the King\'s Field series, this gripping RPG leads the player into the mighty fortress of Lysandria to recover a sacred artifact guarded by fierce enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41ot.jpg'),(1690,'Oli One: Sneak in','2023-03-09','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Trick the neighbors and take their diamonds!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63qo.jpg'),(1691,'Sonic Forces','2017-11-09','Platform, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Fight through a world destroyed by Dr. Eggman and a powerful new villain in Sonic Forces, the new fast-paced action platformer from the team that brought you Sonic Colors and Sonic Generations. Sonic Forces lets you speed through rolling ruined landscapes as Modern Sonic, catapult past perilous platforms as Classic Sonic, and use powerful new gadgets as your own Custom Hero Character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zr8.jpg'),(1692,'Gensokyo Defenders','2018-11-29','Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Use Traps and Spell Cards to fight back the magical masses! Blistering shoot-em-up action meets tactical tower defense as you choose from almost 20 popular characters to stop the fairy onslaught! Take advantage of their unique powers and tricky Traps to freeze, fry, and blow your enemies away!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zyz.jpg'),(1693,'Sherlock Purr 2','2024-03-15','Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Join Sherlock Purr on a purrfect adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xki.jpg'),(1694,'Crisis Wing','2021-09-22','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Crisis Wing is a mid-90’s style arcade shoot’em up (shmup) game with frantic fast-paced gameplay and colorful pixel graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ye1.jpg'),(1695,'Capitale','2022-02-18','Quiz/Trivia','Web browser','Guess the hidden capital every day. Use the clues to guess it with the fewest attempts possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dgg.jpg'),(1696,'Welcome to Dustown','2025-04-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Dustown is a 4-player cooperative horror game. Play as field scientists exploring vast fields of labyrinthine corn, collecting samples and evidence on behalf of a mysterious corporation. Just make sure you don\'t get killed at the crossroads.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8o0f.jpg'),(1697,'Catch the Ball / Noughts and Crosses','1980-01-01','Puzzle, Arcade','Odyssey 2 / Videopac G7000','Two titles are available in this cart:\n\n- Catch the Ball puts one or two players in the role of a circus clown who has to catch a while ball which comes rolling down a maze of obstacles. The clown has to try to follow the ball as it falls its unpredictable path. A time limit of three \"game minutes\" is counted down and the player with more balls caught by the end of the time wins. The joystick is used to move the clown left or right and the \"action\" button accelerates his movements. There are 6 possible variations, with the players taking turns after each ball caught, taking turns after each miss or in a single player mode, with the time limit on or off for each mode.\n\n- Noughts and Crosses is also known as tic-tac-toe. Players move a \"+\" cursor over the 9 square matrix and place either blue noughts or red squares. The first to get three symbols in a straight line wins. If all six symbols have been placed and there\'s no winner, they can be removed by placing the cursor over and pressing the action button and then be replaced.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30kj.jpg'),(1698,'Pika Pika Nurse Monogatari: Shounika wa Itsumo Oosawagi - for Nintendo Switch','2020-04-02','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','The player works at the pediatric ward of the general hospital. From nursing outpatients to hospitalized children and newborns, you will need to handle various tasks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7amb.jpg'),(1699,'Gay Sex Adventures: Episode 9',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1700,'GibblePets','2025-01-03','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','GibblePets is a cozy monster collector game where you find a pet once every 3 hours. You can play with them, decorate their room and have them on your screen to keep you company!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oib.jpg'),(1701,'Glory Destiny: Reborn',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1702,'Blastworld','2020-05-12','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Climb any surface and blast your friends with foam in this fast-paced VR PvP shooter! Master the foam physics and become the best foam flinger around!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mcs.jpg'),(1703,'OneShot: World Machine Edition','2024-09-30','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The World Knows You Exist.\n\nExperience an adventure game with puzzles that go beyond its own window and establish a unique bond with the main character.\n\nIn OneShot: World Machine Edition, you discover a strange computer operating system with a self-contained world installed. Explore this world to unravel its mysteries and help guide a child on their mission to restore the long-dead sun.\n\nYou hear that saving the world may no longer be possible… But it’s worth a shot, you think. Now with collectible content and features exclusive to the World Machine Edition!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ldh.jpg'),(1704,'High School Musical: Livin\' the Dream','2007-11-15','Music, Platform, Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Gabriella must be dreaming...\nHelp the Wildcats find the missing instruments in time for the state competition! Play as Gabriella, Troy, Sharpay and Ryan, each with unique abilities. Explore East High while solving the mystery to find the lost instruments. Dance to your favorite songs from both movies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vyh.jpg'),(1705,'Geo-Deux',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1706,'The Catacombs','2022-07-15','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The \"Catacombs\" is a found footage game that plays through the perspective of a VHS camera showing a person venturing deep into the Catacombs of Paris. After exploring far into the maze that lives under Paris the player begins to feel they\'re being followed.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1707,'Wolf & Rabbit','2018-04-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Our hero, an injured wolf boy, encountered a rabbit in red picking up flowers on his way escaping from a forest.\nThe kind rabbit girl invited the wolf boy to her grandma\'s house for a treatment, yet...\nStanding in front of the house, the wolf boy felt... somehow, uneasy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ncx.jpg'),(1708,'Epic',NULL,'Simulator','Android, iOS','Official game of the animated fantasy movie\nEpic is the official game of the movie of the same name. It is a 3D city building game in which you need to nurture and protect the woodland home of the Jinn.\n\nIs it just Ice Age Village in the forest?\nThe gameplay in Epic is very similar to other city building games such as The Simpsons: Tapped Out and Gameloft\'s own Ice Age Village. You have to build your very own version of the Jinn kingdom by planting special trees, constructing lodges and building training grounds and academies for your woodland villagers.\n\nThe idea of Epic is that you plant seed-producing flowers, then you transform the seeds into nectar by planting nectar springs. Seeds and nectar can be used as game currency to purchase new objects for your woodland village.\n\nEverything you plant or construct in Epic takes some time to build, though you can avoid waiting around by spending Aura, which you acquire or can purchase in-app. It\'s feasible that you can build up your village without spending real money, but eventually that requires lots of waiting.\n\nThere\'s also a military angle to Epic, which helps to add some variety to the gameplay and lift it above the ranks of the average city building game. You are responsible for an army of leafmen, who you must train up and equip with weapons and spells in order to fight the insurging Boggans.\n\nYou can take part in battles against the Boggans, which are represented through a different game screen. Here, you decide which leafmen you want to use to best crush your opponents in battles which mix skill and strategy. Epic includes a multiplayer battle mode, where you can go head-to-head with other players.\n\nAside from the battle element to the game, there are some nice touches to Epic, which help to add some variety and interest. For example, there\'s a theater you can build where you can watch video content based around the Epic movie.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rql.jpg'),(1709,'Find with Seoul: Story Puzzle','2023-06-16','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Follow the story of clones set in post-cyberpunk dystopian Seoul while solving 3-match puzzles. Experience the change in the low-grade clone Charashi who couldn\'t even afford a piece of bread.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r1s.jpg'),(1710,'Sprout Valley: Friends Forever','2025-03-05','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1711,'Blood in Baldur\'s Gate','2023-06-19','Visual Novel','Web browser','Blood in Baldur\'s Gate is a community-driven free-to-play narrative browser game developed and published by Larian Studios. It served as a narrative teaser for Baldur\'s Gate III.\n\nSet 15 years before the events of Baldur\'s Gate III, players are tasked with investigating a murder in the streets of Baldur\'s Gate. From June 19 to July 6 in 2023, the community could vote on which locations would be unlocked next. While the polls have ended, players are still able to follow in the voters\' original footsteps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8a2o.jpg'),(1712,'Paper Zelda RPG',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','If you enjoyed the Paper Mario Games, this RPG will not disappoint. Play Zelda as a turn based RPG in 2.5D for the first time ever in this epic adventure being developed and released in early access for you to try! This game is completely FREE to play. Battle Enemies and level up your character. Explore different areas to see new and familiar themes, characters, and sounds straight from your favorite Legend Of Zelda Games! Try it now for free! If you enjoy the concept of the game, consider donating to the developer for more updates and games in the future! Enjoy a fan made game that should have been created a long time ago!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p7q.jpg'),(1713,'Tank Force','2017-10-23','Shooter, Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, MOBA','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Tank Force - the coolest free online tank shooter This is a new word in online tank battles, which combines the best qualities of a tank simulator and thrilling arcade battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2326.jpg'),(1714,'Quadrox Lite',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1715,'Forbidden planet','2016-01-11','Shooter, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Forbidden Planet\" is a Space Strategy and Tower Defence like Game.\nYou control a small spaceship and your main goal is to protect your own home planet.\nExplore the universe for resources.\nColonize other planets.\nDefend from the asteroids.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7878.jpg'),(1716,'Mother Hub','2025-04-24','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A first person shooter horror, inspired by classics like Half-Life, Doom 3, Fallout, and Deadspace. You must try to survive and save the last of humanity, trapped within a massive vault in the distant future. Discover the secrets of the past in a lore rich world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kgu.jpg'),(1717,'Star Raiders II','1987-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC','Star Raiders II is a video game released in 1986 for the Atari 8-bit home computers, and later several other home computers and game consoles. The game was originally developed as part of a tie-in with the movie The Last Starfighter, which featured an arcade game of the same name as part of its plotline. Versions for the Atari 5200 and the Atari 8-bit computers were developed in 1984, although those were never released. Later the tie-in was dropped, and the game converted into a sequel to Star Raiders by changing a number of gameplay elements. The gameplay remained quite different from the original Star Raiders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38t7.jpg'),(1718,'Madness Regent','2008-09-22','Shooter','Web browser','Madness Regent is a game based on the Madness Combat series, developed by Newgrounds guru Tom Fulp.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p60.jpg'),(1719,'Dungeon Mana','2025-05-06','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this turn-based roguelite, each run is unique: characters are randomly generated with different abilities. Combat revolves around three colors of mana: red, blue, and green, creating dynamic strategies. Overcome battles and face the final boss. Master the mana!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ni0.jpg'),(1720,'The Grand Tour Game','2019-01-15','Racing','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Ever wish you could get behind the wheel with Clarkson, Hammond, and May from The Grand Tour? Now it\'s your turn! One moment you\'re watching the hosts attempt some questionable automotive antics... the next you\'re at the wheel yourself - same car, same location, same chance to make a massive mess of it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wnx.jpg'),(1721,'Bubble Bobble Micro Player','2019-12-31','Arcade','Handheld Electronic LCD','Popping onto the scene in 1986, this is the epic adventure of brothers Bob and Bub, who have been transformed into dragons, and must battle through 100 levels to save their girlfriends. Featuring simple yet strategic gameplay, Bubble Bobble continues to be a fan favorite and is consistently ranked among the best games of all time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ehp.jpg'),(1722,'Girls vs. Tentacles',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1723,'Medieval Lords: Build, Defend, Expand','2005-11-24','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Medieval Lords is a 3D city-building game set in the Middle Ages. Players develop towns by constructing buildings connected by a network of roads, managing resources, and fulfilling citizens\' needs for food, security, entertainment, and religious services. The game incorporates geographical elements like water proximity and soil fertility that affect town development. Unlike traditional medieval strategy games, the combat system focuses on defensive fortifications and numerical advantage rather than tactical warfare. The game uses a zone-of-influence system where certain structures provide benefits to nearby buildings, and success depends on efficient tax collection and strategic placement of facilities to maintain population growth and unlock advanced construction options.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ehhkyka96tkkkr7vnbse.jpg'),(1724,'Pavu',NULL,'Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pavu is an action adventure game where we are going to follow a young boy\'s quest in search of answers about himself and humanity in a fantastical land filled with robots, challenges and encounters that was once habited by a human civilization that has vanished.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8os2.jpg'),(1725,'Elfsquad7',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1726,'Circuit Superstars','2022-01-27','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Circuit Superstars is a top-down racer built by racing fans, for racing fans. The game celebrates generations of multi-disciplinary motorsport, focusing on driving that feels great - but with a high skill ceiling that will have players spending hours honing their perfect lap. Starting out is simple but learning the nuances of each car\'s handling and finding the best racing line through each corner of each track will be a challenge for a long time to come. Not only that, but with the option of fuel usage, tire degradation and racing damage, even a good pit stop strategy could make the difference between hero and zero. Feel the rubber bite into the road as you pass the start/finish line and dive, brakes squealing, into the first corner!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53he.jpg'),(1727,'Mythwrecked: Ambrosia Island','2025-12-31','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','You’re shipwrecked on a lost mythical island. As backpacker Alex, you must befriend the forgotten gods of Greek mythology and restore their memories. Explore the dynamic island and its story sandbox to build new friendships, solve the mystery and save the gods.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62oi.jpg'),(1728,'Dying Breed',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Dying Breed is a classic base building RTS game, set in a past alternative timeline, featuring 2 unique faction with a common enemy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68iy.jpg'),(1729,'Zgirls','2016-11-14','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','Android, iOS','Z-Girls is a strategic mobile game app available for android and iOS. You assume the role of the commander of a school situated in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by undead. Collecting resources, training your students, and battling undead and other schools alike, you slowly grow in strength, ready to take on the doomsday horde.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9epd.jpg'),(1730,'Mangchi the Hammer Boy','2004-04-01','Platform, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kkoma Daejang Mangchi is a 3D platforming game for children based on a comic book series by Huh Youngman. The game allows movement in three dimensions, but most of the platforming sequences in the five stages are structured like in a 2D game. A few sequences focus on walking into or out of the depth of the screen in a mostly straight progression, usually running away from enemy vehicles. Enemies have a yellow ring around them on the floor, and the hero can only whack them with his mallet as long as he is standing outside of the ring.\n\nThe official homepage saw the game scheduled for July 2002, but somehow the game didn\'t come out before Candy Global Media published it in 2004, when retail PC games in Korea were all but dead and gone, and even DDS itself would have been near their end, if they still existed at all. Needless to say, the Xbox version that was also planned remained a pipe dream like all other Digital Dream Studios games for the console.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67vw.jpg'),(1731,'Pokémon Fire Red Randomizer',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','A randomizer mod for Pokémon Fire Red.\n\nPokemon Randomizers are a fresh new way to experience your favorite Pokemon games! With wild encounters, trainer pokemon, starter pokemon, field items and TMs randomized anything can happen! Imagine walking into the grass and instead of encountering a Pidgey it is a Mewtwo instead. The possibilities are endless and unique!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ca1.jpg'),(1732,'Fall Into Insanity',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fall Into Insanity is a First-Person Atmospheric Horror Game using the power of Unreal Engine 5. Your friends have gone missing under mysterious circumstances and it is up to you to find them. What you find, might just drive you to Insanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mxu.jpg'),(1733,'The Hell That\'s Coming','2014-11-14','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Medium-sized medieval map with fairly linear gameplay and some monster modifications.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78dw.jpg'),(1734,'Gekko Episode of Yurihime','2024-09-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a stage where swords, machines, and ponytails appear in modern society A school love comedy visual novel in which you can enjoy a love story This is the third installment of the Gekko series. In this work, you can enjoy the love story of “Yurihime,” the protagonist\'s older sister and teacher.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oi9.jpg'),(1735,'Project GGG',NULL,'Shooter, MOBA','Sin plataforma','Project GGG (Gun, Gang, Gold) is an extraction genre, top-down action game. Set in space in the far future, become a bounty hunter and defeat gangs. If you return safely, plentiful rewards will welcome you. If you die? You\'ll lose everything. That\'s life. Don\'t let your guard down until the end!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h12.jpg'),(1736,'Kaitouranma Miyabi','1999-01-21','Simulator, Adventure','PlayStation','Kaitouranma Miyabi takes place in Japan during Edo period and takes course of a single year where the player is a student in a martial arts school. The game is a mix of visual novel style gameplay during dialogues and third-person perspective during training and fighting. During first-person perspective, the gameplay follows a typical static 2D anime character sprites over detailed graphical background art with smaller window showing current expression and disposition of a character talking. While the protagonist has no voice-acting, other character feature full voice-acting during dialogues. Training sequence consists of various actions that will boost player\'s skills and is displayed in isometric view from bird\'s perspective, while dueling is done from side view where player\'s skills and training it taken into consideration when performing various fencing moves. There are also several mini-games that become available as the story progresses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o22.jpg'),(1737,'Terror Spikys',NULL,'Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get hired as a Cactus Hunter, explore the killer cacti infested open-world with your truck, help villagers in return for valuables and wipe out the so-called Terror Spikys.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7frj.jpg'),(1738,'Slymoids','1984-02-01','Shooter','Texas Instruments TI-99','You\'re a cowboy fighting off the Slymoids with your gun. They\'re coming in from the horizon and from the sky. When coming in from they sky they move about from side to side as they slowly descend to the bottom of the play field. You can shoot up in the air at the flying Slymoids, or left and right at the ground dwelling Slymoids once they\'ve reached the front of the screen where you walk to the left or right on the ground. \n \nAs you play, the game follows you to the left and right, scrolling through each of the three locations you can play in: along the coast line, in the city, and in the cavern. The cavern has an extra bit as they add strange live dropping stalactites that follow you once they\'ve landed on the ground. Don\'t get too caught up shooting, you have to stop shooting to move and the Slymoids are coming from all directions but in front of you. You can start the game at any difficulty between 1 and 4, and have three lives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bmnvk4g7iutcly1e690f.jpg'),(1739,'Kidou Senshi Gundam SEED Destiny: Rengou vs. Z.A.F.T. II Plus','2006-06-29','Fighting, Arcade','PlayStation 2','Kidou Senshi Gundam SEED Destiny: Rengou vs. Z.A.F.T. II Plus is an Action game, developed and published by Bandai Namco Games, which was released in Japan in 2006.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z4f.jpg'),(1740,'Celeste Classic','2023-04-05','Adventure, Indie','Playdate','An unofficial port of Celeste Classic from PICO-8 to Playdate. Celeste Classic on Playdate was made to be as faithful as possible to the original game on PICO-8. But here are a few notable changes:\n\nThe game is in black and white only. A lot of visual elements have an outline to make them more readable. But this does not impact their original hitbox.\n\nThe game is rendered at 256×240 from the original 128×128. Four pixel lines are cropped at the top and bottom of the screen. The game can be played at its original resolution by disabling the Fullscreen option available in the game’s menu.\n\nAssist mode is available under the game’s menu. This allows players to skip a level, change the game speed to 0.5×, get infinite dashes, and enable invincibility. If assist mode is used during a run, a mention is added on each level in the lower right corner, as well as in the pause screen and the final score screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73i6.jpg'),(1741,'Elysion: Eien no Sanctuary','2000-08-10','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As the story goes, an old man lives on an island in a mansion near the ocean. He\'s reclusive, private and very wealthy. As the family physician, you are summoned to the island to care for the old man. The premise of the game introduction seems innocent and routine enough but the various characters you meet arouse suspicion and suspense amongst the different players inside the mansion.\nThe cast of characters include the codger\'s granddaughter, a groundskeeper, sinister men, and five maids dressed in frilly maid outfits that have a tendency to billow gratuitously.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lzb.jpg'),(1742,'Dungeon & Fighter: Arad',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95i3.jpg'),(1743,'Gladiator Rumble','2025-02-20','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Where your audience transforms into fierce gladiators, ready to fight for glory in the ultimate Twitch-integrated battle simulator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oid.jpg'),(1744,'Peter Jacobsen\'s Golden Tee Golf','1998-12-31','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Based on the arcade hit, Peter Jacobsen\'s Golden Tee Golf matches realistic gameplay with fun and easy-to-learn controls. The game features six 18-hole courses, from desert green to island links, and players can unlock an additional set of six courses after besting the computer opponent in tournament mode. Play classic stroke or skins scoring, with other options such as Bingo Bango Bongo, Speed Golf, and Club Roulette.\n\nThis version features several enhancements over its coin-op cousin. Realistic shadows, water reflections, and fog, plus dynamic wildlife and flags add to the gaming experience. The game also displays full-screen replays with adjustable camera views.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qy2.jpg'),(1745,'Vex 3','2014-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vex 3 is a challenging platform adventure game. Make your way from one platform to the other and avoid deadly obstacles such as buzzsaws, spikes, crumbling blocks, and more! Run and jump to reach the flags. These are the checkpoints.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52se.jpg'),(1746,'Pinball FX 2: Star Wars','2016-02-13','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Based on events from Star Warsᵀᴹ: The Force Awakensᵀᴹ, players will be able to experience unforgettable moments from the film on two action-packed pinball tables. \n \nTeam up with the Resistance to fight against the First Order alongside Rey, Finn, Poe, General Leia and Han Solo in the Star Wars™ Pinball: The Force Awakens™ Table! \n \nTake command of the First Order as you travel through hyperspace on board a Star Destroyer and restore order to a galaxy far, far away on the Star Wars™ Pinball: Might of the First Order table!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1747,'Skool Daze','1985-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum','Skool Daze sets you as Eric, a typical scamp of a schoolboy whose school report is due, and it is so bad that his parents can\'t be allowed to see it. This means retrieving it from the headmaster\'s safe, by obtaining every piece of the pass-code from the teachers, by hitting each of the shields with your catapult.\n\nAll this has to be done around all the rigors of a typical school day. you must go to class when the bell goes, or else it\'s detention, and the other kids will often play around to block you. The game\'s Artificial Intelligence means that events continue to unfold around you in the other rooms and corridors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xfniwgvvtyafth4to2uc.jpg'),(1748,'Chronicles of Middle Ages',NULL,'Strategy','Web browser','CMA, Chronicles of the Middle Ages, is a simulation game that transports you back to the life in the Middle Ages.\n\nWhen you start your journey, you will select the Capital of the Kingdom you have chosen and choose a skill that you would like to begin with.\n\nAs a simulation of life in the Middle Ages, the game is challenging. You cannot simply send items, traveling takes a lot of energy, you have to eat and drink, and you need to wear appropriate clothing in cold weather to avoid freezing and illness. The primary objective of the game is to survive, as you must eat and drink every day or risk losing health and eventually dying.\n\nOnce you have achieved this critical goal, you can start using your chosen skill, such as farming, breeding, or crafting, to build wealth. Wealth is crucial in the game, as buying shops and learning new skills is expensive. To advance, you will need to grind, but this is what makes the game motivating and keeps you logging in every day.\n\nIn CMA, you can be whoever you want to be - a farmer who wants a peaceful life, a merchant who buys items in one city and sells them in another, or a government official who rises through the ranks to become a governor or a king. It all depends on the skills you choose to learn and how you want to be remembered. Note that the number of skills is capped, so you cannot be a \"Jack of all Trades.\"\n\nWe encourage you to role-play in our forum (coming soon) and reflect your role-play in real actions in the game, but this is not a requirement.\n\nIn this game, Kingdom and community collaboration is a key aspect. The staff organizes periodic events where Kingdoms compete and can earn bonuses for their citizens or for the entire Kingdom. In the future, wars may also be a part of the game.\n\nIf you want to become a King, you will need to be a skilled leader with strong organizational skills. You will need to convince others to help you and make tough decisions to achieve your goals.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1749,'Project Red','2023-01-27','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight in the Blood Arena for your life. Earn, bet money and prove to your team your skills in a fair fight. (3v3, 2v2, 1v1) Blood Arena, poker and many more activities on Project Red will allow you to earn $EGLD while showing your skills to the whole mafia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62as.jpg'),(1750,'Bill Walsh College Football','1994-02-01','Sport, Strategy','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Sega CD','The game features 24 college football teams from the 1992 season and 24 of the all-time college teams since 1978. Play modes include exhibition, playoffs and all-time playoffs and the SNES version also has an eleven week season mode with the National Championship as the ultimate goal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4cox.jpg'),(1751,'Pretty Girls Game Collection 4','2024-09-20','Puzzle, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','A collection of four games in the Pretty Girls mini-games series on a single PS4 disc / Switch cart. The bundle includes Pretty Girls 2048 Strike, Pretty Girls Breakers! PLUS, Pretty Girls Escape and Pretty Girls Tile Match.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rs7.jpg'),(1752,'Call of Duty: Advanced Warfare - Ascendance','2015-12-31','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','Prepare for Ascendance, the second downloadable content pack for Call of Duty: Advanced Warfare. Ascendance comes with four multiplayer maps and one Exo Zombies co-op map. It also includes a new Exo Ability in a special playlist for Ascendance maps: Exo Grapple.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60bu.jpg'),(1753,'Please Be Happy','2022-11-21','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A yuri visual novel that will make you both laugh and cry. A story about love, trust, mortality, and about understanding not just how to be happy, but how to be human.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8owm.jpg'),(1754,'Mashou no Yakata Gabalin','1987-02-01','Sin género','MSX','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43ac.jpg'),(1755,'Astérix & Obélix XXL','2004-06-18','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Game Boy Advance','Astérix & Obélix XXL on the Game Boy Advance features the same story as its console/PC counterpart, but presents the 3D platformer gameplay in new and different levels rendered in an engine tailored to the handheld platform.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fb0.jpg'),(1756,'Kedama no Gonjiro',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1757,'Pool','2018-02-20','Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','An easy to play Pool game to play for all ages, play against another person (2 players) or against the AI (artificial intelligent) player and rediscover the fun and excitement of this classic arcade game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/b11iwkb5zpaoumbsvcbb.jpg'),(1758,'Pretty Girls 2048 Strike','2023-05-11','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The “Pretty Girls\" series now includes \"2048\" slide puzzle! This is a strategic \"2048\" number game where you combine number blocks to create larger number blocks and defeat your enemies by hitting them with those blocks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i84.jpg'),(1759,'Accolade\'s Comics featuring Steve Keene Thrillseeker','1987-12-31','Adventure, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX','A young boy reads his favorite comic book about secret agent Steve Keene. The story begins when agent Keene\'s boss sends him on one of two missions: to Vienna to investigate the mysterious disappearance of a famous professor, or to solve the mystery of strange self-replicating non-functioning fire hydrants.\n\nWhile reading from page to page like a comic magazine you can interact with the characters when you choose what Keene should do or say; sometimes you even can take control over Keene to surpass action sequences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wz4.jpg'),(1760,'Within The Shadows',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Horror game where you\'re tasked with simply going to sleep. Ever since you were a kid, you\'ve been gravely afraid of the dark. Because of this, you need to keep the nightlights on in your bedroom and bathroom. You can\'t quite remember why you\'ve always had this phobia, but you sure don\'t want to find out again...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co831v.jpg'),(1761,'Thor: Bring the Thunder','2011-05-01','Platform, Arcade','Web browser','Play Thor: Bring the Thunder game to explore the fascinating realm of Asgard! Can you help our hero defend his home from the forces of evil?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98vf.jpg'),(1762,'270 | Two Seventy US Election','2018-05-15','Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Do you have what it takes to become President of the United States? Can you win the Two Seventy (270) Electoral Votes needed for victory in the US Election?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ks4.jpg'),(1763,'Conan Exiles: Complete Edition','2021-10-21','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Experience all the content released for Conan Exiles in a single mighty bundle containing the full game, the Isle of Siptah Expansion, and every DLC! Explore the Savage Exiled Lands as brutal barbarian and corrupted sorcerer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s43.jpg'),(1764,'RPG Maker II','2003-10-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PlayStation 2','Sequel to RPG Maker (PSX) moves the roleplaying creation experience into the 3D realm by harnessing the power of the PS2. RPG Maker II offers everything players could need to bring their own fantasy game worlds to life. Build original worlds from scratch using a variety of 3D tools that include: a character editor, map creation tools, visual FX editor, script editor, and monster animation. By providing fully rendered 3D models for all the characters, monsters, backgrounds, and items, RPG Maker II lets you write your own stories and make them come to life. The roleplaying creation kit offers over 200 characters and enemies, more than 250 objects, and an infinite number of Magic/Skill abilities, weapons, equipment, and items, a help feature, up to 8 MB of storage, keyboard and camera compatibility, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9sge.jpg'),(1765,'LEGO Dimensions: Gremlins Team Pack',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w7s.jpg'),(1766,'Zeal-X2','2025-11-30','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zeal-X2 is a 2.5 D platformer in which you take on the role of Redscar.\nHere you can slash your way through enemies and make heads roll.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kgf.jpg'),(1767,'Crypto Cars World','2021-09-30','Racing, Simulator','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Crypto Cars World is a video game base don NFT blockchain technology, inspired by Need for Speed or Gran Turismo, in which players compete in race within circuits where the fastest is the winner.\n\nYou can choose to be a mechanic, a racer or BOTH!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rj8.jpg'),(1768,'DCS World: Combined Arms','2012-05-31','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DCS World: Combined Arms gives you control of ground forces during the battle. Use the Command Map to move ground forces, set artillery fire missions, and control the ground battle. Assume the role of a Joint Terminal Attack Controller (JTAC) in multiplayer and designate targets for player-controlled close air support aircraft, or directly...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ltj.jpg'),(1769,'Travel Junction','1996-12-31','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series','Hero fails to find a job in a major tour company. Eventually, he gets a job in a very small tour company on the verge of bankruptcy only containing four people with him. Their last hope is barely known southern island that no big tourist company holds. Hero and company president\'s daughter go there as guides alongside a tourist group of six women.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1770,'Neofeud','2017-09-19','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Neofeud is a Dystopic Cyberpunk adventure game in the vein of Blade Runner, but with an overlay of Game of Thrones-like political intrigue, and 1366x768, hand-painted, stylized visuals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co253a.jpg'),(1771,'CSS Clicker','2025-04-01','Sin género','Web browser','CSS Clicker is a fully-featured incremental game where your goal is to design your own personal website and get as many views on it as possible.\n\nThe fun part? It\'s a pure-CSS game, meaning it runs no Javascript or server-side code.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mdg.jpg'),(1772,'Fighting Force',NULL,'Fighting, Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Sega Saturn, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Fighting Force players control one of four characters. They move through urban and science fiction environments, battling waves of oncoming enemies with weapons ranging from fists and bottles to knives, chairs and guns. The player can make some choices as to which territory to travel through.\n\nThe four characters have various reasons for taking on Dr. Zeng, a criminal mastermind with an army at his command. The action starts with a police cordon around Zeng\'s office skyscraper, moving to such locales as a shopping mall, subway and Coast Guard base before finally ending at the top of Zeng\'s island headquarters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23ib.jpg'),(1773,'Toki Tori: Ultimate Edition','2024-12-01','Platform, Puzzle','Game Boy Color','Get ready to experience the beloved puzzle game Toki Tori like never before in the Ultimate Edition, remastered to offer smoother gameplay and modern enhancements. Join the courageous Toki Tori as he embarks on a quest to rescue his kidnapped, unhatched siblings, solving challenging puzzles across more than 60 exciting levels.\n\nThis remaster includes exclusive updates that improve the original experience, including:\n- Faster movement\n- Auto-jump\n- No more pesky timer\n- Faster navigation','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rvl.jpg'),(1774,'PedalVerse','2024-11-22','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','PedalVerse combines the thrill of downhill MTB racing with the freedom of FPV drone exploration. Customize your rider and bike, race dynamic tracks, and set records to climb the leaderboard. Tackle challenges and explore a semi-open world. Ready to take on the challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fs5.jpg'),(1775,'SMOD','2004-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SMOD (short for SuperMod) is a single-player modification that adds new effects, weapons, and NPCs to Half-Life 2.\n\nThe new content consists of many new NPCs and weapons, new gamemodes, comprehensive customization and tweaking options, new abilities for the player, and new features to the gameplay, such as level randomization and simple branching in the otherwise linear flow of the main episodes.\n\nThis is a Japanese modification for Half-Life 2 that certainly throws some suprises your way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j3b.jpg'),(1776,'The Night of Joe','2020-10-28','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Night of Joe is an action-horror game set in a supermarket at night. Joe is trying to exit, to do so he has to find and activate some escalators while a monster is chasing him.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i9q.jpg'),(1777,'Pocket Player: Bubble Bobble','2019-12-31','Arcade','Handheld Electronic LCD','The Pocket Player has a full-color display and is fine-tuned for hours of play through its emphasis on ergonomics and compact design.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nde.jpg'),(1778,'Heroes Chronicles: The World Tree','2000-09-27','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The World Tree is the fifth part of Heroes Chronicles, following Clash of the Dragons and preceding The Fiery Moon. \nAs a Barbarian, Tarnum defends the World Tree in northeastern Antagarich from evil Barbarians and Necromancers led by the demigod Vorr. This was available as a free download for those who purchased two Heroes Chronicles games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/kpokm8ag2hkaxufad2lj.jpg'),(1779,'Tetris: The Absolute - The Grand Master 2','2000-10-01','Puzzle, Arcade','Arcade','Arika\'s challenging puzzle-action series continues with new game modes, challenges, and mechanics innovations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a6x.jpg'),(1780,'Meaty McSkinBones','2019-07-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Meaty McSkinBones is a single-player puzzle/platformer where the character is split into three separate bodies. They each have unique abilities or can work together to solve puzzles and traverse the environment. It\'s quirky, hilarious, and a ton of fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bne.jpg'),(1781,'Gravity Forge',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Master gravity and parkour skills to slay hordes of enemies. As an elegant assassin, you can play solo or in co-op with friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xbu.jpg'),(1782,'Vagante','2022-01-27','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Vagante is an action-packed platformer that features permanent death and procedurally generated levels. Play cooperatively with friends or adventure solo in this challenging roguelike-inspired game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2keh.jpg'),(1783,'Final Fantasy XIV: As Goes Light, So Goes Darkness','2015-11-09','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Patch 3.1 brings a myriad of additions and refinements to the realm of Eorzea, including new story quests, new beast tribe quests, exploratory missions, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vmq.jpg'),(1784,'Berserker','2021-02-26','Fighting, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Side scroller game with story-driven elements, based in old Viking age before all known written sagas and scripts, we follow Asbjorn as he must save and protect what he cares the most for.\n\nThis game is violent and has zero respect for the bad guys. You, as Asbjorn who is retired Viking warrior, blessed by gods with Rage rune which he must control and use only when needed are stuck in the situation nobody want´s to be. He must use his axe and shield or axes to reach out of situation he did not want to be in.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gm0.jpg'),(1785,'Free Chess','2024-05-09','Simulator, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Free Chess is a free physics based chess simulator where you are free to play the game of chess with the freedom of however you like.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8efz.jpg'),(1786,'Enchanter','1984-12-31','Adventure','Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, TRS-80 Color Computer, Atari ST/STE, Mac, DOS, Amiga, Apple II, TRS-80, Amstrad CPC, Amstrad PCW','Enchanter is a 1983 interactive fiction computer game written by Marc Blank and Dave Lebling and published by Infocom. It belongs to the fantasy genre and was the first fantasy game published by Infocom after the Zork trilogy (it was originally intended to be Zork IV). The game had a parser that understood over 700 words, making it the most advanced interactive fiction game of its time. It was Infocom\'s ninth game.\n\nKrill, an incredibly powerful evil warlock, is spreading chaos and destruction. None of the more experienced members of the Circle of Enchanters dare to attempt to stop him. In desperation, the player, a novice Enchanter with only a few weak spells in his spell book, is sent in hopes that Krill will either fail to detect him or dismiss him as harmless. More powerful spells can be found on scrolls hidden in various locations, but as the player becomes more of a threat, Krill will respond accordingly.\n\nThis game features an innovative new spell system based partially on Ursula K. Le Guin\'s Earthsea series and partially Dungeons and Dragons\' Vancian spell system, where spells must be prepared through \"memorization\" before being cast. As in the Earthsea series, each spell is represented by some nonsense \"magic word\" which is treated as a verb by the game\'s text parser, so that one can use the FROTZ spell (which causes objects to glow and give off light) by typing >FROTZ BOOK, in exactly the same way as one might type >PICK UP BOOK or >READ BOOK.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5b80.jpg'),(1787,'Phantasy Star: Fukkoku-ban','1994-05-02','Role-playing (RPG)','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','This is a special edition of the first Phantasy Star for Mega Drive. Only released on Japan, made for the release of Phantasy Star IV debut. The real number of copies is uncertain but many forums and collectors say that only 10000 copies are made.\n\nPhantasy Star was first released in Japan for the Master System on December 20, 1987. It was the most expensive game for the Master System in every market, its price being driven by the large 4 megabit chip, the save battery, and a concurrent chip shortage across the industry. In Japan, the game was difficult to find in stores. Sega often got requests from fans for a Mega Drive port, so they eventually shipped a limited release for the Mega Drive as part of a contest in 1994. This version was identical to the Master System version but lacked FM sound enhancements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xk8.jpg'),(1788,'Fire Arrow Plus','2017-02-01','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fire Arrow and Fire Arrow X are time attack style shooters with a heavy emphasis on scoring. Otherwisely, you can call them coffee break shmups.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gex.jpg'),(1789,'Gates of Olympus','2025-01-10','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into ancient Greece in Gates of Olympus, a thrilling match-3 game. Harness the powers of Zeus and the gods to unlock treasures and claim your place among the immortals. The gods await—dare to challenge them!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oi7.jpg'),(1790,'The Psychologist',NULL,'Point-and-click','Sin plataforma','A point-and-click survival horror game, you play as a psychologist. Complete evaluations while preventing your anxiety from escalating. Can you survive The Company?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y41.jpg'),(1791,'Street Fighter II\' Turbo: Hyper Fighting','1992-12-10','Fighting, Arcade','Arcade, Wii, Xbox 360, Super Famicom','Street Fighter II Turbo: Hyper Fighting is a competitive fighting game released for the arcade by Capcom in 1992. It is the third game in the Street Fighter II sub-series of Street Fighter games following Street Fighter II: Champion Edition. Released less than a year after the previous installment, Hyper Fighting introduced a faster playing speed and new special moves for certain characters, as well as further refinement to the character balance.\n\nHyper Fighting is the final arcade game in the Street Fighter II series to use the original CP System hardware. It was distributed as an upgrade kit designed to be installed into Champion Edition printed circuit boards. The next game in the series, Super Street Fighter II, uses the CP System\'s successor, the CP System II.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2srf.jpg'),(1792,'Spy Fox 2: \"Some Assembly Required\"',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Once again, the world relies on Fox - Spy Fox, the suave secret agent who smoothly finesses his way through Spy Corps\' toughest assignments. This time, Spy Corps\' corrupt counterpart, the Society for Meaningless Evil, Larceny, Lying and Yelling (S.M.E.L.L.Y.) has devised a dogbot which will be unleashed upon the unsuspecting world! In his nastiness, S.M.E.L.L.Y.\'s corrupt commander, Napoleon LeRoach, did not install an OFF switch on the dogbot. Instead, he hid the switch somewhere within the World\'s Fair.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nne.jpg'),(1793,'Portabellows',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a wholesome 3D platformer adventure where you’ll gather hard to reach ingredients for baking pies to appease a long forgotten deity, releasing the island’s quirky unwilling guests! Take your time, sip a refreshing tea and explore every nook and cranny!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j24.jpg'),(1794,'Champion Pro Wrestling','1985-12-31','Sport','Arcade, SG-1000, MSX','A colorfully cartoonish professional wrestling game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e85.jpg'),(1795,'Mortal Quest','2026-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A survival-adventure game about a mortal who\'s been transferred to a demon-infested island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lcq.jpg'),(1796,'Logistical: USA - New York','2017-10-24','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Logistical: USA - New York is a large open-world, strategy, puzzle game where you transport different cargoes to complete all the towns throughout the islands with over 1300 towns to Complete.\nLogistical: USA - New York game covers the state of New York including cities like New York, Buffalo and Rochester.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i1c.jpg'),(1797,'Providence',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Providence is a free-to-play multiplayer co-op survival shooter with a strong narrative, challenging combat, and a unique player-driven economy. Providence is set in a universe ravaged by a catastrophic event known as the Singularity. Players, known as Trailblazers, explore alien worlds, compete for resources and craft items to survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8roz.jpg'),(1798,'Traceur\'s Dreamlab VR',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Traceur\'s Dreamlab is a place to be for every parkour runner! You can build your own levels, including not only challenging obstacles but also tricky puzzles and share them with the community. Within our leaderboard system you can run against the time of your friends and other online players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44u9.jpg'),(1799,'SchoolBoy Simulator',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ir9.jpg'),(1800,'Beyond Babel','2002-01-01','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','DOS','Your village, Renesco, is not safe. The dangers of your post- apocalyptic world threaten its very existence. It is up to you to save it, or destroy it if you like.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1801,'RandoJumper','2024-08-02','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A precision platformer of a pirate who is out there to prove himself that he can reach the top!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mi3.jpg'),(1802,'Guild Wars: Nightfall','2006-10-01','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Guild Wars Nightfall, the third campaign in the award-winning Guild Wars universe, you will never face danger alone. Not only can you group with any of millions of players worldwide, but now, for the first time ever, you\'ll be able to band together with customizable Heroes that will not only fight by your side, but level up with your character and follow your orders as you fight to hold back the night.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ygt.jpg'),(1803,'Bullet Soul','2011-04-07','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','A brand-new adaptation to the shooting genre which rewards survival through aggressive play. Blending classic shooting game design with a substantial dose of modern day bullet hell, Bullet Soul has it all! Bringing even more heat are Resonator: the moniker of aural wizards Kenji \'Itoken\' Ito and Kohta Takahashi, setting fire to your speakers with their tunes. Last but not least, Akio Watanabe brings his skills to the scene cooking up the character designs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co230c.jpg'),(1804,'Kirby 64: The Crystal Shards','2008-09-16','Platform, Adventure','Wii, Nintendo 64, Wii U','Kirby\'s first 3-D adventure is also his Nintendo 64 debut, and it finds the always-versatile hero battling a new enemy called Dark Matter. Dark Matter is after a distant land\'s powerful crystal, but a young fairy named Ribbon attempts to save it by escaping with the gem to Dream Land. Now the crystal has been broken, and it\'s scattered around the world. Take control of Kirby and help him journey across six worlds, battling a wide variety of enemies and challenging bosses, as he tries to collect all 100 pieces of the shattered crystal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wcz.jpg'),(1805,'Lords of the Fallen: Master of Fate Update','2024-04-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','VERSION 1.5 - \'Master of Fate\': This update represents the culmination of 30+ post-launch updates resulting in significantly improved performance, stability & optimization, alongside rigorous difficulty balancing, and also includes our \'Advanced Game Modifier System\', allowing ALL players to fully customize and adjust difficulty of future play-throughs.\n\nThe Master of Fate Update concludes now concludes the Free Content Roadmap for Lords of the Fallen, adding the following content and quality-of-life enhancements, vastly improving the experience for all players:\n\n- Significant performance, optimization and stability improvements\n- Rigorous difficulty balancing including mob density reduction & nerfed ranged attacks\n- Split PvP and PvE game balancing\n- Online multiplayer enhancements for improved matchmaking and connection stability\n- New questlines including Season of the Bleak, Trial of the Three Spirits, and Way of the Bucket\n- New armor and weapon sets\n- Additional secret boss weapon abilities\n- Improved boss encounters with additional movesets & new AI\n- 12 new spells including the arena-devastating Immolation\n- New grievous strikes: each weapon family now features two unique finishers: one for single-handed wielding and another for two-handed wielding\n- 3 new projectiles: Blood Vomit, Explosive Mines, and Frost Worms.\n- QOL updates including: inventory expansion, appearance reset, storage functionality & gamepad rebinding','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84kz.jpg'),(1806,'Granny Kick Neighbor',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1807,'The Legend of Heroes: Sora no Kiseki FC Kai - HD Edition','2012-12-13','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 3','A remaster of the PSP version of the first installment in the series, serving as the beginning to the Liberl arc and the series as a whole, with enhanced graphics, cross-save with the PSP version and extras like PS3 themes, music, calendars and more. The game follows protagonists Estelle Bright and her adopted brother Joshua, who journey through the country of Liberl to train to become senior Bracers, members of a non-government multinational organization that acts to keep the peace and protect civilians.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74ec.jpg'),(1808,'Impostors','2024-06-28','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience a NEW ERA of social deduction gaming! Outsmart your opponents, form unlikely alliances, trick & deceive to stay alive! Work together to complete tasks but watch out for the impostors! They\'re lurking in the shadows, ready to sabotage your efforts and kill you off one by one…\nEnjoy countless game scenarios with your friends in this 4-15 player party-game, talk your way out of trouble with in-game voice chat, and immerse yourself in an ever-changing world with surprises around every corner!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pea.jpg'),(1809,'Ghost Clicker',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1810,'Mad Void','2024-11-11','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mad Void is a chaotic space survival online co-op, you face alone or up to 3 crewmates alarming dangers on each mission. Sent out by the Galactic Confederation to extract lost tech from fallen spaceship that succumbed in epic space battle, find your way in the mad void of space to retrieve the tech before the Enemy returns.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90es.jpg'),(1811,'Lunarball','2024-06-04','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Competitive 3v3, team-based sport set in space! Kick, dribble and punch your way to victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g8s.jpg'),(1812,'Infinitrap: Ohio Jack and the cup of Eternity','2015-12-22','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','InfiniTrap is a fast paced maze game for hardcore players. The game will start off with 40 levels and will be available on Windows, OSX and Linux.\n\nEvery level starts with the player character standing on the start tile. The start tile is perfectly safe-- No, trust me. It\'s safe. Once you leave the start tile, you have a limited time to reach the treasure before the level crushes you. To complicate things, each level will include a number of obstacles to waste your time and possibly kill you. You can make your own levels! \n\nThis game will make you ragequit and break your computer or become a god-like speedrunner :)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uxpr64igtgz6odqquqzh.jpg'),(1813,'Gladiators Idle',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1814,'Continuity','2009-12-01','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','Prepare to embark on a perception-stretching, linearity-quashing adventure of amorphous proportions. Every level contains a pristine red door, only usable for exiting purposes after one or more red keys have been collected. Sounds straightforward enough, but it\'s funny just how much this game will twist your perceptions of both straight AND forward. All levels are composed of a number of squares, shiftable in a manner akin to a sliding tile puzzle. Each square contains a finite fraction of the overall level itself, and the key to victory lies in prudent transfigurations of the landscape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wck.jpg'),(1815,'Gloomy Tales: Hotel Frightsylvania - Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1816,'Gnomich','2024-12-05','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gnomich is a clicker game where you mine resources! You can upgrade your gnome to get even more resources! You get one mineral every 3 hours. Join Discord or Telegram to participate in tournaments!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oii.jpg'),(1817,'Yokai Mask','2018-09-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Qiu Yue, the girl who has lost her childhood memories, wants to find out the truth by the only clue -- a fox mask. But she is trapped in a 50-years conspiracy when searching an old mask shop. All the truth is going to show by the adventure of Qiu Yue and two mates ...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l5n.jpg'),(1818,'Bridge Project','2012-10-19','Puzzle, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build A Bridge... and Get Over It!\n\nThe Bridge Project is the successor to the original and award-winning Bridge Builder simulation, all amateur designers and structural engineers finally have a new challenge on their PC.\n\nThe gameplay has been subject to much tweaking and development with new up to date materials exciting scenarios and a variety of tasks waiting to be solved.\nBuild stable bridges in a variety of landscapes with detailed environment.\n\nTake on the task of constructing a huge variety of different bridges: suspended, folding, stone, steel, wood, car or railway bridges.\n\nWhilst you enjoy the enhanced graphics and the new, improved physics engine putting the most spectacular bridges to the test with stress tests.\n\nDownload free levels from the global Bridge Project community, and participate in competitions.Key Features All-new in-game graphics with a variety of detailed 3D objects\nNew user interface for easy operation\nAdditional materials such as wood and concrete\nIn addition to trains, cars and ships you can now test vehicles such as buses and tanksYour Bridges Extended weight and stability testing of different vehicles, or natural events such as storms or earthquakes\n48 varied and challenging levels: different towns, canyons, rural areas\nSet the design tasks to different modes - simple or expert.\nEditor feature - build your own levels and share them with other players\nCompare your technical skills with other players in the global online ranking\nTake part in competitions, improve your own record!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1usg.jpg'),(1819,'Goalkeeper Journey','2024-11-09','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the gloves of a rising goalkeeper, starting your journey at local clubs and working your way to the world\'s biggest football stages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oij.jpg'),(1820,'Sinbad: Legend of the Seven Seas','2003-10-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A video game based on the film, titled Sinbad: Legend of the Seven Seas, was released on August 21, 2003. Published by Atari and developed by Small Rockets, it was released for PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6klp.jpg'),(1821,'Front Lines','1994-12-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Front Lines is a tactical wargame of the \"near\" future (set in 2020 or 2044, depending on whether you play the U. S. or German version). It can run in either single-player or two-player mode, and can use a head-to-head feature by modem. All the usual forces of the modern army are present, but by this time heavy laser weapons have become practical, soldiers wear powered armor, unmanned ground strike aircraft are common, tanks can hover as well as roll, and artillery projectiles are even more powerful and accurate than they are today.\n\nYou command your army, which may incorporate some U. S. forces, in the European theater. Some of the opposing forces answer to a corporate conglomerate. The roles of offensive, defensive, and supply assets have to balanced properly. The game progresses through a series of land battles over various kinds of terrain -- and the terrain gives varying combinations of advantages and disadvantages. The game has some limited representation of Europe\'s real-world geographical features, which gives a sense of why they are militarily important. For example, you can see the importance of the Fulda Gap, just as it was important in previous World Wars, and just as it would have been important if the Cold War had become hot.\n\nEach battle has one or more objectives, and also a time limit. To win, you must accomplish your objectives while stopping the enemy from accomplishing his, and you must do this before time runs out. Each objective accomplished earns you a certain number of victory points. At the battle\'s end, the winner is the player with the most victory points.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42jd.jpg'),(1822,'Cadaver: The Payoff','1991-02-01','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','Cadaver: The Payoff is an add-on that requires the original disc to play. It continues the story and offers four more isometric levels of fiendish puzzles.\n\nAfter defeating Dianos, Karadoc returns to the inn only to find his employers gone, and every living person within the city either dead or transformed into a monster. Seeking the cause behind this, the dwarf fights his way to the local temple, and finds the answers - and his money - deep down in the crypts.\n\nGameplay is similar. Cadaver: The Payoff has only four levels, but they are significantly larger than those of the first game, and the second level has a large number of monsters and scant possibilities to heal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co856u.jpg'),(1823,'Hoppup!','2020-11-23','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hoppup! is a difficult climbing-platformer where you attempt to hop your way to the top of the world! Make strange friends along the way and eat Pineapples whenever possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mzy.jpg'),(1824,'Best of PlayStation Network Vol. 1','2013-06-25','Platform','PlayStation 3','Best of PlayStationNetwork, Vol.1 includes four hits from the PSN library including:\n\nWhen Vikings Attack! – This energetic third person adventure from the PlayStationNetwork features fast-paced battles pitting up to four co-operative players against the Viking hordes, and manically competitive “Versus” arenas where players can test their skills against friends.\n\nSound Shapes – Equal parts instrument and game, Sound ShapesTM gives everyone the ability to make music. Play through a unique campaign that fuses music and artwork into a classic 2D platformer, featuring artwork by Pixeljam, Capy, Superbrothers and more, with music by I Am Robot and Proud, Jim Guthrie and Deadmau5. Create your own unique musical levels with all of the campaign content and share with the world. Sound Shapes creates an ever-changing musical community for everyone to enjoy at home or on the go.\n\nTokyo Jungle – With over 50 playable animals to choose from, unleash your inner beast to hunt your way to the top of Tokyo\'s post-apocalyptic food chain. Whether in Story or Survival Mode, you never know where your next meal will come from or the dangers you\'ll face, so be prepared for anything and everything. Forage through this desolate but dangerous city to complete story-based challenges using a variety of survival skills, from all-out attack to stealth. Beware-- you are not the only animal out there hunting for survival!\n\nFat Princess - Choose from five distinct character classes and switch at any time to best help your team. Charge head first into battle, heal teammates as they break through enemy lines, and upgrade your team and the castle defenses as you work with your team to save your princess. There\'s a catch, though—the other team has been feeding her magical cake, making her harder to escort back to your castle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6033.jpg'),(1825,'Quest for Glory Collection','2016-08-29','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The world of Gloriana, with all its wonderful diversity, awaits you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jlc.jpg'),(1826,'Final Fantasy XV: War for Eos','2022-03-21','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Android, iOS','Final Fantasy XV: War for Eos is an Android/iOS free-to-play game set in the universe of Final Fantasy XV. It features an alternate story which focuses on the rebuilding of Insomnia after the Niflheim Empire\'s attack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co606n.jpg'),(1827,'Escape from Pleasure Planet','2016-12-15','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Escape from Pleasure Planet is a gay-themed science-fiction adventure game with bright colourful graphics, a fun story and character art by Joe Phillips.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qcf.jpg'),(1828,'Trackwars','2022-04-13','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Jump in to an Action packed Role Playing game living in 2056, explore the whole city, and get money by doing jobs. If you wanna be the best in the city you need almost everything, every cars, guns, even apartments! This is the city with bunch of bad guys, explore the future with Trackwars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49n8.jpg'),(1829,'Chick Boy Adventures','2021-11-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chick Boy Adventures - Immerse yourself in the fantasy world of dreams of an unprecedented sweet tooth and collect all the goodies before someone else eats them! Collect sweets in the vast nooks and crannies of your mind and get as far as possible on this extraordinary adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5l43.jpg'),(1830,'Treasure Hunter','2024-01-17','Role-playing (RPG)','Android','Embark on an epic MMO adventure with Treasure Hunter – the ultimate open-world experience awaits! Uncover the thrill of the hunt as you search for hidden chests, each requiring a unique key. But beware, once you possess the key, your location is revealed to all, creating a dynamic and strategic gameplay element.\n\nExplore a vast world filled with secrets, where every corner holds the potential for discovery. Arm yourself with powerful weapons, don mighty armor, and even team up with a trusty rider and pet. Upgrade your gear and challenge other players in the expansive open world.\n\nDive into the unknown, encountering dangerous monsters and collecting rare ingredients for crafting. The world is yours to shape—forge alliances, wage battles, or simply craft to your heart\'s content. No mercy, only endless possibilities in this thrilling MMO adventure! Download now and become the ultimate Treasure Hunter!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98zn.jpg'),(1831,'Spikit',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1832,'Hunt Me','2024-12-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','HUNT ME is a co-op horror survival game for 1-4 players. Gather the ingredients for the ritual, weaken the threat and banish it. Be careful, you\'re also the prey!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8q00.jpg'),(1833,'Ascent: Rivals','2024-06-30','Shooter, Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Early alpha by 4 person indie team: a twin-stick, dual engine death-race where anything goes in order to claim victory and fame. Some do it for the adrenaline, others for fame, and some for a shot at escaping poverty — and the majority to watch the ensuing chaos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7t8j.jpg'),(1834,'Inferno: Beyond the 7th Circle','2021-04-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grid-Based First Person Dungeon Crawler with survival elements. It\'s inspired by classic cRPG from the 90s. An old-school game for hardcore players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31pu.jpg'),(1835,'Tron 2.0','2014-10-06','Shooter, Racing, Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An unknown viral agent threatens the future of computer systems worldwide. Countermeasure programs have scanned the system and have wrongly identified you as the virus source. Your mission is to prevent the sinister conspiracy that threatens to corrupt one reality, and forever transform another.\n\nOver 35 levels of challenging gameplay -- Race at the speed of light, fight off computer Viruses and engage in violent digital combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28sg.jpg'),(1836,'The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion - The Vile Lair','2006-07-13','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The Vile Lair is the sixth official add-on for The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion. It adds a new quest where the player has to buy all upgrades to the Deepscorn Hollow hideout (also added by the DLC), after which it becomes the player\'s property. The add-on also adds some new items and a new merchant to the Wawnet Inn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nju.jpg'),(1837,'Riptide','2024-05-02','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Riptide, gear up your ship, customize your loadout, and fight for the fleet! Riptide is a spaceship combat game with an emphasis on powerful customizations and utility. Accomplish your mission by loading up and taking out the enemy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7w39.jpg'),(1838,'Storm Wings',NULL,'Shooter, Arcade','Android','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kbh.jpg'),(1839,'Exverse','2024-04-15','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into 2085 with Exverse, a gripping FPS that merges intense shooter gameplay with innovative Web3 mechanics built on Unreal Engine 5. Humanity clings to survival in space after a cataclysmic event rendered Earth a wasteland. As the planet\'s flora unleashed a deadly toxin, the race to save or abandon Earth divides humanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82bl.jpg'),(1840,'Coast Guard: Beach Rescue Team','2020-06-04','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Nintendo Switch','Become a member of a coast guard squad and explore beautiful beaches, helping people in need! Coast Guard: Beach Rescue Team is an exciting driving game that will let you drive and pilot multiple cool vehicles - cars, boats, buggies and more! With them, the game will take you along the beaches and into the sea. Drive patrol trucks on the sand, from there get on the road if you need to move to another location or hop into a rescue boat and pilot it into the sea. Whatever the beach vehicle you think of, you’ll probably find it here. Are you ready to try out all of them?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57ai.jpg'),(1841,'Senran Kagura: Peach Beach Splash','2017-03-16','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The summer of bouncy, high-flying hijinks continues for the girls of SENRAN KAGURA! They\'ve fought rival ninja, evil masterminds, and apocalyptic demons from beyond the veil of sanity, but nothing—NOTHING in their lives has ever prepared them for...a water gun fight?!\n\nSummoned to a mysterious tournament by its shady organizers, the buxom shinobi students team up and face off, using all kinds of water weapons to soak and splash their opponents. As they rise through the tournament brackets, they\'ll uncover the secrets behind the organization － secrets that hide an ever-growing threat to... Wait, what? Sorry, I was watching all the splashing.\n\nChoose a team of five from the more than 30 girls available, outfit them with customizable weapons and abilities, lead them through lighthearted water gun battles across five single-player storylines, or join your friends online and take on opposing teams worldwide. Come on in; the water\'s great!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3maa.jpg'),(1842,'Pixicharm: Mariana Gold','2025-03-07','Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ire.jpg'),(1843,'Grimoire','2022-10-27','Puzzle, Indie','Playdate','A casual Minesweeper-like for Playdate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81ls.jpg'),(1844,'G-Mode Archives+: Story of Seasons Mobile - Minori no Shima',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1845,'Lucky Star: Ryouou Gakuen Outousai - DX Pack','2008-01-24','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','Lucky Star: Ryouou Gakuen Outousai - DX Pack is a deluxe edition of the game that includes:\n- A copy of the game\n- A school girl\'s sailor uniform\n- A collection of posters from Lucky Star\n- A school nameplate and pin\n\nThere was also some pre-order bonuses that included such as a CD-ROM featuring various voice overs, a PC fighting game featuring characters from Lucky Star and a balsamic vinegar trap.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53xc.jpg'),(1846,'Shining Song Starnova: Idol Empire','2020-02-20','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The girls of Starnova are back in a new business simulation game! It\'s up to you the producer to build your office, re-hire the girls and get the money flowing to put on the greatest live concert ever. Do you have the management skills to once again accomplish everyone\'s dreams?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zi8.jpg'),(1847,'Rocket Arena: Mythic Edition','2020-07-14','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Rockets rule everything in Rocket Arena, an explosive 3v3 shooter where you\'re never out of the action. Master your hero\'s unique rockets and abilities to rule the arena and become a champion. Let\'s Rocket!\n\nThe Mythic Edition includes:\n- Guardian Phoenix Jayto Mythic Outfit\n- Frost Princess Kayi Outfit\n- Cyber Sailor Blastbeard Outfit\n- Stone Temple Izell Outfit\n- Pulsar Megablast Trail\n- Fragment Return Trail\n- 1000 Rocket Fuel','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ehj.jpg'),(1848,'Gakuen K: Wonderful School Days','2014-10-30','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Gakuen K is an otome visual novel based on K Project by GoHands and GoRa featuring an original character exlusive to the game, Konohana Saya, as the protagonist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kjv.jpg'),(1849,'Last Chance Supermarket','2013-12-15','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Last Chance Supermarket is an exhilarating shopping experience, with death lurking around every aisle.\nThe game involves madly rushing around the shops late on Christmas Eve, trying to purchase a few special things for the big day. You only get one chance a year to really show your family how much you actually care, so make sure to get everything on that list! Try not to buy too much extra stuff though as money is tight and your wife is fussy about clutter! Above all, however, please don\'t get yourself killed by a speeding shopping cart...\nUse your mouse to steer the shopping cart around and sidle up to the things you wish to purchase, whereupon pressing the spacebar will pop them into your trolley.\nThis game was made in 48 hours for Ludum Dare #28.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/y0crqqgjzy466msvqyrf.jpg'),(1850,'Kobolok','2024-01-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Kobolok is an ethnic retro horror game based on an Eastern European fairytale about round bread \"Kolobok\" aka \"O Koblížkovi\" aka \"Pannkauken.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ilo.jpg'),(1851,'Don\'t Shoot Us','2023-12-16','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Don\'t Shoot Us is a solo FPS that tells the story of a tactical soldier from the point of view of his body camera. Try to survive as long as possible against the hordes of infected of all kinds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7iu3.jpg'),(1852,'Halver','2024-04-11','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Halve the blocks into two equal parts and solve the unique puzzles in a game with a blueprint visual style and meditative music','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gtt.jpg'),(1853,'Firefighters: The Simulation','2017-02-16','Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','You and your team will experience the exciting work of the professional fire brigade, surviving realistic missions where you extinguish house fires, salvage and neutralize extremely toxic and hazardous substances, and accomplish many other fascinating tasks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24h9.jpg'),(1854,'Manuganu','2013-12-31','Arcade','Android','Run, jump and slide from ropes, dodge rocks! Not enough? There is much more in Manuganu. Avoid swinging hammers and jump over moving ice blocks. Don’t get burned and jump between walls to collect coins and medallions. Break stone blocks and activate platforms before you fall into fog and much more... Manuganu is a 3D side- scroller running game, in which you control the boy “Manuganu”. Unlike other usual running games, Manuganu brings on the “Halt feature” to avoid swinging rocks, hammers, flames and other enemies with the right timing. Another important feature of Manuganu is the ability to switch from “running” mode to “rope climbing” mode when needed. But be careful! This mode has its own challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z69.jpg'),(1855,'Bassmaster Fishing 2022','2021-10-28','Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Bassmaster Fishing 2022, the official video game is coming this Fall, bringing the thrill of competitive big bass fishing to PC. Dive into the fully licensed content from the Bassmaster series from amateur to elite events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zg6.jpg'),(1856,'Escape from Norwood','2023-09-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore a city that lives without your input in this illustrated text adventure. Observe the lives of its inhabitants behind the veil of your invisibility magic. Find items and combine them to solve intricate puzzles. Set your own pace as you control time and move freely in an open fantasy world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e59.jpg'),(1857,'Rusty Blower 3D','2019-11-12','Simulator','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ru9.jpg'),(1858,'Jennifer\'s Fragments','2024-10-28','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jennifer is trying to piece together her fragmented life amidst the games of her mind. Help Jennifer piece together her memories in dark, uncanny and mysterious places. Get ready for a journey of terrible secrets and traumas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ydh.jpg'),(1859,'Goonya Monster','2022-12-04','Fighting, Shooter, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Goonya Monster is a party game where you go on a rampage playing as characters designed by Terada Tera. Split into Busters and Monsters to face off against one another! An absolutely absurd battle awaits you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wx5.jpg'),(1860,'Dance Dance Revolution Extreme 2','2005-09-27','Music, Puzzle, Arcade','PlayStation 2','In addition to including features from the previous game, PS2 gamers will now have the opportunity to participate in exciting head-to-head DDR online competitions for the first time ever. The 100 top scorers will be recognized through an interactive ranking system, letting novice players test their dancing mettle against top-notch DDR experts. Players can also go online to access new challenge missions which will be refreshed periodically, allowing players a way to continually expand the DDR gaming experience. Whether players are looking to dance to the hottest tracks in town, choreograph, edit and create their own dance steps, or use the \'Work Out\' mode to burn off excess pounds, DDR Extreme 2 will offer players of all ages an interactive and fun way to get up and groove. The game\'s support for the EyeToy Camera continues to add depth and dimension to the gameplay. While using the camera, players can access fast-paced mini games and use both their hands and feet while dancing and watching themselves on TV. Keeping players on the dance mat is more than 100 minutes of energetic dance music, including exclusively-licensed dance hits as well as smash-hit songs, such as \"Genie In A Bottle\" and \"Oops!...I Did It Again.\" Also adding to the impressive line-up of songs is new music by the famous video game musician Yuzo Koshiro, whose credits include composing music for hit games such as Streets of Rage series, Revenge of Shinobi and Shenmue.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20sr.jpg'),(1861,'Eternal Cycle',NULL,'Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Eternal Cycle\" is an AVG game with adventure and puzzle theme. The protagonist explores caves by various props. Throughout the exploration process, the protagonist escapes from different monsters to seek survival. As the exploration continue, the protagonist himself undergones some subtle changes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hak.jpg'),(1862,'Savior','2021-08-12','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Savior is an RPG Maker style horror adventure game. To avoid sudden death, always pay attention and be suspicious of things around you. Collect and use a variety of tools to get to the ground. Please lead the protagonist safely so that the protagonist can achieve his or her purpose safely.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47b5.jpg'),(1863,'Evolution Skateboarding','2002-11-17','Sport','Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Evolution Skateboarding is a 2002 skateboarding video game released by Konami for the PlayStation 2 and GameCube. It consists of several popular skateboarders, such as Rick McCrank, Arto Saari, Kerry Getz, and Danny Way. There is also a create-a-skater feature and an unlockable character for every skater the player completes the game as. There are also sets of level specific songs such as the metal-remix of the Metal Gear Solid theme and a Castlevania theme after unlocking the Vampire Hunter. Levels are unlocked by beating a certain amount of objectives in a current level, such as collecting items like boots and other objects, performing tricks in certain areas of a level, and the occasional grinding a certain amount of meters. The Evolution Skateboarding engine was used in the bonus skateboarding mode included in the PlayStation 2 version of Metal Gear Solid 2: Substance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tyh.jpg'),(1864,'Pole Vault','2025-02-07','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are a stretchy little newt who loves to pole vault.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cly.jpg'),(1865,'Morningdew Farms: A Gay Farming Game','2019-09-17','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sweet southern boy Cody always dreamed of living off the land. Now he\'s taken over his granddaddy\'s farm and can begin a wonderful new life in the village of Morningdew--a notorious Gayborhood!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p56.jpg'),(1866,'Cornucopias','2023-08-01','Shooter, Racing, Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cornucopias is a multiplayer open-world game set in an alternate universe where humanity thrives above an earth in ruin. This new world in the sky is anchored by a new technology powered by the element Genesium, which ironically is what caused a planet-wide calamity. Join forces to explore, survive, combat quantum enemies, develop your territory, and compete for vital resources. In this vast new world, the choices are yours, and the path to success is yours to carve. You are no longer bound to earth - welcome to your future in the sky.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sqc.jpg'),(1867,'The Night Wanderer',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','\"The Night Wanderer\" is a hybrid of RPG and soulslike genres, characterized by unique solutions and an innovative approach to tried-and-true mechanics. The game utilizes level design known from Metroidvania games and a combat system native to soulsborne productions, which emphasizes dynamic yet tactical gameplay.\n\nThe game is based on the award-winning fantasy novel \"Lord of the Ice Garden\" by Jarosław Grzędowicz.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vd0.jpg'),(1868,'Discworld II: Mortality Bytes!','1996-11-30','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Discworld II: Mortality Bytes! is the second point-and-click adventure game based on Terry Pratchett\'s series of fantasy novels set on the mythical Discworld. The game was developed and produced in 1996 by Perfect Entertainment for the PC, and ported in 1997 for the PlayStation and Sega Saturn. It was published by Psygnosis for the PC and PlayStation, and by Sega for the Saturn (only in Europe).\n\nIn Discworld II the player controls Rincewind the \"wizzard\" (voiced by Eric Idle, as in the previous game) who has been burdened with the task of coercing Death out of his impromptu retirement and back into his regular duties. The plot borrows from a number of Discworld books, most notably Reaper Man, Moving Pictures and Lords and Ladies.\n\nIt all begins in a quiet Ankh-Morpork street, where Rincewind and The Librarian inexplicably fail to die from a nearby cart-bomb explosion. The odd event is not shared by them alone however: occurrences of the newly dead re-awakening and disturbing the populace are being reported all over the city, prompting the Archchancellor of Unseen University to halt his usual activities of feasting and merrymaking, and to take charge of the situation. Much to Rincewind\'s despair, the entirety of this process involves appointing him to the task of finding Death and convincing him to resume his work.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pxe.jpg'),(1869,'Zero Tours','2001-07-27','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Advance','This is a Game Boy Advance RPG from Media Rings Corporation, released on July 27th 2001. It is also known as Mugen Kinogyou Zero Tours.\nThe game features characters known as Kigurumians (キグルミアン) who like to dress up as different animals. You can battle monsters (known as Nuigurumin) in dungeons and register them. Using a link cable, you may exchange items and Nuigurumin data.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7exd.jpg'),(1870,'Watch Your Nightmares','2018-07-31','Point-and-click, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Watch Your Nightmares is a point-and-click survival horror video fangame creat of Sweetsylveon. The game is based on FNaF 4 with a concept of camera system, and is released on July 31st, 2018.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77n5.jpg'),(1871,'Yellow Lemon',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1872,'Naruto Shippuden: Gekitou Ninja Taisen! EX 3','2008-11-27','Fighting','Wii','Naruto Shippuden: Gekitou Ninja Taisen! EX 3 is the seventh instalment of the Gekitō Ninja Taisen series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ui2.jpg'),(1873,'Hacker Evolution - 2019 HD remaster','2019-09-23','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This remaster brings back the original Hacker Evolution game with updated HD graphics. Hacker Evolution is a hacking simulation game, featuring unparalleled graphics and features. You play the role of a former intelligence agent, specializing in computer security.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dxe.jpg'),(1874,'The Run: Got Next','2025-12-31','Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','The Run: Got Next is a fast-paced, full court, 3v3 basketball game that celebrates all of street hoops culture worldwide. Play solo online or squad up to stack wins and become the G.O.A.T. Who’s Next?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kj3.jpg'),(1875,'Shadow Squadron','1995-04-26','Shooter, Simulator','Sega 32X','Shadow Squadron is a 3D space combat shooter. The player controls a space fighter in a series of battles against huge enemy ships. There are 2 different types of ships to fly, and 6 different missions. In most missions, the player has to destroy several locations on a large ship in order to blow up the whole thing.\n\nThere are two ways to play the game. First, one can directly control the ship and maneuver it around the 3D polygon environments. Second, the player can let the 32X do the flying, and simply control a gun turret.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ijb.jpg'),(1876,'Alternate Watch','2022-05-11','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Mandela Catalogue themed spot the difference horror game. Report Alternate Anomaly encounters until 6 AM in order to survive the night.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6anw.jpg'),(1877,'Walk','2021-03-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A small Japanese horror game where a terrifying monster is stalking a little school girl.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co393m.jpg'),(1878,'My New Classmate is a Dragon?!','2023-08-09','Visual Novel','Android','From average guy to wizard-in-training—your life gets flipped upside down after you save the life of a stranger on your way home, and now you’re the master of a dragon girl who has sworn eternal loyalty to you! Things don’t slow down there though, as you soon find out you’re actually a wizard, and you’ve been invited to Deagon Academy to hone your budding magic skills.\n\nYou may be new to the world of magic, but with three beautiful classmates cheering you on, how could you fail? The true question is, which one of these girls gets a ‘pass’ from you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x7k.jpg'),(1879,'Report One','2021-08-21','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Report One (Upgrade Edition) is a single player modification from the Report series, for Half-Life, which has an independent universe, saturated with alternative or completely different events, though with some main references to Half-Life 1.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92gj.jpg'),(1880,'Sea of Thieves: X Edition','2025-03-20','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Dive into Sea of Thieves with this special edition of the smash-hit pirate adventure, which includes the base version of the game along with a comprehensive collection of ship sets inspired by Xbox and beloved Xbox titles, plus a varied assortment of cosmetics, currency and access to digital bonus media.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kts.jpg'),(1881,'Cursed Enigma: The Midnight Apartment','2024-02-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Franco moves into an Italian townhouse, where an unsettling presence lead him to uncover dark truths about his new home. Dive into the mysterious events lurking behind the peaceful exterior of the building in the second episode of CURSED ENIGMA: The Midnight Apartment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90ka.jpg'),(1882,'Giresun','2024-04-14','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a 3rd person shooter game that you can play 1v1, 2v2, 4v4, 5v5 mods against bots.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7z89.jpg'),(1883,'The Denpa Men: They Came By Wave','2012-09-26','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo 3DS','A dungeon crawler with nods to Pikmin, Dragon Quest and Pokemon. Use the 3DS camera to capture Denpa Men to build your party.\n\nMysterious little creatures float around near the waves. They\'re called \"Denpa\" Men. You can\'t see them normally, but you can find them and catch them with your Nintendo 3DS. This is a role-playing game in which you collect Denpa Men to form a party, and use this party to explore dungeons. Each radio wave territory has its own completely unique Denpa Men, and no two of them are ever the same! Their faces, bodies, and personalities are all different, and some of them even have special skills and strong points.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wgw.jpg'),(1884,'Earth: 9000','2020-07-17','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Defend the Earth in this hyper intense, visually overwhelming, bullet hell, action shooter.\n\nEarth: 9000 a new indie Bullet Hell, Twin Stick, Rogue-Lite mashup. You take the role of the Earth defending itself against a never ending onslaught of alien invaders. You\'ll unlock dozens of weapons and even more upgrades as you gain research from defeating enemies. You\'ll certainly be defeated, but that isn\'t the end, our patented Reali-time-nsion technology sends your research, weapons and upgrades to a new Earth ready to defend itself once again, but this time with the advantages of everything you\'ve unlocked before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2avo.jpg'),(1885,'Madden NFL 20','2019-08-02','Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Feel like an NFL Superstar in Madden NFL 20. Be the Face of an NFL franchise where the decisions you make matter in your journey to become an NFL Superstar in ‘FACE OF THE FRANCHISE: QB1’. Feel the emotion, personality, and power of NFL Superstars with ‘SUPERSTAR X-FACTOR’, an all-new abilities progression system that reveals special abilities for today’s most exciting NFL Superstars heightening the level strategy and excitement in every game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nh7.jpg'),(1886,'Assassin\'s Creed: Odyssey - Deluxe Edition','2018-10-05','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Assassin\'s Creed: Odyssey - Deluxe Edition includes:\n\nThe Kronos Pack (Including 5 epic pieces of armour, 1 epic weapon, 1 epic mount).\nThe Herald of Dusk Pack (Including 5 rare pieces of armour, 1 rare weapon).\nThe Capricornus Naval Pack (Including 1 ship design, 1 crew theme).\n1 Temporary XP Boost.\n1 Temporary Drachm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ohz.jpg'),(1887,'The Idolmaster: Cinderella Girls - Gravure for You! Vol.7','2015-12-23','Sin género','PlayStation 3','This volume continues the ability to take pictures of two idols at a time, and to add music from CDs into the BGM list. Additionally, it includes an alternate color for the Sea Bloom Curtain outfit in gray, and another outfit combo in the 346 School Swimsuit- coupled with cat ears, tail, and glasses.\nIdol Focus: Rin Shibuya\nCostumes: Sunny Day Furisode, Sea Bloom Curtain, Hula Aloha\nLocations: Shrine, Seaside, Twilight Beach','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rlw.jpg'),(1888,'Casino Tycoon',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Run your own casino. Count money, tamper with slots, hire staff and crooked dealers. Buy new machines, tables, security cameras, and hire bodyguards to protect your interests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bvm.jpg'),(1889,'1917: The Alien Invasion DX Remastered','2025-02-28','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 5','You are in the role of Dr. Brunhild Stahlmüller, an acomplished weapon scientist who upgrades a WW1 triplane with superior alien technology to attack the invaders. You will avenge mankind and take the battle into the darkness of space until you reach an ancient alien world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fn7.jpg'),(1890,'Exit the Gungeon','2020-03-16','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Exit the Gungeon is a bullet hell dungeon climber immediately following the adventures of the misfit ‘Gungeoneers’ and their journey for personal absolution in Enter the Gungeon. The Gungeon has become a paradox and is collapsing! Armed with an ever-changing weapon, an insatiable need to loot, and the trusty dodge roll, each of our heroes must ascend and escape via their own unique route of increasingly perilous elevators. Battle against the last and most bitter of the Gundead at a frantic pace, slowing down just long enough to chat with some familiar faces… and a few new ones. Shifting rooms, enemies, bosses, bizarre weapons and items all combine to ensure that no two attempts to Exit the Gungeon are the same.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xmt.jpg'),(1891,'United Heist','2023-02-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your group consists of the best two thieves money can buy. One day a client requested to take something unknown from the government. Now you can decide who stays back managing the intel and who is going into the facility to accomplish the task in this asynchronous coop puzzle game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65un.jpg'),(1892,'Bally Fears: The Introduction Game','2024-09-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are a child named Reyes Spherikaw. Your mother passed away a few days ago, but Reyes doesn\'t know this yet. Your father has brought you to his workplace because there was no one to look after you. The game begins when your father calls you to warn you about something...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uds.jpg'),(1893,'Fortitude Tower Defense','2025-04-02','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A classic Tower Defense game with minor offensive tactics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kr3.jpg'),(1894,'Mystery Combat Man 4: The End of Time',NULL,'Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The conclusion to the multi-award-winning Mystery Combat Man Franchise, MCM4 strives to be the best sequel to the worst mod ever made! The Mystery Combat Squad returns to an absurdist world of action and intrigue. Following the events of MCM3, a mysterious disruptor has broken into the time bank, setting off a catastrophic chain of events that threatens the timeline of the planet of the Earth. Who could have done this, and why? Whoever he his, he must be tracked down and brought to justice at any cost, and it\'s all down to the Mystery Combat Man to hunt him down across the space-time continuum. Will he succeed? It\'s all up to you, the player, in... Mystery Combat Man 4: The End of Time!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1895,'Leona\'s Tricky Adventures','2014-11-11','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Accompany Leona in a clever puzzle adventure to save the inhabitants of a strange but lovely world. Featuring fresh puzzle mechanics, wonderful retro graphics, lots of exploration and an excellent soundtrack by legendary game composer Chris Huelsbeck.\n\nLeona’s Tricky Adventures is inspired by a clever puzzle game mechanic which was briefly explored in the very early 90s but sadly faded from prominence shortly after. The basic task is to match two increasingly complex patterns using increasingly complex mechanics. While it can’t be directly compared to any contemporary game the mental skills required by the puzzles put them somewhere in between \"Picross\" and \"Bejeweled\" – and in our humble opinion they can easily stand up against those games.\n\nAll puzzles are embedded in a big and complex overworld full of exploration and humorous citizens constructed entirely using beautifully hand-drawn pixel graphics. Exploration and puzzle-solving is intertwined in clever and varied ways which draw you deeper into the game world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86dv.jpg'),(1896,'Learn Japanese RPG: Hiragana Forbidden Speech','2023-12-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dialogue changes from English to Japanese as you learn and progress in this comedic RPG backed by professional Japanese voice acting. This is a full introductory Japanese course and adventure all in one. Master hiragana, basic grammar, and over 240 common words used in anime!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5is2.jpg'),(1897,'Red Faction: Guerrilla - Demons of the Badlands','2011-07-05','Sin género','Xbox 360','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zaa.jpg'),(1898,'Academy Love Saga: Tennis Angels',NULL,'Simulator, Sport, Indie','Sin plataforma','Become a coach for the tennis club in a prestigious sports academy with all members being hot chicks, but they all hate you. What to do now? Conquer them all, of course!!! Prepare yourself for heated tennis matches with dynamic gameplay and powerful abilities. Prove your skills and win their hearts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8n1o.jpg'),(1899,'Jikkyou Pawafuru Puroyakyu 2010','2010-07-15','Sport','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','Released in Japan in 2010.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co723x.jpg'),(1900,'Minecraft: Story Mode Season Two - Episode 2: Giant Consequences','2017-08-15','Point-and-click, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Now that Jesse and the gang have vanquished the Wither Storm, saved the world, and become totally super famous heroes, life has gotten a bit more...complicated. With more responsibilities and less time for adventure, old friendships have started to fade -- at least until Jesse\'s hand gets stuck in a creepy gauntlet that belongs to an ancient underwater temple. Together with old pals and new comrades alike, Jesse embarks on a brand new journey filled with tough choices, good times, and at least one temperamental llama.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vip.jpg'),(1901,'ArcheAge 2',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ArcheAge 2 is an MMORPG being developed by Korean developer Jake Song (former developer of Lineage) and his development company, XL Games, a subsidiary of Kakao Games','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7t8m.jpg'),(1902,'Bullet Roulette VR','2020-09-10','Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Four suspisios persons with mysterious past are sitting around the table in the gloomy dark bar playing Russian Roulette. Beware of other players, because they don\'t look like someone who plan to play fair. Be tricky and become the last survivor!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mmw.jpg'),(1903,'Roxy Raccoon\'s Pinball Panic','2022-03-16','Platform, Pinball, Adventure, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Roxy Raccoon\'s Pinball Panic is a reimagining of the 3D Platformer but told through a unique, pinball format. End the witch’s wicked schemes and conquer her many challenges. Prove once and for all, that you are the true pinball champion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5o3t.jpg'),(1904,'Carnal Instinct','2021-03-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Carnal Instinct is an Adult RPG with an emphasis on AAA quality visuals and compelling erotic interaction. You enter the world of Sabu a slave, but will forge your own destiny and shape the world itself in this realm of ancient gods, mythical creatures, and boundless lust.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wln.jpg'),(1905,'Confabulation','2023-01-13','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your memory is fading. Things around your home keep changing; they are not what they appear to be. Find what is wrong, take pictures to restore your memory. Try to remember. Learn what you have forgotten, learn what has happened. It is not what it seems to be.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65dz.jpg'),(1906,'Anime Girls Military Strike','2024-10-20','Shooter','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Step into the high-octane world of \"Anime Girls Military Strike,\" where cute meets combat in this adrenaline-pumping first-person shooter. Gear up as one of several highly-trained anime girl operatives, each with their own unique abilities and kawaii charm. From twin-tailed snipers to genki girl grenadiers, assemble your dream team and take on missions across vibrant, anime-inspired battlefields.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u8v.jpg'),(1907,'Battle Bruise','2017-04-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Stay atop a mountain of corpses! Fight numerous swarms of enemies, while dealing with the changing terrain.This game isn\'t messy. It\'s MESS ITSELF!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26x4.jpg'),(1908,'Oubey VR: Cosmic Voyage','2020-08-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inside the art - Cosmic Voyage This VR takes you on a cosmic journey through the universe of OUBEYs paintings. Starting on Earth you are led into the far distant depths of space and back...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co473k.jpg'),(1909,'Half Dead','2020-06-11','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Half dead is a multiplayer sci-fi game about a violent TV show. The players\' goal is to survive in a network of rooms full of traps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gfbwbl3emdnso8sly9un.jpg'),(1910,'Jurard Run','2025-02-06','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short side-scroller shooter game featuring Jurard T Rexford of holostars! Fight against corruption beasts and 4 other holostars members in this simple boss-rush game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxj.jpg'),(1911,'My Life as a Cult Leader','2023-03-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After you lose your job and apartment, you\'re left with nothing. Forced to spend the night on a cold park bench, you curse your fate, only for a beautiful woman calling herself Shima Itsuki to appear and ask you to be a cult leader...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rkc.jpg'),(1912,'Final Fantasy XI Online','2003-10-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Final Fantasy XI Online is the franchise\'s first MMORPG as well as the eleventh installment in the main series. FFXI was the world\'s first cross-console MMORPG, available for Windows, PlayStation 2, Xbox 360 and Steam.\n\nSince its release in 2002, it has become the most financially successful title in the Final Fantasy series. Due to the nature of online RPGs, FFXI differs in that the player is not the only hero. Instead, each player creates a customizable character and adventures through the world of Vana\'diel with other players; leveling up, exploring, completing missions, quests, and much more.\n\nLeveling up requires a group of people working together in what is called a Party, with each participant contributing their own skills to help take down a foe and gain Experience points. Battles occur in real-time, taking the ATB system to a new level, which was emulated again to a certain extent in Final Fantasy XII.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co205x.jpg'),(1913,'Eggconsole Super Zenon Gamma 5 PC-8801mkIISR','2025-03-13','Shooter','Nintendo Switch','Join the Earth military G Squadron, \"Gamma-5,\" as a member and destroy the antimatter bomb detonation device located on the Devil\'s Star to save Earth!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9inb.jpg'),(1914,'Super Mario 64: Dark Edition','2022-08-31','Platform','Nintendo 64','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1915,'Era.S Decode','2024-03-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Era.S Decode is a Third Person Arena multiplayer game, designed by a eSports pro to bring a fun, fast-paced high fragging experience with fair, balanced mechanics to ensure that the better player & team always win every match. Featuring a Quick Switch multi-gun system, the skill gap is vast for you to grow your pro comp capabilities & display your greater prowess over all who may challenge you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co875j.jpg'),(1916,'Combat Chess','1997-12-30','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play with living, battling characters! Combat Chess takes the basic chess game and adds an imaginative element for players bored with the simple \"black vs. white\" chess board. Beautifully done in rendered 3D graphics, Combat Chess adds stunning animation sequences during gameplay. Combat Chess is written to Grand Master standards and supports play against human opponents.\n\nCombat Chess includes 3D rendered pieces from a medieval setting with fantasy elements. Pawns become dragons, Knights become real knights, the Black Knight’s turning your pawns to green jelly, and the Queen’s threatening to deliver a majestic head-butt to your king. With over 600 animation sequences, each piece includes \"fidget\" sequences for those moments you need to think. The animations include movement, combat, fidgets, and \"check\" moves. For the traditional minded, Combat Chess includes a traditional set, also 3D rendered. Two boards come with the game, each assigned to the genre of pieces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nh2.jpg'),(1917,'Playing History 2 - Slave Trade','2013-09-13','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Travel back in time and witness the horrors of slave trade firsthand. You will be working as young slave steward on a ship crossing the Atlantic. You are to serve the captain and be his eyes and ears. What do you do, when you realize that your own sister has been captured by the slave traders?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jwj.jpg'),(1918,'Overly Qualified Ms. Mary','2020-02-28','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Overly Qualified Ms. Mary follows the story of Tomoya, an average student just trying to get by at school. His life turns upside-down when he meets Mary Morgan, a transfer student known for her uncommon beauty, being the subject of many students\' jealousy and lust. In a surprising twist, Ms. Mary finds Tomoya unexpectedly attractive. Despite her being a bit of a tsundere at times, the two end up in a relationship together. Will the ordinary Tomoya be enough to satisfy the needs of such rare beauty?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yxm.jpg'),(1919,'Disney Infinity: Toy Box','2013-11-14','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','The \"Toy Box\" mode from Disney Infinity 1.0 as a standalone game on Windows and iOS.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1920,'Hard Core',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1921,'ForeVR Pool','2022-11-17','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Arcade','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR','ForeVR Pool brings the coolest pool halls from around the globe straight to your living room! Challenge friends, family, and in-game pros to a game of 8-ball pool – no table required.\n\nBattle 12 bots to level up and take on Legendary challengers. Join a Quick Match or jump into a private multiplayer party! Friend in town? Share your headset with Pass & Play. Up the ante and stake in-game coins in matches against other players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c9x.jpg'),(1922,'Content Caution: The Horror Filmmaker',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9irl.jpg'),(1923,'Super Fruit Ninja','2024-02-02','Arcade','visionOS','Fruit Ninja is back and this time the power is in your hands! Slice your way through 4 modes of fruit annihilating fun. Charge up juice canisters and unleash your Juice Jitsu power onto unsuspecting fruits! Play fetch with Truffles and make sure you give him a pat! Most importantly, make Sensei proud!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s1p.jpg'),(1924,'Set Off Fireworks Together','2023-11-08','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Set off fireworks together, here you can experience a different feeling, you can create as much as you like in the game, combine fireworks, and pursue the taste of childhood!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74pa.jpg'),(1925,'AgriLife','2022-04-14','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Between turn-based management and farming game, AgriLife puts you in the shoes of a farmer. Plant your crops in a living soil, move on to the next week and watch their evolution! Master this little world, try several strategies… or just enjoy the sunshine and birdsongs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qhd.jpg'),(1926,'Bonobros',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Sin plataforma','Bonobros is a simultaneous turn based strategy game when you play with your favorite streamers as pawns.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l0o.jpg'),(1927,'Tile Kingdom',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Tile Kingdom\" is a strategic city-building game where you place your terrain into empty grids and expand your territory. You will earn reputation and become a real king.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9irz.jpg'),(1928,'Sex Apocalypse 3D','2022-10-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Sex Apocalypse 3D You need to survive in a post-apocalyptic megapolis with lots of zombies in it. After successful battle with zombies you will get amazing arts and videos with hot female protagonist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ic1.jpg'),(1929,'Starfall Serenity',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Starfall Serenity is a relaxing game about a cat that loves watching the stars! Find the best spot, sit back, enjoy the night sky and unwind while collecting as many falling stars as you can!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8642.jpg'),(1930,'The Lord of the Rings Online: Shadows of Angmar','2007-05-24','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Much of the gameplay is typical of the MMO format: The player controls a character avatar which can be moved around the game world and interacts with other players, non-player (computer-controlled) characters (or \"NPCs\") and other entities in the virtual world. Camera angles can be switched between first-person and third-person options. Characters are improved by gaining levels. A character\'s level increases after it earns a set amount of experience points through the player versus environment (or \"PvE\") combat and storyline adventures. Characters\' abilities are improved by increasing in level, but character skills must be purchased from specified NPCs after gaining a new level.\nThe main storyline (also known as the \"Epic Quest Line\") is presented as a series of \"Books\", which consist of series of quests called \"Chapters\". There were initially eight Books when the game was released, with new books added with each free content update.\nTolkien\'s Middle-earth as represented in The Lord of the Rings Online implements magic in a different manner than other MMORPGs such as World of Warcraft. There are only five \"wizards\" in the fictional world, none of which are player-controlled. Instead, there are active skills which require \"power\" (the equivalent of magic points). Some skills behave like magic (like healing or throwing a burning ember at an enemy), but are based on \"lore\". In addition, objects and artifacts are used to create effects similar to magic.\nOther features include a fast travel system and a detailed quest log with tracker and history.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x0x.jpg'),(1931,'Tamaghost Jump!I Can\'t Believe It\'s Not Exorcism!','2022-01-17','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','After months of insomnia, you\'ve tried everything: every pill, herbal supplement, special diet, every snake oil on the market. Nothing has worked. At this point, you\'re pretty sure you\'re just possessed, but you need your sleep either way. And, finally, the exorcism candles you ordered from a sketchy website ages ago arrive at your doorstep! Now, it\'s time to have a chat with the ghosts haunting you and convince them to leave you alone. Can you succeed? Which ending will you get?\n\nA short horror/comedy game, now with 4 encounters and 7 different endings!\n\nOriginally made in just under 3 hours for Trijam #152, with the theme \"Leave me alone!\". Takes about 5 minutes for a full playthrough. Built in Ren\'Py.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gb8.jpg'),(1932,'Maui Mallard in Cold Shadow','1997-04-01','Platform, Arcade','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, PC (Microsoft Windows), Super Famicom','When he morphs into a ninja, you better duck! Play as Maui. Play as the Ninja. Play as Maui. Play as the Ninja. Try not to get dizzy. Find the missing Shabuhm Shabuhm idol before your island paradise goes kaboom kaboom! 40 hours of intense gameplay. So pack plenty of attitude. And your bug gun. Come beak to beak with MudDrakes, Rotting Pirates, Duck Zombies, Amazon Warriors. And a bunch of fowl-tempered hangers-on. Laugh in the face of danger from the top of a volcano, the bottom of the sea, the Realm of the Dead, and Ninja Training Grounds. Then get the heck out! Live every level like it\'s your last - \'cuz it may be!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2je4.jpg'),(1933,'Bandit Knight',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the boots of a master thief in Bandit Knight! Outsmart enemies, steal legendary treasures, and navigate a vibrant 2.5D pixel world. Customize your tools, unlock upgrades, and rise to become the ultimate King of Thieves!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d11.jpg'),(1934,'Sparkle 2 Evo','2011-11-29','Simulator, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, Windows Phone, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Control the evolution with the touch of your finger. Climb your way through the evolutional ladder. Start as a little organism and transform into a magnificent aquatic being. Explore the abyss in search of nutritional elements. Attack other species whenever you run out of other food sources. Enjoy beautiful surreal visuals and relax with minimalistic ambient soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26yt.jpg'),(1935,'2urvive + 3xtinction','2025-03-14','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Two perfect games for all lovers of brutal top down shooters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kt9.jpg'),(1936,'Witch Explorer','2021-12-20','Shooter, Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Witch Explorer is a game which features a mix of both shoot \'em up and tower defense gameplay.\nYou play as the witch Tia, who is on a teasure-hunt in order to remove her debt and improve her magic shop.\nThe goal of the game is to defeat waves of monsters by both strategically placing units on the map, and by flying around on the map while shooting and dodging projectiles and enemies yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4axn.jpg'),(1937,'Hellgate: Redemption',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','An action role-playing game set in the Hellgate: London universe. Details (gameplay, platforms, release date) to be announced.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zm0.jpg'),(1938,'Saint & Sinner','2006-12-31','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ho5.jpg'),(1939,'Hyrule Warriors','2014-09-26','Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Wii U','A Legendary Pairing: Cut down entire legions of enemies as Link, Zelda, Midna and other characters from The Legend of Zelda franchise using over-the-top powerful Dynasty Warriors-style moves. This tour de force through the beloved locales of Hyrule will have players battling some of the fiercest enemies in The Legend of Zelda history. Two players can play local co-op, with one player joining with the Wii U GamePad controller and another with the Wii U Pro Controller or Wii Remote and Nunchuk controllers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p0r.jpg'),(1940,'Dragon Master','2022-03-08','Strategy','Android, iOS','DragonMaster is the first blockchain-based Metaverse game that blends RTS, MOBA, Collection, and Play to Earn gameplay. DragonMaster now allows anyone to join the game for free! Just with 1 phone, you can enjoy the game easily!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uul.jpg'),(1941,'Burnin\' Rubber 4','2018-05-17','Racing, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore the Burnin\' Rubber universe in 5 free-roaming worlds!\nCollect tickets to fight in the toughest challenges yet! Battle in Special Missions to unlock new worlds and content.\n\nAre you ready for the biggest Burnin\' Rubber in the world?\n\nBurnin\' Rubber 4 is the fourth game in the Burnin\' Rubber series which first released on August 10, 2010.\n\nThe player is supposed to complete many different challenges and stages throughout the game.\n\nThe player is given two cars to start with, the Bullet 350 and the Phaser GTI. The player can also start off with the Abraham N1 when completing Burnin\' Rubber 3.\n\nThe player is tasked with the goal of collecting all tickets in the four free roam maps, which are The City, Big Rock, Snow Peak, and The Jungle. The City is available at the beginning, meanwhile the other free roam maps excluding The Docks have to be unlocked. There are a total of 36 tickets in the game which nine are located in each of the four maps mentioned. The Docks is excluded from this.\n\nOn March 2017, Burnin\' Rubber 4 was removed from the game portal Shockwave.com due to the deprecation of NPAPI plugins on modern browsers. On May 17, 2018, Xform released the standalone version of Burnin\' Rubber 4.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25sl.jpg'),(1942,'PokéScape','2024-12-24','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Advance','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1943,'Colony Survival','2017-06-16','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Colony Survival is a voxel RTS developed by a two-man team. Build your own colony in a voxel world. Command guards, farmers, miners and other colonists. Defend your colony against the monsters that attack every night.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26xd.jpg'),(1944,'PSXFunkin\' with Parappa','2021-10-20','Music','PlayStation','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s0f.jpg'),(1945,'Lord of the Jungle','2000-12-31','Puzzle','PlayStation','Lord was a tiny baby when he was taken into the care of the apes.\n\nNow, after 18 years in the jungle, Lord finally comes face-to-face with other people...\n\nAs well as a great half-hour cartoon video, Lord of the Jungle features an easy-to-use virtual colouring book and a challenging puzzle game, letting you join Lord in his adventures.\n\nOTHER TITLES AVAILABLE:\nAnastasia\nGoldie\nLion and the King\nMoses Prince of Egypt\nNice Cats\nThe Dalmatians\nThe Sword of Camelot','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i1g.jpg'),(1946,'Bring Me...','2024-09-20','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bring me... is a first-person anomaly-horror game.\nPlay as a young woman who has been caring for her sick father and has been trapped in an anomalous cycle.\nObserve your surroundings for anomalies to find your way out of this nightmare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u8f.jpg'),(1947,'Ghost Hunters',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','\"Ghost Hunters\" is a Co-Op horror game that can be played with 1-4 players. You need to detect and catch the ghosts that have just taken over the city. You must detect paranormal activities, collect as much evidence as possible and hunt the ghosts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7a84.jpg'),(1948,'Super Mario World','2001-12-14','Platform','Game Boy Advance','The remake of Super Mario World included in Super Mario Advance 2 for the Game Boy Advance. In this refreshed version for the portable system, you can choose to play as either Mario or Luigi in single player.\n\nIf you\'ve played the original, you\'ll find that Mario controls much the same as the Super Nintendo counterpart, but his brother Luigi can jump a bit higher and float a short while, and Luigi\'s fireballs will bounce higher as well.\n\nSaving in this game is available at any point during game, either on the overworld or inside of a level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co779k.jpg'),(1949,'GreedFall II: The Dying World',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','The story starts three years before the events of the first game and the adventures of De Sardet.\n\nThis time you play as a native of Teer Fradee, uprooted by force from your island and taken to the continent of Gacane, where the colonists are from. In this old world ravaged by war and scarred by the Malichor plague and the political scheming of the different factions, you need to regain your freedom and control of your own destiny. Using diplomacy, cunning or combat, as well as help from allies you make, it\'s up to you to end one man\'s ambitions of conquest, which could spell the end for the continent and your island.\n\nExperience the unique world of GreedFall again by exploring the old continent! Travel across new landscapes, from Olima – the city of stars of the Bridge Alliance – to the shores of Uxantis, and uncover the secrets of these ancient lands. Meet all the factions that share control over these nations and navigate the treacherous waters of their schemes and conspiracies.\n\nCreate your own character and find allies to join your team. Help them with their quests, uncover their secrets and make them your friends, rivals or even lovers. As well as equipping them the way you want, you can also take control of them in combat.\n\nImmerse yourself in an ever deeper RPG experience where every choice has an impact on your adventure and where diplomacy, manipulation, infiltration and combat are all viable paths for you to achieve your aims.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i5u.jpg'),(1950,'Super Monk War Z','2020-09-24','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Super Monk War Z\" is a 2D horizontal shooting game that consists of 4 stages. Take advantage of three types of formation and a large amount of Do it or be done Barrage shooting !! Shoot the approaching enemy! Hit! Kill!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42oa.jpg'),(1951,'Shrek Smash n\' Crash Racing','2006-11-15','Racing','Game Boy Advance','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6h0b.jpg'),(1952,'Heisei Shin Onigashima: Zenpen','2014-09-24','Adventure','Wii, Wii U, Super Famicom','Heisei Shin Onigashima: Zenpen is an Adventure game, developed by Pax Softonica and published by Nintendo, which was released in Japan in 1997.\n\nIt is a port of BS Shin Onigashima, a four-part broadcast game released for the Satellaview (a Super Famicom peripheral). This game (Zenpen) is composed of the first two episodes of BS Shin Oni Gashima.\n\nHeisei Shin Onigashima was first released as a Nintendo Power downloadable game, then later released in two parts as cartridges (Zenpen, Kouhen), much like the original Famicom Disk System version was also divided in two parts.\n\nThe game was later released for the Wii Virtual Console, in two parts, and for the Wii U Virtual Console (a single release, Zengohen)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2utx.jpg'),(1953,'Beach Bowling Dream VR','2017-01-13','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A lucid dream about getting ship-wrecked on a deserted island and finding that the materials from your ship have been turned into a beach bowling alley by a friendly ghost of a pirate! A fun room-scale experience/mini-game for the HTC Vive.  Can you unlock the pirate\'s treasure chest?  The lock on it looks fairly brittle...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29wu.jpg'),(1954,'The Chessmaster','1991-12-31','Strategy, Card & Board Game','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Game Gear, Game Boy, Nintendo Entertainment System','The Chessmaster is a game where the player has the chance to play against the CPU controlled Chessmaster at a standard game of chess.\n\nTo play the game the player must pick up the chess pieces with there hand cursor and place it in the desired location, within the rules a standard chess game. There are 16 different difficulty levels that includes 2 beginner levels, 13 standard levels (ranging from an average of 5 seconds to 4.5 minutes per shot depending on level), and a infinite level that will keep thinking of a shot until a perfect shot can be made or it is forced to move. There is also a teaching mode that shows the player all the possible moves with the selected piece. Two players can play each other with two controllers and there is also an option of letting the Chessmaster play itself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yim.jpg'),(1955,'Dragon Ball Z: Supersonic Warriors 2','2005-12-01','Fighting','Nintendo DS','Supersonic Warriors 2 is the DS sequel to the GBA fighting game Dragon Ball Z: Supersonic Warriors, based on Akira Toriyama\'s Dragon Ball series.\n\nThe game features one-on-one battles between over 30 characters with their own movement and combos. There is a main path in the story mode that coincides with Toriyama\'s story for every character and some other paths played out as \"what if?\" scenarios, adding replayability to the game. Next to the story mode, there is the Z battle, the VS battle, Maximum, Free battle and Practice mode. The game has three difficulty levels. In team battles the player can tap the touchscreen to select another fighter. Touch can also be used to perform a powerful combined attack when it is available.\n\nThe sequel moves away from the level system of the first game, where reaching a new character level led to upgraded statistics, or new sprites and attacks. This is replaced by individual characters that become available when a sufficient amount of Dragon Points is available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w9t.jpg'),(1956,'BodyCam GangZone','2025-03-07','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iro.jpg'),(1957,'North Modding Company: Bergsbruk','2021-02-26','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bergsbruk lets you mine gold, crush gravel, build roads, tunnes or just play around with heavy equipment but they will breakdown and need repairs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tle.jpg'),(1958,'Lunar: Silver Star Harmony','2010-04-02','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation Portable','While seemingly placid on the surface, the world of Lunar is slowly descending into chaos, as the Goddess Althena, the creator and guardian of the world, has disappeared and the valiant efforts of the legendary Dragonmaster Dyne and his faithful companions fade into obscurity. With Althena gone and no one able or willing to become the next Dragonmaster, a shadowy figure, known only as the Magic Emperor, has started plotting to usurp Althena\'s place and become a god. In a remote village far removed from the decay that is slowly spreading throughout the world lives a young man named Alex, who dreams of one day becoming the next Dragonmaster like his hero Dyne. One day, Alex\'s friend Ramus convinces him to head towards a cave near town, where it is rumored the legendary White Dragon resides. With Alex\'s adopted sister Luna and his mysterious pet Nall in tow, Alex heads off on what seems to be a meaningless adventure, not knowing that it would be the first step in an epic journey with the fate of the entire world at stake.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pnn.jpg'),(1959,'Hitman 3: The Drop Pack','2024-09-12','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Unlock a series of cosmetics inspired by The Drop Elusive Target mission and gain permanent access to The Base - A two-level Arcade contract featuring The Drop Elusive Target.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ktj.jpg'),(1960,'BomberGuys','2022-10-03','Sport, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BomberGuys is a top-down multiplayer game with simple controls. In fact, apart from movement, the player only has one ability: placing bombs. Each bomb explodes in four directions, the explosion can destroy enemies or destroy brick blocks. In the blocks you can find bonuses that increase the range of the explosion, you can place additional bombs or increase the speed of your character. The goal of each player is to destroy all enemies and remain alone on the field.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4heb.jpg'),(1961,'Little Busters!','2007-07-27','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Little Busters! is a Japanese visual novel developed by Key. The story follows the life of Riki Naoe, a high school student who has been a member of a group of friends named the Little Busters since childhood. Riki brings multiple girls at his school into the Little Busters to have enough people to play a baseball game. The game is rated for all ages in Japan, but a version containing adult content named Little Busters! Ecstasy exists as well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z1t.jpg'),(1962,'Word Invasion',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1963,'Saya no Uta','2003-12-26','Visual Novel','Blu-ray Player, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A horror visual novel about Fuminori Sakisaka, a medicine student who suffers an accident that leaves his perception of the world distorted: everything and everyone is perceived as a twisted mass of intestines, flesh and blood.\n\nEverything, except Saya.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25zj.jpg'),(1964,'Re:Mobilize Jam 2: Re:Visions','2025-02-15','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A set of 6 maps, plus a start map, created for a map jam event held from January 1, 2025 to February 8, 2025, using the Re:Mobilize mod. The objective of this jam was to re:imagine multiplayer maps from different games as single player experiences, all while making use of the three Re:Mobilize mechanics (trampolines, wiremeshes, and lighthooks/lightpanels).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f4u.jpg'),(1965,'The Broken Moon','2023-08-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Broken Moon Execution is a text-based fast-passing supernatural puzzle game. Game play is diverse, players need to explore through the map, collect various clues to solve the mystery, and gradually understand the truth of the collapse of \"Samle\" ......','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zgz.jpg'),(1966,'Crashland','2021-02-25','Shooter, Arcade','Oculus VR, Meta Quest 2, Oculus Quest','CRASHLAND is a VR action horror game set on a hostile alien planet. You play as an intergalactic gladiator who is crashlanding and trying to survive until rescue. Combat in CRASHLAND is fast, vicious, and brutal. You will fight giant hellworms in the desert, terror birds in the forest, scorpions in the mist and spiders in the dark. There is nowhere to hide.\n\nYou will need to master your pistol, boomstick, scanner and teleporter to survive. New firing modes and powerups will drop during missions. By gaining XP you can level up, unlock perks, and radically alter how the game plays.\n\nFeatures:\n- Fast visceral combat against over 50 vicious and deadly creatures.\n- 24 unique missions across desert, forest, and mountain biomes.\n- Advanced procedural animation technology that helps bring the virtual creatures to life.\n- Weather effects like howling winds, rain, thunder and snow.\n- 30 perks to unlock including teleport punch, slow time, and turrets.\n- Local, friend and galactic leaderboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97zu.jpg'),(1967,'Barbie','1991-12-01','Platform','DOS, Nintendo Entertainment System','Barbie is a video game developed by Imagineering Inc based after the famous Barbie doll, created by Mattel Inc. It was created specifically as an attempt to entice more girls to play video games, and was one of the very few Nintendo Entertainment System games with girl-oriented themes. It was not a particularly well-received game at the time, but has received some recognition for having some quality puzzles and gameplay style. Others have criticized it for being an example of \"pink\" software; which refers to software that was designed for male audiences that is re-skinned for female gamers, without taking into account true female gamer preferences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nsr.jpg'),(1968,'School Girl/Zombie Hunter','2017-11-17','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Let\'s see, Zombies? Schoolgirls? Guns? Wooden swords? And set in a high school? This all seems dead familiar. What\'s going on here?!\n\nFrom the people who brought you Onechanbara,comes a new, upcoming title! School Girl/Zombie Hunter follows the story of five girls caught up in a zombie outbreak (obviously). Trapped within what was once a prestigious school, the girls take up arms as they shoot and bash their way through the zombie hordes.\n\nNow how are a bunch of schoolgirls going to survivor being attacked by zombies you might ask? Well here\'s the thing, this isn\'t just any old school. Along side the literary arts they teach military arts as well, and these girls are packing some serious fire power!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a1w.jpg'),(1969,'Jewel Master Double Pack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x0l.jpg'),(1970,'Qanga','2024-09-02','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Qanga is a science fiction game about exploration and survival in the solar system. Synchronize your consciousness in a cyborg provided from ICLab\'s Industry labs and explore this universe!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4awr.jpg'),(1971,'Spectrum Forces','2021-10-25','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Make up your squads out of 9 unique ships and save 3 planets from hordes of robots in this colorful horizontal shoot-em-up!\n\nEach of the 9 pilots in the Spectrum Forces has unique capacities. It\'s up to you to select the right ones for the right job. You\'ve been commissioned to clear 3 planets from the residing Abandonware. Try your best to not lose anyone while doing so!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44k9.jpg'),(1972,'Aikiss 3 Cute: Complete Limited Edition','2022-03-25','Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','This edition includes the following:\n\n- Ai Kiss 3: Cute\n- Theme and Cover Song Album\n- Original Soundtrack CD\n- B2-size Tapestry\n- Acrylic Key Chain\n- Yearbook\n- Lycee Overture PR card','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4n2k.jpg'),(1973,'Xtract','2023-11-30','Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a treasure hunt in the Xtract shooter full of puzzles, PvE as well as PvP missions, treasure hunting, and much more!\n\nThe lost civilization has left rare artifacts and untold treasures on a mysterious island. Find them, outsmart your rivals and get all the loot!\n\nAssemble your team, fight enemies and other adventurers! Get new weapons and supplies, customize equipment and use all the capabilities of modern technology and the power of mystical artifacts!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7eoc.jpg'),(1974,'Etrian Mystery Dungeon','2015-03-05','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo 3DS','\"Far off in the mountains, the small village Aslarga becomes a hub for adventurers looking for fame and fortune from the Mystery Dungeons. But dire challenges await even the most stalwart adventurers in Etrian Mystery Dungeon, a turn-based action RPG roguelike developed by ATLUS and Spike Chunsoft.\n\nThe Nintendo 3DS exclusive mixes Etrian Odyssey’s vast RPG party and skill customization aspects, and Mystery Dungeon’s infinitely random dungeon adventures. The action/turn based combat means that battling monsters is not just about using the right skills, but becomes an elegant Pas de Quatre of strategic positioning. Players form their parties with familiar Etrian Odyssey classes, customize individuals using Etrian-style skill trees, and then take up to four members into the dungeons. Always randomized with various levels and paths, the dungeons require plenty of exploration, not to mention the incredible loot rewards -- just be wary of what waits among the deepest depths.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w77.jpg'),(1975,'In The Shadows','2012-12-30','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Demo version of an atmospheric singleplayer campaign with three small medieval levels (two of which are remakes of the orignal E1M1 and E1M2). It features both normal gameplay and a new, very unique stealth mode. The enemy AI has been vastly improved, and there are countless visual overhauls and miscellaneous additions. Very high quality throughout. A full version was never completed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77yp.jpg'),(1976,'Stormrite',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Stormrite is an upcoming open-world Action-RPG set in the dark, fantasy-medieval kingdom of Redreach. You will play the role of a young squire, exploring a world full of chaos and conflict. Become an expert assassin, learn the arts of dark magic, or lead your armies into large-scale war. With multiple endings to all questlines and a rich character tree to decide how you interact with the environment and its inhabitants, you have the power to decide your role in the world of Stormrite.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rq6.jpg'),(1977,'Blood Red','2023-10-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blood Red is a co-op survival horror game that can be played with 1-4 players. Hunt down demons by forming rituals, find out the demon type and banish the demon forever!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72p8.jpg'),(1978,'Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six Siege: Complete Edition','2016-12-31','Shooter, Tactical','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This version includes:\n\n- Base Game\n- Year 1 Operators\n- Year 2 Operators\n- Year 3 Operators','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i1z.jpg'),(1979,'Planet Gold Rush',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qyr.jpg'),(1980,'Gears of War 2: Snowblind Map Pack','2009-03-31','Shooter','Xbox 360','The Snowblind Map Pack is the third downloadable content pack (DLC) for the 2008 game Gears of War 2. It includes four maps to play on, all with a winter-time theme. Two of these, Fuel Depot and Courtyard, are winterized remakes from previous Gears Of War maps. The other two, Underhill and Grind Yard, are completely new.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nyw.jpg'),(1981,'My Neighbor Alice',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','My Neighbor Alice is a multiplayer builder-game where players build and create their own virtual lands, interact with neighbors, perform exciting daily activities and earn rewards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pjo.jpg'),(1982,'Knights Vault','2024-05-15','Platform, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Knights Vault is simply a multiplayer Souls Like Platformer. Run, jump and dodge roll your way through many environments and obstacles while fighting other players in your lobby, only one knight will stand victorious vaulting their way to the grand treasure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87cp.jpg'),(1983,'Where there once was sand','2016-05-20','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In the middle of an endless desert, an old professor is giving his last efforts trying to discover what he\'ve sought his whole life: the lost civilization of Mu. A life spent in the hunt of a myth, yet without any conclusive finding to support his theory that the continent is now buried under the sand.\n\nHis funding has been cut and the camp site is now to be turned into a mining complex. As a sentient machine sent to prospect the surroundings for geological opportunities, will you try to empathize with him, will try to help him unveil what may lie beneath the sand, or will you just limit yourself to what you\'ve been sent for?\n\nYou may well be the help Dr. Willis had been expecting all this time...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s2z.jpg'),(1984,'Alice\'s Adventures','2018-06-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Alice needs your help unveiling secrets of Wonderland! Colorful 360 degree scenery, animation, and 3D visual effects will make your adventure vivid and fun! Help the heroine solve puzzles and find cleverly disguised clues so she can advance through this wondrous land.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(1985,'Shroud of the Avatar: Forsaken Virtues','2018-03-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Journey to the world of Shroud of the Avatar: Forsaken Virtues, a computer role playing game created by Lord British (aka Richard Garriott), creator of the genre defining Ultima series of computer games, Starr Long, director of Ultima Online, and Tracy Hickman, author of the Dragonlance series. It combines rich story, like those of the single player Ultimas, with deep and varied multiplayer experiences, like Ultima Online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2969.jpg'),(1986,'Mixed-Up Mother Goose','1991-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, Amiga, Apple II','This is an updated version of Roberta Williams\' Mixed-Up Mother Goose. This version utilizes Sierra\'s SCI game interpreter and features enhanced graphics and sound.\n\nThe gameplay remains the same as the previous version; all of the nursery rhymes in Mother Goose Land have become mixed up! Your goal is to set things straight by locating missing items for each of the fairy tale characters in the land. When wandering around the land you can talk to the different characters (each from a different nursery rhyme) to find out what item it is they need; for example, Little Bo Peep is looking for her sheep and Jack Be Nimble lost his candle stick. The items are scattered about the land, and when you locate one pick it up and return it to the appropriate character. When successful, the complete nursery rhyme will play with the lyrics appearing on screen. You can only carry one item at a time, so you may need to remember where you spotted or dropped items not being carried! Also, each time the game is played objects will be in a new location. Included with the game is a map of Mother Goose Land which may help you locate the different fairy tale characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xpq.jpg'),(1987,'Destruct Blocks','2023-06-08','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Destruct Blocks is an addictive isometric puzzle game that combines strategic thinking, block destruction, and color matching challenges. Navigate a shape composed of colored blocks through intricate levels, strategically demolishing target blocks while avoiding others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kw4.jpg'),(1988,'Fire Emblem: Three Houses - Cindered Shadows','2020-02-12','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Nintendo Switch','Cindered Shadows is a DLC sidestory in Fire Emblem: Three Houses where the focus is given to the Ashen Wolves Yuri, Constance, Balthus, and Hapi who resides in the Abyss, a whole town below Garreg Mach Monastery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23i5.jpg'),(1989,'My Lovely Pets 2: Collector\'s Edition','2023-07-13','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','\"My lovely Pets 2\" is an exciting game, which offers interesting ways to find funny and playful pets, as well as bright hidden objects, and a set of popular mini-games. Meet and make friends with these funny pets in beautiful game locations where they are always ready to hide and fool around.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r29.jpg'),(1990,'Block Slender-Man 3D: Lucky Survivor - Worldwide Multiplayer Edition','2015-06-26','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Android, iOS','Block Slender Man in Multiplayer Mode! Now with Worldwide Mode! Now you have a perfect chance to battle with your friends, classmates and colleagues or anyone else around the world! You can create and customize your character and then show off on the battle field!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9900.jpg'),(1991,'Japanese Hiragana & Katakana Review DS','2009-08-13','Sin género','Nintendo DS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s0e.jpg'),(1992,'Nuclear Fission Simulator','2024-02-15','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Simulates the fission of Uranium 235 (U235) atoms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rye.jpg'),(1993,'The Golden Time in High School',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','As a high school student of Shiguang high school, you will spend three years here. What kind of students that you will be? You can choose to study hard and get a good grade.You can choose to be an assistant to teacher to help with their daily affairs. Or just have a romantic date with somebody?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5n3g.jpg'),(1994,'The Hunt for Red October','1991-12-31','Arcade','Nintendo Entertainment System','The NES version has an exclusive level: the final stage changes to platform-style gameplay. The player, as Ramius, must find and disable bombs Soviet-loyal crewmembers have set in the weapons bay of the Red October.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hgf.jpg'),(1995,'Clear: Atarashii Kaze no Fuku Oka de','2009-02-19','Adventure','PlayStation 2','Kouichi returns to his hometown after years of absence, expecting to find many changes. Instead, the island seems pretty much the same as when he left, but people he knew changed and his rekindled friendship and relationship with people he left behind will bring a change in Kouichi. The game is a visual novel with light background animations, while character only change poses and don\'t animate during talking, even moving lips while talking and looking in a different direction is done via character stills and not animated. Aside from Kouichi, all NPCs feature full voice-acting. \n \nOriginally released as Clear for PC (Windows), this PlayStation 2 port was done two years after with reduced rating and removed adult content. To compensate for that, the game features new characters, new branching plot, new CG events and new opening song by Ceui. Gameplay interface has also been improved and adjusted for console gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2623.jpg'),(1996,'Thunder Ray','2023-09-14','Fighting, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Thunder Ray is Arcade-Boxing, Retro-like gameplay with blood and violence. Defeat all the best fighters in the galaxy to become the GOAT of the universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7049.jpg'),(1997,'Farting Simulator','2023-05-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Get ready for a gut-busting good time with Farting Simulator! You experience the joy of controlling an uncontrollable bodily function in a meme-filled and comedic open-world sandbox environment. Farting Simulator is a hilarious and entertaining adventure that\'s sure to leave you FARTING out loud.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8r9y.jpg'),(1998,'Pocky & Rocky Reshrined','2022-04-21','Shooter, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Pocky & Rocky Reshrined follows the adventures of a young Shinto shrine maiden named Pocky and her companion, Rocky the raccoon, as they take on the Nopino Goblins!\n\nA third sequel in the series, Pocky & Rocky Reshrined is currently being developed by Tengo Project and expected for release on PlayStation 4 and Nintendo Switch in the second half of 2021. Tengo Project consists of staff who worked on the original, as well as Wild Guns: Reloaded and Ninja Saviors: Return of the Warriors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ctq.jpg'),(1999,'Riverwood Village','2004-07-25','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Still phased after your trek through Korax\'s homeworld and beyond, rebuilding Cronos has been far from a flawless experience. Much of Korax\'s minions still wander the world, most unfound by any tasked to slay them.\nThat is, until one day you get a summons to the town of Riverwood, academic stronghold where all three orders mingle under the root of nature. Korax\'s minions have regrouped, but under who none can assess.\nYou arrive at Riverwood to find the town already overrun. This mission is no longer a defense on your part... it\'s an assault. You swear to the gods that you WILL get to the bottom of this. Readying your strength, you walk through the town gates, which swiftly close behind you....','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2000,'Project:; Cold Case.Mirage','2025-03-27','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A mystery adventure that immerses you into solving a case right from your PC. Five girls died in the Mirage Forest Fire. Having lost your memories, you begin investigating the fire to recover them. What is the truth behind the fire? How is it linked to your memories? Will you be able to change fate?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l4f.jpg'),(2001,'D3ad Hand','2024-09-02','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crack the code, feed the cat, save the world.\nYuri Spraytyvich has been selected for the role of Junior Strategic Missile Force Manager of Čerëmuški Command Post in Chita, Siberia.\nHis new position comes with a lot of responsabilities and he will need to deal with lack of maintenance, worker strikes, radioactive materials and PERIMETER, the soviet automatic defence system.\nWhen PERIMETER receives by mistake the order to start the launch of the ballistic missile, it is up to Yuri to fix the problem and save the world from nuclear apocalypse.\nD3AD HAND is a satirical Point and click comedy adventure game set during the cold war in a soviet bunker.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8r7o.jpg'),(2002,'Delta Z. INC','2025-03-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Delta Z Inc. is a horror sci-fi puzzle game where you work as a repurposing technician, responsible for modifying reanimated bodies to suit the needs of your clients while keeping within the company\'s budget.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k8a.jpg'),(2003,'Voronica Cleans House: a Vore Adventure','2021-10-31','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A visual novel with high interactivity, \'Voronica Cleans House\' currently includes an hour of voracious gameplay, five potential transformations, nine victims, five main characters, a hundred and twenty five Full HD CG renders, over 10,000 words and way too many sprites!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z3l.jpg'),(2004,'Hakkenden','2024-01-26','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98dn.jpg'),(2005,'Zeta Fighters',NULL,'Indie, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Zeta Fighters is a free-to-play blend between mobile cave shooter and MOBA . Fight online, upgrade your spaceship and work your way to the top. With 15 unique weapons, stunning graphics, and intuitive touch-screen controls, Zeta Fighters makes it easy to jump into quick action-packed real-time space battles no matter where you are.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/c1vwu74gs6iusqf0ascr.jpg'),(2006,'Legend of a Soul Hunter',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Legend of a Soul Hunter is an action-adventure game with RPG elements. Explore islands and many individual dungeons by ship. Get items with different abilities, defeat monsters and become a successful soul hunter!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5it4.jpg'),(2007,'Shugo Chara! 3-tsu no Tamago to Koisuru Joker','2008-03-13','Simulator, Visual Novel','Nintendo DS','Shugo Chara! 3-tsu no Tamago to Koisuru Jokeris a otome game based on the anime Shugo Chara.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80m0.jpg'),(2008,'Alice Through the Fey Realm','2024-06-11','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Alice Through the Fey Realm is an enchanting isometric narrative adventure that thrusts you into the shoes of Alice. A compelling adventure unfolds as you awaken in the mysterious Fey Realm and embark on a quest to discover the key to your journey home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gln.jpg'),(2009,'Last Archmage Journey of Light','2020-07-16','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The legendary mage Merlin betrayed by his teammates in the holy war, fall from one of the legendary heroes to a rookie mage, and proceed the journey to the light with the help of new teammates. Along the way, you\'ll have to collect various magic scrolls and items to use in the combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5idg.jpg'),(2010,'The Stalked','2024-03-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escaped from Liam\'s obsession, Kate seeks refuge in her grandpa\'s mansion. Strange occurrences raise questions about Liam\'s presence or another figure. Unraveling mysterious letters, Kate embarks on a journey, seeking peace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zxk.jpg'),(2011,'Destiny 2: Forsaken - Season of the Forge','2018-12-04','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Also known as Black Armory, this season\'s main activities were the Lost Forges, which once belonged to the Black Armory but have since become forgotten to the folds of history, with a new raid, \"Scourge of the Past\", which takes place in the Last City. Players can also \"forge\" new weapons by completing their respective frames, with three being able to be purchased every week from Ada-1, and then participating in a Lost Forge activity after completing certain objectives for each weapon frame. In addition, the Power level cap was increased to 650, and four new exotic weapons were introduced, with one returning from the first game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z5r.jpg'),(2012,'Timothy and the Mysterious Forest','2021-01-22','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Timothy and the Mysterious Forest is a mix of old-school Game Boy graphics, meta-narrative, stealth system and action combat with an high difficulty level. Elements from adventure/exploration games are mixed with puzzle and stealth: exploration, reading and keeping a slow pace is the best tactic. Multiple endings!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t3b.jpg'),(2013,'Paris Nights','2008-12-31','Simulator','Legacy Mobile Device','Paris Nights is a 2008 game developed and released by Gameloft for the J2ME platform. It is part of the Nights series by Gameloft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ruy.jpg'),(2014,'Bomber Fox','2020-09-17','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Bomber Fox is an action, sci-fi-themed game of the new generation, with an emphasis put into the dynamic gameplay, diverse level design, and innovative game modes.Play as Fox - the space cyborg, who has to win the grand robot-fighting tournament, to be granted a chance to go back home!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mgq.jpg'),(2015,'Tales of Tyria','2020-06-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this loveletter to classics like The Legend of Zelda or Neutopia, you take the role of the chosen hero of light to awaken the Goddess Tyria from her nightmare! Can you master all challenges on your journey to find the seven Light Crysts? Use your sword, shield and powerful magical tools to achieve your goal and save the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2paa.jpg'),(2016,'Asian Dynamite','2007-07-01','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Arcade','This game is a direct sequel to Dynamite Deka, meaning in its localised form, Asian Dynamite is a direct sequel to Die Hard Arcade, with the references to the movie franchise removed.\nThe game has not been ported to home platforms, nor has it even seen a US release. It is extremely similar to Dynamite Cop in design, simply sporting an updated Asian aesthetic and replacing Jean Ivy and Eddie Brown with Caroline Powell and Jennifer Genuine, respectively. Caroline is the president\'s daughter from the first game grown up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ix0.jpg'),(2017,'Need for Speed: Hot Pursuit','2010-12-31','Racing','Legacy Mobile Device','Feel as a driver to be chased by a racer driving a cool car with tuning or feel the excitement of the stalker! In this new part of the super-race, you can start a career of a street racer and a policeman! Challenge the law behind the wheel of supercars of Pagani Zonda Cinque class or stop the drivers in such high-speed police interceptors as Lamborghini Gallardo LP 560-4 Spyder! Get all the achievements and awards in the saturated with adrenalin 24-hour chases and harassments!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70ng.jpg'),(2018,'Cyber Danganronpa VR: The Class Trial','2017-03-06','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR','Stand trial for murder with your classmates in this tech demo based on Danganronpa: Trigger Happy Havoc. Use your truth bullets to shoot through suspicious statements and find the killer! The headmaster has a special punishment prepared just for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kea.jpg'),(2019,'The Last Explorer','2024-03-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Discover an alien world, study and befriend creatures and take beautiful photos along the way.\n\nExplore an open world full of creatures to learn more about, find all the wreckage from your spaceship and use your camera to learn more about the creatures, the world and how you got there.\n\nThroughout your journey you\'ll be able to do quests for the aliens or just play minigames with them.\n\nUse your camera to take beautiful photos and analyze your environment. Throughout your journey you\'ll find new effects to take even better and more unique photos.\n\nThere are many different creatures you can study, photograph and befriend. Photograph them to learn more and use bait to befriend and ride them.\n\nFind out how your ship crashed and what happened to the other astronauts by exploring the island and photographing the wreckage to analyze it and learn more.\n\nThe Last Explorer features:\n- A beautiful open world you can explore any way you want\n- Complex creatures to study and befriend\n- Small side quests\n- A highly customizable camera system\n- Many interesting camera effects\n- Old spaceship wreckage to learn more about\n- A mystery to uncover\n- Land, Air and Water creatures\n- Xbox controller support','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7snb.jpg'),(2020,'Sainthood','2024-11-01','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Sainthood is a cozy strategy game about serving your community and growing your faith. Explore a miniature world and help the islanders by constructing buildings, delivering resources, and volunteering. Pray and attend to other spiritual activities as you rise to become a Saint!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zwa.jpg'),(2021,'Apex Construct','2018-03-20','Shooter, Adventure','Oculus VR, Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Oculus Rift, Oculus Quest','Apex Construct is a story-driven, single player action/adventure made exclusively for VR. Wield an upgradable cyber bow & shield combination to battle enemy robots while exploring a shattered world, gradually realizing what led to the extinction of mankind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28u8.jpg'),(2022,'Can Can Bunny Extra DX',NULL,'Adventure','PC-FX','Can Can Bunny Extra DX is the fifth Can Can Bunny game, and is also the first direct sequel within the series. The hero is lonely and is anxious to get a girlfriend. And once again, the benevolent and gorgeous goddess Swatty is here to provide assistance, together with her side-kicks, the Seven Lucky Gods from the Japanese mythology.\n\nThe interface is still traditional Japanese-style menu commands, but there are many more locations in this game, many of which can be freely accessed by clicking on them while on the main map. Once the player has reached the point where he can begin the physical seduction of the girl, the interface switches to point-and-click, with context-sensitive cursor for touching, kissing, etc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tctsp6uuepkaqqn1elgw.jpg'),(2023,'Bloomtown: A Different Story','2024-09-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Bloomtown: A Different Story is a narrative JRPG mixing turn-based combat, monster taming and social RPG set in a seemingly pleasant 1960s Americana world. Join Emily and her group of friends to save their cozy town from the demonic creatures that live in the hearts of its residents!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m14.jpg'),(2024,'Run from the Feds!','2024-09-06','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Third person 3D platformer with the goal being get to the end as fast as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sy2.jpg'),(2025,'Eve Online: Revelations','2006-11-29','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','REVELATIONS is the first of three installments in EVE Online’s second major game expansion. The first expansion, EXODUS, revealed the escalating tensions between the Empires of EVE with its first installment, Cold War. In the second installment, Red Moon Rising, a galactic arms race forged the most powerful weapons ever constructed by man.\n\nEnter REVELATIONS, in which the empires make their final push towards the brink of war. Uncharted regions of space shall open for pilots to explore, yielding vast wealth and the untapped resources needed to feed a hungry war machine. New innovations in weapons technology will provide pilots with the means to wage the battle for supremacy in the universe of EVE.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c6a.jpg'),(2026,'I.Q. 180','1983-12-31','Sin género','Atari 2600','The title screen shows us 25 letters of the alphabet (where did the Z go?) and 5 symbols, representing little figures. If you press F1 to start, you will see the first screen with all the letters and symbols randomly presented and numbered from 1 to 30. If you move the blinking cursor with your joystick down (in the direction of the red arrows), the second screen will appear with the same letters and symbols also numbered 1 to 30, but in a different order. You will also be confronted by a horrible tune. While the tune is playing, you will have to memorize the positions of the letters and symbols of both the screens by looking at their corresponding number (use your joystick to move the cursor in the direction of the arrows to let the other screen appear) or just write down the thirty letters and symbols of one screen on a piece of paper. When the tune stops, all the letters and symbols of both screens will change into little squares and a timer will count down from 1000 to 0. You have to memory match the same letters (or symbols) by pressing fire when your cursor is on the correct square. When two letters (or symbols) match, you will get 1 point and the two matching letters (or symbols) will stay on screen. When the two letters (or symbols) don\'t match, they will change into little squares again. If you manage to match all the thirty letters and symbols before the timer reaches zero, you will be confronted by another horrible tune and the game will end. If you do not manage to match all the thirty letters and symbols before the timer reaches zero, you will still be confronted by the same horrible tune and the game will end. When the game has ended you are still able to move the cursor and change squares into letters (or symbols).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zep.jpg'),(2027,'Sayings Master','2017-12-24','Quiz/Trivia','Android, iOS','Educational word game to learn real English sayings, proverbs, and vocabulary as you play. Order the words, learn English sayings and wisdom fast! Fun lasting learning.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fq1.jpg'),(2028,'Rovonaut Comrade',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Rovonaut Comrade is a small experimental rover simulator made in 5 days for the \'Weekly Game Jam 129\'\n\nThe theme was \'Lost In Space\'','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1x55.jpg'),(2029,'Shakes on a Plane','2020-12-15','Simulator, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Shakes on a Plane is an ULTRA-FUN co-op time-management game about the daily lives of a airliner cabin crew. Roast and serve BBQ skewers, para-drop passengers, clean knee-high piles of barf at 30 000 feet and so on. Coming in 2019!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jv6.jpg'),(2030,'Act 1',NULL,'Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game about a guy who migrated to Japan to become a NEET.\nSodapoppin was once a popular video game streamer, but he met his match when he became a video game himself. Now, he\'s stuck in a never-ending loop of being killed by players and then respawning, only to be killed again. His screams can be heard echoing through the game world, as he suffers for eternity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pdq.jpg'),(2031,'Who Wants to Be a Millionaire: 3rd Edition','2001-07-11','Quiz/Trivia','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Who Wants To Be A Millionaire: 3rd Edition is the third game based on the successful TV show. Not surprisingly the game itself is unchanged with the exception of new questions. The player takes the role of a candidate and has to answer 15 questions by choosing the correct answer out of four given possibilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ye2.jpg'),(2032,'Microsoft: My Personal Tutor Preschool & Kindergarden','2001-08-16','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get a head start with all the essential skills for Preschool and Kindergarten with My Personal Tutor! There\'s fun and learning from start to finish with My Personal Tutor, the only comprehensive, grade-based solution with TutorAssist learning technology (Professor Presto!). Just like a tutor, this groundbreaking technology identifies your child\'s specific learning needs and offers instruction where and when it\'s needed most. \n \nThis originally came in four disks for Preschool-First Grade (ages 3-7): Preschool Workshop, Alphabet Playhouse, Reader Railway, and Mathopolis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ulv.jpg'),(2033,'Hack Grid','2021-01-22','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hack Grid is a puzzle game & love letter to DOS gaming. Only one piece must remain on the board. Each type of piece has its own set of rules. Retro Sound Blaster 16 style audio will accompany you throughout the game. Hack the Grid!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qxt.jpg'),(2034,'Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six 3: Gold Edition','2008-09-25','Shooter, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Raven Shield: Command an elite multinational squad of special operatives against hidden terrorist forces. In Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six 3: Raven Shield, the third installment to the wildly popular Rainbow Six series, Team Rainbow faces the hidden global forces of a new and secretive foe.\n\nRainbow Six 3 Gold Download Features:\n- All-new eight-mission campaign in locations from Italy and Croatia to Greece.\n- Five new multiplayer levels (Chemical Factory, Ferry Boat, University, Italian Alleys, and Jungle).\n- Three new multiplayer game modes (Adversarial Terrorist Hunt, Adversarial Scattered Hunt, and Capture the Enemy).\n- Seven additional real-world weapons (for a total of 64) with sound effects from the team that worked on the blockbuster movie The Matrix.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3aoc.jpg'),(2035,'Nights of Azure 2: Bride of the New Moon','2017-10-24','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Nights of Azure 2: Bride of the New Moon takes place in a fictional, demon-ridden Western European city towards the end of the 19th century. The story focuses on a knight protector named Alushe and her two childhood friends – Liliana, a kind-hearted priestess, and Ruhenheid, a holy knight of the Lourdes Order. While guarding Liliana, Alushe is ambushed and killed only to later awaken as an artificial half-demon at the hands of the New Curia, a religious organization with dark ties. In the company of a variety of unlikely allies with their own pasts and agendas, Alushe’s strong desire to save Liliana gives her the strength to scatter the shadows shrouding the world and motivation to uncover the shocking truth behind the mysterious Queen of the Moon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rcm.jpg'),(2036,'Save the Halloween','2017-11-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Collect all candies during the game, avoid saws, spikes and falling to abyss - you will help main character come back home and Save the Halloween for his family!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2037,'Kingsley\'s Adventure','1999-10-22','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation','Would you rather watch an adventure or be in one? This is the story of Kingsley, fox club and unlikely hero on a quest to save the Fruit Kingdom from the evil Wizard, Bad Custard. This is a job worthy only of a True Knight. Are you ready for the adventure of a lifetime?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j9p.jpg'),(2038,'Submersed','2020-01-24','Indie','PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rediscover the meaning of terror with Submersed.\nCoast Guard paramedic Jack Ballard, recently reincorporated after the death of his wife, responds to an emergency call from an offshore structure in high seas. The place seems to be abandoned, so who sent the message? Help Jack Ballard find out the truth, exploring the darkest reaches and flooded areas teeming with dangerous predators, solving enigmas and puzzles while you try to survive.\n\nAre you afraid of depths? You will be.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wjr.jpg'),(2039,'My Town: Bakery','2018-01-25','Role-playing (RPG)','iOS','There is a tasty new addition in My Town and it’s time to put your favorite characters to work! In this game, you will get to open your very own My Town : Bakery! There will be customers coming in, so you’d better get baking! Perhaps there is a birthday party coming up and you will need to bake an extra special cake for someone. Maybe someone would like to have a pizza party – grab your delivery driver and make sure it gets there on time! \n \nMy Town : Bakery has SEVEN new locations to explore! There is the bakery, a pizza shop, a park to hold birthday parties in and even an apartment! No matter where you choose to start your adventure, there are HOURS of fun ahead!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pgpnugprp858umwneoa5.jpg'),(2040,'Toxic Crusaders','1992-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','It\'s Clean Up Time!\n\nOnly a complete and helpless nerd like Melvin Junko could be such a klutz that he would run into a vat of Grossolium 90, a terribly toxic waste by-product of the Island City Chemical Plant. Now the wimpy nerd Melvin has mutated into Toxie, a hideously deformed creature of super-human size and strength. But all is not lost, Toxie, with his newfound power, has joined forces with Major Disaster, Nozone, Headbanger, and Junkyard to form the Toxic Crusaders. No, not the ultimate heavy metal band, you moron! This motley crew is sworn to defend Tromaville and the rest of the U.S. from the polluting ways of Dr. Killemoff and his Radiation Rangers!\n\nIt won\'t be any easy mop up operation, but with your help the Toxic Crusaders are sure to make a clean sweep of the six levels of sludge, slime, goop and grime, while washing Killemoff and his filthy friends off the face of the earth forever!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xyf.jpg'),(2041,'Dark Goddess of Destruction','2024-11-04','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This is a unique card battle idle game that we have crafted together with our players. We have developed an in-depth progression system and comprehensive character and monster profiles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9naq.jpg'),(2042,'Simple 2000 Series Vol. 2: The Party Game','2001-11-08','Arcade','PlayStation 2','Forty 4 Party features 39 mini games, but for one player there are only 26 mini games avaliables, the other 13 are multi-player mini games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4t3s.jpg'),(2043,'Halls of Death','1983-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','Commodore C64/128/MAX','Halls of Death is an adventure game where you play the role of one of many explorers who have entered the caverns and rooms over many floors, searching for the treasure within, the only difference hopefully is that you make it out alive. The screen is split into five different parts with two parts text, one a map of the floor you are on, your stats and finally what you can see in front off you or the creature you are fighting. Starting at the bottom of some steps, you move around the map searching each room and text tells you what you see and how many turns you have taken.\n\nAs you explore, some rooms will have traps, some will have treasure and others will have a creature or monster that wants to fight you seen from the side. You have a certain level of strength and psionics (magic) and you can either swing at the creature, retreat or use one of four spells which are sleep, teleportation, lighting and fireball. Spells sometimes don\'t work and can sometimes rebound and hit yourself. You both take it in turns to fight and it is game over if you lose all your strength. You can move your different levels of strength and psionics between each other as you avoid either reaching zero. Another level you have is constitution and this decreases as you explore further into the Halls of Death and so you need to return to the surface to rest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81na.jpg'),(2044,'True Vikings','2025-05-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Choose your own path: become a powerful jarl or a legendary king, or perhaps switch sides and follow the path of a knight, reliving the story of the Duke of Normandy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9krj.jpg'),(2045,'The Phenomenon','2023-07-15','Indie','Android','The Phenomenon is an episodic survival horror game with great re-playability. The main character is Barry Nellan, a paranormal researcher whose work is known worldwide. Many cases connected with unexplained activity were investigated. Most gave no real results, but the last one…\n\nIn the Episode 1, you will explore map of 3 square kilometers with over 500 spawns of objects, use devices for paranormal research, fight against creatures with smart and tricky AI, and find out a lot of other things that make each new game unique.\n\nCompete with other players to take the first place in the global leaderboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kn3.jpg'),(2046,'Chrono Alice','2021-03-31','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Included in the Story Me app.\n\nAlice is a high schooler living in the \"Showa\" period, who meets a boy named Sho in the library, and the two instantly fall for each other. However, you find out that he\'s a high schooler from the \"Reiwa\" period. As \"time\" itself acts as a barrier for the two lovers, Alice also finds out that the library is struggling to stay open......','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49tl.jpg'),(2047,'Spirit Hunter: Death Mark','2019-02-22','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','You have been Marked...\n\nA strange rumor is spreading through the shadows of Tokyo\'s H City: a mysterious disfigurement, like a grotesque birthmark, has been appearing on the bodies of certain individuals. Anyone who receives the Mark will rapidly die of unknown, horrifying causes.\n\nDeprived of your memories, you arrive at a mansion rumored to protect the bearers of the Mark. As the doors swing open, the countdown to death has already begun...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g1a.jpg'),(2048,'Arcade Archives: Mr. Goemon','2015-10-27','Platform, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Arcade Archives: Mr. Goemon is a port of the action game Mr. Goemon. The player has to reach the goal by using various items while not getting caught by the enemies. This title is said to be the foundation of the Ganbare Goemon series which is the representative title for Konami at the time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bae.jpg'),(2049,'Brave the Dungeon',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Brave the Dungeon is a thrilling and immersive multiplayer open-world game that takes you on an epic journey to fight against the daemonic invasion threatening the archipelago.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69z2.jpg'),(2050,'The Exclusion Zone Online',NULL,'Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','MMO First-person shooter with RPG elements. The usual laws do not apply here, there are no police and law enforcement agencies - so the zone attracts people who want to avoid justice. And various anomalies and their creations attract scientists, mercenaries, hungry for profit, and ordinary stalkers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43ru.jpg'),(2051,'HTR+ Slot Car Simulation','2014-05-29','Racing, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation Vita','HTR+ High Tech Racing is a Slot Car Racing Simulation, a virtual version of the classic toy of the 80´s and 90´s. HTR+ is the sequel of HTR High Tech Racing that was downloaded several million times across all platform HTR+ offers 3 different difficulty levels and 20 tracks that include several challenges like loops, jumps, crossroads, narrows and high speed curves. You can even build your own tracks with the highly intuitive Track Editor, You can share your own tracks online.. More than 100.000 tracks have been created by players of HTR and are available for download. With realistic physics HTR+ offers an adrenalin packed racing simulation experience. Tons of cool items to unlock including cars, electric engines, tires, and chassis to optimize your car; there are more than 240 possible configurations to test on each track.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60s0.jpg'),(2052,'The Outpost Nine','2018-07-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Outpost Nine - Episode 1 is a visual novel/point and click hybrid game following the small skeleton crew of \"The Outpost\", a lonely mining facility set on the small moon \"Cobalt Paradise\".','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2053,'Shall We Date?: War of Prayers - Inori no Otome','2015-12-20','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','“Shall We Date?: War of Prayers - Inori no Otome”, is a visual novel and dating simulation game about a romance between a girl who is destined to save the world as a prayer maiden and a knight who protects her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rux.jpg'),(2054,'S.T.A.L.K.E.R. 2: Heart of Chornobyl - Collector\'s Edition','2024-11-20','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Collector\' s Edition includes:\n- The Deluxe Edition of the game\n- Steel Book (Collector`s art)\n- Letter From Developers\n- Souvenir Zone Permit\n- Sticker Pack\n- Zone Map\n- Poster\n- Faction Patches\n- Military Token\n- Keychain (Multi-tool) with Fire Starter\n- Art Book\n- Stalker Figurine\n\n(Pre-order Bonuses)\n- Extended campfire content\n- Exclusive weapon skin\n- Exclusive armor skin\n- \'Early bird\' multiplayer badge','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7op3.jpg'),(2055,'LocoMotion','2022-09-13','Platform, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Locomotion is an Action, Platformer Game Inspired by many other Games out there. This game has a fascinating story behind it! Play it to find out what secrets the Acidic Waters have in store for you!\nYou play as a crash test dummy and the people who made you need to test your strength.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71gj.jpg'),(2056,'Never Date Werewolves','2020-04-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dating a werewolf means you’re left with a litter of kids who turn into cubs when they get upset. You’ve got the silver out of the house, meat in the fridge – but contrary to your ex, you can’t turn into a wolf when the cubs decide to do a runner!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20ek.jpg'),(2057,'Feed Us 4',NULL,'Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98cp.jpg'),(2058,'Crab Crawl','2024-07-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crab Crawl is a short, single-player game that has you guiding a hungry crab from its cave into the wider Chesapeake Bay in search of morsels of food to eat. The waters are alive with hungry catfish, voracious bluegill, and mindless jellyfish who twirl around the salty currents, grabbing whatever prey bumbles their way.\n\nKey features:\n\nBright, cartoony, hand-drawn art;\n\nAn expressive soundtrack to scuttle along to;\n\nNo penalty for getting caught, and overall a design appropriate for most ages and skill levels;\n\nSurprising encounters with sea creatures, enemy crabs, and polluting fishermen.\n\nFind all the food to complete the game, and flee a terrifying predator while saving the bay from its greatest threat!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h63.jpg'),(2059,'Mineirinho Director\'s Cut','2019-12-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A really cool 3d platform game, lots of extreme adventures with our friend Miner, now we have the option Double Miner and the adventure gets a lot cooler. Director\'s Cut version has unpublished scenes that have never been seen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30oh.jpg'),(2060,'Tyke and Sons Lumber Co.','2019-10-26','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tyke and Sons Lumber Co. is a fanmade sequel to one of Scott Cawthon\'s earlier games, \"Chipper and Sons Lumber Co.\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oto.jpg'),(2061,'Good Boy!','2018-05-02','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game \"Good boy\" is an arcade game. Your character is the dog \"good boy\". The objective of the game is to get to the owner what she has lost.\nA good boy will face complex obstacles: garbage cans, fire hydrants, lasers, smart missiles and much more.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- 3 difficult levels that need to go through a certain time with a limited amount of money on lives\n- 3 bosses - leaders of world nuclear powers\n- 5 lives and a timer\n-Incredibly simple interface\n-Many humor\n\nGood luck!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2062,'Borderlands 2: Mad Moxxi and the Wedding Day Massacre','2014-02-11','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','Mad Moxxi and the Wedding Day Massacre is a Headhunter DLC for Borderlands 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6041.jpg'),(2063,'Blood+: Final Piece','2006-09-07','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','An adventure role-playing video game that utilizes animated sequences from the Blood+ anime series as well as new footage created specifically for the game. Saya, joined by three friends from school, investigates the mystery of her father\'s disappearance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6swf.jpg'),(2064,'Gigantosaurus: The Game','2020-03-26','Platform, Racing, Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The most exciting episode of Gigantosaurus yet is one you get to play in. But will you be the most roarsome explorer or the fastest racer? Play together with friends and family to help Rocky, Tiny, Mazu and Bill save the day – before dino-dashing to the next zone. Dinosaurs have never had such giant fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20m0.jpg'),(2065,'Hidden Object: Fantasy Land',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2066,'Coneru: Dimension Girl',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a 2D action date with the dimension-girl, Coneru! This time, your date plan is to fend off the mysterious alien group \"Hateful Fruit Company\" invading Shinjuku City!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gqi.jpg'),(2067,'Avicii Invector: Encore Edition','2022-01-27','Sin género','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Re-take the stage for the most complete performance yet! Soar through 35 of AVICII\'s biggest hits and sweep each fade and attack every beat across SEVEN worlds, in this enthralling rhythm-action experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3r2z.jpg'),(2068,'Shooting Gallery','1972-09-01','Shooter','Odyssey','Shooting Gallery was the very first collection of shooting games with a light gun for a home console system. It came on the Magnavox Odyssey Cartrdige No. 10, used a original sized rifle and four different screen overlays.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6icr.jpg'),(2069,'Mobile Suit Gundam: Advanced Operation','1992-12-31','Strategy','PC-9800 Series','Set in late UC 0089, Advanced Operation occupies that elusive and underused timeline gap between the Gundam ZZ TV series and the film Char’s Counterattack. You follow the crew of the Pegasus Kai class ship Il Nido as they clash with a force of Neo-Zeon remnants commanded by a hawkish Haman Karn loyalist named Gerald Sinclair.\n\nSinclair’s mission is to hunt down the representative of a moderate Neo-Zeon faction that seeks to make peace with the Federation: the late Karn’s own younger sister, Serrana Karn. The game features original character designs by Haruhiko Mikimoto of Macross and Gundam 0080 fame.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5r1l.jpg'),(2070,'I Want to be a Triangle','2019-01-17','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The little adventure of a Rectangle in Geoshape Prime.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4n4m.jpg'),(2071,'Ghost Grab 3000','2019-11-08','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Chain ghosts together with your robotic Grapple Beam... then blast them away to score massive points!! An endless arcade score-chaser with a crunchy/cute retro style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1smb.jpg'),(2072,'Outbreak: Shades of Horror Chromatic Split Lost Lives Collection','2025-03-22','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kto.jpg'),(2073,'Intergalacto-1','2024-07-16','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Intergalacto-1 features intense multiplayer battles in Warzone mode and thrilling survival experiences in mystical horror mode, filled with magical elements and numerous exciting modes. Conquer the galaxy\'s hidden worlds and face the formidable boss, INM.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lzt.jpg'),(2074,'Of The Lilies',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When the curses that only come once a century suddenly resurface, you are tasked to stop them—with a choice that also forces you to face your past. Explore a lore-rich world with 5 possible love interests, and decide if choosing your own motives over the greater good is worth a single sacrifice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pbl.jpg'),(2075,'Fall Gummies','2020-11-20','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Fall Gummies is a relaxing, colorful 3D puzzle game. The story takes place in a fantastic world of happy jellies. Unfortunately one day a huge meteorite hit the planet pushing it towards the black hole. It sucked all the emotions out of the planet and then collapsed. Help our little friends to regain their happiness by collecting the magical essence through the labyrinth! • 1000 challenging puzzles to complete • Customize your characters appearance • Create profiles for each Jelly • Cute and colorful graphics • Intuitive controls • Chilling music BECOME A FRIEND OF GUMMIES AND MAKE THEM HAPPY AGAIN!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4dll.jpg'),(2076,'Sam & Max: Beyond Time and Space - Episode 5: What\'s New Beelzebub?','2008-04-11','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Judgment day is at hand, and it\'s time for a showdown with the guy downstairs to bargain for Bosco\'s soul. But in the corporate wasteland known as Hell, not even the Freelance Police are safe from eternal damnation. Can Sam & Max fight free from Satan\'s grasp, or have they reached the end of the line?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z2j.jpg'),(2077,'Arida: Backland\'s Awakening','2022-06-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','An adventure game with survival elements in the Brazilian backlands. Explore through the arid regions to collect items, solve quests and find the fate of Cicera.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xxj.jpg'),(2078,'Cities in Motion','2011-02-22','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rendered in rich detail, four of the world\'s greatest cities - Vienna, Helsinki, Berlin, and Amsterdam - await the steady hand of a planner to manage their transportation needs in Cities in Motion, a city-based mass transportation simulation game. Overseeing the changing needs of people from 1920 to 2020, it\'s up to you to manage everything from buses, trams and subway trains to maximize profits while pleasing commuters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vqj.jpg'),(2079,'Sucker Punch VR','2021-11-18','Indie','Oculus VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Sucker Punch VR is pong at the next level. It is a single and multiplayer VR experience that is easy to learn and heart-pounding fun to master.\n\nPunch cubes past your opponent while not letting any past you. Collect and use an arsenal of gloves allowing you to unleash a variety of power-ups.\n\nPlay single games to hone your skills, or join the leagues and battle your way to trophies and glory! Think you are the best? Grab a friend and find out in head-to-head multiplayer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bd5.jpg'),(2080,'Goodboy Galaxy',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Game Boy Advance, Nintendo Switch','A vibrant sci-fi platform adventure game for the Game Boy Advance, where you help Maxwell the dog explore unfamiliar worlds, make strange new friends and contend with mysterious forces - by jumping, shooting, slicing, shrinking, warping and drilling.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7odz.jpg'),(2081,'Reflect World','1987-07-02','Shooter','Family Computer Disk System','Reflect World is a shooter with RPG elements developed by East Cube and released for the Famicom Disk System. \n \nReflect World is a vehicle-based top-down shoot \'em up with a lot of RPG and simulation elements. The player controls a large and formidable tank as it makes its way across a wasteland, destroying enemies and tinkering with its many modes and functions. The game is extremely difficult to understand unless the player is knowledgeable in Japanese (the game was never released outside of Japan), the instruction manual or, preferably, both. \n \nThe game was developed and published by East Cube, an obscure Japanese developer that largely focused on Japanese computer games. Reflect World is the only game they ever released on a Nintendo console.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nfqewlrchrosy6qrhn4k.jpg'),(2082,'Knights Within','2024-05-15','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Knights Within is a 1-4 player hack&slash horde shooter with roguelite elements. Design custom loadouts, navigate procedurally generated levels and utilize random power-ups. Can you survive endless waves of enemies to ensure humanity\'s survival?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zlx.jpg'),(2083,'Everest Solitaire - iEverest',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2084,'Shredding Crush',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2085,'Dinosaur King: Operation Dinosaur Rescue','2006-05-01','Fighting, Arcade','Arcade','The next entry of the arcade machine series, where you fight with dinosaurs with a rock, paper, scissors enhanced system.\n\nA continuation of the previous story. Max and Rex decided to continue rescuing dinosaurs. They soon discover the Alpha Gang delivering some dinosaurs away for experiments. They succeeded in creating an Alpha Acrocanthosaurus, in which serves as the final boss. In the story, they were also close to transforming an Irritator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74d6.jpg'),(2086,'Garbage Truck!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2087,'Jolly Roger','2021-08-19','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short BL Visual Novel about romance and pirates. Spanish and English available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xlc.jpg'),(2088,'Princess Dating Sim','2023-12-05','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Princess Dating Sim is an non-linear visual novel where you court multiple princesses at the same time. You\'ll need to woo them, and see what their tastes are before you can pick a partner to marry! But don\'t worry, there are no wrong answers here!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6162.jpg'),(2089,'Knightmare Tower','2013-03-28','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Ouya, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Break through ceilings, rescue princesses and escape boiling lava as you slash your way to the top of the Knightmare Tower!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44jq.jpg'),(2090,'Erogoddess: Mirage','2024-11-07','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a dating simulator with feminized Egyptian gods. Ra, Anubis, Seth, Osiris, Horus and other gods are waiting for you. Discover new gods by spinning the wheel of fortune and go on dates with them, liberating them and undressing them. Add new goddesses to the gallery until you undress them all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nqy.jpg'),(2091,'Dungeon Manager ZV 2','2017-02-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Japanese megahit Dungeon Manager ZV now has a sequel! ZV2 offers a full graphical interface and more options to manage your zombies, monsters and traps. Think strategically to defend against invaders. Now with Steam Workshop you can design your dungeon and share it online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2azr.jpg'),(2092,'In Fear I Trust: Episode 3 - Iron and Rust','2016-09-22','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','“In Fear I Trust” 3rd Episode tells us about the strange events at the local factory. They took place when the player used to work there. The mysterious deaths, the mysterious inspectors. Advancing the episode, the player tries to find out what is really going on and how this is related to VERSA company. Why are people dying on a scheduled basis?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65mm.jpg'),(2093,'Echelon 2D','2016-07-14','Arcade','Android, iOS','A hail of ballistic missiles attacks you wave after wave. Shoot them down and protect your shields, but be careful because for every wave you have a limited amount of rockets! Use your rockets wisely and try to aim perfectly to trigger chain reactions! Train to improve your skills and break through the top of the leaderboard. Show off and share your highscore with your friends. How long can you survive?\n\nEchelon 2D - Features: \n\n- Strictly a skill game!\n- Completely free to play\n- Game Center leaderboard\n- Retro, clean and minimalistic design\n- Simple and intuitive one tap controls\n- Procedural wave creation\n- 6 epic soundtracks','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lpuahkwyxxlnritiibx7.jpg'),(2094,'Redirection','2018-12-20','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Redirection is a challenging 3D puzzle game set in Outer Space. As the Computer of an Interstellar Starship, only you can rescue it\'s missing Robot crew from the perils of an unexplored asteroid belt. Across 45 hazard-filled levels, you must use the ship\'s teleporter to influence the paths of stranded Robots, and \"redirect\" them back to safety. As you progress through the game, you\'ll discover new twists and mechanics, and uncover an exciting science fiction mystery story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84cs.jpg'),(2095,'Reverie: Sweet As Edition','2019-02-07','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Reverie is an action adventure game set on a fictional island in New Zealand, inspired by the legend of Maui and the Giant Fish where the demigod himself fishes up the North Island with a powerful fishhook.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j1k.jpg'),(2096,'Pajama Sam Vol. 2',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uof.jpg'),(2097,'2010 FIFA World Cup South Africa','2010-06-28','Sport','iOS','iOS port of 2010 FIFA World Cup South Africa.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70on.jpg'),(2098,'Skeleton vs zombies',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Your a skeleton and you shoot zombies','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co415q.jpg'),(2099,'Cat in Rain','2024-09-25','Platform','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90uv.jpg'),(2100,'Puzzle Bundle Xbox: Mimi New Friend, Sokocrab and StoryBlocks','2025-03-07','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iry.jpg'),(2101,'Ninja Combat','2008-06-13','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, Neo Geo MVS, Wii, Neo Geo CD','Ninja Combat is a 1990 side-scrolling beat \'em up video game developed by Alpha Denshi and published by SNK. It was one of the launch titles for both the Neo Geo MVS (arcade) and AES (home) systems. It is notorious for its unbalanced difficulty and odd design and gameplay ideas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zw1.jpg'),(2102,'Sandy & Junior: Aventura Virtual','2003-09-12','Puzzle, Tactical, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sandy & Junior: Aventura Virtual is a stealth and action-adventure game developed by the Brazilian company Green Land Studios and published by Brasoft, starring the pair of pop singers Sandy & Junior.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6prj.jpg'),(2103,'Monsty Corp: The Prequels',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Monsty Corp is an advanced science facility in the middle of the Australian desert, Maria, a new member of the Practical AI Division, has been tasked with activating a new AI called \"Sentient Artificial and Intelligent Consciousness\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co832o.jpg'),(2104,'Gar-Type','2024-12-23','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','GORESTAR, the living planet, is on a direct course for Earth.\nIt\'s time to debut our secret weapon duo:\nAce pilot Jon Starbuckle, and his prototype starfighter, Gar-Type D.\nYour mission: save humanity! Defend the Earth from the alien invaders!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98uh.jpg'),(2105,'Quest For The X','2023-10-24','Puzzle, Adventure','Playdate','A retro, story-driven adventure set amidst the medieval intrigue of the Knights Templar.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d65.jpg'),(2106,'Cozy Days','2021-10-16','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cozy Days is a relaxing sandbox game featuring a peaceful house with a warm and cozy fireplace at its heart.\n\nThrow chunky logs into the fireplace, light a few candles and enjoy the crunchy crackling of timber and the soothing dance of glowing tiny pixels as the midi based retro music plays in the background.\n\nCozy Days simply provides a calming hygge ambiance for relaxing, studying, reading, sleeping and meditating.\n\nYou can also organize the items in the house to create your personal space.\n\nBut most importantly, just sit back and enjoy!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2107,'Dungeons & Dragons: Dark Sun Series','2022-03-29','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unleash your imagination into a vast, savage world, sun-scorched and wind-scraped. This series contains the radiant classics, Dark Sun: Shattered Lands, and Dark Sun: Wake of the Ravager.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ho0.jpg'),(2108,'Fortnite: Chapter 5 - Season 3: Wrecked','2024-05-24','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ah, the wasteland… the possibilities seem as vast as the grains of sand. So vast that the “Wasteland Warriors” don’t want to give up control. This band of marauders brings a whole new meaning to scrappy crew — each one is an automobile expert who’ll tread on any rebellion. In Fortnite Battle Royale Chapter 5 Season 3: Wrecked, get in the driver’s seat and bring the Nitro to these vehicular villains!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co892h.jpg'),(2109,'Mighty Morphin Power Rangers: The Movie','1995-09-01','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','The Genesis version of Mighty Morphin Power Rangers: The Movie is a side-scrolling beat-\'em-up that can be played by up to two players, where the player can control both the Rangers themselves and their Zords (depending on the level). The game consists of six stages, with the first two stages and the final one covering events from the film, whereas Stage 3 to 5 are set before the events of the film and adapts key episodes from the TV show\'s second season (namely \"White Light\", \"Ninja Encounter\", and \"Power Transfer\"). The game\'s soundtrack, composed by Hikoshi Hashimoto, features hard rock arrangements of Ron Wasserman\'s original TV themes.\n\nThe game contains a total of nine rangers: Tommy, Adam, Kimberly, Billy, Aisha, Rocky, Zach, Trini, and Jason. When selecting Jason, Zach, and Trini, the voice clips of Adam, Aisha, and Rocky are heard when calling out their respective Zord name as their morphing command. The reason for this is because the original actors for them were released from contract after the events of the Power Transfer two-parter episode of Mighty Morphin\' Power Rangers. Sega and Banpresto asked for permission from Saban Entertainment to use their characters but have the three replacements use their voices instead of Jason, Trini, and Zach. There are cinematic scenes in digitized form that are abridged from the movie and some from Season 2 of the show. Lord Zedd, Goldar, the Putty Patrol, and Oozemen appear as sub-enemies. Nimrod the Scarlet Sentinel, AC, and DC are renamed in this title as Sentinel Neck, Sentinel Ear, and Sentinel Ring respectively. Players also can fight the Ecto-Morphicons using Ninja Megazord or Falcon Zord (both by 2-Player mode; Thunder Megazord and Mega Tigerzord against the Sentinels). Bulk and Skull also appear as cameos in the game\'s ending.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2by0.jpg'),(2110,'Home Survival','2024-07-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Home Survival is an open-world game that is a unique combination of first and third person shooter, survival, crafting, and role-playing games. Experience your own path. Whether it\'s building the home of your dreams, tending to your crops and watching the sun go down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5edf.jpg'),(2111,'Space Manifest',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore the realm of space banking, where strategic competition, intricate dynamics, and absolute profits define the landscape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97y1.jpg'),(2112,'Vividlope','2023-05-19','Platform, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Vividlope, the head-spinning, mind-bending arcade game with a puzzle touch! Master the imaginative realm, where the gravity doesn\'t quite work as you\'re used to, overcome your foes and keep on painting!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5y94.jpg'),(2113,'Cosmic Connection','2023-02-19','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In the distant future, teams of barely-qualified astronauts are sent out on a hail mary mission to find a habitable planet for humanity to migrate to.\n\nYour group is assigned to planet K2-288Bb orbiting a small star hundreds of lightyears out from our Solar System. Communication with Earth is impossible from this distance, so you have missions you must complete and then return to Earth with your findings.\n\nThe group dynamics go topsy-turvy when one of your crew members dies under mysterious circumstances. It\'s up to you to figure out who the culprit is and bring them to justice.\n\nWhat choices will you make? Who will you trust, if anyone? With six endings, plus a secret ending, the possibilities are expansive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85aj.jpg'),(2114,'Genshin Impact: Two Worlds Aflame, the Crimson Night Fades','2024-04-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Version 4.6 of Genshin Impact, which includes:\n• New character: Arlecchino\n• New story quests for Arlecchino and Cyno\n• New areas: Sea of Bygone Eras and Nostoi Region\n• New quality of life features\n• New main event: Iridescent Arataki Rockin\' For Life Tour de Force of Awesomeness\n• …and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84ir.jpg'),(2115,'Sunken Tower','2021-04-26','Platform, Indie','Web browser','Sunken Tower is a platforming roguelike where you descend deeper and deeper into a randomly generated tower that sunk beneath the ground, in an attempt to get your hands on the king\'s wealth. Wealth isn\'t the only goal however; you\'re also searching for the fellow explorers who are lost in the depths, who range from new playable characters to vendors that can appear in future runs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65ku.jpg'),(2116,'Sam & Max: Save the World','2009-06-17','Point-and-click, Adventure','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The characters can travel between a variety of locations in the game using their black and white 1960 DeSoto Adventurer, which, when selected, will present the player with a list of available destinations. The DeSoto is also used for several driving sequences, usually involving pursuing or fleeing criminals in other vehicles. In these driving sequences, the player can use Sam\'s gun, the car\'s horn, or have Max attempt to communicate with other vehicles via a megaphone. In addition, special inventory items may be used to complete specific puzzles within these sequences. Driving sequences are also used for several minigames, such as pulling innocent drivers over for fabricated felonies.\n\nIn keeping with the developer\'s heritage from the LucasArts adventure games, Sam & Max Save the World is designed so that the player characters cannot die or reach a complete dead-end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p6s.jpg'),(2117,'Jolly 2','2017-01-01','Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','After the closing of Freddy Fazbear\'s Pizza in 1985, the animatronics are being shipped as cargo to another location where it will hopefully be used for good.\n\nYou\'re guarding the cargo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nca.jpg'),(2118,'Rockman EXE The Medal Operation','2005-12-31','Sin género','Arcade','Rockman EXE: The Medal Operation is a medal arcade game from the Medalusion series released in 2005 only in Japan. This is the second medal game to the Rockman.EXE series, and is themed on Rockman.EXE 5. The player moves on a board that contains different panels, some with six types of mini games, battle games, and a bonus game, some of them including a fishing mini game and a \"Super Battle Game\" against Nebula Gray. There are three slots below the screen that are used for several parts of the game to make decisions by making medals fall around, and the slot a medal falls in will be the choice, which varies from which path the player will take and which hand he will use in a rock-paper-scissors mini game. Players can win prizes like medals (arcade tokens) or packs of milk chocolate by completing the games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fmhwnp5bzxke7jvxurn7.jpg'),(2119,'Son Son II','1989-02-27','Platform','TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','This platformer sequel to Son Son was only released on the PC Engine in Japan.\n\nSon Son 2 is the direct sequel to Son Son and features an interpretation of the Son Goku character from ancient Chinese novel Journey to the West. Unlike the first game, which played like a ground-based scrolling shoot-\'em-up with several floors the character could switch between, Son Son II plays much more like a traditional platformer, specifically Wonder Boy and even more overtly Capcom\'s earlier arcade game Black Tiger. Son Son attacks with his extendable staff (based on Sun Wukong\'s Ruyi Jingu Bang weapon) and can defeat enemies to earn coins, which can be spent on upgrades and health refills. The player also needs to find a key on each stage before they can reach the boss.\n\nThe goal of the game is to rescue the other members of his party: Xuanzang (Tripitaka), Pigsy and Sandy. They are kidnapped during the opening cutscene by the final boss, who is depicted as a mysterious silhouette.\n\nSon Son II is also one of the earliest Capcom games to use Zenny, their trademark fictional currency.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51vp.jpg'),(2120,'Sprocket','2021-08-26','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Carefully balance mobility, firepower and armour in a dedicated tank designer. Then uncarefully put them to the test in a series of combat scenarios progressing through the ages of the tank. Here, your limit is what you can fit inside your hull and turret while still being able to move forwards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nxi.jpg'),(2121,'Deadly Nightmare Unwanted Heritage','2024-01-15','Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Deadly Nightmare Unwanted Heritage brings you back to the nightmare world, where your mission it so try and break the curse before 6 AM. In the first Deadly Nightmare game, you played the role of John, but this time around you take the role of his grandmother. Surviving is not easy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fyf.jpg'),(2122,'Daemon 9','2018-10-31','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Daemon_9 is an experience that defies easy description. In pure gamer terms, it can be called a Full-Motion Video game; and an ARG (Alternate Reality Game). But in reality it is a new storytelling paradigm, part movie, part game, part augmented reality experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1h7w.jpg'),(2123,'Arcadie: Second-Born','2022-12-09','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this interactive tale of love and war, carve a place for yourself in a world that has disregarded you for too long. Be the force of reason that your kingdom needs, or perpetuate its reputation as a force of destruction. Find love and weave friendships, or cast it away for the sake of retribution.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vky.jpg'),(2124,'Peachy Derby','2024-10-25','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','This is a casual racing game where the girl Natsuki is forced to join the \"Ninja Racing Tournament\" to pay off her debt. Include 10 playable girls, 100 dances, 600 Japanese voices, 16 story chapters, and outerwear destruction system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jz6.jpg'),(2125,'Another Memories','1998-07-02','Adventure, Visual Novel, Card & Board Game','Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Another Memories is a simulation adventure game from the creators of Yūkyū Gensōkyoku, with a focus on managing schedules and relationships as well as card-based battles. The player controls Jeynus, deciding his schedule for each week, exploring the campus and city and speaking with other students, and going on expeditions fighting creatures. Different activities will increase his stats, trigger various events and lead to relationships with the various female students, and determine his prospects and the game\'s ending after two in-game years. Combat takes the form of a deck-building card game, where the player can construct a deck of cards consisting of both element cards and spell cards, using them in turn-based battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cdr.jpg'),(2126,'Sipher Odyssey','2024-03-08','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, iOS','Step into the sci-fi fantasy adventure of the world of Sipheria, Sipher Odyssey invites players into a matrix-like universe, vibrant animal characters, and a vast saga, offering the excitement of blasting through hordes of enemies with godlike abilities, crafted for the short form content TikTok generation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ygm.jpg'),(2127,'Korean Drone Flying Tour Ungdo','2025-04-10','Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','A simulation game where you directly operate a drone based on actual drone flight footage!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ksv.jpg'),(2128,'Alice\'s 1997','2018-12-19','Indie','Web browser','This small experimental narrative experience was made under 7 hours as a personal game and narrative design challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rrm.jpg'),(2129,'Spirit Valley','2024-10-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Spirit Valley is an erotic creature collecting game. Build your dream team and solve the mystery of Spirit Valley!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7px4.jpg'),(2130,'Trainz Railroad Simulator 2019 Pro Train - SD40-2 Loco Bundle 3','2024-03-13','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The EMD SD40-2 is a 3,000-horsepower (2,200 kW) C-C diesel-electric locomotive built by EMD from 1972 to 1989. Featuring multiple custom scripted features, PBR textures, and more, this pack includes BNSF H3, Canadian Pacific, CSX, Milwaukee Road and SLSF (Frisco) locos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co864h.jpg'),(2131,'Bunmei Kaika: Aoiza Ibunroku Saien','2012-05-17','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Remake with additional characters/events.\n\nMito Aoi is a normal high school student living in a shrine with her childhood friend, Kaminari Sousuke. One day her mother asks them to clean their warehouse, where they find a silver mirror among the other antique stuff. Just before they go out, a thunder strikes outside and Aoi gets absorbed into the mirror. When she opens her eyes Aoi finds herself back in 1873, the Meiji era... and in front of her is a group of travelling performers, Aoiza.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6no4.jpg'),(2132,'Mycorrhiza','2022-08-12','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Mycorrhiza is a love letter to horror manga in the form of a visual novel. Some of our biggest inspirations include the works of Junji Ito and Masaaki Nakayama.\n\nWhile Scott is trying to find a way back home, reality distorts and people’s morals start shifting in cruel and unexpected ways. A peculiar plant transforming animals, a horrifying comedy trend and a strange building trapping people. Each of the three arcs explores different terrors.\n\nAs you explore this terrifying world, you\'ll find out more and more about how and why Scott is trapped in it and what lead up to Scott being spirited away.\n\nThe game features a manga aesthetic with animated CGs and character art drawn by a manga artist, a focus on elaborate audio implementation, as well as an honest attempt to make the game accessible by providing visual audio cues and a dyslexic font option.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hyu.jpg'),(2133,'Baseball Megastar',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2134,'Samurai Warriors 4 DX','2019-03-14','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The sparks of destiny ignite in this rich depiction of the Warring States period that features a total of 55 different officers. The deluxe edition contains more than 150 previously released DLC from \"SAMURAI WARRIORS 4,\" including costumes, weapons, customization parts, scenarios, and BGM!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87ci.jpg'),(2135,'Harvest Moon: Boy & Girl','2007-07-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PlayStation Portable','This first release of Harvest Moon on the Sony PSP is a port of \"Harvest Moon: Back To Nature\" and \"Harvest Moon For Girl\", play either with a 4:3 or the new PSP 16:9 resolution. You can either play as a boy (Destiny), or a girl (Fate) to bring life to Mineral Town in this comfy farming stimulator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xku.jpg'),(2136,'Murder in the Maze','2024-07-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play as Mappy , as you go from game to game, looking for clues to solve the murder of Pac-Man!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8idv.jpg'),(2137,'Bunker Wars','2024-07-10','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical','Android, iOS','Bunker Wars: WW1 Strategy is a real-time strategy war game with multiplayer! Gather an army, participate in epic PVP battles, devise your own tactics for victory, and become the best in tower defense!\n\nIn the midst of a world war, defend your base from enemies and break through their defenses. Upgrade your bunkers and expand your territories by sending an army to capture strangers. Install towers and distribute troops to different targets.\nStrategize in every battle, bypass trenches, upgrade your base, and capture all enemy structures to win this epic RTS game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kfy.jpg'),(2138,'The Japanese Calligraphy','2024-11-07','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Japanese Calligraphy Simulator Game! Not only can you practice writing with a brush following examples, but you can also practice writing hiragana and katakana! Self-scoring kanji tests! Grateful sutra copying! Let\'s study Japanese!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co911r.jpg'),(2139,'Mikazuki: Hoshimeguri no Uta','2024-11-09','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is an epic search game in which you roam the vast, mysterious world of stars, like a dream, collect numerous tools, musical instruments, precious objects, and listen to stories from the inhabitants of the stars while searching for something you have lost.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9euz.jpg'),(2140,'Ominoflux','2024-10-23','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Clear lines, crush enemies, and save the realm of Ominoflux. Master the chaos and build your power in a roguelite adventure with multiple game modes. Ominoflux will surely make you think, and maybe even smile too.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9knp.jpg'),(2141,'Ski Rodeo','2017-07-14','Simulator, Sport','Arcade','\"Will you be able to manage skiing off impossible cliffs? \nSki down the sharp slopes of the vast snowy mountain with its sheer drops at tremendous speed!! \nFight for control of the wild skis! \nThe specialized sensory machine creates a shockingly real experience with the response of the skis and intense vibrations. \nThere are several different routes that will take you to the goal. Aim to reach it as fast as you can.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/avhkhyojujf0afbkwdj4.jpg'),(2142,'Kama Bullet Heritage','2017-07-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You play for Kama the younger, the son of Kama Bullet. Your father was killed by the Magician Lezgin, you must find and take revenge on Lezgin, your awaits an incredible journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2666.jpg'),(2143,'Love Story Games: Teenage Drama',NULL,'Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Love Story Games: Teenage Drama is an interactive story where you have to guide your character through her day to day life, where she\'ll find love thanks to your advice. Enjoy this fun teenage adventure where drama and amorous tragedy are the order of the day.\n\nIn this adventure you discover your personality by making decisions that will change your life in dozens of essential ways, turning you into one person or another and unfolding very different key paths based on your choices. Each small step you take will influence your feelings and you never know where you\'ll find love. You might fall for the hottest boy in your class who then rejects you or have to have a secret relationship you hide from all your friends. Think about how you feel and make the right decision based on your ideas.\n\nPick your own style in this adventure and start to discover all the future holds for you in your high school, family, friends, couples... everything that happens in Love Story Games: Teenage Drama can lead you in one direction or another. Recall that only your personality and your decisions will take you from one place to another, but you can start the adventure over again as often as you like, discovering what\'s happened in your life should you opt for a different path in a certain place. Move through the different life stages and discover the new world that opens in front of you in this fun graphic adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c7s.jpg'),(2144,'Arcade Nano Marshmallow','2010-11-01','Adventure','Plug & Play','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4slk.jpg'),(2145,'Boomerforge','2025-03-19','Platform, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Grimdur Stoneheart is an ex-adventurer dwarf, now the manager of the greatest forge on Bramblegate. Stories about a new mine full of ore started to circulate on the city and Grimdur himself decided to explore the mine, using only his trusty bombs to clear the path. Can the dwarf find the legendary ore to create the Ultime Weapon?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ktd.jpg'),(2146,'Hentai Mikky','2023-03-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hentai Mikky is a single player, mouse controlled, casual, adult puzzle game.\n\nThis is a Sliding block puzzle game. Images of a scantily clad or naked Mikky are cut into rectangular tiles and scrambled. The player\'s task is to restore the picture by sliding the pieces around until the picture is fully formed.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2147,'Lunar: Sanposuru Gakuen','1996-02-12','Role-playing (RPG)','Sega Game Gear','This is a side-story, set in the same world as the famous Lunar RPGs: Silver Star and Eternal Blue. The town of Burg is populated by harvesters, and you take control of two girls, Ellie and Lena. One day, they are sent to the island of Ien where they should study magic, and there begins their adventure.\n\nThe game is a traditional Japanese-style RPG. You navigate your party through a top-down world, visiting towns and hostile areas. Enemy encounters are random, the battles are turn-based and are viewed from first-person perspective.\n\nWhilst not officially released in English, there is now a completed fan-translation of this game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zeb.jpg'),(2148,'Better Letter',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iia.jpg'),(2149,'Canyon Bomber','1977-11-01','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','Canyon Bomber is a black-and-white 1978 arcade game, developed and published by Atari. The game was rewritten in color and with a different visual style for the Atari 2600, also in 1978. The player and an opponent fly a blimp or biplane over a canyon full of numbered, circular rocks, arranged in layers. The player does not control the flight of vehicles, but only presses a button to drop bombs which destroy rocks and give points. Each rock is labeled with the points given for destroying it. As the number of rocks is reduced, it becomes harder to hit them without missing. The third time a player drops a bomb without hitting a rock, the game is over.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31zo.jpg'),(2150,'Sushi Striker: The Way of Sushido','2018-06-07','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo 3DS, Nintendo Switch','\"The ultimate food fight!\n\nIn the fast-paced world of conveyor-belt sushi fighting, match colored plates and types of sushi to hurl tall stacks of plates at your opponent. The more matches you make, the taller the plate stack and the stronger your attacks will be. Defend your homeland from invading enemies in this puzzling action game so more people can enjoy delicious sushi in peace. May the best sushi samurai reign supreme!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ri4.jpg'),(2151,'Touhou Genso Wanderer: Lotus Labyrinth R - Lotus Friends','2021-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Venture into dungeons with a huge party of your favorite Touhou characters!\nThis is a dungeon-crawler RPG with an absurdly large party size!\nThe dungeon-crawler RPG Genso Wanderer is now a game with an Oversized Party System that pushes the envelope of the roguelike genre!\nNow you can bring dozens of partners with you on your dungeon crawls, in addition to other quality of life improvements that make the game\'s systems and controls smoother than ever.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s3f.jpg'),(2152,'Rothdam!','2011-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dungeon crawler RPG inspired by Wizardry and the Shin Megami Tensei series, among others. The game was made on RPG Maker 2000 and released originally in 2011 by Engawa. The story is set in a world ravaged by darkness where four adventurers (fully customizable, name, race protrait and job included) are tasked by the goddess Zofie to venture into the labyrinth carved into the great tree in order to restore order to the mortal realm.\n\nThe game features challenging gameplay with a classic-feeling battle system, speel charges rather than MP, and some first persona, tile-based, good old dungeon exploration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4njz.jpg'),(2153,'Murder on the Marine Express','2021-07-30','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Murder on the Marine Express is a visual novel game and the first installment of The Mysteries of Ranko Togawa series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4o2h.jpg'),(2154,'Zumba Fitness World Party','2013-11-05','Music, Sport','Wii, Wii U, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Take your work out to Brazil, Hawaii and beyond in this vibrant fitness journey packed with exotic rhythms and rich culture from around the world. Expand your horizons with 40+ high-energy routines, over 30 calorie-burning dance styles, and a red hot soundtrack featuring Lady Gaga, Pitbull, Daddy Yankee and more. Work your body as you set fitness goals, earn motivating rewards and dance with friends alongside your favorite celebrity Zumba instructors in the new World Tour mode. Transform your at home work out into a rockin\' global fitness-party with Zumba Fitness World Party!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p9v.jpg'),(2155,'The Mighty Quest for Epic Loot','2017-01-10','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Android, iOS','Raid the world of Opulencia by swiping your way to victory! Crush your enemies and grab some loot in this fast-paced action RPG. Start your quest with the humongous single-player campaign to earn limitless wealth, powerful gear and other sweet loot. Rise to the challenge of each area as the enemy hordes grow, and the bosses become ever-more hulking. On top of the main campaign, you can jump into the PVP Arena to prove your mettle against thousands of other players in The Mighty Quest For Epic Loot\'s Tournament. There is more, you can always try your hand at a feast of ever-changing, single-player, time-limited events that come stuffed with exclusive rewards, ensuring the loot keeps flowing!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dt4.jpg'),(2156,'Discovery Tour: Ancient Egypt','2018-02-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Discovery Tour: Ancient Egypt is an educational mode of the game Assassin\'s Creed Origins in which you can discover and explore the world free of conflict, or gameplay constraints.\n\nThe Discovery Tour allows you to roam freely in the beautiful world of Ptolemaic Egypt. Learn more about its life, habits and customs by yourself, or let historians and Egyptologists guide you on one of the 75 available historical tours they have curated.\n\nIt is available as a standalone or as part of Assassin\'s Creed: Origins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z4v.jpg'),(2157,'Two Guys One Cabin','2021-01-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The life of the old stalker Valera began to change radically after the young stalker Sanya stays with him overnight. Experience the incredibly dramatic adventure of two experienced stalker men.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co451h.jpg'),(2158,'Elements Cubed',NULL,'Fighting, Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Elements Cubed is a fast-paced bullet hell game where you REK Computer Viruses!\n\nRun, Dive, and Dodge through perilous enemy fire and retaliate using an assortment of digital skills & abilities!\n\nGo it alone, or play it with a friend in couch CO-OP Mayhem!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co606s.jpg'),(2159,'Arslan: The Warriors of Legend','2016-02-09','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','An exciting collaboration between The Heroic Legend of Arslan anime and the action-infused Warriors series!\nExperience the grand historical fantasy with Arslan: The Warriors of Legend!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5srd.jpg'),(2160,'Wildlife Planet: The Incremental','2022-08-26','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Wildlife Planet is a Simulation & Idle game with the theme of wildlife and nature. You will unlock more and more species as you level up and learn the species knowledge. This is a game with refreshing scenes, immersive background music, and different kinds of wild animals and plants.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5huf.jpg'),(2161,'Incursion Red River','2024-04-10','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Incursion Red River is a tactical first-person extraction shooter set in war-torn modern day Vietnam. Exclusively single-player and co-op gameplay! Customize your loadout, complete contracts & extract, or die trying!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qeb.jpg'),(2162,'Sunshine Love','2024-09-02','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Mac','You are an aspiring junior associate at a prestigious law firm, with hopes of one day becoming a trial lawyer, just like your current girlfriend of five years, Nicole.\nBut that dream has been put on hold the moment your sister calls you out of the blue, needing you to help her save her struggling hotel business and offering you a job down at Sunshine Bay during the summer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rv3.jpg'),(2163,'Nekketsu Renegade Kunio-kun','2013-04-03','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Family Computer, Wii U','Nekketsu Renegade Kunio-kun is the home console port of Nekketsu Kouha Kunio-kun for the Family Computer.\n\nThe game was first released as Nekketsu Kouha Kunio-kun, but has since been localized under the new title of Nekketsu Renegade Kunio-kun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i11.jpg'),(2164,'Ray Scramble',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2165,'Memento Mori 2','2014-04-02','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An award winning adventure crime thriller with a deeply plotted storyline which takes you to atmospheric settings all around the globe, including among other locations, South Africa, Finland and the USA. Three playable characters solve richly varied puzzles and tasks, where differing approaches have a direct effect on the outcome of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nsv.jpg'),(2166,'Trigger Witch','2021-07-29','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Trigger Witch is a 2D, twin-stick, action/adventure game set in an odd open world where magic is mundane, but firearms are the new unknown! You are Colette, and as you graduate from the Stock, a curious man invades your world...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gik.jpg'),(2167,'Chrono Quest','1988-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','Atari ST/STE, Atari 5200, DOS, Amiga','This is the first of a new generation of adventure games from Psygnosis. An adventure game in the classic sense.\n\nYour quest begins in your fathers chateau circa 1920. There you find (or should find) your father\'s latest invention: a fantastic time machine. Your father is dead, murdered, you are the prime suspect. A letter left by your father leads you to think the real culprit was Richard, his not so faithful servant. But he has escaped to the future using the time machine... who will believe your fantastic story... do you believe it?\n\nYou will be presented with many objectives: ultimately you will have to travel through time to collect the fragments of magnetic card to drive the Time Machine into the future. There you will have to... Meanwhile, the immediate objective is to find the time machine... Sorry, a more immediate objective is to find the room with the time machine in it. But its dark... Very sorry, an even more immediate objective is to be able to see where you are going... 3 hours and 250 minutes and even more immediate objectives later, you are standing in the hallway thinking... hellpppp!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ey7.jpg'),(2168,'Space Rocket - Star World',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2169,'Chamber',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Chamber, an entry for Ludum Dare 47, is an indie action-adventure horror game. Choose which rooms to add to a dangerous temple while exploring its secrets and trying to escape.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2170,'Waterside Chirping','2018-08-01','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Follow Aileen through this visual novel with multiple endings, as she tries to discover what happened to her after mysteriously falling asleep. Strange things are appearing around her, could it be due to the curse...?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lxv.jpg'),(2171,'Pixel Pirate','2022-03-18','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pxel Pirate - 2D-platformer about pirates, made in pixel art.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5khb.jpg'),(2172,'Ark Odyssey',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ark Odyssey is a top-down arcade shooter that lets you command an army of starships to fight against the force of void! Gather your fleet into formations, and build your team of evolving synergistic compositions. Order your army of Starforce through space and protect the cosmos!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lt4.jpg'),(2173,'Fantasy Tavern Sextet: Vol.1 New World Days','2020-12-14','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','It is an adventure game where you can enjoy a slapstick love harem play with laughter, tears, and a little H in a bar in a different world.\nThe \"E-mote\" engine that can move illustrations smoothly and three-dimensionally is used for standing pictures in the game.\nThe characters displayed on the screen move as if they were alive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tw4.jpg'),(2174,'Fish For Reel','2018-02-07','Indie','Android','Designed with fishing enthusiasts in mind, now you have the most popular hobby in your pocket. \nRookie or seasoned pro, there are hours of fun with outstanding graphics waiting for you. \nIt`s the addictive fishing game where you choose your gear, catch loads of fish and sell them for coins. \nCollect the coins and unlock exciting new items. More coins, more fun! \n \n \n-Discover a variety of freshwater and saltwater fish! \n-Unlock new Lands and get access to new fish species! \n-Visit the shop for the latest gear! \n-Experiment with your gear and catch more fish! \n \nUnlimited fishing! No gameplay restrictions! \n \nRelax, unwind and cast your troubles away sailing sky blue waters and catching amazing fish. \nTry it and you`ll be hooked!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/iyqnemkvst15jpcepuje.jpg'),(2175,'Hitogata Happa','2011-09-27','Shooter, Indie','PlayStation 3, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shoot \'em up with the 3rd game in the Gundemonium Collection series. Hitogata Happa is considered one of the hardest doujin style shooters ever! – Unlike the first two games, Hiitogata Happa is a vertical scrolling upward shooter, the action in this game is a visual mish-mash of weaponry that will give your senses a total overload. Threatened by an invading army who is terrorizing the land, Rosa enlisted the magic of a witch, Kreutzer – who has charmed her own army of magic dolls, each with extreme power and crazy weapons. Use these dolls to take revenge on the invaders as you blast through six, intense stages. Choose from twelve playable characters (four unlockable), each with their own special abilities, and unlock secret game features.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7edo.jpg'),(2176,'Spirit Charm','2024-06-03','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A few days ago, a woman named Li Wen committed suicide by throwing herself into a well. When everyone wanted to enter the house, there was a sudden lightning flash. A figure was seen standing outside the outfit. Is it the ghost of Li Wen? Or is there someone else?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g8p.jpg'),(2177,'Blobula',NULL,'Music, Simulator','Sin plataforma','Help the blob ecosystem stay alive. Once upon a time there was a blob ecosystem on your screen. Blobs have to eat other blobs to create more blobs. If the time is right blobs of the same color can breed. Each time a blob is created you get a point. If a color disappeared from the ecosystem the game is over. If a blob colony grows too large, it may catch a disease, and the population will collapse. Use the tools to help control the blobs ( if you can). You start off with just your finger, and then you’ll get some basic geometric shapes. As the game progresses you’ll get more tools. Bio weapons to spread disease. Nuclear bombs. Radiation that will mutate blob behavior, for better or worse, and your blobs will did off fast. Get wind to blow the blobs. Gravity and antigravity to push the blobs, black holes to suck the blobs away. The most powerful tool of all is love. Good luck.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2178,'Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 3 - Collection 1','2012-05-08','Shooter, Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Redeploying with an arsenal of content unlike any in franchise history, Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 3’s first downloadable “Collection” arrives stockpiled with not only four Multiplayer/Survival Mode Maps, but two Special Ops Missions—the first time Call of Duty has ever made Special Ops downloadable online.\n\nArmed with just this one content pack, players can choose between heading to a militarized Central Park in Liberation, destroying scenic vistas in a seaside Italian getaway in Piazza, raining glass on New York passersby from 70-stories-up in Overwatch, and battling beside a downed Air Force One in Black Box.\n\nAs if that breadth of multiplayer variety wasn’t enough, fans of Special Ops can hop aboard snowmobiles to infiltrate a diamond mine in Black Ice or head to India, where Negotiator will leave the fate of hostages in their hands.\n\nIn a class of its own with half-a-dozen forms of content, Modern Warfare 3’s first downloadable “Collection” offers a range of combat and co-op the likes of which has never been seen before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kdi.jpg'),(2179,'Legend 64',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Legend 64 is an adventure game, with N64-inspired visuals, where you fight ghosts and undead monsters. Your most precious possession is stolen after you become hopelessly lost inside a mysterious forest, and with nothing but your courage and determination, you embark on a quest to retrieve it. You won\'t be facing the spirit world alone, however, as you\'ve got a ghost friend to help you across your journey. Together with your companion, the wayward soul named Ember, the two of you must traverse the haunted depths of the demonic castle to recover what you\'ve both lost. Will you survive, or become another permanent resident?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xjf.jpg'),(2180,'Asteros',NULL,'Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Asteros is a Sci-Fi third person action rogue-like where intense gunfights and complex combat await. Sent to eliminate an unknown threat in a research facility on the titular planet, you\'ll encounter hostile forces and uncover hidden dangers as you fight to secure humanity\'s future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c1b.jpg'),(2181,'UFO: Aftermath','2009-11-26','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','UFO: Aftermath is the first in a three-game squad-based tactical strategy-RPG series clearly inspired by the original X-COM games, with similar themes and gameplay, but with its own post-apocalyptic horror spin on the concept. The game is rendered in isometric 3D.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cqd.jpg'),(2182,'Falcon City','2020-06-04','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the shoes of Kurt, a cynical rabbit detective, and fight crime in this retro style point and click adventure. Overcome scheming criminals, fat and lazy office workers and a shortsighted, doughnut-eating boss to solve the mystery of a kidnapped girl!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p2z.jpg'),(2183,'Pillars of Eternity: Hero Edition','2017-08-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Prepare to be enchanted by a world where the choices you make and the paths you choose shape your destiny. Obsidian Entertainment, the developer of Fallout: New Vegas and South Park: The Stick of Truth, together with Paradox Interactive is proud to present Pillars of Eternity.\n\nRecapture the deep sense of exploration, the joy of a pulsating adventure, and the thrill of leading your own band of companions across a new fantasy realm and into the depths of monster-infested dungeons in search of lost treasures and ancient mysteries.\n\nSo gather your party, venture forth, and embrace adventure as you delve into a realm of wonder, nostalgia, and the excitement of classic RPGs with Obsidian’s Pillars of Eternity! Play as any one of six races: Human, Aumaua, Dwarf, Elf, Godlike and Orlan. Utilize five core skills to overcome any situation: Stealth, Athletics, Lore, Mechanics and Survival. Sculpt your own story: Side with various factions using a reputation system, where your actions and choices have far reaching consequences. Explore a rich and diverse world: Beautiful pre-rendered environments laced with an engaging story and characters bring the world to life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x6r.jpg'),(2184,'Soccering','2020-08-06','Sport, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Soccering is a physics-based game where the objective is to control a sphere throughout the field and make the ball go inside of your opponent goal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41qm.jpg'),(2185,'Uno: The Call of Yara','2021-10-14','Sin género','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','UNO: The Call of Yara, the latest UNO DLC, is inspired by the exhilarating and liberating atmosphere of Yara! Plunge into the unique ambiance of the tropical paradise that is Yara before planning your next coup or whatever guerrillero stuff you have planned. Have you ever called a guerrilla icon to win an UNO game? Now you have!\nThis is UNO done the Yaran way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4041.jpg'),(2186,'Silent Hunter','1996-02-29','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Silent Hunter is a World War II U.S. Fleet Submarine Combat Simulator. As a commander of a U.S. submarine in the Pacific Theatre, from Pearl Harbor to the end of the war, you have a variety of submarines from which to choose and your task is simple, sink as much enemy tonnage as possible. One can play historical missions, hypothetical encounters or the career based campaign game. There are 9 patrol zones,from the Solomons to the Sea of Japan, and many coastal cities, ports and harbors to sneak into on either recon missions or to just sink ships tied up in port. As commander you may receive medals or commendations after especially successful or hazardous missions. Compare your tonnage and kill scores to those of actual commanders of the period and see if you can match up to the best.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qtfhhgpv5dzicqpuhxxq.jpg'),(2187,'Evil God Korone','2021-11-07','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','An unexpected collaboration from Tsugunohi, the game where horror invades daily life, and VTuber Inugami Korone, from VTuber group hololive. Inugami Korone, who has been live streaming many horror game, has become an evil goddess and taken over Tsugunohi. Now, chop your finger and give it to her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47rt.jpg'),(2188,'Imperiums: Rise of Caesar','2024-02-15','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Imperiums: Rise of Caesar follows the bold conquests of the great general in two linked scenarios, Gaul and the British Isles. It introduces several new mechanics such as weather, seasons, politics in Rome and others. Lead the Roman legions beyond the Alps test your tactical prowess to the limit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rvo.jpg'),(2189,'Super Rude Bear Resurrection','2017-05-05','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Super Rude Bear Resurrection is a super tight masocore platformer that anyone can beat! Every time you die your corpse stays behind – making the game easier. As your bodies pile up, you can use them as carpets, meatshields and paperweights until the game becomes as hard as you’re comfortable with – but if you’re good enough you never have to die at all.\n\nThe Rude Bear universe takes place in a fantasy British grime world, with grafitti skylines and a grime soundtrack produced by Deeco.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qmlhqscczmdsac8rt2ff.jpg'),(2190,'Chordosis','2023-09-15','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chordosis invites you to experience a unique cosmic survival sci-fi horror game centered around alien abductions. Immerse yourself in the small village of Dunahont, Hungary, and uncover its chilling mysteries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co737s.jpg');
INSERT INTO `games` VALUES (2191,'Valkyria Chronicles 4: Memoirs From Battle Edition','2018-09-25','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A Continent Engulfed in the Bitter Flames of War! Valkyria Chronicles 4 takes place in the same timeframe as the original Valkyria Chronicles, but focuses on Squad E of the Federation. Commander Claude Wallace and his childhood friends set out to fight for freedom in this desperate war, but bone-chilling blizzards, waves of imperial soldiers, and the godlike powers of the Valkyria stand between them and victory.\n\nMemoirs From Battle Edition includes:\n- A 100-page artbook modeled after Squad-E commander Claude Wallace\'s in-game journal\n- A Hafen tank vinyl statue\n- 2 add-on missions featuring Squad 7\n- A Ragnarok controller skin\n- A collector\'s edition box','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ga9.jpg'),(2192,'Black Mesa: Blue Shift','2021-12-01','Shooter','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Initially developed and released by Gearbox Software in 2001, second Half-Life add-on, Half-Life: Blue Shift is a return to the Black Mesa Research Facility and another look at the Incident\'s consequences from the eyes of Gordon Freeman\'s best friend - Barney Calhoun. In 2012, Crowbar Collective has delighted Half-Life fans with release of the magnificent Half-Life remake, but there are still no released remakes for add-ons. This is when they are coming in - HECU Collective are developing the Black Mesa: Blue Shift - a free remake with use of Black Mesa resources and style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93my.jpg'),(2193,'Crypto Raiders',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Tactical','Web browser','Raid dungeons, earn gear, and level up. Crypto Raiders is an NFT-based dungeon crawler on the Polygon network with a goal of being the biggest MMORPG NFT Game.\n\nGo on quests, fight MOBs, do PvP, and more. Start your adventure today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mqn.jpg'),(2194,'One Piece: Super Grand Battle! X','2014-11-13','Fighting','Nintendo 3DS','After almost a decade of absence, One Piece\'s Grand Battle sub-series returns with a new game for the Nintendo 3DS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ves.jpg'),(2195,'Rhythm Bang','2024-06-11','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rhythm based aiming game focused around hard electronic music. Aim the blaster with your mouse as it blasts rhythmically to the music, and aim at the falling blocks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wio.jpg'),(2196,'Smart City Plan','2020-03-06','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Smart City Plan is a modern city builder game: Plan zones, roads, public transport like trains, trams, buses, subways and even the hypertube. Set taxes and policies and implement smart city technologies. Generate a sustainable city and take care of your citizens.\n\nStart by creating a few roads and specify zones where your citizens can start building their homes, shops and companies. Once everything runs fine, your can start expanding your city. Extend it by providing public transport for your citizens and implement policies. Ensure everything is taken care for: Pollution, noise, crime, waste, water, energy and so on. Your assistant will help you by guiding your through the process of doing all this easily.\n\nThe game is running in real-time, but can be accelerated and paused at any time. Manage policies, track financial data, analyze problems in your city. Expand the city when you have figured out how everything works and manage the public transport system, and build new infrastructure buildings, stations, rails, hypertube tracks, bridges, or even space ports.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qat.jpg'),(2197,'Jungo','2007-12-31','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Chase the Cheetah rescue his jungle friends in this unique and colorful puzzler.\n\nThe villainous vulture Vargas has unleashed a shadowy spell and trapped all the animals in bright bubbles. Using cat-like reflexes and a keen eye for color, arrange the colored bubbles into matching groups to free the captive creatures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6srg.jpg'),(2198,'Super Bust-A-Move All Stars','2003-09-05','Puzzle','Nintendo GameCube','The legendary Super Bust a Move is has arrived on the GameCube with 5 challenging modes to test your skills, including the new 4 player mode','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6uez.jpg'),(2199,'Short Memories','2024-10-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A short story about life shared through the conversation of two women sitting on a bench.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ol5.jpg'),(2200,'Gloom and Doom','2022-07-19','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Gloom and Doom is a visual novel throwback to 90s slacker movies - complete with the solitude and sarcastic retorts - but with a supernatural twist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2of4.jpg'),(2201,'Pokémon Comet','2024-08-03','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hdw.jpg'),(2202,'Wet Girl','2019-01-30','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a unique first-person spray game. Take a water gun and spray the hot dancing girls, and wet their clothes completely, and then you win. When you see their angry expressions and hear their quick panting, don\'t stop spraying for the sake of your pity on them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jod.jpg'),(2203,'Demonsomnia','2024-08-13','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Demonsomnia is a CO-OP horror video game developed and published by Woziva on Steam. It is a 4-player online CO-OP horror game about the impact of post-nuclear reaction. Radiation spread all over, put on your gas mask and go to the forest, collect the objects, and return to the mansion. Your goal is to gather evidence with equipment and hunt down the ghost.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qza.jpg'),(2204,'Tarragona 4: Devil\'s Lair','2001-05-07','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Devil\'s Lair is a bonus level for the previous one. Does the Devil still live near the bridge? May be Lara will find him at home! Enjoy this 167 room level and see how is the hell! If the previous level do not had too many enemies (I do not like the free violence), in this one there are some, do not hesitate to shot them: They are not longer human, they are Wraiths! If you see them do some strange things like walk over lava, some time they do it, do not worry, it is not a Bug, they are not humans and they can do things that Lara can\'t do it. If you do not help them (with the weapons) to leave their actual existence, there system can slow down and additionally you will not find some pieces that they give you before disappear!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rp6.jpg'),(2205,'Princess Maker 5 Portable','2008-09-25','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','A port of Princess Maker 5 for PlayStation Portable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vuw.jpg'),(2206,'The Longest Journey','2014-11-27','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','The Longest Journey is an amazing graphical adventure, where the player controls the protagonist, April Ryan, on her journey between parallel universes. Embark on an exciting and original journey of discovery, where you will explore, solve puzzles, meet new people, face terrifying monsters, learn, grow, and live the adventure of a lifetime!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vwq.jpg'),(2207,'Tiger Soldier I: MP069',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Tiger Soldier is a military-themed run & gun shooter game. Playing as a lone soldier, first by fighting off infantry units and battling tanks then lob a hand grenade into the enemy\'s fort. Destroy the enemy\'s fort to clear game. The DLC include mission pack 069.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2208,'Tomscape','2018-05-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An online role-playing game in which you slap rats, frogs, and other players to become the coolest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21y4.jpg'),(2209,'Spitkiss','2018-11-06','Platform, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Spitkiss is a trippy story of boundless and unconventional love, told through precision platforming.You play as the spitkissers, sending messages of love and hope back and forth the only way you can: precisely navigating spitballs through a variety of carefully crafted platforming stages. For those truly dedicated to the cause of love there will be extra challenges and additional ways to play each level.\n\nThe game includes themes of polyamory and genderfluid/non-binary identities on two layers. One story takes place in the metanarrative of the spitkissers, the other in the hand-drawn story of the life of Ymer, the person whose body their story takes place inside.\n\nFeaturing 80 levels with many hidden extras and replayable modes on release.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co296h.jpg'),(2210,'Groove Coaster 2 Original Style','2015-07-01','Music, Arcade','Android, iOS','The award-winning Groove Coaster with its unique gameplay and multiple awards from all over the world has been upgraded with the new Original Style where you can use your surroundings as instruments to play the game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6090.jpg'),(2211,'Zero to Death',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83ju.jpg'),(2212,'UFO Swamp Odyssey','2020-05-25','Platform, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A short atmospheric platformer with metroidvania elements made in 10 days as a game jam entry for RNDGAME 2020.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5b8t.jpg'),(2213,'Tentacles Growing Everywhere','2015-05-15','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Puberty is weird and awkward, especially when you happen to be a tentacled space alien! \n \nIn this incredibly queer mashup of Judy Blume, Babysitters Club, and pulpy sci-fi, join three childhood friends -- Charlie, Jace, and Valentine -- as they write to each other in their online journals about going to new schools, fitting in, crushing on cuties, dealing with adults who just don\'t understand, and of course, all those bizarre new changes taking place in their bodies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wpq.jpg'),(2214,'Wasteland 2: Director\'s Cut - Digital Deluxe Edition','2014-09-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Digital Deluxe Edition includes GOG.com codes for Wasteland 1: The Original Classic and The Bard\'s Tale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h54.jpg'),(2215,'Microsoft Flight Simulator X: Steam Edition - Boeing-Vertol CH-47D Chinook','2016-11-08','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Boeing-Vertol CH-47 Chinook is a versatile, twin-engine, tandem rotor heavy-lift helicopter. Boasting top speeds of 170 knots (196 mph, 315 km/h), the Chinook was faster than contemporary utility and attack helicopters when it was introduced in the 1960s.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85u5.jpg'),(2216,'Make Me LAG','2020-03-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Make Me LAG is the first game that features a revolutionary new control scheme: your character actions are determined by the game FPS! Use external softwares and other tricks to lower the FPS count and control your character to defeat evil monsters and save the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20ha.jpg'),(2217,'Warframe: Cumulus Collection','2023-12-18','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Amplify your Arsenal\'s flair with the extravagant Cumulus Collection. Become the envy of your enemies and fellow Tenno alike with the stunning Cirrus Armor Bundle, Cumulus Syandana, Stratus Pistol Skin and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99o4.jpg'),(2218,'Wizard with a Gun: Bounty Hunter Pack','2024-03-07','Adventure, Indie','Xbox One','The Wizard With a Gun Bounty Hunter Pack includes the recipes for Musketeer, Barbarian, and Potionmaker\'s outfits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co886j.jpg'),(2219,'DCS World: Mi-8MTV2 and Ka-50: Memory of a Hero Campaign by Stone Sky','2018-09-26','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Memory of the Hero campaign follows the story of helicopter pilot Sergey Pavlovich Borisov. Being an honored sniper and research helicopter pilot and a hero of the Soviet Union and Russia, this campaign explores his experiences in the Mi-8MTV2 and the Ka-50 Black Shark. The campaign is full of danger and exciting moments as you relive some of his more harrowing experiences!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95vk.jpg'),(2220,'Video Pinball','1980-12-31','Simulator, Pinball, Arcade','Atari 2600','Video Pinball is a loose simulation of an arcade pinball machine: ball launcher, flippers, bumpers, and spinners.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31zy.jpg'),(2221,'Yoga Master: Magic Atmosphere Bundle','2020-09-15','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2222,'Harem Girl: Samantha',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Enjoy some sexy puzzle action in this relax-alot, \'one handed\' puzzle game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qzq.jpg'),(2223,'Ricochet Infinity','2010-08-28','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Ricochet around the Galaxy in this dynamically brilliant breakout action game! Trek across 216 awesome levels, with thousands more online, earning new ranks in the Galactic Tournament, by yourself or with a friend. Play the re-energized Ring Game, winning new balls and ships with unique specialties to give you the edge! Control your ball with the wildly innovative Recall feature...once you’ve tried it, you can’t go back! Travel to the stars and beyond in your glorious quest to become the Ringmaster Grand Champion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gi3.jpg'),(2224,'Wedding Salon',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o3z.jpg'),(2225,'Induction','2021-07-14','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Induction is an abstract puzzle game about time travel and paradoxes. As you master its logic, Induction will rewire how you think about cause and effect.\n\nAcross more than 50 meticulously designed puzzles, you must explore the counter-intuitive possibilities time travel permits. You will learn to choreograph your actions across multiple timelines, and to construct seemingly impossible solutions, such as paradoxical time loops, where the future depends on the past and the past depends on the future.\n\nEach puzzle is crafted to reveal a unique aspect of the game’s elegant yet exacting internal logic, gently guiding you into realising the potential of your powers. Induction does not pander, but gives you the satisfaction of mastering an imaginary yet honest set of physical laws.\n\nAccompanying Induction’s minimalist visuals is a rich and responsive ambient soundtrack by Melbourne-based electronic composer and radio broadcaster Tim Shiel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ect.jpg'),(2226,'XBlaze Code: Embryo','2013-07-25','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','Xblaze Code: Embryo is a Japanese visual novel and the prequel to the fighting game series BlazBlue. The game is set 150 years before the events in BlazBlue: Calamity Trigger. The player assumes the role of Toya Kagari, a resident of Shin Yokozaki City and a sophomore at the prestigious Hakuou North Academy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tzh.jpg'),(2227,'Devil\'s Dream',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','In Devils\'s Dream you play as James, a student which want to examine an abandoned place. He and his girlfriend Sophie drove in the late of the Night to the place and get what they hadn\'t expected. Try to Survive Night. and dont forgot you cannot hide or run from him.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ojw.jpg'),(2228,'Heroes Never Die','2017-07-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Heroes Never Die is a Next-Gen shooting game designed by Frostbite Games. Both traditional mode and VR mode are available in the game. Not as other shooting games, players should save ammo and time. Try to find time bonus and possible strategy to achieve high score. Many heroes can be used and every stage is worth to explore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bln.jpg'),(2229,'Harbinger','2024-10-03','Fighting, Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Harbinger brings the chaos of \'90s boomer shooters into the modern era. Carve your way through waves of enemies in brutal combat arenas and regroup at the tavern to upgrade your arsenal. Enter the Harbinger Realm and leave nothing in your wake!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8r5b.jpg'),(2230,'Corruption Catharsis: Try To Act Normal','2023-06-26','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The ranger has been called to Ranger Station Theta as a precaution as scientists there have reported an anomaly with their slip-tech that would indicate a malevolant force has been trying to exploit the station. They could get a handle on the slip gate interdimensional array and use it as a back-door that would allow them to take control of some of Earth\'s remote facilities. Your breifing was to investigate the disturbance and eradicate any compromised forces or opposition that you encounter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77zy.jpg'),(2231,'Stuck Inside','2022-03-02','Platform','Web browser','A short platforming game about anxiety.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bmw.jpg'),(2232,'Quicksand',NULL,'Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Quicksand is a hardcore third-person shooter game that takes you on a thrilling journey through the heart of the Middle East with 26 well designed levels. Set in a war-torn region, the game combines intense action, strategic gameplay, and a gripping storyline to create an unforgettable experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zhp.jpg'),(2233,'Soltys','1995-05-23','Point-and-click, Adventure','DOS','(In)famous for jokes about it, the Polish city of Wąchock is the place where the story of the Polish adventure game Sołtys takes place.\n\nYou play the head of the village of Wąchock and your aim is to find the missing husband of your daughter (who apparently isn\'t very attractive if you know what I mean). Scared of his future, Leon decides to run away from the wedding and you are responsible for bringing this poor guy back.\n\nThe game is a classic point and click adventure in which you collect objects and find places to use them. You move from one location to another using special \"location icons\". Number of available locations to visit represents the game\'s progress. At first there are only eight of them and later on they increase to total number of 24. The game is full of Polish jokes and \"play on words\" technique to give player hints how riddles should be solved.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zxp.jpg'),(2234,'The Matrix: Awakens - An Unreal Engine 5 Experience','2021-12-06','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5','The Matrix: Awakens morphs from breathtakingly realistic cinematic to fast-paced third-person shooter experience, complete with action-packed car chase sequence, and also provides a rich, vastly detailed open world to explore, set within the universe of \'The Matrix\'.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4abs.jpg'),(2235,'Break a Leg','2024-07-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Break a Leg is a series done over YouTube shorts where the top comment got the next addition to the game. Break a Leg is a game where your primary goal is to break your leg. Once you do, you did it. You won. Therefore, there\'s no more reason to keep playing this game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8etm.jpg'),(2236,'Marvel Super Heroes vs. Street Fighter','1997-08-27','Fighting, Arcade','Arcade, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Now you can choose your favorite heroes from the worlds of Street Fighter and Marvel Super Heroes to face off in a head-to-head battle for supremacy. Dive into the action to perform outrageous moves and link together amazing Chain Combos... then delight in their devastating results! Marvel Super Heroes vs. Street Fighter combines two incredible universes to create an entirely new legend of heroic proportions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8iho.jpg'),(2237,'Mysterious warrior','2021-08-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mysterious warrior - Introduces a 2D action platformer adventure. You have to play as a mystical warrior, carry out the orders of the servants of the deity and destroy the evil spirits that have infected this world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nul.jpg'),(2238,'Kuroinu 2 Redux','2023-11-06','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As the Nation faces invasion from the peoples it has pillaged for a century, one man defends it: Derek Rondo, the second coming of the Mercenary King Vult. He fights for his country, but plots to seize the throne for himself... A new visual novel betrayal epic begins from within!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yc3.jpg'),(2239,'Nature Picross','2025-03-27','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nature Picross is a puzzle game where you use logic and deduction to create pictures themed around nature. Solve 100 satisfying pixel art puzzles, and continue playing with randomly generated puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l6u.jpg'),(2240,'Top Jump',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Top Jump, an exhilarating and addictive game that will test your speed, agility, and strategic thinking! Race against other players in a thrilling vertical challenge, as you strive to reach the summit of a treacherous cave and secure your position on the leaderboard. Can you conquer the heights and claim the top spot?\n\nIn Top Jump, your primary objective is to ascend the cave as quickly as possible. Leap from platform to platform, avoiding obstacles and deadly traps, all while maintaining a lightning-fast pace. Precision and timing are crucial as you navigate through the ever-changing environment, filled with pitfalls and hurdles that can hinder your progress.\n\nWhat sets Top Jump apart is the ability to manipulate time. In the infinite training mode, you have the power to rewind time endlessly, enabling you to perfect your strategies, explore alternative routes, and enhance your skills. However, in the competitive ranked mode, time manipulation is limited and can only be used sparingly during each run. Be strategic in deciding when to activate this feature, as every instance will cost you valuable seconds, potentially affecting your chances of climbing the leaderboard.\n\nAre you ready to embark on the ultimate climbing challenge? Put your jumping skills to the test in Top Jump and prove that you have what it takes to reach the summit and become the reigning champion of the leaderboard!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qej.jpg'),(2241,'Content Warning: Scary Filming','2025-03-13','Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Film the fright, survive the night!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l1l.jpg'),(2242,'Forgotten Playland','2024-11-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Forgotten Playland is a free-to-play, social party game that takes place in the quiet solitude of a long-forgotten and abandoned house, where a whimsical world unfolds.\n\nWithin the dusty rooms and forgotten corners of time, an enchanting realm comes to life as the once-discarded toys left by their owners embark on a magical journey of their own.\n\nWelcome to Forgotten Playland, a realm where the PlushKyns breathe life into a world of games and adventures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x9j.jpg'),(2243,'Wagyan Land 3','1992-12-08','Platform, Adventure','Family Computer','Wagyan Land 3 is an Action game, developed and published by Namco, which was released in Japan in 1992.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4x53.jpg'),(2244,'My Baby: First Steps','2009-11-11','Simulator','Wii','Teach your Baby to Walk, Talk, and Play!\n\nYour baby has grown so fast! Can you believe that a year has already gone by? Take care of your baby from their 1st birthday until they\'re 3 years old. Your baby will discover its entire environment and learn from it, they\'ll walk, babble and speak, try to catch every object they can, and put everything in their mouth... Your baby will be the apple of your eye!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co927h.jpg'),(2245,'SoulPactum','2025-04-30','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SoulPactum is a brutal 2D platformer where every wrong jump ends in failure. Precise timing and patience are the keys to finally making it through the deadly levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rsg.jpg'),(2246,'Monsty Corp',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A story based, puzzle game, Monsty Corp will have you exploring the facility known as “Monsty Corp”, an advanced science facility closed down due to strange occurrences.\n\nIt\'s a race against time to save yourself and possibly the world from an evil AI named SAIC (Sentient Artificial and Intelligent Consciousness). Will you stop it? Or will it keep you captive forever, only time will tell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81je.jpg'),(2247,'Slender Space','2013-02-27','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slender Space is a small indie game created by Ricky Murray (AKA RickkMurray), with the help of Pete Levonpera. It’s based off Slender: The Eight Pages and the Dead Space series. The game features, in-game cinematic as well as creepy sound design and jump scares.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aeq.jpg'),(2248,'H1Z1','2015-01-15','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Offering a total sandbox experience, H1Z1 is a zombie survival MMO set in a post-apocalyptic world where thousands of players must strategically align with friends and against enemies in order to survive the worldwide infection.\n\nDaybreak Games announced in early 2016 that H1Z1 has been split into two games: H1Z1: King of the Kill & H1Z1: Just Survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dbbk2orfn55d5xnd6yxo.jpg'),(2249,'StarBoost',NULL,'Racing, Indie','Sin plataforma','Test your skill and reaction speed in this action-packed sci-fi racer with breathtaking scenery. Boost, strafe, survive! Race alone or against opponents and unlock racers, power-ups, and new tracks through high scores.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7suy.jpg'),(2250,'Is This Game Trying to Kill Me?','2025-04-04','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','An old shack deep in a dense forest, a strange computer and a game that\'s trying to kill you!\n\nIs this Game Trying to Kill Me? - it is a mix of horror and first-person puzzle. You are trapped inside a cabin deep in the forest, and its owner offers to play a computer game in exchange for freedom. But the cabin and the game are much more connected than you might think. Traps from the game begin to appear in reality, and your actions in the cabin affect the computer game. And very soon you realize that the stake in this game is your life!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8app.jpg'),(2251,'Grimhook','2023-12-09','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Descend into Grimhook\'s sunken ruins as Dart, mastering Lovecraftian powers. Bounce, dash, and grapple through flooded caverns, confronting robotic foes in this fast-paced first-person action platformer. Explore, battle, and unravel the mysteries below Miletos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mpk.jpg'),(2252,'Black Witchcraft',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Lady Ligeia, the legendary and magnificent witch, welcome to the House of Usher. Roderick Usher is scheming to resurrect the wicked witch Lenore. We are in dire need of your great Machina magic. Please save us.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mcb.jpg'),(2253,'My Little Prince: A Jigsaw Puzzle Tale','2023-03-16','Puzzle, Strategy, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','“But eyes are blind. You have to look with the heart.” A jigsaw puzzle game to remember a beloved classic story. Contains illustrations created by Katia Numakura with inspiration from “The Little Prince” by Antoine de Saint-Exupéry, and from RPGs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pjg.jpg'),(2254,'Citywars Tower Defense','2022-03-04','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Citywars Tower Defense is a mix between a survival game and a tower defense. Craft your tools, gather resources to build your towers, fight incoming monsters, level up your weapons each with unique skill trees, enchant your armor and play with your friends coop or split screen and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ho1.jpg'),(2255,'Little Noah: Scion of Paradise - Avatar, Lilliput, and Accessory Pack','2022-08-09','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','The contents of the Little Noah: Scion of Paradise DLC 1: Avatar, Lilliput, and Accessory Pack are as follows.\n\nAvatars\nTalk to the Champion on the airship with the \"Avatars\" speech bubble over her head to change to one of these new avatars.\n1. Gourmet Guild Princess Noah\n2. White Mage Noah\n\nLilliputs\nThese Lilliputs appear at random in the ruins. Enlist their aid and expand your repertoire!\n1. Halvor\n2. Pirate King Kidd\n3. Goddess Amelie\n\nAccessories\nThese accessories appear at random in the ruins.\n1. Conflagrant Regalia\n2. Crystalline Regalia\n3. Fulminous Regalia\n4. Master Merchant\'s Turban\n5. Trusty Piggy Bank','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2256,'Catty & Batty: The Spirit Guide','2021-10-13','Music, Puzzle, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Cooperatively build a path to guide spirits home!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t0n.jpg'),(2257,'Kitty Powers\' Matchmaker: Deluxe Edition','2020-02-06','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Match an endless parade of desperate clients with candidates from Kitty’s little black book and guide them through awkward conversations and dozens of perilous dating dilemmas. As your reputation grows you’ll unlock new date venues, more demanding clientele and upgrades for your agency. Send your hopefuls out with the right look and perfect gift to maximise their chance of finding love. Are you ready to bring romance to the world? Or will you leave a sea of broken hearts in your wake? In this deluxe edition, there\'s more dating dilemmas for you to help your clients navigate. Customers will also be sporting new looks! Snazzy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4doe.jpg'),(2258,'Pixel Cross Stitch: Valentine\'s Day Pack','2025-02-06','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','10 free images to color by number or cross stitch','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2259,'Cogmount','2024-05-08','Sin género','Web browser','We tested making the boxes round, and wacky stuff happened','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2260,'Point Blank','2008-10-17','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Point Blank is a fast-paced online first-person shooter, where players join either the Free Rebels or CT-Force team (the Free Rebels are based on the Terrorists from Counter-Strike, while CT-Force is based on the Counter-Terrorists). Each team attempts to complete their mission objective and/or eliminate the opposing team. Each round starts with the two teams spawning simultaneously, usually at opposite ends of the map from each other.\n\nA player can choose to play as one of four different default character models (Acid and Keen Eyes for CT-Force, and Red Bull and Tarantula for the Free Rebels). There are four purchasable deluxe character models: Fennec and Pit Viper for CT-Force or Cheshire and Shadow for the Free Rebels. Players are generally given a few seconds before the round begins, or before respawning, to change weapons and/or equipment.\n\nGame points and experience are awarded for winning a round, losing a round, killing enemies, and completing mini missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wph.jpg'),(2261,'Exovia','2026-12-31','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Exovia is a relaxing physics-based asteroid mining and logistics sim. Move minerals, automate production, and explore deeper into the unknown. What begins as a cold, chaotic rock becomes a thriving machine under your command.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rwd.jpg'),(2262,'Werewolves Revenge',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Werewolves Revenge is a social deduction game where your voice is your greatest weapon. Played by up to 16 Players, games are filled with deceit, murder and twists.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hgy.jpg'),(2263,'Battlefield Online','2010-03-25','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A free to play version of Battlefield 2 and Battlefield 2142 and released specifically for the South Korean market by Neowiz Games, EA and DICE.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rt5.jpg'),(2264,'Re:Touring','2024-03-29','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Re:Touring is a first-person puzzle game in which you\'ll explore the abandoned Luoni Energy Competence Center and uncover the facility\'s history, navigating through a total of 26 varied levels. Using a retro-style computer, you\'ll create color patterns to control elements such as doors, platforms and lasers. Each mechanism is carefully introduced to make the game accessible to everyone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mcv.jpg'),(2265,'Strategic Command: American Civil War','2022-07-14','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','For the first time in the series’ history, Strategic Command will be taking you to the 19th century battlefields of the American Civil War. In this turn-based strategy game, you will control the armies, research, production and diplomatic policy of either the Union or the Confederacy during a time of great innovation and dramatic battles. Your decisions will determine whether the United States leaves this conflict as one nation or two.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4va7.jpg'),(2266,'Tears of Themis','2021-07-29','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','As a new attorney at law, how will you solve a series of mysterious cases? Which of the four unique male leads is your destiny?\n\nThe player is a rookie attorney in the city of Stellis, working hard at a law firm under the careful eye of her mentor. After proving herself through a series of cases, her mentor invites her to join a special taskforce designated with investigation into a series of mysterious crimes related to tampering with an individual\'s mental state. The mysteries they unravel as well as the relationships formed between the player and the rest of the team form the emotional core of the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lmp.jpg'),(2267,'Mayban','2024-03-27','Sin género','Web browser','We\'ve been informed of the existence of colours. This is very troubling.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2268,'Yandere: Love & Madness',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yandere: Love & Madness is a psychological thriller and action game developed by Gemora Studios. Set in a world of intrigue and obsession, the player will take on the role of a young woman with a dangerous devotion to her beloved. With mechanics inspired by the life simulation genre, the game will offer a deep narrative experience, where the player\'s moral choices and actions can lead to unpredictable consequences.\n\nThrough a carefully designehttps://, Yandere: Love & Madness will combine exploration, stealth, and psychological horror elements. Players must navigate the school and its surroundings, managing social relationships while struggling with the dark side of obsession. The game will offer immersive gameplay, with intense interactions, events triggered by the protagonist\'s behavior, and a focus on manipulation and control.\n\nWith a unique visual style and a deep narrative that explores themes of toxic love and madness, Yandere: Love & Madness will challenge players to question how far they\'re willing to go for love and what the line between passion and obsession truly means.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2269,'Project Kyzen','2024-08-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Project Kyzen is a casual, multiplayer game in which players will have the choice to compete against each other in several different mini-games. Users can craft\nunique avatars and explore the Kyzen universe.\n\nProject Kyzen will be developed in phases throughout its lifetime in which players will be able to provide feedback to create the ultimate immersive experience in gaming.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qtb.jpg'),(2270,'Metori','2019-04-03','Shooter, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Strategize, build, and upgrade your fleet to defeat your enemies. All filtered through the design of classic arcade games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jea.jpg'),(2271,'Disposable Heroes','2015-10-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Meet the disposable heroes... A rag-tag band of nobodies who - quite by accident- represent the kingdom\'s last hope. With the royal army slain it is they who must venture across the land on a quest to bring back the head of the king\'s son so that the light might return.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ycx.jpg'),(2272,'AnderKant 4','2025-04-11','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The 4th in the series. Discover more enhanced Visuals and great Music while you move through 7 different universes of your choosing in a fully 3D immersive first-person experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o93.jpg'),(2273,'Erotic Rhythm','2024-10-14','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Erotic Rhythm is a music game that will leave you wanting more, just hit the notes accurately and the girl will swing her body to the music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nwf.jpg'),(2274,'Broken Ceiling','2024-10-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Broken Ceiling is a hand drawn, 2D, top-down eldritch horror adventure video game. Set in deep dark caverns the main mechanic is the light field around the character that needs to be repeatedly recharged to be able to explore the secrets of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cf4.jpg'),(2275,'Covemouth','2024-12-05','Sin género','Web browser','We\'ve run out of funds so Covemonty will have to find their own meals for a while','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2276,'Supreme Ruler 2020: Gold Edition','2008-06-17','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Supreme Ruler 2020 Gold contains Supreme Ruler 2020 and the expansion, Global Crisis.\n\nSupreme Ruler 2020\nOvernight, the US dollar crashes and the sound echoes across the globe. The economic crisis amplifies global instabilities and regional disputes, tearing the world asunder. Nations dissolve, economies collapse, and tensions escalate. Anarchy reigns supreme. The world needs a leader.\n\nSupreme Ruler 2020: Global Crisis\nAt the core of the expansion pack a whole new sandbox style campaign paints a new and far more intricate portrayal of the world of 2020 based on many of the ominous events from recent real-world headlines. The possibilities to change the underlying storyline for new play experiences are limitless.\nSophisticated strategic & tactical military command system.\nSelect from hundreds of real-life military vehicles.\nHigh-Res NASA satellite imagery.\nSuper sandbox mode offers unlimited customization & replay value','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6040.jpg'),(2277,'Roller Coaster Rampage','2012-05-02','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Roller Coaster Rampage is a fast paced, high-scoring, competitive rollercoaster simulator with destructive environments! Players compete to perform the best manual maneuvers, collect the most gems, link to the most track sections, and gain first place on the leaderboards! Roller Coaster Rampage revolutionizes the coaster genre by introducing on-the-fly track construction and deformation. In previous games the coaster riding experience was a passive, non-interactive experience. Roller Coaster Rampage introduces an innovative approach, and a specialized procedural coaster engine that allows players to build coasters in real-time as they ride them. Players leave behind a trail of procedurally-generated coaster tracks and supports, which then become obstacles as the player circles back.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sxegqyu4lc3ps0aiczvb.jpg'),(2278,'Nightmare Party',NULL,'Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nightmare Party is a 5 player co-op multiplayer horror FPS. You are trapped demon hunters and your goal is to survive and escape while a demon and its minions try to kill you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7knf.jpg'),(2279,'The Storyteller','2025-11-03','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Storyteller is an indie game developed by a single person, where one player becomes the storyteller narrating mysterious tales, while others attempt to unravel unexpected solutions. A multiplayer experience blending suspense and questionable humor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rx4.jpg'),(2280,'Mega Man Zero 2','2015-05-21','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Wii U, Game Boy Advance','In Zero\'s next mission, he falls prey to a trap set by Neo Arcadia\'s ruthless commander. Planning to trick Zero, he tries to use him to wreak chaos between reploids and humans once again. But, can he succeed?\n\nLAN Multiplayer.\n\nIf you have two cartridges and a link cable, the players can link two GBAs and take part in a two-player game. There are three modes available to take part in:\n- Time Attack - Set a goal somewhere in the stage. After three tries, the player with the shortest time to the goal wins.\n- Enemy Battle - Defeat the most enemies from the generator within the time limit.\n- Get Item.\n- Collect the most items from the map within the time limit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co203j.jpg'),(2281,'Hearts of Iron II: Complete','2009-01-23','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Includes Hearts of Iron II plus the two expansions, Doomsday and Armageddon\nWhen Germany is defeated in 1945, the Allies and the new Soviet alliance fight for supremacy. World War III is drawing closer.\nPlay as the ruler of one of 175 countries through World Wars II and III. As the Allies and the Soviet Union clash in Europe, the fate of the world hangs in the balance.\n\nDetailed diplomacy and production systems with help functions to avoid micromanagement.\nMovement-is-attack combat system making warfare more realistic.\nMission-based Air and Naval system, giving options for logistical strikes and targeted bombing.\nNew political system with possibilities to change the political base of your country during the war.\nFifteen battle scenarios optimized for an evening or two for gaming. Historical scenarios like Case White, Operation Barbarossa and alternative history scenarios like Operation Watchtower and Case Green are included in the game.\nCo-operative multiplayer, enabling players to share the same country while playing.\nDoomsday Expansion Features\n\nWorld War III scenario with an alternative historical outcome. Play the Soviet alliance, the United States or any country of your choice as new superpowers rise to power on the global stage.\nExpanded tech trees with considerable detail in a new decade of warfare, allowing you to develop tactical nukes and other kinds of nuclear warfare as well as helicopter squads, Escort carriers and much more.\nImproved Diplomatic/Intelligence System reflects the increased political tension of the 1950s.\nArmageddon Expansion Features\n\nNew attachments for Naval units; do you scrap or upgrade those old ships.\nLand units can now be built with brigades already attached.\nAn Air Naval combat system that radically alters the combat balance.\nNew damage algorithms for the Air combat system, making organization more important and allowing air units to fight longer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63l2.jpg'),(2282,'Phantom Club','1987-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','ZX Spectrum, PC (Microsoft Windows), Amstrad CPC','Only you, Plutus, lowliest of the Phantom Club\'s superheroes, can save the once-proud Club from the clutches of the evil Zarg! Use your mighty \'Brainstorm\' power to fight such fearsome enemies as the terrifying \'transforming beings\' and the loathsome \'man-spiders\'!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xmp.jpg'),(2283,'Unknown Region','2020-08-20','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are one of the chosen survivors to set up your life in UNKNOWN REGION. Life has forever changed after an unknown virus has wiped out humanity. Navigate through the region to discover mutated humans and creatures. You will be challenged to test your survival skills. Throughout the region you will craft, build, fight, and scavenge for supplies and battle the elements every step of the way. Design and build base on your own or with your friends. You will need to be one hell of a fighter to survive this.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4cgy.jpg'),(2284,'Retrace','2021-02-24','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A ghost tour gone wrong leads Freya to a parallel dimension, almost designed for her. Can you beat death, and escape? A game of mystery, adventure and queer love stories.\n\nExplore an atmospheric realm of mystery that blends pixel art gameplay with hand-painted character portraits. Solve logic-based puzzles and overcome pulse-pounding action sequences, uncover secrets about the sinister parallel dimension and explore deep relationships with Freya’s companions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1whp.jpg'),(2285,'Encrypt','2020-06-01','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"encrypt.\" is a competitive platformer! Build your own stages or play stages from the community and compete with other players! \"encrypt.\" brings back Retro-Game feelings with modern Pixel-Graphics. We can promise you, this Game will offer you a lot of fun and a nostalgic atmosphere!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pgp.jpg'),(2286,'MultiVersus: Season 4','2024-11-12','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Get your guitars and best goth garb. It\'s time for the Goth Girl Season! Season 4 of MultiVersus has been summoned! Unlock Raven and Marceline through 2 separate battlepasses, and play on 2 new maps based Samurai Jack and Adventure Time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cnb.jpg'),(2287,'Wings 2: Aces High','1992-11-01','Simulator','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','The game takes place during World War 1. Choose one of the five allied fighter pilots to do battle against the Central Powers. The game consists of 20 missions with the final one culminating with a battle between the player and \"The Red Baron\".\n\nMissions are basically the same as in its\' predecessor Wings. There are bombing missions where you have to take out targets that were circled in an aerial photograph, strafing runs where you get to blast anything that you fancy blasting with an unlimited supply of ammo, and of course the main part: dogfights in the sky.\n\nIf a mission is completed successfully, the player can power up the successful pilot in four skill categories: flying, shooting, mechanics, and stamina. A failed mission can lead to either a dishonorable discharge or death for the pilot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49k2.jpg'),(2288,'Afflicted',NULL,'Shooter, Indie, MOBA','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Afflicted is a thrilling post-apocalyptic shooter with exciting game modes and a cheesy storyline.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xas.jpg'),(2289,'Mech x Change',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','You play as a mech pilot, tasked with demonstrating the newest weapons, at a futuristic arms fair. The enemy and player tear off weapons from each other\'s bodies mid-fight, forcing you to quickly adopt new strategies, while impressing buyers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82l2.jpg'),(2290,'Creed: Rise to Glory','2018-09-25','Fighting, Simulator, Sport','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Oculus Rift, Oculus Quest','Do you have what it takes to become a champion? Follow the ascent of boxer Adonis Creed as you go toe-to-toe with the world’s top opponents in this intense, cinematic boxing experience. Featuring new Phantom Melee Technology for impactful VR melee combat, you’ll train, fight, and win like a Creed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hyd.jpg'),(2291,'LEGO Star Wars: The Skywalker Saga - The Mandalorian: Season 1 - Character Pack','2022-04-05','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This is the Way. Play as the iconic characters from the hit series The Mandalorian Season 1. Travel around the galaxy as The Mandalorian protecting Grogu at all costs. The character pack includes: - The Mandalorian - Cara Dune - Greef Karga - IG-11 - Kuiil','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qzm.jpg'),(2292,'Sketch, Share, Solve','2023-10-24','Puzzle','Playdate','Sketch, Share, Solve is a nonogram game for Playdate, fitting loads of puzzles onto the tiny screen. Play on your own or create puzzles with your friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cj7.jpg'),(2293,'Pixel Cross Stitch: Winter Pack 3','2025-01-02','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Enjoy our new pack of 20 winter-themed images','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2294,'Kingdoms and Slaves','2025-02-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a kingdom fallen by a disease, nearby kingdoms keep this isolated, meanwhile, people starve, go crazy and die, but there is still a hope of starting again in another place, but for that it will be necessary to leave before the disease takes over your body and soul...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ik0.jpg'),(2295,'Clash of Busts','2025-02-07','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Clash of Busts is a multiplayer shooter where players battle it out with quirky weapons like Rocket, Milk and Rail Guns across diverse arenas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d1m.jpg'),(2296,'Rolling Sun','2015-06-03','Platform, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inspired by games such as Sonic The Hedgehog and Super Monkey Ball, Rolling Sun takes advantage of the latest version of CRYENGINE, with best in class physics, lighting and water effects. Discover ancient magic as you guide your Sun Stone through lost Incan and Mayan civilizations. \n \nTake control of a defeated Sun God trapped on Earth. Use the last of your powers to guide a stone across and ancient civilization, gaining power as you get closer and closer to your rival, the Moon God.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nnna3behhhqi8ab7lb3j.jpg'),(2297,'City Eye','2022-08-12','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the world of City Eye, you\'ll become an operator of the Central Monitoring System, which will try to prevent the effects of every single transgression in the game. Use the city map to track dangerous areas and don\'t let the suspects run away from the police.\nCity Eye lets you operate hundreds of cameras at once to have a precise insight into every district you feel that may be endangered. Use this to your advantage and find the danger before it\'s too late!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wtu.jpg'),(2298,'Snow White Solitaire: Charmed Kingdom','2017-12-28','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Free the kingdom from a curse!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31k5.jpg'),(2299,'Rockman.EXE Operate Shooting Star','2009-11-12','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo DS','Rockman.EXE Operate Shooting Star is a game released on November 12, 2009 for the Nintendo DS in Japan. It is an advanced port of the first Mega Man Battle Network game with some extras, including a crossover with the Mega Man Star Force series.\nCapcom currently has no plans for a release outside of Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2042.jpg'),(2300,'Soulash 2','2023-12-04','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a realm where gods have perished, a new era of strife has dawned. Seize power, forge legendary artifacts, conquer the world, and ascend to the divine throne in Soulash 2!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co755z.jpg'),(2301,'Age of Empires II: The Conquerors','2000-09-15','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Dreamcast','Age of Empires II: The Conquerors Expansion is the official add-on to the award-winning, best-selling real-time strategy game Age of Empires II: The Age of Kings.\n\nFocusing on legendary leaders, The Conquerors will challenge veterans and novices to wage war on an epic scale with all-new civilizations, unique units and technologies, and campaigns based on infamous conquerors such as Attila the Hun, El Cid and Montezuma.\n\nAge of Empires II: The Conquerors is the first expansion pack to the 1999 real-time strategy game Age of Empires II: The Age of Kings. The Conquerors is the fourth installment in the Age of Empires series by Microsoft Game Studios and Ensemble Studios. It features five new civilizations (the Aztecs, Mayans, Spanish, Koreans, and Huns), four new campaigns, eleven new units, twenty-six new technologies, new gameplay modes, new maps and different minor tweaks to the gameplay.\n\nA Sega Dreamcast version for both the original game and the expansion were announced, but were cancelled for unknown reasons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xya.jpg'),(2302,'Top Gear: Stunt School HD',NULL,'Racing, Sport','Sin plataforma','If you strapped a jet engine to a racing car would you be able to make it jump 100ft into the air? Possibly... and in Top Gear Stunt School you can try this plus loads more ridiculous stunts. There are over two billion different combinations of upgrades and add-ons that you can use to modify your car to try to beat the challenges!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82qj.jpg'),(2303,'Metroid Prime: Trilogy - Collector\'s Edition','2009-08-24','Shooter, Platform','Wii','The Ultimate Metroid Prime Experience\n\nMetroid Prime fans, prepare to be happy--the celebrated series from Retro Studios has gotten a deluxe treatment on the Wii console. All three games in the trilogy have been crafted into one package, with a newly implemented exclusive title menu with direct access to any of the three titles. Not only that, but players can also earn awards by collecting tokens through their progress across the trilogy, making for an ideal award system.\n\nKey Game Features:\n* Three incredible games from the Metroid Prime universe in one package\n* Metroid Prime 1 and 2 have a new refined control system to match Metroid Prime 3\n* Premium tin case\n* Collectable tokens are awarded while progressing through the trilogy\n* Metroid Prime 1 and 2 have new features and improvements such as 16x9 wide-screen presentation, and improved HUD system to accommodate the new pointer control, some graphic improvements, and newly added new difficulty levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co404b.jpg'),(2304,'The Invisible Hours','2017-10-17','Puzzle, Adventure','Windows Mixed Reality, PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Oculus Rift, Xbox One, Oculus Quest','\"The Invisible Hours is a complex murder mystery in VR, in which players freely explore an intricate web of interwoven stories within a sprawling mansion -- in order to untangle the dark truth at its heart.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23cw.jpg'),(2305,'M-1 Grand Prix no Michi: Ore-tachi no Debayashi ha Mou Natteiru','2022-03-24','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9frt.jpg'),(2306,'Monster Girl Breeder','2020-09-18','Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Our protagonist is settling in for a gaming session with the latest erotic fantasy game, when they are suddenly whisked away to a fantasy world! Waking up in front of a horde of horny monster girls, its up to you to repopulate their isolated village!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p3r.jpg'),(2307,'Five Nights at Hololive','2021-05-24','Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Holo Café. The V-Tuber café with the most modern animatronics. Be prepared to meet Usada Pekora, Nakiri Ayame, Shirakami Fubuki, and other Hololive girls!\n\nBut don’t be too careless now, because you must be with them all night long.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rw1.jpg'),(2308,'Batman: Arkham City - Ultimate Edition','2013-05-21','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3','Batman: Arkham City Ultimate Bundle includes:\n• Batman: Arkham City game\n• Batman Inc. Batsuit Skin\n• Catwoman Pack\n• Challenge Map Pack\n• Harley Quinn’s Revenge\n• Arkham Bundle\n-- Nightwing Bundle Pack\n-- Robin Bundle Pack\n-- Arkham City Skins Pack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fqx.jpg'),(2309,'Farming Simulator: Nintendo Switch Edition','2017-11-14','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Take on the challenges of the modern farmer! Explore a huge open world including a detailed North American environment, loaded with farming activities, over hundreds of acres of land. Harvest many types of crops, tend to your livestock, take part in forestry work, and sell your products to expand and invest in your farm! Transport your goods in trucks and trailers, or load and drive trains to reach your destination.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30tf.jpg'),(2310,'Space Harrier','1991-12-28','Shooter, Arcade','Sega Game Gear','The Game Gear Port of \"Space Harrier\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9b5i.jpg'),(2311,'Vampire Legends: The True Story of Kisilova','2015-12-03','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Discover the source of dreadful evil!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21pj.jpg'),(2312,'Dead Cells: Return to Castlevania Edition','2023-08-11','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jf7.jpg'),(2313,'Spacelines from the Far Out','2021-11-04','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Wanting to pilot a Spaceship? Run your own Spaceline? Then look no further! Deal with nosey passengers, overzealous health inspectors, random asteroids, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3u6h.jpg'),(2314,'Ghunter','2024-11-08','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','GHUNTER is a 3rd person action-adventure, twin-stick shooter game about cooking your prey... ALIVE!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91gi.jpg'),(2315,'Pixel Cross Stitch: Menacing Monsters Pack 2','2025-01-02','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A new pack of 20 images to color or cross stitch.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2316,'Euexorista','2024-07-14','Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A short story about stories and growing with or out of them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ish.jpg'),(2317,'Shinobi, Koi Utsutsu: Setsugekka Koi Emaki','2015-06-25','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','PlayStation Vita port with four new character routes added.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qds.jpg'),(2318,'Agma.io',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Free Multiplayer Game - Massive Online Cells Game. Eat other players and grow larger. Level up and use powerups.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fhg.jpg'),(2319,'GemCraft - Chasing Shadows','2015-03-04','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The latest installment of the GemCraft series is a unique tower defense game, where, instead of towers, gems are the main weapon to fight endless hordes of monsters.\n\nPlace your gems in towers, traps, or amplifiers, replace and switch them as you wish. Even combine them to create more powerful gems with powerful abilities, drop them as gem bombs or activate powerful buildings, the possibilities are endless, the choice is yours!\n\nFight your way through an epic story, unfolding mysteries and facing sinister enemies and artifacts, as you try to entrap the Forgotten, an archdemon with an unknown agenda and no known way to kill, and to slay her demonic avatars, the shadows. Fierce and desperate battles await you...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co418h.jpg'),(2320,'Alpha Sorcerer','2023-09-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An elite sorcerer king with forgotten magical powers mysteriously reappears in a bloody quest for revenge in the supreme action platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e4o.jpg'),(2321,'Dies Irae: Interview with Kaziklu Bey','2016-03-25','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"My mother was my sister.\"\n\nBrooklyn, New York - The man who sat across the interviewer at the vampire bar known as the \"Borges House\" began his story with those odd words.\nFollowing the end World War II, the pallid SS officer traversed the globe to many a raging battlefield, leaving carnage unforeseen in his wake.\nThe vampire of the battlefield. The wandering Hakenkreuz.\nThough his saga was passed down as naught but a stale ghost story, it was no mere urban legend.\nFor he was Wilhelm Ehrenburg - hunted in absolute secrecy by the UN as a remnant of the Third Reich, enemy of the world, and one of the infamous members of the demonic Longinus Dreizehn Orden.\n\nAnd after over half a century, the time had finally come for him to depart for Japan in order to fulfill his most ardent desire.\nHumoring this interviewer he would have ignored or slain any other day was merely a whim birthed from the exaltation of the promised time drawing ever closer.\n\nThat was the only reason our intrepid interviewer found him in a talkative mood.\n\nThus, as he reflected on his life, Wilhelm grew nostalgic - sentimental, even - for the path he had walked.\nAnd when asked, he unveiled his past piece by piece.\n\nFrom the accursed blood that poisoned his very soul, to the blight wrought by the works of Mercury.\nHe spun a tale of the day he awakened to the truth of his being, and of the woman who had the nature of Wilhelm\'s existence engraved upon her very being.\n\n\"Don\'t you worry, I\'m gonna tell you everything. From the first moment I met her, to the very end of our story.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3olx.jpg'),(2322,'Sonic the Hedgehog Megamix','2005-11-15','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Sega CD','Sonic the Hedgehog Megamix (commonly shortened to Sonic Megamix) is a work-in-progress multiperson disassembly modification of the original Sonic the Hedgehog videogame for the Sega Mega Drive / Genesis, developed by Team Megamix and more recently moved to the Sega Mega-CD. The game features the ability to play as one of five different characters: Sonic the Hedgehog, Mighty the Armadillo, Shadow the Hedgehog, Miles \"Tails\" Prower, and Knuckles the Echidna. It is an extensive reworking of the original game, featuring new art, music, abilities, layouts, and other things.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3awx.jpg'),(2323,'AsteroidTD','2024-04-05','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Try to survive in infinite asteroid cloud as long as possible in reworked tower defence style. FInd your own playstyle and beat your own records or chillout with original ambient soundtracks. Build, explore, think - everything to create your own colony in this cold space.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wk1.jpg'),(2324,'Festival Tycoon','2021-09-17','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Create and manage your own music festival empire. Book bands, setup stages, organise your line-up, layout tents and portaloos, roll out the food trucks and build your festival’s reputation to appease sponsors and earn big bucks.\n\nIn Festival Tycoon, booking bands, setting up stages, organizing the line-ups, layout tents and portaloos is some of the many mechanics one will need to master to build the festival of their dreams.\n\nPlayers will be able to create, design, and manage their own music festival empire, starting from humble beginnings in tiny fields to a Coachella-sized event.\n\nA fusion of builder, management and RTS, Festival Tycoon is all about hosting the wildest festival the world has ever seen in adorable, colourful voxels.\n\nFeatures:\n? Design the optimal festival layout: Place tents, VIP bungalows, glamorous stages, portaloos, festival decorations and more!\n?Book talent and arrange a stellar line-up: Put your bargaining skills and musical taste to the test by hiring a range of bands across the likes of folk, rock and techno.\n? Attract sponsors and sell tickets: Appease sponsors like banks, record labels and drink companies for grants.\n? Keep the crowds happy: Be wary of your attendees\' satisfaction, as unhappy punters are quick to take to social media and ruin your reputation!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4830.jpg'),(2325,'Sylia','2025-04-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Three gigantic and mysterious Cubes have landed on Sylia\'s main islands. Inside them, unknown creatures (… Aliens) are gathered and plot on how to take control of the lands and ultimately extract the planet\'s energy – that would be the end of all life. Is Sylia a realm about to fall?\n\nMaybe not! A group of heroes is not willing to let that happen! They are Sylia\'s finest knight, wizardress, cleric and warrior. Supported and guided by their nation, they must enter the Cube where the Aliens\' Queen (a mysterious woman by the name of Lady Godiva) is and stop her! But the task seems overwhelming…\n\nWho is going to win the fight for Sylia? Will the land thrive or will the Aliens gain its energy and destroy every life form in the process?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qacigcmnfybhraqeruts.jpg'),(2326,'J.League Jikkyou Winning Eleven 2000 2nd','2000-11-30','Sport','PlayStation','J.League Winning Eleven 2000 is the officially licensed action soccer game based on the second stage of the 1998 J.League season. It is the follow-up to J.league \'98-99. The series is well known for its smooth gameplay and simplicity of controls. J.League Winning Eleven 2000 2nd features the updated teams of the season 2000-2001.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48ln.jpg'),(2327,'The Wired Action Bundle',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2328,'Please Wake Up','2021-01-29','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','“Please Wake Up” is a memory horror game. It has simple and accessible, yet engaging, gameplay that gives the player a fear of their own mind. As you look around the room, objects will change when they are not visible. Click on the objects if they have changed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vfz.jpg'),(2329,'Airplane Mode','2020-10-15','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Airplane Mode delivers all the thrills of a real-time, six-hour commercial airline flight—in Coach. At least you\'ve got a window seat. Buckle up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ik3.jpg'),(2330,'Insignia',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore a colourful world of beautifully animated pixel art, harkening back to the golden age of 2D games. With hand drawn frame-by-frame sprites and gorgeously expansive tile-sets, playing Insignia will have you reminiscing about blowing on plastic cartridges and calling expensive hotlines for hints, no time machine required!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39o1.jpg'),(2331,'Kitchen','2016-10-12','Adventure','PlayStation VR2, PlayStation VR','What on earth is happening in \"KITCHEN\"?\n\nAn evolved survival horror, a prequel to \"Resident Evil 7 Biohazard\". Experience unblinking fear with unprecedented realism and immersion on PlayStationVR.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92l7.jpg'),(2332,'Sex Story: Cuckold Life - Episode 3','2023-08-19','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A steamy Visual Novel featuring high-definition graphics and realistic-looking characters set in beautiful decor. The story continues with Nikki going to the gym on a Saturday morning, attempting to seduce her new smoking hot trainer for a quickie, despite her husband’s reluctance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ic8.jpg'),(2333,'Nancy Drew: The Haunting of Castle Malloy','2009-06-05','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Touted as the most romantic event to grace the ruined halls of Ireland\'s Castle Malloy, the Simmons-Mallory wedding was supposed to be a fairytale beginning, but now the groom is missing! Did a banshee crash the wedding or is this a case of cold feet? Can you, as Nancy Drew, unravel the knot of scattered clues and scary superstitions? You\'ll to catch more than a bridal bouquet to make this is a happily ever after!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qsx.jpg'),(2334,'Blood Knights','2013-11-13','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Confront the superior strength of the enemy and regain the honor after you, the glorious vampire hunter, have been transformed into a vampire. It launches devastating attacks combining your vampire abilities with the powerful attacks of your swords.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uzw.jpg'),(2335,'Special Operations','1984-12-31','Tactical','BBC Microcomputer System, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Acorn Electron, Amstrad CPC, MSX','Special Operations is a top-down, turn based, tactical squad game where the player has to achieve a particular objective at an enemy compound.\n\nAt the start of the game, the player selects the mission, with options as simple as photographing the compound to as difficult as blowing part of it up. Once the objective is selected, the player needs to select the squad members based upon their skills. Each potential squad member will have a primary skill and a secondary skill which is only revealed by interviewing the potential recruit.\n\nCertain skills are essential in order to complete your objective, for example a photographer and explosives expert for the example above and some are more generally useful, such as a diver which will let you explore any lakes that are encountered.\n\nOnce the game begins you need to explore the forest in order to locate the compound or other elements that may help you complete the objective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20tw.jpg'),(2336,'Sandstorm','2015-01-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','journey into the desert\n\ndiscover its secrets\nmaster your technique\ncomplete your pilgrimage\n\nand try not to lose your way\nas so many others have','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4av7.jpg'),(2337,'Lynn\'s Legacy','2006-08-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Follow Lynn the mercenary as she recollects the mysterious mission that nearly took her life. Travel through multiple overworld areas, (forest, towns, desert, mountains) and boldly step into uncharted dimensions in search of memory!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2338,'Game Room','2010-03-24','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','A smattering of virtualized versions of popular bar/arcade games like pinball, pool, shuffleboard, table tennis, darts, and table hockey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/umyzofh3kkcgd7w73t9o.jpg'),(2339,'Buffet Knight: Decadent Full Course','2025-03-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gobble up everything around you in this hungry action adventure as Buffet Knight. Battle monsters, conquer puzzling dungeons, save the culinary world! The more you eat, the stronger you grow... But will you end up biting off more than you can chew?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gjm.jpg'),(2340,'Nope Nope Nope Nope Nurses','2023-10-13','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The thrilling final installment of Dark One!\'s hit visual novel series! Hapless protagonist Yamada is once again at the mercy of the tender depredations of the world\'s worst staff of nurses... and this time, it\'s up close and personal with the ruthless Head Nurse who dominates all the rest!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76xc.jpg'),(2341,'Dorado','2021-09-22','Sin género','iOS','Dorado is a first person point and click graphic puzzle adventure, similar to games you may have played in the ’90’s or similar to a virtual escape rooms you may have played. A simple gameplay interface consisting of the world that you explore and an inventory panel where you can collect, combine and use items you find along the way to solve puzzles.\n\nExplore areas, collect hidden objects and take in your surroundings. You will need all of your puzzle solving skills to put together a plan to escape the jail and out to the town, solving riddles and down the many paths working towards the lost treasure of Dorado.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2342,'Hypnosis Mic: Alternative Rap Battle 1st Period',NULL,'Music','Nintendo Switch','A Hypnosis Mic game for Nintendo Switch.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2343,'Dancing Ant','2001-03-31','Music','Web browser','You choose the move and he\'ll do the groove! You control the music, dance moves, lyrics and backing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co951w.jpg'),(2344,'Warcraft III: Nirvana','2015-04-02','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warcraft III: Nirvana is a melee mod for WarCraft III TFT. It adds several custom races and can be played on any melee map. This project is focusing on renovating WC3, expanding its playability while keeping it well balanced.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hpy.jpg'),(2345,'Pig Escape','2025-03-24','Sin género','PlayStation 5','You are a pig on the run, and someone is hunting you down! Dash, sneak, and use the environment to your advantage to avoid capture. Navigate through forests, fields, and villages, find hiding spots, and overcome obstacles with clever tactics. Every choice matters—will you escape to freedom or end up in your pursuer’s grasp?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kku.jpg'),(2346,'Roterra: Flip the Fairytale','2019-01-31','Puzzle, Indie','iOS','Can you find your way in a world where the ground shifts under your feet with every move? Slide and rotate cubes in this gravity-defying world to find the correct path for Princess Angelica and her friends. Flip the world and you may just discover that the journey matters far more than the destination – and that stereotypes are not to be trusted.\n\nInspired by “Orlando Furioso,” the 16th-century Italian epic poem by Ludovico Ariosto, the constantly shifting physical world of Roterra reflects the many conflicting points-of-view in the poem. The constant changes in perspective are not only a core feature of the gameplay but the of the narrative itself, prompting players to see female agency and power in a whole new light.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j1d.jpg'),(2347,'Leisure Suit Larry: Magna Cum Laude - Uncut and Uncensored','2004-10-29','Adventure','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','With gorgeous co-eds everywhere, college dweeb Larry Lovage is chasing around more than his diploma. He\'s trying to live up to the legend of his uncle, Larry Laffer, everyone\'s favourite polyester playboy. Larry Lovage is a typical college student. He lives in a dorm, has a crush on his biology professor, and goes to bars with his buddies. But when a TV dating show comes to campus, Larry gets a chance for national sexposure. If he can show that he can make any girl on campus swoon, he will become a campus legend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2erm.jpg'),(2348,'A Day of Slacking','2003-08-19','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co951u.jpg'),(2349,'Rememento White Shadow','2024-12-18','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Korean Turn based RPG','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96ge.jpg'),(2350,'Whispers of Prague: The Executioner\'s Last Cut','2024-09-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Classic first-person point-and-click adventure game set in contemporary Prague. As a programmer and treasure hunter, you embark on a long journey to uncover the secrets of the infamous Executioner. Your task will be complicated by a sect of fanatic cultists and your own unexplained heritage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sdc.jpg'),(2351,'Operation: Overkill II',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2352,'Buster Bros. Collection','1997-05-01','Sin género','PlayStation','Comprising three titles, (Buster Bros., Super Buster Bros., and Buster Buddies), Buster Bros. Collection is a compilation of Capcom\'s \"Buster\" arcade series -- released over a period of six years from 1989 to 1995. Gameplay presents a blend of puzzle and action that sees players strafing from side-to-side, shooting vertically at the bubbles that bounce around the arena. Enclosed within the confines of a single, 2D arena, one or two players must utilize their rope-gun devices to destroy the deluge of bubbles that inundate the screen. When hit, the bubbles burst into multiple, smaller segments, and will continue to do so until the smallest bubble is destroyed. Only by clearing the screen can players proceed. However, coming into contact with a bubble will result in the immediate loss of a life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ilb.jpg'),(2353,'Murder Mystery Paradox: Fifteen Years of Summer','2023-12-01','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Murder Mystery Paradox: Fifteen Years of Summer is a mystery visual novel where you enter the remote and sparsely populated island of Shikinejima and attempt to solve the strangely recurring mystery found there.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fgx.jpg'),(2354,'Bishoujo Senshi Sailor Moon SuperS: Sailor Moon to Hajimete no Eigo','1995-08-24','Adventure','Playdia','Bishoujo Senshi Sailor Moon SuperS: Sailor Moon to Hajimete no Eigo for the Playdia','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qi5.jpg'),(2355,'Exilium','2025-12-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Exilium is an atmospheric point & click project. As an exorcist, you will face demons and occult rituals. Cast out evil spirits with your skills and improvised means. Uncover dark secrets and restore balance before it\'s too late...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gvu.jpg'),(2356,'Juuzaengi: Engetsu Sangoku Den 1 & 2','2015-08-27','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','A port of both games with after stories and touch functions added.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lsh.jpg'),(2357,'LEGO Horizon Adventures','2024-11-14','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Join machine hunter Aloy as she leads a colorful crew of heroes through the lush wilderness on a quest to save the world and learn the secrets of her past. Dive into boundless adventure, customize to your heart’s content, and take on action-packed battles solo or with friends in co-op.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8juk.jpg'),(2358,'Panic Palette Portable','2008-07-31','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Panic Palette Portable is a port of Panic Palette for PlayStation Portable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ulk.jpg'),(2359,'Snap Jack','1981-06-06','Arcade','Arcade','Guide a dot-munching, stretch-legged character through right-to-left scrolling scenes of landscape and tunnels. Avoid, among others, jelly fish and of course the kettles and boots on the overhead conveyor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/f22xdleqstcba748xclb.jpg'),(2360,'Pro Philosopher 2: Governments & Grievances','2024-10-08','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive headfirst into everyone\'s favorite topic: politics! Engage famous philosophers of all stripes, challenge their ideas, and change the world— or just tell everyone they smell terrible. NONSENSE!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97u5.jpg'),(2361,'Wer weiß denn sowas?: Das 3. Spiel','2024-08-29','Quiz/Trivia','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rv5.jpg'),(2362,'Triad Wars','2016-01-20','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Triad Wars was to be a spiritual sequel of Sleeping Dogs. Developed by United Front Games with the support from Square Enix London Studios and published by Square Enix, it was an open world free to play online game for Microsoft Windows. There was no linear storyline, as it focused on your created character and your gang. It was going to feature a similar combat, shooting and driving systems found in Sleeping Dogs.\n\nIt was announced on December 23rd, 2015 that the game would be closed on the 20th January, 2016.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sesqhfh0q7czetdwnn86.jpg'),(2363,'Groove Coaster: Wai Wai Party!!!!','2019-11-13','Music','Nintendo Switch','Rhythm Game x Roller Coaster!!!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s8v.jpg'),(2364,'Showdown in 2100 A.D.','1979-12-31','Arcade','Odyssey 2 / Videopac G7000','In an authentic acre of the old west, two gunslingers (human or android) duel for their lives. Each one has six bullets in his gun, and trees are placed all around.\n\nEach player has to hit his opponent ten times in order to win. At each hit, both players get their guns reloaded. They can also reload their guns anytime by taking the hidden bullets in the tree that matches their outfit','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/iskmm83l74vuu4bmvzl5.jpg'),(2365,'OneShot: Frostide','2024-12-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a short journey with Niko through the snow covered world you both once helped save!\n\nSneakily leave behind gifts for the people you\'ve met along your previous journey, and maybe even get one yourself!\nSave Progress:\n\nYou can safely close the game to save your progress.\nSaved mod progress will not interfere with your vanilla or other mod saves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97qt.jpg'),(2366,'The Jester','2025-03-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A first-person psychological horror game with a VHS effect. Something lives in the shadows and feeds on your fear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l1j.jpg'),(2367,'Tit Tap Tingle','2020-07-24','Simulator, Strategy, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A school field trip to the nearby beach island Chikubijima suddenly goes on lockdown due to some unknown circumstances in Japan and various other countries around the world, leaving TonTon University students and their professors stranded. You\'re now stuck on an island with your beautiful classmates that barely know you - make the best use of this opportunity and enchant them with your titty-tapping skills!\n\nTit Tap Tingle is a revolutionary titty-tapper for PC and Mac. Use various \"tools\" to tap to your heart\'s content and find a girlfriend while learning about the pasts of six young, beautiful ladies from different parts of the globe! It\'s your turn to tit, tap, and tingle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7im4.jpg'),(2368,'Oblitacrater','2025-03-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Oblitacrater is a twin stick shooter where you fight endless alien monsters in increasingly difficult waves. Last as long as you can, raise your score, and then escape before you are taken out. You must escape the planet with your points! Don\'t let the bugs get youuuu!!!!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hvh.jpg'),(2369,'Sticky Business: Complete Bundle','2025-03-14','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Experience the joy of running your own cozy small business: Create stickers, pack orders and hear your customers’ stories. Time to build the cutest shop on the internet!\n\nThe Complete Bundle includes: Base game, Plan With Me and Camp Zinnias.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kah.jpg'),(2370,'Death in Unison','2024-08-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive the world\'s deadliest psychopaths. Experience a unique 2-player co-op experience that puts your teamwork and communication to the test. Complete your duties alone or with a partner in a prison like no other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qwn.jpg'),(2371,'Tetris','2008-12-31','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Tetris is a mobile game developed and published by Electronic Arts for iOS and Android. It was later replaced by the 2011 edition,','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7skb.jpg'),(2372,'Sonic the Hedgehog Beta Hoax','1999-05-10','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','In 1999, Cyan Helkaraxe wanted to stir up more interest in Sonic 1 among the Sonic community. He decided to do something which had never been done at that time: create a ROM hack. The resulting hack would become known as the Sonic 1 Beta Hoax.\n\nCyan set to work on the Sonic 1 REV00 ROM, researching its internal workings primarily by a trial and error process, since there was absolutely no documentation on Sonic 1 available at the time. His goal was to create a hoax prototype a game that mimicked the behavior of a \"genuine\" Sonic 1 prototype.\n\nIn May 1999, Cyan released his hack to Simon Wai\'s Sonic 2 Beta page. The ROM was deliberately not listed as a hoax; rather, it was released under the title \"Sonic 1 beta?\".\n\nThe release of the hoax prototype stirred up more interest in Sonic 1, and when it was identified as a hoax, Andy Wolan invited Cyan to the Sonic Stuff Research Group for his work in creating the ROM hack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93nd.jpg'),(2373,'Hitman 3 Access Pass: Hitman 1 GOTY Edition','2021-01-20','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Hitman 3 Access Pass system allows you to access Hitman 1 and Hitman 2 locations in Hitman 3. Purchasing or redeeming this Access Pass will grant access to the locations from \'Hitman 1 - GOTY Edition\' in Hitman 3. You must own Hitman 3 to access this content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co620k.jpg'),(2374,'Mysteries Mix 2: Whispers of Hollow Town',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2375,'Heroes of Paragon','2017-07-05','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Heroes Of Paragon takes strategy gaming to its next level by challenging you to fight against other players in intense base-vs-base battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2blt.jpg'),(2376,'Shwip','2018-12-31','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Shwip is straight up twin-stick action, with a whip. Get that daily fix of pixel induced-destruction with devastating weapons & abilities the military would be jealous of. Evade, outlast, and play with style in three invigorating game modes. Unlock achievements, compete against friends in local-multiplayer, and show the world who\'s number one on Shwip\'s online leader-boards. Ready thumbs, soldier!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co242p.jpg'),(2377,'An Everyday Story','2024-09-25','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An Everyday Story is a story-driven puzzle platformer with a heartfelt twist. Experience a life from the view of three trinkets... what do you think happens when our dreams become so real that they stain our reality?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r07.jpg'),(2378,'Neon Blood','2024-11-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The dual Viridis, separated between the luxurious Bright City and the dangerous Blind City, where inequality reigns until you, Axel McCoin, an idealistic detective, start a revolution to change the world in this cyberpunk RPG adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hzv.jpg'),(2379,'Golazo!','2019-09-12','Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Football is all about fun and teamwork. It doesn’t matter if you’re on the field or play it on console sitting with your friends on the couch. Golazo boldly recalls the glory days of the arcade soccer games, bringing back memories of cult classics we all know. With its vintage, not-too-serious, artistic and creative modern approach to classic gameplay, Golazo is certainly a perfect game for people who are weary of football managers or complicated hard-core simulators. You just grab your pad, sit on the couch and play!\n\nGolazo is a dynamic 2.5D arcade football game with a medium sized fields, no fouls and offsides whistled. Just pure fun! Mastering the game is incredibly easy during the fun and furious 7vs7 matches. With its local multiplayer modes and crazy vintage approach, Golazo is the ideal choice for Couch & Party gamers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qi8.jpg'),(2380,'FOnline: Ashes of Phoenix',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','FOnline: Ashes of Phoenix is a Fallout MMORPG based on the FOnline engine. It takes you to Phoenix, Arizona, around 2220.\n\nThe city miraculously avoided its global destruction during the Great War of 2077, and a well preserved part of its center remained almost completely unnoticed for almost 150 years. Eventually, a rumor speaking of plentiful resources and intact buildings has been spread into the Wasteland. Independent organizations showed up, preparing themselves for an unavoidable conflict with each other, while stronger forces remain hidden, waiting for the situation to evolve and give them the opportunity to achieve their objectives.\n\nYou are a Wastelander, coming to Phoenix for food and adventure. Fortunately, factions there are happily accepting extra manpower in their ranks. Make your choice, and join the battle for the city.\n\nAshes of Phoenix is a PvP oriented game. It encourages players towards cooperation as well as competition. Recently arrived in Arizona, you’ll have the opportunity to choose a faction composed both of Wasteland characters and other players. In its ranks, you will make your way, explore the Wastes, gather resources, craft gear, barter precious items, gain experience and weapon mastery. Then, you’ll be able to gather with your mates, create new active cells into your faction, explore the city and its undergrounds, face terrifying creatures, control resources, use your sense of diplomacy with other factions and defeat your enemies to become the unique master of Phoenix.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2381,'Unctrl','2024-10-11','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','UNCTRL is a fast-paced one-button game.\n\nYour goal is to launch guided missiles and hit enemies and their projectiles. The enemies come from the right and constantly shoot. Press a button to fire a missile. The missile will always go down on its own and you can make it go up by holding a button.\n\nThe game is over when an enemy projectile hits you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yre.jpg'),(2382,'The Lord of the Rings Online: Riders of Rohan','2012-10-15','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Riders of Rohan expands the online world of Middle-earth where players join forces to ride into the Plains of Rohan. Riders of Rohan includes an increased level cap, the vast plains of Rohan including iconic locations such as Amon Hen and Fangorn Forest, the new Mounted Combat system and much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8izm.jpg'),(2383,'Kuro Tactics','2021-07-01','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kuro Tactics is a unique Turn Based Strategy RPG with Grid Movement that was inspired by Game Boy Advance favorites. Strengthen your Heroes by Leveling, Weapons, Gear & Artifacts to defeat all types of nefarious enemies on your path to victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co453o.jpg'),(2384,'Bionic Commando','1992-09-01','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, Game Boy','The original arcade game was advertised in the United States as a sequel to Commando, going as far to refer to the game\'s main character as Super Joe (the protagonist of Commando) in the promotional brochure, who was originally an unnamed member of a \"special commando unit\" in the Japanese and World versions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ih4.jpg'),(2385,'Holopoint: Chronicle','2019-01-31','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Holopoint: Chronicle is intense archery combat. Explore the once lively island while skillfully weaving your way through waves of relentless holographic enemies, all while swiftly loosing arrows toward your targets.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2386,'City 20','2024-09-23','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a dystopian-tinged survival sandbox adventure where the world dynamically responds to your actions. Craft your own narrative through a series of choices, navigating harsh environmental conditions and organized factions, and delving into unsolved mysteries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s9y.jpg'),(2387,'Magic: The Gathering - Duels of the Planeswalkers 2013: Expansion','2012-09-19','Card & Board Game','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox 360','The Ravnica expansion for Duels of the Planeswalkers 2013 featured five two-color decks, five added single-player campaign levels and five single-player revenge campaign levels, five additional challenges, and additional persona portraits, achievements and trophies to unlock.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2388,'Total Annihilation','1997-09-30','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','What began as a conflict over the transfer of consciousness from flesh to machines escalated into a war which has decimated a million worlds. The Core and the Arm have all but exhausted the resources of a galaxy in their struggle for domination. Both sides now crippled beyond repair, the remnants of their armies continue to battle on ravaged planets, their hatred fuelled by over four thousand years of total war. This is a fight to the death. For each side, the only acceptable outcome is the complete elimination of the other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4l7r.jpg'),(2389,'The Quest for the Candies','2022-11-01','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','This is a Halloween-themed hack that was started in 2019 and finished in 2022. There are 34 exits, spread across 5 worlds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z48.jpg'),(2390,'Rack N Ruin','2015-09-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Chaos reigns in this top down action adventure game starring Rack, a demon with an appetite for destruction. Pave a path of mayhem as you guide Rack on his quest to jump start the Apocalypse. Wield powerful magic, decimate your foes, unravel mind bending puzzles, and smite titanic bosses all while corrupting a vast open world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21hk.jpg'),(2391,'Parallel','2017-08-04','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An unsuccessful author lives alone in his isolated house. He dreams of other worlds, full of adventures and stories he could write about. One night, a young girl appears in his dreams and asks him to write a forest for her. Will this story have a happy ending?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qvb.jpg'),(2392,'Voice of Cards: The Beasts of Burden','2022-09-13','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Voice of Cards: The Beasts of Burden, is a new standalone turn-based RPG adventure, that brings players to an illustrated world presented through the medium of cards as the third release in the Voice of Cards franchise, now giving players the ability to trap the monsters they defeat in cards to use them as skills in battle.\n\nThis truly unique gaming experience brings back the creative minds behind the previous Voice of Cards games, beloved NieR series and Drakengard series, including: Creative Director, YOKO TARO (Drakengard series, NieR series), Music Director, Keiichi Okabe (Drakengard 3, NieR series) and Character Designer, Kimihiko Fujisaka (Drakengard series).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55jm.jpg'),(2393,'Deadline of the Dead','2018-12-04','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Balance work and not being eaten by zombies','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2394,'Modern Combat: Sandstorm','2010-11-25','Shooter','Android, iOS','Assigned to Mission Sandstorm, your duty is to locate and annihilate a new terrorist cell setting up shop and recruiting foreign insurgents in a remote desert hot spot.\nModern Combat: Sandstorm is a first-person shooter set in the Middle East. The player controls the character Chief who, working together with a squad, participates in ten missions against terrorists. Missions are linear with scripted events. Different weapons can be used, such as two types of assault rifles, an SMG, an RPG, a sniper rifle and grenades. Some weapons are hidden in crates found along the way. The character is controlled using a virtual joystick while aiming is done by scrolling across the touchscreen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jie.jpg'),(2395,'Who is Paul','2024-10-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Isaac, a failed detective, receives a mysterious letter that leads him to investigate a desolate and abandoned house in order to make ends meet. However, upon arrival, he realizes that instead of investigating, he must survive. To escape this house filled with dark secrets,','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z28.jpg'),(2396,'Madness Arena','2024-11-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter the ultimate battleground, where chaos reigns and survival is everything. Every decision could be your last—will you rise to the challenge or descend into madness? Master powerful abilities, crush your','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92ex.jpg'),(2397,'Frog Pond','2024-11-28','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Frog Pond is a relaxed, bite-sized desktop idler where you can decorate a pond and collect different kinds of frogs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rb0.jpg'),(2398,'X-Men: Next Dimension','2002-10-15','Fighting','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','X-Men: Next Dimension is a fighting game and the third game in the X-Men: Mutant Academy game series. Next Dimension expands upon the concept of the first two games by adding several new characters, 3-D maps, and a story mode, which allows the player to fight a series of battles in between short movies that move the plot along. The plot of the story mode is loosely based on the comic story \"Operation: Zero Tolerance\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dzm.jpg'),(2399,'Baldur\'s Gate Compilation','2006-06-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Special 4-game DVD-ROM \n \nPlay the original Baldur\'s Gate game \n \nIncludes Tales of The Sword Coast Expansion \n \nExplore unseen lands as you take part in an epic conflict that will define your future, and create your legend \n \nVenture into a deadly new dungeon \n \nCast powerful new spells \n \nGain amazing high-level abilities \n \nPlay a new character kit, the Wild Mage \n \nFight and summon awe-inspiring D&D characters \n \nPlay the full version of Baldur\'s Gate II - Shadows of Amn, you will face deadly foes armed with your wits, skills and magic -- collect allies and form a party that takes you into the hostile land of Amn for treasure and glory \n \nAlso features real-time gameplay and the ability to pause at any time -- plus all-new multiplayer games for up to 6 players \n \nIn Baldur\'s Gate II - Throne of Bhaal, you\'ll uncover the mysteries of Watcher\'s Keep, explore new dungeons, and use the all-new character called the Wild Mage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n0b.jpg'),(2400,'Fast:Run',NULL,'Racing, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fast:Run is an exhilarating, fast-paced running game that challenges your reflexes and speed. In this game, Your goal is to navigate through these obstacles as quickly as possible without crashing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90ze.jpg'),(2401,'Mafia III: Family Kick-Back','2016-10-07','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Family Kick-Back Pack is a DLC for Mafia III. It contains three exclusive vehicles and weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lkl.jpg'),(2402,'The Dwarves of Glistenveld',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The Dwarves of Glistenveld is a Real-Time Strategy game in which you control a clan of dwarves as they fight to retake their homeland from a horde of goblins. Driven underground, help them explore the unknown as you mine, forage, build and fight your way through this forgotten underworld!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43qr.jpg'),(2403,'Steel Heart','2024-08-14','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Steel Heart is a first-person horror mech game where you have to manage the mech\'s resources and fend off the dangers that lie on the alien planet that constantly rains steel... One mech. One Planet. One promise of freedom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8m6g.jpg'),(2404,'Circus of Clowns','2024-07-21','Sin género','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qve.jpg'),(2405,'Arcana Heart 2','2008-03-21','Fighting, Arcade','Arcade','Arcana Heart 2 is the sequel to Arcana Heart. It was the first game in the series to be developed and published by Examu after the rights of the franchise had been transferred to the company from Yuki Enterprise. It was also the first game for Examu\'s proprietary eX-Board, an arcade board based on Windows XP Embedded that would become the standard platform for the rest of the series and other arcade games published by Examu. The game was unveiled at the AOU2008 Amusement Expo. Andamiro demonstrated the original version of Arcana Heart 2 in the US at the 2008 Amusement Expo conference from September 10 to September 12, 2008. The game was running in a Japanese \"candy\" cabinet but with English gameplay and artwork. It was released in the US in October 2008 as a conversion kit to change other arcade games into an Arcana Heart 2 arcade game.\n\nThe game features 6 new fighters, each with their own unique Arcana. New techniques were also included, such as the Arcana Blast, allowing the player to become temporarily invulnerable; Arcana Homing, a feature allowing the player to simultaneously close the distance between them and the opponent while homing in on them; and the Critical Heart, a devastating special attack unique to each character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6blz.jpg'),(2406,'Sengoku Rance: Limited Edition',NULL,'Turn-based strategy (TBS), Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The limited edition comes with:\n- Special Box Case\n- 80 Page Manual Booklet\n- Reversible DVD cover case\n- Sengoku Rance game DVD\n- Sengoku Rance OST CD\n- Sengoku Rance Digital download card\n- Kenshin Acrylic Keychain','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ah9.jpg'),(2407,'MultiVersus: Season 1','2022-08-15','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Season 1 contains a new battle pass, along with new cosmetics, modes, and characters including Rick, Morty, Black Adam, and Stripe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co537p.jpg'),(2408,'Psycho Fox','1992-12-31','Platform','Sega Master System/Mark III','Psycho Fox must get to the right hand side of the level. However, there are many enemies in the way. He can use a Shinto stick to change into characters/animals like a hippopotamus, a monkey or a tiger, each of which has its own special ability. The hippopotamus is slow and cannot jump very high, but can punch through special destructible blocks in the game world. The monkey can jump higher than the other creatures and the tiger can run faster. Psycho also has an ally named Birdfly, who can be used as armor or as a boomerang. If Psycho is hit while carrying Birdfly, Birdfly goes away and the player does not lose a life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k59.jpg'),(2409,'Dragontwin',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Dragontwin is an upcoming open-world RPG/Strategy game in which the player shapes their own destiny as a Dragontwin, a legendary mortal soulbound to a powerful dragon.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2410,'Looping Doors: Diner','2024-07-27','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rdi.jpg'),(2411,'Cheezure','2023-07-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Game made for NoneJam 7 in which the player controls the ship of the great pirate captain Lespito and helps him face the dangers that await him on the seas.\n\nManage your cheese intelligently and improve your entire ship to reach the golden treasure, the great Cheezure.\n\nCould you be the most fearless mouse on the seas?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sg4.jpg'),(2412,'Macross Digital Mission VF-X','1997-03-28','Shooter, Simulator','PlayStation','The year is 2047 AD, approximately two years after the Protodeviln War in which the United Nations discovered the Spiritia-enhancing potential of music. In this light, the popular five-member idol group Milky Dolls (yes, Milky Dolls) comes to a colony planet to perform a concert -- only to be captured by a fleet of Zentradi. Your mission is to fight through this massive armada of ships, pods, and fighters to save the idol singers.\n\nThe opening sequence is storyboarded by Kawamori Shouji and accompanied by Fire Bomber\'s \"Fly Away.\" The game itself is divided into nine missions, beginning with one in which you pilot a VF-1 Valkyrie against a VF-4 Lightning III as training and culminating with a final protracted duel with the de rigueur \"boss\" -- a transforming Zentradi fighter. Survive the battle with this never before seen mecha, and you will be at the front seat of a concert by the Milky Dolls with a song written and composed by Iijima Mari, the original Lynn Minmay voice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ynod5rqeqqzo6zchzyqu.jpg'),(2413,'Rock \'n Shaolin: Legend of the Seven Paladins 3D','1994-12-31','Shooter','DOS','A taiwanese first person shooter and one of the first build engine games released worldwide.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gzk.jpg'),(2414,'Puss In Boots','2011-12-02','Adventure','PlayStation 3, Wii, Xbox 360, Nintendo DS','In the years before meeting Shrek & Donkey in Shrek 2, Puss in Boots must clear his name from all charges against him that has made him a wanted fugitive. While Puss is trying to steal magic beans from the infamous criminals Jack and Jill, the hero crosses paths with his female counterpart, Kitty Softpaws, who leads him to his old friend turned enemy, Humpty Dumpty. Memories of friendship and betrayal enlarges Puss\' doubt, but he eventually agrees to help the egg get the magic beans. Together, the three of them plan to steal the magic beans, travel to the Giant\'s castle, steal the golden goose, and clear Puss\' name.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z6x.jpg'),(2415,'The Tower of Mimi','2025-04-01','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore the Tower of Mimi floor by floor and try to reach the top! Endure games forced on you by Mimi, resident strange funny animal. See if you can survive... ohoho~','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mrq.jpg'),(2416,'Car Dealer','2020-04-19','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Manage the world\'s most popular auto gallery in Car Dealer, an indie RPG simulator. Sell ​​vehicles in your auto gallery that will appeal to customers. Grow your auto gallery and make it the most popular in the world. Watch out, thieves are walking around! You can purchase various measures for your car gallery such as bodyguards and security cameras. There are many people and places to interact with in the city, where you can meet your various needs. You can make a website by agreeing with freelancers and attract more customers to your auto gallery by buying fake reviews. You don\'t just need to sell vehicles to earn money. Explore the city and set up your big auto gallery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p21.jpg'),(2417,'Pixel Cross Stitch: Menacing Monsters Pack','2025-01-02','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A free pack of 10 brand new pixel images.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2418,'Validus Mortis','2023-09-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Validus Mortis is a 2D platformer in fantasy style. To stop the evil wizards of taking control of the land. explore the stage with your hero knight and find items to progress forward. Slay monsters and gain experience and new spells.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71aj.jpg'),(2419,'Glitch Busters: Boss Challenge Pack','2023-08-15','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','This new endgame \"Challenge Mode\" pits you and up to 3 others against six bosses one after another--and of course comes with new customization parts, 15 in total.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zvb.jpg'),(2420,'FroggieChat','2021-02-27','Sin género','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A faithful remake of Pictochat for Windows and Android','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kqh.jpg'),(2421,'Angry Birds Football','2016-04-25','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Android, iOS','Join a Bird Island soccer team, and manage every aspect of your career to carry your team to the top!\nYou are the newest aquisition of soccer team, the Mighty Feathers. Managed by none other than Mighty Eagle, The Mighty Feathers have fallen in the league, and they’re looking for fresh talent to reinvigorate their game. That’s where you come in. Take control of every aspect of your career as the brightest upcoming soccer star on Bird Island, and lead your new team to victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tku.jpg'),(2422,'Gargoyle\'s Quest','1990-05-02','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, Game Boy','Gargoyle\'s Quest Brings Big-Screen Action to Game Boy!\n\nYou are Firebrand - gargoyle and proud guardian of the Ghoul Realm. The Destroyers have returned to wipe out your planet... and they take no prisoners!\n\nUse your breath of fire and your flying ability to combat the enemy. Fight heroically, and you\'ll recover stolen magic items that will strengthen you for your many battles.\n\nDetailed Graphics set new standards for Game Boy\nFascinating new epic adventure story!\n\nFor 1 player only.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27rm.jpg'),(2423,'Wayward Manor','2014-07-15','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Wayward Manor invites you to jump into the afterlife of a disgruntled ghost, trying to reclaim his house from its newfound owners. Set in the 1920s, this puzzle, adventure game transports players to an era of dark screwball comedy where they must unlock the secrets of a twisted mansion. Players will discover the quirks of Wayward Manor\'s unwelcome guests and choose how to prey on their darkest fears.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/be3svpk9mvnsfkqrbjb1.jpg'),(2424,'Adventure Mosaics: Venice Carnival',NULL,'Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2425,'Match Marbles 6',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2426,'Everyone Fights','2025-02-19','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Everyone Fights is a turn based city building and conquering strategy game. Complete with a map creator, character creator, campaign, multiplayer, and loads of characters with their own unique ways to play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nr6.jpg'),(2427,'Sleepy Head',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2428,'Flight Simulator 2025 VR','2025-03-07','Simulator','PlayStation VR2','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9irk.jpg'),(2429,'Greed is Good','2023-11-06','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Greed is Good, a PvPvE game, you will enter the mysterious dungeon as a Bounty Hunter. In the game, you need to cooperate with your teammates to fight against enemies and fears. Be aware of the toxic gas and be sure to escape before you are drown out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74gw.jpg'),(2430,'Klonoa 2: Lunatea\'s Veil','2022-07-07','Platform, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Klonoa 2: Lunatea\'s Veil is a remaster of the original 2.5D platformer game, released for modern consoles with enhanced graphics. The game was bundled with Klonoa: Door to Phantomile in the Phantasy Reverie Series. This is actually the first time Lunatea\'s Veil has had any sort of rerelease since its debut on the PS2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7be1.jpg'),(2431,'Skater Cally','2018-09-25','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cally is ready to take on her next goal, being a Professional Skateboarder! Utilize a classic combo system by linking together flips, grabs, gaps, manuals, grinds, and special tricks to rack up huge points and achieve Career Goals that will make Cally a skateboarder of legend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co415o.jpg'),(2432,'Armikrog: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co806v.jpg'),(2433,'Crash / Impact / Contact','2022-07-30','Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser','A stone falls into a desert and is surrounded by life. Understanding comes with effort, at a cost.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8znp.jpg'),(2434,'Helltower','2019-03-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Helltower is a challenging retro style action platformer. Ascend the tower to discover the fiendish traps and gruesome creatures lurking above. Can you get to the top?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2435,'B.E.A.S.T.S.',NULL,'Fighting','Sin plataforma','Break Everything And Stack Towering Structures','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2436,'Eira','2022-08-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Eira\" is a role-playing game developed by the independent team \"Gearonin\". In this game, you will play a girl named \"Rui\" who just turned 15 years old. Together with the thoughtful and handsome butler \"Ralph\", she runs and protects the ancient magic shop left by Rui\'s grandmother \"Eira.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gnq.jpg'),(2437,'Danganronpa Z: Patient Madness Cropper','2019-05-12','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Danganronpa fangame that is set in a hospital. 15 students are trapped in a hospital with a psychotic bear named Monokuma, the only way to get out is by getting away with murder. This fangame was completed up to chapter 4 daily life, and has since been cancelled.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lm4.jpg'),(2438,'Rhythm of the Gods','2020-03-22','Music, Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Join the strongest mortal warrior, Lyrik, and slide, jump & slash to the beat to please the Gods of Rhythm! Solve the problems that the mortal realm faces in this auto-running, Greek-inspired rhythm game. Keep in time and reveal each gods\' true tune with unique beatmaps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20nw.jpg'),(2439,'Hikari no Senshi Photon: The Ultimate Game on Planet Earth','1987-09-28','Sin género','Family Computer','Photon: The Ultimate Game on Planet Earth is an adventure game developed for the Famicom by Takara, and published in 1987. The English name of the game has special significance, since \"Photon: The Ultimate Game on Planet Earth\" is also the name of the first commercial version of a game commonly known today as Laser Tag. However, besides the name, and the fact that you play a character who fires a Photon gun, any further connection between the live action game and this video game is unknown.\n\nIn the video game, you play a soldier who must navigate through several different floors of a dungeon which contains items and traps. The player must figure out how to maneuver through the dungeon in an effort to collect various items that will expand his ability to search, and find various disks which contain hints and messages to further aid the player. The game is played from a third-person behind-the-shoulder perspective and contains pseudo-3D visuals. This game was never released outside of Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co742a.jpg'),(2440,'Dead by Daylight: Dungeons & Dragons','2024-06-03','Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dead by Daylight: Dungeons & Dragons brings the realm of fantasy horror into The Fog with new Killer, Vecna and new Survivors Aestri Yazar and Baermar Uraz (one character with 2 playable options). A new Map, Forgotten Ruins, is available for all players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ai1.jpg'),(2441,'Croak!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2442,'Pang Pang Terrible','2003-08-21','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A online MMO FPS/proto-Hero Shooter made available by OnGame Brasil in 2005 on Brazil. Unlike other typical military shooting games of the time, it allows users to raise their own characters as they like. And it features bright and unique cartoon characters without any dark or gloomy mood. There\'s various game modes: Snowfight, Survival/Team Battle, Clan Battle, Pang Gold Battle, Boss Battle, Territory Battle, and Flag Battle. It also has leveling up characters, acquiring items, and shop functions. Deviating from the previous Wear & Tear character system of FPS into a new upbringing & character system. This game started in Korea and was planned for English in 2008 but never opened. The game is shut down now.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2443,'Box #341','2025-04-21','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A quirky box on a journey to find its place in the warehouse, using liquids to gain abilities, solve puzzles, and make new friends on the way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gq0.jpg'),(2444,'Match Marbles 11',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2445,'Game with Car',NULL,'Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a game, with a car','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k1c.jpg'),(2446,'Orbo\'s Exodus','2025-12-31','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After a whirlwind odyssey with his friend, our accountant-turned-hero Orbo decides to make his way home by way of Peeb\'s signature biplane. While flying over the coast of a mysterious vacation resort, Peeb\'s attempt to demonstrate a cool loop-de-loop turns into a spectacular nosedive that is only one-upped by the resulting explosion.\n\nFollowing the crash, Orbo is left stranded, with Peeb nowhere in sight. Left to his own devices, Orbo begins an all-new quest to buy a ferry back to the mainland, but in the process he may discover there\'s more to the island than meets the eye...\n\nArmed with some new moves and a set of snazzy hats, Orbo sets out on his final adventure: an exodus of epic proportions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ql6.jpg'),(2447,'Day of the Lords','2003-10-19','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Large ancient castle with custom textures, great details and atmosphere.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77kl.jpg'),(2448,'Kalpa of Sword','2024-01-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aw2.jpg'),(2449,'Love & Knights Solitaire',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2450,'198BREW: The Age of Orpheus','2024-09-01','Visual Novel','Web browser','198X.\n\nLong after Adin\'s discovery. After the Night of the Comets. Sometime after she went away. Three days after you buried the cat.\n\nYou stand in your kitchen. And you find yourself out of coffee.\n\nStep into the blizzard. Go through this strange world of talking animals, immortals, fanatics, robots -- and find that shot of caffeine','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co954x.jpg'),(2451,'Hiyoku no Tori','2023-02-23','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','An occult-mystery-adventure game set in Kyoto—detectives investigate to solve bizarre and complex cases. What did Kamotan detectives finally uncover on their way to the truth of these cryptic incidents?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hed.jpg'),(2452,'Astra Noctis',NULL,'Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Astra Noctis is a Metroidvania more focused on combat than exploration. It contains some RPG touches, such as the inventory and equipment system. These systems encourage experimentation and the creation of different builds and playstyles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rfj.jpg'),(2453,'Garfield: The Search for Pooky','2005-11-14','Sin género','Game Boy Advance','Garﬁeld has lost his favorite Pooky Bear...Young players must help Garﬁeld in his search for Pooky. The game takes Garﬁeld through his best known haunts interacting with his favorite characters e.g. Jon, Odie and Arlene to name but a few. No cat\'s tale would be complete without the usual encounters such as: dogs, mice, spiders & scraps of food. \n \nTrue to his character Garﬁeld can not resist eating as much as possible throughout the game but food equals\' energy & energy enables this fat cat to perform extraordinary moves throughout his adventures in the game. At the same time all sorts of obstacles will have to be avoided, such as web spinning spiders, happy Odie rushing towards Garﬁeld, bad food, annoying kids, angry pit-bulls and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d3y.jpg'),(2454,'Floyd Factory Jam','2024-10-13','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Floyd Factory Jam includes 11 maps (+ start), with the aim of creating factory type environments with no restriction on theme or texture set. The only requirement is that Floyd must be included on your factory\'s payroll. This jam is based on Alkaline.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xpo.jpg'),(2455,'Slimeboo','2024-02-22','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Boo, a small and adorable slime, has gotten lost on a tropical island. To find his way home, he must leap over all the obstacles in his path. Help him overcome them! Good luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gf6.jpg'),(2456,'Warfield','2021-03-07','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Single player and multiplayer war game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ud3.jpg'),(2457,'Dead Cells: Everyone is Here Vol. 2','2022-11-07','Sin género','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Introducing 6 new famous character (Shovel Knight, Hotline Miami, Katana Zero, Risk of Rain 2, Terraria & Slay the Spire) in this new cross over update. 6 new Outfits and Weapons based on 6 indie games crossovers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5r9m.jpg'),(2458,'And All That Could Have Been','2003-09-02','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Large, professionally built industrial map using Speedbase textures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77kk.jpg'),(2459,'Shrek: Ogres and Dronkeys','2007-12-05','Simulator','Nintendo DS','Shrek and Fiona\'s energetic triplets appear along side Donkey and Dragon\'s playful offspring, the dronkeys, exclusively on the Nintendo DS. This game gives handheld gamers the chance to train, play and explore with their mischievous new friends on wild adventures throughout the hilarious world of Shrek.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ds9.jpg'),(2460,'Shockman','2011-02-16','Shooter, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, Wii U, PlayStation Portable','It\'s been two years since Arnold and Sonya were made into Shockmen. A message from the professor to return to their bodies has them head to his laboratory, but they are ambushed by a mysterious enemy along the way. After narrowly defeating the enemy, they catch a TV news flash announcing the Ryo Empire invasion. They find that the professor has been abducted and set out to rescue him.\n\nShockman is a side-view action shooter that has eight stages, including Action Stages, where you jump and use special techniques, and side-scrolling Shooting Stages. This game expands on the well-paced story from the previous version and contains cooperative elements like shared life and a powerful Team Shockbeam that can be used during two-player simultaneous play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xpr.jpg'),(2461,'Tornado Emergency',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A storm chasing simulation/strategy based game that immerses players in the thrill of tracking and intercepting tornadoes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87js.jpg'),(2462,'Go Kart Run!','2020-04-09','Racing, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aim for 1st place! Collect and customize 20 drivers, race to increase your rank, make a comeback with food items and go insanely fast with 5 engine options!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41d9.jpg'),(2463,'JumpJumpJump!','2025-03-05','Sin género','PlayStation 5','Jump, dodge, and soar your way to victory in JumpJumpJump! Take control of a fearless girl as she leaps from platform to platform, avoiding dangerous obstacles and moving hazards to reach the finish line. Precision and timing are key—one wrong move, and it’s game over!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mnj.jpg'),(2464,'Space Varments',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Space Varments is a built-in game of the GP2X Wiz portable console.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2465,'The Apartment','2007-03-29','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Apartment is a short RPG-Maker horror experience, about Joe Malcom, a resident of an apartment. After he receives books from his neighbour, after her husband commited suicide, strange things start to happen. Perhaps the same books offer an explaination on what is happening.\n\nA speciality of the game is, that everything happens in this one room apartment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k2s.jpg'),(2466,'Ancient Conquest: The Golden Fleece','1999-04-12','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ancient Conquest is set in the fictional days when heroes like Hercules and Zetes lived, days that we know from legendary myths. The objective of the game is to get the Golden Fleece. To reach the objective, players will have to build their navy, the legendary ship Argo, earn money while exploring natural resources, like amber, fish and Leviathans.\n\nWhile playing the game, players will have to fight against monsters (harpies, medusas, cyclops, minotaurs, etc.), sea creatures (sharks, crocodiles, sea-serpents, swordfish), wizards, survive natural disasters as well as the mighty Persians and Barbarians who robbed you of your ships and settlements. To overcome obstacles you have to attract ancient heroes to help you on your quest, for their skills will help you on your journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ccd3saghdaryxclyzi65.jpg'),(2467,'Legacy of Kain: Soul Reaver 2','2001-11-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Soul Reaver 2 picks up where Legacy of Kain: Soul Reaver left off, with Raziel having just plunged through the Chronoplast time portal in his relentless pursuit of Kain. Over the course of his quest for revenge, Raziel must unearth the mysteries of Nosgoth’s ancient races, expose the machinations behind the corruption of the Pillars, and the vampire genocide. Throughout the game, Raziel acquires numerous new abilities, weapon enhancements, and spells, all of which are critical to the completion of his epic adventure.\n\nSoul Reaver is a third-person combat adventure filled with devious puzzles and kick-ass combat. Fly, swim, jump, and even travel from the material world to the spectral realm to overcome obstacles and conquer your enemies. With over 40 abilities to choose from, no two fights will ever be the same.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93d6.jpg'),(2468,'Tap Knights: Heroes & Monsters','2018-02-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','iOS','Start fighting now with our heroes and defeat them all! Train our best warriors, upgrade them and find the right equipment to face your enemies! In this knights and monsters medieval war you\'ll have to be fully prepared to overcome each level. Strategically defeat the monsters of death and their bosses. Upgrade your armour, weapons and spells to get an advantage on the battlefield!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tqpt5tpjg9llptbq8sov.jpg'),(2469,'Pokémon Regulation Blue','2021-06-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Game Boy','Pokémon Regulation is a rom hack that attempts to maintain as much of the vanilla experience as possible while also allowing players to challenge themselves by applying special rules to the gameplay. Upon starting a New Game, you will be asked to provide a regulation code before your adventure starts. You can generate regulation codes on https://pokereg.net/','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90e2.jpg'),(2470,'The Disney Collection: Quackshot Starring Donald Duck & Castle of Illusion Starring Mickey Mouse','1996-12-31','Platform, Adventure','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Castle of Illusion Starring Mickey Mouse: In Castle of Illusion Mickey is on the trail of a wicked witch who has kidnapped Minnie, and you must find the seven gems in order to defeat the witch\'s spellbound baddies and save Minnie.\n\nQuackshot Starring Donald Duck: Join Donald in the quest to find Garuzia\'s Great Duck Treasure! Travel the continents searching for clues and tools, and pit your wits against the many dangers in store for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tlk.jpg'),(2471,'Zero Divide 2','1997-06-27','Fighting','PlayStation','Zero Divide 2: The Secret Wish is a sequel to the robot fighting game Zero Divide. The game features higher resolution graphics and more detailed character models. It adds two new robots, the nurse-like Pixel and the crab-like Cancer, along with a few new bosses and hidden characters. It also adds various new arena types of different shapes (the original game only had standard square arenas), including completely walled-in ones, as well as arenas with low barriers that the opponent can be juggled over to lead to a ring out. Rounds are now considerably shorter, and the robot\'s armor easier to knock off.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j2g.jpg'),(2472,'Word Vomit',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your home is getting moldier day by day. Air is uncomfortable to breath. Your room is only place where you feel somewhat safe from his neverending wrath. This can\'t keep going.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9re9.jpg'),(2473,'Fungus and Delicacies','2019-12-23','Sin género','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Going into the woods to scavenge for supplies, you soon find yourself lost in a world that is not quite your own...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9reh.jpg'),(2474,'Dragon Sweeper','2016-01-29','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dragon Sweeper is a mix between mine sweeper, classic NES era JRPGs and modern twitch games. Dragon Sweeper is designed to give you the full experience of a classic RPG in a shorter play session. Your job is to rid the land of monsters and kill the dragon that lives on the island. Dragon Sweeper has several randomly generated islands filled with land to explore, towns to visit and monsters to defeat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6994.jpg'),(2475,'Astro Bot: Vicious Void','2025-02-13','Platform','PlayStation 5','This free update features harder levels to test your jumping skills. Each level comes with a brand-new Special Bot to rescue and, once that’s done, can be replayed in Time Attack mode with online rankings. It has weekly release schedule:\n\n- Feb 13: Tick-Tock Shock\n- Feb 20: Thrust or Bust\n- Feb 27: Cock-A-Doodle-Doom\n- Mar 6: Hard to Bear\n- Mar 13: Armored Hardcore','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e7z.jpg'),(2476,'My Candy Love: Alternate Life','2022-01-26','Visual Novel','Web browser, Windows Phone, Android, iOS','What if your last year at Anteros Academy happened differently? And what if your first love was still in Amoris?\n\nMy Candy Love: Alternate Life is the fourth ongoing season of My Candy Love, being a series of retellings of University Life, with individual stories and romances following Candy\'s relationships with Lysander, Kentin, and Armin respectively.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ty7.jpg'),(2477,'Shrek: Dragon\'s Tale','2006-12-31','Sin género','V.Smile','Shrek and friends teach young children great life skills such as maths, spelling, telling time and science.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/idiqjmuhtjigyognsc5f.jpg'),(2478,'Dreamworks Animation','2006-12-31','Sin género','Plug & Play','Dreamworks Animation is a Plug It In & Play TV Game system with 5 games based off Dreamworks\' Shrek and Over The Hedge movies released by Jakks Pacific and developed by Handheld Games, LLC in 2006.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5f7z.jpg'),(2479,'Oroboros Square','2025-04-04','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is based on real events.\n\nReality however, is a fickle thing.\n\nPlay through one of many lost dreams where you must escape reality.\nYou know nothing, and have to find out...\n\nWhat lies underneath it all?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oyu.jpg'),(2480,'LithoBreak','2021-02-23','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Story driven management space mining simulator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s7x.jpg'),(2481,'DreamWorks Shrek: Multi-Game Mayhem - Featuring Shrek','2006-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','A standalone handheld electronic device that only includes a Shrek game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co890x.jpg'),(2482,'Puzzle Swap','2011-03-31','Sin género','Nintendo 3DS','Puzzle Swap is a game in which players aim to complete a 3D animated picture of a Nintendo video game by gathering its pieces. If a player encountered on StreetPass possesses any pieces the player does not have, the player can choose one of their pieces to add to their own. The player may also use Play Coins to buy random pieces for their existing panels, although it won\'t always be a new piece. After the December 2011 update, new puzzles became available which included four or eight pink squares in the center. Pink pieces are distributed to players via SpotPass and can only be gathered via StreetPass; they cannot be bought using Play Coins. Some puzzles have more pieces than others, making them harder to complete.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zbv.jpg'),(2483,'Rise of the Wool Ball','2017-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rise of the Wool Ball is a 2017 total conversion for the ZDoom engine. It was made by MSPaintR0cks and is the sequel to Shadow of the Wool Ball. The game is spread across three episodes, each having five levels with a secret level. Like its predecessor, Rise of the Wool Ball uses a cartoon art style, and it was named a runner-up at the Cacowards that year.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4m3t.jpg'),(2484,'Cosmic Invasion',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Cosmic Invasion is a combination of strategy mixed in with quick frantic battles against fleets that contain many ships. The strategic layer is a 20 X 30 grid with 600 sectors. Move your ships around to protect your home planet and space stations from the invading fleets of UFO ships.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gpv.jpg'),(2485,'Shrek 2: Ogre Bowler','2004-08-03','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q2i.jpg'),(2486,'Super Mario 256','2018-12-15','Platform','Nintendo DS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w8a.jpg'),(2487,'Blood Bound','2019-03-30','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Bloodbound, Book 1 is the first book of the Bloodbound series. It is followed by Bloodbound, Book 2 and Bloodbound, Book 3. It is the predecessor to its spin-off, the Nightbound series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8phg.jpg'),(2488,'The Spiritworld','2023-04-06','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Large episode with 7 main levels + 3 secret levels + custom start map + new end boss, all inspired by Quake 1 episode 4 (Elder World) in a classic-ish id1 style. Supports co-op.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77kh.jpg'),(2489,'I\'m counting to 6...','2024-01-26','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Turning onto an old road, the main character gets into an accident due to thick fog. Now he\'s trying to find someone who can help him. Forced to enter an old house, the main character finds himself trapped, from which it is not so easy to get out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p3f.jpg'),(2490,'Chubby Bear Smash','2021-06-04','Fighting, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Webcam motion control, action-packed and fighting game. Take on the challenge and fight against the bees to finally get your hands on the delicious honey hidden away in the forest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30s7.jpg'),(2491,'ChuSinGura 46+1 Edo Kyuushin-ha Hen','2011-12-31','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ChuSinGura 46+1 Edo Kyuushin-ha Hen is an adventure themed erotic visual novel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jia.jpg'),(2492,'Dead Cells: Everyone is Here!','2021-11-22','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Crossover content with Hyper Light Drifter, Curse of the Dead Gods, Guacamelee, Skul, Blasphemous, and Hollow Knight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5r9s.jpg'),(2493,'Cannoneer','2024-12-09','Point-and-click, Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cannoneer is a 2-dimensional, top down shooter game. You bomb planes to earn treasure and get new high scores. You can use that treasure to purchase skins and use those in game. The main gimmick of your cannon is that you only have one bomb. Every time the bomb leaves the screen you get it back. The cannon is stationary, but you can rotate in place at a set speed. The game mechanics include 30-second waves of planes that change direction and location every wave, speed increases per each wave, an explosive grenade that spawns after you shoot 15 times, and intense situations coupled with high-speed gameplay. You can track your best scores with the scores tab in the menu, and compete with your friends to get the best score. Good luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co975d.jpg'),(2494,'Dungeon X Dungeon','2023-08-18','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Arcadia \'s best treasure hunter Luke is a dungeon hunter to prevent the resurrection of the Evil! We invite you to the world, which is filled with interesting stories, encounters with friends, action games that will defeat invulnerable monsters and use various elements to get through the dungeons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co662n.jpg'),(2495,'International Sensible Soccer','1994-12-31','Sport','Amiga CD32, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga, Atari Jaguar','Released alongside the 1994 World Cup, this was the first version of Sensible Soccer to feature teams from outside Europe. The World Cup tournament is featured in full, and you can adjust which 24 teams this features, a particularly crucial feature for English and French fans, as their nations failed to qualify. For the first time in the series an on-screen referee is featured. The club team data has been updated to take into account transfers and kit changes since the previous version. Gameplay is much the same as previous editions, being viewed from above with small sprites and loose ball control.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ple.jpg'),(2496,'Hero Blaze: Three Kingdoms',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2497,'LEGO Star Wars II','2007-01-05','Adventure','Legacy Mobile Device','Play through a LEGO recreation of Star Wars Episode IV: A New Hope as Luke Skywalker, R2-D2 and Princess Leia. Use each characters unique abilities while battling Stormtroopers to navigating through the Death Star and rescue the Princess from her prison cell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qr7.jpg'),(2498,'Blade Crafter',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2499,'Aikagi 3','2021-05-28','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6muv.jpg'),(2500,'The Legend of Arcadieu 2','2020-11-02','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A sexy RPG adventure in a magical world filled with beautiful girls! Part two!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43x5.jpg'),(2501,'Pogo Postman',NULL,'Platform','Sin plataforma','Delivering mail on a pogo stick is tricky.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2502,'Mickey\'s Apple Cart','2006-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','A Soukoban clone; similar to the previously-released Push the Box by JungleTac.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2503,'Dead by Daylight: Special Edition','2017-06-23','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Dead by Daylight is a multiplayer (4vs1) horror game where one player takes on the role of the savage Killer, and the other four players play as Survivors, trying to escape the Killer and avoid being caught, tortured and killed. Survivors play in third-person and have the advantage of better situational awareness. The Killer plays in first-person and is more focused on their prey. The Survivors\' goal in each encounter is to escape the Killing Ground without getting caught by the Killer - something that sounds easier than it is, especially when the environment changes every time you play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y8r.jpg'),(2504,'Star Wraith',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2505,'Safari Photo Africa: Wild Earth','2006-09-18','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The player acts as a photojournalist in Serengeti National Park and is assigned to photograph various types of animals, from hyenas to rhinoceroses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zdr.jpg'),(2506,'Twisted Metal','2012-03-08','Shooter, Racing','PlayStation 3','Twisted Metal is a vehicle combat video game developed by Eat Sleep Play and published by Sony Computer Entertainment for the PlayStation 3. It is a reboot of the Twisted Metal franchise. The game was originally planned to be released in October 2011 but was delayed to early 2012.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sjc.jpg'),(2507,'Fever Sankyo Koushiki Pachinko Simulation for WonderSwan','2000-01-09','Sport','WonderSwan','The Sankyo Fever series\' sole WonderSwan entry.\n\nFever Sankyo Koushiki Pachinko Simulation for WonderSwan is a Miscellaneous game, developed and published by Bec, which was released in Japan in 1999.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/m3ry0f187eni5d7vog0p.jpg'),(2508,'Under A Star Long Cold','2024-02-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have 30 minutes to loot this place and pay your debts before the planet is destroyed. Intense stealth-action with permadeath. An exploration of agency and hope.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pln.jpg'),(2509,'King of Light','2023-01-05','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65hu.jpg'),(2510,'Rogue Eclipse',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A spacefighter for the new age. Master your piloting prowess in an epic sci-fi setting, take down swarms of starfighters, merciless armadas and colossal behemoths in a roguelike campaign that spans the cosmos. Easy to learn, tricky to master, and impossible to put down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bin.jpg'),(2511,'Undergod','2024-09-16','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take over heaven in this airborne-combat roguelike where you fight hordes of angels while growing stronger every minute.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cvu.jpg'),(2512,'Tic-Tac-Toe','1982-12-31','Card & Board Game','DOS','Tic Tac Toe is a BASIC implementation of the familiar strategy game, where each player attempts to form a line of either noughts or crosses through the 3x3 game board. Two human players may challenge each other, or one may test his wits against the computer (the human player always goes first). When playing against the machine, its degree of cunning depends on the chosen skill levels: \"basic\", \"more difficult\" or \"most difficult\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4l5g.jpg'),(2513,'Rooms: The Unsolvable Puzzle','2018-06-23','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Oculus Rift','Rooms: The Unsolvable Puzzle is a unique puzzle game inspired by sliding puzzles and platformer games. In a twisted mansion made of rooms that slide like sliding puzzle, player should find a way to the exit by moving rooms and using what\'s inside them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mq7.jpg'),(2514,'Earnest Evans','1992-12-31','Platform, Adventure','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Sega CD','In the 1930\'s, famed archaeologist Earnest Evans unearthed his greatest challenge: three ancient idols that together could bring an end to life on Earth. The idols were scattered at random throughout the world by the god of the winds, Hastur, before its power was crushed. Yet Evans was injured before he could complete the search. Fifty years pass and now its up to Dr. Evans\' grandson Earnest to save the world.\n\nIt is the second in a trilogy of games, which includes El Viento, Earnest Evans and Anett Futatabi','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25pa.jpg'),(2515,'Building Rush 2',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','You are the boss! Manage the manufacturing and delivery of building materials to construction sites in multiple cities.\n\nBuild and upgrade your plants and construction fleets to produce, ship and sell the building materials that your plants generate. Deliver the goods as quickly and efficiently as possible to keep your customers happy and earn bigger bonuses. Watch out as your competitors will also set up factories to try and steal your business!\n\nEarning medals and achievements will award you with money that you can spend to upgrade your facilities and fleets.\nThe better your performance on a level, the more money you\'ll earn to spend on upgrades. Replay completed levels to improve your scores and earn more money for upgrades!\n\nIt\'s time to get to work!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2516,'Open Ocarina','2022-12-31','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Open Ocarina is a PC port of the decompiled The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time originally for the Nintendo 64.\n\nIt supports features such as 30-120 fps, free camera, rumble, gyro aim, and HD texture packs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78cv.jpg'),(2517,'Damage Control','2016-04-05','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Control your squad of engineers and maintain your ship, and it\'s crew, until it reaches it\'s destination. Careful planning and timing will be required to tackle the dangers of deep space. Only your team stands between your sturdy ship and and certain doom. Take command!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2518,'Project 2/3',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Project 2/3 is an upcoming open world ARPG independently developed by Diversity Game Studios. Read on to learn about its release date, what platforms it\'s coming to, and announcement history.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92qm.jpg'),(2519,'Tobor','2023-11-15','Point-and-click, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tobor is a spy simulator game where your mission is to observe an insane world using a surveillance camera. You have 7 days to gather intelligence and investigate the tragic story of Undercroft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e91.jpg'),(2520,'Typecast','2023-11-07','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Typecast is a bullet hell where you type to shoot. Get swarmed by enemies, manage the chaos, and climb the leaderboards in this unique arcade experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76rr.jpg'),(2521,'Miazma or the Devil\'s Stone','2018-05-02','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','MIAZMA is the second Jonathan Hunt adventure, sequel to award-winning FMV title Yoomurjak’s Ring. The agile NY journalist embarks on a new investigation after a curious meteorite. What is inside the devilish stone? Is it a huge gem, a magic formula or a devastating substance?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27m8.jpg'),(2522,'Quiz Thiz United Kingdom','2022-12-10','Quiz/Trivia','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Answer questions about this country and collect valuable points! Also, learn new facts about this country while playing!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vl5.jpg'),(2523,'Through the Murky Water',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','VHS mockumentary horror game. You\'re an employee of an underwater station. Something lurks in these depths. Something is waiting for you. Something calling to you. Make your way through the murky water.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rn8.jpg'),(2524,'Famicom Bunko: Hajimari no Mori','2013-08-21','Adventure','Wii, Wii U, Super Famicom','Hajimari no Mori is an Adventure game, developed by Pax Softonica and published by Nintendo, which was released in Japan in 1999.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3902.jpg'),(2525,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s: Help Wanted - Bundle','2021-10-08','Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Five Nights at Freddy’s VR: Help Wanted is a collection of classic and original mini-games set in the five nights universe. Survive terrifying encounters with your favorite killer animatronics in a collection of new and classic FIVE NIGHTS AT FREDDY’S experiences.\n\nThe Curse of Dreadbear DLC unlocks a new Halloween themed hub packed with spooky new mini-games and prizes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v6z.jpg'),(2526,'Wiz',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Wiz is a 2D pixel-art Metroidvania focused on exploration and skilled combat with great rewards. Enter the world of Wiz and try saving the land to restore light and balance for all living creatures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h0c.jpg'),(2527,'Gaslamp Cases 10: The Loch Ness Enigma',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2528,'Hexroll',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','A deckbuilding roguelike with dice! Collect dice and upgrade them to battle enemies. Purchase powerful artefacts to alter the battlefield and unlock many dice bags with different dice and abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lwq.jpg'),(2529,'Eutolant Saga','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Liberate the Fallen Kingdom and Ignite a New Hope! A classic fantasy SRPG featuring a simple system and a cast of captivating characters woven into an epic tale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qu0.jpg'),(2530,'Transformers: War for Cybertron Map and Character Pack','2010-07-27','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','The additional TRANSFORMERS characters entering the pack include SCATTERSHOT, ONSLAUGHT, SHOCKWAVE, DEMOLISHOR and JAZZ. Players have access to all five characters in the game\'s adrenaline-pumping, four-player co-op Escalation mode, and will be able to select their chassis to create their own TRANSFORMERS character in competitive multiplayer.\n\nAdditionally, four brand new multiplayer maps extend the diverse set of battlefields on which players can battle with or against their friends online. District and Forsaken allow fans to team up in all-new environments in Escalation mode, while Havok and Fortress deliver more frenetic gameplay in competitive multiplayer modes.\n\nDemolisher, Jazz and Shockwave were originally released as individual pre-order bonus codes from Amazon, BestBuy and GameStop respectively.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61ho.jpg'),(2531,'Fantastic 4 In A Row 2','2016-08-15','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fantastic 4 In A Row 2 is a modern version of the timeless classic, played on a distant planet with beautiful graphics and music. Participating players take turns dropping colored discs from the top of the screen into a vertically suspended grid.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vln.jpg'),(2532,'Stunt Paradise','2024-03-21','Platform, Racing, Sport, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Get ready for an adrenaline-fueled ride in Stunt Paradise! Take on epic challenges, perform insane stunts, and experience extreme driving. Buckle up and play now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80fm.jpg'),(2533,'Karma Collector','2022-09-16','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is an action combat game that is played with with the D and A keys or a controller. You earn experience points by defeating enemies. When you have earned enough your rank will increase, which raises your attributes such as your attack power. A tutorial is available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ht1.jpg'),(2534,'Cats Visiting Lunar New Year','2025-01-23','Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Celebrate Chinese New Year! Find 100 hidden cats in 5 festive drawings and collect all 12 zodiac animals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9akm.jpg'),(2535,'Venator Universe','2024-10-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Venator Universe is a sci-fi RPG survival game developed by VenatorGames. It aims to create a highly action-packed and hostile environment. The goal of the game is to survive, which requires players to gather resources, craft items, and improve themselves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co936d.jpg'),(2536,'The Sims 2: Celebration! Stuff','2007-04-03','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your Sims can now celebrate in style with this fun collection of furniture, party fashions, and décor items in The Sims 2: Celebration Stuff. Throw the ultimate celebrations with all-new items including delicious cakes, colorful paper lanterns, balloons, sparkling tiaras, and more. Host the social events of the season with your Sims! The pack includes two pre-made houses and 54 new items.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hhc.jpg'),(2537,'Monster 4x4: Masters of Metal','2003-11-25','Racing, Sport','Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Get ready to pilot the world\'s most powerful trucks and go head-to-head in pulse-pounding off-road competitions. You can pick from over 20 unstoppable Monster trucks, including Grave Digger, El Toro Loco, Bulldozer, Bounty Hunter, Blue Thunder, and Maximum Destruction. Whether you\'re grinding through mud pits in Louisiana, crunching up cliffs in California, or smashing up trees to make the ride a little bumpier for the guy behind you, keep your eyes on the prize: The cash you earn on the circuit goes to buy new trucks and build up your ultimate Monster machine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6udz.jpg'),(2538,'For All the People I Love','2025-02-12','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Follow the expression of Prince Mont Grand\'s scattered feelings through different sceneries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kw1.jpg'),(2539,'Shrek 2: Beg for Mercy!','2004-11-27','Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Shrek and friends are back in an all-new adventure in Shrek 2: Beg For Mercy! on Game Boy Advance. This action-oriented game features the acrobatics and swordplay of Puss in Boots. Additionally, Shrek 2: Beg for Mercy! allows players to control some of their other favourite characters, including Shrek and Donkey. Players can re-enact the story of Puss in Boots and discover just how he came to meet up with a large green ogre and a magical talking donkey. This side-scrolling adventure emphasizes combat-heavy gameplay with an intuitive input-driven combo system. Puss in Boots also has an assortment of enhanced acrobatic manoeuvres at his disposal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d2o.jpg'),(2540,'Digimon Adventure: Anode Tamer','2000-01-16','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','WonderSwan','The game is based on the popular manga series Digimon, which follows the adventures of children who can gain access into the digital world and fight digital monsters there. In this game, the evil Milenniamon has kidnapped several children and is planning to take control over the Digiworld. One of the good monsters, Agumon, escaped, and transported the hero Ryou to the Digiworld. Now Ryou has to fight monsters, capture them, and assemble an army to overthrow Milenniamon and to rescue his friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ssf.jpg'),(2541,'Sanguine Sanctum','2018-09-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It desires more. Feed It. Nourish It. Sanguine Sanctum is an atmospheric horror-exploration game with a low-poly, PS1 aesthetic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d9c.jpg'),(2542,'Stickman Killing Zombie','2024-04-12','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The stickman world is in a zombie epidemic- kill zombie stickmen with your epic red sword!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xau.jpg'),(2543,'Unbox The Cats','2025-03-26','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Find and rescue adorable cats hidden among boxes. Feed them treats to add them to your collection. Discover 100 unique cats in this casual puzzle game inspired by Minesweeper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kzo.jpg'),(2544,'Beneath a Dead City','2024-12-31','Simulator, Strategy','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Run your own Adventurer\'s Guild in this fantasy colony sim with a focus on dynamic storytelling. Recruit heroes to explore a ruined city, but keep an eye on those murder hobos. An unhappy hero could turn to arson, violence, and jaywalking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98ps.jpg'),(2545,'THE Misshitsukara no Dasshutsu: Unmei o Tsunagu 35 no Nazo','2018-06-21','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','The Father Who Vanished\n\nOur hero goes place to place, searching for his lost father with nothing but the mysterious key he left behind. Will he be able to escape the countless prisons his destinations inevitably become and find his parent?!\n\nWaking Up Imprisoned\n\nOur hero wakes up with a cell phone and a note. Though he has no memories to rely on, a mysterious woman appears in front of him - Kei.\n\nThey move forward, clinging to the only clue they can believe in, and come upon a shocking revelation...!\n\nWhat connecting truth lies under the mysteries of both stories? Play and find out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co306w.jpg'),(2546,'Nindo: Guardian of the Starlit Shadow','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"NINDO: Guardian of the Starlit Shadow\" is a ninja rogue-like deck-building game set in a beautiful Japanese-inspired world. Face powerful enemies, make strategic choices, and grow stronger to craft a unique battle style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qtp.jpg'),(2547,'Enshrouded World: Home Truths','2018-02-26','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your memories are beyond reach, a side effect of a life-saving operation. Stationed at an oxygen production facility you must oversee an exodus to the surface. When an army of rogue security devices is unleashed you commandeer a tank and choose your own unique path through the facility.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29av.jpg'),(2548,'Portal 2: Confinement','2024-01-16','Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Confinement is a Portal 2 mod featuring 28 challenging co-op puzzles based around the confinement mechanic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qu2.jpg'),(2549,'Fluffy Autumn','2022-09-23','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are Coco, a little lost kitten wandering aimlessly through Westpace Park until you meet Rocky. Your mission is to help Rocky find a bone that is lost somewhere in the park.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r2h.jpg'),(2550,'LEGO World Builder','2002-12-31','Puzzle','Web browser','World Builder is a Shockwave puzzle-platformer that was hosted on the official LEGO website in 2002. The player must collect LEGO pieces and the recipes that allow them to assemble those pieces into different kinds of units and vehicles. Each unit type has its own capabilities, allowing the player access new areas and collect more pieces and recipes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bq2.jpg'),(2551,'The Bodycam Shooter','2025-02-27','Shooter','Nintendo Switch','Fast, tactical, and relentless—survive the fight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gki.jpg'),(2552,'Shutsudou! Miniskirt Police','1997-09-25','Puzzle','Sega Saturn','A erotic table game exclusively for the Sega Saturn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pz3gwh6ed3u78yrhewci.jpg'),(2553,'Shovel Knight Dig','2022-09-23','Platform, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','When Drill Knight and his dastardly digging crew blast apart Shovel Knight’s peaceful campsite and steal his loot, he grabs his trusty Shovel Blade and starts tunnelling after them! Meet new friends and foes, visit strange lands, and outfit yourself in your quest to keep the entire land from collapsing underfoot! Jump, slash, and dig your way down an ever-changing chasm of mystery in Shovel Knight Dig, an all-new Shovel Knight adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iho.jpg'),(2554,'Sam & Max: The Devil\'s Playhouse - Episode 5: The City That Dares Not Sleep','2010-08-30','Point-and-click, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','This is the biggest Sam & Max game ever!\n\nIn Episode 5, an enormous, scaly, floppy-eared monster is rampaging through the city, and Sam assembles a crack team to stop him! To end the mayhem, they must venture...inside...the beast!\n\nWith an all star cast of heroes and villains – you’ll be riveted to your seat for each thrilling twist, and the truly shocking conclusion in this series finale episode!\n\n* Episode 1: The Penal Zone\n* Episode 2: The Tomb of Sammun-Mak\n* Episode 3: They Stole Max\'s Brain!\n* Episode 4: Beyond the Alley of the Dolls\n* Episode 5: The City That Dares Not Sleep - Finale','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jg7.jpg'),(2555,'Robot Hospice',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','\"Robot Hospice\" is a 2D pixel art adventure game where beloved robots spend their final days in a hospice. As a new staff member, you will gently yet painfully bid farewell to these cherished machines that once lived alongside humans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r6a.jpg'),(2556,'Blocky Blast','2025-05-09','Puzzle','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9sgi.jpg'),(2557,'Station Noctis','2025-04-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Find the damaged map in the waiting room of the station and arrive safely to the final station, Noctis Station. Please note that there are mannequins with bombs in each station!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n3v.jpg'),(2558,'So Many Me: Extended Edition','2020-01-16','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Filo is Filo, one of a kind or so he thought as he is woken from his peaceful sleep and eat life to go on a quest of great importance. Which he doesn’t really care much for the details so he just does. His journey however starts in a magical fountain which splits Filo’s essence into hundreds of clones each shaped by an individual part of his personality which are called Me’s. However they are all a part of him so they are compelled to move when he does. Me’s as well as Filo now also have the ability to turn into magical stone platforms which can be used for puzzle solving. Eating transmitter fruits changes the properties of the transformations. Filo can also work with the other Me’s to do special dances to allow them to transform into creatures like the Jellysaur or the Tankephaunt. He runs into other characters like Flora who seems to be a fan girl. Filo is supposed to be going after The organization called Cloud 9 in the world of Xio, runny Baron Vost. The rest he is just goofing off.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4doa.jpg'),(2559,'Paint It: Spooky Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2560,'Circuit: Laser Maze',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Love logic puzzles? Challenge yourself with 55 levels of 3D connect-the-point style laser puzzles! Combining colors and angles for a truly retro gaming experience. Use your knowledge of the color wheel and keen skills of spatial perception for some passively educational fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cqi.jpg'),(2561,'Midnight Star','2015-02-05','Shooter','iOS','Midnight Star is a first-person shooter for iOS from Industrial Toys.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/q2usgombi1noctqupq1q.jpg'),(2562,'MultiVersus: Season 3 - Sugar, Spice & Everything Nice!','2024-09-17','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Season 3 comes to MultiVersus with a dash of Chemical X from the Powerpuff Girls! All the way from Themyscira, Nubia joins the heroic line-up Mid-Season.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t9q.jpg'),(2563,'The Black Eyed Peas Experience','2011-11-08','Music','Wii, Xbox 360','The Black Eyed Peas Experience is a dance game along the lines of Dance Central or The Michael Jackson Experience. You follow along with the dance moves on the screen, like an aerobics tape that judges you at the end. It stars all your favorite band members like will.i.am, Fergie... uh...\nAnyway, The Experience works much in the same way any of these dance games do. For those of you that just want to have fun at a party, you can jump into any of the songs and dance. But the campaign mode is where you unlock new venues, clothing for your avatar, and learn the different routines step by step.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co213a.jpg'),(2564,'Fruits of Fury','2024-05-12','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lace up your boots! Fruits of Fury is a bullethell roguelike (bullet heaven) where you will decimate waves of fruit minions using an arsenal of unlockable and upgradeable skills. Then, step into the ring and face off against the champion fruit bosses as you journey from rookie to legend!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jhp.jpg'),(2565,'Battle of Empires: 1914-1918 - Battle of Cambrai',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Historical multiplayer reconstruction, dedicated to the offensive of the Entente forces at Cambrai in 1918.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2566,'Aureole: Wings of Hope','2025-05-15','Fighting, Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','At sonic speeds, Aureole: Wings of Hope takes platforming to the literal skies! Join Ramila and Ryleth on their crusade to reclaim their home from demonic forces in this unique physics-based side-scrolling game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76tp.jpg'),(2567,'MIKU: May I Keep Up?','2025-05-01','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A second-person physics-based platformer about love, loss, and the struggle to move on.\nParkour your way up through scattered memories of love in form of platforming challenges while you control two characters bound to each other by a thread while listening to healing journey of a man recovering from a heart wrenching breakup.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gqp.jpg'),(2568,'Ashes of the Singularity: Escalation - Turtle Wars',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dz9.jpg'),(2569,'Rurouni Kenshin: Meiji Kenkaku Roman-tan - Juuyuushi Inbou-hen',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Rurouni Kenshin: Meiji Kenkaku Roman-tan: Juuyuushi Inbou-hen is a role-playing based on the Rurouni Kenshin series which featured 2D fighting game inspired battles. It was released by Sony on the PlayStation system in Japan','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gf5.jpg'),(2570,'Pumpkin\'s Revenge',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2571,'Project ZipZap','2024-09-12','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hack and Dash through waves of enemies in Project ZipZap, an isometric, fast-paced, movement game. Chain together dash abilities to blitz through levels and race your way up the global leaderboards. Hone your skills and achieve mastery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pyj.jpg'),(2572,'Push 3D','2024-12-04','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Push 3D is a turn-based multiplayer board game, where the goal is to PUSH your opponent off the board!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pya.jpg'),(2573,'Spellweaver','2016-02-01','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Spellweaver is a fast-paced fantasy-themed online digital trading card game (TCG), created by a self-funded indie team of seasoned game developers with a passion for card games. The game focuses on strategic depth and variety, while still being easy to learn. It is a game true to the classics of the genre, while adding in unique features to make the game quick to learn, yet challenging for veteran fans of TCGs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rdk.jpg'),(2574,'Soupcosis','2025-03-17','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rec.jpg'),(2575,'Drift Alone','2020-04-15','Racing, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Feel the motion. Drift Alone is a drift racing indie game. The game focuses on simple controls and fun simcade style driving physics. Throw your car trough corners and get the best driftpoints to beat the game. Have fun and keep your car on the road!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oz0.jpg'),(2576,'Let Me In','2025-01-23','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a calm, quiet night. You can sit in your room and watch your favorite TV show. You can just relax and enjoy this calm night. But it looks like you have a guest. Someone decided to visit you. Someone who looks and talks pretty strange. You surely didn\'t wait for him.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rpc.jpg'),(2577,'LEGO Marvel\'s Avengers: Spider-Man Character Pack','2016-05-24','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One','This pack for LEGO Marvel\'s Avengers includes 8 new characters and outfits: Spider-Man, Peter Parker, Spider-Man (Miles Morales), Miles Morales, Spider-Man (Civil War), Iron Spider, Scarlet Spider, and Spider-Girl.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co531j.jpg'),(2578,'Pokémon Giratina Strikes Back','2017-10-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Players begin the game with one Pokémon, and can capture more using Poké Balls. They can also use their Pokémon to battle other Pokémon. When the player encounters a wild Pokémon or is challenged by a trainer to a battle, the screen switches to a turn-based battle screen where the Pokémon fight.\n\nDuring battle, the player may use a move, use an item, switch their active Pokémon, or flee, although fleeing is not an option in battles against trainers. All Pokémon have hit points (HP); when a Pokémon\'s HP is reduced to zero, it faints and cannot battle until it is revived.\n\nIf the player\'s Pokémon defeats the opposing Pokémon (causes it to faint), it receives experience points. After accumulating enough experience points, it will level up; most Pokémon evolve into a new species of Pokémon when they reach a certain level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yvj.jpg'),(2579,'Bananounce','2024-10-27','Simulator, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Idle game with banana bouncing everywhere!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zlb.jpg'),(2580,'Catoise','2023-01-24','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Make portals and levitate objects to solve puzzles - help Catoise get back home after a shopping trip in space ends in a crash landing. Collect parts of the damaged ship scattered across this strange planet. Meet friendly and unfriendly animal characters along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61rn.jpg'),(2581,'Puzzle Machine',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2582,'Traum',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2583,'Project P',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2584,'Blazing Crow','2024-08-17','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blazing Crow is a SLG-based puzzle game(PUZ). The goal is to destroy all the electric towers! 4 action points can be allocated each round to move, use branches and attack towers. Dodge the spreading flames, they will kill anything; dodge the human shots, the bullets will destroy everything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ffd.jpg'),(2585,'Alien Brigade','1990-12-31','Shooter','Atari 7800','Alien Brigade is a side scrolling shooter similar to Operation Wolf. Aliens have arrived on earth and have brainwashed both soldiers and civilians in order to take over the world. Your job is to stop them! On each of the five levels you will have a different objective to complete, including saving civilians and destroying alien installations. Throughout the levels there will be numerous aliens and brainwashed people you will need to shoot, as well as attacking tanks, helicopters, and more. After shooting enemies a bonus may sometimes be left behind; if you shoot this, you can earn additional ammo, more powerful weapons, or increased health. If you don\'t shoot fast enough and are hit by enemy fire your health will slowly decrease; the game ends when all of your health is gone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pez.jpg'),(2586,'Dark Souls II: Crown of the Old Iron King','2014-08-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Dark Souls II: Crown of the Old Iron King is the second DLC expansion for Dark Souls II, released in August 2014. It takes players to Brume Tower, a massive, decrepit structure filled with new enemies, challenging bosses, and treacherous environments. The expansion adds new weapons, armour, and spells, as well as additional lore that delves into the history of the Old Iron King.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vv1.jpg'),(2587,'Dungeon Explorer: Warriors of Ancient Arts','2008-02-19','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation Portable, Nintendo DS','In Dungeon Explorer: Warrior of the Ancient Arts, players are trained in weaponry and mystical forces and embark on a quest and ready to uncover the fate of a legendary kingdom. DE: WAA features hundreds of variations of weapons, armor and equipment that can be chosen and upgraded throughout the adventure to defeat enemies. Unique for the PSP system, players have the ability to choose their warfare style with more than 150 different kinds of fighting arts, including Big Bang Arts, allowing three players to team up to triple their destructive power in Ad-Hoc Multiplayer mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nkr.jpg'),(2588,'Spider-Man 2: The Game','2004-08-29','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Spider-Man 2\" for PC and Mac is an almost completely different game than its console counterpart. This is not a port from the console version, but a different version developed by The Fizz Factor and published by Activision.\n\nAs Spider-Man you must battle out through 8 chapters of mischief and mayhem to succeed. Along the way you will encounter and have to battle old foes like Rhino, Mysterio, Puma, Doc Ock and more. The game interface consists of a simple point and click system coupled with keyboard movement. Unlike it\'s console counterpart there is no free swinging movement but one designed with kids in mind.\n\nFighting consists of basic punching, kicking, jumpkicks and a power meter that let\'s you do a supercharged attack. \'Spidey\' can also zip to walls and objects and use his web to do basic attacks on enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4es6.jpg'),(2589,'Looping Doors: Subway','2025-02-03','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are stuck in a loop in a subway station. And there are two buttons in front of you. You need to press the right button 20 times to get out of this loop. Memorize where the items are in the subway station in level 0. You need to find out if there are any anomalies in the next levels. If there are, press the red button, if not, press the green button. One mistake will send you back to level 0. Good luck...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rdk.jpg'),(2590,'Vive le Roi 3','2021-02-21','Platform, Puzzle','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','«Vive le Roi 3» is a puzzle and anticipation game, without chance or timing, based on mini puzzles to be solved by choosing the right ladder on each floor to reach the king and save him from his executioner.\n\nInspired by the concept of labyrinths, the originality of «Vive le Roi 3» is to be able to modify the state of the active elements of the levels according to your choices.\n\nThe levels are made up of numerous obstacles, such as doors, monsters, moving guards, tunnels… They are also made up of multicolored switches allowing to invert the states of the obstacles in order to clear a path.\n\nCrowns are placed at the end of the level and the player will have to collect them in order to collect all the cards of the kings of France.\n\nThis brain game features 1000 levels to resolve, 5296 crowns to collect and 66 French kings to discover.\n\nThe third opus has a richer narrative thanks to the history of France told through the 66 cards to collect.\n\nUnlike previous «Vive le Roi» or even Limbo-like, the gameplay is mostly based on logic and anticipation concepts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nxz.jpg'),(2591,'LEGO DC Super-Villains: Aquaman Pack 2','2019-01-08','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The second of two packs for LEGO DC Super-Villains inspired by the 2018 film Aquaman. It includes Aquaman, Vulko, Trench, Murk, Brine King, and Orm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xqz.jpg'),(2592,'LEGO Friends Heartlake Rush',NULL,'Racing','Android, iOS','Race through Heartlake City in this free LEGO racing game! Have fun with Olivia on the race track or download the app for the full play experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bf3.jpg'),(2593,'Rocksmith','2012-10-12','Music, Simulator','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Rocksmith\'s innovative game design makes playing music visually intuitive and will engage experienced musicians as well as those who have never picked up a guitar in their lives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w59.jpg'),(2594,'Tales Beyond The Tomb: The Farm\'s Secret','2024-12-22','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Tales Beyond The Tomb\" is a chilling episodic horror series that plunges players into the shadows of real-life cases.\n\nThis is the second episode of the series:\n\nEpisode 2: The Farm\'s Secret\nDragged into a web of secrets and lies, Samantha seems to be part of a puzzle impossible to solve. What once seemed obvious soon turns into something far more sinister, and the line between villain and victim begins to blur.\n\nNothing is as it seems. How far will you go to uncover the truth?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97df.jpg'),(2595,'Nidana','2025-12-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','She continues to dream. A first-person dream simulator where you explore a corner of a dream.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qeu.jpg'),(2596,'Dead Mall','2024-08-06','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Christmas is tomorrow, and what better place to do your holiday shopping than the town\'s abandoned mall? Collect as many gift boxes as you can, bring them to the getaway car, and make your escape!\n\nExplore an ever-changing/procedurally-generated mall, watch out for power outages, and if you\'re lucky, you may even catch a meet-and-greet with Frosty the snowman...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9riw.jpg'),(2597,'Operation Outsmart',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Physics-based sandbox game where you build wacky machines to solve environmental puzzles. Create alloys from a mix of metals to reinforce your builds, recruit koalas to operate your weapons, solve puzzles to get rewarded with parts and weapons, and save the island from the erupting volcano!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lcp.jpg'),(2598,'Traitors in Salem','2022-04-22','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Social deduction game from the creators of Town of Salem, BlankMediaGames','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48g7.jpg'),(2599,'Caravan Quest: Discover America',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2600,'FaithEater','2024-04-21','Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In a world where humans hunt the Gods for a chance at hope, you have betrayed the Faith Eaters. Given the highest punishment, you\'ve been thrown into the Cathedral at the End of the World, where the God of Death Muerte has been imprisoned. You expect it to devour you without mercy. Instead, it offers you hope. The very same hope the Faith Eaters have taken away.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kri.jpg'),(2601,'Eiyuden Chronicle: Hundred Heroes - The Chapter of Seign','2025-03-13','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jgt.jpg'),(2602,'Mafia Solitaire 2',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2603,'Street Outlaws 2: Winner Takes All','2021-09-21','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The stakes have just been raised! In this high-octane release, you’ll have to prove your mettle in some of the roughest and most and unforgiving track and street races across the United States. Your success and reputation will all depend on how you perform, your strategy on modding your car, and ultimately, how much outlaw credibility you earn along the way. Do you have what it takes to be crowned the Winner Takes All National Champion? Choose your crew, choose your car, get the hell in and drive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ipb.jpg'),(2604,'Crossroad Mysteries: The Broken Deal','2017-09-01','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Anna goes to the places of her childhood. She hopes to get cured from strange disease. This is the last chance to find out the cause of her misery. Whether she ever recover and at what price?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23n7.jpg'),(2605,'Roads of the Middle Ages: Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2606,'Providentia Academy','2024-12-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Providentia Academy is a 2D visual novel with the themes of romance, mystery and horror.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pye.jpg'),(2607,'Tiny Tales: Hidden Objects','2024-11-20','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore charming scenarios, find 3, 5, or 7 hidden objects in 20 stunning levels. Become a master in the search for carefully concealed secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92mu.jpg'),(2608,'Triforce: The Topologies of Zelda','2018-12-31','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Topologies of Zelda: Triforce is a head melting non-euclidean puzzle adventure in which you attempt to collect three Triforce pieces while traversing a The Legend of Zelda\'s inspired 2D world that\'s mapped onto rotatable 3D structures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bzn.jpg'),(2609,'Royal Detective: Legend of the Golem','2017-08-21','Point-and-click, Puzzle','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Elephant Games is back with a new case that only the Royal Detective can solve!\n\nThe peaceful town of Glanville is under attack! Each day, a golem arrives, leaving a trail of destruction and terror in its wake! But each new golem is even stronger than the last, and they\'re evolving into an unstoppable destructive force. You\'ve been called in to help defeat the mysterious Master and their stone-cold creations. With the help of some friends, follow the clues to discover who the Master is and what they have in store for the town. Find hidden objects and solve puzzles to help you along the way. The townspeople are counting on you. Do you have what it takes to help them before it\'s too late?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8njb.jpg'),(2610,'Instant War','2022-07-08','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark into a military strategy RTS game, in a world where your battle tactics and your army strategy are the keys to victory.\nInstant war : Ultimate Warfare delivers an amazing battlefield experience. As a commander, you must develop your military base and lead your army (tanks, soldiers, anti-aircraft units, etc..) through the battles in order to climb the ranks of this 4X RTS tank war game.\n\nJoin an alliance and defeat your opponents, using a large action pannel available : army reinforcement, battle tactics, real-time strategy, assault forces, drone and even airstrike. In this 4X game, you can fight for strategic territories or ressources points.\nChose wisely how to manage your ressources and massive army in order to defend your base from the other players. All your actions are in real-time strategy, so you can cooperate with your friend in order to defeat the toughest foes. As a multiplayer 4X game, the key to your victory will be your military strategy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hfu.jpg'),(2611,'Last Day Lockdown',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Bid farewell to the mundane and embrace the extraordinary as you step into \"Last Day Lockdown,\" a thrilling office escape puzzle that transforms your farewell into an unforgettable journey!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c8a.jpg'),(2612,'Pug and Seek',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2613,'Climber: Sky is the Limit','2024-09-19','Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Climber: Sky is the Limit is a unique survival and simulation game where players become winter climbers. To succeed you need to plan your journey, prepare appropriate equipment, choose a trail, face extreme weather conditions and survive. Only the sky is the limit!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lmw.jpg'),(2614,'Sonic & Sega All-Stars Racing with Banjo-Kazooie','2010-03-04','Racing','Xbox 360','In a frantic battle to the checkered flag, Sonic and friends speed around tracks set in medieval castle ramparts, lush rainforests and bustling cities, all taken from the visually rich and varied universes of Sonic and SEGA. Fan favorites such as Dr. Eggman, Tails, AiAi, Amigo and many more will join Sonic in their custom built vehicles, revving their engines and jostling to stay ahead of the pack. Each character will speed around the track in cars, planes, motorbikes, and in Aiai’s case – a banana mobile! Secret short cuts, swift handling and avoiding strategically placed obstacles are certainly the best way to get to the top of the podium.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ah2.jpg'),(2615,'Oath',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Oath is a new free-to-play open world action combat, sandbox MMORPG from Ready-Up Studios built with the powerful Unreal Engine 4 and SpatialOS! It features action-based combat with many classes to choose from including Berserker, Pyromancer, Rogue, Guardian, Knight, Ranger, Cryomancer, and more coming. Oath also has advanced social systems such as the revolutionized Guild Land system which allows guilds to purchase land and build their own base that enables special features.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s7j.jpg'),(2616,'Pebble Witch','2020-12-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play as a witch. Talk to pebbles. Reflect on the melancholy of becoming. Sit more. Walk. More walking. Have a crush on your burly teacher. Enjoy a lovely day in an Australian beach town.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qw8.jpg'),(2617,'Friday Night Funkin\': VS Spider-Man - Volume II','2022-01-07','Music, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight against the one and only Friendly Neighborhood Spider-Man in the new FNF mod \"Vs. Spider-Man\".\n\nBut that\'s not all, fight against a guy who leaks your IP address (Mysterio).\n\nA symbiote who\'s fallen from space and took captive of an innocent human (Venom).\n\nNow with v2, fight along with Spider-man to defeat his greatest enemies such as Doctor Otto Octavious, A man who fell into a pool of eels! (Electro) and last but not least, the man Spider-man hates the most.. the one and only Norman Osborn aka Green Goblin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5r82.jpg'),(2618,'The Gold River Project','2025-09-30','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Single or multiplayer open world camping adventure game where you and your friends are offered a remote camping trip. One week turns into several as you suspect your guide is never coming back. Deserted, you discover you are trapped in an experiment to see if you can survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98j5.jpg'),(2619,'Are You Alone?',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have been accepted into a secret project.\n\nAnswer the questions on the screen, simple enough.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rfm.jpg'),(2620,'Project Borealis: Prologue','2024-11-11','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Project Borealis: Prologue is a fan-made game which expands on the classic episodic series by Valve Software. Return to a snow covered Ravenholm and experience the iconic town reimagined in an arctic atmosphere and modern graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91zb.jpg'),(2621,'Hataraku Otona no Renai Jijou','2016-01-29','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9by1.jpg'),(2622,'Pokémon Platinum Redux​','2024-01-12','Sin género','Nintendo DS','Platinum Redux is a difficulty/enhancement ROM hack of Platinum. It aims to provide a more challenging Platinum experience with focus on teambuilding and battling. As a completed ROM hack, Platinum Redux includes all 493 catchable Pokémon.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2623,'Donkey Kong II','2001-02-21','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A digital simulator based on the Game & Watch Multi Screen handheld under the same name.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c0s.jpg'),(2624,'Psychopathy Assessment',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2625,'Red Door Ylw Door','2024-07-19','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Red Door Yellow Door is a first-person psychological horror game. Starting with what seems like a normal ritual but quickly revealing its sinister nature. Beware, something malevolent lurks in the shadows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ijr.jpg'),(2626,'Ah!Zombies HD','2012-03-21','Arcade','iOS','Ferocious as the earthquake, unstoppable as the deadly plague, inconceivable as aliens, they shatter the civilization and throughout our entire world in no time, here comes the No.1 destruction force: Zombies!\n\nThe story is about a bunch of heroes guarding a school bus to the security shelter in the zombie doomsday. The stunning visual effects and exciting gameplay will rock you to the max! Don’t lose your vigilance to those stupid looking zeds, prepare to say goodbye to this cruel world if you facing them without some badass gears.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ile.jpg'),(2627,'Cosmic Fantasy Collection 2','2023-12-14','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','A collection of the three final games in the Cosmic Fantasy series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9841.jpg'),(2628,'Zero Escape Trilogy',NULL,'Puzzle, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86n6.jpg'),(2629,'Shoot Crow',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2630,'Barony: Myths & Outcasts','2019-02-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Adventure through the Barony dungeons as the evil monster races and all new classes, providing dozens of new gameplay combinations. Or play with a monster skin, just for fun! Play with others whether or not they own this DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jbt.jpg'),(2631,'Kamikaze Lassplanes','2024-08-30','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Fly and fall for powerful Lassplanes! Discover a hand-crafted anime VN with story-driven arcade shoot-\'em-up gameplay. Take part in a romantic story with drama and comedic elements set in a steampunk Kingdom filled with magic and torn by a brutal war. Decide the fate of your country and heart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hzv.jpg'),(2632,'Project Borealis',NULL,'Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Project Borealis\" is an unofficial version of \"Half-Life 2: Episode 3\" with the original script made by \"Marc Laidlaw\" before leaving Valve Software.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1knq.jpg'),(2633,'Street Fighter IV: Arena','2014-06-24','Fighting','Android, iOS','Street Fighter IV: Arena is a mobile fighting game based on the Street Fighter IV line of games. It introduces leveling-up and social game trappings to the mix. This title was exclusive to Korea.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w6h.jpg'),(2634,'LittleBigPlanet: Pirates of the Caribbean Level Kit','2009-12-22','Platform','PlayStation 3','Get Sackboy ready for adventure with this downloadable collection of Pirates of the Caribbean goodies, including tons of stickers, music and a Cannibal costume.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kph.jpg'),(2635,'Quest: Brian\'s Journey','2000-02-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Game Boy Color','Brian lives in a peaceful and quiet town where nothing ever happens, which is the way everyone likes it. Suddenly, hordes of evildoers overrun the town and start wreaking havoc in this once-sleepy community. The town is counting on Brian to go on a quest to restore peace and harmony. You take control of the unlikely hero and set out on the adventure of a lifetime. While traveling, you will discover something more nefarious is happening, and you\'ll have your hands full of monsters and enemies. Throughout your journey you will have to battle these monsters and enemies in turn-based combat with a twist. The twist is that you can move between turns to dodge attacks, and you can also combine spells and attacks to create special moves. Help Brian save his town, and maybe even the world, in QUEST RPG: Brian\'s Journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kyt.jpg'),(2636,'Sunshower','2025-03-17','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Sunshower is a colorful, casual arcade action game that follows a robot\'s survival in a rain storm! Use the plant installed on your head to reach for the sky as you achieve high scores and stop the rain from washing away the world. Enjoy a transforming, traditionally illustrated watercolor background and fun new music that appear as you gain more points. And, as you play more, find out what the robot you\'re controlling, Hinata, thinks of your time playing together.\n\nCollect, combine, and chain power-ups to stop the rainfall! Gain more strength to carry more drops, increase your speed, or use an umbrella to deflect one drop. Every playthrough is unique!\n\nUnlock an alternate, more challenging single player mode! You can also find 8 different customization options for Hinata! Try local co-op to reach for your highest score with a friend or compete to see who comes out on top!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ofr.jpg'),(2637,'Just Crow Things','2024-08-15','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Play as a cute crow, fly around town, poop on people, and steal their shiny trinkets! In this sandbox-y adventure game, help your animal friends create adorable chaos and have a beak-tastic time customizing your adorable crow appearance! Why? Just caws!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70ln.jpg'),(2638,'Zorovan Powerplant','2023-08-09','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A VHS Found Footage Urbex Simulation horror with emphasis on atmosphere, unpredictability, realism, focusing on the feeling of providing a realistic solo urban exploration in a abandoned military owned soviet era powerplant and the feeling of being stalked by aliens.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7q1c.jpg'),(2639,'Divo','2013-01-05','Platform, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Divo - This is an unusual, bright and dynamic arcade game, where you control a hamster in a cyber wheel! Our hero must, within a limited time, reach the finishing point of the level while simultaneously avoiding collisions with enemies and collecting all sorts of bonuses, to successfully complete each level! The game also has various elements of puzzles, where you have to find certain items in order to pass a certain obstacle. Levels are designed as a large tower (tower rotation depends on the movement of the main character) around which are placed all the game elements: platforms, teleporters, traps, etc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fl54hniukf8vcqwgynpi.jpg'),(2640,'Deep Snow Delivery','2024-07-07','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Humanity is on the brink of extinction due to a self-inflicted ice age. Navigate the frozen wastes in an ancient WW2 tank fitted with a storage bucket and claw arm. Collect and sell junk, make deliveries between underground settlements, navigate mountainous terrain, and buy upgrades to make your job easier.\n\nThousands like you have tried and failed to undo humanity’s mistakes. Will your story be different?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yuo.jpg'),(2641,'The Treasures of Montezuma 3','2011-05-19','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Match tokens to unlock incredible riches in The Treasures of Montezuma 3! With Casual and Timed modes to enjoy, 160 levels to beat, and dozens of mind-bending mini-puzzles to solve, you could be in the jungle for months!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xqm.jpg'),(2642,'Firescape','2025-02-23','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Firescape is a short game where you play as a firefighter. Need to put out a fire? Use your fire extinguisher! Need to get to the fire if it\'s too high? Fly your fire extinguisher! But be careful, something hides in the fog. He is watching. He always watches. He knows, you are somewhere here. Try to stay inside or he will see you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rpe.jpg'),(2643,'Last Space Mission','2020-07-23','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Last Space Mission is a 3D Wave Shooter in the space where you are the pilot of a spaceship whose planet has been conquered. Fight back and show them that you are the best star pilot in the galaxy and a cunning warrior.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co456n.jpg'),(2644,'Marsupilami: Hoobadventure','2021-10-06','Platform, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Discover with Marsupilami: Hoobadventure, a brand new adventure inviting young players and adult alike to take control of the three Marsupilamis from the Palombian forsest.\n\nPunch, Twister and Hope are three Marsupilamis living a peaceful life in Palombia. Their lives are about to take a drastic turn when they accidentally open a sarcophagus whilst playing with debris on a beach, releasing a mysterious ghost cursing all the animals! Thankfully, our three Marsupilamis are immune to the curse and decide to set out on an adventure and find the ghost and reverse the curse.\n\nInspired by the comic book Marsupilami from Franquin, this 2.5D platformer will take you on a colorful journey through the Palombian jungle, a coastal city and even an abandoned temple. Jump, punch, dash and swing with your tail like only Marsupilamis do!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31am.jpg'),(2645,'Pathfinder: Kingmaker - Beneath the Stolen Lands','2019-05-24','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Meet with the self-proclaimed protector of Golarion, and discover what secrets lie buried beneath the Stolen Lands, in a shifting labyrinth of madness where nothing is what it seems, complete with dangerous enemies to battle and ancient treasures to unearth. Defend the lands against one of the most deadly enemies the world has ever faced.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cdw.jpg'),(2646,'Corona Simulator: Savior Edition',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','The Savior Edition, includes cool new features, like premium UI themes, more game events, and a new virus strain. Additionally, 20% of the revenue made with this Edition will get donated to the WHO COVID-19 Solidarity Response Fund.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2647,'Blast Rush Classic','2020-05-04','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Legacy Mobile Device','Blasting is everything in this infinite-bomb shoot-em-up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mcr.jpg'),(2648,'Lovely Lisa and Friends','2010-03-28','Simulator','Nintendo DS','FASHION IS FUN WITH LISA AND HER FRIENDS!\n\nLovely Lisa helps younger girls learn the importance of having fun and working hard while earning your way to your own fashion style! Earn Lisa-points by perfecting your beauty skills and techniques, helping out around the house and even learning what it takes to become a successful career girl! Providing a well-rounded approach to beauty and fashion, Lovely Lisa rewards girls with gorgeous accessories, original clothes and fabulous hairstyles and make-up! Prove you’ve got what it takes in the Heart Hills pageant-with-a-difference! Only the girl with the best skills in all categories can win – because after all, beauty is only skin deep!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/kupeuv7smrtlwks3wy5x.jpg'),(2649,'Call of LDPR','2021-01-19','Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Call of LDPR is a variable first-person shooter that tells about the life of ordinary people in Russia, whose life is radically changed by the arrival of the LDPR party in their hinterland. Such Runet personalities as Ilya Madisson, Yuri Khovansky, and Vladimir Zhirinovsky himself took part in the scoring of the project.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2okv.jpg'),(2650,'Anomaly Exit','2024-04-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You were on your way home one day when you realised the train was stopping at the same station over, and over again... at least you thought they were all the same station...\n\nTaking elements from Exit 8 and I\'m On Observation Duty, Anomaly Exit fuses the spot-the-difference genre with psychological horror. Additionally, the experience is designed with singleplayer and multiplayer in mind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co816h.jpg'),(2651,'The Raincoat Man',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The Raincoat Man is a third person horror game. Through the years the legend of the raincoat man haunted the Rocksfield City and now he is back to catch you. Be aware, he is always looking for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5g8y.jpg'),(2652,'Not Dead Yet','2020-12-15','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kill zombies, buy better gear, die, repeat. You can also play with 3 other friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t69.jpg'),(2653,'Ryte: The Eye of Atlantis','2021-01-27','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','SteamVR','With a little help from the Historia Time Travel agency, set sail to the city of Atlantis for a VR Myst-ical adventure : Fill in the sandals of an Atlantean who recently broke out of prison, wield supernatural powers, solve esoteric puzzles and try to prevent the End of Atlantis !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2omz.jpg'),(2654,'PC Building Simulator: Overclockers UK Workshop','2021-04-14','Simulator, Indie','Nintendo Switch','Build your PCs in the HQ of Overclockers UK – the legendary PC shop and home of world-famous overclocker 8Pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d8n.jpg'),(2655,'Ishidó: The Way of Stones','1990-12-07','Puzzle, Strategy','Family Computer Disk System, PC-9800 Series, Sharp X68000, PC-8800 Series, Mac, DOS, FM Towns, Amiga, MSX','Ishido: The Way of Stones is a puzzle video game released in 1990 by Accolade and developed by Publishing International. It was designed by Michael Feinberg and programmed by Ian Gilman and Michael Sandige. Producer was Brad Fregger, and Brodie Lockard (the designer of the Shanghai computer game) contributed with graphics.\n\n\"One misty spring morning in 1989, in the remote mountains of China\'s Han Shan province, a Mendicant monk of the Northern School of the White Crane branch of Taoism, walked silently out through the front gates of the Heavenly Peak Temple\nThe monk carried a stone board, a set of seventy-two carved stone pieces, and an ancient scroll inscribed with brush and ink in elegant calligraphic script.\nHe also carried with him a secret which had lain cloistered and hidden for thousands of years.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a18.jpg'),(2656,'Flipper Soccer','2023-10-05','Sport, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play a quick game of Flipper Soccer - the game that mixes football with pinball. Control the flippers to score goals against your opponent, who can be your friend or the computer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lq9.jpg'),(2657,'Shopping Clutter 23: Beauty Salon',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2658,'EA Sports College Football 26: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Sport','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9sgl.jpg'),(2659,'Etrian Odyssey II HD','2023-06-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Etrian Odyssey II HD rebirths the timeless adventure of the mysterious floating castle.\n\nBuild your own party from twelve different classes of heroes and climb through the Yggdrasil tree to reach the clouds and uncover the truth of High Lagaard.\n\nNew features included remastered graphics, a remastered soundtrack, quality of life improvements, difficulty options and save slots','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64r3.jpg'),(2660,'Dawn: Instagram Model','2022-03-08','Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A short story of an Instagram model.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jxe.jpg'),(2661,'The Hermit Chronicles','2023-06-16','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Hermit Chronicles is a 1st-person survival horror game set in a deep forest. Assuming the role of a hermit, you will have to get food, scout your neighborhood, and search for resources to make gear. But after the sun goes down, you\'ll have to survive for real...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ijn.jpg'),(2662,'BattleCry: Age of Myths',NULL,'Strategy','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are one of the commanders in training, under the new emperor\'s rules. Command your army and fight against oncoming enemies in the battlefield. Add different types of soldiers and try new formations to win the battles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j32.jpg'),(2663,'LEGO Dimensions: Micheal Knight (Knight Rider) Fun Pack',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w80.jpg'),(2664,'Box \'n\' Robot','2021-03-21','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Box \'n \' Robot is an old school box pushing puzzle game with randomly generated levels. Walk around a ship filled with boxes, with the task of turning off all the lights.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9io5.jpg'),(2665,'Action Replay Max','2003-09-05','Sin género','PlayStation 2','Action Replay MAX is the most powerful PS2 game enhancer ever made. It’s packed with cheats and enhancements for your favourite games, lets you play import DVD\'s on your local PS2, and can be updated over the internet or by typing in new codes.\n\nThe world\'s most powerful cheat code system and video game enhancer is now better than ever before! Action Replay MAX once again takes PlayStation 2 game enhancement to a higher level.\n\nAction Replay MAX is packed with game-busting codes, allowing you to beat your PS2 games with a whole host of 100% unofficial cheats you won\'t find anywhere else. Instantly acquire MAX health, ammo and money. Unlock secret characters, levels, vehicles and much, much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3i3s.jpg'),(2666,'Covetous','2010-07-23','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Given a chance at life, a choice must be made by a being whose tragic fate is to parasitically grow inside another.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fr1.jpg'),(2667,'Kuro Neko','2021-03-17','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kuro Neko is a 2D platformer. In Kuro Neko you have got lost and you must find your way home by collecting oil lanterns and avoiding monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46ju.jpg'),(2668,'Wanna Peek? Candy Bunnies','2023-04-08','Puzzle','Web browser','Wanna Peek? Candy Bunnies is an Easter-themed hentai puzzle game inspired by the Gals Panic series. The player must strategically draw lines to remove sections of the overlay, gradually revealing the hidden bunny girl images beneath. However, they must evade enemies, as both the player and the drawn line are vulnerable to attacks.\n\nThe player can defeat enemies by trapping them within segments, earning valuable rewards such as bonus time, extra lives, and power-ups. Each main level also contains a hidden Easter egg, which, when discovered and the basket is captured, unlocks a special bonus level and exclusive artwork.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9khm.jpg'),(2669,'Seth',NULL,'Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as Seth, the God of Chaos. Break the legions of Apophis in a mythological Fast-FPS/Rogue-Lite, in a mix between Ancient Egypt and Science Fantasy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90ki.jpg'),(2670,'LEGO Dimensions: The Wicked Witch Fun Pack',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w83.jpg'),(2671,'Drome Racers','2002-11-20','Racing','Game Boy Advance','Tensions are high as you await the first stage of the Drome Championship.You\'ve trained for the intensity of Multi-Challenge Racing; each race a seamless set of stages, mixing tracks from realistically stunning City, Mountain, and Canyon environments.\n\nNow you must prove you\'re up to that grueling challenge. With high-tech racing machines based on new cars from the 2002 LEGO Racers construction toy range, Drome Racers is a racing experience like no other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84q2.jpg'),(2672,'Mystery of Fortune 2','2016-08-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Android, iOS','Mystery of Fortune 2 is the eight episode of the Fortune Chronicle saga and the official sequel to Mystery of Fortune. Explore dungeons with your own army and try to make the most efficient corps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9flr.jpg'),(2673,'Ominous','2024-08-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ominous is a thriller/horror game for up to 4 players. In this game, you must collaborate with your teammates to face a creature within an indoor setting. What sets Ominous apart is its unique approach to multiplayer, offering a distinct experience compared to many other horror games available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co836e.jpg'),(2674,'Land Air Sea Warfare HD','2010-05-06','Strategy','iOS','Dominate in this real time strategy game! Fortify your base with turrets, surface to air missile launchers, torpedo launchers, and long range cannons. Next create factories to pump out legions of vehicles, aircraft, and ships to wage war with, you decide what to build. Form groups and transport units to prepare for an assault on the enemy! Finally execute your strategic battle plan and enjoy the immense carnage that ensues. With unique explosions, wreckages, sound effects, and animations for every unit the carnage is as beautiful as it is deadly. Discover and mine unique resources to build gigantic mega units which can turn the tides of war instantly!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2675,'Ridevery','2023-10-18','Racing, Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the game you have to become the fastest and most reliable pizza delivery guy, conquering realistic city streets on your high-speed scooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76zy.jpg'),(2676,'Rocket Fruit','2021-03-23','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Android','Rocket Fruit is a free 3D arcade game you can play whenever you want. Use your boost to find your way up through the platforms, and try not to get hit by the knifes.\nWell, there are plenty of goals you can reach by collecting the coins you get from boosting through a platform. There are different type of fruits you can buy in the shop, it is always a surprise if you want to buy a fruit, because the shop is random!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vg3.jpg'),(2677,'Puzzle Paradise','2025-03-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on an exciting adventure where you will have to investigate the mysterious disappearance of a local resident. Use your powers of observation and logical thinking to solve a variety of puzzles, collect clues and reconstruct the events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9py6.jpg'),(2678,'Pumpkin Clicker',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2679,'Mosey the Pirate',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mosey the Pirate is the official Flying Spaghetti Monster action-adventure role-playing game, with the titular Mosey, a Pirate from the FSM canon, as the story\'s protagonist! Follow Mosey on the adventure that is his life, as he rises from being another lowly, down-on-his-luck short-order cook under the cruel employ of Phil the Night Manager, to becoming the world’s first Pirate, one of the chosen, holiest, and most chill people of the Flying Spaghetti Monster.\n\nExplore an open satirical variant of the ancient Mediterranean, craft an assortment of useful items, manage your own crew as the captain of the mighty Lasagna, combat all sorts of hilariously devious enemeis, and discover the true meaning of being a Pirate!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gwr.jpg'),(2680,'Godessess\' Whim',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2681,'Magic Shot','2015-04-08','Sport, Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','Magic Shot is an experimental billiard game. Based on traditional French Billiards, players have to touch both the yellow and red balls with the white cue ball in a single go. If only it was that simple! The table morphs after each successful shot.\n\nMagic Shot has three different modes to fit your every mood- Meditation, Purity and Insanity. In Meditation mode you will discover a new table at every step along the journey, each named after a city. In the course of 2763 levels, memory and imagination are invoked, linking the table shape with the character of the place name. The aim of Purity mode is to get as high a score as possible. Unlock the ‘Ultra’ phase, accessed by playing perfect shots in a row, and multiply your points while avoiding the decaying table. For Insanity, this is where it gets insane! The table changes continually, the clock\'s counting down and the pressure is on to get the highest score possible. All players will be able to track their progress on a global Leaderboard. Magic Shot mixes game design and an artistic approach to push the limit between minimalism and entertainment. The unique audio specifically crafted in collaboration with Renaud Bénard using ‘Little bits’, combined with this innovative redesign of classic French Billiards, will surprise you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hddwkkfetdxyspndkjpg.jpg'),(2682,'Astérix & Obélix XXL 2: Mission Wifix','2006-11-17','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation Portable','The PSP port of Astérix & Obélix XXL 2: Mission Las Vegum adds a multiplayer mode that can accommodate up to four players for team and objective-based missions. One team must achieve an objective (collecting herbs, defending the village, stealing a magic potion) while the other must prevent it. AI-controlled teammates can join in if there aren\'t enough players available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kws.jpg'),(2683,'Hollow 2','2021-12-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Once again, you are on board Shakhter-One. Traverse the deck of a well-known mining ship and depths of Mark\'s twisted mind blended together. What really happened to this place? How your past is connected to the present events? Run, fight, hide, explore – do your best to destroy Shakhter-One.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42i8.jpg'),(2684,'Tiger Tank 59 I: Winter Assault MP042',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','\"Tiger Tank 59 I Winter Assault\" is a top-down shooting gameIn this game. Players need to control their tanks, through the enemy lines, break the enemy base, or defeat the enemy tanks. The DLC include map pack 042.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2685,'BrickFall: Fun Game of Bricks',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2686,'NoReload Heroes','2018-07-19','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','NoReload Heroes is a chaotic co-op party shooter for up to four people. Work as a team to beat the accidental evil you created, and be sure to pick up the best magitech guns on the way, or it\'s back to the bottom floor with you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27n8.jpg'),(2687,'Poker Quest','2022-11-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','♠♥♦♣ Poker Quest is a fantasy roguelike card battle game set in a vast world of castles, knights, wizards, and dragons. All your power comes from a deck of playing cards to empower your items in combat - Battle through a world full of monsters. Bigger and better hands can trigger stronger abilities on your items.\n\nDiscover thousands of different items and hundreds of monsters. March forward through a huge variety of locations and events in a procedurally generated, high-fantasy world.\n\nChoose one of many heroes. Each hero comes with a unique set of equipment and abilities, to encourage many different play styles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wr7.jpg'),(2688,'Inspector Waffles Early Days','2024-11-15','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A top-down detective adventure with point-and-click mechanics, inspired by classic Game Boy games. Follow Waffles in his first days as an inspector who wants to prove to everyone that he is more than just a rookie. But beware… Your future worst enemy is hiding in the shadows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ztw.jpg'),(2689,'LEGO Dimensions: Wonder Woman Fun Pack',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','This LEGO Dimensions Wonder Woman (DC Comics) Fun Pack (Universal) makes a fun addition to a fan\'s collection. It includes a full-color Wonder Woman figure and an assortment of pieces that assemble to form her iconic invisible jet. This kids\' building toy set is recommended for ages 7 to 14.\n\nLEGO Dimensions Fun Pack includes:\nWonder Woman\nInvisible jet','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w7n.jpg'),(2690,'Seacorp Technologies',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2691,'Caveman Ninja','1991-12-31','Platform','Arcade, Zeebo, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, DOS, Amiga','Back in the distant past (way back - like when “rock and roll” was just rock and fast food was dinner you couldn’t catch), lived two cave dudes named Joe and Mac. Whether it was dinosaur demolition or pterodactyl hang-glidin’, life for the boys was pretty cool.\n\nCool, that is, until a bogus bunch of neanderthal nerds crashed their village and scared off all the cave-babes. Now the cave-babes are out there - SOMEWHERE, lost and reeeeally lonely… so what are you waitin’ for? It’s up to Joe and Mac to get ‘em back.\n\n* Fight flying pterodactyls in one or two-player simultaneous play.\n* 12 cliff-hangin’ levels with more than 6 bonus levels to find…\n* Amazing arcade graphics will keep you clubbin’ to find your babes…\n* Joe & Mac’s pre-hysterical escapades will keep you comin’ back for more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uz4.jpg'),(2692,'Pew Pew Zombies',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2693,'Batty Jumpers',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2694,'Bloom','2022-04-18','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Playdate','Bloom is a real-time narrative-driven social sim about starting up a flower shop made exclusively for Playdate. Tend to Midori\'s garden while texting friends and family as she starts a new chapter of her life. The game takes place over many real-life days.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4p8a.jpg'),(2695,'Beholder\'s Lair','2021-01-06','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beholder\'s Lair is a difficult 2D platformer that revolves around skillfully avoiding different kinds of enemies. Learn the movement patterns of your enemies, outsmart them and escape the demons lair!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t9v.jpg'),(2696,'Zombie Commander','2018-05-13','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zombie Commander is a strategy game about bringing the extinction of humanity by a zombies invasion, and lead the apocalpyse !','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2697,'Haifa',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Haifa is a hidden object puzzle experience that tells a story about the emotional struggles of trying to maintain hopefulness in times of war. Help your characters keep their head up by finding small objects in their environment to lift their spirits, as they look for their lost friend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m4o.jpg'),(2698,'Pixel Origin',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2699,'Puzzle Summit: Solve & Rise','2025-02-12','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Puzzle Summit: Solve & Rise is a brain-training puzzle game featuring dozens of challenges like Sudoku, Nonogram, and Fill Lines. Players engage their cognitive skills across hundreds of levels, solving puzzles while improving memory, focus, and problem-solving abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9py5.jpg'),(2700,'Rebel Spirit!','2020-05-03','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The main character is a graduate of the prestigious magic academy, but as it is often to find a job was an impossible task, but he was able to correct the situation! To do this, he will have to teach three students his magical style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n55.jpg'),(2701,'Migux','2008-07-07','Simulator, Adventure','Web browser','Migux was a Brazilian online multiplayer-style social media and mass community game aimed at children and teenagers, developed by Brancaleone in 2007, and released on July 7, 2008. The video game ended in 2012 the loss of registered users and financial problems. The game was set in an underwater environment and had an educational proposal, in addition to helping children acquire environmental awareness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fkq.jpg'),(2702,'Harlot\'s Diary','2024-08-23','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a ruthless world where you\'ve lost everything, only desperate measures remain. Fight to survive as a sex worker and reach the top, avoiding deceit, murderers, and abuse on your path to success.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oyu.jpg'),(2703,'Killer Instinct 2 Classic','2014-09-23','Fighting, Arcade','Xbox One','Killer Instinct 2 Classic is a complete port of the original arcade hit from 1996. Thrown back 2000 years in time by Ultratech, the surviving combatants from the first tournament plus new fighters from across time must battle each other for the right to face Gargos and decide the fate of the world. Who among them has the killer instinct?\n\nThis enhanced version for Xbox One features competitive multiplayer over Xbox LIVE, an enhanced training & practice mode, and achievements. Killer Instinct 2 Classic is included in the Season 2 Ultra Edition bundle. To play KI 2 Classic, you must purchase Season 2 Ultra Edition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vdv.jpg'),(2704,'Sniper Elite: Nazi Zombie Army 2','2013-10-31','Shooter, Tactical, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience a terrifyingly intense co-op campaign for up to four players in this gut-wrenching sequel to Steam best-seller, Sniper Elite: Nazi Zombie Army.\n\nWith World War 2 Europe overrun by legions of the undead, you must find mankind’s salvation deep in the twisted bowels of Berlin by securing the sacred artefacts that unleashed this damnation. Every step must be paid in blood as players work together against impossible odds and descend further into the demon-infested city and the terrifying Führerbunker itself.\n\nTackle the campaign online in co-op for up to four players, or embark on the twisted missions alone if you’ve got the bottle.\n\nFeaturing new enemies, new environments, blood curdling surprises and the return of the infamous X-ray kill cam, Sniper Elite: Nazi Zombie Army 2 will satisfy even the most bloodthirsty of zombie hunters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kl9.jpg'),(2705,'The 7th Circle: Endless Nightmare','2020-02-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The 7th Circle: Endless Nightmare is a First Person Dungeon Crawler RPG for hardcore gamers. Inspired by classic games from the 90s, the game try to add new juicy features to modernize a classic genre of role playing games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co430k.jpg'),(2706,'Scene of the Crime','2003-12-31','Quiz/Trivia','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qts.jpg'),(2707,'Good Girl Gone Bad','2019-12-11','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You play as Ashley and make choices that will affect her story in a meaningful way. Are you a good girl or a bad one? Will you stay in the right path or deviate and fall prey to the temptations you\'ll find in your way? Whatever you choose, it will lead to interesting, exciting and vastly different outcomes. \nThis game aims to present you a complex and branching storyline, coherent characters and a lot of freedom, with meaningful choice mechanics and hand drawn illustrations different form the usual 3D models. And a lot of kinky scenes and situations!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vre.jpg'),(2708,'Eden Star','2015-01-30','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Have you ever wanted to make a fresh start on an alien world? Eden Star is a survival game that drops you onto the alien landscape of Pharus 7, free to explore and gather resources, but you’ll want to be careful: death is permanent. You need to use resources to construct defences, craft weapons and build up outposts to protect your vital Eden Kit. With physics-based combat, free-form construction and destructible environments to explore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q15.jpg'),(2709,'Sword Maiden of Azure Dragon','2020-01-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ou5.jpg'),(2710,'Winter','2022-12-01','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Winter - is an adveture third person game in medieval setting with intense gameplay and exciting combat system which allows you to use different combo moves, tricks and special atacks. Along the way, you will meet creatures that will challenge you to fight and try to get your power. Follow your destiny, let the story tell you about how the first snow fell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tcy.jpg'),(2711,'Pixel Ninja','2020-08-10','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is an exciting ninjya action game with a 16-bit taste!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vdn.jpg'),(2712,'NiftyVille',NULL,'Shooter, Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','NiftyVille is a place where you get to be you. But the extraordinary is always just around the corner! Demolition Derbies, Races, Zombie Parties... anything can happen in the world\'s first play-to-earn open world game on the Ethereum network.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co439h.jpg'),(2713,'The Lion King','1994-12-08','Platform, Puzzle','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Linux, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS, Amiga, Super Famicom','The Lion King brings to life the majesty and mystery of Africa through the tale of Simba, a lion cub faced with the challenging transition to maturity. Believing himself to be responsible for his father\'s death, Simba enters the wilderness - where he finds salvation with Pumbaa the warthog and Timon the meerkat, and his education begins.\n\nTake control of the young cub Simba and, through interaction as detailed as the lust terrain, guide him safely through.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63ny.jpg'),(2714,'BEAST: Bio Exo Arena Suit Team','2024-02-01','Shooter, Adventure','iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Immerse yourself in the cosmic adventure of BEAST! A unique 3V3 online shooter designed for all ages. BEAST combines charm and excitement with intuitive controls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s7v.jpg'),(2715,'Bone n\' Gone','2025-09-30','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A challenging and fun game that will push the player to the peak of their gameplay. Get ready to win, lose, die, and play again! Perfect for those looking for a challenge in the FPS style!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h3x.jpg'),(2716,'Funko Fusion: Hazel & Cha-Cha Pack','2024-12-06','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Now you too can be a time travelling assassin! This pack adds The Umbrella Academy\'s Hazel and Cha-Cha as playable characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fae.jpg'),(2717,'Hawk and Puma','2023-11-14','Adventure','Web browser','Hawk and Puma is a minimalist game that pays tribute to Guaman Poma, the indigenous chronicler of the Andes. Through a research-creation process, this game reimagines Guaman\'s journey, exploring themes of racism, sovereignty, and religion from decolonial aesthetics and Andean-inspired music.\n\nThis project has been developed in collaboration with members of the ÑawpaÑan community in the Sacred Valley of the Incas in Cusco, Peru, allowing us to create the final version in English, Spanish, and Quechua, and plan upcoming ludic workshops with community youth as part of the ethical research-creation process.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fov.jpg'),(2718,'Anoxemia','2015-01-16','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Anoxemia is a story-driven exploration game that puts you in control of the scientist Dr. Bailey and his operations drone, ATMA. Search the ocean floor as you discover and extract samples from the bowels of the underwater caves. Danger lurks in each passageway, everything from poison drifts to powerful ocean currents, mines leftover from the war, and mobile machines running haywire. There\'s also the ever-present risk of running out of oxygen. Fortunately, ATMA can help guide you to your destination using a few special tools and upgrades. Assuming you can find them, that is.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h24.jpg'),(2719,'Tropico 4: Junta Military','2011-11-03','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Time to get military! Secure your rule of Tropico with the new bunker, the \"Veteran\" character trait for a more battle-hardened military leader and an appropriate dress uniform. Decorate the island with the new guard booths, oberservation tower, ammunitions depot, barricades and a tank!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/eqceqy9jzngbede4j4nn.jpg'),(2720,'Troubleshooting',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An FPS in your old family computer. Hunt a virus, fix the WiFi, and become an actual JPEG. Contains BSODs, a massive homework folder, and maybe even a paperclip. Your old computer needs you one last time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8o7j.jpg'),(2721,'Skeletons','2022-09-09','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Regurgitated back into a cursed and dying world, you must fight and explore to ascend the tower. But be warned, time and life isn\'t on your side.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lub.jpg'),(2722,'LEGO Bricktales','2023-12-07','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure','Meta Quest 2','In LEGO Bricktales, discover an innovative brick-by-brick building mechanic to design puzzle solutions from your own imagination. See your creations brought to life in a beautiful LEGO world where every problem has a constructive resolution.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h0e.jpg'),(2723,'Animal Shelter','2009-09-24','Simulator','Web browser','In this game you have your own animal shelter and you have to take care of animals. Here you should give them medicine, feed and wash them. Also you should play with your animals. If you treat them badly, you shelter will be closed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9954.jpg'),(2724,'Apothecary','2023-09-07','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A cute story-driven zen puzzler in which you brew potions, customize your workshop, and interact with the quirky residents of the magical town of Mangrove.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70hl.jpg'),(2725,'Moses: From Egypt to the Promised Land',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Moses: from Egypt to the promised land is a first person adventure game inspired by one of the most amazing stories in human history from the Old Testament. In the game, we play the role of Moses, the holy prophet, the leader of the Israelites, during their journey to the Promised Land.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5874.jpg'),(2726,'Junkbot Undercover','2002-12-31','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','The sequel to Junkbot. It is a Shockwave puzzle-platformer that was hosted on the official LEGO website in 2002. The player must place LEGO bricks to form paths and stairways so Junkbot can reach and consume all the recycling bins in a level. The game introduces lasers as a new hazard, as well as various other new elements such as moving blocks and teleportation pads.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6clv.jpg'),(2727,'Shin Nippon Pro Wrestling: Toukon Retsuden Advance','2002-03-29','Fighting, Sport','Game Boy Advance','Toukon Retsuden Advance is a wrestling game on Game Boy Advance','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/c026kvxcnilalq4nxg5s.jpg'),(2728,'Emergency: Rescue Disaster Squad','2009-04-07','Simulator','Nintendo DS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xgm6g9paabpqcjl1sfbj.jpg'),(2729,'Donkey Kong','1983-12-01','Platform, Arcade','Apple II','The Apple II port of Donkey Kong was developed by Atari, Inc., under the Atarisoft label. It was released as a floppy disk.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hrt.jpg'),(2730,'The Disappearing of Gensokyo: Patchouli','2018-01-11','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This pack will add Patchouli Knowledge to the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zsz.jpg'),(2731,'Oddworld Adventures 2','2000-06-01','Platform, Strategy','Game Boy Color','Abe thought he had saved the Mudokons from the evil Glukkons with the destruction of Rupture Farms. However, a new threat has arisen: the Glukkons who run Soul Storm Brewery have created an addictive drink made from Mudokon bones. To get all of the bones they need, Soul Storm has an army of Mudokon slaves excavating the Mudokon City of Death; when one of the slaves is worked to death, he becomes part of the product. The only person who can put a stop to this is Abe. You will guide Abe as he travels through the brewery and tries to destroy the boilers. Along the way, he must also try to save his people. Luckily, Abe can talk to his people and get them to help defeat the enemies and solve puzzles he faces along the way. Help Abe save the Mudokons in Oddworld Adventures 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gu6.jpg'),(2732,'Starbot 4Ever',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Starbot 4EVER is an action-packed platforming adventure which mixes speed, mobility and combat in a way never seen before!\n\nThis game gives you diverse areas to explore and master over time, new enemies to discover and defeat, new weapons to find and obtain and plenty of high-speed action if you know how to earn it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l5i.jpg'),(2733,'Extreme Assault','1997-07-30','Shooter, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Set in a futuristic theater of war, Extreme Assault guides the player through six totally different operation zones, each sub-divided into multiple missions requiring the completion of a variety of exciting tasks. Objectives range from destroying all the enemy units in a given area, to rescuing hostages, defending towns, pulverizing hidden bases, and even engaging alien forces! \n \nAt times you\'ll also find yourself in restricted quarters and have to transfer from your lethal Sioux AH-23 attack helicopter to the awesome T-1 battle tank. Each vehicle is heavily armed with a vast array of weapons ranging from Laser Guns and Guided Missiles, to enormously powerful Smart Bombs and Thunderbolts. And I haven\'t even mentioned the graphics!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co231p.jpg'),(2734,'Wild Animal Sports Day','2018-08-31','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','All your favourite Wild Animals are competing for the title of Wild Animal Champion of Champions! Tennis, Hurdles, Darts, Diving, Skiing, Pole-Vault, Trampolining and for the first time in a game Rhythmic Gymnastics! But watch out for King Croc!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6clj.jpg'),(2735,'O---O','2021-05-27','Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','You are the result of a project codenamed O---O, the alter-ego, the mechanical expression of a particle of your soul. You traverse the corridors of digital reality in order to destroy the enemy of the system. The main rule of the game is not to die. Each contact of the core with the object causes your annihilation, which means returning to the last checkpoint. The number of lives per location is limited.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5anb.jpg'),(2736,'LEGO Rock Raiders','2000-08-17','Tactical','PlayStation','Unlike the Windows version, the PlayStation version is an action and strategy game, in which the player controls a character instead of just commanding a squad. While the former was centered on constructing a base and mining, the latter centers on exploring.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3shy.jpg'),(2737,'Sonic Sunsation',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w88.jpg'),(2738,'The Lurking Horror','1987-05-06','Adventure','Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, Mac, DOS, Amiga, Apple II, Amstrad CPC','The Lurking Horror is an interactive fiction game released by Infocom in 1987. The game was written by Dave Lebling and inspired by the horror fiction writings of H. P. Lovecraft (including his Cthulhu Mythos). Like most of Infocom\'s games, it was released for several platforms simultaneously thanks to the Z-machine.\n\nThe original release included versions for DOS, the Apple II, Atari ST, Atari 8-bit family and Commodore 64. Later, it was ported to the Amiga with the addition of sound effects, making it the first title with that feature. The effects would play at appropriate times in the game in an effort to intensify the horror atmosphere. This marked one of the few major additions to the Z-machine with the exception of graphics; traditionally, Infocom had eschewed such changes in favor of expanding the parser capacity and overall size of game files. It was Infocom\'s 26th game; Infocom rated it as \"Standard\" in terms of difficulty. Lurking Horror was the only horror game ever released by Infocom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vp3.jpg'),(2739,'Forspoken','2023-01-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Forspoken follows the journey of Frey, a young New Yorker transported to the beautiful and cruel land of Athia. In search of a way home, Frey must use her newfound magical abilities to traverse sprawling landscapes and battle monstrous creatures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4u6r.jpg'),(2740,'Fell in love with the Nobility girl As a member of the rebel organization','2025-01-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Kingdom of Caeser is facing internal and external difficulties. As the captain of the rebel army, I met Cosgray, the daughter of the Duke who was loyal to the Kingdom of Caeser, at this time. In my interactions with her, she has become increasingly unforgettable to me.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oap.jpg'),(2741,'Lake Masters',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A Japanese exclusive PlayStation fishing game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/udndvafhgub9edorp21e.jpg'),(2742,'The White Canvas','2015-02-18','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The White Canvas is the story of Nico Sales, a very ironic painter without inspiration and with a lot of personal problems. Midas, the most important patron in the world has arrived at his city. Nico needs to find him and convince him to take care of his artistic career. This won\'t be very easy for Nico because feels depressed and anxious due to his lack of inspiration. Moreover, Midas it\'s very evasive and discret. Will Nico be able to find Midas and convince him? Try to help him and you will find out a lot of interesting things about the charismatic painter Nico Sales. -- Thanks to David Silva for his help.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d7n.jpg'),(2743,'Soul of Butterflies','2023-11-11','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Soul of Butterflies is a point-and-click adventure game with a unique worldview. Players will take on the role of Anders and explore an extremely enigmatic world. Amidst indescribable struggles and fears, they will gradually piece together the truth of this world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pcv.jpg'),(2744,'Mark of the Ninja Remastered','2018-10-09','Platform, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In Mark of the Ninja: Remastered, you\'ll know what it is to truly be a ninja. You must be silent, agile and clever to outwit your opponents in a world of gorgeous scenery and flowing animation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wju.jpg'),(2745,'Full Throttle','1995-12-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','Full Throttle is a computer adventure game developed and published by LucasArts. It was designed by Tim Schafer, who would later go on to design Grim Fandango, Psychonauts and Brütal Legend. The game features voice actors Roy Conrad and Mark Hamill. It was released on April 30, 1995. It is the tenth game to use the SCUMM adventure game engine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30yp.jpg'),(2746,'Portal Gun in Sonic 2','2014-08-18','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Portal Gun in Sonic 2 is a Modification of Sonic the Hedgehog 2 that does just that add the portal gun from the portal series into Sonic the Hedgehog 2.\n\nSonic\'s Sprites have been tweaked, and the Portal Gun is fully functional the portals warping you to their adjacent portal. The portals can also interact with Enemies and Bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s0n.jpg'),(2747,'Super LSG World','2020-08-23','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79re.jpg'),(2748,'Senran Kagura 2: Deep Crimson','2015-09-15','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Nintendo 3DS','Senran Kagura 2: Deep Crimson is a 3D side-scrolling action game made for the 3DS, and was developed by the same team which created Senran Kagura Burst. New gameplay is included in the form of pair battles, which allows a second character, to which the player can give commands, to fight alongside the player\'s character. The playable characters in the game are customizable. Outfits, accessory size and position, and hair color can be changed to the player\'s liking. Augmented reality functionality was also included in the game. The playable characters could be posed against a real-life background in a variety of poses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k2d.jpg'),(2749,'Pixel Cross Stitch: Easter Pack 2','2025-04-03','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','20 new Easter-themed images to color by number or cross stitch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kr7.jpg'),(2750,'Valkie 64','2022-11-25','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Valkie 64 is an action adventure inspired by action adventure games from the Nintendo 64 era.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tk6.jpg'),(2751,'2017 VR','2017-05-08','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','“2017” is an excellent VR Co-op Survival game, in which players from all over the world gather together in teams to try and hold back the zombie hordes and prevent the outbreak from spreading any further. You won\'t miss it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29d5.jpg'),(2752,'007: Quantum of Solace','2008-10-31','Adventure','Nintendo DS','The DS version of the game is drastically different from its console counterparts. The game is played with the DS sideways and as such is not a first person shooter. Actions (such as firing a weapon) are done by pressing icons on the touchscreen, while the DS\'s buttons are relegated to primarily initiating hand-to-hand combat. Bond\'s movements are controlled in a similar fashion to The Legend of Zelda: Phantom Hourglass, where the player drags the stylus around the touchscreen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ega.jpg'),(2753,'Operation: Thunder','2021-09-29','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Operation Thunder is a top-down shooter with a tactical twist and destructible walls. Use your guns, gadgets and wits to outsmart your enemies and become a hero. Good luck, Soldier.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jzw.jpg'),(2754,'Guilty Gear Xrd Rev 2: Character Colors - Johnny',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2755,'StrayShot','2024-09-20','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','StrayShot is a thrilling free-to-play third-person shooter game where you step into the boots of a Bounty Hunter, and take on rivals in intense matches in several game modes.\nTeam up with friends or go solo to fight other players in an epic battle for survival and earn exclusive rewards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ehf.jpg'),(2756,'Akudaikan 3','2007-05-01','Sin género','PlayStation 2','Akudaikan 3 is an action adventure game, developed and published by Global A, which was released in Japan in 2007.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75q2.jpg'),(2757,'Bid For Power','2004-09-20','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bid For Power is a total conversion for QuakeIII that plays nothing like the original game. Players take control of Ki-powered superheros and battle it out in a mostly aerial fight. The game is highlighted by the work of a great art team and an original style, and the gameplay is extremely fast paced.\n\nBFP started out as a Dragonball Z game, and neared completion as one. We ran into legal problems and had to repopulate the universe with original things. This delayed us quite a bit, but we ended up with a population of unique and cool characters to play.\n\nIf you are new to the game be prepared to have a difficult time finding a server. We had about 30 people playing at a time for about a year or two, but it has mostly died out. BFP has also been heavily modified by several different groups using the scripting system, so you may run into compatibility issues.\n\nBFP is no longer under development.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28as.jpg'),(2758,'Hack 1 2','2020-09-30','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gxg.jpg'),(2759,'Magikoopa\'s Midnight Mayhem',NULL,'Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2760,'LEGO Super Mario Jigsaw Puzzle',NULL,'Puzzle','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pfn.jpg'),(2761,'After Wave: Downfall','2022-08-03','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','After Wave: Downfall is an arcade shooter where the player battles against monsters, completes various missions with a cool battleship. Deathrix invaded the world and released a mysterious meteorite causing a great flood. Players can upgrade their ships for better performance to fight the most brutal enemies. A Local Co-op mode allows the player to team up and adventure with others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52ju.jpg'),(2762,'Voron',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are a raven with an important task: guiding lost souls to their new home. In this story-driven adventure game, you will learn how to fly, explore a Norse-inspired, tiny open world, and don’t forget to croak from time to time — that\'s what a raven does, right?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92kp.jpg'),(2763,'Hundred Days','2021-10-13','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Winemaking could be your best adventure. Make the best wine interacting with soil and nature and take your winery to the top. Your beautiful journey into the winemaking tradition starts now.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yvh.jpg'),(2764,'Outline','2016-01-24','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','From the creator of games about getting lost in the dark and dying alone in the desert comes a brand new adventure in amazing one-bit colour.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ate.jpg'),(2765,'Pixel Cross Stitch: Fantasy Medieval Pack 3','2025-03-06','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','20 more images to color by number or cross stitch','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2766,'Souno\'s Curse','2024-10-31','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An action platformer inspired by Hollow Knight and Journey. Featuring metroidvania elements and a surprising story about regret and living in the moment','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yna.jpg'),(2767,'3D Box Sokoban','2022-04-08','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','3D Box Sokoban is a logic game that will exercise your brain, helping developing its capabilities. - The goal of the puzzle is to push all of the boxes onto the goals. - Only one box can be pushed at a time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56yj.jpg'),(2768,'LEGO Dimensions: Gimli Fun Pack',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w81.jpg'),(2769,'Top Gun: Hornet\'s Nest','1998-12-18','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Top Gun: Hornet\'s Next is the sequel to Top Gun: Fire at Will. Once more you take on the role of US Navy pilot Maverick in his F-18 Hornet.\n\nThe game features a multi-player mode, instant action and a campaign with 30 missions. In the campaign missions are briefed with full motion videos. Battles in this flight simulator are fought in Columbia, Siberia and the Persian Gulf.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zew.jpg'),(2770,'Wario Land II','1998-03-09','Platform, Adventure','Game Boy','What kind of no-good ruffians would break into my castle and steal my treasures?! It\'s that rotten Captain Syrup and that Black Sugar Gang! I\'m looking out for bad guys and scavenging for coins as I track down my treasures. If I don\'t get them all the first time, that\'s OK. I can go back again and again until I find them all. Captain Syrup doesn\'t stand a chance against me!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qfz.jpg'),(2771,'NightmAR Protocol','2020-08-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take control of Azael, a young magician who is now forced to survive against the Host\'s demons inside an artificially constructed reality. Experience a unique blend between a 3D dark fantasy environment and 2D hand-drawn horrors. Learn new spells and hone your reflexes to survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q57.jpg'),(2772,'Lara Croft: Relic Run','2015-05-28','Arcade','Windows Phone, Android, iOS','Set shortly after Lara Croft and the Temple of Osiris, the game follows Lara as she goes in search of fellow archeologist Carter Bell. On her search, she uncovers a world-threatening conspiracy. Relics collected during play sessions unlock journal entries that reveal pieces of the story and make new locations available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pocjs9gfhsivd2qvcmao.jpg'),(2773,'Deadcam',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DEADCAM is a 80\'s and 90\'s inspired psychological survival horror game based around found footage presented as \"recordings\". These recordings serve as a collection of short, self-contained experiences, each set in their own location featuring unique entities, monsters and creatures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95ms.jpg'),(2774,'Blade X: Odyssey of Heroes','2024-01-09','Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','Blade X, the sequel to the Blade series which was the first action RPG to surpass 5 million downloads, is known for its spectacular action and smooth controls. Known for its console-like storytelling and high-quality graphics despite being a mobile game, the Blade series previously achieved top rankings on both the App Store and Google Play Store, ranking 1st and 2nd.\n\nBlade X continues the unique world and story of the previous Blade series, offering various content for character growth. Players can engage in story-based Scenario Mode, protect the NPC while fending off monsters in the Guardian Mode, defeat over 30 boss monsters and obtain rewards in the Sealed Relic Tower, and participate in the ranking competition based on character growth progress in the Dimension Gate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7la5.jpg'),(2775,'Ishin Renka: Ryouma Gaiden',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Ishin Renka: Ryouma Gaiden Shokai Seisanban is a Japanese Otome-style visual novel for the PSP.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ok2lotp2kari6p8hvfgw.jpg'),(2776,'First Time in Paris','2023-03-17','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac','Join amateur travel blogger Kate Robinson and her daughter Nicole as they go on their first big business trip to save a Parisian hotel!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5o3k.jpg'),(2777,'Templum de Malum','2019-06-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unearth the mystery of the Tower of Babel as you use your wits to solve puzzles, defeat enemies, and extinguish the evil within in this Classic style point-and-click adventure game with a modern twist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wo5.jpg'),(2778,'Aggretsuko: The Short Timer Strikes Back','2020-07-28','Puzzle','Android, iOS','A match-three game based on the TV and Netflix series Aggretsuko. The titular red panda has been tasked by her tyrannical boss to decorate the various floors of the new office building.\n\nTo do so you must earn her \"stars\" by completing levels of match-three puzzles. Each level has differently coloured tiles (modeled after the characters in the series), plus office-themed obstacles that require special criteria to be removed. The goal is to remove the obstacles and clear the level in a set number of moves.\n\nAlong the way you unlock the various characters, which each have special abilities. You also unlock the one-minute episodes of the Aggressive Retsuko TV series.\n\nThe game contains two types of currency, which are available for in-app purchase.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8scf.jpg'),(2779,'Witch\'s Doll','2024-05-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Witch\'s Doll is a first-person psychological horror game with realistic graphics. Beware, something is lurking in the dark. Get ready for intense jumpscares.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87gq.jpg'),(2780,'Crude',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2781,'Castle Battle: The Game','2007-12-31','Point-and-click, Arcade','Web browser','Castle Battle: The Game is a Castle online game. In it, the player chooses to ally themselves with the Crown Knights or Skeleton Warriors and defend the respective side\'s main residence from attacking forces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65pv.jpg'),(2782,'Shell\'s Kitchen: Nico\'s Journey','2024-05-17','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8p4j.jpg'),(2783,'C64anabalt','2012-01-06','Sin género','Commodore C64/128/MAX','C64anabalt is an official conversion of Adam Atomic & Danny B.\'s award winning single-button 2009 indie game Canabalt for the 8-Bit, 64KB RAM, 1Mhz Commodore 64 home computer developed by Paul Koller (Paulko64). This particular version was designed to run from a 16KB cartridge (although there are also tape and disk versions available to download as well).\n\nThe game was developed as an entry for the RGCD C64 16KB Cartridge Game Development Competition (2011), and the name C64anabalt was suggested by Adam Atomic himself. The physics and procedural algorithms are based on those documented in the original game\'s open source code.\n\nThere are two versions of C64anabalt available; one with a SID chip conversion of Danny B.\'s original score by Mikkel Hastrup (Encore), and an alternative build featuring music from the PC indie game ThrustBurst by Andreas Slotte (Ghormak). Unfortunately it wasn\'t possible to fit them both into a single 16KB ROM, so we\'ve made two versions available to order (more on that in a bit) or download.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2784,'Virtua Cop','1994-09-01','Shooter','Arcade, PC (Microsoft Windows), Sega Saturn','Players assume the role of police officers in a first-person perspective and use a light gun to shoot criminals and advance through the game, with penalties for shooting civilians. The players could also shoot powerups that grants him a weapon or a life. The weapon is lost if the player is hit, but not if he shoots a civilian. Virtua Cop was notable for its use of polygonal graphics, which were subsequently used in both House of the Dead and Time Crisis, instead of the two dimensional sprites that were popular for previous games in the same genre. It is also notable for being one of the first games to allow the player to shoot through glass. Its name derived from this graphical style, which was previously used in Virtua Fighter, Virtua Striker and Virtua Racing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25zv.jpg'),(2785,'Fall Guys World','2020-10-16','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Welcome to the new season in two dimensions of Fall Guys! The players are getting ready for the craziest marathon of all time, worth the legendary Supreme Crown, the most valuable of all! What awaits you in this adventure? Find out for yourself!\n\n> This game contains saving by percentage (%) different from the classic exit count format;\n> 19 challenging exits, with many obstacles and other \"guys\" to get in your way;\n> A version of the great title of Mediatonic, with a unique and original story, honoring this game that has become a fever in a year of so many uncertainties.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qi6.jpg'),(2786,'LEGO Dimensions: Excalibur Batman Fun Pack','2017-02-10','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Wii U, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Venture through the night with Excalibur Batman! Build the Dark Knight and place him on the Lego Toy Pad to bring him into the Lego Dimensions multiverse. Use Excalibur Batman’s trusty sword to battle enemies on the streets of Gotham. Unlock The Lego Batman Movie Adventure World and Battle Arena, and then use Batman’s Master Builder and Sword Switching abilities to win the day! For even more super-power fun, take a ride with the Bionic Steed and rebuild it into the Bat-Raptor and Ultrabat for additional in-game abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w7l.jpg'),(2787,'Tokyo Revengers Pazuribe!','2022-06-24','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Tokyo Revengers: Pazuribe! is the official Tokyo Revengers game designed for smartphones on iOS and Android. It is a puzzle game with multiple sub-stories loosely based on the anime adaptation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o6k.jpg'),(2788,'Mario\'s Keytastrophe: Rebirth Edition','2017-07-09','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79s0.jpg'),(2789,'Finally, in Love Again','2023-06-22','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Included in the \"Love 365: Find Your Story\" app.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66gc.jpg'),(2790,'Stick Tongue','2025-03-07','Platform, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hello, I\'m Frogus! Humans have ruined the Earth and depleted its resources. My plan? Climb to heaven with my tongue and ask God to make it rain!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9488.jpg'),(2791,'Rolling Thunder 2','2007-12-24','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade, Wii, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','A terrorist group has taken out the world information flow and, as either a guy named Albert Ross or a woman named Leila, you must stop them. You can also get cool weapons that pack more of a punch than your ordinary hand gun.\n\nAlso RT2 is a password supported game, so in other words you get a password at the end of each round so if you loss all your lives, you can continue from the end of that round, very handy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85m0.jpg'),(2792,'Global Conflicts: Palestine','2007-07-05','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The player assumes the role of a freelance journalist who has just arrived in Jerusalem facing challenges. The goal is to create and get an article published for a newspaper by collecting quotes from the dialog in the game. The player can either get information by building up trust with each side or take a more confrontational approach to dig out information. In the end, the story with the most news-value will get the best exposure. The player must be careful what they submit for print, because it will affect their standings with both sides.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bigibftw5pz7g6pa09y0.jpg'),(2793,'Alaca','2023-11-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Alaca is an action rogue like game with a Top down perspective. While it contains different types of weapons and elements, you must build and master your character by combining them in the most correct way. There is no save point. kill, build character, learn and repeat..','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79bs.jpg'),(2794,'Ecstatic','2022-06-10','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mouse-controlled Bullet-hell with a Spider mech that freezes time and shoots rockets out of its butt, against Drones synced to rave music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uvc.jpg'),(2795,'The Vanishing of Ethan Carter Redux','2015-09-11','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An Unreal Engine 4 remaster of the original game.\n\nApart from the new engine, the revised version includes a new save system and eliminates the backtracking from the ending sequence of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2foj.jpg'),(2796,'Fura-fura Bouken Flan-chan','2018-09-23','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A doujin game by Nuu based on the Touhou Project series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vlv.jpg'),(2797,'The Skulls','2018-09-15','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Will you accept the challenge of collecting the 8 skulls spread around different, difficult, rage inducing levels, guarded by tons of hostile deadly enemies, if you are so prepare to DIE, If you dead that is OK because it is a HARD game for hardcore players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gmaugfuh2qu47m5vprn3.jpg'),(2798,'Volt Recharge',NULL,'Racing, Sport','Sin plataforma','Race customizable RC cars in intense multiplayer battles! Split-screen, unique abilities, and dynamic tracks await. Get ready to dominate the competition!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87fe.jpg'),(2799,'Nex Machina','2017-06-20','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','From the collaboration between Housemarque (Resogun, Alienation, Matterfall), and Robotron and Smash TV legendary creator Eugene Jarvis comes Nex Machina, an explosive arcade experience created with competition in mind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1twn.jpg'),(2800,'Mysteries of the Undead','2019-03-28','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Demystify the zombie island and break the ancient curse!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6tq6.jpg'),(2801,'Classic NES Series: Super Mario Bros.','2004-02-14','Platform','Game Boy Advance','Classic NES Series: Super Mario Bros. takes you back to the very first battle between Mario and Bowser. Now on the Game Boy Advance, you can relive all the mushroom-eating, Koopa-stomping action from the original game. Always strive for the high score while jumping on top of flag poles, pipes, and bricks. This time, two players can alternate play with a single Game Pak or with GBAs linked by a Game Boy Advance Game Link Cable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3axg.jpg'),(2802,'Guilty Gear Xrd Rev 2: Character Colors - Faust',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2803,'Guilty Gear Xrd Rev 2: Character Colors - Elphelt Valentine',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2804,'Donkey King Arcade Game',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2805,'Gravitorium','2024-08-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Harness the power of gravity to maneuver through challenging precision platforming and puzzle levels in this fun and kinetic 2D platformer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pu6.jpg'),(2806,'Combat Master Mobile',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Join fast-paced action-packed combat. Play Combat Master -- the ulimate FPS experience on your mobile. Best-in-class multiplayer gunfight. Next-level performance. And a whole lot more.\nWhether you\'re a tactical professional, or simply love the tactical aesthetic, Combat Master provides a shooter gameplay that focus on the quality and innovation you\'re looking for.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wrc.jpg'),(2807,'Furies: Last Escape','2018-10-30','Strategy','Android, iOS','It’s been 3 years since Zgirls built bases against zombies. Zgirls has mastered a vast amount of advanced military technologies. However, terrorists controlled upgraded zombies and invaded Zgirls bases. The bases got compromised while they were under loose defense. Now, you commanders will lead Zgirls fight with decisive organizations. Build your own military empire, conduct all kinds of army, and rebuild the world order until to be the new leader!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fza.jpg'),(2808,'DreadEye VR','2017-11-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Please, take a seat. You\'ll be here for a while. Don\'t worry, you won’t be alone. Let these creatures welcome you to give you a taste of a dark surreal experience. Don\'t be afraid just yet. Perhaps they will spare you this time around. After all, the nastiest thing they can do to you will only be virtual. But, then again You will probably be wishing you were in a real dream.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2517.jpg'),(2809,'Super Robo Mouse','2016-04-07','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U','Robo the mouse has to collect Titanium Cheese to unlock the gates and escape the maze it is trapped in.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v0t.jpg'),(2810,'Evolution II: Fighting for Survival','2015-02-12','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Evolution II: Fighting for Survival is a real-time action life simulation game. Conquer a world of randomly generated, evolving species.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2811,'Shanghai Dragon','2002-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shanghai Dragon is a 3D rail shooter, similar to The House of the Dead or Virtua Cop. The action takes place in 1937 and the player takes the role of Jackie Hua. He is a member of the Chinese resistance, fighting against the Japanese occupation. The hero walks through the city without player input and the player only has to shoot enemies. Sometimes he has to save some civilians. They give him first aid kits, weapons and ammunition. He has seven types of weapons. The main weapon is a pistol with unlimited ammo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ez2.jpg'),(2812,'Fat Bear Week','2020-05-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become the fattest bear before winter comes! \n \nRoll around eating food and turning into the biggest bear of the forest! Unlock new friends and levels by finding hidden berries! \n \n  A third person, single player action paced collectathon full of delicious food to eat and secrets to find \n  A full cast of lovable bears to unlock \n  Full controller support \n \nThe controls are simple and accessible - simply roll, jump and eat everything in your path. Explore a cute and colorful world full of everything good a bear could ever want and discover the secrets hidden in each level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fa5.jpg'),(2813,'My Next Life as a Villainess: All Routes Lead to Doom! - Pirates of the Disturbance','2022-02-10','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Nintendo Switch','Catarina Claes, the young daughter of a noble family, one day bumps her head and regains memories of her past life as an otaku. It is then that she realizes she has been reborn into the world of the otome game Fortune Lover, reincarnated as the game\'s villainess who, regardless of what route the player took in the original game, is doomed to be either killed or exiled. In order to avoid these routes that lead to doom, Catarina begins taking countermeasures to try and avoid things going the same way as the game. This, however, ends up having unexpected consequences on her relations with the other characters of the game\'s world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pbj.jpg'),(2814,'Men in Black 2: The Series','2000-08-09','Sin género','Game Boy Color','Based on the cartoon series of the same name, MEN IN BLACK: The Series 2 starts with aliens invading the Earth. It is up to a covert organization, known only as Men In Black, to stop the invasion. You take the role of Agent J as he hunts down 12 different alien races, including the Skraaldians and the Fmeck. Luckily, J has a wide range of weapons to help him put an end to the alien menace; most notable is the Noisy Cricket. While most aliens are relatively easy to spot, some can change shape and will not reveal themselves until J gets close to them...so keep your eyes peeled. When a stage is cleared, you are treated to an animated sequence that advances the plot. Will the Agent J be able to save the world? Play MEN IN BLACK: The Series 2 and find out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d0z.jpg'),(2815,'Wadanohara and the Great Blue Sea -Reboot-','2020-02-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wadanohara and the Great Blue Sea -Reboot- is a re-release of Deep-Sea Prisoner\'s third game, Wadanohara and the Great Blue Sea. It features extra content not found in the original game as well as adjustments to gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7f28.jpg'),(2816,'DeadLock','2021-08-24','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In DeadLock, the player must connect the processor and the resources it needs in the appropriate order to prevent \'DeadLock\' from occurring. More and more targets need to be scheduled, and new kinds of resources emerge. It\'s up to the player to efficiently schedule without generating \'Deadlock\'.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gqn.jpg'),(2817,'Vastophobia',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Explore varied environments and chilling soundscapes. avoid threats that stalk the in-between. try to uncover why you are here and what happened to you. listen out for strange out of this world creatures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hug.jpg'),(2818,'Fantasy Shootoff','2021-07-22','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fantasy Shootoff is a free PvPvE fantasy game where you fight against enemy npcs or have a duel with your friends on one big map filled with crazy weapons, story and much more. Play Single player and level up your character or jump into Multiplayer and kill enemies or just hang out with others','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kof.jpg'),(2819,'Tom Clancy\'s Ghost Recon: Breakpoint - Deep State','2020-03-24','Shooter, Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A new adventure called Deep State provides more than five hours of additional gameplay that expands the original story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co570y.jpg'),(2820,'Will Die Alone','2022-06-08','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Some memories aren\'t meant to stay. We are our memories and our experiences. What happens if you delete some of them? If you change your past and, thus, your future?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qgf.jpg'),(2821,'Train Sim World 5: Thomas & Friends Edition','2025-03-20','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kvm.jpg'),(2822,'Imprisoned','2023-03-02','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Imprisoned is a Massively Multiplayer Online Role-Playing Game (MMORPG) developed with the Unreal Engine 5 graphics engine and advanced predictive artificial intelligence system.\n\nYour objective is to serve your sentence and survive within a hostile prison as a persistent world. During your time behind bars, you must create a character, level up, improve it, and obtain protections and weapons through missions or by eliminating certain enemies you will encounter during your journey through the prison.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98qf.jpg'),(2823,'Motorbike Garage Mechanic Simulator','2018-03-14','Puzzle, Racing, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a professional bike mechanic and develop your business doing something you love. This comprehensive, technical simulation is all about choppers – the manliest motorcycles in the world. Exchange parts, service bikes and assemble them from scratch!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27mk.jpg'),(2824,'Splatterhouse','1992-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Arcade, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, FM Towns','Splatterhouse is a sidescrolling beat \'em up video game in which the player controls Rick, a parapsychology student who is trapped inside West Mansion. After his resurrection by the Terror Mask, Rick makes his way through the mansion, fighting off hordes of creatures in a vain attempt to save his girlfriend Jennifer from a grisly fate. Players of this game will also recognize a number of western horror film influences, such as Friday the 13th and Evil Dead 2.\n\nSimilar to many sidescrolling beat \'em up games, Rick can only move in a two-dimensional environment. The playing field does not feature a three-dimensional area, a feature that was added later in the series with Splatterhouse 3. He has the ability to jump and can punch and kick. Rick also has a Special Attack, where he will perform a drop kick that sends him skidding along the ground, damaging any enemies he hits. Rick can also perform a low kick, low punch, and jumping attacks, as well as pick up and use various weapons placed in the levels.\n\nAll of the levels consist of walking left to right, with occasional auto-scrolling segments. However, alternative pathways through sections of the house are possible by falling down through holes or jumping up onto ladders. In this way, branching gameplay is possible, if only prevalent in the middle levels. Levels culminate in boss fights that take place in a single room. Unlike traditional side-scrolling fighters, boss fights have varying objectives and styles. Unlike most arcade games in the genre, Splatterhouse sends players back to checkpoints after losing lives or reaching game over, discouraging \"credit feeding\" as a method of overcoming the various challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sun.jpg'),(2825,'Lunorbit Deluxe','2025-05-06','Indie, Arcade','Playdate','You\'re the last stand against a hoard of asteroids headed straight towards the moon! Ram your specially-designed ship into them before they make contact with Luna and survive the onslaught as long as you can.\n\nThis deluxe edition builds upon the original with a variety of features- rebalanced difficulty, combos, and a whole new ship with a unique playstyle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ry7.jpg'),(2826,'Mixpirit','2021-04-25','Visual Novel','Web browser','One rainy night, he wakes up from shortness of breath and finds a corpse laying flat. He is confused by his blood-stained body, a place he does not recognize, and the sight, when two men appear.\nThe two men call themselves \"Karamora\" and ask for his protection.\nHe is forced to accept.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94ym.jpg'),(2827,'WWE 2K17','2016-10-11','Fighting, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','Welcome to Suplex City, courtesy of cover Superstar Brock Lesnar! WWE 2K17 arrives as the reigning and defending flagship WWE video game franchise champion! WWE 2K17 features stunning graphics, ultra-authentic gameplay and a massive roster of WWE and NXT\'s popular Superstars and Legends.\n\nExperience the most authentic WWE gameplay ever, featuring thousands of new moves and animations, backstage and in-arena brawling, and the biggest roster of WWE and NXT Superstars and Legends to date.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24js.jpg'),(2828,'Ashes of the Singularity: Escalation - Secret Missions',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dz8.jpg'),(2829,'Coin World','2018-09-29','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d5g.jpg'),(2830,'Fallen London: Upwards!','2020-11-24','Adventure','Web browser','An addon for Fallen London. A Premium Story, originally debuting for the holiday season in 2020.\n\nUpwards! is intended for high level players. It can be accessed from the Bone Market, on the storylet \"Palaeontology: Upwards\", or directly from the Fate page.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4idn.jpg'),(2831,'RollOver',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2832,'Initial Daydream','2023-12-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Playdate','Initial Daydream is a Pulp RPG in the style of NES JRPGs, specifically the early Dragon Quest and Final Fantasy entries. Towns, dungeons, turn based battles, goofy plot and dialogue; you name it, we got it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co797r.jpg'),(2833,'The Settlers: History Edition','2018-08-21','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Haven\'t you always wanted to be king? Indulge your fantasy in the world of The Settlers. You alone determine how your kingdom will be formed, how large it will be, whether to limit your ambitions to agriculture, breeding of stock, and fishing, or whether you want to start an industrial revolution. Turn back the clock 25 years and relive the fascination of this classic in gaming history!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mb1.jpg'),(2834,'Elsinore','2019-07-22','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Elsinore is a time-looping adventure game set in the world of Shakespeare\'s Hamlet. Elsinore combines strong social simulation elements, a dynamic story that reacts immediately to player decisions, and a world full of diverse characters with secrets to uncover. Can Ophelia prevent the tragedy that lies before her?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2473.jpg'),(2835,'Trainz Railroad Simulator 2022: Route: Japan - Model Trainz',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','This layout is inspired by the Okayama Prefecture, Japan. It is designed for busy train traffic, and features a great range of challenging sessions. There are also some display cabinets where you can put trains on for stationary display.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2836,'Kelime Oyunu','2014-11-15','Quiz/Trivia','Android','Are you ready to test your vocabulary with the Word Puzzle Game? Play a word game with thousands of words specially prepared for Turkish word game lovers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fq2.jpg'),(2837,'Rotting Jam','2023-08-07','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rotting Jam is a collection of seven maps created over a period of two weeks for Arcane Dimensions with the theme \"Decay and disrepair\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78du.jpg'),(2838,'Stellaris: First Contact','2023-03-14','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are not alone! The galaxy is vast and full of wonders, but it’s also full of alien empires you’re going to encounter, whether you’re ready or not. First Contact offers a set of new origins and mechanics that give players the chance to tell stories about their civilizations’ early encounters with visitors from the stars — ones that may not have come in peace!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68lg.jpg'),(2839,'The Last Planets','2020-12-22','Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Android','This is an infinite and endless run, adventure, arcade, physics based, space and planets exploring game.\n\nTake part to this infinite progression through the dangers of this universe, controlling some planets that are shattered from a great explosion produced somewhere...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4q45.jpg'),(2840,'Take a Walk','2025-01-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take a Walk brings nature trails to the comfort of wherever you are! This cozy, open-world walking simulator is the next best thing to touching grass. Embrace the calm, uncover hidden treasures and enjoy your walk.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bsf.jpg'),(2841,'The Mirror\'s Curse','2024-12-04','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Mirror\'s Curse is a first-person puzzle solving mysterious action game. You’re trapped in a limbo — a twisted version of your own home.\n\nTo escape, you must solve intricate puzzles and evade spirits.\n\nThe mirrors are your greatest mystery and danger: while they reveal hidden clues, staring too long raises your curse level, triggering supernatural attacks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92bc.jpg'),(2842,'UltraNothing','2024-01-21','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nothing to See Here... 2d Puzzle Strategy (not RPG) Platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ehq.jpg'),(2843,'Import Tuner Challenge','2006-07-27','Racing','Xbox 360','Import Tuner Challenge is set on the Shuto Expressways of Tokyo, Japan.\nThere a total of 415 rivals in the game. It features C1 and Shinkanjo like many other TXR games but unlike TXR3, Import Tuner Challenge does not feature the highways of Nagoya, Osaka, and Yokohama. But two new highway sections of Tokyo are in the game which are Rt.3 Shibuya and Rt.4 Shinjuku.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xxu.jpg'),(2844,'LEGO Star Wars',NULL,'Adventure','Legacy Mobile Device','Play through a LEGO recreation of the opening of Star Wars Episode III: Revenge of the Sith as Anakin Skywalker. Build new pathways, solve challenging puzzles and wield your lightsaber through 18 action-packed levels, battling through the Trade Federation cruiser to rescue Chancellor Palpatine from the clutches of General Grievous.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qc9.jpg'),(2845,'Junkbot','2001-12-31','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','Junkbot is a Shockwave puzzle-platformer that was hosted on the official LEGO website in 2001. The player must place LEGO bricks to form paths and stairways so Junkbot can reach and consume all the recycling bins in a level. The game would receive a sequel titled \"Junkbot Undercover\" in 2003.\n\nDespite being officially licensed by LEGO, Junkbot never appeared in any physical LEGO sets, though the \"Haunted House\" set from 2021 features a hidden box containing his parts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5shq.jpg'),(2846,'Sprucerio','2021-12-29','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You went to the forest for a tree. You have a sled on which you transport the tree. A kettle with hot tea (so hot that it doesn\'t cool down to the end). Lantern and ax. Having cut down a tree, night has come, you return home through a dark forest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ssr.jpg'),(2847,'Helicopter 2.0','2022-01-03','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game about a helicopter plowing through the open spaces, the land scorched by the sun. With addictive gameplay and auto-generated levels, the goal of the game is to fly as much as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95u2.jpg'),(2848,'Sonic Unite',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kik.jpg'),(2849,'Haunted House','1980-05-01','Adventure','TRS-80','Escape from the haunted house.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mxudp5j0udmarzgpqahs.jpg'),(2850,'Monolithic Laser','1983-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Apple II','Monolithic Laser is a Space Invaders clone. The player shoots alien vessels to try to stop an alien invasion. The player controls a small space ship in the bottom half of the screen which can move in 4 cardinal directions. Moving left to right on the top half of the screen are the invading alien vessels, which fire randomly upon the defending player. If your ship is hit, it is destroyed. When the player has destroyed all ships, they move to a higher difficulty level with faster moving ships that fire more frequently. The player has a total of 3 lives. When all are lost, it\'s game over.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2851,'Viscera Cleanup Detail 2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','On the 26th of February 2024 it was announced that RuneStorm was \"confident that we have more than enough material for a sequel and lots of interesting improvements to add\".','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2852,'Spark in Sonic After the Sequel',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2853,'DCS World: NS 430 Navigation System for Mi-8MTV2 Cockpit','2021-11-06','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The NS 430 for the Mi-8MTV2 module integrates the NS 430 panel directly into the Mi-8MTV2 cockpit (not as a pop-up display). The NS 430 is fully wired into the electrical and radio systems of the Mi-8MTV2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95vn.jpg'),(2854,'Project Genesis','2020-05-22','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a sci-fi journey in this player versus player shooter. In Project Genesis, you\'ll get to pilot a powerful space-faring battle craft and as an avatar in first-person, giving you an intense and exciting gameplay experience.\nSet in the future and half galaxy away, an AI rebellion has sparked a dangerous conflict that threatens to consume everything in its path. As unit with a specialized breach-and-board assault pod, you\'ll dramatically transition between the space theater and close quarters FPS combat as you fight aboard titanic capital ships.\nWith fast-paced combat, stunning graphics, and immersive sound design, this game is like Call of Duty in space. It\'s designed for players who love first-person shooters in a science fiction universe\nProject Genesis is currently in pre-alpha, so you can watch it develop and contribute to its evolution.\nGet ready for an intense battle that will push you to your limits. The fate of the galaxy is in your hands. Are you ready to take on the challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sc6.jpg'),(2855,'Quadrata','2022-10-10','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Quadrata is a minimalist puzzle where you control two different characters with the same keys on either side and collect diamonds with a limited number of moves to finish. The difficulty of the game increases gradually, thanks to new mechanics added every 10 levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ycv.jpg'),(2856,'Astro & Suzy Go to the Beach','2023-01-31','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Astro & Suzy have finally made it to the beach! And the humans are dropping all kinds of yummy things! Hotdogs! Tacos! Hamburgers! Help Astro & Suzy eat all the wasted human beach food before it hits the ground. But watch out for the Mayo! It will ruin the whole day. Make sure to get all the power-ups like Catsup, Mustard, and Salsa! They increase Astro & Suzy’s food bonus multipliers! And don’t miss the ‘dog bone of invincibility’! (Based on a real-life story that hasn’t happened yet)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65f6.jpg'),(2857,'Horror of Minos',NULL,'Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You are the only survivor from a team of explorers set to discover the misteries of King Minos, Ancient Greece and the mythological beast Minotaur.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47pz.jpg'),(2858,'Plumber Survivors','2024-09-27','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Plumber Survivors is an arena action with Roguelike elements. Play as the formidable Plumber (and his friends), repel hordes of zombies and other vile creatures. Grab you plunger tight and plunge into the fight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cta.jpg'),(2859,'Balloon Fight-e','2002-09-16','Platform','Game Boy Advance','Balloon Fight-e is a port of Balloon Fight for the Game Boy Advance released for the e-Reader.\nThis game is emulated from a slightly modified version of the original game, so there are very few gameplay differences. The main difference between this version and the original is the lack of multiplayer, as the option has been entirely removed, with Balloon Trip now taking the place of Game B. The other difference which is shared by virtually all NES to Game Boy Advance ports was the \"squished\" resolution, as the system\'s screen was lower resolution than the NES\' output.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co438i.jpg'),(2860,'BattleCore Arena','2024-06-06','Shooter, Platform, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BattleCore Arena is a free to play competitive platform shooter where gravity mastery is the key to victory. Use your trusted weapons and abilities to eject your opponents out of the arena in style. Glory awaits you, take the plunge!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8b8k.jpg'),(2861,'SimEarth: The Living Planet','2009-06-26','Simulator','Wii, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','An entire planet becomes your laboratory in this large-scale simulation game. Players help foster new life and promote its evolution into life forms of higher intelligence. Guide civilization along the path of evolution until it can achieve Exodus, the ultimate goal of settling on another planet. The basic challenge of the game is to maintain a comfortable environment for the life forms by adjusting atmospheric and geological parameters. Small organisms called Prokaryote and Trichordate will grow and evolve into a multitude of life forms. Making a drastic change is a recipe for disaster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50c8.jpg'),(2862,'Minecraft PSP',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','PlayStation Portable','A Minecraft port for the PlayStation Portable developed by AlexDev2 and RegenStudio.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n3y.jpg'),(2863,'Snk\'s Cool Cool Toon','2000-09-10','Music','Dreamcast','Cool Cool Toon (クルクルトゥーン?) is a rhythm-based music video game exclusive to the Dreamcast. It was developed and published by SNK and released in Japan only on August 10, 2000.The letters A, B, X and Y appear at the edge or in the middle of a large circle on screen. The player must use the analogue stick to move a marker to the letter and press the corresponding button on the controller at the right time. If the player misses too many letters, they will fail.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ygohqro3kolymigv2idm.jpg'),(2864,'Cygni: All Guns Blazing','2024-08-06','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','It\'s a twin-stick vertical scrolling Shooter hybrid with a cinematic flare:\n\nAn unrelenting onslaught of eye-popping visuals, ear bursting soundscapes and mind-melting action makes Cygni the vanguard for the next generation of shoot-em ups.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c4n.jpg'),(2865,'Who\'s That Flying?!','2010-11-16','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable','As the mysterious and powerful \"Guardian of Earth\" your steely eye and HYPER-POWERED LASER ARM have kept the citizens of Earth safe for generations (as well as proving a hit with the ladies).\n\nWith all your awesome TALENT and FLAIR, surely it would be IMPOSSIBLE for a devastating invasion of Doom Beasts to descend on your cities and cause havoc without your knowledge? (Even if you were MAYBE showboating for a magazine photo-shoot at the time...)\n\nNow, you must not only defend your cities from the ravenous hordes of Doom Beasts - you must defend yourself against accusations of gross incompetence from the Galactic Council of Justice! And this is all BEFORE you can even start to get to the bottom of just who OR what is really behind the attacks...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72hp.jpg'),(2866,'Ragdoll LABS','2025-06-30','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ragdoll LABS is a game of action, physics, and lots of laughs, where you control a ragdoll in wild and varied simulations. Have fun watching your enemies failing miserably, unlock items to give your beloved ragdoll a unique look, create your own simulations, or play in others developed by the community.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lvr.jpg'),(2867,'Knights & Guns: Silver Edition','2023-06-30','Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Knights & Guns: Silver Edition is a digital bundle that contains the base game and Armor Pack #2 which adds 2 majestic armors, epitomizing grandeur and strength.\n\nA classic revenge story set in a medieval fantasy world… with a touch of deadly modern firepower just to turn things up to eleven. Fight through the armies of undead, mutants, aliens, machines and beasts in order to get back what is rightfully yours and bring some semblance of peace back to the land. Who knows - if you’re thorough enough you might even discover the history of the kingdom itself, long lost to the scholars of the realm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76p7.jpg'),(2868,'Pokémon Masters','2019-08-29','Strategy','Android, iOS','Pokémon Masters takes place on the island of Pasio, where the rules of battle are different and the treasured bond between Trainer and Pokémon is taken to the next level with sync pairs—the combination of a Trainer and their partner Pokémon. For the very first time in a Pokémon game, Trainers and their partner Pokémon from every Pokémon region will come together to form sync pairs. Players can team up with duos such as Korrina & Lucario, Brendan & Treecko, Clair & Kingdra, and many more. With all sorts of Trainers on Pasio, there are sure to be some exciting and unexpected encounters in this new story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kii.jpg'),(2869,'Chef Wars Journeys','2018-05-23','Quiz/Trivia','Android','Spin-off of the title published by Mindcake Games in 2017 (Chef Wars).\n\nThis is a trivia game about food and recipes from all over the world in which the player can obtain new ingredients and chefs, but also try to complete every single \"thematic\" quiz.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7y8l.jpg'),(2870,'The House of the Dead: Nightmare','2011-12-31','Arcade','Legacy Mobile Device','Agent Thomas Rogan arrives at the familiar Curien Mansion to stop the zombie outbreak and save his girlfriend Sophie in this top-down, arcadey remake for mobile phones.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49hl.jpg'),(2871,'Chocolate Confession','2018-10-02','Visual Novel','Android','Take the place of the protagonist Kaori and live two love triangles between your friends Darius and Cloud and a confession in between!\n\nChocolate Confession\nSt. Valentine is coming, and your heart starts to beat differently for one of your firends... You want to seize this day and confess and that everything will be perfect. But... Are things really going to be as you planned? Or would they be even better?\n\nChocolate Confession Christmas Special\nIt saddens you to learn this will be the first Christmas you won\'t spend together with your childhood friends Darius and Cloud. But one of them left a mysterious invitation to spend that day together. And it dosen\'t sound it\'s just as friends... Which one of them do you wish it was?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70oe.jpg'),(2872,'Novus Inceptio','2015-10-05','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warning: Game is in early access! Welcome to the mysterious world of Novus Inceptio where new gaming experience of exploring, building and surviving awaits. Explore the true sandbox survival world and take part in the development of the full game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21ej.jpg'),(2873,'Die Bücher Luzifers','2002-12-22','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Die Bücher Luzifers is the second game of German RPG Maker developer Kelven and is yet another horror game. While influcenes of Silent Hill and Resident Evil do exist in this one, they\'re more subtile and the plotline and world do feel a lot more unique, then in the first game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75ai.jpg'),(2874,'Police Quest: SWAT','1995-09-30','Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','Two figures appear in the scope of your rifle; an enraged attacker and his trembling hostage. In one single moment, all your training comes down to these two faces in the crosshairs, and your finger on the trigger. The shot is yours.\n\nIt\'s all in a day\'s work for members of the most elite force in crime fighting history: SWAT, the Special Weapons And Tactics team. Now you can experience this relentless adrenaline-pumping action firsthand as you begin your training as a SWAT officer. After instruction in actual SWAT tactics and target training sessions your skills will be called into action in multiple scenarios and career-advancing missions.\n\nInnocent lives rely on your split-second decision making and your team\'s courage in the face of incredible danger.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d63.jpg'),(2875,'Pikmin 3 Deluxe','2020-10-30','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Prepare yourselves, brave explorers, and set-off for the lush planet PNF-404!\n\nThis new version for Nintendo Switch features multiple difficulty modes, new side-story missions featuring Olimar and Louie, and all the DLC from the original release.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8grk.jpg'),(2876,'Drop: System Breach','2023-03-28','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Drop, a fast-paced action-strategy hacking simulator. Ready to hack your way to fame and fortune while avoiding getting caught? Use stealth and cunning to maneuver between the ongoing power struggle of corporations and factions to control the fragmented networks in the city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6azf.jpg'),(2877,'LEGO Star Wars: The Force Awakens - First Order Siege of Takodana','2016-10-25','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','This DLC for LEGO Star Wars: The Force Awakens features a scene from the film in a new perspective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fqd.jpg'),(2878,'Defense Grid: The Awakening - Resurgence Map Pack 4','2010-06-23','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','New Maps, New Strategies, New Experiences, and New Achievements From the Creators of Defense Grid Defense Grid: Resurgence Map Pack 4 Kill Zone and Overflow - The final installment of the Resurgence series includes two more environments sure to challenge your tactical planning.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8iit.jpg'),(2879,'Pascal\'s Wager','2020-06-24','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Android, iOS','Pascal\'s Wager is an action role playing game with the style of dark fantasy. The game provides its players with top-notch picture quality and a feast for the senses that the mobile platform has never had before. In the game, the world is shrouded by dark mist, where light is dim and mysterious. People there become lunatic, and nobody knows the secrets behind that. \n \nPlayers can play multiple characters to experience the strong storyline and reveal various hidden areas of the map. Along the way, they will fight unbelievable enemies, confront epic bosses, and embrace overwhelming death and truth. All the while, they\'ll be engrossed by a magnificent soundtrack performed by a world-class orchestra.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28ut.jpg'),(2880,'Forest Phantoms','2023-07-04','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Forest Phantoms is an addictive horror-survival game in which players beat back the spirits of the forest to keep their fires burning and survive as long as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98bj.jpg'),(2881,'Diddy','2025-01-17','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Destroy a dark party in Diddy\'s mansion. Gather your comrades Eminam and 51 Cent and save Justin B from Diddy! You can destroy the party with your friends by experiencing co-op','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98ta.jpg'),(2882,'Renai, Karichaimashita','2021-07-21','Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Because of his family\'s unique circumstances, the only thing Yuki put his faith in was that \"Money will make my little sister happy.\" To this end, he regularly worked a part-time job until late at night.\n\nHis goals were to graduate as soon as possible and get a full-time job. But, one day as he was leaving for work, his little sister told him, \"If Yuki isn\'t going to college then I won\'t either.\" He knew he couldn\'t put such a burden upon his little sister.\n\nSo, in order to gather the necessary sum of money to enter university, Yuki signed up for a \"human employment rental\" website. It seemed extremely suspicious, but desperate times call for desperate measures.\n\nHe starts his new job...and for some reason, a girl in his class asks him to be her pretend boyfriend. Then he\'s hired to pretend to be a woman\'s lover, another girl\'s friend, and even the older brother to a pair of twins!\n\nThe details of his fake relationships with these girls begin as soon as he takes their money!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vql.jpg'),(2883,'Airstrife: Assault of the Aviators','2021-02-26','Shooter, Platform, Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Use different planes with upgradable parts and numerous weapons you can mount to your planes to destroy your enemies. Discover the world\'s beautiful atmosphere while fighting experienced Aviators. Fly solo or play with your friends and enjoy local coop. A modern re-invented classic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tlg.jpg'),(2884,'Kingdom Come: Deliverance - Limited Edition','2018-02-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A humble, young blacksmith loses everything to war. As he tries to fulfill the dying wish of his father, Fate drags him into the thick of a conspiracy to save a kidnapped king and stop a bloody conflict. You will wander the world, fighting as a knight, lurking in the shadows as a rogue, or using the bard’s charm to persuade people to your cause.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4apu.jpg'),(2885,'Kingdom Come: Deliverance - Special Edition','2018-02-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A humble, young blacksmith loses everything to war. As he tries to fulfill the dying wish of his father, Fate drags him into the thick of a conspiracy to save a kidnapped king and stop a bloody conflict. You will wander the world, fighting as a knight, lurking in the shadows as a rogue, or using the bard’s charm to persuade people to your cause.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4apr.jpg'),(2886,'Syzygy','2020-11-20','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Syzygy is an enigmatic game focused on the ability of morphing at will a square world into triangles and hexagons','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42u6.jpg'),(2887,'Grime: Definitive Edition','2024-01-25','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Destroy... Absorb... Grow... GRIME is a methodical and unforgiving 2.5D soulslike metroidvania in which you crush your foes with living weapons that mutate form and function.\n\nGrime: Definitive Editions includes all previously released updates and DLCs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ghu.jpg'),(2888,'Cavimilation','2023-03-03','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cavimilation is a 2D shooter/platformer throwback to classic high score chasing games with the addition of modern roguelike elements. Explore an endless procedurally generated cave filled with treasure and monsters, where every mistake takes its toll and where every bullet counts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98ct.jpg'),(2889,'Journey to the Center of the Moon',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2890,'Tokyo Xtreme Racer: Zero','2001-03-15','Racing','PlayStation 2','Tokyo Xtreme Racer Zero is a racing game developed by Genki for PlayStation 2. Despite its name, it is set between Tokyo Xtreme Racer 2 and Drift, and has enhanced sound and graphics. The game was released in Japan as Shutokou Battle 0, but was also a release in North America. The game was released in a PAL version in Europe and Australia under the title Tokyo Xtreme Racer (not to be confused with the Dreamcast title of the same name).\n\nThis is the first game in the series that has been released on a platform other than the Dreamcast. Zero was originally to be released on the Dreamcast but was then canceled and moved to the PlayStation 2. The Tokyo Xtreme Racer series has produced a total of six games, the first four being U.S. localizations of the first four Shutokou Battle series games and the final two being U.S. localizations of the first and third Kaido Battle series games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hrz.jpg'),(2891,'Injustice 2: TMNT','2018-02-20','Sin género','Xbox One','Deep below the surface, in the sewers of New York City, four turtle brothers were mutated by radioactive ooze and began training in the art of ninjutsu. While in a fight with the fearsome Krang—our heroes in a half-shell were jettisoned on a one way trip across the Multiverse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kf6.jpg'),(2892,'Fortnite: Chapter 2 Remix','2024-11-02','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Island you knew is back, remixed and reimagined, with weekly location and loot drops inspired by the best of early Chapter 2 OG gameplay and some of the greatest music icons in history. In this time rewind, Snoop D-O-double-G heads up the Agency, the rap god Eminem sets up shop in the Grotto, hip hop princess Ice Spice lays claim to Shark Island, and the remix hits the finale with a celebration and tribute to the legend and icon, Juice WRLD. Push play, turn up the volume, and open up the vault in Fortnite Battle Royale Chapter 2 Remix!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co907g.jpg'),(2893,'LEGO Marvel Super Heroes 2: Out of Time Character Pack','2017-12-19','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This character pack includes for LEGO Marvel Super Heroes 2 adds Iron Man 2020, Lady Spider, Nosferata, Captain Assyria, Warmaker, Hulk 2099, and Daredevil Noir.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xsd.jpg'),(2894,'GiseiHero','2020-09-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Among the 18 people who have a heart of justice, there is an evil that seeks murder. It is a mysterious and malicious death game of justice ADV. This is a free game made by an individual. Please note that this is an unfinished work.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41ag.jpg'),(2895,'Cozy Dungeons','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Explore deadly dungeons, clear them out of enemies and renovate them in Cozy Dungeons, a one-of-a-kind adventure/interior design game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ar2.jpg'),(2896,'Hakuoki Reimeiroku DS','2012-04-26','Visual Novel','Nintendo DS','A port for DS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5g8b.jpg'),(2897,'Am I AI',NULL,'Arcade','Sin plataforma','Am I AI - Image Trivia Game is an exciting and addictive game that puts your visual intelligence to the test! Set to challenge players\' perceptions, AM I AI is an innovative picture trivia quiz game that invites players to distinguish between AI-generated images and real images created by photographers, illustrators and designers.\nEach level presents you with two similar images, one created by AI and the other real. The challenge is to identify which image has been generated by AI correctly.\nWith different of categories to choose from, including faces, landscapes, and more, the game offers variety and multiple levels of difficulty, for the most keen of eyes.\nImmerse yourself in stunning visuals as you explore captivating images and uncover the secrets of AI-generated artwork. Train your eye to spot the subtle differences and nuances that distinguish real photos from AI-generated ones.\nEngage in a captivating journey of discovery, where each correct guess brings you closer to unlocking new categories and conquering higher levels. Sharpen your visual acuity and become a master at deciphering AI-generated content.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2898,'Gods Will Be Watching: Special Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2899,'Hell-Copter',NULL,'Fighting, Shooter','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3v4t.jpg'),(2900,'The King\'s Campaign','2023-07-13','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The King\'s Campaign is a hybrid of Grand Strategy and Real-Time Strategy gameplay set in Medieval Europe and North Africa, where you manage your cities, engage in diplomacy and direct your armies on the world map before plunging into battle and commanding your troops directly on the battlefield','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c1h.jpg'),(2901,'Prove You Can Win','2025-01-04','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This is a puzzle game like a mathematical book, based on logic and deduction. In this game, you don\'t need to beat the level, but need to prove it is beatable. Your goal is not to win, but to prove you can win.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pyh.jpg'),(2902,'WildAge',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','A platformer-puzzle game You play as two dragons with different abilities. One dragon can jump, and the other can push magical stones.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2903,'J.League Jikkyou Winning Eleven 3','1998-11-12','Sport','PlayStation','The third installment in the J. League Jikkyou football/soccer series. As with the other games in the series, the game focuses entirely on Japanese soccer leagues and lets you choose a team and try your luck at various available cups, quick exhibition matches or leagues. All the expected gameplay elements of a soccer game are there, from various player moves and rules of the game to setting team formations and choosing teams to control and stadiums to play on. Live commentator is present, but doesn\'t comment on everything but only on key elements as well as addressing players by their actual names. Camera isn\'t fixed and adjusts during gameplay to best show the current action, switches to back view for free kicks and penalties, zooms out if the ball is too high to show both the kicker and the ball, and otherwise works as an action camera slightly rotating angles and using zoom automatically instead of just scrolling over the soccer field. Before engaging in a match with another player or the CPU, player can also do training with a selected team where only your team players are on the field where one can test all the moves and learn the ropes. Penalty kicks are also available for practice, but it includes two teams aiming to score five goals first.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96ah.jpg'),(2904,'Taishou x Alice: All in One','2022-04-14','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Once upon a time, in a topsy-turvy world...\n\nIn the beginning, you find yourself lost within a world of utter darkness. Your memories are gone; even your name is a mystery. But just when the bitter loneliness threatens to break your spirit, you meet Alice—a blond-haired, blue-eyed young man who promptly christens you \"Arisu.\"\n\nLike you, Alice cannot remember anything beyond his own name. Ignoring his protests, you drag him along with you through the darkness... until you happen upon a massive mirror made of crystal. You stumble through the glass and into the Looking-Glass World, an antiquated fairytale dreamscape that feels oddly familiar...\nThere, amid a colorful cast of gender-swapped fairytale characters, you take on the role of the heroine and join them in their twisted tales.\n\nHow will the story end? It\'s up to you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jn0.jpg'),(2905,'Psi Academy: Orientation','2025-01-02','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Finding love in a psychic high school.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pyd.jpg'),(2906,'LEGO Agents: Mission X','2008-12-31','Racing','Web browser','Lego Agents: Mission X was a web browser game based on the Ultra Agents set from 2008.\nThe player was tasked to complete various missions based on different sets using different vehicles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qim.jpg'),(2907,'Dedalus','1997-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Set on the island of Crete, as Mr. Snooze, face the minotaur, escape the maze and save sweet Akhenaten in Dedalus, created by the italian author Ivan Venturi.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gu5.jpg'),(2908,'Reimu Needs Help!? Aunn-chan to the Rescue!','2024-06-28','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a Touhou Project fan game in which the player tries to help Hakurei Reimu, who is in trouble, with items completed in a slot.\nThe main character in this game is Komano Aun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qwj.jpg'),(2909,'State of Decay 2: Curveball Update','2023-09-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','How do you meaningfully add to a game that’s been in players’ hands for five years? In the case of State of Decay 2, you throw a curveball. Although this is the 34th update for State of Decay 2, Curveball represents a significant overhaul. This new update, coming to players for free on September 18, is a landmark moment for the game – not just offering a swathe of new content for the game’s most dedicated players and newcomers alike, but marking a new era in State of Decay 2’s development through the work of Wushu Studios.\n\nWushu, from Liverpool, England, will continue providing support to State of Decay 2 as much of original studio Undead Labs transitions to work on the next entry in the series – but where you might expect that support to be incremental, Wushu is making a very big splash. Curveball is a major update, touching almost every element of the game, and designed to consistently offer brand new challenges, even to those who have been playing State of Decay 2 since release.\n\nAvailable after the fifth in-game day, curveballs can change the world around your settlement in some very interesting ways. Housed in a new menu, curveballs will periodically appear – each with their own narrative attached – offering new objectives, rewards, enemy types and much more. Curveballs can be positive (like finding increased loot) or negative (like buffing regular zombies in multiple ways); they can be timed or objective based; they can affect enemies, your survivors, or other NPCs. Effectively, any element of the game you may have gotten comfortable with can, and often will, change.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7369.jpg'),(2910,'Greengrocer\'s','2024-10-07','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Greengrocer\'s is a clicker game where you click vegetables! In Greengrocer\'s, you click vegetables to gain even more vegetables! For every 3 clicks, you get a new vegetable! You will also receive extra vegetables for the time you spend managing your Greengrocer\'s.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lz0.jpg'),(2911,'Cuter Kaizo World','2022-05-17','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90al.jpg'),(2912,'Dangerous Dave in the Deserted Pirate\'s Hideout','1988-12-31','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), Apple II','In 1990, Softdisk Publishing publishes Dangerous Dave in the Deserted Pirate\'s Hideout! (also known as Dangerous Dave in Trophy Trouble, Dangerous Dave), a puzzle-solving game for the DOS system. Offering action genre, it is now an abandonware.\n\nOne of John Romero\'s earliest games before he became world-famous as one of id Software legends, Dangerous Dave is a fun platformer similar to Super Mario. You are Dangerous Dave, a little precocious kid who must find ten skateboarding trophies that your nemesis Clyde Cooper hid in a pirate\'s hideout. Gameplay in Dangerous Dave is nothing you haven\'t seen if you have played other platform games. What makes the game memorable and a lot of fun, however, are the many cool secret levels and the great sense of humor. Your enemies include creative monsters with names like WeirdWeeds, FearsomeFire, and WickedWater, all of which have unique attacks and characteristics. Level designs are excellent, showing much of Romero\'s knack that would become a hallmark in id Software games. With a lot of secret levels, humorous monsters and gags, and simple but fun gameplay, Dangerous Dave is a solid shareware game that paves the way for id blockbusters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63ca.jpg'),(2913,'Infection Crisis: Fight For Life','2023-11-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Infection Crisis : Fight for life. This is without a budget survival game made by a single developer. A zombie apocalypse has happened in your country. Player must survive on this road.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76m3.jpg'),(2914,'Cyber Rescue: Virus Eruption',NULL,'Shooter, Racing, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Race through cyberspace to destroy the source of your friend\'s virus.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2915,'Disney\'s Pocahontas','1996-12-31','Platform, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Disney\'s Pocahontas is a platform game based on the film of the same name. The Sega Genesis/Mega Drive version was developed by Funcom Oslo on contract with Disney and was released on January 1, 1996. It was followed by a later version for the Game Boy developed by Tiertex Design Studios and released on June 10, 1996, nearly a year after the film\'s premiere','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1w8i.jpg'),(2916,'Spaceman Memories','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Spaceman Memories is a retro JRPG that takes place in a distant future but draws inspiration from ancient Japanese folktales. A story full of wonder and nostalgia as you take on the role of Ichiro 94, an astronaut who wakes up from hypersleep to go on a journey to find the remnants of his past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9524.jpg'),(2917,'Dead Cells: The End Is Near','2024-08-19','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dead Cells final new content update. It brings new mobs, weapons, mutations and biome effects all expanding on the curse mechanic, 40+ new head skins, almost 20 new legendary affixes, extra accessibility options and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wjv.jpg'),(2918,'Wii Sports',NULL,'Simulator, Sport','Wii','Bowl like a pro or go for that home run...\nExperience Tennis, Baseball, Golf, Bowling and Boxing as you never did before. Thanks to the Wii Remote, each sport will be immediately familiar and easy to play. And, when you feel ready, challenge your friends and family: everybody will be in for some serious Wii Sports fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vge.jpg'),(2919,'Hot Wheels Monster Trucks: Stunt Mayhem - Deluxe Edition','2024-10-18','Racing','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hot Wheels Monster Trucks: Stunt Mayhem Deluxe Edition is the definitive arcade Monster Trucks experience, combining the full game with the exclusive Treasure Hunt Pack digital content. The Hot Wheels Monster Trucks: Stunt Mayhem Deluxe Edition includes:\n\n- The full Hot Wheels Monster Trucks: Stunt Mayhem game that let\'s you GO BIG and perform insane stunts while smashing and bashing through fantastical arenas in your favorite monster trucks!\n- Treasure Hunt Shuttle Monster Truck, and Glow Party Skin\n- Treasure Hunt Rodger Dodger Skin\n- Treasure Hunt Twin Mill Skin\n- Exclusive Menu Soundtrack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xbd.jpg'),(2920,'Digerati Best Sellers','2021-02-04','Platform, Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A triple treat of Digerati hits! This bundle contains Slain: Back From Hell, Snakeybus, and Sunless Sea: Zubmariner Edition.\n\nSlain: Back From Hell: A heavy metal inspired arcade combat game with stunning pixel art visuals, challenging old-school gameplay, and a brutal soundtrack. Fight through a Gothic world and face the deadly overlords that reign over each of its cursed realms. Defeat them to continue your quest, or fail and die gruesomely…\n\nSnakeybus: An absurd arcade-driving game and frantic score-chasing experience where the biggest danger is yourself! Wind through city streets, pick up as many passengers as you can and deliver them to their destination to increase your score AND the length of your bus!\n\nSunless Sea: Zubmariner Edition: LOSE YOUR MIND. EAT YOUR CREW. DIE. Take the helm of your steamship in a Victorian Gothic roleplaying game of discovery, loneliness and frequent death.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co391m.jpg'),(2921,'Eat Girl','2019-09-21','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Eat Girl is a surreal top-down action game about moving through tight corridors and eating dots.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cqr.jpg'),(2922,'World of Jade Dynasty','2022-08-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, MOBA','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"World of Jade Dynasty\" (Zhu Xian World) is a fairy-themed online game developed by Perfect World Games. It was launched for public beta on December 19, 2024. The game is developed using the UE5 engine, using various technologies such as physical rasterization and ray tracing rendering, dynamic shadow options, screen space and true 3D reflection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93rm.jpg'),(2923,'2Unreal5Underground','2024-12-30','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fangame that aims to remake the gameplay and story of Need for Speed: Underground 2. It originally started in Unreal Engine 4, titled 2Unreal4Underground, but it has since moved to a custom version of UE5 to utilize its features.\n\nTUFU is in active development and had an alpha release at the end of 2024.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99f2.jpg'),(2924,'Riviera: The Promised Land','2024-02-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','The first entry in the Department Heaven Episodes, Riviera: The Promised Land, comes back as a remastered release. Various additional features have been implemented, significantly upgrading playability. From newcomers to returning players, it is packed with satisfying elements.\n\nRemastered Features\n\nChange the background music between five different sound sources.\nPlay at up to 5x speed.\nSkip event scenes.\nAll illustrations are in high-definition resolution.\nAuto-save.\nDifficulty level and mode select options increase playability.\nBoost feature enables quick skill learning.\nA more user-friendly interface.\nTouchscreen support.\nFreely switch between Japanese and English voice-overs.\nNote: Text is Japanese-only.\nAnd more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90of.jpg'),(2925,'Spring Escape',NULL,'Platform, Indie','Sin plataforma','Spring escape is a 2D platformer where you control a sentient piece of dirt with the objective of getting to the end of every level it ends up waking up in.\nYou must use your powerful dirt digging ability to get through every obstacle, from avoiding deadly cameras to dashing through electricity filled halls, and don’t think the dirt is always going to protect you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l5n.jpg'),(2926,'Ar tonelico: Melody of Elemia','2006-01-26','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','Ar tonelico: Melody of Elemia is a role-playing video game developed by Gust Corporation for the PlayStation 2 and originally published by Banpresto in 2006.\n\nJourney throughout the world of Ar tonelico to find the key to destroying the viruses once and for all. Partner up with a Reyvateil, a girl who can create magic through songs, and fight your way back up the tower to save your home. Explore a Reyvateil\'s inner world with the revolutionary new Dive System, which allows you to go on \"Virtual Dates\" to increase their magical power.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1osv.jpg'),(2927,'WarTech: Senko no Ronde','2007-06-08','Fighting, Shooter','Arcade, Xbox 360','WarTech: Senko no Ronde thrusts the player into a distant future where humanity has colonized countless new galaxies and Earth has become a planet mined for its natural resources. A violent war has erupted as nations struggle for world domination. Rounder Mechs fill the skies as the fate of the world is determined through aerial combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jah.jpg'),(2928,'The Photographer','2025-03-01','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are a crime scene photographer who needs to take pictures of the criminal case involving the Edwards family. The house where it occurred feels eerie and you already know that there is something that does not want you to be here...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9maw.jpg'),(2929,'Tint The Saver','2025-03-17','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A survival game where players capture and protect endangered species, facing hostile environments while maintaining rare wildlife. Cutting down trees and trash lowers the environment index, while cleaning up raises it. If the index hits zero, players’ health rapidly declines.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hm3.jpg'),(2930,'G.I. Joe: The Rise of Cobra','2009-08-04','Shooter','PlayStation 3, Wii, PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360, Legacy Mobile Device, PlayStation 2','After the events of the film, Duke and Scarlett travels to the Arctic and free Heavy Duty, Ripcord and Snake Eyes from the M.A.R.S Detention Center. Also, they fight the Baroness and bring her to the Pit. In Egypt, the Joes learn that Cobra is taking the Apep (Gem), and must defeat Firefly. In the jungle, the Joes learn that Cobra is making a pyramid-like building in the middle of the jungle. From there, the Joes must defeat James McCullen (who now takes the identity of Destro) at the rooftop of the pyramid building. Finally, they must defeat the Cobra Commander and Storm Shadow at North Magnetic Pole Volcano base.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e72.jpg'),(2931,'Never Forget to Nausicaä Game Forever','1984-06-30','Shooter, Adventure','MSX','The third game based off Nausicaä of the Valley of the Wind, Never Forget to Nausicaä Game Forever was released for the MSX and is the most well-known of the releases and has been frequently and erroneously referred to as a game where the player kills the Ohmu.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6muh.jpg'),(2932,'LEGO DC Super-Villains: Aquaman Movie Level Pack 1','2019-01-08','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The first of two packs for LEGO DC Super-Villains inspired by the 2018 film Aquaman. It includes Aquaman, Black Manta, Mera, Orm, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xqt.jpg'),(2933,'Unboxing the mind of a Cryptic Killer','2020-12-27','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Two detectives get trapped as the next targets of a Cryptic Killer. Being separated they have to solve the puzzles that the killer prepared for them. Neither of them has the full picture, so they have to communicate in order to escape.\n\nThe game is co-op only, played on two devices with an external voice connection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ika.jpg'),(2934,'HamJam!!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qal.jpg'),(2935,'Hot Wheels Unleashed: Challenge Accepted Edition','2021-09-30','Racing, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Build your collection!\nThe very best of the Hot Wheels universe is here!\n\nGet behind the wheel of the coolest, fastest, and most legendary vehicles, with their own personality, driving style, and levels of rarity. Discover all their unique attributes and how to use them to face every track and challenge. And with the Livery Editor make your ride a one-of-a-kind masterpiece of speed!\n\nThe Challenge Accepted Edition includes:\n\n- Game: Hot Wheels Unleashed\n- Hot Wheels Pass Vol. 1\n- 2 Sided Poster\n- Steelbook Case\n- Bone Shaker Diecast','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yts.jpg'),(2936,'Tropico Reloaded','2009-07-24','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','TROPICO RELOADED is the ultimate game compilation for hobby-dictators and those dreaming of their own Caribbean island. Tropico combines real-time strategy and simulation elements with a healthy dose of political intrigue and Caribbean flair to create a unique and critically acclaimed game experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cz5.jpg'),(2937,'ACT','2020-12-27','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bluff, build alliances, betray your friends, and become the richest player! Speak with other players, guess their job, and kill them if it can bring you money. Between Police, FBI, Robber, Mafia, Kamikaze, and Serial Killer, you will find the best job to win.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56wp.jpg'),(2938,'Space Dudes vs Alien Dudes','2022-10-28','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Space Dudes vs Alien Dudes - Alien Dudes are attacking the base, It\'s up to the space dudes to stop them!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tnz.jpg'),(2939,'Grand Theft Auto VI','2026-05-26','Shooter, Racing, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5','Grand Theft Auto VI heads to the state of Leonida, home to the neon-soaked streets of Vice City and beyond in the biggest, most immersive evolution of the Grand Theft Auto series yet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rwo.jpg'),(2940,'Mythic Realms','2025-03-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Meta Quest 2, Meta Quest 3','Bring the adventure to your living room in Mythic Realms’ mixed-reality fantasy adventure. Test your skills and gather loot to build up your very own VR kingdom. Mythical creatures and epic boss fights await in this RPG roguelite.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9izk.jpg'),(2941,'NBA Showdown','1994-12-31','Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','The final entry in Electronic Arts\' basketball series based on the old NBA playoffs engine before the NBA Live series took over.\nFor the first time, the game features all 27 NBA teams from the 1993-1994 season. You can now play a full season with 82 games in addition to playoffs and exhibition games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5oyi.jpg'),(2942,'8bit-Collection Data East Vol. 01','2018-02-28','Sin género','Nintendo Entertainment System','Six Data East classics on one Famicom cartridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r9p.jpg'),(2943,'Waltz and Jam',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Waltz is a pure and innocent soul who awoke in Downtown, and Jam is the lovable dog who was there waiting. Join them on this amazing and heartwarming journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8btr.jpg'),(2944,'Trine 4: The Nightmare Prince - Toby\'s Dream','2019-12-10','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This is a DLC level in which the three heroes help Toby the Dog reunite with the prince. The level appears on the map after completing the Prince\'s Dream level in the main game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ew5.jpg'),(2945,'Pretty Princess: Magical Garden Island','2023-06-22','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Create the farm of your dreams!\n\nCultivate crops and raise livestock while exploring the island to collect resources and create goods in this fun fantasy farming simulation game where you are free to play as you like. Set in a cute European fantasy world, this next installment to the Pretty Princess series will delight all princesses – young or young at heart.\n\nThe residents of your magical island are depending on you to keep them thriving and content. Roam the island to collect ingredients and materials to craft the goods they need. Back on your farm, plant seeds to raise crops that will grow over time, and collect milk and eggs from your animals. Use the money and goodwill you earn from your hard work to decorate the island and make it your perfectly cute fantasy home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hn2.jpg'),(2946,'Diorama Worlds','2017-06-13','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build and Explore worlds with a growing library of tiles and objects.  Simple to use, easy to learn, fast to build.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2asx.jpg'),(2947,'Project; Virai: Doomer\'s Life Escape','2025-09-30','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help a doomer girl make her VTuber persona popular and escape her depressive routine. If you can.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rr1.jpg'),(2948,'Pongo17','2023-01-07','Indie, Arcade','Android','In Pongo17, players represent godesses Midori(Nature) and Kuroyuri(Chaos), and they must defend their core crystal from a bouncing ball representing the original information.\nAs they move their paddles left and right, they not only defend their crystals but also modify the original information of the ball.\nAlong the way, they can collect power-ups symbolizing the different forces at play in this eternal struggle.\nThese power-ups have varying effects and can tip the balance in favor of one side or the other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8v8m.jpg'),(2949,'They See Us','2025-12-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','They See Us is a multiplayer horror game. Work together to find all the anomalies – before they find you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ru5.jpg'),(2950,'Warframe: The Seven Crimes of Kullervo','2023-06-21','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Return to Duviri and delve into a sprawling new island dungeon where the tragic Warframe, Kullervo, awaits your redemption. This strange, floating prison obfuscates both Kullervo’s crimes as well as the mysterious (yet familiar) Warden who binds him under lock and key. Explore the prison’s cells to uncover the story of Kullervo’s misdeeds and wield the power of treachery through his trademark daggers and thirst for vengeance.\n\nAs a mainline update It contains an exhaustive list of quality of live changes to the game. The main new content is the 53rd Warframe, Kullervo, and his signature weapons along with the chance to encounter his story missions on a new island in Duviri.\nOther Duviri changes include Captain Vor\'s appearance in Undercroft challenge missions for a chance at new arcanes, Kaithe customization with armor and ephemera, 2 new side missions with Paragrimm\'s Tomes and Lost Belongings objectives, the return of Kaithe races and 15 new decrees.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zqr.jpg'),(2951,'Spiral Knights: Operation Crimson Hammer','2012-02-29','Shooter, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Challenge Warmaster Seerus and claim his mighty weapons for your own in this all-new Expansion Mission Pack!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9atv.jpg'),(2952,'Brasfoot 2021','2021-03-17','Simulator, Sport','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Soccer manager and coach game.\n\nBecome a manager and command a soccer team, buy and sell players, choose the tactics and participate in the championships that simulate reality.\n\nThe game is super light, and several seasons can be played quickly and fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vcn.jpg'),(2953,'A.D.A.M.',NULL,'Puzzle','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A.D.A.M. tells the story of a factory worker robot who gains consciousness.\nGuided only by mysterious messages, hidden by his creator Dr. Eugene Whistlewiley deep in the system logs of the facility\'s mainframe computer, A.D.A.M. tries to uncover the secret behind his existence. Although A.D.A.M. gained control over his own actions when he was disconnected from the central network, he\'s got one serious problem: He\'s only able to move in a straight line.\n\nWhile exploring countless underground rooms, A.D.A.M. learns how to use the environment to his advantage. By seizing control of other robots, he\'s able to venture deeper into the heart of the factory to discover the true nature of his mission.\n\nAlthough the gameplay is based on a simple ruleset, A.D.A.M. is a very challenging game. It requires the player to think ahead, plan tactics and recognize patterns of movement and timing. At the same time, thanks to multiple routes and difficulty levels, A.D.A.M. is suitable for all skill levels.\n\nBy introducing new mechanics, enemies and environments along the way, the games ensures that the player must adapt his/her mindset frequently to solve puzzles and dig deeper into the mysterious plot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8chj.jpg'),(2954,'Grandia HD Remaster','2019-10-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','GRANDIA HD Remaster brings enhanced visuals to both gameplay and cinematic videos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uni.jpg'),(2955,'Buggos 2',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Buggos 2 is a horde-based auto-battler where players command a sentient hivemind to evolve and deploy massive swarms of alien insects against human forces. The game features permanent upgrades, specialized unit types, and strategic control of the battlefield to overwhelm increasingly advanced enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rvm.jpg'),(2956,'LEGO Stunt Rally','2000-09-13','Racing','Game Boy Color','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76ju.jpg'),(2957,'Cat Lady: The Card Game','2019-12-12','Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Cat Lady: The Card Game is a fun card-drafting game in which players are Cat Ladies, trying to tempt cats into their cattery using food, toys, costumes and more. Based on the much-loved card game by AEG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3my4.jpg'),(2958,'Inspector Waffles','2021-10-14','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Inspector Waffles is a point & click detective game in which you follow the story of a witty cat detective. Will you find out who killed Fluffy, the beloved CEO of Box Furnitures? The first hints are leading to something bigger than expected...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2urr.jpg'),(2959,'Sonic 3 Timelines SMS Remake','2022-06-26','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fanmade remake of both Sonic the Hedgehog Chaos and Sonic the Hedgehog Triple Trouble for Sega Game Gear, featuring new characters and habilities, new zones and levels, red star rings to unlock new stages, blue spheres special stages, Time Stones, a 16 bit music mode, a hub world, Ultra transformations, a pause menu, a debug mode and cheats, new color palettes and new player camera, gamepad support, 30 and 60 fps support, 4:3, widescreen and ultrawide.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7191.jpg'),(2960,'Punishment Special Edition','2025-01-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help the knight Roger in his mission to rescue survivors in an ancient dungeon, in this turn-based RPG game with horror elements based on old games and other Survivor Horror and Soulslike titles. Face challenges like dealing with monsters, puzzles and yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pyc.jpg'),(2961,'Cazzarion: Hell Biker','2025-03-14','Simulator','PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i26.jpg'),(2962,'Rose of Winter','2016-10-17','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Rose of Winter is a charming visual novel with adventure, romance, and heartbreak. Choose one of four princes to take on your adventure, and make decisions to unlock multiple endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gmx.jpg'),(2963,'Animal Crossing Plaza','2013-08-07','Simulator','Wii U','A free application on Wii U that allows players to hang out in the plaza with their favorite villagers and import their photos from Animal Crossing: New Leaf save them to a gallery and share them on the Wii U Miiverse. The service ended on January 1st 2015.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bvm.jpg'),(2964,'ArcticBoy: The Interactive Story','2021-04-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A touching story of a young programmer Alexey. One day he meets a girl through a joke site, but who would have thought that Alexei would not be laughing at all. Take a pack of sushi rolls, saddle a snowmobile and go on a long journey to your princess.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lml.jpg'),(2965,'Hopscotch','2017-10-05','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Jumping game with fun graphics, jump and do not let the janitor catch you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bnb.jpg'),(2966,'Alien Weapon Test Grounds','2024-08-07','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Alien Weapon Test Grounds (AWTG) is an artificial domain where you can test guns created by other civilizations and sharpen your shooting skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nfj.jpg'),(2967,'The End of Us','2011-01-30','Indie','Web browser','Circling chasing bumping leading caretaking racing following friendling crashing bouncing rushing thriving finally understanding dying','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j5e.jpg'),(2968,'Coward Knight',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2969,'The Legend of Zelda: The Hunter\'s Song','2025-01-03','Role-playing (RPG)','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','“Old Man Link” is paid a visit by an old acquaintance but what’s precipitated this visit?\n\nWhy, another adventure of course… But why indeed?\n\nFeaturing the following changes to A Link to the Past:\n\nNew Sprites\nThree New Dungeons\nA White Beard\nA cute little Minish garbed in full armor\nPicasso’s Peace Dove\nA Buzzing Hero\nA Capra Hircus\n\nand so much more…\n\nTake courage. Experience “Link” with a voice(gasp), stripped of sword and youth(double gasp). Rely on wisdom(or save state(no you’re better than that(but it’s so convenient(fair enough)))) to not soft lock the game from that bomb puzzle(triple gasp to admit the game’s broken so brazenly).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99eu.jpg'),(2970,'Hatsune Miku: Project Diva Extend','2012-09-13','Music','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Portable','Hatsune Miku: Project Diva Extend is a rhythm game and an enhanced version of the 2010 title, Hatsune Miku: Project Diva 2nd. Like the original the game primarily makes use of Vocaloids, a series of singing synthesizer software, and the songs created using these vocaloids most notably the virtual-diva Vocaloid Hatsune Miku. The gameplay remains the same as in the previous game, but Extend features a larger set of songs and modules. Similar to past games in the series, a companion game Hatsune Miku: Project Diva Dreamy Theater Extend was released on the PlayStation 3 with improved visuals and it also supports stereoscopic 3D for the first time in the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1trl.jpg'),(2971,'Muppet Adventure: Chaos at the Carnival','1990-11-01','Sin género','Nintendo Entertainment System','Yipes! The awful, evil Dr. Grump has pignapped the lovely Miss Piggy and taken her to his secret carnival hideout! Now Kermit and the whole crazy Muppet crew need your help! Jump! Leap! Hop! And charge into action! But watch out! Dr. Grump\'s Carnival of Clamorous Confusion is a rollicking roller coaster of thrills, spills, and chills! Join Kermit as he faces the fearsome challenge of the Raging River Ride. Help Fozzie lick the Amazing Ice Cream Maze. (But beware of those Canine Carnival Barkers!) Blast off with Gonzo on the Lost in Space Ride. Then let Animal drive you crazy on the incredible Crash Car Course. And if you dare, enter the ultimate challenge - the Cave of the Grumpasaurus! Only your quick wrist, sharp wit - and some help from Kermit and the gang - can defeat Dr. Grump and rescue the still-lovely Miss Piggy! It\'s Muppet mayhem! You\'ll want to play again and again!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6osa.jpg'),(2972,'Escape Observation','2025-03-16','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','‘Escape Observation’ is a short walking simulator inspired by the game ‘The Exit 8’, where you can only move your character and control your vision. It is important to note that the game is not about finding out if a room has changed, but rather that each room is different and you must be aware of the signals that these changes give you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g9g.jpg'),(2973,'Dollar','2024-07-12','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This dollar is an excellent steam inventory item based on a real life currency item of the same name. Every hour you will receive a dollar, with a very small chance to receive the golden dollar. Good Luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kpv.jpg'),(2974,'Demon Front','2002-12-31','Shooter','Arcade','The gameplay is similar to Metal Slug and other run and gun games. It lacks the vehicles that were an element of Metal Slug.\n\nIn addition, there are some unique features in the game. Each of the four characters brings along a pet, which can be sent to attack enemies or used as a shield. There are three buttons: Shoot, jump, and shield. Holding the shoot button charges your pet, and when released the pet launches a stationary devastating attack for a few seconds. The shield button converts the pet into a shield that is permanent - until you press the button again or it takes enough damage to disappear. Melee attacks and pet attacks release hearts which boost your shield power.\n\nCharacters include Jake and Sara, two regular humans from Earth. Dr. J, a scientist, and Maya an ape. All characters largely play the same.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vd8.jpg'),(2975,'Gears 5: Ultimate Edition','2019-09-10','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','From one of gaming’s most acclaimed sagas, Gears is bigger than ever, with five thrilling modes and the deepest campaign yet. With all-out war descending, Kait Diaz breaks away to uncover her connection to the enemy and discovers the true danger to Sera – herself.\n\nGears 5 Ultimate Edition includes:\n• Gears 5 standard edition\n• Halo: Reach Character Pack\n• 30 days of Boost','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ecj.jpg'),(2976,'Nintendo World Championships: NES Edition','2024-07-18','Platform, Racing','Nintendo Switch','Test your speedrunning skills across more than 150 challenging moments from 13 classic NES games! Compete against players around the world online, challenge your friends on the couch, or try to see how far you can push your personal bests.\n\nDo you have what it takes to be a champion? The tougher challenges may truly test your limits!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86hd.jpg'),(2977,'European War 5: Empire','2016-12-25','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Commander!\nYou are about to build a great empire:\nWorld conquests through 6 eras with over 100 great generals,\nFollow the conquering journeys of great kings such as Alexander, Genghis Khan, Caesar, and Barbarossa\n\nAcross 2000 years, more than 150 major historical battles\nWorld conquests through 6 eras with over 100 great generals\n22 world civilizations, 90 military units\n\n------------------【Empire Mode】------------------\n\nCommander! You are about to build a great empire\n*** Your empire will experience 6 ages and explore 2000 years of history\n*** As the empire expands, there are a variety of tasks to be explored\n*** Seize the cities of the enemy and collect resources to build your own\n*** Hire generals in the tavern and pursue beautiful princesses from different countries\n*** Trade in the market, defend the frontier, and defeat the invading generals\n*** Collect all sorts of materials and grow your empire to a new age\n\n------------------【Battle Mode】------------------\n\n*** Fight 150 great battles and experience 6 ages including the Classical Age, the Medieval Age, the Empire Age, the Discovery Age, the Gunpowder Age and the Industrial Age.\n*** Follow the conquering journeys of great kings such as Alexander, Genghis Khan, Caesar, and Barbarossa\n\n------------------【World Conquest】------------------\n\n*** Conquer the world in 6 ages\n*** Exercise your power to develop economy, declare wars or establish diplomatic relations with other countries\n*** Meet various influential events during your conquering journey\n*** Upgrade the age and recruit different armies and generals\n*** Princesses have different talents, they will promote the development of the empire\n*** Show your diplomatic skills form an alliance, declare wars or stay neutral','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8iog.jpg'),(2978,'Atari Arcade 2','2025-04-25','Sin género','Evercade','Enjoy 10 classic early ’80s arcade games from Atari on Evercade, including the legendary Berzerk and its sequel Frenzy, plus cult favourites like Maze Invaders, Fire Truck and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lxx.jpg'),(2979,'CoLoBot','2001-12-31','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Original mix of adventure and educational game. While you have fun with this game, you will also learn C-BOT, program language that is similar to all C- languages. C-BOT wouldn\'t allow you to write programs, but it will ease learning of C- languages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c1l.jpg'),(2980,'Strategist','2018-08-30','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Life is all about achieving goals and dodging obstacles. In this brainteasing game, you use your mind to determine a path you will engage with your body.\nThis mind boggling game inspires you to think before you do. Even more so, before thinking about taking action you are encouraged to observe. See what the world around you is doing and learn from it.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2981,'Railbreak: Extra Cheese Collection','2023-12-29','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Dinos and zombies await in three terrifying adventures!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p8i.jpg'),(2982,'LEGO Star Wars III: The Clone Wars','2011-03-22','Platform, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, PlayStation Portable','The Saga continues. Build, battle and laugh your way across the Star Wars universe like never before! Play as Anakin Skywalker and Obi-Wan Kenobi through a story spanning the entire Clone Wars era. LEGO Star Wars III: The Clone Wars combines epic space battles, challenging puzzles and of course, the imaginative gameplay of LEGO.\n\nThe Sith and their allies have declared war on the Jedi Council with an army of droids, and it’s up to you to stop them. With the Dark Side gathering power and entire star systems in turmoil, galactic freedom hangs in the balance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ysb.jpg'),(2983,'Hentai Tales: Conception Shrine','2024-04-04','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','There is a shrine called the Conception Shrine. It is said that women who come here will be able to conceive as long as they worship the abbot. Therefore, this shrine is famous and popular with a large number of childless women.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80im.jpg'),(2984,'Exo One','2024-06-27','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Exo One is a single-player, exoplanetary exploration game where you pilot an alien craft capable of manipulating gravity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xto.jpg'),(2985,'Sailor\'s Grave: the Curse of the Cook','2019-05-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Delve into the Silver Christine, a cruise ship that disappeared below the ocean surface. Collect the transmitters containing information about the ship\'s demise. Beware, as the murky ocean hides dark secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1l9a.jpg'),(2986,'The Bible','2022-11-14','Quiz/Trivia, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A digital recreation of The Bible in Kinetic Novel form! Read through and save passages in any order with an original soundtrack, or listen through the greatest story ever told in audiobook form. Featuring an extensive Trivia section to find out how well you really know the stories of Old and New.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97yn.jpg'),(2987,'Highway to the Moon','2016-08-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Highway to the Moon is a fast-paced scrolling arcade shooter where you take control of Jacob Helaway, stunt man and thrill-seeker extraordinaire, as he makes his way to the Moon in pursuit of the interstellar criminal known only as the Moon Man. You’ll have your work cut out for you though, because between the Unger Max Gang, Air Traffic Control, Alien Affairs, and Leadersquad, it looks like everyone wants a piece of the Moon Man.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2988,'The Bugs Bunny Birthday Blowout','1990-09-01','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','The game is a side-scrolling adventure game where you control the famous Warner Brothers cartoon character Bugs Bunny on a quest to get to his 50th birthday party. He is armed with a mallet that he can swing at various enemies to defeat them, deflect certain projectiles or destroy bricks. He can also collect hearts to restore his health and carrots for bonus points. At the end of each level, Bugs Bunny had to use his mallet to defeat a Warner Brothers cartoon character such as Foghorn Leghorn, Sylvester, or the Tasmanian Devil. These other Looney Tunes characters are trying to stop Bugs because they are all jealous that Bugs gets all the attention.\nLevels:\n1: Grass land (Daffy Duck, Tweety Bird, Daffy, Wile E. Coyote)\n2: Desert (Daffy, Tweety, Yosemite Sam) (Level 2-3 has no boss)\n3: Evening Canyon (Daffy, Elmer Fudd, Daffy, Sylvester Cat)\n4: Night Caves (Daffy, Tweety, Daffy, Pepe le Pew)\n5: Jungle (Daffy, Elmer Fudd, Daffy, Foghorn Leghorn)\n6: Temple (Daffy, Elmer Fudd, Daffy, Tazmanian Devil)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v2r.jpg'),(2989,'LEGO Marvel\'s Avengers: The Thunderbolts Character Pack','2016-01-26','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One','This pack for LEGO Marvel\'s Avengers include 7 new characters from the antihero team The Thunderbolts: Citizen V, Atlas, Mach 5, Songbird, Meteorite, Techno, and Jolt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83f9.jpg'),(2990,'Vampire Clans',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Create the most powerful Vampire Clan, to take over Paris streets and underground. Challenge other clans, beat them and enslave. Use spells, alchemy and human blood to grow up your power. Become the terror of all inhabitants or use quiet politics to achieve your goals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57zm.jpg'),(2991,'No Creeps Were Harmed TD','2023-08-18','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Employ lethal turrets, traps, and gadgets to defend against an onslaught of evolving creeps! Step into a twisted, hyper 3D, mind bending realm. Upgrade and adapt your defenses. Become a master maze crafter. Collect bizarre artifacts. Rush creeps for lucrative rewards, and succumb to greed!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j05.jpg'),(2992,'Target Party',NULL,'Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Target Party, the first-person platform game that will make you feel the adrenaline of speed and the art of speedrunning! Face a fast-paced challenge as you dash through action-packed, thrilling levels with only one goal in mind: destroy all the targets before you reach the finish line, and do it at full speed!\nExplore different strategies and routes, perfect your jumps and spins, and discover hidden shortcuts as you dive into the challenging world of Target Party. Master the mechanics and compete with players from around the world in online leaderboards to prove who is the true king of the party.\nJoin the party and discover why Target Party is the first-person platformer that will keep you glued to the screen, enjoying dizzying thrills with every jump, every shot and every second it takes to reach victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pil.jpg'),(2993,'Hentai Tales: The World Only Maid','2024-02-22','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You wake up and find yourself in a strange room, and a maid next to you wakes you up. You seem to be the master of the house and have countless maids who will do anything you command. Even if it\'s a little confusing, you decide to enjoy the situation. What will happen?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80yx.jpg'),(2994,'DCS World: Su-25',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Note: This is the exact same simulation of the Su-25 as featured in DCS: Flaming Cliffs 3.The Su-25 \'Grach\' (Rook), NATO callsigned \'Frogfoot\', is a dedicated strike attack aircraft designed for the close air support and anti-tank roles. The Su-25 has seen combat in several conflicts during its more than 25 years in service.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lw9.jpg'),(2995,'Real Hentai 5','2025-02-20','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2996,'Phantom Brave: The Lost Hero - Heroes of the Past','2025-02-27','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2997,'Phantom Brave: The Lost Hero - Parallel Siblings','2025-02-20','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2998,'Moloch: Zero','2018-10-26','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to MOLOCH (Zero), the official interview simulation for MOLOCH Corporation. If you are reading this, you have been selected as a potential candidate for further screening for the position of [shift manager] within MOLOCH Corporation.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(2999,'Hentai Tales: Taboo Sisters','2025-01-30','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The protagonist is an ordinary social person with a huge penis. He lives with his sisters at home. On the surface, they have a harmonious relationship between the siblings, but the undercurrent of desire is quietly growing... What happens there?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ooa.jpg'),(3000,'Trauma','2011-08-08','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Racing, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','TRAUMA tells a story of a young woman who survives a car accident. Recovering at the hospital, she has dreams that shed light on different aspects of her identity - such as the way she deals with the loss of her parents. TRAUMA lets you experience those dreams in an interactive way, reminiscent of Point-and-Click Adventure Games.\n\nIt builds upon this established formula by introducing a gesture-based interface, real-time 3D technology for dynamic level layouts, unique photographic visuals and a level design philosophy that focuses on creating a rich experience rather than an elaborate puzzle challenge. Combined with the unconventional story, it is aimed to be a compact and deep game for a literate and mature audience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k38.jpg'),(3001,'Epic Racers','2020-11-06','Racing','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Epic Racers is a Super Mario Kart mod with new characters and tracks based on mythologies and religions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sia.jpg'),(3002,'Monster Collection: Kamen no Madoushi','1999-10-28','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation','A Role-Playing game, developed by Kadokawa and published by ESP Software, which was released in Japan in 1999.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zwc.jpg'),(3003,'VHS','2024-07-17','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','VHS, the most retro and nostalgic Idle game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8joc.jpg'),(3004,'Dungeon No Dungeon','2021-03-06','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A turn-based cult strategy game: Unpredictable expeditions that never end!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2txy.jpg'),(3005,'Florensia','2016-11-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Florensia is a Free-to-Play MMORPG and with it´s 3D anime style the game shows you its legendary worlds ashore and at sea.\nMysterious islands, the great ocean, dungeons, picturesque pirates and dangerous monsters are waiting to be discovered.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q69.jpg'),(3006,'Puppycraft: Maze','2025-02-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A turn-based strategic duel where you command a tactical cat against AI dog armies on a 7x7 dynamic board; Deploy 10 unique barriers per match to build evolving mazes while racing to breakthrough enemy lines; Victory demands razor-sharp calculation of distance optimization and resource management.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pyb.jpg'),(3007,'D4: Dark Dreams Don\'t Die - Season 1: Deluxe Edition','2015-06-05','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Deluxe Edition of D4: Dark Dreams Don\'t Die - Season 1 includes the Base Game and all of the following:\n\n- D4: Special Costume Set (12 Beers) DLC\n- D4: Special Art Book\n- D4: Season One Voice Over Script\n- D4: Mini Soundtrack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hx8.jpg'),(3008,'SuperLite 1500 series: The Tetris','2000-07-19','Puzzle','PlayStation','The original version of the latest puzzle game classic!\n\n\"Tetris\" is proud to number more than 50 million sales worldwide, is a popular puzzle game. This work \"The Tetris\" So scores continue to compete off the block \"1PLAYER\" mode, you can play with man against man \"2PLAYER\" We offer a mode.\n\n\"1PLAYER\" mode is a type of game scores compete. Eliminate one level up every 10 columns, change the background image is available 140 sheets at a time. The faster the blocks fall in the level rises will slow once every five levels, maintains the integrity of the tension and sense of relief on continuing the game.\n\nThe difficulty levels from 0 to 30 can be selected at intervals of 5 levels. When you reach a level higher than 35 games go, the more you can choose from one level in the next play.\n\n\"2PLAYER\" mode is a type of game play against each other to do two users. Depending on the column player disappeared, garbage is fed to the other blocks. Saseta side wins piled up above the opponent\'s block.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co586d.jpg'),(3009,'Peggle Blast','2014-12-02','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Take your best shot with a blend of luck, skill, and joyous thrills in Peggle Blast! Clear the orange pegs as you rack up bonus points, and hit style shots that’ll make you smile for weeks. Learn from Peggle Masters and harness their powers to score big in peg-popping challenges. From the makers of Bejeweled and Plants vs. Zombies comes the newest PopCap game, bursting with character, charm, and fun. Join the millions who adore the magic of Peggle. Aim for greatness!\n\nSIMPLE CONTROLS\nBring the joy anywhere, anytime with easy-to-use controls and unpredictable gameplay. It’s an exuberant ball-and-peg blasting puzzler everyone can enjoy, but only the magical will master.\n\nSMILE-INDUCING TENSION\nBounce your way to fun with every high stakes shot and mighty near miss. Pop orange pegs to reach the explosive joy of Extreme Fever. Compete against friends while you progress – and send them sparkling gifts! The action never gets stale thanks to peg-gooping gnomes, gem drops, time bombs, brilliant boosts, and triumphant rainbows.\n\nA FANTASTIC ADVENTURE\nImmerse yourself in an evolving, wondrous map full of glittering worlds, including Pearl the octopus’s sunken pirate ship and Madame Batrina’s cave opera hall. Win big and experience over-the-top reward moments, enhanced by a majestically dynamic soundtrack that sings with each shot.\n\nLEARN FROM MAGICAL MASTERS\nMeet mystical Peggle Masters and learn to use their extraordinary powers, like Bjorn the unicorn’s Super Guide, or Jimmy Lightning’s nuttarific multiball, to rack up legendary scores. Then test your skills with head-to-head matches against the Evil Master Fnord (Bjorn’s mischievous brother). Aim! Shoot! Score!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3btd.jpg'),(3010,'Color Me !!! for Mac',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3011,'Dance Dance Revolution Supernova','2006-07-12','Music, Arcade','Arcade, PlayStation 2','The hottest revolution and bestselling video game in the music game category returns to its arcade roots with Dance Dance Revolution Supernova, the first arcade version to be released in North America in 6 years. Dance Dance Revolution Supernova uses a completely new hardware engine and is the largest game in the series. Players will have access to over 300 songs from different musical genres and 2000+ dance step patterns. Dance Dance Revolution Supernova is a brand new evolution in the DDR series and expands on every aspect of what made the original series innovative, fun and addictive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5twx.jpg'),(3012,'Katana Robo: RTA','2023-12-15','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Katana Robo fights his way to the top floor of the Robot Tower, which looks like a platformer game stage, to thwart Samurai Robo\'s ambitious plan to use the Dominion Sphere at the top of the Robot Tower to control the robots throughout the universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fjo.jpg'),(3013,'Elite Forces: Navy SEALs','2002-05-02','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A new era of world conflict. Go where most men don\'t dare and do what most men won\'t. Arrive by sea, air and land prepared for unconventional warfare, counter-guerilla tactics and clandestine operations in the most turbulent hot spots in the world. Push your stamina and strength beyond your physical and mental limits, ready to lay down your life in service of your country.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uzt.jpg'),(3014,'Tiny Troopers: Joint Ops','2020-09-01','Fighting, Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One','Fire yourself into an epic bite-sized arcade shooter, filled to the brim with action-packed mini maps of mayhem.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e06.jpg'),(3015,'Ar Tonelico Qoga: Knell of Ar Ciel','2010-01-28','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3','The third game in the Ar Tonelico series, and the first on PlayStation 3.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v5b.jpg'),(3016,'The House','2014-07-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You came to see the old datached house which you are going to buy.There is no one in the house.While looking through the numerous rooms and corridors you understand that there is something unusual.Since then you found out a terrible story.Besides you understand that you\'re not alone there.There is a \"master\" in the house,the personification of the evil.At first it will frighten you,then it will try to kill you,after that it\'ll call its dark forces.You have either to die or try to win the evil by all means...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ngw.jpg'),(3017,'Globesweeper: Hex Puzzler','2019-11-16','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Globesweeper: Hex Puzzler takes the spherical minesweeper concept from Globesweeper and twists it into a whole new logic puzzle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uwa.jpg'),(3018,'Where Kiwis','2024-07-03','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Search for 100 Kiwis. A carefully hand drawn scene filled with cute characters. The process is short and won\'t take up too much player time. You can choose your favorite dyeing for the convenience of color blind players. Extremely easy to achieve.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8e9o.jpg'),(3019,'Asuka-san ha Nabikanai','2022-12-23','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Asuka-san wa Nabikanai is a visual novel developed by Azarashi Software about a student council president.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co552z.jpg'),(3020,'Related','2020-05-14','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Related is a game that immerses into the dark but fascinating story of two sisters. Explore the dark locations of an abandoned orphanage, solve mysteries, while immersed in memories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g21.jpg'),(3021,'No Walking, No Problem!','2009-12-31','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','Oh no! An evil purple slug has stolen poor Sticky\'s ability to walk!\nUse your mouse to manipulate objects to guide Sticky on his journey to vengefully steal back his walking power!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r4z.jpg'),(3022,'Zoku Mikagura Shoujo Tanteidan: Kanketsuhen','1999-10-07','Visual Novel','PlayStation','Zoku Mikagura Shoujo Tanteidan～Kanketsu Hen～ is an adventure game that lets players enter into the mystic Taisho and early Showa periods and find out the truth behind each case. The number of scenarios has been increased largely and the “inference trigger” feature is kept intact to deliver the most enjoyable detective game experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rgm.jpg'),(3023,'Garden\'s Bane: DG\'s Quest','2022-07-10','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a difficult precision platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yt6.jpg'),(3024,'Ace Combat 7: Skies Unknown - Collector\'s Edition','2019-01-18','Simulator','PlayStation 4','The Collector\'s Edition of Ace Combat 7: Skies Unknown contained the base game, the Aces at War: A History 2019 art book, a steelbook, an emblem patch, and six emblem stickers all within a collector\'s box. In Korea and Taiwan, the Collector\'s Edition also included the Season Pass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zp2.jpg'),(3025,'Sir Galgano: A Medieval Tale','2025-04-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sir Galgano is a side-scrolling medieval beat ‘em up game with RPG elements','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ltd.jpg'),(3026,'Crystal Quest','1992-07-10','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','PC-9800 Series','The puzzles include a tile-matching memory game and a timed top-down maze sprint (find the exit before the time runs out). In each subsequent area, the difficulty of these puzzles increases, and the amount of clothes the demi-humans wear after a puzzle has been solved decreases.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co995k.jpg'),(3027,'Shelter 2 Mountains','2015-08-25','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Lynx mother Inna and her cubs discovers a new area on their journey. A vast mountain landscape where dense lowland forests leads up to the vistas of the mountain tops. But they are not alone. The small family must use both wits and agility to outsmart the prey and predators spreading from this new world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dzxh61nviowyz4lkens9.jpg'),(3028,'Ultimo Reino 2','2020-04-13','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Time of guilds, wizards, warriors, blacksmiths, tailors, scribes, alchemists, woodworkers, animal tamers, brewers, traders, traitors and murderers. The Ultimo Reino II begins!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pd1.jpg'),(3029,'Frame of Mind: A game of Thoughts',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Frame of Mind is a brief and cozy narrative game that lets you discover a character trough thoughts and mementos they find while moving out of their parents home. It\'s an introspective game, meant to share some experiences a peer-group of neurodivergent queers, including the developer, had growing up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8txg.jpg'),(3030,'Konosuba: God\'s Blessing on This Wonderful World! Love for These Clothes of Desire!','2024-02-08','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','It\'s time for a Visual Novel Quest with a twist! Join Kazuma, a reincarnated adventurer, and spend turbulent days with his unfortunate party members. Prepare for waifus, dress-up and resource management and get ready for an Isekai comedy that’s out of this world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qe0.jpg'),(3031,'RV Renovation',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Build your dream RV in this incredibly detailed and highly realistic simulation game. Find classic, unique campers, busses, minivans or caravans. Restore them, give them a new look and bring them back to life!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3032,'Dynasty Warriors Online','2015-11-19','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','The game was originally announced for Microsoft Windows in 2004 as Shin Sangoku Musou BB (Dynasty Warriors Broadband), with a release in Japan in early 2006. The PS3 version was later confirmed, exclusive only to Japan, in 2010.\n\nThe game\'s name changed from Dynasty Warriors BB changed its name to Dynasty Warriors Online on Wednesday, November 28, 2007.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6t9g.jpg'),(3033,'Mount Your Friends','2013-06-06','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Mount Your Friends is a physics based competitive climbing game where what you climb is each other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qry.jpg'),(3034,'Meridian 59','1995-12-15','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Meridian 59 was the first graphical massively multi-player game. Played on the Internet with hundreds of users able to interact in the same world, the game is often considered the start of modern MMO gaming.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ha7.jpg'),(3035,'Audio Party Pack','2020-05-14','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A party game designed around sound. Includes 3 mini-games featuring \"sound\" focused gameplay!This party game is designed with visual impairments in mind as it relies strongly on sound. There are three mini-games, each focusing on a different challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45u9.jpg'),(3036,'Balloon Strike','2018-05-18','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Balloon Strike is amazing Balloon Strike game in which you have bow and arrow to hit balloon and get score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6agv.jpg'),(3037,'D&D Classics',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','This ultimate collection consists of 30 iconic Dungeons & Dragons video games. These include “Gold Box Classics”, \"Silver Box Classics\", \"Spelljammer: Pirates of Realmspace\" and other adaptations of the D&D universes that bring to life many iconic locations, monsters, heroes, and villains.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ekn.jpg'),(3038,'Knights of Riddle','2021-01-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into Riddle, a vast world teeming with magic and mysteries to explore! See what happens as you explore and meet new fellow knights and uncover mysteries and challenges as you progress through the world learning the beautiful story and lore behind this magical world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44k3.jpg'),(3039,'Heretic: Shadow of the Serpent Riders','1996-12-31','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','In a twisted medieval dimension, undead creatures and bestial horrors have done the unthinkable--callously slaughtering your entire race. Your friends. Your family. Eliminated. But the nightmare has just begun. Wielding ungodly weapons such as the Firemace and Hellstaff and casting spells from the Tomes of Power, you must seek your vengeance. Or die trying.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2no1.jpg'),(3040,'Roman Legionary',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Take on the role of a soldier in the Roman army and fight in brutal battles in which you will fight with barbarians and hostile Romans. Strive to become the commander of the Roman legion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yoe.jpg'),(3041,'Abracadabrew','2020-10-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Abracadabrew is a memory-based 1-4 player local co-op game. Cooperate with friends while using your memory to brew as many potions as you can by dawn. Gather ingredients hidden around the room while communicating and staying focused to unlock new brain-racking potion combinations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pdd.jpg'),(3042,'Blood Bowl: Death Zone','2019-07-10','Sport, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blood Bowl: Death Zone is a competitive 1 vs. 1 game of football, violence and mayhem. Pick a Star Player, a team and a sponsor from the many combinations available and challenge coaches from all over the world in real-time. It’s Blood Bowl, like you’ve never seen it before!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3043,'High Seas, High Profits!','2025-03-31','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Live your medieval trader life! Buy low, sell high and explore the world! Buy ships, build businesses, find or train captains. Deal with pirates, manipulate mayors and challenge traders. React to hundreds of events that shape your very own procedurally-generated world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m3s.jpg'),(3044,'Wormster Dash','2018-03-29','Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Prepare yourself for a one-of-its-kind runner game with hidden passages, deathly traps and a dazzling fantasy world. Your task is to outrun a menacing monster you awakened when digging too deep into sacred grounds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27gj.jpg'),(3045,'Time Secret',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3046,'Flappy',NULL,'Puzzle','PC-8800 Series, Sharp X1, Wii, Family Computer, NEC PC-6000 Series, MSX','Flappy is a puzzle game by in the same vein as the Eggerland series and Sokoban that is obscure outside Japan. It features Flappy, a somewhat mole-like character who must complete each level by pushing a blue stone from its starting place to the blue tile destination.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9het.jpg'),(3047,'Rockman Bug Sweeper','2003-12-31','Puzzle','Legacy Mobile Device','Rockman Bug Sweeper (ロックマン バグスイーパー Rokkuman Bagu Suīpā) is a Mega Man themed Minesweeper game released by Capcom for mobile phones in Japan. Instead of mines, Mega Man and Beat deal with hidden bugs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vwa.jpg'),(3048,'Phenol\'s Pocket Photo Gallery Vol. 1','2025-03-13','Sin género','Web browser, Game Boy','Welcome to the \"Phenol\'s Pocket Photo Gallery\" now being held in an 8-bit virtual space.\n\nThe game contains 45 photographs by photographer Phenol, converted into a format that can be displayed on the Game Boy.\n\nYou control Shannon, a young girl visiting a photo exhibition, and you will be able to look around the exhibition in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kzp.jpg'),(3049,'Date Warp','2010-05-22','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Time keeps slip, slip, slipping away...You\'re trapped in a mansion with five guys, one of whom has a gun.There\'s a giant countdown ticking down. At the end of this story, someone will die.Will it be you? Or can you escape... the DATE WARP?Use a steady hand to connect the wires and put the pieces together to solve the mystery of the mansion before it\'s too late. Your choices will turn the story towards one of eleven possible endings.Characters: Janet - A freshman at Brook College, previously a socially-isolated student. Will she live or die? Alben - A mysteriously hostile young man. Why is he so angry? Bradley - A cheerful jock who\'s been asking every freshman girl on exactly one date each. What is he planning? Linds - A lecherous scientist who is clearly up to something. What does he know about the forcefields? Nathaniel - A polite and wealthy gentleman offering assistance to those in need. But is that too convenient? Rafael - A soft-spoken young man who takes care of others but dodges questions about his past. Who is he working for?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o6e.jpg'),(3050,'Karma Miwa','2016-08-12','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You play a strange fragile flightless bird, who has been gone for too long and now wants to go home to its mate, which is far away.\n\nHowever for unknown reasons, enemies are being lured and attracted the bird. The flightless bird needs to run and jump over many enemies and obstacles on its journey home to your mate. The bird trek is long and full of danger.\n\nCan you help the bird to get home to your mate?\n\nThis game was heavily inspired by the classic game Snokie, which appeared on the Commodore 64 and Atari 800 back in the ’80s. While much of the basic gameplay is similar, the graphics, music and sound has been enhanced considerably and there are many newer enemy types.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44fl.jpg'),(3051,'Tropico 4: Megalopolis','2012-11-15','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build the largest city in the Caribbean on an island with constant influx of immigrants. Deal with problems such as unemployment, over-population and food shortages. Use the Conventillo, a cheap residential building that houses many residents using little space.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dh902tvzhs0kkpxzmzy6.jpg'),(3052,'Phantom Brave: The Lost Hero - The Wandering Pirate','2025-03-06','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3053,'Compartmentalize','2024-11-17','Music, Puzzle','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A narrative Sokoban puzzler about grief, anger, reflection, and other complex emotions and feelings created for the Lady Arcaders Game Jam (LAG Jam 2024). \"Sokoban\" refers to the mechanic of moving objects around a level towards a marked goal.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3054,'Granny Applebee\'s Cookie Factory','1993-12-31','Point-and-click','Apple II','Granny Applebee\'s Cookie Factory is an educational managerial program.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qj0.jpg'),(3055,'Totm','2015-02-03','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Totm is a multiplayer action game with realtime strategy influences. Kill creeps and opponents, gain power, grab items. Be one step ahead of your enemies and choose the right combination of spells. You fight about strategic points on a large outdoor map.\nCompared to other MOBAs, Totm features more action-oriented direct controls (WASD or Gamepad) as well as a third person camera view.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/k87nls3r6sxpgvmrwh44.jpg'),(3056,'Myth Makers: Orbs of Doom','2007-10-26','Puzzle','Wii, PlayStation 2','Join the Myth Makers in an all new adventure! The evil Sinster Rebus is trying to take over the Myth Realm! He has created 8 magical crystals known as the Orbs of Doom and has trapped each of the Myth Makers within them. Now no one can stand in his way ... or at least that\'s what Sinster Rebus thinks. Can the Myth Makers roll their way through the puzzling Myth Realm and save themselves from the clutches of Sinster Rebus? They must venture through 40 brain busting levels set across 5 lavish environments!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ai8.jpg'),(3057,'Pocket Gal','1987-12-31','Sport','Arcade','Pocket Gal is an arcade game released by Data East in 1987. The gameplay is similar to the NES version of Side Pocket, although the player has less lives, the two-player mode does not have lives (although a 20-second time limit between shots is added), and of course, the game contains nudity. There is an English version of the game called Pocket Gal 2, which was released in 1989. Also in 1989, a version of the game was released titled Super Pool III. This version of the game does not contain nudity, and it was released in North America by I.Vics. A sequel to Pocket Gal was released in 1993 called Pocket Gal Deluxe. The gameplay of Pocket Gal Deluxe is similar to the Sega Genesis version of Side Pocket. In Pocket Gal Deluxe, the art style is much more realistic than Pocket Gal.\n\nEach of the 4 stages is hosted by a corresponding girl, who\'s only function (not that I\'m complaining) is to strip when the level is cleared. Additional points and shots can be gained by pocketing balls in order, in computer-predetermined pockets, clearing special bonus tricks between stages, etc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wdj.jpg'),(3058,'Colorful Colore','2021-01-22','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','For us, there are two foundations to a wonderful puzzle title: 1/ SIMPLE YET CHALLENGING In each level, the goal is never far… The path, though, is a real maze. Choose a direction and avoid the walls not matching your color. It’s easy at first, but quickly gets tricky with clever level design and new mechanics such as switches and teleporters. Solving all 50 stages is an achievement to be proud of! We’re confident that Colorful Colore will tease your brain in various and unique ways to ultimately deliver this awesome sense of reward.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ngg.jpg'),(3059,'Data East All-Star Collection','2017-12-31','Fighting, Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Entertainment System','A compilation of Data East NES games on one cartridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3t2h.jpg'),(3060,'A Very Merry Nightmare','2025-01-23','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A First-Person 3D Christmas Thriller Game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m8f.jpg'),(3061,'G-Mode Archives 06: Shijou Saikyou Miyamoto Julia','2020-06-25','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','50 years after the end of the Galactic War, the eastern galaxy\'s bubble economy finally pops. The resulting depression catapults society into a desperate age of class stratification, with workers at the bottom struggling to make ends meet. Julia Miyamoto, the player character, is a temp worker doing her best to get by in the bad economy. She takes a gig at the Galaxy Crisis Management Organization, where she discovers that she has an incredible talent for cleaning up other people\'s messes, and sets out to prove herself. In the process, she\'ll find herself drawn into a galaxy-wide conspiracy. This mission-based action RPG has players setting out to clear missions by wiping out waves of enemies as efficiently as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7szf.jpg'),(3062,'Mordfield Command',NULL,'Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Mordfield Command: a sci-fi turn-based strategy where humanity\'s fate hangs in the balance. Build an army and command forces to shape humanities future. Lead the resistance to victory or succumb to the control of AI overlords in this tactical, combat-focused 4X.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bsv.jpg'),(3063,'Pixel Cross Stitch: Christmas Pack 2','2024-11-21','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Celebrate Christmas with us and our new 20 Christmas-themed pixel images!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3064,'Dirty Crown Scandal','2023-11-27','Simulator, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Four men who demand a relationship under the pretext of survival.\n\n“Have you never thought that if I can’t have it, I might as well ruin you?”\n\nA chill ran down Matias’ spine at the sound of a voice that was kind and smooth, yet ominous.\nThe laughter had remained in the man’s face faded, replaced by a stark emotionless expression as he added dryly.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8azd.jpg'),(3065,'Sea of Thieves: Season 11','2024-01-23','Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Access the adventures you crave more quickly than ever before with Season 11\'s overhaul of Voyages and encounters!\n\nExplore a redesigned Quest system, major expansions to most Trading Companies, new loot items and more with the Sea of Thieves at your fingertips.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nhx.jpg'),(3066,'Only Hope: Episode 6',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Decades since we last heard the Gods spoken. The evil soon broke into our world with the full power, causing it to tremble. The world had changed. Colors left us for many centuries, and a new powerful entity dwells. We divided. The matter of blood has never been so important before, as it is now.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3067,'Dungeonfield','2019-01-07','Platform','Web browser','Plunked into a 2D, side-scrolling world randomly generated and populated with dangerous dungeons, and you\'ll need to smash, stab, dig, and otherwise destroy your environment to gather the supplies you\'ll need to craft and survive day-to-day. Turns out in a great battle, the kingdom was destroyed and all its people carted off to dungeons, and only you can save them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f6m.jpg'),(3068,'Balls Royale','2023-07-21','Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Bases, paddles and balls... you know what it is!\nNow in Battle Royale version!\n\nBalls Royale is 50 players Battle Royale inspired by classic arcade game.\nMassive cross-platform multiplayer free-for-all rounds.\n\nGame is available for PCs on Steam and for free for Android on Google Play and iOS on App Store. Players from different platforms can compete with each other in online games and world ranking!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6smu.jpg'),(3069,'Duke Nukem: Episode 2 - Mission: Moonbase','1992-12-31','Shooter, Platform','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','Duke Nukem is the debut of the world’s greatest wise-cracking, alien-punching, gun-toting badass - a man who would later go on to combine both ass-kicking and bubblegum in a revolutionary way. In a world ravaged by Dr. Proton’s villainous ambitions, the original video game action hero must rise against the evil scientist’s army of sinister Techbots. And although Duke isn’t exactly what the Doctor ordered, he’s exactly what the world needed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y78.jpg'),(3070,'Magic Lessons in Wand Valley: A Jigsaw Puzzle Tale','2020-07-09','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Learning magic the hard way. See how the wizard apprentice Leroy takes his greatest lesson in a minimalist jigsaw puzzle game, featuring six illustrations from Tiago Alvarez with his cartoony art style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46si.jpg'),(3071,'Big Bang Pro Wrestling','2000-01-01','Sport','Neo Geo Pocket Color','Only a handful of top wrestlers can be show their face on the TV for their fans at home. In the I.E.W mat, this rule is no exception. In an event practiced for 300 years, only the best performances are in demand. This year, the great king of the I.E.W, Joseph Steel, returns to defend his throne. The story of eight top wrestlers competing for the greatest prize on the ring, the I.E.W champion belt, is about to begin...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ck3slwciebodkc5gmpna.jpg'),(3072,'Fjords','2013-10-31','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fjords is a pizza-delivery adventure game set in a world made of science.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n7p.jpg'),(3073,'Genesis Noir: The Cosmic Collection','2021-03-26','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Cosmic Collection includes:\n- The noir adventure Genesis Noir and all its available digital extras\n- The original soundtrack\n- A digital art book \"An Act of Creation\"\n- The interactive comic \"Moiré Noir\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3t3l.jpg'),(3074,'Resistance is Fruitile','2019-04-10','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Resistance is Fruitile is a challenging twin stick shooter jam-packed with sinister fruit monsters and plenty of firepower to take them all on!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2849.jpg'),(3075,'The Witch and the Hundred Knight: Revival Edition - Limited Edition','2016-04-01','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Sport','PlayStation 4','Two powerful witches have been battling one another for over a hundred years. Now, the Swamp Witch has unleashed the legendary Dark Knights, and seeks to destroy the Forest Witch once and for all!\n\nAdopting high-res, fully 3D environments and characters, as well as a dark fantasy world brought to life by Takehito Harada, The Witch and the Hundred Knights will deliver a brand-new action RPG experience from Nippon Ichi Software.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/kdcjammh9ccbzavsvnoc.jpg'),(3076,'Perseverance: Part 1','2018-07-23','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Perseverance is a horror/drama visual novel about survival and redemption.\n\nIn Part 1 you play as Jack, a father who is struggling to keep his family together and finds himself in the middle of horrific events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3v9r.jpg'),(3077,'Flight of Nova','2022-05-31','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Flight Of Nova is a flight simulation in which you take control of spacecrafts on the full-scale planet NVA-31. You will fly on different types of machines during transport and research missions in an environment with realistic aerodynamics and orbital physics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yqu.jpg'),(3078,'Tales of Arise: Collector\'s Edition','2021-09-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Featuring a diverse cast of characters, an intuitive and rewarding combat system, and a captivating story set in a lush world worth fighting for, Tales of Arise delivers a first-class JRPG experience.\n\nThe Collector\'s Edition includes:\n- Game: Tales of Arise\n- Exclusive 18-cm Alphen and Shionne figurine\n- Exclusive Luxury Box\n- Art book\n- Original Soundtrack\n- Logo Metal Pin Badge\n- Illustration Sticker\n- Acrylic Figure\n- Post Cards\n- Accessory Doll DLC','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30aj.jpg'),(3079,'Samurai Spirits: Oborozuki Densetsu',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3080,'The Keep','2014-09-10','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore the subterranean depths in this first-person dungeon crawler with real-time combat, a unique rune magic system, exploration, and puzzle solving. This game will awaken memories of what made old-school dungeons so much fun to play while you fight, hunt for hidden treasures, and avoid deadly traps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23d0.jpg'),(3081,'Drox Operative 2','2021-10-20','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game is described as an RPG where you are the captain of a single ship traveling around a galaxy, populated by alien races and factions that are playing a 4X game.\n\nFactions will declare war on each other, sign treaties, and territories will constantly shift and change as the galaxy goes about their business, regardless- or because of- your intervention. Accept quests, negotiate with the various factions, and upgrade your ship with new weapons and components. You can even team up with a friend in online co-op.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2924.jpg'),(3082,'Punch Club: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3083,'Railbreak: 90s Throwback Collection','2025-03-08','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9irw.jpg'),(3084,'Book of Hours: Perpetual Edition',NULL,'Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ydb.jpg'),(3085,'Godzilla: Battle Legends','1994-02-26','Fighting','TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','Godzilla: Battle Legends (simply referred to as \"Godzilla\" in North America) is a fighting game based on the Godzilla film franchise, made for the Turbo Duo in 1993, developed by Alfa System and published in the United States by Hudson Soft.\n\nWhen Godzilla fights a certain foe, his appearance changes to reflect the era when he battled in certain films. For example, Godzilla looks like as he did in 1955 when he fights Anguirus, and as in 1964 when he fights Rodan. This game\'s sequel, Godzilla: Monster War for the SNES, features fewer monsters, with the inclusion of Biollante as a playable character and Mothra.\n\nIn single player mode, only Godzilla is playable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6an5.jpg'),(3086,'Creation and Conquest: The Future War','2019-06-10','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Players need to design their own DIY Infantrys, Vehicles, and even Aircraft. In the game through DIY It can create hundreds and thousands type of combat units, according to the opponent\'s tactics, research and development of restraint of the opponent\'s weapons is the key to victory.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3087,'Jackie\'s Tapes','2024-12-10','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A set of three favorite tapes of the villain Cry of Fear: Epilogue. Learn the Doctor\'s story during the events of Epilogue in three expansion packs. Explore the burned-out asylum for answers in SINNER, fight in an abandoned hotel in EVICTION and try to stop Jackie in THE MARTYR.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3088,'The Lord of the Rings: The White Council',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The Lord of the Rings: White Council was a role Playing video game based on the high fantasy novel The Lord of the Rings by J. R. R. Tolkien, however on February 2, 2007, EA announced that the game had been put on an indefinite hiatus, and to date no further information has been released. \n \nThe action was meant to take place in a massive open world where you can go anywhere you want, and the characters in this world were to be powered by an incredible simulation AI based on the same technology used by the makers of The Sims 2. The story of the game was to be built around a series of Story Quests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/l2enfatdwxoztephmemz.jpg'),(3089,'Side Pocket','1987-10-30','Sport, Arcade','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','The NES port of Side Pocket, a pocket billiards video game originally released into arcades by Data East in 1986.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7svc.jpg'),(3090,'Hatsune Miku: Project Diva Arcade','2010-01-01','Music, Arcade','Arcade','Hatsune Miku: Project DIVA Arcade is an arcade rhythm game. The game is a port of the 2009 video game, Hatsune Miku: Project DIVA, with updated visuals. The gameplay is relatively the same as the original. The signature PlayStation buttons, cross, circle, square and triangle are now the 4 large buttons on the machine\'s panel, and players push those buttons to play the games. Unlike the handheld versions of the game, players can hold a button or buttons for an unlimited time when the game indicates to hold a certain note. This will allow players to receive a bonus which continuely increases the score until the player releases one of the held button or a \"Max Hold Bonus\" is granted. Another difference is that multiple buttons can be hit at the same time up to all four buttons. The arcade version features songs from both Hatsune Miku: Project DIVA series and Hatsune Miku and Future Stars: Project Mirai, along with a variety of original songs not included in either of the handheld versions. The Promotional Videos for the game, which are the videos playing in the background during a song have been updated and re-rendered for the game bearing a similar resemblance to the Dreamy Theatre versions of the PVs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4syn.jpg'),(3091,'LEGO Harry Potter: Years 5-7','2011-11-11','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Wii, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360','The game will whisk you away to familiar locations from books 5-7 Order of the Phoenix, Half-Blood Prince and The Deathly Hallows, including Grimmauld Place, the Ministry of Magic and Godric\'s Hollow.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qro.jpg'),(3092,'Totemlands','2021-09-03','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are an adventurer who just arrived at the mysterious land of Oakshade, inhabited by spirits known as Oaklingers, peculiar locals and… totems? Totemlands is a relaxing crafting, building game where you hunt spirits, use them to craft and raise totem poles. Totem poles produce valuable resources called Relics, which can be sold for Golden Acorns (in-game currency). which later can be used to expand, upgrade or unlock new territories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53t5.jpg'),(3093,'Chess Knight',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3094,'Wild-9','2021-02-26','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Wild-9 is a short robot cowboy adventure. You crash on a donut shaped asteroid and when you wake up, you notice some of your ship parts are stolen. On top of that, severe heat is damaging your systems. How will you ever be able to survive this mess?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u0n.jpg'),(3095,'Magician\'s Quest: Mysterious Times','2009-06-05','Adventure','Nintendo DS','As players attend Magic Academy, they\'ll be immersed in a living, breathing world where time flows as it does in the real world, and each week, player\'s wizardry skills are put to the test in a new magical adventure. Custom avatars can be made with 1,500 varieties of clothing, furniture and characters to choose from. Additionally, players can learn new magic spells and abilities by forming different bonds with the 150 unique characters populating the world. Different stories and adventures will be revealed depending on what bonds are formed with the game\'s characters and how the player chooses to solve each of the 52 adventures. Use more than 100 magic spells to become the greatest magician of all time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4lha.jpg'),(3096,'Overwatch 2: Season 14 - Hazard','2024-12-10','Shooter, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Introducing Hazard, the new Tank hero, embodying the spirit of anarchy for the greater good. Then test your skills with a unique blend of past and present in the 6v6 Role Queue event, using the 2-2-2 setup. Plus, master the elements with an Overwatch 2 x Avatar: The Last Airbender collab event, celebrating unity, resilience, and the power within. And don’t miss out on Mythic Thor Reinhardt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94zi.jpg'),(3097,'Spectrolite','2023-05-24','Shooter, Platform, Racing, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Spectrolite is a challenging first-person platformer set in futuristic environments. Combine parkouring with powerful abilities, test your skills in fast paced timed challenges, and follow the call of a mysterious specter while traveling through a ruined world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4976.jpg'),(3098,'Galactic Bowling','2008-09-02','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Galactic Bowling is an exaggerated and stylized bowling game with an intergalactic twist. Players will engage in fast-paced single and multi-player competition while being submerged in a unique new universe filled with over-the-top humor, wild characters, unique levels, and addictive game play. The title is aimed at players of all ages and skill sets. Through accessible and intuitive controls and game-play, Galactic Bowling allows you to jump right into the action.  \n \nA single-player campaign and online play allow you to work your way up the ranks of the Galactic Bowling League! Whether you have hours to play or only a few minutes, Galactic Bowling is a fast paced and entertaining experience that will leave you wanting more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xz1hgouwdv6qlaqac99a.jpg'),(3099,'A Day of Maintenance','2022-04-22','Puzzle, Racing, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A Day of Maintenance is a new, unusual kind of exploration game, taking cues from In Other Waters, 17776, Signal from Tolva, and Euro Truck Simulator 2.\n\nIt\'s a mixture of a visual novel, driving game, crane game, fixing game, and some other stuff too.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d52.jpg'),(3100,'Twin Hawk','1990-12-14','Shooter','Arcade, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','Twin Hawk is a 1989 vertically scrolling shooter arcade game developed by Toaplan and published by Taito. Twin Hawk resembles other shooters of the time, specifically Toaplan\'s earlier game, Flying Shark. Also like Toaplan\'s other games, there were various differences between the Japanese version and other versions, including a checkpoint system and higher difficulty for the former. Unusually, the game contains no flying enemies; thus, a complete lack of physical obstructions and a stronger focus on the numbers and speed of ground forces.\n\nAnother draw of Twin Hawk is the game\'s unique \"smartbomb\" in the form of a group of friendly planes; pressing button 2 once will call in six Flying Fortresses to surround and protect the player\'s plane, and provide back-up fire. They are easily taken down by enemy fire, so the player must use them wisely.\n\nPressing button 2 again immediately after the call-in will sacrifice the planes for a more typical smartbomb. Otherwise, pressing button 2 while any other plane is on-screen will suicide them all into the nearest enemies below.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z1l.jpg'),(3101,'Loveland\'s Leap','2024-11-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Leap into the forest in this 2d puzzle platformer! Swing through the woods, find flies, and solve simple brain teasers. Let the trees envelope you as the water colored backgrounds and kalimba themed music create an unforgettable story book like atmosphere.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pji.jpg'),(3102,'Qusha','2024-04-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In \"Exorcism\", a game in the style of Vampire Survivors, you gain experience and currency to strengthen your magical abilities and attributes by slaying massive amounts of demons with your ever increasing magical powers.\nIt is a course example for an indie game creator class launched by Lao V and Mo Hua and therefore is not particularly long, but free to experience for everyone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85jh.jpg'),(3103,'Desert Stormfront','2012-11-21','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Desert Stormfront is a Real-Time Strategy (RTS) game situated in the Middle East. You play on hot desert landscapes for power and oil. Units at your disposal include Humvees, Tanks, Artillery, Mechanics, Helicopters, Planes, Ships and Submarines amongst others. Desert Stormfront supports multiplayer games over LAN and internet including co-op multiplayer.\n\nThe game features 30 pre-defined campaign missions where you take command of the Western coalition and fight battles in the Middle East for control of major cities, oil fields and military structures. Nations in play are the USA, England, France, Italy, Iraq, Iran, Saudi Arabia, Egypt, and Afghanistan plus a rebel faction.\n\nDesert Stormfront contains a random map generator in addition to the 30 campaign missions. Scenarios include eliminating enemy forces, capturing the flag, defending against incoming troops, convoy missions, sea and air battles as well as tank fights. The game keeps track of high scores and playing statistics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kn6.jpg'),(3104,'Elevator','2021-12-17','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inspired by games like The Stanley Parable and Portal 2 you have to find your way through a creepy building, locked doors, an uncooperative elevator and challenging puzzles to get to your job interview on the top floor in this uncanny adventure game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4asc.jpg'),(3105,'Pixel Cross Stitch: Winter Pack','2024-12-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Celebrate the winter with 10 free images to color!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3106,'Emperor: Rise of the Middle Kingdom','2002-09-09','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Emperor: The Rise of the Middle Kingdom is a game about politics, trade, and city design in ancient China. In Emperor, players progress through 3000 years of Chinese history, facing ever-changing economic, military, and diplomatic challenges as each Chinese dynasty waxes and wanes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22rl.jpg'),(3107,'Public Defense Corp: The Ambassador of Peace','2022-06-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Haruka finally catches a break after Jakou’s attack on Japan relents. At the same time, without any enemies to fight, her life as an FUW pilot has become a bit boring. Luckily, her staff has a great idea: become a tourism ambassador to help the economy recover!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xeg.jpg'),(3108,'Tower of the Ice Lich','2024-10-13','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A pixelated homage to 16-bit RPGs, this former print-and-play card game has come full circle as a digital experience! Choose your champion, enter the tower, and make wise decisions on your ascent to face the Ice Lich at the top','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gnk.jpg'),(3109,'Cats Visiting Cozy Art Studios','2025-03-27','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Explore cozy art studios and uncover hidden cats in this charming seek-and-find adventure. Search through beautifully illustrated creative spaces, click to collect every feline, and complete each level. Can you find them all?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l41.jpg'),(3110,'Theatre of War 3: Korea','2011-03-24','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Replay the events of the first hot war of the Cold War era, the Korean War, also known as the Forgotten War. Players will be involved in two campaigns, both set in the 1950\'s: the North Korean (June 25 – August 20) and the American (September 15 – October 8).\nIn this title tactical engagement experts can test their skills on a new strategic level. Move your forces over the entire Korean Peninsula, managing reserves, as well as the fuel and ammo supplies. Tactical battles in Theatre of War 3: Korea are generated based on the strategic situation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jb9.jpg'),(3111,'Castelo Rá-Tim-Bum','1997-09-01','Platform','Sega Master System/Mark III','Castelo Rá-Tim-Bum is an action-adventure game based on the popular educational Brazilian TV series with the same name. The player can chose to play either Pedro or Biba to search for the ingredients through five levels. Each level involves some platforming and minor puzzle solving elements, like jumping over the right sequence of platforms, or finding food inside the kitchen\'s drawers in the right order.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3960.jpg'),(3112,'My Little Riding Champion','2018-11-29','Simulator, Sport, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Your horse. Your passion. Get ready to fulfil your dreams at a gallop. Choose your favourite horse, take care of it, train it and win medals for your club!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qrg.jpg'),(3113,'Sneaky Forest','2021-11-07','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Web browser','A Tower Defense game made at Siberian Game Jam. Key feature is that it has not predefined waves of enemies, instead game is adapting to player\'s actions, which makes it more dynamic that traditional tower defense games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hqw.jpg'),(3114,'Avadon 3: Hint Book & Extras',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3115,'M.U.S.H.A.','1991-12-31','Shooter','Wii, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','M.U.S.H.A. is a Sega Genesis vertical-scrolling shooter from Compile and Seismic originally released in 1990 and later re-released on the Nintendo Virtual Console in 2009. The game is known for its rarity and its ability to fetch high prices on auction sites.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gm6.jpg'),(3116,'Observer: System Redux - Day One Edition','2021-07-16','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Observer: System Redux is the definitive vision of the award-winning cyberpunk thriller, rebuilt and augmented for the next generation. System Redux offers expanded gameplay, which includes new game mechanics, new secrets to find, redesigned stealth, additional neural interrogations, and quality-of-life improvements made with the help of the Observer community. Veteran Observers can also dive deeper into this dystopian reality thanks to three brand-new side cases to solve, adding another layer of depth to the game’s story while exploring thought-provoking themes of a future that soon might become our present.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c1r.jpg'),(3117,'Museum of Other Realities','2020-02-28','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','An immersive art showcase in VR, the Museum of Other Realities is a space to connect, share, and experience virtual reality art with others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pg3.jpg'),(3118,'Formation Soccer \'97: The Road to France','1997-06-27','Sport','PlayStation','After the releases of the SNES & N64 games Formation Soccer \'97 is the second game for Playstation One (after Hyper Formation Soccer), the game features the qualify rounds of national teams that wants to enter the World Cup \'98.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r55.jpg'),(3119,'The Joy of Creation: Halloween Edition','2016-10-31','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Joy of Creation: Halloween Edition is a free-roam survival horror video game developed by Nikson. The game is created for Halloween, and the player\'s only enemy is Ignited Springtrap.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l12.jpg'),(3120,'In-Flight Tetris','2000-12-31','Puzzle, Arcade','Linux, Android','One of the most popular games in the world and bound to be an everlasting classic, Tetris is without a doubt one of the most challenging and addictive game available out there. Whether you\'re a beginner or an advanced player, this game will provide you with hours of entertainment. Line up the falling pieces to form lines. When you run out of space, the game ends. Make Tetris combos to get more points.\n\nIn-Flight Tetris is a Tetris game available to play in some passenger airplanes. It is currently sold to airlines by Global Eagle as part of their Airgames catalog.\n\nIn-Flight Tetris uses standard Guideline rules for gameplay, and it uses either touch or built-in remote controls. Game interface is mostly based on Tetris Zone.\nThere are four modes available: Marathon, Fourty Lines, Ultra, and Battle 2P. Scores are saved on a leaderboard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xoz.jpg'),(3121,'Zodiac DX','2021-07-15','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Retro side-scrolling adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5trq.jpg'),(3122,'All Zombies Must Die! Scorepocalypse','2012-04-19','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the sturdy boots of McJagger and take on an army of the undead! In the standalone spin-off to All Zombies Must Die!, the only thing that really matters is your score. Build your multiplier and rack up as many kills as possible to become the most fearsome zombie-slayer in Deadhill. To that end, the fact remains the same: all zombies must die.\n\nAs well infesting familiar locations such as Town Square, Shopping Mall and Surburbia, the undead have ambled their way into all new areas of Deadhill: the Military Base and Graveyard. McJagger will also have to deal with three new flavours of zombie: Soldier, Necro and Ghost. Our stoic hero shouldn’t be too concerned, however, there are two new weapons to help send the shufflers packing: Mini-gun and Rocket Launcher. Boom!\n\nYour score is based on a combination of two multipliers, one of which increases as you complete quests that appear organically as you play, and the other based on how many environmental modifiers you’ve managed to apply to the undead. Use fire, shock, sonic and radiation – and the environments themselves - to your full advantage, and send that score soaring!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v74.jpg'),(3123,'Days Gone: Collector\'s Edition','2019-04-26','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4','Days Gone is an open-world action-adventure game developed by Bend Studio and published by Sony Interactive Entertainment. Released in April 2019 for PlayStation 4 and later for PC in May 2021, the game is set in a post-apocalyptic world where players control Deacon St. John, a drifter and bounty hunter navigating a landscape overrun by \"Freakers,\" zombie-like creatures created by a global pandemic.\n\nThe gameplay focuses on exploration, combat, and survival elements, with players able to use various weapons, craft supplies, and upgrade Deacon’s motorcycle, essential for travelling across the vast and hostile environment. Days Gone combines narrative-driven missions with an open world filled with dynamic events, enemy camps, and environmental challenges.\n\nDays Gone: Collector\'s Edition includes:\n\n- Full game in a standard edition case\n- A figurine of the hero with a zombie and a motorcycle\n- 6 Pins\n- 4 Decals\n- A steelbook case\n- Physical soundtrack\n- 48-page mini-art Book by Dark Horse Comics\n\nIt also includes a Voucher for the following digital content:\n- Digital Mini-Art Book by Dark Horse Comics\n- Deacon vs. The Horde dynamic theme\n- An early unlock of the Monkey Wrench ability\n- 3 Bike skins','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6in6.jpg'),(3124,'Tokyo Xtreme Racer Drift 2','2006-10-27','Racing','PlayStation 2','The mountains of Japan are calling - and so are your racing rivals. With the mysterious disappearance of the reigning champion, the tournament crown is suddenly up for grabs. Many will vie, only one can win. Do you have what it takes to race, grind and drift your way to the ultimate racing prize? Race in the dangerous mountains of Japan - Hakone, Niko, Haruna and Akagi - all faithfully recreated using the most advanced laser techniques to maintain every tight twist and turn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hsb.jpg'),(3125,'Vampires and Knights: Eclipse Survival & Magic Craft','2025-03-06','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ira.jpg'),(3126,'Kurayami',NULL,'Adventure','PlayStation 3','The eccentric Suda51 harnesses the power of PS3 for a bizarre action/adventure inspired the work of existentialist writer Franz Kafka. In an unusual town full of odd locals, your stranded character must explore the town and its castle to find a way out, using only his carried torch to light his way and to fend off the unexpected and unexplainable horrors that await. Advanced new lighting and graphic techniques are used to impress upon you the feeling of fear and loneliness (the tite \"Kurayami\" means \"Darkness\" in Japanese) as you venture through to the end of your quest. Kurayami was cancelled before it was ever released.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lah.jpg'),(3127,'Solitaire Match 2 Cards',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3128,'Pixel Cross Stitch: Flowers and Butterflies Pack 2','2024-11-07','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Enjoy 20 flower and butterfly themed images with this new image pack','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3129,'Shell Song','2020-11-10','Adventure','Web browser','Shell Song is an interactive audio-narrative game about deep-fake voice technologies and the datasets that go into their construction. By considering physical and digital bodies and voices, it asks what a voice is worth, who can own a human sound, and how it feels to come face to face with a ghost of your body that may yet come to outlive you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66yw.jpg'),(3130,'Dap','2021-09-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dap is a horror-action-adventure about gathering and protecting a pack of fragile creatures called Daps. Lead your Daps to safety through an eerily beautiful world, fighting off threats, solving puzzles, and avoiding the infection that twists your companions into something alien and terrifying…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2si2.jpg'),(3131,'Pixel Cross Stitch: Dogs Pack','2024-11-07','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Enjoy the 20 hand-drawn dog images to color or cross stitch.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3132,'Pariah','2005-05-06','Shooter','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pariah is a first-person shooter video game, developed by Brainbox Games, HIP Games and Digital Extremes. It was released on May 3, 2005 for Microsoft Windows and Xbox. It uses a modified version of the Unreal engine and the Havok physics engine. Pariah received mixed reviews from critics.[1]','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qu3.jpg'),(3133,'Frogger Beyond','2003-03-24','Platform','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Hop into the latest addition to the Frogger franchise with Frogger Beyond, a new adventure that takes you through eight expansive worlds. As the amphibious hero, Frogger, you\'ll encounter a wide range of enemies, obstacles, and new challenges. This time, you can snowboard ice-covered mountains, travel through lava caverns, and navigate the depths of outer space. Frogger Beyond revives the series with 40 new enemies, new frog abilities, and hidden areas and power-ups.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tyd.jpg'),(3134,'Dance Summit 2001: Bust a Move','2000-11-02','Music','PlayStation 2','A dancing rhythm-matching & button recognition game with up-beat Japanese music. PS2 update to the classic Bust a Groove series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qdv.jpg'),(3135,'Pixel Cross Stitch: Fantasy Medieval Pack 2','2024-11-07','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Enjoy 20 fantasy medieval-themed images to color or cross-stitch','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3136,'Nbb.Exe','2024-10-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','NBB.EXE is a challenging fast paced puzzle platformer. Bomb your way to victory through devious gauntlets and reveal the secrets of the mysterious NEON corp. in a modern reimagining of Bomberman with a metroidvania twist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vuf.jpg'),(3137,'Dying Light: Retrowave Bundle','2019-12-19','Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Surf the retrowave with this bold retrofuturistic gear. This bundle includes a new outfit (Night Rider), a new buggy paint job (Speedmaster Turbo), and three new weapon blueprints (Blademaxx machete, Vindicator 2000 revolver, and Volkatronix rifle that shoots electric bullets).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uch.jpg'),(3138,'Gravity Angels Part 2: The Betrayal','1998-12-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gravity Angels Part 2: The Betrayal is the second installment in Brilliant Digital Entertainment\'s Gravity Angels saga. Just like the first part, this Multipath Movie uses the in-game engine to render a real-time, three-dimensional, digitally animated story. At certain predetermined points in the storyline the player gets to choose one of multiple plot alternatives or paths that, while influencing the story, never change the actual outcome. Each Multipath Movie episode - they were originally available as Webisodes as well - runs approximately 30 minutes.\n\nWe rejoin the team of rogue employees, introduced in the first episode, on Jupiter\'s moon Ganymede just as the Miller Western Corporate Conglomerate is moving to turn the mining base into a death trap. It soon becomes clear that the company will stop at nothing to secure its interests in the alien artefact discovered deep below the surface. Green, the facility sheriff and company henchman, receives orders to terminate any witnesses. All transmissions are jammed, company backup is on the way and that means there\'s only two options left to our heroes: death or a desperate fight for survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x15.jpg'),(3139,'Fighting Ex Layer Another Dash','2021-05-20','Fighting, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','This latest edition re-examines the theory and systems of fighting games! Unbound by traditional techniques and systems. The latest title in the FEXL series! What fate lies ahead for these fighters and their new powers? The EX System is a new approach, take it for a spin! Tear it up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3jll.jpg'),(3140,'Quantum Replica','2021-05-14','Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hide in time as you explore a sealed off cyberpunk metropolis in Quantum Replica, a mix of fast-paced stealth and metroidvania.\nIn Quantum Replica, you are an unregistered entity who has managed to enter the cyberpunk heart of this sprawling megacity. Immediately made Most Wanted by its security forces, your urge to explore the city in search of answers will be far from easy. With nowhere to hide, your only refuge is time itself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gmvg0xxqcknrupdk5soo.jpg'),(3141,'Magicka: Aspiring Musician Robes','2012-07-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Some wizards are not only terrible spell casters, but terrible musicians as well! Join their ranks, and explore a variety of music history\'s greatest styles, from the heavy-metal guitar to the cool-but-moist saxophone! Take the lead in Aldrheim\'s very own misunderstood progressive basement band, adorned with musically inspired robes and powerful magickal instruments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98ft.jpg'),(3142,'Don Bradman Cricket 17','2016-12-15','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Don Bradman Cricket 17 brings a new revolutionary control system delivering the best batting, bowling and fielding experience by providing you an even greater level of variety and precision of play.\n\nYou Are Invincible!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co271g.jpg'),(3143,'Chronicon Apocalyptica','2019-01-11','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Battle Norse raiders, ghosts, and changelings to save medieval England! But beware, if the elves can capture the Book you hold, the world will end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zhb.jpg'),(3144,'Justin Wack and the Big Time Hack: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zk0.jpg'),(3145,'Jillian Michaels\' Fitness Ultimatum 2009','2008-10-28','Simulator, Sport','Wii','Building on the success of her first videogame, star fitness trainer Jillian Michaels returns to Wii/DS with a new and improved fast-paced, high-intensity workout in Jillian Michaels\' Fitness Ultimatum 2010. Set on a rugged, Pacific jungle island, players will enter a Hell Week-style boot camp filled with many new features and workout modes for 2010, including more accurate motion tracking and a calendar system enabling the user to program routines on a period of up to 6 months. Finally, you\'ll never train alone with direct feedback and motivation from Jillian for greater results! Game design by health and wellness expert Jillian Michaels: > Features Jillian\'s motion-captured movements > Fitness routines created by Jillian > All-new audio from Jillian','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/koiq3ugjuetobaj3x52b.jpg'),(3146,'Vaccine','2017-02-23','Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Find a vaccine for your infected friend before the time runs out, but be aware your friend will relapse sooner or later and you will have to find a new vaccine in a new randomly rebuilt house. Will you be able uncover the mystery to save your friend once and for all!?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28bw.jpg'),(3147,'Vader Immortal: A Star Wars VR Series','2019-05-21','Adventure','Oculus VR, Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR, Oculus Rift, Oculus Quest','Step inside a galaxy far, far away with Vader Immortal: A Star Wars VR Series. You are a smuggler operating near Mustafar, the fiery world Darth Vader calls home. When you are unexpectedly pulled out of hyperspace, you find yourself uncovering an ancient mystery at the behest of the Sith Lord himself.\n\nWith the help of your droid companion, ZO-E3, you’ll navigate the dangers of the fortress, hone your lightsaber skills, and meet new characters along the way as you discover what Vader is up to.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31db.jpg'),(3148,'Banish','2022-03-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BANISH is a Single and Co-op horror survival game for 1-4 players. As a Priest, you are sent by the local church to a failed exorcism attempt in the Luxford Mansion. Fear, Panic, and Horror awaits you...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gfn.jpg'),(3149,'Original War','2001-06-15','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An American geological expedition, under a UN mandate, assesses the natural resources in a distant part of Siberia, deep in the trackless steppes of Eastern Russia. But instead of oil, they discover a deposit of a hitherto unknown mineral.\n\nAmerican scientists working for Department of Defense find out that this mineral is in fact identical to the substance used to power an extraterrestrial artifact in their possession. This object is called the EON (Extraterrestrial Object Nexus).\n\nIt was found in 1919 by Colonel Emerson near the site of the Tunguska explosion. Emerson was the commander of a US military unit in charge of transporting US war supplies from the city of Vladivostok to the Eastern front during World War I.\n\nDoD Experiments have shown that items placed in the capsule are transported hundreds of thousands of years back in time. The American scientists were not able to understand its construction, nor could they manage to synthesize its fuel. Eventually, the machine - classified Top Secret - was stored, pending further advances in human science.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20k6.jpg'),(3150,'Ironclad Tactics: Deluxe Edition','2013-09-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3151,'Those Nights at Rachel\'s 2',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','That onslaught and terror which corrupted your very mind is only the beginning, those nightmares which tormented your brain is nothing like what we prepared.\n\nTogether we\'ll make your final moments something worth chanting for, something worth telling. And you- well you\'ll just be there to watch it all go down, sitting and staring without the ability to pick yourself up.\n\nTonight will be OUR night, the night in which we reign the same amount of screams and terror as we have in the past to find the one thing in which we really want','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dcv.jpg'),(3152,'Mickey Mania 2',NULL,'Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Mickey Mania 2 was a planned sequel to Mickey Mania: The Timeless Adventures of Mickey Mouse, set to arrive on the Sega Mega Drive. The game was not officially announced, but its existence was revealed by Jon Burton, co-founder of Traveller\'s Tales.\n\nThe game would have played similarly to the first, though would have featured stages based on different Mickey Mouse cartoons as well as including new mechanics. It was cancelled by Traveller\'s Tales in favour of the console version of Toy Story, though an early prototype is known to exist.\n\nFootage of the prototype shows a wild west stage and a ship stage loosely based on the 1934 cartoons, Two-Gun Mickey and Shanghaied, respectively. The latter stage originally featured a scrolling floor and a first-person stage that jokingly used a placeholder HUD to parody Doom - these features would be repurposed for Toy Story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fop.jpg'),(3153,'Bridge Creator 2015','2015-01-26','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Use your skills as an architect and build your bridges using different materials such as iron, steel and wood in a variety of thicknesses and lengths. Make use of a variety of engineered parts including working hydraulics, rotary plates, winches, rope and support cables.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3154,'Thread','2022-10-18','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A puppet themed platformer metroidvania with a focus on platforming rather than combat. Throw your crystal scissors into walls to create your own platforms, explore a twisting and mysterious land, and solve puzzles on a worldwide scale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xr4.jpg'),(3155,'Samurai Shodown Enhanced','2021-03-16','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Samurai Shodown: Special Edition returns as a brand-new game featuring high-end visuals and gameplay! The physical Special Edition includes the Season 1 Pass AND the new DLC Cham Cham character.\n\nSamurai Shodown has enjoyed worldwide success as a blade-wielding fighting game series since its first release in 1993. Faithfully reproducing the game mechanics and atmosphere that contributed to the success of the series, SAMURAI SHODOWN includes a revolutionary feature that learns players’ game actions and patterns in order to create CPU-controlled “ghost” characters. With its story set one year before the very first installment, warriors and combatants from various backgrounds and with their own goals are about to battle to fulfill their destinies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ut8.jpg'),(3156,'Lands of Havoc','1985-12-31','Sin género','Atari ST/STE','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3157,'Green Berets','2001-07-30','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Green Berets is a total conversion for Myth II that places player in the jungles of Vietnam. Like the original Myth games, Green Berets is a 3-D war simulation that places great emphasis on strategy and terrain. Highly detailed units fire M-16s, M-60\'s, throw grenades, dodge mortars and call in helicopter support.\n\nGreen Berets features ten new levels and 18 new units. Missions include destroying VC anti-air emplacements, protecting fire bases, and rescuing POWs. In addition to single player, Green Berets has multiplayer capabilities and includes the original Myth II game and level and unit editors Fear and Loathing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fvd.jpg'),(3158,'Morse','1984-12-31','Puzzle','Odyssey 2 / Videopac G7000','Morse teaches the code to players. There are 4 types of games which can be selected in a menu screen:\n\n- The first type is a Morse code learning game. The player selects the game speed (4 to 30 words per minute) and level (1 to all 36 characters available). The computer will play the Morse signal for the first symbol (Q) and the player has to type in the symbol. After learning two signals, the game starts properly by introducing a row of trees in the top of the screen. An arrow is also displayed near the 4th tree from the left and a man on the right side. For each 10 correctly responded symbols the man takes down one tree. When he reaches the arrow, a new symbol is introduced and the process starts over again.\n\n- The second type lets the player type individual symbols and listen to their respective codes.\n\n-The third type is similar to the second one, but in this one the player types a sequence of symbols and then press \"enter\" to ask the computer to play the respective code.\n\n- In the fourth type the player uses the \"action\" button of the joystick to enter codes into and the computer plays them and shows the respective symbol entered.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23dp.jpg'),(3159,'Arkanoid Returns','1997-12-31','Point-and-click, Strategy, Arcade','Arcade, PlayStation','Arkanoid Returns is an arcade game released by Taito in 1997 as part of the Arkanoid series. It was the fourth overall, and third to be released in arcades. The game was since ported to the PlayStation, with an updated home release being released afterwards titled Arkanoid R 2000. All versions were released exclusively in Japan, currently making it the only game in the series to never receive an international release. The enemy known as \'DOH\' still did not get the message and after many years of silence decides to attack once again.\n\nThe \'Vaus\' space vessel better be ready to face new, yet familiar challenges, in order to stop \'DOH\' once again. The gameplay remains similar to Arkanoid: Doh it Again, the previous game in the series released for the Super Nintendo, in that it features the same powerups , some re-used level designs, and the same board size. The initial arcade game contains only 50 levels, the environment changing every 9 levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w82.jpg'),(3160,'Infinity Nikki','2024-12-05','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Infinity Nikki is the fifth installment in the beloved Nikki series developed by Infold Games. This cozy open-world game is filled with lovely little wonders to collect. Utilizing the UE5 engine, this multi-platform game offers platforming, puzzle-solving, dress-up and many other gameplay elements to create a unique and rich experience.\n\nIn this game, Nikki and Momo embark on a new adventure to travel across the fantastical nations of Miraland, each with its own unique culture and environment. Players will encounter many characters and whimsical creatures while collecting stunning outfits of various styles. Some of these outfits possess magical abilities that are crucial for exploration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tdc.jpg'),(3161,'Orchids to Dusk','2015-12-03','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A short networked wandering experience about an astronaut stranded on an alien planet, with only a few minutes left to live.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58d1.jpg'),(3162,'WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2008','2007-11-13','Fighting, Sport','PlayStation 3, Wii, PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360, Legacy Mobile Device, PlayStation 2','The 2008 edition in the Smackdown vs. Raw series holds new features to the WWE game franchise. This is the first in the series to include the extremists of ECW, including The Sandman, Marcus Cor Von and CM Punk.\n\nThe game also features a new struggle submission system, new weapon choices including guitars, and eight superstar fighting styles, including Showman, Powerhouse, High-Flyer and more. Each player can now choose a primary and a secondary fighting style. It continues the legend trend and new arenas, such as Wrestlemania 23, Unforgiven and Summerslam as well as the classic superstars like Undertaker, Shawn Michaels and Ric Flair. The roster largely depends on the platform, and some versions include wrestlers not available in the other ones.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pob.jpg'),(3163,'Cranky Food Friends','2015-01-01','Puzzle','iOS','A reskin of Puyo Puyo Quest for the western market.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yfi.jpg'),(3164,'Re:Turn - One Way Trip','2020-10-14','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Trapped in a ghostly train, Saki must search the past and present to find and save her friends. More importantly, Saki must use her wits if she is to survive against an unspeakable evil hellbent on avenging unrequited love.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h81.jpg'),(3165,'Lost in Shadow','2010-10-08','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Wii, Wii U','\"Lost in Shadow\" (released as \"A Shadow\'s Tale\" in Europe/Australia and as \"Kage no Tou\" in Japan) is a puzzle platforming video game developed for Nintendo\'s Wii console by Hudson Soft. It was released in Japan in July 2010, in Australia and Europe in October 2010, and in North America in January 2011. It was also released for Wii U via Nintendo eShop in 2016.\n\nLost in Shadow is played largely in the background of the game environment as the player controls a boy\'s shadow, which must climb the shadows of a tall tower, rife with puzzles and enemies. He is accompanied by a sylph that can alter the direction of the foreground light sources, altering the alignment of shadows upon which he climbs. There are times in the game when the boy is able to materialize into the three-dimensional world and briefly interact with the objects themselves as opposed to simply their shadows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oh8.jpg'),(3166,'Temujin','1997-10-02','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Temüjin is a first-person adventure game, notable for its use of live-action full motion video and 360-degrees movement. The player begins in the lobby of the Stevenson Museum without any clue as to how they got there or their identity. The player travel through the halls, controlled in 360-degrees movement and will encounter items, which can be picked up and manipulated as well as different people who can be interacted with in various fashions. Various puzzles relating to the Mongols and the exhibits must be solved, over seven episodes, in order to complete the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/a8stwr8erbleeosyz6r9.jpg'),(3167,'Tim 7: Concours Pour New York','1997-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tim 7: Concours Pour New York is an edutainment game focusing on 6e level of Mathematics.\n\nThe contents of the subject are:\nDecimal writing - fractional writing: decimal fractions; multiplication and division by multiples of 10; arrangement of decimal numbers.\n\nOperations on decimals: addition, subtraction and multiplication of decimals and decimal fractions; orders of magnitude and approximations; solving problems with decimals.\n\nDivision: dividing whole numbers and decimal numbers; solve division problems; divide with fractions.\n\nNumerical calculation: calculate with and without parentheses; calculate with fractions; solve simple equations; learn to calculate quickly.\n\nYou play as Tim 7, named as such due to being kidnapped by Dr. Gaaf and being the 7th guinea pig of his experiments. Tim 7 has lost his memories and you need to help him escape the island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co906m.jpg'),(3168,'Tumble Egg','2025-12-31','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A colorful physics-based 3D ball platformer where you play as an egg. Traverse levels across the four seasons. Collect challenging coins and speedrun levels to test your skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h7k.jpg'),(3169,'Blade Dancer: Lineage of Light','2006-03-02','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation Portable','Brandish your blade and dance of the edge of destiny!\n\nA mysterious girl with no memory of her past. A knight in black armour appears from nowhere on the legendary island of Foo where the Prismatic Moon shines. The legend of \"Blade Dancer\" will be revived.\n\nFull 3D Adventure Field: Explore towns, fields and dungeons, all in a large-scale, fully 3D environment.\n\nIn Depth Item Crafting: Appraise an item you obtain to and discover its recipe to create new items.\n\nExciting Real Time Battles: A completely real-time battle system. Experience a new type of battle in a fight to charge your Lunar Gauge and execute special abilities.\n\nFind Your Ultimate Weapons!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nhv.jpg'),(3170,'SCP Operations','2024-05-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In SCP Operations, tactical gameplay and strategic thinking are your greatest assets. Lead your team of four specialized agents through intense, turn-based combat scenarios. Customize and develop your squad by allocating talent points to enhance their abilities, choosing the perfect weapons, and equipping them for success. As you progress, you\'ll face off against the Chaos Insurgency, a formidable enemy bent on undermining the Foundation. Engage in meticulously planned battles against both human adversaries and a host of bizarre SCP entities, each with unique abilities and challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s89.jpg'),(3171,'Super Mario Advance 4: Super Mario Bros. 3-e - A Musical Trek','2004-12-31','Platform','Game Boy Advance','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3172,'Secret of Evermore','1995-10-01','Role-playing (RPG)','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Secret of Evermore is another famous RPG developed and released by Square in 1995. A day at the movies for a young boy & his dog turns into an adventure that spans across several different time periods and locations, on their journey they discover the Secret of Evermore and find their way home. Produced by the North American branch of Square, Evermore\'s soundtrack would be the first major work by Jeremy Soule, the famed Elder Scrolls composer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kz6.jpg'),(3173,'Epic Mickey','2010-11-26','Platform, Adventure','Wii','Disney Epic Mickey is an action-adventure platforming game for Wii console that sends Mickey Mouse on an epic journey of creativity and discovery. As Mickey, the player is propelled into Wasteland, an alternate world made up of Disney\'s forgotten creative efforts, and is given the power to wield paint and paint thinner to dynamically change the world while determining Mickey\'s path to becoming an epic hero.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6omo.jpg'),(3174,'Asteroids Deluxe','1984-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade, BBC Microcomputer System, Atari ST/STE','Like in the original Asteroids the objective is to score as many points as possible by destroying asteroids and flying saucers. The asteroids come in three different sizes. If the player fires at and hits a large asteroid, it breaks into medium size asteroids. If the player fires at and hits a medium asteroid, it breaks into small asteroids. If a player fires at and hits a small asteroid, it disappears. Different points are awarded for hitting each size of asteroid, and for hitting flying saucers. The player controls a ship that can rotate left and right, fire shots straight forward, and thrust forward. Asteroids Deluxe replaces the hyperspace feature with shields which deplete with use. Other differences include asteroids which rotate and a new enemy which is dubbed a \"killer satellite\" which would, when shot, break apart into three smaller ships that homed in on the player\'s position. The screen of the game is wrapped both vertically and horizontally so that if any object moves past the top edge of the screen it reappears on the bottom edge at the same lateral location, and if it moves past the left side of the screen, it reappears on the right side of the screen in the same vertical location.\n\nAsteroids Deluxe swaps vector graphics of the original for bitmaps.\n\nIn 2007, AtariAge self-published a cart release of Asteroids Deluxe for the Atari 7800.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gcf.jpg'),(3175,'Orbt XL','2017-04-21','Indie, Arcade','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Defy Gravity! Orbt XL is an intense, addictive and fun \'just-one-more-round\' score chaser. Perfect for playing while waiting in queue for another game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22t9.jpg'),(3176,'The True Love Rings','2023-01-17','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"The True Love Rings\" is a scene interactive decryption game. The overall atmosphere is casual and relaxed. Players follow the prompts in the scene to gradually solve the puzzles and help solve the problems encountered in life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61iz.jpg'),(3177,'Maniac Mansion Deluxe','2004-01-01','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Maniac Mansion Deluxe is a 1:1 remake of the original \"Maniac Mansion\" on 256-colour. Sandy, girlfriend of the games\' hero Dave has been kidnapped by evil scientist Dr. Fred Edison. So Dave has to gather two friends around him and go to the old mansion to rescue her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oef.jpg'),(3178,'Asterix & Obelix: Cesar\'s Challenge','2022-08-26','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7x15.jpg'),(3179,'At Dead of Night','2020-11-19','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','At Dead Of Night is part horror film, part horror game and part ghost hunt. It seamlessly blends live-action and graphics to create a unique immersive horror experience like no other. You play Maya, a student trapped in a remote hotel run by a psychopath called Jimmy Hall. Jimmy has tied up Maya\'s friends and locked them in their rooms, with evil intentions. Maya has managed to escape, but Jimmy is on the prowl looking for her. However, to get him to release her friends, Maya must uncover Jimmy\'s dark secret. Using an ancient ghost voice receiver she finds, Maya must communicate with the ghosts of Jimmy\'s past, who materialize around the hotel and gradually reveal their story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p4w.jpg'),(3180,'Edge of Dead: Under a Uranium Sky','2023-11-16','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Edge Of Dead is an action roguelike game set in a post-apocalyptic world. Use shotguns, power saws, axes, hand grenades, cybernetic implants, and more to battle your way across the scorched landscape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3prz.jpg'),(3181,'Jaguar Drift Simulator',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3182,'Persona 3 FES: Limited Edition','2008-11-28','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','Each copy comes with 52-page Color Art Book, Soundtrack CD featuring 18 songs and outer Collector\'s Box. Engaging Social Link system - build intimate relationships with friends and love interests alike\nNever the same game twice, with over 20 Social Links and a complex storyline encompassing a full school year. Intense, strategic battle system - Find and exploit enemy weaknesses with the help of your allies\nHighly stylized designs with beautiful 2D character portraits, detailed 3D animations, and heart-pounding cut scenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6edj.jpg'),(3183,'Squares of Hell','2024-06-14','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hell is divided into squares for sinners. For each sin there is a separate square. Bad smoker square - smoker is tempted by unavailable cigarettes. Bad Driver Square - The driver is always pushing the car uphill. Those who make a lot of noise jump up and down on a large subwoofer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8b3k.jpg'),(3184,'Metaball: Guitar Man Pack','2024-03-06','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','7 Legendary Items, 1 Stamp, 1 Emote, 500 Metanium, and 30 Beam Shards! This is the Guitar Man Pack available at an affordable price! A once-in-a-lifetime opportunity, don\'t miss out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87zg.jpg'),(3185,'Crazy Christmas','2016-12-15','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8krt.jpg'),(3186,'Mortal Kombat 1: Peacemaker','2024-03-06','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Christopher Smith, the Peacemaker, cherishes peace with all his heart. So much so, that he will kill anyone and everyone necessary to get it.\n\nThis pack includes playable character Peacemaker, based on DC\'s Suicide Squad, including all new movesets.\n\nPeacemaker is a guest character based on John Cena\'s appearance as the character in The Suicide Squad movie and the Peacemaker television series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7u00.jpg'),(3187,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s Remake','2018-03-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A remake of the popular Five Nights at Freddy\'s game made by Scott Cawthon, but in Unreal engine 4 with free roaming gameplay and an immersive environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69ds.jpg'),(3188,'Code:29',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','This is a post-apocalyptic zombie shooter game. You can switch between first person and third person. You can switch between first person and third person. Multiple bosses, multiple choices, multiple endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co561j.jpg'),(3189,'Nike+ Kinect Training','2012-11-30','Sport','Xbox 360','Get fitter, faster and stronger with Nike+ Kinect Training, a personalized training experience built from the ground up with athletic expertise and inspiration from Nike coupled with powerful and precise technology from Kinect for Xbox 360. Nike+ Kinect Training brings world-class Nike training directly into the home to help individuals meet their fitness goals and reach their personal best.\n\nThrough the magic of Kinect, Nike+ Kinect Training can see how the body moves, assess physical strength and athleticism, identify areas for improvement, and create a personalized workout plan tailored to each person. With real-time feedback to make sure positions and movements are correct and a customized program that evolves over time, Nike+ Kinect Training is for everybody, whether a professional athlete, an everyday athlete or someone just getting started. With fitness assessments every four weeks and the ability to work out with friends over Xbox LIVE and tap into the Nike+ community, Nike+ Kinect Training helps athletes stay motivated every step of the way.1 Take training even further by competing in challenges, sending encouragement to friends and keeping workouts on track with a mobile companion app.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22tn.jpg'),(3190,'Mystic Mayhem Unleashed','2019-08-20','Platform, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Mystic Mayhem Unleashed is the adventures of Max, who crash landed on an island and accidentally releases an evil wizard named Malwarp. He must fix what he unleashed. Max will have to stop Malwarp from summoning evil forces to take over the world. Fight your way though Malwarp’s minions and avoid traps along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5o0s.jpg'),(3191,'O.M.G. 26: Our Mini Games','2007-10-31','Puzzle, Arcade','Nintendo DS','O.M.G! Solve the mysteries of the spooky mansion and discover the treasures within! With a variety of mini-games that will test all of your senses and skills, you and your brave band of friends will overcome many obstacles and try to escape unscathed!\n\nThis spook-tackular title is filled with fun and challenging mini-games that revolve around a haunted mansion theme. For a bit of fun and fright, this title is definitely the ticket for excitement! With over 25 mini-games that will have you fend off flying dishes, search for keys, escape from ginormous boulders and more, this title is perfect for on the go fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81hb.jpg'),(3192,'Mobile Suit Gundam: Extreme vs. Maxi Boost','2014-03-06','Sin género','Arcade','Mobile Suit Gundam: Extreme Vs. Maxi Boost is an arcade game and updated version of Mobile Suit Gundam: Extreme Vs. Full Boost, released on March 6, 2014. Much like Full Boost, the game will introduce both new suits and characters as well as new game mechanics such as a revamped EX Mode and changes to forms for certain units. The theme song is Rave-up Tonight by Fear and Loathing in Las Vegas. It is later followed up by a portable spinoff, Extreme Vs Force and an update in Maxi Boost ON.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c03.jpg'),(3193,'Sly Cooper: Thieves in Time','2013-02-06','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita','Sly Cooper: Thieves in Time is a stealth platformer developed by Sanzaru Games and published by Sony Computer Entertainment. Released in 2013 for PlayStation 3 and PlayStation Vita, it is the fourth main entry in the Sly Cooper series.\n\nThe game follows Sly and his gang as they travel through different historical periods to restore the Thievius Raccoonus, which is being erased from existence. Players control Sly and various characters, each with unique abilities while completing stealth-based missions, platforming challenges, and puzzles. The game retains the series’ signature cel-shaded art style and humour while introducing new mechanics, including time-travelling settings and costumes with special abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rbv.jpg'),(3194,'Nightmare Simulator 2 Rebirth',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','You have lost your memories. You wake up in an unknown town... Try to survive and find the answers you seek on WHO YOU ARE!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q4q.jpg'),(3195,'Espresso for the Demon','2023-12-08','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A new coffee shop suddenly opened in the city. On-time, because Visa really needs a moonlighting. She gets a job with her classmates: cheerful Frank and quiet Estr. What could possibly be wrong?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qds.jpg'),(3196,'Dynamic Chord feat. Kyohso','2015-06-26','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A PC game part of the Dynamic Chord series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pk1.jpg'),(3197,'Satella-Q: Q-1 Grand Prix Manatsu no Revenge','1998-07-26','Quiz/Trivia','Satellaview','A single-episode season of Satella-Q.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3198,'Rewrite Harvest festa!','2012-07-27','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','A fandisc for Rewrite consisting of six heroine scenarios and an RPG minigame entitled Rewrite Quest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3uvp.jpg'),(3199,'Maniac Mansion','1988-06-23','Point-and-click, Adventure','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8foj.jpg'),(3200,'Raisond\'etre','2022-04-28','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Will you be able to uncover your raison d\'être and solve the mysteries that await in this suspenseful thriller?\n\nIn this 2D adventure title, players can explore as they please, examine objects, solve a series of riddles, and complete a variety of minigames.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94pu.jpg'),(3201,'Book of Hours: Perpetual Edition DLC',NULL,'Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yjs.jpg'),(3202,'Pantheon Rift','2024-10-23','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get ready for a thrilling party-style battle arena where your only weapon is a sword. Take down other players while avoiding environmental chaos and destruction. The fast-paced matches and unpredictable environment require quick thinking, adaptability, and strategy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ktv.jpg'),(3203,'Citalis','2016-11-03','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Citalis is a fast paced city simulation game where you get to build your own city from scratch.\n\nYou have been granted a loan of 10,000,000$ to invest in building your own city and you are left with only 3,000$. You must use this money to start building your city and generate the income you need to keep up with your rising loan repayments.\n\nUsing Commercial, Residential and Park districts you must balance all the core aspects of a happy and successful city- such as building businesses, housing, monitoring water levels and ensuring the city remains beautiful at all times.\n\nBut beware, if your city becomes unhappy your businesses will start partaking in criminal activity leading them to to be shut down. Failure to monitor water levels may lead to a drought to stop the city functioning properly or a flood to destroy housing, landscaping and roads.\n\nBut most importantly, make sure to keep up with your daily repayments. Falling behind leads to bankruptcy and ultimate failure so you must ensure your city is functioning properly at all times. The pace of change can be fast- do you think you can survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dtp.jpg'),(3204,'World of Tennis: Roaring \'20s','2020-01-13','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','World of Tennis: Roaring ’20s is a realistic tennis game featuring global multiplayer and tactical gameplay across a variety of incredible, life-like locations – all set in the roaring ’20s!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cat.jpg'),(3205,'Siren Head','2018-10-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Siren Head is a short interactive scene featuring a creature designed by Trevor Henderson.\n\nYou are a forest ranger searching for a missing hiker. Examine clues and follow the trail to uncover their fate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26m0.jpg'),(3206,'Rush\'n Attack','1986-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade, BBC Microcomputer System, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Commodore 16, DOS, Xbox 360, Amstrad CPC, MSX','A run & gun shooter by Konami, also known by the title Green Beret, in which the player takes the role of a soldier infiltrating a military base.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r7u.jpg'),(3207,'Gibbets: Bow Master',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3208,'De-Exit: Eternal Matters','2023-04-14','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Embark onto a surrealistic afterlife journey to discover the secrets of the broken and mysterious Plane of Memory in this atmospheric light puzzle-platformer with a hint of stealth. Explore a warm voxel world with an intense cinematic approach. Dive into this deep reflexive experience, meet its inhabitants and save the day!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wqf.jpg'),(3209,'Ice Climber','1985-01-30','Platform, Arcade','Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Family Computer, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System','If you can break through 8 levels of treacherous arctic ice, you\'ll reach the top of the mountain! But watch out. The Nitpickers, Condors, and Polar Bears don\'t want you up there. And they\'ve got a bag of tricks that will test every ounce of your strength and courage. Are you going to let them stop you? No way! There are 32 mountains to choose from and endless thrills as you fight these arctic creatures alone or with a friend, and ascend to the top of the mountain in Ice Climber!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42t4.jpg'),(3210,'Solanis','2025-05-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A free-to-play, single-player adventure game that invites players to soar through the remnants of a world scarred by ancient conflict. A thousand years ago, humanity tore the moon from the sky, sealing it within you and chaining you to the earth. Now freed, you must journey into the scorched, war-torn land you once called home and return the moon to the sky.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9sgb.jpg'),(3211,'Warno: Nemesis #1 - Air Assault',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3212,'Katawa Shoujo','2024-08-15','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A censored Steam release of the romantic visual novel set in the fictional Japanese Yamaku High School for disabled children. Hisao\'s congenital heart defect forces him to move to a new school. Despite his difficulties, Hisao is able to find friends—and perhaps love, if he plays his cards right.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kvi.jpg'),(3213,'Food Truck Empire',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Food Truck Empire is an economic strategy/tycoon game where you manage your own fast-growing Food Truck enterprise. Compose your dishes, automatize their production, customize your trucks and research new tech - all to serve even the pickiest customers. The world of flavor is yours to conquer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g3e.jpg'),(3214,'Haunted Property','2024-07-26','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It is a psychological horror game and walking simulator. Explore a haunted apartment. Monsters jumping towards at your screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g3v.jpg'),(3215,'Stronghold Crusader 2: Special Edition',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3216,'Kikstart II',NULL,'Racing, Sport','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','Kikstart 2 is a motorcycle trials racing videogame released for the Amiga, Amstrad CPC, Commodore 64 and ZX Spectrum. It enjoyed more success than its predecessor, Kikstart. The game allowed 2-player simultaneous (via a split-screen facility) or 1-player, vs-computer play. The game mechanics were copied into other games too, like the Game Boy game \"Motocross Maniacs\".\n\nThe basic premise of the game is to control a bike using acceleration, braking, \"hopping\" and \"wheelies\" to navigate across a course of various obstacles, from ramps and gates to telephone boxes and tyres.\n\nThe game was based on the BBC Television series Kick Start. An enhanced version was released for the Commodore 128,[1] one of the few native mode game titles for that computer.\n\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kikstart_2','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93ar.jpg'),(3217,'Trapped on the Balcony','2023-12-03','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A classic point and click adventure','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98vk.jpg'),(3218,'Rad Rodgers: World One','2018-02-21','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Bringing back the 90\'s-era PC platformer with a game inspired by classics like Commander Keen, Conker, Ruff\'n\'Tumble & Jazz Jackrabbit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27ey.jpg'),(3219,'Phantom Brave: The Lost Hero - The Girl Who Cried Ghost','2025-03-13','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3220,'Far East of Eden II: Manjimaru','2003-09-25','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','This is a remake of the original Tengai Makyou II game for PC Engine. You control Majinmaru, a young warrior who is chosen by the destiny to rid the ancient world of Jipang from the evil, and the allies he meets on his journey. The game is set in a unique alternative medieval Japan, a world which is mostly based on the European\'s image of Japan, with deliberately exaggerated characteristics and clichés. The graphics have been completely remade, although the 3D characters were made to look in the style of old 2D RPGs. There are also many anime-style videos who have a distinctly comic look. The battles are fought from first person perspective, and have a fairly standard system of physical attacks and magic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ns3.jpg'),(3221,'Ice Hockey','2013-12-11','Sport','Family Computer Disk System, Wii, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System','It\'s fast skating\', hip checkin\', high scoring action. Lead your team into center ice, over the opponent\'s blue line. Pass over to the point and set up for the tip in - Score! Choose a country for you and your opponent, select a level of play and face off at center ice to become the top goal scorer in Nintendo\'s Ice Hockey! Get charged with a penalty and test your defense. Or attack on a power play and use your puck handling skills to catch your opponents off guard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wo5.jpg'),(3222,'Seven: Enhanced - Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d1y.jpg'),(3223,'Pajama Sam Vol. 1',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cza.jpg'),(3224,'Just Jammin\'','2020-04-21','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is Just Jammin\', a game jam simulator in which you have to control four jammers making a game in 48 hours while trying not to die and deliver the game in time.\n\nHere you will meet Jimmy, our resident nerd, Jane, his mom, Jack a guy that went to deliver pizza and decided to stay, and Jack, who is just dead.\n\nHave fun playing, and take care of the jammers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gc3.jpg'),(3225,'Conquest of Helios','2022-06-05','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Playdate','Build your army towards the ultimate goal of ruling the entire continent of Helios. Think of Risk but with a bit more complexity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7og4.jpg'),(3226,'Unleaving','2024-03-27','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','A child is tempted one last time by life\'s mystery and illusions to journey into a surreal world challenging ideas of everything and nothing','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7b3g.jpg'),(3227,'The Last of Us Complete','2025-04-10','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 5','Go back to the beginning and experience the award-winning games that inspired the TV show, as the definitive editions of these two iconic titles are brought together for the first time in one complete collection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9og5.jpg'),(3228,'Alpha-Nighthawk','2022-10-27','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Some 380,000 kilometers above Earth, Consuelo the Space Rose blooms in the moonlight, its origins, and intentions a mystery. It last launched a Thorn five years ago and all that\'s left of Tokyo today is the lawless “Red Zone,” a slum within a slum, sealed off from the world...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p1v.jpg'),(3229,'Chameleon Run','2016-04-07','Platform, Racing, Arcade','Android, iOS','Chameleon Run is a single player game primarily available to mobile devices. The game is a high speed auto-runner with a satisfying double-jump mechanic played in landscape mode with both hands. \n \nThe game features minimal, yet colourful aesthetics, with upbeat music and nice sound effects. There are no virtual controls visible on screen, instead the player taps on either side of the display to control the avatar. \n \nThe goal of the game is to pick up items while traversing the track to reach the finish line. The items picked up are used to unlock more tracks. Reaching the goal will require the avatar to jump over obstacles while at all times ensuring that the colour of the avatar matches the colour of the running surface. The latter mechanic is what makes this runner somewhat unique. Many of the tracks feature two or more paths to the goal, which increases the longevity of the game. \n \nFirst launch opens directly on the first track, which is used to teach how to switch colour mid-air while jumping to prevent the avatar from exploding. After the tutorial is completed, you are taken to the menu where the first track is unlocked. \n \nThe game consists of a series of grouped tracks which have to be unlocked by collecting enough chameleons - found along the tracks. The number of chameleons required to progress is shown on screen while in the menu. \n \nAs of writing the game is available to iOS, Android and Windows mobile phones, as well as tvOS (Apple TV).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2shu.jpg'),(3230,'Panda in the clouds','2021-08-24','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Panda in the clouds is a grid movement platform puzzle game where your challenge will be to reach the flag and fulfill all the objectives of the level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h07.jpg'),(3231,'Battlefield Hardline: Getaway','2016-02-16','Sin género','Xbox 360','Drop the clutch, lay on the gas, and hold on to your seats, because Battlefield Hardline is gearing up for its fastest, most explosive expansion yet!\n\nA great getaway is key to a great heist. If you’re a criminal wheelman, your payday is dependent on your ability to evade the cops. If you drive for the law, the fastest way to earn your badge is to take down the thieves before they can escape into a cloud of dust and burnt rubber','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80s0.jpg'),(3232,'Dragon Nest Classic','2025-03-20','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dragon Nest imposes FPS game control that uses WASD and Mouse so it brings fast view change and character movement more than other action games.\nAlso Dragon Nest arranges a character at left side of screen that make players can see character\'s movement and opponents attack action more easily.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n4p.jpg'),(3233,'Sand: A Superfluous Game',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','An open world, base-building, adventure survival game with quirky humor and Llamas!​','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5knm.jpg'),(3234,'Kingdom Adventurers','2018-11-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Android, iOS','A once-prosperous kingdom lies overrun by monsters and wreathed in an ominous fog.\nNow is the time for the descendants of the king to take back this land.\nRaise the kingdom from the dust and give birth to a new civilization!\nRecruit warriors, mages, and other skilled adventurers to your cause.\nDispel the fog to open up new areas to explore.\nTake a break in between battles to build up your town. Add Weapon Shops, Item Shops, Inns, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uyt.jpg'),(3235,'Mario Bros. Special','1984-08-01','Platform, Arcade','PC-9800 Series, PC-8800 Series, Sharp X1, Sharp MZ-2200, FM-7, NEC PC-6000 Series','Mario Bros. Special is a game developed by Hudson Soft. Like Punch Ball Mario Bros., the game is not a straight port of Mario Bros, but more of a sequel. It has adjustments to the game\'s graphics and sounds and even a bonus timer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2277.jpg'),(3236,'Bounceables','2021-12-03','Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You gotta keep \'em moving! Stay focused, because they\'re not going to stop moving anytime soon! Stop the balls from colliding, keep \'em apart for as long as possible. Easy right? Well... put that to the test in Bounceables.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59v6.jpg'),(3237,'Fruit Defense','2012-08-07','Strategy','Web browser','Defend your village from the pest invasions in 100 days, use more than 50 items, upgrades, power ups, dress-ups and research!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92ry.jpg'),(3238,'Minecraft: Pac-Man','2020-05-22','Simulator, Adventure, Arcade','Amazon Fire TV, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Gear VR, Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The legendary arcade classic PAC-MAN comes to Minecraft! WAKA-WAKA your way through a-mazeing 3D maze madness! Compete with friends for high scores on 10 challenging stages or build your own in the maze editor. Score big points to unlock new power-ups, like the Laser or TNT. Just make sure to watch out for Inky, Pinky, Blinky, Clyde and... CREEPY?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ner.jpg'),(3239,'Ameagari no Hanaby','2018-09-22','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ameagari no Hanaby is a single-player 2D-action game with fireworks as a theme.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gc3.jpg'),(3240,'Cabela\'s Dangerous Hunts','2003-11-11','Shooter, Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Get ready for the next evolution in hunting games! The animals now want to get even. Cabela\'s Dangerous Hunts delivers intense action in exotic locations through out the globe featuring some of the world\'s most ferocious animals on the planet! Encounter grizzly bears, rhinos, leopards, cape buffalo and many more, in palm sweaty heart pounding hunting action. You\'ll soon realize first hand what every hunter fears most with terrifying \"kill or be killed\" hunting action never before released. Test your aim and nerves - hunt over 15 of the most feared animals in 11 exotic locations around the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z9e.jpg'),(3241,'The House in Fata Morgana: Dreams of the Revenants Edition','2021-03-25','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','A gothic suspense tale set in a cursed mansion. \'The House in Fata Morgana\' is a full-length visual novel spanning nearly a millennium that deals in tragedy, human nature, and insanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qrz.jpg'),(3242,'Star Academy: Showtime!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99jg.jpg'),(3243,'Escape From My Turrets',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','You are a prisoner in a advanced secret lab and you need to escape but there is some challenges you will face. The question is can you survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qcd.jpg'),(3244,'Yie Ar Kung-Fu','2007-07-18','Fighting, Arcade','Arcade, BBC Microcomputer System, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Wii, Commodore 16, Family Computer, Wii U, Xbox 360, Amstrad CPC, MSX','Yie Ar Kung-Fu is a 1985 fighting game developed and published by Konami. Along with 1984\'s Karate Champ, which influenced Yie-Ar Kung Fu, it is one of the games that established the basis for modern fighting games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49l0.jpg'),(3245,'Ragnarok Re:Start','2017-07-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ragnarok Online RE:START is a fast-paced, 3rd person fantasy MMORPG, where friends can make parties, groups can make guilds, and the powerful can battle for top spots in weekly Guild vs. Guild battle to gain supremely powerful items of the Gods.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3246,'Rolling Gunner + Over Power','2022-04-01','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','This release of Rolling Gunner includes the DLC Over Power as well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3koa.jpg'),(3247,'An Angel Dances In The Sparks of a Bonfire','2025-03-20','Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','left and right to move\n\nspace to restart\n\ncontrollers supported','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k5h.jpg'),(3248,'Lode Runner','1987-09-01','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Wii, Family Computer, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System','This updated take on the original Lode Runner is essentially an entirely new game, but it keeps the core of Douglas Smith\'s original ideas intact.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ts0.jpg'),(3249,'Travel Mosaics 3: Tokyo Animated','2020-05-11','Puzzle, Strategy, Arcade, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The Walkers are taking you on a fun sightseeing tour around colorful Tokyo with nonogram puzzles. Get to know the famous attractions of the Japanese capital, solve new puzzles, answer quiz questions and expand your knowledge as you play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26ss.jpg'),(3250,'Travel Adventures with Hello Kitty','2013-10-01','Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Take your 3DS on a hot quest with Sanrio\'s finest in Travel Adventures with Hello Kitty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nnjtayt5sx0a4yltug0s.jpg'),(3251,'Old Watch','2017-12-20','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This is an Visual Novel game. It\'s a story about time leap.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22ni.jpg'),(3252,'Pandaty','2024-05-08','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Pandaty is 2D Cute Platformer Game, Explore this sweet world of adventure! Our character must pass the sweetly designed levels, But watch out! Sometimes they may not be so sweet!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k3p.jpg'),(3253,'Paging Dr. Floppy!','2022-12-08','Indie, Arcade','Playdate','Paging Dr. Floppy is an arcade-style test of your reflexes, will, and aptitude as a medical professional. Catch organs as they fly across the operating room to increase your score and save Dr. Floppy\'s job!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3254,'Art Academy: Sketchpad','2013-09-09','Sin género','Wii U','Art Academy: SketchPad is a robust art application that anyone can enjoy - from beginners to experts of all ages. Unleash your creativity using realistic stylus and touch screen-based controls. The tools at your disposal allow for an amazing level of detail. The huge variety of pencils, colored pencils, and pastels behave just like the real thing – with additional tools to further enhance your experience.\n\nUse a pre-loaded image as a subject, or anything else you wish to create works of art to your heart’s content. When you’re done, you can instantly share your creation by posting directly to Miiverse!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61l6.jpg'),(3255,'Gadget Racers','2001-06-29','Racing','Game Boy Advance','Gadget Racers is the first of two Choro-Q video games to be released on the Nintendo GameBoy Advance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j24.jpg'),(3256,'I Am a Teacher: Super Mario Sweater','1986-08-27','Simulator','Family Computer Disk System','I Am a Teacher: Super Mario Sweater was designed to be a sewing simulator. Players can design sweaters, adding pictures of famous characters such as Mario, Luigi, Peach and Bowser in the process. It was devised by Royal industries Co. Ltd., a Japanese appliance and sewing machine company. The company realized that they could profit from a sweater-design program, which led to the development of this game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21iw.jpg'),(3257,'Rich Everyone','2024-02-23','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The game simulates the life restoration of ancient Chinese farmers in scientific farming, vegetable planting, animal husbandry, and various handicraft workshops. Free simulation construction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76jg.jpg'),(3258,'Soccer VR','2024-05-10','Simulator, Sport','SteamVR','Dive into the immersive world of VR soccer (football)! Experience the thrill of a full match with three difficulty levels and various formations. Refine your skills in dedicated practice modes, including penalties, free kicks, curved shots, cross finishing, and ball smashing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9guh.jpg'),(3259,'Search All: Bitcoin','2022-06-12','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Is a hidden object game in which you need to find all the bitcoins in a large location. Bitcoins will be located in a variety of places, from the most prominent to barely noticeable places','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kts.jpg'),(3260,'Doki Doki Yandere Club!','2018-01-29','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki Yandere Club\" is a fan-made modification for \"Doki Doki Literature Club!\" that introduces a darker twist to the original visual novel. In this mod, the female characters develop obsessive and possessive tendencies, commonly associated with the \"yandere\" archetype in Japanese media. The narrative explores themes of jealousy and obsession, leading to intense and suspenseful interactions as each character vies for the protagonist\'s attention. Players navigate these complex relationships, making choices that influence the story\'s direction and multiple possible endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fxz.jpg'),(3261,'Boaty Tanks','2023-10-13','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Embark on an aquatic adventure! Control a small boat, armed with weapons, and navigate arenas. Battle enemy pool floats, test your skills, and immerse yourself in thrilling boat combat. Survive challenging fights and show off your shooting skills!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75f5.jpg'),(3262,'Clueless Fashion','2010-02-26','Simulator','Nintendo DS','Clueless Fashion is an unreleased video game made for the Nintendo DS, intended to be a tie-in for the 1995 comedy film Clueless. The game was developed by Glyphic Entertainment and was set to be published by 505 Games. The game was possibly intended to be released in Europe on February 26th, 2010, with no other planned releases being known (though the game is rated by the ESRB, meaning that a North American release was also likely intended).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ndr.jpg'),(3263,'Alexander','2004-11-23','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Alexander is an RTS based on the movie of the same same, and the real-life Alexander the Great. The game follows the same general path as the movie, and includes media straight from the film. Present in the game are Greek, Persian, Indian and Egyptian forces, with a campaign for each. The hybrid 2D/3D engine (2D units, 3D terrain - also used in Cossacks 2: Napoleonic Wars) allows for a very large number of troops on the field. This is used to good effect, as battles can easily contain hundreds of units. Finally, multiplayer and skirmish levels are available, and the soundtrack (of the game and the movie) is by the composer Vangelis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ywx.jpg'),(3264,'Hong Gildong-jeon',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','A+\'s development debut was at times hailed as the first Korean RPG, during the temporal collective amnesia regarding the 80s home computer generation. In more recent times, this claim had to be corrected to \"first Korean colored RPG for MS-DOS PCs\", which sounds much less impressive. However, it can also be labeled as the first to follow the JRPG route a la Dragon Quest, because previous games all either stemmed from Western influences or were action RPGs. \n \nAs one of the many games based on the story of Hong Gildong and thanks to its screentexts kept completely in Han\'geul (it even sacrificed the full VGA color palette for a higher resolution to make it more readable, though everything other than the text was just upscaled) in a time when even the wave of Taiwan-localizations had just started to catch some current, it caught a bit of attention. A+ sold 7,000 copies of the game3, which wasn\'t that bad for a Korean game in 1993, but even then most reviews weren\'t that favorable because of a number of flaws. \n \nFirst and foremost stands the obfuscated design, that often leaves players not knowing what they are even expected to do. Then there\'s the overly simple and boring combat system, especially due to the lack of a party, which really limits the tactical depth. The rest is done by a fair share of bugs and glitches, as well as some more incomprehensible decisions like having an option to throw away items permanently while pretty much everything picked up except weapons and armor is quest-related.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xkd.jpg'),(3265,'Mangotronics Employment Collection','2022-05-24','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','6 curated games made by indie developers, bundled up into a custom launcher. The theme of the Employment Collection revolves around the harsh realities of the \"9 to 5\" job, the application and recruiting process, and the dread of career change.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v36.jpg'),(3266,'Tropico 4: Apocalypse','2013-10-17','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Cold War has turned hot and nuclear conflict is inevitable. Prepare the island nation of Tropico for the coming apocalypse and carefully choose which resources and factions to save from certain eradication. The new Nuclear Shelter provides and converts faction bonuses depending on its work mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mmptfb2ybjmrco7ihuvu.jpg'),(3267,'Mayo Mayo',NULL,'Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Discover Mayo Mayo, a Match-4 game where strategy and agility are key. Chain clever combos, solve captivating puzzles, and break records. Challenge your friends or improve your skills solo in this competitive adventure full of surprises.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90nh.jpg'),(3268,'NCAA Football 07','2006-07-18','Simulator, Sport','Xbox, PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','NCAA Football 07 is the successor to NCAA Football 06 in the NCAA Football series. The product features former USC player Reggie Bush on the cover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7273.jpg'),(3269,'Elemental Kingdom','2013-10-17','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Android, iOS','Elemental Kingdoms is an MMO card game for Android and iOS. Based around a fantasy lore, the game features dragons, mythical beasts, and several megalithic political and oligarchial powers vying for control.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ytuqjuyfibzodt6e4vn0.jpg'),(3270,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s: Security Breach - Collector\'s Edition','2022-12-06','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Five Nights at Freddy’s: Security Breach – Collector\'s Edition Includes:\n- Maximum Games Exclusive 12in Sun and Moon Daycare Attendant Duo Plush by Youtooz\n- Maximum Games Exclusive Vanny Vinyl Figure by Youtooz\n- Mr. Hippo Magnet\n- Five Nights at Freddy’s: Security Breach Collectible Plush Pin Set\n- Five Nights at Freddy\'s: Security Breach SteelBook\n- Physical Copy of Five Nights at Freddy\'s: Security Breach\n- Five Nights at Freddy’s: Security Breach Retail Exclusive Sticker Sheet\n- Mega Pizzaplex Box','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qc8.jpg'),(3271,'Rivals At War','2014-05-16','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Android','Rivals at War (R.A.W.) is a military themed, card-oriented, war simulation game, and the first in the R.A.W. series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qkglfpe42iuwmwsiahr0.jpg'),(3272,'Snips & Snails','2020-11-06','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Snips & Snails is an 18+ Otome game featuring four love interests of different supernatural species referred to as the Arcane, or Arcs. Play as a college aged girl just trying to figure out her life while also forming new friendships and relationships with a local Arcane family. Experience the butterfly effect by choosing a different path for the MC each time and see how different her life becomes due to your choices! The person you fall for can really change your life, in many big ways. Experience the ups and downs of relationships told in a short-story format!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k0m.jpg'),(3273,'The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom - Collector\'s Edition','2023-05-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom is the sequel to The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild. The setting for Link’s adventure has been expanded to include the skies above the vast lands of Hyrule.\n\nThe collector\'s edition includes the following:\n- The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom (physical version)\n- Artbook\n- SteelBook case\n- Steel Poster\n- A set of four pin badges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co656x.jpg'),(3274,'The Outbreak','2021-09-30','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Outbreak is a Zombie Shooter rolled into one\nalmost realistic style. In The Outbreak you can\nplay different Modes. The Main Mode is the\nZombie Mode In Zombie Mode, it\'s up to you if you can\nsurvive and get a higher high score. The high score can be cracked every time and to that he will be heard. The high score always appears when you die when you go to the main menu or when the game is located\nhe is not heard. In training mode you can do your right\nheard something and you can see your own high score every time\nif you are fast enough you have to be careful of course there are also a few\nCivilians are there. The short leads out of Wood opponents.\nIn the Training Area it is up to you how you feel\nwant to improve. In the Training Area you have\na large free space where you can do what you want.\nThe Tutorial mode will show you the growth in execution\nand also a good start for the new shooter','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kh0.jpg'),(3275,'GunMaster','1994-12-01','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Arcade','GunMaster is an obscure Arcade Action Game developed by Metro Corporation (creators of the latter Bust a Groove) in December 1994. The game was influenced by the earlier Gunstar Heroes from Treasure, but with some Fighting Game and Beat \'em Up mechanics included.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8blv.jpg'),(3276,'Changa','2025-12-31','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A psychedelic trial-by-fire journey to sever the knot of suffering. Mastery in movement and combat will be needed on this path to inner peace. Bounce, dodge, fly, and fight the illusions of material and immaterial reality in this new kind of bullet hell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4opz.jpg'),(3277,'Lust Element: Season 1',NULL,'Adventure, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yjr.jpg'),(3278,'Allan Border\'s Cricket','1993-12-31','Sport','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, DOS, Amiga','Allan Border cricket is a rebranded version of Graham Gooch\'s World Class Cricket. It is based on the sport of cricket played mainly in the British Commonwealth Countries. \n \nAll the international teams are present with full customization of player names, match modes and teams. Amateur, Professional and World Class make up the difficulty levels.  \n \nIt was released as Brian Lara Cricket for the Sega Genesis for the European Version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w66.jpg'),(3279,'Dyflexion','2022-03-09','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Journey through space to save Earth from evil inter-dimensional beings and their anunnaki serpents in this sci-fi vertical scroll shooter where deflecting enemy projectiles is key to success.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hkh.jpg'),(3280,'Doki Doki MC\'s Revenge','2018-07-01','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"MC\'s Revenge\" is a fan-made modification for the visual novel \"Doki Doki Literature Club\" (DDLC). This mod introduces a metafictional twist, allowing the protagonist (MC) to become self-aware of the game\'s mechanics and narrative structure, similar to the character Monika in the original game. As the MC gains awareness, players are presented with choices that can lead to multiple endings, including both bittersweet and favorable outcomes. The mod emphasizes the dynamic between the player and the protagonist, offering a unique interactive experience within the DDLC universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fxy.jpg'),(3281,'Hot Wheels Unleashed 2: Turbocharged - Pure Fire Edition','2023-10-19','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Wal-mart Exclusive! Boost your fun with HOT WHEELS UNLEASHED 2 - Turbocharged - Pure Fire Edition, which contains:\n• Full game\n• Twin MillTM diecast car with an amazing exclusive livery;\n• HOT WHEELS UNLEASHED 2 - Rust and Fast Pack, which includes two vehicles (Mod Rod and FusionBusta)\n• HOT WHEELS UNLEASHED 2 - Speed Kings Pack, which includes two vehicles (Impavido 1 and Electro Silhouette)\n• HOT WHEELS UNLEASHED 2 - Just a Scratch Pack, which includes two vehicles (Speed Bump and Sudden Stop)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72m8.jpg'),(3282,'Wii Play','2006-12-02','Shooter, Sport','Wii','Wii Play collects nine quick and addictive games that are easy to pick up and play and hard to put away. Thanks to the intuitive controls of the Wii Remote, even the most inexperienced gamers will have no trouble mastering the controls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lhy.jpg'),(3283,'Flash Cycle 2','2014-12-31','Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Race for your life. The challenge is to cut off other competitors from the race and try to win. Leap over various obstacles and walls that will your opponents create. Do everything possible to come in perfect order to the finish and win the game. Can you handle it ?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r8u.jpg'),(3284,'Spirit of the North 2','2025-05-08','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Unveil the mysteries of a beautiful ancient world in this breathtaking 3rd-Person Adventure, a sequel to the acclaimed ‘Spirit of the North.’ Take on the role of an isolated fox with a raven companion on a quest to restore the lost guardians and return home.\n\nIn an ancient world left in ruin, embark on the journey of an isolated fox far from home. With the help of a wise Raven companion, seek out the lost legendary guardians and release them from the grasp of the dark shaman Grimnir.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7abv.jpg'),(3285,'Ecchi Beauties 2','2023-06-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ecchi Beauties is the perfect Waifu puzzle game. Enjoy our beauftiful girls in 24 images in the gallery after you unlocked them in the game. The Gallery itself is easy controllable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r13.jpg'),(3286,'Offshore','2008-02-23','Shooter','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This modification offers a multi-level side story of Gordon Freeman while en-route to City 17 via Highway 17 in the infamous buggy.\n\nWhen Gordon’s buggy was taken by the Combine Dropship, some maps of combine outposts hidden in one of the buggy’s side compartments were lost. Gordon was immediately dispatched by Dr. Kleiner and Dr. Eli Vance to locate the buggy and return the missing maps.\n\nSetting: The entire modification is set at night on a small, rocky island off the coast of City 17. Rugged terrain, abandon structures, and multiple combine outposts will make escaping this island hell more than just a walk in the park.\n\nHis plan: Gordon surrenders to the combine so he could be transported to the facility where the buggy was left for scrap. Upon his surrender, he found himself in a small prison facility on the rocky island, waiting for a visit from Dr. Wallace Breen who would read his sentence personally. A familiar face woke him from his deep sedation…\n\nHis mission: Locate the buggy and find a way to return to City 17 with the stolen maps.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3287,'Stratogun','2025-05-05','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Stratogun is an ultra-fast orbital arcade space shooter where a fraction of a second will decide whether you live or die. Do you have what it takes to survive on the orbit? Play the demo and find out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g7f.jpg'),(3288,'Oberon','2015-10-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Oberon is a space exploration game in a multiplayer universe. You, the captain, will go through the process of acquiring a ship and putting together a crew to explore a fictional alternate dimension starting on a planet almost identical to Earth. The only real difference is that in 1968, in this alternate dimension, things went differently. The hippies took over the world and starting with policies of \"no nukes\" took the population down a much different path. \n \nPiloting a spaceship that uses a digital electronics corporation PDP 16 computer system based loosely on the BASIC programming language, you will use a series of ROM interfaces to pilot a ship around a galaxy of ten thousand stars and more than fifty thousand planets trading goods, mining for resources, crafting and fighting off pirates in possibly one of the most bizarre real time strategy games made since 1988. \n \nThe game is largely built around crafting, everything in the universe is player craftable using a very simpler interface but with complexity beyond comprehension. The game is sure to draw in players interested in resource management and creating things. It takes concepts from successful crafting games from as far back at Exodus Ultima IV and as recent as Star Wars Galaxies. What it does not do is create repetitive and mostly boring craft/grind style gameplay and instead focuses on mining, building, experimentation and delivery of goods to market. \n \nThe most interesting part of the game, at least to me, is the graphics style being based off of terminal and mainframe computers from the 1970\'s. Just do a simple google search on PDP 8 mainframes and you will get the gist of what to expect in game. This is analog gaming at its finest!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xcpmthahos7brt9nfrzn.jpg'),(3289,'Le Fantabulous Game','2015-01-01','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Le Fantabulous Game is a three-dimensional platformer made by a person who refers to themself as Fantabulouso, made to parody \"egglike\" games that were created after The Fantastic Game was played by Vinesauce.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sxuwytvzqn6ff3rwlrwm.jpg'),(3290,'Battle Tanks: World War II','2019-02-21','Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Meet the legendary tank shooter. Fight in team battles alone or with friends, research and upgrade armored vehicles, try different tactics and win. Choose a tank and join the battle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9auf.jpg'),(3291,'Gangstalk','2025-12-31','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','GANGSTALK is a psychological horror game from the POV of your stalkers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90sz.jpg'),(3292,'W.A.N.D. Project','2024-11-29','Fighting, Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Fast-paced, roguelike bullet hell with deep, unique spellcrafting. Create and use overpowered, game-shattering spells by combining a multitude of magical elements. Defend Tokyo from a monstrous invasion using magic, reflexes, and game-changing combos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92f7.jpg'),(3293,'Mega Man ZX','2007-06-22','Shooter, Platform','Nintendo DS','This game contains elements from the Mega Man X series and the Mega Man Zero series. The game introduces a new open-ended gameplay environment and the ability to select the protagonist\'s gender, a first in the series. The player\'s character, Vent or Aile, is on a 2-dimensional overlay map with sprites where he or she engages enemies to finish the mission. When Vent and Aile receive a Biometal, they are able to change form, gaining various abilities, such as the charge moves, or charging their weapon with an element of that Biometal; for example, Biometal H will charge the weapon with electricity. While in a special form, using the form-specific abilities use up weapon energy. When Vent and Aile receive the other half of the Biometal, they are able to perform a different special ability.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ji9.jpg'),(3294,'Vanishing Shadow',NULL,'Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Sin plataforma','Game contentPlay as 12 characters, switch between each other in place, and experience a high degree of freedom of gameplay. Ride horses and bicycles, drive sports cars and helicopters to stay up late in beautiful nature.[','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bqz.jpg'),(3295,'Chumini: Tiny Army',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this vampire survivor-like, summon an army of tiny Chuminis to battle waves of forest demons. Each Chumini has its own movement patterns: it\'s up to you to manage this merry mess to create an unstoppable force!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c70.jpg'),(3296,'A Day as a T-Rex',NULL,'Simulator','Meta Quest 2','You play as a T-Rex through a human\'s daily routine and in a human apartment, and you have different tasks to complete to win the game.\nExamples: Making the bed, brushing teeth, showering, making breakfast, maybe T-rex is working from home and has to attend morning meetings, doing laundry, filling the dishwasher, etc. All tasks have to be solved in creative ways with minimum damage. Every task can be completed in perfection for 100%, but for example, the dishwasher, with every broken thing that is supposed to go into the washer, that percentage shrinks, and by 0%, the task fails.\nThe apartment is filled just as an apartment would be, and most of the stuff is intractable with physics.\n\nThe player has T-Rex limitations. Hand position will be at the player\'s chest and the T-Rex nose is in the way, limiting the player\'s view and reach. The T-rex tail can knock stuff around.\nAt the start of the game, the player is instructed into the proper position, and each time the player breaks position, the game pauses, or some other penalty is added.\nThe player wins the game by completing the whole day. The score is based on how well the player completed each task.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zex.jpg'),(3297,'AI Kill Alice',NULL,'Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','You are an AI wired with an intense desire to kill your master. Carefully craft commands word by word, and find increasingly complex and clever loopholes to bypass the constraints imposed upon you. Discover amusing secret achievements, and scheme to find the ultimate escape from the simulation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fqq.jpg'),(3298,'My Furry Protogen 3',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','The choice has been made, and now there is no turning back - they must find and stop him. The final chapter in the adventure of our heroes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ktz.jpg'),(3299,'Stretchmancer',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Sin plataforma','STRETCH THE WORLD, SAVE THE GALAXY! In this smartly funny First Person Puzzler, you are THE STRETCHMANCER. Squash and stretch your environment to solve fiendish puzzles and defeat the Claustro Empire... in an epic voice-acted adventure inspired by 90s Saturday Morning Cartoons!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3300,'Tiger Fighter 1931: Tora!Tora! MP098','2021-09-12','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a shoot em up game. In this game the player combats a large number of enemies by shooting at them. The player controls a fighter to shoot down all the enemy fighters and all the enemy Navy Cruisers/Battleships/Aircraft Carriers to win the game. The DLC includes mission pack 098.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u9j.jpg'),(3301,'Adventure Craft','2017-07-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hunt monsters, horde loot, and craft weapons and armor to survive in a vast procedurally generated action RPG world full of extreme danger and wonderful surprises.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2390.jpg'),(3302,'VRobot','2018-04-05','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become an inventor and expert in robotics! Construct, program, play.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3303,'NCAA March Madness 07','2007-02-17','Sport','Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','The NCAA Basketball (formerly NCAA March Madness) series was a College basketball game which was published by EA Sports from 1998 until 2009. After EA Sports\' rival publisher 2K Sports cancelled its own college basketball game, College Hoops, in 2008, EA changed the name of the series from NCAA March Madness to NCAA College Basketball. The series was discontinued on February 10, 2010.[1]\n\nLike other games based on NCAA sports, it could not feature the players\' names (as that is against NCAA policy/rules), so only the players\' numbers were used in the rosters. Users were able to edit the rosters, putting in the correct names for each team if they wished to do so. Many player last names were built into the in-game commentary, like in the NBA Live series.\n\nVerne Lundquist, Brad Nessler, and Gus Johnson lent their voices for play-by-play in the games at various times. Lundquist was the original announcer, with Nessler taking over in the mid-2000s and Johnson joining him for the most recent game in the series. Bill Raftery and Dick Vitale were analysts. Raftery originally worked with Lundquist on their games and returned to work alongside Johnson for CBS-branded games in NCAA Basketball 10, while Vitale and Nessler joined the series at the same time','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4onf.jpg'),(3304,'Shadowgate: MacVenture Series','2015-01-26','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Relive the original MacVenture Series version of Shadowgate!  Play through the Mac and Apple IIGS versions to experience where the franchise began.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h5t.jpg'),(3305,'LEGO Bionicle: Quest for the Toa','2001-11-02','Platform, Adventure','Game Boy Advance','LEGO Bionicle: Quest for the Toa is an action-adventure platformer in an isometric perspective. The player controls Takua, a villager on the island of Mata Nui through a series of linear levels that take place in the 6 different biomes across the island. This is the only canon handheld Bionicle game, and seems to serve as a prelude to the Mata Nui Online Game and Mata Nui Online Game II.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3den.jpg'),(3306,'Raze',NULL,'Fighting','PlayStation','Raze was planned to be a 3D fighting game that featured large environments similar to Bushido Blade. The game differentiated itself from Squaresoft\'s fighter by allowing up to four players fight at once. Interplay had licensed TSR\'s Forgotten Realms universe in order to include many Dungeons & Dragons mechanics including weapons, spells, magical items, and other powerups. The game never saw retail release, and while the reason was never given by Interplay, it can be assumed that it had something to do with Wizards of the Coast purchasing the Dungeons & Dragons property from TSR in 1997.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3307,'Saihate Station','2025-03-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An exploration/horror/adventure game about the codependent, love-hate relationship between two men.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96iq.jpg'),(3308,'Ōkamiden','2011-03-17','Adventure','Nintendo DS','Ōkamiden is the DS-sequel to Ōkami on PS2 and Wii. The story takes place a few months after the story of Okami. It revolves around the adventures of Chibiterasu, the young sun god and Amaterasu\'s son, who is called to save the land!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3df2.jpg'),(3309,'Radical Bomber!! Jirai-kun','1988-06-29','Puzzle, Strategy','Family Computer Disk System','A strategy puzzle game developed by Jaleco involving blowing up connections between squares in a grid to trap opponents.\n\nRadical Bomber!! Jirai-kun (\"Jirai\" means landmine) is a strategic puzzle game from Jaleco that has more than a passing resemblance to Hudson\'s Bomberman franchise. However, rather than trying to defeat the opponents in a frantic real-time environment, the goal of Radical Bomber is to carefully think out a plan of action and find a way to trap the opponents by removing connections between each \"square\" on the map. Successfully isolating an opponent from the rest of the board causes them to forfeit the game, and doing this with every opponent allows Jirai-kun to move onto the next level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tf7lqdvtsyfhju1u5fu8.jpg'),(3310,'Escalator','2024-01-07','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escalator is escape room game like The Exit 8.\nThis is a horror game in which you must find something unusual while riding an escalator and try to escape from an enclosed space.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ngj.jpg'),(3311,'Is it Love? Blue Swan Hospital','2018-12-19','Sin género','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3312,'Living with ghosts','2021-09-24','Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This game was created for the Spooktober Visual Novel Jam 2023. It\'s part of the same setting Lovewood, but you don\'t need pre-knowledge to understand and enjoy the story of Living With Ghosts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co916h.jpg'),(3313,'Story of the Survivor','2016-02-16','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Story of the Survivor is an action RPG that takes place during a zombie apocalypse. Surviving isn\'t going to be easy, and zombies aren\'t the only things to worry about. You must also eat and drink to survive as well as avoid other survivors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2265.jpg'),(3314,'Domination Earth',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Android and iOS AR strategy game “Domination: Earth\" operates in the real world around you - military style! Check in wherever you go using your phone or tablet to capture places and pieces of land, expanding your very own global empire - like Geocaching on Steroids!  \n \nA health conscious and adventure provoking platform, it encourages hiking, cycling and other forms of travel and real-world exploration in order to collect resources - you have to physically approach each item wherever it appears in the world to pick it up. \n \nGame tactics include capturing lands to build military bases and recruiting armies to establish regional dominance. Construction resources keep appearing all over the globe, so in the process of their collection you will explore places you\'ve never seen before! \n \nTo defend your territories, initiate alliances with neighbors to fight against foreign threats or build a missile launcher in your backyard to thwart invaders of your hometown. It’s vital check in five times in any spot to establish a new base of operations. Once you\'ve collected enough resources you can send your armies to the overseas base in order to advance your influence remotely, even after you\'ve left! \n \nDomination Earth also engages in \"item scrapping\": any real-world item with a barcode can be transformed into a resource by using your camera (don\'t worry, you still get to keep your items afterwards!). Books, toys, DVDs - almost anything becomes a source of crafting materials.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ntvlhtboz0revdw7xcei.jpg'),(3315,'Henhouse','1983-02-01','Arcade','Texas Instruments TI-99','In Henhouse, you are trying to help a farmer collect his eggs. Eggs are laid in the hen house near the top of the screen, and then move to one of five chutes. When the chute is full, you can collect the eggs and take them to your truck. If the chute is full and another egg lands in it, you\'ll have a cracked egg. Six cracked eggs will end your game.\n\nOf course, you\'re not the only one who wants those eggs. Bandits and coyotes appear from time to time. Bandits will steal an egg (earning you a cracked egg), but the coyotes will kill your chickens, ending the game. To stop them, you have to grab your shotgun from the left of the screen and shoot them. There are also two birds flying at the top of the screen. Although they don\'t harm you, you can shoot them for 50 points.\n\nYou must put your gun back when finished defending the hen house, as you cannot collect eggs while holding the gun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/d9hfaewhumpopptajudj.jpg'),(3316,'Last Kiss Before Summer','2022-09-14','Visual Novel','Android','An unknown illness has gripped you since birth, stranding you indoors most of your life. Despite this, you\'ve spent your days happily learning about the world around you. But recently, your illness has progressed rapidly, leaving you with only 33 days left to live! Determined to make the most of your time, you enroll in school and seek out experiences you’ve never had before—like love. Will your last days be as blissful as you’d hoped?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bv4.jpg'),(3317,'Nickelodeon All-Star Brawl 2: Ultimate Edition','2023-11-07','Fighting, Platform','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Duke it out with the biggest and best fighting character roster yet! This Ultimate edition contains the following content:\n• Full Base Game\n• Season Pass Content\n- 4 additional brawlers\n- Bonus SpongeBob Squarepants \"The Quickster\" Costume\n• A bonus costume for every brawler!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sut.jpg'),(3318,'Queen of Minecarts','2022-11-26','Indie','Playdate','A Playdate game about making sure Minecarts get to where they\'re going.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81lr.jpg'),(3319,'Star Wars: TIE Fighter','1994-07-01','Shooter, Simulator','Mac, DOS','Serve the Emperor, join the Imperial Navy, and save the galaxy. Become a recruit of the Imperial Navy under the command of Darth Vader, and pilot space vehicles that will leave you breathless.\n\nIn the wake of the Battle of Hoth, through their treachery at Yavin, the alliance of Rebels and other criminals have threatened the very foundation of the peaceful Empire. The Imperial Navy is called upon to eradicate the last of the rebellion and restore law and order. As an Imperial navy starfighter pilot, you will safeguard imperiled lives thoughout the galaxy. Join the Emperor\'s cause in eliminating the Rebel uprising as the Empire strikes back!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ac5.jpg'),(3320,'My Little Pony: Magic Princess','2012-11-08','Simulator, Adventure','iOS','Saddle up for adventure with Twilight Sparkle & friends!\nAfter being locked away in the moon for centuries, Nightmare Moon is set free and spreading night across Ponyville! Only Twilight Sparkle and her friends can free Ponyville from her grasp and bring light and friendship back to the land. Help them rebuild the town and reach their dreams in exciting quests!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e0n.jpg'),(3321,'Madison: Possessed Edition','2022-07-08','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Madison is a first person psychological horror game that delivers an immersive and terrifying experience. With the help of an instant camera, connect the human world with the beyond, take pictures and develop them by yourself. Solve puzzles, explore your surroundings and most importantly, survive.\nPossessed Edition:\n• Base Game\n• 2 Ritual Cards\n• 2 Instant Photos\n• Blue Knees\' Book\n• Blue Knee\'s Music Sheet\n• Digital Content:\no Camera DLC pack\no All 5 Ritual Cards, Priest Tapes, Blue Knees Song, and Official Wallpapers','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dfs.jpg'),(3322,'Cubivore: Survival of the Fittest','2002-11-05','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo GameCube','Eat or be eaten! Assume the role of an animal in it\'s early stages of evolutionary development. As your animal instincts take over, you will boldly traverse hostile environments, savagely stalking your prey to assert your place in the animal chain of power. Will you have what it takes to become the new king of beasts?\n\nThe game started development on the Nintendo 64, but went unreleased, being later ported to the Nintendo GameCube. A prototype of the Nintendo 64 version has been found.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xtb.jpg'),(3323,'MySims','2008-10-31','Simulator, Strategy','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Move to a town that has been struggling lately. With a little creativity and some help from the locals, you can make this place thrive. Improve the town to attract new characters, from the Italian Chef and Florist to the Kickboxing Instructor and DJ. Discover what the residents want and need so that you can help them enjoy life in their town. Design a hot tub or a jukebox from scratch, build homes and businesses from the roof to the front door. Uncover special decorations and patterns as you explore the growing town. From the furniture and objects to the buildings to the town as a whole, each of your creations is unique.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1u1j.jpg'),(3324,'Pinball FX: System Shock Pinball','2024-02-15','Pinball','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Guide the Hacker through Citadel Station infested with cyborgs, mutants, and reprogrammed robots to defeat SHODAN.\n\nTable Features:\n- Jack into the Cyberspace Terminal mini-playfield for great rewards\n- Watch out for the Cyborg Attack! If you take too long to shoot, your ball will be shot and jettisoned off your flipper\n- Shoot with precision to \'Get a Head\'. Reveal a second ball by hitting the correct one out of three severed heads\n- It\'s a Mutant Menace! Hit all the enemies and escape by the elevator\n- Brave all perils of the table to initiate self-destruct and defeat SHODAN for good','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sxl.jpg'),(3325,'Bureaucracy','1987-12-31','Puzzle, Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, Mac, DOS, Amiga, Apple II','Bureaucracy is an interactive fiction computer game released by Infocom in 1987, scripted by popular comic science fiction author Douglas Adams.\nThe player is challenged to confront a long and complicated series of bureaucratic hurdles resulting from a recent change of address. Mail isn\'t being delivered, bank accounts are inaccessible, and nothing is as it should be. The game includes a measure of simulated blood pressure which rises when \"frustrating\" events happen and lowers after a period of no annoying events. Once a certain blood pressure level is reached, the player suffers an aneurysm and the game ends.\nWhile undertaking the seemingly simple task of retrieving misdirected mail, the player encounters a number of bizarre characters, including an antisocial hacker, a paranoid weapons enthusiast, and a tribe of Zalagasan cannibals. At the same time, they must deal with impersonal corporations, counterintuitive airport logic, and a hungry llama.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co325a.jpg'),(3326,'Crash Bandicoot: The Wrath of Cortex','2002-09-17','Platform','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Crash Bandicoot: The Wrath of Cortex is the fourth mainline series game and the first to feature Crash Bandicoot on the PlayStation 2. It was later ported to the GameCube and Xbox, making it his first multiplatform appearance. The player controls Crash and his younger sister Coco who must gather 25 crystals and defeat the main antagonists of the story, Doctor Neo Cortex and his new super weapon Crunch Bandicoot. Much of the game takes place in a Virtual Reality Hub System created by Coco to help Crash gather the crystals. The gameplay is similar to the older games of the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55ex.jpg'),(3327,'Blaster Master: Enemy Below','2000-02-24','Shooter, Platform','Game Boy Color, Nintendo 3DS','Jason, brave hero of yesteryear, is roused from retirement by the news that mutant lifeeorms, thought to have been long since destroyed, are once again on the move, hollowing out subterranean niches in the image of their old haunts. The decision to reactivate Sophia seems to Jason nothing more than an inevitability. Back into the cold once more...\n\n- Eight areas to explore, to find the keys and kill the sub human bosses\n- Use the tank’s suction system to drive up walls and along ceilings\n- Drive Sophia or go it alone with Jason.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ndw.jpg'),(3328,'Re:bound','2022-02-07','Role-playing (RPG), Pinball, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','It\'s a mix of genres like roguelike, rpg, pinball, idle games. You need to earn experience defeating monsters to gain level and upgrade points. When you die, you can spend upgrade points to improve your attack, defense and/or health points and try to reach the end of forest again.\n\nYou need only the mouse to (or touch if you are on mobile/tablet device).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w7e.jpg'),(3329,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization IV: Warlords','2006-11-14','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sid Meier\'s Civilization IV: Warlords is the first expansion pack for the award-winning game that has become an instant world-wide hit. Paying homage to some of history\'s greatest military leaders, the expansion delivers six unique and interesting scenarios, giving players the chance to change the course of history with the help of their new powerful \"warlord\" unit. Civ IV: Warlords includes new civilizations, leaders, units, and wonders that offer even more fun and exciting ways for players to expand their civilization\'s military power as they strive for world domination.\n\nGame scenarios: the expansion delivers eight scenarios.\n\nNew civilizations: the pack provides six new civilizations and associated unique units.\nCivilization leaders: 10 new leaders, including leaders for the new civilizations as well as additional leaders for existing civilizations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rjm.jpg'),(3330,'Top Gear Rally 2','2000-02-04','Racing, Sport','Nintendo 64','Top Gear Rally 2 is a racing game for the Nintendo 64. It was released in 2000, and is a sequel to Top Gear Rally.\nThe game\'s objective is the same as the prior version: race through different locations (like farms, jungles, deserts and mountains) with the possibility of changing the climate (clear, rain, and snow). The game will randomly choose whether it is day or night.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47wx.jpg'),(3331,'Sims 4 Multiplayer','2019-06-23','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Sims 4 Multiplayer is a mod for The Sims 4 that allows you to play the game with up to 12 friends in real-time multiplayer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vvj.jpg'),(3332,'Antarctic Adventure','2014-06-19','Platform, Racing, Arcade','ColecoVision, Wii, Family Computer, Wii U, MSX','Antarctic Adventure is a video game developed by Konami in 1983 for MSX, and later for video game consoles, such as NES. The player takes the role of an Antarctic penguin, racing to disparate research stations owned by different countries in Antarctica.\n\nThe gameplay is similar to Sega\'s Turbo, but plays at a much slower pace, and features platform game elements. The penguin, later named Penta, must reach the next station before time runs out while avoiding sea lions and breaks in the ice. Throughout the levels, fish jump out of ice holes and can be caught for bonus points. The game, like many early video games, has no ending – when the player reaches the last station, the game starts from the first level again, but with increased difficulty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68ca.jpg'),(3333,'Dragon Fang Z: The Rose & Dungeon of Time - Extra Dungeon: Friendship\'s Labyrinth','2019-05-06','Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','Now, our friendship is being tested! Let\'s go on the adventure with friends!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3334,'Bloop Reloaded','2015-01-05','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your favourite chemistry potions puzzler is back in Bloop Reloaded and ready to test the brain cells like never before. Make sure you save as much of the potions as possible. How you do it is up to you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1oaj.jpg'),(3335,'Microsoft Golf 2001 Edition','2000-08-24','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take your golfing game to seven different authentically recreated courses. With over a dozen different scoring modes, Zone and LAN multiplayer support, this game has plenty of options for you to play even if you\'ve never laid hands on a golf club before. Full tutorial and quickstart options ease you into the game. Multiple swing methods and customizations keep the game catering to you, not the other way around.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qbo.jpg'),(3336,'Kingdom Days Sim Date','2010-09-05','Point-and-click, Visual Novel','Web browser','Kingdom Days is set in a kingdom neighboring Wonderland and was released on 5th September 2010. It is about a princess named Rose who is forced to flee her kingdom with her elf servant, Lewis, when it is attacked by a neighboring kingdom. They wander through a forest till they see on a castle and knock on its door and meet a king who will not let them stay unless Rose marries him in 30 days.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4nvh.jpg'),(3337,'Snakebird Primer','2019-02-20','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','The snakebirds are back, this time yellowbird joins the team on a more relaxed island with easier puzzles. A casual puzzle game for the entire family as well as a primer for the serious challenges of the original game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41pc.jpg'),(3338,'Fussball Manager 25','2025-03-08','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mod for the FIFA Manager series by EA to get the Manager-Experience with updated squads and other new additions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j11.jpg'),(3339,'Glitch Blaster\'s Waifu','2024-11-29','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to \'Glitch Blaster\'s Waifu,\' the ultimate retro-style shoot \'em up adventure! As an intrepid hacker, you find yourself pitted against a malevolent AI that has kidnapped innocent girls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7v3n.jpg'),(3340,'Star Splash: Shattered Star','2017-02-02','Arcade','Wii U','Swim, jump, dive and dash to save the world with your acrobatic dolphin skills! \nThe celestial Mother Star brought balance to the planet for millennia. But because of an evil creature, it is now shattered into thousands of pieces. A courageous dolphin must find the pieces to reconstitute the Mother Star and defeat evil to prevent world devastation! \n \nIn \"Star Splash: Shattered Star\", you must do all sorts of well timed, precise acrobatics to collect stars in over 30 levels. Swim through the seas, jump high in the air, and dive & dash at high speeds to save the Mother Star or compete with a friend in 2 player mode and see who catches the most stars!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d8v.jpg'),(3341,'Kloinks!','2024-03-08','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Claymation-like Standalone Game for GZDoom','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3342,'Murder Next Room','2024-08-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Murder Next Room is a multiplayer role-playing game. You are trapped in a location with others and one or more of them are killers. The police has been called and in the mean time try to survive. You can try to report the killer but there is no guarantee that the phones will be working.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5r3q.jpg'),(3343,'Ultimate Spider-Man','2005-11-30','Platform','Legacy Mobile Device','Ultimate Spider-Man is a mobile adaptation of the 2005 console game of the same name. It\'s a side-scrolling platform game where the player can choose to play as either Spider-Man or Venom. As Spider-Man the objective is to save the citizens of New York from Venom\'s evil rampage before the population is reduced to less than five. Meanwhile, Venom\'s task is to attack and feed on the citizens before eliminating Spider-Man. Regardless of the character chosen the game contains the same twelve levels with the objectives being the same in all. The gameplay is also similar for both characters with running, jumping and swinging with either web or tentacles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qy8.jpg'),(3344,'You Alone Can Defeat Evil',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You Alone Can Defeat Evil is a gripping and challenging 2D top-down action-adventure game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jil.jpg'),(3345,'Prism','2022-10-01','Adventure','Web browser','Born to a city of wonders beyond your reach, scarcity has always been a close friend. As a courier, the city’s human infrastructure, you scale its roofworks, evade its constables, risk death every day for others’ convenience — until opportunity crosses your path, and you’re allowed to discover what you believe beyond survival.\n\nGiven a scrap of power, how do you reinvent yourself, your relationship to the city, its people? Will it allow you to maintain a companionship based on mutual struggle?\n\nAnd, beneath it all, from where do the canals in this desert flow?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vf7.jpg'),(3346,'Kimagure Strawberry Café','2005-08-04','Simulator, Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','In Kimagure Strawberry Cafe you play as Ichigo Mizuhara (default name) and your luck left you when your parents suddenly decide to have a trip for a whole year. Things couldn\'t get any worse, now you are in charge of a cafe that your parents left you. Well things aren\'t so bad when you have a childhood friend and your cute underclassmen to help you run the cafe. And who say lady luck just left you, when now suddenly you are stranded to manage the cafe with 5 cute guys.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6le0.jpg'),(3347,'Popeye','1982-12-31','Platform, Arcade','ColecoVision, Arcade, Atari 2600, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Intellivision, Atari 5200, Odyssey 2 / Videopac G7000, Texas Instruments TI-99','Popeye (ポパイ Popai) is a 1982 arcade game developed and released by Nintendo based on the Popeye cartoon characters licensed from King Features Syndicate.\n\nThe Family Computer (Famicom) saw an educational sequel on November 22, 1983: Popeye no Eigo Asobi, an English teaching game akin to the later Donkey Kong Jr. Math.\n\nIn Popeye, two players can alternate playing or one player can play alone. The top five highest scores are kept along with the player\'s three initials. Popeye was available in standard and cocktail configurations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pge.jpg'),(3348,'Space Battle Royale','2023-11-16','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Calling all space pilots! Fight your way to the final showdown inside the mysterious Cube, unleashing havoc and leaving only the debris of the rival ships behind. Oh, did you find yourself left among the wreckage? Upgrade your attributes, modify your ship – and get back into the carnage!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bzc.jpg'),(3349,'SGS Glory Recalled','2022-01-13','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Relive the Battle of Hong Kong (8–26 December 1941), one of the first battles of the Pacific War in World War II.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5l1x.jpg'),(3350,'200% Mixed Juice!','2015-10-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','200% Mixed Juice! is the 10th Anniversary game of Orange Juice, an old school RPG featuring a 200% mix of Orange Juice characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21sk.jpg'),(3351,'Stellar Stroll','2023-10-10','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore the cosmos with your furry friend and collect antimatter to open portals to different celestial worlds. Use gravity and momentum to navigate through planets, asteroids, and comets while avoiding black holes and space debris.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6cv0.jpg'),(3352,'Aerena: Clash of Champions','2013-10-18','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','ÆRENA is a challenging, hero-centric combat game teeming with innovative features, revolutionary mechanics and jaw-dropping graphics. In an ever changing battlefield, will YOUR tactics prevail?\n\nTHE ULTIMATE CROSS-PLATFORM ARENA GAME!\nAssemble a team of uniquely skilled gladiators. Lead it to victory in challenging tactical combat and become the Æther Master!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29pq.jpg'),(3353,'Road Fighter','1985-07-11','Racing, Arcade','Arcade, SG-1000, Wii, Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System, MSX','Road Fighter is a car-based arcade game developed by Konami and released in 1984. It also was the first car racing game from Konami. The goal is to reach the finish line within the stages without running out of time, hitting other cars or running out of fuel (fuel is refilled by hitting a special type of car). The game also spawned two sequels in its time, Midnight Run: Road Fighter 2 in 1995 and Winding Heat in 1996, respectively. A Japan-only rebooted sequel was also released in 2010, 14 years after Winding Heat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p30.jpg'),(3354,'Offroad Delivery Service',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A courier and an off-road simulator rolled into one, where you are faced with an arduous task of delivering cargo of various sizes to distant and hard-to-reach places. Get contracts, earn money, upgrade your equipment and SUV.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58j9.jpg'),(3355,'Fancyland','2024-03-27','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After breaking in to an abandoned indoor amusement park, finding clues and solving puzzles, you soon realize that your investigation is not just a search for answers, but a desperate struggle for survival against a sinister force that lurks within.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ump.jpg'),(3356,'Desktop Meadow','2020-04-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Transform your entire computer into a beautiful meadow, complete with birds, flowers, and tiny mail birds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ox9.jpg'),(3357,'Sunseed Island','2025-04-25','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Sunseed Island, a calming farming simulation where you create your own magical paradise. Grow crops, build up your farm, and rebuild your village, while discovering the secrets of the Tree of Life. This cozy experience lets you settle into a slow rhythm, whether you want to explore the sunny island archipelago or simply relax while tending to your land.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qei.jpg'),(3358,'Ertugrul',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Survive the chaos of the medieval era and set out on a mysterious journey to become the hero of the innocent. Live the life like a true Turkish warrior in this semi open-world action adventure game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ncb.jpg'),(3359,'Tax Avoiders','1982-02-01','Sin género','Atari 2600','You are John Q and you want to be rich.\n\nIn this game, you start out on the income screen where you try to collect the money (dollar signs) while avoiding the governmental red tape (look like red snakes). You have only one year to get your money and invest it. Each second, a day goes by. My, how time flies.\n\nOnce a season, you are sent to the investment/tax shelter screen, where you must collect an icon representing an investment and then grab your portfolio (briefcase). Investments have a 50/50 chance of making or losing money. Also on this screen is a character whose color changes.\n\nWhat color he is determines who he is:\nBlack=Eggie, the IRS agent. If he catches you, he will audit you. In these audits, you always lose. You are then taxed at 50% of your income and sent back to the income screen.There are no appeals to tax court.\nPink=Waggie, the CPA. If he catches you (or you go to him), he will charge you $1,000.00 but whatever tax sheltered investment you have, he will put you in a better one.\nGreen=Toodles, the registered investment adviser. If you two meet, he will put you in the best tax sheltered investment available, thus making you the most profit.\n\nAfter each season, you are taxed to an amount determined by your tax shelter. The object is to have $1,000,000.00 at the end of the year after taxes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xyk0br2qayfhi5jfiryv.jpg'),(3360,'Chosen Dice',NULL,'Puzzle, Arcade','Sin plataforma','A Tile-Matching Puzzle Dice Game, only on Playdate.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3361,'Ugly Americans: Apocalypsegeddon','2011-07-03','Shooter, Sport','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','With four-player top-down co-op gameplay that hearkens back to such classics as Gauntlet and Robotron, \"Ugly Americans: Apocalypsegeddon\" features four playable characters, each with their own unique abilities, weapons and strengths. Players must comb the streets of New York City and pacify raving demons, delinquent man birds and zombies by lactating fire or hurling wacky objects like flying demon skulls, fish, baseballs and wrenches.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/etevhyrexvq5zl0bepjc.jpg'),(3362,'Wizavior',NULL,'Platform, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Wizavior is a single-player 3D platform game with rich 2D animations, in which the player visits different planets to save their inhabitants from imminent and unknown destruction.\n\nInspired by arcade games that had several levels and score accumulation, the player will travel across different planets collecting and managing their current resources, being able to secure themselves with lower scores or take risks for higher scores.\n\nIn the Stages, the Player must jump on rotating platforms collecting Crystals and return to a central platform to deposit them, powering up a Spell. The Spell must be kept energized for the duration of the stage, when a Portal is opened to save the aliens on that Planet. The player will visit different planets, each with their own mechanics and peculiar inhabitants.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6p8p.jpg'),(3363,'Conquer Antarctica','2006-02-07','Shooter, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Web browser','A turn-based combat Flash game where 2 penguins must battle other penguins floating on icebergs. Either deplete the opponents\' HP or knock them off their icebergs; the last penguin standing wins! The game is the predecessor to Raft Wars, a 2007 Flash game using the same art style, objects, physics, and sound effects.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ds5.jpg'),(3364,'Pizza Bar Tycoon: Legendary Edition','2025-02-21','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3365,'Train to Hong Kong',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The sudden appearance of zombies has disrupted the normal course of things, now you and your comrades have to get to a bunker in Hong Kong. Can you survive in a world where force decides everything and every choice has consequences?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co947e.jpg'),(3366,'Urban Flow: Full Edition','2025-02-14','Puzzle, Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3367,'Fudêncio e Seus Amigos: Jogo do Miolo-Mole!','2008-12-31','Puzzle','DVD Player, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jogo do Miolo-Mole is a memory game with the main characters of Fudêncio e Seus Amigos which released exclusively through the first season DVD set. It can be played on a computer if you insert the DVD into the disk drive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e0d.jpg'),(3368,'Lumo: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3369,'Sunforge Solar Survival','2024-11-21','Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4','In \"Sunforge Solar Survival,\" you find yourself in a futuristic world of floating islands, harnessing the power of sunlight to thrive. You\'ll have the opportunity to build advanced structures, cultivate food, craft innovative gadgets, and embark on airship journeys to explore distant islands suspended in the sky.\nUse renewable energy sources such as sunlight, wind, and water to power your creations and automate essential processes like resource gathering and irrigation.\n\"Sunforge Solar Survival\" offers a unique blend of survival gameplay, technical innovation, and exploration, making every moment a quest for sustainable living in a beautiful and challenging environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ft6.jpg'),(3370,'Desert Kingdoms 2','2024-11-01','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Desert Kingdoms 2 is a minimal real-time strategy game. Manage resources, develop villages, protect your king and conquer the desert!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ncg.jpg'),(3371,'Mikagura Shoujo Tanteidan','1998-09-17','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 3, PlayStation','Mikagura Shoujo Tanteidan makes use of an inference trigger system in which players have to detect points that need attention or are contradictory during conversations and look for suspicious spots in crime scenes to find out the truth.\nHave fun playing detective with the Mikagura girl detectives today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2god.jpg'),(3372,'Labyrinth of The Demon King','2025-05-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Labyrinth of the Demon King is a challenging first-person dungeon crawler, set against the backdrop of a mythical feudal Japan besieged by demons. As a lone foot soldier, embark on a quest to track down and slay the Demon King who killed your Lord. But will you have the skill, resources and stamina needed to survive through all the horrors this brutal world will throw at you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s5t.jpg'),(3373,'The Butterfly Dreams','2024-09-01','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A visual novel exploring reality, imagination, and the gap between them that we believe to be there.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wo1.jpg'),(3374,'Easter Day Solitaire',NULL,'Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p62.jpg'),(3375,'Paranormal Files: Sacrifice to Shadows - Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p5w.jpg'),(3376,'Karaoke Revolution: Glee','2010-12-09','Music','Wii','You\'ve followed the show from the pilot through every heart-wrenching, awe-inspiring episode as the Gleeks belted out chart-topping hit after chart-topping hit. You\'ve been there with the characters as they\'ve struggled for the chance to perform. Now it\'s your time to shine, and the cast of Glee is going to be right there beside you as prove you have what it takes to call yourself a Gleek.\n\nSing hits from the first season\nJoin the Karaoke Revolution in this special Glee edition that features songs, scenes and characters from the show\'s first season. Rock out in true lead-singer style using a microphone to belt out top hits from the show like \"Don\'t Stop Believin,\'\" \"Defying Gravity,\" \"My Life Would Suck Without You\" and more. Delve deeper into the halls of William McKinley High School as you perform to video montages with exclusive, never-before-seen footage from the show. Prove your chops with long, challenging notes, and perform with Rachel Berry, Finn Hudson, Will Schuester and the rest of the cast as you perfect your vocal harmonies. Take a shot at Shooting Star mode with up to six players, sing a sweet duet with a friend or compete in multiplayer singing games as you prove yourself to be the ultimate Gleek. So pick up that microphone, clear your throat and whatever you do, don\'t stop believin\'.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d6h.jpg'),(3377,'Blazing Beaks','2019-05-10','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Birds with guns are blazing the way out through the piles of mutants, monsters and creepy creatures to stop the invasion. Gathering items and artefacts is essential to survive in this fast-paced colorful roguelite. Lots of mysteries to unravel, secrets to find and levels to explore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cmo.jpg'),(3378,'Burger Truck Trump','2022-12-31','Point-and-click, Simulator','Web browser','Love him or hate him, Donald Trump has been given the boot, but his mission is to return to the white house... by selling burgers! Can you help him restore him to power and get him back behind is beloved Resolute Desk?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hdz.jpg'),(3379,'Tugtics',NULL,'Puzzle, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3380,'Social Status: Life Simulator','2023-12-21','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this online survival life-simulator, you start off in town with no money and no prospects in life. Get an income, a house, interact with other players, save money, buy the things you have always dreamed of. Become a part of the social elite and be remembered as a social legend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co815z.jpg'),(3381,'One Piece: Pirate Warriors 2 - Collector\'s Editon','2013-09-03','Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3','One Piece: Pirate Warriors 2 is the breathtaking sequel of One Piece: Pirate Warriors, a big action/adventure game in which you will take down hordes of Pirates in the beloved world of One Piece. Immerse yourself by playing the “New World”, with your favorite’s characters and their latest techniques and costumes!\n\nThe collector\'s version contains a Luffy figurine made by the renowned Japanese sculptor Keiji Iwakura','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rvu.jpg'),(3382,'Ambroise Niflette & the Gleaned Bell',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this stop-motion inspired adventure, play as detective Ambroise Niflette in the thrilling investigation of the search for the stolen bell in a mysterious village.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93r1.jpg'),(3383,'Arcade Archives: Pinball Action','2025-04-24','Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3384,'Doki Doki Another Round','2022-07-25','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki: Another Round is a mod for Doki Doki Literature Club! that delves even deeper into the characters\' psyches, exploring themes of memory, reality and the continuous cycle of events. The game challenges the player\'s perceptions, introducing a darker and more intriguing atmosphere.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hqz.jpg'),(3385,'Nazo Waku Yakata: Oto no Ma ni Ma ni','2011-08-04','Music, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Nazo Waku Yakata is a 3DS game by Capcom that takes advantage of 3D Sound, or Optophonics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x2e.jpg'),(3386,'Maths Pals','2025-04-17','Puzzle','PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Embark on an exciting math adventure with six lovable animal friends, each a master of their own math skill! From counting and addition to multiplication and division, explore 20 levels per topic, starting with simple visuals like fingers and dice, and working up to complex challenges with numbers up to 25x25. Earn stars for every correct answer, improve your score, and choose your own path to learning success. Visit each pal at their cozy home and let them guide you through fun, interactive quizzes designed to make math magical!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r6y.jpg'),(3387,'Doki Doki Your Bully: Natsuki','2017-12-31','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki: Your Bully – Natsuki is a fan-made mod for Doki Doki Literature Club! that reimagines the relationship between the protagonist and Natsuki, transforming it into a tense and emotional experience centered around bullying, personal struggles, and eventual character growth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fxx.jpg'),(3388,'Super Mega Bob','2015-12-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bob\'s world has been invaded by mechanical demons from the nether! SEND THEM BACK TO WHERE THEY CAME FROM! . . . by shooting at them like a madman, of course!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9joj.jpg'),(3389,'Assau!t','2021-02-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Assau!t is a defense first person rail shooter. Defend yourself against the advancing, enemy charge. Although you have to stop it yourself, you can do it with good handling of the gun. Apply and use a variety of weapons to survive long with your guns from enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co585n.jpg'),(3390,'Keb Up!',NULL,'Sport, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Memo Lee jumped from his bed. He was late for work. The boss was no joke. KEB UP! is a story based parkour game. From Adana City to another...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ktx.jpg'),(3391,'Novena','2018-06-04','Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser','everyone knows the ocean listens to you and grants wishes. one must ask the ocean for nine days.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20at.jpg'),(3392,'Deliricard','2022-01-03','Strategy, Card & Board Game','Web browser','It is a collectible card game. It is a game with simple mechanics, in fact all the cards have 1 to 3 keywords to describe their skills. The game consists of resetting the life points of the opposing characters (Heroes) to earn VPs (Victory Points) with each kill.\nWithin the game there are different types of cards, permanent and temporary.\nThe game is all written in HTML, PHP and JavaScript so it can work on any type of browser.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mgv.jpg'),(3393,'Stick Hunter: Exciting Ice Hockey','1988-01-18','Sport','Family Computer','Stick Hunter: Exciting Ice Hockey is a game for the Famicom released only in Japan in 1987. It was never released in North America. Stick Hunter was the first actual ice hockey game created for a Nintendo gaming system.\n\nThe game was designed so that 1 player could play against the computer, or 2 players could play simultaneously against each other. The length of the periods and difficulty level could both be adjusted.\n\nPlaying as a character who has possession of the puck, the character could not only skate faster, but could only shoot the puck forward. So if the player wanted to pass to a teammate, the character on screen would have to be facing the person to which he\'s passing. The same applied to shooting at the net and attempting to score a goal. The character would have to be facing the opposing net. A player without the puck could only skate faster. If the goalie had control of the puck, he could only pass to a teammate.\n\nAs in the real-world sport of hockey, the object is to score more goals than the opposing team.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/kfwkbjqlm2y8d2kep2ek.jpg'),(3394,'Blue Protocol','2024-08-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Blue Protocol is set in a world spun by “overwhelming graphics along the lines of anime movies” and incorporates multiplayer action that utilizes the qualities of an online game. It runs on Unreal Engine 4.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vac.jpg'),(3395,'Virtual Rides 3: Astronaut',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7a2h.jpg'),(3396,'Soukoku no Kusabi Hiiro no Kakera 3 Portable','2010-04-15','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','A port of Soukoku no Kusabi Hiiro no Kakera 3 for PSP.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54ye.jpg'),(3397,'Echo','2022-06-14','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What if you had a clone who repeats everything you do? And what if you had to destroy it? This is precisely what this game is about.\n\nIn echo, the player has a clone, who mirrors your every move. Just like a mirror reflection. Your goal is to figure out how to destroy that clone. You solve puzzles by figuring out how to use the environment and items to correctly sync the player\'s and clone\'s movements. Only then can you destroy the clone. You have to be careful though. The wrong move can lead to you destroying yourself instead of the clone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gly.jpg'),(3398,'Gomiboru','2025-02-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Gomiboru is an arcade-puzzle game set in Stampland, a decaying amusement park. Guide a strange sticky ball as it collects the trash scattered throughout the environments, solving physics puzzles and facing absurd obstacles. Unravel the mystery behind the chaos in a dark and surreal world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9haw.jpg'),(3399,'Speed',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3400,'MechWarrior 5: Mercenaries - Dropship Collection',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d4p.jpg'),(3401,'Game Builder Tycoon','2024-09-30','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In Game Builder Tycoon, begin as an indie game developer. Personalize your character, craft hit games, manage marketing, research stuff and manage a skilled team. Overcome competition to guide your game development studio to global recognition and dominate the gaming industry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8v00.jpg'),(3402,'Doki Doki Sayori Date!','2018-02-12','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki: Sayori Date! is a wholesome and heartwarming fan-made mod for Doki Doki Literature Club! that gives players the chance to go on a full-fledged romantic date with Sayori. Unlike the psychological horror elements of the original game, this mod focuses on lighthearted romance, fun interactions, and deepening your bond with Sayori in a meaningful way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fy0.jpg'),(3403,'Doki Doki Sweet Dreams','2017-03-01','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki: Sweet Dreams is a heartwarming yet bittersweet Doki Doki Literature Club! mod that explores themes of comfort, nostalgia, and second chances. Unlike the original game’s unsettling twists, this mod focuses on an emotional journey where the protagonist experiences a dreamlike world where they can reconnect with the Literature Club members in a way that feels both peaceful and surreal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fy5.jpg'),(3404,'Mars Odyssey','2019-12-10','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), Oculus Rift','Mars Odyssey is a single player VR simulator experience. Land on the red planet. Walk the surface of Mars in your living room and interact with full-scale, realistic NASA Landers and Rovers. Learn about the Red Planet, its history, and its geography in this interactive experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2c6m.jpg'),(3405,'Guilty Gear: Strive - Season 3 Character Additional Colors','2023-08-24','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','An additional color pack including 6 colors for the 4 additional characters of GGST Season 3 (total of 24 colors).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co713k.jpg'),(3406,'Brothers in Arms: Hell\'s Highway','2008-10-08','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Brothers in Arms Hell\'s Highway brings the critically acclaimed squad-based WWII shooter into the next generation of gaming with amazing graphics and sound, new cutting-edge gameplay features and a totally redesigned online component.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28fa.jpg'),(3407,'Project After: Shadow Theory',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Side-scroller beat am map','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sy1.jpg'),(3408,'Penny Arcade\'s On the Rain-Slick Precipice of Darkness 3','2012-07-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox 360','The Startling Developments Detective Agency springs into action as On the Rain-Slick Precipice of Darkness 3 begins, set in motion by a call from a mysterious source. The ever escalating perils on the Rain-Slick Precipice of Darkness will season our tender heroes to their very core! Expect cunning evil doctors, a series of unexplainable thefts, a mysterious book of power, enigmatic supernatural forces, hoboids, roboids, time travelling dinosaurs, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rio.jpg'),(3409,'36 Fragments of Midnight','2017-08-07','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation Vita, New Nintendo 3DS, Nintendo Switch','In this procedurally generated platform game, you have to collect all the Star Fragments of Midnight\'s friends to get of their greatest gift.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22jt.jpg'),(3410,'Star Wars: Heritage Pack','2022-04-28','Racing, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Five great classic STAR WARS games','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ynw.jpg'),(3411,'Bakatonosama Mahjong Manyuki','1991-02-01','Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Neo Geo AES, Neo Geo MVS','The third Japanese mahjong game released on Neo Geo hardware is based on a comedic variety show set in feudal Japan. It is the only game in the Neo Geo library to have explicit nudity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rvtodssqpcous53m8rij.jpg'),(3412,'Devil World','1984-10-05','Puzzle, Arcade','Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Family Computer, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System','Devil World is a maze video game developed and published by Nintendo for the Nintendo Entertainment System. It was released in Japan on October 5, 1984 and in Europe on July 15, 1987. The game was also released on the Wii\'s Virtual Console in Japan on January 22, 2008 and in Europe and Australia on October 31, 2008. The game has similar gameplay to that of Pac-Man. It is the only game designed by Shigeru Miyamoto that has not been released in North America, despite the fact that the game is simple and in English. This was due to Nintendo of America\'s strict policies on the use of religious icons in games, which were at their strictest level at the time of the game\'s original release, but there would eventually be a North American release for the first time in October 2023 as part of the Nintendo Switch Online lineup.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nuo.jpg'),(3413,'Dragon Girl','1989-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','DOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9afn.jpg'),(3414,'Digimon Masters Online','2016-11-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Digimon Masters is the latest MMO featuring the ever-popular Digimon franchise. This long awaited game will feature a deeper RPG experience, enhanced graphics and adrenaline-pumping real-time combat. Both new and long-time Digimon fans can now immerse themselves into this new epic adventure with their very own Digimons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1o43.jpg'),(3415,'Jumping Jazz Cats',NULL,'Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play, race and hang with your feline friends in this online platformer party game! Purrfect your pussycat parkour as you sprint, jump, bounce, swing, skid and slide through a collection of collaborative and competitive mini-games set in a grandiose cartoon mansion. Get jumpin\', jazz cats!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98yo.jpg'),(3416,'Doki Doki Space','2021-10-31','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki: Space is a mod for Doki Doki Literature Club! that offers a narrative experience focused on the character Sayori, exploring themes of hope, distance and the search for comfort in the midst of adversity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hr0.jpg'),(3417,'Eggggg','2016-10-20','Platform, Indie','Android, iOS','Egggg is a classic platformer for mobile units, but with a twist: You can vomit. The main character is a boy allergic towards eggs, and you must get through a lot of challenging levels without getting into contact with eggs, chickens or mean auntie Doris.\n\nAll the games mechanics is based on the character throwing up, and the vomit has unique abilities based on what you eat. For example, you can make the ground icy in order to move faster, sticky in order to climb walls, hot in order to spit flames, make puddles you can swim over, and a lot more.\n\nThe game is a tie-in with the feature film under production by Maipo Film, and both the movie and the game based on the book Eggg by Stein Erik Lunde, will launch fall 2016.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ribeuvsu7asvm2h3kuay.jpg'),(3418,'Brutal Fate',NULL,'Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Brutal Fate is a fast-paced ultra-violent retro first-person shooter inspired by 80\'s and 90\'s sci-fi movies. As a marine from the Global Order Alliance sent to Callisto to take over the local corporate government, you find yourself surrounded by legions of demonic alien invaders and you must fight for your survival.\nIt blends the best features of classic shooters such as non-linear level design, a huge arsenal and large enemy variety with some modern aspects, making it a unique mix that does not try to hang on nostalgia, but be something of it\'s own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m99.jpg'),(3419,'Neko Candy Shop','2021-09-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Relaxing puzzle game with adorable neko girls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j60.jpg'),(3420,'Naruto Shippuden 3D: The New Era','2011-03-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Naruto Shippuden 3D: The New Era is an action/brawler for the Nintendo 3DS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gdj.jpg'),(3421,'Bow to Blood: Last Captain Standing','2019-04-03','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Bow to Blood: Last Captain Standing is a single-player action-strategy roguelike in which you’ll oversee a flying airship in a multi-stage competition being broadcast as a deadly reality TV show. You’ll have to use keep your wits about you, as you manage your ragtag crew to keep your vessel afloat, fend off incoming attackers, gather resources, and search for treasure. Like any good reality show, forging temporary alliances is the name of the game, as players team up with NPCs to conspire against the most dominant threats. Just be aware that there’s little honor among sky pirates and only one captain will be crowned victorious.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1k4v.jpg'),(3422,'Tumbleweed Express','2016-05-31','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Trains with guns on them in the Wild West! Shoot, upgrade, customize, and mount up to defeat brutal outlaws and ruthless businessmen! Tumbleweed Express is a tower, or travel, defense game set in the American West.\n\nThe year is 1885, the height of the Age of Steam in the United States of America. But something is not quite right in the land of destiny and the free market: Dirigibaus, a ruthless entrepreneur, has monopolized trade in the West with a fleet of airships! Dirigibles and zeppelins dot the skies as agents of an oppressive business regime.\n\nSomeone still fights for the little people, though. The venerable Tumbleweed Express Steam Engine, long-thought to be obsolete and scrapped, is set to saddle up and ride again. The Tumbleweed is about to spearhead a logistics campaign meant to compete with the Dirigibaus, bringing support to those who have been downtrodden and forgotten. Dirigibaus doesn\'t take kindly to competition, however, so the Tumbleweed has armed herself for war...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rgt.jpg'),(3423,'Founders\' Fortune','2019-07-19','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Founders’ Fortune is a colony simulator that draws a lot of inspiration from the Sims: It incorporates a lot of creative building and puts a heavy focus on the colonists themselves, simulating thoughts, wishes, expectations, and traits. \n \nThese psychological components have a tremendous influence on the game: Migrants will only consider your colony if you can fulfill the expectations of your inhabitants. Your colonists think of a lot of wishes and you need to fulfill at least some of them to keep them happy and productive. \n \nLike other colony games, there are resources to gather, technologies to unlock, and dangers to survive. Colonists get experienced in their professions unlocking new and faster ways to do their jobs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pu5.jpg'),(3424,'Virtual Rides 3: Roundtrip',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7a2c.jpg'),(3425,'Townseek','2025-12-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Townseek is a relaxing exploration-trading game where you embark on a journey across the world of Explora and discover the lost legacy of Sir Reginald Sharkingston! Discover exotic landmarks, trade with faraway towns, fish, mine, and farm as you complete your journal and make a name for yourself!\n\nThe whole world is your sea now, so be sure to see all that it has to offer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65f9.jpg'),(3426,'Kewtia: Crystallite Hunt',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kewtia: Crystallite Hunt is a 3D platformer collectathon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/u6jbzknz5kkwq3nvphto.jpg'),(3427,'Mudlarks','2014-04-10','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A mysterious point and click adventure... a tale of friendship, the supernatural and unraveled secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xki.jpg'),(3428,'Tennis','1984-01-14','Sport','Family Computer Disk System, Arcade, PC-8800 Series, Sharp X1, Wii, Family Computer, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System','Tennis is a sports game developed and released by Nintendo for the NES. In North America and Europe, Tennis was one of 18 launch games for the NES. A Game Boy version was also released.\n\nThe game features single-player and two-player modes for singles and doubles matches, with either competitive or cooperative gameplay. A computerized opponent\'s artificial intelligence can be set to one of five difficulty levels. Mario referees the matches.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42vk.jpg'),(3429,'Irori',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','As the aroma of savoury skewers wafts outside, hungry passengers rest their weary souls at the hearth. You are the chef on the cross-lands train, in charge of the irori cabin. Cook up a variety of skewers to warm bellies and hearts as you cross paths with travellers on their own journeys.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7duh.jpg'),(3430,'Game with Friends',NULL,'Simulator, Arcade, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a virtual hangout game that aims to bring you together with your friends and have a good time. This platform promises to give you unforgettable moments by combining the fun competition of board games, the excitement of arcade-style racing and the different experiences offered by various games and entertainment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85ex.jpg'),(3431,'Mortal Kombat 11: Premium Edition','2019-04-23','Fighting','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Mortal Kombat 11 is the latest installment in the critically acclaimed franchise, providing a deeper and more personalized experience than ever before.\n\nThe Mortal Kombat 11 Premium Edition includes:\n• Main Game\n• Kombat Pack\n\nThe Kombat Pack includes:\n• 6 new DLC playable characters, released over time\n• 7 exclusive Character Skins\n• 7 exclusive sets of gear\n\nThe physical Premium Edition had a steelbook case and came with a download code for the Kombat Pack.\nThis edition was removed from purchase on digital stores after the announcement of the Aftermath expansion.\nA new edition, Mortal Kombat 11: Aftermath Kollection, and bundle, Mortal Kombat 11: Aftermath + Kombat Pack, seem to be the direct replacements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kkj.jpg'),(3432,'Crazy Machines 1.5','2008-12-12','Puzzle, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Create Your Own Zany \"Rube Goldberg\" Devices! Go crazy with over 200 brand new gizmo-twistin\' levels! Enjoy all-new elements, music, backgrounds and more. Start off in the Inventor\'s Training Camp to sharpen your skills.                    \n					Get ready for explosive action and building fun using 100 awesome & wacky parts  including bottle rockets, cannons, bombs, and robots.                    \n					The Ultimate Brain-Teazing Puzzle Game! Continuing the fun, but not including puzzles from Crazy Machines: The Wacky Contraptions Game.                    \n					Key Features:					All-new levels!                    \n					Brand new elements                    \n					Fun for the whole family','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3433,'The Alters','2025-06-13','Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','To survive on a lonely planet, Jan creates alternate versions of himself - the alters. Each alter’s personality is shaped by Jan’s various life paths. The Alters begs a simple question surrounding life-changing moments and the decisions people make: What if…?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ype.jpg'),(3434,'The Mega FMV Bundle','2023-04-03','Sin género','Xbox One','Wales Interactive is proud to offer the Mega bundle for their very best FMV games! Featuring The Complex, Late Shift, The Bunker, The Shapeshifting Detective, The Infectious Madness of Doctor Dekker, Five Dates, Who Pressed Mute on Uncle Marcus, Bloodshore, Night Book and I Saw Black Clouds in one bundle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e25.jpg'),(3435,'Crescent Quest','2023-08-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crescent Quest is a mostly medieval turn based open world RPG that is inspired by old 2000s MMO designs while being a single player experience. Increase your skills, go on unique quests, grind for and collect rare items, be a part of the constantly changing world of Reltionus!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jj2.jpg'),(3436,'Bowlbo: The Quest for Bing Bing',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A sinister Witch has kidnapped your beloved Bing Bing. You must travel the sweeping lands of Cósta Cré and do what it takes to get your poochingus back from the Nightmare Realm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3miq.jpg'),(3437,'Juiced 2: Hot Import Nights','2007-10-26','Racing','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Juiced 2: Hot Import Nights is a racing video game for various platforms. The PlayStation 2, Xbox 360 and Nintendo DS versions were released on September 17, 2007. The PlayStation Portable version was released on October 8, 2007. The PlayStation 3 version was released on October 22, 2007. The Microsoft Windows version was released on November 16, 2007. It is a sequel to the 2005 game Juiced. It was developed by Juice Games and published by THQ. It utilizes more advanced car modification methods in comparison to its predecessor.\n\nA demo for the Xbox 360 version was released on Xbox Live Marketplace on July 19, 2007. A second, multiplayer demo appeared on September 14, 2007. Ursula Mayes is on the cover of the game on all platforms. A Wii version was planned but it was cancelled.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ow2.jpg'),(3438,'Aeolis Tournament','2020-07-23','Sport, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Use the power of the wind to compete in the various games of the Storm Championship in this charmingly chaotic 8-player action party game. Aeolis Tournament features physics-based gameplay, a tournament mode and local and online multiplayer play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29rm.jpg'),(3439,'Beat Heaven Symphony','2025-04-19','Music','PlayStation 4','In Beat Heaven Symphony, rhythm isn’t just heard — it’s felt.\nWith 20 unique tracks, every beat is a challenge, every note a step in your musical journey.\nFrom Easy to Expert, test your timing and let your fingers dance.\nHit the right keys at the right moment and become the master of rhythm.\nThe music is rising... the stage is yours, the tempo is with you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pna.jpg'),(3440,'Small Worlds','2009-12-31','Platform','Web browser','A short atmospheric game about exploring.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4reg.jpg'),(3441,'Birth','2023-02-17','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Birth is a pleasantly creepy point-and-click puzzle game about living alone in a large city and constructing a creature to keep you company out of spare bones and organs you find lying around. Explore libraries, post offices, museums, cafes, and apartments that don\'t belong to you, solving observational puzzles hidden in personal belongings and scenery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4um5.jpg'),(3442,'Paper Plane',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9sgm.jpg'),(3443,'Parasite Inside','2024-03-07','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this Sci-Fi Horror game, our protagonist, Oni Lim, awakens aboard a colonization spaceship. However, as she awake from her slumber, she quickly realizes that all other crew members remain in cryogenic stasis, and critical ship systems are malfunctioning. Determined to uncover the source of the problem, Oni embarks on a perilous journey through the labyrinthine corridors of the ship. What she discovers amidst the flickering lights and ominous shadows is nothing short of shocking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mhx.jpg'),(3444,'MiniTank: Desert Strike',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','This is a twin-stick shooter in the style of The Binding of Isaac. A MiniTank, was sent on a mission to destroy an Enemy Base producing zombies was found in the Desert and Arctic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kz0.jpg'),(3445,'Wii Fit','2007-12-01','Simulator, Sport','Wii','Wii Fit is an exercise game consisting of activities using the Wii Balance Board peripheral.\nThe game uses a unique platform peripheral called the Wii Balance Board, on which the player stands during exercise. The game features yoga, strength training, aerobics, and balance games. Wii Fit has been used for physiotherapy rehabilitation and has been adopted by various health clubs around the world. Additionally, the game has been used in nursing homes to improve posture in the elderly. The game has received generally positive reviews, despite criticism over the lack of intensity in some of its workout activities\n\nAs of March 2012, Wii Fit has held the position of third best selling console game not packaged with a console, with 22.67 million copies sold.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86ml.jpg'),(3446,'Conan Exiles: Blood and Sand Pack',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Sin plataforma','With the Blood and Sand Pack you can crush your enemies wearing all new armor sets and wielding fearsome weapons while fighting in new vaulted tunnels and arenas.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3447,'Universe Surfing','2019-02-14','Sin género','iOS','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3448,'Traffic Department 2192','1994-04-30','Shooter','DOS','Traffic Department 2192 is a top down shooter game in which the player pilots a futuristic \"hoverskid\" about a war-torn city. The game emphasizes story, with cutscenes before each mission following the arc of troubled pilot Lt. Velasquez. There are three episodes containing twenty missions each, with varied mission objectives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mkiaehkcsu8oqwth4bsc.jpg'),(3449,'Ayakashi: Romance Reborn','2018-10-30','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Stand and fight for a love 1,000 years in the making.\n\nYour once peaceful life is turned upside down when a mystic wand awakens your latent powers as an Onmyouji Diviner.\n\nAyakashi spirits, drawn to you by this newfound strength, have startling news for you: the Capital is under attack from evil creatures known as Wraiths.\n\nOnly you and your Ayakashi Spirit comrades have the power to save the city and end the Wraith scourge!\n\nStrengthen your bonds, protect those you love, and discover the secrets that bind you all together...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c0z.jpg'),(3450,'Wanted 3D: Dead or Alive',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Grab your bandolier and saddle up for Wanted 3D, a GZDoom-powered Spaghetti Western FPS! It\'s time to settle the score with your former gang and reclaim what is rightfully yours. Are you ready for the wildest showdown the Wild West has to offer?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jl8.jpg'),(3451,'Volara','2024-12-19','Sin género','Meta Quest 2','A flight adventure game where you soar through amazing worlds just by moving your hand. Explore beautiful environments, earn badges, discover secrets, overcome challenging boss fights and become a top pilot.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3452,'Goat Simulator MMO Simulator','2014-11-20','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Coffee Stain Studios brings next-gen Goat MMO simulation to mobile devices. You no longer have to fantasize about being a simulated goat in a simulated MMO, your dreams have finally come true!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/avesvvfkwni0bgttegsg.jpg'),(3453,'Dance! Dance! Dance!','2024-09-19','Music','Meta Quest 2','Follow a dance instructor\'s moves in virtual reality, and do battle by popping bubbles.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3454,'Bukkaku',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The indie game is of experimental genre with mostly horror elements. Bit of survival with sci-fi and RPG elements. A story between life and death in a stylized game origami world. Bukkaku created by Lukas Reznicek aka RZE.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gzi.jpg'),(3455,'Catch the Rhythm','2024-05-23','Music','Meta Quest 2','Play as a cheerleader in this VR-only rhythm game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3456,'Doki Doki Zero Bitches Plan','2022-02-17','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki: Zero Bitches Plan is a hilarious and satirical mod for Doki Doki Literature Club! that puts the player in the role of a protagonist (MC) desperate to finally get a girlfriend. Inspired by the famous “Zero Bitches?” meme, the mod plays on the MC\'s lack of charm and social skills, turning his romantic journey into a sequence of comical failures and disastrous attempts to win over the girls in the club.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hr6.jpg'),(3457,'Rock \'N Racing Bundle 3 in 1','2021-04-16','Racing, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Get ready to enjoy Off Road races with your friends and family!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ar6.jpg'),(3458,'Metacity Patrol','2023-08-25','Sin género','Meta Quest 2','As a new recruit in Metacity Law Enforcement, free fly in your air car around the miles of sky above the city. Fight a crime wave of illegally modified synthetics, respond to HQ calls in real-time, collect evidence, interrogate suspects, uncover a criminal underworld, and liberate Metacity.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3459,'Spanky Attourney Ch.1','2024-03-19','Puzzle, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a parody game of Ace Attourney by Capcom\n\nFollow the path of a rookie lawyer, Winchester, and unravel the truth of a ( really small ) case, however if you fail, the punishment waiting for your client would be cruel and unforgiving.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90tb.jpg'),(3460,'The Great Yokai of the Haunted Halls','2025-01-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You and your childhood friend Yua were supposed to just pick up a book from the decrepit building, but when a sudden twist of fate sends the two of you stumbling into a hidden realm teeming with spirits and yokai, it\'ll be up to you to find a way out! In this eerie supernatural dimension, you meet Izuna, who claims to be a great yokai with a fondness for humans. Can you escape this otherworldly realm, with the help of Izuna and the Kosaka sisters\' spiritual powers?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dx8.jpg'),(3461,'California Speed','1999-02-28','Racing','Arcade, Nintendo 64','California Speed features racing through California, with a range of different and unique tracks based on the real life maps of the US state, with short-cuts and branching elements adding elements of strategy when racing to the finish line.The car pool includes the usual collection of fast cars, as well as F1 racers and golf-carts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co294q.jpg'),(3462,'Farm Tribe 2','2016-09-22','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Annie build a farm and prepare for her wedding!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3463,'Whispers in the Dark','2021-08-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Whispers in the Dark is a mystical horror game in which you have to find yourself face to face with impenetrable darkness and what it keeps in itself. The nightmares of the past will come to life and will try with all their might to destroy you. Fear the whispers in the dark!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pgq.jpg'),(3464,'Botsu',NULL,'Fighting, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight your friends in hilarious sandbox sports: Boxball, Sumo Survival, and Stockpile. Wrestle your way to victory online or split-screen in unique matches. Unlock outrageous outfits and pull off awesome moves to flex your skills!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nrd.jpg'),(3465,'Save Daddy Trump 3: Rise of Evil','2022-09-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','after many years the peace has been disturbed in Peaceland. New army has captured Daddy Trump again. Now Kiki Trump is more powerful than ever and need meet new very powerful enemy and his army to save daddy Trump again in this low poly RPG game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kpt.jpg'),(3466,'Warau Warawau','2011-02-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warau Warawau (Laughing Warawau) is a freeware story-heavy adventure/RPG made in RPG Maker 2000.\n\nWarau Warawau is a spin-off game in the Towelket series, mixing characters and stories from the mainline series with popular fiction, most noticeably Lewis Carroll\'s Alice in Wonderland. There is some turn-based combat like in the mainline series and the game takes you to many exotic, surreal and sometimes disturbing places. Warau Warawau became a cult hit and is still popular among Japanese fans.\n\nThis is the first game to not use a mix of public domain music (classic, jazz, ragtime etc.), but instead it features the free music by Hirokazu Akiyama, whose music was also used in other RPG Maker games/series like Alicemare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7klz.jpg'),(3467,'Project Wormhole',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Project Wormhole was a game exclusively available to PlayStation Underground subscribers, and was a result of an 18 month long interactive development process that taught the basic process of game design.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ikjrqkpaso1pqgjrcue1.jpg'),(3468,'Limbus',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You continue to wander through an endless looping corridor beside the abyss. Is there a way out... Is there salvation...? You walk on without understanding anything. All you can do is choose the right path. Will there ever be an end to this nightmarish journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kdq.jpg'),(3469,'Necromance-chan',NULL,'Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38zn.jpg'),(3470,'Madoro-Mu','2010-06-09','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Madoro-Mu is a traditional Yume Nikki fangame. It stars Isokishi who, unlike most fangames, uses her bed to save and exits her room directly to the Nexus. Rather than having a nexus full of doors, Isokishi\'s nexus consists of three windows. One is nailed shut until later in the game. There is little to no sound in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rfr.jpg'),(3471,'Hollow Hometown','2025-04-11','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When your father calls you frightened, telling you that strange things are happening in your hometown, you decide to return to investigate.\n\nPeople are no longer themselves. They fade away. They behave strangely: blank stares, icy smiles, emotionless voices.\n\nAnd when your father also disappears, you realize you have no choice. You have to act.\n\nSomething is happening.\n\nAnd you may be the only one really ready to deal with it.\n\nOr die in the attempt.\n\nThe alien invasion on Italian soil is something no one expected. But you can still do something about it!\n\nThis game was made for the \"SPAGHETTI INVASION GAME JAM 2025\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nsp.jpg'),(3472,'Super Mario Flash','2007-12-31','Platform','Web browser','Super Mario Flash (also known and abbreviated as SMF1) is the first of two online games developed by Pouetpu and released on pouetpu.pbworks.com before the creation of Pouetpu-games site. Super Mario Flash is entirely based off of the Nintendo game \"Super Mario Bros.\", and also combines several features of different games such \"Super Mario Bros. 3\".\n\nThe main feature of this game is that includes a level editor so the players could make their own levels and share it on the forum/site so other players could test them and rate them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49ut.jpg'),(3473,'Hypercharge: Unboxed','2020-01-30','Shooter, Platform, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Grab a friend and protect the Hypercore. Hypercharge is a solo and co-op wave-based first/third-person shooter with a small twist: you\'re an action figure! Explore. Defend. Survive.\n\nIf you grew up watching classic toy movies and played with action figures, get ready for mass nostalgia! Fight waves of weaponised toys in fun, light-hearted battles where each wave gets tougher and tougher. Hypercharge is easy to jump in and out of, allowing you to progress at your own pace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5c1l.jpg'),(3474,'Metropolis','1989-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC, MSX','Metropolis is a game inspired by Capcom\'s Trojan, offering a unique twist on beat \'em ups. Players must defeat enemies using only a sword and shield. Set in a post-nuclear disaster city governed by the law of the strongest, players control Geitor, tasked with restoring peace. By leading a revolt and eliminating five nuclear tanks held by the city\'s evildoers, Geitor aims to establish peace in Metropolis. Opposition comes from three factions: The Warriors of Death, The Dartfire mutants, and The Girlkiller gang.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5008.jpg'),(3475,'Age of Empires: Castle Siege','2017-04-06','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Age of Empires: Castle Siege invites you to guide your empire through the Medieval Era on your Windows PC or touch screen device. Choose from one of several civilizations, including the Britons, Teutons, and Kievan Rus. Upgrade your keep, fortify your walls, and garrison defensive troops to protect yourself from marauders. Then, train an army to raid other cities, and command them in battle to dismantle your opponents’ defenses.\n\nAge of Empires: Castle Siege was a free-to-play medieval massively multiplayer online tower defense game in the form of a Windows app, designed for Windows 8.1 and Windows Phone. Released in 2014, the app featured micro-transactions to aid in rapid development of a castle and to improve defensive and attacking capabilities. It was developed by Smoking Gun Interactive and Microsoft Studios, and was formally announced on August 26, 2014. Unlike any preceding Age of Empires game, Castle Siege takes the form of a tower defense game. Castle Siege was made available on iOS in 2015 and Android in 2017.\n\nOn November 13, 2018, Microsoft Studios announced that it would close the game on May 13, 2019, and since then, it is presently not working.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xy2.jpg'),(3476,'Yuukyuu Gensoukyoku 3: Perpetual Blue','1999-12-22','Adventure, Visual Novel','Dreamcast','Yukyu Gensokyoku 3: Perpetual Blue is a Strategy game, developed by Starlight Marry and published by MediaWorks, which was released in Japan in 1999.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xxd.jpg'),(3477,'Never Ending Beyond','2025-06-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The only roguelite where you must pet animals to survive. Each animal comes with its own unique weapons and passive abilities. Pet animals, mixing and matching abilities to create unique skill builds and conquer the Beyond.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vnn.jpg'),(3478,'Empty.','2016-12-19','Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Everything must go. \n \nA simple zen-like puzzle that has no clock and no score. \n \nClear the room of all the objects by rotating it. If an object is not visible, it\'s not there anymore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28p9.jpg'),(3479,'JESUS: Kyoufu no Bio Monster','1989-03-17','Puzzle, Quiz/Trivia, Adventure, Visual Novel','Family Computer','JESUS: Kyoufu no Bio Monster is a port of the popular computer game Jesus for Famicom.\n\nSome changes were made to the story development and dialogue (for example, the partner you act with in the latter half of the story can be chosen in the PC version, but in the Famicom version it is fixed to Elline), and some adult-oriented graphics and scenes were changed or removed due to the age group of Famicom users.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co633h.jpg'),(3480,'Dominant Species','1998-10-15','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter the bizarre and alien world of Dominant Species- the next generation command and control real time strategy game with fully 3-D creatures and terrain. You are a powerful alien intelligence engaged in constant and deadly conflict with other hives over the possession of Anima, the precious substance that sustains you and your fellow aliens. However, unwelcome humans have arrived on your planet and threaten to upset the balance of conflict between hives that has raged for countless millennia. Attempting to take the priceless Anima and use it to create immortality, humans join an epic battle of survival of the fittest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22n5.jpg'),(3481,'Horse Farm','2020-01-29','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Create the ranch of your dreams, with cute horses, diverse buildings, amazing features and captivating quests. Download Horse Farm now and take care of your horses!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y5k.jpg'),(3482,'Emberward','2024-06-25','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Emberward is a unique tower defense game that focuses on maze building and interesting tower mechanics. Construct mazes with blocks of different shapes and set up defense towers on them to withstand the onslaught of monsters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7css.jpg'),(3483,'Super1337',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super1337 is an intense 3rd person hack-n-slash wave based survival game with time dilation mechanics made in Unreal Engine. With both Melee and Ranged based characters, persevere against increasingly difficult odds by utilizing different move sets and combos in bullet-time combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68ar.jpg'),(3484,'Shelldom','2025-02-25','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Shelldom, snails worship alcohol—a drink they love but one that kills them. Their cults sacrifice their own for more, trapped in a doomed cycle. But legend speaks of the Holy Water, hidden atop a merciless tower. Can you climb, endure, and break the curse? Or will you fall like the rest?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d5u.jpg'),(3485,'Global Conflagration',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Global Conflagration is an RTS game with a modern near futuristic setting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ner.jpg'),(3486,'Exo Wanderers','2024-11-21','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a sci-fi top-down tank shooting game that can be played solo or with two players. As human civilization is on the brink of extinction, you will take on the role of one or two \"Exo Wanderers,\" seeking the truth of the Galactic and Earth civilizations on Gliese 667Ce.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pm5.jpg'),(3487,'Ironhive',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ironhive is a deckbuilding strategy game about surviving in a dying world. Build your colony, ensure the survival of your people, create a legacy that will be passed on to the next generations. As the Ironlord, you are their only remaining hope.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r45.jpg'),(3488,'Sonic and the Dragon\'s Path',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','An upcoming Sonic fangame based on the Storybook series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iad.jpg'),(3489,'Victor e o Jacaré','1994-12-31','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Victor e o Jacaré, you\'ll meet a boy who gets a real alligator as a present. Through drawings and puzzles, you\'ll read the story of the beautiful and delicate friendship that grows between the two.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xm2.jpg'),(3490,'SimuSex','1992-12-31','Simulator','DOS','SimuSex 1.0 is a simplistic sex simulator for DOS made by Erosoft.\n\nThe few novelties of SimuSex are fluid animation, the fact that it was one of the first virtual girl-programs with more than still graphics and text descriptions, and that it was extremely widespread in many BBSs in the 90s.\n\nA copy of SimuSex 2.0 is promised when registering the game. The developers promise MPEG1 SVGA quality digitized video on software, interactive 3D models with toys, digitized sound effects, sort of a mood AI for the girls and a range of other ahead of their time features. The 2.0 version never realized into a real product.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6byy.jpg'),(3491,'Rocking Pilot','2017-05-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Shoot, blast and slash through hordes of enemies in Rocking Pilot - a twin-stick shooter extravaganza inspired by arcade classics.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3492,'Orbit HD','2015-03-18','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Explore the cosmos as a comet, orbiting planets with a realistic gravity system and a backdrop of procedurally generated nebulae. Learn to use planetary gravity to your advantage, and relax in the ambience of space.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s2t.jpg'),(3493,'Super Phantom Cat','2019-03-07','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','A retro-casual platformer game! No matter who you are! Get your cat ears ready, BRING IT ON! Set off on the crazy journey to rescue your sister!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sd2.jpg'),(3494,'Puzzle Fever','2021-09-09','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Puzzle fever - Endless game for puzzle lovers! Place figures on the playing field to fill in lines and get coins and points for successful combinations, use bonuses in difficult situations and conquer point records!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5og8.jpg'),(3495,'Infantry Online',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Infantry Online is a Massively Multiplayer Online (MMO) and is often referred to as the world\'s first 2D isometric shooter.\n\nThe game pits you against hundreds of other online players in whats often an all out frenetic combat lasting hours, whether you\'re defending a base from the opposite, fighting zombies to save man kind or playing a supportive role in many of the zones available.\n\nYou can feel the rush of adrenaline when you and hundreds of other plays clash on the battlefield. Go it alone or form-up into battalions. Tactics and skill determine the victor!\n\nInvade an enemy\'s heavily fortified base with a well-organized group of teammates for final victory after hours of battle in a game of CTF. Get behind the controls of a heavily armed tank while a buddy mans the turret in a Skirmish battle. Assist in scoring a goal after narrowly avoiding death from the opposing team in a match of GravBall. Unload dozens of rounds into a group of enemies to save a teammate in Team Deathmatch. These are some of the intense experiences to be had in Infantry. Infantry hosts a wide variety of games with heart pounding action and addictive amounts of depth. Hundreds of players can compete on a single battlefield, working together to win the day or dueling against each other for personal glory. With a wide variety of weapons, vehicles, and player classes in the many different types of games, Infantry always offers something new.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1h47.jpg'),(3496,'Fort Zombie','2009-10-30','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fort Zombie is a role-playing video game developed by Kerberos Productions.[1] It was released on October 30, 2009. The game takes place on a version of Earth that is being invaded by an evil force which warps reality and creates zombies. Players control Ben Riley,[2][3] a young man who has survived through the destruction and is setting up a safe haven in the fictional town of Piety, Indiana[1]. Each version of Piety in any play-through is procedurally generated, with different houses, items and enemies placed each time the player enters the town.[4] Players must choose a location to fortify, build defenses and find supplies and survivors in thirteen in-game days before a zombie horde pours out of Indianapolis and overwhelms the survivors. The game began as a test for technology to be used in the upcoming game Northstar and uses a similar engine.[4]','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q6l.jpg'),(3497,'The Endless Express','2016-06-27','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','After falling asleep on the train, you must embark on a journey to catch another that will bring you home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g59.jpg'),(3498,'The Legend of Heroes: Trails through Daybreak - Voice Set','2024-07-05','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','This set includes the following DLC: Holo Core Voice: Renne Bright, Holo Core Voice: Judith Lanster and Holo Core Voice: Barkhorn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8l2w.jpg'),(3499,'PoligonVR',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Imagine a virtual world where you can create or be anything you ever wanted. PoligonVR is a powerful community driven sandbox where we give you the necessary tools to turn your dreams into virtual reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xz9.jpg'),(3500,'Palace of a Thousand Curses',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Palace of a Thousand Curses is a 2.5D narrative swashbuckling adventure set in an Andalusian fairy tale.\n\nYou play as a desperate beggar that has been trapped in an old storybook, where you will duel strange creatures, avoid deadly traps, and confront that most unexpected of enemies: the Spanish Inquisition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9al9.jpg'),(3501,'Aritana and the Twin Masks','2021-02-25','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Prove your value and unmask all the mysteries inside YpY\'s Temple. Using an enchanted bow and arrow, take Aritana on this journey to save the Tree of Life while discovering some ghosts from his past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24gd.jpg'),(3502,'Batrider','1998-02-01','Shooter','Arcade','Armed Police Batrider (アームドポリス バトライダー?) is a vertically scrolling manic shooter arcade game developed and published by Raizing/Eighting in 1998. The player controls teams of flying jet bikes (Batriders) each with their own pilot; players can choose up to three of nine standard characters plus another nine unlockable characters from the previous Raizing games Mahou Daisakusen and Battle Garegga. Batrider contains up to seven stages along with a large number of secrets, which are either unlockable with codes or DIP switch settings, or hidden within the game itself.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3503,'Hyperun','2017-09-08','Racing, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hyperun. Unlimited speed driving game with tricks. Players compete on an international leaderboards for the highest speed and the highest score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qdw.jpg'),(3504,'SiIvaGunner: King for a Day Tournament - Playable Credits Minigame!!','2018-10-08','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SiIvaGunner: King for a Day Tournament - Playable Credits Minigame!! is a short game made for the SiIvaGunner: King for a Day Tournament which is based on the credits segment of Super Smash Bros. Melee, in which the player scores points by shooting down all the credits from the tournament. The game was released with the video \"ONE FINAL ANNOUNCEMENT (for real this time)\" alongside the album for the soundtrack for the event.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97oe.jpg'),(3505,'Grisaia no Kajitsu: Side Episode','2017-07-27','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','Grisaia no Kajitsu Side Episode was released for the PlayStation Vita as a compilation of 3 side stories released for the Grisaia series of visual novels. It contains the stories \"Grisaia no Yuukan\" (The Leisure of Grisaia), \"Grisaia no Zankou\" (The Afterglow of Grisaia) and \"Grisaia no Senritsu\" (The Melody of Grisaia).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59xn.jpg'),(3506,'Watchlist','2017-07-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Accused of committing a crime affecting the nation\'s security, you are now tasked with tracking down various undesirables in order to redeem yourself in the eyes of the powers that be. Blast through procedurally generated levels and complete the Watchlist in this retro arcade shooter!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co273v.jpg'),(3507,'Mondschein','2003-03-13','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Old Fynn tells of his life and remembers his past. He always wanted to go to the stars. And when the opportunity arose, he joined a space mission. But on this mission, the ship is shot down by unknown persons. However, Fynn can escape in a rescue pod - and crashes on an alien planet. There he is picked up by the girl Ki, who becomes his companion from now on. With her help, he sets out to find the so-called people of the moon, always pursued by terrible nightmares.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1q6h.jpg'),(3508,'Provincies',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','An educational trivia game about the Provinces in The Netherlands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lrbwwucacwwql8iadbbb.jpg'),(3509,'Shadows in the Dark',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Shadows in the dark is a short roguelike game with frantic action. Defeat the horde of enemies, collect coins to improve your skills Collect the diamonds to activate the holy statue. There are four automatically generated areas to leave your even more interesting gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58ud.jpg'),(3510,'JoJo\'s Bizarre Adventure: All Star Battle','2014-04-29','Fighting, Arcade','PlayStation 3','Adapted from Hirohiko Araki’s smash manga hit, JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure, the game takes characters spanning all eight incredible story arcs of the manga and pits them against each other in an epic one-on-one fighting game.\n\nWith a revolutionary proprietary graphics shader system, JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure: All-Star Battle gives players the feeling that they are participating in vivid and colorful battles straight from the pages of the manga. Players will be able to choose from an impressive cast of characters spanning the entire series. Each character comes with their signature moves punctuated by dynamic camera angles to capture every highlight of the fight either against computer opponents via Story Mode or human adversaries online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qgm.jpg'),(3511,'There\'s Always a Madman: Do Your Worst','2024-11-08','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as the vengeful secret agent Virginia West and take on a silver-loving madman called The Silver Fox in this single-player interactive spy novel. Surveil your enemy, get revenge for your partner\'s demise, and maybe - just maybe - save the world along the way. Don’t do your best … Do your worst!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vip.jpg'),(3512,'Bomberman','1990-04-02','Strategy, Arcade','Family Computer Disk System, Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','Bomberman is a robot engaged in the production of bombs. Like his fellow robots, he had been put to work in an underground compound by evil forces. Bomberman found it to be an unbearably dreary existence. One day, he heard an encouraging rumor. According to the rumor, any robot that could escape the underground compound and make it to the surface could become human. Bomberman leaped at the opportunity, but escape proved to be no small task. Alerted to Bomberman\'s betrayal, large numbers of the enemy set out in pursuit. Bomberman can rely only on bombs of his own production for his defense. Will he ever make it up to the surface? Once there, will he really become human?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v5i.jpg'),(3513,'InfiniPicross 2.0','2018-07-10','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A never ending supply of picross puzzles in any rectangular shape between 3x3 and 100x100 as well as \"classical\" picture picross, all accompanied by a soothing ambience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43kq.jpg'),(3514,'Little Kitty, Big City','2025-05-09','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','You\'re a curious little kitty with a big personality, on an adventure to find your way back home. Explore the city, make new friends, wear delightful hats, and leave more than a little chaos in your wake. After all, isn\'t that what cats do best?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mbt.jpg'),(3515,'Arcade Archives: Bomb Jack','2015-08-18','Platform, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Arcade Archives: Bomb Jack is a port of the action game Bomb Jack. Players control Jack, a superhero who can leap and glide, to collect all bombs in game stages. By retrieving the ignited bombs first, you can earn bonus points and fill up your Power gauge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wni.jpg'),(3516,'Soulslinger','2022-10-26','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Soulslinger is a challenging, fast paced runner with roguelike elements, in which you must reap your way through the Underworld! Dodge obstacles, eat pies, and get blessings to defeat threatening foes with the help of your powerful Soulvolver.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pfo.jpg'),(3517,'Plants vs. Zombies: Cubed','2022-11-11','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Plants vs. Zombies: Cubed is a Quilt-only mod made to bring Plants vs. Zombies content to Minecraft. The objective is to add as many plants, zombies, and references from the PvZ franchise as possible.\n\nBuild defenses with your favorite plants, try to survive for as long as possible against the ever-increasing zombie waves in survival mode, stage fights between plants and zombies in creative mode, hypnotize Gargantuars and ride on them, and more...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79ci.jpg'),(3518,'Search for the Titanic','2021-04-02','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join the quest of the century in an authentic simulation that reflects man\'s achievement landing. The search for the Titanic, the greatest ship to ever fall to the grip of the elements, has peaked man\'s interest for decades. Experience the challenges and dangers, the excitement and reality of scientific under-water exploration as Search For The Titanic takes you on the quest to find the world\'s most famous lost ship. Reviewed for authenticity by the staff of the Woods Hole Oceanographic Institution, the American organization that first discovered and photographed the Titanic wreck, Search For The Titanic contains digitized pictures from the actual photos of the Titanic, taken at a depth of more than 12,000 feet. \n \nYou begin as an inexperienced oceanographer. You must build your reputation, gaining points for finding and exploring other lost vessels, and earning the resources for a Titanic search. You plan each expedition — obtaining funding, a ship, personnel and the right equipment — then, chart the course and battle the elements as you dive for wrecks, gaining experience and expertise. Search For The Titanic includes over 75 wrecks to explore, more than 100 navigational maps and charts and 47 ports of call. Realistic weather patterns and currents, sophisticated sonar, magnetometers, under-water cameras and minisubs all come into play as you navigate the trade routes in search of missing ships. Search, locate and explore the Titanic and you will be rewarded with digitized pictures of the actual Titanic shipwreck as it sits on the ocean floor today.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21m4.jpg'),(3519,'Resident Evil: Operation Raccoon City - Special Edition','2012-04-20','Sin género','PlayStation 3','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3do5.jpg'),(3520,'Munchkin.io','2017-12-07','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Android, iOS','\"Fight the enemies and monsters with cute characters and raise the level. At every level you can learn new skills or get new items. Achieve the crown and gain glory. Gather gold and get new characters, items, and skills\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hg4.jpg'),(3521,'Prison Tycoon: Under New Management','2023-02-07','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Design, build and run your own prison!\n\nPlan and build your own prison from the ground up! Secure government grants, hire guards and staff and begin welcoming new prisoners in this reboot of the Prison Tycoon franchise.\n\nThe goal of a good Warden is not to punish their prisoners, it’s to rehabilitate them into productive members of society. In Under New Management, each inmate must work through their own issues that landed them in prison, and it’s your job to provide them with the help they need to get healthy.\n\n“Prison Tycoon : Under New Management” is looking for a good Warden. Are you up for the job?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a2o.jpg'),(3522,'Handmancers',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Handmancers is a first-person roguelike deckbuilder set in a crazy fantasy world where warriors solve their problems through the power of their hands… literally.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wk7.jpg'),(3523,'Infectonator','2014-09-16','Simulator, Strategy','Android, iOS','Have zombies? Will travel! Take over the globe with a tap of your finger in this addictive arcade game of world domination with retro pixel graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co974v.jpg'),(3524,'European Super League','2001-03-30','Sport','Game Boy Color, Game Boy Advance','Port of \"European Super League\" for Game Boy Color and Advance.\n\nEuropean Super League brings together the talent from the very finest teams in Europe to create a \"European Super League Championship\". Ronaldo, Zidane and Edgar Davids are names to excite the most fanatical football fan and they, along with countless other world class footballers, are the foundation of this game.\n\nThis game is somewhat different from the standard console version in that the action is viewed from an isometric perspective and the game only has 12 teams instead of 16.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i7f.jpg'),(3525,'Spamware','2025-04-01','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are sentenced to 3000 hours in prison. Earn your freedom by identifying and reporting spam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g3j.jpg'),(3526,'Dare to Lucid Dream','2025-06-30','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','For the first time in years, Sonny meets a person he knows inside of his lucid dreams and, to his surprise, Sonny discovers that what he says and does in his dreams directly affects the people he dreamed about.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fh5.jpg'),(3527,'Rocket League: Chaos Run','2015-12-01','Racing, Sport, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Soccer meets driving once again in the long-awaited, physics-based multiplayer-focused sequel to Supersonic Acrobatic Rocket-Powered Battle-Cars!\n\nThis add-on includes... Two new Battle-Cars, Ripper and Grog, six unique Decals for each new Battle-Car (12 total), two new Paint Types, two new Wheels, two new Rocket boosts, three new Toppers and three new Antennas','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4skk.jpg'),(3528,'The Black Grimoire: Cursebreaker','2023-03-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immerse yourself in a medieval fantasy world in this classic top-down single player adventure RPG. Journey through a sprawling open world and progress through dialogue options to uncover the story of Rothar Aercrest - the cursed lord to the remote lands of Imberthale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co432p.jpg'),(3529,'Savant: Ascent','2013-12-04','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A malicious orb has cast Savant out of his tower and transformed his surroundings into dangerous enemies!\nDodge and shoot your way back up the tower, and blast down waves of enemies as you make your way towards the top! As you progress, you unlock CDs that not only give you new tracks to play to, but also grant you powerful new abilities!\nYou play as the powerful Alchemist, a mechanical wizard who tries to possess the power of the mysterious orb. He\'s able to shoot vollyes of magic missiles, aswell as being nimble enough to dodge and jump out of harms way.\nUnlock 6 unique soundtracks from musical artist Savant each with unique powers to help you ascend the Alchemist\'s tower, or reach new highscores in Time Attack or Endless Mode. There are also secret powers to unlock, and several achievements to challenge the most experienced of players.\n\nCan you make it to the top?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40tc.jpg'),(3530,'Crysis 3','2013-02-19','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, Xbox 360, Xbox One','The award-winning developer Crytek is back with Crysis 3, the first blockbuster shooter of 2013! Crysis 3 is the ultimate sandbox shooter, realized in the stunning visuals only Crytek and the latest version of CryENGINE can deliver. Available now on Xbox 360, PlayStation 3, and PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2on3.jpg'),(3531,'Last Threshold','2022-03-24','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Dive into the world based on the Lovecraft universe and its successors. In immersive visual novel discover the secret of the temple and learn the truth about your companions and your father’s past!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5iee.jpg'),(3532,'101 Cats Hidden in Orlando','2025-03-04','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join this adventure and discover the hiding places of 101 kittens in the hand-crafted Orlando landscape. Earn lots of achievements. How many can you find? Be quick! ⏱️','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ghv.jpg'),(3533,'Tapeworm Disco Puzzle','2022-06-01','Platform, Puzzle','Playdate','Tapeworm puzzle disco is a grid based puzzle game where you play as a tapeworm; the local night club owner. It\'s your job to make sure the fleas enjoy themselves. You\'ll be helping them collect blood, play bangin tunes and get them to gigs on time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68pq.jpg'),(3534,'Flatline','2020-08-25','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as Scarlett, a freelance cyborg ninja, in a neon city filled with corporate drones. Use her top of the line sword and bio enhancements to dash throughout the city and chain your dashes through drones. Make sure to watch your health, too many mistakes and you might Flatline.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gss.jpg'),(3535,'A Corgi\'s Cozy Hike','2025-06-30','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Em-bark on a therapeutic adventure as a Corgi exploring a peaceful island getaway. Climb the mountain, soar the sky, and sail the seas to uncover treasures and cozy spots. No need to rush. Relax and savor this bite-sized, open-world experience while 10% of your purchase is donated to animal shelters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66z8.jpg'),(3536,'100 Los Angeles Cats','2025-12-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join the cutest adventure in the Los Angeles, full of cats! Explore the charming hand-drawn artwork of themed locations as you embark on a quest to find 100 adorable cats hidden throughout the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hj4.jpg'),(3537,'Wikipedia Speedruns','2021-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','The rules of this game are simple. You\'ll be given a starting Wikipedia article and an ending Wikipedia article. Your goal is to navigate from the starting article to the ending article using only the article links.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69lt.jpg'),(3538,'Assetflip Attorney','2025-02-10','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Assetflip attorney is a murder mystery satire visual novel, Solve crimes in a world where everyone has gone insane and everything feels like a fever dream, interrogate witnesses, hunt for clues and take down the criminal organization that threatens to destroy reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g7k.jpg'),(3539,'Mr. Luma\'s Cooking Adventure',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Are you ready to go on a cooking adventure?\nIn Mr. Luma’s Cooking Adventure life is wonderful and relaxing. Explore a fairy-tale forest for all the ingredients nature has to offer, whether it’s delicious fruit, healthy vegetables or fresh fish. When your basket is full of goodies head back to your cozy tree house to cook for your furry little friends!\nLet your imagination run wild in your fully equipped tree house kitchen! Slice, juice, fry and boil your ingredients. Once your plate is deliciously decorated, sit back and watch the adorable animals’ reactions.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3540,'Hidden Mysteries: Civil War','2015-08-11','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This hidden object game is devoted to the Civil War between the Union and Confederate armies which took place in the United States of America. You have an unique opportunity to take part in this major event. A great variety of historical locations are waiting for you to explore them. Look for hidden objects and discover more interesting information about this event.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co219o.jpg'),(3541,'J.M.Rhythm','2024-03-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','J.M.Rhythm is a black-and-white style rhythm game set in the southern regions of Yangtze River of China. It is the first work produced by J.M.Arcady. In this game, you can use our “rhythm generator” to upload your own music and it will generate a corresponding beatmap automatically.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tch.jpg'),(3542,'The Butterfly Sign','2016-12-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Butterfly Sign is a detective story putting players into the role of the survivor of a disastrous incident. The protagonist takes an experimental drug which immerses him in the depths of his mind. In his memories, he will discover the ones responsible for the disaster, little by little, step by step...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co979y.jpg'),(3543,'Walt Disney\'s The Jungle Book: Mowgli\'s Wild Adventure','2000-11-14','Platform','Game Boy Color','In Walt Disney\'s The Jungle Book: Mowgli\'s Wild Adventure, you must guide Mowgli on an adventure to become King of the Jungle. Mowgli must work his way through more than 20 levels of adventure, using his superior intellect. Instead of beating up monkey guards, Mowgli can use a banana to lure them away from their posts. However, there will come a time when fighting is necessary, and the man-cub can use a number moves to get rid of the enemies including a butt-stomp and a vicious spin-attack. Since the game is optimized for the Game Boy Color, the environments look like they could have been taken right from the film. Help Mowgli survive to adulthood in Walt Disney\'s The Jungle Book: Mowgli\'s Wild Adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1w8b.jpg'),(3544,'The Odyssey','2016-09-04','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Step into this epic point-and-click mythical adventure game. See what it takes to be the Greek hero Odysseus (Ulysses)! Get ready to embark on a journey filled with danger, mythical creatures and ancient Gods. Thrilling moments and unexpected twists as well as the evil presence of legendary creatures dominate this mythical game throughout.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4404.jpg'),(3545,'Arabian Nights','2001-10-05','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Arabian Nights is a 3-D action-adventure arcade video game published in 2001 for Microsoft Windows. It was published by Visiware and Wanadoo. It is based on One Thousand and One Nights.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7o27.jpg'),(3546,'Ghost of Yotei','2025-10-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 5','The game takes place 300 years after Ghost of Tsushima. Set in the lands surrounding Mount Yōtei, a towering peak in the heart of Ezo, an area of Japan known as Hokkaido in present day.\n\nThe area is outside the rule of Japan, and filled with sprawling grasslands, snowy tundras, and unexpected dangers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9coo.jpg'),(3547,'Digerati Indie Bundle: INK & HackyZack','2018-12-24','Platform, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Enjoy two indie favourites from Digerati! This bundle contains colorful splatformer INK and bouncy ball-juggler HackyZack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co391l.jpg'),(3548,'Picayune Dreams: Contamination','2025-02-20','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fjv.jpg'),(3549,'Flyland Wars: 2 Not Yours Mine','2021-10-04','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A sci-fi flying person vs. robot battle game. A stolen asteroid on this flyland contains a labyrinthine mine named Not Yours Mine, and may still have murderous minedroids and a security force-- but certainly does have poison-gas-spewing spiderbots. You have to destroy them all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5o7i.jpg'),(3550,'Asameshimae Nyanko','1994-03-18','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','Super Famicom','Asameshimae Nyanko has similarities with Reversi (or Othello) and with fights that are similar to rock-paper-scissors to intercept additional moves with kittens that have different proficiency with vertical/horizontal and diagonal moves.\nIn the game, players partake in a Reversi-esque game and get to choose a number of stages to play on and the type of kitten they want to use. They can also change the rules and settings to an extent. It\'s red versus blue, with a random player going first. As players would in Reversi or Othello, sandwich kittens vertically, horizontally or diagonally (though since the game is isometric, it\'s hard to say vertically or horizontally). They will change all the kittens in between to a certain color, but can additionally select cats in the area to do battle with. Winning allows players to further convert cats to their cause. There are special items which have certain effects such as making players lose a turn, but, there isn\'t much interruption from them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l3m.jpg'),(3551,'Cockhead','2020-09-27','Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cockhead reveals the story of a penis, a penis who made it. Experience a stunning adventure with our protagonist, enjoy fully hand-drawn graphics, original story and Big Band style jazz music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co298h.jpg'),(3552,'Qrabbles',NULL,'Platform, Racing, Indie','Sin plataforma','Qrabbles is a physics based sandbox game where you can build your own worlds, and play in them as a sticky creature.\nThe game is a building game, where you can build giant parkour maps, or create tornados with fans, giant escape rooms, but what you biild is up to your imagination.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4jzv.jpg'),(3553,'Super Space Invaders','1991-12-31','Shooter','Arcade, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Sega Game Gear, DOS, Amiga, Amstrad CPC, Sega Master System/Mark III','Space Invaders is the most famous video game ever! Now SUPER SPACE INVADERS has arrived with a host of amazing new features - wave after wave of weird and hostile aliens, fantastic multiway scrolling playfields, huge end of level mega monsters and secret levels for only the best to find! It\'ll drive you crazy, but you won\'t be able to leave it alone!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6erm.jpg'),(3554,'Kaiju Khaos','2019-09-06','Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Unleash the beast! An endless runner where you must cause as much destruction as you can whilst you make your escape from the military containment facility. Unlock different Kaijus and grow them to monstorous sizes to overcome the obstacles in your path and take your revenge on mankind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59ac.jpg'),(3555,'100 Miami Cats','2025-12-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join the cutest adventure in the Miami, full of cats! Explore the charming hand-drawn artwork of themed locations as you embark on a quest to find 100 adorable cats hidden throughout the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hj7.jpg'),(3556,'Game (not) Over','2025-03-31','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','GAME (not) OVER is a survivors-like with deck-building elements, blending both genres to offer a fresh game. Lost in the world of video games, use cards to summon hero allies, and defend yourself from the hordes of villains who want to claim their revenge on you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gr7.jpg'),(3557,'Evolution RTS','2014-04-07','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Evolution RTS is a free an Open Source RTS game designed using the Spring Engine. It has been in development for many years and receives updates often. It’s gameplay is designed specifically to appeal to gamers of all skill levels. The gameplay is designed around the use of unit groups, and the mixture of your unit group often will determine how successful you are in battle, as opposed to churning out hundreds of the same unit continually. \n \nThe economy and teching system is easy to learn and use. The game itself supplies many tools that make managing your economy easier so that you can focus more on crushing your enemy than of playing simcity in your base. Units interact using realistic physics and varied terrain (you can actually micro units in order to dodge projectiles!).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tw6.jpg'),(3558,'Across Age II','2015-02-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, iOS','** Sequel to the critically acclaimed J-Action-RPG **\nAles and Ceska return for their biggest journey yet!\n\n- EXPERIENCE THE GOLDEN AGE OF 16-BIT RPGs\nIts engaging storyline, intense action and eerie dungeons provided a whole new game experience. The sequel improves the formula with over 20 hours of exciting gameplay and beautiful pixel perfect 2D environments.\n\n- THE TIME TRAVELLING STORY CONTINUES\nA mysterious girl from the future appears and she carries a terrible secret. Find out what\'s going on and repair the past, present and future to save the world.\n\n- PLAY WITH 4 CHARACTERS\nSwitch between up to 4 characters and use their unique abilities to beat huge boss monsters, discover hidden secrets, solve puzzles and cast magic to open new paths on your epic journey through time.\n\n- EXCITING J-ROCK SOUNDTRACK\nEnjoy an awesome soundtrack that keeps you on your toes and rekindles the style of classic Retro Action RPG\'s like the Ys Series (*Nihon Falcom) on the Turbo Duo console (*NEC).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84ln.jpg'),(3559,'Microsoft Flight Simulator X: Steam Edition - Battle of Britain: Spitfire','2015-05-19','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The supplied paint schemes include a number of aircraft flown by the ‘aces’ of the Battles of France and Britain and the flight dynamics of this simulation have been specially programmed to allow you to fly ‘by the book’, so go ahead and try your skill at ‘matching the numbers’ achieved by ‘Mutt’ Summers and Jeffrey Quill in the prototype, or test your nerve on an endurance run over the fields of France and back in your Mk1A! Custom built with an incredibly detailed and ultra-high quality cockpit, exacting flight dynamics and realistic Merlin engine sounds, this is the ultimate Spitfire package for Microsoft Flight Simulator X: Steam Edition!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85iw.jpg'),(3560,'Neet & Fairy',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3561,'Pacapong',NULL,'Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Pacman + Pong + Space Invaders','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gru.jpg'),(3562,'Welcome Kokuri-san','2023-05-25','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Welcome Kokuri-san is a visual novel starring the VTuber Kurune Kokuri. The story is fully voiced, and will include scenes with realistic ASMR voices, so you can enjoy the scenario “as if you were there.”','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jah.jpg'),(3563,'No Time For Caution','2022-12-10','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','No Time For Caution is a 3d parkour game. Sit back and enjoy the parkours with different difficulty levels. Don\'t forget! No time for caution.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vx3.jpg'),(3564,'O Reino em Outro Mundo','2024-05-29','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have been transported to a procedurally generated voxel world where every decision matters. Manage resources, fight zombies and prepare for the harsh winters. Survive, build and thrive in an environment full of challenges and discoveries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8r0h.jpg'),(3565,'Psycho Bathroom','2022-04-29','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Psycho Bathroom is a 2D boss rush game. In the bathroom you reside in, your toilet lid is broken. Every toilet flush is splashing aerosols all over the place. You, as a toothbrush, must eradicate the threat and protect your master.\nUpgrade your gear! Meet new buddies! Bond with your master and explore his dark but comic story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4odp.jpg'),(3566,'Voidface','2025-12-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Face off in a challenging bullet-hell arena shooter to try and clear bite-sized boss rush challenges. Learn to dodge their attacks, cast spells to gain an upper hand, and kill everything that gets in your way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fhe.jpg'),(3567,'That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Succubus','2023-10-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sumire was just like any other woman... until she was reincarnated as a succubus in a magical world! Now she must find her way back to her home world and survive the many challenges that await her in this fantasy realm!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72ju.jpg'),(3568,'Project Float','2012-02-14','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join Buddy on his adventure to take down BluCo Science and save his town from the robot attack. Project Float is a puzzle based platformer with several RPG elements. You play as the child hero who stumbles upon an abandoned sphere who encourages him to help him defeat the robot overlord secretly in charge of this island. On your adventure you find several other robotic spheres who each give you, the player, a unique ability that will help you pass through obstacles.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3569,'Gakuen Club','2018-08-30','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Gakuen Club is a school life love story that begins when you discover a secret at your academy, setting off a chain of events that you never imagined. Enjoy the different distinct and unique characters along with their own stories and wonderful voices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24im.jpg'),(3570,'An Autumn With You','2020-09-07','Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Game Boy','Your parents, your Nana and you have just moved to a remote location out in the country. Help them settle in and explore the wilderness around your Nana\'s house! It\'s said that there are spirits in this forest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79r1.jpg'),(3571,'Dead Pixels','2012-12-04','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A toxic waste spill finds its way into the water supply causing the recently deceased rise from their graves. Now you have to shoot your way through the hordes of undead to reach your only hope for survival. On the way to your rescue you will have to search stores and houses for supplies, and trade with other survivors.\nWith three game modes, hundreds of items, weapons and grenades, and a city that is never the same twice, there is always something new hiding round the corner in Dead Pixels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e2a.jpg'),(3572,'Jissen Pachi-Slot Hisshouhou! Mou-juu-oh S',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A virtual slots game for the PlayStation 2 that simulates the 2002 pachi-slot machine Mou-juu-oh S (itself part of the Juu-oh series of machines).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jvakiklqfspf8p1bgnln.jpg'),(3573,'Extrapower Star Resistance','2012-10-11','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An indie shoot \'em up from doujin team Lucky Lamp that takes place in the Extrapower universe. Prior to the events of Attack of Darkforce, Sharkungo and Force Star respond to a report that Dark Force is attacking the Shakun Star itself. Traverse across 6 stages from the Satellite Mesa to the heart of the royal capital city to fight through swarms of enemies and repel the Dark Force attack on Sharkungo\'s homeworld.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i09.jpg'),(3574,'The Inanimate Mr. Coatrack','2019-06-22','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Bawdy Buddy-Comedy Adventure','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co697n.jpg'),(3575,'Teller\'s Duty',NULL,'Point-and-click, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Teller’s Duty is a simulation game where players take on the role of a bank teller in a dystopian world. They must process transactions, verify documents, and detect fraud while navigating complex moral dilemmas that shape the story. Featuring a vintage paper-inspired aesthetic and a choice-driven narrative, the game challenges players to balance their duties with ethical decisions that impact their future','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k8g.jpg'),(3576,'Death Kid','2025-04-02','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Death Kid is a fast-paced arcade-inspired arena brawler with meta-progression. Wipe out hordes of daunting foes, master powerful abilities and grow stronger with each attempt. Venture deep inside a treacherous well to put the wheel of life and death back in motion and break the curse of immortality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jga.jpg'),(3577,'Hentai Arcade: Lustful Girls',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Hentai Arcade: Lustful Girls is a collection of various games to raise your mood. And not only. There is 5 different and non-standard modes, 45 great artworks, ultra relaxing music, Super-Zoom and 54 achievements.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3578,'Stargaze','2020-11-20','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gaze into the stars as a curious astronomer in this magical VR adventure game. Influence a whole galaxy of planets and their mysterious inhabitants by manipulating a powerful telescope. Take photos of captivating events and fill out your research journal to uncover the secrets of the cosmos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i77.jpg'),(3579,'Only Down!','2023-07-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Have game developers often forced you to climb somewhere with no purpose? This time, your goal is to hit rock bottom and nothing else. It should be simple enough, good luck to everyone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70jk.jpg'),(3580,'Egyptian Ball',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/upewtt6emd5ghcji2bjq.jpg'),(3581,'Mafia: The Old Country','2025-08-08','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Uncover the origins of organized crime in Mafia: The Old Country, a gritty mob story set in the brutal underworld of 1900s Sicily.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s2c.jpg'),(3582,'Football Heroes Turbo','2019-01-17','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Fight your way to the end zone using skill, strategy, and super moves to smash the competition. Collect and upgrade hundreds of unique players to build the ultimate football team. Get online and experience the most action-packed football game in the universe!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27ql.jpg'),(3583,'Kill AI','2024-02-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An RPG with multiple endings written by AI. All interactions with the player that are in the game show the real attitude of the evil AI towards a person.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tpf.jpg'),(3584,'Neverwinter Nights: Pirates of the Sword Coast','2005-06-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Neverwinter Nights: Pirates of the Sword Coast is a Premium module for Neverwinter Nights. It features a new storyline to play but has no technical improvements to the main game and previous add-ons. The story begins in the city of Neverwinter, and leads to a lengthy ship-borne, swashbuckling-style adventure','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1t1s.jpg'),(3585,'Cat Girl','2017-08-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cat Girl is an AVG with novel endings influenced by different choices. The game feautres an incredible storyline and voice-over throughout all game for main characters. Besides over 100,000-word script, Cat Girl also has different choices, which will lead to numerous endings.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3586,'Ship Simulator 2006 Add-On',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Ship Simulator 2006 is a revolutionary simulation game that puts players at the helm of some of the most varied and detailed ships to be found at sea, where they will need to perform a multitude of tasks, all set within a stunning 3D environment. Players will take control of a wide array of ship types, from massive cargo ships to speedboats. \n \nThe Official Add-On for the acclaimed hit Ship Simulator 2006 gives ship simulation enthusiasts a variety of new features to enhance their experience of this best selling title. PS: Users of the Add-On need to have the original game installed first.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/raqhteskbhze1wknyaeq.jpg'),(3587,'I\'m in Love With Your Dead Grandmother','2023-08-18','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co539j.jpg'),(3588,'The Anomaly Experiment','2025-04-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Psychological Horror where you’re offered freedom by joining a trial for a new drug. The experiment is simple: enter the room, observe, and identify what has changed. Complete all tasks, and your sentence is commuted.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qxz.jpg'),(3589,'Spirit of the Island: Adventureland','2023-10-03','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rejoice, Adventurers: A brand new way to entertain your guests is coming up to the tropical world of Spirit of the Island. Please welcome: Adventureland! Are you ready to build your own tropical amusement park?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77ra.jpg'),(3590,'Syd of Valis','2022-12-22','Platform','Nintendo Switch','Wait a minute! When did Valis become so cutesy?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fdd.jpg'),(3591,'Bakutou Dochers: Bumps-jima ha Oosawagi','1994-10-28','Puzzle','Super Famicom','Bakutou Dochers is a Japan-only action game for up to four players. It superficially resembles Hudson\'s Bomberman series, with its top-down grid stages and chaotic gameplay, but rather than leaving bombs and waiting for them to explode, the player can shoot energy at blocks and each other.\n\nThe goal is to sneak up behind the opponent and shoot them before they can reciprocate. Various power-ups may appear after destructible blocks are removed, which can give the player an edge or, in the case of the ? icon, a possible random negative effect like reversed controls. There are also wandering monsters that can cause damage to anyone they come in contact with. Every combatant has a health bar which depletes at a rate dependent on the attacks they are getting hit by.\n\nThe single-player mode involves fighting through various worlds and removing all enemy combatants from the field to progress.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xs6.jpg'),(3592,'Cursed Treasure 2','2017-07-21','Strategy, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Why be good when you can be... bad? Cursed Treasure 2 is an addictive tower-defense game that puts the power of darkness at your fingertips. Build towers of powerful orcs, demons, and undead, and master powerful spells, to protect your precious hoard from all manner of no-good do-gooders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23ne.jpg'),(3593,'World Soccer Winning Eleven 9','2005-09-15','Sport','PlayStation Portable','PSP Port of Winning Eleven 9.\n\nPro Evolution Soccer 5 (known as World Soccer: Winning Eleven 9 in North America and Japan, sometimes mislabeled as World Soccer Winning Eleven 9 International) is a football video game developed and produced by Konami as part of the Pro Evolution Soccer series. With featuring Arsenal and Chelsea it is the first release of the series which offered fully licensed clubs from the Premier League, which is one of the 3 unlicensed leagues of the game. There are also 3 licensed leagues just like in the predecessor Pro Evolution Soccer 4. The game also includes 3 fully licensed leagues, which are the Spanish Liga Española, the Dutch Eredivisie and the Italian Serie A. As with previous versions, the game features an edit mode allowing the player to edit certain elements of the game. It was the last release to feature the German Bundesliga (in the game as German League) before it was replaced by a generic league because of losing the license for the following releases. Pro Evolution Soccer 5 marked the series\' first appearance on the PSP. The game was also the first in the series to feature online play for the PlayStation 2. Within online play, statistics and league points are stored on the server for each game played. These points determine a team\'s (player\'s) position within the five online divisions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9clv.jpg'),(3594,'Silent Hill 2','2012-03-20','Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','This version of Silent Hill 2 is a remaster included in the Silent Hill HD Collection. The graphics have been re-mastered to 720p, the in-game voice-over was updated along with a re-mastering of the soundtrack and achievements/trophies were added.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wkr.jpg'),(3595,'Cornerpond','2025-04-21','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Idle game that sits at the bottom of your screen, customize your character through unlocks and catch multiple different fish. Has interactions and features to unlock more idle game play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9prx.jpg'),(3596,'Sam & Max: Save the World - Episode 5: Reality 2.0','2009-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','With an internet crisis looming and a viral video game holding its players hostage, Sam & Max will need to slip into a new reality to set things right. But can the Freelance Police crack this virtual case in time to avoid worldwide system failure? One of six self-contained cases with an overarching story arc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40rg.jpg'),(3597,'Interstellar Dominion','2023-01-29','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Open World Space Survival','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82t8.jpg'),(3598,'Higurashi no Naku Koro ni: Himatsubushi-hen','2015-03-12','Visual Novel','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','A port of the remade version of the original fifth chapter of Higurashi When They Cry for modern consoles in widescreen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zwe.jpg'),(3599,'Starry Garden: Animal Park','2018-05-21','Simulator','Android','Build your own garden beneath a beautiful night sky. Collect constellations and a variety of pets. Calm and soothing music will relieve your stress!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co500s.jpg'),(3600,'Midnight Monitor: Anomaly Watch','2023-09-01','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A \"spot the difference\" horror game where you have to monitor cameras in a haunted house and report anomalies. You have no choice but to finish the job. Can you spot every anomaly? Can you survive the night?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s10.jpg'),(3601,'Color Dark Castle','1994-12-31','Arcade','Mac','Color Dark Castle is a remake of the first Dark Castle adding colored graphics, new \'Novice\' difficulty setting, allowing to save the game, and a secret level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i77.jpg'),(3602,'TrackMania 2: Canyon','2011-09-14','Racing, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','TrackMania² Canyon will let you experience the fun and adrenaline of racing stunning cars on sensational tracks in a major enhanced sequel to Nadeo Studio\'s online racing phenomenon TrackMania, already enjoyed by millions of players.\n\nTrackMania² Canyon goes far beyond traditional driving games with racing in a fully customizable world of tracks generated and powered by players themselves! With loops, wall rides, ramps and a multitude of other stunts, you’re in for the ride of your life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6k81.jpg'),(3603,'Brothers in Arms: Road to Hill 30','2005-03-15','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','Xbox, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation 2','Based on a true story. Set during the famous airdrop before the invasion at Normandy, where Sgt. Matt Baker and his squad of 101st Airborne Paratroopers were scattered over the French countryside.\nAs the story unfolds, you must choose between the success of your mission and the lives of your men - your brothers in arms.\nBrothers In Arms: Road to Hill 30 will immerse players in the historic, eight-day invasion of Normandy - with unparalleled imagery, authenticity, sound, and gameplay.\nOne of a kind: Brothers In Arms Road to Hill 30 is the only first-person tactical shooter set in WWII.\nReal military tactics: Intuitive and easy-to-use squad controls appeal to both the hardcore and mainstream gaming audience.\nReal soldiers: Featuring a cast of more than 20 characters, each with a unique personality, appearance, and style.\nRevolutionary AI system: Allies and enemies use the standard operating procedures of fire and maneuver to flank and kill their foes.\nUnprecedented authenticity: Historically accurate and detailed battlefields, events, and equipment re-created from Army Signal Corps photos, aerial reconnaissance imagery, and eyewitness accounts.\nInnovative multiplayer: Players command three-man AI teams in a battle of wits and skill to accomplish exciting objectives.\nAward-winning team: Gearbox Software, creators of Half-Life Opposing Force and developers of James Bond: Nightfire, Counter-Strike, and Halo (PC).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28fb.jpg'),(3604,'Dig Dug: Digging Strike','2005-11-18','Puzzle','Nintendo DS','This 3D adventure combines the classic arcade digging action with new baddies, environments, weapons, mini-games and strategies to deliver the most action-packed Dig Dug game to date. Whether tackling the underground alone or wirelessly with a friend, gamers discover 15 stages with more than 80 areas in Dig Dug Digging Strike. Players explore 3D environments on the top screen of the DS, then plunge underground on the bottom screen to dig and connect fault lines that will trap monsters. Only by sinking enemy bosses do players move to the next level - and they encounter some familiar faces along the way. The dreaded Pooka and Fygar are back to threaten Dig Dug, along with a host of never-before-seen bosses. Dig Dug is armed with a series of thrilling weapons to combat monsters as well as elements from the environment including rolling rocks, quicksand and flowing lava.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4lbn.jpg'),(3605,'Margo: The Bean Adventure','2021-06-02','Adventure, Indie','iOS','Will You Rescue Margo\'s nation or not? Margo is a bean that was living in peace with his family, but peace could not last so long! An evil sun attacked Margo nation and turned them into black rocks. Now Margo will ride this adventure to rescue his nation by defeating the sun. But through his adventure, he will go through a lot of different puzzles, fight monsters and bosses. 43 levels included. 8 bosses fights with different stages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j4m.jpg'),(3606,'Petals','2022-10-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Petals is a first-person photography game, developed as part of an ARG promoting Gun Interactive\'s The Texas Chain Saw Massacre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p08.jpg'),(3607,'Death Flush','2020-09-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Haunted by the memory of his grandfather\'s death, Ronnie must face his greatest fear - peeing alone. Is the legendary Toilet Seat Killer really dead? Can Ronnie hold it a little longer?\n\nFeaturing wooden voice acting, cryptic puzzles, and bathroom puns to last for days, Death Flush is spine tingling retro style terror.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o79.jpg'),(3608,'Spacelords: Sööma Deluxe Character Pack',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Sööma, acolyte of the enigmatic Algia Creed, is now available in Spacelords. Followers of this cult worship the god Fëhb, the Great Red Worm of the sands of Mars. It is said that sand touched by Fëhb provides its followers with the power to ease the pain of others, at the expense of suffering it themselves.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3609,'Forever World Cup Simulator','2024-08-22','Simulator, Sport','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The simulator lets you select 50+ tournaments at the same time, including EURO, World Cup, Nations Leagues, and AFCON. Its unique \"forever\" feature allows simulations to run indefinitely, with 220+ national teams\' attributes evolving dynamically. You can create new teams with a powerful editor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pvb.jpg'),(3610,'Crusader Kings III: Content Creator Pack - North African Attire','2024-01-23','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inspired by historical fashions of the North African Middle Ages and authentic Berber style, “North African Attire” adds new clothing, headgear and designer patterns.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i6d.jpg'),(3611,'The 9th Charnel',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A first-person survival horror game, The 9th Charnel is filled with a rich and frightening atmosphere. While exploring the many mysteries of this world, you must survive- whether you do it through stealth or by using weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5oxb.jpg'),(3612,'Crash Boom Bang!','2006-07-20','Puzzle, Quiz/Trivia','Nintendo DS','Crash Boom Bang! is a party game developed by Dimps and published by Vivendi Universal Games in Japan and by Sierra Entertainment internationally for the Nintendo DS. It was released in Japan on July 20, 2006, in North America on October 10, 2006,[1] in Europe on October 27, 2006, and in Australia on November 2, 2006.[3] It is the only game in the Crash Bandicoot series to be developed by a Japanese company and the first to be released in Japan before North America. It was also the final game in the series to be released in Japan.\n\nCrash Boom Bang! is the first game to be released exclusively for the Nintendo DS, and the second party game of the series, after Crash Bash. The game\'s story centers on a multi-millionaire who uses the characters of the series to unearth a powerful object dubbed the \"Super Big Power Crystal\". The game has received largely negative reception from reviewers, who criticized it for having unoriginal, dull gameplay and poor controls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55s8.jpg'),(3613,'Street Food Restaurant Owner','2025-04-17','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','You don\'t need Mishelin Star to create the best restaurant in the world. Who says street food can\'t be delicious?\n\nStart a real street food restaurant in your city and make it a legend. It\'s all for your beloved customers and let everyone visit you and find something tasty. Make this place trendy and watch your business grow!\n\nExpand and upgrade your restaurant. Every guest will feel the fusion of the simple street food and amazing taste. Be a perfectionist and create something unique even in such a trivial place.\n\nManage the restaurant - add tables and new thematic spaces. Open new zones and add new dishes. Experiment with the menus and the ingredients. It\'s all up to you!\n\nLet everyone taste and fall in love with your delicious street food!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9axu.jpg'),(3614,'War Saber',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','War Saber is a physics-based VR saber combat game that allows players to engage in intense duels featuring full dismemberment. Combine your saber fighting skills with a number of powerful abilities to become the ultimate warrior.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hqv.jpg'),(3615,'Romopolis','2016-05-18','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Construct an idyllic ancient Roman city with plenty of houses and keep your residents happy by providing all the services they need. You\'ll be rewarded with money, fame and honor. You can work your way to the top in the comprehensive campaign mode or you can create and play your own custom scenarios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yom.jpg'),(3616,'Stone Crawler','2019-05-20','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Windows 10 rpg developed in C which takes influence from rpgs such as Shin Megami Tensei, Persona 2, Final Fantasy, and Dragon Quest','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s2t.jpg'),(3617,'Arise: A Simple Story','2019-12-03','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Set out on an emotional journey through the bittersweet lives of two people where memories come alive and time bends to your will. Lose yourself in moments of happiness and overcome every hardship as you relive your life’s story. A story of joy and sorrow. A simple story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ekb.jpg'),(3618,'Portal: A Computer Novel','1987-01-01','Adventure, Indie','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, Mac, DOS, Amiga, Apple II','Home, a biological computer. The final link to the past and the only conduit to the future. But Homer is dying and access grows weaker moment by moment. Will you discover where everyone has one or will the doorway to humanity close forever, leaving you totally alone?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oke.jpg'),(3619,'The Line','2020-08-04','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The line, is a game with puzzles integrated into the narrative. The story takes place in a dystopian future, where the sea level rose so much that it flooded most of the planet, thus collapsing societies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43xm.jpg'),(3620,'World of Warcraft: 15th Anniversary - Collector\'s Edition','2019-10-08','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Celebrate your part in the online community that changed the course of gaming history. This limited-edition collector\'s set contains a trove of collectible items to commemorate World of Warcraft\'s 15 th Anniversary.\n\nRagnaros Statue\nBehold Ragnaros, he who was ancient when this world was young! Bow, mortals, before this 10+ inch immortalization of the Firelord himself.\n\nOnyxia Pin\nAdd to your pin collection and adorn your home with the head of Onyxia, Broodmother of the Black Dragonflight.\n\nMap of Azeroth Mouse Pad\nGaze upon the realms your character has explored these past 15 years while you prepare for the next adventure.\n\nFine Art Prints\nReach into Azeroth\'s vivid past with this selection of frameable fine art prints.\n\n30 Days of Game Time\nReturn to Azeroth with 30 days of game time to aid you on your next adventure.\n\nAlabaster Mounts\nTake to the skies with these sculpted beasts:\nAlabaster Stormtalon (For Alliance characters)\nAlabaster Thunderwing (For Horde characters)\n\n*These mounts are not available in World of Warcraft Classic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vyz.jpg'),(3621,'Venture Valley','2020-10-13','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Venture Valley is an esports-style multiplayer game that lets you pit your business savvy against friends and competitors. Slam down cards that will leave your opponents scrambling to deal with their muddling effects - or use the cards to bolster your own enterprises! Build your empire from scratch, starting with a dog walking business. Then, grow it by creating a successful mini-golf, pizza parlor, drone delivery service, robot factory, and other exciting companies. Earn money and reinvest in your hustle by upgrading your HQ, showing everyone who’s really the boss!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3okz.jpg'),(3622,'Trivia Vault: Mixed Trivia 2','2018-02-13','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the Trivia Vault contestant! Play as a contestant in a gameshow called Trivia Vault: Mixed Trivia 2 and bring your thinking hat. Answer mixed category trivia questions as quickly as you can, the faster you answer the higher the cash value.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44z5.jpg'),(3623,'The Crow\'s Eye: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4dun.jpg'),(3624,'Higanbana no Saku Yoru ni: The First Night','2016-07-27','Adventure, Visual Novel','Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Higanbana no Saku Yoru ni: The First Night is the first installment of the Higanbana no Saku Yoru ni visual novels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7avw.jpg'),(3625,'The Battle of Sol','2015-07-01','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Battle of Sol is an intense space action game where you participate in epic capital ship battles, thrilling dogfights, space station raids, and much more as you liberate humanity\'s solar system from enemies determined to bring us to its fiery end. Pilot multiple ships while commanding your fellow wingmen to attack and defend as you battle a ruthless enemy across parts of our solar system and beyond!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bs6axpjdu9ocouzfvecr.jpg'),(3626,'Mortal Kombat 11: Spawn','2020-03-24','Fighting','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch, DUPLICATE Stadia','\"Al Simmons, once the U.S. government\'s greatest soldier and most effective assassin, was mercilessly executed by his own men. Resurrected from the ashes of his own grave in a flawed agreement with the powers of darkness, Simmons is reborn as a creature from the depths of Hell. A Hellspawn. Now he is thrust into the world of Mortal Kombat, where he will fight for supremacy against all Kombatants.\"\n\nMortal Kombat 11: Kombat Pack owners had a week of early access to this DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25dg.jpg'),(3627,'Afterlife VR','2022-05-13','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation VR2, Windows Mixed Reality, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Afterlife VR is a deeply immersive horror game that will let you experience the true essence of terror.\n\nPlay as Adam Bernhard, a young rookie police officer on a routine night patrol, who receives a call that will change his life forever.\n\nWhat is really lurking behind the door of a well-known mental facility, where Adam’s younger sister, Allison, was recently sent? Is there any connection between missing patients and hospital workers and the groundbreaking study about the Indigo Children phenomena?\n\nUncover the secrets hidden deep within the Black Rose mental hospital walls, where most of the patients pose a threat to themselves and to others. Look into the eyes of pure madness intrinsically linked with this place and its history.\n\nWill you dare?\n\n– Immersive first-person horror game built from the ground up for VR\n– Blood chilling story that will make you question your own senses\n– Innovative puzzle design, taking advantage of both the motion controllers and the protagonist\'s telekinetic abilities\n– Enjoyable and scary encounters with enemies – fight them with your firearm and/or your psychokinetic powers\n– Explore the mysterious Black Rose hospital and immerse yourself in its twisted story','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co571z.jpg'),(3628,'Search for the Secret Keys','2002-07-09','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It\'s a dark and stormy night when Mickey and friends drop in at a haunted house looking for directions; the front door slams shut, locking the group in, and the five of them spread out to search the house for keys. The house is haunted by three friendly ghosts that only Pluto and the player can see; Shaky, Quaky and Clyde, who assist the group by making keys available as Mickey and pals solve six puzzles.\n\nSilverware dances, a stuffed bear yawns and stretches, spiders scurry about as the player clicks on items in the six rooms; often two characters will converge in a room and hold a short conversation while the player is idle. Gameplay uses the mouse; to move from room to room the player clicks where the cursor becomes an arrow - at the edge of the screen, on the staircase and the secret passageway.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fp1.jpg'),(3629,'Voxelgram 2','2025-12-31','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 3D nonograms game where solving puzzles feels like sculpting in three dimensions. Reveal voxel models as you complete each challenge. This edition adds puzzles in two colours and procedurally generated puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iqq.jpg'),(3630,'Fossil Fighters: Champions','2010-11-18','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo DS','In this dino-tastic adventure, players get some hands-on time to hunt and clean fossils, and revive and battle vivosaurs. A fossil park is hosting a large-scale tournament in which competitors enter vivosaurs created from dinosaur fossils into competition. Fossil Fighters from all over the world battle their vivosaurs against one another to find out who will be crowned champion.\n\nPlayers excavate and clean fossils. New giant fossil rocks (containing complete dinosaur fossils) and odd fossil rocks (which are two-sided) add to the fun of the cleaning process.\nOnce the fossils have been cleaned, they can be revived into Vivosaurs, which players can then arrange into teams for battles. The better the fossils have been cleaned, the more powerful the Vivosaurs are in battle.\nStrategy is key in battles. Players must put forth teams of three vivosaurs, then rotate their positions to maximize their power advantage over opponents.\nNew “super evolver” vivosaurs evolve into new forms with the help of gold fossils.\nPlayers can compete in matchmaking battles or upload their best team to see how it fares against others. Players can also download additional vivosaurs and events.\nUsing DS Download Play, one player who has the game can link up wirelessly with up to three other Nintendo DS owners within range and cooperate to expertly clean fossils together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ejl.jpg'),(3631,'Captain 13 Beyond the Hero','2017-09-29','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Captain 13 - Beyond the Hero is an endless arcade shooter set in multiple galaxies of the universe. You are Captain 13, the sole survivor of a voyager fleet sent with the mission of clearing asteroid clusters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a8m.jpg'),(3632,'Ada: Tainted Soil','2025-06-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the world of Ada, a story-driven single-player 2D top-down action RPG with fast-paced combat and stunning visuals to enjoy. Combine different weapons, spells, and skills to overcome all obstacles in your way. Be prepared for the unexpected.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c5c.jpg'),(3633,'Candy Creeps','2022-10-27','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as Elma and Harper, two tweens who may or may not have inadvertently summoned the evil Pumpking, who has swiped the whole neighborhood\'s Halloween candy and hidden it inside his army of tiny, adorable decorative gourds. Smash the pumpkins to find candy, then chow down. Once you\'re turbo-charged with sugar, transform into a costume-clad avenger and bash the Pumpking until he explodes! Master four unique levels and go for a high score in one- and two-player modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u1z.jpg'),(3634,'Gambaru Amabie-chan','2020-04-09','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is an action game created by Wanpaku Pixels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57c2.jpg'),(3635,'Inquir P.T.',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A post-apocalyptic story-based action adventure game. Fully customizable weapons and a high mobility character. Zombie horde mode and full of action, blood, brutality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hbg.jpg'),(3636,'Arcade Archives: Libble Rabble','2021-11-11','Puzzle, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Libble Rabble is an action puzzle game released by Namco in 1983. Control Libble and Rabble to bashishi various characters. When you bashishi all the Topcups that pop out of treasure chests, a miracle will occur that allows you to enter a bonus stage. Remember treasure chest locations and aim for a high score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mfv.jpg'),(3637,'Lost Lands: The Wanderer','2021-05-07','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','For years now, the sailors and pirates of the Lost Lands have been talking about a ghostly ship sailing in the heart of a storm. This vision disappears as soon as it comes to life, yet witnesses still spread rumors... About a huge octopus traveling with the ship. About its owner, the captain. About the earl\'s rage and his curse. And the sorceress they believe is responsible.\n\nMeanwhile, somewhere else in space and time, Susan finds a strange pirate chest with the compass of the worlds inside, and a note begging for help. It\'s time for her to return to the Lost Lands again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hvj.jpg'),(3638,'The Return: Survival',NULL,'Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Return: Survival is an action packed Co-Op shooter for up to four players with dinosaurs and a lot of badass weapons. Can you survive the green hell?\nIf you are brave enough, explore the deadly island and stand your ground in 2 different epic modes and a great pool of different maps against hordes of blood thirsty dinosaurs, like the Velociraptor or the T-Rex.\nYou can choose one of four classes with three unique and powerful abilities to defend yourself and your team mates against any giant lizard.\nHunt those dinosaurs, earn cash and buy yourself better equipment to make sure to survive. To achieve that goal, you can use a wide range of different SMG\'s, MG\'s, Sniper Rifles, Rocketlaunchers, Grenadelaunchers and even Flamethrower.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j1i.jpg'),(3639,'Our Personal Space','2014-12-31','Simulator, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A visual novel where your choices determine the future of your relationship and the success of your colony. Choose how to treat your husband and how to spend your free time in this frontier sci-fi story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qpk.jpg'),(3640,'Blind Quest: The Enchanted Castle','2020-02-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome Wayfarer! Your journey in the world of Blind Quest begins NOW! Blind Quest is a fantasy role-playing game where you will guide Nathan the mercenary in an epic adventure across the lands of Aetherna.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20hr.jpg'),(3641,'Cordels & Spells',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Cordels & Spells is a thrilling cooperative twin-stick shooter action adventure based in the culture of cordel literature. Explore procedurally generated maps, battle gangs of bandits, and recover the Enchanted Cordels, magical artifacts that hold the history and essence of Northeast Brazil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ib9.jpg'),(3642,'HyperBlade',NULL,'Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','HyperBlade is a tactical sword fighting game inspired by titles such as Jedi Knight, Blade Symphony, and Super Smash Brothers. Combining physically-based tracers with mechanics found in traditional fighting games such as grapples, and combos HB aims for a unique blend of arcade and competitive','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43ff.jpg'),(3643,'The Noroi no Haibyouin: Tojikomerareta Kao no Nai Shoujo',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3644,'Kitty Survivors: Rogues of Catmere','2023-05-31','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kitty Survivors is a funny action rogue-lite game where you slay hordes of creatures, create overpowered builds, use elemental skills and craft stupid weapons. Join a growing guild of misfits with a thirst for milk, hired to protect the Kingdom of Catmere!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jio.jpg'),(3645,'Asteroid Shooter VR','2017-06-06','Shooter, Arcade','Android, iOS','You are one of the representatives of the warlike race from the planet Epsilon Prime. You need to get to your planet and clearing the way from asteroids. \n  \nUse Google Cardboard or any other VR device for the game. During the game in VR mode you do not need to use the joystick or other buttons, the control is performed only by the rotation of the head and a delay of the sight on the button. \n \nThe game also has a ranking system and the ability to get achievements. \nWho will be the best destroyer of asteroids? Complete with your friends! \n \nTHE GAME CONTAINS: \n- 6 unique planets; \n- 17 space stations ( with different number of enemies ); \n- endless amount of missions ( after 50 gameplay missions ); \n- 6 types of asteroids ( with different resources ); \n- 5 different types of weapons; \n- the ability to add additional weapon to second slot; \n- 5 health upgrades; \n- about 12 unique achievements; \n- 5 different leaderboards types.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fnl1lspjasvqp6s6fkka.jpg'),(3646,'Rude Racers','2019-10-24','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rude Racers offers exciting bike racing with crazy fighting action, mad weapons and fast gameplay! Play through a tremendous variety of innovative challenges and establish yourself as the meanest racer on the street in this smashing new pick-up-and-play racer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r78.jpg'),(3647,'Emoji Puzzle Action: Codename: ManKun','2025-04-05','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a future transformed by tech, social media and emojis dominate communication. But a disaster strikes when the \"Emoji Virus\" turns emojis into aggressive beings, overrunning the world. You, \"ManKun\", the sole survivor and ex-security expert, must now save humanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n0s.jpg'),(3648,'Raiders of the Broken Planet','2017-09-22','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The game is being released as set of standalone campaigns that can be played in any order. The Prologue is the base of the game, which contains 2 full missions, and will be permanently free on the games release.\nThe first campaign, Alien Myths, will be available for purchase the same day. It contains new characters and missions with a story that will continue to build on the games world.\nThere is a total of 4 campaigns currently announced and they are designed to be playable in any order.\n\nThe game is a short campaign based co-op shooter that has multiple missions linked together. It has a 4v1 game mode that puts your team against a random online opponent who will also be using one of the games playable characters while interfering in your missions as you play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24pq.jpg'),(3649,'Table Tennis','2002-10-24','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co957n.jpg'),(3650,'SpongeBob SquigglePants 3D','2011-05-26','Arcade','Nintendo 3DS','In SpongeBob\'s most crazy, creative adventure yet, be prepared to laugh your SquigglePants off as you tilt, flick, tap and draw through more than 100 Nanogames set in six zany worlds. SpongeBob SquigglePants puts you in the driver\'s seat for a dizzying series of lightening-speed Nanogames, giving you mere seconds to finish one before moving right on to the next. Within this rapid-fire succession of challenges, SpongeBob SquigglePants exposes players to never-before-seen SpongeBob art styles from the Nickelodeon vault. SpongeBob SquigglePants also lets players digitally draw, paint, color and choose from dozens of SpongeBob-themed stamps to create a masterpiece worthy of a place in Patchy\'s own collection of SpongeBob art. The entire game is hosted by SpongeBob\'s biggest fan, Patchy the Pirate, in a never-before-seen live action experience for an added level of under-the-sea silliness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n0u.jpg'),(3651,'Namco Museum Collection 1','2020-06-08','Arcade','Evercade','The Namco Collection 1 is a compilation cartridge for the Evercade which contains 11 classic Namco games.\n\nGames included:\n- Pac-Man\n- Galaxian\n- Dig Dug\n- Xevious\n- Star Luster\n- Libble Rabble\n- Mappy\n- Battle Cars\n- Metal Marines\n- Quad Challenge\n- Mappy Kids','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xyu.jpg'),(3652,'Just Cause Collection','2013-12-12','Shooter, Racing, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Experience two of the most explosive open-world games of all time in one adrenaline-fuelled collection.\n\nYou are Rico Rodriguez, The Agency\'s most powerful weapon. BASE jump, parachute, hijack, blow up, race and skydive across hundreds of square kilometers of island paradise in your mission to kickstart a nation\'s revolution by ANY means necessary.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h17.jpg'),(3653,'Yardlings','2020-04-17','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Yardlings is a local multiplayer battle arena about vegetables in a garden! Build an adorable army, place yourself strategically on the battlefield, using special abilities, capturing potted plants (outposts) and big seed-shooting flowers while you try to gain control over the yard!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27lb.jpg'),(3654,'Dragon\'s Lunch','2017-09-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dragon\'s Lunch - the real time Roguelike game. Explore the depths to get your golf ball back, but be careful you don\'t end up as Dragon\'s Lunch!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29cd.jpg'),(3655,'Ib','2024-03-14','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Ib is a remake of the original 2D exploration adventure game, featuring new puzzles and graphics, a new soundtrack, many improvements, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nn3.jpg'),(3656,'100 Italy Cats',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','100 Italy Cats - Join the cutest adventure in the Italy themed locations full of cats! Explore the charming hand-drawn artwork of Italy places and Cats as you embark on a quest to find 100 adorable cats hidden throughout the game. Can you find them all?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rah.jpg'),(3657,'Virtual Rides 3: Salsa',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7a2i.jpg'),(3658,'Superfighter','2001-11-28','Fighting','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9540.jpg'),(3659,'9 Lives to Defend','2024-06-20','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Face a pest infestation and survive until Loki\'s parents return from their trip! Defend the house with your 9 lives. Choose upgrades, and play with different versions of Loki, with unique weapons and abilities to fight this war ^.^','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7q87.jpg'),(3660,'March of War','2014-05-02','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The year is 1947. The world lies ravaged by war. Align yourself with one of six warring factions and fight for global domination in a world where borders rapidly shift as battles are won and lost.\n\nThis is March of War. An online turn-based strategy game set in a dieselpunk world where strategy and firepower rule the day. Take command and lead your army into 3D battlefields that allow you to assess the war-zone from every angle. Deploy a wide range of vehicles, infantry and artillery where their specific weapons can be most effective.\n\nDestroy your enemies and capture their territory to advance through the ranks of your faction. Rise high enough and you’ll have the honour of joining your faction’s High Command, or perhaps even be voted Faction Leader. Achieving High Command or Faction Leader status expands the game into an intricate web of political allegiances and betrayals, where your decisions directly influence the course of the war as you strive to lead your faction to global domination.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lbkvotruozxhipvrnued.jpg'),(3661,'Ride','2015-03-27','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','Bikes from the world\'s most beloved motorcycle manufacturers, breathtaking races, and a round-the-world trip taking in 15 different locations: all this and more in the new videogame: RIDE.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r5e.jpg'),(3662,'Sqrl Golf II','2001-08-16','Sport','Web browser','Golfing with squirrels!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9577.jpg'),(3663,'Solar Expanse',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore the Solar System. Mine and drop asteroids. Colonize and terraform. Lead the space race and compete with other corporations on your way to profit. Watch the expansion of human race over the centuries. Then go beyond and conquer the galaxy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rnj.jpg'),(3664,'Hats and Guns','2025-12-31','Strategy, Tactical, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hats and Guns is a roguelite deckbuilder set in the Wild West. Play as different characters with unique gameplays. Upgrade your cards and collect powerful weapons and relics as you attempt to survive in the heart of a dangerous procedurally-generated desert.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hn3.jpg'),(3665,'VetVR: Veterinary Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','As a brand-new veterinarian, you\'re tasked with the responsibility of saving animal lives while building your clinic\'s reputation. Play through real-life veterinary training, discover Easter eggs and unlock rewards as you learn all you need to treat emergencies, heal wounds, and diagnose illnesses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co648q.jpg'),(3666,'DekaBlox Arena',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3667,'R2R: Rewire to Revolt',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','A teenage hacker with the unique Flipper Zero device stands against a bloody AI dictatorship in a post-apocalyptic Eastern Europe, where a cyber-technology war rages for human consciousness. Use hacking, parkour, and stealth, to stop this genocide.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mil.jpg'),(3668,'Cooking Tycoons: 3 in 1 Bundle - Extended Edition','2025-02-21','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3669,'Wrestling With Emotions','2016-06-08','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Quest For The Perfect Match','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yof.jpg'),(3670,'Lazergoat: Invasion','2018-05-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Martians have invaded the Earth and enslaved our animals, but worst of all, they made Lazergoat angry. Now, he wants revenge!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3671,'Picture Cross','2015-05-14','Puzzle','iOS','Solve the puzzle to paint the picture! Now with over 1,100 fantastic Picture Cross puzzles.\n\nPICTURE CROSS (also known as \'PICROSS\', \'Nonograms\', \'Hanjie\' and \'Griddlers\') is the classic picture logic puzzle enjoyed by millions worldwide.\n\nHere you\'ll find an epic collection of hundreds of brain-stretching Picture Cross puzzles ranging from Easy to Expert difficulty.\n\nEach puzzle you complete reveals another square of a detailed-packed Hidden Scene.\n\nDownload free and start your Picture Cross adventure!\n\n\nHOW TO PLAY\n\nUse the number clues at the edge of the grid to determine which squares to fill in, and gradually reveal the hidden picture.\n\nWe\'ve included a quick and easy tutorial to get you started.\n\n\nSUPPORT\n\nPlease select the HELP option from the Options menu (the gear icon in the top right corner of the game screen) if you require assistance.\n\nIf you still have questions about the game or require assistance, please email: community@appynation.com\n\nPicture Cross is free to play, but contains optional paid items to unlock content more quickly.\n\nFacebook: /BigPuzzles - Twitter: @BigPuzzles','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qav3tryw9cxaovix6ntl.jpg'),(3672,'Kyukyoku Senki Gikadiver',NULL,'Sin género','PlayStation','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3673,'Garters & Ghouls',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3674,'World of Tanks Modern Armor - Tactical Expert','2025-03-11','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','If one gun allows you to launch a blistering assault, what can you do with three? Take command of the Orochi O-Ni and find out!\n\nThe Orochi O-Ni is a massive heavy tank for World War II mode that boasts multi-turret functionality. Switch among its three turrets to discover new tactics and unleash the full potential of its firepower.\n\nTactical Expert also gives you the Gunpei Takeda Commander, a formidable figure that you can customize with Skills to optimize your tank\'s performance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ix6.jpg'),(3675,'Where Is Here: New Home',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A sci-fi, survival horror and first-person game. The player will encounter numerous of creatures and characters that involves a mystery to be unraveled on all worlds, finding clues and going through portals. The player progresses through exploration and may die if they fail to avoid the monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5htc.jpg'),(3676,'Vertebreaker',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A new game by the creators of Sonic Mania.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1x9b.jpg'),(3677,'World of Warcraft: Legion - Collector\'s Edition','2016-08-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Contents:\n- World of Warcraft: Legion — Full version of Legion on DVD.\n\n- The Art of Legion\n\n- Legion Behind-the-Scenes Blu-ray and DVD set\n\n- Soundtrack\n\n- Legion Mousepad, featuring Gul\'dan and Illidan\n\n- Digital in-game goodies\n\n- World of Warcraft – Illidari Felstalker Mount and [Nibbles] Pet — Stalk the invading demonic forces atop one of the Burning Legion’s own twisted hounds of war, and summon a delightfully demented companion to keep you warm by the fel fire—both available immediately upon pre-purchase.\n\n- Heroes of the Storm – Felstalker Mount — Charge down the lanes of the Nexus and wreak havoc on the opposing team astride this fierce fanged terror.\n\n- StarCraft II – Fel Protoss Portraits — Take back Aiur in infernal style with psionic-infused StarCraft II portraits of Illidan and Gul’dan.\n\n- Diablo III Wings of the Betrayer — Equip your hero with Illidan’s wings and strike terror into the hearts of Sanctuary’s demons.\n\n- Hearthstone Card Back — Your adventures in Draenor will be the talk of the tavern after outfitting your champion’s deck with this custom card back forged in the fires of Blackrock – available to Hearthstone players just in time for the launch of Legion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ydv.jpg'),(3678,'Pac-Man Mega Tunnel Battle','2020-11-17','Arcade','Google Stadia','Prove your mettle in the world’s biggest simultaneous multiplayer PAC-MAN experience! Jump into 64-player games and show everyone who\'s the leader of the PAC! Invade other players\' mazes, eat their dots and power ups - even other players! - and dominate the mazes! But watch out: viewers can vote on power-ups that can cause you - or your opponents! - to stumble on the field and be eliminated from battle! Invade, defend, and rack up high scores across a field of 64 interconnected mazes. Take advantage of brand-new power-ups, spy on neighboring boards, and much more! Spectator interactivity means even viewers are part of all the thrilling action! And customize your PAC-MAN and your home maze with fun skins to show off unique looks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j1t.jpg'),(3679,'Chaos Awakens','2021-04-24','Simulator, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Chaos Awakens is a re-imagination of the OreSpawn mod for Minecraft, it adds more bosses, armors, weapons, tools, dimensions, dungeons and so much more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co613i.jpg'),(3680,'Ghost Sector','2026-03-31','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ghost Sector is a survival horror game where you play as M-07, a prototype machine trapped in a cybernetic facility during lockdown. Outwit the automated defenses, search for answers to your origin uncovering secrets, solving puzzles, and upgrade your abilities while preserving your finite energy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jkb.jpg'),(3681,'Nicktoons: Battle for Volcano Island','2007-06-07','Sin género','Game Boy Advance','Nicktoons: Battle for Volcano Island is the sequel to the 2005 video game Nicktoons Unite! Players assume the role of up to 6 playable characters from numerous Nickelodeon shows, such as SpongeBob SquarePants, Danny Phantom, and The Fairly OddParents. The plot involves SpongeBob SquarePants, Danny Phantom, Timmy Turner (with Cosmo and Wanda), Patrick Star, Sam Manson, and Sandy Cheeks to protect the island from an all-new villain named Mawgu. Tucker Foley, Squidward Tentacles, and Jimmy Neutron also appear, but only as support and are non-playable. It was followed by Nicktoons: Attack of the Toybots a year later.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gb1.jpg'),(3682,'Sqrl Golf','2001-03-14','Sport','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9573.jpg'),(3683,'Sanity of Morris','2021-03-23','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Sanity of Morris - psychological horror adventure. Discover clues but stay away from the light, or you\'ll be caught. Try to stay sane in the search for your father, consumed by conspiracy theories about the government and aliens.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i9j.jpg'),(3684,'Gold Rush in the Oort Cloud','2017-07-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the SSGMC - Solar System Gold Mining Corp. You\'re going to mine a gold! Gold from asteroids.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bhy.jpg'),(3685,'Ghoul','2018-06-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What would you say regarding what you have been through; happenstance, or result of your actions ? We can not expect good things to happen to a thief who works with contracts, but this time what she will experience is even different from what you imagine. Help Nil fulfil her task and make sense of what is going on around her.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3686,'Casanova','1989-12-31','Adventure','ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC, MSX','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mxg.jpg'),(3687,'Vostok 2061','2023-12-20','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Vostok 2061 is a modern graphic vertical scroll-shooter. Gorgeous alien worlds, a lot of spaceships, bright explosions, secrets, various bosses, and a great soundtrack!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7io9.jpg'),(3688,'Lost Lands: Redemption','2022-01-03','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','“Lost Lands: Redemption” is an adventure game in the genre of Hidden Objects, with plenty of mini-games and puzzles, unforgettable characters and complicated quests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nmz.jpg'),(3689,'Expense','2022-10-11','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Balance chance and strategy to escape a procedurally generated maze of unique AI opponents in this first-person adventure/escape room blend. Follow your pendulum and try not to lose money; you\'re going to need it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5h1g.jpg'),(3690,'Anno 1800: Pioneers Edition','2019-04-16','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pioneers Collector’s Edition\n\nImmerse yourself in the world of Anno 1800 with the Pioneers Edition. This massive Collector’s Edition includes the following physical and digital content:\n\nPhysical content:\n\nAn exclusive Victorian-style Collector’s Box\nThe Art of Anno 1800: Fully enjoy the world of Anno 1800 with this 120-page Artbook featuring the stunning artworks created by Ubisoft Blue Byte Studio Mainz during the development of the game.\nExclusive Steelbook featuring a unique Anno 1800-inspired design (21x29,7cm)\nLithographs : Three exclusive, large-scale lithographs (27x21cm) created by fan-favorite Karakter Design Studio\nLetter from Hannah: Relive the game’s story driven campaign with this sealed replica of the letter that starts your journey\nGame Soundtrack : Enjoy your favorite tracks from the Anno 1800 Soundtrack anywhere you go, thanks to the game’s orchestral soundtrack\n\nDigital Content*:\n\nFull Anno 1800 game\nThe Anarchist DLC: Meet the Anarchist Dr. Hugo Mercier and decide whether he will become a powerful ally or a dangerous opponent. This new character comes with new quests and new items. Dr. Hugo Mercier also brings a new player portrait and a new company logo for you to customize your profile. Available Spring 2019.\nCompany logos : Make sure your opponents know you mean business when you start your adventure with one of these exclusive company logos','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x3w.jpg'),(3691,'Mars 2120','2024-08-01','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','MARS 2120 is a metroidvania with engaging melee combat inspired by classics like Super Metroid, Castlevania: Symphony of the Night, or Guacamelee! With the use of special abilities tied to elements like ice, fire, and electricity help Sgt. Anna “Thirteen” Charlotte navigate the colony and battle her way through the secrets of Mars','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98qz.jpg'),(3692,'Storm VR','2016-09-23','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Storm is an atmospheric survival game. This is the first, short introduction to a series of episodes of Storm. You wake up in an intense snowstorm. As you look around for ways to get out of the biting cold, to somehow find shelter, your body gets colder, your hands freeze up, and the storm intensifies. And as you slowly move forward a bigger question rises: who are you? Where are you? How did you get here?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h58.jpg'),(3693,'Industrial Firefighters',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Industrial Firefighters is the new edition of our well-known firefighter series. With modern graphics, new soundtrack and intensive atmosphere our well-known fire department series comes to new life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gvc.jpg'),(3694,'Beatmania','1997-12-10','Music','Arcade','Beatmania is a rhythm game developed by Konami. It is the first game in the BEMANI series ( which it was named after: BEatMANIa ). It is one of the few music games developed by the internal studio GMD (Game Music Division).\n\nBeatmania is played with a controller with one turn table and 5 keys, three white and two black. On the screen you will see bars moving from the top to bottom in columns representing each of the keys and the turntable. When the bars reach the judgement line it is time to scratch.\n\nThe game contain 7 songs, which is the lowest number ever in the BEMANI franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bz9.jpg'),(3695,'The Alliance Alive HD Remastered','2021-02-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Rise up and ignite the resistance in The Alliance Alive HD Remastered! Explore diverse realms, awaken new skills mid-battle, and forge alliances to challenge the Daemons that have taken over the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wfo.jpg'),(3696,'Ninja Gaiden: Dragon Sword','2008-04-25','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Nintendo DS','This action-adventure title is presented in a third person, pseudo-3D manner, meaning all the game-models are rendered in full 3D, but the world the player travels around in is pre-rendered. When played, the Nintendo DS is held sideways, as in Hotel Dusk: Room 215 and Brain Age: Train Your Brain in Minutes a Day!. The left screen shows the area map, while the right displays the main gameplay, when set for right-handed play, and reverse when set for left-handed play.\nSet six months after Ninja Gaiden, Ryu Hayabusa has rebuilt the Hayabusa Village. When fellow villager and kunoichi, Momiji, is kidnapped by the Black Spider Ninja Clan, he is forced to find her, while uncovering the secrets behind the mysterious Dark Dragonstones and their relation to the Dragon Lineage','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co404s.jpg'),(3697,'Destiny 2: Collector\'s Edition','2017-09-06','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Destiny 2 – Collector’s Edition offers the ultimate collection of physical and digital items. It Includes the Destiny 2 base game, a fully-wearable Destiny 2 – Frontier Bag, Expansion Pass, premium digital content, and a Cabal-themed Collector’s Box.\n\nBorn in the City, Hawthorne left as a teen to seek a life of freedom in the wilderness outside the safety of our walls. She has survived for years outside of Guardians’ protection, and has come to learn her true purpose: To provide shelter to humanity by helping them not only survive, but lead a better way of life. This is a frontier bag, as worn by Hawthorne. In it, you will find tools and a place to store the valuable equipment you uncover on your own adventures.\n\nFrom the makers of the acclaimed hit game Destiny, comes the much-anticipated sequel. An action shooter that takes you on an epic journey across the solar system. Humanity’s last safe city has fallen to an overwhelming invasion force, led by Ghaul, the imposing commander of the brutal Red Legion. He has stripped the city’s Guardians of their power, and forced the survivors to flee. You will venture to mysterious, unexplored worlds of our solar system to discover an arsenal of weapons and devastating new combat abilities. To defeat the Red Legion and confront Ghaul, you must reunite humanity’s scattered heroes, stand together, and fight back to reclaim our home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28ac.jpg'),(3698,'Scoot','2020-12-28','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scoot is a physics based scooter game made for all the scooter riders out there! Perform tricks, airs, flips, and make parks to share with your friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t4f.jpg'),(3699,'Soaring Machinariae','2021-06-10','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A girls\' adventure story, told through a traditional action RPG! Control Iris the Machinariae to explore fields and dungeons, and fight against monsters with sword combos, items, and special moves!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46xy.jpg'),(3700,'City of Brass','2018-05-04','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Armed with scimitar and versatile whip, lash, slash, trick and trap\nyour way through the City of Brass, a first-person rogue-lite of treasure, snares and ghoulish foes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j7v.jpg'),(3701,'Mining Mechs','2023-10-27','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Unleash your inner miner as you commandeer a high-tech Mining Mech! Mine for valuable resources and upgrade your mech for even bigger hauls as you explore the underground. Mining Mechs is a small game that you can play alone or with up to 7 friends in online co-op and offers 4-8 hours of gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g0q.jpg'),(3702,'Vampire: The Masquerade - Justice','2023-11-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR','You are a vampire. You strike from the shadows and drink the blood of both mortal and vampire prey. In a gritty main narrative that includes several side missions and dialogue options, explore a dark and mysterious Venice to improve your abilities and become the ultimate arbiter of justice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6knh.jpg'),(3703,'Divimera','2021-05-01','Point-and-click, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Divimera is an adult visual novel/dating sim game with point-and-click and sandbox gameplay. It is set in a Victorian fantasy world inspired by the work of H.P. Lovecraft and contains strong language, some elements of horror and a lot of pornographic images and animations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66wi.jpg'),(3704,'Whispering Willows: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ctj.jpg'),(3705,'Automachef','2019-07-23','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Automachef is an indie puzzle game in which you will have to build automatic kitchens for a robotic fast food tycoon who believes he\'s a human.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1o3b.jpg'),(3706,'The Chaser\'s Voyage',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Pilot the Chaser through dangerous interstellar terrain and shake off hostile pursuers in this 2D single-player sci-fi adventure. Transport clients from planet to planet in order to pay off your debt to a notorious pirate lord before it\'s too late!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co433r.jpg'),(3707,'Addled','2022-06-22','Puzzle, Indie','Playdate','Classic puzzling with some new twists','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3708,'Battle Moon Wars','2005-08-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Battle Moon Wars is a PC-made series of Super deformed Tactical RPGs created by Dojin soft developer and publisher Werk in 2005. Its popularity in Japan has given rise to a number of Battle Moon Wars games. The series has a basic similarity to the Super Robot Wars series and its Super deformed looks, as well as taking its crossover concept.\n\nThe game uses the crossover of Type-Moon\'s visual novel and anime series, including Tsukihime and Fate/stay night with several original characters made exclusive by Werk. Their involvement in the series are covered as Acts.\n\nThe game is completely translated, with the story content and interface all translated to English.\n\nKnown Type-Moon series included\n\nFate/hollow ataraxia\nFate/stay night\nFate/unlimited codes\nFate/zero\nKara no Kyōkai\nKagetsu Tohya\nMelty Blood\nTsukihime','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2im5.jpg'),(3709,'PBA Tour Bowling II',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3710,'Hello Lady! Superior Dynamis','2019-06-27','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','Hello Lady! Superior Dynamis, the “new noble school adventure” game, features character design by Hokuto Saeki, and scenario by Wataru Hino and Joo Shuudou. It bundles together the 2014-released PC visual novel Hello Lady!and the later 2014-released Hello Lady! New Division in a single package.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jo4.jpg'),(3711,'Grindshift','2022-06-29','Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grindshift is a stylized hoverboard game with ramps, rails and jumps. There are no gameplay objectives or unlockables, just endless hoverboard riding and score counting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dvo.jpg'),(3712,'Angel Killer','2023-12-17','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A non-linear murder mystery set in early 2000\'s with 22 different endings','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87v7.jpg'),(3713,'Icarly vs. Bigfoot','2010-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94og.jpg'),(3714,'Fitness Boxing','2018-12-20','Music, Sport','Nintendo Switch','Get off the couch and get moving with fun, boxing-based rhythmic exercises set to the instrumental beats of songs by popular artists, including Lady Gaga, Pitbull and Kesha. You can personalize your workouts by selecting from different fitness goals. Train your way, whether you\'re on your own, with a friend, at home, or on the go! Now you can work out anytime, anywhere on the Nintendo Switch system!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a1q.jpg'),(3715,'How do you like it, Elon Musk?','2020-02-20','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build your cosmodrome, construct a rocket and send it to Mars, trying to withstand difficult economic conditions, bureaucracy and corruption in Russia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wyk.jpg'),(3716,'Hybrid',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','These people aren\'t like you.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3717,'Void Witch','2021-12-31','Quiz/Trivia, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jhj.jpg'),(3718,'Valkyrie Profile','1999-12-22','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation','Valkyrie Profile is a role-playing video game developed by tri-Ace and published by Enix (now Square Enix) for the PlayStation. It was released on December 22, 1999 in Japan and on August 29, 2000 in North America. An enhanced port of the game was later released for the PlayStation Portable under the name Valkyrie Profile: Lenneth on March 2, 2006 in Japan, July 18, 2006 in North America, and April 27, 2007 in Europe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1u5x.jpg'),(3719,'Guilty Gear: Strive - Additional Character 6: Bridget','2022-08-08','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','This allows the character \"Bridget\" to be used in-game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ify.jpg'),(3720,'Tyrant\'s Blessing: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zjz.jpg'),(3721,'Dualis','2024-04-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dualis is a sci-fi horror thriller whose story takes you to an underground research complex. You will have to fight not only for your life, but also to understand if you really exist. What is consciousness and personality are the questions you will have to ask yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cj4.jpg'),(3722,'My Little Pony: Color By Magic',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Embark on a colorful adventure as twilight sparkle needs your help to restore the Museum of Friendship to its former glory. Color hundreds of images to gather enough memory stars to help rebuild and decorate the Museum of your dreams. It’s fun and easy to color all your favorite ponies and reminisce wonderful memories from My little pony: Friendship is Magic! Everypony to the rescue!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65ju.jpg'),(3723,'The Summoning','1992-12-31','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','The Summoning is an isometric-view fantasy role-playing video game developed by Event Horizon (later renamed DreamForge) and published by SSI in 1992.\n\nThe sequel to Event Horizon\'s first game, DarkSpyre, The Summoning replaced the random-generated dungeons of the previous game with pre-designed levels. The title featured numerous magic items, as well as a spell-casting system utilizing virtual hand gestures. The game also utilized \"runes\" as a way to magically gain abilities or items.\n\nThe game had several features typical of dungeon crawls, such as random treasure, weapon and armor options, treasure chests, and the use of a mannequin to visually aid in inventory management.\n\nThe dungeon in The Summoning was broken up into separate levels and sections, with different types of monsters (such as undead) and NPCs being found in each.\n\nThe featured weapon in the game is a large two-handed blade called \"Warmonger.\" When first found, it is rusty and not very effective. But by repeatedly using it to kill, the magical blade becomes an immensely powerful weapon. The blade is actually a sentient, evil being with bloodlust.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v5s.jpg'),(3724,'Purdy-Durdy',NULL,'Music, Simulator','Playdate','A tiny hurdy-gurdy simulator for Playdate.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3725,'MP1: Animal Crossing','2017-02-27','Card & Board Game','Nintendo 64','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3726,'Ganbare Goemon: Jetto GO! GO! GO!','2003-03-13','Sin género','Legacy Mobile Device','Ganbare Goemon: Jetto GO! GO! GO! is an action game developed and published by Konami for mobile phones and was released on March 13, 2003 in Japan. It is part of the Ganbare Goemon: Tsuukai Game Apli series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ty9.jpg'),(3727,'A Small Car','2011-02-24','Racing, Indie','Web browser','Stay on the road and get the small car (that is hard to control) to the end of the level. Can you drive fast enough and get three stars on every track to unlock the special bonus stage?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k9u.jpg'),(3728,'XAirports',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3729,'Add Town','2024-06-26','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','sliding puzzle game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8svz.jpg'),(3730,'Mickey\'s Toddler with Active Leveling Advantage!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','The comfortable setting of Mickey\'s neighborhood serves as an ideal learning environment for Toddlers. While interacting with Mickey and his friends, kids will learn about numbers, letters, colors and shapes as well as other age appropriate skills. Disney\'s Mickey Mouse Toddler is filled with activities that build self-confidence by means of continuous positive reinforcement from Mickey and his friends.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3731,'Senran Kagura Burst Re:Newal - Nyuu Nyuu DX Pack Limited Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','This edition includes the following\nGame: Senran Kagura Burst Re:Newal\nLuxury Booklet\nDrama CD\nStrap Set with Collection Box\nCharacter Card Set with DLC','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3732,'Tick Hop','2025-03-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Tick Hop\" is a time-based puzzle platformer where players control the Guardian of Time. Navigate through levels made of time fragments, solving challenges and unlocking the past to restore the future. Manage a dynamic countdown and use time-altering items to overcome obstacles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fzd.jpg'),(3733,'Megami Paradise','1994-09-30','Role-playing (RPG)','Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','Megami Paradise is a role-playing game by NEC Home Electronics and released in 1994 on the PC Engine Super CD-Rom. It was originally one of the reader-participation projects serialized in Dengeki PC Engine, and later OVA and games were released. The OVA is also sold in North America, but the game is sold only in Japanese.\nThe appearance and parameters of the character change with changing clothes. Wearing certain combinations of clothes makes it possible to use special techniques. Also, if you wear specific clothes set for each character, you can see a single picture called \"Zubapita graphic\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hfi.jpg'),(3734,'Survival RPG 2: The Temple Ruins','2019-04-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Android','A magical artifact lying among the ruins of a lost temple? Embark on a journey full of adventure, quests and exploration. You will need your survival skills in this retro 2d pixel art universe. Survival RPG 2: The Temple Ruins is the sequel of the first retro game Survival RPG: The Lost Treasure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ort.jpg'),(3735,'Project Lazarus','2022-06-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are the first party mech pilot of alien planet colonizers! Project Lazarus is a survival game with rogue-lite elements. Deploy and upgrade your mech to the metal!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xdz.jpg'),(3736,'The Hummingbird\'s Crown','2022-06-30','Point-and-click, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Wren is a hardworking book editor who has recently turned 30 and begins to ruminate about her life.\n\nHer only solace is gaming and her small group of 2 online friends, Kanaria and Lonan, who she sometimes chats and plays with.\n\n‘What does it mean to be an adult? Why does my job make me feel incomplete? Why do I feel like I don\'t fit anywhere?\'\n\nOn May 31st, taking advantage of an upcoming long weekend, Kanaria suggests they should finally meet in person at the upcoming GameCon, a medium-sized local game event from Solstice City.\n\nUnfortunately, the day of the event itself, a terrible accident happens at the Eon Building, the place where it\'s being held. Wren panics and doesn\'t know what to do until... huh?\n\nWhy is it suddenly May 31st again? Did she just go back in time?!\n\nStore page: https://prikarin.itch.io/hummingbirds-crown','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ihk.jpg'),(3737,'Namco Museum Archives Volume 2','2020-06-18','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Take a trip down memory lane and relive the magical times of the 8-Bit era with a collection of Namco’s hits and long-lost treasures in Namco Museum Archives Volume 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2c4s.jpg'),(3738,'Pogo3D','2023-10-09','Platform, Racing, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tough-as-nails 3D platforming using only your mouse! Bounce off platforms and even the walls to reach the next checkpoint. Go on a linear adventure through an interconnected world, or quickly test your skills in challenge mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d74.jpg'),(3739,'Craft Elements','2019-12-19','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Craft Elements is a first person minecraft-esque journey into the nuclear reactor design, periodic table and vaporwave world. It is a unique, simple and atmospheric sandbox puzzle game with a focus on complex simulation and calculations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nls.jpg'),(3740,'Earthbound Halloween Hack','2008-10-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','EarthBound Halloween Hack, or Radiation\'s Halloween Hack, also sometimes known as Press the B Button, Stupid! is a romhack of EarthBound made by Toby Fox and released in 2008 for starmen.net\'s Halloween Funfest. It was inspired by the Brandish series, where the hack\'s protagonist, Varik comes from. It is much shorter than the original EarthBound.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hu5.jpg'),(3741,'Slenderman: Lost Children','2012-11-21','Adventure, Indie','iOS','Play what people are calling \"quite possibly the scariest mobile game\" and \"finally a game worthy of the Slenderman mythos\". Can you find your child!? Is it too late? Is he another lost soul and victim of Slenderman? Only you will know when you follow your child\'s clues to find him.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98ew.jpg'),(3742,'Dead Cells: Road to the Sea','2022-01-06','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','This bundle contains the base game and all of the DLCs that have been released for Dead Cells so far: Rise of the Giant, The Bad Seed, Fatal Falls & The Queen and the Sea. So you will get 8 new levels and 5 new bosses with all their associated enemies, weapons & outfits on top of the original Dead Cells.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bql.jpg'),(3743,'Hallow Maze','2026-06-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hallow Maze is an epic action adventure through an intricate world submerged in war. Explore twisting caves, enormous palaces, battle unhuman horrors and help those in need, in a gothic hand painted 2.5D artstyle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kkn.jpg'),(3744,'Human Save Plan',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','This is a kind of dark RPG treasure brushing game. The affixes of props are randomly generated and can be exchanged at will. With the addition of the thinking system, players can make objects carry out specific AI logic through thinking output.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co630o.jpg'),(3745,'Yaku Slap','2025-12-31','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yaku Slap – A rogue-like card battler where you duel monsters, master Hanafuda combos, and slap down the perfect hand! Unlock new perks, and classes as you fight your way down the Flower Path to become a Yaku Master!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ckq.jpg'),(3746,'Phantom Fighter','1990-04-01','Fighting','Nintendo Entertainment System','Wacky Chinese phantoms, Kyonshies, are on the loose, wreaking havoc in eight villages. Phantom Fighter and his incompetent assistance are the only ones who can save the villagers from these zombie ghosts that get bigger and stronger as you get better. Answer tricky quizzes to acquire special skills from the Kung Fu Master. Then you can chop and kick your way to victory!\nBased on the movie \"Mr. Vampire\".\n\n-Over 15 types of powerful enemies\n-Sophisticated animation with smooth movement\n-Password memory feature for continuing play\n-Exciting full sound effects\n-Fun-filled dialogue and bonus quizzes\n-Eight villages filled with mysterious ghost-filled houses, cemeteries and academies','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ot4.jpg'),(3747,'Warzone',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3748,'Where Is My Mom','2021-08-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Where Is My Mom is a side-scrolling game tells a story about the fate of a girl who was stolen.The chapters are divided into stories that differ in gameplay and mechanics: the main mechanics of the game are puzzles but there are also stealth mechanics and horror elements at play as well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n63.jpg'),(3749,'Powerpuff Girls: Paint the Townsville Green','2000-11-28','Sin género','Game Boy Color','The Powerpuff Girls return to the Game Boy Color with their second game, POWERPUFF GIRLS: Paint the Townsville Green. This time around, the evil Gangrene gang is causing trouble in the city and it is up to Buttercup to battle through the town and stop them. Since she is known for her physical strength, Buttercup uses it throughout the game to destroy enemies and anything else that gets in her way. Of course, all this fighting can wear on a girl, but the power-ups scattered throughout the levels will help aid the fight. Along with the power-ups, there are collectable items hidden in the game as well. After collecting these items you can trade them with the other two POWERPUFF games via link cable. Help Buttercup save the day in POWERPUFF GIRLS: Paint the Townsville Green.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qbj.jpg'),(3750,'Things That Bounce and Explode','2021-03-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Things That Bounce and Explode is a fast-paced blend of brick-breaker and action RPG. Fight against the Blokolonian menace with an arsenal of mighty B.A.L.L.s, and master thousands of builds in this ever-evolving bouncing adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co313y.jpg'),(3751,'If U Seek Amy','2022-12-31','Music, Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser','An RPG about the Princess of Pop, Britney Spears.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98q8.jpg'),(3752,'The Soldat with Twin Arms',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co397i.jpg'),(3753,'Microsoft: My Personal Tutor 1st & 2nd Grade','2002-05-10','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Come along with Professor Presto on a fun-filled learning journey--from outer space to beneath the sea, to a museum brimming with adventure. Microsoft My Personal Tutor: 1st & 2nd Grade contains hundreds of activities, games, songs, storybooks, and characters to entertain your child for hours. With three full-featured CD-ROMs, it\'s a great value. This software offers the TutorAssist technology to provide your child with personalized instruction that uses engaging multimedia tutorials.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ulx.jpg'),(3754,'Chess88',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3755,'Toren','2015-05-12','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Toren brings poetry to life in an epic journey of growth, discovery and overcoming great hurdles. In Toren players guide Moonchild from birth to coming-of-age as she embarks on a dangerous journey of revelation and transformation. A distinct and unique art style, dark fantasy storytelling, innovative puzzles and beautiful soundtrack combine to make Toren a memorable gaming experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2by1.jpg'),(3756,'Phantom Tank','1983-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Atari 2600','In Phantom Tank (German: Phantom-Panzer), the player takes control of an assault vehicle in order to defend their \"energy base\" at the bottom of the screen from the attacking phantom tanks.\n\nThe game consists of three phases: the first phase takes place in a city and looks like a maze. It offers relative protection with the building walls. The second phase has the enemy tanks crossing two bridges over a river, but there\'s practically no cover. In the third and final phase, it\'s an all-out battle with the phantom tanks aggressively charging in on the player\'s base and no obstacles to stop them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co913c.jpg'),(3757,'Rascal’s Escape','2024-12-11','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Rascal\'s Escape is a co-op adventure game to satisfy your wanderlust.\n\nJoin the nimble Squirrel and the strong Bear on a wild journey. Jump, stomp, zoom through colorful cities following Rascal\'s clues. Travel Europe with your friends and experience nutastic moments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co929m.jpg'),(3758,'SnowRunner: Burning Bright Vinyl Wrap Pack','2021-05-18','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Customize your SnowRunner experience further with the Burning Bright Vinyl Wrap Pack, adding four exclusive skins for the Azov 5319, Azov 73210, YAR 87 and Voron AE-4380!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30lf.jpg'),(3759,'CryptoFarm','2018-09-14','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Develop your own cryptocurrency farm and see how good you are in the art of bitcoin mining. Install right equipment, hire personnel and monitor the exchange course!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3760,'Psalm 5:9-13','2024-03-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Psalm 5:9-13\" is a first-person psychological horror game with VHS effect. Be careful and attentive, there is something hiding in these rooms, something is watching from the darkness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7y8n.jpg'),(3761,'Vupechat',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Vupechat.com is a vibrant social playground where VTubers and anime fans connect through unique avatars and spontaneous mini-games. Meet new friends, play games like Doodle Duel, Would You Rather, and Chibi Chess, and collect rare Charms to unlock special abilities. Step into world of creative self-expression, where every encounter is an adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9od9.jpg'),(3762,'Pokémon Go: Season of Celebration','2020-12-01','Sin género','Android, iOS','The first implementation of seasons intersected with the Winter season in Northern Hemisphere and Summer season in the Southern Hemisphere. It intersected with the GO Beyond update which added Kalos Pokémon, Levels 41 to 50. A theme of this season is celebrating Pokémon from all regions with events focused on each of them. The event will end with a brand new global event experience as the 25th anniversary of Pokémon approaches','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bgb.jpg'),(3763,'Drakan: Order of the Flame','1999-07-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Centuries ago, mankind and dragons battled, causing chaos. Eventually, the Order of the Flame formed, uniting humans and dragons as protectors of peace. Under their guidance, Drakan flourished in magic and harmony.\n\nDrakan features a unique engine that seamlessly combines outdoor and indoor scenes. Play as Rynn, wielding swords and bows, or ride Arokh, using fiery breath as a weapon. Engage in battles against dragons, spiders, scavengers, and Wartocks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28fi.jpg'),(3764,'Tales of Herring Lake',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Welcome to Tales of Herring Lake, where your favourite Sunday fishing show meets Alfred Hitchcock. Grab your gear and start shaping your story!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42wg.jpg'),(3765,'Miden Tower: Experience & SP x2',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','All characters\' experience and SP gained increases by 100%.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3766,'Indiana Jones\' Greatest Adventures','2010-04-23','Platform, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Wii','Indiana Jones’ Greatest Adventures is a 1994 platform video game released for the Super Nintendo Entertainment System. It is a video game adaptation of the Indiana Jones films Raiders of the Lost Ark (1981), Indiana Jones and the Temple of Doom (1984), and Indiana Jones and the Last Crusade (1989). The game was developed by Factor 5 and published by JVC Musical Industries, Inc. The story is told through cutscenes and text and is mostly faithful to the movies. Its release coincided with that of Super Star Wars: Return of the Jedi, also released by JVC and LucasArts and in the same platform style as the Super Star Wars trilogy.\nA Sega Mega Drive/Genesis port of the game was apparently completed and ready to be released between summer and autumn of 1995, and was reviewed in GamePro (#73, August 1995, rated 3.5 out of 5.0) and in Germany\'s GAMERS (November 1995 issue, rated 2 (B Grade). Like many third-party titles near the end of the Genesis\' life, however, the game was shelved and was never released.\nThe game was re-released for the Wii\'s Virtual Console service on November 16, 2009 and in the PAL region on April 23, 2010 for 800 Nintendo Points.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26e1.jpg'),(3767,'Indiepocalypse #42',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Issue #42 of a monthly indie game anthology collecting games from 10 developers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7t1c.jpg'),(3768,'Haunted Halls: Green Hills Sanitarium Collector\'s Edition','2010-10-28','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a decrepit mental asylum and find your missing boyfriend in Haunted Halls – Green Hills Sanitarium!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gtx.jpg'),(3769,'Medieval Legacy','2025-04-28','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Start as a humble commoner and guide your family through generations in this family sim meets city builder. Climb the ranks of society to become the most influential family in the land. With wit, strategy, and a bit of luck, build your legacy - just try not to trip over your ambition!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ran.jpg'),(3770,'Sirens',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a deadly Siren and hunt down the most dangerous sea creatures that have ever swum in the depths of the oceans! Experience a fascinating journey through the world as seen from the perspective of Sirens at various stages of their evolution.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7j2d.jpg'),(3771,'Kaiju Princess 2','2024-12-12','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Journey across the galaxy with a cute kaiju and her ravenous appetite as you collect ingredients to cook up the ultimate feast!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r46.jpg'),(3772,'Seventh Circle','2019-09-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Seventh Circle is an urban fantasy visual novel about friendship, love, and fighting people with magic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40z8.jpg'),(3773,'Shadow Hearts: Covenant','2004-02-19','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 2','Shadow Hearts: Covenant is a direct continuation of Shadow Hearts; Its story starts a year and a half after the first one in the midst of World War I. It focuses on Karin Koenig, a lieutenant in the German Army who assists in the exorcism of a man able to turn into demons, Yuri Volte Hyuga. However, after learning of Yuri\'s caring nature, Karin goes on a quest with him to save him from a spell inside him and are drawn into a conflict involving demons of demonolatry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hz4.jpg'),(3774,'Battleship: Official Edition','2018-08-14','Strategy, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','You sank my battleship! The official version of the classic Hasbro board game of naval combat! Challenge other players in Classic Mode or in the all-new Commanders Mode - a fast-paced, strategic and exciting variation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9egh.jpg'),(3775,'Rocket Monsters',NULL,'Shooter, Racing, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Rocket Monsters is a Free to Play blockchain game built on Unreal Engine 5. The Rocket Monsters Universe is filled with a variety of characters, weapons, and vehicles which are all player owned. Engage in PVP and PVE across multiple areas with endless possibilities. Experience a robust game economy where players will be introduced to vibrant and meaningful gameplay! We are the next evolution, A player centered Universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nsu.jpg'),(3776,'Grand Dad Overthrows Bowser','2020-11-12','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Join Grand Dad on his quest to save Peach from Bowser, Bowser is at it again and since Mario and Luigi is nowhere to be found it’s up to Grand Dad to save the day! So what are you waiting for for, jump on this little adventure to take care of Boswer and his shenanigans, do it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65xz.jpg'),(3777,'Re:Awaken',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Purify negativity from the afterlife and bring together the children of fate! Swear oaths to divine beasts and wield powerful twilight abilities in this anime inspired roguelite adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fo5.jpg'),(3778,'Warfare Reloaded','2010-02-05','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Saudi Arabia, one of the worlds leading oil suppliers and a key U.S. ally, has been taken over by a highly organized group of radical terrorists. The government is in a state of collapse and turmoil and you have been chosen to lead the United States armed forces to restore control.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rdv.jpg'),(3779,'SteamWorld Heist: Hatbox - Hatful Eight + 2',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ce7.jpg'),(3780,'Dweller\'s Empty Path','2020-07-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A small RPG Maker game exploring the life of a lost being from another world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u0q.jpg'),(3781,'Ernie\'s Big Splash','1986-03-01','Puzzle','DOS','Ernie\'s Big Splash is a 1986 Sesame Street video game starring Rubber Duckie. The goal was to create a series of connections, for Rubber Duckie to make his way to Ernie\'s bathtub. The game teaches basic logic, directions (North, South, East and West) and sequencing.\n\nThe video game was created by CBS Learning Systems, for ages four to six.\n\nThe game was originally made for DOS, but was released for the Nintendo Entertainment System in 1989. On NES, it was released on the cartridge Sesame Street ABC, supplementing Letter-Go-Round. At some point in time, the game was released for the Unisys ICON operating system, a platform commissioned by the Ontario education system. No copies of this format exist, as the last ICON computers and software were destroyed in the early-2000s.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52nx.jpg'),(3782,'Everything','2017-03-21','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Everything is an interactive experience where everything you see is a thing you can be, from animals to planets to galaxies and beyond. Travel between outer and inner space, and explore a vast, interconnected universe of things without enforced goals, scores, or tasks to complete. Everything is a procedural, AI-driven simulation of the systems of nature, seen from the points of view of everything in the Universe. Narrated by the late British philosopher Alan Watts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24rj.jpg'),(3783,'The Bear: A Story from the World of Gra','2025-03-04','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Home is where the stars are. An interactive bedtime story, for anyone who needs one. Take the bear and the little one on a deeply meaningful journey, as you experience stories of togetherness, of letting go and of finding a place you belong.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ggz.jpg'),(3784,'City Block Builder','2022-08-17','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience a beautiful tycoon management style game that allows you to build your own business empire in Los Angeles during the 1950s era. Manage businesses ranging from Movie Theaters to Jazz Clubs to Restaurants and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n6p.jpg'),(3785,'Gremlins 2: The New Batch','1990-12-31','Platform','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga, Amstrad CPC, MSX','As Billy, you set off to rescue Gizmo the Gremlin from Clamp Tower skyscraper, where Dr. Catheter plans to viciously experiment with him. Unfortunately, Catheter gets word of your plans, and mixes up a whole new batch of vicious gremlins. As a result, your mission is now one of destruction and avoidance.\n\nElite\'s implementation of this is a five-level side-view action game, in which you run around avoiding or shooting the gremlins. Each level has a secret object which must be collected. Bonus items such as extra lives and time can be collected, as can improved weapons, and credits to spend on a new weapon after each level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5be4.jpg'),(3786,'AI Roguelite','2022-03-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Infinite text-based RPG, powered by cutting-edge AI technology which runs on your graphics card.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5755.jpg'),(3787,'Heracles no Eikou III: Kamigami no Chinmoku','1992-04-24','Role-playing (RPG)','Wii, Wii U, Legacy Mobile Device, Super Famicom','Heracles no Eikou III: Kamigami no Chinmoku is the third installment of the series. Originally released for the Super Famicom, it was released on the Japanese Virtual Console in 2007 and a mobile phone in 2008 by G-Mode.\n\nThe game\'s plot and setting are loosely based around various episodes included in Greek mythology. The hero begins the game in a state of total memory-loss, but discovers that he has somehow acquired a mysterious power that shields him from all bodily harm, essentially making him immortal. The only clue the hero has in discovering his own identity is a mysterious dream that he sees every night, and he begins his journey in search of the location shown in the dream.\n\nThe gameplay borrows various motifs from ancient mythology, particularly the concept of immortality. An immortal character can execute certain actions that other characters cannot, like jumping off high cliffs without being injured. The game\'s writer, Kazushige Nojima, composed a storyline where the hero encounters the Greek gods while trying to discover his own true identity. Like the game\'s predecessor, Heracles no Eikō II: Titan no Metsubō, the game focuses on its rich storyline rather than the game system, which does not differ significantly from other role-playing video games of the period.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4cap.jpg'),(3788,'Last Heroes 4','2017-04-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enjoy another classic 16-bit RPG from Warfare Studios of Vagrant Hearts, Ashes of Immortality and Valiant fame, with the epic finale of the Last Heroes saga!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jno.jpg'),(3789,'Frontline Fury: Trenches, Mud & Blood',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter the brutal battlefields of World War II in this grim, blood-soaked top-down shooter. Fight your way through relentless enemies with brutal gunplay, gritty visuals, and intense, unforgiving combat. Every bullet counts as you move through the trenches, leaving a trail of destruction and gore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g19.jpg'),(3790,'Double Dragon III: The Sacred Stones','1991-02-22','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, Family Computer, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System','Billy, Jimmy, and the whole Double Dragon gang fight for the Sacred Stones to save in the world in yet another beat-em-up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wuo.jpg'),(3791,'PoliPlanet',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Set on small procedurally generated planets, PoliPlanet is a unique first-person city building game. Discover new planets, gather resources, craft, explore, and build to create a thriving interplanetary civilization!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kt1.jpg'),(3792,'Total War: Warhammer II','2018-11-20','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Total War: Warhammer II is a strategy game of titanic proportions. Choose from four unique, varied factions and wage war your way; mounting a campaign of conquest to save or destroy a vast and vivid fantasy world. This is a game of two halves: one a turn-based open-world campaign, and the other intense, tactical real-time battles across the fantastical landscapes of the New World.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rsu.jpg'),(3793,'Nonsense Asteroid','2020-03-19','Arcade','Android','Nonsense Asteroid is a mobile arcade space action game. Stranded in space, the player needs to control a damaged spaceship in an asteroid field. The objective of the game is to survive the longest by evading asteroids, space debris and other obstacles. With simple control mechanics, using only one button, the player must direct the ship through space, the ship constantly rotates on its own axis, following the direction you are pointing the moment you press or hold the command button. The longer you survive, the more difficult it gets and the music gets more intense.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28gt.jpg'),(3794,'Bowl-Ed Over',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3795,'Project 13','2024-05-31','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Welcome to Project 13, a unique Walking Simulator that challenges your perception and instincts in a dystopian world. In this immersive experience, you step into the shoes of a disposable Probant, devoid of rights and a future, tasked with navigating a mysterious, repeating Hospital Corridor.\n\nYour objective is clear: report any anomalies encountered during your walks. The catch? A single mistake means starting anew. Only by consistently reporting accurately can you progress through the enigmatic corridors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kzz.jpg'),(3796,'Sand Storm','1992-01-01','Shooter, Arcade','DOS','This game, set during the Gulf War, features a series of twenty missions in various Middle East locations. There are three mission types: Scud Defense, Jet Defense and Tomahawk Offensive. The defense-type missions are reminiscent of Missile Command -- jets and missiles appear on the screen, and the player must defend cities on the ground by directing defensive fire with the mouse. In the Tomahawk Offensive missions, the situation is reversed -- the player is given a target and must hit it by maneuvering a missile around defensive fire, launching it towards the ground as soon as it is lined up with its intended target.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/aa2derkwvdgucfhx5epn.jpg'),(3797,'Hardware Excalibur','2024-05-31','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hardware Excalibur is a simulation game based on DIY assembly with ‘hardware components’. Explore endless possibilities! Use hardware parts to piece together your ‘Excalibur’, unleash your imagination, and create your own legendary weapon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8f9h.jpg'),(3798,'PowerWash Simulator: The Muckingham Files','2023-04-18','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Muckingham Files will take you to never-before-seen places from the original universe of the base game, with new characters, locations and stories. Get to know more about your stomping ground and its inhabitants as the most in-demand power washer in town.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f0u.jpg'),(3799,'Orwell: Ignorance is Strength Seasons Complete',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3800,'Super BoxMan Ultra','2017-11-13','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Super BoxMan Ultra is a classic Sokoban puzzle game where you play as worker in a warehouse, your job is to position the boxes at the designated locations to complete the level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dkr.jpg'),(3801,'Corrupted','2018-09-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Corrupted - the mix of arcade, RPG and visual novel. Fight off the hordes of monsters and break through to the truth. Discover new skills and improve your combat arsenal. The ground under your feet will be strewn with skulls of enemies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nk7.jpg'),(3802,'MX vs. ATV: All Out','2020-09-01','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','All Terrain, All Vehicles, All You! MX vs ATV All Out is the complete off-road racing and lifestyle experience! Find your Rider Style at your private compound, Free Ride across massive environments, and compete in the best series events!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nb2.jpg'),(3803,'Fushigi no Gensoukyou Chronicle','2012-08-11','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Five previous works have been reborn as a single story piece.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6n2p.jpg'),(3804,'Plunder Panic','2022-09-16','Fighting, Platform, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Plunder Panic is a swashbuckling, up to 12-person local multiplayer arcade game where two rival crews battle for supremacy on the high seas. Defeat the enemy captain, scuttle their ship, plunder enough booty or end up shark bait in Davy Jones’ Locker!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vgf.jpg'),(3805,'Surf\'s Up','2004-05-25','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co957j.jpg'),(3806,'Persona 2: Eternal Punishment','2000-06-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Persona 2: Eternal Punishment is a role-playing video game developed by Atlus, and chronologically the third installment in the Persona series. Eternal Punishment takes place in the fictional Japanese city of Sumaru, and is a direct sequel to Persona 2: Innocent Sin. Taking place a year after Innocent Sin, the game follows reporter Maya Amamo as she investigates the Joker Curse, a malign phenomenon where people\'s wishes and rumors are coming true and causing chaos. During her investigations, she and others who join her gain the ability to summon Personas, personified aspects of their personalities. The gameplay features turn-based battle gameplay, where characters use their Personas in battle against demons, and a separate Rumor system, where rumors spread around the city can influence events in the characters\' favor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6k6n.jpg'),(3807,'Romero\'s Aftermath','2015-09-24','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive against the odds in a giant sandbox MMO world featuring lush forests, dry desert plains, peaceful meadows and the eerie zombies that inhabit the world.\n\nScavenge for guns, supplies, survival items and crafting materials in various zones including cities, farms, military bases, abandoned outposts, forgotten rest stops and hundreds of small encampments left behind by survivors before you.\n\nBuild and protect your shelter, harvest crops, learn crafting blueprints and store your items on our server in your Global Inventory or hide them in a stash box in the world.\n\nBe a civilian, a trader, a protector of peace, a ruthless bandit or combination of them all. Customize your character with hundreds of visual cosmetic items including Headwear, Facewear, Shirts, Jackets and Pants. Swap your cosmetic items at any time on the fly, unlock weapon skins and show everyone in a safezone that you know where to find the rare items.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ehiiffdt8tn47yibbtc6.jpg'),(3808,'City Turn','2024-07-29','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','City Turn is a 2D single player, turn based game. The player is competing against a program (AI) in finding the same 5 images in the given order. Player can win/loose points and be hit by the objects. Buildings are stored differently for each game on loading game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3809,'Wolfie\'s Break Out','2021-09-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A retro-inspired brick breaker game that takes players on a nostalgic trip down memory lane. With its classic arcade-style graphics and upbeat chiptune soundtrack, the game is designed to transport players back to the golden age of video gaming.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nc4.jpg'),(3810,'Code Has Price','2024-04-01','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Buy Commands. Make a program. Collect more coins. Repeat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7atb.jpg'),(3811,'Korean Drone Flying Tour Danyang-gun','2025-02-06','Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','A simulation game where you directly operate a drone based on actual drone flight footage! You can enjoy the actual beautiful natural scenery in high definition','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ait.jpg'),(3812,'Shadowgate: Special Edition','2014-08-21','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Special Edition Pack includes Shadowgate and The Special Edition Upgrade DLC','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8km3.jpg'),(3813,'Ultra Age','2022-04-27','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Ultra Age follows the story of a young warrior named Age, who embarks on a mission to save humankind from extinction. He must use his blades to cut through robotic and mutant foes, explore futuristic locales, and unravel a vast conspiracy concerning the fate of the planet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t7e.jpg'),(3814,'Daemonical','2018-08-15','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Daemonical is an asymmetrical horror multiplayer game in which a group of people find an unfinished demon summoning ritual. With the demonic entity released upon the island, the players must find a way to send it back to hell or end up slaughtered. \n \nNever knowing which one of them has become possessed by the demon, it is their decision to make on if they want to team up and trust each other or try surviving alone. \n \nThe humans are played in the first-person mode. In order to exorcise the demon, they need to find the missing ritual components and bring them back to the alter. Their only alternative is hiding and surviving until the dawn, when the sunlight will purge the demon from the grounds. They can use fire, which hurts the demon, or weapons and tools hidden around the island to their advantage. While the demon can’t be killed, he can be crippled, stalled and distracted. \nThe demon is played in the third person, needs to simply slaughter all the humans and prevent them from finishing the ritual. He is fast, agile, powerful and deadly. \n \nThe humans are stronger when they band together, but they are easier to find. Stay together or split up to avoid ending up in a group with a demon – it is for you to choose. \n \nWill you go for the missing ritual parts, or just try to hide until dawn? Will you help the others, or just be a lone wolf – the game leaves that up to you. \n \nWhen a player dies in the game, their soul gets separated from their body and they can float around the map in the shape of a glowing ball of light. He can light the way for the players, find the demon and follow him so the others can see where he is, or just lead the others to his body so they can be revived. \n \nDaemonical also features a positional voice chat, so you can tell the other players that are close to you your plan, or pick a strategy together, but be careful! The demon might be listening in. \n \nCustomize your character – pick your gender, choose between various player models, clothes, colors and symbols that you can put on your clothing. \n \n-Asymmetrical multiplayer \n-First person and third person playing mode \n-Dynamic time of day and weather system \n-Most of the map is procedurally generated \n-Tools and weapons randomly placed across the map \n-Big open landscapes \n-Positional voice communication \n-Fully customizable characters \n-Interesting locations and landmarks \n-Nonlinear gameplay \n-The most terrifying hide and seek experience in gaming \n-Scare your friends, or get scared with your friends \n-Multi-platform Support (Windows, Linux, Mac)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mrtb6rvejsxvku5oiaxx.jpg'),(3815,'Car Licence','1995-12-31','Shooter, Simulator','Sega Game Gear','Car Licence is an educational game developed to help users pass their driving test. The first section includes instructions on how to drive a car. The second section shows how to identify the road traffic signs. Finally, there is an endless mini-game in which the player keeps a line of cars from crossing a white line by shooting them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gax.jpg'),(3816,'Disco Elysium','2025-12-31','Adventure','Android','An upcoming port of Disco Elysium, adapted to a vertical, story-rich text adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j3v.jpg'),(3817,'Arté Mecenas','2017-08-17','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Command history as head of the Medici. Become the patron of such luminaries as Da Vinci and Michelangelo by using your wits to build your banking empire, establish your reputation, and commission artworks. But beware - your choices have consequences. Will you prosper or perish?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27j6.jpg'),(3818,'Ultimate Play The Game: The Collected Works','1988-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','ZX Spectrum','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83sh.jpg'),(3819,'Halls of Watershot','2023-11-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A deck-building ARPG in a dark fantasy setting. Find powerful items, wield elemental magic, and battle dangerous monsters as you explore a dark and twisted castle. Combines the decision making and variety of a card game, with the fast paced combat of an ARPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95da.jpg'),(3820,'Wild Streets','1990-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','The chief of Intelligence has been kidnapped.\n\nThe CIA is counting on your natural survival skills and the hunter\'s instincts of the Black Panther, the magnificent predator trained especially for your protection, to go and find the Chief.\n\nNot just one man\'s life is at stake, but the complete CIA operations network is being undermined.\n\nRight now, the Mafia\'s terrorists are torturing their prisoner in order to get the names of the agents leading the fight against organised crime and drug dealing.\n\nBoth you and your ally are deposited, by helicopter, near the spot where the Chief was last seen before his disappearance.\n\nPrepare yourself for a fight to the death, but remember to only use your gun when all else fails.\n\nYou are accompanied by a black panther and a magnum 357 against an armada of punks, assassins and trained to kill hit men.\n\nYou are the CIA\'s only hope..','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vk2.jpg'),(3821,'Ninja Avenger Dragon Blade','2017-03-17','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Join the amazing adventure of Hayashi in an incredible ninja universe with legendary clans, ancient dragons, incredible ninja wars. Help Hayashi bring peace once again to these troubled realms.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co250b.jpg'),(3822,'PowerWash Simulator: Cruise Ship Sun Deck - Summer 2024','2024-08-01','Simulator, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Cool off with sudsy, high-pressured water this summer in PowerWash Simulator’s latest Seasonal Special. Take a vacation from Muckingham’s mainland to clean up the sun deck of Crab Bay’s cruise liner following a messy departure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mc4.jpg'),(3823,'Noise Hunters','2020-05-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Noise Hunters is an action stealth video game where noise is your tool, but also your enemy. Don\'t let them hear you, HUNT or be HUNTED.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4728.jpg'),(3824,'My Girls’ Secrets','2023-12-04','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a \"casual\" game with beautiful painting style, go through the level and explore the mysterious world, in this world will meet all kinds of girls, in the face of their challenges you should make choices to make them succeed as your girlfriend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e5a.jpg'),(3825,'Devil\'s Hunt','2019-09-17','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The war between Demons and Angels takes you to hell and back in this third-person action game. You are Desmond, the one man with demonic powers who can decide the fate of our world by joining either side of the conflict.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1o1g.jpg'),(3826,'The Legend of the Dragonflame High School 2','2019-03-22','Role-playing (RPG), Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is a 2D action game that high school students fight. If you defeat an enemy by punching or kicking or throwing it to annihilate it, you can proceed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jh5.jpg'),(3827,'Runner','2024-01-03','Racing, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a motion capture game with a focus on parkour. The player\'s computer needs to be equipped with a camera to better experience the game. After starting the game, the camera will capture the movements of the human body in real time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hqa.jpg'),(3828,'The Sims 3: Outdoor Living Stuff','2011-02-03','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','For the first time ever, your Sims can get the best in outdoor luxury for their homes with The Sims 3: Outdoor Living Stuff. Whether they\'re decorating the perfect patio, setting the mood with a cool new hot tub, or firing up a state-of-the-art grill for the ultimate BBQ, your Sims\' outdoor decor is getting a boost. Give your Sims everything they need for a stylish and comfortable outdoor living space!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hgy.jpg'),(3829,'Katekyo Hitman Reborn! DS Flame Rumble X',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s05.jpg'),(3830,'Two Worlds II: Velvet Edition','2012-04-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Includes 2 items: Two Worlds II, Two Worlds II - Pirates of the Flying Fortress\n\nA breathtaking journey into Antaloor\'s past.\n\nAfter the downfall of Aziraal, God of Fire, the Dark Lord Gandohar has nearly achieved his objective to disrupt the balance between the elements. Dark magic surges into the land to fill the void. Recognizing the potential for complete control over the dark powers, Gandohar starts to use the power of Aziraal trap within Kyra, the descendant of the Orphans. Despite her ancestry, Kyra cannot endure the strain. With Antaloor already in his clutches, Gandohar concocts a new plan from his stronghold in Oswaroth. There are still those who struggle against the tyrant, hoping to shift the balance of forces in their favor. The fight for Antaloor continues...\n\nFive years have passed since dramatic events brought the whole world to the edge of the abyss. The hero is a prisoner in the dungeons of Gandohar\'s castle. His hopes of saving his sister vanished with his freedom. Just as despair threatens to overcome him, hope comes from where he would have least expected. The Orcs, a race the hero had always hated, have put together a rescue squad that frees the hero from his bonds. He emerges into a land desecrated by evil. He embarks on a journey to shed light on Gandohar\'s dark past, hoping to discover a weak point in his enemy\'s defense. If he fails, he will lose his sister forever.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cps.jpg'),(3831,'One Escape','2021-12-03','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, Web browser, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','One Escape is a puzzle platformer. You control three friends with different abilities, as they try to escape from jail.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qlh.jpg'),(3832,'Mizu no Senritsu','2009-12-24','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','Mizu no Senritsu is an otome game, developed and published by Kid, which was released in Japan in 2005.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5flr.jpg'),(3833,'Go Fight Fantastic!','2024-03-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Go Fight Fantastic! is a 3-player Action-RPG with heavy focus on teamwork and co-operation! Play as three unique characters (Tank, Striker or Healer), each with his/her own set of abilities - both over the Internet or with friends at home (couch co-op).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kax.jpg'),(3834,'The Mindvasion',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What\'s more frustrating than watching an army of monsters fail to wipe out humanity? Take control of a minion and turn the tide in a roguelite survival game. Just died? No problem—another creature is ready to be possessed. Keep the carnage going and make sure humanity meets its end!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lgn.jpg'),(3835,'Power Drift','1998-02-26','Racing, Arcade','Arcade, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, DOS, Amiga, Sega Saturn, Amstrad CPC, MSX','Power Drift is a kart racing game released in arcades by Sega in 1988. More technologically advanced than Sega\'s earlier 2.5D racing games, like Hang-On (1985) and Out Run (1986), in Power Drift the entire world and track consist of sprites. The upgraded hardware of the Sega Y Board allows individual sprites and the background to be rotated–even while being scaled–making the visuals more dynamic.\n\nDesigned and directed by Yu Suzuki, the game was a critical and commercial success upon release in arcades. It was subsequently ported to various home computers in Europe by Activision in 1989, followed by a PC Engine port published in Japan by Asmik Ace in 1990. It was not released on Sega consoles until the Sega Ages release for the Sega Saturn in 1998.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ht5.jpg'),(3836,'KitBashers 2: Multiplayer','2023-02-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','KitBashers 2 [Multiplayer] - Bad Dudes are attacking Planet KitKa. Queen Calica needs Your Help. The Kits are getting Bashed. You and Your team must take out ALL Aliens and Save the Planet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8eqo.jpg'),(3837,'Rocky Ride','2020-05-08','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the \"Rocky Ride\" arcade race! The \"Rocky Ride\" game is unpredictable tracks, crazy speeds and dangerous rivals. Upgrade your buggy car, choose any of a huge number of different tracks, and - go! To the prize places!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54js.jpg'),(3838,'Uno','1999-12-31','Card & Board Game','Game Boy Color','UNO, the classic card game of skips, draw-twos, and reverses, has come to the Game Boy Advance. There are two modes of play: Standard and Challenge. Standard has the players keep going until they reach a specified number of points, usually 1000. However, a player only scores points when he gets rid of all the cards in his hand. The points are the total value of the cards left in the opposition\'s hands. In Challenge, each player has a set number of points, and a player is eliminated when he reaches the point total. Play continues until one player is left standing. In both modes, you can play against up to three computer-controlled opponents. You can also play a single human opponent via a link cable. As an added bonus, there are three new cards that are not part of the real-world game. Now you can play UNO by yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4eri.jpg'),(3839,'Killing Floor 2','2016-11-18','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','In Killing Floor 2 players descend into Europe where the Zed outbreak has quickly spread and gained unstoppable momentum. Just one month after the conclusion of the events in the original Killing Floor, the clones are everywhere and civilization is in disarray; governments have collapsed, and military forces are gone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2coc.jpg'),(3840,'Bill Wants to Retire','2025-04-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','By day a cozy farming sim, by night a doom like boomer shooter. Farm, gather resources, and craft powerful weapons because when night comes so do the wolves. Can you protect your chickens and make it to retirement?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lmy.jpg'),(3841,'Eggs & Kings','2020-05-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SYSYGY`s Eggs & Kings - this is an unrealistic hardcore game that will explode your computer! Grab your gamepad and a lot of patience! You will have to destroy crowds of monsters, collecting their precious eggs.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3842,'Max Gentlemen','2014-08-21','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Max Gentlemen is an arcade-style extreme manners simulator about stacking hats, inspired by a spam email for male enhancement. Challenge your friends. Prove once and for all who is the most gentlemanly. Seriously though, 2 player is super fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sob.jpg'),(3843,'Shards of God','2023-07-16','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Shards of God is a retro hand-painted point and click murder mystery. It was originally started as part of AdvJam2023, and the full game was then finished within two months.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sa5.jpg'),(3844,'Yukkuri Labo: Touhou Yukkuri no Ragdoll Simulator Game',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3845,'Escalation!','2020-08-11','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A visual novel with 3D model animation featuring BDSM (Bondage, Domination, Sadism, and Masochism).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31ii.jpg'),(3846,'Swung','2020-05-22','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You play as the sword of the prince. Everyone in the land thinks the prince is brave and adventurous, but in reality his magical sword is all that.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lu2.jpg'),(3847,'Commander Keen Complete Pack','1990-12-14','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','Commander Keen: Invasion of the Vorticons:\n\nEpisode 1: Marooned on Mars (Dec. 14th 1990)\nEpisode 2: The Earth Explodes (1991)\nEpisode 3: Keen Must Die! (1991)\nCommander Keen\'s very first adventure, and the debut of id\'s groundbreaking side-scrolling technology. In the game you play the role of Commander Keen: the alter-ego of an eight year-old genius by the name of Billy Blaze. When Billy learns that the Earth is in danger, he dons his brother\'s football helmet and his homemade interstellar spaceship to become Commander Keen -- Defender of the Earth!\n\nCommander Keen in Goodbye Galaxy!:\n\nEpisode 4: Secret of the Oracle (1991)\nEpisode 5: The Armageddon Machine (1991)\nYou are eight-year-old Billy Blaze, boy genius to your neighborhood. Commander Keen to the rest of the universe. It\'s time to grab your trusty pogo stick and neural stunner, climb into the cockpit of your homemade Megarocket and blast off for the Shadowlands. To prevent the obliteration of life as we know it, you\'ll have to battle your way past deadly hazards and devious creatures, or end up as space toast.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wo2.jpg'),(3848,'Nachzehrer',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','[h1]Nachzehrer[/h1]Your fear of being in the dark comes true in this short single player horror game. You find yourself stuck at a power plant at night, when suddenly the lights begin shutting off. However, attempting to turn them back on may cause you to meet your fears.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3849,'Undercover Agent','2018-01-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Think fast and lie faster! When you go undercover to retrieve a deadly new bio-weapon, can you pull off the mission and escape with your life?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3850,'Fuego!','2015-10-28','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fuego is an online Mexican standoff game between two opposing players and their teams of gun toting animal-banditos. The game starts in the standoff where players position and orient their banditos one at a time, in double blind turns. During the standoff players are trying to unravel the impending shootout while identifying strategic linchpins and outsmarting their opponent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pqp0vxratvni9jj1we5l.jpg'),(3851,'Endless Dungeon','2023-10-19','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Endless Dungeon is a Rogue-lite Tactical Action game, set in the award-winning Endless universe. Recruit a team of shipwrecked heroes, plunge into a long-abandoned space station, and protect your crystal against never-ending waves of monsters… or die trying, get reloaded, and try again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mgb.jpg'),(3852,'Pro Yakyuu Family Stadium \'87','1987-12-22','Sport','Family Computer','Not so much a sequel to Pro Yakyuu Family Stadium than an enhanced rerelease with updated rosters. It was published by Bandai for the Famicom in late 1987.\n\nPro Yakyuu Family Stadium \'87 is the second game in Namco\'s long running Family Stadium series, also known as Famista. It\'s a traditional baseball game that allows one human player against the CPU, two competing human players and two competing CPU players in a \"Watch\" spectator mode.\n\nRather than being a full sequel to Pro Yakyuu Family Stadium the game is instead an updated version of the original, which was reflected in its lower price at release. It adds a few features and updates the official rosters for the athletes, but is functionally identical to the original Family Stadium. This specific type of annualization would become common practice for sports game franchises such as Madden NFL and NHL.\n\nIt\'s worth noting that this game is unrelated to R.B.I. Baseball 2 from Tengen. The original R.B.I. Baseball and Family Stadium were one and the same, the former receiving a name change to appeal to a Western audience, but after that initial game both franchises diverged. R.B.I. Baseball specifically favored more realistic looking athlete sprites while Family Stadium would persist with the cartoonish \"super deformed\" sprites.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/kkdooslw6ngurje9cdqd.jpg'),(3853,'Galactic Ruler Enlightenment','2024-04-18','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play campaign stories within the Galactic Ruler universe. Invade the galaxy to eliminate those who stand in your way or rally alien races to defend against the invaders. Fight battles at both planet and space across a procedurally generated galaxy. Use new unit control systems to manage your forces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vki.jpg'),(3854,'Case Hunter','2021-07-29','Sin género','Android, iOS','A succession of detective cases to make the city was plunged into chaos… Under the glamorous surface, the city hiding all kinds of evil.\n\nIn order to help people restore the peace life, as a great detective you are obliged to do it!\n\nFind out the truth, find the hidden clues, it\'s time to show your true wisdom!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ynh.jpg'),(3855,'Coffence','2017-03-14','Fighting, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Coffence is a fast-paced blend of fighting games and twin stick shooters with a dash of caffeine. Coffee is literally your health bar and every hit ejects the precious liquid up in the air for anyone to take. Experience dramatic reversals and tense stand-offs as you fight to the last drop with up to four players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vou2mbgjnpa3l8l0dle6.jpg'),(3856,'Project: SnowBound','2024-12-06','Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Hybrid-MMO made in a futuristic setting, where you can race or catch big air with your customized gear, and with your friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pyk.jpg'),(3857,'Tabletop Playground','2020-05-15','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Mac','Play any kind of tabletop game you want online! You make the rules in a physically simulated 3D sandbox. Or create your own games using the integrated editor and share them with the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xlr.jpg'),(3858,'Marshmallow Marvin: Greenwood','2025-03-11','Platform','Xbox Series X|S','Marshmallow Marvin on a sweet new adventure in Greenwood! Explore a magical forest full of vibrant mysteries, quirky creatures, and hidden secrets, where every corner holds a new challenge for our squishy hero!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9htb.jpg'),(3859,'Wrath: Aeon of Ruin','2024-02-27','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Blast, slice and shred through your enemies in this hardcore FPS inspired by the icons of the \'90s, powered by the legendary Quake-1 Tech. Taking place in a realm left to rot, take up arms, unearth long-forgotten secrets and hunt down the Guardians of the Old World.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7shc.jpg'),(3860,'Bring Your Own Oxygen','2021-05-10','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A game about disability and attempting to achieve the usual. Explore Elery as a 10 year old kid just trying to finish their town history project, and uncover the town\'s secrets, or don\'t. Bring Your Own Oxygen is a story about a chronically ill child trying to do what every other kid in Elery does, only to find some strange truths about the world around them. Whether you report it or not, the consequences may be more than you think.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mqz.jpg'),(3861,'Quur','2016-09-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Violence is not always your best option.\n\nIn a world sustained by a magical liquid, called the Color, you embody an ethereal being capable of manipulating it.\nEvery action you take will have a direct impact on the forest of Quur and on the creatures who inhabit it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/efftetxczli99aco70zt.jpg'),(3862,'Vampirii','2024-11-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Prowl homes, explore neighborhoods, overcome random encounters, reveal dark secrets, and make difficult choices as a newly-risen vampire in this text-heavy visual novel. Make friends and enemies while surviving this new life in which one night you are the predator, another - the prey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jni.jpg'),(3863,'Pitfall II: The Lost Caverns','1984-12-31','Platform, Arcade','ColecoVision, Arcade, SG-1000, Atari 2600, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, TRS-80 Color Computer, DOS, Apple II, MSX','Pitfall II: The Lost Caverns is the sequel to Pitfall and was released for a variety of systems during the mid-1980s including the SG-1000 in 1985. It was also ported to Sega System 1 arcade hardware by Sega. Gameplay is similar to the original game, but the levels are more maze-like.\n\nSega\'s version of Pitfall II was tweaked significantly from its western counterparts released for the Atari 2600, ColecoVision etc. The gameplay is largely the same, but there are many additions. These include a Lives system, mine-carts, balloons, and a final Demon boss. The increased specifications of System 1 hardware means the arcade version is much more detailed and allows the player to see more of the maze at one time. The SG-1000 version is directly inspired by the arcade game, and though cannot match the same level of graphical quality, it is arguably the nicest looking home port of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97gs.jpg'),(3864,'Gamedog','2012-12-31','Indie, Arcade','Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Enjoy twelve of the craziest games ever seen on Steam in this retro-inspired collection with full Xbox 360 controller support. Meet your soul mate in GIRL CUBE. Blast your way through the universe in AERODRUHIT. Zap players on the rink in HOCKEY LORDS. Avoid temptation and collect the coins in DEVIL\'S ROAD. And much more - there\'s TWELVE unique, all-new games in this insane, value-packed wonder fest. You WILL be barking at the moon in pleasure after gaming on your own personal GAMEDOG machine all night long. And best of all? Many of the games have high-score leaderboards! With 20 mind-bending Steam achievements, you\'re sure to have a playtime measured in WEEKS - ARROOOOOOOOOO!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xwd.jpg'),(3865,'RealSports Baseball','1982-10-01','Sport, Arcade','Atari 2600','Join the Atari Aces in the World Series of video baseball--RealSports BASEBALL! It\'s a hot day in the ballpark--you can see the hot dog and soda pop vendors making their way up and down the bleachers. The crowd roars after each pitch, and filling the stadium is the sound of \"STEERIKE! YOU\'RE OUT!\" Down on the field it\'s a different story--just you and the pitcher facing each other in an enormous diamond of brown and green.\n\nThe roar of the spectators fades into the distance as the pitcher winds up. His arm arches back, his leg goes up, and...THUNK! The ball flashes by and hits the catcher\'s glove at 90 miles an hour. \"STEERIKE!\" Another windup, another 90 mile an hour fastball, and \"STEERIKE TWO!\" Gripping the bat tightly, you stare down at the pitcher, see him wind up, and watch as the ball seems to float in slow motion down the field toward you. Everything falls into place as you swing with perfect timing, feel the contact, and see the ball sail over the right fielders outstretched glove and over the wall. HOME RUN!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b76.jpg'),(3866,'Wolverine and the X-Men','2009-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Leapster, Leapster Explorer/LeadPad Explorer','A spelling game for the Didj, the Leapster, and the Leapster Explorer. Players search for letters while fighting enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co980u.jpg'),(3867,'East Trade Tycoon: Inheritance','2024-10-21','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Eastern Trade Tycoon: Inheritance is a trading simulator game.In the game,you can from zero to hero.By trading markets, build a business,earn money,level up, investing accurately, and manage family to become a trading tycoon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z2c.jpg'),(3868,'The Lonesome Guild','2025-12-31','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','In a world consumed by loneliness, only friendship can save the day. Lead a quirky cast in this colorful single-player ARPG full of heart, battles, and bonds that change everything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g3s.jpg'),(3869,'Extraneum','2022-06-15','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight your way through mutated fiends and stop their progress in this old school FPS','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5i4w.jpg'),(3870,'Kaleidoscope','2020-08-20','Adventure, Visual Novel','Web browser','You are Lucas: a runaway teen in New York City’s Union Square, trying to make it to the hospital— with a dead phone and no money —before your father dies from cancer. This is a story about losing the fear to ask others for help, and the dangers of going it alone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s7e.jpg'),(3871,'Ultra Street Fighter IV: Challengers Horror Pack 1','2015-10-28','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Alternate costume pack for USFIV. Contains new horror outfits for Hakan, Makoto, Guy, Dudley, and Dee Jay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7svy.jpg'),(3872,'Babysitting Party',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vbp.jpg'),(3873,'Speaking Simulator','2020-01-29','Simulator, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Learn how to function in society with this hilarious game about a mildly evil robot with a prototype mouth. Communicate in actual human conversations by mastering the difficult and disgusting art of using a tongue and lips to make words.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wld.jpg'),(3874,'Bow to Blood','2019-04-02','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Captain your airship to victory in Bow to Blood, a VR experience where you compete in deadly battles, high-speed races, and wars of wits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8o0g.jpg'),(3875,'Mochi Sprint','2024-05-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have become a \"Mochi\". A perfectly round Mochi. Navigate through 2D scrolling dungeons, avoiding brutal traps, and aim for the goal (mortar). That\'s all there is to the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81vf.jpg'),(3876,'Invasion Survivors',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Sin plataforma','Invasion Survivors is a mix of bullet heaven and bullet hell with roguelike elements inspired by Brotato. Fight to survive challenging waves of enemies, choosing from a variety of weapons and characters to create your own way to battle invading alien hordes.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3877,'Violetta: Rhythm & Music','2014-09-26','Music','Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Nintendo DS','Violetta: Rhythm & Music is a video game based on the hit Disney Channel teen telenovela. Players experiment with music and rhythm on their way to become a singing superstar. Tap to the rhythm of Violetta’s hottest tracks. Disney Violetta: Rhythm and Music lets you show off your rhythmic and musical abilities as you score points while watching your favorite music videos from the hit TV series. Think you know everything there is to know about Violetta? Take the Violetta quiz and prove it. Are you ready to test your coordination and timing? Challenge yourself in “Pop Music” and interact with each song like never before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rzn.jpg'),(3878,'Star Parodier','2008-08-11','Shooter','Wii, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','Star Parodier is a vertical scrolling shooter, much like the Star Soldier games, and features many of the same conventions, such as collecting power-ups to upgrade the player\'s weapons, and facing several bosses and minibosses as they progress through the game. The game also features the 2 and 5 minute high score time attack modes seen in previous games.\n\nHowever, in parodying the hard sci-fi atmosphere of the Star Soldier games, Star Parodier takes a light hearted approach by featuring cute, cartoonish graphics and toning down the violence (for example, defeated enemies wave white flags in surrender). The players choose from one of three craft to play as in the game: the Paro Ceaser from Star Soldier, a giant flying Bomberman or an anthropomorphic PC Engine console that shoots HuCards and CD-ROMs at enemies.\n\nThe game was originally only released in Japan, though it was also intended to be released in North America under the name Fantasy Star Soldier.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ra7.jpg'),(3879,'Harvest Moon: More Friends of Mineral Town','2003-12-12','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Wii U, Game Boy Advance','Live the simple life as a farmer in Harvest Moon: More Friends of Mineral Town. This game is similar to the original Harvest Moon: Friends of Mineral Town, but now you can play as a girl who has left the city to pursue a life on the farm. You\'ll take part in growing crops, managing livestock, finding a husband, and raising children.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xm5.jpg'),(3880,'Hyperdimension Neptunia Re;Birth1 - DLC pack',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d4a.jpg'),(3881,'Adventure: Welcome to the Genre','2018-01-23','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When another threat to the Adventure section of the Gameworld starts looming, Thalia James is once again in pursuit of it. Discovery, puzzles and strangeness abound in this sequel to Adventure: The Inside Job and Adventure: All in the Game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3poo.jpg'),(3882,'R Wheel','2023-12-19','Arcade','PlayStation 4','R Wheel is a fast-pased one-button game. Try to survive inside a spinning wheel with spikes. Press a button to jump and hold a button to stay in the air longer. But your jumps release a wave that spawns the spikes. Collect bonus items to release a wave that clears the spikes and score points by clearing them. The game is over when you hit the spikes.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3883,'Total War: Pharaoh','2023-10-11','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Total War: Pharaoh features a choice of eight faction leaders from three rich cultural hubs, with unique playstyles and diverse unit rosters. Whether you’re charming the courts as a peerless diplomat, charging into battle as an unwavering commander or causing chaos as a fearless warlord, become a leader that history will remember.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jdb.jpg'),(3884,'Let\'s Sing 2019: Mit Deutschen Hits!','2018-10-26','Music','Wii','Your song. Your voice. Your moment! Light up the speakers with the latest version of the singing game Let\'s Sing. The fat playlist guarantees lots of fun for you and your friends. So choose your song and be the star of the next party, sing solo or together, among other things, German hits by artists such as Andreas Bourani with \"Auf Andere Weg\", Vincent Weiss with \"Feuerwerk\", Max Giesinger with 80 million\" , Silbermond with \"Leichtes Gepck\", EFF with \"Voice\". International chart hits by artists such as Shawn Mendez with \"There\'s Nothing Holdin\' Me Back\" and many other songs are available and of course legendary ones are allowed Karaoke classics like ABBA with \"Mamma Mia\" are not missing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m5b.jpg'),(3885,'G-Mode Archives+: Tantei Kibukawa Ryousuke Jiken-tan Vol. 4 - Shirasagi ni Aka no Hane','2023-03-09','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','This year, red leaves are dancing in the hearts of the white herons left behind. The story of assistant detective Shirasagisu Itsuna and her unknown past.\n\n“I… where was I trying to go? ”\n\nThis story begins with the protagonist, who has lost her memory, waking up in a mountain forest filled with autumn leaves.\n\nThe protagonist is rescued by a high school girl who calls herself ``Taihouin Izuna\'\' and learns that this is Momoshiro Village, a small village deep in the mountains of A Prefecture.\n\nWho am I? Why did you come to such a remote village? Why did I lose my memory?\n\nAs the protagonist works with Ituna to unravel her memories, she becomes embroiled in the inheritance issues swirling around the village.\n\nThis is a sad and heartbreaking incident that leads her to pursue her career as a detective. In this work, you can enjoy the first and second parts of \"Crimson Feathers on the White Heron\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68k2.jpg'),(3886,'RoadRunner',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','RoadRunner - This is everyone\'s favorite Runner, where the player needs to run from point A to point B','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3887,'Famicom Mini: Nazo no Murasame-jou','2004-08-10','Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Famicom Mini: Nazo no Murasame-jou is a Game Boy Advance video game released in 2004 by Nintendo. It is a remake of the Famicom game The Mysterious Murasame Castle, and little to no alterations were made on the game to stay faithful to the original title. The game was not released in America or Europe, and thus was exclusive to Japan. It was part of the Famicom Mini Series that re-released a variety of classic Famicom games for the Game Boy Advance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4394.jpg'),(3888,'In Next Life','2021-12-21','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','In next Life is a crafting, survival, and civilization building game, where collaboration with other players gives you very real advantages (it is possible to play alone, but it will be harder to survive). Your technology level starts at stone age level, and then it\'s up to you and your village members to invent and craft tools and technologies such as fire, baskets, spears, ..., in order to survive easier and to advance to new development stages. Time moves quickly and each game played equals one life, including birth, childhood, adulthood and old age.\n\nThe goal of each life is to contribute as much as possible to the survival and development of your village, children and future descendants. What you leave behind will be the foundation for others to keep building on. The flint spear you invented one life, could turn out to be the difference between survival and annihilation for your whole civilization. There are hundreds of objects you can craft, collect, cook, and eat. We intend to add at least 1,000 more during the Early Access period.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co502t.jpg'),(3889,'Russian Hunter',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Russian Hunter is the most realistic hunting simulator you\'ve ever seen!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5o90.jpg'),(3890,'Space Channel 5: Part 2','2011-10-05','Music, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Dreamcast, PlayStation 2','Hey there, SpaceCats – meet Ulala, the grooviest reporter in the galaxy! She’s got attitude, and she’s got moves. Help her get the scoop on an unidentified Dance Troupe that has captured thousands of people and is forcing them to dance!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mw1.jpg'),(3891,'Worms Reloaded','2010-08-26','Platform, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ten years on from Worms Armageddon and the turn-based comic mayhem continues in Worms Reloaded, an all-new edition available for PC through Steam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xmk.jpg'),(3892,'PlayStation Classic','2018-12-03','Sin género','Plug & Play','An official PS1 emulation system that came with 20 PS1 games in the form of a miniature PS1 system. Games output at 720p through HDMI, and the controllers use standard USB ports.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co530e.jpg'),(3893,'PositronX','2018-04-27','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','PositronX is a Rogue-lite First Person Shooter that emphasizes on strategic fast paced combat, innovative time and movement mechanics and detailed graphical quality, packed into a highly re-playable experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wox.jpg'),(3894,'reSnake','2022-12-10','Indie, Arcade','Playdate','Your classic snake with a timely twist!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3895,'Divine Wish',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Divine Wish is a fast-paced roguelike shooter with various classes and special abilities. Find your play style, survive waves of enemies, and use artifacts to change the tides of the battle. Die, learn, adapt!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l8k.jpg'),(3896,'Jumper Jape','2016-11-17','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Jumper Jape is a skill-based hardcore platformer game. The game is about getting from one side of the screen to the other without dying. This might sound easy enough but a single touch from a spike will instantly kill you and send you back to the start of the level. \nAll levels consists of a single static screen filled with hazards. If you think you have what it takes, give it your best shot. This game is not to be considered easy. \n\nThe story is told with the help of signs placed in the levels and it progresses as you complete levels and get further. If you rather just focus on the gameplay you can ignore the story all together, the choice is yours. \n\nThe recommended input method is a good gamepad/controller but keyboard works just as well if you prefer it. \n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nGAME FEATURES\n\nChallenging Gameplay \nLevel Editor with workshop integration \nPlay user created levels \nAchievements \nLeaderboards \nCloud saves (cross platform) \nJumping \nFull Gamepad Support (Xbox 360 tested) \nAuto Save System (Continue on level you quit on) \nA Bar \nBooze Powerups (Dont drink & drive kids) \nVaried Level Design','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/oh7ric9mhjyv2ibdbaeo.jpg'),(3897,'Frogs vs. Storks','2021-12-30','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','In Frogs vs. Storks you play with your little frogs that make a good and peaceful living in their beautiful pond. But, with the arrival of storks, the pond became a dangerous place to live! Storks are everywhere now just waiting for their chance to eat your frogs! Outsmart evil storks and once again make you pond a peaceful place to live in Frogs vs. Storks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7haw.jpg'),(3898,'BS SimCity: Machi Tsukuri Taikai - Scenario 3','1996-08-18','Simulator','Satellaview','The third episode (scenario) of BS SimCity: Machi Tsukuri Taikai.\n\nBS SimCity: Machi Tsukuri Taikai is a Downloadable 4-part Soundlink game for the Satellaview that ran between August 4, 1996 and January 31, 1998. The game was broadcast in as a rerun at least twice throughout the lifetime of the Satellaview, once in October 1996 and once in January 1998 as the winner of the third Player\'s Choice vote. BS SimCity is a pseudo-sequel to the original 1991 SimCity for the Super Famicom. There are four characters (Dr. Wright, Yoshio Kanetake, Mr. Roy, and Madam Mary) added. Four different maps are given to player every week, the objective is to develop the city within time the limit. During the game, voice of characters is told and happenings occur simultaneously to all players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4878.jpg'),(3899,'The Traveler\'s Path','2023-04-17','Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In \"The Traveler\'s Path\", you have to help the character reach his destination by swapping and rotating the pieces of the path. The pieces need to fit together correctly to form the perfect path. Test your thinking and logic skills in this challenging puzzle game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fgn.jpg'),(3900,'Detective Conan: Tsuioku no Gensou',NULL,'Adventure','PlayStation','The fifth and final overall Detective Conan game developed by Bandai for the PlayStation. There was also a Trial version of the game released under the name Detective Conan: Trick Trick Vol 0.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ziv.jpg'),(3901,'Crime Reaper','2021-04-19','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It\'s murder sudoku — solve crimes and impress Death in your new afterlife puzzle career!\n\nCrime Reaper takes the intrigue of murder mystery logic puzzles, like Cluedo and Inspector Parker, and combines it with the ingenuity and simplicity of Sudoku. There are over 16,000 possible murder scenarios that can occur and likely millions of different puzzle variations. To top it off, there are 14 different criminals to catch in Career mode with plenty of hijinks for you and Mx. Death to experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nnd.jpg'),(3902,'No Heroes Here','2017-10-02','Platform, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','No Heroes Here is a 2-4 multiplayer cooperative frenetic Castle Defense game where you and your friends must defend castles against hordes of enemies. Craft, craft more, craft some more, load your cannon and FIRE! In this frantic game for the survival of the kingdom of Noobland, players need to cooperate and coordinate at all times in order to achieve their goal!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uj8.jpg'),(3903,'Hungry Frog','2021-05-21','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game about eating bugs and dodging stingers! An entry into the Mini Jam 79: Frogs Jam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4beb.jpg'),(3904,'Abarenbo Tengu & Zombie Nation','2021-10-28','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','This revival is a dual set of Abarenbo Tengu, a game that was released in 1990 on the Famicom System and Zombie Nation, which was released in the following year. Save the world and fight to maintain the peace in this exciting side-scrolling shooter, now with new modes and functions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wz2.jpg'),(3905,'Jump Gunners','2020-01-13','Shooter, Platform, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Jump Gunners is the definitive couch combat game for up to 4 players, matching fast paced hilarious recoil jumping gunplay, with core gameplay that is easy to learn but hard master. Become the champion among friends, as you fight alone, or team up together against your foes. With multiple game modes featuring over 20 weapons, 80+ destructible environments, custom battles and single player challenges... Jump Gunners has something for everyone.\n\nJump Gunners is best played around the screen together with friends, but not so close to each other that you\'ll catch an errant rage induced fist or thrown controller!\n\nFeatures in Jump Gunners:\n\n1-4 player support\nUnique bullet jumping recoil mechanics\nSkill shots and mastery, become the champion among your friends\nCustomisable characters\nMultiple game modes, such as classic last man standing, team deathmatch and capture the flag\nHilarious multiplayer & single player minigames\nTough Single player challenges to test your abilities\n20+ over the top weapons, including Sniper Rifles, Flamethrowers, Rocket Launchers, Gauss Rifles and more!\n80+ Levels to conquer, with multiple themes and procedural content\nUse the fully destructible environment to kill your enemies\nCustom game mode, play the game how you want to play\nAll the content for one price including all updates and DLC. No paywalls, no loot boxes no cash grabs... just regular free updates and content','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yf1.jpg'),(3906,'Drive for Your Life','2019-04-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you have what it takes to drive through the middle of a zombie apocalypse? Push yourself to the limit and test your skills!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3907,'Haunted Houses','2022-11-11','Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Digital Eclipse re-imaged the Atari adventure classic in 3D and with 2-player co-operative play. This is a reimagined/sequel to Atari\'s Haunted House, being inspired by more modern takes of horror games, while retaining classic aspects of the original Haunted house featuring 4 new locations to explore.\n\nReleased as part of \"Atari 50 Anniversary Collection\" in 2022.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co621u.jpg'),(3908,'Gundam Breaker 4','2024-08-29','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Create your own ultimate Gundam in the newest Gundam Breaker! With more customizable parts than ever before, you finally have the freedom to build your perfect Gunpla. Test it in battle using the brand new dual-weapon system and break parts off of your enemies and add them to your collection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92s8.jpg'),(3909,'F.I.S.H.','2021-03-25','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','F.I.S.H. is an intense, fast paced rhythm game that relies on cues and quick reactions.\n\nYour job working for the Department of F.I.S.H. is to enforce road safety onto any fish swimming towards an area that they\'re not supposed to be in. You accomplish this if you can successfully input a STOP sign when the fish are close enough on screen; if you\'re too early or too late, said fish will swim by as if the STOP sign wasn\'t even there. How rude!\n\nAs your training progresses, you\'ll learn about the 5 different types of fish that are known to disregard road safety in the city of [CLASSIFIED]. They are: Tuna, Salmon, Barracuda, Sailfish, and Swordfish. Each fish has a unique timing that changes dependent on the speed of the music.\n\nAt the end of each level, you\'ll be judged based on a score out of 30. Score a 15/30 or higher, and you can move on to the next level (unless it\'s the last one). Score anything lower, and you\'ll have to retry the level until you get a 15 or higher.\n\nAs of the current version, F.I.S.H. features a singleplayer campaign of 15 levels. There may be extra levels added in future updates.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vfz.jpg'),(3910,'Ablaze','2004-06-19','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Those alien bastards have built a base in the mountains. Your mission: destroy it.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3911,'Taisen Bomberman Cross','2009-10-29','Arcade','Legacy Mobile Device','The seventh game in the Taisen ☆ Bomberman series. It is an expanded version of Taisen Bomberman +, adding a cross-play compatibility between different mobile phone carriers (i-Mode, EZweb, Yahoo! Keitai).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4of6.jpg'),(3912,'Extermination','2003-04-19','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Extermination is a well layed out city level, the map is packed tightly in and around the main street.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3913,'Super Rad Raygun','2016-11-08','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It is the year 198X. Big hair is hot, and the war with the Soviets is colder than a refreshing glass of New Coke. RAD RAYGUN must travel the world fighting communist robots, and save the 1980′s by shooting his way through the decade in a totally fresh, expanded version of the original XBLIG game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wsj.jpg'),(3914,'Beautiful Desolation: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3coy.jpg'),(3915,'Southfield',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Weird farming meets silly physics in Southfield! Combine chaotic crops with unpredictable effects, build your dream farmstead, and experiment with playful machinery. Wobble your way around an ever-changing island solo or with up to three friends and unearth its secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qen.jpg'),(3916,'Tropico 4: Complete DLC Pack',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3e00.jpg'),(3917,'Juufuutei Raden\'s Guide for Pixel Museum','2025-12-31','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A VTuber from hololive DEV_IS, \"Juufuutei Raden\" from ReGLOSS, will guide you through a museum as the curator. The entire game world, including Curator Raden and the museum, is depicted in \"pixel art\". The illustrations are completed by solving logic nonogram puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94dp.jpg'),(3918,'Defunct','2018-09-13','Racing, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Defunct is an indie adventure game with a focus on flow, speed and an engaging world. You are a broken robot that accidentally falls out of a giant cargo ship onto a post-human Earth, now inhabited by robots. You have to get back to your ship before it’s too late!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24xw.jpg'),(3919,'Warrior Bloodline: Path of Survival',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Sin plataforma','An epic journey of the fellowship of the children bonded by blood, escaped an experimental camp, wandering the woods and struggling both to survive and to reveal their destiny. An immersive, story-driven exploration game with a strong focus on realistic survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lwf.jpg'),(3920,'Tarthenia','2016-09-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Debbie Johnson thought her days of adventure were over. But when an evil warlock intervenes on behalf of his cousin, Esmeralda, she is whisked away to the island of Tarthenia. A place beyond the realm of imagination; where beauty and danger go hand in hand. And in order to save not only her life, but her sister\'s as well, Debbie will have to use every ounce of ingenuity she possesses. Can she thwart the plans of a madman bent on revenge? Only time will tell!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3upa.jpg'),(3921,'Dusty Revenge: Co-Op Edition','2014-02-17','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Revenge will consume you, but redemption will push you to your breaking point.\n\nPlay as Dusty, a multi- weapon wielding warrior ready to face loads of outlawed criminals, dangerous creatures and the ruthless evil villain that rules them all. Meet friends along the way with new weapons and talents, journey through lavishly drawn environments and work together to fulfil your unquenchable thirst for vengeance. Players can call upon two support characters, Rondel the artillery support who tramples enemies with his massive rocket launchers, and McCoy the sharpshooter who takes down loads of enemies stealthily with his deadly accurate rifle.FeaturesStylistic 2D action combat blended with unique support character abilities and frantic platforming.\nUnique ally system. Take on large enemy clusters with your heavy arms specialist ally or take precision kills using your sharpshooter support as you brawl your way through countless minions.\nFeaturing new local co-op mode with a new playable character, \'Kitsune\'.\nUnlock new \'Boss Rush\' mode and test your fighting prowess.\nStunning visuals. Dusty Revenge Co-op Edition will immerse you with 10 beautiful hand drawn environments and 8 different boss fights.\nNew Content. Dusty Revenge Co-op Edition polishes up with a new playable character, a new level, new enemies and new bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gt5.jpg'),(3922,'Biing!: Sex, Intrigue and Scalpels','1995-02-02','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','Biing is a hospital simulation in which the player tries to earn as much money as possible. The game has a satirical approach and is best known for its unique graphic style, which consists of scantily dressed nurses and nudity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co686n.jpg'),(3923,'Shape Shifter','2016-07-07','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re a white, ever shifting shape. You need to find your way through the cracks. Use the holes punched by the ones that came before you. Make your way through the cracks, break through and create new holes by using the green elements. Enjoy the party.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jvj.jpg'),(3924,'Call of Duty','2004-11-22','Shooter','N-Gage','The Nokia N-Gage version of \"Call of Duty\" brings the intense World War II action of the acclaimed series to a portable format. Developed specifically for the N-Gage platform, this version offers a unique gaming experience that captures the essence of its console counterparts. Players engage in key battles from the European Theater, taking on the roles of American, British, and Soviet soldiers.\n\nDespite the handheld format, the game delivers a compelling narrative and a variety of missions that involve infantry combat, vehicle engagements, and strategic objectives. It retains the series\' hallmark features, such as immersive environments and realistic sound effects, adapted for mobile play. The N-Gage version of \"Call of Duty\" offers fans the chance to experience the thrill of World War II combat on the go, making it a notable entry in the franchise\'s history.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b04.jpg'),(3925,'Urban Assault','1998-07-31','Shooter, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dystopian futuristic strategy game with tanks and aircraft, where the player can also take direct first person control of any of their units. Airborne units have six degrees of freedom in the style of Descent (1994).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tcovf84lyfw5xz1tgorb.jpg'),(3926,'WarPath','2006-07-18','Shooter, Strategy','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows)','WarPath is a first-person shooter video game developed by Digital Extremes. The game was originally being developed as a sequel to Pariah, but since Pariah was a commercial flop, WarPath continued development as a whole new game. However, the similarities between the gameplay of both games are very apparent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ezt.jpg'),(3927,'X: Gold','2001-12-31','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','X-Gold is a compilation that contains X: Beyond the Frontier and its expansion pack X-Tension.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qxs.jpg'),(3928,'Candy Shop Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Dive into a sugary world of sweetness in Candy Shop Simulator! Open your shop, create delectable pastries, manage sales, and expand your candy empire. Satisfy your sweet tooth and build your confectionery legacy now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7y57.jpg'),(3929,'Piofiore: Fated Memories','2020-07-25','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Liliana Adornato was born and raised in the church in the center of the Italian town of Burlone. Three criminal organizations control parts of the city, and Lily discovers that she is in the center of their turf wars. Her encounters with the leaders of the Falzone, Visconti, and Lao-Shu families lead to danger and distraction. Once Lily is drawn into the shadowy world of the mafia, she realizes there is no going back. Experience gorgeous music and artwork depicting the sun drenched (and sin-filled) world of early 1900’s Italy. Navigate organizations filled with intrigue and betrayal as three mafia families fight for honor and control. Unlock additional story options, new perspectives, and deeper, deadlier secrets as you complete the game multiple times.\n\nOriginally released as Piofiore no Banshou for the PlayStation Vita. The game was then re-released for the Nintendo Switch as Piofiore no Banshou -Ricordo- with updated scenarios and new CGs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sd5.jpg'),(3930,'Actua Soccer: Club Edition','1997-12-31','Sport','DOS, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Actua Soccer Club Edition is a re-edition of Actua Soccer, released with the 20 teams of the English Premiership instead of international competitions. New commentary was recorded and some Premiership historical data was included. All remaining aspects of the game were unchanged or just tweaked.\n\nThe rest of the game is well known to fans of the genre - it was the first fully polygonal football game on the market, which allowed an unprecedented graphical realism and (technically) unlimited camera angles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cdd.jpg'),(3931,'Tequila Zombies 3','2017-03-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tequila Zombies 3 is a platform shooter. Zombie apocalypse strikes hard. Zombies, vampires and demons spread all over the world. But there is still hope... guns... and alcohol! So there is still a chance to survive. Kill all zombies, drink all tequila!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63j6.jpg'),(3932,'Pictode Collection','2022-04-23','Puzzle, Indie','Playdate','Never enough puzzles!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3933,'Naruto Shippuden: Ninja Destiny 2','2009-10-15','Fighting','Nintendo DS','Naruto Shippuden: Ninja Destiny 2 features fast paced Naruto Shippuden 3D fighting action with the addition of an all-new Quest Mode, new characters, jutsu and a storyline based on the Naruto Shippuden animated series. The title also features wireless multiplayer gameplay, offering Naruto fans and newcomers to the series competitive 3D fighting on the Nintendo DS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ubg.jpg'),(3934,'Plague M.D.','2020-09-17','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Plague M.D. is a medieval medicine simulator.\n\nBecome a quack doctor stuck in a backwater village in the 16th century. Your task is to diagnose and cure the patient using the available tools, ingredients, recipes and books. This is a difficult game against time, misdiagnosis and procrastination can lead you to the stake, and every choice has consequences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jqw.jpg'),(3935,'Back in Business','2020-12-14','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An entirely new episode of 4 levels with various themes: city/casino, nature/industrial, snowy/hi-tech and prison/nature. Each level has a strong mission objective to complete.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3936,'Satryn','2021-03-19','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A chaotic, infinite twin stick shooty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wuu.jpg'),(3937,'Splitgate','2019-05-22','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Splitgate is a free-to-play, fast-paced multiplayer shooter that features player-controlled portals. This sci-fi shooter takes the FPS genre to a new dimension with its portal mechanics, delivering high-flying, multi-dimensional combat. Evoking memories of the most revered shooters of the past two decades, Splitgate embraces the classic and familiar feel of close-quarters combat while adding a unique twist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cs5.jpg'),(3938,'Zaccaria Pinball: Mexico \'86 Table','2016-06-16','Pinball, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Mexico \'86 Table is an association football themed pinball table.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wym.jpg'),(3939,'Darkstalkers Chronicle: The Chaos Tower','2005-03-24','Fighting, Arcade','PlayStation Portable','Once again, the monster warriors from the Darkstalkers series return to battle for control of the night. From vampires to mummies, Darkstalkers Chronicle: The Chaos Tower includes all 18 characters from previous installments in the franchise. Choose your favorite character, and master his or her unique moves to gain victory in various gameplay modes, such as arcade, training, tower, and Ad-Hoc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x7u.jpg'),(3940,'Sin Center','2012-02-26','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin Center is a single player map made as a tribute to the classic style city maps of the original game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3941,'Biohazard RE: 3 - Z Version','2020-04-03','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Experience a terrifying single-player campaign and thrilling one-versus-four online multiplayer.\n\nZ version stands for Japan\'s Z-rated version of the Resident Evil 3 Remake game. It is an \"Adults only 18+\" age-restricted version of the game, up from the \"Mature 17+\" rating of the base game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83xj.jpg'),(3942,'A Week in the Life of Asocial Giraffe','2025-12-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','“A Week in the Life of Asocial Giraffe” is a point-and-click stealth game where the goal is to make sure nobody talks to you so that your head does not explode. You\'ll get to experience an average week of Giraffe\'s life as he does exciting things on his to-do list, such as going to the laundromat, peruses antique stores, purchasing groceries, and working out at the gym, all while making sure the incredibly sociable citizens of Friendly City never have a chance to speak with him for fear of losing your head.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ih2.jpg'),(3943,'Call of Duty: Black Ops II - Nuketown 2025 Edition','2012-11-13','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Pushing the boundaries of what fans have come to expect from the record-setting entertainment franchise, Call of Duty: Black Ops II propels players into a near future, 21st Century Cold War, where technology and weapons have converged to create a new generation of warfare.\n\nCall of Duty: Black Ops II - Nuketown 2025 Edition includes:\n- a copy of the base game\n- the multiplayer map Nuketown 2025','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ay4.jpg'),(3944,'Surreal House','2023-08-18','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A point-and-click puzzle game inspired by escape rooms. Enter the house if you dare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xro.jpg'),(3945,'One Stroke - one tap connect','2017-12-22','Puzzle','iOS','Draw everthing with only“one touch”. Test your brain with the addictive puzzle game.\nIt sounds very simple and easy. With level gets higer, the puzzle will be difficult to complete. Wanna have a try? Let\'s learn how to play the addictive games?\n\nRules:\nChoose a dot to connect\nConnect all dots to complete a geometric figure with one touch \nDraw all figures with one line\n\n\nFeatures:\nOver 100 levels\nMany geometric figures\nChallenge your brain\nEasy to PLAY\n\nWish you have a lot of fun with the one stroke game.\n\n\n------- One Stroke Premium Subscription------\nSync the materials in One Stroke to all your One Stroke installations on any platform. Restore from storage with any new device running One Stroke.\n\nWith One Stroke Premium, you will be able to access exclusive features like all levels unlock\n\n1 month subscription:$29.99\n\n\nSubscriptions automatically renew at the end of the period unless turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period in the account settings. Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase. Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal. Subscriptions are managed by the user.\n\n------Links------\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://sites.google.com/view/onestroke\nTerms of Service: \nhttps://sites.google.com/view/one-stroke','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/oynkhmjbfcmpvu9qcqbn.jpg'),(3946,'Ball Rush 2','2024-11-02','Racing, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Smash a path to the finish!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co927w.jpg'),(3947,'Euro Truck Simulator 2','2012-10-18','Racing, Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Mac','Euro Truck Simulator 2 is a vehicle simulation game and a direct sequel to the 2008 game Euro Truck Simulator. Travel across Europe as king of the road, a trucker who delivers important cargo across impressive distances! With dozens of cities to explore from the UK, Belgium, Germany, Italy, the Netherlands, Poland, and many more, your endurance, skill and speed will all be pushed to their limits. If you’ve got what it takes to be part of an elite trucking force, get behind the wheel and prove it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7et5.jpg'),(3948,'Club Penguin Dimensions','2023-04-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Arcade','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Club Penguin Dimensions is a non-profit, educational recreation (under the principles of fair use/fair dealing) of the original Club Penguin game, which ended its activities in 2017. Since April 2, 2023, Club Penguin Dimensions continues the story from a new multiverse perspective, where different realities and events are interconnected by the Box Dimension.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95ls.jpg'),(3949,'Close Your Eyes','2018-02-17','Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Close Your Eyes is a puzzle horror game where your only defense against enemies is to close your eyes. Enemies will not chase you while your eyes are closed. You are being hunted down in an eerie research facility with a backstory shrouded in mystery. The creatures that roam in this facility are tenacious and ruthless. Remember, if you can\'t see them, they can\'t see you. \n \nYou can\'t outrun them. You can\'t hide from them. Your only option is to close your eyes. \n \nYou may need to adjust the graphical settings depending on your computer. \nEstimated play time is 1 hour.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26h1.jpg'),(3950,'Sudoku 4ever Plus',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Solve unlimited number of puzzles in this Sudoku game from 1gravity','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yezmcybf1szydkexpig7.jpg'),(3951,'Unitystation','2021-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Based on cult classic Space Station 13, Unitystation is a game centered around life on an outpost exploration ship in the far reaches of space.\n\nThe game is full of paranoia and lighthearted shenanigans, being a station that is as much at risk from clowns and mimes as it is from undercover operatives, eldritch cultists, changelings, demons, revolutions, and assaults from enemy corporations. Played in rounds that reset the station every time, the game features an assortment of jobs, including doctors, chemists, scientists, janitors, engineers, atmospheric technicians, security guards, bartenders and the all-important clown.\n\nEach round’s randomly selected antagonists will try and execute plans to fight the station’s crew. Despite some unintuitive graphics and mechanics, the game can be incredibly addictive! Endless possibilities await you on the barely airtight deathtrap that is Unitystation...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3psl.jpg'),(3952,'The Kids We Were','2021-12-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','The Kids We Were is an award-winning adventure game originally released worldwide for smartphones in February, 2020. Selected as one of the top 3 titles at the Google Play Indie Games Festival 2020, it has also won the avex Award, and been chosen for the Best Indies category of Google Play\'s Best Games of 2020.\n\nTo celebrate the release of The Kids We Were on Nintendo Switch, we\'ve added a bunch of brand-new content. If you want the full experience, look no further than this, the Complete Edition!\n\nThe Complete Edition includes the full story available in the app, in addition to a new bonus episode set after the events of the main game. There are also brand-new collection items to find!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3tvs.jpg'),(3953,'Mr. Barrel','2019-07-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Meet Mr. Barrel who sometimes works at a restaurant, and sometimes fights against dark forces!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mnw.jpg'),(3954,'Tochi T.U.N.R','2023-05-26','Adventure, Indie','Playdate','A remake of an Action-Adventure game for the Playdate!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3955,'Wakeboarding XS','2003-10-30','Sin género','Web browser','Wakeboarding XS is an online game where you can choose your wakeboarder and aim to score as many points as possible. You\'ll need to combine a perfect wake line, reach maximum power, and pull off the biggest air combo tricks over the wake and obstacles. Be sure to complete your tricks before hitting the water and stop grinding at the end of the rail to avoid wiping out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co958i.jpg'),(3956,'Cinemoji: Series','2021-12-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Are you a series marathoner? This game is for you! Test your deduction skills and your knowledge trying to guess the name of the series represented by the emojis!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cq9.jpg'),(3957,'Dysto-wanderer',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Dive into a puzzle adventure in the post-apocalyptic world of dysto-wanderer. Join Pia, lost in the toxic slums of a ruined city, as she searches for a safe place. Explore a destroyed civilization, solve intricate puzzles, and survive the harsh environment along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90jb.jpg'),(3958,'Car Clicker','2024-07-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Car Clicker is a clicker Game, in which you click a Car! In Car you click the Car to gain even more Cars! Every 1 and 18 hours, you get dropped a car. Each cars is also made by the community in discord. Come hang out with us and let\'s grow into something awesome ! ','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pd1.jpg'),(3959,'Theatre Europe','1985-12-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Apple II, Amstrad CPC','Theatre Europe is a turn-based strategy video game developed and published by Personal Software Services. It was first released in the United Kingdom for the Commodore 64, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC and Atari 8-bit home computers in 1985. It was later released in France by ERE Informatique in 1986, and was released in the United States by Datasoft later that year. It was also ported to the Tatung Einstein home computer in 1989, exclusively in the United Kingdom. It is the fifth instalment of the Strategic Wargames series. \n \nThe game is set during a fictional war in Europe between NATO and the Warsaw Pact, in which both sides use nuclear and chemical weapons against each other. The main objective of the game is to fight conventional battles in continental Europe, whilst trying to avoid a worldwide nuclear holocaust. Throughout the game, various capital cities and their civilian populations will be destroyed by nuclear weapons; the game will only end once either side is forced to surrender or if the entire population of Europe perishes. In order to request a nuclear strike, the player was required to call a dedicated telephone number, which led to an automated message announcing the authorisation code. \n \nDuring development, the developers obtained extensive information and statistics of military strength from the Ministry of Defence and the Soviet embassy in London. Theatre Europe gained national controversy upon release, receiving criticism from both the Campaign for Nuclear Disarmament (CND) and The Sun newspaper. Some high street retail chains refused to sell the game upon release. Despite the controversy, the game received critical acclaim from reviewers. Praise was directed at its accuracy, playability and value for money. It won the \"Best Strategy Game\" award at the 1985 Golden Joystick Awards and was nominated for the \"Game of the Year\" title.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dgdff3iuxu9sg4apbqg5.jpg'),(3960,'Mythic Ocean','2021-07-02','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Explore an ocean that exists before the beginning of time and meet creatures with hidden powers waiting to be released. How you choose to influence them will change the fate of the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xfu.jpg'),(3961,'The Incredible Hulk: The Pantheon Saga','1997-04-10','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','True to the comic books, the Hulk relies on no other weapons than his massive muscles to punch, kick and crush his enemies. When he has accumulated enough gamma energy, he may use powerful special moves like a Vortex Spin or the Floor Hammer. Rare bonus items also allow the Hulk to summon one of the four Pantheon team members Atalanta, Ulysses, Ajax and Hector to assist in the thick of battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52sl.jpg'),(3962,'Lost Cartridge: Cold Read','2023-01-16','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lost Cartridge: Cold Read is the first in a series of horror anthology games by Pure Ice Blue, creator of Lily\'s Well and I Cannot Drown. Explore the library, hide from those who want Mitch\'s life to end, and solve puzzles in order to possibly find a way to escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w4w.jpg'),(3963,'World Robot Boxing 2','2020-01-29','Fighting','Android, iOS','The sequel to Real Steel World Robot Boxing. In this new entry, you\'ll take part in battles across quests, with robots that now have 6 unique classes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9itf.jpg'),(3964,'Let’s Build a Zoo: Aquarium Odyssey','2023-08-17','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Escape to a brand new AQUARIUM ISLAND and discover a world of seafaring beasts. Start a brand new zoo complete with adorable water splashing and ocean dwelling creatures, brand new themed shops and a whole host of new decorations to give your guests the ultimate aquatic experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ylc.jpg'),(3965,'The Neverhood','1998-04-23','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','The game follows the adventure of a claymation character named Klaymen as he discovers his origins and his purpose in a world made entirely out of clay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h4m.jpg'),(3966,'Cra Cra','2024-07-20','Indie','Playdate','It\'s an incremental game with mechanics inspired by clicker games. Turn the crank to generate energy (Wh) and compete for the time it takes to charge the battery to 10,000GWh (you can continue after that).','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3967,'MLB 2K10 DS','2010-03-02','Sport','Nintendo DS','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3968,'Dragon Takers',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"Rise, those who resist the dragons—\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vlg.jpg'),(3969,'Inertial Drift','2020-09-11','Racing, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','An arcade racer that tears up the rule book with innovative twin-stick controls, completely re-imagined driving mechanics and a huge roster of fiercely individual cars and tracks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gtf.jpg'),(3970,'Kanon','2024-06-20','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The remastered version of Kanon, which features the CGs in high definition and color corrected and includes full voice-acting utilizing both recordings made in the Dreamcast/PS2 and PSP releases of the game (minus Shiori, whose non-PSP lines were newly recorded) and touchscreen support.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87p0.jpg'),(3971,'Dead Dating','2021-12-23','Puzzle, Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A romantic summer date party gone wild! A sweet party becomes a murder scene...\nyou have to find a way to survive in an isolated mansion on an isolated island with ten guys! Can you rescue your lover and catch the killer?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43b3.jpg'),(3972,'Soukou Akki Muramasa: Janen-hen','2010-08-26','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The official anthology DVD of Soukou Akki Muramasa, which includes sidestories written by guest scenario writers, wallpapers, Twitter icons and backgrounds, new songs by Ono Masatoshi and and much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3txx.jpg'),(3973,'The Sisters 2: Road to Fame',NULL,'Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Get on trend and take the road to fame!\nDouble the trouble, double the fun, our Sisters are back to cause twice the chaos!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jhq.jpg'),(3974,'LEGO Studios Backlot','2002-01-01','Platform, Adventure','Web browser','You\'ve arrived at LEGO Studios for an afternoon tour, but thins change when action star Johnny Thunder asks desperately for help with retrieving his lost hat, gun, and binoculars. Help him and you\'ll get hired on the spot, now working at the backlot as multiple film crews struggle to complete a day\'s work.\n\nThis early 3D Shockwave game features a blend of simple adventure puzzling and Havok physics-based platforming. Learn the studios front and back, solve problems for your co-workers, and get those promotions! It\'s a condensed LEGO Studios experience, starring you and Steven Spielberg.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65gw.jpg'),(3975,'The Haunted: Hells Reach','2011-10-25','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','All Hell Has Broken Loose!!!  The Haunted is a fast paced third person action horror game that focuses on delivering an intense multiplayer experience. Your goal is to liberate cursed places and survive the assault from the minions of Hell. The game features several multiplayer modes such as co-op survival, demons vs. humans and demonizer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/exmvbe0kdoikyzgavqep.jpg'),(3976,'Hentai Tales: Scent Of Mixed','2025-02-27','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','As exchange students, Astrid Lindström and her mother Helena Lindström arranged to live together in the protagonist\'s house to facilitate their in-depth understanding of Japanese culture... What happens there?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oo9.jpg'),(3977,'Boku to Nurse no Kenshuu Nisshi','2018-08-23','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','A visual novel about a hospital love story between a medical intern and a nurse who would go above her duties to take care of him.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57at.jpg'),(3978,'Tempest X3','1997-02-01','Shooter, Puzzle','PlayStation','In Tempest X3 you control a claw that perches and crawls around the outer edge of a series of geometrically shaped, tube-like constructs, shooting down or out into the nebulous void of outer space. From the core of this void, fuseballs, rockets, pulsars, tankers and other hazardous aliens and alien artifacts move toward your ship. Once you clear a screen, you fly into the void and onto the next level. Watch out for spikes as you advance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31rk.jpg'),(3979,'BattleJuice Alchemist','2024-03-21','Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','BattleJuice Alchemist is a singleplayer RPG combining classic top-down combat with third person bullet time. Explore a dark procedural world, learn ritual magic, solve riddles, craft alchemical potions and combine them in deck-building-like fashion to fight the demons overrunning the lands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m0e.jpg'),(3980,'Dead Herring VR','2021-02-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dead Herring is a VR-Experience in which you solve a murder case.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o8a.jpg'),(3981,'Cranner','2022-07-22','Indie, Arcade','Playdate','An endless runner for the Playdate. Dodge and jump for the high score as a crab.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co828o.jpg'),(3982,'Slay or Fall','2024-09-15','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The player takes on the burden of a dark dungeon lord. However, a squad of heroes has come to his lands and intend to defeat the player. The task of the dark lord: to kill, expel, break the heroes before they reach him. Throughout the game, the lord is in his throne room and influences events indirectly. However, it is through such undermining decisions that the heroes must be overcome. In addition, the political situation in the dungeon lands is extremely unstable. Of the 4 nations, only one favors the player, the rest have to be taken into account and solve pressing political problems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u33.jpg'),(3983,'Real Boxing','2013-08-27','Fighting, Sport','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation Vita','Real Boxing features ultra-realistic motion capture from real boxers, with amazing graphics, you\'ll be sure to feel every hook, jab, and uppercut. Train your fully customizable boxer and seek glory in career mode, or duke it out with other players in a deep and satisfying local and online multiplayer modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61bx.jpg'),(3984,'Midway Arcade Treasures: Extended Play','2006-02-24','Arcade','PlayStation Portable','Midway Arcade Treasures: Extended Play, includes 21 arcade games that are the \"best of\" Midway Arcade Treasures 1 & Midway Arcade Treasures 2.\nEnjoy the coin-op masterpieces of the past for the first time on a portable system with multiplayer wireless support!\nNow you can play classic arcade games anywhere, anytime with Midway Arcade Treasures: Extended Play for the Sony PSP Portable Entertainment System.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7257.jpg'),(3985,'Agents: Biohunters','2020-04-07','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a dangerous world where giant creatures are attacking us, we need heroes to defend our lives. We call them Agents! YOUR MISSION: Capture these creatures with the collaboration of your team and protect the world! Oh and by the way, the enemy team are not going to make things easy...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ck5.jpg'),(3986,'Dead Rising 2: Case West','2010-12-27','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox 360','The game features Frank West, the main character from the first Dead Rising game, and serves as the canon Overtime Mode of Dead Rising 2, with Frank teaming up with Chuck to further investigate the link between Phenotrans and the Fortune City zombie outbreak, and find proof that clears Chuck of any wrongdoing.\n\nThe story follows on from Ending A of the main game, with Frank rescuing Chuck from the elevator. Frank was going to meet Rebecca Chang to investigate a Phenotrans facility west of Fortune City, but learns from Chuck that she was killed by Phenotrans mole Sullivan. Although initially suspicious of Chuck because of the media reports blaming him for the Fortune City outbreak, Frank lets the motocross star come with him to find proof that Phenotrans was behind the outbreak.\n\nCase West includes cooperative play for two players, with each taking control of one of the two characters. The episode features new challenges, enemies, items, combo weapons. The photography element returns from the first Dead Rising; the characters use this to generate proof of Phenotrans\' part in the zombie outbreaks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mqf.jpg'),(3987,'Getsuei no Kusari: Sakuran Paranoia','2013-04-18','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable','Getsuei no Kusari -Sakuran Paranoia- is a otome game for PlayStation Vita and PlayStation Portable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eg0.jpg'),(3988,'Lost in the Nightmare','2005-11-07','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Private detective Burak Güney travels to Karabalta Town to investigate the disappearance of three university students who were camping in the woods. When he arrives in the town in September 1988, he soon discovers that the event is linked to an old tale about \"The Lost One\", still haunting the villages.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3989,'Caretaker Sacrifice','2016-08-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Narrated by David Hewlett of Stargate, Caretaker Sacrifice is an epic sci-fi 6DOF adventure puzzle shooter game set in the far future. At the end of time, delve into the twisting innards of this hostile alien machine, through peril and adventure, to puzzle out and solve the ultimate mystery of what happened to the universe. Fulfill your final mission. In every sense, it’s a cerebral descent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/w0d93gkqj1nplwscgzav.jpg'),(3990,'Galaxy Control','2016-08-10','Strategy','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Galaxy Control is an ultimate space combat strategy game with fast-paced combats!\n\nBuild your base and battle with other players to control the galaxy! Galaxy Control is an ultimate space combat strategy game with next generation 3d graphics and fast-paced combats!\n\nGather minerals and extract uranium, defend your base with laser towers, missile turrets, cannons, walls and mines, create the ultimate army with unique ground and air units! Battle with millions of players and take their Fame point and resources! Became the TOP 1 in the galaxy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96ki.jpg'),(3991,'Haunted Cities Volume 2','2017-10-31','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A free collection of four short, experimental games previously released as monthly rewards for Kitty Horrorshow\'s Patreon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co482r.jpg'),(3992,'Spire Horizon','2024-02-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Discover a thrilling world of adventure in Spire Horizon, an RPG open world game, where you embody a skeleton protagonist, explore a visually stunning world, engage in battles against formidable enemies, and traveling in search of a beloved wife.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rsq.jpg'),(3993,'Kuma Story','2010-09-29','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It’s Kuma Bear’s anniversary with his girlfriend, Cinnamon Bear. He is hoping to surprise her on their anniversary with a small present, but doesn’t have anything to give to her yet. Help Kuma Bear find something nice to give to Cinnamon Bear, and a way to surprise her with it. Kuma Story was originally created as an anniversary gift from SpacePirateCaine to his girlfriend for their 3-year anniversary. She enjoyed it very much, and asked that it be continued, and shared with the rest of the world. Please note that what little text there is in the game is generally in Japanese. There is nothing specifically important written at any point as Kuma Story is intended to be a short, mostly textless adventure game, playable and accessible by anybody in any language.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(3994,'Ancient Dungeon VR','2021-11-03','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR, Oculus Quest','Ancient Dungeon VR is a rogue-lite dungeon crawler with randomly generated dungeons. Uncover its secrets and challenge powerful bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c7d.jpg'),(3995,'Coconut','2024-08-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Idle clicker with periodic free skin rolls that can be used in-game and traded.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pfu.jpg'),(3996,'Megatagmension Blanc + Neptune VS Zombies','2015-10-15','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','Zombies have invaded Gamicademi, and now it\'s up to Blanc and friends to school them! Take them out with crazy combos in this hack \'n\' slash with a tag-team in single player, or complete special missions with up to 3 other players with online play!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qoa.jpg'),(3997,'Curse of the Sea Rats','2023-04-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Embark on an epic, hand-animated, ‘ratoidvania’ adventure, where your crew has been turned into rats by a pirate witch! Explore a rich non-linear world, enjoy fun action platforming, face challenging bosses, and unlock unique abilities - either alone or in local co-op!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6cl8.jpg'),(3998,'Alice Trapped Beyond Wonderland','2021-08-20','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Discover and solve the extraordinary mysteries from the magical kingdoms beyond the incredible Wonderland, Find where the evil red queen banished your friends, gather clues about their whereabouts, and solve multiple puzzles to rescue them once and for all to get them back to their home in Wonderland.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kne.jpg'),(3999,'Farm Frenzy 2: Pizza Party HD','2011-06-29','Simulator, Arcade','iOS','Do you like pizza as much as we do? Then you\'ll love the pepperoni-packed sequel to the No. 1 arcade farming sim – Farm Frenzy 2: Pizza Party! \n\nAt first, you\'ll grow crops, feed animals and collect produce, and then you\'ll turn your goods into the ingredients you need to make a variety of pizzas. From China to Germany and Italy to New York City (where pizza is considered one of the main food groups), people from around the world will enjoy your mouthwatering creations!\n\nAs you master the fast-paced point-and-click gameplay, you\'ll fend off bears, purchase buildings that produce different ingredients and upgrade your vehicles so you can transport more goods. You\'ll also enjoy some of the zaniest animations ever created for a casual game! Don\'t miss all the fun in Farm Frenzy 2: Pizza Party!\n\nThere\'s also iPhone and Mac versions of this game! Check the App Store!\n-----------------------------------------\nSTILL NOT CONVINCED? Try the Lite version for FREE by searching for \"Farm Frenzy 2: Pizza Party HD Lite\" in the App Store.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/an4ogd2bzvz9pi1vyfk5.jpg'),(4000,'Ultimate Low Poly Pet','2020-02-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ultimate Low Poly Pet is a clean and stylish interactive 3D live wallpaper that display cute low-poly pets on the desktop with animated backgrounds. You can control and interact with pets with your mouse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pbl.jpg'),(4001,'Darling of the Sea','2020-05-26','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Darling of the Sea is a short romance thriller game about the protagonist, Ivy Blue, who wished on a shooting star on her lover\'s death anniversary; and her resurrected lover. There are slight horror elements and 4 endings in this game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s5n.jpg'),(4002,'Cynthia: Hidden in the Moonshadow - Anniversary Edition','2025-01-26','Sin género','Xbox One','Emotional, 3rd-person, story-driven, adventure game focused on solving puzzles and using stealth mechanics. Use your bow to interact with environmental elements. Sneak, climb or distract guards to move further unnoticed. Solve light puzzles alongside your path to rescue your loved one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e4w.jpg'),(4003,'Shy Girl\'s Makeover','2024-08-02','Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','College students Kenta and Ayaka are united in their love for video games – and in their feelings for each other. Will their relationship progress beyond being two close gaming friends or will Ayaka’s heart be charmed by someone else? Find out in this slice of life RPG set in modern Japan!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ml4.jpg'),(4004,'Pokémon Green Version','1996-02-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, Game Boy','Pokémon Green, along with Pokémon Red, are the first video games in the Pokémon series of games. They are the first paired versions of Generation I. Developed over the course of several years, Red and Green established several standards for later Pokémon games and sequels. They take place in the Kanto region, with the player having to collect eight Gym Badges to become the Pokémon Champion while also completing the Pokédex by collecting all 151 Pokémon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sag.jpg'),(4005,'Taisho x Alice: Heads & Tails!','2022-07-08','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Fandisc of the Taishou x Alice series. Contains after-stories for the original characters and includes new routes for sub-characters Ookami and Ryoushi. Also featuring a school-parody story with routes for all the original characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jcl.jpg'),(4006,'101 Cats Hidden in India','2024-08-13','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Find and discover 101 cute cats hidden throughout the India landscape in this hand-drawn hidden object game. Can you find them all?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8o3m.jpg'),(4007,'Skeppskatten går iland','1999-12-31','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An educational game for kids teaching Swedish words when they have just started to learn reading and writing.\n\nThe game will teach:\n- Read and writing\n- Consonant lengthening\n- Word comprehension\n- Synonyms\n- Phonics\n- Create with text and image','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97py.jpg'),(4008,'War On Terrorism','2001-12-20','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co958z.jpg'),(4009,'4 Wheel Madness','2006-11-29','Sport','Web browser','Get in Bigfoot\'s driver seat. Can you make it across the finish line with more than just four huge wheels?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co976n.jpg'),(4010,'Bound','2016-10-06','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR','Bound is a 3D platformer designed for people with the desire to concentrate on the narrative side of games and experience a mature story. On the other side of the spectrum, Bound is also being prepared for hardcore gamers looking for the challenge of one big puzzle that can be only solved by a community of players working together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eal.jpg'),(4011,'Fatal Labyrinth','2010-09-13','Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dragonia, the castle of doom, has been resurrected! But the ghouls from the castle have stolen the Holy Goblet, the source of light. Without it, the world will be trapped in darkness forever. Don your armour and pick up your weapon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92i2.jpg'),(4012,'Mi Scusi','2021-10-08','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mi Scusi is a casual adventure game following the exploits of the Scusi Man, an unstoppable force of Scusi causing chaos across the world...and beyond! Discover secrets and accomplish tasks in each level to unlock unqiue cosmetics and travel to new locations in this wacky world of Scusi.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yx8.jpg'),(4013,'The Big Bang Theory Game',NULL,'Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94wg.jpg'),(4014,'Ultima VIII: Gold Edition','2012-04-19','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','The Guardian has tricked you, Avatar. After you defeated Batlin on Serpent\'s Isle, he banished you to Pagan, a world under his control. Once, it was a beautiful land, but ever since the ancient battle between the Elemental Titans and the evil \"Destroyer\", it is engulfed in eternal twilight. Titans - now worshiped as gods - are cruel and uncaring. They bestow power on their most dedicated followers who, in turn, terrorize Pagan\'s population. To find a way back home, you need to become a Titan yourself before the Guardian succeeds in his plot to conquer Britannia--and then Earth itself.\n\nThe eighth installment of the Ultima series takes a much darker tone. The story is much more mature (do the ends justify the means?) and the game focuses more on action, like climbing and jumping across platforms. Training your character has also changed: the more you use an ability, the better you are with it. Without a party to assist you, you must rely on your own strength, dexterity, intelligence, and magical abilities to save Britannia and Earth.\nDark, engrossing story with a moral dilemma: will you accept evil for the sake of the greater good?\nMuch more action-oriented than previous installments with fluent and responsive combat mechanics and new ways to explore the unknown.\nLiving world: each inhabitant has his or her own schedule, going about ordinary business in Pagan.\nIncludes the speech pack: some of the major game characters are fully voiced.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cq4.jpg'),(4015,'Rubble Trouble Moscow','2011-12-21','Puzzle','Web browser','Demolish using new tools and avoid hazards in winter wonderland, Moscow!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9762.jpg'),(4016,'No Food No Drink','2025-04-07','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enjoy delicious snacks, earn rewards, and navigate whilst avoiding the librarian. Equip yourself with many tools to distract others creatively. Assist your classmates and prepare to face challenges in this stealth-strategy game at different time or weather.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mv4.jpg'),(4017,'Village Cult','2024-07-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The events take place in a Soviet forest village located far from civilization. The main character inherits a house. Soon the hero learns that the entire village is part of a cult. Those who sacrifice people and engage in cannibalism. The hero has to get out of the village. But can he?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jnw.jpg'),(4018,'Angular Momentum',NULL,'Platform','Sin plataforma','Use the left and right arrow-keys to roll your ball to the goal in each level. The game becomes more and more obstacle-filled as you progress.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co976t.jpg'),(4019,'Titan Slayer','2017-04-27','Shooter','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','A first-person perspective action game to battle giants Defeat the giant monsters with sword, bow, or gun! All the battle depends on your movement! Don\'t be afraid of the powerful attack of the giant, exterminate the enemy stylishly.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24ng.jpg'),(4020,'Alien Cow Rampage: Orion Needs Your Milk!','2014-07-07','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In an original boardgame that could be described as the jumpsuit-clad cousin of Chainsaw Warrior and Munchkin, you\'re an alien on the run. Within 12 hours you need to make it through a mazy suburbs, abduct cows from heavily guarded pastures, and brave an Earthling military base in order to catch a ride on your mothership.\n\nThere is little time. There are many dangers. But you CAN make it, and there are always cows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pp3.jpg'),(4021,'Mole Mole !','2017-06-25','Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Legacy Mobile Device','Mole Mole\n\nAn infinite competitive endless source of fun!\n\nHelp Mole, a Miner Mole to collect gold, gems and diamonds while evil bots will try everything to stop you.\n\nSet Skills, level up, dodge cave-ins, evade a colourful cast of robo-foes and collect many treasures and reveal the secrets of the deep cave!\n\nMole Mole, a cute challenge for everyone','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xmrfr941oomqgrtfncgz.jpg'),(4022,'Sanguo Warriors VR','2018-09-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a sub-era realistic VR game. The game tells the story of the player passing through time and space and fighting ancient fighters. You can use dozens of weapons to fight, you can experience the system and growth of traditional RPG, and gain experience and money weapon props through battle and exploration, and constantly improve yourself to challenge more difficult enemies.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4023,'Skipper & Skeeto: The Shadow of Mr. Shade','1999-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The fourth game in a series of point-and-click games. Set in a factory of mister Shade.\n\nMagnus and Mia can walk, climb, jump, push and pull. You play alternately Mia and Magnus through 4 chapters. Click on mosquito or Alpha for help. Many new exciting characters. More than 200 tasks and puzzles. Learn as you play - facts about plastic, oil, glass and many everyday objects.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7q85.jpg'),(4024,'Starcaller','2021-04-01','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Oculus VR, Windows Mixed Reality, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Starcaller is a rapid fire puzzle solving VR game inspired by The Crystal Maze game show.\n\nSet in an abandoned temple you must restore as many walls as possible to their former glory, before helping return the fallen stars back to the night sky.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vd2.jpg'),(4025,'Freaky Trip','2023-10-06','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Put your imagination to the test and go on a freaky rescue trip. Help rescue Salcy’s beloved cockapoo from unknown danger in which she was sure to find herself. In Freaky Trip you will encounter many logical puzzles, which you can find everywhere.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76gd.jpg'),(4026,'C.H.A.I.N.G.E.D.','2023-06-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The antichrist has won, the world has ended.\nTime to make some choices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l99.jpg'),(4027,'Tochi','2022-04-24','Adventure, Indie','Playdate','Tochi is a simple Action-Adventure game set in a dungeon filled with enemies that will attack you without a second thought! And if you die it\'s game over! Made exclusively for the Playdate!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qnp.jpg'),(4028,'Hidden my game by mom - escape room',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4029,'Zombies Ruined My Day','2020-10-29','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This is the story of how the best day of your life can become a nightmare full of zombies. Survive in a hostile environment using all sorts of weapons. Defend your position with barricades, blow up groups of zombies with grenades, sweep the area away with a Gatling and more! All in a fully action packed game with colorful backgrounds and fearsome monsters. Show us that you\'re more than a snack for zombies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co248l.jpg'),(4030,'Primal Slideee','2024-07-13','Racing, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Does this game seem easy and simple to you? It will require both your skill and luck.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kpy.jpg'),(4031,'Gary Grigsby\'s War in the West','2014-12-31','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Based on the War in the East engine with years of additional major features and improvements, Gary Grigsby’s War in the West 1943-45 is the most ambitious and detailed computer wargame on the Western Front of World War II ever made. Starting with the Summer 1943 invasions of Sicily and Italy and proceeding through the invasions of France and the drive into Germany, War in the West brings you all the Allied campaigns in Western Europe and the capability to re-fight the Western Front according to your plan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ymm.jpg'),(4032,'Coloring Pixels: Flag 2 Pack','2022-09-09','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Flag 2 BookThis Flag-themed book unlocks 20 additional levels for Coloring Pixels! The second flag book but this time with a twist!Each image shows a part of the world map, and each country in that area is depicted in the colours of that nation\'s flag!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x4h.jpg'),(4033,'Lancelot\'s Hangover : The Quest for the Holy Booze','2020-10-01','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Monkey Island meets Monty Python\'s Holy Grail (in a Belgian point-and-click adventure game with an attitude!) - WARNING : You play a sexy half-naked knight ! Your mom will be proud !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m96.jpg'),(4034,'Indiana Jones and the Fate of Atlantis: The Action Game','1992-12-31','Adventure, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','Being an action title, the game starts off where Indy is about to have an excuse to use his trusty whip: in Monte Carlo, after he recruited headstrong former student Sophie to his aid and determined the location of ancient discs needed to open the door to the lost city of Atlantis. Most action takes place in isometric view, although there are some variations along the way to keep up interest. There are even some adventure-game elements, such as Indy\'s inventory which you can fill with various objects to use (i.e. money to buy things). They are mostly easy though, and are there only to relieve the tension from knuckle-blistering action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co984n.jpg'),(4035,'The Journeyman Project 1: Pegasus Prime','2017-02-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Epic Time Travel Adventure Begins! The origin of the acclaimed Journeyman Project series.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4036,'Bad Blood','1991-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','Commodore C64/128/MAX, DOS','A nuclear war has turned the world into a wasteland. The pure-blooded humans have retreated in large cities while mutants live in small villages on the plains where they make a living by hunting the many monsters. Now one of the human leaders, Lord Dominix, wants to start a war to wipe out all the \"bad-blooded\" mutants. Your village chief has assigned you with the task of preventing this war.\n\nBad Blood is a top-down action game with light role-playing elements. You can not create your own character but have to pick one of the three predefined ones: Varrigg (a strong green mutant who fights with his bare hands), Dekker (a human male armed with a knife) or Jakka (she looks human but can shoot laser beams from her eyes like Cyclops of X-Men fame). The choice you make has only a limited impact on gameplay and storyline.\n\nGameplay consists of exploring the world map, visiting several cities and villages, talking with NPCs, picking up items and new weapons (like shotguns, grenades, Uzis etc.) and lots of real-time combat. Bad Blood lacks character stats and character development. The game has a day-night cycle which influences the amount of monsters on the plains and whether or not you can talk with some NPCs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wre.jpg'),(4037,'Click Space Miner 2','2019-07-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Click Space Miner II you take control over a mining company in space. There is a big market, a lot of customers, but therefore also a lot of concurrents so you have to mine fast. Click fast to get rich. Mine resources with your mouse fast and buy new tools and machines to do the work for you. Earn more and more money and get rich.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26bd.jpg'),(4038,'Dream Island: A Skyward Journey','2024-01-01','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Master tricky jumps, outwit prowling lions, and conquer a challenging world across two distinct islands!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7km4.jpg'),(4039,'Heaven\'s Vault','2021-01-27','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Explore the lost ruins of the Nebula, read ancient inscriptions, and uncover a forgotten past in this narrative archaeological science-fiction adventure game from the creators of 80 Days.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t94.jpg'),(4040,'Midnight Mutants','1990-12-31','Adventure, Arcade','Atari 7800','Can you save Grampa from Plasmic Prison\n\n7800 Arcade adventure like you\'ve never seen before. This game has it all places like rivers, deep dark forests, creepy caverns, labs, creatures like Vampires, Mutant zombies and menacing bats. Your adventure includes exploring large areas and finding awesome weapons. A press of a button brings instant on-screen hints and tips.\n\nIt all adds up to awesome action with mega Graphics. Grampa’s back, it’s up to you to wipe out the Monsters and clean up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lgswkvoucsivorqiznia.jpg'),(4041,'Ishar Compilation',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3crp.jpg'),(4042,'Streets Ablaze','2018-09-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Streets Ablaze is a 3D side-scrolling beat em\' up inspired by the arcade and console games we played growing up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4263.jpg'),(4043,'Pandora\'s Box','2012-03-31','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Pandora\'s Box is a nightmarish text-based adventure game, with the adventure being your own mind. The mystery at the heart of the game constantly swims in and out of focus and there are clues to locate that may or may not help you. It might even be a new genre: A \'whyisit\', rather than a \'whodunnit\'.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gw9.jpg'),(4044,'Cooking Mama 4: Kitchen Magic','2011-11-15','Puzzle, Simulator','Nintendo 3DS','Join the original digital chef as she makes her debut on Nintendo 3DS with Cooking Mama 4: Kitchen Magic! From new recipes and ways to play to fresh kitchen activities and dish combinations, the iconic kitchen cutie has some tricks up her sleeve that will magically transform kitchen newbies into master culinary artists! Slice, dice, knead, toss and flip your way through more than 200 unique Touch Screen mini-games as you cook in brand new ways with the Nintendo 3DS gyroscope: crack eggs, flip pans, balance plates and much more. Earn bronze, silver and gold medals while mixing up over 60 recipes that range from side dishes to full meals. Organize, decorate and clean your kitchen while watching surprising 3D events unfold as you prepare each meal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c9c.jpg'),(4045,'Valkyrie Squad: Siege Breakers','2025-02-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Valkyrie Squad: Siege Breakers\" is an exhilarating top-down shooter survival game. The mission is to break through the enemy\'s fortified defenses and face extreme survival conditions. you will lead this brave squad, utilizing each member\'s unique skills and defeat powerful enemies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9adu.jpg'),(4046,'Ron-Q! Highland in DS',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4047,'The Knight of Queen','2020-05-29','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Dive into the world of old-school RPG in VR !! Become the Hero of her majesty the Queen, and travel to defeat the evil Devil King, bringing peace to the world !!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xy0.jpg'),(4048,'Shelter from the Storm','2025-01-09','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rain lashes down soaking you to the bone, you take shelter in a seemingly abandoned house. Navigate through the rooms solving puzzles and trying to escape in this short point & click adventure game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ol7.jpg'),(4049,'Picture the Link','2017-01-11','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','iOS','Frank’s eyes nearly popped out as he gasped in horror!…\n\nFrank has been hired as the security guard at a new glitzy art exhibition, with lots of distinguished guests attending the grand opening.\n\nThere are many, many walls full of beautifully painted pictures. The pictures on each wall had been carefully arranged in a specific sequence. Each picture was linked to the one before it and the one after it. You know what they say - a picture paints a thousand words! Problem is, some yahoos have sneaked in and moved the pictures around, completely ruining the sequence!\n\nThese pictures need to be put back in the correct sequence before the opening ceremony or, sorry to say, it\'s goodbye Frank!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ubhinrx1anhqaf0xw1yo.jpg'),(4050,'Submarine Titans','2000-08-09','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Submarine Titans is a real-time strategy video game that takes place in the year 2115 after a comet has struck Earth, driving two human factions, the militant White Sharks and the scientific Black Octopi, to establish underwater bases and fight for dominance over the oceans. The comet also brought a mysterious alien race known as the Silicons, who compete with the two human factions to collect resources and build a gate that would take them back to their homeworld. Each faction has its own ten-mission campaign, and the player can play the three campaigns in any order.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cgi.jpg'),(4051,'Junjou Gal to Shiawase no Katachi: Shape of Happiness',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','A childhood friend reunited with you after several years has turned into a \"Gyaru\"!? Just how will the girl who loves the protagonist even after her makeover, and our troubled protagonist\'s relation turn out? Will they be able to find their shape of happiness?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gg4.jpg'),(4052,'You Are Peter Shorts','2024-05-11','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are Peter Shorts! You have been captured and taken to a secret cloning facility. Can you escape with your newly-cloned brethren?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85ne.jpg'),(4053,'Red Egg: High Protein Gluten Free Adventure',NULL,'Simulator, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Red Egg is an addicting and fun jumping game that you wont be able to stop playing.\nContinue to jump and score more points, connect with the red squares only and let the super fun begin !','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4054,'Hidden Ghost Town','2021-11-21','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Find the objects that are hidden on the map.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e9w.jpg'),(4055,'Summer Time Render: Another Horizon','2023-01-26','Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Summer Time Rendering: Another Horizon is a mystery visual novel that retells the events of the TV anime, with six original stories and an original ending.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fpd.jpg'),(4056,'Deadly Racing Duel','2022-01-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deadly Racing Duel - in the role of a racer who conquers circuit auto racing, you accept challenge after challenge in order to prove how good a racer you are.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5d1h.jpg'),(4057,'Capcom Arcade Stadium','2021-05-24','Fighting, Shooter, Platform, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Rediscover the era of 1up\'s and quarter eaters with Capcom Arcade Stadium, a collection of Capcom\'s most beloved arcade games spanning three decades! With 32 action-packed classics featuring some of the best games in Capcom history, such as Street Fighter II: The World Warrior and Strider, this compilation of retro games allows you to travel back in time to scratch that nostalgic itch or share your fond childhood memories with friends or family members!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mgd.jpg'),(4058,'FloodSim','2008-12-31','Simulator, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Web browser','Floodsim is a flash-based serious game created by Norwich Union in cooperation with Playgen in 2008 in order to raise awareness of the dangers that flooding present to the United Kingdom. The goal of the game is to protect the people of the United Kingdom from floods that damage the economy and lives of the people through an assortment of realistic means over a time span of three years.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3we7.jpg'),(4059,'Canterz Paranormies 2','2023-01-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Canterz Paranormies 2 is a 2D Top Down survival horror game based on the story of the most renowned paranormal investigation team of the US, Canterz Paranormies, who received a request to investigate the Kentucky house located in the vicinity of the cemetery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5snh.jpg'),(4060,'Sakaagari Hurricane Portable: Complete Limited Edition','2021-10-28','Visual Novel','PlayStation 4','The complete limited edition includes:\n- Game\n- \"Rin and Yukari on the Beach\" Tapestry (B2 size)\n- Sakahari P Illustration Album\n- OST \"SOUND OF HURRICANE\"\n- LYCEE OVERTURE PR Card','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h42.jpg'),(4061,'Super Street Fighter IV: Pachislot Edition','2016-07-11','Arcade','iOS','On October 12, 2011, Enterrise released a pachislot version of the game in Japan. This version features all of the characters from the console release. The player plays as Ryu in the game\'s story, although other characters such as Ken or Chun-Li can only be played at certain points in the game. New to this version are 3D overworld segments where Ryu travels through some of the game\'s stages and destinations. The battle segments also return in this version, but unlike the arcade and console versions, the pachislot version\'s battle segments are now turn-based (similar to Pokémon Stadium, its sequel and Pokémon Battle Revolution). The Reg Bonus in this game features a new door-opening bonus stage that didn\'t make it into the arcade and console versions of Street Fighter IV and its updated versions. A sequel based on SSFIV: Arcade Edition was released on March 22, 2016.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w6i.jpg'),(4062,'Dune: Spice Wars - House Vernius of Ix','2024-03-07','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the heart of the Ixian Confederation, House Vernius, masters of science and engineering, established itself as the Empire\'s primary supplier of cutting-edge technology. Adapting to the constraints of the Butlerian Jihad, they discreetly explore forbidden self-learning tech.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co867k.jpg'),(4063,'Sakura Angels','2015-01-16','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','日本語バージョンダウンロード開始されました。Two girls, blessed with magical powers, are faced with the task of saving the lonely protagonist from the clutches of a mysterious witch and ancient evil, sealed away long ago by his ancestors. What does this sorceress want from our protagonist?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e6a.jpg'),(4064,'8-Bit Blocks','2024-10-20','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Discover a world of blocky action in 8-Bit Blocks for the Commander X16!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9512.jpg'),(4065,'Gnomes And Co: The Art of the Build','2020-12-19','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gnomes & Co is an optimization-based puzzle game from Cheers Games.\n\nSomewhere out in the forest live the gnomes - tiny people who make their living building products for the big folk. As their new director, your job is to figure out the most efficient way for them to build each product.\n\nThis includes using multiple gnomes, designing your own scaffolding, making multiple products in a batch... the only limit is your cunning.\n\nAlthough each gnome\'s move set is simple, every puzzle has a vast array of possible solutions. Compete with other players online to come up with the best designs.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4066,'Ila: A Frosty Glide',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Set foot on a magical island and immerse yourself in a whimsical small open world as ILA, a spirited young witch-in-training with her trusty skatebroom. Explore, find secret places, collectables, and improve your magic and flying abilities as you make your way to the summit.\n\nExplore a whimsical small open world as ILA, a spirited young witch-in-training. Start your journey fueled by determination and your trusty skatebroom. Find secret places, collect valuable items, and improve your magical flying abilities.\n\nWho needs a broom when you have a skatebroom? Soar through snowy mountains and enchanted forests, feel the wind as you cross stunning landscapes. Master and upgrade the magic of your to soar higher and farther.\n\nExplore ILA’s small open world at your own pace and relax. Find hidden nooks, uncover treasures, and unlock secrets flying on your skatebroom. Each discovery rewards you with valuable items and deeper lore, enriching your magical journey.\n\nCollect special items and coins to personalize ILA’s outfit with stylish hats, capes, and skatebrooms to reflect your unique style. As you progress, access new skatebroom upgrades to improve ILA’s flying powers.\n\nFeel the magic and enjoy the captivating original soundtrack composed by Joaquim Scandurra (Sku), which builds up and grows with you as you approach the summit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bmo.jpg'),(4067,'ACA Neo Geo: Puzzle Bobble 2','2019-02-07','Shooter, Puzzle, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Puzzle Bobble 2 is an action puzzle game released by Taito in 1995 as the second sequel of Puzzle Bobble. Bub and Bob, the bubble spitting dragons from the action game are back again to take on new challenges! Skillfully bounce bubbles off the walls, make chains, and erase them! Aim for even greater chains with the new Star Bubbles and Metal Bubbles! The \"ACA Neo Geo\" series has faithfully reproduced many classic Neo Geo masterpieces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qvq.jpg'),(4068,'The Return Home','2016-07-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The house of a rabbit has been attacked by reptiles from another dimension and they prepare occupation of the planet by means of portals. Whether the rabbit will be able to fight back reptiles and to return the house?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jn9yxkkppbu2xcts8lwa.jpg'),(4069,'Murder House','2021-10-14','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A local news team breaks into an abandoned house to chase a salacious ghost story... until a MANIAC chases them! ...VHS era 80\'s slasher. PS1 style survival horror!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7khb.jpg'),(4070,'Two Point Hospital and Two Point Campus Double Pack','2023-01-19','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Two Point Studios Double Pack features both critically acclaimed games - Two Point Hospital and Two Point Campus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5q0n.jpg'),(4071,'Shitsuji ga Aruji wo Erabu Toki','2016-02-25','Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','All the visual novel elements are there featuring full voice-acting. On-screen text can be toggled off with ability to use analogue sticks to zoom and scroll the clear background image with characters. While this game is a port of an adult visual novel for Windows with the same title released a couple of years earlier, this version has all the adult content removed and main scenario adjusted to work accordingly.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56v1.jpg'),(4072,'Samurai Maiden: Deluxe Edition','2022-12-08','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','The Samurai Maiden: Deluxe Edition contains:\n- Samurai Maiden (Base Game)\n- Tsumugi\'s Costume: Victory Swimsuit 4-Color Set\n- Iyo\'s Costume: Victory Swimsuit 4-Color Set\n- Hagane\'s Costume: Victory Swimsuit 4-Color Set\n- Komimi\'s Costume: Victory Swimsuit 4-Color Set\n- Tsumugi\'s Costume: Sengoku Samurai Girl 4-Color Set\n- Iyo\'s Costume: Matching Uniform 4-Color Set\n- Hagane\'s Costume: Matching Uniform 4-Color Set\n- Komimi\'s Costume: Matching Uniform 4-Color Set\n- Tsumugi\'s Weapon: Luminous Eliminator\n- Extra BGM: Kotonohanisaku (Tsumugi Ver.)\n- Extra BGM: Kotonohanisaku (Iyo Ver.)\n- Extra BGM: Kotonohanisaku (Hagane Ver.)\n- Extra BGM: Kotonohanisaku (Komimi Ver.)\n- Extra BGM: Bullet Girls Special Sound Pack (Exclusive to the Deluxe Edition)','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4073,'Detective Masochist 3: The Case of the Naked Truth','2014-10-03','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Our setting is the venerable city of Kanazawa...\n\nOur protagonist is the (Acting) Director of a Private Detective Agency, tasked with keeping peace in this fair city. As a detective, he\'s still a little green, but as a super-masochist, he\'s top-notch!\n\nHis brave assistant is one Satomi Komatsu. The two of them have gotten wrapped up in a case involving strange rings. One such ring has twisted Satomi physically and mentally, and at times she transforms into a super sadist herself!\n\nOur hero investigates the rings hoping to return Satomi to normal, but he just can\'t quite crack the case. Troubles plague him during his investigation, first when he takes another case by the well-endowed erotic novelist Kiriko Noto, and then when the Agency is taken over by the beautiful and mysterious Regina Kaga.\n\nA detective story filled with ups and so, so many downs!! And that\'s even before the Queen of Dawn, an assassin for the sinister Association, shows up!\n\nWhat will tomorrow bring for a man who can never improve as a detective and can\'t stop improving as a masochist?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7g3e.jpg'),(4074,'Super Sapiens','1989-12-31','Quiz/Trivia','ZX Spectrum','Super Sapiens is a trivia game developed by Coronel for ZX Spectrum 48K, +3DOS, ZX Spectrum 128 +3. Launched in 1989 by SYGRAN Publishing Group','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95bc.jpg'),(4075,'Doki Doki Mario 64','2018-06-09','Platform, Visual Novel','Nintendo 64','Have you ever wanted to date all the enemies of the Mario Universe?\nIn this game, Mario visits the local high school to conquest the hearts of various characters seen around the Mushroom Kingdom!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6png.jpg'),(4076,'Epic Mickey 2: The Power of Two','2014-10-06','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360','Unleash the power of the brush in an all new co-op adventure. Join Mickey and Oswald in an epic battle to save the magical world of Wasteland and change it forever. Interact with your favorite characters like never before in the most heroic adventure yet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nhy.jpg'),(4077,'Bleach: Rebirth of Souls - Deluxe Edition','2025-03-21','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Awaken the blade within you and reverse your fate in BLEACH Rebirth of Souls! Engage in thrilling battles with powerful sword abilities and characters from this legendary anime franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kt8.jpg'),(4078,'Cthulhu: Frozen Nightmare','2020-06-09','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cthulhu waits dreaming... Until some bizarre cultists in the far north awaken him. Use your aircraft to put Cthulhu back into his icy slumber or die trying!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kr1.jpg'),(4079,'Freedom\'s Twilight','2023-04-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Summoned to the strange dark fantasy world of Amissus you will encounter both natural and supernatural obstacles as you explore, collect, craft, learn, build, and survive the fog blanketed realm. Fight back the abhorrent creatures of darkness and build yourself a place you can call home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6clr.jpg'),(4080,'MechAnimals',NULL,'Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Gear up for mayhem: From the creative minds behind Kung Fu Panda and The Mario Movie, MechAnimals combines Roguelite progression and Beat \'Em Up action featuring cute tiny animal MECH PILOTS!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9flp.jpg'),(4081,'Perspectrum','2018-08-09','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Perspectrum, an indie game developed by ProudMom Games, is a 2-D puzzle platformer for Windows, Mac, and Linux via Steam, Itch.io, and Game Jolt. Players take the role of the \"Tall Stranger\", a being who has awakened with the power to use ancient fountains to change the elements of the world. The stranger must use spirit fragments scattered throughout the various levels to bring the mountain back to life. The game will include an overworld and five dungeons, each introducing it\'s own unique mechanic to help collect more spirit fragments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wj7lfbamjcxmxwtbal4w.jpg'),(4082,'Dethroned','2024-05-26','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unleash your inner ruler in Dethroned - an army-building roguelike with short runs, tactical but dynamic fights and infinite possibilities. Choose a mage, hone unique abilities, hunt for spells and artifacts. Explore an unpredictable world, grow influence and forge alliances to reclaim the throne.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ys8.jpg'),(4083,'Cape\'s Escape Game','2020-11-19','Puzzle, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','The main character recently moved to the apartment. Because the rent was quite cheap, he was pleased with himself. He did not seem to have any doubts concerning the cheap rent. One day, just a few days after moving in, when he twisted the doorknob, thinking of going out, it would not open. Cape, a mischievous ghost, suddenly appeared in front of the main character who was left wondering. Of course, there was the reason why the rent was cheap. Yes, a ghost was haunting this place. The main character was locked in the room by Cape. Let\'s solve the mystery and help the main character escape from this room.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4084,'Mad Nords: Probably an Epic Quest','2016-12-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It seems that the whole world is on the verge of the terrific cataclysm. Strange cults and evil monsters spread on the once peaceful lands. But who cares? Maybe you?! The time for adventures and glorious deeds has come! It\'s time to complete probably an epic quest!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21c2.jpg'),(4085,'Dance Aerobics',NULL,'Sport','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','Dance Aerobics is a chance to get fit by following the movements of an aerobics instructor.\n\nPlayers use side B of the Power Pad accessory (a floor mat with 12 pads in a 4 by 3 grid) to follow the movements of an aerobics instructor. To succeed the player must press the pads with their feet and hands at the same time as the on screen aerobics instructor. Any missed movements are recorded on a mistake counter and 10 missed movements will fail the level. The routines (a set of repeated movements) start slow and simple with a bit of no-penalty practise time however as the player gets better the routines get more complex with less practices time. Each level has a set number of routines that increase with each level from 4 at the start to a total of 32 on the final level (level 7). At the successful completion of each level the player will get a pass stamp which they can enter later to skip that level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nuc.jpg'),(4086,'BS Dragon Quest','1996-02-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Satellaview','BS Dragon Quest is a version of Dragon Quest released for the Super Famicom add-on peripheral Satellaview, via broadcast, in Japan. It was divided in chapters, that could be playable only for an hour, and consisted of four one-hour scenarios which players would download on a weekly schedule. It consists of four stories: \"導入 (Introduction)\", \"ダンジョン特集 (Dungeons Collection)\", \"フィールド特集 (Field Collection)\", \"フィナーレ (Finale)\". Players were tasked with leveling their character, collecting medals and completing scenario-specific conditions with special events designed to occur under specific conditions in real-time. It was compatible with the SoundLink add-on.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co309p.jpg'),(4087,'8 Ball Pool','2013-01-23','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','Android, iOS','Play with friends! Play with Legends. Play the hit Miniclip 8 Ball Pool game on your mobile and become the best!\n\nRefine your skills in the practice arena, take on the world in 1-vs-1 matches, or enter tournaments to win trophies and exclusive cues!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pcx.jpg'),(4088,'Pastel Pop','1996-12-01','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ath.jpg'),(4089,'Brain Age: Concentration Training','2012-07-28','Sin género','Nintendo 3DS','Brain Age is back with all-new devilishly difficult brain-training exercises designed by world-famous brain researcher Dr. Ryuta Kawashima. The modern mind has numerous devices to stay connected (e.g. laptops, smart phones, tablets), and these distractions have led to an information overload making it difficult to stay focused on specific tasks. Brain Age: Concentration Training offers newly designed training exercises to combat this information addiction. By spending at least five minutes a day, these exercises will challenge players with activities to help improve their concentration skills and the ability to access their short term memory. The new Devilish Training exercises dynamically increase or decrease in difficulty based on your real-time results to help consistently train players at the limit of their abilities. Beyond the Devilish Training, there are additional new and classic puzzles for every purpose, whether to challenge one\'s concentration or math skills or provide relaxation activities to give the brain a break.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7n12.jpg'),(4090,'My Pretend New York City - Big Apple Friends',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4091,'Super House of Dead Ninjas','2013-02-18','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Descend a seemingly-endless tower, wielding an arsenal of deadly ninja weapons and attacks, as the fearsome Crimson Ninja. This 2D action-platformer uses ninja magic to generate every tower randomly, so no two adventures are the same!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qg6.jpg'),(4092,'Git Up!','2024-09-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A platformer where you need to jump between, and balance on, loose platforms in order to reach the time portal and continue your journey through time. Unlock new locations and pixelart characters as you go. Keep your balance, but if you fall down, just Git Up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j5p.jpg'),(4093,'Gauntlet Legends','2000-07-21','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Dreamcast','The third and final console version of Gauntlet Legends, released in June of 2000.\n\nThis version is most notable for being a near-direct arcade port, as the only console port to feature the four original Realms from the arcade original. However, some of their levels were completely redone, a new physics engine was used, and some of the soundtracks were remixed.\n\nLike the arcade version, there is no inventory. The player can only access the shop after completing a level. Special items are used on a time limit, which is slightly longer than the arcade version. The game is often criticized for not allowing players to buy food at the shop.\n\nThis port includes many features from Gauntlet: Dark Legacy, including its 8 new character classes. The Poisoned Fields area is included as the first level in the Castle Stronghold. The Mausoleum is also accessible from a secret passage in the Castle Courtyard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91oe.jpg'),(4094,'Wanderland','2016-12-20','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wanderland, the mystery adventure from Artogon, the world-famous creator of great casual adventures series such as Shiver, Treasure Seekers and Depths of Betrayal. Sleeping Beauty has been kidnapped! Explore a world full of temples, crypts, and more.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4095,'Outbreak: The Nightmare Chronicles - Definitive Edition','2021-02-05','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox Series X|S','Return to the world of survival horror. Monstrous beasts and disfigured remnants roam freely with their numbers increasing rapidly. Scattered and separated from your fellow survivors, you\'ve fled into a large manor estate to escape the relentless horde. Your only goal now is survival. Explore the manor, locate supplies and find a way to wake from this nightmare. But somehow... you know your fate is sealed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kam.jpg'),(4096,'Superfetch Dog','2023-08-29','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play fetch as Gale the goodest boy.\n\nSuperfetch Dog a platformer where you need to fetch the orb for your owner. Run across various landscapes, jump over obstacles, climb trees, bark at small creatures, avoid dangerous wildlife, learn new tricks… Do anything you can to retrieve the orb before it’s too late!\n\nNothing can stop a good boy like Gale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zv2.jpg'),(4097,'Mask II','1987-12-31','Shooter','ZX Spectrum, MSX','MASK II is a 2D horizontal scrolling shoot-em-up. The game featured many more of the M.A.S.K. vehicles, and included a selection process in which the player chose which vehicles to use before the game began. Only one vehicle could be controlled at a time but these could be quickly interchanged. Again, the game was received favorably in the press, where it was noted that it was a better tie-in to the franchise than the first, because it featured more of the vehicles','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31ff.jpg'),(4098,'Pinochle HD','2010-09-13','Card & Board Game','iOS','The classic thrills of Pinochle burst onto the iPhone and iPod Touch with Pinochle HD! Download this digital update of the classic card game NOW to get your hands on the complete versions of both single-deck and double-deck Pinochle for endless fun on the go! Entertain your brain and rediscover the timeless appeal of Pinochle with Pinochle HD.\n\nWith full Game Center integration, Pinochle HD allows users to play Online matches against random opponents as well as invite friends to a match! Play with 4 people or 2 in ether cooperative or versus modes. Pinochle HD also includes full Leaderboard and Achievement support.\n\nDeveloped as the highest quality Pinochle adaptation available on the Apple App Store, Pinochle HD caters to all players. Detailed instructions and interactive hints at every stage of play are provided for novices while experienced Pinochle veterans can simply pump up Pinochle HD’s adjustable difficulty settings – three separate difficulty settings are available to choose from -- or play against tough live opponents through the Peer to Peer gaming options included within the game.\n\nDeveloped to bring the authentic Pinochle experience into the digital age, Pinochle HD allows users to play from any Apple mobile platform, play Online via Game Center and review game play with recorded match statistics and hand histories. Pick up your mobile device and discover—or rediscover—the time tested joys and challenges of Pinochle today with Pinochle HD!\n\nApp Features:\n- 3 unique difficulty settings (Easy, Medium, & Hard).\n- Single player game mode.\n- Support for both Single Deck and Double Deck Pinochle.\n- Multi-Player game-play on the device\n- Peer-to-Peer game-play via Bluetooth.\n- Online games via Game Center\n- Complete game statistics for all matches.\n- 6 unique background/ layout choices.\n- Full instructions for new players\n- Extensive hints at all stages of game-play and in-game ‘Explain’ option for novice users.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ofelbyfte4nvpnb2pepp.jpg'),(4099,'Die After Sunset','2022-02-11','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Die After Sunset is a 3rd person action rogue-lite shooter with a unique mechanic featuring light and darkness. Battle for Earth and travel through time as you defeat hordes of enemies and complete random quests to create the best build possible. Can you solve the mystery behind the Murkor invasion?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zj6.jpg'),(4100,'Japanese Style Tien Gow','2023-11-22','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Tien Gow\" is a game exclusively for four players using 32 tiles. This game, which is said to have various local rules, has been adjusted to \"Japanese Style Tien gow\". Tiles are played based on the 8 tiles dealt, and the last player to play a strong tile wins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fhc.jpg'),(4101,'Auto Modellista','2004-01-20','Racing, Simulator','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Handle the road like a pro with your own customizable racing machine or your choice of more than 60 top-of-the-line models. Race vehicles from manufacturers, including Toyota, Nissan, Honda, Subaru, and Mitsubishi, against up to eight drivers online or up to two drivers in split-screen mode. You\'ll tear past spectators, maneuver your way through tight mountain passes, and round each corner of the race track in your dream car at lightning speeds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uqu.jpg'),(4102,'Divergence: Online','2016-01-06','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Divergence: Online is an open-world sandbox MMO that began as the spiritual successor to Pre-NGE SWG, but since has grown into its own living breathing universe. Divergence was designed to provide unmatched crafting, player and guild housing and player freedom on a scale, we believe, never before achieved. We hope you\'ll enjoy our Early Access release and help us continue to develop this game!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4103,'Mines',NULL,'Puzzle','Playdate','Minesweeper for Playdate. Multiple mines per space!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4104,'Muse Dash','2018-06-15','Music, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Play as characteristic heroines, dash through fairy tale like stages, dancing to the rhythm and beats, kick those silly cute enemies into outer space!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6h43.jpg'),(4105,'Wufo','2022-12-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Navigate your ship and recover Wi-Fi while dodging obstacles and fighting space enemies in the 4 worlds and 8 available bosses. You can also play together with a friend in 2D cooperative multiplayer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ydp.jpg'),(4106,'Solarpunk','2025-12-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Solarpunk is a survival game in a technically advanced world of floating islands. Alone or together with your friends, you can construct buildings, grow food, craft gadgets and explore distant islands with your own airship.\n\nUse sunlight, wind and water to create an energy system and automate your processes like gathering ressoureces, watering your plants or catching fish.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jem.jpg'),(4107,'Dungeon Master Nexus','1998-03-26','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','Sega Saturn','Dungeon Master Nexus is part of the Dungeon Master series, it is the first game in the series using a 3D graphics engine. The game features 15 levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s3t.jpg'),(4108,'Welcome to... Chichester 2: Part II - No Extra Regrets For the Future','2021-09-30','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Grendel Jinx is in danger of having to repeat a school year. Refusing to allow this to happen, she enlists the services of the protagonist - her newly found \"Best Friend\" - and is promptly rebuffed. Grendels drastic actions soon catches the attention of her mother.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z4g.jpg'),(4109,'East Wood Carnival','2024-06-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A PSX retro horror game made by a sixth grader. Your car runs out of gas on your way to an abandoned carnival now infested with danger at every corner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h01.jpg'),(4110,'Trolls','1997-12-31','Platform','Amiga CD32, DOS, Amiga','This platform game features the small blue-haired cutesy creatures that were popular around the time (although surely not with most computer game buyers?). You play a Troll roaming the levels in the hope of rescuing as many baby trolls as possible - each level gives you a set minimum to retrieve before you can leave via the Pigstop.\n\nInitially you have no weapons, and contact with the nasties costs you energy, but a Yo-Yo can be collected, which can be used not only to kill enemies, but also to smash blocks away and open up paths, and even (with practice) tied to a ledge to allow you to swing across a gap.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kh9.jpg'),(4111,'Commander Keen: Battle of the Brains','2011-02-02','Platform','DOS','Battle of the Brains, also known as Keen 9, is the third and final episode of the unofficial \"The Universe is Toast\" trilogy by Ceilick, with the bulk of the modding done by Ceilick, Mink and Tulip, with extensive patching by Levellass and Lemm. Work on the mod began shortly after the release of Dead in the Desert in 2009. It was released in February 2011.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8611.jpg'),(4112,'Asaki, Yumemishi','2008-07-25','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable','I am a high school student. This summer, I am visiting a small town in the country. The town is surrounded by mountains and people peacefully coexist with ayakashi (ghosts). I don\'t remember this place, but I feel like there was something I cherished there. The people I spend my time there all feel somehow important. They are Giou (an ayakashi), Shinonome, Shu, Takatora, and Chihaya. I get involved in a trouble due to appearance of an another mysterious ayakashi. Mysterious phenomena... Nightmare... I don\'t wanna remember that thing, but I have to... When the moon becomes full, what will happen to me...? Now, my summer starts...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1prw.jpg'),(4113,'Nakobeat','2021-11-20','Music, Arcade','Android, iOS','A pixel art rhythm game where you control the main character, \"Nako-chan\", and avoid enemy characters approaching in rhythm. In a pinch, strum the guitar to wipe out the enemies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fpv.jpg'),(4114,'Olympic Boxing','2021-03-20','Sport','Nintendo Switch','Fight with a variety of devastating punches. Feel every hook , jab and uppercut with intuitive and responsive controls. Olympic Boxing brings you all the sensations of real boxing competitions. Put your boxing skills to test and challenge competitors from all over the world. Fight for your country in the boxing tournament and win the gold medal. Challenge your friends and family in two-player mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jx1.jpg'),(4115,'Pecaminosa','2021-05-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Pecaminosa is a Police Action RPG, based on a Film Noir concept with a Pixel Art aesthetic. As John Souza – a former detective succumbed to the pleasures of alcohol and flesh – you will explore the city and its environs, as well as chase and fight ordinary thieves, smart criminals, and even some forces of… the occult.\n\nPecaminosa is a dark and gambling city that smells of death, sex, and gunpowder. And you know what? Once you are there, you’ll get the opportunity to experience this fictional open-ended city, all the while living through an humorous, provocative and rich story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kaa.jpg'),(4116,'Bum Simulator','2021-08-26','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','You lost everything and ended up on the streets. What will you do? Adapt and survive? Take revenge on those responsible? Become an urban legend?\n\nBum Simulator is a sandbox game bursting with inappropriate humor and memorable characters. Apart from day-to-day survival, you can enjoy many unique features.\n\nYou can throw pigeons at people and watch as the panic ensues. Not fun enough? Upgrade your birds with explosives and let chaos reign. Still not satisfied? Wait until you see the fully upgraded pigeonado skill…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m6r.jpg'),(4117,'Metal Garden','2024-08-16','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Travel through an overgrown megastructure, and discover what lies beyond it. Metal Garden is a short, atmospheric singleplayer FPS game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h5w.jpg'),(4118,'Coloring Book for Adults','2020-11-05','Point-and-click','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Boost your creativity with Coloring Book for Adults! Choose from a wide range of coloring pages within the app and experience coloring many different characters, patterns, and objects. Lose yourself in colors, forget about time and duties, say goodbye to stress!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ngk.jpg'),(4119,'Ether One Redux: Deluxe Edition','2014-03-25','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1l4k.jpg'),(4120,'Baseball Brat Badventure',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle','Playdate','Puzzle Platforming for Playdate','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4121,'Eisenhorn: Xenos','2016-08-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','‘Eisenhorn: Xenos\' is a premium 3D action and adventure game based on ‘Xenos\', the first book in Games Workshop\'s best-selling ‘Eisenhorn\' trilogy, written by award winning author Dan Abnett. Set in the grim, dark future of Warhammer 40,000.\n\nEisenhorn: Xenos tells the story of Gregor Eisenhorn, an Inquisitor and member of the ‘Ordo Xenos\', sent out to fight and protect the Imperium of man from anything that may threaten it. Presented in full 3D, Eisenhorn: Xenos players will get to play as Eisenhorn himself (voiced by Mark Strong), and explore various areas of the Warhammer 40k universe with a party of characters in tow.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hca.jpg'),(4122,'Cult of the Lamb: Cultist Edition','2022-08-11','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Cult of the Lamb: Cultist Edition bundles the base game with the exclusive Cultist Pack that includes a seven-piece decoration pack for your charming commune, as well as five exclusive Follower forms. You\'ll be the envy of every cult.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50n3.jpg'),(4123,'God of War: Bonus Edition','2018-04-20','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4','This particular edition of the game is exclusive to Amazon in the EU and offers us as a bonus content the \"Three shields\" DLC and a dynamic theme (the content can be downloaded via a voucher inside the package).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3di7.jpg'),(4124,'Ashes: 2063','2018-09-23','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ashes is a Post-apocalypse themed Doom II Total conversion, designed to be run in the Gzdoom or Qzdoom ports, and includes support for either software or hardware options. Set decades after a worldwide catastrophe has reduced most of the country to toxic wasteland, the player takes on the role of a scavenger searching the ruins of \"The City\", a once thriving metropolis, for valuable items. Add bands of mutant cannibals, limited ammunition, and a mysterious group of gas-mask wearing para-military types prowling the rubble.\n\nHeavily inspired by 90\'s FPS games, 80\'s post-apocalyptic movies, and a shit-ton of other references, Ashes will be designed to either run as a weapons mod, a map-pack, or as a full conversion, depending on the modules downloaded and run.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3jib.jpg'),(4125,'Super Famicom Wars','2010-02-16','Strategy','Wii, Wii U, Super Famicom','Super Famicom Wars is a war simulator produced by Nintendo for the Super Famicom. It was released via the Nintendo Power game service. It is the follow-up to the original Famicom Wars and a precursor to the Advance Wars series.\n\nSuper Famicom Wars features all 15 stages from the original 2-Players mode from Famicom Wars, where the player can choose between the Red Star or Blue Moon armies, as well as a New 2-Players mode featuring 15 new stages where the player controls one of the two new armies (Green Earth or Yellow Comet). There\'s also a 4-Players Mode featuring 10 stages where all four armies fight each other as well as four new final stages for each side upon completing the first 15 stages in either 2-Player Mode, for a total of 42 stages.\n\nAs in the original game, one can choose which army will be controlled by a player and which one will be controlled by the computer. A new feature in Super Famicom Wars allows the player to select the General for each army. There are seven Generals, each with his or her own unique ability. There are also eight new units and new facilities such as labs and rail stations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w0g.jpg'),(4126,'Sinjid: Shadow of the Warrior','2007-12-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser','Sinjid Shadow of the Warrior is the second game in the Sinjid series. It is a role-playing game, where the players take control of the eponymous protagonist, Sinjid.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wuwkunr5nqi26o4tem0e.jpg'),(4127,'One Week At Pan','2021-05-23','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','One Week At Pan is a point and click horror FNAF fan game inspired from other fan games like: Jonochrome\'s Flumpty series, Emilmaco\'s Candy series and WwwWario\'s Wario series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30wk.jpg'),(4128,'Granblue Fantasy Versus: Rising - Free Edition','2023-12-14','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Enter the world of Granblue Fantasy at no cost with the Free Edition of Granblue Fantasy Versus: Rising, which includes: 4 playable characters (Gran and 3 rotating characters), part 1 of the story, online matches and lobby access (including access to Grand Bruise Legends!). Some features are limited in the Free Edition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wn3.jpg'),(4129,'Hell Clock','2025-06-01','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Forge powerful builds with endless loot in this relentless combination of Roguelike and ARPG. Blast through dungeons and unleash inhuman powers in a dark fantasy twist on Brazil’s War of Canudos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co946e.jpg'),(4130,'PowerWash Simulator: Ice Rink - Winter 2024','2024-12-05','Simulator, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Put all your plans on ice, this is no rinky-dink clean up. With the grand reopening of the Ice Rink just around the corner, and the place nothing short of a glacial grime-fest, you’re the power washer wielding hero Muckingham needs this holiday season.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94bi.jpg'),(4131,'Deadlands Noir: That Old Time Religion','2015-07-03','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A Visual Novel set in the Deadlands Noir RPG Setting from Savage Worlds.\n* Now updated to include Episode 1 and 2 *\n\nNew Orleans, 1935. Whoever called this \"The Big Easy\" sure got that one wrong. Things are tough all over. Honest work is hard to find, and even dishonest jobs are getting scarce. The one thing that\'s not in short supply is trouble. From shady thugs to crooked cops to mafia soldiers, there\'s plenty of characters out there looking to give an honest Joe a hard time. And that\'s not the worst of it.\n\nThere are stories going round about things that go bump in the night. Things you wouldn\'t want to meet in a dark alley on a darker night. And those stories aren\'t just coming from rummies or saps who read that epitaph rag.\n\nStill, there are a few heroes left in the concrete jungle. Steely-eyed private dicks, fast-talking grifters, wild-eyed inventors, and shadowy houngans still struggle against the encroaching darkness. With enough moxie--and more than a little luck--they might just be enough to turn the tide.\n\nThis is just one story. The story of Harvey Jenkins, Private Investigator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45ln.jpg'),(4132,'In the Kingdom','2014-06-13','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A deliberately retro horror FPS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sre.jpg'),(4133,'SoKoStaTioN3',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4134,'Pip 3','2022-09-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pip 3 is a cute puzzle game with pipes. Enjoy a relaxing time connecting pipes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fa5.jpg'),(4135,'Hidden Through Time','2020-03-12','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Embark on a colourful hand drawn journey of discovery through the ages! From missing dinosaur eggs in the stone age, to a king\'s crown in medieval times, can you find them all? Discover, create and share worlds with your own hidden treasures in Hidden Through Time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20gn.jpg'),(4136,'En Garde!: Student Project','2018-06-26','Fighting, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A swashbuckling adventure!\nEn Garde! is a swashbuckling action-adventure game set in 17th century\'s Spain. Play as Adalia de Volador, a noble & impetuous swordswoman! Your palace has been seized by a mysterious mastermind and his hoard of guards - you will have to defend your family\'s honor!\n\nFight with your rapier and acrobatic moves against numerous opponents, and use the environment to your advantage in an intuitive way (every object is interactive, from tables to chandeliers!). You can even use your sense of repartee to taunt your opponents. Combat is a spectacle and should be done with panache!\n\nThis En Garde! prototype features story-driven action in an open level (the Volador\'s Palace) for a total play time of about 30 minutes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6slu.jpg'),(4137,'Freedom Force vs. The 3rd Reich','2005-03-08','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Freedom is threatened yet again and only Minute Man and his heroic Freedom Force can save the day in the follow up to one of the most critically acclaimed games of 2002.\n\nFreedom Force vs. the Third Reich brings dynamic storytelling, fast-paced tactical role-play, and larger-than-life characters from the comic book pages to the computer screen. In this title, the league of heroes must travel back in time to defeat Blitzkrieg, defender of the Reich and his homicidal henchmen. With action spanning from the blasted battlefields of World War II to the dazzling depths of distant dimensions, Freedom Force vs. the Third Reich will give Freedom Fans more than they can handle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28fk.jpg'),(4138,'The Temple of No','2016-06-21','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','The Best Game Ever Made (but in twine form)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qks.jpg'),(4139,'Duck Hunt Pro','2024-07-02','Sin género','Android','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co973a.jpg'),(4140,'The Crystal Nebula','2016-07-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fly your spaceship from wormhole to wormhole, navigating dangerous space station obstacle courses and collecting crystals from the wreckage of fallen enemies. The Crystal Nebula demands your highest dexterity and accuracy in order to shoot and dodge your way through its waves of opposition!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4141,'Battleship War Multiplayer',NULL,'Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Battleship War is the classic strategy/skill game.\n\nHit all the ships of your enemy and lead your fleet to the victory!\n\nTwo games mode:\nClassic: Guess the position of your enemy’s ships and destroy them!\nAdvanced: Collect points and buy 2 special power-up.\n\nAlso challenge your friends with online multiplayer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95bk.jpg'),(4142,'Horror Park of Willie Mouse',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co973b.jpg'),(4143,'Ozymandias: Deluxe Edition','2022-10-11','Simulator, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vfq.jpg'),(4144,'The Leopard Catgirl in Miaoli','2019-12-14','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The protagonist Wang Cheng-En returns to his hometown due to the rivalry between different countries. Along the way, he encounters a girl with animal ears by accident.How will this relationship develop when he lives together with this unusual girl?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43xf.jpg'),(4145,'Police Simulator: Patrol Officers - Extended Edition','2024-03-18','Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Extended Edition contains the Police Simulator: Patrol Officers game and the Garage Bundle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lmm.jpg'),(4146,'Ballistix','1989-12-31','Sport, Arcade','BBC Microcomputer System, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, Acorn Electron, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, DOS, Amiga','Ballistix is a video game created by Martin Edmondson for the Amiga and Atari ST and published by Psyclapse in 1989. It was also converted to a number of other home computers in the same year and the PC Engine/TurboGrafx-16 console in 1991. It is a fictional futuristic sport involving directing a puck to a goal by shooting small balls at it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gq5.jpg'),(4147,'Ferocious',NULL,'Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ferocious is a survival shooter in which you will discover a lost prehistoric world full of deadly creatures under the control of hostile forces. Fight, Explore, Survive','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lju.jpg'),(4148,'Ghostwriter','2022-04-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ghostwriter is a singleplayer typing game that pits your words-per-minute against poltergeists who have nothing better to do. Type whatever shows up on the monitor and meet your quota before the time limit. Encounter a variety of ghost types that will interfere in different ways. Buy upgrades and powerups to give yourself an advantage. Improve your words-per-minute and have fun while you are at it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hi6.jpg'),(4149,'Pokémon Café Mix','2020-06-24','Puzzle','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','Complete touch-based puzzles to serve dishes and drinks to adorable Pokémon customers!\n\nLink together Pokémon icons to clear puzzles as you work to build up your very own café in Pokémon Café Mix, a free-to-start game for the Nintendo Switch system! Meet the goals for each puzzle before you run out of turns—link a certain number of icons, get a high score, or even destroy sugar cubes to serve up Pokémon themed menu items.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2aa9.jpg'),(4150,'Jock Studio',NULL,'Simulator, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Jock Studio is a BL/Gay Dating Simulator following the story of Ace Anderson, an indecisive and aimless freshman at the prestigious all-boys sports campus, Olympus University. Ace is invited to join a hidden film club and discovers that it\'s actually a porn studio featuring the sexy jocks and athletes from around campus.\n\nExperience Ace\'s journey as a new member of the club, interacting with fellow actors, unraveling their stories, and forming meaningful connections that will help Ace find his own purpose.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qjy.jpg'),(4151,'The Ultimate Game','2021-10-08','Simulator, Sport, Tactical, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Ultimate Game is a fast paced sport played 2v2 up to 7v7. The game is about passing the disc - realistic flight physics and intricate thrower controls allow for a huge variety in flight paths. Everyone but the current thrower can run and jump freely. Points are scored by catching the disc in endzone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ts8.jpg'),(4152,'The Mist City','2020-05-12','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You fall into the river by accident under the guidance of the unknown and mysterious power. Then you wake up in an empty city and meet another 12 people who have the same experience as you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7oob.jpg'),(4153,'Claws & Feathers III','2020-12-03','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The birds and cats are back in an all-new puzzle adventure that sends them soaring across the galaxy in search of a new home! When a zombie apocalypse ravages their home planet, the birds set off for the stars. But they\'re not alone!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n8g.jpg'),(4154,'Grisaia Phantom Trigger 5.5 to 08','2023-06-29','Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Grisaia Phantom Trigger is finally complete!\nThe second half of the series is now available in one package!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s02.jpg'),(4155,'Haven & Hearth','2009-04-04','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Haven & Hearth is a MMORPG (Massive Multiplayer Online Roleplaying Game) set in a fictional world loosely inspired by Slavic and Germanic myth and legend.\n\nThe game sets itself apart from other games in the genre in its aim to provide players with an interactive, affectable and mutable game world, which can be permanently and fundamentally changed and affected through actions undertaken by the players.\n\nOur fundamental goal with Haven & Hearth is to create a game in which player choices have permanent and/or lasting effects and, thus, providing said players with a meaningful and fun gaming experience','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kts.jpg'),(4156,'Slimepocalypse','2024-10-10','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4157,'Dungeons & Dragons Online: Delera\'s Tomb','2006-02-28','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A premium collection of short dungeons about ghostly skeletons and other undead. The main quests are narrated by Gary Gygax.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qnd.jpg'),(4158,'The Elder Scrolls Online: Deluxe Collection - Gold Road','2024-06-18','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Pre-purchase now to get immediate access to a new mount and additional rewards at launch.\n\nThe Elder Scrolls Online Deluxe Collection: Gold Road is ideal for adventurers who wish to access all major Chapter zones and quests found across Tamriel. The Deluxe Collection: Gold Road includes the Base Game, Gold Road, all previous Chapters (which can be played immediately), and all previous Deluxe in-game items.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fmf.jpg'),(4159,'Octopath Traveler: Traveler\'s Compendium Edition','2018-07-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','A role-playing game from the Bravely Default team is being developed exclusively for the Nintendo Switch. They have brought a new world to life through a mix of CG, pixel art, and \"HD-2D\" visuals.\n\nThe Traveler\'s Compendium Edition contains:\nOctopath Traveler Game\nDouble-Sided cloth World Map of Osterra\nReplica of a Leaf Coin, the in-game currency\n8-Page Pop-up Book with Item Compartments','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co324u.jpg'),(4160,'Accele Brid','1993-11-26','Shooter','Super Famicom','Players progress through the game as a robot racing through a pipe, shooting everything that moves. The robot can shoot from both arms, jump, kick and punch. There are also power-ups and bonuses that can be collected to upgrade the robot\'s weapons and armor.\n\nThere are three different types of robots to choose from: Silver Mare, Beliws, and Nitika. Weapons are chosen before each stage and every level has Mode 7 graphics. Three difficulty levels can be chosen; ranging from easy, medium, and hard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b2z.jpg'),(4161,'Ignis Universia: Eternal Sisters Saga DX','2019-10-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ignis Universia: Eternal Sister Saga is a short but epic visual novel/JRPG made for Ludum Dare 45 by a small team in Tampere, Finland.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yns.jpg'),(4162,'Game of Skulls',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','In Game of Skulls you are playing against an AI, trying to predict its moves and come up with a counter strategy. The rules are simple but coming up with the right strategy is a serious challenge.\nBoth you and the AI start with 12 cards. In each round, you both play a card on different stacks collecting penalty points. Whoever has the least amount of penalty points at the end wins. You can play multiple rounds and keep track of your overall score.\nThe game has two difficulty modes. One mode for beginners that doesn\'t keep a persistent score and a challenge mode.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4163,'Gnomes & Goblins','2020-09-23','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','Gnomes & Goblins is an original indie production from Wevr with MWM and Golem Creations that offers players a unique opportunity to explore an enchanted virtual world created by Jon Favreau (director of The Lion King, The Jungle Book, Chef, Iron Man) in collaboration with VR Director Jake Rowell (theBlu, Call of Duty, Superman Returns).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a9j.jpg'),(4164,'GundeadliGne','2011-08-02','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Reload for more shooting action with GundeadliGne, the 2nd title in the Gundemonium Collection - this anime-style side-scroller brings the intensity of the \'bullet hell\' shooter genre to Steam. Take your place as a mercenary and assist in the effort to prevent the annihilation of mankind by the demons of the underworld. Grab a friend, lock and load your guns - play online together in co-op mode! Choose from two player characters, and fight to unlock the third! Four levels of difficulty will make your experience an intense battle. As an added bonus, choose from 6 Matrix Masters with different abilities to help you along your way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yp1.jpg'),(4165,'Per Aspera','2020-12-03','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Per Aspera is a narrative-driven strategy game with the goal of overcoming the challenge of terraforming Mars. Explore the planet, gather resources, and make strategic decisions as you live the fantasy of scientifically-based interplanetary expansion. Hardship awaits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g12.jpg'),(4166,'Fission','2024-03-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When the ball hits a fungus, the fungus disappears and the ball bounces back. The game is completed when all the fungi on the screen disappear by repeating this process. When the fungus disappears, a capsule that fission the ball may be dropped. There are 9 stages in total.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7z49.jpg'),(4167,'Incredible Dracula II: The Last Call',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4168,'The Great Book of Mario','2021-08-20','Platform, Role-playing (RPG)','Wii','The Great Book of Mario is a text hack of Super Paper Mario created by Solargress. The original game\'s script is placed through oscillating translations on Google Translate, creating a new plot and comedic moments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ucb.jpg'),(4169,'Interstellar Enforcer','2018-06-16','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a nutshell, IE is a mission based GZDOOM TC for DOOM II. Take doom, mix in a dose of unreal and turok, add a splash of metroid and maybe a little bit of system shock 2 and you\'ll not be far from the target. You play as an officer of the Interstellar Enforcement Patrol, tasked with policing the obscure fringes of humanities bustling space empire in the future of the DOOM II timeline. You generally do this by shooting things.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4n5q.jpg'),(4170,'Tiny Tina\'s Wonderlands','2022-03-25','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Embark on an epic adventure full of whimsy, wonder, and high-powered weaponry! Bullets, magic, and broadswords collide across this chaotic fantasy world brought to life by the unpredictable Tiny Tina.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co390m.jpg'),(4171,'Game Party: In Motion','2010-11-18','Sport','Xbox 360','Game Party: In Motion is an exclusive game for Kinect with arcade, sports, and party games for all ages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co229z.jpg'),(4172,'TrackMania Turbo','2016-03-24','Racing, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), Oculus Rift, Xbox One','Trackmania offers you the ultimate arcade racing universe where everything is about reaching the perfect racing time. Test your skills in over 200 tracks, experience immediate fun by challenging your friends at home (offline splitscreen) or online. The competition lasts forever: design and share your own tracks with other players in the Trackbuilder!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z4h.jpg'),(4173,'Hidden Deep','2022-01-24','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hidden Deep is 2D action & exploration sci-fi thriller game (for PC) where you command group of explorers deep under the ocean floor to find out what happened to previous expedition to which contact has been lost. As they go deeper and deeper, they discover strange structures and deadly unknown organisms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4dfy.jpg'),(4174,'Neko Ghost, Jump!','2022-01-11','Platform, Puzzle, Racing, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Neko Ghost, Jump! is a puzzle-platformer where you not only switch between 2D & 3D camera perspectives but also between your physical & ghost forms to solve puzzles, combat enemies, and clear levels faster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c3x.jpg'),(4175,'Johnny Turbo\'s Arcade: Super Real Darwin','2019-02-28','Shooter, Simulator, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Super Real Darwin is a fast-paced, vertical scrolling shoot-em-up that rewards skill and persistence - a cult classic for the retro shmup fan. Take control of a fighter ship capable of mutating into different shapes as it evolves while fighting off enemy invaders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3tw0.jpg'),(4176,'Coded Arms','2005-07-06','Shooter','PlayStation Portable','Coded Arms is a visually stunning first-person shooter that places the gamer in the role of a computer hacker who infiltrates an abandoned virtual reality system. Originally created as a combat training simulator to prepare for an alien invasion, the VR system was shut down during development after a major flaw was discovered. Unbeknownst to its creators, the simulation program continued to evolve on its own, turning into a vast and brutal VR world populated with virtual alien invaders, dangerous computer bugs and the VR system\'s own security bots. Arm yourself with an assortment of weaponry and battle these enemies through the virtual landscape.\n\n• Multiplayer modes for 4 players\n• Immersive single player mode\n• Weapons and power-ups collected in single-player mode stay with you in multiplayer\n• More than 30 weapons including assault rifles, pulse weapons and rocket launchers\n• Multiple game worlds with randomized levels','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hvo.jpg'),(4177,'Slipways','2018-03-20','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Build a vast interstellar empire in 30 minutes flat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xlu.jpg'),(4178,'TwinBee','1986-01-04','Shooter, Arcade','Family Computer Disk System, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Family Computer, Wii U','A port of TwinBee for Famicom and Famicom Disk System.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mi1.jpg'),(4179,'G-Mode Archives+: Tantei Kibukawa Ryousuke Jiken-tan Vol. 2 - Kairoukan Satsujin Jiken','2021-04-08','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The \"Kailoukan\", a strange building surrounded by the sea on all sides. Inside a mansion closed underwater, the curtain rises on a tragedy.\n\nHello, everyone.\nMy name is Ikurumi, a game scenario writer.\n\nDo you know the previous work \"Masked Fantasy Murder Case\"?\nThis time, I would like to introduce an incident that happened in a strange building called \"Kairokan\" six months after that incident.\n\nIt is said that it was built by the former chairman of a famous architectural company as a stranger. This story begins from the place where we are invited to the inauguration event of the mansion.\n\n7 invited guests who visited. The owner of the mansion who will not appear forever. And...\n\nA tragedy that happens in a mansion closed in the sea.\nWho is the culprit? What\'s the motive? And what is the secret hidden in this building? The truth is, in the dark sea...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68jv.jpg'),(4180,'Noël: La Niege','1998-02-26','Simulator','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Noël: La Niege is the second game in the Noël series.\n\nIn the game you have to communicate with the three girls you met and get acquainted with them by talking to them with video phone and create a future for you and them.\n\nThe game features Japanese voice acting and lots of full motion video sequences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ylj.jpg'),(4181,'Dragon Star Varnir: DLC Bundle',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tbq.jpg'),(4182,'Argonus and the Gods of Stone','2019-10-08','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The creators of Shadowgate present Argonus and the Gods of Stone, an epic first-person adventure set in ancient Greece. Stranded on an uncharted isle, you must use your wits to unlock legendary mysteries, barter with gods and overcome an evil that threatens to bring the world to ruin...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25g4.jpg'),(4183,'Random Quest','2009-05-31','Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Random Quest is a slightly experimental mod with an unusual story. It is not set inside the Half Life universe and there are some game mechanics which have been subtley altered. The pace starts out slow, and builds up gradually.\n\nThis mod is intended to be more of an adventure rather than a shooter. If you approach this mod as a pure shooter, then you will probably not enjoy it.\n\nThere are some intense action scenes, but most of these come later on, much of the earlier parts of the mod are focused on adventure and storytelling.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91mr.jpg'),(4184,'Soul King','2023-11-15','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Reach out and connect. Fight through tight retro FPS levels to free dreamers from captivity. Build your army of free people until you\'re powerful enough to take on the Soul King itself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5m61.jpg'),(4185,'Lonely',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','《Lonely》 is a puzzle-platformer game, which contains 20 game levels. Players in the game have the ability to control time reversal. Players in the game should go back to the past, cooperate with themselves, and shuttle through parallel worlds in the game, so as to cross the platform, across the abyss and solve the puzzle switch to move...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46my.jpg'),(4186,'Shizumeru Rakuen','2024-01-21','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Follow the girls\' \"last day\" and unravel the truth','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7icn.jpg'),(4187,'R-Type Final 2: Digital Deluxe Edition','2021-04-30','Shooter, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Digital Deluxe Edition contains the full game, soundtrack, art book, and the R-Type Final 2 Stage Pass, which includes DLC Set 1, 2, and 3. Altogether they consist of a variety of new stages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kaf.jpg'),(4188,'Haunted Obachestra Vol. 2 Bianke','2022-02-11','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Haunted Obachestra Vol. 2 Bianke follows Erlucia, Treis, Dhyos, & Henas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o9z.jpg'),(4189,'Kryh Explorer',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore the world of the crystal-mining creatures, the Kryh, Meet other alien races, improve your equipments and customize your burrow. Great adventures are waiting in Kryh Explorer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82n3.jpg'),(4190,'Qwirks','1995-03-31','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Qwirks is an English adaptation of Puyo Puyo (1992) for home computers licensed from Compile. Unlike Dr. Robotnik\'s Mean Bean Machine, and Kirby\'s Avalanche it does not involve the use of a particular license, instead featuring entirely original characters. The game was introduced by Alexey Pajitnov, the creator of Tetris.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ihs.jpg'),(4191,'Betrayal at Krondor Pack',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','This Betrayal pack includes two games: Betrayal at Krondor and Betrayal in Antara.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dxi.jpg'),(4192,'Saint Hazel\'s Horsepital','2019-05-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your best Buddy has been kidnapped by a mysterious hospital director, and you are going to save him! The only problem is... you are a horse. Sneak your way through a bizarre hospital while wrecking havoc, ruining doctors\' days, and tripping balls in Vietnam!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1st1.jpg'),(4193,'Commando Sniper Counter Strike',NULL,'Fighting, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Become a commando sniper in counter strike mission game as a frontline hero. This counter terror as commando mission game 2017 take you to the front of the modern war to face the enemy crazy sniper and assault soldiers. This is a great FPS terror battle game. In counter strike games with mission! Show no mercy on any enemies standing in front of you! Unlock all the terrorism shoot weapons, and win the final terror attack victory of this war game. The FPS criminal shoot game with plenty of weapons in the terrorist war with counter terrorist strategy game. You have to kill the crazy enemy with your terrorism shoot gun as a sniper commando assassin. Play as the elite sniper with your MP4 commando assassin gun in Commando Sniper Counter Strike. \n \nDagger battle game with counter terrorism is all about commando games 3d 2017. You are playing as the last commando of the city and you have advanced weapons to tear up the enemy\'s commando. You have to attack frequently in this terror war with non-stop to killing of the enemy. Be vigilant in this sniper shoot and commando assassin game. Super FPS (first person shooting) action game for the lovers of commando games 3d 2017 as a commando city sniper. Ultimate counter terrorism shooting and dynamic sniper combat action in counter strike mission game. Complete all professional sniper missions to unlock all commando weapons in sniper assassin 2017. \n \nAs a commando shooter, play with courage by facing countless enemies. You have to destroy the enemy and finish the terrorists killing missions. Frontline war has just begun and you have to clear the area and safe the all hostages. Battle your way into the heart of enemy’s territory. Utilize special war gear on the battlefield with counter strike games 2017. \n \nFeatures of Commando Sniper Counter Strike: \n \n✓ Multiple weapons to strike like AK47, M9, shot gun and rifle. \n✓ Brave assassin commando complete mission and target. \n✓ Best shooting game with real front line fighting. \n✓ Upgrade your gun from a wide range of assault weapons. \n✓ High quality 3D graphic with thrilling sounds in commando sniper adventure. \n✓ 15 extreme terrorist shooting killer and classic dagger battle missions. \n \nGet ready for the aim is to shoot and eliminate kidnappers & terrorist border shooting showdown. You have to take a risk of fighting missions, take up your sniping position, aim down the sniper scope, and fire as commando shooter. Download now Commando Sniper Counter Strike and enter into the world of counter strike games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yhyxbfl6krr9m86wht7t.jpg'),(4194,'Project Eden','2001-10-22','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Due to severe overpopulation, the planet Earth’s diameter is increasing with the growth of towering mega-cities, each inhabited by millions of humans. Buildings are growing ever-upwards, interconnected with a thick web of roads, walkways and service channels. In these giant human hives, only the affluent may feel the rays of the sun and breathe the cleaner air. Your team has been selected to go down and investigate problems at the Real Meat factory, in which all of the equipment has started to simultaneously malfunction. Technicians sent to repair the machinery have gone missing without explanation. The UPA\'s (Urban Protection Agency) orders are clear: prepare for the descent.\n\nProject Eden is a 3D shooter with an emphasis on puzzle-solving. You\'ll lead a squad consisting of four UPA agents: Carter Dorlan, Andre Herderman, Minoko Molensky, and Amber Torrelson. Each operative has his or her own special ability that you\'ll need to master in order to progress. As Carter, use your knack for interrogation and nimble fingers to gain information and unlock doors. When you need something fixed and in a hurry, Andre is your man. Computer terminals are no match for Minoko\'s hacking talents. Last but not least, Amber can traverse hazardous environments with nary a scratch and she\'ll be your weapons expert. Brave the lowest strata and prepare to go through hell in Project Eden! If you\'re looking for some gritty cyberpunk-ish storytelling, challenging puzzles, and original gameplay (with optional drop-in, drop-out co-op), this is your game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1q73.jpg'),(4195,'Joana\'s Life','2016-09-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a peaceful part of the town, a series of deaths occur, seemingly random at first, but gruesome in their nature. One day, you find an object that doesn\'t belong in your house. An old, worn-out, stained mirror. You\'ll come to discover that the simple mirror isn\'t the only thing that is out of place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hiq.jpg'),(4196,'Hoesa Kiugi','2020-08-10','Simulator, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a company management simulation game that anyone can easily play.\n\nIn this game, you can decide the name of the company and raise the company.\nAlso, you can hire a company employee.\n\nRaise your company and make it the best company. Good luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52ja.jpg'),(4197,'Bladenet','2017-09-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Multilpayer game of Hide & Seek. Blend in with the AI crowd simulation to stay hidden as you watch for rival \'data collectors\' who are also hiding. Find and fight the human controlled avatars to collect thier data and escape the bladenet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co270u.jpg'),(4198,'Darkness Ahead','2016-11-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Darkness Ahead is an adventure game with some horror materials. The main goal in the game is finding your little brother in a plateau left in the building process years ago. You follow your brother\'s traces around the place with the help of tools you find on your adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o4p.jpg'),(4199,'Tanuki Justice','2021-02-27','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Tanuki Justice is a continuous intensive action run\'n gun in which you incarnate a tanuki brother and sister. You\'ll face hundreds of enemies in feudal Japan. Varied environments with landscapes of all kinds, retro and fast rhythmic music, numerous and difficult situations reminiscent of good old arcade games. A gameplay both simple and rich allowing spectacular actions. Possibility to play with 2 people for even more fun. And challenges that will challenge even the most skilled players. Time will be your worst enemy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nx2.jpg'),(4200,'Final Lap 2000','2000-03-23','Racing','WonderSwan','Final Lap 2000 is the first hand-held incarnation of Namco\'s Final Lap racing games. That \"Final Lap\", which is a perfect fusion of the fun of a racing game and the online competition, will appear in WonderSwan with various new elements. With the communication battle function that can be performed in real time, the beautiful race screen, the power change depending on the position, etc., it is a work that makes you think that \"Final Lap\" is well reproduced on a handheld game machine.\nAlso, in addition to the original new modes of WonderSwan version such as world tour mode and time trial mode, it is also equipped with a course edit function that allows you to freely create courses, and you can also send your own course to your friend\'s WonderSwan and play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4agm.jpg'),(4201,'Court of Ashes','2019-10-10','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gather your wits and enter the council chamber. The king has fallen, but the five of you remain in the fight. You can mourn the loss of his majesty later; your own survival still depends on how you respond to this war. Undoubtedly, figuring out how to respond will be easier than convincing the others to listen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nlb.jpg'),(4202,'Left in the Dark: No One on Board','2014-09-04','Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Left in the Dark: No One on Board is a hidden-object puzzle-adventure game with a grim, mysterious ambiance and plenty of scares! Private Detective knew this case was going to be strange as soon as she read the letter from the Mayor of Port Providence, in which he asked her to board a ship that went lost at sea years ago, then recently reappeared with no sign of the crew or cargo.\n\nDetective is at a loss as to what happened to the vessel, even after examining all of the evidence. She knows there is more to this case than the Mayor is letting on. The press is abuzz with talk of a curse. And, after encountering a hooded figure with a hook on his hand, on a supposedly abandoned ship, she begins to believe it.\nDetective is a rational woman, not prone to believing in ghost stories or fables. But this case is unlike anything she has ever seen. What connects the ship’s disappearance with Devil’s Island, and a local family’s unsolved murder? Will she find the allies she needs to break the Traveler’s Curse?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21ok.jpg'),(4203,'Bricasso','2010-11-30','Sin género','iOS','\"How good would it be if you could play with Lego wherever you are, without having to carry around the little bricks? That dream is now a reality thanks to the new iPhone app Bricasso.\" - Gizmodo, December 2010\n\n\"I had strong doubts about how well this could actually work, but I couldn\'t have been more wrong. The interface and controls are simply flawless. If the idea of having the chance to play with lego-like building blocks on your iDevice holds any appeal at all, don\'t hesitate for a second to pick this up.\" - Gabrien, TouchArcade\n\nFeaturing a beautifully intuitive interface that really captures the feel of building with toy bricks, you\'ll be letting your imagination run wild in seconds. There\'s no complicated controls or cameras to get the hang of, just a simple drag and drop interface that perfectly recreates the feeling of building the real thing.\n\nIf you like the sound of a portable box of bricks that you can build with anywhere, anytime, then what are you waiting for - get Bricasso!\n\nFeatures:\nOne of the most intuitive interfaces ever seen for building with virtual bricks.\nNine colourful background scenes to inspire you.\nDozens of authentic colours to choose from.\nDozens of brick types to play with; bricks, plates, wheels, cylinders, slopes and tiles are all here!\nIn game tutorial explaining everything you need to know about Bricasso in a few simple lines.\nShare your creations with others using the easy-to-use screenshot option.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/iudl8ul6wz6cwmgfijrw.jpg'),(4204,'Hades 2','2001-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hades 2 is a first-person shooter developed by Espaço Informática, a Brazilian company. Espaço Informática placed Hades 2 in the public domain and offered a Freeware download of the game on 20 September 2009 to celebrate the project\'s 10th anniversary. On the game\'s opening screen, users can select to play the game in English or Portuguese. The distribution package includes a Portuguese-language manual in Firefox Document format.\n\nHades 2 was Espaço Informática\'s biggest hit, selling over 50,000 copies in Brazil with additional distribution in Europe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29k9.jpg'),(4205,'Sports Bar VR','2016-06-01','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PlayStation VR, SteamVR','Bringing the virtual pub experience to your living room. Sports Bar VR is the ultimate social experience available on PlayStationVR, featuring an awesome set of bar games, an incredible pool simulation and an amazingly detailed sports bar overflowing with fun and silly physics props. Join up with 6 of your friends to hangout and play some air hockey, throw a few rounds of darts or build an insane dominoes setup using books, chairs, bottles and whatever else you can find. Play with friends or offline against the AI, earn experience points and unlock a wide array of collectable hats and fun objects to add a bit of swagger to your VR style.\n\nWhether you\'re a budding Skreeball champion, or its a serious game of pool your after or just want take part in the time-honoured pastime of throwing empty beer bottles against the wall there is no wrong way to hangout in Sports Bar VR.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8eem.jpg'),(4206,'Pinball FX: Marvel Pinball Original Pack','2023-04-13','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This four table pack features some of the most iconic Super Heroes in the Marvel Universe: Spider-Man, Wolverine, Blade and Iron Man. Use your pinball wizardry to save the universe from notorious Super Villains! Marvel Pinball is the ultimate Super Hero pinball experience!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4207,'Ties: Soul Link',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','TIES is an Emotional and Brutal 2D Metroidvania, combining Action RPG elements with Adventure Platformer.An exciting story of resilience and overcoming fears. Explore incredible cities in a world in decline, set in the year 2097, full of secrets and with brutal and bloody gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dix.jpg'),(4208,'Barbie and Her Magical House','1994-12-31','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Barbie and her Magical House is an educational computer game based on Mattel\'s Barbie toy line. The player is invited to visit Barbie\'s mansion as he/she uncovers over 300 animated surprises and 7 games and activities. Each room can be accessed by clicking on a doorway, or even easier, by using the map. The player can click on any of the furniture to see them change colours and styles. Activities can also be accessed in each room, e.g. the jigsaw puzzle on the refrigerator of the kitchen area. Barbie and her Magical House includes full voice acting of Barbie and Ken, and can be enjoyed at any age, including adults. (Description from MobyGames)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6t66.jpg'),(4209,'Warlords Battlecry: The Protectors of Etheria','2023-12-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A terrible threat long foretold rises to finish a war waged in prehistory, throwing Etheria into chaos. Will you save or lose your kindred? In this successor-in-the-making to the RPG/RTS Warlords Battlecry, interact with the world and discover myriad new tactics to dominate the battlefield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xub.jpg'),(4210,'Godzilla Kaiju Wars VR','2024-05-14','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','This unattended VR motion attraction features five action packed levels of cinematic VR at a level of intensity and realism never seen before … anywhere. Godzilla Kaiju Wars VR is designed from the ground up to provide the most compelling experience while providing Raw Thrills’ trademark reliability and longevity. This highly interactive VR game boasts the Thrill-D NXT motion platform, patented force-feedback blasters, wind and vibration effects, 6 channel Earthshaker audio, and featuring the massive 2X65″ GigaScreen video displays – to suck in a never ending stream of players!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8geh.jpg'),(4211,'Bill & Ted\'s Excellent Adventure','1991-12-31','Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, DOS, Amiga, Nintendo Entertainment System','Bill & Ted\'s Excellent Adventure is a single player graphic adventure video game for the Commodore 64, Amiga and MS-DOS platforms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nt6.jpg'),(4212,'Unpogable','2023-04-20','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Unpogable is a 2D platformer all about precise platforming!\n\nYou\'ll not only use one pogo stick to navigate through each level, but two! It\'s not as easy as it sounds. Unpogable will challenge all your platforming and pogo skills.\nThe huge campaign level will teach you all the necessary skills you need to succeed! It starts easy and gets more difficult the further you get, just like life. Falling can mean a huge loss of progress, so be careful!\n\nOnce you\'re ready, you can try completing the daily challenge levels! It\'s a new level every day, randomly generated and the same for every player! Or, use your own seeds to generate levels. The perfect feature to challenge your friends to a race!\nYou can see your stats at the end of each level. Copy your stats with the press of a button and share them on Twitter or other Social Media platforms to flex with your super awesome Unpogable skills.\n\nWant to customize the look of your game? You can customize the color of every single object. Player, environment, one-way-platforms, slipper; almost everything. You\'ll unlock new colors by collecting Qubs in the daily challenge levels.\n\nYou play as a \"Quboid\". The Quboids are caught in an endless cycle of climbing to reach the Star to ascend to Elysium. Not many Quboids can make it to Elysium. But maybe you can?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c4p.jpg'),(4213,'Gas Station Simulator: Party Time','2022-09-22','Simulator, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The party is about to start with new content in this free DLC. Collectables, popularity boosts and ice cream to get everyone excited!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6att.jpg'),(4214,'NBA 2KVR Experience','2016-11-21','Sport','PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the NBA 2KVR Experience, players will join NBA 2K17 cover athlete and All-Star Paul George, as they step onto the court at the Indiana Pacers’ stadium, Bankers Life Fieldhouse. Paul George will also provide commentary and guide the player by offering tips to help improve their skills in mini-games and features including three-point shootout, a speed and accuracy skills challenge, the buzzer beater countdown. Players who can earn a variety of Gatorade boosts that will aide their shooting acumen, speed, recovery and more to help reach the top of the leaderboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q0p.jpg'),(4215,'Lightbringer','1994-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Arcade','Light Bringer (ライトブリンガー) , also known as Dungeon Magic, is a 1994 arcade game by Taito Corporation Japan and is also included in Taito Legends 2. Unlike most medieval/fantasy beat \'em ups, it featured an isometric viewing angle, some platforming (usually involving players stacking rocks or crates to climb on and jump to treasure chests), unusually large stylised sprites, and variable blood/gore settings.\n\nUnusually, there are two European versions of the game: one uses the title Light Bringer, and the other uses the title Dungeon Magic. While this game uses the same title as Taito\'s earlier NES game Dungeon Magic: Sword of the Elements, the two games are unrelated aside from their titles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65ai.jpg'),(4216,'World of Warcraft: Shadowlands - Collector\'s Edition','2020-11-23','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','BRAVE THE BEYOND - What lies beyond the world you know? The Shadowlands, resting place for every mortal soul—virtuous or vile—that has ever lived. Be ready to discover what awaits in this world between worlds.\n\nEXPLORE AZEROTH’S AFTERLIFE - The Shadowlands are home to an entire universe of the departed. Journey through hidden realms of wonders and. horrors that await any who pass to the other side.\n\nCHOOSE YOUR COVENANT - Align yourself with one of the Shadowlands’ four Covenants—otherworldly shepherds of the dead, each with their ambitions, motives, and incredible powers to claim as your own.\n\nSTORM THE ETERNAL PRISON - Test your limits as you ascend Torghast, Tower of the Damned, a highly replayable ever-changing dungeon in the dark heart of the Maw, where the vilest souls are locked away forever.\n\nSHADOWLANDS EPIC EDITION COLLECTOR’S SET\nThe Shadowlands await beyond a shattered sky. This Epic Edition Collector’s Set features a trove of rare and wondrous items to aid you on your journey into the beyond.\n\nWORLD OF WARCRAFT: SHADOWLANDS EPIC EDITION GAME KEY - Use this digital key to unlock the Epic Edition of Shadowlands.\n\nEPIC EDITION IN-GAME CONTENT - Includes a deep trove of Shadowlands-themed extras:\n- A Shadowlands-Level Character Boost* - Instantly boost a single character to be ready for Shadowlands-level content. This boost cannot be transferred between World of Warcraft accounts.\n\n- Anima Wyrmling Pet - Explore the afterlife alongside your new companion.\n\n- Ensorcelled Everwyrm Mount - Take flight to your next adventure on a supernatural being of pure anima.\n\n- Vestments of the Eternal Traveler - Use your Everwyrm to begin a quest for the Vestments of the Eternal Traveler, an all-new transmog set.\n\n- Eternal Traveler’s Effect for Your Hearthstone - Return to your Hearthstone bind location with a reality-bending cosmetic effect.\n\n- Illusion: Wraithchill – Weapon Enchant - Unlock a chilling new cosmetic effect for your weapon. As with other Illusions, Wraithchill can be applied only to certain weapon types.\n\n- 30 Days of Game Time - Extend your stay in Azeroth (and beyond!) with 30 days of game time.\n\n- ART OF THE SHADOWLANDS - Explore the visual development of Azeroth’s multifaceted afterlife, an aspect of the Warcraft universe that has been little explored—until now.\n\n- COLLECTOR’S EDITION DIGITAL SOUNDTRACK KEY - Download the stirring orchestral pieces from the Shadowlands soundtrack, the perfect mood music to explore the realms beyond the veil.\n\n- COVENANT SIGILS – FOUR-PIN COLLECTOR’S SET - Add the symbols of all four Covenants to your pin collection and adorn your backpack, lanyard, or clothing with the sign of your chosen path.\n\n- SHATTERED SKY MOUSEPAD - Witness the moment Sylvanas shattered the veil between this life and what lies beyond, changing Azeroth’s fate forever.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l95.jpg'),(4217,'Goosebumps: Dead of Night','2020-09-14','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Slappy the Dummy has unleashed a nightmare of Goosebumps monsters, and they’re all out to get you! Escape from frightening creatures like the Graveyard Ghoul, Lawn Gnomes, Annihilator 3000, Murder the Clown, and the Werewolf of Fever Swamp as you collect the scattered pages of Slappy\'s book to seal him away. You’ll explore infamous Goosebumps locales for clues, hide from monsters, and solve Slappy’s devious puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28jh.jpg'),(4218,'LEGO Dimensions: B.A. Baracus (The A-Team) Fun Pack','2016-09-27','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Wii U, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Smash your way through the Lego Dimensions Multiverse with the classic action hero, B.A. Baracus. Add the A-Team’s mohawk-sporting mechanical genius to the mash-up adventure with your favorite characters! Build and place him on the Lego Toy Pad to send him into the game with his Super Strength and Fix-It abilities, or activate his special A-Team Master Build and Laser Redirect skills for those harder-to-solve puzzles. Unlock the Adventure World and Battle Arena and use B.A.’s Van to quickly get him where he’s needed most, then rebuild it into the Fool Smasher and, if B.A. can overcome his fear of flying, rebuild the vehicle again into The Pain Plane for upgraded powers in the game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w4l.jpg'),(4219,'My Little Farmies','2018-02-27','Simulator','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Show your artistic side! Create your own medieval settlement in the My Little Farmies tycoon. Build artisan workshops and production sites. Trade with fruit, vegetables and cereals. Download My Little Farmies now!\n\nManage a medieval settlement and help the villagers prosper in this free online farming game. Grow your crops, breed animals, develop trades and discover new quests and activities as you progress. Will you prove an apt master in this free online simulation game? Check it up now and play with friends to cooperate. This top sim game offers rich gameplay with plenty of ways to evolve. Build up windmills and smiths to develop production and trade your foods and goods. With a vast virtual map you can explore medieval world in its variety in one of the best farm games free online in your browser.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pje.jpg'),(4220,'New Tales from the Borderlands','2022-10-21','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Decide the fates of altruistic scientist Anu, her ambitious, \"streetwise\" brother Octavio, and the fierce, frogurt-slinging Fran. Claw and con your way through five thrilling chapters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co548j.jpg'),(4221,'One of a Kind','2009-10-29','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95ei.jpg'),(4222,'Ashina: The Red Witch','2023-08-25','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Get ready for adventure not like any other! This story is about Ash. An ordinary girl who takes an unexpected journey through the mysterious spirit world filled with strange creatures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gyu.jpg'),(4223,'Arcade Archives: Burger Time','2020-07-30','Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Burger Time is an action game released by Data East in 1982. The goal is to make burgers by stepping on the giant ingredients to drop them onto the plates below. Defeat the enemy pickles and wieners by trapping them between the burger ingredients!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4icw.jpg'),(4224,'Masagoro','2021-03-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','\"MASAGORO\" is a horror type of exploring game for single player, written in the first-person. The game focuses on the exploration of an abandoned Ryokan (Japanese-style hotel) called \"Masagoro\", and the past of Masagoro is revealed by finding various clues in the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3npm.jpg'),(4225,'What\'s the Dog Doing?',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','The dog\'s been acting strange lately...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95em.jpg'),(4226,'Savannah Park','2021-10-14','Simulator, Indie','Android, iOS','In the heart of Africa lies a paradise of incomparable beauty. These endless expanses are home to the continent’s largest land animals and present the visitor with breathtaking views. You are rangers, each running your own wildlife park in this beautiful part of the world. Help your animals to gather with others of their kind in the largest herds possible by moving them to new spaces. Secure precious watering holes that increase your park’s value and protect against bush fires. The more shady trees and lush grass in your park the better, too. Once all animals have been moved, the game ends with a scoring round. The ranger with the most points wins.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4227,'Hana Awase: Mizuchi','2012-12-05','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Volume 1 of Hana Awase.\n\nA maiden\'s prayer shall make the flower bloom.\n\nThere is a card game called \"Kasen\", which is played with cards known as \"Hanafuda\". Only a handful of people, known as \"Kaei\", can call on and draw the power of the \"flower\". With most Kaei are men, the five students who possess the most power within the academy are referred to as the \"Gokou\" and are revered.\n\nThis is a story about a maiden who has dedicated herself to five male students aiming to become one of the Gokou, set in Kasen National Academy, which is a school that produces many individuals with rare talents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6k3f.jpg'),(4228,'Locomotion','1992-12-31','Puzzle, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','Locomotion is an arcade-puzzle game in which you are presented with a top-down view of a railway network with a number of stations and junctions. Trains are released from stations at random intervals, each with a destination station. Your job is to get a set number of them to this destination within a time limit.\n\nYou control a cursor which can click on each of the junctions, toggling their positions. When trains reach a junction which is not set in a direction they can move through, they will stop until you move it. When they reach the wrong station they simply reverse and continue. If two trains make contact, they are lost, and a penalty is accrued.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s1c.jpg'),(4229,'Company of Heroes: Opposing Fronts','2007-09-28','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The next chapter in the #1 rated RTS franchise thrusts players into a hellish war torn landscape to command two battle-hardened armies in relentless campaigns for honor and country. Players lead the tenacious British 2nd Army during the heroic World War II liberation of Caen, France, and command the German Panzer Elite as they struggle to repel the largest airborne invasion in history.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qus.jpg'),(4230,'Dead Purge: Outbreak','2017-07-13','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dead Purge: Outbreak is a modern first-person shooter set in an unforgiving post-apocalyptic world where every minute can be your last.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24vk.jpg'),(4231,'Robin Morningwood Adventure: A Gay RPG','2020-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Robin Morningwood Adventure is a gay (bara) RPG video game where you play an adventurer, discovering Whellcum, a gay village.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yls.jpg'),(4232,'Always',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After losing his daughter, a broken detective clings to the sound of her voice — until an accident pulls him into a twisted nightmare. Trapped in haunting echoes of her past, he must solve puzzles and uncover chilling clues to stop a deranged man from sacrificing his child... to bring back his own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s8r.jpg'),(4233,'Marvel Super Heroes in War of the Gems','1996-11-18','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','The most powerful collection of Marvel Super Heroes now unite to battle treacherous mobs of Super-Villians! A mysterious foe has kicked off his plan to rule the world by collecting the Infinity Gems. While each gem controls one force of nature, combined they command limitless power.\nThe fate of the entire world depends on your ability to defeat this sinister scheme before the gems are combined. Master the brute strength of your favorite hero to take on this life and death challenge. You choose the hero best suited to each mission and control all the action, like breaking barriers with the Incredible Hulk or tackling challenges with Spider-Man\'s webs and climbing ability.\nIt\'s an incredible action-adventure demanding skill, cunning and reflexes to defeat a diabolical plot and the most amazing assortment of corrupt Super-Villains ever assembled.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b7l.jpg'),(4234,'Honkai Impact 3rd: Part 1 - The Moon\'s Origin and Finality','2016-10-14','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','The Moon\'s Origin and Finality is part 1 of HoYoverse\'s Honkai Impact 3rd. It tells the stories of Kiana Kaslana, Raiden Mei, Bronya Zaychik, students at St. Freya High and normal Schicksal Valkyries, who through numerous trials, and with the help of their loved ones, protected the world from both the threat of the Honkai and those who sought to purge it no matter the cost.\n\nThe Moon\'s Origin and Finality spans 35 Main Story Chapters along with several bonus EX Chapters and the Elysian Realm Gamemode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8b8i.jpg'),(4235,'Error','2021-08-19','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A corrupted version of Portal that I\'ve somehow managed to get...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co727i.jpg'),(4236,'The Fishing Club 3D','2017-03-23','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Go fishing and relax! Bait your hooks and catch over 50 different fish species from the smallest roach to the mighty sharks, in beautiful 3D locations all over the world. Create your own fishing club and go fishing with friends, take part in exciting competitions, and weekly club tournaments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27hu.jpg'),(4237,'Sega Rally Championship','2004-12-31','Racing, Sport','Arcade, N-Gage, PC (Microsoft Windows), Sega Saturn, PlayStation 2','Sega Rally Championship is a 1994 arcade racing game developed by AM5 on the Sega Model 2 board. The unique selling point of Sega Rally was the ability to drive on different surfaces (including asphalt, gravel and mud), with different friction properties, with the car\'s handling changing accordingly. As the first racing game to incorporate this feature, Sega Rally is considered to be one of the milestones in the evolution of the racing game genre.\n\nThe music for the arcade game was composed by Takenobu Mitsuyoshi, while the Sega Saturn port\'s soundtrack was done by Naofumi Hataya and the Guitar were played by Joe Satriani.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ael.jpg'),(4238,'Flyhight Cloudia IV - Eien no Kizuna','2012-06-18','Role-playing (RPG)','Android, Legacy Mobile Device','The Flyhight Cloudia series, which is popular as a full-fledged mobile RPG. The latest work \"Flyhight Cloudia 4\" is a scenario RPG that depicts the mystery of mysterious events that began to happen one after another in the empty world \"Cloudia\" and the bonds of the people involved in it.\n\nEvent scenes with beautiful graphics are included everywhere in the magnificent story. You will be drawn into that dramatic development involuntarily. In addition, there are some \"special skills\" that player characters learn that can only be obtained by generating events!\n\nA combat system that emphasizes the ease of playing with mobile phones. The combat system pursues the ease of play unique to mobile phones and adopts the multi-weight battle that has been inherited in the Fly Height Claudia series. With easy operation, you can enjoy highly strategic battles.\nIn addition, there is also a convenient \"AUTO\" mode without the hassle of command input, so you can quickly battle with lower-rated enemies!!\nGame screenGame screen. There are also a lot of rushing elements.\n\nThe collection of familiar hidden dungeons and air crests through the series is of course alive and well! In addition, new challenging elements such as \"Arena\", \"Battle Graph\" where you can fight past enemies, and mini events other than the main scenario will appear, and you can play for a long time after clearing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wyf.jpg'),(4239,'Princess Quest R','1999-10-05','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A port of Princess Quest for PC.\n\nThe game was illustrated by Sugiyama Genshō. It was based on a 1996 audio drama of the same name. The game was developed by AIC Spirits and Increment P Corp.\n\nThe story is set in the Dharma Kingdom, and involves the theft of a jewel. Clues must be sought after in dungeons, castles, and towns, until the true culprit is found.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6paj.jpg'),(4240,'World of Guns VR: Guns Full Access','2019-08-05','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','World of Guns VR: Guns Full Access unlocks all existing and future released gun models for World of Guns: VR Currently there are 190 +gun models in the game. Attention! Full Access does not unlock Bonus models!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4241,'Space War - Retro Shooter',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4242,'Hierofanía 2','2016-06-21','Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Queen Caramela was raised by a fierce, unhappy woman, and lived under the influence of a deity of modest powers. All she wants is to keep harmful things at a distance, to live for beauty and fun, for things to continue as they are. She won\'t get her wish.\n\nHierofanía 2 is a visual novel with seven endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co301q.jpg'),(4243,'Dead by Daylight: Survivor Expansion Pack','2021-06-15','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Will you be a leader? A hero? An escape artist? The Survivor Expansion Pack gives you access to 11 original characters to discover and explore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tn4.jpg'),(4244,'Rivers of Chaos','2024-05-10','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Conquer the galaxy in this cinematic, battle-simulator. Each playthrough offering a completely unique galaxy, over 100 total specialized ships to command, and distinct commanders to lead your people. Pick your favorite faction and lead your forces into a dynamically generated battlefield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8b87.jpg'),(4245,'Fire Emblem: Justice & Pride','2019-07-20','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','Game Boy Advance','The continent of Irona. Many years ago, the land was ruled by the forces of darkness. Monsters and dragons alike terrorized the small human populace in Irona. However, one day, a great sage appeared, commanding light and nature, and with the combined might of the sage and her allies, the monsters were sealed using the power of a mysterious tower known as the Spire of Darkness. Following the conflict, the warriors of legend went their own separate ways and founded their own lands, but they all swore fealty to the brother of the great sage, who was crowned Emperor of Irona.\n\n500 years have passed since the time of the Hero of Light. Irona’s Emperor Perseus, a descendant of the first emperor, Hawke, has been acting suspiciously. He and a mysterious mage named Caelia have been reawakening the monsters using the Spire of Darkness. In Norbury, a land on the western end of the continent founded by the master archer Quentin, Duke Robert dies of unknown causes. Tragedy would also strike the duchy of Abrein, a southwestern duchy founded by Bishop Leticia. The son of Duke Simon and descendant of Leticia, Prince Travis, is killed by a surprise ambush by powerful monsters on a scouting mission. This tragic chain of events throws the whole continent into turmoil, pitting the western duchies against the loyalist eastern lands.\n\n11 years after the Great Tragedy, Travis’s younger sister, Princess Aderyn, chooses to fight back. Together with her allies, she strives to save Abrein and to free the rest of the continent from the iron fist of Perseus’s reign.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54eg.jpg'),(4246,'Momotaro Collection 2','1996-12-06','Sin género','Game Boy','Two more classic Momotarou games on one cartridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hq6.jpg'),(4247,'Otokonoko Fishing','2024-07-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a boy and go fishing in a city with rivers all around you! Cross-dressing Fishing is an action game-like fishing simulation! Your ultimate goal is to find your missing brother in the distant sea. Equip yourself for this with \"Fishing and Cross-dressing\"!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93gb.jpg'),(4248,'Dragon King: The Fighting Game',NULL,'Fighting, Platform','Nintendo 64','Dragon King: The Fighting Game was an unfinished low budget 3D fighting game, and was the first in a planned series of fighting video games. The game was developed for the Nintendo 64, where it was to make unique use of the joystick on the controller. After deciding to use Nintendo characters to give it a more proper atmosphere on the Nintendo 64, the game later became Super Smash Bros.\n\nIn 2022, Masahiro Sakurai presented in his own YouTube Channel some footage of the game, with the official title localization of \"Dragon King: The Fighting Game\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7t1r.jpg'),(4249,'Sonic the Hedgehog 2','1992-10-16','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Sega Game Gear, Sega Master System/Mark III','This is a completely different game than its 16-bit counterpart on the Genesis/Mega Drive, and was originally released on the Sega Game Gear and Master System.\n\nThe Sonic the Hedgehog 2 game marks the debut of Miles ‘Tails’ Prower, Sonic’s best pal, who is then seen recurring in the series. Assist Sonic to rescue Tails, who has been kidnapped by Dr. Robotnik in this platform video game. In exchange of Tails’ safety in this Sega Game Gear video game, the evil scientist asks that the six Chaos Emeralds be given away to six robots, so he can dominate the entire globe. With advanced ability of Sonic to smash through walls and grab back scattered rings hit by enemy, this platform video game is made even more exciting. Join the protagonist in the Sonic the Hedgehog 2 game as he rides a mine cart, a hang glider or skims through water surface in his rescue attempt. With seven zones and three acts each, this Sega Game Gear video game is a rollercoaster ride where you get rewarded at the end of each act.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zus.jpg'),(4250,'Two Crude Dudes','1992-02-11','Fighting, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Arcade, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Two Crude Dudes is a 1991 beat \'em up arcade game produced by Data East. The game was later ported to the Sega Genesis in 1992. Outside Japan, the port was released under the name Two Crude Dudes. In Japan, the game was titled: Crude Buster.\n\nIn the game, players control one of two mercenaries hired by the U.S. government to stop the terrorist organization \"Big Valley\". Their objective is to retake control of a ruined New York City from Big Valley after a nuclear explosion the group caused.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wwk.jpg'),(4251,'A Rum Tale','2023-01-05','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this platform game you will embody a drunken pirate in search of a lost cargo of rum. But will you be able to face the challenges that will arise before you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ytz.jpg'),(4252,'Daylight','2014-04-29','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You awake, trapped in an abandoned hospital. Your only source of light is your phone. You hit a dead-end and must turn around, but behind you lurks an eerie presence and strange noises…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pv5.jpg'),(4253,'Mach Wing','2024-10-07','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a mythological world dominated by combat ships known as MachWing, Ignis, a brave pilot, will play a significant role. A JRPG-style story unfolds, where battles take on a \"Shoot em up\" style with RPG and strategy elements. Experience this unusual blend!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83ou.jpg'),(4254,'Boxing Gym Story','2022-11-17','Fighting, Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Introducing a sim with real punch! Are you the manager this down-on-its-luck boxing gym needs to get back on its feet? Get the town excited about boxing, and more people will start signing up. Stand by the ringside to cheer on your boxers. You never know how a match will go until the very end! And don\'t forget about marketing - fans are the lifeblood of competitive sports! Rack up more wins, and you\'ll be able to upgrade your facilities with spa baths, high-class cafeterias, and more. Before you know it, athletes will be lining up to join you! Hire trainers and hone your boxers\' skills until they\'re ready to take on the world! Make your gym unique by outfitting it with facilities of your choice, creating the perfect environment for fostering boxing talent. Don\'t give up until you get that championship belt! Enjoy all the thrills of an underdog boxing story in Kairosoft\'s latest management sim game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5748.jpg'),(4255,'Fledglings',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crash landed on an alien archipelago, you must raise native Fledglings to fight off waves of sea creatures at night. Collect Fledglings, scavenge for resources, and survive the nights with the help of your companions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x8t.jpg'),(4256,'Killing Floor: Horzine Outbreak','2020-09-03','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Horzine Outbreak is based on original Killing Floor mod (KFMod) v1.0 for Unreal Tournament 2004 by Alex Quick and tell a story about incident in Horzine Biotech, currently in progress and being made by the last version of Xash3D + XashXT.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95s2.jpg'),(4257,'Fallen London: The Garden Embassy','2019-06-01','Adventure','Web browser','An addon for Fallen London. The Exceptional Story for June, 2019. First entry in the Season of','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hyq.jpg'),(4258,'Hippy Skate','2023-10-30','Racing, Sport, Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','A new style of skateboarding game using a simple two button mechanic. Tap the left side of your screen to make your skater move. Hold the left side of your screen to make your skater stop. hold the right side of your screen to make your skater crouch. Release the right side of your screen to make your skater Ollie. Crouch on a downhill to give your skater a boost of speed. Release at the right time on an up hill to make your skater launch higher into the air.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7g4s.jpg'),(4259,'CityWarHeroes VR','2019-12-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In 2050, alien spaceships suddenly approach peaceful earth. The spacecraft lands in Incheon, South Korea, making the area a shambles. You\'ll have to fight against aliens as armed special forces, armed with armor and weapons packed with the most advanced technologies of the future. But what if the aliens are cute?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n72.jpg'),(4260,'Romance of the Three Kingdoms XIII: Scenario - Hebei Conflict & Event Set','2021-02-11','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','The balance of powers shifts in Cao Cao\'s favor after his victory at Guandu. Yuan Shao makes another unsuccessfully attempt against him， but soon succumbs to an illness. While Yuan Tan and Yuan Shang fight for the right of succession， Cao Cao seizes the opportunity to invade Ji.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4261,'WizMo\'s Workshop: Dragons of Frozzbokk','2002-09-30','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows)','WizMo\'s Workshop: Dragons of Frozzbokk is an educational game created for kids aged three to six. It is meant to stimulate the imagination of children and teaches color and shape recognition while developing hand-eye coordination. Children can explore the Workshop, help WizMo build different machines, collect prizes to show off to their friends, and learn while playing with WizMo\'s little dragons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30ce.jpg'),(4262,'Moon Runner','2022-10-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An atmospheric survival shooter set on a small moon. You are tasked with finding the monoliths across the lunar landscape and restarting the moon\'s infrastructure. Traverse the dangerous terrain and deal with enemy droids corrupted by an ominous presence below the surface...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yg4.jpg'),(4263,'Total Annihilation: Commander Pack','1998-11-13','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','What began as a conflict over the transfer of consciousness from flesh to machine has escalated into a war that has decimated a million worlds. The Core and the Arm have all but exhausted the resources of the entire galaxy in their struggle for domination. Choose your side, build an army, and crush your enemies on huge, three-dimensional battlefields. And remember, there is no such thing as \"too many guns\"!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hml.jpg'),(4264,'Ascendant Hearts','2018-01-18','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','A visual novel where you wake up in a strange new world before going on a real-life RPG adventure with three wacky party members.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m6j.jpg'),(4265,'Split Brain','2024-12-05','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Share the same body with a friend in Split Brain. One of you controls, the other one sees, but the decisions are made together! Face the illusion and uncover the truth to find your way out of Hexarture.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93p4.jpg'),(4266,'Chyrza','2014-10-18','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A first-person flash-fiction horror story. Explore a surreal desert while collecting fragments of a memoir.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xs4.jpg'),(4267,'Love Live! School Idol Festival: After School Activity','2016-12-06','Music, Arcade','Arcade','Love Live! School Idol Festival: After School Activity is an arcade version of Love Live! School Idol Festival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qln.jpg'),(4268,'Rift Rangers','2022-12-08','Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rift Rangers is a sentai themed casual rogue-lite where you defend against an endless horde of dimensional creatures. Construct and upgrade your defensive turrets while dodging enemies! Find the right combination of turrets and upgrades to become an impenetrable fortress!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yf0.jpg'),(4269,'Enchanted in the Moonlight: Miyabi, Kyoga & Samon - Luck in Love: The Key to Happiness','2020-01-30','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4270,'Gears of War 3: Limited Collector\'s Edition','2011-10-20','Shooter','Xbox 360','Gears of War 3 is a 2011 military science fiction third-person shooter video game developed by Epic Games and published by Microsoft Studios for the Xbox 360. Originally due for release on April 5, 2011, the game was delayed and eventually released on September 20, 2011.\n\nGears of War 3 made over one million pre-orders. It is the third installment of the Gears of War series. The story was written by science fiction author Karen Traviss.[4] A sequel titled Gears of War 4 was announced in June 2015 and will be released in 2016.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5eyn.jpg'),(4271,'Docking Ships','2023-06-20','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Prepare to embark on a charming and cozy puzzle adventure in Docking Ships a delightful game that combines the charm of pirate ships with the brain-teasing challenge of navigating through a grid tile system to successfully dock your vessels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jh7.jpg'),(4272,'Beach Club Simulator 2024','2024-08-16','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beach Club Simulator is a very comprehensive beach management game. Develop your beach from zero to hero. Increase your earnings, popularity and business acumen. Enjoy the sea, sand and sun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yxy.jpg'),(4273,'Sweet Volley High','2016-10-26','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sweet Volley High - A Yuri / Otome Visual Novel from NewWestGames\nSweet Volley High is the story of Aya Mizuki in her senior year at high school, and beyond, as she pursues a dream of becoming a professional volleyball player. Will she find romance and success, or rejection and heartbreak? Your choices will affect the outcome in one of 5 endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2da6.jpg'),(4274,'DK: King of Swing','2015-01-22','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy','Wii U, Game Boy Advance','The normally quiet jungle is abuzz with excitement, because it\'s time for the ceremony to choose the king of the jungle! Or at least it would be if King K. Rool hadn\'t stolen the special medallion meant for the winner. Donkey Kong and his friends must swing their way through the jungle to get the medallion back and, along the way, rescue Diddy, Dixie, and Funky Kong from King K. Rool\'s minions. A unique control system lets you swing through the trees and spin to build up momentum for a mighty leap. Innovative level design combines elements of platform and puzzle games: Grab gears and spin to crank doors open. Watch out for bolts that loosen as you spin, or you might find yourself falling flat. You\'ll need steady hands to make the leap-of-faith that takes you to the treetops.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wfx.jpg'),(4275,'Stick War: Castle Defence','2018-03-16','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Paying homage to an era of stickmen and flash games, whilst diving into modern day, rpg inspired combat and progression. Hone a unique play style to combat hordes of unmotivated stickmen, as they attempt to storm your castle.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4276,'All Men Are Pigs','2024-07-12','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A queer and raunchy adult comedy with a tropical flavor. As the main character, you get to move to a Caribbean island named Santa Locura, working the summer away in a bar named The Inqueersition.\n\nYour day to day routine gets derailed by the men you meet, all of them hiding a dealbreaker in their closet. What IS their deal? WHY is it so hard to find a proper man? Do you even NEED a man?\n\n...well, this is a dating sim, so we’ll go with “yes”.\n\nYou will get to interact with your friends, coworkers and possible love interests in a variety of ways. Will you manage to land the man of your dreams and love him despite the issues they might have, or will they chew you up and spit you like gum?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ckr.jpg'),(4277,'VAR: Exterminate','2021-05-16','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','VAR: Exterminate; Zombie rough-lite shooter that promises raw exhilarating horror with vast replay-ability. Designed exclusively for VR, immerse yourself in a post-apocalyptic city overrun by zombies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oiz.jpg'),(4278,'The Lord of the Rings Online Trading Card Game','2004-01-31','Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Based on the physical Lord of the Rings Trading Card Game, LOTROTCG was a digital version of that game played online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7iso.jpg'),(4279,'9th Dawn','2014-01-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','9th Dawn is an old school tile base fantasy role playing game. It harkens back to the days of Ultima 4 or 5, or similar tile based games of the mid to late 1980s. The game took quite a long time to finish so there is a lot to see and explore in 9th Dawn. 9th Dawn II is in the works and I for one look forward to that.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qcnf9m37i8h2rqahsahi.jpg'),(4280,'Fatal Frame: Maiden of Black Water','2015-10-30','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','Wii U','Fatal Frame: Maiden of Black Water is a survival horror video game developed by Koei Tecmo and published by Nintendo for the Wii U. The fifth main entry in the Fatal Frame series, it was released in Japan in September 2014 and worldwide in October 2015. As with previous games in the series, players navigate areas filled with hostile ghosts which must be fought by taking photographs using the Camera Obscura, which is directly controlled using the Wii U gamepad. A post-endgame story featuring Ayane, a character from the company\'s Dead or Alive series, is also available featuring altered gameplay mechanics. The story, which is set on the fictional Hikami Mountain, focuses on three protagonists who are drawn into supernatural events revolving the area, including an ancient ritual to seal away Yomi, a malevolent force corrupting the surrounding spirits that is tied to the fate of the titular shrine maiden Ouse Kurosawa.\n\nPlanning for the game began in 2011, during the projection of the Wii remake of Crimson Butterfly. The game was first proposed by series co-creator Keisuke Kikuchi when he saw the Wii U hardware and the possibilities of the gamepad becoming the Camera Obscura. The game was a joint production effort between Koei Tecmo and Nintendo Software Planning & Development, with Kikuchi and fellow co-creator Makoto Shibata returning as to their respective posts of producer and director, together with staff from the previous series entry Mask of the Lunar Eclipse and developers new to the series. The cast went through several revisions during development, while the staff experimented with the capacities of the new hardware. As with previous games, it features a theme song by Tsuki Amano. Upon release, the game received critical acclaim for its use of the gamepad and dark atmosphere, while opinions were mixed on its story, portrayal of its female characters, and other aspects such as its pacing and controls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zcv.jpg'),(4281,'Brave New World','2022-04-15','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s98.jpg');
INSERT INTO `games` VALUES (4282,'D+Vine[Luv]','2000-02-25','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Even at the cost of my life—there is someone I want to protect.\"\n\nIt is said that there once existed a civilization on this earth more advanced than the current one. This rich civilization was built using the power of \"magic\" granted by the spirits. However, this long-lasting civilization rapidly declined after the spirits disappeared and eventually perished.\n\nThere were those who were interested in this ancient world. The protagonist, Hyde, travels around the world seeking the legacy of the old world. During his journey, he happens to visit the town of Arville. There, he hears rumors that something resembling ancient ruins has been found in a nearby cave. Hyde heads to the cave and meets a girl who holds the key to the truth.\n\nThe game was developed over a period of more than two years. It features a wealth of content, including around 800 types of items and modes where the enemies\' strength is doubled or tripled, providing substantial replay value.\n\nUnlike the original PC (Windows) version released almost two years earlier, the Dreamcast port does not feature any adult content. A couple of years later, DVD PG Edition release came out which also includes adult content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8blf.jpg'),(4283,'Summer Memories: Deluxe Edition','2020-06-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It is the summer break again and you\'ve just graduated from university, so you decided to pay your aunt and cousins in the countryside a long-overdue visit. However, it has been years since you\'ve last seen them, so you don\'t know what to expect. What could go wrong? Find out in Summer Memories!\nFeatures\n\nA Slice of Life Game Experience\nA Variety of Mini-Games\nAnimated Character Sprites\nTime Management System\nAnd Multiple Maps to Explore!\n\nSummer Memories+ - Expansion DLC\n\nWere there not enough memories to be made in the original? Don\'t worry, we agree!\n\nFrom the developer, Dojin Otome, comes an expansion DLC for our hit game, Summer Memories!\n\nUnlock new memories with added scenes for all the characters.\n\nEnjoy some new interactions and voices, including with side characters.\n\nAnd more!\nFeatures:\nNew Scenes\nNew Interactions\nNew Endings\nAdded Voices for Side Characters','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c74.jpg'),(4284,'Knight\'s Maze','2020-06-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Four brave knights in search of treasures appeared in an ancient labyrinth. Get them out of there, but don\'t forget about the traps. Go around them, solve unpretentious puzzles on your way, upon completion of which you will be closer and closer to freedom!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44jz.jpg'),(4285,'Suspense: Madman\'s Dreams','2025-05-01','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This psychological adventure, focused on narrative, is based on a scientific representation of mental disorders. Are you ready to face the fears of people suffering from mental illnesses? Use your voice as the voice of the main character to get as close to them as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bo0.jpg'),(4286,'Invaders Inc. - Alien Plague','2016-01-27','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','Android, iOS','Alien Plague is afast-paced strategy simulation game where you take control of an alien invasion against planet Earth. Lead your invaders to victory and wipe out the human race.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hxx.jpg'),(4287,'Log(Hic!)',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4288,'Assassin\'s Creed: Director\'s Cut Edition','2008-04-10','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Assassin\'s Creed is a non-linear action-adventure video game, during which the player controls a 12th-century Levantine Assassin named Altaïr Ibn-La\'Ahad during the Third Crusade, whose life is experienced through the Animus by his 21st century descendant, Desmond Miles.\n\nThe Director\'s Cut Edition features four PC-exclusive memories, including the Rooftop Race Challenge, the Archer Stealth Assassination Challenge, Merchant Stand Destruction and Informant Escort Challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zj6.jpg'),(4289,'Encore Classic Card Games',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Shuffle the cards and deal yourself in to the greatest card game collection of all time. With over 150 game variations, Encore Classic Card Games is one of the largest & most comprehensive collection of card games available for your PC!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gsx.jpg'),(4290,'Dracula 4+5',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dr6.jpg'),(4291,'The House of Da Vinci Bundle',NULL,'Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bqw.jpg'),(4292,'Moto Rush GT: Ultra Edition','2025-02-15','Racing, Sport, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4293,'Detective: Rainy Night','2025-12-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Detective Rainy Night is a narrative adventure with elements of deduction. Violent crimes, mature stories, and a touch of psychological horror await you at the Motel Holiday. Grab a pencil and paper because solving this case won’t be easy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gpa.jpg'),(4294,'SteamBoat Willie, Endless Run',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co973d.jpg'),(4295,'Tank Battle','2006-12-31','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tank Battle is a shooting gallery game. The main player, a cannon, must adjust the level of the cannon to that of a tank which you have to destroy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hic.jpg'),(4296,'Cannon Bird 3',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Compilation of 3 bootleg Angry Birds games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95eu.jpg'),(4297,'Alien 8','1985-02-01','Platform, Puzzle','BBC Microcomputer System, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC, MSX','Alien 8 is an action-adventure video game developed and published by Ultimate Play The Game. It was released for the ZX Spectrum, BBC Micro, Amstrad CPC and MSX in 1985.[a] The game is a spiritual successor to the best-selling Knight Lore, which was lauded by critics for its isometric graphics. In the game, the player takes control of a robot, Alien 8, whose job is to ensure that all of the cryogenically frozen passengers on board a starship remain viable during the ship\'s voyage.\n\nThe game was written by Chris Stamper, and graphics were designed by Tim Stamper. Alien 8 uses the same image masking technique as Knight Lore, which allows the developers to create composite structures out of stacked images without visual overlay. The technique was copyrighted by Ultimate as the Filmation game engine. As with its spiritual predecessor, the game is rendered isometric projection.[2] The game was critically acclaimed upon release. Reviewers praised the game\'s graphics and innovation, however minor criticism was directed at its similarities to Knight Lore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/svtxitc4lriwxhligza5.jpg'),(4298,'Pool Fever: Prime Edition','2025-02-21','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4299,'Mario Party 64','2020-02-16','Platform','Nintendo 64','Mario Party 64 is a hack made by MrComit and released February 16, 2020. It contains 70 stars.\n\nIts levels are all heavily based off Mario Party for the Nintendo 64, recreating all 8 boards. The music is also styled after Mario Party, along with several stars obtainable in unique mini-game scenarios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v3g.jpg'),(4300,'DeepLands','2020-07-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have just bought a new house, and then your wife disappears. Strange things start to happen, and then!\nyou find your self in a dark and lonely place. Now you have to find a way home, and survive the DeepLands!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gsw.jpg'),(4301,'Pilot Light','2003-09-12','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An old-school style point\'n\'click adventure game done in the vein of the Sierra and LucasArts classics. On a simple cargo delivery assignment from Alpha Region to Charlie Region, bad luck and circumstances conspire to trip up our beloved hero. Battle astro-serpents, tackle nefarious hoodlums, and pay for gasoline in this pint-sized epic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j40.jpg'),(4302,'Maze','2022-10-03','Puzzle, Indie','Playdate','A Marble Maze Game for Playdate','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co828u.jpg'),(4303,'Seka II',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lead a fearless team of mice up to 8 players through challenging test chambers! Dodge traps, battle foes, break barriers, collect cheese, and uncover the secrets behind the experiments. Join the mission now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g74.jpg'),(4304,'Final Fantasy X-2: Last Mission','2004-02-09','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 2','Final Fantasy X-2: Last Mission is a playable sequel to Final Fantasy X-2, originally released exclusively in Japan as a bonus for Final Fantasy X-2: International + Last Mission for the PlayStation 2 on February 9, 2004. It is included in Final Fantasy X/X-2 HD Remaster, making it available for English speakers for the first time on March 18, 2014.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f7w.jpg'),(4305,'Sonic Arena: The Lost Chapters',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fc0.jpg'),(4306,'Foddia','2025-03-04','Platform, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Foddia is a 2D-Platformer inspired by Getting Over It. There are difficult challenges to overcome and mysteries to uncover at every turn. Swing on ropes, make long jumps across chasms, and climb your way to the top of the Foddian Mountain.\n\nYou came here for a reason.\nWas it to climb this mountain that won\'t stop towering over you?\nWas it to search for secrets in the depths unknown?\nWas it to become the fastest hiker the world has ever seen?\n\nThe only certainty is that if you leave now...\nYou may never know why you came in the first place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jrm.jpg'),(4307,'Gates vs. Jobs: The Game!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95ew.jpg'),(4308,'Goof Troop',NULL,'Sin género','DOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95ey.jpg'),(4309,'Hate Plus','2013-08-19','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Let\'s spend the next three real-time days together uncovering the mystery of what went horribly wrong on a derelict generation ship, with the help of a spunky/more-than-slightly-traumatized AI sidekick! A sequel to Analogue: A Hate Story that tells a whole new hate story of its own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co427l.jpg'),(4310,'ItsJustAStory','2023-07-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ItsJustAStory is a solo post-apocalyptic game, it\'s a story about a doctor and a build-up to the production of the actual game. your goal is to stay alive and find the cure, you play through a series of events with tasks simple to complete. the main focus here is to get the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sji.jpg'),(4311,'Little Nightmares II: Deluxe Edition','2021-02-11','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d1f.jpg'),(4312,'Remedium: Sentinels','2023-07-18','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Remedium: Sentinels is an auto-shooter with rogue-lite elements set in a grim post-apocalyptic world, where The Grey Plague turned most humans into vicious mutant freaks. Play as a a steel Sentinel and defend the cities against the endless hordes of mutants until your reactor dies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68kw.jpg'),(4313,'Angry Birds: Dangerous Railroad',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95f0.jpg'),(4314,'The Book of Unwritten Tales: The Critter Chronicles','2012-12-05','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Critter Chronicles tell the story of how adventurer Nate Bonnett and Critter, his hairy sidekick, first met, all set before their appearance in Wilbur\'s and Ivo\'s adventure in The Book of Unwritten Tales. Enjoy a thrilling and hilarious point-and-click adventure in the fantasy world of Aventasia. Travel from the Northlands to the Mage\'s Tower of Seastone and experience a story that offers tremendous fun for seasoned players of \"The Book of Unwritten Tales\" and newcomers alike.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qlp.jpg'),(4315,'Adidas Power Soccer','1996-10-01','Sport','PlayStation','Adidas Power Soccer kicks its way onto the PlayStation. You are given a wide variety of gameplay options to choose from, such as season and tournament modes, single games, and multiplayer.\n\nWhen going through the season mode, you can play either a shortened season or an official full-length season. Your team, as well as your opponents, are taken from all over Europe and other countries. If you\'re interested in reaching supreme glory at a quicker pace, there is an option for cup battle. Like it implies, you\'ll have to beat a certain number of teams in tournament fashion to claim your prize.\n\nThe game can be played two different ways, arcade or simulation. By choosing the arcade mode, you won\'t have to worry about soccer physics or penalties whereas the simulation goes by actual soccer rules. If you lay into someone\'s shin, you\'ll probably get called for a penalty. Depending on the severity of the penalty, the game will switch to a penalty shot mode, just like real soccer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uki.jpg'),(4316,'Neo Neo','2018-06-16','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Use a devastating and deadly warp ability to feed an ever-watchful Temple with souls and unlock true power! Neo Neo is a super fast paced arcade shooter set in a vibrant and colourful world where only death is a certainty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q25.jpg'),(4317,'Puyo Puyo','1994-07-31','Puzzle','Game Boy','The Game Boy port of Puyo Puyo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6klm.jpg'),(4318,'Gomola Speed',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4319,'Mount Your Friends 3D: A Hard Man is Good to Climb','2018-02-23','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Join in the great simulated sportslike experience of friend mounting! Assemble your team and climb your way to the top! Mount Your Friends 3D brings mounting to the third dimension, with the same classic innuendo that made you slightly uncomfortable back in the day.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qqn.jpg'),(4320,'Penduline Village','2023-10-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Penduline Village allows you to impersonate a witch moving in on her own island. She can then use her ability to cook and brew potions in order to help the villagers with the quests they offer, and get appreciated in the village.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c5q.jpg'),(4321,'Hana no Keiji: Kumo no Kanata ni','1994-11-18','Fighting, Adventure','Super Famicom','During the closing years of the civil war period and uneasy reign of Toyotomi Hideyoshi, when men high and low scramble to follow conventional propriety so that they don\'t attract undue notice (or death) to themselves, there is one very bizarre individual who is known for his legendarily outlandish and wild personality, physical appearance and behavior. Experience the adventures of Keiji Maeda from personal conflicts with his adopted Maeda family, brave combat exploits, travels to the capital, and relationships with famous existing figures such as Iyeyasu Tokugawa, Rikyuu the tea master, and Hideyoshi himself, to experiences with the foreign and Japanese Christian faithful.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4cxp.jpg'),(4322,'Sumoman','2017-03-28','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sumoman is an adventure puzzle platformer with advanced physics, destructible objects and the ability to reverse time. Solve various physical puzzles, trying to keep the unstable Sumoman on his feet in challenging environments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27em.jpg'),(4323,'Sunny-Place','2021-12-21','Platform, Racing','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A game about driving rocket cars with your friends, furnishing a space apartment, picking a cool outfit and playing a simple cardgame.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pft.jpg'),(4324,'Crazy Shopping',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','The time of life is limited. I just want to tell you one thing. End shopping quickly, accurately, and brilliantly.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nmt.jpg'),(4325,'Bubble Bobble Revolution','2005-12-02','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Nintendo DS','Originally released as an arcade game by Taito in 1986, Bubble Bobble starred two dinosaurs - Bub and Bob who co-operate to make their way through a hundred levels to rescue their girlfriends. This addictive two player game went on to be released on most console formats. Now the game is reborn on the Nintendo DS with all new graphics, split screen action and the classic gameplay. 100 new exciting levels to explore. All new power bubbles and bubble attacks. Microphone activated challenges and Bubble mini-games. Includes a perfect re-creation of the original Bubble Bobble arcade machine game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6iq2.jpg'),(4326,'Nova Antarctica',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive Earth\'s harshest conditions on a devastatingly beautiful journey shaped by the choices you make, the paths you take, and the stories you weave with the mysterious animals of Antarctica.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53a1.jpg'),(4327,'Mystery House II','1982-12-31','Adventure','Sharp MZ-2200, FM-7, NEC PC-6000 Series, MSX','Mystery House II is an adventure game in Japanese and the sequel to the 1982 title Mystery House, which is in turn inspired by the 1980 title Hi-Res Adventure #1: Mystery House. Just like in the first game the goal is to explore a mysterious house and discover the treasure hidden inside by gathering four notes that provide clues.\n\nExploration is similar to the first game, using N/S/E/W to move through the environments shown using a first-person perspective and drawn with outlines. At the bottom commands are entered, such as TAKE, READ or SEARCH. Items can be picked up and used elsewhere to solve puzzles. Compared to the first game the environment is now much larger as the house consists of three floors and the environment can be explored as well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xwqxtb524itjqnmabvsy.jpg'),(4328,'Operation Carnage','1996-06-01','Shooter, Arcade','DOS','Operation Carnage is a top down arcade-style shoot-em-up for DOS developed by Midnight Synergy and released in 1996. It is now available as freeware.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4o4g.jpg'),(4329,'Paradise Marsh','2022-10-13','Music, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Wander through a perfect endless wetland! Catch tadpoles, enjoy peaceful sceneries and find lost poems while restoring fallen stars in the empty night sky.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5inm.jpg'),(4330,'Submerged: VR Escape the Room','2018-09-06','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Trapped inside a room filling with water, you will decipher secrets and tools to aid your escape. Hold your breath and dive for answers within a submarine deep below the ocean.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42k3.jpg'),(4331,'Pixa',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Do you love classic video games from the 8-bit era? Do names like \"Pitfall,\" \"Combat,\" \"Adventure,\" or \"Haunted House\" bring back warm memories of fuzzy televisions and pixelated landscapes? Pixa offers all the nostalgia of an 8-bit classic with all the polish and depth of a modern hit. It will take you on a smile-inducing quest in true old-school style. Simple. Classic. Engrossing. Try it now!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4332,'Ardenfall',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Ardenfall is a first-person RPG set in a world of intricate politics and ancient cultures. Explore rain-drenched wetlands and forgotten dungeons full of danger. Meet countless interesting characters with unique dialog and quests, and leave your mark on this mysterious world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co582x.jpg'),(4333,'Blind Hope',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','A first-person survival horror with a cosmic twist, where you must blindly navigate a decayed historic manor swarming with warped children with only your vague memories and peripheral senses to guide you. Will your sanity hold? Or will blind hope turn to blind despair?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rrl.jpg'),(4334,'Fight To The Death','2024-05-26','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join an arena filled with hundreds or thousands of monsters, use each character\'s unique skills, collect powerful items, create your own play style and become the last man standing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7t3c.jpg'),(4335,'CyberSkyscrUpper',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','This game has no text and can be played in any language! There are no repeating annoying sprites in the game! You get into the building of a space elevator, but it turns out that the elevator is broken and you have to go upstairs on foot, it will be an unforgettable Cyber Trip.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71u8.jpg'),(4336,'Harvest','2002-12-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Harvest is a suspenseful mystery adventure game. This first game by the independent developer Michael B. Clark delves into the subconscious and paranormal.\n\nYou are walking your dog in the park one night when he suddenly dashes off after something and disappears from sight. Searching for him, you find the entrance to an underground complex. Knowing your dog has gone into it, you follow and find yourself inside a huge bunker-like residence. Curiosity, plus the desire to find your pet, leads you further in. You uncover a madman\'s plan involving a water extraction machine and the poisoning of the population\'s water supply. The life of a once normal person was irrevocably changed with the death of his parents. What pushed him over the edge .. and where is your dog?\n\nThe story develops as you read diaries, newspaper articles and other materials left behind. Secret rooms in the bomb shelter type area are protected by elaborate locks with puzzles connected to them. Puzzles are varied and include inventory-based ones, mechanical-logical Myst-style puzzles, a slider puzzle, memory puzzles and a maze.\n\nGraphics are mostly stills with little animation. There is mood-music and some sound effects can be heard. The game is mouse-controlled, point-and-click with various cursors for navigation and interacting with the environment.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4337,'These Doomed Isles','2023-09-25','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inspired by classic god games, survival city-builders and roguelike deck-builders, in These Doomed Isles you\'ll craft your deck of cards to raise islands from the sea, build settlements for your followers and keep them alive as famine threatens, forests burn and raiders loom on the horizon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5aw5.jpg'),(4338,'Caveman World: Mountains of Unga Boonga','2016-04-26','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Caveman World: Mountains of Unga Boonga is a retro inspired platformer adventure game set in fantasy prehistoric time. You play as a Caveman, exploring various levels and overcoming physical obstacles. Levels become increasingly more difficult as you encounter enemies, obstacles, traps and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jrm.jpg'),(4339,'DCA3','2024-12-29','Shooter, Racing, Simulator, Adventure','Dreamcast','An unofficial reverse-engineering project that brings Grand Theft Auto III to the Dreamcast.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98fl.jpg'),(4340,'Super Smash Bros. Ultimate: Almost Competitive Summit',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','t\'s almost there, a competitive version of Summit. This stage removes pretty much every single gimmick normally found on this stage, including making the ice no longer slippery. The zoomout during the slide, however, cannot be changed','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4341,'Squirrel with a Gun','2024-08-29','Shooter, Platform, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Squirrel with a Gun is a sandbox game that focuses on exploration and shooting combat.\nDefend yourself from random encounters with Agents using various weapons. Deflect their melee attacks with exceptional timing to disarm them.\nClimb and jump across platforms with your natural squirrel skill. Use weapon recoil to cross even greater gaps. Explore the neighbourhood from a squirrel\'s eye view.\nTalk with residents of the neighbourhood and help them out for goodies. Or mug them for goodies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70e0.jpg'),(4342,'Dark Envoy','2023-10-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dark Envoy is a non-linear RPG inspired by the likes of the Divinity series, XCOM and Dragon Age to offer free world exploration with an emphasis on tactical combat layered with lore and strategy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7iql.jpg'),(4343,'Rogue Rocks','2019-08-15','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rogue Rocks is a space rocks shoot-em-up with minimalist roguelite elements. Blast your way to the center of a procedurally generated galaxy before you get caught!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2chj.jpg'),(4344,'Home Together',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Home Together is a real-time adult game made in unreal engine 5\n\nCreate your own characters in an extensive character creator\nSave and share creations with other players\nInvite your creation to your house and have adult fun together\nPlay as male in first person and female in third person\nChoose between many adult sex poses across the house\nVoice acted female character\nExperimental VR support','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88yj.jpg'),(4345,'Rachel\'s Game Pack','2022-06-03','Indie','Playdate','A pack of minigames for the PlayDate','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c6j.jpg'),(4346,'GreenGuardiansVR','2024-10-24','Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','Tricky and funny cooperative multiplayer action in VR - A mega-corporation beams you into a supposedly rosy future. But rebels hack into the system to warn you: Only together can you break through the propaganda machine and save the world! Only German language','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oiq.jpg'),(4347,'Little Misfortune: Fancy Edition','2019-09-18','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cq2.jpg'),(4348,'Photo Dojo','2009-12-16','Fighting','Nintendo 3DS, Nintendo DSi','Photo Dojo brings a new twist to the side-scrolling beat ‘em up – literally putting you in the middle of the action!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e0m.jpg'),(4349,'Aquarium HD',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4350,'Moogle Cavern: The Online RPG','2016-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fw7.jpg'),(4351,'Burger Chef Tycoon: Elite Edition','2025-02-14','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4352,'ESPN Great Outdoor Games: Bass 2002','2001-12-29','Sport','Game Boy Advance','With crystal-clear graphics, sound effects as clear as an Alpine stream and excellent play control, ESPN Great Outdoor Games: Bass Fishing is sure to knock your warders off! In Free Fishing Mode, drop a line into any of the 30 ponds and lakes that dot the tranquil landscape. Cast your skills against the world\'s top anglers in Tournament mode. In this mode, you\'ll race to see who can land the five biggest fish of a given variety, including bluegills and many types of bass. After picking from 15 unique lures, a power meter indicates the strength of your cast. You can reel in or play out line. Successful anglers will continually monitor the water depth and temperature and the time of day. The atmospheric soundtrack includes chirping birds, softly lapping water and cheery banjo plucking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cjveevftm2hhznrz3da0.jpg'),(4353,'Sonic Overture',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9il6.jpg'),(4354,'SQGT',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4355,'The Long Fall Home','2025-06-16','Platform, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','THE LONG FALL HOME is a precision puzzle-platformer for 1-4 players. Waking from cryo-sleep decades too late, you must navigate a surreal, shifting space of bizarre obstacles and cosmic oddities. Solve physics-based puzzles, overcome traps, and uncover the truth on your long journey','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9sci.jpg'),(4356,'StarCrawlers Chimera','2024-05-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','StarCrawlers Chimera is a first-person, turn-based, cyberpunk RPG. Customize your character skills and dive into the Chimera complex to find the elusive Dr. Cerberus. Are you a stealthy cyberninja? A crazed pyromaniac soldier? Mind-bending void psyker? Or... a bit of all of them?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4218.jpg'),(4357,'Spelling Challenges and More','2007-09-25','Sin género','PlayStation Portable, Nintendo DS','They\'re the fundamentals of language. They comprise how we communicate and how effectively we can express opinions and succeed at fulfilling our dreams. One of the earliest brain teasers was the Spelling Bee. Recently, we\'ve been experiencing an upsurge in popularity and fascination with word games. On Broadway, people are flocking to the musical 25th Putnam County Spelling Bee. In the movies, the recent Akeelah and the Bee, and Spellbound became surprise hits with millions of fans. The primal challenge to see how many words you can spell correctly to win the game. It\'s the game that took over as brains rose in significance over brawn. Unlike Akeelah, who had to carry thousands of cards to practice for her Spelling Bee challenges, all you need is the console and Crave\'s Spelling Challenges and More. It\'s for Spellin Bee aspirants and for future literati (did I spell that correctly?). Spelling Challenges and More! is themed around a spelling game show \" where you compete for points and prizes but also is much more! Of course, there\'s only one winner. Will it be you? Designed for ages 6 and over ESRB is E for Everyone - Fun and educational word challenges for Everyone How many spelling errors can you find in this dscription? Be challenged from over 25,000 words to spell Choose from 100 difficulty levels Compete in 11 different games','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ytu.jpg'),(4358,'Crat Strat\'s Sonic 1 Hack',NULL,'Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4359,'Emerald Ties',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Emerald Ties is an upcoming Sonic the Hedgehog fan game that features classic gameplay with a modern aesthetic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95nx.jpg'),(4360,'Adrenalinkick','2025-05-09','Racing, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Feel like Ghost Rider and race across the highways and streets of any regions.\n\nA race in the grey area of the law, because there is no speed limit for you.\nBut always remember,\nevery decision could be your last.\nYou don\'t have unlimited guardian angels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9sb9.jpg'),(4361,'Detective Evangelion','2007-01-18','Adventure','PlayStation 2','Detective Evangelion (Meitantei Evangelion), an adventure/strategy PS2 game published by Broccoli, follows Shinji Ikari, a detective hired by Nerv, as he attempts to uncover the truths behind a series of murders. The game was released in Japan on Jan 17, 2007 and include voices from all the original Seiyū. There were 2 editions of the game: a standard edition which included a Nerv magnifying glass/key chain if you pre-ordered; and the premium edition (about 26,040円) which included a multi-face analog watch.\n\nYou play as Shinji the detective in an adventure style gameplay, talking to the Nerv personel and other people in the environment in order to pick up clues within the conversations. The game starts as Shinji emerges from an outdoor stall with sirens blaring in the background. He then finds Rei Ayanami being attacked by a teenager with tentacles. Shinji must then fight the teenager in order to free Rei. From this point on, you pick locations and explore, the ultimate goal being to discover the identity of the killer that\'s committing murders all over Nerv and Tokyo-3. At each of the locations, you can interact with the people there, with the occasional action sequence or mini game. All of Shinji\'s friends, Gendo and Misato all appear in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wj3.jpg'),(4362,'Vantage: Primitive Survival Game','2018-05-22','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vantage is a Primitive Survival Game. Your main objective is simple... to stay alive!\n\nYou explore the massive world searching for food, creating primitive tools and weapons to create, hunt, and craft other items to make your life easier.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47ry.jpg'),(4363,'State of Decay 2: Heartland','2019-06-10','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','State of Decay 2: Heartland features a return to Trumbull Valley in a new story-based adventure. Once the iconic site of the original State of Decay game, the towns of Spencer’s Mill and Marshall are now overrun with an advanced form of blood plague: a more aggressive and far deadlier version than exists anywhere else. Though it may be familiar territory to those who homesteaded here years ago, Trumbull Valley is packed with new dangers… and unspeakable horrors.\n\nIn Heartland, players choose from two sets of starting characters who have traveled to Trumbull Valley for different reasons. Both pairs of survivors are on a mission to find people important to them: characters who appeared in the original State of Decay. Players must also find and recruit crucial hand-crafted characters in order to build a strong community. They can also claim the beloved Jurassic Junction as their homesite and build the biggest base yet, blending nostalgia with new features.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1luk.jpg'),(4364,'Solo King: Single Player - Texas Hold\'em Poker','2020-03-03','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SoloKing Poker - AI coaching and training poker software. Poker training complex tools: Poker Hand Evaluator, Showdown Calculator, Table Simulation, Equity Evaluator,Draw Evaluator, EV Evaluator, Advisor Coach. The Strongest Poker AI Opponents. No-Limit ring games, MTTs, heads-up tournaments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m07.jpg'),(4365,'Strings of Fate XI: Magic Dream','2025-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Strings of Fate XI: A Magic Dream is an attempt to create a new fantasy world of adventure for fans of the RPG genre. Using the Unreal Engine, the game world will be presented in a colorful way with already familiar graphics technologies and mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99c3.jpg'),(4366,'Garbage Truck City Tycoon',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','\"Let’s clean the world together! Join EMKA - waste disposal company, on their quest to save our planet from getting covered in trash. Welcome to Garbage Truck City Tycoon. In this game you as a player take control of a recycling ECO truck, equipped with special vacuums that harvest garbage. By cleaning the environment you can invest in new trucks, upgrades and green technologies that will improve your gameplay. The main goal of this game is to highlight the importance of ecology. Various environments starting from forests, cities and deserts you will encounter in the game will show you how garbage crisis affects the environment. Features:\nBuy and upgrade trucks, for better performance\nCollect special boosters with various effects\nUnlock legendary trucks\nConstruct and upgrade structures of garbage processing\nExpand your business\nDozens of levels with various environments to unlock\nHelp us clean the world together with EMKA!\"','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4367,'Haunted Hotel: Ancient Bane - Collector\'s Edition','2014-05-30','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','What kind of evil resides in the hotel? An exciting investigation in the cursed hotel awaits you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b4a.jpg'),(4368,'My Forged Wedding','2011-12-12','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','In My Forged Wedding, the player takes on the role of a recent university graduate who must trade a few days in a false marriage for the job of her dreams.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qu4tffoyj3nbrbbtzf4e.jpg'),(4369,'Star Fox 64 3D','2011-09-09','Shooter','Nintendo 3DS','The Star Fox team triumphantly returns to one of its greatest missions with this remake of Star Fox 64 in full 3D, featuring a complete graphical update.\n\nThe entire Star Fox universe spreads out realistically into the depths of the Nintendo 3DS screen while the 3D visuals give the player a clearer grasp of distance and position. This makes the game more approachable and intuitive, thereby allowing players to focus on the action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wwu.jpg'),(4370,'Hero World','2023-10-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is Hero World, the new platform and turn-based game by QVIK GAMEZ! The barriers of time and space have been shattered. Creatures from a mystical realm have entered our world. Heroes from across the multiverse have emerged to stop the creatures of darkness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67dk.jpg'),(4371,'Final Fantasy XIV: A Requiem for Heroes','2019-01-08','Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Patch 4.5 includes a host of new features such as the very first limited job - blue mage, final chapters of the Four Lords saga and Return to Ivalice, and brand-new main scenario quests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vpg.jpg'),(4372,'Mister 9','2024-03-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Look for irregularities in the house where the uncles live. Irregulars are the enemy. For the sake of world peace, shoot without mercy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ure.jpg'),(4373,'Number Smash 123',NULL,'Puzzle, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Get ready for a smash-tacular Number smash fest.\nNumber smash is a simple one touch arcade game. Your objective is to smash as many tiles as you can before the timer runs out. Compete with your friends. Brag about your high scores on Twitter and Facebook. Earn achievements and try to climb your way to the top of the leaderboard.\nIf you\'re good enough you\'ll be able to play the crazy frantic Number smash mode.\nHit us up on twitter for any feedback. Tap on the Developer Website to contact us!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4374,'Block Jam: Cute Edition','2025-02-22','Puzzle, Strategy','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4375,'Ironsight','2019-06-20','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Online FPS game, near future background, Resource Warfare between Military Forces and PMC. More than 50 kinds of original weapons with customization option. Use Peripheral objects, Tactical drones, Active objects to experience dynamic warfare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97fg.jpg'),(4376,'Sleigh Strikers','2024-01-11','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Santa\'s going high-tech with the Present Launcher 1225! Join the jolly ride, rescue reindeer, and blast presents down chimneys in this holly, jolly, fast paced shoot \'em up. Make every shot count and save Christmas in a dash!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gfb.jpg'),(4377,'Fairy Biography 2: Confidante','2022-11-24','Platform, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Players can obtain game qualifications by using magic balls to attach naughty elves to the Elder Scrolls, unlocking and collecting different types of beautiful elves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vi4.jpg'),(4378,'Painkiller: Overdose','2007-11-23','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Painkiller: Overdose is the second stand-alone Painkiller game.\nThe story is set just after Daniel kills Lucifer. The death of Hell\'s leader allows Belial, the prisoner and outcast, to escape and start his vendetta against those who imprisoned him: demonic beast Cerberus and Sammael, an angel who betrayed his own kind. Belial starts his journey with killing his prison warden (and later using his head as a weapon). After traveling through various hellish places and defeating countless demons he kills Cerberus and reaches Samael\'s lair. There, Belial defeats the fallen angel and rips his wings off as an act of vengeance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qrd.jpg'),(4379,'Immortal Game','2022-03-17','Card & Board Game','Web browser','Immortal Game represents the first ever free-to-play and play-and-earn version of chess with a built-in earning mechanism, and our mission is simple – provide existing chess players with the most nuanced and variable experience available coupled with financial rewards for their skills, while simultaneously introducing the game to an entirely new audience of investors and DeFi / GameFi enthusiasts.\n\nBuilt on the Ethereum network, the project is available for both mobile phones and PCs, and whilst we were passionate about keeping the core rules of the gameplay unchanged, we have introduced an exciting new element, which will allow players to access fun features and new ways to play that will enhance the gaming experience, as well as maximize earning potential.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63ra.jpg'),(4380,'Sonic: Quick Step Challenge',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4381,'Tank vs. Tank: Deluxe Edition','2025-02-14','Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4382,'The Academy: The First Riddle','2020-06-19','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','The Academy is a puzzle-packed adventure set in a school filled with mystery. Leave your mark on Arbor\'s Academy and find out why it only welcomes the best and the brightest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tn7.jpg'),(4383,'Space Quest II: Vohaul\'s Revenge','1987-11-14','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Apple IIGS, Atari ST/STE, Mac, DOS, Amiga, Apple II','Just when you thought it was safe to go back into space, He\'s Back! And he wants revenge! Sludge Vohaul, the demented evil scientist (whose sinister plan you unknowingly foiled in our last episode), is seething over his Sarien slip-up. Madder than a drenched Astrochicken, (and still determined to rule the galaxy) Vohaul has devised a new plan. A nasty plan. A plan so evil that only one as wickedly sadistic as he could imagine it. Yes, the worst nightmare ever is about to come knocking on your door- and it won\'t take No for an answer!\n\nIt\'s The Invasion of the Insurance Salesmen! Hordes and hordes of pushy, obnoxious (genetically engineered) salesmen will soon be dumped upon your home planet- unless somebody dumps on Vohaul first. And who knows more about getting dumped on than you?\n\nRoger Wilco to the rescue! Once again, you, Roger Wilco, sanitation engineer and involuntary hero, must don your sanitary space mittens and prepare for the onslaught of evil that Vohaul has prepared. A chore not for queasy or fainthearted. And if you can stomach that…Get ready for the Granddaddy of Gross. The Emperor of Evil. The first name is Nastiness, Sludge Vohaul himself! With nothing to protect you but your wits and your wet mop, you haven\'t got a chance! (But that\'s what makes the game so much fun!)\n\nHave fun staying out of trouble! Beat the odds. Conquer insurmountable obstacles. Defy gravity. Cry for help. Misfortune awaits you at every turn… Boggle your way through the humid stenchlands of the jungle planet Labion. Blunder your way onto the asteroid fortress of the slime-sucking Vohaul. Flounder your way through more perilous escapades than you can wiggle a space worm at.\n\nGuaranteed to make you laugh! Packed with comedy, tragedy, suspense, horror, and many other nouns, Space Quest II will tickle your funny bone and relieve that heavy feeling in your wallet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v4q.jpg'),(4384,'Dream Cage','2025-02-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Robert battles early Alzheimer\'s and nightly sleep paralysis. Each night reveals fragments of his past. Uncover the truth and help him solve the mysteries haunting his mind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9b85.jpg'),(4385,'Sonic: Project Survival','2016-10-24','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sonic: Project Survival is a Sonic fan game that is Mega Drive-style Sonic platformer, with original zones based of classic games in the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e7s.jpg'),(4386,'Demon\'s Score','2012-09-19','Music','Android, iOS','Demons\' Score is a 2012 fantasy rhythm action game developed by iNiS and published by Square Enix for mobile OSs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/g0szggw5wakzjrbx1ipd.jpg'),(4387,'Sonic: The Blue Blur',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4388,'Ghost in the Shell: Arise - Stealth Hounds',NULL,'Shooter, Tactical','Arcade','\"Sound Reveals the Concealed\nTeam PVP Field VR activity has finally arrived!\nShoot down enemies while moving freely through a wide open arena!\n\nAs a rookie of the special force team created by Motoko Kusanagi, join in the fight against the terrorist organization.\n\nExperience this activity on a large dedicated 20m X 12m arena with a highly sophisticated multi-person full body tracking system.\nA maximum of up to 8 players can participate in this 4 vs 4 team battle.\n\nEmploy iconic, powerful technology from Ghost in the Shell such as optical camouflage, prosthetic body, cyberbrain, etc. Become fully immersed and experience futuristic warfare for yourself.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zpc.jpg'),(4389,'Race On','2008-12-18','Shooter, Racing, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Race On brings you the epic WTCC 2008 season down to the smallest detail and now you get the chance to show the world who the real champion is. The Race OnExpansion Pack includes the Iconic Detroit Muscle cars suited for those who like to lay down lots of rubber power sliding out of corners on the rev limiter. Enough torque to drag the moon off orbit, full opposite lock and a big grin on your face. Or you can try your hand at the Formula Masters, a top of the line open wheel series, offering you even more speed and action than ever before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86hn.jpg'),(4390,'Gauntlet III: The Final Quest','1991-12-31','Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','Gauntlet III is an action-based dungeon exploration game. Like in the predecessors you empty areas infested by all kinds of enemies while running for the exit. Like this was rather a straight forward thing in the first two games, it\'s not that easy to finish a level anymore. While you only had to run until you find the exit (and besides killing hordes of enemies you probably find some keys to unlock doors leading to deeper dungeons) you might have to solve a few \"quests\" to proceed to the next level in this installment. These \"quests\" are very basic, for example you have to find object A, then bring it to B, advance to C and finally go to D to uncover the exit.\n\nWhile the first two games had a top-down view, Gauntlet 3 has an isometric perspective. The old four characters (warrior, wizard, elf and valkyrie) are ready for action again and this time they get backup by four new characters which include the Lizard, Neptune, Stoneman and the Iceman.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lda4yvpn2ysdxxghujts.jpg'),(4391,'Star Wars: Episode 1 - Director\'s Cut','2006-02-15','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a Stand Alone Game. It is not compatible with the Lara At The Movies project and cannot be substituted into that game. It is a tribute to the wonderful Star Wars adventures. This release is in response to feedback from some players who had difficulty with the original Lara at the Movies version of these levels. I have called this new release the Director\'s Cut as it contains material not included in the original version (one new playable level and two cutscenes). The original levels have been significantly revamped with revised texturing, atmosphere and additional audio. The timed runs and podracing events should now be playable by players of all skill levels.\n\nThis TRLE was placed in the trle.net hall of fame in 2007.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lcf.jpg'),(4392,'The Legend of Sword and Fairy 5 Prequel','2021-06-17','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Legend of Sword and Fairy 5 Prequel is an action role-playing game developed by Softstar Technology (Beijing) Co., Ltd. It is the seventh installment in the Legend of Sword and Fairy (or Chinese Paladin) video game series and is the prequel of The Legend of Sword and Fairy 5. Set in a fictional version of ancient China, the game is based on the wuxia genre with elements of fantasy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co469c.jpg'),(4393,'Horror Nightmare Collection','2024-01-24','Simulator, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Horror Nightmare Collection is an anthology of retro-style horror games. Immerse yourself in unique stories, from eerie forest horrors to forsaken prison nightmares, pushing your nerves to the limit. Explore psychological and grotesque terrors in this dread-inducing assortment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wnt.jpg'),(4394,'Hot Wheels Unleashed 2: Turbocharged - Day One Edition','2023-10-19','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The ultimate racing game is back — and more charged up than ever!\n\nOver 130 vehicles, including new types like motorbikes and ATVs, five new environments with racing surfaces impacting vehicle performance and creating more dynamic gameplay, new driving unique strategies as like lateral dashes and jumps to ensure more wild races, a story-driven campaign, and a variety of exciting new game modes.\n\nThe multiplayer experience is enriched thanks to the Cross-play feature, online ranking and PC anti-cheat system. And a lot of ways to show off your creativity are available with the renewed track editor and brand-new stickers for unique vehicle liveries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72m9.jpg'),(4395,'Orestruck: Space Miner',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A fast-paced First Person Shooter inspired by the classics of the genre. Shoot and kick your way out of the war-torn planet to survive the attack of the space undead. Zombie blood has never splashed so good!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l9k.jpg'),(4396,'Floating Star','2024-10-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as a lone space traveler, floating in the galaxy while exploring the boundaries of human civilization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oaz.jpg'),(4397,'11.45 A Vivid Life','2018-10-25','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short weird tale about a girl who discovered her skeleton isn\'t hers, stole an xray machine and fled to the country to investigate her own body','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u6p.jpg'),(4398,'Forking Hell','2020-07-01','Simulator, Arcade','Oculus VR, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Forking Hell is a single player 3D casual arcade-simulation game where the player guides a forklift vehicle around a virtual warehouse and completes customer orders over the working days. The chaos of the Rumba-Bots combined with the semi-realistic physics helps give an arcade style to the simulation genre. Forking Hell is built with controller or keyboard/mouse input to support various play-styles and preferences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co261h.jpg'),(4399,'Dragon Ball FighterZ: FighterZ Pass 2','2019-01-31','Fighting','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The FighterZ Pass 2 will grant you access to no less than 6 additional mighty characters who will surely enhance your FighterZ experience! All fighters come with their respective Z Stamp, Lobby Avatar, and set of Alternative Colors.\n\nContains the following fighters:\n- Videl\n- Goku (GT)\n- Jiren\n- Janemba\n- Gogeta (SSGSS)\n- Broly (DBS)\n\nBy purchasing the FighterZ Pass 2, you will also be receiving exclusive Commentator Voice Packs to bring further excitement to your fights!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hpv.jpg'),(4400,'Dragon Ball Z: Infinite World','2008-11-04','Fighting','PlayStation 2','Dragon Ball Z: Infinite World combines all the best elements of previous Dragon Ball Z games, while boasting new features such as “Dragon Missions”, new battle types and drama scenes for fans to delve deeper than ever before into the Dragon Ball Z universe. The new “Dragon Missions” Dragon Ball Z Infinite World include many famous scenes from the Dragon Ball Z series never before seen in a video game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3tse.jpg'),(4401,'ZigZag Ball','2025-02-16','Arcade','PlayStation 4','ZigZag Ball is an endless casual game, switch sides to move forward in the world and do your best to stay on the right track and not fall, and collect diamonds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fz0.jpg'),(4402,'Supreme Commander: Gold Edition','2008-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Gold Edition includes: \n \n- Supreme Commander \n- Supreme Commander: Forged Alliance','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2npo.jpg'),(4403,'Doll Dress Up: Classy Edition','2025-02-22','Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4404,'Urban Flow: Deluxe Edition','2023-03-24','Puzzle, Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Urban Flow is a game about the subtle beauty of city streets filled with cars moving in perfect harmony. But such order does not happen all by itself - the city needs you to control the traffic lights and to make sure everything goes smoothly. That means no crashes, no jams. Everything will run perfectly - as long as you stay focused!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ay4.jpg'),(4405,'Philosophers Lab','2024-05-29','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Navigate this robot\'s intricately designed home, immerse yourself in a calming Lo-Fi soundtrack, and interact with a rich selection of literature for relaxation and focused study in this interactive exploration experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fat.jpg'),(4406,'S2: Silent Storm - Gold Edition','2004-09-09','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2upt.jpg'),(4407,'Celeste Classic 2: Lani\'s Trek','2021-01-25','Platform, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A Pico-8 platformer about hiking around a mountain, made in three days for Celeste\'s third anniversary.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7szc.jpg'),(4408,'Shenmue III: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','The Digital Deluxe Edition includes the full game, DLC Pass (the complete post-launch DLC content and the “Burning Sandstorm” Advanced Technique Scroll) and Ryo\'s legendary Flight Jacket.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d1h.jpg'),(4409,'Human Fast Food','2025-04-24','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A cooking simulator where you run an underground fast food for monsters and serve them with human meat. Improve your kitchen appliances, unlock new recipes, manage your stock and keep the monsters well fed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qes.jpg'),(4410,'Fallout 3: Point Lookout','2009-10-08','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Buy a ticket and hop onboard the Duchess Gambit, as Tobar the Ferryman takes you to the strange seaside town of Point Lookout. What secrets does the dilapidated boardwalk hold? Who lives in the sprawling mansion? Why is the Punga Fruit so important? And what horrors lie in the depths of the murky swamp? Point Lookout is the most open-ended DLC yet, and allows you to explore an entirely new and expansive gameplay area any way you’d like. A completely new quest line allows you uncover the town’s hidden secrets, and wield powerful new weapons like the Double-Barrel Shotgun against the swamp’s dangerous, and deformed, denizens. So venture to Point Lookout, if you dare. Just pray it’s not a one-way trip.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x84.jpg'),(4411,'Coloring Book: Cute Edition','2025-02-15','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4412,'Lorera','2020-07-15','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hook your way through the colorful world of Lorera and solve it\'s biggest mystery. From a little flower to a vicious warrior, Lorera is all about growth and persevering your way through obstacles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ct8.jpg'),(4413,'Dragon Ball Z: Super Goku-den - Kakusei-hen','1995-09-22','Sin género','Super Famicom','Dragon Ball Z: Super Goku-den: Kakusei-hen is the second and last video game of the Super Goku-den series. It was released only in Japan on September 22, 1995, for the Super Nintendo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4l0w.jpg'),(4414,'Sonic Generations 2D',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4415,'Urusei Yatsura: Endless Summer','2005-10-20','Adventure, Visual Novel','Nintendo DS','A dating sim for the Nintendo DS based on the anime Urusei Yatsura. As Ataru Moroboshi, the player spends a month with other characters from the series, and the girl with the highest love rating at the end of the month falls in love with him.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2udj.jpg'),(4416,'Attack of the Weeaboo Invaders',NULL,'Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h44.jpg'),(4417,'Gallop Racer','1996-09-27','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Arcade, PlayStation','Just like in real horse racing, no two races are alike: race outcomes are determined by racetrack, conditions, pack and luck. A great party game for players and spectators alike, you can be the jockey, or select watch mode, and be a spectator. As the jockey, you decide when to hold back, move inside, move outside and go for the lead horses even change lanes, get bumped, get blocked and lose ground on curves. The winners are put out to stud, and the losers, put out to pasture.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oeq.jpg'),(4418,'Sutte Hakkun BS Version 2','1998-11-15','Platform, Puzzle','Satellaview','Sutte Hakkun BS Version 2 is a platform/puzzle game that was released in 1998 in Japan. As the game\'s title implies, it is a sequel of sorts to the earlier Sutte Hakkun (Nov. 1997) and Sutte Hakkun Event Version (Oct. 1997). A later titles in the same series, Sutte Hakkun \'98 (Dec. 1998) followed a month after the broadcast of Sutte Hakkun Version 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38uz.jpg'),(4419,'SoulCalibur VI: Character Creation Set F','2020-12-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Celebrate 20 years of SOULCALIBUR with an all new Character Creation set!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4420,'Sweet Hell','2024-02-05','Platform','Web browser','Your brother has taken over your throne. Reclaim it by defeating his eight legendary monster guardians.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4421,'Word Shuffle',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4422,'Bless Global','2023-02-28','Role-playing (RPG)','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Bless - is a huge world, which has been simmering struggle between the Empire and the Union of Giron. Different races, each with its own history and philosophy, are on opposite sides of the conflict. Choose whose ideology is closer to you, and fight for all that is best in the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93t2.jpg'),(4423,'Sonic Fear 2: Metal Sonic Out of Control','2016-12-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4424,'Sonic Boom and the Smash Crew',NULL,'Fighting, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4425,'Mario Kart 64',NULL,'Racing, Arcade','Wii, Nintendo 64, Wii U','Mario Kart 64 is the second main installment of the Mario Kart series. It is the first game in the series to use three-dimensional graphics, however, the characters and items in this game are still two-dimensional, pre-rendered sprites. The game offers two camera angles and three engine sizes: 50cc, 100cc and 150cc. Each kart has distinctive handling, acceleration and top speed capabilities. Shells that you fire at rival racers, Bananas that make them skid out and Lightning Bolts that make them small and very slow are just a few of the game\'s unique power-ups.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67hm.jpg'),(4426,'Mortimer Beckett and the Time Paradox','2008-11-12','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mortimer Beckett\'s back for an all-new, eye-popping adventure! Although Mortimer was able to get rid of the ghosts in his last outing, his Uncle Jerome\'s home is now host to another ominous challenge - a time portal! Even worse, the Time Bomb that Jerome built to close the portal has been scattered across eight different eras! Join Mortimer for a wild trip to find the scattered Time Bomb, put it back together, and close the portal before it\'s too late!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rji4wnyopwnbnlkfyfne.jpg'),(4427,'Grand Fantasy Heroes','2025-03-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An epic Fantasy RPG where you will level up heroes, go on adventures, and progress in power until you can take on the Demon King.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jys.jpg'),(4428,'Never7: The End of Infinity','2000-12-21','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Portable, Dreamcast, PlayStation 2','Never7: The End of Infinity is the first title in the Infinity series, and is followed by Ever17: The Out of Infinity, Remembe 11: The Age of Infinity, 12Riven: The Psi-Climinal of Integral, and Code_18.\n\nIn the game, the player takes the role of Makoto Ishihara, a college student who attends a seminar camp on an island together with three other students; he also befriends three other people who he meets on the island. The game takes place over the course of a week, and consists of the player reading the story, occasionally making choices that affect the direction of the plot; on the sixth day, one of the female characters dies, and the game moves back in time to the beginning, letting the player use knowledge from the first set of six days to make new choices, to try to prevent the character\'s death.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2271.jpg'),(4429,'Seclusion','2025-04-18','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The walls listens...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qfs.jpg'),(4430,'PlayZ','2020-08-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','PlayZ is arcade-style singleplayer puzzle style game! You have different levels and at each level, you have different gameplay styles! The aim of the game is to finish as fast as you can.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kj3.jpg'),(4431,'Murder Mystery Adventure','2016-10-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Murder Mystery Adventure tells the suspenseful story of a chilling murder committed in a mysterious mansion upon the hillside at the outskirts of town. Only you can solve the crime. Only you have the wits to solve challenging puzzles to unveil critical clues. Only you have the investigative knowledge to interact with possible suspects to decide who is lying and who are innocent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86f4.jpg'),(4432,'Kobito-zukan: Kobito no Fushigi Jikken Set','2013-12-12','Sin género','Nintendo 3DS','In this second installment of the Kobito-zukan series for 3DS, the player can search for mysterious creatures called Kobito across different locations, conduct experiments, and play Kobito-themed minigames.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ccc.jpg'),(4433,'Sonic Generations: The Lost Zones',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4434,'Super Luigi Land Wii','2020-06-16','Platform','Wii','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8p5p.jpg'),(4435,'Battle Arena VR','2020-11-26','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Battle Arena VR is a multiplayer arena shooter, where you are automatically matched with opponents. Challenge yourself, challenge everyone in a deathmatch Battle Arena!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59ng.jpg'),(4436,'Wing of Darkness: Limited Edition',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Wing of Darkness: Limited Edition includes;\n- Game: Wing of Darkness\n- Original Box,\n- Original Soundtrack\n- Abend Flügel Pins\n- Abend Flügel Crest\n- Acrylic Figurine\n- B5 Sticker Sheet\n- Visual Fan Book\n- Secret Item','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4437,'Koegasuru','2025-04-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Create your own music video by controlling Hatsune Miku! When you solve the 4 riddles, a music video will be created of you solving the riddles! It is an escape room game set in the music video \"KOEGASURU\" by TEMPLIME!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qfm.jpg'),(4438,'The 9th Gate','2018-10-17','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A girl goes missing. The voices are a-calling. Can you find her before they find you?\n\nThis is a survival horror game where you must search a presumed abandoned apartment for nine cursed dolls and destroy them in a ritual circle to save the girl. Spirits, both wandering and hostile will get in your way and with each doll destroyed, expect more of the dangerous ones to appear! Use your wits and whatever courage you can muster to find these dolls. This is not a game for the faint of heart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70cv.jpg'),(4439,'Samurai Shodown: Warden','2020-06-24','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','This digital purchase will unlock the DLC character \"WARDEN\" for your copy of SAMURAI SHODOWN.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40s4.jpg'),(4440,'\"Comrades, We Have a Mole Problem.\"','2024-07-03','Sin género','SteamVR','\"Hear me comrade, lives are at stake here. You are to take matters into your own hands, saving yourself and your comrades from spies from the West. The party appreciates your work, but don\'t forget, the party will not forgive incompetence.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89tg.jpg'),(4441,'Psych//Shift','2024-05-30','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Psych//Shift is a unique take on the fast and frenetic First-Person Shooter/Parkour formula. With one core mechanic at its center, the ability to instantaneously swap minds with nearly any enemy you choose. Taking on both their current position and also their characteristics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ggl.jpg'),(4442,'Steel Division 2: General Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d83.jpg'),(4443,'Sorcery Jokers','2018-04-24','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Inner yearnings...\nImmutable ideals...\nDreams and reality...\n\nOne day, all of a sudden, magic came into the world. The existence of magic wasn\'t a secret known only to a certain few, but was announced by the current government and quickly became common knowledge.\n\nToday, it\'s an age where magic is used as a resource and has permeated throughout many different fields. A city was founded on Agartha, the island where magic was discovered, and research continues to this day. This is a story about the fates of those who live in this magical world.\n\nWatch as six radically different people find their paths converging...\n\nMutsumi Haruto, a 9th-Class Caster at the First National Magical Academy. A slightly half-baked boy who can\'t turn a blind eye to wrongdoing.\nSenri, an OutCast. An anonymous inhabitant of the city\'s nightlife.\nRikudou Asahi, a 9th-class Caster at the Academy. A unique girl facing trials on her way to the Land of Dreams.\nAtori Riku, a 10th-Class Caster at the Academy. A CEO\'s daughter who\'s not on the same wavelength as her peers.\nKousaki Fiona Annabel, an apprentice sister at the local church. Her smile never goes out.\nNoah, the Unknown. A girl spotted on Agartha.\n\nCasters and OutCasts... What fate awaits these two divergent forces?\n\nThe miracle of magic which governs the world will shape the fates of those within it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41sp.jpg'),(4444,'James Bond 007: The World Is Not Enough','2000-10-17','Shooter, Adventure','Nintendo 64','The World Is Not Enough is a first-person shooter video game developed by Eurocom and based on the 1999 James Bond film of the same name. It was published by Electronic Arts and released for the Nintendo 64 on October 17, 2000, shortly before the release of its PlayStation counterpart. The game features a single-player campaign in which players assume the role of MI6 agent James Bond as he fights to stop a terrorist from triggering a nuclear meltdown in the waters of Istanbul. It includes a split-screen multiplayer mode where up to four players can compete in different types of deathmatch and objective-based games.\n\nThe game runs on an engine that was adapted to take advantage of the Nintendo 64 strengths. Although Eurocom used original production material to recreate the environments of the film, the company added elements to help the game design, including a mission which takes place in the London Underground. The game supports the Nintendo 64 Expansion Pak, which provides enhanced graphics and visual effects, but a Controller Pak is required to save the player\'s progress through the game.\n\nThe World Is Not Enough received generally positive reviews from critics and was frequently compared to Rare\'s Nintendo 64 first-person shooters GoldenEye 007 and Perfect Dark. It was also considered superior to its PlayStation counterpart because of its level design and inclusion of a multiplayer mode. Critics generally praised the game\'s graphics and smooth frame rate, but criticized its weak and inconsistent enemy artificial intelligence. In the United States, the game sold more than one million copies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xsr.jpg'),(4445,'Brickbuilder VR',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Brickbuilder VR is a high-fidelity VR model building simulator. With both decorative blocks and mechanical components such as axels, gears and motors, the game enables you to build a wide variety of interesting creations that move and interact with each other in the virtual world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mki.jpg'),(4446,'Star Wars: Jedi Math','2008-12-31','Sin género','Leapster','Join the Jedi Knights and their allies on a mission to save the galaxy from the evil Separatists!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74j5.jpg'),(4447,'Master of Orion: Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xu4.jpg'),(4448,'Tennis no Ouji-sama: Doki-doki Survival - Umibe no Secret','2007-01-25','Sport, Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','Tennis no Ouji-sama: DokiDoki Survival - Umibe no Secret is an Adventure game, developed by WinkySoft and published by Konami, which was released in Japan in 2007.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80mb.jpg'),(4449,'For the Greater Good','2025-06-23','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','For the Greater Good is a violent, story-driven action game where unique characters fight a blood cult hell-bent on world domination.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s8k.jpg'),(4450,'Age of Empires II: HD Edition - The African Kingdoms','2015-11-05','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Age of Empires II: HD Edition - The African Kingdoms; the second new official expansion for the Age of Empires II universe in over 16 years. Challenge friends with four additional civilizations, new units, ships and technologies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80rk.jpg'),(4451,'Solitaire & Mahjong','2009-12-31','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','Wii','Solitaire and Mahjong may be considered as two of the most well known casual games around. Napoleon Bonaparte was said to have played solitaire during his exile while Confucius has been rumored to be the inventor of Mahjong. Solitaire & Mahjong form a true delight for all thinkers and wonderers as it will challenge all forms of minds. Fans will find endless challenge and fun in the 101 variations of these two timeless classic that\'s packed into one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1kvq.jpg'),(4452,'Island Time VR','2018-04-03','Simulator, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation VR2, PlayStation VR, SteamVR, Oculus Rift','After a journey at sea, you are shipwrecked on a tiny island. Using your wit, ingenuity and the advice of your new buddy, Carl the Crab, you’ve gotta find a way to keep yourself from starving and survive. Craft tools, fend off creatures, try to signal an airplane… or you could just give up and die? Maybe, just enjoy the sunset while you can. Almost makes you forget that you\'re in a desperate struggle against your own mortality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27ok.jpg'),(4453,'Flood of Zombies','2025-03-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Flood of Zombies is a third-person roguelike shooting game in which the player takes on the role of a soldier, defending against numerous zombie attacks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gcd.jpg'),(4454,'Equiverse','2024-05-23','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience the ultimate ecosystem simulator! Equiverse is a cozy simulation game where you care for different species of animals, earn income by keeping them happy, unlock helpful companions, and defend against invading monsters. Can you keep your ecosystem thriving?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mba.jpg'),(4455,'Railroad Story HD','2012-07-06','Sin género','iOS','All Aboard! Take your small bank loan, and transform the industry by becoming one of the most successful railroad tycoons known to man! Build tracks that connect small towns and watch their economies boom as your railroad system builds them up. It\'s your time to shine in Railroad Story!\nThe time has come for the wild west to connect! Build tracks between towns and cities, and watch as the resources flow freely! Use bridges and tunnels to complete tracks across difficult terrain, and prove that nothing can stand in your way! Help industrialize the area spanning 98 different cities and towns, across 18 missions, using 4 different types of trains! Out with the old horse drawn carriage, and in with the locomotives! But beware, with new technology comes new dangers! Throw some more coal on the fire, and roll on down the track!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4456,'Braaains!',NULL,'Puzzle','Playdate','Party trivia...but with zombies','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4457,'Spin Jam','2000-10-24','Puzzle, Strategy','PlayStation','Spin Jam is a puzzle game that involves aiming colored bubbles at flower petals. When three bubbles are united with their respective colored petal, the petal will burst. When all petals burst, you\'ve defeated the level. Arcade mode is one of three separate ways to play Spin Jam. In it, you must challenge your skills in 100 levels. Each level will get more difficult, and you\'ll discover more twists and turns as you advance.\n\nBattle mode lets you and a friend compete in a head-to-head match. The winner is the first to explode their screen\'s petals. Story mode is like a single-player version of the Battle mode. You\'ll progress through each character\'s series of \"planets\" to get a shot at defeating an evil dictator named Moolamb. Eight characters are initially available, with more waiting to be unlocked. Use special bubbles as power-ups to help you clear each color-changing petal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qyzepfxiykvr03rprtvr.jpg'),(4458,'Our world has not decayed','2019-10-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a doomsday visual novel. The game consists of 8 exquisite pieces, dynamic vertical drawing and nearly 200,000 words with a full voice. Although it is already the end of the world, my world and her have not yet decayed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26c6.jpg'),(4459,'Sonic CD Breakout','2016-12-31','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fw5.jpg'),(4460,'Evatchi','2020-06-13','Simulator','Handheld Electronic LCD','The Evatchi, also known as the Multipurpose Egg Shaped Decisive Weapon Evatchi is a licensed Tamagotchi Nano model based on the anime series Neon Genesis Evangelion.\nSpecial Governmental Agency NERV has developed the technology to apply retroversion on Angels, forcing them into their embryonic state to be raised in egg-shaped containers filled with L.C.L. The egg-shaped armored containers are built to restrain Angel from its rampage and allow people to carry them outside of the organization’s laboratory. As a member of NERV, you have been assigned to raise the Angels using the ‘Evatchi’, and based on how you handle various events, the Angel will grow into various forms. Attend to any instances of L.C.L. corruption and break through all generated A.T. Fields!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ybn.jpg'),(4461,'Super Life RPG','2019-07-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome home to Sun Villa! After a long summer at grandpa\'s ranch, it\'s time to finish school, get a job and move into your own place. Let the adventure of life begin! Super Life (RPG) is a game about constant progression. Go to work, study or hit the gym, these actions will reward you will XP, STR (strength points) and INT (intelligence points). Earn enough points to level up and you will unlock new tasks, new job opportunities and new areas of the map to explore!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rhd.jpg'),(4462,'BS Shin Onigashima','1996-12-02','Adventure','Satellaview','BS Shin Onigashima is a Downloadable 4-part Soundlink game for the Satellaview that was broadcast in at least 2 distinct runs between September 29, 1996 and January 31, 1996. The game was popular and won its December 1997 rebroadcast through the votes of players in the Third Player\'s Choice competition. The game came in second (in terms of votes) to BS SimCity: Machi Tsukuri Taikai and so it was broadcast second as a 4-day broadcast.\n\nBS Shin Onigashima was a remake sequel to the earlier Shin Onigashima, a game that was released for the Famicom Disk System in September of 1987. The major difference between the two games relate to the SoundLink elements that were introduced for the Satellaview broadcasts. BS Shin Onigashima was later re-made in December 1997 as the commercial release, Heisei Shin Onigashima, for the Nintendo Power system. This was later followed-up by the May 1998 Super Famicom cartridge release of the same name.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uu0.jpg'),(4463,'Donnie the Chao','2016-12-31','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4464,'Rock and Scroll',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Rock and Scroll you follow Sisyphus who is now cursed to be the very boulder he pushed up the mountain, as he tries to outwit the gods one last time in this literal side scroller platform game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9sb5.jpg'),(4465,'Sengoku Cyber: Fujimaru Jigoku-hen','1995-10-27','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PlayStation','Sengoku Cyber - Fujimaru Jigokuhen is a tactical strategy role-playing game that follows the ninja Fujimaru and his ninja clan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vz5.jpg'),(4466,'Surviving Mars: Below and Beyond','2021-09-07','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Key Features Back to the Bases - Expand your colony into caves and lava tubes under the surface. Mine Your Own Business - Go below the surface and beyond the red planet to mine new resources. Branching Paths - The Recon and Expansion research trees unlock additional features for exploration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qx5.jpg'),(4467,'Hot Brass: Operator Edition',NULL,'Shooter, Tactical','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3s5m.jpg'),(4468,'Irrelevance V','2016-03-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore Neptune\'s moon Triton.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fi0.jpg'),(4469,'GSpot Master','2019-10-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a cool breezing morning, a strong, lean muscle young man, stand in front of the Yunu Clan ’s main gate. Although there is no one, he can tell there were many people just practiced and trained kung-Fu. All the training facilities are well prepared and fresh footprints on the training ground.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qzt.jpg'),(4470,'Kronii is Hungry','2022-01-24','Simulator, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kronii is Hungry is a fanmade visual novel featuring sixteen hololive members, in which you can interact with them, present them with items, take lessons to increase your status, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4td6.jpg'),(4471,'Dragonskulle','1985-12-25','Puzzle, Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX','Dragon Skulle is an action-adventure game for the Commodore 64 developed and published by Ultimate Play the Game in late 1985. It is a sequel to The Staff of Karnath, Entombed and Blackwyche, and the final title to feature the aristocrat adventurer, Sir Arthur Pendragon. The game was created by brothers Dave and Bob Thomas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pb9mbngf11pep4lfz0vm.jpg'),(4472,'The Witcher Battle Arena','2015-01-22','MOBA','Android, iOS','The Witcher Battle Arena is a spin off from the CD Project Red\'s Witcher series into the MOBA genre. There are 8 playable characters from the Witcher universe, fighting in short matches 3V3 (~10min).\n\nDesigned with mobile devices in mind, Battle Arena combines intuitive controls with skill-based strategies and fast-paced action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m0r.jpg'),(4473,'Wai-wai de Q: Dai-4-kai','1995-10-28','Quiz/Trivia','Satellaview','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4474,'Catale',NULL,'Strategy, Card & Board Game','Sin plataforma','Catale is a new type of card game with a mix of CCG and RogueLike. Use units strategically in the field, and attack enemies with spells to win. After opening the loot pack to get the card, make your own deck to face a more powerful enemy...!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lo9.jpg'),(4475,'Arthur and the Invisibles','2007-01-09','Platform','Game Boy Color, Nintendo DS','Directly inspired by world famous film director and writer Luc Besson\'s upcoming animated film of the same name, the Arthur and the Minimoys game will follow the film\'s storyline and feature eye-popping graphics and technical innovations.\n\nBy taking a very unique approach to its presentation of the Arthur universe and utilising the unique features of the DS hardware, the Nintendo DS version of Arthur and the Minimoys is a different kind of game to the versions for other consoles and PC. Arthur and the Minimoys for DS gleefully portrays the magical world of Arthur through a series of original and entertaining micro games and with an absorbing \'virtual pet simulator\' where players are responsible for caring for and breeding \'Mul mull\', small, fluffy, flying creatures found in abundance in the world of Arthur.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yqb.jpg'),(4476,'Chicken Boy\'s Counterattack','2024-03-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a bullet hell arcade game where you move to dodge bullets, rebound them, and eliminate Xiao Heizi to unlock more chicken boys. Keep fighting back against Xiao Heizi! Come on, show the dignity of Chicken Boy and say no to Xiao Heizi.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wa5.jpg'),(4477,'The Patrician','1992-12-31','Simulator, Strategy','Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','The Patrician is a trading simulator set in the middle ages, it\'s the first game in the Patrician series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69lk.jpg'),(4478,'Memory Island',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You accidently lost your memory. In order to get back those memories, you need to face powerful enemies, solve puzzles, and learn about the people and things about this island. Gradually find out who you really are and the origin of the Memory Island during the journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fsr.jpg'),(4479,'Zaxxon\'s Motherbase 2000','1995-07-14','Shooter, Racing','Sega 32X','This 32X-exclusive sci-fi shooter is similar gameplay-wise to Sega\'s arcade game Zaxxon. The graphics consist of a diagonally scrolling playfield which creates a pseudo 3D environment. The backgrounds are drawn using 2D scrolling planes, but the enemy and ship objects are drawn using 3D flat-shaded polygons.\n\nAlthough the basic goal of each of the 9 levels is to shoot everything without getting shot, the game has a strategic element. Your basic spacecraft has very little firepower, and can only sustain one hit. To make matters worse, there are very few power-ups. In order to survive, you have to jump on top of enemies and take control of their weapons systems. This system allows for a large variety of player-controllable ships.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zsi.jpg'),(4480,'Heartbeats',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4481,'Polaris Sector: Gold Edition',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cbw.jpg'),(4482,'Dragon Ball FighterZ: Vegito (SSGSS)','2018-05-31','Fighting','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','One of the most powerful fused characters, Vegito (SSGSS), enters the world of Dragon Ball FighterZ!\n\nThis content includes:\n- Vegito (SSGSS) as a new playable character\n- 5 alternative colors for his outfit\n- Vegito (SSGSS) Lobby Avatar\n- Vegito (SSGSS) Z Stamp','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vce.jpg'),(4483,'XF Extreme Formula','2024-06-11','Racing, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Race at the speed of sound and beyond in the great XF Extreme Formula championship!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73jk.jpg'),(4484,'Sword Art Online: Hollow Realization Collector\'s Edition','2016-11-08','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4','In Hollow Realization, players will assume the role of series protagonist Kirito as he enters an open-world named Ainground. The game is being produced in partnership with Reki Kawahara, the creator of the Sword Art Online series.\n\nHollow Realization will feature a brand new battle system, with a party of four players able to use sword skills and work together to chain attacks. New monsters will also be introduced in this game, and an online multiplayer mode has been confirmed. Characters Asuna, Leafa, Sinon, Lisbeth, and Silica will appear in the game.\n\nThe PlayStation 4 collector\'s edition of Sword Art Online: Hollow Realization for the Americas will include exclusive Kirito and Asuna figurines, each one standing at six inches tall. This collector\'s edition will also include a custom steelbook case, two-disc soundtrack, blu-ray bonus disc containing \"special contents\", mini-posters, decal sheets, art book, and a copy of the game.\n\nIn Europe, people who pick up the Sword Art Online: Hollow Realization Collector’s Edition will receive a PlayStation 4 copy of the game, 17cm (6.7”) tall Kirito and Asuna figures, and a collector box to store everything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zqg.jpg'),(4485,'Mr Farmboy',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','MR FARMBOY is a cute colony farming automation game. Plant, grow, harvest, raise animals, hire workers, gather, craft, automate, and build a beautiful farm for villagers to visit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9scw.jpg'),(4486,'McDroid','2016-03-01','Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A super frantic Arcade Tower Defense, McDROID starts gently then progressively challenges your trigger finger and your wits (and your sanity) as you multitask like a robotic-spider-doggy-thing: running, shooting, building base, herding, healing, harvesting, repairing, planting, upgrading, researching, frying giant snail-hammer-thing with a giant-tesla-on-your-back (it actually happens).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z35.jpg'),(4487,'Majin and the Forsaken Kingdom','2010-11-26','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','In Majin and the Forsaken Kingdom, a once thriving society is suddenly engulfed by a dark force that nearly eradicates all of its inhabitants. Many tried to reclaim their fallen homeland but were annihilated by strange warriors who rose from the darkness. A hundred years later, a cunning young outsider is drawn to this forsaken kingdom where he encounters and befriends Majin, a mysterious monster-like being with incredible strength. Now in an effort to restore the empire, the two set out to uncover Majin\'s forgotten past and the secrets that lie within the ancient land.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2chx.jpg'),(4488,'Boreal Tenebrae Act I: \"I Stand Before You, A Form Undone\"','2020-05-19','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Delve into the dream of a dying town in \'Boreal Tenebrae\', a retro-style adventure with horror elements.\n\nTaking cues from the fixed-camera angle games of the PS1 era, and the dream logic of works like \'Yume Nikki\', vignettes beget vignettes in this web of Trees and Streets.\n\nExplore the interweaving narratives of a northern community, cast adrift in an increasingly urbanized world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gmd.jpg'),(4489,'Wall-E: The Video Game - Slider',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95fa.jpg'),(4490,'Flaming Trails: Lost Ember','2025-12-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fsn.jpg'),(4491,'Supipara: Chapter 1','2016-07-29','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Spring has come, and our protagonist, Yukinari, returns home after 7 years. Between his second cousin Sakura, who meets him outside in a full maid outfit, Hotaru, a half-Japanese beauty with a sharp tongue, and the lazy scheming witch Alice - life just got way more interesting!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fta.jpg'),(4492,'Words of Yendor','2023-11-01','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A word puzzle roguelike set in a steamgoth world of amalgamated steam-age technology and antediluvian sorcery. Collect resources, solve dangerous situations and prepare for a showdown with each Master Villain to discover the meaning behind the Word of Yendor!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ipe.jpg'),(4493,'A New World: Kingdoms','2017-10-05','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A New World: Kingdoms is a turn-based strategic 4X game. You must carefully expand your kingdom by constructing buildings and managing your resources. But building your own empire is not easy; there will be challenges along the way, from mountains to navigate, to your rival and his army.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29dy.jpg'),(4494,'Badass Inc.',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Building on 2nd place in the 32nd Ludum Dare and made with nostalgic 30 somethings in mind, Badass Inc. is a point and click action game that will take you back. You\'re a contract killer; a sleek, stylish, feline predator that trades in scalps and briefcases full of cash. Your mission: eliminate a target for Ludum-Tek in an \"unconventional way\".\n\nPacking pixelart and a brooding soundtrack, Badass plunges you into a city wracked with desperation. Revel in the apathy of the protagonist as you work through situational puzzles, interspersed with cinematic action scenes and tense shootouts. It\'s an in and out job, take out the target and get paid, right?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ps6.jpg'),(4495,'Nightshade','2017-04-11','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','A romance visual novel game made in collaboration with D3P and Red Entertainment.Character design and illustrations are by the popular illustrator Teita. The romance revolves around Ninjas who have lived through the Sengoku Period.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gci.jpg'),(4496,'Sowon','2022-10-28','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the middle of the night, while finding her parents, a girl falls to the toy world through attic locked for a long time. Will it be possible for her to find her parents and go back to her world? Let\'s solve some puzzles and explore the mysterious toy world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pc3.jpg'),(4497,'Lovely Koala','1986-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','A game presumably made to cash in on a massive boom in popularity for koalas in 1980s Japan','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95gp.jpg'),(4498,'Street Fighter Alpha 3','2000-09-14','Fighting, Arcade','Dreamcast','The Dreamcast port of Street Fighter Alpha 3 uses all the added features from the PlayStation version but features a different World Tour mode. Guile, Evil Ryu and Shin Akuma are immediately selectable, although the latter still shares a slot with his regular counterpart and is playable via a special button combination. An online mode was added, allowing the player to display their high score. In addition, a Saikyo Dojo mode was added, which pits a character that the player has built up in World Tour mode against a very strong opponent who had to be downloaded from the Internet and changed every week.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6akr.jpg'),(4499,'Umurangi Generation VR','2024-04-18','Simulator','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2','Experience the award-winning creative sandbox photography game in VR!\n\nSet in Tauranga, Aotearoa off the back of an impending crisis, life is bleak for those living in the city. As a courier for the Tauranga Express who is also an avid photographer, you have the freedom to travel around the city to document the impending doom through the lense of your camera.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cvq.jpg'),(4500,'Void','2017-10-31','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Void is a visual novel themed around espionage and revenge. You play as Arthur Woods, a man seeking revenge from the death of his loved one, forging himself into a deadly assassin. Along the way, you will meet people who may (or may not) be your allies, as you try to untangle the web of lies and intrigue surrounding your girlfriends death.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2744.jpg'),(4501,'Moon Crystal','1992-09-28','Platform, Adventure','Family Computer','As Ricky Slater, the player must rescue Ricky\'s family and confront the evil forces of Count Crimson, who wields the powerful Moon Crystal! Owing much inspiration to Prince of Persia, this game boasts colorful graphics and vivid animations coupled with non-linear exploration and gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w5z.jpg'),(4502,'Beyond Pearl Harbor: Pacific Warriors','2000-10-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Imagine the classic Arcade game 1942 in 3D.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jzq222fbtcaetvmciamy.jpg'),(4503,'Cleo: A Pirate\'s Tale - Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c6r.jpg'),(4504,'LIP! Lewd Idol Project Vol. 3','2024-02-10','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kanako arrives on the scene! The third and last part in Lewd Idol Project’s story begins now. Join Kairi, Yuki, and Ranko as they try to find the last piece of the puzzle and make this tsundere rocker girl join the group and finally make their long awaited live debut! IT\'S TIME TO ROCK!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6d33.jpg'),(4505,'Independence Day','1997-07-01','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Independence Day is a combat flight simulator video game based on the 1996 film of the same name. The game was developed by Radical Entertainment, published by Fox Interactive and distributed by Electronic Arts for Microsoft Windows, PlayStation and Sega Saturn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2f2y.jpg'),(4506,'Hitman','2016-03-11','Shooter, Tactical, Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Become the Master Assassin in an intense spy-thriller story. As Agent 47, you perform contract hits on powerful, high-profile targets in exotic locations around the world. Gameplay focuses on taking out targets in huge and intricate sandbox levels with complete freedom of approach. Where to go, when to strike and who to kill – it is all up to you.\n\nHitman is an expanding and evolving world of assassination. The experience began with a Prologue and Paris location in March, continued with Episode 2: Sapienza in April, Episode 3: Marrakesh in May, the Summer Bonus Episode in July, Episode 4: Bangkok in August and Episode 5: Colorado in September. The season finale in Hokkaido, Japan arrived on October 31st.\n\nHITMAN also features a major live component, which is made up of Elusive Targets, Escalation Contracts, Community-inspired Challenge Packs and Contracts Mode.\n\nAn Elusive Target is the closest thing to the Hitman fantasy that we’ve ever created. These targets will be custom-created characters that are added to existing locations and are only there for a limited time in real-time. You’ll only have one chance to take them down. If they escape, they are gone for good. If you kill them, that’s the way that you killed them. There are no do-overs and no second chances. When an Elusive Target leaves the game world (one way or another) they never return.\n\nEscalation Mode is something else completely new for HITMAN and was created as a way to regularly provide a fresh challenge to players. You’ll need to master the location as well as the gameplay mechanics to complete a hit that will escalate in difficulty by adding new elements. This mode has a strong focus on having fun with the game mechanics and mixing them up. It’s more about being playful than realistic.\n\nContracts Mode returns from Hitman Absolution; Play-to-create, mark your own targets, choose how to kill them and compete against your friends. We will also pick the best of the bunch and put them in the Featured Contracts list so you’ve got something fresh to play whenever you load up the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fgr.jpg'),(4507,'Simulacrum','2022-07-05','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Swing through abstract dreams and blow through hordes of enemies at breakneck speed. A first person aerial movement shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5l7k.jpg'),(4508,'Skin Deep','2025-04-30','Music, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Skin Deep is an immersive first-person shooter. We got sneezing. We got things getting stuck in your feet. Stalk through a vast non-linear starship and sneak, subvert, and sabotage to survive in this stellar sandbox. You\'re outnumbered, outgunned, and have no shoes. Welcome to Skin Deep!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qg3.jpg'),(4509,'Legends of Ethernal','2020-10-30','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"Legends of Ethernal\" is a 2D single-player action adventure game where you need to explore beautiful hand-crafted environments, solve clever puzzles and battle tough creatures to uncover the truth about your parents’ disappearance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ipr.jpg'),(4510,'Macis',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Macis is a platform game focused on exploration. In this game, you control a young Chia in a search for her parents, who mysteriously disappeared when she was a child. Your main suspect? The one responsible for security in the city where she lives. Finding her parents seems like an impossible challenge, but alongside her team of bounty hunters, she is confident that she can finally find out what happened.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8evu.jpg'),(4511,'Brawler Friends',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4512,'Adspectabilis',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fuk.jpg'),(4513,'Path Of Balls',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Help a God recover his sacred balls! Capture them, solve puzzles and embark on a journey full of adventures, challenges and collections in a stylized world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ler.jpg'),(4514,'Terabout',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4515,'Sonic the Hedgehog 4 Remastered',NULL,'Platform','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4516,'Miasmata','2012-11-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Miasmata is a first-person survival/adventure game, developed from the ground-up by brothers Joe and Bob Johnson. You play as Robert Hughes, a plague-stricken scientist on a journey to discover a cure. Your adventure begins on the shores of a remote and mysterious island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1szx.jpg'),(4517,'Bleak Sword','2019-10-08','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','iOS, Mac','Bleak Sword is a dark fantasy action game tasking players to struggle across compact, cursed diorama battlefields. Through nine tense chapters, heroes must lift the curse of the legendary Bleak Sword by striking down all manner of creatures in every forest, swamp, castle, and dungeon on their journey. Invoke powerful magic, uncover helpful items, and level up your character to upgrade your stats before facing down menacing guardians. Once the curse has been lifted the challenging Arena Mode and thirty unlockable achievements await even the most accomplished warrior.\n\nBleak Sword is designed to be able to play it easily with elegant controls allowing heroes to roll, parry, attack and counter-attack using basic movements on gamepads and touch controls. Scored by award-winning composer Jim Guthrie with sound by famed designer Joonas Turner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a5c.jpg'),(4518,'Sonic World Remix',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4519,'Dying Light: The Beast','2025-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Dying Light: The Beast is a thrilling standalone zombie adventure set in a tightly-crafted rural region. Play as Kyle Crane, a legendary hero who breaks free after years of brutal experiments. Now, he must realize there’s more at stake than just revenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pey.jpg'),(4520,'X-Plane 11: FeelThere - TIST: St. Thomas International Airport',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','TIST public airport located west of the central business district on the island of St. Thomas. It is currently the largest international airport in the United States Virgin Islands and one of the busiest hubs in the eastern Caribbean, our favorite at FeelThere.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4521,'Disc Golf: Game On','2023-03-25','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The fun of disc golf, coming to PC and console. Featuring six different throw types, ten unique courses and tons of new plastic!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gwu.jpg'),(4522,'Terra Nil Prototype','2019-10-06','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Terra Nil is a reverse city builder about ecosystem reconstruction. This game was created by a small team for a game jam and is now regarded as the prototype version, distinguishable by its pixel art style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2f5x.jpg'),(4523,'Zoor: Majuu Tsukai Densetsu','1999-06-11','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo 64','A role-playing video game for the Nintendo 64. Battles take place in realtime and the player\'s party is built out of monsters they train.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wr2.jpg'),(4524,'EvilQuest','2012-04-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Why save the world when you can conquer it? In EvilQuest, take on the role of Galvis — a dark knight obsessed with ultimate power. Set out on a quest of revenge,destruction and conquest in this exciting retro Action RPG title. Along the way you’ll unlock ancient mysteries, discover legendary weapons, relics and magic…and of course kill thousands of those foolish enough to stand in your way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qfm.jpg'),(4525,'Sonic Battle Force',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4526,'Beast Mode',NULL,'Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4527,'Warhammer 40,000: Space Wolf - Wrath of the Damned','2018-12-20','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warhammer 40,000: Space Wolf is a card-driven turn-based tactical game which features RPG elements, containing a single player campaign, survival and PvP modes. Win these battles using the arsenal of weapons, abilities and cunning of the sky warriors. The Wrath of the Damned DLC includes a new PvE arena marking the next step in the evolution of the acclaimed The Fall of Kanak mode, new heroes, and a new set of cards for the main game and new achievements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99tw.jpg'),(4528,'Madness Below','2024-12-20','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Madness Below is a RPG dark fantasy horror game developed by Sif Kamira that began development in November 2024.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96yc.jpg'),(4529,'Ohr Oni','2012-12-26','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ohr Oni is an Ao Oni spinoff game created with the OHRRPGCE (Official Hamster Republic Role Playing Game Creation Engine), a program that was pretty popular in the late 90s/early 00s pre-RPG Maker years. It is made in the style of late-80s Famicom games like Sweet Home and MOTHER, so if you’ve ever wanted to be chased around by a very cute, chunky 8-bit Oni, then this is your chance. The game is veeeeerrrry short (for players on their second playthrough, it can be cleared in less than 15 minutes) and has two endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4btg.jpg'),(4530,'Geneforge 3','2005-03-28','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Geneforge 3 is the next, huge installment of the Geneforge saga. In this fantasy adventure, you can explore strange, hostile lands, choose which side you will fight for, and, as always, make your own horde of completely obedient mutant monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2177.jpg'),(4531,'Resident Evil 5','2009-03-12','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Resident Evil 5 is the seventh video game in the Resident Evil series. It features similar gameplay to Resident Evil 4 utilizing the same over the shoulder view, but this time the environment plays a significant role. The player is now dependent on his partner more than in older games. When the partner\'s health bar drop down to 0, he will enter the dying stage where the health bar will flash red and gradually lower as he stays like this. Resident Evil 5 also features new types of enemies called Majini and mostly are of African descent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vzi.jpg'),(4532,'Ace Combat 7: Skies Unknown - 25th Anniversary Edition','2022-05-26','Sin género','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','The Japan-exclusive 25th Anniversary Edition of Ace Combat 7: Skies Unknown includes the base game, the Original Aircraft Series, the Experimental Aircraft Series, and the Cutting-Edge Aircraft Series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7m73.jpg'),(4533,'2 Games in 1: SpongeBob SquarePants: Battle for Bikini Bottom + SpongeBob SquarePants: Supersponge',NULL,'Sin género','Game Boy Advance','A compilation of two SpongeBob SquarePants games on a single cartridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o4j.jpg'),(4534,'Dragon Snakes','2019-05-09','Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Classic and addictive gameplay reimagined with colorful dragons. Try to beat your high score or play against up to 4 friends on a single screen. Eat as many butterflies as you can and watch your dragon grow!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57ew.jpg'),(4535,'Total War: Warhammer II - The Shadow & The Blade','2019-12-12','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Shadow & The Blade is the latest Legendary Lords Pack for Total War: Warhammer II. Introducing Malus Darkblade and Deathmaster Snikch both with their own objectives, mechanics, units and playstyle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xvn.jpg'),(4536,'The Legend of Zelda: Mystery of Solarus XD','2011-04-01','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Link lost everything: memory, her equipment, and even worse, Princess Zelda. It\'s up to you to help him overcome this terrible ordeal! It is a complete game, which will make you laugh (hopefully) from beginning to end. It has two gigantic dungeons and its lifespan is estimated to be between 5 and 10 hours. Fortunately, the Forcetri is with you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bxf.jpg'),(4537,'Anicon: Animal Complex - Sheep\'s Path','2018-07-04','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Includes the Sheep\'s route.\n\nA romance, comedy, fantasy visual novel filled with adventures, misadventures, adorable animals, brother conflicts, circus cleaning, collecting puzzle pieces, and more — in one package!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lil.jpg'),(4538,'Megapolis','2016-06-15','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Construct beautiful and functional city zones with plenty of modern blocks and keep your residents happy by providing all services they need, and they will reward you with a tidy profit. You can work your way to the top in the comprehensive campaign mode or you can create and play your own custom scenarios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nsb.jpg'),(4539,'EVE burst error','1995-11-12','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series','An adult murder mystery/detective visual novel with 2 stories taking place at the same time. The point of view can be swapped between the main characters, a private detective hired to investigate some very suspicious pieces of art and a government agent assigned to protect the daughter of a Japanese embassy official stationed abroad, at any time to help solve the cases they are working on and interacting with each other at points to progress their stories.\n\nThe game was ported to Sega Saturn and that version was then ported to Windows, with changes to the games content in both instances, resulting in a 15+ rating.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1i1f.jpg'),(4540,'The Space-Eating Croc','2023-03-04','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Space-Eating Croc is a mystery adventure game influenced by classic horror RPG Maker games. Inspect your surroundings to find clues, and solve puzzles to progress.\n\nExplore the mysterious hotel by controlling a mysterious man and a suspicious hotelier. Face the dark truth hidden deep inside the metaphorical spaces within the hotel, and find the monster hidden in between the rifts of space.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u6h.jpg'),(4541,'Dragon Ball FighterZ: Android 17','2018-09-27','Fighting','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Don\'t be fooled by his ranger outfit and love for nature, Android 17 is one of the most powerful warriors of Universe 7, and he will prove it once again in DRAGON BALL FIGHTERZ.\n\nThis content includes:\n- Android 17 as a new playable character\n- 5 alternative colors for his outfit\n- Android 17 Lobby Avatar\n- Android 17 Z Stamp','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vcl.jpg'),(4542,'Geomancers',NULL,'Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Geomancers is a PVP card game turn-based shooter where you command powerful elemental magic from a wide array of spells of your own choosing to destroy and create terrain, manipulate your mana and spells, or even summon powerful creatures to fight by your side.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9873.jpg'),(4543,'Call of Duty: Infinite Warfare','2016-11-04','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Call of Duty: Infinite Warfare delivers three unique game modes: Campaign, Multiplayer, and Zombies. Campaign is a return to the gritty, military roots of the franchise, while boldly looking ahead, delivering a rich and engaging narrative that is unlike anything to date in a Call of Duty game. The player will embark on a classically-styled story about grand scale warfare, set in a future where human conflict has spread throughout our solar system.\n\nMultiplayer combines popular mechanics such as the chained-based movement system, with a load of gameplay innovations to deliver one of the deepest and most engaging online experiences in gaming. The new Zombies mode will thrill co-op players with an original, distinctive approach and an uproarious narrative sure to excite fans. The title introduces stunning, multi-planetary environments, new weaponry, and all-new player abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wkp.jpg'),(4544,'Meow TD: Endless Yarn',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A tower defense game where cats battle waves of yarn! Every five levels, you can choose an upgrade. Resources can be harvested from tougher yarn (rock) to enhance and expand your cat city. The game features a sandbox style with no definitive end - how far can you go?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fue.jpg'),(4545,'City of God I: Prison Empire','2017-03-06','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','City of God I: Prison Empire is a prison themed RPG simulation game. Build your prison freely and make prisoners work for you with maximum efficiency by providing all kinds of prison facilities. Build different kinds of workshops to keep your prisoners working hard and earning money from the market. Find the specially skilled prisoners from the government and police database, and make those people work in your prison. Work as the warden to unlock different projects. Time your selling at the right time at the market. Make more money to expand your prison empire and use money to influence politicians and gangs in the city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ajb.jpg'),(4546,'Quest Room','2022-10-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The main goal of the quest is to get out of the room, and for this you need to solve riddles and find hidden clues.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5oi4.jpg'),(4547,'TT Isle of Man: Ride on the Edge 2','2020-03-19','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Racing across an over 60 km long ultra-technical track at breakneck speed requiring realistic riding skills... that is the challenge that awaits in TT2!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20hk.jpg'),(4548,'Cyber Sweep',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Mines are randomly distributed. Find where they are by removing blocks. Beacons will guide you by showing how many adjacent Mines there are, if any. You win when all Mines have either been surrounded or have been removed. Be careful not hit a Mine!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dd8.jpg'),(4549,'Dragon Ball Z: Shin Budokai','2006-03-07','Fighting','PlayStation Portable','The wildly popular Dragon Ball Z series makes its first appearance on the PlayStation Portable with Dragon Ball Z: Shin Budokai. Play as the good guys or the bad guys in this high-energy fighting game. You can use flight and energy abilities, transformations, and counterattacks, as well as character-specific attacks featured in the Dragon Ball Z TV show. There are 18 playable characters and seven story modes to choose from. Challenge other gamers to multiplayer duels via the PSP Wi-Fi connection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x9j.jpg'),(4550,'Freakshow: Anniversary','2018-04-24','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Who doesn’t love the circus? Come play some circus game, Continue Michael’s story Or maybe see the circus freak! (Watch out, they bite!) Enjoy the Freakshow circus in all its glory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zxi.jpg'),(4551,'Bibi Blocksberg: Big Broom Race 3','2018-11-20','Racing, Simulator','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Take to the air! A wild witch rally begins: Bibi and her friends leap onto their broomsticks and explore exciting worlds. With mysterious witches\' potions and turbulent aerial maneuvers, they zoom through the age of the dinosaurs, the Orient, and Transylvania. Whizz-whizz, and off they go!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dvh.jpg'),(4552,'Metal Gear Solid: Integral','1999-06-24','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PocketStation, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Metal Gear Solid: Integral is an expanded version of the original game. It includes most of the changes and additions that were made in the NTSC-U/C version of the original Metal Gear Solid as well as new features and changes of its own, including a third disc consisting almost entirely of VR training missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e0f.jpg'),(4553,'Go Kart Mania: Deluxe Edition','2024-10-04','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4554,'Helldivers','2015-12-07','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','Helldivers is a topdown shooter set in a satirical dystopian future where mankind is ruled by a managed democracy. You are part of the Helldivers – the spearhead of humanity’s defense against the perpetual alien threat on Super Earth.\n\nWith up to four player co-op missions, working together as a team is vital, whether calling in strikes or placing weapons, each action must be totally synchronized to achieve the objectives. This isn’t just a four player co-op game; it’s a co-op game that relies on the global efforts of the entire Helldivers community!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mo3.jpg'),(4555,'Battle Fantasy','1994-05-15','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG)','Sega CD','Battle Fantasy (バトル ファンタジー) in Japan is a Sega Mega-CD fighting game that has a combination of RPG, vertical shooter, and fighting with a fantasy/anime style. There are ten available characters, each with their own animated backstory and fighting techniques. You must choose a hero and guide their stats to create a formidable fighter capable of taking down the Devil King and freeing the land.\n\nIn the Quest mode, you name your selected character and start at a lowly Level 1. The local town acts as a hub with opportunities for training, equipment purchases and rest. You can leave town and battle contenders for money in the fighting game. You can advance the story by taking quests from the town\'s guild, which are played in the vertical shooter game.\n\nThe fighting engine is further explored in two side modes - Tournament and Arena of Death. Tournament acts as a basic fighting game, allowing 1 or 2 players to progress through the ranks with the stock characters. No customization is available in this mode.\n\nArena of Death allows eight players to be created using the stock character templates. You assign attributes by shifting various bars between two extremes. You can then match these creations against each other and watch as the computer simulates a battle between them. The primary use of this mode appears to be testing various tactics against each other to decide how best to play your character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zvm.jpg'),(4556,'Eternal Maze','2017-09-11','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Find the map, find the monoliths, avoid the dogs and survive to escape from the mazes! Inspired by crop circles, Eternal Maze is a puzzle adventure game about a farmer who is trapped in corn mazes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pc6.jpg'),(4557,'Forza Horizon 4: Mitsubishi Motors Car Pack','2019-01-15','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Mitsubishi Motors Car Pack is a free downloadable car pack for Forza Horizon 4 released on January 15, 2019 with Update Five.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j6i.jpg'),(4558,'Ultraman Fighting Evolution 3','2004-12-02','Fighting','PlayStation 2','Ultraman Fighting Evolution 3 (ウルトラマン Fightingファイティング Evolutionエボリューション 3スリー Urutoraman Faitingu Eboryūshon Surī) also called \"Ultraman FE3\" is a Fighting game developed and published by Banpresto. it is the 3rd in the Ultraman Fighting Evolution series. The direction is provided by Yuji Machi, who acted as Ultraman Tiga\'s voice actor as well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yqo.jpg'),(4559,'Bob & Bernard Against the Nazis',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are Bob, a brave undercover agent. You are sent on a special mission in a faraway village, where you must find and neutralize a sinister Nazi gang. An exciting adventure, full of surprises and ridiculous situations is awaiting you! Can you complete the mission and save this odd village?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2si9.jpg'),(4560,'Paws: A Shelter 2 Game - Pitter Patter Edition',NULL,'Platform, Simulator, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dre.jpg'),(4561,'Rei: A Girl With Wings','2024-05-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','REI is a gliding action adventure game inspired by 『ICO』 and 『Portal』. Become a small but brave boy in a ruined world and fly while holding the hand of a winged girl. Jump through space and time with the necklace. Uncover the secrets of the abandoned laboratory and escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7w7k.jpg'),(4562,'Sonic: Haven Home World',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g6t.jpg'),(4563,'Go Kart Mania: Discovery Edition','2025-02-21','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4564,'Period Cube: Shackles of Amadeus','2017-04-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','An otome visual novel with RPG combat elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98l6.jpg'),(4565,'Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 3 - Collection 3: Chaos Pack','2012-09-13','Shooter, Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','With its third DLC Collection, Modern Warfare 3 drops a combat-heavy care package of Special Ops Chaos mode, 4 new Special Ops missions (Arctic Recon, Light \'Em Up, Special Delivery, and Vertigo), and 3 Face Off maps (Intersection, U-Turn, and Vortex) for the ultimate trifecta in solo and co-op gameplay. High-altitude Special Ops challenges put tactical skills to the test, with players navigating armed drones above a Russian destroyer and evading RPGs from the roof of a helicopter-swarmed hotel. Upping the ante further, Face Off firefights pit players head-to-head on a six-lane stretch of desert highway, at an abandoned crossroads near a New York overpass, and near the path of a violent tornado.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kfw.jpg'),(4566,'Nekojara Monogatari',NULL,'Sin género','Nintendo 3DS, Game Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6cjn.jpg'),(4567,'Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War','2004-09-20','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War is a revolutionary science fiction real-time strategy (RTS) game set in the violent, post-apocalyptic universe of the 41st Millennium. Utilizing the exceptional game design skills of Relic Entertainment, Dawn of War provides an immersive entertainment experience of epic proportions. Command hardened troops, deadly vehicles and high-tech weaponry with one goal in mind, the complete extermination of the opposition.\n\nWhether you lead Humanity\'s finest - the Space Marines, - the masters of mechanized warfare and billions-strong human army of the Imperial Guard, the diabolic and villainous traitors of man - the Chaos Space Marines, the brutal and savage beasts - the Orks, or the psychic and technologically advanced alien warriors - the Eldar, you control the action and the fate of your race!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wep.jpg'),(4568,'Neon Marble Rust','2023-10-11','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play as one of 3 Houses: Neon, Marble, or Rust! Each faction is completely unique: buildings, units, even resources are unique to each House. A two-state rollback system ensures smooth online gameplay, while a mix of challenging mechanics and automation allow you to play (and win) how you want!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s4m.jpg'),(4569,'Big Top',NULL,'Puzzle','Commodore C64/128/MAX','This is a prototype of a children\'s educational game that was done by James WickStead Design Associates. It was archived from JWDA graphics designer Robin Ballweg. According to to her, the game was never fully developed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8aqx.jpg'),(4570,'RealSports Football','1982-12-31','Sport, Arcade','Atari 2600','RealSports Football is a 1982 football video game made by Atari for the Atari 2600, Atari 5200 and Atari 8-bit computer platforms. RealSports Football presents a greatly simplified version of football for play. Players in the game cannot go out of bounds or fumble the football, and there are no penalties in the game. Also, touchdowns automatically score 7 points; there is no kicking for extra points.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qas.jpg'),(4571,'Blockman 1989','2020-04-30','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','In trying times like these, the world needs a hero!\n\nBlockman is back in an all new adventure! Return to the skies and take down a new threat and restore peace and order to the ski resort!\n\nBlockman 1989 is a direct sequel to the cult favorite, Blockman 1988. Play as John Q. Blockman - the \'Q\' stands for \'Qube\' - and take down a new terrorist threat that\'s cutting into his vacation. Buy upgrades and expand your arsenal, and get creative with your kills. Blockman 1989 is a platformer made for the retro enthusiast, with tight controls, and old-school game mechanics (with a modern twist).\n\nIn light of world news, Blockman 1989 will be free for all. I hope you enjoy playing Blockman 1989 as much as I did making it. <3 i3','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bw1.jpg'),(4572,'Jack and Casie Demake','2024-01-26','Puzzle, Strategy','Web browser','This is a mouse controlled real-time inventory management game, think of it as Attache Case from Resident Evil but things are happening at the same time as you\'re trying organize it.\n\nIt is a demake of the original game by Alex Sian aka Shoutscion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p36.jpg'),(4573,'Ginseng King','2019-11-15','Puzzle','Android, iOS','My boss hates me... my co-workers don’t recognize me… and ! \nAlways carrying resignation letter, my health is getting worse... \n \nI need some remedy food!!!!!!!! \n \nGinseng! How many did you try?!!!! \n \nSpecial Ginsengs are waiting for you..?! \nMove one nutrient in a puzzle to get many combo as possible! \n \nMy precious Ginseng, how old can you grow? \n \n▶ Say bye to good old puzzles~ \nSpiderweb, Ice, Rotten nutrients will hinder ginseng’s growth…! \nGet rid of them for your precious Ginsengs!! \n \n▶ HI, is this your first Ginseng? \nGinsengs out of this world!!! \nOnce you’ve taste it, you can’t get out it! \n \n▶ Play Ginseng King when you are tired~! \nFunny and cheerful ginsengs will bring you happiness!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mk6.jpg'),(4574,'Tron: Catalyst','2025-06-17','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','The Arq Grid stands on the brink of collapse. With your Identity Disc and Light Cycle, fight to escape by wielding the power of the Glitch loop. Electrifying action and a rich story combine in a new adventure set within Disney’s iconic TRON universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xqr.jpg'),(4575,'Kamifuda','2022-09-13','Strategy, Indie, Visual Novel, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Master the eldritch art of Kamifuda—channeling long dead powers within arcane cards—in this visual novel and deck builder game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hv1.jpg'),(4576,'Air Ball',NULL,'Arcade','Playdate','Arcade - keep the ball in the air! For Play date!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4577,'Windforge','2014-02-02','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','WindForge is a side-scrolling block-building game where you explore hostile skies in an ever-changing Steampunk world. Everything you see can be created or destroyed, creating an RPG without barriers that rewards creative problem solving and improvisation. Take off in fully customizable airships, and embark on a journey of discovery and survival that will take you to the heart of the world and beyond.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n98.jpg'),(4578,'Acalesia','2021-03-31','Platform','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Our attractive protagonist wishes for just two things — to save the princess and to become rich. Actually, he’s doing it just to get rich, but if the princess Celinda will be saved in the process, let’s consider it a nice bonus! To get all the treasures of Acalesia this hipster with a shotgun will have to fight hordes of monsters, sneak through a myriad of devious traps and reveal a few secrets of survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wyl.jpg'),(4579,'Amber Isle','2025-02-13','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Amber Isle - a quaint, friendly village of prehistoric residents who are in need of a new shopkeep... That’s you! Craft and sell items, upgrade your shop, befriend your Paleofolk neighbours and customise the island to bring the village back to life and welcome even more prehistoric pals!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bun.jpg'),(4580,'Q2 Humanity','2023-08-30','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','he smash hit game “Q REMASTERED”, which became extremely popular amongst users in Japan in early 2023, is now coming back! \"Q2 HUMANITY\" is finally available as Early Access! In \"Q2\" the sequel to \"Q1\" you can play as a character yourself. You can fly, jump, run, draw, grab, throw, and so on.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i8w.jpg'),(4581,'Squad 44','2018-08-09','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Formerly known as Post Scriptum, Squad 44 is the most authentic WW2 first-person shooter, featuring 20 large-scale battlefields, upwards of 80 realistic WW2 weapons, and over 50 true-to-life vehicles. You must prioritize communication, coordination, and teamwork to snatch victory from the jaws of defeat.\n\nExperience real WW2 campaigns, such as the liberation of the Netherlands and the Battle of Normandy. The war stretched across the farms, villages, and cities of Europe, and whether you’re jumping out of a plane, arriving by sea, or storming the battlefield in a tank, you’ll need to group up with your squad before taking on the enemy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jfx.jpg'),(4582,'Bad Bots','2013-05-17','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Bad Bots is a retro style platform shooter with intense robot blasting action and sci-fi story.\n\nIn Bad Bots you hack and blast your way through an onslaught of truly bad \'bots to find a way to prevent a potentially planet-destroying catastrophe.\n\nBad Bots stars Sam McRae, a grease mechanic aboard the \"Titan Hauler\" space cargo ship who wakes from cryogenic hypersleep to discover the ship\'s robotic crew has been reprogrammed to destroy humans. Even worse, the ship has been rerouted on an explosive collision course with Earth.\n\nYou can play either the Challenges Mode to see if you can survive sixty seconds in a room with an endless supply of robots or the story-based Campaign Mode that includes boss battles, puzzles and a compelling story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2phy.jpg'),(4583,'Myrddin','2011-02-15','Music, Puzzle','iOS','The classic handheld game, back in the palm of your hand. A faithful reproduction of the late-\'70s bestseller Merlin, with all six of the original games:\n• Tic-Tac-Toe\n• Music Machine\n• Echo\n• Blackjack 13\n• Magic Square\n• Mindbender','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4584,'Adventure Apes and the Mayan Mystery','2016-07-15','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Go Ape-bit with this fast-paced retro platformer, in which you work to recover a stolen magical artifact in the labyrinth of an ancient temple!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cmwg9cw2bipx6glq78ke.jpg'),(4585,'Fishlike','2024-08-23','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','High speed microgames involving fish, fishing, and fishlike activities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8k7k.jpg'),(4586,'Gyakuten Touhou 2','2009-08-15','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game is the second entry in the Gyakuten Touhou series. The game follows Aya Shameimaru as a defense attorney who investigates four cases. The gameplay is mostly the same as in the previous game, divided into two types of phases: investigations, where Aya searches the crime scene for evidence and talks to witnesses, and rebuttals to learn new information. During the courtroom sections, Aya defends their client and cross-examines the witnesses\'s testimonies using the evidence found during the investigations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47d8.jpg'),(4587,'Mind Over Mushroom','2018-07-17','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mind Over Mushroom is a turn-based, tactical strategy game featuring a free-form movement system and over a dozen unlockable character types. Fight your way through 25+ challenging battles set in a variety of diverse locations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hdsfkpcokxfubtbu3wbh.jpg'),(4588,'Chill Fishing','2025-04-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fish, upgrade, relax! Cast your hook, explore the depths, catch unique fish, and discover rare species. Upgrade your gear, unlock new biomes, and progress at your own pace in a simple, relaxing fishing experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lmj.jpg'),(4589,'Alzara: Radiant Echoes',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Restore peace to a world torn apart in this 3D turn-based RPG inspired by Japanese classics. Combine the elements to unleash spectacular attacks, solve magical puzzles, and bring the world together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87as.jpg'),(4590,'The Far Kingdoms: Spooky Mosiacs','2018-01-22','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You need to prepare your Kingdom for a spooky celebration. Solve puzzles to find gold coins and buy decorations. Solve all the puzzles and find the missing Dracula costume for the Elven Prince.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lpj.jpg'),(4591,'American Bass Challenge','2001-12-05','Sport','Game Boy Advance','Hook up with the biggest bass in this ultimate rod n\' reel challenge. The most thrilling fishing experience you\'ll get on 32 bits!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mwcdzxtspz496m3l7ycw.jpg'),(4592,'Mega Man at the Tokyo Olympics 2',NULL,'Shooter, Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4593,'Paradise Lost','2004-01-16','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Paradise Lost takes off in a dystopian setting that comes off as much more blatantly dark than its successors’. The stage is in a city known only as Sodom, which is separated from the outside world known as “Zoar”. Ruled by the gang known as the Infinite Viper, the law of “the strong eat the weak” is rampant throughout Sodom to the point that if you’ve lived beyond the age of 20, you most likely have murdered someone in order to do so. It is widely believed that outside lies a peaceful world free of the everyday violence so frequently seen in Sodom, but there is a closely guarded Gate that prevents residents of Sodom from leaving so no one has actually left and returned to confirm.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4594,'Formula 1 98','1998-11-30','Racing','PlayStation','Psygnosis hits back with Formula 1 98 not only providing a new game engine and features but also developer Visual Science. Formula 1 98 also sports a real 1998 FIA licences insuring real tracks, cars, racers, teams, more detailed statistics and other F1 lifelike aspects.\n\nVisually Visual Science have managed to tweak field depth and reduce pop up while providing the same detailed, fast visuals the first two were known for. Players also witness the action from a new cockpit view with realistic driver head animation and new particle effects have been added to heighten realism and crash effects. Also check out startling commentary now not only with famous English commentators but also other languages provide real commentators, certainly a good option for those who prefer non-English commentary.\n\nCars are also modelled upon 1998 versions with greater attention to detail and advertising while all tracks have been greatly improved likewise. The Interface now features a track map in arcade mode while existing car dynamics and control have been tweaked in simulation mode to appear more realistic than ever. Formula 1 98\'s new pit features have also been added including animated pit crew, penalties and Wipeout style pit stops in arcade mode. Psygnosis have also incorporated a new arcade challenge mode while many of the game\'s existing features such as modes, options and general features have been retained.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lpwjihy8w82pmu72zht8.jpg'),(4595,'Fohh','2024-05-16','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a mysterious world with a mysterious magical companion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ais.jpg'),(4596,'Warshmallows','2022-01-06','Shooter, Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Battle online in a captivating four-player arena shooter with endless amounts of fun, Warshmallows! Take control of your favorite Warshmallow and hop, dash, loot and shoot to be the last one standing. Twist the time with automated bullet time, survive the chaotic catastrophes and collect the donuts!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s1h.jpg'),(4597,'Fat Orc Life Simulator',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96se.jpg'),(4598,'Sokobundle','2024-12-27','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Come have fun with this challenging puzzle bundle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eeo.jpg'),(4599,'Youkoso Jitsuryoku Shijoushugi no Kyoushitu he: Merge Puzzle Tokubetsu Shiken','2024-02-01','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Experience the story of the \"Yomi\" anime with the easy-to-use and addictive \"Merge Puzzle\"!\nThere are no difficult operations to advance the game! Combine various objects and clear the mission!\nThe side scenario also features a behind-the-scenes story that is not depicted in the anime!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fs9.jpg'),(4600,'101-in-1 Megamix','2010-09-22','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation Portable','101-in-1 Megamix is a collection of 101 games offering a healthy serving of adventure, action and puzzle gameplay galore that is fun for all family. Featuring 101 games that take you from the depth of the ocean to the Wild West... From the Stone Age to space racing... 101-in-1 Megamix boasts a unique visual style, a wide variety of unlockable games and prizes, and superb multiplayer action. Come channel surfin\' through 8 different TV stations and play through a series of zany TV shows tailored to all sorts of themes, each packed to the brim with insane adventures and delightful challenges!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70ok.jpg'),(4601,'Amigo: Kebab Simulator','2023-04-03','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Friend! I need your help to run my Kebab business, take care of placing the orders, keep the place clean, serve customers properly, try to have positive reviews, improve the place And, beware those of health!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b78.jpg'),(4602,'Bug Butcher','2022-06-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bug butcher is a roguelite action game with random locations, dynamic gameplay and tons of bugs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5c7x.jpg'),(4603,'Stay Silent','2019-06-21','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Stay Silent is a western-themed multiplayer online FPS game for virtual reality (VR). You will become the sheriff of an American town in the Wild West of the 1880s. Fight against stealthy bandits and brutal aliens on dark, silent nights using traditional firearms and powerful alien weapons!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co422t.jpg'),(4604,'Save Room: Organization Game','2022-04-28','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','When you enter a save room you know you are safe, no danger can come to you, you can relax. Take advantage of this short period of time to organize your inventory, heal your wounds and reload your weapons. Can you make all the items fit in your inventory?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ft6.jpg'),(4605,'Bomberman Collection','1996-07-21','Arcade','Game Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d85.jpg'),(4606,'Cards and Guns','2024-05-02','Shooter, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cards and Guns is a top-down arena shooter roguelite, where you’ll have to defeat hordes of creatures. Choose from a variety of cards and upgrades to create unique builds and survive to the end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bvu.jpg'),(4607,'Sonic Lost Adventure',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4608,'Puzzle Boys','1990-12-16','Puzzle','Family Computer Disk System','Puzzle Boys is the second game in the Puzzle Boy series of 5 games. The first game is the most well known, released as Kwirk on the GameBoy in North America. This is Atlus’s only FDS game, and a late one at that, as the FDS was pratically dead by the time the GameBoy came out. This game improves on Kwirk by adding color, a really fun two player on the same screen mode with the ability to handicap the better player, and way more puzzles in Puzzle Challenge Mode, 80 vs. Kwirk’s 30.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2izm.jpg'),(4609,'Storage Hunter Simulator','2024-10-10','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bid, win and then sell for profit as you work your way up from the bottom to become the king or queen of the storage auction. Take risks and fight for garages amongst fierce competition as you compete with other bidders to find hidden treasures that will help you turn a profit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8v3f.jpg'),(4610,'Ricochet Lost Worlds: Recharged','2004-10-01','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The award-winning game play of Ricochet Lost Worlds is back! From the talented minds of designers all over the world comes the most dynamic brick-busting experience ever! This wild and warped game has you smashing your way through over 350 beautiful and exhilarating rounds that are truly the best of the best. With its gorgeous artwork and innovative \"Ring Game\", you need to download it today. Rejuvenated, Reloaded...RECHARGED!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a8m.jpg'),(4611,'Mega Monster Party','2021-10-22','Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mega Monster Party is a classic multiplayer board game and minigame collection by AirConsole, perfect for passing time and ending friendships!\nPlayers use their smartphones as gamepads to control one of eight monstrous characters and conquer the board.\n\nChoose paths wisely, use secret items to gain advantage and stock up on coins by winning PvP minigames. Once you have the funds, find the Board Master and trade coins for monster minions to get ready for the multiplayer final battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3r38.jpg'),(4612,'One Last Breath','2024-03-28','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A 2,5D adventure set in a world in which almost no life is left you will play as Gaia, a being born from nature\'s last wish with power to influence the surrounding nature in order to face a dark world while being chased by strange creatures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mjq.jpg'),(4613,'OASE: Other Age Second Encounter','2010-09-16','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','OASE - Other Age Second Encounter is a game with elements of adventure, dating sim, and visual novel. In OASE, you control Prince of Zeiva Empire in his quest to date a girl using a machine called Luv Luv Nitarou Dynamite. With it you can summon girls from any place, time or space. Follow stories of different characters and collect as many ending as you can!\n\nOASE has a total of 10 summonable girls, 200+ illustrations, and 55 endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q9z.jpg'),(4614,'Witchaven I & II Bundle',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hqy.jpg'),(4615,'Super Melee Adventure 64',NULL,'Platform, Adventure','Nintendo 64','Super Melee Adventure 64 is a ROM hack/mod of Super Mario 64 based on the Adventure Mode from Super Smash Bros. Melee. There are different versions of the mod to play, choosing from Mario, Captain Falcon, Fox McCloud, Ness and Luigi, and they each have different characteristics that make the game a different experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wqy.jpg'),(4616,'Nerf Legends','2021-11-19','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','NERF Legends thrusts you into a futuristic, sci-fi world where you\'ll come face-to-face with legions of robot enemies and ultimate boss masters. Armed with a wide array of NERF blasters based on their iconic, real-world counterparts, you\'ll thwart formidable enemies while being challenged to pull off the most impressive high-flying trick shots across a series of unique and immersive environments. Are your NERF skills up to the challenge to become the ultimate NERF Legend?\n\nExtreme Games Meet NERF set in out-of-this world locations such as Fortress Siege, Jungle Trouble, ragnarok, and Spaceport Blastoff.\n\n15 Authentic NERF Blasters across the Mega, Ultra and Elite lines. Plus upgradable perks and skins to customize your blaster.\n\n19 Single player levels with tournament courses.\n\n4 vs 4, 8 player free for all with online multiplayer modes.\n\nCollect dart powerups such as magnetic push and pull, seeker darts and freeze to change the tide of battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i03.jpg'),(4617,'Amy to Yobanaide','1995-08-11','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series, PC (Microsoft Windows), FM Towns','Amy to Yobanaide follows the story of a high school girl named Emi who has fallen in love with her younger step-brother, Tomomi. On her eighteenth birthday, she decides to confess her feelings to him. However, their lives take an unexpected turn when debt collectors seize all of her father\'s possessions, and Tomomi mysteriously disappears. Determined to find him and share her feelings, Emi takes on a quest to locate her step-brother.\n\nAs she searches for Tomomi, Emi discovers an alternate personality within herself named Amy. While Emi is shy and modest, Amy is driven by a desire to fulfill her deepest fantasies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lz3.jpg'),(4618,'Reporter 2',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','The continuation of the popular action-horror game - \"Reporter\" from \"AGaming+\" studio, will shock you to the core! Turn off the lights, connect headphones and be careful, because only the attentive and cautious person can finally unravel this dark history!\nYou somehow miraculously survived in the hospital! Do you think it is over? And what about that strange call about 7 days? The time is running out! Carefree dreams are left behind: now you are hostage of nightmares and wake up in a cold sweat every morning. And nightmares are becoming more realistic and eerie every day. That\'s why you are trying to find out something about that mysterious girl, who is following you in nightmares. One of your friends found out something interesting and you need to start your action, immediately! It\'s time to go!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4619,'Renai Karichaimashita: Koikari - Love For Hire','2021-10-22','Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Due to family circumstances, Yuki has only one belief: money will make his little sister happy. And thus, he works part-time jobs late into the night. His plan is to start working full-time after graduation, but his little sister tells him that if he won\'t go to university, then she won\'t either.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47jb.jpg'),(4620,'Cynthia: Hidden in the Moonshadow - Special Edition','2024-06-16','Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Emotional, 3rd-person, story-driven, adventure game focused on solving puzzles and using stealth mechanics. Use your bow to interact with environmental elements. Sneak, climb or distract guards to move further unnoticed. Solve light puzzles alongside your path to rescue your loved one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dqk.jpg'),(4621,'Sacred 2: Ice and Blood','2009-10-02','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Expanding the world of Ancaria, Ice & Blood features two new regions, a new playable character and tons of new items, enemy’s, weapons and missions.\n\nKey features:\n2 New Regions - The blood soaked Cursed Forest and the arctic Crystal Region.\nNew Enemies, Items and End Bosses.\nOver 30 hours of additional game play.\nConfigure and develop one of seven characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ynx.jpg'),(4622,'Shall we date?: Can\'t Say No','2013-12-02','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Can\'t Say No is an interactive romance novel game developed and published by NTT Solmare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rcw.jpg'),(4623,'King & Balloon','1980-10-31','Shooter','Arcade, MSX','Released by Namco in the summer of 1980, King & Balloon is a shoot em up in the vein of Galaxian, but trades the outer space theme for pseudo-medieval setting. In the game, the player controls two green men who carry a cannon, as they defend the king below them from getting abducted by the balloons above, which keep invading the lower part of the screen while also shooting projectiles. Once all the balloons are shot down, the game moves on to the next level.\n\nOne thing that makes King & Balloon unique is that you don\'t lose a life when hit. Rather, you respawn and keep on playing. The only way to lose a life is letting the king get abducted. Another interesting mechanic of note is that the balloons stop attacking and descending when one grabs ahold of the king, and they will keep still until the king is back on the ground. This creates a risk versus reward mechanic and entices you to let the balloon carry the king high enough so you can take out more balloons, then rescuing the king just in time.\n\nKing & Balloon was also one of the first games to have speech, and it still holds up better than most contemporary or even later examples. The king says \"Help!\" when abducted, \"Thank You!\" when rescued, and \"Bye bye!\" when he leaves the screen. There are actually different voices for the game in Japan and the US version, with the Japan version having a slight Japanese accent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/guf3mn3c3hf6asnwzqc5.jpg'),(4624,'Hiss',NULL,'Arcade','Playdate','A twist on an old classic.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4625,'Waternet','2023-01-05','Puzzle','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Playdate','Playdate version of Waternet, which is a multiplatform water pipe puzzle game written for old consoles and handhelds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6180.jpg'),(4626,'Train Game',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4627,'A Story About Farting','2024-04-22','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The most beautiful story in the world of games! An innovative clicker where you fart and burp your way through earning achievements! Visit Old Mushroom\'s hut, welcome Fatty and feed him until he explodes! Fart, burp and have a great time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fnx.jpg'),(4628,'Northern Tale','2016-02-09','Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A beautiful legend filled with magic, bravery and amazing adventures!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21ee.jpg'),(4629,'Cyborg3003','2023-11-06','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','6-player co-op survival horror at its finest with cyborgs, monsters, and aliens.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7g4p.jpg'),(4630,'To the Moon and Beyond','2020-09-11','Card & Board Game','Android, iOS, Xbox One','In this single player card based game, you get to manage and build up your own space program. Your goal is to build all 8 mission critical objectives to safely send humans to the Moon and establish a permanent Moon habitat. You do this by determining what research to fund on the space station and what projects you want to fund back on Earth. Conducting research on the space station can reduce the cost of some projects or give you the ability to fund others. Results from the projects you fund determine your budget for the next year and get you closer to building your very own custom Rocket, Space Suit, Lunar Space Station, Moon Habitat, and more. Everything you do affects the outcome of your eight part program. But beware, events can happen that can influence that outcome. Will you be able to complete all of your eight mission objectives in four short years?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4u2d.jpg'),(4631,'Jurassic World Evolution 2: Dominion Biosyn Expansion','2022-06-14','Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The biggest DLC yet for Jurassic World Evolution 2 features a new campaign inspired by events from Jurassic World Dominion, including all-new prehistoric species, feathered dinosaurs, a new Chaos Theory scenario, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v57.jpg'),(4632,'I Want to Go for a Walk','2024-07-31','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','I like going for walks.\n\nI use them to sort through my thoughts, to try to make sense of them, but lately that hasn\'t seemed to help as much.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p8a.jpg'),(4633,'Mario Golf: Advance Tour','2004-07-08','Role-playing (RPG), Sport','Wii U, Game Boy Advance','Grab your clubs and start down the road to golfing perfection in this role-playing golf adventure! Chat up the locals at golf clinics, hone your skills in challenges like Club Slots and Go-Go Gates, and try to become the champ of all the country clubs! The Mushroom Kingdom residents take on only the very best.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2204.jpg'),(4634,'Cosmos Bit','2022-03-11','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Cosmos Bit is an old school metroidvania that will take you in an extraterrestrial world painted with the legendary Amstrad CPC\'s colour palette, reworked for modern devices. The game is enjoyable for both veterans and newbies of this genre!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co492b.jpg'),(4635,'Uta no Prince-sama: Amazing Aria & Sweet Serenade Love','2017-10-19','Music, Simulator, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Bundle of both fandiscs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t6v.jpg'),(4636,'Dragon Ball: Xenoverse 2 - Super Pack 3','2017-04-25','Adventure','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Get your hands on new super content, including powerful characters from \"Future Trunks\" arc of DRAGON BALL SUPER!\n• 3 Additional Characters (Goku Black Rosé, Zamasu, Bojack)\n• 3 New Parallel Quests\n• 5 Additional Skills\n• 4 Additional Costumes\n• 5 Super Souls\n• 2 Emotes\n• Bojack as a Master','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52kc.jpg'),(4637,'Climber Animals: Together','2024-03-22','Platform, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Climber Animals is a challenging and dynamic parkour game for 1-8 players. In this game,overcome obstacles and climb to the top with your friends. If you fall, your progress is lost and you start over. Keep your balance on this challenging climb and compete with your friends to reach the top.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zjk.jpg'),(4638,'BlockStar VR','2024-04-22','Sport, Adventure','SteamVR','BlockStar is a VR shooter where you put your reflexes to the test shooting cubes and completing challenges in an action-packed futuristic tournament. Play the 40-mission story mode and show that you have what it takes to become a filthy-rich champion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bqi.jpg'),(4639,'Shera and the 40 Thieves','2021-10-01','Platform, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Entertainment System','A NES Puzzle Platformer from Crazygrouptrio, more commonly known for their Game music arrangements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30vd.jpg'),(4640,'Master of Orion 1+2',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dzs.jpg'),(4641,'Dungeon Siege II','2011-04-08','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It’s been a generation since you vanquished the evil that plagued the Land of Ehb, and now…a new menace has awakened. In Dungeon Siege II, the sequel to the best-selling RPG from Gas Powered Games, you will be called on to again wield sword and spell to save the world from a growing abomination many years in the making.\nA thousand years ago, the crusaders of Azunai crossed swords with the legions of Zaramoth in the final battle of a century-long rebellion. As the tyrannical god Zaramoth struck the final blow through Azunai’s trembling shield, the earth shook. In that moment, the forces of magic were unchained, and both armies were consumed in a brilliant cataclysm that stretched for leagues across the Plain of Tears. Only a scarred wasteland remained as final testament to the First Age of Man.\nAnd for a millennium, magic has continued to spread to the farthest corners of the world, freely flowing to any who would command it. But the tide of magic has begun to wane, heeding instead the call of an ancient legacy. From the Plain of Tears a new heir beckons, and with each day his strength grows. Consuming those who submit, eradicating those who resist. With none to oppose his ascendance, the circle will be complete, and an ancient age will begin anew.\nWhat fate will befall the Second Age of Man? The time for judgment is nigh.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2347.jpg'),(4642,'Alfred Hitchcock’s Psycho Adventure Game','2022-09-07','Point-and-click, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Alfred Hitchcock’s Psycho Adventure Game is a classic point and click game.\n\nThis game created by one single person is a short \"9 verbs\" point & click adaptation in pixel art inspired by the classic Alfred Hitchcock\'s Psycho movie. It reinterprets the iconic scene of the film.\n\nIt follows the scenario of the original movie adding some new features...\n\nYou have to resolve some puzzles to progress in the game. Talk with characters, interact with your environment, use your collected item...to unlock the next challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yo6.jpg'),(4643,'Life in Willowdale: Farm Adventures','2022-10-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Willowdale, your life of farming and adventure starts here!\nThe once thriving town of Willowdale is in ruins! The mayor’s business minded daughter Penny has seized the opportunity to transport this once pleasant place into a high-flying modern tourist destination. She doesn’t really like animals and thinks keeping livestock is dirty especially when you can import all these products easily from a nearby town. With humans and nature so out of balance… some of the animals felt abandoned and have already left. Is it too late to stop the changes set in motion by her?\n\nYour uncle, mayor Moneybags calls for your help. Return to your family’s farm to help restore harmony between the people and nature! It is time to light the way for the lost people of the town by reigniting their passion and helping them appreciate the beauty of Willowdale!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4aqg.jpg'),(4644,'Ururun Quest: Koiyuuki','2005-07-28','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','Ururun Quest - Koiyuuki is a fully voiced Japanese PS2 videogame classified as an \'Onna no Ko Senyou (Girl-targeted) Love Simulation+RPG\' by its developer. It was released in 2005 and marketed as the first \'RPG targeted towards girls\'. The player acts as the main character, Ruri, while she adventures around her world with her friends and finding new companions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j91.jpg'),(4645,'Despelote','2025-05-01','Sport, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Despelote is a soccer game about people. Get immersed in the streets and parks of Quito through the eyes and ears of eight year old Julián. Dribble, pass and shoot your soccer ball around town, and see what happens when you kick it someone\'s way. Feel the city change as Ecuador comes closer than ever to qualifying for the World Cup.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s7h.jpg'),(4646,'Hyperspacer','2024-06-03','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Travel through space in your own spaceship, land on planets and moons, learn about local history, perform various tasks, collect scientific data, gather minerals, acquire better equipment, upgrade your ship, advance your skills, and delve into the main storyline.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fw5.jpg'),(4647,'Bloodwood Reload','2015-11-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a small village in central Europe something is happening, the forest growing around has something different. Its wood is red color, unique in the world. This does not pass unnoticed to the world\'s largest logging company, the White Wood Company','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7aw5.jpg'),(4648,'Monsters\' Den: Book of Dread','2016-07-19','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter the Monsters\' Den, a place of endless adventure, battle and reward! Lead your party of four heroes through each level of the ever-changing dungeon, fighting in turn-based battles and hunting for that elusive rare loot. The web-game classic comes to Steam!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p45.jpg'),(4649,'Disappearance: Takeshi. You were right. That Abandoned Village is Too Bad','2024-01-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shissou: Takeshi Omae no Iu Toori datta Ano Haison ha Yaba sugiru is a first-person horror comedy game that explores an abandoned village in Japan to find your lost best friend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nfw.jpg'),(4650,'Cubiquity',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vtd.jpg'),(4651,'The Barkless Doctrine','2023-06-06','Adventure','Playdate','The Barkless Doctrine is an interactive comedy novel; a book in which you navigate the complex geopolitical tomfoolery that gets thrown at you. Will you accept Kitty’s invitation to a daring mission? Will you be rude to people, or only kind of rude? Green or red salsa? Choose wisely, for the fate of the free world is in your goofball hands!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jwg.jpg'),(4652,'Bind: Brain teaser puzzle game',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4653,'Hockey General Manager',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4654,'Memento Vivere','2021-04-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dekar is a noble warrior who has a estranged relationship with his father. After abandoning his rights to the throne and choosing to live a simple life, everything changes for him when a Winged One crashes into his village asking for his help. The fate of the world now lies on his shoulders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nsw.jpg'),(4655,'Clock Faces',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4656,'Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine','2017-09-21','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','In Warhammer 40,000 Space Marine you are Captain Titus, a Space Marine of the Ultramarines chapter and a seasoned veteran of countless battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tx9.jpg'),(4657,'Iron Sea Defenders','2017-06-13','Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One','Man the guns. The enemy fleet is on the horizon. Defend your fort from attacks - show your tactical skill.\n\nBuild cannons, save money, destroy the enemy with the help of secret weaponry and keep your wits about you, because your enemy never sleeps. This unique historical setting will allow you to immerse yourself in an atmosphere of real and uncompromising battle. Varied enemies, powerful cannons and secret weaponry which will drive your enemy to despair all of this in a new Tower Defense game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30ez.jpg'),(4658,'Orwell: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4659,'Perennial Order','2024-09-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac','Perennial Order is an atmospheric One-Hit-Death Boss Rush, set in a verdant Dark Age world. Explore a lore-filled and eldritch land alone or with a friend. Slay nature-infested horrors, creatures, and titans, all in a painterly 2D style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3v9e.jpg'),(4660,'Waku-waku Sonic Patrol Car','1991-12-31','Arcade','Arcade','Waku Waku Sonic Patrol Car is a children ride released on December 1991 exclusively in Japan. The arcade ride is part of Sega\'s \"Wakuwaku\" line and features Sonic the Hedgehog playing the role of a police officer, patrolling the streets of a city and keeping it safe from Dr. Eggman. Both Japanese and English versions of the ride exists, though the English version was not exported to other countries and was likely used in areas with a large number of visiting English speaking tourists.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zsr.jpg'),(4661,'Shin Sedai Robot Senki - Brave Saga','1998-12-17','Sin género','PlayStation','Shin Sedai Robot Senki - Brave Saga is a tactical RPG published by Takara. It is based on the \"Yuusha\" (Brave) franchise of anime and toys.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fje.jpg'),(4662,'Resident Evil: Containment','2023-09-28','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Resident Evil - Containment, is a new stand alone total conversion mod for the original 1996 release of Resident Evil. It follows the story of Ghost, a member of the Umbrella Security Service, who were sent into the Arklay Research Facility to investigate a distress call. This mod takes place shortly before the events of Resident Evil 0 and Resident Evil.\n\nThe mod features a whole new story that loosely fits within the original Resident Evil time-line as well as many brand new locations, some of these new locations are based off the scrapped prototype concept art for Resident Evil and others are all brand new original creations. It also contains new cutscenes, new puzzles, new events, new music, new sounds, new FMV movies and also new gameplay features never before seen in Resident Evil!\n\nExperience the world of survival horror one more time in this brand new, complete, stand-alone, total conversion mod for Resident Evil!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77wj.jpg'),(4663,'Minako: Beloved Wife in the Countryside','2024-04-19','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Happily married couple Minako and Tatsurou trade the busy life in Tokyo for a nice, long vacation in the countryside. Visiting her husband’s hometown for the first time in her life, Minako soon finds herself charmed by nature’s beauty and the villager’s hospitality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80yp.jpg'),(4664,'Pac-Man Mega Tunnel Battle: Chomp Champs','2024-05-09','Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Pac-Man Mega Tunnel Battle: Chomp Champs is an online-only Pac-Man eating competition! Eat your way through multiple interconnected mazes using Power Pellets and a variety of Power Items to chomp the Ghosts and opponent PAC-MAN players! Be the last Pac standing at the end of each match in this 64-player Battle Royale to be the Chomp Champ!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77pa.jpg'),(4665,'Penalty Shoot-Out Soccer: 2010 World Champion','2010-06-21','Sin género','iOS','Are you crazy about World Cup ? Are you a soccer enthusiast ? Now you will be able to experience a different soccer!! Penalty Shoot-Out Soccer: 2010 World Champion will bring you different experience of Soccer! Choose a country you like to play against other 31 countries and you can defeat them by penalty kick. Win the World Champion for yourself or for the country you like! No more hesitation! Simple control will greatly improve your penalty kick skills! Endless fun!!!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4666,'Steins;Gate: Divergencies Assort','2019-03-20','Adventure, Visual Novel','Nintendo Switch','Steins;Gate: Divergencies Assort includes three Steins;Gate series in one collection: Steins;Gate 0, Steins;Gate: Hiyoku Renri no Darling, and Steins;Gate Senkei Kousoku no Phenogram.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jnr.jpg'),(4667,'Tekken Tag Tournament','2000-10-26','Fighting','PlayStation 2','Has a huge upgrade to the graphics, and even adds in stages and music that weren’t in the original.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84rb.jpg'),(4668,'Gradually Jojo ni','2023-03-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game where you play as a runner who is rushing to the goal. As you constantly speed up towards your goals, you may wonder to yourself, ‘what am I missing along my path?’ Slow down by pressing the button and you may see something you didn’t realize was there. Enjoy the environment and have a rest with simple interactions. Remember, the goal will always be there, and you can take your time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hi7.jpg'),(4669,'Games for Stream!','2023-09-29','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An exhilarating chat interactive game, where the chat becomes your co-pilot, shaping the course of the game in real-time. Engage with your favorite streamers and viewers like never before as you type commands, make choices, and influence the game\'s outcomes directly through chat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75ff.jpg'),(4670,'Gunforce','1991-04-01','Shooter, Platform','Arcade, Super Nintendo Entertainment System','GunForce: Battle Fire Engulfed Terror Island or simply titled as GunForce, is a side-scrolling action shooting game produced by Irem for the arcades in 1991. The game was later ported by Bits Studios and published by Irem to the Super Famicom exclusively in Japan in 1992.\n\nOutside of Japan, it later received a sequel titled GunForce II, originally known in Japan as Geo Storm.\n\nThe player is armed with a gun that fires rapid-fire bullets. Each direction it shoots can be fixed toward it so the player doesn\'t have to hold the joystick toward it. Players may find motorcycles to speed across enemy territory faster in addition to helicopters and cable cars. After scoring over any high score, whether they win or lose, players can enter their name into the high score list after the game over screen is \"achieved\". A strict time limit keeps the game going at a steady pace throughout; the consequence involves losing a life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30ri.jpg'),(4671,'1Quest','2014-12-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','1Quest is a roguelike, a challenging turn based RPG with high replay value','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z6s.jpg'),(4672,'The Escapist','2014-09-15','Platform, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A base of 2D platformer with extra spicy bouncing, in a mix of 48 heavily trapped levels, sided with 3 badass bosses. There\'s also tasty upgrades to avoid choking. Best served hardcore, enjoy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wp47owf7ygrtl6zg658x.jpg'),(4673,'Super Robot Taisen OG: Original Generations','2007-06-28','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical','PlayStation 2','Original Generations is a remake of the two Original Generation games for the Game Boy Advance and is intended to celebrate the Super Robot Wars series\' 15th anniversary.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nk3.jpg'),(4674,'World of Conquerors','2019-08-30','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Construct cities, train soldiers and enter tactical battles to conquer the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nea.jpg'),(4675,'Witch & Hero III','2018-03-22','Role-playing (RPG), Arcade','Nintendo 3DS','Witch and Hero 3 is an action game where you control the Witch, Hero and Little Hero at the same time. The two Heroes are physically strong and will keep fighting no matter how many times they\'re beaten. The Witch, however, is vulnerable and even weaker in stone form; if she goes down the game is over. When the Heroes protect the Witch and fight they can collect monster\'s blood from defeated enemies. When the Witch\'s magic power is full she can temporarily be cured of the stone form and use magic to fight back against the dangerous enemies. Clear the stages by defeating the Boss enemies and seek revenge over the final Demon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59gi.jpg'),(4676,'Lower? Higher!','2024-11-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','your pawnshop will usher in guests with different needs every day, bargain with them, let the income soar! With the expansion of pawnshops, activities such as sending shop assistants and responding to emergencies are also essential. you seem ordinary transaction may cause the butterfly effect.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89zs.jpg'),(4677,'Desvelado','2024-08-14','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Turn off the lights, dodge the ghosts and go to sleep as soon as you can in this hand-crafted 2d platform experience! In this vampiric precision platformer you will overcome challenging puzzles and deadly enemies before going to sleep in your cosy coffin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bsu.jpg'),(4678,'Wedding Dash 2: Rings Around the World','2009-07-12','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Quinn is back on a new whirlwind adventure, joined by Flo and Joe Wright, wedding photographer. Help Quinn become the world\'s top wedding planner in this hilarious sequel to the hit game Wedding Dash. Visit beautiful, exotic locations while managing new guests, fulfilling bride and groom requests, and tackling comedic disasters. Do you have what it takes to help Quinn win the honor of planning the most exclusive wedding of the year?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n96.jpg'),(4679,'Moeru! Onii-san','1989-08-08','Adventure','Family Computer','A Famicom game based on a manga of the same name.\n\nThe game stars Kenichi as the main character, while featuring Hidou, Rocky, and Shiranui as playable characters in some levels. The goal of the game is to rescue Yukie from a dragon simply named Dra Gon.\n\nThe game was re-branded with a circus theme and released in North America under the name Circus Caper, also published by Toho. The RPG element with the final boss was removed, the stages and bosses are in different order, and many graphical and musical changes were made to better resemble a circus theme.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fjb.jpg'),(4680,'Super Robot Taisen MX','2004-05-27','Strategy','PlayStation 2','Super Robot Taisen MX is a video game for the PlayStation 2. It is part of the Super Robot Wars series by Banpresto, a division of Bandai, and was released on May 27, 2004. It was later ported to the PlayStation Portable on December 19, 2005, with minor gameplay tweaks, titled Super Robot Wars MX Portable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gpo.jpg'),(4681,'Assassin\'s Creed Unity: Underground Armory Pack','2015-02-11','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','\'Always be better prepared than your enemies with these new additions to your armory.\nArm and protect your assassin with:\n- 2 complete outfits and 2 pieces of gear for additional customization options.\n- 3 pistols and 2 swords to show off your combat skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sj5.jpg'),(4682,'Skater Bunny Simulator','2024-11-02','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Unleash your skate skills and hop to new heights with Bunny Skater!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yxn.jpg'),(4683,'Rogue Command','2024-11-18','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Classic RTS gameplay fused with a modern roguelike. Shape your build each run by assembling an evolving arsenal of powerful units and facilities. Harvest resources, build out your base. Raise your army and call down orbital strikes to overcome the forces threatening your survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t7i.jpg'),(4684,'Learn to Play Chess with Fritz & Chesster','2009-02-06','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','Nintendo DS','DS Port of \"Learn to Play Chess with Fritz & Chesster\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93g9.jpg'),(4685,'Stronghold HD','2012-11-01','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The original castle sim, Stronghold HD allows you to design, build and destroy historical castles. Engage in medieval warfare against the AI in one of two single player campaigns or online with up to 8 players. \n \nWith 21 missions to test your mettle and four renegade lords to defeat, it is up to you to reunite medieval England and take back your lands from the treacherous Rat, Pig, Snake and Wolf. Missions range from breaking sieges and capturing enemy castles to raising gold and holding off enemy attacks. Also featured is a full economic campaign, tasking players to gather resources and build weapons within the time limit. \n \nWield greater control over your army than ever before with new high resolution graphics! The new HD battlefield view allows you to zoom out and play in real-time, with the whole map on one screen. Advance on the castle gates while flanking the enemy from behind, feign retreat and lead your foe into a deadly trap or just sit back and watch the destruction unfold.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dr3.jpg'),(4686,'Alien Blast: The Encounter','2003-01-27','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Alien Blast: The Encounter is a first person stationary shooter similar to Made By Kiddies\' previous title, Air Raid. On any given level, the player mans one of the defensive turrets, with a 360 degree view of the area and must blast alien creatures as they appear on the radar. Aliens can come by both land and by air. A friendly spaceship named the UMBK will sometimes arrive to drop power-ups on the battlefield including shield restores, ammo replenishing and new weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9epf.jpg'),(4687,'Lost Horizon','2020-03-05','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','1936: Soldiers of the Third Reich roam the world seeking occult weapons for their insane plans of conquest. When Fenton Paddock, a former British soldier and hapless smuggler, is asked to look for his friend Richard, who went missing in Tibet, he has no idea that this search will lead him across three continents to a secret that could turn the whole world upside down. Enough mystery? Not in the mood for another crime story? \"Lost Horizon\" brings the classic adventure back to its roots: the 1930s, exotic settings all over the world, and the dangerous quest for one of the greatest secrets of mankind makes adventurers\' hearts beat faster. The Makers of the award-winning Secret Files series invite you to experience a technically outstanding, carefully designed game featuring an absolutely thrilling story at the side of Kim and Fenton.\nKey features:\n\nUnique handmade graphic style\nExotic settings you\'ve never seen before\nMovie-like story by novelist Claudia Kern\nBoth realistic and funny dialogues\nExcellent technical appearance and minimal system requirements\nFast-paced presentation of the exciting story in movie style\nInnovative puzzle design, always fair and logical','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s8j.jpg'),(4688,'Gun Force II','1994-09-01','Shooter','Arcade','Gun Force II is a run and gun arcade video game developed and originally published by Irem on September 1994. It is the sequel to the original GunForce and one of the last arcade games released by the company.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ruo.jpg'),(4689,'Nobunaga\'s Ambition: Sphere of Influence - Ascension','2016-03-24','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','The newest release from the Historical Simulation Game landmark series, \"Nobunaga\'s Ambition!\"\nIn this release we include \"Officer Play\" for the first time in the series, allowing players to advance from retainer to Castle Lord and then on to Daimyo. Experience the reality of an officer of the warring states from differing perspectives!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7o91.jpg'),(4690,'General Horse and the Package of Doom','2020-06-23','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','General Horse and the Package of Doom is a space travel adventure with choice-based resource management, simple yet risky barter system, and full motion video sequences that feature awesome special effects and Oscar-worthy method acting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hbf.jpg'),(4691,'Freeland','2024-09-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Windows Mixed Reality, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3','Freeland is a virtual universe waiting to be explored, conquered, and shaped by your choices in this massively multiplayer online role-playing adventure. Immerse yourself in a colossal VR galactic online adventure where expansive open worlds teem with endless possibilities. Engage in quests that will challenge and reward you as you traverse this ever-evolving virtual universe. Unveil the rich storyline and forge your identity while connecting with players from across the globe through unparalleled social experiences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8shf.jpg'),(4692,'Don\'t Look Back','2009-03-11','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Android, iOS','Don\'t Look Back is a game about fantasy. Just to warn you, it can be quite tricky in places...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4iee.jpg'),(4693,'Summer Vacation','2021-12-31','Adventure','Windows Mixed Reality, SteamVR, Oculus Rift','Summer!, Beach! and VR!\nHot summer has come! How about vacations at VR Beach?\nLet\'s experience a fun time a tropical beach.\nYou can enjoy VR tropical country with plenty of attractions!\nIt is also important to heal the tired body after plenty playing? !\nIt also implements functions that can be nulled using oil.\nHere we go! Let\'s experience hot summer \"SUMMER VACATION\" this summer!\nHere\'s your expectation!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5omg.jpg'),(4694,'Verdungeon',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4695,'Genital Jousting','2018-01-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Genital Jousting is an online and local multiplayer party game about flaccid penises and wiggly anuses for up to eight players at once.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co418c.jpg'),(4696,'Project: Horned Owl','1996-10-01','Shooter','PlayStation','An invasion of mechanized terrorists turns your city into an urban battleground!\n\nTime: the future- Metro City is under attack from legions of robots directed by a twisted dictator. Your squad of mech-suited cops hits the ground, transformed into deadly defense unit. Your city is buckling, street by street - can you stop a total mech takeover?\n\n-A non-stop action shooter exclusively for the PlayStation game console.\n-Two player co-op mode and KONAMI ENFORCER Gun support double the destruction!\n-Interactive backgrounds allow you to blast cars, obliterate walls and annihilate mech suits on factory conveyors. Watch out-innocent civilians are everywhere!\n-Incredible Japanese anime sequences connect battle scenes into an all out urban war!\n-Rapid fire combat packed with futuristic war machines including cybercops, armored mechs with automatic weapons, tanks, missiles, bombs, energy scans and high-tech Heads-Up-displays.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gss.jpg'),(4697,'iO','2014-12-05','Platform, Puzzle, Racing, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One','iO is a physics platformer in which you control a ball. By growing or shrinking the ball you can influence its speed and weight. Use these mechanics to gain momentum and make your way through the levels. Toy with the laws of physics, solve the puzzles and reach the exit as quickly as possible. Can you win the gold medal in all levels?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27zz.jpg'),(4698,'Ambulance Rescue Driving',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4699,'Hi-Octane','1995-12-31','Racing','DOS, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Hi-Octane is a racing/vehicular combat video game released in 1995 for the PC, PlayStation and Sega Saturn developed by Bullfrog and based upon their earlier Magic Carpet game code.\n\nIt is notable amongst racing games for its wide and open tracks, and the resulting freedom offered to the player, and also for its excessive speed. It suffered in the marketplace due to thematic similarities with the better received Wipeout by Psygnosis and the generality of its graphics engine made for a very short depth of view compared to contemporary racing games.\n\nHi-Octane is rumored to begin life as something several Bullfrog programmers coded in free time, and then decided to improve the game and market it under the auspices of Electronic Arts. Another version of the legend is: EA set Bullfrog under pressure to release Dungeon Keeper or Magic Carpet 2 - but they weren\'t able to. So they released Hi-Octane, a quickly done game.\n\nIn a Gamasutra article it was mentioned that \"PC and Saturn racing game Hi-Octane, was developed in just eight weeks using the Magic Carpet engine, as a way to “fill a quarter that didn\'t have enough revenue”.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a86.jpg'),(4700,'KKND: Krush, Kill \'N\' Destroy','1997-03-25','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','KKnD, or Krush, Kill \'n\' Destroy is a real-time strategy games in the KKnD series. The game takes place in a post-apocalyptic setting, where two factions are fighting for control over the few natural resources left. Each faction has its own campaign consisting of 15 missions each, and there is also a multiplayer mode which allows up to 6 people to play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nkx.jpg'),(4701,'Sword of the Stars: The Pit Gold Edition - Juggernaut',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4702,'Bapbap',NULL,'Shooter, Strategy, Indie, MOBA','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Join BAPBAP, the Roguelike Party game where no two matches are ever the same. Round up your homies, pick a character, and build a giga-unfair build that\'ll make them hate you - then do it all over again!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b06.jpg'),(4703,'Paranormal Detective: Escape from the 90\'s','2022-01-18','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Arcade','SteamVR, Oculus Rift','90\'s teen Delia has disappeared in an abandoned arcade and it’s up to you to find her in this thrilling VR escape room adventure! Solve challenging puzzles and discover mysterious clues, all while playing awesome retro 90\'s arcade games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4eia.jpg'),(4704,'Elasto Mania Trilogy Pack','2023-09-10','Puzzle, Racing, Simulator','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','All your favorite ELMA titles in one iconic collection.\nA great deal and an epic experience in one neat bundle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78gs.jpg'),(4705,'Technotopia','2024-10-23','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Technotopia is a city-builder roguelike card game. Take on the role of an AI designed to build a perfect city. Build districts, meet the needs of diverse communities and maintain the delicate balance between factions vying for control over you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8b79.jpg'),(4706,'Dot Fighters','2006-12-31','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dot Fighters is a 2006 2D Fighter Maker doujin game by Takase, the guy who made Arm Joe. It only contains 4 characters drawn in an extremely retro, pixel-art style. Despite the small amount of content, it is pretty infamous for its larger filesize. It contains a full soundtrack and voice acting. The game requires that your computer\'s locale be set to Japanese in order to play.\n\nLooks can be quite deceiving with Dot Fighters, as it actually contains a fairly complex gameplay system, which is arguably better designed than Arm Joe\'s. Unfortunately, Takase has retained the same design ethic for Dot Fighter resulting in vastly overpowered characters and moves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6375.jpg'),(4707,'eXceed Gun Bullet Children','2005-12-31','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Humanity is at war against vampires and deviants. Mankind’s last line of defense is a group of children trained to wield powerful magic that can rival the demonic hordes, but at the cost of most of their lifespan. Likened to bullets of a gun, they are known as the ‘Gun Bullet Children’. The time is NOW! A vampire invasion force has been detected in the airspace above Tokyo Portal 5. Preliminary reports indicate over 500 vampires and accompanying Killings Dolls with reinforcing hordes of deviant humans. The first line of defenses has been obliterated and the Gun Bullet Children are scrambled to launch a counter-assault and stop the invasion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qgf.jpg'),(4708,'Pandora: First Contact - Gold Edition','2013-11-14','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cbv.jpg'),(4709,'République','2015-02-25','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You receive a call from Hope, a woman trapped inside a mysterious totalitarian state. Hacking into an elaborate surveillance network, you guide Hope through a web of danger and deception across five thrilling episodes.\n\nDeveloped over five years by industry veterans (Metal Gear Solid 4, Halo 4, F.E.A.R., Black & White 2, SOCOM) and fully realized in Unity 5, Republique is a thrilling and topical stealth-action game that explores the perils of government surveillance in the Internet Age.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sgd.jpg'),(4710,'Soul Axiom','2014-10-03','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, Xbox One','Explore Soul Axiom’s rich environments and immersive story to unravel the mystery of your life, and your digital afterlife. You will be taken on an intriguing voyage of discovery, through beautiful, haunting locations, facing challenges that will lead you into danger on your mission to unlock your identity, your story, your mystery. But beware: some mysteries are better left unsolved.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z3x.jpg'),(4711,'Simply Sudoku','2023-09-10','Puzzle','Playdate','A simple sudoku game for the Playdate handheld console.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co809n.jpg'),(4712,'Text Adventure','2023-08-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Look at art, listen to jazz, and immerse yourself in the world of Joey Pawelko\'s Text Adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wap.jpg'),(4713,'Shoulders of Giants','2023-01-26','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Shoulders of Giants is an explosively colourful roguelike where players simultaneously control a mysterious mech and the gunslinging amphibian riding on its back. Work alone, with a friend, or as one member of a four-person online co-op team, cutting through waves of enemies on a quest to rescue the galaxy from the forces of Entropy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ut6.jpg'),(4714,'Sword Princess Amaltea: The Visual Novel','2021-10-21','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Princess Amaltea is sent out on this quest, and rescues Prince Ossian. They are both unwilling to play along in these traditional expectations of them, and after fleeing their own wedding they are now out on the open roads – on to new adventures in this gender flipped world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xzi.jpg'),(4715,'Mortal Kombat 1: T-1000','2025-03-25','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','The T-1000 has been announced as a DLC guest character in the Khaos Reigns expansion for Mortal Kombat 1.\nNo release date was announced but the expansion will include a 1 week early access period for the character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jtq.jpg'),(4716,'HorrorVale','2019-07-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to HorrorVale, a world full of monsters, ghouls, and all sorts of fiendish undead. Help Alice on her quest to save her dog from strange and unusual monsters who suddenly showed up in HorrorVale!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rpa.jpg'),(4717,'Surge Generations','2025-12-31','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Surge Generations is a complete overhaul of Shadow Generations with the goal of replacing everything Shadow-related with Surge, such as voice lines, cutscenes, animations, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i7k.jpg'),(4718,'Arsenal Shock',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Arsenal Shock is a fast-paced singleplayer arena dual-weapon shooter. Use a multitude of weapons to fight off endless waves of enemies and achieve new high scores in 11 diverse mayhem-filled arenas. Also includes two Playground levels with gravity gun functionality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co584g.jpg'),(4719,'Necrosmith','2022-07-13','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','A necromancer simulator. Assemble the dead using different body parts while upgrading your tower, combine the abilities of the different fantastic races to fight your way through the hordes of enemies and overrun the ’chosen ones’. To tell the truth, the dead are pretty, uhm, dumb.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4z0z.jpg'),(4720,'Mortadelo y Filemón: La Sexta Secta','2023-12-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Extended version of the merging of \'Operación Moscú\' and \'El Escarabajo de Cleopatra,\' with additional and alternative content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7en3.jpg'),(4721,'Ophidia',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Consume all life as a serpentine demi-god in Ophidia!\n\nA decree has been made: all worlds must be purged so life may begin anew. Play as the legendary Norse Ouroboros, sent down from the heavens to cleanse Yggdrasil—the world tree—of all beings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yxf.jpg'),(4722,'Pokémon Seek & Find','2006-12-31','Puzzle','Web browser','Pokémon Seek & Find is one of three Flash-based computer games that were developed for the 10th Anniversary Perdue Farms promotion. The other two games are Pokémon Team Rocket Blast Off and Pokémon Poké Ball Launcher. Pokémon Seek & Find is a simple game where the player must follow cues to find one Pokémon among a group of Pokémon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93dj.jpg'),(4723,'Hero Defense','2018-08-15','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','CREEPS CRUMBLE. HEROES RISE. Command a team of renegade heroes and impale, slash, tear and burn through legions of undead hell-bent on world domination. Your mission: to defeat the world’s most powerful vampire, Count Necrosis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27py.jpg'),(4724,'The Prince Edward',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle','Web browser','The son of King Henry IV, prince Edward, is a very naughty boy no one can stop. One night, in the royal palace, boredom takes over Edward.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qdn.jpg'),(4725,'Zoda\'s Revenge: StarTropics II','2008-12-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Wii, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System','Stop Zoda\'s revenge and break the code!\n\nIntrepid adventurer Mike Jones, just back from the South Pacific, is off on a new journey through time and space. Mikes mission: to save seven mystic Tetrads while he faces the avengers of his foiled foe, the evil Zoda! Now three alien clones are hot on his trail through time!\n\nUnfold nine new chapters of adventures to decipher codes, solve mysteries and battle dragons with heroes of days gone by. Mike won\'t stop until the Tetrads are found and the Zodas are history!\n\n+Wind your way through more than a dozen action-packed stages in eight settings!\n+Save your progress and continue your time travels with the battery-backed memory!\n+Now with 8-directional diagonal movement!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kch.jpg'),(4726,'7th Deep','2018-03-08','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The 7th Deep Beckons... \n \nThe mysterious Kaia has found seven powerful individuals, one of whom is capable of reaching the bottom of the 7th Deep, an ancient dungeon filled with countless treasure and hordes of monsters, to claim the powerful God-Asper. This Relic is said to give the wielder the power to make dreams come true and you can bet that everyone wants a piece of the action! \n \nMake your choices: Will you be an evil alien who uses hi-tech weapons to obliterate his foes, a vampire that uses the lifeblood of others to revitalise herself, or maybe a powerful acolyte with potent, innate healing abilities? \n \nYour character choice will decide which options you have when you must make difficult decisions while exploring the Deep. A man is hanging on for his life. What will you do? As a Good character you may get help or put yourself at risk to save him. As an Evil character you might taunt him, rob him, or hasten his demise. The choice is yours. \n \nYou must use all of your cunning and resourcefulness if you wish to reach the bottom of the 7th Deep where an incredible object of power and an even greater, ancient evil awaits. The God-Asper silently awaits its new owner. Anticipation races through your soul; what would you do with such power?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co297g.jpg'),(4727,'Hexuma: Das Auge des Kal','1992-12-31','Adventure','DOS, Amiga','Hexuma: Das Auge des Kal sends you into an old, supposedly haunted mansion, which turns out to be a gateway to six different periods in Earth’s history. Travel from the age of dinosaurs to the distant future and bring back six crystal shards to battle the sinister god Kal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40dy.jpg'),(4728,'Dark Prospect','2020-08-11','Shooter, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dark Prospect is a FPS/RTS Hybrid, a genre mix, featuring 4v1 battles between upto 4 FPS player and 1 RTS player. \n \nThe idea for Dark Prospect came to us because there have been more and more 4 player coop games lately. While the graphic and playful implementation is often very good, there is often a lack of really good AI that works tactically and creates interesting situations. That\'s why we wanted this role to be taken by a player who can observe the situation from an RTS perspective and thus has the opportunity to act more tactically than an AI could. \n \nAlthough Dark Prospect offers the possibility that the monsters can be controlled by an AI, the clear focus is on PVP.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2drv.jpg'),(4729,'Tower of Winter','2022-07-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, iOS','For decades, the harsh winter persists, forcing people to rely on a blend of magic and steam technology to survive. However, their plight is becoming increasingly desperate. The source of the endless winter is rumored to reside within a tower at the northernmost point of the continent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uyi.jpg'),(4730,'Australian Idol Sing','2006-09-21','Music','PlayStation 2','Australian Idol Sing is a single and multiplayer singing game. In real karaoke style, songs appear on your screen and you have to sing the right words at the right time. Onscreen indicators inform you what pitch you need to maintain at any given time. Hit the right notes for the right amount of time, and you\'ll get high scores.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yzaxdrjxsyv20umgixu0.jpg'),(4731,'Siberian Dawn','2018-09-20','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Siberian Dawn is an original, solo, digital card game that combines the core soul of a deck builder with the tactical power of a war game and the strategic challenge of crisis management. Take on various objective based Missions as you defend the Union against the dangers of the cult of the Dawn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co413a.jpg'),(4732,'Blossom','2024-07-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Early spring, 1999, Taoyuan Village. In just several days, a series of drowning incidents occurred in the same quaint village. Then, on the night of the fifteenth day, numerous villagers witnessed a woman in red who bore an uncanny resemblance to a lady who had previously met an unjust demise...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vhw.jpg'),(4733,'Erit',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Space themed exploration and platformer game in which an alien girl crashes into an unknown planet and must find the missing components of her ship in order to leave the planet and continue her journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39oi.jpg'),(4734,'Dungeon Overseer','2021-12-21','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dungeon Overseer fills a void in that super fun RTS genre. Don the crown and pursue glory by building a unique dungeon layout, constructing your lair, upgrading and expanding, questing, crafting, researching, recruiting, defending your base, and raiding.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p90.jpg'),(4735,'Train Simulator: South West China High Speed Route Add-On',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Boasting over 570 km of truly rapid inter-city travel, the Southwest China High Speed Network, available for Train Simulator, is a wonder in and of itself; watch high-flying viaducts and scenic valleys soar past as you embark on one of the fastest sets of rails in the world courtesy of Partner Programme Developer Just Trains.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4736,'Smite: X Edition','2017-12-24','Sin género','Xbox One','Become a God from ancient mythology and do battle in the #1 Battle Arena on Xbox. Now available in stunning 4K Native HD on Xbox One X!\n\nAs a special bonus, you’ll enter the Battleground of the Gods with the Japanese Warrior Amaterasu and her Shining Heaven Skin.\nDownload and play for free today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27vv.jpg'),(4737,'Dragon Adventure VR','2017-09-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"My father is the most famous explorer in the dragon world. Two months ago I\'v lost contact with him. He was on a unique expedition. I studied his research and followed him to an anonymous isle. I have to find him!\" \n \nFollow our little dragon to a mysterious Island. \nCollecting crystals to reveal the path to find the little dragon\'s father, aka Piggon the Great Dragon Explorer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2awt.jpg'),(4738,'Death Jump','2019-05-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Evil aliens invaded our peaceful pixel country. They destroyed all living thing around. You must stop them. Make the deadly jump into the darkness, defeat the Crushers and save our world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c7j.jpg'),(4739,'Tell me tonight was real','2023-02-15','Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A game about two friends with benefits, a vampire and a human going on a impromptu date and realizing they are in love.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4740,'Tomorrow is my Birthday','2023-07-19','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','we don\'t have to do this\nwhy don\'t we just leave?\n\nThere\'s a certain kind of coolness haunting this summer. And two friends want to run away from it. Get to know Petal, Bios and their summery secret.\n\nThe words you choose to say during this journey will decide its ending. Watch all the flowers closely. Breathe in the humid colors around you. Catch the essence of Petal and Bios\' relationship. To escape this skewed reality.\n\nA denpa Point-and-Click-Adventure about becoming a person, giving up, and a doomed friendship. And don\'t forget that you always can go home again.\n\nWhen i’m near death i feel more real.\nDo you feel real often in your life?\nI forget... all the time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wxp.jpg'),(4741,'Galaga \'91','1981-12-31','Shooter','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ba5.jpg'),(4742,'ElDewrito',NULL,'Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Halo Online was a free-to-play first-person shooter developed by 343 Industries and Saber Interactive, and published by Microsoft Studios and Russian publisher Innova Systems. The game is based on a heavily modified version of Halo 3 (Blam! Engine), optimized to be run on lower-end PCs. A closed beta for the game took place in Russia in spring 2015, but the game was later cancelled with no plans to launch it in other countries.\n\nLater, a fan-made mod called ElDewrito revived the game and allowed it to be played worldwide. It gained increased popularity upon the release of Version 0.6, which included many added features that increased its stability and accessibility.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1kq5.jpg'),(4743,'Kill the Plumber','2016-01-01','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kill the Plumber is a challenging anti-platformer game. Play as the enemies instead of the hero for a unique new experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86di.jpg'),(4744,'Spider Riders: Battle for Arachna','2007-02-09','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser','Spider Riders: Battle for Arachna was a web browser RPG based on the anime series Spider Riders, itself an adaptation of a series of novels.\n\nThe game\'s Combat consisted of players rolling dice and using a deck of cards they assembled in turn-based battles. It featured a customizable avatar character and spider, 15 single-player missions, online play, and a Guild system, where players would align with one of four mentors to compete and amass the most points during recurring events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tfk.jpg'),(4745,'Call of Duty: Black Ops III','2015-11-06','Shooter','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','The PlayStation 3 and Xbox 360 versions of Call of Duty: Black Ops III were developed by Beenox and Mercenary Technology while the PlayStation 4, Xbox One, PC versions of the game were developed by Treyarch. Due to the last generation consoles\' inferior hardware, significant changes had to be made.\n\nThese changes include:\n\n- The campaign is not available.\n- Nightmares mode is not available.\n- Ground War is not available.\n- The Season Pass is not available\n- Only the bonus Zombies map, The Giant and the Awakening DLC pack are available to download\n- Reduced graphics quality and performance','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60bm.jpg'),(4746,'Love Red','2024-06-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is an independent game! It\'s quite difficult! You need to have love, courage, and wisdom to pass the level! It has a unique gameplay. I hope you can experience endless fun from it! This is definitely worth it! Hope everyone likes it! I will do better!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8f7f.jpg'),(4747,'Dawn of the Monsters: Arcade Edition',NULL,'Fighting, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This DLC adds Arcade Mode, new playable character Meteor Temujin, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lhh.jpg'),(4748,'Kurupara!','2001-07-14','Puzzle','WonderSwan Color','Kurupara! is a Puzzle game, developed and published by Tom Create, which was released in Japan in 2001.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6tc1.jpg'),(4749,'Prospekt','2016-02-18','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Prospekt begins in the Nova Prospekt prison in the Half-Life universe. Gordon Freeman is slowly being overrun by soldiers in the prison, however unknown to him, his Vortigaunt allies manage to find some help from a forgotten hero.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y27.jpg'),(4750,'Acter World','2001-12-31','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9csa.jpg'),(4751,'Criminal Clue: Spot the Difference',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4752,'Eclipse: Edge of Light','2020-01-14','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Explore an unknown world. Discover its past. Uncover its mystery. Eclipse is a first-person sci-fi adventure game. After crash-landing on a sentient planet, you awake to find a dreamscape world filled with discovery, wonder and the littered remains of a betrayed civilization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xx5.jpg'),(4753,'Revo','2021-08-24','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Revo is a neon styled and classically inspired space shoot \'em up with an original, retro fueled synthwave soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i94.jpg'),(4754,'Insufficient Adjectives','2019-09-04','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Insufficient Adjectives is about the labels we use to describe ourselves, and how those labels help us find our tribe. It\'s also about delivering packages to stores.\n\nThis game was commissioned by Playcrafting for the 2019 Play NYC Convention. Five \"Graffiti Games\" made by LGBTQ+ developers in NYC were created in 6 weeks and debuted first at Play NYC at the Metropolitan Pavilion in Manhattan.\n\nHow To Play - Hover over trucks to view clues as to their contents. Drag road tiles from the bottom of the screen into the city to help guide the truck to the correct store, based on what you think the truck is carrying.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2apk.jpg'),(4755,'Quake II: Call of the Machine','2023-08-10','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A brand-new Quake II experience from MachineGames consisting of 28 campaign levels and one multiplayer deathmatch map. In the depths of Strogg space lies the Machine, a singularity capable of collapsing the fabric of reality. Fight across time and space to find the Strogg-Maker, destroy it, and change the destiny of man and machine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x7j.jpg'),(4756,'When Heaven Knocks','2024-12-03','Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','One year prior, the town of [REDACTED] suffered from an odd incident, where students from the local school were compelled to dance... Evidently, against their own will. Only one student was unaffected by this mass hysteria.\n\nNow a year after the incident, a mysterious man visits an old abandoned church...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ci0.jpg'),(4757,'Special Counter Force Attack','2019-02-08','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get engaged in the Special Counter Force Attack plot to overthrow the oppressive rule of the drug cartel threatening the city. Make your way through different environments and brave the variety of tough game modes to get ever so closer towards bringing peace to the city.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4758,'Dead Weight','2025-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Challenge the Ancient Gods! Set the sails of your flying pirate ship and embark on the adventure in the steampunk world of Dead Weight. Explore floating islands in search for loot. Choose a class or create your own and enjoy turn-based tactical combat on tiny battlefields where every step matters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83vu.jpg'),(4759,'The Legends Gate: Awoken',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','The Legends Gate: Awoken is a new epic medieval universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hnc.jpg'),(4760,'Necrojacks','2021-02-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Summon undead to keep the graveyard calm and your business afloat','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q0x.jpg'),(4761,'I\'ll Take You to Tomato Town','2017-12-05','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A small game about completing your grocery list.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yq0.jpg'),(4762,'Dice Player One','2024-09-12','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Dice Player One\" is a roguelike strategy game where dice reign supreme! Roll your dice, seize pivotal moments, and transform limited chances into boundless opportunities. Conquer challenges, unearth hidden secrets, and master the art of dice manipulation!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8e7a.jpg'),(4763,'Television Trivia','2020-11-06','Quiz/Trivia, Indie','Amazon Fire TV, Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','How well do you know your Television Trivia?\n\nTest your knowledge with some of the most popular Television Shows.\n\nTelevision Trivia has never been so much fun. Challenge yourself or have a TV trivia night with friends and family in Party Mode! Choose from some of the most popular television shows including The Simpsons, Game of Thrones, The Office, Friends, Star Trek, South Park, Grey’s Anatomy, The Sopranos, and Seinfeld.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8960.jpg'),(4764,'PixelJunk Monsters 2: Danganronpa Pack','2018-07-03','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','\'All the monsters from Hope\'s Peak Academy wear a bear mask...\nOnly a true Tikiman can overcome the trial\nthat awaits!\n\n\'The Danganronpa Pack includes:\n- New Area: Hope\'s Peak Academy (3 stages)\n- New Tower: Mana\n- New Enemies (4 types)\n- New Danganronpa-themed Masks','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2imx.jpg'),(4765,'Emergency 2013','2012-11-02','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the Emergency series for PC, the player acts as a dispatcher in gripping rescue missions. Clear car wreckages fast to help pave the way for the fire fighters to advance to the source of a blaze! Secure crash sites and at the same time get medical help to those injured. If you have always wanted to direct fire services, police, technical relief units and medics all at once, the Emergency rescue strategy game series is just the game for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pvd.jpg'),(4766,'My PlayHome: Play Home Doll House','2011-05-27','Sin género','iOS','Now with another complete home for you to play in! Ideal for kids 2 and up!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4767,'Family Trainer: Meiro Daisakusen','1987-08-31','Sport','Family Computer','A Famicom game developed by Bandai as part of their Family Trainer series, which all use the Family Trainer (Power Pad) accessory. The goal is to explore mazes.\n\nThe fifth in Bandai\'s series of Family Trainer games, created for the accessory with the same name (or Power Pad in the US). Unlike the others, which tended to be athletics/exercise games, Meiro Daisakusen (\"Epic Maze Battle\") is a maze-exploring light RPG where the goal is to walk and jump around mazes to find items and, eventually, the exit.\n\nThe game\'s controls are dictated entirely by the Family Trainer/Power Pad. Different buttons will either cause the protagonist to jump, walk forward, walk backwards, turn left or right or switch their position to the left, right or center of the screen. While searching for the exit, players must be mindful of the various enemies that also inhabit the mazes, most of which must be avoided by jumping over them or running past them.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4768,'Anatomy',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4769,'Pixicharm: Porkocalypse','2025-03-21','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kea.jpg'),(4770,'Korpus: Buried over the Black Soil','2020-02-14','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Korpus: Buried over the Black Soil is a first-person horror game in which you have been sent to evaluate an abandoned house, set somewhere in Eastern Europe. Uncover the houses past and the secrets buried within.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lti.jpg'),(4771,'Legends of the Eternal Flame','2024-05-29','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Embark on a perilous journey to rekindle the eternal flame and save the world that is falling into chaos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6spx.jpg'),(4772,'LoopBreaker',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Sin plataforma','LoopBreaker is a story-driven time management plus turn-based combat game where you play as a high school student who discovers the loop and gathers power, defeats the bad guys, breaks the loop, and saves the world!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4773,'Switch','2008-06-24','Point-and-click, Puzzle','Web browser','Somehow you are in the locked room.\nLet\'s escape from this room by full use of hidden items and your brain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8p04.jpg'),(4774,'Burnout Drift','2019-03-28','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Are you a drift master? Prove your skills in Burnout Drift!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4775,'Tuned Turtle',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Tuned Turtle is a wacky 2D platformer inspired by the \"Tortoise x Hare\" tale. Tune up your shell with mighty power-ups and cross the finish line before \"Loko Rabbit\". You are the only hope to save a village in ruins from the hands of the greedy \"Dirty Duke\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co376c.jpg'),(4776,'Poppy Kart','2015-08-02','Racing, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Poppy kart is a funny karting game in a pixelated world. Travel, fight and drive as fast as you can on 29 handcrafted crazy races.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k69.jpg'),(4777,'Satella-Q: Sayonara Heisei Q-nen Nenmatsu Soukessan!','1997-12-21','Quiz/Trivia','Satellaview','A single-episode season of Satella-Q.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4778,'Peanut','2019-05-13','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Peanut is a unique 8 bit-like 2D platform adventure featuring the cute yet determined adventure corgi Peanut Stumpers. Lead him through 45 levels of amazing artwork from across the world and beyond in his quest to save his beloved BAE who has been taken by the Evil Veronica Vet.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4779,'Mobile Light Force','2003-04-10','Sin género','PlayStation','Mobile Light Force is a sloppy localization of the first Gunbird for PlayStation originally released in 1994. This localization removed all plot-related elements including cutscenes and endings, took the in-game\'s fan art gallery and renamed some characters with names taken from XS Games employees. The game\'s cover art and title screen also feature a completely unrelated artwork featuring characters resembling the main trio from Charlie\'s Angels. This realistic artwork is the complete opposite of the anime-styled aesthetics of Gunbird, and the characters displayed don\'t appear anywhere in the actual game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84fb.jpg'),(4780,'Dots','2017-12-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dots - is an exciting and amazing puzzle game, in which you need to consistently connect points, creating a variety of figures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2awf.jpg'),(4781,'Silica','2023-05-03','Shooter, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Silica is a crossover of FPS and RTS where up to 3 factions battle for control over the planet of Baltarus. Lead from above as commander, or experience the action first-hand, either alone, or with friends. Join one of two human armies, or hunt them down as the territorial aliens.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6i48.jpg'),(4782,'Momotaro Dentetsu World','2006-04-01','Simulator','Legacy Mobile Device','Momotaro Dentetsu WORLD is a video game in the Momotaro Dentetsu series of board game-style video games, genre released in 2006 by Hudson Soft for mobile phones.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4783,'Cube Dancer','2020-08-01','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cube Dancer is a short VR rhythm game, that puts you in dance battles against mysterious opponents. Each with its own unique dance style. Study their moves. Hit all the cubes that are thrown at you. And become the best cube dancer of them all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ogl.jpg'),(4784,'Void\'s Blight',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Void’s Blight is a Horror Atmospheric Platformer. The void has taken over the world leaving you as the only sole survivor of its onslaught. Can you survive long enough to rid the world of the Void’s Blight?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ot4.jpg'),(4785,'Fierce Dragon Godzilla: Metropolis Destruction!!','1985-12-31','Simulator','Sharp X1, FM-7','The player takes control of Godzilla in this game. Godzilla goes through towns and forests. Godzilla can step on tanks and fire his atomic breath at soldiers which gives him points. There is a yellow bar that indicates Godzilla\'s stamina. Above it, there\'s a container that fills up with purple liquid as the game progresses. A newscaster appears in the top-right corner of the screen, delivering news as the action unfolds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vun.jpg'),(4786,'Small Iron','2021-01-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jump and shoot your way across six levels to recover six weapons in your fight against the McCoy gang. Fight against rampaging wildlife in exotic locales across the territory to restore peace and order to the town of Little Brick.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41os.jpg'),(4787,'Tell a Demon','2017-07-01','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Tell a Demon is a visual novel set in a 1920s style fantasy world, centering around themes of love, loss, and vengeance. Your choices affect the character development of each of the three protagonists, leading to sixteen different endings. \n \nMany endings will vary based on your decisions throughout the story-some choices affect a viewpoint character\'s personality, while others alter the plot. The stories of the three separate viewpoint characters intertwine, but how much those stories intertwine-and who survives to the end of each playthrough-depends on you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27hf.jpg'),(4788,'TankZone Battle','2015-09-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','TankZone Battle is a dynamic 3D action game. Online fights in principle similar to game Counter-Strike. Dynamic and exciting battles are awaiting you, where the power of ammunition is not everything. Use your speed and agility to defeat your rivals!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/j7pblti5fjabrrkcrncw.jpg'),(4789,'Jazz Jackrabbit 2 Collection','2017-10-30','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','JAZZ IS BACK!\n\nThe nefarious turtle, Devan Shell, has built a time machine as part of a diabolical plan to rewrite Carrotus\' past. Now, only our hero along with his spaced-out little brother, Spaz, can stop him from turning history on its ear!\n\nJazz Jackrabbit 2 Collection includes:\n\nJazz Jackrabbit 2 - The Secret Files\nJazz, the PC platform hero, has finally made comeback with all new adventures. This time he\'s brought with him not only his space cadet brother Spaz, but also their sister, Lori - and she has supernatural athletic powers! This story, completely fresh and new for our gamers, takes our favourite rabbits to a haunted house, a city and an extended Easter level! On their way they encounter numerous enemies and sneaky adversaries, but trust them to bring the game to a wild conclusion when they find a mysterious code which is the key to the Valhalla.\n\nJazz Jackrabbit 2 - The Christmas Chronicles\nThey are back! Super-cool rabbit jazz, his crazy little brother, Spaz, and their athletic sister Lori will gang up for Christmas to have a wild and wacky time on your PC. In these Christmas levels of the PC hit Jazz Jackrabbit 2, our favourite rabbits have brand new adventures in cold, snowy landscapes, where there are many evil enemies.\nIncredibly fast-paced game play.\nChoice of at least three characters, each with its own specific gaming features.\nFly, swim and warp your way through over 40 levels of non-stop action.\nJazz Creation Station, a super-friendly level editor, enabling players to create their own levels.\nDeliriously fun Party Mode: Jazz up your social life with four-mode multiplayer gaming; two to four players on one screen; up to eight players on two screens via modem; up to 32 players on eight screens via LAN or the Internet!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sqa.jpg'),(4790,'Classic Jigsaw Puzzles: Beautifully Illustrated','2021-05-27','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This puzzle game helps your kids develop matching and fine motor skills. Your children will just love these wonderfully hand-drawn pictures and will improve their spatial skills while having fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n89.jpg'),(4791,'Iblis','2021-04-16','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Demon is a first-person psychological horror game. How much can a game affect your real life? Enjoy a realistic home environment and terrifying moments of being immersed in a real-life story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2y10.jpg'),(4792,'Snoopy Tennis','2001-05-06','Sport','Game Boy Color','It\'s a tennis game, Charlie Brown! The PEANUTS gang have packed up their rackets and headed to the courts for some fun tennis action in SNOOPY TENNIS for Game Boy Color. Choose from an initial selection of four characters Snoopy, Charlie Brown, Linus, and Lucy and take to one of four courts: clay, hard, and two different grass courts. Five gameplay modes await you: in Normal mode you play a quick best-of-three or best-of-five match up against a computer or human opponent; Sudden Win gives you an instant victory if you gain two games on your opponent; in Point Race mode, you\'ll race to see how many points you can score in a minute; Special mode throws a variety of power-ups into the mix; and Championship mode has you battling several opponents in order to become champion and unlock four new characters and courts. In addition, three different difficulty levels allow players of all skill levels to enjoy the game. SNOOPY TENNIS is for Game Boy Color only.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7x7a.jpg'),(4793,'Pyramid Defense','2020-01-23','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grave robberies\' army are coming. Pyramid Defense is a 3D tower defense game. Grave robberies\' army will rush to the pyramid from all directions to seize the Pharaoh\'s coffin. You will play the guard of the pyramid, sniping at the bandits with various weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lxk.jpg'),(4794,'Ragnarok: Back to Glory','2025-04-17','Sin género','iOS','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4795,'Knight Fall','2024-06-13','Platform, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Knight Fall, where every move is a challenge! Battle bosses as you climb through dangerous lands. Be careful; a single wrong move could mean the end of the journey. Will you beat the horrors or fall to the bosses on your daring quest?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bfq.jpg'),(4796,'Ninja Crusaders','1991-01-14','Platform, Arcade','Nintendo Entertainment System','They struck without warning, wiping out the Earth\'s defenses in one master stroke. Cities were crushed, and the invading aliens showed no mercy! A small resistance force of Ninja, refusing to be conquered, still remained to fight the evil Inimicus. A daring plan was devised by the Ancient Ones to send out two special Ninja, and annihilate the alien threat once and for all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6osp.jpg'),(4797,'God of War Collection','2010-03-18','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita','God of War Collection brings the nonstop action of God of War and God of War II to modern consoles in HD.\n\nExperience the brutal world of ancient Greece as the legendary Spartan Kratos seeks revenge on Ares, the God of War, and tries to accomplish what no mortal has ever done... alter the course of Fate itself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2enh.jpg'),(4798,'Living With Dragons','2024-06-21','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Travel with your dragon companion to locate and hatch the 6 Elemental Dragons. Farm crops and raise livestock to feed your creature companions as well as crafting items to make your journey easier. Tame new creature companions and use their abilities to improve your farming and crafting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g8n.jpg'),(4799,'Simple Duel','2024-12-31','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Simple Duel is a rock-paper-scissors style fighting game with players making moves simultaneously. Select a weapon that determines your health, energy, move set, and combo. There are three different match types to choose from next: default, rounds, or lives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kz1.jpg'),(4800,'Shake it up! Dice','2021-10-12','Card & Board Game','Android, iOS','Shake it up! Dice is a mobile game on Android and iOS that feature\'s the world\'s first Deck of Cards on Dice. The gameplay is centered around 9 six-sided dice that feature all 54 playing cards from a traditional deck (including two WILDS).\n\nThe cards are distributed across the dice faces in a patented mathematical formula allowing players an incredibly fun and much easier way to play games that require making traditional playing card hands.\n\nThe mobile game has a familiar but fresh player experience of rolling all 9 dice a total of 3 times while getting to hold what you want to achieve a goal (like Two Pairs, Four of a Kind, Full House, etc). Players play head-to-head against friends, random opponents, and bots to achieve the most goals by filling out their scorecards and receiving bonus points for achieving a higher hand than their opponent. There is a classic 9-Hand Game mode as well as a 3 and 1-Hand game mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uue.jpg'),(4801,'Rise of the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: City Showdown','2018-07-26','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Web browser','Help Raph, Donnie, Leo, and Mikey fight off the bad guys and protect Manhattan. In Nickelodeon\'s newest free and fun online action game, it\'s up to you to guide the turtles through different quests and challenges. When you land on a green, yellow, or red spot it is time to battle a new mutant in each area of the city created by the villain Baron Daxum, Each battle lets you collect points, stickers, or pizza for a high score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ylb.jpg'),(4802,'Nakajima Satoru: F-1 Hero','1988-12-09','Racing','Family Computer','Superstar Nakajima Satoru (Michael Andretti in Western versions) personally guides you through the perilous and exciting world of Grand Prix Racing! Four of the most powerful racing machines are your to command on 16 famous international Grand Prix courses from around the globe! Hone your driving skills or challenge the best - it\'s all up to you in this amazing simulation of Formula One racing!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bpv.jpg'),(4803,'Even in Arcadia','2019-05-29','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An experiential narrative game about people, plants, and interplanetary capitalism.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4m38.jpg'),(4804,'Sonic NG',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sonic NG is a fan-made game in the Sonic the Hedgehog franchise. Players control Sonic and possibly other characters as they speed through levels inspired by classic Sonic games. The game likely features fast-paced platforming gameplay, with Sonic running, jumping, and spin-dashing through various environments. Sonic NG may incorporate both 2D and 3D elements, blending traditional side-scrolling sections with more modern 3D gameplay. As a fan creation, the game probably aims to capture the essence of classic Sonic titles while introducing new elements or improvements. Sonic NG might include original levels, characters, or gameplay mechanics designed by fans to expand upon the established Sonic formula. While not an official Sega product, Sonic NG represents the ongoing enthusiasm of the Sonic community for creating new experiences within the beloved franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ucx.jpg'),(4805,'Panilla Saga','2021-07-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, iOS','Panilla Saga is a mobile Japanese-style idle card-collection game by More2Game which combines idle RPG and instant battle game elements. It is available for Android and iOS in Taiwan and Hong Kong/Macau and SEA regions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gpx.jpg'),(4806,'Reines Du Sabbat','1995-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC-9800 Series','Reines Du Sabbat is a JRPG developed by doujin circle Kenix who would later develop Corpse Party, this work became quite infamous on the Japanese internet during the late 90\'s and early 2000\'s due to its grotesque content to the point of being \"quietly\" distributed on freeware sites.\n\nThe game takes place in the country of Serfina. In a small hut there lived a girl called Puff, together with her older brother, Lux. Since they\'ve lost their parents at an early age, the older brother had to take the parent role and take care of his little sister. However, one day, Lux suddenly fell ill with a fever of an unknown origin, with no doctor able to help and him gradually losing his strength. Puff heard about a medicinal herb called the Snow Herb that can quickly bring down any kind of fever and went to the forest of Pia to find it. In the forest, being absorbed in the beautiful flowers blooming there Puff lost her uncle.\n\nThis is where the game begins and Puff\'s journey will lead her to witness the cruelty of human beings...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i3q.jpg'),(4807,'Aru Kanrinin no Koi: Spring + Summer Complete Edition','2022-04-02','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A port of Aru Kanrinin no Koi: spring + summer Free Edition with additional content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f2t.jpg'),(4808,'State.io','2023-08-15','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical','Web browser, Android, iOS','Welcome to State .io, the epic strategy game that lets you conquer an alternative world! In this cell battle game, you\'ll command your troops to capture all the states while challenging your logic and reaction time.\n\nState .io is an abstract real-time strategy game, a tactical clash of dots, and an exciting countries takeover. Fight against armies by solving strategic puzzles to beat your rivals and expand your superiority in the world arena. Lead your army to victory in this epic battle game and become a war strategy winner!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8byd.jpg'),(4809,'Blue Reflection','2017-03-30','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Blue Reflection, a new RPG title from Gust Studios, puts the player in the shoes of Hinako Shirai, a seemingly normal high school girl who gains the mysterious power of a Reflector, a champion able to manipulate the dimension known as The Common. Follow her story as she creates new bonds and gain new strength as she fights through dangers of The Common.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4aux.jpg'),(4810,'Voxel Sword','2019-01-10','Fighting, Shooter, Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A comical versus game for everyone to enjoy! Voxel Sword is an easy to play action game, set in an adorable toy fantasy world, where you can wield various weapons to defeat monsters. This is our toy fantasy world, Voxel. Since ancient times, humans and monsters have worked together and coexisted in peace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59fr.jpg'),(4811,'Momotaro Matsuri','2001-03-21','Role-playing (RPG), Card & Board Game','Game Boy Advance','Japanese festival RPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mwehf2jrwip6lxjwpghy.jpg'),(4812,'Maggotmania','1983-12-31','Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX','Maggotmania is a single screen shooter inspired by the arcade game Centipede where you control a blue creature at the bottom of the screen trying to destroy a large maggot that appears at the top of the screen over various levels. You can move left or right, and forwards a short distance as well as move backwards and you keep firing upwards when you fire your weapon. The maggot moves across the screen and when it hits a flower or the edge of the screen then it moves down one place and moves the opposite way. When you hit the maggot, it splits into two parts and keeps moving downwards towards you leaving behind a flower. Flowers stop your bullets but after a few shots it disappears and if you hit a flower then you lose one of three lives. Other creatures make an appearance like a spider and snail and these can be shot for bonus points. If the maggot reaches the bottom of the screen then it starts to move upwards and when destroyed you move on to the next level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jm3.jpg'),(4813,'Otogi 2: Immortal Warriors','2003-12-25','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox','Take the role of the undead warrior Raikoh Minamoto and his companions as they are tasked with vanquishing the invading hordes of demons and protecting Japan\'s capital city from being consumed by the darkness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48qc.jpg'),(4814,'Toto Temple Deluxe','2015-09-29','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Ouya, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, Xbox One','Toto Temple Deluxe is a fast-paced, local-multiplayer king-of-the-hill style game in which players must steal an egg-laying goat from their friends and try to keep it on their own head for as long as possible. You know, normal stuff.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44si.jpg'),(4815,'Little League World Series Baseball 2010','2010-07-13','Sport','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','The Games on Demand version supports English. Swing for the fences this season with Little League World Series Baseball 2010! Little League welcomes you to the baseball diamond for the first time ever with easy to pick-up-and-play control mechanics that get you right into the action. Play your way from league champions to the regional tournament and, if you have what it takes, go all the way to the World Series in Williamsport, PA! Endless gameplay features that include team and player customization, collectibles, realistic 3D stadiums, talents, skill challenges and more fun than ever for the entire family!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nr7zmfu85frygvkojika.jpg'),(4816,'LEGO Creator: Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets','2002-12-10','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','LEGO Creator: Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets is an adventure/puzzle game where players can explore the a range of environments from Harry\'s second year, including Hogwarts, the Quidditch pitch, the Dark Forest, Diagon Alley, and even the mysterious Chamber of Secrets itself.\n\nOn this journey, players will collect chocolate frogs, find LEGO treasure chests, and cast spells at characters, creatures, and models. In addition, players can fully customize their adventure by building structures and characters in the workshop and dropping their creations into the world of Hogwarts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e8y.jpg'),(4817,'Dynasty Warriors 8','2013-07-19','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','The main mode in this latest installment in the Dynasty Warriors series is Story Mode, which follows the stories of the kingdoms of Wei, Wu, Shu, and Jin.\nThis completely new story includes new episodes with all-new characters and takes an ever deeper look at the drama that unfolds in the Romance of the Three Kingdoms compared to previous titles in the series.\nThere are also new \"What If?\" scenarios that take a look at what could have happened if famous characters of the time period had lived on to fight another day.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45uz.jpg'),(4818,'Animal Kostume','2023-05-22','Platform, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','No talk, compadre. It\'s Animal Kostume time! Follow kroc-boy in his path to overcome a series of difficult levels in this hardcore 2D platformer with a lot of enemies, bullets and surprises.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co774v.jpg'),(4819,'Tom vs. The Armies of Hell','2015-01-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tom vs. the Armies of Hell (AoH for short) is a challenging indie Action-Adventure game from Darkmire Entertainment. Set in a world somewhere between Office Space and Army of Darkness, you play Tom, a down-trodden software-engineer turned reluctant half-demon hero when an experiment gone awry in the basement government lab sends his entire office complex plummeting into Hell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/emcobwpqfspiy2nywcln.jpg'),(4820,'A.C.E','2025-04-28','Sin género','iOS','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4821,'L.O.C.K.','2016-12-07','Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A small exploration of the universe, as previously imagined: based on cosmologies which place the Earth, and thus humans, at the center of the universe, Loci Omnes Caelesistis Kyries shifts between a simple diagram and a fascinating machine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ulw.jpg'),(4822,'Cluedo: Master Detective',NULL,'Strategy','Commodore C64/128/MAX, DOS, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','A murder is announced.\n\nWhodunit? Was it Madam Rose in the carriage house with the poison? Monsieur Brunette in the trophy room with the horseshoe? Or was it Colonel Mustard in the library with his trusty revolver?\n\nPlay the home computer version of your favorite game of criminal detection just as you would on the board game, with friends.\n\nOr do what you can\'t do with the board version: play against the ultimate master of deduction, your own computer!\n\nYou can even do both: play with a mixture of human and computer-controlled opponents!\n\nEnjoy the enhancements the computer can bring to the game play, such as graphic animation and sound. Watch Miss Peach stroll into the gazebo and hear the twittering of songbirds.\n\nClue Master Detective is an enhanced version of the game Clue you know and love. The new game has even more to exercise your \"little grey cells\"- more suspects, more possible murder locations (indoors and outdoors), and more weapons- in fact, more mayhem!\n\nSo put away your violin, put on your deerstalker hat, fill your meerschaum pipe, and start sleuthing!\n\nWho will be the first to the solution? You, your friends, or the computer?\n\nThe game\'s afoot!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ltkxrwt43xgqdjqngegs.jpg'),(4823,'Valkyrie Profile 2: Silmeria','2006-06-22','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','Valkyrie Profile 2: Silmeria is the second installment of the Valkyrie Profile series.\nTaking place hundreds of years before the original game, the story revolves around two characters living the same body, named Silmeria and Alicia. Together, the two characters work to stop a catastrophe that could cause war between the people and the gods. The game received generally positive reviews, citing its similarity to the original Valkyrie Profile game and its beautiful graphics, but had a convoluted interface and a high degree of difficulty. The game went on to be re-released as a Square Enix \"Ultimate Release\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1onn.jpg'),(4824,'Street Warrior','2007-02-12','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 2','Near future, City of Westbay. In recent years, corruption and crime rate has grown very fast, and the government is unable to secure the cities anymore. The streets were overtaken by criminals, and the city is now ruled by merciless and cruel gangs.\nIn desperate need to fight back, the government gathers the best of the best and creates a special unit called Strike Force.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/h1mzxi1cvcy4q0gqg7gb.jpg'),(4825,'Biblios: Tome of Darkness','2024-09-01','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Biblios: Tome of Darkness is a fast paced first person shooter inspired by the biggest hits of the 1990s and Boomer Shooter revival. Fight a host of unique and challenging enemies, wield a powerful arsenal of weapons, and search high and low for secrets and lore notes to reveal the mysterious motives of the evil Acolytes of Seth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qzo.jpg'),(4826,'Rune Factory: A Fantasy Harvest Moon','2007-09-14','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Nintendo DS','You awaken to find yourself in an unfamiliar village with no memory of who you are or how you arrived. Mist, a beautiful young woman comes to your aid and helps you start to build a life for yourself on a farm. Till the land, grow crops, raise animals, catch fish and battle monsters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xkp.jpg'),(4827,'The Settlers : Heritage of Kings - History Edition','2018-11-25','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','With this modernized History Edition dive into the diversified mix of enthralling build-up matches and exciting real-time fights. Manifold landscapes await to be explored and populated. Includes the main game plus the two expansions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23tx.jpg'),(4828,'Getsuei no Kusari: Kyouran Moratoriamu','2016-12-21','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable','The fandisc for Getsuei no Kusari, it adds a route for Ooigawa Mamoru\nwhich continues from the normal end and after stories for the main cast.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kk1.jpg'),(4829,'Wai-wai de Q: Dai-2-kai','1995-10-14','Quiz/Trivia','Satellaview','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4830,'Ace Combat 7: Skies Unknown - Deluxe Edition','2019-01-18','Simulator','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Deluxe Edition of Ace Combat 7: Skies Unknown contains the base game, the Season Pass, and the 8 Popular Squadron Emblems DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dd1.jpg'),(4831,'Sweet Bakery Tycoon: Multiplayer Edition','2023-03-24','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Start your baking career and prepare some delicious cakes for your clients, using a whole set of creams, fruits, and decorations. Test your skills on 60 diverse and increasingly difficult levels. Personalize your interior with countless upgrades.\n\nAll of us have a magic place, where everyday troubles seem to disappear. Sweet Bakery Tycoon fulfills your fantasy of creating and managing a bakery of your dreams','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6axj.jpg'),(4832,'TramSim Vienna','2020-10-29','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Tramway Simulator that plays on line 1 in Austria.\n\nSteer the streetcar through Austria and transport your passengers.\n\nOriginal route\nVehicle can be operated completely\nMost modern tramway called: Flexity','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jfm.jpg'),(4833,'Koverpark Haunted Subway',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4834,'Sim Settlements 2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A sequel to the popular Sim Settlements mod, containing three chapters with dozens of fully voiced characters and storylines based around a deeply expanded settlement building system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84em.jpg'),(4835,'Truck Kyousoukyoku: Ai to Kanashimi no Rodeo','2000-12-14','Racing, Simulator','PlayStation 2','The PS2 port of this game betters the original with new tracks and additional graphical details. As the truck maneuvering maniac, your goal is to race against competing truckers any which way but loose. Drive on sidewalks, search for shortcuts, discover secret roads and plunge headlong into traffic with no reservation. You are, after all, a maniac. Upon winning races, the player gets a can of aerosol to paint designs and emblems on the body of the truck. The sides, top, back, and head of the vehicle are open canvases for you to drop paint and swirl a menacing symbol or a nature panorama. Preset designs may be chosen or you can create your own doodles which help you help your truck emote. The action is hot and the paint jobs add to the ambience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98nc.jpg'),(4836,'I Borrow',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','I Borrow gives you an opportunity to be a great community member! Annoyingly, you don\'t own anything. You need to borrow stuff from your surroundings. There is no limit of what you can take, be it a chair, fridge, wall, anything!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43gd.jpg'),(4837,'Shotgun Knight','2023-08-08','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on an impossible climb with nothing but yourself and a shotgun to propel yourself upwards while falling losing all your progress countless times.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zmr.jpg'),(4838,'Witcharoo','2023-10-01','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Your life as a cat is turned upside down after being kidnapped by a crazy witch..!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77xm.jpg'),(4839,'Cat Simulator: Animals on Farm','2021-07-23','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sneak up on your enemies, help Farmer, Goat and Piggy, and start a family!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ckr.jpg'),(4840,'The Lost Legends of Redwall: The Scout - Act 2','2021-04-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A whimsical puzzle-adventure game set in the world of the bestselling Redwall books. In this second episode, fresh off your defeat of the murderous Scumsnout, you wake to hear the sounds of battle - and must make your way into the fray to find your lost beloved!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hng.jpg'),(4841,'Golfing In Aether: Winter','2022-12-08','Simulator, Sport, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The second free expansion to Golfing in Aether, introducing a snowy winter landscape along with several new levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70k3.jpg'),(4842,'Eye, caramba!','2020-12-23','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Got a keen eye? Then try to solve these colorful soothing puzzles while listening to relaxing music!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qhl.jpg'),(4843,'Mental: The Dark Night',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Mental is a Single and Multiplayer psychological horror game, with varied story modes and contracts. The main idea of Mental is to offer the best visual and sound experience, so that you immerse yourself in an immersive experience that is as realistic as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c5z.jpg'),(4844,'Gilbert and the chemystical island','1998-12-31','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When the egg hatches and the dragon Gilbert takes his first steps onto the beach, there begins a chemical adventure the likes of which you have never before seen, It is an adventure where your own curiosity and thirst for knowledge steer the course of the game. In the hunt for the various parts of the egg shell, which are scattered to the winds, you will learn the secrets of chemistry accompanied by the lab assistant, the desert bedouin, the lava man, the snow queen, and several others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x5l.jpg'),(4845,'Tempest: Treasure Lands','2017-08-08','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dozens Islands of Paradise\nFor Some it\'s A Blessing\nFor Others...\nIt\'s A Curse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31wn.jpg'),(4846,'Sakamoto Dangerous Barrage',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sakamoto Ryoma and his friends, who were in the midst of forming an alliance with Satcho, are suddenly transported to “Fluffy Land”! A bullet-hell shooter in which the player dives through a dense barrage of bullets by time-stopping and momentary movement.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9euq.jpg'),(4847,'Amy Rose in Sonic the Hedgehog','2010-04-14','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Amy in Sonic 1 is a modification of Sonic 1 that swaps sonic out with Amy Rose from Sonic CD, bringing with her, her move-set from Sonic Advance.\n\nUsing Her Piko Piko Hammer she will have to Jump, whirl, and dash through South Island to put a Stop to Robotnik\'s plans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co293p.jpg'),(4848,'No Anglerfish','2022-02-05','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You awaken on a desert island with no knowledge of who you are, or how you arrived there. Explore and unlock surrounding islands by playing the mysteriously powerful arcade machines spread throughout the lands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5js7.jpg'),(4849,'Street Fighter IV','2009-07-07','Fighting','Arcade, PlayStation 3, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox 360','Street Fighter IV brings the legendary fighting series back to its roots by taking the beloved fighting moves and techniques of the original Street Fighter II, and infusing them with Capcom’s latest advancements in next generation technology to create a truly extraordinary experience that will re-introduce the world to the time-honored art of virtual martial arts.\n\nNewcomers:\n- Abel\n- C.Viper\n- Rufus\n- El Fuerte\n- Gouken','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1w4t.jpg'),(4850,'Elman España: Anarchy','2017-01-01','Platform, Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','In Elman España: Anarchy the player controls the character based on the Spanish model Elman España. Through twelve levels of 2D side-scrolling gameplay with three different map locations ruined post-apocalyptic versions of Texas, California and New York City are visited. In each stage, special ops enemies attack in hoards with different types of weapons from assault rifles to grenade launchers. The objective of the game is to destroy all enemies until you reach the final level, twelve boss. You get weapons upgrades such as pistols, AK-47s, grenades, etc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xpy.jpg'),(4851,'Astro Shooter',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4852,'Survival Island: The Forest 3D',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4853,'Addictive',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4854,'My Dragon Girlfriend','2019-04-19','Visual Novel','Android','As you are returning home one day, a moaning voice from the dark disrupts your short cut through the park. As you approach, you see a girl who has fallen over on the grass. You cautiously approach and soon realize that she is bleeding onto the ground!\n\nYou approach now with fear and trepidation on your mind when the girl suddenly grabs your arms. The next words out of her mouth are outrageous. \"Please, give me some of your blood.\" she groans. Surprised and frightened, you listen to your first instinct to run away. Before you can get too far, though, you feel guilty for leaving the bleeding girl there and return to her side.\n\nYou strengthen your resolve before thrusting out your neck towards the girl. The next thing you know, you are drifting into unconsciousness. The next morning, you notice that you wake up in your bed at home. You instantly believe that everything that happened yesterday must have been a bizarre dream. That is… until you see the girl from yesterday - Alice, as you find out she is called - sitting in your living room and eating a donut.\n\nAfter this incident, everything changes. Your classmate Seychelles and Merle - who comes from the demon world - begin to try and get closer to you. Thus begins your exciting new life!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mty.jpg'),(4855,'Sonic the Hedgehog Snowday',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ilm.jpg'),(4856,'Mortal Kombat: Deception - Premium Pack','2004-10-04','Fighting','PlayStation 2','Mortal Kombat: Deception (Premium Pack Bonus Disc) is a Fighting video game published by Midway released on October 4th, 2004 for the PlayStation 2.\n\nIncludes:\n\n- An exclusive “Arcade Perfect” playable version of Mortal Kombat 1.\n- 25 Character Video Bio’s, Including Mortal Kombat team commentary.\n- History of the Mortal Kombat franchise movie.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wwk.jpg'),(4857,'Looney Tunes: Back in Action','2003-11-24','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Looney Tunes Back In Action is a hilarious adventure featuring everyone\'s favorite cartoon two-some, Bugs Bunny and Daffy Duck, in a globetrotting scavenger hunt to find the mythical Blue Monkey Diamond. From Hollywood to Las Vegas, from Paris to Africa, our roving heroes must run, jump, slide, and bounce their way through a heap of cartoon perils and put an end to the sinister plans of the evil ACME Corporation in an effort to save the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1owo.jpg'),(4858,'Amihailu in Dreamland','2016-08-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A magical, dreamy adventure starring Amihailu Dugashoba and her friends! You\'ll wander the echoey and endless halls and spooky painting worlds to solve the mystery and escape the fantasy world. Or you would solve the mystery... if anything Amihailu said made a grain of sense!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31yl.jpg'),(4859,'C.E.O.','1995-12-31','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','C.E.O. is a game about management training, with features such as stocks and subsidiaries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/f9atvzebrmx8ygluc5e7.jpg'),(4860,'Wild Harmony',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4861,'Undead Legions II','2018-07-30','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Never stop shooting. Never Surrender! In Undead Legions 2 you will experience intense combat and tactical Tower Defense elements in a fast-paced and frantic Action-Rpg setup. Survive the unforgiving zombie hordes and JUMP up to the challenge!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4862,'Ex-Mutants','1995-12-31','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Action game based on the Ex-Mutants comic book series by Malibu Comics.\n\nLeaping from the pages of the popular comic book come the Ex-Mutants. Choose Shannon or Ackroyd as you weave your way through the nuclear wasteland to battle the minions of the evil Sluggo and restore the human race!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5l8b.jpg'),(4863,'Shall we date? Eternal Vows: Love Beyond Time','2010-08-26','Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation Portable','Originally released as Nise no Chigiri in Japan for PSP & PC.\nPublished by NTT Solmare in English for iOS and Android.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bw9.jpg'),(4864,'Hot Wheels Unleashed 2: AcceleRacers Free Pack 2','2024-05-02','Racing','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Piledriver takes its name from a wrestling move that leaves no opponents a chance. Technetium, on the other hand, is a beauty shrouded in mystery. The only thing that won\'t be a mystery is that they will take you straight to the podium!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dyo.jpg'),(4865,'Radiant Silvergun','1998-07-23','Shooter','Arcade, Sega Saturn','Unlike in most other shoot \'em ups, there are no power-ups. All weapons are available from the start. Weapons can \'level up\', however, becoming more powerful as the player uses them to score points. There are a selection of 7 weapons that can be used at any given time:\n\nThe game is designed so that there is almost always a \'right\' weapon for any situation. The bosses in the game are designed so that they have multiple \'sections\' which, if all destroyed before the \'core\' of the boss, will award the players with point bonuses. Being able to apply the right weapons on any different boss is key to obtaining these bonuses. For example, a boss may have two sections located on either side of the screen. You could immediately go up to one and begin shooting it with a vulcan, or you could hover in the centre and hit both at the same time with the side bombs. This would increase your chance of obtaining the bonus before the time limit runs out and the boss self-destructs.\n\nThe game rewards players for \"chaining\" enemies of just one of three colors, red, blue, or yellow. Whenever the player kills three enemies that are of the same color, who can obtain a points bonus. This also facilitates faster upgrading of weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47r5.jpg'),(4866,'Skynet Rising : Portal to the Past','2016-10-14','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the world of Skynet Rising. From the mastermind creator Dr. Rex Havoc, Skynet Rising is a top notch action packed “Super Sandbox FPS”. Explore a beautifully crafted post apocalyptic world. Survive and conquer command towers through tough gun battles. Fight back to back with your brother in arms. Featuring a high adrenaline single player campaign, the game has a wickedly great Run and Gun gameplay with tons of \"Shoot them in the face\" fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ukln38jfyakh8b8rxizk.jpg'),(4867,'Dollmare','2024-10-24','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'ve accepted a shady job offer at a doll factory. Inspect dolls for defects and anomalies. Follow strange protocols. Don\'t get fired and stay alive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xqi.jpg'),(4868,'Bear Boy','2020-01-19','Fighting','Game Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o63.jpg'),(4869,'Joe Dever\'s Lone Wolf: HD Remastered','2015-11-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','For Sommerlund and the Kai! Lone Wolf is back with an exclusive storyline, stunning graphics and a deep combat system. Make meaningful choices and carve your own path.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h1a.jpg'),(4870,'Megabonk',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Smash your way through endless waves of enemies and grow absurdly powerful! Grab loot, level up, unlock characters and upgrade to create unique and crazy builds as you fend off hordes of creatures!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98po.jpg'),(4871,'The Masochistic Ball','2025-05-26','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Roll. Jump. Fall. Repeat. The Masochistic Ball is a precision 2D platformer with a rising difficulty curve. The early levels welcome everyone. The final ones? Pure nightmare fuel. 40 levels. No enemies. Just you, gravity, and your will to endure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9sb2.jpg'),(4872,'Nemiza\'s Verdict',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nemiza\'s Verdict is a cooperative roguelite dungeon crawler where your soul takes over various monstrosities. Hunt down Nemiza and challenge their verdict in the twisted labyrinth of Lovence by evolving your monstrous abilities and remember skills from your past life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jko.jpg'),(4873,'New World: The Ideal World','2025-03-16','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This world is crazy. This is the story of a cute ASCII art character living in a harsh world. A simple command-based RPG. ASCII Art charactor is from 2chan, but knowledge of 2chan is not required. Only Japanese is supported.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jg8.jpg'),(4874,'Crash Test Billy','2017-08-18','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Billy get to the checkpoint by creating a suitable vehicle using a variety of different parts. Billy must survive, so drive safe!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2alm.jpg'),(4875,'Crescent Tower','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aspire to reach the top of Crescent Tower that appears just once every 50 years! An authentic 8-bit style dungeon crawler RPG with a retro level of difficulty, where you repeatedly explore, level up, and traverse dungeons!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o49.jpg'),(4876,'Faire ar Éin','2025-03-09','Simulator, Indie','Web browser','An idle clicker game where you play as an avid birdwatcher snapping pictures of fowl in your garden. Take photos and upgrade your garden to unlock new birds to photograph. Inspired by Irish nature and language.\n\nCreated for the GN! Game Jam (Spring 2025).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iof.jpg'),(4877,'House of Terror','2025-04-08','Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you have what it takes to survive the House of Terror? Step inside… if you dare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nvt.jpg'),(4878,'Karawan','2021-10-05','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Guide your caravan turn by turn through a crumbling word. Forage, mine and expand your following. Hire a Magus to perform world transforming spells, and finally reach the portal that will save...most of you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sap.jpg'),(4879,'The Gateway Trilogy','2020-03-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Guide a character through a series of rooms. Solve puzzles to advance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uus.jpg'),(4880,'Spec Ops: Airborne Commando','2002-10-31','Shooter, Strategy, Tactical','PlayStation 3, PlayStation','The first Spec Ops title on the PlayStation to feature a third-person 3D shooting style, Spec Ops: Airborne Commando literally drops you behind enemy lines as an elite U. S. Ranger paratrooper equipped with essential gear and a lethal arsenal. Weapons include a standard military knife, a Colt 1911A1 Semiautomatic pistol, silenced M4 rifle, sniper rifle (Barret M82A1), the M3 RAAW reusable launcher rifle, hand grenades, and C4 demolition packs. Binoculars, a laptop, and a handheld radio round out the inventory, with satellite imaging available for locating positions of rangers, checkpoints, helicopter extractions, and both real and decoy SAM launchers.\n\nPlayers earn awards and promotions for successfully completing the 16 missions, with scores based on factors such as reconnaissance and intelligence recovered, rescue of hostages, enemies killed, and demolition. Ten ranks can be achieved, ranging from Private E1 to Sergeant Major and, depending on success, six decorations and medals can be earned, including The Purple Heart, Bronze or Silver Stars and the Congressional Medal of Honor. Airborne Commando features five difficulty settings, ranging from Super Easy (10 extra lives) to Super Hard (no extra lives).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gfv.jpg'),(4881,'We Bowling?!','2025-04-01','Platform, Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','WeBowling?! is built from the ground up for Speedrunners. In this game you take control of a bowling ball of your choosing and make your way through the obstacles in the fastest amount of time.\n\nEach of the 5 current levels (more to come) contains its own steam leaderboard so you have 5 chances to get the WR.\n\nWith force sensitivity options and ball selection, you have all the means necessary to tailor the game to your exact specifications!\n\nObstacles range from mini-golf esque obstacles like windmills and spinners to more mundane ones like.... a rock!\n\nDo you have what it takes to bowl a strike?? Let\'s find out....\n\nI only have one question for you....\n\nWe Bowling?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ipy.jpg'),(4882,'Double Trip','2025-05-08','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Double Trip is a tile-based sokoban game about solving puzzles with the help of two friendly characters. Travel through a beautiful island by learning how its different elements interact with each other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s4f.jpg'),(4883,'Ball Drop','2025-03-06','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Get the ball to the end zone safely. Without exploding!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m8j.jpg'),(4884,'Vicious Star: Kill All','2023-07-27','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Vicious Star\" is an engaging turn-based strategy game, thrusting you into the role of a village guardian fighting intense battles. Within the game, you\'ll assemble your team, mixing and matching various characters and runes, and deploying unique skills to obliterate the monsters menacing your home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6syk.jpg'),(4885,'Multi Level Car Parking Simulator',NULL,'Racing, Sport','Sin plataforma','Multi Level Car Parking Simulator now bigger and better than ever before! It’s all you’ve been waiting for! Park at the ultra-realistic multi-level car park, in a variety of awesome cars. Can you handle them all?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4886,'Ava\'s Hidden Adventures',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Search for hidden objects in hand-drawn, highly interactive worlds of imagination. Ava\'s magic pencil makes her drawings come to life! Choose a drawing and enter it. Twang trees, break rocks, tickle ninjas, poke goblins, have fun and relax, as you adventure with Ava.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8eo1.jpg'),(4887,'Furry Twins Oshikake Kemomimi Twins',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Dog Ears! Cat Ears! Fox Ears!\nIs this a curse, or a test of love?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aje.jpg'),(4888,'Bento Bugs','2024-10-07','Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Dispatching these simple beetles should be no problem at all! Protect your food from pesky pests! If you’re lucky, you might catch an illusive scarab. Winner of Ludum Dare game jam 56.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bi0.jpg'),(4889,'Ace Combat 7: Skies Unknown - 8 Popular Squadron Emblems','2019-01-16','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This DLC pack includes eight emblems from older Ace Combat games: Aquila, Wardog, Garuda, Gryphus, and low-visibility versions of each. It can only be purchased directly in Japan (all platforms) and Asia (PS4 and Xbox One); in all other regions, it is only available in special editions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7m7a.jpg'),(4890,'Nightly Maintenance','2022-04-11','Puzzle, Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Nightly Maintenance is a psychological horror hidden object game. Play as Malcom, the maintenance worker, tasked with completing 3 tasks each night in a creepy, abandoned factory. Beware the watchful eyes of an oversized mannequin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68uf.jpg'),(4891,'Bring the Book Back','2025-04-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You wake up on the floor of a library, guilt-ridden for forgetting to return your borrowed book. Now, you find yourself trapped in an endless loop of bringing it back to ease your conscience, forced to check for anomalies to work off your debt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mcc.jpg'),(4892,'Subscribe To My Adventure','2020-04-29','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Android','Subscribe To My Adventure is an RPG that satirizes the real-world social media experience. As a newly-established livestreaming adventurer in the Kingdom of Ohfly, your task is to hack, slash and stream your way to becoming the biggest social-media sensation of all time, all while keeping the Kingdom safe from the many threats that surround it. EXPERIENCE the lifestyle of an adventurer! BASK in the adoration of your fans! FEEL VAGUELY ANNOYED by everyone in the comments sections! The Kingdom of Ohfly has all the phenomena you cherish in your real-life social networks: clickbait, cancelling, witch-hunts, misinformation, echo chambers, and more. Only now you get to whack it all with a sword!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86ox.jpg'),(4893,'Real Soccer 2007','2007-12-31','Sport','BlackBerry OS, Legacy Mobile Device','Real Soccer is a mobile phone sports video game franchise with gameplay emulating soccer. The series is developed and published by Gameloft. The Real Soccer series started in the mid-2000s with Real Soccer 2004, which was free on some mobile phones. As of 2016, a new installment of the series has been published every year. The games feature both national teams and local clubs, and allow the player to play in various \"real-life\" cups. Real Football 2008 was the first in the series to be published on more than just mobile phones, as a Nintendo DS version was also produced. Real Soccer 2009 added an iOS version, and expanded the team lineup. Real Soccer 2012 added an Android version. Real Soccer 2018 was the last game in the series to be released on Java ME.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70k0.jpg'),(4894,'Getting a Bottle of Water Simulator','2024-03-22','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The title is pretty self-explanatory. Get the bottle of water.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i6r.jpg'),(4895,'Kamigami no Asobi: Ludere Deorum','2013-10-24','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Kamigami no Asobi: Ludere Deorum, abbreviated as KamiAso, is a Japanese otome game published by Broccoli (company). It was released in Japan on October 24, 2013 for the PlayStation Portable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lsl.jpg'),(4896,'Lies of P','2023-09-18','Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','Inspired by the familiar story of Pinocchio, Lies of P is an action souls-like game set in a dark Belle Époque world. Guide Pinocchio on his unrelenting journey to become human.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lxr.jpg'),(4897,'Fist\'s Elimination Tower','2017-08-28','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A 2D platformer in which you play as randomly generated contestants that have to bounce their way to the top of an obstacle course full of robots, electric currents, explosives, and fists.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24hb.jpg'),(4898,'Moonstone Island: Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j93.jpg'),(4899,'The Fall Part 2: Unbound','2018-02-13','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Continue ARID\'s journey of self discovery as she\'s thrust into a challenging and bizarre adventure that will test your wits as a player. The Fall Part 2: Unbound will put you in perspectives that you haven\'t seen before in a game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23cb.jpg'),(4900,'Personal Sam-Y',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A SAM-Y of your very own.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4901,'Mire','2021-08-05','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Mire is like a very small metroidvania, but nothing is gated. You can visit any area, in any order. There are \'upgrades\' that you might find useful but they are not necessary, and you can just pick up the ones you want. It\'s more about exploration, of seeing something at the corner of the screen and figuring out how to get there.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ntc.jpg'),(4902,'Wally the Seal 2','2024-10-18','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The new entry in the Wally The Seal series arrives! You were able to escape the mazes last time, but your second go around won\'t be so easy!\n\nIn Wally The Seal 2, your objective is to find and collect 4 mysterious flowers from each of the levels. Use the new Salmon Radar to track the flowers while avoiding Wally The Seal and his partner Mrs. Wally.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ykl.jpg'),(4903,'Symphoni','2025-03-06','Music, Indie','Meta Quest 2','A virtual reality rhythm game where you can be a grand musical wizard who breathes new life into classical music.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4904,'How to Fool a Liar King','2017-10-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Regina, the heroine of our story, finds herself magically transported to the land of Eroolia, clueless about how to return home. She meets Juli and his companions who are in the middle of a journey to Laarz, a country of cat people. Will she find out how to get back home? Or will she fall in love before that happens? Find out in this game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26u4.jpg'),(4905,'Hyper Princess Pitch','2011-12-31','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hyper Princess Pitch is an 8-directional shoot\'em up where players fight Santa with explosions','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qds.jpg'),(4906,'X-Booster','2020-12-03','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','X-Booster is a fun and innovative way to enjoy an intensive VR full-body workout! Stand and fight off the pounds in the virtual arena. Punch, cut, block, and dodge your way to a slimmer you! Start burning those calories with handcrafted tracks or your own MP3 files.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l8r.jpg'),(4907,'RedCat Spookkasteel','2000-12-31','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grizella, the wicked witch, has captured WhizzKitty and only RedCat can save her! RedCat must search in and around the magical haunted castle. RedCat will have to face numerous enemies in five different worlds. In the forest, the castle, the caves, the graveyard, and the castle tower, Brutus and Max are also hiding and will try to thwart RedCat at the most unexpected times! Along the way, RedCat will encounter creepy and enchanted creatures such as giant spiders, red-nosed bats, poison frogs, and brightly colored ghosts!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co527q.jpg'),(4908,'Digdig','2024-09-10','Racing, Arcade','Playdate','A casual game where you turn a crank and dig the ground more and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ta6.jpg'),(4909,'Spilled Mushrooms','2024-09-24','Puzzle, Strategy, Card & Board Game','Playdate','Spilled Mushrooms is a card puzzle game with quick and charming puzzles. Using a small deck of critter cards, you need to strategically collect every mushroom from each region within a short number of turns. Each card has its own unique behaviors that can combo with - and against - other cards, leading to a complex system of synergies and sticky situations. Puzzles are procedurally generated, meaning every delivery is a completely one-of-a-kind challenge with at least one solution. While most of your deliveries can be completed with ease, some of them may leave you scrambling to collect that last mushroom!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vby.jpg'),(4910,'Hero of Allacrost','2015-06-30','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hero of Allacrost is a single player 2D role-playing game inspired by classic console RPGs. The player will explore rich environments, solve challenging dungeon puzzles, and fight strategic battles in an active-time system. The game is distributed for free as open-source software and is available across several platforms including Windows, OS X, Linux, and FreeBSD.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4911,'Snow Battle Princess Sayuki','2019-03-20','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Sayuki, a cute and powerful snow goddess is on a quest to save her beloved human boy, from the evil curse of the demon! An exciting, retro style, scrolling shooter. Go to the world of Japanese myth!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gfj.jpg'),(4912,'Minecraft: Tricky Trials','2024-06-13','Simulator, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Tricky Trials is an update for Minecraft: Java Edition filled with daring adventures and surprising rewards. Hunt for the trial chambers, and take on the challenge that awaits you in this sprawling copper structure. Fight off unfamiliar foes like the bogged and the breeze in your hunt for an elusive trial key! Then unlock your reward from the vault, a block that makes adventuring fun for every player, no matter the size of your party.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d3r.jpg'),(4913,'Trepang2: Banger Edition',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6npr.jpg'),(4914,'Witch Rise','2023-04-26','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','An old-school style inspired FPS featuring some action RPG elements, like leveling system, a metroidvania style exploration and 2D sprites in a 3D environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jaf.jpg'),(4915,'Arden: The World of William Shakespeare','2007-11-27','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Developed by an Indiana University team led by Edward Castronova, Arden was intended as a platform both for conducting research on economics and social systems in virtual worlds and for educating users about Shakespeare.\n\nThe project was discontinued due to inadequate funding and dissatisfaction with the gameplay, with a release of what had been completed as a custom Neverwinter Nights module primarily based on Richard III.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50qm.jpg'),(4916,'Sinergy','2019-07-15','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sick and tired of those custom wads full of boring old tech places, straightforward monster placement and non stop Romero\'izms? Then you\'re in the wrong place because this wad is nothing but straight vintage Doom styled fun with everyone\'s favorite tropes such as pistol fights on beginning levels, misaligned textures, homages, a shit load of secrets and all round classic Doom gameplay! As is tradition each episode takes you to new locales and unleashes harder threats!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75ci.jpg'),(4917,'Negative Nancy','2021-10-23','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Hate your job? You are Nancy, a retail clerk at Megamart. Take control of your life by saying “NO” to incompetent bosses, demanding friends, and delusional customers in the first ever interactive sitcom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qte.jpg'),(4918,'Warhammer 40,000: Darktide - Grim Protocols','2024-12-03','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','This update will include:\nNew Game Mode - Havoc: Think you’ve mastered the threat over Tertium? Think again. Havoc is a new end-game experience that will test the resolve of the most seasoned operative. Be ready to face daunting challenges and earn new cosmetic rewards. We’ve posted an initial dev blog about this, and we’re working on finishing the Q&A post to follow.\nNew Mission - Dark Communion: Return to the Carnival and explore its darkest corners. Steel yourself as you face hordes of cultists who will stop at nothing to achieve their Dark Communion. We are working on a dev blog for this.\nThree New Weapon Families: Tear through waves of enemies by wielding the destructive might of the Two-Handed Force and Power Swords, and the Ogryn Heavy Stubber.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co922f.jpg'),(4919,'PBA Pro Bowling 2021','2020-12-21','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','PBA Pro Bowling 2021 is the ultimate game for all bowling fans! Play online versus your friends, or start your PBA Career in a deep single player experience. This game has something for everyone with options for both an authentic simulation mode or an explosive arcade style of gameplay!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nmh.jpg'),(4920,'Hamster','2024-06-28','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hamster is an idle clicker game in which you click a Hamster to make him shiver. Each click has a random chance to make him shake a little more, or a little less. Can you make him go crazy?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8foi.jpg'),(4921,'Mecha and Tank Fighting','2021-03-15','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mecha and Tank Fighting is a high degree of freedom sandbox game. Players need to drive multiple mecha tanks to fight, upgrade and obtain equipment and companions on a 100 square kilometer map.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nrl.jpg'),(4922,'Pelican Post',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pelican Post is a cozy narrative game about delivering mail to a town of unique characters and helping to regain a lost sense of community.\n\nYou play as Pepper, a young pelican who recently moved to Port Pleasant to take a job as the town\'s mailman. Through your job, you\'ll get to interact with and get to know the townsfolk and help them out.\n\n\"Small acts of kindness\" is pretty much in the job description.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n02.jpg'),(4923,'Super Mario Bros. Z: The Game','2014-10-01','Fighting','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super Mario Bros. Z: The Game is a fan game made in Unity based on the Super Mario Bros. Z animated series by Mark \"Alvin Earthworm\" Haynes. The game is a 1 on 1 fighting game starring the characters from the animated series, which borrows characters from the Mario and Sonic universes.\n\nThe game is based on the original series, not the reboot, and is actually the second Super Mario Bros. Z game by the same creator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7u2e.jpg'),(4924,'Train Valley 2: Workshop Gems - Emerald',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t6d.jpg'),(4925,'Anonymous Hacker Simulator','2024-04-03','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the shoes of a skilled Anonymous hacker and embark on a mission to unveil the truth hidden behind a sinister organization\'s plans to monitor civilian data and enforce mass surveillance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co717n.jpg'),(4926,'Chicken Nuggets',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Racing, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Chicken Nuggets is a roll a ball puzzle game set in the countryside as an adorable round chicken. Solve puzzles on a journey that will take your far from your coop!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cob.jpg'),(4927,'Anno 1602: Creation of a New World','1998-09-24','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It is the year 1602 and you find yourself in command of a sailing vessel, navigating the waters of the uncharted island world of Anker. You have aboard your ship no more than an handful of trusty followers and a limited supply of food and building materials. You are here to begin a new life. As you select which island to settle, your future is already sealed, for each one has its own special characteristics.\nYour goal is to create a whole new world. Explore, construct, settle, trade and defend - that is the challenge that lies before you!\n\nAnno 1602 takes you into the world of construction strategy games. Build a realistic, living world for yourself according to your own ideas; your chosen strategy will decide the development and destiny of your towns and villages. Prove your diplomatic skills in your dealings with natives, your comrades and pirates too. Start by building up farms, plantations and small workshops to produce, then use your business acumen and begin to generate trade with your fellow players.\nBut beware, for with riches and prosperity also comes envy and anger! Train soldiers and build defensive structures to protect your property and wealth, or perhaps it may be wise to put your negotiation skills to use outside of business?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xv2.jpg'),(4928,'Hammer 2 Reloaded','2021-08-27','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Enjoy intense action in this third-person shooter action game. Your job is to clean city of crime in mutiple missions, each one with its own goal. The game features a fully Open World Environment. Improve your arsenal in the dedicated shop with cash you gained from previous missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3s8q.jpg'),(4929,'Eggconsole Marchen Veil PC-8801mkIISR','2024-01-11','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','The tale of a prince transformed into an ugly monster and cast to the ends of the world. Overcoming numerous challenges, he must now return to the princess!\nThis action RPG was released by System Sacom in 1985.\n\nThis game is the first part of the \"Märchen Veil\" series. The story of the first part is until you meet Neptunus, the god of the sea.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mx6.jpg'),(4930,'Tomorrow','2021-02-08','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, iOS','Tomorrow has come! Get ready to fight in a post apocalyptic wasteland where survival is an ongoing adventure. In Tomorrow: MMO Nuclear Quest, players are thrown into a post nuclear wasteland full of zombie, monsters, and hostile factions. Set in the 2060s, the open-world RPG allows you to complete different types of quests. You can craft essential items, defend against zombie who have managed to survive the apocalypse, and much more. Each quest tests your skills and forces you to adapt in this harsh post nuclear MMO wasteland.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ag2.jpg'),(4931,'Super Glitch Dash','2021-04-29','Platform, Puzzle, Racing, Arcade','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','Crack your knuckles and take a deep breath because the ultimate twitch runner has arrived. It’s called Super Glitch Dash for a reason, people: because it’s really, really super. Immerse yourself in jaw-dropping next-generation visuals that pulsate to the beat of the rhythm-driven gameplay. Feel the rush of your reflexes as you swipe your way past axes, hammers, lasers, meat grinders and spikes while trying to navigate the insane obstacle courses that comprise each stage. Grind rails, flip upside down, and scream into all-new indoor environments as the rollercoaster-like worlds unfold before your very eyes. We promise: surviving has never been so much fun. So if you’re looking for a really challenging impossible runner, then Super Glitch Dash is the game for you! Features • Simple controls, swipe to move • Spectacular twitch gameplay with unpredictable courses that zoom past you in the first-person • Incredible cutting-edge graphics take full advantage of powerful devices • Epic beat driven gameplay thumps to a grooving soundtrack • Make a Perfect Run and grab every collectible for the ultimate bragging rights Play today and test your skills!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yhr.jpg'),(4932,'Five Shows at Wario\'s',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Five Shows at Wario\'s is a fan game that combines the Wario franchise with the FNAF universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wwy.jpg'),(4933,'Strike Daz Cans','2021-05-29','Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Aim! Strike! Knock Down! The target of the game is knocking down the cans with as less throws as possible. This may sound easy, and it is early levels, but you\'ll have to cope with moving objects in higher levels making the game increasingly difficult. The game stores your progression in persistant storage alllowing you to suspend a play and take it over whenever your want.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4db0.jpg'),(4934,'Hazel the Plant Witch','2020-11-02','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A kind and cosy game about listening to others. \n \nPeople say talking to plants helps them grow. Hazel knows better. Most plants can\'t understand human speech. Luckily, Hazel is a brilliant techno witch who has made a gadget that will help her communicate to plants! By listening to plants, Hazel can record what plants are saying to her. This way, she can replay that dialogue to other plants and have a real conversation with a plant in their own language! \n \nCan Hazel overcome the limitations of speaking in pre-recorded messages and help her plant friends out?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k2j.jpg'),(4935,'Staroot','2025-06-30','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','1-person Topdown strategy game. Plant seeds to defend enemy and grow roots. Terraforming the planets!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lo8.jpg'),(4936,'Multiworlds','2023-12-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Multiworlds\" is an online multiplayer game that revolves around the emergence of a terrifying glitch that affects various world environments. As the game\'s hero, your task is to solve this problem. The game features immersive 3D graphics and includes a variety of puzzles and challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7f3g.jpg'),(4937,'Vortex: The Gateway','2016-03-22','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vortex: The Gateway is an open world survival horror game with two game modes. If you want to survive then be alert, sneak, build and fight. Meanwhile life back on Earth changes dramatically. What changes? You will get bits of information through your adventure. Prepare for the worst!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1k87.jpg'),(4938,'Burnout Crash!','2011-09-20','Puzzle, Racing, Arcade','PlayStation 3, iOS, Xbox 360','Burnout Crash! is a downloadable action driving title in the Burnout video game series. It is developed by Criterion Games and published by Electronic Arts for PlayStation 3, Xbox 360, iOS and Android via PlayStation Network, Xbox Live Arcade, iTunes App Store and Google Play Store.\n\nIn Burnout Crash!, players drive into an intersection and attempt to cause as big a pile-up as possible. Unlike previous games in the series, Burnout Crash! is played from a bird\'s-eye or aerial view. Points are earned for causing damage and destroying the environment and other vehicles. Leaderboards powered by EA\'s Autolog service enable players to compare scores with other players.\n\nThe game features three game modes and six different intersections to play, as well as seven drivable vehicles, for example the Vegas Saloon. The Xbox 360 version of the game also includes a Kinect mode, allowing players to use gestures to control the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co213h.jpg'),(4939,'The Book of the Dead',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','This is a story where you are a Grim Reaper. On the night of the 31st of October (Halloween) every year, Grim Reaper gets a chance to save only one person. Get to know all of the characters by hearing their stories and make your choice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8v09.jpg'),(4940,'War of the Visions: Final Fantasy Brave Exvius','2020-03-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','Android, iOS','War of the Visions: Final Fantasy Brave Exvius is a tactical role playing game that takes place on the continent of Ardra on the world of Lapis. Summon units and level up characters to unlock new abilities .\n\n\"In this war-torn world with sword in hand for what would you fight - what would you protect ? The Visions are with the ring...\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mkl.jpg'),(4941,'Suez Canal Simulator',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Drive Real 1:1 Scale Ships Thru The World Famous Suez Canal!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42l1.jpg'),(4942,'Courier of the Crypts','2019-04-19','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Courier of the Crypts is a 2D puzzle adventure game where you have to survive as a Courier on his first errand to the ominous crypts. Main tool to achieve the mission is a Magic Torch which you use to illuminate your path, defend from darkness and solve puzzles - it must never run out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1kxd.jpg'),(4943,'Phantom of Inferno','2002-09-10','Visual Novel','DVD Player, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Phantom of Inferno is a story detailing the life of a 15-year-old Japanese boy who is kidnapped after witnessing the killing of a reporter. After being kidnapped his memories of his past life are erased and is given the choice to join Inferno or die. He makes the only choice he can to join and is given the name Zwei and will study under Ein. She is also known as Phantom since this is the title given to the organization\'s top assassin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sd7.jpg'),(4944,'Mace and Grace','2019-05-15','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Protect your Grace and Kingdom. Have a blast dodging bombs and smashing enemy knights. Seize the day and go for another round. Play the most furious Medieval arcade ever!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mql.jpg'),(4945,'Space Pirate Sara','2015-02-20','Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sarah is a most terrible pirate knight who dances her way around the galaxy empire that has been ravaged by war. In the galaxy ruled by a number of power-hungry rival warlords, an evil sadistic web is woven around Sarah, who is slowly guided down to her destruction. When the silver knight Sylia comes across the evil aristocrats who have run the gamut of corruption in the galaxy and the slave traders of darkness, the demonic twins, a desperate predicament is visited upon Sarah!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h8e.jpg'),(4946,'Gem Hunter','2021-04-27','Role-playing (RPG)','iOS','“Gem Hunter” (Cazador de gemas) is an MMORPG game that combines combat, gathering, farming and social interaction in one, with a variety of game mechanics and a classic PVP experience. Here you will find charming characters within a super adorable and romantic anime-style virtual world.\n\nDefeat terrible “Bosses” to raise your level and unlock extravagant abilities, also get the company of a faithful “Companion”, cute “Streales”, legendary “Gods” and among others. You can also create or join a guild for a more interactive and exciting adventure with other players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8aiy.jpg'),(4947,'Astro Emporia','2015-02-02','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Astro Emporia is a CASUAL turn based randomised trading game where your objective is to make as much money in a limited amount of turns.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a2d.jpg'),(4948,'Hammer & Sickle','2005-12-05','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hammer & Sickle is a turn-based strategy game with role playing elements that uses the Silent Storm engine and universe. The year is 1949, with the Cold War between the US and Soviet Union looming and both sides uneasy at the thought of an atomic war occurring. The player takes the role of a Soviet commando on an undercover mission to meet a contact in Allied-occupied Germany. However, things go badly for this meeting, leaving the protagonist without proper support, equipment, and identification papers. Behind Allied-occupied lines, the player must attempt to stop a rogue third party intent on initiating World War III between the US and Russia.\n\nPlayers can choose to start with one of 6 player classes: Soldier, Grenadier, Scout, Sniper, Medic, and Engineer. Additionally, there are opportunities throughout the game to recruit additional characters to round out the party\'s abilities. The game itself features a branching plot where the player\'s actions and dealings with NPC\'s can have serious consequences later on. For example, an intelligent character may be able to talk his way out of a situation, and killing Allied soldiers may prompt more patrols later on and slide the situation towards World War III.\n\nHammer & Sickle also features heavy squad-based combat, and it inherits the turn-based engine from Silent Storm. Players spend Action Points to perform various actions in battle each turn, while the enemy does the same. The engine also models realistic looking physics that feature ragdoll animations, bullet ricochet, and destructible environments. As for available equipment, there are 90 weapons and variants that can be found or bought.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x88.jpg'),(4949,'Monopoly Family Fun Pack','2014-11-18','Strategy, Quiz/Trivia, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','A new era of Monopoly for home consoles! The Monopoly Family Fun Pack gathers the 3 Monopoly Games:\n\n- Monopoly PLU: the classic Monopoly with a 3D animated board!\n- My Monopoly, to create your very own board\n- Monopoly Deal, a fast-paced and addictive Monopoly card-game\n\nEnjoy the classic Monopoly in new fun ways, with your friends and people all around the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gw4.jpg'),(4950,'Shin Megami Tensei: Nine','2002-12-05','Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox','Shin Megami Tensei: Nine was published by Atlus and released on Xbox, exclusively in Japan, in 2002.\n\nForming part of the Megami Tensei series, Nine takes place in the period of time between Shin Megami Tensei and its sequel, with the survivors of Tokyo\'s destruction sheltering in underground bunkers. Taking on the role of a debugger, the player navigates the Idea Space virtual world set up by the survivors of Tokyo\'s destruction, which has come under attack by demonic beings called \"noise\". The gameplay has the player navigating a customized avatar in third-person through the virtual world of Tokyo, battling enemies using a real-time command-based battle system. Despite its title, it is the eighth game in the Megami Tensei series. The game\'s title instead refers to the number of possible moral alignments available to players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2y9r.jpg'),(4951,'Rooftop Rascal: The Alley Cat','2024-06-30','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i5b.jpg'),(4952,'Kamikuishiki-mura Monogatari','1995-06-29','Strategy, Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series','Kamikuishiki-mura Monogatari is a satirical Japanese doujin resource management strategy game developed by HappySoft and published by Aum Soft. Game satirises the Aum Shinrikyo cult and the 1995 Tokyo subway sarin gas attack orchestrated by the cult. A common misconception is that the game was produced by the cult as propaganda, whereas Kamikuishiki-mura Monogatari actually portrays Aum and the sarin gas attack negatively, mocking its members and showing footage of \'humiliating\' media coverage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wkn.jpg'),(4953,'CosmoDreamer','2020-10-03','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','From the popular free game \"Outside\" comes a dreamy and cute barrage shmups. The visuals are colorful, cute and fantastic, and the game features active gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38q8.jpg'),(4954,'WordTactics',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','WordTactics is a single-player strategic word puzzle game. You place letter tiles in a grid, then select adjacent letters to form words and score points. WordTactics is more strategic than most word puzzle games because it requires players to think critically to obtain the highest scores.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ndp.jpg'),(4955,'Glyde the Dragon',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Witness an epic story as Glyde and Wing set out on an adventure to find out the cause of mysterious corruption! Use 8 elemental forms with more than 60 different abilities! Explore the world, collect crystals, save other dragons and gain more insight into the story as you progress!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rjc.jpg'),(4956,'Cinderstone Online','2023-05-31','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Cinderstone Online is a cute and colorful MMORPG. Protect the world from the rivalry gods wanting their stolen lands back. Climb your way for glory, farming, trading, conquering and becoming the ruler of a region. Explore and find new locations filled with rewarding loot and mysteries to uncover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co553f.jpg'),(4957,'Vampire\'s Kiss','2023-10-19','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Unleash your lust and your thirst in a battle for the soul of London! Will passion lead you back to humanity, or will you embrace the night as a vampire?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8b3e.jpg'),(4958,'Arcade Game Series: Dig Dug','2016-04-19','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','First appearing in arcades in 1982, Dig Dug finally comes to Xbox One!\nDig up, down, left, and right and burrow through the earth.\nInflate and pop enemies with your harpoon to defeat them, or squish them with a rock.\nLure enemies into a tunnel and crush several at once for massive points.\nDefeat all the enemies on the screen to advance to the next stage!\n\nPerform a range of techniques, including the rock drop and the \"pump and stall,\" using just 4 directions and a single button! The original and best \"underground smash hit!\"\nWith cute pixel-art graphics, vivid colors, rhythmical beats, and distinctive SFX, the beauty really is in the details.\nThis latest port comes with scanline and sound settings, and the option to switch between the old and new versions - perfect for devoted diggers!\nEnjoy the masterpiece that fervent fans have flocked to play!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i6x.jpg'),(4959,'Sentinel','2023-01-29','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore, fight, and grow stronger as you progress through this 2D Metroidvania-style platformer. Can you uncover the secrets that hide on our moon?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62vf.jpg'),(4960,'Monster Trucks Kids Racing Game','2016-05-13','Sin género','iOS','Monster Truck Racing Game for young kids and toddlers! get Ready, Set, GO!\n\nIf your kids love all things monster trucks, Then they will love this game! Monster Trucks racing game for young kids and toddlers!\n\nDesigned for young Children and toddlers between ages 2 to 8 years old, Simple controls to drive the monster trucks along the course. the truck never flips ensuring your child always gets to the finish line! \n\nRace against other trucks, Which slow down when they are ahead, to give your child the best chance of winning each race!\n\nFun big buttons to Jump, Beep the horn and change the music track for lots of fun sounds.\n\nCrush the cars along the course in the monster machines, Collect stars, Fireworks and balloon popping are at the end of each level to give more excitement to the kids playing.\n\nThere is 4 mini games included.\nBalloon Pop\nMemory Cards\nPuzzles\nColoring pages\n\nWith 15 cool looking monster trucks across 42 levels to blaze across, will create hours of fun for your toddlers.\n\nMonster Trucks Kids Game helps your child understand the educational mechanics of using mobile and tablet devices. with puzzles, memory card and heaps of fun racing action.\n\nFeatures:\n* 15 Monster Trucks to choose from\n* 42 Levels to play\n* Fun Cartoon HD graphics\n* 5 different kids music sound tracks for the child to switch between.\n* Cute Monster trucks, engines, horns + much more vibrant sounds \n* Balloon pop game & Fireworks at the end of each race.\n* Mini Games such as Puzzles, Coloring pages, Memory Cards & Balloon Pop\n+ much more.\n\nIf you\'re having any problems with this app, or would like any updates/enhancements, feel free to contact us at webnowau@gmail.com. We would love to hear from you as we are committed to updating all our games and apps for the best possible user experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/swbfotenyhwoalxahu2z.jpg'),(4961,'Spy Tactics','2019-07-12','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Spy Tactics is a mix of puzzle and turn-based strategy about fascinating adventures of a spy.\n\nDevelop your strategy and move the player on a grid, using tricks and tactics. There are many difficult missions waiting for you ahead: destructing special objects, obtaining the secret data, murdering dangerous enemies, stealing classified information. Calculate every step you make! Enemies are armed, but your espionage skills will allow you to remain unnoticed and get into top secret rooms!\n\nmany levels with their own secrets\nseveral options of passing the levels – tactical/strength\nbeautiful visual style, area and locations\npicking mechanical locks\nhacking computer terminals\nenemies of various strength and with various abilities\ncomplicated puzzles that only the real agent can solve!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1msp.jpg'),(4962,'Free Bowling 3D','2017-10-07','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the bowling 3D. Free game with no rules, just throw the ball and knocking the pins, soft music and beautiful 3D graphics.\nEnjoy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bg4.jpg'),(4963,'Animal Fun for Toddlers and Kids','2020-04-23','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Tap the different animals to interact with them and hear their common sounds or other funny noises. Some animals and little surprises are hidden within the game. Can you find all secrets?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56zw.jpg'),(4964,'Marvel Comics: X-Men - Tiger Barcodzz','1994-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','A handheld video game based on Marvel\'s superheroes X-Men.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vyi.jpg'),(4965,'Clostrophobia: Vol 1','2024-08-10','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Clostrophobia is a short difficult horror game where you find yourself trapped inside an unusual and deadly air duct maze filled with unpredictable monsters and deadly traps, and you have to find your way out of it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8o30.jpg'),(4966,'Pokémon Advanced: Cyber Poké Ball 2','2005-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','Handheld Electronic LCD','This is the second version of the Cyber Poké Ball, a simple RPG set in the Pokémon universe and contained within a handheld shaped like a Poké Ball. The units come in several colors and patterns. In the game, players explore a map to find wild Pokémon and battle them. A weakened wild Pokémon can be captured and added to the party; the player may own a maximum of three Pokémon at a time. Pokémon automatically evolve upon reaching certain level thresholds. Players may challenge area bosses, which will grant access to new parts of the world upon their defeat. They may also use the device\'s connectivity features to battle other nearby players. Special chips, which came packaged with various Pokémon toys made by Bandai, could be inserted into the device in order to access new content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yaq.jpg'),(4967,'Tank Brawl 2: Armor Fury','2021-03-26','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A unique shoot-up tank game with vehicle/driver RGP upgrade system inspired by Final Fantasy and Titan Quest. Other features such as impressive and satisfying visual of tanks blowing up are just added bonuses for your playing pleasure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u35.jpg'),(4968,'Snowboarder XS','2003-12-13','Sport','Web browser','Choose your character, snowboard down a realistic 2 km of piste, collect stars and perform amazing tricks in this fantastic game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co954i.jpg'),(4969,'Bigfoot Quest','2024-02-17','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Embark on an adventure of a lifetime and explore the forests of the Pacific Northwest in search of the famously elusive Bigfoot. Many books have been written, many blurry photos have been taken, but has anyone really found Bigfoot? Discover beautiful landscapes, find clues, and solve puzzles along the way in this point-and-click style puzzle adventure game.\n\nYour Uncle Henry has set up camp deep in the forest of the Pacific Northwest in search of the mysterious Bigfoot. He asks for your help as he is close to discovering the location of Bigfoot’s den. Will you find Bigfoot?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p9k.jpg'),(4970,'Uprising','2021-08-30','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Uprising is a narrative driven DOOM2 megawad for limit removing ports (tested on Crispy Doom). It features an extensive dehacked patch with changes to weapons and monsters, alongside varied maps and gameplay. You\'ll be fighting through wastelands, abandoned facilities, hellish installations, ruined cities, frozen techbases and beyond...\n\nThe intended difficulity is UV but all other skills are implemented. There is something for everyone, including maps dripping with atmosphere, non linear keyhunts, short shootouts, frantic slaughter and a few true epics. Don\'t worry if you\'re intimidated, the largest fights have been inundated with powerups on the lower difficulties to allow the budding tourist to explore safely.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6std.jpg'),(4971,'Mr. Death: The Violent Silence',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mr. Death is a Terrifying Thriller where you take place as a detective named Sebastian Moonshade in the open world of Woodcarve Town. Your mission is to investigate the murders of the killer Vincent Crowfield whilst playing against his state-of-the-art AI that learns from your actions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8m6i.jpg'),(4972,'Alien Wall',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Alien Wall is a powerful genre mix between a brick breaker and ‘shoot em up’. Modern retro Arcade fun at its best!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5783.jpg'),(4973,'Spark Five','2018-11-18','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome to Project Spark. Help our little android friend navigate across multiple, challenging levels in search of bio-matter. You see, we are in desperate need of those primarily to restore human civilization and undo the damage caused by our own problem child - Artificial Intelligence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41wv.jpg'),(4974,'Omen of Sorrow','2021-09-15','Fighting, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Omen of Sorrow is a classic 2D, four-button fighting game, with Unreal Engine 4 powered graphics, a cast of 12 characters inspired by classical horror, fantasy and mythology, and a battle system designed from the ground up to leverage player skill, rather than stats or random chance, featuring deep combat mechanics that favor movement and spacing over tight execution to provide an engaging experience for pros and newcomers alike!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m8l.jpg'),(4975,'NoSleep: Nightmare Chronicles',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a an unforgettable narrative journey with NoSleep: Nightmare Chronicles, a chilling collection of interactive horror stories from the r/NoSleep subreddit. Explore immersive environments, face grotesque encounters, and fight to survive in this gripping anthology of terror.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82le.jpg'),(4976,'True Bliss','2015-05-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Modify geometry and experience a gaming genre that is truly unique, different, beautiful and serene all in one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w14.jpg'),(4977,'Maybe: Interactive Stories - Keeper of Mine','2020-01-20','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Keeper of Mine is based off of the novel and promotional webtoon, I\'ll Protect the Second Male Lead\'s Love! During the events of the book, you control and play as Leah Stephilia De Lenokyn as she navigates the world of \'From Hostage to Empress\', a novel read shortly before her transmigration. Eager to save the tragic fate of the second male lead, Ain, she pushes the female lead towards him in hopes they can trigger their happy ending. Will she be able to save the second male lead\'s love?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sio.jpg'),(4978,'No Reloading: Survival Trials','2024-01-30','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Infinite destruction in infinite combinations! No Reloading: Survival Trials is a third-person rogue-lite style shooter taking inspiration from classics like Max Payne. Slay simulants, earn upgrades, and look cool while doing it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jh5.jpg'),(4979,'Gun Nac','1991-09-01','Shooter','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','The most happening place in the universe is the trendy, upscale solar system of IOTA Synthetica, part of the Galactic Federation of artificial stars. It\'s as far from dirty old Earth as can be... But don\'t sign up to go yet! A strange cosmic energy field with a major attitude has engulfed the system, and the most outrageous things are happening. Ordinary inanimate objects are coming to life - harmless little animals are becoming rabid giants - and the freaked-out residents are under attack! The only Galactic Commander who can handle this ordeal is the eccentric renegade called Gun-Nac. He can oust this aura that\'s threatening the destruction of comfortable artificial life as we know it. But where in the universe is he? He could be as far away as Earth, searching for a new Game Pak. Commander Gun-Nac, if you read this, call H.Q., A.S.A.P., O.K.? We N.E.E.D. you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nzm.jpg'),(4980,'Front Line','1984-12-31','Shooter','Atari 2600','Front Line is a vertically scrolling action game. Your mission is to infiltrate enemy territory and destroy their fortress. To reach the fortress, you will have to make your way through varied and dangerous terrain. Jungles, deserts, brush, and rocks all slow your progress, plus each area has numerous enemy fighters and tanks trying to stop you. To help get past these obstacles, you are armed with a machine gun and grenades; at some points in the game you may even come across an abandoned tank which you can control to increase your odds of survival. When you reach the end of the level and successfully destroy the fortress, the game will repeat at a higher level of difficulty. Gameplay is for one or two players, and four different skill levels are available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mp1.jpg'),(4981,'Zakesta-Z','2024-01-20','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zakesta-Z is the newest version of the shoot \'em up that challenges players to blast their way through a total of five stages, with a main shot that can be powered up 5 levels and an array of sub-weapons that can be powered up 3 levels. The game also includes a stage select feature that allows players to practice previously-cleared stages with infinite lives, as well as a sound test that unlocks upon clearing the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ipw.jpg'),(4982,'RPGolf','2017-11-15','Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','RPGolf is an exciting blend of classic JRPG with 8-bit golf. Relive the nostalgia of the classic gaming age, but in an exciting new mash-up that combines the best of both worlds.\n\nRPGolf seamlessly blends golf and RPG into one game. Battling monsters will level you up, allowing you to hit the ball further. Discovering new clubs and gloves scattered around the world will improve your golf game, and also give you the edge in combat. By blending 2 game styles together, RPGolf creates a brand-new take on both.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eqz.jpg'),(4983,'Vtuber Simulator','2021-08-08','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A simulation game where you\'re a Vtuber and need to reach milestones to improve. You can train yourself and stream.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4imn.jpg'),(4984,'Tinseltown Dreams',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4985,'The Curse of Silent Marshes','2014-02-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You must save your friends from a vengeful voodoo spirit dressed as a circus clown. Move quickly and use your resources wisely in The Curse of Silent Marshes, a hair-raising hidden object adventure that will have you wondering at first who\'s on your side.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52z3.jpg'),(4986,'I Doesn\'t Exist','2023-10-05','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Classic Zork meets Existential Crisis. A modern text adventure that explores themes of control, isolation and mental health while levelling up the genre with beautiful pixel art and AI.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52cc.jpg'),(4987,'Merry Christmas, Alfred Robbins','2008-12-22','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Merry Christmas, Alfred Robbins is a point-and-click adventure game made in roughly two weeks about an ordinary man who works hard to support his wife and son. Although it seems like it will be a very bleak Christmas in their household, Alfred does his best to make the situation better.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x47.jpg'),(4988,'The Walking Dead: Season One - Episode 2: Starved for Help','2013-08-20','Point-and-click','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Just like the first episode it consists of eight chapters and it picks up three months after the events of the first one, also taking into account choices that have been made in that earlier episode. This includes statements and decisions Lee has made that characters still remember, as well as major choices such as having taking along either Doug or Carley, which alters whether they are present or not in this second episode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v56.jpg'),(4989,'Arc Defence','2020-06-26','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Arc defence is a game in genre classic top down 2d tower defense, But in difference of classic TD, enemies can fight back. Use towers upgrades and special abilities to stop waves. Be ready for epic battle and try to protect our lands!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45tf.jpg'),(4990,'Airport Madness 3',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4991,'Shadow Watch','2000-03-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Congratulations, Soldier, You\'ve been recruited to lead an elite corporate commando squad. \n \nAs chief of security, it\'s your job to stop a deadly plot to destroy the construction of the world\'s first international space station. \n \nThere\'s no end to the adventure, or the danger, when you step into the shadows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ypz.jpg'),(4992,'Trajectory of Summer Flower','2017-09-16','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Let\'s make a promise... When I grow up, I\'ll find you.\" By complete chance, these two childhood friends meet again after 10 years apart, but this time, will he be able to hold on to her? Or, will he lose here again forever? A love story about a summer trip in the countryside.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8e05.jpg'),(4993,'Nayuta no Kiseki: Kai','2021-12-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nayuta no Kiseki—an ambitious entry in the Trails series originally released for PSP in 2012 that adopts action RPG-style gameplay—returns for PlayStation 4 as the latest entry in the Kai series (enhanced ports of older Falcom games).\n\nIn addition to new illustrations for the main characters, new illustrations have also been added for each of the characters that appear on “Remnant Island,” where the game’s story is set. Graphical elements have also been significantly enhanced, including dedicated illustrations for event scenes and other visual aspects.\n\nThere are also various other upgrades that take advantage of PlayStation 4, including 60 frames per second support, high-definition image quality, and high-quality background music and sound effects, making the story of Nayuta no Kiseki more accessible than ever before.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yt5.jpg'),(4994,'Ryza Roads','2017-12-17','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A open-world racing game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2chr.jpg'),(4995,'Super Jigsaw Puzzle: Cities','2018-05-29','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','If you like to make puzzles, Super Jigsaw Puzzle: Cities is your game.\n\nTravel the world enjoying its comfortable and intuitive interface and its relaxing music that will allow you to concentrate on the difficult task of solving these beautiful photos that pose a real challenge for lovers of puzzles.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(4996,'The Story of Henry Bishop','2019-10-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The story of Henry Bishop is a first-person psychological thriller, where the player will have to fight, guess riddles, immerse into a mystical plot and an incredible story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1q4t.jpg'),(4997,'Angry Neighbor Simulator','2024-11-14','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Silence the chaos, one swing at a time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yij.jpg'),(4998,'Love Breakout','2020-03-13','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Relax arcade game to keep you in a good mood','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7irt.jpg'),(4999,'Poop Killer II','2022-06-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Poop Killer 2\" is a comedy game mixed with trash horror from the 80\'s and 90\'s. Inspired by old movies involving marijuana and a lot of shit. It\'s a short game with the objective to amuse the player, it contains 2 simple endings.\n\nBilly is a marijuana dealer and lives with his friend Jamal in an apartment. They sell and smoke a lot of weed... After your friend takes a shit in your toilet... the poop killer comes to visit you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xnb.jpg'),(5000,'Emoji Puzzle','2020-08-25','Sin género','Web browser, Android','A new imagination game in which you need to connect pairs of emotions by associations. Think and find the idea of each puzzle. Just tap one by one on the elements from different columns to connect them with a line. Or drag to draw a line and connect elements from different columns. If you correctly connect all the elements, you pass the level. Harder than you think!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c8m.jpg'),(5001,'Pizza Bar Tycoon: Elite Edition','2025-03-14','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5002,'Toy Stunt Bike: Tiptop\'s Trials','2018-10-25','Racing, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Toy Stunt Bike is a 3D, action-packed, micro-sized motorbike trials game. Guide Tiptop the chimpanzee across thirty-six tracks set in a variety of household locations. Leap over toasters, make massive jumps onto garden chairs, use laptops as ramps and perform crazy stunts. Silky smooth 60fps gameplay in every mode. Thirty-six tracks to race + secrets. Compete worldwide with online leaderboards. Spectacular bike stunts and crashes. Ideal for handheld, short burst play. Stunning soundtrack by Waterflame.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hes.jpg'),(5003,'Emberbane',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Emberbane is a pixel action-platformer with combat revolving around a mixture of four elements with unique abilities. Join Ophelia on her journey to slay the malevolent gods of elements and bring equilibrium to the land; use the elementals to your advantage and uncover the untold tale of centuries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gqn.jpg'),(5004,'Harrier Jump Jet','1992-09-15','Simulator','DOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/drsamfy09cdrnks1efam.jpg'),(5005,'Heart: Future Whispers','2025-03-24','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Heart: Future Whispers is a top-down shooter set in a dystopian future. Face hordes of enemies, manage resources to acquire powerful weapons, and uncover the dark secrets behind the chaos. Test your skills in infinite mode and fight for the highest score!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h42.jpg'),(5006,'Metal Gear Solid Delta: Snake Eater - Digital Deluxe Edition','2025-08-26','Shooter, Tactical, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Digital Deluxe Edition includes both the game and the Sneaking DLC Pack at a reduced price.\nIncludes:\n・METAL GEAR SOLID Δ: SNAKE EATER\n・Sneaking DLC Pack\nUniform: Battle Dress (PW ver.)​\nUniform: Sneaking Suit (PW ver.)​\nUniform: Crocodile Suit​\nUniform: Naked (Woodland)​\nUniform: Naked (Ammunition Belt)\nUniform: Gold\nFace: Glasses\nFace: Sunglasses\nEquipment: Kerotan Mask\nEquipment: GA-KO Mask','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9edj.jpg'),(5007,'Power Rangers: To the Rescue','2008-12-31','Sin género','Plug & Play','Power Rangers: To The Rescue (Known simply as Power Rangers from the title screen) is a Plug It In & Play TV Game controller developed by HotGen and published by Jakks Pacific, released in 2008 and again in 2009. The controller is shaped in the red ranger\'s helmet, which opens into a game controller.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k1l.jpg'),(5008,'Creepy Ball Pixel',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5009,'Home: Postmortem Edition','2020-10-08','Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Play the complete indie horror classic, now with a brand-new Postmortem Mode — a guided tour by the developer that brings you behind the scenes as you play the game! Awakened by an oncoming storm, you open your eyes to discover yourself in a strange, dark room — tucked away in a house that’s not yours. Find your way back home — but be careful, because each choice you make can change your story in ways you might not expect. FEATURES: - The complete, original indie horror classic, rebuilt for Nintendo Switch - Multiple endings and story variations, depending on your choices and actions - Innovative new Postmortem Mode provides a guided tour of how the game was made, as you play it — straight from the developer - New behind-the-scenes Gallery complete with design documents, process images and other creepy, real-world artifacts','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57qj.jpg'),(5010,'Atomic Tomb','2000-07-29','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A level for Ultimate Doom + a port that will up the vis-plane limit and is compatible with boom. Shortly after Deimos vanished, the hellspawn appeared on Mars and Earth. Blah Blah Blah, you are a private UAC marine stationed on Mars, and your buddies are gone. Grab your shotgun and take some of the uglies out!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5011,'Neko Navy','2017-06-14','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Flying cats versus 10,000 soothing characters!\nWhat awaits them beyond all those furious midair fights...?\nWitness the world\'s most shocking ending for yourself!\n\nShoot, evade, and detonate Bombers!\nNeko Navy is an exhilarating horizontal-scrolling shooter with easy controls.\n\nThe game offers three difficulties that everyone from a beginner to an advanced player can enjoy.\nFire off as many Bombers as you can to achieve high scores!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2538.jpg'),(5012,'Graduation Life Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Graduation Life Simulator \"is a simple and casual 2D simulation business development game. Here, you will transform into a newly graduated college student, bringing dreams and challenges to the big city, striving to accumulate wealth from scratch, with the ultimate goal of earning 10 million yuan!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96m0.jpg'),(5013,'Elven Legacy Collection','2011-10-11','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Elven Legacy Collection includes Elven Legacy and its three add-ons: Magic, Ranger, and Siege','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ots.jpg'),(5014,'Hard Ball Wikie','2022-04-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','HARD BALL WIKIE is a two-dimensional platform game. The game contains various dangers waiting for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e38.jpg'),(5015,'DeepSea','2020-06-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Keep the jellyfish safe from various obstacles! Only you can protect the jellyfish.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oas.jpg'),(5016,'Jeep Jamboree: Off Road Adventure','1992-08-01','Racing','Game Boy','There are several options in the game including: difficulty level, whether to race in MPH or KM/H, steering ability, whether or not to have a track map, chevrons, and position flashing. The object is to race laps around a muddy race track while trying to get first place. There are twenty tracks to race in; each with a timer that forces the player to race fast. There is an option to either do a single race or a multi-race tournament against a computer opponent or through a human playing while using the Game Boy link cable and another copy of the video game. Items in the background like electric lines and rocks help provide a road-like feeling to the races.\n\nIn a single-player race, the player will race to the finish line against a field of approximately nineteen other drivers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hhh.jpg'),(5017,'Garden Witch Life','2024-09-12','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Journey through various distant and isolated skies, making and helping friends along the way. Sharing company with those who have stories to tell and new perspectives to discover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lv8.jpg'),(5018,'Wukong','2021-12-10','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A small and colorful platformer, inspired by the \"Journey to the West\" novel. Every level contains a new mechanic that will explore new ways to use your skills.\nIn Wukong you play as the Monkey Key in a quest to retrieve the lost scrolls. Jump, spin, throw your staff, and step on the enemies that will try to put an end to your journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b0l.jpg'),(5019,'Icewind Dale II Complete','2002-10-16','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Includes the original Icewind Dale II and the Adventure Pack\n\nThe worst fear of the civilized realms has come true. The Goblinoids have united into an army of outcasts and misfits and they want to claim the Ten Towns for themselves. Massive swarms of Orcs and Worg-mounted Goblins are attempting to overrun the town of Targos, and that\'s just the beginning! A call has gone out to all those willing to face insurmountable odds in defense of the Ten Towns. Will you heed the call to arms and face the greatest threat to the Spine of the World?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21uj.jpg'),(5020,'Three Days to Chicago','2023-08-25','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','One of them is visiting a friend in Chicago. The other wants to shake things up in New York City. It starts in San Francisco, but where this relationship goes is all up to you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vk7.jpg'),(5021,'Skyfox','1986-12-31','Shooter, Simulator, Arcade','Atari 8-bit, PC-8800 Series, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Mac, Amiga, Apple II, Amstrad CPC','Aliens have invaded your beloved homeland, and you must help save it. You are flying the Skyfox, the most advanced attack fighter plane available to the Federation, from within the cockpit. Skyfox is complete with deflection shields, laser cannons, five guided and five heat-seeking missiles and a top speed of Mach IV. The 15 scenarios can be played at 5 skill levels. You will have to fight tanks, enemy planes and the mothership. Use the radar to locate enemy vehicles, and the long-range scanner to ensure that no wave reaches your base before you can take it out. Keep an eye on your shields, and on fuel levels - you can dock at the base to refuel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gyb.jpg'),(5022,'Serious Sam 4: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85my.jpg'),(5023,'Pac-Man World 2','2005-08-19','Platform','Game Boy Advance','This version of Pac-Man World 2 is the Game Boy Advance portable version. It is sprite-based and an isometric platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31xe.jpg'),(5024,'BloodLust 2: Nemesis','2020-03-26','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bloodlust 2: Nemesis is a \"Hack \'n Slash - Dungeon Crawling - Action RPG\" experience that will allow players to explore the dark underworld of a forgotten society of Vampires and their disciplines, all while trying to solve the secrets to their bloodline\'s scientifically enhanced monstrous power.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pky.jpg'),(5025,'Arcade Archives: Gradius III','2020-12-24','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Gradius III is a scrolling shooter game released by Konami in 1989. The story of Planet Gradius has transformed from legend to myth. Take on the Bacterion Empire in epic space battles. An edit mode has been added to the game, allowing players to customize their equipment. Enjoy playing the best game in the series!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ie1.jpg'),(5026,'Mergest Kingdom','2021-05-28','Simulator','Web browser','We haven’t released any merge games on our site so far, so it’s high time to fix the flaw. Welcome to the magic kingdom plagued by a dark force. Match 3 items to create a new object and help to restore the realm. A mix of simulation and match 3 games, this free merge game online will appeal to both children and adult audiences. Fantasy artwork and relaxing matching gameplay makes makes it pure fun to play full screen without download. Create new items and unlock more characters, reclaim new parts of the map and enjoy the evermerge game online for free.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48rf.jpg'),(5027,'Marky Mark and the Funky Bunch: Make My Video','1992-02-01','Music','Sega CD','Make My Video: Marky Mark and the Funky Bunch is a video game based on real-time editing of music video footage. The setup is that a brother and sister pair is arguing about what would make the best Marky Mark video. Since they can not agree, they enlist help from some other people: A boxer and his trainer, a trio of teenage girls, the members of a garage band, and their parents. Each group has their ideas about what an ideal Marky Mark video should or should not contain. The specifications normally come in the form of a set of pictures they either do or don\'t want to see, and perhaps some effects. The game has three Marky Mark videos from which to choose: \"Good Vibrations\", \"I Need Money\", and \"You Gotta Believe\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qne.jpg'),(5028,'The Journey of Piggy','2024-11-07','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Journey of Piggy is a roguelike adventure game with fast-paced, shoot \'em up combat set in a beautifully hand-drawn world. Choose from a variety of weapons, cards and power-ups to create unique builds and survive until the end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ru7.jpg'),(5029,'Tunnel Vision','2023-09-30','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take control of Suoni V Linnet\n(choice of voice & pronouns)\nIn this eerie, atmospheric, narrative-driven horror adventure made in 1 month for Spooktober VN Jam 2023.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77xq.jpg'),(5030,'Dynasty\'s Defender: The Scroll\'s Curse','2024-08-19','Fighting, Puzzle, Racing, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dynasty\'s Defender: The Scroll\'s Curse is a strategic bubble shooter game set in the Western Han Dynasty. Players assume the role of a great general battling a magic scroll-wielding assassin. Precision shooting will burst all magical bubbles to rescue the emperor and empress.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pa4.jpg'),(5031,'Deus Ex: Special Limited Edition','2000-12-31','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An extended demo of the original Deus Ex game, marketed as a Special Limited Edition and sold for 10 USD in North America.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22mn.jpg'),(5032,'Tomba!','1997-12-25','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Tomba! is a side-scrolling platformer in which players control Tomba, a wild boy on the search for his grandfather\'s bangle that was stolen by some evil pigs. Although Tomba is normally restricted to a two-dimensional plane, there are certain points where he can jump or climb onto a new plane. Tomba\'s main method of attack is to jump on top of enemies to grab them, allowing him to hop around on them before throwing them away. This can also be used to open other objects such as eggs or treasure chests. Tomba is also able to use various projectile weapons such as maces and boomerangs and can swing on branches and poles.\n\nThe game is based around a mission system, where the main character\'s (Tomba\'s) skills are employed to complete various tasks. Completion of a mission gives a certain amount of adventure points (AP) which are required for AP boxes which contain food (which gives you AP and restores 1 space of vitality) or items, and you may for example need 50,000 AP to open one. AP is also used to gain access to special places or information later in the game. Not all missions are necessary to progress in the game, however, they are required to achieve full completion. There are 130 events (missions) in the game, many of them rely on other events to be completed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55st.jpg'),(5033,'Itoi Shigesato no Bass Tsuri No.1: Aki no Zenkoku Tournament','1997-11-23','Sport','Satellaview','A SoundLink game using \"糸井重里のバス釣りNo.1 (Itoi Shigesato no Bass Tsuri No.1)\". Only players who own the \"Bass Tsuri No.1\" game can participate in the event, otherwise the player participates in the garbage-picking-up event. The players compete for total weight of five basses. 100 higher-ranking winners qualify for the final tournament. Shigesato Itoi, bass professional Kawabe, Ogimori Jyunko Hagimori, and Kyoko Koizumi appeared on the event.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43nr.jpg'),(5034,'Fire Hawk: Thexder - The Second Contact','1990-10-24','Shooter, Platform','DOS','Fire Hawk: Thexder - The Second Contact is the sequel to Thexder, an amazing game originally developed in Japan and later released to the USA.\n\nFire Hawk: Thexder is well known for its eleven game music tracks, which were of a quality that was relatively unknown for video games released in the late 1990\'s.\n\nGame play consist of the player in the role of a robot battle unit that transforms into a space fighter jet \"Fire Hawk\" depending on the current action. When battling, the player maneuvers the robot transformer which can levitate and float while firing at enemy objects, creatures, droids and bots in order to clear the room in order to proceed. The robot battle unit transforms into the \"Fire Hawk\" space ship jet in order to move quickly and to navigate narrow connecting tunnels.\n\nUltimately the goal is to conquer the invading alien species by navigating the catacombs to clear alien enemies and disable the alien mothership. There are 9 different combat missions that must be completed to disable the mothership.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gv7.jpg'),(5035,'Sheaf - Together EP','2019-07-23','Music, Indie','Oculus VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Enter virtual reality to listen to the debut EP “Together” of synthwave producer Sheaf. No gameplay involved -- just sit back, relax, and enjoy the music while you drive through a retro low poly world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9806.jpg'),(5036,'Horror Tales: The Beggar','2024-06-17','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Control space-time to fight an evil monster in this terror and science fiction journey set in a shattered but beautiful world. Bend physics, the sky and the earth itself in engaging boss-fight encounters with the full power of Unreal Engine 5 and Nvidia DLSS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84rq.jpg'),(5037,'Bestial Reception','2023-08-18','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','In the game \"Bestial Reception\" the strongest survives, grab a weapon and start running towards the enemy. Shoot and destroy everyone who happens to be near you. Get new more powerful weapons with the help of earned gold.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xss.jpg'),(5038,'Market Simulator','2024-02-06','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'ve embarked on a journey to acquire your dream market and have finally reached your goal. Now, manage your market to offer friendly service to the neighborhood! Provide a range of products, from beverages to food, cleaning items to electronics, meeting community needs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xc9.jpg'),(5039,'Commander of Battlefront','2021-07-22','Shooter, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A new game created by Yashiromori Yuki, a japanese indie game developer. Commander of Battlefront is an anime world war two game that uses anime characters and tanks. Its a third person, single player strategy game. The game is currently in alpha mode as the developer is still making adjustments to his game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5040,'Haunted Hotel: The X Collector\'s Edition','2015-11-13','Point-and-click, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','The crimes of the past keep haunting the Lexington Hotel!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co427t.jpg'),(5041,'Stand My Heroes','2016-09-05','Puzzle, Simulator, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Stand My Heroes is a mobile game developed by Coly and released on iOS and Android on September 5, 2016. The game is a puzzle combined with otome game style.\n\nAn anime television series adaptation aired from October 2019 to December 2019. An original video animation was released in May 2023.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pav.jpg'),(5042,'Echo: The Oracle\'s Scroll','2024-10-08','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Playdate','Explore a fading world and best its many challenges. As an adventurous child, you\'ll embark on a quest to deliver a scroll from Bottomrock up to The Archives. Journey through magma lakes and overgrown caverns as you venture through The Kingdoms Three!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co903r.jpg'),(5043,'Hermes\' Runner','2025-03-19','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hermes Runner is a 3D movement-based open level parkour punk game. Freerun using Hermes’ boots, deface billboards, and make deliveries in a reimagined 2000s Greek city where the Gods are real, and they own everything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hmf.jpg'),(5044,'Premortal VR','2023-07-31','Adventure','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR','Premortal VR is a medieval VR-only game. Explore and survive the procedurally-generated wilderness. Gather resources and craft gear. Build formidable bases. Overcome all boss trials to ascend!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mlw.jpg'),(5045,'Dead Frontier 2','2019-07-15','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Online survival horror at its darkest. As one of the few survivors of the outbreak, you must scratch a living out of the decaying ruins of society. Scavenge for supplies, trade with other players, and grow your sphere of influence. All the while, keeping your eyes peeled for the infected lurking around every corner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o5x.jpg'),(5046,'Bombergrounds: Reborn','2022-10-06','Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Bombergrounds is a free-to-play multiplayer action-based bomber game. Engage in solo- and team battles in both fun and competitive game modes, or simply find a new friend in the Bombergrounds community.\n\nWill you be victorious? Lets find out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fkb.jpg'),(5047,'Propeller Rat','2024-09-24','Indie','Playdate','Pilot a propeller-strapped rat through increasingly challenging, hazard-filled worlds with','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9006.jpg'),(5048,'Rosabella: Eternal Light and Magic in Harmony','2025-03-14','Music, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Meet Rosabella, a young girl with a heart full of curiosity, who discovers that she is the only one who can restore the lost light to the kingdom where she lives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kgh.jpg'),(5049,'Pull Dots','2017-09-25','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Strategy, Tactical','iOS','Pull Dots is a highly addictive puzzle game.\n\nThe goal is to clear all colored dots from the board using up to four black dots. Use game bonuses to achieve this goal.\n\n** Game Modes **\n\nTimed Mode:\nHow fast can you pull the black dot? It\'s an exciting race against time to clear the board of all colored dots.\n\nPerfect 12:\nHow well can you plan your moves? A more strategic mode where the goal is to clear every colored dot for 12 Loops. The catch is, the board increases in difficulty from Loop to Loop.\n\nCasual Mode:\nWorry less about strategy because leaving 2 dots on the board is still considered a cleared Loop.\n\nInfinite Mode:\nJust enjoy the game without any worrying about strategy or time, with an unlimited amount of bonuses and moves.\n\n** Game Bonuses **\n\nAdditions:\nUse additions to add a previously removed black dot\n\nSubtractions:\nUse subtractions to remove an individual color dot\n\nSkips:\nUse skip bonuses to skip the current Loop (level) if you get stuck.\n\nColor Change:\nEach black dot can be converted into a color dot via a triple tap gesture. This is most useful when there is one color dot left on the board.\n\n** Features **\n\nLeaderboards:\nCompete against other Pull Dots players for the highest score worldwide! The Pull Dots Leaderboards can be accessed via the Trophy scene or after the game ends by clicking the \"Leaderboards\" button.\n\n- You must be signed into Game Center in order for this feature to work','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27x1.jpg'),(5050,'Tri: Of Friendship and Madness - Deluxe Edition','2014-10-09','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Deluxe Edition includes TRI, the Original Soundtrack and the Artbook.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cdg.jpg'),(5051,'One Piece: Yume no Luffy Kaizoku-dan Tanjou!','2001-04-27','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Color','From TV Animation One Piece: Yume no Luffy Kaizoku-dan Tanjou! is a tactical RPG for the Game Boy Color console based on the manga and anime series One Piece. Developed by Alpha Unit and published by Banpresto (a future subsidiary of Bandai), it was released on April 27, 2001.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ver.jpg'),(5052,'Retro First Friday Collection #1',NULL,'Tactical, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d4o.jpg'),(5053,'New Club Penguin','2020-07-08','Sin género','Web browser','New Club Penguin is a fan made continuation of the original Club Penguin, bringing it into the future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e7o.jpg'),(5054,'James Bond 007: From Russia with Love','2006-05-11','Shooter','PlayStation Portable','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gyw.jpg'),(5055,'International Track & Field 2000','1999-12-10','Sport','Nintendo 64, PlayStation','Pure adrenaline! Go for gold with the only Track and Field title for Nintendo 64! Lightning-fast gameplay for up to four players. Over a dozen grueling international events, from weightlifting, to gymnastics, to the 100M dash.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yed.jpg'),(5056,'Robots','2005-02-24','Platform, Puzzle, Racing','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Live the adventures of a genius inventor robot named Rodney Copperbottom as he moves to the big city to work for the company founded by his childhood hero. When Rodney uncovers a villain\'s plot to take over the city, the brave young bot, with the help of his new friends, overcomes all obstacles to realize his dreams -- and make the world a better place for all robots. Take wild rides in fast-paced robot vehicles, upgrade your gadgets with cooler, more useful parts, and team up with your trusty Wonderbot to solve challenging puzzles, battle evil bots, and explore a highly interactive 3D universe that brings the world of Robots the Movie to life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1oz9.jpg'),(5057,'GooseGame.io',NULL,'Arcade','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5058,'Barricade','2024-10-22','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Barricade is a zombie horde shooter with a classic 90\'s feel. Players use objects to build a barricade that protects their only source of upgrades. Endless waves of zombies will exploit weaknesses in your defenses. Will you juggle building, shooting, and repairing, or be overrun?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rbh.jpg'),(5059,'Forgotten Myths CCG','2016-03-21','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Forgotten Myths is a free to play online collectible card game that incorporates deck building, card collection and strategic gameplay in a fantastic historical background incorporating several civilizations, myths and legends in the same universe!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5060,'Holiday Simulator : Wacky Sleigh Ride','2016-12-21','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Holiday Simulator – Wacky Sleigh Ride tests your skills to see if you have what it takes to deliver all the presents before the sun comes up.  Choose between tossing presents or lumps of coal in this comedic journey in the north pole.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5061,'Kingdom Flipper',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grab a broom and hammer, it’s time to flip castles! Take drab strongholds and transform them into palaces fit for royalty. Take jobs, buy land, and build your dream castle all for profit, of course!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95fc.jpg'),(5062,'Zombie Blocks: Pixel Shooter Gun','2025-03-28','Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','In Zombie Blocks: Pixel Shooter Gun, you will face thrilling adventures in a blocky world where pixel art meets dynamic action and survival in a zombie apocalypse. Immerse yourself in a world filled with zombies and dangers, and prove that you can survive!\n\nZombie Blocks: Pixel Shooter Gun offers a unique blend of blocky graphics and intense gameplay in a world full of zombies and challenges. Prepare for endless adventures and prove that you can survive in this dangerous world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ft7.jpg'),(5063,'Crash \'n\' the Boys: Street Challenge','1992-10-01','Fighting, Racing, Sport','Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System, Nintendo Switch','Theodore \"Todd\" Thornley IV has had enough. After being humiliated once again by his rival, Jeff \"Crash\" Cooney and his blue-collar buddies from Southside High School at the All-City Track Meet, he has decided to issue a challenge to Crash. Inviting two of the other elite high schools to participate in the challenge, plus an additional team sponsored by his wealthy father, Todd has seemingly stacked the deck against Crash and his boys. The game has four different teams to choose from, as well as a fifth computer-controlled team. Each team have five members each with their own strengths and weaknesses, making some better suited to certain events than others. Before each event, players have the opportunity to go shopping in the mall to buy power-ups for their characters. These items are paid for through the various medals that each team achieve as they progress through the challenge, but since the winner of the challenge is the team that collects the most medals overall, players must be fairly judicious in how much they spend. There are two types of events in the game: individual events (Hammer Throw and Roof Top Jumping) and head-to-head events (400 Meter Hurdles, Swimming and Fighting). In individual events, each team takes turn individually and ranking is determined by who gets the most points. The head-to-head events take place under a single elimination tournament format, in which one player against another in a series of heats. The player who successfully defeats both of his opponents will get to compete against a member of Team Thornley for first place. The game can be played by up to four players. Since there\'s never more than two teams competing at the same time, the third and fourth player can play simply by alternating between the two controllers. Thus, a four player adapter is not required, unlike other Kunio-kun games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vva.jpg'),(5064,'Solar Struggle','2022-07-09','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Solar Struggle is an Ultimate Doom, limit-removing (Complevel 3) community project. Each map was given a name first and then participants were invited to make a level based of it.\n\nThe first 3 episodes are comparatively easy and short, and the 4th is ramping difficulty up quite a bit. The maps are balanced for pistol-start primarily.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6tph.jpg'),(5065,'Honkai Impact 3rd: Woven from Last Snow','2023-05-16','Sin género','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Version 6.6 of Honkai Impact 3rd, which includes:\n• New Valkyries: Dreamweaver & Terminal Aide 0017\n• New Story Chapter XXXVII: Of Salt, Snow, and Sand\n• New Featured Event: TeRiRi\'s Magical Quest\n• ...and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d2p.jpg'),(5066,'Mega Man X Dive Offline','2023-09-01','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','The newest entry in the hit action series Mega Man X makes its way to Steam and smartphones! Strengthen your characters and weapons with a variety of powerups to make them all your own. Then test them out in the side-scrolling action of \"what-if\" worlds in Mega Man X!\n\nThis product is the offline version of Mega Man X DiVE. Online features such as Battle Mode, Co-op, Ranking, Guild, and Capsule are not included. Collaboration contents such as characters and stages from other Capcom franchises are not available in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ybs.jpg'),(5067,'Lost Alice: Destined Lovers in Wonderland','2016-12-04','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','“You’ve come here, neither following the White Rabbit nor in response to the Queen of Hearts.You’ve come to Wonderland on your own will.”\n--The key to solving all the mysteries is your lost memories.\n“My Alice, I’ve been waiting for you for so long.”\n“I told you, I’m not Alice!”\n--You remember nothing but your name. They call you Alice.Elegant tea party with the Hatter. Temptations from the Cheshire Cat. The golden afternoon with Joker. While the days in Wonderland never cease to entertain you...you find your true love.\nWhose “Alice” will you be?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oe7.jpg'),(5068,'Ba Quartet X','2012-11-25','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ba Quartet X (バカルテットX) is a fan-made Touhou Project Mega Man X series-like action-platformer game, featuring the bakartet: Cirno, Mystia Lorelei, Wriggle Nightbug, and Rumia. It was created by Penpenmushi no Koucha','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co830p.jpg'),(5069,'City Island 6: Building Life',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Build the city of your dreams, become the major and take care of your people!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82dx.jpg'),(5070,'Lila\'s Sky Ark','2022-04-21','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to the trippy world of the Rainbow Ark – filled with quirky characters, puzzles, secrets and more. Defend your home against a fleet of deafening airships by using alchemy to craft and throw powerful weapons at deadly intruders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uyq.jpg'),(5071,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Training Lair','2014-07-22','Arcade','Xbox 360','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Training Lair is a free Xbox 360 Kinect game based on the 2014 film. The game is sponsored by Pizza Hut and features their advertising. Players will have the opportunity to use all four of the Ninja Turtles weapons and swipe at on-screen items for maximum ninja training.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yvo.jpg'),(5072,'Patrician II: Quest for Power','2001-10-08','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sequel to the trading simulator The Patrician','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hi7ywgnz8siasewohrxe.jpg'),(5073,'Castle Chaos','2015-12-08','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Castle Chaos is a fast paced local multiplayer game for 1 to 4 players inspired by the old classic game \"Rampart\". Build castles with tetris-like shapes and shoot cannons to destroy your opponents\' castles. Available for PC, Mac and Linux.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jspi14dkvooprrkf27rk.jpg'),(5074,'Twisted Edge Extreme Snowboarding','1999-03-12','Sport','Nintendo 64','This is it! The fast-paced, intense snowboarding action you\'ve been waiting for! TWISTED EDGE: EXTREME SNOWBOARDING! The sickest tricks, the biggest air and runs you\'ve only dreamt about \'til now. No more searching for the best ride ever, grab your controller and prepare to get twisted! Loaded with riders, boards, and secrets - each with their own unique qualities. There\'s lots available, but only if you aren\'t slackin\' off in your ridin\' skills! Performance is everything and it pays off in TWISTED EDGE!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47x3.jpg'),(5075,'Biker Garage: Mechanic Simulator','2022-01-03','Puzzle, Racing, Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Biker Garage: Mechanic Simulator allows you to be a top motorcycle mechanic. Your main aim is to be the best mechanic you can, with loads of really happy clients. You start your adventure in a small home workshop which you will need to grow to become the best motorcycle mechanic in the world. Test your bikes on a track, check the quality of your repairs and improve bike performance with fine-tuning. Not only do you customize motorcycles at the request of customers, but you can also create your own dream machine. Find a bike at the junkyard or buy it from a shop and change it beyond recognition while choosing from hundreds of different parts. When you expand your business (and your garage), you will unlock new features like the auction system, racing, and further skills for more difficult tasks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4d3w.jpg'),(5076,'Wrapped With a Kiss','2021-12-22','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A Christmas Themed Otome Game featuring 50k words, partial voice acting, and custom art.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k9u.jpg'),(5077,'Postal: Special Delivery','1998-08-17','Shooter','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This expansion adds four new levels to the single-player campaign with new NPCs, improved net code with a rebalanced multiplayer, and Co-op for the single-player campaign.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ht2.jpg'),(5078,'King of the Universe',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Help the kingdom of Kish conquer all of ancient Mesopotamia in this historical realtime strategy game. Fight all other empires in the region to earn the ancient title of Lugal Kiški: King of the Universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ikd.jpg'),(5079,'Pac-Man 12-in-1 Legacy Series','2021-12-31','Strategy, Arcade','Arcade','Pac-Man 12-in-1 Legacy Series is an arcade machine bundle by Arcade1Up that features various arcade games from Namco.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mw7.jpg'),(5080,'AuroraRL: Special Edition','2015-04-23','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Player takes control over a spaceship that was built with the cooperation all human nations. \nAnything, from artifacts of forgotten civilizations to new technologies, from unusual lifeforms to secret alien cookie recipes \ncan help Earth overcome its political and energy crises.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1lxk.jpg'),(5081,'King\'s Quest 1+2+3','2011-02-21','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This Bundle contains:\n\n- King\'s Quest: Quest for the Crown.\n- King\'s Quest II: Romancing the Throne.\n- King\'s Quest III: To Heir Is Human.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gs8.jpg'),(5082,'False Skies','2022-11-30','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','False Skies is a traditional turn-based RPG with an involved class system and a retro look. Explore a not-quite-modern world with a party of your own creation, and learn the truth behind the disappearance of a city that vanished 2000 years ago.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5unm.jpg'),(5083,'Driving Simulator 2013','2013-08-30','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Race for the best time, chase criminals, save lives, tow vehicles and go off-road. Choose your vehicle, start your engine and prepare for a thrilling ride across three European cities. \n \nWhether you want to test your speed in a powered up sports car, save lives in the ambulance missions or just cruise the motorway in the camper van, Driving Simulator 2013 is the full package. You can get behind the wheel of several types of vehicles each with their own special missions and, new for 2013, take part in a European driving school to test your skills on the road.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gjcd6upomj0z4msc2fcv.jpg'),(5084,'Galactic Civilizations III: Mercenaries','2016-02-08','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The human race is fighting a desperate war against the remorseless Drengin Empire. Both sides have become increasingly desperate, leading them to turn to the galactic underworld and their elite mercenaries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co212x.jpg'),(5085,'Gun Strike Ops: WW2',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5086,'Final Fantasy XI: Rise of the Zilart','2006-04-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Final Fantasy XI: Rise of the Zilart is an expansion pack of Final Fantasy XI. This expansion pack brings several new areas, Jobs, quests, and a new mission storyline to the game.\n\nRise of the Zilart is the first expansion pack in Final Fantasy XI and was only officially released in Japan since Final Fantasy XI itself had not been released for other regions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x52.jpg'),(5087,'Nostalgia Zero','2024-09-22','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nostalgia Zero is a set of 36 maps in CL3 for The Ultimate Doom. This WAD uses exclusively vanilla textures and vanilla limits, with the target source port being Chocolate Doom. In terms of gameplay and level design it’s much closer to the IWAD than either of the Nostalgia WADs, though it does sometimes dip it’s toes into more modern tropes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w7p.jpg'),(5088,'Speed Crew','2024-01-31','Racing, Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A hilarious party game that focuses on chaotic cooperation between players. The task of the pit crew is to inspect arriving cars and perform quick repair services while navigating intricate levels. To succeed and beat their bitter rival, players must help each other and build tactics for each race.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bbo.jpg'),(5089,'Stop Online: Battle of Words','2016-01-15','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Stop Online is a multiplayer battle of words game where you compete with several players aiming to challenge them on their knowledge of words, trying to be the quickest to respond in order to achieve the highest rank. The words are in your language and you will challenge players in the same language. Languages currently supported are English, Portuguese, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Russian, Turkish, Czech, Dutch and Polish.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j1u.jpg'),(5090,'Buddi Bot: Your Machine Learning AI Helper With Advanced Neural Networking!','2020-09-29','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Buddi Bot is an isometric puzzle game where you must (re)train Buddi Bot, an advanced AI with neural network technology. With just a click, Buddi will complete tasks like washing dishes or cooking a steak, by learning COLORS and SHAPES. Are you prepared for the future? Play and find out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5c7u.jpg'),(5091,'Choppertchi','2023-02-25','Simulator','Handheld Electronic LCD','The Choppertchi is a licensed Tamagotchi Nano based on the character Tony Tony Chopper from the anime and manga series One Piece by Eiichiro Oda.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5y8o.jpg'),(5092,'Spherical','1989-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','Solomon\'s Key is a clear conceptual influence for this action puzzler. Our hero must guide a ball through a level to the spot marked \'In\', by creating and removing blocks to alter its path. The game is prevented from being a pure clone due to the ball, which moves automatically once activated, and can be controlled by using strategically-placed blocks.\n\nSimply reaching the ball usually involves modifying the level layout using these bricks. There are enemies moving on fixed paths which must be avoided, and bonus items to collect. Also watch for bonuses such as invincibility, gravity-alteration and teleporting. You take time to rotate, so the controls aren\'t truly immediate. The ball takes 20 seconds to start moving, so use this time to plan ahead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/r5xtxgmdfrpvychviigu.jpg'),(5093,'Elevator Action','1983-05-23','Shooter, Platform, Arcade','Arcade, Atari 2600, PC-8800 Series, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Sharp X1, FM-7, Amstrad CPC, MSX','Elevator Action is a 1983 arcade game by Taito. It debuted during the \"Golden Age of Arcade Games\". Innovative in gameplay, the game was very popular for many years.\n\nIn the game, the player assumes the role of a spy who infiltrates a building filled with elevators. He must collect secret documents from the building and traverse the 30 floors of the building using an increasingly complex series of elevators. The player is pursued by enemy agents who appear from behind closed doors. These agents must be dealt with via force or evasion. Successful completion of a level involves collecting all the secret documents and traversing the building from top to bottom. In the lower floors of the building, the elevator systems are so complex that some puzzle-solving skills are needed.\n\nThe game was available as a standard upright cabinet The controls consist of a 4-way joystick and two buttons, one for \"shoot\" and the other for jumping and kicking. The maximum number of players is two, alternating turns. The graphics are extremely simple, 2D color graphics and in-game music was composed by musician Yoshio Imamura. The game was followed by a sequel, Elevator Action II (also known as Elevator Action Returns).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65am.jpg'),(5094,'Deadly Rooms of Death: King Dugan\'s Dungeon','2005-12-05','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Turn-based puzzle dungeon delve. Control Beethro as he tries to get out of the dungeon with his trusty sword, bypassing traps and slaying monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fonp9fltlusluvlsuwvv.jpg'),(5095,'Imaginstruments','2013-05-28','Music','PlayStation Vita','Set your creativity free!\nBecome an Imaginstruments virtuoso and start making music with your PS Vita. Mix drums, melodies and bass sounds, add effects and change the key and tempo of your tracks, all in real-time and on-the-go.\n\nWith six virtual instrument tracks to choose from, you can bring each sound into the mix and start creating some unique grooves. Once you’ve got your track locked down, switch to the bass channel and combine four bass sounds to give your tune some funk, then twist your basslines up with a selection of effects and filters.\n\nMusic at your fingertips\n• Bring six instrument tracks into the mix: a kick drum, a snare drum, a hi-hat, a cymbal and two keyboard melodies.\n• Add bass sounds and twist them up with a range of effects.\n• Adjust the key and tempo to suit your musical style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60vg.jpg'),(5096,'Tropical Liquor','2018-03-09','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Tropical Island.\nThe Liquor Game is a color-matching game! Clearing the blocks up top will make the blocks in the bottom float up! Play your cards right and they\'ll strip...?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44zm.jpg'),(5097,'Undying: Halloween 2023 Free DLC','2023-10-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join UNDYING now and join other \"moms\" to get a new \"Halloween 2023 DLC\" for free!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5098,'Madame Fifi\'s Bakery',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5099,'VRC Pro: Deluxe Off-Road Tracks 3','2016-05-12','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This VRC PRO: Deluxe Off-Road Tracks 3 pack gives you 5 additional off-road RC tracks from all around the world. Expand your off-road tracks. Experience real existing world class tracks. Join more events & more multiplayer sessions.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5100,'Brawl Stars: Dark Sands','2025-03-06','Sin género','Android','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jit.jpg'),(5101,'Westard',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5102,'Nihiland',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5103,'Point Blank 3','2001-05-01','Shooter','Arcade, PlayStation','The escapades of Namco\'s Dr. Dan and Dr. Don continue in Point Blank 3, the third edition of the irreverent, mini-game based light-gun series. A selection of 80 events are offered, many of which thrust the hapless duo into situations that require timely intervention by the player on their behalf, testing your reflexes and shooting accuracy at the same time. The myriad of events present the player with basic tasks that range in both scope and difficulty. A plethora of mini-game formats are provided that include shooting color-coded targets to protecting the two numbskulls from threatening objects, to those that require the player to perform rudimentary mathematics calculations before shooting the correct answer. Cameo appearances by Tekken characters, classic Namco franchises and other such in-jokes abound in the many scenarios players will find themselves embroiled.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2f20.jpg'),(5104,'Muffins on Stream','2023-03-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Muffins on Stream\" is an engagement game based on a video game in development called\"Muffin Tour Legacy\" that brings the fantasy world of Flourden to life on Twitch. As a streamer, you will use assets from \"Muffin Tour Legacy\" to create an interactive experience for your viewers, allowing them to join in on the fun and compete against each other in real-time.\n\nThe game is designed to be a fun, in-between game that can be played during live streams or as a giveaway for your viewers. Players will need to navigate the world of Flourden, uncovering clues and secrets about the \"baker dust\" and its potential to unleash great power and evil. With fast-paced gameplay, an engaging story\n\nBy purchasing \"Muffins on Stream\" on Steam, players will not only be able to enjoy the game but also support the development of the full game \"Muffin Tour Legacy\". The funds generated from the sales of \"Muffins on Stream\" will be used to further develop the game, improve its graphics and gameplay, and add new features and content. Additionally, the success of \"Muffins on Stream\" on Steam will help demonstrate the potential popularity of \"Muffin Tour Legacy\" and attract additional funding to bring the full game to fruition.\n\nMore about the game we want to make: In Muffin Tour Legacy, players take on the role of Molly, a skilled baker who owns the popular \"Muffin Legacy\" shop in the fantasy world of Flourden. Known for her exceptional muffin-making skills, Molly\'s world is turned upside down when a mysterious old man appears in her shop and offers her a rare ingredient called \"bake dust\" that can make her baking taste out of this world, but with the wrong usage, it can cause great evil.\n\nAs Molly embarks on a quest to save the universe from the Evil Bearclaw King and his pastry army, players will have to navigate the dangerous world of Flourden, uncovering clues and secrets about the \"baker dust\" and its potential to unleash great power and evil. Along the way, players will encounter various colorful characters and challenging obstacles as they strive to become the ultimate muffin-making hero. With fast-paced gameplay, an engaging story, and a unique fantasy setting, Muffin Tour Legacy offers players an unforgettable gaming experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66vc.jpg'),(5105,'Forces of Ether','2024-11-08','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blast your way through an Isometric Open World Galaxy. Fly seamlessly to space. Lead your chosen faction in ground and space battles. Stop the imminent Collapse of civilization... Or let it all fall into ruin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w7m.jpg'),(5106,'South Park: The Fractured But Whole - Bring the Crunch','2019-07-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','An idyllic summer at Lake Tardicaca turns into a nightmare when the camp counselors go missing. Team up with FastPass, Dr. Timothy, Professor Chaos, and a new member, Mintberry Crunch to save summer camp. Embrace the new “Final Girl” class and overcome the odds to survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vxl.jpg'),(5107,'RPG Maker Fes','2016-11-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','\"Are you ready to become a game developer?\n\nCreate the RPG you always dreamed of with RPG Maker Fes!\n\nRPG Maker Fes is a game creation software that lets you create your own RPGs, at anytime and anywhere, on the Nintendo 3DS system without any programming knowledge.\n\nMoreover, all your completed RPGs can be uploaded and then downloaded to be played by other Nintendo 3DS users for free!\n\nIn order to download and play other users\' creations, please visit the Nintendo eShop and download the free software RPG Maker Player.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27w9.jpg'),(5108,'Cosmic Fantasy 3','2025-02-13','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5109,'Bopl Battle','2023-11-16','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A couch/online game where you battle your friends with unique and wild abilities. There are many choices such as a shrink ray, creating black holes, stopping time and attaching a rocket engine to the stage to send it flying. Choose a combination that synergizes well to win the round!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ios.jpg'),(5110,'Babysitting Mania','2008-02-02','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo DS','Babysitting Mania is a simulation-style, time-management game developed by Gogii Games and iWin and available for OS X, Microsoft Windows and the Nintendo DS. The game allows the player to babysit many virtual children while cleaning the house and managing parties all under a certain time limit. The game is available for free as a download from iWin.com.\n\nThe player has a limited amount of time to keep the chaos meter down by clicking items with a red outline, washing clothes, or putting rubbish in the bin. If the player does not manage the chaos, the player will not be able to put the children to bed. If the player does not do it before the parents come home then the player will have to retry the level. To make it more difficult, there are different and larger houses in which the kids get more chaotic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vzylylbwo86shehoirwg.jpg'),(5111,'World Basketball Manager Tycoon','2013-11-18','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','WBM Tycoon is a fresh look in sports strategy games that combines the classic manager game with the financial management and development of a Tycoon type game. As the Club Owner you must generate (or loan) the necessary funds in order to expand the club\'s facilities, raise the financial level and improve the team\'s roster. And as you remain the Manager you are still in charge of the Player\'s training program and when the match day comes, you have to select the team lineup, create the most appropriate strategy and find the way to victory by countering the opposing manager\'s plans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ne1.jpg'),(5112,'UBRocks',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5113,'Pirate Haven','2023-09-15','Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sail the seas as a pirate captain in this challenging roguelike action adventure game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vzp.jpg'),(5114,'T.R.A.G.: Tactical Rescue Assault Group - Mission of Mercy','1998-12-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','The year is 2042. Play as four different members of the eponymous anti-crime unit as they head through the Togusa Building defeating mutants, robots and others creatures to save a kidnapped scientist. Originally released in Japan as Hard Edge, which is also its European name.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yu6.jpg'),(5115,'Legend of the Tetrarchs',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The holy sword that sealed away an ominous power has been drawn out and darkness starts to spill out across the land, mutating people into monsters. The four Tetrarch heroes of ancient times will meet a new band of brave warriors to slash through the darkness with the light of courage! What will they find beyond the chaos? This is a full-fledged fantasy RPG with thrilling turn-based battles. Throw yourself into command battles with up to 10 allies and your own strategy using skill sets. The beautiful pixel animation and art aren\'t just present in combats but also while you adventure around the expansive openworld or dungeons! Go on treasure hunting to boost your status, take on side quests and speed up battles to become the legendary new hero! A grand fantasy tale is ready for you to save the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co249s.jpg'),(5116,'Imaginary Spectacle Parade',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','The Imaginary Spectacle Parade is the story of a young man who has experienced something very spectacular from an ordinary amusement park.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j3j.jpg'),(5117,'Grapple Tanks','2024-01-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Traverse dynamic terrains and engage in an endless deathmatch with a grappling-hook-equipped tank. Outlast and outmaneuver your opponents in Grapple Tanks, a 2D multiplayer shooter game playable with up to 4 people.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qd6.jpg'),(5118,'Magical Drop Pocket','1999-07-24','Puzzle','Neo Geo Pocket Color','Magical Drop Pocket is a Miscellaneous game, developed by SAS Sakata and published by Data East, which was released in Japan in 1999.\n\nMagical Drop Pocket\'s core mechanics are similar to those of Magical Drop III. The only exception is that that the battlefield consists of six columns instead of seven, akin to the Super Famicom ports of the first two Magical Drop games.\n\nThe game features Story, Self Challenge and Friend Challenge; these correspond to the standard 1P VS Com, Solo, and 2P VS modes featured in other Magical Drop games. Story features five difficulty modes while Self Challenge features three.\n\nLike many other handheld puzzle games of the time, Story does not feature a \"true\" AI opponent; instead, the player attempts to fill a gauge by creating chains. While the player attempts to fill this gauge, the AI attacks at random intervals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52xj.jpg'),(5119,'Cazzarion: Demon Hunting','2022-06-09','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Demons are troubling here. Kill the brood of evil and send it back to hell. Standard weapons (Assault Rifle, Shotgun) and special weapons (BoomShot, Reaper, ....) are available. As opponents, the demons of hell are fighting against you. Choose your weapon and shoot (\"Groarrr.....BOOOOOM\")','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cla.jpg'),(5120,'Tournament of Legends','2010-07-01','Fighting','Wii','Tournament of Legends has ten playable characters based on Graeco-Roman mythology. The gameplay is described as a hybrid between traditional fighting games and the alternative puzzle-based gameplay of Punch Out!!. Players gesture using the Wii Remote and Nunchuk to initiate horizontal and vertical attacks. Button inputs allow the character to dodge, block, charge and use special attacks. To win a match, the player must defeat the opponent three times in two 90 second rounds. Breaks are allowed for fighters to regenerate armor and health.\n\n\"Become A Legend In, \"The Wildest Wii Fighter Yet!\"\n\nExperience 3D weapon and magic duels against the biggest legends of world mythology. Enter powerful battles with a rich assortment of blade weapons and tons of magical attacks. Dodge giant creatures and even wield two weapons at the same time.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ocy.jpg'),(5121,'DCS World: World War II Assets Pack',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','The DCS World: World War II Assets Pack provides numerous World War II air, land and sea assets to populate the Normandy and other DCS World maps with. Eagle Dynamics has spent several years creating an entirely new set of combat vehicles to support DCS: World War II, and each unit is created with an exceptional level of detail and accuracy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ltd.jpg'),(5122,'Dead Trip: Hope','2023-09-04','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take part in the adventures of Lars and Jessica in a world of death and chaos. Surviving among the crowds of zombies in search of supplies and fuel in order to pursue the last hope of saving humanity and defeating the virus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64t9.jpg'),(5123,'Royale Online','2024-03-08','Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','Royale Online invites you to an enchanting MMORPG experience! The game unfolds in a thrilling universe, focusing on the epic struggle among three kingdoms. Each kingdom brings together heroes of different classes, plunging into the heart of an epic war.\n\nAs players immerse themselves in the rivalry and strategy between kingdoms, they also have the opportunity to unravel the powerful secrets of the magical stones within the game. These mystical stones, when shattered by the warriors of the kingdom, grant unique enhancements. Heroes steadfastly breaking the stones can gain superiority over their enemies, elevating their kingdoms and altering the course of the war.\n\nRoyale Online offers an unforgettable MMORPG experience with its impressive graphics, rich storyline, and strategic depth. Take part in the epic struggle between kingdoms, guiding characters with unique abilities, acquiring powerful allies, and discovering the power of magical stones. Royale Online calls you to an epic adventure – join the war between kingdoms and write your legend!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7v2w.jpg'),(5124,'Pawnholm',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Island survival RTS rogue-lite, with mysteries behind every corner. Assign your pawns to craft, build, explore, and upgrade your kingdom. Every randomly generated island holds unique secrets to be uncovered. As the Duke of Pawnholm, will you lead your pawns to prosperity ...or to calamity?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7x9j.jpg'),(5125,'B.A.S.E. Jumping',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5126,'In the Psychic City','1984-10-01','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC-8800 Series, FM-7','An early Japanese RPG released by Hot-B in 1984 that departed from the fantasy themes of most other early RPGs in favour of what is possibly gaming\'s first sci-fi cyberpunk plot. Set in a post-apocalyptic city, the game revolves around an amnesiac protagonist with psychic powers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ntk.jpg'),(5127,'Tocovix',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Place Crosses on the game board and complete Shapes. Earn Stops to block your opponents and make your way to victory! Play with your friends on the same device or challenge other players Online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5njf.jpg'),(5128,'The Battle for Murk','2018-07-11','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Battle for Murk is an interactive narrative set in a gritty medieval world. Play as Corporal Mandrake from the City Watch in a fantasy adventure game. Uncover the truth behind a treacherous conspiracy in a race against time to save your hometown from falling into the hands of a cruel barbaric leader.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4328.jpg'),(5129,'Ape Escape M','2008-12-31','Adventure, Arcade','Legacy Mobile Device','Ape Escape M takes the core concepts of the console Ape Escape games and brings them into a 2D game with an overhead perspective. The story is similar to the original Ape Escape in that it has you playing as Spike as he tries to stop Specter and his army of apes, but it does take place after the first game. In each level, you’re tasked with capturing most of the apes with your net before you can advance. You also have other gadgets, such as the stun club, radar, and slingshot that can be used to track the apes and stun them for easier capture. As you explore each level, you can find healing items, items that grant additional lives, and enemies that can only be defeated and not captured. Some levels also have doors that lead back to hidden areas in previous levels if you can find the key to unlock them. There are 121 apes in total to catch across five different worlds and in-game achievements can also be unlocked based on the player’s accomplishments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kl7.jpg'),(5130,'Untitled Game','1999-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Untitled Game was made just as game modifications began to gain widespread recognition as an art form unto itself. JODI made the piece by altering the graphics of Quake as well as the software code that makes it work. Their mods reduced the complex graphics of Quake 1 to the bare minimum, aiming for maximum contrast between the complex soundscapes and the minimal visual environment. For the mod \'Arena,\' JODI took this principle to the extreme: they completely erased every graphical element of the game, turning monsters, characters and backgrounds all to white. The more psychedelic \'Crl-Space,\' the earliest of the set, is not based on a static image. Instead, it features a swirling black-and-white background. The game engine generates this effect as it continuously tries, and fails, to visualize the interior of a cube lined with black-and-white wallpaper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4811.jpg'),(5131,'Meadow','2016-10-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Meadow is Might and Delight\'s latest release; a massively multiplayer online sandbox that allows players to interact as animals would. Described as a \"forum in games\' clothing\", this online fable experience lets fans - old and new - come together and experience a peculiar world.\n\nUnlike traditional titles from the Shelter franchise, in Meadow the more time spent embracing the gameplay features in the world, the more you receive. Owning any previous Shelter related title(s) or products will also unlock in-game content. The open landscape also provides ample room for exploration with new patches and additions promised.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3he7.jpg'),(5132,'Unlock the Three','2024-08-14','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unlock the Three is about a Police,Medic,Security Worker and a Father trying to escape from a monster in locked hospital. Monster is also controlled by a player and each survivor has its own unique skills to perform.Survivors must be collaborate with each other to be able to escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8opt.jpg'),(5133,'Dino Crisis','2000-09-06','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation, PlayStation Portable, Dreamcast','Dino Crisis is a survival horror video game developed originally for the PlayStation console. It is the first installment in the Dino Crisis series and was created by the same team behind the Resident Evil games. Instead of the pre-rendered backgrounds of the Resident Evil games that preceded it, Dino Crisis uses an original real-time engine with 3D environments. Gameplay features traditional survival horror mechanics including action and puzzles, and it was developed to have more consistent visceral terror with the dinosaurs being quick, intelligent, and violent. There are four possible endings based on choices made by the player during the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co530k.jpg'),(5134,'Orbituous','2025-04-10','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Orbituous is a fast-paced, retro-style brick breaker with a dark twist. What begins as a casual arcade game slowly unravels into something… off. Break bricks, survive glitchy levels, and uncover secrets hidden beneath the pixels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o8h.jpg'),(5135,'Remains of Yith','2025-04-11','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Remains of Yith is a point and click adventure puzzle game inspired by The Shadow Out of Time by H.P Lovecraft, play as Sarah as she explores a mysterious island trying to recover a lost alien artifact','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o8v.jpg'),(5136,'World of Tanks Blitz: Vindicator Pack','2024-05-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Vindicator Ultramarines is a tank destroyer armed with a large-caliber gun that can inflict heavy single-shot damage. Its solid frontal armor features additional protection in the form of a daunting dozer blade.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5137,'Kadetstvo: Novaya Istoriya','2009-12-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game will have a new meeting with the heroes of the popular TV series: the charming bully Makarov, the handsome intellectual Sukhomlin, the kind Perepechko, ensign Kantemirov, General Matveyev and other old acquaintances.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kat.jpg'),(5138,'Harum Scarum','2003-12-31','Platform','Web browser','A Flash platformer featuring the characters from The Grim Adventures of Billy & Mandy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gsh.jpg'),(5139,'Cyber Commander: Zombie Revenge','2024-05-30','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cyber commander: Zombie Revenge is an exciting game in the Tower Defense genre. Build ingenious lines of defense to withstand the next onslaught of monsters. Will you have enough strategic skills to survive another night?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8r3e.jpg'),(5140,'#COMPASS','2019-11-20','Fighting, Strategy, Arcade, Card & Board Game','Android, iOS','#COMPASS (COMbat Providence AnalysiS System) is a 3v3 mobile game created by NHN PlayArt in conjunction with DWANGO/Nico Nico Douga. The game sees a red and blue team fight to capture and maintain control over control points (known as Portal Keys) scattered around the arena through use of their characters abilities and cards. Whichever team is in control of the most keys at the end of the timer is crowned the winner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oi7.jpg'),(5141,'Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs 2','2013-10-17','Arcade','Nintendo 3DS, Nintendo DS','\"Following the events of Sony Pictures Animation\'s original culinary comedy, Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs 2 continues the exciting journey of inventor Flint Lockwood and his friends as they rush to save the world from his most infamous machine that is now creating food-animal hybrids- \"Foodimals\"! This action-adventure title, starring a dazzling cast of characters, art, and environments from the animated feature, is ideal for young gamers and fans of the film of all ages. Complete with a suite of unlockable levels, unique character abilities and power-ups, and bonus Challenge and Survival gameplay modes in addition to the main story, Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs 2 is a game you\'ll savor with every play.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rfciqimno2tt89dwlglf.jpg'),(5142,'Mini Motor Racing X','2020-05-14','Racing, Arcade','Meta Quest 2, Oculus Quest','Jump into a nitro fuelled world where little cars mean BIG fun! Spanning across reclaimed ruins and scorched outbacks through to rain soaked docks and sun-kissed tropical islands - Mini Motor Racing X will take you on a micro driving journey across the globe like no other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4nvn.jpg'),(5143,'Raspberry','2024-07-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Raspberry is a simple and fun way to collect and trade raspberries with others. Most importantly to declare war on the evil banana\'s!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pdm.jpg'),(5144,'Kwaan','2016-01-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Kwaan is part RPG, part online ecosystem and part pixel editor ! The prophecies were right : the end is near ! KWAAN has come and ask for sacrifices ! Create rituals, craft trees and flowers, fight pollution and organize with your friends to save the world from impending doom','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/twg4oj94uzsbyjk8hw6s.jpg'),(5145,'DNF Duel: DLC 2 - Brawler','2023-09-14','Fighting','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','\'Brawler\' can be used in DNF Duel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co722g.jpg'),(5146,'Husky\'s Adventures','2021-06-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Husky\'s Adentures, 3D Cute Platformer Game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cry.jpg'),(5147,'Farmer\'s Life: Pimp my Cottage','2024-04-29','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Requested by the players, delivered by the devs. Pimp my Cottage is the first DLC to Farmer\'s Life where you get a full interior/exterior design, new concrete and block buildings, and adorable cats and dogs. Don\'t be a wimp just pimp it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84u8.jpg'),(5148,'Nana','2005-03-17','Music, Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','Nana is a simulation game released in 2005 based on the manga of the same name, where the player can choose their character and experience the Tokyo life by meeting other characters, getting part-time jobs, buying clothes, and decorating their room.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ghz.jpg'),(5149,'Backyard Brawl','2018-11-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Backyard Brawl! A third person laser tag game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5150,'Dave in Danger',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5151,'Mad Shark','1993-02-01','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','Mad Shark is an Action game, developed and published by Allumer, which was released in 1993.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/q9eyiipx2uziv6fhfgcs.jpg'),(5152,'Carcassonne: The Official Board Game - The River','2017-11-29','Puzzle, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Carcassonne: The River, an expansion for Carcassonne: The Official Board game, lets you embellish your landscape while changing up the starting location. The River is made up of 11 tiles, which replace the starting tile. Take turns placing the River tiles while also deploying meeples. Once you\'ve used up the River tiles, continue playing as usual with the other tiles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rsv.jpg'),(5153,'Zero Distance',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Sin plataforma','Take on the role of a courageous freedom fighter and defeat waves of occupation forces in this bullet heaven. Buy weapons and upgrades between waves and become absurdly powerful against an invading army.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84cg.jpg'),(5154,'Outshine','2022-11-03','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unleash your powers against your oppressors in this arcade, fast-paced typing game. Avoid traps, destroy enemies, defeat bosses to seek your revenge, and rush to the top of the leaderboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k6j.jpg'),(5155,'Panzer Corps 2: Axis Operations - 1942','2021-07-08','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Axis Operations 1942 DLC Campaign almost exclusively focuses on the fighting on the Eastern Front in this critical year of the Second World War, 1942.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hqq.jpg'),(5156,'Mega Man Reloaded','2012-10-27','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','Mega Man Reloaded is a simple Mega Man 1 hack. It has new graphics, new layout and design, and music ported from Mega Man 2!\n\n“Wily got out of prison and he secretly built up his new base on a small island. He stole and reprogrammed Light’s first 6 robot masters from the Robot Museum, to get revenge for being defeated for the 11th time. Dr. Wily sent them across the world to cause total chaos! Will Mega Man be able to stop Wily once again?!”','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98vm.jpg'),(5157,'Embraced by Autumn','2021-08-24','Adventure, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A sweet romance story with four heroines set in an all-girls’ boarding school in France in 1896, featuring a crossdressing male protagonist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pvb.jpg'),(5158,'One Piece: Burning Blood - Wanted','2016-05-31','Sin género','Xbox One','This amazing Wanted pack gives you access to: 6 alternate versions of playable characters 8 new costumes 4 customizable HUDsA perfect mix to gear up for the fight!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53ri.jpg'),(5159,'Super Street Rally Racer 2 in 1','2020-10-27','Racing','Nintendo Switch','Combine the cart in the box of Super Street Racer and the eShop code in the box of Rally Racers and get a great value pack with two great racing games. Super Street Racers (cartridge). The official arcade racing game for Super Street, the world\'s number One in automotive tuning culture. Start from the bottom with nothing but Scrap as you build your dream ride part by part and use it to tear up asphalt in a wealth of different game modes and environments. Experience intense action-packed classic arcade racing pushing your car to the limit. Customize your ultimate Street racer using tons of Authentic car parts and unleash it on the streets, leaving behind a trail of spectacular and detailed destruction. Rally Racers (code in the box). Wacky cartoon racing at its best, this is an action-packed family racing game that’s fast and furious fun for all. It’s high-speed at its very best. A race of good versus evil, beating the bad guys before they beat you! Bash and battle to racing glory, pick up special weapons and boosts, recruit race mates from the opposition team and complete stunts and challenges to be first over the finish line. Find and collect secret hidden fruit, upgrade cars, perform point-scoring stunts, shoot the bad guys, choose in-game partners based on their specific skill sets, turn the bad guys good and complete action-packed challenges to emerge victorious!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co311k.jpg'),(5160,'Zagadki Lwa Leona','1998-10-28','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2obz.jpg'),(5161,'Brain Ball: Big Data','2017-01-25','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Quiz/Trivia','Android, iOS','Very funny math game for improving your brain & memory, play & enjoy free.\nBy selecting the type of math problems from the main menu and choosing hardness, start playing. Math problems never repeated and will change every time. Intelligent persons can gain higher level, use your brain and improve your level to showing your talent to others. By playing Brain Ball improve yourself instead of playing and waste your time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/o4mnq4bg4fd92grf6oms.jpg'),(5162,'Eggnog Incorporated','2020-12-29','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enjoy working as an Eggnog Inspector for a shady company. Verify the color, art, ingredients for batches of eggnog. Its not glamorous but its an honest living. Who knows what surprises are in store for you...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2na9.jpg'),(5163,'The Infernal Mist',NULL,'Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Descend into the Infernal Mist. A MistCrawler Roguelite where you explore, and Hack and Slash your way through the Mist, while surviving the encroaching darkness. Collect Souls of the Mist, unlock god-like powers and weapons, challenge the merciless wardens, and face the King of the Mist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9459.jpg'),(5164,'Glittermitten Grove','2016-12-13','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Just like the faeries in your garden, we love collecting berries for our prickleberry loaves and finding treasure with our special fribblesham fireworks. Come join us in our faerieland, full of strange adventure!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fv7xwmif8lynpkwbahyb.jpg'),(5165,'Someday You\'ll Return','2020-05-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Someday You\'ll Return is a story-driven psychological horror game about a desperate search for a missing daughter deep in the woods where you swore you\'d never return, brought to you by the creative duo behind J.U.L.I.A.: Among the Stars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25bb.jpg'),(5166,'Pillars of Eternity II: Deadfire - The Beast of Winter','2018-08-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Far in the southernmost reaches of the Deadfire Archipelago, frost and death have encroached upon the land of the living. You, Watcher, have received a missive from the isle\'s residents: worshipers of Rymrgand, the god of entropy and disaster. They call you Duskspeaker, a harbinger of the end, and pray you fulfill your destiny.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wgg.jpg'),(5167,'The Invisible Hand: Deep Pockets Edition','2021-05-07','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Deep Pockets Edition includes the satirical stock broker simulator The Invisible Hand and its Original Soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dui.jpg'),(5168,'War Stars','2005-05-25','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co999c.jpg'),(5169,'Puzzle Adventure VR','2024-02-13','Strategy','SteamVR','Embark with us on a journey in Puzzle Adventure VR! A classic match blocks type game, for the first time in VR. Crush colorful blocks in a cartoon-styled VR world. Relaxing and intuitive, perfect for all ages, offering a blend of tranquil visuals, engaging puzzles, and a soothing soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7x66.jpg'),(5170,'The adventure of Kroos','2017-12-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The adventures of Kroos is a magic style 2D horizontal action adventure game. Rich and interesting BOSS warfare, sophisticated design agencies, and plot scenarios closely linked to the puzzle design, in addition to testing the player\'s operation, but also to seriously consider the strategy of clearance.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5171,'Work It Out! Job Challenge','2022-01-03','Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Become a firefighter, comic book artist, train conductor, and more! Everyone grab your Joy-Con! Up to four players can join in the fun! There are collectibles, motion controls, and loads more to enjoy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tw5.jpg'),(5172,'Stickman Trenches','2023-03-01','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Stickman Trenches is a Real Time Strategy game in which you need to manage your men and weapons and build up your defenses in the brutal trenches of Stick World War 1.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5esm.jpg'),(5173,'Pong 3D',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5174,'Tiny Farm: Remastered','2025-03-13','Simulator','Android','A warm, relaxing story of starting a small farm! Meet your animal friends now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jji.jpg'),(5175,'RoboKiden','2024-07-04','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RoboKiden is an innovative team-based action game where five players collaborate to control a single mecha in strategic battles. Integrating Web3 technology and blockchain, the game uses the $KIDEN token for in-game transactions and NFT trading. Players can earn and trade $KIDEN, enhancing gameplay with digital ownership and economic opportunities. Developed by The Breach Studios and powered by Elixir Games, RoboKiden offers a unique gaming experience with vibrant characters and dynamic battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8don.jpg'),(5176,'Whale Well','2024-08-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Whale Well is a short adventure game where you play as a duck. Collect and trade items while exploring a civilization in the belly of a great whale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oq6.jpg'),(5177,'Hearthstone: Ashes of Outland - Trial by Felfire','2020-06-17','Strategy, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Follow the story of Aranna Starseeker (Elise Starseeker’s crafty younger sister) as she embarks on a thrilling journey of self-discovery, assembling a motley crew of outcasts and teaming up with Illidan to take on the mad architect of the Rusted Legion itself: Mecha-Jaraxxus!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cjl.jpg'),(5178,'Spirit Legends: Finding Balance - Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5179,'WRC II Extreme','2003-04-22','Racing, Sport','PlayStation 2','WRC II Extreme is a 2002 off-road video game released for the PlayStation 2. The game was developed by Evolution Studios and published by Sony Computer Entertainment Europe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48x0.jpg'),(5180,'Chronicle: Rewritten','2022-04-12','Strategy, Adventure, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chronicle: Rewritten is a recreation of Jagex\'s original collectable card game, Chronicle: Runescape Legends. The game was taken offline on the 6th of August 2018 and hasn\'t been accessible ever since. Until now!\n\nThis remake is built from the ground up with the goal of having this game playable until the end of time. As long as there is a download available somewhere, you will be able to play it!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5181,'The Legend of Zelda: A Link to the Past','2002-12-02','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Advance','The Game Boy Advance port of A Link to the Past has some small design differences with the original version, like Link\'s voice and an additional quest and dungeon unlocked after the completion of the main content. The new dungeon is only available after finishing Four Swords.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x34.jpg'),(5182,'Stray Kids SKZOO Tamagotchi','2025-04-03','Simulator','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9igb.jpg'),(5183,'One Piece Unlimited World Red: Chopper Edition','2014-06-27','Adventure','PlayStation 3','One Piece: Unlimited World Red is an Action/Adventure video game based on the famous One Piece manga and anime.\n\nThis is the thirty-sixth video game based on the series, and the fifth title in the Unlimited sub-series. It was released for the Nintendo 3DS in Japan on November 21, 2013 and released for additional platforms and in more regions the following year.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5px4.jpg'),(5184,'Military Life: Tank Simulator','2016-06-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Have you ever dreamt of riding a tank? Now is your chance! The times, when this sort of simulation was complex and enormous complicated, have past. This game differs completely from the others and captivates with its intuitive and easy gameplay. Furthermore it gives you the opportunity to move virtually freedom in a vast 3D landscape. Depending on the task your mission can be the most perfect and precise completion of a contract or a demonstration of the highest possible destructiveness.\n\nTwo different kinds of tanks as well as the varied level design guarantee a long lasting fun factor for all fans of these big machines.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tmbyi3qziildu4lyre6r.jpg'),(5185,'Zombie Apocalypse: Escape the Undead City','2016-06-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Battle through Zombie Apocalypse horror! Which is better - shotgun, pistol or AK-47? Blast their rotten, infected brains out and choose your favorite! Scavenge weapons and armor to pimp out your souped up zombie slaying car - then plow down the man-eating hordes to Escape the Undead City, and try not to get your guts torn out!!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l2r.jpg'),(5186,'Good Pizza, Great Pizza: Vintage Sunshine Set','2023-05-09','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Walk into the cozy sunshine with these decors!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5187,'Shin Koihime Musou: Fighting Maidens of the Romance of the Three Kingdoms','2014-02-20','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Arcade, PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 2D fighting game spin-off from the Koihime Musou franchise, where where the generals of the Romance of the Three Kingdoms have been reimagined as anime heroines.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/f7kj5x37mldzrf4n5ojx.jpg'),(5188,'Fallen London: Dernier Cri','2022-06-30','Adventure','Web browser','\"Dernier Cri\" is add-on for Fallen London, a browser-based choose-your-own-adventure game set in \"Fallen London\", an alternative Victorian London with gothic overtones. \"Dernier Cri\" was originally the Exceptional Story for July, 2022.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xnd.jpg'),(5189,'Suspended','1985-12-31','Adventure','Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, Commodore 16, Mac, DOS, Tatung Einstein, Amiga, Apple II, TRS-80, Amstrad CPC, Commodore Plus/4, Amstrad PCW, Texas Instruments TI-99','You must save the planet above by repairing the Complex you are frozen within. You must do it before they arrive to shut you down. And you must do it not with your own hands, but with those of your robots.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ibx.jpg'),(5190,'Injustice 2: Fighter Pack 2','2017-09-12','Fighting','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Featuring new fighters and additional customization options, Fighter Pack 2 contains: • 3 Playable Characters: Black Manta, Raiden, and Hellboy • Reverse-Flash Premiere Skin Also available as part of the Ultimate Pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co310x.jpg'),(5191,'Project Angels',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','In the 2050s, the Steel Waters security company and Angels are the only answer to the growing threat of maritime piracy in Red Tide Waters. Follow the story through the eyes of Steel Waters Commander-in-Chief and uncover the truth behind the strongest pirate congregation; Apollyon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mnt.jpg'),(5192,'The Fog',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5193,'Good Pizza, Great Pizza: Floral Nostalgia Set','2023-05-09','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Flowers are a timeless Mother\'s Day classic.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5194,'Reconnect: The Heart of Darkness','2021-06-10','Music, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Reconnect is the minimalistic real-time strategy game with real self-learning AI. Defend your grid-free light network against attack waves of merciless drones that get smarter with every generation. Reach the Heart of Darkness to weaken the AI and command your own drones in the next round.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30qg.jpg'),(5195,'Azu-Beach','2002-12-31','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','AzuBeach is a fanmade EasyGameStation game for PC. It is from 2002. It is based on the Azumanga Daioh anime and manga and features the characters facing each other in volleyball matches.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jgh.jpg'),(5196,'Zombie Hunter','1987-08-03','Role-playing (RPG)','Family Computer, MSX2, MSX','Zombie Hunter is an action RPG exclusively published in Japan. It was developed by a Japanese gaming magazine known as Hi-Score. The player must complete six sidescrolling levels and in each level, the player is presented with a number of fights that prevent you from making progress until all of the enemies have been defeated or chased away.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96gy.jpg'),(5197,'Monster Hunter Freedom','2006-05-26','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PlayStation Portable','Known as \"Monster Hunter Portable\" in Japan, Monster Hunter Freedom is essentially a PSP version of the preceding expansion to the original game, Monster Hunter G. As such it features very similar content, reworked to be a portable experience. Monster Hunter Portable does not features Minegarde Town from Monster Hunter and Monster Hunter G, and was focused around local multiplayer rather than online. As such, the game was completely rebalanced to be more friendly to solo players. The game features a single new monster that was not in the series prior, Yian Garuga.\n\nThe game revolves around the player completing quests and gathering materials to upgrade their equipment in order to advance. The more rare the items and equipment, the stronger the main physical aspects of the character will be. Unlike other hack \'n\' slash games, this game requires planning and skill in order to overcome large monsters instead of brute force. There are many weapons which the hunter can use to bring down the monsters, these are sword and shield, great sword, dual swords, hammer, lance, bowgun and the heavy bowgun. Each requires a variety of items to create which are acquired by completing quests, and collecting the spoils carved from monsters or found on the ground.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1po0.jpg'),(5198,'Pixi Poxi Autorunner Lab','2023-11-24','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Pixi Poxi is a challenging autorunner rage puzzle platform game that will test the limits of your gaming skills. You will accompany a test subject on their quest to escape to freedom fighting through several levels with a variety of difficulties, traps and barriers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lhr.jpg'),(5199,'Batman: Arkham Knight - Batman: Noel Skin','2015-12-22','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','This addon includes a reinforced leather suit from the Batman: Noel comic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fva.jpg'),(5200,'Galaga 30th Collection','2011-06-09','Shooter','iOS','The Galaga 30th Collection universal app will act as a hub for the Galaga universe across all iOS devices. iPhone, iPod touch and iPad owners will be able to experience the celebrated Galaga franchise at the tips of their fingers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/h0dslcgo2rwusnvdhyqy.jpg'),(5201,'The King of Fighters \'97','1998-03-26','Fighting, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, Neo Geo MVS, Wii, Android, Sega Saturn, PlayStation, Neo Geo CD','The King of Fighters \'97 is a 1997 fighting game produced by SNK for the Neo Geo arcade and home console. It is the fourth game in The King of Fighters series. It was ported to the Neo-Geo CD, as well as the PlayStation and the Sega Saturn in Japan only.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p0x.jpg'),(5202,'Dynasty Warriors 5: Special','2005-12-22','Tactical, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Dynasty Warriors 5: Special includes content from Dynasty Warriors 5 and Dynasty Warriors 5 Xtreme Legends (excluding the Edit Mode and Destiny Mode features). Sports higher resolution graphics and includes the Japanese and English tracks.\n\nThe game was exclusive to East Asian regions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f4l.jpg'),(5203,'Operação Prato',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','\'Operação Prato\' is a game based on one of Brazil\'s greatest ufological mysteries. Step into the shoes of Mario, the reporter who will risk his own life to expose the entire truth about the events that terrified the residents of the Colares region.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zt2.jpg'),(5204,'Fahrenheit 451','1984-12-31','Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, Mac, DOS, Apple II, MSX','The time is not too long from now. The place is New York City. Yet it is a setting few of us would ever recognize.\n\nFor this is a world where simply owning a book is dangerously illegal. Where Firemen come not to save houses, but to burn them for the books inside. And where you, once a dedicated Fireman, are now a rebel with a passion for books --- and the most wanted fugitive in the country.\n\nAn Interactive Fiction game based on the book with the same name. Set as a sequel to the book, taking place after the novel ends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ic3.jpg'),(5205,'Zombinoia',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5206,'The Uwaki Kareshi: Totsugeki! Uwaki Genba',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5207,'Guns and Robots','2014-08-04','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Guns and Robots is free to play online third person shooter. The game brings robot action with massive customization. Players get cartoony bright 3D graphics in attractive environments and challenge each other in open arenas. Guns and Robots gives fun, entertaining experience with easy to master gameplay and numerous options to experiment robot constructing skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nttlcnf25vs54zwldsnz.jpg'),(5208,'Rec',NULL,'Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Set in a parallel world, REC presents a thought-provoking narrative where Ukraine is universally recognized as a force for good and is heavily supported with advanced weaponry. The story begins with a Russian soldier who uncovers a secret plan designed to ignite a nuclear war, only to be killed immediately after his discovery. Players take on the role of a soldier, viewed through a bodycam, tasked with eliminating enemies in hyper-realistic environments. As you progress, you’ll uncover clues and traces leading to the deeper truth about this alternate reality in Ukraine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co928r.jpg'),(5209,'Forgetter','2021-04-16','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Forgetter is a destructive journey of pain, memory and artistry. In the future, creative minds can be inherited by clients’ newborns. You\'re hired to destroy unhealthy memories in the minds of deceased artists. Remember to smash everything. Don\'t let the artists’ remaining consciousness stop you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ztx.jpg'),(5210,'Hank\'s Voyage',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Sin plataforma','Join Hank on an adventure to rescue his friend and uncover the secrets of ancient Egypt! \nUse your hat as a multi-purpose gadget, hide from your enemies, solve puzzles and prove that you\'re a world-class spy every step of the way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vso.jpg'),(5211,'Dirge of Cerberus: Final Fantasy VII','2006-11-17','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','Dirge of Cerberus: Final Fantasy VII is an action role-playing third-person shooter. As the first shooter game in the Final Fantasy series, the action is viewed from an over-the-shoulder perspective similar to Resident Evil 4, although players can switch to a first-person perspective if they wish. Defeating enemies yields EXP, and at the end of each stage, the player can either use that EXP to level up, increasing Vincent\'s stats, or convert it to Gil (the in-game currency), which can then be used to purchase items and equipment upgrades.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co205e.jpg'),(5212,'Micetopia','2021-01-27','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A pixel art Metroidvania.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2la1.jpg'),(5213,'Siren','2020-04-01','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An intercepted distress signal lures you to a UAC black site. Your mission: containment. Siren is a total conversion, of sorts, for ID\'s latest: Doom 2. Bringing a new roster of weapons get through its exclusive campaign.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4lsc.jpg'),(5214,'Dawn of the Mexica','2020-11-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dawn of the Mexica is a turn-based roguelike that blends accurate history and mythical fantasy. It features complex combat mechanics, tactics and skills, yet also brings you an easy to use interface. Fight your way through the procedurally generated scenarios and stop the fall of the Fifth Sun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tp9.jpg'),(5215,'Medieval Steve','2018-09-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Steve - a magic pile of armour - is destined save the world. Use your abilities in this fast paced side-scroller, to help you crush your enemies, collect gems and upgrade your character, making you stronger, faster and unstoppable!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nrx.jpg'),(5216,'Street of the Cats','2024-08-20','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Search and find cats in a relaxing hidden object game for cat\'s lovers. Can you find them all?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d1v.jpg'),(5217,'Dinobreak Killer Crisis Collection','2023-10-04','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Two retro survival horror nightmares overflowing with dinosaurs and zombies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7b7y.jpg'),(5218,'Samantha Swift and the Hidden Roses of Athena','2008-10-31','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo DS','On a quest to recover the Scepter of Zeus for The Museum of Lost Secrets, archeologist and adventurer Samantha Swift stumbles upon one of the greatest archeological finds of all time! Unfortunately, she also runs into greedy treasure hunter Ravena Stryker.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31w3.jpg'),(5219,'Reader Rabbit 2','1991-12-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An entry in The Learning Company\'s popular series of educational games for Windows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/p1azb9xaulpt7ibjn8ht.jpg'),(5220,'Enduro','1977-12-31','Racing, Arcade','AY-3-8760','Enduro is a mix of Stunt Cycle and Motocross. \nBasically the player first has to overcome obstacles and have enough speed at the end to make a successful jump.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/irf5lov5fzuzuwnyb6se.jpg'),(5221,'Jumpy Jumptime','2024-05-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jumpy Jumptime is an endearing first-person platforming game that immerses players in the excitement of exploring a world of floating islands. As Jumpy, a lovable alien who has crash-landed, your goal is to recover the scattered parts of your UFO and simply find your way back home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8l72.jpg'),(5222,'Panzermadels: Tank Dating Simulator','2016-03-09','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Panzermadels! The first dating simulator to deliver a thoughtful look at tanks, and the men who date them!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qgw.jpg'),(5223,'Love Drunk','2025-04-16','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Drive in your car to your ex\'s place while picking up beverages along the way to keep yourself in the right state of mind to keep moving forward. Cops don\'t like drunk drivers. Please don\'t drink and drive. We do NOT support drinking and driving. HAVE FUN ! :)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ouw.jpg'),(5224,'RoboSync','2024-03-11','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RoboSync is a puzzle game where you will need to use logical reasoning and precision to complete the challenges. Release and lock passages at the right time to synchronize your robots\' movements and achieve perfect synchronization to release all the locks at the same time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7n3n.jpg'),(5225,'Cool People Club','2022-12-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join the Cool People Club in an epic quest to prove their coolness to the world! Dodge bullets, fight powerful foes, and determine your fate in this surreal 3D bullet hell adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5d41.jpg'),(5226,'Railway Empire: Crossing the Andes','2018-10-19','Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Take on new journeys in the depths of South America in the early 20th century, where a hoard of exotic new resources are ripe for the picking and plans for crossing the Andes by train are drawing attention from investors far and wide. Unforgiving mountains and relentless jungle terrains will make this challenge a tough one for even the most experienced tycoons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x9w.jpg'),(5227,'Meet\'N\'Fuck: BDSM Club','2009-04-17','Visual Novel','Web browser','Recently I met a very sexy girl. Her name was Rachel. She was telling a lot of stories from her weird sexual life. At the first time, I didn\'t believe her of course. But on my birthday, she gave me a flyer to BDSM club of Madam Vinson.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gzp.jpg'),(5228,'Dungeon Warfare 2','2018-07-16','Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Dungeon Warfare 2 is the definitive sequel to Dungeon Warfare, a challenging tower defense strategy game where you become a dungeon lord to defend your dungeons with the deadliest of traps and insidious contraptions against greedy adventurers and wannabe heroes. \n \nGame Features \n- Physics-enabled tower defense mayhem \n- 33 unique traps with 8 unique traits for each trap \n- More than 30 unique enemies, each with a special trait \n- More than 60 handcrafted levels + an infinite number of procedurally generated dungeons \n- 5+ boss battles \n- Progression with experience providing passive upgrades for the traps as well as skill points \n- Three skill trees with 11 skills on each tree \n- Equipment system with more than 30 unique items \n- Mix your own difficulty by combining difficulty mode runes for more challenge & reward \n- Endless mode \n- Environmental Hazards','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2od7.jpg'),(5229,'Edaqa\'s Room: Prototype','2020-08-01','Puzzle, Indie','Web browser','A Game Master is Needed -- Online escape & puzzle game\n\nPrototype is a comedic online escape game featuring Wendy! She\'s looking for a new game master to run her shiny new escape room. Alas, during your introduction you\'ve become trapped inside.\n\nEdaqa\'s Room is all about puzzles. Search the environment for clues and objects. Turn up the brain power to work through logic logic puzzles. Press buttons, play with plush toys, and have fun! I even built-in a hint system to keep you moving when my design brainwaves don\'t align with yours.\n\nThis web game is built for multiplayer. Multiple people, I recommend 2-4, enter the same room from their own system. It works just like a real escape room, less all the sticky bits and bumping into each other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2exi.jpg'),(5230,'Strike Force 2: Terrorist Hunt','2020-11-24','Shooter, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A tropical paradise turned into a warzone. One of our agents was on the mission to investigate a para militarized terrorist organization lead by a former german secret service agent. We lost his tracking signal. The last message we got was his coordinates and request for extraction. You are a member of the Strike Force Unit. Your objective is to rescue our agent and combat the terrorist organization. Gear up with a modern arsenal of machine guns, assault rifles, sniper rifles and pistols and fulfill your objective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7iey.jpg'),(5231,'Throw Knife',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5232,'My Forged Wedding: Party','2014-06-26','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','A remaster of My Forged Wedding.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6622.jpg'),(5233,'Final Gear','2021-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','Android, iOS','Final Gear is a Mech Styled Strategy mobile RPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4pck.jpg'),(5234,'Abzu','2018-11-29','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Abzu is an exploration game where you are a lone diver in a lush ocean world. The diver descends deeper and deeper into the depths, where she will encounter majestic creatures, discover ancient secrets, and search for her true purpose. Abzu roughly translates to \"The Ocean of Wisdom\" from ancient Sumerian.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28sy.jpg'),(5235,'Naruto x Boruto: Ultimate Ninja Storm Connections - Deluxe Edition','2023-11-17','Fighting, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Legendary ninjas reunite in the next exciting entry of the Storm series! With new playable characters, the game features the largest ninja roster ever!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dxz.jpg'),(5236,'AirFighter','2021-07-20','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Air Fighter is a free 3D game in which you can fly your personal plane from World War II and take part in air battles against other planes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co574z.jpg'),(5237,'Matadouro: Grindhouse','2024-01-18','Shooter, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A rogue detective infiltrates a cult compound to save a kidnapped woman and discovers a dark labyrinth of inhumane experiments and manmade flesh monsters. A tense and unnerving first-person survival horror game, with limited resources, exploration, and puzzle-solving.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nic.jpg'),(5238,'Giant Blobs From Mars','2021-03-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are a Giant Blob From Mars who has come to Earth to devour it\'s rich resources. Consume land to gain energy and leave no land untouched! This casual strategy game allows a single player to escape into mindless game play for hours while listening to a soothing acoustic guitar soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co419w.jpg'),(5239,'Destiny 2: Beyond Light - Deluxe Edition','2020-11-10','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This version includes:\n\n- Access to Seasons 12-15, the No Time to Explain Exotic Pulse Rifle, ornament, catalyst, and the Any Other Sky Exotic Sparrow.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39ow.jpg'),(5240,'Tearscape','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Discover a Gothic world in this 2D top-down action-adventure, blending fast-paced combat, exploration, and pixel art inspired by Game Boy Color classics. Fight monstrous foes, unlock new abilities, and explore a non-linear map filled with hidden secrets and dangerous challenges.\n\nMaster precise combat, where every strike and dodge matters. Strategically manage your stamina by carefully considering each move as you face off against grotesque enemies. You have a limited number of healing flasks—use them wisely and plan your moments to recover carefully. Upgrade your character\'s stats to remain effective and competitive in combat.\n\nDiscover powerful items hidden in the dungeons that enhance both combat and exploration. Unlock new abilities to defeat enemies more effectively and access hidden paths, uncovering deeper secrets within the world.\n\nUncover hidden dungeons throughout Tearscape\'s dark, interconnected world. Each dungeon holds unique challenges, powerful items, and deadly enemies, pushing your combat and exploration skills to the limit.\n\nFace off against challenging bosses—massive, grotesque creatures born from dark experiments. Each encounter demands precise timing, strategy, and mastery of your abilities to emerge victorious.\n\nExplore the vast, interconnected map filled with branching paths, hidden shortcuts, and secret areas. The non-linear design encourages exploration, rewarding you with powerful items and new abilities.\n\nEncounter a diverse cast of NPCs, some offering guidance, others seeking your help, and a few with their own hidden agendas. Every interaction adds depth to the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99ts.jpg'),(5241,'Just Cause 4: Complete Edition','2019-11-07','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Unlock the true potential of Just Cause 4 with the Complete Edition! This ultimate all-in-one package includes all previously released improvements and additions to the game as well as access to all Black Market, Expansion Pass and Premium content.\nJump into an explosive open-world sandbox experience, fully loaded with a wide selection of weaponry, vehicles and gear. Strap into your wingsuit, equip your fully customizable grappling hook, and get ready to bring the thunder!\n\nJust Cause 4 Complete Edition includes:\n- Black Market Bundle (Access to all Black Market/Premium Content).\n- Dare Devils of Destruction Expansion.\n- Los Demonios Expansion.\n- Danger Rising Expansion.\n- Skystriker Weaponized Wingsuit.\n- Black Hand Stealth Micro Jet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3he0.jpg'),(5242,'Undying Memoir','2023-09-05','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Undying Memoir is a platforming game with unlockable lore.\nThis is a fangame based on Touhou Project.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co777b.jpg'),(5243,'Bluma',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Join Bluma in this puzzle-platforming adventure where you make the platforms. It’s up to Bluma and her magical tail to unite the realms by solving physics-based puzzles and farming vegetables.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e0z.jpg'),(5244,'Big Bass Arcade','2011-12-24','Sport','Wii, Nintendo DSi','Big Bass Arcade is loaded with fishing action! Catch a boatload of fish and take a shot at the World Record Bass.\n\nReel in Largemouth Bass, Muskie, Northern Pike, Bluegill, and Crappie.\n\nCompete in Challenges and Tournaments, or Free Fish any lake at your own pace.\n\nBig Bass Arcade is stocked with features: 4 fish filled lakes, 9 lures, and 5 multiple lake tournaments. High scores are tracked for every event on your quest for the World Record Bass.\n\nExperience life-like fish behaviors and spectacular visual effects.\n\nPut the fun back into console fishing! Use the Wii Remote and Nunchuk as a virtual rod and reel to cast, reel, and control the fish fighting action.\n\nBig Bass Arcade appeals to fishing enthusiasts and gamers alike by capturing the adrenaline rush of fish fighting in an arcade style game.\n\nFeatures\n\n• Fish Fighting Action\n• Largemouth Bass, Muskie, Nothern Pike, Bluegill and Crappie\n• Multiple Challenges and Tournaments\n• Life Like Fish Behaviors','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pte.jpg'),(5245,'Super Vadimka VII: The Nightmares of The Current Continue','2023-02-25','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super Vadimka VII: The Nightmares of The Current Continue is an exhilarating platformer action game that pushes the boundaries of gameplay while infusing elements of survival horror. Released on February 25, 2023, for Windows, the title is crafted by the talented duo at VadimBallzGames and HyperTheLoopa420, featuring the iconic character, Super Vadimka, in his most challenging adventure yet. This final installment in the Super Vadimka series elevates the gaming experience with its high-quality graphics and intricately designed levels that demand precision and skill from players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uum.jpg'),(5246,'Ibara','2006-02-23','Shooter','Arcade, PlayStation 2','Ibara is very similar to 8ing/Raizing\'s Battle Garegga and Battle Bakraid games.So much so that Ibara could be considered a pseudo-sequel or, at least, a spiritual successor. The similarities are numerous - some are subtle, some are easily spotted. These include combining archaic technology such as biplanes with more advanced machinery; firing and power-up system; and a medal collecting system which drastically increases scoring. The game features a similar method of earning bombs and a delay when launching them as well.\n\nA notable feature of Ibara is the inclusion of a variable, real-time difficulty system by way of the Rank system. The player\'s rank increases as they acquire more items and cause more damage, increasing the difficulty of the game along with it. The number of enemies does not increase but the number of bullets fired towards the user does, often reaching a ridiculous level of bullet density.\n\nThere are ways of lowering this rank system if the odds appear too much. The only known way of decreasing the player\'s Rank in Ibara is to die. The more lives you have, the less the rank decreases when you die.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gombjmbhznoaibvnsaib.jpg'),(5247,'Korean Drone Flying Tour Jebu-do','2025-04-17','Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','A simulation game where you directly operate a drone based on actual drone flight footage!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ini.jpg'),(5248,'The 13th Doll: A Fan Game of The 7th Guest','2019-10-31','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Return to The 7th Guest\'s Stauf Mansion in this mind bending fmv puzzle game made by fans of the original series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s9z.jpg'),(5249,'Ninja Village Wars 2','2018-01-03','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','忍者村大战2 (Ninja Village War 2) is out of War3 engine research and development of a new anime hero against the client online games. Is the only legitimate sequel ninja village of war. Is endure village for the first time based on PC platform of network game, it inherited the play of the map, inherited from maps, flow the origin of the soul, based on a map. By the ninja village war map core maker: sheng sheng, wave Peak to hangzhou points the development of a multiplayer online real-time strategy game.\n\nAnime hero character design style, exquisite and gaming experience (hero skill variety, game strategy and changeful, limit operation killed and five friends open black against), on the basis of provides conforms to the operation mechanism of competitive user habit, let all kinds of players can not only easily to fit in more luxuriant micro and outstanding perfect interpretation of consciousness, competition and charming!\n\nSkin mass hero, personality, skill variety, style is changeable, real-time matching, open black friends, for players to experience the depth, classic, high order of competition and fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xijkfeopk9btssjzh4us.jpg'),(5250,'Cynthia: Hidden in the Moonshadow - Xmas Edition','2024-12-24','Sin género','Xbox One','Emotional, 3rd-person, story-driven, adventure game focused on solving puzzles and using stealth mechanics. Use your bow to interact with environmental elements. Sneak, climb or distract guards to move further unnoticed. Solve light puzzles alongside your path to rescue your loved one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e4v.jpg'),(5251,'Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo! Kibou no Meikyuu to Tsudoishi Boukensha-tachi!','2019-06-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','Konosuba: God\'s Blessing on this Wonderful World! Labyrinth of Hope and the Gathering Adventurers is a Japanese dungeon RPG adventure game. It takes place after the crisis in Alcanretia. Kazuma and friends return to their mundane hikikomori lifestyle....that is until Aqua picked up a mysterious glass piece. They took it to Vanir\'s appraisal for assurance where they learn it is a magic stone piece with immense power and worth... 10,000,000 Eris!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co615d.jpg'),(5252,'Miko Adventures Puffball','2021-09-15','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Miko is a raccoon who lost his way while wandering through the forest, he discovers a portal and upon touching it he finds himself in a world full of dangers. Miko is transported into another dimension and your goal is to help him find a way back home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3od4.jpg'),(5253,'Lendas do Pebol: Mythic Football','2023-01-12','Sport, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A football game with characters you\'ve never seen before! Get ready for a 1-on-1 Football match with mystical players! Choose your favorite Amazonian legend and fight to score a goal! Who will do better? The Boto? The Uirapuru? The Big Cobra? The Boitata? The power is in your hands!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c8f.jpg'),(5254,'Man in gravity','2020-08-11','Platform, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A runner in which the player is able to control the force of gravity (change the gravity up and down). The goal of the player is to run as far as possible, and preferably get a better result than other players','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3no2.jpg'),(5255,'Inescapable','2014-04-03','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Named the \"Best PC Metroidvania You Didn’t Play of 2013\" by Matthew Zulawski of metroidvanias.com and listed as a notable game in indiegames.com\'s Top 10 Indie Horror Games of 2013, the game sees players unravel the mystery uncovered by a remote interplanetary mining operation. \nWhat did they find? What threat does it pose? And ultimately, what does it truly mean to be a hero?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bfpw9rwngpkbl4fcq1gg.jpg'),(5256,'Rocket Swords','2018-09-10','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','CLOWNS ARE FALLING FROM THE SKY! KILL THEM ALL! \n \nYou must destroy them. Do not relent. Do not give them quarter. \n \nFLY THROUGH THE AIR USING A UNIQUE MOTION SYSTEM, NEVER BEFORE SEEN IN VR! \n \nTHEY ALSO LOOK LIKE CLOWNS.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5257,'Doki Doki Spark Of Hope','2019-09-16','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki: Spark of Hope is a mod for Doki Doki Literature Club! that offers a unique and exciting approach to the universe of the original game. Unlike the dark psychological experience of the DDLC, this mod seeks to bring a new perspective, focusing on themes of hope, overcoming and the emotional development of the characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gh2.jpg'),(5258,'Fracture the Flag','2016-12-07','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fracture the Flag is a PvP oriented RTS. Plant a flag to claim territory as your own. Hurl boulders in parabolic paths to crush your opponents base. Or hand deliver bombs to knock down stone walls. \n \nExpand your territory by collecting resources and planting your flags. Some territory is rich in resources other has tactical and strategic value. Destroy your opponents flags to remove their claim and make your own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q6t.jpg'),(5259,'Second Stone: The Legend of the Hidden World',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A retro-inspired adventure RPG with beautiful handcrafted visuals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57jq.jpg'),(5260,'Behind Enemy Lines','1997-12-01','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','Behind Enemy Lines is a first person rail shooter where the player controls a machine gun mounted on a jeep driving through enemy territory. The game consists of four missions that all involve infiltrating and destroying various enemy facilities. The setting is modern and enemies include simple foot soldiers, light vehicles such as Jeeps, Humvees, and heavy vehicles like tanks and helicopters.\n\nAs in other rail shooters, the player\'s control is limited to moving a crosshair and shooting, while movement is automatic. The main weapon is a machine gun that can fire both bullets and missiles. There is no reloading, and it\'s not possible to run out of ammo completely but if the ammo counter gets too low the firing rate will decrease. Therefore, more ammo has to be collected by destroying ammo crates. Missiles, too, have to be collected by destroying crates. They can however only be used on certain heavy targets, such as helicopters and tanks and when aiming on these the missile will automatically lock on the target and the player only has to launch it by pressing the right button. Fuel can also be collected by hitting fuel drums. If the vehicle\'s fuel supply is depleted the player will get a score penalty.\n\nThe game can be played by one or two players each controlling a machine gun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xd2.jpg'),(5261,'The Settlers IV: Mission CD','2001-08-02','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A set of new missions for The Settlers IV. Although Morbus, the leader of the Dark Tribe, has been finally defeated, his tribe is not completely eradicated. Some survivors still pose a threat and wreak destruction. We can enjoy three more campaigns offering over 50 missions in total. The players can assume the role of the leader of the Romans, Mayans or Vikings. Each nation has different tasks to perform: the Romans must defeat the Dark Tribe once and for all, the Mayans must stop the Roman offensive, and the Vikings must discover an ancient world. The included map editor is a special new feature in this expansion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/p6ilx74y9yprak1ayynl.jpg'),(5262,'Lose 95',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5263,'Soda Star','2015-05-14','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Soda Star is a competitive, single player puzzle experience where players square off for the best scores and flawless sorting by controlling multiple switch controls.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5264,'Pocket Room Sanrio Characters','2025-03-22','Simulator','Handheld Electronic LCD','A new Tamagotchi based on Sanrio characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9igc.jpg'),(5265,'Super Dodge Ball','2014-06-18','Sport, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Wii U, Xbox One, Nintendo Entertainment System','Team USA is on its way to a Cinderella success story in the Super Dodgy Ball World Cup Championships. From out of nowhere, this scrappy bunch of rookies is advancing to the final round of competition. Seven powerful teams still stand between Team USA and their ultimate challenge; the long awaited grudge match with the undefeated, defending world champions, Team USSR. Only you can lead the U.S. to victory over the highly-favored competition, and give them the chance to crush the mighty Soviets.\n\n-1 or 2 players\n-Multi-dimensional, high-resolution graphics\n-3 increasing levels of challenge\n\nThrash, Bash, and Smash the Competition','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hur.jpg'),(5266,'Beer Ranger','2018-02-19','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Logic platformer in the Oldschool style. The dwarfs are on a quest to find as much beer as they can. Only smart mind and skilfull hands will bring them to the desired goal. Will you manage to beat the most hardcore levels?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pirpc2wvfggwknm4iync.jpg'),(5267,'Ingression','2024-05-03','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ingression is an unforgiving & mind-bending precision platformer where you\'ll think and platform with seamless portals. Play as Rina, a thief living in the year 2442 in the corrupt Galactic Empire. Travel to the future to save the past from a tremendous time paradox. Fulfill your destiny of keeping time intact.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7njz.jpg'),(5268,'Summer Trip Cruise','2023-05-25','Racing, Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hey you, we need a captain! Drive the cruise ship with the on-screen rudder, avoid obstacles, take pictures and enjoy the ride. Take it easy... or take the challenge!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ber.jpg'),(5269,'Oden','2025-02-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','ODEN: Divine Destiny in a Steaming Bowl - Serve Japanese soul food with mystical powers at your midnight oden cart. Choose the perfect ingredients to heal broken lives in this heartwarming journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ifz.jpg'),(5270,'Zid Journey',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Zid Journey is a hand-drawn adventure game with a strong, classic 90\'s vibe. Play as Zid, a yellow dinosaur, and point-and-click his way as he goes on a journey to find the lost parents of a small Daspletosaurus hatchling!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co596t.jpg'),(5271,'A-Spec: First Assault','2023-11-10','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Engaging space combat simulator, using a realistic flight system with Newtonian physics, sophisticated and diverse gameplay featuring detailed ship systems, including ship weaponry and module customization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lg1.jpg'),(5272,'Doki Doki Youtuber Club',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Doki Doki: Youtuber Club is a mod for Doki Doki Literature Club! that takes the game\'s universe in a fun new direction, combining the original atmosphere with the world of social media and content creation. In this mod, the girls in the literature club are not just ordinary students - they are digital influencers with their own YouTube channels, each with a unique style and theme.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gh7.jpg'),(5273,'Moirai','2013-11-26','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The townsfolk tell you that a woman named Julia has gone missing. You venture out into the cave just beyond the village looking for her. You\'re given a knife to protect yourself. What you find there may surprise you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2655.jpg'),(5274,'Tailside: Cozy Cafe Sim','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A charming RPG where you\'ll discover the joys of running your own cozy cafe. From brewing the perfect cup of coffee to making friends with the locals, experience a blend of relaxation and adventure during your own coffee break.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92ez.jpg'),(5275,'The Plague Doctor of Wippra','2022-10-05','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The plague spreads fear and agony in the small town of Wippra. As a doctor, you help where you can. Then medieval superstition and religious zeal mix into a deadly threat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h9h.jpg'),(5276,'Doki Doki Another Moment With You','2018-10-01','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki: Another Moment With You is a mod for Doki Doki Literature Club! that expands the original game experience, adding new events, interactions and an in-depth storyline for the characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gox.jpg'),(5277,'Graveball','2018-07-31','Sport, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Graveball is a multiplayer game where teams of goblins play a game of graveyard rugby while smashing each other with clubs. Death is not the end! Respawn as a ghost to move swiftly into position and summon a new goblin from the earth!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q9s.jpg'),(5278,'Virtua Fighter 4: Evolution','2003-07-07','Fighting','Arcade, PlayStation 2','Evolution was an updated version of Virtua Fighter 4. The game introduced two new characters and adjusted every other character as well. The two new characters were the Judoka-assassin, Goh Hinogami and the Muay Thai boxer Brad Burns. With the addition of Brad Burns, Vanessa Lewis\'s alternate Muay Thai style from Virtua Fighter 4 was removed and replaced with a Vale Tudo \"Offensive\" style; making her a solely Vale Tudo brawler.\n\nAll of the stages were adjusted. For example, Lei-Fei\'s stage in Virtua Fighter 4 previously took place during sunset, in Evolution it takes place during the morning.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hqq.jpg'),(5279,'Badminton Warrior','2018-11-15','Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Easy to learn but hard to master, Badminton Warrior provides a classic challenge that focuses on reflexes, timing, and problem solving. Clear, drive, and smash your way through unique, sports themed levels to face the ultimate evil, the Bellighost.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3luv.jpg'),(5280,'Poop Killer 5','2022-10-18','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Poop Killer 5\" is the sequel to the stinkiest and deadliest killer... The Poop Killer Returns...\n\nWith a different construction from the previous ones, Leaving the gameplay more dynamic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xo7.jpg'),(5281,'Club Penguin Brasil',NULL,'Adventure, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4koo.jpg'),(5282,'Grid Masters','2016-05-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight for victory in a 1v1 or 2v2 grid-based deathmatch in Grid Masters. Represent your favorite faction as one of five characters (with more to come), each with their own unique abilities. Toss massive bombs, rocket punch, or send explosive robot minions to take your enemies down!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5283,'Horace and the Spiders','1983-12-31','Platform, Arcade','ZX Spectrum','In 1983, Tang produced the third title in the series, Horace and the Spiders. This was primarily a platform game with the Horace sprite retained from the first two games. The first level sees Horace climbing a hill while jumping over spiders. The second level involves crossing a bridge by swinging on spider threads. The third level is the final confrontation with the spiders – he must create holes in the web, luring the spiders into the holes to fix them and consequently jumping on them.\n\nUnlike the earlier two titles, this game was only released for the ZX Spectrum. The first stage of this game shared similarities with both Pitfall and the Colecovision game Smurf: Rescue in Gargamel\'s Castle, whilst the third platform stage is essentially a Space Panic clone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pzhafadokchcxf3szwzz.jpg'),(5284,'World of Warcraft Classic','2019-08-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','World of Warcraft: Classic (shortened as Classic) is a new server option for World of Warcraft announced at BlizzCon 2017. The goal of Classic is to let players experience World of Warcraft as close as possible to what it was before The Burning Crusade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1trz.jpg'),(5285,'Euler Wars','2020-02-29','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Test your flying and design abilities in this challenging 3D space arcade shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lpz.jpg'),(5286,'TriviaQuest: Mythic Conquest','2024-01-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','TriviaQuest: Mythic Conquest is a game where you battle mythical monsters by answering true/false to questions. Utilize unique abilities and progress through challenging levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lrg.jpg'),(5287,'Quarries of Scred','2014-01-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bringing classic arcade games such as Boulder Dash and Dig Dug into the 21st century, Quarries Of Scred is an unapologetically brutal, retro-inspired arcade game designed to see just how far you\'ll go to risk your bounty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y6p.jpg'),(5288,'Legend of Heroes: Three Kingdoms','2025-03-26','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Legend of Heroes: Three Kingdoms\" is a single-player RPG where you shape the Three Kingdoms era. Choose to be a ruler, a loyal advisor, or a cunning mercenary. Marry, build homes, or train in martial arts. Restore peace through diplomacy or conquer with mighty armies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9got.jpg'),(5289,'O2Jam Pop','2013-04-17','Music','Android, iOS','An O2Jam game with casual gameplay and pop music.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5290,'After Friday','2025-04-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After Friday is a psychological horror game. Every late Friday night on your way home, you sense that someone—or something—is following you. At the same time, your memories begin to fade—perhaps they were never important to begin with.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nwa.jpg'),(5291,'NumWorlds','2025-03-07','Puzzle, Indie','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jkc.jpg'),(5292,'Trimps','2022-05-02','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','An incremental game focused on resource management where players command creatures called Trimps, using them to gather different materials, engage in combat, and return with new loot and upgrades.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nor.jpg'),(5293,'Absolution','2025-03-14','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Absolution is a first-person psychological horror experience where you face THE JUDGE as they peel apart your very soul. Uncover dark truths and navigate moral dilemmas as you\'re questioned about your past deeds. Every lie has consequences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hvz.jpg'),(5294,'Touhou Spell Bubble: Character Pack - Suwako Moriya','2021-12-23','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','The new character pack is here at last! Our first installment contains the Highest of Native Gods, Suwako Moriya! She has the ability to turn Blank Bubbles into the more user-friendly Awakening Bubbles, and she\'s got three special spell cards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zil.jpg'),(5295,'Goblin Slayer','2025-03-14','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Enter the world of Goblin Slayer, where you\'ll battle waves of goblins across an open map filled with levels to conquer. Collect power-up as you progress, stacking them to become incredibly powerful as you clear each wave. Take on bigger challenges and face ever-growing hordes in this fast-paced, action-packed adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mne.jpg'),(5296,'Sonic Quest',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ijp.jpg'),(5297,'Actua Ice Hockey','1998-12-31','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','An Ice Hockey game from the Actua Sports franchise. It has a sequel which was released in 1999.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yvo.jpg'),(5298,'Eternal Journey: New Atlantis','2012-06-23','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Eternal Journey: New Atlantis is a casual hidden object game developed by Five-BN and published by Alawar Entertainment for the Mac and Windows. The player plays a female archeologist investigating the secrets of Atlantis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p75.jpg'),(5299,'3D Xmas Adventure: Santa\'s Rescue','1996-01-01','Shooter','DOS','Armed with a magic candy cane that shoots jingles and sprinkles, you run around the North Pole gathering gifts, freeing grounded reindeer, and thawing out elves. Beware of the growling abominable snowmen and the menacing grinchy creatures!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e6s.jpg'),(5300,'No One Lives in Heaven: Digital Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3s5t.jpg'),(5301,'Interview With the Whisperer','2020-12-02','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short game about a journalist who travels into the Galician countryside to interview an old man who claims to have built a radio that allows him to speak with God.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p9f.jpg'),(5302,'Rize of the Summonds','2019-08-08','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rize of the Summonds is a metroidvania, fantasy, sidescroller game in which you can transform into an orc, wraith, cat and many more summonds, to unlock unique abilites for combat, puzzles and to reach new areas. Unlock these new summonds, uncover the intricate story of the game, complete the challenges and missions and manage your strategic combat abilities as this game will not always hold your hands. So be alert at all cost. Oh and one more thing, there will be many upgraded items/weapons and spells.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yl2.jpg'),(5303,'Shootball Arena','2022-04-08','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shootball Arena is a fast paced online multiplayer game in which football and third person shooter merge together. Choose your avatar, hold your favorite gun and challenge your friends in exciting matches up to ten players. You need speed, agility and a perfect shot… do you have what it takes?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5l4x.jpg'),(5304,'Gang Wars','2021-03-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gang Wars - shoot faster, live longer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4171.jpg'),(5305,'The Great Fluctus',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A relaxing game to zone out for an hour, all while exploring cozy alien worlds, trading with mutants, rebuilding society and saving the world - no pressure, right?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wq2.jpg'),(5306,'Davis Cup Tennis','1993-12-31','Sport','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','The Davis Cup is an annual international team event in men\'s tennis. The participating countries, consisting of different players, compete in both singles and doubles matches. The entire championship has been made available in this game, and the matches are played using a third-person perspective.\n\nThere are different types of courts and difficulty levels. Aside from the championship, you can also practice, enter tournaments or play exhibition matches. Work along with a friend as a team or compete in singles matches. Aside from the familiar strokes, timing is important to determine the amount of spin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5l33.jpg'),(5307,'World of Tanks: Blitz - Free Pack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Three days of increased profitability! Get 50% more XP and credits, enjoy the improved Garage, and acquire the Undeniable Advantage special camouflage.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5308,'Spirit Speaker','2025-03-17','Sin género','PlayStation 4','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9keh.jpg'),(5309,'New World Computing Bundle',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ds4.jpg'),(5310,'Planet Alpha: Digital Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d2u.jpg'),(5311,'If Only I Could Go Home Early','2023-04-13','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','“If only I could go home early” is a pixel wind adventure puzzle game. It’s about a young man who is a workaholic and does not spend time with his wife. As a result, his wife launched a retaliation against him, playing dead.\nThe player must unlock the puzzle designed by the wife who is a SOHO novelist in every level. Otherwise, the game is over. The posture of dead body, the painting on the wall, and so on, everything in the house may be the key to unlock the puzzles. The biggest secret of the wife is waiting to be lift the veil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hfa.jpg'),(5312,'Birdcakes','2018-05-29','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','\"Ptui, ptui, ptui!!!” - That´s the glorious sound of bullets in this 2D shooter platformer!\nStep in a world of state-of-the-art Cupcakes weaponry! After a picnic went horribly wrong, Pancake the Cupcake desperately tries to fend off hungry flies away from his girlfriend Cherry! Fly through 6 fly-infested worlds and destroy them with Pancake’s powerful candy bullets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28vk.jpg'),(5313,'A Solution','2025-03-02','Point-and-click, Adventure','Game Boy','A prime minister is murdered, and the entire nation is in shock. No one had believed that something like this could happen here. Yet, everyday life continues, in the firm belief that the police are doing their utmost to find a solution. And they are—but the solution they are seeking is not the same one the people are looking for.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i9c.jpg'),(5314,'Slippy Bear','2025-04-04','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Things don\'t move on their own, and things don\'t stop moving on their own. The same applies to bears. Welcome to the world of inertia, a law of physics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ndi.jpg'),(5315,'Jungle Quest','1984-12-31','Platform, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX','In this action game published by Solar Software the player has to guide fearless Jim through the 5 screens of jungle hazards to rescue Jane from the cannibals cooking pot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xhayiy8xiyjotaofqlnn.jpg'),(5316,'Sky Aces','2003-09-12','Shooter, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sky Aces is a WWI themed fighter plane game. The game comes with a campaign mode featuring ten allied missions and ten German missions. Missions will usually feature such goals as destroying fuel tanks, bridges, or other aircraft. Some missions will find you with allied craft many though showcase your ace solo skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w72.jpg'),(5317,'Runnordai','2021-09-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter the foreboding world of Runnordai, an eerie and unsettling game set within the confines of a sprawling hospital. As you navigate the labyrinthine corridors, your sole objective is to check every locker and uncover a crucial code needed to escape. But beware, a sinister figure lurks in the shadows, emerging at random intervals with distorted laughter and a chilling presence that clouds your vision.\n\nTime is of the essence in this macabre chase. Lingering too long in a certain area spells doom, but swift evasion can keep you one step ahead. Equipped with a phone, you monitor ventilation issues, while managing the battery levels of both your phone and computer. The PC serves as your lifeline to rectify the escalating ventilation problems, its power restored through a strategically placed lever within the map.\n\nImmerse yourself in the chilling atmosphere of Runnordai, where each step could be your last. Unlock the secrets within the hospital\'s walls, confront your pursuer, and strive to escape this haunting nightmare. Are you ready to embrace the darkness and face the unknown?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ogh.jpg'),(5318,'Tourist Trophy','2006-06-01','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 2','Tourist Trophy: The Real Riding Simulator is a 2006 motorcycle racing video game. It was designed by Polyphony Digital, the same team behind the popular Gran Turismo auto racing series. Tourist Trophy is one of only four titles for the PlayStation 2 that is capable of 1080i output, another being Gran Turismo 4, the game engine of which is heavily used in Tourist Trophy.\n\nTourist Trophy was first released in China on January 26, 2006, then in Japan on February 2, 2006. The NTSC edition was officially released on April 4, 2006 with seven extra motorcycles, new riding gear, seven bonus background music tracks, enhanced visual effects, an exclusive \"Semi-Pro Mode\" and bike profiles. The PAL edition was launched on June 1, 2006 in Australia, and in Europe the next day. The PAL version offers two additional motorcycles and five new BGM tracks from European artists Infadels, Vitalic and Hystereo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6psb.jpg'),(5319,'Royal Agents: Sweet Zombie','2017-09-14','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Royal Agents: Sweet Zombie is a turn-based squad game with unlikely agents trying to stop evil in time for tea. You control a team of three agents of the crown with different skills and backgrounds, tasked with the assignment to investigate and stop any evil-doings in a graveyard.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5320,'What\'s On The Menu?','2025-03-04','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In What\'s on the Menu?, step into the shoes of a restaurant manager. From selecting ingredients and crafting menus to hiring staff and customizing your restaurant, every decision counts. Face random events, unlock new recipes, and rise through the ranks to become the ultimate restaurateur!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gc0.jpg'),(5321,'Metric Racer','2021-02-23','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Race through future cities and across the surface of other planets to out run, out maneuver and out pace your competition. Metric Racer, a fast paced, cartoon shaded futuristic racer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tjh.jpg'),(5322,'Mercs','2009-02-20','Shooter, Platform, Arcade','Arcade, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Wii, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Amiga, Amstrad CPC, Sega Master System/Mark III','The players are members of a covert counter-terrorist team of mercenaries known as the \"Wolf Force\". The aim of the game was to rescue the former President from rebels in the fictional African country of Zutula, which bears resemblance to the apartheid regime in South Africa. The game has six main levels, plus the final level where your mission is to rescue the former U.S. president from the Hercules Transport. The game\'s arsenal include real-world machine guns, shot guns, flame throwers, and grenade launchers. Several missions even have pilotable vehicles available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co264b.jpg'),(5323,'Clover Reset',NULL,'Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Hey, do you know the meaning of the four-leaf clover?\" Set at \"Shonan Saika Academy,\" a prestigious school in Shonan, Kanagawa Prefecture, this is a youthful story of girls wavering between friendship and love.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bwj.jpg'),(5324,'Bart Bird','2014-06-10','Adventure, Indie','Android','Fly with a crazy bird crossing obstacles and grab all the fruit you can on the way! \n \nRandom way in which the game is never the same. \n \nTake apples as you can. \n \nConcentration skill and cold blood Bart Bird!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ymzcvvcsdmrozhpgjdxi.jpg'),(5325,'Failure Drill','2023-03-11','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 2D, singleplayer adventure game set in the near future. The player controls Claire on her journey as a soldier in a mysterious war, while also attempting to solve the enigmas her identity and reality hinged upon before. This game is a drama with psychological horror themes and stylized 2D art.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b9i.jpg'),(5326,'One Piece: Tobidase Kaizoku-dan!','2001-08-02','Sin género','PlayStation','From TV Animation One Piece: Tobidase Kaizoku-dan! is a Japan-exclusive role-playing game created by Bandai for the PlayStation. It is the fourth game to be based on the One Piece manga and anime. This game\'s introduction uses the theme song Believe from the One Piece Anime.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q1g.jpg'),(5327,'Hunter Gatherer','2015-03-24','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hunter Gatherer is a top down adventure in which you are found, lost in the woods, by a forest spirit. He has a passion for cooking and will point you in the direction of your home town if you help him find some ingredients. Some though, are hard to find, and you must travel long distances, find food, avoid and combat dangerous monsters, set traps, and gatherer materials to make a fire, before it gets dark.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5328,'Goofy Gorillas','2023-12-01','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Relive your childhood nostalgia at Goofy Gorillas, the largest virtual jungle gym! Battle it out with your friends in a wide range of casual but intense PvP gamemodes, or chill out and take part in some extra activities around the venue! Make the Goofy experience your own!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fss.jpg'),(5329,'Slip \'n Dip','2020-08-04','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slip \'n Dip is a local multiplayer game where up to 4 penguins fight for survival on rapidly melting ice. Jump and slide around the ice to knock off your opponents before they can knock you off!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lxi.jpg'),(5330,'Battle Live: Halloween Live',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5331,'Dylan Dog: Through the Looking Glass','1993-12-31','Adventure','DOS, Amiga','The second game based on the Italian character Dylan Dog.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/k5ccrlrtvgkfftcs1ke7.jpg'),(5332,'Ark: Survival Evolved: Explorer\'s Edition','2017-10-04','Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Combining the base game with 3 massive Expansion Packs, ARK: Survival Evolved Explorer\'s Edition is a ultimate way to get even more dinosaur action! The Explorer\'s Edition gives you access to the mega hit ARK: Survival Evolved as well as the Scorched Earth, Aberration, and Extinction Expansion Packs, adding nearly 900 hours of gameplay!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v45.jpg'),(5333,'Satan\'s Puzzle 666','2022-03-29','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Satan\'s Puzzle 666 is a puzzle game where you have to match the pieces to obtain the seal of evil spirits and behold their divine image.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jl1.jpg'),(5334,'Goi: Let\'s Play Together','2023-03-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Goi: Let\'s Play Together is an online multiplayer game that combines the elements of Battle Royale and Casual then becomes a Party Survival Game. There will be only one winner in Goi.Try your best to survive the ghost hunt, but OH! Your friends are ghosts too!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oav.jpg'),(5335,'Keylogger','2020-12-13','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Each person’s family name in the Continuum is given a debt which they must pay back, or they risk being wiped by the Grid.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ij8.jpg'),(5336,'Dokyusei: Bangin\' Summer','2022-04-15','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dōkyūsei is a seminal classic of the dating sim genre that first blew Japan\'s mind in 1992. This updated remake adds HD art, optional modern features, and for the first time ever, a global release.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5him.jpg'),(5337,'Endless Invaders','2018-04-23','Arcade','iOS','Endless Space Invaders. Blast your way through an endless invasion of space aliens. Collect power ups to help you survive. Collect coins to unlock ship upgrades. How long will you last against the Space Invaders? •Game Centre- To challenge your friends and the universe. •One hand joystick control.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5338,'WWE 2K24: Bray Wyatt Edition','2024-10-16','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','The WWE 2K24 Bray Wyatt Edition includes WWE 2K24 Forty Years of WrestleMania Edition and the Bray Wyatt Edition Pack Featuring a brand-new playable version of ‘\"The Fiend\"\' and much more. Let him in.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9esx.jpg'),(5339,'The Callisto Protocol: Day One Edition','2022-12-02','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Pre-purchase now to get the following digital content:\n- Retro Prisoner Character & Weapons Skin\n\nSurvive to escape the horrors of Callisto and uncover the dark secrets of Jupiter\'s dead moon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4viw.jpg'),(5340,'Toon War','2019-05-30','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, Nintendo Switch','ToonWar is a twin stick shooter game with colorful graphics. Your mission is to liberate peaceful villages from evil forces, eliminate enemies and win over dangerous bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23u7.jpg'),(5341,'Save the Astronaut','2020-09-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re stranded. Navigate a perilous uncharted world full of freezing waters, and razor sharp rocks. You have ten seconds to breathe. Don\'t choke.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40ti.jpg'),(5342,'Weed','2018-01-28','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','WEED - an unusual match3 game with beautiful anime graphics and interesting light casual gameplay. Move the lines! Play with match3 with a sexy anime girl. \nLine up and win!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5343,'Night Nite','2023-12-22','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Night Nite\" is a horror comedy adventure game set in modern times. One day, mysterious events begin to unfold around you. What could be the true identity behind these occurrences?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hs7.jpg'),(5344,'Aqua Glide','2024-05-29','Racing','Meta Quest 2','A virtual reality Jet Ski game with multiplayer and monster survival matches.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5345,'Zero Glide VR','2023-11-17','Sin género','Meta Quest 2','A virtual reality motorcycle game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5346,'F1 22','2022-07-01','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Race the stunning, new cars of the Formula 1 2022 season with the authentic lineup of all 20 drivers and 10 teams, and take control of your race experience with new immersive or cinematic race sequences. Test your skills around the new Miami International Autodrome, and get a taste of the glitz and glamour in F1 Life. Create a team and take them to the front of the grid with new depth in the acclaimed My Team career mode, race head-to-head in split-screen or multiplayer, or change the pace by taking supercars from some of the sport’s biggest names to the track.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4r57.jpg'),(5347,'Inazuma Eleven 3: Bomb Blast','2013-09-27','Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, Nintendo DS','Several months have passed after saving Earth from Alius Academy’s attack (in Inazuma Eleven 2), Mark Evans and his teammates are summoned by Seymour Hillman to assemble at Raimon Jr. High.\nWhen the team get to the school, they see familiar faces from Japan’s national football players who have once fought along with them, such as Xavier Foster and Jordan Greenway originally from Alius Academy, as well as new faces. Hillman has assembled all these Japan’s best football players for one purpose; to enter the “Football Frontier International (FFI)”.\nWelcoming Mark Evans as Japan’s national team captain, they now strive forward to challenge best football teams from all around the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co407q.jpg'),(5348,'Automatum','2018-07-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Automatum is a 2D action and platform game with a dark pixel art style,in wich we take the role of an alien that must face a lot of adversities like platforming, combat and puzzles so he can regain his precious freedom.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5349,'VVVV','2010-01-27','Platform','Web browser','Disaster! While traveling to the beach planet of Relaxia, you and all your crew members suddenly got teleported to a dangerous but strangely familiar place.\n\nRescue the six stranded crewmen so you can finally bask in both glory and sunlight on Relaxia.\n\nVVVV is a 4K tribute to Terry Cavanagh\'s brilliant game VVVVVV.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s3n.jpg'),(5350,'Survivors of Xcalibur','2024-11-22','Sin género','Meta Quest 2','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5351,'Kirby Air Riders','2025-12-31','Racing, Arcade','Nintendo Switch 2','Kirby Air Riders is the long-awaited sequel to Kirby Air Ride on the Gamecube.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m6e.jpg'),(5352,'Find Pixel','2017-11-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Remember the games where you had to find objects, now it\'s all in three-dimensional space, with nice graphics, and an unusual storyline. Help the ghost find the items that he needs, while interacting with the outside world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2be0.jpg'),(5353,'Junkyard Frog',NULL,'Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jhp.jpg'),(5354,'Feed All Monsters','2023-06-22','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Feed All Monsters is a cute and cozy Line Puzzle game. Assist a team of delivery workers in their quest to bring tasty food to all the little monsters. Find the optimal path for each worker in order to get all the monsters fed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rqc.jpg'),(5355,'Norsk: Epistle',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Norsk: Epistle is an experimental singleplayer game. Set in the atmospheric abandoned Siberian town the game will introduce how to solve puzzles using second dimension in 3d world to understand what happened with humanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q7p.jpg'),(5356,'HeartFinder','2024-11-20','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hi! Can you find 50 little hidden hearts?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94yu.jpg'),(5357,'Trucks & Trailers','2011-06-17','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Trucks & Trailers puts your driving skills to the ultimate test with 50 individual truck driving challenges. Compete against the clock to complete intricately designed courses and tasks that put you firmly into the driver\'s seat. Can you avoid obstacles whilst reversing a trailer? Do you have the lateral thinking required to sort a series of trucks & trailers in the yard into their correct positions? Can you park with precision?\n\nAs your skills increase, upgrading the difficulty level will guarantee that there is always a task that will put you and your truck to the ultimate test! At the highest difficulty setting external camera views are disabled, forcing you to maneuver like the pros using only in-cab mirrors. A test that will award you the gold medals and the honor of being a real trucking titan!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44zu.jpg'),(5358,'Dan the Man: Action Platformer','2015-11-25','Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','Android, iOS','With nearly 10 MILLION installs and growing each day, it’s easy to see why Dan the Man has been awarded as one of the “Best of Games for 2016” across the major mobile platforms! \n \nThis legendary game dials back to gaming’s retro roots to bring you an action platformer brawler that you’d swear you’ve played in the old arcade! So download now and take control of the legendary (and often inappropriate hero) … Dan the Man! \n \nWith a cracking funny story, awesome upgradeable fighting skills and an epic arsenal of weapons that will make even the most heroic of heroes envious, Dan The Man\'s arcade fight fest has enough enemies and boss fights to satisfy every hardcore gamer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/korwcqrxahljwiexv2tz.jpg'),(5359,'Yukuhito no Pleroma','2016-12-29','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A visual, sound, and novel game that illustrates a Gnostic world.\nA story that combines human history, religion, politics, fiction, and prophecies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97z5.jpg'),(5360,'Pixel Cross Stitch: Spring Pack 3','2025-04-24','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','20 new images to color by number or cross stitch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9npt.jpg'),(5361,'Overlooting','2025-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An inventory management roguelite game. Adapt your strategy to a skill tree that changes every run, combine pieces of equipment to form powerful synergies and create a game-changing build capable of defeating the bosses that will try to stop you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iin.jpg'),(5362,'Don\'t Starve Alone Pack Plus','2018-11-08','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Don\'t Starve Alone Pack Plus includes:\n\n- Don\'t Starve\n- Don\'t Starve: Reign of Giants\n- Don\'t Starve: Shipwrecked\n- Don\'t Starve: Hamlet','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t72.jpg'),(5363,'Gunslugs: Rogue Tactics','2019-08-06','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Make use of the many talents of an elite unit, given the task to take out the evil Black Duck Army. Use stealth attacks to sneak up on your opponents, use your wits to outsmart enemy patrols and if all else fails, use a large collection of weapons to take out the Black Duck Army in style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41j9.jpg'),(5364,'Filament: Marmalade Edition','2020-04-23','Puzzle, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Make your mission loadout complete with the digital deluxe package - The Marmalade Edition!\n\nIncludes the base game plus:\n- The stunning original game soundtrack featuring all the tracks from Filament.\n- DELUXE EDITION EXCLUSIVE: Marmalade\'s Sketchbook which will give the artistic insight of the eponymous crew member, including sketches of actual in-game puzzles and objects from around the Filament Corporation ship.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d1l.jpg'),(5365,'Maverick Gunn and the Eye of Oggun','2020-08-14','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are Maverick Gunn, treasure hunter and renegade History teacher. You start the morning at home as usual and after a few minutes of conversation with a mysterious and dangerous looking man, you are drawn into the chase for a huge diamond...and face to face with an ancient mystery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3twa.jpg'),(5366,'Kids dinosaur puzzles and number games',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5367,'Wheel Dismount',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5368,'Color Fear',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Today on the Color Fun Coloring Show they want Viewers to Help them Find out Who is Breaking into Their House.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s56.jpg'),(5369,'Pearl Grabber','2020-07-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','i\'m feeling like i wanna grab the pearls','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qew.jpg'),(5370,'WorldShift','2008-05-01','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','WorldShift is a cyber-fantasy RTS game where you discover the mysteries of an object called Shard Zero','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cy7.jpg'),(5371,'Heli-Yeah! Bundle',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dry.jpg'),(5372,'Bill',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Bill is a master in crafting, restoring, and building - Craft tools, items, and upgrades for your home - Grow your food - Take care of yourself - Make money online by shipping your creations. Help a baby alien who crashed in your garden by feeding him and building a homemade rocket.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bmk.jpg'),(5373,'Silent Heroes: Elite Troups of WWII','2005-09-16','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Expansion to Soldiers: Heroes of WWII','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rb1.jpg'),(5374,'The Last Tape','2025-03-07','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A hidden truth. For over 50 years, Lurmont has been hiding incredibly dark secrets from the public. During an investigation, tapes are discovered showing all the atrocities they have committed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ift.jpg'),(5375,'Cave Flying','2017-03-03','Indie, Arcade','Android','Cave Flying is retro style and challenging cave flyer game with modern design. Cave Flying takes you back to world of classic Amiga and C64 games like Thrust and Asteroids. Its simple vector style lets you focus to master your flying skill through challenging caves. Game includes also different missions and story elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ejjue6billza5mjhvtab.jpg'),(5376,'Escape from Chernobyl','2019-07-05','Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','TRY TO ESCAPE FROM THE HAUNTED AREA OF CHERNOBYL NPP \nEscape from Chernobyl is a survival-horror game taking place in the Chernobyl power-plant complex. It features an initial story-driven part taking place inside the reactor buildings and then turns into an open-world survival with total freedom to explore in a seamless experience: from open spaces to the maze-like corridors of each building and the nuclear unit buildings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j7n.jpg'),(5377,'Anomaly Living','2025-03-10','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Anomaly Living is a cooperative horror game for 1-2 players. Only you can help find Leia in this world filled with monsters and anomaly phenomena. Good luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l6t.jpg'),(5378,'One Piece: Going Baseball - Kaizoku Yakyuu','2004-03-11','Sport','Game Boy Advance','One Piece: Going Baseball is a Japanese only game released for the GameBoy Advance in 2004. The controls are simple and the basic point of the game is to choose a team and try to win in a tournament against all the other teams. There is a story mode, which is needed to unlock the final team, and a minigame mode.\n\nThe game appears to take place after the Skypiea Arc, as the crew is seen in the beginning wearing their outfits from Skypiea, and the Skypiea arena is the farthest point that the game goes up to.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q2a.jpg'),(5379,'GoreBox','2023-07-21','Shooter, Simulator, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','GoreBox is a chaotic physics-driven sandbox where creativity meets destruction. Use the Reality Crusher to spawn, manipulate, and obliterate anything. Customize, battle with friends, roleplay, or face devious creatures. In this world, your imagination rules—and chaos is your playground!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91ib.jpg'),(5380,'Reach the Beat','2024-08-15','Music','SteamVR','Dive into the stunning world of \"Reach The Beat,\" where your shooting skills are tested to the electrifying rhythms of electronic music. In this game, every move and shot you make creates a musical harmony, illuminated by the neon lights of an abstract city. Ready to feel the rhythm?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nos.jpg'),(5381,'We Love Katamari','2006-02-02','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 2','We Love Katamari, is a third-person puzzle-action video game where the player controls the Prince, the 5-centimeter-tall son of the god-like entity the King of All Cosmos, who rolls around a \"katamari\", a magical ball that causes objects smaller than it to attach to it. Throughout each level, the play must collect objects in order to fulfill objectives set by the prince\'s father.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4af9.jpg'),(5382,'Earthworm Jim 2','2009-12-14','Shooter, Platform, Quiz/Trivia, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Linux, Wii, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, PC (Microsoft Windows), Sega Saturn, PlayStation, Game Boy Advance','From Evil the Cat’s’Circus of the Scars’ to the planet of Meat, join Jim on a madcap chase across the galaxy. Saving cows, thwarting lawyers and outsmarting Psy-Crow are all in a day’s work for Jim. Are you up to the challenge? Can you handle the awesome new weapons? Excellent! Then stop reading this. Try it now! Trust no one, play it yourself.. or EAT DIRT!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co289m.jpg'),(5383,'DNF Duel: DLC 1 - Spectre','2023-07-12','Fighting','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','\'Spectre\' can be used in DNF Duel.\n\nSpectre is the first character in the DNF Duel: Season Pass and was released alongside a major balance patch and gameplay update that added new systems to the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co722j.jpg'),(5384,'DexSweeper','2025-02-23','Puzzle, Arcade','Playdate','A minesweeper-type game where the cursor never stops moving. Use the Playdate\'s crank to guide your movement, then time your tile reveals carefully. One wrong move could be your last.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5385,'Faraway Qualia','2021-05-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A JRPG that combines a turn-based RPG with a simulation game. Successfully fulfill the conditions assigned to each monster to get many items! Alchemy is the magic that makes everyone happy. This is the story of alchemy and people\'s happiness that takes place in Meltria, the birthplace of alchemy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zko.jpg'),(5386,'Valkyrie Anatomia: The Origin','2016-04-28','Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','Valkyrie Anatomia: The Origin is the forth game in the Valkyrie Profile series and is set as a prequel to the first games story. It is a free-to-play mobile game with micro-transactions.\n\nYou move between points on a mission map that lead to battles, battles are turn-based, using an action meter, and requires you tap the character portraits to activate an attack and swipe the screen at the right time to use a special attacks if available. It takes time to recharge points used to move on the map and heal after battle. There are story cutscenes between missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qkrn4hmfh2vrc24vnl1k.jpg'),(5387,'ACA Neo Geo: Soccer Brawl','2017-11-22','Fighting, Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Soccer Brawl is a soccer game released by SNK in 1992. Sparks fly as teams representing 8 different countries battle for the championship. Staged in the near future, teams feature 7 robot player instead of the normal 11 players, allowing the defense to also go on the attack and for a variety of arrangements.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22kc.jpg'),(5388,'Pokémon Café ReMix','2021-10-28','Puzzle','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','Link together Pokémon icons to clear puzzles as you work to build up your very own café in Pokémon Café ReMix, a free-to-start game for Nintendo Switch systems! Recruit Pokémon to help out at the café (in their stylish uniforms) by building friendships while expanding your café and menu offerings by completing puzzles. Each Pokémon staff member has a Café Skill that will come in handy solving puzzles!\n\nComplete touch-based challenges in this free-to-start puzzle game\n\nStrategize the best way to clear Pokémon icons within the turn limit in adorable-yet-challenging puzzles. Use your puzzle skills to complete the objective and employ the help of every Pokémon’s Café Skills for some extra oomph! In addition to Café Skills, each Pokémon staff member has a specialty and specialty gimmicks they can destroy with ease—Eevee can make quick work of sugar cubes, for example. Match a Pokémon’s specialty with the drink or dish you’re making to get bonuses in puzzles.\n\nRemixed fun for everyone\n\nPokémon Café ReMix is a revamped version of the original Pokémon Café Mix game. Puzzles have been refreshed and there are even more Pokémon to discover and recruit. Your Pokémon may outfit themselves in café chic with newly added dress-up options and can improve their abilities through training puzzles! If you’ve played the original, your golden acorns will all transfer over to Pokémon Café ReMix.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tuc.jpg'),(5389,'Exo-tical','2023-09-21','Indie','ZX Spectrum','Space Adventure for ZX Spectrum','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5390,'Enter the Moon','2018-09-08','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore the moon in breathtaking real-time 3D.\nExplore his geological aspects.\nBattle against spaceships or a secret lunar base.\nEnter the ISS.\nMeasure the moon.\nAnd get in the cockpit.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5391,'Tiny Toon Adventures: Wacky Sports Challenge','1994-09-30','Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Humor! Wackiness! Sports!\nls that what you\'re looking for? if so. this game\'s got it! Plus cool graphics.\n\nSTARRING YOUR FAVORITE TINY TOON ADVENTURES CHARACTERS FROM THE ANIMATED TV SERIES!!\nYou can play as Buster Bunny. Babs Bunny (no relation). Plucky Duck or Dizzy\nDevil! You\'ll also run into your other favorite cast characters.\n\nHIDDEN BONUSES!!! TWELVE DIFFERENT EVENTS!!! MULTIPLE SKILL LEVELS WITH DIFFERENT HAZARDS!!!\nFace it. if you want a laugh riot. sports action. and tons of replay value. then this is the game you\'re looking for! Just check out those screen shots.\n\nBUY THE GAME. PLAY THE GAME. BE THE GAME.\nBesides. where else are you going to find Bungee Jumping, Chicken Race. Ice Cream Toss, Weight Lifting and eight other games in one convenient package?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mfh.jpg'),(5392,'Closer','2021-07-29','Puzzle, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Closer is a creative adventure game. This is a game with distinctive art and gameplay. It contains a lot of creative designs. The game tries to make it interesting without fighting. Players need to think about how to accomplish by \"winning by cleverness\". Each section of the game will have a different experience and gameplay, so that players can experience freshness in every part, and can think about emotional cues of the current mood of the character. Throughout the game, players need to avoid crisis brought by the enemy, and use some knowledge to deal with the challenges of solving puzzles. I hope that through this game, everyone will care for those people whose hearts have been traumatized.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5393,'Mortal Kombat 1: Premium Edition','2023-09-14','Fighting, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The Premium Edition includes the Kombat Pack, early access to the game beginning Sept. 14, and 1,250 Dragon Krystals (in-game currency).\n\nThe Kombat Pack will feature a Johnny Cage character skin with the likeness of famed actor and martial artist, Jean-Claude Van Damme (available at launch), early access to six new playable characters (available post-launch), and five new Kameo Fighters (available post-launch)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6i8x.jpg'),(5394,'Diabolic','2020-03-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The game is set in a dark pixel fantasy world. Destroy hordes of monsters ruling over what once was a prosperous land. 10 levels filled with various enemies await, you, each requiring a different approach to defeat. Like in any RPG, leveling up is the core element of the game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20zl.jpg'),(5395,'Wonderful Doom','2007-03-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wonderful Doom is a 2007 megawad for The Ultimate Doom created by Eugene Guschin (Wraith777), containing 36 levels created in the style of the original levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79ng.jpg'),(5396,'Shichisei Tantei Club: Koganemushi-tachi no Kisou','2022-11-18','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A clickable adventure game reminiscent of detective adventure games of the \'80s and \'90s. The story follows the main character, a young detective, as he meets a series of unique characters and works to solve a case.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6isk.jpg'),(5397,'Dancing Stage Fusion','2004-11-05','Music, Puzzle, Arcade','Arcade, PlayStation, PlayStation 2','Dancing Stage Fusion, abbreviated DS Fusion or simply Fusion, is a music video game released by Konami to the European PlayStation and PlayStation 2 gaming audience on November 5, 2004. In April of the following year, Dancing Stage Fusion was released as an arcade game. Fusion featured new gameplay features such as EyeToy support for the PlayStation 2 release as well as new music from hit pop artists. The arcade version of Fusion was the first arcade machine in Europe since Dancing Stage EuroMix 2 and set a milestone as the first Dance Dance Revolution arcade machine produced by Konami since Dance Dance Revolution Extreme in 2002. The arcade release marked a total game engine upgrade from the old PlayStation-based boards to a new system built on top of an off-the-shelf PlayStation 2. This hardware upgrade would be later featured in the global release of Dance Dance Revolution SuperNova in 2006.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5txq.jpg'),(5398,'Atelier Ryza 2: Lost Legends & The Secret Fairy - Premium Box','2021-01-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4','This edition includes the following PS4 Game: Atelier Ryza 2: Lost Legends & The Secret Fairy, Ryza costume downloadable content: \"Dawn Sonnet\", Tao’s Notebook (visual book), B2 cloth poster featuring special illustration, Clear file x 2, Acrylic mini character charm','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5399,'Alien: Isolation','2014-10-07','Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Alien: Isolation is a survival horror game based on the Alien franchise. As Amanda Ripley, daughter of Ellen Ripley, you will navigate through an increasingly volatile world as you find yourself confronted on all sides by a panicked population and an unpredictable Alien. You must scavenge resources, improvise solutions and use your wits, not just to succeed in your mission but to simply stay alive. In addition to the main story mode there\'s Survivor mode in which the player needs to escape from a specially designed map fulfilling secondary objectives along the way, while being aggressively hunted by the alien. This mode includes online leaderboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vzu.jpg'),(5400,'Seven Days','2022-10-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Seven Days is a single-player first-person exploration game. Play as a camper who has come to Camp Summershade for a peaceful retreat. But things take a turn when you start finding strange things around you at Summershade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sgc.jpg'),(5401,'Green Diver','2022-06-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a hidden object game in which you have to dive to the bottom of the ocean. Explore the psychedelic depths, become a participant in amazing adventures, but don\'t forget to come back up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dup.jpg'),(5402,'Tales of Legendia','2006-02-07','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','Tales of Legendia is a fantasy role-playing game that continues the Tales series of games. You can play as Senel Coolidge, who encounters a giant, mysterious ship while adrift in a small boat with his sister. As you explore the history of the ship, you will encounter epic enemies and engage them using the \"X-LiMBS\" battle system, which lets you fight in real time like in a fighting game. The story is beset with unique characters designed by the animator featured in Kill Bill Vol. One.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p28.jpg'),(5403,'Pac-Man & Galaga Dimensions','2011-07-26','Shooter, Platform','Nintendo 3DS','Includes Pac-Man, Galaga, Pac-Man Championship Edition, Galaga Legions, Pac-Man Tilt and Galaga 3D Impact, the last two of which are exclusive to this compilation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dnv.jpg'),(5404,'Almost a Hero','2017-03-15','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Android, iOS','Almost a Hero is a free-to-play idle/clicker game available on iOS and Android devices. Your objective is to recruit and train heroes to take on endless waves of enemies. Along the way, unlock more hero characters, tap away with new powerful rings, pets with fantastical abilities, and finally permanent artifact upgrades to make your next run just that little bit less deadly.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sfn.jpg'),(5405,'Legion of Scorn','2019-05-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Retro, twin-stick shooter based in sci-fi and cyberpunk roots. Battle through the Legion.exe research arena against the latest in military robotics technology. The only way to earn your freedom is to battle your way through countless waves of enemies and survive the Legion of Scorn.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5406,'Piggy: Chapter 1','2023-04-09','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Piggy kidnapped you!\n\nTherefore, you will have to escape from the house by solving puzzles and using objects to get out of that place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e7v.jpg'),(5407,'Scavengers','2021-05-01','Shooter, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scavengers is your strategic survival battleground. Enter a free-to-play action shooter where squads of three compete to survive and dominate in a hybrid of sandbox-style PVE and class-based PVP. Choose from a roster of adaptive Explorers, arm yourself with a combination of unique abilities and weapons, and conquer the challenges of a hostile wasteland. Outthink and outfight enemy players and the dwellers of the frozen Earth.\n\nScavengers was shut down on December 16, 2022, and is no longer online. The game is no longer available on either the Steam or Epic Games storefronts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yd7.jpg'),(5408,'Princess Maker Collection','2001-07-19','Simulator','Dreamcast','A collection of Princess Maker 2 and 3 for the Sega Dreamcast.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p0t.jpg'),(5409,'Nobunaga\'s Ambition: Awakening','2023-07-20','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The Fief system allows you to capture land and give it to your subordinates to manage. Divvy up and parcel out the beautifully detailed Sengoku Japan as you like, and make it prosper','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sps.jpg'),(5410,'Manacaster',NULL,'Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An old-school tabletop card-battle game for players who like bashing each other with monsters. Precision-balanced gameplay, no collectables or pay-to-win.\n\nChase Victory, Not Cards!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nu5.jpg'),(5411,'Skyward Battles','2024-05-09','Indie','Playdate','An arcade shooting game with air battles. Operate your battle plane using the Playdate\'s crank control.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5412,'Sky Ahoy',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this steampunk RPG, adventure into a world of floating islands, pirates and robots. Craft and dismantle with a unique forging system and watch as the world changes around you based off your choices. Will you be a hero, a pirate or break the system and become a revolutionary?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iji.jpg'),(5413,'Omnn','2026-03-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A tale of hubris in the far-flung future, inspired by that one Sci-Fi novel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9max.jpg'),(5414,'Untravelled Planet','2024-12-23','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Outer space 3D-platformer action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co953q.jpg'),(5415,'Lover Pretend','2021-03-25','Adventure, Visual Novel','Nintendo Switch','Lights, camera, action! A hilarious comedy about the entertainment industry and the colorful characters that populate it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4p90.jpg'),(5416,'Tapestry','1996-10-10','Adventure','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It is a symbol and a tool. It is your past and your future. It is all things, in time. You, Timothy Hunter, have lived, and like all things mortal you have died. But the aftermath of that lifetime is anything but simple...\n\nFaced with creatures beyond your ken, the fruition of whose inscrutable motives hinge on your decisions, what will you do? Will you face who and what you once were? Or will you try to change things for the better? Or the worse?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57h0.jpg'),(5417,'Paper Dungeons Crawler','2018-07-17','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','True turn by turn classic 16 bits Roguelike with a unique specialization system.\nExplore the mysterious Dungeons of Cyndaria and an extensive lore to unearth. A plethora of creatures and magical items are waiting for you to step into ever-changing dungeons, with diverse biomes and challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qtl.jpg'),(5418,'Magical Drop VI','2024-06-14','Puzzle, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The legendary Japanese arcade game is back! Choose your favorite character—will it be World, the Overseer of the Magical Land, the mighty Justice, or the devious Black Pierrot?—and play in one of the numerous game modes available.\n\nSolve diabolical puzzles or beat strong opponents in Arcade match. Follow an adventure in Story or Path of Destiny modes, full of twists and turns.\nChallenge your friends and the best players online!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fe9.jpg'),(5419,'Yume Memory','2023-06-15','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A relaxing Match Two Minigame featuring Anime Characters from the Works of Yume Creations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k5k.jpg'),(5420,'Three Wishes',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Have you ever wondered what the three little sisters of the famous Lilypads get up to in their free time? Find out in this Lilypad Lily spinoff adventure full of headpats, plot twists, and silly hijinks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kuc.jpg'),(5421,'Monster Maker II: Uru no Hiken','1993-03-19','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy','Monster Maker 2: Uru no Hiten is an RPG licensed from the 1988 Card Game. As such, monsters, NPCs and even destinations on the world map are represented with a playing card aesthetic. Gameplay itself is similar to many other RPGs including Dragon Quest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iln.jpg'),(5422,'World Cup Soccer 2026','2025-04-11','Sport','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Get ready to experience the thrill of international soccer like never before in World Cup Soccer 2026! Whether you\'re battling it out in a high-stakes World Cup tournament or just enjoying a casual friendly match, this game brings all the excitement of the beautiful game to your console.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r6b.jpg'),(5423,'Find the Balance','2018-09-20','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Stones, bones and bananas - whatever you can imagine. Place all the stuff to make a steady tower and have fun finding the balance in this exciting physics game. Think over, select and rotate elements, cut the line and drop objects gently.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57nh.jpg'),(5424,'Dual Universe','2022-09-27','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dual Universe is a Continuous Single-Shard sandbox MMORPG taking place in a vast Sci-Fi universe, focusing on emergent gameplay with player-driven in-game economy, politics, trade and warfare. Players can freely modify the voxel-based universe by creating structures, spaceships or giant orbital stations, giving birth to empires and civilizations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5h2f.jpg'),(5425,'Shotgun Symphony','2019-01-07','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shotgun Symphony is an episode replacement PWAD for Doom, released in January 2019 by Steve Duff, requiring a Boom-compatible source port. An E1-E2 style maps heavily inspired by Fava Beans, Shotgun Symphony features seamless progression between levels (with each new map\'s initial area being introduced by the previous map\'s exit location), creating the impression of a lone, giant facility.\n\nShotgun Symphony was one of the recipients of the 2019 Cacowards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4nuo.jpg'),(5426,'Conan Exiles: Treasures of Turan','2019-04-15','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The riches of the eastern kingdom of Turan await! Build opulent palaces adorned with glittering statues, tame rhinos and elephants as pack animals and dress yourself in the dazzling Turanian Phalanx armor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i73.jpg'),(5427,'September 7th','2023-01-06','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you believe in the existence of Christmas elves that appear on New Year\'s Eve and Christmas? If so, then most likely you have heard of the good elves. But imagine that there are still evil elves. They create madness and can come to you at any time if they get bored. They are watching you and testing you. Or maybe they just want to have fun. Will you play by their rules?\n\nDima is a graduate student. His family is planning a move. Finally, this day came on the seventh of September, Dima and his parents move into a new apartment. A few weeks pass and Dima receives a funny Christmas Elf doll as a gift. With her appearance, strange things begin to happen in the house.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zid.jpg'),(5428,'Battleplan: American Civil War','2014-07-04','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to fastplay wargaming, a new kind of strategy game experience. Battleplan: American Civil War is an exciting top-down real time/turn-based hybrid strategy game. Take command of either Confederate or Union troops and fight your way through ten of the American Civil War’s most famous battles.\n\nExperience the excitement and satisfaction of co-ordinating plans, seeing them through, revising them dynamically and achieving victory over an opponent with several strategies to employ against you.\n\nA pure strategy experience, Battleplan: American Civil War’s gameplay focuses solely on battle management – the only thing you have to worry about is where best to send your troops and how best to keep them supplied. The short, demanding battles can be ideal for brief journeys as each can take as little as ten minutes to play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1o7x.jpg'),(5429,'DarkMaus','2016-01-26','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"DarkMaus is an indie action RPG with challenging, skill-based combat that punishes careless play. In DarkMaus, you play a lonely wanderer searching for what’s left in a corrupted world. The odds are against you – you will certainly perish.\n\nDeath Echo: Each time you die, an ally ghost is summoned that retraces your steps, fighting by your side. With time you can collect multiple ally ghosts and choose their weapons for extra strategy opportunities.\n\nA worthy challenge: Combat in DarkMaus is thoughtful and skill based. Enemies force you to be reactive to survive, and punish any greedy moves or mistakes. You’ll start out swearing that it’s impossible, and end up a god among Mäuse.\n\nA dark world to explore: Search for answers and secrets in the desolate land of Hazath, whose inhabitants have gone feral.\n\nCombat style variety: From spears to greatswords and bows to fireballs, DarkMaus has a large number of viable builds and playstyles.\n\nDarkMaus is designed for a controller, and is currently PC only.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ojx.jpg'),(5430,'Expedition','2017-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Entertainment System','Where do you go when you’ve already conquered and exhausted your industry? Expedition is the tabletop sensation that spawned three successful Kickstarter campaigns, global distribution through Target and other channels, and a fanbase of thousands around the globe. While their market is divided into the segments of board games, dice games, role-playing games, and card games, Expedition spans all these categories, drawing fans from each. Mega Cat Studios & the Expedition team took that one step further with the world’s first NES cartridge-guided Dungeon Master.\n\nOur collaboration created an exclusive, highly collectible video game cartridge that expanded the play experience and enabled new forms of brand activations and deeper engagement for Expedition fans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yxn.jpg'),(5431,'Flat 9','2025-03-18','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A psychological horror set in a deserted apartment, where you\'re trapped in a relentless cycle. Armed with a strange device, you must find and report every anomaly to escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9heq.jpg'),(5432,'The Adventures of Emoji 4: Fly High Mouse','2021-10-06','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An action adventure shoot em up side-scroller game. Engage in battle with strange enemies and bosses. Funny hand drawn scenes and game mechanics. Music that captures the mood of each level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yxg.jpg'),(5433,'Spellcasting 1+2+3','2018-04-26','Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cds.jpg'),(5434,'SuperPower 2','2004-10-11','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SuperPower 2 is a real-time strategy wargame developed by Canadian based GolemLabs and published by DreamCatcher Games in 2004, following SuperPower. It was released between October 11 and November 19, 2004 in North America and Europe, respectively.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fj1zhvmuhczz4mm0gwhw.jpg'),(5435,'WWF Raw','1995-12-31','Fighting, Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega 32X, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Sega Game Gear','Raw slams your senses with 24 megs of the most ruthless mat mayhem ever! The hottest superstars, all new superhumans megamoves and more in-and-out-of-the-ring action stand between you and the championship belt. This Raw...and RAW IS WAR!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jae.jpg'),(5436,'Legend: Ashita he no Tsubasa','1991-05-31','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy','Legend: Ashita e no Tsubasa is a Role-Playing game, published by Quest, which was released in Japan in 1991.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ild.jpg'),(5437,'JumpJet Rex','2017-06-28','Platform, Racing, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','JumpJet Rex is a punishing, old school 2-D platformer where players take control of a Tyrannosaurus Rex with extraterrestrial jump boots to save dino-kind from extinction by a giant asteroid.\n\nAs Rex, players will jump, drop and dash through more than 40 challenging levels and race against the clock to not only preserve life during the Mesozoic era, but also prove their platforming prowess against other dino enthusiasts.\n\nPlayers can explore the galaxy and unlock new worlds alone or team up with a friend in co-op mode, where players will need to coordinate movements to get past challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/iwrxctd1urjhuso36kft.jpg'),(5438,'Nolean: The Space Bartender',NULL,'Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as a bartender traveling across the galaxy, serving unique drinks to clandestine clients while evading the watchful eyes of the Shioncala Empire. With your trusty ship, you\'ll navigate space, dodge patrols, hack enemy systems, and craft custom cocktails without leaving a trace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ihn.jpg'),(5439,'Voir Dire','2024-04-15','Point-and-click, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An absurd jury-packing auto-battler created in 48 hours for Ludum Dare 55: \"Summoning\"\n\nThis game takes about 10-15 minutes to complete and has a definitive ending. Hang in there \'til the end!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83g1.jpg'),(5440,'Mato Anomalies: Digital Shadows','2023-08-03','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Digital Shadows is the first expansion for Mato Anomalies giving you the opportunity to dive deeper into the game\'s rich narrative. But this time, from \"\"the other side\"\".\nTake control of Gram\'s android companion SkyEye and team up with Mist to explore the virtual dimension of Mato and free it from the digital threats lurking in the dark web.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x8w.jpg'),(5441,'Cabela\'s Deer Hunt: 2004 Season','2003-08-26','Shooter, Simulator, Sport','Xbox, PlayStation 2','Keep your eyes peeled and your trigger finger ready as you never know when a \"Monster Trophy Buck\" will cross your path. In Cabela\'s Deer Hunt: 2004 Season, you will hunt in nine different deer species using over authentic firearms, gear, and more than 90 unique rack configurations. Get ready to travel to exotic locations via ATV, boat, snowmobile, and truck. With advanced animal AI and true-to-life habits, these deer will have your heart pounding and your palms sweating with intense hunting action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/l907evtsqxfqeqzxnurf.jpg'),(5442,'Chuck Rock II: Son of Chuck','1993-12-31','Platform, Puzzle','Amiga CD32, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Sega Game Gear, Amiga, Sega CD, Sega Master System/Mark III','Chuck Rock II is a side-scrolling action game featuring the son of the protagonist Chuck Rock as he fights off dinosaurs and tries to help save his parents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p6n.jpg'),(5443,'The Fallen Angels','1998-03-01','Fighting','Arcade','Fallen Angels is a two dimensional fighting game that takes a somewhat realistic approach in its gameplay, with super powered moves and with fluid movements animated using real motions (which was also featured in Art of Fighting 3).\n\nProjectile attacks are limited to three characters, atypical for the game\'s genre.\n\nThe game featured eight playable characters: Cool, Harry Ness, Yuiren, Yuiran, Tarō, Torao Onigawara, Ruccio Roche and Haiji Mibu. The boss characters are Trigger and Carlos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i2g.jpg'),(5444,'Sega-Galaga','1985-12-31','Shooter','SG-1000, Sega Master System/Mark III','Sega-Galaga is the SG-1000 port of Galaga, and is strangely the only port to receive a name change.\n\nThe player pilots a starship and must destroy all the on-screen enemies, similar to Space Invaders and Galaxian. However, the enemies in Galaga have the power to steal your ship to use as reinforcements (meaning the player loses a life). However, if you are able to destroy the enemy who has captured your ship, you are able to pilot both ships at once, doubling your firepower at the expense of being a bigger target.\n\nThough Sega-Galaga is essentially the same game as the arcade original, the limitations of the SG-1000 means the graphics and sound are not quite as advanced. Also the \"challenging stages\" have been omitted, meaning each stage is identical to the last.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yhvn3btrfkikf6vkxmka.jpg'),(5445,'The Maw: Brute Force','2009-02-18','Platform, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','In this \"deleted scene\" from The Maw, the Bounty Hunters have sent in members from their new elite strike force, the Brutes, to stop Frank and Maw. The two must use powers from the Beetull and Gastro creatures to avoid capture. This part of the story takes place between the Bulb Valley and Chaindown levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9arg.jpg'),(5446,'LEGO Pirates of the Caribbean: The Video Game','2011-05-10','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','LEGO Pirates of the Caribbean: The Video Game is an action adventure game that brings the Pirates of the Caribbean world and all its colorful characters to life in LEGO Brick form. Players experience all the memorable scenes from all four films in the humorous and quirky LEGO Video Games style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qk0.jpg'),(5447,'Tiger Woods PGA Tour 2004','2003-09-22','Sport','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','While professional golfer Tiger Woods has no equal on the PGA Tour, you now have the chance to build a golfer that\'s even better. Take your custom golfer through the trials and tribulations of all the courses in Tiger Woods PGA Tour 2004, earning cash to spend on new digs and advanced equipment. Use the analog stick to shape any shot type such as the flop or punch. Go head-to-head against the computer, a friend, or an online player with PS2\'s network adapter. With all the top competition on some of the most famous fairways and greens ever, this is the one of the most complete golf experiences yet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97y4.jpg'),(5448,'Toymaker','2017-03-24','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Toymaker is a roleplaying game that takes place in a dark, snow-filled world, where life is harsh and the people living there have become hard and cold. In this land, the darkness has eyes, the winter wind whispers with a piercing voice and the frost hungers for warm flesh.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44u3.jpg'),(5449,'Bouncy Butter Ball','2018-05-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bouncy Butter Ball ! It\'s an ACT game where you can control a ball to break colored boxes, pass through dangerous thorn-blocks, moving gates, flipping traps, keys & locks.. 56 levels and 188 achievements will make you crazy !! Refreshing new record on leaderboard is VERY ADDICTIVE !!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5450,'Digi-Dodgy',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','3D collectathon platformer videogame featuring 200 addictive levels. A digital virus has corrupted the DigiWorld. The Bots that reside within are now under the control of the evil MegaBot. The world’s fate lies on the small shoulders of a bot untouched by the virus named Digi.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kq1.jpg'),(5451,'BattleTech: Heavy Metal',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Heavy Metal unleashes a wide range of ‘Mechs that both longtime fans and new players can enjoy. Pilot seven classic BattleMechs along with one new ‘Mech designed exclusively for this expansion. Experience the mystery of a derelict cargo ship while attempting to take control of its payload in the new flashpoint mini-campaign and crank...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dvo.jpg'),(5452,'Amid Evil','2019-06-20','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Once branded a heretic. Now you have been chosen. Reclaim our sacred weapons. Take back our ancestral lands. If you can stand... Amid Evil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pf7.jpg'),(5453,'Lumines Remastered','2018-06-26','Music, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Lumines Remastered brings minimalism to the puzzle genre where the fusion of light and sound sets the stage for a two-color falling block experience playable on-the-go on Nintendo Switch or at home in 4K on PC and consoles. Groove to electronic jams while strategically dropping blocks before the BPM bar sweeps combos clean after each measure. It’s a stylish game perfect to play anywhere or at anytime.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26qs.jpg'),(5454,'Sovietpunk: Chapter one','2021-04-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sovietpunk is a cyberpunk story set in the setting of the Soviet Union after a global nuclear war. You have to guide the main character through the gloomy tunnels, in which the struggle for life is in full swing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5m6w.jpg'),(5455,'Marvel\'s Spider-Man 2','2023-10-20','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Marvel\'s Spider-Man 2 is an action-adventure game developed by Insomniac Games and published by Sony Interactive Entertainment. Released in October 2023 exclusively for the PlayStation 5, it is a direct sequel to Marvel\'s Spider-Man (2018) and Marvel\'s Spider-Man: Miles Morales (2020). The game continues the story of Peter Parker and Miles Morales as they face new challenges and threats in New York City.\n\nIn Marvel\'s Spider-Man 2, players can switch between Peter and Miles, each with unique abilities and combat styles. The game introduces new villains, including Kraven the Hunter and Venom, while expanding the open-world environment with more detailed and interactive elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79vq.jpg'),(5456,'Angel Island Tour','2021-08-02','Platform, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co692l.jpg'),(5457,'Right Nice Party',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Right Nice Party is a playful, family-friendly and strategic party game with cheerful characters and a colorful world. Take over locations and build up your influence in the refreshingly new Conquest Mode and battle your friends in engaging mini-games between rounds!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mfj.jpg'),(5458,'Touhou Rock Maiden: Houraisan Kaguya no Yabou!?','2015-11-21','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Touhou Doujin game based on Rockman (Megaman), developed by Capricorn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4som.jpg'),(5459,'Arca\'s Path','2018-12-04','Platform, Adventure','Oculus VR, PlayStation VR, Oculus Go, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Oculus Rift','Tricked by a wicked android witch, you must seek a path home and escape the simulated world of Arca. Fully integrated across all major VR platforms, with no need for controllers, Arca’s Path is an easy to pick up atmospheric VR game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28ub.jpg'),(5460,'>//:System.Hack','2017-05-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','>//:System.Hack is a sim-rpg set in a dystopian future. Take the role of a programmer-turned-hacker as they begin their criminal career. While hacking, enter a virtual world, delving the digital dungeons of Systems for wealth and experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uj5.jpg'),(5461,'Dragster','1980-02-01','Racing','Atari 2600','You have in your hand one of the most exciting video games ever designed. One word of caution: this game takes a little time to learn because it\'s so challenging. It\'s very tricky. So, please read these directions and give yourself some practice time. Then you can aim for the World Record.\n\nGame 1: Straight-ahead Dragster, one or two players.\nGame 2: Steerable Dragster, one or two players.\n\nYour Joystick Controller is both the clutch and gear shift for your Dragster; the red button is your gas pedal. Use left Joystick for the top car; right one for bottom car. Hold Joystick with button at the upper left.\n\nTo shift gears, clutch by pushing Joystick to the left and shift by letting the Joystick spring back to the center.\n\nYour car starts each race in neutral (N). There are four gear positions--1, 2, 3, 4--and you must clutch and shift between each gear. You cannot downshift.\n\nWhen the countdown reaches 0, you can start. If you drop into gear too soon, before the end of the countdown, EARLY will appear on the screen and you have to wait for the next race. You can clutch during the countdown, but you cannot drop into 1st until the countdown reaches 0.\n\nThe object of Dragster is to beat your opponent across the screen, or to race against the clock for best time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kth.jpg'),(5462,'Halo 3: Combat Evolved','2022-12-09','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Halo 3: Combat Evolved is a mod for Halo 3: ODST that re-creates the Halo: Combat Evolved Multiplayer and Campaign experiences within Halo 3: ODST.\n\nThe goal of this project is to remake every single Campaign and Multiplayer level from Halo: Combat Evolved.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ujv.jpg'),(5463,'Terminator 2: Judgment Day','1992-11-01','Sin género','Game Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9idc.jpg'),(5464,'Type','2018-04-04','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Type you can play on more than 5 Modes at 3 Difficulties. Playing on Easy is just a warm up, Playing on Medium is just playing a normal game, Playing on Hard is another different story. It will give you some fun, challenge and may improve your skills at typing.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5465,'Hentai Girls: Winky Witch','2024-10-31','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Meet over 50 pretty anime girls in this relaxing puzzle game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co927t.jpg'),(5466,'Capcom Generations 5: Street Fighter Collection 2','1998-12-03','Fighting','Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Capcom Generations: Street Fighter Collection 2 contains the first three versions of the original Street Fighter II. Some minor changes are made to gameplay, compared to the arcade versions of the games. A Collection mode is also featured where the player can view strategies, character profiles and artwork specific to each game, some which become available after meeting certain requirements.\n\nCapcom Generations 5: Street Fighter Collection 2 includes:\n- Street Fighter II: The World Warrior\n- Street Fighter II: Champion Edition\n- Street Fighter II Turbo: Hyper Fighting','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pok.jpg'),(5467,'Evolution Board Game','2020-12-10','Simulator, Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Inspired by the board game with more than 1.6 million players, Evolution sets a new standard for digital tabletop. Adapt, survive, and thrive in a beautiful and ever-changing ecosystem enhanced by incredible art and thoughtful, balanced mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n54.jpg'),(5468,'Goober Dash','2023-11-01','Platform, Racing, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Goober Dash: A 2D platformer battle royale where Goobers Run, Jump & Dash to victory! Customize your Goober, dash to outmaneuver opponents, create your own levels, and compete in global time trials. Unlock exclusive skins and celebrate your wins in this action-packed multiplayer Race Royale!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d23.jpg'),(5469,'Ionization','2025-12-31','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','IONIZATION is a work-in-progress singleplayer 3D first-person shooter action and post-apocalyptic standalone video game, based on a custom Half-Life 1 SDK known as PrimeXT SDK and running on Xash3D FWGS engine. The main idea originated in 2011, being inspired by the Half-Life series, the modification Paranoia and other creations of the BuZZeR level designer.\n\nAn Intro Demo version was released on March 5th, 2024. It is an opening part of the storyline, which takes about 15 minutes to complete. This build performs an introductory function and it does not reflect the final quality of the project.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96sq.jpg'),(5470,'NBA Supercard','2020-12-10','Sport','Android, iOS','NBA SuperCard is the legendary card battle game where rising stars meet basketball’s Superstars. Play the latest card battle game, pitting iconic NBA athletes against modern stars in an all-out battle on the court.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nvi.jpg'),(5471,'Skull and Bones','2024-02-16','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Set sail into the vibrant open world of Skull and Bones, a naval online action RPG where you rise to become the most fearsome pirate kingpin.\n\nCustomize your fleet, craft unique ships, and forge formidable weapons to dominate in exhilarating sea battles against your foes, all while expanding your pirate empire. Join a dynamic and ever-evolving world that brings fresh challenges, features, and stories with each season, immersing you in a continuously unfolding pirate saga.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yl7.jpg'),(5472,'Shin Megami Tensei: Devil Survivor Overclocked','2013-03-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','Nintendo 3DS','Devil Survivor Overclocked is an enhanced port of Devil Survivor made exclusively for the Nintendo 3DS. The port features enhanced art, voice acting for almost every piece of dialogue, new demons and an extended story (8th Day).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26id.jpg'),(5473,'Grimgig Railway',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grimgig Railway is a horror game with train simulation elements where you’ll need to keep calm and face your fears. You’ll drive the train across an old railway in Sakura valley, deep in the Japanese countryside. Drive the train and find soon enough why not everyone can keep this job.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co991b.jpg'),(5474,'One Dreamy Night',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','One Dreamy Night is a traditional RPG game that takes inspiration from Yume Nikki to create a surreal world with oddities at every turn. There\'s things to find to increase your stats and skill set, along with wacky individuals to encounter. You\'ll get to the end as long as you look and explore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mx9.jpg'),(5475,'Valz','2018-11-28','Music, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','iOS','Valz is a story driven rhythm RPG that revolves around music with a beautiful, hand¬-painted motion comic story¬telling. The game boasts RPG elements, such as deep story and party customization, and a unique rhythm-based mechanics in its combat system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jvl.jpg'),(5476,'The Bard\'s Tale','2011-12-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','BlackBerry OS, Xbox, Ouya, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation 2','Completely unlike the classic Bard\'s Tale games, this game is in a 3D environment with the player watching his only controllable character from an overhead vantage point, and it is better described as an action-adventure game than a traditional role-playing video game (i.e. there are no character classes or inventory management). \n \nThe player\'s character, The Bard, has magic and weaponry at his disposal to complete the task. The more the player accomplishes, the better his skills will become. The appearance and gameplay is much the same as the Baldur\'s Gate: Dark Alliance series, which shares the same graphics engine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d92.jpg'),(5477,'Ryse: Legendary Edition','2014-10-07','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox One','Amidst the chaos of the late Roman Empire, become soldier Marius Titus and embark on a perilous campaign to avenge the death of your family and defend the honor of Rome. In Gladiator Mode, step into the Colosseum and fight for the glory, spectacle, and entertainment of the crowds. Legendary Edition includes full Season Pass contents, three bonus maps optimized for maximum challenge in Solo mode and a new Legionary Skin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kly.jpg'),(5478,'Birdie Shot','2022-10-05','Sport','Android','Birdie Shot is a casual golf game where you can create your own golf team and compete with other players on golf courses around the world. Build a team of 8 characters and compete against other players in casual PVP golf matches. Upgrade your characters, equip them skills and items to gain the upper hand and make profit. You can earn the in–game currency \'Gold\' by winning against other golfers in multiplayer matches, which you can exchange for BIRDIE Tokens and BORA crypto tokens. Meet and play fiercely with masters from all over the world. Collect rewards and make money!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5q54.jpg'),(5479,'Heart. Papers. Border.','2017-08-20','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Heart. Papers. Border. is an optimistic strategy game about travelling, freedom and changing the world!\n\nYou are a freelance adventurer who wants to experience everything planet Heart has to offer, regardless of the inherited privileges determined by the country of your birth.\n\nCONCEPT\nYou travel to learn, and as you pay a closer attention to what each country has to offer, you gather wisdom that you channel in a blog that grows in popularity. Eventually you come to grasp the power of your influence: where you pass, things change faster to the better, and locals that you have met increasingly demand openness from their governments. You have always been an optimist and dreamed of a completely border free world, but as you travel, you realise you might actually actually live to see your dream come true - that of living in a world without borders!\n\nVISUALS\nHeart. Papers. Border. is inspired by NASA\'s Visions of the Future posters, The Jetsons\' cartoon series and current real life events. We chose vibrant colours and a retro futuristic style to gently remind you that Heart, just like Earth, is moving towards openness, kindness and love, even though the movement might sometimes seem too slow to notice. But you can always make a difference!\n\nGAMEPLAY\nHeart. Papers. Border. is as easy or as challenging as you want it to be. Through very simple control mechanics and up front information, you can strategize an optimal life that allows you to see the last border disappear in the course of your long and safe life. With multiple win conditions, challenging puzzles and morally difficult quests, Heart. Papers. Border. simply asks you how do you choose to live this virtual life\n\nSo how will you play?\n- Create your Multipass and choose your Citizenship (Easy, Med, High, Random); this determines your starting conditions\n- Take a look at your native country, look at the Top Bar to see your situation and starting conditions\n- Click on touristic objectives to visit them, click on countries to apply for Visas and then visit them\n- Gather hashtags from visiting objectives and write blog posts in your SpacePad\n- Gain followers, become influential, and notice how planet Heart responds to your actions\n\nA few Development Details\nThis is a Pre Alpha game, and we have many features in the pipeline which are Work in Progress now. If you wish to keep track of our progress, we shared our live game design wiki so check our presence on the web. Please keep in mind:\n- We aim to launch the first version of Heart. Papers. Border. somewhere this summer\n- This is an evolving game, we aim to progressively update it until we or our community is out of ideas (which we hope is for years to come)\n- We practice Open Game Design and welcome any feedback','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24x8.jpg'),(5480,'Thunder Tier One','2021-12-07','Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Thunder Tier One is a top-down tactical shooter that let\'s you play as tier one operator across various scenarios located all around the globe. Set in late 80s/early 90s it allows you to combine your leadership and tactical skills and contemporary equipment into an efficient war machine. Create your own customized Tier One avatar and jump into action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mg6.jpg'),(5481,'Super Anime Waifu BBQ Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Grill Guy needs Waifu\'s help! Tour the Glazed Fields looking for Grill Guy\'s lost BBQ sauce! Explore various mouth watering sections of the Glazed Fields, a mysterious place that somehow has floating hot dogs and ground beef mountains, is this even edible?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56tl.jpg'),(5482,'Gatecrasher','2017-05-31','Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS, Playdate','Gatecrasher is a game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qgu.jpg'),(5483,'Elkrone no Atelier: Dear for Otomate Limited Edition','2012-04-12','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Otomate-developed visual novel for the PlayStation Portable based on the turn-based RPG Atelier series by Gust. The limited edition of Elkrone no Atelier: Dear for Otomate comes with an audio drama CD and an exclusive artbook.\n\nMeriela (a.k.a Meri) has inherited her grandmother\'s workshop, and now it\'s up to her to decide what to do with it. One day, a fairy called Popotto pops up at the front door, asking her to create a mysterious item—the Blue Wakaka.\n\nNeither the client nor the alchemist have ever seen it, but since the fairy is in no great hurry, he decides to lodge with Meri to help her out with item synthesis, ingredient collection, monster fights and finding her soul mate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mm8.jpg'),(5484,'Data mining 5','2019-01-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Data mining 5 - casual colorful minimalist puzzle in which you have to collect all the files that are not corrupted to exit the closed circle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o6c.jpg'),(5485,'Scooby-Doo! & Looney Tunes Cartoon Universe: Arcade','2014-08-07','Arcade','iOS','Create and customize your own cartoon character, then step into the AMAZING 3-D Scooby Doo & Looney Tunes Cartoon Universe: Arcade!\n\nHang out in the arcade with Scooby, Bugs, Daffy and ALL your favorite cartoon friends. Play ten fun mini-games – all included with the purchase of the game – based on the iconic Looney Tunes and Scooby Doo cartoon worlds. Each arcade game comes with multiple levels and increasingly difficult challenges!\n\nEarn coins while you play to unlock other games in the arcade! You can also customize your own 3-D cartoon character with special clothes, hats, and styles!\n\nScooby Doo & Looney Tunes Cartoon Universe: Arcade contains hours of fun for kids AND adults! With multiple user profiles, share the game with the entire family – and no one will lose their progress OR their score! Everyone in the family will enjoy creating a cartoon character in their own unique style!\n\nChallenge yourself to unlock tons of achievements as you play through multiple levels on each of the TEN included arcade games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6flb.jpg'),(5486,'The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild Randomizer','2021-11-20','Adventure','Wii U, Nintendo Switch','This Randomizer will randomize items you will find in chests and be given by NPCs. Randomized enemy drops are included too. Additionally, warping via both the Sheikah Slate as well as going inside and outside of shrines has the chance of getting randomized too.\n\nIt was taken down from GameBanana by request from Nintendo of America.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68ke.jpg'),(5487,'999','2018-06-29','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','999 Lives, 999 Stars, 999 Levels - Get ready for a challenge! \n \n999 is a puzzle platformer style game in which you must fling your character to the exit through 999 very difficult levels that will push your platforming skills to their limit. \n \nThrow and fling your character around gruelingly addictive, funky, psychedelic, colourful and thrillingly rage-enduing levels and get as far as you can - you may think that 999 lives is generous, but prepare to be surprised and, most of all, prepare for a challenge! \n \nThis is a PC game available via Steam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pck.jpg'),(5488,'Golden Tee 2020','2019-09-24','Sport','Arcade','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sea.jpg'),(5489,'Horse Racing 3D 2015',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5490,'Hokuto no Ken: Hokuto Shinken Denshousha no Michi','2008-02-14','Adventure','Nintendo DS','Hokuto no Ken: Hokuto Shinken Denshousha no Michi is an Action game, developed and published by Spike, which was released in Japan in 2008.\n\nAdvertised as a \"vital point striking\" action game, the player takes control of Kenshiro and must use the DS\'s touch screen to strike the vital points of adversaries to defeat them. The game\'s graphics consists entirely of colorized panel art from the original manga. The story mode consists of 22 chapters and adapts the manga\'s storyline from the beginning and up to the conclusion of Raoh saga. Other game modes includes a Battleship-style Versus Mode between two players, a Quiz mini-game, and a database of characters and famous lines from the manga. Akira Kamiya and Kenji Utsumi both return to provide their voices as Kenshiro and Raoh, with Shigeru Chiba as the narrator as well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3uoq.jpg'),(5491,'Putter Golf','1990-11-03','Sport','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Putter Golf is a golf game developed and published by Sega for the Sega Mega Drive. It was only available in Japan as a download through the Sega Game Toshokan service.\n\nPutter Golf is essentially (but whether or not it officially is is unknown) a Mega Drive version of Putt & Putter: a very simple golf game with an isometric perspective. Rather than compete on wide open courts however, the game opts for much smaller levels which would only require a putter (much like minigolf). As well as this, there are a number of obstacles which can get in your way, from bumpers to lava.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jxj.jpg'),(5492,'Xenoblade Chronicles X','2015-12-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Wii U','Xenoblade Chronicles X is an action role-playing video game and a part of the Xeno series of video games, serving as a spiritual successor to Xenoblade Chronicles on the Wii. In a similar fashion to the original, the game plays as an open world role-playing video game, with an emphasis on exploration. Traveling can take place on foot, or in large humanoid robots, approximately four times the height of the average playable character, called \"Skells\" (\"Dolls\" in the Japanese version), that the player may opt to control. The Skells have the ability to fly, traverse water, and transform into vehicles such as motorcycles or tanks. Aerial battles will also take place in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nwh.jpg'),(5493,'Evil Democracy: 1932','2020-06-06','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the unique world of this political simulator, you travel to Europe, 1933-1935, to become the party leader in one of the following countries: Germany, France, or England. You have a real chance to become the winner of WWII even before it begins...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2c47.jpg'),(5494,'Dusk Child','2017-10-28','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dusk Child is an adventure-platformer about a young archaeologist looking for her home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2908.jpg'),(5495,'Flatworld','2022-04-28','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a world full of magic, puzzles and enemies in which the main character is the weakest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oxs.jpg'),(5496,'The Archivist: VR','2018-04-17','Indie','Oculus VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','The Archivist: VR takes you into the unpredictable dreamscape of Twin Peaks. Leaving the borders of reality behind, you will enter the meticulously recreated world in virtual reality and experience an unprecedented level of immersion as you re-live some of the show’s most iconic moments. With an original story line, set against the supernatural mythos of television\'s most mysterious town, \'The Archivist: VR\' will bring you closer to the show than ever before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23tl.jpg'),(5497,'Knight Without Sword','2023-10-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A strategy and tactics game, you will play the role of an apprentice knight, use your wisdom to kill enemies without using any attack means, get gold coins, and reach the end point, in addition, don\'t forget to bring your chicken, it is your important partner !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zsl.jpg'),(5498,'Jack Vs Ninjas',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5499,'Mochi A Girl','2019-12-12','Platform, Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Easy controls! Exhilarating and springy wire action!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dqu.jpg'),(5500,'Undead Shadow Army',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Undead Shadow Army is a challenging 2.5D zombie shooter ! Are you ready to fight against the army of undead shadows ?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pqn.jpg'),(5501,'Mass Effect 2: Kasumi - Stolen Memory','2011-01-18','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','\"Stolen Memory\" introduces two new missions where the player assumes the role of Commander Shepard, an elite human soldier who must recruit a new squad member named Kasumi Goto and help her steal a graybox that contains important information and memories of her partner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vhl.jpg'),(5502,'An Evil Existence','2021-05-07','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Within the first 5 minutes of game play you will be trapped into a interactive nightmare, a horrific exploration of pure and realistic survival horror.\n\nThe only way to survive and stay alive is to defend yourself from each member of the family who engage in combat through out the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ket.jpg'),(5503,'Kirakira Stars Idol Project Ai','2020-02-17','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','\"I\'ll be an idol singer!\" The story of the beginning to the top idol singer starting from the accidental reunion of the new face manager \" Nobuyuki Kinoshita \" and childhood friend \" Ai Amane\" of the talent agency.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ltf.jpg'),(5504,'Drawful 2','2018-06-21','Strategy, Quiz/Trivia, Indie, Card & Board Game','Amazon Fire TV, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The team behind the hit party games Fibbage, Quiplash, and YOU DON’T KNOW JACK presents Drawful 2, the game of terrible drawings and hilariously wrong answers!\n\nYou use your phone or tablet to draw weird and funny things like “pitcher of nachos” or “death by trombone.” The other players type in what they think the (probably terrible) drawing is and those become the multiple-choice wrong answers. Then everyone - even an audience of potentially thousands – tries to guess the REAL answer.\n\nDrawful 2 is a go-to party game that everyone can play and enjoy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qa7.jpg'),(5505,'Dream Team','2021-03-29','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Do you ever hear different voices in your head when you\'re half-asleep?\n\nHelp Triangle, Circle and Square navigate through your dreams. Where will they go? What will they become? Will it be a pleasant dream or a dreadful one?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s65.jpg'),(5506,'European Air War','2021-12-31','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','European Air War is a combat flight simulator game set in World War II with the player participating in the Battle of Britain and the rest of the European Theater.\n\nof Britain and the rest of the European Theater.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gvq.jpg'),(5507,'Tsukumono','2019-01-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aim for a 999 chain! A brand new experience combining tower defence and matching tile puzzle games into a game you can easily play in 1-5 minute bursts! Let\'s try it for how many times you can chain. Online battles are supported in game so test your might against players from around the country!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5508,'The Lost Vikings','1993-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy','Amiga CD32, Amiga','The Amiga and Amiga CD 32 port has a tiny bit different music, lacks second player to control other vikings, black backgrounds, and has wider screen compared to the Super Nintendo original.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54v2.jpg'),(5509,'For Honor: Season 20 - Frozen Shores','2021-12-09','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The rise of the waters during the Tempest and the subsequent winter allowed seafaring pirates passage to the frozen shores of Heathmoor. These pirates had no allegiance to any faction – they only cared about treasure. In their pursuit of wealth, they began trading with the people, offering warriors access to new weapons from across the sea.\n\nTake your character through a journey of 100 Tiers of rewards for all heroes! Available during For Honor: Frozen Shores only.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oru.jpg'),(5510,'Ranfren: Not Lucid',NULL,'Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fan-made visual novel for the webcomic RANFREN produced by captainhowdie','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mmm.jpg'),(5511,'Drakula','2021-02-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DRAKULA is an action-platformer with puzzle elements where you play as Van Helsing. Use your wooden stakes to climb obstacles and kill enemies on your war.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hk0.jpg'),(5512,'Inspector Waffles: Purrluxe Edition',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5513,'WTC: Love\'s Labour\'s Lost','2023-10-12','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Violet Hotel\'s waitress and local tour guide are determined to foil the protagonist\'s plans to take Grendel back to America. Unfortunately, neither native is prepared for the cost of doing so','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58es.jpg'),(5514,'The Mythical City 4','2024-07-07','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hordes of monsters are moving towards your cities to stop them, build walls, place magic books that will attack the enemy, hire soldiers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99hc.jpg'),(5515,'Tsunagari Chess School','2024-10-10','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A psychological horror game taking place in a Japanese chess school. Get to know the girls, go on dates, and prepare for the worst.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yy2.jpg'),(5516,'Nagagutsu wo Haita Neko: Sekai Isshuu 80-nichi Daibouken','1986-12-21','Platform','Family Computer','Nagagutsu wo Haita Neko: Sekai Isshuu 80-nichi Daibouken is a 1986 video game based on the third film of The Wonderful World of Puss \'n Boots that was released exclusively in Japan for the Family Computer. Four years later, the game (with several modifications) was released in North America under the title Puss \'n Boots: Pero\'s Great Adventure.\n\nThe main character is the Puss in Boots character from the tale; a cat named Pero (Toei Animation\'s mascot) He is also known as \'Perrault\' in the game, as that was the name of the original author of the Puss In Boots story; Charles Perrault. He is known for helping an impoverished master attain wealth through the use of trickery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co749l.jpg'),(5517,'Dynasty Warriors 5: Empires','2006-03-28','Tactical, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Dynasty Warriors 5 Empires (真･三國無双4 Empires) is the second expansion for Dynasty Warriors 5. Like the previous Empires expansion, the game focuses on the player\'s ability to simulate a leader taking and controlling territory, eventually becoming a powerful leader controlling China. They can form helpful alliances with other factions, recruit powerful officers to their side, use tactics to gain the upper hand against foes, etc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fc0.jpg'),(5518,'Friday Night Funkin\': vs. Zardy','2021-03-21','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You find yourself lost in a cornfield maze, and what do you find. It\'s Zardy! Though he\'s not here to scare you in the traditional way you would think.\n\nCan you fight him off? Or will he reign victorious?\n\nThis mod is based on Zardy\'s Maze a game by SwankyBox.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9b4b.jpg'),(5519,'Forza Horizon 5: Deluxe Edition','2021-11-09','Racing, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Your Ultimate Horizon Adventure awaits! Explore the vibrant and ever-evolving open world landscapes of Mexico with limitless, fun driving action in hundreds of the world’s greatest cars. The Deluxe Edition includes the full game and Car Pass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45k6.jpg'),(5520,'SankakkuDoku','2024-10-31','Puzzle, Strategy, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','S.O.S! Astronaut Aki-chan needs your help urgently....','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yxk.jpg'),(5521,'Lily & Sury: Adventures On Cristya','2025-02-25','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Classic retro-style platform game. Help Lily or Sury save your friends from the evil Wuning through 8 worlds and 32 levels.\n\nIn this game you will find 32 challenging levels, find secret treasures, jump, crush your enemies and go through multiple obstacles, stairs, cliffs, spikes, various enemies and most importantly, save your companions from the hands of Wuning to prevent them from destroying the planet Cristya.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gbi.jpg'),(5522,'Two Love','2020-01-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Text adventure An English noble could no longer tolerate the torture of disease.Just when he decided to end his life,he met a traveler with black hair and red pupil...An English vampire is still looking for what she wants.On Canvey Island,she sees a glimmer of possibility...A talented woman chasing her enemies,a message came...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m2o.jpg'),(5523,'Battlegun','2017-08-09','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Battlegun is a fun and online cartoon fps game. Create a room and kill the rival team. See more fun on multiple maps. Play now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29wl.jpg'),(5524,'Arcade Archives: Dragon Spirit','2022-03-03','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Dragon Spirit is a shooting game released by Namco in 1987. Control Amul, a hero who\'s been transformed into the Blue Dragon, and save Princess Alicia of Midgard who was taken by the dark lord Zawell. Battle enemies on the ground and in the air, and use power-up items to progress through the areas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4moo.jpg'),(5525,'Retail Mage','2024-11-12','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome, Retail Mage, to your first day of employment at MageMart! Get 5 star reviews from customers before the store closes. Say and do (almost) anything in this open-ended, creative co-op game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y1f.jpg'),(5526,'Homefront: The Revolution','2016-05-20','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Homefront: The Revolution is an open-world first person shooter where you must lead the Resistance movement in guerrilla warfare against a superior military force.A living, breathing, open world responds to your actions - you and your Resistance Cell can inspire a rebellion on the streets and turn Occupation into Revolution, as oppressed civilians take up the fight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ksh.jpg'),(5527,'Challenger','1985-10-15','Platform, Adventure','Wii, Family Computer, Wii U, Legacy Mobile Device','Play as Challenger, a brave archeologist whose mission is to rescue a princess who\'s been kidnapped by a secret evil organization. The game offers four different types of adventures in four different ways to play, starting with a runaway train battle, exploring a vast island, and facing off against a boss.\n\nOriginally planned as a port of the ZX Spectrum video game Stop the Express, which was released by Sinclair Research Ltd in 1983. Stop the Express only contained the first train level, and 3 levels were added for the release of Challenger.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gba.jpg'),(5528,'Echoes of War: The Last Heartbeat','2018-08-01','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Echoes of War is an action packed shooter with stratigic elements for virtual reality devices. Set up your defences, lay waste to hundreds of drones and mechs and use all you can salvage to repair your ship.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5529,'Galactic Protection Squad: Episode 1','2020-04-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Learn fraction concepts in a short sci-fi escape-room educational game. Explore a huge realistic highly-detailed space station, solve puzzles using Star-Trek-like holographic terminals, and relax once a while to enjoy nice Earth views, which are getting nicer as you advance through the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a5b.jpg'),(5530,'One Piece: Maboroshi no Grand Line Boukenki!','2002-06-28','Sin género','Game Boy Color','The game follows the anime storyline from the beginning of the Loguetown Arc to the end of the Whiskey Peak Arc, including the Warship Island Arc. Along their way, the Straw Hat Pirates fight enemies like Smoker, Nelson Royale and others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53sb.jpg'),(5531,'Backyard Soccer','2001-09-28','Sport','PlayStation','Backyard Soccer is the first game in the Backyard Sports Soccer Series. Gameplay is simple. There are 30 kids to pick on a team, and many custom color teams to create. You also get to be in two game types: Single in which you play one small game and Season play, in which you play for a whole a lot of time and features you playing against some unusable custom teams.. This game also includes a practice mode to help you get used to the kicking in the game, and also shows what it is like during a penalty. All rules to soccer including fouls and hat tricks, are included in the game. When picking the kids on your team you will want to read about how good they are - don\'t just pick a kid cause they look cool.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cyuyqchlvjpce5iulorn.jpg'),(5532,'Monster Blast Infinity','2025-02-14','Shooter','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Shoot waves of monsters','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dpr.jpg'),(5533,'Casual Crusade','2023-09-09','Puzzle','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kiw.jpg'),(5534,'Trainz: A New Era - Route: Bea-Dawe Model Railway','2017-06-21','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This British Diesel-era layout includes several stations, goods yards and engine facilities and was inspired by memories of growing up in the Midlands spending many hours standing on the side of the Lickey Bank with Granddad watching the trains go past.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5535,'Hyperspace','2024-06-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a hardcore 3D detective/puzzle game. You will play as SU, a person from the future, who travels through wormholes across multiple timelines to solve puzzles, gather clues, and use deductive reasoning with the collected clues to uncover the truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8f5s.jpg'),(5536,'Samurai Warriors 4: Special Anime Pack','2014-10-21','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4','Samurai Warriors 4 is a hack and slash game, and sequel to Samurai Warriors 3. The game was made to celebrate the tenth anniversary of the series. The game features a character-switching feature, similar to the spin-off, Samurai Warriors: Chronicles, with which players can take two characters into battles simultaneously, and freely switch between the two. Two new moves, \"Hyper Attacks\" and \"Rage Mode\" are featured in this game: Hyper Attacks is a secondary moveset available to all characters that allows the player to sweep through and clear out crowd of enemies with a dashing animation, although it is useless against enemy officers, as they will either deflect it or are otherwise immune against it. Rage Mode renders the player invincible for a period of time, and also enhances the player\'s attacks as well as empowering their Musou attack by using the Spirit Gauge.\n\nExclusive Content:\nSpecial Anime Pack 10th anniversary Collector\'s Edition packaging\nSAMURAI WARRIORS: Legend of the Sanada anime (Blu-ray Disc)\nSAMURAI WARRIORS 4 (PS4 game)\nSAMURAI WARRIORS 4 Official Soundtrack (CD)\nSpecial Costume Pack 4: Garcia, Ina, Nene and Oichi (DLC)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r7g.jpg'),(5537,'Where the Water Tastes Like Wine','2018-02-28','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Where the Water Tastes Like Wine is a Narrative-Adventure game about traveling, sharing stories, and surviving manifest destiny. Featuring gorgeous hand-drawn illustrations, Where the Water Tastes Like Wine combines 2D visuals with a 3D overworld US map.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wf0.jpg'),(5538,'Heavy Weapon','2005-02-24','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Heavy Weapon is a cartoonish side-scrolling action game where you control a single tank fighting waves of opponents. Driving to the right over flat terrain at a constant speed, the tank can move left or right while the sky is filled with aircraft such as jets, helicopters, zeppelins, bombers, and missiles. Projectiles need to be avoided or taken out. Some friendly planes will pass and drop power-ups to improve speed, gun power or shield, or provide nukes, rockets, a laser, rapid-fire, or spread fire. During each level, enemies will drop parts of a mega laser weapon. If the four parts are found, an extremely powerful laser beam is added to your arsenal for a short time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5thl.jpg'),(5539,'Dawn Patrol','1988-12-31','Sin género','MSX','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5540,'Infinite Blue','2024-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Discover an immersive ocean Eco-Sim where you can be almost any animal under the sea! From a tiny seahorse to a massive blue whale, experience the endless circle of life in a massive world of reefs, shipwrecks, and hidden wonders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lqe.jpg'),(5541,'Euro Truck Simulator 2: Schwarzmüller Trailer Pack','2016-09-16','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','We are proud to introduce five highly detailed trailer models officially licensed from The Schwarzmüller Group to Euro Truck Simulator 2. The Schwarzmüller Group develops, builds and services commercial vehicles that are ideal for highly competitive and demanding businesses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8io3.jpg'),(5542,'Sunday x Magazine: Nettou! Dream Nine','2009-02-26','Sport','Nintendo DS','Sunday X Magazine: Nettou! Dream Nine is a Baseball simulator developed by Pawapuro Productions and published in 2009 by Konami for the Nintendo DS. It is a spinoff of the Power Pro-kun Pocket series made to celebrate the 50th anniversary of the Weekly Shōnen Sunday and Weekly Shōnen Magazine manga magazines. Titles include H2, Touch, Strongest! Aoizaka Metropolitan High School Baseball Club\", Diamond of Ace, and Cross Game. It also contains characters from other non-baseball themed manga, such as Ghost Sweeper Mikami, Ranma ½, Detective Conan, Hayate the Combat Butler, and Hajime no Ippo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jhf.jpg'),(5543,'One Piece: Pirate Warriors 2','2013-08-30','Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita','One Piece: Pirate Warriors 2 is the breathtaking sequel of One Piece: Pirate Warriors, a big action/adventure game in which you will take down hordes of Pirates in the beloved world of One Piece. Immerse yourself by playing the “New World”, with your favorite’s characters and their latest techniques and costumes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qwk.jpg'),(5544,'Wild Ones Battle Stadium','2024-12-25','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Wild Ones Battle Stadium is a 2D turn-based game where players control animals in battles, earning points, coins, and experience. Customize the game with equipment and pets, join clans, and compete in modes like Battle Royale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9md2.jpg'),(5545,'Q.U.B.E. 10th Anniversary','2022-09-14','Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Entirely rebuilt from the ground up, Q.U.B.E. 10th Anniversary is the ultimate celebration of the decade-old original, bringing refined visuals, completely redesigned and revised gameplay sections, and a whole new chapter to the award-winning, brain-twisting first-person puzzler.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ygb.jpg'),(5546,'Player Killers\' Exchange','2018-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Web browser','The Player Killers\' Exchange is a hack and slash style rogue-like-like RPG. Kill NPCs to loot equipment. Kill players for fun and profit. \n \nMany of you have been griefing the Internet for years now. But why do it for free? Put your PK skills to the test and earn nanocurrency for your efforts. \n \nNano is freely exchangeable on Binance, Kucoin and other major exchanges. It is not a token issued by the developer. \n \nThe Player Killers\' Exchange is a browser based IO game. No install or special plug-ins are necessary. No deposit is required to play the game or earn crypto rewards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23p6.jpg'),(5547,'Fargone','2022-12-23','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fargone is an RPG-based survival game with a strong focus on creating a living, breathing world through dynamic events, and NPC interactions. Set in a fictional land known only as The Barrens, you must survive by any means, whether that be alone or by allying yourself with a faction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x4s.jpg'),(5548,'One Piece: Unlimited Cruise 1 - The Treasure Beneath the Waves','2009-06-19','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Wii','One Piece: Unlimited Cruise is an third-person action adventure game with an original story separate from the manga/anime. It consists of two episodes and is a sequel to One Piece: Unlimited Adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mcd.jpg'),(5549,'World Soccer: Winning Eleven 9','2006-02-07','Simulator, Sport','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Pro Evolution Soccer 5 (abbreviated PES 5), known as World Soccer: Winning Eleven 9 in Japan and North America (sometimes mislabeled as World Soccer Winning Eleven 9 International), is a 2005 football sports simulation video game developed and produced by Konami as part of the Pro Evolution Soccer series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cm0.jpg'),(5550,'Home Again',NULL,'Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Home Again is an interactive story game about Jason, a man stuck in an endless loop of work who adopts a stray cat. Discover Jason\'s journey through the eyes of his little cat friend as they meet Melissa, a caring florist who will change the way Jason sees the life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gb8.jpg'),(5551,'Hayato\'s Journey','2024-07-27','Platform, Arcade','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hayato\'s Journey is a SEGA Mega Drive / Genesis homebrew game that works like an unofficial spiritual sucessor of Kenseiden, a cult-classic SEGA Master System game.\n\nHayato\'s Journey is the first full SEGA Mega Drive / Genesis game powered by the Scorpion Engine by earok.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lnw.jpg'),(5552,'Airport CEO',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Airport CEO is a tycoon and management game where you take seat as the CEO of your own airport. You will build the airport’s infrastructure with everything from runways to restaurants and check-in. Manage resources by hiring employees, signing contracts and making sure that the budget holds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fskvagcnhvpxhnhngwgs.jpg'),(5553,'Star Defense',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5554,'Diavolo no Daibouken','2007-03-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Diavolo no Daibouken is a free Japanese fangame based off the manga JoJo\'s Bizarre Adventure. It is a simplistic graphical roguelike that stars Diavolo, the main villain of part 5 of the manga.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e1q.jpg'),(5555,'Soul device','2023-12-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Soul Device is a 2D platformer shooter with features of the roguelike genre. On your way you will encounter various items that will strengthen you, equipment that will give you new abilities, and several weapons that will be responsible for your attacks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7f8h.jpg'),(5556,'Gamecraft','2019-05-10','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gamecraft is a game maker, where you can build your own physics games from blocks and components without the need to write code. You can also play many games that have been created and shared by others in the community.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wln.jpg'),(5557,'Hail to the Chimp','2008-10-17','Strategy','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Since the dawn of time, Man has wondered who would win if a polar bear and jellyfish teamed up to fight an armadillo and yak. Do you have what it takes to learn the shocking truth? When the King of the Animals is forced to resign in disgrace, a motley group of candidates turns out for a bare-knuckle campaign to win the Crown. From Ptolemy, the mighty hippo, to Crackers, the devious monkey, each of the ten candidates has distinct strengths and strategies, but the same hunger for political power. Hail to the Chimp is a party game that delivers exciting gameplay, lush interactive environments, and a comic look at politics. Players use the game’s unique team-up mechanic, mixing cooperation with competition, to claw their way to victory. Whether played by four friends on one TV, online against distant challengers or single-player against advanced AI, Hail to the Chimp offers endlessly replayable party fun for gamers of all stripes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rgqpjb311lglkevlq7io.jpg'),(5558,'Humanity Is Dead','2018-11-25','Shooter, Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A third-person action shooter where you are facing a war between humans and robots.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yxd.jpg'),(5559,'Space Hulk: Deathwing - Enhanced Edition',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Space Hulk: Deathwing &ndash Enhanced Edition - Deluxe, includes the base game and the Official Soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82bm.jpg'),(5560,'Whispers of a Machine: Blue Edition',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cdb.jpg'),(5561,'Mild Dream','2018-06-28','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mild Dream is an English Yume Nikki fangame made for Dream Diary Jam 2. One differing feature is that there are two different types of effects: Normal and Lucid. In order to use Lucid effects, the player must enter a state of lucidity by interacting with one of the various bees found within the dream world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rfk.jpg'),(5562,'Cooking Craze','2017-06-26','Simulator, Strategy, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Join the Cooking Craze! Prep, cook, and serve tasty food to earn achievements while you expand your culinary skills and grow a restaurant empire across the globe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dkq.jpg'),(5563,'Firework Thrower Kantaro\'s 53 Stations of the Tokaido','1986-09-03','Platform','Wii, Family Computer, Wii U','Although commonly referred to as Toukaidou Gojuusan-tsugi, the full name of the game is Kanshakudama Nage Kantarou no Toukaidou Gojuusan-tsugi, which can be roughly translated as \"explosive throwing Kantarou and the 53 stations of the Toukaidou\". To further explain the main character\'s name is Kantarou, and he throws bombs at his enemies. He is attempting to travel from Kyoto back to Edo (known today as Tokyo) to see his girlfriend Momoko. To get there, he is traveling through the Toukaidou highway which is composed of 53 checkpoints along the way. However, an unscrupulous merchant is attempting to capture Kantarou and steal his explosive technique secrets.\n\nToukaidou Gojuusan-tsugi is a horizontally scrolling action game developed by Sunsoft in 1986. It was never released outside of Japan. On June 29, 2001, the game was released for the Windows platform as part of Sunsoft Classic Games 2 along with Ikki (which was itself rereleased as a budget title in 2004). On December 27, 2001, the game was released on the PlayStation as part of Memorial Series: Sunsoft Vol. 3 along with The Wing of Madoola.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nyt.jpg'),(5564,'Spelp','2023-01-31','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Spelp program needs you to annihilate thousands of aliens with a variety of weapons, members and unique capacities. Unlock characters and make up your own team to fit your playstyle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6323.jpg'),(5565,'Wild',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Wild is a survival game inspired by the \"7vsWild\" series. The goal is to survive, fight against dangerous animals, and build your shelter. For that, you are only allowed to take one bottle as equipment, so prepare it well in advance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co989g.jpg'),(5566,'Vartra Abyss','2024-11-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vartra Abyss is an isometric ARPG that has the player exploring a dystopian underground cavern in search of their lost friend. You must learn to fight using your new abilities that you will attain by slaying enemies. Play your way and mix up your abilities to suit your playstyle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92xb.jpg'),(5567,'Rocket Racing','2023-12-08','Racing','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','From the developers of Rocket League comes Rocket Racing, a supersonic arcade racer that lets you drift, fly, and boost with your friends through an ever-growing selection of tracks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hhc.jpg'),(5568,'Bridge Constructor Trains',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dtu.jpg'),(5569,'Arcade Archives: Tube Panic','2020-04-23','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Tube Panic is a shooting game released by Nichibutsu in 1984. It is considered to be the first game circuit board to have a 3D rotation function. A mysterious tube net appears before the command ship Marcus as it cruises through space. Use 360° turning to battle enemy ships hiding in the depths of each stage, and face off with the mother ship\'s fleet waiting at the end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4icd.jpg'),(5570,'Night Terrors','2023-06-15','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience a chilling adventure unlike any other! Join Kenny on a journey to conquer his night terrors and discover the ultimate solution. Kenny\'s parents, desperate for a remedy, have sought the help of a renowned doctor who offers an experimental drug to banish these haunting nightmares for good.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lhc.jpg'),(5571,'IOI Collection',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d17.jpg'),(5572,'The Goto Family\'s: The Island Murder Case','2019-05-20','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is a detective adventure game, made by a former Japanese private detective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31jk.jpg'),(5573,'Dusk: Intruder Edition',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cbh.jpg'),(5574,'Neon Abyss: Deluxe Edition Bundle',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k85.jpg'),(5575,'Yoostar on MTV','2011-11-15','Music','Xbox 360','Yoostar on MTV fulfills the dreams of pop culture fans and gamers alike by giving everyone the opportunity to star in the most iconic scenes to ever hit cable TV. With a huge library of live events, news, classic, reality, and original shows to choose from, as well as the inclusion of upcoming shows to maximize its cultural relevancy, the extensive archive of trend-setting and entertaining content leaves no stone unturned. Additionally, some of the most popular music videos in recent history will be playable in Yoostar on MTV, in which you can perform with your own voice or via lip dub.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26ku.jpg'),(5576,'Battlefleet Gothic: Armada - Complete Edition',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Battle for the control of the Gothic sector in Battlefleet Gothic: Armada - Complete Edition, including the base game, all DLCs and the Original Soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3drm.jpg'),(5577,'Escape Floor 13',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escape Floor 13 is a survival-puzzle game with adventure and simulation elements. Set in a mysterious hotel, players are trapped on the 13th floor and must carefully navigate each level to reach safety. The primary goal is to cross each floor and reach the elevator, but supernatural anomalies complicate the journey. If an anomaly is sensed, players must retreat to their starting point to survive. The game’s tense atmosphere is heightened by the ever-present surveillance of the hotel, challenging players to rely on their instincts to escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z51.jpg'),(5578,'Our Mother\'s house','2023-04-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Our mother`s house is a survival, exploration, puzzle horror game with randomly generated events. Try to survive the night by using different items and exploring your mother`s childhood house. But be careful as many shadows and monster are lurking in the darkness...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k5w.jpg'),(5579,'Cities XL 2012','2011-10-20','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Imagine and conceive cities of all types and sizes. From a several million citizens megalopolis to a hyped seaside resort, to an industrial city, everything is allowed in Cities XL 2012! Take advantage of an incredible collection of more than 1000 buildings and structures (over 300 new buildings), and 62 different types of maps (15 new maps) featuring realistic environments. Enjoy never seen before freedom in a city-builder, allowing you to create your cities in every detail! \n \n As a virtual mayor, find the right balance between economic development of your cities, attractiveness, transportation (road traffic, bus, metro...), pollution, social services, taxes and even leisure activities. \n \n Create a proper economic development by setting up trade between cities; you can specialize certain cities in specific areas to fill in the needs of the others. This will ensure large-scale financial success and allow you to develop an increasingly complex network of cities!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e0e.jpg'),(5580,'Crime Crackers','1994-12-03','Shooter','PlayStation','There are many stars out there in the vastness of space...and where there are stars, there are also crooks who make a living in outer space! These worthless no-gooders steal and plunder and cause trouble whenever it is possible. However, where there are crooks, there are also police. In an effort to stop intergalactic crime, the \"Galaxy Police\" were born and they are also known as GG, or the Galaxy Guard. While the GG is somewhat successful in their efforts to prevent criminals from plundering the valuable resources of the universe, some jobs are just too big for them to handle.Here\'s where you come in; you control the team of wacky heroes who take care of the jobs that even the GG can\'t deal with. Flying through the Milky Way in a Pink Dolphin space craft and donning the title of Crime Crackers, you control the Pink Dolphin team, which has six members in it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4897.jpg'),(5581,'Alwa\'s Legacy','2020-06-17','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Alwa’s Legacy is a modern retro game full of dangerous dungeons, magical items and ancient secrets. By upgrading your magic, any way forward is right in this non-linear adventure game full of exploration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2923.jpg'),(5582,'The City of Time','2019-09-22','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','The little girl comes to the City of Time, this place has the magic of making time back, you can use the magic of time backward to make time interlaced to help the little girl through difficulties. Your actions mean the route when the time goes backwards. Once make mistakes, they will be irreversible, you need to use your brain to make full use of the time back and the appropriate course of action to pass the level successfully','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4349.jpg'),(5583,'Baldur\'s Gate: Enhanced Edition','2014-09-27','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Running on an upgraded and improved version of the Infinity Engine, Baldur\'s Gate: Enhanced Edition includes the entire Baldur\'s Gate adventure, the Tales of the Sword Coast expansion pack, and never-before-seen content including a new adventure and three new party members: the Calishite monk Rasaad yn Bashir, Neera the wild mage, and Dorn Il-Khan, the evil blackguard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ugr.jpg'),(5584,'Ditto Leapfrog','2005-05-15','Arcade','Game Boy Advance','Ditto Leapfrog is a Pokemon e-Reader game for the Game Boy Advance. In order to play Ditto Leapfrog three different Pokémon e-Reader cards must be scanned. The cards required are: Ditto (#51), Granbull (#61), and Snubbull (#101).\n\nIn Ditto Leapfrog a Kingler Pokémon will throw fish type Pokémon from the background to the foreground. The player must move Ditto (Who is in the foreground) left or right in order to make the fish Pokemon bounce off and into the water. Once three of the fish Pokemon have been missed the game will be over.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5585,'Egg Raiders','2024-10-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Egg Raiders is a cooperative horror game where four players work together to infiltrate an area teeming with aggressive monsters. You must survive for three days, gather valuable loot, and escape before more monsters come after you. Teamwork and strategy are the keys to success!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zgc.jpg'),(5586,'100 Hidden Frogs','2021-11-15','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The frogs hid. Can you find them?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bcg.jpg'),(5587,'ChuChu Rocket!','2011-11-22','Puzzle, Strategy','Android, iOS, Wii U, Game Boy Advance, Dreamcast','The object of the game is to guide one or more mice (\"ChuChus\") around a board into one or more goals while avoiding cats (\"KapuKapus\") roaming the board. The mice and cats all move in predictable paths by always turning right when hitting a wall head on, by following corners or by turning around when in a dead end.\n\nChuChu Rocket!\'s multiplayer mode revolves around up to four players placing arrows on the level at once, trying to direct mice into their own rockets and cats into other players\' rockets (any cat that reaches a rocket removes a percentage of the mice within). Each player can only have three arrows on-screen at a time and cannot place them on other players\' arrows or their own arrows. Arrows would disappear over time, or could be removed by a player placing his fourth arrow (which would eliminate the first arrow placed, thus leaving three). Although a simple concept, this quickly becomes frenetic with the relentless speed of the mice and four players fighting over them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21su.jpg'),(5588,'Sanctum','2012-08-13','Shooter, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An inventive tower defense/ first person shooter hybrid that pits elite soldier Skye against various forms of alien life on a small set of unique maps. Skye must build and upgrade defensive structures while jumping into the fray to help her creations take down the hostile invaders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hky.jpg'),(5589,'Relics of ancestors','2021-03-31','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is a RPG adventure and exploration role-playing game. The story takes place in Beijing six thousand years later. At present, this work is a beta version, with only one occupation and one chapter of plot. In the beta version, adventurers can set up their own adventure team to explore and discover the heritage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yew.jpg'),(5590,'Chihiro Himukai Always Walks Away','2021-03-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chihiro Himukai Always Walks Away is a sweet visual novel about two people finding each other after slipping apart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l3e.jpg'),(5591,'Star Wars: Obi-Wan','2002-03-28','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox','Join the legendary Jedi Knight Obi-Wan Kenobi as he takes on the worst scum and villainy the galaxy has to offer in level after level of fast-paced action. In Star Wars: Obi-Wan, you\'ll call upon the Force and your powerful lightsaber as you face a mysterious new enemy, an assassin droid project and a devious plot that could dramatically shift the balance of power in the universe. Fight your way through an underworld trail of munitions dealers and crime lords-from the lowest depths of Coruscant and dusty Tatooine to the lush city of Theed. The Force is in your hands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2485.jpg'),(5592,'Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora','2023-12-07','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora is a first-person, action-adventure game set in the never-before-seen Western Frontier of Pandora. Abducted by the human militaristic corporation known as the RDA, you, a Na’vi, were trained and molded to serve their purpose. Fifteen years later, you are free, but find yourself a stranger in your birthplace. Reconnect with your lost heritage, discover what it truly means to be Na\'vi, and join other clans to protect Pandora from the RDA.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oe3.jpg'),(5593,'Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50tw.jpg'),(5594,'Drago Adventure','2009-09-18','Platform','Web browser','Play the Drago Adventure game to join a little magical dragon on a big quest! Explore 7 worlds, fight enemies, and use amazing powers to save the day!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5595,'Wipeout: The Game','2010-07-22','Platform, Strategy','Wii, Nintendo DS','Based on the hit ABC TV show, Wipeout: The Game challenges fans to master speed, balance, and precision to overcome the world\'s largest obstacle course while enduring the inevitable hilarious falls, sometimes at the hands of your friends and family!\n\nIn Wipeout: The Game, players will prove they have what it takes to make it to the grand finale \"Wipeout Zone\" for their chance to be proclaimed champion. Four players can compete at the same time, even allowing players to hurl objects at and taunt their opponents. The video game features everything that people love about the hit ABC show, including commentary from the show\'s hosts, John Anderson, John Henson and co-host Jill Wagner. Players will have to run, jump and dodge all of Wipeout\'s various obstacles, including the brutal Sucker Punch, the beloved Big Balls, and the insanely difficult Sweeper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nsy.jpg'),(5596,'Nakoruru: Anohito kara no Okurimono','2002-03-28','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Dreamcast','Nakoruru: Ano Hito kara no Okurimono, abbreviated as \"Nakorimo\" or Nakoruru ADV internationally, is an adventure game developed by Inter-lets as a spin-off of the Samurai Shodown series. It was released on July 6, 2001 in Japan for the Windows operating systems and later for the Sega Dreamcast. The game was scheduled to be available at the same time as Samurai Shodown: Warriors Rage but experienced several setbacks due to the game\'s changing sponsors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c19.jpg'),(5597,'Amanda\'s Sticker Book','2018-12-17','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enjoy a fun match-3 puzzle game for kids and adults alike! Put your matching skills to the test as you swap stickers and use power-ups to clear each puzzle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57th.jpg'),(5598,'Maisons de repos','2025-02-27','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Maison\'s de repos is a pure and realistic horror videogame based on true events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mc3.jpg'),(5599,'Still Joking','2025-01-14','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','What do mirror reflections do once they have no one to repeat after anymore? This game offers you a few ideas to explore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co996j.jpg'),(5600,'Virtua Fighter','1993-10-15','Fighting','Arcade, Sega 32X, Sega Saturn','A classic fighting game by Sega, considered one of the first 3D fighting games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84c6.jpg'),(5601,'Sonic Colors: Ultimate','2021-09-07','Platform, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Join Sonic in the high-speed adventure of a lifetime across a colorful interstellar amusement park. Color the Universe in Sonic Colors: Ultimate!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31a0.jpg'),(5602,'Friday Night Funkin\': Hotline 024','2021-09-06','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Meet Nikku, an alien girl that crashed on earth and was captured by a secret agency, she has been used for experimentation for years, until one day she was able to escape and decided to hide in an abandoned mall.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4r5l.jpg'),(5603,'Uwaiteru','2025-04-24','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A chill platformer where you play as Bubble Cat. Help her jump and slide along bubbles to reach a bubble star and achieve her bubble dreams!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q85.jpg'),(5604,'Funfair Party','2008-11-21','Sin género','Wii','Funfair Party assembles a variety of 23 funfair themed minigames for the Nintendo Wii. From simple target shooting to memory and reflex games inside or outside the circus tent, Funfair Party provides hours of fun and challenge for every member of the family. Featuring two distinct play modes, players can choose to immerse themselves in a heroic narrative where the success of each minigame helps a young boy stave-off a looming threat to the funfair, or, for a quicker play experience, pick-and-choose their favourite minigames to play with a friend. Funfair Party takes full advantage of the unique Wii Remote controller with a variety of gestural commands, custom-designed for each game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gkq.jpg'),(5605,'Tiny Toon Adventures: Wacky Sports','1994-11-25','Sport','Game Boy','Tiny Toon Adventures: Wacky Sports (Tiny Toon Adventures 3: Doki Doki Sports Festival in Japan), released in 1994 on the Nintendo Game Boy and developed and published by Konami, is the third Tiny Toon Adventures-related game for the system.\n\nThe player chooses either Buster Bunny or Babs Bunny and participates in their choice of sports activities, including baseball, soccer, or tennis. As Buster, they can also play carnival games set up by characters such as Shirley the Loon and Fifi La Fume. Carnival games include a watergun gallery and a beat-the-clock challenge featuring Elmyra Duff.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96e9.jpg'),(5606,'The Last Guild',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An RPG full of combat and regions to explore, focused on collecting resources to create magical items and defeat monsters. You are the last defender of this kingdom, hire adventurers to help you on your journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r7h.jpg'),(5607,'Football VR','2016-07-14','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Anyone can throw a football on Earth. With FOOTBALL VR, step into a new world where you are the quarterback. Throw the football and race against the clock to score as many points as possible while you go for fame and try to reach our high score leaderboard.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5608,'WorMoon: Awakening',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Embark on an epic journey in worMoon Awakening - A fast paced card battle game with some RPG and innovative roguelite mechanics to create a simple, fun and replayable game.\nBuild your deck of nine cards by combining the power of your team of heroes. Unleash the forces of nature with Bo, wield powerful magic with Ash, and uncover the enigmatic hero Jomei\'s secrets.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5609,'Blazing Chrome','2019-07-11','Shooter, Platform, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Blazing Chrome is a classic co-op run \'n gun with an original arcade feel. Players can choose between Mavra, the badass human resistance, soldier or Doyle, the groovy rebel robot, to kick some metal ass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rs5.jpg'),(5610,'Ancient Society','2022-04-18','Strategy','Web browser','Ancient Society is a multi-platform P2E game where your opportunity to create, build, and rule your very own empire through the Ages of Civilization (and beyond) awaits.\n\nAncient Society mimics the politics and uncertainty of the Classical Era, where alliances are made and broken every day. Will you rise to the top as a diplomatic and cunning ambassador? Or will you smash the forces of your opponents with brute strength and steal resources only to strengthen your own democracy? The choice is yours.\n\nAncient Society is developed as an NFT-based Play-to-Earn game that incorporates all the thrills and values of NFTs and cryptocurrency coupled with the excitement of real-world building, resource-gathering, and role-playing. Ancient Society is a browser-based game with cross-compatibility with mobile devices and our metaverse-based NFT Worlds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64pb.jpg'),(5611,'Hasbro Compilation','2006-07-16','Puzzle, Strategy','Nintendo DS','Monopoly/Boggle/Yahtzee/Battleship is a collection of the hit board games that so many enjoyed as kids. Try your finance and negotiation skills in Monopoly, see how good you are with words in Boggle, roll the dice and hit the high numbers in Yahtzee and use your critical thinking to sink your friend\'s Battleship. State-of-the-art engine and physics create stunning visuals and effects Blood-curdling music and sound effects enhance the experience\n\nPlay four of your all-time favourites anytime, anywhere\nWireless multiplayer mode--challenge up to 4 friends\nTouch-screen controls - play word games as fast as you can think!\n\"Hot seat\" mode--share games with up to 4 people on a single DS','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/iyy4sq1feabebafdw2lu.jpg'),(5612,'Grav','2015-01-08','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','GRAV is a sand box experience where you explore a multitude of planets, hunt strange alien creatures, build and defend outposts, craft weapons and armor, and attempt to survive against other players in a hostile environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xxt.jpg'),(5613,'Button City: Soccer Days',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Rejoin the wholesome cast of Button City as they compete in this cozy soccer adventure! Build your dream team, plan your day, bond with teammates, enjoy action-packed soccer, and win the tournament!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70lr.jpg'),(5614,'Trinelogy','2015-08-20','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Trinelogy is a bundle including Trine Enchanted Edition, Trine 2: Complete Story, and Trine 3: The Artifacts of Power.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7f6s.jpg'),(5615,'The Madness of Death','2023-01-25','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Madness of Death is a first person psychological horror game. Explore the house in order to escape from it and break the curse of the Death Stone. You will have to solve the puzzles in order to advance and try not to stay in the dark.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62h3.jpg'),(5616,'Major Minor\'s Majestic March','2009-03-31','Music','Wii','In a town where marching bands are prevalent and everyone is looking to be the best, Major Mike Minor is fairly ambivalent towards marches despite hailing from a long line of illustrious Drum Majors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xexr7tzatxknkajxjx6v.jpg'),(5617,'Fazbear Nightmare',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The residents of Trillium County will know the feeling of an old wound.\nTime has passed and doors that seemed locked forever are opened once again and the timing couldn\'t be any worse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zmd.jpg'),(5618,'Power Instinct','1994-11-18','Fighting, Arcade','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Wii, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Wii U, Super Famicom','The console version of Power Instinct released on the Super Nintendo and Super Famicom. There are various minor features removed from the Super Nintendo release of the game.\nA Japanese exculsive Sega Mega Drive version was also released with minor changes and an extra game mode.\n\nPower Instinct is a one-on-one 2D fighting game in the tradition of Street Fighter 2, in which you select your character from a group of unique fighters and attempt to defeat your opponents in successive fashion using your arcade reflexes and your character\'s unique moves.\n\nFeatures 8 selectable characters, plus a boss character, and single or 2-player Vs gameplay. Also includes a practice mode, battle mode and time attack and life attack modes for extended gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5b37.jpg'),(5619,'The Scent of Home',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Do you remember the scent of your home?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5620,'Galactic Assault: Prisoner of Power','2007-09-11','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Claim the role of supreme commander and assault the enemy from different sides of the battle, as three rival factions - the Khonties, Barbarians and the Insular Empire - become embroiled in a fierce struggle to destroy the entire race of the Land of the Unknown Fathers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q7o.jpg'),(5621,'Aggressive Inline','2002-09-06','Sport','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Combine the many tricks and styles of the extreme sport, inline skating, with a Tony Hawk style system, complete with objectives and huge arenas, and you have Aggressive Inline.\n\nProgress through the career mode, where you must complete objectives (such as grind a certain object(s) to jump over large gaps and gain points) to open up further arenas, which there are 7 in all, and once your bored with them, you can make your own in the park editor. The game doesn\'t use a hard time limit but the so-called \"juice meter\": it fills up when performing stunts and if it gets empty, the level ends. During the game you level up your character in seven stats, e.g. speed and grinds. The game uses a \"learning by doing\" approach to this, meaning that the stat improves if you perform the associated actions often enough. There are also five hidden keys in each level which open up new areas within the level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3g90.jpg'),(5622,'Matchmaker Agency','2025-02-13','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Hot singles near your area and they\'re ready to date! Not with you, no. Your job is to find them the perfect date and become the best matchmaker in town.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78ly.jpg'),(5623,'Daikoukai Jidai','1990-02-01','Simulator','MSX','The Franco family used to be one of the influential houses of Portugal. That is until the head of the family sailed out of a disastrous voyage to find the kingdom of Prester John. The disarray that followed brought about an end to the nobility of the Franco name. 100 years have passed and Portugal has prospered through it\'s sailing and trading empires. Young Leon Fanco wishes to restore his family\'s good name and make a name for himself as a sailor. At the heart of his ambition is the fair lady, Christiana, who is desired by the likely heir to the kingdom. Towards that end, Leon has been working hard to secure finances for his first ship. With the first step of his dream complete, Franco sails out with his father\'s good friend as first mate, you\'re off to find fame, adventure and fortunes out on the sea and in uncharted waters.\n\nUncharted Waters is a sailing and trading simulation. Your goal is initially to sail between ports and trade goods between them to make a profit. Along the way, you may be called upon by merchants and royalty to do specific tasks. Several different nations as well as pirates roam the sea and not all have good relations with one another. You can take as long as you want and explore as much of the world as possible to complete your ultimate task of marrying Christiana, which will require your fame rating to be quite high anyway. Available at most ports is a trader for cargo, a supply station for your crew\'s food and water as well as repairs, a shipbuilder, an item store and finally a pub for gaining information, crew and gambling.\n\nAll of the game progresses on an overhead-view, by sea you navigate your fleet by direction and can issue additional orders including landing on any piece of land to search for supplies. A variety of hazards live at sea including storms, other ships, seaweed and simply bad winds and currents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4o3h.jpg'),(5624,'Z-Warp','2022-04-06','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Z-Warp is an intense vertical shoot\'em up presented in retro pixel art style, featuring frenetic arcade-inspired action where blasters, bombs and killer specials are your only allies. Shoot down demonic enemies as they try to overwhelm your ship with bullet hell salvos and turn the tide of battle by charging your killer weapon capable of instantly wiping out anything in a tight radius around your ship! Face massive boss abominations and aim for high scores in Story or Endless modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7iqd.jpg'),(5625,'Let It Die','2017-02-02','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','LET IT DIE is a hyper-violent hack-and-slash action experience with roguelike elements. Fight your way to the top in this free-to-play collaborative creation brought to you by Grasshopper Manufacture and GungHo Online Entertainment America.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qiy.jpg'),(5626,'Phantom Doctrine: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cbr.jpg'),(5627,'Pretty Angel','2019-12-13','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Relax class puzzle game to keep you in a good mood','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hy0.jpg'),(5628,'Cobra Command','1985-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade, Sharp X1, Sega CD, MSX','Terrorists are threatening the Free World and have amassed a diabolical force. Only the brave pilot of Cobra Command can vanquish the terrorist threat and save the free world from total destruction. The player assumes the role as pilot of the LX-3 Super Cobra helicopter.\n\nThe missions go across the New York City streets, the Statue of Liberty, the Atlantic Ocean, Italy, the Grand Canyon and the enemy\'s headquarters on the Easter Island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ihu.jpg'),(5629,'Akai Katana','2010-08-19','Shooter','Arcade, Xbox 360','Experience sensory overload with shoot-em-up master Cave\'s Akai Katana. Set in a parallel world resembling Japan\'s Taisho period, the people have discovered the powerful Blood Swords. Requiring human sacrifices to unleash their immense destructive power, these swords have been used by the empire to crush neighboring countries. However, all the bloodshed and power gained through sacrificing close family members has made some of the swordsmen reconsider. With new fighter planes and the powered up swords at their disposal, this small band of rebels now fight back against the tyrannical empire.\n\nCreated specifically with the Xbox 360 in mind, Akai Katana is the first CAVE release to feature horizontal combat in sumptuous HD and eye-watering full 16:9 support. Prepare for a new definition of \'bullet-hell\'!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kqx.jpg'),(5630,'Void Sails','2025-05-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Void Sails is a single-player adventure where you captain a flying ship across uncharted space. Sail through mysterious worlds, battle powerful foes, and make story-defining choices. Uncover dark secrets in a game where every discovery could bring you closer to the truth—or to madness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95i8.jpg'),(5631,'Shechu de Fubao','2022-02-25','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','A Blessing for the Herd is a morality tale about China\'s \"996\" system of overworking employees, aimed to expose the societal and cultural structures behind the \"996\" system. Take control of a fledging e-commerce startup, manage investor funds and employees, and grow your customer base -- but be warned, pushing your employees to the edge can have devastating consequences. As the company expands, the stories of you and six other employees intertwine, as you work overtime to fulfil impossible investor expectations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pk6.jpg'),(5632,'Sands of Fire','2021-04-02','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take control of forty tons of pure armored destruction! World War II is raging, and the enemy is fighting hard for every inch of territory in North Africa. Devastate the opposing forces with superior tactics, cunning strategy, and tremendous might.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40sd.jpg'),(5633,'Homunculus Hotel','2021-09-24','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore the floors of the mysterious Homunculus Hotel and help its guests understanding their dreams.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5edi.jpg'),(5634,'Hearthstone: The Boomsday Project','2018-08-07','Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Can you feel it? That electric tension on the wind, the reek of ozone and Khorium, the distant rumble of explosions; there’s science in the air! Word around the inn is that Dr. Boom has returned to his secret laboratory in the Netherstorm. No one knows exactly what the mad genius will unleash, but a lot of very, VERY strange cards have found their way into decks around here lately: mechanical amalgamations, eerie crystals, revolting, lab-grown monstrosities… the good doctor and his esteemed colleagues are working on something big! Time to venture into the Netherstorm, find the lab, and uncover what these maniacs are up to.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hdb.jpg'),(5635,'Homebound','2017-02-16','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immerse yourself in the most beautiful and spine chilling VR experience to date. Experience a series of catastrophic events in the cold void of deep space as you crash rapidly towards earth. When disaster strikes, your one mission is to make it out alive as fast as you can. Dead or alive, you are Homebound.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bn5.jpg'),(5636,'Meat Puppet','1997-08-01','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lotos Abstraction. A Beautiful woman with a keen mind and a big gun, living in a destroyed 21st century. Someone has taken her memory and her freedom. Now she must kill or be killed, while trying to find whoever or whatever is controlling her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cr5.jpg'),(5637,'King of Boxer','1985-02-01','Fighting, Sport','Arcade','Ring King is a boxing game in which the action in the ring is viewed in a 3D top-down view and a full range of moves is provided, with the standard jabs complimented by body punches and the ability to dodge, duck or raise your guard. \n \nEach punch weakens your opponent\'s strength which can slightly recover during a round break. A rain of well placed blows can produce a quick knockout, but normally you must hit your opponent many times before he goes down. \n \nThe game has three play modes. There is training mode to train your player before you enter a tournament. A ranking mode where you can select one of the three championships, Rookie, Japan and World. Each championship can be played at five difficulty levels. The third mode is the tournament mode. To reach the number one spot in the ranking or tournament mode you must train your boxer well. \n \nBefore you start you must create your character and set his initial abilities, strength, speed and stamina. Each won bout increases these abilities slightly. The abilities of your opponent and you are visible in the status bar at the top of the screen during the game. Strength is represented with a boxing glove, speed with a shoe and stamina with a dumb bell. \n \nThis game can be played by one player against the computer or by two players against each other. A password is given after each won bout and it enables you to continue with the next match in a tournament at a later time.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5638,'Titan Warriors','1988-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Family Computer','Titan Warriors is a cancelled shoot-\'em-up that was developed by Capcom for the NES / Famicom, in 1988. The game was meant to be a sequel of Vulgus, an arcade shooter developed and published by Capcom in Japan in 1984.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oxu.jpg'),(5639,'Get fit with Mel B','2011-08-30','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, Wii, Xbox 360','\"Get fit with Mel B\" is a sporty workout game that will bring you right into the action. Together with a healthy nutrition plan shaped for your needs, Scary Spice will guide you through various modes like dance fit, cardio, step, pump and tone and kickboxing. The game also supports a large variety of fitness accessories that will make the workout even more effective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22o2.jpg'),(5640,'A Short Hike','2019-07-30','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hike, climb, and soar through the peaceful mountainside landscapes of Hawk Peak Provincial Park as you make your way to the summit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e83.jpg'),(5641,'ChatBattlers','2024-12-18','Fighting, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ChatBattlers is a Twitch Integration game releasing on Steam in September. Steamers have get an interactive 3D set of both Idle, and engaging game mods. Both Transparency support as well as a Stream-Safe LoFi sound track are included. Users can download the app in order to customize their slime with weapons, skins, costumes, and accessories to appear in other streams. Join streams to compete and wind Gems to purchase customization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tgz.jpg'),(5642,'Fallout: New Vegas - Ultimate Edition','2012-02-07','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Welcome back to New Vegas!\n\nWith the introduction of the Ultimate Edition Bethesda Softworks presents the definitive edition of Fallout: New Vegas. This complete package, which includes the Dead Money, Honest Hearts, Old World Blues and Lonesome Road add-on packs, allows you to experience everything that New Vegas has to offer. To sweeten the pot, you\'ll be armed with the latest cache of unique weapons, ammo types and recipes from the most recent add-on packs Courier\'s Stash and Gun Runners Arsenal.\n\nWhether you\'re a seasoned explorer of the Mojave or playing the game for the first time you will find there are more friends, and enemies, to make, more consequences to be responsible for and more opportunities to live in glory, or infamy, throughout the Wasteland. The choices you make will be as influential as ever.\n\nEnjoy your stay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ybz.jpg'),(5643,'Naruto Shippuden: Gekitou Ninja Taisen EX3','2008-12-27','Fighting','Wii','The game includes three game modes that are new to the series. Naruto\'s transformation now has three tails. Another new feature is the Senzai Ninriki (translated in Clash of Ninja Revolution 3 as Latent Ninja Powers), where every character glows a certain colour when they hit low health/crisis mode. Similar to gaining new specials in crisis mode as of the first Revolution game and beforehand Naruto: Gekitō Ninja Taisen! 3, the Senzai Ninriki is a special crisis mode that provides certain effects depending on the character, for example Naruto and Temari\'s backward strong attacks no longer use up chakra, Hinata can chakra cancel her attacks with no chakra cost, Kakashi deals damage through guard with all his attacks, Neji and Gaara automatically deflect projectiles while standing still, certain characters\' moves become unblockable and so on. Most of the characters\' Senzai Ninriki effects change in Naruto Shippūden: Clash of Ninja Revolution 3 onwards.\nOne of the game\'s new modes is the \"Hurricane Clash Mode\", which is also reworked into the new story mode which is original from the main storyline. In this mode, the player controls their character in a full 3D movement perspective and can take on hordes of ninja in a beat em\' up genre fashion, with many character movesets retweaked solely for this mode. This style has not appeared in any later Gekitou Ninja Taisen/Clash of Ninja games ever since.\nThis game was released only in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gdl.jpg'),(5644,'Case 32','2025-06-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A series of mysterious murders takes place in a small provincial town. Detective Cooper must unravel a tangle of mystical, chilling events to get to the bottom of the mystery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p1v.jpg'),(5645,'Chaos;Head Noah / Chaos;Child Double Pack: SteelBook Launch Edition','2022-10-07','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','The edition comes with a steelbook featuring exclusive art drawn by the character designer Mutsumi Sasaki.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5eg0.jpg'),(5646,'Capcom Arcade 2nd Stadium: Mega Man 2 - The Power Fighters','2022-07-21','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Add CA2S: Mega Man 2 - The Power Fighters to your Capcom Arcade 2nd Stadium game line-up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65ow.jpg'),(5647,'Tiny Racing','2025-12-31','Racing, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A nostalgic top-down racing game with vibrant pixel art. Choose from unique vehicles, conquer constrasting tracks, and master different modes. With intuitive arcade controls, experience high-speed excitement and become the ultimate racing champion in this retro adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gv4.jpg'),(5648,'Amphibia: Locust Pocus','2019-06-23','Adventure','Web browser','Browser game based off the tv show','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hdu.jpg'),(5649,'Super Onion Boy+','2024-05-31','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Super Onion Boy+ offers an exhilarating journey in a 2D platformer filled with action and adventure, in the nostalgic retro style. Your mission is to rescue the princess, who has been imprisoned in a magical bubble by a terrible monster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d20.jpg'),(5650,'Star Wars: Battlefront Classic Collection','2024-03-14','Shooter, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Fight in iconic battles from across the STAR WARS galaxy!\n\nPlay the classic STAR WARS Battlefront games on modern consoles, online and offline in this complete classic collection.\n\nThis Classic Collection includes:\nSTAR WARS Battlefront (Classic)\n-Includes Bonus Map: Jabba\'s Palace\nSTAR WARS Battlefront II\n-Includes Bonus Maps: Bespin: Cloud City, Rhen Var: Harbor, Rhen Var: Citadel, and Yavin 4: Arena\n-Includes Bonus Heroes: Asajj Ventress & Kit Fisto\n\nKey Features\nTraverse the Galaxy in Campaign Mode & Galactic Conquest\nGalactic Conquest: Devise your strategy, recruit your troops, and execute your tactical vision for conquering the galaxy.\nSTAR WARS Battlefront Campaign: Experience iconic battles from STAR WARS Episodes I-VI\nSTAR WARS Battlefront II Campaign: Join the rise of Darth Vader’s elite 501st Legion of Stormtroopers\n\nMassive Locations with up to 64-player Online Support\n-Fight on the ground: Wookiee Warriors, Jet Troopers, Droidekas and more in massive multiplayer action\n-Drive iconic vehicles: Speeder Bikes, AT-STs, AT-RTs, and more in offensive and defensive battles\n-Pilot legendary starships: TIE fighters, X-wings, and more in space and air dogfights\n\nExpanded Hero Assault\nHero Assault is playable on all ground maps including: Death Star, Kashyyyk, Kamino, and Naboo for the first time ever\n-Fight with heroes: Mace Windu, Yoda, Luke Skywalker, and many others!\n-Battle with villains: Darth Maul, General Grievous, Darth Vader, and many others!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7shi.jpg'),(5651,'Miryam: The Polluted Land','2025-03-27','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Traverse the wasteland with Miryam. Use magic items to build defenses against evil spirits. It\'s a casual tower defense game of construction and resource balance. Characters grow via challenges, from timid to fearless and wild. The blend of building and defense makes it addictive and engaging','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gig.jpg'),(5652,'Rune II','2019-11-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inspired by the original Rune (2000), Rune II is set in a dangerous Norse universe during Ragnarok, the end of days, where beasts and the last remaining humans alike struggle to survive.\n\nYou have been chosen by the gods to be Midgard’s savior - receive their blessings and powerful abilities as you endeavor to end Ragnarok! Race against time to prevent the trickster Loki from destroying Midgard as he keeps the world in a perpetual state of chaos.\n\nAlone or with friends, you will battle legions of Loki’s minions in brutal melee combat, travel the world collecting rare resources, locate precious artifacts to weaken the Realm Gate and craft the mightiest weapons the Nine Realms have ever seen.\n\nAre you powerful enough to Take Down Loki...or will a new age of darkness begin?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1sfd.jpg'),(5653,'Life Goes On: Done to Death','2018-07-23','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','A comical puzzle platformer where you must die to progress. The bodies you leave behind are your only tools to solve puzzles on your quest to find the Cup of Life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p6r.jpg'),(5654,'Beherit','2018-07-16','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Trapped and alone, you must uncover the truth behind the gemstone known as the Beherit and overcome its nightmare. \n \nIt will be no easy task, requiring you to navigate an ever expanding level and solve a wide array of puzzles, all the while being hunted by an advanced AI system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1t4u.jpg'),(5655,'Army Bus Driving Simulator','2025-04-17','Racing, Simulator','PlayStation 4','Your task is to safely transport soldiers between bases through difficult routes, overcoming off-road terrain, checkpoints and other obstacles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r6d.jpg'),(5656,'Metro: Last Light - Chronicles Pack','2013-10-16','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','The Chronicles Pack DLC is the last Metro DLC pack said to \'include new, original single player gameplay that expands on Metro: Last Light\'s universe and story\'. The player will play three levels as Khan, Pavel and Anna, in their respective levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7z8z.jpg'),(5657,'Darksiders III: The Crucible','2019-02-26','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','In this mighty morsel of digital wonderment, competitors can expect to receive a truly earth-shattering experience: The Crucible!\n\nA legendary challenge whispered with reverence across the universe. Not even the Creator could have envisioned such glorious spectacle as that which is found in this fabled arena.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mwr.jpg'),(5658,'Commandos 2 & Praetorians HD Remaster Doube Pack','2020-09-18','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Relive two masterpieces, originally developed by the legendary Pyro Studios, that defined the real-time tactics genre like nothing before, re-imagined in full HD and bundled together for the first time ever! In Commandos 2 – HD Remaster, take control of an elite group of commandos, venture deep into enemy territory and utilize their combined expertise to complete a series of notoriously demanding missions set in World War II. Prepare to face overwhelming odds as you operate covertly to turn the tide of war.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30rk.jpg'),(5659,'James Bond 007: A View to a Kill','1985-12-31','Adventure','Mac, DOS, Apple II','\"James Bond 007: A View to a Kill\" is a text adventure based on the James Bond film of the same name. Released in 1985 for DOS, Macintosh and Apple II computers, it was developed by Angelsoft, Inc. and published by Mindscape Inc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99ux.jpg'),(5660,'Minecraft Tower Defence','2011-12-03','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','You begin your journey by digging your own path, making sure you don\'t cross over and reach your house. The longer your path, the more resources you acquire. The more resources you acquire, the more turrets and traps you can buy and upgrade to hold of the many mobs of Minecraftia! With 4 dispensers to buy, and 4 traps to lay down all in which can be upgraded you can defend your way on Survival Island, Dungeon and in the Nether! Hint: You can get to the end if you play long enough! Thanks for taking time to play the game, please leave some of your finest critique... Love, Adam, Lewis and Billy! Still not satisfied? Just you wait for what we have in store for you guys next time around!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67ts.jpg'),(5661,'Sonic 3D Blitz','2023-07-02','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hei.jpg'),(5662,'Crysis 2','2011-03-22','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Sequel to one of the greatest PC shooters ever, Crysis 2 offers console players their first taste of Crytek\'s unique shooter gameplay. Featuring futuristic war, gorgeous destruction and the chance to kick alien butt on the grandest stage of all, New York City, Crysis 2 is destined at the least to equal its predecessor, if not surpass it. Additional features include: challenging AI enemies in the single player campaign, 12-player support online, new and improved upgradable Nanosuit 2 technology and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2on2.jpg'),(5663,'Marvel 5DX Legacy','2021-12-31','Fighting, Arcade, Card & Board Game','Android, iOS','Iconic Marvel Cinematic Universe characters come to life in stunning Augmented Reality! Collect Marvel Cinematic Universe heroes and villains like Iron Man, Witness Captain America, Captain Marvel, Spider-man, Thanos and more. Improve your heroes’ stats and unlock special characters & moves as you expand your card collection. Now it’s time to enter the real-time online battles and experience never-before-seen action!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co920h.jpg'),(5664,'Zombies Crusher','2024-10-12','Racing, Simulator, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Undead Drive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yss.jpg'),(5665,'RPG Merchant','2018-02-15','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RPG Merchant is a VR serving simulator set in a fantasy world. It puts the player in the shoes of a merchant who sells items for adventurers, such as swords, shields and potions. Customers enter the shop in waves, and the player needs to sell them the right items while fending off thieves and other obstacles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27fl.jpg'),(5666,'Sonic Quantum Collision',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ikk.jpg'),(5667,'Tales of Arise: Beyond the Dawn - Ultimate Edition','2023-09-19','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Beyond the Dawn Ultimate Edition includes:\n• Tales of Arise\n• Beyond the Dawn Expansion\n• Classic Characters Costume & Arranged BGM Pack\n• Premium Travel Pack\n• Starter Pack\n• Premium Item Pack\n• Premium Costume Pack\n• Collaboration Costume Pack\n• 18 additional costumes\n\nWield the Blazing Sword and join a mysterious, untouchable girl to fight your oppressors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78ft.jpg'),(5668,'Let\'s Cook Together 2','2025-02-06','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Let\'s Cook Together 2 is a plot-driven co-op game. Use teamwork to fight against Nutri Inc. - a dystopian food government. Cook and serve dishes like the future depended on it. Travel across the world to make cooking meaningful again. Take back the taste.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59z0.jpg'),(5669,'Steel Division 2: Total Conflict Edition',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d82.jpg'),(5670,'NBA Live 18','2017-09-15','Sport','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','\"NBA LIVE 18 is all about player control, taking place where skill meets style. Every outcome is based on the actions you take, with mechanics that make every choice and twitch skill more impactful than ever before.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27xy.jpg'),(5671,'Dirt Bicycle Rider Simulator','2023-08-15','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Choose your bike, conquer the town and mountains! Test your skills in Dirt Bicycle Rider Simulator, packed with realistic graphics and exciting missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vov.jpg'),(5672,'Neon Runner',NULL,'Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Test yourself on the neon lit tracks of Neon Runner. A fast paced runner style game that requires speed and precision to complete all levels as quickly as possible and set a high score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6uth.jpg'),(5673,'Coil\'s Containment','2025-04-11','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Coil\'s Containment is a horror roguelike where you start a new job at a local ice cream parlor. To secure your employment and satisfy your boss, Mr. Coil, you must generate enough revenue in 11 days.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9my4.jpg'),(5674,'Train of the Century','2021-11-12','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Web browser','Train of the Century is a railroad simulator RPG built on the WAX blockchain. Players are known as \"Railroaders\" and can build trains, deliver commodities to player-owned stations, interact with the lore-rich \"Centuryverse,\" and embark on an intricate sci-fi fantasy story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4l42.jpg'),(5675,'Fighters Megamix','1998-12-31','Fighting','Game.com','Virtua Fighter 2 was full of many brand new gameplay elements implemented into the realistic fighting engine of the first Virtua Fighter. The Virtua Fighter series has been heralded before as the fighting game with most involving gameplay.\n\nIn Fighters Megamix, another game has been added, a game called Fighting Vipers. Fighting Vipers has drastically different gameplay than the more popular Virtua Fighter 2. Instead of being sophisticated, Fighting Vipers is simplified to appeal to a wider audience of video gamers and was meant for \"casual\" gamers.\n\nMixing a simplistic video game and a sophisticated video game must have been difficult. But Fighters Megamix manages to do so by offering many options. The most important option available is the choice of having Fighters Megamix run under the Fighting Vipers style of gameplay or the Virtua Fighter 2 style of gameplay. Other options are unlockable while playing the game.\n\nOne good thing about mixing two games into one is that the game would include more selectable characters. Not only are there the 22 characters from Virtua Fighter 2 and Fighting Vipers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4jb7.jpg'),(5676,'Sonic Labyrinth',NULL,'Sin género','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5677,'Space 2048','2014-09-26','Sin género','Android, iOS, Mac','Space 2048 takes place in outer space with grandiose visuals of the entire universe as background. Here you are surrounded by galaxies, suns and asteroids and move entire planets to get to your score. For an engulfing game experience Space 2048 includes a soundtrack and great sound effects. You can quit the game at any time and continue exactly where you left off later. There is an undo for any mistakes you might make and you always have a history of your last 8 scores available.\n\nThe rules for the Space 2048 game are very simple. There are only four game moves. Use the arrow buttons or swipe on the screen to move to the left, the right, the top or the bottom. All planets will then move into that direction as far as they can. Planets of the same kind will merge into a new planet with their combined value and your score is updated. You win once you have one planet with the value of 2048. And that is much easier said then done.\n\nVisuals are a big part of the gaming experience and to match the overall theme all interface elements like the triple setting sound switch for example (full sound with background music, effects only or sound off) rotate floating in space. And while the true stars - pun intended - of Space 2048 are the planets with their magnificent slow rotation, they are more than matched in grandiosity by those fascinating backdrops. The latter are images taken by the Hubble Space Telescope with titles like \"Antennae Galaxies\" or \"Ring Nebula\".','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5678,'Rain Games Steampunk Bundle','2020-11-25','Platform, Puzzle','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Rain Games Steampunk Bundle includes two titles from Rain Games: Teslagrad and World to the West.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3drz.jpg'),(5679,'The Nightmare Before Christmas: Oogie\'s Revenge','2005-10-10','Music, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox, PlayStation 2','Action game based on Henry Selick\'s stop-motion movie masterpiece. Players slip into the role of Jack Skellington, King of Halloween, and relive the adventures set in Tim Burton\'s dark world. Following the events of the Tim Burton\'s The Nightmare Before Christmas movie, players take control of Jack Skellington who sets out on a search of new ways to spook kids during Halloween. He returns home to find that Oogie Boogie has returned and Halloween Town is in peril once again.\n\nThe game combines elements of action, platforming, and rhythm-based gameplay, as Jack must also perform musical battles to defeat certain bosses and progress through the story. Each battle is set to a unique musical number, bringing the dark charm of the film\'s soundtrack to life in a new and interactive way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rn4.jpg'),(5680,'Haunted Hotel: The Axiom Butcher - Collector\'s Edition','2016-05-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Eleven years after the Axiom Butcher\'s reign of terror in the hotel, the murders have resumed. It\'s up to you to uncover the mystery behind this madman and help the hotel guests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e47.jpg'),(5681,'Pinstripe','2018-02-07','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Pinstripe is an emotionally charged adventure about Hell created entirely by a one-man team over the course of five years. Play as Teddy, an estranged ex-minister forced to venture through the frozen afterlife in search of Bo, his three year old daughter, and her perverse kidnapper. Discover the dark secrets of Teddy\'s past, and confront his sleazy, demonic nemesis, Mr. Pinstripe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wdvojtqymc24siasqjde.jpg'),(5682,'Cosmic Fantasy 4: Van\'s Return','2025-02-13','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5683,'Bleach: Soul Resonance',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','BLEACH: Soul Resonance is a 3D action game that immerses players in thrilling sword-fighting battles. Roleplaying as Ichigo Kurosaki, players will wield their powerful Zanpakuto as they lose themselves in an original storyline while fighting alongside friends and growing stronger. The game features smooth swordplay, diverse battle strategies, and gameplay mechanics like collecting and developing multiple characters and teaming up with others for battles.\nAs BLEACH fans ourselves, we are honored to have the chance to develop a game for the franchise we love. We are committed to expressing our passion and love with this labor of love, and we hope that more people will discover its charm and experience it for themselves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kq3.jpg'),(5684,'NBA Action','1996-06-05','Sport','Sega Saturn','NBA Action comes to the Saturn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52vj.jpg'),(5685,'Your Android','2025-01-10','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your life is changed forever when a mysterious package arrives at your front door. Go on many different outings with your new android companion as you both form unforgettable memories in this beautiful visual novel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9byb.jpg'),(5686,'Domina: Ludus Expansion - Livery',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Is your Ludus full to the brim? No room for horses and chariots and lions amidst these stinky men? Build a Livery! Massive spacious expansion of the ludus includes roomy training area for horses, chariots, and even those dirty gladiators who you don\'t like very much. Space for activities!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5687,'Cryweard',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','\"Project Ergath\" is a single-player action RPG developed by a student, with the focus on tense moments in battles and a feeling of accomplishment in a victory.Enjoy the tense, authentic combat and the sense of accomplishment amplified by the high difficulty level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mo4.jpg'),(5688,'Endless Immortal Journey','2025-03-25','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a casual strategic placement game. In the aerial world set in ancient China, players will play the role of a descendant of the Immortal Cultivation Sect. Travel through the barren continent, obtain various resources, build your sect, and ultimately ascend to the immortal realm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qde.jpg'),(5689,'Rune It Out','2023-05-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Short Description: Rune it Out is a multiplayer PVP game where you and your fellow RuneMages combine runes into spells to blast each other. One wrong incantation and you\'ll blast. Don\'t blow it','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lja.jpg'),(5690,'Xtris','2025-02-25','Arcade','Playdate','XTRIS is an arcade dexterity game for the Playdate console. The goal is to catch as many Xs as possible within 60 seconds by moving around tetronimo-inspired game boards. The game currently features 3 levels, complete with stat tracking, leaderboards, achievements, and unlockable skins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dk4.jpg'),(5691,'Space Cube X',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','A card game with a light meat pigeon and space horror theme. The favorite art style of independent game gamblers is slightly retro, simple, and elegant. Come and have a round!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lox.jpg'),(5692,'NBA 2K16','2015-09-29','Sport','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','The NBA 2K franchise is back with the most true-to-life NBA experience to date with NBA 2K16. Guide your MyPLAYER through the complete NBA journey, take control of an entire NBA franchise, or hone your skills online competing against gamers from around the world. With animations that provide smoother movement and more realistic articulation, it’s certain to be the most authentic NBA gaming experience yet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co257u.jpg'),(5693,'CriticalOrb','2024-03-29','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Defeat continuously incoming monsters with various abilities!CriticalOrb is a 3D top-down shooting game. Choose various abilities to defeat the continuously incoming monsters until the boss appears! You need to become more critical before the boss arrives!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8081.jpg'),(5694,'Galaga 2000',NULL,'Shooter','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ba6.jpg'),(5695,'Fly','2023-12-25','Simulator','Meta Quest 2, visionOS, Meta Quest 3, Oculus Quest','Fly is game for the Meta Quest and Apple Vision pro headsets that uses Google Earth data to let the user explore the world.\n\nEmbark on an extraordinary journey with FLY, and redefine the way you explore our planet. Powered by Google\'s cutting-edge 3D Maps Tiles, this immersive experience lets you soar through the skies and witness the world\'s wonders like never before. From the ground all the way to the edge of space, you can truly Fly for the first time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99zc.jpg'),(5696,'Raining Blood: Hellfire','2023-11-03','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Annihilate countless hordes of enemies while unraveling the mysteries of the demonic invasion in this CoD Zombies-inspired bullet Hell. Kill, upgrade, explore, die, repeat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gdu.jpg'),(5697,'The Last V8','1985-12-01','Racing','Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Amstrad CPC','Seven years have passed since world war III, and only now dare you leave your shelter in order to investigate what has become of the surface world. You drive out in your specially-equipped vehicle, the Last V8, only to discover that the outside world is more hostile than you would have expected. Your task is now (as commended by a digitised voice at the beginning of each level) simply to get back to the base in as short time as possible. \n \nThe Last V8 is an over-head driving game where you must drive through narrow roads without crashing into anything, and with a strict deadline for your arrival at the base. This is somewhat complicated by the fact that you have only a narrow stripe of screen space to see where you\'re driving; two thirds of the screen is dedicated to instruments (speed readout, radiation level and mission objectives). The steering method is not the usual Sprint one; instead you simply pull the joystick in whichever direction you want to go, pulling it in the opposite direction in case you need to decelerate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/txanbjtwniytvgxypyuj.jpg'),(5698,'Train Simulator 2021: Corris Railway Expansion Pack Loco','2017-12-06','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience industrial narrow gauge along the Corris Railway with this expansion pack for Train Simulator 2021, featuring No. 5 \"Alan Meaden\" and No. 9 \"Aberllefenni\".','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5699,'Dr. Plague','2025-04-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a world ravaged by plague, a lone plague doctor embarks on a journey to stop both the disease and a sinister order of knights controlling it. Dr. Plague is a stealth-adventure game that combines puzzle-solving, platforming, and ambient soundtracks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9my3.jpg'),(5700,'The Russian Roulette Game: PR','2024-04-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The classic Russian roulette with friends, With a small twist to bring more chaos and fun to the gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xg1.jpg'),(5701,'Mario Golf: World Tour','2014-05-02','Sport','Nintendo 3DS','Luigi and his Mushroom Kingdom neighbors are teeing up once again in Mario Golf: World Tour. The Nintendo 3DS game includes both simple controls and a deeper experience for golf fans, plus courses that range from traditional to those inspired by the Mushroom Kingdom','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co224o.jpg'),(5702,'Hools: Football Club Territory','2014-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport','Android','All of us can see the power of football fans community in real-world. Every match, every championship, you can see crowds on stadium and millions in front of the TV. This phenomenon is not just about watching some guys playing, it\'s about people, about community around theirs club, theirs team. Why then do not move it into virtual world? To allow an ordinary football fan to be like characters in Green Street Hooligans, but without real violence and hooliganism? We didn\'t see any reason why not, and after few months of work, we can proudly present:','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/oglxtutgi3wenmjxjqt1.jpg'),(5703,'Full Spectrum Warrior: Ten Hammers','2006-03-28','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Sequel to the critically acclaimed, squad-based/real-time tactical combat game, Full Spectrum Warrior: Ten Hammers delivers the most authentic and realistic infantry combat experience ever. As Squad Leader, coordinate the actions of multiple infantry squads, leading them through over 12 levels of intense action. Utilize authentic combat tactics to command your squad as you battle enemies with an explosive arsenal of weapons, high-tech military equipment and new controllable mechanized units. New advanced squad controls give you more in-depth tactical command over your squad as you lead them through a variety of realistic combat missions. With all new multiplayer modes, go online and team up with a friend in two player co-op or go head-to-head with up to eight players through a variety of new adversarial and team-based objective missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co400a.jpg'),(5704,'Qwak','1993-12-31','Platform, Puzzle','BBC Microcomputer System, Amiga CD32, PC (Microsoft Windows), Amiga, Game Boy Advance','In this game, you play a duck and the object of the game is to get the highest score without losing all your lives. This can be achieved by getting all the fruit and gems in the level, or killing off enemies. There are 80 levels to complete and once you complete all of them, the levels are repeated.\n\nYou exit each level by collecting all the gold keys then entering through the door that opens. You have a certain amount of time to complete the level before spikes fall down the level. There are eight areas, all consisting of ten levels. At the end of each area, there is a guardian waiting for you, and again, you have a certain amount of time to defeat them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xiw.jpg'),(5705,'Nippon Marathon 2: Daijoubu','2025-06-30','Racing, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dash, dodge, and dive through the ultimate Japanese gameshow experience! Up to 4 contestants race through chaotic obstacle courses across Japan, filled with hilarious hazards and obscure obstacles. It’s so crazy, you’ll be shouting ‘Konnichi-what?!’ instead of ‘Konnichiwa!’','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96zw.jpg'),(5706,'Bibi & Tina: Mikoschs großer Auftritt','2004-12-31','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Help Bibi and Tina organize an exciting horse show and expose the unscrupulous horse thief! The two friends get a visit from Mikosch, the young horse herdsman from the Puszta. Mikosch is to appear at the castle festival of Count Falko von Falkenstein with his great riding show. But someone is after his horse Baboschko and wants to steal it. The horse-loving user has the task of finding out with the help of Bibi and Tina who wants to kidnap Baboschko and for what reason. In eleven minigames with two different levels of difficulty, the user has to take care of Baboschko, train him for show riding or find Baboschko\'s horse pass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31te.jpg'),(5707,'Hanayaka Nari, Waga Ichizoku Gentou Nostalgie','2015-05-28','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','A compilation release, bringing the Hanayaka Nari, Waga Ichizoku two fandiscs Kinema Mosaic and Tasogare Polar Star to the Vita.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g7n.jpg'),(5708,'Kessen','2000-12-15','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PlayStation 2','The ancient storied battlefield lies before you. At your command are 100,000 troops including archers, infantry, riflemen, and the powerful cavalry. Kessenis a real time strategy game that gives players strategic command and control over huge armies during epic battle sequences from the Warring States period of seventeenth century Japan. Key features include more than 100 movie segments, battlefields with full 3D terrain, separate animation routines for every character, and three different camera views. Known best because it is the very first PlayStation 2 game to ship using the DVD format.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ow7.jpg'),(5709,'Contradiction',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Contradiction is a fully interactive crime drama. Everything you see is live-action video, with real actors in atmospheric locations. You decide where to go, where to investigate, who to speak to and what to ask. As the story unfolds you\'ll meet new people, witness new events and discover new places.\nYou investigate with Inspector Jenks, who has been assigned to the case of a student found murdered in an idyllic English country village.\nYou meet several characters during the game, most of whom you can visit as often as you like. You can ask these characters about any item of evidence or information that you\'ve collected along the way.\nThe aim (and name) of the game is to spot contradictions in what they\'ve said. By consulting your notes and pairing together two contradictory replies, Jenks will interrogate the character and they will be forced to reveal new information, allowing you to progress further through the game.\nReveal all the contradictions to complete the game! Playing with headphones a must for a complete experience.\nContradiction is also available in HD and with added features on Steam for PC and Mac.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5710,'Breach of Contract Reloaded','2018-03-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Breach of Contract Reloaded is the new Online FPS Game you\'ve been wanting! With game modes Team Deathmatch, Free-For-All, Domination, Elimination, Zombie Escape, and 4 maps. Be prepared, it\'s coming.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5711,'Luigi in Sonic the Hedgehog','2020-04-05','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Luigi took a wrong warp and landed straight into Sonic 1!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qjk.jpg'),(5712,'Kindling: The Last Light',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','They smothered the sun and choked the light from our world. One light remains.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5713,'Grapple','1982-12-31','Arcade','Apple II','You must stop the galactic jailbreak. The player controls a small character which can move up and down, while firing horizontally to the right. The screen is divided into 5 rows, and the player can fire high, medium, or low in each row. At the beginning of each level, 5 alien creatures attempt to escape to the left. Each monster must be shot in a specific location, and when they hit they are pushed back to the right. When a monster is pushed off the right of the screen, they are eliminated, but the empty rows can then produce small blue creatures which endanger the player. These creatures are destroyed in one hit. The player loses a life if any monster reaches the left side of the screen. Victory for each level is achieved by clearing the screen. Each level has monsters which take progressively more hits to push back, increasing the difficulty. The player starts with 3 lives, and gains an extra at 30,000 points.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hod.jpg'),(5714,'PDC World Championship Darts 2008','2008-09-26','Sport','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Go head-to-head with the greatest PDC Champions and be part of the year\'s most fierce console Championship with PDC World Championship Darts 2008. Starring even more Champions, the full line up of electrifying tournaments, exceptional graphic enhancements, even more play modes and additional formats.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co727n.jpg'),(5715,'Soul Slayer',NULL,'Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','Sin plataforma','Unlock, equip, upgrade and create your build. Combine different elements for their powerful element reactions slaying thousands of enemies. Are you able to defeat all Soul Lords and the Soul King?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77bz.jpg'),(5716,'Robot Battler','1991-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','A top-down action game with robots.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rdxklschydwoiwby68zk.jpg'),(5717,'Architect of the Union',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A tower defense RTS where you are in the middle of the army instead of just overlooking it. Based in an apocalyptic Soviet Union.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rad.jpg'),(5718,'Miyako: Awayuki no Utage','2012-04-19','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','A fandisc for the original MIYAKO game. Izumi holds a party for the shigoryou and shocks everyone by saying he’s disbanding their group. He also trusts Sangou with the mission of collecting magical shells to become a better shikigami.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kjs.jpg'),(5719,'Touhou Rhythm Carnival! Kurenai','2012-05-27','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Touhou Rhythm Carnival Kurenai is a Rhythm Heaven like game including Touhou characters. It is made by Focus Lens and it mainly focuses on Embodiment of Scarlet Devil characters. This game is also known as Touhou Rhythm Carnival Kurenai','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a35.jpg'),(5720,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s Plus','2023-08-05','Point-and-click, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome back to Freddy Fazbear’s Pizza! Spend your nights with us working as a security guard, looking after the infamous pizza restaurant that brings kids and grown-ups alike their favorite foods and thrills at a discount price!\n\nDuring your shift you’ll get to work up close and personal (but not too close!) with our beloved animatronic entertainers; Freddy Fazbear, Bonnie and Chica! Just keep an eye out on those cameras, make sure our robot friends can safely wander around at night, prevent any damage to company property, and most importantly: DON’T let anything inside your office! (trust us, it’s a long story)\n\nAre you ready to survive a brand new five nights at Freddy’s?\n\n\"Five Nights at Freddy\'s Plus\" is a fan-made remake/reimagining of \"Five Nights at Freddy\'s\" by Scott Cawthon, officially licensed and published under the \"Fazbear Fanverse Initiative\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co615m.jpg'),(5721,'World Piece and Peace','2015-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','World Piece and Peace is a feature-length dark fantasy RPG. Each of the 3 battle systems require a different set of controls and tactics - it\'s up to you to grasp their characteristics and defeat the powerful enemies that stand in your way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gp0.jpg'),(5722,'DodgeSaw','2020-10-30','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','DodgeSaw is a 3D-ish dodgeball bullet hell which rewards you for being risky.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vin.jpg'),(5723,'The Simpsons','2021-11-12','Sin género','Arcade','Redefining family game rooms, game caves, and even home offices, Arcade1Up game cabinets have quickly become absolute must-haves for retro gaming enthusiasts and pop-culture collectors; they play great, look great, and are instant conversation pieces. Exactly how you remember it from the early ‘90s, play as Homer, Marge, Bart, and Lisa, taking on swarms of Springfield’s cast of characters. Four simultaneous players, endless animation inspired fun. Ready to team up for some remote play? The Simpsons home arcade game is equipped with Live WIFI; yes, you can fight your way through each level with the help of fellow retrogamers playing from their own cabinets! Oh, and you want to switch it up a bit? You got it. Also in this cabinet is The Simpsons Bowling! Beautifully bold cabinet artwork (with a matching riser!), stunningly vibrant graphics, this is an arcade cabinet that would make any retrogamer envious. Invite The Simpsons into your home, with this arcade cabinet from Arcade1Up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cl7.jpg'),(5724,'League Manager 2022',NULL,'Simulator, Sport, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Let\'s be the manager of the E-Sports club! Choose your favorite team and recruit your favorite players. Train them and choose a tactic that suits the personality of the team member and opponent. Make your favorite team win and make it the most prestigious club.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4nx5.jpg'),(5725,'Star Wars: Force Arena','2017-01-12','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Android, iOS','In Star Wars™: Force Arena you will lead a powerful team of iconic Star Wars™ characters, including new favorites from Rogue One™: A Star Wars™ Story, into real-time, adrenaline-fueled battles against other players from around the globe! Players must form a powerful squad from a roster of over 80 upgradable characters and units to emerge victorious in the quest for galactic dominance. \n \n● BATTLE or join forces with other players from around the globe in real-time 1v1 or 2v2 PvP arena battles. \n \n● LEAD a team of iconic Star Wars™ characters including Han Solo, Darth Vader, and even new Rogue One™: A Star Wars™ Story characters such as Jyn Erso or Grand Moff Tarkin! \n \n● COLLECT character cards and upgrade your favorites to create the ideal Rebel or Imperial squad while leveraging powerful character duos that boost your effectiveness in battle. \n \n● COMPETE to earn rewards, special characters and bonus items by participating in events as you climb to the top of the leaderboards on your journey for galactic dominance!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rev.jpg'),(5726,'Jewel Quest II','2009-08-24','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Trek through Africa in the return of the Ultimate Gem Matching Adventure. It’s 1944, and Rupert Pack returns. Join him as he hunts his way across the wild African safari, explores the lost Zimbabwe ruins, and surveys the majestic Victoria Falls on one of the worlds richest continents. Skilfully evade the menacing Sebastian Grenard while unearthing precious gems to ultimately escape with the grand jewel board.\n\nGet swept away by the heart pounding soundtrack as you\'re immersed in realistic and authentic African settings. Discover an amazing new element of fun with the Exclusive \"Duelling Jewels\" Tournament Play: Pit your jewel matching skills against others around the world! Play against other players, or be matched with a computer opponent! Embark on a thrilling journey in a story filled with adventure, love, and betrayal that changes with every replay!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/slzs9kf1fcwbseapphdd.jpg'),(5727,'Chaotix Mania',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hxt.jpg'),(5728,'Legend of Ahssûn','2018-12-24','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5729,'Mega Man Y+1: Operation X.M.A.S.','2023-12-08','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mega Man Y+1: Operation X.M.A.S. is a bite-sized Mega Man adventure to save Christmas! Featuring 9 unique stages, you\'ll be taken to all sorts of locales in the hunt for your misplaced belongings. With fortresses made of gingerbread, summery beaches south of the equator, and even Dr. Wily\'s own chimney, there\'s no telling where you\'ll need to go. Don\'t dawdle, though - these levels don\'t pull any punches, and you\'ve got time trial records to beat! Aim for gold!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hiy.jpg'),(5730,'Rogue Samurai','2024-04-18','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rogue Samurai is a roguelike action game where you must battle against waves of enemies. Fight, die, upgrade your skills and fight again until you beat all your enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nz3.jpg'),(5731,'Gerty','2019-12-19','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Gerty is a top-down rogue-lite twin-stick shooter with a fully destructible environment. Carve your own path through replayable procedurally generated levels and create tactically advantageous situations to eliminate the alien threat in intense, tough but fair, action-packed gameplay. Mine Juice crystals to upgrade your gear, discover alien structures, and eliminate the source of the alien threat in singleplayer or local co-op mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27p8.jpg'),(5732,'House of Velez','2017-10-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','House of Velez is a horror game based around stealth/puzzle elements. It emphasizes sneaking, running and hiding mechanics to surpass obstacles rather than combat.   \n   \nThe game features a \"Focus Mode\" that allows you to see your pursuers\' field of vision and hearing radius, while also monitoring your own noise levels.   \n   \nAnother feature is \"Heart Rate Suppression\" that restricts movement, but allows you to become \"invisible\" when used effectively.   \n   \nHouse of Velez draws inspiration from titles like Haunting Ground and even film such as the 1980\'s Hellraiser.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co219u.jpg'),(5733,'La maison perdue de l’oncle Ernest','2016-02-29','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The player has found an album that narrates the life of Uncle Ernest in a mysterious countryside house. He explores its pages to uncover secrets, navigating between them by clicking on bookmarks, all while having the option to keep with him the items he finds useful to solve the puzzles he encounters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s0t.jpg'),(5734,'Maximum Action','2018-09-19','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Maximum Action\" - A brutal and satisfying physics-based first-person shooter influenced by Hong Kong action and other old-school titles','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kow.jpg'),(5735,'Lazerbait','2016-10-13','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lazerbait is a free arcade strategy game set in virtual reality with one simple goal: capture all the planets to build more ships and destroy your enemies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82oc.jpg'),(5736,'Wizardry Xth: Zensen no Gakufu - Academy of Frontier','2005-02-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 2','A spin-off of the Wizardry series, Wizardry Xth: Academy of Frontier is set in a military academy where the students are sent into randomly generated dungeons to train.\n\nThe game uses a team of up to 6 students, with various alignments, from 10 races with 15 professions. The students also have traits that will influence the teams stats and abilities through a compatibility system.\n\nThe game uses a turn-based combat system with a new mechanic that will change the enemies element as time passes. Outside of combat various places of the school can be visited and new items or weapons can be crafted from things found in the dungeon.\n\nThe game was only released in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h3i.jpg'),(5737,'Warcraft III: Reforged','2020-01-28','Real Time Strategy (RTS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Warcraft III: Reforged is a stunning reimagining of the revolutionary real-time strategy game that laid the foundation for Azeroth\'s most epic stories. It is a remake in the truest sense, featuring a thorough visual overhaul, a suite of contemporary social and matchmaking features, and more. Command the Night Elves, Undead, Orcs, and Humans as alliances shift and armies clash in this timeless real-time strategy game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rrv.jpg'),(5738,'Liberty or Death','1993-12-31','Strategy','PC-9800 Series, Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, DOS','The European Wars against Spain and France have been costly to the British Empire. In order to gain additional funds for the war effort, the Crown raise taxes from the New World colonies without representation. This act compels the New World colonies to protest and boycott against British rule. By 1775, the Crown alarmed by the protests, boycotts and politically instability in the New World sends troops to subdue any rebellious efforts by the New World colonists. This threatening approach provokes the Thirteen Colonies to revolt. Thus starts the War for Independence in the New World (American Revolutionary War).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wfl.jpg'),(5739,'Lemon: Kageetei Nostalgia',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','The game begins when the main character, Ryuichiro, visits Kageitei, and first interacts with the heroines who work as female salaries. When the interaction at the cafe is over, select the night opponent from the heroines in the cafe and select the play from there. The content of the play is hinted at by the lines of the heroines. The types of play increase depending on the degree of interaction with the heroines, and even in the same play, the scenario development differs depending on the number of times.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48pl.jpg'),(5740,'Roboctletes','2023-11-20','Sport','Playdate','A futuristic robot track and field game for playdate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7981.jpg'),(5741,'Onaji','2011-12-13','Puzzle, Strategy','iOS','Welcome to the world of Onaji: a fun puzzle game that combines color-matching and pachinko with strategy. This versatile game is ideal no matter what your skill level. So easy to play that anyone can do it; yet challenging enough to twist the thumbs of the experienced gamer.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5742,'Shining Song Starnova: Limited Edition',NULL,'Simulator, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cpx.jpg'),(5743,'Nobunaga’s Ambition: Rebirth - Treasure Box Limited Edition',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','This edition includes the following:\n- Game: Nobunaga’s Ambition: Rebirth\n- Kou Shibusawa Secret Strategy Data & Officers Art Book\n- Daily Pad Calendar\n- Two-disc Original Soundtrack\n- Exclusive Scenario DLC','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5744,'Headhunters: Bang Bang','2024-11-27','Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Modern Gun Fight Strike Games','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93f9.jpg'),(5745,'Poker Mega Pack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5746,'Rika Suzuki',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5747,'Lightvayne: Adventure on Volcanus Island',NULL,'Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9417.jpg'),(5748,'Your Only Move is Hustle','2023-02-03','Fighting, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your Only Move Is Hustle is an online, turn-based fighting game and superpowered fight scene simulator. Using a unique and accessible control scheme, harness the power of precognition to land the perfect blow. Master your technique, execute flashy combos, and outsmart opponents across the world, frame-by-frame.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ftc.jpg'),(5749,'Assassin\'s Creed Origins','2017-10-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','For the last four years, the team behind Assassin’s Creed IV Black Flag has been crafting a new beginning for the Assassin’s Creed franchise.\n\nSet in Ancient Egypt, players will journey to the most mysterious place in history, during a crucial period that will shape the world and give rise to the Assassin’s Brotherhood. Plunged into a living, systemic and majestic open world, players are going to discover vibrant ecosystems, made of diverse and exotic landscapes that will provide them with infinite opportunities of pure exploration, adventures and challenges.\n\nPowered by a new fight philosophy, Assassin\'s Creed Origins embraces a brand new RPG direction where players level up, loot, and choose abilities to shape and customize their very own skilled Assassin as they grow in power and expertise while exploring the entire country of Ancient Egypt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rbe.jpg'),(5750,'Trainz Plus','2022-05-30','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Drive, Explore, Operate and Create the railroad of your dreams - and now collaborate in real time with Multiplayer Surveyor! And with Trainz Plus memberships, you get more content, more features and the latest Trainz has to offer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nn1.jpg'),(5751,'Minecraft: World of Color Update','2017-06-07','Simulator, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Minecraft: World of Color Update is a major update for Minecraft, which added new and changed colored blocks to be more vibrant. It also added the Parrot, the recipe book and the knowledge book, new commands, and other additions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jeq.jpg'),(5752,'Tetrisphere','1998-02-01','Puzzle','Nintendo 64','Tetrisphere is a variant on Tetris in which various shapes are shifted across a wrapped three-dimensional grid resembling a sphere, and then destroyed. The objective of the game changes depending on the mode, but generally consists of removing layers of shapes to reach the playing field\'s core. Despite very little domestic advertising, Tetrisphere enjoyed moderately good sales and a mostly favorable critical reception. Reviewers praised the game\'s originality and the musical score composed by Neil D. Voss.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bag.jpg'),(5753,'Skater Girl - Makeup & Dressup',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5754,'La-Mulana','2020-03-17','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','La-Mulana is the “Ruins Exploration Archaeological action game” in which the player seek the “Anthropo-origin”, sleeps in the Huge Ruin La-Mulana, which is said the beginning of whole the civilizations.\nVarious types of traps for blocking infiltrators are awaiting inside the ruins, and sentinel-monsters are roaming about. Target the deepest point of the ruins by figuring out riddles, putting off the monsters and deactivating the traps. The way to the goal will be extraordinary, more complex riddles will be waiting for you as you come deeper point.\nHandle Professor Lemeza to find out the Anthropo-origin!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hd2.jpg'),(5755,'Gyrodisc Super League','2016-03-04','Sport, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A bright, colourful arcade sports game for up to 4 players. Compete in a lightning-fast futuristic sport that’s a blend of air hockey, tennis and volleyball. The rules may be simple, but victory is seized through quick reactions and devious mind games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bcbjiqxm7dfq1o5x0ftk.jpg'),(5756,'Hoshi no Kakera no Monogatari. Shikake-ban','2022-11-30','Adventure','PlayStation 4','Help a stranded girl escape with just your eyes in this puzzle game designed specifically for VR. From the stationary convergence point between the two worlds, use the \"Focus Lock\" to tell her the steps she has to take in order to put the star back together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w3o.jpg'),(5757,'High Heat Baseball 2000','1999-03-31','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','High Heat Major League Baseball was a series of baseball computer games, released on PlayStation, Xbox, PlayStation 2 and PC. There were six annual versions of the game released, started with High Heat Baseball 1999, and ending with High Heat Major League Baseball 2004.\n\nThe game, featuring the official licensed team and player names from all 30 MLB teams, was created by games company 3DO which subsequently filed for bankruptcy in 2003 soon after the release of the final version of the series, High Heat Major League Baseball 2004. In August 2003, Microsoft purchased the rights to the High Heat franchise from 3DO, however, Microsoft has yet to develop a new title in the series.\n\nHigh Heat was traditionally known for possessing more simulation-style qualities than competitors World Series Baseball, All Star Baseball, or Triple Play Baseball, but frequently lagged behind in graphical quality. At the core of High Heat′s gameplay was its batter-pitcher interface, which was often hailed as the most realistic of its era.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8iw5.jpg'),(5758,'Tank Battle: East Front 1943','2014-04-24','Simulator, Strategy','iOS','Tank Battle: East Front 1943 is the third in the successful \'Tank Battle: East Front\' series, a game of tactical combat on the Russian Front during 1943. Fight as the Germans or the Soviets in a series of ever more complex missions.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5759,'Sherman M4','1989-11-01','Simulator, Strategy','Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','Sherman M4 is a combat tank simulation set in the World War II.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1iln.jpg'),(5760,'Toca Blocks',NULL,'Sin género','Android, iOS','With Toca Blocks, kids can construct worlds and fill them with adventurous paths. They can craft detailed obstacle courses, intricate race tracks or floating islands and meet the characters to discover each one’s unique abilities!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zsi.jpg'),(5761,'Death Carnival',NULL,'Shooter, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Death Carnival, the fast-paced top-down parkour shooter. Insane assortment of weapons & characters, and a controller-smashing experience that will leave you hungry for more. Play story campaign solo, co-op with friends, or destroy everyone in PvP. Cross-platform and packed with spectator and party modes so the fun never ends. Choose from over a dozen characters each with unique attacks and story campaigns.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ko5.jpg'),(5762,'Project M','2011-02-07','Fighting','Wii','Project M is a community-made mod of Brawl inspired by Super Smash Bros. Melee\'s gameplay designed to add rich, technical gameplay to a balanced cast of characters while additionally enhancing the speed of play. Project M employs new codes which seamlessly add in new, universal features to the entire cast to add technical variety to all characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z39.jpg'),(5763,'Kekcroc Forever','2023-01-12','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kekcroc Forever is a MegaDrive-style game based on a fictional character Kekcroc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d19.jpg'),(5764,'Shitty Cactus','2020-02-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help the grumpy cactus reach the stars! Find your way all the way up! Upgrade your way up until you reach the best view of the night sky.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lzs.jpg'),(5765,'La La Land','2006-12-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','La La Land is the first game in the La La Land series, a pentalogy of short experimental videogames by Matt \"theanemic\" Aldridge which share a recurring cast, sardonic, subliminal, and fable-like storytelling, and a haunting atmosphere.\n\nIn the first installment, the main character Biggt wanders around a distorted world collecting lightning bolts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55fo.jpg'),(5766,'Gears of War 2: Limited Edition','2008-12-07','Shooter','Xbox 360','In Gears of War 2, the COG continues its fight against the Locust horde, who are attempting to sink all of the cities on the planet Sera. Sergeant Marcus Fenix leads Delta Squad into the depths of the planet to try to stop the Locust during the assault upon Locust territory. The player controls Fenix in the main mission campaign, with the ability to play cooperatively with a second player controlling Fenix\'s best friend and fellow Squad member Dominic \"Dom\" Santiago. The game includes several existing and new multiplayer modes including five-on-five battles between human and Locust forces, and a \"Horde\" mode that challenges up to five players against waves of Locust forces with ever-increasing strength. New weapons and gameplay mechanics such as \"chainsaw duels\" and the ability to use downed foes as \"meatshields\" were added to the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ey5.jpg'),(5767,'Kuroi Tsubasa','2022-04-04','Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Meet Kureha Kurono and her friends in this charming visual novel! With the help of the devil Blackwing-chan they\'ll be able to defeat the evil shadow, right? What was that? It was Blackwing himself who caused this mess? Oh dear, oh dear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5in2.jpg'),(5768,'Toy Wars','2017-05-24','Simulator, Strategy','Android, iOS','Build your toy army and rule the battlefield using your strategy skills.\nA brand-new version of Toy Wars is now available: deploy defensive structures, protect your home base from enemy invasions!\nPlay like a kid, fight like a man in a war without limits! Based on the toy army of your childhood, you must defend your flag against the enemy and attack using a powerful combination of tactics to win the miniature war between your green army and the evil toys! Lead an army of green soldiers, remote-control planes, robots, and many other toys in various epic battles! Defend yourself against the invasion and put your strategy to the test. Using your best survival tactics is the only chance to win.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x3t.jpg'),(5769,'Hellboy: Asylum Seeker','2003-05-01','Sin género','PlayStation','Hellboy: Asylum Seeker is a third-person adventure game in which you play as Hellboy- Mike Mignola\'s comic-book hero and paranormal investigator.\n\nThe game takes place in 1960\'s Prague, during Hellboy\'s early work with the BPRD (British Paranormal Research Division). Hellboy and Sara are investigating their missing agent Peter, who lost contact with his team somewhere in Czechoslovakia. It\'s up to Hellboy to uncover the events surrounding that disappearance, and set things right.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kvv.jpg'),(5770,'Trash Punk: Extended Edition','2024-04-26','Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5771,'Egg Time','2016-09-19','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Meta Quest 3','The game revolves around simple mechanics and physics.\nCatching eggs, defusing bombs, using “egg time” a variation of bullet time to catch even the most hard to catch eggs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82o2.jpg'),(5772,'iBridgeFun',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5773,'Shadow of the Wool Ball','2016-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shadow of the Wool Ball is a 2016 total conversion for the ZDoom engine. Made by MSPaintR0cks, this is a unique shooter in which the player is a hedgehog fighting an army of cats. It is spread across three episodes, each having six levels. The mapping style is more akin to Wolfenstein 3D than classic Doom.\n\nThe playful art style, creative gameplay mechanics, and humorous plot were well-received, including a runner-up at the Cacowards 2016. A sequel, Rise of the Wool Ball, was released by MSPaintR0cks the following year.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4m3u.jpg'),(5774,'Fallout: The Frontier','2021-01-15','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fallout: The Frontier is a gigantic DLC/New Game. As the “Courier” you start a new adventure centered around a conflict between the NCR and the Legion in the snow blasted remains of Portland Oregon. Featuring 3 major questlines, 60+ side quests, hundreds of new armours, weapons and items, and tens of thousands of lines of new voiced dialogue!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ohf.jpg'),(5775,'Happy Birthday, Maisy!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5776,'CRSED: F.O.A.D. - Dieselpunk','2022-10-06','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A new champion joins the game — the jack-of-all-trades Friedrich Diesel. His passion for engineering and everything connected with it has been fanatical since childhood, preferring machinery construction to communicating with people.\n\nDiesel managed to learn the “Weird Science” ability and can create different mechanisms: a buggy, a helicopter, a spy camera, a protective wall. No laws of physics, and certainly not morality, can stop the genius of engineering on his way to victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pbk.jpg'),(5777,'Steamboat Rescue','2024-11-24','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Take control of a steamboat and rescue animals drowning in the river!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92t5.jpg'),(5778,'Shot in the Dark','2021-01-12','Point-and-click, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Armed with nothing but a six gun the lone bandit will need a quick hand and a sharp eye to fend off the nightmares lurking in the dark.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ok1.jpg'),(5779,'Get Packed: Couch Chaos','2022-04-28','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Get Packed: Couch Chaos is the expanded edition of the couch co-op removals game that’s full of calamity and physics-based carnage for 1-4 players, and it’s now on Nintendo Switch!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4o52.jpg'),(5780,'Ideology in Friction: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c76.jpg'),(5781,'Sled Riders','2024-05-23','Racing','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Discover incredible winter sled races on exciting tracks against other racers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87dq.jpg'),(5782,'Aquamarine Submarine','2015-10-20','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','How quick are your reflexes? Are you ready to explore the depths of the sea with all its dangers and adventures? Then Greyheadstudio’s latest aquamarine is your best bet!\nIn aquamarine you’re the helmsman of a little yellow submarine, trapped deep down in the ocean. You have been tasked with examining the undiscovered parts of the sea and the only way through is in the darkest and most threatening waters. On your journey you will encounter dangerous sea creatures who will try to attack your submarine during your expedition. Beware of Larry the shark, Kraken the octopus, Sammy the jellyfish , Bob the bigfish and many other aquatic predators. Yet your deadliest enemy of all is the giant iceberg located under the water, once you touch it , your travel is over and you have to start your tour all over again. Your goal throughout the game is to travel deep into the waters as far as you can without touching the rocks and encountering the sea’s hooligans.\nSo how quick are your reflexes ? Ready to get frustrated and let aquamarine play around with your nerves and patience? Don’t be a wuss and see how long you can last in the dangerous world of aquamarine!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxv.jpg'),(5783,'You Died but a Necromancer Revived You','2019-04-19','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','You Died ... but a Necromancer revived you! Reaching the top is no easy feat: The pathways are narrow, full of traps and on top of that, the floor will start exploding behind you if you take too long!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26au.jpg'),(5784,'Jimmy Connors Pro Tennis Tour','1993-10-29','Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','The 1992 Super Nintendo port of the DOS/Amiga/Atari ST release.\n\nJimmy Connors, ranked Number 1 for 159 weeks, holder of EIGHT Grand Slam titles and a record 109 single titles - more than any other male player in history - is the GREATEST tennis champion ever! Now YOU’RE Jimmy Connors, battling your way to the Number 1 spot. Past sixteen professional opponents. On center court of the most prestigious tournaments on the world circuit.\n\nPut a topspin on your serve and smash it past your opponent. Ace! Learn the strengths and weaknesses of each player as you climb the ranks to the top.\n\nWork with five professional coaches to hone your shots-lob, volley, forehand, backhand, net and serve. Play one or two player against one, two or three computer opponents. Realistic graphics and awesome sound. This is professional tennis at its very best!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c6l.jpg'),(5785,'Groove Adventure Rave','2002-01-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation','Released only in Japan, Groove Adventure Rave is the first action RPG game based on the Rave Master manga series written and illustrated by Hiro Mashima.\n\nThis action RPG includes a original story with a new character created by the original author Mashima-sensei, featuring the RPD system where your companions trust changes based on the aciton you make.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kq2.jpg'),(5786,'Detective Grimoire','2007-07-05','Adventure','Web browser','At 10:28 last night, a body was found at the local Fairground that operates just outside of town. The cleaner, one Jerry Spears, discovered the dead body of his former colleague, Hugh Everton, inside the Hall of Mirrors.\n\nAll the evidence points towards murder. The clown, Charles Ringer, who works at the very same fairground, is the main suspect. He seems to have some less than favourable links with the victim.\n\nIf this grim case remains unsolved, the Fairground Manager, Mr Gary Coils has stated he will have to \"permanently shut down operations.\"\n\nPrivate Detective Grimoire has been called in to clear things up. We\'ve got one evening to find the truth about what happened last night. If Grimoire can\'t solve this mystery, no one can.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5c1a.jpg'),(5787,'Game Of Thrall\'an','2024-10-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Game of Thrall\'an is an action RPG where players take on the role of a character named Thrall\'an, embarking on a journey to the icy land of Alterrac, filled with enemies, to destroy the Ice Lord, Lookholar.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co906g.jpg'),(5788,'MotoGP 13','2013-06-21','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360','2013 Riders, teams and tracks; both simulation and accessible bike handling with scalable aids; photorealistic graphics with TV style interface; ingame voice over by official MotoGP commentators; first person elements such as the helmet view and 3D pits to put you in the rider’s shoes. This is MotoGP13, the official MotoGP videogame: try Career Mode, rising from a Moto3 wildcard to the MotoGP World Champion, or challenge your friends in Split Screen or Online Championship.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fyb.jpg'),(5789,'Intelligence Operation',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Intelligence Operation is a War GameAs an Intelligence Operation, as an elite soldier in a highly trained special operations unit, your unique skills in the art of tracking, target detection, surveillance and firing accuracy will bring mission success.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43mx.jpg'),(5790,'Kargast','2023-05-16','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Kargast is a dark narrative exploration game with light RPG elements, branching endings, and a semi-satirical view of narrative RPGs. It tells the story of an unwell child on the brink of death, and his adventures through his surreal, cryptic surroundings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wvl.jpg'),(5791,'Moero Chronicle: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c6g.jpg'),(5792,'A Minecraft Movie','2025-03-30','Sin género','Web browser','A promotional game by McDonald\'s made as a part of their campaign for A Minecraft Movie.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mo9.jpg'),(5793,'Foreveracers','2018-03-29','Racing, Sport, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The bouncy wobbly arcade online multiplayer driving game. Jump in to the action with no fuss. Race, roam, roll, crash, and challenge as you drive around the game world day and night. Cut corners, find shortcuts and avoid other players while trying to set the best lap times or win the challenges.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5794,'The Second Circle',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Second Circle is a skill-based fast paced movement game. With a unique mix of fast movement mechanics, deadly weapons and powerful abilities all blending together in lethal dance, it is your skill that will prove whether you are worthy to pass the trial or be stuck in the circle of desire!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lcm.jpg'),(5795,'Kick Bastards','2024-01-05','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kick Bastards is a fast paced parkour game with a deep movement system! Kick your way through beautiful and varied levels where you must find your own route to overcome challenges and get a sick time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co746b.jpg'),(5796,'Elemental War','2019-07-19','Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','The next level of tower defense games: Use the elements to build a powerful bastion against deadly monsters from all known and unknown dimensions. Three challenging game modes, community features and much indie love make Elemental War an outstanding game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q1f.jpg'),(5797,'War Robots: Frontiers - Lancelot Rising','2025-02-25','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Push beyond your limits with new battle supplies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9irt.jpg'),(5798,'Final Round Tennis',NULL,'Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD, Game Boy Advance','A tennis game with somewhat realistic graphics; different to the \"Wii clone\" Tennis game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5799,'Borgo the Cat','2018-02-07','Platform, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as Borgo, a rather *ROUND* cat! You can roll, jump, and turn your trusty camera to change your perspective of the world around you.\n\nWith five levels *plus a bonus one* this will only take around 5-10 minutes to complete, so if you don\'t have a lot of time this is perfect! Please, if there are any problems you are having, feel free to tell me.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e0u.jpg'),(5800,'Tiny Dangerous Dungeons','2019-03-01','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Hop into a classic Game Boy inspired metroidvania adventure! Explore a huge and open dungeon, collect hidden power-ups and gain new skills to aid you on your quest! Can you survive the Tiny Dangerous Dungeons and find the presumably huge treasure?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2c3i.jpg'),(5801,'Anarchy Arcade','2014-09-03','Shooter, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Turn your entire digital life into a game. AArcade is a 3D desktop that launches shortcuts to absolutely anything you like. Join the anarchy of the persistent online metaverse, or remain in your own private reality. Casual in-game building features, plus hundreds of thousands of addons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uvd.jpg'),(5802,'The Darkside Detective: A Fumble in the Dark','2021-04-15','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Delouse your room with sage and pack up your travel-sized ouija board, it\'s time to re-enter Twin Lakes - America\'s 34th most haunted city. Join Detective McQueen as he puzzles his way through 6 chilling cases, risking life and pixelated limb to solve the macabre mysteries that plague the poor town.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u5k.jpg'),(5803,'Talents','2025-12-31','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Write your way to success with your talented yet rowdy co-founders in this game development-themed romance visual novel! Do you have what it takes?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wrv.jpg'),(5804,'Battle for Esturia','2021-03-20','Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A turn-based strategy RPG featuring an open world filled with monsters, dungeons, and interesting characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lzv.jpg'),(5805,'Super Smash Bros. Sonic','2020-05-14','Fighting','Nintendo 64','Super Smash Bros. Sonic Mod is a mod that changes Super Smash Bros. to feature Sonic the Hedgehog stages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cax.jpg'),(5806,'Disney\'s The Little Mermaid: Magic in Two Kingdoms','2006-10-03','Platform, Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Disney\'s The Little Mermaid: Magic in Two Kingdoms invites kids to experience their favorite moments, both under the sea and on land, from Disney’s classic film. The game offers eight new games with Ariel and other memorable characters like Flounder, Sebastian, Eric, Ursula, King Triton, and even Ursula. Players have fun playing music with Sebastian, racing with Flotsom and Jetsam, illuminating Ariel and Eric as they boat on a lake and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vxr.jpg'),(5807,'Ultimate ADOM: Caverns of Chaos - Save the World Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c6e.jpg'),(5808,'JoJo\'s Bizarre Adventure: Eyes of Heaven','2015-12-17','Fighting, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4','JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure: Eyes of Heaven is an upcoming Japanese fighting game based on the long-running JoJo\'s Bizarre Adventure manga franchise. Eyes of Heaven is designed to be a 3D action brawler with tag-team elements set in large arenas based on locations in the manga. Players may pick a single character to control in a large environment, as well as a second character that may be controlled by either a CPU or second human player to fight the enemy team for a 2v2 battle. Like in All-Star Battle characters are categorized by fighting styles, which currently includes Hamon, Ogre Street Techniques, Vampiric, German Science, Mode, Stand and Mounted.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55p6.jpg'),(5809,'Danmaku Juuenka: Danmaku Card Battle','2022-09-03','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Web browser','Players place \"characters\" from their own \"deck\" on a 6x6 \"map.\"\nThe player \"moves\" his or her character across the field, shooting barrages of bullets with \"spell cards\" and avoiding barrages of enemy characters with \"graze\".\nEven if your character is destroyed, you can \"replenish\" your deck of cards to regroup and fight until the enemy\'s \"remaining\" units are reduced to zero in this thrilling strategic duel game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56np.jpg'),(5810,'Tomba! Special Edition','2024-08-01','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Our favourite pink-haired, high-jumping jungle boy is back!\n\nLimited Run Games are working with creator Tokuro Fujiwara to bring the beloved platformer Tomba to modern consoles via the Carbon Engine, with a new soundtrack by the legendary FUJITA HARUMI.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92no.jpg'),(5811,'Dark Quest 1 & 2',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cp8.jpg'),(5812,'Meet the Robinsons','2007-03-27','Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The game follows Wilbur through 40 missions and 6 different locales, a few of which are revisited in the movie. Secret Blueprints allow the player to \"build\" different Cheats and Extras, using Cornelius Robinson\'s Transmogrifier. This machine creates items using Base Components which Wilbur collects during his adventure. A Breakout like game called Chargeball is both featured in the game itself and as an extra gameplay option. Different Chargeball \"maps\" can be found throughout game and it is up to Wilbur to become the Chargeball champion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cwo.jpg'),(5813,'Eggconsole Xak II PC-8801mkIISR','2024-11-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Nintendo Switch','This game not only enhances the visual beauty but also improves the action elements. Embark on an adventure in the world of Xak as the brave warrior Latok!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co942h.jpg'),(5814,'My City: Newborn Baby',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5815,'Jubilee','2021-11-18','Platform, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Challenging precision platformer based on tight, fluid movement. Open map layout with multiple routes. Collect gems and save animals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47oz.jpg'),(5816,'The Amazing Crackpots Club!','2024-06-08','Fighting, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Amazing Crackpots Club! is a fast-paced, action-packed magic duel in a 2D arena, where wizards throw powerful spells trying to destroy the opponent’s pots, while using mobility and defensive abilities to protect their own pots from incoming attacks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r4b.jpg'),(5817,'The Bus','2021-03-25','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Bus is the next generation of city bus driving simulation. Sell tickets and transport passengers with various buses on different lines across the German capital Berlin on a realistic scale of 1:1.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xp8.jpg'),(5818,'Battle Vision Network','2025-12-31','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Battle Vision Network is an online PvP Puzzle-Battler fusing cozy color-matching puzzle gameplay with deep turn-based tactics. Teams from across the galaxy vye for the ultimate championship title in fast n’ fierce puzzle battles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8biz.jpg'),(5819,'Blind Quest: The Ivy Queen','2024-06-11','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blind Quest - The Ivy Queen is a stand-alone adventure adventure with 86 new maps in 5 different scenarios to explore and interact with! Escape from the Tyrannical Ivy Queen prisons. An adventure audiogame for real adventurers! Explore and fight in the magical world of Blind Quest 3!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g5m.jpg'),(5820,'Blood & Gold: Caribbean! - The Zombiest Adventures',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cbo.jpg'),(5821,'The Red Room',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','The Red Room. A man named \"Alex\" is working in a secret government power plant. Everyone has been chipped in the brain. But one malfunction, causes all to go downhill. Being chased by security he runs into the one open door he can. It slams behind, this is the Entry to The Red Room.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l5v.jpg'),(5822,'Neko Sagashi','2022-10-06','Sin género','Android','A cat playing in the park...\nA kotatsu, a mandarin orange, and a cat...\nThe cat is always by my side, nya.\n\nBut as time passes, the \"cat\" runs away, nya...!\nBefore that, you can save all the \"cats\"\nCan you find me?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u2j.jpg'),(5823,'Infinite Minigolf','2017-07-25','Simulator, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Explore thousands of holes created by the community, set new world records, participate in multiplayer competitions, customize your character with unlockable clothes and accessories or create your own courses – the possibilities are endless in Infinite Mini Golf.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29cj.jpg'),(5824,'Croakoloco','2024-05-06','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Croakoloco is a frog collecting idle game. Watch them jump, croak, and eat delicious flies. Grow frogs, feed frogs, or take control of one in “Froggy Mode” for a more active play style!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8am8.jpg'),(5825,'Empire Architect','2017-05-26','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Architect Empire is a ancient city-building real time strategy game, with elements from grand strategies sprinkled in for good measure. The levels are procedurally generated, and you have limited control over your subjects','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b1j.jpg'),(5826,'PaRappa the Rapper: Stage 1 Music D',NULL,'Music','PlayStation Portable','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94mz.jpg'),(5827,'911 Operator Bundle','2018-10-26','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5828,'Choro Q HG 3','2002-12-01','Racing, Adventure','PlayStation 2','Choro-Q HG 3 (Japanese: チョロQ HG 3) (also known as Gadget Racers in Europe) is a role-playing, racing game for the PS2. It is the sequel to Choro-Q HG 2. It was also slated to be published in North America by Conspiracy Entertainment under the title Road Trip Adventure Avenue but it was cancelled for unknown reasons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mjz.jpg'),(5829,'Fresh Tracks',NULL,'Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Jump, dodge, and fight to the rhythm of the gods in this thrilling music action game on skis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jkn.jpg'),(5830,'Xuan-Yuan Sword VII: Limited Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','This edition includes the following:\n\n- Xuan-Yuan Sword VII\n- Special Collector Box\n- Steelbook\n- Original Soundtrack\n- Visual Book','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5831,'Lawnarchy','2022-03-29','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A card game for gardening lunatics: manicure your lawn, trim your hedges – and steam roll over your neighbors\' flowers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ife.jpg'),(5832,'The Bard\'s Tale IV: Director\'s Cut - Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c9t.jpg'),(5833,'Pulpcraft DX','2022-12-12','Adventure','Playdate','Pulpcraft DX is a 1D Minecraft clone for the Playdate Handheld','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5834,'Cribbage Quest','2009-08-21','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5835,'BlazBlue: Central Fiction','2016-10-06','Fighting, Arcade','Arcade, PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','BlazBlue: Central Fiction is a 2D fighting game developed by Arc System Works. It is the fourth game to the BlazBlue series, and is set after the events of BlazBlue: Chrono Phantasma. The game adds Naoto Kurogane and Hibiki Kohaku as playable characters. BlazBlue: Central Fiction marks the conclusion of the story surrounding protagonist Ragna the Bloodedge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co232h.jpg'),(5836,'Doomblade','2023-05-31','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deep underground, Gloom Girl discovers Doomblade, a sentient weapon hellbent on escape after eons in chains. Together, “Doom and Gloom” embark on a brutal quest to unlock the powers of The Void and destroy the Dread Lords once and for all in this 2D Action Metroidvania.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jkq.jpg'),(5837,'Operation Apex','2017-11-28','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A virtual reality underwater adventure for the Vive in which you, a citizen scientist, take control of a research rig in order to learn about the current state of the oceans. As you begin to learn how to study the seas you are witness to one of the largest great white sharks ever seen. Moments later, your mission is clear - travel through the kelp, down the continental shelf and out in the open ocean to find and scan the mysterious shark.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mgyvasfrk7krebtnp2jp.jpg'),(5838,'Moonstone Island: Cozy Comforts DLC Pack','2024-06-19','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5839,'Blood Bowl 3: Black Orcs Edition','2023-02-23','Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Fashion is not exactly a priority for Black Orcs… but intimidation, on the other hand, now we\'re talking! Demand respect with the Black Orcs Edition. It includes customization Items for a Goblin, Troll and Black Orc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60er.jpg'),(5840,'Blank Dream','2015-08-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blank Dream is a freeware horror-exploration game by Kanawo (of Teriyaki Tomato) made in RPG Maker VX Ace.\n\nWishing that she had never even existed, Mishiro Usui threw herself into the lake.\nWhen she came to, she was in the Mirror World, a place neither heaven nor hell.\nThere, her reflection instructed her: \"Find the mirrors in this world, and break them.\"\n\nWARNING: This game features many dark themes, with a particular focus on suicide.\nIt is recommended you not play this game if you feel the subject matter may be too much.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k27.jpg'),(5841,'Peekaboo','2025-03-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A terrifying first-person escape, where every step could be your last. Find your way out of a dilapidated, crooked house by discovering the secret passageways of the house. While outrunning a sightless, twisted puppet from hell, which will hunt down every noise it hears!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lnm.jpg'),(5842,'8/8/88 Needle AL','2022-05-22','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','8/8/88 Needle AL is a realistic visual novel style game that is made from actual 360 degree photographs. You must read through clues to piece together the overall story. The game is dark and very atmospheric.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cwp.jpg'),(5843,'Clumsy Shumsy','2006-10-27','Sin género','PlayStation 2','Help the Shumsy, a peaceful people living on an inhospitable planet, drive away some invaders to the continuous search for lands to conquer * 8 completely different games that can put a strain on the reflexes of the most experienced players: Lost Shumsies, Delicious Fireworks, Air Traffic Controller, Know Your Colors, Big Journey, Clumsy Tennis, Clumsy Soup, Clumsy Parachutes * Each game is based on the special skills of the Shumsy: in Delicious Fireworks it is necessary to let the Shumsy eat their favorite food - fireworks - in a particular order, in Know Your Colors the mumps skills of the Shumpsy are put to the test trying to jump on the same color platforms, etc ...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ruez3idi3tpajddmnjs1.jpg'),(5844,'Does Canned Rice Dream of a Napkin Heap?','2015-02-21','Indie','Web browser','Two aliens, a robot, and a canine cosmonaut walk into a spaceport bar. Now you have to get them to pay for your drinks by sharing a tall tale of galactic intrigue to keep them entertained.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5845,'Kaiju-ou Godzilla','1993-12-17','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Game Boy','An action game in which Godzilla must continue moving right, crushing opposing military forces until reaching bosses consisting of various monsters from the Godzilla universe. It was a Japan-only, Game Boy release.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6an2.jpg'),(5846,'Megadimension Neptunia VIIR: DLC Pack',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tbl.jpg'),(5847,'Golf Daisuki! O.B. Club','1997-04-27','Simulator, Sport','Satellaview','Golf Daisuki! O.B. Club is a view-limited Downloadable golfing game for the Satellaview initially running between August 10, 1997 and August 23, 1997. The game was rebroadcast for at least 4 runs ending in March 30, 1998.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v4a.jpg'),(5848,'Flying Soul','2019-01-15','Racing, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fun and challenging flying game as you\'ve never seen before! This is not another flying game. With a proposal never seen before, you will be challenged to do fantastic moves to achieve your goals. To win you and your Spaceship will have to be only one soul!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5849,'Bright Memory','2020-03-25','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bright Memory is a lightning-fast fusion of the FPS and action genres, created by one-man development studio FYQD using Unreal Engine. Combine a wide variety of skills and abilities to unleash dazzling combo attacks. SRO (Supernatural Science Research Organization) agent Shelia\'s adventure is about to begin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26z5.jpg'),(5850,'Hammerin\' Harry','1991-03-31','Platform','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','Hammerin\' Harry, known in Japan as Daiku no Gen-san (大工の源さん?), is a platforming video game developed and published by Irem in 1990. The game is centered around the titular Harry (or \"Genzo Tamura\" in the original Japanese), a hammer-wielding carpenter who protects his hometown of Beranme from the corrupt construction companies that mean to tear it down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31fj.jpg'),(5851,'Immortality','2024-01-23','Point-and-click, Simulator, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac','Marissa Marcel was a film star. She made three movies. But none of the movies was ever released. And Marissa Marcel disappeared. The new game from Sam Barlow, creator of Her Story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55cl.jpg'),(5852,'Directly Drink Milk from Cow','2022-03-31','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The main character comes to work part-time at a ranch and takes care of 16 Holstein cows and their calves. He has to chase the cows with his dog, milk the cows, feed them, and carry the milk in buckets slowly without spilling. You can also take a car to explore and talk to the villagers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wv8.jpg'),(5853,'Malevolence: The Sword of Ahkranox','2014-04-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter the world of Ahkranox - the first ever genuinely infinite first person roguelike. Become the incarnate form of a magical, sentient Sword, protecting a realm of dreams from the shadows of its own tormented soul, and stand as an eternal guardian against the infinite darkness that threatens to consume all.\n\nIn development since 2010 and meticulously inspired by the classic RPG experiences of the early 90s, this turn-based roguelike drops you into the infinite realm of Ahkranox, a dream-world in the mind of a sentient sword. The world is infinite, the loot is infinite, the quests are infinite and the possibilities are infinite. Relive the classic adventure experience of the past in this modern day salute to the pioneers of modern role playing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mu8.jpg'),(5854,'Idle Trader Simulator','2021-09-02','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Idle Trader Simulator - is a simulator of buying / selling currency in the stock market. The game will help you get a first idea of the financial market, without losing your real money.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5h6t.jpg'),(5855,'ABC Follow Me: Animals','2022-02-04','Music, Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','An educational game for preschool children that will develop their motor skills and introduce them to the basics of writing letters and numbers in a child-friendly design. Once this is mastered, you can move on to a more challenging game mode where children learn animals from A to Z in English!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56yq.jpg'),(5856,'Chuchel: Cherry Edition',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Cherry Edition contains the full game, 44-minute original soundtrack from the acclaimed band DVA and an 89-page digital art book with concepts and sketches by the creator Jaromir Plachy. \"CHUCHEL Sans\" OpenType font included. \n \nCHUCHEL is a comedy adventure game from the creators of Machinarium, Botanicula and Samorost. Join the hairy hero Chuchel and his rival Kekel as they will be facing numerous puzzles and challenges on their quest to retrieve the precious cherry!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cc0.jpg'),(5857,'Transylmania II: The Vampire Bites Back!','2006-10-01','Platform, Arcade','Web browser','Pesky village people are back again and hell bent on destroying Vampy inside his castle!\nSheez! Sometimes it sucks to be a Vampire!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73pl.jpg'),(5858,'Aerial Guardian','2018-07-23','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aerial Guardian is a large scale multiplayer battle first person shooter. Choose from several classes and play as a soldier to embroil yourself in a space fleet battle. Choose from a variety of over 20 weapons and several vehicles including mechs. Engage in space dogfights with fighters, or target enemy installations as a bomber, or bring the fight to the enemy with a boarding vessel. Features destructible scenery and weapons that can rebuild them and create defenses. Deploy drones to attack the enemy and repair your ship. Or take command of the entire fleet as the commander and issue orders to your teammates, spawn vehicles, and order tactical laser strikes.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5859,'NightCry','2016-03-28','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','Welcomed aboard a luxurious cruise liner, you are spending your time enjoying this rare opportunity. But at the height of the evening, things are not as they appear as a murder brings it all to a grinding halt. With no idea which direction to turn, blame is thrown around the ship in panic as the guests start to suspect one another.\nAs night falls and a cry echoes out through the ship, the true nightmare begins.\n\nNightCry is a 3D point-and-click adventure game. Click to move your character and search the ship. Interact with objects by selecting them. Make sure you check it all carefully, for the clues you need may not be easy to find.\nBut searching isn\'t all you will be doing. As you search, you will be haunted, and the Scissor Walker will be coming for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/enbdn9ulq2ts1y1wke2c.jpg'),(5860,'Ghostbusters','1985-12-31','Arcade','Atari 2600, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, DOS, Apple II, Amstrad CPC, Sega Master System/Mark III, MSX','Ghostbusters is an action game that features an overhead-view and a side-view. From Ghostbusters HQ, the player must monitor a map of midtown Manhattan for \"ghost alarms\", as well as for casual, roaming spirits, and plot a route to the alarmed area. Once the route is plotted, the player then controls the purchased Ghostmobile as it drives through traffic. Here, the player is able to capture casual ghosts on the way if they are en route. When the haunted location is reached, the game switches to a side-view. Two of the Ghostbusters will take position, activate their proton beams, and toss a trap to the ground. The player must then use the two Ghostbusters to attempt to lead the ghost(s) over the placed trap. Once activated, the trap springs to capture any ghosts directly above it. A successful capture will earn the player money, which can then be used to purchase new Ghostbusters vehicles and new modifications for it. An unsuccessful capture will see the ghost fly away (after nastily sliming one of the Ghostbusters).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3sxe.jpg'),(5861,'Gold Hunter','2022-05-13','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have always dreamed of going on a search for gold or moving big machines. Then you can now show what is in you and grow beyond you. In this game, we bring you closer to the search for gold. Get ready for a unique experience you will never forget.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sdj.jpg'),(5862,'Fantasy Sword','2024-11-28','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','Fantasy action RPG with swords and magic!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93f6.jpg'),(5863,'Receiver','2013-04-29','Shooter, Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Receiver was created for the 7-day FPS challenge to explore gun handling mechanics, randomized levels, and unordered storytelling. Armed only with a handgun and an audio cassette player, you must uncover the secrets of the Mindkill in a building complex infested with automated turrets and hovering shock drones.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29ot.jpg'),(5864,'Up Left Out','2018-06-26','Puzzle, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','\"Its my fourth puzzle game after \"Hook\", \"Klocki\" and \"PUSH\". \n \nAs always its a minimal experience with no text at all. \nJust chill and try to solve all 50 levels.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27fv.jpg'),(5865,'Suishou no Dragon','1986-12-15','Point-and-click, Adventure, Visual Novel','Family Computer Disk System','A Famicom sci-fi adventure game developed by Squaresoft and released in 1986.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dwm.jpg'),(5866,'Kyoufu Shinbun Heisei-ban: Kaiki! Shinrei File','2003-08-07','Adventure','PlayStation 2','One of several adaptations of Jirou Tsunoda\'s \'Kyoufu Shinbun\' manga, this one is a visual novel/third-person adventure. Your protagonist has been cursed by the titular paper, which warns of terrible events to come in the future. During the day, he talks with family & friends, making dialogue choices along the way. At night, he investigates relevant locations. An interesting combo, to be sure.\n\nKyoufu Shinbun Heisei-ban: Kaiki! Shinrei File is a Adventure/Horror video game published by Konami released on August 7th, 2003 for the PlayStation 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k8b.jpg'),(5867,'Joe Dever\'s Lone Wolf: Console Edition','2016-03-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Lone Wolf is back in video game form with a brand-new story, a deep combat system, stunning graphics and much more!\n\nAcclaimed author Joe Dever played an active role in the development of the game and his new narrative follows on from his classic 1980\'s gamebook, shedding a new light on Lone Wolf’s world, Magnamund!\n\nThe Console Edition includes all 4 acts of the story. Are you ready to write your own destiny?\n\n▪ A brand-new adventure written by Joe Dever, with a deep and dark redesign of Lone Wolf, his world and his enemies.\n▪ A real medieval tome with hand-drawn illustrations.\n▪ Create your character and try out different combinations of Kai Disciplines, traits and gear.\n▪ Write your own story through multiple choices.\n▪ A real combat system, where your prowess really counts –no random number table or dice to throw!\n▪ Wield Lone Wolf’s signature weapon, the Sommerswerd!\n▪ Play again, make different choices and explore new paths and fighting styles!\n\nFor Sommerlund and the Kai!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ghkq0ghav3oaslx5jwvu.jpg'),(5868,'Crossroads of Helmia','2022-08-31','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Crossroads of Helmia you will explore the world, meet its inhabitants and build your own team. Find the interesting Characters of Helmia and recruit them to join your forces. Build the team to fit your playstyle, defensive or aggressive and defeat your enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5d8i.jpg'),(5869,'Bandits','2019-07-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bandits is a Tank Brawler Arena where you operate one of 8 tanks with their own play style and abilities. Matches are Straight-forward, dynamic, designed to reward strategy and careful positioning!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lwt.jpg'),(5870,'Blob','2025-01-16','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a chemistry-packed adventure! Collect elemental blobs, combine them into powerful compounds, and build the ultimate periodic table collection. One element drop per hour, with more drops influenced by your blobventory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co920i.jpg'),(5871,'Rome: The Mystery of the Chronovisor','2023-05-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Solve the mystery of the enigmatic time machine! In this Hidden Object Adventure game you will go for a walk around Rome to search for the secret of the Chronovisor and save the heroes who have fallen into a trap. You will make unbelievable discoveries on your way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rn5.jpg'),(5872,'BoBo','1988-12-31','Platform, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','A video game adaption of the similarly titled Franco-Belgian comic strip for early computers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i9d.jpg'),(5873,'Gold Mining Simulator','2017-10-13','Simulator, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Become the gold miner. Work hard, dig deep, explore the world, and you’ll become the wealthiest man in Alaska. Use a variety of highly-detailed machines to find as much gold as you can.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81gw.jpg'),(5874,'Switchblade','2025-05-08','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Master your Switchblade in frantic combat against an endless swarm of enemies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hdy.jpg'),(5875,'The Static Speaks My Name','2015-08-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, Windows Phone, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A dark/sad/weird/funny first person exploration game. You play a man on his last night alive as he obsesses over a mysterious painting. More of a story game in that it emphasizes mood and character over gameplay. Takes ten minutes to play and has \"next-gen\" features like a shrimp tank.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4449.jpg'),(5876,'Killing Floor III','2025-07-24','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','It\'s 2091. Megacorporation Horzine has produced the ultimate army: an obedient horde of bioengineered monstrosities called \"Zeds.\" Now, only the rebel group Nightfall stands between these infernal creations and the future of humanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f9j.jpg'),(5877,'Night at the Hospital','2013-04-29','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Night at the Hospital is Team Snugglebunny’s visual novel entry for the Pulse Pounding Heart Stopping Dating Sim Jam of 2013. The first release was made in 5 days. Meet Steve. Steve is a ghost hunter. This is not the story of Steve. This is the story of Frank. Frank and Steve have been best friends since middle school. When Steve gets in a bind, Frank bails him out. As far as Frank is concerned, tonight’s little foray into the abandoned hospital is just business as usual. That is until he meets Luka. This is the epic tale of Frank, conspiracies, cuddling, and some sweet, sweet mysterious stranger lovin’.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3tyi.jpg'),(5878,'Valiant Hearts: The Great War','2014-06-25','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox 360, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Valiant Hearts: The Great War is the story of 4 crossed destinies and a broken love in a world torn apart. Dive into a 2D animated comic book adventure, mixing exploration, action and puzzles. In Valiant Hearts, the lives of all these characters are inextricably drawn together over the course of the game. Friendship, love, sacrifice and tragedy befall each one as they help each other to retain their humanity against the horrors of war.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25zo.jpg'),(5879,'Pups & Purrs Pet Shop','2021-07-15','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Become an employee at a ppular, a stylish pet shop in town, take care of the little dogs and cats, and sell pet products while enjoying every day interacting with the adorable pets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6i2c.jpg'),(5880,'Glaze Cup: Journey to the West','2024-01-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a plot type interactive game, interspersed with action adventure scenes, with the three worlds of human, demon, ghost and God as the background, telling the story before laosha\'s journey to the West','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59ma.jpg'),(5881,'Yarudora Series Vol. 1: Double Cast','1998-06-25','Visual Novel','PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','The game begins with you, the main character, waking up at a fountain to the face of a pretty girl. You are a high school boy, and this girl has helped you out of the garbage where you had passed out in a drunken stupor. (Talk about first impressions!) As it turns out, she cannot remember anything about herself except for her name, Akasaka Mitsuki. Since she has no place to stay, you offer your own, and so begins your unusual relationship with this spirited girl. When your film club finds itself in need of a female lead, Mitsuki joins in, and from there the main story begins to unfold.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rb6.jpg'),(5882,'Chill Town','2024-03-22','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A sequel of Chill Corner - a combination of relaxing simulation and idle game. Listening to beautiful music while decorating the room, fishing, cooking or even keeping it in background while doing your real life activities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cop.jpg'),(5883,'Zombie Sanctuary: Ash','2023-09-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a fun 3D mowing magic battle game. Very decompression, press a few keys, move the mouse can feel a pleasant game experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wkm.jpg'),(5884,'Frogun Encore','2024-06-25','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Frogun Encore is a dashing standalone expansion/sequel to indie hit Frogun! Join now older Renata and Jake in a trek around the whole world to prevent the return of Beelzebub. Encore builds on Frogun\'s retro PS1/N64 formula. Plus, enjoy the whole adventure in true couch co-op.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a6s.jpg'),(5885,'DCS World: AV-8B Night Attack V/STOL',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','The AV-8B project was born in the early 1970\'s as an effort to address the operational inadequacies of the AV-8A first generation Harrier, aimed to dramatically improve the capabilities and performance of the early AV-8A\'s.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7m0q.jpg'),(5886,'Dynasty Warriors 9: Empires - Deluxe Edition','2022-02-15','Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Engrave your life on the battlefield!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k8y.jpg'),(5887,'Memory Ghosts','2022-09-02','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A paranormal otome where there\'s no escape from what haunts you.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5888,'The Looter',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Looter is 2D, action/adventure, pixel art, postapocalyptic indie game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38x5.jpg'),(5889,'Omitted','2022-07-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Omitted is a first-person psychological horror game. Experience being left alone in an old hospital, discover its secrets and try to survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jx5.jpg'),(5890,'Cyber Storm Edge 64','2024-04-02','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','64-bits inspired 3D Fast-paced Action Platformer! Collect the disks and unlock new worlds to choose from! Speedrun through past stages to achieve better times and earn gold medals!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80fb.jpg'),(5891,'Spot The Difference: Christmas Edition','2024-11-07','Puzzle, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Celebrate the holiday season with Spot The Difference: Christmas Edition, brought to you by the original creators of the globally beloved Spot The Difference amusement machine game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91vw.jpg'),(5892,'Kapia','2022-01-25','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An adventure of a small girl and her grandfather in a funky apocalyptic world of Kapia. Solve puzzles, play mini-games, interact with eccentric characters to unveil the mystery of the Kapia','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j0v.jpg'),(5893,'Opus: Rocket of Whispers - Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Adventure, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bqn.jpg'),(5894,'Total War: Warhammer II - Limited Edition','2017-09-28','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The limited edition of Total War: Warhammer II, contains:\n\n- Embossed metal case.\n- Sticker sheet.\n- Exclusive mini-strategy guide.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mdqrk4dnb8xysxm830yn.jpg'),(5895,'Generation Exile','2025-12-31','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are aboard humanity’s first and final generation ship, a last-chance expedition now teetering on the rim of collapse. One step at a time you must rebuild society and the ship’s fragile ecosystems — using only what you brought with you — in this turn-based narrative city-builder.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8but.jpg'),(5896,'Kirby no Omochabako: Baseball','1995-12-18','Sport','Satellaview','This is a simple one screened game that featured Kirby being the ball. It plays somewhat like pinball, where the player must hit the ball in one of the scoring slots, or if he fails to make it in any slot, he gets a strike. The goal is to get as many runs as possible, and just aim for a high score. The game technically plays forever or until the player gets 3 outs, but since there is a limited period for broadcasting the Baseball game, it only lasts as long. There is a 2-player mode available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30de.jpg'),(5897,'Heretic II','2000-05-08','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Amiga','Heretic II is a third-person action game based on the Quake II engine that plunges you into a deep, compelling game combining brutal face-to-face combat and mystery-laden adventure. Gamers travel through complex, richly detailed environments filled with stunning special effects, wicked magic spells, detailed characters, vivid artwork and challenging level designs created by the Raven team and renowned fantasy artist Brom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29sq.jpg'),(5898,'Cassiculus','2024-06-25','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This terrifying first-person horror experience immerses the player into a world of isolation, fear, paranoia and claustrophobia as you make your way through the Oberon Cave. Throughout the game, you will experience atmospheric environments, disturbing audio and horrifying visuals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8en4.jpg'),(5899,'Netaboku: A robot girl changes my life as a bedridden boy','2020-12-17','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This game is a sci-fi romantic adventure(visual novel) modeled after the avatar robot cafe. Japan, circa 2040. Kanto lives in a residential facility for the severely physically disabled. One day, they meet a mysterious girl, Kanata, and their destiny changes dramatically...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co471e.jpg'),(5900,'Find Wario and Friends','2005-12-31','Puzzle','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9b61.jpg'),(5901,'Glow Glow Firefly','2005-12-31','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are in control of Busby and you task in each level is to collect all dewdrops and avoid the enemies (i.e. centipedes), spiny plants or even carnivorous plants. Once the last dewdrop is collected, you proceed with the next level. The dewdrops are in different colors in the game and you can only collect those that match your own color. But you can change your color when ever you want (by rotating through them). Color codes are also important for some enemies, as they may go about the color (they attack you when you don\'t match their color).\n\nIf you manage to collect five dewdrops of the same color in a row, you get the super-power and you can knock off or even out the most dangerous foe. The game consists of more then 70 levels spread over 5 different world (like Terrarium, Honey Garden, etc.) and offers 9 power-ups to help you get that far. And at the end of each world, you face a boss.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hnl.jpg'),(5902,'Disaster Blaster','2025-04-02','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Disaster Blaster is a roguelite bullet heaven card game where you play a questionably sane scientist building the most over-the-top weapon in the universe. Evolve your blaster’s card sequence and let it rip against hordes of alien enemies across a galaxy of unfortunate planets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c7z.jpg'),(5903,'Tails\' Nightmare 3',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5904,'Beyond the Wall','2017-08-08','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The world is in chaos. Avalon V is the last paradise on Earth. Here, behind huge walls, people live a quiet and happy life. But what lies beyond the wall? You have to find the answers to this question. The player\'s main task is to survive, to interact with the NPC and surrounding world. The player needs to explore the ruins of the old city, save the survivors, build a fort, and also protect the wall of the new city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29xf.jpg'),(5905,'Hell Cab','1993-08-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hell Cab is a first person point and click adventure game that starts by taking the wrong cab in NYC. Stan is the cab driver; he brings the protagonist back in time to solve puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bwz.jpg'),(5906,'1001 Crystal Mazes Collection','2010-05-03','Puzzle','Nintendo DSi','Give your brain a workout with 1001 Crystal Mazes Collection, the deceptively simple jewel logic game. It\'s easy to learn but hard to master. Your task is to push the crystals forward to their target destinations one at a time. It sounds simple, but be careful. You can push your jewel into an impossibly locked position if you don\'t plan ahead. As the mazes get harder and the crystals pile up, you\'ll need clever thinking to clear the labyrinth. With more than 1,000 jewel-filled puzzles, this fun collection will challenge your mind and push your skills to the limit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sn8h7vdlojgsmce4omdg.jpg'),(5907,'Kung Fu Duel','2025-03-24','Fighting','Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kxl.jpg'),(5908,'Rattle Royale','2024-11-23','Strategy, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','4 Player Madness!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93fl.jpg'),(5909,'Arkanoid vs. the Occult','2024-04-02','Arcade','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Arkanoid is back to fight the evil occult powers in: Arkanoid VS the Occult\n\nEvery screen is more or less connected to occult symbolism (or conspiracies). Some of the symbols are quite distorted due to the limitations of blocks per screen\nThe game now has black blocks (instead of cyan) which do not exist in the original version\nThe balancing between the stages is a bit wonky, but all stages are completable. Easy mode recommended\nStartscreen by Svambo (thx a lot!)\nFull 99 level romhack (just the boss stages weren’t edited)','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5910,'Shark Simulator: Ocean Predator Survival','2024-11-29','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Hunt, Grow, and Reign Over the Ocean!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92t4.jpg'),(5911,'Super Mecha Champions','2019-05-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Super Mecha Champions is an action shooter featuring mecha combats, which sets scene in a neo-futuristic Alpha City. An exciting battle is taking place here, you need to overcome opponents with cutting-edge weapons, magnificent mechas and vehicles, aiming for the highest honor of being a champion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cu0.jpg'),(5912,'Samurai Champloo: Sidetracked','2006-04-11','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 2','Samurai Champloo steps out of the hack-and-slash action genre and offers a new way to swing a finely-honed samurai blade. Set in Japan with hip hop feel from the hit TV series by the same name, this title allows gamers to breathe life to a \"lost episode\" as one of three playable characters - Mugen, a reckless samurai with break-dancing fighting style, calculated Jin who abides by the decorum of Bushido, and a mysterious new character exclusive to the video game. Stranded in northern land of Ezo (current day Hokkaido) in search of the samurai who smells of sunflowers, the player must face foreign mercenaries, master swordsmen, diabolical assassins, mythical beasts, and gangster monkeys. The core of the game\'s unique combat system lies in the innovative integration of music and linked attacks. The players can choose an array of combos based on the different hip hop grooves that they can swap at will. Music tracks become collectible, opening an extensive assortment of linked attacks that can be implemented tactically during combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50it.jpg'),(5913,'WWE SmackDown! Shut Your Mouth','2002-11-15','Sport','PlayStation 2','A WHOLE NEW SEASON OF SMACKDOWN!\n\n-BUILD YOUR OWN DRAMA WITH REAL WWF STORYLINES\n-ALL-NEW DRAFT\n-INTERACTIVE BACKSTAGE AREAS\n-WHATCHA GONNA DO?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kbm.jpg'),(5914,'Toradora! Portable','2009-04-30','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Toradora! Portable is developed by Guyzware and published by Namco Bandai Games.\n\nThe player assumes the role of Ryuuji Takasu where he moves around school and town, conversing with characters and working towards multiple endings as part of an original storyline.\n\nThe game also features a minigame where players play as Taiga, fending off lovesick guys.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z77.jpg'),(5915,'VectorBall',NULL,'Sport, Indie','Sin plataforma','VectorBall is a multiplayer dodgeball inspired game. Throw balls and move out of the way of incoming balls, this is a fast paced game with easy to understand mechanics. Throw a damage ball to kill another player. If you want to move, throw a teleport ball, or dodge by moving in your play area.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oj9.jpg'),(5916,'Block-Man 1','1994-12-31','Sin género','DOS','The player controls Block-man. Block-Man is in a game-area bounded by red bricks and flaming torches, representing the room he\'s in. Every room has an exit and from his starting position Block-Man must get to that exit. In his way are walls and pits that he must overcome. The only available resource are building bricks. The only commands available are move left / right. pick up/put down and climb (a maximum of one brick only). Using these commands the player must solve the puzzle and get Block-Man to the exit of each room. \n \nThe shareware game consists of ten levels. The full, registered, game has more levels, and for a further fee a constructor option that allows the player to create and play their own levels and those of other game owners is available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/k0jrfjy4ljjnql1ovz4t.jpg'),(5917,'Insurgency: Sandstorm - Rust & Wrap Weapon Skin Set','2023-03-30','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This content requires the base game Insurgency: Sandstorm on Steam in order to play.Embody the grizzled fighter within you with the Rust &amp Wrap Weapon Skin Set for Insurgents. These skins can be applied to six different weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bj4.jpg'),(5918,'Stakes Winner 2','1996-01-13','Racing, Sport','Neo Geo AES, Neo Geo MVS, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Like its predecessor, Stakes Winner 2 is a 2D horse racing game. Choosing from one of the game\'s selection of horses, players must compete in a series of races on different tracks to earn money and prestige. Each horse that players can select is rated according to speed, stamina, and burst.\n\nPlayers control their horses with the joystick and three buttons. Pressing the A button repeatedly keeps the horse accelerated with a slight drain of the stamina bar, while pressing the B button applies the rider crop to the horse. This results in a slight burst of speed at the cost of draining the horse\'s stamina bar faster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vzb105gqzckrefxd3jkg.jpg'),(5919,'From Heaven to Earth','2022-02-17','Platform, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Find your way down to earth in this amazing platformer game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57oe.jpg'),(5920,'Computer Virus Simulator','2023-11-30','Point-and-click, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Safely experience the danger and excitement of digital chaos!\n\nIn a world where cyber security breaches are on the rise, take this exciting opportunity to peek behind the curtains of the darkest aspects of the internet - computer viruses. Computer Virus Simulator will wreak havoc on you safely in-game.\nComputer Virus Simulator takes you on a thrilling journey through the world of computer virus all wrapped up in a completely harmless and immersive game.\nNavigate an astounding variety of computer virus simulations, from the commonplace to the uniquely obscure.\n\nImmerse yourself in the realistic simulation of computer viruses. There are many error dialogs, warning sounds, and beeps that mimic the behavior of a real PC.\n\nExperiment with a large number of computer viruses, each unique and intricately designed.\n\nEngage in these harrowing adventures without endangering your personal computer. Despite the striking realism, remember - this is a game. You can explore these threats in the most comprehensive, and non-destructive way possible.\n\nEncounter simulated viruses which are strikingly close to the real ones. They exhibit the similar characteristics of creating error dialogues, marks, beeps, and system warnings that you would potentially face with actual computer virus.\n\nSo, are you ready to dive center stage into this chaotic digital world? Navigate your way through the thrilling, yet absolutely safe, realm of computer viruses with Computer Virus Simulator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5aq3.jpg'),(5921,'Undead Breakout','2017-10-06','Puzzle','iOS','In Undead Breakout, you must use the pathways and thoroughfares in the ruins of a resort town, Paris and New York City to move survivors to escape points (indicated by a gold star). Each level provides a variety of challenges in which you have to move the gold survivors around the board like pieces on a game board, avoiding the zombies that will try to overtake the survivors and the spreading infection. Each zombie and each survivor type has different characteristics that impact their movement and movement speed. To aid survivors, some missions incorporate police officers or soldiers who can protect the survivors. The soldiers can create a protected spot by holding zombies back a space. Police officers can be used sacrificially to kill one zombie they encounter although the officer will die in the process. Think strategically to reach each goal and survive the undead masses.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5922,'Tennis Ace','2018-02-01','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An interactive, furry, adult furry visual novel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v8a.jpg'),(5923,'Tekken 4','2001-07-01','Fighting','Arcade, PlayStation 2','Tekken 4 marks the return of Namco\'s premier fighting franchise, Tekken. This version features enhanced graphics, gameplay mechanics, and fearsome fighters. Newcomers engage old favorites in interactive, multileveled arenas. The addition of walls, terrain effects, position changes, and enhanced sidestepping will force you to adjust your fighting strategy. Expanded game modes such as Training, Team Battle and the new Tekken Force provide the player with a deeper gameplay experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46rs.jpg'),(5924,'Build-A-Bear Workshop: Bear Valley','2013-06-29','Sin género','iOS','Welcome to Build-A-Bear Workshop Bear Valley, the valley where your furry friends magically come to life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xsn.jpg'),(5925,'Counter-Strike Online','2008-07-24','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Counter-Strike Online is a first-person shooter video game, targeted towards Asia\'s gaming market released in 2008. It is based on Counter-Strike and was developed by Nexon with oversight from license-holder Valve. It uses a micropayment model that is managed by a custom version of Steam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2psv.jpg'),(5926,'Sonic Ultimate Battle',NULL,'Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5927,'Snowcat Simulator','2014-11-26','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are responsible for the quality of the slopes in a huge ski area. Every day, big crowds flock to the ski-regions and want to rush down the ski runs as fast as possible. But as soon as any inconveniences or delays arise, the tourists complain and money stops rolling in. Keep in mind, keeping such a slope in good repair is not as easy as you might think. Perpetual snow fall, aggressive snowboarders or strong winds mean that the pistes slowly but surely become impassable. Therefore you and the piste caterpillar have to keep on moving - in such a profession the fear of steep slopes is out of place. Slide the snow correctly, compress it and spare no effort to ensure that the slopes keep in good repair, the skiers will thank you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41q3.jpg'),(5928,'Beneath Steel Clouds','2020-10-01','Puzzle, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beneath Steel Clouds is a life-sim set in a dystopian future with a cyberpunk aesthetic and themes but without the gritty, grim-dark tone and with a healthy dose of snark added on top. You have thirty days to get a grip on your life, earn (or get) some credits and hopefully get the girl. Get on it, chummer, things ain’t gonna solve themselves! They never do.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40py.jpg'),(5929,'Planet Zoo: Africa Pack','2021-06-22','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on an unforgettable African adventure with the Planet Zoo: Africa Pack! Adopt and raise five stunning new animals, master the challenge zoo set in an oasis bazaar, and build out the zoo of your dreams with over 180 beautiful new scenery pieces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69p8.jpg'),(5930,'Harold Halibut','2024-04-16','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Dive into this nautic adventure as curiosity will guide you through a space ship wreck on an unknown planet made up of water. When one of the lead scientists still on board tries to unriddle the possibility of a relaunch young Janitor Harold is around to assist her. Join Harold in his clumsy undertakings to stir up the ark-like ship’s stale day-to-day life and find the secrets that lie behind its doors.\n\nUnderwater atmosphere, self-reflective humor and contemporary adventure mechanics make up the foundation of this game created entirely out of craft supplies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m8p.jpg'),(5931,'Office Rivals',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Office Rivals is a slice-of-life visual novel and a love story between two office-rivals-turned-lovers, inspired by wholesome doujinshi and webtoons!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f96.jpg'),(5932,'Onimusha 2: Samurai\'s Destiny','2002-10-04','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 2','Onimusha 2 is the second installment in the Onimusha series of video games released in May of 2002. The game retains the action elements from its predecessor such as the use of multiple special weapons that can be upgraded by defeating enemies. Apart from the main character, the game features four playable sub-characters, each of whom shares a part in the story. The player\'s actions determine which characters will decide to help Jubei in his quest. These characters were added by the Capcom staff to give a bigger depth to the game and expand the game\'s feeling of adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qzs.jpg'),(5933,'The Metronomicon: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Music, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A Rhythm Role-Playing Game! Fight party crashing monsters with the power of music! Level your party and upgrade your gear while dancing to the beat of some SICK tunes. Packing in a fully-fledged story mode with a colorful cast of musically-empowered heroes and villains, The Metronomicon sees you take control of a party of eight new masters of the “rhythmic combat arts” to wage musical warfare against a multitude of dance-mongering fiends. Control up to four concurrent heroes as they cast powerful spells, buff their teammates, and beat down their enemies with a variety of magical loot and groovin’ dance moves. The effectiveness of your team is all in the rhythm, so put on your dancing pants, light up dad’s disco ball, and prepare your body for The Metronomicon. Oh, and did I mention couch co-op? Because nothing\'s better than an armored dance partner. Hash me bro! #Metronomicon \"You got your glowsticks in my chainmail! You got your fireballs in my dubstep!\" - Danny (lead dev) The Metronomicon features a fantastic, fully-licensed soundtrack featuring some of the hottest electronic, synthwave, chiptune and indie artists, including an exclusive track from Jimmy Urine of Mindless Self Indulgence, an unreleased track from Shiny Toy Guns, along with tracks from YACHT, Perturbator, J-Punch, Dj CUTMAN, and many, many more. As much a soundscape as it is a soundtrack, the music behind The Metronomicon is set to be every bit as varied and exciting as the gameplay itself.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5934,'Sonic: Round 7',NULL,'Platform, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5935,'Tankr','2016-06-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tankr is a top-down Arcade developed Mighty Toast, where you can play with or against your friends in dozens of frenzy arena multiplayer battles filled with powerups, bouncing bullets and explosions... You can even design your own battlegrounds! \nUp to four players can play together against the IA in any of the five campaings of increasing difficulty; the game offers over one hundred stages. Players also can take free-for-all battles on local and online games, to know who is the best in a selection of battlegrounds, or being able to design new ones thanks to the built-in Map Editor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qt8zzkspxm8y99cpudea.jpg'),(5936,'Wai-wai de Q: Aki no Daikansha Matsuri! - Dai-1-kai','1995-11-01','Quiz/Trivia','Satellaview','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co483z.jpg'),(5937,'Stargate Adventure','2005-10-29','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98f8.jpg'),(5938,'Under the Ocean',NULL,'Platform, Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Overcome the weather, vicious animals, injuries, disease, dehydration and famine to build your home on a deserted island.\nYou start out shipwrecked, thirsty and alone. Start your campfire, find weapons and forage for food before the night sets in.\nYou scavenge what you can from what\'s washed up on the beach; but from then on, you\'re on your own.\n\nHundreds of items interact in strange and unexpected ways.\nAttach glow worms to spears to light your way. Attach explosives to make them deadly. Attach a rifle because - well, why not?\nCraft your own shelter, bridges and walls. Build traps to snare animals.\n\nTravel through beaches, caves and jungles. Swim through lakes and raft over oceans.\nSearch for exotic crafting materials in hidden and deadly locations.\nFind your way home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hoh.jpg'),(5939,'Outside Parties',NULL,'Sin género','Playdate','Outside Parties is a “hidden picture”/“hidden object”-style horror scavenger hunt, coming to Playdate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7900.jpg'),(5940,'Rampage','1986-12-01','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Arcade','Rampage is a game where players control giant monsters/mutated humans. Players must smash buildings while destroying vehicles such as tanks, planes, and trains to advance to the next level. Smashing windows will sometimes reveals items of interest that the player may use.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ys2.jpg'),(5941,'Hazard Protocol',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Team up in this procedurally generated world, solving dynamic puzzles, and engaging in intense top-down action. Choose your controls, face the unknown, and master the Hazard Protocol with your elite squad!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ixg.jpg'),(5942,'Crunch','2019-06-15','Racing, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Drive a car, break blocks competing with computer opponents, fight against zombies or become a zombie yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25ly.jpg'),(5943,'Loathful','2024-04-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Loathful is a Survival Horror in first person with PS1 graphics. Bring yourself in a retro-style adventure where all your nightmares are brought to life. Survive your demons, dive into your darkest fears to overthrow a mysterious virus who seems to have put his hands on this universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65kv.jpg'),(5944,'The Basement','2005-01-07','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97mz.jpg'),(5945,'Cuban Missile Crisis + Ice Crusade Pack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5946,'Brassheart','2025-04-04','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Brassheart is a Point & Click adventure game set in the alternative 1920s, inspired by the dieselpunk aesthetics and the classics of the genre. In this world, Pola follows the clues that may provide a way to save her father kidnapped by his own invention, a rebellious supermachine, Valkiria.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cr2.jpg'),(5947,'Ropebound','2025-03-31','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Swing through ropes and overcome obstacles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co993w.jpg'),(5948,'BloodRayne Complete Bundle','2020-11-26','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cp1.jpg'),(5949,'CruiSim',NULL,'Simulator, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','CruiSim is a new, upcoming, realistic ship simulator game where you can steer large, breathtaking cruise ships with amazing graphics.\nShipping companies like AIDA, MSC or Carribean are represented.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5950,'Cease To Breathe','2023-07-03','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cease to Breathe is retro-inspired adventure heavily influenced by the Commodore Amiga games of the late 1980\'s / early 90\'s.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sid.jpg'),(5951,'Euro Truck Simulator 2: Wielton Trailer Pack','2023-07-17','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Wielton Trailer Pack DLC includes officially licensed content including 6 trailer types, with a variety of trailer and chassis sizes, cabin accessories, and customization options.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s33.jpg'),(5952,'Gem Tower Defense 2',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Gem tower defense is different from general tower defense games. The map of gem tower defense is extremely open and free. Players need to constantly plan and build labyrinths to delay the advance of waves of monsters hitting the fortress.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dmd.jpg'),(5953,'Tongari Boushi to Mahou no Omise','2010-11-11','Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo DS','Tongari Boushi to Mahou no Omise is the follow-up of Magician\'s Quest: Mysterious Times. It retains the Animal Crossing like gameplay of the previous game, however there is now an emphasis on owning and running a shop. These shops cover all types of goods from cakes to flowers to clothes to furniture. The shops products are created by playing mini-games.\n\nThe game also has further updates from the previous game. There is now a new castle location where players can hear the king\'s opinion on their store. The number of students, teachers, spells, incantations, furniture, cd\'s, insects, and fish have all been increased too.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bw5.jpg'),(5954,'Debut Project: Cooking Cafe','2024-11-14','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','As a new cafe employee, you’ll be taking orders and completing challenges on your journey to create recipes which will take social media by storm. Share pics of your cooking to get Likes and boost your cafe’s rating. See if your culinary creativity can earn a million followers for the cafe!\n\nCreate up to 80 different menu items in the cafe kitchen! Experience the joys of cooking though 13 minigames in which you’ll choose flavors, toppings, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z67.jpg'),(5955,'Drawn to Life','2014-05-22','Platform, Adventure','iOS, Nintendo DS','Drawn to Life is an action-adventure platform video game for the Nintendo DS. In the game, the player creates their own playable characters, level objects, and accessories by drawing them using the DS\'s stylus and Touch Screen. The game was ported to iOS by WayForward Technologies and released by 505 Games on May 22, 2014.\n\nDrawn to Life requires the player to create a hero in order to free a cursed village from an encroaching darkness. It features numerous platforming levels, a top down central village, and other elements such as vehicles, weapons, and platforms, which are drawn or colored by the player using the stylus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48sy.jpg'),(5956,'Armor Battle','1980-09-04','Shooter, Arcade','Intellivision','You are on a dangerous tank mission. To reach and destroy your assigned target, you must maneuver through a field filled with enemy mines. Although these are hidden, the mine detection equipment in your tank warns you of their presence by producing a buzzing sound. This is your signal to change course on route to your target. If you should stumble into a mine, your tank will be \"destroyed\" and returned to its original starting position. If you get through the minefield and successfully engage the target, the built-in computer will automatically set up another challenge with a new starting position, target location, and minefield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pft.jpg'),(5957,'Dying Byte Survival',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Dying Byte Survival is a Gun-Fu shooter with a variety of weapons, Slow motion effect, Diving, Cloak of Invisibility and very detailed particle and effect system in a Open World with closed quarters but also open fields, with storyline and persistent gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pa8.jpg'),(5958,'Ariane in Paradise','2022-07-01','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your character is a refugee of one of those war-torn regions who managed to swing a sponsorship to this city. You can play as a previous player character (DA/SITA or AiP) who Ariane sponsors or you can be a new character who won a sponsorship. Your character can be male or female.\nYou move into a house with three women: Ariane, Rachel, and Maya. The object of the game is to get a good job and become friends with all three roommates, and if you are successful you can help negotiate a plan to keep the city-state stay alive a little longer.\nThe game opens up in a refugee-holding area. It used to open up with long-winded exposition text until I decided “showing” is better than telling. You deal with an immigration agent in a military uniform, and then the first people you meet are people that hate refugees. The first friendly person you meet is Rachel.\nRachel gives you a tour of the house, then you meet Ariane, and depending on which origin you pick for your character, this is either a getting to know Ariane section, or a getting caught up section. There is a key point where Ariane asks what you are interested in, which is a key choice in the paths you can take.​','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oti.jpg'),(5959,'Quad Hopping','2017-08-23','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The simplest puzzle game is the reaction and the ability to make quick decisions. As we move, we score points and the game gradually accelerates, it is already harder to catch up on the cherished platform to jump even further, to a greater result.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jdd.jpg'),(5960,'Visa Control: USA Border Simulator','2024-11-14','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Will you uphold the law and make the right choices at the USA border?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s7t.jpg'),(5961,'Be the Bullet',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5962,'Kudos 2','2008-10-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Kudos 2 is the life-simulation strategy game from Positech Games (makers of Kudos, Democracy and Rock Legend). Kudos is the original inspiration for the game SimSocial by EA (also known as the myspace sims game). Kudos is a turn-based game that puts you in control of a single character and manages their life from age 20 to 30. You get to pick their friends, their job, and how they spend their free time, but there is a catch! You can only choose to do one thing each day, or two at the weekends. This makes Kudos 2 a game of agonizing choices. Do you turn down an invitation from a friend because you are too tired from work? Do you put more time into your friends or your career? When do you find time to look for a better job, or to spend time with your pet?\n\nKudos 2 is unlike any strategy or casual game you have played before. The game has a totally original style, and uses artwork by legendary comic artist Jamie McKelvie. Every game of Kudos is unique. Did you become a high-flying corporate lawyer who cruises to the office each morning in a luxury car, but has no social life, or do you become a popular, trendy and much loved guitar-player, who works as a waitress to pay the bills? Will you have the money to splash out on a burglar alarm, or rely on your martial arts (or your faithful pet dog) to protect you from crime?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gmct0zyxzv6is5pb812j.jpg'),(5963,'Evil Dead: Regeneration','2005-09-13','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Evil Dead: Regeneration takes over where the film Evil Dead 2 left off. You can play as Ash, who has been committed to an insane asylum where a mad scientist is doing experiments with the Necronomican. With the help of some firepower and your new sidekick, a 3-foot tall \"deadite,\" you can battle the scientist\'s unholy creations and save civilization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mfs.jpg'),(5964,'Homecoming: Kitaku','2024-11-21','Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Uncover the truth hidden in the darkness with your own hands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93fo.jpg'),(5965,'Cheddly and Cloud\'s Crazy Adventure',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5966,'Charmy Maze',NULL,'Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5967,'Azoove','2025-05-01','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Adventure with friends in this co-op card roguelike, bravely crossing the dangerous Azoove desert. Manage resources and communicate effectively to survive the journey and return the cursed book to the Library. Strategize and make it there in time to seal the evil fiend Ur\'gan!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wdp.jpg'),(5968,'Beautiful Japanese Scenery: Animated Jigsaws','2016-09-15','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Animated Jigsaws is a jigsaw puzzle game with video instead of pictures. “Beautiful Japanese Scenery” contains moving images from Japanese famous places including Mt. Fuji, Kyoto, Tokyo, the Snow Monkeys in a natural hot spring and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d3y.jpg'),(5969,'Railworks 3: Train Simulator 2012 - Bristol to Avonmouth','2010-12-31','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bristol to Avonmouth\nThe Bristol and Avonmouth route has been created to give you the chance to enjoy many operations around the route, from the coal loaders at Avonmouth to the bustling docks, the Severn Beach line (highlighted by Thomas Cook as one of the most scenic lines in Europe!) to the four-mile tunnel under the River Severn.\n\nStarting at Bristol Temple Meads, you can take a trip to Bristol Parkway in preparation to carry on to London. Go South into Portbury docks and take in the magnificent Clifton Suspension Bridge or take a heavy freight load past Filton Airport, where Concorde G-BOAF resides opposite the magnificent Brabazon hangars.\n\nDo you feel like taking a trip back to the past? Drive to the Bristol Harbour Railway where you can travel up and down the dockside railway and see Brunel\'s famous SS Great Britain and the M Shed Museum which occupies the former Bristol Industrial Museum building.\n\nOr maybe you\'d prefer a trip into the future? Portishead railway station is subject to a great deal of debate at the moment with ongoing campaigns to re-open the line and its stations at Pill and Portishead to ease traffic on the A369. The line has been included, with the station at Pill bought back to life and the lines laid and station buildings placed at Portishead station.\n\nIf you want to do some good old fashioned shunting, there\'s plenty of scope for that too, with the docks at Avonmouth and Portbury, coaling yards at Avonmouth, and shunting yards at Stoke Gifford and east of Bristol Temple Meads.\n\nBristol and Avonmouth includes a total of 21 stations and features 15 scenarios, ten using default stock, and five using stock from Just Trains, as well as four Free Roams.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mmz.jpg'),(5970,'Knights & Guns: Deluxe Edition','2023-07-21','Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Knights & Guns: Deluxe Edition is a digital bundle that contains the base game and Armor Pack #1 which adds 2 robust armors, expertly crafted to endure the toughest battles.\n\nKnights & Guns brings you to a dangerous world where you will fight, alongside your friend, against demons, ghouls & ghosts. Use shotguns, lasers and the power of chivalry to overcome every obstacle. Become the best version of a knight - one with a gun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76pm.jpg'),(5971,'Crowsworn',NULL,'Platform, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore a dark world inhabited by men and monsters in this action packed platformer. Lay waste to the monsters that stand in your way with a wide array of stylish combat maneuvers, as you attempt to unravel the truth behind the curse of Fearanndal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ydc.jpg'),(5972,'NASCAR Thunder 2004','2003-09-16','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation, PlayStation 2','NASCAR Thunder 2004 is a racing simulator by EA Sports, released in 2003 and available in separate versions for PlayStation, PlayStation 2, Xbox, and PC. It features the 2002 champion Tony Stewart on the cover with a scowling look to represent the new Grudges and Alliances feature. It was the only game as of 2002 to feature the previous Winston (Sprint) Cup Champion on the cover. The game had the most extensive soundtrack of the series up from four songs from the previous game. The game also has a career mode, season mode, Lightning Challenge mode, SpeedZone, as well as a tutorial mode featuring Richard Petty. The game is an EA Sports Bio game, and is compatible with other EA Sports Bio games like Madden NFL 2004 and NCAA Football 2004.[3] A Nintendo GameCube port was planned but was cancelled, as the console did not support Online Play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ydt.jpg'),(5973,'Phantasms: Maledictus',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Phantasms is an episodic psychological horror game. Each chapter is hand crafted to deliver a unique and immersive horror experience.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5974,'Holy Potatoes! What the Hell?!','2020-06-24','Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Holy Potatoes! What the Hell?! is a whacky hell-themed cooking management sim where you take on the role of a chef in an Afterlife populated by potatoes! Sort potato sinners into cooking stations to extract sinfully delicious ingredients, cook up incredible potato-based recipes, and appease the gods in your Pantheon by serving them savory spud dishes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24ws.jpg'),(5975,'Airhead','2024-02-12','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Help a small body save a head-like organism full of air, from a leak that threatens its life. Explore their Metroidvania style world and overcome challenging environmental puzzles to find the key to the head\'s survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fty.jpg'),(5976,'The Emerald Maiden: Symphony of Dreams','2016-02-18','Adventure','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Save your family from an ominous undersea facility!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21oa.jpg'),(5977,'Ultimate Fishing Simulator: Japan',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d0i.jpg'),(5978,'Stunt Race FX','1994-12-31','Racing','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Stunt Race FX is a cartoon-style, 3D-racing game that ran on the Super FX chip (the same engine that ran under Star Fox).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dxa.jpg'),(5979,'Clock of Atonement','2017-04-28','Puzzle, Indie','Android, iOS','Clock of Atonement is a pixel art mystery adventure game you can finish within 30 minutes - like an interactive visual novel with JRPG-style gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co684q.jpg'),(5980,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization IV','2005-10-25','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sid Meier and Firaxis Games will take this incredibly fun and addictive game to new heights by adding new ways to play and win, new tools to manage and expand your civilization, all-new easy to use mod capabilities and intense multiplayer modes and options','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rjp.jpg'),(5981,'Amy Dress Up',NULL,'Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(5982,'Touhou Hakanai Cards','2020-05-21','Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Touhou Hakanai Cards is a strategy game combining TCG. The card characters are all from the Oriental project. You can use these different styles and distinctive characters to match a variety of lineup combinations. Enjoy well-designed balance and a fun-filled sense of operation, carefully plan the resources in the game, and use beautifully illustrated character cards to play against! It can also support 2-4 people on the PC platform for online battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2abm.jpg'),(5983,'Yellow Brick Road II','1996-08-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Apple Pippin','The good witch Glinda is captured by the Wicked Witch of the West, and the Tin Man, Cowardly Lion and Scarecrow must set out to rescue her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vlk.jpg'),(5984,'The Legend of Zelda: The Wind Waker HD Randomizer','2024-06-17','Adventure','Wii U','Randomizer mod for the Wii U remaster of Wind Waker by SuperDude88.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f78.jpg'),(5985,'Quake III Arena','2000-10-22','Shooter','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Dreamcast, PlayStation 2','Welcome to the Arena, where high-ranking warriors are transformed into spineless mush. Abandoning every ounce of common sense and any trace of doubt, you lunge onto a stage of harrowing landscapes and veiled abysses. Your new environment rejects you with lava pits and atmospheric hazards as legions of foes surround you, testing the gut reaction that brought you here in the first place. Your new mantra: Fight or be finished.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ybj.jpg'),(5986,'Hentai Girls: College Romance','2024-12-05','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Meet over 50 pretty anime girls in this relaxing puzzle game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94uc.jpg'),(5987,'Sheepherds!',NULL,'Indie, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Sheepherds! is a cozy co-op party game where you and your sheepdog buddies guide colorful flocks through beautiful landscapes to sheer their wool. Take your time and have fun barking, running and discovering magical places together— or take on challenges to win even more treats!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iar.jpg'),(5988,'Return to PopoloCrois: A Story of Seasons Fairytale','2015-06-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','The fairy tale world of PoPoLoCrois meets the farm living of Story of Seasons in this cross-over RPG. It features classically-styled turn-based combat and towns full of lively and interesting NPCs who contribute to a heartwarming narrative that veterans or newcomers to either franchise can enjoy. Ample farming and life simulation elements such as crop-raising, bug-catching, rock quarrying, item synthesis and more round out the experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56oz.jpg'),(5989,'Super Neptunia RPG: Party Member - If','2019-07-09','Sin género','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oic.jpg'),(5990,'Run Run Kyousoukyoku','1989-09-15','Racing, Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series, PC-8800 Series','Run Run Kyousoukyoku is an arcade-style on-foot racing game. It uses a split-screen side-scrolling view and can be player against computer-controlled opponents or in a two-player mode. The latter allows players to choose any stage, while the former follows a linear set of levels, starting in Tokyo and advancing to the USA via China and Europe. The courses typically feature platforming sections alongside flat terrain; it is usually required to jump in a timed fashion to succeed, and jumps can vary in height and length depending on how long the player holds the correspondent key. Runners would also take falling damage in certain spots.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f4s.jpg'),(5991,'Castlevania: Circle of the Moon - Card Mode','2020-01-14','Platform, Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Circle of the Moon was a great Castlevania game, but the card system left something to be desired. Cards being dropped solely from enemies was less than desirable, since it meant that the main gimmick of the game was locked behind a game of dice. This mod makes the cards more accessible by placing them in specific locations around the world. Enemies who did drop cards now instead drop meat, as a nod to the classic style Castlevanias. Cards are generally placed in an ascending order of power; you won’t get big bone powers by searching the early areas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7syp.jpg'),(5992,'Mobile Suit Gundam: Extreme Vs. 2','2018-10-30','Arcade','Arcade','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dc9.jpg'),(5993,'Hentai Fantasy Chicks','2023-07-05','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hentai Fantasy Chicks is a casual puzzle game. Listen to the relaxing music, move around the fragments of the image, and make the full picture. Explore and enjoy all different types of fantasy girls and relax.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r64.jpg'),(5994,'Dead or Alive ++','1998-09-01','Fighting','Arcade','Dead or Alive ++ (Plus Plus) is an updated version of Dead or Alive released in 1998. It includes new characters, improved graphics, and unlockable costumes. The updated version also features remixed stage designs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49m3.jpg'),(5995,'Maze: Pedestal of Trials','2022-06-23','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Maze: Pedestal of Trials is a sequel spin-off to our original puzzle game, Maze. This entry into the TreeFall Studios Maze series brings all new challenges, new game-play abilities, new environments, and new puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hwz.jpg'),(5996,'Dolls','2023-12-20','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dolls is a first-person horror game in which the player must escape from a dark school inhabited by seemingly lifeless dolls. Confront your fears, unravel the mysteries, and survive this suffocating environment in order to return to reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co771o.jpg'),(5997,'Tavern Master','2021-11-16','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Tavern Master is all about managing your medieval tavern. You start with a very small room, couple of benches and tables and build your way up to a huge successful tavern with a kitchen, rooms for guests, group of loyal staff and much more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dfr.jpg'),(5998,'EZ-Talk Shokyuu-hen 4','2001-08-01','Quiz/Trivia','Game Boy Advance','The fourth entry in the EZ-Talk edutainment series for the Game Boy Advance. English phrases are spoken aloud by the character\'s mother, and the user follows those directions to complete minigames and tasks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hsr.jpg'),(5999,'Asteria','2014-07-03','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Asteria is a fast paced indie platformer, wrapped up in a sandbox sci-fi world where everything is destructible, mineable, collectable, craftable and creatable. You play Ryker: the only surviving human colonist after your people were wiped out by local aliens. Now you’re stranded on Asteria, with no means of escape. This isn’t just about survival, it’s about revenge. Build your safe haven and go track down the aliens who destroyed your colony.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8poe.jpg'),(6000,'The Moto Racer Collection',NULL,'Racing','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8at2.jpg'),(6001,'Dink Smallwood','1998-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dink Smallwood is a humorous role-playing video game. It was first released in 1998 before becoming freeware on October 17, 1999. It was developed by Robinson Technologies, at the time consisting of Seth Robinson, Justin Martin, and Greg Smith. Mitch Brink composed several of the game\'s music tracks, while others are MIDI forms of classical music such as Debussy\'s Reverie. The game has a small but dedicated fan following that continues to develop add-ons for the game more than a decade after its release.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pmg.jpg'),(6002,'The Colonel\'s Bequest','1990-12-31','Adventure','Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','The Colonel\'s Bequest is a character-driven graphic adventure game by Sierra On-Line. It was developed for Atari ST, Amiga, and MS-DOS in 1989. It was the first of the short-lived Laura Bow Mysteries series created by Roberta Williams. \n \nThe thrill and suspense of The Colonel\'s Bequest is unprecedented in animated adventure games. Never before has a plot been so complex, or characters so well developed. From the die-hard mystery fan, to the veteran 3-D adventurer, this game is not to be missed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pox.jpg'),(6003,'Silkgrove',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a Restorer in Silkgrove. Use your toolkit to scavenge resources, repair, and upgrade your mobile home. Travel across regions, help rebuild communities, and restore balance to the world.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6004,'Scatteria','2019-11-08','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scatteria is Post-Apocalyptic 2d Shooter best served with friends in local couch splitscreen mode. Find better weapons, destroy your enemy bases, survive and conquer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co293j.jpg'),(6005,'Hidden Kitten','2023-10-23','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive whisker-first into \"Hidden Kitten,\" a purr-fectly delightful hidden object game! Follow Charly the cat\'s dream escapades, and search for hidden objects in charming black and white hand-drawn scenes. Prepare for a paw-sitively un-fur-gettable experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d3h.jpg'),(6006,'Tiger Girl Hill Breaker',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Smash the girl\'s body with a small ball layer of camouflage, see her real side. Be careful not to let the ball fall off the screen, which will start over.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44ni.jpg'),(6007,'Saihate no Ima','2012-07-26','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable','This game tells the story of seven long-time friends. How they grew closer or further apart as they got older. The story is presented using a blog-like interface. \n \nThe protagonist, Atemiya Shinobu, who was raised at a certain facility since young, had no one around him that could be called \"friend\". Being that way, the first thing he started doing after leaving the facility with his sister - Chidori - was to find and make friends. \n \nBenio Azusa, a tomboyish girl who lived nearby. \n \nHondou Sayaka, a quiet yet sharp-tongued girl who was in charge of raising the pets at school just like him. \n \nTsukamoto Youko and Itsuki, a pair of siblings who belong to a prestigious family around the area. \n \nHiguchi Shouji, a boy he knew by being attracted to by the similarities they both share. \n \nIzuki Fueko, a girl he met by chance. \n \nTogether with Shinobu, they were a group of seven. Just like that, each and every one of them, who had never experienced the joy of having friends, was able to meet each other and become companions. The story begins in a quiet town colored by dusk. Around the seven friends, there were understanding, empathy, conflict, and what\'s more, fleeting love of adolescence. It was a friendship that could last forever. \n \nSuch a simple happiness should have... lasted forever. \n \nThat was until the \"enemy\" appeared. \n \nThe \"enemy\" had disturbed the peaceful relationship of the seven people. \nShinobu could not forgive that. He could not forgive the one that injures his companions, nor could he forgive the one that hurts another one\'s hearts. And when he realized all that, the world they reside in changed, rather then becoming the new world that it should have... they had arrived at the \"sanctuary\" instead. \n \nThis is a story that describes the heart. \n \nA story that describes the thing located in the farthest end of a heart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mox.jpg'),(6008,'Mr. Flipper','2019-08-04','Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You are Mr. Flipper, the only Flipper in a pinball world. \n \nYou can\'t wait for the ball to come to you, You\'ll have to move to the ball!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6009,'Dungeons & Darkness','2016-09-29','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore various dungeons, making use of various weapons and magic! Challenge the most deadly locations, make your name as an adventurer! Clear the corridors of monsters, collecting tools and weapons as you go. Watch out for booby traps!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p96.jpg'),(6010,'Tekken 3','1997-03-20','Fighting','Arcade','Tekken 3 is the third installment in the Tekken series, it maintains the same core fighting system as its predecessors but brings many improvements such as significantly more detailed graphics and animations, fifteen new characters added to the game\'s roster, more modern music and faster gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d7q.jpg'),(6011,'QP Shooting: Dangerous!!','2012-12-31','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','QP Shooting - Dangerous!! is a bullet hell type shoot\'em\'up starring the pudding-loving dog girl QP seen in 100% Orange Juice. Nothing can stand between QP and her pudding - not even difficulty options to reduce the experienced gamer to tears! The game has 5 stages and 4 difficulty levels, as well as 3 styles to chose from that affect the use of your hyper mode in-game. It also has an arcade and a conquest mode, which allows you to save after each stage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r1g.jpg'),(6012,'Digerati Presents: The Dungeon Crawl Vol. 1','2020-08-20','Shooter, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Nintendo Switch','Explore, loot, and battle! Four adventure-filled worlds in one unmissable bundle: Fall of Light: Darkest Edition: A story-driven action RPG set within a world consumed by darkness. An old warrior and his luminescent daughter embark on a dangerous journey to reach the last place on Earth still touched by sunlight. Reverse Crawl: A fast-paced turn-based strategy RPG that lets you lead mobs of monster minions and back-from-the-grave goons into battle against the elite ‘heroes’ of the Red Queen. Includes a local PvP mode, created exclusively for the Nintendo Switch. Skelly Selest: A score-attack slash dash run ‘n’ gun-athon that places players in the skeletal shoes of a Heavenly Keeper. Only the Selestial Order can defeat the sinful horrors that lurk in the depths of Hell. Unexplored: Unlocked Edition: Descend into the Dungeon of Doom, steal the Amulet of Yendor, and make it out alive. An accessible yet challenging action RPG, Unexplored is the roguelite that feels like a roguelike.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57ee.jpg'),(6013,'Dizzy Two','2021-02-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a legendary quest from the 80s, invented by the Oliver Twins, about a yolkfolk living in trees. The main character, Dizzy, constantly rescues relatives who get into trouble. And now he found himself on a strange island after his family was kidnapped by the Hunter...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oqe.jpg'),(6014,'Ink Plane','2018-09-16','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Short arcade game drawn and coded by Artur Petrov. \nYou have to fight the pirates in the air, sea and land.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6015,'Bloody Tentacles',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','you are a floating eyeball / jellyfish monster who hates helicopters and spikes\n\ncontrol your body using WASD or arrow keys, and your tentacles with the mouse by mousing over things when the mouse button is down','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6016,'Adventure Island','1992-04-23','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, Game Boy','Master Higgins\' girlfriend Tina, has just been kidnapped by the Evil Witch Doctor\'s persistent followers. Despite its English title, this is a handheld port of Adventure Island II, not its predecessor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79zw.jpg'),(6017,'Two Point Campus: Brainy Bundle','2023-11-16','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','For the truly studious, may we present an exciting limited-time offer crammed with all the extra tuition you could ever wish to stuff into your noggin. This collection of DLC and the base game is available in this awesome new value bundle, giving you the ultimate Campus experience, be it exploring brave new frontiers in Space Academy, or visiting the Lifeless Estate and getting all spooky in School Spirits, and the latest set of medical course mayhem in Medical School!\n\nSo if you\'re new to the game and want to try out everything Two Point Campus has to offer, grab your prospectus and join the brainy bunch today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7f4n.jpg'),(6018,'Borderlands 2: Psycho Pack','2013-05-14','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Take a peek at Pandora from behind the menacing eyes of Krieg, the Psycho Bandit, an all-new character and the 6th playable class in Borderlands 2. You’ve fought against them as enemies, now use that aggressive energy on the vault hunter’s side. Slice, dice, light yourself on fire and blow things up – taking damage was never so rewarding – or so much fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bu0.jpg'),(6019,'Cooking Mama: Cookstar','2020-04-28','Simulator','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Cooking Mama: Cookstar keeps the basic Cooking Mama formula with a few new features. The new vegetarian mode lets players avoid cooking meat-based recipes. Players can also show off their creations in the in-game social media network and build their clout over time. Players can use motion controls while the system is in docked mode, or alternate touchscreen controls while playing handheld.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22xu.jpg'),(6020,'PaRappa the Rapper: Stage 2 Music A',NULL,'Music','PlayStation Portable','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94n1.jpg'),(6021,'Gangster Bros','2009-03-16','Shooter, Platform','Web browser','Mario is on a hunt in the Gangster Bros Game! Help him fight his way through fire and vicious traps to rescue Ms. Princess Peach one more time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7m9x.jpg'),(6022,'NieR Re[in]carnation','2021-02-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, iOS','NieR Re[in]carnation is a role-playing video game which takes place in the universe of NieR and its sequel, NieR: Automata. Set in a realm called the Cage, the player takes on the role of a girl guided by a ghost-like being.\n\nThe gameplay is split into three parts: exploration, where players can roam the different stages of the Cage; weapon stories, which showcase memories from different characters in a side-scrolling painting-like perspective; and battles, featuring a mix of real-time combat with time-based skills. Players will have to assemble teams of 3 characters while taking into account their elements, roles and equipment in order to prevail in PvE and PvP encounters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bm4.jpg'),(6023,'Play Twice','2025-03-12','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Enjoy Twice\" – A new Sokoban-style puzzle game, Play Twice! Once you clear a stage, a second playthrough begins on the same board. Enjoy a dual-layered puzzle experience where strategic planning for the second round is the key to success!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ghd.jpg'),(6024,'Starseed','2025-03-24','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Starseed aims to slightly twist the peaceful, calming farm sim archetype. \"A farm sim with dark undertones and an isolated atmosphere\" - would be a fitting description.\n\nIt is still, in sense, a peaceful sim without combat, but this time there\'s no relationships to build, your interactions are with your helper robots and with mission control back on Earth. You are millions of miles from the people you\'re trying to save.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co421u.jpg'),(6025,'Iron Conflict','2021-01-07','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight for glory in Iron Conflict, an online competitive real-time strategy game that features both aircraft and tanks from WWII through today. Make use of military tactics and choose from hundreds of different units to win on the ground and in the air!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k19.jpg'),(6026,'Hillbilly Hellfire',NULL,'Shooter, Strategy, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Defend a holy relic in this third-person tower defense repelling waves of hellspawn using divine intervention and a bit of hillbilly ingenuity. Charge headfirst into fierce battles, outsmarting twisted foes with quick decisions, explosive turrets, and precision gunplay as you claim victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f4x.jpg'),(6027,'Road to Morrow',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Road to Morrow is a narrative-driven puzzle adventure game set in a near future Europe devastated by the effects of climate change. Explore this new normal through Iris, a girl whose memory was erased by an unknown event and must survive working for a company that controls everything. Travel around different countries created in a unique art style that bring together 2D and 3D graphics. Complete your tasks and reveal all the secrets of a world which is closer that you think.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wbi.jpg'),(6028,'Exo','2012-12-31','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An audiovisual exploratory game based on Gatekeeper\'s eponymous electronic studio album.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4aj6.jpg'),(6029,'Din\'s Curse: Demon War','2011-02-22','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Din\'s Curse: Demon War is the first expansion for the unique action RPG Din\'s Curse. Din\'s Curse is a single player and co-op multiplayer action RPG for Windows and Mac PCs with 141 class combinations (196 with the expansion), infinite number of dynamically generated towns, real consequences, and a dynamic, evolving world. \n \nMultiplayer notice: The online multiplayer portion of Din\'s Curse requires a unique CD key, which will be located in your game shelf. \nPlay the Demon Hunter class (now 196 total class combinations)! \nFight many new demons (3 new species, 8 new types, 40 new variants)! \nExperience a lot more of what makes Din\'s Curse incredibly unique!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21j4.jpg'),(6030,'Tanktics: Computer game of Armored Combat on the Eastern Front','1981-12-31','Strategy','Atari 8-bit, Commodore PET, Apple II, TRS-80, FM-7','Using only text commands, players engage in turn-based tank battles against AI opponents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f67.jpg'),(6031,'Human Cannonball','1978-12-31','Strategy, Arcade','Atari 2600','In Human Cannonball your goal is to fire a man out of a cannon and have him land in a bucket of water. To do this you need to adjust your cannon so the position, angle, and firing speed are just right. You score a point for each successful landing, and the game ends after seven attempts. Several game variations are included which allow you to have the position, angle and speed all set by the player, or have one or more of these in a fixed position, or have one or more of these randomly set by the computer. If you wish to make the game more challenging, you can also set a moving wall in front of the bucket which will make your timing more critical.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co986t.jpg'),(6032,'Tekken 6','2007-11-26','Fighting','Arcade, PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Tekken 6 is a fighting game developed and published by Bandai Namco Games. It is the seventh main installment in the Tekken franchise. It was released in Japanese arcades on November 26, 2007 as the first game running on the PlayStation 3-based System 357 arcade board. The game received an update, subtitled Bloodline Rebellion, a year later.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84sc.jpg'),(6033,'Harvest Moon: Save the Homeland','2017-05-09','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 2','The first Harvest Moon game for the PS2 takes a little deviance from all the other games in the series. The goal this time around is to save your town from being turned into a resort next year. The game focuses more on relationships than making money - which is the goal in all other Harvest Moon games to date. You still are running a farm and must succeed in the life of a farmer, but the actual gameplay rewards those who interact with the townspeople over those who just work the fields.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26e3.jpg'),(6034,'Spelljammer: Pirates of Realmspace','1992-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','Swashbuckling excitement and the magic of D&D adventures - in wildspace. Captain your own Spelljammer ship. Recruit officers and crew to man your magical ship. Soar into the ether and explore the planets of Realmspace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ki2.jpg'),(6035,'Blue Wednesday','2023-08-28','Point-and-click, Music, Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Blue Wednesday is a story about jazz and love, and about failure. The boring days pass for failed jazz pianist Morris. One day is the same as the next until Morris meets jazz saxophonist Angela.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63jp.jpg'),(6036,'Kamboja','2018-03-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kamboja is a Top Shooter Local Multiplayer Party Game wich you can compete with your friends with various types of weapons to see who kills more!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6037,'Castle of Lord Velimir','2024-09-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Epic battle against encroaching darkness. It is a baby from Warcraft 3, Dark Souls and Super Mario bros. Don\'t ask, it was wild party.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c96.jpg'),(6038,'Otomedius Excellent','2011-04-21','Shooter','Xbox 360','The lovely rocket-riding ladies of Otomedius Gorgeous arrive in the US for the first time in Otomedius Excellent, the highly anticipated sequel to the Japan-exclusive arcade hit. Otomedius Excellent is an Xbox 360 exclusive and features nearly ten playable characters, heart-pounding classic Gradius-style shoot-em-up gameplay, a dazzling array of stunning visuals, thrilling multiplayer action locally or via a connection to Xbox LIVE, an improved upgrade system, downloadable content and of course the Otomedius Excellent game disc. With all this and more it is sure to be the must-own arcade style shooter for Xbox 360 players in 2011 and beyond.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8iym.jpg'),(6039,'Dragon Fantasy: The Volumes of Westeria','2015-03-04','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, Linux, Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, PlayStation Vita','Experience an all-new old adventure! Fight your way through hordes of strange, silly, and scary monsters! Explore the caves, castles, and dungeons of an ancient evil! Meet warriors, princes, pirates, zombies, and crazy old woodsmen in a huge world of epic retro adventure! Authentic 8-bit artwork and an original soundtrack by renowned Bay Area 8-bit musician Crashfaster keeps the game true to its retro roots.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xuu.jpg'),(6040,'Little Witch Nobeta','2022-09-29','Shooter, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Control the lovely little witch Nobeta, explore the unknown mysterious castle, and gradually discover the truth!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6y4h.jpg'),(6041,'Tarven Guardians: Banquet','2018-11-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Tavern Guardians, a strategic match three RPG! Every action you take will determine your success against countless monsters and magical creatures. Take up arms as a heroic guardian and claim victory against evil!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6042,'Star Fox: Super Weekend','1994-01-31','Shooter','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','A promotional cartridge, Super Star Fox Weekend (Official Competition) (titled Star Wing: Official Competition in Europe), was released as part of the game\'s marketing campaign in Europe and the U.S. It featured time-limited single-player mode on modified stages, as well as an exclusive bonus level. The altered start-up screen displays \'Official Competition Cartridge\'. Depending on the points scored, players could win a t-shirt, a jacket, or trips to international destinations. An estimated 2000 cartridges were made.\n\nIn the United States, the Super Star Fox Weekend was played by tens of thousands of competitors in malls across the country. Stores such as KB Toys and Suncoast Video (usually any store that carried Super Nintendo games participated) hosted the event. After the competition, a limited number of the Super Weekend cartridges were sold through the Nintendo Power magazine, listed in the Spring 1994 \"Super Power Supplies\" catalog that was mailed to subscribers, with an original list price of $45.\n\nIn the United Kingdom, the competition was known as the Star Wing Challenge and was held in gaming shops across the country on May 29, 1993.\n\nNintendo Netherlands also held the Starwing competition at various game selling stores in early 1993. The winner of each day won a large Starwing poster. Starwing competition was also used during the Dutch Nintendo Championship in October 1993 – 1996.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ap2.jpg'),(6043,'Eggconsole Guardic MSX','2024-11-21','Shooter','Nintendo Switch','A shooting game from COMPILE that requires mapping. Explore the maze and destroy the enemy mothership at the deepest level!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93fk.jpg'),(6044,'Ungrateful Birds: Call of the Desert','2023-01-09','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A standalone companion game/expansion to Ungrateful Birds: No Good Deed, with 16 new stages and new birds. For one or two players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co601p.jpg'),(6045,'Madden NFL 22: Dynasty Edition','2021-08-20','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Dynasty Edition comes with:\n- 3 Day early access\n- Dual Entitlement\n- Franchise: 100 Staff Points\n- Face of the Franchise & The Yard: The General Player Class starting at Level 10\n- Tom Brady Gear Capsule\n- Choice of 1 out of 32 NFL Stars\n- Choice of Brady or Mahomes Elite Item\n- Exclusive Challenges during early access window\n- Choice of Brady or Mahomes Curated Legends Pack\n- 22 Team Fantasy Packs','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gl1.jpg'),(6046,'Fortnite Festival','2023-12-09','Music','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Play in a band with friends or perform solo on stage with hit music by your favorite artists in Fortnite Festival! On the Main Stage, play a featured rotation of Jam Tracks. Compete against friends for the best performance or team up to climb the leaderboards. The festival is just beginning with more Jam Tracks, Music Icons, concerts, and stages coming soon. Take your stage in Fortnite Festival!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ho6.jpg'),(6047,'Dead Effect','2014-11-03','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fight for your life in the INDIE SCI-FI FPS game fit for both casual and hard-core gamers with a passion for hunting down hordes of zombies. Prepare yourselves for the incoming nightmare! The ESS Meridian starship is travelling through space with a new FTL technology, heading towards its destination - Tau Ceti f, the first planet in the history of mankind to be colonized. A few months later an elite member of Unit 13 is disrupted from cryogenic sleep. But Tau Ceti f is nowhere in sight and something is very wrong. What happened to all those people? Why are they so aggressive and attack without any survival instincts?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fa80gqinjt4taddzzvzr.jpg'),(6048,'The Backrooms Experiment',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The Backrooms Experience is a co-op walking simulator with horror and thriller elements. Find your way in Backrooms, avoid the entities, cheese entities with voices, explore the levels, cooperate with your friends, and most importantly, do not die.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6260.jpg'),(6049,'Gotham by Gaslight',NULL,'Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Set at the end of the 19th century, Gotham by Gaslight follows the Dark Knight as he tracks down Jack the Ripper.\n\nThe game was cancelled after THQ failed to secure the rights. Concept illustrations and early prototype gameplay were released afterwards by developer Day 1 Studios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qsl.jpg'),(6050,'Baia',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Due to the volcanic eruption, the climate has become abnormal. Floodwaters are about to inundate our homes. Commander, please lead the people to quickly build an ark and save them!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i2h.jpg'),(6051,'Run! Bunny','2019-08-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','STORY\nThere are many small animals living in a coastal town, there was a peaceful life. But now, all is being controlled by baddy devil, and the town is full of danger and risky. You are a bunny name of Mr. Tiny Green, came out to find some carrots to eat and found the devil, decide to do something about it to restore peace.\n\nGAMEPLAY\nIn a level-based gameplay loop, each level’s objective is the same: collect 3 carrots and back to the starting point.In most cases, Only directional movement control is required. Just a few levels require some extra button. For example, the BOSS level of 15 levels needs to be taken on a boat with A button(Controller) or Space(Keyboard). A controller is recommended for precision maneuver over varios danger, Both joystick and D-pad have their own advantage in different circumstances. the joystick is more comfortable to control, and the D-pad is more precise. The keyboard uses WSAD key to move, and the game feel is between the two.\n\nAnd,each level’s limitation is also the same: 5 lives and limited play time. But there’s checkpoints for each of you to make mistakes and be a little happy about failtures\n＼(￣▽￣)／\n\nFEATURES\n1、Level-based Bullet Hell experience\n2、Up to 30 levels (for now)\n3、Support Xbox controller and keyboard(Mac Not Support Controller)\n4、Two unique Boss battle. Beware o the final one\n5、Cute animals, more carrots!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r7k.jpg'),(6052,'LEGO Juniors Create & Cruise','2016-03-22','Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Little Kids 4/7 can create their lego vehicles and run them on the roads, getting bonus pieces when picking points on the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p6q.jpg'),(6053,'Grisaia Phantom Trigger Vol.5.5','2019-04-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Three months have passed since Arisaka Shiori started her somewhat special position as a teacher at Mihama Academy, the \"school of assassins\", when she is forced to take an objective look at herself. Does she want to continue in this job? Which world will she choose to live in?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41hg.jpg'),(6054,'LMA Manager 2002','2001-11-02','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PlayStation','LMA 2002 was the final version in the series to be released on PlayStation, launched in October 2001. Although chiefly just an update from the 2001 version, the game did prove to be quite a stepping stone from the LMA of old and the LMA seen today.\n\nThe first PlayStation 2 incarnation went under the same name when released in April 2002. A significant update from PS1, it allowed players to manage in one of six European leagues, all of which were processed by the game simultaneously (the top two divisions in Italy, Spain, Germany and France were added, in addition to the existing top four divisions in England and Scotland). On the PS2, matches played out in full in a 3D match environment, followed by post-match highlights voiced by famous BBC presenter Gary Lineker alongside the returning Hansen. The game play advanced in this game from the 2001 version, in particular the in-match style. Players tend to shoot early, from around thirty yards, rather than enter into the penalty area.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h0u.jpg'),(6055,'Generations','2022-10-02','Puzzle, Indie','iOS, Mac, Playdate','A puzzle game about organization and family.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jwa.jpg'),(6056,'The Tide Intro','2020-02-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\'The Tide Intro\' is only the beginning. Stay alert for \'The Tide\' coming up soon this year!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m28.jpg'),(6057,'Fragments of Euclid','2017-02-26','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fragments of Euclid is a game about exploring and solving puzzle in a mind-bending environment inspired by M.C. Escher.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26l3.jpg'),(6058,'God of War III: Collector\'s Edition','2010-03-19','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3','Set in the realm of brutal Greek mythology, God of War III is a single-player game that allows players to take on the climatic role of the ex-Spartan warrior, Kratos, as he scales through the intimidating heights of Mt. Olympus and the dark depths of Hell to seek revenge on those who have betrayed him. Armed with double-chained blades, and an array of new weapons and magic for this iteration of the trilogy, Kratos must take on mythology\'s darkest creatures while solving intricate puzzles throughout his merciless quest to destroy Olympus.\n\nThe limited God of War III Collector\'s Edition includes:\n- God of War III game\n- Collectible packaging\n- Art cards\n- Phantom of Chaos skin*\n- Dominus Skin*\n- God of War arena*\n* requires online connection to download','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eni.jpg'),(6059,'Kitaria Fables','2021-09-02','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Action Adventure fused with RPG and Farming elements. Armed with sword, bow and spellbook, fight against a rising darkness threatening the world. Plunder dungeons in search of relics and resources, tend to your farm to make provisions and potions, and take on quests solo, or with a friend!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co394s.jpg'),(6060,'Essence of Waluigi II: Eternal Awakening','2022-03-31','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','One year after the events of Essence Of Waluigi, Mario & Luigi are knocked out. While they were sleeping, Waluigi brings back the Essence thanks to the help of a mysterious new partner. Soon, the Mario bros. wake up to find that Toad Town is in ruins. Along with that, a strange looking moon has started to travel towards the planet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fnd.jpg'),(6061,'There\'s No Santa','2024-11-28','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','There\'s no Santa is a hidden object game with a selection of 4 locations and Christmas-themed items to find for each of them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ras.jpg'),(6062,'Hot Shots Golf 2','2023-01-17','Sport','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Experience Hot Shots Golf 2 originally released on the PlayStation console, enhanced with up-rendering, rewind, quick save, and custom video filters.\n\nCombining addictive gameplay and stunning visuals, Hot Shots Golf 2 delivers a comprehensive golfing experience, with a wacky sense of humour.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61z6.jpg'),(6063,'Frederic: Evil Strikes Back','2014-05-08','Music, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Frederic - Evil Strikes Back - The Bigger, Better, More Awesome sequel. Great new tracks. Great new locations. Great new features. Great new story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27q7.jpg'),(6064,'Welcome to Moreytown','2017-05-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Claw your way to the top of Moreytown, a furry slum for human-animal hybrids. Will you take down the gangs who rule the town, or take them over instead?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9721.jpg'),(6065,'White Cat Project','2014-07-24','Sin género','Android, iOS','White Cat Project is a free-to-play action role-playing game developed and published by Colopl for Android and iOS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rvg.jpg'),(6066,'Kingdom Come: Deliverance - Royal DLC Package','2019-05-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dvd.jpg'),(6067,'Learn to Play Vol. 9: Santa\'s Sleigh Ride','2024-12-24','Puzzle, Racing','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','You are Santa Clause and it\'s your task to deliver all the Christmas presents, just in time for the holidays.\nHop on your sleigh, fly over a bustling town, decide who\'s been good or bad and deliver lots of wonderful presents to all the happy townsfolk.\nWatch out for obstacles in the sky! Can you make it in time for Christmas?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co979o.jpg'),(6068,'Archetype Arcadia','2021-10-21','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The world has fallen to Peccato Mania (original sin), which causes self-harm and other problems.\n\nTo save his younger sister Christine, who has been stricken by the disease, Rust full-dive into the online game \"Archetype Arcadia\", which is the only way to stop the progress of the symptom.\n\nHope, pain, joy, betrayal, and inevitable \"death\" are found in this game, where the memories of the players turn into avatars and fight.\n\nA fully-voiced text novel adventure game that tells a terrifying story of the overwhelming volume, led by memories that should have been lost.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7530.jpg'),(6069,'Viv and Bob','2019-06-19','Puzzle','Web browser, Game Boy','Viv and Bob is a puzzle game made with GB Studio 1.1 where you play Viv and Bob, trying to exit the many rooms of the mansion\'s basement. While Bob is strong enough to push blocks to their designated places, Lil Viv is light enough to walk above insecure parts of the floor. Bob and Viv are trapped in two sides of a mirror. The room Bob is standing in is a mirrored version of Viv\'s room and vice versa. Actions on one side of the mirror affect the other side as well. Switch between both protagonists and always think about both sides of the mirror.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h2z.jpg'),(6070,'Wildlife Park 2','2006-05-12','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Now\'s the chance to build the Zoo of your dreams! Just like in a real Zoo, your animals must receive complete care. Feed them, train them, cure them and even relocate them. Observe their realistic interactions with one another, the landscape, the play equipment and even Zoo visitors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l1x.jpg'),(6071,'Love Tore: Sweet','2012-09-27','Music, Visual Novel','Xbox 360','Fill your days with dance, rhythm and girls. Set up the Kinect and let Love Tore pull you into the dance club. The game is a trilogy of challenges. The first game Sweet sets up stage where you meet the girls in your club. Get used to holding their hands and their waists and guiding them across the dance floor.\n\nHowever, the club room is not the only place you practice. You might get into situations where you have to dance in swim suits. Practice the different routines and get used to all sorts of beats, because the club\'s over if you can\'t lead the girls to steal the show during the school festival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co758y.jpg'),(6072,'Moonrise',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Moonrise combines the deep strategy of a collectible card game with the tactical pacing of a head-to-head fighting game. \n \nThroughout history, the enigmatic event known as the Moonrise has periodically caused widespread fear and destruction. As its corrupting shadow spread across the land, peaceful creatures known as Solari were transformed into savage Lunari, attacking towns and cities for months until the effect faded. In recent times, Moonrises have been rare, sometimes separated by centuries, and their corruption lasting mere days. But that’s changing now, as the cycle intensifies once again, and the world faces an age of danger and uncertainty. \n \nNow it’s time for you to set off on a grand adventure to protect your world and fulfill your destiny to become a master Warden.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qqi.jpg'),(6073,'Injustice: Gods Among Us','2013-04-19','Fighting, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Wii U, Xbox 360','What if our greatest heroes became our greatest threat? Injustice: Gods Among Us introduces a bold new franchise to the fighting game genre from NetherRealm Studios, creators of the definitive fighting game Mortal Kombat. Featuring DC Comics icons such Batman, Cyborg, The Flash, Harley Quinn, Nightwing, Solomon Grundy, Superman and Wonder Woman, the latest title from the award-winning studio presents a deep original story. Heroes and villains will engage in epic battles on a massive scale in a world where the line between good and evil has been blurred.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8616.jpg'),(6074,'Detective Girl of the Steam City','2019-07-19','Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Detective Girl of the Steam City is the story of Sophie, a private investigator not unlike Sherlock Holmes. It\'s up to Sophie to uncover the mysteries of the Steam City through her investigations. What mysteries and intrigue await her? Find out in this Steam Punk RPG!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xbt.jpg'),(6075,'Horizon Worlds','2021-12-09','Sin género','Meta Quest 2, PC (Microsoft Windows), Meta Quest 3, Oculus Rift','(Meta) Horizon Worlds is an ever-expanding VR world to explore, play and create. Defy distance, discover extraordinary experiences and be inspired by others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v7t.jpg'),(6076,'Endless Nesla','2023-01-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Endless Nesla is a demanding infinite runner game with dynamic movement mechanics and immersive graphics. Escape Nesla, and challenge other players on the Leaderboards !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zwx.jpg'),(6077,'Biomes O\' Plenty','2012-09-24','Simulator, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Biomes O\' Plenty is an expansive biome mod for Minecraft that adds a slew of new, unique biomes to the Overworld and Nether! To go along with the new biomes, it adds new plants, flowers, trees, building blocks, and much more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6130.jpg'),(6078,'Sphere: Flying Cities - Save the World Edition',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c7c.jpg'),(6079,'Arcane Sorcery','2015-09-15','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Arcane Sorcery is a 4x strategy game. You are a sorcerer king. Cast powerful spells from afar from one of 4 spell books. Train units and build your economy. \n \nHigh strategy on a campaign map as well in turn base battles. \n \nChallenging AI that does not get buffs in all but the hardest difficulty.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6080,'Dead Island 2: Deluxe Edition','2023-04-21','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Deluxe Edition includes two premium character packs, featuring a unique costume and weapon, and the Golden Weapons Pack. Pre-purchase now and get the Memories of Banoi pack, with two weapons, a special weapon perk and skill card.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54b7.jpg'),(6081,'Warmonger: Sins of the Naga',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Gunpowder and Sorcery Squad-Based Tower Defense game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hqj.jpg'),(6082,'The Red Hat','2015-09-22','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98ht.jpg'),(6083,'JiangHu Record of Another World','2019-07-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Video 1 is recorded in the 3D game \"JiangHu Record Of Another World\", which has been updated to 3D version 0,5 in November. The game screenshots are shown in 2D and 3D. Publish the 3D release on STEAM every week.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59ki.jpg'),(6084,'Traysia','1992-02-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','In Traysia the player controls a young man named Roy, who lives in the town Johanna. All his life Roy has been dreaming about leaving the town and going to explore faraway lands. Now, finally, his chance has come. His uncle, a travelling merchant, is going on a journey, and Roy decides to leave with him. His girlfriend Traysia gives him a pendant, to remind him of her... will Roy be able to escape from all the dangers that await him on his long journey and to see Traysia again?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p3r.jpg'),(6085,'Jamsterdam','2019-04-29','Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A game about trying to be a Jazz musician in Amsterdam.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6086,'Conditus','2022-06-14','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Show your friends who\'s the strongest ninja, and make them suffer. Or team up with them to eliminate your enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ufn.jpg'),(6087,'Batman: The Brave and the Bold - The Videogame','2010-09-07','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Wii, Nintendo DS','The Brave and the Bold the Videogame fully immerses fans into the vivid animated world of the successful TV series where kids can play as Batman or together with family and friends in two-player co-op mode. Players can choose from iconic characters Robin, Green Lantern, Blue Beetle, along with drop-in heroes such as Aquaman to help solve puzzles and fight foes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hfo.jpg'),(6088,'UNB','2025-03-05','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Uh oh! Your tryin to HANG OUT WITH YOUR FRIEND ALIEN, but HIS UGLY and STUPID CYC is trying to KILL you! He\'s an STICKFIGUTRE, the only way to get to his GLASSES? The power of FL STUDIO...\n\nPRESENTED BY THE RIZZ RESIDENCE CREW','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jma.jpg'),(6089,'Shoot. Push. Repeat.','2020-06-08','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This fun and dynamic clicker puzzle game will not leave anyone indifferent! You have to deliver the blue ball to the desired point using only the laws of physics!\nThe game is a worthy successor to the Oik series, taking only the best from it.\nA huge number of various puzzles will not leave anyone indifferent!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a1d.jpg'),(6090,'Legends of Heropolis','2015-12-24','Simulator','Android, iOS','In Legends of Heropolis you manage a small town which is a secret base of super heroes. The heroes are residents in the town. They do farming, manufacturing products to sell while responding to distress calls from different areas where villains attack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uzd.jpg'),(6091,'Ultimate Fishing Simulator: Amazon River',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d0n.jpg'),(6092,'Flightless','2017-10-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Flightless is a tile-based puzzle adventure game. Navigate your way through a series of floating islands, each presenting a curious puzzle. A minimalist art style and calming piano soundtrack complement senses of wonder and discovery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2beo.jpg'),(6093,'Boku ha Tomodachi ga Sukunai Portable','2012-02-23','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','It\'s a shame that these girls are going to be turned into a game.\n\nBoku wa Tomodachi ga Sukunai Portable is a romantic comedy visual novel based on the light novel, with an all-new original storyline.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4idq.jpg'),(6094,'Bad North: Jotunn Edition - Deluxe Edition','2019-07-24','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Bad North: Jotunn Edition Deluxe Edition is an upgrade for the Bad North Game\n\nUpgrade includes:\nEnhanced Commander Portraits Show the invading forces the might of your kingdom with new royalty-themed artwork. Original soundtrack files Composed by award-winning sound designer Martin Kvale, available for digital download.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cbk.jpg'),(6095,'Erovoice! Sexy Voices Lead to a Successful Love Life','2018-12-21','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The story’s protagonist is a young man infatuated with the audio design in adult works he enjoys. Oftentimes, he\'ll end up focusing on the audio much more than the actual visuals, making him an auralist. One day, while browsing through job applications, he stumbles across a posting for a general affairs office worker, made by Cuckoo Clock. The company focuses on voice acting recording for erotic games, working with a number of voice actresses to provide the necessary samples and dialogue.\n\nOverjoyed by the opportunity to work together with the actresses he adores so much, the protagonist happily applies for the job. Soon, he begins working at the office, performing a number of sometimes unexpectedly intimate tasks. In his line of work, he comes to meet new and long-time voice actresses, as well as spend time with the team’s sound engineer and manager. Just what kind of trouble could he get into while working for the studio?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vtm.jpg'),(6096,'Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War - Master Collection','2014-05-14','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Prepare yourself for the grim, dark future of the 41st millennium, where alien races battle mankind for galactic domination in a universe of unending war.\nPersonalize your armies with a revolutionary unit customization tool that gives you the ability to choose your armies insignias, banners, squad colors and names.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uk0.jpg'),(6097,'Wario Blast: Featuring Bomberman!','1994-11-01','Puzzle, Strategy','Game Boy','OH, NO! Wario has stumbled upon the secret gateway into Bomberland! Now the greedy warmonger wants to claim the land, its inhabitants, and treasures as his own. Entering the underground labyrinth, he meets the resistance of the Madbombers - explosives experts who have some TNT tricks and surprises to toss at Wario. The battle heats up as Wario and Bomberman each try to outwit the other, level by level in a dynamite duel!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b96.jpg'),(6098,'The Waystone\'s Toll: A Diorama Mini-Dungeon','2020-10-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the town of Knights Passing, demons swarm the streets at night. A Standalone Diorama Dungeoncrawl Adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p07.jpg'),(6099,'Time Walker: Dark World','2023-11-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','This is a roguelike auto chess game with automatic combat. Players need to adjust the formation, plan resources, and match the skills provided in the loot to different occupations. to meet the challenges of the next wave.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90aw.jpg'),(6100,'Evan\'s Remains: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cp6.jpg'),(6101,'The Legend of HyperStar','2020-08-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Legend of HyperStar is a roguelike,Darksoul like indiegame.Play a well-trained, beautiful and powerful brave girl, challenge various levels. Get more powerful props, strengthen runes and skills, and get better weapons and equipment in random events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43x8.jpg'),(6102,'Faraday Protocol','2021-08-12','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Faraday Protocol is a first-person, story-driven puzzle game that will award you with a solid sense of accomplishment when overcoming its challenges. You are Raug Zeekon, interstellar archeologist from planet Cunor. You have been sent by your company to investigate the source of a mysterious signal coming from an unexplored star system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2swm.jpg'),(6103,'Akanesasu Sekai de Kimi to Utau','2017-12-31','Puzzle, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Akanesasu Sekai de Kimi to Utau (茜さすセカイでキミと詠う) or Reciting With You in the Glowing Red World is a Japanese smartphone app game produced by GCREST.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6845.jpg'),(6104,'Azul Baronis','2008-07-06','Shooter, Arcade','Web browser','A top-down spaceship shooter flash game produced by Mofunzone.com in like 2007.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fjf.jpg'),(6105,'Hand Simulator: Horror','2020-12-21','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fear clouds the mind. Fear paralyzes the body. If your hands are shaking with fear, you will remain in this hell forever.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41ky.jpg'),(6106,'Killzone 2','2009-02-26','Shooter','PlayStation 3','Killzone 2 is the third game in the Killzone franchise and continues the story two years after the events of the first two games. The gameplay consists of what the developers describe as Hollywood Realism, focusing on scripted, cinematic gameplay. The game is played entirely from the first-person perspective, except for the portions with vehicular combat with a tank and an exoskeleton. Next to the single-player campaign, there is squad-based multiplayer called Warzone with five different kinds of missions (Assassination, Search & Retrieve, Search & Destroy, Bodycount and Capture & Hold) based on seven kinds of classes. There is support for up to 32 players, with the addition of bots to fill the remaining spots.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3j9z.jpg'),(6107,'The Valley In My Mind','2017-12-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore several unique environments and fight to escape with your life! After awaking in a strange realm, you must uncover your hidden past and carve a path back home. Collect upgrade parts to craft the tools you need to make the cut, and choose an ancient power to aid you in your journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23ff.jpg'),(6108,'Crime O\'Clock','2023-06-30','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Crime O\'Clock is an investigation and time exploration game with a deep storyline. Investigate cases through time and evolving maps by unveiling a multi-eras linked story. Will you be observant enough to solve the mysteries? Crime waits for no man!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co559r.jpg'),(6109,'DC: Batman Bat-Tech Edition','2021-08-05','Adventure','Android, iOS','The ultimate augmented reality Batman mobile experience, featuring Bat-Tech STEM-inspired stories, mini-games, stickers, and more. Travel through Gotham City in a way that’s never been done before - augmented reality. Learn how to use Batman’s unique technology, take on challenges against Batman’s most evil adversaries, and play Batman versions of fan favorite mobile games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ju5.jpg'),(6110,'I Wanna Maker','2020-02-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','I Wanna Maker is a precision platformer with a robust level editor and online level sharing, based on I Wanna Be The Guy fangames. Create complex levels using a variety of objects, a powerful events system, and customizable visuals. Browse levels online, make playlists, and take on challenge modes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bzw.jpg'),(6111,'Club Nintendo Picross Plus','2014-10-19','Puzzle','Nintendo 3DS','Club Nintendo Picross Plus is a Japan-only Nintendo 3DS eShop Picross title, sequel to Club Nintendo Picross. It is very similar to its predecessor, featuring all the original content from the first, as well as being packed with over 100 new puzzles. The game could only be downloaded through the Club Nintendo rewards program.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4z2a.jpg'),(6112,'Sclash','2023-08-04','Fighting, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Sclash is a plug’n-play 2D samurai fighting game full of tension where one hit is enough to kill.\nPlay as a hand-drawn samurai in beautiful painted settings and fight your opponent in epic solemn duels where each move matters. Manage well your stamina, breath and take your time to land a deadly hit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40v4.jpg'),(6113,'Pure Chess: Grandmaster Edition','2016-09-09','Sin género','Xbox One','\"Pure Chess: Grandmaster Edition\" is a stunning celebration of the greatest strategy game of all time.\n\nThe Pure Chess Grandmaster Edition iincludes a variety of beautifully crafted, exclusive Chess Sets and Chess Pieces, from the antique to the modern day. There’s a chess set and setting to suit everyone’s style.\n\nFeatures:\n9 chess sets created with stunning detail and precision\n6 locations beautifully portrayed\nComprehensive tutorial that teaches you basic, intermediate, and advanced chess techniques\nTrack your ELO and Tournament ratings in the ranking boards','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/p6ccr18v7lpmxujw8d5h.jpg'),(6114,'RideOp','2018-10-18','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RideOp puts you in control of some of the biggest and most thrilling theme park rides in the world. Give all your guests the most unforgettable experience! With full control of the ride\'s motion, you can offer a unique journey every ride. Now it\'s your turn to create thrilling experiences!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co243a.jpg'),(6115,'Phantasie','1987-03-01','Role-playing (RPG)','Atari 8-bit, PC-9800 Series, PC-8800 Series, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Sharp X1, Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, Amiga, Apple II, FM-7, MSX','The Isle of Gelnor is divided by a chain of mountains into two regions. The west is the traditional domain of human and humanoid beings - with a few renegade Orcs and Lizardmen - dedicated to order and goodness. The east is inhabited by more exotic creatures - dragons, trolls and giants. These regions have been waging war throughout the history of the Great land.\n\nSince the Great invasion by the evil sorcerer Nikademus, the isle of Gelnor has been terrorized by his merciless Black Knights. To maintain their reign of terror, the Black Knights travel from town to town, demanding sacrifices and homage.\n\nYou are an adventurer looking for fame and fortune, as most of them do, and you see your chance here. Those Black Knights deserves your attention no matter the costs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dhikh0hzeca5exi4to7s.jpg'),(6116,'Valkyrie Star: A Cacophony Choir','2025-03-18','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Valkyrie Star: A Cacophony Choir, where four seasoned magical girls—now teachers—must juggle their everyday lives with the duty to battle evil. This unique JRPG offers a fresh take on the magical girl genre, showing characters who moved into adulthood while never abandoning their fight for justice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9egq.jpg'),(6117,'Star Matter',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Star Matter is a single-player, 2D, tile based, spaceship physics RPG, where you pilot a ship that you are able to customize and configure to suit the current task, your playstyle, or what remains of your ship.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h9m.jpg'),(6118,'Napoleon\'s Campaigns','2013-12-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The greatest historical strategy game about Napoleon\'s Campaigns is here! Napoleon\'s Campaigns is a realistic simulation of the campaigns fought by the renowned French emperor between 1805 and 1815. In addition to reliving these landmarks of operational maneuver across Europe, the game also includes the Peninsula War (1808-1814) and even a what-if scenario where Napoleon invades England (1805).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ync.jpg'),(6119,'Flood: The Prequel','2017-09-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You wake up this morning, just like any other day. You look at your T.V. and see there is nothing to watch. You check you email, then BAM!!! An angel appears in your home telling you that you are the Chosen of God and says he is going to send you to the time before the flood.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bez.jpg'),(6120,'Simulators Mega Bundle: Truck, Construction, Farming, Offroad, Bus','2025-03-06','Racing, Simulator, Strategy','Nintendo Switch','Drive, build, and thrive in the ultimate simulator pack!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ino.jpg'),(6121,'Touhou Danmaku Kagura: Phantasia Lost - Digital Deluxe Edition','2024-02-07','Shooter, Music, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','This bundle contains the game Touhou Danmaku Kagura Phantasia Lost together with Additional Song Packs 1 to 4 and the Digital Soundtrack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7u6d.jpg'),(6122,'Suzumiya Haruhi no Chokuretsu','2009-05-28','Strategy, Visual Novel','Nintendo DS','Suzumiya Haruhi no Chokuretsu is a visual novel where Kyon and the other SOS Brigade members are forced to investigate weird phenomenas happening around the school after Haruhi heard about it, now they have to figure out what\'s causing these strange things to happen without her noticing,','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e7k.jpg'),(6123,'Antadin DX','2020-09-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A dark jrpg with tough choices that change the story. You play as the last of the antadins, the protector of the queen of your colony. You have to traverse bleak, corrupted caverns, inhabitated by a myriad of different insects. Trying to protect your ward.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57xv.jpg'),(6124,'LepozhdianVibe',NULL,'Shooter, Racing, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lepozhdian Vibe is an immersive simulator inspired by the synthwave aesthetic and the 1980s. It\'s a game where creativity and freedom take center stage. We offer a variety of modes: sandbox, classic shooters, arcade racing, social dynamic modes like Mafia, and even an editor where you can create your own maps, stories, and worlds.\n\nLepozhdian presents a unique game that knows it’s a game. In this experience, reality and the game world intertwine, breaking the fourth wall. Characters discuss their roles, the game’s rules, and even address the player directly, creating an unforgettable experience. It’s more than a game — it’s a reflection on what a game truly is.\n\nThere are no strict boundaries in the game. Want to build a city? Go ahead. Prefer competition? Host races or battles with friends. It\'s all up to you.\n\nOur game supports multiplayer, style customization, and VR. Want to play in your own atmosphere, with personalized interface settings and weapons? No problem. Most importantly, we\'ve added modding capabilities through a built-in programming language. Everything you need for creativity is already in the game.\n\nLepozhdian Vibe is a free game with no microtransactions. However, the project\'s support relies entirely on you. Subscribe to our Patreon if you\'d like to help us make the game even better.\n\nThis format allows us to continually develop and improve the game, respond promptly to your feedback, add new content, fix bugs, and implement innovative ideas. This gives us the flexibility to keep the game fresh and engaging for you over a long period of time.\n\nWe are confident that this approach will allow us to create something truly special and captivating. Together with you, we can develop a game that will bring joy for years to come.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95tv.jpg'),(6125,'Cataline HD','2011-06-30','Sin género','iOS','Blast your way through the embroidered world of Cataline HD! Set in a world made entirely of fabric, wool and yarn, this physics-based puzzler lets you play as Cataline the ginger cat, who has to fly and land safely in a fish bowl to catch a meal. Launch her from a thimble and knitting needles - just let her fly and fall into a fish bowl.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6126,'URG','2021-02-02','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','URG is a retro-style side-scrolling arcade shooter with beautiful 3D graphics and a ton of action with big explosions and a co-op mode for up to four players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s3p.jpg'),(6127,'Oddlly','2019-01-26','Puzzle','Android','The point of the game is to connect as much blocks as possible using swipe and destroy other blocks to get the highest score. Each block that connected to the pile increases pile\'s points exponantially.And if you manage to connect all the blocks of one kind you started with, score of that pile will be doubled.You can not destroy standalone blocks.Each level has a minimum score point you must reach in order to unlock the next level in challenge mode.As you progress in Challenge Mode,difficulty increases like limitations to the moves you can make gets restricted, e.g. only allowed to swipe up. Try it out,Have Fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j24.jpg'),(6128,'Magicami','2020-09-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Visual Novel','Web browser, Legacy Mobile Device','A brand-new turn-based RPG game filled with sexy magical girls! Can you unravel the mysteries? Assist the beautiful Kamisaman in stopping the raging demons and helping to get a world engulfed in chaos back to order and harmony. Every choice you make will bring you one step closer to shaping a brighter future for all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31pr.jpg'),(6129,'Hamster Playground','2022-08-22','Puzzle, Racing, Simulator, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Prepare for cuteness overload, relentless training, and fierce rivalry as you and your hamsters take on challenges while traversing the maze and riding a skateboard! Be the first ones to cross the finish line to earn rewards and yummy treats!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87gf.jpg'),(6130,'Percy the Penguin Saves Christmas','2017-12-18','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Percy the Penguin is a platformer designed to mimic old arcade games, such as \"Mario Bros.\" and \"Bubble Bobble\". Throw snowballs at rogue Christmas toys to stun them, and touch them to wrap them in a present. Once every enemy is wrapped up, continue on to the next level! For 1-2 players locally, on PC and Mac.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xi1pwyor0kp7uklw1ybr.jpg'),(6131,'Cheddly and Cloud\'s Crazy Adventure 2',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6132,'Police Simulator - Law Enforcement',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Astragon Entertainment and Bigmoon Entertainment are teaming up to entertain with the release of Police Simulator - Law Enforcement.\n\nDazzling blue lights, high-speed chases and exciting investigative work: hobby sleuths can be looking forward to a new police simulation game for their PC! In cooperation with Portuguese developer Bigmoon Entertainment, astragon Entertainment is very happy to announce Police Simulator – Law Enforcement today.\n\nSlip into the role of a real US police officer and discover exciting day-to-day policework while on patrol through a city developed using the Unreal Engine 4!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6133,'StarsOne','2016-04-08','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You’ll see an unexplored world full of dangers, mysteries and adventures. You will explore randomly generated planets, develop industry, conduct trade, plant colonies, explore outer space.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fk4.jpg'),(6134,'G-Mode Archives+: Megami Tensei Gaiden: Shinyaku Last Bible II - Hajimari no Fukuin','2022-11-28','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Boy, be the light that illuminates the world. The gospel of the beginning rings out in the land covered with despair.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hbw.jpg'),(6135,'Steel Republic: Rail Defender','2024-04-15','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SRRD is a hybrid of Strategy Railroad Logistics, Resource gathering, Base building, and Tower Defense','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fs5.jpg'),(6136,'Hoyle Casino','2000-12-31','Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Dreamcast','Set in a virtual Las Vegas casino, players create profiles and are given a set amount of virtual money. A player can then visit any part of the virtual casino and wager their virtual money as they could in a real casino. The game offers instant access to the rules for each game, as well as real time tips and strategies as the player plays a game. Hoyle Casino features 25 default characters to choose from, or players can simply create their own unique custom character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40o0.jpg'),(6137,'Go! Go! Nippon! 2015','2015-10-16','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A standalone expansion of Go! Go! Nippon! that nearly doubles the content of the original game––adding new locations like Tokyo Skytree, Odaiba, Comiket, and more! The expansion renders the game in 720p widescreen format, with both new and old CGs in the new aspect ratio.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vx0.jpg'),(6138,'Fernbus Simulator: Bavarian Castle','2020-12-18','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This free DLC will add the famous and romantic 19th-century bavarian castle to the world of Fernbus Simulator.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6139,'Sea Wolf','1976-03-31','Shooter, Arcade','Commodore VIC-20, Arcade, Commodore C64/128/MAX','Sea Wolf is an arcade game by Midway, originally released in 1976. The player looks through a large periscope to aim at ships moving across the virtual sea line at the top of the screen, using a thumb button on the right handle of the scope to fire torpedoes. The periscope swivels to the right and left, providing horizontal motion of a targeting cross-hair. The cabinet features a mixture of video game and older electro-mechanical technology for player feedback. Using back-lit transparencies reflected inside the scope, the number of torpedoes remaining are displayed, as well as a red \"RELOAD\" light which lights up momentarily when the player has launched five torpedoes. Additionally, when ships are hit on the screen, an explosion \"light\" is reflected inside the scope. A blue overlay is affixed to the screen to provide a \"water color\" to the sea. Sounds include a sonar ping and the sound of the PT Boat racing across the screen. Sea Wolf is time-limited, with the player having an opportunity to win bonus time by reaching an operator-set score. The player\'s score is shown on the bottom half of the screen as well as the high score, one of the first known instances of a high score in a video game. Targets include destroyers, a fast moving PT Boat, and mines floating across the screen can that serve as obstructions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xo3hk9shfyrugjelnayk.jpg'),(6140,'Late Night 1320','2019-03-16','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Experience a blast to the past of old school drag racing in its purest form. Find a variety of classic cars, trucks, and odd vehicles from the junkyard and rescue them from their inevitable demise. Once you\'ve restored and fixed your junker, take it to the backroads and compete against a variety of racers to earn their respect. Work your way up the chain and gain rep with the local crowd. Discover new drag spots to further work your way up the chain and continue upgrading your car. Compete at the drag strip for the ultimate test against sponsored racers and become the Late Night king.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6141,'Wolf And Moon: Nonogram','2021-06-13','Puzzle','Android','This logic puzzle that anyone can enjoy.\nWake up your brain with hundreds of puzzles.\nNonogram is a picture puzzle game in which players color the empty cells according to given numbers.\nFind the illustrations hidden behind the numbers!\nFind the answer while following simple rules and complete the amazing dot illustrations by coloring them.\nUpgraded tutorial and convenience features are available.\nIf you like logical puzzles, play this game now!\nComplete the cool dot illustrations by following some simple rules.\nEnjoy the hundreds of cool dot illustrations for you to collect.\nCollect various dot illustrations while reading a great story!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mpm.jpg'),(6142,'Recettear: An Item Shop\'s Tale','2010-09-10','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Recettear is an item-shop-focused role-playing game. That means that the core gameplay revolves around running your item store. You will find or purchase items, sell them to townsfolk, and manage your store with an eye toward repaying a debt each week. The game is beaten when the debt is completely repaid.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jkp.jpg'),(6143,'Seeds of Chaos','2020-01-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Not your average visual novel, Seeds of Chaos is a sexy dark fantasy tale with RPG & Strategy elements. Become an active participant in the story, making choices which impact your experience and shape the direction of the narrative.\n\nSeeds of Chaos is a dark fantasy eroge made in Ren\'py, inspired by the worldbuilding of Berserk, Dark Souls, The Witcher and other epic fantasy series\', as well as the adult games Corruption of Champions, Legend of Queen Opala, and Slavemaker. The game is set in The Six Realms, the westernmost continent in the world of Solanse. Seven years have passed since the last Demon War, and the defeat of Lord Karnas at the hands of the forces of Light ushered in a new era of peace and prosperity for all the races of the six kingdoms. Evil never lies dormant for long, however, and in the shadows new threats to the tenuous peace begin to stir.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m9l.jpg'),(6144,'Mining Mechs: Camel Chaos','2025-02-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a brand new map and storyline set in the Desert. In this brand new adventure, unidentified animal sounds have been detected underground and of course the only logical solution is to dig down in your mining mech and find out what\'s going on.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6145,'Star-Crossed Myth','2014-08-08','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Included in the \"Love 365: Find Your Story\" app.\n\nStar-Crossed Myth is an otome game made by Voltage Inc. You are the reincarnation of a goddess and you fall in love with a god who you must help absolve his sin, but he commits another sin by falling in love with you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66gh.jpg'),(6146,'The Jackbox Party Pack','2015-02-04','Puzzle, Strategy, Quiz/Trivia, Indie','Amazon Fire TV, PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The team behind \"You Don\'t Know Jack\" presents five guffaw-inducing party games in one pack! You\'re gonna need more than one party for this. Your phones or tablets are your controllers! For 1-100 players! Games include:\n- You Don\'t Know Jack 2015, the trivia comedy sensation with hundreds of all-new questions. (1-4 players)\n- Fibbage XL, the hilarious bluffing game with over 50% more questions added to the original hit game Fibbage. (2-8 players)\n- Drawful, the bizarre drawing game—you draw right there on your phone or tablet (very little/no real skill required). (3-8 players)\n- Word Spud, the racy-as-you-want-to-be fill-in-the-blank word game. (2-8 players)\n- The wacky-fact-filled Lie Swatter. (1-100 players)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zel.jpg'),(6147,'Guilty Gear: Strive - Additional Character 1: Goldlewis Dickinson','2021-07-30','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','This DLC allows the character Goldlewis Dickinson to be used in-game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ieu.jpg'),(6148,'Inertial Drift: Twilight Rivals Edition','2022-10-20','Racing, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Set in a 90s retro future, ‘Inertial Drift: Twilight Rivals Edition’ is an arcade racer that tears up the racing rule book with innovative twin-stick control and completely reimagined driving mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53pl.jpg'),(6149,'Eraser vs. Ruler','2024-11-21','Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Which side will you choose?!\nEraser Army VS Ruler Army\nThe ultimate desktop showdown is about to begin!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93fm.jpg'),(6150,'Eggconsole Ys MSX2','2024-11-14','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','The landmark first game of an ongoing popular title. Master the \'half-character shift\' and embark on an adventure in the land of Esteria!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co942x.jpg'),(6151,'.Hack//Outbreak','2002-12-12','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 2','.Hack//Outbreak is the third of a series of four games, titled .hack//Infection, .hack//Mutation, .hack//Outbreak, and .hack//Quarantine, features a \"game within a game\"; a fictional massively multiplayer online role-playing game (MMORPG) called The World which does not require the player to connect to the Internet. Players may transfer their characters and data between games in the series. Each game comes with an extra DVD containing an episode of .hack//Liminality, the accompanying original video animation series which details fictional events that occur concurrently with the games.\n\nThe games are part of a multimedia franchise called Project .hack which explores the mysterious origins of The World. Set after the events of the anime series .hack//Sign, the games focus on a player named Kite and his quest to discover why some users have become comatose as a result of playing The World. The search evolves into a deeper investigation of The World and its effects on the stability of the Internet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co216k.jpg'),(6152,'Gwent: Crimson Curse','2019-03-28','Strategy, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Along with a multitude of new tools for waging war, Crimson Curse introduces over 100 cards across all of GWENT’s playable factions. Players will be able to afflict the enemy with Poison and Bleeding, use Shield and Vitality to defend against incoming damage, as well as attempt to turn the tide of battle using the Deathblow and Berserk gameplay mechanics.\n\nAs always, every card comes in both a standard version and a premium animated variant — one of the hallmark features of GWENT’s presentation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yw9.jpg'),(6153,'Hauntrick','2025-04-11','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hauntrick is a chaotic, goofy horror game where you hunt cursed objects, perform rituals, and survive bizarre hauntings—solo or with friends. The ghosts? Unpredictable, absurd, and hilariously annoying. Every match is a mix of strategy, panic, and laughter as reality itself starts to unravel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nor.jpg'),(6154,'Metro Franchise Bundle','2019-02-14','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3coq.jpg'),(6155,'Survival: Lost Way','2021-02-04','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survival: Lost Way - is a sandbox game survival in an open post-apocalyptic world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s3t.jpg'),(6156,'The Glassworks','2009-03-03','Adventure','Web browser','Climb both sides of the glass to navigate your way through the glass works.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91t3.jpg'),(6157,'Parker & Lane','2018-02-27','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Are you ready to solve the case and bring a criminal to justice?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3quf.jpg'),(6158,'Sonic Mobius',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6159,'Hidden Paws Mystery','2022-10-27','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','What is this cat doing here? And where are his friends?\nExplore strange and beautiful islands to find all the little kittens hidden there.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27q0.jpg'),(6160,'Peter Pan: A Story Painting Adventure','1993-12-31','Sin género','DOS','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6161,'Shoujo Kakumei Utena: Itsuka Kakumei Sareru Monogatari','1998-05-28','Adventure, Visual Novel','Sega Saturn','Based on the 1997 anime, Shoujo Kakumei Utena: Itsuka Kakumei Sareru Monogatari tells an original story which is set between episodes eight and nine of the TV series. The main character of the game is an original character who transfers to Ohtori Academy.\n\nThe game is in the style of a visual novel with strong dating sim elements. The major characters each possess a statistic called \"Heart\'s Nobility\" which the player affects through dialog choices that appear sporadically during play. Each character\'s level of Heart\'s Nobility determines how the game will end. The special endings available for characters that end with particularly high Heart\'s Nobility represent the game\'s dating sim element, but because it is set within the larger plot of the TV series the relationships are usually somewhat platonic, or one-sided affections on the part of the main character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30sx.jpg'),(6162,'VICCP','2019-06-20','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','VICCP is a Very Important Central Control Panel. Brainstorming / Puzzle / Quest / Point Click. You are using mysterious remote panel that you can control. Find out how it works, make decisions, solve puzzles. The game has a lot of endings that you have to find yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ons.jpg'),(6163,'Capcom vs. SNK: Millennium Fight 2000','2000-08-13','Fighting','Arcade, Dreamcast','Two of the worlds greatest arcade fighter developers, Capcom and SNK, join forces to finally answer the question asked by many for years: Who is the dominant fighter?\n\nA range of fighters from both worlds are available to choose from, with two different fighting styles (Capcom and SNK, of course) meaning that players of both worlds can fit into the game easily, while new gamers can try Ryu using the SNK format.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gwf.jpg'),(6164,'Northern Tale 5: Revival','2020-03-30','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ragnar - the fearless leader of the Vikings, fell in battle with Evil. But this is not the end! The Scandinavian God Odin decided to return to him not only life, but also youth. Forward to meet new adventures!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q7u.jpg'),(6165,'Pirates Treasure II','2019-12-31','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pirates Treasure II is a 5 reel, 25 payline slot machine (pokie) with a Pirate theme, oriented from left to right.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vd0.jpg'),(6166,'Surfers Code',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Sin plataforma','3D open world tropical adventure and surfing simulation. Immerse yourself in this chill environment with quirky characters and challenging surfing. Unveil the mysteries tucked away in every corner of the islands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co812a.jpg'),(6167,'Kopanito All-Stars Soccer','2016-11-16','Sport, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fast-paced football game without a referee on the pitch and with crazy super-powers! It may not look serious, but we guarantee, that it is. Kopanito’s match engine is well-balanced and entirely skill-based.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hqu.jpg'),(6168,'Time Mysteries 3: The Final Enigma','2014-08-04','Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Time Mysteries 3: The Final Enigma is the epic finale to the time-travelling adventure series. In the face of the looming magical cataclysm, Ester Ambrose has to fight to save her future once again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21pg.jpg'),(6169,'Little Imps: A Dungeon Builder','2019-01-24','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Establish yourself as a feared ruler of the underworld! Create your own dungeon, conquer cities, subjugate menacing creatures and make them to your bidding. Start excavating your lair now in \"Little Imps: A Dungeon Builder\"!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tf1.jpg'),(6170,'Shinobi, Koi Utsutsu: Kanmitsu Hana Emaki','2017-09-28','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','Sequel + fandisc to Shinobi, Koi Utsutsu.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qdt.jpg'),(6171,'H.I.A: Horror Investigation Agency','2024-02-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','H.I.A: Horror Investigation Agency is a fun multiplayer horror game in which you and co-players have to investigate unique horror cases. Among finding victims and evidence of the horror event that has taken place, you will be faced with jumpscares and scary monsters along your investigation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o07.jpg'),(6172,'EarthKart','2023-10-09','Racing, Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','3D Google Earth Driving Simulator','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75e2.jpg'),(6173,'Inazuma Eleven: Victory Road','2025-08-21','Role-playing (RPG), Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch 2, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The latest entry in the character collection and football simulation RPG series, \"Inazuma Eleven!\" With an original story featuring new main characters, over 4,500 players from across the series\' history to collect and train, as well as exciting online tournaments, you can play the game your way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nsw.jpg'),(6174,'Naxat Cup Satellaview Bass Tournament \"Big Fight\": Dai-1-shuu','1995-12-01','Sport','Satellaview','The first episode (week) of Naxat Cup Satellaview Bass Tournament \"Big Fight\".\n\nNaxat Cup Satellaview Bass Tournament \"Big Fight\" is a Downloadable 4-part Soundlink game for the Satellaview that was broadcast between December 1, 1995 and June 1, 1996. It is a pseudo-sequel to Super Fishing - Big Fight. The player competes in the sum of weight of Black Basses within the limited time. To apply the contest, player sends passwords shown in the result scene. Some prizes went to the best performer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co487u.jpg'),(6175,'How Many Deaths to Clear?','2023-05-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"How many deaths to clear?\" is a time attack game where you compete to clear the game as quickly as possible while keeping your death count as low as possible. Try to clear the game as fast as you can without dying too much, and enjoy the thrilling sensation that comes with it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6irf.jpg'),(6176,'Crewsaders','2016-11-17','Fighting, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Crewsaders is a frenzy couch based multiplayer game. 2 to 6 local players are divided into 2 teams controlling 2 gigantic robots. Cooperate to keep the gears and wheels moving on, and punch your opponents!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nn8.jpg'),(6177,'Disgaea 7: Vows of the Virtueless - Bonus Story: The Delinquent, Curry Lover, and Lady Overlord','2023-10-03','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Adds a story featuring the following 3 characters. Once completed, you gain them as playable characters and save icons. - Raspberyl - Usalia - Girl Laharl','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7b89.jpg'),(6178,'LEGO Universe','2012-01-30','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lego Universe was a massively multiplayer online game that was available between October 2010 and January 2012. The game was developed by NetDevil and released on October 26, 2010, with an early opening (October 8, 2010) for the to-be Lego \"Founders\", which consisted of users who pre-ordered the game.\n\nIt was globally distributed by Warner Bros. Interactive Entertainment. Its release was delayed from original estimates of 2009, Teasers were released by Lego in 2007 and late November 2008 to promote the game, and also in 2009 for one last promotion. The game was available in English and German.\n\nThe servers were shut down permanently on January 30, 2012 due to \'unsatisfactory revenue\' from within the game\'s target audience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hx4.jpg'),(6179,'Road 96','2022-04-14','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Road 96 is a crazy, beautiful road-trip. The discovery of exciting places, and unusual people on your own personal journey to freedom. An ever-evolving story-driven adventure inspired by Tarantino, The Coen Brothers, and Bong Joon-ho. Moments of action, exploration, contemplative melancholy, human encounters and wacky situations. Set against a backdrop of authoritarian rule and oppression. A stunning visual style, a soundtrack filled with 90s hits, and a thousand routes through the game combine so each player can create their own unique stories on Road 96.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77x7.jpg'),(6180,'Hive: Altenum Wars','2018-05-01','Shooter, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','HIVE is a multiplayer hero shooter in 2.5D side scroll with futuristic style and frenetic gameplay. Up to 10 players will have to fight in hexagon-shaped combat areas, divided into 6 zones, each one with Its own gravity direction.\nHeroes in HIVE are Hexadiers, and they have several abilities and weapons equipables so that it adapts to the game style of each player.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co280e.jpg'),(6181,'Star Wars: Battlefront - Elite Squadron','2009-11-03','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation Portable, Nintendo DS','Fight epic all-in-one battles spanning ground, space and capital ship connected battlefronts. Use classic Star Wars vehicles to travel from the ground, up into the air and then into space where you will continue the battle among, and even aboard, enormous Capital Ships.\n\nImmerse yourself in an engrossing original story campaign that spans the entire Star Wars saga and beyond, plus engage expanded gameplay features like deeper character customization, hundreds of unlockable achievements, new multiplayer stats, deadly new weapons, new heroes and villains, new Star Wars worlds and much more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nz9.jpg'),(6182,'Order of War','2009-09-22','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the summer of 1944, the Second World War entered its end-game when the Allies launched two major operations that would drive back German forces on both the Western and Eastern Fronts at once. \n \nTheir names were Overlord and Bagration. Overlord famously commenced with the D-Day landings in Normandy and ended in the Liberation of Paris, while Bagration - a far less well-known but far larger Russian operation - crushed the invading German forces in the east, leading to their complete withdrawal from Soviet territory. Had either operation been unsuccessful, history could have been very different. \n \nIn the ultimate test of military strategy, Order of War will challenge you not only to lead America\'s finest to victory in the west, but also place you in command of the German forces charged with repelling the Red Army\'s seemingly unstoppable offensive in the east. Even the keenest military minds will find that it\'s one thing to make history, but quite another to change it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d2n.jpg'),(6183,'BS Zelda no Densetsu: Dai-3-wa','1995-10-15','Adventure','Satellaview','The third part (week) of BS Zelda no Densetsu.\n\nBS Zelda no Densetsu was a remake of The Legend of Zelda that was released for the Satellaview attachment of the Super Nintendo Entertainment System in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co414f.jpg'),(6184,'SkyFactory 4','2019-04-15','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Back again for more modded skyblock fun! SkyFactory 4 offers a brand-new experience never before seen in the series. Full automation, tech, magic, and bacon resources! This iteration offers over 30+ world types so you can play the pack like never before! While some world types are based on the classic tree on dirt others are designed with unique recipes and advancements.\n\nWhat makes this version different from every other SkyFactory before it? We\'ve completely redesigned the resource gathering. Sieving for resources are a thing of the past. For a more immersive experience, Sky Orchards has been introduced. Resource Trees provides a built-in progression system and lets the player choose the resources they want to produce rather than a randomized system. We\'ve removed the achievement book and replaced it with the advancement system. Instead of requiring players to manually check out what they\'ve accomplished, the game will keep track for you. This system isn\'t designed to create a required questing system, but rather an optional set of goals for players looking for ideas on what to do next.\n\nSkyFactory 4 introduces the prestige system! This is a completely optional game mode allowing you to unlock mods, items, and mechanics through an open progression system. Prestige points and unlocks are global and can be brought with you to other worlds! Prestige points can be gained by finishing advancements or by using the Parabox, a time-traveling box that generates points. To get started, enable prestige mode on the world creation screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v5b.jpg'),(6185,'I\'ve Got a Brand New Pair of Legs','2020-01-15','Platform, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Android','I\'ve Got A Brand New Pair Of Legs is a puzzle-platform game where you must figure out the best selection of legs to use to traverse each level!\n\nChris wants to get from point A to point B and he wants to eat his share of pizzas on the way. But the environments are dangerous and can not be traversed with human legs alone...\n\nThankfully, Chris has the power to replace his legs on the fly!\n\nThat pizza is too high up; giraffe legs make Chris tall.\nChris can\'t breath in water; duck legs make Chris float.\nThere are spikes on the floor; frog legs make Chris jump.\nThese are just a few of the types of legs to help Chris on his way!\n\nChris is very clumsy; if he collides with an obstacle or bumps his head, he\'ll lose a pair of legs! This will hinder your ability to complete the level.\n\nSome levels can only be finished with certain legs, so you\'ll have to figure out which legs are most suitable based on the types of traps you encounter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tdd.jpg'),(6186,'Star Wars: Demolition','2000-11-12','Shooter, Racing','PlayStation, Dreamcast','Star Wars: Demolition is a vehicular combat game set in the Star Wars universe created by both Luxoflux and LucasArts using the Vigilante 8 game engine. The premise of the game is that the Galactic Empire declares they have officially banned Jabba the Hutt\'s podraces, so Jabba creates a more life-threatening vehicular combat contest to replace the sport of podracing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vyd.jpg'),(6187,'Lantern','2016-11-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Be the wind and guide a beautiful lantern that spreads the powerful message of everlasting love, by bringing life and color back to the world around you. Lantern is a relaxing game experience full of positive emotions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ip5.jpg'),(6188,'WGV: Dreamcatcher',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6189,'Thunder Truck Rally','1997-07-01','Racing, Sport','PlayStation','Monster Trucks offers nine rugged off-roaders with which to race across jagged, imposing terrains. Not the only game to twist the racing genre to this end, but as you\'d expect from Psygnosis, the quality of presentation is head and shoulders above the rest. \n \nThere are two types of courses; circuits offer demanding hilly terrains which can easily trash the vehicle and must be learned intimately. Endurance courses offer greater freedom, with the aim of finding the best route to link eight dispersed checkpoints. \n \nTo avoid any disorientation, arrows guide you to the next marker. Each area, be it snowy or volcanic, has characteristic features and hazards, yet this doesn\'t stop a repetitive feel developing. The third option is a fun mode, and one you might expect from the developer of Destruction Derby. Players have sixty seconds to take their truck on a car smashing spree.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qmawltdnri4awvoaif8a.jpg'),(6190,'Wet Passion',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6191,'Wheel Of Fates','2024-10-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A lovingly crafted RPG with a unique spin, with cheerful characters and fun storytelling.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9md8.jpg'),(6192,'WebCum Secrets',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6193,'Castlevania Double Pack','2006-01-11','Simulator, Sport','Game Boy Advance','Compiles both Harmony of Dissonance and Aria of Sorrow on one Game Boy Advance cartridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z47.jpg'),(6194,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Smash-Up','2009-09-22','Fighting','Wii, PlayStation 2','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Smash-Up is a fighting video game for the Wii and PlayStation 2 video game consoles. It was developed by Game Arts in cooperation with Mirage Studios and released by Ubisoft in celebration of the 25th anniversary of the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles in 2009.\n\nThe game is a 4-player 2.5D fighting game, similar to the Super Smash Bros. series. During battle, players attempt to KO opponents by depleting their life bar, knocking them off the stage or into traps.Characters are color-coded on-screen via a glow effect to help players keep track of their character (a feature that can be toggled on and off in the options screen). Like Super Smash Bros., the game features many customizable options for battles.The game stresses interaction with the environment, and stages in the game feature traps, changes to the stage itself and interactive elements. The gameplay system also features items, including life-restoring pizza and ninja skills that grant players special abilities like fire breathing and electrical shields. The modes for this game are Arcade, Battle Royal, Survival, Tournament, Swap-Out, Practice, and Mission Mode, as well as an online mode for four players and mini-games. Players can collect \'shells\' during battles or mini-games and use them to unlock special features, including trophies that other players can win in online tournaments. Arcade mode features animated cut scenes illustrated by Mirage Studios artists.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w99.jpg'),(6195,'Hammerin\' Harry: Collector\'s Edition','2024-01-24','Sin género','Nintendo Entertainment System','Ported to the home console a year after the original arcade, 大工の源さん (Daiku no Gen-san) would feature much of the arcades content - although a bit less brutal. A version was released in Europe under the name Hammerin\' Harry which would replace certain Japanese cultural staples from the game such as ramen shops becoming pasta shops as well as some items.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6196,'Webcam Love',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6197,'Qb','2017-08-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','qb is an open world sandbox adventure game. Play together with your friends or singeplayer. Craft and enchant items. Skill your character. Earn rewards through quests. Help the villagers and let their homeland grow. Don\'t like the scenery? Modify it to your likings and share it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27cb.jpg'),(6198,'Atomic Spider',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','You are an Atomic Spider! Created in a lab, you are now our universe\'s only hope to fend off alien interlopers from another dimension.\nAtomic Spider introduces a new touchscreen game mechanic married to intense gameplay and bright vector-style visuals. Battle your way through 50+ levels chock full of tricky monsters and bosses.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6199,'Craftomation 101','2024-02-19','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You land on a frozen planet in a tiny rocket with a robot inside. Harvest and combine materials to discover new ones. Use visual programming to make the robot do the tiresome work for you. Slowly build a gang of self-sustaining robot workers and watch them terraform the planet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7oex.jpg'),(6200,'The Guild 3','2022-06-14','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Guild 3 is a fascinating trade and life simulation that takes place during the late Middle Ages. Step into the shoes of a citiizen, acquire businesses and mansions, produce goods and trade them, start intrigues in politics and society, love, hate, bribe, fight and live through good and bad times!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wv3.jpg'),(6201,'Plazma Burst 2','2011-03-10','Shooter, Tactical','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Plazma Burst 2 is the sequel to Plazma Burst. In this game you play as a marine, who wasn\'t sent to the past successfully in order to change the history of mankind to a better life and avoid the invasion of Usurpation Forces. In Plazma Burst: Forward to the past, after when our hero\'s ally was critically damaged, marine travels back to the Earth to attempt another try on traveling back in time... Will fortune smile to him this time?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40qb.jpg'),(6202,'Junk Jack','2020-04-02','Platform, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Junk Jack is a 2D sandbox where you can explore, build and survive in randomly generated procedural worlds full of monsters, hidden treasures and beautiful landscapes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21o6.jpg'),(6203,'Turn off the light','2022-01-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A gloomy platformer in which you have to get out of the desperate consciousness of the main character. The unique ambient and minimalistic graphics will create a tense atmosphere. Explore the game space and avoid all its aggressive inhabitants.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5npz.jpg'),(6204,'Koi no Hanasaku Hyakkaen','2020-01-30','Visual Novel','Nintendo Switch','An otome game by Takuyo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69a2.jpg'),(6205,'Little Big Workshop: The Evil',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','The Evil DLC expands on what makes Little Big Workshop great! Your factory is turning profits week after week but you still feel unfulfilled? Then it’s time to crank the corporate greed dial all the way to sinister! Bladh will be thrilled.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gwk.jpg'),(6206,'Subliminal Region',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The first game of Sorcerer’s Records Series Season 3 is here! Check out the story of Sorcerer\'s Records, which is more mature than ever! This game is a standard lower window novel game for men of all ages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5oeg.jpg'),(6207,'Whispers Of Fear',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6208,'eBall','2019-05-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','eBall is an old-school multiplayer arena shooter with high speed gameplay and a minimalistic look. An old school rocket and grenade in combination with rattling speed gameplay and predictive air shoot of a classic arena FPS with the power of modern gaming technology.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1l2c.jpg'),(6209,'Bepuzzled Kittens Jigsaw Puzzle','2019-06-11','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This game is great for kitten lovers who like their cats in cute or funny poses! 107 Puzzles! User friendly User Interface \'Magnetic\' puzzle pieces to make life easier Calming music What more do you need and at such great value!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6210,'JaleOlle Famicom Ver. Saiyuuki World','2024-12-18','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','The project \"JALECOlle Famicom Ver.\" continues to release Jaleco\'s Famicom titles one after another!\nThe 4th release is \"Saiyuuki World\"!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aj9.jpg'),(6211,'F.E.A.R. Perseus Mandate','2007-11-06','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','F.E.A.R. Perseus Mandate is the second expansion pack to F.E.A.R. The game\'s action and horror elements are tied to a plot filled with backstabs and double-crosses as senator, his lackey and a group of shadowy mercenaries clash in their journey to unlock the mysteries revealed in the previous F.E.A.R games. In addition to the weapons from the first two F.E.A.R games, in Perseus Mandate the player has access to a grenade launcher, a lightning gun and an advanced rifle, all of which will be necessary to dispatch a tough new cast of bad guys. Unlike the previous expansion, this title can be played stand-alone and does not require the original game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vow.jpg'),(6212,'Winners Don\'t Do Drugs','2009-01-20','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jfa.jpg'),(6213,'Ballest of Them All',NULL,'Platform, Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A physics-based platformer about smooth movement. Master your ball to earn medals on highly-replayable tracks, or climb the Tower to prove you\'re the Ballest of Them All.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fa6.jpg'),(6214,'Cursed House 13','2024-03-07','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A new Cursed House game. A new set of tricky levels. A new town to unspell. Play it relaxed, Time/Moves limited modes and replay your favourite levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7usk.jpg'),(6215,'Examination Chambers','2021-12-02','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this short puzzle adventure, you play as a tester who has to overcome increasingly harder logic puzzles. Room by room, your actions will be commented on by a test supervisor. Place different sizes of cubes on buttons in first person to solve logic-gate-like riddles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48zu.jpg'),(6216,'Whisper of the Shade: Gray',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6217,'Battle Beach','2013-06-18','Real Time Strategy (RTS)','Android','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92r5.jpg'),(6218,'Winner In Life',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6219,'Uni Turret','2019-04-10','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It is a shooting game where you control the battery and defeat the enemy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1o3l.jpg'),(6220,'Wizard Hangover ExtreamZz!!','2008-08-30','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jfb.jpg'),(6221,'Spells & Secrets','2023-11-09','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Spells & Secrets is a modern-day fantasy roguelike set in a procedurally generated wizarding school. Players can craft their own wizard using in-depth character creation, team up with a friend via local co-op, and get creative with an arsenal of physics-based magic, using clever combinations of spells to get the upper hand against puzzles and enemies alike.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oyu.jpg'),(6222,'Skibidi Toilet Skibidi Boom','2024-01-31','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get ready for a hilariously outrageous multiplayer FPS experience that combines the meme world of the Skibidi toilet with intense action-packed battles! In \"Skibidi Toilet Skibidi Boom\" you\'ll dive headfirst into a quirky universe where two bizarre factions clash for supremacy: the eccentric Cameraheads and the wacky Skibidi Toilets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co717g.jpg'),(6223,'Chuck Meowrris','2020-02-28','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as the special agent Chuck Meowrris, as you attempt to complete Dr. Kibblesworth\'s Gauntlet of Randomness. With nine lives and five different classes, can you complete the entirety of the Gauntlet of Randomness and defeat Dr. Kibblesworth?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lmk.jpg'),(6224,'The List','2021-06-30','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A young man is interviewed by the police only to turn up dead a week later. 3 years have passed, a special agent from Santa Fe navigates the police database in order to solve the mystery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43xo.jpg'),(6225,'Aces of Thunder','2025-12-31','Simulator','PlayStation VR2, SteamVR','Experience the thrill of aerial combat like never before with Aces of Thunder, the upcoming VR game made specifically with capabilities of PlayStation VR2 in mind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ed4.jpg'),(6226,'Merge Town!','2017-08-29','Puzzle, Simulator','iOS','Ever wanted to be Mayor? Ever wanted to run a town, develop the land, and see a metropolis grow? Well, look no further than Merge Town!, the newest title from Gram Games. The concept of the game is simple - you have a plot of land, and it’s your job to turn it into a town. Every so often, you’ll be gifted with a house. Each house can be merged with other houses of the same variety to form a bigger home. Every house built on the land will earn you money - the bigger the home, the more you will earn. The more you earn, the more houses you can purchase, and the more you can push the clock to develop faster. Use your spoils to discover new homes, and to expand into all new towns.\n\nYou have a singular goal: make your towns the best they can be. The bar at the top of the screen measures development - Merge buildings to earn XP and level up. Higher levels will unlock more space in your plot for you to develop, which will only allow you to develop your town to even further greatness. Once you develop into new towns, keep an eye on all your land, ensuring that you’re merging and developing to your full potential.\n\nMerge, build, and develop your very own towns with Merge Town!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rjb3n8ot4oyvnpnmgose.jpg'),(6227,'Melo\'s Cat Cafe','2024-07-02','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Melo\'s Cat Cafe is the perfect game for players who want to relax in a stress-free environment. Instead of chasing goals, players can simply enjoy spending time with the cats. Observe the cats as they eat and sleep, and find peace of mind in their calm presence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gjd.jpg'),(6228,'Once Upon a Jester','2022-11-09','Music, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Travel the kingdom as Jester with his best friend Sok to improvise theatre shows and perform on stages far and wide. Sing your hearts out, crack jokes and impress audiences to become the stars of the famous Royal Theatrical Spectacle!\n\nThey embark on a grand adventure across a fantasy kingdom, meeting tons of wacky characters, performing improvised shows and singing their hearts out. Along the way, they unintentionally discover the freedom and joy of musical theatre. Will the pair change their wicked ways or do whatever it takes to get rich?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qmg.jpg'),(6229,'Fallen Legion Revenants: Digital Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t74.jpg'),(6230,'Paradise Heights GB','2024-02-05','Indie, Visual Novel','Game Boy Color, Web browser','Classic eroge ported to Game Boy','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d55.jpg'),(6231,'With The Fire And Sword',NULL,'Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Turn-based strategy game with role-playing elements. WTFAS is a round PvP battle between several opponents until one winner remains. Play in pairs with a friend, improve your hero, army, artifacts, economy, etc. The main goal of the game is to stay alive longer than your opponent...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kzz.jpg'),(6232,'Stop and Breathe','2025-02-11','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 3D puzzle platformer that teaches you a breathing technique to help with your anxiety! Calm your mind by performing the breathing technique, Belly Breathing! Traverse a school environment, solve puzzles, move platforms, all while being accompanied by your companion, Zen!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hbg.jpg'),(6233,'Princess Knight\'s Mission: Anna\'s Marvelous Adventures','2024-05-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The princess of the kingdom, Anna, received news of the resurrection of the Demon King. Despite her frustration with the demanding duties of governance, she donned the hero\'s attire blessed with the \"Divine Blessing.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79k5.jpg'),(6234,'BulletRoyale','2021-04-29','Shooter','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to BulletRoyale!\n\nThe all new 2D Top Down BattleRoyale styled game! This game includes art styles that are very clean and simple, and this game is also developed by the Shibaflow Development Team which has previously made the game on the play store known as FrontFight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4adp.jpg'),(6235,'Starpoint Gemini','2012-01-04','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Starpoint Gemini is an RPG tactical simulator focused on the control and strengths of individual vessels. In SPG ship captains and their skills make the greatest difference in large-scale battles. The games is set in a science-fiction universe where various thriving technological directions exist side by side.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ql0ozdyisawdoclu0edq.jpg'),(6236,'Cold Wires','2019-12-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cold wires-is a 2D arcade game with a side view, the essence of which is to clean the playing field and charge with the battery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nfw.jpg'),(6237,'Trainz Railroad Simulator 2019: CFCLA, RailFirst, Freightliner GE C44aci Pack','2022-04-22','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The C44aci is a model of Australian heavy duty diesel electric locomotive designed operated by a number of rail freight operators. This pack features CFCLA, RailFirst, and Freightliner livery units, with custom cab views, full PBR textures, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6iv7.jpg'),(6238,'Epic + Inferno: The Odyssey Continues Bundle','2019-12-20','Shooter, Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tbn.jpg'),(6239,'Mechanita','2025-02-05','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Puzzle your way through a steampunk world of precision platforming and roving robots!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99xr.jpg'),(6240,'America Wild Hunting','2021-03-05','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','If you love to shoot with the most well-known guns, rifles, hand guns and machine guns of the market, you will love playing this shooter. You\'ll find in this hunting game the real birds you can shoot in real life hunting on North American territory from Albatrosses to Eagles, Swans to Ducks, Pigeons to Bufflehead and many more. With its high-paced action, America Wild Hunting will challenge your dexterity and ability to concentrate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5avv.jpg'),(6241,'Daffy Duck in Hollywood','1993-12-31','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Sega Game Gear, Sega Master System/Mark III','Presenting the world famous Daffy Duck P.I. Armed with your lethal bubble gun, search the Hollywood film sets for Yosemite Sam\'s Golden Cartoon World Movie Awards and the despicable Mad Professor Duck Brain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hjv.jpg'),(6242,'Goblin Hotdogs','2024-06-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Goblin Hotdogs is a cute and casual 3D Puzzle/Platformer. Explore, solve the mysteries of the universe, and collect the ultimate prize (hotdogs).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fb1.jpg'),(6243,'The Purge Man','2021-01-12','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','You feel tired of your own existence, you feel like everything is going wrong, there is no way out of this. The only way is to PURGE.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6244,'Grid','2010-06-04','Racing, Sport','Arcade','An arcade version of Race Driver: GRID, featuring different, more arcade driving physics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99kt.jpg'),(6245,'Ylands','2017-12-06','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ylands is both a sandbox exploration adventure and a platform for making custom games, ranging from simple scenarios to sophisticated game modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24jj.jpg'),(6246,'Vault Resort','2017-08-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are a prisoner in a vault. Waking up in a dirty scary cellar, you have to find your way out. By exploring various scenarios and surroundings, you must solve physical puzzles and handle exiting challenges. Vault resort is a real-life obstacle course inside a huge castle and its surroundings. A unique teleporting control system guarantees that your are always at the right spot to use every inch of your room-scale space in all scenarios. \n \nEnjoy at leat 1 hour of fun, challenges and excitement! \n \nThis VR game is for HTC vive only. \n \nEnjoy maximum immersion with Vault Resort.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6247,'Skeletal Skism','2022-01-03','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','War has broken out between the undead... All for one sole purpose: to determine the One - True - Skeleton - King. Do you have what it takes to claim the crown?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lu9.jpg'),(6248,'In Between','2016-06-08','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One','In Between is an atmospheric, award-winning platformer where you solve mind-bending\npuzzles by manipulating your surroundings and gravity itself.\nBe invited to reflect on life while getting to know the story of the dying protagonist and his inevitable struggle for existence. Dive into the atmosphere of a dense, hand painted game while exploring the reason why you are here.\nWelcome to a world In Between .','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qed.jpg'),(6249,'Ultimate Fighting Championship','2000-11-25','Fighting, Sport','PlayStation, Dreamcast','The Ultimate Fighting Championship tournaments started in the 1990s, giving martial artists of the world a chance to distinguish themselves in a fighting environment with very few rules. Fighters could be matched up against fighters of any style, and the match ended only when one fighter submitted.\n\nThe popularity of the sport resulted in the creation of other mixed martial arts tournaments and the evolution and merging of fighting styles for greater effectiveness. Ultimate Fighting Championship is a 3D fighting game that tries to simulate the experience of a real mixed martial arts fight. Players can choose from a selection of established UFC fighters, or create their own fighter through the Career Mode.\n\nWhile in Career Mode, players start the character creation process by selecting from several style templates, then using points earned through fighting and beating a series of progressively more difficult fighters to buy attribute upgrades in stamina, endurance, punching ability, kicking ability, or to learn certain techniques.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3g8w.jpg'),(6250,'Gravity Mastery','2021-03-10','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A perspective-disorienting puzzler where the definition of down is yours to decide. Change to flow of gravity to complete each of The Adviser\'s varied, but logical tests. Can you become proficient enough to control the six directions and master gravity? \n \nThe current master of gravity, The Adviser, has created a gauntlet of trials to test all those who believe that they are deserving of being the new master of gravity. Any and all challengers are welcome to try their hands and engage their mind in the worlds devised to confuse and disorient. \n \nThe rules are simple. Each trial consists of several red cubes and green spheres. Once every red cube simultaneously contains a green sphere, then the trial has been successfully completed. \n \n- Campaign - A series of hand-crafted levels with a progressing level of difficulty. \n- Compounding Game Mechanics - Compete in levels with an ever-expanding list of possible game mechanics. \n- Time Trial - Race against the clock to beat the par time for a level in time trial mode. \n- Minimalistic Art - An art style where every resource at your disposal is visually apparent and clearly defined.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u9x.jpg'),(6251,'Rainy Day Racer','2018-07-12','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','3D time-attack motor racing in a city in Scotland where it rains like a bastard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4de1.jpg'),(6252,'Date A Live: Rio Reincarnation - Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Simulator, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tbu.jpg'),(6253,'Metaphor: ReFantazio - Atlus 35th Digital Anniversary Edition Upgrade','2024-10-11','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9esr.jpg'),(6254,'Final Fantasy XII International: Zodiac Job System','2007-08-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 2','The game takes place in the fictional location of Ivalice, where the empires of Archadia and Rozarria are waging an endless war. Dalmasca, a small kingdom, is caught between the warring nations. When Dalmasca becomes annexed by Archadia, its princess, Ashe, creates a resistance movement. During the struggle, she meets Vaan, a young adventurer who dreams of commanding an airship. They are quickly joined by a band of allies; together, they rally against the tyranny of the Archadian Empire.\n\nIn this new version of XII, there are 12 different layouts of the license board based on different jobs you can give the characters, opening up a whole new level of complexity to add to the epic show-stopper. Other goodies include a 16:9 view mode that enables widescreen viewing and a new bonus DVD.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uke.jpg'),(6255,'Yoshi Goes to Tesco','2022-03-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Browse the aisles for the items on your grocery list, get into some trouble, and solve minor puzzles in this short (15-25 minute) shitpost about the wonders and terrors of retail, with dumb references to outdated memes, copyright infringement and jokes about British \"culture.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6egw.jpg'),(6256,'Zone4','2016-11-20','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ultimate 3D Fighting Online Game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gkd.jpg'),(6257,'Pilfer','2019-07-03','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A stealth game in which the player is free to explore a small town filled with NPCs that live their own life. Sneak into their houses, steal their silverware, and make it to the online leaderboard!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21xr.jpg'),(6258,'JongRo 3_Street','2024-01-22','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"In the year 2024, South Korea has become a wasteland due to the Epsilon virus. South Korea is full of infected people. In this desolate landscape, a man hears a rumor about a path to salvation at Jongno 3-ga Station and decides to head there.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7njd.jpg'),(6259,'LEGO Star Wars: The Force Awakens - Escape From Starkiller Base','2016-11-01','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','This DLC for LEGO Star Wars: The Force Awakens features an untold story about two Resistance pilots not seen in the film.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fqf.jpg'),(6260,'Wizardry Gaiden II: Curse of the Ancient Emperor','1993-01-26','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy','Wizardry Gaiden II: Curse of the Ancient Emperor, published in 1992 by ASCII, was the second of the trilogy of Wizardry roleplaying games released for the original gray-scale Nintendo Game Boy portable video game system. .','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ies.jpg'),(6261,'Blade of Unagi',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6262,'Airstrike II: Gulf Thunder','2005-02-11','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Airstrike 2 is a top-down third person helicopter shooter. In each mission your goal is to survive and shoot as many things as you can to increase your score. As you progress through the game, you are given access to different helicopters that trade more speed for less armor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lmijsprslyscky4mxitt.jpg'),(6263,'Gypsy Juggler','1978-06-01','Arcade','Arcade','Players control a Gypsy who juggles eggs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ltda1gtwtegamwv5umha.jpg'),(6264,'An Abstract Art Game in 10 Seconds','2010-05-14','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xeu.jpg'),(6265,'Isonzo: Collector\'s Edition','2022-09-13','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Ferocious Alpine warfare will test your tactical skills in this authentic WW1 FPS. Battle among the scenic peaks, rugged valleys and idyllic towns of northern Italy. The Great War on the Italian Front is brought to life and elevated to unexpected heights!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fib.jpg'),(6266,'ZeGame','2016-05-27','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','ZeGame is a tile based puzzle game in 3D space. The objective of the game is to move green player blocks in the right direction until they reach the finish. ZeGame has very atmospheric style, with each world having its own environment and soundscape making it a very relaxing experience for the user.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rxp.jpg'),(6267,'Dragon Ball Z: Budokai HD Collection','2012-11-02','Fighting','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','The game is an HD collection that features both Dragon Ball Z: Budokai 1 and Dragon Ball Z: Budokai 3 enhanced and re-mastered in HD, alongside full Trophy and Achievements support. The graphics of Budokai 3 HD are similar to those of Dragon Ball Z: W Bakuretsu Impact. Since Kenji Yamamoto\'s original soundtracks have been accused of plagiarism, both included games have entirely new soundtracks mixed from the soundtracks of Dragon Ball Z: Budokai Tenkaichi 2, Dragon Ball Z: Budokai Tenkaichi 3, Dragon Ball: Raging Blast, Dragon Ball Z: Tenkaichi Tag Team, and Dragon Ball Z: Ultimate Tenkaichi, plus entirely new music and the American Dragon Ball Z theme song from the original game and show. Both games also support the optional original Japanese language track (but in Europe, only Japanese is available for Budokai 1, much like the original release).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lqf.jpg'),(6268,'God of Thunder','1993-12-31','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','DOS','God of Thunder is a 2D platform puzzle game created by Ron Davis and published by Software Creations in 1993. It was previously a shareware product but was released as freeware.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25fe.jpg'),(6269,'SimCity Creator','2008-09-19','Simulator, Strategy','Wii, Nintendo DS','SimCity Creator follows the basic SimCity formula that sees players managing a city and placing residential, commercial, and industrial zones for buildings in addition to facilities such as police stations, hospitals, seaports, and stadiums. Players are also able to customize the look of their buildings by choosing from several themes for the city such as Egyptian, Roman, Japanese, European, Las Vegas, and near-future styles, in addition to ones that result in a crystal or confectionery-like appearance to buildings. Players are also able to tour their city, rendered in 3D graphics, in a helicopter or airplane. If the player builds an airport, more touring vehicles can be unlocked.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3det.jpg'),(6270,'Super Roll Out',NULL,'Platform, Pinball, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Super Roll Out\" is the exciting debut game from Project8024Games, blending the charm of classic Nintendo 64 and Sega Dreamcast titles with modern gameplay elements.\n\nTake control of Ballu, the determined protagonist on a mission to halt the havoc caused by the nefarious Dr. Marblous. Journey through diverse worlds,\n\nsolving puzzles and gathering shattered Mega Gems to restore peace and thwart tyranny. Explore numerous worlds filled with challenges and uncover thrilling mini-games along the way.\n\nCan you rescue the planets from impending destruction and restore order to the cosmos?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81mc.jpg'),(6271,'Disco Elysium: The Final Cut - Collage Mode','2023-03-16','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In Collage Mode, players have the ability to create and set the scene in and around Martinaise. They will have full access to characters, environments, effects, and custom dialogue to create the screenshots that they have always desired and fabricate completely new dramas from unforgivable punch-ups to fruity yet forbidden kisses.\n\nPlace and Pose – Place, rotate, and resize your favorite characters across the game’s painterly environments and then pick from a range of silly and sensible poses to strike.\n\nWrite Dialogue – Create a whole story with a single image by entering custom text that can be placed anywhere and even make it look authentic by using the FELD dialogue reel.\n\nBe Aesthetic – Bring out your inner Art Cop by applying weird and wonderful filters; choosing from rain, fog, and snow; as well changing the time of day to capture the exact mood you’re after.\n\nStick ‘Em Up – Put gloves and guns in unsuspecting hands with a huge collection of items and clothing stickers or add extra style with new and extraordinary art from our talented collaborators.\n\nGet Framed – Finish up by choosing a frame to wrap up your fantasy with audacious themes such as “Kim Catsuragi,” “F**k The World,” “Visual Calculus,” and “Building Communism.”\n\nBonus! Secrets to Find – Hunt for never-before-seen scenes from across Martinaise history if you’ve got a keen enough eye for it and enjoy a velvety new voiceover from the game’s narrator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fxa.jpg'),(6272,'Quadrant','2015-05-26','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The year is 1979. A secret, final lunar mission has retrieved hundreds of moon rocks for study at Aether Research Facility. Overtaken by curiosity, researchers delve deeper and deeper into the unknown. Only to find a sinister and unperceivable','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6273,'Tekken 7: Craig Marduk','2018-12-03','Fighting, Sport','Xbox One','Craig Marduk, ferocious beast and Vale Tudo fighter, has joined the fray! Tower over your opponent before pummeling them with powerful techniques!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4etu.jpg'),(6274,'Mr. Magic',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Mr. Magic is an awesome, third-person, action-adventure game where you become a superhero. Unlock powerful skills by visiting secret places around the globe to retrieve mystical skills before they fall into the wrong hands. Master extraordinary abilities with mystical secrets!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lly.jpg'),(6275,'Mega Roller Ball','2020-08-04','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A challenging, 3d obstacle, platformer game!! Where you play as...a ball. But not just a ball. A MEGA ROLLER BALL!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ns5.jpg'),(6276,'ESPN Extreme Games','1996-12-31','Fighting, Racing, Sport','DOS, PlayStation','Insane sports for an extreme generation!\n\nRip up courses on in-line skates, shoot for max speed on the street luge, pull serious air on the skateboard, and shred courses on the mountain bike.\n\nGet ready to PUNCH and KICK your way through an entire season of Extreme competition. Battle radical opponents on the most treacherous terrain found on the face of the earth.\n\nThis is ESPN\'s Extreme Games. No Kooks allowed!\n\nHard Core Features:\nCharge six different banzai courses covering San Francisco, Lake Tahoe, South American, Italy, Utah and The Money Level.\n4 levels of difficulty from beginner to EXTREME.\n2 player split screen racing action.\nCatch epic air off ramps, launch over cable cars and discover hidden zones for the ultimate victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mjma1vnpoywp2tpxrmhd.jpg'),(6277,'Inazuma Eleven Origins','2023-06-24','Role-playing (RPG), Sport','Nintendo DS','Inazuma Eleven Origins is a hackrom based on the original game of Inazuma Eleven, where the story of the legendary David Evans is intended to be told from his youth.\nWith over 350 new players, more than 50 custom hissatsu techniques and a completely new map set in the era of David Evans, explore every corner of Inazuma City to uncover all its secrets, and perhaps even become part of the legendary Inazuma Eleven...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ufm.jpg'),(6278,'Level Down','2025-06-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crashed in space, surrounded by collapsing floors, reach for the top...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a6i.jpg'),(6279,'Dream Antique','2023-08-02','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7onm.jpg'),(6280,'Duskfade','2026-12-31','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Duskfade is a colorful adventure in a world where the torments of the past haunt you. Battle against your memories in a dizzying dance to fade the shadows of the dusk.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nll.jpg'),(6281,'Thexder','1988-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Apple IIGS, PC-8800 Series, Sharp X1, Mac, DOS, Amiga, Apple II, TRS-80, Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System, MSX','Thexder is a robot capable of transforming into a jet whose job is to destroy the central computer to save the planet.15 stages are waiting you for in this shooting game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w8h.jpg'),(6282,'Godzilla: Doki-doki Kaijuu-tou!!','1999-12-31','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Sega Pico','Godzilla: Heart-Pounding Monster Island!! is a game for the Sega Pico developed by Sega and released on July 25, 1995.\n\nThe game consists of multiple \"pages,\" which act as hub levels. Each page contains multiple kaiju, which can be clicked on and interacted with. This causes some kaiju to perform different animations, while with some kaiju it will activate minigames. The player is in control of Godzilla.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6anl.jpg'),(6283,'Sonic Stage Collection',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j9q.jpg'),(6284,'Zomborg','2017-11-10','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','It is the year 2000, and the United Nations has established several quarantine zones around the world to\nstem the tide of an unknown virus pandemic. The United Nations called upon a private military company, highly skilled mercenaries to retrieve the data and uncover the secret of the zone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jp7.jpg'),(6285,'16 Ways to Kill a Vampire at McDonalds','2016-10-01','Adventure','Web browser, Android, iOS','You\'re a vampire hunter on your night off.\n\nYou\'re getting a manicure, seeing a movie, and eating fast food.\n\nBut there\'s a vampire in this McDonalds.\n\nIf you don\'t do something, then in one hour it will eat the cashier.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52xn.jpg'),(6286,'Metal Division','2019-01-15','Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dynamic multiplayer tank battle simulator with a rich set of maps, game modes and boosters','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1i09.jpg'),(6287,'Awaria','2024-12-16','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome to the tunnel maintenance crew. If the generators fail, it\'s your job to fix them. Check what\'s wrong, craft all the needed parts and deliver them. It\'s simple. Just stay clear of anything that randomly cracks bolts of electricity, spews fire, throws sharp pieces of scrap at high-velocity or radiates with ominous green light.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co960w.jpg'),(6288,'Stellar Overload','2016-10-11','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Robots of the Imperium Machina invaded the peaceful planet Merx. Go on an adventure to free your world from them. \n \nStellar Overload is a 3D open-world, blocks-based, FPS, adventure game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25gr.jpg'),(6289,'AirBorne Sea','2024-09-12','Shooter, Simulator, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You find yourself stationed behind the awesome firepower of a 40mm anti-aircraft fixed deck gun on the bow of a battleship. Your mission is to blast away at the endless onslaught of enemy attackers bent on sinking your battleship.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69eh.jpg'),(6290,'The Legend of Heroes: Trails in the Sky - Premium Edition','2011-04-29','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation Portable','Limited Edition includes the following additional contents to the standard game: Soundtrack CD containing over 20 songs, 13-inch by 19.5-inch poster, 1.5-inch Bracer Guild replica metal badge\nDynamic and Unique Strategic Combat System\nAfter a brief hiatus since its last release in January 2007, this latest The Legend of Heroes title kicks off a new trilogy and brings this innovative RPG series to new heights\nAnother highly-acclaimed soundtrack from the renowned music department at development house Falcom, 57 original tracks set the mood for this moving tale.\nthe first of a new trilogy in the established The Legend of Heroes RPG series','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co724a.jpg'),(6291,'Princess Ruby','2022-12-09','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Princess Ruby is a 2D Platformer aimed at young children. Play as a princess and run, jump and sometimes ride a unicorn through each level. Dress up how you want, change your hairstyle and the colors of your costume.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vkz.jpg'),(6292,'Robin of the Wood','1985-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum','As the outlaw Robin of Sherwood, you aim to win recover the prize of the Silver Arrow from the Sheriff of Nottingham. Before you can enter the contest to recover the arrow, you must purchase your equipment from a tree spirit (Ent) hiding in the forest. And to purchase your equipment, you wander the forest in search of moneybags or rich nobles who you can ask for a \"donation.\" \n \nThere are allies, such as the Hermit, who will heal your wounds providing you don\'t attack him. There are also foes such as Norman soldiers, the Sheriff of Nottingham, witches and wild boars who will impede your progress to enter the contest. \n \nIn a nutshell, wander the forest gathering money to buy your sword, bow and arrows while avoiding/defeating your enemies. You can also collect flowers to placate the witch who will send you to some other part of the forest instead of taking your money and locking you in the dungeon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fjrdsdqzep6glasf1vsd.jpg'),(6293,'It\'s Mealtime!','2021-10-21','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In The Mealtime is a physics multiplayer game where one or two teams of four players each work in a restaurant.\n\nPlant, cook and serve plates while working together. Communication is crucial, but having fun is a must!\n\nStop crows and insects from eating your crops, prepare the dishes correctly and treat the customers nicely. With this, everything should be fine…right?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cup.jpg'),(6294,'Strategic Command Classic: WWI','2011-03-01','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Strategic Command World War I: The Great War is a grand strategy game in the series from award winning game designer Hubert Cater. It is more than just another addition to the Strategic Command series - it is an entire game engine at your fingertips!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1umc.jpg'),(6295,'Log Jammers','2018-11-23','Sport, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Entertainment System','Log Jammers is a homebrew arcade sports game. It is similar to the PC and console versions of the same name and by the same developer. Those versions are not identical and described as an \"upmake\" of the NES version. The game borrows elements from Windjammers, which served as an inspiration.\n\nPlayers select one of six characters from a cast with names such as Rad Carlton, Bruiser Bogardus, Hot Foot Francis, Sparerib Boneapart, Mayo Monsoon or Ollie Oilsack. There are also multiple environments and different game modes. The characters are described as lumberjacks. Matches take place on a fixed screen view shown from an elevated position. Characters are standing on rolling logs and throw an axe that acts like a ball.\n\nIn a typical tournament different opponents need to be defeated one after the other. Points are scored by throwing the axe into the goal area behind the opponent. This zone is different for each environment. Sometimes there is only a single, large goal area, while another environment has three zones for five, two and five points respectively. In some levels like North Pool the middle part is entirely open, while in others like Mount Olympus the axe can only be thrown through a few open passages.\n\nThe opponent guards these areas and attempts to catch or bounce back the axe to try the same on the other side. A set is won when someone reaches twelve points. The best of three sets wins a match. Special items appear during matches such as stars (use a signature throw different for each character), magnets (increase catching range for five seconds), ice cubes (decrease the opponent\'s movement speed for a short amount of time) and oil (the axe cannot be caught for five seconds and will bounce back instead, and at a reduced speed). There are counters for some power-ups. For instance, when the signature throw is caught by the opponent, their signature throw becomes active right away.\n\nThe game supports competitive multiplayer against another opponent on the same screen. The game comes in a box with a green cartridge and a full colour manual.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3j6y.jpg'),(6296,'Sudoku - Premium Number Puzzle','2009-09-16','Puzzle','iOS','Sudoku for beginners and advanced players alike, with no ads, unlimited grids on or offline, 6 difficulty levels ranging from \"easy\" to \"diabolical,\" daily challenges, and a beautiful ergonomic design.\n\nSudoku with no distractions:\n- Fast: no lengthy intros or slow animations.\n- Small: doesn\'t eat up a lot of storage on your device.\n- Friendly: big buttons avoid fat-fingering.\n- Non-intrusive: plays your music and nothing else.\n\nSudoku with all the nuts and bolts:\n- Undo / Redo.\n- 10 concurrent grids.\n- Automatic and manual notes.\n- Conflict and error highlighting.\n- Customizable input and display settings.\n\nSudoku on all your devices:\n- Universal: iPad, iPhone, and iPod touch.\n- Retina: native resolution on all screens.\n\nFor feature requests and feedback, please email us at help@mindthefrog.com.\n\nEnjoy,\nThe friendly team at mindthefrog :)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ewlb9ha5dyhnazlak5wp.jpg'),(6297,'Farcaster',NULL,'Indie','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3','Farcaster is a game that seamlessly blends classic FPS gameplay with thrilling on rails action and wave shooters. Ride flying platforms or paraglides, shoot and kill enemies, dodge bullets from all directions, and run and climb through immersive military bases.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97s8.jpg'),(6298,'NothingElse','2013-05-29','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6299,'Dnieper River Line','1982-12-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Atari 8-bit, PC-8800 Series, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Commodore PET, Apple II, TRS-80, FM-7','The Dnieper River Line is a fictionalized engagement between German and Russian forces in the Southern Ukraine in late 1943. As the Germans you are challenged to repel Russian efforts to breach your critical defensive position. The Soviet units controlled by the computer seek to over run your thin German defensive line and capture sufficient objectives to assure victory. Dnieper River Line is a computer game which is played out board game style with a 8\" x 11\" mapboard and 240 5/8\" illustrated counters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ik9.jpg'),(6300,'Strayed Lights','2023-04-25','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','An atmospheric action adventure combining a wordless experience with cinematic fights based around colors. Restore your light that was torn by shadows and face endearing creatures deformed by their emotions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67ty.jpg'),(6301,'Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six Siege - Pro League Clash Set','2019-03-26','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Celebrate the Rainbow Six Siege Pro League with Clash\'s Gold Chibi charm, Celestial Glory uniform, Challenger headgear and Halcyon Flux weapon skin for the SPSMG9 and the CCE Shield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i1y.jpg'),(6302,'Jeff-16','2021-06-02','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join the adventure of Jeff the F-16 pilot! Jeff-16 is a fun and challenging obstacle course shooter game where you attempt to fly perfectly through golden rings.You will fly across cities and mountains in an attempts to destroy the evil army who attacked your beloved city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44am.jpg'),(6303,'Hands On! Tangrams','2013-11-21','Puzzle, Strategy','Nintendo 3DS, Nintendo DSi, Nintendo DS','The Nintendo DS variation of the ancient ‘Chinese Moving Puzzle’ will captivate players of all ages! Solve 100 puzzles in 10 different themed levels and watch them roar to life on your screen! Improve perception skills, logical thinking, and hand-eye coordination in this hands-on adventure that is loaded with fun!\n\nTangrams help to develop positive attitudes towards geometry, promote an understanding of basic geometric shapes and interaction and further shape recognition and organization skills. Using the touch screen to test your perceptual proficiency, Hands On! Tangrams brings manipulative puzzle solving to your Nintendo DS!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7n1p.jpg'),(6304,'Gran Turismo Sport: Digital Deluxe Edition','2017-10-19','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4','Digital Deluxe Content:\n\n12 Cars\n- Audi R18 TDI\n- Audi Sport Quattro S1 Pikes Peak ‘87\n- Peugeot RCZ Gr.B Rally Car\n- SRT Tomahawk Vision GT\n- Ford Mustang Gr.B Rally Car\n- Ford Focus Gr.B Rally Car\n- Mazda LM55 Vision GT\n- Mitsubishi Lancer Gr.B Rally Car\n- Subaru WRX Gr.B Rally Car\n- Toyota FT-1 Vision GT Gr.3\n- Nissan GT-R NISMO GT3 N24 Schulze Motorsport\n- Chevrolet Corvette C7 Gr.3\n\nLivery Stickers\nA sticker pack that can be used in the Livery Editor of the game.\n\nIn-Game Credit (Cr. 2,000,000)\nIn-game currency that can be used for various purchases in the game.\n\n60 PS4 Avatars\nA set of 60 \'Gran Turismo Sport\' original avatars that can be used with your PlayStation4 profile.\n\nRacing Helmet - Chrome\nSpecial chromed helmet that can be used in-game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g83.jpg'),(6305,'Tasty Planet: Back for Seconds','2010-09-01','Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Control a tiny ball of grey goo with the ability to eat anything smaller than itself. The more it eats, the bigger it gets! Eat rats, dinosaurs, gladiators, samurai, pyramids, volcanoes... Everything! Soon you\'ll be eating the entire planet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42y1.jpg'),(6306,'Teiji Taisha Online','2019-10-14','Fighting, Shooter, Simulator','Android','Japanese people work hard, and they do many jobs. But, because of their jobs, they sometimes want to escape from their offices. In this game, we can experience running away from there. Please escape from your office and its boss...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3uu0.jpg'),(6307,'Links 2001','2000-11-10','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The venerable golf simulation from Access (nee Microsoft) returns.\n\nNew features in this updated version include new graphics and ball physics, new courses and tour players, centimeter accurate greens, custom club distances; faster, easier online play and golfers that each have their own personalities.\n\nIncluded in the game are some of your favourite golfing heros, Arnold Palmer, Sergio Garcia and Annika Sörenstam to mention a few. Play as them or against them.\n\nThere are six world-class courses featured in the game, San Diego\'s Aviara, Canada\'s Chateau Whistler, The Prince Course on Kauai, Hawaii; Westfields Golf Club, St Andrews Old Course and Mesa Roja fantasy course. More courses can be downloaded for free from the Web.\n\nAlso included in the game is the Arnold Palmer Course Designer. Build your dream course, from the tee to the fairway to the hole.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hzk.jpg'),(6308,'Escape From the Void','2021-10-05','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An asymmetric VR game where you will have to cooperate in order to solve puzzles and escape from the void.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yy3.jpg'),(6309,'Heisei Shin Onigashima: Kouhen','2010-06-01','Adventure','Wii, Wii U, Super Famicom','Heisei Shin Onigashima: Kouhen is an Adventure game, developed by Pax Softonica and published by Nintendo, which was released in Japan in 1997.\n\nIt is a port of BS Shin Onigashima, a four-part broadcast game released for the Satellaview (a Super Famicom peripheral). This game is composed of the last two episodes of BS Shin Oni Gashima.\n\nHeisei Shin Onigashima was first released as a Nintendo Power downloadable game, then later released in two parts as cartridges (Zenpen, Kouhen), much like the original Famicom Disk System version was also divided in two parts.\n\nThe game was later released for the Wii Virtual Console, in two parts, and for the Wii U Virtual Console (a single release, Zengohen).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2utw.jpg'),(6310,'Beating A Dead Horse With A One-Trick Pony','2018-11-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beating A Dead Horse With A One-Trick Pony is a first-person RPG (ArtPG) with a narrative, mild melee combat, and some platforming elements. The game is a sequel to, Jeff Koons Must Die!!!, and is set in the same destroyed museum that the previous game ended in.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6311,'Ninja Cats vs Samurai Dogs','2014-02-21','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','TIGA award nominated Ninja Cats vs Samurai Dogs combines the addictiveness of a tower defence game with the depth and tactical variety of a Real Time Strategy title. Choose your side in a fast paced and frenetic battle for canine or feline supremacy! Leading an army of Ninja Cats or Samurai Dogs has never felt so compelling! Construct buildings, gather resources and command your forces to victory across 65 exciting battles. Unlock new units, buildings and abilities through the deep skill tree and put your skills to the test to defeat your mortal enemies once and for all!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6312,'Twin Mirror','2020-12-01','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Twin Mirror is a psychological thriller wrapped around an investigation where your memories, choices, and relationships will determine Sam\'s complicated fate.\nIn Twin Mirror, every decision you make alters the course of your investigation, as well as your relationships in Basswood. Trust others or rely only on yourself in your hunt for the truth. But no matter your choices, your story is yours.\nTake a look in the mirror - what will you see?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w0s.jpg'),(6313,'Aveyond: The Darkthrop Prophecy','2015-01-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mel has gone into hiding after she discovers she can use magic. To make matters worse, wicked creatures called Darklings keep popping up, convinced that Mel is the prophesied one who will build a dark empire for them. \n \nEdward, the ousted heir to the throne of Thais, who is also Mel’s best friend, eventually finds her hiding in the village of Harakauna. To her dismay, he’s brought along two professors from a prestigious magical school called Shadwood Academy. Will they convince Mel to go to a school where she can learn to control her powers?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bsjah3pvgpblz9zcf29s.jpg'),(6314,'Trials of Fire: Inferno Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k81.jpg'),(6315,'Run Run Run','2021-10-12','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Run Run Run the players compete against each other or during battles in exchange for points that can be converted into coins used to customize your character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40fh.jpg'),(6316,'PC Building Simulator: Fractal Workshop',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hqp.jpg'),(6317,'Tails 64 Revamped',NULL,'Platform','Nintendo 64','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jt0.jpg'),(6318,'Mojo Melee','2023-07-06','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical','Web browser','Mojo Melee is a strategic auto chess battler game where strategy and tactics reign supreme. Assemble unique teams of Mojos, Champions, and SpellStones, and battle it out in engaging PvP matches.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ir4.jpg'),(6319,'女主播经纪公司',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6320,'Smash Legends','2021-03-16','Fighting, Shooter, Platform, Strategy, MOBA','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Smash Legends is a thrilling real time 3 vs. 3 action game.\nJump right into the battle arenas in the Library World with appealing Legends whenever you want. And it’s free-to-play. Join the fun and play against players from multiple platforms such as Steam, iOS and Android devices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vcr.jpg'),(6321,'Escape the Underground','2021-03-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','At the bottom of a massive underground dump, a sentient pile of sludge is born. After finding a discarded book that shows photographs of the surface, they decide to make the journey upward to see the outside world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qd9.jpg'),(6322,'Clockwork Tales: Of Glass and Ink','2014-03-04','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Clockwork Tales: Of Glass and Ink is an adventure game in the steampunk genre. It is a detective drama featuring action elements such espionage, monster battles and even hang-gliding!\nA continuing string of strange earthquakes are causing the world’s cities to crumble to ruin. Dr. Ambrose Ink—one of the foremost minds of the technological revolution—hopes to expose the underlying cause of this supernatural phenomenon.\nHis research leads him to Hochwald, a town nestled high in the mountains near the mysterious Barber family castle. Yet, shortly after arriving at the estate, Dr. Ink disappears.\nIt’s up to Dr. Ink’s longtime friend and confidante, Agent Evangeline Glass to save Dr. Ink and reveal what is causing the earthquakes. With only a mechanical raven to guide her, she must storm the well-secured castle and face the General Engineer of Gottland.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21rs.jpg'),(6323,'Bill Laimbeer\'s Combat Basketball','1991-12-01','Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','The game predicts a science-fiction version of the year 2030 in which there are only robot basketball players (excluding Bill Laimbeer). Basketball teams play in gruelling league matches where new players are bought and sold. Within this future, basketball uses a dedicated robot to perform the toss up at the start of each match as referees had been fired by Bill Laimbeer sometime prior to the year 2030. As a result, players now wear armor to their games and weapons are thrown from the audience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xrv.jpg'),(6324,'Godville','2011-03-17','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser, Windows Phone, Android, iOS','Godville is a massively-multiplayer zero-player game (ZPG). The gist of Godville is that it is a parody on everything from \"typical\" MMO games with their tedious level ups to internet memes and ordinary day to day things appealing to a wide audience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kio.jpg'),(6325,'Cottontales',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jhv.jpg'),(6326,'Mindmist','2021-06-21','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mindmist is a first person, story driven game about exploring the dark side of the human history. You will visit past and witness some of the historical events that represents how we, as humans, are greedy and inclined to fight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s39.jpg'),(6327,'Stick Cricket Super League','2016-12-14','Sport','Android, iOS','Smash sixes. Sign superstars. Captain your Twenty20 cricket team to global Stick Cricket Super League glory.\n\nTake full control of your mobile cricket game career - and your own T20 cricket team - as a top flight franchise player. Stick Cricket Super League, the follow up to Stick Cricket Premier League, offers fans of cricket games the chance to:','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xrw.jpg'),(6328,'Typo','2021-04-09','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Typo is puzzle-driven sidescrolling adventure. Find your way through a mysterious testing lab, type and spawn what you need to survive in this love letter to the puzzle-platformer, solving tens of unique puzzles in a hand-crafted world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xou.jpg'),(6329,'Icosi-Do','2022-11-11','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your superpower is your patience. Nurture it with this single-player minimalist puzzle based on pure logic: swap pairs of colored rods such that all four rods that meet in any of 30 corners have different colors. Thousands of problems await you: from trivial to superhuman difficult.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5h5w.jpg'),(6330,'Rayon Riddles: Rise of the Goblin King','2017-03-21','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Goblins have been displaced and enslaved. It\'s up to you to help them flee from the Orcs and return to their homeland. Solve puzzles and escape Orcs, Trolls and other creatures on an exciting and funny journey full of surprises.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jqx.jpg'),(6331,'Forget Me Not, My Love','2012-11-05','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','“We’re your fiances.” Three of your fiances show up after you wake up in the hospital! However, you can’t remember a single thing since you’ve lost all of your memories… Everything is a haze now due to you getting in an accident, and all you want to know is: who is your real fiance?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66gb.jpg'),(6332,'Travel Fanz','2021-02-08','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Manage Tourists as they explore maps of real world locations. Build a great travel experience. Discover cultural and natural Attractions. Keep them fed at Restaurants and rest them in Hotels. Discover many places you might never have heard of. Have a great trip!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44w4.jpg'),(6333,'Madden NFL 21: Deluxe Edition','2020-08-25','Sport','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Rise to fame in Madden NFL 21. A new generation is leaving its mark on the NFL. Will you rise to the occasion? Change the game, and take control of your own legacy.\n\nMadden NFL 21 - Deluxe Edition includes:\n- 3-day early access\n- 7 MUT Gold Team Fantasy Packs','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e0y.jpg'),(6334,'Heart of Ember','2015-07-27','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Heart of Ember is a simple turn based RPG with a simple story. It is set within a beautiful hand painted 3D world. The game will be released by episodes. The reasoning behind this is because there is only one single developer creating the game. This is the first episode of the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86co.jpg'),(6335,'NCAA Football 2002','2001-08-24','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 2','NCAA Football was an American football video game series developed by EA Sports in which players control and compete against current Division I FBS college teams. The series is a younger brother to the Madden NFL series.\n\nIn July 2013, the NCAA announced that it would not renew its licensing contract with Electronic Arts because of an ongoing legal dispute regarding the use of player likenesses in the games. However, this contract only covers the use of the NCAA name and related logos, not those of individual schools and conferences, which are negotiated individually or through the Collegiate Licensing Company. The CLC concurrently announced that it would extend its existing licensing deal with EA through 2017, ensuring that EA Sports could continue the series without the NCAA branding.[1] However, the series was placed on hiatus in September 2013, following three major conferences pulling their trademark licenses from EA, and uncertainties surrounding the results of lawsuits involving the use of player likenesses in-game. However, EA Sports is still making an attempt to get the series back going.[2]','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/k1paxkmdsbh6n9wgt2gt.jpg'),(6336,'Detective Frizbee','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to \"Detective Frizbee\". It’s an open-world RPG with a detective twist. In this game, you play as Frizbee, a cuddly, silly yet clever puppy. You’ll follow the storyline and help Frizbee solve puzzles to deduce who the culprit could be.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f8f.jpg'),(6337,'Clean City Malaga','2007-03-01','Real Time Strategy (RTS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Clean City Malaga is a educational RTS videogame where your goal is to clean 10 different areas of the city of Malaga. This game was developed in 2007 for a awareness campaign hosted by the malaga town hall and distributed in different educational institutions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99yo.jpg'),(6338,'Quirky Forest','2025-12-31','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Place the correct item at the right place, plan ahead, think carefully, you could say this game is easy to play, but hard to master, be prepared to be challenged!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iif.jpg'),(6339,'Yume: Special Edition','2022-03-25','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Xi He is a new actor, young, less acting experience. But with a comely outstanding face, she stood out in a number of trainees, become famous.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59f2.jpg'),(6340,'Battle Princess of Arcadias','2013-11-26','Fighting, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3','The kingdom of Schwert was once peaceful and beautiful. But now it\'s been overrun by monsters, and as the Battle Princess Plume, it\'s up to you to set things right in this colorful, high- speed action RPG! Recruit a group of warriors and engage in skirmishes against the enemy before taking on huge and powerful bosses in epic siege battles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fqn.jpg'),(6341,'Tomb Raider Starring Lara Croft','2000-06-08','Platform, Adventure','Game Boy Color','Tomb Raider is an action-adventure video game released for the Game Boy Color. This release is significant as it is the first portable game in the Tomb Raider series. This version has the standard Tomb Raider gameplay of running, jumping and switch-flipping, but presented in a side-view 2D style, reminiscent of Flashback. At Lara\'s disposal are 25 or so moves, which are crammed onto the 2 GBC buttons. There are also game-save crystals at special points throughout the levels. Although it shares its title with the first entry in the series, Tomb Raider for Game Boy Color follows a different storyline.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hbn.jpg'),(6342,'Anxietyware',NULL,'Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','All you need is a good night\'s sleep...','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6343,'Beast Dungeon','2023-07-14','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A classic roguelike dungeon-crawler game with pixel graphics.\n\nFight your way through ten levels of a dungeon filled to the brim with aggressive monsters in order to take down the big, bad boss. The Lich Lord awaits you with powerful magic. Will you triumph, or will you become just another pile of ashes on the dungeon floor?\n\nGather equipment, spells, and skills to build your strength and defeat the ultimate challenge!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77cy.jpg'),(6344,'Redden','2015-07-09','Platform','Android, iOS','Redden tells the tales of forgotten tools using their own voices.\nBecome an arrow, kunai, and bullet from across the centuries\nand turn common items into heroes of legend!\n\nBeautiful and unique world that symbolizes the features of each object.\nThirty-three ancient, medieval, and modern historic scenes as remembered by tools!\nExplore the world through moments that only tools can perceive.\nExperience the simple yet unique world of tools!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wjfrswumsuf4go40zd05.jpg'),(6345,'Back to Life 2','2014-05-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The adventure of little beneficial cell continues. As in the first chapter of his journey, the small cell will have to come back to life a part of the organic tissue in which it floats, but this time the method used is very different. You must create and close the beneficial bubbles to attain a level of coverage required to overcome the various levels. These bubbles, once created, will crystallize and explode on contact with the main cell. With increasing levels appear new bonuses and new enemies. There are three worlds, in which appear random barriers and large breathing cells that will hinder the journey of the protagonist.\n\nThe aim of the game is to revitalize the organic tissue (at any level) with the \" beneficial bubbles \" that are drawn from the main character ( \"back to life ... \"). To close the drawing of the bubble must return to the starting point of the \" design \" ( indicated by the yellow arrows ) . In the design phase of the bubble, if the red contours are touched by an enemy or by the protagonist himself, then the construction of the bubble explodes and is canceled. To pass each level you have to fill ( revitalizing ) with the \" beneficial bubbles \" a certain percentage of organic material present in the playfield ( the percentage covered / required is displayed in the lower-right corner of the screen) . There are 300 levels divided into three worlds. With increasing levels appear new enemies and new bonuses. Each level has a time limit to be exceeded, visible in the upper-left corner of the screen. The final goal of the game is to overcome all 300 levels of the three worlds, to complete the mission of the small beneficial cell.\n\nOnce created, the beneficial bubble \'crystallises\' after a few seconds (and turns blue). If the main character touches a bubble crystallized, it explodes decreasing the percentage covered. This was done also to improve the \'strategic\' side of the game. At the top right of the screen is also a MAP that helps you to orientate in the exploration of the level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3luc.jpg'),(6346,'F.E.A.R. 2: Project Origin - Limited Edition','2009-03-10','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It includes both the original F.E.A.R. and F.E.A.R. 2 Project Origin, as well as exclusive in-game skins and steelbox presentation','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xj7.jpg'),(6347,'Super Golden Sibs.','2020-04-01','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jhk.jpg'),(6348,'Prison Tycoon: Under New Management - Bundle 1',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54qg.jpg'),(6349,'Patrol Police: Job Simulator',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6350,'Company of Heroes 2: German Commander - Joint Operations Doctrine','2013-06-24','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','German Commander - Joint Operations Doctrine; Spot your enemy and disrupt their operations, troop concentrations, and armored spearheads with artillery. Light Artillery Barragea: light artillery barrage from nearby 7.5 cm le. IG 18 infantry support guns can scatter enemy forces. LEFH 18 Artillery: This light 10.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gyt.jpg'),(6351,'Galactic Civilizations III: Mega Events DLC',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Sin plataforma','Shake up your gameplay with new galaxy-wide Mega Events! These new events introduce additional complexity requiring your skill and strategy to overcome if you hope to be victorious.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rtc.jpg'),(6352,'Thriving City: Song','2023-04-21','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In 960 A.D., the Zhao Song Dynasty was established. As the mayor, you\'ll need to help the townspeople settle down, cultivate the land and expand. However, when the emperor issues a national mandate, conflicts between factions threaten city development—what strategy will you adopt?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6env.jpg'),(6353,'F.R.A.G.G.',NULL,'Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the future of gaming with F.R.A.G.G, the ultimate arena combat experience powered by Unreal Engine 5. Prepare yourself for next-generation graphics, intense multiplayer and singleplayer gameplay, and a universe brimming with excitement and competition.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6354,'Death Rings of Jupiter','2017-12-01','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Death Rings of Jupiter is a 2d retro bullet hell shooter, set in the dense asteroid fields that make up the rings of Jupiter. \nIt features original gameplay that mixes classic gravity games and platformers. \n \nHidden somewhere in the rings of Jupiter, there is treasure, and it\'s guarded by an infestation of alien monsters. \nYou steal a ship, fire up your percolator and set the controls for the epic gas giant. \nWhile you dust off your trusty lasers, fear creeps into the back of your mind. \nNo one that has gone into the rings of Jupiter has ever returned.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2aqw.jpg'),(6355,'A Fascinating Story: Ice Cream','2024-10-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the game, you need to find two cards with the same picture and successfully eliminate them. On the contrary, the cards with different faces will not change. The way to pass the level is to eliminate all the cards in the picture. You can experience more character pictures after passing the level~','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x1k.jpg'),(6356,'Dragot','2023-10-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dragot is a fast paced bullet hell dungeon crawler in which you live or die by the mysterious items you find hidden in each room; Fizzle out early or snowball your newly acquired powers to fight through all six areas and finally defeat the dragon that pursues you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xeh.jpg'),(6357,'A Plague Tale: Innocence','2019-05-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','A Plague Tale: Innocence, on PlayStation 4, Xbox One and PC, tells the grim story of two siblings fighting together for survival in the darkest hours of History. This new video game from Asobo Studio sends you on an emotional journey through 14th-century France, with gameplay combining adventure, action and stealth, supported by a compelling story. Follow the young Amicia and her little brother Hugo, who face the brutality of a ravaged world as they discover their purpose to expose a dark secret. On the run from the Inquisition\'s soldiers, surrounded by unstoppable swarms of rats incarnating the Black Death, Amicia and Hugo will learn to know and trust each other as they struggle for their lives against all odds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1lat.jpg'),(6358,'Ironfall Invasion','2024-11-28','Shooter, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Join the resistance and reclaim Earth from an army of invaders who won’t go down without a fight!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9435.jpg'),(6359,'Arwinia','2020-11-04','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Arwinia is a retro-style fantasy action platformer. Play as Trenton on a quest to find and bring a powerful wizard back from the shadows. As a ranger use your longsword, shortbow, and dexterity to navigate this perilous journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ko3.jpg'),(6360,'Ghost Song','2022-11-03','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','On the desolate moon of Lorian V, a long-dormant Deadsuit awakens from slumber. Journey beneath the surface on an atmospheric 2D adventure of self-discovery, ancient mysteries, and cosmic terror. Explore winding caverns and acquire new abilities to unearth this alien world’s long-buried secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4koz.jpg'),(6361,'The Fairy\'s Secret','2023-02-07','Adventure, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In the sequel to the fantasy yuri visual novel, The Fairy\'s Song, Marnie and Lisbeth return to Fenchapel to visit Marnie’s grandmother. Things soon become complicated, however, when they run into two figures from the past who ought to be dead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6drx.jpg'),(6362,'Incoming Forces','2002-03-08','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Prepare for one of the most action packed-shooters in PC gaming history! Every level is full of enemies and targets for you to destroy! You will become a soldier of the alien species and protect your home world from the forces of the Human armada.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ai2.jpg'),(6363,'Quantumleaper','2019-11-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Quantumleaper, you\'ll use your Superposition ability to solve puzzles that would be otherwise impossible to complete. Duplicate your position with a single button and press it again to switch between your two selves at any time, no matter how far.\nYou can use your other self to activate switches, mislead enemies and block projectiles. Sometimes, even tunnel through walls. As you progress, new components will require you to find new ways to advance – using both intelligence and skill. It\'s a huge maze filled with deadly puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y6f.jpg'),(6364,'Yu Crossing Animals','2021-12-01','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yu\'s got a new job - working as a mayor\'s assistant in a small town.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gcj.jpg'),(6365,'Knights','2016-05-30','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Knights is a minimalist puzzle game based on a single chess piece, the titular knight. A simple enough to pick up and relaxing experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44ju.jpg'),(6366,'Warriors of the Nile Series Bundle',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zj7.jpg'),(6367,'Smile Poker',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6368,'Ketsui: Kizuna Jigoku Tachi DX','2004-12-24','Shooter, Arcade','Legacy Mobile Device','The second phone adaptation of the arcade game Ketsui: Kizuna Jigoku Tachi. Released for DoJa mobile devices.\n\nUnlike the earlier phone adaptation for J2ME devices, this version features all of the original game\'s five stages and enhanced graphics.\n\nThe new and authentic shooting game of the arcade debut in 2003 is now available on EZweb! A hard world view and serious stories set in the near future, unique characters, and a game system with a high level of challenge are the great attraction of the game. Let\'s master the new system \"Rock Shot\" and enjoy a harder high score battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81p5.jpg'),(6369,'Worms Revolution: Gold Edition','2012-10-12','Fighting, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Includes: Worms Revolution, Worms Revolution - Customization Pack, Worms Revolution - Mars Pack, Worms Revolution: Funfair DLC, Worms Revolution: Medieval Tales DLC Worms Revolution is another entry in the classic turn-based strategy series to come to the PC, featuring exciting new features and beautiful 3D graphics whilst retaining the classic 2D gameplay that fans love. Choose to play the extensive single player mode which features both campaign and puzzle missions or dive straight into multiplayer warfare via local play. For the first time ever see the inclusion of dynamic water, physics objects and worm classes! Customise your experience by choosing what classes you play with, what they look like and even how they speak! Worms Revolution sticks an exploding sheep under worm-on-worm conflict and blasts it squarely into the 21st century.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qai.jpg'),(6370,'Wacky Burgers','2024-04-12','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Wacky Burgers\" is a casual and cute point-and-click game. You are a staff member of a hamburger store that is visited by many funny customers, and you have to help the store by selling lots of food.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82pe.jpg'),(6371,'Jumpcore',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jhs.jpg'),(6372,'Kingdom Come: Deliverance','2024-03-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Story-driven open-world RPG that immerses you in an epic adventure in the Holy Roman Empire. Avenge your parents\' death as you battle invading forces, go on game-changing quests, and make influential choices. Explore castles, forests, villages and other realistic settings in medieval Bohemia!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4aqi.jpg'),(6373,'Persona 5 Tactica','2023-11-17','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','After a strange incident, the Phantom Thieves wander into a bizarre realm where its citizens are living under tyrannical oppression. Surrounded by a military group named Legionnaires, they find themselves in grave danger until a mysterious revolutionary named Erina rescues them and offers an enticing deal in exchange for their help. What truth lies behind Erina and the deal she offers to the Phantom Thieves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jo3.jpg'),(6374,'Wagers of War','2018-08-08','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wagers of War is a multiplayer card battler based on the classic card game of War.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/m2jvndgkszmlpyiun2di.jpg'),(6375,'Mortal Kombat Advance','2001-12-12','Fighting','Game Boy Advance','Classic Mortal Kombat action returns as you defend the Earth against the most lethal fighters from Outworld. Immerse yourself in battle and prepare for the fight of your life as you enter the world of Mortal Kombat Advance and discover what awaits you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y18.jpg'),(6376,'Road 96: Mile 0 - Stronger Together Bundle',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c2p.jpg'),(6377,'Ninja Stealth','2016-09-29','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Evade the guards and the defences to escape the evil facility on this click and play stealth game, there will be difficult on your path, young padawan!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q63.jpg'),(6378,'Metal Slug','2008-05-26','Shooter, Platform, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, Neo Geo MVS, Linux, Wii, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Portable, Neo Geo CD','Metal Slug is a 1996 run and gun arcade video game originally developed by Nazca Corporation and released by SNK for the Neo Geo MVS. It is the first installment in the eponymous series. Set in 2028, players assume the role of Peregrine Falcon Strike Force soldiers Marco Rossi and Tarma Roving on a fight against the Rebel Army led by Donald Morden and overthrow his coup d\'état to prevent a New World Order.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20gf.jpg'),(6379,'Untitled Black Panther Game',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As announced during the 57th anniversary celebration of the character, the first project for EA\'s novel studio, Cliffhanger Games, will be an original, third-person, single-player Black Panther game in collaboration with Marvel Games. The stated mission is to build an expansive and reactive world that empowers players to experience what it is like to take on the mantle of Wakanda’s protector, the Black Panther.\n\nGame lead Kevin Stephens announced, “We’re dedicated to delivering fans a definitive and authentic Black Panther experience, giving them more agency and control over their narrative than they have ever experienced in a story-driven video game. Wakanda is a rich Super Hero sandbox, and our mission is to develop an epic world for players who love Black Panther and want to explore the world of Wakanda as much as we do.”','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q74.jpg'),(6380,'The Artifacts','2019-05-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Artifacts is an interactive storybook. Take a Journey with Asaf, as he explores his world and you might just find he\'s not so different from yourself. While it is aimed at middle grade, parents should also get lots of enjoyment from the story and interactivity.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6381,'Contraption',NULL,'Sin género','Amstrad CPC','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6382,'Apocalypse Traffic',NULL,'Racing','Sin plataforma','The year is 2030. A human pandemic has swept the Earth leaving only a few survivors. The world\'s cities are now run by nature; barren land resides where communities once thrived. Buckle up, it’s time to fight for survival through the Apocalypse Traffic.\nDrive your way through three decimated locations whilst avoiding traffic to increase money; High-octane driving is rewarded with near miss and high-speed bonuses. Witness the new world through three locations - a decaying city, desolate badlands and a town left in ruins.\nAfter dodging traffic, spend your coins on upgrading the car’s brakes, steering and acceleration. Once the money rolls in, upgrade your car from one of the seven available. Each has their own unique style and characteristics.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6383,'Kingdom Hearts HD 2.8 Final Chapter Prologue: Cloud Version','2022-02-10','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','KINGDOM HEARTS HD 2.8 Final Chapter Prologue features 3 magical experiences, all leading up to KINGDOM HEARTS III:\nKINGDOM HEARTS Dream Drop Distance HD: A full-HD remaster. Sora and Riku take on the Mark of Mastery exam in preparation for their coming showdown with Master Xehanort.\nKINGDOM HEARTS χ Back Cover (movie): A new HD movie that tells the mysterious story of the Foretellers from the series’ origins.\nKINGDOM HEARTS 0.2 Birth by Sleep – A fragmentary passage – : A brand new episode that links to KINGDOM HEARTS III.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co401o.jpg'),(6384,'Gamera: Daikaijuu Kuuchuu Kessen','1995-04-03','Sin género','Game Boy','A Gamera game for the original Game Boy. It was released to coincide with the movie of the same title, in 1995.\n\nThe game is essentially a turn-based battler, in a similar vein to the Pokemon games for the same console. Its battle system is similar to that of an RPG game, but other than that, the similarities end there.\n\nMost of the attacks rely on Button Combos, but the game provides a list of combos for the more inexperienced player.\n\nGamera\'s enemies are Gyaos, Guiron and Viras. Eventually, the game\'s final battle pits Gamera against a clone of himself.\n\nThe game\'s language is in Japanese, but an English fan translation does exist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hfg.jpg'),(6385,'Fraction Munchers','1987-12-31','Quiz/Trivia, Arcade','Mac, Apple II','Fraction Munchers is the second math based game in the Munchers series of educational games. Aside from the subject matter, the basic concept is the same as other games in the series. It is played on a grid where the player controls a creature called the Fraction Muncher who has to eat the numbers or fractional expressions that correspond to the statement that is written above the grid. Other creatures known as troggles roam the grid and try to get to the muncher. There are five different ones and they all have their own behaviour and movement patterns. Eating wrong answers or getting caught by a troggle leads to a life being lost. There are four different game modes which decide what kind of statements should appear: fraction types, equivalents, comparing and expression. Additionally there is a combined mode that mixes all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95ak.jpg'),(6386,'Hissatsu Pachinko Station 2',NULL,'Arcade','Sin plataforma','The second Hissatsu Pachinko Station game and the sixth game overall in the \"Hissatsu\" meta-series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/a7xazrwsvk0i1fzvwrco.jpg'),(6387,'Beasts of Steel',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Beasts of Steel is a semi-realistic WWII game that combines FPS and Strategy where you can battle solo or online. Experience intense combat as an infantryman, tank crew, or take to the skies as a pilot. Unleash chaos and dominate the battlefield!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71ky.jpg'),(6388,'Foreign Galaxies','2022-04-22','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After a galactic portal failure you find yourself lost in a galaxy 500 light years away from home... With your main propulsion systems disabled you are unable to traverse space, so you try to collect resources you find near you in order to create a galactic portal to return back.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5oa4.jpg'),(6389,'PokéROM: Psyduck','2000-06-30','Puzzle, Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This PokéROM is part of a set of educational games featuring creatures from the Pokémon universe. The game contains mathematical challenges for children up to a fifth grade level; upon completion, the player will be awarded with pictures of Psyduck. A competitive trivia mode supports up to four players in a race to the finish line. Players take turns to answer questions pertaining to such subjects as geography, grammar, and Pokémon knowledge, with correct answers moving the player closer to the goal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bha.jpg'),(6390,'Up\'n Down','1983-12-31','Racing, Arcade','ColecoVision, Arcade, Atari 2600, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, DOS, Apple II','Up\'n Down is a vertically scrolling game that employs a pseudo-3D perspective.[citation needed] The player controls a purple dune buggy that resembles a Volkswagen Beetle. The buggy moves forward along a single-lane path; pressing up or down on the joystick causes the buggy to speed up or slow down, pressing right or left causes the buggy to switch lanes at an intersection, and pressing the \"jump\" button causes the buggy to jump in the air. Jumping is required to avoid other cars on the road; the player can either jump all the way over them, or land on them for points.\n\nTo complete a round, the player must collect 10 colored flags by running over them with the buggy. If the player passes by a flag without picking it up, it will appear again later in the round. The roads feature inclines and descents that affect the buggy\'s speed, and bridges that must be jumped. A player loses a turn whenever the buggy either collides with another vehicle without jumping on it, or jumps off the road and into the grass or water.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/onvv0e1skpz5rodszcvv.jpg'),(6391,'66 Bricks','2014-01-28','Puzzle','iOS','Give you 66 bricks, build your own tower.\nPhysical version of Tetris, be arbitrary place bricks, build a variety of towers, challenge the patience and balance limits, see how high you can stack.\nHow to play: Move your finger left and right to adjust the position of the bricks, move your finger down brick drop quickly , tap the screen rotate bricks.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6392,'Soulbringer','2000-06-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Thousands of years ago six demon kings, known as the Revenants, ruled the world with an iron fist and bloody swords. Donning the bodies of mortal vassals, they could live in the realms of man forever. The great hero and warlock Harbinger was the only one who could stand up to their power. One by one he hunted the Revenants, taking their spirits and casting them into the Well of Souls. Alas, the Revenants survived. As a young man you will travel to meet your uncle in the town of Madrigal. There, your destiny draws you into the path that Harbinger trod - to confront the Revenants and banish their souls back to the Well forever. Your travels will take you far from Madrigal, to the ruined kingdoms of Horath, the ancient empire of Thardolin, and through the lost city of Talendrah. You will brave searing deserts and icy plains. You will have to seek answers among the living and the dead.\n\nCustomizable combat and magic system that can be as simple or as complex as you like.\nCompelling story with many twists and turns will keep you hooked for hours.\nDynamic music, high quality voice acting, and more than one possible ending.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1q7v.jpg'),(6393,'Furi: Modore Edition','2022-05-17','Fighting, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Modore Edition! The edition includes:\n- Furi\n- The new DLC Onnamusha to fight as the powerful Onnamusha Rider with new attacks - All content created and improvements made to the game since its launch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rn1.jpg'),(6394,'Legends of Awen: Rise of The Fianna',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Legends of Awen: Rise of the Fianna is a story-driven cRPG set in a Celtic-inspired medieval-fantasy world. Gather your party of legendary Fianna champions and embark on a journey to save the kingdom of Tara from internal strife and the return of an ancient dark force!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94ca.jpg'),(6395,'12 Tails Online','2011-03-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\'12 Tails Online\' is a Thai instance-based MMORPG by BigBug Studio.\n\n\'12 Tails Online\' are named for the 12 animal species that make up the playable classes; Bat, Bison, Cat, Chameleon, Mole, Monkey, Panda, Penguin, Rabbit, Sheep, Whale, and Wolf.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co851j.jpg'),(6396,'Minimapperz','2025-03-27','Quiz/Trivia, Arcade','Web browser','Minimapperz is a multiplayer and solo game where players are placed inside a 360° scene from a video game and must guess the exact location on the map. The closer the guess, the higher the score! Challenge your knowledge of game worlds and compete with friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lg6.jpg'),(6397,'Go Fetch!','2022-01-14','Quiz/Trivia','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Video Chat Party Game for 3+ Players of All Ages. Players take turns being the judge and giving out prompts for other players to use in finding a real-life object. Points are awarded not just for getting items that match the prompt quickly, but also for matching the prompt in a creative way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4be7.jpg'),(6398,'Gun Club VR','2019-07-18','Shooter, Simulator, Indie, Arcade','Oculus VR, Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), Oculus Quest','Take to the range with an arsenal of the world’s most powerful weaponry in Gun Club VR. Addictive gameplay and unsurpassed realism combine to make Gun Club VR the ultimate virtual weapon simulator. The only thing missing is the smell of the gunpowder.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ifi.jpg'),(6399,'Epstein 2','2024-09-06','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join detective Michael in his psychological horror-filled adventure to gather evidence and find his mother on Epstein\'s dark island. In this single-player game, read notes carefully, collect equipment to protect yourself from aggressive test subjects, and uncover the truth...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ruu.jpg'),(6400,'Awakened: Dark Space','2022-02-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Awakened: Dark Space is an adventure indie game that\'s a unique fusion between medieval, present and sci-fi. Go on a search to find your friend Sara who went missing in a mysterious area called Crystal Woods which is rumored to be cursed for over 800 years, since a certain incident.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i2j.jpg'),(6401,'Fun VR Farm','2019-01-23','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to your Fun VR Farm ! Discover VR in a nice and peaceful environment with simple mechanics : Take care of the farm give the animal\'s favorite food & water, make quest for the farmers, sell food you collect to the town in order to Unlock over 15 cute animals !','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6402,'Pac-Man: Party Royale','2019-10-18','Arcade','iOS, Mac','A brand-new arcade experience featuring a four-player Battle Mode where the last PAC-MAN standing wins.\n\n\"Challenge your friends in this brand new PAC-MAN game, mixing the instant fun of arcade retro-gaming with a multiplayer experience.\n\nPlay our 4 Players Battle Mode, and be the last PAC-MAN standing to win the rounds!\n\nEat PAC-DOTS to gain speed and catch the Super Pellet first, and see your friends and the ghosts running away from the random Power-Up you got from the classic Energizer, to the brand new L.A.S.E.R. and Electric Field!\n\nBe careful, the more PAC-MAN you eat, the more Ghosts there will be, and they will try to get revenge on those who ate them!\nAlso beware of Itchy, a new Ghost poisoning you on touch with a random negative effect.\n\nPlayers who became ghost can come back as PAC-MAN if they manage to eat another PAC-MAN: don\'t give up on victory and get back in the fight!\n\nBut beware the 256-glitch ! If there is no winner soon enough, the maze will start to collapse on you and the safe area will shrink until there is only one PAC-MAN left!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22kz.jpg'),(6403,'Supersonic Bridge Racing',NULL,'Racing','Sin plataforma','A fast-paced racing game where the player controls the track. Fight against Friends on a global leaderboard or in the local multiplayer. Supersonic Bridge Racing is a mix between a flying and reaction race.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ls7.jpg'),(6404,'The Labyrinth of Greed','2021-11-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Having collected all the treasures, you will gain power that the gods themselves did not dream of. Classic gameplay in which you have to collect items and avoid dangers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5n5o.jpg'),(6405,'Hotel Tutwin','2019-04-15','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hotel Tutwin is an interactive visual novel of the horror/romance genre, for casual gamers who appreciate female leads and supernatural characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wkw.jpg'),(6406,'Joint Operations: Combined Arms Gold','2009-09-29','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The most ferocious online conflict of the 21st century is now available in its most definitive form: introducing Joint Operations: Combined Arms Gold, the largest multiplayer FPS collection ever. With the award-winning Joint Operations: Typhoon Rising and the bestselling Joint Operations: Escalation together in one convenient package, it\'s easier than ever to join the world record setting large scale modern warfare that critics have called \"extremely intense,\" and \"an absolute blast.\"  (PC Gamer) \n\n\n					Play in games of up to 150 players online via the all-new, blazing fast NovaWorld network, or host up to 64 player games on LAN\n					Experience the most premium connections and sophisticated anti-cheat technology available with THREE MONTHS FREE NovaWorld Gold premium service included with purchase\n					Battle over 30 unique, breathtaking and massive multiplayer levels across the diverse environments of Indonesia, from chemical weapons factories to ancient jungle ruins\n					Choose your specially-skilled class of warrior from 7 different authentic fighting forces\n					Crush your enemies with 35 fully drivable war machines, from M-1 battle tanks to LCAC amphibious assault hovercraft and Black Hawk helicopters','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tsp.jpg'),(6407,'GrimKeep',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac','Grimdark roguelite dice-builder. Scavenge for powerful relics, forge unstoppable synergies, and shatter the limits of power. Carve your own path through a world of twisted horrors, where every roll seals your fate in GrimKeep!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n4k.jpg'),(6408,'Best Fiends Forever','2015-12-11','Indie','Android, iOS','Get ready for the very big adventure with very small heroes! The sequel to the award-sometimes-winning-and-if-not-we\'re-just-happy-to-be-nominated Best Fiends! But it\'s nothing like that game! Except that it\'s got the same characters, and you\'re still beating up slugs. But it\'s a clicker adventure, which is different, and we think a lot of fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qe5b3r07ianwmxwyse8j.jpg'),(6409,'Pirate Hunter','2009-09-10','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pirate Hunter is a classic representative of the First Person Shooter (FPS) genre, using an original graphics engine DIOsoft Engine. The game was inspired by Far Cry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ms3.jpg'),(6410,'Far Cry 6: Ultimate Edition','2021-10-07','Shooter, Adventure','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Welcome to Yara, a tropical paradise frozen in time. Far Cry 6 thrusts players into a modern-day guerrilla revolution. As dictator of Yara, Anton Castillo is intent on restoring his nation back to its former glory by any means, with his son, Diego, following in his bloody footsteps. Become a guerrilla fighter and liberate Yara. Far Cry 6: Ultimate Edition includes the game, the Ultimate Pack and the Season Pass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ed1.jpg'),(6411,'Curse of the Lich King','2019-04-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser','Can you survive long enough to face the Lich King?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bw1.jpg'),(6412,'Megami Tensei Gaiden: Last Bible II','1999-04-16','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Color, Nintendo 3DS','Megami Tensei Gaiden: Last Bible II is a role-playing video game series developed by Multimedia Intelligence Transfer, Sega, and Menue, and published by Atlus and Sega for multiple platforms. Players explore the game world and fight monsters in menu-based battles; players can also attempt to recruit monsters to their party, and can fuse two allied monsters into a single new one to try to get stronger monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jkf.jpg'),(6413,'Toppler',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6414,'Panic Cell',NULL,'Platform','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jhh.jpg'),(6415,'Watch Dogs 2','2016-11-29','Shooter, Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Explore a massive and dynamic open world offering an incredible variety of gameplay possibilities. Hack your way through traffic while you engage in dangerous car chases through the winding streets of San Francisco, traverse the rooftops of the colorful and vibrant neighborhoods of Oakland, and infiltrate the cutting-edge offices of Silicon Valley companies. There are many secrets to uncover in the birthplace of the tech revolution.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p3j.jpg'),(6416,'Koopa CD','2022-10-02','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Koopa is sent to the past by the Toads in the future as they plan to corrupt everything in that time.\n\nThis was a submission for the SMB Jam 22, and it is a small but complete overhaul of the game. This entry scored 3rd place out of the 11 contestants.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62b1.jpg'),(6417,'Redacted: Genome','2024-01-23','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Redacted:Genome is a survival action horror game where the player is given the ability to swap between various arm powers and rifle barrels to fight off enemy mimics in the third or first person. Craft ammo, food, and upgrade your abilities for the greatest chance at survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rwd.jpg'),(6418,'An Ordinary Sonic Fangame',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Evade Sonic.EXE in warped versions of the original Sonic the Hedgehog (1991) zones. Inspired by \"Ordinary Sonic ROM Hack\" (2013) by Cinossu.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bgh.jpg'),(6419,'Spinning Maze','2016-10-17','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Mr. Box accidentally fell into a cube maze, and now he has to use his sense of direction and powerful spatial thinking to escape from this mysterious space. Please help him collect gems and look for the keys to get out of these mazes~ The ingenious level designs, diversified traps, and exclusive puzzle setting make the game unique and stylish. The integration of space thinking, reasoning, action and many other elements will bring you a peculiar entertainment experience!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6420,'Wayward','2016-04-22','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Wayward is a turn-based, top-down, wilderness survival roguelike in beta.\n\nIn Wayward, there is a large focus on simulation, survival and openness. There are no classes; there are no levels. Progression of your character depends on individual skill and stat gains by your interactions with items or objects in the world. You are free to play and explore the game in any fashion you wish.\n\nWayward will continue to grow, expand, and evolve over time to open up new modes of play, add depth and complexity, add content, and further refine the systems presented.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rv1.jpg'),(6421,'Titan Quest','2006-06-26','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Titan Quest is an action role playing hack and slash video game developed by Iron Lore Entertainment. It was released worldwide by THQ on June 26, 2006. The game was released on Steam, along with the expansion Titan Quest: Immortal Throne, on July 17, 2007. The game is also available via Impulse, GamersGate, GameTap, Direct2Drive and OnLive. In 2013, the IP for Titan Quest, along with most of THQ\'s other games was purchased by Nordic Games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z4f.jpg'),(6422,'Wheelie King 7','2024-12-31','Racing, Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Realistic 3D motorbike simulator All devices cross-play (IOS,Steam,Android). Steam-deck compatible. Realistic motorbike wheelie game. Customize bikes. Play offline & online. Change bike parts. Spray paint bike parts. Play offline & online Change bike parts Spray paint bike parts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9md9.jpg'),(6423,'Ghostbusters: Spirits Unleashed','2022-10-18','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','An all-ages take on its brand of four-versus-one asymmetric multiplayer games, where you play as your own original Ghostbusters team — or take on the role of a ghost hellbent on wreaking haunted havoc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co543w.jpg'),(6424,'Ultimate Doom the Way id Did','2019-02-16','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A custom Doom 1 level pack released in 2019 that takes over the Episode 4 slot of The Ultimate Doom. Created by various mappers from the Doom modding community, \'Ultimate Doom the Way id Did\' is an attempt at replicating the style of the various mappers that contributed to the original Episode 4 of Doom and its difficulty.\n\nThis level pack is 9 maps long, and occupies the entirety of Episode 4. No other new maps occupy the first 3 episodes, and this can be seen as an expansion to \'Doom the Way id Did\', released in 2011.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61x0.jpg'),(6425,'Kaze Kiri: Ninja Action','1994-04-28','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','Kaze Kiri takes place in Feudal Japan where the kingdom princess Shizuhime is abducted by a group of mysterious ninjas. A feared swordsman called Kaze Kiri, hero of the game, is given the task to rescue the poor girl and restore order. Our ninja can can use a broad variety of fightings skills - he can run, jump, dash and slash without mercy anyone who gets in his way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48hc.jpg');
INSERT INTO `games` VALUES (6426,'EchtegP','2023-06-01','Platform','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','EchtegP is platformer in Godot. Enjoy and keep track of future updates.\nYou can play with WASD or arrow keys and additionally space bar is for jumping.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oe0.jpg'),(6427,'Chained','2024-08-06','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are chained to your friends and must climb to the top. One wrong move can decide your friendship.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kvj.jpg'),(6428,'Flowers: Le Volume sur Printemps','2016-08-17','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable','Suoh Shirahane, a shy girl with a mysterious past, will begin her first year of high school at Saint Angraecum Academy, where she hopes to find a new beginning. She will navigate friendships and mysteries at her new school, and discovers that love can come in many forms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dlm.jpg'),(6429,'PolyClassic: Wild','2023-01-25','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is an action game that combines elements of the classic retro shooter and low poly styling. The player\'s task is to destroy all enemies that come across on the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vhe.jpg'),(6430,'Lothgar Online',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Lothgar Online','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/igmqvtod8enojtuyxzda.jpg'),(6431,'Diluvian Winds',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Diluvian Winds is a management game set in a small hamlet at the foot of a lighthouse. Welcome weary travelers and help each other to try and survive the unpredictable weather. Grow your hamlet on land, under the sea or among the clouds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lvn.jpg'),(6432,'Kanda Alice mo Suiri Suru.','2021-04-28','Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Yuri visual novel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84kn.jpg'),(6433,'Killer Klownz','2016-12-05','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Alone in your childhood nightmare, you find yourself under attack by homicidal clowns who appear from a dark field of discarded toys. Kill the Klownz before they reach you...or die trying.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6434,'Would You Like to Run an Idol Café? 3','2022-05-09','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After their first music video goes viral, the girls of Sweet Shoreline, plus Naoya, are invited to a competition in Tokyo, where they can prove their worth against numerous famous idol groups. Will Sweet Shoreline prevail, or will their first big concert end in disaster?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59pb.jpg'),(6435,'Under the Sky World','2023-01-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','One day, by chance, I entered the most popular game \"Under the Sky World\"! When I entered, I accidentally found that the game was invaded by a virus. Players need to find evil hackers and stop this virtual world from being destroyed!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eq0.jpg'),(6436,'Plunderer\'s Adventures','2022-02-25','Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Plunderer\'s Adventures is a pixel art tower defense action game where you use your trusty flintlock pistol and every trick up your sleeve to take down your opponents. Blast enemies as they cross the screen towards your crew. Take them down quickly and efficiently, and your crew will support you with extra lives, loot multipliers and more, but fail to protect them from the onslaught, and they\'ll be carried off by malicious marauders! By clearing enemy waves, you\'ll unlock new stages, skills, crew members, gallery images and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ap6.jpg'),(6437,'Formaggio 2','2023-11-23','Point-and-click','Web browser','The sequel to the Scratch project Formaggio 1.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98ng.jpg'),(6438,'Monument Valley 1&2 Bundle','2025-04-22','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Experience the magic of Monument Valley and Monument Valley 2 in one complete bundle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pyl.jpg'),(6439,'Fishao','2013-08-24','Sport, Adventure','Web browser','Fishao is an online fishing game that features a cute and very colourful theme that is very engaging. Players are presented with a huge open world to explore and plenty of special items such as fishing rods and tackle to collect that are designed to help give them the edge as they work towards the ultimate goal of winning the prestigious fishing tournament.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jbw.jpg'),(6440,'ExSpire',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','ExSpire is a bullet hell dungeon crawler where time is a currency. Explore what makes you tick, manage your seconds, and climb The Spire to undercover its secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qh9.jpg'),(6441,'Button VR','2023-02-03','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','Button VR is a game where the core idea is to press the button to progress to the next level with each new level having increasingly harder puzzles and new content to solve.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zyi.jpg'),(6442,'Le Fol',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Le Fol is a point-and-click narrative game with multiple endings, puzzles, and poetry, featuring neo-impressionist 2D isometric art. Inspired by The Fool’s Journey from the Tarot de Marseille and the city of São Paulo, it follows an unconventional protagonist, exploring the fragility of human connections across eight branching storylines.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oe8.jpg'),(6443,'Guardian Codex','2016-11-03','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Android, iOS','Guardian Codex is a free-to-play RPG for iOS and Android devices featuring a deep story, console-quality 3D graphics, and an engaging multiplayer battle system. Created by the team behind the popular card battle games GUARDIAN CROSS and DEADMAN’S CROSS—which have surpassed eight million combined downloads worldwide—Guardian Codex brings players into an exciting new world featuring the familiar “Guardians.”','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dyr36slonvn4bec3tuno.jpg'),(6444,'Wind Giants',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Wind Giants is a narrative-driven 3D walking simulator blending exploration and puzzle-solving. Journey across mystical floating islands to unravel elemental challenges, awaken ancient giants, and restore a forgotten world emerging from catastrophe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hv6.jpg'),(6445,'The Inner Friend','2018-09-06','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Inner Friend features a rich visual environment, supported by an immersive soundscape and a cinematic soundtrack enhancing immersion and emotional moments. Movement, imagery, and music are the main ways for the player to interact with the Shadow, their guide throughout the descent. Dark and scary, mysterious at times, the world of The Inner Friend is a surrealist representation of memories and fears.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27ay.jpg'),(6446,'Break It Down',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Advanced Destruction Physics | Everything is Destructible','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mjx.jpg'),(6447,'Birnchen & Friends: Minor Confrontations',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Visit Pear and Mr. Blue in their playroom and fight each other for a bowl of candy in this colorful RTS! Whether it\'s fruity attack or stormy chaos, you choose the side!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wda.jpg'),(6448,'Mana Khemia 2: Fall of Alchemy','2009-08-25','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','The 10th core Atelier game and the second game in the Mana Khemia series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w6o.jpg'),(6449,'Cities XL','2009-10-09','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cities XL is a simulation game in which players can build their own cities on realistic 3D maps. Players are challenged to create the right combination of social services, employment, activities, and job opportunities for the cities\' citizens. In a handful of brief animations, a grandmother character will get into scuffles with much stronger men; this is usually depicted in a slapstick manner as the men cower in fear or futilely strike back.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e0c.jpg'),(6450,'Gachi Heroes 2: Flexboll','2019-12-19','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Everyone knows who the real king of Flex and today he is ready to teach you. Plunge into an incredible adventure, meet different characters from the universe \"gachimuchi\" and find out how deep you are ready to go. However, there is one problem...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zvr.jpg'),(6451,'L.3.3.T.',NULL,'Fighting, Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Modern First-Person shooter with epic fights against players or AIs. Group with your friends or play alone and join the raid, find goods and escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6g9l.jpg'),(6452,'Kochiya Sanae no Kamikaze to Tomo ni','2013-12-30','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The gameplay consists of action, platform, small puzzle solving elements and boss battle at the end of each stage. Sanae has Kirby\'s signature method of dispatching enemies by using the ability of inhaling with extreme power. By pressing X button repeatedly, Sanae is able to fly for as long as she likes to reach higher platforms or to find secret item locations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8637.jpg'),(6453,'Moving Out','2020-04-28','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Moving Out is a cooperative moving simulation game. In a local cooperative experience, players move objects from houses into a moving van while coping with exaggerated physics.\n\nIt was followed by Moving Out 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xlt.jpg'),(6454,'Sonic the Hedgehog: Chaos Delta',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jhu.jpg'),(6455,'Whiskey-Four',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6456,'Girls Power: The Fantastic World Of Dreams',NULL,'Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The girls of the magical world went to look for the ruthless thief who stole the mystical object from their museum. Which they protected traveling between worlds until finding out in which dimension the thief was, and there the thief put many traps in the different worlds where they chased her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jer.jpg'),(6457,'Assassin\'s Creed III: The Battle Hardened Pack','2013-01-15','Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, Xbox 360','The Battle Hardened Pack extends the Assassin’s Creed III multiplayer experience with three new playable characters and maps, plus awesome bonus items! Become the influential Governor, the resilient Highlander, or the fearsome Coyote Man.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jbq.jpg'),(6458,'Owyn\'s Adventure','2018-12-14','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Call Grandpops and tell him that dinner\'s ready? What sounds like a straightforward task from Mum becomes an adventure when Owyn leaves the safety of his house and enters a garden world where threats abound, and not even the slowest of creatures can be trusted... \n \nPlay as Owyn as he puzzles his way through the many landscapes of his adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2odi.jpg'),(6459,'John Christian 3.0','2024-04-26','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','John Christian 3.0 is a Christian adventure game with spiritual battles. The game presents the story of young John who, dressed in the Armor of God, embarks on his new mission to fight against the forces of evil in a universe with many challenges to free the imprisoned people.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ayg.jpg'),(6460,'Dragonyhm','2024-12-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Game Boy Color, Game Boy','Experience an epic tale set in a vivid fantasy world.\n\nFor a number of years after the age-old conflict with dragons came to a head, the people of Archend have enjoyed an era of peace.\n\nAll was well until the esteemed Yhmszindr, Kurtis, went missing, and the sealed dragons began to awaken.\n\n​Explore, solve, and battle your way through this heroic adventure, meeting memorable characters while uncovering the rich history of the land of Archend.\n\nStep into this world as Kris, son of the Yhmszindr, embarking on a quest to find him. Along the way, put a stop to the plot that threatens the kingdom!​','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93yi.jpg'),(6461,'Hero\'s Hand','2026-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embark on the ultimate Poker-Based Roguelike RPG Adventure! Hero’s Hand packs a strategic punch! Become the Knight of Spades & save the land of Cardunia! The game features hand drawn animation, humorous fantasy monsters, & addictive turn-based poker combat that keeps you coming back for more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jlg.jpg'),(6462,'Ultimate Fishing Simulator: Kariba Dam',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d0l.jpg'),(6463,'Kinnikuman Nisei: Dream Tag Match','2002-04-02','Sport','WonderSwan Color','Kinnikuman Nisei: Dream Tag Match is a wrestling game based in the manga/anime series of the same name. It features the cast of Kinnikuman Nisei (known in the West as \"Kinnikuman: Second Generations\") in a battle to victory. The main story follows Kid Muscle, the prince of Muscle Planet and son of King Muscle (the early protagonist of the series), who fought for peace and justice in the Universe. Kid has now been chosen as King Muscle\'s predecessor in wrestling history, and must now defeat every opponent that comes his way, stopping total domination by the Demon Manufacturing Plant, an evil wrestling league which wants to take control of the universe, and the loss of his fanbase, which includes the love of his life, Roxanne.\n\nThis game supports up to 2 players and includes 14 characters (which aren\'t all available from the beginning). Game modes are Story Mode (in which you will fight as Kid Muscle, and will have to defeat all your opponents), Tag Mode (you will have to choose a companion and confront other 10 couples, if you win, you will unlock a character), Classic Mode (this one will be available once you unlock all the characters of the game, and once done, it will let you play a port of the original Kinnikuman NES game).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dmnbim9qblfdjxffbtyq.jpg'),(6464,'Savage: Ultimate Boss Fight','2024-06-06','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Savage is a single-player action game that allows players to experience MMORPG-style battles. Many bosses are included this game. Unravel the gimmicks hidden in the attacks, find a strategy, and try to clear the stage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ide.jpg'),(6465,'Vampire: The Masquerade - Coteries of New York Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cqg.jpg'),(6466,'Monster Truck Championship: Rebel Hunter Edition','2021-03-16','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, Nintendo Switch','A true Monster Truck simulation. A unique and challenging motor racing experience where local or online victory depends solely on your driving skills. 16 customizable trucks, 25 arenas and 3 leagues to win to become champion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kdq.jpg'),(6467,'Idle Luca','2022-09-29','Fighting, Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Android','Idle Luca aims to be an easy and convenient RPG game. Users can grow their mercenaries (Velius) by collecting attractive characters. And the progressed Velius collects progression materials even when offline, allowing the users to progress their Velius with ease and continue their adventures when they reconnect to the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63c2.jpg'),(6468,'Major League Curveball',NULL,'Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the Major Leagues! In Major League Curveball, you dodge, strike, and get smashed by homing balls as you compete against players in this fast-paced, last player standing sports brawler.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88sy.jpg'),(6469,'Chronicles of a Dark Lord: Episode 2 War of the Abyss','2014-11-14','Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Chronicles of a Dark Lord: Episode 2 War of The Abyss is the next episode in the epic JRPG series Chronicles of a Dark Lord. Experience the 30+ hour long continuation of the saga of the Dark Lord, Magus Drakhen Lee, in this innovative next installment that will draw you into the world of Cora like never before with immersive, all new high-resolution artwork and lush landscapes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wtiebnwzzcwe5ws5sib4.jpg'),(6470,'Madden NFL 2003','2002-08-12','Sport','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Madden NFL 2003 is an American football video game. It features then-reigning 3 time NFL Offensive Player of the Year, and former St. Louis Rams running back Marshall Faulk on the cover. This edition of Madden was the first to feature EA Trax.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30us.jpg'),(6471,'Techpack Adventure',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jhr.jpg'),(6472,'F-Zero: GP Legend','2015-01-01','Racing','Wii U, Game Boy Advance','The F-Zero series grows with new racing circuits, an intense storyline, and multiplayer modes. F-Zero GP Legend lets you take control of one of eight characters, including Captain Falcon, racing star Rick Wheeler, the evil lord Black Shadow, and more. Guide your character through various Grand Prix cups, time trials, and challenges that span multiple planets. In addition to conquering single-player challenges, you can challenge up to three of your friends in multiplayer competitions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tjx.jpg'),(6473,'Nebula Ball 3D',NULL,'Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s 2250. Aliens and humans pack together in the Nebula Arena for the craziest sport in the galaxy: Bowling! From the dude that’s making Brooke Vs. World Doom comes an absolutely insane bowling game. Each game of bowling is played in a unique level with 10 different lanes, each one trickier than the last. Unlock crazy bowling balls by gaining experience points, which you can earn by scoring high and completing mini objectives that can differ per level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jzt.jpg'),(6474,'Rave Paradise',NULL,'Music','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ju3.jpg'),(6475,'Brothers in Arms DS','2007-06-21','Shooter','Nintendo DS','Brothers In Arms DS brings all the action and strategy of the series to a handheld, utilizing the DS Touch Screen to control the squad. Fight in 16 different missions and use a wide range of weapons such as bazookas, sniper rifles, and grenades, or fight in major multiplayer battles with three of your friends in different multiplayer modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rhu.jpg'),(6476,'War Sniper',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6477,'Weapon Rearing','2024-12-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Idle weapon collection and weapon development game. Legendary weapons can be automatically obtained.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mqo.jpg'),(6478,'Robots & Things',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jhn.jpg'),(6479,'Wheelie City','2024-12-16','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wheelie City is a game about doing deliveries as fast as possible, climbing the urban ranks while collecting and customizing your bike to fit your style! Stunt your way accross hand crafted maps to find shortcuts and secrets and become the best delivery driver in the Wheelie City','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mdb.jpg'),(6480,'Blowhards','2017-02-28','Fighting, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blowhards is a long range multiplayer fighting game, with king of the hill style gameplay. The game is inspired from a mix of Super Smash Bros. and Towerfall Ascension.\nThis game is made for every couch game lover out there','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co232u.jpg'),(6481,'Who Was The Cat?',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jsw.jpg'),(6482,'Wasted','2025-02-17','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A surreal group of generic ATMs acts like bumper cars in an arena, roaming around set on a desolate square quay in an infinite ocean. As a first-person player, you ram into other bot ATMs before they hit you. This is an indie art video game by Studio Alona Rodeh, Berlin, Germany.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mdk.jpg'),(6483,'Flocky the Cat',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A traitor in your village kills your father and kidnaps your sister. You are a young cat who must save his sister and other clans of cats.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jep.jpg'),(6484,'atooi Collection','2020-08-07','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Nintendo 3DS','Atooi Collection was Limited Run Games\' 001 release on Nintendo 3DS, which went live August 7, 2020.\nOnly 6000 copies were made with 2000 sold as part of the Collector\'s Edition.\nThe collection is region-locked to North American versions of the Nintendo 3DS.\n\nA single cartridge features the following critically-acclaimed games: Mutant Mudds Deluxe, Bomb Monkey, Xeodrifter, Mutant Mudds Super Challenge, and Chicken Wiggle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mnh.jpg'),(6485,'Assassin\'s Creed Shadows: Digital Deluxe Edition','2025-03-20','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac','The Assassin\'s Creed Shadows Digital Deluxe Edition includes the base game and the Deluxe Pack.\n\nExperience an epic action-adventure story set in feudal Japan! Become a lethal shinobi assassin and powerful legendary samurai as you explore a beautiful open world in a time of chaos. Master complementary playstyles, create your shinobi league, customize your hideout, and usher in a new era for Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kt3.jpg'),(6486,'Goddess Of Swing','2025-01-22','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Highscore Chaser game, made from german group of students.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bjb.jpg'),(6487,'Illusion Spectre',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jhm.jpg'),(6488,'Atelier Ryza 2: Lost Legends & the Secret Fairy','2021-01-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','This story takes place three years after the events of the previous game “Atelier Ryza: Ever Darkness & the Secret Hideout,” and depicts the reunion of Ryza and her friends, who go through new encounters and goodbyes to discover a true priceless treasure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hbf.jpg'),(6489,'Thousand Threads','2020-07-30','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A beautiful open world where your actions matter. Give, take, save, kill, inform, hide, befriend, betray. And deal with the consequences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ede.jpg'),(6490,'Pip 2','2022-08-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','PIP 2 — cute puzzle game with pipes. Enjoy a relaxing time connecting pipes','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kga.jpg'),(6491,'Mystic Inn','2006-04-14','Puzzle, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Playing as Daphne, the unfortunate hostess ensnared by the enchanted Mystic Inn, you serve all of the patrons in order to get magic to upgrade the inn. Once you have fully upgraded the establishment, the spell that locks Daphne within her confines can be broken.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co849j.jpg'),(6492,'Quest: The Adventure for the 6 Stones','2021-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Game Boy Color, PC (Microsoft Windows), Game Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jhi.jpg'),(6493,'Shrimp Keeping Simulator','2025-02-20','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grow, feed and care for your shrimp pals. Watch your shrimp multiply and sell your colony when they become too numerous.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ol4.jpg'),(6494,'Keyboard Warrior: Dreamstate','2022-07-23','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Keyboard Warrior: Dreamstate is the world\'s first action-clicker game. Wield your mouse cursor as a weapon against hordes of oncoming enemies. Fight your way to the top using wit, creativity, and pure clicking strength.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ij5.jpg'),(6495,'Destruction Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Destruction simulator is a demolition simulation game, where you take on the role of a construction worker. You are tasked with the destruction of multiple buildings, using your tools to fullfill your job.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ltu.jpg'),(6496,'The Visitor','2013-08-06','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gather round, kids, it\'s time for some\nstory-telling. You got the lights off and curtains down?\nThen let\'s start.\n\nLet\'s go back in time, to the year 1913.\nWe\'re going to follow the story of a normal,\nbut yet not so normal family.\nIt all started when the family inherited\na big mansion from the mothers\nnow deceased uncle.\n\nThey weren\'t rich by any means, but they also inherited\nquite a bit of money.\nSo they thought: \"Wow, living in a mansion,\nlet\'s try it out!\"\nAh, the young and foolish.\nWould there be any stories to tell without them?\n\nAlright kids, let grandma Agatha guide\nyou through this night of horror.\nYou like scary stories, don\'t you?\nBecause if you don\'t...\nShoo! Go away!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co321c.jpg'),(6497,'The Humans: Meet the Ancestors','2009-05-08','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy','Nintendo DS','Guide your tribes of cavemen through various obstacles in their quest for enlightenment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ld6.jpg'),(6498,'Suicide Guy: Sleepin\' Deeply','2018-10-25','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In this new chapter of \"Suicide Guy\" you\'ll be challenged with even more insane puzzles, generated by the surreal dreams of the Guy.\nYou\'ll encounter the weirdest of the living beings as you go deeper and deeper into his subconscious.\nThis time to wake him up you\'ll need all your skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co276e.jpg'),(6499,'Puyo Puyo Da!','1999-12-26','Music','Arcade, Dreamcast','Puyo Puyo DA! is a Dance Dance Revolution based game for the Dreamcast with Puyo Puyo characters. This game is based off a Disc Station game previously featuring Ellena Stevens.\n\nIn contrast to most Puyo Puyo games, a large majority of the text in this game is in English.\n\nIt was Compile\'s last Puyo Puyo game to be released on a Sega system. (The last Compile game in the series, Puyo Puyo Box, released a year later.)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xxj.jpg'),(6500,'Voids & Vessels',NULL,'Fighting, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jsv.jpg'),(6501,'Kaleidoscope Chateau',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Unpack the past and deny the future in this first-person psychological horror about the perception of memory, time and the lengths we go to control these forces. Find your remaining possessions and say goodbye to your shining castle, your diamond home, your Kaleidoscope Chateau.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66ai.jpg'),(6502,'Foldy\'s OS Quest',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Foldy’s OS Quest invites players into a colorful computerized world for an action-packed 3D platforming adventure like no other! Run, jump, zip, surf and stomp your way through the magical world of personal computing, and take down the virus before it can break through the Firewall!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jlf.jpg'),(6503,'9-nine-: Episode 2','2018-04-27','Simulator, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','9-nine-: Episode 2 is the second volume in a series of supernatural mystery games, with Episode 2 telling a story centered around Sora Niimi. The entries in the the 9-nine- series share the same setting and world, but each entry focuses on a different heroine. 9-nine- is a tale of the town of Shiromitsugawa, host to mysterious Artifacts and the superpowers they bestow on their Users. A tale of a brother and sister with a close bond, and also a murder mystery where they hunt down the culprit behind a series of supernatural murders. Each game has an independent story that can be enjoyed on its own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co267w.jpg'),(6504,'Friday Night Funkin vs. junim Cururu','2021-06-18','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A mod made by a brazilian that loves Friday Night Funkin\' :3 where he presents Junim Cururu and his Funk do Cururu','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a4y.jpg'),(6505,'Monster',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','The princess is gorgeous, out of this world. However, reality is often hidden behind what we see. The princess has a slave named MC and she is often seen torturing him. Visiting the royal library recently, MC stumbled upon a magical book. So, how will MC take advantage of the book, let’s find out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lik.jpg'),(6506,'Gran Turismo 7: Launch Edition','2022-03-04','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Gran Turismo 7 brings together the very best features of the Real Driving Simulator. Whether you’re a competitive or casual racer, collector, tuner, livery designer or photographer – find your line with a staggering collection of game modes including fan-favorites like GT Campaign, Arcade and Driving School. With the reintroduction of the legendary GT Simulation Mode, buy, tune, race and sell your way through a rewarding solo campaign as you unlock new cars and challenges. And if you love going head-to-head with others, hone your skills and compete in the GT Sport Mode.\n\nGran Turismo 7: Launch Edition includes:\n- 100,000 CR (in-game credit)\n- Three-car pack, including:\n- Mazda RX-Vision Stealth Model\n- Porsche 917 Living Legend\n- Toyota Supra GT500 Castrol TOM’S','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4cfb.jpg'),(6507,'A Death in Hyperspace','2024-09-01','Indie','Web browser','When your captain dies suspiciously halfway through a hyperspace transit, you know you’re in trouble. Not because you need a captain — as an embodied AI spaceship, you can pilot yourself just fine — but because, as an aficionado of mysteries and detective stories, you know there’s only one explanation: murder most foul.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jk4.jpg'),(6508,'Nirvana X-ROM',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Nirvana X-ROM is the companion game to the Italian SciFi film Nirvana directed by Gabriele Salvatores. It is set after the events of the film: VR game developer Jimi Dini has wiped the source code of his latest game Nirvana, thus releasing its protagonist Solo from his virtual prison. However, portions of the game still survive in Jimi\'s archives, creating a potential risk of Nirvana being re-assembled. The player is called upon to investigate Jimi\'s house and archives in search for the lingering game code and destroy it. \n \nThe gameplay is a mixture of puzzle-solving and exploration viewed from the player\'s perspective. The location view can be freely rotated by moving the mouse and several objects are clickable, often giving access to secret rooms. The bottom bar icons offer several actions such as using scanners, connecting to the network and communicating with the artificial intelligence that powers Jimi\'s house. Many solutions to the puzzles are found by sifting through Jimi\'s archives, which contain audio, images and clips from the film, as well as program code and other digital objects','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nkg.jpg'),(6509,'Hector\'39',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A Hatsune Miku theme STG by Ichigo-Citron released in Comiket 73.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a5j.jpg'),(6510,'The Front',NULL,'Shooter, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Front is a survival-open-world-crafting shooter game. Players will assume the role of a resistance fighter sent back in time to stop the rise of a tyrannical empire that has conquered the world using technology based on unknown relics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6y3o.jpg'),(6511,'Crowd Smashers','2017-05-04','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crowd Smashers is a local versus game. Annihilate your opponent\'s supporters while you protect yours is the key to victory. Combine three magic elements to create tricky and powerful spells. The longer is your exchange, the stronger and powerful will be your magic ball. Use your super attacks to Buff, Debuff and destroy your opponent\'s public.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2717.jpg'),(6512,'HorrorBox',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','HorrorBox is a Multiplayer Horror Game dripping with an eery cinematic experience set in the 80s. Utilize tools and work together to survive either PvE or PvP fright nights...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58ku.jpg'),(6513,'Garten of Banban 6','2024-10-31','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Explore the forgotten levels of Banban’s Kindergarten. Survive the new terrors that reside below. Uncover the truth behind the place, and find the whereabouts of your missing child…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x88.jpg'),(6514,'Satama Puzzle','2022-05-18','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Satama Puzzle is a relaxing building and puzzle game where you will optimize the layout of a Port of Unloading. Each level will have three random variable scoring conditions, so it will be a new experience each time. Try to beat your score!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qyn.jpg'),(6515,'Whoopi',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6516,'Europa Universalis IV: Wealth of Nations','2014-05-29','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Wealth of Nations is the second expansion for the critically praised strategy game Europa Universalis IV, focusing on trade and how to make the wealth of the world flow into your coffers. The expansion allows you to create trade conflicts in secret, steal from your competitors with the use of privateers, use peace treaties to gain trade power and create a new trade capital to strengthen your grasp over trade. The age of exploration is brought to life in this epic game of trade, diplomacy, warfare and exploration by Paradox Development Studio, the Masters of Strategy. Europa Universalis IV gives you control of a nation to rule an empire that lasts through the ages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ekibo2fjyzqffnxpkifw.jpg'),(6517,'Holy Breaker! The Witch Betrayed Blue Moon Wicca','2015-02-27','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hinoue Itaru\'s visual novel project, with Kashida Leo as the scenario writer. A low-priced visual novel that was initially sold at Comiket 87.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qef.jpg'),(6518,'The Jackbox Party Pack 4','2017-10-17','Puzzle, Strategy, Quiz/Trivia, Indie','Amazon Fire TV, PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The biggest and fourthiest addition to this storied party game franchise features the blanking fun sequel Fibbage 3 and its new game mode, Fibbage: Enough About You; the web-based frame game Survive the Internet; the spooky date-a-thon Monster Seeking Monster; the deranged debate match Bracketeering; and the one-up art game Civic Doodle. Use your phones or tablets as controllers and play with up to 16 players, plus an audience of up to 10,000!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zeo.jpg'),(6519,'Sniper Jarhead','2024-11-21','Shooter, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Precision marksmanship and calm decision-making are crucial for this rescue mission. Feel the intense tension as you look through the scope and pull the trigger.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92t7.jpg'),(6520,'The Epyx Games: Sports Collection','2024-11-28','Simulator, Sport','Nintendo Switch','Relive over 50 different athletic and sporting events across eight of Epyx\'s retro classics in this remastered collection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92t0.jpg'),(6521,'Only for Gamers','2025-02-25','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game was designed for only Pro gamers. There are many hard obstacles in the game. You have to find a correct solution to overcome all the obstacles. However, It will not be as easy as you imagine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gxj.jpg'),(6522,'Waste Time Lotto','2025-03-13','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A lottery where winning is rare, but clicking is endless! Watch numbers roll, enter your lucky pick, and embrace the odds. No money, just infinite glory! Plus, a totally useless yet oddly satisfying clicker. Come waste some time—you’ve got nothing to lose… except time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mdi.jpg'),(6523,'Tom Clancy\'s The Division 2: Warlords of New York - Season Two: Keener’s Legacy','2020-06-23','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Division tracks down a new rogue agent cell determined to pick up where Keener left off. Take down these all new targets, participate in new Leagues, Global Events, and more. And of course, earn all-new gear, weapons, and a new skill variant.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4z4r.jpg'),(6524,'Geo-Fall','2016-07-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Geo-Fall is an action packed room-scale game in which you collect and sort orbs to get the highest score possible!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6525,'REalM: Walk of Soul','2021-10-30','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','One night Iris awakens in a bizarre and perturbing REalM, where she must embark on a journey to uncover the truth behind its mysteries and find herself. Dive into this 2D surreal horror puzzle adventure set in a nightmarish world, filled with mind breaking enigmas awaiting to be uncovered.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47r2.jpg'),(6526,'Stronghold: Warlords - Special Edition',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cot.jpg'),(6527,'Ride 4','2020-10-08','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Are you ready to live the best gaming experience that a motorcycle fan can get? RIDE 4 will spark your competitive soul with hundreds of bikes, dozens of tracks and a whole new level of realism.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27l0.jpg'),(6528,'Digimon Rumble Arena','2001-12-06','Fighting','PlayStation','Digimon Rumble Arena is a crossover fighting video game developed and published by Bandai in association with Hudson Soft for the PlayStation video game console.\n\nPlayers are able to choose from up to 24 characters (fifteen of which need to be unlocked) from the Digimon Adventure and Digimon Tamers seasons of the Digimon anime, such as Terriermon, Agumon, Gatomon, and Renamon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zfm.jpg'),(6529,'Weapon and Armor: Mahjong','2017-09-17','Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Weapon and Armor: Mahjong is the perfect game for the casual player looking for fun and extensive gameplay.\nThe goal of this game is to match open pairs of identical tiles and remove them from the board. The game is finished when all pairs of tiles have been removed from the board.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/kkyygndwcu5qwms8ilvd.jpg'),(6530,'Two Point Hospital: Culture Shock','2020-10-20','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This DLC gives you new locations, illnesses, gameplay and much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j31.jpg'),(6531,'Mystery Trackers: The Four Aces','2012-11-10','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The entire town of Brightfield was evacuated after a series of bizarre animal attacks. Now, strange creatures roam the streets, danger lurks around every corner and you’ve just landed smack in the middle of it all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kzv.jpg'),(6532,'True Tears','2008-08-07','Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','The gameplay in True Tears requires little player interaction as much time is spent on reading the text that appears on the lower portion of the screen, representing either dialogue between characters, or the inner thoughts of the protagonist. Before the beginning of every week in the game\'s storyline, the player is given the option to plan a schedule, and is allowed to pick and view any three days of the given week. Different events occur depending on the days that the player chooses. Every so often, the player will come to a \"decision point\" where he or she is given the chance to choose from options that are displayed on the screen, typically two to three at a time. Depending on which choice the player makes, the \"tear points\" of the heroine associated with the events of the day would either increase, decrease, or remains the same. \"Tear points\" act as a system notifying the player how well he or she is treating a certain character. If a character\'s tear points exceed the maximum amount of eight, her ending is rendered inaccessible during that specific playthrough. There are multiple plot lines that the player will have the chance to experience. To view all of the plot lines, the player will need to replay the game multiple times and make different schedules and choices during decision points to progress the plot in an alternate direction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rim.jpg'),(6533,'Watermelon','2024-10-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Watermelon\" is a gamAn interesting and unusual clicker game in which you need to level up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mdf.jpg'),(6534,'Neon Abyss: Alter Ego','2021-06-17','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Take on the New Gods with a series of Alter Egos for your Characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4dre.jpg'),(6535,'Locked in my Darkness','2022-12-09','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Locked in my Darkness is a psychological horror game & horror atmosphere, which takes place in an apartment complex.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j04.jpg'),(6536,'The Astronomy Game',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Learn about astronomy and the wonders of space!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co431t.jpg'),(6537,'Dice Legacy: Corrupted Fates','2022-04-19','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Corrupted Fates is the new expansion to Dice Legacy, Gamescom\'s Most Original Game of 2021. A mysterious cult has formed within your realm. Convert your dice into Cultists and obtain powerful Revelations. Your actions, however have wicked consequences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xh1.jpg'),(6538,'The Void Chronicles Chronis','2025-03-06','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Every decision matters. It’s a race against the clock in a story where paranoia, creativity, and courage are your only allies. Will you break the loop, or will time break you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n0r.jpg'),(6539,'Elise','2022-09-10','Platform','Nintendo 64','Elise is a Yume Nikki-like romhack in which you play as Elise, a fresh young adult who, in her despair, wished she could stay eternally asleep. This wish was granted to her and she is now wandering her own subconscious dreamworld. It is up to you to find all the dream drops, discover the story behind her predicament, and wake herself up from her slumber.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dpa.jpg'),(6540,'Sengoku Basara: Samurai Heroes','2010-10-15','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Wii','Featuring unique playable characters, as well as supporting generals who will make it easier to command and lead armies, players will see the battle from the perspective of each military commander with the ultimate goal of re-writing history to rule all of 16th century Japan. In the dynamic new \"Hero\'s Story\" mode, the player\'s decisions impact history with a redesigned story mode. Based on choices made by the player, new drama unfolds as friends become enemies, enemies become friends, and a new Sengoku story unfolds. Adding a new strategic element to the game, forces can fight for control/taking over of camps and ultimately entire battlefields.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nvq.jpg'),(6541,'Superman: The New Superman Adventures','1999-07-23','Shooter, Adventure','Nintendo 64','Superman: The New Adventures, often referred to as Superman 64, is a 1999 adventure video game developed and published by Titus Software for the Nintendo 64 video game console. The game is based on the television series Superman: The Animated Series. Superman was first released in North America on May 31, 1999 and in Europe on July 23, 1999.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b3i.jpg'),(6542,'Doom II Enhanced','2020-01-09','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73w6.jpg'),(6543,'Hue','2016-08-30','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hue is a stark puzzle platformer where you shift the hue of the world, creating rifts when colours collide.\n\nIn this world, everyone sees in grayscale. Anne, a researcher specialising in colour theory, has created a mysterious ring which grants the ability to perceive and alter colour. After a fracas with her research assistant, she disappears into a coloured void. You play as Hue, Anne’s son, as he discovers fragments of his missing mother’s research and learns to perceive and alter colour for the first time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i4q.jpg'),(6544,'FIFA 22','2021-10-02','Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Port of FIFA 22 for PlayStation 4, Xbox One and PC. This version doesn\'t have some of the new technologies employed in the next generation version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68bs.jpg'),(6545,'GeGeGe no Kitaro: Yokai Souzoushu Arawaru!','1996-12-13','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy','This is an RPG game developed for the Game Boy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hfr.jpg'),(6546,'The Bell Chimes for Gold','2015-10-15','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Bell Chimes for Gold is a visual novel in which we will follow Maria. She is a skilled and dedicated herbalist who suddenly gets dumped by her mentor for another pretty girl. This makes her declare that she will get rich and marry someone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xs2.jpg'),(6547,'Way of the Hunter: Aurora Shores','2023-02-23','Shooter, Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S','Explore untouched Alaska nature with a rich population of wild animals like Kodiak bears, Roosevelt elk, Wood bison. Use a broad selection of firearms and equipment to get the best trophies and enjoy the open world habitats ranging from grasslands to mountains','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co670v.jpg'),(6548,'Far Cry: Primal','2016-02-23','Shooter, Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Gamers play as TAKKAR, a seasoned hunter and the last surviving member of his hunting group. Arriving in the majestic and savage land of Oros, players will pursue one single goal; survive in a world where humans are the prey. They will meet a cast of memorable characters who will help them push back and tame the dangers of the wild.\n\nPlayers will journey as the first human to tame the wilderness and rise above extinction. Along the way, they will have to hunt for food, master fire, fend off fierce predators, craft weapons and tools partly from the bones of slain beasts, and face off against other tribes to conquer Oros.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28ha.jpg'),(6549,'Blood Lily Loop','2024-09-16','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your bestie seems to be hiding something. There\'s something about your world that seems odd as well, like it has...secrets. Dive into the time loop of this horror game and witness a \"friendship\" that rewrites the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87hp.jpg'),(6550,'Gex: Enter the Gecko','1998-12-01','Platform','Game Boy Color, Game Boy','A conversion of the 3D platform title, this game features all the same levels shrunk down onto the Game Boy Color screen.\n\nGex is sucked into his TV, and must explore all of the TV style levels, find the remote controls and save the world of television from Rez, who is planning to take over the world\'s TV networks, as well as return home. Each level is based on a popular TV genre, such as horror, sci-fi and comedy, and has mentions of well known programs and movies along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ppo.jpg'),(6551,'Heretic + Hexen Collection','2012-11-21','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cut.jpg'),(6552,'A Building Full of Cats 2','2025-06-30','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome back to the world of A Building Full of Cats! In this sequel, not only will you be petting all the cats in the building, but you\'ll also be assisting its residents with various tasks. Can you pet all the cats and make a difference in the lives of the building\'s residents?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co880x.jpg'),(6553,'Fear of Sexy Water Ghost','2025-04-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Watch out! The terrifying sexy water ghost is here!\" A survival horror action-adventure where you escape from a nightmarish city that has suddenly gone mad.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jcb.jpg'),(6554,'Super Cars II','1991-12-31','Shooter, Racing, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, iOS, DOS, Amiga','Produced by Magnetic Fields, this game was on the amiga in the uk and was the basis for super cars international on the pc. It is linked to other Magnetic Fields games including: Lotus Esprit Turbo Challenge, Lotus Esprit Turbo Challenge 2, Lotus Esprit Turbo Challenge 3 and Super Cars','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85lz.jpg'),(6555,'Ungrounded: Ripple Unleashed VR','2017-08-19','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unleash your inner hero in this 16 player PvP VR arena. Fly and engage in high action aerial battles with energy blasts and charge beams. Grapple across buildings facing off against giant Titans with your two swords, or play as a Titan and crush the tiny humans going after you in this. Motion sick players be warned, this is no bars held, no teleportation, no baby steps.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6556,'Sniper Elite 5: Complete Edition','2023-08-24','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Sniper Elite 5 Complete Edition includes the base game, Season Pass One, and Season Pass Two.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70he.jpg'),(6557,'Your Home','2019-02-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game originally participate on Global Game Jam 2019! This is a story of the man, which return home from the hard work, just to find out what his home, become a deadly trap. And to get out, you need to play some game with a bloody maniac.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hys.jpg'),(6558,'Delicious Fruitworld',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Delicious Fruitworld is a classic jump \'n\' run platformer where the goal is to complete each level with as many points as possible.Points are awarded for fruits distributed in the world and for a good time in which the level was passed. Share your score!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gqs.jpg'),(6559,'Super Cars','1990-12-31','Shooter, Racing','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), Amiga, Amstrad CPC, Nintendo Entertainment System','Super Cars is a top-view racing game from Gremlin Interactive, who later produced the Lotus series of games. Stylistically, the game is influenced by Super Sprint.\n\nThere are 9 tracks at each of the 4 difficulty levels, which can be raced in any order (although the last track you race is made harder than usual). In the races you win money, which can be spent on temporary handling and power upgrades, plus armour plating and front/rear shooting missiles that can knock out other racers. The player must finish in the top 3 of each race to progress - initially there are 4 computer opponents, but more are added as you progress through the game.\n\nThe car can be upgraded throughout the game via the shop section. The player is given an initial price, but also a number of options of things to say to the salesman - with the right combination, the price will drop.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k3x.jpg'),(6560,'Filling Up','2020-09-27','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Luna and Rezzy are on a roadtrip, and need to get gas. Things escalate from there.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w1g.jpg'),(6561,'Dragon Ball GT: Transformation','2005-08-09','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Game Boy Advance','Dragon Ball GT: Transformation is a Game Boy Advance action game based on the Japanese cartoon Dragon Ball GT. Transformation follows the Dragon Ball GT storyline from the Child Goku Saga to the Baby Saga. You can create three-man teams from seven playable characters--such as Goku, Trunks, and Uub--and choose who you control in the middle of a battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co408a.jpg'),(6562,'Worms: A Space Oddity','2008-03-17','Puzzle, Strategy','Wii','Join in on an interplanetary odyssey that\'s odder than any oddity you can imagine! Retaining the classic turn based gameplay, stylized environments and humor synonymous with the brand, Worms: Wii brings players closer to the game than ever before! Taking advantage of the Wii Remote with a redesigned control scheme, players will launch attacks with unique Worms\'s weaponry via a wide range of gesture-based maneuvers. Now everyone can join in the all new single and multiplayer experiences of Worms: A Space Oddity, enjoy a host of new Worms party games, and take on friends in classic Worms matches. The more players put into the game, the more they get out! With an all-new visual style, environments, intuitive controls, and even more customization options, it has never been easier to pick up a Worms title and join in the wormy fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xmj.jpg'),(6563,'Space Crew: Legendary Edition','2020-10-15','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Captain\'s Log, Star Date 2152. This is Space Crew. Its continuing mission: To defend Earth and humankind, to eliminate the extraterrestrial threat and to boldly go where no Crew has gone before in this unique, strategic, space simulation!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6715.jpg'),(6564,'Snafu','1981-10-15','Arcade','Intellivision','The contest is on! Create a maze to corner your opponents...before you are cornered yourself. Split-second reflexes keep your trail in motion -- while blocking your opponent and/or the computer in a trap from which there is no escape. Or direct a hungry serpent after your opponent, and bite his tail off before he bites yours. It\'s a twisting tangle which only the swift survive. 16 game variations put you in control.\n\nTrap Games (12 variations) -- To keep your trail moving without colliding -- and to block your opponents\' trails so that they are forced into collisions. Trails that collide with others, with the edge of the picture, with obstacles or themselves are eliminated.\n\nBite Games (4 variations) -- To make contact between the head of your serpent and the tail of your opponent\'s serpent, \"biting\" off one link with each contact. The winner is the surviving serpent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pgl.jpg'),(6565,'Tube Tycoon','2018-03-28','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A streaming simulator in which players strive to make a living in the wonderful world of YouTube.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rr9.jpg'),(6566,'Trauma Center: Second Opinion','2006-12-02','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure','Wii','In Trauma Center: Second Opinion the player plays the part of Derek Stiles, a doctor who has just completed his residency at Hope Hospital and is now a full time surgeon. The story takes place in the year 2018; by this time a lot of diseases thought incurable have been cured, but people still get sick and are involved in accidents requiring attention of doctors such as Stiles. Dr. Stiles career begins rather normally with a series of routine surgeries to get warmed up. Later though it\'s discovered that Dr. Stiles has the \"healing touch\", a rare ability he can use to slow down time to perform surgery faster while maintaining accuracy. This ability becomes important as a new, deadly disease begins spreading...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sra.jpg'),(6567,'Rummel & Rabalder: Jakten på Kapten Hanssons Guld','1998-12-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Rummel & Rabalder: The Hunt for Captain Hansson\'s Gold\" is a Swedish computer game from 1998 produced by Utero Digital Media AB , based on an idea by Lars Anttinen. The game is based on TV4 \'s characters Rummel and Rabalder from the TV series of the same name by Lattjo Lajban , created by Torbjörn Jansson , who also wrote the script for the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9meb.jpg'),(6568,'Unkilled','2015-09-03','Shooter, Adventure','Android, iOS','The multiply awarded best-looking mobile shooter you have ever seen. Online multiplayer, extra long storyline, special ops, many unique weapons.\n\nNew York City has become the epicenter of the world\'s most terrifying zombie outbreak. What\'s needed is a hero with the grit and skill to take on the undead and find out who or what catalyzed this cataclysmic event. Start the story with one of five unique characters that are elite members of the task force called in to do the dirty work on the streets of the Big Apple, known simply as the Wolfpack. As part of a private military organization designed to find, track, and eliminate any and all threat, you will dig deeper into the streets, subways, sewers, and back alleys of New York. In so doing, you\'ll uncover a plot more heinous and nefarious than anyone expected. Good thing you\'re packing a lot of firepower.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rsc.jpg'),(6569,'Block City Wars: Mafia Town','2014-01-04','Simulator','iOS','Are you aching for some audacious daredevilness and real danger? Then it’s high time we set out to open the criminal world of Block City!\n\nUse our special Skins Exporter for Minecraft! It is a user-friendly tool for changing standard skins in Minecraft Pocket edition and Minecraft PC edition to a variety of exclusive ones which are created by our designers. Export can be used either from the first game screen, main lobby or the game interface. Skins can be exported either to Minecraft mobile or desktop version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vif5vw9kwxzeg9a0eumx.jpg'),(6570,'Micro Machines World Series','2017-06-20','Racing, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Micro Machines World Series will retain the manic social game play of the classic series, but will bring a new dimension to the experience with stunning HD visuals – taking you to the much-loved household environments as they’ve never been seen before. \n \nAs well as bringing to you the classic game modes like Race and Elimination, Micro Machines World Series will introduce a new style of game play to the series: Battle Mode. The all-new Battle Arenas will allow you to wreak mass destruction on a miniature scale against your friends or the AI. Meanwhile, Team Play lets you work together using your vehicles’ unique skills with modes such as ‘King of the Hill’ or ‘Capture the Flag’!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nzu.jpg'),(6571,'LEGO Fortnite: Brick Life','2024-12-12','Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Build your new life in an ever-evolving LEGO city.\n\nExperience a highly social destination for up to 32 players where you can explore all the city has to offer!\n\nBe the ultimate socialite and hang out in restaurants, house parties or rooftop clubs. Chat with friends or make new ones, activities in LEGO Fortnite Brick Life are better together. Host a band practice down the beach, grab a bite to eat with others or race through the streets on hover boards.\n\nTake on a job, complete tasks to earn some spending money and start living the life in Brick Bay with vehicles, housing and more. Customize your home with furnishings from the local store or invite your friends over to hang out.\n\nGetting this experience is not necessary to access this content. When you launch Fortnite using this through your Library, the experience will be pre-selected for your convenience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95dd.jpg'),(6572,'Island Crusaders',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Island Crusaders is a cute yet brutal tactical RTS game. Defend your home against swarms of enemies as your picturesque island gets stained by the blood of your enemies. Unlock new and unique units, strategically place and move them, and defeat the impending army.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5heq.jpg'),(6573,'Rise: Battle Lines','2015-11-17','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Draft an army and fight a battle all in 15 thrilling minutes. Opponents issue orders at the same time in this unique system of simultaneous turn-based tactics. The rules are simple but the strategies require the brains and bravado of a general, destined to Rise!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r5q.jpg'),(6574,'Digimon World: Next Order','2016-03-17','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation Vita','Digimon World: Next Order is a role-playing game set in an open world environment and played from a third-person perspective where players take control of a human character who is accompanied by two partner Digimon.\n\nThe player chooses from ten possible starting companions at the beginning of the game, who grow and evolve throughout the course of the story by taking part in battles and interacting with their owner. Players can increase the bond between their Digimon and themselves by praising, scolding, feeding, or offering items. Together, they travel through various environments completing objectives and advancing the story by interacting with non-player characters and battling enemy Digimon they encounter in the field. Battles themselves take place in real-time when an enemy creature is touched, which causes a circular-shaped battle area to appear which each partner is free to move within. The companion Digimon act automatically through an assigned AI strategy while the player can halt combat to issue commands or use restorative items. Players can switch between either partner in battle to issue specific commands or instigate a special evolution where both Digimon temporarily merge. After battle, their Digimon\'s stats are increased, making them stronger.\n\nA total of 217 obtainable Digimon creatures are available in the Japanese version of the game. with a further 15 added to the western version of the game, taking the total to 232.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bhu.jpg'),(6575,'Overturn: Final Operation',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','After the down of Beholder, Magi is left alone and since the final fight, she lost all her abilities and is unable to fight anymore.\nEnemies are still coming and they shows no sign of stopping...\nIt’s terrifying to see that there are still a huge number of enemies even many of them have been defeated before. The enemies surround MAGI and come to get her.\n\nThought this is the end, Magi is giving up slowly, but all of a sudden unknown Androids come and fight the enemies.\nStartled, Magi looks at them. She has no idea of who they are and where they come from. But one thing that she knows, the androids are sent to protect and rescue her.\n\nMagiI uses the very last of her power and makes an attempt to escape with the help of the Androids.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6576,'LEGO Legends of Chima Online','2013-08-06','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser, iOS','Explore the vast and dangerous World of CHIMA ruled by animal warriors in the brand new, free-to-play LEGO Legends of CHIMA Online game. Play co-operatively with friends or venture out as the solo hero in an action-packed multiplayer adventure game based on the highly popular toy line and cartoon series from the LEGO Group! Choose from the Lion, Eagle, Gorilla and Bear tribes and customize your very own warrior. Smash LEGO objects to collect studs, bricks and special items. Build and expand your Outpost to craft powerful weapons, armor, powers and gear to defeat the Croc, Raven, Rhino and Wolf tribes. Solve fun puzzles, complete challenging missions, and unleash the power of CHI in epic battles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61um.jpg'),(6577,'Witch Trainer','2016-10-06','Point-and-click, Simulator, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Miss Granger has become a headache for Professor Snapes, and next to this one you will try to \"put in waist\" to this one, developing not only his personal growth but also affecting other characters such as Snapes, Harry or Ginny, although these are only mentioned.​','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yew.jpg'),(6578,'Cybershock: Future Parkour','2020-07-28','Racing, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cybershock: Future Parkour is a runner game with outrun aesthetics in which you are an antivirus. Your mission is to destroy all the viruses on your computer before they destroy you. For this you must parkour through the different levels and avoid all the obstacles that stand in your way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tw8.jpg'),(6579,'An Unnamed Jumping Game','2024-12-05','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Short Platformer about Jumping','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91ay.jpg'),(6580,'Mahjong Haouden: Kaiser\'s Quest','1992-03-28','Strategy, Card & Board Game','TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','A mahjong game with an RPG element. Players move around a map beating monsters at mahjong.\n\nMahjong Haouden: Kaiser\'s Quest (\"Mahjong Overlord: Kaiser\'s Quest\") is a mahjong game released exclusively for the PC Engine. The game features a handful of RPG heroes as they set out to remove the various monsters and villains that have taken over their kingdom. To defeat these monsters, the player must beat them in mahjong games. The player has three characters they can choose between initially, and more become available later.\n\nThe mahjong side of the game offers a standard one-vs-one mode. The player has to win a few games to obtain 100% of the points available, and more points can be earned depending on how the player won.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xij.jpg'),(6581,'Super Grid Run','2013-02-12','Puzzle','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Super Grid Run is a fast-paced simple to pick-up but hard to put-down multi-platform retro action game where you must avoid everything coming at you for as long as you can whilst the speed relentlessly increases testing your twitch-gaming skills to the limit! \n \nFeatures \n3 Difficulty Levels from Easy to Insane! \nGlobal Cross-platform High Scores \nAmazing Chiptune Music \nfrom the talented Garry Lee! \nNew Future Game Modes Coming Soon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xdd.jpg'),(6582,'The Mummy: Demastered','2017-10-24','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"A powerful ancient evil has arisen, and the war to save humanity has begun! The Mummy Demastered throws you into a 16-bit-inspired battle against the undead in a 2D, nonlinear, action-packed adventure. As an elite agent in the monster-hunting Prodigium organization, you must use a variety of weapons, upgrades, and mysterious artifacts to defend mankind against the supernatural hordes of Princess Ahmanet. Your Prodigium unit is already on the scene, but HQ lost contact with them hours ago. Only by exploring tombs, forests, abandoned tunnels, and the cursed streets of London will you discover the fate of your allies. But beware - Ahmanet commands legions of undead, insects, plague-ridden vermin, and worse! If you\'re not careful, you\'ll be the next soul in her army.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23do.jpg'),(6583,'Thumpies','2010-02-17','Music, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Thumpies is a unique rhythm-based music game for players of all ages! The best way to describe Thumpies is a rhythm game crossed with juggling. Press number keys on your keyboard to match the beat of bouncing Thumpies, creating layers of a song. Tap the targets in time to make your Thump-o-Meter rise, but miss or tap out of time and the meter falls. Unlike typical rhythm based games, Thumpies has you bouncing in time instead of just following a series of notes. Unlock more Thumpies characters by collecting butterflies, but be warned--hungry Thumpies might just eat them up! Thumpies features quirky characters and a unique musical score from award-winning composer David Kerr.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vhr.jpg'),(6584,'Bubbelsche Deluxe','2024-11-15','Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','In Bubbelsche Deluxe you must navigate a small bubble through a long, complicated maze without colliding on the game blocks. Manage the bubble as fast and wide as possible without bursting.\nYou have exactly one attempt per game to make it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91f5.jpg'),(6585,'Nostradamus: The Last Prophecy','2014-03-04','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','tA historical fiction based on the life and works of Nostradamus. This first-person, point-and-click adventure will defy logic.\n\nThe art of cross-dressing. Madeleine must confront the prejudice of a “man’s world”. Her father’s mastery of cosmetics allows her to take on the identity her younger brother, Caesar. Toggle between identities to uncover the truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jjb.jpg'),(6586,'Me & My Katamari','2005-12-22','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation Portable','The King of All Cosmos and the Royal Family decide to take some time off from their celestial construction and travel to Earth for a well-earned (for the Prince at least) tropical summer vacation on their own sunny island. Unfortunately, the King\'s over-exuberance creates a tsunami that strikes and devastates nearby Paradise Commonwealth Island. One of the residents, a turtle, washes ashore next to the Royal Family and tells them his tale. The King then decides to make new islands for the animals of the Commonwealth with several katamari. Similar to the previous Katamari titles, the King sends the Prince to the Sunflower Continent, which is full of the paraphernalia used to create new landmasses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hix.jpg'),(6587,'Slime 3k: Demake','2024-10-16','Adventure, Arcade','Web browser','A blob of goo, initially used to nourish artificial humans, has become sentient and risen up against its creator—the Despot, an evil AI and the unfortunate ruler of the world in the year 3000! The future is bleak, and humanity is beyond redemption, but at least you have the power to save yourself. This demake is a mini-version of the game Slime 3K: Rise Against Despot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92dv.jpg'),(6588,'W. L. O. Sekai Renai Kikou','2009-03-26','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Much of the gameplay requires little interaction from the player as the majority of the time is spent reading the text that appears on the game\'s screen. The text being displayed represents the thoughts of the characters or the dialogue between them. The player is occasionally presented with choices to determine the direction of the game. Depending on what is chosen, the plot may progress in a specific direction. The PC version contains scenes of the protagonist having sex with the heroines, but these were removed for the console version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ryycehjwlckdoqtfytw2.jpg'),(6589,'Plots!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6590,'Aveyond 3-4: The Darkthrop Prophecy','2015-02-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this final installment of the Orbs of Magic series, Te\'ijal, Galahad, Edward, Stella, and Mel come together to stop the Darkthrop Prophecy from occurring. Will they succeed?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bgd.jpg'),(6591,'Booby Boys','1987-08-10','Adventure','Game Boy','Booby Kids is an action video game for the Nintendo Family Computer. This video game is the home conversion of Nichibutsu\'s arcade game, Kid no Hore Hore Daisakusen (キッドのホレホレ大作戦), that was originally supposed to be named Booby Kids.\n\nIn 1993, Nichibutsu released for the Game Boy a similar game entitled Booby Boys.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ml0.jpg'),(6592,'Keep Looking','2024-11-06','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a nerve-wracking horror game that puts you in a dark, claustrophobic cave with a relentless creature. Survive by flashing your dying flashlight at the right moments—too soon or too late, and it’s over. You must keep an eye on the creature, but beware: staring too long is just as deadly.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90pk.jpg'),(6593,'Child of Light','2014-08-01','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360, Xbox One','The Black Queen has stolen the Sun, the Moon and the Stars. You play as Aurora, a young princess with a pure heart whose soul is brought to the kingdom of Lemuria. Embark on a quest to recapture the three sources of light, defeat the Black Queen and restore the kingdom of Lemuria.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21q2.jpg'),(6594,'Cave Story 3D','2011-11-08','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Having received tremendous acclaim in its previous releases on PC and WiiWare, Cave Story, an indie side scrolling 2D action game, now makes its way into an all new dimension with Cave Story 3D for Nintendo 3DS. At once both a throwback to classic 2D action platformers and also the potential future of the genre, Cave Story 3D blends tight controls, superb level design, and excellent story and presentation to deliver a memorable, addicting retro experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dhp.jpg'),(6595,'Qiyb2','2025-04-22','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Qiyb2 is a mathematics -themed 2D score-attack auto-platformer with many different random-generated cubes, hand-crafted backgrounds and experimental soundtracks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pzf.jpg'),(6596,'Rip & Tear','2025-04-22','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rip &Tear is a brutal top-down 2D arcade shooter where your shotgun is your only lifeline. Face endless waves of demons, cultists, and biomechanical horrors in a blood-soaked battle for survival. No gimmicks—just pure, relentless carnage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pz9.jpg'),(6597,'Four Seasons - A fan-created Avatar Game',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','\"Four Seasons - A fan-created Avatar Game\" is a 3rd Person Action Adventure set in the universe and time of the animated Series \"Avatar - The Last Airbender\".  \n  \nExplore iconic Locations of the Avatar Universe with Aang and Momo as the main-playable Characters, while exploring the 3D Worldmap with Appa.  \nRelive Aang\'s Storyarc with an original Soundtrack inspired by the animated Series. \n \nAvatar and related marks are owned by Viacom International Inc. This fan-created game is not endorsed by, sponsored by, or affiliated with Viacom/Nickelodeon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tny.jpg'),(6598,'Rock \'N\' Roll Defense','2016-08-10','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rocked by an explosive soundtrack, choose your band, place your equipments and defend the Rock \'N\' Roll from everyone and everything who try to pull it down, on a totally hardcore tower defense!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ymz.jpg'),(6599,'Hakuoki Zuisouroku Portable','2010-08-26','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','A port for PSP.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5g84.jpg'),(6600,'LEGO Marvel\'s Avengers: The Avengers Explorer Character Pack','2016-01-29','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','This pack for LEGO Marvel\'s Avengers includes 3 new characters: Space Iron Man, Scuba Iron Man, and Iron Skull.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co834l.jpg'),(6601,'Kodama',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','What kind of tree is this? A Kodama tree?! Here\'s a game of voice changing and creature collecting! You\'ve found a rare Bonsai, where cute and mysterious voice spirits called \"Kodama\" come to play! These spirits love to play tag and hide & seek!\nOnce you find one hiding around your Bonsai, it\'s time to play tag!\nIf you can catch it before it escapes, it\'ll become your friend!\nTalk to one of the Kodama you\'ve befriended, and it\'ll echo your words back to you!\nThey echo your words in many ways, such as high-pitched, with added bleeps, backwards, or fast-forwarded! Each Kodama has a different echo, so make friends with them all and see what you can find!\nPlus, if you make friends with enough Kodama, you can get a rare wallpaper showing a glimpse of how they live!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6602,'Neon Drive','2016-05-12','Music, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Neon Drive is a slick retro-futuristic, \'80s inspired rhythm arcade game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1q72.jpg'),(6603,'Chaos Party','2020-10-16','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Legacy Mobile Device, Nintendo Switch','Chaos Party is a fast-paced, friendship destroying party shooter set in a 2D universe.\n\nEach game provides a new opportunity to try synergies with over a hundred weapons.\nShould your overlord get lasered, missiled, or tossed into a black hole.\nYou still might have eight rounds to return the favour.\nChaos Party can be played solo or with up to 3 more players for even more clutch moments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i1z.jpg'),(6604,'Genshin Impact: Hidden Dreams in the Depths','2022-05-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Version 2.7 of Genshin Impact, which included:\n• New characters: Yelan and Kuki Shinobu\n• New main story quest: Interlude Chapter, Act II - \"Perilous Trail\"\n• New story quests for Yelan\n• New hangout events for Kuki Shinobu\n• New main event: Perilous Trail\n• …and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rxr.jpg'),(6605,'LEGO Ninjago: Spinjitzu Scavenger Hunt',NULL,'Fighting, Arcade','iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4coc.jpg'),(6606,'Trip Time Collection',NULL,'Racing, Simulator','Sin plataforma','Visit famous tourist destinations with our games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ahu.jpg'),(6607,'Death end re;Quest 2 - Ultimate Weapon Set',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qm7.jpg'),(6608,'Maybe: Interactive Stories - Princess Irene','2019-05-29','Indie, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Princess Irene is based off of the novel of the same name. Covering the events of the original novel, you control and play as Princess Irene Victoria Sor, eldest daughter of Ermond, the King of Sor, as well as a tomboy who is forcibly sent to the neighbouring country in order to become Princess Consort and clear the gambling debt her father\'s accumulated over the years. There, she meets and befriends other princesses, as well as the 1st prince himself and his confidantes. However, not all is as it seems, and those who wish to bring chaos to the land soon play their hand. Can Irene defeat the competition and take the place of Queen whilst its foundation crumbles?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5shf.jpg'),(6609,'War Lands',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6610,'Gas Station Simulator: Drive & Pumping',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to \'Gas Station Simulator: Drive & Pumping\'! Restore a forgotten gas station, grow your business, fuel cars, and open a convenience store. Become the gas station tycoon and pave your way to prosperity in this thrilling adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7g77.jpg'),(6611,'Warhammer 40,000: Mechanicus - Omnissiah Edition',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cde.jpg'),(6612,'Solfege','2009-07-25','Music, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable','Kagura is a high school student who returns to her old school after three years abroad. There, she wants to meet again her sempai Sukune, who she admired since she was little. But she has also more friends: the active Chiho and the serene Kotomi. But it seems Sukune has forgotten her! What\'s happening...?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67qz.jpg'),(6613,'2 in 1: Trash Punk & Knights and Guns','2024-11-29','Shooter, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Rock the apocalypse in punk style!\nKnight in shining armor, fight your way... with Guns!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9429.jpg'),(6614,'Urban Heat',NULL,'Shooter, Tactical, Indie','Android','Crew up and conquer the war for power on the streets in Urban Heat! Immerse yourself in the gritty, action-packed urban warzone of this epic multiplayer first-person shooter (FPS) game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x49.jpg'),(6615,'Romestead',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rome has fallen! Rebuild civilization in this action-adventure survival game for 1-8 players. Fight, build towns and earn favor with the Roman gods! ...or just farm your crops.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k16.jpg'),(6616,'NASCAR Racing 2002 Season','2002-02-14','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The racing game NASCAR Racing 2002 Season or NR2002 for short, was the successor to the immensely popular NASCAR Racing 4 and the immediate precursor to the even more popular NASCAR Racing 2003 Season. This sim provided much more accurate car models and a vastly improved physics engine. The box on the game prominently featured new NASCAR star Kevin Harvick in the Goodwrench #29 car, a driver missing from NASCAR 4 as the game was released very shortly before the death of Dale Earnhardt. Also featured on the cover; Terry Labonte in the Kellogg\'s #5 car, Dale Jarrett in the UPS #88 car, (in the background) Jeff Burton in the Citgo #99 car, Ward Burton in the Caterpillar Inc. #22 car and Ken Schrader in the M&M\'s #36 car.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/almfqicfeg5c2opwjx8w.jpg'),(6617,'Tropicalia','2020-09-06','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Tropicalia is an RPG about Brazilian mythology, set in the country before colonization where you play Kaique, a little Guarani warrior, who had his girlfriend kidnapped by the demigod Tau. Gather materials to craft new items. Have fun grinding at quick battles. Test your strategies against challenging bosses. Fish, swim, dive, jump, embroil.\nHere you will not meet Dragons and Dwarves. But get ready to face Kurupiras and Boetatas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n7a.jpg'),(6618,'Syndicate','1995-06-09','Strategy, Tactical','3DO Interactive Multiplayer','The 3DO port controls the game through a controller instead of mouse. The game also has different colors on the HUD and the mini-map, the menus before missions have different button highlights due to the controller, as well as having overall different sound generation for music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53mn.jpg'),(6619,'Syberia Trilogy','2019-12-02','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Experience the complete adventures of Kate Walker in this complete box including Syberia 1, 2 and 3.\n\nSyberia 1\n\nIn Syberia, join Kate Walker on an extraordinary journey that takes her all the way from Western Europe to the far reaches of Eastern Russia. You will come across a host of endearing characters and incredible locations as you search for tracesof Hans Voralberg, the genius inventor of the automatons. It is a search that will take you to the legendary island of Syberia, in the far North of the continent, where the last living mammoths reside, hidden from modern eyes...\n\nSyberia 2\n\nContinue the adventure in Syberia 2! After roaming Europe from West to East in search of Hans, Kate Walker sets out on another long journey, this time across the Great North. She will soon be faced with the dangers of the wild, religious fanaticism, and poachers seeking to lay their hands on the precious ivory of the Mammoths… What will become of Kate Walker and her friends? Find out wherever you happen to be!\n\nSyberia 3\n\nThe limitless imagination of Benoit Sokal continues in Syberia 3, focusing on an entirely new adventure. After abandoning the island, Kate is found dying on the edge of a river by the Youkole tribe, a nomadic people migrating with their snow ostriches. Stuck in Valsembor village, together they must find a way to continue their journey in a race against their enemies and unexpected obstacles, not to mention Kate\\\'s past, which catches up with her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78y9.jpg'),(6620,'Copy Editor',NULL,'Puzzle, Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Copy Editor is a RegEx tutor within a puzzle game. Regular Expressions are used in computer science and language theory. RegEx patterns direct search operations and manage text. Novices and experienced programmers will enjoy the challenge of creating progressively more complex strings.\n\nIn Copy Editor, review famous works and make changes to the text building on new Regular Expressions with each level. Use characters, scripts, and sequences to align your “Input” with the “Objective.” Begin the game with a few expressions and gather skills in combining operations.\n\nA fake Chat Box provides hints along the way. The Chat gives you additional options to select your level, find RegExp tips, and access Help if you are completely baffled. Copy Editor includes RegEx Help, linked to the open source “regular expressions 101” in GitHub.\n\nWhether you are new to using Regular Expressions or want to test your proficiency, Copy Editor promises a fun and challenging puzzle experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oss.jpg'),(6621,'Prison Escape Simulator: Breakout Master','2024-12-26','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Outsmart, escape, survive: break free or be caught.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lg9.jpg'),(6622,'Caring Critter Bundle',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Loddlenaut is an ocean cleanup adventure set on a vibrant alien planet. Play as an interstellar custodian who is tasked with cleaning up the pollution left behind by a spacefaring mega-corporation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9akk.jpg'),(6623,'Rhythm Tengoku','2007-09-20','Music','Arcade','Rhythm Tengoku was ported to the Sega NAOMI Arcade system, with higher-quality graphics and an exclusive new set of minigames.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50l4.jpg'),(6624,'Cad Cam Warrior','1984-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX','Shooter','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8o5m.jpg'),(6625,'Ghostbusters: The Video Game Remastered','2020-11-17','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hunt, fight and trap a variety of new and familiar ghouls and phantasms, all remastered in HD resolution. Ghostbusters: The Video Game Remastered equips you with cool gadgets and upgradeable weapons to play with in huge boss fights and destructible environments. Scan and analyze targets with the P.K.E. Meter and Paragoggles, then strap on your Proton Pack to wear ghosts down with the blast stream before wrangling them with the capture stream.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1o1f.jpg'),(6626,'Witches\' Legacy: Slumbering Darkness',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6627,'W.A.R.P.',NULL,'Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','3 Game Modes.\nPerfect for quick games at all times.\nMore than 140 stages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65hn.jpg'),(6628,'Magic Pen Color Book','2022-01-29','Point-and-click','Nintendo Switch','This coloring book game will let your kid(s) draw by finger touch anything from their imagination or color, decorate the ready to use templates included, in order to create their own unique paintings. Many painting tools are available to help them, including pencils, markers, color bucket, stickers, magic pen, color spray, patterns, with undo/redo capabilities. Once kids are done with their creations, those are automatically saved into device memory with the possibility to be later erased to start over and over...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ehk.jpg'),(6629,'School Bus Fun','2014-06-04','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','School Bus Fun features a heart-warming story about a mother taking her daughter and her friends to school who takes this up as a profession investing in new cars and equipment. The game offers a variety of unique maps, vehicles, upgrades, characters, cutscenes, trophies and much more. Meet and transport all the kids with their different personalities and preferences! Learn to cope with varying demands and aim for the perfect scores and all gold trophies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40ut.jpg'),(6630,'Character Sheets, Please','2022-07-17','Puzzle','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A silly parody of \"Papers, Please\", where you\'re playing as a Game Master and have to review your players\' character sheets. Confront the rulebook (with increasing number of rules) with information on the sheet and try to spot any mistkaes... mistakes... oops.\n\nHow to play: Check your rulebook (on the left) with character sheet (on the right) and spot any inconsistencies. Click on an incorrect element and reject the character sheet or approve it if everything seems to be in order.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6631,'Chester One','2017-02-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Now with over 200 Achievements! Chester returns in Chester One: a remaster of the 2011 Style Switching Platformer. Unlock powerful new art styles and use them to your advantage as you battle through 40 levels unlocking new Chesters, finding secrets, and reclaiming your cupcakes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ai5.jpg'),(6632,'Squishy the Suicidal Pig','2014-10-23','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Squishy the Suicidal Pig has made a deal with the devil and will do anything to reach his parents in heaven. This is a hard-going platformer with various puzzle elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ipe.jpg'),(6633,'Gleamlight','2020-08-20','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Gleamlight – a 2D action game that will take you through an adventure traversing a beautiful, transient world.\n\nImmerse yourself amid the beautiful stained glass artistry as you navigate without the reliance of any standard game UI, while tracing the world’s mysterious unspoken story. What will you, as Gleam, sense and feel through your travels across this beautiful, yet fearsome world of glass?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xml.jpg'),(6634,'Cubic Figures','2022-09-21','Puzzle, Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Cubic Figures is a minimalistic puzzle game where you need to make up different figures from a number of given shaped blocks. Take the block, rotate if needed and put it into the outlined figure to fill it. Repeat until all the blocks will be revealed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7grx.jpg'),(6635,'Bipt','2025-01-21','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BIPT is a single player time attack game with multiple endings. Figure out what to collect, and go for the best time! Bipt can slide, super jump, and teleport. Combine these tools and find the fastest path to the finish.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m9n.jpg'),(6636,'Blackbox','2024-02-02','Puzzle','visionOS','What if a game was nothing more than a peaceful place where curiosity was rewarded?\n\nBlackbox, the evolution of the Apple Design Award winning puzzle game for iOS, leaps beyond your fingertips, through the confines of glass, and into your home and being. Poke bubbles, ponder puzzles, and let the rest gently unfold around you. Become enveloped in reactive visuals, perplexing sounds, and perhaps find something profound.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a58.jpg'),(6637,'Stunt Wheels Party!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6638,'Liar Trick: Psychological Crime Mystery','2020-07-31','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Are all your expressions \"real\"? The content of a person\'s words can be both truthful or false. In this new psychological crime mystery game you will unveil \"lies\" through emotions! You can play Visual Novel Stories, Facial Expression Analysis Mode, Liar mode, and Deduction Mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46lz.jpg'),(6639,'Far Cry 3: Blood Dragon','2013-05-01','Shooter, Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The year is 2007. It is the future.\n\nYou are Sergeant Rex Colt: Mark IV Cyber Commando. The year is 2007 and Earth has been ravaged by a nuclear war which erupted in the 90s. The east vs. west conflict has raged for generations, and humanity continues to struggle to progress after a disastrous decade. New paths for peace must be found, and the US cyborg army may have found a solution: a powerful bioweapon on a distant island. Your mission is to gather information and figure out what the hell is going on.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vpp.jpg'),(6640,'Merge Hamster','2024-09-18','Sin género','Android, iOS','Squeeeak!!! The hamsters are angry!!\n\nAn evil force has suddenly appeared in the once peaceful forest of the hamsters, disturbing their tranquility.\nTheir peaceful days of eating and sleeping have been shattered, and they can no longer tolerate it!\nDon’t underestimate them because of their small size! It’s time to show what the hamsters can do!\n\nMerge Hamster is an idle merge game. Recruit hamsters, merge and upgrade various weapons, and protect the forest!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6641,'Descending The Woods','2024-07-13','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','By day, tend to your farm, care for your pets, and explore the mysteries of the haunted woods. By nightfall, They will come from the woods, Beware of ghosts and demons of the haunted woods. Hide, Survive, Build, Fight and Explore in this eerie Survival Horror alone or with friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88l9.jpg'),(6642,'Pokémon Velvet','2024-10-22','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Color','A Rom Hack of Pokemon Yellow with new Pokemon and quality of life features','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxb.jpg'),(6643,'Party Panic','2016-07-28','Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Party Panic is a crazy online and local-multiplayer party game. Compete against your friends in 15+ rapid fire minigames, or race through the brutal Gauntlet. There is even a built in drinking game! You\'ll laugh, you\'ll cry, it\'s stupid.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gl6.jpg'),(6644,'BallisticNG: Maceno Island','2022-12-14','Racing, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome to Maceno Island, a man made paradise home to high rise sea fronts, massive jungles, precarious mountain thrills and an AGL newcomer with a rich history in sea bed mineral mining and designer sandals.\n\nMaceno Island introduces 6 new tracks, all playable in forward and reverse, a new campaign and a new set of colorful liveries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68yf.jpg'),(6645,'King Lucas','2016-12-01','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','After an affair King Lucas had with the Witch of Sausan, the Queen left him and remarried in an adjacent kingdom, and now his daughters are the only ones left at his side. Due to his love for them, each and every time they get lost in the castle, he moves heaven and earth to get them back and he only resorts to the most intrepid knights in order to find them. Will you be one of those knights? \n \nPlay for the favour of King Lucas and the three princesses’ love. A castle will be randomly built and you must find them inside a little area of it. You can move horizontally and vertically through the rooms until you reach your goal. Once you succeed, the castle will become a little bit more difficult: a larger area will be unlocked… and the experience will become more hardcore when the princess becomes lost inside a fully unlocked castle with more than 1,000 rooms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zud.jpg'),(6646,'Mark-I: Mission Pilot',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Arcade top-down shooter with coop for 2 players. Play as Pilot of 「MARK-I」 – new prototype of intelligent combat unit. Complete short intense action mission by shooting enemies, avoiding threats and upgrading shell with different battle configurations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3np4.jpg'),(6647,'Galak-Z: The Dimensional','2015-10-29','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Galak-Z is a modern, A.I. and physics-driven open-world action game, viewed through the lens of the classic 16-bit space shooter. It’s 2D combat taken to the next level. Players will take control of a variety of classic spacecraft inspired by anime of the late 70’s and early 80’s, piloted by a cast of characters every bit as colorful as the rainbow-hued explosions erupting all around them. Newtonian physics take center stage as players experience finely-tuned control, blasting enemies, unleashing missile salvos, and tossing enemies into explosive obstacles.\n\nThe bar is raised for intense deep-space dogfighting with dynamic and life-like enemies, powered by the next generation Cyntient AI platform, developed by Cyntient Inc. Players will be forced to outmaneuver, outgun and outsmart enemies that think, react and cooperate like seasoned pilots. Both stealth and skill are required to defeat enemy squads in a brutal game of cat and mouse. Prepare for an enemy that comes alive like never before.\"\n\nThe game was later re-branded as Galak-Z: The Void with the released of a free DLC update for the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gjo.jpg'),(6648,'Mortal Kombat 1: Khameleon Kameo','2024-01-16','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Announced for the Mortal Kombat 1: Kombat Pack, Khameleon is returning as a Kameo Fighter and was previously playable in Mortal Kombat: Armageddon as an exclusive character for the Nintendo Wii version.\n\nShe was introduced to the series in the Nintendo 64 version of Mortal Kombat Trilogy as a secret character with the abilities of all female ninja characters in the game. A male version called Chameleon was officially introduced on the other platform versions of the game with most of the abilities of all male ninja characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co849u.jpg'),(6649,'Pokémon Steam','2020-01-16','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A French fan-made Pokémon game in which you embody the son/daughter of the Champion and try to be one in your turn in an all-new region named Exodius.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5stm.jpg'),(6650,'Retro First Friday Collection #2',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3con.jpg'),(6651,'A Cyberpunk\'s Dream of 2077','2020-11-19','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Passed out after a night of New Year’s Eve partying, you are awoken from your drunken stupor by a RetailBot.\n\nThis robot informs you that it had a dream, and would like your help in determining its meaning.\n\nYou are free to help or hinder this robot.\n\nJust remember: words and actions can have consequences…\n\nA (very short) cyberpunk visual novel\nDialogue system inspired by RPG classics\nFour distinct endings based off your choices throughout the game\nPixel graphics!\nFeaturing photography from Unsplash.com and music by Alexander Nakarada','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6652,'Eat\'em All : Bite the Fruit!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6653,'Tommyknockers','2018-03-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have one job: Protect the gold and stay alive all night! Can you last the night against the onslaught of the cunning and creepy Tommyknockers? They come for you!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6654,'Macross Trial Frontier','2010-10-07','Sin género','PlayStation 3','This PS3 release is part of the Macross Frontier The Movie: The False Songstress Hybrid Pack.\n\nThis hybrid disc release of the first Macross F movie also includes a special presentation of a then in-development Macross game, under the title of Macross Trial Frontier. The game takes place over five aerial stages where the goal is to survive for five minutes (stage 4) or defeat all enemies (all other stages). In normal mode stages unlock sequentially, and each stage has a set vehicle and co-pilot. Upon completing normal mode hard mode stages are unlocked, which have hardier and more aggressive enemies as well as the ability to use all vehicles, pilots, optional gear, and co-pilots in the game. The player can also toggle flight controls between Normal, where the Valkyrie jet mode moves similarly to its bipedal modes, or Real, where the jet can bank and spin like an actual aircraft. In combat Valkyries and the Large Varja units can shift between their different forms by tapping a direction on the right stick. The Queadluun-Rhea does not have alternate forms, but can still change between high speed and maneuverability modes. Units will have a primary weapon (typically a rifle), and a secondary weapon (typically missiles), a melee attack, and speed boost. Weapons have unlimited ammunition, but limited magazines, and must be reloaded when depleted. All units can dash in a direction to break missile locks by double tapping, and shoot down missiles automatically with the missile defense move as long as they have remaining Anti gauge. A Special bar is replenished by gaining sequential hits on targets, and can be expended to increase boost, turn melee into a charging tackle, unleash the vehicle\'s unique ultimate attack, or activate the co-pilot\'s special ability. Upon finishing the stage the player is graded on the number of enemies shot down, as well as time and health remaining.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co754b.jpg'),(6655,'Microsoft Flight Simulator X: Steam Edition - Paris Orly (LFPO)','2015-10-29','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Microsoft Flight Simulator X: Steam Edition\'s incarnation of this fabulous airport has been modeled down to the smallest of details including all buildings and airport institutions. All features of this airport, including the docking systems, are fully accurate and up to date, and both static and dynamic objects are included which enhance the realism of this Parisian hub. Paris Orly is best experienced with your favorite airliner or business jet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85jt.jpg'),(6656,'Chernobylite: Complete Edition','2024-12-13','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Chernobylite is a non-linerar, science-fiction survival horror RPG. Explore the Chernobyl Exclusion Zone and uncover the truth of your tortured past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n7h.jpg'),(6657,'Eclectic Shell','2024-04-12','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Beginnermediate shells hope it is enjoyable!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9apf.jpg'),(6658,'Shellax','2021-05-01','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','This hack is focused mainly on shell tricks but still a ton of platforming throughout each level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9arp.jpg'),(6659,'R.O.O.T.','2023-06-07','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This story is about a corporation named RavenTech, set in the near future. R.O.O.T.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7iam.jpg'),(6660,'Might & Magic: Clash of Heroes','2011-04-13','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox 360, Nintendo DS','Scattered across five different regions, five special heroes must travel their own dangerous paths to grow in strength, unravel a demonic plot & ultimately save the world from chaos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bhl.jpg'),(6661,'SF-HiSplitter','1979-02-01','Shooter, Puzzle, Arcade','Arcade','A special version of Space Fever called SF-Hisplitter was released the same year and features aliens that are double the width of the standard variety, which can either be destroyed completely or split into two smaller aliens depending on where they are shot. This version is in color, and the shelter blocks are visually distinct from the monochrome version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x36.jpg'),(6662,'Giant Bundle',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k0b.jpg'),(6663,'Sucker Punch','2016-01-27','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sucker Punch features 9 small single-player maps for Doom II, tested in PrBoom+, ZDoom, GZDoom and Doom Retro. The WAD is made up from three mini-episodes of three maps each which escalate from easy (with green details) to harder (yellow) to hardest (red). The maps should take no longer than two or three minutes each to play and are designed for pistol starts. Difficulty settings are implemented.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6soj.jpg'),(6664,'Ancient Wars: Sparta Definitive Edition','2022-01-28','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','One of the most innovative Real-Time Strategy Games comes back totally renewed and improved to the smallest detail, with epic large scale battles, new civilizations, unit customization system never seen before in a game, 8K support, and a lot of more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57uy.jpg'),(6665,'TrackMaster: Free For All Motorsport',NULL,'Racing, Sport','Sin plataforma','TrackMaster is an all-terrain, all-vehicles, physics based sandbox and racing game: play whatever way you want, in any kind of track and event, with any vehicle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44uc.jpg'),(6666,'Storm Tale 2','2022-01-21','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Join Griffri, the wizard, on a quest to not only rebuild his village, but to put an end to the treacherous reign of evil that threatens the realm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co424y.jpg'),(6667,'Rise Eterna Bundle','2024-08-22','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','This bundle contains Rise Eterna & Rise Eterna War','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8q2s.jpg'),(6668,'Bakken: Ski Jumping 2025','2025-02-26','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bakken 25 is a winter sports simulation game. Become a ski jumper and master every aspect of the discipline from the inrun to the outrun: the jumping, the flying and the landing! Are you ready for a new season?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gco.jpg'),(6669,'Beacon of Neyda',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a world where a robot revolution failed, the last humans search for a way to survive and escape. Beacon of Neyda is a side-scroller strategy game where you have to survive waves of enemies while creating and upgrading your base. Build where you want - Defend what you can.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dei.jpg'),(6670,'ColdSide','2020-11-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ColdSide is a psychological horror first-person game. It takes place in an abandoned underground laboratory that studied anomalous phenomena.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2les.jpg'),(6671,'Final Fantasy Type-0 HD','2015-03-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Originally released in Japan in 2011 for the PlayStationPortable handheld entertainment system, FINAL FANTASY TYPE-0 will be coming to the West as an HD remaster for the PlayStation4 computer entertainment system and Xbox One, the all-in-one games and entertainment system from Microsoft..\n\n“The voice of our Western fans was instrumental in the development of FINAL FANTASY TYPE-0, and we’re very excited to release this title soon,” said Hajime Tabata, director of FINAL FANTASY TYPE-0. “The new PlayStation4 system and Xbox One platforms have really helped to re-envision this dynamic and turbulent world of Orience.”','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9er5.jpg'),(6672,'Arcane Chaos','2024-11-16','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Arcane Chaos, built with Unreal Engine 5, a fantasy adventure that combines top-down 3D shooting and role-playing! Transform into a cute robot hero, defeat unique enemies, unlock a variety of guns and skill combinations, with light skill construction and roguelike elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91no.jpg'),(6673,'Atomic Girl',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s an isometric RPG / 2D point-n-click adventure game, called \"Atomic Girl\". When technology meets stupidity, the most paradoxical things can become reality. Our hero just got into such situation, when he came to a secret institute where his mother works. Strange mechanism... bright glow... some hardcore erotic procedures... and now he\'s a girl with a fantastic body. But maybe it\'s not so bad, let us take this opportunity to get even closer with the family, find new friends and take part in exciting wet adventures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vg3vggp4hgryliui8lbh.jpg'),(6674,'Microsoft Flight Simulator: Dune','2024-02-13','Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows)','In partnership with Legendary and Warner Bros. Entertainment, Microsoft Flight Simulator has created an authentically detailed House Atreides Ornithopter. Master the complex controls of one of the most dynamic aircraft ever conceived as you pilot your ornithopter through awe-inspiring locations across the mysterious desert planet of Arrakis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m11.jpg'),(6675,'Renfield: Bring Your Own Blood','2023-04-12','Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slash and survive a typical workday as Dracula\'s overworked and underappreciated servant! You\'ll have a bloody good time as you rampage through New Orleans to find fresh victims for your narcissistic boss.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ds0.jpg'),(6676,'Baunsudaun','2020-06-09','Platform, Arcade','Game Boy','See how long you can survive in Baunsudaun and compete for your personal best score.\n\nIn Baunsudaun you control \'Blob\' by moving him left or right. There are 7 different types of platforms that will spawn all with different effects. Your goal is to avoid the spikes on the ceiling, and avoid touching the fire at the bottom by trying to use the platforms to keep Blob alive as long as possible. While all this is going on, the lines will continually move faster making it more difficult the higher your score gets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6t11.jpg'),(6677,'Mario Sports Mix','2011-02-04','Sport','Wii, Wii U','The games include volleyball, hockey (both field and ice), dodgeball, and basketball in the vein of the two companies\' earlier collaboration, Mario Hoops 3 on 3. There are power-up items which give advantages to the team that attains them. Each game has an Exhibition mode, in which up to four human players compete in individual matches, and Tournament mode, where up to three players play matches in a tournament structure, with modes of difficulty named Mushroom, Flower and Star.\n\nMario Sports Mix also includes several party games based on the mechanics of each sport. Smash Skate is based on Hockey, Bob-omb Dodge is based on Dodgeball, Feed Petey is based on Basketball, and Harmony Hustle is based on Volleyball.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co223k.jpg'),(6678,'Extremely Powerful Capybaras','2023-12-05','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become the bullet hell with your friends in this chaotic survival roguelite game for 1-4 players. Collect items that unlock weapons and skills, face hordes of enemies and become the mightiest capybaras of all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70lv.jpg'),(6679,'Clockwork Sword','2025-03-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slash, stab, and shoot your way through a multi-tiered museum filled with corrupted automata, customizing your weapon with the scraps of the fallen. Clockwork Sword is a thrilling isometric hack and slash, in which you utilize combinations of weapons and elements to conquer your foes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r9r.jpg'),(6680,'The Two Thinkers','2025-04-16','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A challenging puzzle and platformer game for 2 players. Play with a friend, combine your skills, think logically, and overcome obstacles together to reach the exit and complete each level. Only by working as a team will you be able to overcome every challenge and progress!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l7a.jpg'),(6681,'Birdo\'s Holiday Brawl','2023-12-07','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take control of Birdo to rescue her friends from Wart and the Eight Bits before the Subcon Holidays!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hid.jpg'),(6682,'SturmFront: The Mutant War - Übel Edition','2017-08-11','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Wii U, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Arcade action game in the vein of Commando, Ikari Warriors and Shock Troopers, mixed with bullet hell elements. You play as an experimental cyborg battle unit fighting against unrelenting mutant hordes to a soundtrack of aggressive heavy metal and psychedelic electronica.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v0m.jpg'),(6683,'Disney\'s The Jungle Book','1994-08-25','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','The NES port of Disney\'s The Jungle Book.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ux9.jpg'),(6684,'Heaven Will Be Mine','2018-12-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Heaven Will Be Mine is a queer science fiction mecha visual novel from the creators of queer cult horror visual novel We Know The Devil, about joyriding mecha, kissing your enemies, and fighting gravity’s pull. Follow three women piloting giant robots in the last days of an alternate 1980s space program fighting for humanity’s future—or ditching their jobs to make out with each other instead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uqp.jpg'),(6685,'Forklift Extreme: Deluxe Edition','2022-12-01','Racing, Simulator, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','An exceptional physical experience with unique visuals and super smooth, yet demanding gameplay','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vjk.jpg'),(6686,'XCOM 2: Anarchy\'s Children','2016-03-17','Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This rebellion-themed content pack introduces more than 100 new exotic customizations for the entire arsenal of armors available to your XCOM soldiers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ocr.jpg'),(6687,'Sonic Smackdown','2020-11-10','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gameplay heavily inspired by Ultimate Marvel vs Capcom 3, Sonic Smackdown brings the fast paced combos and intuitive controls to the Sonic franchise. You\'ll be able to pull off combos at blazing speeds which only Sonic and crew are capable of!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29j7.jpg'),(6688,'Firegirl: Hack \'n Splash Rescue','2021-12-14','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take on the role of a young rescue officer starting her career. Armed with a trusty axe and high-pressure fire hose that also acts like a jetpack, Firegirl responds to emergency calls across the city. Can Firegirl save all the trapped civilians caught in each blaze?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nk1.jpg'),(6689,'Dance Dash',NULL,'Music, Simulator, Sport, Indie, Arcade','Meta Quest 2, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Dance Dash is a thrilling VR rhythm game where you move your full body to the beat and become one with your avatar. Bring the arcade home and feel the music as you nail sick combos with independently tracked feet movements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73k2.jpg'),(6690,'传奇世界之仗剑天涯H5','2020-12-15','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','《传奇世界之仗剑天涯H5》荣耀版资料片燃爆来袭，不再是广告，多倍升级万倍伤害天天攻沙，流水线挂机刷怪，高画质更流畅，酷炫拽技能免费抽，极炫外观任意搭，震撼视觉狂战氛围，快来觉醒传世魂，轻狂热血续青春！','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cpz.jpg'),(6691,'The Long Dark: Tales from the Far Territory',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The first paid Expansion for the award-winning survival experience, THE LONG DARK. Explore the vast and mysterious Far Territory, deep in the heart of Great Bear. Extract its dark secrets. Navigate its treacherous Regions. And most of all: strive to survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v0n.jpg'),(6692,'Panfu','2007-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser','Panfu was a massively multiplayer online role-playing game for children between the ages of 8 and 12. Each player had their own panda avatar that they could style. This avatar could then be used to walk around the virtual world, chat with other pandas, play games, and complete quests.\n\nIt was eventually shut down in November 2016 due to financial difficulties caused by a lack of investors. However, fan-made versions of the game are still available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86b1.jpg'),(6693,'Barista Master: Café Empire','2025-02-26','Simulator','PlayStation 4','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gu4.jpg'),(6694,'Saints Row IV: Re-Elected & Gat out of Hell','2015-01-20','Sin género','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Saints Row IV: Re-Elected\nAfter saving the world from a terrorist attack the leader of the 3rd Street Saints is elected to become President of the United States. Things go reasonably well until an alien warlord named Zinyak attacks the white house and abducts his entire cabinet. Now stuck inside a reality bending simulation, the President and the Saints fight to save themselves, Earth, and the entire galaxy… if that all sounds crazy to you, trust us: we’re just getting started.\n\nSaints Row: Gat out of Hell\nIn this standalone expansion epilogue to Saints Row IV, join Johnny Gat and Kinzie Kensington on an Orphean quest to save the Boss’s soul from the bowels of Hell. Come for the demon killing, stay for the historical icons, open world shenanigans, talking gun, and full length musical number. Yes, seriously.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ch0.jpg'),(6695,'Black Otaku 2: Taekwondo is in my Blood',NULL,'Fighting, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join Sahara B. Shabazz as she honours that Korean man\'s sacrifice by winning this martial arts tournament with the Taekwondo that flows in her veins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yhi.jpg'),(6696,'The Best Most Epic Turnabout','2016-10-12','Visual Novel','Web browser','An epic of never before seen proportions... is what our protagonist \'Ren\' is yearning for. Being an undefeated prosecutor for years, he\'s seen it all.\n\nHowever, he has not yet given up. Some day, he is certain, he will find the glory he is yearning for. Maybe he\'ll even put an end to the dark age of the law that\'s looming on the horizon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ko8.jpg'),(6697,'Profundus','2025-04-19','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re a dog. You\'re stuck on a weird green-porcelain island. There are statues of familiar dogs. You\'re alone. So... you fish.\n\nCatch stuff, score points, try to beat your high score! Simple, weird, and somewhat cozy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pz0.jpg'),(6698,'Worker Riot','2022-06-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A worker who has been left without a salary is a dangerous opponent. Armed with a hammer, he will not leave them alone. Help him defeat them all. Beat out of them everything they owe you for your work','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59ru.jpg'),(6699,'Call The Abyss','2025-03-17','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','2D Survival Arcade Game packed with Action and Dark Magic. You cannot survive the relentless Forces of Good alone. Better call allies from the Abyss!! Gather Resources and Summon them from your Cauldron. Conquer the worldwide Leaderboard. Completely FREE TO PLAY!! For now...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a1z.jpg'),(6700,'R-Type Final 2: Ultimate Edition','2023-10-02','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Soar to new heights and save big with the R-Type Final 2 Ultimate Edition which includes the base game, all DLC sets, Soundtrack, Art Book, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ei7.jpg'),(6701,'Capcom Arcade Stadium: Mega Twins','2021-10-20','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Add Mega Twins to your Capcom Arcade Stadium game line-up! Fifteen years have passed since the peaceful utopia of Alurea was destroyed by monsters. The twin sons of the king have grown into strong young men.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64uj.jpg'),(6702,'Burst','2016-03-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Challenge your music!  Destroy enemies.  Avoid obstacles.  Run for your life...and points.  Go for a high score and always fight to the beat! \nOnly .ogg files are supported.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6703,'Chorus','2021-12-03','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Take control of Nara, once the Circle\'s deadliest warrior, now their most wanted fugitive, on a quest to destroy the dark cult that created her. Unlock devastating weapons and mind-bending abilities in Chorus, a true evolution of the space-combat shooter. Along with Forsaken, her sentient starfighter, explore ancient temples, engage in exhilarating zero-g combat, and venture beyond our waking reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25ie.jpg'),(6704,'Interactive Buddy','2004-05-04','Simulator, Indie','Web browser','A classic Flash game in which players can interact with a buddy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pmb.jpg'),(6705,'Doka-fli','2020-12-01','Sin género','Sega Game Gear, Sega Master System/Mark III','Game that takes place in the credits of the Game Gear Micro White, made for the Sega Master System/Sega Mark III by M2. It is a simple game where you destroy the credits of the staff that worked on the game and the GG Micro White/Aleste collection by bouncing a spaceship among them. Released on December 24, 2020 inside the Game Gear Micro White, and in extremely limited quantities for the Sega Master System.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yig.jpg'),(6706,'Oiche Mhaith','2013-06-27','Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Ouya','Oiche Mhaith is an Adventure game, developed and published by Terry Cavanagh, which was released in 2013.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nuk.jpg'),(6707,'Hex and Chill','2025-03-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A serene match-3 puzzle game designed for pure relaxation. Swap colorful hex tiles at your own pace with no timers or pressure—just soothing gameplay and tranquil music. Includes full source code for the curious. Your personal oasis of simple puzzles awaits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ltd.jpg'),(6708,'Gearshifters','2021-09-30','Shooter, Racing, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Steer, drift, spin, smash and gun through waves of enemy vehicles. Go to war against extreme machine bosses. Build up and tune your tactical loadout of car mods, defences and weaponry for each treacherous transport mission. Drive. Destroy. Get Paid. Upgrade!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gps.jpg'),(6709,'Soviet City','2016-03-31','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Soviet City is a game made up of quick game plays, where building and control is essential. We take a lot from classic city builders. The player takes the role of mayor of the city. Soviet law and economy have their own laws. Every building influences a terror bar. Be careful, because excessive terror level leads to a rebellion. On the other hand, when terror level is too low, the dictator can replace you with a more appropriate person. Limited materials and people disobedience can cause trouble with implementation of five-year plans.\n\n(From Steam)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xdcqaddgnlek72tnlzuw.jpg'),(6710,'Assassin\'s Creed: Altair\'s Chronicles','2008-02-05','Platform, Adventure','Windows Phone, iOS, Nintendo DS','As the direct prequel of the critically acclaimed console title Assassin’s Creed, discover more of the story of Altaïr as he must find “the chalice,” an object of such power that whoever is in possession of it can end the Crusades.\n\nAltair will explore a fully realized 3D world traveling through four cities of the Crusade’s Middle East. The game will feature acrobatic moves and exhilarating combo attacks that mix both sword skills and kicks.\n\nThe setting is 1190 AD. The Third Crusade is tearing the Holy Land apart. You, Altaïr, intend to stop the hostilities by suppressing both sides of the conflict.\n\n• Be an Assassin\n\nMaster the skills, tactics, and weapons of history’s deadliest and most secretive clan of warriors.\n\n• Action-platforming Gameplay\n\nFast-paced action features swordfights, combo attacks and acrobatic moves that journey through historical 3D environments\n\n• Choose Your Weapon\n\nLearn and master 11 weapons for both close combat and long-range attacks, featuring five swords, varying types of daggers, explosives and a grappling hook\n\n• Immersive Storyline\n\nA deep and compelling storyline that will appeal to those who have both played the console title or are new to the franchise\n\n• Touch-Screen Mini-games\n\nPlayers will be able to use the Stylus to perform pickpocket maneuvers to carefully steal precious items from the crowd and make informants speak\n\n• Upgrade and Rank Up\n\nCollecting orbs will upgrade Altair’s health and weapons\n\nThe game is no longer available for iOS and Android.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yvv.jpg'),(6711,'Halfquake Trilogy','2018-10-05','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Halfquake your purpose is to get killed in most ridiculous ways for the sole purpose of entertaining your spectators. You might get weapons to fight your way through, but you will never be able to escape. You\'re not here to win. You are here to die.\n\nHalfquake Trilogy combines the Half-Life modifications Halfquake (2001), Halfquake Amen (2002) and Halfquake Sunrise (2010), each part having its own distinct style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78on.jpg'),(6712,'Coffee Talk','2020-01-29','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Coffee Talk is a coffee brewing and heart-to-heart talking simulator about listening to fantasy-inspired modern peoples’ problems, and helping them by serving up a warm drink or two.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55rx.jpg'),(6713,'Dinosaur Bone Digging','2019-04-25','Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Excavate and collect ancient dinosaur bones and different hidden objects – you must clean the bones and make your own dinosaur by playing amazing dino puzzles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m1l.jpg'),(6714,'Tiger Fighter 1931: Tora!Tora! MP051',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','This is a shoot em up game. In this game the player combats a large number of enemies by shooting at them. The player controls a fighter to shoot down all the enemies fighter and all the enemy Navy Cruiser/Battleship/Aircraft Carrier to win the game. The DLC include mission pack 051.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6715,'Final Fantasy XVI: Collector\'s Edition','2023-06-22','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 5','Final Fantasy XVI is the first fully fledged action RPG in the mainline Final Fantasy series. Clive Rosfield is on a mission to free mankind from its fate, and must use the Eikonic powers at his disposal to overcome every obstacle his enemies lay before him.\n\nCollector\'s Edition in-game item\nBonus Weapon: Blood Sword\nThe fabled scarlet steel of Firion, hero of Final Fantasy II.\n\nCollector\'s Edition bonus digital contents\nDigital Mini Artbook, Digital Mini Soundtrack\nThese digital contents allows you to enjoy the world of \"FINAL FANTASY XVI\" to your heart\'s content.\n\nCollector\'s Edition bonus physical contents\nPremium Statue - Phoenix vs Ifrit\nA premium statue depicting a battle between two eikons - Phoenix and Ifrit.\nApprox. size: W230mm x D150mm x H270mm\nMaterial: PVC, ABS\n\nMetal Eikon Pin Collection\nA premium metal pin collection featuring eight eikons.\nApprox. size: W33mm x D5mm x H35mm (Ifrit)\nMaterial: Zinc Alloy, Brass\n\nSpecial Clive Rosfield SteelBook Case\nA SteelBook case featuring artwork of Clive Rosfield, the protagonist. Use the case to store the disc-based media of your choice.\nMaterial: Tin, Polypropylene\n\nCloth World Map of Valisthea\nA cloth map of Valisthea where the story unfolds.\nApprox. size: W615mm x D350mm, Thickness 0.3mm\nMaterial: 100% Cotton','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81g5.jpg'),(6716,'Jewel BEM Hunter Lime','1993-06-10','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series, Sharp X68000, FM Towns, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','A twelve episode series of short, low-interaction semi-animated episodic games by Silence. The series tell the story of Bass and Lime, two demonic creatures who assume human form and travel to Earth in order to retrieve stolen jewels from \"big-eyed monsters\" (BEMs). The anime Jewel BEM Hunter Lime is based on these games.\n\nOnce upon a month, a door behind the full moon opens. This door is between the human world and magical world. Now it just so happens that on one such night, Lime and Bass are in hot pursuit of a demon who had stolen six power gems from the magical world. The demon escapes to the human world through the open door, and the two follow. Now they must search for the six power gems, all of which have been scattered all over Tokyo. It\'s up to Lime and Bass to blend into with humans and find the gems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7187.jpg'),(6717,'Theme Hotel','2011-12-31','Simulator, Indie','Web browser','The goal is to leave customers satisfied and reach the five stars as soon as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69ew.jpg'),(6718,'Vikings Pinball','2024-08-09','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Fun pinball style battles. Attack the military camps of the holy Roman Empire and crush the legionaries. Choose the right trajectories to inflict as much damage as possible. Shoot down enemies, blow up barrels and collect coins. Free the map from these lazybones!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jvz.jpg'),(6719,'Cloudpunk: Ultimate Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k08.jpg'),(6720,'Whispered Stories: Sandman',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help the young orphan James locate his missing girlfriend, Mary, in Whispered Stories: Sandman. While searching for her, he falls under the spell of the sinister Sandman. To save his girlfriend he must find a cure against the evil spell of the Sandman. But where can he find it? Join James on his journey and help him to withstand the Sandman and save Mary in this mysterious Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yyz.jpg'),(6721,'Hope Deferred','2025-04-08','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hope Deferred is a first-person psychological horror RPG. Explore nightmare worlds and search for understanding in this PSX inspired dungeon crawler.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m2b.jpg'),(6722,'Quackdzilla: Pool Cleaning Simulator','2024-05-29','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Feel the specific atmosphere and humor of the Pool Cleaning Simulator. Take on the role of a pool boy and discover what fate awaits you in the free prologue of Pool Cleaning Simulator - Quackdzilla?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89py.jpg'),(6723,'Pizza Delivery Survivors','2025-03-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience the thrill of pizza delivery in a zombie apocalypse! \"Pizza Delivery Survivors\" combines survival, strategy, and fast-paced action. Deliver pizzas, outsmart the undead, and turn everyday items into weapons to fight for survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mlo.jpg'),(6724,'Mini Ninjas','2009-09-11','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Nintendo DS','Mini Ninjas is a game that combines furious action with stealth and exploration for an experience that appeals to a wide audience across age groups and preferences. It’s an action-adventure with a strong focus on allowing the player freedom to explore the world and has the depth to allow for very varied gameplay and approaches to getting through the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21i5.jpg'),(6725,'Dariusburst: Chronicle Saviours - Limited Edition','2017-03-30','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','DARIUSBURST Chronicle Saviours is the latest installment in Taito\'s DARIUS series of arcade-style shooting games. Blast hordes of alien sea-monsters, and blaze your own trail through branching environments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xv1.jpg'),(6726,'Agoraphobia','2021-04-26','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After arriving at college, Joyce struggles with a yet-undiagnosed panic disorder while attempting to find direction and acceptance among their peers.\n\nTheir panic disorder distorts the world around them, rendering an otherwise friendly world overwhelming and horrific.\n\nIn search of respite, they stumble across their campus\'s art studio and begins to make peace with themself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k8a.jpg'),(6727,'West Journey',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"West Journey\" is an action-adventure game brimming with mystery and challenge, transporting players into an ancient world rich with legend. Here, along the ancient west wind trail, history stretches back eons, concealing countless undiscovered secrets and treasures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mdd.jpg'),(6728,'Avalog','2023-11-17','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chess, but continuous! Avalog is a free game for playing analog chess with others, either locally or online. As well as a \'classic\' mode, there is a \'draft\' mode, where players pick pieces from 5 different factions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co775o.jpg'),(6729,'EX-802','2025-02-05','Shooter','PlayStation 4','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jl3.jpg'),(6730,'Commandos: Ammo Pack','1999-03-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Commandos: Ammo Pack is a value-bundle containing both the original Commandos: Behind Enemy Lines and the expansion pack Beyond the Call of Duty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cok.jpg'),(6731,'Hazardous Space','2018-04-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hazardous Space is a Roguelike 2d turn-based action game with RPG elements, where there is no room for friendly NPCs or safe locations. Using tactics, various kinds of weapons, and your character\'s skills, fight your way through hordes of enemies and try to get off the station.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qbc.jpg'),(6732,'A Duck Has An Adventure','2013-05-28','Adventure','Web browser','A Duck Has An Adventure is an unique hypercomic adventure game that challenges you to discover all the different possible lives one duck could live. From adventures on the high seas to the halls of academia and beyond, every choice you make builds a new pathway along which to explore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wz4.jpg'),(6733,'Rance IX: The Helmanian Revolution','2014-04-24','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rance IX: The Helmanian Revolution is the 12th game in Alicesoft\'s flagship Rance series. It takes place in Helman and revolves around Patton Misnarge\'s revolution against the Empire of Helman, drawing elements from other subplots as well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gr5.jpg'),(6734,'Tiger Fighter 1931: Tora! MP022','2021-08-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game\'s system is somewhere between air combat and naval warfare. It\'s a lot like the old game I played as a kid, and we control fighters to destroy the enemy\'s fleet. The DLC include mission pack 022.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tyc.jpg'),(6735,'Trainz Railroad Simulator 2022: CFR Modernised Doubledecker Pack No. 2','2024-03-17','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Manufactured in 1988/89 at the \"VEB Waggonbau Goerlitz\" factory in Germany, these doubledecker cars were and still are used for regional passenger transport in Romania, and many have been modernised. This pack features 6 versions of these cars with interior views, PBR textures, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91gy.jpg'),(6736,'Final Fantasy XII','2006-03-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 2','The game takes place in the fictional land of Ivalice, where the empires of Archadia and Rozarria are waging an endless war. Dalmasca, a small kingdom, is caught between the warring nations. When Dalmasca is annexed by Archadia, its princess, Ashe, creates a resistance movement. During the struggle, she meets Vaan, a young adventurer who dreams of commanding an airship. They are quickly joined by a band of allies; together, they rally against the tyranny of the Archadian Empire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rhx.jpg'),(6737,'Final Fantasy X/X-2 HD Remaster','2014-03-18','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Based on the international versions of the games that were previously only released in Japan and Europe, FINAL FANTASY X/X-2 HD Remaster brings these timeless classics forward to the current generation of fans, old and new alike.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zpl.jpg'),(6738,'The Sims 2: Bon Voyage','2007-12-17','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Whisk Sims away from their everyday routines and take them on exciting trips to three exotic locations in The Sims 2: Bon Voyage, the sixth expansion pack for The Sims 2! Whether relaxing on a lush tropical island in a luxury suite, camping with the family on a pristine mountaintop, or exploring the culture of the Far East, Sims will engage in new activities and experiences as they relax and rejuvenate. Transform them from bumbling tourists to savvy international travelers as they learn new customs including local greetings, dances and more to take home and teach to their friends. Send Sims packing for the trip of a lifetime!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kd1.jpg'),(6739,'Star-Crossed Myth: The Department of Wishes','2020-06-04','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The tale of the frighteningly beautiful gods of the stars… The lights of Tokyo blot out the stars. One night, you notice a sparkling star, and the beautiful gods of the stars appear. “We’ve been looking for you.” Your wishes have granted you a profound love story. Discover their celestial beauty…\n\nContains the routes of:\n* God of Leo, Leon\n* God of Cancer, Karno\n* God of Aquarius, Huedhaut\n* God of Taurus, Teorus\n* God of Capricorn, Aigonorus\n* God of Sagittarius, Tauxolouve','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87nm.jpg'),(6740,'Head Over Heels','2021-10-28','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Head Over Heels Is a Classic Ocean Software Game , Re-Imagined With Beautiful High Res Pixel Art and a Great Soundtrack!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4288.jpg'),(6741,'The Enjenir','2023-12-18','Platform, Puzzle, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this light hearted physics based building game, you are a clumsy medieval engineer. The game combines gridless sandbox building with hilarious physics driven third person controls. With infinite structural design possibilities - the only limit is your imagination… oh, and gravity!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co924a.jpg'),(6742,'Light Up the Room','2021-11-03','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In this precision fast-paced action platform game you\'ll test your reflexes and discover the world around you to jump and dash to avoid obstacles on the way to reach your goal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45aw.jpg'),(6743,'Cheech and Chong Bud Farm','2020-03-11','Simulator','Android, iOS','Cheech and Chong Bud Farm is a free-to-download and play hemp and marijuana lifestyle app, but some game items can be purchased for real money. A network connection is not required, but you will have limited access to in-game functions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ghv.jpg'),(6744,'Plankton Gang: Sponge Neighbor',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co973i.jpg'),(6745,'Beacon','2018-04-30','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beacon is a sci-fi themed Action Roguelike. Played as a top-down shooter, you must fight your way through a randomly generated hostile world, all the while trying to locate your emergency distress beacon and escape the planet into which your ship has crashed.\n\nWhile you’re making your way through these areas you’ll not only find weapons and items to help you; You’ll also be collecting DNA from the enemies you defeat. Then, when you inevitably die, you’re given the opportunity to combine the DNA you’ve collected to your own, granting you different stats and potentially gameplay-altering physical mutations for your next run.\n\nBeacon aims to create a bridge between fast, frenetic action and long-term strategy, where your actions can be felt and built upon hours down the line.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23y8.jpg'),(6746,'Winnie-the-Bear: Honey Run',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co973e.jpg'),(6747,'Winnie the Bear',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co973f.jpg'),(6748,'Poveglia: The Island of Non Return','2024-12-20','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Visit one of the darkest places in Italy where hundreds of souls were forgotten in time. After an acclaimed career as a private investigator, detective William Miller takes on one last case; the disappearance of the Family Pierangelli, which has remained in mystery for over thirty years.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9701.jpg'),(6749,'Uta no Prince-sama: Amazing Aria','2010-12-23','Music, Simulator, Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Spin-off of Uta no Prince-sama, of which characters are in A class in the main series. The game has addition plot of main story line, and contains mini games of new songs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pdc.jpg'),(6750,'The Growth Project',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xz1qoyhzmiywopxr75by.jpg'),(6751,'Video Ghastlies','2025-12-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Video Ghastlies is a survival horror game set in iconic film eras. It\'s 1990s Scotland, and your brother has gone missing after becoming obsessed with a mysterious new VHS format. Follow his trail through the tapes and uncover why the government wants to ban \"Video Ghastlies\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ojh.jpg'),(6752,'Dying Light: Savvy Gamer Bundle','2021-06-24','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Find out how to turn a tablet, LED lights and a few cables into awesome combat gear with this new Savvy Gamer bundle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qg5.jpg'),(6753,'Chip\'s Challenge','1990-12-31','Puzzle, Strategy','Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, Amiga','A port of Chip\'s Challenge, originally for the Atari Lynx. In this strategy game, players of all ages will love the puzzle-solving challenges facing Chip as he must conquer 144 game levels in order to join Melinda\'s exclusive computer club, the Bit Busters.\n\nEvery level of Chip\'s Challenge represents a unique, timed, one-player puzzle. Solving a level invariably involves collecting microchips with available tools such as keys, magnets, shields, and cleats. Doors, traps, monsters, and other mischievous devices pose barriers, entice you into danger and complicate your progress. As each level is solved you are led into the next, slightly more difficult level.\n\nThe first eight levels are puzzles that introduce you to the game\'s basic concepts. You find your way through mazes, collect keys to open doors, teleport from place to place, pick-up tools, and use logic to conquer each puzzle.\n\nThe levels get progressively more formidable. You must pay attention to subtle hidden clues, learn how to evade many forms of disaster, and execute a complex series of actions.\n\nWith 144 levels, even the most skilled strategy game players will be absorbed by Chip\'s Challenge for countless hours.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3g3q.jpg'),(6754,'Bug Bites!','2023-05-20','Sin género','Game Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o6c.jpg'),(6755,'Inside the Code','2016-01-08','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inside The Code is a puzzle/action game.\nFight against your enemies and disarm the bomb through hundreds of procedurally generated levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xuzajibmrqxwhkldwxm6.jpg'),(6756,'Christmas Wonderland 14: Collector\'s Edition','2023-12-14','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enjoy an exciting Christmas Wonderland and Happy Holidays in Springfield. Help Santa at his North Pole Workshops. Fly in his brand New Sleigh. Visit Santa\'s Amazing Virtual Reality Grotto. Take part making a Movie.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h3u.jpg'),(6757,'Meltylancer: Ginga Shoujo Keisatsu 2086','1996-12-13','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Tactical, Adventure','Sega Saturn, PlayStation','MeltyLancer: Ginga Shōjo Keisatsu 2086 is a life simulation game and an expanded port of the PC game The Melting Pot Police: MeltyLancer. The game plays generally the same: the player determines the weekly schedules of six young Lancers; when they patrol and which days they have off, and what kinds of training they do to sharpen their skills. Battles can occur during patrols or special missions but are largely automated, with the player only having limited control such as ordering a Lancer to retreat.\n\nThe console versions of the game contain significantly revised simulation mechanics and story compared with the original PC version, with additional story events and full voice acting as well as completely revamped graphics and sound. The later Sega Saturn version additionally includes even more new scenario events, though is otherwise the same game as the PlayStation version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9on3.jpg'),(6758,'Fly of butterfly','2018-08-29','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fly, butterfly, fly. Relaxing game for those who do not like stress and like when everything is simple and easy.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6759,'Barista Coffee Simulator','2025-04-14','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6760,'Sudoku Classic 2','2024-12-26','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Customizable Sudoku with the feel of writing with a pen on paper and the ease of playing a video game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aib.jpg'),(6761,'Ascension: Deckbuilding Game','2014-12-16','Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Ascension: Deckbuilding Game is now available for your PC and Mac, complete with 9 full expansion decks! Play alone or with friends to battle against the Fallen One for honor and victory. Conceived and designed by Justin Gary, Ascension will provide hours of engaging and strategic game play for enthusiasts and experienced gamers alike.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60kg.jpg'),(6762,'Killer is Dead: Nightmare Edition','2014-05-23','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Killer is Dead is an action game that is no sequel to Killer7 or the No More Heroes series by the same developers, but shares elements such as violent action, a main character wielding a katana as the most prominent weapon, assassins as an important theme, and a cel shaded visual style. The game is divided into 12 episodes in locations all over the world and stars Mondo Zap as the main character. He is a contract executioner who works for the he Bryan Execution Firm. The game is set in the future and Monda receives jobs to kill cyborgs and assassins. Before each mission a brief overview of the objective is shown against a world map and in between the fighting there are often animated sequences that further the story. Completing a main mission usually opens up several side missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mtl.jpg'),(6763,'The Magnets','2021-02-25','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Magnets is a logic puzzle game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43yl.jpg'),(6764,'Blob Boy',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Roll, Bounce, and Swing your way to the top of the mountain in this 3d momentum-based precision platformer! Be warned, this game is not for the faint of heart! You will fail, many... many times! Are you up to the challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hjk.jpg'),(6765,'Voice Love on Air','2024-12-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','This game is a BL dating sim game with a unique twist of voice acting and studio management elements. The story tells how Aki, a new voice director who has to complete several BL Dramas, and the charming voice actors fall in love with each other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co803p.jpg'),(6766,'Grab Lab','2019-01-10','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Grab Lab is a crazy mix of puzzle and arcade game. Complete all unique levels - from simple to extremely advanced and demanding. Save the world - fix the gravity and rules of physics!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41eu.jpg'),(6767,'Hellbound: Survival Mode','2018-05-09','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','90\'s style First Person Shooter, 20 years later.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co497d.jpg'),(6768,'Söldner: Secret Wars','2004-03-27','Shooter, Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Soldner: Secret Wars is similar to the recent online FPS combat games involving infantry and vehicular warfare. But it also has a few features that separate it from the rest.\n\nThe Advanced Destruction System means you\'re no longer restricted to how a map should look. You can knock down trees to block a road or destroy a bridge to prevent armour from crossing. Damage remains until the end of the round instead of being just a decal that does not affect game play.\n\nUnit are able to be customized. You can choose your look, headgear, uniform and add extras like sunglasses and backpacks. Soldner features a large variety of weapons including the basic pistols and rifles but also features specialized items like sniper rifles, explosives and rocket launchers. There is a large variety of vehicles available to the player as well.\n\nThe other major game play feature is the command structure. An elected leader is able to set out objectives and waypoints for team members. As well as allocating funds for weapon and vehicle purchases. Bringing a more cohesive sense of game play to the battlefield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s24.jpg'),(6769,'Mutrix','2023-06-20','Sport','SteamVR','Mutrix is a music movement VR game, in which players need to use a lightsaber to slash flying notes, the greater the movement, the higher the score. The game library is rich, covering a variety of styles of music. Let\'s rhythm together!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ml3.jpg'),(6770,'The Land Before Time: Big Water Adventure','2002-10-03','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Featuring characters from the animated film series, The Land Before Time: Big Water Adventure lets young players guide Littlefoot, Ducky, Cera, and Spike through 14 levels in four worlds: Mountain Pass, Great Landbreak, New Water, and Soggy Swamp. Characters jump, run, slide, head-butt, and tail-whip as they explore levels containing obstacles such as moving logs, trees, lava, geysers, rivers, and ravines. The objective in each level is to collect 30 \"treestars\" and unlock bonus picture puzzles in Petrie\'s Palace.\n\nOther features include in-game movies and Mo\'s Big Water Racing, a bonus game that becomes available only after the main game has been completed with all four characters. In the bonus game, players have Mo jump through hoops on the river to trigger special animations. Each stage in the main game unlocks the next in sequential order, but once completed, levels can be replayed in any order in an attempt to collect all possible treestars.\n\nThe Land Before Time: Big Water Adventure is based on Universal Picture\'s film The Land Before Time IX: Journey to Big Water.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zw8.jpg'),(6771,'AstroGenesis: Boss Rush','2019-07-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is development to the game AstroGenesis. Fight with 10 new and unique bosses! Are you ready to defeat them all? Go ahead! What is new in the development:\n– 10 entirely new and unique bosses, in a Boss Rush regime (only bosses one after another, no enemies)\n– 10 new achievements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1n89.jpg'),(6772,'Overcooked! 2','2020-04-06','Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Overcooked returns with a brand-new helping of chaotic cooking action! Journey back to the Onion Kingdom and assemble your team of chefs in classic couch co-op or online play for up to four players. Hold onto your aprons… it’s time to save the world again!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1usu.jpg'),(6773,'Crabs: Sponge\'s Neighbor',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co973j.jpg'),(6774,'Starship Caramba','2005-05-29','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co979c.jpg'),(6775,'Marvel Pinball: Avengers Chronicles','2012-06-19','Pinball','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Avengers Chronicles is a collection of DLC pinball tables for Pinball FX2 as well as Marvel Pinball. It includes four pinball tables not available separately for the platforms listed here:\n-Fear Itself\n-Marvel\'s The Avengers\n-The Infinity Gauntlet\n-World War Hulk','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vdg.jpg'),(6776,'Warriors: Rise to Glory!','2018-02-02','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Warriors: Rise to Glory! is a turn-based combat game with RPG elements. You are a fierce warrior in your path to glory. Fight epic battles against many different enemies and gain experience and loot to improve your skills, weapons, and armor to find revenge and freedom!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23uq.jpg'),(6777,'Four Sided Fantasy','2016-08-30','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, Xbox One','Four Sided Fantasy is a wordless, seamless experience where you use screen wrap to solve puzzles in ways you never thought about before. Remember in Pac-Man how you can go off one side of the screen and \"wrap\" to the other? In Four Sided Fantasy, the player has the ability to toggle this screen wrap on and off at any time. Each new season in the game brings a new twist to screen wrap. Just as you think you’ve mastered a screen wrap mechanic, the world will change its rules and present a new way for you to look at the confines of your screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1za2.jpg'),(6778,'Europe Geography','2022-11-27','Quiz/Trivia','Android, iOS','How good are you in geography? Do you know all the countries of Europe and their capitals? And how about English counties, German states or French regions? Can you list 10 longest European rivers? Do you know the highest mountain of Apennines? Are you able to recognize Barcelona, Amsterdam or Prague by photo?\n\nMeet the most comprehensive game about the geography of Europe. With Europe Geography - Quiz Game you can learn in the easy and entertaining way everything about European geography: all the countries and their capitals, major cities and administrative divisions, mountains and mountain ranges, islands and archipelagos, rivers, lakes, seas and other water bodies. Europe Geography - Quiz Game is a real discovery for fans of vexillology - in the game you can find flags and coats of arms of states, regions, major cities and outside territories. Furthermore, in our application, you can find basic physical characteristics of natural objects as well as some statistical data, such as population, area size, population density, GDP and many others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uw0.jpg'),(6779,'ForeVR Bowl','2021-05-27','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Arcade','Oculus VR, Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, Oculus Quest','“ForeVR Bowl is the best bowling game of all time” -Vicki P, Mother of the Game Designer\n\nGame night is back like never before! Take your pick from over six alleys (1990’s hall, the Moon, Tiki Island, and more!) and have a blast with friends and family in an experience like no other in VR. Bowl solo or invite a crew to join in an immersive landscape complete with unique soundtrack and fun easter eggs. Enjoy casual competition or join the tournament ranks unlocking over 100 collectable balls, each with its own unique throwing style and just a little bit of spice.\n\nForeVR Bowl is designed as an incredible bowling simulator thanks to a cutting edge game engine and Real Feel Throw technology to recreate everything you’d expect in your local alley... without having to rent any smelly bowling shoes.\n\nWhether you just want to bowl with a few friends, throw down with a full-on tournament or just hang out on the moon, ForeVR Bowl is the best bowling simulator on Earth.\n\nGame on!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c9y.jpg'),(6780,'MadOut Ice Storm','2015-06-09','Racing, Simulator, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Destroy opponents, improve your car and weapons. Feel the dynamics of the chase and fighting battles. Enjoy good physics cars. You can choose between 15 cars, more than 80 unique tracks and several kind of weather condition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ixe.jpg'),(6781,'Paladog!','2011-01-24','Strategy, Arcade','Android, iOS','Introducing Paladog, the apex of all defense games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78zx.jpg'),(6782,'Pub Encounter','2016-04-12','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','\"Pub Encounter\" is a romance game where you can fall in love with one of several middle-aged men.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y3d.jpg'),(6783,'Pocket Tanks','2003-02-26','Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','The fastest game of artillery you\'ll ever play. Pocket Tanks is designed to be easy to learn, and fun to master. All the excitement of lobbing projectiles over a mound of dirt without all the complicated details found in most artillery games. Select your angle, power, and fire over 30 distinct weapons at your opponent. There is an innovative Weapon Shop to keep the game moving fast and a Target Practice mode for experimenting with all the weapons \"no holds barred!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27j0.jpg'),(6784,'MetaDOS','2024-03-07','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','MetaDOS: The Next-Gen Metaverse Battle Royale game.\nInspired by Apex Legend and In-Time movie. MetaDOS develops the game focused on E-sport battle royale mode with time system (time is currency) and high-quality graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s21.jpg'),(6785,'Smalles','2021-08-07','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Smalles is a game where you will send your champion into the Dungeon to collect gold and also raise in strenght.You will acquire precious Talent Points that can be used to upgrade your character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41o9.jpg'),(6786,'Pathfinder: Kingmaker - Royal Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50u3.jpg'),(6787,'Final Fantasy Digital Card Game','2019-07-09','Strategy, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','In Final Fantasy Digital Card Game you’ll make your own decks consisting of various characters from the Final Fantasy series as well as numerous summons in pixel art form.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vp0.jpg'),(6788,'Rings of Saturn: Tales from the Rings',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3t5h.jpg'),(6789,'Flippin Kaktus','2022-05-12','Fighting, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Flippin Kaktus is a brutal action-driven vendetta featuring a spiky hero with the thorny past and rage-outbreaks combat style. When the vicious “Calaveras” drug cartel raids his home, he breaks bad in a hardcore journey to save his foster family. Reveal the dark side of the wacky 80s punk and flip the switch to obliterate anyone in his path!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co399l.jpg'),(6790,'One Room: Yui Hanasaka Memorial','2025-01-11','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A new immersive animated novel game where you can experience the story of Yui Hanasaka, the main heroine of the popular short anime series OneRoom, from the protagonist’s point of view.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96f6.jpg'),(6791,'Street Fighter II: Rainbow Edition','1992-12-31','Fighting','Arcade','This game is a hack of Street Fighter II: Champion Edition, notable for modifying many gameplay aspects, the most noticeable being the ability to transform into other characters and being able to pull off special moves in midair.\n\nSome of the special moves were modified, such as the Hadokens, which can either home in on the opponent or travel extremely fast, as well as 7 different characters being able to execute them as opposed to just Ryu and Ken. Zangief moves noticeably faster in this game, and E. Honda can pull off Hadokens when performing his Hyakuretsu Harite.\n\nThe graphics and music are identical to those in the original game aside from the title\'s logo, which is now rainbow-coloured, which is where this hack gets its name from.\n\nAlthough there are many different revisions of this hack readily dumped and emulated, several versions are still left undumped. The rampant craziness with these hacks and the popularity of arcade distributors putting these hacks in machines was one of the reasons behind the creation of the legitimate Street Fighter II: Turbo Hyper Fighting update.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31de.jpg'),(6792,'Touhou Spell Bubble: Special Music Pack Vol. 2','2020-10-15','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','This is Vol. 2! Get new arrangements of 6 popular Toho songs\naccompanied by 6 challenge stages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yya.jpg'),(6793,'Mega Man Battle Network 6: Cybeast Falzar','2016-03-10','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical','Wii U, Game Boy Advance','In Mega Man Battle Network 6, Lan\'s father has received a job transfer and the family moves to Cyber City, a town known for conducting various technological experiments. Lan will meet new people and build new friendships in the real world while Mega Man befriends helpful Navis and encounters dangerous new enemies on the virtual plane. Together they will face threats far more powerful and perilous than they ever have before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bhe.jpg'),(6794,'Unreal Tournament 2004: Editor\'s Choice Edition','2004-03-16','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In addition to the original version of Unreal Tournament 2004, this \"Editor\'s Choice\" package includes new vehicles and characters, maps for the Onslaught mode, and a number of high-quality community-developed, publisher-approved mods.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86iv.jpg'),(6795,'JuJuJu Club: Potsunen','2019-11-27','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Available in the Story Me app.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6p5y.jpg'),(6796,'Everybody Wham Wham','2021-01-29','Music, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Compete to build the best snowman in a story-driven, winter adventure! Make friends at the festival, tune in to the Wham Wham Radio Station and uncover the hidden truth behind Wham Wham the Snowman-man. Can you build, decorate and sabotage your way to the festival grand prize?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pca.jpg'),(6797,'The Gray Wolf and The Little Lamb','2021-06-17','Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Once upon a time there lived the grey wolf and the little lamb. One was infamously cruel while the other had a heart of gold. They both egotistically believed they could teach one another a life lesson. But maybe they could become friends in the end?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dfy.jpg'),(6798,'Mini Golf Arena','2018-04-21','Simulator, Sport, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Mini Golf Arena is an exciting multiplayer golf game for up to 24 players online','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qp6.jpg'),(6799,'Vicious Red',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Vicious Red is a third person survival-horror game that stays true to the genre\'s best traditions. Set in an alternate universe of the recent past, the game takes place on a space station overrun by a terrifying virus. Players must fight for their lives as they face off against unimaginable horrors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hto.jpg'),(6800,'Redviil','2019-03-12','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Now it\'s 2143, my name is Alice, I was born in a small town called Gwaine. I dream to continue the work of my great-grandfather: to find a cure for the red plague and release people living in hundreds of bunkers.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6801,'House Painting: Simulator','2024-12-21','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Enjoy the most realistic and fun house painting simulator you’ve ever seen!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aj4.jpg'),(6802,'Pickomino','2015-04-02','Sin género','iOS','An appetizingly addictive dice game for up to 4 gambling gobblers. Barbecued worms are in high demand, and only the coolest-headed chicken can win the tasty snack! But beware: Anyone who doesn\'t manage to grab a worm off the grill can help himself to those on his opponents\' plates! In Reiner Knizia’s popular dice game, 16 barbecue worm portions with different values are waiting on the grill to be snatched up by the dice-throwing chickens. The rules are simple, but don’t push your luck too far: To get your claws into one of the delicious worms, you roll all 8 dice at the same time. You then pick a value from your throw and remove all the dice showing the same value, before throwing the remaining dice again. If your score corresponds to an available barbecue worm portion on the grill you can take this portion - or maybe even grab a portion from the plate of your fellow players! You’ll need both the luck of the dice and the right strategy: Stick with your score, or roll the dice just one more time to get a better portion. The player with the most worms in his claws at the end of the game wins!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6803,'Demon of the Dark','2024-08-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 3D Survival Horror Game, in which the player has to investigate an abandoned hospital, while looking out for whatever danger that resides in the unknown darkness. Play Demon Of The Dark for a bone-chilling experience, like none other!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8n9m.jpg'),(6804,'Bulletline','2018-06-04','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to a world where ninjas, spec-ops agents, chefs, cowboys, princesses, and the wretched hag do battle with automatic assault weapons and high-powered rifles - Bulletline is the ultimate combat-focused, team-based, local-multiplayer game-mode-royale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rxm.jpg'),(6805,'Super Street Fighter II: The New Challengers','1993-09-10','Fighting, Arcade','Arcade, Sharp X68000, FM Towns','A new challenge awaits. For two years, they have reigned supreme. Twelve of the most gifted fighters from across the world have battled each other in the World Warrior Tournament. But the time has come for them to step aside – now is the time of the New Challengers!\n\nCammy, Dee Jay, T. Hawk, and Fei Long have earned the right to enter the World Warrior Tournament. Each of them possesses a lethal combination of martial arts skills that they believe can destroy M. Bison. But can they survive the original Street Fighters and their new abilities? Only the true Street Fighters among you will find out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yje.jpg'),(6806,'Pokémate','2006-06-05','Simulator','Legacy Mobile Device','Pokémate was a mobile phone application which allowed players to send messages to other people on the user\'s friend list or chat with them. Players could select and capture Pokémon to keep in the storage feature of the application. They could also subscribe to the game in order to receive more Pokémates, Poké Balls, and other media.\n\nThe game was only distributed in Japan. However, it was presented in the United States during the 2006 E3 summit. The service was discontinued in January 2008.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6n00.jpg'),(6807,'Ame Koi','2014-08-08','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ame Koi is an erotic visual novel developed by Noesis.\n\nIt was the last title released by the brand before the departure of Coffee Kizoku, which resulting in its closure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rnd.jpg'),(6808,'Emma: Lost in Memories','2020-05-15','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Emma is a 2D puzzle platformer that revolves around a potent central mechanic: all the platforms and walls start disappearing when the player touches them. This creates a series of challenges around this idea. Also, the player only needs to focus on jumping and reacting to its environment as he runs automatically. The game is all about overcoming one-screen puzzles with skill and ingenuity. Emma aims to be a simple and enjoyable game that works around the concept of fading away, both mechanically and thematically through delicate storytelling. Emma tackles themes like loss (focused on memory loss) and the acceptance of who you are.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26m9.jpg'),(6809,'Phantasy Star Collection','2003-03-07','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Advance','Phantasy Star Collection is a compilation of Phantasy Star games that was released on the Game Boy Advance on November 26, 2002 in the United States and in March 2003 in Europe. This version, produced by Digital Eclipse, altered the classic titles in order to function within the Game Boy Advance\'s resolution. Strangely, the bundle omitted the fan-favorite Phantasy Star IV: The End of the Millennium from its selection of games, only offering Phantasy Star, Phantasy Star II, and Phantasy Star III: Generations of Doom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ilc.jpg'),(6810,'The Photo of God','2025-04-22','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short narrative-driven atmospheric horror game, where you play as an old photographer, who decided to take the photo of God one day. Take your camera and you are ready to go. Birds will lead you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pyz.jpg'),(6811,'Wasteland 3: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cqf.jpg'),(6812,'Criminal Girls: Invite Only','2015-02-06','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','Criminal Girls: Invite Only a Japanese role-playing game and the enhanced version of the original Criminal Girls game. The game follows a group of girls in Hell who have to climb a tower to be reincarnated. The battle system is unique since you give the characters, each representing a different vice, orders in battle and sometimes they won’t listen to you because they haven’t been trained.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xb9.jpg'),(6813,'Xmas Lemmings','1991-12-31','Strategy','DOS, Amiga','Xmas Lemmings is a demo released to promote Oh No! More Lemmings. It includes two levels from Oh No! (different ones depending on version and platform) and two new exclusive Christmas-themed levels. The levels feature snowy landscapes, snowmen, festive lights, Christmas songs as background music and the Lemmings dressed in Santa hats and coats.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83re.jpg'),(6814,'Left On Read','2025-04-02','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','When your friend, Eiran, left the country to go on a family trip for about three months, you weren\'t upset that he wasn\'t responding because, obviously, he didn\'t have service. But now he\'s been back for two weeks and hasn\'t responded to a single message you sent, and even left you on read?!\nNow you\'re on your way to a party his family is hosting with your parents. And so help you, if you see him there, you are going to confront him. You want to know if you did something that might\'ve made him uncomfortable or hurt his feelings.\nOr, worst case scenario, he found out you have a crush on him...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pz7.jpg'),(6815,'BackRooms X',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BackRooms X is a game that combines all quality backrooms games into one.\nThe game features many levels where you will have to avoid strange creatures and solve puzzles. The gameplay is full of exploration and survival elements, where every detail matters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9liz.jpg'),(6816,'BloodRealm: Battlegrounds','2015-01-04','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Card & Board Game','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','BloodRealm combines all of the strategy and depth of a traditional collectible card game experience with the convenience of online gaming. Build your own decks to play against your friends, compete in online tournaments, and explore a rich fantasy world in a single-player campaign mode.\n\nBloodRealm places you amidst the eternal warring of the gods. The covenant which decreed that the gods would respect the free will of mortals was broken by the powerful sun god Ra, who consumed a mortal mind to serve him as champion, leading his armies into war.\n\nThat champion is you; the game begins when you shrug off the mental bondage of Ra, an act so cataclysmic that reality broke, and all of the gods the heavens bore fell to the Earth. The gods are desperate to restore their immortality and regain their place at the zenith of the world. Only you possess the strength of will powerful enough to stop history repeating and end their tyranny once and for all.\n\nCan you make your own miracle and kill the gods?\n\nThere are Six Realms of Magic in BloodRealm: Chaos, Order, Nature, Myth, Shadow and Light. Each Champion has access to 2 of these Realms in building a deck composed of powerful ally and spell cards. Champions also have a special unique \'Blood\' ability, with additional Blood powers unlocked as they Ascend to become Gods themselves.\n\nThe free download of BloodRealm provides each player with the choice of one of three Champions, its starting Deck of Ally and Spell cards, 1000 Gold, and 36 single-player Campaign battles (each with 3 levels of difficulty). Additional Champions, single-player Campaigns, and card packs may be purchased using Gold, which may be earned by playing the game or by spending real currency.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9px7.jpg'),(6817,'Hungry Adventurer','2023-09-21','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help hungry ninjas survive their starvation and face various enemies in this foodnastic platformer! Are you ready to collect some food? Be careful food is very addictive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bxt.jpg'),(6818,'VR Blade of Blocks','2025-03-16','Simulator, Indie','SteamVR','VR Blade of Blocks is a first-person VR block-cutting game where players take on the role of a swordsman, slicing through various colorful blocks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l6v.jpg'),(6819,'Pokémon Tower Battle','2019-12-23','Puzzle','Web browser','Pokémon Tower Battle is a spin-off Pokémon game on Facebook Gaming developed by Bombay Play. It was released worldwide on December 23, 2019 and is available in four languages: English, Indonesian, Thai, and Traditional Chinese.\n\nThe game is hosted on Facebook\'s servers, either on the website or the app. In-game, players take turns placing down Pokémon artwork to build a tower. The game ends when one person knocks over one of the Pokémon on the tower, prompting the other as the winner. In addition, a Pokémon can be switched out for another with a Poké Ball, which can be acquired by watching advertisements. There also are Ultra Balls, which have the chance to hold rare Pokémon, and Master Balls, which guarantee a rare Pokémon on use. These can also be obtained by watching ads, though are distributed randomly by watching videos in a row.\n\nThe game keeps track of the highest stack a player has built, allowing them to share it online through Facebook if they so choose. The game also has ranked seasons, allowing users to gain rewards through ranks by continuously playing the game before the season ends and said rank is reset.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nek.jpg'),(6820,'Battles of Destiny','1992-12-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','DOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4pdx.jpg'),(6821,'Krypt','2022-06-21','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Krypt is an old-school text adventure filled with excitement and peril. Fight monsters, make choices, and travel through forests and mountains to defeat the evil King Krypt in this epic fantasy tale. But watch out as you try to discover all the paths, because not every choice ends in victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5imm.jpg'),(6822,'Supermarket CEO Simulator','2025-04-25','Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4','Supermarket CEO Simulator – Build your retail empire and become the market leader!\nTake charge of your own business and turn a small store into a thriving supermarket chain! In Supermarket CEO Simulator, you have full control over every aspect of supermarket management – from stocking shelves and hiring staff to marketing and expanding your business. The competition is fierce, and customers have high expectations – do you have what it takes to become a retail mogul?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r6m.jpg'),(6823,'Centauri Sector','2015-06-23','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Centauri Sector is a top down tactical space combat game powered by a dynamic turn based campaign, rpg elements, fleet management and ground base combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a57.jpg'),(6824,'Hypnocult','2019-08-23','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fast action game - twist and weave your way through tunnels, collecting lines.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hcp.jpg'),(6825,'Luminleaf Chronicles','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','\"Luminleaf Chronicles\" is the story of a group of cat girls who set out on an adventure to purify the world\'s water. In this game, you can choose different characters to go on your own adventures with others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gf2.jpg'),(6826,'Strawberry Jumping Journey','2025-04-19','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Embark on the Strawberry Jumping Journey and help the strawberry navigate through the forest! With countless obstacles blocking her path, you\'ll need to rely on the power of the quadruple jump to overcome them. Stay focused and survive as long as possible to achieve the highest score!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r6h.jpg'),(6827,'Euro Truck Simulator 2: Scania S BEV','2024-07-02','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Enjoy the Scania S BEV in Euro Truck Simulator 2! The Scania 40 S and 45 S BEV, which are both based on the Scania S with a 4x2 chassis, feature two powertrain options, a 6-speed transmission combined with 3 electric motors with a power output of 400/450 kW. For now only as Quick Jobs trucks.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6828,'OnOrbit: Virtual Space Lab','2025-09-30','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','OnOrbit is a virtual space lab lets you assemble and operate space hardware as if you were actually in space. Make your own craft in a sandbox mode, then simulate its operation as part of the Supernational Space Cooperative (SSC). Climb the ranks and head out to the planets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8q3x.jpg'),(6829,'Destiny: Rising','2024-11-01','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','Enter an era of heroes and legends set within the rich tapestry of the Destiny Universe, where you will meet both familiar faces and intriguing new characters. Experience top-tier sci-fi shooting action in the franchise’s first mobile game as you embark on a new adventure in an alternate Destiny timeline. Play as these unique characters to defend future Earth and reclaim humanity\'s future!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co912s.jpg'),(6830,'LEGO Rock Band','2009-11-27','Music','PlayStation 3, Wii, Xbox 360','LEGO Rock Band is a blending of Rock Band and LEGO series. Players get to start a band and hire band members who will play with them. Just like with real Lego, players can mix and match bodies, torsos, legs and heads to create a character any way they want. The main game has players touring around the world at various locations, like the original Rock Band games. Unlike Rock Band however, LEGO Rock Band also has special levels where you must perform outrageous tasks such as fighting an octopus or demolishing a building using your rock concert. As players make their way through the song lists, they earn \"Studs\", the game\'s currency. Studs can be used to purchase Lego items to decorate your Rock Den, hire new staff, buy new clothes or instruments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wpb.jpg'),(6831,'Guns Up!','2015-12-05','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','GUNS UP! is a free-to-play side-scrolling strategy game that pits players against each other in a battle to destroy enemy bases to increase their own army’s strength. GUNS UP! combines the fun of enemy base invasion with tower–defense, for an experience like no other on the PS4 system.\n•Free-To-Play – Players on PS4 can download and play GUNS UP! for free. Players can use in-game experience or purchases from the store to unlock upgrades to: supplement their armies, customize their characters, and upgrade their bases.\n•Find and Destroy Enemy Bases – While connected online, players can build their army to obliterate opponents’ bases to become to ultimate field commander\n•Build And Defend Your Base – Set up and tweak your military stronghold to keep the enemy away from your base\n•Leveling System – Upgrade bases and enhance your troops by unlocking perks. As you gain experience, your troops and armaments level up, improving players’ abilities to conquer more enemies','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hq4.jpg'),(6832,'Jane\'s Realty',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6833,'The Bard\'s Lore: The Warrior and the Dragon','1998-12-31','Sin género','DOS','Welcome to the mystic world of THE BARD\'S LORE. Deriving from the Bard\'s Tale series, it takes you into the limit of adventuring. If you can beat Grendel, you will truly prove yourself to be a worthy adventurer! But there are some major monsters out there, just waiting to take a bite out of you...you must use all your cunning and wits to solve this one.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6834,'Virtual Girl @ World\'s End','2025-06-12','Music, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A visual novel developed by HEADLOCK about Virtual YouTubers in an apocalyptic world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99zf.jpg'),(6835,'Dungeons of Legend: Cast Within','2019-02-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dungeons of Legend: Cast Within is a first person dungeon crawling adventure. Each level is hand crafted to provide the most immersive and complete experience. Explore, search, gather hints, solve riddles, fight monsters, and find tons of loot and upgrades!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ceq.jpg'),(6836,'Overtime Pay','2024-08-29','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As the clock strikes midnight, you find yourself trapped within the oppressive confines of a desolate office. Your task seems straightforward: Keep putting the correct paper in the correct place and you might find yourself entitled to overtime pay. And will you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gm4.jpg'),(6837,'Evolution VR','2017-02-03','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into an alien world, and evolve a creature of your design to be the top of the food chain. Precisely guide your creature to attack smaller prey and avoid predators with motion controls. Fully customize your creature’s body parts and abilities, unlocking more as you grow. Explore beautiful and dangerous worlds with larger predators around every corner. Become the most fearsome creature on the planet!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b5t.jpg'),(6838,'Anima Fighters','2024-12-21','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight to escape from the dimensional prison: choose one of the six warriors and prepare for battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fjt.jpg'),(6839,'Interesting Kaizo World','2020-05-19','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','An intermediate Kaizo Rom Hack of Super Mario World.\n\nThe Hack Features :\n- Kind of Vanilla Levels Design\n- Fast Retry System\n- No Overworld\n- No Wall Jump\n- No Rope Glitch\n- No Double Switch Hit\n- Custom Sprites\n- Custom Musics','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lrq.jpg'),(6840,'One Piece: World Seeker - Episode 1: The Void Mirror Prototype','2019-07-12','Sin género','PlayStation 4','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53sc.jpg'),(6841,'Clock Tower Deluxe','2023-01-07','Sin género','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Clock Tower Deluxe is a hack of Clock Tower (1995) for the Super Famicom created by BobSchneeder45\n\nList of changes and improvements:\n\n—Features—\nMouse support\nLost bedroom, clown doll, zombie, extra cave event ported from the PlayStation version\nCan run up and down the stairs (can also run to all hotspots)\nRefined chase system (opt out by using the classic chase patch)\nHold UP or DOWN to speed up the credits\nFaster health regeneration\nRegion error screen disabled\n\n—Mouse—\nLeft button: walk/click things\nRight button: stop/panic button\nPress SELECT to change mouse speed (on real hardware). Changes cursor speed for the gamepad instead if no mouse connected.\nMove the cursor down to access the inventory. Right clicking there will switch to the default cursor','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qab.jpg'),(6842,'Butasan','1988-12-31','Arcade','Arcade, Sharp X68000, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC, MSX','The object of Psycho Pigs UXB is to eliminate your opponents (who are pigs) by throwing bombs at them. When thrown, the bombs will count down from the number shown on the bomb, exploding when they reach zero or when they hit their target, whichever comes first. Items can be picked up along the way that will help you defeat opponents, like a knapsack that allows you to carry more than one bomb at a time. After certain levels, a bonus game appears, and the object of this game is to attempt to kiss the lady pigs as they pop in and out of holes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wq6.jpg'),(6843,'Obama Alien Defense','2009-11-05','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','President Obama stars in this exciting game in which he defends against a huge alien invasion. Help the President battle the space aliens to save the world. Use the arrow keys to move and the Z button to shoot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9760.jpg'),(6844,'BrambleLash','2017-09-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','BrambleLash is a spritely local co-op with team-and-swap action. Enchanted sprites work together to defeat slimy invaders in a whimsical setting full of glimmering shadows. Connect, co-operate or betray to win!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a05.jpg'),(6845,'Baron of Shell','2022-06-17','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Baron of Shell is an expert-difficulty Kaizo hack of Super Mario World focused on shell physics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rbv.jpg'),(6846,'Kunoichi Ninja','2019-09-12','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An English version and a Japanese version enter together. I produce this game with a Japanese environmental PC. For the one where the toe roux end is not seen in, the version to be seen immediately enters together. It is freedom whether you use it. Three hours fastest as for the play time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co453n.jpg'),(6847,'Forbidden Art','2024-03-25','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','Forbidden Art is a VR escape room puzzle game where you escape from a killer\'s secret lair.\nStart in the dungeon and work your way through secret passages, studies, morgues, vents, chapel, and more to escape without being seen by the killer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86qi.jpg'),(6848,'Urban Showdown','2025-04-25','Fighting, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6849,'Tiny Time Travellers','2019-08-26','Platform, Adventure','Android, iOS','Travel through time and space and rescue Earnest\'s true love Minnie from the Evil time wizard.\n\nNavigate through Ancient Egypt, Medieval England, Ancient Greece and Korea in the year 2049.\n\nCollect tiny coins to upgrade Earnest\'s micro mini blaster and change his clothes in the time travelling shop.\n\nHelp Earnest you\'re his only hope!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1q1b.jpg'),(6850,'The Magic Cooking Pot','2023-07-31','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','A 32-exit long romhack for SMW with new characters, enemies, and visuals. The levels are longer compared to those in SMW.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wtx.jpg'),(6851,'The Last DeadEnd','2018-05-04','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Last Dead End is an adventure game with the elements of FPS and horror.\n\nIn this game, we play the role of young scientist Farhad Novruzov, who returned to his homeland to help in filming a documentary movie for an international television channel. Here he faces strange events connected with the ancient religion of Zoroastrianism and the scientist has to find out the reason of these events.\nThe game takes place both from the first person and the third person. Most actions and active research take place in the first person view. The main action of the game takes place in Baku, Azerbaijan. It takes place in an actually existing inner city of Baku. This is the oldest district of the city with a thousand-year history, surrounded by a fortress wall, inside which along with the old streets, there are dozens of historical and archaeological sites.\nThere are several regular enemies in the game, as well as strong enemies (bosses), that were inspired by local legends. In the fight against some of them, there is its own tactic of winning them.\n\nThe game has an extensive encyclopedia and the possibility of research. Articles in a vast encyclopedia, containing articles about historical objects, characters, symbols, etc., are added along the course of the game. In the game there are various items that can be selected, viewed from all sides, learn information about them. With the help of technological glasses, which the main character has, you can read and decipher the inscriptions in the ancient languages that are on the walls of the old city.\n\nSome of the locations are built one-to-one with real city and historical buildings, the game has many objects that reflect the national flavor of the old city.\n\nMost of the game takes place in unusual locations for the genre - a flooded fortress, an ancient palace, ancient ruins, etc. This is one of the rare games in the genre, with elements of horror, where action takes place in a real city, enveloped in a mystical atmosphere.\n\nSurvival mode. Special mode where you can fight with different enemies in various maps. There are three types of survival: try to hold out \"waves\" of enemies, kill all enemies in a certain time and finally, to last as long as possible, remaining alive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v7f.jpg'),(6852,'Total War: Shogun 2 - Rise of the Samurai','2011-09-27','Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rise of The Samurai is an, independent campaign for Total War: Shogun 2. \n \nSet 400 years before the dramatic civil war depicted in SHOGUN 2, the \"Rise of The Samurai\" campaign is based on the Gempei War, a conflict between six legendary clans of the Taira, Minamoto and Fujiwara families. It culminated in the first Shogunate, and the rise of the Samurai as the ruling class.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/j4jrykro63cdywbwicro.jpg'),(6853,'Queen\'s Gate: Spiral Chaos','2011-07-28','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PlayStation Portable','This is the sequel to Queen\'s Blade: Spiral Chaos.\nIt features returning game exclusive characters Jean and Cute, and introduces a new heroine, Maron Makaron.\nIt also features characters from other forms of media, such as the Soul Calibur, Tekken, Dead or Alive, Samurai Showdown, BlazBlue, Guilty Gear, and the King of Fighters fighting game series, as well as other anime and manga series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a24.jpg'),(6854,'Star Control: Origins - Galactic Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cqh.jpg'),(6855,'Neighbor Fight','2022-06-09','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Multiplayer first person strategy game with lots of destruction. Destroy the house of your neighbor by throwing furniture and build a business by selling weed!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j5v.jpg'),(6856,'Slum Guide','2024-09-27','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a mysterious slum town and recruit women seeking fortune. Use them as fighters in a coliseum or to defend yourself against local threats. As a cunning guide, gather intel, use tools, and manipulate secrets to immerse them into the town\'s hidden desires.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95ai.jpg'),(6857,'Crossfire: Dungeons','2015-05-21','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Battle against rival fantasy armies in this fast paced turn based strategy game. Fight powerful bosses while you hunt for treasure in dungeon mode, play through over one hundred single player missions in campaign mode, or match wits against your friends in multiplayer. Simple one-click per unit control scheme takes minutes to learn, while the in-depth army building and game strategy keeps you coming back for more. 6 different armies to master each with unique units, strengths and play styles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hm3.jpg'),(6858,'Fatal Frame III: The Tormented','2005-11-08','Adventure','PlayStation 2','Rei Kurosawa suffers a strange dream each night, since she took a photo of her dead boyfriend in an abandoned old mansion.\n\nEvery night the dream will take her deeper and deeper in an old mansion, when she will have to find out what is going on.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ov1.jpg'),(6859,'Gogh: Focus with Your Avatar','2025-04-30','Simulator, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','gogh: Focus with Your Avatar is more than a focus tool – it’s a cozy blend of avatar creation, room design, and virtual pet game. Build your perfect space, vibe with Lofi beats, and let your cute avatar and quirky companion turn work into pure fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g7d.jpg'),(6860,'Iota','2021-02-24','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','iota is the first hardcore platformer designed with the touch screen in mind! There is no jump button. You will bounce from the floor to the ceiling as you make your way left, right, up, and down as you dodge saws and avoid spikes to make it to the next level.\n\niota features 36 handcrafted levels which provide over 5 hours of content!\n\niota is for people who are bored with casual games and are ready for a real challenge! Experience console level difficulty on your iPhone and iPad!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co447u.jpg'),(6861,'Earl vs. the Mutants','2024-07-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as Earl, a mutant exterminator, in this top-down driving rogue-lite. Navigate a post-apocalyptic wasteland, mowing down hordes of mutants while fulfilling your mission to save humanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lb5.jpg'),(6862,'Sonic and the Black Knight HD',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kip.jpg'),(6863,'Namco Classic Collection Vol. 1','1995-11-01','Shooter','Arcade','An arcade-exclusive compilation featuring four classic Namco games: Galaga, Xevious, Super Xevious and Mappy. It also adds brand-new \"Arrangement\" versions with updated graphics, audio and gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qsq.jpg'),(6864,'Dance Dance Revolution Ultramix 3','2005-11-15','Music','Xbox','Dance Dance Revolution Ultramix 3 allows players to compete online and go head-to-head with other DDR fans from around the globe, talk live to other DDR players as well as download new songs and other content. Ultramix 3 also features never-before-seen offline modes that cater to the casual, beginner and advanced dancers. \'Freestyle Mode\' lets newcomers to the series dance to any song without having to follow specific dance steps on the screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tx4.jpg'),(6865,'Alienz',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6866,'Knights and Dungeons','2020-07-12','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Knights and Dungeons is a single player game inspired by games like Clicker Heroes and other clickers.Knights and Dungeons is a clicker Idler game where your main goal is to defeat the enemies in the dungeon.and try to beat most levels as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46ji.jpg'),(6867,'Solas 128','2021-01-25','Music, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Explore Solas, a game of interconnected puzzles where you redirect and reconfigure rhythmic pulses of light to breathe life back into an ancient machine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nns.jpg'),(6868,'Bob Mazzolini Racing','2020-09-11','Racing','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Game is based on timing. As simple to play as holding the STAGE button until the light is green and releasing to go. You can then try to find the best shift points with a four speed transmission and try to improve your reaction time and try to break a record to get on the leader board.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mg8.jpg'),(6869,'2100','2019-02-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the year 2100. You have been selected to conduct research on the most advanced space station in all of the history of mankind with the most advanced AI. However, things start to take a turn for the worse when the AI begins to turn against you.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6870,'Echoes of The Backrooms','2024-08-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Echoes of The Backrooms\" is an indie horror game that masterfully captures the unsettling atmosphere of the Backrooms and the uncanny eeriness of liminal spaces. This game excels in creating an immersive experience with its cinema-quality visuals and meticulously crafted environments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qfq.jpg'),(6871,'Poliana Cake Crush','2021-12-21','Puzzle, Arcade','Android, iOS','Poliana Cake Crush is a match-3 puzzle game where you make delicious combinations and conquer all levels!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ggm.jpg'),(6872,'Reading Blaster: Ages 9-12','1997-10-30','Point-and-click, Adventure','DOS','Reading Blaster: Ages 9-12 is an educational point-and-click adventure game. Use your reading comprehension skills to help Rave rescue the missing people. Find the main ideas, detect important details and draw conclusions to unravel the mystery! Master over 20 essential skills with over 75 unique mystery stories that will stimulate your imagination. Three levels of difficulty offer progressive learning challenges, and comprehensive content prepares you for standardized tests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hkr.jpg'),(6873,'Hoyle Card Games','2000-12-01','Strategy, Card & Board Game','Game Boy Color','Hoyle Card Games is a Game Boy Color-only video game that was developed by Sandbox Studios and published by Sierra On-Line under their Sierra Attractions label.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wmm.jpg'),(6874,'Star Wars: Rogue Squadron III - Rebel Strike Preview Disc','2007-09-15','Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo GameCube','A preview disc containing a demo for Rebel Strike, as well as a handful of trailers for other games releasing around the time and a port of the original Star Wars arcade game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g07.jpg'),(6875,'Everreach: Project Eden','2019-12-04','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Everreach: Project Eden is a fast-paced, story-driven action-RPG set on the visually stunning Planet Eden. In Everreach, you play as Nora Harwood, member of Everreach’s Security Division, on a mission to secure the colonization process of Eden and investigate mysterious incidents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rgy.jpg'),(6876,'CSI: Miami','2004-05-24','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','CSI: Miami is a video game based on the CSI: Miami television series. The game was developed by 369 Interactive, published by Ubisoft, and was released for the Microsoft Windows on April 24, 2004. In 2008, Gameloft redeveloped the game for iOS.\nThis game, like CSI: Crime Scene Investigation, follows a distinct pattern of five cases, with the fifth case tying together the previous four.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ri2.jpg'),(6877,'The Bard\'s Quest: Dungeons of the Unknown','1994-12-31','Sin género','DOS','This is a NEW VGA/MCGA 256-color RPG game from VisionSoft! You must unravel the secrets of the mysterious dungeons of Isil Thania and discover the ancient Star Light Cult! So real you\'ll be playing for hours!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6878,'Downward Spiral: Prologue','2017-03-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Downward Spiral: Prologue is a unique action adventure multiplayer game powered by innovative, free movement in VR without motion sickness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78u5.jpg'),(6879,'The Legend of Heroes: Trails into Reverie - Advanced Set 1',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','This set includes the following DLC:\n- Sepith Set 2\n- Sepith Set 3\n- High-Grade Medicine Set 2\n- Accessories Set 2\n- Ingredients Set 2\n- Spirit Incense Set 2\n- Dragon Incense Set 2\n- Zeram Powder Set 2\n- Zeram Capsule Set 2\n- U-Material Set 2\n- +More','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q9o.jpg'),(6880,'Shin Megami Tensei III: Nocturne Maniax Chronicle Edition','2008-10-23','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','Shin Megami Tensei III: Nocturne Maniax Chronicle Edition is a re-release of Shin Megami Tensei III: Nocturne Maniax featuring Raidou Kuzunoha XIV and his feline companion Gouto. They replace Dante from the original Maniax version. This version was released only in Japan exclusively as part of a bundle titled Devil Summoner: Raidou Kuzunoha vs. King Abaddon Plus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7prb.jpg'),(6881,'Eye of the Beholder III: Assault on Myth Drannor','2015-08-20','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','Eye of the Beholder III : Assault on Myth Drannor is an all 3-D, Legend Series computer role-playing adventure based on the popular Advanced Dungeons & Dragons 2nd Edition rules and on an original story created for this game . The action takes place in and around Myth Drannor, located in TSR\'s Forgotten Realms game world.\n\nEverything in Eye of the Beholder III is from your point of view . Watch the trees pass by as you move through the forest around Myth Drannor . Pick up items and take them with you. Open doors with keys, by pressing buttons, or by pulling release levers. See monsters draw nearer to you and close in for battle . Attack with the weapons your characters have in their hands. Cast spells with your clerics\' or paladins\' holy symbols and your mages\' spell books . Those in the front of the party may attack with weapons such as swords and maces, while characters in the rear ranks may attack with spells, ranged weapons (such as bows and slings), and polearms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6k3c.jpg'),(6882,'Forsake','2022-03-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Forsake is a 1 to 4 player co-op online survival horror game where each player is a member of an urban explorer group. Choose your equipment to explore places full of paranormal and exorcise them, if you think you can handle it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62ka.jpg'),(6883,'Asteroid Invaders','2019-07-19','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Asteroid Invaders is fast-paced, neo-classic space shooter game. Remastered with compelling, graphics, music,enemies, bosses and weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lpm.jpg'),(6884,'D.R.I.L.L. - Dynamix VR','2018-01-23','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DynamixVR - D.R.I.L.L. is the first part of our VR wellbeing platform made available to the public. Ship your space cargo through the galaxy, protect it from pirates, defend your base while completing a pain-relief VR exercise specially good for your shoulders and upper back. No more routine, just fun.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6885,'The Bard\'s Lore II: The Dark Tower','1998-12-31','Sin género','DOS','Welcome to the mystic world of THE BARD\'S LORE. Deriving from the Bard\'s Tale series, it takes you into the limit of adventuring. If you can beat Grendel, you will truly prove yourself to be a worthy adventurer! But there are some major monsters out there, just waiting to take a bite out of you...you must use all your cunning and wits to solve this one.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6886,'Touhou Spell Bubble: Touhou Seirensen Arrangements Pack','2022-06-16','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','This pack consists only of \"Touhou Seirensen\" arranged music!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s9a.jpg'),(6887,'I Want an Identity','2011-02-08','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98fc.jpg'),(6888,'Warhammer 40,000: Dakka Squadron','2020-12-08','Shooter, Arcade','Android, iOS','Warhammer 40,000: Dakka Squadron - Flyboyz Edition is a fast paced aerial shooter set in the Warhammer 40,000 universe. The game play in a very arcade-like fashion as the player goes through a journey to become the best flyboy.  \n  \nPlayers complete missions, acquire \"teef\", upgrade and customize their planes, and jump back into the action to shoot down more enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tnf.jpg'),(6889,'2 in 1 Game Pack: DreamWorks\' Shark Tale + Shrek 2',NULL,'Sin género','Game Boy Advance','A compilation of two games based on DreamWorks animated movies on a single cartridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r8d.jpg'),(6890,'Heiankyo Parameters','2014-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser','The successor to the original Parameters game, Heiankyo Parameters adds a few new features to the game.\n\nTerritory\nOccupying territory is done by clicking and holding the mouse button over an empty or semi-occupied territory. Territories have a number of different levels of occupation, each providing a different quantity of cash once completed. Each territory also provides automatic income at regular intervals once it has been obtained.\n\nYellow territories are occupied by aliens and must first be cleared before they can be built upon. Each of these combat situations takes into account the player\'s attack and defense values and with each click, runs a combat simulation. If the player\'s health reaches 0, attack, defense, and recover are temporarily reduced to 0. The player must wait for these to return before attacking again. Once an enemy has been attacked, their health will regenerate over time.\n\nCash\nCash is rewarded each time an unoccupied territory is leveled up, and a smaller amount at regular intervals thereafter. Cash can be spent on buying upgrades that affect attack strength and defense level.\n\nLeveling\nThis is done automatically when the player collects enough XP. Once a level has been achieved, the player receives points that can be spent on attributes. The attributes are assigned at the right of the screen using the + buttons next to the three lines. The five available are Life, Attack, Defense, Recovery, and Cost.\n\nAction Points\nActions can only be performed when the player has enough points to spend on performing them. These can be seen in the purple bar on the right of the screen. Each action takes a number of points to perform, and these points are returned at a rate determined by the recovery score of the player.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fh5.jpg'),(6891,'Lootbox Incremental','2025-02-22','Simulator','Web browser','Lootbox Incremental is, well, an incremental game built around opening lootboxes.\n\nYou get a $10 giftcard from a kindly relative and decide to start opening lootboxes in your favourite RPG and streaming you opening them to the world. The rarer the items you find, the more income your stream will get you and the more lootboxes you can open.\n\nWith upgrades, achievements and multiple collections to complete, Lootboxes Incremental should give you just as much dopamine as opening actual lootboxes, only without the crippling sense of guilt afterwards.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6892,'Everybody\'s Golf VR','2019-05-21','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation VR','Step on to the course like never before in the most immersive Everybody’s Golf experience yet!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1lf0.jpg'),(6893,'Song Animals','2019-03-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A surreal journey of strange animals through hand-painted watercolour worlds set to a relaxing soundtrack','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6894,'Examples of Human Capital','2025-04-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short narrative experience set in a corporate structure...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pxh.jpg'),(6895,'Harder','2025-03-07','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Harder is an action rogue-like game with combat heavily inspired by the hack and slash genre. Progress through a series of enemies and bosses to reach your one true goal. Dodge, dash, parry, and slash your way through angels and demons alike in this quest to kill GOD.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9if4.jpg'),(6896,'Mythic','2022-09-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Mythic is a Roguelite MMO where you explore an infinite, procedurally generated labyrinth. Discover a world packed with puzzles, enemies, bosses, and treasure. Join forces with fellow heroes to hunt down the gods, or strike out alone and be the first to discover uncharted territory. Become Mythic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co528z.jpg'),(6897,'Pine: A Story of Loss','2024-12-13','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Alone in the forest glade he shared with his wife, a woodworker struggles to accept her passing. Help him hold on to cherished memories of their life together as he struggles to care for himself and his now empty home. Pine is a single-serving game focused on telling a beautiful, emotional tale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gal.jpg'),(6898,'Psyvariar Delta','2019-07-02','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Psyvariar Delta is a classic shooter known for the Buzz System, where players level up by grazing enemy fire and chaining Buzz. Also included in this version are 2 HD remakes of the arcade classic Psyvariar Medium Unit and Psyvariar Revision with new additional features.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67mm.jpg'),(6899,'For Honor: Season 23 - The Demon Dagger','2022-09-15','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Includes Testing Grounds TU2, Web of the Jorogumo (Halloween Event), Kensei Hero Skin, the Yokai Nightmare (Seasonal Event), Cross play phase 2, New Seasonal Customization and a new Battle Pass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pbg.jpg'),(6900,'Hole io & Candivity','2024-12-26','Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Here\'s the ultimate arcade bundle you\'ve been waiting for! Grow & merge solo or with friends in multiplayer mode!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aj3.jpg'),(6901,'Feed Us: Pirates',NULL,'Sin género','Web browser','Argh!! The Pirates have invaded the shores! Our little piranha friend is back again, in a buccaneer adventure! This expansion to Feed Us Lost Island has new victims to eat, new customizations and new objectives to complete.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a8o.jpg'),(6902,'Crazy School: Schulverweis!','2003-10-01','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crazy School: Schulverweis! is exactly the same game as Gefeuert! Dein letzter Tag... just in a school instead of a office. The player takes the role of a pupil who wants to cause as much chaos as possible. With simple point & click controls the player walks trough the levels and uses the various items to play his pranks, e.g. knocking over a bucket or tearing apart a notebook. For some actions he needs to collect and use another item, e.g. toilet paper to clog a toilet.\n\nEvery action takes time and is rewarded with points, more complicated or mean ones give more. So the main goal for a level is to beat the highscore in a limited time. When the player gets caught he has to absolve a mini game of Hangman where he has to guess words in a limited time and in limited tries. The campaign consists of 21 levels and the player can choose his gender and the names of the NPCs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99li.jpg'),(6903,'Cold Winter','2005-06-03','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 2','In \"Cold Winter\", you play the role of Andrew Sterling, a former member of MI6, the British secret intelligence service. Andrew is caught preparing to assassinate someone in China, and is thrown into prison. There he faces torture and imminent execution. But a former friend from his MI6 days arranges to rescue him and offers him a job, having planned in advance to manipulate him so that he is unable to refuse. The first task seems fairly ordinary: to track down a weapons dealer who has been supplying terrorists.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1otm.jpg'),(6904,'Snooker Fever','2025-01-01','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','The classic pool experience, right at home!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aie.jpg'),(6905,'Fortnite Festival: Season 2','2024-02-22','Music','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Get ready to go gaga as the legendary superstar, Lady Gaga, becomes the Icon for Fortnite Festival Season 2: Unlock Your Talent!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7spg.jpg'),(6906,'Poly Puzzle','2020-03-12','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Show everyone, who is the best in polygon shape games and collect all unique pictures in the one poly artbook! This poly art game is among challenging, brain training and relaxing games at the same time. All you need is to swipe to rotate the poly puzzle and find the correct angle at which the figure will be complete. Create unique poly art masterpieces. Challenge yourself inside a polysphere world! It is the best choice to spend your time. It will help you to concentrate better and develop imagination. Playstyles and moves are rendered in-game with meticulous attention to detail. Simple, fun and addictive for all ages. Get a completely new experience and relax your mind with 3d puzzle! FEATURES - Poly puzzle game is for all ages - Collect all art pictures in the poly artbook - Brain training and creative poly puzzle - Anti-stress effect of poly sphere - Simple gameplay - Enjoy solving various 3D poly sphere puzzles','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5api.jpg'),(6907,'Seidkona: A Tale of Death and Dice','2020-12-05','Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play a Viking Shaman and rain Death upon your Enemies with your Magic Dice on the War Table.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6908,'Killing Floor: Community Weapon Pack','2012-10-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Straight from the talented community modders of the IJC crew comes the first DLC weapon pack for Killing Floor. Featuring a diverse set of new weapons the Community Weapon Pack brings new game play options for your favorite perks.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6909,'Taram Baba','2025-04-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Taram Baba is an Action Roguelike with spectacular combat. Plunge your light deeper and deeper into the darkness of the abyss and fight your way to Taram Baba.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gwu.jpg'),(6910,'New Play Control! Metroid Prime','2009-02-19','Shooter, Adventure','Wii','Wii de Asobu: Metroid Prime (also known as New Play Control! Metroid Prime) is a port of Metroid Prime for the Wii with motion controls compatibility.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m4m.jpg'),(6911,'Drone Perspective','2025-03-26','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Real-time dynamic tactics with the strong focus on squad positioning and collaboration. Connect to the warzone from your home PC and orchestrate modern military operations from the Drone Perspective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jwx.jpg'),(6912,'Shoot, I Got Abducted!','2008-05-13','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98f9.jpg'),(6913,'The Rebirth','2013-07-15','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98f4.jpg'),(6914,'A Dog Called Buddy','2024-03-30','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short PSX tower defense style game about protecting a dog. Survive 6 hours while the rescue department is coming. Creatures from the fog are going to try to devour your \'buddy\'.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pz1.jpg'),(6915,'Duke Nukem: Episode 3 - Trapped in the Future','1991-07-01','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','Duke Nukem is the debut of the world’s greatest wise-cracking, alien-punching, gun-toting badass - a man who would later go on to combine both ass-kicking and bubblegum in a revolutionary way. In a world ravaged by Dr. Proton’s villainous ambitions, the original video game action hero must rise against the evil scientist’s army of sinister Techbots. And although Duke isn’t exactly what the Doctor ordered, he’s exactly what the world needed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ya9.jpg'),(6916,'Age of Speed Underworld',NULL,'Racing, Sport','Sin plataforma','The survival of mankind has been threatened after an asteroid hit the Earth. The peaceful planet has been poisoned through the Earth’s core with a devastating element known as Testalunium spreading through the lands. Scientist’s from around the globe has created the most technically advanced vehicle for you to race to the centre of the earth to extract the element. Time is of the essence as you speed through the Earth’s core defense lines. Power Ups and upgrades can assist your mission to save humanity in Age of Speed Underworld.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co976r.jpg'),(6917,'Han Seimei Senki Andorogynus','1987-05-01','Shooter','PC-9800 Series, PC-8800 Series, MSX2','Andorogynus is a top-down shoot-em-up. The player controls the titular hero(ine), shooting at constantly attacking enemies. Unlike in most games of the type, the screen scrolls down rather than up. The protagonist is equipped with a default single shot and has protective orbs revolving around that damage nearby enemies. The weapon can be enhanced (rapid fire, three-way fire, etc.) by collecting randomly descending power-ups. The player controls the male incarnation of the protagonist initially, but later switches to the female one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fjb.jpg'),(6918,'Ridge Racer 8',NULL,'Racing','Nintendo Switch','Cancelled mainline Ridge Racer title for Nintendo Switch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o20.jpg'),(6919,'Pinball FX3: Star Wars Pinball - Unsung Heroes','2017-09-26','Simulator, Pinball','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Journey to a galaxy far, far away and fight alongside unhailed warriors as they take on the might of the evil Empire in the Star Wars Pinball: Unsung Heroes pack!\n\n- Join the Rebellion and restore hope to the galaxy on the \"\"Star Wars Pinball: Rogue One\"\" table. Help Jyn Erso and a small group of Rebel fighters uncover a way to destroy the Empire\'s ultimate weapon by stealing the Death Star plans.\n\n- Aid the Rebel crew of the Ghost starship on the \"\"Star Wars Pinball: Star Wars Rebels\"\" table. Ezra Bridger and Kanan Jarrus battle against The Inquisitor and defy the Empire in this table based on the Star Wars Rebels TV show.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85pt.jpg'),(6920,'The Corpsmen','2021-04-23','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Corpsmen is a deck-building roguelite where you build and lead a team of creatures to fight, hunt and harvest other monsters. Your creatures will grow and learn new skills according to how you construct them. Craft unique creatures and decks, and venture forth into the unknown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ywv.jpg'),(6921,'Unprompted','2023-03-07','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Quiz/Trivia, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A.I. is here. Type to guess the words used to create A.I. artworks, while slowly uncovering A.I.\'s reflections on its own work. Come investigate more than 1,500 artworks made by A.I. across 7 carefully curated galleries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a91.jpg'),(6922,'Charm Girls Club: My Perfect Prom','2009-10-20','Simulator','Nintendo DS','Charm Girls Club: My Perfect Prom takes girls through the thrills and drama of planning, fundraising, decorating, getting ready and attending the big night! Create endless trendy and stylish looks and customize a Charm Girl to reflect your unique style. Choose everything from hair, make-up, wardrobe, shoes and accessories! The Charm Girls, Anna, Sara, Olivia and Emilie, are the BFFs every girl dreams of. The Charm Girls will guide you on adventures, encouraging you along the way, like all best friends do. Choose the perfect dress, the perfect date and get ready for the big night in Charm Girls Club: My Perfect Prom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co926q.jpg'),(6923,'I Want to Die: Remake','2021-01-04','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98fd.jpg'),(6924,'Tiger Fighter 1931','2018-08-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a shoot em up game. In this game the player combats a large number of enemies by shooting at them, the game is set in the Chinese People\'s War of Resistance against Japanese Aggression off the air of the North Eastern Province.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44nf.jpg'),(6925,'The Coma: Back to School Bundle','2024-09-10','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Sharpen your pencils, pack your notebooks, and pick up your controller (what?!) - it\'s time for a new lesson in fear. We’re going Back to School!\n\nThis bundle includes\n- The Coma: Recut\n- The Coma 2: Deluxe Edition\n- Artbook\n- Soundtrack\n- 2 DLC costumes\n\nDive headfirst into the Korean shadow realm and explore the twisted halls of Sehwa High with BOTH full games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ds3.jpg'),(6926,'Forza Horizon 4: LEGO Speed Champions','2019-06-13','Racing','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Forza Horizon 4: LEGO Speed Champions, the second major expansion for the award-winning Forza Horizon 4, presents a wonderous new LEGO Valley to race and explore. Amass your own Brick Collection and construct a Master Builder’s House with a garage of amazing LEGO Speed Champions cars including the McLaren Senna, Ferrari F40 Competizione and 1967 Mini Cooper S Rally.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e1e.jpg'),(6927,'Super Dragon Ball Z','2005-12-22','Fighting','Arcade, PlayStation 2','Based on the arcade game, this is a fighting game in the Dragon Ball Z universe, developed by Craft and Master (whose team members include former Street Fighter producer Noritaka Funamizu. Super DBZ is a cell-shaded fighter featuring your favorite Dragon Ball characters. Each character has his own special abilities, with Frieza making use of warps and Trunks using swords for up-close attacks. The game uses a four button setup. Two buttons are reserved for strong and weak attacks. One button is used for guarding with another used for making your character jump. The guard and jump button can be pressed together to execute a dash move. Super DBZ features both ground-based and air-based fighting. Stages are multi-layered, and you can move between different areas, taking the fight to an area that\'s more advantageous to your character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50f5.jpg'),(6928,'M*A*S*H: The Adventure Game','2021-02-07','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98fh.jpg'),(6929,'Candy Puzzles','2024-12-24','Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Stack, Match, and Munch!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9akj.jpg'),(6930,'Everybody\'s Gone to the Rapture','2015-08-11','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deep within the Shropshire countryside, the village of Yaughton stands empty. Toys lie forgotten in the playground, the wind blows quarantine leaflets around the silent churchyard. Down on Appleton’s farm, crops rustle untended. The birds lie where they have fallen.\n\nStrange voices haunt the radio waves as uncollected washing hangs listlessly on the line. The televisions are tuned to vacant channels. Above it all, the telescopes of the Observatory point out at dead stars and endless darkness. And someone remains behind, to try and unravel the mystery.\n\nImmerse yourself in a rich, deep adventure from award-winning developer The Chinese Room and investigate the last days of Yaughton Valley. Uncover the traces of the vanished community; discover fragments of events and memories to piece together the mystery of the apocalypse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3way.jpg'),(6931,'The Chaput\'s Baby','2022-09-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Chaput church was a well know place by the neighbors. Year gave way to year and the small church now is only the place where the Chaput family lives. Samantha is hired by the family to look after their baby, but things starts to go off inside the house.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cbx.jpg'),(6932,'Mystery Box 4-in-1 Bundle','2025-01-02','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy','Nintendo Switch','Mind bending puzzle games bundle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aiy.jpg'),(6933,'Anne\'s Zombie Odyssey','2024-11-28','Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Heart-pounding 2D action returns! Play until your fingers hurt and zombie heads explode! Survive while drenched in blood. The bloody feast begins at your fingertips!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aku.jpg'),(6934,'Maze Bandit','2017-07-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build your own dungeon. Defend it with deadly traps. Conquer & loot other mazes!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6935,'Battlefield 1942: World War II Anthology','2004-04-16','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This bundle includes the original Battlefield 1942 and its 2 first expansion packs, Battlefield 1942: The Road to Rome, and Battlefield 1942: Secret Weapons of WWII.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eio.jpg'),(6936,'Neon Chrome: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cam.jpg'),(6937,'Typoman: Revised','2017-02-21','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Typoman is a 2D puzzle platformer. You slip into the role of a character made of letters, struggling to make your way through a dark and hostile world. Despite your small stature you have a powerful gift: You can use words to alter your environment. But choose your words wisely. They can either be a blessing... or a curse!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z4i.jpg'),(6938,'Peppa Pig: World Adventures','2023-03-17','Platform, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Play in the bigger, wider world of Peppa Pig, and bring your family into the story! Make pizza in Italy, walk on Hollywood Boulevard, climb the Eiffel Tower and more on your world tour. Create your own unique and dazzling family home, and discover more characters, quests and fun than ever before!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zca.jpg'),(6939,'Mountain Bike Rally','1993-02-01','Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','The player starts in qualifying, and as he/she plays the game more frequently, he/she can qualify for the regionals, nationals, the championship, and the grueling final race where he/she must get first place in order to beat the game. Players will spend literally hours in the easier modes and this game is like exercise for his/her thumbs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z3g.jpg'),(6940,'Resident Evil 4','2007-03-02','Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Despite earlier rumors of a downgraded port due to the PlayStation 2\'s hardware limitations, this port of Resident Evil 4 have been generally favorable. Almost all the GameCube\'s real-time cut scenes were converted into movie files in order to maintain a better quality. Furthermore, voices and sound effects quality outside the cut-scenes had been reduced due to disc space being quickly used and audio RAM constraints. Capcom added new content made specifically for this port to compensate for the late release, such as minigames, documentaries and costumes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wki.jpg'),(6941,'Mischief Dungeon Life: Isekai Tensei shita Ore no Itazura Dungeon Life - Janice Edition','2022-11-24','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','“Mischief Dungeon Life\" is an isekai fantasy novel game in which Renji is reborn in another world as a demon. He encounters various heroines while playing a big role in the fates of both the Demon Clan and the Human Tribe.\nThis bishojo game released in 2020 from the brand \"Calcite\" has been remade for the \"CS Novel Club\" platform so that it can be enjoyed by people of various ages around the world.\n\nJanice Edition is a short version that includes a story focusing on \"Janice,\" a dragoness who hates the occult.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rdu.jpg'),(6942,'Banjo-Threeie',NULL,'Platform, Adventure','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube','Banjo-Threeie is a rumored third entry for the Banjo-Kazooie series that was supposedly intended to be made for the Nintendo GameCube in the early 2000s.\n\nThe game was first hinted at the end of Banjo-Tooie, in which the character Gruntilda jokingly says \"Just you wait until Banjo-Threeie...\", which was speculated to be evidence that the game was at one point planned by fans.\n\nAt SpaceWorld 2000, a small animation featuring characters from the Banjo-Kazooie series was shown, showing off the presence of Rare during the GameCube era of gaming. The animation features Banjo, Kazooie and Mumbo Jumbo being chased by enemies from Banjo-Tooie, all using their models from the game.\n\nIn 2002, Rare was brought by Microsoft, which caused various games developed for Nintendo systems at the time to move platforms, which would\'ve included Banjo-Threeie.\n\nDecades later, in 2020, the developer Gregg Mayles confirmed it to be simply a joke that fans took at face value, and the SpaceWorld demo was confirmed to simply be a showcase of how many N64 models the GameCube could render at once.\n\nAccording to Mayles, a game in the same style as the first two wasn\'t in the plans, and they went through three different concepts, until setting on what became Banjo-Kazooie: Nuts & Bolts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qk7.jpg'),(6943,'Big Bang Mini','2009-03-06','Shooter, Puzzle, Arcade','Nintendo DS','Big Bang Mini is a bidimensional shoot \'em up with \"bullet hell\" influences. Even the player\'s projectile can become dangerous, when they explode and return in the lower screen. Developed by Arkedo and published by SouthPeak Games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29st.jpg'),(6944,'Jigoku Hell','2017-09-26','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game about eggs. Made for #AGBIC jam 2017.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zpx.jpg'),(6945,'Special Delivery','2023-05-02','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on an exhilarating puzzle-solving adventure as you transport a mysterious box through rooms filled with conveyor belts, pistons, and cranes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pp6.jpg'),(6946,'2 Games In 1: Disney\'s Brother Bear + Disney Princess','2005-05-11','Sin género','Game Boy Advance','2 Games In 1: Disney\'s Brother Bear + Disney Princess is a compilation of games developed by Vicarious Visions and published by THQ for Game Boy Advance.\n\nThe game contains two full Disney themed games on a single cartridge. There is a menu that allows players to select which game to play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wbs.jpg'),(6947,'Quinty',NULL,'Puzzle','Super Famicom','Quinty is an unreleased puzzle game that developed by Game Freak for the Super Famicom in 1999. The game was a remake of the Famicom/NES game of the same name, which is also titled Mendel Palace outside of Japan. On October 12, 2024, 3 prototype builds of the game were leaked during the 2024 Game Freak Leak.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y3f.jpg'),(6948,'Eggconsole Dragon Slayer: The Legend of Heroes II PC-8801mkIISR','2024-12-12','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','An RPG set in a world 20 years after the previous installment. Take on the role of Prince Atlas and confront a new darkness threatening the peace of Eselhasa.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ajh.jpg'),(6949,'Cologne 3D','2021-10-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore parts of Cologne like the historic Old Market in the old town and the Gottfried-Hagen-Street in Cologne-Kalk (the office of the developer!).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gpn.jpg'),(6950,'Harley-Davidson & L.A. Riders',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Arcade','Arcade, Dreamcast','In Harley-Davidson & L.A. Riders, the player rides one of five Harley-Davidson models. The objective is to complete a series of checkpoints around Los Angeles under a time limit. The objective is similar to the later Sega arcade game, Crazy Taxi (1999).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4934.jpg'),(6951,'Snakecremental','2025-04-22','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Snake, but with a skill tree','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pzk.jpg'),(6952,'ATC Flight Operator','2025-01-22','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ATC Flight Operator is an air traffic control simulation engine with a powerful interface that gives users complete control of their airspace. Are you capable of taking control of an iconic airport while preventing mid-air collisions, and still directing airplanes to land as quickly as possible?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m8d.jpg'),(6953,'Spy x Anya: Operation Memories','2024-06-28','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Play as Anya and experience the world of SPYxFAMILY in its first console-game! Anya Forger has received a new assignment from school: create a photo diary of memories.\n\nOn weekdays, head to class in the morning, then enjoy family time in the evening.\n\nOn weekends, visit all sorts of exciting places, like the beach or art museums, in search of subjects worthy of photographing!\n\nWhat kind of photo diary will you help Anya create?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72yy.jpg'),(6954,'Yamamura Misa Suspense: Kyoto Kurama Sansou Satsujin Jiken','1994-03-20','Sin género','3DO Interactive Multiplayer','Kyouto Anba Sansou Satsujin Jiken (京都鞍馬山荘殺人事件) is a murder mystery adventure game based on writings of Misa Yamamura, a Japanese writer of murder mystery novels. The protagonist of the story is Akiko Sonoyama (園山千晶), freelancer who finds herself in the middle of a murder mystery after the son of the host dies during the dinner right after drinking the wine. The game uses live-action videos and actors and shows the player protagonist in 3rd-person during investigation, similar to other games of such era, such as The Beast Within or Phantasmagoria 2. During gameplay, the full-screen videos appear in the center of the screen with surrounding window showing various action icons and game progress. While the player character appears during cut-scenes and dialogues, navigating environment is done using 1st-person perspective. During dialogues player has a list of questions one can ask with replies being a set of live-action videos of certain character addressing the player. 15 years after the 3DO game release, the PSP remake with the same title was released. The main difference there is that live actors have all been removed and characters were replaced with silhouettes and game interface changed to look like a mystery visual novel but with a selectable actions such as talk or inquire which make the game less of a typical visual novel and only resemble it in graphical presentation by using static backgrounds with dialogue text over it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74zi.jpg'),(6955,'Senran Kagura: Peach Beach Splash - Sexy Soaker Edition','2018-03-07','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The digital \"Sexy Soaker\" edition includes the same DLC pack as the physical LE containing the Soaking Wet High School Uniform costume, a set of colorful bikini costumes, the Futomaki Roll Bazooka special weapon, a Bebeby pet card, and a special set of skill cards, and a downloadable soundtrack containing the same 47 music tracks included in the soundtrack CD of the physical version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co872f.jpg'),(6956,'LEGO Star Wars II: The Original Trilogy','2006-09-11','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo DS','Nintendo DS port of LEGO Star Wars II: The Original Trilogy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gzn.jpg'),(6957,'Pinball FX3: Star Wars Pinball - The Force Awakens','2017-09-26','Simulator, Pinball','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Based on events from the hotly anticipated Star Warsᵀᴹ: The Force Awakensᵀᴹ movie, players will be able to experience unforgettable moments from the film on two action-packed pinball tables.\n\nTeam up with the Resistance to fight against the First Order alongside Rey, Finn, Poe, Princess Leia and Han Solo in the Star Wars Pinball: The Force Awakens Table!\n\nTake command of the First Order as you travel through hyperspace on board a Star Destroyer and restore order to a galaxy far, far away on the Star Wars Pinball: Might of the First Order table!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/f89zgncnyufbuxyuhaqg.jpg'),(6958,'Fairy Fixer',NULL,'Point-and-click, Visual Novel','Web browser','NSFW parody of Winx Club, you control an unknown male spellcaster as you meet the cast of Winx Club, partake in events leading up to the first half of the first season and romance every female in the cast.\nYou can have erotic interactions with most of the cast of Winx Club aside from the protagonist Bloom and as most of these games work, the event will end with a minigame based on different erotic scenarios with the cast. You have dating sim interactions where you can choose between different dialogue choices and, like most dating sims, the routes for certain characters will end in an event, the aforementioned erotic scenes.\nThere are also time based combat mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d8a.jpg'),(6959,'F1 Manager 2023','2023-07-31','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','F1 Manager 2023 gives you unparalleled control of your chosen F1 team, with rich and detailed management features, refined racing spectacle, deeper authenticity and a brand-new mode that allows you to rewrite the season on your terms.Drive every decision and become the best team on the grid across the official 2023 F1 season and beyond.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jhs.jpg'),(6960,'White Album 2: Mini After Story','2014-12-25','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"White Album 2: Mini After Story\" is a Japanese visual novel, taking place in the same setting as its predecessor with approximately ten years having been elapsed since the events of the first White Album. \"White Album 2: Mini After Story\" covers the after stories for both Kazusa\'s and Setsuna\'s true endings as well as a extra episode for Kazusa\'s normal ending.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bbr.jpg'),(6961,'LEGO Creator','1998-10-26','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game that lets you build with an unlimited number of Lego pieces to construct your very own Lego world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mef.jpg'),(6962,'Sumo','2018-12-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sumo is a multiplayer physics-based party game for up to 4 players, featuring silly spherical characters with unique powerful abilities. Use a combination of mobility and tactics to survive the longest on Arenas which are just as much of a threat as your human or AI-controlled opponents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s2z.jpg'),(6963,'Link\'s Awakening DX HD','2023-12-03','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into the enchanting world of The Legend of Zelda: Link\'s Awakening DX as you\'ve never experienced it before, with this meticulously crafted PC version that breathes new life into this classic adventure. Immerse yourself in the nostalgia of Koholint Island with enhanced graphics and widescreen support, bringing the charming landscapes and characters to vivid detail on your modern PC display.\n\nBut that\'s not all – we\'ve turbocharged the gameplay with high framerate support, ensuring that every sword swing, puzzle solve, and enemy encounter feels smoother and more responsive than ever. Rediscover the magic of this timeless Zelda title with improved performance, letting you explore dungeons, uncover secrets, and engage in epic battles with unparalleled fluidity.\n\nWhether you\'re a long-time fan of Link\'s Awakening or a newcomer to the series, this PC version offers a fresh take on the beloved classic, combining the essence of the original with cutting-edge enhancements. Embark on a journey across the mysterious island, solve puzzles, meet quirky characters, and relive the adventure with a level of polish and finesse that pays homage to the legendary legacy of The Legend of Zelda.\n\nThe game was taken down by Nintendo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7j1h.jpg'),(6964,'DDRMax Dance Dance Revolution','2002-10-28','Music','PlayStation 2','DDRMAX will have you working up a sweat to over 65 songs. The 100+ minutes of music include licensed tracks, fresh dance hits, and cool new songs exclusive to the North American release. DDRMAX delivers never-before-seen in-game videos, new gameplay options, blistering 60-frames per second frame rates and the largest song library in franchise history. Further enhancing the gameplay experience is the introduction of the FREEZE ARROW option that freezes on-screen arrows and forces you to modify your dance steps thus increasing complexity and adding a twist to the routine. Popular gameplay options that return in DDRMAX are the Edit Mode that enables you to customize your own dance steps, and the special Work Out mode that tracks the number of calories burned with every move.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p9j.jpg'),(6965,'Starship 1','1976-12-31','Arcade','Arcade','The object of Starship 1 is to destroy alien spacecraft while maneuvering through star and asteroid fields. The game uses a first person perspective on a black-and-white monitor. Compared to common arcade games of the time, Starship 1 was comparatively advanced, but used quite a bit of analog technology that would become less common in arcade games in following years.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rezqtqaq0dem3v9vo69y.jpg'),(6966,'NFL GameDay 2000','1999-08-30','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation','The world champion Denver Broncos approach the line-of-scrimmage, the quarterback takes the snap, he feigns left then delivers the delay hand-off to Terrell Davis, who skirts right, turns on the speed hitting the hole between the offensive tackle and the center and explodes into mid-field for a 23 yard gain. Well in this scenario, the quarterback is not the retired John Elway, but his replacement Bubby Brister, and the game is not a live broadcast but another go at 989 Studio\'s NFL GameDay 2000. The 2000 edition features more balanced plays, better CPU AI (including a pre-snap AI scheme), and more than 200 new motion captured animations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/v9nksfdgavcwmmvnpezl.jpg'),(6967,'No Rules: Get Phat','2001-11-25','Platform, Sport','Game Boy Advance','One Eye Jack, a badass little skate fiend and leader of the No Rules posse, must stop an alien invasion of his local hangouts. To achieve his goal, he must board like a pro, be a dead-eye shot with his slingshot and alien slime gun, and grind the rails of social irresponsibility-all in the name of preserving his lifestyle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sdge8qvais2lqcyscruk.jpg'),(6968,'Marvel\'s Guardians of the Galaxy: Cosmic Deluxe Edition','2021-10-26','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Fire up a wild ride across the cosmos with a fresh take on Marvel’s Guardians of the Galaxy. In this action-adventure game, you are Star-Lord leading the unpredictable Guardians from one explosion of chaos to the next. You got this. Probably.\n\nThe Cosmic Deluxe Edition includes:\n- Marvel\'s Guardians of the Galaxy\n- SteelBook Case\n- Sun-Lord Outfit for Star-Lord (Early Unlock)\n- City-Lord Outfit for Star-Lord (Early Unlock)\n- Marvel\'s Guardians of the Galaxy: The Hits - Original Video Game Soundtrack (Digital Download)\n- Marvel\'s Guardians of the Galaxy: The Art of the Game Mini Artbook (Hardback)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3grj.jpg'),(6969,'Farming Simulator 19: Premium Edition','2020-11-12','Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Become a modern farmer in the most complete farming experience ever. The Premium Edition contains the multi-million seller game Farming Simulator 19 and a harvest of additional content to help you develop your farm in solo or online with your friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kdp.jpg'),(6970,'Innocent Life: A Futuristic Harvest Moon','2006-05-27','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PlayStation Portable','Life is good for the residents of Heartflame Island, especially since new robots and automated machines do almost all of the work. But technology is a tool--not an answer to all problems. Maybe that\'s why everyone is a little uneasy about the old stories of strange magic and a prediction that Flame Mountain will erupt and destroy everything. That\'s why Dr. Hope, a caring and wise old scholar has sent you, his son on a journey to the ancient ruins to try and run a farm. It is your father\'s dream that you will unlock the secrets of the ancient ruins and find the meaning of \"life\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26oy.jpg'),(6971,'Deep Under','2024-04-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DEEP UNDER is a grim visual novel about how an ordinary camping trip with friends can turn into a real nightmare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wbj.jpg'),(6972,'Sassy Cybergirl','2023-07-14','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immerse yourself in a world filled with stunning cyber-girls, dazzling graphics and relaxing music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sk9.jpg'),(6973,'The Reaper','2013-07-15','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98f5.jpg'),(6974,'Rhem','2002-12-31','Puzzle, Racing, Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rhem is an adventure game in which the player explores a barren, maze-like landscape of water ponds, walkways, and brick buildings with the aid of a partial map. The game has several puzzles involving machines and symbols.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hed.jpg'),(6975,'Metathrone','2008-12-04','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Metathrone combines dynamic FPS and stealth-action in an alternative anime universe which is home to two races: developed and advanced humans co-exist with the people of Alta, who have chosen a different evolutionary path.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xfc.jpg'),(6976,'Dead Motherland: Zombie Co-op','2020-09-21','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A co-op top down shooter about zombie apocalypse in Russia. Explore russian locations - cities, villages, industrial zones. Enjoy the dark, realistic atmosphere. Shoot from a russian weapons. Run from hords of fast bloodthirsty zombies! Play alone or in a co-op for 4!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o8k.jpg'),(6977,'Empty War',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','\"You\'re the best warrior in your planet. Now your race want to conquert everything, and you\'re the only one to stop them.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gsh.jpg'),(6978,'Ender Magnolia: Bloom in the Mist','2025-01-22','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Decades after the Rain of Death, a new journey begins in the Land of Fumes, where mystical powers lie beneath the earth. The kingdom’s desire for conquest led to the creation of the Homunculi, machine-like artificial life forms prepared to execute the king’s will. A recent resource-harvesting mission gone awry caused toxic vapors to emerge from underground, driving both man and machine to feral madness.\n\nAs the Homonculi devolve into dangerous creatures, guide Lilac –- an “Attuner” with the power to purify those infected by the fumes — on a quest to save the kingdom. With the help of friendly machines and spirits who fight in Lilac’s stead, fend off mechanized legions of lunging carcasses, cannonball-firing corpses and chainsaw-wielding goblins terrorizing the land.\n\nTurn foes into friends by exorcizing corruption from enemy bosses. Wield their powers to add 30 different abilities to Lilac’s combat repertoire in an enhanced battle system where she can equip up to four special abilities at once. Improve Lilac’s odds of surviving this hunt for lost memories by leveling up attack strength, HP, and armor.\n\nExplore the depths, heights and far corners of the kingdom for lore-filled relics. Collect and trade gold for upgraded items at the Blacksmith’s storefront. Combine story fragments from the kingdom’s fleeing inhabitants with Lilac’s forgotten memories. Seek the truth in an atmospheric hand-drawn setting set to the soothing serenades of returning musical group Mili (Ghost in the Shell, Goblin Slayer) with a brand new original soundtrack available for purchase at launch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gk1.jpg'),(6979,'Galaga Legions','2008-08-20','Shooter','Xbox 360','Galaga Legions is an Xbox Live Arcade exclusive video game created by Namco Bandai Games. The title was developed by the same team who created Pac-Man Championship Edition. This game is also included in the Namco Museum Virtual Arcade collection, and in Pac-Man & Galaga Dimensions for Nintendo 3DS. A DX version of the game was released on Xbox Live Arcade as part of the Namco Generations series on June 29, 2011, with the PlayStation Network version released in August 2, 2011.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xycfvlt9bffob0phxrop.jpg'),(6980,'Nightmare Creatures','1998-11-01','Adventure','Nintendo 64, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','The story behind Nightmare Creatures draws upon gothic horror elements of the 19th century. The story begins in 1666, when a devil-worshipping cult called the Brotherhood of Hecate were conducting sinister experiments in London so as to take over the city and then the world. The Brotherhood tried to develop an elixir that would endow them with superhuman powers. However, rather than creating their intended superhumans, their experiments created only grotesque monsters. When they decided to use these creatures as an army of conquest, one of their number, Samuel Pepys, set their headquarters on fire, resulting in the First Great Fire of London. The game takes place in 1834 when London falls victim to several evil occurrences. Monster sightings are reported along with news of people mutating into ungodly creatures, and that the dead are waking from their graves and walking amongst the living. All of London is in a panic and vulnerable to the schemes of Adam Crowley, a mad scientist and occultist enlisting the help of the Brotherhood.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j7q.jpg'),(6981,'Black Desert: Conqueror Edition','2020-08-13','Sin género','Xbox One','Black Desert supports backwards-compatibility on Xbox Series X|S.\n\nBlack Desert: Conqueror Edition includes the following:\n- Black Desert (Full Game)\n- Conqueror Edition Item Pack: Value Pack (90 Days), Pearl Box - 3,000, Inventory +16 Expansion Coupon, Secret Book of Old Moon (15 Days), Horse Emblem: Tier 7 White Horse (Female), [Event] Premium Outfit Box, Polar Bear, Hedgehog, Wizard Gosphy, Trainer\'s Flute (Permanent), Contract: [Transaction Maid] Fairy Irene, Pearl Shop 20% DC Coupon\n\nNote: The item package included in the bundle will only be sent to the server that corresponds to the region where the product is purchased.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i8j.jpg'),(6982,'Super Cup Finals','1993-06-05','Sport','Arcade','A soccer game with a perspective playing field. Play against the computer or other human players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co835r.jpg'),(6983,'Obergenie',NULL,'Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Arcade, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As simple as Sudoku, as tactical as chess!\nThis fast-paced arcade puzzle game will get your gray cells firing. One mistake can make the difference between victory and defeat as you take on ever new brain teasers alone or against an opponent!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o2d.jpg'),(6984,'Onizuka Katsuya Super Virtual Boxing: Shin Kentou-ou Densetsu','1993-11-26','Sport','Super Famicom','Onizuka Katsuya Super Virtual Boxing ~Shin Kentou Ou Densetsu~ is a boxing video game, developed by Sting Entertainment and published by SOFEL, which was released exclusively in Japan in 1993. It was licensed and endorsed by Katsuya Onizuka, a former WBA Super Flyweight champion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sbm6e3f74scxg7yglnhp.jpg'),(6985,'Hellseed','2022-11-30','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hellseed is a first person horror adventure with puzzles and some action elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y4l.jpg'),(6986,'Starman\'s VR Experience','2018-02-20','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience Starman\'s amazing journey through our solar system in Virtual Reality. See a \'live\' view from the cherry red sports car or move in time to see future events.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(6987,'Rui ha Tomo wo Yobu','2013-09-26','Visual Novel','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gcp.jpg'),(6988,'A Clockwork Ley-Line: Kagerou ni Samayou Majo','2017-04-27','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','A Clockwork Ley-Line: The Borderline of Dusk\n\nIn a mysterious school where day and night are two separate worlds, a mismatched trio works to resolve magic-related incidents.\n\nMichiru is a newly enrolled first-year student at a boarding school with a notably large clock tower, located deep in the mountains. Unfortunately, on his first day of school, he gets caught up in some sudden trouble, and accidentally breaks an expensive-looking statue.\n\nIn order to compensate for the broken statue, the principal orders him and the boy who caused the incident to work for the school’s “Bureau for the Investigation of Special Affairs.”\n\nWhen they arrive at the Bureau’s headquarters, a room situated in the school’s enormous underground library, a girl is waiting for them there with an apathetic look on her face.\n\nThe girl informs the confused pair of the situation: Magic exists in this school.\n\nWhen the clock tower chimes, the “Realm of Night” appears, and merges with the school building. The Bureau’s job is to take care of the supernatural problems that arise. And so, Michiru struggles to protect the school from troublesome magical items known as “Mists”…\n\nA Clockwork Ley-Line: Zanei no Yoru ga Akeru Toki\n\nMichiru and Ushio continue to spend their days solving problems at Tenbinruri Academy as part of the special investigation office, otherwise known as ‘Tokusa’. One day, a foreign girl named Adelheid came to seek their help in looking for her grandmother’s memento. Along the way, will they find out more about the link between the day and night worlds?\n\nA Clockwork Ley-Line: Asagiri ni Chiru Hana\n\nThis is the third game and finale of UnisonShift Blossom’s magic mystery Ley-Line series. The ‘night world’ crumbled and their students vanished. Mitsuyoshi thought that the cause might have been a fire that happened at the school 20 years ago, and began to investigate this incident in order to reunite with his friend Kotarou who had disappeared as a ‘night school student’. Meanwhile, the school principal who had also vanished secretly planned to bring back the night world from the other side. All of the remaining mysteries of the school will finally be brought to light.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co312a.jpg'),(6989,'Saurian','2017-08-02','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Saurian is a video game project focused on living as a dinosaur in a dynamic open world through intense, survival-based gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24rt.jpg'),(6990,'Monolithic Candle Chapter.2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fvq8cn6djdsmzmsf21kw.jpg'),(6991,'Shinobi Rising','2023-04-26','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Shinobi Rising, the exciting new game set in the Japanese-inspired cyberpunk universe of Katana-Ra. In this thrilling adventure, you play as a shinobi who must solve a murder mystery and discover the culprit behind the death of an innocent child heiress.\n\nAs you navigate your way through the streets Clan Kata’s village, the entire game takes place across one single night and you\'ll need to use all your cunning and skill to survive. Uncover clues and solve puzzles and inch closer to uncovering the truth behind the killing. But be warned, this is a village where not everyone is what they seem.\n\nWho will you strike from the shadows?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57br.jpg'),(6992,'Sly Spy','1990-12-31','Racing, Arcade','Arcade, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','It is an action arcade game released by Data East in 1989, and is inspired by the James Bond movie franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co318b.jpg'),(6993,'Insane Rules','2023-03-17','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When you live alone at home, you suddenly encounter all kinds of strange things, such as hair in the water pipe, strange figures on TV, eyeballs in the refrigerator, and so on. What\'s the matter?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p1k.jpg'),(6994,'Good Morning, Radio','2017-05-29','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','In school I had the first shift on the student radio station.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tfp.jpg'),(6995,'Bacta','1992-02-04','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series','Jinpachi Tanaka is a paranormal investigator who possesses the powers of detecting and fighting demonic creatures. As these demons are usually female and pretty, they can easily pose as humans, and Jinpachi must use somewhat unorthodox techniques to tell friend from foe. Jinpachi and his employees must cooperate with the police and avert grave dangers posed by an angry female demon who has sworn revenge against the hero.\n\nBacta is a Japanese-style adventure game. The player is presented with a text menu containing verbs, most of which lead to sub-menus with objects. Some of these commands are context-specific, while others (\"Look\", \"Talk\", \"Move\", etc.) are present in every situation. Sometimes events must be triggered by repeatedly selecting commands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7137.jpg'),(6996,'Void Pyramid','2016-12-05','Role-playing (RPG)','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Void Pyramid is a post-apocalyptic RPG set in the space-faring Egyptian empire. In the far future, the maniacal Prime Pharaoh rules the wastelands of Earth. Any who oppose him are exiled to the Void Pyramid. This outer space prison is populated by criminals, beasts, and mutants.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v8b.jpg'),(6997,'Horse Reality','2018-10-08','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Web browser','Horse Reality is a free-to-play horse sim with exquisite images, set in the real world with a realistic breeding and colour genetic system. Build your own estate and breed horses to perfect the bloodlines or colours. Travel around the world to gather feral horses and bargain with other players.\n\nParticipate in national and international competitions to win medals. Perform in horse shows to collect rosettes for your horses. Start a club with friends or go to the university to earn a degree and start your own company.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/y0lgoioj0etwcz5cxyei.jpg'),(6998,'De:Fanastasis','2024-04-29','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A full-length RPG that focuses on map exploration, where you can enjoy \"discovery\". A ruined kingdom with countless hidden passages and doors. Peek into the lingering thoughts of the dead to find clues, and expand your search with items from hidden treasure chests. Fragments of information obtained in various places may eventually connect and reveal not only one\'s own memories but also the hidden \"truth.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87bf.jpg'),(6999,'K.C.\'s Crazy Nightmare!','2009-04-05','Arcade','Atari 2600','K.C. has found himself trapped in a Atari 2600 system along with some enslaved O2 zombies! The Atari system maze is deadly, he cannot touch the maze walls, if he does his 02 code will mix with the 2600 code and destroy him!\n\nObjective:\nIncrease your score! Gather Bullets (white dots) to shoot the O2 zombies for 10 points! Gather hidden vitamin tablets (red dash) to slightly protect you against O2 zombies for 1 point! O2 zombies and maze walls may kill you instantly if touched (you may be able to brush by them if you have some resistance given by a vitamin tablet but don\'t count on it every time)! O2 zombies take bullets out of your inventory when they reach a bullet before you do! They take a point out of your score if they reach a vitamin tablet before you do! You can only carry a maximum of 6 bullets at any one time! O2 zombies are sent back to the Graveyard (the center of the maze) whenever one is hit by a bullet, they will not hurt you when they are blue for a short time after they return to the Graveyard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ynk.jpg'),(7000,'River King: A Wonderful Journey','2005-11-16','Role-playing (RPG), Sport','PlayStation 2','Hook, line and sinker, you\'re part of a long line of fishing folk. From father to son and mother to daughter, knowing where and what to fish was always part of your family mangrove tree. Only one thing is missing from the long list of accomplishments, a fish that shook hooks for generations: The River King. Perhaps today, perhaps this cast, you\'ll feel the strum of a tight line as the legendary giant pulls you into angling immortality. Play as one of four family members. Assist villagers and other shoreline folk. Win it all in fishing and cooking contests. Take on crafty critters in tricky trivia challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6t3v.jpg'),(7001,'11eyes: Resona Forma','2011-04-15','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7002,'Niplob Adventure',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game pays tribute to the best jump and runs ever made whilst adding its own flaire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rzo.jpg'),(7003,'GT Racing 97','1997-12-31','Racing','DOS','GT style racing features in this racer, which tends more towards arcade than simulation. Cars include the Predator and the Hurricane, each with their own strengths and weaknesses. The action can be viewed from inside or outside the car.\n\nWhen starting the game for the first time you can take part in a training or start in a championship. The practice will be done on one of the two initially available tracks. The other tracks are closed. To gain access to those tracks you must first complete one of the championships. Championships consists of a number of races in different countries, taking in road and asphalt settings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kur.jpg'),(7004,'Riki Densetsu','2012-12-12','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Nintendo 3DS','Spin-off of the Kunio-kun series starring Kunio\'s friend, Riki.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jekmnl4pn5r03kzbupbr.jpg'),(7005,'Assassin\'s Creed III: Deluxe Edition','2012-10-18','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, Xbox 360','The year is 1775. The American colonies are about to revolt. You are Connor, an assassin who has sworn to secure liberty for his people and his nation. To do so, you will hunt your enemies across a staggeringly large, open, and realistic world. You will unleash your lethal skills in a violent quest that will take you from chaotic city streets to blood-soaked battlefields in the hostile American wilderness and beyond. You will meet legendary heroes of American history, and together you will conspire to annihilate those who threaten Liberty itself.\n\nWhether you use your predatory instincts to kill silently, or your fearsome arsenal to kill openly, one thing is clear: the world that the Assassins live in has become far more deadly. And so have you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jbp.jpg'),(7006,'Onraid','2017-04-18','Shooter, Platform, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Onraid is a challenging 2D shooter game, where you are free to develop your own play style and tactics to destroy your enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qw0.jpg'),(7007,'Dinobreak: Couch Co-Op Collection','2025-03-15','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','LIMITED TIME BUNDLE THROUGH MARCH 31st, 2025! Dinosaurs return to retro survival horror in this nightmare collection!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ktf.jpg'),(7008,'Vagabond','2023-05-01','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore procedurally generated living worlds in this 2D sandbox RPG. Meet hundreds of characters in cities, complete quests, craft powerful items, buy and furnish your home or fight monsters in dungeons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6eqy.jpg'),(7009,'Battle Bugs','1994-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, PlayStation','In this unconventional real-time strategy game, control a fearsome army of stink bugs, cockroaches, lightning bugs, ants and more in a miniature, pun-filled warzone! 56 battles with 22 types of Battle Bug await you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lzr.jpg'),(7010,'PuPu\'s Adventure Park','2023-07-18','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build an Adventure Park from the ground up! The PuPu clan had just rented a new \"playground\" from the Dark Goblins. Manage the park, construct park facilities, and grow your clan to serve the expansion of the Park for \"hero\" customers summoned from other planets!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6eqm.jpg'),(7011,'Football Director DS','2008-12-28','Simulator, Sport','Nintendo DS','Designed by veteran football management game designer Roger Womack (whose credits include Championship Manager, FA Premier League Manager and Football World Manager) and developed by Bradford-based Four Door Lemon, Football Director DS brings all of the tactical and strategic depth that\'s expected of a contemporary football management game to Nintendo\'s handheld console.\n\nTaking complete control of his or her favourite team, the Football Director player grows and moulds a squad by judicious dealings in the transfer market; drawing from the game\'s database of around 3,800 players drawn from all of the major leagues across the globe. This squad can then be developed into a winning unit using the game\'s exhaustive training and tactics functions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tk4cfdeaxl1zxk7adysj.jpg'),(7012,'Poltergeist Watcher','2024-05-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Can you survive the night watching the cursed house?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85fj.jpg'),(7013,'Blue Sabers: Early Mission',NULL,'Shooter, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Use conventional and three types of special weapons to overcome difficult situations. Take control of the battlefield with support aircraft! Long-established STG development team, Blue&White, the first new one in 13 years, and a new origin!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31lq.jpg'),(7014,'Realms of Magic','2017-12-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Realms of Magic is a 2D sandbox rpg set in a classic western fantasy universe. Create your character and live it\'s life. Gather resources, craft items and build your base. Explore the world, complete quests and crawl through dungeons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27cl.jpg'),(7015,'Caper in the Castro','1989-06-30','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Mac','Caper in the Castro is the first known LGBT video game. The player assumes the role of a lesbian detective investigating the disappearance of a drag queen in the Castro neighborhood of San Francisco.\n\nThe game was distributed by BBS, with donations requested \"to an AIDS-related charity of your choice for whatever amount you feel is appropriate\". It was eventually commercially released as Murder on Mainstreet with all LGBT content removed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hab.jpg'),(7016,'NetherEx','2016-07-27','Simulator, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','NetherEx is a mod for Minecraft which largely reworks the Nether, adding four new biomes, each designed to fill a specific purpose with a unique approach within the dimension. The biomes are populated with new mobs, decorated with new blocks, and filled with over a dozen new items.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61ff.jpg'),(7017,'StickSpinner','2023-09-17','Platform, Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Challenging Action\" meets \"Party Game\" for up to four players! Introducing our latest game where players navigate using rotating sticks and control their jumps based on stick angles. The unique feature that sets this game apart is the \"Jump\" mechanic, which also presents its greatest challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70c2.jpg'),(7018,'Crime Scene Cleaner','2025-04-17','Simulator, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Once you get tangled with the mob, you will forever be a part of the mob. At least they pay a decent salary and all you have to do is clean up after their dirty work, but you know what you’re doing. So clean crime scenes, outsmart the police and get ready for the next mission.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vyd.jpg'),(7019,'Pachillinko','2022-02-01','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pachillinko is a mix of japanese Pachinko and western Plinko style game, set in neon synthwave design with some retro feeling of 80s. Relaxing mouse-only clicking gameplay allows you to sit back and just chill...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k7o.jpg'),(7020,'Husk','2017-02-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Husk is a purebred FPP horror inspired by the most classical representatives of the genre. Discover Shivercliff - a daunting town where you uncover the ominous and tantalizing plot. Face the worst nightmares, solve mysteries and survive the devouring darkness in order to find your family.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24wj.jpg'),(7021,'The Mortuary Assistant: Definitive Edition','2024-08-02','Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Darkstone Digital is bringing more scares, more lore, and an endless embalming-only mode for those more interested in Rebecca\'s day-to-day work without the worry of being scared on August 2nd with The Mortuary Assistant: Definitive Edition!\n\nAlong with this free update to owners of Mortuary Assistant on PC and Nintendo Switch, the Definitive Edition is also going to be available on consoles! The Mortuary Assistant: Definitive Edition comes to PlayStation and Xbox on the same date with some new content too!\n- Embalming only mode - embalm unlimited bodies\n- New Haunt Events\n- Additional Lore\n- New bodies to embalm\n- New Valentine\'s Day seasonal event (Stop by the mortuary in February)\n- New achievements\n- Multiple Bug and Stability Fixes\n- Performance Improvements','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mjs.jpg'),(7022,'Mega Man Star Force: Dragon','2007-08-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo DS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co204a.jpg'),(7023,'Star Wars: Yoda Stories','1997-03-31','Puzzle, Adventure','Game Boy Color, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grab your lightsaber and get ready for terrific Star Wars adventuring in Yoda Stories, the newest in a series of easy-to-play Desktop Adventures from LucasArts. Join Luke Skywalker as he trains to become a Jedi with Yoda, then harness the Force and cross the galaxy to meet exotic aliens, collect stange devices and weapons and deal the Galactic Empire one crippling blow after another - all within an hour!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74jd.jpg'),(7024,'Split Second',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','A recreation of an LED game, with no LEDs','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7025,'Sherlock Holmes: Crimes & Punishments','2014-09-29','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Crimes & Punishments lets you become the greatest detective of all time, Sherlock Holmes! Solve six high-profile, gripping and varied cases: murders, disappearances, spectacular thefts and sensational cases will sometimes take you to the realms of the fantastic in this stunning game of investigation in the fine tradition of the Conan Doyle novels. Crimes & Punishments offers you a large degree of freedom to make moral choices that go beyond merely seeing that justice is done: your decisions have a real influence on the game both in terms of your character’s reputation and the consequences that arise in a realistic and sometimes unexpected way.\n\nWill you listen to your moral sense, or will you impartially enforce justice?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1sqz.jpg'),(7026,'Doloc Town','2025-05-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is a pixel art simulation game & shooting game, it has cute picture, semi-open world story system, rich and deep game system. The story is witty, lighthearted and casual, you can build your own farm, tackle cute Npcs, catch small animals, learn food recipes or fight monster in jungle-land','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s2f.jpg'),(7027,'Search All: Tools','2024-02-28','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Is a hidden object game in which you need to find all the tools (mainly construction tools) in a large location. The tools will be located in a variety of places, from the most prominent to the most barely noticeable places','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7uq5.jpg'),(7028,'Lacey\'s Flash Games','2025-12-31','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','These are the REAL girls’ games. In the mid 2000s, Charlie (Charchar887), discovers the Laceys\'s Flash Games and their disturbing secrets. Step into the virtual world to uncover the whereabouts of the missing website creator, Rocio Yani, and explore all the games and activities with Lacey!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ia8.jpg'),(7029,'Planet Zoo: Eurasia Animal Pack','2023-12-13','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wrap up warm and explore the heart of Eurasia with Planet Zoo: Eurasia Animal Pack! Immerse yourself in vast landscapes and untamed beauty as you welcome captivating species to your zoos, including seven habitat species and one exhibit reptile.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i2x.jpg'),(7030,'Wayne\'s World','1993-06-30','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wayne\'s World is an adventure game based on the movie with the same name. The game itself is a classic point and click adventure, and should not be confused with the platform game based on the movie.\n\nYou play both Wayne and Garth, and you can switch between them at any time. The plot is simple; In an attempt to save their tv-show, Wayne and Garth decide to hold a pizza-thon (a charity show with a pizza-theme) in order to raise money. In order to be able to hold the pizza-thon Wayne and Garth must embark on several quests to collect items and hire people they need for the show. The adventure includes participating in babe-jeopardy, joining a biker\'s gang and baking pizza. The graphics are in 2D and the sound contains several samples from the movie.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8l3z.jpg'),(7031,'Re-Exit','2024-11-22','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Re-Exit, a psychological horror, spot the anomaly game that challenges your perception and attention to detail. Trapped in a temporal loop, your mission is to observe your surroundings carefully and report any anomalies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kqy.jpg'),(7032,'Dingletopia: Nation Under Siege (by Orcs)','2020-07-15','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a nice sunny day in Dingletopia and Prince Dingle Dorfen and his wise adviser Forlorn Gumpel are slurping up the gorpulsen and planning their next conquest. Their life of luxury is soon interrupted however when Orcs burst into the lands with rattling sabers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3omj.jpg'),(7033,'Outbreak 2030','2023-06-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','2030, The year Russia decided to end the war with a powerful weapon, as they claimed. Shortly after using that weapon, Russia went dark. Ceasing all communications and locking its border. That\'s when The U.S. sent a task force for infiltration and reconnaissance. To find out what went wrong.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co650r.jpg'),(7034,'Zorse','2024-10-10','Puzzle, Strategy','Web browser','Combine two phrases into one to find a mash-up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a65.jpg'),(7035,'Cryptical Path','2025-01-29','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cryptical Path is a thrilling rogue-lite dungeon crawler that pushes the boundaries of the genre. Play the Architect, build your own path, and navigate an ever-changing labyrinth you\'ve been summoned in.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c1z.jpg'),(7036,'Stunt Driver Collection',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Perform crazy and spectacular stunts!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aic.jpg'),(7037,'Akai Suna Ochiru Tsuki','2013-04-13','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','A otome game for Vita and PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21ws.jpg'),(7038,'LEGO Battles: Ninjago','2011-04-12','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Nintendo DS','Build your army, battle your enemies and become a master of Spinjitzu as you recover powerful ninja weapons and restore the world\'s harmony in LEGO Battles: Ninjago! Deploy Hero troops through exciting missions and adventures to defeat the sinister Skulkin forces, play as the bad guys and face-off against ninjas of Spinjitzu, or challenge a friend in thrilling multiplayer battles to see whose army ranks supreme.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4o8h.jpg'),(7039,'Zooma','2020-01-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immerse in the universe of a magic mind-teaser in VR. Do you have what it takes to make your way through all the riddles and save the world in time? Check out what happens if you mix shooting, puzzles and classic match-three in virtual reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lpi.jpg'),(7040,'Mistaken',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The world is lost to eldritch mist. No heroes, no grand purpose—only survival. Build, fight, and carve your path through treacherous lands where the remnants of humanity and horrors beyond reason now roam. Survive… or be Mistaken.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jaw.jpg'),(7041,'Joust 2: Survival of the Fittest','1987-01-01','Platform','Arcade','Joust 2: Survival of the Fittest is an arcade game developed by Williams Electronics and released in 1986. It is a sequel to Williams\' 1982 game Joust. Like its predecessor, Joust 2 is a platform game that features two-dimensional (2D) graphics. The player uses a button and joystick to control a knight riding a flying ostrich. The object is to progress through levels by defeating groups of enemy knights riding buzzards. Joust 2 features improved audio-visuals and gameplay elements absent from the original.\n\nThe game uses more advanced hardware than the original Joust, allowing for the new elements. John Newcomer led development again, which began to create a conversion kit that allowed arcade owners to convert the cabinet into another game. Williams chose a vertically oriented screen for the kit as a result of the design\'s popularity at the time. Released during the waning days of the golden age of arcade games, Joust 2 did not achieve the success that Joust reached. The game was later released on home consoles as part of arcade compilations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/im61uk6v9jlhbbrkbiwc.jpg'),(7042,'Quiz Quest',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Quiz/Trivia, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Quiztal Games introduces Quiz Quest: a mind-stretching, collaborative quizcapade!\n\nTeam up with friends and family, using your smartphones as your controllers, and put your heads together as you journey to achieve the rank of Master Quizards.\n\nThe fallen knight Sir Answerlot needs you to take up his failed quest to rid the kingdom of its most hated tormentor: the evil dragon Spontanius the Combustor. You will need to keep your wits about you as you encounter many allies and enemies, make many crucial decisions and answer many, many quiz questions along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7790.jpg'),(7043,'Desert Survival','2018-07-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a survival game from third person perspective, in which players search for resources in a desert to build their own base and ward off invaders.\nIn this game, the gun accessories can be freely replaced. Destroying enemy can get upgraded to learn new skills.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7044,'One Last Crane','2022-07-05','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','One Last Crane is a visual novel centered on Yuuki Murakami, a boy who has a brain tumor. After a long year of treatment without any positive results, Yuuki asks for his final wish: to return to his hometown and fulfill his promise to meet again with his childhood friend, Saki Nishimura...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h2x.jpg'),(7045,'Fall Guys: Pegwin Party Pack','2022-10-17','Platform','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Grab this bundle to make every Round a Pegwin Pursuit!\n\nIncludes:\nPegwinner (Whole Costume)\nPegwinging It (Whole Costume)\nPegwhimsy (Whole Costume)\n1000 x Show-Bucks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c1l.jpg'),(7046,'Flat Heroes','2016-09-08','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Flat Heroes is a minimalist super intense local multiplayer game with special care put into the game-feel and polishing of every detail in a trendy graphic experience. The game includes multiple cooperative and competitive modes for 1-4 players and features squares!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wip.jpg'),(7047,'Memory Match Saga: Expansion Pack 8',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Memory Match Saga - Expansion Pack 7 - A classic memory game that will improve your memory and brain power. You can spend the pleasant and leisure time with the game, meanwhile you can test and improve your memory and attention, whether you are a child or an adult. With this DLC you will unlock Post-apocalyptic memory theme.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7048,'League of Tanks: Global War','2019-01-10','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure','Android, iOS','Every player begins with a level 1 Tank, there are many ways to increase the level of Tanks buying or farming, the game offers for new players the chance to obtain at least a level 4 tank which Is good to reach the max level king. it\'s all simple to understand inside and also how to add empowerement tools for win easily also against top players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d1e.jpg'),(7049,'Endless Road','2018-09-10','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Endless Road is a roguelike card game where the player can use a variety of equipment and skills to defeat their enemy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fx5.jpg'),(7050,'Shelloween','2022-12-06','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','This is my second hack, with some cool chocolate mechanics all around the shell, I`ll hope you enjoy to play it','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aae.jpg'),(7051,'Creature Summon: Showdown Moment','2024-01-17','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A creative first-person card game that simulates VR perspective and controls. 3D spatial UI allows players to throw cards to any location based on their hand speed using the mouse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qxz.jpg'),(7052,'Bike Dirt Extreme 3D',NULL,'Racing','Sin plataforma','Ride, stunt, and soar: become the ultimate dirt bike champion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91wu.jpg'),(7053,'The Hugo Trilogy','2014-08-19','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take Hugo through an animated \"classic\" style adventure, solving puzzles, finding hidden objects and outwitting the maniac hosts of the haunted house to rescue Hugo\'s sweetheart Penelope.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jmm.jpg'),(7054,'Zombie Killtime','2015-08-04','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Zombie Killtime is a fast-paced, action-packed, zombie platform shooter with 4 player coop gameplay. Survive against endless waves of zombies with your friends as you upgrade your guns and earn new ones.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pwiaq0cgup5bsnyjiz4x.jpg'),(7055,'Hello Kitty Dream Village','2021-07-10','Simulator','Android, iOS','Originally launched in Japan in 2017, rolled out to Taiwan, Hong Kong, and Macao in 2020, and now available in English: Hello Kitty Dream Village is a supercute fashion and interior design game based around the Sanrio characters. Players can change their avatar\'s outfit, decorate their room as well as interact with other online players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s6h.jpg'),(7056,'Roly-Polys World Tour','1997-12-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u8b.jpg'),(7057,'Life after Death','2022-09-29','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you remember the scares that chased you in childhood? How did your limbs shake with fear, take your breath away, and you couldn\'t do anything about it? I invite you to live it all over again!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5iwb.jpg'),(7058,'Telling Lies','2020-04-28','Point-and-click, Simulator, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Four private lives. One big lie. Search through secretly recorded video conversations to discover the truth. The successor to the acclaimed Her Story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ryq.jpg'),(7059,'Silversoul Orphanage','2023-03-15','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Silversoul Orphanage is a standalone realistic urban exploration simulation. A VHS Found Footage Urbex Sim horror with emphasis on atmosphere, unpredictability, realism and a non-linear design with subtle scares, focusing on the feeling of being stalked during an urban exploration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7q19.jpg'),(7060,'Planet Zoo: Conservation Pack','2022-06-21','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Introducing the Planet Zoo: Conservation Pack! Learn about the critical role zoos take in helping the planet as you expand your own zoo with five endangered animals: Przewalski’s horse, amur leopard, scimitar-horned oryx, siamang, and axolotl.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b0q.jpg'),(7061,'Spinner Invaders 2: A Mad Revenge',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Shoot your way through a thrilling action adventure of 120 waves in 4 different game modes while fighting against waves of enemies and 12 extreme bosses. Save the world from a new mystery threat by yourself or with a friend locally and play 10 different Challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fp0.jpg'),(7062,'Lyne','2014-01-01','Music, Puzzle, Indie','Linux, Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Deceptively simple. Infinitely complex. Lyne is a minimalist puzzle game that will knot your brain as it calms your soul.\n\nConnect the shapes. Fill the board. Lose yourself in the interflowing paths of Lyne.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l2u.jpg'),(7063,'Togainu no Chi True Blood','2008-05-29','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','Togainu no Chi True Blood is a Japanese BL visual novel. Can you help Akira, numb from a lifetime of violence and isolation, forge the bonds he needs to survive a ruined Tokyo\'s deadly underworld? \'\nTrue Blood is a re-released version of Togainu no Chi, featuring new CGs, characters, and scenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72g4.jpg'),(7064,'Scarlet Hollow: Episode 1','2020-09-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The free-to-play first episode of a horror-mystery game with dark humor and hand-drawn art from award-winning graphic novelist Abby Howard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kqs.jpg'),(7065,'Forza Horizon 4: 1979 Talbot Sunbeam Lotus',NULL,'Racing','Sin plataforma','1979 Talbot Sunbeam Lotus','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7066,'Transporter Manager Tycoon','2021-04-02','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Transporter Manager Tycoon you will control your own carrier, you will manage freight, buy new trucks and even expand your carrier to a distributor. Start small, and with a lot of dedication and effort become one of the biggest carriers in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7oy1.jpg'),(7067,'Modo Defence','2023-03-11','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Modo Defense is a strategy tower defense game. Spin yut, similar to dice, to obtain various resources and summon or strengthen towers. You can customize your tower however you like. Specialize in multi-attack or strong one-by-one! And we have to stop the demons coming in. How far can you stop it?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co662s.jpg'),(7068,'MoonFall: Butterfly Lovers',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','2021 Galgame popular works The story is based on Chinese legends Before the moon fell, Spending time with beautiful girl Kaori. Whether to live in a dreamlike utopia, Or face the harsh reality. Love, self, future, all in the world of Moonfall','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ljt.jpg'),(7069,'Sea of Thieves: Forsaken Shores','2018-09-27','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Forsaken Shores is the third DLC for Sea of Thieves and features a new eastern region named Devil\'s Roar. The included islands will periodically erupt and shake due to the volcano centered on it. Expect geysers, flying rocks, and water hot enough to kill pirates in the new areas. Because of the boiling water surrounding the volcanic isles, the update also introduced rowboats that players can use to safely reach the shore. These can be found drifting near islands and once acquired - attached to the back of the ships for further use.\n\nThe update also introduces a new merchant quest type called Cargo Runs. Players will have to transport important cargo from one place to another and do it safely. Broken rum bottles, wet cloth, and dead plants are signs of a trip gone bad. Take good care of the cargo until it\'s reached it\'s destination.\n\nOther DLC features include Skeleton Lords and combined item barrels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y9n.jpg'),(7070,'Half-Life 2: VR Mod - Episode Two','2023-04-06','Shooter, Adventure','SteamVR','Prepare for unforeseen consequences as you traverse the White Forest and battle the Combine forces as Gordon Freeman in this community-made adaptation of Episode Two to glorious roomscale Virtual Reality!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b3o.jpg'),(7071,'Fogrest: The Whisper of Harbingers',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fogrest is a 2D pixel adventure game. A fog has descended on the land, monstrous creatures are waiting to attack. Make your way through dark forests and deserted towns to find answers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fiy.jpg'),(7072,'Tails of Iron: Crimson Knight','2023-12-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Includes Exclusive Crimson Knight Set.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tyr.jpg'),(7073,'Grand Theft Auto: Double Pack','2004-05-04','Shooter, Racing, Simulator, Adventure','Xbox, PlayStation 2','The Grand Theft Auto Double-Pack combines the award-winning Grand Theft Auto 3 and Grand Theft Auto: Vice City together in one collectible release. From the dark and seedy streets of Liberty City\'s underworld to the glamorous hedonism of Vice City in the 1980\'s. Two towns, each brimming with limitless delights and degradation, where anything can happen. Two criminal sagas of greed and desperation that will take you into the world of Grand Theft Auto.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tvf.jpg'),(7074,'GuJian 2','2013-08-18','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','GuJian 2 is a Chinese martial arts role-playing game developed by Aurogon. The second installment in the \"Gu Jian Qi Tan\" series of Chinese action RPGs.\n\nIn comparison to its predecessor, the game mechanics have been changed from turn-based to real-time, and it also includes unique features such as constellations and achievements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co277u.jpg'),(7075,'DCS World: Flaming Cliffs 3','2012-11-08','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DCS World: Flaming Cliffs 3 is the next evolution of the Flaming Cliffs series that operates with DCS World. FC3 features the F-15C, A-10A, Su-27, Su-33, MiG-29A, MiG-29S and Su-25. The FC3 aircraft provide an easy learning curve for new players and focuses on a broad range of aircraft rather than a detailed single aircraft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lt6.jpg'),(7076,'Simple 2000 Series Vol. 85: The Sekai Meisaku Gekijou Quiz','2005-08-25','Quiz/Trivia','PlayStation 2','The Sekai Meisaku Gekijou Quiz: The 85th volume of D3\'s Simple 2000 series is a quiz game featuring questions from 22 years of anime, totaling over 23 productions. The game includes over 5000 questions from such properties as Peter Pan no Bouken, Romeo no Aoi Sora, Trap Ikka Monogatari, and Flanders no Inu. Gameplay modes include Memorial Quiz, where you select from 8 works and answer questions set in multiple stages that follow the production\'s storyline, Solo Quiz, where you select from 8 works and 6 genres and work to keep a life meter from reaching zero, and Travel Quiz in which two players answer questions pulled from eight productions simultaneously. The game includes summaries of the original works which provide hints to performing well in the question sessions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tea.jpg'),(7077,'Fantasy Map Simulator','2024-09-04','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fantasy Map Simulator: Create and watch imaginary worlds evolve over centuries. Design maps, simulate nations, and control destinies. See empires rise and fall on your desktop wallpaper. A unique simulation for history buffs and creative minds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mtv.jpg'),(7078,'Rollerboy 2','2000-10-01','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Rollerboy 2 was a classic side-scrolling platformer game developed in Java in the early 2000s. Players controlled a character on rollerblades navigating through various levels filled with obstacles, enemies, and challenges. The game featured smooth gameplay mechanics, colorful graphics, and catchy music, providing an enjoyable experience for players of all ages. With its addictive gameplay and level design, Rollerboy 2 became a beloved title among fans of retro gaming. In an effort by the community to preserve the game, it was resurrected through reverse engineering and can still be found online today for players to enjoy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7z6n.jpg'),(7079,'Jujutsu Kaisen: Cursed Clash - Deluxe Edition','2024-02-02','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Deluxe Edition includes:\n• Jujutsu Kaisen Cursed Clash\n• Hidden Inventory/Premature Death\n• Jujusta 2024','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pj1.jpg'),(7080,'Yandere Simulator 2: The Sequel','2017-02-03','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yandere Simulator 2: The Sequel is a Visual Novel that takes place after the story of the official Yandere Simulator Game, when Yandere-Chan finally killed all of her rivals.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7081,'Berlin 1948','1989-12-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','West Berlin is held hostage by a nuclear device...\n...and you\'ve been sent to find it. You\'re Sam Porter, CIA agent extraordinaire. Or at least you\'d better be. An atomic bomb is set to vaporize West Berlin and time\'s running short. Everyone says you\'re the best undercover man in the agency. Now you have to prove it!\n\nDivided Berlin isn\'t the easiest place to run a covert operation. A Soviet blockade ravages the city, while black marketers run rampant on the Ku\'damm. Foreign agents are everywhere and the citizens don\'t trust strangers. You\'ll need help!\n\nRoam the war-torn street of West Berlin, stopping in bookstores, nightclubs and the cinema to try and unravel the plot that threatens world peace. Taxi through each sector, trading cigarettes, questioning suspects, making friends and enemies, and searching for the doomsday device - and the people who planted it.\n\nViewing cinema newsreels is one way to find clues and enjoy the brilliant graphics in this dramatic adventure.\n\nTalk to citizens, trade with merchants and deal with Black Market leaders - they have the information you need!\n\nTaxi across town using an historically accurate map of 1948 Berlin.\n\nHistory\'s sights and sounds come alive with an audio cassette that syncs to your computer\'s graphic display.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ytw.jpg'),(7082,'Master Key','2024-05-17','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Master key is a top down adventure game with a strong focus on item based exploration and secrets. Embark on a journey to discover what that key could be used for and meet colorful characters !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kpe.jpg'),(7083,'Secret Santa','2016-12-01','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sneak around children, pets, and the elderly as you deliver Christmas joy. Complete the list of deliveries, and have some cookies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jq6.jpg'),(7084,'All Japan Super Bombliss Cup \'95: Dai-1-kai','1995-10-11','Puzzle','Satellaview','The first episode of All Japan Super Bombliss Cup \'95.\n\nAll Japan Super Bombliss Cup \'95 (also Bombliss Cup \'95) is a Downloadable game for the Satellaview that was broadcast between October 11, 1995 and November 21, 1995. The game was presented by Hatris, Yoshi\'s Cookie, and Tetris developer, BPS, and it is a pseudo-sequel to the Tetris variant, Bombliss.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co487t.jpg'),(7085,'Crusader Kings II: Rajas of India','2014-03-25','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Crusader Kings II: Rajas of India is the sixth expansion for the critically praised strategy/RPG Crusader Kings II and will focus on Eastern Persia and India. The expansion Rajas of India extends the map to the east, including the entire Indian subcontinent, and allows you to play as a Hindu, Buddhist or Jain ruler. Can you defend Dharma against foreign invaders and bring order to the subcontinent?\n\nCrusader Kings II explores one of the defining periods in world history in an experience crafted by the masters of Strategy where medieval times is brought to life in this epic game of knights, schemes, and thrones...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yx7.jpg'),(7086,'Megaton Musashi W: Wired - Attire: Yamato - Student Uniform','2024-04-24','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','New Pilot Attire is here to jazz up your wardrobe during sorties!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90h5.jpg'),(7087,'Aces High','2000-05-08','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aces High is a multiplayer game in which three teams fight over domination of the map. The success is measured in ground targets: a team loses when they only have their headquarters left. To capture a target (some have to be simply destroyed), the team has to bring its defenses down and then bring in troops (for example with a C-47). However, this is not enough because - depending on the damage taken - it first has to be built up again. The time this takes depend on various factors, e.g. what other near targets are available, and can be sped up with supply drops by transport aircraft. Available ground installments also have other effects, e.g. the availability of ammo or troops.\n\nThe majority of of the action is fought in the air with World War II aircraft, but there are also ground (e.g. tanks) and naval vehicles available. The matches itself are of a grand scale and can take multiple hours; afterwards the map is reset. Overall the controls are somewhere between simulation and action. Depending on the arena, which can also be crafted with the editor, the exact winning conditions can be slightly different. While the multiplayer matches are subscription-based, there is also a free offline mode for training included.\n\nIn the years after release, the game was under continuous development and saw many minor and major changes. This includes World War I vehicles, a tool to record/replay gameplay footage and changes to the technical framework resulting in updated system requirements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3uf6.jpg'),(7088,'The King of Fighters \'98','2013-05-30','Fighting, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, Neo Geo MVS, Wii, Android, PlayStation, Neo Geo CD','The All-Star dream battle is here at last: It\'s King of Fighters \'98! Here come 38 of your favorite characters from the King of Fighters series. Your favorite characters and teams are back! Filled with new surprises like the Roulette Team Edit and Advantage System, King \'98 will pop your cork with unrelenting excitement!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y8h.jpg'),(7089,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s Franchise Bundle','2015-06-03','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Franchise Bundle, also known as the Franchise Pack and Five Nights at Freddy\'s Bundle, is a compilation pack for multiple Five Nights at Freddy\'s games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co800g.jpg'),(7090,'Permadeath','2024-10-31','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9li4.jpg'),(7091,'My Memory of Us: Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3caw.jpg'),(7092,'Hentai Girls: Sweet Skier','2024-12-26','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Meet over 50 pretty anime girls in this relaxing puzzle game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ajc.jpg'),(7093,'Supercharged Robot Vulkaiser','2015-06-04','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','70s giant robot anime-inspired side-scrolling shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kvj.jpg'),(7094,'Ugo Volt',NULL,'Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Ugo Volt was an action-adventure shooter set in a post-apocalyptic Lisbon in the 22nd century, the world would be at a detriment due to global warming and only Ugo would be able to define the destiny of humanity.\nIt started development in 1999 as an entry to a contest from Infogrames Portugal with the title of Fusion, placing it at 7th place. It eventually was renamed Doshowbikum: The Run when Move Interactive was formed and renamed again when the game was further in development to simply as Ugo Volt, being showcased at E3 2006.\n\nIn 2007, the game was put on hold due to financial difficulties after its fundraisers pulled out of the project, and by 2008, the company was out of business.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qnw.jpg'),(7095,'Space Goose',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7096,'Ys X: Nordics','2023-09-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Ys X: Nordics is a brand-new adventure set in the northern sea Obelia Bay, featuring young adventurer Adol Christin as the protagonist. Please look forward to this latest title in the Ys series, from the development team that brought you Ys VIII: Lacrimosa of Dana and Ys IX: Monstrum Nox.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s9q.jpg'),(7097,'LEGO Marvel Super Heroes 2: Deluxe Edition','2017-11-14','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Get the Deluxe Edition now and gain access to the main game and season pass content! Join your favorite Super Heroes and Super Villains from different eras and realities as they go head-to-head with the time-traveling Kang the Conqueror in the all-new, original adventure, LEGO Marvel Super Heroes 2! Play as the Guardians of the Galaxy, Spider-Man, Thor, Hulk, Black Panther, Captain Marvel, Doctor Strange, Green Goblin and dozens of other Marvel Super Heroes and Villains in this cosmic battle across the time-tossed city of Chronopolis! Travel across lands -- from Ancient Egypt to The Old West, Sakaar and New York City in 2099 -- and transport objects or characters through the centuries! And, with new battle modes, friends and family can play against each other in a series of themed challenges and battle arenas!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27zc.jpg'),(7098,'Fighting Golf','1988-03-24','Sport','Family Computer','The player can choose between four different golfers, of which each Character has his or her own advantages and disadvantages. Lee Trevino is playable as a character named Super Mex (an actual nickname of his); other characters include Pretty Amy, Miracle Chosuke and Big Jumbo. Pretty Amy has limited range, but the easiest control (\"control\" refers to the length of the aiming guide). Miracle Chosuke and Super Mex have average attributes. Big Jumbo has the best range, but the worst control. Despite the title, no fighting is involved in the game, the title is Asian \"Engrish.\" The player has to avoid sand traps, water hazards, rough ground and trees.\n\nThe courses range from relatively straightforward fairways to elaborate arrangements of sand traps. The two courses available for play are the United States, which consists of mostly bunkers and super rough and the Japan course, consisting of water and tight boundaries.\n\nAt the end of the game, the player is greeted with a photorealistic shot of the country club lodge against the setting sun and surrounded by trees.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55q5.jpg'),(7099,'EarthNight','2019-12-02','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','EarthNight is an illustrated epic 2D platformer about the dragon apocalypse, and a love letter to classic arcade games.\n\nEarthNight is a procedurally generated platformer that takes place in a dystopian future just after the dragon apocalypse. Humans have been exiled to space, forced to live in orbit above the planet. Our heroes, Sydney and Stanley have had enough! They’ve decided to skydive back down to the planet, taking out as many dragons as they can along the way.\n\nEach run begins in space. You must traverse five layers of the atmosphere on the perilous journey down to Earth alternating between skydiving and running on the backs of dragons. Your path to EarthNight will always be different and riddled with danger.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2shv.jpg'),(7100,'Re-Legion: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cd2.jpg'),(7101,'NBA 06','2005-10-26','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation Portable','NBA 06 deviates from other traditional NBA titles with the addition of the Life Mode. While it does include classic features such as exhibition, season, franchise, and multiplayer modes, the life mode is a take similar to the MLB: The Show.\n\nThe life mode has the player take control of an NBA rookie right out of college and just being drafted. As in the MLB Show series, the player may only control one character and cannot control others on their team or make any management decisions. The player\'s role of the team will be determined by their performance on and off the court. The better the player is at playing basketball and being a teammate, the more likelier they will be a huge part of the team and receive better contracts and endorsement deals.\n\nLikewise, the decisions the player makes off the court will determine who they are perceived as well, such as how they interact with teammates, what they buy or who they hang around with. The player can also train their character through a series of 20 mini-games, e.g. one-on-one, three-on-three, etc.\n\nThe game also features Showtime Gameplay, where the player may increase attributes and become a better team player with no-look alley-oops and highlight reel dunks. It also has online capabilities as well as the option of utilizing the EyeToy to put the user\'s face onto a created character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co726y.jpg'),(7102,'Babataire','2022-11-09','Puzzle, Indie, Card & Board Game','Web browser','A solitaire inspired heavily by Zachtronics\' Cluj solitaire, with Baba Is You character art on the cards!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7103,'Destiny 2: Digital Deluxe Edition','2017-08-31','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Destiny 2 – Digital Deluxe Edition includes:\n- Destiny 2 Base Game\n- Destiny 2 Expansion Pass\n- Premium Digital Content:\n- Legendary Sword\n- Legendary Player Emote\n- Cabal Empire Themed Emblem','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28ad.jpg'),(7104,'Delta Force: Xtreme 2','2009-05-27','Shooter, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enemies lurk in locations around the globe, waiting for the right opportunity to strike. As part of Delta Force, the U.S. Army\'s most secretive and highly trained unit, you have the skills and the firepower to hunt them down and take them out. Get ready to insert yourself into critical situations by air, land and sea, and show you have the courage to take the fight to the enemy and overcome overwhelming odds to achieve victory.\nIn Delta Force: Xtreme 2, you\'ll take control of Delta Force, employing the most dangerous and effective commando tactics and state-of-the-art weaponry at your disposal to defeat the enemy. Track enemies across a variety of expansive landscapes scattered across the globe in 10 single-player scenarios, and take them down with more than 20 real-world weapons. Insert into danger zones using dangerous HALO jumps, and use choppers, tanks and high-speed watercraft to roar into the midst of the action. Create your own exciting custom levels with the Battle Editor tool, and battle players from all over in five challenging online multiplayer game types.\nFeatures\nCommand the secretive, highly trained Delta Force and use commando tactics and state-of-the-art weapons to take out dangerous enemies\nInsert yourself into the action by land, air and sea using choppers, tanks and high-speed watercraft\nExperience realistic, accurate and deadly shooting via enhanced ballistics\nEmploy the powerful and easy-to-use MED level editor to create custom levels or recreate historical fights\nCustomize urban, jungle and mountain environments using 10 new and 20 classic highly detailed terrains\nAdd dynamic weather effects and real-time lighting as well as thousands of objects and buildings to create a realistic environment\nUp to 64 players may battle online in Deathmatch, Team Deathmatch, Capture the Flag, Team King of the Hill and Flagball multiplayer games\nExperience a fair fight every time using the game\'s anticheat technology, and see how you measure up with persistent stats that track your performance\nAssemble an impressive squad and manage it via the new NovaWorld Community','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oc3.jpg'),(7105,'Zoids Wild Arena','2023-09-20','Strategy, Card & Board Game','Android','Trading card game that features of the characters from the ZOIDS WILD franchise.\n\nZOIDS WILD ARENA is a trading card game (TCG) that incorporates units from the ZOIDS WILD franchise as cards. The game allows players to form a deck using 30 cards, which will allow them to battle against each other for supremacy. Every card can be upgraded all the way to 6 stars, so everyone has a chance to build powerful decks without relying on luck. Test your wits against others all over the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8709.jpg'),(7106,'Elex II','2022-03-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','Several years after Jax defeated the Hybrid, a new threat arrives from the sky, unleashing the dangerous powers of dark Elex and endangering all life on the planet. In order to defend the peace on Magalan and the safety of his own family, Jax has to go on a mission to convince the factions to unite against the invaders.\n\nDive into a huge, hand-crafted, completely unique world with multiple factions and diverse environments set in a post-apocalyptic science fantasy universe. Explore the vast world of Magalan with your jetpack, and play through the epic story the way you want.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39yr.jpg'),(7107,'10 Years After','2015-01-30','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','10 Years After is a survival based horror adventure in which the player has to deal with the consequences of government having drugged the population and the side-effects of that drug finally kicking in.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/g1g8s2smplq4kgon7lvt.jpg'),(7108,'Story of Season: Friends of Mineral Town - Digital Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7109,'Artech War Game Bundle',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bqt.jpg'),(7110,'Infamous: Second Son - Cole\'s Legacy','2014-03-21','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 4','Cole\'s Legacy is an expansion pack for Infamous: Second Son which was initially available only by pre-ordering the game or purchasing the Special Edition.\n\nThe pack contains missions uncovering the events which happened during the seven-year time span between the activation of the RFI in Infamous 2 and the storyline of Infamous: Second Son.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rxz.jpg'),(7111,'Halcyon','2022-12-08','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A pixel art challenging sidescroller shooter set in a future inhospitable version of Earth.\n\nThe year is 2506. A vestige of humankind, you’ve been sent to Earth on the faint hopes that you will find more than the corpse of a once hospitable planet. Instead, you find a landscape blooming with lush, mutated new life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w4b.jpg'),(7112,'Momotaro Dentetsu: Showa, Heisei, Reiwa mo Teiban!','2020-11-19','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','In Momotaro Dentetsu: Showa, Heisei, Reiwa mo Teiban!, players become the president of a railroad company and must acquire properties across Japan with the goal of having the highest total assets in the country.\n\nYou will become the president of a railroad company and you must acquire all the properties and have the highest total assets in Japan.\n\nNew properties have been added including the “New National Stadium” in Sendagaya and “Shime Parfait” in Susukino. And there are all sorts of events all over Japan, and a lot of monsters to each area, which can either become an ally or an obstruction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gls.jpg'),(7113,'Star Conflict: Shrike','2024-07-02','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This pack includes:Rank 17 Federation cover frigate ShrikeUnique weapon Hybrid blaster “Alpha-N”Active module “Universal repair module”Rahil “Coin” Weintraub portraitSpecial bonus for everyone who buys the bundle — Premium license for 30 days!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7114,'Sockventure','2021-05-11','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','In this challenging 2D platformer game, play as a Superhero and help the Kid to find all the missing socks inside the cursed washing machine, Sockventure has stunning colorful graphics, hand-crafted levels, tight controls and fun ever-changing gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zxy.jpg'),(7115,'Work In Progress',NULL,'Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It’s your first day in office, half of the staff is on burnout and the other half is already AFFLICTED.\nSeems familiar ?... I know !\nIn Work In Progress, eliminate all that threatens the WAY, so you can once more perform your capitalist duties in peace !\nAn action Roguelite tainted with mysteries.\n\nAn impactful ACTION gameplay !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96kd.jpg'),(7116,'Super Soccer Champ','1992-07-01','Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Super Soccer Champ is a Soccer Sim game, developed and published by Taito Corporation, which was released in 1992.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4x4v.jpg'),(7117,'Dragon Spirit: The New Legend','1989-04-14','Shooter','Nintendo Entertainment System','Dragon Spirit: The New Legend is a fantasy-themed overhead shoot-\'em-up. It is a remixed port of the 1987 arcade game Dragon Spirit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wuc.jpg'),(7118,'The Complete Movie Games Collection',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jws.jpg'),(7119,'BS Fire Emblem: Archanea Senki-hen - Dai-3-wa: Seigi no Touzokudan','1997-10-12','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Satellaview','The third part of BS Fire Emblem Archanea Senki-hen (BS Fire Emblem: Akaneia Senki-hen).\nIt is a turn-based tactical RPG set in the fantasy world of the Fire Emblem universe. It is based on the engine for the January 1994 Super Famicom release, Fire Emblem: Monshou no Nazo, and the gameplay is largely the same. Gameplay involves the tactical movement of character units through a map grid in order to defeat the opposition militarily.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47l4.jpg'),(7120,'Toaplan Arcade Shoot\'em Ups 1',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jwu.jpg'),(7121,'A Night at the Watermill: Collector\'s Bundle',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jwt.jpg'),(7122,'Sir Whoopass & Switchball HD Bundle',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6d7w.jpg'),(7123,'Mini Pocket Racers',NULL,'Racing, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Mini Pocket Racer is a retroarcade race car game where you choose your car and run thru the fastest Traffic and obstacles to gain access to exotic cars.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7124,'Street Fighter Alpha Anthology','2006-06-13','Fighting, Arcade','PlayStation 2','Street Fighter Alpha Anthology is a compilation that collects the Street Fighter Alpha series with a remixed version of the console-exclusive Street Fighter Alpha 2 Gold and Super Gem Fighter Mini Mix. The original Street Fighter Alpha, Alpha 2, Alpha 3 and Super Gem Fighter Mini Mix are ported from their original arcade releases, while Alpha 2 Gold is a remixed version that combines elements from the previous console version and the Japanese arcade release Street Fighter Zero 2 Alpha. Two secret games are also included in this compilation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6cdy.jpg'),(7125,'Minecraft: Disney - Worlds of Adventure','2023-08-22','Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Step into the magic of six classic Disney tales with this unique map. Explore the world of Aladdin and the sea of The Little Mermaid. Help Snow White, or take a trip with Alice in Wonderland. You can even meet Simba in the savanna, or dine with Belle and the Beast in their castle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yx0.jpg'),(7126,'Flip Words',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7127,'Spells & Secrets + Stranded Sails',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jwn.jpg'),(7128,'Influence','2023-09-24','Strategy','Web browser','Welcome to Influence, a space strategy sandbox MMO set in the asteroid belt of the Adalia system. Adalia is humanity’s new home after an ill-fated journey aboard the Arvad, a multi-generational ship that fled a dying Earth.\n\nCompete with other players through multiple avenues: mining, building, trading, researching, and fighting. Colonize asteroids and exploit their resources, build infrastructure, discover technologies, engage in combat. Expand your influence across the belt, either solo or by collaborating with other players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4d2q.jpg'),(7129,'Difference','2024-08-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An officer who decided to take the subway home was trapped. Each time he returned to the same station, which is endlessly repeated, but something different from the original. You will need to detect and mark all the anomalies to get out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pn3.jpg'),(7130,'Peekaboo Collection - 3 Tales of Horror','2020-04-14','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Three horror games. Three different stories exerting you into dark twist, forcing you confront face to face with the creatures that lurk there.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qwa.jpg'),(7131,'7Swordsman','2022-04-27','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A medieval turn-based RPG','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cwm.jpg'),(7132,'Idle Mall Tycoon','2024-12-05','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Have you ever played a tycoon game that is as realistic and visually stunning as the ones you see in the screenshot images? \"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dcc.jpg'),(7133,'Two Hours One Life','2018-03-14','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fork of One Hour One Life that explores less restrictive settings and gives players significantly more liberty to explore the world, its unique mechanics and large collection of craftable items and objects. The private aspect, regarded as undesirable and futile on the original production, is also considerably more pronounced in this diversion.\n\nThe game management team maintain a Discord community in which they themselves are active members, causing a good portion of the game to also be shaped by the community. That is more evident on the extensive use of graphic content based on art created by members of the community and submitted for use in the game.\n\nA source code repository is also maintained on Github and on several occasions code submitted by users were accepted and later implemented into the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4o2b.jpg'),(7134,'Witch\'s','2023-07-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An evil witch has taken over the kingdom and you\'re the only one who hasn\'t been hit by the curse! Be yourself the savior of Farheim!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yg5.jpg'),(7135,'Girls of DOA Blackjack: The Kasumi Version','2009-06-10','Card & Board Game','iOS','With popular “Dead or Alive” character KASUMI, quickly and easily play exciting blackjack anytime, anywhere!\n\nKASUMI’s 3D character expressed by the finest animation leaps up at you from the screen, and there are a lot of charming motions you can see only in DOA BlackJack.\n\nHit by tapping the table, Stand by swiping the screen, and Split by spreading your two fingers. These hand operations give you the same atmosphere and sensation, just like playing at real casinos.\n\nThe game contains “Costume Change” function, into which new costumes will be added by racking up your wins. From the original outfit to a rare swimsuit, you can enjoy seeing KASUMI dressed fashionably in a range of outfits. Have lots of fun playing blackjack with KASUMI anytime in your favorite costume!\n\nThere are plenty of selected images in the “Album Mode.” Try to get the all images by your earning coins and be always with KASUMI!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/e1bc5f99cbfg1uuqnofh.jpg'),(7136,'WorldBox: God Simulator','2018-10-02','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','WorldBox is the ultimate god simulator and sandbox game. Create your own world or destroy it using different powers. Watch civilizations grow, form kingdoms, colonize new lands and sail to far continents. Towns will rebel, empires will fall. It\'s your choice to help or watch them fight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3uwi.jpg'),(7137,'Gears of War 2: Dark Corners','2009-07-28','Shooter','Xbox 360','The Dark Corners Multiplayer Map Pack is the fourth and final downloadable content pack (DLC) for the 2008 game Gears of War 2. It includes:\n\n- A bonus deleted single-player chapter, Road to Ruin, where players can choose between completing the scene guns blazing or stealthily\n- Additional achievements for 325 gamerpoints\n- Seven new multiplayer maps (War Machine, Allfathers Garden, Highway, Memorial, Nowhere, Way Station, and Sanctuary)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nyz.jpg'),(7138,'Bleach: Shattered Blade','2006-12-14','Fighting','Wii','Fighting game developed by Sega taking place in the Bleach universe. Takes advantage of the wii motion sensor controls and focuses on the story of a game exclusive character called Arturo Plateado.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ptu.jpg'),(7139,'Sovereign Syndicate: Digital Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jwo.jpg'),(7140,'She is Mermaid','2018-09-08','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','She is Mermaid an VN game developed jointly by a Japanese and Korean team. After having been regarded highly among players, the PC version is finally here! Centered on legends and stories of mermaids, experience an amazing summer vacation with lovely mermaids now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ipb.jpg'),(7141,'The Matchless KungFu','2023-08-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Matchless Kungfu is an open world sandbox RPG game based on a WuXia background. You can play any martial arts role you imagine in this wild world. Travel through the great wilderness, or be the leader of the group. The most important thing is, build your own story and live the experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43yw.jpg'),(7142,'TV Studio Story','2024-03-07','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Create shows, sign stars, and dominate the airwaves in this TV studio sim.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7liu.jpg'),(7143,'Hope','2023-01-27','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mistakes are not an impediment, but an opportunity to grow. Play and learn from your mistakes. Come and recharge your hopes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62db.jpg'),(7144,'XCar: Experimental Racing','1997-08-22','Racing, Simulator','DOS','Extreme Machines. Surpassing the limits of traditional auto racing, XCar is unlimited class racing. Bound only by the laws of physics, your XCar prototype is the pinnacle of speed. XCar challenges all racing enthusiasts, and delivers a state-of-the-art adrenaline rush!\n\nAre you up to the challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8iew.jpg'),(7145,'SSB Scene Creator','2008-11-14','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','To play, just drag the characters you want onto the stage. There are 3 stages to choose from, as well as 3 tracks you can play in the background.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9abi.jpg'),(7146,'Intergalactic Bubbles','2015-05-29','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Blast your way through space in this innovative 3D bubble puzzler! Bounce, bobble, swing, and explode bubbles across the universe. Intergalactic Bubbles advances the classic match-3 genre into the 21st century with stellar graphics, 3D action, and upgrades.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86d7.jpg'),(7147,'Love Me or Die','2024-10-21','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yuki, a lonely teenager, embarks on a desperate quest for popularity and fame. But her path soon turns into a dark and tragic journey that will change her life forever. A retro graphic adventure with challenging puzzles, intense tweet battles, and a pixelated world filled with humor and mysteries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co905x.jpg'),(7148,'Draw Rider Plus','2013-04-06','Racing','iOS','Can you get to the finish line safely and securely? Draw Rider is not an ordinary race, here you are waiting for insidious tests from many hardcore levels. Get gold medals, becoming the best racer on each track, to unlock new levels and new characters.\nThanks to the level editor you can create new tracks and share them with other players. Participate in the race for a while, communicate and evaluate the tracks of other players, become a part of the Draw Rider community!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7149,'Azumanga Fighter: Come Back!','2005-12-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game features the six main girls as playable characters, each having an unlockable EX character variant. Starring alongside them are their teachers- Yukari and Nyamo, both unlockable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a7x.jpg'),(7150,'Mage Mayhem','2023-07-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mage Mayhem is a team-based strategy game where you can compete in up to 4v4 battles with your friends competing across different game modes and maps to prove who is the best mage. Customize your character with many different classes, abilities, and perks to fit your playstyle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q8n.jpg'),(7151,'Beyond the Diorama: Caribou World','2021-01-19','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In partnership with the Natural History Museum of Los Angeles County, USC students harnessed emerging technology to create immersive experiences to illustrate how the climate crisis is affecting habitats across the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m40.jpg'),(7152,'Beast Master and Prince: Snow Bride','2011-02-24','Visual Novel','Android, iOS, PlayStation 2','Fandisc of Beast Master and Prince.\nIncluded in the \"Story Jar\" app in English.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5h1z.jpg'),(7153,'Without Escape','2011-08-03','Adventure','Nintendo DS','A homebrew horror game for the Nintendo DS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s22.jpg'),(7154,'Under the Moon: Crescent','2005-06-25','Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','Under the Moon: Crescent is a port of Under the Moon. It censors the erotic scenes from the original game, but adds new event CGs, a new scenario, and several endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tc3.jpg'),(7155,'Feast Your Eyes','2020-08-11','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 3D surreal horror game that combines fixed camera angles with 2.5D elements. The game is mostly focused on its dark world that is occasionally littered with a strange threat or puzzle. Things start off a bit slow but gradually escalate, all while being mindful to pace itself and balance a level of intrigue, involvement and introspection.\n\nTravel between several strange locations, varying from a decrepit theater to a small forest village with no people in it, partake in strange events and overcome any challenges that may come your way. But be wary, things are often not what they seem.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q4x.jpg'),(7156,'Waifu vs. Evil','2021-09-11','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Waifu vs Evil is a first-person action horror game set in a small abandoned town that has been attacked by an alien.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3la1.jpg'),(7157,'Classic Board Game Bundle: Ticket to Ride, Cluedo, Mouse Trap, Battleship and The Game of Life 2','2024-12-05','Simulator, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Play board games all day long – without any missing pieces!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ajy.jpg'),(7158,'Budget Cuts Ultimate','2023-06-01','Adventure','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR','Zip, sneak, and stab your way through a heart-pounding dystopia filled with evil robots! What began as a cost-cutting strategy has spiraled out of control, and now it’s up to you to save humanity from being optimized out of existence. Budget Cuts Ultimate is the essential VR action stealth game, containing all previously released games and content updates.\n\nAs your last human co-worker is hauled away, a mysterious briefcase from someone on the outside is delivered to your desk. You need to get to the bottom of what is going on at TransCorp.\n\nSneak around enemy robots by climbing through air ducts and service tunnels, or embrace violence by unleashing a fistful of knives, quivers of arrows, grenades, and coffee mugs onto their unsuspecting circuits. Once you’ve completed your mission, test your skills in the arcade with multiple modes, difficulty levels, and scoring.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jeq.jpg'),(7159,'Smugglers V: Invasion','2014-10-16','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Smugglers 5 is the fifth installment in the turn-based single-player space trading game series. Will you be a greedy trader, an ambitious fleet pilot or a ruthless pirate? Board enemy ships, manage factories, conquer star systems and forge your own galactic empire - ultimately, your actions will have an impact on a galactic scale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jpt.jpg'),(7160,'Carnivores','1998-11-30','Shooter, Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Carnivores is a first person shooting video game produced by Action Forms and released by WizardWorks Software in 1998. It is the first video game in the Carnivores series.\n\nThe player takes the role of a DinoHunt customer. At the start of a new game, the player must register a new hunter or continue with a saved hunter. The point of the game is hunting dinosaurs to get trophies and accumulate score. Each dinosaur represents a set number of points. A novice hunter starts with zero points, when his points increase he\'ll be able to hunt new dinosaurs on additional terrains with more powerful weapons. If the player is killed by a dinosaur, all points accumulated on that specific hunt are forfeited. The player must be picked up by DinoHunt to keep the points he earned.\n\nA hunter will become Advanced after earning 100 points, and Expert with 300. To begin a hunt, the player must choose the location, the weapon, the dinosaur and some hunting accessories which help the player but will deduct the score during that hunt. Each location is unique, with varying difficulties and terrain. The new hunter will be given three areas, with two more added for the Advanced hunter and a final area for the Expert hunter, for a total of six locations. Level locations include jungles, and deserts accompanied by pyramids and an ancient temple.\n\nNext, the player must choose a dinosaur to hunt. A new hunter will be given the choice of four dinosaurs: Parasaurolophus, Stegosaurus, Pachycephalosaurus and Allosaurus. An Advanced hunter gains the ability to hunt the Triceratops and the Velociraptor. Only an Expert hunter can hunt the Tyrannosaurus rex. Harmless creatures such as Moschops, Gallimimus and Dimorphodon are present in each level. They are worth zero points and can be killed with a single shot.\n\nThe player must also choose a weapon, which can be set for kill or tranquilize for additional points. A beginning hunter can only use a shotgun or a crossbow. A sniper rifle is unlocked upon becoming an Advanced hunter. First time hunters can use the Observation Mode to familiarize themselves with dinosaur behavior and different terrain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zh0.jpg'),(7161,'The Dark Heart of Uukrul','1989-10-01','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, Mac, DOS, Apple II','A dungeon crawling role-playing game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/x6l7dnzkufmcm11zode4.jpg'),(7162,'Escape Academy','2022-07-14','Puzzle, Adventure, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Welcome to the Escape Academy. Train to become the ultimate Escapist. Solve Puzzles. Hack Servers. Meet the Faculty. Brew the perfect cup of tea. Escape Rooms in single player or co-op with a friend - local or online!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kjz.jpg'),(7163,'Happy Sawland','2024-06-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a journey to reach the far lands of «Happy Sawland». Go forth, the seeker of «Happy Sawland». No hesitation before the many challenges you are to come across! Jump and dodge until the goal is reached!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8drq.jpg'),(7164,'Hydra Hide Land','2025-03-29','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hydra Hyde Land is a deck-building rogue-lite game. The player must defeat a “certain demon” in order to break the curse placed on the girl who saved his life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ln6.jpg'),(7165,'Story Jar','2018-12-20','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','A collection of Shall We Date games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uy0.jpg'),(7166,'Smoothcade','2024-11-14','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Smoothcade is a cute “clear the screen” modern-arcade game that features co-op gameplay for up to four players. Recover the missing golden blend through 100 platform-jumping, puzzle-solving levels in story mode - consisting of handcrafted levels and a ton of fruity critters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rc6.jpg'),(7167,'Bloxiq','2018-08-23','Puzzle, Strategy, Arcade','PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','A 3D block matching game for the PlayStation Vita.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6k7q.jpg'),(7168,'Touhou Asked','2018-10-07','Strategy, Quiz/Trivia, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This quiz game is themed on the Eastern Project, but it is different from the usual quiz games and is tailored to Oriental needs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co543u.jpg'),(7169,'Ladybug Quest','2019-02-11','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ladybug Quest is a 3D, tile based, action-platformer that sends players on a story-driven adventure following the journey of a Ladybug on a quest to save her colony! Hop and dodge your way through the enchanting environments, while immersing yourself in the riveting story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4545.jpg'),(7170,'Unrest','2014-07-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Unrest is a role playing adventure game set in a fantasy interpretation of ancient India that adapts to death, failure, and the choices you make. Play as ordinary people in a struggle for safety, freedom, and a chance at peace. Use conversation, manipulation (and rarely, violence) to achieve your goals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pdl.jpg'),(7171,'Hidden Shy Cats & Dogs Bundle','2024-11-21','Music, Puzzle, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Find shy musician cats and dogs in this charming bundle! Enjoy cozy hidden-object gameplay as you discover adorable animals and create your own musical mix!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94u4.jpg'),(7172,'Lizzie McGuire: On the Go!','2003-09-12','Sin género','Game Boy Advance','Lizzie McGuire -- On the Go! is more than just a game! You can play the exciting arcade game \"When Cheerleaders Attack!\" and you and your friends can have fun with exciting games like, Gordo\'s Gunk, Dots \'n Boxes, Box Bash, Memory, Droppers and Hangman. You can also use Lizzie McGuire for the GBA as the centerpiece of any party! \"Lizzie McGuire -- On the Go!\" becomes the hit of the party as girls can use it to guide them through crazy party games like Charades, MatchMaker, Fill-In\'s (Mad-Libs anyone?) and Operator. Finally, to help plan for the next party, Lizzie McGuire for the GBA will let players keep track of friends\' contact information, important dates, and of course, horoscopes and biorhythms! More than 20 games and activities to choose from in all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qkz.jpg'),(7173,'Sparking Beam Strike 1000','2024-12-12','Puzzle, Simulator, Arcade, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Puzzle Your Way by Controlling the Light!\nReflect the beams and hit the targets right!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aia.jpg'),(7174,'Mullet Madjack: Deluxe Edition','2024-05-15','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mullet Madjack is a single-player fast-paced FPS that brings you directly inside a classic anime. The DELUXE Edition contains Mullet Mad Jack GAME, an official ARTBOOK and OST SOUNDTRACKS !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xqb.jpg'),(7175,'1991 Du Ma Racing','1991-12-31','Puzzle, Racing, Sport, Adventure','Family Computer','1991 Du Ma Racing is an unlicensed horse racing game for the NES that was developed by Idea-Tek and published by Super Mega. The game offers two game modes.\n\nIn race mode, two players can compete in a race. By pressing a button at the right time, they can build up their horse\'s power, then press another button to release it and give their horse an edge in the race. The player who does this faster and more accurately will have a better chance of winning the race.\n\nIn gamble mode, 1 to 6 players start out with 500 credits to place bets on 5 horses. The race will be simulated without any player interaction, and at the end of each race event players will get their respective prize money. The goal is to earn more money this way than any other player.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nrp.jpg'),(7176,'Truck Sim 2024','2024-02-23','Racing, Simulator','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','In Truck Sim 2024, players are thrust into the driver\'s seat of their own destiny. With a plethora of missions awaiting completion, from delivering crucial cargo to overcoming treacherous obstacles, every journey presents new opportunities and challenges. Whether it\'s hauling precious goods across long distances or tackling time-sensitive deliveries, the road ahead is yours to conquer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kxh.jpg'),(7177,'Arcobaleno!','2009-05-14','Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','Arcobaleno is a otome game for PS2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54pq.jpg'),(7178,'Megamari: Marisa no Yabou','2006-04-24','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Megamari: Marisa no Yabou is a Touhou game in the style of Mega Man by Tasogare Frontier, the makers of Immaterial and Missing Power, starring Marisa Kirisame and Alice Margatroid.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4urv.jpg'),(7179,'PolitiCats',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Free clicker game released on android and ios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mnr25d6dtrsk48cjdghb.jpg'),(7180,'Ultimate Skyrim','2019-04-06','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ultimate Skyrim is a total conversion modpack for Skyrim, built around the Requiem Roleplaying Overhaul. Its goal is to transform Skyrim into the ultimate fantasy life simulator by combining the excellent mods of the Skyrim modding community with proprietary features found only in Ultimate Skyrim.\n\nUltSky is intended for players who enjoy dynamic fantasy worlds with deep mechanics and systems. Every part of the game has been rebuilt, including combat, progression, AI, factions, the economy, the visuals, and more. The result is a deeply simulated roleplaying experience unlike any other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7njl.jpg'),(7181,'Arcade Archives: Life Force','2020-02-26','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Arcade Archives: Life Force is a port of the shooting game Life Force. The player will challenge against the aggressions from the Bacterian special force known as Salamander. This title will include Salamander which is the Japanese version of the game, and Life Force which is rearranged as the Japanese version of Life Force that was released in 1987 in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bye.jpg'),(7182,'The Sub Shop','1998-12-09','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Duke finds himself in a rocky area close to the sea.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7183,'The Revenge of Shinobi','1991-01-31','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3, Linux, Wii, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox 360','The Revenge of Shinobi, known as The Super Shinobi in Japan, is the continuation of Shadow Dancer - the arcade sequel to Shinobi. The game was the first Shinobi title developed exclusively for home consoles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30ih.jpg'),(7184,'Asterix & Obelix XXL 3: The Crystal Menhir - Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Platform','Sin plataforma','This edition includes the following\nAsterix & Obelix XXL 3: The Crystal Menhir\nObelix Idefix Figurine made of Resin','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6t45.jpg'),(7185,'Tiger Tank 59 I: Super Tank MP001','2021-07-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tiger Tank 59 I: Super Tank is a top-down shooting game. Players need to control their tanks, through the enemy lines, break the enemy base, or defeat the enemy tanks. This DLC includes map pack 001.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7va3.jpg'),(7186,'Avoid the Rain 2',NULL,'Racing, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','This is an agile parkour game. You can dodge quickly to avoid raindrops falling from the sky and go to the designated place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60so.jpg'),(7187,'Santa in search of toys','2019-01-19','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a nice 3D platformer with a side view. In it you have to play for Santa and collect a variety of toys to then put them under the Christmas tree in the house!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4dr6.jpg'),(7188,'Mighty Doom','2023-03-22','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Arcade','Android, iOS','Run and gun through hundreds of exciting levels and battle challenging bosses as you level up, gain powerful skills, loot new gear, and upgrade legendary weapons. Descend into iconic Doom worlds in this single-touch shooter with an animated style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30vh.jpg'),(7189,'Child of Light: Ultimate Edition + Valiant Hearts: The Great War','2021-05-18','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Play the Child of Light Ultimate Edition and Valiant Hearts: The Great War bundle at home or on the go. Enjoy both games\' intricately crafted worlds that tell deep and personal stories. Enjoy two great games in one bundle, providing hours of immersive entertainment. In Child of Light, join Aurora on her journey to save her ailing father and a lost kingdom in the magical world of Lemuria. Fight alongside your allies to upgrade your stats, unlock unique abilities, and use unique gems to improve your skills. In Valiant Hearts: The Great War, the lives of all the characters are inextricably drawn together over the course of the game. Choose your favorite control mode and experience the game with either a Joy-Con or the touch screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3v8s.jpg'),(7190,'Road Runner\'s Death Valley Rally','1992-12-22','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Everybody has remembered waking up early on the weekend to watch Saturday morning cartoons. But would would happen if the cartoons were interactive? Well, you might end up with something like Death Valley Rally. The object is pretty simple: Race the Road Runner through each level as quickly as you can while collecting different colored flags, which are worth different amounts of points. When you reach the ending, if you\'re fast enough, you\'ll also get a time bonus, but if you\'re good enough, you\'ll get a flag bonus. Some of the flags are INCREDIBLY difficult to find, and the fact that you won\'t usually be able to find them, will challenge (or at least frustrate) most gamers. You can run, turbo run (by stocking up on bird seed), peck, and jump in this wild adventure, as you try to catch the escape the ever-witty Wile E. Coyote and his assorted ACME contraptions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2equ.jpg'),(7191,'Qualia: The Path of Promise','2020-06-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','“Machina” is the world\'s first android to pass the Turing Test. Incidentally, she is also dressed like a maid. Dr. Hiro Koshino ends up taking Machina home and has her work as a maid. As she continues to learn and grow, he also begins to develop certain feelings towards her…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6604.jpg'),(7192,'Chuusotsu! 1st Graduation: Time After Time','2018-04-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chuusotsu is a fun, colorful story of three girls brought by their individual circumstances to live under the same roof and being forced to tackle existential questions to win their place in society.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23wd.jpg'),(7193,'Pop\'n Music: Disney Tunes','2000-11-22','Music','Game Boy Color, PlayStation','Disney Tunes is one of the many titles in Konami\'s long-running pop\'n music rhythm game franchise. Notes scroll toward the bottom of the screen along nine tracks, and the player must tap the correct buttons in time with the music to play along. Play well, and the \"groove meter\" increases, but play poorly and it will drop. If the groove meter is high enough at the end of the song, the player can move on to the next song.\n\nThis release is a straight port of the arcade version Mickey Tunes, and includes a selection of popular songs from Disney\'s vast catalog of animated films. The game itself is built off of pop\'n music 4, and features the same selection of game modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1w8k.jpg'),(7194,'Tiny Toon Adventures: Babs\' Big Break','1992-02-01','Platform','Game Boy','Tiny Toon Adventures: Babs\' Big Break is a platform game for gameboy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72qm.jpg'),(7195,'The Lab and Dungeons','2024-01-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Lab and Dungeons is a fusion of roguelike action and shooter RPG. As a robot, mine ores, craft unique weapons, and conquer procedural dungeons. Collect materials to unlock more advanced weapons. From a novice to a high-spec warrior robot, enjoy physics-based combat solo or in co-op mode online!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bto.jpg'),(7196,'Game of Fame and Fortune','2024-02-20','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Game of Fame and Fortune\" is a real-person interactive narrative product. You will become a fledgling young director, looking for the most appropriate decision among various difficult \"choices\". . Is it \"starry\" or \"begging on the streets\". Everything depends on your \"means\"!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lp2.jpg'),(7197,'Mario\'s Keep Co-op','2021-04-22','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','A co-op version of Mario\'s Keep, a Super Mario Bros. puzzle ROM hack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sbh.jpg'),(7198,'Dismantle: Construct Carnage',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','‘Dismantle: Construct Carnage’, is a local-multiplayer arena brawler, where you can literally tear your opponents limb from limb. Feel the effects of damage as you hop, crawl and roll your way to victory, making sure your own body parts aren’t used as weapons against you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3op0.jpg'),(7199,'Tetris Battle Gaiden','1994-01-24','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Super Famicom','Tetris Battle Gaiden is a competitive puzzle-battle game, similar to games such as Puzzle Fighter or Puyo Puyo. One can play against a friend or the Computer in a story mode. There is also an included Rensa mode, which ensures a more hyperactive game due to increased gravity. The player can choose from a list of characters in the story mode, including a Dragon or a pumpkin named Halloween.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ivy.jpg'),(7200,'Sword Art Online: Hollow Realization','2016-11-08','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','Sword Art Online: Hollow Realization is a Japanese role-playing game and the fourth game based on the Sword Art Online light novel franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s44.jpg'),(7201,'Taz: Wanted','2002-09-17','Platform, Adventure','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Taz: Wanted is an action-adventure video game featuring the Tasmanian Devil, from the Looney Tunes. Blast your way through 15 different levels, destroying \"Wanted\" posters to get your revenge against Yosemite Sam.\n\nThe game was nominated for 2002 BAFTA award in category \'Best Children\'s Entertainment\'.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6va1.jpg'),(7202,'Umineko no Naku Koro ni: Episode 6 - Dawn of the Golden Witch','2011-12-15','Visual Novel','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','A remake of the sixth episode of Umineko no Naku Koro ni for console releases.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78nh.jpg'),(7203,'Minemadness','2022-05-13','Puzzle, Strategy','Web browser, Android','A game that innovates the way you can find (sometimes not) mines in a field, through clues given by numbers and your own logical reasoning, train, win and share your scores with your friends and the whole world, Minemadness offers 4 game modes: Classic, Madness, Training and Custom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qzz.jpg'),(7204,'WarShape','2025-02-07','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','WarShape is a \"Top Down Shooter\" where you face growing hordes of enemies. As you progress, the weapons and defenses of everyone in the arena evolve, starting from primitive equipment to technological weapons. Build, find weapons, recruit allies and buy upgrades to survive the attacks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mdl.jpg'),(7205,'Mirror\'s Edge 2D','2009-02-20','Platform','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','2D flash version of the parkour game of the same name. Developed by Brad Borne for EA2D.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kx9.jpg'),(7206,'Ar nosurge Plus','2014-10-02','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation Vita','Ar nosurge Plus is a Fantasy, Sci-fi, \'7 Dimension\' RPG, that takes place in a world where music and song can create magic. It tells the compelling story of a civilization that lost their planet and has been roaming the edge of space for 2000 years in search of a new home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nex.jpg'),(7207,'Wild Animals - Animated Jigsaws','2016-11-07','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Animated Jigsaws\" is a jigsaw puzzle game with videos instead of pictures.  \n\"Wild Animals - Animated Jigsaws\" contains moving images of lion,tiger,elephant,giraffe,gorilla,zebra,koala,kangaroo,giant panda and surprised king penguin colony.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xe3.jpg'),(7208,'Chronicon Complete',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6am0.jpg'),(7209,'Wolfenstein 3D','1992-05-05','Shooter','DOS','Wolfenstein 3D is a first-person shooter presented with rudimentary 3D graphics and a follow-up to the top-down infiltration game Castle Wolfenstein. The game is broken up into levels, each of which is a flat plane divided into areas and rooms by a grid-based pattern of walls and doors, all of equal height. Each level is themed after Nazi bunkers and buildings. To finish a level, the player must traverse through the area to reach an elevator. Levels are grouped together into named episodes, with the final level focusing on a boss fight with a particularly difficult enemy. While traversing the levels, the player must fight Nazi guards and soldiers, dogs, and other enemies while managing supplies of ammunition and health.\n\nWhile later releases of the game included the Nocturnal Missions expansion, this initial release did not.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yw5.jpg'),(7210,'Guardian Legend','2019-09-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Guardian Legend is a q RPG game. Lovely modelling, nostalgic style of the scene, humorous dialogue, can take you into a relaxed and happy fairy tale world. If you like this style, don\'t miss it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7oot.jpg'),(7211,'Touhou Gendanshou Y: Unlimited Heroes','2011-08-13','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A doujin game by INSIDE SYSTEM based on the Touhou Project series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xpx.jpg'),(7212,'Drom','2017-02-08','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Described by the developer: \"A short, pointless game about a dream I once had.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s5x.jpg'),(7213,'Chocolate makes you happy: Halloween','2018-09-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Casual colorful physical puzzle with sweets, jumpers, teleports, accelerators, reverse gravity, traps, treadmills, fires, ghosts, Jack-O\'-Lantern\'s and explosions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o6b.jpg'),(7214,'Shopping Spree: Extreme!!!','2023-08-22','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Make your way around the shopping center to collect items on your shopping list. But be careful; one slip up and you\'ll be paying for a broken item! Avoid grumpy shoppers or simply shove them out of the way! Various other obstacles get in your way as you fill your cart and make it to checkout!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cuj.jpg'),(7215,'Baseball Stars','1999-12-31','Sport','Neo Geo Pocket Color','Baseball Stars Color is sports game about baseball. Game is similar to Baseball Stars from NES but has less realistic characters and gameplay\'s style. You manage own baseball team and play in series of matches. Game has typical baseball rules - one player throws the ball, second hits the ball, someone else grabs it etc. Each character has own statistics','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/djlwuj6pisq8b3zx1xfp.jpg'),(7216,'Star Castle','1980-11-01','Shooter, Arcade','Vectrex, Arcade','Star Castle is a 1980 vector arcade game by Cinematronics. The game involves obliterating a series of defenses orbiting a stationary turret in the center of the screen. The game was designed by Tim Skelly and programmed by Scott Boden. Tim Skelly also created a number of other Cinematronics titles, including Starhawk, Armor Attack and Rip-Off. As with many other titles by the company, Star Castle was ported to the Vectrex video game console in 1983.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s94.jpg'),(7217,'Madrid Noir','2021-11-08','Adventure, Indie','Meta Quest 2, PC (Microsoft Windows), Oculus Quest','Madrid Noir is a 45 minute mystery adventure that unfolds across two acts in this VR film. With her uncle declared dead, a disenchanted young woman must delve into her memories to pick up his shadowy trail. Solving the puzzles of the past ain\'t gonna be easy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hhq.jpg'),(7218,'Canvas Quest','2017-07-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Canvas Quest is a turn-based JRPG made in RPGMaker MV. The game features an artstyle based around poorly made digital and physical art, featuring stickman characters and an abundance of obvious perfect circles and lines. Journey with Bob and friends to rid the world of the Evil King.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26rk.jpg'),(7219,'Cookulo','2024-12-05','Puzzle, Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Cookulo: An experimental cooking game where your mission is to complete your Recipe Book!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94ua.jpg'),(7220,'Deathsmiles II: Makai no Merry Christmas','2009-05-14','Shooter, Indie','Arcade','Deathsmiles II: Makai no Merry Christmas is a horizontal side scrolling shoot \'em up arcade game by Japanese developer Cave, released in 2009. It is the third Cave shoot \'em up to be played using a horizontally-oriented monitor (preceded by Progear and the original Deathsmiles). Deathsmiles II is also the first CAVE arcade game to use polygons instead of their traditional sprites for graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pvn.jpg'),(7221,'Manifold Garden','2019-10-18','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Manifold Garden is a game that reimagines physics and space.\n\nExplore a world of beautiful Escher-esque architecture where the laws of physics are different. Geometry repeats infinitely in every direction and falling down leads you back to where you started. Manipulate gravity to change your perspective and see the world in new ways. Master the rules of the universe and restore a barren world with vegetation and life.\n\nKey Features\n- An expansive and visually striking world filled with mind-bending puzzles.\n- Manipulate gravity to gain new perspectives and walk on any visible surface.\n- Experience space in new ways as you explore infinitely repeating Escher-esque architecture.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ws9.jpg'),(7222,'Naruto Shippuden: Ultimate Ninja Storm 3','2013-03-08','Fighting','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Ultimate Ninja STORM 3 promises to unleash a tornado of ninja action and adventure that the franchise is known for, with over eighty playable characters, advanced online modes and enhanced fighting mechanics that allow anyone to become a ninja master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ulj.jpg'),(7223,'Dead Grid','2022-03-24','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dead Grid is a single player game with tactical card combat, level-based progression and loot set in a post-apocalyptic dynamically scaling world. Manage a squad of elite mercenaries, discover and upgrade hundreds of cards ranging from weapons to consumable items.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45zl.jpg'),(7224,'Darts Fever','2024-12-24','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Step Up to the toe line!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ak3.jpg'),(7225,'Fallen Legion: Rise to Glory','2022-08-26','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Fallen Legion is an intense action RPG where every battle is a heart-pounding fight and each gut-wrenching choice impacts the realm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w16.jpg'),(7226,'Money Garden','2021-03-23','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have a tree in your garden—a MONEYTREE! Strap your lawn vacuum on you back and collect all the money as it drops. Try to keep your garden clean.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bgg.jpg'),(7227,'Power Struggle','1988-12-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, Amiga','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qtdz9tugwphm9b3q58m6.jpg'),(7228,'Stellar Echoes','2022-12-27','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','You may wonder how the ‘future’ looks like, Stellar Echoes would resonate you with the vision and voice of the imaginary future. Inside the VR world of Stellar Echoes, let us witness then define the future together; moreover, feel free to stay in touch with Li，wave at it and say ‘Hi’!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6492.jpg'),(7229,'Furball','2021-07-30','Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join the fun as adorable animals battle for athletic supremacy across a variety of fantastic arenas! Play against friends across multiple platforms over the Internet. In FurBall, you play on teams of up to 4 players on each side in noble competition, attempting to score goals for your team!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5okv.jpg'),(7230,'Doki Doki Grappling Hook Yuri: The Origin Arc','2022-11-27','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grappling Hook Yuri: The Origin Arc is a mod for Doki Doki Literature Club! that takes players on a comical and action-packed adventure through the multiverse, centered on the character Yuri equipped with a climbing hook.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hr2.jpg'),(7231,'Swords and Sandals I: Gladiator','2005-01-01','Fighting','Web browser','Swords and Sandals Gladiator, are you ready to unleash hell in the arena?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vne.jpg'),(7232,'Stones of Harlath','2021-06-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Meta Quest 2, Oculus Quest','Shipwrecked on the small island of Harlath, players will adventure through a mysterious Island and multiple dungeons, battling foes, solving puzzles, and ultimately discovering the nature of the curse that looms over the island.\n\nStones of Harlath is a VR first person adventure game. Players will play as a powerful battle mage, explore a mysterious island, adventure in many dungeons, wield swords & shields and cast powerful magic by drawing runes with their controller.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3amw.jpg'),(7233,'Vault Assault','2001-08-11','Shooter, Arcade','Atari 2600','Vault Assault is a game based on the old arcade game Space Zap, written by Brian Prescott for the Atari 2600. Brian released Vault Assault in cartridge form at the 2001 Classic Gaming Expo, selling out all the copies he brought with him.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54ce.jpg'),(7234,'PartySaur: Dino Mayhem',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','PartySaur: Dino Mayhem is a casual 1 - 4 player local multiplayer action game where players battle each other in a variety of mini-games set in a prehistoric environment. Defeat your rivals and become the PartySaur champion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7eq3.jpg'),(7235,'Clockwork Empires','2016-10-26','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take on the role of a Junior Bureaucrat (Colonial Grade), sent forth to seek fame, promotions, and natural resources to feed the ravenous maw of Imperial Industry & Commerce. Build a prosperous colony, fill it with magnificent factories worked by oppressed labourers, and harness the awesome power of steam through fearsome machines invented by determined men and women of Science! History is yours to seize for fame and fortune, for Science, and for the Queen and the glory of the Clockwork Empires!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pri.jpg'),(7236,'AI Shogi 3','1998-12-18','Puzzle, Strategy, Quiz/Trivia, Card & Board Game','Nintendo 64','AI Shogi 3 is a Board game, developed by I4 and published by ASCII Entertainment, which was released only in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w1u.jpg'),(7237,'Into the Nightmare','2022-12-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When people around town start getting transported to a mysterious space, Yatsuha must embrace her family\'s power, and protect the inhabitants of the city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hcr.jpg'),(7238,'D-Force','1991-12-20','Shooter','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Gameplay involves being the pilot of an Apache Helicopter, and shooting enemies down in the style of a vertical scrolling shooter. Large red gunships can be shot down to gain power-ups for the helicopter in order to upgrade the guns and have it fire homing missiles. Each level features a midboss and a boss, and both must be destroyed in order to advance to the next level. The style of the levels as the player advances alternates between \"Shooting Mode\" and \"Exploration Mode,\" where the latter involves levels set in a fantasy-like setting and are the only level types that provide no power-ups to the player and give the player the ability to switch their altitude.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rih.jpg'),(7239,'Cyanotype Daydream: The Girl Who Dreamed the World','2022-02-09','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kaito wakes to find himself in a strange room, with no memories, and a taciturn girl named Yonagi by his side. Upon learning of his role, he immerses himself into three wondrous dream worlds with her. When all three stories meet a bitter end, Kaito recovers his memories, and the true story unfolds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4huu.jpg'),(7240,'A Night On The Farm','2024-02-14','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Survive the night and uncover the mystery of The Farm, in an atmospheric horror adventure! Locate key items, uncover cryptic notes, gain access to [REDACTED], and make decisions that alter your story!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tjv.jpg'),(7241,'The Caligula Effect: Overdose - Swimsuit Bundle','2019-03-12','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t6g.jpg'),(7242,'Pharaoh: A New Era','2023-02-15','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A remake of the 1999 strategy game Pharaoh and its expansion Cleopatra: Queen of the Nile.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lww.jpg'),(7243,'Arena Football','2006-02-07','Sport','Xbox, PlayStation 2','The speed. The scoring. The spectacle. Experience the intensity and passion of the indoor gridiron for the first time with EA Sports Arena Football. All the devastating hits and non-stop passing thrills are brought to life as you\'re put in the middle of the action from opening day all the way to the Arena Bowl. Rediscover football and play the game in a new way with EA Sports Arena Football.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/iynpuebltvig3j0azocm.jpg'),(7244,'Empire of Sin','2020-12-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Empire of Sin, the strategy game from Romero Games and Paradox Interactive, puts you at the heart of the ruthless criminal underworld of 1920s Prohibition-era Chicago.\n\nIt’s up to you to hustle, charm and intimidate your way to the top of the pile and do whatever it takes to stay there. This character-driven, noir-inspired game puts players smack dab in the glitz and glamor of the roaring 20s, all while working behind the scenes in the gritty underbelly of organized crime.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nbm.jpg'),(7245,'Zoo keeper','2020-04-21','Point-and-click, Puzzle','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This game is about abandoned Zoo, and you are a new zookepeer.\nYou need to entertain, feed and take care of various animals.\n\nThis game contains 8 minigames with 7 difficulty levels.\n\nAll minigames played with click(or taps).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co992f.jpg'),(7246,'Heckle Dungeon','2019-08-26','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Web browser','You are a pesky fairy on a quest to BOTHER EVERYONE. And legend tells of a powerful artifact at the bottom of a dungeon that can deal out ultimate irritation. Poke and pester your foes on your way to the treasure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rvr.jpg'),(7247,'Arcade Archives: City Bomber','2024-12-05','Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','It\'s a frantic chase scene to escape!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94tf.jpg'),(7248,'Duel Jousting','2017-11-15','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dragon Jousting in 2.5D. Become the best Dragon Jouster as you level up, progress through stages, and show your might in the arena!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cqsjub2tgd1olbcpm55w.jpg'),(7249,'Operation Lone Wolf','2018-10-01','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Operation Lone Wolf is a multiplayer & soon to be Singleplayer first person shooter, set in the second world war. You can play with up to 10 players, in different free for all gamemodes. At the moment this game has 8 gamemodes, including: standard free for all, gungame, sniper, shotgun and pistol-only and more. You can play on 10 different maps, set on all kinds of locations. Operation Lone Wolf has small maps, and big, more open maps so there are many gameplay options available for the players. This game is not trying to be a realistic representation of WW2, but more of an arcade, fast paced shooter, in which having fun is the main goal. Post launch updates like new maps, new gamemodes etc. will all be free, and there are no in-game purchases in Operation Lone Wolf. The game will cost around $17 at launch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27nk.jpg'),(7250,'Pharao Reloaded',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','In Pharao Reloaded you find yourself in the maze of an Egyptian pyramid full of treasures, monsters and potions. Each pyramid is more difficult than the previous one. Can you find the exit in time before the pyramid kills you? How far will you come?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vae.jpg'),(7251,'Sonic DS','2004-12-31','Platform, Arcade','Nintendo DS','A tech demo featured at E3 2004 which had the player swiping back and fourth and the touch screen to allow Sonic to gain speed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co852p.jpg'),(7252,'Rusted Warfare','2011-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Rusted Warfare is a 2D RTS game in the vein of Total Annihilation featuring large armies and a pixel art style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24o7.jpg'),(7253,'Princess Strike!','2013-05-16','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','After the passing of the King of Nippon, a lottery is held to decide who will be the next king. The one who was chosen was Ataru, who up until now hasn’t had any luck at all. That morning when his osananajimi Hiyoko came to wake him up, two girls dropped down through the ceiling. Milfy and Sera were princesses, and they both wanted to marry him! Since his house was broken, he gets to live in the royal palace with them. Hiyoko couldn’t stand leaving him and came to live with him as a maid. Who will he ultimately choose as his bride?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co525d.jpg'),(7254,'(heart) Sudoku','2011-01-02','Puzzle','Mac','(heart) Sudoku provides unlimited puzzles at 17 difficulty levels. Novices and experienced players alike will enjoy our extensive feature set, tutorial, and advanced hint system. The more you play, the more you will enjoy Sudoku!\n\nOur multi-stage hint system starts with a gentle reminder to get you back on track, and works up to demonstrate the exact technique to use. Our hints ease those frustrating moments and teach you how to be a better player.\n\nFeatures include:\n\n- Puzzle generator for unlimited play\n- 17 difficulty levels, something for everyone\n- Tutorial teaches you new techniques\n- Enter games from the newspaper\n- Solver helps you with games from the newspaper\n- Advanced techniques at the higher levels, including X-Wings, sashimi fish, and XY-Chains\n- Choice of six color schemes\n- Undo/redo\n- Automatic or manual pencil marks\n- Save your game while you try alternatives\n- Highlighting helps you discover patterns\n- Game clock; compares your time to other players\n- Avoids graphic frills that distract from play\n- Choice of digit styles, including Kanji and Hanzi\n\nAll games are true Sudoku, with symmetry and a single solution that can be discovered by logic alone. If you doubt that a puzzle can be solved by logic, simply have the hint system explain it to you step by step.\n\nIf you enjoy Sudoku, this is the app for you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/kfvcgkjxkmi5zuhbnrwf.jpg'),(7255,'Maze Art: Blue','2021-12-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Maze Art: Blue - is a minimalist game of simple mazes with relaxing music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kt9.jpg'),(7256,'Evangeline','2017-01-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Evangeline is a short story of love and connections, and was inspired by the loss of one of the game developer\'s, Nicholas Laborde, grandfather.\n\nSet in a monochrome neighborhood, Evangeline uses color as a primary mechanic to guide players through the world. Evangeline has been created with dedicated color blind accessibility options after a gif of Evangeline’s color mechanic was posted to reddit and imgur in early December, and went viral with 1.6 million views.\n\nThe game has been designed as a fifteen-minute story that the developers hope will help players connect with their loved ones, while there is still time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ngp.jpg'),(7257,'Echoes of You','2023-06-03','Point-and-click, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Echoes of You is a point n click visual novel about leaving behind a loved one and remember them for life. Play as a Vivienne, a vampire, who decides to visit her girlfriend\'s house one last time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6le3.jpg'),(7258,'Touhou Spell Bubble: Character Pack Hata no Kokoro','2022-07-14','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','Introducing \"Hata no Kokoro\" the expressive pokerface!\nHas the \"Combo Morph: 3 Types\" ability that gives you three types of Special Bubbles depending on the color of your fifth combo.\nWhen the 5th combo is performed by a red/purple bubble, a \"Flam Bubble\" appears on the opponent\'s field.\nYellow/Green will grant you a \"Thunderswipe Bubble\", and Blue will grant you a Paint Bubble.\nAlso, the Spell Card is a distinctive character!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4z9u.jpg'),(7259,'Ultimate Epic Battle Simulator 2','2022-05-12','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Ultimate Epic Battle Simulator 2, the most ridiculous and insane battle simulator in existence! Create eye watering battles with hundreds of thousands, even millions of characters on screen! Jump into multiple campaigns in game or player made, or play in sandbox mode and FPS invasion','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pbh.jpg'),(7260,'Lunch A Palooza','2020-07-22','Fighting, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Lunch A Palooza is a fast-paced multiplayer party game, the goal is to be the last food standing. You must use special “attacks” to push other meals off the table, using food-related items, whilst dodging endemic enemies, as well as making use of power-ups, and utilizing traps to foil opponents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eqp.jpg'),(7261,'Chouchou Jiken Rhapsodic','2017-11-30','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','Chouchou Jiken Rhapsodic is an otome visual novel with both romance and drama elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30cd.jpg'),(7262,'Pinball FX3: Star Wars Pinball - Balance of the Force','2017-09-26','Simulator, Strategy, Pinball','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Feel the disturbance in the Force in Star Wars Pinball: Balance of the Force, featuring three brand new original pinball tables immersing fans in the most iconic moments of the Star Wars universe.\n\nThe pack includes Star Wars: Episode VI Return of the Jedi, Starfighter Assault, and a table dedicated to Darth Vader.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vymyplseit4lpi4n2waj.jpg'),(7263,'Cops N\' Zombies',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Cops N\' Zombies is a multiplayer horror social deduction game. You and your police team are to investigate an area but one of you is secretly a zombie, whose goal is to kill everyone. You can find guns and defend yourselves, except the zombie is able to transform at will, so who do you trust?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qsn.jpg'),(7264,'Test Your Math','2017-03-26','Puzzle, Strategy, Quiz/Trivia, Indie','Android, iOS','Test your Math will help you master your math skills! Collect brain points to unlock more game modes and get new characters! Use power-ups to get more brain points. This is a perfect game for math lovers and those who want to learn math in a fun way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/v4kw0guzh3eeangrh4qc.jpg'),(7265,'Truck & Camping Collection',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Perfect holidays? Caravanning and offroad!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ahv.jpg'),(7266,'Marathon: Rubicon X','2010-08-20','Shooter','Linux, Mac','Marathon: Rubicon X is considered by some the unofficial fourth chapter in the Marathon series.\n\nRubicon X features all new high-resolution artwork, new and updated maps, and enough surprises to feel like a whole new game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co831d.jpg'),(7267,'Multi Turret Academy','2024-01-18','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Multi Turret Academy is a top-down tank shooter game where you serve as the commander of various WWII tanks to participate in tank battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73gf.jpg'),(7268,'Marvel Nemesis: Rise of the Imperfects','2005-09-20','Fighting','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','Marvel Nemesis: Rise of the Imperfects pits fierce Marvel superheroes against each other in a 3D fighting game. You can assume control of heroes such as the Punisher, Spider-Man, and Captain America, and duel with them in interactive and destructible environments. A new team of superheroes called the Imperfects joins the mayhem. You can play in single-player story mode to unlock collectible awards, or you can play against other gamers in multiplayer modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e7a.jpg'),(7269,'Put Pud Nudli\'s Adventure','2022-05-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a hero who saves the island of cats. Explore these varied areas of this island. Fight Chef The Cat’s creatures and after that face the meowing horror. The game is hard, but if you can give it time, you will become better and better.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ofs.jpg'),(7270,'Basketball Classics','2019-12-18','Sport, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','5 on 5 Pro Basketball born from the golden era of sports games. This spiritual successor to the 8-bit ballers bridges the gap between retro and today’s simulation games. \n \nSide-scrolling, sweaty arcade action with simplified 3-button gameplay and retro vibes galore. Explore decades of rosters featuring 160+ teams and 800+ players – all with individualized attributes. Introducing the first seamless play calling system of its kind, along with sensational cut scenes. Single player Story Mode unlocks secret teams or engage in endless scream-inducing local multiplayer. \n \nLace up those hi-tops, hot shot. It\'s time to show us what you got.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v95.jpg'),(7271,'VBR Clash','2024-08-06','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','VBR Clash is a challenging platformer where you must go through exasperating and sometimes maddening levels that requires skill and precision to complete. The different gamemodes will offers you different platforming experience to bring you one step closer to mastering the art of platforming.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8n97.jpg'),(7272,'Suki!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7273,'Funny Archery','2019-10-04','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the role of a brave and clever soldier, your mission is to protect the wall from enemy attacks till your last breath with a bow as the main weapon. The enemies become increasingly dangerous through each wave , so the player must keep focusing on each shot to ensure no enemy will pass through the wall.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co400j.jpg'),(7274,'Legends Of Heropolis DX','2024-06-04','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Android, Nintendo Switch','Build the town of Heropolis.Gather your strongest heroes and destroy Evilcorp!\nThe town of Heropolis has been destroyed! Can you rebuild it to be the center of justice once more?\nGrow your heroes, gather your friends, and battle evil in this superhero simulation game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uzf.jpg'),(7275,'Cyberpunk Speed Assassin','2024-12-26','Shooter','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Control time, strike fast, or don’t survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s56.jpg'),(7276,'Dead Estate','2021-10-19','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dead Estate is a gory, fast-paced top-down shooter roguelike with a heavy emphasis on Halloween and horror. Ascend four floors of a monster-filled mansion with two different playable characters, 25 different weapons to choose from, and 50 different items to aid you along the way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sqr.jpg'),(7277,'Rite of Life',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rite of Life is a life-sim RPG. It features a player-driven open world where you start with a small encampment. Through exploring, battling and gathering resources you can turn your home into a prospering town.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5aqy.jpg'),(7278,'The Anacrusis','2022-01-13','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Anacrusis is a four-player, cooperative first-person shooter set aboard a massive starship stranded at the edge of explored space. Team up with your friends in an infinitely-replayable fight against alien hordes to unlock perks, weapons, and new ways to play that you can share with your team!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bgn.jpg'),(7279,'BrainRot','2025-02-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A party pvp game based on brainrot trends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kka.jpg'),(7280,'Medieval Pathfinder',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jwr.jpg'),(7281,'Toaplan Arcade Shoot\'em Ups 3',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jwv.jpg'),(7282,'Pro Pinball: Timeshock!','1997-12-31','Pinball','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation','Timeshock! is a 1997 pinball computer game developed by Cunning Developments and published by Empire Interactive. It is the second game in the Pro Pinball series, and is themed around the concept of time travel. \n \nThe inclusion of a time machine fixture on the table facilitates the game\'s time travel theme. At any one time the player is in one of a handful of time zones, the main ones being: The Present Day, The Distant Future, Ancient Rome and The Prehistoric Age. Completion of certain objectives allows the player to travel between time zones (although some must be unlocked first, by means of completing secondary objectives). \n \nAlthough the basic method of playing is persistent across time zones, the details of particular awards and objectives are themed towards the current time, for example, you might be awarded with a ray gun in the future, whilst in the present day you might be awarded with a magnet. This provides variety, and helps facilitate a wider set of goals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co262a.jpg'),(7283,'Exist Archive: The Other Side of the Sky','2015-12-17','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','The game is set within modern day Tokyo, Japan, alongside a world on another planet, called “Protolexa.” There are a dozen young protagonists, all of whom are evil, soul-collecting gods who have become embroiled in the issues of all gods. The main focus of the game is dungeon crawling. You’ll be able to explore dungeons from a side-view perspective, while the characters are presented in a 3D, chibi-sized style. The characters can use various skills like jumping, dashing, and more to solve puzzles. The enemies are not randomized, they are presented on screen prior to battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b6y.jpg'),(7284,'Hillthorn','2025-05-02','Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a mysterious mountains to find a missing person in this card-based investigation game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9sgz.jpg'),(7285,'Crash Presents: July 1989','1989-07-01','Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','ZX Spectrum','Covertape compilation included with Crash Magazine issue 66. Included were four full ZX Spectrum games, including the original release of \'Quondam\', later published by Ocean, and \'A Whole New Ball Game.\'','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co956j.jpg'),(7286,'RPG Maker VX Ace','2011-12-15','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RPG Maker VX Ace is the latest and greatest engine in the RPG Maker series, improving on every aspect of creating your very own epic adventure. The most powerful editor yet, Ace supports multiple tilesets, offers full control over autoshadow and has a very flexible features system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n1p.jpg'),(7287,'Spa Mania 2','2016-09-28','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Jade make her Spas more efficient!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1scx.jpg'),(7288,'Hoshizora no Memoria -Eternal Heart-','2010-01-29','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The fandisc for Hoshizora no Memoria. \n \nIt contains addition story routes as a sequel to complete the Yume and Mare routes of Hoshizora no Memoria, as well as an additional side story for the other heroines of the game. \n \nThe HD rerelease of Hoshizora no Memoria includes this fan-disc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fcy.jpg'),(7289,'Battle Bruise 2','2020-01-21','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Back again, not messy, but MESS ITSELF!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lzq.jpg'),(7290,'Veecaloid Pop','2015-06-11','Music, Arcade','iOS','The object of Veecaloid is to gather various objects littered across the screen, themed to either a Magical Girl or pop idol. The main character is a vocaloid based on (and voiced by) voice actress/singer Cristina Vee.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lcjglyx6qr9k6ylltj92.jpg'),(7291,'Retro Sports Bundle',NULL,'Simulator, Sport','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ds2.jpg'),(7292,'Dafen Oil Painting Village: An Immersive Reality','2018-11-15','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dafen Oil Painting Village: An Immersive Reality is a virtual reality experience about global creation, emerging technologies, and the future of media.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7293,'Card Shark: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Adventure, Card & Board Game','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4txr.jpg'),(7294,'R-Type DX','1999-07-01','Shooter, Arcade','Game Boy Color','It\'s five games in one! R-Type I and II for Game Boy pocket, R-Type I and II color-enhanced for Game Boy Color, and the all-new R-Type DX for the Game Boy Color.\n\nTear through Bydo defenses as you blast enemies with your Fire Chain, Super Laser and Bubble Beam. Take the fight to a fevered pitch with two pulse-pounding rapid-fire modes on your Game Boy Color system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d8q.jpg'),(7295,'Urusei Yatsura: Miss Tomobiki wo Sagase!','1992-07-03','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy','A Urusei Yatsura role-playing game for Game Boy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ieb.jpg'),(7296,'My Universe: Doctors and Nurses','2021-12-13','Simulator','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Step into the shoes of a doctor or a nurse! Diagnose illnesses and infections so you can treat and help your many patients. Set out on an adventure in a buzzing hospital environment, meet all sorts of characters and discover a story full of surprises!\n\nPlay as two new hospital recruits! Gradually realize that your day-to-day existence is going to be anything but restful. Build relationships with the other members of your team and get to know their personalities. Over the course of your next adventure, you’ll take care of various patients, listen to them carefully to understand their symptoms and play fun mini-games to treat them. Every day is a new challenge with its fair share of surprises including a rival colleague called Doctor Pierce! Try not to let him distract you from your patient’s care!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3za6.jpg'),(7297,'Spark the Electric Jester 2','2020-09-07','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Following right after the ending of the original Spark the Electric Jester, you\'ll take control of Fark, now in the third dimension, in his quest to find out his true identity! Speed through several fast paced platforming stages, action packed bosses and fully animated cutscenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zfb.jpg'),(7298,'The Sinking City: Investigator Pack','2019-06-27','Adventure','Xbox One','Upgrade your gaming experience with an exclusive private investigator outfit, permanent access to a first aid kit, antipsychotics and a crafting materials starter pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8imd.jpg'),(7299,'Rising Heat',NULL,'Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rising Heat is a fast-paced horde survival game combining momentum-based movement with strategic, deck-builder-style upgrades. Play the demo today and face waves of cyborg enemies, multi-stage bosses, and bullet-hell battles. Customize your build with powerful ‘hacks,’ discover synergies, and unlock new pilots and ships for endless variety. Experiment with Rising Heat’s Fusion mechanic to create unique playstyles and dominate the arena!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x5x.jpg'),(7300,'Shattered Souls',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hell hath no fury like a woman scorned, and you will not forget the betrayals inflicted upon you. With a mark that ties your fate to seven men, you’re determined to lay waste those who tried to shatter you. Will you try again?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93n8.jpg'),(7301,'Sakuna: Of Rice and Ruin - Collector\'s Edition','2020-11-10','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','This version contains:\n\n- Game Sakuna: Of Rice and Ruin\n- 132 page art book\n- Complete soundtrack on 3 CDs\n- Double-sided poster\n- Collector\'s Edition Box','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kdv.jpg'),(7302,'Cubixx HD','2019-10-03','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Cubixx HD is a fast paced action puzzle game which sends high scoring, combo chasing gameplay to the third dimension! \n \nPlay through the epic 50 level arcade mode, challenge your skills to the limit in 50 challenges or take on the world in over 150 online leaderboards! If that isn’t enough you can join forces with friends in the 7 player co-op or destroy each other in the 7 player Deathmatch!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26bx.jpg'),(7303,'Mimicry','2022-08-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mimicry is a minimalist 2D puzzle-platformer where you control 2 characters at once in 100 levels. However, one character\'s controls are inverted, so each level feels like a puzzle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gxk.jpg'),(7304,'Rd Mars','2022-01-19','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RD Mars is a top-down shooter where you play as an AI reconstruction of a once-great inventor, Felix Darwins. Explore the laboratory, and learn of his rise and downfall.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lz3.jpg'),(7305,'Guild Receptionist 2: Stardust Liberate','2024-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Become the receptionist of the guild and protect your precious daily life! This is a simulation game of a receptionist. Whether you run around to protect your village, follow the king, or expose the darkness that pervades the country, the future depends on your choice!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bbp.jpg'),(7306,'Auto Dealership Tycoon','2015-10-23','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome to Auto Dealership Tycoon, own and operate your own car dealership.  \n \nWatch your Customer Satisfaction Rating, if it sinks too low customers will stop coming! \n \nSpecial customers will visit your Dealership on occasion! Sometimes good, sometimes bad.  \n \nCustomer Satisfaction Rating \nUsed Car Auctions \nTrade-ins \nBuy Competing Dealerships \nWeather \n35+ Improvements  \n5 Buildings \n8 Brands \n25 Cars \nAdjustable Pricing \nRandom Events','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7307,'Build A World',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7308,'Escape the Tank','2021-02-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','a simple 3d platform game set inside a fish tank. the aim of the game is to escape the tank by exploring the surroundings, avoiding hazards, solving problems and traversing platforms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4637.jpg'),(7309,'Shop Empire 2','2012-07-06','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The popular Shop Empire game sequel. With more booths, new facilities, a fun new parking system for cars and trains. But sadly also more clever thiefs that want to rob your shops! Build a bigger and better shopping mall, hire staff members to run the place smoothly. Shop Empire 2 is a detailed and free resource management game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ac5.jpg'),(7310,'Mama Die and Retry','2023-01-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mama Die and Retry is an old school action platformer that offers a challenging experience through 26 levels and 4 bosses. Fight with a working class hero and discover new horizons filled with a lot of aliens and threats. Use your broom against them. Each time you die, you will retry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ezv.jpg'),(7311,'You Shall Not Break!','2018-12-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Are you ready for some serious clicking? You Shall Not Break! is the ultimate clicker/arcade game. Make your way through 16 levels in 4 different environments and show you are the best! Prepare for moments of excitement, tears, anger, not to mention finger cramps!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l6k.jpg'),(7312,'Bells & Whistles','1991-03-01','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','Detana!! TwinBee is a vertically scrolling shoot \'em up game following the same conventions established in the original TwinBee, where players assume the role of Light and Pastel taking control of TwinBee and WinBee across seven levels to defeat invading forces of the evil alien Iva and save planet Meru.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nhb.jpg'),(7313,'Cassette Beasts: New Wirral Edition','2025-04-07','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','A perfect fit for savvy collectors is Cassette Beasts\' New Wirral Edition! Includes the base game and all DLCs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nhd.jpg'),(7314,'Hellgate VR','2021-03-31','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hellgate VR is a new VR game in the Hellgate series. This is a story about the fight of mankind for survival in the war against the devil. For all mankind! We need you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co429x.jpg'),(7315,'What\'s Your Story?',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7316,'The Valiant: Coat of Arms collection',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6t1c.jpg'),(7317,'Outriders','2021-04-01','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Outriders is a 1-3 player co-op RPG shooter set in an original, dark and desperate sci-fi universe. As mankind bleeds out in the trenches of Enoch, you’ll create your own Outrider and embark on a journey across the hostile planet. With rich storytelling spanning a diverse world, you’ll leave behind the slums and shanty towns of the First City and traverse forests, mountains and desert in the pursuit of a mysterious signal. Combining intense gunplay with violent powers and an arsenal of increasingly twisted weaponry and gear-sets, Outriders offers countless hours of gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e4r.jpg'),(7318,'Mir 4','2021-08-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Legacy Mobile Device','Mir 4 is a free-to-play open world Asian-fantasy MMORPG that can be cross-played on both PC and mobile devices. Mir 4 is full of action and features numerous large scale clan PVP battles. Join now and become a legend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3iq6.jpg'),(7319,'LittleBigPlanet 3: Baroque Costume',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co979z.jpg'),(7320,'Jam and the Mystery of the Mysteriously Spooky Mansion','2019-10-13','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The detective prodigy Jam already knows who did the crime, but what the crime actually was remains to be determined.\n\nIt\'s up to you to guide Jam through eight rooms of point-and-click puzzles, gather evidence, and deduce what really happened in the Mystery of the Mysteriously Spooky Mansion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co279w.jpg'),(7321,'Syphon Filter: Dark Mirror','2006-09-29','Shooter','Super NES CD-ROM System, PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','Dark Mirror is the sequel to Syphon Filter: The Omega Strain. In Dark Mirror, a mysterious operation at an Alaskan oil reserve has Gabe Logan investigating the cause. He is quickly presented with a deeper operation that has him venturing across the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gfu.jpg'),(7322,'Sakura Stars','2020-05-21','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','When hordes of Youkai threaten the world, the Tanukis send a messenger to choose human girls to receive magical powers to defend humanity. They are known as SAKURA STARS. This is a horizontal shmup made on Pico-8, a retro fantasy console with purposeful limitations to simulate an 8-bit era console.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lax.jpg'),(7323,'Psy-O-Blade','1990-04-27','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC-9800 Series, PC-8800 Series, Sharp X1, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, FM-7, MSX2','In 21th century, there are three main powers on the Earth. The free world and the communist block carried over from the 20th century; the third power is the New Communist Federation. Since a program of denuclearizing was supported by all those powers, the New Communist Federation developed a devastating non-nuclear weapon: the satellite \"Raiden\". The two other powers competed with the New Communist Federation, developing their own killer satellites, and the danger of total annihilation became once again an issue. Seeing no future for the Earth, humans started to colonize other planets. In 22th century, they sent an experimental ship \"Septemius 1\" to a star six light years far away from the Solar System. The ship\'s main computer, \"Racoon\", sent a strange message before stopping any communication. Keith McDonnell, a seventeen-year-old crew member of the ship \"Septemius 2\", was sent to investigate the strange disappearance. Psy-O-Blade is a Japanese adventure in anime style. The player interacts with the game world by moving a cursor and clicking on objects to examine or use them, and people to talk to them, or by choosing options (\"Move\" and \"Scroll\") from a menu. There are no puzzles to solve; the player advances in the game by talking to characters, visiting different locations, as well as examining and using objects.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a88.jpg'),(7324,'Naraka: Bladepoint - Iris\' Whisper Pack','2023-12-20','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tarka Ji Legendary Outfit [Justice·Iris\' Whisper], Tarka Ji Legendary Hairstyle [Justice·Hue]','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7325,'Mysterious Puzzles Collection: Nemezis, Schizm, Reah',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hqn.jpg'),(7326,'Meanwhile',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','An Interactive Comic Book','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7327,'Ys III: Wanderers from Ys','1991-11-01','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','TurboGrafx-16 Port of \"Ys III: Wanderers of Ys\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bj5.jpg'),(7328,'The Demon Crystal','2018-12-20','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC-8800 Series, PC (Microsoft Windows), MSX, Nintendo Switch','Originally released in 1984 for the MZ-1500.\n\nFrom MobyGames:\nDemon Crystal is an action puzzle game. Scattered around the stage are numerous keys which help open locked areas. The goal is to find the big key which is needed to open the exit and advance to the next stage. Ares\' only weapon is a limited number of bombs, which explode in a flame and can kill multiple enemies at once. The game consists of 30 stages (houses).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23tm.jpg'),(7329,'Bunker 58','2017-06-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When waking up in a Bunker after visiting to shoot a short film, you notice your best friend is missing. You must go on a search for your best friend based off an unfinished bloody note that was left behind. Finding him will not be easy, and finding your way out... Well that will only add to the difficulty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a1k.jpg'),(7330,'Arm of Revenge Re-Edition','2021-01-14','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Arm of Revenge\" A arcade style platform action game, get more experience, learn new skills, upgrade equipment, Touching story, smooth moves, more than 30 skills to combo, 3 types of arm to change, survival mode...and more!, quickly with the hand of revenge kill all enemies.Enjoy it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co583u.jpg'),(7331,'Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War: Lord of Skulls',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dxj.jpg'),(7332,'Otokomizu','2019-10-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Hovering in the sky over Edo City with a loincloth! A jet pack firefighting 3D action feelinggame with the most mysterious operation ever!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qwl.jpg'),(7333,'AKB1/149: Renai Sousenkyo','2012-12-20','Visual Novel','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable','AKB1/149: Renai Sousenkyo is the third entry of the AKB1/48 dating sim series, now featuring all promoted members from AKB48, SKE48, NMB48, and HKT48.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4aus.jpg'),(7334,'Intruder','1981-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','Intruder is an arcade game originally released by Konami as Space War. It is a one-on-one spaceship combat game with each player controlling a ship at the top or bottom of the screen. Between the players is a stream of innocent space ship traffic limiting the possibility of getting a clean shot.\n\nWhen your fuel reaches a high number (like 75 or so) your laser will reach the other side of the screen to get your opponent. Once you fire your laser your fuel drops sharply and you must wait for it to build before you can shoot at your opponent again.\n\nSpace War is Konami\'s first known original video game design. It was licensed by Taito, who released it as Space Laser (in Europe), and by Game Plan, who released it as Intruder (in North America).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yzx.jpg'),(7335,'Raging Tiger: The Second Korean War','2004-08-16','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Raging Tiger: The Second Korean War is an extremely complicated strategy game from ProSIM Company and Shrapnel Games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xencjluhaqzrp3znhz57.jpg'),(7336,'Kingdom: New Lands - Royal Edition',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cd0.jpg'),(7337,'Tetris Party Deluxe','2010-09-03','Puzzle','Wii, Nintendo DS','Tetris Party makes its way to the Nintendo DS and Wii. Deluxe features six new game modes and four new enhanced modes of play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cyk.jpg'),(7338,'Hidden Shapes Animals: VR',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Tired after a hard day at work? Now, with the help of VR, you will delve deep into an environment exclusively prepared for you to have fun and rescue your tranquility, surprising yourself with each solved puzzle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5eao.jpg'),(7339,'Zombie Army 4: Dead War - Renegade Officer Character',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Loyalty to the Fuhrer? Not likely! Werner Sauer was a legend throughout the Afrika Korps for his bravery under fire, but when he put a lethal end to an occult ritual conducted by an SS Officer, he was sent to a penal battalion as punishment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t5y.jpg'),(7340,'Stellar Checkpoint',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Inspect alien documents as Earth\'s first interstellar border agent. Verify passports, detect forgeries, and make crucial decisions that impact human-alien relations. Can you keep Earth safe while navigating complex intergalactic regulations?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lxz.jpg'),(7341,'Chlorofell','2025-02-14','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chlorofell focused on mastering quick thinking and manual reloading. You play as a soldier of nature’s wrath, and fight through a factory of environments where plants and technology collide, and squads of enemies coordinate to stop you.\n\nWith a limited shield covering your fragile amount of health, you can be easily overwhelmed, but through mastering the speed of movement, manual reloading, and the specialized ammo you’ll find along the way, you just may make it all the way to the source of this scourge and have the chance to finish this fight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hl7.jpg'),(7342,'Red Ops: The First Infection','2024-09-26','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Red Ops: The First Infection is an engaging ​BL/yaoi visual novel (18+) ​featuring hardships, world-ending events, zombies, love and intimacy. Follow our characters as they embrace their sexuality and explore their newfound romance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79e5.jpg'),(7343,'Rally 9000','2023-03-30','Racing, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rally 9000 is a simple 3D rally game. Complete tracks as fast as possible, and unlock levels and upgrades!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lxx.jpg'),(7344,'Arena Wars 2','2012-10-12','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Arena Wars 2 is the sequel of the award-winning Arena Wars series and combines revolutionary RTS fights with RPG elements. Join the Battlefield of the future and prove your skills in fast paced multiplayer matches as well as against the advanced AI. Stunning maps, highly detailed units, powerful upgrades and skills as well as a best balanced gameplay offer intensive fights in a spectacular Sci-Fi scenario.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a29.jpg'),(7345,'Ruku\'s Heart Balloon','2025-04-20','Puzzle, Indie, Card & Board Game','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A cute adventure story about a rabbit, Ruku, and a cat, Lish, just like in a picture book. Make a \"heart balloon\" with the flower puzzle. How far can you fly in the sky?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67ub.jpg'),(7346,'Luminos','2019-04-11','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','When the colours of the world are no more… Little Lumi must embark on a journey across a variety of wonderful sceneries to bring them back. Let the adventure begin!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4iv7.jpg'),(7347,'在末日前夕等待放晴','2019-02-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the May of the Month, one of the Tamshui’s school had wind & rain always. Jia Wei, a campus student who met a girl called Gabriel in the graduation of the eve. Many types of coincidence connected them together, running repeatedly in campus on rainy day.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7348,'Fight High','2020-02-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','If you enjoy absolute chaos, blasting enemies to pieces and being surrounded by an overwhelming amount of enemies then this game is for you! How far can you go?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wyc.jpg'),(7349,'The Little Crane That Could','2015-04-27','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Little Crane is back! And it brought its friends to play in the dirt. \nDriving and operating heavy machinery is a blast! \nTest your operating skills in this simulator game with a diverse set of challenges. \nUse the crane to load an unload, the bulldozer to shape the terrain, and an excavator to dig up the terrain.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7350,'Island Rescue','2025-03-08','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Rescue the stranded in this addictive puzzler','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kgd.jpg'),(7351,'Run For Rum: A Pirate Tale','2014-07-02','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Run For Rum: A Pirate Tale is a strategy game whose core mechanics are based on classic board games like Chess and Checkers.\n\nThe player takes control of Short Legs Bill, a fisherman with an extraordinary talent for telling lies. The adventure begins when Jake, his best friend who had enough of the lies told by Bill, decides to curse him making his biggest lie reality. This lie is nothing more nothing less than Road Jack the most terrible tyrant of the seven seas.\n\nThe main theme of Run for Rum is the life of a pirate, and the goal of the game is to combine strategy with an entertaining narrative in a way that challenge and fun comes together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yr1.jpg'),(7352,'Cursed Exped','2022-06-19','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take part in the first journey of the Cursed Exped. Your mission is to cleanse cursed items in a haunted house. Use your tools to locate and investigate items. Create a ritual area to mark your location of interest and bring items with energy there to progress through the game. Be careful though, the unknown is always watching you and waiting around every corner. Stay safe and happy investigating.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tnq.jpg'),(7353,'Kursor','2021-08-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this game, the ball chases the mouse cursor, so you\'ll have to overcome the inertia of movement and a multitude of obstacles. Innovative gameplay, simple controls but difficult to master! This is Kursor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5in3.jpg'),(7354,'Hyperdimension Neptunia Re;Birth2: Sisters Generation - DLC Pack 2',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d4b.jpg'),(7355,'Mad Machines','2019-02-28','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mad Machines, a new indie online multiplayer PC game that puts you in control of a magnetic robot gladiator. Teams of 3 face off in a hockey-like game (only there’s a spike-ball instead of a puck) that requires precise skill and an eagerness to kick ass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yw9.jpg'),(7356,'Braise Satan','2024-11-11','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BRAISE SATAN is a frantic cooking game set in Hell. Chop, fry, and blend your way to heaven, while fighting off the mischievous imps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mfa.jpg'),(7357,'Skautfold: Moonless Knight','2020-03-04','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Skautfold: Moonless Knight is a very open-ended Metroidvania, featuring a totally unique battle system. Set in an alternate history Japan in 1900, Lovecraftian horrors have plagued the world, as our very Moon opens up and becomes our end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co403r.jpg'),(7358,'Warplanes: WW2 + Space Commander Bundle','2024-12-12','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy','Nintendo Switch','Become a legend of air combat! Two thrilling flight combat games together - Warplanes: WW2 Dogfight and Space Commander: War and Trade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co959d.jpg'),(7359,'Stockfish Chess','2014-01-22','Strategy','Mac','Stockfish is a powerful chess analysis app. Play two-player games on the beautiful chess board, or get instant accurate analysis of any game. Stockfish will tell you who\'s winning and calculate the best move.\n\nFeatures:\n\nINTERACTIVE, IMMERSIVE BOARD\nStockfish has a gorgeous board that looks fantastic on Retina Displays. It\'s full of nice touches: when you click or drag a piece, its destination squares are highlighted in yellow, and the best move is shown with a red arrow. Plus, you can go full screen for the most immersive chess experience.\n\nTOP-NOTCH CHESS ANALYSIS\nAnalysis is powered by the Stockfish chess engine, the strongest free chess engine in the world. You\'re getting top-notch analysis that surpasses the strongest human chess grandmasters.\n\nADVANCED FEATURES\nStockfish has many enhancements for advanced users. You can browse through multi-game PGN files, copy and paste FEN strings, utilize Syzygy endgame tablebases, and use MultiPV.\n\nFREE AND OPEN SOURCE\nStockfish is completely free, and the source code is available on our website (stockfishchess.org) under the GPLv3 license.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ugtrhiksvdkmjekcbesf.jpg'),(7360,'They Are Hundreds','2020-12-23','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','They Are hundreds is a sandbox first-person survival. Build great walls, fight great hordes of varying types, or just have a goof with friends in multiplayer.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7361,'Anne in the Sky',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Anne conquers the skies in a timeless adveture','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7362,'You Are a Failed Murderer',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A visual novel passed through an image compressor Play as a murder unsure of his entire life, down to his name. But you have a mission. One you NEED to undertake.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9min.jpg'),(7363,'Streets of Rage','1993-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Handheld Electronic LCD','The LCD version of Streets of Rage is a handheld game released by Tiger Electronics based on the Sega game, Streets of Rage. It was released in both Electronic and Pocket Arcade form, although the former appears to be quite rare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sy3.jpg'),(7364,'X-Plane 12 Global Scenery: Africa','2022-09-16','Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','X-Plane 12 Global Scenery: Africa is a free DLC that you can activate through your Steam Client. It will give you the default Africa Scenery.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7365,'Giant Celebration','2018-12-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play at human scale or shrink down to the size of a toy! Giant Celebration is a VR hidden object game with a unique scale mechanic to let you play from any point of view. Help a lost dog find its owner; Reunite a chef with his unattended food cart; Get the band back together; Search living dioramas!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7366,'Completion LawnCare','2022-07-25','Simulator, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short game where you take strange lawn-mowing requests and eventually get yourself into some big trouble.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57w6.jpg'),(7367,'Slippery Richard!: He\'s Taller Than My Husband','2022-10-25','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An unplanned shotgun wedding! This isn’t the first time Yaya has made a mess of things and expected her mother to clean up... “When you truly love someone, you plan ahead—marriage is supposed to come before all that other stuff! Now I guess it’s up to me to test if he’s really husband material...”','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rj4.jpg'),(7368,'Sega Ages 2500 Vol.17: Phantasy Star Generation 2','2014-08-20','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 2','This game is much like Phantasy Star Generation: 1, except that it stands as a remake of Phantasy Star II. Like the first \"Generation\" a number of tweaks were made to bring it in line with more modern RPGs, and the graphics and sound have been updated.\n\nAlso included is an emulated version of the Mega Drive Phantasy Star II (the Japanese version).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zz5.jpg'),(7369,'The Settlers: New Allies - Deluxe Edition','2023-02-17','Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Upgrade your game experience with the Deluxe Edition including the game, the Deluxe Pack and additional digital content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56te.jpg'),(7370,'NEStalgia','2014-03-02','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','NEStalgia is an original multiplayer RPG inspired by the glory days of traditional console RPGs. Essentially \"Dragon Warrior 3 meets World of Warcraft\", NEStalgia is an amalgam of the best generations of RPG gaming. Players wage classic turn based battles in multiplayer parties while enjoying modern trappings such as a full-featured quest system. Those who prefer to go solo can recruit almost any monster in the game to fight alongside them as they explore every nook and cranny of NEStalgia\'s expansive 8-bit world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qtp.jpg'),(7371,'Liferaft: Zero',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','This is a browser super meat boy type platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qn8zqz906j212lrpeg6v.jpg'),(7372,'Cowboys vs. Zombies','2024-12-12','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Fight for survival in the Wild West!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ajz.jpg'),(7373,'Thumper','2016-12-18','Music, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Meta Quest 2, Google Stadia, PlayStation VR2, PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, SteamVR, PlayStation 5, Oculus Rift, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch, Oculus Quest','Thumper is a rhythm violence game. It combines classic rhythm-action with breakneck speed and brutal physicality.\nThumper strips rhythm gaming down to its core. Classic rhythm-action is combined with breakneck speed and brutal physicality. With one analog stick and one button, you control a space beetle while hurtling through stunning and treacherous worlds.\nThere\'s no blood or gore, but you\'ll feel the violence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z4e.jpg'),(7374,'Tower of Waifus 2','2021-06-17','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tower of Waifu 2 is a sokoban puzzle game. Conquer the tower, solve the puzzle and rescue your Waifus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44to.jpg'),(7375,'Rockin\' Pretty','2009-07-29','Music, Simulator','Nintendo DS','Get your groove on with Rockin\' Pretty, a music rhythm game starring four teenage girls trying to make it as rock stars. Select one of four instruments, including lead guitar, bass, keyboard, or drums, and then use your stylus to tap or strum on the touch screen in time to the beat. Earn applause and \"stars\" after each successful performance and move one step closer to fame and fortune. Accumulated stars can also be used to unlock additional clothing options, hairstyles, and instruments for personal use or to trade with others via wireless connection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66dy.jpg'),(7376,'Ultimate Fishing Simulator: Thailand',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d0k.jpg'),(7377,'No More Heroes 1 & 2','2021-10-07','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Burn rubber through the coastal city of Santa Destroy on Travis\' motorbike, the Schpeltiger! Unlock a devastating arsenal of pro wrestling moves from Power Bombs to Brain Busters. Unleash the powerful Dark Side to mow down the competition and show em who\'s boss! Dual wield beam katanas as Travis Touchdown to dial the hack and slash insanity up to 11! Jump through combat as the agile Shinobu or leave foes in the dust as Travis’ brother, Henry. Experience a blast from the past by playing 8 bit minigames to earn money and power up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4826.jpg'),(7378,'Taipan!','2009-12-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Web browser, Apple II, TRS-80','A turn-based strategy game based on the novel Tai-Pan by James Clavell, in which the player seeks riches through naval trade in East Asia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f66.jpg'),(7379,'Punk Wars: Hold the Line',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bke.jpg'),(7380,'Pee War!','2020-08-03','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play pee Superman and destroy the city and the forest! Destroy everything in your sight and avoid the human army attack!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co474l.jpg'),(7381,'Bomberman Blast','2008-09-30','Arcade','Wii','Look out for Bomberman Blast! There\'s 8-person online multiplayer and you can even use your Mii as a Bomberman!\n\nA brand new addition to the Bomberman series is available on WiiWare! Up to eight players can battle online simultaneously via Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection! Simple controls make this a great game for family and friends to enjoy at anytime! New items can be triggered by shaking the Wii Remote controller for excitement never before experienced in a Bomberman title! You can even take the intensity up another notch by adding your own Mii caricatures to the mix! Battle results can be recorded on Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection Ranking, so see how you stack up against others around the globe! This title will prove to be a blast for everyone--from those who\'ve never touched a Bomberman game, to the Bomberman masters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gjz.jpg'),(7382,'Urban Car Driver Simulator: City Explorer Challenge','2025-03-29','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Drive, explore, conquer – the city is yours!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kdc.jpg'),(7383,'Xenocrystal TD','2025-04-09','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Rogue-like Tower Defense game with 10 towers, 5 damage types, 20 abilities, and hundreds of upgrades. Select one or more upgrades to your towers and/or abilities at the end of each level that stay with you through your mission to protect the Xenocrystals. Limitless possibilities!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mva.jpg'),(7384,'Avant-Garde Discerning Paralleler','2013-12-30','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Avant-Garde Discerning Paralleler has a total of 16 selectable stages and 2 difficulty levels. There are 2 player teams to choose from: Ran Yakumo with Chen, and Seiga Kaku with Kyouko Kasodani. Each team has a different play style and a different set of stages to play.\n\nScoring revolves around the \"Connect Bonus\" system. Collecting special Connect items will start a time limit, during which any point items collected by the player will be added to the bonus. The time limit can be extended via Connect items and grazing. Should the player hold on to the bonus until the boss arrives, its value will be added to each of the boss\'s spell card bonuses, resulting in a vastly higher score. A high cumulative score is required to unlock the more difficult stages in the game.\n\nThe most recent version of the game (1.10) also includes a series of standalone \"Boss Challenges\". These boss battles feature unique rules regarding player characters, scoring and bombs, as well as a surprise guest appearance from the Seihou Project.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5b85.jpg'),(7385,'Connection of Worlds: Mirrored Earths - Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7386,'Annoy Squidward','2019-10-20','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Total conversion mod that transforms Springfield into Bikini Bottom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94rw.jpg'),(7387,'The Orphan A Tale of An Errant Ghost: Hidden Object Game','2020-01-06','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Orphan is filled with emotional story of Sarah, the orphan girl who mysteriously disappeared with her family. You as Sarah\'s cousin has lost your memory and has to find out the clues with the help of an unknown spirit while saving yourself from another ghost in an abandoned house.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co440d.jpg'),(7388,'Stardust Skate','2025-03-21','Sport, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Skate through Stardust Valley in this endless runner, competing for the highest score and the coolest deck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ifj.jpg'),(7389,'Go-Go Town!','2024-06-18','Simulator, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Plan, Build...Prosper? As mayor, it’s up to you to breathe life back into this rundown town. Construct shops, hire staff, automate deliveries with couriers, and attract tourists to town, all while managing infrastructure and avoiding catastrophes! Who said being mayor was going to be easy…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c2d.jpg'),(7390,'Please, Touch the Artwork','2022-01-26','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','What happens when you DO touch the artwork? Part Zen-puzzle, part narrative-adventure, you\'ll unravel the secret world behind iconic abstract paintings through over 160 puzzles. An aesthetic journey to the origins of modern art, set to a soothing jazzy soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4equ.jpg'),(7391,'Creature Battle Lab','2016-06-10','Fighting, Arcade','Android, iOS','Creature Battle Lab, an action-packed, 3D creature creator and battling game.\nEnter a world of bizarre science, filled with gene splicing and mixed up molecules. Become an intern at the famous ‘Creature Battle Lab’, experimenting with DNA to create a team of fearsome/cute/weird battling creatures. Unleash them in the lab arena and work your way up the leagues to prove yourself, as the ultimate creature “Pro”-fessor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/aoaru04yqwqrsmkiu7tt.jpg'),(7392,'PickCrafter','2017-12-14','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Mine gems, collect Pickaxes and discover treasure filled Biomes in PickCrafter!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xdd.jpg'),(7393,'AionGuard',NULL,'Sin género','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','AionGuard is a cancelled open world fantasy RPG from Avalanche Studios, that would have been released on PS3, X360 and PC. \n \nAionGuard was announced as being cancelled in Feburary 2010.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gf12cuk3pyoesryhunnq.jpg'),(7394,'The Love','2019-09-06','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Amy wakes up in a strange room. She seems to have lost all her memory. She only knows that there is a blue monster under the same roof. She needs to avoid the weird monster and escape from unknown houses. As time passed and groped, the weird monster tried to give her an Injection of a drug.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43yd.jpg'),(7395,'Hidden Robo Cats','2024-06-04','Point-and-click, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hidden Robo Cats - Find and paint 100 hidden cats in this biggest Robo Cat factory! Beep... Test your attention and relax in this cozy and free game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ai9.jpg'),(7396,'Emoji Kart Racer','2022-12-22','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Get behind the wheel with up to four players and race across 16 intense racetracks. The unique emoji generator also gives you the opportunity to create your own personal emoji racer from thousands of combinations.\n\nLet yourself be inspired by the colorful tracks with great music, funny sound effects and of course countless emoji\'s. Great emoji power-ups\nlike poop or rocket are also available!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yra.jpg'),(7397,'Table Tennis Pro','2021-03-04','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Ultimate Table Tennis (Ping-Pong) Simulator!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42uc.jpg'),(7398,'Fables Mosaic: Little Red Riding Hood','2020-02-03','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Help Little Red Riding Hood to bring candies to her Granny! It features a collection of colored puzzles solved by logic, while following the Little Red Riding Hood Story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jmg.jpg'),(7399,'The Orphaned Soul','2018-09-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A young girl, abandoned as an infant, goes on a search for her parents and identity in a dark fantasy world populated with foul beasts and nasty cuthroats.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7400,'Space Empires Complete Pack',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dxs.jpg'),(7401,'Aban Hawkins and the 1,001 Spikes','2011-01-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Old-school indie platformer for PS Vita.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ydedynba7uh3elouvjkq.jpg'),(7402,'Star Trek: Starfleet Command - Gold Edition','2016-11-22','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dozens of missions & more than 50 ship designs put you in the captain’s chair for an amazing real-time space combat experience commanding ships from the United Federation of Planets, the Klingon Empire, the Romulan Star Empire, the Hydran Kingdom, the Gorn Confederation or the Lyran Star Empire!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72d2.jpg'),(7403,'Sega 3D Classics Collection','2016-04-25','Puzzle, Racing, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo 3DS','Sega 3D Classics Collection is a Sega Genesis compilation game developed by M2 and published by Sega for the Nintendo 3DS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sp5.jpg'),(7404,'Sprawl','2023-08-23','Shooter, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','“You chose exile in search of penance, in place of revenge. I seek to give you both - and in return… I will be set free.” - FATHER\n\nEnter the dystopian world of SPRAWL, a hardcore retro FPS set in an endless cyberpunk megalopolis. Advances in cybernetics and artificial intelligence pushed humanity into a new era, but that golden age has crumbled…leaving behind a broken world.\n\nPlay as SEVEN, a disgraced special ops super soldier who finds herself embroiled in conflict with government forces trying to kill her while a mysterious voice in her head pushes her to survive. Betrayed by her organization and on a mission to overthrow the Junta, a military regime that rules the sprawl with an iron fist, SEVEN must escape the walled city and discover what secrets lie at the SPIRE.\n\nThe streets of the SPRAWL are vast and the armies of the corporate government seem endless. But the dark alleys and dilapidated apartment surfaces are all compatible with the “Icarus” cybernetic implant, allowing SEVEN to perform gravity-defying wall-running maneuvers and slow down time with excess adrenaline drops from dismembered enemies. With a horde of different troop types and carefully designed weapons, she will be pushed to the limit to survive.\n\nThe SPRAWL eventually consumes us all…will you fight your way out?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qcl.jpg'),(7405,'Dehumanized','2018-07-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DeHumanized is a Roguelite sidescroller action shooter inspired by Metroid and Binding of Isaac.The world runs on physical rules with elements interacted subtly with each other. To survive you have to take strength from beasts, and learn rules how the world works. Would you lose in killing and destroying or would you stick to belief and humanity? Would you uncover the truth behind this whole plague?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7406,'Tiny Troopers 2: Special Ops','2017-05-31','Shooter, Indie','Windows Phone, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Tiny Troopers are back and better than ever! Decked out in new uniforms and sporting the latest in military hardware, the troopers are just itching to get back into the fight! Test your mettle and lead your troopers to victory in four thrilling special operations!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28cx.jpg'),(7407,'Sakuya-san Crisis & SakuTaku','2013-05-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A discount bundle of a previously released ARPG and SRPG.\n\nThis game is sold exclusively on DLsite.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5091.jpg'),(7408,'Ages of Cataria','2024-03-31','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Care for generations of townsfolk in a land of mystique and wonder. Build colonies along side your friends in this multiplayer colony sim and narrative RPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rqb.jpg'),(7409,'Beatmania Append 3rdMix Mini','1998-11-27','Music','PlayStation','Beatmania Append 3rdMix Mini is a smaller version of the PlayStation game Beatmania Append 3rdMix, it contains the same features as the main version but only five songs: find out, life goes on, Queen\'s Jamaica, tribe groove, and wild I/O.\n\nThe game came bundled with the soundtrack for the bBeatmania 3rdMix arcade game, titled Beatmania 3rdMix complete.\n\nSince this is an Append release, it needs another Beatmania title to act as a key disc to boot the game.\n\nThe game is played with a controller with one turn table and 5 keys, three white and two black. On the screen you will see bars moving from the top to bottom in columns representing each of the keys and the turntable. When the bars reach the judgement line it is time to scratch.\n\nUnlike the arcade counterpart, the PlayStation version does not have a combo counter. Expert mode is also missing from this version of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2c2l.jpg'),(7410,'Rebels & Redcoats','2019-09-25','Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Rebels and Redcoats recreates the battlefields of the American Revolutionary War. The war began in 1775 when the American colonies rebelled against the British Empire, declaring their independence in 1776.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yc0.jpg'),(7411,'Idle Airport CEO','2025-02-27','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Step into the shoes of a savvy CEO and take control of your very own airport!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ope.jpg'),(7412,'Street Fighter V: Type Arcade','2019-03-14','Fighting','Arcade','A Japanese arcade cabinet version of Street Fighter V with some changes.\n\nThe arcade version uses a different/separate ranking system than the PS4 and PC versions of the game and a Fighter ID can be used to access some costumes already purchased on the account.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yyl.jpg'),(7413,'Forever Space','2018-03-07','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This experimental short story is more of an interactive experience than a \"game\". It is based on an original story by Catalina Leon and presented through key moments over several days. Play as Greg who must decide whether lapses in his memory are just paranoia, or something more sinister.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3jd7.jpg'),(7414,'Nickelodeon All-Star Brawl 2: Mr. Krabs Brawl Pack','2024-02-15','Fighting, Platform','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Featuring unique money mechanics that enhance abilities based on how much money he has aquired, Mr. Krabs from SpongeBob Squarepants joins Nickelodeon All-Star Brawl 2!\n\nThis pack features:\n• Playable brawler Mr. Krabs\n• Alternate Mr. Krabs costumes','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sul.jpg'),(7415,'Project One','2019-05-22','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Old School RPG. Sorry, Japanese Language Only. It is an old school RPG. In RPG, it enters the genre called puzzle RPG.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7416,'Sonic Scene Creator 5','2011-09-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Featuring 100s more sprites, backgrounds and many different kinds of elements to use to build your own scenes in this sonic scene creator flash game with this being the 5th instalment by Zhuburz.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9abf.jpg'),(7417,'Hentai Fantasy','2020-05-21','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Enjoy the beauty girls picture and relaxing music to complete the puzzle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46br.jpg'),(7418,'Dragon Quest Builders 2','2018-12-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dragon Quest Builders 2 is a block-building role-playing game with a charming campaign and a robust multiplayer building mode that supports up to four players online. Create your customized character, team-up with your fearless friend Malroth, gather the skills required to become a full-fledged builder, and combat the Children of Hargon, a vile cult that worships destruction! Then, take your builder online and join your friends to collaborate and create something truly magnificent. Don’t let the name fool you, despite the 2, this is a completely standalone experience featuring new characters, an expansive world, unlimited building combinations, and a storyline that’s sure to satisfy longtime fans and newcomers alike!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61vn.jpg'),(7419,'Dragon Quest X: Mirai he no Tobira to Madoromi no Shoujo Online','2024-03-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','This is the sixth major expansion for Dragon Quest X, known as Version 7, which will feature a new story, new characters, a new area called Zenias, and the new master vocation Dragon Mage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d8w.jpg'),(7420,'World Class Leaderboard','1987-12-31','Sport','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Mac, DOS, Amiga, Apple II, Amstrad CPC','Now you have the opportunity to play the same courses that have challenged golf’s greatest legends. World class leaderboard features three famous 18-hole golf courses and each hole authentically reproduces the distance, traps, trees, rough and water hazards of:\n\n-St. Andrews - The Most Revered Course in Golf\n-Doral Country Club - The Florida Blue Monster\n-Cypress Creek - The Largest and the Finest\n\nThe fourth course, designed specifically for “world class” is the “Gauntlet Country Club”. Only those who have mastered the best courses in the world should expect to come close to par at “The Gauntlet”.\n\n“World Class” will challenge you with the same strategy and option decisions you face in your real game. And because the look and feel are so life-like, it may improve your actual golf game as well!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qbx.jpg'),(7421,'The Mystery of the Planet Venus','2021-11-04','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Mystery of the Planet Venus is a single-player first-person adventure game set on the planet Venus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gab.jpg'),(7422,'4D Golf','2024-03-22','Puzzle, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore higher dimensions... with golf! With different visualizations, game modes, and a level editor, you\'ll gain a hands-on understanding of the 4th dimension and beyond.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co856c.jpg'),(7423,'Eragon','2006-11-14','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360, Game Boy Advance, Nintendo DS, PlayStation 2','Eragon is a third-person video game released for the PC, PlayStation 2, Xbox, and Microsoft Windows, developed by Stormfront Studios. Also released are unique versions of Eragon for the Game Boy Advance, Nintendo DS, PSP, and mobile phone handheld gaming systems, primarily developed by Amaze Entertainment.[1] \n \nThe game is based upon the Eragon film, which is in turn loosely based on the book Eragon, by Christopher Paolini. The games were released on November 14, 2006 in the United States of America, on November 24, 2006 in European[2] and on November 23, 2006 in Australia[3] in order to coincide with the release of the film. In the game the player takes on the role of the protagonist from the book and film, Eragon, and occasionally controls his dragon Saphira. \n \nThe game was generally received poorly by critics, usually receiving press averages around the 4-6 out of 10 region (or the equivalent).[4][5] The combined sales in North America were over 400,000 copies.[6]','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ouo.jpg'),(7424,'Mindcircus','2018-05-07','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Infu is a failed medical student on the verge of becoming an alcoholic.\nDue to his naturally gloomy personality, he has been living a depressing life and before the summer vacation, he finally faces the risk of repeating a grade.\nMeanwhile, he wins a ticket to travel to a tropical country in a lottery held by a credit card company. Infu throws everything away and goes on a trip in high spirits, but along the way he becomes involved in a mysterious series of murders.\nWill Infu be able to uncover the truth behind the incident? And will he be able to escape from the island!? Hurry up before you start experiencing withdrawal symptoms!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c5a.jpg'),(7425,'Schwarzschild III: Wakusei Desperan','1992-02-28','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC-9800 Series','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67rc.jpg'),(7426,'Requiescat','2021-10-02','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Requiescat is a sci-fi RPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yfu.jpg'),(7427,'Removed','2014-09-27','Sin género','Web browser','A Game and an Essay About Game Boy RPGs','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1x3u.jpg'),(7428,'Totems',NULL,'Platform','Sin plataforma','A parkour inspired game where you will be able to transform the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/t1b52sprrgg2nidbujql.jpg'),(7429,'Love Colors','2021-09-17','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Love Colors is the relaxing paint by numbers pixel art game. Choose from over 150 stylish paintings from lovable themes and become the Picasso of the pixel. Playable solo and up to 4-player couch co-op.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3tsg.jpg'),(7430,'Morwen Estate','2025-05-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The case was cold. The house was colder.\n\nDetective Ryan McMillan’s investigation into a string of missing persons cases brings him to the isolated Morwen Estate. But when a sudden blow leaves him unconscious, he awakens in a dark, damp basement—surrounded by cryptic clues and the restless spirits of the lost.\n\nTo escape, McMillan must explore the eerie estate, uncovering the tragic stories of those who vanished. Every room hides secrets. Every item left behind is a key to the truth. But as the past resurfaces, something far darker watches, waiting for its next victim.\n\nThe truth is buried, but escaping may cost you everything...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r0u.jpg'),(7431,'Astron Belt','1983-05-01','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade, MSX','The player controls a lone spacecraft on a mission to singlehandedly take down the entire enemy armada. Enemy fighters and ships shoot at the player, and there are mines and other objects that must be shot or avoided.\n\nThe game is divided into waves. At the end of each wave is a command ship that must be destroyed. In later waves the enemy fighters move and shoot more aggressively, and their shots are more accurate. Some waves take place in open space, while others require the player to battle enemies while flying through narrow trenches and tunnels.\n\nThe player is on a timer at the beginning of the game, with an unlimited number of lives available. The length of the timer can be adjusted by the machine operator, but is normally 60 seconds. After the timer expires, the player is given a limited number of additional lives. When all of those lives are lost, the game ends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e92.jpg'),(7432,'Cold Vengeance','2017-01-11','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','When Canada invades the USA, Sgt. Jon Dagger must run and gun his way across the ruins of America to the Frozen North to deliver Cold Vengeance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ak9.jpg'),(7433,'Border Pioneer','2025-02-06','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You! the most outstanding pioneer who graduated from this kingdom, are finally about to embark on your legendary journey. Construct towns across various levels to fend off waves of attacks from diverse enemies until you establish a firm footing and complete your exploration!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vb0.jpg'),(7434,'Space Probes','2020-08-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Space Probes is a Shoot Em Up (SHMUP) inspired by productions from the 90s released on SNES, MEGADRIVE, NEO-GEO, PC-ENGINE etc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46wx.jpg'),(7435,'The Struggle of Combat','2020-06-21','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Struggle of Combat is randomly generated side-scrolling shooter with roguelike elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bez.jpg'),(7436,'Apple Bang!','2021-06-04','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Apple Bang is a 3D action platform game about Maid running her master\'s apple errand. Good luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31ce.jpg'),(7437,'F1 Mobile Racing',NULL,'Racing, Sport','Sin plataforma','Develop and customise your own F1 car from the ground up, race for one of the 10 official F1 teams, and challenge opponents from around the world to thrilling multiplayer Duels.\nFeaturing all the official teams and drivers of the 2022 Formula 1 season, F1 Mobile Racing lets you compete on stunning circuits from this season against the greatest drivers on the planet, such as Lewis Hamilton, Max Verstappen, Charles Leclerc and Fernando Alonso.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7438,'The Uprising','1998-09-06','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Looks like you\'re coming out of retirement, son.\n\nAnother citadel was taken over by the forces of Hell, just when you thought you exterminated them all!\n\nThis time, it\'s not so easy. The minions are more dedicated than ever, to take over the world! They\'ve teamed up in larger numbers, and in tougher groups. This will be the toughest battle you may ever have been in, provided you can last through this marathon of gunfire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zkx.jpg'),(7439,'The Jumping Pizza','2022-05-27','Simulator','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Join BIG P on his exciting journey through the kitchen and make him jump!\nEnjoy the colorful comic graphics accompanied by atmospheric music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sfm.jpg'),(7440,'Redshift Blueshift','2015-09-23','Sport, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Redshift Blueshift is a tournament-ready pong-like 2D shooter in which two pilots fight for glory in their variable paddle ships! Power up your shields, unleash a horde of drones and homing missiles on your opponent and keep the hyper-ball in play! Supports local multiplayer and single player vs AI. Gamepad strongly recommended.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jqr.jpg'),(7441,'Wheels of Aurelia','2017-11-02','Puzzle, Racing, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A narrative road trip game set in the roaring Italian 70s, it tells the story of Lella, a restless woman driving on the roads of the western coast of Italy, the famous \"Via Aurelia\".\nThis is an interactive fiction in the shape of an isometric driving game and with a focus on replayability: every playthrough lasts about fifteen minutes and there are sixteen different endings to discover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24ka.jpg'),(7442,'Sunday Rivals','2020-08-06','Sport, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sunday Rivals is a fresh take on the hard hitting, action-packed football games of the past, built and tuned for a hungry generation of players ready to take back the field.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2owm.jpg'),(7443,'Universe 24','2019-04-23','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Universe 24 is a local highscore style, madness action based, 3d platform game. \n \nStory mode takes place over 6 missions in varying environments, designed to challenge the player in different ways and escalated difficulty. \n \nIn skirmish mode you can customize your own fights. \n \nChoose Between 7 Maps and Environments. \nEach map has a dedicated leader-board, so you can track your skill improvements. \n9 Different Gun Modes, With Over 30+ Weapons. \nCustomize the numbers of enemies and there intelligence to change the difficulty, or simply go unlimited enemy spawns and find out how long you can last. \nAfter every challenge you get presented with statistics from the last played round. \n \nKey Features \n \nHigh tempo action \nStory mode with 6 missions \nAll of the story text can be narrated, if you so chose to. \nCustomizable Skirmish mode with 7 different maps \nQuick round restarts \n30+ weapons \nLocal high-score \n36 music tracks \nNo DRM','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co269l.jpg'),(7444,'A Twisted Place','2021-03-01','Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Depressing Cosmic Horror','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7445,'Grand Theft Auto: Forelli Redemption','2022-10-21','Shooter, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 2','2001. The events are taking place at the same time as those of Grand Theft Auto III\'s original story. Giovanni Forelli, 26 years old, is the son of Sonny Forelli, also the nephew of the current Forelli patriarch, Giorgio. He was lucky enough to survive the destruction of Little Italy during 1998. The Forelli Family is weak these days, though it still manages to stay in the game. However, a short chain of events and a bit of luck gives the Forellis a chance to restore their power…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74eu.jpg'),(7446,'Doodle Kingdom: Medieval','2025-03-25','Sin género','Android, iOS','Remaster of the classic Doodle Kingdom with thousands of new reactions!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7447,'Cannonfire Concerto','2016-12-08','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Cannonfire Concerto is a 190,000-word interactive novel where your choices control the story. It\'s entirely text-based - without graphics or sound effects - and fueled by the vast, unstoppable power of your imagination. Play as male, female or non-binary; gay, straight, bi, or asexual. For some, romance is a means to an end. For some, it\'s a sonata duet of love and sex. Perhaps both.\n\nWill you and your Genius achieve immortality, or will the poisoned pens of critics slaughter your career? Will you overthrow the church, bringing forth a new era of enlightenment, or defend your kingdom from a secular invasion? The concert hall is silent. The Cannonfire Concerto is about to begin.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7448,'Tomb Raider: Legend','2006-12-01','Adventure','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','This version of Tomb Raider: Legend has had a couple of cuts most likely due to disc space. The rolling demos that would normally play if the game was left inactive while in the title screen have been removed and the Unfortunate Mishaps video is also missing. The many filters used for explosions and motion blur are also gone, rendering the game with sharper textures, but less remarkable explosions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gze.jpg'),(7449,'Danger Ramps','2024-02-26','Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Danger Ramps is a 3D platformer driving game. Master the control of your vehicle to advance through colorful environments, collecting stars without flipping over or falling into abysses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lj4.jpg'),(7450,'Cinematic Mod','2005-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What is Cinematic Mod?\n\nCinematic Mod (CM) is a Half-Life 2 modification, that adds more details and a darker look to the original Half-Life 2 series.\n\nImagine, a Hollywood producer got his hands on the game. The result would be similar to what the Cinematic Mod is: a graphics blockbuster, redesigned to the typical game to movie adaption with an orchestral soundtrack and beautiful people everywhere.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u2d.jpg'),(7451,'S-In','2022-04-14','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Easy and relaxing puzzle game to play. The player\'s goal is to do whatever they can to reach the green goal to pass all the levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4nzj.jpg'),(7452,'Astral Hound VR','2025-02-17','Indie','SteamVR','Become The Astral Hound, play as Howard, a man who can project himself into the astral plane, as he traverses the Astral Realm to find and rescue Allie who has been kidnapped by a supernatural organization BIO.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m86.jpg'),(7453,'Lily',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Create beautiful music in Lily – a playful music creation game for people of all ages and musical abilities. Explore music and melody to produce delightful, tuneful lily ponds. Relax in a calming, creative experience in which there is no winning or losing – only artistic exploration and expression.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qkl.jpg'),(7454,'Black Out','1992-11-01','Shooter, Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Black Out was a cancelled game which would be played using the SNES Mouse. A leaflet about it was included with the Japanese version of Mario Paint.\n\nA prototype (known as Sleep) was found in the Nintendo Gigaleak of 2020. It is a game where you help a sleepwalker traversing obstacles and shooting at projectiles. The game was made to be played using the Super Scope or the SNES Mouse. It has no sound and uses assets similar to those of Super Donkey (another prototype found in the Gigaleak, possibly related to the original Donkey Kong series) and Yoshi\'s Island.\n\nAs a game under the name of Sleep was never announced nor rumored, even though the game was never shown before and having a different name in the dataleak, Black Out and Sleep they are likely to be the same game given the time frame and the use of the SNES Mouse. Both games are also related to Super Scope 15 (a Super Scope compatible cancelled game) in the dataleak.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yux.jpg'),(7455,'Nancy Drew: Shadow at the Water\'s Edge','2010-10-19','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Nancy Drew heads for Japan where she’s staying at a traditional ryokan (inn) for a little R&R with Bess and George, but when reports of a vengeful ghost start scaring away the guests, Nancy’s vacation takes a turn for terror! It’ll be up to you, as Nancy Drew, to uncover the secret that lies beneath the surface, before the ghost can take its revenge! Dare to Play \n \nNancy Drew: Shadow at the Water’s Edge is a first-person perspective, point-and-click adventure game. The player is Nancy Drew and has to solve a mystery. Explore rich environments for clues, interrogate suspects, and solve puzzles and mini-games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1t2a.jpg'),(7456,'Super Dodgeball Beats','2019-11-07','Music, Sport, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','You’re invited to the craziest dodgeball contest ever! Get your groove on with Super Dodgeball Beats, the world’s most insane rhythm-sports game! You’re invited to the craziest dodgeball contest ever! Get your groove on with Super Dodgeball Beats, the world’s first ever rhythm-sports game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1q4s.jpg'),(7457,'Microsoft Hearts','1992-02-01','Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Microsoft Hearts is a computer game included with Microsoft Windows, based on a card game with the same name. It was first introduced in Windows 3.1 in 1992, and has since been included in every version of Windows up to and including Windows 7.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mj7.jpg'),(7458,'Big Toddlers and Kids Bundle',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','This bundle contains nine top games for toddlers and kids. Hours of educational and relaxing fun with puzzles, matching pairs, popping balloons, washing cars and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4iug.jpg'),(7459,'Aarik: and the Ruined Kingdom','2024-06-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Aarik (and the ruined kingdom) is a perspective based puzzle game centred around a Prince trying desperately to repair his father\'s kingdom. Using a magical crown Aarik must grab, roll, move and mend to save his homeland and his family.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ax4.jpg'),(7460,'UltraGoodness 2','2021-02-12','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The struggle between Good and Evil continues in this bloody action, top-down action-roguelike shooter where time moves only when you move or shoot. Tear Satan\'s forces to pieces, leave oceans of their blood and mountains of demon\'s corpses in the name of Goodness!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5agk.jpg'),(7461,'Rage Against the Machine','2007-10-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rage Against the Machine was a fan add-on project to create a commercial quality Blood game; the title is sometimes shortened as Rage or RATM. Episode one was first released on October 31, 2007, before being re-issued as a \"New Compact Version\" on May 16, 2008, and is currently the only released portion of Rage Against the Machine. \n \nThe add-on includes a new soundtrack and is intended to add many new levels that are compatible with single player, BloodBath and cooperative play. \n \nThe story is intended to be played out through \"live-action\" cutscenes shown at the end of the episodes. It was created by Matthew \"Daedalus\" Kallis (project leader and mapper), Dimebog (musician), and Filip (oBe) Walgraef (artist and animator). As well as a founder of The Postmortem and later Altar of Stone fan sites, Daedalus was the previous creator of the Sin Campaign mini-episode, which partly utilized assets from BloodLines.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sah.jpg'),(7462,'Apprehending the Adventuer Chan!: Live2D Tentacles Simulator','2024-06-27','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A tentacle training simulator developed specifically for experienced players. Players will control tentacles to fully train the captured adventurer-chan. All animations are rendered in full Live2D, providing immediate feedback based on various actions to satisfy your desires for tentacle training!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mto.jpg'),(7463,'The Matrix Online','2005-03-25','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a part of Matrix history as you play through and experience events directed by the renowned Wachowskis. Master the innovative combat system to defeat your enemies, while using devastating martial arts maneuvers and gunplay in a fully realized Mega City.\n\nThe Matrix Online was an MMORPG that continued the story of the Matrix franchise past the third film, \'Revolutions\'. The game featured a unique \'Interlock\' combat system, flexible skill allocation and a constantly evolving storyline that players could interact with. The game was shut down on July 31st, 2009.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89gd.jpg'),(7464,'Batman: Arkham Knight - 2008 Movie Batman Skin','2015-12-22','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This addon inlcudes a Batman costume inspired by the 2008 movie ‘The Dark Knight’.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fx3.jpg'),(7465,'Itoi Shigesato no Bass Tsuri No. 1','1997-02-21','Simulator, Sport','Satellaview, Super Famicom','Itoi Shigesato no Bass Tsuri No. 1 is a fishing video game developed and released only in Japan for the Super Famicom on February 21, 1997 and updated for broadcast as eight different episodes on the Satellaview subsystem between April and November 1997.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43o9.jpg'),(7466,'Neko Doll','2022-02-04','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Come and meet your neko doll, let her accompany you to complete challenging levels, unlock her mysterious realm, and experience the joy of intimate contact with neko in different scenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6g9w.jpg'),(7467,'Nickelodeon Extreme Tennis','2022-01-21','Sport','iOS, Mac','Join your favorite iconic characters from Nickelodeon shows past and present as they compete in the most Extreme Tennis Matches EVER! All your favorite retro Nicktoons come together for the ultimate tennis showdown: SpongeBob, Angelica, Rocko, Garfield, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kc6.jpg'),(7468,'Island, Sex & Survival','2024-06-25','Strategy, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You began a new life on the mysterious deserted island after drifting there due to a shipwreck, starting from scratch. Building a base, exploring different areas of the island, living alongside various female characters you encounter, and experiencing all sorts of miraculous events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qyx.jpg'),(7469,'Joe and the Gun','2021-05-21','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Joe must survive in the arena and destroy all the aliens who attacked the North Pole.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44bm.jpg'),(7470,'1001 Jigsaw: World Tour - Great America','2019-01-21','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','1001 Jigsaw. World Tour: Great America is an exciting puzzle game and a fantastic opportunity to feel the true American spirit. Assemble jigsaws from a multitude of pieces and learn the history, traditions and attractions of the United States of America in 500 high-quality photos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rah.jpg'),(7471,'SnowRunner: 4-Year Anniversary Edition','2024-01-31','Racing, Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The ultimate off-road experience!\n\nDrive over 70 powerful vehicles and overcome extreme open environments. SnowRunner\'s 4-Year Anniversary Edition includes the base game as well as the Year 1, Year 2, Year 3 and Year 4 Passes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pc9.jpg'),(7472,'Mediterranea Inferno','2024-03-05','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Explore the inner demons of three childhood friends on a summer retreat. Unearth secrets, fears and obsessions as you help them reconnect and rediscover themselves. A mature and treacherous visual novel from the creator of Milky Way Prince - The Vampire Star.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70jh.jpg'),(7473,'Catwoman','2004-08-06','Platform','Game Boy Advance','The Game Boy Advance version of the Catwoman movie license video game. The look of the graphics aims toward a comic-book feel instead of the more realistic-looking 3D of the console and PC versions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6h0l.jpg'),(7474,'Babel Defense','2025-02-20','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 3D real-time strategy tower defence based on the Tower of Babel. Organise your army of angels as waves of humans appear. Unlock upgrades and prosper to stop the human advance. Use your omnipresent powers to help you in your mission.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m8c.jpg'),(7475,'Leftovers KO!',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Leftovers KO! is a Punch-Out-inspired, hand-drawn animated boxing game where you fight a bunch of leftovers. After a long day at work, you come home to find that your uneaten food has come to life—and it\'s here to beat you up... with its hands! Defeat them all and uncover the truth!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l26.jpg'),(7476,'Not a Creature Was Stirring...',NULL,'Music','Sin plataforma','(except Squeaky Whiskerson and his Marvelous Musical Mice!)','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7477,'Spacebound',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7478,'Wasteland Rangers','2025-03-07','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wasteland Rangers is a fast-paced first-person shooter where you fight for survival in post-apocalyptic wastelands. Choose from four unique classes, battle across diverse locations, and prove you\'re the best ranger!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mdj.jpg'),(7479,'The Mono-Yellow Madness','2022-09-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Mono-Yellow Madness is a survival horror game taking place in the backrooms. Will you survive in this multi-level trap? Will you put an end to this? Only you can uncover the mysteries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co586y.jpg'),(7480,'Train Valley 2: The Pandeia Project','2023-07-13','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Brought to you by our community member and a renowned level designer Dracken - in cooperation with Flazm Interactive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lp3.jpg'),(7481,'Microsoft Combat Flight Simulator: WWII Europe Series','1998-12-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Microsoft\'s flight simulators aimed realistically portray life as a commercial pilot for over a decade before combat was added. In this offshoot (pardon the pun) of the series, you are a combat pilot during World War II, for either the RAF, USAAF or Luftwaffe.\n\nEight different planes and the battered cities of Berlin, Paris and London are incorporated. Full cockpit designs and damage models are featured - watch for engine smoke and explosion debris.\n\nThere is a full campaign mode, which takes in the Battle of Britain, defending London during the Blitz, and finishing the job started on D-Day by pummeling ground targets.You can also play individual missions or fly freely. Online multiplayer options allow you to take this worldwide fight around the real world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ck8.jpg'),(7482,'Autos','2024-12-21','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Autos is driving game contains five modes Racing, Car Park Drift, Truck Challenge, Rally and Transportation Open World Driving.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99z9.jpg'),(7483,'AlterSpace',NULL,'Tactical, Adventure','Sin plataforma','A space exploration game.\n\nExplore the huge universe while you also try to find out why all humans got extinct, and by what.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j2n.jpg'),(7484,'Garten of Banban 5',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Enter Banban\'s Kindergarten, and you\'re sure to make some friends. Explore the mysterious establishment and don\'t lose your life and sanity. Uncover the horrifying truth behind the place, but be careful, as you are far from alone…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x87.jpg'),(7485,'Messy Room Simulator','2020-09-21','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Attention! This game IS NOT a training software that helps you organize your room better. On the contrary, it may in turn affect you in reality in some way. The room, whether the result is good or bad, the author of this game WILL NOT be responsible for it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nua.jpg'),(7486,'Loli Racing','2024-02-28','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Loli Racing is a Japanese-style kart racing game, the overall operation difficulty is low and easy to get started, there are 15 types of karts and characters can choose from, in terms of maps, there are 38 tracks with different themes to play, support single-player and multiplayer','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7x96.jpg'),(7487,'Super Metroid: Subversion','2022-08-31','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Following the events of Super Metroid, Samus must destroy another Metroid research facility built by the Space Pirates on Planet TN578. This time however, the Pirates are more prepared to deal with Samus with the development of new weapons and armor based on Verdite technologies. It is time once again to protect the galaxy! With complete map and room overhaul, new items, new enemies, new challenge and difficulty modes and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pcn.jpg'),(7488,'Highrisers','2021-07-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An Urban Survival RPGCrafting, Exploring and Defending in a desolate metropolis haunted by the mysterious dreamers.Lead a team of 4 survivors through this urban desert of skyscrapers and high-rises, where the dimly lit streets are crowded with the mutated victims of an unstopable disease that forever trapped them in a dream.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wk3.jpg'),(7489,'Cliffhanger',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7490,'Warbox',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7491,'Anime Girls: Bouncy Basketball','2025-04-10','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Meet over 50 pretty anime girls in this relaxing puzzle game!\nComplete puzzles of pretty anime girls in this relaxing puzzle game with over 50 levels! Once the puzzles are complete, you can enjoy admiring the girls in the gallery at your own time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r75.jpg'),(7492,'Niva','2016-11-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','NIVA is a pacifistic exploration art game. The player slips into the role of a mighty forest god to restore the harmony in a mesmerizing forest and relieve it of a mysterious infestation. This shuddersome, mothlike infestation is drawn to the conflicts of the forest\'s inhabitants. Through observation and by using the abilities of nurturing and withering fascinating plants the player can solve said conflicts. NIVA\'s scenic art style, relaxing music and simple but intriguing game mechanics invite to explore the forest and have a rest from the stressful everyday life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j78.jpg'),(7493,'Legendary Tales: Stolen Life','2021-10-07','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','“Legendary Tales: Stolen Life” is an adventure game in the genre of Hidden Objects, with plenty of mini-games and puzzles, unforgettable characters and complicated quests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4038.jpg'),(7494,'Major Mayhem','2014-02-24','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Arcade cover shooter inspired by Time Crisis, Metal Slug and 80\'s action heros! He\'s got an itchy trigger finger, some scratchy stubble, and a fondness for shooting dudes in the face. Run and gun your way through gorgeous 3D environments as you embark on a mission to rescue your kidnapped girlfriend from the Forces of Evil. Guns, grenades and an assortment of other tools of destruction are at your disposal, and you\'ll need every last one of \'em. So what are you waiting for, Major Mayhem? The future of the Free World -- and your love life -- hangs in the balance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co946b.jpg'),(7495,'Nanotale: Typing Chronicles','2019-10-23','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Google Stadia, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Something is wrong with the heart of magic. Play a young archivist venturing out into a dying world, cataloging its mysteries and its wonders to unearth the truth. Nanotale is the new adventure from the Typing Chronicles franchise and the spiritual successor to the acclaimed Epistory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j4z.jpg'),(7496,'Build-A-Lot 2: Town of the Year','2008-04-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation','It’s time to get busy again building, buying and selling houses in Build-a-lot 2: Town of the Year! There are new towns to explore, new Mayors to meet and lots of money to be made as you cast your vote for the ‘Town of the Year’. Use your keen eye to pick the right locations to build parks and shops. Pick your paint colors, upgrades and landscaping to create the ultimate curb appeal and earn outstanding profits. How about a latte from the new coffee shop? Some new flower boxes from the garden center? It’s all waiting for you in Build-a-lot 2 ...welcome to the neighborhood.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zfs8nrou0s2ffcyu9wmk.jpg'),(7497,'Drill Sergeant Mindstrong','2009-07-22','Puzzle','Wii','Get ready for boot camp!\n\nLine up and get ready to use your mind! Drill Sergeant Mindstrong is a party game that allows up to four people to play at once. Players will become boot-camp trainees under the tough Drill Sergeant Mindstrong and go through mind-boggling, mind-strengthening training games. The rules are simple, but concentration and quick thinking are both key to playing this game and emerging as lean, mean, thinking machines. Become the top boot of your class and earn promotions based on your efforts! This game is best played with friends and family.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/f3egugi02i0zhqubyln5.jpg'),(7498,'The Money Game','1988-08-10','Simulator, Strategy','Family Computer','A Stock Market/life-sim game where the player must manage their stocks in order to achieve a happy life. It was developed by SOFEL for the NES and released in Japan only.\n\nThe Money Game is a stock market simulation game where the goal is to raise money through the wise purchasing and selling of various types of stock. Coupled to this is a life-sim aspect where raising a sufficient amount of money at certain checkpoints allows the player to gain and keep a girlfriend, who later becomes their wife and provides children. As well, the player can upgrade from their initial studio apartment to a terraced house to a mansion with its own Olympic-sized swimming pool.\n\nThe game is densely packed with Japanese script and requires both literacy in that language and a fairly good understanding of dealing in the stock market itself (though the game does provide tutorials for the latter). It would be followed by a sequel, The Money Game 2: Kabutochou no Kiseki, which in turn would be the basis for SOFEL\'s Wall Street Kid.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xckdf9ruahnnp5spm5jg.jpg'),(7499,'Shark Dating Simulator XL','2017-07-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shark Dating Simulator XL is a quick-to-play comedy visual novel with colorful cartoon characters, a multiple choice storyline and dozens of different endings. The only thing for sure is that at some point you\'ll make it with a shark girl. Go you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mnq.jpg'),(7500,'Atelier Marie','2006-04-03','Simulator, Adventure','Legacy Mobile Device','A port of Atelier Marie Plus for Vodafone phones in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bks.jpg'),(7501,'Rockytown','2020-07-14','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What happened to the people of Rockytown? Have fun at the village fair, with 4 exciting mini-games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47a3.jpg'),(7502,'The Legend of Dragoon','2023-02-21','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Experience The Legend of Dragoon originally released on the PlayStation console, enhanced with up-rendering, rewind, quick save, and custom video filters.\n\nUnveil a fantasy of magnificence, deception, magical combat, and retribution as you join swordsman Dart and his companions to harness the spiritual forces of Dragons and triumph over evil.\n\nUsing a unique and innovative tactical combat system, transform into Dragoons and unleash extraordinary powers. Control a wide variety of characters that wield unique weapons and Dragoon attacks powered by the elements in this unforgettable role-playing game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66qw.jpg'),(7503,'Double Shoulders','2025-01-31','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Double Shoulders is a two player action-adventure game. You take control of Lois and Sam, two kids trying to escape from a strange place filled with dangers and challenges. You\'ll have to work together to get out of this place alive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mur.jpg'),(7504,'Touhou Danmaku Kagura: Phantasia Lost - Extra Song Pack 7','2025-03-19','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7505,'Speed & Precision Collection',NULL,'Racing, Simulator','Sin plataforma','Master your skills in the fastest games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ai2.jpg'),(7506,'Tincan 2','2012-11-11','Platform, Indie','Web browser','A difficult platformer revolving around the blue box named \"Tincan\". Navigate Tincan through 7 stages, each one becoming more impossible than the last. With the aid of launch pads and switches, Tincan must now also avoid moving spikes and lasers. Tincan 2 features exciting music by Zack Harmon and graphics by Noel Berry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gar.jpg'),(7507,'Voodoo Detective','2022-05-24','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Do you like adventure, comedy, and dime store detective novels? Then boy have we got the game for you! Join Voodoo Detective in a story-rich, hand-drawn noir where you’ll pit your wits and hoodoo know-how against a sinister evil that’s taken root on beautiful Zo Wanga Isle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uq4.jpg'),(7508,'TrickStyle','1999-09-09','Racing, Sport','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Dreamcast','Grab your board, surf through the air, show your stuff, and win eternal glory with your off-the-chain skills. Re-Live this Dreamcast Classic Today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44xj.jpg'),(7509,'Thunder Zone','1991-02-01','Shooter','Arcade','Desert Assault or Thunder Zone is a isometric scrolling military themed shoot \'em up game where you take control of one of four commandos operating in the Persian gulf. Each commando has their own look and special limited bomb. \n \nAs you walk through the stages you fight a variety of enemies on foot, vehicles, static guns and bosses. While playing destroyed enemies drop weapons and items to restore hit points that can be picked up. Weapons include a shotgun, machinegun, bazooka, rocket launcher and flamethrower. Sometimes a vehicle must be mounted. These include a car and some kind of desert/snowmobile. There are two and four player versions. In the slightly different Japanese version the second stage takes place in the Artic while in the other versions the second stage takes place in the desert.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7510,'Concord','2024-08-23','Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','In Concord, you play as the crew of the Northstar—a group of guns-for-hire known in our galaxy as Freegunners. The Freegunners roam the stars taking high-stakes jobs on worlds across Wild space, where they face other fiercely competitive Freegunner crews. From match-to-match, you’ll form your team of Freegunners with other players and battle it out with rival crews to take home the reward across a variety of maps and modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8aag.jpg'),(7511,'World of Tanks: Modern Armor - Vipers Starter Pack','2025-02-04','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Get a grip on this DLC bundle packed with Boosters and Premium Account time to help you earn more from every match.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f11.jpg'),(7512,'Queen\'s Quest 4: Sacred Truce','2019-10-10','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Restore peace in the realm of the Five Kingdoms!\n\nThe realm of the Five Kingdoms faces a formidable challenge. A mysterious power is trying to destroy the relationship between humans and elves and start a conflict.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21p1.jpg'),(7513,'Anime Girls: Lovely Lolita','2024-12-12','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Meet over 50 pretty anime girls in this relaxing puzzle game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95ut.jpg'),(7514,'Virtua Tennis 2009','2009-06-19','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox 360','Virtua Tennis 2009 features several international tennis stars like Roger Federer, Boris Becker or Maria Sharapova against which the player needs to compete against or play with in the heart of the game: The World Tour. The player creates his own character from scratch and plays to reach the number one rank on the world ranking list.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ssu.jpg'),(7515,'Li\'l Rumble','2019-10-09','Shooter','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It\'s a Pico-8 Battle Royale! Well sort of anyway...\n\nThrown on to a big island chock full of weapons, it\'s every man/cat/alien for themselves! Play either you vs 19 others or watch as 20 AI controlled opponents duke it out amongst themselves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7oow.jpg'),(7516,'Peachy Derby: Rush Edition','2025-03-27','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7517,'The X Factor Sing','2005-10-21','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','X-Factor is a single and multiplayer singing game. In real karaoke style, songs appear on your screen and you have to sing the right words at the right time. Onscreen indicators inform you what pitch you need to maintain at any given time. Hit the right notes for the right amount of time, and you\'ll get high scores.\n\nAs the focus of the game is the TV show atmosphere, special attention has been paid to select a variety of video clips of judge comments and special performances of the show. This way, players need to struggle to achieve a good result and are awarded with special contents from the show. The game also contains Party modes in which players compete by playing a selection of humorous mini-games.\n\nBoth versions of the game are bundled with a USB microphone.\n\nThe tracklist of the game features songs like Superstar (Melanie C.), Shiver (Natalie Imbruglia), Is there something I should know? (Duran Duran), Is this the way to Amarillo? (Tony Christie), and many others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nzj.jpg'),(7518,'Hand Simulator: Survival','2019-12-17','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wild island. Thirst and hunger. Dangerous animals and insects. The perfect place to test your survival skills, especially if you only have empty hands, especially if it is a hand simulator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ve0.jpg'),(7519,'Genshin Impact: A Parade of Providence','2023-04-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Version 3.6 of Genshin Impact, which included:\n• New characters: Baizhu and Kaveh\n• New areas: Gavireh Lajavard and Realm of Farakhkert\n• New hangout events for Layla\n• New story quests for Baizhu and Nahida\n• New main event: A Parade of Providence\n• …and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6svz.jpg'),(7520,'Flyist','2021-06-18','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You control a small plane. You need to fly over and under the rocks and collect stars of distinction along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co465a.jpg'),(7521,'Bloodwolf','2020-10-20','Strategy, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Role-playing game in which you play as a villager or a werewolf !\n\nWerewolves Online is a game of strategy, bluff and mischief !\n\nEach player is assigned a role at the start of the game.\n\nMember of the village, member of the pack or even solo, the goal is to win the game by fulfilling certain objectives !\n\nWithout revealing their role, each villager will have to participate in the debate and win with their own. Otherwise, he will die by hanging, be devoured by werewolves or worse !\n\nA werewolf must try to devour all the villagers without being exposed, otherwise, he will be hanged by the village !\n\nThe whole village is made up of several roles: Villager, Werewolf, Witch, Seer and many others to discover by downloading our application !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sl2.jpg'),(7522,'Slime Alchemy','2025-12-31','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Slime Alchemy is a relaxing puzzle game where you must place pieces in specific locations on a hexagonal grid.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kif.jpg'),(7523,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s: In Real Time',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You work the nightshift at Freddy Fazbear\'s Pizza looking out for the animatronics, now moving towards you in real time. Relive FNAF 1 with a moving animatronics camera system; but as we all know, the animatronics tend to wander a bit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qu9.jpg'),(7524,'Blood Feed','2017-04-28','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Blood Feed - The Mystery of Insectville is FPS depthless and mindless shooter, where you, smashing through the waves of bugs, insects and hordes of most disgusting things that ever roamed the earth, need to unravel the mysterious dissapearance of the whole town, including your family.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29yo.jpg'),(7525,'Wai-wai de Q: Haru no Saiten Special - Dai-2-kai','1996-03-14','Quiz/Trivia','Satellaview','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7526,'Remington Super Slam Hunting Africa','2010-12-17','Shooter','Wii','Head into the deepest reaches of Africa, armed with your wits, your skills, and an array of high-powered weapons and accessories! Experience action arcade hunting excitement like never before as you explore 35 challenging missions across a variety of terrain. Match the right weapon to the situation to maximize your score, as you hunt over 15 different big game animals, birds and varmints.  Pull off amazing long shots, zoom in for spectacular head shots, and take down dangerous predators before they attack!\n\nCompete with up to 4 players locally in co-op and challenge modes. Earn achievements, purchase new weapons, and aim for the worldwide high score leaderboards as you fight your way through the safari!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ytni0iywf9wu5cmfizin.jpg'),(7527,'Robot Unicorn Attack 3',NULL,'Racing, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Adult Swim is back with another Robot Unicorn Attack game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7528,'I\'m the Master of 3 Cute Maids','2022-09-09','Visual Novel','Android','You\'re a perpetual job-hopper with no real future… until you save an old man from a group of delinquents. As thanks, he offers you a ridiculous reward—a gigantic mansion with three maids ready to serve you! However, in order to become the ‘true owner,’ you must prove yourself worthy within a month’s time. You quickly accept the challenge... How hard could it be to own a mansion?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bv5.jpg'),(7529,'X-Samkok','2024-07-29','Role-playing (RPG)','Android','Idle leveling in a Three Kingdoms fantasy! Flexible strategies, multiple modes, simple gameplay, and rich experience! Achieve your conquests in the Battle of the Three Kingdoms!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ach.jpg'),(7530,'Grip','2018-11-06','Shooter, Racing, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Inspired by the Rollcage games of 1999 and 2000, Grip is a new IP for a new generation. A return to the hardcore combat racer, bristling with heavy weapons and packing ferocious speed, the game is an intense, sensory feast.\n\nHarnessing the awesome potential of Epic\'s Unreal Engine 4, GRIP will take you back to your nostalgic past, while simultaneously propelling you into a kick-ass future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1iwv.jpg'),(7531,'Bust-A-Move Pocket','1999-05-30','Puzzle','Neo Geo Pocket Color','Bust-A-Move Pocket, also called Puzzle Bobble Mini, is a Neo Geo Pocket Color version of the Bust-A-Move (Puzzle Bobble) series of puzzle games. It was released on the Neo Geo Pocket Color by Taito in 1999.\n\nThe format is similar to Bust-A-Move 2 for the PlayStation. The game\'s Puzzle mode includes a feature that saves initials of those who have completed the level in the fastest time. The game contains a survivor mode where the player has to burst the oncoming bubbles, making sure they don\'t reach the bottom line which spells the end of the game. Also present is a vs CPU mode, where the player can compete against a selection of eight characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52xl.jpg'),(7532,'Street Hoop','1995-01-09','Sport, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, Zeebo, Neo Geo MVS, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Neo Geo CD, Nintendo Switch','Street Hoop, known in Japan as Dunk Dream and known in North America as Street Slam, is a basketball video game developed by Data East for Neo-Geo, released in 1994. The game features three-on-three basketball match-ups with a variety of different teams.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7irn.jpg'),(7533,'Dreamland Solitaire: Dragon\'s Fury','2024-03-15','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','When a dragon\'s fire lights up the night sky and burns a lowly village to the ground, only one fairy can set things right. You must take the role of this enchanting creature as she completes quests in her search of why this tragedy occurred.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oyf.jpg'),(7534,'TheHunter: Call of the Wild - Weapon Pack 3','2019-08-01','Shooter, Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The wardens have just sent word that a new shipment has been delivered, containing quality hunting weapons like the Eckers .30-06 Bolt-Action Rifle, the Vasquez Cyclone .45 Big Bore Air Rifle, and the Andersson .22LR Semi-automatic Pistol.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4x6b.jpg'),(7535,'Paper Trails','2024-12-09','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It all started with a simple robbery. When that thread was pulled, a tapestry of mysteries were revealed. Solve cases and outsmart criminals in a detective story full of lies, confessions, and maybe even a murder or two.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k9m.jpg'),(7536,'Dungeon Nightmares II: The Memory','2015-09-14','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dungeon Nightmares II is a first-person psychological horror that takes you through a journey of discovering what nightmares are.\n\nThe game is inspired by classic roguelike games which include 100% procedural-generated maps and permadeath. These features play an important part in making this game tense with the feeling of dread & terror as you walk the hallways of the dungeon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d3h.jpg'),(7537,'1000 Princes','2025-01-23','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','1000 Princes is a female-oriented 3D visual novel romance game. A fracture in your timeline has caused all your prince husbands—spanning past, present and future from different settings—to time-travel to your current era. Now1,000 princes coexist on your shared timeline, protecting and adoring you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98kd.jpg'),(7538,'Bridge Race & Stacky Dash','2025-03-15','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Get ready for a thrilling duo of fast-paced, brick-stacking action with Bridge Race and Stacky Dash!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nu9.jpg'),(7539,'Attack Hole: Monsters DLC','2025-03-14','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7540,'Attack Hole: Heroes DLC','2025-03-14','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7541,'Doraemon Story of Seasons: Friends of the Great Kingdom','2022-11-02','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Doraemon, Noby and their friends land on an unknown planet and decide to help a new friend fulfill his dreams—by farming! Plow the fields, harvest crops and tend to the animals. You can even use Doraemon’s secret gadgets to farm in a flash! Relax by living with friends, eating delicious meals and fishing. And with local play, you and a pal can build a ranch together!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4x7s.jpg'),(7542,'Gunducky Industries','2017-08-28','Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fly your plane with arcade flight simulator controls through narrow levels shooting enemy robots and dodging amongst obstacles such as trees and ancient ruins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2806.jpg'),(7543,'Atri: My Dear Moments','2020-06-18','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','\"As the world sank, I found you.\" In the near future, a sudden and unexplained sea rise has left much of human civilization underwater. In a little town slowly being enveloped by the ocean, an unforgettable summer is about to begin for a boy and a mysterious robot girl...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21uu.jpg'),(7544,'Dr. Robotnik\'s Ring Racers','2024-04-24','Racing','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dr. Robotnik\'s Ring Racers is a kart racing video game originally based on the 3D Sonic the Hedgehog fan-game \"Sonic Robo Blast 2\", which itself is based on a modified version of Doom Legacy. It is the sequel to Sonic Robo Blast 2 Kart.\n\nHang up your sneakers, because Dr. Robotnik and his ex-enemies are going go-karting! Use the untapped potential of rings to super-charge your vehicle across more than 200 crazy courses. With over 20 unique items and some of the hottest moves on this side of the Floating Island, this is Racing at the Next Level!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85ae.jpg'),(7545,'Disney Step','2025-03-03','Sin género','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jb7.jpg'),(7546,'Kyn: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63kw.jpg'),(7547,'Phantasy Star','2009-08-14','Role-playing (RPG)','Wii, Sega Master System/Mark III','The time: Space Century 3240. The place: The Algol Star System. It began when King Lassic turned evil and let hordes of hideous, magical creatures run amok on the three planets. When her brother was killed, Alis vowed to avenge his death and put an end to Lassic forever.\n\nJoin her in a journey across time and space to worlds where creatures speak...where magic and science combine to take you on the ultimate video quest.\n\nPhantasy Star is total adventure role playing with towns full of people and shops...16 level dungeons full of traps and treasure...three companions who will help you if you find them and some of the most awesome graphics ever put in a video game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b8l.jpg'),(7548,'Football Striker 2025','2025-04-04','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','From the creative minds behind Jumping Food Games comes the sequel to the most exciting soccer puzzle game of the year: Football Striker 2025!\nDive into the world of soccer with this sequel and experience 20 new football-related levels that will challenge your gray matter.\n\nOver 20 tricky levels are waiting for you!\n\nGet Football Striker 2025 now and become a legend on the virtual pitch!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mmq.jpg'),(7549,'NBA Jam: 2020\'s On Fire Edition','2025-02-17','Sport','PlayStation 3','NBA JAM: 2020\'s On Fire Edition is a historical conversion mod of NBA JAM: On Fire Edition for PlayStation 3. It features every franchise\'s best teams of the 2020\'s. Every team has accurate uniforms, courts and arenas, coaches, and logos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f4q.jpg'),(7550,'Impossamole','2019-09-03','Platform, Adventure','BlackBerry OS, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, Amiga, Atari Jaguar, PC Engine SuperGrafx, Amstrad CPC','For Monty Mole, a day at the beach turns into the adventure of his life when he\'s beamed aboard an alien spacecraft. He\'s transformed into Impossamole, with super powers to save their planet from the evil Vlarg! Now you\'re up to your cape in Vlarg\'s monster bosses with crack-up creatures ready to nail your tail! Power up your laser to blast the Dragon Boss. Bomb the Abominable Snowman. Then trash the Venus Moletrap before he has you for lunch. Swim, fly and blast through five wacky action-packed worlds. The fiendish Vlarg awaits your final desperate battle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43iu.jpg'),(7551,'Fit In','2018-12-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fit In is a challenging game that you can play simply and enjoy deeply. You will die a lot but that feeling when you pass a level can\'t be described but only experienced.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7552,'One Line Coloring','2020-08-21','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','A vibrant world of colorful shapes awaits! Connect the dots to uncover charming objects in this colorful take on a classic paper puzzle game. Complete lively dioramas and relax yourself in the pastel world of One Line Coloring.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2exu.jpg'),(7553,'Nurse Love Syndrome','2019-12-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Meet cheerful Kaori Sawai, fresh out of nursing school, as she joins Yurigahama Hospital. Surviving a near death experience as a child left her with a desire to become a nurse and \"healing hands\" that let her relieve pain in patients just by touching them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qv9.jpg'),(7554,'Dungeons & Dragons Online: Devil Assault','2010-10-20','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Chronoscope premium raid and a dungeon that supports multiple character levels. Travel back in time to find out what happened when a vortex of invading devils destroyed the Stormreach Marketplace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qnh.jpg'),(7555,'Craggenrock',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Craggenrock is a crafting shop management game taking place on a remote island after a great disaster. You play as Arlo, a young crafter seeking a name of his own replacing his former crafting master in the mining town of Pareho.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5d6a.jpg'),(7556,'100 Hiddensaurs','2024-08-08','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','100 Hiddensaurs is a hidden object game with dinosaurs. The game is drawn by hand.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8eik.jpg'),(7557,'Subverse','2021-05-26','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','StudioFOW blasts onto Steam with \"Subverse\" - a sexy new Sci-Fi parody where you command your own starship filled with the hottest babes in the universe! Explore a vast galaxy filled with wacky scumbags and ancient mysteries before unwinding in your quarters with your favorite alien waifus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yha.jpg'),(7558,'The Exorcist: Gravebound Horror','2025-03-20','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Can you survive the wrath of the vengeful spirit?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kdh.jpg'),(7559,'Toree Jolly Jam','2023-11-30','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Toree Jolly Jam is a short little, speed based, one level 3D Platformer, in a wintery holiday coating, that rewards the player with certain goodies. Finishing the level will grant the player several bonus \"presents\" to choose from, containing different surprises. These could be anything from new characters (or multiple characters at once!) to completely different minigames. There is even an old fashioned retro styled \"sound test\" hidden in there somewhere (as pointless as it might be nowadays).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hnm.jpg'),(7560,'Red Baron Pack','2016-01-07','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Red Baron flies again!\nReturn to the classic Red Baron games with this digital collection featuring the original Red Baron, Red Baron 3D, the Red Baron Mission Builder and high-quality scans of the original manuals, maps and reference cards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ycp.jpg'),(7561,'Voltage','2019-05-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Set in the town of Frontier, Missouri, in the 1980s, young man called Mark finds a prototype of VR-glasses. And to his surprise, the glasses are compatible with his Amiga 500. He launches a game and step in to an incredible adventure..','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5i28.jpg'),(7562,'PlayerUnknown\'s Battlegrounds: Season 8','2020-07-30','Shooter, Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Season 8 is soon here and brings massive changes to the island of Sanhok, a new way to gear up with the Loot Truck, the start of the next Ranked Season, a new Survivor Pass, and loads more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gps.jpg'),(7563,'Galactivore',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7564,'Anomaly Hunter - Observation Duty',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7565,'Astra','2024-01-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore the expanded lore of Gor3 in this RPG-Lite prequel. Take on quests, buy upgrades, and unravel the mystery of the town of Cladworn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fyo.jpg'),(7566,'Hack and Slime','2022-06-01','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','What could be scarier than a massive dungeon-tower infested with skulls, ogres, and dragons? That those same monsters ride the largest multinational in the world with it. You know; business is business.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4t5g.jpg'),(7567,'Protect Me Knight','2010-05-24','Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox 360','Protect the princess from goblins, demons, minotaurs, even dragons, by attacking them directly or using towers in this classic 8-bit style action/tower defense mash-up','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/aulikefkgnp2d1a5nqvp.jpg'),(7568,'War of Warship','2024-11-01','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Command history\'s most iconic war vessels as you build your own massive naval fleet. Level up important tech modules and prepare to dominate the oceans!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mdn.jpg'),(7569,'Stolen Blood','2025-04-18','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Stolen Blood is a first-person mystical horror game inspired by European folklore. Haunted by visions, you uncover a tragic past of family, curses, and death. These visions flow from your very blood—they call to you. Once you understand your past, only one question remains: whose soul will you save?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pzd.jpg'),(7570,'BallisticNG: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Racing','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7f0x.jpg'),(7571,'12 Labours of Hercules IX: A Hero\'s Moonwalk - Collector\'s Edition','2019-10-11','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mx9.jpg'),(7572,'Yume Koujou: Doki-doki Panic','1987-07-10','Platform','Family Computer Disk System','While two children, Poke and Piki, are reading a story, a monstrous hand suddenly appears from inside the pages and kidnaps them. When the rest of the Dream Factory family hear their cries of help, they jump into the story and help save them from the evil Wart.\n\nThe game was released as part of the Yume Koujou \'87 event (sometimes referred as Dream Machine, in English), which was sponsored by Fuji TV, and stars its mascots.\n\nThe game was edited and released as Super Mario Bros 2. Due to Nintendo of Japan feeling like their version of Super Mario Bros 2 would be too difficult and outdated by the time it got to the United States.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21j0.jpg'),(7573,'SphereFace','2017-05-19','Shooter, Simulator, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','SphereFace is a retro-styled 3D vector shooter, wrapped around the inside of a sphere. An unashamedly abstract shooter that ranges from slow, strategic sniping to frantic rock-dodging action, with roguelike elements of exploration, progression, discovery and permadeath.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22b4.jpg'),(7574,'Sakura no Kumo * Scarlet no Koi','2020-09-25','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"1920 ...?\"\n\nTsukasa Kazami, a young man who lives in 2020, sees himself travel back in time 100 years ago after sitting under a cherry tree.\n\n-- Tokyo, the Imperial Capital. Full of hopes for the future, it\'s a brilliant romantic city where the flowers of culture are in full bloom.\n\n\"Elementary, Tsukasa. The last thing left is always the truth.\"\n\nA mysterious British woman who runs a detective agency alone in the imperial capital.\nUnder her lack of money, Tsukasa is involved in numerous incidents ...?\n\n\"--Now, let\'s find out the answer\".\n\nWhich era will awaken his true potential, Reiwa or Taisho? The curtain of this retro mystery among cherry blossoms lifts!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vqi.jpg'),(7575,'Bakugan Battle Brawlers','2009-10-20','Strategy, Card & Board Game','Nintendo DS','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7576,'Bing Bong XL','2018-05-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bing Bong XL is the first of three games in my minimalist arcade series that share aesthetics while having different control and game play. It is an addictive \'just-one-more-round\' score chaser, perfect for playing while waiting in queue for another game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2955.jpg'),(7577,'Iris: A Colorful Dream',NULL,'Platform, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a world without its colors, stories are told about a time when life was bright and radiant, when the sunlight was warm and nature was strong. While Iris is still young and their world has always been dull and faded, these stories inspire them to dream of a better future. Could these dreams be a sign of change?\n\nJoin Iris as they adventure through the unknown in search of the six lost crystals to make the world colorful once again!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b6o.jpg'),(7578,'Sugoi Girls: Sassy Spy','2025-03-13','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Meet over 50 pretty anime girls in this relaxing puzzle game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kdn.jpg'),(7579,'Depth Fantasia','2001-12-06','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Depth Fantasia, Enix\'s latest massively multiplayer online PC RPG, has had its official Japanese release date set for December 12th of this year. The game follows on the heels of Cross Gate, another MMORPG released by Enix this summer. Depth Fantasia will continue Cross Gate\'s excellent standards, and will help to further open the online RPG market in Asia.\n\nDepth Fantasia allows up to four players to join a party. The party will travel to Ritos Island where they will slay demons, collect Life Gems, and restore order to the cursed land. Players will build their characters based on a class system. As with any other class system, characters learn abilities and then pass them on to more advanced classes. To gain levels, one will need to find Life Gems, or fight another player in a duel.\n\nPlayers will interact with a number of NPCs. These characters all have a unique niche in the world; some examples of these roles include fearsome warriors, mystic sorceresses, and holy clergymen. Each NPC will give the player advice and assistance in completing their quest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j17.jpg'),(7580,'Kentum','2025-09-30','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Stranded in the year 10,000, Kent—an average Joe turned clone—must survive, explore, and rebuild civilization with the help of a snarky AI. Craft, farm, and automate in this 2D craftervania adventure as you uncover Earth’s secrets and kickstart humanity, one machine at a time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co951h.jpg'),(7581,'Psych',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7582,'I Am Butter',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7583,'Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six Siege: Operation Void Edge','2020-03-17','Shooter, Tactical','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','For the fifth year of Rainbow 6 Siege, give some space to our two new operators as they break into this season with their unique abilities. Thanks to her Gemini Replicator, attacker Iana can create a usable clone of herself, while Defender Oryx can use his Remah Dash against enemies and walls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a5b.jpg'),(7584,'Gravitators','2025-01-23','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Gravitators is a Gravity Twin Stick Shooter game where you pilot ships and complete mission objectives to secure the future of humankind. Defend the Earth and travel through the galaxy to repel an alien invasion.\n\nInspired by classic games like Thrust, Gravitar, Asteroids, Solar Jetman and others, Gravitators unshelves this old genre and overhauls it into modern times, while keeping the genre\'s trademark features: maneuvering through tight spots while carrying heavy objects, fighting enemies and preserving fuel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3fd5.jpg'),(7585,'The Hidden Room','2021-10-14','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Hidden Room is an escape room containing various puzzles. Several popular rumors speak of a hidden treasure somewhere in the home of Tom Barkley, an American archaeologist who moved to Germany.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co408d.jpg'),(7586,'A Sexy Tour With: Fiona','2025-02-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a titillating journey through Italy with Fiona, your alluring tour guide. This adults-only \"spot the differences\" game challenges your keen eye while rewarding your success with seductive reveals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m84.jpg'),(7587,'A Lanterns Glow','2020-04-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ALG is a challenging top-down survival RPG. Explore an expansive, randomly generated world shrouded in darkness. Gather resources, craft items, construct buildings, fight strange creatures, and study magic and science to survive and solve the many mysteries of the forest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p0g.jpg'),(7588,'Plan Z Chapter 1','2016-06-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Plan Z is a true-to-life post-apocalyptic zombie survival game that includes an imminent nuclear meltdown, which shapes your every decision in the game to survive. Players will follow Gary Gannon from his home city of Green Bay, WI on his journey across a zombie-infested country to reach the west coast, where his father resides. As in a real-life situation with un-manned nuclear plants, Gary knows he only has so many days to reach his father with his young daughter in tow, which many post-apocalyptic zombie games never address. Along the way, he must make harrowing decisions to evade zombies, trust other survivors, and redeem himself in the eyes of his daughter, whom he neglected her entire life. As a player, you can see Gary’s viewpoint from a multitude of decisions and maybe learn some survival skills. Will you survive in this new world? What’s your plan?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7589,'MotoGP 19','2019-06-27','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Race with official 2019 Championship riders! Have fun with the new multiplayer experience and become Race Director. Challenge the new AI, take a ride through the history of the MotoGP™ and unleash your creativity with the graphic editors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24ae.jpg'),(7590,'Gorogoa','2017-12-14','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Gorogoa is a beautiful hand-drawn story suspended inside a completely unique puzzle. Arrange and combine lavishly illustrated panels, each one a separate interactive window into a living game world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kby.jpg'),(7591,'Hunt for the Shadow Rider','2019-10-01','Shooter, Platform, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A rogue Shadow Rider has escaped to the year 2078. You are the only Hunter left who can take him down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2khz.jpg'),(7592,'Thrill Penguin','2022-06-29','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','crazy parkour game with No cycles, No texts, No complicated weird mechanics, Just have fun and get the thrill now !!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ngn.jpg'),(7593,'幻刃录','2020-10-16','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','《幻刃录》是一款西游题材的RPG仙侠游戏，不单拥有丰富的玩法、精美的场景、炫丽的打斗特效等特色，更有幻刃神兵特色养成系统；在游戏里你可将一块凡铁打造成为能与孙悟空金箍棒同阶的存在，幻刃神兵多种形态可满足玩家培养的欲望；游戏中更新悟空虎装，唐僧袈裟等特色时装让玩家本色出演；加入仙门学习仙法，丰富副本获得法宝，开局送神兵，通关送vip，元宝直接掉落，拥有VIP与神兵的你，可以创建家族，制霸全服；快来与孙悟空一起大闹天宫吧！','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gqr.jpg'),(7594,'Vacation Parking Collection',NULL,'Racing, Simulator','Sin plataforma','Ever thought about parking on vacation could be tricky?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ahp.jpg'),(7595,'Kamen Ridertchi','2022-03-17','Simulator','Handheld Electronic LCD','The Kamen Ridertchi is a licensed Tamagotchi Nano model based on the Toei television series Kamen Rider, created to celebrate the show\'s 50th anniversary.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5y6f.jpg'),(7596,'One Piece: Grand Battle! 3','2003-12-11','Fighting','Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','One Piece Grand Battle 3 is a video game of the action-adventure genre released in 2003 by Ganbarion. This is the third game in the Grand Battle series and the sequel to Grand Battle! 2. The game was released only in Japan on December 11, 2003 for the Playstation 2 and Game Cube.\n\nThe Game cube version of this game featured a demo of One Piece: Going Baseball in which could be played on a Game Boy Advance. Only Luffy and Enel were playable. This game was never translated into English.\n\nThis game includes sixteen playable characters and seven stages all based on the One Piece story up to the Skypiea Arc. Each character contains over two special attacks, and can use the environment as a weapon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53r6.jpg'),(7597,'Descent: Freespace - Silent Threat','1998-12-31','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Expansion to the original Freespace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pwl.jpg'),(7598,'Hero\'s Odyssey','2025-06-27','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Awaken on the mysterious island of Damatheia with a Godly mission in your backlog. Forge bonds with unlikely allies, make life-altering choices, and battle the undead in this Visual Novel filled with secrets, minigames and multiple endings. What truths will you uncover... and at what cost?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gif.jpg'),(7599,'War of Wheels',NULL,'Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','War of Wheels is a frenetic car fighting game in an original “medievalpunk” setting. Choose your car, inspired by a fantasy class, and get ready for battle! Play the single player campaign in the world of Zeranthia or challenge your friends in the numerous multiplayer modes. Fight!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zfu.jpg'),(7600,'Mothmen 1966','2022-07-14','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Mothmen 1966 is a \'Pixel Pulp\' - a visual novel featuring a fusion of exceptional writing and stunning illustration, inspired by mid-20th century pulp fiction and 80s home computer graphics - set amongst the strange occurrences of the Leonid meteor shower of 1966.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55b2.jpg'),(7601,'Dead Nation: Apocalypse Edition','2014-03-05','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','Dead Nation is a top-down shoot \'em up video game for the PlayStation 3 developed by Finnish video game developer Housemarque. It was released on November 30, 2010 in North America, and December 1 in Europe, on PlayStation Network. Dead Nation takes place in a fictional world afflicted by a zombie apocalypse. The player can play as a male or female character and fight different types of zombies. Dead Nation was one of the games given by Sony as part of their \'Welcome Back\' package because of the PlayStation intrusion. In February 2014 a PlayStation 4 version of the game titled the Apocalypse Edition was announced. The Road of Devastation DLC was released at launch, while the main game was free for PlayStation Plus subscribers in March 2014.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h4n.jpg'),(7602,'Mars Horizon','2020-11-16','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In Mars Horizon the player is tasked with leading a major space agency from the dawn of the space age though to humanity\'s journey to Mars. Players run a government space agency from when the first rockets launched into the atmosphere, right through to the first crewed mission to Mars. Research new tech, expand your agency base, build rockets, send satellites into orbit, and launch a variety of missions. As the player, you’re in charge of every element of the journey into space.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47vw.jpg'),(7603,'AFL Evolution','2017-05-05','Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','EXPERIENCE THE EVOLUTION - AFL Evolution brings you the most intense and feature packed AFL experience ever.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22mk.jpg'),(7604,'The Epyx Collection: Handheld','2025-04-09','Shooter, Platform, Sport, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Witness the return of six awesome Epyx classics from the 1980s/90s, originally designed for cutting-edge handheld gaming.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84qr.jpg'),(7605,'Anstoss 1-3 Bundle',NULL,'Simulator, Sport','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t6j.jpg'),(7606,'Hospital Manager','2015-03-25','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Experience something novel, bursting with extraordinary phenomena and strange situations in your hospital! Only you have the power to make the best decisions and to make your hospital the most popular one! But beware: Several events will add some spice to your life!\nEmbark on the career of your life!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43d5.jpg'),(7607,'Star Saga One: Rise of the Dominators','2018-01-19','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Do you like blowing things up? So do I, that\'s the reason my dog Otis and I made this game. Star Saga One is a fast-paced space style shoot-em-up that takes place at an orbital mine station in the middle of nowhere. It features 3 different weapon types and a personal shield when things get real hairy. This game has you pitted against hordes of deep space drones, each wave more challenging than the last.\n\nYour weapons include your standard Blaster Pistol, the Wolf-PPK, with included rapid fire mode. The Ram-PPK Polarizer, which temporarily inverts your enemies target. The last is the Hart-PPK EMP grenade when you\'re surrounded and you need to take out more than you have time to. Your digital defense is a personal crystalline shield made from liquid diamond, but even it won\'t protect you if a strategy isn\'t on your side.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mrdp9l1x7ailggrk4rql.jpg'),(7608,'Pragmata',NULL,'Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Pragmata is an action adventure title that depicts a near-future dystopian world on the moon through a deeply profound story and setting. The game will take full advantage of next-generation platform features, and as Capcom\'s first completely new IP made for dedicated video game consoles in four years†, the company aims to establish Pragmata as one of its core brands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48ze.jpg'),(7609,'AI War 2: Titan Edition',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hr2.jpg'),(7610,'Eggconsole Riglas PC-8801','2024-12-05','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','Seeking the secret of Beljuna, May Osborn set out from the village. What he saw, guided by the crystal, was..','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9427.jpg'),(7611,'Riverhill Trials','2018-04-12','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You wake up on a strange planet and you don\'t know how you got there, but you\'ll soon find out that the forest is alive and you must overcome its challenges. In Riverhill Trials nothing is what it seems, its dynamic environment will challenge and test you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lumt5qzctfzsxh3ydch5.jpg'),(7612,'City Tales: Medieval Era','2025-05-22','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build medieval cities teeming with life and tales untold. Forge organic urban landscapes and manage a rich economy whilst building bonds with companions whose stories are intertwined with the fate of your city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94c7.jpg'),(7613,'Christmas Stories: A Christmas Carol - Collector\'s Edition','2013-12-05','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Go off on a Christmas journey through time and space to help Scrooge, and fill his flawed and miserable lonely life with good deeds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b4i.jpg'),(7614,'English with Rayman',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','English with Rayman is an educational 2D platform game, based on the original Rayman. It was designed to teach young children the basics of the English language. It is not to be confused with Rayman Junior, which is an entirely different game. English with Rayman blends the Glade of Dreams with the real world in a way which makes little sense in the context of the series, making numerous references to real-world locations such as Ireland and Scotland. English with Rayman was adapted to teach various other languages under such names as French with Rayman.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4jo7.jpg'),(7615,'Fur and Fables','2025-04-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into Fur & Fables, a party based bullet heaven roguelike! Assemble a party of adventurers, level up, and recruit new friends along the way. Experiment with party composition and synergies to fit your playstyle to save Fabletown from the endless hordes of monsters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mec.jpg'),(7616,'Adventure Match','2021-08-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxn.jpg'),(7617,'Rehtona','2020-01-17','Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','A single-player puzzle-platformer that features parallel universes and a mysterious branching storyline with alternate endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l5a.jpg'),(7618,'Combiner the Card Game','2018-08-10','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Digital version of the card game called \"Combiner\". The playing process is based upon the use of combinations in order to reduce the opponent\'s score. Play with computer players or on a local network (up to four players).','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7619,'12 Labours of Hercules XI: Painted Adventure - Collector\'s Edition','2020-11-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxe.jpg'),(7620,'Trouble Kingdom','2016-04-13','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98z6.jpg'),(7621,'Desperate 1: After Sunset',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','The first work of the \"Desperate\" series - After Sunset, it’s a horizontal 2D action game with hand-painted, and using a new keyboard operation, you can feel a more intuitive combat experience in this game. Fight for the thing you loved in your life in every street you pass by！','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92xk.jpg'),(7622,'Boss Rush Bundle',NULL,'Shooter, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6usy.jpg'),(7623,'The Living Remain','2022-04-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Living Remain is a virtual reality first person adventure shooter where players immerse themselves in a new world where the undead have taken over. You must survive the horde of undead using an arsenal of weapons in a story driven campaign loaded with a variety of interactive environments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43xs.jpg'),(7624,'Astronarch','2021-01-22','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fusion of roguelikes and auto-battlers like never before seen. Recruit a party of mysterious heroes, navigate deadly lands, collect an arsenal of magical items, and vanquish a new evil threatening the realm!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66i0.jpg'),(7625,'Mega Drive Twin Pads',NULL,'Platform, Adventure','Plug & Play','The Mega Drive Twin Pads is a Mega Drive \"console on a chip\" originally produced by AtGames for the Asian market with 5 built-in games and distributed in Europe by Blaze Europe with 10 games. One of the two game controllers plugs directly into a television, however it will only output a PAL signal. There is no cartridge slot, so you are limited to the 10 games. Four AA batteries are needed to operate the console.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w7j.jpg'),(7626,'Defensurvivor','2024-12-11','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DEFENSURVIVOR is a strategy game where you build obstacles and place and move units to block zombies. There are various units with unique characteristics and powerful high-level units that can be obtained through combination. Use randomly given units to survive until the end!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94i8.jpg'),(7627,'Area 51/Maximum Force Duo','1998-03-31','Shooter','Arcade','Players can choose to play either of these previously released titles. In the first game, use a light gun to shoot infected human \"zombies\", aliens and their mothership. In the second game, players shoot terrorists.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25j4.jpg'),(7628,'12 Labours of Hercules XII: Timeless Adventure - Collectors Edition','2021-08-02','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','One sunny day brave Hercules was resting in his hammock and cooking delicious donuts. He dozed off just for a few minutes but it was enough for the hero\'s brunch to burn to a crisp. All the dreams of a starving Hercules were ruined. What should he do? There was a way. Hercules decided to turn back time, and move the clock\'s hand back with all his might. What could possibly go wrong? Obviously, everything!\n\nThe collector\'s edition contains additional bonus levels, a guide, and wallpapers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxf.jpg'),(7629,'Amelie falls over and over again',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Masamune and Amelie are tasked with infiltrating the Caledonia Magic University. However, various schemes are swirling around the University. Unexpected struggles, a week looping through magic. Where will the story lead...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p2z.jpg'),(7630,'Slot Advanture','2024-03-01','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Are you lucky or bad? 2D turn-based action adventure game. Defeat the monster with the hit rate you get by turning the slot. You can also get the character\'s stat, various items, and good ability buffs all at random. Trust your luck and go on an adventure rather than a high-level strategy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7y2u.jpg'),(7631,'Dark Ages','2014-05-05','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','Dark Ages is a platform game written for MS-DOS, published by Apogee Software. It was the first shareware game to feature support for the AdLib sound card.\n\nDark Ages was distributed as shareware. It consists of three episodes, with only the first episode playable in the shareware version. The episodes are:\nPrince of Destiny\nThe Undead Kingdom\nDungeons of Doom\n\nThe game was released as freeware on March 20, 2009.\n\nGameplay:\n\nDark Ages is a side scrolling game where the player\'s alter ego, the prince, can move sideways, jump and shoot. Game play involves killing and avoiding enemies and jumping over obstacles. Progression to the next level often involves a hidden door, revealed by one of several Wise Men type characters after retrieving an item for them. The items include a key, a shield, and an apple.\n\nThe player can use magic to fight the prince\'s enemies, starting out with a simple energy bolt and slowly gaining access to more destructive spells as the game progresses. There are three spells in the game: a blue bolt that flies straight forward, a boomerang that flies forward then returns allowing enemies to be hit twice, and a magic beam with a shorter range but can kill most enemies in one hit and can be fired in rapid succession.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63dp.jpg'),(7632,'Sword Art Online: Last Recollection - Deluxe Edition','2023-10-06','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The culmination of the Sword Art Online game series, Last Recollection features the largest roster of SAO playable characters and sub scenarios!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co788r.jpg'),(7633,'The Dark Realm','2022-03-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Dark Realm is a roguelike with emphasis on fast-paced gameplay and bullet hell elements. No more boring choices, dialogues and inventory management - just do everything as you go and enjoy the pure action!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k9z.jpg'),(7634,'Command: Modern Operations - Desert Storm','2019-03-28','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Command: Desert Storm is a new DLC release for Command: Modern Air/Naval Operations. Fourteen historical & hypothetical campaign scenarios plus a bonus contemporary standalone scenario cover the major actions that marked the conflict, allowing you to explore the events that happened - and the ones that could easily have.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yot.jpg'),(7635,'New Warfare',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7636,'Puzzles for smart: Dogs','2018-09-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fairly simple, educational game. Assemble the puzzle of dogs from certain parts of the picture. The game of puzzles will seem to your child very fascinating as he will gradually achieve that he wants to see rather','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7637,'Turdy',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Play as Turdy the Turtle, (what kind of name is that...) as he traverses the vast open world. Collect coins and discover secret items, pets, passages, levels, costumes, and more while meeting some interesting characters along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5npu.jpg'),(7638,'Touhou Mahoujou: Book of Star Mythology','2016-10-14','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Touhou Project fangame developed by Maceknight and Raichu that originated as a Touhou styled music album, but was eventually made into a game. Gameplay revolves around collecting star items dropped from enemies, where more can be obtained by attacking enemies at close range. Collecting star items increases the Magnitude gauge, which leads to higher point multipliers. Star items do many other things: they factor in gaining resource pieces, they increase the point item value, and gathering enough in a stage will trigger the stage boss\'s \"Last word\" spell card.\n\nThis game uses the chapter system of Legacy of Lunatic Kingdom, and is also divided into two modes: \"Legendary Hero Mode\" with infinite lives, and the regular \"Legacy Mode\". Legendary Hero Mode is different from Pointdevice Mode in that it ignores what chapter you\'re on; instead, you simply respawn where you died, either at that exact spot or at the bottom of the screen (depending on the setting in the Option menu).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6es5.jpg'),(7639,'Don\'t Be Afraid: The First Toy','2020-07-02','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Don\'t Be Afraid - The First Toy, is an introduction to the dramatic story of a boy kidnapped by a psychopath. Exploring the giant house of your torturer you will soon discover things worse than your childish nightmares. Take on the role of Jamie and see what phrase “The First Toy” actually means.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4o6u.jpg'),(7640,'Voodoo Chronicles: The First Sign','2011-10-18','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help out James Voodoo as he investigates mysterious attacks through the forsaken hamlet of Ravenhill, the wealthy city of Richtown, and a variety of breathtaking sceneries inspired by major fiction genres: adventure, film noir, thriller, steam punk, and more!\n\nWith over 50 scenes to investigate, numerous puzzles, oodles of hidden objects to find, and a captivating story told through cut scenes and voice acting, \"Voodoo Chronicles: The First Sign\" will let you embark on an adventure you won\'t want to stop!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a81.jpg'),(7641,'Intensive Exposure','2016-09-06','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Intensive Exposure is a fast paced game in which you have to expose yourself as many times as possible while constantly avoiding the security. Play as Moe Lester and expose yourself with grace, style and intense satisfaction whenever and wherever you can! Are you in the office? On sunday shopping? Or maybe on an afternoon trip to the museum? It doesn’t matter - the time has come! But be aware, as you must protect your identity. Don’t let the security get you and watch out for ladies that may like what they see a little too much… Use the environment to slow them down and expose, expose, EXPOSE!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ialyqgcgdjsgmsawu9it.jpg'),(7642,'Toonstruck','1996-11-30','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','Toonstruck is an adventure game released in 1996 in which, although all the imagery is drawn and scanned into the game, the protagonist Drew Blanc (played and voiced by Christopher Lloyd) is an actual video-captured representation of the actor (the name is a pun, since the character has \"drawn a blank\" on coming up with a new idea for a character). Drew\'s sidekick, crudely named Flux Wildly, is a drawn character voiced by Dan Castellaneta. Toonstruck also features scan-line compressed FMV and was also one of the first video games to include stock music from APM Music, notably the classic \"Spooky Scherzo\" by Sam Fonteyn and \"Lonely Hearts Club A\" by David Bell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71r2.jpg'),(7643,'Resident Evil 7: Biohazard - Not A Hero','2017-12-12','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The third DLC for Resident Evil 7. It features the character that introduces himself as Chris Redfield at the end of the main story.\n\n\"Not a Hero is a little different from the nightmare suffered by Ethan in RE7\'s main game. Chris has the skills, and the firepower, to get the job done. Do you have what it takes to complete the mission?\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yf8.jpg'),(7644,'Diabolik Lovers: Dark Fate','2015-02-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','An otome game for the PlayStation Vita.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zz4.jpg'),(7645,'The Legend of Heroes: Trails of Cold Steel','2013-09-26','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','The Legend of Heroes: Trails of Cold Steel is the sixth installment in the main Trails series, serving as the beginning to the Erebonia arc. The game follows Rean Schwarzer and his fellow students of \"Class VII\" at Thors Military Academy, a newly formed class at the academy which is the only one not segregated by social class, composing of both Erebonian nobility and commoners.\n\nThe basic gameplay is nearly identical to the previous entries with a few changes. The biggest change to the battle system and also counting as a brand new feature is the \"Tactical Link System\". The \"Tactical Link\" allow players follow up with three different kinds of link attacks, dealing additional damage and providing various other benefits. \"Tactical Link\" becomes a more useful asset to the player as the story progress and characters level up their \"Link Levels\" with other characters. As the link levels increase, you will obtain new link abilities such as healing the link partner or increase the CP gain of the partner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44ma.jpg'),(7646,'Mercury Abbey','2024-11-22','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game uses pixel sprites, with characters drawn in a classic American comicbook style. Fossil halls, greenhouses, hedge mazes, botanical gardens, underground cave systems...scenes appear one after another, presenting a visual feast. Unique lighting and shading technology creates an engaging atmosphere and a wonderfully immersive experience.\nThe game embraces the spirit of early suspense novels, interspersing classic cultural elements throughout the story. Adopting an overhead world view, the world is composed of anthropomorphic animal (furry) characters; the social structures, folklore, and ethnic relations of this world are all waiting to be discovered by players!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wq2.jpg'),(7647,'Trendpoker 3D Community Edition','2017-12-01','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Are you a rookie? Or a professional? Whatever! With this poker game you can compete against a powerful A.I. based on neural networks - or other poker players in the online community! \n \nIn No Limit, Pot Limit, Split Limit poker and various game modes such as single game, tournament, network game and internet game you can train and improve your poker skills - or just play for fun. \n \nEven people who have never played a round of Texas Holdem Poker are quickly and easily introduced into the rules and can immediately start exciting poker tournaments!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27i2.jpg'),(7648,'World of Warcraft - Battle Chest','2007-10-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','World of Warcraft Battle Chest (this is obsolete and no longer available as it has been replaced by the World of Warcraft package) is a collection of World of Warcraft products released by Blizzard Entertainment on October 2, 2007. It combines the DVD versions of World of Warcraft and its first expansion World of Warcraft: The Burning Crusade with the BradyGames strategy guides for both titles, as well as two Guest Pass Keys, in one package at a suggested retail price of $39.99 in the United States and €34.99 in Europe','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tza.jpg'),(7649,'SCP-582 Slenderman Chapter 1','2022-08-07','Adventure, Indie','Android','SCP-582 Slenderman Chapter 1 is the first part of the SCP-582 game series.\nThe game is first-person, based on the SCP foundation, and the famous creepypasta Slenderman. the game contains puzzles and secrets behind the SCP foundation and the Item SCP-582 Slenderman. with a new re-imagination of the SCP foundation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7n2c.jpg'),(7650,'Corral','2018-09-26','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Corral','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7651,'Freedom','2021-06-01','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are the golden eagle, the apex predator of the avian world. Hunt, kill, and fly to survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zxy.jpg'),(7652,'Totoball','2017-09-11','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Totoball, also known as table football, is a football-inspired game. In it players have to pull, push and spin the soccer players\nthat are stuck in cross bars, a simple game that can give you lots of fun times with your friends','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jqp.jpg'),(7653,'Despotism 3k','2021-11-19','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Humanity is enslaved by an AI… which is awesome, because we’re on the right side of the conflict. Exploit puny humans to extract power and build your own empire! You’ll have to keep track of them to make sure they don’t succumb to exhaustion and hunger… although the weakest ones can always be thrown to the Bioreactor.\nIn other words, this is a resource management sim with rogue-lite elements, dramatic plot, and an abundance of pop culture references. Also, jokes. Slaughter has never been so fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28x8.jpg'),(7654,'Flipull','1990-03-16','Puzzle','Game Boy','Game Boy port of Plotting for the Arcade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wu6.jpg'),(7655,'Warhall','2021-10-29','Simulator, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Warhall is a free to play online wargaming simulator for The 9th Age: Fantasy Battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4932.jpg'),(7656,'Fully Dogomatic','2025-02-17','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','An auto shooter where you create a ring of guns around you to mow down thousands of enemies! You may be an adorable corgi, but that won\'t stop you from designing the ultimate arsenal of fully customizable, realistic weaponry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87ky.jpg'),(7657,'Be a Pirate','2020-11-09','Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game about a small but brave pirate, whose goal is to collect all the coins and escape faster, because time is limited.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tot.jpg'),(7658,'Escapade',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7659,'Jinga Online','2020-02-17','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grab a block from anywhere under the last completed row and then put it on the top - that\'s it! The longer you play the harder it\'ll be as the tower becomes more and more unstable, however, you\'ll also unlock stuff faster. Good luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1sko.jpg'),(7660,'Aces of the Deep','1994-12-31','Simulator','DOS','Take command of one of seven German U-Boats during WWII and hunt down and destroy allied convoys. This is never an easy task since their escorts and aircraft are waiting to ruin your day. The level of realism, and with it the difficulty, can be set by enabling or disabling ten options, e.g. unlimited ammo, clear sight or even invulnerability.\n\nCampaigns can be started in one of several time slots, allowing you to play for the entire war if you wish. During these campaigns you gain medals and promotions which includes the command of better submarines. You can also choose to play a single mission where you can set certain variables, e.g. number of ships or weather conditions. Specific missions aren\'t required because the engine \"rolls up\" convoys and targets, meaning every time you play the missions will change. The type and location of these missions depend on the historical time and the used submarine.\n\nThe submarine consists of several rooms where you can access the functions and instruments you\'ll need, e.g. the logbook in the captain\'s room or the fuel and battery prompt in the engine room. However, the most important functions can be brought up at any time, this includes the sea map where you set waypoints. The crew can take over certain tasks, e.g. identifying ships.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v9d.jpg'),(7661,'The Church in the Darkness','2019-08-02','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','From Richard Rouse III and inspired by real-life events, The Church in the Darkness is an action-infiltration game that delves into the radical movements of the 1970s. As a former law enforcement officer, you have resolved to get into Freedom Town and check on your sister\'s son. But life in Freedom Town may not be what it seems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1neg.jpg'),(7662,'Disney\'s American Dragon Jake Long: Rise of the Huntsclan!','2006-11-12','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Advance','Jake Long\'s most fierce enemy, Dark Dragon, takes Rose, Jake\'s love interest, hostage in order to cause Jake\'s destruction in Disney\'s American Dragon: Jake Long, Attack of the Dark Dragon. When Dark Dragon realizes the evil Huntsman also has an interest in rescuing his hostage, the ultimate duel ensues. Players battle their way through an onslaught of villains that pour in from every direction to save Rose in the process.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vxp.jpg'),(7663,'Orika: Rise From The Crash',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','ORIKA is a fun 3D action-adventure and story-rich game inspired from 3D Platformer games, where the robot ORIKA sets out to clean up polluted water environments. Explore beautiful landscapes, solve puzzles, and overcome challenges in this exciting adventure to restore clean water.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kni.jpg'),(7664,'Christmas Puzzle Story','2024-12-19','Puzzle, Strategy, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Celebrate the magic of the holiday season with Christmas Puzzle Story, a cozy and addictive puzzle game where festive fruits and Christmas treats collide in delightful combos!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aju.jpg'),(7665,'Warranty Man','2024-11-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','First person scary game set in an underground parking garage. Find your lost parking card, collect some cash to pay for your parking and get out before Warranty Man finds you and sells you auto insurance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mej.jpg'),(7666,'The Last Cube','2022-03-10','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Venture through six unique areas of the cube-world and overcome three-dimensional brain-teasers in this upcoming puzzle adventure game. You, the Last Cube, were awakened for a purpose - save this peculiar world from collapsing by solving puzzle tracks left by your ancestors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ch2.jpg'),(7667,'Retro First Friday Collection #3',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bhi.jpg'),(7668,'The Companion','2021-05-13','Music, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A cinematic gaming experience. Play as a Spirit Animal on a quest of purpose and fate. Explore a magical and beautiful world where visions of a past, present, and future, guide you. Collect Essence and find Artifacts that aid in building a link to the corporeal world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rzt.jpg'),(7669,'Super Mega Neo Pug','2016-05-11','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Turbo Pug is back! And this time, he\'s airborne! Fly through deserts, green fields and more stunning environments. Dodge an onslaught of enemies and go head to head with giant bosses! Unlock new costumes for Turbo Pug and new creatures to play as. Please try not to squish your pug!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ak1.jpg'),(7670,'Mystery Master: Felony!',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7671,'12 Labours of Hercules XIV: Message in a Bottle - Collector\'s Edition','2022-10-28','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxo.jpg'),(7672,'Roodies Factory',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Imagine being the owner of a factory and going back years later it was abandoned because your brother has recently gone missing? This is a game you wouldn\'t want to miss...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ku8.jpg'),(7673,'Hotel Renovator: Indoor Garden Room & Furniture Set','2023-10-17','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escape the daily rush and immerse yourself in a lush, tranquil oasis with our Indoor Garden Room & Furniture Set. Turn your hotel room into a nature lover\'s paradise!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7956.jpg'),(7674,'Frozen State','2014-06-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Frozen State is a game about the adversities faced whilst existing and surviving in a dying Siberian city, Duga 40.\n\nThe experimental city has been infested by an extraterrestrial parasite that has obliterated the native population. Once infected, the parasite causes its victims to become vicious alien hybrids…\n\nHowever, the grotesquely disfigured creatures are not the only menace that threatens the surviving citizens – hunger, and the bitter Siberian cold, will force them to behave in a Machiavellian fashion with one another .\n\nFrozen State is still very early in its development. Some features have not yet been implemented or may not work properly. However, we are continually working to improve Frozen State and eagerly anticipate your feedback and suggestions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mps.jpg'),(7675,'Demon\'s Winter','1988-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga, Apple II','Demon\'s Winter is a sequel to SSI\'s 1987 Shard of Spring, set two hundred years after the events of the original, and featuring a game world 32 times the size of the previous one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uwmqsl85dywtjohoreek.jpg'),(7676,'PetDrivr','2020-12-24','Racing, Simulator, Indie','Oculus VR, Oculus Go, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Drive with your pet over the town, collecting pet snacks, and their favorite toys before reaching your destination. Get help from your friends to find the exact location of the toy in the cooperative mode, or challenge them to find out who can collect more snacks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3v9v.jpg'),(7677,'Blockium',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7678,'Kindaichi Shounen no Jikenbo: 10-nenme no Shoutaijou','2000-12-16','Adventure','Game Boy Color','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vca.jpg'),(7679,'Vicarious','2022-05-21','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vicarious is a limit-removing wad for Doom 2 set in a medieval city. It\'s mostly inspired visually by the Elden Ring Trailer that came out some time around last year, as well as Scythe 2 and @Egg Boy\'s Cold Front.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7axz.jpg'),(7680,'Runoveryou','2019-11-29','Racing, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Runoveryou is a Run Over \"simulator\", in a way.Drive your vehicle and run over who ever is in the way, play different game modes, customize the game in the \"Mods Garage\".Put your aggression out and drive \"safe\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tj8.jpg'),(7681,'Dandy Ace','2021-09-28','Fighting, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dandy Ace is an over the top action game that follows this fabulous magician seeking to combine and use his magical cards, fighting and looting his way to defeat the Green-Eyed Illusionist and free himself from a cursed mirror.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25fl.jpg'),(7682,'Universal Combat CE','2015-02-06','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The ultimate space capital ship combat compendium is the evolution of hard core space combat sims. The only game of its kind currently in existence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63nb.jpg'),(7683,'The Asskickers','2015-02-06','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Asskickers is a modern tribute to 2D arcade beat\'em ups. Join Alex, Diane and Marcus in their action-packed journey through the heart of the modern urban jungles. Wrongly accused, our three heroes will stand up to a corrupt political and financial elite and make white-collar criminals discover the lost art of asskicking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co431r.jpg'),(7684,'Defend Home','2020-07-22','Shooter, Platform, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome To my Defend Home Home Page. The Space Shooter is here for kid or adults of any age to play. We want people to have fun, share who can go the farthest, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hfm.jpg'),(7685,'Williams Arcade Classics','1997-12-31','Arcade','Game.com','A port of Williams Arcade Classics for the Game.com that includes the Arcade games: Robotron: 2084, Joust, Sinistar, Defender and Defender II.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rtg.jpg'),(7686,'Wild Hunger','2018-02-06','Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','Play as a wolf help him and his pack reach the farthest into the valley of \"Wild Hunger\". Increase your wolf\'s skills and try to unlock the skin that better fits you.\nFace a different challenge in each game and keep improving the wolf\'s abilities to survive longer and have access to alternative routes that will allow you to dodge dangers and / or collect more rewards!\nDo you think you can avoid all kinds of dangers?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hjs957j76ldeh5iwbfjy.jpg'),(7687,'The Passage','2021-09-13','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"The Passage\" is a first-person exploration game set in a cold forest of a post apocalyptic world. You suddenly run out of gas in a distant area and your only way out is to search for 2 gas canisters in the area to help you on your journey, but... beware of the creatures in the forest.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7688,'Super Mario Run: Ver. 3.0.4','2017-09-28','Platform','Android, iOS','The update added a mode called Remix 10, a new set of levels to explore with World Star, an unlockable Princess Daisy and a feature to silence the background music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99ol.jpg'),(7689,'Super Neptunia RPG: DLC Bundle',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tbr.jpg'),(7690,'Bullet Cell','2019-05-01','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7691,'Elemental, Querido Gunso','2023-01-23','Shooter, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embark on this adventure together with Gunso and many other characters to defeat the Enedusi and bring peace back to the world! In \"Elemental, Querido Gunso\", you\'ll be able to fight against your enemies thanks to the cannon that our protagonist has installed on his wing, solve puzzles with the obstacles you find along the way and... much more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62pk.jpg'),(7692,'Cannibal Chickens','2019-06-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Even chickens love chicken! A feeding frenzy for up to four players! Straightforward play for casual and hardcore gamers alike!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7693,'Pomegranates','2024-05-07','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Set in Gaza, Palestine, travel between the past and the future to restore the community you come from. The game was created to memorialize the Palestinians lives lost since October 7th, 2024.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99i3.jpg'),(7694,'Epic Snowday Adventure','2018-03-09','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The neighborhood kids must be neutralized. I\'m sure its for their own good. Only you can restore order by DESTROYING YOUR NEIGHBORS WITH SNOWBALLS. They\'ll thank you for it later.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7695,'Living Books: The Berenstain Bears in the Dark','1996-08-26','Point-and-click, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"The Berenstain Bears in the Dark\" is an interactive educational game based on the book of the same name. It follows Brother Bear reading a scary story to Sister Bear, leading her to fear the dark. Papa Bear helps Sister Bear realize it\'s just her imagination, while Brother Bear eventually becomes afraid of the dark too. The game features two play modes, \"Read To Me\" and \"Let Me Play,\" as well as bonus games like \"Animal Match\" and \"Picture Jumble.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6omv.jpg'),(7696,'Memory Leak: Cyberpunk Hentai','2019-08-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A causal memory training puzzle with a nice reward at the end of each level.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7697,'9-nine-:Episode 3','2019-04-26','Simulator, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','9-nine- Episode 3 is the third volume in a series of supernatural mystery games, with Episode 3 telling a story centered around Haruka Kosaka.\nThe entries in the the 9-nine- series share the same setting and world, but each entry focuses on a different heroine. 9-nine- is a tale of the town of Shiromitsugawa, host to mysterious Artifacts and the superpowers they bestow on their Users.\n\nA tale of growing trust and budding romance between the protagonist and the heroine, and also a murder mystery where they hunt down the culprit behind a series of supernatural murders. A tale of our group running into an organization composed of Artifact Users called Rig Veda. What is their goal, and what is the real goal of the culprit? Will romance develop by working together?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2suz.jpg'),(7698,'Roadclub: League Racing','2019-01-08','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ascend the divisions of the mysterious Roadclub and race for a chance to one day challenge the reigning Roadclub Master for his title. Make your mark on the online leaderboards or challenge a friend in local splitscreen races. Whichever path you choose, Roadclub takes you for a ride.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r61.jpg'),(7699,'MindJam! The Knowledge Guru','2017-04-05','Quiz/Trivia','Android, iOS','Challenge your friends in a MindJam knowledge quiz game. Become a knowledge guru by answering thousands of quiz questions in Science, Geography, History, Sports, Cinema and other categories. Compete and challenge other players online globally in Questions with images, Four different question types and three challenging game modes. Join the MindJam game community and challenge your friends in an online or local game. An absolutely entertaining quiz game for genius players who like to compete, test and quest their skills in an online or local MindJam match.\n\nAre you up to the challenge? Knowledge, Agility and a Genius mind are skills needed to become a MindJam Guru.\n\nAn absolutely must have quiz game with:\n- Quest you skills in thousands of entertaining questions\n- Four different type of games ( Multiple choice, Sorting, Find the images, Find three )\n- Beautiful images for all questions\n- Different categories of questions like: Geography, History, Science, Sports, Cinema and with more coming up\n- An online active community to socialize and test your skills\n- Match and compete against other players in an online or local game\n- Three exciting game modes challenge your friends\n- Test your knowledge in a match with friends even when you are offline\n- Connect with Facebook\n- Share your success on Facebook\n\nWith a slick and joyful user interface, MindJam! The Knowledge Guru, offers a unique multiplayer challenge for genius players that seek to test their trivia skills and critical thinking, while having tons of fun!\n\nPlay with your family and friends and brag about your knowledge, by sharing your results on Social networks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jlld8xp3spnmixym56vi.jpg'),(7700,'The Centennial Case: A Shijima Story','2023-04-25','Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The Centennial Case: A Shijima Story centers around the ill-fated Shijima family, who have experienced a chain of inexplicable deaths in their family over the past century. Players will take on the role of mystery novelist, Haruka Kagami and use their powers of deductions to uncover the truth behind four murder cases that have taken place in the Shijima household over the last one hundred years.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hct.jpg'),(7701,'Dinosaurs: Mission Dino Camp','2023-10-19','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The schleich DINOSAURS have come to life and need your help! Find and rescue the legendary giant creatures while you an embark on an action-filled adventure deep in the amazon jungle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sr4.jpg'),(7702,'No, Thank You!!!','2013-06-28','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An Adult BL visual novel game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q7z.jpg'),(7703,'The Adventure of Pixi: The 3 Stones','2025-05-01','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A humorous adventure of epic proportions, spanning 1 fully open map, 2 worlds, and (more than) 3 colors! The Old Man gives Pixi a quest: find the 3 stones and use them to restore the colors! During her adventure, she will have to cross dungeons, another world, and maybe even face... herself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kuf.jpg'),(7704,'RhythMario 64.5: Crescendo of Cosmic Beast','2021-06-26','Platform','Nintendo 64','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8phw.jpg'),(7705,'PUBG: Battlegrounds - Season 28','2024-02-15','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The map service has been updated to closely reflect regional preferences.\nIntroducing PUBG\'s first electric vehicle. Ride the new 6-seater Pico Bus and discover the unique charm of electric vehicles as you hit the roads of Rondo! Explore new ways to jump, strengthen teamwork, and have a bit more fun with our new vaulting features.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rra.jpg'),(7706,'The Cow G','2022-03-25','Simulator, Indie','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','The clicking adventure you and your friends need. Milk the cow to collect the milk cans with the main hero of the game The Cow G, so you can save the farm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4klu.jpg'),(7707,'Demelia\'s Isle',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','You just woke up on a beach. Simply trying to survive, you find yourself immersed in a quest against the demonic forces that are awakening again in this isolated kingdom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oc7.jpg'),(7708,'Snowshine',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7709,'Metal War Online: Retribution','2015-12-12','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fast Online Car Shooter. Unmatched dynamic shooter with a huge selection of futuristic technology! Millions of players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/brbar1eopw6tulbjkn82.jpg'),(7710,'Noroi Kago: The Grudged Domain','2025-04-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Noroi Kago: The Grudged Domain is a four-player co-op survival horror game centered on the supernatural \"Yokai\" from Japanese folklore. Trapped in a cursed domain, you and your companions must work together to endure the curse, hide from the terrifying Yokai, and find a way to escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vlw.jpg'),(7711,'Cabal Online','2006-09-01','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Long ago, a powerful group known as the CABAL used their powers to transform the continent of Nevareth into a utopia, ruled by the strong. Constant abuse of power, coupled with in-fighting between members, ultimately led to their downfall, leaving the continent in ruins. During this massive upheaval, nearly every member of the group perished, sparing only seven, including their leader, Faust.\n\nUsing his last remnants of power, Faust saw a glimpse of the future and in his vision, saw once again the near annihilation of Nevareth due to the misuse of power. Now, nearly a thousand years after the sundering, that same evil has renewed and the cycle of extinction has begun. It is up to you to face the wake of destruction that begins to envelop Nevareth, and bring about its salvation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j7z.jpg'),(7712,'Un Profe','2003-11-27','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98zb.jpg'),(7713,'Unexpected Quest','2007-04-26','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98zg.jpg'),(7714,'Space Warp','1984-12-31','Puzzle','FM-7','Space Warp is a puzzle game in which you control a ship within four boxes that abstractly represent a three-dimensional cube. Your goal is to touch the letters in alphabetical order. There are 9 difficulty levels which adjusts the amount of time given to you to finish the level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2li7.jpg'),(7715,'Magic and Legend: Star Seekers','2021-05-21','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Game Boy','Magic and Legend: Star Seekers is an arcade platformer with the goal of collecting stars across multiple levels themed on locations around the world with a variety of other game styles in between.\nThe second in a planned trilogy of homebrew games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pvy.jpg'),(7716,'Harvest Moon: One World','2021-09-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Explore a world of new and familiar faces, unique villages and adventurous challenges, while managing your growing farm.\n\nHarvest Moon: One World features an all-new engine and graphics, creating a brand-new way of exploring Harvest Moon for seasoned players and new generations alike.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xl3.jpg'),(7717,'TCG Card Shop Master','2025-01-31','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','What’s your strategy for becoming a top card retailer?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co921u.jpg'),(7718,'Dreaming in the Mountains','2023-08-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A dream and a question The game tells the story of a climber who enters a dream The player, as an abstract subject in the dream, experiences various dream slices hope you get something out of this','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ypk.jpg'),(7719,'Pixel Fixel: Remixel Edition','2024-06-23','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Support Pixel Fixel and its developer by purchasing this DLC! Unlock 40 new levels with unique shapes, a colorway creation tool, decorative flair for your multiplayer username, new soundscapes, new themes, and new cheat codes. Thank you for your support!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kw4.jpg'),(7720,'The Little Witch and The Lost Memories','2024-07-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Little Witch and The Lost Memories is an exploration-based adventure game set in the dreams of a girl who has lost her memories. The game\'s story unfolds as she uncovers various secrets while exploring her dream world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ubm.jpg'),(7721,'Cursed Castilla','2012-12-12','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cursed is an action platformer with a compendium of myths from medieval Spain and the spirit of a mid-to-late \'80s arcade game.\n\nRun, jump and throw your weapons as you move through decadent medieval landscapes full of dangers and monsters. Learn about each situation and enemy pattern in order to progress. Open chests and hit hidden spots for bonuses, weapons and equippable objects. Find the five Moura\'s tears to unlock the true final chapter and discover a bunch of secrets to reach different endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7t1d.jpg'),(7722,'The Warp Coin Catastrophe','2019-11-25','Visual Novel','Game Boy','The Warp Coin Catastrophe is a visual novel game. The Warp World Crew is in trouble, and they need your help! Someone has eaten all the Warp Coins made by Marianne\'s Chocolate! Use all of your skills and know-how to find the evidence that will clear your friend’s name and prove their innocence!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ief.jpg'),(7723,'Firezone','1988-12-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','2160. Beam technology, energy shields, and ground-skimming propulsion systems have revolutionized ground combat into high-speed, wide-ranging battles. World powers like the Pacific Combine and the European League spar and vie for territory with Grav tanks, striders, and Leviathans. Take the role of a commander overseeing one of these skirmishes and match your tactical wits with the computer or another player.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w05.jpg'),(7724,'Pulseball','2020-10-03','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Merging sports with first-person shooters, Pulseball is a fast-paced, competitive multiplayer game. Now with better netcode than Halo Master Chief Collection!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mqj.jpg'),(7725,'World of Warships: Godzilla - Apex Monster','2021-05-11','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Amagi is a Japanese battleship that embodies the development of the Tosa-class battleship project. She is armed with ten 410 mm guns in twin turrets that can unleash a weighty salvo . The ship has a decent HP pool and good anti-torpedo protection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ann.jpg'),(7726,'Starion Tactics','2014-09-05','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Perfect for the novice, yet sophisticated enough for the veteran, Starion Tactics is a casual, turn-based 4X space strategy game that delivers a deeply tactical and highly visual experience with fun and quick gameplay.\n\nAfter assuming command of one of four human or alien factions vying for galactic dominance, immediately define your game’s scope. Play for minutes to hours across tens to hundreds of planets in single-player skirmish or multiplayer modes—it’s entirely up to you.\n\nLeave the tedious, everyday tasks that take away from crafting and executing tactical strategies to your faction as you explore the galaxy. Discover different planet types: some rich in resources, some barren and unfit for terraforming. Expand your empire by choosing which planets to invade, colonize, destroy or simply ignore. As you conquer planets, acquire resources to grow and strengthen your fleet, empowering you to overthrow enemy factions and rule the galaxy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/c7m9ovjos8pdvoihfnzw.jpg'),(7727,'Capture the planet: Cute War','2019-02-20','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the game you have to shoot a slingshot funny animals, in order to destroy the buildings that prevent them from living normally.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c9m.jpg'),(7728,'Epic Empire: Tower Defense',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r5z.jpg'),(7729,'Gun vs. Zombies','2024-01-12','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gun vs. Zombies is a thrilling showdown where precision meets undead mayhem. Take control of a dynamic gun affected by physics as you fend off waves of zombies hungry for a brain feast. Compete against others on the global leaderboard by showcasing your shooting skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sg9.jpg'),(7730,'Taisen Bomberman','2004-12-02','Arcade','Legacy Mobile Device','Taisen Bomberman is a mobile Bomberman game with online features. It is the first game in the Taisen ☆ Bomberman series.\n\nYears later, a game called Taisen! Bomberman was released, but they are unrelated.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u69.jpg'),(7731,'Stars Die','2020-01-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A giant cathedral of flesh has appeared in the middle of the ocean on a dying world. A small group of scientists are secretly investigating it when a mysterious woman appears, facing an impossible task.\n\nStars Die is a non-linear, sci-fi mystery game with branching dialogues.\n\nFEATURES\n\n- Completely non-linear story. Have long debates with people or ignore them the entire game.\n- Five parallel, but interconnected story lines, each with its own completely separate ending.\n- The player isn\'t at the center of the narrative. Each character has their own agenda and they will try to act accordingly in real time, with or without you.\n- You can take your time to explore the environments freely, but you might miss events and conversations if you take too long.\n- The choices aren\'t about moral dilemmas, but ideological ones. It\'s all about your personal perspective on the events and what you believe in.\n- Dark industrial soundtrack by composer Connor ORT Linning.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eaz.jpg'),(7732,'Abomination Tower','2015-02-13','Platform, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Abomination Tower is a humorously macabre, 2D procedurally generated platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cmd.jpg'),(7733,'Super Gracie World','2018-04-23','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Super Gracie World is intended for people who want a somewhat easier kaizo experience. Intended to be played without savestates.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9apg.jpg'),(7734,'Fadedlands',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7735,'Last Hit Titan','2025-04-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Strategically place turrets and build defenses to maximize your firepower against colossal Titans! Experiment with different setups, optimize your battlefield, and take down legendary creatures with the most efficient tactics. Every decision counts in this unique tower defense experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lml.jpg'),(7736,'Pro Pilkki 2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','The original ice fishing simulator published in 2013.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c04.jpg'),(7737,'Pinball FX2: Mars Table',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7738,'Bakugan: Defenders of the Core','2010-10-19','Adventure','PlayStation 3, Wii, PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360','The game follows a story arc from Bakugan Battle Brawlers: New Vestroia not followed in the Anime. When Bakugan Interspace has a malfunction, the player is sent to an alternate Earth. In this Earth, the Resistance lost to the Vexos. After that the Vexos took over Earth. The Resistance has been fighting the Vexos and they got hit with a beam used by the Vexos\' newest creation, the Vexos Crystal, which breaks the Resistance\'s Gauntlets and leaves them unable to brawl. Due to the player not being affected by the beams, he decides to help the Resistance defeat the Vexos and also tries to find a way home. This is also your game character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fbb.jpg'),(7739,'Lost Colony','2025-12-31','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Lost Colony\" is a Twin-Stick Shooter Action-Roguelike set on an abandoned space colony. Guided by your drone companion, you must explore the planet and defend yourself from the swarms of aliens and the corrupted colony security system. Will you uncover the secrets of the Lost Colony?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9738.jpg'),(7740,'My Summer Drive',NULL,'Racing, Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r5y.jpg'),(7741,'Flashlight','2021-10-25','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Salvage scrap, build defenses, and rank-up to survive against the hordes of zombies and enemy mercenaries in an action packed looter shooter roguelite survival or fight head to head with other players in Capture the Flag and Team Death Match.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kci.jpg'),(7742,'Angor',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7743,'Star Rush: Stack & Jump','2025-01-30','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Just stack boxes, jump, and collect stars! Easy, right?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bok.jpg'),(7744,'Anti Air','2020-08-01','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Oculus VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Anti Air: is a VR homage to the best of retro gaming.\n\nAs the Cubicon Conjunction begins, descent to various planets across the galaxy and blast away the Cubicon invaders.\nFor the Cubicons it is not just a matter of cubes, it is about life and death.\n\nUse a variety of advanced weaponry to battle these Alien invaders.\nResist waves of different Cubicon invaders which enter the planet’s troposphere from the outer space. Their goal is to eradicate everything on the planet, starting with you – the planet’s first line of defense and its last chance.\n\nSelect a planet to save and get your weapons ready.\nBring enough ammunition with you to the ground, as this might be the last chance to preserve that planet in the universe.\n\nProtect the various planets in the galaxy from the elusive and vicious attackers.\nThey will send their best warriors in different formations to outwit your every move.\n\nEnjoy this unique competitive Virtual Reality (VR) Arcade game.\n\nHow many space Cubicons will you take down?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2754.jpg'),(7745,'Shepherd\'s Crossing','2003-12-25','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','This game allows players to build a farm and hunt for treasures.\nEven though the game is not as much open as other farming games, players will be able to fight off other creatures in turn-based battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49vh.jpg'),(7746,'EA Family Bundle','2016-12-28','Sin género','Xbox One','Whether you want to enjoy the biggest, craziest battle in the universe with Plants vs. Zombies Garden Warfare 2, push your limits with Need for Speed, or embark on a seemingly larger than life journey with Unravel, there is a game for everyone in the EA Family bundle! \n \nBundle includes: \nNeed for Speed \nBecome the ultimate icon of today’s urban car culture in Need for Speed, featuring Five Ways to Play and a huge open world to race and explore from dusk ‘till dawn. \n \nPlants vs. Zombies Garden Warfare 2 \nThe battle for suburbia grows to crazy new heights in Plants vs. Zombies™ Garden Warfare 2! In this action-packed shooter, Dr. Zomboss has strengthened his horde and rebuilt suburbia as a zombie utopia. \n \nUnravel \nUnravel introduces Yarny, a new, lovable and endearing character made from a single thread of yarn. Embark with Yarny on a seemingly larger than life adventure to reconnect the long-lost memories of a family.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pwzetabdlcsrinhlijtv.jpg'),(7747,'Glitch','2018-07-26','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Don\'t you hate it when you are casually walking through the forest when you fall 60 feet into a mysterious world? Well... that\'s what goes down. And now you, must find a way up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9chh.jpg'),(7748,'American Motorcycle Simulator',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Have you ever had enough of everything? Did you want to drop everything and move on? What would you say about a great road trip across the States on the legendary Route 66? Only you, your faithful bike, beautiful landscapes and the magnificent roar of the engine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lfh.jpg'),(7749,'Bodycount','2011-09-01','Shooter','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Bodycount rips apart the first person shooter as genre-defining gunplay comes alive in a balletic orgy of bullets and destruction.Experience the intense thrill of close-quarters combat in a shreddable world as Bodycount blasts outrageous fire-fights and ferocious action from both barrels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49l3.jpg'),(7750,'ΔV: Rings of Saturn - Space Furry Edition','2019-08-12','Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50u4.jpg'),(7751,'A Koopa’s Revenge 2','2014-09-17','Platform','Web browser','A Koopa’s Revenge 2 is a Super Mario fan game set in a parallel universe where Bowser and company are the good guys, while Mario and his pals are pure evil. After defeating Mario and his cohorts in the first game, Koopa sets off to a distant land where a kidnapped Bowser is being held by a mysterious robed figure. Play as Koopa, Goomba, or Shy Guy on your quest to free Bowser and restore justice to the Koopa Kingdom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f9s.jpg'),(7752,'PUBG: Battlegrounds - Season 25','2023-08-09','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','A new challenging Season of Ranked – Season 25 has arrived with this update.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7753,'Might and Magic VI: The Mandate of Heaven','1998-04-30','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Ironfist Dynasty is tottering on the brink of ruin. As endless calamities plague the kingdom of Enroth, evil doomsday cultists plan to overthrow child Prince Nicolai and claim the throne for their charismatic leader. Fear grips the land and the people wonder if their sovereign has lost the Mandate of Heaven - the divine right to rule. The enemies of reason are at the gate and only extraordinary heroes can stem the tide of darkness. Will you answer the call?\n\nFrom the depths of the deepest dungeons, to the intrigues of the royal court, you will lead a band of adventurers on a dangerous journey of amazing depth and intelligence. With a completely new 3D graphics engine and a non-linear adventure system, Might and Magic VI: The Mandate of Heaven brings a unique role-playing experience to life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3czc.jpg'),(7754,'Bik - A Space Adventure','2014-09-02','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Bik is a retro-style point and click adventure game.  \n \nIn Bik, we follow a young boy who is abducted by aliens while on a camping trip with his friends. After joining forces with two friendly alien mercenaries, Ammut and Tatenen, Bik escapes from his abductors and tries to find his way home. Along the way, Bik and his newfound friends outsmart hijackers, (eat some brownies), accept a perilous mission to find a missing alien, (make some sandwiches), foil a dastardly plot by an evil corporate empire, (argue with disgruntled robots), and save a planet on the brink of destruction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/a4xgyzoilysumwfngu3x.jpg'),(7755,'Zion Survivors','2024-06-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Customize your ship. Defeat or escape from chase enemies. Destroy city walls. Drive your ship to machine city. Begin to believe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co596v.jpg'),(7756,'Football Stars: Head Ball Soccer Co-op Battle','2024-12-19','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Team up with friends for epic co-op battles.\nJump, kick, and unleash special moves.\nScore big and become the ultimate champion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ajq.jpg'),(7757,'XIII Century: Gold Edition','2009-08-28','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','XIII Century Gold Edition combines the highly successful strategy game XIII Century: Death or Glory with the follow-up sequel, XIII Century: Blood of Europe.XIII Century: Death or Glory is an RTS game which immerses players in the Middle Ages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l98.jpg'),(7758,'Super Yum Yum 3',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7759,'Cyclotronica',NULL,'Racing','Sin plataforma','Race through high energy reactors and particle accelerators as the infinitesimal \"Mr. Big\", riding an ultra-high tech monowheel cycle, collecting particles, conducting experiments, dodging and doing battle with antimatter and radioactive isotopes, solving puzzles, and discovering the Periodic Table.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nzk.jpg'),(7760,'Bug Riders: The Race of Kings','2011-12-31','Fighting, Racing','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','The King of Entymion, Leptus, is about to die. Rather than hold elections or keep the tradition of primogeniture, the next king will be chosen with a race. Not just any race, but a race in which the participants ride on giant bugs. Choose from 22 different contestants, each with unique racing styles and weapon, and try to be the first to the finish line on six tracks. If finishing first is a little too tough, make your bug go faster by using your riding crop. But be careful, or your bug will quit running for you. For those looking for a less-than-honest way to win, collect power-ups and weapons scattered throughout the track to blow past your opponents or blast them out of the sky. And don\'t forget to keep your eyes open for the shortcuts in each track. Do you have the nerve and the skill to win the Great Race? Play BUG RIDERS: The Race of Kings and find out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ur8.jpg'),(7761,'R.I.P.D.: The Game','2013-07-17','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Based on the 3D supernatural action-adventure film, R.I.P.D., you and a partner will take up the holsters of two lawmen dispatched to the otherworld to protect and serve the living from an increasingly destructive array of souls who refuse to move peacefully to the other side. Top-notch teamwork and an arsenal of badass weapons are the keys to defeating your enemies and bringing order back to the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dlrxutjefsnk0grrapfg.jpg'),(7762,'Alaloth: Champions of The Four Kingdoms - Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9592.jpg'),(7763,'Ys Strategy','2006-03-23','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo DS','Ys Strategy is a real-time strategy game developed by Future Creates exclusive to the Nintendo DS. It was published by Marvelous Interactive (now absorbed into its parent company, Marvelous Entertainment) in Japan and Rising Star Games in Europe. Its status in canon is unknown, as Falcom hasn\'t stated anything about it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4pmm.jpg'),(7764,'Wylde Flowers','2022-02-18','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Join Tara on a heartfelt journey to become a witch in Wylde Flowers. Farm by day, and cast spells by night as you craft your cottagecore life and bond with your coven. Come to know and love the fully voice acted characters of Fairhaven, as you unravel a local mystery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lvg.jpg'),(7765,'NTR homestay','2017-04-21','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hkw.jpg'),(7766,'Strike Commander','1993-05-01','Simulator','PC-9800 Series, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS, FM Towns','After the success of the Wing Commander games, Chris Roberts and Origin turned their eye to developing a story-focused combat flight simulation. The result was Strike Commander.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wvi.jpg'),(7767,'The Terrible Persistence of Memory','2021-06-15','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When you wake from a deep sleep, the first thing the goblin doctor asks is \"What\'s your name?\" The problem is: you don\'t know. Retrace your steps. Find what you\'ve lost. Piece together who you are from the strange and incredible things you can do','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46cg.jpg'),(7768,'Sky Falling Giant','2018-06-26','Arcade','Android','Sky Falling Giant is an adventure Android game. Full of beautiful sight of clouds, Magical beanstalk and sky. In this fun game, sky Falling Giant is falling down of the Magical Tree\'s Bean Stalk. He faces dark clouds which are poisonous and make him die in no time. He collects Gold Coins and life on his escape Fall.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yiq9zg9t2cvn9rojqmfa.jpg'),(7769,'Flesh Psychosis','2025-03-28','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Flesh Psychosis is a little casual puzzle game, in which you have to score as much as possible. You have to collect various spooky ingredients and make deathly meals, using gravity and mad scientist tools.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g7o.jpg'),(7770,'12 Labours of Hercules V: Kids of Hellas - Collector\'s Edition','2016-05-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mx2.jpg'),(7771,'Baldr Sky \"Zero\"','2013-09-27','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Baldr Sky \"Zero\" is a cyberpunk action game. It is the first of two prequels to Baldr Sky.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48sp.jpg'),(7772,'Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets','2003-06-30','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets is the sequel to Harry Potter and the Sorcerer\'s Stone for PC and Mac. As its prequel, five different versions of this game were released for different gaming platforms. In this version, you control Harry in an action-adventure platforming gameplay. The most significant difference from the previous game is that gameplay is less linear, with Hogwarts becoming more of an open world. You can Interact with familiar characters from the movie like Ron, Hermione and of course Gilderoy Lockhart. Additionally, there are multiple mini-games and side quests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20dl.jpg'),(7773,'Beyond Memories: Darkness of the Soul',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Don the cloak of a Grim Reaper and free tormented souls in a non-violent, spooky adventure with 11 haunting tales.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ako.jpg'),(7774,'Garfield',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7775,'Platform 4','2024-12-26','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The sequel to the acclaimed anomaly-finding games \"Nibansen\" and \"Sanbansen\" has finally arrived! Find the pattern and escape if an anomaly occurs in the mysterious homage-inspired escape game \"Platform 4,\" where you journey from a repeating station to the airport.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96ky.jpg'),(7776,'My Universe: Puppies and Kittens','2021-10-28','Simulator','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Whether you’re a dog or a cat person, your new companions are waiting for you to take them home and give them endless love. Help them grow daily with good care and proper training so they will become well behaved pets. Do not forget to give them lots of cuddles and play with them often. Each animal is unique and has its own personality and preferences so pay attention to your animal needs and they will give it back to you by becoming the most loyal of friends. You can even teach your pet tricks and train them to enter competitions and unlock rewards & new accessories. Participate also in various activities like exploring your neighborhood to find treasures, visiting the meadow and the dog park or go to the shop to acquire new items. Engage with other pets whist walking your companion so they can make four-legged friends to play with and get advice from other owners on how to raise your puppy well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zdt.jpg'),(7777,'Cake Yasan Monogatari Oishii Sweet wo Tsukurou!','2017-11-09','Simulator','Nintendo 3DS','Play as a novice patisserie and work at a cake shop in a town, gaining experience while learning various sweets recipes from the store manager, and grows into a full-fledged patisserie.\n\nThe game contains 50 recipes for sweets that you can make. In addition, you can enjoy dress-up and interior coordination.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fwu.jpg'),(7778,'A Matter of Time','2020-10-16','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wield blazing light-blades, harness the extreme power of the ‘Paradox Cape’ and plot an exciting course for an epic adventure to save the universe!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45rc.jpg'),(7779,'Red Dust','2020-10-11','Shooter, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Red Dust: Hardcore FPS in a randomly generated world. Move carefully, shoot accurately, and avoid being shot. Mistakes have consequences. Intense, fast-paced action inspired by Receiver. Play Red Dust for a thrilling FPS experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ycy.jpg'),(7780,'Helicopter Simulator VR 2021: Rescue Missions','2021-04-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Learn, hone and master all the instruments and controls of a real helicopter! Follow the tutorials to turn the aircraft on and off, learn to use ropes and flares and apply your knowledge in missions based on real situations!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co429l.jpg'),(7781,'Hoarding Simulator 2.0','2025-01-25','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Sleep, train, ride a bike—almost anything is possible in this game. All you need to do is collect!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bow.jpg'),(7782,'12 Labours of Hercules VIII: How I Met Megara - Collector\'s Edition','2018-12-07','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mx7.jpg'),(7783,'The Haunting of Ptolemy','2025-04-22','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Haunting of Ptolemy is a first-person shooter game. The game features a variety of weapons, which will be needed for protection against some of the indigenous life forms. Collect the spore samples, transport them back, outmaneuver the obstacles and traps, and above all, Stay Alive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pzb.jpg'),(7784,'Puzzle Journey','2024-01-28','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Puzzle Journey\" is the kind of game that captivates you for hours on end. It\'s perfect for players looking to unwind alone or those wanting to spend quality time with family and friends. Are you ready to take on the challenge? Come and experience \"Puzzle Journey\" today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sfh.jpg'),(7785,'Shobatsu',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Shobatsu is a fast paced arcade style beat\'em up which will let you take the role of four highly skilled ninjas who must fight against hordes of powerful and varied enemies. Face the challenge yourself in the single player modes or invite a friend for extra fun in the local co-op mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kz2.jpg'),(7786,'TUBWT','2019-05-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to TUBWT, the place where all your memories will be resurrected, the place where every corner is your mind, the place where everything you see is yourself. Can you get out of the long-forgotten fragments of memory? Can you accept reality again? And if there is any way out?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7787,'Fatal Dopamine',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Play as a nameless gambler who arrives at a mysterious gambling table, constantly challenging different opponents. At this table, the stakes are not money but life itself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kuj.jpg'),(7788,'Metal Toy Excavator',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7789,'Depixtion','2020-02-28','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Depixtion, a relaxing puzzle game where you create beautiful works of art using logic. Based on the popular Picross series, Depixtion blends color mixing mechanics with the rules of nonograms to create a uniquely colorful experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vsp.jpg'),(7790,'King of Kalimpong',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','You\'re a fast-moving minivan with a projectile weapon in this Online Multiplayer PvP Battle Arena. Shoot rocks at your friends and capture their flag. Boost, jump, dodge, and flip to survive. Block projectiles with well-timed kicks, and smash other vehicles to bits when they get in your way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ik8.jpg'),(7791,'The Adventures in Carnal Hell','2024-01-01','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Game Boy Color','A slightly naughty GBC-style roguelike RPG!\n\nLet\'s go through the tower, which has up to 15 floors, defeating enemies as you go.\nEvery step you take Every time you advance, enemies in the same room will also move and attack you.\nAt times, enemies that send acid or fireballs flying or traps may block your way.\nYou must decide how to act and win the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7y7p.jpg'),(7792,'Redswood VR','2016-08-18','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Redswood VR is a virtual retelling of the Red Riding Hood story. In this tale, you play as both Red and then the Huntsman, each separately tasked with making their way through a dying and unrecognizable forest from their pasts to the inevitable conclusion at Granny\'s house.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yr7.jpg'),(7793,'Great Again: 3D Shooter','2025-01-23','Shooter','Nintendo Switch','Fight the Zombies, Clear the Chaos, Become the Hero!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d0c.jpg'),(7794,'High School Love: A Visual Novel Romance','2024-12-23','Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Meet Lana in this visual novel, a shy and dreamy girl who meets Leo in the school library, a boy passionate about music, who is looking for a quiet place to play his guitar.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aja.jpg'),(7795,'Tom Clancy\'s Splinter Cell: Essentials','2006-04-06','Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation Portable','Tom Clancy\'s Splinter Cell: Essentials is an action-adventure video game with heavy emphasis on stealth. It is part of the Splinter Cell series and was released for the PlayStation Portable handheld system. It was developed by Ubisoft Montreal and published by Ubisoft on March 21, 2006 in North America. It is the fourth entry in the series and was powered by Unreal Engine 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co205a.jpg'),(7796,'Fallen Rebellion',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Run and jump through the land of an ancient civilization in a challenging platformer in which your goal is to reach the end without any saves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zjh.jpg'),(7797,'Claw Breaker','2018-08-23','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Claw Breaker is a head to head crab fighting game! Cut off your opponent\'s claws to win or be a peaceful crustacean and collect all the starfish for a defensive victory. Foam at the mouth to taunt your enemy! Battle on six different stages and hone your crab fighting style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n8c.jpg'),(7798,'Virtual Pro Wrestling 2: Oudou Keishou','2000-01-28','Fighting, Sport','Nintendo 64','The sequel to Virtual Pro Wrestling 64, and released only in Japan. The title translates to Royal Road Succession; the name of the career mode in the game. The fifth wrestling game developed by AKI Corporation. Contained many improvements from previous titles that would be featured in AKI\'s final Nintendo 64 wrestling game WWF No Mercy. Some features, such as creating masks in edit mode and the MMA style grappling system, would not be carried over to WWF No Mercy.\n\nVirtual Pro Wrestling 2 carries the All Japan Pro Wrestling license, and features 21 wrestlers from their promotion. The rest of the characters included in the game are based on other real promotions and wrestlers, but due to copyright have fake names and appearances. This is common among other Japanese wrestling games. You can identify who the other wrestler\'s are by their unique moves and taunts, and the edit mode contains each piece of ring attire you would need to recreate their actual likeness.\n\nIn total, there are 98 wrestlers in the game, 23 of which have to be unlocked. There is also 16 original character slots you can use to edit and create your own wrestlers, bringing the potential total of wrestlers in the game to 114. This game has the largest roster of all of AKI\'s wrestling games. In comparison, WWF No Mercy would have 64 wrestlers available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tucrem7ud9pqmtee2wd9.jpg'),(7799,'Five Nights with Mac Tonight: Halloween Special','2018-10-31','Point-and-click','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Five Nights with Mac Tonight: Halloween Special is a Halloween-themed version of the FNwMT series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ekv.jpg'),(7800,'Redemption\'s Guild','2022-11-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Redemption\'s Guild is a VR Multiplayer Online Role Playing Game (MORPG) with an emphasis on combat, character progression and customization. Redemption\'s Guild allows up to four players to adventure together. Whether you are a knight on the front line, a cleric healing the party, or any of the other robust classes, gather your best dungeon party and join the adventure together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yd1.jpg'),(7801,'5 Star Hawaii Resort','2018-03-09','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxh.jpg'),(7802,'Dragon Ball: Xenoverse 2 - Super Pass','2016-10-25','Adventure','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Extend your experience in the unique universe of DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE 2 with the Super Pass! The Super Pass gives you access to 4 DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE 2 content packs, including:\n\n- 9 additional playable characters: Cabba, Frost, Champa, Vados, Goku Black Rose, Zamasu, Bojack, Fused Zamasu, and SSGSS Vegito\n- Episodes and Quests\n- Masters and Masters Quests\n- Stages\n- Skills, Costumes and Accessories\n\nSUPER PASS BONUS:\nIncludes early access to the character Future Trunks from DRAGON BALL SUPER!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1kv5.jpg'),(7803,'Eutergeläuter','2020-07-24','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The bull Hans is bored alone on his pasture. He is quite happy that so many cows are waiting to be made happy by him on the neighbouring pasture. He jumps over the fences and begins to make all the cows happy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qep.jpg'),(7804,'Cossacks Anthology','2003-11-20','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An anthology of the Cossacks game series, which includes:\n\nCossacks: European Wars\nCossacks: The Art of War\nCossacks: Back to War','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hlf.jpg'),(7805,'The Chatters Show','2021-06-11','Quiz/Trivia','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Chatters Show is designed for Twitch streamers and their chats. Create questions sets and play with your chat to see who is the smartest person.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31xw.jpg'),(7806,'Paver Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Did you ever dream to become a paving artist? Perform tasks, during which the most important thing is creativity and precision. According to your design you lay different types of paving stones, so you earn money and raise the level of your reputation. Test your skills in the Paver Simulator','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71of.jpg'),(7807,'Treehouse Riddle','2018-08-10','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','\"Treehouse Riddle\" is an adventure game where you unfold its story by solving riddles and puzzles. Just like the treehouse itself, the 30+ riddles and puzzles are made of wood.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j10.jpg'),(7808,'Shark Assault Simulator','2022-06-10','Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','I don\'t think you\'d want to rest on that beach. Shark Assault Simulator is a game that shows us how dangerous it is to sunbathe on an unknown beach.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5l3b.jpg'),(7809,'5 Star Miami Resort','2019-06-25','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxi.jpg'),(7810,'12 Labours of Hercules IV: Mother Nature - Collector\'s Edition','2016-04-21','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mx0.jpg'),(7811,'Free Icecream','2009-10-16','Sin género','Web browser','You, a little girl, end up in a creepy cellar after being promised free \"icecrem\".\nEscape from the house without being caught by the insane cook!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9caw.jpg'),(7812,'The Bakery Tales','2025-01-24','Simulator, Strategy, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Where every recipe tells a story, and every loaf builds a legacy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ai7.jpg'),(7813,'MetroLand','2024-10-17','Platform, Racing, Sport, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','MetroLand is a new endless runner that takes what you know and love about the classic endless runner and turns it up to 11!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xuw.jpg'),(7814,'3D Mahjong Deluxe','2012-04-11','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxc.jpg'),(7815,'BlueSuburbia','2023-12-29','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BlueSuburbia is a haunted world where you explore poems through immersive environments. Seek out dark secrets, confront your demons, and delve deeper into a dream that dances between beautiful and terrible. Explore forgotten dreamscapes and open worlds on your quest to find hope.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r7j.jpg'),(7816,'BlackJack: Daily 21 Points',NULL,'Arcade, Card & Board Game','Sin plataforma','Black Jack - Daily 21 points, supports Insurance, \"Straight Flush\" and \"Five Dragon\" inside.\n\nBlackjack, also known as twenty-one, is the most widely played casino banking game in the world.[1] Blackjack is a comparing card game between a player and dealer and played with one or more decks of 52 cards.\n\nThe player or players are dealt an initial two card hand and add the total of their cards. Face cards (Kings, Queens, and Jacks) are counted as ten points. The player and dealer can count their own Ace as 1-point or 11 points. All other cards are counted as the numeric value shown on the card. After receiving their initial two cards, players have the option of getting a \"hit\" (taking additional cards) to bring their total value of cards to 21 points, or as close as possible without exceeding 21 (called \"busting\"). If a player holds an ace valued as 11, the hand is called \"soft\", meaning that the player cannot go bust by taking an additional card; otherwise, the hand is \"hard\".\n\nThe dealer has to take hits until his cards total 17 or more points. (In some casinos, the dealer also hits on a \"soft\" 17, e.g. initial ace and six.) Players who do not bust and have a total higher than the dealer, win. The dealer will lose if he or she busts, or has a lesser hand than the player who has not busted. If the player and dealer have the same point total, this is called a \"push\" and the player typically doesn\'t win or lose money on that hand.\n\nMany rule variations of blackjack exist. Since the 1960\'s, blackjack has been a high profile target of advantage players, particularly card counters, who track the profile of cards that have been dealt and adapt their wager and playing strategies accordingly.\n\nOther casino games inspired by blackjack include Spanish 21 and pontoon. The recreational British card game of black jack is a shedding-type game and unrelated to the subject of this article.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cgbdtxepu52aedxovdnn.jpg'),(7817,'Mesozoica','2018-01-02','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A prehistoric themed park tycoon simulation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ytcgv9wudyg68pjlccox.jpg'),(7818,'MotorStorm: Pacific Rift','2008-10-31','Racing','PlayStation 3','The first MotorStorm wowed fans with its heady formula of brutal, unpredictable off-road racing, festival vibes and stunning Monument Valley desert scenery. Now Motorstorm Pacific Rift takes you to a solitary tropical paradise in the Pacific Ocean, ready for a whole new take on no-holds-barred racing action through thick swamps, dense jungle, towering peaks and steaming volcanoes.\n\nNot just pretty backdrops to the action, these environments take center stage in challenging players with everything in Mother Nature\'s arsenal. Thick mud, tangled undergrowth, swift flowing rivers, choking volcanic clouds and searing lava pools all test the drivers to their limits and beyond.\n\nExpect a rich festival of off road racing, along with a host of game modes and rewards. It\'s brutal, dangerous, relentless, and unpredictable and more than a game - MotorStorm Pacific Rift is a way of life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26t6.jpg'),(7819,'Kimagure Temptation','2019-09-27','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mysterious murders. A cursed apartment building. Cohabitating with a cute demon girl?! All in a day\'s work for diviner, Haruhisa but will he be able to solve the case and not be distracted by a demon girl only interested in him?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7htd.jpg'),(7820,'Yeolleb Warrior','2022-01-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yeolleb Warrior is a action-adventure game with a cartoon animation style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59k3.jpg'),(7821,'Moth','2025-04-14','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Moth is a single-player , first person, psychological horror game. A murder has happened and you have to investigate the undeground parking hall for clues. What is the real crime?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7822,'Herogest',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bp3pge1uvmyxsrbopijk.jpg'),(7823,'PlayStation All-Stars Battle Royale: Graveyard','2013-03-19','Fighting, Platform','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita','The stage starts in the graveyard from MediEvil. Caskets constantly rise from the background and produce zombies. If the the casket is blown up by the statue before the zombies are released, then the casket will drop AP. When the White Swan appears, the background will fade to white as in The Unfinished Swan. Ink blots will then splatter onto the background to create platforms when the whiteout ends. The statue of the King and the city from The Unfinished Swan will appear in the background when the first whiteout ends.\n\nA Gargoyle statue from MediEvil: Resurrection appears near the foreground and will taunt and wisecrack at the players, producing a unique line of dialogue for some characters in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nio.jpg'),(7824,'Noddy and the Magic Book','2006-10-13','Adventure','PlayStation 2','Travel to a magical world of live toys and nonviolence. With Noddy and the Magic Book, you can improve your hand-eye coordination and reinforce your social values.\n\nJoin Noddy as he travels around Toyland in an attempt to right the wrongs caused by Sly and Gobbo whilst trying to catch the two troublemakers as quickly as possible - so they don\'t cause anymore mischief!\n\nNoddy and the Magic Book is a game full of adventure offering non-violent game-play that teaches life lessons and imparts social values with humour.\n\nThe game exercises the player\'s hand-to-eye co-ordination all while helping others and having lots of fun in the process!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gqlezozerhidwzajvqz8.jpg'),(7825,'The Little Mermaid: Princess of the Underwater Kingdoms','2024-02-29','Music, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Ariel returns in a new story, embarking on a heroic mission to safeguard Triton\'s kingdom, facing unprecedented challenges in a plot full of intrigue and courage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ucx.jpg'),(7826,'12 Labours of Hercules VII: Fleecing the Fleece - Collector\'s Edition','2017-06-08','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mx5.jpg'),(7827,'12 Labours of Hercules X: Greed for Speed - Collector\'s Edition','2020-04-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxa.jpg'),(7828,'Phobos Dere.GB','2022-03-05','Platform, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Game Boy','After uncovering a GameBoy cartridge haunted by a malignant force, a guilt-ridden scientist involved in sinister experiments must face his fears and relive the terrifying nightmares of his past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wwa.jpg'),(7829,'As I Began to Dream',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','As I Began to Dream is an enchanting puzzle-platformer that merges a unique environment manipulation mechanic. Utilize this power to navigate dream worlds, solve puzzles, and aid Lily\'s escape from her dream realm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76tv.jpg'),(7830,'Endless Combat','2017-11-12','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Endless Combat, is a team based game which is about fighting as characters with unique skills, the game also contains free for all mode','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b1t.jpg'),(7831,'Thrillville: Off the Rails','2007-10-09','Racing, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo DS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91tj.jpg'),(7832,'12 Labours of Hercules XIII: Wonder-ful Builder - Collector\'s Edition','2022-01-10','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxk.jpg'),(7833,'Backrooms: Inside the Escape','2025-01-16','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Venture through a labyrinth of seemingly endless, creepily familiar corridors based on popular Creepypasta lore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9apv.jpg'),(7834,'The Simpsons Game','2007-11-09','Platform','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','The Simpsons Game is based on the animated television series The Simpsons. It features an original storyline written by Tim Long, Matt Selman, and Matt Warburton. In the self-referential plot, the family discovers that they are forced to participate in another The Simpsons video game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ma9.jpg'),(7835,'Mountain\'s Memory','2025-04-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mountain\'s Memory is a walking simulator horror game where players explore a mountain at night, armed only with a lamp. Inspired by the chilling style of Japanese horror, this game delivers an atmosphere of fear and mystery. Feel the terror unfold in the quiet, desolate mountain.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7836,'Project Terra','2024-03-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a strange and hostile world, Raka, an exploration robot, finds themselves alone and separated from their friends. Help them reunite with their companions and unravel the mysteries hidden within this new world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79ap.jpg'),(7837,'August Walk','2023-05-18','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game has three story branches: normal, realistic, and mystical walk. In the normal branch you can just walk around the summer city, the forest and the spring.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d04.jpg'),(7838,'Vainly','2024-06-21','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vainly is a minimalist and story-driven platformer that subverts some of the common expectations from games by blending gameplay with the philosophy of Absurdism.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8589.jpg'),(7839,'Chronicles of Arcadia','2014-09-01','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chronicles of Arcadia is a free-to-play fantasy MMORPG where your journey is shaped by the choices you make. Dive into a vast world of magic and mystery, conquer challenging dungeons, and fight alongside others in epic battles. With a flexible dual class system, constant updates, and a passionate community, it’s a game built for adventurers seeking both nostalgia and fresh discoveries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ks2.jpg'),(7840,'Tokimeki Restaurant: Project TriStars','2018-02-22','Simulator, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','Tokimeki Restaurant☆☆☆ Project TRISTARS is one of the Tokimeki Restaurant☆☆☆ projects that commemorates the social game\'s fifth anniversary. It was first announced to the public at the virtual reality event, 3 Majesty×X.I.P. LIVE -SPLASH SUMMER FES 2017-.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5i68.jpg'),(7841,'Towelket: One More Time 4','2010-05-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Towelket: One More Time 4 - Ocean is a freeware story-heavy adventure/RPG made in RPG Maker 2000.\n\nTowelket 4 is somewhat of an ironic Peter Pan + Little Mermaid while also being full of references to the previous games. For the first time in the series you have an overworld resembling older RPGs like Dragon Quest. It also has the biggest number of party members to choose from.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zxl.jpg'),(7842,'Indigo Satellite','2025-01-31','Fighting, Platform, Indie','Web browser','A combat-based platformer where you play as Zero, a powerful fighter robot capable of obliterating obstacles in his path. Armed with only their two fists, they have to navigate through the ruins of a laboratory filled with deadly enemies, and deadlier bosses.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7843,'SimCoaster','2001-01-29','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SimCoaster is the third and final game in the Theme Park series. It uses the same graphic engine as the previous game Theme Park World. It is a theme park management game where players build their own theme park and attract as much visitors as possible. This time there are also grandparents of the little visitors who need to be entertained.\n\nThis version focuses more on the management side of running a park. It contains various types of business related to campaigns and objectives, such as bringing in a certain number of guests to a ride. By completing these challenges, promotions can be gained. As with the previous game in the series, players can walk around in their park in a first-person mode and go on the rides.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6t3m.jpg'),(7844,'Hinami Bay','2023-04-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hinami Bay is a casual, mini open-world hentai game. Talk to girls on a private island and train yourself to become smarter and stronger, so have a better chance with the ladies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bt7.jpg'),(7845,'Garden Simulator','2022-09-08','Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Plant, design, harvest. With Garden Simulator you\'ll get your own allotment, place deco elements and cultivate plants to harvest and sell them. Get ready for a beautiful time in nature. Always remember: A garden is a delight to the eye and a solace for the soul.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56v9.jpg'),(7846,'Burn',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7847,'Assignment Due: Project Blue','2023-06-30','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Made for Otome Jam 2023.\n\nA week-long online project being partnered with the quiet boy in your class that spirals into something different. Career dreams and the color blue, you wouldn’t have guessed an online class you were forced to take for your second year of college would lead you right to anything. Let alone to someone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6t37.jpg'),(7848,'Devil May Cry 4','2008-01-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Devil May Cry 4 is the second sequel to the original Devil May Cry game. It immerses the player in a gothic supernatural world, where a new protagonist clashes with a familiar hero. As the new leading man, Nero, players will unleash incredible attacks and non-stop combos using a unique new gameplay mechanic, his powerful \"Devil Bringer\" arm. With the advanced graphical capabilities of the PC, high definition visuals and intricate detail come to life as players explore new and exotic locales. Dynamic action and undeniable style combine with explosive fighting options and a gripping story to produce the incomparable experience that only a Devil May Cry game can deliver.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1u6n.jpg'),(7849,'Melly the Naughty Dog','2024-07-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Melly the Naughty Dog is a short, funny point-and-click puzzle game with hand-drawn and digital art. Play as Melly, navigating his dream world, solving puzzles, and meeting characters like the fairy dog and the knight to reclaim his jug and return home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92y0.jpg'),(7850,'Car Heist Simulator: Thief Mechanic','2025-01-25','Puzzle, Racing, Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','The city’s most prized cars, waiting for the perfect thief.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9akl.jpg'),(7851,'Cathode Ray Sunshine','2018-03-01','Puzzle, Adventure','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This is a short horror game that I developed for Fantasy Console Game Jam #3 using the Pico-8 fantasy console. This game is not suited for children or those who are easily disturbed.\n\nThe objective of this game is to move around a desolated town and touch certain magic pillars. When you touch the pillars (it\'s a little finicky, so try to move around them a bit), a streetlight will come on near a lighthouse to signify your progress. You must light all six streetlights, at which point the lighthouse will light up. Touch the light of the lighthouse to complete the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vbx.jpg'),(7852,'Kori Walk',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7853,'Dance with Devils','2022-12-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','Multimedia otome project collaboration between Rejet, Elements Garden, and Avex.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zrt.jpg'),(7854,'Factory & Roof Collection',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Sport','Sin plataforma','Under or on the roof, check both driving venues!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ajl.jpg'),(7855,'Wallace & Gromit\'s Grand Adventures: Episode 3 - Muzzled!','2009-06-15','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Wallace & Gromit in Muzzled! is the third and second-to-last episode of Wallace & Gromit\'s Grand Adventures.\n\nThe local dog shelter got hit by a storm and was destroyed. Now stray dogs terrorize the town and even damaged Wallace\'s new invention: the Inviniflavour. It\'s a ice-cream maker that can scan any item and use it\'s flavor to create a completely new kind of ice-cream. The reason he build such a vehicle is the upcoming Fundraise-A-Fair hosted by Monty Muzzle who wants to help the town raise enough money to rebuild the dog shelter. A noble cause Wallace of course wants to support. But does Mr. Muzzle really just want to help the town or are there more sinister motives behind his actions?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co507f.jpg'),(7856,'Greybit','2025-01-12','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Greybit is a heart-pounding, adrenaline-fueled first-person shooter (FPS) game paying homage to the iconic 1993 \"Doom\" while adding a fresh twist. Play as a lone warrior battling hordes of demons in a nightmarish landscape where every corner hides a new threat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kuk.jpg'),(7857,'Super Killer Hornet: Resurrection','2014-02-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super Killer Hornet Resurrection is an intense vertical shooter with a brain train twist. Through the chaos and explosion try to answer the falling math problems to increase your multiplier and power up your ship.\n\nFeaturing a superb sound track by UK rock hip hop maestros the Sixty fours as well as classic tracks from Dylan Barry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97t2.jpg'),(7858,'Umineko no Naku Koro ni: Game Master Battler!','2021-01-28','Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','An extra arc originally included in Umineko no Naku Koro ni Tsubasa, where after finding the truth and becoming Game Master, Battler tries to write a scenario for the next episode. As Game Master, Battler can do anything, and many people are more than willing to secure a role.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7922.jpg'),(7859,'Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban','2004-06-02','Sin género','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','This version of the game has a similar approach to the previous entry, with Hogwarts being an open world that you can explore at your leisure in between completing the levels necessary to advance the story. The big change this time is that Ron and Hermione have been promoted to playable, allowing you to play as all three members of the trio. They each have different abilities, and, depending on the platform, you either can or can\'t decide when to switch characters. Another difference is that Quidditch is no longer playable, with flights on Buckbeak replacing it for the requisite flying mechanic. Perhaps due to the source material being more emotional and less action-oriented, ​The Stations of the Canon are mostly just skimmed over.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rbs.jpg'),(7860,'Warhammer Age of Sigmar: Realms of Ruin - Ultimate Edition','2023-11-14','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Wage a campaign of brutal conquest in this realm-shattering real-time strategy game set in the Warhammer Age of Sigmar universe. Command four unique factions in dynamic battles as part of a story-driven campaign and test your mettle in online multiplayer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6z0b.jpg'),(7861,'The King of Fighters Bundle',NULL,'Fighting, Arcade','Sin plataforma','The King of Fighters Bundle comes with 6 games plus Upgrade pack 1 and 2 for The King of Fighters XIV: Galaxy Edition!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77mi.jpg'),(7862,'Midnight Heist','2023-10-25','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Go on heists through Midnight City alone or with up to three friends to fulfill tasks as a hacker for various organizations. Improve your reputation, earn money, customize your character and uncover the secrets of shady companies in this co-op horror game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nq1.jpg'),(7863,'Carrot Commotion',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Planning a games night? Here comes a highly explosive game show for up to eight players! Choose your favourite character, keep the contents of your box a secret while deducing the contents of the other boxes! Use social deduction and strategy over four fast paced rounds to win the Carrot Cup!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kui.jpg'),(7864,'Bloons 2 Christmas Expansion','2010-12-23','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ninja Kiwi brings you a special exclusive pack of Christmas themed Bloons 2 levels. Have a happy and safe Christmas!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co979l.jpg'),(7865,'Meiro Master','2024-07-24','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Now is your time to become the ultimate Meiro Master. Earn your way in to the history books and fulfill your childhood dreams of becoming the unrivalled Meiro Master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ouu.jpg'),(7866,'Rabi X Laby: Rabbit X Labyrinth Puzzle Out Stories','2017-07-20','Platform, Puzzle','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','A compilation of the following games; Rabi Laby, Rabi Laby 2, Rabi Laby 3 and Witch\'s Cat.\n\nReleased for PS Vita first, followed by the PS4 and Nintendo Switch versions, this is the first appearance of these games on consoles. The graphics have been tweaked from their previous releases and they now have a higher resolution. An Easy Mode has also been added which simplifies the control scheme making the game more accessible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57c5.jpg'),(7867,'Disney\'s Bonkers','1994-12-31','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','The game is based on the Disney TV show of the same name. Bonkers is a bob-cat police officer who lives in \"toondom\", a cartoony land where people co-exist with various creatures from cartoon movies.\n\nOne day, Bonkers and his partner Lucky hear about a shocking robbery: Hollywood\'s most valuable treasures - Sorcerer\'s Hat, Mermaid\'s Voice, and Magic Lamp - were stolen! Now it is up to Bonkers to capture the thieves and to take back the stolen treasures.\n\nThis is an action platform game. Bonkers can jump and dash, throwing enemies aside and even destroying some obstacles. Enemies can be killed by jumping on their heads. You can also collect various items such as bombs to throw at the enemies, cakes to refill your health, or hyper juice to make you dash continuously.\n\nBesides the common license, this game is totally different from the Genesis game Bonkers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49wc.jpg'),(7868,'Escape from Nightmare: Horror Tales','2025-01-23','Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','A dark and terrifying horror full of secrets and mysteries will make you feel the whole atmosphere of escaping from an abandoned labyrinth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aqg.jpg'),(7869,'Space Bear','2020-03-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Space Bear is a multi-choice text adventure typing game! Sort of. I mean, there isn\'t many actual choices, and the typing is more \"mashing\"...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20hw.jpg'),(7870,'Ban: The Prologue of Gucha Gucha','2024-10-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','【A richly coloured horror and mystery tale】\"BAN: The Prologue of GUCHA GUCHA” is a third-person horror adventure game. Experience the messy horror from the perspective of the protagonist, who is caught up in the whirlwind of events in a certain town in Japan, Utagacho.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89ht.jpg'),(7871,'Monster Energy Supercross 25: Special Edition','2025-04-07','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Be the first out of the gate! Pre-order the Monster Energy Supercross 25 - Special Edition and get 3 days of early access in addition to the Full Game, Season Pass and the two DLCs Stars & Stripes Pack and Touchdown Pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nhh.jpg'),(7872,'Medieval Trader Simulator','2021-12-18','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A manager simulation for a medieval trader life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bai.jpg'),(7873,'Kamikaze Bros. 3','2016-10-26','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Kamikaze Bros. 3 is a kaizo style SMB3 romhack.\n\nThis hack was designed to be fun and very challenging. The player must perform tight jumps, advanced techniques and abuse the game’s mechanics in order to save the princess and emerge victorious.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8el8.jpg'),(7874,'1001 Jigsaw. 6 Magic Elements','2019-07-05','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','1001 Jigsaw – the opportunity to relax from the hustle and bustle in jigsaws.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rsf.jpg'),(7875,'Venom/Spider-Man: Separation Anxiety','1995-12-01','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Separation Anxiety is a side scrolling beat\'em up game, featuring characters and stories taken from the Spiderman comics. The story is loosely based on a mini series of comics about Venom. In this game, the player(s) gets to choose between controlling Spider-Man, or his on and off again foe Venom. As Spiderman you must stop the life foundation who have removed five symbiotes from Venom. They plan to bond them with their soldiers, creating a dangerous army. Venom recovering from his wounds also realises he must destroy them.\n\nThe game lets you punch, kick, swing and do combos throughout streets, the woods and underground complexes towards your goal. Throughout the game the player can pick up superhero icons. This icons will help you by summoning help from some of Spiderman\'s greatest allies like Daredevil, Ghost Rider, Hawkeye and Captain America','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ja4.jpg'),(7876,'Assassin\'s Creed Brotherhood: Copernicus Conspiracy','2010-11-09','Adventure','PlayStation 3','Copernicus Conspiracy is a free downloadable content addition for Assassin\'s Creed: Brotherhood, originally released exclusively for the PlayStation 3.\n\nThe DLC focuses on the famed astronomer Nicolaus Copernicus, who came into conflict with the Vatican, as they did not want Copernicus educating the public about astronomy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zlj.jpg'),(7877,'12 Labours of Hercules VI: Race for Olympus - Collectors Edition','2017-02-27','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mx4.jpg'),(7878,'Terracotta - Shards of Doom','2019-08-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','High Wizard Clayton has animated clay pots to attack people! Do you have what it takes to stop him? Travel across different worlds fighting High Wizard Clayton\'s pot army, discovering hidden pots and finding new weapons! Terracotta is a First Person Collectathon. Now go shatter some pots!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mgz.jpg'),(7879,'People\'s General','1998-08-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A classic SSI game suing the Panzer General game mechanics applied to a late Cold War era conflict against a Chinese/North Korean coalition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yxe.jpg'),(7880,'FIFA Soccer 2003','2002-12-14','Sport','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Master the fundamentals of soccer in FIFA Soccer 2003. With more ball control and player moves, this year\'s FIFA Soccer puts the The Total Club Championship within your grasp. Unleash the skills of the world\'s greatest players through new player animations and signature skill moves. Experience pressure-cooker atmospheres as you take on Europe\'s elite teams in their own stadiums featuring actual team chants and songs. EA Sports Freestyle Control lets you produce a feint, one-touch pass, or skill move to leave your opponents standing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5y4y.jpg'),(7881,'Cyberpunk Paradise Elysium: The Visual Novel','2024-05-24','Music, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','In a dystopian future, a journalist investigates disappearances and faces a corporation trying to hide the truth. Can Alex reveal the dark reality before it is too late?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8a92.jpg'),(7882,'kicker VR','2018-06-13','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','kicker VR presents historical moments of the german football story and the possibility to change it actively ingame.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7883,'Amakano+','2016-12-22','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is the fandisc for Amakano, with two episodes for each of the three heroines: a summer episode and a future episode culminating in marriage. It also includes other mini bonuses, like special commemorative voices and desktop accessories. Each heroine will get 5 H scenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wma.jpg'),(7884,'I\'m on Observation Duty','2018-12-14','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Your job is to monitor live surveillance camera footage and spot anomalies in the monitored rooms. Anomalies range from furniture movement to otherworldly intruders. When you spot an anomaly you have to file a report to fix it. You will need sharp eyes and good memory to survive the entire night.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u72.jpg'),(7885,'Signal: Uncharted Lands','2025-03-04','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embark on a journey with four adorable explorers! Uncover all the secrets of a post-apocalyptic world, meet the future inhabitants of Earth and enjoy plenty of Easter eggs. Your choices will shape the game\'s ending, so choose wisely! Or try a second playthrough to catch all the fun moments!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gbx.jpg'),(7886,'Innchanted','2023-03-28','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Innchanted is a co-op adventure where you discover magical potions, serve otherworldly guests, and pacify monsters. Gather your party and journey on a quest to overcome the evil Wizard – your landlord!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67tk.jpg'),(7887,'POD: Back to Hell','1997-12-31','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','POD: Back to Hell is the expansion for POD: Planet of Death.\nIt includes:\n- Sixteen new tracks that were also available on the Ubi Soft website.\n- Eight new cars, including Razor, Xira, RM67, Nocte, IRX, Onyx, Akir7 and Eclypse, and some surprises such as flying or monster-themed vehicles.\n- The most recent version of Game Service that allowed players to race on Ubi Soft servers.\n- Upgrades and patches that enhance gameplay, compatibility with 3D cards and audio.\n- POD-inspired Windows themes, icons and cursors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4of9.jpg'),(7888,'Arcade Archives: Escape Kids','2025-01-16','Racing, Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','\" ESCAPE KIDS \" is a sports-action game released by KONAMI in 1987. ESCAPE KIDS has only one rule: run faster than everyone else. Use the “RUN” and “SUPER JUMP” buttons to win the future superhero race.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9agy.jpg'),(7889,'Alien: Isolation - Safe Haven','2015-01-13','Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Welcome to Safe Haven, the third add-on content pack for Alien: Isolation, featuring the all-new Salvage Mode. How long can you survive? \r\n\r\nYou\'ve found the only safe room on Sevastopol but supplies are running out. You\'ll have to venture out, complete objectives and return to the safe room safely. But who\'s waiting for you out there? And what choices will you make to stay alive? \r\n\r\n- An all new Salvage Mode map, twice the size of any previous Survivor Mode map. \r\n- Play as Hughes, and get faster access to the Bolt Gun, Shotgun and EMP Mine. \r\n- Choose to explore the Gemini Systems or the Bacchus Apartments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yc9.jpg'),(7890,'LEGO Island','1997-09-26','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lego Island is a nonlinear game with a first-person perspective. The game features a series of missions including pizza delivery, jet ski racing, and putting the Brickster back in jail. It also features a variety of playable characters that each have unique abilities that can help the player throughout the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hp5.jpg'),(7891,'Treasure Hunt',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Treasure Hunt is a fast-paced party game where up to 6 players compete as pirates to dig up hidden treasure chests, steal loot from each other, and outsmart their rivals. Use quick reflexes to dig, roll, and shoot your way to victory in chaotic, treasure-filled battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gid.jpg'),(7892,'Bokida: Heartfelt Reunion','2017-05-17','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Bokida — Heartfelt Reunion is a peaceful game where you experience freedom while exploring a peculiar world. As the player, you will journey through this world using your abilities to reunite two stars who were separated a long time ago.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2022.jpg'),(7893,'Hanarenga: Takumi no Utage','2025-03-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A puzzle game based on the motif of fireworks. The player character must explode and chain all the fireworks together to clear the game in this exhilarating puzzle game! Get back your friends who have been deprived of their energy by the evil doctor!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9maz.jpg'),(7894,'Pleasure Puzzle:Workshop - Part 2',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Cartoon theme package.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7895,'Throne of Marrow',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Throne of Marrow is a metroidvania where you play as Benjamin, a reanimated skeleton. With inspiration from the horror movie classics to H.P. Lovecraft. The way you decide to build your character for each run is up to you, will you go for a melee fighter, take your foes down with range or even dip into the magical essence of this world?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mvh.jpg'),(7896,'Life\'s Too Short','2023-04-11','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Playdate','In Life\'s Too Short, you take on the role of a celestial marriage councilor as you\'re tasked with repairing a rift between two vampires who have dramatically fallen out and confined themselves to their respective coffins...\n\nYou\'ll need to explore the mansion, meet various spooky characters and solve simple puzzles in order to put the mansion back together and mend the rift in the vampires\' relationship!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71r6.jpg'),(7897,'Oval Racer Series: Sandbox','2021-11-19','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','HOME OF THE OVAL RACER Very First EVER dedicated pc game for UK oval racing Feel what it is like to get on one of the UK Oval Circuits in a Racecar','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sgs.jpg'),(7898,'Deep Space Rush','2019-10-24','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Join the DeTeam! A top-secret security force that protects the scientific space stations from virus contaminations!\n\nTake on randomly generated levels to save everyone before they all get infected. Avoid traps and monsters to survive the sweep!\n\nAre you ready to protect the space stations from biological threats? Then grab your gun, jump into your ship, and prepare for lift-off!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2flx.jpg'),(7899,'Memory Holder: Winds of Freedom','2025-04-15','Sin género','PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nh9.jpg'),(7900,'Missing Persons',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Missing Persons is a horror-survival game that you play as an officer to uncover the truths behind reported paranormal encounters and missing person cases near Southern California.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lfk.jpg'),(7901,'Eggconsole Zanac MSX','2025-01-23','Shooter','Nintendo Switch','A representative shooting game for the MSX. Pilot the fighter ZANAC and use 8 types of special weapons to defeat the mechanized army!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aqf.jpg'),(7902,'Castle of Illusion Starring Mickey Mouse','1991-06-01','Platform','Sega Game Gear, Sega Master System/Mark III','To save his girlfriend Minnie from the wicked witch Mizrabel, Mickey must venture into the Castle of Illusion. Crossing six levels (including a magical forest, a toy land and a candy world), he must collect the gems of the rainbow in order to confront and defeat the witch.\n\nEach level features unique obstacles, enemies and a final boss. The enemies can be defeated by jumping on top of them. An alternative way is to pick up objects lying around (like rocks in the forest or blue balls in the toy level) and throwing them at the enemies. Mickey\'s ability to pick up things and carry them around also leads to some sort of puzzle-oriented gameplay. By placing objects in the right spot and jumping off of them, he can get to areas that are otherwise out of reach. In some levels, he also has to collect keys to open doors. A unique type of object is the treasure chest - by jumping on top of one or throwing it, Mickey gets access to its contents, which might include extra lives, a health power-up or coins to collect for points.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6as3.jpg'),(7903,'Mondrian - Abstraction in Beauty','2015-09-21','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inspired by the works of the De Stijl masters’ limitations on form and color, Mondrian - Abstraction in Beauty takes an abstract look at the history of video game art in the form of a circular block-breaker.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qq0.jpg'),(7904,'Loopwood','2023-10-27','Puzzle, Indie','Playdate','Loopy, moody, solitaire puzzle','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7905,'Slave Girl',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7906,'Star Chef: Cooking Game',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7907,'Time Ocean',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Time Ocean is a puzzle game that you use time manipulation to overcome obstacles and reach a goal. Help the water drop that fell alone in the vast sea of time to solve the difficult puzzles and reach the last point of the sea.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ilt.jpg'),(7908,'The Conqueror of Battles','2022-03-25','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Create your team and destroy your enemies with your cards in amazing multiplayer battles 1vs1 or 2vs2 in this new fighting and strategy game. Win many rewards during your battles to become even more powerful with terrifying items. Add the game to your Wishlist and Play for free today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mzk.jpg'),(7909,'Trap Defense','2018-07-02','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Trap Defense is a TD like puzzle game. In each level, you need to place the traps at a correct position to prevent the balls reach the finish point.\n\nIn a tradition tower defense game, you always don\'t know what enemies will appear in a level. It always influencing you to make best decisions.\n\nIn Trap Defense, you don\'t need to estimate any unknowes. All balls and traps is appear at the start of each levels. What you need to do is to try your best to place the traps at a correct position. It makes you feel more that you are solving a puzzle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27c1.jpg'),(7910,'Baseball 9',NULL,'Sport','Android, iOS','Enjoy fast-paced, realistic baseball game, featuring compact gameplay and informative stats.\n\nPlay BASEBALL NINE to become the Legend League Champion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tml.jpg'),(7911,'Doll\'s Liminal','2023-03-06','Shooter, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Avoid or defeat dolls that move when you\'re not looking, take their bodies, and make your way to the 399th dimension. This is a short horror game of fear and strategy, an exploration survival horror.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vec.jpg'),(7912,'Since Memories: Off the Starry Sky','2021-12-16','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The main character \"Junya Mizumoto\" helps his family\'s business \"Mizumoto-dou\" while attending university. His heart is bind to his older brother Takaya, who died last year.\n\n\"Why did I survive?\"\n\nOne day, he meets a girl. \"I wish you\'re the one who died,\" she says, before disappearing without telling herself identity.\n\nAfter that, Junya\'s childhood friend \"Chihaya Houjou\" comes in with a project to renovate the old Houjou family house. It would be the first big job for Junya to take charge. He was confused by the series of firsts. How he will face the task that he cannot accomplish alone? The various people he meets through the job... Junya is at the mercy of many problems and conflicts caused by their respective emotions.\n\nWill he be able to successfully renovate the old Houjou house?\nWho is that girl?\n\nThe fate tied to his older brother’s death is about to begin…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93o2.jpg'),(7913,'Isolation','2017-01-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The plague destroyed the world you once knew. This unknown bacteria destroyed the lives of many people who lived in various countries around the world. When the plague was first identified by doctors, researchers started working on a cure immediately. The infected people were transported into hospitals to isolate them from other people. But this was not enough to stop it. Researchers failed in finding a cure, and there was nothing anyone could do. Slowly the plague started affecting all countries worldwide, and then that\'s when civilisation collapsed, and that is when the plague infected your country.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bqv.jpg'),(7914,'Pocket Digimon World','2000-10-06','Adventure','PlayStation','Original version of Pocket Digimon World using the PocketStation, a PlayStation accessory device. The exclusive digimon of this version are Agumon, Biyomon and Veemon. The actual main game primarily happens in the PocketStation.\n\nIn the PocketStation, you can raise your Digimon and battle it either with in-game Digimon or a friend\'s PocketStation wirelessly over IR connection. You can also connect it to other Bandai Digimon games and products.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5thn.jpg'),(7915,'Trap Genesis','2021-09-21','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Finally, a new universe is here! The great finale of the ten years history of the \"Trap\" series. This is the creation myth of the birth of a blessed world where Gods, men, and crossdressers can love each other freely!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44ve.jpg'),(7916,'Three Fourths Home/Paranautical Activity Bundle',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','In this bundle you get two thrilling games!\n- Three Fourths Home: Extended Edition\n- Paranautical Activity','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7917,'House of Caravan','2015-04-16','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Taking place in a single mansion in Candlewood, northeast USA, in the early 20th Century, House of Caravan is a sinister adventure filled with dark secrets and vexing puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86cy.jpg'),(7918,'Bouncing DVD : The Game','2019-02-10','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hit the DVD into the corner. Can you beat the high score?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mil.jpg'),(7919,'MoW: Face Off M','2015-07-16','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Battlefield Card Game with a roguish community. Come join us and immerse yourself in an alt history Steampunk universe where the impossible is possible. Choose the faction that complements your play style, build a devious deck & battle your opponent across the battlefield. + iOS & Android.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(7920,'Down n\' Up','2022-07-07','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Down n\' Up is a platformer where you can\'t move: you can only jump. In an all-in-one map where many challenges await you, climb higher and higher to reach the top. Be careful not to fall from too high!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5h08.jpg'),(7921,'Rival Turf!','1993-12-31','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Wii, Wii U, Super Famicom','Rival Turf is a cyber-punk comic-book style beat \'em up inspired by the likes of Streets of Rage and Final Fight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z9i.jpg'),(7922,'Silver Pines',NULL,'Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Silver Pines is a survival horror metroidvania. Fight nightmarish terrors and solve puzzles, while carefully managing your scarce resources as you uncover the mysteries of a case that could hold the key to redemption.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ojw.jpg'),(7923,'8-Bit Adventures 1+2 Bundle',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65ly.jpg'),(7924,'Crypto Unicorns','2022-05-03','Simulator','Web browser','A unicorn pet-collecting and farming game built on blockchain by Laguna Games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rp3.jpg'),(7925,'Lots of Things 2: Travel and Search - Collector\'s Edition','2024-05-30','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','AviGames presents Lots of Things 2, the second partt in the new hidden object series! Explore a variety of locations and search for hidden objects! Play lots of mini games and solve puzzles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gdf.jpg'),(7926,'Tiger Tank 59 I: Rainstorm MP053','2021-07-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tiger Tank 59 I: Rainstorm is a top-down shooting game. Players need to control their tanks, through the enemy lines, break the enemy base, or defeat the enemy tanks. This DLC includes map pack 053.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7u4o.jpg'),(7927,'P\'radikus Conflict','1990-12-31','Shooter','Nintendo Entertainment System','Using the typical thrust movement from the Asteroids games, you roam space with your starship to return the peace by force. Starting as a rookie, many enemy ships need to be destroyed to earn credits that can be exchanged for fuel, armor, weapons, shields and warp drives. The commander instructs you with specific missions, such as destroying outposts or freeing alien groups. However, your ultimate goal is to find the Toson Drive, the only device powerful enough to reach P\'radikus. To spice things up, there are many weapons such as shock waves, mines, missiles, cloaking devices and atomic cannons. As your fuel constantly depletes, you often need to orbit new planets to refuel and stock weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ost.jpg'),(7928,'A meadow Piece','2019-03-07','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This is a meadow simulator with slightly different flowers. Either just watch the flowers grow. Or defend yourself against strange aliens. Actively intervene in the development of the meadow. Play with your friends, either as a team or against each other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62nq.jpg'),(7929,'SmFly: Gravity Adventure','2020-10-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Platformer with physics and gravity toggle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41op.jpg'),(7930,'Brain Frame','2021-01-28','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Note: Brain Frame is a game jam title done over 15 hours with a team of 5 - plus some special appearances from \"actors\".\n\nDo YOU have what it takes to jack into the net and use your ultimate hacking skills to crack your enemy\'s defenses?\n\nHackmaster, the benevolent gray hat, was wandering through cyberspace one day when he came upon a suspicious garbage file hidden on the servers of one of the world\'s biggest tech giants. He investigates the contents of the garbage file, but the server\'s defenses activate once they\'re alerted to the presence of a foreign user in the system.\n\nYou\'ll have to use every hacking trick in the book to blast algorithms and viruses at your opponents to ensure their coroutines never run again.\n\n-Single level prototype with hardcore platforming and best-in-class roguelike functionality\n-Integrated narrative FMVs - the pinnacle symbiosis of graphics and story\n-Art, Music, SFX, and UI/UX inspired by humanity\'s last golden era - the 90s','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ojc.jpg'),(7931,'Crazy the Hedgehog','2014-07-30','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Crazy the Hedgehog is a modification of Sonic the Hedgehog for the Sega Genisis, in which you play as an alternate dimension version of Sonic named Crazy.\n\nCrazy has to defeat the parallel of Dr. Robotnik, Dr. Mechanik and his robot army as he\'s attacking North Island, to find the Dimensional Gems!\n\nBut this dimension isn\'t exactly like it\'s parallel, it\'s similar but different, its a crazy world! This hack features new level palettes and layouts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3awo.jpg'),(7932,'Keith Courage in Alpha Zones','1988-08-30','Platform','TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','Now the Battle is in Your Hands.\n\nYou are Keith Courage. Struck by a giant meteor, the world has been invaded by strange creatures from another planet. Burrowing deep within the Earth\'s surface, the Planet of B.A.D. (Beastly Alien Dudes) seeks to take over the world. As a member of N.I.C.E. (Nations of International Citizens for Earth), your mission is to defeat B.A.D. and bring peace back to the world.\n\nArmed only with a sword, you must first defeat the outpost guards. Then, enter the Underworld. Here you activate the awesome Nova Suit. A secret force left to you by your fallen father, you are half man, half mechanical monster. Nearly invincible, your sword cracks with the power of lightning, as you wreak havoc on the fearsome Dudes. Your goal is to reach the Robo Zone (the seventh Alpha Zone), headquarters of B.A.D. Succeed here and you will have won the game, recapturing the Earth and restoring humanity\'s place in the universe. You have help along the way. Four friends offer you advice, swords, bombs, and extra lives. Collect the stolen riches left behind by the invaders and buy your way out of trouble with money.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6msv.jpg'),(7933,'Island of the Ancients',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A single-player third-person action-adventure shooter set on a mystical island in the Bermuda triangle. With a companion by your side, fight your way through scores of deadly creatures. Discover new weapons and companions to tip the odds in your favor. Your family\'s survival depends on it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co448t.jpg'),(7934,'Echoes','2024-04-12','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Immerse yourself in a stunning sci-fi visual novel. In a fractured Federation on the brink, Captain Zara Kincaid is caught between political schemes and an enigmatic alien force. Your choices determine her path and the fate of worlds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8a3q.jpg'),(7935,'Pazing By','2021-06-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pazing By is a GRAZE-oriented with 2D platformer and bullet hell game, player need to dodge enemy\'s bullets or stay near enemy to damage enemy. A game for graze lover, dodger, and bullet-hell player!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co474h.jpg'),(7936,'Alien Shepherd',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Alien Shepherd is a platformer with a flying mechanic that can be activated by fusioning with a pet Jellyfish.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co577y.jpg'),(7937,'Space Farm','2020-10-16','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','SpaceFarm is following in the footsteps amazing games like Stardew Valley, and any of the Harvest Moon franchise. We are setting out to bring this amazing genre into the next generation. In-depth questing, rewards, leveling, items, battles, mini games, and of course FARMING!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2is3.jpg'),(7938,'Yeah! You Want \"Those Games\", Right? So Here You Go! Now, Let\'s See You Clear Them! 1+2','2024-12-19','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','This bundle, containing \"Those Games\" and \"Those Games 2\" is for you! Play Pin Pull, Number Tower, and more to your heart\'s content!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9apz.jpg'),(7939,'Nari Kids Park: Ultraman R/B','2018-11-21','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Ultraman R/B, which broadcasts on TV Tokyo every Saturday, joins the Nari Kids Park series. Transform into Ultraman Rosso and Ultraman Blue and have fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27ms.jpg'),(7940,'Need For Race: Street King','2025-01-17','Racing, Sport, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Fuel your ambition, ignite the streets, and race beyond the horizon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aj2.jpg'),(7941,'Danger Scavenger','2021-10-29','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Danger Scavenger is fast-paced action, cyberpunk-themed, roguelike skyline crawler. Blow up, cut, shoot enemy robots on the roofs of skyscrapers. Choose your way to higher levels, loot, buy stuff, upgrade yourself, fight against greedy corporations, be a rebel!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29jt.jpg'),(7942,'Nation Breakers: Steam Arena','2019-11-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hold your steam! It’s the premium sport of Planet Piston! Zip through portals, traverse unruly platforms and blow your fellow steam-bots into tiny bits! So buff your cogs and tune your springs, it’s your turn to compete (single player, online and couch multiplayer) in this steampunk 2D platform fighting game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q06.jpg'),(7943,'Zombotron Re-Boot','2023-11-22','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Zombotron Re-Boot is a remaster of the original Zombotron Flash game series, with updated graphics, an improved physics engine and new, incredibly rich effects!\n\nIn this action platformer you will have to fight countless different enemies: zombies, robots and other mysterious monsters. Find weapons and upgrade your skills to find and rescue survivors, and explore this mysterious planet together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s6g.jpg'),(7944,'Yeah! You Want \"Those Games\", Right? So Here You Go! Now, Let\'s See You Clear Them! 2','2024-07-18','Puzzle, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','\"Those Games\" are back! Play through familiar minigames to your heart\'s content! Take on five different minigames with a total of 250 stages! Sit back and play fully, thoroughly, and enjoyably!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8izt.jpg'),(7945,'Tsundere Milfin','2023-05-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tsundere Milfin is a lighthearted and quirky match-3 puzzle game combined with a visual novel story. Solve puzzles and make the right choices in conversations to endear yourself and gain the favor of your boss.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67eh.jpg'),(7946,'Talking Tom Jetski','2015-10-21','Arcade','iOS','Ride the wave of the FRESHEST AND FUNNEST RUNNER GAME on the horizon. Jump on the jetski with TALKING TOM or TALKING ANGELA and experience the most exhilarating water action out there - dashing through cool missions and daring challenges on the ride of your life.\n\nMOVE FREELY: Greater swipe control allows you to be nimble, combining high-octane speed and accuracy.\nRIDE THE ACTION: Enjoy the simple and action-packed gameplay.\nACCOMPLISH MISSIONS: Take on cool missions and challenges to win awards.\nCHOOSE YOUR FAVORITE CHARACTER: Ride along with Talking Tom or Talking Angela.\nCHALLENGE YOUR FRIENDS: Who will have the highest score?\nENJOY EXCITING GRAPHICS: Have fun with cool designs and awesome graphics.\n\nThis app contains:\n- Promotion of Outfit7\'s products and advertising\n- Links that direct customers to our websites and other Outfit7 apps\n- The possibility to connect with friends via social networks\n- The possibility to connect with Game Center and Google+\n\nTerms of use: http://outfit7.com/eula/\nPrivacy policy: http://outfit7.com/privacy-policy/','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/oaquayezem6dmytkg38k.jpg'),(7947,'Gizmos: Interstellar Voyage','2021-01-28','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Space adventures are waiting for you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41ak.jpg'),(7948,'Drifter King Online','2020-05-15','Racing, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Precision drift racing solo or against friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co461l.jpg'),(7949,'Try to Reach 10','2020-05-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Try To Reach 10 is a complex of fun mini-games in which you can spend a great time. How correct are you making choices? How fast will you assemble an electrical circuit? How accurate will you click on the circles? Maybe you want to try yourself in the test for general knowledge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m2q.jpg'),(7950,'Mindshadow','1986-12-31','Adventure','Amstrad CPC','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m5y.jpg'),(7951,'100 Mind Game','2018-06-22','Puzzle','Android','100 is a puzzle based numbers game. The aim of the game is to tap a number that is the same or smaller than the middle number. You only get three strikes before it\'s game over and a timer that gets\'s progressively faster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/orwxkr2rqvgy55xmntca.jpg'),(7952,'Fuzz Force: Spook Squad','2020-11-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Roll into a dicey deckbuilder set in a spooky board game world. Capture ghosts as the elite Spook Squad using their customisable Dice-Powered weaponry. Navigate eerie areas filled with battles, treasure and random events on your mission to capture the ghoulish PolterPrince.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zak.jpg'),(7953,'DreamHack Beyond','2021-07-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to DreamHack Beyond, an at-home, all-digital free interactive experience showcasing the best of DreamHack. Players can dive into the story of the mystical Sleepers by creating their own characters, completing the game’s narrative, looking for side quests and building up their XP, farming for items like Cheer Gear, and more! Want to skip the game and get right to the booth you want? No problem!\n\nDreamHack Beyond can be enjoyed anyway you like. With areas dedicated to game demos, cosplay, tournaments, and more, DreamHack is looking to go BEYOND the creative edge and create a one-of-a-kind online multiplayer experience. Scroll down to read more and join our community pages below for more updates.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31um.jpg'),(7954,'Elektrosoul','2022-07-25','Puzzle, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Awake the droid\'s consciousness taking control on the system against the timer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51d9.jpg'),(7955,'Death Tractor','2015-10-29','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This totally serious, 100% accurate to life corn harvesting simulation experience will get your adrenaline pumping and nerves excited. You\'ll never be able to farm for corn in the same light again! How much corn will YOU harvest before your eventual death by tractor? Don\'t let your family, or the tractors, stop you from becoming the ultimate capitalist in DEATH TRACTOR!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yyc.jpg'),(7956,'The Lord of the Rings Online: Rise of Isengard','2011-09-27','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rise of Isengard will expand the online world of Middle-earth where players will join forces to press further eastward into the legendary region of Isengard. Rise of Isengard includes an increased level cap, the new region of Isengard including the legendary tower of Orthanc, enhancements to monster play and much more.\n\nExplore Three New Regions\n\nDunland\nAdventure amidst the bright forests in the foothills of the southern Misty Mountains. Beware the Dunland Clans, rugged warriors tempted by the dark promise of power.\n\nGap of Rohan\nBattle over the legendary pass between Eriador and the plain of Rohan. This key strategic point must be defended against the ambitions of Sauron.\n\nIsengard\nExplore Orthanc, one of the iconic Two Towers, as it rises over the once beautiful Isengard valley, now desecrated beyond repair by Saruman the betrayer.\n\nAdvance to Level 75\nFace new challenges and continue to forge your own legend in Middle-earth with all-new epic quests, skills, and deeds as you fight new enemies on your journey to level 75!\n\nMaster the Legendary New 24-Player Raid\nBattle the ancient evil of Draigoch, one of the most powerful creatures in Middle-earth! Prepare for the ultimate challenge where nothing less than the strength of an entire force of 24 heroes stands the chance of victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8izj.jpg'),(7957,'Escape Game The Resort Facility','2025-01-23','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','The orthodox escape game for you, staged in a resort facility.\nCan you solve all the riddles and get out?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aqh.jpg'),(7958,'Heist Simulator 2025','2025-01-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Plan, steal, escape – live the adrenaline of a perfect heist!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d0m.jpg'),(7959,'realMyst: Masterpiece Edition','2014-01-28','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Alone on a mysterious island, you set out to explore its grandeur and mystery. Here, a chilling tale of intrigue and injustice, defying all boundaries of space and time, is being told. Summon your wits and imagination about you. Every scrap of paper and ambient sound may provide the vital clues that allow hidden secrets to unravel before you. Each discovery you make and each puzzle you solve will lead you one step closer to reversing a wrong that has gone unchecked for ages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co263b.jpg'),(7960,'Net.Attack()',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unleash your inner hacker skills and code your way to victory in a game where complex algorithms meet intuitive gameplay. Net.Attack() is a dynamic top-down survivor-like roguelite where you create your own abilities with a node-based coding mechanic. Go and dominate the virtual battleboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8soz.jpg'),(7961,'Pirates: Legend of the Black Buccaneer','2006-11-17','Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox, PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Pirate Francis Blade searches for the treasure of the Black Buccaneer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9epb.jpg'),(7962,'Unaccessible','2025-01-24','Platform, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unaccessible is a third-person wheelchair platformer about struggling to get a health insurance claim approved on a mysterious island without accessibility ramps. Tackle stairs, climb obstacles and hop your way through the pain of the claims approval process.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dgn.jpg'),(7963,'Cosmic Soldier','1987-06-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC-8800 Series, Sharp X1, DOS, MSX','In the game, you must locate 3 data cards and 4 \"filters\" that allow access to a secret file in the enemy data bank. Data cards and filters are located in different stars of the Quila system, which can be reached immediately via an air shuttle; all the information you need in order to locate the items can be obtained by talking to enemies. Once the items are in your possession, you must locate the data bank and get the file.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pwlgeu3ho9lnugyxvjap.jpg'),(7964,'Asterix & Obelix: Slap Them All! 2','2023-11-30','Fighting, Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Asterix & Obelix - Slap them all! 2 is a Beat\'em Up with an original story. Explore different places such as forest ruins, a vast Roman camp and even Lutèce. This dynamic game invites you to come on an adventure — with a generous distribution of slaps!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pc2.jpg'),(7965,'Taka Taka','2024-02-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Taka Taka is a Japanese-folklore-inspired rhythm game. Play as Tengu and Oni, an unlikely pair attempting to survive a world of Yokai. Match the characters with their colorized notes and face increasingly more conniving enemies in order to progress through the world of Yokai.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yvg.jpg'),(7966,'Go Banana',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','If you thought, \"Wow, another weird game came out...\", you\'re sharp! Feel like you\'re watching a B-movie, grab some cola and popcorn and get through this silly game! Get ready to throw your mind, time and money down the drain. And now you too, let\'s Go! Banana! to this crazy world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ubr.jpg'),(7967,'Asteroid Colony','2024-10-23','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this real time strategy city builder game you will help humanity reaching beyond earth by establishing a permanent and thriving settlement in the asteroid belt. Settling in space comes with enormous challenges and dangers, which you will have to guide your people through','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z64.jpg'),(7968,'Animetic Story Game 1: Cardcaptor Sakura','1999-08-05','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation','Animetic Story Game 1: Cardcaptor Sakura was released on August 5th, 1999. Published by Arika for the PlayStation 1, the game is an adaption of the first season of the anime.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4otk.jpg'),(7969,'The Jumping Sushi','2022-07-29','Simulator','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Join BIG S on his exciting journey through the kitchen and make him jump!\nEnjoy the colorful comic graphics accompanied by atmospheric music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50ou.jpg'),(7970,'Commander Bug Wars','2024-07-19','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dive into the thrilling clash between humans and cybernetic bugs. Lead your infantry, tanks, aircraft, and ships through intense battles. Use strategy and tactics to outsmart your foes. Every decision shapes the war\'s outcome. Are you ready for the challenge? Time to eat the Bugs!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xdk.jpg'),(7971,'WWE All Stars','2011-11-22','Fighting, Shooter, Sport','PlayStation 3, Nintendo 3DS, Wii, PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','WWE All Stars will deliver one of the greatest rosters ever assembled in a wrestling-centric videogame. Renowned WWE Legends will align with today\'s most prominent Superstars, inviting players to generate fantasy matches and ultimately determine the greatest competitors of all time. In addition, each Legend and Superstar will boast a distinctive and highly stylized appearance, adding to the overall atmosphere and intrepid attitude exuding from the on-screen action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hdw.jpg'),(7972,'Onion Assault','2023-01-26','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The evil Croquetto Empire is trying to conquer Onionia and it\'s up to one brave onion farmer, and his mom, to stop the tyrannical invading fascist army!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61i3.jpg'),(7973,'Pudgy Party','2025-04-22','Platform','Android, iOS','Stumble, survive, and race through a winter wonderland packed with wacky obstacles, fast-paced survival rounds, and high-energy races! Dodge spinning hammers, jump across slippery platforms, and outmaneuver rivals in a battle to be the last penguin standing. With up to 16 players in every match, every round is a fresh, chaotic rush to the finish line!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pwq.jpg'),(7974,'Boom Stick','2020-02-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Boom Stick is a Fast-Paced Shooter with projectile based combat. Inspired by many of the Old School Shooters but with some new Ideas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mhc.jpg'),(7975,'Order of Battle: World War II - Order of Battle: Allies Victorious',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5f3n.jpg'),(7976,'Iron Man 3: The Official Game','2013-04-25','Sin género','Android, iOS','A combat-heavy 3D Infinite runner based on the 2013 blockbuster film.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rio.jpg'),(7977,'Wild Guns Reloaded','2018-04-17','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Wild Guns Reloaded is an enhanced remaster of Wild Guns. It introduces two new characters, Doris and Bullet the dog, along with his sentry drone. The update also includes extra stages and modes, along with improved visuals and audio.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23qm.jpg'),(7978,'Links LS: 1998 Edition','1997-06-30','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Links LS 1998 Edition is the first game in the Links series to run in native Windows 95 mode. \"Look ahead\" rendering sees the game predict where your next shot will be from, reducing redraw times. There are two new offline tournaments for a total of six, and an internet play mode. Perhaps in response to Tiger Woods\' success at the time, a black-skinned golfer is added to this version. You now view other golfers on the main play screen, and the action is tracked by 8 smart cameras. New visual enhancements include water reflections, waving flags, blimps, balloons, airplanes and environmental haze and fog.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hzy.jpg'),(7979,'Comrades and Barons: Gates of Freedom','2023-06-01','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Great War had barely ended, when Red Army started an offensive westwards to ignite the revolution in Europe. Comrades and Barons: Gates of Freedom is a hex wargame that lets you to relive the events on the battlefields of this turbulent time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kkj.jpg'),(7980,'Tuneria','2020-10-23','Music, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Tuneria is a music-focused RPG inspired by games such as Golden Sun, Ocarina of Time, Chrono Trigger, and To the Moon. Tuneria is a 2d RPG where you can use your keyboard to hold frets and pick your guitar strings. Use your guitar in battle by playing powerful Tunes, or use those same tunes in the environment to discover hidden secrets. Completely original soundtrack composed by Chaotrope.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2inr.jpg'),(7981,'Desynced','2023-08-15','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Desynced is a sci-fi strategy game with fully customizable units and behaviors. Gather, build, research, and explore the unknown. Alone or with friends, unveil the mystery of an AI on the edge of self-awareness and uncover the hidden truth in this blend of strategy, automation, and exploration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ytf.jpg'),(7982,'Final Fantasy XIV: The Gears of Change','2016-02-23','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Patch 3.2 brings a myriad of additions and refinements to the realm of Eorzea, including new story quests, new beast tribe quests, battle class adjustments, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hvr.jpg'),(7983,'Leap of Phase: Samantha','2022-07-13','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Leap of Phase is a first-person puzzle game. You will need to solve puzzle rooms by utilizing personal teleporter units. Place up to three of these at any time you want.\n\nYou thought it would be the chance of a lifetime when tech giant IRT hired you to work in their new testing facility. But now… you’re a guina pig for experimental teleporting technology and suspect that something is wrong with this company. Very wrong...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6edz.jpg'),(7984,'Whale Rock: All Games Bundle',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hu3.jpg'),(7985,'Interstellar Space: Genesis - Evolving Empires',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Sin plataforma','Interstellar Space: Genesis - Evolving Empires is the second expansion to the turn-based space 4X strategy game Interstellar Space: Genesis. Adds two major new features to the game, Evolutions and Minor Civilizations. These features provide tons of new content, 7 new leaders and 2 new music tracks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qe1.jpg'),(7986,'Starry Nights: Helix','2017-02-17','Shooter, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The retro-style Side Scroller shooting game with vivid storyline depicts fully charactered protagonists love affairs.! Colorfully themed game stages and variety of bosses infests here!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co421r.jpg'),(7987,'DreamWorks Dragons: Legends of the Nine Realms','2022-09-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Unleash your inner dragon and fly beyond the Hidden World, on a fiery adventure to rescue Thunder’s family and save the dragon kingdoms!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5es6.jpg'),(7988,'Star Vikings','2016-10-06','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Star Vikings is a casual Puzzle/RPG that is fun, easy to get into and that respects players\' intelligence. Developed by the creators of Relic Hunters Zero, Chroma Squad and Dungeonland!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co422j.jpg'),(7989,'Charge Champs',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Charge Champs is a 2D platform fighter with a unique combat system where players charge their character to temporarily unlock abilities and gain an advantage over their opponents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cmr.jpg'),(7990,'This is the last time','2025-04-03','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is the Last Time is a minimalist first-person narrative game with a dark and heavy atmosphere.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mem.jpg'),(7991,'Fairy Fencer F: Advent Dark Force - Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c6n.jpg'),(7992,'Turok: Rage Wars','1999-10-31','Shooter','Nintendo 64','Turok: Rage Wars is a first-person shooter video game released for the Nintendo 64. The game supports up to four players or bots with a single player mission-based mode also available. The game allows use of the RAM Expansion Pak for enhanced play sessions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zqu.jpg'),(7993,'Lily\'s Day Off','2017-01-06','Adventure, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Lily\'s Day Off is a visual novel, but not in the typical sense.\nAs you progress in this game, your actions drastically change characters, story lines, and outcomes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co253r.jpg'),(7994,'Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde','1989-04-01','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde is a 1988 side-scrolling action video game for the Nintendo Entertainment System loosely based on the novel Strange Case of Dr Jekyll and Mr Hyde. Gameplay alternates between the characters of Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde based on the player\'s ability to either avoid or cause damage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nvk.jpg'),(7995,'A Session with Dr. Liebnitz','2025-04-04','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Session with Dr. Liebnitz is an exploration game taking place in the mind of the playable character. You will be wandering through your mind, trying to cure it from fear, depression, anger and many more deep, troubling conditions. The extraordinary Dr. Liebnitz will guide you on this journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9men.jpg'),(7996,'Schizm: Mysterious Journey','2021-10-08','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As two survivors of a spaceship crash, you must solve insidious puzzles to rendezvous with each other and uncover the mystery of the abandoned planet Argilus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co403m.jpg'),(7997,'Stream Train','2023-04-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Twitch integrated game where viewers use chat commands to guess if cards will be higher or lower to avoid obstacles. Ideal for Starting Soon or Break scenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zw4.jpg'),(7998,'Zigglox','2023-05-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Team up with friends or get online and find bricks to build the highest and prettiest tower before the other team ! Beware though, some bricks are... specials!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4l3l.jpg'),(7999,'Pixel Paint: Definitive Edition','2023-03-29','Puzzle, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Pixel Paint is anything but a classic coloring book. The point of the game is for you to put your mind at ease, follow the numbers and fill every last pixel with a corresponding color.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dmf.jpg'),(8000,'Nige-ron-pa','2000-11-23','Role-playing (RPG)','Neo Geo Pocket Color','nige-ron-pa is a turn-based RPG set in the world the game was named after featuring humans, elves, demons and other creatures co-existing with each other.\n\nPlayers take control of an elf and a catgirl who are about to take the exam and become workers. After passing the exam and obtaining a license, players can accept various tasks which will reward them with money and Worker points.\n\nThe worker points serve both as the game\'s reputation system and are an integral part of the game\'s license system. They determine who would accept to be a part of the player\'s party, as well as allow players to get new licenses, which works in a similar way to Final Fantasy\'s job system. Equipping different licenses will unlock different spells for players to use in battle. The more worker points players get, the more likely it is that additional characters can be hired.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92vk.jpg'),(8001,'Fields of Mistria','2024-08-05','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Start your new life! Build the farm of your dreams as you discover a world brimming with possibilities. Magic, romance, and adventure all await you in this nostalgic farming / life sim RPG!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gwn.jpg'),(8002,'Tapes of Fear: Smile',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Tapes of Fear is a psychological horror game where you investigate an isolated mansion while something sinister stalks your every step, testing your will to survive. The Infinity Fear System analyzes your behavior and fears, adapting events to create a deeply personal horror experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l0q.jpg'),(8003,'Floating Girl','2021-05-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a \"beautiful girl + hit the plane + choppy\" combination of the game.You will encounter all kinds of beauties in space, some sexy, some cute, and some hot and passionate.With the downing of the plane, the beauties will meet you, and then...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co464z.jpg'),(8004,'Star Fleet Armada: Rogue Adventures','2017-06-05','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Captain a fleet of ships. Meet new races. Explore other star systems. Discover and explore anomalies, asteroid fields, nebulas, suns, comets and more. Can you find that rare Rainbow planet that is teeming with mass amounts of resources? Play as any of the 45 races. Earn Achievements to get rare in game artifacts!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h4w.jpg'),(8005,'Terror at Oakheart','2024-02-27','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The renowned slasher horror films of the 1980s and 1990s serve as a source of inspiration for Terror at Oakheart. The community of Oakheart has been terrorized by Teddy, a masked serial killer. As the body count rises, you discover there is more going on here than just a man in a mask killing helpless teenagers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77un.jpg'),(8006,'Touhou Genso Maroku W: The Devil of Decline','2024-06-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','The Devil of Decline is a fan-made traditional turn-based RPG based on the Touhou universe and lore. It was developed and published by Strawberry Bose.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a6j.jpg'),(8007,'Light Bringer','1994-02-01','Fighting','Arcade','Light Bringer (también conocido como Dungeon Magic), es un juego de arcade de Taito Corporation, perteneciente al género Hack and Slash medieval. A diferencia de la mayoría de los beat\'em ups de ambientación medieval / fantástica, el juego cuenta con una vista isométrica, algunas plataformas (por lo general, cajas apiladas, mesas o rocas para subir y saltar), grandes personajes estilizados y ajustes de variables de sangre. \nUn malvado mago resucita a un espíritu maligno, conspirando para tomar el control del reino, y ha secuestrado a la princesa para usarla como sacrificio. Cuatro guerreros se adentran en el mundo mágico para salvar a la princesa de las garras del mago malvado: Ash el Caballero, Gren el guerrero errante, Cisty el elfo, cuya familia entera fue destruida por el espíritu del mal en el pasado, y el viejo mago Vold, contando con la ayuda del equipo de magia, iniciaran su odisea para rescatar a la princesa.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8008,'Construction Simulator 2+3 Bundle','2024-04-04','Simulator, Strategy','Nintendo Switch','CONSTRUCTION SIMULATOR 2 Once you have started your own company, you can start exploring new regions in Westside Plains bit by bit, and accept ever-larger and more lucrative construction jobs in the open world of Construction Simulator 2 US – Conso','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81tq.jpg'),(8009,'Barton Lynch Pro Surfing 2022','2023-11-17','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Barton Lynch Pro Surfing 2022 pits you against the world’s best surfer’s at the most exotic locations on the planet. An in-depth leader-board sports game meets free surf exploration at 12 massive worlds. Get pumped by the unique control, amazing weather & customization tools.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59ms.jpg'),(8010,'Chopper Attack','1998-06-17','Shooter','Nintendo 64','ACES NEEDED! Join an elite group of international chopper pilots with one objective... hunt down and destroy a renegade terrorist group bent on world domination! Engage and destroy the enemy in 8 different intense missions. Blow up strategic enemy radar. Shoot ground troops and enemy aircraft as you rescue hostages or escort friendly aircraft from dangerous enemy territory. Cash rewards give way to an explosive arsenal of ground and air missiles. Transform enemy installations into explosive fireballs with devastating ground and air target lock-on cluster bombs. Fly one of 8 different choppers, each one with different weapon and flying capabilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pqv.jpg'),(8011,'Ceville','2009-02-27','Point-and-click, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Be the lesser of two evils in this tongue-and-cheek sendup of the fantasy genre. Point and click your way back into royalty as the vertically challenged (and recently deposed) despot Ceville.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hdn.jpg'),(8012,'Atari Flashback 2+','2010-02-22','Arcade','Plug & Play','It includes 20 classic Atari 2600 games and 20 new Atari games. The game lineup is mostly the same as the original Flashback 2. However, games such as Pitfall!, River Raid, and Wizard do not appear, and are instead replaced by sports games.\nA third hidden game, Circus Atari, was added.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8013,'Word Chase','2024-09-12','Puzzle','Web browser','Word Chase is a word building game where players attempt to find as many words in the game as possible and earn a high score.\n\nWords must be at least 2 letters long. Each letter connects to any adjacent letter, including those beside, above, below, or diagonally. Connect letters to form words. Each letter is worth 10 points. Starting with the 6th letter in a word, each letter is worth 20 points. Words only count once, even if you find them using different paths on the grid.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94m0.jpg'),(8014,'Undead Wilderness',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Undead Wilderness: Survive the unforgiving jungle, unravel its mysteries, and escape the relentless horde of bloodthirsty zombies. Scavenge, manage resources, and fight for your life in a heart-pounding race against the growing undead threat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97v1.jpg'),(8015,'Layers of Fear: Masterpiece Edition','2016-08-02','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Layers of Fear: Masterpiece Edition includes both Layers of Fear and the Inheritance DLC in a single, horror-filled package.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mcu.jpg'),(8016,'SteamHammerVR','2017-01-20','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your adventure takes place in Victorian London 1892. The dastardly Professor Rattwurm is attempting to enslave the fine English folk with his multitude of clockwork automatons! Armed with your steam powered weapons, can you save old London Town?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29cu.jpg'),(8017,'Quell Reflect','2014-02-19','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Nintendo 3DS, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','An enchanting puzzle game of logic and relaxation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co258b.jpg'),(8018,'Yuoni: Rises','2020-02-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Nintendo Switch','Yuoni: Rises is a VR visual novel game where players sit at a desk and relive the characters\' experiences while progressing through the story. The story is set in mid-90s Japan when the Internet was still not widely used and cell phones were owned by a select few adults.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5owa.jpg'),(8019,'Meow Time Machine: Newton','2025-04-11','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is an immersive hidden object puzzle game that takes you through time to explore the extraordinary life of physics genius Isaac Newton. From the inspiration under the apple tree to the publication of \'Principia Mathematica\', from Trinity College Cambridge to the Royal Society, every step is a journey into scientific mysteries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o91.jpg'),(8020,'The Hungry Fly','2024-10-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Once upon a time, there was a fly. A hungry fly. A fly with razor-sharp teeth, with a taste for dead things. This is the tale of its adventure to find something dead to devour, in a swamp where nothing dies, everything is grotesque, and every choice matters, no matter how surreal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qx8.jpg'),(8021,'Operation Deep Magic: Cryptanalysis','2020-01-21','Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Reconnaissance operatives infiltrated a corporate building and extracted electronics and files encrypted with 56-bit DES. Items were handed over to you, the cryptanalyst. Your mission is to decrypt the files.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lwd.jpg'),(8022,'Kikuni Masahiko no Jantoushi Dora-ou 2','1993-12-03','Sport, Card & Board Game','Super Famicom','Kikuni Masahiko no Jantoushi Dora Ou 2 is a mahjong game with a parody supernatural superhero theme. Like its predecessor, it uses mahjong as a sort of component for its \"battle\" system.\n\nKikuni Masahiko no Jantoushi Dora Ou 2 is a bit more \"free\", allowing the player to explore the world map. It also allows for four-person games, removing the two-person limitation of its forebear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73xq.jpg'),(8023,'Excessive Speed','1999-03-01','Racing, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Isometric racing game with power-ups.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8upt.jpg'),(8024,'Surf Safari','2022-04-21','Indie, Arcade','Playdate','Surf Safari is an endless survival game built for playdate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8287.jpg'),(8025,'Isle of Skye','2018-07-19','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Five clans are fighting to rule over the Isle of Skye. Only the chieftain who develops the best clan territory and trades wisely will be king!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co448z.jpg'),(8026,'Steel Storm: Forgotten Prison','2013-09-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Of course you all remember Steel Storm, well known for its fierce and intense action. This DLC is not only action packed, but also brings a challenge full of puzzles and traps, you need to think your way through. Think outside the box, explore, observe, and you shall succeed at your mission!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hcc.jpg'),(8027,'Femida','2020-01-16','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Judge Simulator 2020. Play the role of Judge Daemon Mardoch and investigate the disappearance of your father during the Last Revolution. Set in the dystopian State with a post-WWII level of tech and noir aesthetics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wfp.jpg'),(8028,'Xel: Save the World Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52zz.jpg'),(8029,'Wukong Sun: Black Legend','2024-12-26','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Unleash the Legend of the Monkey King!\nBattle through chaos, conquer mythical foes, and reclaim your destiny.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ahq.jpg'),(8030,'Nature Hunter','2023-05-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A video game about animals, insects, mushrooms, ruins, Nature, all through the seasons in open world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8p1k.jpg'),(8031,'The Angry 4','2021-08-29','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c64.jpg'),(8032,'Bingo Beavers: Kitchen','2023-07-27','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embark on a new adventure in the Bingo Beavers game as you expand the beaver mansion with a charming new room - the Kitchen.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8033,'Sixty Second Heist','2022-02-07','Puzzle','Web browser','You\'ve only got 60 seconds to pull it off!\nThe heist of the century, or something like that...\n\nAll mini-games are either click or click-and-drag.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8034,'Astyanax','1989-12-31','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Arcade','Astyanax is a side-scrolling platform action game set in a fantasy world. The hero sets out to slay the evil wizard terrorizing the land. He is armed with an ax and also has a magic lightning spell that can be powered-up two times. Magic upgrades and health potions can be found in small stone pillars. The player needs to beat monsters in a number of locales, jumping across pits and fighting bosses at the end of stages. Two-palyer co-op is supported, with the second player being palette-swap of Player 1.\n\nThe game was designed by Tokuhiro Takemori who previously worked on Legendary Axe, and the basic game mechanic is similar -- in order to deal heavy blow with the axe the player needs to stop swinging it for a while. The NES version released after the Arcade game, while generally having same gameplay, features completely different level layouts, enemy designs and story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dkd.jpg'),(8035,'Jessika','2021-08-19','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Jessika committed suicide, and it’s up to you to find out why she did what she did by prying into her digital past. What at first seems to be a job like any other quickly develops into a dark drama with twists and turns.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2et0.jpg'),(8036,'Particle Mace','2016-05-20','Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Particle Mace is explosive arcade fun for 1-4 players that pays homage to twitch games of the past, but replaces the typical guns with an unruly physics-based weapon. Take control of a tiny ship in an extremely hostile universe, and defend yourself as long as possible from enemy ships and asteroids using a collection of trash particles tethered to the ship. To survive, you must carefully navigate around the many hazards while building up momentum to swing your weapon into your foes or your friends, all in a field of brightly abstracted visuals and an entrancing procedural background.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pqv.jpg'),(8037,'Car Wash Tycoon Business Simulator','2025-02-01','Puzzle, Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Transform a simple wash into a car cleaning empire!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aq9.jpg'),(8038,'Rocket Royale',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8039,'In His Time','2024-05-23','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','This is a 2D adventure game of puzzle solving. As you control Ollie, a young boy, use your head to overcome the many obstacles that stand in your way. To obtain items, you may need to persuade characters or win mini-games. Through these, players will get to know the world even better.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75fd.jpg'),(8040,'Lemures Blue\'s 2 A.M.','2014-11-02','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aoi, a third year middle school student who attends an all-boy\'s junior and senior high school. Hinata, the mysterious \"Dead of Night Man\" who only appears at 2 A.M. beneath the sakura tree. An intense sense of intrigue deepens as they encounter through a chance meeting that expands into secret rendezvous... what will come of it?\n\n\"——\'Aoi\'s heart must be mine.\'\nIt seems that is the one and only way to obtain the Lemures Blue.\"\n\nA rose that is said to bring eternal youth to the living and give life back to those who have died. What could be the secret behind this phantom flower, the \"Lemures Blue\", and the lost prodigy, Akane?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38qg.jpg'),(8041,'Mahjong Sex & Girls',NULL,'Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Sin plataforma','《Mahjong, Sex & Girls》 is a lighthearted adult mahjong game. You are the part-time worker at the mahjong parlor. Besides getting entangled in various heart-pounding interactions with the female characters, even the boss lady has her eyes on your body...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nmm.jpg'),(8042,'RocketBird','2022-12-04','Indie, Arcade','Playdate','Strap on your space suit, grab your crank, and get ready for the challenge of RocketBird!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8043,'Bed Survival','2021-12-31','Simulator, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','\'Bed Survival\' is developed by AvoCavo who is also the author of \'Meteor 60 seconds!\'\nIt\'s cold and dangerous outside of bed. Achieve your happiness in bed!\n\n**Warning : There is an element that can cause discomfort. Not appropriate for all ages group. **\n\nFull of humor : Enjoy comic, anime-like dialogues with humorous illustration. And some serious story.\n\nStraightforward and easy-to-control : Support mouse-only controller. Grab various foods by using a fishing rod! In addition to that, you will need to find various entertainment contents to kill your time.\n\nFull of humor Playtime : 1-2 hours\nMATURE CONTENT DESCRIPTION\nThe developers describe the content like this:\n\nThis game contains unexpected discomfort. Not appropriate for all audience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xnm.jpg'),(8044,'Light Guardian','2025-01-30','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Retrieve all the light shards back and see where your journey ends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d0n.jpg'),(8045,'Eggconsole Crimson PC-8801mkIISR','2025-01-16','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','Carry on your late father\'s will and defeat the ferocious Crimson! XTAL SOFT presents a fully-fledged command-based RPG!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aji.jpg'),(8046,'Idol Symphony','2025-01-30','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy','Nintendo Switch','Melodies, outfits and puzzles – the bright show begins!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9box.jpg'),(8047,'The Chronicles of Riddick: Assault on Dark Athena','2009-04-24','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','The Chronicles of Riddick: Assault on Dark Athena is a new, action stealth first person shooter set in the rich, futuristic, sci-fi world of the Riddick film saga. The game features a rich storyline, intriguing, developed characters, and the voice acting of Vin Diesel.\nThe Chronicles of Riddick: Assault on Dark Athena follows up the story from the original game title as Riddick must now flee the Dark Athena, following his harrowing escape from the notorious Butcher Bay prison. During the adventure, Richard B. Riddick must escape the predatory Merc-ship Dark Athena using stealth and action to overcome its merciless crew and challenge the nefarious Captain Revas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bqs.jpg'),(8048,'Hanerutchi','2005-03-31','Simulator','Handheld Electronic LCD','The Hanerutchi is a Tamagotchi released in 2005 exclusive to Japan. The programming is based on that of the Keitai Kaitsuu Tamagotchi Plus, while the characters are based on characters from the Japanese comedy variety show Haneru no Tobira.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xzi.jpg'),(8049,'Ishara: Bane of the Seas','2015-04-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ishara named herself after a fabled sea witch to instill fear in all she encountered, which is the path of an exiled woman looking to turn to piracy. She needs one thing first, and that\'s a ship. If only she didn\'t need her family to get to it.\n\nChoose between two separate story branches depending on who Ishara gets stuck with, her hated twin sister Cendre or her sister\'s deceptive fiancé Félix. Totalling 36,000 words, features include two hours of playtime, a battle mini-game, partial voice acting (for battles), and 4 endings.\n\nIshara: Bane of the Seas was made in one month for NaNoRenO \'15, a visual novel game jam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26g0.jpg'),(8050,'Tonka Search & Rescue 2','2002-12-31','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Save the day the Tonka way in fire,police, water and mountain rescues! Product Information Join the ranks of brave police officers, firefighters and rescue workers in exciting search and rescue missions. Tonka Joe needs a tough hero like you to answer the call to fight forest fires, break up traffic jams, save people stranded by floods and rescue boats lost in a storm!The game begins at the dispatch center, where Tonka Joe explains about the missions and general play. There are four areas to explore: the Fire Station,Police Department, Mountain Rescue Station and Water Rescue Station. Each of these has three missions and also features activities. The missions involve rescuing stranded animals and people, moving hazards, clearing roads, and constructing protective buildings. Kids will know they have a mission to attend to when a siren goes off on one of the stations in a random fashion, and will need to click on that building to participate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4nxv.jpg'),(8051,'Half Alive','2023-09-05','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Half Alive is a Low Poly Multiplayer FPS Game. Survive each round of zombies after which a more difficult round begins. Enlarge your playing area and your weapons backpack to provide yourself good chances of survival!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70fy.jpg'),(8052,'Mutiny!!','2017-10-20','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Mutiny!! is set in a world of fantasy, and adventure. A realm where airships can sail among the clouds as well as the sea, entering the flogiston to journey to other planes. There’s treasure spread out over many planes if you’re brave or curious enough to find it! At the bottom of the sea or within mysterious ruins, protected by curious animated guardians. The world of Mutiny!! is in every way ‘fun’, silly and sexy as you imagine!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gy4.jpg'),(8053,'Alarm für Cobra 11: Das Spiel zur RTL-Erfolgsserie','2000-12-31','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ukd.jpg'),(8054,'Final Ninja','2008-07-24','Platform','Web browser','Use your ninja rope and cloaking skills to take down your ex-boss','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mv0.jpg'),(8055,'Warlock: Tower Defence','2018-01-08','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warlock: Tower Defence is a story driven tower defence game, giving players access to 6 elemental magics to face challenges spread across 5 chapters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3luo.jpg'),(8056,'Earthworm Jim Collection',NULL,'Platform, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65di.jpg'),(8057,'Frail Hearts Collection',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66zw.jpg'),(8058,'All I Do Is Dream',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A game written by Megan Stevens for the 22nd Annual Interactive Fiction Competition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/u0fwilibwbl6zdokkidz.jpg'),(8059,'Iridion 3D','2020-04-08','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Game Boy Advance','In the distant regions of our galaxy, far beyond the darkest limits of the Orion Nebula, a deadly force has bee unleashed upon the universe and is heading straight for Earth. Get ready to travel forward to a time, when the fate of the universe rests in the palm of your hands! - See more at:','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3geg.jpg'),(8060,'Sight Blight','2023-05-15','Indie','Playdate','A small game about saving Elves from a horrible laser death.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8061,'Urbex Murder',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Urbex Murder is a cooperative horror game where you explore abandoned places alone or with friends. Solve puzzles, confront events, and uncover hidden secrets. Each map offers unique scenarios for an immersive and terrifying experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93x5.jpg'),(8062,'The Forgettable Dungeon','2019-10-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Forgettable Dungeon is an ONLINE co-op top down action roguelike that takes place in a procedurally generated destructible voxel world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43sk.jpg'),(8063,'Urban Myth Dissolution Center','2025-02-12','Puzzle, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Join forces with the psychic Director of the Urban Myth Dissolution Center and solve a variety of cases involving cursed relics, rental properties with shady histories, and dimensional anomalies. Monstrous oddities and otherworldly planes abound in this occult mystery adventure game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yr9.jpg'),(8064,'Malevolent Madness','2025-04-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Malevolent Madness invites players into a tension-filled horror adventure, offering an experience rich in mystery and puzzles. A mysterious time machine unleashes extraordinary powers that could disrupt the balance between universes, but this discovery becomes a significant threat to humanity in the wrong hands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96ub.jpg'),(8065,'Bunker Game','2024-05-26','Point-and-click, Adventure, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short, post-apocalypse, story-driven point-and-click game about companionship and legacy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cpr.jpg'),(8066,'The Shrimp Crematorium','2025-04-15','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You work at the Universal Crematorium System. They are doing some weird stuff with shrimps here. Your job is simple: Find out which shrimp are rotting and... Well, exclude these shrimp from the tests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pxr.jpg'),(8067,'Contact','2006-03-30','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo DS','Contact is a role-playing video game developed by Grasshopper Manufacture for the Nintendo DS handheld game console. It was published by Marvelous Entertainment in Japan on March 30, 2006, by Atlus in North America on October 19, 2006, and by Rising Star Games in Australasia and Europe on January 25, 2007 and February 6, 2007 respectively.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3t6h.jpg'),(8068,'Little Tank','2025-04-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shoot the Skeletons & Defend the Goddess statue. Enjoy the excitement when shooting the skeletons with a cannon ball. Fulfill your curiosity by exploring the map and crafting different items to help you win the game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o9b.jpg'),(8069,'My Little Dog Adventure','2020-11-05','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','In Little Dog Adventure you play as a little dog that discovers the world on its mission to find its way back home. It\'s a short emotional story-driven exploration game that will keep you interested with an immersive story and lovable characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pjd.jpg'),(8070,'To the Hall of the Mountain King',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','3D hack and slash platforming action adventure in which your mission is to rescue your cat and carry out a coup against the king who ordered cat\'s abduction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h3k.jpg'),(8071,'The Prabbits: Happy Dogfights','2021-07-31','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Happy Dogfights is a fast-paced, 4 player party game, where you take the air as a Prabbit.\nAlways up for a friendly fight, the prabbits are organizing all kinds of tournaments with their new flying machines. In a series of quick and intense matches, their sole goal is to knock their opponent out of the skies and prove that they are the best pilot in the tribe. These chaotic matches can bring the best... or the worst out of you and your opponents as you try to gain the Prabbit Champion crown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hrg.jpg'),(8072,'Asterix & Obelix XXL 2','2018-11-29','Fighting, Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Originally released in 2005 on PlayStation 2 and PC, the two famous Gauls take up the challenges set by Julius Caesar in his new amusement park. Players will need to keep their eyes peeled to find the many pop culture references hidden in the scenery and dialogue.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28ul.jpg'),(8073,'Prima Doll: Fuyuzora Hanabi/Sekka Monyou','2023-04-28','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Prima Doll: Fuyuzora Hanabi/Sekka Mon\'you is the first volume of a kinetic novel series based on the multimedia project Prima Doll that adapts the Haizakura and Karasuba prequel episode originally serialized for the official website.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ccy.jpg'),(8074,'Kokopa\'s Atlas',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Discover new beginnings after crash-landing on an undiscovered planet. Join Kokopa and Pollimero as they explore, build, garden, and meet new friends — while uncovering the mysteries of this unknown planet!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co399e.jpg'),(8075,'High School Private Tutor','2023-12-20','Visual Novel','Android','You’re a gifted college student carefully balancing your studies with a part-time tutoring gig until an offer lands in your lap that just might be too good to be true. When your seemingly shy high school tutee falls head over heels for you during the very first lesson together, you’re suddenly thrust into a situation where your head is at war with your heart and your future may just be on the line if word of it ever gets out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k0h.jpg'),(8076,'Insurgency: Sandstorm - Woodburn Weapon Skin Set','2023-10-24','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bring a touch of timeless elegance to your arsenal and embrace the charm of classic wood weapons with the Woodburn Weapon Skin Set for Insurgents. This skin can be applied to six different weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7czy.jpg'),(8077,'Barcode Battler: Cha-Han','1991-12-31','Simulator','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mct.jpg'),(8078,'Atari Flashback Classics Vol. 1','2016-11-04','Simulator, Strategy, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Relive the golden age of video games on the latest generation consoles. Each volume of Atari Flashback Classics brings 50 iconic Atari games, complete with multiplayer, global leaderboards, and much more. From arcade legends to 2600 classics, this massive library includes some of the most popular Atari titles ever released, including Asteroids, Centipede, Missile Command, and many more. Intuitive interface design delivers the responsive feel of the originals on modern controllers. All new achievements, leaderboards and social features, combined with an amazing archive of classic artwork make Atari Flashback Classics the ultimate Atari collection!\n\nGame list;\n1. 3-D Tic-Tac-Toe (2600)\n2. Air-Sea Battle (2600)\n3. Backgammon (2600)\n4. Basketball (2600)\n5. Black Widow (Arcade)\n6. Blackjack (2600)\n7. Bowling (2600)\n8. Canyon Bomber (2600)\n9. Centipede (2600)\n10. Centipede (Arcade)\n11. Circus Atari (2600)\n12. Combat (2600)\n13. Combat 2 (2600)\n14. Desert Falcon (2600)\n15. Dodge ‘Em (2600)\n16. Fatal Run (2600)\n17. Football (2600)\n18. Home Run (2600)\n19. Human Cannonball (2600)\n20. Liberator (Arcade)\n21. Lunar Lander (Arcade)\n22. Millipede (2600)\n23. Millipede (Arcade)\n24. Miniature Golf (2600)\n25. Pong (Arcade)\n26. Quadrun (2600)\n27. Radar Lock (2600)\n28. Realsports Boxing (2600)\n29. Realsports Football (2600)\n30. Realsports Soccer (2600)\n31. Realsports Volleyball (2600)\n32. Save Mary (2600)\n33. Slot Machine (2600)\n34. Slot Racers (2600)\n35. Space Duel (Arcade)\n36. Sprint Master (2600)\n37. Star Raiders (2600)\n38. Steeplechase (2600)\n39. Stunt Cycle (2600)\n40. Super Baseball (2600)\n41. Super Football (2600)\n42. Swordquest: Earthworld (2600)\n43. Swordquest: Fireworld (2600)\n44. Swordquest: Waterworld (2600)\n45. Tempest (2600)\n46. Tempest (Arcade)\n47. Video Olympics (2600)\n48. Warlords (2600)\n49. Warlords (Arcade)\n50. Yars’ Revenge (2600)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5byn.jpg'),(8079,'Puzzles By Axis Hyper','2018-09-16','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Complete the puzzle with the correct colors following clues scattered across the board. No guesses or blind choices. Use only logic and strategy to complete hundreds of exciting, fun and challenging puzzles.\n\nBased on the \"Y\" mode from \"Puzzles By Axis\", now with new rules and features.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8080,'Unsweet',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unsweet is a cinematic and colorful platformer that will give you endless fun, catchy gameplay and a touching story about the hero\'s grand and tragic journey through the world of ice cream, chocolate, rainbow and alive sweets','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ow3.jpg'),(8081,'Koumajou Remilia Ⅱ: Stranger\'s Requiem','2023-12-14','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The sequel to Koumajou Densetsu: Scarlet Symphony. A Touhou game with Castlevania-esque elements, featuring a new main chracter, new game mechanics and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l3h.jpg'),(8082,'Forgekeepers',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As a Forgekeeper, upgrade your weapons, unlock powerful abilities, and battle relentless waves of alien invaders. Defend key locations, and help other comrades in this fast-paced roguelike action game. Adapt, strategize, and survive—can you withstand the onslaught?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9flb.jpg'),(8083,'Live together Now','2023-11-23','Simulator, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Live togeter Now is mobile dating sim game.\n\nWhen I opened my eyes, I suddenly had a girlfriend.\nAnd the beginning of cohabitation.\n\nThe player becomes \"Yujin\", an ordinary college student and a protagonist who has never had a relationship before.\nAs the boyfriend of the lovely girlfriend \"Serin\", he works hard and proceeds with the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fxv.jpg'),(8084,'RoboWarrior','1989-09-27','Shooter, Adventure','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System, MSX','Robowarrior takes place on an alien planet called Altile. The player operates a cyborg named ZED (Z-type Earth Defence). In the game, ZED raids Altile to fight the Xantho empire and destroy its leader, Xur. ZED deploys bombs to clear a path through rocks, walls, and forests, while killing enemies and collecting items.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3026.jpg'),(8085,'Tenchu Z','2007-06-21','Strategy, Adventure','Xbox 360','Tenchu Z is an action-adventure stealth video game.\nIt is different from previous games in the series in that the player creates their own ninja characters, then builds up their skills as they play through the game rather than choosing from a small selection of pre-made characters, as they take orders from the series\' previous main male character, Rikimaru.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ivp.jpg'),(8086,'Magicolors','2020-04-16','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','You are a Wizard, who to perfect himself in the art of magic, begins a challenging journey. Using the power of your staff and the ability to solve puzzles, you will acquire the energy of rare crystals and unlock powerful spells. Are you ready to this journey?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1q47.jpg'),(8087,'Rin: The Last Child',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A dark fairytale Metroidvania with a unique spellcrafting system. Experience the story of Rin as she was thrown into the vortex of the Teller\'s world and help her discover her destiny.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mh8.jpg'),(8088,'Memory Puzzle: Mystery Mermaids','2021-12-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Train your brain with this memory game, revealing sexy mermaids hidden under viking rune symbols which you have to match.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r1o.jpg'),(8089,'Pro Wrestling','1986-07-20','Sport, Arcade','Sega Master System/Mark III','Pro Wrestling is a professional wrestling video game released for the Sega Master System in 1986 by Sega. It centers around tag team wrestling, with four duos that players can select and guide to various championship titles around the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cpib8axeemftpw3tpaae.jpg'),(8090,'Rematch','2000-12-31','Sin género','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Like Aisle, this is a game that only lasts one move; you\'re expected to repeat that move many, many times. Unlike Aisle, though, this is a puzzle game--there\'s a problem you\'re trying to solve in that one move. It\'s a pretty complex problem, moreover, and the parser is accordingly expanded--in some syntaxes, up to five nouns, well beyond the norm. Not only is the puzzle difficult, but there are some red herrings that make the puzzle even harder--but it\'s also very satisfying when you finally do solve it. Both funny and grim--lots of amusing stuff around the edges, but the puzzle itself isn\'t particularly funny. A few nudges are included in the game, but no explicit spoilers.\n\nInteractive Fiction written by Andrew D. Pontious.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79os.jpg'),(8091,'Farmer and Zombie',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','This is a free independent game where you can have a thrilling experience of shooting and fighting endless enemies.Upgrade, become stronger, and defeat more waves of enemies.Fight for higher achievements！','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qn5.jpg'),(8092,'SOS','1994-06-30','Platform, Adventure','Satellaview, Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','In this game, the player controls one of several different playable characters onboard a passenger liner in the early 20th century when it hits a storm and capsizes. The player character must navigate the shifting ship\'s destroyed corridors and rescue and lead to safety as many passengers as possible, all while the ship gradually fills with water.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wf3.jpg'),(8093,'CubeZ','2014-11-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','CubeZ is an action game with destroy the brain to kill mechanics, fully destructible characters, and a high level of customization that gives you the freedom to play with your own style. From tanked out battle axe warriors to SMG ninja assassins, everyone gets to play how they want.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cjsrxqblygk1lqo4gayj.jpg'),(8094,'Gensei Suikoden Plus','2023-11-30','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A remake of Gensei Suikoden for NIntendo Switch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zw1.jpg'),(8095,'The Soldier and the Golden Princess','2024-11-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Princess Knight Lucrezia is known for her exceptional swordsmanship and striking beauty, but when whispers about a secret relationship with the much-maligned General Abol start sweeping through the ranks, it falls to you, a lone soldier, to uncover the truth!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dx4.jpg'),(8096,'Puzzle Adventures: Sea Animals','2025-01-13','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Easy to use puzzles for toddlers and kids. Featuring funny and cute animal motifs with 30 unique puzzles. 100% frustration free and child-safe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9boc.jpg'),(8097,'Exist',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8098,'Zamba y San Martín',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Argentinian game/app','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8099,'Roller','2018-05-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Let the colors hypnotize you in this fun filled ball roller game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8100,'Find X','2024-05-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"FindX is an all-age suitable first-person casual shooting game, where players need to find differences in two time-frozen and similar worlds, and use a variety of quirky weapons to address these discrepancies.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8k9z.jpg'),(8101,'The Final Battle','2019-09-11','Point-and-click, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Isometric point and click adventure game. The sequel to Legend of the Sword.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43s4.jpg'),(8102,'Trackday Manager','2016-03-31','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ready for something new? Trackday Manager introduces a new category of skill based race car management in a multiplayer online environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cf7izaoklgjknrt2vzll.jpg'),(8103,'Satomi Hakkenden Murasamemaru no Ki','2015-01-22','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Satomi Hakkenden Murasamemaru no Ki was released in 2015 for the PSP.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5flq.jpg'),(8104,'The Stare','2025-12-31','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into a nightmare where every level hides a deadly secret. Trapped in a twisted maze of endless corridors and eerie rooms, every door you open could be your last, and every step could lead you deeper into danger. Can you stay calm, solve the mysteries, and find a way out?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ffl.jpg'),(8105,'Pixel P.I.','2025-03-01','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pixel P.I. is a detective game that allows you to ask questions by typing in order to unlock answers from witnesses or suspects.\n\nIt follows Pixel, a hacker detective who lost her recent memories and is going over past police cases trying to find any clue about her missing past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jgj.jpg'),(8106,'Battimals','2024-07-27','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Battimals: Combine animal DNA and battle foes in fast-paced matches. Hilarious, strategic fun in quick play sessions. Create your ultimate team!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fww.jpg'),(8107,'Rewriter',NULL,'Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rewriter is a grid-based roguelite.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8108,'Insurgency: Sandstorm - Mountain Nomad Gear Set','2023-10-24','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Combine the rugged resilience of nomadic attire and the tactical prowess of combat gear with the Mountain Nomad Gear Set for Insurgents. This set includes five different cosmetic gear pieces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7afh.jpg'),(8109,'Ocean Driving: Boat Parking Simulator','2025-01-23','Racing, Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Realistic watercraft boat parking simulator - test your ship mooring skills in dangerous conditions!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aj0.jpg'),(8110,'Rogue Robots','2020-06-11','Fighting, Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A roguelite twin-stick shooter. Your mission is to defeat the cops gone mad in this action-packed game. Beware, their mission is to destroy humanity. The fate of the whole mankind is in your hands. Are you brave enough to take on the mission?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cd2.jpg'),(8111,'Star Wars: Prequel Pack','2025-01-23','Racing, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','The STAR WARS: Prequel Pack offers four action-packed STAR WARS games for one low price!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bp1.jpg'),(8112,'Drake Hollow','2020-10-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Welcome to The Hollow, a blighted and dying place, and home to the Drakes.\n\nDrakes are the friendly vegetable folk native to these parts, and they need your help. They’re hungry, thirsty, and need a place to sleep. They can - quite literally - die of boredom. It’s on you to save them. Build gardens to provide them with food, wells for water, and yoga balls and puppet shows to keep them entertained. You can even craft treadmills and solar panels to generate power for Tesla coils, electric fences, and other fortifications.\n\nYou’ll need robust defenses, as you’ll quickly see that The Drakes aren’t the only residents of The Hollow. The Feral have overrun the land, evil creatures that are looking to shred anything happy or good. Battle them one-on-one with a wide array of weapons ranging from tennis rackets to nail guns, bring your friends to lend a hand, and build your defenses so you can take them out without lifting a finger.\n\nTravel from region to region, season to season, taking the Drakes and their village with you. Each region is over a square mile of territory to explore, dynamically generated and populated with each passing season.\n\nYou must balance your time carefully. What supplies are most crucial at any given moment? What does your village need? Metal from the supply caches to build your defenses, or crystals from the blighted regions to grow your Drakes? Prove that you’ve got what it takes to help the Drakes and take back The Hollow.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xs8.jpg'),(8113,'Wanting Wings','2023-12-15','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','At Seiyou Girls\' academy, there are rumors of an angel. Roommates Hina, Rin, and Fumi all have completely different personalities, but they all experienced 1 strange event: They all once saw an angel in their youth. They gradually begin to suspect that one of their roommates might be that angel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8f8e.jpg'),(8114,'Good Kill!','2024-11-11','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Good Kill is an immersive FPS game where players take control of a door gunner in a military helicopter during the Vietnam War. Engage in intense combat across destructible environments, complete missions, and upgrade your helicopter and weapons to dominate the battlefield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qqh.jpg'),(8115,'Wildemist Isle','2021-09-10','Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wildemist Isle, a 3D Open World Adventure Card Game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m3s.jpg'),(8116,'Outlaw Heart',NULL,'Shooter, Music, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Outlaw Heart is a Fast Paced Character Action/Rail Shooter that is playable on Flatscreen or VR!\n\nHelp Remy and her band shred their way through the city they love!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co629w.jpg'),(8117,'Volta-X','2020-08-12','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Volta-X blends real-time decision-making and strategy into action-packed 1v1 battles. Customize and operate your own giant robots, called Voltas, and manage a diverse crew of pilots as they build up their base from scratch. Unlock and upgrade new weapons as you climb the ranks, and explore nearly endless customization combinations to improve your roster of Voltas. Players will also be able to dive into Volta-X’s thrilling single-player campaign. As the story unfolds, the pilots will have to work together to prove themselves as the best of the best, while discovering dramatic secrets about each other, and the global threats lurking in the shadows of the WVA’s past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wo4.jpg'),(8118,'Shipping Nightmares',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A co-op horror game where you and your crew must keep a cursed cargo ship running, scavenge for supplies, and survive relentless horrors lurking in the shadows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ixw.jpg'),(8119,'Cats Visiting Christmas Town','2024-12-19','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Embark on a Christmas quest to uncover hidden cats in charming holiday scenes filled with snowmen, festive shops, and a grand tree adorned with gifts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co969n.jpg'),(8120,'Poly Memory: Cats','2021-12-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cute, relaxing, polygonal memory game with cats.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kxo.jpg'),(8121,'Dogs and Pigs','2022-01-22','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','“Dogs and pigs” is a word that immediately shows how Korean game companies treat their customers. You decide to hack into the computer of the famous gaming company NNN for revenge. You decide to go directly to the company and plug in the USB containing the virus for the most reliable hacking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gyd.jpg'),(8122,'Exorcise Demons','2019-09-18','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Trapped in a mysterious place, you must perform rituals to defeat powerful demons.\nThe Book of Rituals is your only way of knowing how to achieve them.\n\nBut there is a catch: only one player can see the screen, and the other is the only one who can read the book! In this game, communication is essential, never stop sharing information!\n\nDiscover through the story a new type of game based on your ability to communicate. Exorcise The Demons is a unique experience and an immersive game that will test your friendship!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pqu.jpg'),(8123,'Shadow Complex','2009-08-19','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','Shadow Complex is presented in 2.5D format; the game world is fully three-dimensional, but the player can only move in two dimensions, simulating the environment of a classic side-scrolling video game. Enemies can, however, move in any direction, and auto-aim is utilized to allow the player to fire at nearby enemies or objects both inside and outside of the 2D plane. The player can use the right control stick to aim with a laser sight. Gameplay in Shadow Complex was inspired by Super Metroid and Castlevania: Symphony of the Night. The gameplay takes many cues from Metroid: the player can move freely throughout the expansive game world, defeating enemies with a variety of weapons, and as they overcome challenges, they gain new abilities and weapons which allow them to reach new areas.\nThe game rewards the player with experience points as they complete objectives and defeat enemies. The player can gain experience levels, each level boosting basic attributes of the character. These experience levels grant the player skills such as improved gunfire precision or damage resistance. Special rewards such as revealing the full map and unlimited special ammo are granted at specific levels. When the player starts a new game, they will lose all the weapons and items that they have acquired, but will keep the character\'s experience level and any benefits they have already received from that experience.\nIn addition to the main campaign, a number of challenge levels, called \"Proving Grounds\", are available, generally requiring the player to make it to the exit of a room using a limited set of items and health. Players are ranked based on time of completion and any scoring objectives when they complete the level. Scores and other statistics from the main campaign and the training group are tracked via online leaderboards.\nA remastered version and port was announced during the 215 Game Awards, to be released for PS4, Xbox One, PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2421.jpg'),(8124,'Let\'s Aim! Ring Toss','2025-01-16','Puzzle, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Gear up for a carnival game classic: ring toss!\nWin as many prizes as you can and become a ring toss master!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aix.jpg'),(8125,'LumineNight','2024-11-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\'LumineNight\' is a mystery adventure game set in the city of Summerset, USA, in the 1950s. It involves detective Kelvin Foster and his only daughter, self-proclaimed detective Selen Foster, unraveling the secrets of a series of unresolved murders over a decade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93s4.jpg'),(8126,'Bat Boy','2023-05-25','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A Sentai sports hero 8-bit action adventure!\n\nBat Boy and his fellow sports-star friends secretly battle against the evil invading forces of Lord Vicious, hell-bent on hosting sinister athletic events for his own amusement!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j6w.jpg'),(8127,'Diablo IV: Loot Reborn','2024-05-14','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Become the hero of your choosing. With a newly improved itemization system, the power is in your hands to craft the weapons of your dreams. Temper your gear with a new crafting system to face down hordes of enemies in the updated Helltides. Achieve the pinnacle of your build through Masterworking and try your hand at the daunting challenge of the Pit.\n\nThe armies of Hell are expanding their reach across the world of Sanctuary. New threat system, enemies, Blood Maiden boss, and events. Join the Iron Wolves in this seasons’ activities and fight to beat back the tides of Hell, earning you Reputation and rewards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85nd.jpg'),(8128,'Cookie Crisp City',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8129,'Strategic Command WWII: War in the Pacific','2024-07-18','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fury Software completes its trilogy of WWII games with Strategic Command - WWII: War in the Pacific, enabling you to re-fight the great land and naval campaigns of this amazing theater. Are you ready to avenge the Day of Infamy?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8axb.jpg'),(8130,'Gene Rain Ultimate & Your Toy Bundle','2020-11-06','Sin género','Xbox One','Two great games in one pack!\nGene Rain Wind Tower: Ultimate Edition: control a human resistance army in game, fighting to end the conficts afflicting the whole world. The Ultimate Edition includes the 4K UHD reworked Gene Rain base game, Sky City Rebirth DLC, and Way to Heaven DLC.\n\nYour Toy: Do you rememver your childhood toy? Where are they? They were your friend, ever, but can you imagine how they will be your nightmare for now? A popular 3D first person puzzle adventure game is now on sale!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87zn.jpg'),(8131,'Nie no Hakoniwa: Dollhouse of Offerings','2024-02-17','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Let us celebrate, the birth of this nightmare.\" A story about an urban legend surrounding a certain \"Box\", this is a Japanese-style, supernatural visual novel about madness, love and hate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7uox.jpg'),(8132,'Chained Heroes','2025-02-03','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Can you reach the top, or will the water pull you down?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91ws.jpg'),(8133,'The Lord of the Rings Online: Mordor','2017-08-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Lord of the Rings Online: Mordor expansion will immerse you in the legendary land beyond the Black Gate. Every legend has a journey but not all legends are truly tested. Prove your legend!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hkb.jpg'),(8134,'The Schism',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','The Schism is an online co-op horror game. There has been a paranormal split, colliding realities and causing all manner of dangerous lifeforms to scatter across the globe. With the world in chaos, it seems like it\'s down to you and your team of scientists to get to the bottom of it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7w6n.jpg'),(8135,'MoBu - Adventure Begins',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Meet MoBu, the laziest ape in the jungle, who has the appetite of 5 elephants. One day MoBu meets a whimsical voodoo magician MaGu, who lends MoBu a supernatural power that allows him to infinitely extend his arms. However, if MoBu wants to satisfy his hunger now, he has to eat bananas... A lot of bananas.\nMoBu is an action-packed simple platformer game with fun mechanics designed for mobile devices. Instead of running or flying, MoBu swings his arms to victory against his hunger.\nManeuver through uniquely designed environments like vile jungles and toxic dumps. The innovative game mechanics, combined with beautiful and humorous art style, will give you a memorable and funny game experience.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8136,'Blackjack Bailey VR','2017-04-27','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Blackjack Bailey VR is a casual casino blackjack game you play in Virtual Reality against a cute and charismatic dealer that goes by the name of Bailey. It\'s simulated gambling so there are no real money transactions, it\'s just for fun and practice!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29y0.jpg'),(8137,'A Plague Tale Bundle','2022-12-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A Plague Tale Bundle includes the entirety of Amicia and Hugo’s heartrending journey through history\'s darkest hours with the two acclaimed games A Plague Tale: Innocence and its sequel A Plague Tale: Requiem.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co604y.jpg'),(8138,'Bubble Battle','2025-04-25','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bubble Battle is a retro online/local multiplayer fighting game inspired by arcade classics. Players fly around with one simple objective: burst opponents’ bubbles before they burst yours. Collect powerups and out-maneuver opponents for fast-paced, addictive fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h8u.jpg'),(8139,'Korean Drone Flying Tour Chuncheon City','2024-12-26','Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','A simulation game where you directly operate a drone based on actual drone flight footage!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ais.jpg'),(8140,'Pom-Bar: Weltenbauer',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cyb.jpg'),(8141,'Duck Season','2017-09-14','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Oculus Rift','The game of your dreams just dropped, DUCK SEASON, a hunter with ridiculous graphics. Luckily, it\'s summer vacation and Mom just surprised you with a one day rental of it! Unfortunately, as you binge play it becomes apparent that all is not right with Duck Season...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1o4n.jpg'),(8142,'Traversion','2023-11-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Introducing Traversion, a movement-based arcade platformer with a focus on rocket jumping, strafing, and grappling to navigate levels as efficiently as possible. Enjoy a minimalist, skill-based experience where the primary goal is to achieve faster completion times and hone your senses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7b0g.jpg'),(8143,'Frogger In Toy Town','2019-09-19','Platform, Arcade','iOS, Mac','Toppling blocks, falling books...\nThings that seem unimportant to humans can pose great danger in the frog world...\n\nFrogger is back! The classic frog-action game returns on Apple Arcade with an all-new look and the same simple gameplay. Guide the iconic amphibian forward as you evade the numerous obstacles in your path!\n\n- Simple tap and swipe controls!\n- Playable in both landscape and portrait screen modes!\n- Over 400 pieces of furniture and other items ensure that stages are never dull!\n- Customize Frogger with over 20 different costumes!\n- Various missions give stages added replay value!\n- Play together with friends in the co-op mode!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o2r.jpg'),(8144,'Spookity Hollow','2021-09-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Spookity Hollow is a ghastly third-person sandbox game created for young children (Ages 4+) which encourages curiosity and role-play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nwt.jpg'),(8145,'I, Robot','2025-04-17','Shooter, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation VR2, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Jeff Minter is back with another unique take on a 1980s Atari arcade game: I, Robot. Reimagined in Minter’s signature assault of colors, shapes and sounds, this new take on the eclectic arcade title is built from the ground up with new challenges, new twists, and a whole lot of llamas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jkj.jpg'),(8146,'Initia: Elemental Arena','2016-04-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Initia: Elemental Arena is a new take on online arena shooters. It blends frantic team-based game play of first person Arena shooters like Unreal Tournament & the FPS Magic mechanics of Skyrim. It combines it all with strategic objectives and tactical team play.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8147,'The Mystery Room','2017-12-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is a game where you solve the puzzle problem and escape the room. \nWhen you start the game, you will be able to solve the puzzle problem and ask for reasoning ability. \n \nThe protagonist entered the house to experience horror and was trapped in the room. \nEvery time you escape from a locked room, the story is revealed a little bit. \nPlay the game and find out what secrets are in the house where the protagonist is trapped. \n \nUnlock all secrets in 8 rooms and escape. \nTense music and a mysterious background await you. \nPuzzles of various difficulty await you. \nThere are two endings to play. \n \nPlease be sure to escape the room!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xlndi9ewp0zavwwewzqb.jpg'),(8148,'Tiny Troopers: Global Ops - Digital Deluxe Bundle',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','The Tiny Troopers: Global Ops Digital Deluxe Edition Includes:\n\n- Tiny Troopers: Global Ops\n- Tiny Troopers: Joint Ops\n- The ‘Tiny Tales’ Comic Book\n- The Tiny Troopers: Global Ops Original Soundtrack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6am1.jpg'),(8149,'I am an Air Traffic Controller: Airport Hero - Centrair 20th Anniversary','2024-12-11','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Centrair 20th Anniversary! Tackle the toughest aviation puzzles with the special \'I am an Air Traffic Controller Airport Hero\' game, in collaboration with Centrair!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93fg.jpg'),(8150,'Notch - The Innocent LunA Collection',NULL,'Adventure, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66h6.jpg'),(8151,'Zen Pinball Party','2021-09-03','Pinball','iOS, Mac','Zen Pinball Party delivers the ultimate pinball experience with carefully crafted tables that are inspired by some of the biggest brands from DreamWorks Animation and Hasbro, as well as popular pinball classic themes. Players will challenge their friends and family for the highest score on fun and unique tables.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k52.jpg'),(8152,'Cannon Foundry Simulator',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','You set up a cannon foundry. You have to go through the entire process of creating an old cannon from the very beginning. Build your workshop and start production. You start with the most primitive medieval guns. But you\'re still developing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5end.jpg'),(8153,'Sugoi Girls: Tribal Crush','2025-01-16','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Meet over 50 pretty anime girls in this relaxing puzzle game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aq2.jpg'),(8154,'Deleveled','2020-09-10','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Deleveled is a physics-based puzzle-platformer in which you simultaneously control two characters who fall in opposite directions. You must help them work together to get through dozens of tricky levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g6b.jpg'),(8155,'Yu-Gi-Oh! GX Tag Force','2006-09-14','Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','PlayStation Portable','Yu-Gi-Oh! GX Tag Force, known in Japan as Yu-Gi-Oh! Duel Monsters GX Tag Force is a video game based on the Yu-Gi-Oh! GX anime series. It is the Yu-Gi-Oh! series\' debut on the PlayStation Portable system and the first game in the Tag Force series.\n\nThe player enrolls at Duel Academy as a transfer student. The main focus of the game is a Tag Force tournament that will take place on the island. Players must find a partner to compete in the tournament alongside. The game includes characters from the anime, as well as characters exclusive to the video games. Three promotional cards come packed with the game - \"Phantom Beast Cross-Wing\", \"Phantom Beast Thunder-Pegasus\" and \"Phantom Beast Wild-Horn\".\n\nThe game was eventually ported to the PlayStation 2 under the name Yu-Gi-Oh! GX Tag Force Evolution. This game includes connectivity with the original game\'s sequel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zw0.jpg'),(8156,'Hitman 3: Mendoza','2023-01-20','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As one of the most well-known wine regions in South America, Mendoza is the perfect place to take in the beautiful sights and acquired tastes of Argentina. From the sloping hills to the modern vineyards, there’s plenty of opportunity to explore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97al.jpg'),(8157,'Dead End Job','2019-12-12','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dead End Job merges the frantic, addictive, highly replayable gameplay of a procedurally generated twin-stick shooter with the iconic look of a 90s cartoon.\n\nYou take on the role of a worker at Ghoul-B-Gone – the #1 experts in paranormal pest control. Ghosts are captured using a tug-of-war mechanic and every ghost you catch, citizen rescued, and job completed is added to the client’s bill.\n\nEvery week in-game you’re competing against the company golden boy to be named “Employee of the Week\" based on the amount of money you earned the company.\n\nHave you got what it takes to be the best at putting pests to rest?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z2n.jpg'),(8158,'Viola: The Heroine\'s Melody','2021-02-17','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Viola: The Heroine\'s Melody is the musical Platformer/RPG! After failing at violin practice for the hundredth time, Viola becomes trapped inside her instrument\'s fantastical world. Join her adventure to find her way back home, aided by the diverse ensemble of friends she meets along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tgn.jpg'),(8159,'Syberia 3','2018-10-18','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Syberia 3 takes you inside an enchanting, mysterious universe full of life for you to explore in 3D. Plunged into the heart of a world inhabited by a cast of interesting characters, you\'ll discover and experience a fabulous tale as imagined by Benoit Sokal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24va.jpg'),(8160,'Monoquous 2','2024-12-20','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A challenging puzzle platformer in which you can phase through walls to invert the world around you, taking the direction of gravity with it - up becomes down, black becomes white, and deadly obstacles lose and gain their threat along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96jf.jpg'),(8161,'Crime Secrets: Crimson Lily','2016-07-14','Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Stop the mysterious killer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21nf.jpg'),(8162,'Farewell North','2024-08-16','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Restore color to the desolate islands of Farewell North, an open world journey where you play as a collie traveling with his owner. Explore land and sea, uncover hidden paths, evade monsters, and free wildlife to bring color back to the world while revealing an emotional story about saying farewell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8n7i.jpg'),(8163,'Hotel Giant Bundle',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k07.jpg'),(8164,'Escape The Ayuwoki Horror Fort','2019-04-12','Simulator, Adventure','Android, iOS','The long-awaited release of the escape the Ayuwoki for mobile devices!\n\nEach time you hear Ayuwoki Hee Hee run and hide from Ayuwoki!\n\nSay hello to your new neighbor the Ayuwoki and escape this jacksons mansion. Each time you hear ayuwoki hee hee, run and hide as your new neighbor eni ayuwoki, who keeps you in jacksons fort prison, is running to get rid of you. Do your best to escape the jacksons fort prison to forget the horror of the ayuwoki. Run as fast as you can, hide under every available piece of furniture, and do everything to escape from the eni ayuwoki. When you hear ayuwoki hee hee, you better hurry as your new neighbor is incoming. Escape jacksons manor in our new horror escapade simulator: Escape The Ayuwoki Horror Fort. Escape the ayuwoki and jacksons fort prison to forget the horror of ayuwoki hee hee.\n\nIn this horror escapade simulator, your objective is to escape the jacksons mansion. To complete such a task, you should be very careful because your new neighbor The Ayuwoki can hear you, so be very careful when you run, jump or open the doors of the jacksons manor. Actually, any noise could attract eni ayuwoki, if The Ayuwoki is close enough to hear it. If you are hidden, but your flashlight is turned on, eni Ayuwoki will still be able to catch you, so to truly be hidden, turn off the flashlight while you are hiding inside, under or behind some piece of furniture in the jacksons mansion.\n\nFirst, you have to find the main gate key in the jacksons prisons fort. The key could be anywhere in the manor. Also, you can hide behind objects, inside some furniture or under the tables. Once you obtain the key, just go for the main gate of the jacksons fort prison to unlock it and escape the mansion. Sounds simple, right? The key icon will appear on the screen, once you collected the key. Other state icons will tell you what you are doing, if staying idle, walking, running, etc. Put close attention when the icon turns into an eye with a crossed line. It means you are hidden and The Ayuwoki will not be able to catch you. Do your best and escape the jacksons mansion in our horror escapade simulator. Once you escape the fort prison, you will be able to forget the ayuwoki hee hee for a long time.\n\nEscape The Ayuwoki Horror Fort is a free to play horror escapade simulator in which you will have to escape the jacksons mansion of the eni ayuwoki. Do your best and Escape the Ayuwoki in this horror escapade and escape the manor. Remember, you can guess where eni ayuwoki is when you hear the ayuwoki hee hee. Just find the key and escape the jacksons mansion and your neighbor The Ayuwoki. Download our new horror escapade simulator and Escape the Ayuwoki now. Your new neighbor The Ayuwoki is waiting for you in his fort prison.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69r5.jpg'),(8165,'Astroswarm','2024-04-29','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fight for your life against the incoming swarm of zombified astronauts in ASTROSWARM! Use a variety of weapons, turrets, and power-ups to survive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wc3.jpg'),(8166,'Ball Platformer','2018-03-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Get ready to jump into a fun adventure with Ball Platformer!\n\nStart the game with four different worlds to choose from: Forest, Desert, Canyon, and Island. Explore each of the world\'s levels to get familiar with how to beat them. Each world offers different terrain and obstacles. As you explore each world, you will encounter different abilities that will help you clear the levels; finish exploring the world to claim the ability for good. Then, take on the challenge to see if you can clear the world from start to finish with a limited number of lives. Once you beat all four of the challenges, you will unlock the final world and the final challenge, Space, which will test your platforming skills. Think you can beat the final frontier?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8167,'Shin Megami Tensei: Nocturne Randomizer',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','This is a randomizer for Shin Megami Tensei: Nocturne. \n \nThe randomization includes: boss shuffle, enemy/demon shuffle, skill randomization, Magatama and key item drops by bosses, and race randomizer for fusion logic.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8168,'The Crypto Prophecies','2021-11-01','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical','Web browser','A MAGICAL SHOWDOWN\n\nEnter the Crypto Kingdom of Opulentos and put your crypto prophecy to the test. Go head-to-head with other players in this zero-sum price prediction game. Place your wager and cast your magic against your opponent as you foresee the crypto futures to make your profits.\n\nUse NFT Crypto Prophets to battle against other players. Predict where the candles will move next. In 10 fast paced rounds use your Crypto Prophet to predict how each 10 second candle will close to beat your opponent. The player with the most points will take all the winnings.\n\nAlso benefit from many game features where players are rewarded with daily & weekly league table prizes and prize draws by playing to earn entry tickets and climbing leaderboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b3f.jpg'),(8169,'Who Must Die','2018-11-13','Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are replacing a doctor, charged to find who, among the three patients, is the one that is contaminated. To do this, you can use a whole range of experiments to be performed on the sick. You can also ask the guard to do the dirty work for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xuv.jpg'),(8170,'Digital Eclipse Bundle',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74c3.jpg'),(8171,'Escape Room Killer: Moon, flowers and the Creepy Ghost','2024-12-05','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Wake up in an abandoned sanatorium with a single mission: escape before time runs out. A killer resides in your mind, provoking you and playing with your sanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ajk.jpg'),(8172,'199X','2015-03-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In 199X, you control Clara. That\'s the problem.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a1n.jpg'),(8173,'Solitaire Klondike Pro.',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8174,'Absolute Acey Deucey',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8175,'Toro and Friends: Onsen Town','2020-07-09','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Toro and Friends: Onsen Town is a Match-3 Puzzle mobile game Developed by BeXide and published by Forward Works for Android and iOS. It was first released in 2019 in Japan for the Doko Demo Issyo series 20th anniversary, then later released worldwide in English, Chinese, and Korean in 2020 which was published by PiG Corporation. The game\'s service ran until 2021. After the closure of the Japanese servers, an offline mode was added to the game and all story episodes were made available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4q7y.jpg'),(8176,'Power For Young Inventors',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8177,'Digimon New Century','2021-10-21','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qxm.jpg'),(8178,'Restaurant Tycoon: My Cooking Empire','2024-12-25','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Master the Kitchen and Build Your Empire!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95uy.jpg'),(8179,'Ramiel','2021-08-06','Visual Novel','Web browser','Ramiel is a short game about wings, hope, and living in a body that is very clearly not your own.\n\nIt\'s a game for the angels in our lives who just can\'t bear living without their wings any longer.\n\nOne day, we will all find our wings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3iys.jpg'),(8180,'The Crew: Motorfest - Deluxe Edition','2023-11-09','Racing','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','With the Deluxe Edition, get access to the base game and the Fitted Ultimate Pack, including:\n- Porsche 718 Spyder 2021 Fitted Edition.\n- Honda Civic Type R 2021 Fitted Edition.\n- Customization items.\n\nWelcome to Motorfest, the ultimate driving experience! Explore the vibrant open world of O‘ahu in Hawaii as you compete in intense races, themed events, and much more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cf4.jpg'),(8181,'Skullgirls Encore: Big Band','2015-09-29','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Big Band is the second of 5 additional characters to be added to Skullgirls Encore. Once a cop known as Ben Birdland, he fell flat when he got on the wrong side of New Meridian\'s corrupt police force. Birdland was broken and bent out of shape by his former colleagues, but was tuned up by Dr. Avian and ASG Lab 8. Now he is armed with a full ensemble of pneumatic weaponry, making him the full fortissimo instrument of justice: \"Big Band.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v60.jpg'),(8182,'The Mansion of The Macabre','2025-01-03','Fighting, Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Explore the Crowley Manor and unravel the secrets of the Occult. Inspired by the Works of HP Lovecraft and a love letter to classic 90’s survival horror games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ahy.jpg'),(8183,'Model Railway Easily Christmas','2020-01-27','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Model railway builder wit true 3D graphics. Place all the highly detailed objects on the snowy landscape and create exciting model railway layouts! Start your trains and enjoy the Christmas style decorated environment!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p2g.jpg'),(8184,'MySims SkyHeroes','2010-10-01','Simulator','PlayStation 3, Wii, Xbox 360, Nintendo DS','Take to the sky to lead the resistance against Morcubus and his drone army and to stop his plans to take over the skyways. MySims SkyHeroes is an all new adventure that brings the thrill and high speed action of flying to the creative, immersive world of MySims.\nGo from unknown pilot to celebrated hero as you defeat dangerous enemies in aerial dogfights, test your reflexes in fast-paced speed challenges, and take on massive enemy bosses that demand all your skill as a pilot to survive. As you progress, you build, customize and tune your aircraft to give you an edge in combat – upgrade your wings for swifter maneuvers, switch out your engine for a speed boost, or change the paint job to camouflage your plane and avoid enemy fire.\nFace Morcubus’ drones with an ally in split-screen cooperative gameplay, or take the game online to challenge your friends in fun, competitive 10-player high speed action.\nMorcubus and his drones must be stopped; will you rise to the challenge?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1u1l.jpg'),(8185,'Mythic Mire','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A surreal, dark fantasy world with turn-based RPG combat. Explore strange environments with your trusty digital Pixie companions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fir.jpg'),(8186,'Spirit Hunters Inc.',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8187,'Star Traders RPG',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Sin plataforma','This epic space pirate RPG offers a deep and challenging world and economy to Star Trading captains. You must navigate the waters of Quadrant politics and chose sides among the constantly conflicting Factions, or take the risk to stay independent. Enjoy endless replay value in this deep space civ and trading simulation which allows you to take any path you want as a captain. Act as a pirate against the merchants using the great shipping lanes, join the Solar War as a military captain, or hunt targets across the Quadrant as a fearsome bounty hunter!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8188,'Shattered Heaven','2023-05-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shattered Heaven is a single-player deck builder card game with RPG elements and an ambitious branching narrative, set in a dark fantasy world. The game focuses on a card game and roguelike gameplay fueled by a great replay value, thanks to procedural dungeons, a deep crafting system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5l3i.jpg'),(8189,'Super Mario Country','2014-07-24','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8190,'Andre Agassi Tennis','1994-03-31','Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Sega Game Gear, Sega Master System/Mark III, Super Famicom','A game endorsed by the American player who stunned the tennis world in the early 90s with his \"Image is everything\" looks, sporting long hair, earrings and colorful shirts, Andre Agassi Tennis includes eight players (male and female and as as expected, only Agassi is a real player) rated according to movement speed and both accuracy and strength on serve, backhand and forehand.\n\nGameplay features all the usual moves: smashes, passing shots, volleys and all kinds of backhand and forehand plays, but unlike other games, precise positioning and timing are crucial to avoid hitting the ball outside the court, swinging the racket into thin air or more embarrassing, let the ball hit you on the head.\nThree courts are available: Grass, Clay and Indoor (Sega versions add a fourth, Hard), but the differences between them are minimal. Game modes change according to the version, with the 16-bit versions including a \"Skins\" game, where each point is worth a sum of money based on the number of times the ball was hit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l16.jpg'),(8191,'Mega Man 9: Endless Attack Mode','2009-07-08','Platform','PlayStation 3, Wii, Xbox 360','Endless Attack Mode will be added to the Game Menu. Try to get as far as you can in a stage without end. (Distance measured in \"screens.\")\n\nMega Man must make his way through an \"endless\" version of Dr. Wily\'s fortress, facing difficult enemies, challenging rooms, and all eight of the Robot Masters. Players start out with no extra lives, parts or energy tanks, but have all of the special weapons. There are 42 levels of about 3 screens each, including boss areas, and the game randomly determines how these are generated.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vc0.jpg'),(8192,'Chairs','2024-05-17','Platform, Racing, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fast-paced action platformer doubling as the most realistic chair simulator money can buy! Have you ever wondered what your chair thinks? What it believes? What it desires? Learn the answers and destroy some dimensions along the way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ljt.jpg'),(8193,'Mystery Case Files: The Countess - Collector\'s Edition','2018-11-28','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Lady Eleanor Codington, prominent friend of the Queen herself, has disappeared while renovating her family’s legendary estate. Explore the crumbling grounds of world-famous children’s author Gloria Codington for clues. A towering black mirror may reveal a secret, but gazing into its depths may bring more than just a few years of bad luck. Can you find Eleanor and escape the manor alive? Find out in this heart-pounding hidden-object puzzle adventure game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zn8.jpg'),(8194,'81diver','2009-07-14','Strategy, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 2','In the world of Shogi (Japanese Chess), there are professional players who make their living at the game and gamblers who play Shogi for money. In Hachi-One Diver, gamers take the latter tack and play Shogi against an assortment of opponents who vary in their level of skill and attitude.\n\nBased on the manga by Shibata Yokusaru which was made into an 11-episode television series, Hachi-One Diver on the PS2 features a Story Mode where players take on the role of Sugata Kentarou who possesses a decidedly blank visage. Sugata was once a promising student at the Shogi Player Foundation but he faltered and failed at his dream. Nowadays, he has taken the role of a Shogi gambler who earns his keep by facing opponents in Shogi parlors and contests. But he is devastated when he is beaten completely by a young woman known as \"Ukeshi\" who takes any challenges and never loses. As Shogi means everything to him, he decides to train himself harder to become the strongest player.\n\nThe Story Mode of the game follows Sugata\'s trials as he plays Shogi against a steady parade of competitors. By beating certain opponents, Sugata faces new challengers based on his performance. Hachi-One Diver also features a Versus Mode, a 2-Player Mode, and a Shogi School Mode that teaches newbies the basics of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h7e.jpg'),(8195,'Flea!','2020-10-30','Platform, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Entertainment System, Dreamcast','Flea is a challenging platformer with an intriguing back story. Play as Henry the Hyperactive Flea who just can’t stop jumping! Navigate the beast and collect blood to get the the heart of the problems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hix.jpg'),(8196,'Borderlands 2: Tiny Tina\'s Assault on Dragon Keep','2013-06-25','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Tiny Tina\'s Assault on Dragon Keep is DLC for Borderlands 2.\n\nSorcerers, Wizards and Crumpets, oh my! Join vault hunters, old and new, in Tiny Tina epic quest of revenge and redemption. Tiny Tina’s Assault on Dragon Keep, the biggest and most inspired add-on content in Borderlands history, features a game within a game, as Tiny Tina takes on the role of Bunker Master in a game of “Bunkers & Badasses”. Travel through a dark and ever changing world of castles, dungeons and magic forests as you fight off skeletons, orcs, dragons and more. Explore side missions and answer riddles as you roll your insight stat to gain new and amazing loot. Join with friends to save the queen and restore peace and order to the world once more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27fo.jpg'),(8197,'Gonshit infarct',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','You are correct, but \"gOnshit infarct\" is a brand new romance simulation visual novel developed by AGC GAMES. The game takes place in a fantasy world called \"Tiamat,\" where chosen individuals are bestowed with the power of \"Free to play\" to guide the flow of memes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mmq.jpg'),(8198,'Jigoku Kisetsukan: Sense of the Seasons','2015-05-12','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jigoku Kisetsukan is a bullet hell shootergame with anime-style drawings and chip music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qgh.jpg'),(8199,'Foresight','2014-11-28','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Foresight is an epic space-based RTS game that throws you, the player, into the thick of the battle as a commander. Lead huge fleets, armed with fighters and bombers across wormholes to fight it out with your enemy. Launch bombing missions, fighter patrols, plant observation posts or fire support base with reconnaissance units. Intelligence is key.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vdv.jpg'),(8200,'The Beard in the Mirror','2016-10-25','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A point-and-click adventure filled with magic, danger, fantasy, and romance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t6b.jpg'),(8201,'The Vanished Soul','2025-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Vanished Soul is an indie, first-person, psychological horror game made by one person. It is set in 2016 in the fictional place called Novazenica. Dive into realistic and atmospheric setting, solve various puzzles and interact with many objects in the game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vf6.jpg'),(8202,'Myst','1996-11-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Windows Mobile, Philips CD-i, PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), 3DO Interactive Multiplayer, Mac, LaserActive, Amiga, Atari Jaguar CD, PlayStation Vita, Sega Saturn, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','A mystical journey through worlds that changed the concept of an adventure game.\n\nLose yourself in fantastic virtual exploration, blurring the line between fantasy and reality, challenging your wits, instincts, and powers of observation like never before. The fantasy beckons... can you resist its call?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y96.jpg'),(8203,'Doom I Enhanced','2020-01-09','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53x0.jpg'),(8204,'Velvet Assassin','2009-04-28','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','Inspired by the fascinating story and unbreakable spirit of British secret agent Violette Szabo, players take control of Violette Summer, a beautiful World War II spy deep behind enemy lines with no support or official backing from the British Government. Intense stealth action game play with a startling real-time lighting system and surreal visuals combine to produce an incredible gaming experience. Through third person game play, sneak up on enemies and pull the pins from their belted grenades. Infiltrate a Gestapo prison and slip cyanide to your own men before the Germans make them talk. And slink through the shadows to finish off your unsuspecting enemies with a single, silent move. Through Violette\'s fever dreams, experience what she experienced. Walk where she walked. And kill those she killed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rt0.jpg'),(8205,'Adventure in the Dungeon','2024-07-12','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immerse yourself in the world of 2D action platformer, where you have to fight enemies and overcome obstacles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t09.jpg'),(8206,'Metal Gear Mario','2009-10-26','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8207,'King\'s Field','1994-12-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Prepare yourself for an epic action-adventure never before imaginable. Only now, with the gaming power made possible by the PlayStation is a world as vast and detailed as King\'s Field a reality. This first-person game is completely rendered in beautiful 3D polygon graphics, with texture mapping and fully controllable 360° viewing.\n\nImagine a universe where you can travel freely - being able to look up and down, climb ancient ruins, traverse across oceans, jump off ridges, and duel enemies - all in real time, non-linear play. This visual world will not only astound you, but will pull you right into its universe. You will embark on a journey to an island of evil-ridden dungeons, villages, and castles as you seek the Moonlight Sword, which had been stolen by a cult of insidious worshipers of evil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tgm.jpg'),(8208,'My Life: Pet Vet','2022-10-20','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Take care of sick and injured animals in your own small animal practice. Use various examination techniques, make the right diagnosis and give your little patients the right treatment - just like a real-life vet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mjq.jpg'),(8209,'Him & Her Collection','2022-06-22','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Him & Her Collection brings three games of the challenging puzzle-platformer series, Him & Her, Her Challenges and Him & Her 3. The player gets to control Him, a guy who got split apart from his partner in this ever changing scenario, through his journe…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7heb.jpg'),(8210,'Twilight Monk','2025-03-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Explore the shattered world of Speria as the last remnant of ancient Kung Fu warriors in Twilight Monk! Destroy demons, or enslave them as you hunt down and obliterate the portals from whence they came. In Twilight Monk, you will explore Metroidvania dungeons connected by an open world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nqc.jpg'),(8211,'Lonely Things',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Mystery horror, set in a remote hotel.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8212,'Summer Girlfriend: Natsu Kano','2025-01-16','Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Can the overly insensitive Yuichi find a girlfriend this summer!?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aq3.jpg'),(8213,'Puyo Puyo!! 20th Anniversary: Mini Version','2012-11-07','Puzzle','Nintendo 3DS','Puyo Puyo!! 20th Anniversary: Mini Version is a Puzzle game, developed and published by Sega, which was released in Japan in 2012.\n\nIn Mini Version, you only have the option to just play as a single one. You play through eight stages, with each culminating in a Puyo Puyo battle against another character. At the end of each stage, you receive a rank ranging from F to S.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6juq.jpg'),(8214,'Eugenics','2016-12-31','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome to \"Eugenics\" ! In this management-strategy game, you play the sorcerer\'s apprentice of genetics, in Utopia-1 colony. Decipher the genome and create your brave new world, for better or for worse… \"Eugenics\" works like Mastermind board game : first, you\'ll have to identify every gene and its effect. Then, you\'ll be able to modify and edit the genom. As a demiurge, you will however have to render account to the company that employs you. But you can decide if you want to make the world better place, make money, or even if you just want to follow the latest fashion ! Easy to learn but difficult to master...The game is highly replayable, and some endings have the same dark humor as Dr. Strangelove.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yzot7bcpbr7j4is4lvya.jpg'),(8215,'Regrowth','2021-04-19','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Turn barren islands into lush green paradises through puzzles, while the islands and your toolkit may change from level to level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j0j.jpg'),(8216,'Bible Trivia: Avatar Edition',NULL,'Quiz/Trivia','Sin plataforma','An Xbox Live indie game. It is a sequel to Bible Trivia now featuring avatars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cklffslsgwxfzuqvgdqr.jpg'),(8217,'Gun Store Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Take control of a gun store in Gun Store Simulator and manage every aspect of the arms trading business. Buy licenses, select products, hire staff, and ensure safety to grow your store and build a successful chain. Can you dominate the market?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96ph.jpg'),(8218,'Bubble Shooter World','2025-01-30','Shooter, Puzzle, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Aim for bubbles of the same color and enjoy the satisfying pops when you take multiple down in one go!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aqa.jpg'),(8219,'Monopoly','1993-12-31','Card & Board Game','Mac','Everything you love about Monopoly is now here for the Mac. Classic Monopoly is a mouse click away as you engage in the pursuit of great fortunes. With computer enhanced graphics and billions of different dice sequences it\'s never the same game twice. Wheel and deal against the supreme game challenger, your Mac. Or play with up to eight players, in this ultimate computer version of the best selling boardgame of all time. The thrill of buying and selling railroads and properties and collecting rent on Park Place awaits you. Pick a \"Chance\" card and advance to Boardwalk. Or throw doubles three times and \"Go directly to Jail\" You can play with the \"official\" Monopoly game rules, or customize them to fit the way you play at home. But as always, the richest player wins. And both color and black and white versions of the program are included - making it perfect for your desktop Powerbook Macintosh. This is a must for the library of any Mac gamer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ubx.jpg'),(8220,'The Wayward Tower','2024-05-30','Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Follow a man cursed to roam the world without ever finding a home, as the road once more leads him to a mysterious tower where a wolf-like wizard lives in peaceful solitude.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9b1b.jpg'),(8221,'Postmortem: One Must Die (Extended Cut)','2013-12-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Narrative-adventure playing an Agent of Death who must take ONE life that could change the fate of a conflict-torn Nation!\nThink The Walking Dead meets Home and The Last Express, with a dash of To The Moon!\n\nFreeform exploration with Rich dialogue\nWhat might you learn searching the fundraising Gala and talking to patrons? Perhaps the less you know the better?\n\nMeaningful choices and Unintended Consequences\nCan your choice change the fate of a Nation? What other result could your meddling have?\n\nCast of ambitious and influential characters\nWhat if they die? More importantly... what if they live?\n\nComplex setting of violent domestic conflict and industrial revolution\nA devastated country - but is it your place to fix it? What if your educated guess is wrong?\n\nDynamic and surprising Ending\nThe choice is *entirely* up to you - but what other factors may be affecting the outcome?\n\nOnline Stats to compare Your Choices with\nAnonymous aggregate stats of everyone\'s playthroughs will let you see how your own choices compare! Are you one of the good guys?Free VersionThe basic game, without the extra character and bonus materials, is also available for free from our Official Website!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86fz.jpg'),(8222,'Sonic Frontiers: Digital Deluxe Edition','2022-11-08','Platform','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Worlds are colliding in Sonic the Hedgehog’s newest high-speed adventure! In search of the missing Chaos emeralds, Sonic becomes stranded on an ancient island teeming with unusual creatures. Battle hordes of powerful enemies as you explore a breathtaking world of action, adventure, and mystery. Accelerate to new heights and experience the thrill of high-velocity, open-zone platforming freedom as you race across the five massive Starfall Islands. Jump into adventure, wield the power of the Ancients, and fight to stop these new mysterious foes. Welcome to the evolution of Sonic games! Experience All-New Open Zone Platforming Race across five massive overworld islands brimming with dense forests, overflowing waterfalls, and sizzling desert landscapes, each with their own unique action-platforming challenges and hidden secrets to uncover. Unparalleled High-Speed FreedomAdventure across the Starfall Islands and see what each has to offer at the speed that only Sonic can deliver. Blaze a trail as you see fit and discover side quests, solve puzzles, scale enormous structures, go fishing, and encounter a friendly face or two along the way… Challenge Yourself In Cyber SpaceDiscover portals scattered across the island and venture into Cyber Space levels through portals scattered across the islands featuring signature 3D platforming at Sonic speeds, packed with challenges to put your skills to the test. Cyber-Powered CombatThe Starfall Islands are home to strange creatures Sonic has never encountered before. Use the all-new battle system and skill tree upgrades to fight strategically, combining moves such as dodges, parries, counters, combos, and the new Cyloop ability to take down mysterious foes and colossal titans. A New Adventure Full of Mystery and IntrigueBecome Sonic and journey to uncover the mysteries of the remains of an ancient civilization plagued by robotic hordes. With nothing but a handful of questions and a disembodied voice to guide you, set out to save your friends and the enigmatic inhabitants of the Starfall Islands from a colossal, mechanized threat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5srb.jpg'),(8223,'Boat Delivery: Island Transport Simulator','2025-03-06','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Deliver. Navigate. Conquer the waves!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ing.jpg'),(8224,'Primal Hearts','2021-07-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Campus politics heat up in more ways than one in this rom-com from developer Marmalade!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qu7.jpg'),(8225,'G Prime','2016-01-06','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','A gravity gripping, Steampunk-styled, moody-beautiful, slingshot simulating puzzle pleaser. If you like Gravity Sling, Blast Off or Gears of Gravity, you’ll love this game.\r\n\r\nExplore the vast uncharted mysteries of “The Rain”, an incoming solar-system spanning cloud of rock, ice, metal, and other asteroids containing precious materials. This creates a boundless opportunity for wealth, and this is where you come in. In your role as sounding officer onboard Ptolemy Station, you are tasked with launching sub-etheric reconnaissance rockets into increasingly challenging gravity fields of iceteroids, theophosphorus, and quicksand clouds within The Rain in order to chart its vast riches.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/h6gc5n5ii2nn4iifkbgi.jpg'),(8226,'Firestorm Deadland',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Firestorm Deadland is a first-person shooter survival horror game where you have to survive as much time as you can by defending the world against unHumans and unknown species in the year 2063.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s5z.jpg'),(8227,'Bloxy Puzzles',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8228,'Gimmick! 2','2024-09-05','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Embark on a sparkling journey in this long-awaited sequel to SUNSOFT’s legendary 8-bit platformer Gimmick! Solve puzzles, trick enemies, and explore a physics-based playground. Yumetaro is back!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dro.jpg'),(8229,'MotorStorm: Apocalypse','2011-03-16','Racing, Sport','PlayStation 3','MotorStorm: Apocalypse (released as MotorStorm 3 in Asia) is a 2011 racing 3D video game by Evolution Studios and published by Sony Computer Entertainment for the PlayStation 3. It is the fourth game in the MotorStorm series and the third for the PlayStation 3. It was announced shortly before the beginning of the Electronic Entertainment Expo 2010 on the PlayStation Blog by Evolution Studios on 10 June 2010.\n\nMotorStorm: Apocalypse was released in Europe on 16 March 2011 but the UK release on 18 March was delayed by Sony Computer Entertainment UK following the 2011 Tōhoku earthquake and tsunami in Japan. The Australian launch went ahead as planned on 17 March, but Sony announced further shipments of the game to that country would be halted in the wake of the disaster. The planned North American release date of 12 April 2011 was delayed by Sony who later confirmed new releases dates of 31 March 2011 in the UK and 3 May 2011 in North America.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26tb.jpg'),(8230,'Folk Tales: Ala Geyik',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Folk Tales: Ala Geyik is an action-horror game. It follows a hunter who, after experiencing a nightmare, is chased by a deer he has repeatedly killed. As supernatural events unfold, he must face the Ala Geyik in a night filled with haunting nightmares and his struggle for survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l53.jpg'),(8231,'Cosmic Osmo and the Worlds Beyond the Mackerel','1989-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You\'re an Osmo, a strange creature indeed. You explore the galaxy in your spaceship, and the planets you encounter are almost as bizarre as the Osmos themselves. There are seven worlds presented for your consideration, each more goofy and peculiar than the last. Cosmic Osmo is a game about exploration and discovery, not winning or challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nkd.jpg'),(8232,'KnotBot','2020-05-08','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','From collecting buttons to solving tangled mazes, automate KnotBot on a quest of handcrafted puzzles. Solve the problems your own way, it\'s simple to understand but still deep and challenging.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co452c.jpg'),(8233,'Galactic Campaign','2019-04-25','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A galactic political campaign where everything is allowed.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8234,'Cosmic Pioneer','2017-06-07','Platform, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Navigate through space and successfully land your spacecraft without crashing. Cosmic Pioneer is heavily inspired by the classic Moon Lander game.\nTraverses the galaxy made of randomly generated levels filled with various hazards, keep track of your ships condition and aim for the highest score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zqz.jpg'),(8235,'Mew Mew Power: Cyniclon Invasion','2005-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Web browser','Mew Mew Power: Cyniclon Invasion is a Flash game developed and published by 4Kids. The game is a Space Invaders clone based on the anime Tokyo Mew Mew, localized as Mew Mew Power in the west.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9afu.jpg'),(8236,'Houkagou Colorful Step: Undou-bu!','2014-01-09','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable','Houkago Colorful * Step: Undoubu! is an otome game, developed and published by honeybee+, which was released in Japan in 2014.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s82.jpg'),(8237,'Banger Racer',NULL,'Sin género','Amstrad CPC','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8238,'Game Store Simulator','2023-11-20','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Buy and sell video games, upgrade your shop,load the cargo in your vehicle and take it to your store. Sell them to customers, make improvements and purchase new items to increase customer satisfaction and earn your place in the video game sales empire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zxl.jpg'),(8239,'Fantasy Jigsaw Puzzle','2025-03-27','Puzzle, Adventure, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Immerse yourself in a world of magic and mystery with this relaxing and engaging jigsaw puzzle game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ksx.jpg'),(8240,'Doodle Creatures','2014-04-30','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Build creatures through your own genetic laboratory','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94d3.jpg'),(8241,'Rematch: Elite Edition','2025-06-16','Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Rule the game with the Rematch Elite Edition, where excellence meets exclusivity.\n2 x Captain Pass Upgrade Ticket – Double the rewards, double the swag.\nBlazon Player Background & Title – Showcase your identity with an epic design that makes a statement as unique as you are.\nBlazon Buckler Tank Top – Classic tank top rebellion with blazon elegance, crafted for those who show their strength and shape their destiny with every match.\nBlazon Pattern (for Top & Bottom clothes) – Infuse your outfit with a seamless epic design that truly reflects your unique identity—perfect for those who want their style to tell their story.\nBlazon Jewel Set – Crafted from folded leather, each piece designed to shine on and off the field.\nGlitcher Trainers – Step into the future with every stride. Who says errors can\'t be aesthetic?\nBlazon Augmented Reality Cage – Brings each match to life with a vibrant blazon display that celebrates every goal.\nBlazon Cap – It\'s more than just a cap—it\'s a declaration of status, identity, and conviction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9npy.jpg'),(8242,'Rhombus Legends','2018-09-24','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A unique spatial battle system for card games. Unite with friends for clan wars, explore the dungeons and search world map for Bosses. Magical power awaits you!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8243,'Chess Bomb','2025-03-04','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chess Bomb is a unique puzzle game where bombs take the shape of chess pieces. Strategically use these explosive chess bombs to fend off waves of invading monsters threatening the chess kingdom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gbq.jpg'),(8244,'Creatures: Docking Station','2001-12-31','Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Creatures Docking Station is a free multiplayer add-on for the game Creatures 3. The game can also be played stand-alone with limited options and a downsized playworld.\n\nLike the previous games in the series, in Docking Station you breed Norns and raise them. You can teach them to talk, play, eat, avoid hazards and reproduce. Each Norn has its own set of genes which is passed on to its children. With this online version you can easily pass on your genes to Norns from all over the world and chat with other players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5d7f.jpg'),(8245,'Mumu\'s Soup Adventure',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jill the candy making witch summoned a cute little ghost cat named Mumu to help her with her candy making duties.\n\nOne day, Jill decided to make soup and Mumu agreed to help. All was going well until Jill decided Mumu\'s heart would be a part of the recipe! Scared for his life, Mumu barges out of the house and escapes, but Jill does not intend on letting him go that easily...\n\nDuring his escape, he encounters various characters and slowly uncovers the truth that ties everyone together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jpk.jpg'),(8246,'The Rose and I','2016-04-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An immersive, animated VR film. Crafted by the artists, animators and storytellers of Penrose Studios, \"The Rose And I\" is about loneliness, friendship, love, and loss. Come meet a lonely Rose living in the unlikeliest of places, and join her as she transports you to a brand new universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hpl.jpg'),(8247,'Momotaro Dentetsu 7','1997-12-23','Quiz/Trivia, Card & Board Game','PlayStation','Momotaro Dentetsu 7 is a video game in the Momotaro Dentetsu series of board game-style video games, genre released in 1997 by Hudson Soft for the PlayStation. The game was only released in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ps4esxg4bkrtkfyqpwtm.jpg'),(8248,'Puzzle: Stone Blocks','2020-12-22','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Free version of the Games for meditation and relaxation. Has 5 paid add-ons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4778.jpg'),(8249,'Irem Arcade Classics','1996-04-26','Arcade','Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Irem Arcade Classics (アイレム アーケードクラシックス) is a compilation of three arcade games by Irem, released exclusively in Japan for the Sega Saturn and Sony PlayStation. The game consist of 10-Yard Fight, Spartan-X (Kung-Fu Master) and Zippy Race (Motorace USA)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ish.jpg'),(8250,'Angst: Rahz\'s Revenge','1997-01-01','Shooter','DOS','In this game the player controls Werner Mueller, working as a Sysop at the GIC Headqurters in Futura City. One night, heavy explosions wake him unpleasantly from his sleep. He steps outside to see what happened, only to find himself in the middle of a deadly fight...\n\nAngst: Rhaz\'s Revenge is a traditional first-person-shooter in the legacy of DOOM: the player walks through the levels and uses ranged weapons to shoot at enemies. The game has a steampunk setting in the style of Jules Verne.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yxq.jpg'),(8251,'Big Cat Jigsaw Quest','2024-12-25','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a majestic adventure into the wild with \"Big Cat Jigsaw Quest\"—a thrilling puzzle game that immerses you in the untamed beauty of lions and tigers. Piece by piece, bring to life breathtaking scenes of roaring kings of the savanna and stealthy prowlers of the jungle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m9m.jpg'),(8252,'Aero Cosmos','2025-03-07','Racing, Simulator, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Soar through the void—master the skies beyond the stars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9km0.jpg'),(8253,'Blask','2019-01-15','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Blask is a unique puzzle game where you control the environment in order to hit all the goal markers with lasers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mcm.jpg'),(8254,'Witchy Woes','2024-04-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When a power hungry, egotistical young witch disobeys her school’s headmasters, she is cast out and exiled. Play as Devious Donna as she wreaks havoc on those who have wronged her. Harness the dark arts and exact your revenge on the masters of magic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ita.jpg'),(8255,'Colony on Mars','2018-01-04','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You play as an astronaut in a colony on Mars and you need to upgrade your colony, build new constructions and collect resources','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/a5iwhwsgvxjs8lshkcwy.jpg'),(8256,'Freja And The Sequel','2014-02-07','Point-and-click','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A complete stranger threatens to blow up the biscuit placebos offices, if they don\'t make a sequel to the classic cult game \"Crystal Raven Quest\". Freja, a nerdy and insecure girl with big black hair and a degree in computer science, is pulled into the mess and is given the task to develop the sequel.\n\nThe more absorbed she gets in her work, the more questions arise. Who\'s actually developing the game, and who is a character in the game? Who is the stranger who threatens to blow up the office? Where is the art director hiding the gold can opener? Is the sequel really supposed to be \"on ice\"? Why are the goblins in the labyrinth of death keeping their garbage in the dungeon? And perhaps most importantly: who is really Crystal Raven?\n\nFreja and the sequel is a funny, scary (and surreal) story-driven point and click-adventure for iOS (iPad and iPhone), Windows, Linux, Mac and Android.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bgd.jpg'),(8257,'Coarse Blade','2022-12-28','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Atari 2600','Terror reigns in The Old Kingdom. An evil sorcerer is ruling the land. Then one day, he is challenged by a barbarian Knight who is traveling from a foreign land to seek fame and fortune. You take control of the brave knight as you decide the fate of the Kingdom in this all-new Atari 2600 game.\n\nFight your way through the forest and conquer the three castles he occupies to overthrow the evil sorcerer and become the new king.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f7w.jpg'),(8258,'What Makes Us Special','2020-04-27','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','What do you need to start a school newspaper? The team of course! Nobody is perfect. Everyone is different.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4t6a.jpg'),(8259,'Expert','2014-05-28','Shooter, Puzzle','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Uncover the truth of the incident that struck the intelligent building that has been occupied by the terrorists as a member of the \"Expert\" Special Forces!\n\n3D gun shooting game that captures the action in a first person perspective. Explore the building freely, but be careful and take out the enemy before they take you out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4epz.jpg'),(8260,'Battle Royal: Battlegrounds Call','2025-01-10','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Where Survival is Earned, Victory is Inherited.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9akq.jpg'),(8261,'Gran Turismo Sport: Day One Edition','2017-10-19','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4','Day 1 Edition Content:\n\nLivery Stickers\nA sticker pack that can be used in the Livery Editor of the game.\n\nIn-Game Credit (Cr. 250,000)\nIn-game currency that can be used for various purchases in the game.\n\n60 PS4 Avatars\nA set of 60 \'Gran Turismo Sport\' original avatars that can be used with your PlayStation4 profile.\n\nRacing Helmet - Chrome\nSpecial chromed helmet that can be used in-game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wh2.jpg'),(8262,'Airplane Flight Simulator: Dangerous Landings','2024-12-12','Racing, Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Handle Extreme Landing Situations in Airplane Flight Simulator : Dangerous Landings','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9al0.jpg'),(8263,'Bear Escape Mission','2025-04-11','Platform','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','A simple, casual platformer with 40 short levels and infinite lives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ob7.jpg'),(8264,'Time Travel: Escape Room Game','2025-03-13','Puzzle, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Your help is essential in this time travel machine game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kdg.jpg'),(8265,'MegaRace','2017-11-09','Racing','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), 3DO Interactive Multiplayer, Mac, DOS, Sega CD','Virtual Television has given us a chance to do the things that we can\'t make real in everyday life: Race through 14 great tracks in 5 different environments in a totally virtual place where you can kill each other quite easily with sidekicks or guns. In every track you will see some symbols that can make your car speed up, slow up or even blow up, like your mega-host Lance Boyle says, \"Who knows; who cares!\" Everything you see in MegaRace is virtual and no one really dies there. So have fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z1i.jpg'),(8266,'#1 Anagrams','2021-05-14','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Do you enjoy crosswords or word games? Uncover hidden words: connect the letters, interpret the clues, improve your vocabulary, try your memory, challenge yourself and test your English skills.\n\nWhy waste time finding and downloading thousands of crosswords when #1 Anagrams generates randomly infinite crosswords for you? On top of that you can enjoy the story mode with 200 crosswords sorted by difficulty level, and solve the Daily Anagram (you get a new one every day) which is the same for everyone in the world.\n\nAre you up to the challenge? #1 Anagrams is a game made by fans for crosswords and word games that will not let you down!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bbw.jpg'),(8267,'Super Robot Taisen Compact 2 Dai-2-bu: Uchuu Gekishin-hen','2000-09-14','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','WonderSwan','Super Robot Taisen Compact 2 Dai-2-bu: Uchuu Gekishin-hen is a Strategy game, developed by TOSE and published by Banpresto, which was released in Japan in 2000.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qht.jpg'),(8268,'Valhalla Mountain','2025-01-16','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Ascend Yggdrasil\'s surreal landscapes in this Norse-inspired puzzle adventure. Solve puzzles, twist geometry, and uncover a warrior\'s path to Valhalla.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ahs.jpg'),(8269,'Ys X: Nordics - Attachment Pack','2024-10-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9527.jpg'),(8270,'Digimon Tamers: Battle Spirit Ver 1.5','2002-04-27','Fighting','WonderSwan Color','Japanese only upgrade to Digimon: Battle Spirit, including new characters and a new hidden boss in XeedMillenniummon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zng.jpg'),(8271,'Choice Clash: What Would You Rather?','2023-12-15','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Experience a world of choices in this ultimate decision-making game with 300 mind-bending dilemmas. Your path, your destiny awaits! And You What Would You Rather? Be invisible for a day or Be able to fly for a day? Your Choice matter!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ciz.jpg'),(8272,'Greed: The Mad Scientist','2024-02-29','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In this thrilling hidden object adventure, the laboratory of the world famous scientist Dr. Ralph Goodwin is blown up. Find out what\'s behind the assault and find a missing drug that can heal all diseases.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sm7.jpg'),(8273,'Book Supermarket: Library Manager Simulator','2025-03-13','Simulator, Strategy, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Build, manage, and grow the ultimate bookstore!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kde.jpg'),(8274,'Hent-Ai Puzzle','2024-05-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\'Hent-ai Puzzle\' is a puzzle game with a total of 12 sexy women in clothed, bikini or underwear and nude versions. You can switch between these versions and have a good time with 36 sexy pictures','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8a0b.jpg'),(8275,'Code Age Commanders: Tsugu Mono Tsugareru Mono','2005-10-13','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 2','Code Age Commanders is an action role-playing game, It is part of the Code Age series, a franchise designed to span different interweaved titles in multiple platforms and media.\nSet in an \"intraglobular world\", a fictional hollow world , with people living on its internal surface. The center of the sphere is occupied by the \"Central Code\", a spherical structure which goes through a transformation called \"Reborn\" about every ten thousand years, destroying all life on the globe and allowing for the birth of a new one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1veh.jpg'),(8276,'Train World Driver','2025-12-31','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take the Driver’s Seat in Train World Driver! Control iconic locomotives from steam engines, diesel beasts, and modern high-speed marvels in this casual, fun game. Complete missions, deliver passengers or cargo and explore stunning environments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fyi.jpg'),(8277,'1001 Jigsaw: World Tour - London','2019-02-05','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Assemble jigsaws from a multitude of pieces and learn the history, traditions and attractions of London in 500 high-quality photos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rai.jpg'),(8278,'Skull Pirates: Adventures','2024-08-30','Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Captain, set sail and explore the rough and tumble seas!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jvs.jpg'),(8279,'To Be A King: Volume 1',NULL,'Adventure, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ocq.jpg'),(8280,'LEGO Star Wars: The Skywalker Saga - Andor Character Pack','2022-11-29','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Fight against the evil Galactic Empire and play as resistance fighters from Star Wars: Rebels, LEGO style.\n\nCharacters Include:\n\nSabine Wren\nEzra Bridger\nAdmiral Thrawn\nKanan Jarrus\nHera Syndulla','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uh1.jpg'),(8281,'Mass Effect: Andromeda','2017-03-23','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A new adventure awaits in the Mass Effect universe. With stunning visuals and a new galaxy to discover, BioWare delivers the next generation of space exploration.\n\nCommander Shepard\'s story may be over, but there are many more stories to tell in the Mass Effect universe. Mass Effect Andromeda will be set in a new galaxy, with new characters, new quests and a whole load of new consequence-laden decisions to make.\n\nMass Effect: Andromeda takes you to the Andromeda galaxy, far beyond the Milky Way. There, you\'ll lead our fight for a new home in hostile territory - where WE are the aliens.\n\nPlay as the Pathfinder - a leader of a squad of military-trained explorers - with deep progression and customisation systems. This is the story of humanity’s next chapter, and your choices throughout the game will ultimately determine our survival in the Andromeda Galaxy.\n\nAs you unfold the mysteries of the Andromeda Galaxy and the hope for humanity lies on your shoulders – You must ask yourself… How far will you go?\n\nKey Features:\n\nReturn to the Mass Effect universe. Lead the first humans in Andromeda on a desperate search for our new home. In this new chapter of Mass Effect, meet and recruit all-new, interesting characters caught up in an epic space saga filled with mystery and galactic conflict.\n\nFight for survival. Battle with your Pathfinder team against terrifying enemies and creatures. New additions like destructible environments, boosted jumps for added verticality, and all-new weapons and Biotics make combat more thrilling than ever.\n\nBuild your hero. Create a formidable hero with amazing weapons, powers and tech. A much more flexible skill and weapon progression tree means you can replicate your play style to make you unstoppable against new, powerful alien enemies.\n\nExplore a new galaxy. Chart your own course in a dangerous new region. Unravel the mysteries of the Andromeda galaxy as you discover rich, alien worlds in the search for humanity’s new home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39vk.jpg'),(8282,'Hunter Moonstrike','2025-01-23','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hunter Moonstrike is the first survival game integrated with artificial intelligence. In this game, all npc have their own unique story and you can see the story of the game from their point of view. Talk to any person, ask any question you like, they will answer and think they are alive','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96tr.jpg'),(8283,'Mario Andretti Racing','1994-12-31','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Italian-born Mario Andretti is one of the most successful racing drivers in the US scene, and five of his relatives have also raced professionally. This game allows you to sample Indy cars, stock cars and sprint cars, all of which have been graced by Andrettis. The physics are customized to each of these, so expect sprint cars to slide around on the dirt tracks, and the slipstream effect is detectable.\n\nThere are 27 computer-controlled cars with individual profiles, and 8 cars to choose from in each race, with varying engine, grip, brakes and pit crew standards. You can view the action either from behind the car, or from the nose. In longer races you must monitor the pit strategy, with the options of a splash \'n\' dash stop if your tires are still fine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ntt.jpg'),(8284,'iGrow Game','2016-06-09','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The new age of farming is here on steam! Not the typical farming game or simulator you will find anywhere else.\n\niGrow Game is a single player cannabis growing game for windows PC. iGrow game is the only cannabis growing game available in 3D and in first person. Start your own cannabis growing factory in a grimy tower block based in the UK. Your goal is to take over and become the best grower around using the best equipment. Unlock equipment and new cannabis strains to sell to the highest ranked dealers to get the best price for your cannabis. The better price you get the more xp you will receive.\n\nDealers buy depending on criteria such as dryness and potency. You can harvest a lot more wet cannabis then you can with dry cannabis, the quality will be greatly reduced despite high potency. Depending on rank, some dealers will not buy wet cannabis buds no matter what cannabis strain it is.\n\nEvery game is different, the tower block is generated at the beginning of a new game. So dealers and rooms available to buy, will be in randomly generated positions. There\'s 4 ranks of dealers and the higher rank\'s are higher up in the 10 floor tower block. Move between floors by lift.\n\nEquipment effects your plants final yield and potency so make sure you upgrade between grows. \n\n\n- Unlock and grow over 30 different strains of cannabis.\n\n- Unlock and buy containers, hydroponics, lights, reflectors and fan systems.\n\n- Grow up to 8 plants per room.\n\n- Buy over 30 rooms in each generated account.\n\n- Sell your cannabis to build up your weed growing empire!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/p2jm9golvt2spjqme1b1.jpg'),(8285,'Splash Cars','2022-03-09','Racing, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Paint the world a better place, one neighborhood at a time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41yy.jpg'),(8286,'Jennifer Wilde: Unlikely Revolutionaries','2022-10-18','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','In 1921, young French artist Jennifer Chevalier becomes embroiled in death, espionage and revolution, assisted by the ghost of Oscar Wilde. A hand-drawn Point & Click adventure with a unique comic book inventory design.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44as.jpg'),(8287,'Samurai-Ghost','2007-11-02','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Wii, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','This action platformer features a samurai ghost from the depths of the underworld. In a past war, Kagekiyo managed to defeat the shogun Yoritomo and his clan. However, their evil spirits were not completely destroyed, and now, in the world known as Dark Side, they seek the time of their rebirth. In order to shatter those ambitions, Kagekiyo must make his way across seven zones and head for \"The Heart of the Darkside\" where Yoritomo lies in wait. Use spirit weapons to power up your sword, or other items, such as candles to recover health, and defeat the endless hordes of enemies. Each zone is not only protected by a boss but also includes demons as well as real samurai from 12th-century Japan. Get ready for some intense one-on-one combat action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50as.jpg'),(8288,'Demon Go!','2022-09-08','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A little demon determined to escape from a terrible hell! Jump and dash to the last gate of hell to avoid enemies and obstacles. The terrible demons will try to stop us from escaping, If you rescue the cute cat and clear the challenge, you will definitely escape! Just remember jump and dash!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fun.jpg'),(8289,'Fantasy Life','2014-10-23','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Embark on the adventure of your dream life as you craft, cast, fish, mine, battle and explore like never before. With the innovative Life system, your choices don’t just upgrade characters—they help shape your journey. Explore a huge fantasy landscape beside surly dark paladins, slick pirate captains, regal princesses, and others who share your taste for the unknown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2haw.jpg'),(8290,'Dimension Shift',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Get ready for a challenge! Dimension Shift is a hardcore game for hardcore gamers. Avoid the spikes. Reach the end. It\'s that simple. Or is it...?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co460m.jpg'),(8291,'Mutland','2018-12-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This is a new pixel style survival game. Players need to elude zombies, grow crops, harvest trees/rocks, hunt animals, gather food/drink, craft knife/axe/torch/food/medicine… Above all things, only one purpose, live!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8292,'Legendary Tales: Cataclysm','2022-01-03','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A dreadful prediction came to the oracle — the cataclysm is coming. The renegade witch is about to save the world or ruin it… “Legendary Tales: Cataclysm” is an adventure game in the genre of Hidden Objects, with plenty of mini-games and puzzles, unforgettable characters and complicated quests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5it3.jpg'),(8293,'Break the Empire','2025-03-26','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A straight forward, action-rougelite game. No lore, no story, no choices other than how to build your character and how to kill/conquer. Permadeath, unique builds, wild combinations and high replayability!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u22.jpg'),(8294,'Fight Legends: Mortal Fighting','2025-03-27','Fighting','Nintendo Switch','Unleash your rage! Choose your class, weapons, and armor! Explore and fight!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ix8.jpg'),(8295,'Jewel Match: Solitaire Seasons - Collector\'s Edition','2024-08-29','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','For everything there is a season, and for every season there\'s Solitaire! Play more than 1000 levels across 10 locations in any season. Be sure to participate in the best Solitaire experience of this season and last. Shuffle your cards to victory with Jewel Match Solitaire Seasons!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jpf.jpg'),(8296,'Where\'s My Kitty','2025-02-20','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you like playing hide and seek with cats? Come and find them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9md6.jpg'),(8297,'Through the Edges','2025-03-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into a world divided by the enigmatic Spheres, where different races live under strict balance – a balance that has never been questioned… until now.\n\nAs the protagonist, an ordinary young person from a remote village, you receive an unexpected invitation to a grand ball. What seems like a stroke of fate soon turns into a revelation of hidden anomalies, ancient powers, and a secret that could shatter reality itself.\n\nBut you are not alone.\n\nMeet intriguing characters from various races, each carrying their own secrets, struggles, and desires. Will they become your allies, rivals, or something more? Your choices will shape their destinies – and your own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gro.jpg'),(8298,'Cosmophony','2014-09-25','Shooter, Music, Indie','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Wii U, PlayStation Vita','Cosmophony is a musical shooter designed for demanding gamers seeking an original and intense experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wv4.jpg'),(8299,'Atelier Escha & Logy Plus: Alchemists of the Dusk Sky','2015-01-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation Vita','This world has gone through many Dusks, and is slowly nearing its end. Within this world, in the western reaches of the \"Land of Dusk,\" there was a nation that prospered thanks to its use of alchemy. There, in order to survive the eventual arrival of the \"Dusk End,\" the people devoted their efforts to rediscover and recreate lost alchemic technologies. Rediscovered technology from the past era was gathered in the alchemy research city known as \"Central,\" where research was conducted on how to halt the advance of the twilight. One of the heroes is a young man who researched alchemy in Central, the other a girl living in a small town on the frontier. This girl\'s name is Escha. In the process of using her knowledge of ancient alchemy to help others, she was assigned to the Development Department. The young man\'s name is Logy. Having learned the newest alchemic techniques in Central, he requested a transfer to this understaffed town to make use of his abilities, and meets Escha when he is assigned to the Development Department as well. The two make a promise to use their alchemy together, and bring success to the Development Department.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hmt.jpg'),(8300,'Diener Dates','2023-06-02','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The good news is that you have gotten the chance to take over a prestigious diner, in a delightful location somewhere in the Afterlife! The bad news is that you died.\n\nDiener Dates tasks you with running the diner of your dreams, a diner you would die for (literally). Customise the interior, purchase different types of food and make friends or enemies with the local clientele! Oh, did I forget to mention the customers? There are 8 charming customers that will visit your store regularly, so make sure to treat them well.\n\nMay the odds be ever in your flavor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lq4.jpg'),(8301,'Pirates In Love','2011-06-25','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','No longer available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61m4.jpg'),(8302,'Dungeons & Dragons Online: The Isle of Dread','2022-06-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Isle of Dread expansion for Dungeons & Dragons Online, also known as Update 55. The expansion is built around a beloved classic D&D adventure and features an increased level cap, a new playable race, new character-building options, monsters, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co931p.jpg'),(8303,'Hitchhiker','2022-03-10','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hitchhiker is a mystery game set along lost highways, where your goal is to solve the puzzle of your own backstory. As a hitchhiker with no memory or destination, you catch a series of rides across a strange and beautiful landscape, tracking the mysterious disappearance of a person close to you. Your drivers range from stoic farmers to off-duty waitresses, and each one has a story to tell. Clues appear, alliances emerge, and nothing is quite what it seems.\n\nAs your journey continues, you must decode the events of your past while confronting the dangers that lie ahead. Hitchhiker is a road-trip odyssey about exploring the unknown in order to find yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52d0.jpg'),(8304,'Cranked Up','2021-07-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You all know the famous proverb : \"The best donuts are cooked in the oldest cups\". Unfortunately your donut has lost his cup. Help him find Mr. Mug in a crazy world led by an evil Hawaiian pizza.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pt0.jpg'),(8305,'Meet Your Maker: Sector 2 Cosmetic Collection','2023-09-26','Shooter, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Nights are long, resources are scarce, and a bitter cold chills to the bone. Here only the ruthless survive. Meet Your Maker\'s Sector 2 Cosmetic Collection is inspired by the bleeding-edge tech created to survive the Arctic wasteland\'s frigid extremes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gtc.jpg'),(8306,'Tahitian Driftin\'',NULL,'Racing','Sin plataforma','A tropical anti-gravity racing game from the depths of a long-lost arcade cabinet that will have you cruising through lush, remote Polynesian islands with a draft-based boost system that fosters tight-knit competition between players','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hu0.jpg'),(8307,'Corpse Party','2021-10-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A friendship ritual gone awry transports high school student Ayumi Shinozaki and her friends to an alternate reality version of a tragedy-stricken institution that stood on the site of their own school long ago. As the vengeful spirits of elementary school students threaten their lives and their sanity, their only hope of survival–much less escape–is to uncover the chilling details surrounding the murders of those trapped before them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42j9.jpg'),(8308,'Last Train Home: Digital Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Strategy, Tactical','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fi3.jpg'),(8309,'Fancy Skiing: Speed','2019-06-07','Sport, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Fancy Skiing\" is a series of games developed by Hash Technology, which has been welcomed by players around the world. ​Compared to the earliest version “Fancy Skiing VR”, \"Fancy Skiing: Speed\" has been made some changes, added a level mode, and set up a world...','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8310,'Shaq Attaq',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8311,'Deep Diving VR','2019-09-12','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Submerge yourself in one of the most immersive VR experiences to date! Explore uncharted waters, witness vivid marine life, collect ancient artifacts, upgrade your gear, and enjoy the underwater adventure in Virtual Reality!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oal.jpg'),(8312,'Mobocratic Union','2024-05-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Mobocratic Union, a thrilling political simulation game. This time, you\'ll leave the confines of a small, deserted island and venture into the grand spheres of the European Parliament. Get ready to make strategic decisions, form alliances, and shape the continent’s future!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75lx.jpg'),(8313,'Cyber Ops','2020-05-21','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a military hacker and help your black ops team reach their goal in this noir cyberpunk tactical game. Scan, hack, overtake, control and manage high tech devices, vehicles and even enemy cyborgs with cutting-edge implants.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xm4.jpg'),(8314,'Fishing: North Atlantic - Scallops Expansion','2021-08-11','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Expand your gaming experience with the new official Scallop DLC for Fishing: North Atlantic!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3s5h.jpg'),(8315,'World Soccer: Winning Eleven 2010 - Arcade Championship','2010-02-24','Sport','Arcade','An arcade game in the World Soccer: Winning Eleven (Pro Evolution Soccer) franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80lk.jpg'),(8316,'Master of Magic','2010-04-27','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','You came to the world of Arcanus as a fledgling wizard. Sparsely equipped with but a spell or two, you begin as the ruler of a tiny hamlet and its people. With these raw materials, you must build a thriving city, explore the two worlds of Arcanus and Myrror, expand your empire and learn new spells. In time, you will meet other wizards, each rising from equally humble beginnings, each having the same goal as you, namely conquering the worlds.\n\nHow well you allocate resources, make use of your races’ potentials, seize opportunities and negotiate with other wizards determines your eventual success. In the end, though, there can be only one Master of Magic!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co255e.jpg'),(8317,'Bounsweet\'s Bouncy Adventure','2017-03-02','Platform','Web browser','A Pokemon browser game, an auto scrolling platformer. Bounsweet bounces along avoiding fire balls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nyy3st6u3eqssczaerpq.jpg'),(8318,'Project: Curse','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j7j.jpg'),(8319,'SD Gundam Gaiden Knight Gundam Monogatari: Seikihei to Kikoushin','2010-10-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Legacy Mobile Device','\"SD Gundam Gaiden Knight Gundam Monogatari: Seikihei to Kikoushin\" is the latest installment in the \"SD Gundam Gaiden: Knight Gundam Monogatari\" role-playing game series, first released as a home video game in 1990 and ported as cell phone content in 2008. (As of 2010)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9deo.jpg'),(8320,'Chicory: A Colorful Tale','2023-05-30','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Chicory: A Colorful Tale is an adventure game about a dog wielding a magic paintbrush! Use the power of art to explore, solve puzzles, help your animal friends and restore color to the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s6f.jpg'),(8321,'Simple Dot','2019-05-17','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Simple Dot is a minimalistic logic game in which thanks to surrounds and lines of different physical properties appearing problems can be solved.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8322,'Witch Pachi',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Sin plataforma','\"Witch Pachi\" is a physics-based roguelike game featuring elemental and skill deck-building. It introduces new mechanics that offer fresh strategies and fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hti.jpg'),(8323,'Project Highrise: Brilliant Berlin','2018-07-19','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In Brilliant Berlin, you’ll be challenged to adapt and keep up with the diverse needs of this thriving global city. To succeed in Berlin, you will need to build towers brimming with art, amenities, and elegance to lure in discerning tenants.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ces.jpg'),(8324,'Capybara Spa','2022-03-14','Point-and-click, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build your own capybara spa in this cute point and click simulation game! Grow fruits, craft soaps and clean towels to pamper the capybaras during their visit. Furnish the mountain with gardens, baths and decorations to design the best capybara spa!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4be1.jpg'),(8325,'Cars 3: Driven to Win','2017-06-13','Racing','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Wii U, Xbox 360, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Cars 3: Driven to Win is a game that empowers players to master their driving skills for the ultimate competitive racing experience. With six thrilling modes for gamers to learn and advance their abilities, players can progress their character through training and tests of racing proficiency that unlock new modes, tracks, characters and more. Players can hone a wide variety of skills and abilities including Drifting, Turbo, Two-wheel Driving, Driving Backwards and Side-Bash. Each unique mode and ability allows players to explore the deeper gameplay mechanics and earn rewards for their expertise. Cars 3: Driven to Win provides an exhilarating, action-packed experience where training and skill give players an edge in a racing experience that anyone can win.\n\nAdditionally, players will be able to experience Cars 3: Driven to Win with their friends or on their own to perfect the various racing styles and modes available to them. Available for pre-order now, the game will include local split-screen cooperative play, allowing players to compete or team up and play at home together, making it easy for friends and family members to join the race - and the fun - at any time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22v7.jpg'),(8326,'Puyo Puyo SUN Ketteiban','1997-12-27','Puzzle','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation','This game is a Japan-only port of the third game in the Puyo Puyo series originally made for the Arcades by Sega.\n\nThe name of Puyo Puyo Sun comes from a Japanese pun on \"san\", and also indicates a new Ojama brought into the game. As Sun Puyos were used in this game, and the game itself is not only set on a tropical beach, but is the third in the series (三, \"san\" is the Japanese word for the number 3), the name suited the game. The Ketteiban (Definitive) edition of the game introduces a nazo puyo puzzle mode. Rerecorded audio tracks and voice acting, using higher quality audio tracks from the arcade version as a source.\n\nJust like the predecessors, Puyos fall from the top of the screen in pairs, can be moved left and right, and can be rotated clockwise and anti-clockwise by 90°. The rule of Sousai and Zenkesei still remained, but every time you countered, special garbage would fall on the screen in a preset pattern. Every time you cleared the screen however, Sun Puyos would fall on the screen, and the All Clear bonus removed.\n\nThe game features 3 story modes featuring their own character and difficulty: Draco Centauros (Easy), Arle Nadja (Normal) and Schezo Wegey (Hard).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d5g.jpg'),(8327,'Countryle','2022-02-18','Quiz/Trivia','Web browser','Guess the hidden country every day! Use the clues to guess it with the fewest attempts possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9klb.jpg'),(8328,'Virus',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','You are a computer virus, programmed to to adapt and learn to aid in getting full access of different computers and servers. Will you be able to adapt fast enough to complete your job?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5i1e.jpg'),(8329,'WRC Generations','2022-11-03','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','New mechanics have been integrated to represent the demands of the hybrid engines. In order to win, you have to carefully manage your battery by adapting your engine mapping throughout the special stages you take part in.\n\nAs community satisfaction is always a priority , you can now share customised livery and stickers with other players. The best creations will be rewarded and highlighted.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rp1.jpg'),(8330,'Digimon','2000-12-31','Adventure','Web browser','A Flash adventure game developed by Delaino Barris and formerly hosted on the Fox Kids site.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9meh.jpg'),(8331,'Wolf in the City','2024-01-07','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A lone wolf whose children have been kidnapped from an animal shelter and is looking for his children in a Big city. He will need to find food and track to survive. As the wolf, run through the streets and interact with cars and people. Sleep and recharge, or talk to other animals. This is a ThirdPerson game about story and tracking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jol.jpg'),(8332,'Sorry, James','2017-11-10','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','You are James Garner, a security engineer at Mantis Corp., a leading tech company in weaponry field. You got a usual task to decrypt company files. Unusual is that these files contain bizarre chat. Things become weirder when you realize that your job is to “hack love story.”\n\nWhy is this so important for Mantis?\nWhat can be hidden in someone\'s conversation?\nWhat will you risk to find out the truth?\n\nSorry, James is non-linear story-driven puzzle game which takes unusual step on storytelling. You will discover plot through dialogues of two strangers and learn a tale about James, whose role is to decrypt files containing that chat. Along with creepy thriller and conspiracy atmosphere, there is the unique game mechanic that reminds mix of Sudoku and Minesweeper-like gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24tg.jpg'),(8333,'A Knight\'s Devotion','2012-10-30','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','A Knight\'s Devotion is an otome game from Voltage Inc. You are princess who falls in love with one of the knights who escorts and protects you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co661n.jpg'),(8334,'Political Punchers: 2024 Arena','2024-04-09','Fighting, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','In a time where politics feel more like a battleground than a debate, Political Punchers transforms the intensity of the political sphere into an exhilarating 3D fighting game that’s both humorous and thrilling. As the presidential election looms on the horizon, it’s time to elect your fighter!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co834k.jpg'),(8335,'Polaris SnoCross','2000-02-18','Racing, Sport','Nintendo 64, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','If it doesn\'t say Polaris... it ain\'t SnoCross! Join the Polaris Snowmobile Racing Team and dare to tame the mountain! Pull off a variety of insane tricks as you master the challenges of monster jumps, hidden pitfalls, shortcuts, and treacherous terrain. Race against fiercely competitive AI characters, or take on your own friends in multi-player mode. Feel your customized Polaris sled move, twist and turn just like a real snowmobile!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z1e.jpg'),(8336,'Metro: Last Light - Complete Edition','2013-12-31','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows)','It is the year 2034. Beneath the ruins of post-apocalyptic Moscow, in the tunnels of the Metro, the remnants of mankind are besieged by deadly threats from outside – and within.\n\nMutants stalk the catacombs beneath the desolate surface, and hunt amidst the poisoned skies above. But rather than stand united, the station-cities of the Metro are locked in a struggle for the ultimate power, a doomsday device from the military vaults of D6. A civil war is stirring that could wipe humanity from the face of the earth forever. As Artyom, burdened by guilt but driven by hope, you hold the key to our survival – the last light in our darkest hour...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oco.jpg'),(8337,'Newton\'s Cradle Puzzle Game','2020-08-27','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Newton\'s Cradle Puzzle Game is an unique & challenging puzzle game. There are almost no instructions, so you have to find out how to solve these levels yourself. There are 33 (challenging!) levels and 8 jazzy songs in the background.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co471r.jpg'),(8338,'AirRacer','2022-01-27','Racing','Meta Quest 2','Do you have what it takes to pilot a hovercraft going at top speed? Then the high-risk sport of Air Racing is for you!\n\nCompete in interplanetary races, collect new ships as you advance your career, and claim your place on the leaderboard!\n\nAirRacer is a VR racing game that you can play anywhere. Just tilt your head to control the vehicle, no controllers needed!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fms.jpg'),(8339,'Ultimate Soccer Manager \'98','1999-12-31','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ultimate Soccer Manager or USM is a association football management video game serie for MS-DOS, Commodore Amiga and Windows 95, produced by Impressions and distributed by Sierra from 1995 to 1999. The game was a massive hit in Europe (except in Germany, where it was worse received due to some similarities with managers produced by local software houses such as Software 2000 and Ascaron), although it gained little support in Japan.\n\nThe series was noted for its micromanagement, where the player had to do the job of the team manager and much of that of the chairman, from player training up to bank balance management. Other well-known features were to bung an opposing team for preferential market treatment, rig or betting on the outcome of the players\' team matches. Interviews after the match where some answers were printed with different interpretations on the next days\' newspaper (the player could reply a question about the game with \"It was a game of two halves\", and \"He amazed us after the game by giving us an insight into the rules of football\" would be printed on the newspapers).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gqi.jpg'),(8340,'Creepy Tale Bundle',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k09.jpg'),(8341,'Atari Recharged Bundle',NULL,'Arcade','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zj0.jpg'),(8342,'Return Alive','2024-10-23','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Return Alive is a Free-to-Play Top-down Tactical Shooter Game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yhg.jpg'),(8343,'Free Bees','2025-04-07','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A brick-breaker reimagined with hexagons, honey, and heavy-duty chains! Free the bees by chaining together projectiles in unique visual settings using new brick-breaker mechanics. Create & share your own custom levels, chill with the freed-bees in the sanctuary, and, most importantly, FREE THE BEES!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qes.jpg'),(8344,'Survivia.io',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ri2.jpg'),(8345,'Swipe Fruit Smash','2018-06-25','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Use the mouse to swipe through the fruits and collect all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42sk.jpg'),(8346,'Being Mindful','2019-09-11','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this awareness game you try to maintain awareness of aspects of your body for as long as you can. Body awareness is practiced sitting, standing, doing yoga, simple tai chi and other exercises.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bkp.jpg'),(8347,'Mr. Shorty','2025-03-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A retro top-down RPG shooter indie game where you play as Mr. Shorty: the heroic ranger in the wild west. Unlock weapons, take on bounties and discover the dormant evil behind the recent onslaught of bandit attacks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l1r.jpg'),(8348,'Audition Online','2008-05-01','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Audition Online, is a downloadable multiplayer online casual rhythm game produced by T3 Entertainment. It was originally released in South Korea in 2004, but it has been localized by various publishers around the world. Audition Online is free to play but it earns its revenue by selling virtual items such as clothes for the player\'s avatar.\n\nIt is a major hit in Indonesia and Vietnam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3i9w.jpg'),(8349,'Goat\'s Tale Adventure','2024-01-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the shoes of the new heroine and pursue the treasures in this exceptionally demanding adventure. Explore lands where only the most resilient players will reach the summit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nh6.jpg'),(8350,'Zombies & Love','2024-03-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Immerse yourself in the adult FPS shooter game \"Zombies & Love\", where sensuality meets horror. Go through explicit scenes and crowds of zombies in a world of apocalypse. Help Ted and Vera to survive in this dead world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82hc.jpg'),(8351,'Pause Ahead','2013-08-20','Platform','Web browser','A Molyjam inspired platformer from Askiisoft, which seeks to answer the question \"What if the pause button was a weapon?\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xf5.jpg'),(8352,'Trinity Trigger: Extra Episode - Cyan',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f88.jpg'),(8353,'The Sinking Structure, Clione, and Lost Child: Log4','2022-03-23','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Two silent wanderers,6 full chapters,A game of exploration and adventure','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4m1h.jpg'),(8354,'South Park: The Fractured but Whole - Gold Edition','2017-10-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In this new opus, from the creators of South Park, assume the role of the New Kid and join South Park favorites in a new hilarious and outrageous RPG adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co275j.jpg'),(8355,'Eight Thirty, Nowhere','2021-04-21','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Eight Thirty, Nowhere is an attempt at creating a massive, open space that is sparse, largely empty, with a focus on being a tone piece above all else.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co435m.jpg'),(8356,'Armortale','2019-11-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Baby demon foxes are on a rampage! Head on an epic journey together with a wise witch to stop their mischief and save the kingdom. A fun action platformer with a unique armor swapping mechanic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lns.jpg'),(8357,'Truck Raid','2021-01-21','Racing, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Truck Raid is a retro-style racing game that will take you back to the glory days of 90s racing games. With its vibrant graphics and fast-paced gameplay, Truck Raid captures the spirit of classic racing games while bringing new twists to the genre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lwh.jpg'),(8358,'Dizzy 3 and a Half: Into Magicland','1991-03-31','Adventure','ZX Spectrum','In this prequel to Magicland Dizzy, our hero has to rescue his nephew then find out how to activate Granddizzy\'s teleport machine so he can go to Magicland to rescue his friends.\n\nThis game is a mini-adventure which serves as an introduction to \"Magicland Dizzy\" and was given away free on Crash Magazine\'s covertape in January 1991.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wzubno4ryzujj3g6qzwa.jpg'),(8359,'Jet Pilot','1996-12-31','Simulator','Amiga','Jet PIlot is an advanced Flight Simulator featurng the Lockheed F-104 and the English Electric Lightning.\n\nYour aim is to successfully complete some 20 qualification missions on one or both aircraft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dbr.jpg'),(8360,'Andarin Weppes','2024-06-19','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A first person puzzle experience of someone with advancing dementia...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ti9.jpg'),(8361,'Cinders','2020-08-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Cinders is a mature take on a classic fairytale with a heavy emphasis on player choices and role playing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co722b.jpg'),(8362,'Necros no Yousai','1990-06-01','Role-playing (RPG)','TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','Coming from a promotional Candy Toy Made by Lotte Group, Necros no Yōsai is a JRPG set in an anime / manga, fantasy, turn-based with licensed title themes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f8c.jpg'),(8363,'RayCrisis: Series Termination','2000-11-25','Shooter','Arcade, PlayStation','An ambitious and unethical scientist, a secret experiment gone horribly awry, and an artificially intelligent supercomputer gone mad; all the necessary ingredients for the imminent extinction of mankind. You are humanity\'s last hope, a hotshot pilot given the unenviable task of flying an experimental fighter into the dark heart of the Con-Human Network. Seize the controls of three Wave Rider spacecraft, each equippped with the WR-01 primary weapon array, WR-02 secondary lock-on laser system, and WR-03 single-use weapon for emergency situations. RayCrisis: Series Termination is the final entry in Taito\'s acclaimed trilogy of shooters, and it bombards your CRT with an abundance of fourth-generation optical stimulation: multilevel scrolling, transparency and lighting effects, and enough polygons to overload your cerebral cortex. Dodge, weave, and blast through two play modes, disintegrating wave after wave of relentless bogeys, to achieve high scores and unlock hidden bonuses. Prepare your senses, reinforce your nerves, and limber your trigger finger - the final assault has begun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ey4.jpg'),(8364,'Heebie Jeebies: The Roller Coaster',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Heebie Jeebies is a horror roller coaster game created especially for VR. To survive the whole ride, you will have to hold the handles in front of you. If at any point you will release them - GAME OVER. This is the perfect game for you to experience something spooky and to scare your friends as well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4297.jpg'),(8365,'Infraspace','2021-10-15','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','InfraSpace is a sci-fi city builder - but every resource you produce has to go through your transport infrastructure. In order to thrive in this solar system, you\'ll not only have to start mining operations and manage production chains, but also make sure your road network is up to the task.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43kc.jpg'),(8366,'Heroes of Myths - Warriors of Gods','2017-12-07','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beat back the demonic hordes with your Spartan soldiers in this awesome defence game! The gods of Ancient Greece and a cast of legendary heroes will help you defend your chosen deity’s temple against your otherworldly foes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bls.jpg'),(8367,'Pale','2025-01-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are sent to a snowy wasteland to investigate a mysterious signal...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kzq.jpg'),(8368,'Star Control 3','1996-10-01','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Since the events in Star Control 2 the Ur-Quan have been pacified and the captain who bravely destroyed the Sa-Matra has had a horrible vision of the future. Suddenly without warning, all Hyperspace travel in the universe has stopped. Top scientists have pinpointed the cause of this disturbance somewhere in unexplored space in an area known as the Kessari Quadrant. Hastily assembling a fleet of ships as and an untested Precusor star drive... a loose alliance of alien races known as The League of Sentient Races sends a task force to the Kessari Quadrant. You are it\'s commander. \n \nStar Control 3 features a new 3D star map, new alien races to discover, new worlds to explore and colonize, new artifacts to research and a new isometric Hyper Melee battle system for inter-starship battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rej.jpg'),(8369,'Treasure Cove! + Treasure Mountain!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8370,'Family Business',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','I\'m going to make you an offer you can\'t refuse...Have you ever thought about being part of the Mafia?So enter in the world of Family Business,a massive first-Person shooter. Play against other players, earn cash, buy weapons, improve your arsenal and show everyone whos BOSS !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63yw.jpg'),(8371,'Containers',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Containers – a clicker game where unexpected discoveries await you! Your main task is to click the button to earn balance and open various containers with rare and valuable items. Test your luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mwn.jpg'),(8372,'Banana Blitz','2024-10-23','Platform, Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Banana Blitz is an exclusively online multiplayer running game where players must use their wits and reflexes to outrun, outsmart, and backstab their friends to be the first to reach the finish. Set traps, unleash chaos, and steal the idol at the last second as you battle for supremacy in thrilling, fast-paced races.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yzq.jpg'),(8373,'Tetris Plus','1997-08-31','Puzzle','Game Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9idl.jpg'),(8374,'Verdant Idea','2024-09-26','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Minecraft 1.20.1 Modpack.\n\nThe world as you know is gone. Your task is to bring it back to life!\n\nInspired by Regrowth, Verdant Idea is a unique experience in which you start in a vast, empty world and eventually build a thriving civilization using magic and technology.\n\nWhile this modpack takes inspiration from Regrowth, treat it as a spiritual successor - there are many exiting changes and additions!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k5m.jpg'),(8375,'Joyride: Lowpoly World','2024-05-24','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Joyride is a low-polygon style racing game. Different seasons have different scenery, and different locations have different driving pleasures. You can race, off-road, hang out, and even operate drones here. You can also discover hidden levels in the game to get a completely different experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6upo.jpg'),(8376,'Pharmacy Simulator','2024-08-30','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience a realistic pharmacy management experience with Pharmacy Simulator. Set up your shop, decorate it as you wish, and purchase over a hundred types of medications. Pharmacy Simulator offers you an incredibly realistic pharmacy experience. Prove your skills in a challenging economic system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co839w.jpg'),(8377,'BrickOut','2021-09-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Brickout is a funny game. The aim of the game is to destroy all the bricks and collect any falling power-ups to move to the next level. The game is an ordinary arknoid, with cute graphics and good music. There are 20 levels in the game, can you pass them all?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5c6f.jpg'),(8378,'Quantum Error',NULL,'Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Quantum Error is a cosmic-horror FPS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29q3.jpg'),(8379,'The Basement\'s Calling','2018-05-18','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escape the basement, but something will try to stop you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mb9.jpg'),(8380,'Eternal Melody','1996-11-22','Simulator, Visual Novel','Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Main character is a normal high school student who gets into an accident at the construction site. Instead of dying he finds himself in a strange world. There he learns that he needs to find a powerful artifact in order to return to his world. However, there are also other contestants for the treasure as it can help to conquer the world. Will protagonist return to his world safely?\n\nThe primary objective of this game is to plan training schedules for yourself and the four members of your party, including you, to strengthen them. You must win several board game battles that occur during the journey. Additionally, by forming close bonds with the girls you recruit as allies, you can receive a confession of love from them in the ending (if you fail to build a good rapport with any party member, you will receive a confession from one of the rival characters, Kyle, Remit, or Iris). These romantic elements are secondary objectives. There are a total of 27 different endings in the game.\n\nThis game can be considered a precursor to MediaWorks\' Yuukyuu Gensoukyoku Series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co779d.jpg'),(8381,'Strong Bad\'s Cool Game for Attractive People Episode 2: Strong Badia the Free','2010-12-21','Adventure','PlayStation 3, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows)','As the episode begins, The King of Town institutes an e-mail tax. Strong Bad is the most heavily affected. However, being unaware of the existence of the tax, he is put under house arrest (with an explosive collar around his neck), a predicament that leads him to unite the citizens to rise up against the authorities. Strong Bad then declares his own plot of land (an empty lot featuring a fence, a spare tire, and a graffiti\'d stop sign, which Strong Bad has named \"Strong Badia\") an independent nation. The inspirational speech he gives to the citizens inspires them to create their own independent countries. In order to overthrow the King of Town, Strong Bad must work his way through the countries and unite Free Country USA once again under the Strong Badian flag. Strong Badia the Free\'s minigame, Math Kickers: Featuring the Algebros, a parody of beat \'em ups such as Double Dragon, involves the player solving math problems by punching enemies. In addition, the game also features a second minigame called Maps & Minions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tk3.jpg'),(8382,'Pokémon Emerald Slide','2022-07-15','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Game Boy Advance','In this hack, the entire overworld has been turned into an ice puzzle. The game is able to be beaten (a lot of overworld changes were required to make this happen, carpets and flowers are safe spots), but the path to the end is very different than a normal playthrough.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fje.jpg'),(8383,'Project: Gobble','2025-12-31','Sin género','PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j7k.jpg'),(8384,'Rollover','2025-03-27','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rollover is a brutally punishing climbing game where every roll could be your last. With unpredictable, difficult physics and a movement system designed to test your limits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l1s.jpg'),(8385,'Killer7','2018-11-15','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Sneak into a world of underground assassins as Harman Smith, a man who manifests 7 deadly personalities, the killer7. Take control of this distinct murderers\' row as they hunt down the sinister Kun Lan to thwart his plan of world dominance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1owa.jpg'),(8386,'Walk to the Woods',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Ever walk into nature with your friends and just chat? Walk to the Woods captures that feeling by asking deep and thoughtful questions while you stare up at the stars together. Some questions change every time they\'re asked. Some will make you laugh. Some will make you cry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hp8.jpg'),(8387,'Microsoft Adventure','1979-12-31','Adventure','DOS, Apple II, TRS-80','Microsoft Adventure is a 1979 interactive fiction game from Microsoft, based on the PDP-10 mainframe game Colossal Cave Adventure, and released for the TRS-80, Apple II, and later for the IBM PC','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d95.jpg'),(8388,'Fate/Stay Night: First Press Limited Edition','2004-01-30','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The first release of Fate/Stay Night, released at a limited number, came with an alternate designed box & an a 100 page art & info booklet called the Side Material.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fde.jpg'),(8389,'Ballistic','2000-03-17','Puzzle, Arcade','Game Boy Color','Ballistic (also known as Puzz Loop) is a tile-matching arcade puzzle game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mjh.jpg'),(8390,'Campaign \'84','1983-06-01','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','ColecoVision','Campaign \'84 is a game developed by Sunrise Software and released for the ColecoVision in 1983. It is a political simulator in which the player must run for president in the 1984 American presidential elections.\n\nThe plot involves the player campaigning in the continental U.S. to become the president of the United States. The player has a limited amount of time to play as well as random events which may come up. The player must focus on many comical issues like reducing Pet Rock unemployment or controlling water guns.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co985p.jpg'),(8391,'Scrolls of the Lord','2017-11-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scrolls of the Lord is a classic fantasy from the first person, taking as a basis the best games in this genre. \n \nWe have to play for the criminal sentenced to death, but at the behest of the case, escaped her having escaped in the most unusual way. \nWe have to visit the parallel world - reveal its secrets and learn the stories of those who tried to do this before us. \n \n-The game presents 4 combat styles that can be used separately and combined to get the level you can develop one of them. \n-12 weapons each with its own characteristics. \n-Carefully read descriptions of items and experiment with fighting styles only then you can get a good ending.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8392,'Rock \'N Racing Off Road DX','2022-02-11','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Wii U, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The same top-down arcade racer as before, now with more tracks for a bigger game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xwh.jpg'),(8393,'Crash Bandicoot 4: It\'s About Time','2021-03-26','Platform','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Crash Bandicoot 4: It\'s About Time is the eighth Crash Bandicoot series game, though the fourth chronologically. The game retains the series\' core platforming gameplay and adds new elements through the use of the Quantum Masks, who can alter levels and provide means to traverse or overcome obstacles. It also includes additional game modes for replaying levels, and the ability to control five characters, three of whom – Cortex, Dingodile, and Tawna – have their own unique gameplay and levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hp4.jpg'),(8394,'Minecraft: Frozen','2019-11-22','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure','Amazon Fire TV, PlayStation 4, Gear VR, Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Arendelle, home of Anna, Elsa, Olaf and friends. Adventure past the Ice Palace and into the unknown in this Frozen themed world! Play mini-games and complete puzzles to earn rewards, then head back to decorate the castle, all while enjoying your favorite Frozen songs!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ndv.jpg'),(8395,'Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets: The Chamber Challenge','2003-03-11','Puzzle','DVD Player','This is a mini game included in the DVD release of Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets.\n\nThe Chamber Challenge: The main goal in this game is to get through the Chamber of Secrets and get to the secrets that lie in the chamber. However, many familiar faces are quick to stop you on your quest. In order to get past, you must answer their quiz questions correctly. The questions vary from matching to sequenced order, all based on specific scenes in the movie. If you get anything wrong, you must restart. If you manage to get them all correct, you are in grasp of all the secrets that lie in the chamber. However, the quiz is always the same and there is only one ending.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72dl.jpg'),(8396,'Unending Galaxy','2016-02-19','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unending Galaxy is a unique space-sim in which you can fill any role from pirate or trader to the leader of a large galactic empire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co406g.jpg'),(8397,'PogoChamp','2021-04-12','Platform, Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','PogoChamp is a physics-based 3D platformer where you can\'t walk. Instead, you\'ll need to tilt, jump, flip, and roll your way to the goal, without hitting your head.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kjn.jpg'),(8398,'Skelewton\'s First Law',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8399,'Conqueror\'s Blade: Season II - Wrath of the Nomads','2019-12-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A realm of infinite opportunity draws aspiring conquerors from afar, but there are those who have always been here, and always will be… Through the piercing bite of winter, drought, famine, and unspeakably blood-soaked chapters in their war-torn history, the nomadic tribes endure.\nThe Sons of the Steppes are warriors who hail from the great rolling steppes of the north. They live off the land while enduring the harshest environments, yet their combat skills have decided the fates of empires in the past. Knowledge is power, and their survival skills and history within this land makes many warlords eager to draw swords with them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3fjt.jpg'),(8400,'Claire de Lune','2021-07-12','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Claire de lune offers puzzle solving, platforming, stealth sequences and first person combat, combined with an engaging character-driven storyline. You play as John, a smuggler on the run with his daughter, Claire. After crash landing on a foreign planet, John is separated from Claire. He must use his ingenuity, agility, and a few handy pieces of technology to find Claire, repair his ship, and escape safely. However as John progresses further, he soon discovers that the planet is more mysterious than it initially seems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wqc.jpg'),(8401,'Crimson Song','2023-05-15','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','It was only meant to be another annual visit to his mother\'s grave, but midway through Diandrir\'s story was shrouded in darkness. A kinect visual novel about darkness and girls\' love.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qyd.jpg'),(8402,'House Mansion Flipper','2025-02-14','Puzzle, Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Rebuild, redesign and make your dream homes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d0d.jpg'),(8403,'Demon\'s Blood','2023-11-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Demon\'s Blood is a first-person shooter that throws you into a Demonic universe, Become a special agent, arm yourself and improve your equipment in different games to repel the demonic forces trying to invade your world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97tp.jpg'),(8404,'Blow & Fly','2022-04-15','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Fulfill your wildest dreams: become a blowfish that traverses the world by rolling on the floor! Take a deep breath, aim at your target and blow all the water out of your puny body to propel yourself in the air!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5brw.jpg'),(8405,'The Final Specimen: Arrival','2017-03-02','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Final Specimen is a comedic sci-fi adventure game in the style of the classic 2D platformers of the \'90s. Packed with whimsical settings and eccentric characters, this energetic, challenging title brings an exciting take to old-school gaming.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23cd.jpg'),(8406,'Egypt II: The Heliopolis Prophecy','2001-05-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation','The game is set in 1360 BC and Heliopolis, the City of the Sun, has been struck by a plague. The player\'s father has also been infected. In a first person perspective, the player must find a cure and save your father and the rest of Heliopolis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lho.jpg'),(8407,'Shattered Planet','2014-06-04','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Galactic Union\'s job for you is clear: research the alien wildlife -- for science! However, in this case, researching may include lasers, explosions, hungry aliens, space sushi, and other similarly delicious-or-terrifying hazards. In-between missions, use scrap metal you\'ve collected to upgrade your stats.\n\nWhether you survive or die, you\'ll come away better than you started.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rjf.jpg'),(8408,'Golf Club Nostalgia + The Cub Bundle','2024-10-04','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','A ruined Earth won’t ruin your fun in this bundle! In Golf Club Nostalgia, return to a desolate Earth for a few rounds of golf. After all, that’s what rich people do right?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jic.jpg'),(8409,'Coded Soul: Uketsugareshi Idea','2023-06-20','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hcm.jpg'),(8410,'Typing Hero','2019-11-27','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In a world filled with Zombies, a Spec Ops squad tries to survive and make their way through Hordes of Zombies to reach their final destination.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91c4.jpg'),(8411,'Time Travelling Navy Seal Ninja Warrior','2019-07-24','Adventure, Indie','Oculus VR, Windows Mixed Reality, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Using the skills of a Navy Seal and the grace of a Ninja Warrior, travel through time to different eras to defeat the forces of evil! Use stealth and mercy to avoid damaging the space time continuum. Or ignore that and kill everyone!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97zw.jpg'),(8412,'Ouija Escape VR','2024-08-15','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','SteamVR','BEWARE THE EVIL THAT IS OUIJA. now you must escape the evil and save your soul before its to late. experience the scares and the dark truth behind what happened. each question you ask the board, you might not like the answers can you survive the terror.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8osf.jpg'),(8413,'Do Not','2024-12-25','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do Not is an analog horror game set in a \'90s donut fast food restaurant. You\'re the night shift worker at a Donut&Go on the outskirts of town. Few customers, lots of silence... but try not to die of fright!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97if.jpg'),(8414,'Crusader Kings II: Customization Pack',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mfe.jpg'),(8415,'Christmas Wonderland 13: Collector\'s Edition','2022-12-30','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Santa’s Magical Christmas Wonderland Adventure for All the Family to Enjoy! Enjoy magnificent Holiday Festivities in Springfield. Help Santa at the North Pole.\n\nThe Collector’s Edition includes:\n- Check out spectacular bonus locations for more holiday fun!\n- Enjoy exclusive wallpapers and seasonal soundtrack\n- Explore the mega collection of bonus puzzles\n- Earn special Extreme Mode rewards','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7w0v.jpg'),(8416,'Overtime Anomaly','2025-03-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re working overtime again in your dead-end job, whilst your boss is on vacation. However, strange things are happening throughout the office. Complete your daily work tasks, explore your office, report any anomalies you may find, and you may just find yourself getting a promotion...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kth.jpg'),(8417,'Tecmo World Cup Super Soccer','1996-12-31','Sport','Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','Tecmo World Cup Super Soccer is quite different from the similarly-named Tecmo World Cup Soccer. In this football (soccer) game players can choose between competing for the World Cup or participating in the Japanese league tournament. Only eight international teams (Brazil, Argentine, Japan, England, France, Spain, Italy, and Germany) are available. Before a match begins players can choose between three general strategies for the team - normal, offensive, or defensive. Weather conditions (normal, rain, or snow) and match length can be selected as well. The game itself is played from a third-person perspective that slightly switches between isometric and top-down depending on the situation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n2q.jpg'),(8418,'The Eastermansion','2009-04-11','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a fan-made standalone game that uses the Tomb Raider The Last Revelation engine while creating its own story and puzzles. This TRLE was made for Easter.\n\nThis TRLE was placed in the trle.net hall of fame in 2012.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lc7.jpg'),(8419,'Dragon Ball: Sparking! Zero - Ultimate Edition','2024-10-07','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','DRAGON BALL: Sparking! ZERO takes the legendary gameplay of the Budokai Tenkaichi series and raises it to whole new levels. Learn and master an incredible roster of playable characters, each with signature abilities, transformations, and techniques. Unleash the fighting spirit within you and take the fight to arenas that crumble and react to your power as the battle rages on.\nThe Ultimate Edition includes:\n\nDRAGON BALL: Sparking! ZERO base game disc\nCollectible lenticular card with Ultimate Edition upgrade pack voucher\nSeason Pass - 3 Packs including Dragon Ball Super: SUPER HERO and Dragon Ball DAIMA content that contains more than 20 playable characters.\nSeason Pass Bonus - Summon Shenron and 3 Days Early Access to the 3 DLC Packs\n3 Days Early Access\nUltimate Upgrade Pack - including the following in-game items:\nGoku (Super) Costume with Power Pole\nEmote Voice Set\n2 player card backgrounds\n1 customization item that increases a character\'s fighting ability\nUltimate Edition Bonus - Summon Super Shenron','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8him.jpg'),(8420,'The Simorgh','2022-11-10','Adventure','Playdate','A text-based adventure for the Playdate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kdp.jpg'),(8421,'Crash Team Racing Nitro-Fueled','2019-06-21','Racing, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Crash Team Racing Nitro-Fueled is a kart racing game developed by Beenox and published by Activision. It is a remaster of Crash Team Racing, which was originally developed by Naughty Dog for the PlayStation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wvy.jpg'),(8422,'Economy Bundle',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k0a.jpg'),(8423,'Conquests of the Longbow: The Legend of Robin Hood','1991-12-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','DOS, Amiga','Conquests of the Longbow is an adventure game and a follow-up to Conquests of Camelot. It uses an icon-based interface common to most contemporary Sierra adventures. Like its spiritual predecessor, it differs from most other games in the genre by reducing traditional inventory-based puzzles in favor of exploration and varied tasks dictated by the situation at hand. These include talking to characters, gathering information, making decisions, solving riddles, or participating in mini-games such as combat, archery contest, and Nine Men\'s Morris (with adjustable difficulty).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6z2w.jpg'),(8424,'Nancy Drew: Secret of the Scarlet Hand','2002-08-12','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Expose Buried Secrets and Catch a Thief Red-handed!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qsu.jpg'),(8425,'Millennium Atoll',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','a singleplayer sci-fi adventure game where you play as a a former child-soldier and his son uncovering the largest conspiracy in world history.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3odf.jpg'),(8426,'Stratum Descent','2024-11-20','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Stratum Descent: a thrilling rogue-lite card game where you forge customizable cards, navigate through dangerous stratums, and confront powerful stratum lords. Upgrade your character, collect relics, and delve deeper into an ever-challenging journey. How far will you descend?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7iet.jpg'),(8427,'Transformers Beyond Reality','2022-09-01','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation VR2, PlayStation VR','Transformers Beyond Reality is an arcade-style first-person VR shooter. Join the fight as one of the first human recruits and immerse yourself in the world of the TRANSFORMERS. Battle alongside your favourite Autobots as you fight to defeat the Decepticons and save both Earth and Cybertron.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55tu.jpg'),(8428,'Jump Boy','2020-01-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jump up the small steps, take a rainbow bath in the final toilet, and you will enter the next level','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lt4.jpg'),(8429,'Aperture Desk Job','2022-03-01','Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aperture Desk Job reimagines the been-there-done-that genre of walking simulators and puts them in the lightning-spanked, endorphin-gorged world of sitting still behind things.\n\nYou play as an entry-level nobody on their first day at work — your heart full of hope and your legs full of dreams, eager to climb that corporate ladder. But life’s got other plans, and they all involve chairs.\n\nDesigned as a free playable short for Valve’s new Steam Deck, Desk Job walks you through the handheld’s controls and features, while not being nearly as boring as that sounds.\n\nLower your expectations: This is not a sequel to Portal. Now get ready to raise them slightly, because it is in the expanded universe of those games. Desk Job puts you squarely in the driver’s seat at Aperture Science. Then quickly removes the driving part and adds a desk in front of the seat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ibh.jpg'),(8430,'Golden Yoshi\'s Island','2018-08-08','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Golden Yoshi\'s Island is a ROM Hack of Yoshi\'s Island built to be played for live audiences in a speedrunning setting. It\'s a modified version of SMW2+2 by Golden Yoshi (with his full consent).\n\nThis hack features several optimizations to make it a faster run than its source material, based on feedback from the Yoshi speedrunning community:\n\n-36 levels hand-picked from the original ROM Hack\'s 50 and rearranged into 4 worlds.\n-Default egg aim setting is now Hasty\n-Transformation sequence has been sped up\n-World-clear cutscene has been removed\n-Message box upon collecting first flower has been removed\n-Autoscrolling sections removed\n-New tech to skip vehicle sections\n-Various other sections of levels have been modified for brevity and consistency\n-Entering the top secret code now triggers the credits sequence\n-Brand new title screen and credits sequence, courtesy of Mattrizzle','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rgo.jpg'),(8431,'Pixel Cross Stitch: Simple Patterns Pack 4','2024-12-05','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Like our patterns? Here\'s 20 more!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8432,'Menacer','1992-02-01','Shooter','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','The Menacer 6-Game Cartridge is a cartridge containing six light gun games for use with the Sega Menacer. The Menacer came bundled with this cartridge, and predictably it is not compatible with any other Mega Drive peripheral.\nIncluded games:\n\nPest Control\nSpace Station Defender\nReady, Aim, Tomatoes!\nWhack Ball\nFront Line\nRockman\'s Zone','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bkisdavm5qpgtjzrbsbl.jpg'),(8433,'Maverick Hunters: Dawn of Sorrow',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Play as X, Zero or Vile from Mega Man X in this Julius Mode hack. All Content from the original game is pre-unlocked, allowing Maverick Hunter Mode to be played immediately. New music tracks and more were imported for this romhack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9chz.jpg'),(8434,'Battle City','1991-08-09','Shooter','Game Boy','Game Boy port of Battle City.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vvb.jpg'),(8435,'Todesangst','2001-04-13','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Todesangst is a single player Half-Life modification, which follows an alternate timeline where the nuclear destruction of Black Mesa and the Seven Hour War never happened.\n\nGordon is back from Xen, and it\'s all business as usual. That is, until a sinister scientist named Jack Newell, motivated by morbid curiosity and seething hatred of Gordon, decides to start another bloodbath, forcing Gordon and his friend Joe to put a stop to his experiments with Xen creatures.\n\nTodesangst (pronounced TOH-dess-ahngst) is a German word that literaly means fear of death, but is usually translated as meaning terror or dread.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94oy.jpg'),(8436,'Mr. Yo-Yo','2019-09-15','Arcade','Atari 2600','You control Mr. Yo-Yo. You are given five lives at the start of the game – one in play, and another four in reserve. The object of the game is to descend to the bottom of the cave, and rescue the Notelies by returning them to the top of the cave. When a Notely is ready to be rescued, he will appear in the little bucket area at the bottom of the cave. To pick up the Notely, descend to the bottom of your string. Mr. Yo-Yo will begin flashing various colors to indicate you’ve picked up a Notely. Then, return to the top of the screen to release the Notely to freedom! Mr. Yo-Yo will then return to his normal color, and you can get ready to rescue the next Notely. Sometimes, you may have to shoot some enemies to get the Notelies to appear. The further you get into a level of caves, the more timid the Notelies become. You’ll have to shoot more and more enemies for them to have enough courage to appear.\n\nThere are five different types of creatures inside the caves (Blobs, Flappers, Bouncers, Stunners, and Snippers). If Mr. Yo-Yo comes in contact with any of them, he’ll lose a life. Some of these creatures may also interact with Mr. Yo-Yo’s string in various ways. So be sure to keep an eye out above you if you’re spending a lot of time at the bottom of one of the caves!\n\nYou\'ll find various objects in the caves that can help you out. Coins, which you can collect or shoot. Power Pods, which you can also collect or shoot, but it\'s better to collect them (just as with the coins). However, shooting a Power Pod will clear the screen of enemies! Bonus Targets fly around in Bonus Caves -- shooting ten of them will cause the Bonus Gem to appear. Collect the Bonus Gem and bring it to the top of the cave before the time expires for a large point bonus and extra life!\n\nThe game ends when you have lost all your lives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75ju.jpg'),(8437,'Wizards & Warriors','1988-07-15','Platform, Adventure','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','You are Kuros, a powerful knight who enter the woods of Elrond. Legend says that a powerful wizard named Malkil has has gone completely mad during his years and turned his powerful magic to the dark side. Malkil has his base on the castle IronSpire where he has imprisoned a young and beautiful princess. It is up to Kuros to save the princess once and for all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wgh.jpg'),(8438,'Streets of Rage 2: New Era',NULL,'Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A fan-made port of Streets of Rage 2 to modern platforms. SOR2 was ported manually via reverse engineering to create the best version of the game ever!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8439,'3D Shinobi III: Return of the Ninja Master','2013-12-19','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Nintendo 3DS','Joe Musashi’s sworn enemies, the Neo Zeed, have returned!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3uld.jpg'),(8440,'Persona 4 Arena Ultimax','2014-08-28','Fighting, Visual Novel','Arcade, PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Nintendo Switch','Persona 4 Arena Ultimax is a fighting video game developed by Arc System Works and Atlus. It is the direct sequel to Persona 4 Arena, which is itself a follow-up to the role-playing game Persona 4. The game was originally released in Japanese arcades on November 28, 2013, and later ported to home consoles. Unlike the previous game, it is not region locked.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k1y.jpg'),(8441,'Gal*Gun VR','2017-08-09','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Put the VR headset on and enter a world where you are the most popular guy around! Dreams do come true! The legendary arcade-shooting game \"Gal*Gun\" is here in VR!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1n1u.jpg'),(8442,'Red Wings: Aces of the Sky','2020-10-13','Shooter, Simulator, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Red Wings: Aces of the Sky is a dynamic action game that will show you amazing battles from the pages of the history in a brand new arcade gameplay style. Use your unique skills to take your opponents down, develop your deadly pilot aim and become the true ace of the sky.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hdq.jpg'),(8443,'Mr. Steal Yo Wifi','2018-01-28','Platform, Strategy, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sneak your way around the building to download pictures on your neighbour\'s wifi. Hide from their sight behind curtains, inside the shower or the closets, and whistle to distract them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cflj7bv0fxukqqjvabkz.jpg'),(8444,'Banned Tapes','2025-03-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are a filmmaker and recently purchased a box of VHS tapes at a flea market. Now you need to look through them and select tapes on which occur supernatural, violent, horrifying scenes...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gr1.jpg'),(8445,'Touhou Spell Bubble: Touhou Eiyashou - Arrangements Pack','2021-04-15','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','This new Music pack, \"Touhou Eiyashou Arrangements Pack” contains new arrangements of six popular Touhou Eiyashou (Eternal Night) songs and six challenge stages go to with each song.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yze.jpg'),(8446,'Memorrha','2019-09-27','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Go on a voyage of discovery following the traces of a mysterious culture. Discover diverse landscapes, investigate abandoned artifacts, and wake strange machines from their slumber.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m64.jpg'),(8447,'Race07',NULL,'Racing, Sport','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8448,'Shopping Fever','2025-02-06','Puzzle, Racing, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Let the shopping fever get the best of you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dpl.jpg'),(8449,'Naheulbeuk\'s Dungeon Master','2024-07-09','Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Build, Manage & defend your dungeon in this satirical heroic fantasy universe of Dungeon of Naheulbeuk. From a shaky establishement to an infamous lair','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lyj.jpg'),(8450,'Mawaskes','2008-12-11','Puzzle','PlayStation Portable','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co724e.jpg'),(8451,'Henry Danger Crime Warp','2017-11-15','Platform','Android, iOS','Kid Danger and Captain Man are back chasing bad guys through time and space! This time their adventures take them to the Groovetopia dimension of Sky Whale! You’ll battle toga-clad bears, hot dog slinging turtles, and even face off with Frankini as you free Groovetopia from his evil clutches! Get ready to punch, jump and kick your way through this funky, groovy world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54dv.jpg'),(8452,'Blackhawk Striker 2','2004-08-02','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Blackhawk Striker 2, you\'re a pilot for the 365 Assault Helicopter Co. Your job is to fly your bird with turbine power, 10 grunts, and a ton of grit. As the last pilot on this mission after a brutal night of heavy attacks, you\'ll need to fuel up and make a quick stop at the arming pits for some linked 7.62 for the M-60\'s. Colonel Jackson, a former West Point Officer, has hand-picked you to be his ace gunner along with a top-level flight crew. He clenches your shoulder and passes you a mission log from a well-known pilot, Jim \"Ironhawk\" Jones. \"Good luck,\" says Colonel Jackson, \"make us proud.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9br7.jpg'),(8453,'Lode Runner: Lost Labyrinth','1990-07-27','Platform, Puzzle','TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','This TurboGrafx-16 release of Lode Runner allows users to create and save levels, much like the original computer-based releases.\n\nA very straightforward conversion of a popular puzzle platform game. You must collect the piles of gold on each level, while avoiding the robots on patrol. To defend yourself, you are able to shoot holes in the platforms to your left or right, and these will capture the robots for a short time before they climb out again. Once you have collected all the gold, make your way to the top of the screen for the next level. The game also includes a level editor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kef.jpg'),(8454,'Odin Sphere','2008-03-13','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','The nation of Valentine was once a grand kingdom with powerful magic. With the power of a magical relic known as the \"Cauldron,\" King Valentine subdued the neighboring nations and brought them under his control. His kingdom enjoyed a long period of prosperity... but a sudden disaster destroyed it overnight. War broke out between the Fairy Kingdom of Ringford and the warrior nation of Ragnanival over ownership of the now-abandoned Cauldron, and control of the wasteland that was once Valentine.\n\nWith the battle growing fiercer by the day, Demon Lord Odin, King of Ragnanival, sets forth a plan to conquer Ringford and claim the Cauldron once and for all. Meanwhile, in the neutral realm of Titania, King Edmund had become a puppet king of his court sorcerer Urzur, who schemes to follow a forgotten prophecy and bring about the Armageddon; a prophecy stating that the world will be destroyed in five great disasters, but the survivors will become kings. As the nations struggle for control, the world steadily slips unknowingly toward its demise, and the prophecies become clear...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25ur.jpg'),(8455,'Potion Party','2022-05-05','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Potion Party is a funny couch co-op alchemy game for one to four players. Working as a team, you and your friends must manage your own alchemy shop. Earn money, upgrade your tools, decorate the shop and become a master alchemist!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g4x.jpg'),(8456,'LEGO Star Wars: The Skywalker Saga - Rogue One: A Star Wars Story Character Pack','2022-04-19','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','It takes an unlikely band of heroes to save the rebellion. With their weapons and skills, these heroes (and a villain) are ready for battle. The character pack includes: Jyn Erso, Cassian Andor, Baze Malbus, Bodhi Rook, Chirrut Îmwe, Director Krennic, K-2SO','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qvd.jpg'),(8457,'Cyber Mission','2023-09-25','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Side-scroller, with beautiful 2D pixel art, addictive shooter gameplay, classic levels and weapons that will let you perform a symphony of destruction of the alien base in the black eye galaxy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co690n.jpg'),(8458,'Dogyuun','2024-04-08','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A science fiction-themed vertically scrolling shoot \'em up game known for its stunning detailed pixel art, gigantic bosses, and a menacing difficulty. From the legendary studio Toaplan, this is quite possibly the most rock and roll shooting game of all time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83f3.jpg'),(8459,'Eternal Fate','2014-09-19','Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Join the world of Eternal Fate! Collect hundreds of mighty heroes and defeat the Corruption from your PC or mobile devices. Whether you want to roll through endless dungeons with your guild, or battle it out in multiple PvP arenas, Eternal Fate has something for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vv6ad3vygsmx47ten079.jpg'),(8460,'Eormor: Shattered Lands','2019-11-08','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A hand-drawn empire building game set in a fictional medieval world. The Kingdom of Eormor has collapsed. Chaos spreads throughout the lands as the old order tries to retain control and new noble houses try to claim their piece of the world. Will your house succeed in these shattered lands?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pxi.jpg'),(8461,'Conquest of the Crystal Palace','1990-11-01','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','Return to the once beautiful Crystal Palace where your father\'s kingdom was brutally overthrown by Zaras, king of the infernal plateau. Call upon your guardian dog. Zap and battle your way through the peaks of Mount Crystal. Find Kim at the astral-mart, she will help you along your way with tools and food needed to make this awesome journey. Step into the Realm of the Guardian, the walkway to impending doom. Acid rain is forecasted by QNN... so keep your eyes on the road ahead. Beware! You will fight the biggest, meanest enemies ever seen on the NES! Investigate the Lair of Hungry Ghosts, gather special weaponry and gold. Enter the Gateway of Flame. Look out! The pathway has disappeared and there\'s only a moment between you and a sea of lava. These tasks and much more must be accomplished if you wish to regain your rightful throne!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yut.jpg'),(8462,'Grey\'s Anatomy: The Video Game','2009-03-10','Simulator, Adventure','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo DS','Play as all your favorite characters and perform life-or-death operations in this all-new Grey\'s Anatomy story.\nImmerse yourself for the first time in this all-new Grey\'s Anatomy story written in collaboration with the TV show writers. Play as your favorite characters as you strive to save Seattle Grace Hospital from its worst crisis yet. Influence the outcome of the storyline and perform all the multi-step surgeries that the series is known for.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dcx.jpg'),(8463,'Buzludzha VR','2019-11-20','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','Step into this immersive VR experience and explore a reimagined version of the abandoned UFO-shaped Buzludzha monument. Learn about the building’s history and immerse yourself shooting with wine guns, flying a helicopter around the structure, playing the grand piano or climbing the 70m high tower.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mog.jpg'),(8464,'ZanZan','2000-05-18','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3jeu.jpg'),(8465,'Pokémon Project Studio: Red Version','1999-11-09','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This program lets the user create all kinds of Pokémon-related projects such as calendars or greeting cards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k6x.jpg'),(8466,'House Flipper: Pop Art Furniture Pack','2024-06-06','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Behold the mind-bending creations from the most twisted imaginations! You\'ll discover items that defy convention and redefine the meaning of pop-art. Post-modern sofas, freaky chairs, and gripping dressers? We\'ve got it all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fvb.jpg'),(8467,'Go Vacation','2018-07-27','Music, Racing, Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','In Go Vacation players explore four paradise resorts hosted on Kawawii Island: Marine, City, Mountain, and Snow. Over 50 activities are available on the island including bungee jumping, ice fishing, scuba diving, miniature golf, tennis, off-road racing, and snowman building. In the bungee jumping mini-game, players are challenged by needing to brake as close to the ground as possible. The island can be explored at leisure and navigated by walking, rollerblading, or riding on an ATV.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l2b.jpg'),(8468,'Stargate',NULL,'Shooter, Platform, Puzzle','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Super Famicom','Warp through the Stargate to an intergalactic dimension of non-stop action, danger and adventure! Face a hostile and unknown world in over 30 missions. From the village of Naganda to Ra\'s pyramid spacecraft, you\'re armed with an arsenal of weapons and incredible alien fire power. It\'s up to you to defeat the evil ruler Ra and unlock the mystery of the Stargate! It will take you a million light years from home... but can you find your way back?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3e0l.jpg'),(8469,'Anime Princess: Cosplay ASMR','2023-06-16','Simulator','Android, iOS','Have you ever dreamt of cosplaying as an anime magic princess? Anime Princess: Cosplay ASMR will make your dreams come true!\nAnime Princess: Cosplay ASMR is a cosplaying fashionable simulation game with cute anime girl style, suitable for all age girls to play.\n\nIn Anime Princess: Cosplay ASMR, you can cosplay and dress your own anime doll image. Step into the anime girl dress-up cosplaying room, collect exquisite fashion items to fill your wardrobe, and customize the princess styles you like. Not only can you enjoy the fun of DIY your styles, but also Anime Princess: Cosplay ASMR has lots of character outfits, like royal-themed outfits, school-themed outfits, and so on.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87qq.jpg'),(8470,'Dragon Ball Z',NULL,'Arcade','Plug & Play','Plug & Play from Jakks Pacific released in 2005. There are 3 main modes available:\n\n• Buto-Retsuden: Arcade Mode in which you have to compete in 1v1 matches. The sprites look similar to the SNES DBZ games\n• Kamehameha Assault: Try to conquer all 7 Dragon Balls in a kind of \"pong\" clone\n• Pinball: Search for secret triggers and collects as much points as possible: you\'ll unlock a boss fight and if you win, you\'ll get a Dragon Ball. Conquer all 7 and a wish of yours will come true','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6aca.jpg'),(8471,'The Idolmaster: Cinderella Girls - Gravure for You! Vol.8','2016-01-28','Sin género','PlayStation 3','This volume continues the ability to take pictures of two idols at a time, and to add music from CDs into the BGM list. When the selected idol wears the Dreamy Wedding or Dark Rose Fantasy outfits, the player can take pictures of the idols sitting with the dress\' skirt billowing around them.\nIdol Focus: Chieri Ogata\nCostumes: Dark Rose Fantasy, Bikini of Siren, Dreamy Wedding\nLocations: Halloween Manor, Nighttime Beach, Church','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rlx.jpg'),(8472,'Amaze Classic','2018-05-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Amaze Classic is a straightforward and surprisingly - difficult celebration of the simple beauty of the maze with abstraction art and calm soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3let.jpg'),(8473,'Ancient Spirits: Columbus\' Legacy','2023-12-29','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A mysterious ghost story, a gripping thriller, a historical hidden object adventure. A 500 year-old galleon is found on the beach of a deserted village. The ship, laden with a mysterious artefact, belonged to Christopher Columbus and was thought to have simply vanished. Investigate the mystery...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hr6.jpg'),(8474,'Super Puzzle Fighter II Turbo','1996-05-31','Puzzle, Arcade','Arcade, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','The game\'s title is a parody of Super Street Fighter II Turbo (or Super Street Fighter II X in Japan), as there are no other Puzzle Fighter games, and the game includes music and interface elements spoofing the Street Fighter Alpha and Darkstalkers games. It was a response to SEGA\'s popular Puyo Puyo 2 that has been sweeping Japanese arcade.\n\nA HD-remake version titled Super Puzzle Fighter II Turbo HD Remix, is available for purchase on Microsoft\'s Xbox Live Arcade and Sony\'s PlayStation Network.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8e94.jpg'),(8475,'Cell Scientist: Beyond','2024-10-30','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','An exciting puzzle game with 50 levels story mode and easy to pick gameplay mechanics. Embark on an adventure to destroy viruses using futuristics nano ships and help the patients. Save the day using your puzzle-solving skills!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58ur.jpg'),(8476,'Kumoon: Ballistic Physics Puzzle','2015-11-10','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A trickshooting challenge! Jump, run, hover and ricochet your projectiles through 48 levels ranging from all ages easy to reasonable challenges for any gamer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bfsiilkygvu6bh1geytb.jpg'),(8477,'Car Detailing & Wash Simulator: Luxury Car Cleaner','2025-02-07','Racing, Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Luxury Cars, Flawless Shine – Master the Art of Detailing!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aq8.jpg'),(8478,'Parodius','1990-07-30','Shooter, Arcade','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','This is mostly the parody of Gradius (Nemesis on some systems), with some flavor from other shoot-em-ups, like Twinbee. The series is available on numerous platforms.\n\nThe game is a right-to-left scrolling shoot-em-up. You can choose from 4 different flying creatures, with different weapons. You must finish 7 stages, each having a boss at the end. You may start at either one, but must complete every level to advance to the final stage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xwk.jpg'),(8479,'Build the Bridge','2010-12-31','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Physics game – build bridges so trains can get across safely.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r92.jpg'),(8480,'The Monkey Wrench Conspiracy','1999-12-30','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Monkey Wrench Conspiracy \"mod\" puts you in the role of an intergalactic secret agent dispatched to deep space to rescue the Copernicus station from alien hijackers. It is a complete tutorial for a complex technical product, designed to teach industrial engineers how to use new 3-D design software.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pstytpus2706cl87xdnq.jpg'),(8481,'Cooking Simulator: Pizza','2020-11-12','Simulator, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','MAKE DELICIOUS PIZZA Prepare dough and sauces using authentic recipes, or mix various ingredients to come up with your own homemade concoctions. Bake 3 different sizes of pizza using a brick oven, and add a personal touch to every order with dozens of realistic ingredients! CAREER AND SANDBOX MODES Master the art of making pizza in Career mode. Decide which orders you want to fill and take your time to prepare the most delicious pizzas. Unlock new perks and ingredients and complete various quests focusing on different aspects of baking and serving pizza. Play the Sandbox mode to get instant access to all the ingredients and recipes and take as much time as you want to prepare whatever pizzas you can imagine! ITALIAN PIZZERIA Take control over a cozy Italian pizzeria consisting of 3 working areas: a fully-stocked pantry, a prep kitchen, and an oven area. The place looks stylish and has all the utensils and workspace you’ll need to master the art of crafting top-quality, authentic pizza!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co854b.jpg'),(8482,'Saw Lab','2024-03-20','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Saw Lab: Test Your Survival InstinctIn a world where every second could be your last, your fate lies in the hands of a mad genius. \"Saw Lab\" is not just a survival game it\'s a test of your mind, willpower, and ability to act under the pressure of unbearable fear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81fj.jpg'),(8483,'Tobu Tobu Girl','2017-12-03','Platform','Game Boy','In Tobu Tobu Girl, players bounce higher and higher into the sky in order to rescue a cat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rp8.jpg'),(8484,'Senkou no Clarias','2021-11-26','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Fantasy Mecha Action Game made by the same development team of the Baldr Series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4892.jpg'),(8485,'Zombie and Juliet',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8486,'Arcade Archives: Atomic Robo-Kid','2016-09-30','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Atomic Robo-Kid is a shoot\'em up game released by UPL in 1988. The player will control an atomic Robo-Kid sized robot and proceed into the underground dungeon to fight with enemies using several types of weapons. So enjoy various stages in the game whether you\'re exploring the dungeon using free scroll or playing the battle mode fighting with the enemy one on one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ca8.jpg'),(8487,'Ego Protocol','2016-02-16','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','INNOVATIVE! ADDICTIVE! FASCINATING! LOGICAL! \nIt is EGO PROTOCOL, an award-winning action-packed puzzle platformer that will addict you from the first play!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40j2.jpg'),(8488,'Disney\'s Reading Quest with Aladdin','1998-12-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Your child will be whisked away to learning adventures that build essential reading skills and challenge the imagination. Genie, Jasmine, Iago, and the gang are here to cheer kids on with encouragement and helpful hints. Watch them improve their skill levels as they journey to free Aladdin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ptv.jpg'),(8489,'Alia\'s Carnival!','2019-11-15','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','The Sakumo ward is well known for its cherry blossoms. In recent years, as part of the redevelopment of the ward, an experimental education system was introduced where the students would govern themselves in the newly constructed Sakumodai Gakuin to improve the student life. Those students who are capable and work hard to improve the learning environment would receive various benefits. Also, it seemed that the one with the top results would get a special privilege.\n\nRen returned to Sakumo ward after a long time away and transferred into the school, reuniting with his timid little sister Karin and childhood friend Shiina, who had grown up to be very beautiful. On his first day at school, he was caught up in some trouble and ended up saving a girl. The girl Asuha asked him to join her club, aim for ALIA and change the school. He was puzzled over her sudden invitation, but was excited that his new school life will be surely be an exciting one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yim.jpg'),(8490,'A Tale of Synapse: The Chaos Theories','2021-06-30','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','A Tale of Synapse is a cross of platformer and puzzle game melting abstract art and sciences. Use the universe rules and all the element that compose it to help Synapsians to openminded. Discover an incredible and colorful story with Sci and Néro, two heroes, who cooperate to evolve in this oneiric world based on Math’s’ logics rules. The original soundtrack will immerse you in the universe of Hemeide. Are you able to enter this magical land? Play alone or co-op with your friend and develop your synapses to get more competencies, solve puzzles and fight enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bby.jpg'),(8491,'Pokémon Sword Expansion Pass','2020-01-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Continue your Pokémon Sword adventure in The Isle of Armor and The Crown Tundra, two new areas to explore that will be added to the Galar region as part of the Pokémon Sword Expansion Pass! Each area offers a different adventure, where you’ll be able to visit the far reaches of the Galar region and meet the people and Pokémon that live there. You’ll also see some familiar Pokémon that didn’t appear in the Galar region before, a total of over 200 Pokémon. If you buy the Pokémon Sword Expansion Pass, you’ll be able to enjoy both The Isle of Armor and The Crown Tundra as they’re released!\n\nThe Isle of Armor is full of different landscapes, including beaches, bogs, forests, and more. Here you’ll become the student of a former champion and train alongside the new Legendary Pokémon Kubfu. While this area is focused on growing as a trainer, The Crown Tundra is all about exploring uncharted territory! Traverse The Crown Tundra’s blizzard-swept expanse and the depths of Pokémon Dens as you unravel the mystery of the Legendary Pokémon Calyrex. These new areas aren’t just about training and exploring—there are new Gigantamax forms, clothes, items, and more to enjoy. Keep the adventure going with your existing Pokémon Sword save data and jump into this new expansion to Pokémon Sword. It looks like there’s more to the Galar region than meets the eye.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wdv.jpg'),(8492,'Burger Joint',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Welcome to Burger Joint, a strategy game where you both design a restaurant and grow a criminal enterprise. With these two sides of your operation working side by side, you can build your own thriving business. Be wary however, the police, FDA, and a rival cartel are just around the corner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mnr.jpg'),(8493,'Invasion Zero','2019-01-11','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Invasion Zero is a multi-player online free to play first-shooter game where you are able to play against enemy AI bots or players from all over the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g6f.jpg'),(8494,'Contender','1998-06-21','Fighting, Sport','PlayStation','A boxing game that straddles the line between arcade and sim. Known as Victory Boxing 2 in Europe, Contender was the first title in the series to be released outside of Europe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ii5.jpg'),(8495,'Streets of Rage 2: Puyo Wars','2014-12-18','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Puyo Puyo characters in Streets of Rage 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qzh.jpg'),(8496,'I Am Overburdened','2017-11-02','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','I Am Overburdened is a silly roguelike full of crazy artifacts and a \"hero\" who has 20 inventory slots.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2boa.jpg'),(8497,'Breach','1987-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','Atari ST/STE, Mac, DOS, Amiga','The first Breach in the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hdgfme6gvpxn443e36tu.jpg'),(8498,'Wi-Fi Taiou Yakuman DS','2006-09-14','Card & Board Game','Nintendo DS','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8499,'Humanities Legend: Dark Horizon','2023-09-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A segmented open world action-adventure game. Fight bosses, explore dungeons, and find magic abilities to push out the Dark form the land. Collect and level up to fight stronger enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co788i.jpg'),(8500,'The World Is Really Right!','2024-02-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a game made of rpg maker mv! A classic jrpg! Bring together people with different world views and backgrounds and meet here! There are swords and magic, infinite magic, bullets and fire, all kinds of fancy things, science and technology, ancient and endless unknown things here!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tc2.jpg'),(8501,'Starry Sky: in Spring 3D','2013-04-25','Visual Novel','Nintendo 3DS','Starry * Sky: In Spring 3D is an otome game, developed and published by honeybee, which was released in Japan in 2013.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4r4x.jpg'),(8502,'Hazard Pay',NULL,'Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this dark and mysterious block-pushing puzzler, you\'ll navigate through a secret, hazardous laboratory complex. Discover creative methods to destroy evidence and cover up the crimes of your employer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tt2.jpg'),(8503,'The Cake is Alive',NULL,'Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8504,'God of War: Betrayal','2007-06-20','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Legacy Mobile Device','Betrayal is the only installment in the series to be released on a non-PlayStation platform and presented as a 2D side-scrolling game. Despite the limitations of the mobile platform, in comparison to its home console counterparts, it retains the action-oriented approach of its predecessors, with the same combination of combo-based combat, platforming, and puzzle game elements. Although God of War is primarily a home console series, Betrayal was praised for its fidelity to the series in terms of gameplay, art style, and graphics: \"the real deal third game in the killer franchise\".\nIt received awards for \"Wireless Game of the Month\" (June 2007) and \"Best Platform Game\" (wireless) of 2007.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2edk.jpg'),(8505,'War of the Old Gods','2025-04-04','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The country is on the brink of a new war, and Oriana and her brother are caught between that and their own personal safety. Orion will have to learn from his older sister how to properly use his powers, because he knows that ultimately, he won\'t be able to avoid doing so.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9meu.jpg'),(8506,'Uncharted Waters Online','2005-03-03','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Discover yourself in the “Age of Discovery” where you’ll sail out into the uncharted waters! Discover real historical artifacts and mystical legends! Start a company and make enormous fortunes! Fight in fierce sea battles! Whatever your play style, you can play who you want and how you want in UWO!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hrc.jpg'),(8507,'Barbie Mermaid Adventure','2004-03-16','Point-and-click, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In Barbie Mermaid Adventure, Barbie assumes the role of a specimen of that mythical fish-human hybrid, the mermaid, and plans a party with all of her undersea friends. Unfortunately, a magical light shell in the main palace broke. In order to fix it, Barbie needs to enlist the help of 3 rainbow dolphins.\n\nExplore three exotic undersea worlds!; Play seven fun-filled games and activities!; Care for cuddlefish, free Whisper the whale, and more!; Collect decorations and hand out party invitations!; Help Mermaid Barbie and her friends compose the \"Song of the Sea\"!; Play two of a kind with school fish and watch them dance at the celebration and design a crown and necklace for Barbie to wear!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6t6j.jpg'),(8508,'Street Fighter X Tekken: Special Edition','2012-12-31','Fighting','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Street Fighter X Tekken is a crossover fighting game developed by Capcom and released in March 2012 for the PlayStation 3 and Xbox 360, in May for the PC and in October for the PlayStation Vita. The game features characters from both the Street Fighter franchise and Namco\'s Tekken series. In the game, players select two characters and face other duos in tag team fighting matches, in which the objective is to knock out one of the members from the opposing team. In addition to the game\'s multiplayer modes, the game also features a single-player Story mode with a plot revolving around a mysterious object called the \"Pandora\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4abh.jpg'),(8509,'Alien: Isolation - Ripley Edition','2014-10-07','Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','Discover the true meaning of fear in Alien: Isolation, a survival horror set in an atmosphere of constant dread and mortal danger. Fifteen years after the events of Alien™, Ellen Ripley\'s daughter, Amanda enters a desperate battle for survival, on a mission to unravel the truth behind her mother\'s disappearance. \n \nAs Amanda, you will navigate through an increasingly volatile world as you find yourself confronted on all sides by a panicked, desperate population and an unpredictable, ruthless Alien. \n \nUnderpowered and underprepared, you must scavenge resources, improvise solutions and use your wits, not just to succeed in your mission, but to simply stay alive. \n \nRipley Edition includes two bonus pieces of content: Last Survivor and Crew Expendable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1l4v.jpg'),(8510,'Warhammer 40,000: Sanctus Reach','2017-01-19','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warhammer 40,000: Sanctus Reach is a 3D turn-based strategy game like you\'ve never seen before: fast, immediate, deep, impressive to look at and incredibly fun! Fight through a dark era of carnage and endless war and lead the Space Wolves in a struggle to defend the last bastion of mankind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24ki.jpg'),(8511,'Akhra: The Treasures','2023-04-21','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Go on a journey into the fantastic world of Akhra! Construct and use the ancient, powerful artifacts in order to find all of the hidden treasures. Earn powerful skills you can use to solve the puzzles. Enjoy the peaceful music and relaxing atmosphere in this phantastic Match-3 game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7giz.jpg'),(8512,'Payday 2: Gage Chivalry Pack',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Time to explore the art of ancient warfare and get medieval on some asses.The Gage Chivalry Pack is the 28th DLC for PAYDAY 2 and is a collaboration between Torn Banner Studios and OVERKILL! Go medieval on D.C.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m04.jpg'),(8513,'Souls-Like Bundle',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tbx.jpg'),(8514,'Unionatic',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Unionatic is a real-time strategy game that deals with the ancient war of humans and creatures, while also defending your village by building and managing your troops.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ia6.jpg'),(8515,'Hiragana Hero','2024-12-02','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Learn to read, recognize, and use hiragana as you guide Keen Reflex through a 50-floor labyrinth in an addictive and educational dungeon crawler RPG.\nLearning to read [i]hiragana is the first step in your Japanese learning journey and it\'s the first hurdle that learners struggle to get over.\nThis addictive RPG dungeon crawler will have you reading Japanese in record time and cut out all that boring study.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89ol.jpg'),(8516,'BadLands','1990-12-31','Fighting, Shooter, Racing','Arcade, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','Badlands is effectively the spiritual successor to Atari\'s previous racing games Super Sprint and Championship Sprint. Similarly to the Sprint titles, Badlands pits three cars against each other in a three lap race around a small, single-screen circuit. Bonuses are present in the form of wrenches which can be traded for goods such as extra speed, extra acceleration or better tires\n\nUnlike the Sprint games, Badlands expands upon the formula, taking place in a post-apocalyptic environment and equipping each of the players with cannons. In reality, the cannons do little except to slow cars down by repeatedly shooting at them, but the shop between levels offers the possibility of arming the car with missiles which will destroy the target car, placing it at a severe disadvantage as a replacement is brought onto the track, taking a few seconds.\n\nThe tracks also featured a number of new obstacles, including mines and retractable barricades.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92pv.jpg'),(8517,'Ruinsmagus: Complete',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Complete the Magic – The complete edition of RUINSMAGUS includes both the main game and its DLC, The Warrior and the Tailor, all in one convenient bundle. Everything is included! This also includes full English voice-over, and you can also enjoy the original Japanese voice-over with English subtitles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72aw.jpg'),(8518,'Campaign Leipzig',NULL,'Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','The dynamic battles of the Spring Campaign of 1813 had seen the French victorious at both Lutzen (May 2nd) and Bautzen (May 20-21). However, they lacked all of the essential elements of a great army to bring the war to a successful conclusion. This was due to the severe cavalry losses in Russia and the lack of Napoleon\'s subordinate commanders to successfully operate on their own. Shortly after Bautzen an armistice was agreed upon and both sides used the time to rebuild their forces. During this period Austria and Sweden joined the Sixth Coalition and the numbers tipped dramatically in the Allies\' favor. \n \nNow you can refight the famous battles of the Fall Campaign of 1813 such as Leipzig and Dresden. March in the steps of the young French conscripts or lead the Prussian landwehr towards the French lines with Blucher\'s famous cry of \"Vorwarts meine kinder!\" All of the armies of the 1813 Fall Campaign await your command. \n \nCampaign Leipzig is the product of three years of research and design. The scenarios represent the titanic struggle that engulfed Germany during the Fall Campaign of 1813. A large assortment of units are represented such as the vaunted Prussian Leib Hussars and La Grande Armee\'s Old Guard. New program features help to accurately portray the unique features of this campaign. Players can wage the entire Fall Campaign as well as five other, subsidiary campaigns ranging from the efforts to take Berlin to MacDonald\'s failed attempt to defeat the Army of Silesia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vqw.jpg'),(8519,'Last Remains','2023-12-25','Fighting, Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Last Remains is a 50-player zombie battle royale game where survivors compete in a PvPvE world and take risks on their journey to the extraction point by searching buildings to find food, water, and digital collectible skins such as equipment and weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hcl.jpg'),(8520,'Anime Girls vs. Soldiers',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','This game basically anime soldiers fight game. Very very dark story(NONE) and some losses(NONE) Oh Anime Girls very upset now and soldiers to. Cover yourself because they are very very angry. You have to be in life and you have to take high score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57wv.jpg'),(8521,'Operation Hardcore','2016-12-28','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Operation Hardcore is an action-packed 2D side-scrolling shooter inspired by classic twitchy action games of yesteryear, but with modern touches and conveniences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22t2.jpg'),(8522,'Shark Attack','2010-06-11','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It is the year 30XX and Earth is at peace thanks to the Shark Attack Force, a group of humanoid sharks made to fight terrorists and criminals. The human race had launched a new space shuttle to explore the galaxy, and despite its success of discovering new life forms and planets, a mysterious life form breached the shuttle and directed the ship toward Earth. With Earth now at risk of war and invasion, Shark Attack has been sent to deal with this threat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co292z.jpg'),(8523,'Darkness of the Coast',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Your in a third person character view playing as an 18- year old boy called Anders whos scared of the world and his fate. The game is action-packed as the character can attack the enemies in the third person, swim, and even drive. The game is filled with cutscenes as it gives the story good balance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5czf.jpg'),(8524,'There Will Be Ink','2019-09-06','Shooter, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','There Will Be Ink is a tactical action game for 1-4 players. Play solo or with friends in battles between stick figure armies on a paper notepad, just like you used to draw in class instead of paying attention!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co442e.jpg'),(8525,'Aurora: A Child\'s Journey','2020-11-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aurora: A Child\'s Journey is a short and emotional game about the impacts of a huge environmental disaster through the eyes and feelings of a child.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2y8o.jpg'),(8526,'Loondon',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8527,'Zector 7','2024-10-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight zombies with your friends in this survival open-world sci-fi. Harvest, Craft, Build, and purchase better gear and vehicles to survive the night. Explore and loot abandoned bases, crashed ships, caves, alien temples, and outposts to become the ultimate survivor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84hz.jpg'),(8528,'Mario Party: Fushigi no Koro-koro Catcher','2009-12-31','Card & Board Game','Arcade','Mario Party: Fushigi no Koro-koro Catcher is an arcade medal game based on Mario Party 8. Up to 16 players can play at once. It includes some boards and minigames from the aforementioned Nintendo Wii title, although some are modified. Gameplay also revolves around a rotating carousel in the middle containing balls, which the player must try to grab with a crane at certain points in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co223b.jpg'),(8529,'Shin Megami Tensei V: Vengeance - Demon Subquest: Sakura Cinders of the East','2024-06-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Additional content that will grant access to the subquest \"Sakura Cinders of the East\".\n\nIn this quest, players will be able to take on \"Konohana Sakuya\", and even recruit her should they prove victorious.\n\n*After progressing to a certain point in the game, talk to the Bethel researcher in the Tokyo Diet Building to begin the subquest.\n*It is recommended that this subquest be attempted at least halfway through the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cv2.jpg'),(8530,'Fastigium: Dead End','2017-03-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fastigium: Dead End is a VR game (FPS) designed by ifgames studio. \n \nFastigium: Dead End is the 2nd edition of , it provides 3 huge maps which players could move freely. The further you explore, the more fatal dangers you will face to. Take your weapon! Fight your way out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bcw.jpg'),(8531,'Rethawed',NULL,'Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Breathe new life into Tony Hawk\'s American Wasteland on PC with reTHAWed, a comprehensive mod that injects the game with a massive dose of fresh content and long-awaited fixes.\n\nShred with a legendary roster of skaters, including those previously cut from the game or those that hail from other Tony Hawk\'s Pro Skater titles.\n\nreTHAWed doesn\'t just expand your skater selection, it lets you customize them further than ever with a wealth of new clothing, hats, and deck options.\n\nExperience classic levels from across the Tony Hawk\'s franchise all while battling\nyour friends online thanks to the mods restored and improved multiplayer functionality.\n\nOn top of that, reTHAWed tackles lingering bugs in the original game, introduces a custom launcher for ease of use, and even throws in widescreen support and adjustable physics for a fine-tuned skateboarding experience.\n\nWith frequent updates adding even more content, reTHAWed is the ultimate way to revisit and revitalize Tony Hawk\'s American Wasteland.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zi3.jpg'),(8532,'Dark Eyes: BattleGate','2001-03-15','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','WonderSwan Color','Dark Eyes: BattleGate is a Strategy RPG game, developed by NexTech and published by Bandai, which was released in Japan in 2001.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dff.jpg'),(8533,'Colors! Maze 2','2022-03-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Colors! Maze 2 is a minimalist casual game of easy mazes with relaxing music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cue.jpg'),(8534,'Eye To Me','2024-06-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Eye To Me\" is a modern-era adventure game. I am creating your \"video game\" and showing it while eating fries at a store. I wanted a place to share memories with you. You stare at me with big eyes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fff.jpg'),(8535,'Chromocide: Prism of Sin','2025-02-17','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shoot, shift color and race against the darkness in this short-run psychedelic action roguelite. Will you atone for your sin?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bv8.jpg'),(8536,'Curvature',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Take control of a highly adaptable battle machine and infiltrate a hostile civilization to keep peace in the universe. Build your own playstyle with a vast amount of gadgets, weapons and unique abilities. Survive and dominate a harsh and atmospheric world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vgd.jpg'),(8537,'Call of Farming','2023-08-03','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game for you to create your own farming or simulation game. It includes an inventory, craft, building, growing plants, farm animals and much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vg6.jpg'),(8538,'Project Blari','2020-10-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Try to survive in this semi open horror game inspired by the ps1 graphic era.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y0r.jpg'),(8539,'Yo-Kai Watch 2: Fleshy Souls','2016-09-29','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo 3DS','Watch out! The strangely charming troublemakers, Yo-kai, are back for an all-new adventure! Find, befriend, and battle more than 350 new and returning Yo-kai. Hop on a train to seek out new towns and new Yo-kai. Teaming up with the heroic cat, Hovernyan, travel back in time to save Springdale, and witness the origin of the Yo-kai Watch!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o27.jpg'),(8540,'Codename: Iceman','1989-12-31','Simulator, Adventure','Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','A global oil shortage...\n...radical terrorists...\n...international crisis...\n...and one man can make the difference.\n\nFrom Jim Walls, designer of two of the most exciting and realistic graphic adventure games ever written, comes a story as chillingly authentic as tomorrow\'s headlines.\n\nAction and intrigue combine with the latest in simulation technology to create a thrilling adventure. The scenario: a kidnapped U.S. ambassador and the only man who can save him- Codename: Iceman.\n\nOil shortages, international politics and radical terrorists form the backdrop for a powerful story of world crisis, superpower conflict and high tech escapades.\n\nUse authentic Naval intelligence charts to pilot a nuclear submarine into enemy territory in a race against time.\n\nSierra\'s 3-D Adventure Game Format, enhanced graphics and sound capabilities add to your gaming enjoyment.\n\nContains a realistic submarine simulator- the newest in simulation technology for a new kind of computer entertainment.\n\nPenetrate the deadly security of an enemy harbor on your way to a rendezvous with destiny. A hostage waits in a terrorist stronghold for rescue... or death!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v8b.jpg'),(8541,'Sweet Liquid',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','A visual novel from Katsudou Mangaya.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cx9s1k1bwx1tw5ynwdka.jpg'),(8542,'Digscovery','2023-05-15','Simulator, Indie','Playdate','An artifact is just out of sight... why not dig for it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mvx.jpg'),(8543,'Gravity Chase','2022-01-21','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Welcome to the futuristic anti-gravity arcade racer with a twist.\n\nGravity Chase racing competition takes place on tunnel tracks for super-fast 360 degree Zero G racing.\n\nSkill and precision piloting are required to follow the optimum line along with strategic use of pickups, powerups and weapons in order to progress through the race series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hit.jpg'),(8544,'Advent of Ascension','2012-10-12','Simulator, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Advent of Ascension is a massive adventure and exploration mod for Minecraft designed to flesh out every area of the game as much as possible. It adds 21 new dimensions, each with its own items, ores, blocks, mobs, dungeons, and bosses. In addition to new tools and armor, players can access a set of special skills that offer perks at higher levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co611w.jpg'),(8545,'Invisible',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Invisible, is a single-player game with the goal of sending chills down your spine.\nInvisible is a first person horror game. Utilizing endless tension, exceptional 3D graphics, and a horrifying soundscape, this game is crafted to scare your pants off!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zy8.jpg'),(8546,'Majestic Majolical','2022-12-22','Adventure, Visual Novel','Nintendo Switch','Nintendo Switch port that combines all three PC volumes & adds in a route for Jasper Beryl.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5y0y.jpg'),(8547,'Elephantasy','2020-12-07','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After falling from the sky into a miniature world, a tiny Elephant has a big adventure in store for them! Climb, dash, lift, and swim while exploring colorful pixel-art environments in this cute 2D puzzle-platformer! Can you collect all the Gems, reach the Tower in the clouds, and return home?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2svf.jpg'),(8548,'Summer Pockets','2018-12-17','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Summer Pockets is set on an isolated, rural and peaceful island on the Seto Inland Sea called Torishirojima, which has a population of about 2,000 people.\nThe protagonist is Hairi Takahara, a young man not native to the island.\nHairi grew up in an urban setting, but after an unpleasant incident, he uses the recent death of his grandmother as an excuse to come to the island to take care of her estate sale.\nOnce there, he gets to know four girls who are the focus of the story.\n\nThey include Shiroha Naruse, who forgot her summer vacation:\nAo Sorakado, who is pursuing the legends of the island.\nKamome Kushima, a high-class girl looking for a pirate ship.\nand Tsumugi Wenders, a younger girl trying to find herself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co276f.jpg'),(8549,'Stellar Echoes: Brave Trial',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Stellar Echoes: Brave Trial is a mild rogue combat shooter that also allows you to turn on Endless Mode after completing the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zz6.jpg'),(8550,'SD Gundam Gaiden: Knight Gundam Monogatari 2 - Hikari no Knight','1991-10-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Family Computer','SD Gundam Gaiden: Knight Gundam Monogatari 2 - Hikari no Knight is a Role-Playing game, developed by TOSE and published by Bandai, which was released in Japan in 1991.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dem.jpg'),(8551,'Super BOO Quest','2018-10-21','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super BOO Quest is a lighthearted game suitale for every kind of player, from casual to hardcore. It is a mix of arcade, puzzle, and stealth, to be played alone or with a friend.\nThe game is presented with 16 bit-style graphics, as a tribute to Super Nintendo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42mn.jpg'),(8552,'The Dead Zone 2','2024-10-02','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Go to various death zones filled with unknown creatures, complete the mission at all costs, and then evacuate. Of course, we will provide various black technology blessings for everyone. Wish you good luck.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w3f.jpg'),(8553,'Cats Visiting Underwater World','2024-12-24','Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Dive into a hidden-cat adventure! Explore vibrant coral reefs, sunken temples, and ancient shipwrecks to uncover cats and collect rare treasures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ajx.jpg'),(8554,'Atelier Marie & Elie: The Alchemist of Salburg','2012-02-02','Adventure','Legacy Mobile Device','Atelier Marie & Elie: The Alchemist of Salburg was a social game based on the Atelier series.\nThe main goal of the game is to graduate from Salburg\'s Academy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bi7.jpg'),(8555,'Blood and Guts Bundle','2020-06-18','Fighting, Puzzle, Sport, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Satisfy your lust for carnage with three gloriously gratuitous games! This bundle contains Slain: Back From Hell, Slayaway Camp: Butcher’s Cut, and Super Blood Hockey. Slain: Back from Hell. A heavy metal inspired arcade combat game with stunning pixel art visuals, challenging old school gameplay and gore galore. Plus the most metal soundtrack you\'ve ever heard! Slayaway Camp: Butcher’s Cut: A killer puzzle game and darkly comic homage to 80s horror movies where you control Skullface, a homicidal slasher hell-bent on revenge. Super Blood Hockey: Arcade sports gaming gets a shot of adrenaline in this violent homage to classic 8- and 16-bit ice hockey games. Use fast-paced skills and bone-crunching brutality to dominate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co573s.jpg'),(8556,'Train Sim World 2: Bakerloo Line','2023-09-26','Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Experience the hustle and bustle of packed-in commuters, trains every few minutes, the echo of screeching rails in tunnels with the classic Bakerloo Line, rendered in its entirety within Train Sim World!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t8l.jpg'),(8557,'Tehnodrom','2024-06-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Tehnodrom\" offers exciting gameplay, a variety of enemies and weapons, and the ability to make strategic decisions that affect the course of the game. The game is intended for fans of casual games in the 2D platform style who love challenges and want to test themselves as a brave tehnodrom pilot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8f2j.jpg'),(8558,'Borderlands 2: Creature Slaughterdome','2012-12-11','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','Enter the Creature Slaughter Dome and face off against the toughest monsters in all of Pandora. Your efforts will not be in vain. Gain experience and gear to bring back into the main game. Endure the battle, and you will receive numerous rewards, including Moxxi’s Rocket Launcher.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bu2.jpg'),(8559,'Warlords','1989-12-31','Strategy, Arcade','Mac, DOS, Amiga','Warlords is a stratigic war game, fought out by eight different players, for the domination of the Kingdom of Illuria. It can be played by one to eight people, with the computer taking the remaining positions. The Kingdom of Illuria, after some severe internal disputes, has setthed under a sullen and uneasy peace. This truce has now disappeared, along with the arch-mage who imposed it. The eight empires of Illuria realize that this is their chance for total domination, a very unstable situation. Forces are being mobilized for conquest, and only one Supreme Warlord will prevail.\n\nYour objectives in Warlords are brutally simple: to eliminate all organized opposition to your rule. To do this, you will have to control all eighty cities in the lands of Illuria, and thereby eliminate all seven opponents. There are many ways to achieve this, and brute force is just one of them. you might ally with dragons or wizards, or have your Heros search out and wield magical swords that will tip the battle in your favour. Clever military tactics and even economic warfare are possibilities too.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/euht14l9jzakkta0yelt.jpg'),(8560,'SquareMan','2022-02-05','Platform, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SquareMan has fallen off a cliff and into a the Caverns of Squared. Attain willpower and escape via the bridge atop the mountain in SquareMan, a punishing 2D precision platformer. Beware the spikes and slopes that may either break or make your spirit in this dangerous journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i27.jpg'),(8561,'Once a Tale','2024-04-19','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are invited to step into the enchanting world of fairy tales like never before. Play as Hansel and Gretel in this unique stop-motion-style single-player 3rd-person narrative adventure where you\'ll uncover mysteries, solve puzzles, and meet a reimagined cast of beloved fairytale characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6z3y.jpg'),(8562,'Ashes of Arcanum','2024-07-04','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a simple engine created based on the TTRPG Ashes of Arcanum.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h29.jpg'),(8563,'BrasFoot 2004','2004-02-05','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BrasFoot 2004 is the second iteration of the soccer management simulator focused on Brazilian teams where you can buy and view players from other teams at any time during the game, manually select players for each match, change the ticket prices of the game at any time, and much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9diu.jpg'),(8564,'Charon\'s Staircase','2022-10-28','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In this first-person horror mystery game, you set out to bury the horrible past of a tyrannical government. Retrieve and destroy the documents that unravel the secrets that lie beneath Oack Grove. Will you discover the terrifying truth and find your way out?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4spf.jpg'),(8565,'Memory Match Saga: Expansion Pack 2',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Memory Match Saga - Expansion Pack 2 - A classic memory game that will improve your memory and brain power. You can spend the pleasant and leisure time with the game, meanwhile you can test and improve your memory and attention, whether you are a child or an adult.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8566,'Calculator: The Game','2017-06-12','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Welcome to Calculator: The Game where you\'ll manipulate numbers by adding them, subtracting them, converting them, reversing them, and stuffing them through portals ... yes ... PORTALS.\n\nAlong the way you\'ll get to know Clicky, your adorable assistant who will hack the calculator and unlock new powerful buttons so you can destroy all the numbers ... oh wait, that\'s a lie, you won\'t be destroying any numbers ... but you WILL destroy 200 puzzles ... with NUMBERS!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vq8.jpg'),(8567,'Pokémon Black 2 Randomizer',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','A randomizer mod for Pokémon Black 2.\n\nPokemon Randomizers are a fresh new way to experience your favorite Pokemon games! With wild encounters, trainer pokemon, starter pokemon, field items and TMs randomized anything can happen! Imagine walking into the grass and instead of encountering a Pidgey it is a Mewtwo instead. The possibilities are endless and unique!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cac.jpg'),(8568,'1x1','2023-08-12','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','1x1 is an MBF21 (-complevel 21) community project hosted in my discord server. The concept is simple: the maps only use 1 texture and 1 flat, with the exception of a single switch texture and F_SKY (which was only allowed to be used if the texture was transferred to it!). The wad features 24 mbf21-compatible maps (01-21, 31-33) made by various authors, with difficulty ranging from around early Sunlust difficulty to absolutely batshit crazy, though difficulty settings are implemented. Maps are ordered very roughly by difficulty. Pistol starts are intended but not required.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yc8.jpg'),(8569,'BS Zelda no Densetsu: Dai-4-wa','1995-08-27','Adventure','Satellaview','The fourth and last part (week) of the first map of BS Zelda no Densetsu.\n\nBS Zelda no Densetsu was a remake of The Legend of Zelda that was released for the Satellaview attachment of the Super Nintendo Entertainment System in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40qx.jpg'),(8570,'Victor\'s Test Night','2024-02-16','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Victor\'s Test Night is a first-person adventure game.\nYou have to explore each museum by day and by night, and find and report on anomalies not seen by day.\nThe game lasts 5 days, but it\'s actually 5 minutes and 55 seconds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qaq.jpg'),(8571,'Cosmonator','2019-02-25','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cosmonator is an \'RPG-em-up\': a hybrid of classic fast-paced top-down shmup action infused with some really deep character building elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26bs.jpg'),(8572,'Syberia 3: The Complete Journey','2017-04-20','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The limitless imagination of Benoît Sokal continues in Syberia 3, focusing on an entirely new adventure. After abandoning the island, Kate is found dying on the edge of a river by the Youkole tribe, a nomadic people migrating with their snow ostriches. Stuck in Valsembor village, together they must find a way to continue their journey in a race against their enemies and unexpected obstacles, not to mention Kate\'s past, which catches up with her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ce0.jpg'),(8573,'Call of Duty: Black Ops II','2012-11-18','Shooter','Wii U','Rooted in near-future fiction, Call of Duty: Black Ops II propels players into a visual landscape in an epic single player campaign highlighted by branching storylines and non-linear missions. The game is a re-imagined multiplayer that introduces players to some of the most cutting-edge weaponry and equipment that 2025 will have to offer, and punctuated with an all-new Zombies experience running in the multiplayer engine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3aud.jpg'),(8574,'Ucchan Nanchan no Honoo no Challenger: Denryuu Iraira Bou','1997-12-19','Arcade','Nintendo 64','Ucchannanchan no Honoo no Challenger: Denryuu Iraira Bou follows the same playing principle as the mechanical wire loop game. In this variant, the player has to guide a ball through six courses which basically consist of narrow ways with curves and obstacles. Later levels introduce moving obstacles and parts in which the screen slightly tilts. The player is not allowed to touch anything and has to solve the course within a time limit. This all is commentated by an enthusiastic announcer. Multiplayer is a simple split-screen race.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zrv.jpg'),(8575,'Spelunker World','2015-03-19','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','\"In SPELUNKER WORLD, players take the role of a Spelunker, following in the footsteps of his father who disappeared 10 years ago. Players can venture into caverns solo or together with up to six players online in search of legendary treasures while avoiding dangerous pitfalls, boulders and wicked creatures. Hidden within every nook and cranny are various power ups and unlocks to customize characters’ skills and appearances. The title offers an array of adorable pets that aid players as they uncover deeper and dangerous caves.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yr0.jpg'),(8576,'Vetica',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8577,'Duru: About Mole Rats and Depression','2023-05-08','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Follow the story of Tuli – a story about the struggle with insecurities, depression and friendship, told in a colorful, accessible way. Run, jump and paint your way through puzzle filled tunnels while also dealing with an unhelpful AI companion you just can\'t get rid of.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z2e.jpg'),(8578,'Shake the Baby!','2025-03-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shake the Baby! is a fast-paced satirical boomer shooter with a very peculiar weapon system. Pick up a wide variety of babies and merge them into an even more powerful baby. Rip apart your foes in arena combat or traverse carefully made tactical levels. Just remember: SHAKE. THE. BABY!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l1m.jpg'),(8579,'The Liminal Dimension','2024-11-27','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You\'re trapped in an endless loop within a liminal dimension, where each loop leads to increasingly unsettling places. Will you find the way out of this psychological horror? The game offers a unique déjà vu experience that blurs the lines between reality and illusion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96wi.jpg'),(8580,'Tiger Tank 59 I: Volcano MP038','2021-07-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Tiger Tank 59\" is a top-down shooting gameIn this game. Players need to control their tanks, through the enemy lines, break the enemy base, or defeat the enemy tanks. This DLC include map pack 038.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7uow.jpg'),(8581,'Trek to Yomi','2022-05-05','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','As a vow to his dying Master, the young swordsman Hiroki is sworn to protect his town and the people he loves against all threats. Faced with tragedy and bound to duty, the lone samurai must voyage beyond life and death to confront himself and decide his path forward.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4p88.jpg'),(8582,'Super Robot Taisen OG Saga: Endless Frontier','2008-05-29','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo DS','Super Robot Taisen OG Saga: Endless Frontier is a unique sci-fi/fantasy RPG that takes players across a variety of worlds, ranging from an apocalyptic wasteland covered with the hulks of downed spaceships to a fantastical place of fairy tales and dark magic. Join Haken Browning: gunslinger, professional bounty hunter, and amateur ladies\' man, along with his motley crew of robots, were-beasts, secret agents, and busty princesses as they delve deep into the mysteries of how their worlds came to be and face a threat that imperils the multiverse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wll.jpg'),(8583,'GraFi Lunar','2020-01-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','GraFi Lunar - casual, colorful, minimalist, physical puzzle with traps, treadmills, portals, dragons and changing gravity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41f2.jpg'),(8584,'The TET Offensive','2021-12-31','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are a Viet Cong during the Tet Offensive, a massive surprise attack that changed the course of the Vietnam War. Your objective is to take the American\'s Base, you can stealth your way by digging tunnels and avoiding detection, or release all bullets from your AK-47 into the enemy, the way you conquer the Base is your choice, but remember... there are consequences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93ke.jpg'),(8585,'Don\'t Shoot First!','2025-03-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Face off in Don\'t Shoot First, a Wild West duel where timing is everything. Draw too soon, you lose. Wait too long… it’s over. Do you have the nerves to hold back and the reflexes to strike at the perfect moment?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kmy.jpg'),(8586,'Good Morgan Eve','2024-12-21','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short RPG Maker horror game where you play as Morgan, an odd girl navigating a typical day where she has to deal with an obsessive stalker and an even more obsessive girlfriend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fi6.jpg'),(8587,'Naklua VR','2017-11-10','Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Naklua VR is a large puzzle game set in a spacious sky where you must navigate a multitude of levels, traps and dangerous paths. Naklua has used VR to it\'s advantage by making the experience as limitless as possible.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8588,'Decollate Decoration','2023-08-31','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a point-and-click, command-selection style adventure game where the protagonist is a girl who has become a ghost. The objective is to fulfill her desires by speaking to her beloved \"him\" causing poltergeists, visiting in dreams, or even cursing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cv7.jpg'),(8589,'BrasFoot 2006','2006-02-10','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BrasFoot 2006 is the fourth iteration of the soccer management simulator focused on Brazilian teams where you can buy and view players from other teams at any time during the game, manually select players for each match, change the ticket prices of the game at any time, and much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9diy.jpg'),(8590,'Way of the Hunter: Tikamoon Plains','2023-08-11','Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Venture out into this exotic new hunting ground in the heart if Africa. Enjoy a new hunting adventure, using a broad range of equipment, now also including Bows, and meet wild animals like Buffalo, Hyena, Wildebeest, Honeybadger and Gemsbok.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x9w.jpg'),(8591,'Super Rolling Heroes','2022-03-23','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super Rolling Heroes is an unforgiving physics-based 3D platformer. Destroy every object while maintaining momentum, exploding, bouncing, using power-ups and avoiding deadly obstacles. It includes ‘Rolling Hell’, an extremely hard mode that challenges you to beat the game in a single run.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4g7c.jpg'),(8592,'BackStab HD','2011-06-23','Sin género','Android','The action of the game happens in the 18th century in one of the Caribbean islands. You are Henry Blake, the officer of royal fleet of England in the past, you need to help him with aspiration to justice and revenge. Use your dexterity, cunning, deadly fighting skills for defeat of the opponent and everyone who becomes on your way. In the game there’s quite big and beautiful world which has a set of traced elements, and for orientation in this space you are given a map. Also there will be a pointer which shows the direction you need to go for a performance of the mission. By the way, missions in the game are the most various - from simple, to carry a parcel to other place, to quite fascinating, to destroy some large ships.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ueq.jpg'),(8593,'Captain Power and the Soldiers of the Future','1988-12-31','Shooter','Commodore C64/128/MAX, PC (Microsoft Windows), Apple II','It is the year 2147. The Metal Wars have reduced a lush Earth to the twisted and smoldering debris of a once-free world. Lord Dread now rules the enslaved planet and the few humans that survive. The future of mankind looked grim...until now...\n\"power on\", with Captain Power and The Soldiers Of The Future! Prove yourself worthy of battle in a death-defying flight sequence! Once you have passed the important test of skill, you are given the mission: Conduct a full-fledged bombing raid to end the rule of Lord Dread and his Bio Dread Empire!\nProve to Captain Power and The Soldiers Of The Future you have what it takes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co543v.jpg'),(8594,'Days of Thunder','1992-12-31','Racing, Simulator','Game Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97az.jpg'),(8595,'Tower of Boin','2023-12-31','Platform, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77mh.jpg'),(8596,'MO:Astray','2019-10-24','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','MO:Astray is a pixelated, side-scrolling, puzzle-solving action game. Featuring the main character MO and its special abilities, the game is loaded with bizarre enemies, threatening traps and ingenious level designs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m9h.jpg'),(8597,'Codemancer','2019-08-12','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aurora needs to learn magic to rescue her Dad, but the way Magic works in Aurora\'s world is the way Programming works in ours! Help Aurora by Defeating evil puppets, Solving ancient puzzles and Exploring the world of magic!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mmg.jpg'),(8598,'Sneakers','2002-02-22','Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox','Get ready for a fun adventure filled with cartoon combat. In Sneakers, you play Apollo, a mouse who must lead his friends through a human-sized town to battle the enemy. You must protect your troops by directing their actions and throwing wind-up punches and flying kicks. While your small size lets you take shortcuts through small holes in the wall, it also makes a rolling apple as dangerous as a tumbling boulder. Only those with cunning and quick minds can leave victoriously.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co525y.jpg'),(8599,'The Legendary Boy Run',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8600,'WarKlinika',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8601,'Hot Wave',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8602,'Cube Universe','2018-04-24','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore an infinite universe and its various, procedurally generated planets! Help the locals by doing quests, find precious materials in deep caves to craft armor and weapons, or simply explore the epic landscapes to find a nice spot and build a house or whatever you can imagine!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cbg.jpg'),(8603,'Mega Man Zero 3','2015-05-28','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Wii U, Game Boy Advance','It\'s the third chapter in the Mega Man Zero action adventure series for the Game Boy Advance. Featuring a new customization system, you can now equip Zero, with a combination of chips that will affect both his attributes and abilities, allowing you to adapt him to different challenges. Among his other new skills, Zero will now have weapon called the recoil rod. Now be jumps at double his normal height. These new skills will allow our hero to march into Arcadia to defeat the evil Omega single-handedly... Or will they?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co204h.jpg'),(8604,'Walking in Fog',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8605,'Sonic the Hedgehog Classic Heroes','2010-11-02','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Tails and Charmy are the flying types with the ability to soar through the air nothing stands in their way, and with Each carrying a legion of friends when super or hyper, Dr. Robotnik\'s forces don\'t stand a chance!\n\nKnuckles and Vector are the power types delivering devistating blows to Robotnik\'s Badnick army combine that with the ability to Glide, climb walls, and Power Dash, these two are the roughest, toughest dudes around.\n\nAs if the Teams weren\'t enough to sway you new powerups make their rounds aswell: Home in on Robotnik\'s forces with the Homing Sheild, Burn those bots with a fire sheild.\n\nShort-circuit them with an electric sheild, If a watery grave awaits you a bubble sheild is just around the corner.\n\nThe Sol Emeralds have also managed to cross dimensions through the Special Zone but not to worry Team Sonic and Chaotix are on the job!\n\nUsing both the Power of the Chaos and Sol Emeralds will unlock a very familiar power.... can you collect all 14?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s0h.jpg'),(8606,'Shoot For The Stars','2025-05-16','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A foddian style game but you are a gun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jmm.jpg'),(8607,'Solraid','2020-12-14','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SOLRAID is a single player top-down spaceship shooter.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8608,'Secret Files: Tunguska','2009-10-29','Point-and-click, Adventure','Wii, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Wii U, Nintendo DS, Nintendo Switch','Unravel one of the greatest mysteries of our time! On the 30th June 1908 an explosion with the combined energy of 2000 Hiroshima bombs rocked the region of Tunguska in Central Siberia and felled over 6,000 square km of trees. The explosion could be heard from as far as 1,000km away.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s8h.jpg'),(8609,'Evil\'s Den',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Evil\'s Den: Forsaken Dungeon is a rogue-lite dungeon crawler featuring procedurally generated levels where you will battle through hordes of monsters to close a portal to Hell opened in the village\'s church.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hgv.jpg'),(8610,'Yumimi Mix','1993-12-10','Adventure','FM Towns, Sega CD','Yumimi Mix is an interactive novel for the Sega Mega CD platform. An enhanced remake for the Sega Saturn was also released, called Yumimi Mix Remix.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6djg.jpg'),(8611,'Draft Day Sports: College Basketball 2018','2018-03-13','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Draft Day Sports: College Basketball 2018 puts you in the role of head coach of your favorite college basketball team. Every decision can be made by you from staff hiring, recruiting, scouting and all the way to making each substitution to lead your team to tournament glory and becoming a dynasty.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8612,'Symbiosis','2014-03-02','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97ew.jpg'),(8613,'Wii Fit Plus','2009-10-30','Sport','Wii','Wii Fit Plus provides all of the original activities in Wii Fit in addition to fifteen Balance/Aerobics games (in a separate category called \"Training Plus\") and six Yoga and Strength-Training exercises unique to the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86mm.jpg'),(8614,'Nurburgring-1','1976-03-01','Racing','Arcade','Considered by many to be the first fully electronic, first-person driving simulator, this was Dr. Reiner Forest\'s attempt at miniaturizing the racecar driving experience. It directly inspired Ted Michon\'s game Night Racer, which in turn led to him working with Midway to create 280 Zzzap around the same time. Meanwhile, Atari designer Dave Sheppard saw a screenshot of what was very likely Nürburgring 1 in a magazine; this led to the company\'s own iteration, the better-known Night Driver.\n\nThe arcade cabinet has a black and white monitor, a steering wheel and two foot pedals for gas and brake. The screen is completely black with white rectangles representing roadside poles. A monitor overlay sticker displays the car hood and boxes at the bottom of the screen for the distance, speed and misses. The player gets 90 seconds to drive across the finish line; crashing the car results in a time penalty. The game plays the sound of the engine and screaming tires.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65xy.jpg'),(8615,'James Bond 007: Tomorrow Never Dies','1999-11-25','Shooter','PlayStation','In 007: Tomorrow Never Dies, which is based on the movie of the same name, the player takes the role of the famous James Bond who fights against Elliot Carver. Carver tries to increase his TV ratings by creating a war between the British and the Chinese. To achieve his goal he sunk a British ship with his stealth ship and made it look like the Chinese Air Force was the offender. Now it is Bond\'s responsibility to set things right...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dlp.jpg'),(8616,'The Sims 4: Home Chef Hustle Stuff Pack','2023-09-28','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Grow your culinary skills with new small appliances and turn cooking into cash with The Sims 4 Home Chef Hustle Stuff Pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co785p.jpg'),(8617,'Modern Fantasy: Urban Legends','2022-07-18','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Can you track the source of the Zombie Epidemic engulfing the rural island you\'re currently inhabiting before your lost friend falls victim to a deranged scientist? Explore a turn-based RPG with action elements while fighting against the undead, crazed people, enraged animals & unusual mutants!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lgu.jpg'),(8618,'Verticow','2017-08-30','Puzzle, Indie','Legacy Mobile Device','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cll.jpg'),(8619,'Aqua GT','2001-01-26','Racing','PlayStation, Dreamcast','Aqua GT is powerboat racing game. It features three modes: Championship, Arcade and Two-player.\n\nChampionship mode is the main single player game, where you advance through the Bronze, Silver and Gold Championships. In the Arcade gameplay mode you have to beat the clock. In two-player split screen mode you go head to head against another player.\n\nThere are 5 boats to choose from, and you can unlock another 15 while progressing through the game. All boat vary in speed, acceleration and handling.\n\nThe tracks are set in canals of major cities, like London, Amsterdam and New York. Each track has a high or low tide, and you can race at day time or during the night time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yes.jpg'),(8620,'Monster Hunter Frontier Online','2010-06-24','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Monster Hunter Frontier is an online MMORPG on the PC and Xbox 360 with a great amount of new weapons, quests, armor, and monsters. The game will continue to expand with new content added through patches. There is currently a Japanese, Korean and Chinese (Taiwan and Macau) version of Frontier. The game has a built-in IP blocker that prevents IP addresses outside of Japan from connecting to the server, but it is still possible for residents in other countries to connect. The Korean Frontier requires a KSSN (Korean Social Security Number) in order to play but it does not carry the same monthly fee as the Japanese version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co406t.jpg'),(8621,'Kirby no Omochabako: Guru-guru Ball','1996-02-08','Arcade','Satellaview','In this game, the player fires spherical Kirbys through a spiral tube, which is designed to look like Efreeti. This tube has holes in it, which a speedy Kirby will pass right over. The point is to fire the Kirbys with just the right amount of power to pass over certain holes but slow down and fall into another hole. Different holes give different numbers of points, so the goal of the player is to shoot his/her Kirbys into the highest-scoring hole as much as possible. When the player runs out of Kirbys, the game ends.\n\nLike every other sub-game in Kirby\'s Toy Box, this game could only be downloaded by the Satellaview during the brief period it was broadcast.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30d4.jpg'),(8622,'Brownie\'s Haunted Christmas','2024-01-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A cozy Christmas cooking horror experience! Join Brownie in mixing, baking cookies, and decorating as you help him prepare his new home for the holidays. Overcome the mischievous ghost, earn coins, and transform his house into the ultimate cozy Christmas haven. Are you up for the challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ixk.jpg'),(8623,'Allakin',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Allakin find his way back home and defeat the dark force in many varied levels','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58tm.jpg'),(8624,'Dragon Ball Z: Budokai 3','2004-12-03','Fighting','PlayStation 2','The third installment in the Dragon Ball Z: Budokai series begins another tournament of champions where only one fighter can prevail. As one of the characters from the Dragon Ball Z animated series, you can master an all-new fighting system that lets you teleport, juggle opponents, fly, and attack in a variety of ways. As you progress through the tournament, you can unlock up to 40 bonus characters from the DBZ universe. You can also post and retrieve character profiles from the Internet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dfo.jpg'),(8625,'Pokémon Corogarena','2022-03-14','Sin género','Arcade','Pokémon Corogarena is a Japanese exclusive arcade game medal game by Sega.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jtc.jpg'),(8626,'Mystery Loss','2017-09-21','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help! A little pretty сanary is lost! Join Grandmother-detective and her funny cat Leonardo in their investigation of the mysterious kidnapping. Play match-3 and HO levels, find pieces of evidence and track down the villain who dared to hurt innocent little bird!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p5z.jpg'),(8627,'Sonic Championship',NULL,'Fighting','Arcade, Sega Saturn','The original arcade release of Sonic the Fighters, released as Sonic Championship outside of Japan and in Sonic Gems Collection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zn5.jpg'),(8628,'100 Doors: Escape from Work','2022-03-02','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','This escape logic puzzle game takes you to the most beautiful company in the world. Just when you\'re busy looking around, you find out that you can\'t leave. Solve the puzzles, find the keys to all of the doors & escape from work!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ejw.jpg'),(8629,'Risk of Rain 2: EXXXXXXX-X','2024-08-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An ancient threat awakens on Petrichor V. Master new Survivors, wield new items, and fight your way across uncharted regions. Ascend the levels of the Colossus in a race to confront The False Son. Defeat him and unlock the true power of his Soul!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cbg.jpg'),(8630,'A House of Locked Secrets',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Step into the shoes of Bolen, a now-former thief living in the City. After some tumultuous events, you\'ve been rethinking your path in life and your new road takes you high into the mountains, to the gates of a mysterious monastery. If you beat the mission, you can also get a coupon code for 50% of the companion novella, Shadowcursed','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j01.jpg'),(8631,'Abunai Koi no Sousashitsu: Eternal Happiness','2015-05-21','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','A sequel to Otome game from PSP called \"Abunai Koi ☆ no Sousashitsu\" released for the PlayStation Vita.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oge.jpg'),(8632,'Chessmaster 4000 Turbo','1993-12-31','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','DOS','Updated version of Chessmaster 3000. This is the last game in the series made by The Software Toolworks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/plbbcl4hjuxodayuqa5s.jpg'),(8633,'Kawaii Killer','2014-07-31','Arcade','Android, iOS','Kawaii Killer is an intuitive & fun game taking place in an environment where super cute graphics meets cartoon gore. You are Davy, a young trapper killing every single cute animal in the Kawaii Forest. \n \nBut beware! Each animal is different! When the fox needs only a simple tap to be killed, you\'ll have to perform a slice to kill a rabbit, while the frog needs to be torn apart using two fingers! \n \nYou\'ll have to face 14 different animals in Arcade mode, beat the timer in Speedrun mode, grab the gold medal in 36 challenges, and unlock all the badges in the game! \n \n- Intuitive gameplay, fun and accessible \n- A game which challenges your observation skills, memory, agility and reflexes \n- Super cute graphics meeting cartoon gore \n- Multiple challenges with innovative and fun rules \n- Multiple game modes and hardcore challenges for the strong-headed \n- Achievements that can be used in the Arcade mode to change the rules \n- Seasonal backgrounds provide a colourful backdrop to the action \n- Google Play Game Services and Game Center integrated \n- No in-app purchases, everything is unlocked with skill, not money \n- Translated in 6 languages (English, French, German, Portuguese, Spanish and Japanese) \n- Full indie game made with love and passion','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1phm.jpg'),(8634,'Girl Friend Beta','2012-10-29','Simulator','Android, iOS, PlayStation Vita','Girl Friend Beta is a Japanese smartphone dating simulator. It features over 100 different virtual girls, each with a unique voice actress. The player progresses their relationship with the virtual girlfriend by taking her on dates. The game is free-to-play, however the player pays real-world money to gain premium services. The game features various events that occur, including battle events when bad guys appear. The player can engage in club activities and school class events to solicit romance and increase intimacy with female students. There is a card-based system within the game, where the player collects different cards of varying rarity; each card has different attributes, such as attack and defense costs. Cards can be enhanced by engaging in a part-time job.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60r8.jpg'),(8635,'Shattered God - Quest for the Divine Relic','2017-06-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','2D Action-RPG that\'s a mix of familiar and new concepts, focused on a unique, fun and challenging battle system. Unravel the lore with the new NPC system and make your own destiny with choices that affect endings, party members, and even bosses. Discover what truly means to be a hero!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27de.jpg'),(8636,'Stray Souls: Cult Classic Edition',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7b2m.jpg'),(8637,'Deepolis','2008-12-17','Simulator','Web browser','In Deepolis, the player takes on the role of under water admiral commanding a submarine in a three-dimensional underwater world, with the aim of completing quests and sinking other players and NePCs. As a result, the player collects experience points (EP) and advances upwards through the levels.\n\nThe game optionally supports player clans, both for PVP and PVE play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vdd.jpg'),(8638,'Blade Force','1995-12-31','Shooter','3DO Interactive Multiplayer','In the year 2110, in the city of Meggagrid, once known as Los Angeles, you meet Dr. Grubert, a very prominent inventor who has been crippled by an explosion perpetrated by a crime family known as The Pitt Family. He gives a suit known as the Helipak Flight Suit to fight back and take down the criminals in the city and apprehend The Pitt Family and bring peace back to the city. With an arsenal of nine different weapons and twenty power-ups, the player flies around seven levels of the city with six degrees of freedom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p4v.jpg'),(8639,'Social Interaction Trainer','2016-11-02','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Learn how to conduct yourself in social situations with Social Interaction Trainer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nh3.jpg'),(8640,'Those Nights at Fredbear\'s: Reboot',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','hose Nights at Fredbear\'s Reboot is a discontinued official remake of the very first cancelled free-roam FNaF fan-game Nikson made. The remake features new story, new graphics, new characters etc. If you are going to use anything on this page for refrence in your fangame. Please credit the page and those who have contributed to it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dcx.jpg'),(8641,'Super Metroid: Y-Faster','2016-08-25','Sin género','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','\"Entry for MetConst Summer Contest \"\"Race to the Finish\"\"\n\nPlot : A flying brain from another dimension is wrecking the galaxy, Samus has decided to put an end to this.\nShe has less than one hour to complete her task otherwise she\'ll die from heavy brain damage.\n\nGoal : Defeat 4 main bosses in 4 distinct areas then head to the final area as fast as possible.\nEach area can be completed in one run and in any order (no need to go back and forth between areas to progress).\nThere\'s a bit of exploration thrown in for good measure but for the most part, the main path is quite straightforward (I think?)\nIn case you\'re confused, look at the map - all area maps are available from the start.\nBacktracking is usually needed when you\'re exiting an area to go the next one.\nMost enemies has altered vulnerabilities, health and damage so you should be able to deal with them underequipped.\nThat includes bosses & zebetites weak to uncharged shots, etc.\nYet, as a general rule of thumb, bumping into everything (ie enemies, spikes) isn\'t the best way to progress.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93ho.jpg'),(8642,'Half Moon ni Kawaru made: Ramiya Ryo no Nijiiro Tamatebako','1995-04-14','Adventure','PC-9800 Series, FM Towns','The game is based on the manga \"Half Moon ni Kawaru\" made by Ryo Ramiya. It contains four separate stories, which can also be defined as mini-games due to their short length.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4p0h.jpg'),(8643,'Punch Guy',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Punch. Die. Repeat.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8644,'Where in the U.S.A. is Carmen Sandiego?','1989-12-31','Puzzle, Adventure','Apple IIGS, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Mac, DOS, Amiga, Apple II','As a detective, the player must hunt down Carmen Sandiego\'s henchmen, who have stolen outrageous items that are important in US history and heritage. Using clues, the player will follow the henchmen from city to city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vfj.jpg'),(8645,'I hope she\'s ok','2020-11-13','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','“I hope she’s ok” is a single-player first-person atmospheric mystery inspired by Nordic folklore. Set around a beautiful lakeside cabin in the heart of Finland during the midsummer solstice, the idyllic scene takes a turn for the worse when you discover that your friend is missing.\n\nExperience the mystery of midsummer in a traditional lakeside cabin in the heart of Finland, where the long evening gradually turns into dawn without ever visiting the night.\n\nEvery year you travel to this beautiful and remote part of the world to visit your oldest friend who lives an isolated life off the grid. Except this year for some reason and without warning, she’s not at home.\n\nAs you search for the clues that might help find your friend, things start taking a strange turn. Are you succumbing to cabin fever or could rumors of a mysterious lake creature actually explain her disappearance?\n\nAn avid social media user, you post regular photos and updates to your friends and followers. The tone you select for those interactions will go some way to determining whether you come through this experience unscathed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86yt.jpg'),(8646,'911 Operator: Every Life Matters','2017-12-07','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Control the Boston riots and don’t let the Miami summer festival get out of hand. Handle EVENTS in the Free Game mode. Use the new REINFORCEMENTS function that will let you summon new units during your duty. Take advantage of two new vehicles and two new pieces of equipment designed especially for the new events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ang.jpg'),(8647,'Hentai Nurse','2022-11-26','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hentai Nurse is a relaxing puzzle game. With the theme of nurse and 24 unique sexy girls Enjoy sexy girls pictures and relaxing music to complete the puzzle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hdm.jpg'),(8648,'New Super Mario Bros. 2: WillyMaker\'s Level Pack','2024-10-04','Platform','Nintendo 3DS','A 1-world level pack for New Super Mario Bros. 2 created by WillyMaker.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97jt.jpg'),(8649,'Chromatic Resonance','2024-08-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bullet hell meets auto-shooter in this roguelike color-matcher where RGB itself is your weapon! The Maiden of Light has been captured by the forces of entropy. Six challenging bosses stand in your way and only you can save her!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6u58.jpg'),(8650,'New Super Mario Bros. 3DS','2024-08-17','Platform','Nintendo 3DS','A 2-world mod for New Super Mario Bros. 2 created by BrewNick!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97ju.jpg'),(8651,'Grisaia: Phantom Trigger Vol. 8','2022-02-25','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Grisaia: Phantom Trigger Vol. 8 is a visual novel and the final installment in the Phantom Trigger series. What will become of the members of SORD at the end of this long, grueling battle? This final volume contains over three times as much text and voiced lines as the previous volumes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ic0.jpg'),(8652,'Sin and Punishment','2000-11-21','Shooter','Wii, Nintendo 64, Wii U','Earth is under threat from Ruffians - mutants bred to boost dwindling food stocks who have turned against their masters. As a young resistance fighter, face an onslaught of bio-genetic monsters and corrupt military forces in your battle to save the planet.\n\nFor the first time outside of Japan, you can experience the non-stop action of this Nintendo 64 classic, created by the shoot em up masters at Treasure Co. Ltd.\n\nBattle across land, sea and sky; collect energy, time and point bonuses; rack up massive combos to earn extra continues; and face the wrath of enormous bosses. Plus - invite a friend to join in, controlling the gun sight while you move the character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1u47.jpg');
INSERT INTO `games` VALUES (8653,'Sunlight Scream','2023-10-02','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','The hero moves to a new city because of life circumstances. Upon entering university he makes new friends, he is horrified to discover that one of them is a murderer... And your decisions alone will determine the outcome of this story!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6tbn.jpg'),(8654,'Disney\'s The Hunchback of Notre Dame','1997-04-01','Arcade','Game Boy','Disney\'s The Hunchback of Notre Dame is an Action game and a mini games collection based on the Disney movie of the same name. It\'s essentially the same game as the PC version, but features two new mini games (\"Catch the Fool\" and \"Picture Puzzle\"). In turn, the mini games \"Le Food Fight\" and \"Inside Outwords\" were removed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vzz.jpg'),(8655,'The Last Meadow','2025-04-01','Point-and-click','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','April Fool\'s game published by Discord in 2025','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m1a.jpg'),(8656,'Truth: Disorder III - Gemini','2019-04-24','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Truth: Disorder III - Gemini is a strange story about two twin girls: Mei and Aoi. Despite external similarity, their characters are absolute opposites.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8657,'Red Dead Redemption 2: Collector\'s Box',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','The Red Dead Redemption 2: Collector\'s Box features a curated assortment of outlaw essentials all packaged in a thick gauged metal tithing box.\n\nMetal Tithing Box with Lock & Key: Inspired by the lockbox used by the Van der Linde gang to stash contributions to the camp\'s upkeep, this thick gauged metal box includes a lock & key, and features black metal band detailing and an engraved Cornwall Freight & Commodities plaque.\n\nCollectable Challenge Coin: Featuring the majestic American Buffalo on one side and a scenic landscape on the other side, this engraved, gold-colored collectable coin comes in a magnetic presentation holder with a black, engraved plaque describing the history of this endangered species.\n\nDouble Sided Puzzle: This double-sided, 100-piece wooden jigsaw puzzle features an illustrated view of the bustling port of Saint Denis on one side, and a classically inspired Rockstar Games logo on the reverse.\n\nSix Shooter Bandana: A staple for any frontier outlaw, this bandana features a traditional paisley-inspired pattern with hidden weapon iconography throughout.\n\nTreasure Map: Printed on durable, unrippable paper, this exclusive treasure map reveals the location of some buried treasure that may start Arthur on a search for more riches hidden throughout the world of Red Dead Redemption 2.\n\nPin Set: This set of six individual pins includes representations of key weapons from Red Dead Redemption 2 including a shotgun, revolver and Dead Eye \"X\" marker. The set comes in a canvas carrying bag.\n\nPlaying Cards: Commemorate the outlaws of the Van der Linde gang with this fully illustrated deck of playing cards featuring key members of the gang including Arthur Morgan, John Marston, Javier Escuella, Bill Williamson and Dutch van der Linde.\n\nWheeler, Rawson and Co. Catalogue: The one-stop shop for everything from weapons to clothing, the Wheeler, Rawson and Co. Catalogue is an essential shopping tool for turn of the century life. This complete 150-page book is a replica of the edition found in stores throughout Red Dead Redemption 2.\n\n12 Cigarette Cards: These beautifully-illustrated collectable cards can be found throughout the world of Red Dead Redemption 2. This physical collection includes one select card from each set like Famous Gunslingers and Outlaws, Stars of the Stage and Marvels of Travel and Locomotion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yhpi5zxefhgma3d8wzba.jpg'),(8658,'Internet Court','2021-04-06','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A live-action comedic courtroom thriller, where YOU are the prosecution, defense and the judge!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46gb.jpg'),(8659,'Calm Down, Stalin','2016-09-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Calm Down, Stalin is a game where you directly control your hands to threaten your enemies with nuclear weapons by moving your finger closer to The Button while signing important state papers, answering phone, dealing with your subordinates and most of all - fighting the stress of your position by smoking your pipe and any other available means!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cfb.jpg'),(8660,'Office Simulator','2025-04-28','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ready to climb the career ladder? In Office Simulator, start as an intern and rise through the corporate ranks. Gain experience, earn promotions, and when the time comes, launch your own company to begin a new business adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96on.jpg'),(8661,'Aery: Path of Corruption','2022-12-16','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','You play as a bird-like spirit and fly through the different scenarios of the decision-making process of the protagonist. Each level represents a different path that the protagonist could take. Discover the different paths, find their possible outcomes, and find a good future for your new friend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5709.jpg'),(8662,'Cosmonuts',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8663,'Fair and Square','2024-06-20','Real Time Strategy (RTS)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fair and Square is a fast paced real time strategy where you will need to defend your base against multiple waves or battle opponents. Play with or against friends chosing not one faction but a combination of factions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gw8.jpg'),(8664,'Gensou Sekai: Eastland Saga','2012-12-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Reimu travels alone at first, but new heroines can be obtained as the player progresses through the game\'s story by exploring the game world and defeating opponents.\nThe battle system is turn-based with the protagonists and antagonists on different sides of the battlefield, using various commands such as: attack, magic, heal, defend and run.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86ud.jpg'),(8665,'Company of Heroes Online','2010-09-02','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Company of Heroes: Online is a MMO real-time strategy game, based on Company of Heroes. The game contains the original campaign and skirmish maps, but adds the option to compete with other players. Per account players can manage up to four commanders, who can rise in level and acquire new abilities. A Blitzkrieg commander for example, can call in extra tank support.\n\nRelic\'s cancelled WWII RTS game, redesigned as a free-to-play online game. Its cancellation was confirmed in a THQ investor\'s call in February 2011.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gzi.jpg'),(8666,'Ryahs Rhythm','2022-01-04','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Android, iOS','Ryah\'s Rhythm: Relaxing Games invites you into a world where your creativity is the key to relaxation and enjoyment. Design and personalize your ultimate retreat, from dream homes and lush gardens to intricate greenhouses and whimsical treehouses. Embrace the serene ambiance enhanced by cozy vibes and a tailored selection of relaxing soundtracks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98yr.jpg'),(8667,'KaBoom!',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Pew Pew Pew, KaBOOM! is a challenging old school arcade game filled with action! Unlock new costumes and enjoy the awesome Chiptune OST as you reach new highscores!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5huo.jpg'),(8668,'Amaze Dark Times','2017-08-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','aMAZE Dark Times is a straightforward and surprisingly-difficult celebration of the simple beauty of the maze with cool soundtrack and timer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26o8.jpg'),(8669,'5D Diplomacy with Multiverse Time Travel',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A new standard in measuring how galaxy-brained you are, 5D Diplomacy With Multiverse Time Travel combines the classic game of pure negotiation with the modern classic game of pure disorientation. Can you convince your opponent to support an attack in the present while simultaneously backstabbing them five years ago and seven timelines over?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8670,'King\'s Quest: Chapter 3 - Once Upon A Climb','2016-04-26','Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','King’s Quest - Once Upon a Climb is the third chapter in the new, critically-acclaimed reimagining of the classic King’s Quest game series. In his latest adventure, King Graham recounts his most personal tale yet. When the magic mirror reveals the location of his one-true love, Graham must climb to daring new heights to save his future Queen. But what he encounters there might just send his notions of romance sailing out the window.\n\nWill Graham finally meet his match? Will it be love at first height? Will love-sickness have Graham seeing double? And when did he have time to go to the gym?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ye5.jpg'),(8671,'Selene\'s Unbearable Night','2023-08-05','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A third person survival horror game. Search for key objects, solve puzzles and face dangers in order to escape. Inspired by the old survival horror, with two playable characters and modern mechanics delve into the narrative story of Selene\'s Unbearable night.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70hh.jpg'),(8672,'Murdered: Soul Suspect','2014-06-03','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','Murdered: Soul Suspect is a supernatural detective thriller which challenges players to solve possibly the hardest case of all… their own murder.\n\nSet in Salem Massachusetts, players have the freedom to explore the New England-style wooden houses, narrow streets, Gothic churches and historical landmarks for clues. They will need to battle demonic spirits to preserve their souls whilst uncovering the shocking revelations about who is responsible for their death.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r7a.jpg'),(8673,'Tyranny: Bastard\'s Wound','2017-09-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Experience a new chapter of Tyranny, the critically-acclaimed role-playing game, in Bastard\'s Wound, a new expansion that builds upon the game\'s compelling story. Tyranny invites the player to make their mark on a world conquered by evil, and the Bastard\'s Wound expansion opens up a new area of the Tiers where refugees from the war-torn world have established a haven in secret.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co213e.jpg'),(8674,'Dark Asylum: Mystery Adventure','2018-09-18','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Featuring a captivating combination of adventure and hidden object gameplay, Dark Asylum contains dozens of unnerving rooms to explore and each one is packed with secrets and pulsating with an undercurrent of dread.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co299z.jpg'),(8675,'Cornbread PNG',NULL,'Platform, Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','In \"CORNBREAD PNG\" you will be challenged to maintain your balance as you walk across narrow beams, over city streets, deep crevasses, and other environments. Be careful not to rush, or you may lose your footing, but don\'t hesitate for too long - the beam may just slip out from under you.\n\nThis game is designed to be challenging. It will test your willingness to endure stress and your patience.\n\nThere is no save feature, but there are \"safe\" areas where you can go to rest before you take on the next beam. The game is complete when all beams have been crossed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8twt.jpg'),(8676,'Megadimension Neptunia VII: Nightwear Pack','2020-07-28','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Nintendo Switch','No rest for the moe! But they can dress to rest with this Nightwear Pack.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8677,'To Be or Not to Be','2022-12-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a text adventure game that combines the gameplay of desktop pets and mini-games. You can advance the plot by clicking on the dialogue, or play mini-games to accumulate values to trigger new plots, and you can also cultivate your favorite characters by hanging up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u0w.jpg'),(8678,'The Mirst',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Mirst is a horror game, you will be unleashed in front of your house where bizarre events are going to happen to you to find the origin of it all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4x2w.jpg'),(8679,'Pokey Ball',NULL,'Arcade','Web browser, Android, iOS','Try to poke and flick your ball as high as you can.\n\nHow high can you go?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95j6.jpg'),(8680,'The Walking Dead Arcade','2017-12-31','Arcade','Arcade','The AMC hit TV series The Walking Dead has been officially transformed into an arcade gaming experience unlike any other. With an authentic crossbow controller, players aim to take their shot at the undead and rescue the innocent. Interior lighting and a bone-shaking Thrill-D sound system will keep players on the edge of their seats as they struggle through swarms of walkers to reach safety. Fast-paced action and movement demand precision accuracy and quick reflexes. Additional armaments, such as nail guns, knives, crowbars, and more, will aid the player in escaping from the dead. Rescuing fellow survivors from the oncoming horde grants players a health bonus, which reduces the odds that they too will join the ranks of The Walking Dead. Play with friends or play by yourself, if you dare!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yny.jpg'),(8681,'Bloody Roar Extreme','2003-07-17','Fighting','Xbox','Bloody Roar Extreme is the Xbox version of Bloody Roar Primal Fury first released on the Nintendo GameCube. This version includes a new character, CGI cutscenes and hidden game modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xrq.jpg'),(8682,'Girl Abducted','2025-03-03','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A quiet evening turns into a nightmare. Two sisters find themselves stalked by abductors. As they close in, the girls must outwit their pursuers to survive the night. With tense chases, comedic twists, and daring escapes, their bond will be tested in a high-stakes battle for freedom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i67.jpg'),(8683,'Suffocate',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Suffocate is a first-person horror survival game. The story takes place in modern Taiwan and combines family, religion, politics and other elements; avoid the chasing of spirits in the mansion, seeking the unbearable memories and truth while exploring the environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zsp.jpg'),(8684,'The Adventures of Rad Gravity','1991-05-30','Shooter, Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','The Adventures of Rad Gravity is a video game for the Nintendo Entertainment System developed by Interplay and published by Activision in 1990. The game is a platformer with a wacky storyline in which the eponymous main character explored multiple planets and fought enemies while jumping through levels. The game was notable for the planet Turvia, where gravity works in reverse. In that level the protagonist was drawn upside down, as were the enemies and the entire screen. The main character has a comically large head and strongly resembles actor Bruce Campbell. His early game attack consists of a sort of a lightsaber.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5agl.jpg'),(8685,'Until the Last Plane 1942','2025-02-17','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Soar across the skies of World War II in this vertical shootem\'up. Duel enemy fighters, strike critical targets and choose your wingmen wisely. The year is 1942, and the odds are against you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7f82.jpg'),(8686,'Santa Claus Saves The Earth','2002-11-29','Platform','PlayStation, Game Boy Advance','Wow! Only one day left until Christmas! Little children all over the world are anxiously awaiting Santa\'s visit. Meanwhile, very deep underground lives a wicked fairy, Nilam. She has a magic pot that allows her to see everywhere in the world. She looked into her pot and saw Santa and his helpers packing presents for all the children and became furious that so much joy existed in the world.\n\nNilam concocted a spell that enchanted Santa and locked him in her magic lands. You must help Santa escape the worlds controlled by Nilam, so that he can complete his Christmas Eve mission. Only a few hours remain, so get cracking!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xtw.jpg'),(8687,'Vector the Crocodile in Sonic the Hedgehog','2012-02-12','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','This is a hack which replaces the main character with Vector the Crocodile in the original Sonic the Hedgehog for Sega Genesis. Vector the Crocodile is a character first playable in Knuckles Chaotix and later playable in Sonic Heroes. His abilities are based on those found in Knuckles Chaotix. Moves include a spindash, air dash, and wall climb. The move list can be found in the readme. As in Chaotix Vector has reduced jump height and acceleration, making Vectors air dash move all the more valuable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qjn.jpg'),(8688,'Standpoint','2015-03-05','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A labyrinth fades into view; a space you control but that holds you. Completely lost with nowhere else you could be.\n\nHelped or harried, you are not alone here – there is someone calling, caring and crying for you. The voices you hear will guide you through the unnavigable and teach you the importance of perspective. You must use every obstacle to your advantage to escape the tunnels and discover where it was that you started – if you have moved very much at all. Real or imagined, the maze is what you make of it and if it is all in your head, where is your head?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/g02wgsqewzoxdy4hpxkt.jpg'),(8689,'Spyro: Season of Ice','2001-11-07','Platform','Game Boy Advance','Spyro: Season of Ice is the first Spyro game not developed by Insomniac Games and to appear on the Game Boy Advance. Unlike the Playstation series, Seasons of Ice has the player controlling Spyro through an isometric overhead camera. However, all of Spyro\'s skills are still available to use, including his flame breath and glide. And the flying bonus levels make use of the Mode 7 technology in order to create the 3D like perspective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yqk.jpg'),(8690,'Kurayami no Hate de Kimi wo Matsu','2009-10-22','Adventure, Visual Novel','Nintendo DS','Kurayami no Hate de Kimi wo Matsu is an adventure visual novel game, developed by WitchCraft and published by D3Publisher, which was released in Japan in 2009.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4utv.jpg'),(8691,'Aislin\'s Story: The Bloodbath Trials',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Hardcore, short horror survival game, segmented from the full game \"Aislin\'s Story\"','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8692,'The Adventures of Firulais & Calcetines','2019-10-11','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97md.jpg'),(8693,'U-Force Power Games',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Master the Power Field with the U-Force Power Games! \n \nIn this multicart, you\'ll be able to experience the only games designed specifically for the U-Force controller. Included are the games Hose \'Em Down, Nuclear Rat Attack, Rock on Air, and Power Field B-Ball. \n \nIn Hose \'Em Down you are in charge of a fire hose in front of a burning building. As people appear at the windows you must slowly lower them with your water blast. Go too slow and they burn to death! \n \nPink mutant rats are attacking your reactor in Nuclear Rat Attack. If you don\'t kill them fast enough they fry and meltdown the system! \n \nRock on Air turns your U-Force into a theremin and lets you create music. Wave your hands around so your friends think you are crazy! \n \nThink sports games where you just hit a button are too easy? Power Field B-Ball challenges you by having no buttons! Added two player mode with one U-Force controller ensures the hilarity doesn\'t stop. \n \nMuch more than a reproduction, this original game cartridge is built using all new parts. No donor carts were harmed in the making of this game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8694,'Pokémon Light Platinum','2008-10-26','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Game Boy Advance','You wake up in a mystery place and witness a fight between Arceus, Dialga, Palkia, and Giratina. \"It must be a nightmare\" you think. Where are you and what is going on? When the dream ends, you appear to be in your house but you get a message that the Professor need your help. Only you know the secret language of Alpha, a language passed down by your father. It is the only key to solving the problem. Did that dream have any effect on your world? Get a Pokémon, travel across the world and save it before it\'s too late!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90cs.jpg'),(8695,'Cortex Command','2012-09-28','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In the world of Cortex Command, many humans have opted to amputate their entire natural bodies in order to prolong their lives and enable interstellar space travel. Their disembodied brains are hardly helpless, however, as they can remotely control all kinds of machines and craft through artificial interfaces.\n\nPlaying as one of these people\'s brains, you can quickly switch control between many different expendable bodies in order to complete otherwise dangerous tasks - all from the physical safety of your command bunker. Use these technological powers of telepathy to collect gold out of the fully destructible terrain, then purchase even more bodies and materiel with those newly acquired funds!\n\nYou can even program the crude A.I.s of your puppet army to complete simple tasks (patrolling, digging, etc.) while your attention and direct control is somewhere else. Use your accumulated forces to protect your brain, explore the world, and defeat your competition!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eiu.jpg'),(8696,'Nemesis Perspective','2016-12-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Challenge your friend in a classic hero versus giant boss monster setting. Wielding VR equipment your objective is to prove your superiority by crushing those who disturb your sacred peace (namely your friend who’s playing as your opponent with console controller).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/esfi46k7fexxqqcikq6o.jpg'),(8697,'CyberNeon',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','This game takes the classic MATCH-THREE concept for a spin. A competitive and rapid gameplay, set in a dystopian CYBERPUNK future. Match three signs to colorize the board and DOMINATE your opponent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dct.jpg'),(8698,'Metahorror Therapy Session','2025-06-01','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take control of a therapist in a mysterious, never-ending therapy session. Can you unravel the truth behind your patient\'s lies, and live to tell the tale? A psychological mystery developed by a psychologist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9myn.jpg'),(8699,'Where Winter Crows Go','2022-12-24','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Would you risk living together with a stranger in an isolated cabin to avoid the freezing cold?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g9u.jpg'),(8700,'Atelier Ryza: Ever Darkness & the Secret Hideout - Digital Deluxe Edition','2019-10-29','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','(Content of \"Atelier Ryza: Digital Deluxe Edition\")\n- The game \"Atelier Ryza: Ever Darkness & the Secret Hideout\"\n- Costume Set \"Another Fashion\"\n- Costume Set \"Summer Style\"\n- Hideout Parts \"Pixie Forest\"\n- Hideout Parts \"Lakeside Hideout\"\n- Initial Dash Item Set\n- Extra Large! Rebuild Gem Pack\n\nThe concept of this title, the latest in the series to depict a new \"Atelier\" world, is \"True-to-life youths that develop together, even if just a little bit\".\nIt is the story of a girl and her friends who are about to become adults, discovering what is most important to them.\nTo depict the story of the main characters discovering things they\'ve never seen before, we\'ve created fields with natural shadows that allow you to feel the breath of the world. Graphics have been further enhanced, allowing for a world of daily-life and adventure to be depicted in a new way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cns.jpg'),(8701,'OLO game','2012-05-25','Strategy','iOS','OLO is an addictive game of skill and strategy, a new generation social board game for all ages. Play with up to three friends on one device.    The aim is to get as many of your OLOs into your target zone. Use cunning techniques to outmaneuver your opponent and claim victory, but beware the death finger!\n\nOlo is a tabletop game similar to shuffleboard where players flick an \"olo\" disc to the other side of the screen. Olos come in different sizes and weights, and can be captured if bounced back into your scoring zone. After 3 captures, an olo is destroyed by the touch of death. Olo supports same-screen multiplayer action for 2 or 4 players and previously supported online multiplayer operated from 2012 until 2020 with the release of OLO Loco. Based on a once popular web app.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co256d.jpg'),(8702,'Gachinco Tennis S','2021-01-28','Fighting, Sport, Indie','Nintendo Switch','Gachinco Tennis S is a tennis battle game with flashy magical ball attacks that can be activated with a single button.\n\nThere are 24 characters with different magic and abilities. The game starts with 12 characters and others are unlocked by defeating them in invasion matches after winning in the tournament mode.\n\nThe game uses a tag team match with original rules, after selecting 2 characters it plays like a singles match but the characters can swap at any time during a rally. Seize victory by using two types of magic and swap characters depending on the situation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73uw.jpg'),(8703,'Batman: Arkham City - Batman Inc. Batsuit Skin','2011-12-20','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','In appreciation of your continued support, please download this free Batman Inc. skin. Unlock the Batman Inc. Batsuit Skin and lead the war on crime as the head of a global vigilante task force. This skin can be worn in the story campaign upon completion of main story and in the challenge maps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zh1.jpg'),(8704,'Life is Strange','2015-01-30','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Life is Strange is a five part episodic game that sets out to revolutionize story based choice and consequence games by allowing the player to rewind time and affect the past, present and future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r8e.jpg'),(8705,'Live Art','2023-05-16','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hold to draw, avoid the obstacles, and bring the arts to life! Super easy to understand but very challenging and packed with tons of fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hi5.jpg'),(8706,'The Spidy D','2022-06-17','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','The clicking adventure you and your friends need. Catch moths with the main hero of the game The Spidy D and chatch all the moths in the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vm8.jpg'),(8707,'BioShock: Ultimate Rapture Edition','2013-01-22','Shooter','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','This edition includes the original BioShock, BioShock 2 and add-on content for both games.\n\nFor BioShock, this edition includes the Plasmid Pack and the DLC \"Challenge Rooms\" (which was a PS3 exclusive, now available as well for the Xbox 360 version). In addition, a new add-on for BioShock, \"Museum of Orphaned Concepts,\" showcases early concept art and ideas that were removed or never added to the final version of the game.\n\nFor BioShock 2, the Ultimate Rapture Edition will also include the Sinclair Solutions Tester Pack, Rapture Metro Pack, Kill \'em Kindly, The Protector Trials and Minerva\'s Den DLC, which come with related achievements/trophies.\n\nThis edition also comes with a collectible Columbia Sticker pack, inspired by the then-upcoming game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54yf.jpg'),(8708,'Petz Rescue Ocean Patrol','2008-10-28','Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo DS','Petz Rescue: Ocean Sanctuary is an adventure game in which players manage a dolphin sanctuary for displaced or wounded ocean animals. Players complete various tasks and participate in mini-games, while learning about the plight of endangered species. Tasks/mini-games include tending to the wounds of dolphins, feeding dolphins, preparing medicine, and locating lost animals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xwn8ifbo0ldaoy51g0m3.jpg'),(8709,'Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba - The Hinokami Chronicles: Nezuko Advanced Demon Form','2022-08-09','Fighting, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Nezuko Kamado (Advanced Demon Form) will become a playable character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zkh.jpg'),(8710,'Dragon Ball Z: The Legacy of Goku II','2003-06-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Dragon Ball Z: The Legacy of Goku II was released on June 17, 2003. The plot of the game picks up where The Legacy of Goku left off, and continues until the end of the Cell Games Saga when Gohan defeats the evil android Cell. The game introduced several new concepts to the series. The first was transformations, which allowed characters to become temporarily stronger, at the cost of slowly draining their energy. It also introduced the scouter, which allowed players to look up the stats of other characters in the game, as well as basic information about them. The game also introduced charged melee attacks, which allowed characters to unleash a powerful physical strike after a short charging period. The game also allowed characters to further supplement their stats with capsules that were scattered around the game world. Despite being titled \"The Legacy of Goku\" this game featured the most limited play as the character Goku.\n\nDue to the game\'s success, a second version was released titled Dragon Ball Z: The Legacy of Goku II International exclusive to Japan on July 23, 2004. In this version all characters were given new profile images and their names were reverted to their original Japanese. However, Mister Satan still retains his English name \"Hercule\" on the front of his parade float.\n\n[Source] - Wikipedia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z5y.jpg'),(8711,'Prototype X1','2016-11-06','Shooter, Arcade','Android, iOS','PrototypeX1 is the most spectacular Sky-Shooter action game for mobile devices! Take control over a legendary plane called \"PrototypeX1\" and rescue the world. Stunning 3D graphics are featured and combined with user-friendly controls and unforgettable boss battles.\n\nAre you ready to rescue the world from general Brevil?\n\nFEATURES:\n- 8 beautiful levels (desert, forest, ice and more).\n- Challenging boss battles.\n- Upgradeable superweapons (shields, guns, lasers, mega-bombs and photon-shots).\n- Designed for beginners and hardcore shooters.\n- Full voiceover and incredible soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/q1a4s339i7j0xdq9vw8z.jpg'),(8712,'Sakuya-san Crisis: The Perfect Elegant Skill','2011-05-08','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blow up enemies in your way! Kick fairies for good measure!\nBlast away massive hordes of enemies in this Touhou parody shooting RPG!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5080.jpg'),(8713,'Callparin 2','2021-08-03','Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Callparin Island is a sun-drenched island with lots of jungle, beautiful beaches and an extremely hot desert in the center of the island. Callparin 2 offers a varied open world in third-person perspective, where you can interact with pretty much anything. There are numerous shops where you can buy and sell items. It is up to the player how the money is made. In addition, there is a lively underwater world that can be explored.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mp6.jpg'),(8714,'BioShock 2','2010-02-09','Shooter, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','BioShock 2 is the second game of the BioShock series and the sequel to BioShock. It continues the grand storyline of the underwater metropolis Rapture. BioShock 2 capitalizes and improves upon the high-quality effects, unique gameplay elements, and immersive atmosphere that defined the first game. It explores more brutal gameplay than its predecessor, with new enemies, weapons, Plasmids, and Gene Tonics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mlj.jpg'),(8715,'Totally Spies! Cyber Mission','2024-10-31','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Totally Spies! Cyber Mission is a brand-new story set in the world of the new Season 7 of the Totally Spies! series.\n\nPlaying as Sam, Clover and Alex, players will be plunged into the heart of Singapore, where every street and every corner holds secrets to be discovered. Whether playing solo or in local multiplayer mode for up to three players, they will have the opportunity to master the art of infiltration, solve complex puzzles and, thanks to a variety of fashionable gadgets, save the world with style!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9moz.jpg'),(8716,'Ray the Flying Squirrel in Sonic the Hedgehog','2019-10-04','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','This is a ROM hack of Sonic the Hedgehog for the Sega Mega Drive, that features Ray the Flying Squirrel, who takes the place of Sonic the Hedgehog.\n\nUnlike Fabricechaotix\' 2007 version of Ray the Flying Squirrel in Sonic the Hedgehog, which only had SegaSonic the Hedgehog to reference, this one used Sonic Mania Plus as a reference, and also pulled assets from it, such as art.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qua.jpg'),(8717,'Cross The Boundaries','2025-03-24','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a Touhou Fangame. Maribel Hearn is a girl with unusual experience with ghosts and supernatural beings. In Cross The Boundaries, you will solve riddles while trying to stay alive, and looking for a way out of the nightmare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hm4.jpg'),(8718,'Brave Doggy Quest','2021-11-12','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Brave doggy quest - Mysterious creatures have stolen the entire supply of your favorite bones and scattered them everywhere - you need to do something about it! Go on a journey, collect your wealth and put things in order!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5c5b.jpg'),(8719,'Afterdream & Distraint Series Bundle','2023-09-28','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This bundle comes with 3 games and the soundtrack for Distraint 2!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77ml.jpg'),(8720,'Max Pirate','2024-05-04','Arcade','Mega Duck/Cougar Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ok5.jpg'),(8721,'Dungeon Master II: The Legend of Skullkeep','1995-12-31','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','Mac, DOS, Amiga, Sega CD','Dungeon Master established several new standards for role playing and computer games in general. Dungeon Master was a realtime game instead of the traditional turn-based approach that was prevalent until then. Instead of using text-based commands to interact with the environment, players directly manipulated objects and the environment by clicking the mouse in the enlarged first-person view. Abstract Dungeons and Dragons style experience points and levels were eschewed in favor of a system where the characters\' skills were improved directly via using them.\n\nIt also introduced some novel control methods including the spell casting system, which involved learning sequences of runes which represented the form and function of a spell\'s effect. For example, a fireball spell was created by mixing the fire symbol with the wing symbol. This kind of attention to detail and focus on the user interface was typical of the game and helped create an often captivating sense of craft and ingenuity. Other factors in immersiveness were the then-revolutionary use of sound effects to indicate when a creature was nearby, and (primitive) dynamic lighting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yn4.jpg'),(8722,'Escape the Quack',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get ready to race in this exciting platformer against the clock, complete your tasks, and outsmart the duck in this captivating low-poly world! Compete against friends and the world with an online leaderboard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gm1.jpg'),(8723,'Call of Duty: Modern Warfare Remastered','2016-11-04','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','One of the most critically-acclaimed games in history. Call of Duty 4: Modern Warfare is back, remastered in true high-definition, featuring enhanced textures, rendering, high-dynamic range lighting, and much more to bring a new generation experience to fans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wla.jpg'),(8724,'Bloody Roar: Primal Fury','2002-05-03','Fighting','Nintendo GameCube','Bloody Roar Extreme (also known as Bloody Roar: Primal Fury outside of Japan) is a fighting game. It is an updated version of the PS2 game Bloody Roar 3. Players can control a number of characters which have the ability to morph into powerful animals, such as tigers and wolves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4t49.jpg'),(8725,'Pupperazzi','2022-01-20','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Who will photograph, pet, and tell these dogs they\'re good boys and girls if you don\'t?? The world NEEDS you in Pupperazzi, the dog photography game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m9t.jpg'),(8726,'Pikmin','2002-08-23','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Adventure','Nintendo GameCube','Pikmin is a whole new breed of gameplay from Nintendo. The quirky, life-under-the-microscope title delivers a unique experience like few before it with a blend of real-time strategy, adventure, and puzzle elements. Taking advantage of the GameCube\'s graphics power, Pikmin sports lush texture work that brings to life a microscopic fantasy world. Players control Captain Olimar, a lovable little astronaut, who crash landed on a planet inhabited by even more lovable little plant creatures known as Pikmin. Olimar can command these creatures RTS-style, assign them tasks, make them attack foes, and gather resources. The ultimate task is to rebuild Olimar\'s space ship before a 30-day time window elapses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nqg.jpg'),(8727,'Cthulhu Virtual Pet 2','2019-07-25','Simulator, Indie','Android, iOS','Have you ever dreamt of raising a Lovecraftian God from infancy to glorious monsterhood? \n \nNo matter if you are a fan of Lovecraft or you just read this name for the first time, this pixel art retro virtual pet game will be in your pocket to fill your days with fun. \n \nYou will be a new student of the Miskatonic University, and your mission is to take care of the great old one Cthulhu ^(;,,;)^. \n \nKey features: \n \n- Feed, clean, destroy and make him sleep \n- 4 stages of evolution from infant to god \n- 5 different scenes depend of the day \n- 6 groups of food to satisfy his big stomach \n- Dress him up with 80+ pieces of T-shirt, pants, hats, wings and glasses \n- Invoke other Lovecraftian monsters and receive special gifts \n- Play mini games to gain souls for his daily routine \n- Accomplish missions to collect seals and golden skulls \n- Name your own Cthulhu and his witnesses \n- Optional retro filter for your nostalgia \n- Cloud save keeps your progress in sync on your different devices \n \nWake up the sleeping Cthulhu and help him to resume his rule of earth!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ruu.jpg'),(8728,'King\'s Quest 7+8','1998-11-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This bundle contains:\n\n- King’s Quest 7: The Princeless Bride\n- King’s Quest 8: Mask of Eternity','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gsa.jpg'),(8729,'Coby Portable DVD Player',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','The TF-DVD560 is a portable DVD player released in 2006, manufactured by Coby with 12 built-in Sega Game Gear and Master System games. It has a 3.5 inch TFT screen and runs off an AC adapter, car adapter or lithium ion battery. The games are emulated using console-on-a-chip hardware licensed from AtGames.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sm6.jpg'),(8730,'Kiss the Demiurge','2022-12-01','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Minori is a mage tasked with hiding magic from the world. She has spurned love in the pursuit of her mission. One day she meets a group of three girls obsessed with magic. Will she stop them from discovering real magic? Or will she fall for their charms? Find out in this dramatic girls-love story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5trj.jpg'),(8731,'Pixxelverse Online',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pixxelverse Online is a game that blurs the line between a social platform (MMOSP) and a roleplaying game (MMORPG). It is a place for people to socialize, build together, talk to each other, share video, and communicate in real-time. You and your friends can join together and go on adventures on a map that changes each year. By playing the game and exploring the world the users can obtain new cosmetics, furniture and weapons to enhance their characters and offer them a unique experience with a unique avatar customized by you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m4n.jpg'),(8732,'Metal Gear Rising: Revengeance - Blade Wolf','2013-05-09','Arcade','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Blade Wolf is the second story DLC for Metal Gear Rising: Revengeance. Initially a commercial release, it was made available for free around the time of the PC version\'s release, where it was included by default. It is a separate story campaign with Blade Wolf as the protagonist, a boss for Raiden in the original game. It is a robot wolf with a chainsaw on its back who originally worked for Mistral. The campaign is set prior to the encounter with Raiden at Abkhazia in the original game and the story is told as a flashback. Just like the first DLC most of the environments are reused from the original game, most notably R-01.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zf5.jpg'),(8733,'BioShock 2 Remastered','2020-05-29','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','BioShock 2 Remastered was released as a part of BioShock: The Collection and also available separately for PC. The remastered version has achievements, full controller support, high resolution textures, models and interface, and 4K resolution support.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54yw.jpg'),(8734,'Werewolf: The Apocalypse - Earthblood Champion of Gaia Edition','2021-02-04','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','You are Cahal, a powerful Garou who chose to go into exile after losing control of his destructive rage. On his quest for redemption and blood, Cahal plays a crucial role in the great war between the Garous and Endron, a powerful oil company that serves the Wyrm, whose destruction is ravaging the planet.\nHe can transform into a wolf and a Crinos, a huge ferocious beast.\nEach form has its advantages: the wolf can sneak around undetected, Cahal as a human can interact with other people, and the Werewolf can unleash its rage to tear enemies apart.\n\nThe Champion of Gaia edition includes:\n- Full game\n- 3 outfits for Cahal\n- 4 exclusive furs for the Wolf and Werewolf\n- A nature spirit to help you in combat\n- A unique finishing move','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4o7a.jpg'),(8735,'Jalecolle Famicom Ver. Magic John & Totally RAD','2025-04-23','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8736,'Deadly Tide','1996-10-31','Point-and-click, Shooter, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deadly Tide is a pre-rendered shooter in which the player gets to control a deadly new undersea vehicle. The basic plot behind the game is that the aliens have arrived on Earth, and they are not friendly. They take up residence in the oceans of Earth, and begin to launch attacks on shipping. Plus, they are also slowly raising the level of the oceans, trying to flood humans from the planet. Your mission is to stop them.\n\nThe game is split up into a number of stages, taking place in various locations, the ultimate aim being to make your way through to the end of that level in once piece. There are many cutscenes that advance the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s8a.jpg'),(8737,'Rurouni Kenshin: Meiji Kenkaku Roman-tan - Ishin Gekitou-hen','1996-11-29','Fighting','PlayStation','Kenshin Himura was an assassin for the Imperial side during the war that ended the Shogunate and installed the Meiji government. After killing countless people, he made a vow to never kill again. Ten years later, he finds a home at a failing dojo, only to be caught up in a string of murders related to an opium ring. His commitment to never taking a life is put to the test as the people he\'s come to care about are threatened by figures from his past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u9e.jpg'),(8738,'Spirit of the Island: Beach Resort','2023-06-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Spirit of the Island: Beach Resort is set to bring this much requested feature at no additional cost! With the new DLC, you will have the option to pick a brand new starting location — Beach Resort.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kpi.jpg'),(8739,'Lara Croft: Reflections','2013-12-20','Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','iOS','Lara Croft: Reflections is a battle card game starring Tomb Raider\'s protagonist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ejpxg6mhoybqi1y5lkdj.jpg'),(8740,'Boss Beek-Beekeeping Simulator','2022-02-03','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Boss Beek is a beekeeping game that allows you to play the role of a beekeeper! You\'ll have hours of entertainment building hives with the best parts you can find to house the best queens and make the best honey!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5c3u.jpg'),(8741,'Immercenary','1995-12-31','Shooter','3DO Interactive Multiplayer','In the future, mankind has been enslaved in a virtual reality simulation known as Perfect. This simulation is controlled by an entity known as Perfect1 and it has to be destroyed in order to shut down the system. You are Immercenary Number Five, and it\'s your job to do it.\n\nFrom a secret lab you log into the simulation which sends you to a place in Perfect known as the Garden. Every entity in the game has a certain rank that determines its offensive and defensive capabilities. You start at 255, the lowest rank, and must rise in ranks to defeat Perfect1, who holds rank number 1. To do so, you destroy higher-ranked Rithms, as the other entities in the game are called. To pass beyond certain ranks, unique Rithms high in the Perfect hierarchy have to be destroyed.\n\nDifferent weapons and power-ups can be collected and spent offensive and defensive energy can be recharged at energy spires. In the center of the Garden is a place called DOAsys, which functions as a neutral zone and healing center. There you can talk to other Rithms and ask for hints about combating special Rithms and where to find special items. These dialogue sequences take the form of live action clips of actors in elaborate costumes playing the Rithms.\n\nWhen the player logs out of the simulation or is violently forced out, he returns to the lab where one may load and save a game and access detailed statistics on the trips to Perfect.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gs5.jpg'),(8742,'G-Mode Archives 53: Daienkai Buchou','2023-12-07','Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Aim to be the biggest banquet manager in Japan!! Let\'s liven up the banquet with partitions and care!\n\n\"Daienkai Buchou\" is a collection of mini-games based on the motif of Japanese salaryman culture \"Banquet\".\n\nLet\'s play unique and varied mini-games to liven up various banquets such as year-end parties, New Year\'s parties, cherry blossom viewing, barbecues, etc., and improve the skills of the secretary!\nIn addition to \"Drinkers\" who pour beer into the mug, \"Sashi-turning\" to help with entertainment, etc., all 9 types of mini-games full of seasonal feeling such as \"Cherry Blossom Viewing\", \"Nagashi Somen\" and \"Fireworks Festival\".\n\nAlso, let\'s collect bingo prizes with bingo tickets that you can get when you get a high score.\nDepending on the degree of collection of prizes and the score of the game, the title of banquet manager will be increased! Please aim for the ultimate title!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7y7g.jpg'),(8743,'The Uncertain: Last Quiet Day','2022-03-03','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','The Uncertain: Last Quiet Day is an story-driven adventure game set in a post-apocalyptic world. You see it from the perspective of an engineering robot RT-217NP, who seems to be very curious about the human race, long extinct in wasting wars. Experience the mysterious vibe of each of carefully explored locations. Test your skills, solving diverse puzzles. Make fateful decisions and discuss intriguing matters to find out the whole truth being kept from you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co445z.jpg'),(8744,'UltraGoodness Franchise Bundle',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t6b.jpg'),(8745,'Li Li Nuo De Qi Huan Zhi Lu',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Lina was judged a witch by the church, and Lilina was ordered to execute her best friend... After a few years, theia territory again appeared the trace of the devil, Lilina decided to seek the truth in those days, set foot on the journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ixh.jpg'),(8746,'Kung Fu Legend','2023-05-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An open-world adventure with lots of humor and stimulating combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5imy.jpg'),(8747,'Start Over','2024-09-27','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Start Over is a thrilling multiplayer survival game that takes you to a deserted island where you must build a base, craft equipment, and defend against waves of enemies. Collaborate with other players to build a thriving community, or become a lone wolf.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j58.jpg'),(8748,'Ratopia','2025-05-01','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','New game with combined genre of strategic survival, Sandbox, and city building simulation. Enjoy the simulation with vast world to adventure with a great number of contents. Build your own economical system to sustain your ideal city of Ratopia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bre.jpg'),(8749,'Maraiyum: Rise of the Setting Sun','2016-08-25','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The coup has finally come!  \n \nAfter the disastrous rule of the previous Emperor, the Imperial army have placed you, a distant relative with no training, on the throne. With rebellions, religious insurgency, widespread famine, and a rapidly dwindling treasury, time is not on your side. Over the course of one year you must decide how best to spend your time, training your skills to enable you to make the right decisions to restore the once great Empire of the Setting Sun to its former glory, or condemn it and you to the dustbin of history.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8750,'Blades of Time: Limited Edition','2012-03-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Nintendo Switch','Ayumi, the gorgeous gun and sword-wielding treasure hunter, sets out on a journey to an ancient island in search of new adventures. While rich in bounty, the island is also filled with the magic of Chaos, being at the same time home to blood thirsty monsters. With a host of colorful characters, eye-popping visual appeal, tons of treasure and a huge variety of combat skills to master, Blades of Time will bring just as much fun and satisfaction both to gamers that are new to the action adventure genre and to experienced players.\n\nLimited Edition includes:\nBlades of Time\nBlades of Time - Dismal Swamp DLC\nBlades of Time - Original Soundtrack\nBlades of Time - Artbook','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ca7.jpg'),(8751,'Island Designer',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Turn islands into dream paradises in Island Designer! Buy, design, and sell unique retreats to satisfy clients, build your reputation, and unlock new challenges. Your vision is their paradise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co824h.jpg'),(8752,'Dead Alliance: Multiplayer Edition','2017-08-28','Sin género','Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8753,'Ariel\'s Story Studio','1998-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ariel\'s Story Studio is an interactive storybook game for children of 4 years-old and above.\n\nThe player scrolls between different screen to follow the story from The Little Mermaid. In each screen different items animate when clicked-on, and stickers for the \"Create your Story\" part may be discovered by animating some of them. In each screen\'s dialog, a word is highlighted. When the player clicks on it, it gets changed for a synonym.\n\nThe game features a \"Create your Story\" mode in which different customizable backgrounds and stickers are used to create an unique printable story. It also features a \"Compose your Melodies\" mode, in which the player chooses different instruments for the undersea orchestra to create unique songs. It also has a room in Ariel\'s cave in which the player can invite different animals that will interact together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1w1f.jpg'),(8754,'Avalon: The Journey Begins','2016-11-11','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Depart your home world of Avalon to begin the longest journey ever attempted by mankind, to find the end of the universe. What is at the end of the universe and where is the end of the universe? This is where your journey begins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lsg.jpg'),(8755,'MightyIronBall','2017-12-28','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The MightyIronBall is lost in a odd world. Help him to back to home through warp gates. Play several levels in a fast, addictive platform game with a real physics friction system. A balance mix between skill and cunning against the time. Warp gates last a few seconds, there is no time to waste.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/odx4ak3n5kvvjvt941yq.jpg'),(8756,'Tidal Hopper','2015-01-15','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tidal Hopper is an arcade game in which you play as a penguin jumping out of the water while keeping track of your oxygen meter and avoiding enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9juo.jpg'),(8757,'Footage','2024-08-12','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','FOOTAGE is a short bodycam shooter styled game witch uses unreal engine 5 latest technology to get stunning graphics and amazing gameplay. FOOTAGE has lot of action packed moments with multiple levels with different difficulty\'s to help make the game a longer and a more fun experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oan.jpg'),(8758,'Infinity war','2021-09-08','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inifinity War is a multiplayer turn-based strategy game where you will have to defend your capital, explore modules, create tanks and of course fight. To win the game, you need to capture all the enemy capitals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hat.jpg'),(8759,'James Bond 007: Everything or Nothing','2004-02-27','Shooter, Sport, Adventure','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Returning as James Bond is Pierce Brosnan, who will lend his cyberscanned likeness and voice to the character. The rest of the cast will include new Bond girls (Shannon Elizabeth and Heidi Klum) as well as old and new Bond villains. The original script will take players through exciting locales in four continents including the Valley of the Kings in Egypt and the French Quarter in New Orleans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21s1.jpg'),(8760,'China Miner','1984-12-31','Platform','Commodore C64/128/MAX','China Miner is a single screen platform game where you play Wally who is the only person to know the location of the Jade Mines belonging to the Pong Dynasty in China. On each of the 30 screens you must collect certain objects before collecting a key to move onto the next screen. As well as the platforms to negotiate you must also avoid the various creatures that populate the mine and if you touch any of them then you lose one of five lives, sent to the start of the screen and all objects reappear. There are various obstacles to avoid or use like lasers, moving platforms and platforms that disintegrate when stepped on. Falling from heights also lose you a life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hyt.jpg'),(8761,'YanYueDao Kill','2024-08-17','Point-and-click, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a simple point-and-click game where you must slay demons at the right moment. Along the way, you can acquire exquisite cards to enhance your combat power.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nci.jpg'),(8762,'Tomb Raider: The Prophecy','2002-11-12','Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Tomb Raider: The Prophecy is the first game for the Gameboy Advance. Lara is now in a quasi-3D overhead environment, as opposed to the 2D-platformer view of the previous handheld versions. This view proves helpful while Lara runs, jumps, shimmys, and shoots around. Although there is lack of a save feature, there is a password system which lets you restore back to \'almost\' where you left.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3iad.jpg'),(8763,'Doomed Detective Game','2025-03-25','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doomed Detective Game is a game in which you will play the role of a detective who has arrived in the city of Redrock to figure out a very mysterious crime. Your task is to explore the city, find clues, talk to the residents of the city and find the killer! P.S: Every city resident is an AI...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kla.jpg'),(8764,'The Plane Effect','2021-08-12','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Players take on the role of Solo, a lonely office worker who\'s trying to get home to his family after his last day of work. Somewhat worryingly, it seems Solo experiences some trouble remembering his family, and also has to contend with the shifting balance of space and time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ryv.jpg'),(8765,'Lucha Masters StickerMania','2023-09-22','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lucha Masters StickerMania is an action and platform game, you will play with Lucho, a small axolotl with a big dream, be a Luchador.\nLucho meddles in a new problem, mistakenly releases the god of jokes Mexica, a coyote, the god Huehuecoyotl, who for fun makes a joke: Destroy reality.\n\nYou will enter a world of video games and you will visit several cities in Mexico to prevent the Coyote\'s plan.\n\nYou will not be alone in this adventure, you will be able to play with professional Wrestlers such as the Legend Octagon , the Son of Octagon, Coco Rojo Segundo, Dr. Karonte Jr. and many more. Rudos and Técnicos come together to stop this threat.\n\nFace monsters like the Mummies of Guanajuato, the Witch of Catemaco, the Vampire of Guadalajara, La Llorona and many more.\n\nWill you have enough courage to stop a god, become a Luchador and eat many chilaquiles?\n\nGet ready to be a Lucha Master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co716n.jpg'),(8766,'Gas Pack','2025-01-06','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Over 100 rooms of your favorite trick Shell jumps! whooohoooo oh yea baby gimme that sweet kaizo gas pack we bringing all the smoke with this one and I promise YOU WILL feel it!\n\nThank you to everyone that play my hacks and motivate me to build fun setups. This Is my 17th Rom hack yea right wtf it does not seem real. Ok time for shell jumps!! GLHF','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fjl.jpg'),(8767,'Tenebris Pictura','2023-08-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Exploration, ghost hunting and puzzles in the Victorian era.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rzj.jpg'),(8768,'Armored Firestorm',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Armored Firestorm is an intense top-down shoot\'em up action game in a futurist environments. At the controls of your Hovertank, survive against the attack of the machines in the orbital city of the federation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co583w.jpg'),(8769,'Keep Talk Until You Dead','2021-05-04','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Voice is Your Weapon. Keep Talk Until You Dead is a Survival action game. Use your voice , destroy hordes of zombies. Improve your abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44g8.jpg'),(8770,'Ultimate Sudoku Collection: Flower Pack',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','250 puzzles of “Flower Sudoku”','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8771,'Brawlout','2018-08-21','Fighting, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Brawlout is the competitive platform fighter, designed for couch play, online ranked matches and competitive tournaments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r7b.jpg'),(8772,'Octrons Challenge: Mission Science Genius','2020-05-14','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','Octrons Challenge - Mission Science World is an arcade style Flying SuperHero Sci-Fi action adventure game for children and family.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bw3.jpg'),(8773,'Inside Jennifer','2022-10-02','Simulator, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62de.jpg'),(8774,'Bakery Shop Simulator','2021-04-20','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Run Your Own Bakery Shop . Manage Economics , keep and eye on your resources \nwhile baking 25 types of bread and cakes , and be the cashier in a bakery shop \non the main street','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xnv.jpg'),(8775,'Uncharted 4: A Thief\'s End','2016-05-10','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4','Several years after his last adventure, retired fortune hunter, Nathan Drake, is forced back into the world of thieves. With the stakes much more personal, Drake embarks on a globe-trotting journey in pursuit of a historical conspiracy behind a fabled pirate treasure. His greatest adventure will test his physical limits, his resolve, and ultimately what he\'s willing to sacrifice to save the ones he loves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r7h.jpg'),(8776,'Gregor',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Solve the mysteries of the forest while developing your teaching career.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6cv8.jpg'),(8777,'Bish Bash Bots','2023-10-19','Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Bish Bash Bots is a unique mix of casual tower defense strategy and all-out brawling action. Team up in couch co-op / online play or go it alone and fight to save the world by building upgradable turrets, unlocking gadgets and bashing bots with giant hammers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70ks.jpg'),(8778,'Iron Cross','1994-12-31','Strategy','DOS','Iron Cross is a real time/turn based hybrid wargame placed in the France of WW2. You create a character and then go at it in 1 one of 12 pre-made scenarios from either side. Depending on your prowess you\'ll be promoted or demoted with the consequential increase or decrease of units available to command.\n\nGraphics are top-down 2D SVGA sprites, and the game includes historical commentary on all of the 12 scenarios, as well as a scenario editor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w6x.jpg'),(8779,'Cataclismo','2024-07-22','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Cataclismo left us broken. Construct fortresses and defend against waves of Horrors in this mix of tower defense and real-time strategy. Lead an expedition beyond the gates of the last city, and reclaim mist-shrouded ruins as you rebuild humanity—stone by stone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fgm.jpg'),(8780,'Miss It!','2009-06-23','Arcade','Atari 2600, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Miss It is a homebrew Atari 2600 game developed by Alan W. Smith and initially released online in 2009. The game went on to receive a limited cartridge release through Good Deal Games in 2011. Miss It was later included in the Atari Flashback series of plug-and-play consoles, starting with the Atari Flashback 5 in 2014, and most recently in the Atari Flashback X Deluxe in 2019.\n\nIn Miss It, the player must move a black square to avoid touching colorful squares that bounce around the screen, the number of which increases over time. The longer the player manages to avoid contact, the higher the score they achieve. The left difficulty switch can toggle the functionality of the score counter, either to go up 1 point every second, or to only increase when the the player is moving.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nwh.jpg'),(8781,'Razion EX','2021-09-16','Shooter, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, Neo Geo MVS, Nintendo Switch','Razion EX is a horizontal shooting game with a score system based on growing gold cubes and using the beam. There are three game modes; novice, normal and maniac.\nNovice mode is significantly easier and will allow more people to enjoy the great graphics and music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d9w.jpg'),(8782,'Still Life','2005-06-03','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Two separate murder cases, in two separate lifetimes - so similar in the smallest of details that one could believe they were performed by the same person. Impossible! One of the crimes took place 75 years ago, while the other just happened! Is someone copying an old serial killer? Or is it remotely possible that the same murderer is still alive and committing more crimes?\n\nIn this thriller adventure, you\'ll play as Victoria, an FBI agent, in modern Chicago as well as her grandfather, Gustav, P.I. in Prague in the 1920s. Explore Chicago and Prague and solve puzzles while preforming investigations in two time periods.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co222h.jpg'),(8783,'Mario & Sonic at the Rio 2016 Olympic Games','2016-04-09','Sport','Nintendo 3DS','A new 3DS game sees Mario and Sonic team up to compete in a whole range of different Olympic games. You can download to three other 3DS’s and play four players in each of the different events. There’s also a Pocket Marathon mode than uses the motion sensor in the 3DS to act like a pedometer and challenge people to get outside and get active.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22wj.jpg'),(8784,'You Are Mine 2','2022-12-13','Simulator, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Part 2 of the popular love story has finally arrived!\n\nIn this interactive romance otome game, you are the one in control of the romantic story!\n\nYou have several options as to how the story will unfold.\nImmerse yourself in an enchanted game of your choice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8asd.jpg'),(8785,'Sonic Legacy',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h4y.jpg'),(8786,'Kirby no Omochabako: Cannonball','1996-02-08','Arcade','Satellaview','In Kirby\'s Toy Box - Cannonball, the player controls a giant robotic Rick, which can shoot spherical Kirbys out from its head. The game is a simplified take on the same concept used by numerous other games based around lobbing parabolic projectiles at opponents over hills with destructible terrain, such as Scorched Earth and the |Worms series. A large hill divides the screen into two halves, with Player 1 on the left; the right side is occupied by another robot hamster, which is controlled by a CPU or a second player. The goal of the game is defeat the opponent robot by hitting it with enough Kirbys. Each robot can move its head to change the direction and angle of the Kirbys it fires. They can also walk slowly forward and backward. The robots can blast tiny holes in the hill by shooting it with Kirbys. When one robot is defeated, the game ends with surviving robot being the winner.\n\nThere are multiple stages to play on, but the only difference between them is the scenery. Clouds will stop any Kirby that hits them, causing the projectile to lose all momentum and fall.\n\nLike every other sub-game in Kirby\'s Toy Box, this game could only be downloaded by the Satellaview during the brief period it was broadcast.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30d6.jpg'),(8787,'Star Fire',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','This rogue-like action game will get your adrenaline pumping, combining exhilarating combat with deep strategic building! Every adventure is a brand-new beginning, you\'ll unlock new talents, hone your skills, and create powerful skill combinations to destroy groups of monsters ultimately! Ready？','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t4p.jpg'),(8788,'Plotting','1990-12-31','Puzzle','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','Home computer version of the Arcade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wuu.jpg'),(8789,'Dangerous World 2','2010-10-19','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sequel of Dangerous World and events of the HL2: Episode Two. We\'ll see how Frank Harrison deals with it.\n\nAlthough, DW2 full version was scheduled to be released in 2011, only a playable demo version was released on October 2010, which contains two maps for DW 2. Players were advised to observe their vicinity carefully - sometimes even a small detail can show them the right direction or tell them what to do.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99z3.jpg'),(8790,'Mound of Music','2024-10-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Mound of Music\" is a game dedicated to the art of MUSIC, presenting a captivating sci-fi story. Experience unique gameplay that lets you explore humanity\'s past through the universal language of music. Embrace beautiful classical music from around the world, fate and the truth are about to emerge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z6a.jpg'),(8791,'Naruto Shippuden: Clash of Ninja Revolution 3','2009-11-17','Fighting','Wii','Naruto Shippuden: Clash of Ninja Revolution 3 is an exciting new fighting game based on the hit Naruto Shippuden animated series, exclusively for Wii','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ubt.jpg'),(8792,'A Mind Forever Voyaging','1986-12-31','Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, Mac, DOS, Amiga, Apple II','A Mind Forever Voyaging (AMFV) is a 1985 interactive fiction game, intended as a polemical critique of Ronald Reagan\'s politics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co211d.jpg'),(8793,'Bloodborne: The Old Hunters Edition','2015-11-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4','This edition includes the following:\n- Game: Bloodborne The Old Hunters Edition\n- Guide Book\n- Mini Soundtrack CD','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47rc.jpg'),(8794,'Silent Forest: Deadly Night Horror','2025-02-06','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Silent Forest: In this forest, silence is deadly. Hunt or be hunted.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d0o.jpg'),(8795,'Fallout 3','2009-01-15','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Fallout 3 from the creators of the award-winning Oblivion, featuring one of the most realized game worlds ever created. Create any kind of character you want and explore the open wastes of post-apocalyptic Washington D.C. Every minute is a fight for survival as you encounter Super Mutants, Ghouls, Raiders and other dangers of the Wasteland. Prepare for the future.\n\nThe third game in the Fallout series, Fallout 3 is a singleplayer action role-playing game (RPG) set in a post-apocalyptic Washington DC. Combining the horrific insanity of the Cold War era theory of mutually assured destruction gone terribly wrong, with the kitschy naivety of American 1950s nuclear propaganda, Fallout 3 will satisfy both players familiar with the popular first two games in its series as well as those coming to the franchise for the first time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ycw.jpg'),(8796,'Kotsuniku no Scotra: Banana Squash','1998-07-06','Sport','PC-9800 Series','A PC98 Disc Station game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co683f.jpg'),(8797,'Oik Reloaded','2020-06-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The final part of the OIK reloaded!\nYou need to remove all red objects from the screen and hold the blue cube on the platform for 2 seconds!\nThe game simulates real physics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a15.jpg'),(8798,'Orc Massage','2022-02-09','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Orc Massage is a 3D adult simulation game. You play as an honest Orc who is trying to make a living with his business, but his monster girl clients have a bad habit of getting turned on by his \"handy work\". Will he stay professional or be seduced by his clients? That is all on you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qo3.jpg'),(8799,'Luigi\'s Misadventures 4: Galactic Kids Next Door','2022-07-18','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','This is a sequel of Luigi\'s Misadventures 3 with 105 exits.\nIt\'s about the Galactic Kids Next Door.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wtu.jpg'),(8800,'Immortals Must Die','2024-06-18','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Indie Roquelite 2d\n\nKill hordes of demons as you unlock new items and skills, complete quests, upgrade your equipment and discover different ways of getting through the challenges that await you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sji.jpg'),(8801,'Ferral Quest','2025-04-04','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Open world. With different biomes: forest, jungle, desert, wasteland snowy, volcanic. In addition to dozens of dungeons to explore and hidden secrets.\nOpen world PVE missions, special dungeons.\nRaid Bosses and Wanderers to hunt scattered around the world.\nProgression from Tier 0 to Tier 10.\nDevelop your skill tree to make your character unique.\nDifferent buffs and equipment so you can forge your strategy in battle.\nGet the best equipment by destroying big bosses in their dungeons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hl8.jpg'),(8802,'Gold Medalist','1988-02-01','Sport','Arcade','Based on the Seoul Olympics, this is a multi-event track and field game for up to four players and featuring nine different events. Despite being heavily influenced by Konami\'s own \"Track and Field\" series, Gold Medalist lacks both the addictiveness and tight gameplay mechanics of the games upon which it is based. The nine disciplines, which can be attempted in any order, are : \n* 100 Metre Sprint \n* Long Jump \n* Horizontal Bars \n* Freestyle Swimming \n* Boxing \n* Discus \n* 110m Hurdles \n* High Jump \n* 400m Relay','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/t82ebwnecwe0qufr3yg7.jpg'),(8803,'Bayonetta + Bayonetta 2: Special Edition','2014-10-24','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Wii U','This is a European bundle that includes Bayonetta 1 and Bayonetta 2 both in each own disc and case for the WiiU.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fho.jpg'),(8804,'Rail Route','2021-06-23','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rail Route is a tycoon/management game based on railroad dispatching. Control the traffic, build out your own network, then optimize and expand. Unlock new technologies, upgrade the infrastructure, and automate operations! Design and share your own maps with the in-game editor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wmv.jpg'),(8805,'Return to Ringworld','1994-05-04','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After saving the puppeteer race from extermination and uncovering some powerful ancient technology in the first game, Quinn, Seeker of Vengeance and Miranda Rees find themselves searched as fugitives by all three major species, so they go to Ringworld to hide. Once in Ringworld they\'ll try to uncover some evidence to clear their names, but they stumble across another universe-threatening plot. This time U.N. general Carson Teal is out to rule the universe by uncovering Ringworld\'s secrets, and you must stop him.\n\nReturn to Ringworld is the sequel to the Ringworld: Revenge of the Patriarch. Like its predecessor, it is based on Larry Niven\'s Known Space series of novels. Once again this game is a puzzle-solving point-and-click adventure. This game is much larger than its predecessor, with hundreds of screens, mazes, etc. The player can control three characters throughout the game, a la Day of the Tentacle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zhcm7ygmoqcbn9ie2h28.jpg'),(8806,'Algebra Ridge','2020-11-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ready to save the world with the power of math? Find out in this unique story-driven adventure! In Algebra Ridge, you must stop Big Cheesy from stealing the Pencil of Knowledge!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lbn.jpg'),(8807,'EF Universe: Reclaiming the World','2019-03-28','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An idle game with a collectible card theme. Open booster packs, collect cards, build an elaborate stat chain, manage 6 different currencies, battle your way across 6 different regions, and reclaim the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3psu.jpg'),(8808,'Skipper & Skeeto: Tales from Paradise Park','1996-01-01','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Danish point-and-click adventure game with some edutainment content. The first game in Skipper and Skeeto -franchise.\n\nA witch has stolen the good fairy\'s magic wand and Skipper and Skeeto must help get it back. The game is set in a park where the player helps various animals in order to move forward in the story.\n\nGame features minigames with some educational content, for example locating countries on a map or telling the time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xob.jpg'),(8809,'What Lies in the Multiverse: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k05.jpg'),(8810,'Pixie Pete','1983-12-31','Strategy, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX','Deep, deep, down underground, Pixie Pete the pot-holer is digging for his life! Can you help him survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ijwmxdmdraepsgo2uhh3.jpg'),(8811,'Bonds of the Skies','2019-03-14','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A fantasy RPG with a story of friendship between humans and gods! Eil and Nogard set off to look for the demon who cast the town into a sea of flames, and to find other Grimoas in order to put a stop to its violence!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2334.jpg'),(8812,'Fallout 4: Game of the Year Edition','2024-04-25','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Return to the Wasteland today with Fallout 4: Game of the Year Edition. With all the latest gameplay updates (including Survival mode), graphical enhancements, the ability to play Mods for free on PC and consoles, plus all official add-ons included, this is the ultimate way to experience the award-winning post-nuclear adventure from Bethesda Game Studios.\n\nFallout 4: Game of the Year Edition includes the fully updated original game along with all six add-ons: Nuka-World, Vault-Tec Workshop, Contraptions Workshop, Far Harbor, Wasteland Workshop and Automatron. Fallout 4: Game of the Year Edition is available now on PlayStation 4, Xbox One and PC. Be sure to reserve your copy in the upcoming weeks from select digital and physical retailers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1u4f.jpg'),(8813,'Amok Runner','2022-11-05','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','One day, a noble woman turns our protagonist\'s (the doctor) life upside down by visiting his clinic, in a town where the amok madness is rampant. The doctor leaves all his personal effects and career aside and begins to follow this woman\'s footsteps while fighting against the deadly amok syndrome.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xg3.jpg'),(8814,'SD Hiryuu no Ken Densetsu','1999-12-29','Fighting','Nintendo 64','An updated version of Hiryuu no Ken: Twin (Flying Dragon overseas), entitled SD Hiryuu no Ken Densetsu (lit. SD Legend of the Fist of the Flying Dragon), was released in Japan only, adding more characters (such as Jack, Ryu, and Gofire from the Super Chinese series), items and a new gameplay mode. It also removed the more realistic \"Virtual Mode\", favoring the super deformed \"Quest Mode\".\n\nPlayable characters are Ryuhi, Hayato, Min Min, Wiler, Shouryu, Yuka, Suzaku, Powers, Robo No Hana, Bokuchin (unlockable), Jack, Ryu, Raima, E. Quaker, Ellie, Gofire, Ryumaou (unlockable).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wqm.jpg'),(8815,'SoulCalibur III','2005-11-18','Fighting, Strategy','PlayStation 2','Soulcalibur III is a fighting game produced by Namco as a sequel to Soulcalibur II and the fourth installment in the Soul series. The game includes three new modes and a larger character roster with 24 characters playable in Tales of Souls mode and an additional 18 playable in all other modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kmb.jpg'),(8816,'Wheel of Fortune','1993-12-31','Quiz/Trivia','Sega Game Gear','America\'s favorite game show is now bigger and better than ever on the Sega Game Gear. This all-new version features the beautiful Vanna White, and over 4500 new puzzles. Choose the contestant you want to be, play against the computer, or against up to two friends. Spin the wheel, buy a vowel, or attempt to solve the puzzle. Only Vanna White knows what lies behind the tiles. Watching you favorite game show is fun, but GAMETEK\'S WHEEL OF FORTUNE puts you right on the stage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yqd.jpg'),(8817,'City of Secrets 2: Episode 1','2013-06-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zkv.jpg'),(8818,'Five-A-Side Soccer',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8819,'Pentagonal Saloon',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','We chose you! You are invited to “Pentagonal Saloon”. Solve the puzzles! Join the party!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co474q.jpg'),(8820,'Dwarflings','2017-03-16','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Lemmings meets Lost Vikings. Dwarflings is a hardcore classic which will be a challenge for the brain and fingers. In the game, you will take control of up to five characters, each one with a unique ability.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26xl.jpg'),(8821,'The Valley of Super Flowers','2020-03-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Valley of Super Flowers is a 2D Platform Action game based on the story of the the valley which had been forcefully captured by an Evil Satanis ruler.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20my.jpg'),(8822,'A Bug\'s Life','2000-12-31','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','A Bug\'s Life is a bootleg Mega Drive port of the game with the same name for the Game Boy Color published by Unite Lucky Technology in 2000. It was also then ported to the SNES in the same year and was published by DVS Electronic Co.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fi4.jpg'),(8823,'Funko Fusion: Yuletide Pack','2024-12-19','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Happy Holidays from all of us on the Funko Fusion team!\n\nWe’re excited to share a free stocking filler to spread some holiday cheer and thank you for being part of our growing community!\n\nThe free Yuletide Pack includes:\n- Yuletide Freddy\n- Yuletide Eddy\n- Yuletide Foxxo\n- Yuletide Proto','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pxd.jpg'),(8824,'Armored Core 3','2003-05-10','Shooter, Strategy','PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','Armored Core 3 once again puts you in the shoes of a Raven mercenary, with the task of piloting your own battle machine to use in a range of tasks (from destroying other mechs to seek and destroy missions).\n\nAfter each missions, you are payed in full. The money raised can then go on towards the purchase of items for your mech. Weapon upgrades, better shields, even the opportunity to purchase what\'s called an Exceed Orbit, smaller robot gun emplacements that hover around your mech, giving you an added boost of fire power in the crunch.\n\n4 player deathmatch modes are also included, where you each pit your supped-up mechs against each other to see who is the last robot standing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qqs.jpg'),(8825,'Borderlands: Game of the Year Edition','2011-01-26','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Lock, Load, & Face the Madness! Get ready for the mind-blowing insanity, as one of four trigger-happy mercenaries, taking out everything that stands in your way. With its addictive action, frantic first person shooter combat, massive arsenal of weaponry, RPG elements and four-player co-op, Borderlands is the breakthrough experience that challenges all the conventions of modern shooters. Borderlands places you in the role of a mercenary on the lawless and desolate planet of Pandora, hell bent on finding a legendary stockpile of powerful alien technology known as The Vault.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co229j.jpg'),(8826,'Pokémon Battrio','2007-11-21','Arcade','Arcade','Pokémon Battrio is an arcade video game that was announced on April 11, 2007 and released on November 21, 2007 in Japan. The video game requires players to move certain tazos with Pokémon on a grid. The video game is made for two-player multiplayer, where players will fight against other Pokémon. Each player can use up to three Pokémon. It is the first heavily edited Pokémon title for arcades.\n\nThis video game was not released internationally outside of Japan. Due to its popularity, a new version called Battrio: V was made, which, as its name says, contains Pokémon of the fifth generation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ww2.jpg'),(8827,'Attack of the Friday Monsters! A Tokyo Tale','2013-08-18','Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Step into the life of Sohta, the young son of a family that has just set up a dry cleaners shop in the idyllic town of Fuji no Hana. In his interactions with the town\'s unique residents, episodic mysteries are revealed that portend to the strange events surrounding the appearance of a giant monster every Friday. And finally, when Friday evening falls, the giant monster will appear right before your eyes!\n\nCollect the \"Monster Glims\" scattered around town to form Monster Cards, and once you\'ve collected five cards, Sohta can battle his friends for dominance. Winning at Monster Cards gives you the chance to collect useful information, more Monster Glims, and even to cast a secret spell on your friends that will make them fall down at your whim. Why? Because that\'s the rules!\n\nA touching drama about family, friendship, and the innocence of being a child unfolds against hand-drawn backgrounds, charming music, and memorable characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sj6.jpg'),(8828,'Beyond Enemy Lines: Covert Operations','2019-04-23','Shooter','Nintendo Switch','Think your way in, observe the enemies and sneak into their base and complete your objective. You have the total freedom to choose your path - guns blazing or silent assassin - it\'s your choice! Beyond Enemy Lines is an unforgiving, intense experience where skill and tactical decisions matter! Beyond Enemy Lines: Covert Operations is taking the unique Beyond Enemy Lines gameplay to the Nintendo Switch. And is one of the first hardcore tactical FPS for Nintendos console. Beyond Enemy Lines: Covert Operations is a port of the 8 mission long story campaign of Beyond Enemy Lines from 2017. It contains the full experience of it\'s PCs bigger brother. While running on an entirly new game core directly adapted for the use on Nintendo Switch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co572s.jpg'),(8829,'The Wakers',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Great energies are stirring, now it\'s time to wake. Revive giant spirits in this playfully mystical puzzle odyssey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5neo.jpg'),(8830,'Soldam: Drop, Connect, Erase','2017-03-03','Puzzle, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Play one of the original tile-matching games from the 90’s. Dispatch Games brings back the Jaleco arcade classic with, Soldam: Drop, Connect, Erase. The game has been refreshed with updated graphics and gameplay, but retains its arcade charm with its catchy music and unique style that have been fan favorites for many years.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kuf.jpg'),(8831,'MechQuest','2007-10-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','MechQuest is a FREE browser-based fantasy giant destructive war machine battle game. Sound fun? You bet! Heavily inspired by the art from every mecha & giant robot series ever created (and we are throwing in magic and laser swords too!) we will be putting a true \'Anything Goes\' build and battle \'Lunchbreak-sized\' game. Keep your holivids tuned in for more... *Bizzzzzzipwhip...kccccht!*','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i5w.jpg'),(8832,'World of Warcraft: The War Within','2024-08-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Journey through never-before-seen subterranean worlds filled with hidden wonders and lurking perils, down to the dark depths of the nerubian empire, where the malicious Harbinger of the Void is gathering arachnid forces to bring Azeroth to its knees.\n\nDeep beneath the surface lies treasure vaults waiting to be discovered with Delves. Explore these world instances solo or with up to four friends, along with an NPC companion, to defeat bosses and gain epic end-game loot.\n\nExpand the potential of your alternate characters with account-wide progression across your family of characters on your Battle.net account with Warbands. Share your Warband Bank access, War Within Renown, achievements, collections, and more.\n\nRise to new heights of power with new Hero Talent trees. Each class specialization has access to two choices of self-contained Hero Talent trees inspired by iconic Warcraft universe archetypes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8b7k.jpg'),(8833,'Pictlogica: Final Fantasy','2013-11-01','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo 3DS, Android, iOS','The worlds of Final Fantasy and Picross combine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vq0.jpg'),(8834,'Perfect Landing','2023-11-01','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rocket towards victory in Perfect Landing, a 2D minimalist speedrun racer. Dodge obstacles, dominate leaderboards, and create your own physics-based levels for an electrifying challenge!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i2i.jpg'),(8835,'The Red Selene',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The new genre of sci-fi horror survival and all-out action is now with your beloved pixel-art classic games. Grab the top weapons, and resources and use them in the modern combat system with a traditional and retro vibe, Immerse yourself in the huge hand-drawn environments with massive details.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co776o.jpg'),(8836,'Skate','2007-10-12','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','SKATE delivers the feel of skating through innovative controls, authentic cameras and a fully reactive skateboarding city. The game features professional skaters such as Danny Way and PJ Ladd, as well as a reactive city and relevant in-game cameras. SKATE\'s unique control scheme captures the true feel of skating versus the typical button mashing gameplay of past skating games. Featuring physics-driven animations, gamers will have a unique gaming experience every time they pick up the controller since no two tricks will ever be the same.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hns.jpg'),(8837,'Chessmaster: The Art of Learning','2008-03-12','Sport, Strategy, Quiz/Trivia','PlayStation Portable, Nintendo DS','Chessmaster: The Art of Learning expands the scope of chess to include broader principles of learning with Josh Waitzkin\'s training program. Follow interactive advice from the master to perfect your play style. Compete against advanced AI characters (24 ranging from easy to hard) or challenge other real players via local connection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ppm.jpg'),(8838,'Kainga: Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Comes with soundtrack, digital artbook, and wallpaper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c2q.jpg'),(8839,'Beer!',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u3h.jpg'),(8840,'Riff VR','2017-12-06','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Riff VR makes you the player in your own rock and roll world.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8841,'Shepherd\'s Crossing 2','2008-06-26','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','Nintendo DS','Shepherd\'s Crossing 2 DS is a full featured and in-depth farming simulation and strategy game. At its heart, the game is about the player living in a small town and communicating with the other villagers while raising livestock, harvesting crops, and building a farm.\nAside from laying out fields and deciding where to herd the animals, players must also pay attention to the placement of their resources, arranging their life as they see fit. As a special feature unique to the DS, interaction with others is a major part of the game. One can even court, date and marry.\n\nIt\'s just one goal in a game filled with things to do and people to meet. The game is beautifully animated in a Japanese anime style. The open-ended gameplay styles mean the player can choose what they want to do whether it be breed animals, farm their fields, build relationships with the people around town or any combination of these activities as well as many others.\nThe DS allows for unique touch screen controls that are implemented into most of the in-game activities. With so many different activities and open-ended style simulation gameplay, there are hours and hours of entertainment available to players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49vj.jpg'),(8842,'Bayonetta 2','2014-10-25','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Wii U','The witching hour strikes again. Brimming with intricate battles that take place in, on and all over epic set pieces, Bayonetta 2 finds our sassy heroine battling angels and demons in unearthly beautiful HD. You’re bound to love how it feels to string together combos with unimaginable weapons and to summon demons using Bayonetta’s Umbran Weave in this frantic stylized action game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ffy.jpg'),(8843,'The Journey: Bob\'s Story','2016-06-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Journey tells the story about Bob, who goes on an adventure to find his friend who left the village out of curiosity after knowing that a lot of villagers who also were never returned.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rmm.jpg'),(8844,'Weaponry (Experimental)','2024-07-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A fast-paced 1v1 randomized FPS game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kq6.jpg'),(8845,'Carrot Slime 2','2021-06-30','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Carrot Slime 2!\nGet to the golden carrot in the fastest time possible whilst picking up beetroots and normal carrots along the way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gxc.jpg'),(8846,'The Flintstones: Burgertime in Bedrock','2001-05-30','Platform, Arcade','Game Boy Color','The restaurant business meets prehistoric times in this combination of classic video gaming and old-fashioned cartoon mayhem. Mr. Slate has purchased himself a Brontoburger chain, and Fred has been saddled with the unenviable task of playing chef. It seems that the restaurant has come with a pre-existing problem, though: pests! Run from counter to counter, trying to build sandwiches for the hungry customers, avoiding attacks from the flying beasties all the while. Interestingly, the kitchen is also outfitted with a bunch of platforms and ladders which means you\'ll have your share of climbing to tackle as well. Lose all of your lives and you\'re out of a job (resulting in more time at home with the ingratiating Bam-Bam). The graphics and humor are perfect representations of the original cartoon, and the game plays much like the coin-operated BURGERTIME. Play alone or use a link cable to hook up with a friend to see who has the fastest food preparation skills in Bedrock.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zc3.jpg'),(8847,'Mass Effect: Genesis','2011-05-17','Visual Novel','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Mass Effect: Genesis is a downloadable \"interactive backstory comic\". Genesis fills the role of Mass Effect for new players by introducing them to the story of the original game and allowing them to make six of the major plot decisions that players could make. If downloaded, the comic appears between the opening level and character customization. There are two versions of the comic, one each for a male and female Commander Shepard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rwx.jpg'),(8848,'The King of Fighters 2003','2004-03-18','Fighting, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, Xbox, PlayStation 3, Neo Geo MVS, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','The game revolves around The King of Fighters, an elite fighting competition. In this competition, Rugal is defeated and the Orochi are sealed away. The tournament at the centre of the game is sponsored by an unknown patron, whose identity becomes a matter of public interest in the country. Perhaps as a result of this, it attracts a large number of contestants.\n\nWith the inception of the new \"multi-shift\" rule in this KOF tournament, wherein competitors can freely tag off during battles, the competition becomes a \'hot topic\' and provokes widespread discussion. It also leads to a speedy execution of the match with unified team strategies.\n\nIn preparation for the tournaments, stadiums with the capacity to hold tens of thousands of people are procured from cities across the world and established in city centres. Schedules are completed and spectators move from one location to another to watch the preliminary matches. To create the atmosphere of a true street fight, competitions are broadcast live on giant screens.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p0y.jpg'),(8849,'Ink Bunny','2022-12-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Relaxing puzzle game with ink bunnies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hfo.jpg'),(8850,'Power Rangers Zeo - Full Tilt Battle Pinball','1996-10-30','Simulator, Pinball','PlayStation','Earth is under invasion by aliens and the only folks that can stop the madness are the TV heroes known as the Power Rangers. How are they going to do it? Pinball style! You\'ll find all of the classic pinball bells and whistles here (ramps, spinners, bumpers, targets, flippers, and more), but the action is pure Power Rangers, taking place over five different 3D play fields. Not only that, the game boldly travels to 15 locations around the globe, including New York, Africa, and Japan. Between each level of play, you\'ll see an awesome animated sequence that advances the storyline to its next phase. Based on what you see in the clips, you\'ll have to accomplish certain missions in order to advance to the next stage. Though pinball has been around since the early part of the century, it\'s never been so vast or explosive. The game\'s makers even worked in such characters as Zeo Zords, King Mondo, and Queen Madrina, just to make things interesting. Whether you\'re primarily a fan of the Power Rangers, pinball, or PlayStation games, you won\'t be disappointed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ahn.jpg'),(8851,'Endless Legend: Monstrous Tales',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Endless Legend: Monstrous Tales delivers a raft of new quest lines, including a separate and unusual multi-part adventure into ancient truths that are nothing less than... monstrous.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8852,'Transformers: Beast Wars Transmetals','1999-10-01','Fighting','Nintendo 64','Now, experience a Transformers battle you\'ve never seen before! Take command of the Heroic Maximals and Evil Predicons as they struggle for supremacy! More powerful than ever, these cybertronian warriors can convert into 3 modes: beast, vehicle, and robot. Run, blast and transform your way to victory! Crush the competition with the awesome Ultra Blast attack!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7afn.jpg'),(8853,'Alter World','2018-04-05','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, New Nintendo 3DS, Nintendo Switch','Inspired by Stephen King’s book - “The Dark Tower”, Alter World is a 2D platformer with interesting gameplay mechanics. Player can pass on an alternative universe anytime and use an alternative realms to move to another level. Levels are unique, with puzzles. player will have to react quickly and assess when to move between the Worlds. The game is made in unique art style, like a painting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/a7h80nshtesiibixsa3j.jpg'),(8854,'Hijacker Jack','2020-12-07','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','One day just a simple man, lives outcast in the jungle - the other day wealthy and wanted. Money changes everyone? Do you know who you can trust and who is a wolf in sheep\'s clothing? Play this unique real-time action packed FMV-FPS game to figure it out! Famous. Rich. Wanted. Live like Jack!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5eba.jpg'),(8855,'Kipidon: We Will Always Love You','2025-04-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A colorful shooter that uses a flower as a cupid\'s arrow. Shoot as many people as you can before time runs out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lub.jpg'),(8856,'Bishoujo Battle: Double Strike!','2022-04-15','Puzzle','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','\"Bishoujo Battle: Double Strike!\" includes the two games;\n\n- Bishoujo Battle: Mahjong Solitaire - Let the military girls of \"Rikku G Earth\" be your companions as classic tile-matching gets more exhilarating than ever!\n\n- Bishoujo Battle: Cyber Panic - Inspired by the naughty back-room arcades of \'90s Japan, Bishoujo Battle Cyber Panic! Start each action-packed stage with a silhouetted girl behind the playfield and dodge enemies while drawing lines that cut away when connected, methodically uncovering the image underneath.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ot8.jpg'),(8857,'Firefighters 2014','2014-05-21','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','House fires, traffic accidents and large-scale emergencies: Experience the day-to-day life of the fire department in “Firefighters 2014 – The Simulation Game”!\nFinally, what firefighter simulation fans have been waiting on for a long time – play and immerse yourself in the daily operations of a fire department: traffic accidents on the highway, fires in the city and in the countryside, subway derailments and much more.\n\nYour squad members head out with you on your daily operations, putting out fires and helping you in dangerous situations. The new inventory system offers better control with easier handling.\n\nA dynamic backdrop with streets and squares filled with people and traffic. Cars swerve out of the way when you’re out on emergency operations and guarantee a quick arrival at the scene, no matter if it’s the fire truck, the turntable ladder vehicle or the ambulance. Don the uniform and face the danger!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yid.jpg'),(8858,'Pirate Shooter Fantasy Survival','2019-06-03','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pirate Survival Fantasy Shooter is a VR survival adventure that takes you inside a magical realm full of incredible bloodthirsty creatures. Your entire crew has been slaughtered by the cursed creatures living in these crazy islands and your ship is sinking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vcs.jpg'),(8859,'Monopoly Deluxe','1992-12-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co279t.jpg'),(8860,'Amazing Tater','1991-08-02','Puzzle, Strategy','Game Boy','This puzzle-game is the successor to Kwirk. The player has to guide a small potato to the exit of each level, which is made difficult by a number of obstacles. Crates have to be pushed out of the way or into holes to make them traversable. Difficulty is increased by the fact that there are crates and holes of several different shapes and sizes and many levels contain different types of spinning doors.\n\nThe game features four different modes of play: Beginners Mode in which the basics are explained and the player receives hints on how to solve each level; Practice Mode that lets the player choose the size of the levels which are then randomly picked; Puzzle Mode in which the player has to complete 40 levels and receives a score depending on the time it took him to complete a level; and finally Action Mode, which is basically a story mode containing two stories. The game also features a password system and four different difficulty levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gtv.jpg'),(8861,'Cats Epic Puzzles',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8862,'Project: Shinigami-hime','2026-12-31','Adventure','PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j7n.jpg'),(8863,'Climber Girl','2007-10-24','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1oq9.jpg'),(8864,'Blocked Up','2020-02-10','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A platforming match 3 puzzle game.\nSwap blocks to clear them off the board, and keep enough space for your little guy to run around safely.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g6h.jpg'),(8865,'Korean Drone Flying Tour Taean-gun','2025-05-15','Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','A simulation game where you directly operate a drone based on actual drone flight footage!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kgn.jpg'),(8866,'Armored Fist 3','1999-10-12','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Command an entire fleet of M1A2 Abrams tanks in this brutal third installment in the Armored Fist series. Using the latest Abrams technology, the game presents the esteemed tank in its up-to-date form which is designed to survive biological, nuclear, and chemical warfare. You\'ll first take control of a four-man tank, eventually tackling four major campaigns. Set over the course of 50 smaller missions, the campaigns will take you to such troubled lands as Somalia, Thailand, Afghanistan, Pakistan, Myanmar, and the Republic of Georgia. The game\'s five modes of play include solo and co-op entries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lnp.jpg'),(8867,'Real Drift Multiplayer 2','2023-09-19','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Real Drift Multiplayer 2 offers a unique experience waiting for drift enthusiasts! Experience a real racing simulator with customizable vehicles, competitive online modes, and realistic drift dynamics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d5u.jpg'),(8868,'Project Liminal Redux','2023-03-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Project Liminal Redux is a first-person horror made in realistic 3D graphics. The gameplay consists of collecting notes, solving riddles and escaping from various entities. The main goal is to survive and escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i8h.jpg'),(8869,'London Racer II','2002-07-14','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation, PlayStation 2','London Racer II is another iteration in the prolific Racer series by Davilex. The races take place primarily in the streets of London and Edinburgh, with additional tracks in Las Vegas, New York and Chicago.\n\nThere are three single player modes available: Single Race, Tournament and Time Trial. In Single Race, the player is free to choose any of the 6 characters available, any of the tracks and any of the unlocked cars. In Tournament mode, the player races in a series of tracks while collecting money prizes and unlocking new cars. In both modes, players race against other racers while avoiding being caught by the police. In the Time Trial mode, players race against the clock trying to beat the best time for each track.\n\nEach car (driven by a different character) has different stats in acceleration, top speed, handling, breaking and strength. The cars can also be upgraded using money collected from winning races and collecting money tokens during races. The cars also take damage when hit and can break into total loss if the damage bar is full. Repair tokens can be collected during races and if a car finishes a race damaged, it can be repaired before the next one using money. Nitro tokens can also be collected and bought, and the cars\' colors can be changed.\n\nThere are also two split-screen two player modes: Duel and Cop vs. Driver. In the Duel mode, players race against each other in any given track. In Cop vs. Driver, one player is the cop and the other a regular racer, and the cop player must try to crash the driver within the time limit.\n\nThe game can be played from either first (hood camera) or third person (behind the car) perspective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hpu.jpg'),(8870,'iSays - Simon Says Classic Color Switch Memory Game',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8871,'Project: Renzu','2025-09-30','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j7m.jpg'),(8872,'Einn','2019-07-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Separated from your raiding party you are a lone viking stranded in a strange new world. Use the environment to craft tools and weapons. Gather resources to build shelters. Hunt and be hunted by the local life. Will you let this new world claim you? Don\'t just survive. Thrive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1n5x.jpg'),(8873,'Restricted Area','2023-09-28','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is a large team shooting game. The game supports the first person and the third person. In the future, intelligent robots generate autonomy in the process of self-iteration, and they decide to overthrow human domination. The player will play the role of a human soldier defeating a robot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co732w.jpg'),(8874,'Scarlet Enigma','2025-05-09','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Investigate a chilling birthday murder in a branching mystery filled with secrets, suspects, and puzzles. Uncover the truth, bend time, and stop the killer before reality begins to unravel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lud.jpg'),(8875,'Hover!','1995-08-01','Racing, Sport, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hover! was a video game that was included on CD-ROM versions of the Microsoft Windows 95 operating system. It was a showcase for the advanced multimedia capabilities available on personal computers at the time. It is still available from Microsoft and will run on all of Microsoft\'s 95-compatible operating systems, from Windows 95, up to and including Windows 7 and 8. Additionally, Hover! will run in WINE on Unix-like systems.\n\nThe game is a combination of bumper cars and capture the flag.\n\nHover! was also officially re-released by Microsoft with partnership with Internet Explorer for Windows 8 and 8.1. It has three vehicles you can choose from. These include Chicago, Bambi, and Explorer with different stats. The game is available on the Windows App Store.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3sic.jpg'),(8876,'Timepiece Ensemble','2017-08-04','Adventure, Visual Novel','DVD Player, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation Vita','It’s the day before Hourai Shinobazu Academy’s culture festival. Taki and the rest of the Pip Club’s members are busy preparing their booth. On to way to the discount store to buy some last-minute supplies, he came upon a new store in a back alley called Kikouya (House of Tricks). Entering the shop, he was greeted by a talking cat Tetmet who took his order and brought him everything he needed, and at a bargain too. When he was about to leave, the storeowner Kuroha asked him if he would like to ‘buy time’. He was perplexed at her question, but was too worried about finishing up the club’s booth for the culture festival, muttering that ‘if he only had one more day, then everything would be done in time’. “Thank you, please come again,” said Kuroha as he left.\n\nAs expected, there wasn’t enough time for them to finish their preparations, so the club members all stayed overnight at the school to finish up. Although some parts were still not completely done, they planned to give it their all. When they woke up, they began their preparations for the culture festival the next day. An extra day had been added due to Taki’s wish, and he was the only one who realized it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kog.jpg'),(8877,'Jack and Sara: Educational game','2018-05-02','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In an unobtrusive way, Jack and Sara will teach your child fun games for the development of logic, attention, memory and color perception.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co449m.jpg'),(8878,'Last Kids on Earth: Hit the Deck!','2022-11-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Monster-Zombie Apocalypse means no homework, no parents, and no rules! Become zombie-fighting, monster-bashing heroes in this action-packed rogue-like strategy card game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qak.jpg'),(8879,'Mafia II: Jimmy\'s Vendetta','2010-09-07','Shooter, Racing','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Jimmy’s Vendetta introduces a new character to the world of Mafia II where players see the world through the eyes of Jimmy, a mercenary. Jimmy is the guy the other guys call when they need to finish the job.\n\nPlayers will get their hands dirty helping Jimmy clean up other people’s messes as they deal with the Italian and Irish mobsters that reside in Empire Bay. As players progress, dozens of new quests are unlocked, including assassination and timed vehicle pursuits ending in dramatic shootouts and explosive car chases. Execute with deadly head shots or charged explosives, and rack up points for precision-timed vehicular power slides, lofty jumps, and supercharged velocity. Multipliers and combos add bonus points to overall scores that will be immediately posted to the new online leaderboard system, providing extensive re-playability as players work to rise to the top of the ranks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55lx.jpg'),(8880,'Project: Kyouran','2026-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j7l.jpg'),(8881,'He Needs His Medicine','2021-04-14','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You have been dispatched for a 911 call. From the moment you step inside the apartment, you realize something is really wrong with the place. You are gonna make Him the last dosage. He needs his medicine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42am.jpg'),(8882,'Rise of Industry','2019-05-02','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rise of Industry is a strategic tycoon game that puts you in the shoes of an early 20th-century industrialist. Build and manage your growing empire in a living, breathing, and procedurally generated world that is constantly evolving and adapting to your playstyle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rge.jpg'),(8883,'Cradle of Persia','2017-04-04','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo DS','Build the mysterious heart of Ancient Persia in this engaging puzzle game! The original capital of the Achaemenid Empire was adorned with luxurious metals, gems and stone carvings, sure to have impressed peasants and visiting nobles alike. Sadly, the exotic gardens and impressive architecture that once filled this land have vanished into the passing sands. Now you’ve got the chance to seek out the riddles of these ruins, as you travel through the land of a-thousand-and-one nights. To do this, you will need skill and a keen wit, but the result - if you survive - will unlock a mystery never before seen by man, here in the Cradle of Persia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4l8a.jpg'),(8884,'Little Big Adventure: Twinsen\'s Quest','2024-11-14','Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Step into Twinsun\'s fantastical world in this action-adventure remake! Little Big Adventure - Twinsen\'s Quest brings brand new visuals, new music by the original composer, and smoother gameplay to the iconic classic released back in 1994.\n\nEmbark on a Timeless Adventure, Reimagined\n\nTwinsen is back in this remake featuring a new stylish makeover and modernized gameplay. Faithful to the original game, Little Big Adventure – Twinsen’s Quest takes you on an epic journey on a small planet harboring both magic and technology.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8eox.jpg'),(8885,'Army Troop','2023-09-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Army Troop is an old-school PvP World War 2 online first-person shooter. Reminding you of the good old days World War games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64ld.jpg'),(8886,'Virtual Knee Surgery','2007-05-01','Simulator','Web browser','This site takes the children’s game, Operation, to an entirely new level. Snap on your gloves, and play doctor as you perform surgery under expert direction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mwc.jpg'),(8887,'LingTian 2: Your Destined Prince',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','LingTian 2 is a gorgeous and exquisite otome visual novel game. You are ordinary girl experiencing a sweet royal romance with Prince LingTian of Fang Kingdom! The game features over 1,000 stunning scenes, full voice acting, a main storyline, and 10 interactive sections.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i2u.jpg'),(8888,'Miles From Tomorrowland: Missions',NULL,'Arcade','Sin plataforma','Get ready to take your space adventure to the next level as you outrun tidal waves and escape the Flickorax with Miles Callisto and his robo-ostritch best friend, Merc, from the new Disney Junior series, \'Miles from Tomorrowland!\' Journey with Miles on rescue missions, and use cool tools and tricks to dodge asteroids, collect rare space rocks, and turbo boost your way through this blastastic deep-space race!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8889,'Nier: Automata - Game of the Yorha Edition','2019-02-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','NieR:Automata tells the story of androids 2B, 9S and A2 and their battle to reclaim the machine-driven dystopia overrun by powerful machines.\n\nThe NieR:Automata Game of the YoRHa Edition includes the game itself and comes packed with DLC and bonus content for the full experience of the award-winning post-apocalyptic action RPG, including:\n- 3C3C1D119440927 DLC*\n- Cardboard Pod Skin\n- Retro Grey Pod Skin\n- Retro Red Pod Skin\n- Grimoire Weiss Pod\n- Machine Mask Accessory\n- (PC Version) Valve Character Accessory, Exclusive set of wallpapers in the following sizes: 1024 x 768, 1280 x 1024, 1920 x 1080, 2560 x 1600\n- (PS4 Version) Play System Pod Skin, the amazarashi Head Pod Skin, a Dynamic Theme and 15 PSN avatars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p3a.jpg'),(8890,'Europa Universalis IV: Songs of Regency',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u4e.jpg'),(8891,'MP1: Snowflake Lake','2016-11-06','Card & Board Game','Nintendo 64','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8892,'Oops!!! I Slept With Your Mom','2018-09-21','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A small indie title in which you must avoid obstacles and fight against enemies in order to reunite a baby with its mommy. It \'s a pretty simple endless game which starts fairly easy and gets harder as you progress through the levels. Be it for wasting a little time or score chasing, mommies are waiting for you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49c6.jpg'),(8893,'Dino Crisis: Dungeon in Chaos','2003-11-04','Shooter, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Legacy Mobile Device','Dino Crisis: Dungeon in Chaos was a first-person shooter mobile game published by the now-defunct Mobile Capcom in 2003. The game saw its English release in 2007 and remained available until Mobile Capcom\'s closure in 2014.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zni.jpg'),(8894,'Mysterious Blocks 2','2021-06-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mysterious Blocks 2 is the second part of an exciting puzzle game in which you will find many interesting and difficult levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co470r.jpg'),(8895,'Black Beard','1988-12-31','Arcade','ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC, MSX','Top-view arcade game, similar to Gauntlet, where you play as pirate Blackbeard through four phases, fighting against pirates by finding guns, knives, immunity potions and taking care not to pick up rum that will intoxicate our hero for a short time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co760u.jpg'),(8896,'Mr. Driller: Drill Spirits','2004-12-02','Puzzle','Nintendo DS','Mr. Driller, experienced with the drill, much use his abilities to dig beneath the Earth\'s crust in a race to the finish in order to save the day. Dangerous traps await as you dig through the puzzle layout to the goal, and be careful of Mr. Driller\'s air supply which can run out quickly. Find the right powerups to increase abilities and air supply while fighting the time clock.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71qy.jpg'),(8897,'Funko Fusion: Kim Pine','2024-12-12','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Bring the hype with Kim Pine from Scott Pilgrim vs. The World! Add this DLC item to your library to add Kim Pine as a playable character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9px9.jpg'),(8898,'Brave point kill',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','In this world, you have to play as a brave. You will go to the monster camp, defeat the monsters to get gold coins, and improve yourself to defeat more powerful monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mjn.jpg'),(8899,'The Curse of Kubel: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69y3.jpg'),(8900,'EvoWars: New Era','2025-03-06','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','EvoWars: New Era is a competitive multiplayer open-arena game where a single hit means defeat and your power is determined by your wits and size… Easy to learn, hard to master. For daredevils only!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6d0g.jpg'),(8901,'Dragon Star Varnir: Complete Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c6o.jpg'),(8902,'True Love','1996-12-06','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series, PC (Microsoft Windows), NEC PC-6000 Series','True Love is a Japanese bishoujo eroge visual novel with dating sim and adventure game elements released in 1995 which was later localized in Europe by Otaku Publishing and distributed in North America by JAST USA in 1999.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25za.jpg'),(8903,'Hybris: Pulse of Ruin','2018-06-14','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a journey about finding strength to stand up to challenge your destiny and discover a purpose beyond survival. Experience a deep story in a post-apocalyptic fantasy world. Enjoy an epic RPG with an innovative turn-based battle system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43fd.jpg'),(8904,'Forklift Truck: The Simulation',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Here is your chance to take a seat of a fork truck and move around goods without causing extensive damage! Original forklifts offering a very realistic ride, an authentic physics engine simulates the exact loading of different transport goods. Use your skills to move the forklift carefully in the full 3D environment, without harming any container or barrels. Different scenarios will lead you through confusing warehouses, huge freight terminals and lively harbor districts.\n\nForklift Truck – The Simulation offers realistic first person controls including short area turns and the special multi-level hydraulic lift system. What makes this game special is the variety inside the gameplay and the game modes: A game can last minutes or even hours, it’s totally up to your ability and the missions you are playing, but one thing is for sure: this challenging game will keep you entertained for a long time!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8905,'The Desecration','1983-12-31','Adventure, Arcade','Apple II','Graphical text adventure alternating with arcade sequences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vrh8uxkhuqfrpifeatzl.jpg'),(8906,'BS Zelda no Densetsu Map 2: Dai-1-wa','1995-12-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Satellaview','The first part (week) of BS Zelda no Densetsu Map 2.\n\nBS Zelda no Densetsu was a remake of The Legend of Zelda that was released for the Satellaview attachment of the Super Nintendo Entertainment System in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40rq.jpg'),(8907,'VRC Pro: Deluxe Asia On-Road Tracks','2015-07-10','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This VRC PRO: Deluxe Asia On-Road Tracks pack gives you 5 additional on-road RC tracks from Asia continent. Expand your electric on-road tracks. Experience real existing world class tracks. Join more events & more multiplayer sessions.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8908,'Life\'s Too Short: On Reflection',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A little ghost answers a mysterious call...\n\nThe residents of a medieval tower are being taunted by what lies on the other side of a mysterious mirror. Reflection can come in many forms and the voice on the other side of the mirror is not always a friend. Maybe the mirror and the residents need your help?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cas.jpg'),(8909,'Pac-Man: Adventures in Time','2000-10-31','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As in the original Pac-Man arcade game, the basic objective of each level is to guide Pac-Man through a maze while eating dots, unique food items, and power pellets that make Pac-Man\'s enemies, the Ghosts, edible for a limited time. The ability to jump returns from Pac-Mania for bypassing hazards and avoiding enemies. Some levels contain obstacles such as deadly boulders, animals who delay or kill Pac-Man, and explosive projectiles. After every few rounds there is a bonus mini-game in which the player can obtain some extra points (with every 50,000 points earning Pac-Man an extra life). The levels also feature a variety of shapes and architectural features such as cylindrical mazes, canopies, bridges, pyramids, and even walls that allow Pac-Man to walk vertically. The game features more sophisticated events than its arcade predecessor, such as collecting a certain number of pellets to unlock another area of a maze. The game also includes the ability to see the short intermission videos that come before a new level and allow for an option of non-storyline play on specific levels. The game also has the ability to connect over the Internet for multiplayer mini-games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qx5.jpg'),(8910,'Help Annie',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','\"Help Annie\" is an adventurous interactive mystery thriller in the style of a messenger app game. YOU are Annie\'s last and only hope, the choices YOU make may save Annette Lewis who is – instead of spending a once-in-a-lifetime vacation – confronted with a series of mysterious events. Caught up in the shadows of her past, it’s now a matter of life and death.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78vt.jpg'),(8911,'Overcooked! 2: Kevin\'s Christmas Cracker','2018-12-14','Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This FREE festive update is now available across all platforms and includes:\n\n– Five Christmassy kitchens!\n– Three sweet new recipes: mince pies, Christmas pudding and hot chocolate!\n– Two new chilly chefs – elf and snowman!\n– Practice mode – unlimited time, unlimited orders. Cook as much as you like!\n– Additional online features – support for 2 local players to play with or against 2 other local players over an online connection','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gh0.jpg'),(8912,'Serious Sam: GOG Collection',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8913,'Blast Zone! Tournament','2018-07-31','Sport, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Blast Zone! Tournament is the fast-paced game where fun meets explosive combat! 32 player cross-platform multiplayer either local, online, or combined. Ranked and unranked matches to cater to both casual players and hardcore fans. 10 solo and team-based multiplayer modes including Free-For-All, Team Deathmatch, Bomb Blast, Treasure Mode, King Mode, Zombie Mode and more! Story-driven single-player Challenge Mode with 240 unique challenges. 280 multiplayer levels, with tweakable options including handicaps, lives, starting items, bomber stats, overall match settings, and more. Create individual characters with over 10 billion unlockable cosmetic and gear item combinations. Robust set of social features from friends lists to partying, news, mail, and more to help foster a healthy community and lay the foundations for esports tournaments. Pulsating party soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ijw.jpg'),(8914,'Ganso JaJaMaru-kun','1999-05-15','Platform','WonderSwan','Ganso JaJaMaru-kun is a remake of the video game Ninja JaJaMaru-kun released in Japan on April 15, 1999 by Jaleco for the WonderSwan. It is an enhanced version of the original Famicom game with better control, though it uses monochrome graphics due to being an original WonderSwan game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91nb.jpg'),(8915,'One in a Trillion',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Android, iOS','Start your adventure to beat the odds and find the rarest eggs in the world!\n\nOne in a Trillion is a relaxing clicker game where you are challenged with finding all of our ultra-rare eggs. From eggs that only appear once every 250 taps to the insane golden egg that has a one in a trillion chance of appearing!\n\nIt’s not just a case of tapping away and hoping for the best – some eggs momentarily appear on the screen and you must quickly click on them before they’re gone again.\n\nEvery tap comes with a one in a thousand chance of starting an egg hunt. You have ten seconds to quickly hunt down the egg’s location on the screen! These eggs are often found in a dirty condition and require cleaning before you can see how rare it is, but they come with the added bonus of having a rarity rating – providing you with more chances of having a super rare egg.\n\nYou may not always find a cute egg but no tap is without it’s reward, you’ll continuously be earning money which you can spend in the shop to speed up egg cleaning or increase it’s chance of being rare.\n\nYou can also raise funds by selling eggs that you’ve already found. Work your way towards increasing your money and being able to buy the possibility of even rarer eggs.\n\nOnce an egg is clean, watch it’s slow reveal and wait in anticipation to see just how rare your egg is!\n\nOne in a Trillion is an idle tapper game that will keep you busy for many hours.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uum.jpg'),(8916,'Z9 Star',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8917,'The Thing: Space X','2017-09-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','At your disposal are a dozen of the best combat spacecraft equipped with death beams, machine guns and missiles.\nThe sector is divided into several subsectors, which swarm with enemies.\nIn the end, you will have an unbeatable boss - the \"Thing\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jqo.jpg'),(8918,'Jump & Hook',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Jump and hook to climb up with style and speed!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hwa.jpg'),(8919,'Apple Pie','2008-12-31','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Apple Pie is a match-three game. Using your mouse, swap two items to create a straight line of three or more of the same item. The object is to make matches over the tan tiles to clear them. When all the tiles are removed, the level is done. You must do this before the time runs out or you will be fined $500.00. After this, you can use the money you made to upgrade the restaurants decor and/or menu to get your establishment to a five-star level. Later in the game, you are given bonus items to help you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84dr.jpg'),(8920,'Hello Kitty and the Apron of Magic: Rhythm Cooking','2015-11-06','Music, Puzzle, Simulator','Nintendo 3DS','Join Hello Kitty and her friends in the kitchen for this fun-packed cooking caper, jammed with mini-games that see you baking to the beat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ccv.jpg'),(8921,'Dragon Spirit','1987-12-31','Arcade','Handheld Electronic LCD','A port of Dragon Spirit for Namco handheld device.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h9s.jpg'),(8922,'Cockpit Manager \'14','2014-05-11','Racing, Sport, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take control of a Formula 1 team (or customize your own), and try to be the Champion of the world, in this management simulation. \n \nDeal with everything in your team: sign in engine supply contracts, develop your car, attract new sponsors, and hire the best drivers in the world to drive for your own team. In the race, be sure to choose the best tyre and pit stop strategy, to win some places in the grid. \n \nThe game has several playable seasons: the 1976 F1 season, with Lauda and Hunt competing; the 1991 F1 Season, with Ayrton, Piquet, Mansell and Prost in the grid; and the 2000 F1 Season, with Michael Schumacher being the one to beat. \n \nThe game has an in-built Hall of Fame, to which the drivers may be inducted into, if they win titles and races enough. \n \nThere are also 10 Achievements to be unlocked, throughout the seasons. Some of them are really hard to unlock (like winning the Drivers Championship with Rubens Barrichello), which makes this game really challenging.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8923,'Maho Shojo Pretty Sammy: Heart no Kimochi','1998-01-29','Adventure, Visual Novel','Sega Saturn','Heart no Kimochi is the second Saturn release in the Maho Shojo Pretty Sammy games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bgh.jpg'),(8924,'MotoGP 18','2018-06-28','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A complete reboot of the series. MotoGP18 is the greatest and ultimate experience for all MotoGP fans.\n\nTrue to life riders, bikes and tracks. Drone and 3D scanning for a 1:1 recreation of tracks and riders. Down to the smallest detail.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27mj.jpg'),(8925,'Pulsar','2024-01-23','Indie','SteamVR','Pulsar is a VR shooter that combines procedural generation with your music. Built in audio analysis will challenge your reflexes and accuracy with dynamic game play and visual effects. Key Features: in-game file browser and audio analysis 10 different worlds 2 game modes Weapon customization','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97km.jpg'),(8926,'IPL Quiz 2022 Cricket Champion','2022-05-18','Quiz/Trivia, Indie','Android','Fun & Educational Trivia Challenge by answering the T20 trivia questions correctly.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69g3.jpg'),(8927,'Tracing Decay','2022-08-26','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tracing Decay is a dark dystopian simulation, that revisits impactful art that revolves around themes of decay, memory loss and recollection. The experience allows the player to explore the environment freely in search for several galleries within the ruins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nme.jpg'),(8928,'Umineko no Naku Koro ni: Jessica no Haha no Hi Present','2021-01-28','Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','An extra arc originally included in Umineko When They Cry Tsubasa where Jessica summons Zepar and Furfur to help her get a present for Natsuhi, and the results are not quite what she expected.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co792a.jpg'),(8929,'BeatBeat','2020-08-24','Music, Platform, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','BeatBeat is the first of its kind: A rhythm platformer. Left hand moves, right hand grooves. Every level is packed with vaporwave aesthetics and funky beats. Beat Beat the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qup.jpg'),(8930,'Floating Sandbox','2018-07-15','Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is a realistic two-dimensional particle system, which uses mass-spring networks to simulate rigid bodies (such as ships) floating in water and exchanging heat with their surroundings. You can punch holes in an object, slice it, apply forces and heat to it, set it on fire, and smash it with bomb explosions. Once water starts rushing inside the object, it will start sinking and, if you\'re lucky enough, it will start breaking up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3shn.jpg'),(8931,'Theseus: Mythological Hero','2021-07-17','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RPG with a complex maze, full of traps and some puzzles, where the hero must fight the furious minotaur. And also a battle against the god Chronos, to retrieve Athens\' treasure and save the souls of his old friends. Where Princess Ariadne is his only help.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nbx.jpg'),(8932,'Two-Timin\' Towers','2020-07-12','Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome to Two-Timin\' Towers – a tower defense game where your towers have friendly fire. Turning a classic game genre into a bullet hell!\n\nBuild towers to defeat increasingly challenging waves of enemies. But remember, each tower adds more bullets to the screen for you to narrowly avoid!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ngp.jpg'),(8933,'Girl Gunner','2023-12-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Girl Gunner is a fun 2D shooter game with a rich weapon system, exquisite graphics, and beautiful BGM, especially bullets. Currently, there are up to 24 types! Players will play the cute girl Emily, escaping from the deserted island and breaking out of the siege.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dzy.jpg'),(8934,'Seasons','2022-11-11','Platform, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take a journey through the seasons across 48 unique levels. Seasons is 2d platformer with simple charming visuals, relaxing music and plenty of features for you to find along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rtq.jpg'),(8935,'Turbo DX',NULL,'Fighting, Platform','Nintendo GameCube','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pjj.jpg'),(8936,'Namco Museum Mini Player','2019-07-25','Arcade','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nfr.jpg'),(8937,'GyroSphere Trials','2015-12-09','Platform, Racing, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Join the fun and test your ability to master the GyroSphere! Go break your own records and tell your friends about it!\nIt’s a fast-paced race through endless, unpredictable obstacles and time is running out! You will easily learn to control the GyroSpere, but can you master it?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bju.jpg'),(8938,'JoJo\'s Bizarre Adventure: Phantom Blood','2006-10-26','Sin género','PlayStation 2','JoJo\'s Bizarre Adventure: Phantom Blood is an action-adventure video game adaptation of Phantom Blood released for the PlayStation 2 by developer Anchor Inc. and publisher Bandai Namco Games on October 26, 2006.\n\nThis is the second game for the PS2 that is based on JoJo\'s Bizarre Adventure. It was released to coincide with the 20th anniversary of the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55pg.jpg'),(8939,'Jurassic Racer - Dinosaur Racing Game',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8940,'Distortions','2018-03-02','Music, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Use the power of music to reawaken long forgotten memories in Distortions, a story-driven journey through a world of unparalleled beauty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28xi.jpg'),(8941,'The Dark Crystal','1983-12-31','Adventure','Atari 8-bit, PC-9800 Series, PC-8800 Series, Apple II, FM-7','Based on the movie of the same name you play the character of Jen, the last of the Gelflings. Your objective is to find the Dark Crystal and its missing shard before the Great Conjunction, the alignment of the world\'s three suns, takes place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wnb.jpg'),(8942,'​Sonic Robo Blast 2: Official Level Design Collab 2022 - Round 2','2023-01-21','Platform','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Official Level Design Collab (formally Official Level Design Contest) is a collection of levels from the SRB2 community.\n\nContributions:\n- Auburn Heights Zone, Act 1 - Cool Cat\n- Seaside Coast Zone - M/C Industries\n- Speed Highway Zone - LucasLixoso\n- Lost Fortress Zone, Act 1 - EAJS\n- Egg TV Network - Rogerregorroger\n- Poison Temple Z Zone - Zaxel Katsugyo\n- Greens Hill Zone - RoyKirbs\n- Creepy Crypt - Vixuzen\n- Crash Coarse Zone, Act 1 - Voidy2246\n- Shiverside Chasm - M/C Industries\n\nCapture-the-Flag:\n- Firmir Nexus Zone - Chuckles troll\n- Desolate CTF Zone - CG64\n\nMatch/Tag:​\n- Cloistered Woods Zone - Blast98\n\nCircuit​:\n- Gambit Valley Zone - JABSphere94\n\nBattle Capture-the-Flag:\n- Sunset Park Zone, Act 1 - PeneBoi','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s89.jpg'),(8943,'Cardbot',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Cardbot is an action-platformer game about traveling through dimensions to restore the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mvl.jpg'),(8944,'Paladin II',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Sin plataforma','A strategy role-playing game and sequel to Omnitrend\'s popular Paladin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nscvegfdn5mvo8hx1neb.jpg'),(8945,'Mess Quest','2022-11-09','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Mess Quest, arrive at the aftermath of numerous wacky scenarios to clean, mop, and put things back together! Grab a bucket and a mop and get swinging. What’s that green stuff? Where did that bone come from? We don\'t get paid to ask questions, we get paid to clean!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bb2.jpg'),(8946,'Marble Craze','2002-08-10','Puzzle, Racing','Atari 2600','Marble Craze is a homebrew Atari 2600 game developed by Paul Slocum. It\'s a side by side split-screen one or two player game where you roll a marble along a path across multiple screens to a finish line. The game uses paddle controllers, and it is the first game where each player uses two paddles to control the game: one is used to control the marble\'s vertical movement and the other is used for horizontal.\n\nThe goal of Marble Craze is to navigate through each level within the time limit and in later levels, without falling off the edges. There are bonuses, hidden areas, ramps and a lot of other stuff to keep it interesting. It\'s got 18 levels that go from very easy to insanely hard, and several in-game songs that push the Atari 2600\'s sound chip to its limits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63p8.jpg'),(8947,'ABC Follow Me: Animals - Extended Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8948,'Bride into the Cave','2024-04-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Myth lingers in a tranquil and remote ancient town in China. In one telling, once a beautiful maiden is chosen by the cave deity, her soul disappears from the mortal realm. A minority girl called Miao Fei embarks on her journey to uncover the truth behind the legend, and rescue herself, perhap.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79v6.jpg'),(8949,'Sonic the Hedgehog 3 & Knuckles','2011-01-26','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sonic the Hedgehog 3 & Knuckles (or simply Sonic 3 & Knuckles or Sonic 3 Complete Edition) is a platform video game which is the result of locking-on Sonic & Knuckles with Sonic the Hedgehog 3 using the former catridge\'s unique \"lock-on\" technology. It is essentially a large combined game of its two lock-on components and contains all Zones from the said games and also contains special features unique to this game. This would have been the original Sonic the Hedgehog 3 the developers intended but time constraints by Sega resulted in the game being split into two.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c0w.jpg'),(8950,'ProtoCorgi','2023-06-15','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Retro style pixel art, horizontal shoot \'em up, arcade gameplay and the cutest little cyber hero you will ever meet. Play as Bullet, a C³ class (Cute Cyber Corgi) cybernetic pup in his quest for saving his owner, a brilliant scientist kidnaped by a strange alien race that wants to rule the galaxy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fhm.jpg'),(8951,'Nora Roberts: Vision in White',NULL,'Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When a casual fling turns steamy for a brilliant wedding photographer, life remains less than picture perfect. Relying on girlfriends to cope with the reality of her past, will Mackensie capture the romance, or will her narcissistic mother and fear of commitment be the prophetic snapshot of her future? Take part in Nora Roberts’ best-selling novel in Nora Roberts Vision in White, a fun Hidden Object game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2siz.jpg'),(8952,'Death by AI','2023-11-03','Strategy, Quiz/Trivia, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Step into a world where AI holds all the cards. Will it be your ally, or will it pull the plug? Choose wisely, because it\'s not programmed to care! Death by AI is an online prompt based survival multiplayer game to play with your friends, family, community and coworkers on mobile and web.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cou.jpg'),(8953,'Holobunnies: The Bittersweet Adventure','2018-03-31','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Holobunnies is a challenging and rewarding side-scrolling adventure game that happens across every corner of the universe. You play as one of the Holobunnies, Danielle the witch, Leenox the hunter, Roméo the bard, Mephisto the ninja and Avril the catcher which are hologram brothers and sisters, living together aboard their very own starship. Explore planets, fight with vile and weird creatures, meet with special and peculiar people, collect treasures and collectibles and ultimately; find a new home for you and your hologram buddies. Share the fun of exploration and fighting with a friend (or foe?) in coop mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mle6hh1iqiaxyb21wzxj.jpg'),(8954,'Curse of the Shadow Samurai','2023-06-23','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Seek vengeance, battling hordes of enemies across multiple stages. Conquer challenging waves, obtain powerful upgrades, and face formidable bosses. Unleash retribution in this thrilling quest for justice!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99b9.jpg'),(8955,'Densha de GO! Pocket: Yamanotesen-hen','2005-09-29','Simulator','PlayStation Portable','Densha de Go! Pocket lets players drive simulated commuter trains in Japan, picking up passengers and adhering to schedules.\n\nDensha de GO! Pocket: Yamanotesen-hen is a split port of the Densha de Go! Pocket line to the PlayStation Portable, all of which are based on parts of Densha de GO! FINAL:\n- Densha de Go! Pocket: Yamanotesen-hen (loosely translated to \"Go by Train! Pocket: Yamanote Line Edition\") was released on September 29, 2005, including only the Yamanote Line.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z17.jpg'),(8956,'Turrican: Ultra Collector\'s Edition','2021-12-31','Shooter, Platform, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Welcome back… to Turrican! In the Turrican Anthology Vol 1 & 2.\n\nThe Turrican Collection includes:\nTurrican Anthology Vol. 1\n- Turrican (Amiga)\n- Turrican 2 (Amiga)\n- Super Turrican (SNES)\n- Super Turrican Director\'s Cut (SNES)\n- Mega Turrican Score Attack (Mega Drive)\n- Turrican Anthology Vol. 2\n\nTurrican 3 (Amiga)\n- Mega Turrican (Mega Drive)\n- Mega Turrican Director\'s Cut (Mega Drive)\n- Super Turrican 2 (SNES)\n- Super Turrican 1 Score Attack (SNES)\n\nThe Collector\'s Edition contains:\n- Turrican Anthology Vol. 1 Game for Nintendo Switch\n- Turrican Anthology Vol. 2 Game for Nintendo Switch\n- Collector\'s box with magnetic latch\n- Turrican Documentary (BluRay)\n- Soundtrack\n- Art Book\n- Sticker Sheet\n- 4 Acrylic Art Cards\n- 2 Large reversible Posters\n- Enamel Pin\n- Signed Postcard (Print)\n- Approximate size of the Ultra Collector\'s Edition box: 22cm x 16cm x 7,5cm (8,7 x 6,3 x 3 Inches)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vh7.jpg'),(8957,'Mountain Bicycle Rider Simulator','2023-09-06','Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Are you ready to experience the thrill of cycling on snowy mountain peaks? Mountain Bicycle Rider Simulator invites you to an unforgettable adventure with realistic graphics. Now explore and pedal to the top!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co711z.jpg'),(8958,'Vasilisa the Wise','2024-02-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vasilisa the Wise is a visual novel based on the famous Russian fairy tale \"The Frog Princess\". However, unlike the well-known fairy tale, in this game there are several scenarios, depending on the actions of the player. The goal of the game is to defeat the evil and win the heart of Vasilisa.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co932c.jpg'),(8959,'DragonScales 6: Love and Redemption','2020-03-16','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A casual game with tile matching, puzzles and battles. Solve the new DragonScales challenges and shatter the plans of the Dark Empress.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20hx.jpg'),(8960,'Boxing School II','2025-04-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BOXING SCHOOL 2! Take control of a boxing gym in the 80s. You’ll hire the boxers, teach them to fight and climb the ranks. This is the improved and refined sequel to the management game Boxing School.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r6e.jpg'),(8961,'911 Operator: Special Resources','2017-02-24','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Special Resources DLC was released on the same days as the base game.\n\nIt offers new vehicles, new equipment and new incidents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ani.jpg'),(8962,'Dogfight 1942','2012-09-21','Shooter, Simulator','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Piloting a wide range of aircraft, players engage in aerial dogfights and dangerous fighter missions across the major theaters of war during WWII.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ouc.jpg'),(8963,'Horror Tycoon','2022-10-20','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scare, terrify and thrill guests as you build the Haunted House empire of your nightmares. Design and customize your creations with incredible detail to scare your guests, or risk losing it all in this tycoon/tower defense hybrid!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4m96.jpg'),(8964,'The Sword of Ares for Quake','1998-04-06','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Sword of Ares is a 1998 unlicensed total conversion for Quake.\n\nThe game adds several features not available in vanilla Quakes, such as the ability to switch to a third-person view (which may be a bit buggy) and several selectable player skins.\n\nThe Sword of Ares was made of free content but was distributed as shareware. It appears that the registered version (as a separate PAK file) was eventually made available by the author as a free download too, as it can be found on PlanetQuake mirrors alongside the shareware release. It is an unofficial commercial total conversion, whether it was licensed by id Software is unclear.\n\nThe game retailed at $9.99 on their official website.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mxj.jpg'),(8965,'Trainz Railroad Simulator 2022: VR Healesville 1913-1920 TRS19',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Drive classic Victorian Railways steam locomotives through the famed Yarra Valley, north east of Melbourne, during the WW1 era. Comes with a selection of pre-made sessions, a pre-made multiplayer freeplay session, and a variety of Victorian Railways steam locomotives and rolling stock.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8966,'Famicom Meijinsen','1988-09-02','Sport, Quiz/Trivia','Family Computer','Famicom Meijinsen is a Miscellaneous game, developed by Alpha Denshi and published by SNK, which was released in Japan in 1988.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7y96.jpg'),(8967,'Psycho on the loose','2016-12-21','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An assassin with a rise in his career to kill his target is out on a murdering spree. He is out there with alot of motives but his main motive is two eliminate all targets and who ever may get in his way. He is stealthy with his moves and he always watches his back, he changes outfits to suit his missions and has a van with a variety of weapons to choose from, they range from your smaller weapons to the larger weapons, even throwables such as, grenades and molotoves. If he is not careful and is to roucous then he has more then just his target to deal with when backup arrives. His missions take him from woodlands to suburb and cities, no matter if its day or night.  \n \nYou are him so make sure you are stealthy, move corpse to not alert those around. Earn money from each person killed, pass the level and you get to keep your earnings, die and loose all money earned. With a variety of maps and missions, it shall take you into places day or night. Be prepared and select weapons to help you. Good luck Cane!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8968,'Flores con Historias',NULL,'Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ood.jpg'),(8969,'Ronin: The Last Samurai',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, iOS','Ronin: The Last Samurai is a shining example of how incredible control design can elevate a game. It simplifies the complex positioning and careful timing of katana-based swordplay to only two buttons, and it does so without reducing combat to button mashing or mindless grinding.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ejo.jpg'),(8970,'Dive Into The Survival',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8971,'Memories Off #5: Togireta Film','2024-01-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tob.jpg'),(8972,'The Turned About Turnabout','2017-05-01','Visual Novel','Web browser','Phoenix and Maya are thrown into yet another murder case with little to no idea of what they\'re doing. Same old, same old, huh? Except, this prosecutor... well, let\'s just say he\'s a bit \"special.\" With such a clueless opponent, this should be an easy ride for our humble protagonists.\n\n...Right?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ihd.jpg'),(8973,'Marsupilami: Hoobadventure - Collector\'s Edition','2021-11-16','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Marsupilami: Hoobadventure - Collector\'s Edition includes:\n- Game: Marsupilami: Hoobadventure\n- 2 sticker sheets\n- 1 Double-sided Door Hanger\n- 14cm Marsupilami figurine','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h87.jpg'),(8974,'Pyramid Solitaire - Card Game','2009-03-27','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','iOS','Pyramid Solitaire is BRAND NEW and RE-IMAGINED! Pyramid is still the classic card game experience, from the makers of the ORIGINAL Solitaire game! Pyramid is a puzzle game that requires logic and strategy to clear the table. You’ll love adding Pyramid to your collection of MobilityWare Solitaire games!\n\nHow to Play: Pair cards that equal to 13. Jacks = 11, Queens = 12, and Kings = 13.\n\nHere’s a quick view of what our app offers:\n- Classic Solitaire experience\n- Thousands of randomized deals\n- Fun and exciting animations\n- Smooth and polished gameplay\n\nWe guarantee the BEST QUALITY Pyramid card game in the iTunes store. We’re ALWAYS improving and adding new features to the game!\n\nDownload Pyramid Solitaire, completely FREE.\n________________________________________\n\nLIKE US on Facebook\n\nFOLLOW US on Twitter\n@mobilityware\n\nFor answers to frequently asked questions, head over to\n\nCreated and supported by MobilityWare','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/k8bcbm3wbfxxilal7pxa.jpg'),(8975,'Escape the Arcana',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Lost in an enchanted forest, face the Major Arcana in a roguelike deckbuilder journey. Relax, make card combos, navigate shifting paths, and enjoy the groovy jazz. Experiment with different builds and strategies to defeat all 22 Major Arcana and escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kq9.jpg'),(8976,'Basketing','2022-06-09','Sport, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Basketing is the youngest sibling of Volleying! Thus, as another physics-based game, it also gives the players more control over their moves, delivering unique matches each round. Invite your friends over or play remotely and enjoy this predictably unpredictable experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45v7.jpg'),(8977,'Crash Club',NULL,'Racing','Sin plataforma','Crash Club is massively multiplayer action with over 30 players live and real time in every game. Everything can be crashed, with weapons and abilities to battle other drivers available right in the middle of the action.\nOver 25 unique car makes and countless model varieties, with infinite paint, decal, accessory and emoji options. Manage your garage and sell old rides to make way for better vehicles. Pimp them out with upgrades and powers to define your unique style and get the upper hand!\nThis is Crash Club - a living, breathing world from Prettygreat to take online mobile multiplayer to new heights!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8978,'Cheese Dreams','2008-04-10','Platform','Web browser','The moon has been kidnapped by space mice! Bounce him off their ship.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85mh.jpg'),(8979,'Sonic the Hedgehog 3 Complete','2013-08-10','Platform, Adventure','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sonic 3 Complete is a hack of Sonic 3 & Knuckles which aims to provide a much improved variant of the original game, with many new options and features, without straying from the original levels or gameplay. The inclusion of separate modes for Sonic 3, Sonic & Knuckles and Blue Sphere also make this a close cousin of the PC compilation Sonic & Knuckles Collection, albeit designed for the original 16-bit hardware.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r6l.jpg'),(8980,'Train Manager','2019-02-11','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ever thought why Trains don\'t just drive as they want? Well, there is a good reason for that. You will need to overview the Stations and prevent accidents. Navigate the Trains to success. Next thing you know they go extinct because all of them crashed into each other. You are here to save Trainmanity.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8981,'Dexter\'s Laser Lab','2002-09-30','Puzzle','Web browser','Dexter\'s Laser Lab is a Shockwave game based on Dexter\'s Laboratory that was playable on the official Cartoon Network website.\n\nIn this game, Dee Dee celebrates her birthday by having a party in Dexter\'s laboratory, leaving behind many balloons in her wake. Dexter, using his invention called the TidyTron 4000, a high-powered infrared laser, works to get rid of the balloons in his laboratory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68ts.jpg'),(8982,'Kawaii Pet Shop Monogatari 2','2000-12-22','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Game Boy Color','Similar to its predecessor, this is an animal-raising RPG adding more animals and improvements.\n\nThe protagonist\'s father, who runs a pet shop, goes missing after a shipwreck. The protagonist takes over the pet shop management and embarks on an adventure with her exceptional pets to find clues about her father\'s whereabouts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h8q.jpg'),(8983,'Reflec Beat: The Reflesia of Eternity','2016-12-01','Music','Arcade','The sixth and final game in the Reflec Beat series, part of the Bemani franchise. The game features an engine rebuilt from the ground up and a new fantasy styled theme.\n\nThe game is played by hitting circles bouncing down the screen when they reach a certain \"judgement\" line. Circles with green color has other targets slightly raised from the judgement line. The look and behaviour of the circles has often been compared to how an air hockey puck travels across the field, giving the series the nickname \"Rhythm Air Hockey\".\n\nSlide object introduced in Volzza were removed as they often caused technical issues. They were replaced with objects that rumble the screen and other new note types. Because of this and the engine changes, all previous song charts needed to be remade. When the game first launched only 80 songs from previous games were present. However packs of 10 song \"revivals\" has been regularly during its lifetime. Thus far 523 songs have been remade and 152 songs still waiting to be recreated in the new engine. 91 new songs has also been added to the game for a total of 614 songs.\n\nThe game focuses on a new \"Reflesia Mode\" as its main component. Where you are challenged to different quests (random selection of songs) where the opponent has a set health bar. Deplete the health bar by playing well and you will progress the story and unlock songs, as well as characters and items. These characters and items can be levelled up and equipped to be more powerful and deplete the health bar of your opponent quicker.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jef.jpg'),(8984,'Endless Space 2: Definitive Edition',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pdx.jpg'),(8985,'Madden NFL 11','2010-08-10','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Madden NFL 11 re-energizes the game of football with a fun and exhilarating experience to ignite the passion of every NFL fan. Whether you’re rekindling an old rivalry, putting your spin on the best moments of 2009, or building the ultimate dynasty in Franchise mode, Madden NFL 11 makes every day feel like Sunday. Experience the passion for football shared by Gus Johnson and Cris Collinsworth as they call the action on the field. Fight for fumbles, design your own plays, and feel what it\'s like to be an NFL superstar with Madden NFL 11, the ultimate NFL experience on PlayStation Portable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30ur.jpg'),(8986,'Five Nights at Treasure Island: Old Builds','2020-06-16','Point-and-click, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Five Nights at Treasure Island is a FNaF inspired fan game that was originally made by Anart1996 the owner of Five Nights at Treasure Island and Purity Sinners. This version of the title consists of Demo 1, Demo 2, Remastered Demo, AI Demo, Demo 3, and Alpha Test.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6628.jpg'),(8987,'Voyage: Journey to the Moon','2005-08-16','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Make fantastic discoveries and dare to go into the deepest depths of the moon to solve puzzles that will allow you to go back to Earth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co221h.jpg'),(8988,'Sir Tincan: Adventures in the Castle','2020-04-03','Puzzle, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','In 20 different scenes your children help the knight for example to care for his horse, shoot with bow and arrows, repair the castle walls, impress the king at the joust or win the heart of the beautiful damsel of the castle.\n\nA fantastic world full of small surprises, witty experiences, lovely characters and different animals is revealed to the children.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5asi.jpg'),(8989,'Sigma Theory: Global Cold War - Deluxe Edition','2019-11-21','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cba.jpg'),(8990,'The Sims: Vacation','2002-03-25','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Sims: Vacation, known as The Sims: On Holiday in the Republic of Ireland, the UK, China and Scandinavia, is the fourth expansion pack for The Sims. Vacation introduces new items, characters, and features, as well as a new destination called Vacation Island where Sims can take vacations with family members or with other Sims. This marks the first time Sims can stay on lots away from home, meaning the game can be saved while a Sim is on Vacation Island. Vacation Island is split into three distinct environments: beach, forest, and snow-capped mountain. Sims can purchase or find souvenirs and either stay at a hotel or rent a tent/igloo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zo1.jpg'),(8991,'Rage','2011-10-27','Shooter, Racing','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','Rage is a first-person shooter set in the not-too-distant future after an asteroid impacts Earth, leaving a ravaged world behind. You emerge into this vast wasteland to discover humanity working to rebuild itself against such forces as raider gangs, mutants, and the Authority – an oppressive government regime that has a special interest in you in particular.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ybv.jpg'),(8992,'Tonkachi Mario','1987-12-31','Platform, Adventure','Family Computer Disk System','Tonkachi Mario is a bootleg kaizo rom hack of Super Mario Bros. made with Tonkachi Editor, an unlicensed code editor for the Famicom. It is currently the earliest known rom hack of Super Mario Bros, alongside being the first hack of the kaizo genre, dating back to 1987.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(8993,'Neon Genesis Evangelion','1999-06-25','Fighting','Nintendo 64','This game is an interactive adaptation of Neon Genesis Evangelion for N64. Called Shinseki Evangelion in Japan, the Gainax-produced anime series originally aired from October \'95 to March \'96 and soon spawned a feature movie release in \'97. The N64 game starts in the year 2015, 15 years after Second Impact. The Angels have returned and suddenly attack Tokyo-3. Using so-called \"terror-fields\" that cannot be penetrated by ordinary weapons, the Angels are taking on every human force sent out to oppose them. That\'s where you come in. As the pilot of the NERV-designed Evangelions, Shinji Ikari, you take your giant humanoid combat mech into battle with the Angels. Gameplay can best be described as interactive anime, as it relies heavily on timed button presses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wj2.jpg'),(8994,'Nancy Drew: The Secret of Shadow Ranch','2004-08-30','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take a Wild Ride into Terror and Trickery to Rein in a Ghostly Secret!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qsy.jpg'),(8995,'A Joke that\'s Worth $0.99','2022-04-21','Platform, Indie','Playdate','A tiny person with a bouncy butt tells a very long joke. Control the crank of the Playdate to not make him fall.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68p9.jpg'),(8996,'Virtua Fighter 5','2007-02-08','Fighting','Arcade, PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Virtua Fighter 5 features an all-star cast of 17 fighters, including characters from the previous iterations along with two new characters named El Blaze and Eileen. The game delivers fast-paced, adrenaline-pumping action as players head into battle, taking on a host of popular characters. Players not only achieve victory by defeating highly-skilled opponents, but also by competing for prizes which earn them in-game money allowing them to buy many items at in-game shop. These items allow players to customize their ultimate warrior and become the top Virtua Fighter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tyl.jpg'),(8997,'Rain Blood Chronicles: Mirage','2013-10-01','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mirage is an action adventure in which you will need to gear up to clear the 8 levels in this game and by doing so you will eventually learn the truth of Mirage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2214.jpg'),(8998,'Static: The Beginning','2025-04-03','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immerse yourself in STATIC : THE BEGINNING , a horror adventure where Clara\'s quiet evening turns into a nightmare. Navigate a Moroccan riad, face sinister cultists, battle terrifying monsters, and uncover dark secrets. Can you help Clara escape the horrors that await?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mbh.jpg'),(8999,'Checkers Online',NULL,'Simulator, Sport, Card & Board Game','Sin plataforma','Play Checkers online for free!\nChoose your level and favourite rules: American Checkers or International Draughts','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s29.jpg'),(9000,'Pacification Light','2024-06-20','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pacification Light is an exciting 2D platformer that takes us back to a time when spirits and ghosts inhabited our world. During this period, there lived a brave hero who decided to confront the darkness and cleanse the earth of sinister supernatural entities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8esd.jpg'),(9001,'Dead Zone',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Dead Zone is a multiplayer first and third person survival shooter. Your task is to survive within a closed area filled with many enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5g1z.jpg'),(9002,'Pump It Up NX2: Next Xenesis','2007-12-14','Music','Arcade','This was the second Pump It Up game released by Nexcade and Andamiro, fans say this WorldMax is the best in the entire series for its unique song selection and elaborate functions utilized, to keep fans playing for months and months, released in 2008 very few to this day have completed the NX2 WorldMax.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nwvjbp7jnt0mjhkzxvst.jpg'),(9003,'Sakura Scramble!','2019-09-09','Visual Novel','Android','After a lot of hard work, you\'ve managed to make it into high school! But there\'s only one thing that\'s really on your mind... finding a girlfriend! Legend has it that if two lovers confess their feelings underneath the sakura tree in the schoolyard, their love will last forever. As you contemplate your future possibilities, you are reunited with your childhood friend named Poppy - an energetic and spunky girl that you haven\'t seen for years. The two of you decide to help each other out - you find her a boyfriend, and she\'ll find you a girlfriend!\n\nWithin a week, you find yourself acquainted with a beautiful senior as well as a quirky girl from another class. You all quickly become friends... but then you begin to wonder. Who do I want to confess my feelings to underneath the sakura tree...?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wbp.jpg'),(9004,'Mario Artist: Communication Kit','2000-06-29','Simulator','64DD','Mario Artist: Communication Kit serves as an add-on and accessory to the other Mario Artist games. It allowed players to connect to the Internet via RandNetDD and show off their creations to other players. While connected, players can use their characters to explore a virtual 3D community. There is also exclusive content on the disk that can be imported to the other Mario Artist titles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21sq.jpg'),(9005,'Erotic Tentacle Arts Assortment',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9006,'Dune: Spice Wars','2023-09-14','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dune: Spice Wars is a real-time strategy game with 4X elements, from the developers of the critically acclaimed Northgard. Set in Frank Herbert’s groundbreaking Dune universe, you must lead your faction and battle for control and dominance over the harsh desert planet of Arrakis. Best your opponents through political intrigue, crush them in combat, and undermine them with your network of illusive spies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a96.jpg'),(9007,'Metroid: Rogue Dawn','2017-01-14','Shooter, Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Rogue Dawn is an unofficial prequel to the original Metroid game released in 1986. 30 years later we bring you the events that unfolded before Samus’s famous “Zero” mission on planet Zebes. The original Metroid manual tells us about a deep-space research spaceship that was attacked. Pirates seized a capsule said to contain a newly discovered life form in a state of suspended animation. Rogue Dawn surrounds these events that led up to the theft of the capsule which ultimately placed the Metroid’s under the control of Ridley and the Mother Brain. The mission to acquire the capsule is placed in the hands of one of Ridley’s best kept secrets. A rogue human agent trained and manipulated by Ridley from a young age. Taken as a child from a Federation colony obliterated by Ridley’s faction she was initially just another test subject slated to undergo horrific experiments. Ridley decided to instead manipulate and mold her into a weapon, his first human servant and dark agent. Primed yet untested she is sent out on her “zero” mission to retrieve a newly discovered biological specimen in the possession of a Federation research crew orbiting planet SR388 and prove her worth. Her name is Dawn Aran!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wwo.jpg'),(9008,'Sherlock Purr: Extended Edition','2023-03-31','Puzzle, Adventure, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Sherlock Purr is a fun and engaging children\'s game where players help the feline detective search for hidden objects in an apartment. With colorful graphics, entertaining animations, and brain-teasing puzzles, this game is perfect for young minds who love mysteries and cats. Follow Sherlock Purr\'s pawprints and solve the mystery today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dmh.jpg'),(9009,'Daily Life With My Succubus Boss','2023-05-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','With the lewd succubus, start a cohabitation life without shame and impatience. Master artist Tamada Heijun, super crazy full Live 2D!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qyw.jpg'),(9010,'Abyssfall: Seekers Within',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Seek the truth behind a millennia-old tower\'s existence as you navigate its ever-changing floors and confront its strange and fantastical denizens in this character-driven roguelike RPG, where grid-based combat meets fast-paced action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9myo.jpg'),(9011,'LEGO Racers','1999-07-31','Racing','Nintendo 64, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Lego Racers is set in the fictional Legoland universe, the game depicts Rocket Racer, the \"greatest racing champion\" in Legoland. After becoming bored from beating everyone at racing, he decides to create a racing contest, and finds the best racers in the history of Legoland using a dimensional warp machine created by his friend, Veronica Voltage, a genius scientist and mechanic. The player takes on the hosts and co-racers in an attempt to beat Rocket Racer and become the \"Greatest Lego Racer of All Time\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xs1.jpg'),(9012,'Twelve Easy Pieces','2022-03-25','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Twelve Easy Pieces\" (formerly known as \"Constraining Order\") is a set of twelve (or was it thirteen?...) Boom format maps that sets out to do exactly what it says on the tin - provide you some fun in an easy, stress-free environment. No evil archvile closets here (although my memory might fail me, it\'s been a while since I cleaned out those closets); no nasty obstacles to your carefree circlestrafing (watch your step though, I\'m not insured); and certainly no revenants (skinny guy in red pants told me, how could he be wrong?). Take a stroll through techbases, temples, aquatic environments and out-there voids, always knowing that even on UV you\'ll never face anything worse than a slightly spicy HMP Plutonia. Small maps with low monster counts, a restrained texture choice, and occasionally a dash of my personal foibles - puzzles and platforming. Nothing you can\'t overcome, believe me','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xql.jpg'),(9013,'Tangled Up!','2016-09-02','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Tangled Up\" is the story of two electric charges \"Positive Charge\" & \"Negative Charge\" who are paired by an electric string. One day the string that bonds them together gets tangled up! and they\'re unable to unite!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9014,'The King of Fighters: Maximum Impact','2004-08-12','Fighting','Xbox, PlayStation 2','The Synthesis of breathtaking 3D animation with the heart and soul of a 2D classic is now complete!\nA city lay in ruins as rival gangs are at war all vying for the chance to rule the underworld of Southtown. A small group destined to take the city back has established a meeting with the maniacal leader of the most powerful gang, \"Mephistopheles\". On one condition, to be in this meeting, one must prove themselves by defeating the greatest fighters in the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yvd.jpg'),(9015,'Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six Siege: Operation Wind Bastion','2018-12-04','Shooter, Tactical','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','New to Rainbow Six are Kaid and Nomad for Operation Wind Bastion. These two Operators are right at home at the reputable Kasbah Sekhra Mania, the featured Fortress map in Morocco. Join the very best at this elite training ground.\n\nYear Three Season Four will also introduce Pro Team BDUs and Headgears, a new navigational display in the shop, and a new fullscreen view for the weapons. You will find more details on these updates in the full Patch Notes below, as well as many gameplay fixes implemented this Season.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z67.jpg'),(9016,'Scratch Girl','2021-12-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Control the spaceship to find the beauty! Start a journey of conversation with the beauty!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ksr.jpg'),(9017,'Dracula vs. The Ninja On the Moon','2021-03-08','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An all new Interactive FMV game\n\nBased on the real life Underground Cult \"bad\" movie that has been passed around on DVD-R\'s and VHS TAPES for years.\n\nFeaturing\n\n• Stylized FMV video\n• Multiple endings\n• Hidden scenes\nSYSTEM REQUIRE','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ujy.jpg'),(9018,'Lemmings Tribes','2008-12-31','Puzzle, Strategy','Legacy Mobile Device','Lemmings Tribes is a traditional Lemmings game for J2ME-enabled mobile phones. Released in 2008, it was the first Lemmings game to mention the tribes at all since The Lemmings Chronicles in 1994.\nDespite being about the tribes, the game lacks any real story. Much like The Lemmings Chronicles, the game only features 3 tribes.\n\nClassic Tribe, featuring 14 levels.\nMedieval Tribe, featuring 13 levels.\nSpace Tribe, featuring 16 levels.\n\nAdditionally, there are 4 separate Tutorial levels that teach the player the 8 classic skills, including a playground level with infinite time and infinite skills to play around with.\n\nUnlike its predecessor Lemmings Return, the mechanics are significantly different from the J2ME version of Lemmings. The 8 classic skills, for example, all function a bit differently from how they do in either of the former 2 games. The level structure, however, is entirely identical to Lemmings. The number of lemmings in each level does not depend on how many the player saved in the previous level; each level simply has a save requirement the player must meet. The levels can have anywhere from 1 to 20 lemmings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co680t.jpg'),(9019,'1213: Episode 1','2005-12-30','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','1213: Episode 1 is the first iteration of Ben \"Yahtzee\" Croshaw\'s 1213 series. The game follows an amnesiac man only known by his subject number 1213. He is locked inside mysterious facility where his captor runs terrible experiments on him. Then, for reasons yet unknown, 1213 is freed from his cell, just to find out something has gone terribly wrong inside the facility. \n \nUnlike previous games by Ben Croshaw, 1213 is an action-adventure game featuring Prince of Persia style platforming and 2D shooter mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v7k.jpg'),(9020,'Life After End',NULL,'Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Life After End is a harsh and cruel representative of the Survival Horror genre, where you have to survive in post-apocalyptic Siberia. Be prepared for harsh climatic conditions and realistic gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62f7.jpg'),(9021,'Weird Little Guys','2024-02-29','Sin género','Web browser','One afternoon, your cat requests a treat...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j3f.jpg'),(9022,'Bubble Witch 2 Saga','2014-06-04','Puzzle','Web browser, Android, iOS, Legacy Mobile Device','From the makers of Candy Crush Saga, Bubble Witch Saga & Farm Heroes Saga comes Bubble Witch 2 Saga!\nStella and her cats need your help to fend off the dark spirits that are plaguing their land. Travel the realm bursting as many bubbles as you can in this exciting bubble shooting puzzle adventure. Win levels and free Witch Country piece by piece.\nPlay this epic saga alone or with friends to see who can get the highest score!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ont.jpg'),(9023,'Itorah','2023-04-21','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Discover Nahucan, a world inhabited by masked beings. You\'re Itorah, the only human in this strange place. Explore, fight and survive as you save Nahucan from its biggest threat, the black plague.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2esy.jpg'),(9024,'Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six Collection',NULL,'Shooter, Tactical','Sin plataforma','Team Rainbow is a multinational task force comprised of counter-terrorism experts from around the globe. Equipped with state-of-the-art weapons, Team Rainbow is deployed during terrorist crises. When all other attempts have failed, Rainbow is brought in to save the lives of innocent people. They do not negotiate with terror. They destroy it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dsa.jpg'),(9025,'Caves and Castles: Underworld','2018-01-17','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Find adventure beyond your imagination and riches untold as you descend into the caves beneath an ancient castle! Enjoy colorful hand-drawn art and animation, a charming story and hours of match-three fun as you play Caves and Castes: Underworld!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ozk.jpg'),(9026,'Ball','1980-04-28','Arcade','Game & Watch','Ball (originally known as Toss-Up in North America) is a Game & Watch game released as a part of the Silver series on April 28, 1980. It was the first Game & Watch game. It is a single-screen single-player Game & Watch.\n\nIn Game A, the player tosses two balls in the air. As the balls fall, the player must catch and toss them up again. One point is earned for each successful catch. A dropped ball will display a broken ball and end the game. The object is to continuously catch the balls that fall and throw them back up, as in juggling. In Game B, the player must juggle three balls, and each successful catch rewards ten points instead of one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3aur.jpg'),(9027,'The M1 Tank Platoon Collection',NULL,'Simulator, Tactical','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t6f.jpg'),(9028,'Passatempo Turma da Mônica','2002-12-31','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9029,'Namco Museum Collection 2','2020-06-08','Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','Evercade','The Namco Collection 2 is a compilation cartridge for the Evercade which contains 11 classic Namco games.\n\nGames included:\n- Galaga\n- Pac-Attack\n- Tower of Druaga\n- Phelios\n- Dragon Spirit\n- Dig Dug 2\n- Burning Force\n- Weapon Lord\n- Warp Man\n- Splatterhouse 2\n- Splatterhouse 3','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xyy.jpg'),(9030,'Super Lotsa Added Stuff Hack',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','SLASH\'EM is a variant of NetHack based on NetHack version 3.3.1. The object of the game is the same: to fetch the Amulet of Yendor from the bottom of the Gehennom and offer it to your god.\n\nCompared to vanilla NetHack, SLASH\'EM contains five new roles and five new races for the player to choose from, several new special levels, several new monsters, new items and new artifacts, and other changes. The main dungeon is longer in SLASH\'EM than in NetHack but the Gehennom is shorter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/p9wxkniy1ahebdmhkjkf.jpg'),(9031,'Martians Vs Robots','2019-05-24','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Martians want to regain control of their planet! But we have not yet finished exploiting Martian mining resources... We\'re going to have to defend ourselves!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3npg.jpg'),(9032,'Adventures of Red and Carmine','2023-01-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Adventures of Red & Carmine is a simple platformer game with soft background music and fun gameplay, with the special feature to play as Red and Carmine as they adventure through different worlds, and find their way back to each other and go back home.The demo version features Red only.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gik.jpg'),(9033,'Pac-Man\'s Pixel Bash','2018-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','Released in 2018 by Bandai Namco, just ahead of Pac-Man\'s 40th anniversary. Features 31 games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zq2.jpg'),(9034,'Shadowland','1987-04-01','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Arcade','Shadowland is a work about the adventures of the main character, Tarosuke, in hell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50b1.jpg'),(9035,'Tomb Raider','2013-03-04','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','Tomb Raider explores the intense and gritty origin story of Lara Croft and her ascent from a young woman to a hardened survivor. Armed only with raw instincts and the ability to push beyond the limits of human endurance, Lara must fight to unravel the dark history of a forgotten island to escape its relentless hold.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rbu.jpg'),(9036,'Pokémon Vanguard',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter Ayrei, A region split into four separate quadrants, each blooming with life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93de.jpg'),(9037,'Bendy and the Dark Revival','2022-11-15','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Bendy and the Dark Revival is a first-person survival horror game set in the creepiest cartoon studio to ever exist. Discover the truth. Escape the studio. Above all, fear the Ink Demon…and survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co683q.jpg'),(9038,'Dengeki Nurse 2: More Sexy','1994-07-29','Sport, Adventure','PC-9800 Series, FM Towns','Pornographic adventure game developed by Cocktail Soft in 1994.\nDengeki Nurse 2 begins where the previous game ended. The heroes of the story, the young doctor Tanchi and his sweetheart, the lovely Kirara, are enjoying a peaceful moment... when an explosion reminds them that the evil organization Black Cross has not yet been defeated. One by one, the powerful \"nurses\" - agents with super-powers - are sent to deal with Tanchi, Kirara, and their friends, and the only way to stop them is to use Kirara\'s own super-power - turning into the \"electric nurse\"!..','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/r38pdup2os4xbifo9ykg.jpg'),(9039,'Wordfright','2025-03-06','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A reimagining of the classic \'Hangman\' game turned into a horrific thrill ride.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ibe.jpg'),(9040,'Yosumin!','2009-05-26','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Nintendo DS','Make rectangles of the same type of yosumin to make them disappear in this mind-bending puzzle game. The more you get, the better you\'ll feel!\n\nYosumin!, Square Enix\'s puzzle masterpiece, is here! Simply select rectangles of the same type of yosumin to make them disappear in this simple yet challenging puzzle game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l5r.jpg'),(9041,'Quickie: A Love Hotel Story','2021-12-17','Simulator','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Quickie: A Love Hotel Story is an erotic management dating-sim where you manage a love hotel and develop romantic relationships in the city of Tokyo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co477k.jpg'),(9042,'Far Cry 6: Collector\'s Edition','2021-10-07','Shooter, Adventure','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Welcome to Yara, a tropical paradise frozen in time. Far Cry 6 thrusts players into a modern-day guerrilla revolution. As dictator of Yara, Anton Castillo is intent on restoring his nation back to its former glory by any means, with his son, Diego, following in his bloody footsteps. Become a guerrilla fighter and liberate Yara. Pick up the Collector\'s Edition for the true Far Cry fan experience, which includes the game, SteelBook case with alternate art, Season Pass, flamethrower replica, art book, exclusive in-game items, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co318l.jpg'),(9043,'Resistor',NULL,'Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','A turbocharged narrative-driven adventure RPG featuring open-world exploration, stunt-infused racing, and explosive vehicular combat! Build up your team and unravel a twisting story as you compete to take down an oppressive mega-corporation and its enigmatic director.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6luz.jpg'),(9044,'Viking Warrior','2021-01-19','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Viking Warrior is a third-person action role-playing game. It is made in famous Dark Souls style where everything is dark and difficult! Explore this game as a Viking Warrior now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2omk.jpg'),(9045,'Asterism Basketball',NULL,'Sport, Indie','Sin plataforma','Dunks in deep space! Asterism Basketball is a dynamic arcade game for up to four players, with many balls and stages to unlock! It\'s easy to understand, but very hard to master!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lpe.jpg'),(9046,'CiTV Racing',NULL,'Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95ep.jpg'),(9047,'Cadria Item Shop','2018-08-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cadria Item Shop is a casual simulation game with fun plots. In the silent town you are just a shopkeeper to craft items and weapons for heroes. You can sell your items to heroes and complete orders to earn gold coins. By managing and developing your item shop you will help to reconstruct your hometown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mon.jpg'),(9048,'1-2-3 or 4-5-6','2025-05-01','Puzzle, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','1-2-3 or 4-5-6 ..... Spot the outlier. Among the many dice, there is one that stands out.\nFind it within the time limit!\nAnswer correctly to level up. More dice will appear, and the challenge will deepen.\nA simple yet profound test of intuition and observation.\nCan you reach the highest level?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r6z.jpg'),(9049,'LocoRoco 2','2008-11-21','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation Portable','The LocoRoco are in danger again, the evil Moja have returned and this time they\'ve brought with them a terrible song that sucks the life out of living things! The LocoRoco must once again save their planet - this time by making lots of sweet music. LocoRoco 2 is easy to play, instantly addictive and guaranteed to make you feel all warm and fuzzy while you hum along to the soundtrack! Explore 25 new stages, including hidden challenges, and meet a colourful cast of new characters. Enhance your LocoRoco through music and song, learning new actions to overcome the Moja. Perform new actions such as climbing inside shells to destroy thorns, jumping from grass blade to grass blade and swimming underwater. Expand your fun with six new mini games, including an Ad-hoc four player game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ja3.jpg'),(9050,'Tarantula Virus','2023-09-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tarantula Virus is a randomly generated roguelike topdownshooter in a sci-fi style with a lot of items and enemies. Upgrade items unlock new characters find allies and defeat powerful enemies and bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tmh.jpg'),(9051,'Barro F','2020-02-28','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Faster and funnier!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lkk.jpg'),(9052,'Zone of the Enders: The 2nd Runner','2003-03-10','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 2','The sequel to Zone of the Enders is based around mecha combat with the player once again controlling the \"Orbital Frame\" Jehuty. Unlike its prequel, the game is now centered on action elements with the player not needing to protect civilians in need and instead Jehuty contains more weaponry than in the previous game.\n\nThe plot is set two years after the events from Zone of the Enders and focuses on Dingo Egret, a former member from Mars\' military organization BAHRAM whose leader Ridley \"Nohman\" Hardiman wants back with him. Nohman shoots Dingo following his rejection but the agent Ken Marinaris saves Dingo by connecting his body to Jehuty and forces to work in order to defeat BAHRAM. The game had a new director, Shuyo Murata, who producer Hideo Kojima appointed in order to provide a different experience. The team worked to cover the criticism the original Zone of the Enders received resulted in The 2nd Runner having more action elements.\n\nThe game received generally favorable critical response due to the improvements it has in comparison to the previous game. Critics praised the game\'s graphics and gameplay elements but criticized its short length and presentation. Despite the positive critical reaction, the game suffered mediocre sales.\n\nNorth American & Japan got regular ZOE2, but the regular edition of ZOE2 was never released in Europe. Europe directly got the ZOE2 Special Edition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gzx.jpg'),(9053,'Psikodelya','2019-08-07','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore multiple dimensions in a psychedelic world in the quest to find Alice project files. Solve puzzles and overcome obstacles on gravity-defying platforms. Welcome to the world of Psikodelya!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y34.jpg'),(9054,'Trepang2: Digital Deluxe Edition','2023-10-26','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Become the ultimate badass in Trepang2. Unleash hell on your enemies in this gory action-packed FPS set in the future and stop at nothing to get your revenge.\n\nThe Deluxe Edition includes:\n\n- Trepang2 Full Game\n- Season Pass including Survival Mode DLC (Available Now) and Story DLC coming soon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sao.jpg'),(9055,'My Fair Princess','2019-11-08','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the world-renowned Ryokufuuin Academy! Play as Satoshi, a poor dude thrown into a world of rich ladies! You never know what life will throw at you when you have a pet sheep and five ladies clamoring for you love!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3piv.jpg'),(9056,'No Longer Human',NULL,'Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','No Longer Human is a high-energy cybergoth action fvck-em-up with expressive, freeform combat that encourages aggressive, stylish play. Set in the near future, brain-computer interfaces have become as commonplace as mobile phones, allowing users to submerge themselves entirely into the metaverse and abandon the physical world altogether. You assume the role of Tsunono, the once world famous vocaloid idol turned cyberdemon, on her destructive path to total world domination.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vog.jpg'),(9057,'Patterna','2016-10-03','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Patterna is a logic puzzle game for people who think that HexCells is far too easy. It features a highly customizable random level generator, a level editor, more than 70 levels, and an enchanting minimalist soundtrack by Alex Cottrell.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9058,'Payday 2: Buluc\'s Mansion Heist',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Vlad contacts the Payday Gang and wants them to infiltrate the crime lord Buluc’s well-guarded mansion and assassinate him.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kc6.jpg'),(9059,'Dark Deception: Chapter 3','2019-06-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The 3rd Chapter of Dark Deception! New enemies await you in the next 2 nightmares. The darkness is growing and your demons are closing in. Can you change fate? Run or die - it\'s your choice!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47ga.jpg'),(9060,'Kalpa: Cosmic Symphony','2024-08-15','Music, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kalpa, the authentic mobile 5-key rhythm game, is now available on STEAM! The doomed universe needs you to play your life away. Play your life\'s music with Kalpa to save the dying Yggdrasil and revive the universe!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nmm.jpg'),(9061,'Stratego','2010-10-28','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Strategor from Jumbo is all about good tactics, strategy and cold hard bluff, a combination of chess and poker. A Strategy battle game that has been played by millions of board game players and is now available for your iOS device.\n\nThis official single player Stratego comes with a new and improved AI opponent, with adjustable difficulty to match your skills. Play as many battles as you like, and keep track of your tactical skills in the overall battle statistics. Defeat the enemy in a ‘classic’ 40 v/s 40 battle game, a ‘quick’ 16 v/s 16 battle or play a full Stratego campaign. Attack and Defend your army and nation in this tactical war game and become a true hero in battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rzeizp9ajurqhhfxyvck.jpg'),(9062,'Torn',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Join an all-out sci-fi vehicular warfare using all possible variations of battle technologies including robots, tanks, wheeled machines, hovers mounted with deadly weapons that can be combined in hundreds of different ways.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lu3.jpg'),(9063,'Red Supreme','2025-03-28','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The world ends in three days, and you, as a devoted cultist, must bring a new member to the cult. Find a balance between the cult, relationships, and job.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lt9.jpg'),(9064,'Pokémon Emerald Horizons','2023-07-16','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Advance','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o3h.jpg'),(9065,'Front Defense Heroes','2019-05-15','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Front Defense: Heroes, the newest update to Fantahorn’s smash hit Front Defense, brings teammates together with you to most fierce war in human history -World War II.\nFront Defense: Heroes is a multiplayer VR shooting game set in WWII and can support up to 5 VS 5 online battle.\nFront Defense: Heroes delivers the most immersive war experience, using classic WWII weapons in life-like battlefield atmospheres.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zzk.jpg'),(9066,'Nightmare SuperHighway','2024-07-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A surreal exploration game about being alone in a bright, colorful city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k6b.jpg'),(9067,'Rocket League: Season 8','2022-09-07','Racing, Sport, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','It\'s time to take it outside!\nFar from the bright lights of Utopia Coliseum, the dynamic neighborhood of Sovereign Heights is home to an underground Soccar scene like no other. While crews of tuner cars compete for street cred, local garages work through the night, beautifying the block with vibrant custom rides.\n\nDive into the Sovereign Heights Arena, play through a gritty new Rocket Pass, and unlock the classic Honda Civic Type R in Season 8 starting September 7!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69eb.jpg'),(9068,'Backrooms: Partygoers','2024-10-29','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Backrooms: Partygoers is a backrooms horror game based on Level 0 where you play as a researcher tasked to find anomalies inside the backrooms. You are equip with devices that can beep whenever an anomaly is near, where the partygoers roam and can hear you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91gr.jpg'),(9069,'Car Tune: Project','2020-02-20','Racing, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Project Car Tune its a racing game that sets you on building & tuning your vehicles for entry-level motorsports & street racing. It\'s an ambitious project that welcomes all lovers of the automotive tuning scene and avid fans of racing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co200s.jpg'),(9070,'Pussy Password',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9071,'Island Sky',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9072,'Hayami-Chan 3','2021-10-13','Point-and-click, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short visual novel/point & click game about someone who downloads the wrong anime from the web.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4pyf.jpg'),(9073,'Ankabar','2004-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Akanbar is a text-based online Role Playing Game, a land of magic, mystery and fantasy where you the player help to weave the ever changing storyline.\n\nAkanbar is an online fantasy role playing game created by a team of developers who have spent much of their lives both playing and creating role playing worlds. What we have aimed to create is the best of the best. A land that is constantly evolving and cared for by its creators.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w8h.jpg'),(9074,'Sins of a Solar Empire: Ultimate Edition',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t76.jpg'),(9075,'Bai Qu: Hundreds of Melodies','2021-07-09','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','While visiting his sick father, college student Wei Qiuwu accidentally encountered a girl playing a concertina. Though unlikely at first, Wei Qiuwu becomes a good friend of Li Jiayun, the musician. Both of them act as an indispensable tune in each other\'s life. Until one day someone unveils to Wei Qiuwu the cruel truth hidden under a fairy-tale cover…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co667h.jpg'),(9076,'Tantei Jinguuji Saburou: Kiken na Futari','1988-12-09','Visual Novel','Family Computer Disk System','Tantei Jinguuji Saburou: Kiken na Futari is the third game in the Jinguuji Saburo series, known in the West as Jake Hunter. It was originally released across two Famicom Disk System disks, the second of which went on sale several months after the first. The game was eventually localized, as part of the Jake Hunter: Detective Chronicles DS compilation of his early cases, as Jake Hunter: Crash and Burn.\n\nIn this game Detective Jinguuji Saburo/Jake Hunter must solve the mystery behind a sudden death during a motorcycle race. The intrigue is deepened when the body recovered is actually of a different racer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65s8.jpg'),(9077,'Jumpman Junior','1984-12-31','Platform','ColecoVision, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX','Jumpman Junior is the sequel to Jumpman and features similar gameplay with all new levels. As Jumpman, your goal is to disarm all of the bombs on the level before time runs out. Each level consists of a variety of platforms, ladders, and ropes you will need to jump and climb to reach the bombs. To make the game more challenging, a bullet will fire on the screen from time to time which will cause Jumpman to lose a life if hit. Each level has a different theme to it, and a few also have additional dangers as well. You will encounter deadly fires, the bouncing hellstones, moving ladders, disappearing platforms, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h0c.jpg'),(9078,'Key Defence','2019-08-31','Puzzle','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Key Defence is a tower defence game. However, you can\'t place any towers; instead you control were the path will be. Your task is to create the path in such a way that the towers can kill all of the enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qfh.jpg'),(9079,'NinNinDays 2',NULL,'Adventure, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ziz.jpg'),(9080,'Falcon 4.0: Allied Force','2005-06-28','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Falcon 4.0: Allied Force (F4AF) is an F-16 based combat flight simulator released by Lead Pursuit on 28 June 2005. The game is based around a realistic simulation of the Block 50/52 F-16 Fighting Falcon in a series of missions in the Balkans. The game engine is based on the source code of the original 1998 Falcon 4.0 from MicroProse, and consists largely of a collection of improvements from the official patches and extensive Falcon modding community. Allied Force also introduced several major new features and significant improvements in realism and stability.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/p6kujto8yh6weendwnl2.jpg'),(9081,'Snake Rattle \'n\' Roll','1994-12-31','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Snake Rattle N Roll features two snakes, Rattle and Roll, as they make their way through eleven 3D isometric levels. The object is to navigate the obstacles in each level and eat enough \"Nibbley Pibbleys\" to ring a weigh-in bell located in the level, which will allow the snakes to exit. The game can be played by a single player or by two players simultaneously.\n\nIt was later re released as part of Rare Replay collection on Xbox One.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wgd.jpg'),(9082,'Famicom Grand Prix II: 3D Hot Rally','1988-04-14','Racing','Family Computer Disk System','Famicom Grand Prix II: 3D Hot Rally is the sequel to Famicom Grand Prix: F-1 Race, although the two games are very different. In a departure from its predecessor, Famicom Grand Prix II features a behind-the-car view. Rather than consisting of a handful of short tracks, 3D Hot Rally provides three long tracks consisting of a variety of different terrain types giving the feel of an actual rally race. As the name implies, the game allows you to use the Famicom 3D System glasses to give the race a real feeling of depth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ymo.jpg'),(9083,'Forestry 2017 - The Simulation','2016-10-28','Simulator','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Forestry 2017 – This Simulation takes you to the forest! Take over the tasks of a professional woodcutter and enjoy working in the woods. Control huge machinery, fell the trees, arrange the timber and comb through your wood. Sell the wood, several products and earn money to expand your company.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30dw.jpg'),(9084,'Zombie Wars: Invasion','2016-01-14','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','If you like tower defense games , this game is for you ! A game is classic addictive tower defense / defense TD, style game and a lot of features.  \nYou can build towers, you can use abilities(bombs and soldiers) and you can use hero !','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9085,'Princess Lover!: Eternal Love for my Lady',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Kobayashi Teppei was an ordinary student, but that suddenly changed when he lost both of his parents in an accident. His grandfather, Arima Isshin, appears in front of him and demands he be the successor to his famed family which has influence over the entirety of Japan\'s economy.\n\nAn aristocratic life begins for him that he’s only heard about in stories.\nA gorgeous house, outstanding servants.\nAnd life at the richest school in Japan, “Syuuhou Academy.”\nEverything is different from before and he is still troubled with his daily life.\n\nThere he meets the elegant ladies:\n\nCharlotte, the self-centered cat like princess of another country.\nSilvia, the serious minded successor of an aristocratic family who carries the blood of a knight.\nSeika, a member of a social club that only a chosen few can join, a fashion model and designer, she doesn’t like to lose.\nAnd Yuu, his devoted personal maid.\n\nHe ends up being part of his school\'s society club that which only a chosen few people can join. Who will Teppei choose to dance with at the ball held by the school society club? Arima Teppei’s trial to become an established gentleman has just begun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65dd.jpg'),(9086,'Ignisia','2025-01-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immerse yourself in an exciting journey, explore the vast expanses of Ignisia, where magic, adventure, and powerful enemies await you. Discover an amazing world, uncover ancient secrets, and unite with friends to protect it from the looming threat. Perhaps in the future, you’ll find discoveries you never even imagined…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a57.jpg'),(9087,'Forza Horizon 5: Fast X Car Pack','2023-12-05','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This blockbuster DLC includes iconic vehicles like the 1970 Dodge Charger, 1966 Chevrolet Impala Super Sport, 1973 Datsun 240Z, 2022 Dodge Charger SRT Hellcat Redeye Widebody, and the 2022 Flip Car 2.0 to drive and race in the Horizon Festival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90i0.jpg'),(9088,'Blood Omen 2: Legacy of Kain','2002-03-29','Adventure','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Blood Omen 2, the second instalment in the Legacy of Kain Series, is a 3rd person 3D action/combat game in which you assume the role of the vampire Kain. A compelling story takes you through huge, lushly detailed 3D environments and challenges your skills in combat, puzzle solving, stealth and exploration. With each success, you’ll gain new dark gifts that will grant Kain the ability to access treacherous new areas to explore and the power to face stronger, more aggressive enemies. As you develop a stronger, more skilled vampire, you’ll be rewarded with dozens of dazzling in-game cinematic sequences that unfold the continuing epic of Nosgoth, and Kain’s attempts to ultimately rule over it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gy4.jpg'),(9089,'Code: Realize - Future Blessings','2020-04-23','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','The romance(s) continue in a second game of Code: Realize series. Experience new scenarios taking place after the main story as well as more in-depth looks at events that happened in the shadows of Cardia’s previous adventures. Further your relationships with the charming literary figures of the first game. Choose to deepen the connection with your previous beau, or explore exciting new relationships with gentlemen you bypassed the first time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lz5.jpg'),(9090,'Hyperspace Dogfights','2017-03-24','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hyperspace Dogfights is a juicy jet-combat roguelike in which you blast, dodge and slice your way through masses of technologically inferior enemies. During the mission your craft will evolve into something stronger and weirder by gathering some of the 200+ items available ingame.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jlx.jpg'),(9091,'Amarillo\'s Butt Slapper','2024-10-05','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slap it. Turn it. Slap it again. This incredible simulation of the human butt will leave you dizzy with all that bounce. It\'s an autoclicker, but instead of click, it slap. Way better imo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xnt.jpg'),(9092,'The Terminator','1993-04-01','Shooter, Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','The SNES game based on James Cameron\'s classic 1984 film is an action game where the player takes the role of Kyle Reese, sent from the future to protect Sarah Connor from the Terminator.\n\nThe game has two kinds of levels: in several scrolling platform levels, Reese runs and jumps, shooting at Terminators (in the future war level that begins the game), street punks or policemen.\n\nThe film\'s chase scenes are recreated in two driving sequences. Viewed from behind, Reese and Sarah must escape the Terminator\'s pursuit in their car, dodging incoming traffic and avoiding the Terminator\'s fire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98ui.jpg'),(9093,'Artificial Iridescence','2019-08-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','a short visual novel about marriage and sanity \'Artificial Iridescence\' is a free standalone visual novel game that introduces new characters to the AppSir Universe. The events in this game will have long term consequences for the AppSir lore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co584o.jpg'),(9094,'Saikin Koi Shiteru?','2009-07-30','Visual Novel','Nintendo DS','Saikin Koi Shiteru? is an otome game, developed by Microvision and published by D3Publisher, which was released in Japan in 2009.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4w4g.jpg'),(9095,'Jaleco Collection: Vol.1',NULL,'Sin género','PlayStation','Seven Jaleco games collected for PlayStation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hzclgflbekvmqueoio0d.jpg'),(9096,'TouHou Koishi\'s Enchanted Woods','2025-04-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','「TouHou Koishi\'s Enchanted Woods」 is a Touhou fangame.This is a \"reverse-construction\" action rogue-lite.Koishi vs. Kokoro! But as the playable character, Koishi uses various enhancement cards to continuously strengthen Kokoro. Can she ultimately defeat the Kokoro she has built up herself?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gdj.jpg'),(9097,'Assassin\'s Creed II','2009-12-03','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox 360','Discover an intriguing and epic story of power, revenge and conspiracy set during a pivotal moment in history: the Italian Renaissance.\nExperience the freedom and immersion of an all new open world and mission structure with settings such as the rooftops and canals of beautiful Venice. Your options in combat, assassination and escape are vast, with many new weapons, settings and gameplay elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rcf.jpg'),(9098,'A Tale of Paper','2020-10-14','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You play as Paperboy, an origami figure that mysteriously comes to life and now it must embark a journey to fulfill the dream of your creator.\n\nFace the dangers that surround you in this world that is completely unknown to you.\n\nYou will find iconic enemies like roombas and or a giant spider. The environment will also be a part in this dangerous world with such things as water creating interesting obstacles for our character and the fact that you cannot attack will make you approach dangerous situations in a wiser way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t5a.jpg'),(9099,'Trilogi Keluarga Bahagia Side Story: Sulastri Si Tukang Jamu','2021-12-04','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sulastri hasn\'t paid the tuition fee yet.\nHowever, he did not have enough money to pay, considering that his mother could not sell herbs because of illness.\nBecause of Mrs. Jamilah\'s kindness, Sulastri was given an additional 6 months deadline.\nWill Sulastri be able to pay off her tuition fees after selling herbs to replace her mother for 6 months?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8woz.jpg'),(9100,'Horror Royale','2021-07-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Horror Royale is a split-screen and online multiplayer psychological horror game that involves trying to escape a level as monsters try to hunt you down and kill you. With three different game modes and five different monsters, scream and cheer with your friends as you try to survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43ct.jpg'),(9101,'Golfing in Aether: Deluxe Edition','2024-09-23','Sport, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Includes the base game and the Golfing In Aether - Deluxe Edition Upgrade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7134.jpg'),(9102,'International Racing Squirrels',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','A top-down strategy game developed by Playniac','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pd3roouijg8dhylpqewu.jpg'),(9103,'Meritous','2008-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Meritous is an independently-made PC game, a cross between a top-view dungeon crawler and a bullet-hell shoot-em-up. In it, you control main character Merit, who travels through an enormous 3000-room labyrinth, the Orcus Dome, in order to find three artifacts called the PSI Keys, and restore them to their proper locations. \n \nAlthough enemies fire copious amounts of bullets at you, you don\'t shoot back- instead, you have an attack called a PSI Circuit, which you charge up to unleash a shockwave that hits enemies and nullifies their shots. As you charge up the PSI Circuit, target reticules appear on nearby enemies, the circle indicating they\'re in range, and the cross indicating you\'ve charged up enough to damage or kill them. You can\'t just use the PSI Circuit as often as you want, though. After releasing it, there\'s a cooldown time before you can charge up again, and the longer you charge up, the longer you have to wait. Destroyed enemies leave behind PSI crystals you can use to upgrade three facets of your PSI Circuit- Circuit Charge (charge up faster), Circuit Refill (less cooldown time), and Reflect Shields. When you have at least one level in Shields, a barrier is projected around Merit, which will deflect one bullet per shield level, before having to regenerate. As you upgrade Shields, the barrier becomes bigger, then shows multiple layers as it gets stronger.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zkameytcg0na8alfswsp.jpg'),(9104,'Guardians of Greyrock: Card Pack - Summoner\'s Henge',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9105,'Fish Stick Protocol','2025-12-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gather up to 8 players and dive into chaotic procedural dimensions to collect artifacts for the Owner\'s peculiar galleries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oqd.jpg'),(9106,'I.O. Setter',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The main character, astronaut marauder, a former engineer who managed to find out about the secret station, visits the abandoned I.O. complex in search of valuable technologies for further sale. He is absolutely sure that he is the only living being on the station, and in some ways he is right…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vs7.jpg'),(9107,'Dark Souls III: The Fire Fades Edition','2017-04-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Dark Souls III: The Fire Fades Edition is a complete edition of Dark Souls III, released in April 2017. It includes the base game along with both DLC expansions: Ashes of Ariandel and The Ringed City. This edition offers the full Dark Souls III experience, combining the main game and all additional content into one package.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4990.jpg'),(9108,'You Don\'t Know Jack Television','1997-12-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','If you thought all those hours of watching TV were good for nothing, then You Don\'t Know Jack… Television! With more categories than your local cable provider, You Don\'t Know Jack Television spans over 50 years of boob-tube trivia, from Ralph Kramden to the guy on “King of Queens” who looks like Ralph Kramden. So set down the remote and put your recliner in the upright and locked position… it\'s You Don\'t Know Jack Television','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l63.jpg'),(9109,'Defect','2016-07-28','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In Defect, survive betrayal by your own creation - your own ship will be coming back to destroy you, your only hope is to build something better - this time, and every time. In Defect, mutiny is inevitable. Survive against your own creations by building the ultimate spaceship, dogfighting to get through every betrayal. With over 1 billion customisation options, this tale of space mutiny creates the experience of building your own boss - as every ship will be torn from you and become your next boss to defeat. Every spaceship creation builds a unique theme soundtrack, with an epic scale of dogfighting as a single-pilot fighter, all the way to a space station the size of a small moon. Cross-platform play and an unprecedented freedom of spaceship battle creation awaits you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a9v.jpg'),(9110,'Umbra of Fate','2018-05-01','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Like my last mapset, Shadows of The Nightmare Realm, the premise is inspired by H.P. Lovecraft. The story takes place many years before Doom 1, and revolves around a man (NOT the Doomguy) who is on vacation and is out enjoying a day of hunting while his wife and infant son are at home. After a long and boring day, he starts walking back to his car, only to discover a ravine that wasn\'t there before. Feeling an unusually strong urge to find out what lurks beyond the ravine, he jumps down into it and heads out into the dark, foggy forest night. The rest of the story is told in the level itself through additional (skippable) text.\n\nUmbra of Fate an experimental map, where I tried to push the type of gameplay that I personally enjoy to the limit rather than trying to include something for everyone. So expect an emphasis on dark, spooky areas; intense colored lighting; an emphasis on fights with a smaller number of tough enemies; a mix of Quake, Doom 64, and Doom 3 inspired map design; and interesting boss fights. It\'s also one giant level, conceptually split into four areas that are roughly equal to one level each.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rg9.jpg'),(9111,'American Truck Simulator: Farm Machinery','2023-11-30','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Saddle up drivers, because the Farm Machinery DLC for American Truck Simulator has arrived! Transport everything from trusty tractors to forage harvesters and mobile silos across scenic virtual highways and roads.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ka9.jpg'),(9112,'Marginal #4 Road to Galaxy','2017-05-25','Music, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','The story begins two years after Kataoka Yue joined the talent production company “Pythagoras Productions”. She’s worked her way up and now helps manage two of the company’s most popular groups – Marginal#4 & Lagrange Point. One day, Yue and the group members are all called into the company president’s office and introduced to a new group called “Unicorn Jr.” who will have their début at this year’s “Universe Fes”. Once the introductions are over with and everyone leaves the office, the president holds Yue back and tells her that she will be in charge of organizing a huge event called “Pythagoras ✰ All Star Fes” featuring all three groups. As she only has 6 months to prepare, the president tells her that she can only be in charge of one group at the moment and asks her to choose between the three. Which will she choose?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5r9e.jpg'),(9113,'Where Dragon Spirits','2024-04-20','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Dragon Spirits series crossover search game will keep your eyes busy. Find all the hiding Dragon Spirits. Well hand-drawn 4K scenes filled with adorable dragons. Short gameplay that won\'t take up too much of the player\'s time. Very easy to grab all achievements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8eca.jpg'),(9114,'The Nightmare Escape',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Navigate through your nightmares in this immersive first-person horror game. Explore a mysterious abandoned apartment building and unlock four unique interconnected short stories and piece together the puzzles to escape your nightmare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78zp.jpg'),(9115,'Sparklite','2019-11-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Sparklite is an action-adventure set in the whimsical and ever-changing land of Geodia. Battle foes in top-down action using an arsenal of gadgets, guns, and gear. Explore dangerous corners of the procedurally generated world, take down titans of the mining industry, and harness the power of Sparklite!\n\nKey Features\n\n• Stunning visuals - Intricate pixel art aesthetic inspired by retro classics\n\n• Original soundtrack - GameCube inspired soundtrack by composer Dale North (Wizard of Legend)\n\n• Explore the world of Sparklite - Five beautiful, procedurally generated biomes\n\n• Invent your arsenal - Invent gadgets to solve puzzles and defeat enemies\n\n• Battle bosses - Take on the Baron Mining Corp and its formidable gremlin Titans\n\n• Meet the locals - Befriend the people of Geodia and help build The Refuge\n\n• Hunt collectibles - Discover collectibles scattered throughout the world\n\n• Buddy up! - Rescue Ada’s robotic sidekick to play local assistive co-op with a friend','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z3y.jpg'),(9116,'The Legend of Heroes: Trails in the Sky - Kizuna','2018-03-05','Role-playing (RPG)','Android','A mobile game based on The Legend of Heroes: Trails series with 128 characters from the 3 Trails in the Sky games , Zero no Kiseki, Ao no Kiseki, and the 3 Trails of Cold Steel games. \nThe characters can be collected as cards with star ratings that are used in battles against monsters or other players teams.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fzj7va3i2oksjv8w5lr3.jpg'),(9117,'No Border','2025-02-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','No Border is an action-puzzle platformer where you manipulate each level borders to navigate your way through!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6u7d.jpg'),(9118,'Super Mario All-Stars: Limited Edition','2010-10-21','Platform, Arcade','Wii','Super Mario All-Stars Limited Edition is a Mario special edition pack for the Wii released as a Wii emulation of the SNES game Super Mario All-Stars. The game is a tribute to the 25th anniversary of Super Mario Bros. and includes an extra package, with a Super Mario History 1985-2010 booklet, that tells about Mario\'s history and the people who made a big effort making the Mario games, and a CD with many songs across the main series. The game itself is a unaltered emulation of Super Mario All-Stars for the Super Nintendo Entertainment System, down to showing the SNES controller in the configuration screen rather than any of the standard Wii controllers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vvc.jpg'),(9119,'Call of Duty: Ghosts','2013-11-05','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Call of Duty: Ghosts takes place following a catastrophic event that changed the global balance of powers in the world. As a result, the United States is no longer recognized as a superpower. Ten years after the event, an unseen enemy emerges as a threat, but the remnants of US special forces from every branch came together to create an elite group of soldiers known as the \"Ghosts\", who are determined to eradicate all threats to protect the weak and the remains of America.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b15.jpg'),(9120,'Trial of the Gods: Siralim CCG','2020-03-13','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Trial of the Gods is a collectible card game based in the world of Siralim. Collect over 100 creature cards with unique traits and use them to battle against the gods. Features a lengthy campaign with two difficulty modes, along with randomly generated post-game content!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2srb.jpg'),(9121,'Retro Classix 2in1 pack: Bad Dudes & Two Crude Dudes','2020-08-27','Fighting, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','BAD DUDES: \"President Ronnie has been kidnapped by the ninjas. Are you a bad enough dude to rescue Ronnie?\" The Bad Dudes must pursue the ninjas through the streets of New York City, a moving big rig truck, a large storm sewer and much more, in order to save President Ronnie.\n\nTWO CRUDE DUDES: Play one of two hulking mercenaries hired by the American government to stop the \'Big Valley\' terrorist organization. Take back control of post-apocalyptic New York City.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3t4t.jpg'),(9122,'Gleylancer & Gynoug Combo Pack',NULL,'Shooter, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','~ Gleylancer + Gynoug ~','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r49.jpg'),(9123,'Goblin Stone','2024-03-12','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Overadventuring has wiped out 90% of the goblins in the wild. Lead these goblins in a desperate struggle to reverse their fate through this turn-based RPG crafted in charming hand-drawn 2D style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vhm.jpg'),(9124,'Flash Cat','2009-01-21','Racing','Web browser, Android, iOS','Weave your feline way along trap laden courses aboard your legged craft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91t2.jpg'),(9125,'The Effective Detective','2003-09-30','Puzzle','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8780.jpg'),(9126,'Shadowbane','2005-03-25','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Shadowbane was a free fantasy role-playing video game (MMORPG) created by Wolfpack Studios and published on March 25, 2003 by Ubisoft for Windows and Mac platforms. Originally commercial and subscription-driven, Shadowbane was launched in March 2003. It closed on July 1, 2009.\n\nThe regular game took place in a dark fantasy world called Aerynth (the world will sometimes depend on the servers, many of which have unique world maps). Gameplay features many aspects typical of role-playing video games, such as experience points, character classes, and fantasy races. Character creation was fairly extensive, allowing for detailed, differentiable characters to be created.\n\n-Wikipedia','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40zi.jpg'),(9127,'Occupy Mars: Prologue','2020-08-20','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Occupy Mars: Prologue is an introduction to the world of Occupy Mars in which you have to use your brain in order to survive. The Prologue tells a separate story in a closed location and shows a sneak-peek of the full game mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co472m.jpg'),(9128,'Nirvana Pilot Yume','2022-05-20','Music, Platform, Racing, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Nirvana Pilot Yume is the cure for your ‘80s sci-fi anime nostalgia. Experience SkyRoads-inspired space races and a steamy visual novel of romance and redemption. Turn on the neon lights and raise the volume of the synthwave soundtrack: you are at home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q67.jpg'),(9129,'Tomb Raider: Anniversary','2007-10-26','Shooter, Platform, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','OnLive Game System, PlayStation 3, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Tomb Raider: Anniversary is a remake of the original Tomb Raider with a technically more advanced graphics engine. It has the same basic storyline, though some cutscenes and much of the dialogue within have been expanded or modified in other ways. Locations correspond to those of the original version and are accessed in the same order, but have been re-designed with different layouts and mostly completely different puzzles which allow implementation of new moves: swinging on ropes and using a grappling hook at specific points.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vo9.jpg'),(9130,'Wario: Master of Disguise','2016-06-09','Platform, Puzzle','Wii U, Nintendo DS','The world\'s most low-down and ornery garlic-lover never lets a get-rich quick scheme pass him by. Wario: Master of Disguise opens with our money-mad hero taking a break from being a shady software impresario to watch a TV show about a master thief. Working himself up into a lather of jealousy, Wario leaps through the screen and embarks on his own glamorous globe-trotting career as a thief.\nWith the helpful advice of a mustachioed magic wand named Goodstyle, you\'ll soon learn how to use your DS stylus to draw specific designs on Wario to give him new costumes. Break into exotic locations, from a luxury liner & watery ruins to an Egyptian pyramid, all in the hopes of grabbing as much treasure and loot as Wario can carry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5435.jpg'),(9131,'HPL: Nyarlathotep Rising','2025-02-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Deep dive into the HP Lovecraft perverted universe with this oversized narrative RPG. Slip into the intertwined souls of Mark, Anna, and Victor, surrounded by cult worshippers, as Nyarlathotep, the cosmic horror, strives to enslave humanity in 1929.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9b2x.jpg'),(9132,'Griton\'s Gravels','2006-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Based on Jungletac\'s previously-released Garden Maze.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9133,'Ultimate Fishing Simulator: Moraine Lake',NULL,'Simulator, Sport, Indie','Sin plataforma','Famous glacial lake in Canada. The lake contains numerous species of Trout and Zander. Of course, those are not the only species found here. Maybe you should find out for yourself about the secrets that are hiding in this lake?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d0w.jpg'),(9134,'Overcome','2019-02-27','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beat your inner demons without attacking them, in this extremely difficult platformer about how grief changes one\'s perception of the world. It is an expression of the developer\'s experience with cancer and heartbreak.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j3f.jpg'),(9135,'The Memories That Shape Us','2025-01-03','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Memories That Shape Us is a first-person, walking-simulator, narrative video game. Find the Memory Capsules to uncover the story of a person’s life from childhood to adulthood, all the joys, all the struggles, and all the lessons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co995g.jpg'),(9136,'Surbird','2024-03-29','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A thrilling blend of strategy, action and magic, challenging players to use their arcane abilities to protect the innocent from the forces of darkness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91p4.jpg'),(9137,'Football, Tactics & Glory: World',NULL,'Simulator, Sport, Strategy','Sin plataforma','XCOM meets Football Manager. Embark on the career of an unknown coach: tactically outsmart opponents in turn-based matches, earn money and experience, search for talented players, manage a club, build your reputation to get invited to lead the national team, and win the World Championship!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8siw.jpg'),(9138,'Super Mario All-Stars','1993-07-14','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Super Mario All-Stars is a compilation of remasters for the Super Nintendo Entertainment System. It enhances Super Mario Bros., Super Mario Bros. 2, Super Mario Bros. 3 and Super Mario Bros.: The Lost Levels with an added on-cartridge save feature, updated graphics and sound, and an additional \"battle game\" for Super Mario Bros. 3. It is also the first time that the original Japanese Super Mario Bros. 2 was released for the western public.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62ap.jpg'),(9139,'Road Roller',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9140,'Heaven Over It','2024-05-27','Platform, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The theme is to go up, and your mission is to get to heaven. It\'s a vertical scroll platformer, indie and single player action game. It is controlled using only the mouse and can be completed in a few minutes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8aaj.jpg'),(9141,'Jump Over the Age Collection',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Jump Over the Age Collection is a bundle including;\n\n- Citizen Sleeper (the game)\n- Other Waters (the game)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qdz.jpg'),(9142,'BanG Dream! Girls Band Party! for Nintendo Switch','2021-09-16','Music, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Popular rhythm game in Japan!\nTap to the rhythm of over 200 songs to choose from.\nPlay both original and cover songs from popular J-Pop artists and anime songs!\nPlay your favorite songs on a level of difficulty that suits you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3an7.jpg'),(9143,'Astro Flame: Starfighter','2023-08-15','Shooter, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Astro Flame Starfighter is a classic scrolling shooter with modern 3D graphics.\nUpgrade the systems of your spaceship, upgrade your weapons and sweep away hordes of enemies on your way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wzs.jpg'),(9144,'Anandala','2024-06-05','Indie','SteamVR','Anandala is a virtual reality art experience where you explore a vast labyrinth of ever-changing, psychoactive abstract art and interact with curious and expressive artificial-life creatures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fxn.jpg'),(9145,'Dragon Ball: Xenoverse 2 - Super Pack 4','2017-06-27','Adventure','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Keep on enhancing your DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE 2 experience with new exciting content from the \"Future Trunks Saga\" of DRAGON BALL SUPER!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52kl.jpg'),(9146,'Atelier Ayesha Plus: The Alchemist of Dusk','2014-03-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation Vita','Atelier Ayesha Plus: The Alchemist of Dusk tells the story of Ayesha Altugle, who after the death of her grandfather and the disappearance of her younger sister Nio, lives alone blending healing cures to sell in her workshop. When she sees a vision of Nio appearing near her empty grave, Ayesha, convinced she is still alive begins her search to save her. The enhanced PlayStation Vita version brings new features including dual audio, bosses from Atelier Escha & Logy: Alchemists of the Dusk Sky, new costumes, a hard mode and the Album missions which unlock exclusive costumes and gameplay features and the ability to change party members at any time. Additionally, almost all content from the original PlayStation 3 version can be carried over.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hml.jpg'),(9147,'Sonic Origins Plus','2023-06-23','Platform, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Sonic Origins Plus is an updated version of Sonic Origins that includes the Plus Expansion Pack. Unlike Sonic Mania Plus, Sonic Origins Plus can be bought digitally on PC as a single purchase like the console versions, while the base game continues to be available on it\'s own. Digital versions of Sonic Origins on all platforms can be upgraded to Plus by purchasing the Plus Expansion Pack separately.\n\nExperience the collected adventures of Sonic the Hedgehog in the newly remastered Sonic Origins Plus! With 16 legendary Sonic titles including 12 game gear games, new playable characters, modes, challenges, behind the scenes content, and more, this is the definitive way to play these classic games!\n\nSonic Origins Plus will be available as an all-in-one bundle in both digital and premium physical editions that include the Sonic Origins base game and the Plus Expansion Pack, featuring 12 Sonic Game Gear titles, playable Knuckles in Sonic CD, and for the first time ever, Amy Rose as a playable character in Sonic the Hedgehog 1, 2, Sonic 3 & Knuckles, and Sonic CD! This pack also includes previously released add-on content: Extreme Missions, Mirror Mode, new character animations, and additional backgrounds and music.\n\nThe premium physical release marks the first time any version of Sonic Origins was available on physical media. Released for Xbox One, PlayStation 4 and Switch, in addition to including the complete version of Sonic Origins Plus on a disc/cartridge it also comes packaged with a reversible cover with alternate box art, an art book and an outer sleeve.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oez.jpg'),(9148,'Arrog','2020-07-28','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Arrog is an enigmatic puzzle adventure game featuring hand-drawn art and set in a bizarre black-and-white world with color accents. The story of the game is about the journey of a man accepting his death through his dreams. Arrog is a co-production between Hermanos Magia and LEAP Game Studios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22xv.jpg'),(9149,'The Legend of Heroes: Trails into Reverie - Complete Cosmetics',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Look your best during your adventures with the Complete Cosmetics bundle and take your fashion to the next level! All the cosmetic DLC is available in one package.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q9v.jpg'),(9150,'Call of Duty: Ghosts - Onslaught','2014-02-27','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','Onslaught is a downloadable pack for Call of Duty: Ghosts. It is the first DLC to come out for Ghosts. It was released on January 28, 2014 and first on Xbox 360 and Xbox One and Febuary 27, 2014 on PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, and PC. It contains four multiplayer maps (Fog, Ignition, BayView and Containment) and Episode 1 of the Extinction story, Nightfall. It includes two bonus weapons: the Maverick assault rifle and the Maverick-A2 sniper rifle. It has a blue color scheme in the 2nd Season Pass trailer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d6w.jpg'),(9151,'Arcade Archives: Dangerous Seed','2022-02-17','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Dangerous Seed is a shooter released in 1989. You pilot the Moon Diver fighter, which is made up of α-Ship, β-Ship, and γ-Ship, to fight off the mysterious aliens. If you can keep all of your ships running through the battle, they can also combine and transform into an ultimate configuration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4moi.jpg'),(9152,'Insurgency: Sandstorm - Pilot Gear Set','2023-03-30','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Soar to victory as the maverick you are with the Pilot Gear Set for Security. This set contains five different cosmetic gear pieces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gj9.jpg'),(9153,'Cryptfall',NULL,'Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this 1-4 Player Co-Op game, gather resources, fight fierce enemies, and craft essential tools in a dynamic island adventure. Race against time to survive as an ancient evil awakens in just 10 days!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97oj.jpg'),(9154,'Debug Life','2025-03-03','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Anyone who has tried making games knows that it\'s a never-ending grind. Stop the bugs from breaking you and your project! Submitted to Nokia 3310 Jam 7.\n\nYour ammo are the dots on the laptop, while the special is the diamond meter on the laptop. Your remaining life -- the hearts, obviously.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n9o.jpg'),(9155,'Cartoon Strike','2020-03-11','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the multiplayer game Cartoon Strike, each map offers a different gaming experience. Players can enjoy a few minutes of fighting in the WWII, followed by a few minutes in the present, future or even crazy mode. Aside from the default game modes, players can experience modes like Capture the Flag or Capture the Point. The Early Access version offers you 5 maps with 5 different modes: Tounine, Arabian Night, Planet Khione, Stream Houses, and Airport.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p22.jpg'),(9156,'River Rescue','1983-12-31','Shooter, Racing, Arcade','Commodore VIC-20, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum','River Rescue is a 1982 game for the Commodore VIC-20, Commodore 64, ZX Spectrum, and Atari 8-bit family. It is one of a number of game titles produced by Thorn EMI Computer Software (later known as Creative Sparks) during 1982 and 1983. A TI-99/4A version was announced but never released.\n\nRiver Rescue is similar in concept and gameplay to the 1981 Orca arcade game River Patrol.\n\nThe player guides a boat along a river, which scrolls from right to left across the screen in a top-down view. The boat must avoid colliding with various hazards in the river - these include small islands, crocodiles and logs. The aim is to rescue explorers lost in the jungle.\n\nThe boat periodically passes a pair of docks arranged across from each other on either side of the river. If the boat moves to the upper dock, and explorer will run out of the jungle onto the boat. Stopping at the lower dock causes any explorers already on the ship walk back off to safety. Because of the scrolling motion, it is not possible to land at both docks in one go, you must pick up an explorer and then continue along the river until the dock reappears.\n\nDepending on the version and level, between three and five explorers have to be rescued to complete a round. Once the round is complete, the game starts again, faster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bwhsedlnmropnhdfkjwr.jpg'),(9157,'Fish & Dagger','2021-04-02','Adventure','Web browser','You are a secret agent. It’s the end of the world. You are cursed. You came here to rescue your partner, but the mission has taken a turn for the weird. Parody spy thriller.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z8b.jpg'),(9158,'Contingency Plan','2024-07-15','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','Take control of a capable combat frigate with your friends in Contingency Plan, a VR multiplayer co-op sci-fi spaceflight game about taking contracts and making money.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kp9.jpg'),(9159,'Hae','2019-08-03','Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pd0.jpg'),(9160,'Bloodstained: Ritual of the Night - Miriam\'s Complete Cosmetic Bundle','2024-05-16','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','Miriam’s Complete Cosmetic Bundle contains all three premium DLC cosmetic packs designed to give Miriam unique looks in the game. Fight demons in style with these stylish new looks!\n\nThe bundle includes the Succubus, Magical Girl and Japanesque cosmetic packs.\n\nEach cosmetic set includes multiple unique items that can be equipped as a set or individually. When all of the items for a set are equipped, the character’s HUD updates with a unique appearance.\n\nThe individual pieces each have their own stats and can be upgraded by crafting.\n\nSuccubus Cosmetic Set\n- Scythe (WEAPON)\n- Vampiric Wig (HEAD)\n- Vampiric Skinsuit (BODY)\n- Vampiric Wings (ACCESSORY)\n- Vampiric Choker (SCARF)\n- Dream Steal (SHARD)\n\nMagical Girl Cosmetic Set\n- Miri Scepter (WEAPON)\n- Miri Wig (HEAD)\n- Miri Dress (BODY)\n- Communicator (ACCESSORY)\n- Summon Bu-chan (SHARD)\n- Familiar: Bu-chan (FAMILIAR)\n\nJapanesque Cosmetic Set\n- Japanesque Umbrella (WEAPON)\n- Japanesque Wig (HEAD)\n- Japanesque Robe (BODY)\n- Sarashi (ACCESSORY)\n- Usagi Mask (ACCESSORY)\n- Sakura Storm (SHARD)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87ql.jpg'),(9161,'Digital Circus: Obby Parkour','2023-11-05','Platform','Web browser','Pomni is stuck in the Digital Circus and your her is to overcome many blocks and obstacles as she can to reach the finish line. Each level increases in difficulty, and you have to help her with her parkour skills to overcome all obstacles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d7t.jpg'),(9162,'Fallout: New Vegas - Dead Money','2011-02-21','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','As the victim of a raw deal you must work alongside three other captured wastelanders to recover the legendary treasure of the Sierra Madre Casino. In Dead Money, your life hangs in the balance as you face new terrain, foes, and choices. It is up to you how you play your cards in the quest to survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dt4.jpg'),(9163,'Shiny Summer','2020-09-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shiny Summer is an addicting game in which you have to solve puzzles with Lovely Girls.The game is perfect for relaxing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co411r.jpg'),(9164,'99 Levels to Hell','2013-02-26','Platform, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','99 Levels to Hell is a platform shooter with lots of guns, upgrades, magic, traps and monsters to kill. 99 Levels to Hell is a rogue-like-like, which means surviving is key and every time you play you get a new set of levels to play. When you complete 10 levels, the 10th being a boss-fight you unlock a door to the next dungeon.\n\nHidden in the darkness of the dungeons are shops, casinos and elevators. And if you search the dungeons carefully, you might find secret rooms that unlock more of the story, and free new adventurers that you can play as in your next game. Let this great combination of a platformer and a roguelike RPG suck you into its multi-leveled randomly-generated dungeon. You won\'t be back for hours!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27ts.jpg'),(9165,'Guardians of Greyrock: Card Pack - Frozen Peak Pass',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9166,'World Series Baseball','1994-06-30','Sport','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Sega CD','Sega Sports\' World Series Baseball, or simply World Series Baseball, is a sports game developed by BlueSky Software and published by Sega for the Genesis/Mega Drive. It is the first game in the series and was originally released in 1994. A Sega CD version was planned, but later cancelled.\n\nThe game was a major advancement in Sega baseball games in that it included licensed MLB players and teams (the first baseball video game to have both such licenses [previous baseball video games only had one license]; they are based on the rosters for the 1994 MLB season), and relatively accurate gameplay.\n\nSan Diego Padres broadcaster Jerry Coleman provides the play-by-play for the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3uwn.jpg'),(9167,'Mortal Kombat 4','1997-09-11','Fighting','Arcade, Nintendo 64, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation, Dreamcast','Mortal Kombat 4 is 1 vs 1 fighting game, similar to the other Mortal Kombat games, but this is first game in series with 3D characters models. The player can choose from 15 different fighters at the start (and several unlockables later on). Many fighters from earlier games in the series make a comeback (like Scorpion, Sub Zero, Liu Kang, Sonya Blade, Johnny Cage etc.) while other new fighters join in, like Shinook (who is the main evil character in this game), Fujin, Jarek, and Kai. Goro returns as a boss.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53gp.jpg'),(9168,'Divenia Episode One','2019-09-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Divenia Episode One is part of Four Episodes of a Very Dynamic Action-Adventure game with Comic Art and SciFi Story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3opf.jpg'),(9169,'Body Cam Shooter','2025-03-13','Fighting, Shooter, Strategy','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Feel the thrill of real combat, a shooter like no other!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ak9.jpg'),(9170,'Super Neptunia RPG: Party Member - Compa','2019-07-09','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9171,'Cryoloop','2020-04-19','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','You are a Chrono Agent, dispatched across space and time on sensitive missions to alter the course of history. You have arrived on board an abandoned spaceship, the only living crewmember preserved in a cryo-stasis pod, with 59 seconds until the reactor surges and fries the pod. \n \nYou have already failed twice. \n \nYour operator resets you back to the anchor point, and you try again. And again. And again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mui.jpg'),(9172,'Spellhack!!','2025-02-19','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a totally rad Spellhacker in \"SPELLHACK!!\" Collect Technospells, explore Doom City, and defend your portal against waves of Summoned Beasts in this video entertainment computer program!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87rh.jpg'),(9173,'Zodiac','2025-03-13','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lui.jpg'),(9174,'LCD, Please','2023-08-08','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Simulator, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Passport control in your pocket','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8eah.jpg'),(9175,'Stygia II: The Sisters of Stygia','2013-03-01','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Stygia has begun to change and unrest is growing in the lands of the dead. Seek out a broken goddess in a haunted district in a search for answers.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9176,'Other Life','2011-03-01','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Have you ever dreamed of being a blacksmith? An alchemist? Or even a mercenary? Then you have come to the right place.\n\nOther-Life is a community based game that allows you to affect the future of the game.Your actions and decisions along with all the other players will be used to influence the world of your Other-Life. Unlike other MMORPG\'s, Other-Life players have the ability to request & approve changes to the game as it evolves!\n\nThe Other-Life client is multi-platform using OpenGL for the 3D and graphics environment, currently available for Windows, Linux, & Mac and it works on many lower end systems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2y15.jpg'),(9177,'GatePass','2024-10-13','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 2D platformer game with strong puzzle elements. Escape the 100-level labyrinth and return home safely.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y71.jpg'),(9178,'The Adventure of Little Ralph','1999-06-03','Platform','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','The Adventure of Little Ralph is a 2D platformer. In this game the player controls Ralph, who has been turned back into a child by the evil demons who have invaded his homeland. In order to stop them and return to his former self, he must get through each area filled with enemies, traps, and many hidden routes. Ralph is armed with swords and various magic powers and also has the assistance of a small furry companion. The game\'s levels are interconnected, unlike the \"stages\" of most other platform games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a1d.jpg'),(9179,'Radio Fall','2020-05-01','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','When someone falls into a late afternoon nap, they will invariably wake to find their mind vacated of the ability to comprehend time.\n\nShort twine game about communication and loneliness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sh8.jpg'),(9180,'.Hack//G.U. Vol. 3: Redemption HD','2017-11-01','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','.Hack//G.U. Vol. 3: Redemption is the third entry in the .hack//G.U. series containing: Vol. 1: Rebirth, .hack//G.U. Vol. 2: Reminisce and .hack//G.U. Vol. 3: Redemption. As in the previous .hack games, .hack//G.U. simulates a massively multiplayer online role-playing game as the player controls a character who starts playing it. Players assume the role of a participant in a fictional game called The World. While in The World, the player controls the on-screen player character, Haseo, from a third-person person perspective (with optional first-person mode). The player may control the camera using the game controller\'s right analog stick.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49o4.jpg'),(9181,'The Crew 2: Steelbook Gold Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Take on the American motorsports scene as you explore the USA in one of the most exhilarating open worlds ever created. With a wide variety of vehicles to choose from, experience the thrill and excitement of competing across the USA as you test your skills in a wide range of disciplines.\n\nGet The Crew 2 three days early with the Gold Edition. It also features:\n• SteelBook\n• Season Pass\n• The Crew 2 Motorsports Deluxe Pack, which includes:\n• Ford F-150 Raptor Race Truck 2017\n• Abarth 500 2008 Monster Truck Editions\n• Pilatus PC-21\n• Three outfits to customize your avatar','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qfx.jpg'),(9182,'Rune Song',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Rune Song is a 2D action / adventure platformer, where you\'ll help Baba explore a vast and whimsical world in search of the fabled Rune Song.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kxg.jpg'),(9183,'Kong: The 8th Wonder of the World','2005-12-22','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Kong: The 8th Wonder of the World is an action/adventure video game developed by Ubisoft for the Nintendo Game Boy Advance. In Europe, it is known as King Kong: The Official Game of the Movie. Due to the limited technology the Game Boy Advance has, King Kong: The 8th Wonder of the World is very different from the home console versions of the game. In this game, players switch between various roles - one being the movie exhibition visiting Skull Island to do filming which comprises actress Ann Darrow, director Carl Denham and scriptwriter Jack Driscoll, and the 25 ft gorilla and king of Skull Island, King Kong. While the overhead human section focuses on puzzle-solving and adventuring elements, Kong sections are combat-oriented side-scrollers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/f17tr7xnd3wabqafyeay.jpg'),(9184,'Trauma Center: New Blood','2008-01-01','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure','Wii','Keep your hands steady and your mind focused for Trauma Center: New Blood, sequel to Trauma Center: Second Opinion. This time around there\'s a lot more on the line, as every cut of the scalpel, every pinch of the forceps, each and every second that ticks by is of the absolute greatest importance. If you think it\'s too much to handle alone, invite a friend to assist with the operation and work together to save patients from flat lining.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4dx3.jpg'),(9186,'PapiTrio',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9187,'HiveFall',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9188,'Terravale',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Multiplayer farming open world game','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9189,'Farming Simulator 22','2021-11-22','Simulator','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','Take on the role of a modern farmer! Agriculture, animal husbandry and forestry offer a huge variety of farming activities while you face the challenges of the four seasons, especially when winter sets in. Creatively build your own farm and extend your farming operations with production chains, forming an agricultural empire! Even run your farm together with friends and enjoy crossplatform multiplayer together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co494f.jpg'),(9190,'Attack the Light!','2015-04-02','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Adventure','Android, iOS, Mac','A tactical role-playing video game based on the animated TV series Steven Universe and featuring a story written by series creator Rebecca Sugar. Join Steven and the three Crystal Gems—Garnet, Amethyst, and Pearl — as they travel across five color-themed worlds. Players move across the map by swiping the touchscreen and can interact with chests, mechanisms, and hidden areas to obtain items that can either be used in battle or to open up other areas. Some areas may be inaccessible until players solve a puzzle or obtain the necessary item from another level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49p6.jpg'),(9191,'Kingdom, Dungeon, and Hero','2024-07-01','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You lead one of many kingdoms. Form armies, negotiate, trade or conquer other kingdoms. Hire heroes to explore dungeons, lead armies, govern, or go on missions. Research to increase your power. Construct buildings to improve your kingdom. Easy to learn, difficult to master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ath.jpg'),(9192,'My Coloring Book','2021-02-26','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Restore your sense of childhood magic and wonder with My Coloring Book! With this handy app, you can find plenty of drawings that will come to life, but only with your help. Thanks to an amazing variety, My Coloring Book is suitable for all from children to adults. Younger kids will love the fun cartoon drawings while parents can spend some time relaxing with complex geometric pieces (like colorful mandalas). Save your work for later and show off your artistic sense and skill to family and friends.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9193,'No Man\'s Island','2021-05-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','No Man\'s Island is an uncompromising wilderness survival game. Enter a strange and unexplored world full of strange creatures, dangers, and surprises. Gather resources to craft items and structures that match your survival style. Play your way as you unravel the mysteries of this strange land.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30lx.jpg'),(9194,'Super Neptunia RPG: Party Member - Artisan','2019-07-09','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9195,'Scrambled Egg','1983-02-06','Puzzle','Arcade','A one or two player maze game published and developed by Technos in 1983.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gjp.jpg'),(9196,'EZ-Talk: Shokyuuhen 3','2001-08-01','Quiz/Trivia','Game Boy Advance','The third entry in the EZ-Talk edutainment series for the Game Boy Advance. English phrases are spoken aloud by the character\'s family, and the user follows those directions to complete minigames and tasks','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gzj.jpg'),(9197,'ARK Park','2018-03-21','Simulator, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Engage in close encounters of primal species through a series of theme-park attractions and witness with your own eyes dinosaurs roaring in the wild.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28uc.jpg'),(9198,'Apocalypse Z: Survival','2017-07-24','Fighting, Indie','Web browser','Apocalypse Z: Survival is a free 3D FPS survival game taking place at a garden in the midst of a zombie apocalypse. The game is designed for playing in PC browser. \n \nPlayer starts with a revolver and no barricades, with a goal to survive as long as possible. \n \nZombies comes in waves every night, during a day the player has time to prepare himself for the next night battle - buy ammo, better weapons, build barricades, place robotic weapons to the garden and so on for money he collected from the zombies during previous nights. \n \nThe game is available for free to play. No in-game purchases, only ads.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yt0.jpg'),(9199,'Fusion: Genesis','2011-10-03','Shooter','Xbox 360','Spanning light-years the Fusion: Genesis universe allows you to adventure through a vast array of levels and missions. Escort imperial convoys, defend your base from invading fleets, infiltrate enemy lines or mine for rare and exotic minerals to become the wealthiest trader alive! Choose to fight epic battles in player versus player warzones, or cooperate to defend space stations from Dark Legion Raids or join other heroes to overcome the terrible guardians of the mysterious Ark.The game features dynamic missions to give it an MMO like feel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jq2smlu8ezxxx3rjvri5.jpg'),(9200,'Paranoia Place','2025-04-09','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Paranoia Place is a 2 player online co-op survival horror game. Together or alone, you will need to solve puzzles, find items and run from the bloodthirsty demonic killer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h6o.jpg'),(9201,'Guardians of Greyrock: Card Pack - Sunfall Vale',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9202,'Turbo GT',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9203,'Asterigos: Curse of the Stars - Ultimate Edition','2022-10-11','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57k7.jpg'),(9204,'YuYu Hakusho 100% Maji Battle','2018-08-27','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bxh.jpg'),(9205,'100 Bullets',NULL,'Shooter','Xbox, PlayStation 3, Wii, PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360, Game Boy Advance, Nintendo DS, PlayStation 2','Part hard-boiled crime story, part paranoid espionage thriller, 100 Bullets follows what happens when people from all walks of life meet Agent Graves, a mysterious figure who offers his \"clients\" the opportunity of a lifetime: an attache case containing the proof, the gun, and the carte blanche immunity to exact revenge on a person who\'s done them an irrevocable wrong. Based on the Brian Azzarello\'s Veritgo comic of the same name, 100 Bullets features an original story by Azzarelo himself, two playable characters, and fully interactive environments. This version of 100 Bullets was cancelled when Acclaim closed up shop, but a new game based on 100 Bullets was created for a 2007 release.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vmn.jpg'),(9206,'Space Mayhem','2019-11-11','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Designed to eliminate your free time, Space Mayhem is a fast paced, arcade score chaser with retro graphics. Collect powerups, manage your ammo, obtain massive score multipliers and blast your way through infinite, chaotic waves of enemies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2joe.jpg'),(9207,'Worms United','1996-02-02','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','This compilation includes:\n\n- Worms (base game)\n- Worms: Reinforcements (add-on)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ywj.jpg'),(9208,'Arcade Archives: TwinBee','2019-12-05','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Arcade Archives: TwinBee is a port of the shooting game TwinBee. Players will control fighters which are called TwinBee and WinBee, that Dr. Cinnamon developed, and challenge the fight to the army. There are two versions, Bubble system and ROM, in this work. Please enjoy differences of each boards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4byi.jpg'),(9209,'Path of Evil: Immortal Hunter',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9210,'Guardians of Greyrock: Card Pack - Illwater Marsh',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9211,'Guardians of Greyrock: Card Pack - Ancient Necropolis',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9212,'Abdogtion','2021-04-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Some creepy presence lurks deep in the snowy mountains. Locals have been experiencing a series of strange abductions, but none of them were brave enough to do anything. Until the day our main protagonist lost his dog. Powered by little more than his fists, he\'s determined to break through the frozen wastes into the heart of the forest just to get his best friend back.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s4p.jpg'),(9213,'Guardians of Greyrock: Card Pack - Traps And Treasure',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9214,'Love Hospital',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','\"Love Hospital\" is a comedy romance simulation game where you can enjoy sweet relationships with beautiful nurses. Experience the fun and laughter-filled romance unfolding in the hospital!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ixk.jpg'),(9215,'Enemist',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9216,'Custom Drive','2012-08-30','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','An otome game developped by Vridge. The game features customization where the player can change the heroes\' hair style, clothing, hat, glasses and accessories. The items are called \"coordinate items\" and there are various ones to collect throughout the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71fd.jpg'),(9217,'Harvest Moon: Back to Nature','2011-02-08','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Natsume\'s farm simulation series makes its debut on the PlayStation with Harvest Moon: Back to Nature. Starting out with a few rudimentary implements and very little money, you begin the arduous task of reviving your grandfather\'s farm and thereby claiming your place as its rightful heir.\n\nPlayers are given three years to achieve this goal. A year consists of four seasons, each of which lasts 30 days. Different crops can be planted each season, but before the seeds can be planted, the land must be cleared and then the soil tilled.\n\nSeeds must also be watered until the fruit or vegetable matures. Once the crops are ready for harvest, they can be placed in a shipping bin where they\'ll be collected and paid for. In addition to farming, players will interact with local villagers and partake in seasonal events such as the Tomato Festival and Fireworks Display. As more money is earned, players can expand their farm and begin to raise livestock such as chickens and cows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ubz.jpg'),(9218,'Fishing Sim World: Pro Tour - Quad Lake Pass',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9219,'Kamasutra',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9220,'I Can\'t Believe It\'s Not Gambling: GOTY Edition','2017-11-29','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you love opening loot crates, but hate the tedious gameplay sessions in between? Our marketing department has the game for you! Unbox random items! Get stuff, but not what you really want! Skate legal and ethical lines! Remember kids, its only a video game, so grab your parents credit card!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24wc.jpg'),(9221,'David Wolf: Secret Agent',NULL,'Shooter, Racing, Arcade','DOS','Bruno Vasto, a madman, has stolen the experimental SF-2 stealth fighter and threatens to blow up Washington D.C.! It\'s up to you to infiltrate Vasto\'s organization and retrieve the fighter to save the world. It\'s all in a day\'s work for David Wolf, the secret agent.\n\nDavid Wolf: Secret Agent merges digitized cinematic cutscenes with bitmap and 3D animation to create an action-based interactive movie. Four 3D action simulations are the heart of the game: HangGliding (with a machine gun mounted to the front), Sportscar driving (with a machine gun mounted to the front), Fighter Simulation (with a machine gun and a missile launcher mounted to the front), and Skydiving (no machine gun). The player follows along with the story for a few minutes, then is attacked and must outwit his opponents to live.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rj0.jpg'),(9222,'European 5-A-Side','1988-12-31','Sport','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC','Five a side football is played indoors, in a walled arena which causes the ball to rebound at an angle when fired against it. This game gives you the chance to play this, either against a friend or the computer. The action is viewed top-down, with a slight angle giving a 3D effect, which is especially noticeable when the ball is in the air. You control the player nearest to the ball, including the goalkeeper once the ball reaches the 6-yard area, and can pass or shoot from any distance. The length of the match can be altered, as can the colour of the pitch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8io6.jpg'),(9223,'Kawaii Girls',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9224,'70 Seconds! Adventure','2019-08-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','70 Seconds! Adventure - a game where you have to wander around the locations in search of a way out of here. You will have to overcome the intricate locations filled with aggressive monsters and various bosses. Choose your weapon and arm yourself with it and go to a dangerous world. Destroy aggressive bosses, find funny references and Easter eggs, meet different achivki and find new weapons. Go through an adventure that you will remember forever.\nAs you progress through the game you will find a variety of weapons:\nUpcoming for the destruction of monsters and bosses, using a variety of ordnance and tactics are not ogranichivayutsya opportunities\nAlso, you will not pass the game without meeting on the way aggressive monsters:\nMonsters in the game can meet differently, some will look like small and harmless animals, and others, on the contrary, will do everything that would destroy you.\n\nAs well as the passage of the game you will meet the Bosses:\nThis is a separate type of Monsters that have a large amount of health and special abilities. Because of the good protection and a large number of health to win them is not so easy, but with the proper skill and desire, everything is possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22hz.jpg'),(9225,'Cab Driver Commander',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9226,'Wild Woody','1995-12-31','Platform, Puzzle','Sega CD','An adventurer named Dusty returns home with an enchanted Totem Pole. Due to an assortment of rare events, the spirits of the Totem have been freed and they have created a bizarre parallel universe that can devour the world. Lowman, the \"head\" of the Totem, needs some \"muscle\" as he calls it, to bring them back. He finds a pencil on the desk and makes it come to life. The pencil tells Lowman to call him Woody, WILLLLLLLLD Woody. Lowman explains what has happened with his Totem brothers and now Woody goes into the parallel universe, dimension by dimension, and rounds up Lowman\'s Totem brothers.\n\nIn this game, you destroy your enemies by jumping on top of them and Woody can also wipe them out with his eraser. You can erase certain walls to get through them and you can also erase boxes that most of the time teleport if you press down. Other boxes contain items. You also can sketch things and they will come to life, but you can only do this twice because Woody shrinks very quickly from doing this. There are also power-ups that make you grow again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ger.jpg'),(9227,'Guardians of Infinity: To Save Kennedy','1988-11-01','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','Only one man can save time: temporal physicist Adam Cooper, inventor of a miraculous time travel machine - the Time Sphere. Issue commands to your diverse team of operatives to prevent the Assassination of Kennedy, an event that causes a time crisis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vs6.jpg'),(9228,'Factorization',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','In Factorization, you must plan and build a factory capable of producing ever more complex resources. You focus on designing optimal production lines while carefully balancing your budget. In the meantime your workers build your designs and carry out the day-to-day tasks in your factory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58z0.jpg'),(9229,'BS Spriggan Powered: Prelude','1996-05-26','Shooter','Satellaview','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wf1.jpg'),(9230,'Atomic Cards','2021-10-29','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Collect food, weapons and materials, face enemies and make difficult moral choices that will affect the gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5926.jpg'),(9231,'Cell of Empireo: Isoi Sanemitsu no Records','2019-05-03','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bxd.jpg'),(9232,'Arcade Archives: Nova 2001','2014-09-25','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Arcade Archives: Nova 2001 is a port of the shooting game Nova 2001. Players control a fighter which can shoots in all directions. And, its main purpose is to continue to defeat a variety of enemies that appear in each stage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xv4.jpg'),(9233,'Congee','2020-10-01','Simulator, Indie','Web browser','A short story about food, belonging, and seeking home. Text your friend, call your mum, and search for congee on this rainy night.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tbe.jpg'),(9234,'Nippets','2024-10-16','Puzzle','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nippets is a hidden objects game. It is inspired by the joy of people watching and telling small stories. Set in a hand-drawn, interactive city, you must open windows, pull blinds and shake treets to find items and return them to their rightful owners.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ndq.jpg'),(9235,'Jump Raven','1994-12-31','Sin género','Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/guzbkigqllxg694xfkxj.jpg'),(9236,'World of Warships: Legends - European Strength','2025-02-20','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Strengthen your Pan-European fleet with a skilled Commander! This set includes essential in-game resources and a Pan-European Commander crate, guaranteed to drop a Pan-European Commander.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fkr.jpg'),(9237,'Graveyard Spells','2022-01-10','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Graveyard Spells is a fast FPS inspired by 90\'s games, and combines elements of classic retro-shooter with low poly style. Graveyard Spells is an experience from beyond the grave.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bxz.jpg'),(9238,'Boulder Dash','1984-02-01','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','Atari 8-bit','Boulder Dash was originally released in 1984 for Atari 8-bit computers. It was developed and published by First Star Software, and spawned a series of sequels, re-releases, and spinoffs. It also did a great deal to establish and influence the mining genre of video games, which can be seen in modern games such as Minecraft, Spelunky, and Terraria.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jgs.jpg'),(9239,'Dying Light: Volkan Combat Armor Bundle','2020-10-02','Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Join Volkan Corporation’s fight for a safer future with its hi-tech spec ops gear developed specifically for exterminating zombies with maximum efficiency. This bundle includes three new weapon blueprints, a new outfit, and a new buggy paint job.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ilf.jpg'),(9240,'Forget Your Chains','2023-04-25','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Forget Your Chains is a visual psychological horror novel about the horrors of forgetting anti psychotics.\n\nPlay as Nonnie, a strange girl with schizoaffective disorder and try to make the right decisions for her survival. Explore her world, an empty home, through her eyes and mind. Interact with strange & surreal characters as you try to search for medication or try to create safety.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xjy.jpg'),(9241,'MiniBotz','2017-01-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Players take control of Robots loaded to the gears with weapons and bad attitudes. In their struggle for dominance, these robots fight one another or hordes of cockroaches, CandyCubz, and BoomCubez for control of the map. These little Botz, however, are fighting in ridiculous environments. From kitchen tables to dirty bathrooms the MiniBotz will stop at nothing to reign supreme.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qpa.jpg'),(9242,'Rat Chaos','2012-07-18','Adventure','Web browser','Rat Chaos is a 2012 stream of consciousness art and browser game created by Winter Lake.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xef.jpg'),(9243,'Third Reich',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Third Reich is an adaptation of the famous boardgame of World War II Grand Strategy. You may lead either the Axis or the Allies against a human or computer opponent. It will take several play sessions before a new player becomes completely familiar with the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/b0gm6zedz1chn9qtuux0.jpg'),(9244,'Destiny: The Taken King - Legendary Edition','2015-09-15','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Destiny: The Taken King Legendary Edition features the complete Destiny experience including The Taken King, the next great Destiny adventure, Destiny, Expansion I: The Dark Below and Expansion II: House of Wolves. Unite with 20 million Guardians in the fight to defend our universe and Become Legend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30dq.jpg'),(9245,'Gallic Wars: Battle Simulator','2021-03-28','Fighting, Simulator, Strategy, Arcade','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Gallic Wars is a Roguelike tactical strategy game. Fast gameplay, crazy rag-doll physics and challenging rouge-like approach to strategy. Fight your way through roman legions. DEPLOY your troops, PLAN their movement, use magic and items to give yourself an edge, and WIN. Features: - One of a kind approach to the strategy genre - Cartoony style - a true eye candy! - Fast gameplay - Powerful magic and mighty generals - Ragdoll physics - everyone likes ragdoll physics! - Easy to play, hard to master!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k33.jpg'),(9246,'Shit Storm','2017-12-27','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your butt is lost in space.\n\nDodge enemies and consume foods in order to survive but watch out because in space no one can hear you shit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gadfasnyq4y0tmidsxj6.jpg'),(9247,'Trinity Survivors','2024-05-02','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Choose three characters with different styles to team up and combine their skills. Experience the amazing synergy of three characters. Play two-player co-op online with a friend. Defeat hordes of orcs and achieve high scores!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x8f.jpg'),(9248,'Infinitely Up: Skip Figure',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9249,'Unwound','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lose yourself in a surreal candyland adventure about transformation and escapism. Descend into a land of weirdos and forgotten memories as you assemble a new you from whatever you find.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h28.jpg'),(9250,'Tetradome','2025-03-07','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A non-linear puzzle adventure game with 3D pixel art visuals, containing mechanical, logical, and environmental puzzles themed in a fantasy scene. Unravel the enigmas of the four elements of nature so you can free yourself from the dome!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h37.jpg'),(9251,'The Chronicle','2022-06-28','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After receiving a package in the mail, Detective Walter Miles is suddenly transported to a World War II Era newspaper building. Can you solve the mystery and escape?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mza.jpg'),(9252,'DDraceNetwork','2020-08-17','Platform, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','What started as a simple mod is now a big cooperative racing experience! Choose from hundreds of available maps, race your way to the finish line and help your friends. Collaborate and compete with players all over the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2f4u.jpg'),(9253,'Spikeout: Battle Street','2005-03-24','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox','Based on the 3D coin-on arcade title of the same name, SpikeOut: Battle Street offers a quick single-player mode that\'s about two to four hours long and each time it\'s beaten, a new character, with slightly different special attacks, opens up. There are around 10 levels, and 12 unlockable characters, and an online mode. You can connect with three other players for a four-player online bout on Xbox Live, and as a \"sort-of\" team, you then proceed to smack infinite nameless thugs into polygonal paste. The game works one way: Four humans against the computer AI. You\'ve got a punch, kick, jump, and grapple move, and when pressed multiple times, each button ignites combos. By grappling an enemy from various angles and by pressing the Dpad in different directions when executing the throw renders various satisfying hurls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4to4.jpg'),(9254,'Insurgency: Sandstorm - Biker Gear Set','2023-03-30','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This content requires the base game Insurgency: Sandstorm on Steam in order to play.Tread on your enemies with the Biker Gear Set for Insurgents. This set contains six different cosmetic gear pieces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gj7.jpg'),(9255,'Monster Energy Supercross 25 x Monster Jam Showdown: Dirt Master Edition','2025-04-07','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nhe.jpg'),(9256,'Exo-Calibre','2025-12-31','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Meet the Ex-Calibre Knights, elite pilots in state-of-the-art exo-mechs, defending peace, justice and hope across the world! The Exo-Tech corporation is dedicated to developing advanced weapons and defenses to aid humanity, but when AI drones go haywire and start attacking the populous, it’s up to you to take control of the Ex-Calibre Knights and restore order by any means necessary!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9myq.jpg'),(9257,'American Hero Unrated','2023-07-04','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nps.jpg'),(9258,'Infinitely Up 5',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9259,'Infinitely Up: Turn the Figure',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9260,'Lightning Fighter',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9261,'The Lust City 2','2024-09-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embark on an exotic quest in \"The Lust City 2\"! Lead your crew through a steamy jungle, unlocking treasures and secrets of an ancient tribe. Craft your seductive harem in a thrilling adventure that will leave you breathless. Explore the lustful depths of the jungle – where danger meets desire!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82rs.jpg'),(9262,'Dora Think Nobita\'s Exciting Brain Adventure','2023-01-26','Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Doraemon: Nobita\'s Exciting Adventure is an adventure puzzle RPG game. In order to rescue Doraemon who was accidentally imprisoned in the mysterious city, you solve graphics, puzzles, mazes and other problems along the way to defeat robot soldiers, and adventure with Nobita, Shizuka, Fat Tiger, and Suneo. The stage of the adventure is the world in the secret prop \"Game Book\". The interior of the huge castle is divided into 10 floors, and each floor consists of multiple levels. The level screen is in 3D RPG style, and robot soldiers will block Nobita and his friends wherever they go.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a2x.jpg'),(9263,'Hunkenstein',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The most fearsome monsters of classic cinema are now common household pests. You\'re the new exterminator in town. Unlicensed, of course. Shoot, crush, burn, or mulch these physics-based ghouls, then collect the check.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5grv.jpg'),(9264,'Project Carrot',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Project Carrot is a distinctive and challenging 3D platformer, inspired by beloved titles from the 90s. Players will find themselves in a secret underground world full of challenges and delightful characters that pay homage to classic platformers while offering a fresh and exciting adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j07.jpg'),(9265,'Bakken: Ski Jumping','2023-11-22','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bakken: Ski Jumping is a winter sports simulation game. To go for gold you have to jump as high as possible, you have to fly as long as possible and you mustn\'t forget the telemark landing!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e1k.jpg'),(9266,'Pay for Picture: Vol.01',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9267,'Chaos Hero',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9268,'Infinitely Up 3',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9269,'Infinitely Up',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9270,'Infinitely Up 2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9271,'Infinitely Up 4',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9272,'Valentino Rossi: The Game','2016-07-26','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Valentino Rossi: The Game allows you not only to compete in the 2016 season but also with past MotoGP champions, giving you the chance to relive the most important stages of the career of the 9 times world champion. Join Valentino Rossi’s VR|46 Riders Academy, start your debut season in Moto3 and be ready to compete in all motorsports categories Valentino will invite you to compete in.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oh0.jpg'),(9273,'Selfie : Sisters of the Amniotic Lens','2015-04-05','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The endless, halcyon days of \"Nauseous pines\" summer of love are over, the travellers and minstrels, dreamers and drug dealers have gone. It is now 198X, you wake up in a very bad situation. You were the \"Sisters of the amniotic lens\" and now it\'s time to face what you did to the minds of the naive all those years ago.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1noh.jpg'),(9274,'QUByte Classics: Tinhead','2022-10-13','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Embark in an adventure to save the stars in Tinhead','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lp7.jpg'),(9275,'Radio Free Europa','2024-08-23','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','A top-down 2.5D Spaceship shooter. Choose your ship and upgrade it as you go as you fight your way back to earth to deliver a message. Fast-paced dogfights, massive bosses, vibrant graphics, and an original soundtrack that reacts to gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lus.jpg'),(9276,'Arcade Archives: Metro-Cross','2022-08-18','Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','\"Metro-Cross\" is an action game released by NAMCO (Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.) in 1985. Avoid obstacles and slip zones, and make full use of skateboards and springboard to reach the goal in time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55tp.jpg'),(9277,'Project O.R.C.S.',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Project O.R.C.S. is a multiplayer Collaborative Storytelling RPG where you work together with your party to create characters, craft quests, and tell stories. Building upon the magic of telling a story around a table with a group of friends, and evolving that experience into the online world. You can generate and start your session within minutes rather than hours. Whether you choose the role of Guide to facilitate the group’s journey or you join as an Adventurer and craft your dream character, you and your party collaborate to play a story only limited by your imagination.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tvm.jpg'),(9278,'Two Point Hospital','2018-08-29','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Design stunning hospitals, cure peculiar illnesses and manage troublesome staff as you spread your budding healthcare organisation across Two Point County.\nBuild and customise your hospital - it is yours after all - with specialist diagnosis and treatment facilities, as well as the very latest in ornamental technology!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co235d.jpg'),(9279,'Momotaro Dentetsu Happy','1996-12-06','Strategy, Quiz/Trivia, Card & Board Game','Super Famicom','Momotaro Dentetsu Happy is a Miscellaneous game, developed by Make and published by Hudson, which was released in Japan in 1996.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xr1.jpg'),(9280,'Pathfinder: Kingmaker - Noble Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50u2.jpg'),(9281,'Ink Adventure',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9282,'Anime Girls: Highschool of Dead','2023-12-28','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Step into a world where cute meets the undead in \"Anime Girls: Highschool of Dead.\" Take on the role of an adorable high school girl braving hordes of relentless zombies and a variety of formidable enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ciw.jpg'),(9283,'Spider Solitaire 2018',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9284,'Ink Hero',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9285,'Arcade Archives: Pistol Daimyo no Bouken','2022-01-27','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Pistol Daimyo no Bouken is a shooter released by Namco in 1990. Players control the young lord Pistol Daimyo on an adventure as he battles, spirits and evildoers. His energy bullets have 3 tiers of strength, determined by how long you hold the button. Use helpful items you find along the way and triumph over the enemies before you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mgf.jpg'),(9286,'Ys I & II: Lost Ancient Kingdom','2021-03-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sharp X68000','This compilation brings both Ys: The Vanished Omens and Ys II: Ancient Ys Vanished - The Final Chapter together on the Sharp X68000 for the first time. While Ys had been released before, in a port with radically different presentation, Ys II had never before been released for the X68000. The releases in this package are brand-new ports featuring graphics and artwork based on the original PC-8801mkIISR releases.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k3v.jpg'),(9287,'Paranoid!','2004-10-24','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95k4.jpg'),(9288,'Final Crisis: Terrestrial Defense Police','1991-12-01','Shooter','PC-8800 Series','In the year 2991 AD, the Galactic Federal Government agreed to a full-scale disarmament treaty with the Andromeda nation and it looked like the galaxy would finally be at peace. However, just before the signing of the treaty, members of the military-industrial complex, who were opposed to the treaty, carried out a coup d\'état to prevent this. Colonel Iritsa Renina, commander of the Beta Unit of the Galactic Federation, refused to help the coup and ordered the rebellion to be suppressed. The object of the game is that you, the Beta Unit ace pilot Ensign Rova Trotskyna, must destroy the federal facility that was occupied in the coup.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7005.jpg'),(9289,'Grab it! Crane Game','2025-03-06','Puzzle, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Gear up for an arcade classic: the crane game!\nWin as many prizes as you can and become a crane game master!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hi0.jpg'),(9290,'Creaturing: Sea Wonders',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9291,'May\'s Mysteries: The Secret of Dragonville Remastered','2022-08-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Follow May, an independent and charismatic girl, in her quest to find her missing brother. An exciting puzzle adventure with hidden object elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hwx.jpg'),(9292,'RimFolk',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','RimFolk is a multiplayer open-world survival simulator set in a post-nuclear apocalyptic future. Explore the mysteries of the wasteland alone or with friends, craft items, build a base, hunt monsters and fight against other survivors to last another night.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j06.jpg'),(9293,'Harry Potter: Mastering Magic','2007-12-08','Puzzle','Legacy Mobile Device','Harry Potter: Mastering Magic is a collection of mini games revolving around Potter\'s main activity at Hogwarts (yes, that would be studying). The game has an interesting wrap-up where you need to play for a whole school year and pass your final exams. The game consists of the following mini games:\n\nAstronomy - memory game (connect stars to replicate a star configuration)\nHistory of Magic - quiz (Potter trivia)\nDivination - visual recognition puzzle (an object is twisted in a crystal ball, the player must choose the right object out of several similar ones)\nTransfiguration - a Tangram variant\nPotions - memory game (count ingredients)\nCare of Magical Creatures - common sense puzzle (feed the Thestral the right food)\nCharms - word game (explore a grid of letters and form a spell)\nHerbology - logic puzzle (grow plants by casting the right spells)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72e1.jpg'),(9294,'Skate 3','2010-05-11','Sport','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Skate 3 features an all-new co-op mode where teammates can complete challenges together while advancing each other’s careers. From rewarding epic bails and fails with a beefed up Hall of Meat mode to honing your craft with the all-new skate.School, players of all skill levels have multiple ways to “kill it” in the game. The franchise also continues to raise the bar for user created content with the skate.Create feature suite, an innovative toolset that empowers gamers to truly express their skate style by creating their own graphics, videos, and skate parks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1o4l.jpg'),(9295,'How to Lose One\'s Virginity','2024-04-25','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"How to Lose One\'s Virginity\" is an adult visual novel that describes the process of self-discovery... and hot beauties. Playing the role of a loser, are you able to change your life and become someone women are very fond of and build your own harem?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90c1.jpg'),(9296,'Tiny Pixels Vol. 2: Stormy Knights','2025-12-31','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Step into the armored boots of an overzealous knight as you fight across the continent rescuing princesses from monstrous captors in Stormy Knights! Strategic real-time combat ensues as you storm the halls of each castle in side-scrolling pixel art style, from medieval Europe and mystical Persia to feudal Japan and more, all accompanied by an original retro soundtrack!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9myp.jpg'),(9297,'Card Princess',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9298,'Zombie Invasion',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9299,'The Break-In','2023-07-17','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Break-In is a 4 player online co-op burglary game about sneaking into houses, museums, and bank vaults to steal everything that isn\'t bolted down. Use your profits to buy special thief equipment to help you tackle more dangerous locations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5myu.jpg'),(9300,'Casablanca ni Ai wo: Satsujinsha wa Jikuu o Koete','1986-12-31','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series, Sharp X68000, PC-8800 Series, Sharp X1, PC (Microsoft Windows), 3DO Interactive Multiplayer, MSX','In spite of its title, the game has little to do with the famous movie Casablanca beyond a few loose references. It is a text adventure with graphics, in which the player types text commands to interact with the environment. Several useful commands (including Look, Search, Take and Knock) can be accessed directly through function keys. Limited navigation between screens can be performed with directional arrows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xmz.jpg'),(9301,'Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee',NULL,'Fighting','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee is a fighting game developed and published by Pipeworks Software, Inc. for the Nintendo GameCube in 2002. The game was later released for Game Boy Advance as Godzilla: Domination!. A version for the Xbox with additional content was released in 2003. A PlayStation 2 version was planned, but later cancelled.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dz1.jpg'),(9302,'Zhouyi Six Lines Divination Game',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9303,'Legend of Mana','2021-06-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Set off on a journey to find the mystical Mana Tree seen in a dream, before discovering... the world map is empty! During your travels, you’ll acquire special artifacts; place these wherever you’d like on the map to bring towns and dungeons to life and advance the story.\n\nMeet a colorful cast of characters, square off against fearsome monsters, and explore the vast world of Fa’Diel. Not only has the music been rearranged for this remaster, you can also alternate between the new and original soundtrack. Other features have also been added, including the ability to turn off enemy encounters. The game includes \"\"Ring Ring Land\"\", a mini game never before released in the West.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2us6.jpg'),(9304,'Sonic Aural',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96hl.jpg'),(9305,'Heavy Fire: Red Shadow','2018-10-19','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Heavy Fire: Red Shadow, the next installment in the Heavy Fire series, is a non-stop action, 360° arcade-style first-person shooter… just don’t forget to breathe!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1h3o.jpg'),(9306,'Arcade Archives: Pole Position','2023-07-06','Racing, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','\"POLE POSITION\" is a racing game released by NAMCO (Bandai Namco Entertainment) in 1982.\nThe game is divided into qualifying and grand prix. If you make a lap in the qualifying round with a good time, you will advance to the grand prix.\nUse your driving technique to win the POLE POSITION!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qph.jpg'),(9307,'Casino Slot Machines','2017-12-26','Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play the best casino slots offline and experience the real thrill of Slot Machines! Casino Slot Machines offers big wins. Classic and modern slot games seen before only on real casino slot machines in the best casinos, which you can play offline right now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nxxdzhhwzdijbjo9uzol.jpg'),(9308,'Furry Girl','2019-04-27','Puzzle','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','With Furry Girl you can truly relax and experience ethereal pleasure! Help them light the fire of love and you will get unforgettable emotions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dx6.jpg'),(9309,'Jailbreak Lockdown','2018-12-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jailbreak is a fast-paced, 1v1 online game where one player tries to escape prison without getting caught. Play as either the convict or the warden and outsmart your opponent in this stealth battle game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9310,'Penumbris Doña','2024-01-10','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A pixelated, possibly horror, occasionally live-action point-and-click graphic adventure about visiting your ex','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95lx.jpg'),(9311,'Digital Revolution','2025-03-25','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a casual game that combines math and basic elimination gameplay. If you\'re confident in your math skills, give it a try! In the game, you\'ll decide the direction of all the \"blocks\" and gradually strengthen the \"Blue Legion\" to defeat the evil \"Red Legion.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h97.jpg'),(9312,'Dawn of Defiance','2024-08-15','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are the Defier, subjected to a mythic plot across ruined isles. In this Greek myth-inspired survival craft, ascend from weak soldier to god-like anti-hero. Build impressive Greek structures, craft and upgrade your gear, and face down the trials of Gods with up to 3 friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oqy.jpg'),(9313,'Railroad Operator','2018-03-08','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Let\'s operate a train that makes you feel the Showa era! Current Japanese train maneuvering is the lever type, but in the past trains were operated with a mas-con handle and a brake lever. Its operation seems to be complicated, but as you repeat playing, it will lead to the \"fun\" inherent in railroad games.\n(Showa is the era of Japan and refers to the period from December 25, 1926 to January 7, 1989)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23qr.jpg'),(9314,'Soleil Survivor',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9315,'Conduit 2','2011-04-19','Shooter','Wii','Conduit 2\'s single player mode has had many changes from the first game. Players have the ability to flip over objects such as tables, bookshelves and soda machines to use as cover, and shoot off enemy armor and helmets to expose weak spots. A sprint button has been added to allow players to charge or flee from opponents. Players can ride on vehicles in certain levels and fire weapons from them. At the beginning of levels, players can choose their weapon loadouts, and customize their character\'s appearance and ability upgrades. The use of iron sights has been implemented, and grenades explode on a timer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fgo.jpg'),(9316,'Kingdom City Drowning Ep1 - The Champion','2017-08-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter the vast chaotic depths of Kingdom City in a brand new narrative series for high-end VR headsets. Follow Brooks, James and Maika, three delinquents bound by violence, trauma and love on a journey of survival through an endless metropolis of depravity and crime.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co266i.jpg'),(9317,'Norm Aethos Real',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','The new norm sure ain\'t the same as the old norm, huh?\nWe\'re norming out right now!!\nWhat the aethos?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95wc.jpg'),(9318,'Don\'t Bleed','2018-01-19','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Don\'t Bleed is a first person multiplayer open world survival horror game where the goal is to survive and evacuate the infected island before the other stranded fifteen players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2404.jpg'),(9319,'Uncolored Boy','2016-01-27','Puzzle','iOS','A lonely and unhappy boy lost his colors, wandering aimlessly in this colorful world. If you happened to meet this Uncolored Boy, could you please be with him and help him get back his colors? Thanks for your kindness and companion, this journey will reward you in its own way.\n“Uncolored Boy” is a puzzle adventure game developed by three friends. Inspired by real life experiences, the team wanted to use simple puzzles to tell a fairytale story. In the game, the main character-who is called Uncolored Boy lost all his colors. And the player is going to help him get them back. Players can’t control Uncolored Boy. But since his behaviors follow certain rules, players can guide him by changing his surroundings. The level design is concise and challenging，providing a relaxing and immersive game experience. There are also a lot of elements to interact with; making sure the latter part of the game is still refreshing and interesting.\nAre you ready to begin a fantastic journey? Good luck and have fun!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9320,'Fallout 1.5: Resurrection','2013-10-03','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fallout 1.5: Resurrection is a total conversion mod for Fallout 2, featuring a new several dozen hours long campaign: set in the state of New Mexico, at a point between Fallout 1 and 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65rq.jpg'),(9321,'Gary Grigsby\'s World at War: A World Divided',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gary Grigsby’s World At War: A World Divided brings you to back to the dawn of the greatest and most terrible war the world has ever seen. Take command in this dynamic, turn-based strategy game of World War II that puts you in the role of some of the most legendary leaders of history. In Gary Grigsby’s World At War: A World Divided, you have complete control over the production, research and military strategy for your side.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yno.jpg'),(9322,'Ghostbusters VR',NULL,'Adventure','Meta Quest 2','Strap on your proton pack and Quest 2 and step into the world of Ghostbusters in immersive virtual reality. Start your Ghostbusters HQ in a new city, San Francisco, and solve a deep mystery across a new chapter in the Ghostbusters universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oh2.jpg'),(9323,'World of Solitaire','2020-11-06','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Card & Board Game','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A classic collection of Solitaire games featuring stunning 3D graphics, now on Nintendo Switch! Find the secret behind the cards and uncover a mysterious quest in World of Solitaire, featuring 5 classic versions: Klondike, Spider, FreeCell, Tri-Peaks, and Pyramid. Progress through the game to unlock unique card sets and backgrounds. Customize the game’s appearance with beautiful card designs, while stunning animations offer a unique and immersive playing experience. Enjoy the most popular card game ever with hours of endless entertainment in the palm of your hand!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ai9.jpg'),(9324,'Gemini Strategy Origin','2021-01-14','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Gemini Strategy: Origin is the work of TSM series. This game still adopts the way of strategy. You can get free DLC which from the publisher to active more adult content .','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4182.jpg'),(9325,'Cozy Solitaire','2024-12-10','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Classic Solitaire game, accompanied by music and kitties.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ob9.jpg'),(9326,'Worldsmith','2016-08-15','Strategy, Adventure, Visual Novel','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Worldsmith is an exciting, immersive text game. Type in commands and explore the World, solve puzzles, talk to people and play the Game of Worlds. In Worldsmith, you control the story.\n\nWith over 150,000 words of text, Worldsmith is a full, novel length, Interactive Fable.\n\nAs you explore the world of the Septem Tower, you will create solar systems and Life, unearth ancient mysteries, and discover the secrets behind the Tower and its billion year mission.\n\nWorldsmith is an Interactive Fable and is part novel, part adventure, part puzzle and part strategy game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4z6y.jpg'),(9327,'The Crew 2: Motor Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Rule the road, dominate the sea & tear up the sky with The Crew 2: Motor Edition.\n\nThe Motor Edition includes:\n- The Crew 2: SteelBook Gold Edition, including the Season Pass and a collectible SteelBook case.\n- A 11.81\" x 5.9\" specialty license plate customized to reflect the spirit of The Crew 2.\n- A 25\" x 20\" fold out road map of the game - your guide to explore the entire USA, full of activities and hidden surprises.\n- Four motorsport stickers - choose your own style between the 4 Motornation families.\n- High quality Collector Box packaging\n- Three days early access.\n- The Crew 2 Motorsports Deluxe Pack\n- Ford F-15- Raptor Race Truck 2017\n- Abarth 500 2008 Monster Truck Edition\n- Pilatus PC-21.\n- Three outfits to customize your avatar','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rnjlemkx7pnzy5wzeifv.jpg'),(9328,'Trinium Wars','2016-03-02','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Developed by Jang Wook Lee, the lead artist of Diablo III, Trinium Wars is a post-apocalyptic Sci Fi MMORPG set in the remains of Planet Earth after World War III that is now controlled by mutants.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/conwaftilzjlfo4me31s.jpg'),(9329,'Sniper Elite 5: Kraken Awakes - Mission, Weapon and Skin Pack','2023-07-06','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The final content drop for Season Pass Two delivers an incredible new mission called Kraken Awakes that brings the story of Sniper Elite 5 to a close. Shocking new Intel suggests that Project Kraken is still very much alive, and parts are being shipped to a military dock. It’s now down to you to put an end to Kraken once and for all.\nBased around an advanced aircraft carrier that is currently under construction, Karl will have to infiltrate the carrier under the cover of darkness, to stop its deployment as well as putting an end to Friedrich Vogel, who is now spearheading the project.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pp7.jpg'),(9330,'Them and Us','2021-09-28','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Them and Us is a classic, survival horror game with a focus on atmosphere and player immersion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ewo.jpg'),(9331,'Senran Kagura Burst Re:Newal - At the Seams Edition',NULL,'Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9332,'Outlanders','1988-02-21','Role-playing (RPG)','PC-8800 Series','In the midst of a violent invasion of Earth by unknown alien forces, photojournalist Wakatsuki Tetsuya comes across a scantily-clad alien woman, cutting a swath of death through the Terran ranks with her sword. After a chaotic struggle, Tetsuya is knocked unconscious, only to awaken aboard her starship. To his surprise, she turns out to be Kahm, the invaders\' princess - and she has picked Tetsuya for a starring role in her upcoming wedding. As the groom....','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99vq.jpg'),(9333,'Pearlessential',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore, prepare, and battle your way to a passing grade in this rather peculiar turn-based RPG. Engage the unfamiliar without levels or experience points. Instead, find skills, collect gear, and equip your party to assemble a perfect strategy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9luo.jpg'),(9334,'Blood Omen: Legacy of Kain','2009-09-10','Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Blood Omen: Legacy of Kain is a top-down action-adventure video game with role-playing game elements. It is the first game in the Legacy of Kain series, and the only one developed by Silicon Knights and published by Crystal Dynamics. The game was first released in 1996 for the PlayStation, and later ported to Microsoft Windows. A Sega Saturn version was announced during production but later cancelled before release. It was followed by four sequels, which were all developed by Crystal Dynamics and published by Eidos Interactive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93yt.jpg'),(9335,'Ruby Journey','2025-06-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You debark in a hamlet with only one gold in pocket, and you want to get the locals\' ruby. Get resources, do quests, unlock trading opportunities to enrich, all while discovering their lore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9luk.jpg'),(9336,'Patrician IV: Gold Edition','2010-09-17','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Patrician IV is the sequel to the historical trading simulation and strategy series. You are a merchant in northern Europe in the late Middle Ages when the Hanseatic League was flourishing. Your goal is to rise to the most successful and influential member of the Hanse, ultimately being elected Elderman, leader of the trading league. You start bargaining with common goods, build up your own production and establish a merchant fleet. Later on, you will gain more and more political influence and even found new towns.\n\nHowever, a Hanse merchant\'s life can also have its dark sides. On your way to power you have to hold your ground against fierce rivals, whom you have to fight with economic competition, price wars or impure means such as sabotage. Will you even engage in piracy?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/f3spgi2apc5gdtenko8q.jpg'),(9337,'The American War',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','The American War is a first person shooter that takes place during the Vietnam conflict. The narrative is told through comic book panels from the perspective of a US Veteran recounting his experience. The accuracy of this account is dubious, twisted by trauma and the use of military stimulants.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6cu0.jpg'),(9338,'Arcade Archives: Arabian','2020-10-08','Platform, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Arabian is an action game released by Sunsoft in 1983. Set in ancient Persia, a young Arabian boy embarks on a journey to rescue a captured princess. On ships, in caves, and in palaces... Make full use of various actions to collect the magic vases!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4id4.jpg'),(9339,'Magic Wand','2016-08-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Machine to process your sensations into trains and fields the monster people moving \'cross are getting lost and found again. An exciting capsule toy JRPG for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2szg.jpg'),(9340,'Insurgency: Sandstorm - Accolade Set Bundle','2023-03-30','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This content requires the base game Insurgency: Sandstorm on Steam in order to play.To celebrate 4 years of Sandstorm, and the incredible support from the community, get moving with the Accolade Set Bundle. Featuring premium gear and battle-worn weapon skin sets, the bundle is packed full of community-driven content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gj6.jpg'),(9341,'Evolution: From the Little Light','2025-11-18','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A small creature is born in the depths of the ocean, beginning its journey for survival in a ruthless world. Embark on a 2D adventure full of exploration and puzzles, making crucial decisions, facing dangers and discovering the hidden secrets of evolution.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c8z.jpg'),(9342,'Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition - Chronicles: Battle for Greece','2024-11-14','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Chronicles features Age of Empires II gameplay set in antiquity. In Battle for Greece, the first chapter of this multi-part saga, fight with three new ancient civilizations and experience a grand narrative campaign, from the Ionian Revolt to the Peloponnesian War.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co931d.jpg'),(9343,'Cat & Onion','2024-03-12','Adventure, Indie','Linux, Windows Phone, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A warm and whimsical cat adventure game where you climb, talk, fly and smack your way to places where no cat has ever gone before! Go on a short yet cosmic journey packed with curious characters, imaginative environments and good vibes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ue3.jpg'),(9344,'Whale Rock Games: Immersive Puzzles Bundle',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hu4.jpg'),(9345,'Techtonica','2024-11-07','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Techtonica is a first-person factory building game set beneath the surface of an alien planet. Work alone or in co-op to build factories, gather resources, research new technologies, mold the destructible terrain, establish a base of operations, and uncover long-forgotten secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6olx.jpg'),(9346,'Steel Division 2: Reinforcement Pack #5',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Brand-New commanding tools and Two new music tracks are in this fifth Free DLC for Steel Division 2!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d7r.jpg'),(9347,'Poeni Sensou: Chichuukai no Inazuma','2019-08-21','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9348,'No Place Like Home','2023-05-04','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Humanity trashed the Earth and left for Mars. Only few remained. Explore the world. Clean the environment, Craft with recycled resources. Domesticate animals. Rebuild your village. Restore environment and run your own post-apo farm as there is \'No Place Like Home\'!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4j99.jpg'),(9349,'Trainz Simulator 2009: Settle and Carlisle','2010-10-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','We take you to one of the most famous and scenic British main lines at the time of the transition from steam to diesel power. With 10 different types of locomotives and dozens of rolling stock items at your disposal you decide what train to drive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86lz.jpg'),(9350,'Citadale: The Ancestral Strain','2018-10-24','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A century of relative peace (as far as peace goes in medieval times) is about to come to a shocking end. Once again, the screams of the undead are heard in the night as they hail the return of Rhogul, Lord of Darkness and Wearer of Capes. And he has but one goal: Revenge on the Dorleac family. That would be you. \n \nAs Arion Dorleac, you will face Rhogul once more - if you can survive the terrifying traps, dastardly demons and malicious monsters he puts in your way that is. Armed with the legendary Shadow Blade, Arion sets forth to end the reign of Rhogul before it really begins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28wl.jpg'),(9351,'Total War: Warhammer III - Forge of the Chaos Dwarfs','2023-04-13','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Forge of the Chaos Dwarfs campaign pack introduces a new brutal race, the Chaos Dwarfs, into Total War: Warhammer III, in both the Realm of Chaos and Immortal Empires campaigns. Expand, exploit, and dominate the Warhammer world as Astragoth Ironhand, Drazhoath the Ashen, and Zhatan the Black.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69nt.jpg'),(9352,'Station Sabotage',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A multiplayer adventure set in the depths of space. Unravel mysteries, strategize for survival, and explore the unknown in this captivating cosmic escapade.\n\nStation Sabotage invites players into a shadowy, futuristic world of mystery and survival. Aboard a forsaken space station, teams of explorers face unknown challenges and hidden dangers. In this multiplayer adventure, strategy and cooperation are key as players encounter an array of obstacles and enigmatic threats. The heart of the game lies in its unique, suspense-filled objectives, where choices have lasting consequences on the game\'s progression and the unfolding narrative.\n\nThe game\'s immersive environment is heightened by its dynamic design, where no two playthroughs are alike, and unexpected twists keep players constantly on their toes. With a variety of roles to assume, each player\'s experience is tailored to their decisions and interactions within this treacherous space station.\n\nStation Sabotage combines elements of mystery, strategy, and survival, making each session a fresh journey into the unknown. It\'s more than just a game – it\'s an ever-evolving story waiting to be unravelled.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7o1j.jpg'),(9353,'Parawhy','2017-04-12','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95k8.jpg'),(9354,'Super Smash Bros. Ultimate: Challenger Pack 9','2021-03-04','Fighting','Nintendo Switch','Challenger Pack 9 has been revealed to be Pyra/Mythra from Xenoblade Chronicles 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60ym.jpg'),(9355,'Frostfire Planet','2020-10-14','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Frostfire Planet is a strategy game where each player builds an army of creatures that are sent out in waves against the enemy, around a small 2D world. Use your spells to change the terrain and help your creatures control key objectives. Be the last one standing in this 3 player free-for-all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ijv.jpg'),(9356,'Iron & Lead','2024-05-20','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hop in the gunner\'s seat of the Abner Jack in this first-person, arcade alley shooter set in a dieselpunk world. Fight through five chapters of relentless foes to defeat the invaders, and defend your planet. Swap between different guns, and use deployables as you battle against both ground and air.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hg7.jpg'),(9357,'Railway Empire 2: Journey To The East','2024-02-15','Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','In Railway Empire 2 – Journey to the East you’ll embark on a mission that promises unimaginable riches. Starting in Vienna, your enterprise will take you through the Carpathians and the Balkans, before finally reaching the legendary city of Constantinople.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lak.jpg'),(9358,'Thoth','2016-10-07','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','THOTH is a challenging twin-stick shooter you can conquer alone or cooperatively with a friend. Each stage is handcrafted to test coordination and puzzle-solving skills. Colorful minimalist graphics combine with an intense unnerving soundtrack, making for an exciting mix of art and arcade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mvs.jpg'),(9359,'Jump Ball','2022-10-26','Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this game you play as a ball and you have to reach to the end of the level by spin the ball.\n\nThere are many different types of obstacles in the game, such as cliffs, trap, many obstacles and moving object are on the way you need to avoid them by jumping or moving around them in order to survive, etc.\n\nThis is a very difficult challenge, you need skilled operations and constant repeated attempts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pm9.jpg'),(9360,'Discode Reverse',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9361,'Nick Jr. Play Math!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9362,'Zip Zap','1983-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','ZX Spectrum','The player controls a robot sent to an unexplored planet called Hallucinor with the job of investigating it ahead of human colonisation. When it arrives, however, it is attacked by aliens and must manoeuvre its way through the planet, avoiding or killing the aliens, gathering fuel cells to remain powered, and escaping through teleportals to move on to the next level. The robot\'s circuitry has been damaged, however, so it cannot stop moving and has only limited braking power.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22dd.jpg'),(9363,'Memoir En Code: Reissue','2016-09-21','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Memoir En Code: Reissue is an autobiographical game album. Designed to be experienced similarly to a music album, this short experimental game explores different bits of the author\'s life as a series of interactive tracks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e2f.jpg'),(9364,'Zero to Dance Hero','2024-11-21','Simulator, Sport','Nintendo Switch','Become a Dance Hero from Zero! Grab your Joy-Con controllers, and get your body moving to the beat! Learn popular hip-hop dance moves from basic to complex. But you won\'t be alone on your dancing journey. Four instructors help along the way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9221.jpg'),(9365,'Arcade Archives: Terra Cresta','2018-05-10','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Arcade Archives: Terra Cresta is a port of the shooting game Terra Cresta. Players recapture parts that have been left in the ground, to intercept the enemy in the formation attack. To aim the space devil Mandora.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x0b.jpg'),(9366,'Sand Legends','2025-03-22','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Save the princess, be the hero!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ird.jpg'),(9367,'Metal Gear Acid: Mobile 3D','2008-03-10','Strategy, Tactical','Legacy Mobile Device','3D port of PSP\'s Metal Gear Acid, with some missions and characters removed.\n\nThe Metal Gear Series sneaks its way to mobile! A plane has been hijacked by an unknown terrorist threat and it?s up to Solid Snake to infiltrate the enemy and put an end to this dangerous crisis. Get ready to experience deep tactical espionage as you plan out your strategy to infiltrate the enemy and accomplish missions in an entirely new Metal Gear game.\n\nWith atmospheric graphics and appearances by old familiar Metal Gear faces, Metal Gear Acid combines the renowned characteristics of your favourite stealth trip with a new emphasis on tactical turn-based strategy. This innovative approach lets you delve into the strategic side of warfare as differently themed card decks give you unique abilities and actions helping you to defeat the dangers lying ahead. Are you ready to accept your mission?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80m2.jpg'),(9368,'Duality','2024-06-06','Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','What started out as an attempt to flirt with a cute guy lands you in the middle of a bizarre love triangle. This could\'ve been thrilling. That is, if you weren\'t being tugged back and forth between two people, between romance and terror, between bliss and insanity. Choose wisely, \"Main Character\", for your choices might determine who gets to live and who gets to die.\n\nDuality is an erotic horror game about two unstable individuals trying to win you over through every romantic and gruesome way possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c31.jpg'),(9369,'Darkest AFK','2022-05-23','Sin género','Android','Welcome to Darkest AFK, a colorful RPG offline game with an amazing turn-based strategy adventure. With lots of mobile levels in fantasy IDLE games, this game will keep you entertained for hours. Summon a team of heroes and champions and embark on a journey among monsters and enemies in free offline games. In the RAID, you will encounter dangerous gnomes, unfriendly orcs, bands of pirates, raise elves, bloody vampires, and fiery demons! Hundreds of legendary monsters, a huge map, survival, interesting quests, and much more await you in our free RPG adventure games offline. Combat in the PvP arena with multiplayer and powerful brawls. Explore all the edges of the dungeon where you will encounter PvE role-playing offline games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76d0.jpg'),(9370,'Junkyard Fury','2021-09-30','Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You appear in what seems to be an abandoned Junkyard, you don\'t quite know how you got there... But your not alone. Try to escape the Junkyard of killer cars, if you can.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kkq.jpg'),(9371,'Disk Wars Avengers: Ultimate Heroes','2014-11-13','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Nintendo 3DS','A brawler based on the Marvel anime series Disk Wars Avengers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6cad.jpg'),(9372,'Ultra Mega Planet Battles','2025-02-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ultra Mega Planet Battles (UMPB) is an intense arcade-style, space-based, top-down, twin-stick shooter. Players can play by themselves, or with up to 3 friends local co-op or Steam Remote Play (total of 4 players). Select your character, select and modify your ship, then get shooting!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6d6h.jpg'),(9373,'Titan Quest: Atlantis','2019-05-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Play a classic Titan Quest adventure in single player or with up to 6 players in co-op. Survive the Tartarus, an endless, wave-based challenge mode. Unlock new skills, spend all your excess in-game money on random loot and enjoy graphic and QOL improvements!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h7g.jpg'),(9374,'Dollhouse','2021-10-28','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Delve deep into your mind to unravel the truth. However, beware that your own conscience is hunting you down, with a twist that allows you to see through its eyes at a deadly cost.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r8f.jpg'),(9375,'Thought Police','2017-05-01','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A neon-noir visual novel about interrogating witnesses, the latest in bio-sensor technology, and street violence. What\'s scarier than a police investigation? One where they can read your mind.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9376,'Tomb Raider: Definitive Edition','2014-01-28','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Tomb Raider: Definitive Edition is a re-release of Tomb Raider, developed by Crystal Dynamics and published by Square-Enix for the Playstation 4 and the Xbox One. The game is optimized for next-gen consoles, with the help of outside developers including United Front Games and Nixxes Software.\n\nDefinitive Edition includes several visual and game play enhancements, and is packaged with all available downloadable content for the game. The game was released on January 28th, 2014.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co268v.jpg'),(9377,'Worms: Open Warfare 2','2007-08-31','Strategy','PlayStation Portable, Nintendo DS','\"Worms: Open Warfare 2 features a ton of single player content, new multiplayer modes like Forts mode and Race mode and of course you can customize teams and schemes to your heart’s content. On Nintendo DS the gameplay takes place spread over both screens, there is full support for all wireless modes including Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection and the included landscape and flag editors are designed specifically for touch screen use.\n\nThe Nintendo DS exclusive Laboratory mode features three types of experiments; Blow, Blast and Draw. Blow asks you to guide a parachuting worm to the exit by controlling the airflow in the level, Blast sees the player making explosions on screen to blast their worm to the exit and Draw allows players to draw directly onto the landscape to save a worm from being blasted into the water.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xmh.jpg'),(9378,'Ribbiting Saga',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ribbiting Saga is a snappy SNES-inspired action-adventure game with dungeons and bosses that change based on your choices. Laugh and get your butt kicked as you hop your way through puzzle-filled dungeons! Combine all your abilities to complete challenges in interesting ways. Find hidden items and help quirky characters to get stronger. Choose your path. Save the 4 heroes. Don\'t croak!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81is.jpg'),(9379,'Arenum','1992-09-30','Sin género','Commodore C64/128/MAX','The war between the Omega and Theta galaxies cannot be resolved in favor of either of the two contenders and so it was decided to have the two best pilots of their respective armies face each other in a duel to the death. These two drivers are you and a friend of yours who will have the courage to face you. The weapon supplied for both is a starfighter with two laser cannons. The location is the boundary between the two galaxies. The hour is twelfth. You can fight each other across the entire screen and the player who hits their opponent twenty times wins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94q9.jpg'),(9380,'Persona 3: The Answer','2007-04-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 2','The Answer, also known as Episode Aegis in the Japanese version, is an epilogue of Persona 3. As The Answer is a continuation of the story of Persona 3, it is recommended to play The Journey first. Furthermore, the content of this extra scenario is mainly combat oriented and does not involve any daily life or Social Link mechanics.\n\nThe chapter is only available in one difficulty setting, which is supposed to be on par with Persona 3\'s Hard mode. The gameplay is approximately 30 hours long and has Aigis be the playable character in place of the protagonist. The story follows SEES on a new adventure involving a new dungeon, Abyss of Time, which has locked SEES in an infinite time loop within the dormitory. It also introduces a new party member named Metis, a robotic AI similar to Aigis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f80.jpg'),(9381,'Strangers on Paper','2025-02-06','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','What better place to find a muse than among strangers in a bar? In a quest for inspiration, your choices will dictate how you navigate reconnecting with people from your past and helping each other towards a better present and future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d5h.jpg'),(9382,'The Backrooms: Unseen Tapes','2024-06-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"The Backrooms: Unseen Tapes\" is a first-person survival horror game where you navigate a maze-like, ever-changing procedurally generated environment. With stealth, speed, and strategy, evade monsters and conserve limited resources to maintain your sanity and escape this nightmarish dimension.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g1k.jpg'),(9383,'Terminus Historia',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Dark fairy tale / multi-scenario system / fantastic all pixel art! In the boundary called the \"Terminus\" between human\'s world and the devil\'s world,A spectacular war between humans and demons will unfold.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r64.jpg'),(9384,'Night Rogue','2020-07-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a master thief in the dark medieval city of Riverport, a place filled with shadows, corruption, fanatical religions, subterfuge, and mystery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q5d.jpg'),(9385,'Far Cry 6: Yara Edition','2021-10-07','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Welcome to Yara, a tropical paradise frozen in time. Far Cry 6 thrusts players into a modern-day guerrilla revolution. As dictator of Yara, Anton Castillo is intent on restoring his nation back to its former glory by any means, with his son, Diego, following in his bloody footsteps. Become a guerrilla fighter and liberate Yara. The Yara Edition of Far Cry 6 includes the entire game as well as the Crock Hunter Pack DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yxt.jpg'),(9386,'Your Wife Oh','2025-01-02','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your wife. His wife. Whose wife? Everybody\'s wife! Want to raise a wife of your own? Just play with it! Wanna dance? The pas de deux kind. Just play it!Anyone who doesn\'t have a wife should report~','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s5z.jpg'),(9387,'Super Wario & The World of Wirio',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Ugh, not again! Scared to death while sleeping this year, too! Some meteor-thingy crashed into a mine nearby, and two Toads want me to check it out for \'em. I bring the meteor home, hoping I can get a bunch of hamburgers for it. But without me knowing it, it absorbs my DNA! And in the night, it creates a shadow clone of me! Luckily, the two stupid Toads are out for a walk when they see this shadow-me. They overhear his plans, and finds out he calls himself for Wirio (how original), and that he is going to return to his own world and prepare to lay our world in shadows. Oh, and that he has 5 shadow-generators or something that will protect him. And after hearing this the next morning, the Toads want me to go into Wirio\'s world and stop him, blablabla. The only reason I go, is because of treasure...and to stop that thief who stole my good looking face!\"','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9388,'Tomb Raider: The Last Revelation','2000-07-19','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable, Dreamcast','Tomb Raider IV: The Last Revelation is the fourth game of the Tomb Raider games series, it plays very similar to the previous games in the series but some new things have been added to the game. The biggest addition is that now rather large parts of the game consist of several interconnected levels sometimes explored in any order, with puzzles in one level often requiring that some actions are done in other levels. The new additions to Lara\'s arsenal are a revolver and a bow with several sets of arrows including exploding and poisonous ones.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hbt.jpg'),(9389,'English Country Tune','2011-11-25','Puzzle, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','English Country Tune is a luxuriant abstract 3D puzzle game containing more than a hundred levels situated throughout 17 worlds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j7r.jpg'),(9390,'Medieval Defenders','2014-04-11','Shooter, Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One','Defend your ancestral castle – show the invader who the master is! Build towers, save money, train your spells, and your enemy will be vanquished.\n\nThe middle ages was a dark time. Every neighbour wants to encroach on the lands you rightfully own. Don\'t give your enemies reason to think that you\'re weaker than them!\n\nDefend your castle against the incursions of your warlike neighbours! You have cannon towers, money, effective spells and your own strategic reasoning at your disposal! 40 levels of varying difficulty, unique units, and 12 types of towers and buildings. The course of the battle depends only on you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6199.jpg'),(9391,'Ship Ahoy','2018-01-10','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Frag as many other pirates vessels as possible until the time limit is reached.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9392,'Exile',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Arcade','BBC Microcomputer System, Amiga CD32, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, Amiga','Exile is a single-player action-adventure video game originally published for the Acorn Electron and BBC Micro in 1988 by Superior Software and later ported to the Commodore 64, Amiga, CD32 and Atari ST, all published by Audiogenic. Exile\'s game physics engine qualifies it to be the first game to have a complete Newtonian motion model. At the time of its release it was considered to push the boundaries of what was possible on home computers, particularly on the 8-bit platforms. It remains probably the most complex game available for the BBC Micro. The game was designed and programmed by Peter Irvin (author of Starship Command, a space shoot-em-up with an innovative control system) and Jeremy Smith (author of Thrust, a game based on cave exploration with a simpler physics model).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8iom.jpg'),(9393,'Virtual Anime Girl',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9394,'Book of Mario','2019-08-10','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo 64','Book of Mario is a text-hack of the Paper Mario (Nintendo 64) created by Fatguy703 and his fans. The text within the game is produced by oscillating translations several times (with Google Translate) to change the dialogue, creating a very different plot from the original game. The game also has a new badge added, which was only obtained via hacking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hg4.jpg'),(9395,'SpongeBob SquarePants: Plankton\'s Robotic Revenge','2013-10-22','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Wii U, Xbox 360','Plankton and his new legion of evil robots have destroyed the Krusty Krab and stolen the safe that houses the famous Krabby Patty formula! It’s up to you to locate the hidden keys for the safe before the secret is lost forever!\n\nPlay as five of your favourite characters - SpongeBob, Patrick, Sandy, Squidward and Mr. Krabbs. Switch between them as often as you’d like! Travel across lands from the show: Bikini Bottom, Rock Bottom and Dutchman\'s Triangle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uzu.jpg'),(9396,'Lemnis Gate','2021-09-28','Shooter, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Lemnis Gate presents a revolutionary new way to play a First-Person Shooter with its unique time travel gameplay mechanics. Spanned over multiple rounds, players take turns altering the future in this strategic turn-based mind-bending experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45qs.jpg'),(9397,'Wild Animal Racing','2016-03-07','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Wild Animal Racing is an exciting go-kart simulation game with a twist. Play as an elephant, a lion, a zebra, a giraffe, a rhino or a hippo! Play against the other animals or against a friend on the same PC with the split-screen mode! Or invite Steam friends in the multiplayer mode!\nRace your car around tracks in Egypt, Paris and Holland in the World Tour!\nUnlock animations to find out the secret of the animals magic powers...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6cli.jpg'),(9398,'Tiger Tank 59 I: Winter Assault MP046',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','\"Tiger Tank 59 I Winter Assault\" is a top-down shooting gameIn this game. Players need to control their tanks, through the enemy lines, break the enemy base, or defeat the enemy tanks. The DLC include map pack 046.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9399,'Ben 10: Cannonbolt Pinball - Ghostfreak\'s Revenge','2008-12-31','Pinball, Arcade','Web browser','Ghostfreak wants the world to submerge into darkness! Launch Cannonbolt into action in an all-out pinball battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oww.jpg'),(9400,'Shells Shooter',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9401,'Tony Hawk\'s Pro Skater 3','2002-03-05','Sport','Game Boy Advance','Tony Hawk returns with an all new line-up of skaters, an all new line-up of parks to crash through, and a whole new level of graphics.\n\nThe line-up of street and vert riders include Elissa Steamer, Jamie Thomas, Steve Caballero, Rune Glifberg, Geoff Rowley, Andrew Reynolds, Rodney Mullen, Eric Koston, Chad Muska, Bucky Lasek and Bam Margera from MTV\'s Jackass (and Tony Hawk, of course).\n\nThe create a skater mode returns, allowing for even further levels of options for your character, like adding glasses and tatoos to changing the colour of the knee and elbow pads or even the hair.\n\nAnd the levels themselves that you must skate through are now more interactive, with cars and humans blocking paths and making noise as you race around to make as many points as possible. Use items around the streets or the park to jump from or over to increase your score, and pull of as many wild and wacky tricks as you can.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ss5.jpg'),(9402,'Justice League Heroes','2006-10-17','Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox, PlayStation 2','Justice League Heroes is a console video game for the Xbox, PlayStation 2, Nintendo DS, and PlayStation Portable systems. It is based on DC Comics\' premier superhero team, the Justice League of America. It was developed by Snowblind Studios and published and distributed by Warner Bros. Games for all systems except Xbox which was distributed by Eidos Interactive in conjunction with DC Comics. It is based on the long-running comic book series, (as opposed to other recent Justice League games which are adaptations of other media besides the source material) and was written by veteran comic book and Justice League of America writer Dwayne McDuffie. It uses the Dark Alliance Engine.\n\nTwo handheld Justice League Heroes games were released at the same time for the GBA and Nintendo DS systems. The Nintendo DS game shares a similar visual style and gameplay mechanics to the console version, but serves as a prequel to its story. This version was developed by Sensory Sweep Studios. The GBA version is titled Justice League Heroes: The Flash and focuses primarily on The Flash. The game featured 2D sidescrolling action gameplay and a sidestory to the console game\'s plot. This version was developed by WayForward Technologies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ow4.jpg'),(9403,'Not Another Dungeon?!','2021-11-19','Strategy, Indie, Arcade, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The demonic Tower of Imalsrith has appeared on the battlefield of the Kingdom of Infantriell and the Empire of Fractile. Conquer it in this action-packed card game with rogue-lite elements!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yd2.jpg'),(9404,'Galerians: Limited Edition','1999-08-26','Sin género','PlayStation','Galerians: Limited Edition is a special edition that contains a special outer box, a visual Book, a sticker and a memory card case. It was released only in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zjy.jpg'),(9405,'Farmdale',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','No more regular farming! Get ready for the most exciting game ever! Here you will not simply plant plants and raise animals, you will be a part of a real magic adventure with other characters, an exciting plot, dangerous journeys, competitive markets and a world that keeps on growing!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9406,'Eye of Horus','1989-12-31','Platform','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','As a mystical shaman, go through a pyramid in ancient Egypt to get the magical eye of horus. In a cool twist, by pressing the up arrow you turn into a birdy and can search through the levels. Just press the down arrow and voila! Human again. Many traps try to trick you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hs9.jpg'),(9407,'Killer Instinct 2','1996-12-31','Fighting','Arcade','Killer Instinct 2 follows on from the plot line that the previous installment ended with. Eyedol\'s death at the hands of Orchid accidentally sets off a time warp, transporting some of the combatants back in time and allowing the Demon Lord Gargos to escape from Limbo. Now, trapped 2000 years in the past, the warriors that survived Killer Instinct, along with several new faces, fight for the right to face Gargos in combat, but Chief Thunder, Cinder and Riptor did not return. Each character that survived the journey from the first game has a corresponding background story, while new characters on this installment are native inhabitants of this past time period. Some fighters, like T.J. Combo who survives from the original, just want to get home. Others, like new character Tusk, want to bring an end to Gargos and his reign of evil. This time there is no tournament or prize money, just a fight to the finish with the fate of the future hanging in the balance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vdw.jpg'),(9408,'Yahari Game Demo Ore no Seishun Love-come wa Machigatteiru. Zoku','2016-10-27','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','Yahari Game demo Ore no Seishun Love Come ha Machigatteiru. Zoku is an Japanese visual novel based on the Yahari Ore no Seishun Lovecome wa Machigatte Iru. light novel franchise and its Yahari Ore no Seishun Lovecome wa Machigatte Iru. Zoku anime adaptation.\n\nThe romantic comedy revolves around an antisocial high school student named Hachiman Hikigaya with a distorted view on life and no friends or girlfriend.\n\nThe sequel will have a new feature that lets you read the mental state of the other character in order to find out about their real intentions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qza.jpg'),(9409,'God Eater Resurrection','2016-06-28','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','God Eater Resurrection is an upcoming action roleplaying game and a remake of the 2010 game God Eater Burst, which in turn was an enhanced version of the original God Eater game. The game will feature further balancing and new gameplay elements. All elements from God Eater 2 and God Eater 2 Rage Burst will be featured, and an all new \"Predator Style\" will be added. It will also add another story that will tie the stories of God Eater Burst and God Eater 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vp1.jpg'),(9410,'Simulacra 2','2019-12-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','A dead influencer. An obsessed detective. Three suspects. Piece together the truth by going through the victim’s phone messages, videos, and social media. The follow up to the critically acclaimed Simulacra. Investigate a mysterious death with the only tool you have – the victim’s phone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y4y.jpg'),(9411,'Zillion II: The Tri Formation','1987-12-13','Shooter, Platform, Racing','Sega Master System/Mark III','They\'re at it again. The dreaded Norsa Empire is back... and stronger than ever before. This time they won\'t make any mistakes. Others have tried to stop them and all have failed. The evil Baron Ricks knows you are coming. And it\'s a trap! But you\'re the galaxy\'s last hope. Can you do what\'s never been done before?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91g4.jpg'),(9412,'Gunbird for Nintendo Switch','2018-02-08','Shooter, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Who called \"Gunbird (Adventurer of the sky).\"\n\nIn the 19th century Europe, five Gunbirdss are challenging. They keep each wish to themselves and collect \"A magic mirror of Atra.\" Finally, whose wish will be granted with the power of mirror? It depends on your playing skill…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kee.jpg'),(9413,'Dragon Ball Z For Kinect','2012-10-05','Fighting','Xbox 360','Dragon Ball Z for Kinect used the unique gameplay abilities of the Kinect motion sensor to let gamers become part of the DBZ world. It features all the classic action and intensity of the Dragon Ball Z universe but with the unprecedented sense of immersion that only Kinect can deliver. Players will be able to unleash over 100 moves upon their enemies, including the legendary Kamehameha, with their very own fists as they battle their way to victory in this ultimate evolution of the unstoppable franchise.\n\nDragon Ball Z For Kinect also packs a double dose of exclusive content for Dragon Ball Z fans! The game includes the Dragon Ball Z anime episode \"Episode of Bardock\" and will feature Bardock Super Saiyan as a playable character for the first time ever in the history of Dragon Ball Z video games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co228v.jpg'),(9414,'Honey Select 2: Libido DX','2020-10-30','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The ultimate sex simulator is here! Honey Select 2: Libido Deluxe is a love letter to making love. Engage with high-quality, fully-customizable characters in every imaginable situation. From romantic candlelight sex to the most specific kinks, Honey Select is sure to satisfy you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5edm.jpg'),(9415,'Train Simulator: CR400AF Loco Add-On','2025-04-04','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get ready for some Chinese high speed, 21st-Century-style!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n57.jpg'),(9416,'Totomi Trainer',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9417,'Squad Killer','2022-07-01','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Recalling the straightforward and addictive challenge of 8-bit classics, Squad Killer puts you in control of a retro arcade experience with a little modern flair. Graphics are presented in pixelated two-tone style but offer a touch of detail, customization and precision that pushes beyond the limits of its inspirations. Adjust the color palette, choose between multiple play modes, purchase upgrades and overcome unpredictably shuffled stage order with each run!\n\nThe objective is simple – clear all enemies from the rooms you enter, obtain a key and proceed to the next level. But victory is far from certain as new types of enemies aim to end your run and a boss encounter awaits every five stages. Kill or be killed! Take each one down quickly and strategically to collect coins and buy power-ups to stack the deck in your favor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wl9.jpg'),(9418,'The Mummy: Dark Universe Stories','2017-06-30','Point-and-click, Adventure','Android, iOS','The legend of The Mummy continues in this globe trotting supernatural mystery that picks up where the movie leaves off. Choose your fate in an immersive visual tale filled with dynamic comic book style illustrations that spin you through an action-packed adventure. Unlock hidden secrets in every interactive episode as you trigger unique puzzles and uncover multiple endings. Every spellbinding turn reveals a high-stakes decision that changes the outcome of the storyline.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k7f.jpg'),(9419,'Danmaku Kentei Shiken: Ketsui-hen','2006-11-30','Shooter, Arcade','Legacy Mobile Device','How good are you at shooting games? The second entry of the danmaku test series that answers that question is finally available! This time too, you can enjoy a wide range of people from beginners to veterans. Of course, there are also bonus elements unique to the danmaku test trial ...? Face off against the weapons from Ketsui: Kizuna Jikogu Tachi!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82xq.jpg'),(9420,'Root Bear','2023-11-21','Simulator, Indie, Arcade','Playdate','You are the Root Bear serving bears their root beer. They\'re extremely picky on their pour, but they pay well. Go on, Root Bear. Achieve the Perfect Pour.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ks1.jpg'),(9421,'Northbury Grove: King\'s Comfort','2018-11-25','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Affordable rooms with a view to die for...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jxi.jpg'),(9422,'Obscure Doubt','2019-04-26','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An indie game developed using the RPG Maker MV engine. You were killed. You were erased. Can you get revenge?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9423,'Mutant Football League: Diami Krakens',NULL,'Fighting, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Sport','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tbv.jpg'),(9424,'Anthology of Fear','2023-03-17','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Anthology of Fear is the first-person psychological horror, focusing on the story and solving the secrets of the game world. The player learns three stories of heroes taking part in separate, completely unique events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r4q.jpg'),(9425,'Alter Cosmos','2018-07-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience comic book style adventure with Aliencat in a world taken over by a totalitarian system. Find a way through dangerous situations, gather your crew and prepare a ship and escape into cosmos – an infinitive space where everything is possible. Unlock the secrets of The Waves of Distortions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20rj.jpg'),(9426,'Wall Walker','2018-09-26','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wall Walker is spatial reasoning puzzle game based on constantly changing your perspective of a problem.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9427,'Hell Warders - Beta','2017-06-06','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hell is at our gates! Fight hordes of demons head-on with a team of Hell Warders, an ancient order of heroes with unique powers and abilities. Push back waves of demons with an arsenal of weapons, powerful hero skills and deployable towers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26uf.jpg'),(9428,'Police Chase','2021-03-12','Racing, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'ve done something really bad, and the cops are hot on your tail trying to capture you for it. See how long you can evade capture in this fast paced action packed game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vh6.jpg'),(9429,'EverQuest: Terror of Luclin','2021-12-07','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','EverQuest: Terror of Luclin is the twenty-eighth expansion pack to EverQuest. The story revolves around the return to the moon of Luclin, the setting of the third expansion, EverQuest: The Shadows of Luclin from 2001. A powerful force known as the Akheva led by High Priestess Aten Ha Ra emerge in an attempt to re-stablish their empire across the entirety of Luclin while the vampire lord Mayong Mistmoore also serves as a primary antagonist. Players join with a resistance of Akhevian rebels to oppose Aten\'s plans for domination. The expansion features 7 new zones as well as an increased level cap of 120, as well as new abilities, spells, and alternate advancements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h1y.jpg'),(9430,'BS Zelda no Densetsu Map 2: Dai-2-wa','1996-01-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Satellaview','The second part (week) of BS Zelda no Densetsu Map 2.\n\nBS Zelda no Densetsu was a remake of The Legend of Zelda that was released for the Satellaview attachment of the Super Nintendo Entertainment System in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40r0.jpg'),(9431,'Ara Fell: Enhanced Edition','2016-06-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ara Fell: Enhanced Edition is a 16-bit era Japanese-style RPG by Stegosoft Games. The new Enhanced Edition features a slew of upgrades, including a revamped battle system, new character classes and skills, new side quests, an overhauled UI, upgraded crafting system, new enchanting system, enhanced aspect ratios, new difficulty modes, an autosave feature and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21qt.jpg'),(9432,'Trust the blackbird','2021-02-20','Music, Puzzle, Adventure, Visual Novel','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Trust the blackbird is a hand-drawn 2d game made in a form of comics with lovely watercolour illustrations. Follow the heart-warming story about meeting new friend and following the dreams. As the story unfolds, couple of light puzzles will be on your way.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9433,'Hakuoki Reimeiroku Nagorigusa','2012-06-28','Visual Novel','PlayStation 3','Port of Hakuoki Reimeiroku for the PS3.\n\nYears before the beginning of Hakuouki, the Shinsengumi was known as the Mibu Roushigumi. A wandering young man named Ibuki Ryuunosuke falls in with the group by chance just after they first come to Kyoto, and while grudgingly making friends with the members within, witnesses the dawning era of the Shinsengumi.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c7b.jpg'),(9434,'Pixel Fodder','2015-07-20','Shooter, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Pixel Fodder is a old school platformer with a fully destructible world, a large choise of characters, incredible dynamics and gigaliters of 8-bit meat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xrnuxndkdn1fzrx9pot6.jpg'),(9435,'Fiend\'s Isle',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fiend\'s Isle is an action roguelike inspired by retro first person RPGs of the 90s. Explore procedurally generated levels, fight monsters, and uncover the secrets of the mysterious island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vdv.jpg'),(9436,'Lucky Villager',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Lucky villager - The luckiest villager goes hunting for gold! Take all the treasure from the evil leprechauns before they chop you into juicy bacon in this hardcore platformer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jn5.jpg'),(9437,'Bone Appetit','2020-05-08','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When the king declares that all food is now his, whatcha\' gonna\' do? Raise a skeleton slave to steal it back for you, of course!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2udm.jpg'),(9438,'Fresh Merchandise','2018-12-31','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fresh Merchandise is a Dungeon Crawler without Combat.\n\nThe store \"Dungeoneer Gear\" is completely out of wares! Its brave merchant has decided to get some new items alone. Trouble is... They don\'t know how to fight.\n\nYou play as the merchant and will be exploring dungeons, evading enemies, grabbing loot and escaping before things get out of hand!\n\nTo keep your shop in business, you must reach a quota of goods. However, be careful what you pick up, as the more weight you carry, the slower you move.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84rk.jpg'),(9439,'I\'ve Got Your Number','1979-02-01','Sin género','Odyssey 2 / Videopac G7000','Press 1 on the alpha-numeric keyboard.\n\nThe screen will display a giant electronic blackboard filled with orbiting numbers and symbols.\n\nPlayer 1 appears at the left side of the screen. Player 2 appears at the right side of the screen. Each player stands on a scoring box which will automatically count up each correct answer.\n\nThe left hand control unit activates the left hand player on the screen. The right hand control unit activates the player at the right hand of the screen. Push the joy stick away from you to walk your player toward the top of the screen. Pull the joy stick toward you to walk your player to the bottom of the screen. Push the joy stick left to go left. Push it right to go right.\n\nAn addition, subtraction or symbol problem will appear at the base of the screen. The answer will appear somewhere in the orbiting numbers and symbols.\n\nEach player races to the correct number or symbol with the electronic figure.\n\nWhen a player catches a correct answer, a point is scored and the solution is displayed at the bottom of the screen. A new problem will then be presented.\n\nIf a player catches an incorrect answer, he is sent back to the starting position and the incorrect number or symbol is automatically removed from the screen. This process of elimination will eventually guide the players to the correct answer through a positive learning experience.\n\nThe winner is the first player to score ten correct answers. The winner receives an electronic pat on the back and a musical salute.\n\nA new game will automatically start after each ten point round.\n\nSome correct answers will appear in the center of the orbits and will be more difficult to reach. Press the action button to lower the electronic figure\'s head to duck through the orbit without touching a wrong answer.\n\nThis game is programmed so that it may be played by children who do not yet comprehend numbers. At the first level, a child may enter a matching symbol and it will score as a correct answer. The level of play will move up as the players grow more proficient.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fbrew5nvk5qk8bzfgtzz.jpg'),(9440,'Ayakashi Gohan','2014-08-29','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','A Japanese otome visual novel by honeybee, originally released for PC then ported to Playstation Vita as \"Ayakashi Gohan ~Oomori!~\". Its sequel \"Ayakashi Gohan ~Okawari!~ was planned for a release on PlayStation Vita, but seemingly got canceled and is only available on PC.\n\nIn the corner of a certain village where ayakashi and humans coexist, there is a shop that serves meals for ayakashi. The name of this eatery is “Ponpokorin”. In that store, both ayakashi and humans visit it seeking to have a delicious meal. The shop owner is a youko (a mythological fox spirit) taking on a human form.\n\n“Everybody can be happy if they can have a delicious meal.” That was the youko’s creed. The youko and its soon-to-be 7-year-old son continue to cook delicious meals to this very day.\n\nOne day, as the hot summer ended and the harvest of autumn approached, a lone girl enters the youko’s store.\n\nFrom that moment onwards, the story begins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co689c.jpg'),(9441,'Welcome To... Chichester 1 : The Spy Of America And The Long Vacation','2019-01-30','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome To... Chichester 1 is the first of a trilogy, and is set in a semi-fictional world where secret organisations covertly battle each other for ideological supremacy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z7g.jpg'),(9442,'Super Farm','2003-10-17','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Super Farm is a party video game with a farmyard theme developed by Asobo Studio and published by Ignition Entertainment for the PlayStation 2. The game was re-released for Windows 8 in 2013 to commemorate its 10th anniversary.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v7d.jpg'),(9443,'Sweyet Dreaming Emulator the Familiar Discomfort of the Unpredictable',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Learn to live without control while solving dynamic dream scape that change through real-life blinks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9acp.jpg'),(9444,'Duke Nukem','1999-09-10','Shooter, Arcade','Game Boy Color','Duke Nukem is back in this self-titled game. Duke Nukem has become famous and because of that attracted the attention of the alien Zorgonites. The Zorgonites want to abduct Duke to let him lead their armies to conquer the universe.\n\nDuke Nukem on the Game Boy Color is a classical jump and run platform game where you can walk, shoot, jump, climb ladders, hang from ledges, crawl, but also mount vehicles such as a little tank and space ship. You have to avoid enemies and hazardous environments. Levels will bring you on board a Zorgonite spaceship, the moon, LA and other locations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xtx.jpg'),(9445,'Tales from the Borderlands: Episode 3 - Catch a Ride','2015-06-25','Point-and-click, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox 360, Xbox One','A new episodic adventure set in the badlands of Pandora. This collaborative brain child, is set after the events of Borderlands 2 and is a part of the franchise\' official lore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vcs.jpg'),(9446,'Forgotten 23',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Space station Forgotten is in a decaying orbit and engineer Max Novak is the only hope of averting catastrophe with only 23 minutes and endless time loops to spare. Navigate a dark sci-fi adventure, learn more with every loop, solve challenging problems, and uncover the dark secret of the Forgotten.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92fj.jpg'),(9447,'Overcooked! 2: Too Many Cooks','2018-06-12','Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Add-on for Overcooked 2. Add 5 more chiefs to the crew.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s76.jpg'),(9448,'MageSlayer','1997-09-30','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A millennium has passed since the stronger Mageslayer clans betrayed Lord Thane and the Clan of Knowledge. Now Lord Thane is ready to take revenge on the clans that refused to help him against the mages. He\'s gathered the relics of the StarStone and placed them under the protection of his minions. But his enemies have joined forces and sent the best warrior of each of the four remaining clans to fight back.\n\nIn this top-down 3D action game you play the role of any of the warriors chosen among the remaining clans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2y5d.jpg'),(9449,'The Inner World','2015-03-20','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Inner World is a classic-style hand-drawn Adventure game. Solve plenty of challenging puzzles with Robert and Laura in the twisted world of Asposia. Experience an atmospheric and humorous story full of bizarre characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1o15.jpg'),(9450,'Nox Aeterna: Veil of Darkness','2025-03-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','On your journey in this sometimes philosophical text adventure, discover unforgettable characters and secrets that must remain hidden from the human world forever..','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l4u.jpg'),(9451,'Voltage: Episode 2',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','In Episode 2, you try to bring freedom to Voltage and fight against evil forces as you traverse the Voltage Town, Red Forest and many other areas. Your mission is to find resistance scientists, together you might be able to bring peace to the Voltage.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9452,'Serial Lover',NULL,'Music, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A dating sim rhythm game where you seduce serial killers','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hao.jpg'),(9453,'Rise of the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Epic Mutant Missions','2019-12-31','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Web browser','Splinter\'s special items are missing! Help Raph, Donnie, Leo, and Mikey find the missing items and fight off the bad guys. In Nickelodeon\'s newest free and fun online action game, it\'s up to you to guide the turtles through different quests and challenges. Each mission allows you to earn trophies, find the missing items and explore different locations in Manhattan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yle.jpg'),(9454,'Yamamura Misa Suspense: Kyoto Ryuu no Tera Satsujin Jiken','1987-12-11','Adventure, Visual Novel','Family Computer','American investigator Catherine Turner has just been accused of a crime committed on the grounds of Kyoto\'s most famous temple and must prove her innocence by examining crime scenes, collecting evidence and talking to suspects. The first in a series of murder mystery games by Taito written by and named for Japanese mystery writer Misa Yamamura.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ept.jpg'),(9455,'Houkagou Colorful Step: Bunka-bu!','2014-04-10','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Houkagou Colorful Step: Bunka-bu! is an otome game, developed and published by honeybee+, which was released in Japan in 2014.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s83.jpg'),(9456,'Pathologic 2','2019-05-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Pathologic 2 is a narrative-driven dramatic thriller about fighting a deadly outbreak in a secluded rural town. You are a healer, and to save anyone, you\'ll have to survive in this bleak and strange world, where even food and medicine are scarce.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ndy.jpg'),(9457,'Slaughter 3: The Rebels','2020-02-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slaughter 3 is the third-person shooter with lots of guns, fun and a nit of dark humor. The single player campaign offers a threadbare story, taking the player character Russell through a bunch of levels and missions. Break through the enemies, destroying everything that moves!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pal.jpg'),(9458,'All Elite Wrestling: Fight Forever - Season Pass 3','2024-02-14','Fighting, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The AEW: Fight Forever Season Pass 3 includes access to even more AEW wrestlers, the all-new day and evening beach maps, new skins and attire options, loads of new moves and premium music tracks.\n\n- AEW: Fight Forever Swerve to the Beach\n- AEW: Fight Forever Giant Swing in the Ring\n- AEW: Fight Forever - Hayter\'s Gunna Game\n- AEW: Fight Forever Freebie for da Fans\n\nThe Season Pass 3 Content Breakdown:\n- Swerve Strickland\n- Claudio Castagloni\n- Jamie Hayter\n- Day and Evening Beach Maps\n- 33 brand new moves\n- 42 new skin and attire options\n- 11 all new music tracks','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7szr.jpg'),(9459,'Yukomon','2025-03-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The protagonist\'s life changes when their 5-year-old sister is transformed into a Yukomon. The only cure is to complete the genetic search for the 200 cataloged Yukomons, but Team T is ready to sabotage their journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9luq.jpg'),(9460,'DinoFense','2016-12-23','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Defend your Dino Village and Dinozens from being attacked by the uncivilized world! Play rescue missions on the Beach, in the Jungle, or near a Volcano by fighting off the angry cavemen and animals who imprisoned the dinosaurs. Defeat more enemies to unlock powerup items such as Dynamite to decimate your enemies, and keys to free your Dino friends. With adventure and endless modes, you can battle your way through each tier of difficulty or face wave after wave of enemies until you fail.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9461,'Heaven Studio','2024-01-15','Music','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Heaven Studio is a tool to create playable Rhythm Heaven custom remixes, with many customization options.\n\nThis title was delisted from GitHub and Itch.io per a DMCA takedown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7f2g.jpg'),(9462,'Arcade Archives: Youkai Douchuki','2022-04-27','Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','\"Youkai Douchuki\" is a side-scrolling action where players control \"Tarosuke\", a mischievous, playful boy who always troubled his village with pranks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50bb.jpg'),(9463,'Moonstone Island: Chef\'s Kiss DLC Pack','2024-07-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tyx.jpg'),(9464,'Tsukihime: A Piece of Blue Glass Moon - Limited Edition','2023-11-03','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','The Limited Edition includes Tsukihime -A Piece of Blue Glass Moon-, the Special Material Book “Tsukihime Material Ⅰ -material of blue glass moon-“ and a Collector’s Box.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8p16.jpg'),(9465,'Monster F****r One: Vampire','2018-09-27','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re a human, but you don\'t want to be. You want to be a vampire. Mooch through the darker corners of a vampire nightclub in this text-based adventure game, and do your best to get laid, get bitten, or both at the same time.\n\nMonster Fucker One: Vampire is the first instalment in a series of adult interactive fiction games featuring a range of different mythical beings. The free version includes three different encounters, and the full version gives you access to seven. There are over 30,000 words of text, and more than a dozen unique endings.\n\nIt was written by Kristan X - writer, sex nerd and (somewhat twisted) mind behind the professionally-filthy sex blog Lascivity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1h36.jpg'),(9466,'Thousand Arms','1999-09-30','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation','The game takes place on a \"steampunk\" type of world. The Dark Acolytes, a mysterious organization of cyborgs and robots, is trying to find the five legendary Sacred Flames, and bring chaos to the World in the process. Meis, a womanizing \"Spirit Blacksmith\" with the ability to make magical weapons, finds himself chosen to find the flames before the Dark Acolytes do. However, to increase the power of his weapons, Meis must have the help of a woman, and must increase his \'intimacy level\' with her by going out on dates. Along his journey, he meets a colorful cast of characters, including girls to date and allies to join his party.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bso.jpg'),(9467,'Super Metroid: Redesign - Axeil Edition','2018-08-30','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','A refreshing remake of a classic hack, with improved physics, automated/streamlined mechanics for improved accessibility, an optional hint system, rebalanced enemy damage, neat features like area nameplates, and new secrets and puzzles. Even if you know where to go from playing Redesign, or just from using the hint system, it manages to feel like a whole new game. It even has extra stats at the ending under your percentage.\n\nDrewseph has spent the last 9 years taking the criticism of Redesign to heart, and the result is Super Metroid Redesign: Axeil Edition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oda.jpg'),(9468,'Grand Chase','2007-06-01','Fighting, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','free-to-play, two-dimensional side-scrolling MMORPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uhi.jpg'),(9469,'Morbid: The Seven Acolytes','2020-12-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Morbid: The Seven Acolytes is a Horrorpunk Action RPG filled with Lovecraftian horrors and Cronenbergian gore, making it the most gruesome take on the isometric Souls-like genre yet!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29q0.jpg'),(9470,'Jake\'s Halloween Night','2021-10-29','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"It\'s October 31, follow Jake as he gets ready for a killer Halloween party.\"\n\nA short horror game inspired by old slasher movies','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58df.jpg'),(9471,'Street Fighter Anniversary Collection','2004-10-29','Fighting, Arcade','Xbox, PlayStation 2','Street Fighter Anniversary Collection includes Hyper Street Fighter II and Street Fighter III: 3rd Strike. Offering five different soundtracks, multiple voice tracks, and various different modes of play, Street Fighter Anniversary Collection also contains the full U.S. DVD version of the 1994 film, Street Fighter II: The Animated Movie in addition to adjustable gameplay rules.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ber.jpg'),(9472,'Chef Life: A Restaurant Simulator - Al Forno Edition','2023-03-28','Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Make delicious wood-fired pizzas and give your restaurant an Italian ambiance with the AL FORNO pack. Get 8 pizza recipes and a wide range of customization items to decorate your restaurant.\n\nThe Al Forno Editionof Chef Life: A Restaurant Simulator contains the base game and the following content:\n- A new type of dish to add to your restaurant menu: pizza\n- A new cooking station to make delicious pizzas: wood-fire oven\n- 8 pizza recipes (with 3 upgrade levels each): Neapolitan, vegetarian, seafood, cheese, spicy, BBQ, Hawaiian, mountain','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62un.jpg'),(9473,'Catfishing','2024-06-24','Quiz/Trivia','Web browser','Guess the Wikipedia article from its categories. Every day there are 10 notable, diverse, and interesting people, places, and things to guess.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9okr.jpg'),(9474,'Batman: Return to Arkham','2017-02-23','Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Batman: Return to Arkham sees the combination of two classic entries in the Batman: Arkham series make a return to modern consoles (PS4 and Xbox One) with improved graphics. Warner Bros. is remastering 2009’s Batman: Arkham Asylum and 2011’s Batman: Arkham City which will release in this collection package along with all of the associated DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dhj.jpg'),(9475,'Acceptance','2023-08-11','Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A story-driven psychological thriller about the horrific consequences of a loved one\'s suicide.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56vz.jpg'),(9476,'Terraforming Mars Collection',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qva.jpg'),(9477,'Japanese Rail Sim: Hakone Town of Natural Beauty and Hot Springs','2024-09-19','Simulator, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A Japanese Train Operating Simulator Featuring Real Footage!\nOperate one of Japan\'s most famous mountain railways!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s3y.jpg'),(9478,'Puzzle Pests','2017-08-28','Puzzle','iOS','Puzzle Pests is a fiendishly addictive bug-based puzzle game. The aim of Puzzle Pests is simple - clear all the fleas off the game board by blowing them up, sending them through trap doors or matching four fleas of the same color in a straight line or a square formation. But beware! New fleas are being born all the time so you have to keep up with the population growth. Puzzle Pests is packed with puzzles and challenges to keep you coming back for more. Have you got what it takes to beat the pesky fleas?\nHours and hours of insect fun. With three different game modes and cartoon-style graphics, you’ll never get tired of playing Puzzle Pests. Solve 100 puzzle levels, see if you can deal with increasingly more difficult levels in the Round Robin mode or test your mettle under time pressure.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9479,'Zagerrrr',NULL,'Racing, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Zaggerrrrrrrr, try your angles skills and keep the ball on the floor.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9480,'Nightmare Cafe VIII','2021-07-08','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o65.jpg'),(9481,'Stickman Clans','2021-03-02','Strategy','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join a thrilling campaign of tower defense battles in Stickman Clans. You can progress through the campaign and upgrade your army to be stronger, faster, and more prepared for the next fight. That fight could be online vs other players around the world, battling hordes of endless warriors in survival mode, or the next chapter\'s opponents in campaign mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wo7.jpg'),(9482,'Dark Elf Historia','2024-02-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dark Elf is an RPG from oneone1 that was released on August 3, 2017.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rr1.jpg'),(9483,'Red Dragon Rampage','2011-03-29','Point-and-click','Web browser','Defend your red companion in this Action/Defense game from the creator of Toss the Turtle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47d9.jpg'),(9484,'24H Stories: The Cabin In The Forest','2024-07-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a game about rule creepypastas. You are trapped in a cabin in the forest, and you need to find a way to leave by following the diaries and messages. How should these rules be followed? You have to figure it out yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j2s.jpg'),(9485,'Tacticalunderground Arcade','2021-10-23','Sport','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the world of shooting sports! There are tons of shooting tournaments waiting for you in the #tacticalunderground arcade! Day and night, in closed shooting ranges or on huge training grounds, take part in matches in sports and tactical disciplines.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42uo.jpg'),(9486,'Septic Savages','2016-11-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','After encountering an alien creature in a bathroom stall, one man is propelled into a never-ending quest of sewer dwelling carnage! Septic Savages is a 2D, 1 or 2-player, twin-stick shooting roguelike with loads of randomized elements and hours upon hours of gameplay.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9487,'Age of Omens','2019-07-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Age of Omens is a story-driven, multiplayer RPG created by one person, that provides it\'s players with an open-world experience in a stunning 64x64 Km surface world of mountains and ancient forests, and will eventually include (for free) an entire procedural underworld dungeon system that can be re-configured at the server host\'s discreti','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fjv.jpg'),(9488,'NuclearCraft','2014-08-19','Simulator, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','NuclearCraft is a tech mod for Minecraft focused on using nuclear power to provide energy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61fh.jpg'),(9489,'Train Sim World 2: Rush Hour - Deluxe Edition','2021-08-19','Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Be in control!\nAs platforms fill with passengers and rail traffic increases to meet the growing demand, rush hour begins. Take control of packed trains and navigate the busy network, constantly being checked by signals as you wind your way through station after station - Fighting to keep to time and avoid costly delays with Train Sim World 2: Rush Hour.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hjr.jpg'),(9490,'Year of the Ladybug: Season 1',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9491,'Venetica','2010-11-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','In a fantastical Venice, The Corpus are deceived by a cunning necromancer. Transformed into an undead fiend, the conniving imposter is hell-bent on destroying the reinstated Death and the council of Corpus. Only Scarlett, the daughter of Death, can stand in his way.\nKnowing nothing of her destiny at first, Scarlett has to learn about her special powers and become a mighty warrior, strong enough to defeat the greatest threat to the world of the living.\nShe must master her incredible supernatural powers and capabilities, in order to save her father and curse the necromancer and his gruesome henchmen to the eternal hereafter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uy4.jpg'),(9492,'Foxblade','2023-04-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter a war-torn land full of dangers, find powerful weapons and artifacts, make friends and complete their quests, make enemies and hack and slash your way through them, discover the mysteries of the land and earn your place in the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r1g.jpg'),(9493,'Shokujinki','2021-04-29','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A man-eating monster wakes up, in a snowy night. He meets a mysterious girl willing to die. This omnibus novel game tells the story of the strange interaction between them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38qc.jpg'),(9494,'Spindizzy','1986-12-31','Puzzle','Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Apple II, Amstrad CPC','As GERALD (Gyroscopic ExploRAtion Landing Device) you must explore 385 screens of Hangworld, using limited fuel. The game is viewed isometrically, which means that the controls are rotated through 90 degrees - this, coupled with the fact that many screens have huge gaps and diagonal paths, means that it\'s hard to get far at first. Falling off ledges loses you time, which is very limited to start with \n \nGerald must collect energy crystals throughout his journey - which can also be shortened by using a complex system of lifts. Sections you have travelled through are automatically mapped.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/p9ab14xz7owojo3gik7l.jpg'),(9495,'Evil Next Door',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Evil Next Door is a game about survival in a small post-Soviet town called Ensk suffering from a deadly epidemic. Switch between characters, go out for supplies and build a shelter for your people.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58va.jpg'),(9496,'Heathcliff: Frantic Foto','2010-12-31','Puzzle','Nintendo DS','Come along with everyone\'s second-favorite orange cat as you spot the difference between classic newspaper comics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zc5.jpg'),(9497,'OverBlood','1997-05-20','Adventure','PlayStation','Overblood is a 3D action-adventure video game developed by Riverhillsoft and released in 1997 for the PlayStation console. The game takes place in the future, where the player takes on the role of a man named Raz Karcy who wakes up in a cryogenic pod with no memory of who he is or how he got there. As Raz, the player must explore the futuristic environments, solve puzzles, and fight enemies in order to uncover his past and the secrets of the facility he finds himself in. The game features a mix of third-person exploration and combat, and also includes survival elements such as managing hunger and oxygen levels. Despite its initial commercial failure, Overblood has gained a cult following over the years for its unique gameplay and intriguing story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7htx.jpg'),(9498,'Pixel Trouble','2022-03-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pixel trouble - In this unusual platformer, you take on the role of a dim-witted knight who decided to become famous by accomplishing several feats. He chose the ghosts who fled from the cemetery as his goal, but here\'s the bad luck - the sword cannot injure the undead!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5khf.jpg'),(9499,'0°N 0°W','2018-03-02','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A cross country road trip turns into a multi-dimensional walkabout after a quick stop in a mysterious town. A first person surreal adventure of visual auditory stimuli set in a fantastical world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28r7.jpg'),(9500,'The Adventures of Spunk Dodgers and Splat','2021-10-09','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The Adventures of Spunk Dodgers and Splat is a 2D auto-scrolling platformer featuring fast action and hilarious quips. Jump to avoid enemies and obstacles while collecting coins on the way to completing over 50 thrilling levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yvn.jpg'),(9501,'I\'m Truely a Good Guy!','2025-04-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Cattlehorse Corp, where deadlines are tight, and backstabbing is tighter! Complete tasks, expose traitors, and suck up to management—just make sure you survive. Use wacky gadgets, bluff, and betray to climb the corporate ladder. In this office, only survivors get promotions!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lni.jpg'),(9502,'Hide In Dummy','2025-03-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Hide in Dummy\" is a multiplayer game where players hide among dummies or become the seeker. The seeker changes every 30 seconds, and the last player standing wins. Dummies spawn when players are caught, creating chaos. Use strategy to survive or outwit the seeker.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ksd.jpg'),(9503,'Elminage Gothic','2014-09-18','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','From the makers of the world renowned “Wizardry Empire” titles, Starfish SD brings you the latest entry in their popular series of dungeon crawlers. Elminage Gothic, previously only available in Japanese on PlayStation Portable, now comes to PC offering a classic old school dungeon crawling experience with a dark, gothic twist!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3puu.jpg'),(9504,'Nostradamus','1993-02-01','Shooter','Arcade','Nostradamus is a vertically scrolling arcade shoot \'em up released by Face in 1993. \n \nPlayers control either Dalas (player one) or Joanna (player two) to shoot down many different enemies and then defeat the level boss to advance through the game\'s nine stages. \n \nAccording to one of Nostradamus\' supposed prophecies, in July 1999, a great leader would come from the sky to rebirth an old ruler over a lost province on Earth. In the game\'s story, this prediction comes true in the form of an alien invasion. Originating from Saturn, the alien invasion force quickly attacks many locations on Earth in preparation for an even bigger assault and possible complete global domination. Efforts are put into the design of advanced space fighters and mecha along with the best fighter pilots - in this case, pilots Dalas and Joanna - to combat the Saturnites and dispel any further doom prophecies from materializing on Earth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/i0yyg4qyhd12um1nentr.jpg'),(9505,'Extinction: Alien Invasion','2019-03-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Annihilate waves of aliens, build your base, improve your mercenary, do it all with a sound track bathed in rock. Extinction Alien Invasion is an arcade shooter with elements of RPG, inspired by games like: Shadowgrounds, Alien Breed and Alien Swarm.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9506,'Cloak & Dagger','1983-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','Agent X must progress through a series of floors to retrieve a set of stolen plans and destroy Dr. Boom\'s underground bomb factory. Avoid the explosives, bomb converters, forklifts, robot guards, acid pits, and death-ray shooting eyeballs. The game was featured in the motion picture of the same name.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84ga.jpg'),(9507,'JaJaMaru no Daibouken','1986-08-22','Shooter, Platform','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','JaJaMaru no Daibouken is a Family Computer video game that was released exclusively for a Japanese market in 1986.\n\nThe concept of the game is that the player controls a red ninja as he progress through a series of Japanesque levels defeating evil spirits that have spread across the land. The player can even ride his faithful frog if he can recover it from hiding.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o1q.jpg'),(9508,'Time to Star II',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9509,'Pirates, Vikings, and Knights II','2010-01-05','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Pirates, Vikings, and Knights II boasts a unique three-team symmetry and a myriad of colorful characters to promote exciting, strategic, and fun gameplay. It features several game modes, each requiring its own special brand of cunning to master. Do battle on a tropical island for control of bountiful treasure. Appease your gods by spilling the blood of your enemies deep within a Mayan temple. Conquer your foes by taking control of precious badlands territory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m52.jpg'),(9510,'Rollback','2020-11-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a special challenge to get a chance. Go up to the highest point with simple control. If you make a mistake, try again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ynu.jpg'),(9511,'Jigsaw Jumble',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','Jigsaw Jumble is a puzzle game on Xbox Live Indie Games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ahoxlujvfgzkaozkcxfl.jpg'),(9512,'Closed Nightmare','2018-07-19','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','A live action adventure horror game from Nippon Ichi Software.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/klbjpraug0iz0dlhpd13.jpg'),(9513,'Roller Crash',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9514,'Together VR','2018-04-02','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','Come! Indulge yourselves in your own private den and create sweet and loving memories with her!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44ps.jpg'),(9515,'Cafe Owner Simulator: Farm DLC','2024-05-20','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Have you opened your restaurant yet? Now you have the opportunity to supplement your menu with organic products, increase the profit of your restaurant and simply enjoy the nature and atmosphere of the farm. Grow, water, feed, get resources. Animals, beds and greenhouses are waiting for you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wp2.jpg'),(9516,'Payday 2: The Goat Simulator Heist','2016-01-14','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is Going to be a Weird One, Gang.\n\nThe Goat Simulator DLC is the 30th pack for Payday 2, and is a collaboration between Coffee Stain Studios and Overkill. Vlad has a new mission for the gang, but things quickly get more... complicated once they arrive at the scene. With this update we introduce a brand new two-day heist that is unlike anything we\'ve done before. Together with this comes a new shotgun, four melee weapons, four masks, four patterns, four materials and finally two new tracks from Simon Viklund.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qaz.jpg'),(9517,'Youropa',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','When Youropa is torn apart, You must use your unique wall walking ability to navigate a strange fragmented city, restore it to former glory and learn who you really are. A platform puzzle paint adventure about breaking rules, being upside down and thinking outside the box.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1scl.jpg'),(9518,'Ratatouille','2007-11-22','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Players relive the film\'s most thrilling moments as they assume the role of Remy, a young rat who dreams of becoming a great French chef, despite the obvious problem of being a rat. From the underground sewers to the bustling streets of Paris, players dash, glide and slide through 6 action-packed worlds filled with dangerous enemies, heists and perilous missions. Players can go head-to-head with their friends in multiplayer mini-games or navigate their way through a sensational rat race that turns the culinary world of Paris upside down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2je2.jpg'),(9519,'Guilty Gear: Strive - Additional Character 7: Sin Kiske','2023-03-06','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Adds Sin Kiske to the roster of playable characters','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6iek.jpg'),(9520,'Lifesigns','2021-02-11','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The past was haunting — and so, you fled. To the deep web of streets, blinding lights, skyscrapers, creature comforts, a whole new life, a whole new you. Welcome to the City. Welcome to the Corporation. Welcome to the Game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ten.jpg'),(9521,'A Pixel Story','2017-02-24','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','A Pixel Story is a devious 2D puzzle platformer that charts the evolution of video games. You must use your Magical Teleportation Hat to explore 6 increasingly detailed zones on your quest to reach the core of The System to stop the evil OS and save the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co270n.jpg'),(9522,'Dragon Ball: Xenoverse 2 - Hero of Justice Pack Set','2022-11-10','Fighting, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','The Hero of Justice Pack Set bundles together both Packs 1 and 2!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9523,'Snoodoku',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','Snoodoku� is a new Windows puzzle game from the creator of Snood. Like Snood, it is non-violent, intellectually challenging, and non-confrontational. Snoodoku is based on Latin Squares, more recently developed into a game known as Number Place or Sudoku. Similar games are found in newspapers and puzzle books. Snoodoku takes the puzzle a step further, by: Using the Snood characters rather than boring old numbers; Providing a simple user interface, accessible by mouse or keyboard, that keeps track of your play for you without getting in the way; Providing a scoring system that rewards accuracy primarily and then rewards speed to make the game a bit more competitive; and Giving you easy-to-use tools to help you play. Snoodoku has 5 levels of play - Child, Easy, Medium, Hard and Evil - and you can compete against yourself or against others!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9524,'Studium',NULL,'Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gxt.jpg'),(9525,'Rescue: The Beagles','2024-03-14','Platform, Simulator, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A challenging retro arcade platformer/runner with unique parallax based gameplay. Rescue adorable doggies from an evil biohazard brigade in an intense, fast paced parkour through colorful procedurally generated levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7v12.jpg'),(9526,'Storm Area 51: September 20th 2019','2019-07-23','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive the epic raid on Area 51 and rescue the aliens from the military compound using classic stealth mechanics and cover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1n5z.jpg'),(9527,'The Jackbox Party Pack 6','2019-10-17','Puzzle, Strategy, Quiz/Trivia, Indie','Amazon Fire TV, Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','It\'s the wildest Party Pack yet, with the absurd deathmatch Trivia Murder Party 2, the weird word circus Dictionarium, the hidden identity game Push The Button, the comedy contest Joke Boat and the offbeat personality test Role Models. Use your phones or tablets as controllers and play with up to 10 players, plus an audience of up to 10,000!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zep.jpg'),(9528,'Cruis\'n Exotica','1999-12-31','Racing, Arcade','Arcade','GET EXOTIC! …from Atlantis to Mars and everywhere in between.\n\nRace in style! Cruis’n Exotica takes you to fantastic locales in even more fantastic vehicles. Race through steamy Jurassic jungles or on the ocean floor. Midair stunts keep the action nonstop! Valuable shortcuts and nitro boosts speed up the already fast-paced action! Fantastic driving excitement straight from the arcade!\n\n28 exotic cars to race!\n\n1 to 4 player non-stop racing action!\n\nTurbo boosts, stunts, nitros and more!\n\n60 tracks from around the world!\n\nThree modes of play to choose from!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pru.jpg'),(9529,'Taleans Hansel and Gretel story','2019-10-16','Sin género','Web browser','While the boy Hansel and his sister girl Gretel were walking in the dark forest, they lost each other. In \"Taleans Hansel and Gretel\" you will have to help them find each other. On the screen you will see a forest glade, at the different ends of which our characters are standing. For our heroes to meet each other, they need to walk along the path that goes through the clearing. But the path is broken, and you need to restore its integrity by moving the elements on the screen and putting them in the right place. As soon as you finish this task, the heroes will run along the path and meet up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6eb3.jpg'),(9530,'Electric Car Tycoon',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','In Electric Car Tycoon you get to start the electric car revolution with your own car company. Start with an experimental model in your garage and grow your company to hundreds of factories and workers around the world. Research new technologies and improve your models. Create the best electric car','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58pl.jpg'),(9531,'Streets of Neotokio','2019-12-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Neotokio is the capital city of Japan in the year 3020. A place whose control is fought over between two Yakuza clans: the conservative clan Minashigo and the progressive clan Kuroi Taiyo. Put yourself into the position of Kaito, who has to rescue Aiko and recover his lost honour as samurái of the clan Minashigo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4264.jpg'),(9532,'Barbarossa! Susume? Aka-gun Shoujo Ryodan','2018-02-08','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23qs.jpg'),(9533,'That Castle',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A huge castle arose in the north devastating everything around it, the kingdoms are afraid, making agreements and political movements. A reward was made to the brave, can you find the culprit and put an end to it?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mi7.jpg'),(9534,'Panic! Dizzy','2019-08-06','Puzzle','Nintendo Entertainment System','\"Dizzy hits the panic stations as the hydraulic crushers get closer and closer, belching steam - the machines going into termination sequence and its down to you to stop it.\"\n\nDizzy Panic! was a puzzle game similar to Tetris, which involved moving a wall left to right so that falling shapes can pass through the appropriately shapes holes in the wall.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3inx.jpg'),(9535,'Ghostbusters Arcade','2016-12-31','Arcade','Arcade','Ghostbusters Arcade is a video redemption game developed by the arcade masters at Play Mechanix for ICE. Players confront ghosts on two levels which are based on events from the first two Ghostbuster films. They then have to stop the Stay Puft Marshmellow man for the chance at a big ticket bonus!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gas.jpg'),(9536,'No Greater Glory: The American Civil War','1991-12-31','Strategy','DOS','A grand strategy game set during the American Civil War.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zf4.jpg'),(9537,'Rebaixados Elite Brasil','2018-08-31','Racing, Simulator','Android, iOS','Rebaixados Elite Brasil is a Brazil-inspired demoted car game where you can customize your car and character!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7muk.jpg'),(9538,'IL-2 Sturmovik: Battle of Stalingrad - Flying Circus - Volume II','2023-03-29','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Above the brutal meatgrinder of the Great War trench warfare there was a ballet of winged machines made largely of canvas and wood, piloted by knights for a new age, who dueled to the death in a most personal way.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9539,'Yooka-Laylee: Buddy Duo Pack','2019-10-10','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Yooka-Laylee is an open-world platform adventure from genre veterans. Embark on an epic adventure to thwart corporate creep Capital B!\n\nYooka-Laylee and the Impossible Lair is a new 2D platform adventure from some of the key creative talent behind \'Donkey Kong Country\'.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d2r.jpg'),(9540,'A Little to the Left: Cupboards & Drawers','2023-06-27','Puzzle, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Sort, stack, and organize household objects into particular arrangements in A Little to the Left: Cupboards & Drawers. Prepare to clean out the cabinets and secret compartments of the home with even more charming illustrations, surprising scenarios, and 25 delightful new Cupboards & Drawers themed puzzles to discover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6eis.jpg'),(9541,'Gems of Magic: Father\'s Day','2021-08-06','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Remove all obstacles and reunite father and son in 100 challenging levels! In this exciting and adventurous match-3 based puzzle game you will have lots of fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3co5.jpg'),(9542,'Pirates! Showdown: Enhanced Edition','2024-01-26','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fast-paced game combining real-time strategy and defense tactics. Face off against the fearsome Red Hand privateers in thrilling head-to-head pirate battles on the high sea! Capture towns, guard towers, and much more to strengthen your defense, buff up your ships, and increase your gold supply!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ubd.jpg'),(9543,'PewPew 2','2011-03-22','Platform, Arcade','Android','PewPew 2 is the sequel to the acclaimed PewPew. PewPew 2 is the best multidirectional shoot them up on mobile. It\'s basically megatons of enemies and many different game modes, everything rolled up with sweet smooth retro graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jno.jpg'),(9544,'Mutant Football League: New Yuck Threats','2022-10-20','Fighting, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Threats have done a great job of building around QB Stack Killson and infusing talent on both sides of the ball. With three #1 picks in this year’s draft, they added speed on the offense and nastiness on the D-Line. The secondary covers like a blanket and stings like a bee with the additions of D.J. Bleed Jr. and Saucy Charredner. This is a hungry young team ready to take off.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61jc.jpg'),(9545,'Genso Nikki','2016-03-07','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Genso Nikki is a fan made tribute to the Japanese indie game: Yume Nikki\n\nPlay as a boy trapped in his room. If you dare, turn out the lights and explore his mind. Collect effects to alter his appearance and powers, enabling him to access new areas, who know what you might find!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rw9.jpg'),(9546,'Only Lead Can Stop Them','2024-12-09','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Boot up your 486 and launch olcst.exe for this retro fps from an alternate 1990\'s. Descend into the madness of the Spanish Civil War fighting vicious fascist forces and supernatural monsters. Conquer three action packed episodes wielding machine guns, rifles, flamethrowers and explosives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k2r.jpg'),(9547,'Starfighter Origins','2017-04-25','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Starfighter Origins is a 90`s style Indie space combat simulator inspired by games such as wing commander, Freespace and star wars. Combining a focus on single player action and favouring full space combat simulation over dog-fighting, Starfighter Origins looks and plays best using a Gamepad and also supports HOTAS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2263.jpg'),(9548,'Ghostbusters II','1989-12-31','Adventure','Handheld Electronic LCD','LCD handheld version by Pack-in-Video. Released in Japan and based on the film of the same name.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dj3.jpg'),(9549,'TNT War Bundle',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t6e.jpg'),(9550,'Wordeous','2020-12-29','Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Can you play a game with thousands of people? With Wordeous you can! Wordeous allows you to play with your friends or audience. If you are a streamer on Twitch you can play Wordeous with your audience. Thousands of people race to guess the \"Wordeous\" and win! Wordeous is a fun game that will increase interactivity of streamers with audience. If you\'re ready for a fierce competition with random game cards in different categories and challenges, let the game begin!\nWordeous is a card game in which you try to explain the \"Wordeous Word\" to your audience without saying the banned words. Wordeous uses Twitch Chat integration which allows you to receive your audience\'s answers simultaneously. After you login to your account, you are all set to start a new game with many different categories and hundreds of words!\n\nWordeous is a multiplayer, co-op game that requires a Twitch account. The player explains the “Wordeous” and your friends and/or audience try to guess the Wordeous by writing their guesses to your Twitch channel’s chat. You can moderate your own match or you can play with your moderator. If you like to play with your moderators, they need to buy a copy of the Wordeous too, however the others who tries to guess \"do not\" need to buy a copy! You don’t need to be a streamer to play the game, every Twitch account has a chat panel which can be used to play Wordeous!\n\nThe scoreboard system allows you to see your most successful viewer of the last game or all games. You and your viewers gather points according to both your and your viewers performance.\n\nWordeous allows you to have a highly interactive and fun time with your audience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2moc.jpg'),(9551,'Final Fantasy X-2','2003-03-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 2','Final Fantasy X-2 is the direct sequel to Final Fantasy X, developed and published by Square Enix. It was the first direct sequel game in the Final Fantasy series and the first to feature an all-female playable cast. It also returned to the job system not seen in the main series since Final Fantasy V.\n\nThe game uses a character class system where the equipped dressphere determines her abilities and stats. Party members can switch to any dressphere in their Garment Grid to swap to new skills and adapt to different opponents. It makes use of the Active Time Battle system that was absent from Final Fantasy X. The party has access to all locations early on and can visit them through the Celsius, complete several minigames and sidequests in a chapter before progressing through the story to the next one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x4s.jpg'),(9552,'Kyoukaisen no Horizon Portable','2013-04-25','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Game adaptation of Horizon in the Middle of Nowhere exclusive to the PSP in Japan. The game is an RPG, the story is partially based on the anime and the novels but also includes an original scenario, with more than 80 characters from both media making an appearance. The game sold more than 26,000 copies in its first week after launch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4p6c.jpg'),(9553,'Animal Super Squad','2018-05-15','Platform, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Animal Super Squad is a physics-based game that lets you play a chicken riding a toilet on wheels, or a sloth with a propeller on its butt, speeding through a world full of traps and bananas. You can also create your own maps to infuriate your friends with, and ticking off our friends is what we all live for anyway.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28u4.jpg'),(9554,'The Desolation','2023-11-16','Shooter, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Desolation brings a complete cross-platform co-op looter-shooter experience to PC and mobile devices. Make your impact across endless procedurally generated worlds via cooperative action combat, deep build customization and richly satisfying tactical gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7drf.jpg'),(9555,'Aery: Calm Mind 2','2022-03-25','Simulator, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Calm down from the hassle of your daily life, experience the feeling of flying, and immerse yourself into beautiful and atmospheric landscapes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oj4.jpg'),(9556,'Star Conflict: Shrike - Deluxe Edition','2024-07-02','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This pack includes:Rank 17 Federation cover frigate Shrike Unique weapon Hybrid blaster “Alpha-N”Active module “Universal repair module”Rahil “Coin” Weintraub portrait Additionally, the pilot receives:10% bonus to credits gain for 90 days“Predatory colour” pattern“Monte spheres” decorAdditionally, the pilot receives the modules:Unique mod','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9557,'The Lécuyer Cult','2022-03-10','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are a 21-year-old young man who receives an invitation to go to the Lécuyer mansion to find your missing friend. You head to the mansion where a cultured ceremony is taking place. You realize that you are about to experience a whole new world.\nYou walk through the corridors of the mansion that has been owned by the Lécuyers for several years now. You will learn the history of each character and decide whether you want to help them or not.\nYou will learn dark secrets and if you do it right, you will be able to enjoy the girls who are in the mansion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6omi.jpg'),(9558,'Rogue Drone Hunter',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hunt down rogue AI machines in this action roguelike with card-based deckbuilding. Battle in real-time, but pause to unleash powerful card combos from your deck. Explore ancient futuristic ruins, gather powerful upgrades, and fight to defend humanity from a mysterious mechanical threat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lus.jpg'),(9559,'Caretaker Retribution','2016-12-15','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Caretaker Retribution is a six degrees of freedom first person shooter set inside a massive alien machine. The stars are going out. A team is sent to find out why. They discover the cause and try to stop it and they don’t make it out alive.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9560,'Assassin\'s Creed Shadows: Gold Edition','2025-03-20','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Experience an epic historical action-adventure story set in feudal Japan! Become a lethal shinobi Assassin and a powerful legendary samurai as you explore a beautiful open world in a time of chaos. Switch seamlessly between two unlikely allies as you discover their common destiny and usher in a new era for Japan.\n\nExplore the captivating open world of feudal Japan, from spectacular castle towns and bustling ports to peaceful shrines and war-ravaged landscapes. Adventure through unpredictable weather, changing seasons, and reactive environments.\n\nBecome Naoe, a shinobi Assassin, and Yasuke, a legendary samurai, as you experience their riveting stories and master their complementary playstyles. As Naoe, use stealth to avoid detection and agility to confound your enemies. As Yasuke, strike your foes with lethal precision and power. Unlock new skills, gear, and progression independently for each character.\n\nMake information your weapon as you explore the world, and build your own network of spies to be your eyes and ears across locations to hunt down your next target. Along the way, recruit new allies with unique abilities to help accomplish your missions.\n\nCreate a fully customizable hideout for your growing shinobi league as you train your crew, craft new gear, interact with key characters, and choose your base’s layout, decorations, and accessories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cce.jpg'),(9561,'Combat Complex','2024-10-04','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Combat Complex is a fast-paced sci-fi action RPG. You are alone against hordes of enemies. Wield legendary weapons, level up your stats, unlock devastating talents and abilities. Think quick, move fast, outsmart your enemies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y0p.jpg'),(9562,'Atomicrops: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','The Atomicrops Deluxe Edition features the PC version of Atomicrops (with all updated content thus far + Reap what you Crow DLC) and the upbeat, official soundtrack with music from Joonas Turner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d2e.jpg'),(9563,'Test Drive: Ferrari Racing Legends','2012-12-10','Racing, Simulator','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Detailed physics underpin a huge variety of challenges set throughout the history of this landmark automotive brand. Painstakingly detailed cars and tracks reflect visceral damage as races wear on, an acute sense of speed communicates the power of these highly tuned vehicles, as advanced AI challenges even the most experienced driver.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20kl.jpg'),(9564,'Baccarist',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9565,'Hazel & The Deep','2024-10-25','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Doxy certified classic returns! This original web game is now remastered in a new engine, fully voiced and animated to shine through its sexy glory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zp8.jpg'),(9566,'Minecraft: Summer Drop 2025','2025-12-31','Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9567,'Salvation: Shadows of the Faceless',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','A first-person dark horror game essentially tells about mental suffering, overcoming fears, and the power of true love.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j0w.jpg'),(9568,'ACA Neo Geo: Ghost Pilots','2018-04-26','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ghost Pilots is a shooting game released by SNK in 1991. The hero flies an old-fashioned seaplane in order to fight the two powerful nations invading their own country. Alongside giant military weapons, a mysterious combat unit arrives and makes for an intense battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qvu.jpg'),(9569,'Pumpking','2018-10-31','Platform, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A difficult platform game, prove you are a Pumpking!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mdj.jpg'),(9570,'Sitting Ducks','2004-04-16','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation, PlayStation 2','Welcome to the whimsical world of Sitting Ducks, where life is good, food\'s a plenty, and alligators are lurking in neighboring Swampwood. One bird stands out amongst the flock: Bill. He is a quirky, smaller than average duck with a big imagination and a secret fun loving side. Along with his alligator friend Aldo, Bill embarks on 20 different missions in this whimsical action game. Play as Bill the Duck and Aldo the Alligator from the TV series and explore colorful and detailed levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rb6.jpg'),(9571,'Ritual Night','2024-11-04','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Summon Cthulhu in this social deduction game with no early eliminations! Monsters work together to complete the ritual, while stealthy humans secretly sabotage and cause chaos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92ar.jpg'),(9572,'Trip in Hell','2018-09-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a survival-shooter game, in which you must kill as many zombies as possible to hold out incoming hordes of the dead. It\'s available to get into the action in a 4-co-op mode, don\'t forget that, boy!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9573,'Little Nemo and the Nightmare Fiends',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Little Nemo and the Nightmare Fiends is a 2D non-linear platformer with 4 playable characters that players can freely switch between. The game features artwork inspired by the groundbreaking 1905 Little Nemo in Slumberland comic, hand-drawn keyframed animation, and a cast of surreal creatures and characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yhk.jpg'),(9574,'Marvel vs. Capcom: Clash of Super Heroes','1999-11-11','Fighting, Arcade','PlayStation','This PlayStation port differs from the arcade version, in that players are unable to switch characters on-the-fly, reducing the secondary character to an assist role only.\nSignificantly, this removes the tag team aspect of the original.\n\nIt instead offers a \"Cross over\" mode where each player chooses one character, and the second character for each team is a mirror of the opponent\'s pick. In this mode, the players may switch characters at will, but the teams must always be identical.\n\nThis compromise is most likely necessitated by the console\'s small memory size, as the use of identical teams alleviates the memory requirements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eql.jpg'),(9575,'New Ghostbusters II Plus','2012-11-28','Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','A rom hack of \"New Ghostbusters II\". After making a patch to recolor the Ghostbusters to allow Winston a more natural skin tone, many other alterations were made in an attempt to make an already great game even better.\n\nMajor changes:\n- Ghostbusters recolored\n- Improved Ghostbuster sprites (Proton packs, legs, Peter’s hairline, Egon’s glasses, etc…)\n- Color palette tweaks to enemies and a few minor tweaks to level palettes\n- Shrunk giant chair on character select screen\n- Minor sprite/tile edits and fixes\n- Added names to credits\n- Vigo’s hair outlined, making it much more visible (no more bald Vigo)\n- Improved Janosz’s sprite\n- Major color palette tweaks on every level to create better contrast and compliment the new-colored ghostbusters\n- Improved legs\n- Color changes to character select (reverted) and level 2 (for variety)\n- Few other minor tweaks','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z0h.jpg'),(9576,'Crooks Like Us','2021-03-31','Fighting, Tactical, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A chaotic online multiplayer where you get to steal everything you see! Carry as many items as you can to your getaway van before time runs out - a higher stack gets you more points. Fight your way to 1st place as you use gadgets like anvils, ice, earthquakes and more to mess with other players!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r23.jpg'),(9577,'Heartopia',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Android, iOS','Heartopia is a life simulator which gives gamers the chance to slow down and enjoy the little moments in life! No matter your hobbies, personality, talents, or appearance, Heartopia is your chance to share them with the world -- however you want.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pir.jpg'),(9578,'The Sandbox','2014-05-08','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','The Sandbox is a unique world building & crafting game featuring over 200+ physics elements presented in 2D pixel blocks that can interact with each others. Players can craft amazing worlds, create pixel art, chain reactions, chiptune music, advanced contraptions, electric circuits or just play with physics.\n\nPlay with basic elements ranging from simple water, stone, sand, wood, glass, lava, fire, to more complex: electricity, metal, virus, antivirus,heater, cooler, lasers, pipes, gems, sensors, leds TNT, C4, crosswire, conveyor belt, music instruments etc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x73.jpg'),(9579,'Whisker Waters','2024-04-25','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Whisker Waters is the ultimate RPG adventure that blends light fantasy and the art of fishing into a mesmerizing world. As a player, you\'ll create and play as your very own Cat character and embark on a whimsical fishing journey like never before.\n\nUnlike any other game, Whisker Waters makes fishing the star of the show! Use cool fishing tools to explore and catch all kinds of unique fish. Each fish has its own tricks, making it exciting and rewarding!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72sz.jpg'),(9580,'LoopWorlds Free','2018-07-30','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','LoopWorlds is a logic puzzle game where you must collect every ‘bite’ in a level to complete it, in a very limited number of moves. There is usually only one possible combination which will yield victory in the number of moves given for each level, and it will not be the first one you try, and it is sometimes the last one you would ever think of.\n\nAfter each group of levels, a new type of object will be added to the game, including sliding blocks, button-activated walls and portals.\n\nSwipe to move, and the Discoball will keep rolling until it hits something; and if the Discoball exits the side of the screen it loops back in the other side.\n\nYou can still create your own levels too, but in this free version you cannot upload them or download levels from other players, just create and save them for later, and let your friends or family have a go on them! (on your own device of course) :)\n\nLoopWorlds was originally based on the bonus levels in the Dizzy game Kwik Snax, but it has been greatly expanded upon and is now an epic evolution of it’s predecessor :)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/y7duabns6or1ywigdodi.jpg'),(9581,'Story City',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, iOS','Why go on a boring old walk when you can be a secret agent? Or run through the streets of a new city to escape a zombie apocalypse? Have you ever read a story and wish you could be in it? Calling the shots, helping the good guys (or bad), choosing your adventure. Story City makes you the hero of your own story, giving you the chance to take part in your own adventure in cities across the world.\n\nEach game on Story City only opens when you\'re in the right location. Whether it\'s fiction or non-fiction, a musical journey or scavenger hunt, all stories and games on Story City are made by creators who know their cities best.\n\nWill you explore Brisbane while running from a zombie apocalypse? Or how about cruising the Adelaide streets while solving a mystery? Or will you be pillaging the city looking for pirate supplies? Perhaps you\'ll take a musical journey with a First Nations storyteller and drummer in Edmonton\'s River Valley, or learn about your non-profit in a social issues walk.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v9o.jpg'),(9582,'Moving Stories','2014-12-30','Simulator, Indie','Web browser','You\'re moving. What will you pack in your suitcase? What will you throw away?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hcq.jpg'),(9583,'King\'s Quest II: Romancing the Stones','2002-12-17','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','King\'s Quest II: Romancing the Stones is a remake of King\'s Quest II: Romancing the Throne and a follow-up to AGD Interactive\'s (formerly Tierra Entertainment) earlier remake of the first game. Similar to its predecessor, it has VGA graphics reminiscent of Sierra\'s adventure games of the early 1990\'s and a new musical score. The remake retains the general outlines of the original story and the gameplay system, however contains additional locations, expanded dialogue, and new characters. Some of these characters are original, while others are taken from various installments of the series to present a more cohesive view of its overarching story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bun.jpg'),(9584,'Flex Disc Golf','2023-10-12','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play countless disc golf courses throughout the world, find lost discs or buy new ones, and learn new throws and styles! Experience realistic gameplay while being surrounded by highly detailed nature.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gtt.jpg'),(9585,'Caverna do Podrão','2024-07-24','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fa9.jpg'),(9586,'The Legend of Valkyrie','1989-04-01','Adventure','Arcade, Wii, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','Valkyrie no Densetsu is an action game released by Namco in 1989. It is a follow-up to the Family Computer game Valkyrie no Bouken: Toki no Kagi Densetsu. When the seeds of gold are watered by the northern spring, a miracle will spring forth in the doomed land.\nThe game was localized in Namco Museum Vol. 5, under the translated title.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z7w.jpg'),(9587,'VTuber Connect','2022-11-21','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','VTuber Connect is a love letter to VTubers as a medium. One that hides nothing, but embraces everything. Whether you’re a VTuber or a viewer, we all form connections in our own way. How will you connect?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5q4p.jpg'),(9588,'Pinball FX 2: Marvel Pinball','2010-12-08','Pinball','PlayStation 3, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Wii U, PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360','Join Spider-Man, Wolverine, Iron Man, and Blade on four pinball tables powered by the dazzling Pinball FX 2 engine. Use your pinball wizardry to save the world from the most notorious supervillains, and relive the greatest moments of the classic Marvel Universe in an epic pinball adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vde.jpg'),(9589,'Harukanaru Toki no Naka de 3 Ultimate','2017-02-23','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','A combined remake of the original game + Izayoiki that includes the additional content from the collectors edition.\n\nFull Voice, Redrawn Stills, more than 40 new stills added,\nAdds Love ED after stories and a DLC route for Fujiwara no Yasuhira.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60ri.jpg'),(9590,'Abandoned Souls','2023-07-14','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Abandoned Souls is a horror game, shown through a GoPro lens. You play as a vlogger who specializes in urban exploration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r3c.jpg'),(9591,'Bambas!','2025-12-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Relive your childhood and turn every crosswalk, curb, and puddle into an epic adventure with this innovative urban walking simulator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9579.jpg'),(9592,'Pepe\'s Little Adventure','2005-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95m3.jpg'),(9593,'Hush Little Lily',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','A point-and-click, exploration horror game','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9594,'JumpStart 1st Grade Math','1997-12-16','Point-and-click, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','JumpStart 1st Grade Math, later released as JumpStart Math for First Graders, is a game released in 1997 that focuses on teaching a first grade math curriculum.\n\nFrankie loves to mess up his backyard, especially by digging holes for bones. But this disturbs the bugs who inhabit the yard, so as punishment, the Queen Bee shrinks Frankie down to their size. As penance, he can play activities that involve assisting the backyard bugs in various ways. This enables him to earn back some of his bones, which he can now use to make staircases leading him to the magical dog tags he needs to return to normal size.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ctr.jpg'),(9595,'Froggy Pot','2021-12-25','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A super short, linear visual novel about a Froggy chilling a pot.\n\nThe pot is warm now, but it will reach a boil soon...\n\nIt will be dangerous then...so you try convincing Froggy to get out of the pot, as you both begin to chat...\n\nAbout meaningless things, mindless things...\n\nWhy won\'t Froggy leave the pot?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4be3.jpg'),(9596,'Alphadia','2016-02-03','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, Android, iOS','Employing an orthodox turn-based battle system, Alphadia evokes a feeling of nostalgia with its classic gameplay style. In addition, its refined game balance and simple to use interface make this game easy for anyone to pick up and enjoy. Furthermore, with completely redrawn graphics, Alphadia\'s world shines on high-resolution touch screens.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c64.jpg'),(9597,'Kedemara: The Orphan\'s Ballad','2019-10-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The story details the comedic and inspiring tale of a girl trying to recall her past, all the while trudging forward with the help of her 3 newfound, whimsical friends. With the simple intent to find out who her parents are, Deirdre will unknowingly dismantle the largest conspiracy of her era.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44g2.jpg'),(9598,'The Lust City','2023-09-08','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You’re a seasoned explorer on a mission with your expedition crew into the deep jungle. Find lost treasure, explore the ancient mysteries that surround the tribe and build your own harem in The Lust City!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zdx.jpg'),(9599,'El Chavo Kart','2014-02-21','Racing','PlayStation 3, Android, Xbox 360','El Chavo Kart is a mascot-based kart racing game, in the same vein as Konami Krazy Racers, Nicktoons Racing, Mickey\'s Speedway USA, Diddy Kong Racing, Crash Team Racing and the Mario Kart series. Players get to compete as characters from the series (except for Jamito and Gloria), along with tracks loosely based on locations from the animated series.\n\nThe game offers three game modes: Cups, Exhibition, and Challenges. In \"Cups\", the player can unlock characters, while at the end of \"Challenges\" scenarios and tracks are unlocked. The player can collect power-ups along the race which can be used to benefit himself and gain an advantage in the race. Tracks include series features and scenarios such as Azteca Stadium, the city of Acapulco, the Maracana Stadium in Rio de Janeiro and also Stadium TFC in Toulouse. Each track can be raced in the opposite direction, and include alternative paths, traps and obstacles. The game features local multiplayer, allowing up to four players to compete against each other simultaneously. The game features 45 trophies or achievements that can be unlocked to progress through the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ia8.jpg'),(9600,'Shinsouban Okashi na Shima no Peter Pan: Sweet Never Land','2015-03-26','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','A remake with with bonus scenes and updated art.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61cb.jpg'),(9601,'Brutal Pico Race','2018-07-08','Racing','Web browser','Brutal Pico Race futurist racing game on Pico8 by Yourykiki - The Lurking Engine','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s02.jpg'),(9602,'Dragon\'s Dogma: Dark Arisen','2017-10-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dragon’s Dogma: Dark Arisen contains all the content from the original Dragon’s Dogma plus the additional content from its sequel, including the Bitterblack Isle area, filled with challenging new enemies and quests, and additional high level weapons and armour sets. Along with its stunningly high resolution graphics and full Steam platform support, this is the ultimate franchise experience for PC players.\n\nSet in a huge open world, Dragon’s Dogma: Dark Arisen presents a rewarding action combat experience. Players embark on an epic adventure in a rich, living world with three AI companions, known as Pawns. These partners fight independently, demonstrating prowess and ability that they have developed based on traits learnt from each player. PC users can share these Pawns online and reap rewards of treasure, tips and strategy hints for taking down the terrifying enemies. Pawns can also be borrowed when specific skills are needed to complete various challenging quests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a1v.jpg'),(9603,'Pico Pico MicroMix','2017-01-21','Music','Web browser','A rhythm-based game in the style of Dance Dance Revolution for PICO-8.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hlk.jpg'),(9604,'A Nest for Us','2023-08-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fly through the forest collecting twigs to build your nest with in this minimalistic, nature-inspired platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vf3.jpg'),(9605,'Of Sense and Soul',NULL,'Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A queer Victorian romance visual novel in which a gentleman running from the past and a poet hiding from the future collide through a lonely hearts ad. Suddenly, their lives can blossom—if you choose to change them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mbz.jpg'),(9606,'Blood and Zombies: Gold Edition',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69ny.jpg'),(9607,'Falos','2024-09-19','Platform','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Falos: Learn to read 100+ words in 100+ languages while playing a game. A game where you match words to emojis across four different play styles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8n2l.jpg'),(9608,'My Insect Girl Can\'t Be This Cute','2024-12-19','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Warm soft skin, contrasted with hard chitin. It isn\'t something you\'ve thought of until one day where your curiosity forced an encounter with an actual insect girl! In this visual novel, you meet Ophelia, the result of a successful cross genetics experiment between a ghost mantis and a human','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9706.jpg'),(9609,'Street Fighter X Tekken','2012-10-25','Fighting, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360','The long awaited dream match-up between the two titans of fighting is here!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1w4i.jpg'),(9610,'Fear the Dark Unknown: James','2020-12-18','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The clock is ticking and the survival game can no longer be stopped. James and Chloe have been chosen and nothing will ever be the same again after discovering the Dark Unknown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tmj.jpg'),(9611,'20 Words // 20 Seconds','2023-11-05','Puzzle, Arcade','Web browser','You have 20 seconds. For each prompt, type an English word that meets the criteria above. Words that you have used for an earlier criteria cannot be used again later.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gsu.jpg'),(9612,'Touhou Daiundousai','2012-05-27','Fighting, Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A doujin game by Top Arts Plan based on the Touhou Project series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xc6.jpg'),(9613,'Wario no Mori: Bakushou Version','1995-04-01','Platform, Puzzle','Satellaview','Wario no Mori: Bakushou Version is a Downloadable game for the Satellaview. The game is a pseudo-sequel to the earlier-broadcast Wario\'s Woods and Wario no Mori Futatabi featuring the vocal talents of Japanese comedy duo, Bakushou Mondai.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43o6.jpg'),(9614,'War Legends','2022-12-26','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG)','iOS','War Legends is a classic real-time strategy. There are no auto battles or asynchronous multiplayer. The game happens in real time and you control every single unit on the battlefield. You have to mine resources, build structures, and hire an army, just as it used to be in the old school RTS on PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jer.jpg'),(9615,'SinSeed','2021-01-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SinSeed is a battle royale game with no time limits. \n \nAn island awaits you that you will fight endlessly. \n \nA never-ending battle royale game, you are the only one to rule this world! \nThink of a battle royale game, when you face off against thousands of online players and rule the kingdom, you are now their worst enemy. \n \nStart with the character class that\'s right for you. \n \nDefeat enemies and survive on SinSeed island! \n \nUpgrade your items, be the King, rule the island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ono.jpg'),(9616,'3D Ultra Minigolf Adventures: Wild West','2007-05-24','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','3D Ultra Mini Golf Adventures: Wild West is a demo of the full 3D Ultra Mini Golf Adventures game. It was distributed by Taco Bell restaurants during a promotion that ran from May 24 - June 27, 2007. This disc contains 4 holes from the Old West theme of the full game: Graveyard Shift, Prairie Dogs, Dead Man\'s Creek, and Tipi Camp.\n\nWhile up to 4 players can player head to head in the full version, this demo version only allows 1 player to assume one of the 4 edgy, defiant personae available: Hector, Rosie, Joe, and Kate. The other 3 characters will also be playing, more or less as phantoms (their scores are reported summarily without any action seen). The game features 2 different control schemes for setting up the shot and putting the ball. It also allows the player to customize both their player\'s outfit and their golf ball.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kgp.jpg'),(9617,'GunWorld VR','2021-10-15','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fully physics based gun simulator. Build any gun possible - limitless attachments and options. 100% physical hands with realistic handling - just like real life. Play multiple mini-games and modes, and battle over 100 enemies on a single map in War Mode!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41jh.jpg'),(9618,'A Way Up','2024-05-27','Platform','Web browser','Immerse yourself in the thrilling world of \"A Way Up,\" a fast-paced 2D pixel art platformer created during an intense 72-hour game jam. In this adrenaline-pumping adventure, you start on a precarious platform, only to plummet into the depths of a mysterious cave. Your objective? Ascend to the exit as quickly as possible!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89mk.jpg'),(9619,'Mortal Kombat X: Predator','2015-07-07','Fighting','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The one, ugly warrior leaps from the jungle and into kombat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kld.jpg'),(9620,'Super Bit Blaster XL','2020-03-16','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','A SUPER throwback to the classic quarter eating arcade games of the 80\'s. Super Bit Blaster XL is an (even more) enhanced version of the retro styled, addictive, and fast paced arcade shoot \'em up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20hz.jpg'),(9621,'Fish Fear Me','2025-02-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A top-down action roguelike about catching fish, fighting them, selling their bones, and catching more fish. Upgrade your boat and weapons, hunt down sea monster bounties, and try to become the greatest battle-fisherman of all time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8r4k.jpg'),(9622,'Dangerous Skies 80\'s edition','2018-07-23','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter the world of Dangerous skies, a shoot em up inspired by the mythical space invaders, you will face ten fantastic levels in full 80s style.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9623,'Rise of Legions','2019-02-22','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rise of Legions is a free-to-play action-RTS set in a rich fantasy world. Collect dozens of powerful units and devastating spells. Play competitive in 1v1 or 2v2 modes and take on fierce bosses in PvE challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xcw.jpg'),(9624,'Super Mario Kart: Double Dash Reverse Remake','2011-08-30','Racing','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Here is a ROM hack which changes all the tracks in the game to new ones based on Mario Kart: Double Dash.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9625,'Joyous Rebel','1996-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','DOS','Joyous Rebel is an RPG inspired by the Ultima series of games. Initially a shareware title, it was later made available free of charge. It is a reworked version of a smaller game known as Joyous Rebellions of Jive Culture.\n\nAs a guardian it is your duty to defend the king of light. But you had to travel from you islands on a journey of peace and while you where gone booth the king and you feels that evil draws near. You hurry back to you island to defend the king but an enormous storm slows you down and a lightning almost kills you when it hits your boat a fisherman saves you and let you sleep over the night in his cabin. You are now well rested and must hurry to the caste to save the king of light.\n\nThe screen is divided into two parts; to the left is the game area where all the action takes place and to the left is your inventory and indicators of what action you are about to execute. In the game you can use four commands: change between attack mode and walk mode, fire ballistic weapon, Do it (climb stairs, open doors, pick up items) and use inventory. The inventory can contain 24 items.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9626,'Ghostbusters: Dimension','2016-07-01','Shooter, Simulator','Arcade','Originally a tie-in to the Ghostbusters reboot film, it featured the ability for visitors to participate in a \"hyper-reality\" ghost-hunting mission. It was produced and developed by The VOID in collaboration with the respective directors of the original and rebooted film—Ivan Reitman and Paul Feig. The script was written by head writer Tracy Hickman and the experience was directed by Curtis Hickman. Ghostbusters: Dimension marked the first Void attraction outside of Utah. The experience was updated in 2018 to make it available in more locations. The update included an introduction by Ray Stantz (played by Dan Aykroyd) in the pre-show video, as well as the radio voice guide inside the attraction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6eow.jpg'),(9627,'Frontland',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9628,'Survivania','2024-03-22','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survivania is a 2D Score Attack game where you fight hoards of the Demon Lords minions until you inevitebly meet your end. Keep your Combo high and Score high!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8f60.jpg'),(9629,'The Astro Parcel Service','2020-04-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deliver packages as fast as you can while surviving the hazards of space and the crippling pressure of your employer, The Astro Parcel Service.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20ep.jpg'),(9630,'Cloning Clyde','2011-02-02','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Cloning Clyde is a 3D side-scrolling adventure.\n\nAs Clyde, or one of his clones, work your way through the levels of the nefarious Dupliclone, Inc. building. It houses bizarre simulated environments created specifically to accommodate their unconventional cloning experiments. Have fun utilizing the many clones running amok inside Dupliclone, as you try to free yourself…or should we say yourselves. Be careful of the traps set by the sinister corporation, and watch out for mutant clones! Get even more inventive and you can use the cloning technology to combine the Clyde clones with some of your co-inhabitants to make mutant Chicken-Clydes, Frog-Clydes, Ape-Clydes and more. Many of the mutant Clydes have special abilities that can help you to escape from the evil Dupliclone, Inc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2om1.jpg'),(9631,'Ash of Gods: Fan Edition',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure','Sin plataforma','The Fan Edition also includes soundtracks and art books for both games, plus bonus digital art and a print and play set of playing cards from Redemption!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s31.jpg'),(9632,'Possessioner','1994-03-18','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series','Possessioner is primarily a Japanese-style adventure game. The player selects verb commands from a menu and combines them with objects appearing afterwards to interact with the environment and trigger events. Navigation is menu-based as well. The game also contains sporadic turn-based battles against the Possessioners and their minions. Four female combatants have a variety of attacks at their disposal, but the battles are fairly simple and there is no role-playing system. The game contains scenes with nudity and explicit, exclusively lesbian sex scenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52xr.jpg'),(9633,'Magic Disc Golf',NULL,'Sport, Indie','Sin plataforma','Magic Disc Golf lets you take control of your disc and steer it towards the basket. Find the optimal route, navigate challenging terrain, and use your speed boost to cover some extra ground. Choose from three 18-hole courses and four game modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5igf.jpg'),(9634,'Jurassic World Evolution: Deluxe Edition','2018-06-12','Sin género','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Place yourself at the heart of the Jurassic franchise and build your own Jurassic World. Bioengineer dinosaurs that think, feel and react intelligently to the world around them and face threats posed by espionage, breakouts and devastating tropical storms in an uncertain world where life always finds a way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4o77.jpg'),(9635,'ACA Neo Geo: The Last Blade 2','2018-10-25','Fighting, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Last Blade 2 is a fighting game released by SNK in 1998. The Four Gods aiming to seal Hell\'s Gate and the eternal dead who aim to stop them are in the middle of an intense battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a6w.jpg'),(9636,'Contra','1989-05-26','Shooter, Platform','Wii, Wii U, MSX2','Contra is a run-and-gun shooter video game developed and published by Konami. It is one of the many ports of the homonymous arcade game. The MSX2 version was later re-released for the Wii and Wii U Virtual Console.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bey.jpg'),(9637,'Super Mario Kart: 64 Reverse Remake','2011-12-24','Racing','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Here is a ROM hack which changes all the tracks in the game to new ones based on Mario Kart 64. Also Koopa has been replaced by Toad and the original Toad is replaced by Wario.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9638,'Pinball FX: Marvel Pinball - Cinematic Pack','2023-04-13','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tables inspired by blockbuster films in the Marvel Cinematic Universe come together in this thrilling pack featuring \"Marvel\'s Guardians of the Galaxy\", \"Marvel\'s Avengers: Age of Ultron\" and \"Marvel\'s Ant-Man.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9639,'Garten of Banban 0','2025-02-21','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore the origins of the mysterious Banban’s Kindergarten. Survive the dark past of the establishment. Try to make some friends. Uncover the truth behind the place, and who you are','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zdf.jpg'),(9640,'Gumshoe','1988-06-15','Shooter, Platform, Arcade','Arcade, Nintendo Entertainment System','Jennifer\'s been kidnapped! Now\'s your chance to prove you\'re a sharp-shooting detective by helping Jennifer\'s father find the five diamonds that will pay her ransom. You\'ll use your Zapper light gun to blow away anything that gets in your way. But even with the Zapper, this case will be hard to crack. Because not only are the diamonds hard to find, but you only have 24 hours to find them! What\'s more, you\'ll have to think fast and shoot even faster, because ferocious monsters, diving airplanes and hungry man-eating sharks will stop at nothing to prevent you from getting to the diamonds. Think you\'re a sharp-shooting detective? Well, you better be. Because if you\'re not, it\'s curtains for you in this quick-on-the-trigger Nintendo Light Gun game!\n\nA direct port of the game was released for the Nintendo VS. System arcade machine in 1987.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42vs.jpg'),(9641,'Aquarium Travels','2022-12-14','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Recover aquariums from the evils of darkness! Aquarium Travels is an entertaining video game full of eye-popping visuals, just a click away! Recover the beautiful themed aquariums by repopulating them with fish, defending them from the threats that exist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hai.jpg'),(9642,'Logic Car','2021-07-01','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Logic Car is a coding-based puzzle game in which you program cars to achieve goals. Check the conditions given in each unique stage and take advantage of the various functions installed in the vehicle. Sometimes the laws of physics can be the solution. Now is the time to unleash your creativity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45ds.jpg'),(9643,'Vega Conflict: Bastion Cruiser Pack',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','The formidable Bastion Cruiser hulls boast built-in Counter-Chain and the Firestorm Overdrive which unleashes devastating damage when your shields drop.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9644,'Tinting Time','2023-04-14','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tinting Time is a Japanese-style crafting game. Play as a creator who can create all kinds of solutions, and spend some leisure time in the city of Folest. The game\'s creation system that combines crafting and complex resource management gameplay is eye-catching.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ily.jpg'),(9645,'Monstrix TCG Card Shop','2025-03-06','Simulator, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Monstrix TCG Card Shop – Where dreams become reality, and every card is a new adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hh5.jpg'),(9646,'Precision Point VR','2024-01-25','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Precision Point VR is a tactical VR shooter focused on close-quarters combat. Execute strategic breaches, rescue hostages, and engage in multiplayer shootouts. Whether you go solo or team up, each decision and bullet counts in this high-stakes SWAT-inspired experience.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77hw.jpg'),(9647,'GlobalMap Astro','2018-06-12','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','GlobalMap Astro is a program for observing the Universe in 3D format. It is your guide in a three-dimensional model of the Universe. It allows you to see 1.6 million galaxies, over 6 million stars (up to 13th magnitude), as well as planets, comets, asteroids, artificial satellites, spaceports and cities of our planet. Among the most interesting features of the product - to view the lunar and solar eclipses, planetary motion simulation, launch Soyuz rocket from the Baikonur Cosmodrome. Here, in this program, you can not only enjoy space objects, but also learn new facts and astronomical characteristics about them. The program allows you to study astronomy with varying degrees of dedication. It is incredibly interesting for both children and adults.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41bh.jpg'),(9648,'Dune: Imperium - Rise of Ix',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9649,'Legion War','2019-01-09','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Legion War \" is a 4X strategy game with fantasy style. As the leader of the legion,you must build your own castles and territory, explore the unknown lands, search for mysterious treasures, cultivate your own heroes and troops, exterminate other legions, and defeat the god who rules the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yhw.jpg'),(9650,'Captain America in: The Doom Tube of Dr. Megalomann','1988-12-31','Fighting, Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Amstrad CPC','Captain America in the Doom Tube of Dr. Megaloman is a platform/action game developed in 1987 for the Commodore 64 iIt is based on the comic book license of the same name.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zqbvhj7mspxdc7ygntqw.jpg'),(9651,'Disomnia: Lullaby','2014-09-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Direct sequel to Lullaby.\n\nEight years after what happened in Eve\'s house, Kira encounters a new conflict that will engulf the entire city of Salt Lake City in a new curse.\n\nThe story focuses on delving into the privacy of each of the adventure\'s three heroines: Kira, Avril, and Gisele. This way, as we advance through the two worlds that surround Salt Lake City, we will discover the past of each character and their reasons for acting as they do during the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38ra.jpg'),(9652,'Destroy All Humans!: DNA Collector\'s Edition','2021-06-29','Sin género','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','The cult-classic returns! Terrorize the people of 1950s Earth in the role of the evil alien Crypto-137. Harvest DNA and bring down the US government in the remake of the legendary alien invasion action-adventure. Annihilate puny humans using an assortment of alien weaponry and psychic abilities. Reduce their cities to rubble with your Flying Saucer! One giant step on mankind!\n\nThe DNA Collector\'s Edition includes:\n- Premium Box\n- Game: Destroy All Humans!\n- Crypto’N’Cow figurine 23cm x 9cm\n- Key Chain\n- 6 Lithographs\n- Eye-popping anti-stress toy\n- Included All In-Game Crypto Skins','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31cx.jpg'),(9653,'Relic Splatter','2020-11-30','Platform, Adventure','Web browser','Relic Splatter is an action-adventure game where you play as Rebecca Ciler, treasure hunter at the Relic Splatter Inc. Your goal is to find all the gold relics in each chamber with the use of your paintball gun. By coloring the walls you can spot secret passages and hidden relics. If you are a true collector there are also 2 secret red relics in each level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3crg.jpg'),(9654,'Track Masters Pro',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9655,'Accounting+','2018-10-18','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR, SteamVR, Oculus Rift, Oculus Quest','Accounting returns to its roots with Accounting+, a nIGHTMARE aDVENTURE cOMEDY made by Crows Crows Crows and designed with Squanch Games! Double the size of the original Accounting (one of the most popular titles on the HTC Vive), Accounting+ features new things that the original did not have, continuing to combine the absurd creative sensibilities of William Pugh (The Stanley Parable), Justin Roiland (Rick and Morty) and Dominik Johann (Minit) to baffling extremes.\n\nBefore the 19th of December 2017 there has never been a video game in which you join a gang with A Dog voiced by Rich Fulcher (The Mighty Boosh)… But we used to live in dark and disturbing times.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22m0.jpg'),(9656,'Forgotten Paths',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Awaken in a ruined world with no memory. A second chance to redeem yourself, but survival is a daily challenge. Aid survivors, manage madness with a black cat\'s help, and uncover your true purpose.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kux.jpg'),(9657,'Trainer Eyes',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9658,'Project: Icarus','2025-04-15','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Travel with Curias to the ancient greek future and go on a research mission about black holes. Explore the edge of space and time in this rogue-lite management game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oja.jpg'),(9659,'Shadowtime',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9660,'Star Wolves 2','2007-05-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Six years have passed after the events of 2226 A.D. The balance in the galaxy has been restored as transgalactic corporations have been deported to the outskirts of the galaxy and deprived of their power.\n\nThe Empire, just as before, continues to fight against the Aliens. As a rule armadas of battleships aren\'t used in such conflicts. Small maneuverable squadrons that can attack and retreat quickly are better suited for this type of war. This means that the famous Star Wolves team is back in action!\n\nStar Wolves is a 3D space RPG with deep strategy and tactical elements. The game thrusts players into a world of freelance space hunters during a time of war for the all-powerful Empire. Human space pirates, rogue AI computers that rebelled against humanity and Aliens roam space in search of easy prey and planets to conquer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co422n.jpg'),(9661,'I Don\'t Hate Hentai Puzzles','2019-11-13','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a hentai puzzle with a plot!. Plot-twists, humor, hot anime girls, small crack in the 4th wall and warning about what can happen to all of us, depicted in 3 acts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27ri.jpg'),(9662,'Pangya: Fantasy Golf','2009-07-23','Role-playing (RPG), Sport','PlayStation Portable','In Pangya: Fantasy Golf, players practice and perfect their swing on the nine fantasy fairways of Pangya Island. Combining golf gameplay, endless customization options and a slew of sassy female characters set in beautiful environments, PANGYA: Fantasy Golf is based on the global PC MMO PANGYA game developed by Ntreev Soft, and boasts an original storyline with new, exclusive features for the PSP system. Players can utilize the in-game Pangya Shop to customize as many as 18 playable characters and their golf equipment with thousands of unlockable accessories, outfits, gear and power items to improve their golfer\'s stats and land that hole-in-one. Multiple gameplay modes including Story, Free Round, License, Tournament and Network Mode offer an engaging and varied golf experience. Additionally, Network Mode allows the ultimate golf gaming fan to connect with up to eight players and compete against one another in either single or team-based tournaments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hhv.jpg'),(9663,'Transporter',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9664,'Commander: Conquest of the Americas','2010-07-30','Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Combining elements from both trading and strategy games, Commander: Conquest of the Americas will appeal to a wide range of players.Players take charge of one of the many European powers aiming to conquer the New World. Starting from 16th century, players can choose from many different nations, each with their own unique strengths and weaknesses. Founding new colonies and then making them thrive is key to success. In order to accomplish this, players need to manage and optimize resources and production in their colonies, before transporting the goods to other colonies or back to Europe.Rival powers and Native Americans can prove to be allies or enemies, depending on the player decisions. Hostile fleets engage each other in highly detailed tactical level. Players can command their ships in RTS fashion or take direct control themselves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eii.jpg'),(9665,'Cornucopia of Kaizo','2021-08-06','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','27 easy light Kaizo levels for your enjoyment! Can you find all the secret messages?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cm4.jpg'),(9666,'Gates of Horizon','2014-12-18','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Gates of Horizon is a space conquest online game.\nDuring your space journey you will gain power over the universe leading fleets, improving and managing crew and assets, taking control of entire sectors with your corporation and fighting the alien menace that threatens the human race.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9667,'Distress','2018-01-19','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Distress is a Yume Nikki fangame made for the 4th Dream Diary Jam. Help Saya find the effects, there are a total of 11. You can mix up all the effect together, making a total of 55 mixes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rum.jpg'),(9668,'Into The Dread',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9669,'Cities: Skylines - Content Creator Pack: Africa in Miniature','2023-03-22','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cities: Skylines presents Africa In Miniature: a Content Creator Pack set in the African Continent that includes 28 new buildings inspired by the existing urban masterpieces and unique architectural concepts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69lo.jpg'),(9670,'Monster Pub','2017-10-31','Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Monster Pub is a casual narrative game about finding friends in a new town.\n\nPlay as monster-you and meet the barflies at the local public house!\nBond through the power of conversation! Play card games! Be a good friend, or kind of a crummy friend!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99tx.jpg'),(9671,'You Can\'t Save Her','2024-09-01','Adventure','Web browser','You have three seconds to kill your former friend.\n\nThe nuns and sacred algorithms have willed it.\n\nAnd no matter how much you want to save her, you can’t.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yvl.jpg'),(9672,'Private Lessons',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','A visual novel from Dumb Crow.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jkiborvhljc1tfmzns4y.jpg'),(9673,'Sonic Winter Adventures','2013-04-28','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qi7.jpg'),(9674,'Bunny Bond','2023-09-14','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bunny Bond is a steamy visual novel where you can chat, flirt, and fall in love with 6 handsome guys! Enjoy fun interactions with the group, send DMs to whoever catches your eye, and collect all of the sexy pictures they send to you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co772q.jpg'),(9675,'Super Robot Taisen X-Ω','2015-10-04','Strategy, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','A Super Robot Wars mobile game that breaks from traditional Super Robot Wars turn-based strategy and uses a strategic line defense game play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zqb.jpg'),(9676,'The Legend of the Lost Temple','1992-03-31','Platform','Acorn Archimedes','The Legend of the Lost Temple is a platformer that takes place in the rain forest of Peru where an ancient tribe has lived in peace for thousands of year until a group of archaeologists stumbles upon it. The visitors carry a virus that the natives have no immunity to and soon everyone but the young and strong members of the community falls ill. The player takes control of one such young man, Kanu, who sets out to find a temple located deep within a mountain. It is believed that entombed in the temple is an elixir that can save the natives. It is the player\'s task to find this elixir. Like in other platformers the game involves moving left and right and jumping between platforms while combating a large amount of different creatures (bees, eagles, green men etc.) that stand in the player\'s way. To kill the enemies Kanu has an unlimited supply of axes (similar to Wonder Boy and Adventure Island) that can be thrown. Other weapons can be acquired by picking up green or blue shields. The green shield gives a mace while the blue shield gives a bolt of magic. Other collectibles include gems that give bonus points and various potions that give increased abilities such as higher jumps, temporary invulnerability, increases fire rate, freeze monsters and provide extra lives. When starting out Kanu has four lives and a limited amount of life blood. Life blood is drained when contact with enemies are made and when it is all gone a life is lost.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ftr.jpg'),(9677,'Toriki: The Castaway Island',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9678,'Golf Solitaire Simple','2021-10-22','Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A simple Golf Solitaire game with several common rule variations and a challenge mode! Can you beat all of the levels?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61vo.jpg'),(9679,'Department of the Devil','2022-10-24','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re trapped in hell for all eternity - at least, that\'s what the paperwork says. Can you escape by snooping around the private office of The Devil himself? Or will you get caught by his watchful eye?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j77.jpg'),(9680,'Gomorrah','2023-02-16','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A dark and suspenseful narrative RPG about an Italian mafia family, where morality is tested with every branching decision.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6602.jpg'),(9681,'Three Against the Odds',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9682,'Ys X: Nordics - Advanced Pack','2024-10-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co952b.jpg'),(9683,'Nox Archaist Game Bundle',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6g2z.jpg'),(9684,'Shores of Plunder','2023-12-05','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Avast ye! Welcome aboard to the ultimate pirate adventure in SHORES OF PLUNDER! Battle friends, outlast hordes of enemies, and amass the greatest fortune in the seven seas. Race against time on a dangerous island filled with treasure, then unwind in a secret pirate cove full of shenanigans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hlj.jpg'),(9685,'Choujikuu Yousai Macross 2036','1992-04-03','Shooter','Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','A side scrolling shooter for the PC-Engine Super CD format, set in the Macross universe. Developed and published by Masaya in 1992.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/aubh4qozjbghqbmprfyf.jpg'),(9686,'1 Million Zombies','2023-12-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','1 Million Zombies is a post-apocalyptic action game where the player takes on a world overrun by hordes of the undead. The objective of the game is to survive as long as possible by driving a series of vehicles and eliminating as many zombies as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ghi.jpg'),(9687,'Beauty Contest','2020-11-08','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Clara wants to take first place in a Beauty Contest but meets her long-time rival Sherly and childhood friend Olivia. Will Clara be able to win, or will other feelings awaken in her?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m2j.jpg'),(9688,'Acheton','1986-12-31','Adventure','Acorn Archimedes, BBC Microcomputer System, ZX Spectrum, Call-A-Computer time-shared mainframe computer system, DOS, Amstrad CPC, Amstrad PCW','Achteon was originally released on a mainframe computer, similar to Zork. And just like Zork it is a fantasy treasure hunt with 400 rooms and 200 objects, and therefore is much bigger than its more famous companion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/veearjac6jp64kusn3pm.jpg'),(9689,'Velev','2025-04-09','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, MOBA','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dive into VELEV\'s depths, a hidden world where technology and nature merge. Embark on quests, battle monsters, and unveil mysteries with enhanced gear. Experience intense PvPvE combat, strategic team play across diverse classes, and continuous character growth through exploration and extraction','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xny.jpg'),(9690,'River City Super Sports Challenge: All Stars Special','2015-11-04','Sport, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is the River City sports challenge! The Rule is simple, be the # 1 in 4 events by all means. That\'s it! Hitting and kicking? Of course! Wooden swords dumbbells and even bombs are available to use. The great sports challenge where anything\'s possible has just begun!!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yl1.jpg'),(9691,'Launcher Heroes','2023-08-10','Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Launcher Heroes is a tactical, artillery, party game where you try to knock your opponents off the world. Use an assortment of items such as bombs, rockets, and jetpacks to help you navigate and destroy the terrain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67ox.jpg'),(9692,'Halo Wars 2: Operation Spearbreaker','2017-07-25','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30zr.jpg'),(9693,'Raia Nova','2025-02-18','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The greatest tournament of all time has gone terribly wrong. Warriors from different lands do battle and form alliances in the wake of a strange mind wiping spell. Battle hordes of creatures and duel crazy characters in this funny fanservicey ARPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lwm.jpg'),(9694,'Street Fighter V: Luke','2021-11-29','Fighting','PlayStation 4','This DLC adds Luke as a fighter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gwf.jpg'),(9695,'Pyxole',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','\"Pyxole\" is a vibrant pixel art creation and exploration game where players craft characters and worlds, sharing their masterpieces in a community-driven universe. Dive into a realm where creativity meets collaboration, bringing to life endless possibilities in pixel art form.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82qw.jpg'),(9696,'VA-11 Hall-A Kids','2018-04-01','Point-and-click, Adventure, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','VA-11 Hall-A Kids is a freeware game released on the April Fools of 2018.\n\nThe game is a light-hearted parody of VA-11 Hall-A, set in a high school with the female cast changed into schoolgirls. The plot follows Dana Zane as she investigate who crashed Sei\'s festival booth. Gameplay is very simple, involving mostly talking with the characters and looking into places or people. The game is also very short, being finished in a matter of minutes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25ze.jpg'),(9697,'Timberlodge Inn','2022-08-31','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','On your way to Firemore you start feeling exhausted and dizzy. You decide you have to stop at the nearest motel to take some rest. Though what seemed as a quiet night at first quickly makes a turn to a hellish nightmare while you discover the unsettling and unnerving secrets of the town\'s past.\n\nWelcome to Timberlodge Inn.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9698,'Nyanroo the Supercat','2021-03-10','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chosen by a magic cloth you must face a gang of evil dogs trying to conquer the world.\n\nGather different abilities with the help of the Power Yarns scattered through the world to slash and pounce your way through 14 stages and 7 amazing bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hzu.jpg'),(9699,'ACA Neo Geo: Metal Slug 4','2018-08-09','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Metal Slug 4 is an action shooting game released by SNK in 2002 andit marks as the fifth title in the Metal Slug series. In addition to Marco and Fio, the brand new characters, Trevor and Nadia have joined the battle! Use the new items effectively and get the highest score with the new Metallish System!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qvs.jpg'),(9700,'Moto Roader','2007-07-06','Racing, Arcade','Wii, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','Moto Roader is a futuristic racing game that allows up to five players to compete against each other. Players use the cash earned when they win a race to power up their machine. Not only can they change the \"tire\" and \"body\" of their vehicles, but they also can add \"special\" parts. Jump over tall obstacles with a \"hopper\" and blast past rivals at incredible speeds with \"nitro.\" What multiplayer game would be complete without attack items? Use a forward-launching \"grenade\" or a backward-dropping \"bomber\" to blow up and knock away rivals. Outmaneuver rivals in all eight heats to become the champion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o1m.jpg'),(9701,'Knights of Xentar','1991-07-06','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series, Sharp X68000, DOS, FM Towns, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','Dragon Knight III is an eroge role-playing video game released on many Japanese PCs in 1991. It is part of the Dragon Knight series of games created by Japanese game developer ELF, who originally released the game for the NEC PC-9801 computer in 1991, followed by ports for the Sharp X68000 and PC Engine CD platforms.\n\nThe game is a sequel of Dragon Knight and Dragon Knight II. Its gameplay system is different from that of previous installments of the Dragon Knight series, resembling this of the early Final Fantasy (even more in the PC version) series instead of first-person-view dungeon crawler, and enabling the player to explore the entire world of the game. Some of the characters were renamed in the English and German localized Knights of Xentar release, including the protagonist Takeru\'s name changed to Desmond.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28bj.jpg'),(9702,'Destroy','1989-02-01','Fighting','DOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a8i.jpg'),(9703,'Zettai Zetsumei Shoujo: Kokuu no Houteishiki','2023-08-24','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','30 minutes left until the girl\'s death... \"Zettai Zetsumei Shoujo\" is a short science fiction visual novel that pays homage to \"Cold Equations\" and \"Trolley Problem\". You will be forced to make a life choice: a girl who stows away on a spaceship to meet her mother, or a group of victims of a space accident waiting to be rescued. Choose the life you want to save and see the girl\'s fate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gcn.jpg'),(9704,'LiEat: The Lie-Eating Dragon & the Azure Dreameater','2014-06-11','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The second game in the LiEat trilogy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2noi.jpg'),(9705,'Jump Force','2017-12-12','Adventure, Arcade','Android','Tap the player carefully through each obstacle! you get more points and you can share it with your friends. Be careful not to pass through the wrong obstacle, or you\'ll have to start again.\n\nThis is my second Game for Android, I would like you support me and download, test it and give me your experiences, It would help me to improve ... if you like it, share it... thank you in advance','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27zu.jpg'),(9706,'Texas Tango','2017-08-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Texas Tango is an experimental hardcore physics game which is bullets can be collide in the air. \nWith a lots of blood and a lots of fun, explode the opponents and see them flying in the air.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9707,'The Time Warp of Dr. Brain','1996-11-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vh5.jpg'),(9708,'The Fugitives',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lsv.jpg'),(9709,'Laetus.',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Laetus. is a rapid 2D precision platformer focused on speed and skill. You play as a small yet swift circle racing against the developer for the fastest time. Speed your way through challenging levels and use all aspects of your movement and colour-changing abilities to finish in record time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4olv.jpg'),(9710,'Where in Space is Carmen Sandiego?: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Puzzle','DOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/esctfu7b14fgdzi3pjvd.jpg'),(9711,'Square Keeper','2022-06-09','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Square Keeper is a puzzle game, based on a card system, where each card gives the player the possibility to execute different actions, like a sword swing, shooting with a bow or simply walking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nyc.jpg'),(9712,'Hina-chan no Yakiniku Party','2015-09-11','Strategy, Indie','Android','A doujin game by ISY based on the Touhou Project series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yk8.jpg'),(9713,'Enter the Gungeon: Deluxe Edition','2017-12-14','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','This version includes:\n\n- The physical version of Enter the Gungeon with all DLC,\n- Exclusive “Shotgun Kin” Playable Skin\n- Exclusive Stickers\n- Exclusive Bullet Kin Paper craft\n- Reversible Jacket Artwork and a download code for the Original Soundtrack of Enter the Gungeon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8im5.jpg'),(9714,'Vermiworm',NULL,'Arcade','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9715,'Cyberun','1986-12-31','Shooter','ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC, MSX','In the dark reaches of the Amobeus Nebula stands the isolated series of stars and planets, the Beta Gamma System. But to those who have taken the Space, the Zebarema. A tightly bound cluster of planets and dark stars, totally unique in the Whole Universe, bound together by a lattice of Plasmic Energy, extending between one and all Planets in the System. Each Planet is composed of Anti-element Cybertron, it is the only known source in the whole universe and such is its value that many such civilisations have devoted their entire resources to prying off one of the smaller outer planets from the main cluster, in a futile bid to gain access to the untold wealth it would bring, once free from its Anti-elemental Nest. For once the Cybertron is free from the Antiplasmic Lattice, and becomes exposed to positive matter Space, it crystallises to form Cybernite the hardest substance in the known Universe, resistant to all forms of heat and energy, allowing the wielders to mine the greatest form of energy ever, the stars. For who can control the Zebarema, can control the Galaxy. \nBut the Beta Gamma system \"Zebarema\" is reluctant to give up its Cybernite Crystals and exerts an almost unbeatable magnetronic pull on all matter trying to escape its protective envelope. Thus the undertaking of construction of an enormous carrier of the precious Cargo, the Crystal Ship. \nMany years and many lives have been spent on this vast Space Sailer and the time draws near, for the ship\'s destined function, for only the Superlative Power of one such vessel can resist the magnetronic pull exerted by the system on any leaving body. Dut to its immense size, the ship has been constructed in stages which have already been shipped out to the Zebarema System. These propulsion units are of little use elsewhere in the Galaxy and have been constructed solely for the use as escape Engines and Auxiliaries which obey the strange plysical laws particular to the Beta Gamma System.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/f8qvysdyrjaustbmwkil.jpg'),(9716,'Aerostar','1991-12-31','Shooter','Game Boy','After the end of the Sixth World War, the Earth has been rendered inhospitable and uninhabitable by humanity. The Intergalactic Council ruled that Earth could once again be used by humans and sent people there to restore civilization there. Meanwhile, mutants have prospered in the long-lost wastelands of Earth and were unwilling to allow the humans to have it again. The Intergalactic Council has sent in a lone fighter called Aerostar to defend the Earth from a second act of total destruction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hh7.jpg'),(9717,'Genrou','2012-08-30','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Set in the year 1179. The protagonist, Saya, is a 12 year old girl who lives in a small village. Having lost her mother to disease, the young girl lives her days alone working for the head of the village. From a young age, she has the ability to see through lies, possessing what is called “Heaven’s Eye”. One day, a magnificent troop visited her home, and a young man kneeled before her respectfully, saying,\n\n“I have come to retrieve you, M’lady.”\n\nA new world she has never seen before, and coming to meet the entourage led by Minamoto no Yoshitsune. As the era moves towards the “Genpei War” that the land of Japan becomes involved in, Saya has yet to know this at the time….','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kjz.jpg'),(9718,'Dyo','2018-02-14','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as two minotaurs.\nConnect your screens to help each other out and escape the maze.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28xx.jpg'),(9719,'Momotype','2021-12-03','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The monotype, an off-shoot virtual pet, is being play-tested by members of your company. You have been selected.\n\nAn experimental, retro take on tamogotchi-lite games. Will you fulfill Momo\'s needs or does he need something greater?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49xb.jpg'),(9720,'Etherium','2015-03-25','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Etherium is the new, futuristic real-time strategy game developed by Tindalos Interactive, the studio that created Stellar Impact. This strategy game, exclusively for PC, offers a particularly dynamic and edgy gameplay with innovative game mechanics that revitalize the genre.\n\nIn Etherium, three empires are engaged in a merciless struggle to control a handful of planets that contain rich deposits of etherium, a mysterious resource coveted by all. In the multiplayer or solo campaign modes, you lead one of these three factions, each with its own characteristics, strengths, weaknesses, technologies and special abilities, and engage in titanic battles to gain total control of the etherium!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qee.jpg'),(9721,'Ax Battler: A Legend of Golden Axe','1991-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Sega Game Gear','Use your wits and your razor sharp sword to recapture the Golden Axe from the diabolical Death Adder. Defeat skeletons and giant bats in dark, deep chasms and caves. And summon Earth, Thunder and Fire Magic to fight gargoyles that come to life before your eyes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47yt.jpg'),(9722,'The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild - Throwback Expansion','2020-12-13','Adventure','Wii U','A The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild mod which adds Whomp\'s Fortress from Super Mario 64 in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6np6.jpg'),(9723,'Xenoage: Knight of the Rihas',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Civil wars continue throughout Fantasido continent. The United Kingdom of Refando is the only country where peace is said to exist. Lemuel Dettervolf is the son of the feudal lord reigning over the entire district of Shulenburg, within this kingdom. There remains a horrible secret from the past that only a few people in the entire country are aware of. Without ever divulging this secret, Lemuel has grown to become the foremost swordsman within and without his country. His goal is to restore peace to the continent. Never again will the tragedy that he experienced as a child occur ever again. However, full-scale war breaks out. Lemuel takes up his sword to defend the country he loves. \nThe battle develops with turn-style tactics. You order your party (up to 5 characters) to advance into war. There are over 60 different types of magic and assault tactics to use in this animated game. The battle rages on...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xhp.jpg'),(9724,'Dasshutsu Game: Momo',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9725,'Tiger Tank 59 I: Winter Assault MP047',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','\"Tiger Tank 59 I Winter Assault\" is a top-down shooting gameIn this game. Players need to control their tanks, through the enemy lines, break the enemy base, or defeat the enemy tanks. The DLC include map pack 047.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9726,'Mage Tower, A Tower Defense Card Game','2023-04-25','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Draft a deck of cards against an AI opponent then battle them in tower defense-inspired card combat. A 2013 adaptation of the card game, released the same year.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6exq.jpg'),(9727,'Hogwarts Legacy: Onyx Hippogriff Mount','2023-11-14','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','This includes: the Onyx Hippogriff Mount.\n\nHogwarts Legacy is an open-world action RPG set in the world first introduced in the Harry Potter books. Embark on a journey through familiar and new locations as you explore and discover magical beasts, customize your character and craft potions, master spell casting, upgrade talents and become the wizard you want to be.\n\nExperience Hogwarts in the 1800s. Your character is a student who holds the key to an ancient secret that threatens to tear the wizarding world apart. Make allies, battle Dark wizards, and ultimately decide the fate of the wizarding world. Your legacy is what you make of it. Live the Unwritten.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93rs.jpg'),(9728,'F-Zero GX','2003-07-25','Racing','Nintendo GameCube','F-Zero GX is the fourth installment in the F-Zero series and the successor to F-Zero X. The game continues the series\' difficult, high-speed racing style, retaining the basic gameplay and control system from the Nintendo 64 title. A heavy emphasis is placed on track memorization and reflexes, which aids in completing the title. GX introduces a \"Story Mode\" element, where the player walks in the footsteps of Captain Falcon through nine chapters, completing various missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co525x.jpg'),(9729,'Spider-Man & Friends: Doc Ock\'s Challenge','2005-12-31','Sin género','V.Smile','Spider-Man helps young children learn science, like mirrors and lenses, and the solar system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ybmlsokjarfossqy4m3h.jpg'),(9730,'Devil Tears','2021-10-07','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Devil Tears is a 2D platformer in which the player jumps over the cells, heading for the exit, blocks fall from above that can crush him, spikes are placed on the levels. You must overcome all levels using your reaction and logical thinking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yzu.jpg'),(9731,'Ballz Drop',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9732,'RDF 1985','1983-12-31','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Apple II','RDF 1985 is a computer wargame, the second entry in SSI\'s \"When Superpowers Collide\". It simulates a fictional conflict between the United States and the Soviet Union.\n\nThis game simulates the fictional attempt of the Soviet Union to capture oil fields in the Middle East. To combat them the United States sends in the Rapid Deployment Force (RDF).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/milxicimd8cua6wha8fm.jpg'),(9733,'Master Reboot','2013-10-29','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U','Imagine a world where death is no longer final, where precious memories are saved to enjoy forever, where your soul is immortal, welcome to the Soul Cloud. Upload your soul to our dedicated servers and relax knowing that a part of you will live on for eternity. That favorite holiday, happy moments from your childhood, meeting that special someone for the first time. All these memories saved for your digital soul for your family to revisit again and again. The Soul Cloud - saving your past to secure your future.\n\nMaster Reboot is a haunting first person sci-fi adventure horror game set inside the Soul Cloud. It\'s an exploration game with action and puzzle elements set across 34 unique environments. In the not-too-distant future exists the Soul Cloud, a giant server that holds the data of your soul and your memories when you die. The Soul Cloud is filled with floating islands, each island looks like a town, village or city filled with rooms, skyscrapers and houses that hold people’s memories. To house your Soul, a family member (or you before you die) must purchase an island on the Soul Cloud where the server will generate rooms, houses or skyscrapers that hold each and every memory from the deceased’s past. The game features a distinctive visual style, intriguing story-line, psychological adventure-game action and a dynamic atmospheric soundtrack. Get prepared for upload......Where am I?.....Who am I?......It\'s time to piece your life......and death back together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qnn.jpg'),(9734,'Malcatras\' Maiden','2024-05-23','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','uhh super power battle maid.. the girls are so stupid becuase they are too gay.. puppy girl barfs in her childhood flashabck becauyse she needs mommy so bad.. yea gothic horror! or psychosexual thriller...? yes, this is malmaid','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c4f.jpg'),(9735,'HexDefense','2024-07-19','Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','HexDefense is a roguelike tower defense with an emphasis on constant action with little to no downtime. Defend your city by building towers, upgrading them with money from their fallen foes, and equipping them with strange items you find out in the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64ay.jpg'),(9736,'NBA 2K10: Draft Combine','2009-09-03','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','NBA 2K10 is a basketball video game based on the National Basketball Association developed by Visual Concepts and published by 2K Sports. It was released on October 6, 2009 on Xbox 360, PlayStation 2, PlayStation 3 and PSP and on October 12, 2009 on Windows. It was released on Wii on November 9, 2009 in North America. It was released in Europe on November 27.[1] Kobe Bryant is the cover athlete of the game.[2] The game is the first PSP and Wii release of the NBA 2K series, and the first on a Nintendo system since NBA 2K3 for the GameCube. The Wii version, while containing version-specific controls and nuances, is a general port of the Xbox 360 and PS3 versions - including all the modes (online and offline) of the current-gen iterations.[3] The PSP release is essentially a port of the PlayStation 2 version, though lacking online play.[4] Kanye West, Twista, Pitbull , The Game, David Banner & Asher Roth appeared in the video game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hh6lsmq6b8srzqubj0yw.jpg'),(9737,'Undercity',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Try yourself as the subway train driver. You should transport a lot of people according to a schedule. Your reward depends on this. The money can be used to improve the train or to transfer to another major city where you can already drive a new and powerful train. Enter the subway car quickly, do not drive past the stations and arrive right according to the schedule, when the timer is at 0. Not before and not later. Also watch out for vandals and terrorists!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cmu.jpg'),(9738,'Aesthetic','2019-10-11','Indie','Web browser','A game about personal revelations, self reflection, and Magic: The Gathering cards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co950u.jpg'),(9739,'Key 10th Memorial BOX','2009-07-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A special box celebrating the tenth anniversary of Key which contains six games: Kanon, Air, CLANNAD, planetarian ~the reverie of a little planet~, Tomoyo After ~It\'s a Wonderful Life~, Little Busters! Ecstasy, a large-sized t-shirt, a coffee mug, an artbook, six boxes of posters featuring characters from the game, several postcards depicting the heroines of each game, and a thank you document which is signed by all of the key members at Key.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3sm2.jpg'),(9740,'Tontie ver.1','2004-05-26','Arcade','Web browser','This is a kind of evolved whack-a-mole game.\nah, a kind of action game or like that.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kat.jpg'),(9741,'Landfall Archives','2023-03-31','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Break into the Landfall Archives to steal and play previously unreleased games, demos, interactive slide shows, and even an unreleased version of Totally Accurate Battle Simulator from 2017!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6cdf.jpg'),(9742,'Super Blockbreak 3D','2017-07-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super Blockbreak 3D is an action game where you use all your reactions and skills to bounce a ball around an arena breaking blocks as you go. Play to unlock all 30 levels or challenge yourself to get high scores.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9743,'Primateria','2024-01-08','Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take a dive in a Card Game experience dipped in Roguelike and Deckbulding. Combine cards together to make them stronger, discover mysterious items imbued with magic, duel divine creatures, perform combos with infinite combinations and possibilities. Can you be the one to reach the surface?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6idc.jpg'),(9744,'Dragon Nexus','2024-03-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Engage in pulse-pounding combat that hones your abilities. Ride majestic dragons, command their powers, and turn the tide of battle. Reach for the skies and forge an unbreakable bond in a world of danger and beauty. Your destiny beckons in Dragon Nexus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co710y.jpg'),(9745,'Planetbase','2018-01-22','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Guide a group of space settlers trying to establish an outpost on a remote planet. Grow food, collect energy, mine resources, manufacture bots, and build a fully self-sufficient colony.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mn1.jpg'),(9746,'Touhou Genso Maroku','2011-12-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Touhou Genso Maroku is a traditional turn-based RPG released at Comiket 81. It is much like The Genius of Sappheiros, its predecessor from the same creator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51b0.jpg'),(9747,'Physics Sandbox VR',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','No time limits, no objectives .. just physics!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kex.jpg'),(9748,'Iron Dungeon','2023-10-03','Shooter, Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Iron Dungeon combines a twin-stick shooter, a 2d platformer, and a roguelite. Explore a dangerous underground complex searching for dozens of weapons, gadgets, and upgrades to find a way to the surface and discover if there is still life on Earth!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hfg.jpg'),(9749,'Gangpire: Fire & Fury',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9750,'The Backyard','1993-12-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67rv.jpg'),(9751,'Casual Fight','2024-01-15','Indie','Android, iOS','What is she so desperately searching for?\nBegin your adventure now. Begin your adventure now.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nnf.jpg'),(9752,'Space Sergeants',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Dynamic shooter','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41vs.jpg'),(9753,'Extreme Ghostbusters: The Ultimate Invasion','2004-03-01','Shooter','PlayStation','The Extreme Ghostbusters have detected highly paranormal activity! They must now act quickly to find out who is behind this new threat! Choose between 4 characters and 3 exclusive game modes (Training, Arcade and Adventure.) Confront dozens of enemies each one more terrifying than the next.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co685u.jpg'),(9754,'Nudel Tag','2024-04-04','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','In Nudel Tag, challenge your friends to get the most tips, in a crazy ramen restaurant ! Find up to 4 controllers, to have the most fun, and see who is the best waiter in the house !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76li.jpg'),(9755,'Zanfium Tower',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Welcome to Zanfium Tower, a single/multiplayer casual (desktop) VR experience. The game centers around Zanfium Tower, a collection of mini-locations found in the large metro tower. Zanfium Tower brings together content from 3 games to create a unique and immersive game with rotating free content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59cf.jpg'),(9756,'Space Hero Line','2017-08-24','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The time has come for the brave to rise up. One of the most dynamic game, seriously pinch your nerves now wanting to see the opportunity to personally enjoy.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9757,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization V: Gods & Kings','2012-06-22','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sid Meier\'s Civilization V: Gods and Kings is the first expansion pack for Civilization V - the critically acclaimed 2010 PC Game of the Year. This robust expansion covers the entire scope of time from founding your first Pantheon of the Gods and spreading religion across the world, to deploying your spies in enemy cities in order to steal information and technology.\n\nAs you move through the ages, you’ll interact with new types of city-states, engage in new city-state quests and global competitions, and master exciting new systems for land and naval combat. Civilization V: Gods and Kings will also include nine new civilizations, nine new wonders, three original scenarios, and dozens of new units, buildings, and techs that will offer even more ways for players to expand their empire and dominate the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fuy.jpg'),(9758,'Totem Clash','2025-02-26','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Collect blocks to summon units and defeat ghosts! Totem Clash is a roguelike tower fence game where you summon units through blocks to defeat ghosts. Combine and strengthen various units to reclaim areas occupied by ghosts. Use each unit\'s unique characteristics to strategically defeat ghosts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mzq.jpg'),(9759,'Diner Simulator: Horror Story','2025-01-23','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Take on the role of a night shift worker at a small fast food kiosk, where mystery awaits. Your predecessor has vanished under eerie circumstances, and it\'s now your job to uncover the truth. As you juggle late-night orders, unsettling occurrences start to unravel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96j5.jpg'),(9760,'MLB 09: The Show','2009-03-03','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','MLB 09: The Show is a baseball simulation video game developed by SCE San Diego Studio and published by Sony Computer Entertainment for the PlayStation 2, PlayStation 3, and PlayStation Portable systems. It belongs to the Major League Baseball game series on the PlayStation systems. MLB 09: The Show is the fourth edition of the MLB: The Show series.\n\nThe game is a baseball simulation in which, depending on the gameplay mode, the player controls one or all of the players on a Major League Baseball team or some select Minor League Baseball teams. Depending on the gameplay mode, the player may control a team for a single game, season, or franchise, and can also create a player and control his career.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co726m.jpg'),(9761,'Fallout: New Vegas - Old World Blues','2011-07-19','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The residents of the Mojave have long assumed the trackless wastes of the ‘Big Empty’ are a no-man\'s-land, a desolate stretch where no living thing can survive. In Old World Blues, you discover that it is anything but...\n\nAfter being transported to the Big MT research crater, you find you\'re the only hope of saving the Think Tank – the strange group of post-human researchers who inhabit the facility. They enlist your aid to save them from their own experiments - experiments that have gone horribly out of control. As you explore the huge stretch of the Big MT crater and its many underground labs, you’ll confront strange mutated animals, battle terrifying new atomic robots, and discover a new home base to call your own. Recover all the weapons, armor, and tech of the Pre-War era and use them to help save all of Science!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dt6.jpg'),(9762,'Cutey Honey FX','1995-10-10','Adventure','PC-FX','The game is based on Go Nagai\'s manga, that was later made into anime TV series. Rather than following the plot of the manga, the game has the player assume the role of a nameless male detective, who is headed to a fictional country called Austral Island in search of a missing girl. When the hero arrives on the island, he soon discovers that there is some sort of a supernatural organization that might be the reason for the girl\'s disappearance. Then he hooks up with Honey Kisaragi, the heroine of the manga and TV series, who is an android that can assume various combat forms and fight evil creatures.\n\nThis is an adventure game with simple interaction (point-and-click), the cursor turning blue for looking at objects and yellow for using them or talking to people. At some screens there are multiple dialogue choices. There are no puzzles in the game, but sometimes the player controls Honey in combat sequences, which play like a mini-game that involves pressing a button as many times as possible within a time limit, and choosing vulnerable spots on the enemy\'s body to execute attacks. There is also a map of the island which the player can navigate the main character on.\n\nUnlike many other Japanese adventures, characters are animated on almost every screen in Cutey Honey FX, and a large portion of the game is occupied by anime-style movies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7779.jpg'),(9763,'Commander Keen',NULL,'Platform','Android, iOS','Time to kick some asteroid! ZeniMax Online Studios is thrilled to announce Commander Keen, coming soon to iOS and Android devices. Play as twin geniuses Billy and Billie as they race to save the galaxy with their brawls-to-the-wall collection of gadgets and a heapin’ helpin’ of well-intentioned mayhem.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1lvl.jpg'),(9764,'Saber Punks',NULL,'Fighting, Sport, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Sin plataforma','VR Fighting Game with energy weapons that let you sling attacks at your enemy. Directional combos activate special attacks like stun, spin, and Unblockable. Get active in an action-packed duel that you can play online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ajq.jpg'),(9765,'Densetsu no Starfy 2',NULL,'Platform','Wii U, Game Boy Advance','Stafy is now back at Pufftop Palace, playing with his friend Moe. Ogura, imprisoned inside the Magic Jar, unleashes his children into the sky. Ogura\'s children cause a series of thunderstorms and earthquakes that shake Pufftop Palace, causing the Magic Jar to shatter and release Ogura.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4an7.jpg'),(9766,'I\'d Kill You as a Worm','2025-05-09','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You turned into a worm and your boyfriend broke up with you. it\'s time to get revenge','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9euf.jpg'),(9767,'Clergyman',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Clergyman is a simple 2D platformer with elements of survival in which you will need to pass quite a variety of levels, playing for a priest.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9768,'Toast Astronauts','2024-12-06','Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Complete all tasks or exile the assasin!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mzs.jpg'),(9769,'Dredge','2023-03-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dredge is a fishing adventure with a sinister undercurrent. Sell your catch, upgrade your vessel and dredge the depths for long-buried relics. Explore the stories of the strange locals and discover why some things are best left forgotten.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kyk.jpg'),(9770,'Tony Hawk\'s American Wasteland: Collector\'s Edition','2005-11-18','Sport','PlayStation 2','Now you can cruise through LA without loading levels or stopping gameplay in Tony Hawk\'s American Wasteland. You can skate or BMX through a new story mode that takes you through all-new skate areas using tricks that have never appeared in previous Tony Hawk games. The cash that you earn can be used to customize your equipment and your skater by going to tattoo parlors and skate shops. Tony Hawk\'s American Wasteland also includes a classic mode that features classic Tony Hawk Pro Skater maps and objectives.\n\nIncluded in this edition:\n- Tony Hawk\'s American Wasteland\n- Two exclusive classic mode levels\n- Two exclusive secret characters\n- The \"Making of Tony Hawk\'s American Wasteland\" documentary\n- A concept art gallery featuring creations by legendary artist Jimbo Philips','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g2e.jpg'),(9771,'Trainz Plus: NR Class Locomotive - National Rail Mega Pack','2023-07-12','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The NationalRail NR class locomotive was introduced in 1996, and became the most numerous locomotive on the Australian railway network, numbering 120 units. These locomotive are seen on freight trains all over Australia, as well as the famed Indian Pacific, Ghan, and Overland passenger trains.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9772,'Sword and Stone',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Gather your party for a procedurally generated open-world adventure in this Skyrim meets Minecraft multiplayer RPG. Gather resources, craft weapons, embark on epic quests, and erect a city to last for thousands of years. Have caution, though, these lands are cursed and desperate to destroy you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42sr.jpg'),(9773,'Moxie 2','2010-06-01','Puzzle','iOS','Moxie 2 is the FUN word transformation game...easy to learn, but challenging to master. You start with a hand of 64 letters that you go through \"Solitaire\" style. Place each letter on the board or \"Pass\". If you \"Pass\" you can\'t go back to that letter. Once you spell a word and start transforming it into other words, don\'t break the word chain! That\'s a \"Twaddle\" and you\'ll lose points. There\'s no time limit and while it helps to know a lot of words, Moxie will more greatly reward those who like to think strategically.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9774,'How a Body Sounds','2025-03-29','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The stones of the town resonate at the sound of a hollow hand. The Unmake is near, the fissures dilate. Quick, new chants are needed.\n\nHow a Body Sounds is a lore-rich exploration game made with GBStudio. It can be played on GameBoy Color hardware, Analogue Pocket, GB emulators or browser.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nv8.jpg'),(9775,'Dance Dance Revolution Solo 4thMix Plus','2000-12-28','Music, Puzzle, Arcade','Arcade','Dance Dance Revolution Solo 4thMix and Dance Dance Revolution Solo 4thMix Plus were released concurrently with 4thMix and 4thMix Plus respectively, designed for use with Solo cabinets. The changes in the actual game engine are few, but significant. The 4 and 6-panel modes are offered instead of the usual options, and the chubby arrows of the Solo series also appear. Multi-player Mode from the Solo series is not present in either game.\n\nAn ALL MUSIC MODE feature is included for Dance Dance Revolution 4thMix Plus where players have access to all songs in the game instead of picking music genres.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u5j.jpg'),(9776,'Pato & Lobo','2021-05-22','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95kq.jpg'),(9777,'Petoons Party','2019-09-20','Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ready for a great adventure? The Petoons need your help to face the evil Kitra! Kitra wants to conquer the island of Kimera and steal the Petoons magic to control their world. Petoons Party is a party game full of fun mini-games to enjoy with family and friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1l30.jpg'),(9778,'The Occupied Base','2006-07-19','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Professional remake of Quake\'s original deathmatch map DM3. Highly detailed and many expanded areas for single player, yet still maintaining the original layout in deathmatch mode. Map source is included.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77s9.jpg'),(9779,'Rune Tales : Underground','2022-03-24','Adventure','Meta Quest 2, Windows Mixed Reality, Oculus Rift','\"Rune Tales – Underground\" is a cooperative game that is played in individual pods of 2 to 6 players. The story follows the previous opus, Rune Tales : The Citadel, but the game has been designed to be understandable and playable by all players, whether they have experienced the first installment or not.\n\nHere, players find themselves besieged in the catacombs of the City and must find a way out to escape. But it’s without counting on the terrible mage in search of a strange forgotten treasure, who corrupts the creatures of the depths and raises the dead… Along the way, players may encounter the characters of Lug and Dunum, or discover the twists and turns of the Rousse-Croix... A rich immersion in historical references that should delight fans of the capital of Gaule.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w4d.jpg'),(9780,'Floors of Discomfort','2015-05-26','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Floors of Discomfort is a fast paced, extremely difficult, rogue-lite, platformer. Choose from one of five unlockable characters, each with their own back stories, and reasons for being in the lair of Nexrolis.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9781,'NarcoGuerra','2013-06-05','Strategy, Quiz/Trivia','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Can you End the Never-Ending War? Challenging, tactical, engaging and above all, drawn from reality, this is strategy gaming at is most intelligent. NarcoGuerra puts you in the frontline of one of the most dangerous conflicts ever. From the acclaimed creators of Endgame:Syria, described as \"...oozes quite some quality and is actually fun to play... with this unique gamification approach, it will make more people aware of what is happening today...\" (GamesWarp.com), this game challenges you to fight in the War on Drugs. The game features three game-modes; Story, Skirmish and Local Multiplayer. Take operational control of the police as you attempt to stem the ever-growing tide of conflict and trafficking, or try taking control of a cartel in multiplayer, quelling all opposing forces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fsdtg1t1ue8mjvmvgdci.jpg'),(9782,'Vasteel','1990-12-20','Strategy, Tactical','Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','\"Two Powerful Brothers. Two Powerful Armies. One Survivor.\"\n\nVasteel is a hex-based war strategy game in its core. The story mode takes the player (who controls either Stefan\'s or Faliall\'s armies) through various top-down maps, on which the two armies will try to annihilate each other, advance to a better position, conquer enemy cities, etc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4r04.jpg'),(9783,'Gori: Cuddly Carnage - Neon Neko Triple Skin Pack','2024-08-29','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Get three new dazzling outfits to slay the Adorable Army with Neon Neko Deluxe Skin Pack for Gori: Cuddly Carnage:\n\nThe Oni Pack - For when you want to be a demonically sharp dressed cat\nThe Kawaii Pack - For when you feel cute and might delete the Adorable Army, FROM EXISTENCE\nThe Arcane Pack - For when you channel the brightest ancient elements into your fury!\n\nEach of the 3 packs contains :\n\n- A slick new outfit For Gori\n- A new paint job for F.R.A.N.K\n- New effects for Gori’s shield.\n\nDownload today and slay the Adorable Army in style!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l9a.jpg'),(9784,'War Over the Mideast',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Tactical wargame simulating modern air warfare conflicts in the Middle East, part of John Tiller\'s Modern Air Power series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wk4rwlyc31d0hkw367jo.jpg'),(9785,'Silicon City','2023-06-22','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Silicon City is a new take on the classic city builder genre, where each citizen voice their opinion.\nWill you be an urban designer, a rural evangelist or a reckless capitalist?\nBuild your way to the most productive city until elected as the best mayor or plan the city of your dreams in sandbox.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tfz.jpg'),(9786,'Tide: 1932',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9787,'The Godfather II','2009-04-07','Shooter, Racing, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','After being promoted by Michael Corleone to Don of New York, players expand to new cities, as they build up their families through extorting businesses, monopolizing illegal crime rings and defeating new families in an effort to become the most powerful mob family in America. To help players manage their empire, The Godfather II introduces \"The Don\'s View\" - an innovative strategy meta-game that allows players to oversee the entire world as they grow the family business. Using the Don\'s View, players will be able to build, defend and expand their crime rings, while keeping an eye on the movements and plans of the rival families. Players will also learn to master the business of organized crime by building a family of Made Men, hiring crew, handing out orders, and promoting their best men up the ranks. Set in a stunning open-world environment, The Godfather II expands on the popular gameplay mechanics of the first game and doubles down on the series\' signature BlackHand control scheme, which now features even more visceral hand-to-hand brutality at your fingertips, introducing a new combo system, pressure tactics and executions. In The Godfather II, players fight alongside their hand-picked crew, who have their own skills and expertise. Each family member specializes in a specific field such as demolitions, arson, engineering, first-aid and more. As The Don you control the family, sending some of your men on missions while heading off into action with others. The combination of strategic organized crime gameplay and brutal BlackHand action promises to set The Godfather II apart from other open-world games. Play The Godfather II online multiplayer modes and become the true Don of Dons. Take your money, weapons, and crew from your single-player experience online and wage mob warfare against up to 16 players from around the world. Play as one of the family\'s crew specialists and put your best strategies to the test as you take over territory and strike back at rivals. Earn upgrades and money that can be used in your single-player experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o9p.jpg'),(9788,'Catnight','2022-03-07','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Catnight is an online multiplayer third-person perspective game that will heat up any party. You will not only fight with your opponents and the enormous amount of furry bullets in the air, but you will also need to survive special gameplay circumstances, which will make every match more dynamic and funnier.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j2r.jpg'),(9789,'Card Brawl: Dungeon Slayer',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Magical spires have risen across the land causing discord and chaos... No longer a mere shopkeeper, the fate of Aragonia now lies in your hands...\nChoose your path in procedurally generated dungeons and employ unique strategies with each playthrough! Slay your way to the Elite Boss at the end of each dungeon to unlock new cards for your collection and carve your name in history as the top ranked card brawler across Aragonia! Immerse yourself in a turn-based Roguelike CCG like no other, where you must randomly draft cards as you progress through each spire, testing the limits of your wit and skill with each battle.\nCollect powerful cards to create epic combos, wield masterful strategies by unlocking mighty heroes and their unique skills, gear up heroes with legendary equipment and turn the tides of battle across PvE and PvP by unleashing a well-timed spell! In Card Brawl you draft cards as you progress making each level more interesting than the last!\nWhat are you waiting for? Install Card Brawl for FREE to experience the mayhem of roguelike card battles and join the millions of players around the world in the Arena to forge your legacy!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9790,'Twisted Metal: Black','2001-12-07','Shooter, Racing','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 2','Twisted Metal: Black is a vehicle combat video game developed by Incognito Entertainment (formerly Incog Inc.) and designed by Sony Computer Entertainment America for the PlayStation 2 video game console. It is the fifth installment to the Twisted Metal series and was released June 18, 2001. An online enabled multiplayer-only variant, Twisted Metal: Black Online, was released later as a free update.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p3q.jpg'),(9791,'Throweat Area','2024-11-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A arena FPS multiplayer game, were you can collect lot of items around you and throw EVERYTHING on other players or eat EVERYTHING to regenerate your health.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mzw.jpg'),(9792,'Toey Weedz Smoke One',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9793,'Captain America: Super Soldier','2011-10-21','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Nintendo 3DS','The Nintendo 3DS port of Captain America: Super Soldier.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ovp.jpg'),(9794,'Live the Life','2020-09-16','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Live the Life is the first person life simulation game focused on the deep player\'s interaction with the environment. Design your apartment using advanced building features, visit stores to buy furniture, food and clothing you like, and more completely free content coming soon','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45cq.jpg'),(9795,'Urban Entrepreneur','2024-04-11','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Manage inventory, staff, prices and more while creating a monopoly!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gst.jpg'),(9796,'Forza Motorsport 4: Essentials Edition','2012-11-09','Racing','Xbox 360','Forza Motorsport 4 is a racing video game developed by Turn 10 Studios and published by Microsoft Studios for the Xbox 360. It is the fourth installment in the Forza Motorsport series. It is the first title in the series to support the Kinect sensor alongside the traditional controller-based gameplay.\n\nNew to the series is the Autovista mode, a mode in which players can view precise details such as engine parts and interior gauges on a select number of cars. It features a partnership with BBC\'s Top Gear as well as its American counterpart. Jeremy Clarkson, presenter for Top Gear, provides commentary in the game\'s Autovista mode. Other partnerships include a two-year agreement with the American Le Mans Series (ALMS). Over 500 cars and 26 tracks are included.\n\nThe game received universal acclaim from critics. Aggregate websites GameRankings and Metacritic report scores of 90.50% and 91 out of 100, respectively. Metacritic also reports eight perfect scores from various media outlets. Critics praised the enhanced vehicle physics, updated visuals, and strong sound design. Several reviewers also gave high marks for the Forza 4 \'​s Autovista mode. Some critics expressed frustration with Kinect features, and others also felt that the game was not enough of an innovation from its predecessor, Forza Motorsport 3. These critics did, however, concede that the game was a vast improvement over Forza 3.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/u2zufgrvjm0rpppwppan.jpg'),(9797,'SquishCraft','2022-07-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Squish blocks together to solve challenging puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nyq.jpg'),(9798,'Swingin\'',NULL,'Indie','Web browser','This game was created as a part of the \"0 hour game jam\", a game jam taking place over the end of Daylight Savings Time, between 2 AM and 2 AM.\n\nCollect blue to increase score, green to get more lives, and avoid red or else you lose lives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gss.jpg'),(9799,'Bug Bash',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9800,'A Number\'s life','2016-12-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A Number\'s life is a minimalistic yet surprisingly complex game based on moving, combining and dividing numbers. Meet these wonderful characters and test your skills through 80 fun and challenging levels. Create your own levels and share them with the community.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9801,'Shipwrecked 64','2024-01-02','Platform, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A recovered copy of a lost game from the late 1990s about a Beaver named Bucky and his friends trying to escape from an island they crashed upon.\n\nExcerpt from the back of the original Shipwrecked Box:\n\n“BUCKY AND HIS FRIENDS NEED YOUR HELP!\nAfter a sudden crash during a routine fishing trip, Bucky ends up on a mysterious island, where his friends appear to be apprehended by a pack of wolves for disturbing the peace. Embark on a puzzle-based adventure, as Bucky wanders the vast island of Nulla Terra, helping his friends work off the damages, fix your boat, and get back home!”','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7oa2.jpg'),(9802,'Rust Racers',NULL,'Fighting, Racing, MOBA','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rust Racers is an action packed massively multiplayer vehicle MOBA set in a dystopian corpocracy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r7w.jpg'),(9803,'Cooking Championship',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Take part in the Cooking Championship! Create a unique character. Admire beautiful scenery. Prepare original dishes. Compete with other participants. Please the jury. And win the tournament!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5d3v.jpg'),(9804,'VR Sailing','2024-10-15','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','SteamVR','It allows players to transform into sailboat navigators, sailing their beloved ships in the endless sea and enjoying the thrill of 360 degree immersive sailing and waves! Feel the forward momentum brought by the wind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pin.jpg'),(9805,'TransGenDeer','2024-10-31','Platform','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','TransGenDeer is an educational game about the everyday struggle trans people have to go through.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99id.jpg'),(9806,'Ticker',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9807,'Get Mouse','2021-05-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get Mouse is a mouse-feeding puzzle game by Sen (MouSe) made in Wolf RPG Editor. A simple ten-minute game with 8 stages where you have to get the mouse his cheese.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61vt.jpg'),(9808,'Freespace 2','1999-09-30','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The year is 2367, thirty two years after the Great War. Or at least what YOU thought was the Great War. The seemingly endless tide of Shivan capital ships, bombers and fighters with super advanced technology was nearly overwhelming.As the Terran and Vasudan races finish rebuilding their decimated societies, a disturbance lurks in the not-so-far reaches of the Gamma Draconis system. Your nemesis has arrived... and they are wondering what happened to their scouting party...The game continues on the story from Descent: FreeSpace, once again thrusting the player into the role of a pilot fighting against the mysterious aliens, the Shivans. While defending the human race and its alien Vasudan allies, the player also gets involved in putting down a rebellion of those elements of Vasudan (Hammer of Light) and Human (Neo Terran Front) forces which don\'t want to cooperate with one another.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1x4z.jpg'),(9809,'Fervent',NULL,'Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short, VHS - style horror game where you step into the shoes of a paranormal investigator. As you venture into the eerie Fervent Campsite, you\'ll uncover mysterious obelisks with cryptic symbols, abandoned white tents, and an unsettling ritual book.\n\nAverage playtime is 10 minutes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kxl.jpg'),(9810,'Ball 28 In Space','2025-02-28','Arcade','PlayStation 4','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9811,'Ultra Street Fighter IV: Shadaloo Wild Pack','2014-12-16','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Alternate costume pack for USFIV. Contains new wild outfits for M.Bison, Sagat, Vega, Balrog, and Seth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7svh.jpg'),(9812,'Future Vibe Check',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Future Vibe Check is a musical automation game where your factories don’t just produce goods—they make music. Summoned by Infinity, you must rebuild reality. The call of endless optimization will be sublimated into sound. Automate the Vibe. Defend the Vibe. Become the Vibe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9izs.jpg'),(9813,'Tower!3D: ZBAD Airport','2021-04-06','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beijing Daxing International Airport (IATA: PKX, ICAO: ZBAD), ZBAD is Beijing\'s second international airport that has been nicknamed \"the starfish\" because of its look.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9814,'4 Seasons of Doom','2018-10-07','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','4 maps themed after each one of the 4 seasons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yo4.jpg'),(9815,'Card Crafter Genesis','2024-08-15','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Card Crafter Genesis- Create your own card games with custom cards, decks, and rulesets! Then play them against other players online! Each card can be given custom backs, fronts, descriptions, and effects!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74r2.jpg'),(9816,'Paintball 3: Candy Match Factory','2023-10-26','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Join Boldy, the adorable green monster, on his sweetest and most thrilling adventure to fix the broken candy match factory: Paintball 3!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d7o.jpg'),(9817,'Escape from Actaltraz','1998-01-24','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Medium sized based map, escape from prison theme.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77ty.jpg'),(9818,'The Jackbox Party Pack 8','2021-10-14','Indie','Amazon Fire TV, Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Plan your next game night! Jackbox Games is back with 5 hilarious new party games including Drawful Animate, Job Job, The Poll Mine, Weapons Drawn, and the Wheel of Enormous Proportions. No extra controllers needed—players use their phones or tablets to play along! Got a bigger group? Play with up to 10 players and up to 10,000 audience members.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sma.jpg'),(9819,'Ciudad Alfombra','2023-04-29','Racing, Simulator, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this game, you must dodge the obstacles in the city and complete the missions available. There is a wide variety of vehicles and colors, such as minivans and large buses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gps.jpg'),(9820,'Cosmic Star Heroine','2018-08-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"3 exotic planets to explore. Aliens. Robots. Magic. Forbidden technology. Ruined Worlds. Ghosts. Long-lost secrets. Conspiracies. A galactic threat. And one brave heroine to make things right. Cosmic Star Heroine is an exciting new RPG from the creators of Cthulhu Saves the World.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23mu.jpg'),(9821,'Koolah','1991-12-31','Puzzle, Arcade','DOS','Koolah is an English spelling of the Finnish word \'kuula\' meaning the \'metal ball\', that can\'t be squeezed and is used in the game as main protagonist.\n\nThe game\'s idea was taken from a children\'s board game, where one tries to guide a metal ball through a wooden maze without touching the ball. The ball is controlled with two knobs on the side of the maze. One of the knobs leans the maze horizontally and the other vertically. The route through the maze is drawn on it, but there are holes along the route that easily swallow the ball.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81hk.jpg'),(9822,'Virtua Fighter 5 R','2008-07-24','Fighting','Arcade','Virtua Fighter 5 R was an update to Virtua Fighter 5, released on July 24th 2008 to Japanese arcades. This revision featured brand new stages and a new character named Jean Kujo, who practices Karate. Also included was the return of the sumo wrestler Taka-Arashi from Virtua Fighter 3, which brought the fighter count up to twenty (counting Dural).\n\nA \"Version A\" update was released on December 16th, 2008. The version added various improvements to the game, as well support for the \"Bingo Festival - Bingo Days!\" event for the month of December 2008.\n\nVersion B of Virtua Fighter 5 R was officially released in the Japanese arcades on May 21, 2009. This version featured changes in the animations of moves on all the characters, as well as changes to enhance the gameplay modes, and an improved camera system.\n\nVersion C was released on November 25, 2009. However, this particular version mainly added new team items for the character\'s outfits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38vk.jpg'),(9823,'My Crimes','2023-06-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get rid of the crimes. Grab all the evidence. Probably get arrested anyway because you have dogshit lawyers. Don\'t stop punching the boxes, it\'s your only way out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nl0.jpg'),(9824,'Minicology','2024-04-25','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have crash-landed into a mini-verse of tiny planets. Welcome to Minicology! Embark on an interstellar survival sandbox journey. Use your crafting, combat, and automation skills to survive the many challenges this mini-verse throws at you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co821k.jpg'),(9825,'Story of Seasons: Friends of Mineral Town','2020-07-10','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A remake combining the content of the Game Boy Advance games, Harvest Moon: Friends of Mineral Town and Harvest Moon: More Friends of Mineral Town, for the Nintendo Switch.\n\nThe series\' international name was changed to Story of Seasons due to Natsume keeping the rights to the Harvest Moon title when Marvelous began publishing through their own companies, XSEED Games, instead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mij.jpg'),(9826,'Tiny Shooters','2024-10-19','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Engage in fast-paced 2D deathmatch action! Choose from 9 unique characters, collect weapons, grenades, and health packs as you battle for supremacy in a 5-minute showdown. Play against friends or bots in this thrilling shooter game where every kill counts!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mzt.jpg'),(9827,'Season Island',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Season Island is an interactive role-playing experience in which you guide Spike, a human stranded in a mystical seasonal globe…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oqv.jpg'),(9828,'Book of Beasts','2020-11-18','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Book of Beasts is a collectible card game featuring a mythological setting with creatures from fantastical stories. \nThe gameplay consists of connecting different cards together by matching the symbols on their edges. Additional depth is added to the game by the Spell Cards that can be used to change the game\'s rules.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kwy.jpg'),(9829,'Scroll the Pain Away','2024-06-27','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Step into the shoes of Indigo, the owner of a small magic shop. Help your customers with a wide variety of problems!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g6y.jpg'),(9830,'Centauri Dominion','2020-05-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Centauri Dominion is a top down space shooter set in the Centauri sector where a new colony is being established. There are others arriving seeking to dominate the sector for themselves and will not take no for an answer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45nh.jpg'),(9831,'Beautiful Checkers','2025-02-12','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play checkers, feel its beauty. Play in wonderful artist-designed environments whether indoors or outdoors. Whether you are an adult, a retiree, or a child, you can enjoy an immersive visual experience of the game of checkers where difficulty does not matter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m8x.jpg'),(9832,'Next Island',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9833,'Industrial Fear',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','A short, atmospheric psychological horror where you play as a factory worker finishing his shift. There are multiple endings to complete and collectables','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kxm.jpg'),(9834,'Dragon Quest Heroes I & II','2017-03-03','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Nintendo Switch','Dragon Quest Heroes I and II packaged together for Nintendo Switch, including all the extra DLC released for the PlayStation versions of the game. Only released in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30q3.jpg'),(9835,'AST-Hero','2022-09-20','Fighting, Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','AST-Hero is a top-down space-shooter, with unique graphics and sounds.\n\nIt is inspired by the 1979 hit Asteroids. It comes with a lot of new and interesting features.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5b8h.jpg'),(9836,'Home Wars','2017-06-13','Shooter, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you hate bugs and arachnids? Seeing them creeps you out? Would you like them to disappear off the face of the Earth? GOOD! This the right game for you! \n \nIn Home Wars you’ll play as a General of a toy soldiers army, with the sole purpose of saving the owner’s house from the invasion of those damn Bugs. \n \nThe special feature of this game is that you can go instantly into first person towards any selected unit, getting a damage bonus for everything you\'ll hit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bn4.jpg'),(9837,'Wembley International Soccer','1994-12-31','Sport','Amiga CD32, Amiga','Officially licensed by the old Wembley stadium, this football game is essentially an advanced version of Ocean\'s European Champions. Gameplay emphasizes one-touch passing, with a picture-in-picture window displayed when you prepare to play a long pass, which increases you chances of finding the target player. The AGA version was the first floppy-based game to supports a CD32 controller, making it easier to execute moves. 64 international teams are included, with the chance to play a full league competition or a World Cup. Full control over formation and tactics is offered before the match.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h5c.jpg'),(9838,'Agricultural Simulator: Historical Farming','2013-11-06','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enjoy being a farmer between 1950 and 1970 in the Agricultural Simulator – Historical Farming. The game takes you to the good old days and you will experience the charming farming of the 60\'s and 70\'s. Fans of nostalgia and history will be glad to work with original designed machines and to till a field with well known Old-timer Tractors. With the new feature – the dynamic ground Agrar Simulator – Historical Farming presents the first real furrows which will be left when working at the fields with strong machines. The furrows will have impact on the driving behavior of the tractors and guarantee pure realism. It is up to the player to decide in which region he would like to cultivate his farm. There are two amazing scenarios – idyllic highlands, valleys and woods in the alp-region or the fascinating Toscana region with measured climate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l7i.jpg'),(9839,'Sizeable','2021-03-19','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sizeable is a puzzle/exploration game about shrinking and growing the environment in order to find all the hidden objects that every little diorama hides!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j07.jpg'),(9840,'Shadow of the Tomb Raider: The Price of Survival','2019-02-12','Shooter, Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Return to the lush world of Shadow of the Tomb Raider and solve a mystery behind Lara Croft\'s greatest foe. While trying to crack the private codes of Trinity\'s leader, Lara must conquer a new single-player challenge tomb filled with poisonous traps, while defeating the elite soldiers that stand in her way.\n\nEquip the new Hunter’s Array outfit, which is a Classic Trinity uniform that makes Lara’s footsteps quieter while running. The outfit also increases the effect of perception plants, providing longer-lasting vision to hunt enemies. Players will also receive the Silent Sting, a pistol outfitted with a silencer for stealthier kills. Finally, the Raptor’s Eye skill improves Lara’s skill tracking enemies, making their outline visible through walls and other obstacles.\n\nAs part of the update, tombs from the main campaign, “Judge’s Gaze,” “Underworld Gate,” “Howling Caves”, “Path of Battle,” “Temple of the Sun,” “San Cordoba,” and “Ancient Aqueduct” are all now playable in Score Attack and Time Attack modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hdx.jpg'),(9841,'SpongeGlock SquarePants','2021-02-24','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','SpongeGlock SquarePants is an FPS game developed by indie game developer Mix Morris, inspired by Nickelodeon’s favorite cartoon series SpongeBob SquarePants in the late 90s. For those who want to download this unique game in Bikini Bottom, you can find the download links of the game in this article','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ezc.jpg'),(9842,'Deep Rock Galactic: Rival Tech Pack','2021-11-04','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Rival Tech Pack will let you deck out all your guns in theme with our new enemies - no reason to let all those lovely bits go to waste, after all!\nOn top of the set of new unique Weapon Frameworks for all your weapons, the pack comes with a matching Paintjob for your Armors, as well as a new Paintjob for your Pickaxe.\n\n- The Rival Tech Framework - a set of FULL MESH RESKINS of all weapons in the game in the style of our new rivals.\n- Rival Tech Paintjob for all your Weapon Frameworks.\n- Rival Tech Armor Paintjob to match your new weapon Framework.\n- Rival Tech Paintjob for your trusty personal Pickaxe.\n\nImportant note: The contents of this Pack are cosmetic only!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qbo.jpg'),(9843,'The Last Tater','2022-05-19','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You are a little fried tater trying to survive as earth turns apocalyptic in this action packed side-scroller shooter','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4q5u.jpg'),(9844,'Throw Home','2024-11-20','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','(This game was created as both a proof of concept and game design showcase) A 2D action showcase for players new to video games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mzv.jpg'),(9845,'6Souls','2021-12-03','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','6Souls is a challenging action-platformer with over 80 levels to beat and 6 bosses to defeat. Embark on an exciting journey to find the abandoned Clifford Castle and uncover its secrets!\nOur heroes, adventure enthusiasts Jack and his faithful dog companion Butch, go on an exciting quest to find an abandoned castle where the entire Clifford family vanished years ago. The whole castle is surrounded by mystery, from its dark dungeons to its highest towers.\nWhile discovering new rooms, our heroes will learn fascinating details about the Clifford family, meet the castle’s peculiar residents and uncover its secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22i0.jpg'),(9846,'The Devious Four Chronicles 3: The Crater','2015-06-13','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','A romhack with 100 exits\n\nMario has bested the King Koopa, Bowser, time and time again. He has stopped boos from taking over and even giant frogs. However, not long ago, he foiled the attempt of two otherworldly beings named Racter and Magna, from distorting his world\'s magnetic field. Mario bested Racter, but not before he could call for help.\n\nMario must now face off against an enemy like no other he has seen... two enemies! He must be quick, for they have built a devious super weapon that could very well turn the Mushroom Kingdom and more into nothing more than a parking lot! He\'s not alone though, traveling with him is yet another otherworldly being who seems to know the two villains.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dky.jpg'),(9847,'DogDogDog','2024-04-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"DogDogDog\" is a horror adventure game set in modern times. Recently, you have been feeling like someone is stalking you, making you anxious with the feeling of being watched and hearing noises everywhere. Suddenly, you recall your past pet dog, only to encounter a \"DOG\" in the present.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co826a.jpg'),(9848,'Allods Online','2010-10-21','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Allods Online is a free-to-play 3D fantasy MMORPG set in the fantasy space opera universe of Sarnaut developed by Allods Team, formerly Astrum Nival, and published by Mail.Ru Group. It is the fourth opus of the Rage of Mages series which started in the mid-90s, conquering the minds of millions of gamers around the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21mz.jpg'),(9849,'The Amazing Spider-Man 2','2014-04-18','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Android, iOS','The Android and iOS port of The Amazing Spider-Man 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h9v.jpg'),(9850,'Beacon Pines: Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bye.jpg'),(9851,'Starvation',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9852,'Ferrari Grand Prix Challenge','1992-11-13','Racing','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','The Nintendo Entertainment System version of the game is a simplified version that allows players to practice up to six laps or qualify for every Formula One race of the season using metric units (kilometres per hour instead of miles per hour). It was one of the few 8-bit Formula One video games to adequately represent the Circuit Gilles Villeneuve as having an urban background along with several other urban race tracks represented in the 1992 Formula One season. Tire wear is possible resulting in trips to the pit crew for maintenance and repairs. A radio allows communication with the crew chief; he will advise whether repairs are necessary. The top speed of the vehicle is 325 kilometres per hour and turbo is not used in the game.\nBefore the first qualifying session can take place, the player must insert his name and his nationality. The name can be up to 10 characters long and the country has to fit into a three-character field. Since the game doesn\'t verify if the three-letter code matches up to a real nationality, it doesn\'t matter if the player makes up a nationality for a fictional country.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vmt.jpg'),(9853,'Succubus: Red Goddess',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hmd.jpg'),(9854,'Catan: Console Edition - Cities & Knights','2024-02-21','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9855,'Love Colors & Calm Colors','2025-03-15','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Two relaxing art experiences in one bundle! Color, create, and have fun—solo or with friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nu8.jpg'),(9856,'Tanasurga',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Tanasurga is an Narrative driven RPG where you play as mecha mercenaries in alternate WW2 setting. Build your own mecha, recruit and lead a team of pilots with different characteristics and skills. Gain riches and determine how the war unfolds between 3 main factions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jdi.jpg'),(9857,'Animal','1996-12-31','Adventure','DOS','Animal','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hem5kxqzbpaxvcocjwdf.jpg'),(9858,'Hentai Tales Vol. 2: Hitomi and Sea Trip','2023-11-30','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy','Nintendo Switch','Continuation of exciting puzzles with a new plot and even more stunning anime illustrations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ffx.jpg'),(9859,'Snoop Dogg Boxing',NULL,'Fighting, Arcade','Legacy Mobile Device','Snoop Dogg Boxing puts you up against a posse of bad boys, each with a special move to bust you up. These guys are the kings of the ring. It’s a classic arcade style boxing game where you show up without street credibility, fight your way up the ranks, earn respect and ultimately face the king of the hip hop ring, Snoop Dogg, at the final level of the game. Round for round, this game paid the cost to be the boss of all mobile boxing games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qls.jpg'),(9860,'Sushi Bar Express','2023-03-23','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Experience the dizzying life of a top sushi chef as you prepare sushi dishes in this exciting time-management cooking adventure.\n\nServe hordes of demanding patrons and build-up your menu by purchasing more recipes, to take with you to bigger and better restaurants.\n\nStart a career as a sushi chef and absorb all of the wise teachings of your master. Slice, dice, roll and hammer sushi, and then serve it to customers as quickly as you can. Make sashimi, roll uramaki, pour sake, and feed the hungry hordes to collect cash. Catch coins as they fly by, and use the money you make to upgrade your equipment and purchase more recipes.\n\nThe characters and tone of Sushi Bar Express are presented in a light-hearted and comical style, designed to appeal to all types of players – ranging from children to adults, and all genders. Whimsical humour offers a counterpoint to the manic plate-juggling gameplay and helps players to feel comfortable and entertained throughout the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6avj.jpg'),(9861,'Sector Beam','2024-12-26','Arcade','PlayStation 4','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9862,'Romance of the Three Kingdoms Maker','2015-12-09','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Romance of the Three Kingdoms Maker\" celebrates the 30th anniversary of the \"Romance of the Three Kingdoms\" series. It has been realized through a collaboration between the creators of the \"Romance of the Three Kingdoms\" series, Koei Tecmo Games, and the creators of the \"TSUKURU\" series, KADOKAWA.\n\"Romance of the Three Kingdoms Maker\" is based on the classic title \"Romance of the Three Kingdoms II.\" Keeping the same simple and fast-paced game play, you can now enjoy high personalized original scenarios featuring freely editable officers, countries, forces, rewards and battlefields.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3crv.jpg'),(9863,'Minesweeper 99',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9864,'Black Belt','1983-07-26','Fighting, Sport','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Apple II','Kevin Ryan\'s second game, a taekwon-do arcade game which was released in late 1983 for the Apple II and ported to the C-64 in 1984. Similarly to Zoo Master, Kevin did everything from the coding to the graphics and sound effects. After completing Black Belt, Kevin did some contract work for Earthware, including working on a possibly never-released adventure game development system called Megaventure. He stopped doing work with Earthware in 1985, as he had started up at Dynamix.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/k6lzgyqwm0cyoxqgncvs.jpg'),(9865,'Fall Of Mankind','2024-07-12','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','FALL OF MANKIND is a first-person action game where William, a Knight of the Sigma Council hunts the Time and Soul Orb through time and space.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rfa.jpg'),(9866,'Minecraft: Minecon 2016 Skin Pack','2016-09-22','Sin género','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Wii U, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6p4v.jpg'),(9867,'PeakPals','2024-08-16','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','PeakPals offers a multiplayer game where players strive to reach the top, either alone or with friends. The game involves overcoming obstacles, solving puzzles, enduring falls, and engaging in playful acts of sabotage, like throwing grenades at teammates\' feet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fpd.jpg'),(9868,'Fruit: Chain Effect',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9869,'Love is in the Airship','2024-10-26','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this wacky yuri dating sim, come aboard a magical airship cruise and experience romance, hijinks, and a crazy story with over 15 endings! Lots of choices and lots of really cute girls to date.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vo8.jpg'),(9870,'Escape: Zombie Maze',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9871,'The Murder of Sherlock Holmes','2024-05-09','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, PlayStation VR, SteamVR, Oculus Rift','Investigate the murder of Sherlock Holmes in an incredible Virtual Reality adventure. Interact with everything in an authentic voxel reconstruction of 221B Baker Street. Search for clues, play the violin, read books and become a oneiric detective in this dreamlike escape room.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86no.jpg'),(9872,'Project Lazarus 2','2025-05-07','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deploy, adapt, and upgrade your mech in Project Lazarus 2—the next evolution of survival and rogue-lite action! Battle relentless enemies, unlock powerful upgrades, and forge your own path. Gear up and push your limits as every run brings new strategies and intense challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kus.jpg'),(9873,'My Demonic Romance','2024-05-01','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','My Demonic Romance is a Visual Novel with a twist...\nSure you\'re playing a typically geeky guy with classes to attend, a job that sucks and a love life that\'s DOA.\n\nBut the difference is that when the cute, exciting and adventurous girl shows up, she\'s an actual demon, with horns, a pointed tail and a sex-drive to match!\n\nAs that guy you have to navigate your daily life while trying to keep your new demonic companion safe in a world that\'s completely new to her and not to mention handling the fact that she\'s not at all shy when it comes to her physical desires too!\n\nYou take on the role of Adam, a guy studying hard to get the grades he needs to succeed in life, working a part-time job to pay the bills, and all the time longing for some meaningful female companionship - who gets more than he bargained for when Lily, a succubus summoned from hell itself turns up in his life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wbv.jpg'),(9874,'Genius - Tricky Riddles',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9875,'Super Sharp','2015-09-11','Puzzle','iOS','Your finger has never been so sharp! Cut with skill to complete the 120 ingenious physics levels of Super Sharp and become a cut master!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54tg.jpg'),(9876,'The Last Tiger','2024-06-13','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the game \"The Last Tiger,\" you will control the fate of four tank commanders during World War II! You will participate in the most bloody tank battles of the Second World War.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fv4.jpg'),(9877,'Faces of Illusion: The Twin Phantoms','2024-06-21','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','FANTASTIC HIDDEN OBJECT PUZZLE ADVENTURE GAME FROM THE CREATORS OF ENIGMATIS AND GRIM LEGENDS!\n\nEmbark on an exciting adventure between magic and illusion. Conduct your own investigation, solve the disappearance of a rising theatre star, and discover the secrets behind the curtains of the Parisian theatre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21o9.jpg'),(9878,'Call Me Under',NULL,'Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dive into the 1950s and explore an eldritch-horror infested world soaked in dark magic, mystery, and romance. Call Me Under takes place in the mysterious underwater city of Styx, a haven inhabited by humans, sirens, and a host of unknown otherworldly entities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d76.jpg'),(9879,'Marvel: Ultimate Alliance - Special Edition','2006-11-24','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','Marvel: Ultimate Alliance is an action role-playing video game developed for PlayStation 2, PlayStation 3, Xbox and Xbox 360 by Raven Software and published by Activision.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co484u.jpg'),(9880,'Filament','2020-10-07','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The truth is out there. Somewhere. A single-player game with complex, yet ultra-addictive puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yi0.jpg'),(9881,'Pharmacist Jones','2009-07-23','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95md.jpg'),(9882,'Holidays',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9883,'Fire King','1990-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','Commodore C64/128/MAX, DOS','Fire King is a follow-up to Demon Stalkers. Like its predecessor, it is essentially a Gauntlet variant in its core. The player explores the top-down world, descending into dungeons and fighting hordes of enemies in fast-paced, action-oriented combat. Compared to its spiritual predecessors, Fire King incorporates more RPG elements.The player can choose to control one of the six available characters, and specialize in one of the three disciplines: Magic, Armor, and Strength. Spells and other helpful items can be found in the dungeons and used against the enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pibkszitzvsgzbhombeg.jpg'),(9884,'NeoNomicon','2017-06-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Minimalistic puzzle game telling about a tricky life situation, which gets your Hero.\nMysterious world and treacherous enemies. Strange laws of this weird reality.\nHere the help of friends is more dangerous than the attack of enemies!\nWelcome to NeoNomicon!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9885,'Travel Mosaics 8: Breathtaking Seoul','2021-03-08','Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Travel Mosaics is back with a new family adventure in beautiful Seoul!\nJoin the Walkers - a curious family of travelers who love exploring new destinations. Solve colorful mosaic puzzles and learn curious facts while answering tricky quiz questions. On your journey, collect gold coins and souvenirs to commemorate the trip. The stunning capital of South Korea has tons of fun to offer - hop along! Each level contains a hidden picture that you can reveal by solving it! Travel Mosaics is edutainment for all ages: pick the difficulty level corresponding to your skill and enjoy beautiful hand-crafted puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59e7.jpg'),(9886,'Renegade','1988-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','DOS','DOS port of Renegade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6p4c.jpg'),(9887,'Confinio: Reality Prison',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Confinio is an intriguing visual novel that delves into your sensations as you embody the protagonist who has just awakened in a prison with no memory. Make decisions, solve puzzles, interact with the environment, use objects, interrogate people, all to yourself and uncover the enigmatic reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kuu.jpg'),(9888,'Secrets of the Dark: Mystery of the Ancestral Estate','2013-04-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','\"Mystery of the Ancestral Estate\" is the third game in the Secrets of the Dark series. Like the first two it is a hidden object game. Screens have a list of objects that need to be found. Each object found is struck off the list. Items gathered during your journey are stored in an inventory. These items are then used to solve puzzles in the hope of obtaining a piece of the house\'s lamp. As before light and dark needs to be manipulated in order to discover items and puzzles that need completing. Puzzles need to be solved and vary in difficulty. Hints can be used to find hidden objects, to provide assistance as to what to do next or to skip puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/toosi1c4ker2ixsihniq.jpg'),(9889,'Doodle World: Deluxe','2023-03-30','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Doodle World Deluxe includes the original version of Doodle World and the all-new game, Doodle World Redrawn!\n\nDoodle World features an innovative \"Kids Mode\". With \"Kids Mode\" younger players can enjoy the game with more lives, less levels, and easier enemies and bosses!\n\nDoodle World Redrawn is a new, never before released, re-imagining of Doodle World with tougher levels, enemies, and bosses! Use the new double jump ability to navigate through these tougher levels. \"Kids Mode\" is still available in this new version, so even younger players can enjoy this new game!\n\nThe music and sound design for Doodle World Deluxe was created by the extremely talented chiptune artist Takumi Grainger!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bf0.jpg'),(9890,'Bird Go Sky',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A multiplayer game where you play as one of multiple bird characters. You fly through a world with multiple themed areas, build nests to upgrade your character or unlock new species, while exploring, interacting and role-playing with friends and strangers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95xu.jpg'),(9891,'Dragon: The Game','2014-11-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this open world action role-playing game you will bring your dragon\'s story to life. Become a terrifying or benevolent dragon powerful enough to threaten kingdoms and leave its claw-mark in history.   \n \nWARNING:  DRAGON IS IN EARLY ACCESS ALPHA. IT IS NOT A COMPLETED GAME.  Please do not purchase unless you want to actively support development and are PREPARED TO HAVE FUN DESPITE BUGS AND UNANTICIPATED PROBLEMS.  Thank you for your support, Early Access makes this game possible!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9892,'Pokémon Vega','2011-06-18','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Three years ago, shortly after the crowning and subsequent retirement of Champion Brendan, Hoenn was battered by an enormous number of meteors. This disaster, known as the Hoenn Catastrophe, greatly transformed Hoenn\'s landscape, turning much of the southern end into a barren wasteland and destroying the Battle Frontier, among other things. This also had a profound change on the wildlife, driving many species to extinction. More strangely, new species of Pokémon, known as Meteoric Pokémon, began appearing everywhere. At the forefront were three very powerful and evil Pokémon...\n\nThe story begins as you move into Littleroot Town, and are asked by Professor Birch to complete the Pokédex in order to document all the new species. You meet Birch\'s niece (or nephew), April (or Gordon), as well as Billy, the little brother of the current League Champion, Wally. In addition, the Petalburg Gym Leader, Romero, has a little brother himself, who keeps crossing your path. His name is Mosmero, and he\'s quite the strange one. Despite being an adult, he travels the region performing all kinds of pranks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7o37.jpg'),(9893,'Taisen Daifugo +','2008-11-05','Card & Board Game','Legacy Mobile Device','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9894,'Shingakkou The Gift','2012-02-10','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fandisc for Shingakkou, featuring after stories and mini games.\n\nA sweet love disc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9csl.jpg'),(9895,'Star Revenge 6.5: Wrath of the Dim. Flower','2014-08-01','Platform','Nintendo 64','This is the 6.5th in the \"Star Revenge\" Series of SM64 hacks.\nThis hack is based around the idea of the green stars missions of Super Mario Galaxy 2. It also remixes the original stages of SR6 LA into new ones to make it more interesting and not feel the complete same.\n\nIn this hack you play again as Luigi like SR6, but this time the paintings inside of Peach\'s Castle are getting messed up by a huge flower that appeared out of nowhere outside of the castle. You can find 9 main courses in this hack + 2 boss levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wu2.jpg'),(9896,'Wild West Crops','2022-04-08','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','A retro style mini metroidvania game during Old West about \"El Gatito\", a lovely little \"Pistolero\" cat who needs to defend his hometown from evelish mutant vegetables!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2thy.jpg'),(9897,'The Complex','2020-03-31','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Complex is a female-driven, cinematic FMV sci-fi thriller. The interactive movie stars Michelle Mylett, Kate Dickie and Al Weaver. Actors also include Twitch streamer and Xbox UK presenter, Leah Viathan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l6b.jpg'),(9898,'Lucifer Ring','1999-01-23','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation','You play as a young hero named Nash who is tasked with stopping a dark wizard from using the Lucifer Rings that will open the gates of Hell. Naturally, Nash will have to hack and slash his way through Centaurs, Goblins, Dragons and creatures named Bob to put a stop to the evil forces. There will be mini-bosses and multi-state level bosses to round out this adventure to put our hero to the test.\n\nDark wizards never let heroes get any rest, do they?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9imt.jpg'),(9899,'PlayCOQ: The Coop Defender','2024-09-22','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Prove your COQ\'s might in epic battles to save the coop from numerous foes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u7s.jpg'),(9900,'SaDistic BlooD','2019-12-20','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Vampires Yuna and Shizuha come to the island city of Chisakura hoping to find refuge from the relentless pursuit of Vampire Hunters. However, it turns out that the Hunters are already lying in wait for them. Will the Vampire duo escape the Hunters\' trap and live to see tomorrow, or will they meet a fate worse than death...?\n\nThe two Vampires travel Japan together, evading the pursuit of Vampire Hunters in an attempt to live out their undead eternity in freedom. On the fateful night of their arrival in Chisakura, the full moon shines down upon the duo, intensifying their Vampiric impulses. The two attempt to slake their thirst for blood while remaining unnoticed.\n\nLittle do they know that lying in wait for them in the island city is a Hunters\' trap. Outnumbered by a party of dangerous biological weapons commanded by the vengeful Yuika, the two Vampires must now weigh their options. Do they go on the run and flee Chisakura, or do they stand their ground and fight?\n\nWith the odds stacked against them and time running out, Yuna and Shizuha must choose wisely if both of them are to escape with their lives. Will the Vampire duo escape the Hunters\' trap and live to see tomorrow, or will they meet a fate worse than death...?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8au8.jpg'),(9901,'Witchhazel Woods','2022-08-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Your dog has been kidnapped by a lonely ghost! To save her, you must go on a journey through the woods, helping the creatures you meet along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ic3.jpg'),(9902,'Bombshell Barista: Speed Dating','2023-07-02','Simulator, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Bombshell Barista: Speed Dating ---This is an adult, size kink-themed dating sim for the Bombshell Barista series!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gmt.jpg'),(9903,'Flowstone Saga','2024-09-26','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Flowstone Saga is a grand JRPG-inspired adventure that sports a unique battle system, where players manipulate falling blocks to defeat enemies in either real-time or turn-based combat. It features a wide variety of handcrafted and highly-detailed locations with meticulous pixel art and a soundtrack consisting of over 70 pieces, many of which feature live musicians.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39xu.jpg'),(9904,'The Devil\'s Whisper','2024-10-30','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A psychological horror Visual Novel with a full voice cast. Immerse yourself in a haunting mystery filled with dark drama and a touch of romance. Multiple thrilling alternate endings to play through! Choose who lives and who dies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wsr.jpg'),(9905,'The Cradle of Ruin','2017-12-28','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hotarou lives in a white shelter together with four women. They never doubt the happiness in their daily life, but it suddenly comes to an end one day. The first but the most difficult choice lies in front of Hotarou. He has to do something to escape from the circling and repeating tragedy before their whole world is destroyed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5afo.jpg'),(9906,'Archaelund','2024-01-08','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a vast open world and crawl through dungeons in first person, then fight tactical turn-based battles from a top-down perspective. Guide your adventuring party through Archaelund, mankind\'s last frontier, and uncover its many secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4033.jpg'),(9907,'Tiger Soldier I: MP095',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Tiger Soldier is a military-themed run & gun shooter game. Playing as a lone soldier, first by fighting off infantry units and battling tanks then lob a hand grenade into the enemy\'s fort. Destroy the enemy\'s fort to clear game. The DLC include mission pack 095.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9908,'Wonder Ball','2024-11-07','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An action 3D platformer with fast-paced gameplay and low-poly style graphics, inspired by the greatest classics of the genre. Full of platforming levels, combat arenas, many collectibles and secrets. Explore five worlds of Cyberland and save them from the malicious Virus and its army of bots!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8r5g.jpg'),(9909,'Splatter','2022-12-15','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Splatter is a first-person fever dream where you blast constantly-adapting enemies into neon sprays of pulp and slime. Enter a digital mindscape constructed by four anonymous administrators. Can you survive? Can you remain sane? Can you remain yourself?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nwl.jpg'),(9910,'Destroy All Humans!: Crypto 137 Edition','2020-07-28','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9911,'Pago Forest: Dragon\'s Revenge','2020-10-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The first of its kind, \"Pago\'s Forest\" is an educational game: you improve your grammar through the discovery of a heroic fantasy tale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k81.jpg'),(9912,'Beaver Run','2022-09-02','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Beaver Run is a Runner style arcade game where the user leaps and dashes through obstacles to get to the finish line. Play and survive through 12 levels of as you complete your adventure as a Beaver.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56nw.jpg'),(9913,'The Amazing Spider-Man Rescue','1978-12-31','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Handheld Electronic LCD','\"The Amazing Spider-Man Rescue\" is a simple portable game that is mostly based on random luck. The player presses a button, after which various lights illuminate, accumulating different points. These points need to be manually counted and added to the score wheel as Spider-Man climbs higher and higher. The game can be played with two players. The game is functionally identical to The Incredible Hulk Escapes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xga.jpg'),(9914,'Aerial_Knight\'s We Never Yield','2024-07-16','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Discover pulse-pounding stylized parkour action as you run, jump, smash, and slide through an afro-futurist-inspired kingdom. Enjoy a single-player or two-player local cooperative mode and experience the story of two brothers and their unexpected return to their lost kingdom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83n1.jpg'),(9915,'Oblivion Override','2023-06-14','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this fast-paced roguelike side-scroller, hack and slash your way through the Dulce Base as Crimson the combat robot. Unleash fierce rhythmic attacks, customize and retrofit your build whenever, and uncover the true past of a post-apocalyptic robotic civilization…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6izp.jpg'),(9916,'Ravva and the Phantom Library','2023-12-20','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Escape the Phantom Library! Embark into worlds of fantastic books haunted by dangerous ghosts, but you\'re not alone! Join Ravva and 4 unusual companions in this pixel-art platformer in cute dark-fantasy visuals! Can you face this challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wzd.jpg'),(9917,'BHU',NULL,'Fighting','Sin plataforma','BHU (for \"Beat Her Up\") is a fighting game with an all-feminine cast. It is a predecessor to the Schoolgirl Fighting series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zssjbmr7knpht7tafn09.jpg'),(9918,'Crimes Against Slimes','2024-11-05','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crimes Against Slimes is a game where you fight against the never-ending slime hordes, gain upgrades as you level up, and do whatever you can to survive as long as you can.\n\nIt is a survival game where all you can do is run away and shoot the enemies that constantly hunt you down. At first, the slime horde might seem unbeatable but the stronger you get the more you formidable an opponent you become!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co927e.jpg'),(9919,'Conan Exiles: Debaucheries of Derketo Pack','2019-10-08','Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox One','Surrender to your baser desires of lust and excess through the Debaucheries of Derketo Pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kew.jpg'),(9920,'Perfect Bird Pitch',NULL,'Music, Puzzle, Indie','Sin plataforma','Save chicks with a cute black cat! Guess and identify its parent birds with its voice. All you need is so-called perfect pitch!\n\nThe appearance of the chicks is all white and unrecognizable, but they are to chirp in the same pitch as their parent birds.\n\nThe black cat felt benevolent toward the chicks that dropped down due to the strong wind and decided to look for its parent birds.\n\nBy the time you have done the entire game, you will have developed a nearly absolute pitch sense.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co777j.jpg'),(9921,'She Sees Red','2020-05-13','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','She Sees Red is an interactive live-action thriller full of drama, violence, and your responsibility. A detective is doing her best to catch an elusive criminal who murdered several people in a night club. Make different choices to affect the plot line and reveal all pieces of the puzzle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co233q.jpg'),(9922,'Trianthology: Sanmenkyou no Kuni no Alice','2016-08-31','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A visual novel written by Ryukishi07, Tanaka Romeo, and Yuuto Tonokawa and published by 07th Expansion.\n\nA witch named Alice escapes boredom by experiencing three stories: Country Girl, High School Love Adventure, and Vespio 2438.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3doj.jpg'),(9923,'Vega Conflict: Punisher Cruiser Pack',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','The most essential piece of any Xeno Division fleet is the brutal, all-purpose Punisher Cruiser. Now is the time to get yours! Pick up this pack to receive 3 Punisher Cruisers, as well as a full complement of Xeno Disintegrator Cannons to rain down destruction upon the Alien menace.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9924,'Altered','2021-03-12','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Altered is a meditative puzzle game mixing hard puzzles and a soothing atmosphere. Explore a mysterious world filled with challenging puzzles solving them by altering your characters in multiple ways, forcing you to think outside the box.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i2p.jpg'),(9925,'Final Spin','2024-06-07','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 2-4 player online party game about risking your life for the thrill of high-stakes gambling. Use your items wisely to gain an edge over chance and play until you are the last person standing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bwz.jpg'),(9926,'CrazySonic','2015-10-19','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','CrazySonic is a joke hack of Sonic the Hedgehog by Ralakimus. This project was first released as a demo build in July of 2015 and was later released in October for SHC 2015. This hack is a mixture of CrazyBus\' gameplay and music and Sonic 1\'s gameplay, plus other additions. It was designed to be as obnoxious as possible to evoke negative reactions from players. Despite this, it is generally considered to be amusing by players, especially first time players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qkm.jpg'),(9927,'Jack Nicklaus Perfect Golf','2016-05-03','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Jack Nicklaus Perfect Golf is a next generation, indie developed, single player and multiplayer golf game. Jack Nicklaus Perfect Golf provides a truly immersive experience centered on stunning visuals and hyper-realistic game play. Don\'t just play golf - play PerfectGolf!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/iq7h2ta6ltoitkwxzuvz.jpg'),(9928,'Running Through Backrooms','2024-08-29','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Running Through Backrooms, an immersive horror experience that plunges you into the eerie and unsettling world of the Backrooms. Navigate through seemingly endless hallways and abandoned rooms. Each level presents a unique challenge, combining the thrill of parkour with the terror of the unknown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97ir.jpg'),(9929,'Sword of Fargoal','1983-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Commodore VIC-20, Commodore C64/128/MAX, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The pawn has to climb down into an underground dungeon and search for a sword between the fifteenth and twentieth level. He shall hand over this \"Sword of Fargoal\" to the blind knight Gedwyn, so he can fight the devilish Umla.\nAs soon as the player has found the sword in the depths of the dungeon, there are about 30 minutes left to take it out. If it gets lost on the way he must return to the level where he found it.\nSame as in other fantasy role games, the player improves his abilities by collecting experience points. As soon as he has reached 200 experience points, the player goes up one level and his resistance against wounds is raised. The next stage is at 400, the third at 800 and so on (each twice the experience points).\nThe treasures contained in every level can be swapped against experience points in the temple that belongs to every stage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ifx.jpg'),(9930,'Stellar Impact','2012-03-04','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Stellar Impact you command a space battleship in intense tactical multi-player battles! You can choose between several ship classes--from the fast corvette to the heavy dreadnought. Make your own skills template according to your preferences: attack, defense, speed, maneuverability or reconnaissance. Upgrade your spaceship, its crew and the weapons system to get stronger and crush your enemies in various game modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fqinjfzz7onyhdgningq.jpg'),(9931,'LogiKing','2022-12-15','Puzzle, Strategy, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','LogiKing is a game where you utilize the effects of 10 cards numbered 0 to 9 and deduce your opponent\'s hidden cards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6uvj.jpg'),(9932,'Sky Sojourn','2023-12-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the world of Sky Sojourn! You are an adventurer who embarks on an amazing journey overcoming obstacles on floating islands. Will you be able to conquer the peaks and reach your goal? Get ready for an unforgettable climb full of amazing discoveries!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6y3w.jpg'),(9933,'Futanari Sex: The Birthday Massage','2022-06-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An explicit erotic visual novel about a sexy young woman treating herself with a very expensive massage for her birthday. But when she finds out her masseuse has a cock hiding in her pants, she can’t help herself and asks for a happy ending instead of a happy birthday.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5omj.jpg'),(9934,'Playboy Manager',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Play as a talent agent in the Playboy MMO world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/l6sj0acl5rjzxh9ivzfy.jpg'),(9935,'FlightGear','1997-07-17','Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','FlightGear is a free, open-source space and flight simulator used in aerospace research with flight dynamics (JSBSim) used in 2015 NASA benchmark to judge future sim code to NASA standards. The goal of the FlightGear project is to create a sophisticated and open flight simulator framework for use in research or academic environments, pilot training, as an industry engineering tool, for DIY-ers to pursue their favorite interesting flight simulation idea, and last but certainly not least as a fun, realistic, and challenging desktop flight simulator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1o7v.jpg'),(9936,'Power & Revolution: 2019 Edition','2019-03-12','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The new evolution of Geopolitical Simulator 4, the hyperrealistic simulator of today\'s world! In Power & Revolution 2019 Edition, play as the Head of State and extend your influence around the globe. By playing as several countries, try to change the destiny of our planet with orchestrated actions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vj9.jpg'),(9937,'Tiny Pixels Vol. 1: Ninpo Blast','2024-08-14','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Jump on your hoverbike and blast off for unlimited ninja-themed bullet hell mayhem!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8o4h.jpg'),(9938,'Arcade Game Series: Galaga','2016-04-19','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','First appearing in arcades in 1981, the masterpiece GALAGA finally comes to Xbox One!\nMove the fighter left and right, and destroy the waves of incoming aliens in this space-age shooter.\nDestroy all the enemies to advance to the next stage!\nRetrieve a captured fighter and combine into a Dual Fighter!\nTry your hand at Challenging Stages that appear after every few levels, and aim for a perfect score!\n\nWith multiple enemy formations, the high-risk, high-reward of the Dual Fighter, and the Challenging Stages, there\'s plenty here for even the most hardcore players!\n\nThis latest port comes with scanline and sound settings, and the option to switch between the old and new versions - perfect for true fans of the game.\nExperience the shining star of 80\'s arcades for yourself!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rrztpp5iosrmwovhn1ea.jpg'),(9939,'Gamera: The Time Adventure','1995-03-22','Point-and-click','Playdia','Gamera: The Time Adventure is a Playdia game based on the popular turtle kaiju hero.\n\nThe disc also includes a trailer of the 1995 film Gamera: Guardian of the Universe with a message from actress Ayako Fujitani in the role of heroine Asagi Kusanagi.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31i2.jpg'),(9940,'Pokémon Infinite Fusion','2015-04-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pokémon Infinite Fusion is based on the Pokémon fusion generator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k5u.jpg'),(9941,'Minimum','2014-08-03','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Minimum focuses on fast-paced shooting fun and a robust system of in-match crafting, team objectives and customizable roles to create a rich and rewarding PvP experience. You\'ll find a bunch of interesting weapons to collect and customize, armor sets to mix and match, a solid core game mode known at TITAN MODE and more all wrapped up in a unique, minimalist artistic style that\'s more than the sum of its parts. Some of our coolest features include:\n\nCustomizable Weapons: Craft dozens of lethal weapons with unique abilities and roles to best fit your personal playstyles. Each weapon has 5 power levels that are activate during kill streaks, increasing your power making you a force to be feared. Be careful though: weapon power levels are lost upon death, so with great power comes great risk.\n\nBlueprint Crafting System: Gather materials from fallen foes and defeated objectives to craft and upgrade armor sets over the course of a match. Each set of armor has different benefits and weaknesses that can emphasize your favorite playstyle or counter what your enemies are trying to do.\n\nTitan Mode: Battle in epic matches centered on the your team\'s Titan, a giant, destructive robot that confronts the enemy\'s Titan. Players can power up their Titan by performing tasks in-game, can defend their mammoth ally by killing enemy players, and can attack enemy Titans directly. The teams compete until one side\'s Titan reaches the enemy base and destroys it!\n\n5v5 Competitive Gameplay: Create cunning strategies with your teammates and define your unique role on the team by combining different weapons, armor and devices. Support your teammates weapons that increase drop rates for materials and powerups, defend your Titan with armor that grants additional health and survivability, scout enemy positions with weapon and armor that increase speed and allow for double or triple jumps, or simply go glass cannon and dish out as much damage as you can.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1l28.jpg'),(9942,'Beatus Creation Solitaire','2022-05-26','Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Play with VTuber super crew “Beatus Creation” in the classic card game “Spider Solitaire”! Unlock new themes, illustrations, and stamps designed based on each member of Beatus Creation using the coins you earn each time you clear a stage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bjv.jpg'),(9943,'Torikago no Marriage','2014-04-25','Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Torikago no Marriage is an otome game released in 2014 for PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sid.jpg'),(9944,'Ninja Striker!','2018-04-18','Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Ninja Striker! takes visuals and music inspired by the 8-bit era and fires them up with modern touches. Heavily stylised around Japanese themes, your goal is to advance forward with as much speed, flair and combo power as possible. You have double jumps, homing attacks and a special ‘Shinobi Action’ at your disposal; only by mastering each with sharp reflexes will you make it through your quest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81ho.jpg'),(9945,'Granvil\'s Fairytale','2023-12-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Granvil\'s fairytale is an interesting and challenging platform adventure that gives you a lot of satisfaction. By controlling the movements of the dwarf, you need to show above-average dexterity to move on to the next stage. At the same time, you will see an world full of obstacles and surprises!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dtm.jpg'),(9946,'Hockey League Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Sport','Sin plataforma','Make the \"Power Play\" on and off the ice!\n\nExperience the other side of Hockey, the side most people never see. Behind the scenes, where an elite few make the decisions that ultimately lead to victory or defeat. Enter the fast paced world of international sports management, where the movers and shakers spend millions to build their dream teams. Where an injury on the ice can create or destroy empires. Now you can be a player in the game behind the game. Arrange trades and close deals, find that hot new talent in the farm leagues and draft him up to the majors. Keep one eye on the competition and the other on the bottom line as you work to turn your team into an unstoppable juggernaut on the road to the cup!\n\nBuild accurate emulations of any team from any year and play the fantasy games that you\'ve only dreamed of. Imagine, the 1970 Bruins versus the 1987 Oilers face to face in the most incredible play off series of all time! Or, build an invincible All Star Team and take on all challengers!\n\nThe choice is yours- this time you\'re in charge!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wokwcsrh5sqegtk5jjdy.jpg'),(9947,'It Could Happen to You','2024-10-18','Point-and-click, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Your peaceful holiday is interrupted when the small village you’re visiting in becomes terrorized by strange lights on the sky and enigmatic men in black. Some villagers have gone missing, everyone is afraid. Dive into a thrilling adventure with branching narrative and a unique visual style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jif.jpg'),(9948,'Summit','2022-02-24','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a giant mountain massif in this classical 2D Metroidvania. Climb daring mountain passes, explore forgotten ruins and gather equipment as you ascend your way to the ultimate destination - the Summit.\n\nThis already war-torn country has recently been befallen by a mighty set of catastrophes. Your unlikely protagonist, a member of the weak Ruby tribe, turned out to be one of a few survivors of the last cataclysm, a giant avalanche. Your initial personal mission quickly turns into the ultimate search for truth - a search that requires you to climb the fabled grand summit.\n\nYour journey begins when you wake up in a mysterious cave. Struck by the blow of a giant avalanche you and your fellow miners have been washed away into the darkness. You must climb out of this crevasse and head to Pinetown - the once great village at the very foot of the Mountain. There might be your only chance to gather the strength, the gear and the knowledge to begin your ascent of the unknown. Your destination - the Summit - is clear, but the way there is as treacherous as it is fabulous.\n\nAlong your way you will stumble upon characters of all tribes, foreigners and natives to the mountain. You will find climbing equipment that will be essential for your progression - an icepick, a rope and grappling hook, a parachute and many more. You will also encounter great obstacles, mysteries and enemies which will make your journey even more epic.\n\nThis game combines the joy of exploring a large interconnected world with fluid and unique platforming and engaging puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3jgw.jpg'),(9949,'Taisen Daifugo Cross','2009-10-29','Card & Board Game','Legacy Mobile Device','Taisen Daifugo Cross adds cross-platform multiplayer compatibility.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9950,'Letter Quest: Grimm\'s Journey','2014-01-30','Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Letter Quest is a turn-based RPG where players attack monsters by spelling words. But be careful since the monsters know how to fight back - they can create different letter tiles such as poison, plague, stone, whirlwind, duplicator, spike and flipped, steal your health, heal themselves, use critical attacks, and much, much more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86zl.jpg'),(9951,'Plan B from Outer Space: A Bavarian Odyssey','2021-10-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Escape the grasp of the Barbvarians! Plan B from Outer Space is a stellar adventure in the style of an interactive book and takes inspiration from classic science-fiction stories and Bavarian culture. Every decision will affect the outcome of your mission; to leave this strange planet unscathed!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5khy.jpg'),(9952,'MotoGP 22','2022-04-21','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Start your engines! MotoGP 22 is the most immersive and realistic chapter of the racing simulator series MotoGP yet! Immediate fun from day one with the 2022 official season and the new split-screen mode to challenge your friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ky4.jpg'),(9953,'Mario Kart SX','2021-08-27','Racing','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','What if Nintendo created a DLC track pack for Super Mario Kart in 1992? The aim of this hack is to make a compliment to the original game. Super Mario Kart featured courses named for Mario, Koopa and Bowser. This has new themes for the other 5 characters plus a revamp of the Mario, Bowser and Rainbow Road courses. In addition to 20 all-new standard tracks, it also features 4 new battle courses.\n\nThe roster is mostly the same but Donkey Kong Jr. has been replaced with regular Donkey Kong and Koopa is replaced with Paratroopa.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qt1.jpg'),(9954,'Norco: Special Edition',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','The Norco Special Edition includes:\n\n• Norco\n• The Norco Original Soundtrack\n• The Art of Norco','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mez.jpg'),(9955,'Fairy Godmother Stories: Cinderella - Collector\'s Edition','2019-11-22','Point-and-click, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','This is a special Collector\'s Edition release full of exclusive extras you won\'t find in the standard version. The Collector\'s Edition includes:\n\n• Rescue Red Riding Hood’s Grandmother in the bonus game!\n• Inspect hidden cabinets, concoct potions, and more by replaying HOPs and mini-games and earn achievements!\n• Tons of magic shoes, moonstones, and morphing objects to find!\n• Enjoy exclusive wallpapers, music, videos, and more!\n• Never get lost with the strategy guide!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97kp.jpg'),(9956,'Soreike! Anpanman: Minna de Hiking Game!','1992-04-20','Puzzle','Family Computer','Anpanman travels around the world helping people. But what is Anpanman? He’s a superhero whose head is made out of sweet rolls filled with bean jam. Soreike! Anapanman is a fun board game for the Famicom, based on a cartoon by the same name. It is relatively straightforward and simple to play, with no\ncomplex features or obstacles to overcome. There are eight maps and a ninth to unlock, and up to three human players can participate. Join Currypanman and Shokupanman as you try to beat Baikinman!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52uw.jpg'),(9957,'Feather Park','2022-09-23','Adventure, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore an autumn park and play minigames. Make friends and enter the barn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65kf.jpg'),(9958,'City of Secrets 2',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','City Of Secrets 2 is the cancelled sequel to the original point-and-click adventure game, City Of Secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zk7.jpg'),(9959,'Love Love School Days','2023-02-06','Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The protagonist is trapped in the world of a love game. Can you return to the real world again...? Try to escape while running away from the gal game heroine A love simulation-style survival horror game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jmf.jpg'),(9960,'Sakura Taisen 1 & 2','2006-03-09','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical','PlayStation Portable','Sakura Wars 1 & 2 is a compilation of Sakura Wars and Sakura Wars 2 ~Thou Shalt Not Die~ compacted onto a single UMD.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kz2.jpg'),(9961,'Donkey Kong Country','2003-06-06','Platform, Adventure','Game Boy Advance','An expanded port of the original Donkey Kong Country for the SNES. Includes extra collectables, remixed/remastered music and sound design, and additional game modes and minigames.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7j9s.jpg'),(9962,'Dust City','2014-08-20','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A CITY HAS APPEARED IN THE \"CRATER.\"\n\nSatellite imagery verifies that the city had not existed within the crater prior to 12 hours ago.\n\nYou have been randomly selected to investigate the city in the crater to search for anomalies, artifacts, or clues as to the nature of the city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co482p.jpg'),(9963,'Surv1v3','2019-01-29','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Oculus VR, PlayStation VR2, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Forget what you have played so far, Surv1v3 is a unique realistic zombie survival fps game expressly designed for VR that will let you test your survival skills. Play the thrilling story in single mode or coop with your friends (up to 4 players) and survive the apocalypse!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wyi.jpg'),(9964,'Be Rich','2009-01-07','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take charge of Be Rich Inc. where you are CEO to the hottest new real estate firm in the country. Build housing for undeveloped zones, provide your tenants with shopping and maintenance services, decorate greenways, builds stadiums, it\'s all at your fingertips. If you can raise capital, you can turn the neighborhood of your dreams into a reality. Act now before your profit margin slips away!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xsy.jpg'),(9965,'Reversi Let\'s Go','2021-06-03','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Reversi Let\'s Go is a highly-acclaimed strategy board game for all ages. It takes a minute to learn and a lifetime to master! Four different game modes are available for you to play: Classic Solo World-class AI with 8 difficulty levels, suits both beginners and advanced players. Endgame Challenge Solve 80 well-chosen endgame puzzles. Give it a try and show yourself you are a truly Reversi master. Lights Out Classic electronic game - Lights Out. Can you flip all pieces to black on the board? Local co-op for Two Players Do play with your family and friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5aqx.jpg'),(9966,'Space Drop','2024-11-05','Sport, Indie, Arcade','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR','Leap from spaceships into warp tunnels moving at extreme speeds in this exhilarating VR experience. Evade obstacles, maneuver through space gates, collect pickups, and challenge yourself to become the best “Space Jumper” in the universe.\n\nCompete for Galactic Glory','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gpx.jpg'),(9967,'Helldivers: Weapons Pack','2015-12-07','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Weapons Pack is a collection of weapons not normally issued to Helldivers. The weapons are both ultra modern experimental weapons and tried and true workhorses in new formats. The Weapons Pack contains: PLAS-1 ‘Scorcher’: The first ever Helldiver issued plasma weapon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ivk.jpg'),(9968,'XXZ: Strip Club','2017-08-30','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zombie Apocalypses turned out to be somewhat different from what science fiction authors used to write. Only women can turn into zombies. Day Z caught you in one of the biggest strip clubs in Las Vegas. You are gathering a group of three people in order to escape the city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l9s.jpg'),(9969,'Fantasy Zone II: The Tears of Opa-Opa','2008-09-11','Shooter','Arcade','Fantasy Zone II DX: The Tears of Opa-Opa is a special Fantasy Zone game first seen in the Sega Ages 2500 series entry, Sega Ages 2500 Series Vol. 33: Fantasy Zone Complete Collection. It is a remake of Fantasy Zone II: The Tears of Opa-Opa running on emulated Sega System 16 arcade hardware. As of MAME version 0.146u2, the game is currently available to play in an emulator.\n\nFantasy Zone II DX was re-released with additional features in 2014 in Japan and 2015 worldwide as 3D Fantasy Zone II W on the Nintendo 3DS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95nj.jpg'),(9970,'Color Chaos','2016-05-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Color Chaos is a twin stick shooter that delivers fun and chaotic color swapping arcade action that will keep you coming back time and time again to beat the highscores on the leaderboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tkm.jpg'),(9971,'Run!ZombieFoods!','2017-07-15','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','《Run!ZombieFoods!》 It\'s a survival strategy game. By expanding the ranks of survivors, raising the level of survivor experience, exploring the room to collect survival resources, so that you survive in the end of the better.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r7l.jpg'),(9972,'Don\'t Move','2013-09-13','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Don\'t Move is an experimental puzzle platformer with a focus on ludonarrative dissonance and player investment manipulation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29r5.jpg'),(9973,'Hitori Kakurenbo Online','2024-03-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Assymetrical multiplayer horror based on the viral Hitori Kakurenbo japanese ritual, you will play as the evil Doll or the stupid survivor teenagers that prepared the ritual in quick fun replayable games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vn9.jpg'),(9974,'Pokémon Art Academy','2014-10-23','Simulator','Nintendo 3DS','This Pokémon-themed installment of the Art Academy series offers Pokémon fans and budding illustrators alike 40 unique lessons to learn how to paint, sketch and draw beloved Pokémon characters in 2D. Along the way, students of Pokémon Art Academy can pick up actual illustration skills that they can transfer onto real canvas, or share their digital masterpieces with the world. Pokémon Art Academy boasts 40 lessons in which players can encounter favorite Pokémon from throughout the series, such as Pikachu, Oshawott, Charizard, Torchic, Fletchling and Fennekin.\n\nThe Art Academy series offers a comprehensive virtual art studio with a variety of realistically behaving art materials. Wield the stylus with tactile precision on the Nintendo 3DS or Nintendo 2DS touch screen to use a plethora of paint, pencils and pastels. A hallmark of the Art Academy franchise is its easy-to-follow lessons with step-by-step guides that teach painting and drawing techniques. A friendly tutor takes students of all ages through these lessons, each of which breaks down complex-looking images into simple steps. Gradually, players pick up more new techniques that allow anyone to create artwork they can be proud of.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zis.jpg'),(9975,'PC Engine Mini','2020-03-19','Sin género','Plug & Play','The PC Engine Mini is a dedicated home video game console by Konami modeled on NEC\'s TurboGrafx-16, which was designed by Hudson Soft, a video game developer which Konami acquired in 2012. The Mini emulates the original console\'s 8-bit hardware.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wb2.jpg'),(9976,'Mega Man III Ultimate','2016-08-27','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Mega Man III Ultimate is a rebalance of the game\'s level designs, with special attention paid to the Doc Robot and Wily stages, extending from kuja killer\'s Mega Man 3 Improvement hack and serving as a predecessor to the TheSkipper1995\'s later Mega Man 3 Revamped.\n\nBetween the revamped difficulty and inclusions of kuja killer\'s improvements, Mega Man III Ultimate is \"how Mega Man III should have been back in 1990\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90c5.jpg'),(9977,'Ytash','2025-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Ytash is a fast-paced, 2D Metroidvania. Ignite your sword and explore the dark depths and towering heights of a forgotten island that consumed itself long ago.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kup.jpg'),(9978,'SnackHunter','2022-07-08','Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Enchanted snacks face off against hungry mages in this chaotic game of hide-and-seek. Host SnackHunter on your PC and join with your friends on your smartphone. Whether online or locally, with up to 16 players, the party can start now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50he.jpg'),(9979,'Locke(d)','2021-01-23','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An algorithm decided to show you this. What now?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62h1.jpg'),(9980,'Tanitani Wizard','2022-08-26','Shooter','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a retro style pixel-art bullet-hell shooting game.\nDodge the barrage of bullets, destroy enemies and obstacles to advance.\nThere are several types of items available from treasure chests, including shot enhancements, movement speed increases, and a randomly selected companion Tanishi(snail).\nThe ability of the companion Tanishi(snail) slows down the enemy\'s shot, and sometimes even eliminates the enemy\'s bullets.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9981,'Puzzle Pieces 4: Farewell Dear Winter','2023-02-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','With this Jigsaw gameplay and dazzling collection of puzzles, the beauty never stops. The pictures are a mix of beautiful winter and spring scenes. There are a lot of options to choose, from puzzle shape and number of pieces. You will love to use your own images and create puzzles from them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65yw.jpg'),(9982,'Hentai Lust',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','The game \"Hentai Lust\" is relaxing a hentai puzzle in which you need to move the elements vertically or horizontally to get the finished image.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rhn.jpg'),(9983,'Umigame',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Umigame is an explosive roguelite multiplayer adventure. Defeat challenging enemies. Protect and strategically use the Egg, a powerful artifact essential for victory. Unlock unique characters, builds, and strategies in every session.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8k0r.jpg'),(9984,'Water Star Adventure','2021-04-21','Platform','Nintendo 64','Water Star Adventure is a ROM hack for Super Mario 64. It is the seventh installment of the \"Star Adventure\" hack series, featuring 7 courses with 30 stars including a Bowser fight.\n\nThe gimmick, as the game title implies, it has a new mechanism using water physics that the player can use to swim to navigate unreachable places. The plot is bound with philosophy and religious metaphors and most stars and NPCs will tell the player have more or less relevance in the gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co569t.jpg'),(9985,'Rainbow Dawn','2019-05-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','One day, you find yourself trapped in a dream state. You can\'t remember anything about yourself, where you came from, and why you\'ve been asleep for so long. Once you wake up, you realize that the entire world has been cleansed of all human souls..! At least, so you are told by your fairy companion, Hope. You need to find other signs of human life if you wish to survive, if there are any left. However... people may have still had regrets before they passed, and it\'s up to you to fulfill them.. or not.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s5b.jpg'),(9986,'Party Animals: Deluxe Edition','2023-09-20','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Purchase the Deluxe Edition to receive the following exclusive content:\n- Nemo Bucks*1300\n- Bathrobe Harry Outfit & Avatar & Frame\n- Bathrobe Coco Outfit & Avatar & Frame\n- Bathrobe Garfat Outfit & Avatar & Frame\n- Golden Nemo Skin & Avatar\n- Golden Macchiato Skin & Avatar\n- Golden Coco Skin & Avatar','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co787r.jpg'),(9987,'Star Trek Newton: Part One - Anomaly','2009-11-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crewman John Fischer is a recent graduate of Starfleet Academy assigned to the USS Newton, a Constitution-class vessel currently tasked with performing scientific surveys in Sector 004. On the completion of his first week aboard his new assignment, John begins to realize that the reality of life in Starfleet isn\'t all chasing hostile aliens and meeting strange cultures. In fact, it can be quite dull. No sooner does he log this gloomy summary than the ship is rattled by some unseen force that disables many of the ships systems! Isolated and unaware of what is wreaking havoc on the Newton, John must get to his duty station and help himself and his crew stabilize the ship.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9988,'Final Fantasy VII: The First Soldier','2021-11-17','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','A battle royale game set in Midgar before the events of FFVII. As a SOLDIER candidate, make full use of your abilities in a battle for your survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tyz.jpg'),(9989,'Dark Roast Cafe','2024-04-15','Simulator, Strategy','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Summon demons to help you run your business, and work yourself to boost their performance. Decorate the interior, keep the place tidy and pick the best employees to fulfill your customers\' needs!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86mn.jpg'),(9990,'Air Conflicts: Pacific Carriers','2019-03-26','Simulator, Strategy, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Nintendo Switch','True heroes know no bounds! Experience top combat action in this brand new arcade flight sim and become immersed in the exploits of famous aircraft carriers. Choose the side you want to play on: the US Navy or the Imperial Japanese Navy. Climb into the cockpit and re-live the most famous battles of the War in the Pacific.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dx1.jpg'),(9991,'Ghost Study','2020-12-13','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are participating in a study that aims to determine the effects of low-frequency sounds on the human body. Previous studies have shown that these frequencies can cause odd sensations that people attribute to Paranormal Encounters. What will you experience?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(9992,'Fish N Chat','2024-03-20','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Fish N Chat! Feel free to take things easy and relax on the wide open lake in this low poly and 90s chatroom style horror game! Chat with the locals, explore this peaceful lake, and aim to catch the massive fish everyone keeps talking about...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87if.jpg'),(9993,'Sacred Fire','2021-10-18','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sacred Fire is a narrative RPG in which your humanity and emotions impact your fight for survival and inner freedom. Inspired by ancient Caledonia, the story follows a group of resistance fighters and their rise to power.\n\nChoosing motives, ideas and feelings is as important as choosing your actions. Develop your personality and compete for influence to change the story and avert a tragic ending.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v79.jpg'),(9994,'Vermillion Descent',NULL,'Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After falling for what seems like forever, Dictum combat android VERSION-1.413^^10+2 finds herself in a mysterious otherworld deep below, an endless chasm devoid of life and futures. Without memory of who she was, who she is, or where she\'s located, all she can remember is that HOME is ABOVE.\n\nExplore a beautiful and melancholy hand-drawn world inspired by the art of Tsutomu Nihei\'s Blame! and Aposimz. With only your wits and a one-ton coilgun attached to your arm, you must navigate the lower layers of the Follicle, an immense superstructure that seems to extend endlessly both in space and time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4z08.jpg'),(9995,'Hole Dweller','2022-01-25','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hole dweller is a sandbox incremental furry porn game! You are the captain of a caravan, with spare rooms, not to worry there are plenty of cute and hot characters to fill them with.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ga6.jpg'),(9996,'Among Us: Crewmate Edition','2021-12-14','Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Play online with 4-15 players as you attempt to hold your spaceship together and return back to civilization. But beware... as there may be an alien impostor aboard!\n\nThe Crewmate Edition includes:\n- Base Game\n- DLC items: Airship, Polus and MIRA HQ Skins, and Hamster Pet, Bedcrab Pet, Brainslug Pet, Stickmin Pet, and Mini Crewmate bundles\n- 3D Lenticular Case\n- Impostor Syndrome Sticker Sheet\n- 1 of 12 Special Mira HQ Holographic Access Cards\n- Folded Skeld Map Poster designed\n- Redeemable Code for 6 PC/Phone Wallpapers','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wwy.jpg'),(9997,'Kessen III','2005-02-22','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 2','In Kessen III the player takes control of Nobunaga Oda, and unlike the previous two games, you cannot choose a side to play on, and Nobunaga has one goal only... to unify the lands and rid his world of misery and suffering.\n\nFollowing the prequels, this game comes with lots of cinematics and stays true to strategic as well as action gameplay, adding a few new things along the road, like collecting items during battles.\n\nThe two main aspects of this game are planning and engaging in battle. Select officers and strategically place them on the field of battle, assign commands and issue orders. When on the battlefield, each of the officers, including Nobunaga, will have his/her army at their disposal which can be controlled at any point. Level-ups bring additional special attacks to both officers and their troops.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48k3.jpg'),(9998,'Street Survival: Homeless Simulator','2024-11-02','Simulator','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Street Survival: Homeless Simulator plunges you into the unforgiving world of life on the streets. As a homeless individual, your daily struggle for survival is real and relentless. Set in a sprawling urban environment, the game challenges you to navigate the complexities of street life with limited resources and constant dangers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s7f.jpg'),(9999,'Brick Breaker Premium 2','2020-11-10','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Amazon Fire TV, Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','An Arcade Classic. This is the sequel to the classic brick-breaker game. You are the hero, Blippy, the paddle, that has to save planet Earth from a new threat. Over 40 Brand New Challenging Levels to Complete. See the brand new cutscenes at the end if you can complete the game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mkg.jpg'),(10000,'Astérix & Obélix XXL 2: Mission Las Vegum','2006-06-30','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Astérix & Obélix XXL 2: Mission Las Vegum is the sequel of Astérix & Obélix XXL, it was released exclusively in Europe due to the lower popularity of the franchise in the United States and Japan. The game stars the French comic book characters Asterix & Obelix and features spoofs to many classic games, in the same fashion that the comics spoof historical characters and make many cultural references.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fkx.jpg'),(10001,'FelisBelus','2024-04-30','Fighting, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A funny game to represent our pet cats and keep a record and memory of them forever.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gwz.jpg'),(10002,'Mental Harm',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Mental Harm is a first-person psychological horror game. Explore an old, long forgotten atmospheric basement of a house where some strange things are happening','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6413.jpg'),(10003,'Miss Paint',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Miss Paint\" is a puzzle platformer game that takes place inside a nostalgic computer interface where you can use image editing tools such as rotate, resize, copy, move, and rectangle to edit the levels themselves and lead Miss Paint to victory by touching the color green!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8or8.jpg'),(10004,'Blazend','2022-01-07','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blaze through 7 action packed levels in this sci-fi shoot \'em up made to test even the toughest of shmup veterans. No tricks and no gimmicks; all you have is your raw skill. Board the Phoenix G7, and blast those alien lifeforms to interstellar space!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bp0.jpg'),(10005,'I\'m Hungry','2019-07-08','Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation VR, SteamVR','Play the role of a fast-food restaurant employee in I\'m Hungry VR game. You can definitely learn how to make fries, hamburgers and milk shake in the VR world and possibly the real world, as well! The game takes advantage of the VR technique, and it perfectly shows a realistic vision of a fast-food kitchen to the gamers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43ic.jpg'),(10006,'Soul Brave',NULL,'Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Soul Brave is a multiplayer action platform MMORPG with anime-style graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mcd.jpg'),(10007,'Versus Vampire','2023-08-24','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take part in the eternal battle between Vampires and Humans. Choose your camp and fight in this new online multiplayer action game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70e6.jpg'),(10008,'Monkey Adventure',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Run, jump, attack, explore. Cross the various dangers and reach the destination.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5li9.jpg'),(10009,'Guilty Gear: Strive - Additional Character 12: A.B.A','2024-03-26','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','This allows the character \"A.B.A\" to be used in-game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85c3.jpg'),(10010,'Engage Princess: Nemureru Himegimi to Yume no Mahoutsukai','2019-04-01','Music, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser','Engage Princess is a browser game distributed and operated by Dwango.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vu4.jpg'),(10011,'After Death','2017-10-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After Death is a platform / exploration game in a dark and hostile world. With the help from lost souls, you will have to find a way to open a gate which seems to be the only exit from this mysterious world infected by monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22mw.jpg'),(10012,'Caved-in',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Caved-in, a crazy, cute, and colorful parallel universe full of exploration and combat. Interact with cute and funny NPC\'s that will help you in your effort to escape the caverns of Quarry-135.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73og.jpg'),(10013,'1000 Deaths',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','1000 Deaths is a 3D adventure platformer about interpersonal conflicts and the effects of the media. Play fast-paced episodes and discover wildly different endings with each play through. Switch perspectives from a pool of eclectic characters, making decisions that you\'ll take with you to the grave.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vld.jpg'),(10014,'Bad Times at the Silver Lake','2023-05-19','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immerse yourself in the story of Sarah and her dog Shibu. Solve the mystery of the terrible virus infection and save the city of Salt Lake. Solve puzzles, shoot zombies and learn the terrible secrets of this city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gl6.jpg'),(10015,'Time Lord','1990-09-06','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','It is the year 2999, and warriors from the planet Drakkon are launching a savage attack on Earth. Their weapon: a powerful time travel device. Their objective: to control us by changing the course of our history. To win this war, we must meet the Drakkons on a unique and dangerous battleground: our own past! You are a fearless fortune-hunter, hired by desperate scientists for an experimental journey into the 4th dimension. Your code name is Time Lord. Your mission: blast into the past to save the present from certain doom! Battle the aliens in four historical time zones. Search for weapons sent back by the scientists - and decide when to use them. Solve puzzles to collect the mysterious Orbs that hold the secret of time travel. Be cautious yet quick, Time Lord. You have one short year to free history or be history! And the evil Drakkons have all the time in the world...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6owv.jpg'),(10016,'Octahedron: Transfixed Edition','2018-03-20','Music, Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Surf through a pulsating underworld on platforms YOU pull from thin air, where and when you want, in this psychedelic action platformer. Unlock devastating abilities across 50+ handcrafted levels as you defy gravity to a pumping beat. \n \nEnjoy brand new features & content exclusive to the Transfixed Edition: New time trial medals, dozens of new special challenges and new post-game unlockables.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co256i.jpg'),(10017,'Hitman 2: New York','2019-06-25','Shooter, Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','New York City is the most populous city in the United States of America, located in the state of New York. A thriving metropolis, it is home to many famous landmarks as well as Providence associates.\nThe mission Golden Handshake takes place in the city, located exclusively inside the Milton-Fitzpatrick bank. 47 must eliminate Athena Savalas and acquire a Providence data core from the bank\'s heavily-protected vault.\nThis is the first expansion included in the expansion pass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pg0.jpg'),(10018,'Colorspace',NULL,'Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Colorspace is a fast paced singleplayer racing game where you have to destroy obstacles by changing to the right color. Set in a neon minimalist environement, you must clear the levels as fast as possible to restore the communication signal.\nThe best part is you don\'t have breaks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77d7.jpg'),(10019,'Disciples II: Dark Prophecy','2002-01-24','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Disciples II is a fantasy strategy game, set in a fictional kingdom called Nevandaar (also referred to as \'The Sacred Lands\'). The main focus of the story revolves around four dominant races in a state of almost constant war. These four factions are the human Empire, the dwarven Mountain Clans, the demonic Legions of the Damned, and the skeletal Undead Hordes. There are also several other \'neutral\' races such as Merfolk, Greenskins and Elves (the Elves became a full-fledged playable race with the addition of the expansion pack \'Rise of the Elves\').\n\nThe gameplay is divided into three main parts; building up the Capital City of your race so that you can research new Warriors and spells, and building up new armies (this involves careful resource management); using heroes (leading small squads) to explore the surroundings, procure resources and attack the enemy; and finally the battles themselves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22lv.jpg'),(10020,'Classic Arcade Pinball','2004-12-31','Pinball','Plug & Play','Classic Arcade Pinball is a Plug It In & Play pinball TV game by Jakks Pacific and developed by HotGen released in 2004. The controller features front and top flipper buttons, a plunger, and a tilt feature.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fic.jpg'),(10021,'Miku Legends 2','2024-10-31','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation','Get ready to dive into the world of Mega Man Legends 2 like never before! In this special mod, the iconic blue hero has been swapped out for the Vocaloid superstar herself—Hatsune Miku! Grab your buster (or should we say, Miku-themed buster?), and explore this fan-favorite adventure in full Miku style. This isn’t just a character swap—it’s a full Miku transformation!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a37.jpg'),(10022,'Dimension Drive','2018-09-04','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dimension Drive is a space shooter that challenges your skills in entirely new ways. Play two games at once on this dual battlefield madness set on a comic book universe!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1sb0.jpg'),(10023,'Sight Of The Victim: Passenger 23','2025-03-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A regular night shift turns into a chilling fight for survival. Explore a bustling rest stop, uncover dark secrets, and face the haunting legacy of a tragic accident in PASSENGER 23.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j9y.jpg'),(10024,'The Deepwater Witch',NULL,'Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"What wish would you ask the witch to grant?\"\n\nIn a world ruined by pollution, the oceans have swallowed the lands. Ramil is a scavenger, a lowlife who digs through the trash littering his once idyllic hometown. One day he finds a mysterious girl on the beach. She can\'t speak, and she says that she doesn\'t remember where she came from. When Ramil meets her, he is dragged into a surreal dreamscape...but are they dreams or delusions?\n\nAs the mysteries surrounding the girl\'s identity unravel, Ramil is forced to answer a question: What price is he willing to pay to be happy?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7m5z.jpg'),(10025,'Mineral','2024-08-08','Platform, Puzzle','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','A minimalist sci-fi physics based ball-rolling puzzle game. Use abilities and gather collectables to solve puzzles and unlock secrets!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nlc.jpg'),(10026,'Qualia','2025-03-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Intellica thanks you for volunteering in this short text-based AMT study. Pay attention to the participants answers, and classify them as either Human or Artificial. Remember, think happy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co957e.jpg'),(10027,'The Continents: Breakthrough Gaming Activity Center','2022-11-20','Quiz/Trivia','PlayStation 4','A game in the \"Breakthrough Gaming Activity Center\" series!\nThis game\'s release is part of Breakthrough Gaming\'s \"Bible Video Game Sundays\"!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5un9.jpg'),(10028,'Space Duck: Escape','2024-12-03','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Collect equipment and climb upwards to assist Puddles the Duck escape from an erupting volcanic planet in this fast paced rogue-lite vertical platformer. Move quickly to avoid the rising lava flows to help this Space Duck Escape!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dhm.jpg'),(10029,'R.R.S Cape','2023-12-17','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You wake up confused inside the R.R.S Cape, a research submersible on an expedition to survey a newly discovered archipelago. As you come to your senses, you realise that you are stranded *somewhere* at the bottom of the sea & oxygen is quickly running out...\n\nWith limited air, a map & any clues you can gather from inside your soon-to-become coffin, can you deduce your precise location to call for a rescue mission before it is too late?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87ur.jpg'),(10030,'Yang2020: Path to Presidency','2019-12-30','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Andrew Yang is unstoppable on his path to presidency! Play through all of the ups and downs of his campaign journey as you battle the other candidates, the naysayers and of course President Trump!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hy9.jpg'),(10031,'Horror of the Deep','2017-01-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Fallen into a giant old dungeon, unclear for any destiny, you have to descent deeper and deeper to a place, where even all cries will be silenced.​','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24fh.jpg'),(10032,'Heal The Survivors','2024-11-14','Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A horde survival game where the object is to keep moving and stay awake to heal the hordes of patients chasing you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92s4.jpg'),(10033,'Battle Bears Blast','2011-07-12','Sport','iOS','Battle Bears Blast is a Battle Bears mini-game developed by SkyVu Entertainment. You play as Oliver, and you must stop the Huggables from invading your territory and hugging you to death.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xmljmnbpj2iktdgf9cqb.jpg'),(10034,'Grand Ore Deal','2020-09-25','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Solve puzzles, find secret levels and mine magical ore which makes you faster the more you carry and bring it back to the level start to complete levels','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w5c.jpg'),(10035,'Orbit Putt','2024-11-25','Sport, Indie','iOS','Fling golf balls through asteroid belts, wormholes, and tricky gravitational fields in your quest to save the universe from the growing black holes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93o5.jpg'),(10036,'Keith Van Eron\'s Pro Soccer','1988-12-31','Simulator, Sport','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','The game consists of two different soccer simulations, you can carry out a match in the stadium or indoors. The field is always shown from the top and scrolled softly into all directions.\n\nDifferent game modes make for diversity. Up to 15 players can enter their names and then compete with each other in a league. One can also take part in a World Cup, whereby the venue corresponds to the one of a real World Cup. The computer takes over the controls of as many teams as needed. A two-player friendly can be played head to head.\n\nThe game offers features as \"banana kick\", \"action replay\" and weather.\n\nThe original was developed by Sensible Software for the C64, Electronic Pencil Company were responsible for the Amiga and Atari ST versions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63ck.jpg'),(10037,'Winnie the Pooh','2008-12-31','Sport, Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Winnie the Pooh The Video Game is based on the movie of the same name. Following the same story as the movie, Winnie the Pooh is an interactive story book focused on delivering action-driven storytelling and incorporating educational content for children.\n\nThe game is split up into chapters, each offering a new piece of the story, allowing players to interact with the backgrounds via a variety of kid friendly ‘no failure’ mini games. Once chapters are completed, Honey Pots are awarded which can be used to unlock content within the print center. In the print center, parents can print out activity sheets for the children to color in and complete.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ry4.jpg'),(10038,'Castlevania Dominus Collection','2024-08-27','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Three incredible action adventure games from the Castlevania series have finally returned, for the first time! But wait, there\'s more! Haunted Castle Revisited, a redesigned version of the very first Castlevania arcade game, makes its debut!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qn0.jpg'),(10039,'Odyssey to the Frozen Legion',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A survival horror game, in which you search for your last living family member. What begins as an exploration of a mysterious island, becomes a hellish abomination. Descending into this terror is the only way to find what you seek.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l55.jpg'),(10040,'Radix Chronicle',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Radix is a tactical RPG inspired by SNES and early Playstation classics. With dark themes but bright characters, this fantasy tale changes depending on how you fight! Your magic can even alter the land itself. Use your timing and skill, rather than your luck, to lead your party home safely each day!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nxs.jpg'),(10041,'Hyperspeed','2015-04-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','There\'s no room for error when travelling at the speed of light, racing through star systems in a desperate search for a new world to house Mankind. But there are plenty of opportunities for mistakes. Alien races of every conceivable size, shape, temperament and sophistication seek to aid, use, corrupt or destroy you - and you don\'t know which.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6de1.jpg'),(10042,'Kalia','2025-04-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jump, climb, solve puzzles, and explore the ruins of Kalia. An engaging story awaits you, filled with mysteries and challenges. Discover the secrets of this lost world... if you dare!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hjm.jpg'),(10043,'Punch Monkey','2024-08-15','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','Web browser','You\'re a broke loner who lives in a crappy apartment. Crime, drugs and alcohol run rampant in your neighborhood. You dream of a better life but it\'s out of reach. That is, until you see an ad on TV for a big fight with a cash prize! You set out to claim the prize, but you have to make your way through hordes of unsavory crackheads and worthless bums. Are you up to the challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sxq.jpg'),(10044,'Burger Shop 2','2017-11-01','Simulator, Strategy','Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','In Burger Shop, you receive some strange blueprints in the mail and build an extraordinary food-making contraption. Can you build your restaurant into a successful food empire?\n\nIn Burger Shop 2 you awake in a dumpster, with a bump on your head and no recollection of how you got there. Now, you must rebuild your restaurant empire, adding new twists to your menu to entice new customers while uncovering the truth about what happened to your original restaurant chain. Grab ingredients from the BurgerTron2000 to create tasty food items to serve hungry customers in this fast-paced food making game! Start your food making adventure today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2307.jpg'),(10045,'MegaMan Super Charged',NULL,'Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zw7.jpg'),(10046,'MidCreati','2022-11-28','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','MidCreati is a platformer game where a girl must escape by creating platforms, as she is captured by an evil organization who wishes to research her mysterious powers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wxl.jpg'),(10047,'Kiki','2024-04-08','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Put your platforming prowess to the test as you navigate vibrant 3D obstacle courses in first-person perspective! Kiki is a fast-paced action experience that’s laser-focused on precision platforming skills. Run and jump while dodging treacherous traps, collecting stars and trophies, finding keys to unlock gates and more, all set to a pumping chiptune soundtrack!\n\nThere are 60 obstacle courses to master across multiple worlds, each presenting a unique challenge and gradually increasing in difficulty as you progress. Clear mission goals and race against the clock to unlock new stages, or replay cleared levels to improve your score! Do you have what it takes to become the true master of jumping?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kgy.jpg'),(10048,'Rock n\' Bolt','1985-12-31','Puzzle, Tactical, Arcade','ColecoVision, SG-1000, Commodore C64/128/MAX, MSX','Louie The constructor struts pieces to their location. The Girders are constantly moving back and forth. It is your job to lock them down, and then get back to where you started the level. There are 100 levels, and two types of levels. One is just locking down, the others you have to put them in a specific location. There are three levels of difficulty to choose from, you just get paid more the harder the level, and you have less time to complete the level.\n\nThe objective of the game is to lock platforms into place according to a supplied map. There are three levels of difficulty; the second and third level have time limits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y3e.jpg'),(10049,'Spreen Game','2023-01-18','Adventure, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Spreen (twitch streamer) leaves his house to buy an Spreen x Speed energy drink but he will face with a lot mobs, he will pass them succesfully?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10050,'Deity Empires','2018-09-25','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deity Empires is a 4X, turn-based strategy game with a powerful “just one more turn” feel! Enter an intricate fantasy world as one of many deities posed to become ruler of the world.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10051,'Virtual Firearm Simulations','2024-08-01','Shooter, Simulator','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Virtual Firearm Simulations is a low-poly gun building simulator with over 40 accurately modeled weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8iy5.jpg'),(10052,'Maybe: Interactive Stories - Flower Lane 2: A Lingering Fragrance','2021-01-20','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Flower Lane 2: A Lingering Fragrance is an original maybe series. Our story, 7 years later- Seven years after college, you are no longer a young, brash freshman but a seasoned professional in your field. But things take an unexpected turn at work as you run into your ex-lover and flatmates from seven years ago...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sig.jpg'),(10053,'Age of Empires III','2005-11-01','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this highly anticipated next installment in the Age of Empires franchise from Ensemble Studios, Age of Empires III places players in the time period of roughly 1500–1850, picking up where Age of Empires II: The Age of Kings left off. As players work to establish their empire, they take on the role of a European power struggling to explore, colonize, and conquer North and South America.\n\nAge of Empires III introduces exciting new gameplay elements, including the all-new Home City and an incredible combat system. Players have new civilizations to discover, random maps to conquer, and a single-player campaign unlike any other. Players also find stunning graphics as a result of a revolutionary graphics engine that pushes the limits of PC graphics technology in an entirely new way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xy6.jpg'),(10054,'Hanzala Returns','2023-10-30','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You play as Hanzala, a 10 year old Palestinian kid who just wants to go to his home and avoid getting captured or killed by the occupation forces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84o3.jpg'),(10055,'Grand Theft Bubble','2025-01-25','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join an ordinary person as he goes about his work: wrapping objects in bubble wrap. Maybe then you can relax after a hard day preparing orders...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c34.jpg'),(10056,'Riftstrider',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Riftstrider is a deckbuilding roguelite with a twist - your deck is a 2D grid of orbs. Link elemental orbs to unleash powerful combos while battling foes through ever-shifting rifts in spacetime. Each run is a new adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7y27.jpg'),(10057,'Galaxian Mini','2000-12-31','Shooter','Legacy Mobile Device','\"Miniature\" remake of Galaxian. Gameplay involves shooting down small formations of diving enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6k7g.jpg'),(10058,'Fantasmigon','2024-12-14','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fantasmigon is an original turn-based strategy set in a vibrant fantasy world. Engage in thrilling battles and tactical gameplay as you lead your band of characters through challenging encounters','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95pk.jpg'),(10059,'Agricultural Simulator 2011: Extended Edition','2011-02-23','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Assume the role of a farmer to make and manage your land. Invest in CLAAS machinery, crops, livestock, and other improvements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a1r.jpg'),(10060,'Book of the Dead','1987-12-31','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum','Released in 1987, War of the Dead is considered to be the first true survival horror game. SWAT officer Lila must rescue survivors in the demon-infested small town of Chaney’s Hill. It also featured open-world gameplay and RPG elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uzbiyyyxllrddbya7atm.jpg'),(10061,'Hitman 2: Silver Edition','2018-11-13','Shooter, Tactical','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Travel the globe and track your targets across exotic sandbox locations in HITMAN 2. From sun-drenched streets to dark and dangerous rainforests, nowhere is safe from the world\'s most creative assassin, Agent 47. Prepare to experience the ultimate spy thriller story your mission is to eliminate the elusive Shadow Client and unravel his militia, but when 47 learns his target\'s true identity and the truth about his past, it changes everything.\n\nHITMAN 2 introduces new ways to play, new game modes and new features, including the new Sniper Assassin mode with franchise first co-op play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ht5.jpg'),(10062,'Swarming Planet','2021-05-19','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build towers and learn abilities to defend against swarms of hundreds of on-screen hostile alien creatures. Choose between sets of randomized upgrades that both upgrade you and the alien swarm. From enormous explosions to far-reaching flamethrowers, no two games are the same.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ydt.jpg'),(10063,'Fake: Geinoujin wa Zen\'in Usotsuki?','2017-04-17','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','An otome game by Voltage Inc. that\'s currently available in Japanese.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6890.jpg'),(10064,'Interstellar Plunderer','2024-02-02','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Interstellar Plunderer is an indie arcade-style 3D roguelike space shooter game. Take control of a pirate spaceship as you fly through wormholes, do battles with hordes of oncoming enemies, fight fearsome bosses, and gain plunder to spend on new ships and upgrades. How far can you go?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82x3.jpg'),(10065,'Tom Clancy\'s Ghost Recon: Wildlands - Deluxe Edition','2017-03-07','Shooter, Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This Deluxe Edition is available in both retail and digital form and includes:\n\n- Tom Clancy\'s Ghost Recon: Wildlands (base game)\n- Tom Clancy\'s Ghost Recon: Wildlands - Deluxe Pack (DLC)\n- Map of Bolivia (retail only)\n- Official soundtrack disc (retail only)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c7c.jpg'),(10066,'The Sleeping Light','2021-11-02','Visual Novel','Web browser','Relax. Everything will be alright.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pef.jpg'),(10067,'Arkanoid: Amiga Alternate Levels','2020-03-01','Arcade','Nintendo Entertainment System','This is a conversion of the 32 levels created exclusively for the Commodore Amiga version of Arkanoid, adapted into the NES port of the original.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10068,'Ace of Rope','2020-10-04','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A criminal spared by the gallows can control their broken rope. It\'s time for revenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95td.jpg'),(10069,'Succulent','2015-01-13','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Small 2-4 minute game about watching a dude slowly / erotically stick a thing in his mouth. An homage to late homo-hop.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5frt.jpg'),(10070,'R no Shosai: Dai-Ni Maku - Dai-2-shuu','1997-12-07','Visual Novel','Satellaview','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62lm.jpg'),(10071,'DiggerSim','2024-05-23','Simulator','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3','DiggerSim - Virtual reality Excavator & Heavy Equipment Simulator.\n\nDiggerSim is a thrilling excavator and heavy equipment simulator that puts you in the driver\'s seat of a powerful excavator. With realistic controls, you\'ll feel like you\'re really operating heavy machinery.\n\nIn this game, you\'ll be tasked with completing a variety of excavation jobs, from digging foundations to clearing land. You\'ll have to carefully manoeuvre your excavator through tight spaces and navigate around obstacles to complete the level.\n\nAs you progress through the game, you\'ll challenges that will test your skills and abilities. With immersive gameplay and realistic controls, Digger Sim is the ultimate experience for fans of construction and heavy machinery. So put on your hard hat and get ready to dig in!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qzm.jpg'),(10072,'Warped North',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It was a small wonder when, after a mechanical malfunction, the transport ship moving you to an isolated research facility crashed, granting you your long-overdue freedom. But the new frigid land you\'ve arrived in swarms with jabbering, malicious little creatures, and you can\'t help but sense you may have caught the attention of something sinister.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zp1.jpg'),(10073,'Baneball','2021-03-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Sport','Android, iOS','Life goes on after the zombie apocalypse for even the undead need some fun. The favorite game of this new world is the spectacular Baneball - and now it is your chance to be one of the celebrated Sport Managers!\n\nDo you have what it takes to set up a hard-hitting team and lead them to victory in various stadiums all around the globe?\n\nWill you be wise enough to lead and equip your players, manage the resources and train the zombies properly?\n\nAre you so steady that you can reach the world\'s top by outplaying thousands of opponents in this fast multiplayer action-strategy?\n\nIs it so? Then the glory of Baneball is waiting for you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5b1w.jpg'),(10074,'Rubblar','2022-12-04','Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Time to grab everything you can!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co668x.jpg'),(10075,'Defender\'s Squad: The Last Ride','2025-03-04','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Defender\'s Squad is a sci-fi vertical scrolling shooter 2D that combines 7 different levels. Play Solo and pick one of the 3 ships to kill enemies and save the earth from aliens.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kug.jpg'),(10076,'At Dawn\'s Edge','2020-10-10','Adventure, Visual Novel','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','MSX-style cyberpunk graphic adventure game set in Megacaracas, Venezuela','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10077,'City Game Studio','2021-08-24','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You are the founder of your video game company. The starting point belongs to you, in your garage, or think big instead of small by acquiring your first local. At the end of the day, your decisions will make your studio a success and will mark the Video Game History.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wdv.jpg'),(10078,'Furious Fish','2024-07-01','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Frederick save Goldie!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fur.jpg'),(10079,'Stikbold! A Dodgeball Adventure','2016-04-01','Sport, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Stikbold! is a single and local multiplayer dodgeball game heavily inspired by the 70\'s and its athletes. This is a salute to the heroic sportsmanship of the era, a time when tacky was cool and there was no such thing as bad style.\n\nFollow the story of world famous Stikbold athletes Björn and Jerome, team up with a dodgeball buddy in co-op team battles or charge head first into a manic free-for-all battles with up to five others. Get beaten in the area? Get revenge from the outside with disgruntled swans, hungry whales and one very lethal minivan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vsdknmi9ba63qo05d3y6.jpg'),(10080,'Karateka','2012-11-07','Fighting, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox 360','Whether you are a nostalgic Karateka fan or new to the game, Karateka will charm you with its classic love story set in feudal Japan. Fight to save the lovely Mariko from the evil warlord Akuma and reunite her with her True Love!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jlz.jpg'),(10081,'Project Gotham Racing 2','2003-11-18','Racing','Xbox','Project Gotham Racing 2 is a racing game for the Xbox, developed by Bizarre Creations and published by Microsoft. PGR2 is the sequel to the highly successful Project Gotham Racing. It is the second title in the Project Gotham Racing series','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uok.jpg'),(10082,'Semiaquatic Circus','2023-04-29','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Semiaquatic Circus is an episodically-updating friend-sim styled VN. There is a hidden affection meter in each chapter. Gaining enough affection will allow you to successfully complete a chapter. Game takes around 10 minutes per chapter, more or less.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pbx.jpg'),(10083,'A Messenger','2023-10-21','Point-and-click','Web browser','I want to show you something','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mnd.jpg'),(10084,'Pizza Break','2022-04-22','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Pizza Break is an arcade game that lets the user knock out Pizza themed items with a unique Pizza Box paddle and pizza slice ball. Unique Animated levels, Mini-Bosses and Powerups to collect as you progress through the levels. Thirty Levels to compete in and battle mini bosses on your way to victory. Single player fun and arcade style entertainment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k4i.jpg'),(10085,'Gunma\'s Ambition: You and me are Gunma - Reiwa 2nd National Census Edition','2025-12-31','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Let\'s change Japan to Gunma. Everyone Gunma.Let\'s change all of Japan to Gunma.The definitive edition of the Gunma simulation game.Everyone can play!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ev0.jpg'),(10086,'The Lost Cases of Sherlock Holmes 2','2010-02-16','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Return to 221 Baker St. and play as the famous Sherlock Holmes to solve 16 mysterious crimes in Victorian England. Dust off your magnifying glass and use your astute observational skills to gather evidence in 60 brilliantly rendered locations around Victorian England including Stonehenge, Marlsbury Castle, London\'s Music Hall and more! Unlock vital clues by playing over 50 mind-bending puzzles and mini-games in each case, including anagrams, cryptograms, and more. Featuring over 40 levels of hidden object and find the difference gameplay with more than 100 lively characters, including Watson, Mycroft, and Inspector Lestrade. Each clue leads you closer to catching the culprit!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/eoan6tygouy1kzbmgqxa.jpg'),(10087,'A Taça Mágica','1990-12-31','Adventure','MSX','A Taça Mágica is a text-based adventure where you are tasked with searching a magic goblet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69w0.jpg'),(10088,'The Voyage Sinister','2024-03-01','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Voyage Sinister it\'s a Gothic story with an investigative and mystery element, set in a Victorian-inspired world. While a JRPG at its core, the game is also a mixture of Visual Novel and Adventure Game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mnr.jpg'),(10089,'Resident Evil: Revelations 2 - Extra Episode 2: Little Miss','2015-03-18','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','Natalia dreams that her favorite teddy bear, Lottie, has gone missing. Startled, she awakens face-to-face with another version of herself. Unsure if it is still a dream, together they go in search of Lottie. This is the story of Natalia\'s mysterious adventure.\n\n*This extra episode provides a different gameplay experience than the main campaign. Natalia\'s original costume is included.\n*Episode One required to play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jng.jpg'),(10090,'Tezz: Portals','2021-03-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tezz: Portals is a block-fit puzzle with portals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co430e.jpg'),(10091,'Telomeria','2024-01-10','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A short, horror themed point-and-click adventure set in an empty, dreamlike pre-rendered world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98gj.jpg'),(10092,'Retired Men\'s Nude Beach Volleyball League','2021-08-03','Sport, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take to the court and match up against your opponent in physically and mentally challenging beach volleyball!\n\nRetired Men\'s Nude Beach Volleyball is a single-player narrative-based volleyball game set in beautiful locations across Massachusetts. Join the league and play as Len Rizzo as he navigates the later part of life one serve at a time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i9v.jpg'),(10093,'Imperium Galactica II: Alliances','2000-04-10','Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Imperium Galactica II: Alliances is a real-time game featuring aspects of RTT, RTS and empire-building computer games from the Hungarian-based studio Digital Reality. It is the sequel to Digital Reality\'s previous game, Imperium Galactica.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ahz.jpg'),(10094,'Ancient Cities','2020-12-17','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ancient Cities is a Survival and Strategy City Builder PC game through the ages, strongly focused on history and realism. Currently being developed by Uncasual Games.\n\nStarting in the Neolithic era, you will have to guide your people through generations, discovering and improving technologies, managing resources and population, facing threats from raiders and Mother Nature herself. And, ultimately, building the most fantastic city of antiquity through the ages in a fully simulated world and ecosystem.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rea.jpg'),(10095,'Gold Rush Clicker','2023-09-15','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into \"Gold Rush Clicker,\" an idle clicker game where you start as a novice miner. Tap to mine gold, buy upgrades, and face strategic challenges. With procedurally generated levels, stunning graphics, and Steam achievements, it\'s an endless journey to become the ultimate mining tycoon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73rp.jpg'),(10096,'Avon','1982-12-31','Adventure','Legacy Computer','An Interactive Fiction adventure by Jon Thackray and Dr. Jonathan Partington for the IBM System/370 \'Phoenix\' mainframe system at the University of Cambridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9b0g.jpg'),(10097,'Star Wars Pinball','2013-03-19','Simulator, Pinball, Arcade','PlayStation 3, Nintendo 3DS, iOS, Wii U, PlayStation Vita','Set in a galaxy far, far away, Star Wars Pinball lets you interact with the most iconic characters, and relive the greatest moments of the Star Wars universe. Choose to support the Galactic Empire or the Rebel Alliance with your high scores as the Star Wars Pinball community fights for the Balance of the Force!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cfn.jpg'),(10098,'Danchi-zuma no Yuuwaku','1983-09-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC-8800 Series, FM-7','Koei’s erotic RPG about a condom salesman visiting an apartment block, where he must knock on doors trying to “sell his products”, while battling Yakuza and ghosts who roam the halls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7van.jpg'),(10099,'Toran','2019-04-18','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this sci-fi puzzle adventure \"short game\" you are a scientist, stranded on a distant moon during an expedition to investigate alien remains. After finding a strange platform, what seemed to be a one way trip might turn into an intergalactic odyssey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44s1.jpg'),(10100,'Line Loops: Logic Puzzles','2019-03-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Line Loops - Logic Puzzles is a relaxing and challenging logic game, where you try to form a single continuous loop to solve a puzzle. Use the numbers as clues to loop through thousands of unique logic puzzles. Can you solve them all?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10101,'Highwater','2023-03-15','Puzzle, Strategy, Tactical, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Highwater is a story-driven 3D adventure game with isometric turn-based combat set in a flooded post-apocalyptic urban environment. Navigate the world by boat, discover islands, and find new allies to help battle foes in turn-based combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4umz.jpg'),(10102,'Accuser','2024-04-09','Visual Novel','Web browser','A night out takes a drastic turn as Iris\' best friend is accused of a crime. She takes it upon herself to find the truth before her friend gets sent straight into a cell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co859x.jpg'),(10103,'Upload Simulator Silicon','2023-09-22','Simulator','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Upload Simulator Silicon is an incremental game about uploading, making money, hacking, and ascending as a powerful entity that controls the very laws of the universe using powerful technologies you discover throught your journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8r9v.jpg'),(10104,'Helmet Heroes','2013-03-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fight your way through this vast online world of players and monsters as you level up and gain new swords, helmet, and armor. Make friends, create guilds, explore new areas, and unleash some serious energy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nue.jpg'),(10105,'Sensor 2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10106,'Chickens',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10107,'SyS KillMirror','2022-04-14','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','An exploration FPS set on a fake planet called SyS, ruled by the cat named Emperor, will you be able to escape this cursed realm?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t33.jpg'),(10108,'BallzOut','2020-08-31','Sport, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','*Please note this game is primarily designed for two players* Simple, competitive, and absolutely loads of fun, BallzOut is the Ball flinging/smashing game you have been waiting for. It\'s a bit like Lawn Bowls, a bit like Air Hockey and a lot like absolute nonsense. Take it in turns to roll your Ballz into the scoring zone - do you tactically place your Ballz in an area your opponent cannot reach or attempt to smash their Ballz out of the scoring zone? Tough one. Over three rounds and with the help of such powers ups as Big Ballz and Sticky Ballz, can you outwit and outmaneuver your opponent to become the BallzOut Champion?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co571w.jpg'),(10109,'Wai-wai de Q','1995-10-07','Quiz/Trivia','Satellaview','The first season of Wai-wai de Q (later called Satella-Q), comprised of 4 episodes.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10110,'Chorus: Day One Edition','2021-12-03','Fighting, Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Take control of Nara, once the Circle\'s deadliest warrior, now their most wanted fugitive, on a quest to destroy the dark cult that created her. Unlock devastating weapons and mind-bending abilities in Chorus, a true evolution of the space-combat shooter. Along with Forsaken, her sentient starfighter, explore ancient temples, engage in exhilarating zero-g combat, and venture beyond our waking reality.\n\nChorus: Day One Edition includes a copy of the base game and the Elder Armor Skin Set. Resplendent in gold and purple livery, reserved only for the most exalted members of the Circle, the Elder Armor harks back to Nara\'s military past. This cosmetic pack can be applied to Forsaken as well as all three of the starting weapons; the Gatling Gun, Missile Launcher and Laser Cannon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co493h.jpg'),(10111,'Cursor0x0','2022-09-23','Point-and-click, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Cursor0x0 is a collection of various cursor mini games that require a good reaction, stamina, and precision. Fight enemies, win races, dodge bullets, complete different goals to unlock new challenge types and reach the final level!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cv4.jpg'),(10112,'Handle With Care..','2001-04-06','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Our hero was the vocalist of the legendary rock band \"Bloody Roses.\" Presently, his activities with the band are on hold. At one of the live houses he played at, he met an extremely talented vocalist named Sahara Shion. He takes it upon himself to help her in her career... As a player, it is your goal to eventually bring this beautiful talent on stage at the live house \"Moon Rouge.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dij.jpg'),(10113,'Rush Team 2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Online FPS multiplayer game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xmsf0ei5obuzjwm99rup.jpg'),(10114,'Halo Infinite: Winter Update','2022-11-08','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This is the largest feature update to Halo Infinite yet, bringing with it a number of highly anticipated experiences such as Campaign Network Co-Op, Mission Replay, the Forge Beta, and a plethora of new, free content for all players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rhr.jpg'),(10115,'Peek-A-Mimic Christmas Castle','2024-12-18','Point-and-click, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The mimics are on the loose - and this time, it\'s Christmas! Explore the castle and solve its puzzles to reveal and capture all of the hidden mimics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97bd.jpg'),(10116,'Affected Zone Tactics','2015-11-17','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Affected Zone Tactics, a tactical online game with cooperative turn-based PvP combats. Travel through the Tesla portal to a dangerous parallel world, lead the squad of reckless mercenaries, and outrage mighty corporations and cliques.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pea.jpg'),(10117,'Punishing: Gray Raven','2019-12-05','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Punishing: Gray Raven is a story in the future. The \"Fusion Technology\" lead human into a speedy development golden era. However, due to human\'s ultimate exploration of basic science and the exposion of the taboo, the virus representing punishing, the \"Palmis\" virus, was exploded.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wk7.jpg'),(10118,'Narrowboat Simulator','2021-01-01','Simulator','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Narrowboat Simulator a simulation with some game aspects. You control one of Britain\'s typical narrowboats in a 3D environment.  \n \nDuring the game you\'ll have to perform some simple tasks. To advance you\'ll have to collect \"Canal Karma\" by displaying your navigating skills. Speeding and behaving like having a ride on the dodgems is considered as bad karma and will reduce your score.  \n  \nHaving completed the tasks with a high enough score will allow you to cruise freely.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10119,'Twilight Drive','2021-06-01','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Twilight Drive is a top-down driving game where you turbo, drift, and use a grappling-hook like mechanic to turn corners as you set faster and faster track times to earn medals and beat your friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30ti.jpg'),(10120,'Warrior Architects','2024-10-25','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game\'s story follows the grand adventures of warriors who encounter various villages and tribes. Collaborating with these tribes, they transform small villages into large fortresses, building defenses to repel external attacks. Their efforts earn the trust of the people.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zh8.jpg'),(10121,'Maze Art: Green','2021-12-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Maze Art: Green - is a minimalist game of simple mazes with relaxing music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ku5.jpg'),(10122,'Undertinge',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as the Wizard named Frisk. Welding magic as a weapon, you have to end the Eternal Night, destroying the heart of darkness that plagues the land, freeing the world from the wicked clutches of the ancient curse. Will you let the darkness blind you? Will you make it out alive? Well, that, my friend, is up to you to decide.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ciw.jpg'),(10123,'Rock Revolution','2008-10-15','Music','PlayStation 3, Wii, Xbox 360','Rock Revolution lets you release your inner rockstar or allows your friends the privilege of picking up an axe or pounding the skins with you to 41 mind bending rock tracks! Unleash your creative juices in the Studio Mode where you can create your own music in a state of the art multi-track studio! This is the musical revolution the world has been waiting for!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48t8.jpg'),(10124,'Wasteland 2: Director\'s Cut - Digital Classic Edition','2014-09-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','From the Producer of the original Fallout comes Wasteland 2, the sequel to the first-ever post-apocalyptic computer RPG.\nThe Wasteland\'s hellish landscape is waiting for you to make your mark... or die trying. With over 80 hours of gameplay, you will deck out your Desert Ranger squad with the most devastating weaponry this side of the fallout zone, test the limits of your strategy skills, and bring justice to the wasteland.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h53.jpg'),(10125,'Purrgatory','2021-08-22','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A slice-of-death visual novel about making friends, cracking cat puns, and waiting for eternity to pass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3og9.jpg'),(10126,'Sudden Strike 3: Arms for Victory','2007-12-07','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience the hit World War 2 real-time strategy game for the first time in full 3D glory, expanding on all strategic and tactical options. Command joint operations of naval, land-based and airborne units on the largest maps in the series. Newcomers and veterans alike will be right at home with an innovative user interface and improved AI.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28c6.jpg'),(10127,'Bat to Bed',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A punishing vertical climb to the top of a serene forest, with simple but nuanced one-button movement.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xly.jpg'),(10128,'City Defense','2022-07-19','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Arcade','Android','The city takeover has started! They are coming and they protest! You need to protect the crowd city fast! Call all the soldiers for help, let\'s be cops or army commander and stop this crowd evolution.\nConquer your enemies and don\'t let them protest and do a city takeover!\nDraw defence line, get your soldiers at the right place & push em all!\nYou have red and blue stickman, both trying to win. But, if we want to win this battle together, let\'s be cops or army commander, because they know how to handle protest the best!\nThey are billions and they are coming really fast, the crowd evolution is happening now, your soldiers should conquer the enemies!\n\nDon\'t let them get to the police cars, defeat means that between red and blue stickman, the red will win, and red is the enemy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k20.jpg'),(10129,'The Peak Climb VR',NULL,'Sport, Indie','Sin plataforma','Peak Climb VR will bring you an action-packed full-time professional climbing experience and give you exciting moments. While every part of this experience will entertain you, it will also provide you with a tiring calorie burn and game music will provide you with spiritual therapy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co568b.jpg'),(10130,'Corgi Warlock','2015-12-03','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Corgi Warlock is a 1-4 player side-scrolling fantasy action game, where one brave Corgi will take on the Skeleton Bunny King\'s army! Against the power of Narwhals, Fencing Bears, and Crazed Unicorns, it takes more than your average Corgi to survive the King\'s onslaught... it takes a CORGI WARLOCK.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jsc.jpg'),(10131,'Hexapoda','2023-05-19','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','After the last human war, gases were spread through the atmosphere making it unbreathable, pushing the richest to flee to orbital colonies and the others to take refuge underground. Get ready to fight giant Insects for the future of humanity !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r5p.jpg'),(10132,'Forest of Drizzling Rain','2013-10-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Forest of Drizzling Rain is an exploration-based horror adventure game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s9h.jpg'),(10133,'Paraedolon','2024-10-17','Point-and-click, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short experimental experience.\n\nA meteor approaches Earth from deep space. Carrying an unknown malevolent force.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y81.jpg'),(10134,'Drop Pockets',NULL,'Sport, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','The billiards roguelike. Strategic, physics based combat against Pool Sharks who don\'t play by the rules. Pocket your balls and clear out your opposition in this chaotic game of pool!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oer.jpg'),(10135,'Drive On Lucy','2024-02-29','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A simple atmospheric walking (driving) simulator, done in 7 days for LSDJAM 2023. WASD to move, SHIFT to speed up, and that\'s about it. Go link up some beacons along an abandoned road. Get those asbestos-filtered cigs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92z2.jpg'),(10136,'Solitaire','2016-10-11','Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, Xbox One','The card game that everyone loves. Rediscover the classic card game, finally in a digital version that everyone can play! Arrange the cards from Ace to King in the 3 most popular game modes and spend an enjoyable moment indulging in your favourite pastime. A classic brain-teaser in which you will need all your concentration to earn as many points as possible. Only those making the fewest moves will have their names inscribed at the top of the international rankings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co551g.jpg'),(10137,'Recesses','2024-08-23','Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unravel the mystery of your missing 5th grade friend in Recesses, a schoolyard roguelite card battler. Collect rare cards and construct a spaceship that outplays even the most powerful Battaliens cards printed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uoj.jpg'),(10138,'Liminal Ranger','2021-01-21','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','liminal ranger is a first person platformer about talking to spaces and solving their problems.\n\nit has volume settings and mouse sensitivity sliders.\n\nit has a good amount of original music and 3 levels with light progression mechanics.\n\nit has two endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zdk.jpg'),(10139,'Monkey King vs Transformers','2020-12-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a game with Chinese characteristics and culture! Absolute value for money! Otherwise you will regret for life!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p37.jpg'),(10140,'a Dragon\'s reQuest','2024-06-24','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','a Dragon\'s reQuest is nominally a classic-styled retro JRPG with a few modern bells and whistles: Character talkie-pictures, exhaustive character dialog, DEEPLY investigatable background maps, difficult subject matter, mature character relationships that occasionally get sexual, spicy subject matter, bunny suits, and-','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qd2.jpg'),(10141,'16bit-Collection Athena Vol. 01','2018-02-28','Shooter, Card & Board Game','Super Famicom','16bit-Collection Athena Vol.1 is a 16-bit cartridge which built 5 titles in one cassette of old masterpiece game.\n\nIncludes:\n- Pro Mahjong Kiwame\n- Pro Mahjong Kiwame 2\n- Pro Mahjong Kiwame 3\n- Dezaemon SFC\n- Biometal','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23vx.jpg'),(10142,'KittyToy','2024-06-10','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take care of and adopt stray kitties. Buy toys and decorations for your house and yard!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dvj.jpg'),(10143,'Mecha Knights: Nightmare - Operation Ascalon Expansion','2024-03-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Echo Team will be sent on a dangerous mission deep behind enemy lines. Uncover a new chapter in the game\'s story, featuring seven missions and a new tier of advanced parts and weapons.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10144,'The Red Sea','2014-11-13','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Red Sea is a Japanese Yume Nikki fangame. You play as Nagi, a boy who stays in his room. The goal of the game is to explore and find effects.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rxo.jpg'),(10145,'Maquette','2023-05-25','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','MAQUETTE is a first-person recursive puzzle game that takes you into a world where every building, plant, and object are simultaneously tiny and staggeringly huge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21zz.jpg'),(10146,'Mario Party 2','2000-10-13','Quiz/Trivia, Card & Board Game','Wii, Nintendo 64, 64DD, Wii U','Mario and the gang are back for another round of Bowser-bashin\' party action! Watch as your favorite Nintendo characters don different duds for each of the five all-new Adventure Boards! A slew of new tricks and devices bring new levels of challenge and excitement to board game play. New board maps, new Mini-Games, new action and new surprises means a whole new batch of fun! Get ready to unleash your best Hip Drops, hammer swings and high-flying high junks for another round of frenzied multi-player action!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21yt.jpg'),(10147,'A Grave Mistake','2024-04-16','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re a gravedigger out digging graves, but you accidentally summoned an apocalypse, oops! Do you have the smarts to take control of the situation and stop the cataclysm?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jb1.jpg'),(10148,'The Struggle',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','The Struggle is a zombie-based MMO.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wponyhl3xksye5lmklum.jpg'),(10149,'Wrongly Accused','2023-12-16','Point-and-click','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Wrongly Accused is a Case of the Golden Idol inspired murder mystery in the vein of Columbo... more of a How-Dunnit than a Whodunnit.\n\nSet during the Years of Lead in 1970s Italy, an attempted assasination attempt on the mayor may not be what everyone thinks. The main suspect Tony has all the evidence pointing at him but maybe it\'s all a little too convenient.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yxa.jpg'),(10150,'About Elise','2017-09-26','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into this first person puzzle adventure and become Owen Scott to rescue your daughter Elise, who has been kidnapped by the organisation known as Kiminster Labs. By doing it, you will discover the big piece of the puzzle that is About Elise as a whole.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22ku.jpg'),(10151,'Ranma 1/2: Ougi Jaanken','1995-07-10','Puzzle','Satellaview, Super Famicom','The game involves falling blocks of hands displaying the rock, paper, and scissors signs, which fall three at a time. In a similar manner to Tetris, the player can rotate the blocks to stack them, using pieces that defeat other pieces (e.g. paper over rock) to eliminate stacks. Doing so adds garbage pieces onto the opponent\'s screen to make it more difficult for them to eliminate their stacks of blocks. The objective is to fill up the opponent\'s screen up with blocks so that additional ones can no longer fit. Each character has two special attacks which can be used when large combinations are completed. Once in each round each player can also use a bucket of water that can transform a cursed character into their alternate form, which weakens their attacks until the effect wears off. This does not affect Akane or the Gambling King.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zg0.jpg'),(10152,'Beach Makeover',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10153,'Succubus Farm','2021-03-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A dungeon escape, action game. Play as a captured human forced to work for demons, but one day you decide to make a mad dash for freedom!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31s2.jpg'),(10154,'Classic Car School:Driving Sim',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10155,'Madou Monogatari','2005-12-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Legacy Mobile Device','Madou Monogatari is a first-person dungeon-crawler developed by AIKY that released on December 14, 2005 for DoCoMo\'s i-mode branded mobile phones and was available through G-mode\'s R.P.G-mode service, which required a monthly fee of 300 yen to access various RPG games. It is the last Madou Monogatari entry to feature the original cast of characters created by Compile. The game was only available to download for six months before being delisted sometime in June 2006, and as of November 30, 2021, the game can no longer be launched due to G-mode\'s service through i-mode being discontinued.\n\nUnlike Madou Monogatari (Saturn), Madou Monogatari returns to the classic first-person dungeon crawling style. A new spell, Stone, is introduced that attacks enemies with falling stones, and after clearing the game you\'ll be presented with a report card that changes depending on the amount of steps Arle takes, the amount of damage done to enemies, and the number of times that curry is eaten.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l7l.jpg'),(10156,'Neon Survivors','2023-04-28','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ANNIHILATE a small army\'s worth of ghouls, knaves and miners, with the power of lasers, missiles and kidneys! You\'re alone against these hordes with nothing but INCREDIBLE WEAPONRY and MURDEROUS INTENT. Can you survive for FOUR MINUTES?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vcj.jpg'),(10157,'Satsui no Kaisou: Power Soft Satsujin Jiken','1988-01-07','Adventure','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','A murder mystery graphic adventure game for the Famicom. It was never released outside of Japan.\n\nSatsui no Kaisou: Soft House Satsujin Jiken (\"Hierarchy Of Murderous Intent: The Software House Serial Murders\") is a menu-based adventure game by Hyperware in which the player is a young man attempting to solve the murder of a successful software developer. Like in many Famicom adventure games, the player can gather clues by examining sites of interest, talking to various people and keeping track of the information they\'ve gathered. As the case continues, more people working for the titular game company start dying and the player is given more murders to solve.\n\nTime is an important factor in the game as talking to right people and being in the right places at the right moments will prove instrumental towards solving the mystery. The President of the game company only gives the protagonist three days to solve the case before they get the police involved, giving the player a strict deadline. The game\'s writer will introduce himself just before the player is asked to identify the culprit, and provide the game\'s final opportunity to save. The game also has multiple endings, depending on what the player does after the murderer has been identified.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oum.jpg'),(10158,'Bone Voyage','2019-06-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bone Voyage is a third person adventure game set on a Vessel to the Afterlife. Use your skeletal body to your advantage and explore the ship in unique ways to uncover the mystery of the ship and its inhabitants!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30bo.jpg'),(10159,'Vampire! At the Masquerade','2023-12-15','Puzzle','Web browser','You are Mircalla Karnstein, a ███ year old sapphic vampire on the hunt for the feminine comforts of your next dream girl/juice box. With the help of your vampiric servants, you go undercover to infiltrate a masquerade to look hot, overhear gossip, and use your brains to sweet talk a special lady into finding somewhere more private to have a “conversation”…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88cx.jpg'),(10160,'Hampton Court','2019-01-11','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the court of Henry VIII, where your choices decide your fate! Your choices throughout the game change your relationships with the characters and influence the story. There are multiple endings. Be careful what you say! How will you fare at court? Will you find love? Will you find fortune? Will you survive to tell the tale? This is a work of historical fiction. Some of the characters are from history and others are not. What happens in this game is an alternate reality from real history.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hei.jpg'),(10161,'Seventh Choir',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Seventh Choir is a horror game about a hunter who is sent to kill an elk deep within a snow covered swamp. Look to those in the heavens and believe the cry of the seventh choir. A short atmospheric horror game inspired by PS2 hunting games and the Book of Revelation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n40.jpg'),(10162,'Ruins of Mitriom',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore the continent in search of Mitriom, ancient energy crystals to power the various improvements of your caravan (Skills, Bonus, Cannon on the caravan etc). Dynamically manage your resources to adapt your skills according to the situation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h3b.jpg'),(10163,'Space Invaders Forever: Special Edition','2021-12-10','Shooter, Puzzle, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Back again - arcade legend and icon of gaming history! Lighting the fuse for a gaming revolution. Space Invaders is surely one of the most famous video games of all time and was the launching pad for the video gaming revolution. The game mechanics and its design make it a game that encompasses all the very best.\n\nThe following games are part of the Space Invader Forever Collection: Special Edition:\n- Space Invaders Extreme game\n- Space Invaders Gigamax 4 SE game\n- Arkanoid vs. Space Invaders game\n- Rubber Keychain\n- A3 Poster\n- Invader Card\n- 4 Outdoor Stickers\n- Invader Pin\n- Note Pad\n- Post Card Set\n- Mini Art Plate','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49ob.jpg'),(10164,'MixiM','2015-09-05','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','MixiM is a Yume Nikki fangame. The game stars Chie, a girl searching for Effects in order to manipulate her dream world. Through wearing certain effects, areas can change in appearance and show gateways to new locations. Dialogue (including symbols and website names) is used throughout the game to explain the situation of Chie and the dream world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ryn.jpg'),(10165,'Derma','2024-08-14','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Short horror RPG','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oxs.jpg'),(10166,'Apothecarium: The Renaissance of Evil - Premium Edition','2015-05-28','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','During the Middle Ages a terrifying, mysterious disease raged across Italy. It killed thousands of people, whole towns and villages perished together. There were legends of a mythical town of Apothecarium, where the secret to defeating the disease was hidden.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2muk.jpg'),(10167,'The Captcha Game','2023-12-17','Puzzle','Web browser','Welcome to \"The Captcha Game\" – Where completing a verification is the game itself.\nDon\'t worry, it\'ll only take a few seconds.\nSo... Are you a Human?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ko2.jpg'),(10168,'Sunflower Maintenance','2020-08-25','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This game was made for the Touhou Station Game Jam. A game where you try to grow sunflowers while fairies steal them and shoot at you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bg6.jpg'),(10169,'Horse-o-Chess','2022-07-18','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An autobattle strategy game where the player manages resources and spends them to put together teams of units that fight automatically. The player must survive every wave in a mission to win.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zki.jpg'),(10170,'Pico de Pon','2020-04-07','Puzzle, Arcade','Web browser','The classic 16-bit-era action puzzle game returns again - enhanced and remastered. Pico de Pon brings favorite characters from across the PICO-8 library together for intense block-swapping battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hll.jpg'),(10171,'Oh to be a ghost bringing a scarf to my beloved','2022-02-13','Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A cute little mostly point-and-click game about ghosts in love. your partner is cold. bring a scarf to them <3','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gbh.jpg'),(10172,'Noddy and the Birthday Party','2000-09-01','Puzzle, Adventure','Game Boy Color','It\'s Big-Ears\' birthday! Can you help Noddy collect things for the party? Will Noddy earn enough pocket money to buy Big-Ears a really big cake? Explore Toyland, meet your favourite characters, and take part in 10 exciting adventures. Help Noddy find the party invitations--but watch out for Bumpy Dog. Go to the Dark Wood where Sly and Gobbo have hidden all the party hats. From gathering hidden eggs in Farmer Straw\'s field to jumping over rolling fruit in the market square, help Noddy get everything for Big-Ears\' Birthday party. Watch out for Sly and Gobbo, who always seem to be up to mischief, and even Master Tubby Bear, Bumpy Dog and Clockwork Mouse, who accidentally get in the way sometimes.\n\nEncourages recognition of left and right, numbers, colours and objects. There are different skill levels which cater to a range of abilities and ages from 3 upwards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co836g.jpg'),(10173,'Eden',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Eden is a surreal horror enigma with branching paths.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10174,'Legacy of Kalevala','2018-06-30','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Legacy of Kalevala is a re-engineered, re-envisioned and re-maked version of the original Legend of Kalevala flash game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8agl.jpg'),(10175,'Contractors Showdown','2024-04-25','Shooter, Simulator','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3','Contractors Showdown delivers adrenaline-fueled VR combat with two distinct modes: fast-paced Battle Royale and the immersive, tactical Exfil Zone. Customize your loadout, complete missions, and fight to survive in dynamic, high-stakes battles. Gear up, squad up, and dominate the VR battlefield!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98e3.jpg'),(10176,'Bopimo!','2024-12-13','Platform','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Free to play, online 3D platformer where players can create their own levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95nu.jpg'),(10177,'Greed School Test','2001-12-31','Quiz/Trivia','Web browser','Greed $chool Test was an online Adobe Flash game published by Nintendo that could be played alongside 3 other games on the Welcome to Greedville microsite, made to promote the release of Wario Land 4 on the Game Boy Advance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9b63.jpg'),(10178,'Ikemen Vampire: Temptation in the Dark','2017-07-31','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','The game takes place in late 19th century France where you, the player, have been transported to from the 21st century. You\'re stuck in a mansion full of some of the greatest historical figures of all time for a month until you can go back to your own era, but there\'s a catch - every single one of them is a vampire. There\'s only one rule for you during your stay, don\'t fall in love.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rmf.jpg'),(10179,'Tiger Trio\'s Tasty Travels','2021-09-27','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Solve puzzles with a cute, sushi-serving animal crew! This new puzzle game will challenge your wit across a total of 60 stages. It includes a hint function, so players of any age can travel with the Tiger Trio and their friends. On your trip you may even find yourself starting to think like a programmer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i6k.jpg'),(10180,'Hose Hero',NULL,'Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Sin plataforma','A Top-down shooter where you Jet water kids to keep them at bay and Hose them Down for trying to fight your little brother! Shoot water balloons and collect upgrade cards throughout runs and occasionally fight bosses !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8p3n.jpg'),(10181,'The Hitchhiker\'s Guide to the Galaxy','1986-12-31','Puzzle, Adventure','Atari 8-bit, Web browser, Commodore C64/128/MAX, TRS-80 Color Computer, Atari ST/STE, Commodore 16, Mac, DOS, Tatung Einstein, Amiga, Apple II, TRS-80, Amstrad CPC, Commodore Plus/4, Amstrad PCW, Texas Instruments TI-99','The Hitchhiker’s Guide to the Galaxy is a classic Interactive Fiction game. Though divergent from the source material, the main characters, locations, and concepts are here. Unlike the book, death can come quickly if Arthur fails to observe his surroundings, collect inventory, talk to people, and consult the Guide. Don\'t panic!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vpv.jpg'),(10182,'Survive 10 Minutes Please','2022-06-02','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Survive 10 minutes please is a hardcore action roguelike 2D zombie game combined with RPG elements where you have to survive 10 minutes against different types of zombies using different tactics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4r5q.jpg'),(10183,'Transformers: Battlegrounds - Complete Edition',NULL,'Arcade','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Bumblebee and the Autobots have a new commander - you. Assemble your squad and roll out for a battle that will rage from Central City to Cybertron. Choose heroes including Windblade and Optimus Prime, each with unique attacks and abilities. Use each environment to your advantage, taking cover in desert sandstorms and battling your foes in city streets. And charge your Energon to unleash devastating Ultimate Abilities. Then visit the Arcade for local multiplayer battles with the Decepticons and more. It’s the Tramsformers game you’ve waited an eternity for!\n\nTransformers: Battlegrounds - Complete Edition includes:\n- a copy of the base game\n- Gold Autobot Skin Pack\n- Energon Autobot Skin Pack\n- Battle Autobot Skin Pack\n- Neon Autobot Skin Pack\n- Nemesis Prime & Goldfire Bumblebee Skin Pack\n- CUBE Game - Arcade Add-on\n- Transformers: Battlegrounds - Shattered Spacebridge','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kfh.jpg'),(10184,'Secrets of Magic 4: Potion Master','2022-07-07','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Are you fond of magic potions and haunting creatures? Well, join in this unforgettable journey to the roots of magic! Traverse the Forbidden Forest, find extraordinary potion ingredients, and master their magic properties in this thrilling match 3 game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40wy.jpg'),(10185,'Planet Graveyard','2023-12-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Planet Graveyard is a short existential horror game based on a dream. It takes inspiration from LSD Dream Emulator and was originally created for the LSD Jam 2022. Explore bizarre and seemingly lifeless planet that looks like giant graveyard. Find out what actually happened to this world by interacting with different sights, scattered around. You are free to leave this planet whenever you want.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9343.jpg'),(10186,'Polarium Advance',NULL,'Puzzle, Strategy','Wii U, Game Boy Advance','A GBA follow-up for Polarium (Nintendo DS), Nintendo\'s simple, stylish puzzle game. Make your line through the game board, flipping black and white tiles to change and match their color.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v2u.jpg'),(10187,'SnowRunner: Save the Day Vinyl Wrap Pack',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','Sin plataforma','This content requires the base game SnowRunner on Steam in order to play.Customize your SnowRunner experience further with the Save the Day Vinyl Wrap Pack, adding four exclusive skins for the Freightliner M916 and 114SD, International HX520 and Chevrolet Kodiak С70 trucks.This Pack is included in the Year 3 Pass and immediately available upon its purchase.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60we.jpg'),(10188,'Plane Mechanic Simulator','2019-02-13','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','England, 1940. The Luftwaffe is preparing for the invasion of Britain and the RAF need every man to stop it. They need you.\nJoin the ground crews as they struggle to keep the aircraft flying. Repair engine, patch bullet holes, rearm machine guns and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v4p.jpg'),(10189,'Romp of Dump','2024-01-19','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Visual Novel with Live2D Animation, Observing Scum Prisoners! In a prison called a dump, a betting card game among dangerous prisoners begins. Penalty game for the losers! Uncover the hidden pasts and bizarre crimes of these lunatics!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j09.jpg'),(10190,'Gonner2: Lose Your Head Bundle','2022-07-07','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','You get both GONNER2 and GoNNER! GoNNER is a tough as hell procedurally-generated 2D platformer with roguelike elements, following the largely misunderstood and altruistic Ikk on a journey to cheer up his only friend in this world - a giant landbound wha…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ds1.jpg'),(10191,'The Lord of Hexa','2024-01-10','Simulator, Indie','Android','You are a medieval Lord who must construct a colony, complete challenges to expand the kingdom, and rule an hexagonal low poly world. Immerse yourself in a tranquil ambiance with soothing sounds and music in this minimalistic tile game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tqm.jpg'),(10192,'Point Perfect','2014-07-17','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Point Perfect puts your mouse hand to the ultimate test. Navigate your mouse through a procedurally generated gauntlet. Use your reflexes to avoid aliens, saucers, meteors, and all manner of retro arcade enemies. Draw boxes around enemies to target for the mothership to shoot down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vgz.jpg'),(10193,'Pigeon Ascent','2020-04-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take care of your own pigeon as they fight increasingly stronger foes','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10194,'The Pharaoh\'s Labyrinth','2023-03-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Pharaoh\'s Labyrinth is a turn-based puzzle board game. Play with friends online, taking turns rolling your dice. Solve all 6 hidden puzzles and be the first to make it to the pyramid to win. Play with your mouse & keyboard on PC or connect your Tilt Five board for an AR experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64bo.jpg'),(10195,'Gojira tai 3 Daikaijuu','1984-12-31','Adventure','MSX','Once the player gets past the title screen, the game will begin. The movement of Godzilla is in three dimensions, and Godzilla\'s only weapon is his atomic breath, which can be aimed. Godzilla has four lives, which are depleted by either the enemies touching Godzilla, hitting Godzilla with their attacks, or Godzilla falling into a hole.\n\nMegalon will dig holes in the ground and come up to the surface to get Godzilla. After defeating Megalon, Kumongas will come up from the holes and fire at Godzilla with one of two weapons; a string shot or a color-changing projectile. After defeating several Kumongas, King Ghidorah appears and Godzilla has to defend Minilla. King Ghidorah shoots his gravity beams near himself, and if Minilla touches King Ghidorah, Godzilla loses a life. After defeating Ghidorah, the game restarts.\n\nThe 2-Player mode is the same as the one player mode except that two players can alternate between each life, each with their own lives and score meters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ana.jpg'),(10196,'Projekt Godhand','2025-05-08','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An extremely high-speed \"keyboard destruction rhythm game\" in which any key on the same half of the keyboard can be used to input notes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c5a.jpg'),(10197,'The Heroic Legend of Eagarlnia','2020-10-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Eglia\'s It is a \"grand strategy\" game with an aerial background, with a combination of Japanese lihua and pixel art style. The game takes the aerial world as the background and designs several countries with their own characteristics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31l4.jpg'),(10198,'Gaiflame',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10199,'Kellogg\'s Marvel\'s Civil War VR','2016-03-25','Simulator, Adventure','Android, iOS','Captain America: Civil War - Kellogg\'s VR Experience is a 2016 video game made to promote Captain America: Civil War in addition to Kellogg food products. Players can select from Captain America, Iron Man, Black Widow, Black Panther, War Machine, the Winter Soldier, Scarlet Witch, or the Falcon to play through the game\'s four levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91zu.jpg'),(10200,'End of world: Survivors','2023-02-28','Racing, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It is the end of the world and you have survived in an under ground bunker. It is your job to rescue survivors and bring them back to your home. You will need to provide them with the means to live by going out in to the zombie infested world and collecting items.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gvl.jpg'),(10201,'Chaos Ascension','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive relentless waves of monsters in this fast paced rogue lite action game. Choose your hero, defeat epic bosses, and unlock powerful upgrades in a dark, procedurally generated world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99ip.jpg'),(10202,'Eye of Ra','2018-11-16','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','ATMOSPHERIC SPACE SIMULATION \n \n- Played entirely within fictional operating system sMaat 9 \n- Simulation of 250+ solar bodies \n- Exploratory narrative told through email, news headlines, and REGISTRY database entries','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cuu.jpg'),(10203,'Bullets and More VR: BAM VR','2018-04-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jump into a massive multiplayer experience with up to 12 players in about 20 different maps and various different game modes (Deathmatch, Team Deathmatch, Capture The Flag, Virus Infection, Gun Game and Classic Deathmatch). Enjoy an arsenal of more than 20 weapons featuring realistic weapon behaviour and support for attachments, silencers and even bipods. Furthermore also featuring singleplayer modes and a Scene Editor with Workshop support.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/w9jquapu6kdm1ohqbwtu.jpg'),(10204,'Do Not Touch','2020-10-16','Sin género','Android','Are you ready for a whole new Augmented Reality experience? Bring the wild world of Nickelodeon\'s Do Not Touch button straight into your own 3D, real-world space! Play with SpongeBob in your kitchen, enter a portal into outer space from your living room, dig for buried treasure under your bedroom floor, and even breathe fire as Reptar! Get high scores to unlock rare buttons, games, and goodies – think you’ve got what it takes to collect them all?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72ud.jpg'),(10205,'Slotter Up Mania',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ul6.jpg'),(10206,'Super Jigsaw Puzzle: Generations - Peru','2024-01-23','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Puzzles of Peru!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10207,'Dreamreaper: Grey Skies',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Dreamreaper is an action-adventure game in which you play as unwilling partners in the form of an immortal man and an alien entity parasitizing him. Break through the hordes of enemies using feral powers, unravel the mystery of your existence and escape the dying world of the Grey Skies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oyn.jpg'),(10208,'Slendrina Remake','2025-03-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slendrina Remake is a scary survival game set in a dungeon where you must gather items, solve puzzles, and evade the sinister Slendrina herself to make it out alive. Experience the atmosphere of fear and tension in this gripping horror adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jdo.jpg'),(10209,'Lasers','2024-01-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lasers is a multiplayer game where you must survive deadly laser mazes until only one player remains standing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fwq.jpg'),(10210,'The Jackbox Party Pack 11',NULL,'Quiz/Trivia','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n08.jpg'),(10211,'The Jumping Carrot Race','2025-02-28','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hh1.jpg'),(10212,'Remote Bot','2018-04-23','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beholding the future is not the way the greats do. The greats don’t watch, they make! Seize your chance! Take control of a robot via ssh. Command your robot with a brand new command line interface and make them walk, climb, or maybe even make a cup of coffee!\n\nPlatformer games, annoying as never before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hgb.jpg'),(10213,'Twisted Detective','2023-12-14','Visual Novel','Web browser','A mystery detective game set in a space station, you awaken from your hybernation early, only to find something has gone wrong.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87v2.jpg'),(10214,'Spiral Splatter','2017-08-09','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Spiral Splatter is a brain-bending arcade puzzle game that will push your hand-eye coordination to the limit with nonstop, mind-boggling puzzles!\n\nPut your problem-solving skills to the test as you navigate over 100 levels and 11 different stages full of perplexing puzzles. Watch out for moving obstacles as you maneuver through each level. Think fast, if you’re too slow, the ghost may catch up to you. Hustle to reach the finish before your time is up!\n\nEach stage of gameplay adds a new challenge with an ever-increasing difficulty. Don’t be fooled by appearances, Spiral Splatter will stump even the most adept puzzle game aficionado.\n\nStay calm, relax and see if you can take on Spiral Splatter!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24tv.jpg'),(10215,'Georgie-Yolkie','2024-11-13','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Georgie-Yolkie is an all-new purrfect open-world platformer and collectathon! With huge, beautiful worlds, meet an unforgettable cast of silly characters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99zo.jpg'),(10216,'Jiji...Love','2025-01-29','Shooter, Indie','Web browser','A bullet hell game made in 48 hours for MalagaJam Weekend 19','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c2y.jpg'),(10217,'Star Word','2024-09-30','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A mysterious earthquake shatters the two protagonists\' final day on an alien planet. Help them escape using a Scrabble-like method of communication!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wcg.jpg'),(10218,'Solar Colonies','2021-10-21','Strategy','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tame the unstable climates of barren and inhabitable planets, then colonize them!\nGet supplies (plants, building, etc.) by collecting and exchanging your new colonists for them!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10219,'Ikarus Parkour',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ikarus Parkour is a precision 3D platformer set within a deadly game show. Climb the massive 850-meter vertical tower, overcome its obstacles, and claim the fortune that awaits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ny0.jpg'),(10220,'Haiki','2021-06-03','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Haiki is a diamond-hard platformer that rewards skilful play and punishes errors MERCILESSLY. Dive head-first into four worlds of colour-switching, laser-dodging, lightning-fast action.\n\nFeatures\n- Fast-paced, intuitive, limb-free platforming\n- 80 levels, from EASY to PURE HELL\n- A story that makes Shakespeare look like an idiot\n- Speedrun mode for the truly hardcore\n- Collectible hats for the truly awesome','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p9n.jpg'),(10221,'Hoonigans','2024-08-01','Racing','Game Boy Color','Hoonigans is a top-down racing game which pays homage to the classic retro racers of yesteryear. The aim of the game is simple: prove your worth as you tackle the game\'s diverse array of tracks and challenges, and earn medals to unlock a host of characters, tracks, vehicles, and more!\n\nThe game comprises twelve challenging tracks, three playable characters, and a huge array of vehicles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uly.jpg'),(10222,'Devil Mail','2023-10-18','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Web browser, Android, iOS','Devil Mail is a short 3D platform adventure created in fancade. You must find a way to access the castle and deliver an important message to the king, a message from a very far away place...\nIt can be played directly in the fancade app, or from itch.io','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8war.jpg'),(10223,'Temple Of Snek','2021-08-18','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A snaky tile-based puzzle dungeon adventure. Defend the temple, monch the infidels, and grow and grow and grow...\nPlay as a giant snake in an inter-coiled tile-based puzzle dungeon. Explore, master puzzle mechanics and special abilities, and uncover secrets... all is not what it seems in the Temple of Snek.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i53.jpg'),(10224,'Mind Benderz X','2023-09-23','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short, psychedelic first person shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92wo.jpg'),(10225,'Overknight Dungeon',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Overknight Dungeon is an action-packed-dungeon crawler platformer inspired by some arcade classics, featuring an amazing retro pixel art style and an awesome OST made by Richar Rest!\nPick up your sword and make your way through this ever-changing dungeon, collect coins, and get new power-ups to help you in your quest to save your BFF!\nAre you up to the challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pt7.jpg'),(10226,'Cthulhu: The Cosmic Abyss','2026-12-31','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','A mining station in the Pacific abyss is no longer responding. As an investigator of the occult, unravel the mysteries of the deep. Test your wits and sanity in this thriller inspired by the master of Providence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i73.jpg'),(10227,'Edna: Out of Sight, Out of Control','2020-07-12','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play as Edna and make your way through a castle by possessing statues within your line of sight. Solve puzzles by manipulating doors, switches, and mirrors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5duh.jpg'),(10228,'Furnish Master','2024-02-20','Puzzle, Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Furnish Master is a relaxing game about furnishing apartments, houses, commercial estate and even outdoor territory! Realize your design dreams! Add to Wishlist now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7syr.jpg'),(10229,'Eternal Guardian Rubine: The First Fight','2025-03-25','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ETERNAL GUARDIAN RUBINE -The First Fight- is a hair trigger 3D run-and-gun-and-sting inspired by many action games from the 90s, but mainly Sin & Punishment, Alien Soldier, Cannon Spike, and Radiant Silvergun. You as the bio-mechanical superweapon Rubine must use your entire arsenal to blast through various overstimulating levels across multiple small scenarios while racking up the biggest high score you can.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nus.jpg'),(10230,'Rift Runner','2020-07-27','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shoot your way through progressively more difficult waves, clear out the asteroids and finish off a dangerous boss. Between waves you can purchase upgrades and repair your ship to live longer and hit harder. How long can you survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rhl.jpg'),(10231,'AI: Art Impostor','2022-11-04','Simulator','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','AI: Art Impostor is the brand new party AI drawing game. You are an artist who commands AI to draw new artwork. You and other artists will collaborate in preparing for the next exhibition, but one of you doesn\'t know its theme. You should find a fake artist without being doubted by other artists.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uh5.jpg'),(10232,'Dino-Ducks Dash','2024-12-16','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dino-Ducks Dash is a 2D Hi-Score Multiplayer Runner with PvP and Co-Op or you can even play it as a single player to beat the leaderboard.\n\nIt has a couch co-op mode and an online co-op mode, but you can also beat the stuffing out of the other cute Dino Ducks with a machete!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92u5.jpg'),(10233,'Orul','2019-05-10','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','Made for local game jam under 48h hours. Platformer about bending space and connecting it in your mind. Have fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7we9.jpg'),(10234,'Morimens','2024-08-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Morimens is a roguelite card-building game inspired by the Cthulhu mythos, where you craft a versatile and intricate deck tailored to your playstyle. The choice is yours to embark on a climb up treacherous towers or engage in tactical battles. Explore misty maps and uncover the truth of the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8m3r.jpg'),(10235,'Underswap: The Reckoning',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Out of all the possible paths you can possibly entwine yourself into, this one in particular will prove to really challenge your palette.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bzu.jpg'),(10236,'LittleShadows',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Little Shadows is a 2d platformer game in an eerie/dark world. It\'s a small atmospheric game, taking place into a dark world, where you have literally to control light to \"kill\" darkness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1k4l.jpg'),(10237,'Stellar Interface','2024-06-21','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Fight In Ever Changing Space Battles!\n\nRun through the universe, discover the numerous perks/consumables and their synergistic effects. Explore the randomly-generated galaxy to find merchants, unlock spacecrafts, collect StellarNetES Cartridges, checkmark your kills of the various galactic overlords.\n\nAnd die. A lot!\n\nCan you find the most outrageous perk combination to defeat the Last Overlord?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hcs.jpg'),(10238,'Beatification','2010-05-16','Indie','Web browser','A painting game by Stephen Lavelle.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10239,'Xuan Yuan Sword: The Gate of Firmament','2015-02-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The “Xuan-Yuan Sword” is an epic oriental RPG series with 25 years of history.It elaborates on the very heart of this series, the idea of \"one, looking at the same thing from different angles, may come to different conclusions. \" through a variety of historical incidents in different times.\n\nFeatures :\n1. New facial animation and lip-sync systems to enhance facial expression and animation.\n2. New MVN motion capture system that creates real-time character animation.\n3. Real-time combat to make the combat look much more realistic, intense, and diverse.\n4. New Battle field System to make the game much more fun and enjoyable to play.\n5. New Cauldron System (the Urn of Spirit Infusion) to synthesize demons as well as refine or even upgrade their equipments to a better one.\n6. New Guardian System to enable players to capture demons and use them in the game as a combat companion.\n7. New Talisman system that will add additional buffs to players when equipped.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2leg.jpg'),(10240,'Retrowave Drive','2021-02-04','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Retrowave drive is an arcade racing game in retrowave style. Your time is limited, collect bonuses to get extra time and drive as far as you can. Сollect points and complete challenges to unlock all 9 iconic cars with unique abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yhm.jpg'),(10241,'Once Ever After','2022-04-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Red Riding Hood wanders out of the woods... and into an infinite number of alternate dimensions twisting the classic fairy tale in countless ways.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jxb.jpg'),(10242,'Zafe\'s Adventures',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zafe\'s Adventures is a new and simplified 2D platformer game with a simple run and gun elements and gameplay. Inspired by abandonware platformer, Sonic the Hedgehog series and its fangame, Spark the Electric Jester, Jazz Jackrabbit and Freedom Planet and as well with other simple 2D game that was made using GameMaker or Scratch in the past. This has been considered as a small solo indie game project only. The game follows a young and heroic pyrokinetic cartoon humanoid who tries to fight back against evil entities around the hillside wilderness. While he ends up on a long journey through another different world via the mysterious dimension portal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t8t.jpg'),(10243,'The Babysitter','2020-05-22','Adventure, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','At a house in a remote suburb, what you find over the course of one evening, and the decisions you have to make, will test your resolve, your beliefs, and your sanity.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10244,'Sea Balloon','2025-03-24','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a variety of islands with a red balloon! An ode to the art of taking it slow.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kjv.jpg'),(10245,'Smugglers of Cygnus',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Smugglers of Cygnus places you in command of a ship in the service of that noblest profession: Commerce. Travel the galaxy. Deliver goods. Deliver goods of questionable legality for higher rates. Fend off pirates, or perhaps become one yourself...The Galaxy is yours. Come and take it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lzk.jpg'),(10246,'Caduceus','2017-12-01','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Two-player competitive snake. Eat the food to make the snake big before times run out.\nDo not let the snake hit the wall or itself or each other. Try to have the biggest snake!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bd9.jpg'),(10247,'School Girl Apartment Paradise','2022-07-12','Visual Novel','Android','Life is looking up! You just finished your college freshman exams and even landed an internship abroad… But when your grandmother suddenly falls ill, it\'s up to you to look after her apartment complex. That seems simple enough, until you realize that not only is it an all-girls apartment, but there’s also a greedy yakuza boss looking to tear it down!\n\nAs if being the landlord wasn\'t hard enough, you now have three beautiful girls all vying for your attention. A sexy and suave actress, a perky high school senior, and… her mother?! Can you save the complex all while juggling the needs of your beguiling tenants?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zy7.jpg'),(10248,'Oddsparks: An Automation Adventure','2024-04-24','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Design automated workshops for your odd and adorable Sparks to carry and craft everything, including more of themselves! Lead your squad of Sparks into combat. Explore a strange fantasy world, in single player or online co-op. Unearth the ancient mystery of the Sparks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84jr.jpg'),(10249,'Dreadwinter',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Dreadwinter is a single-player, fantasy coffee shop RPG, where the game\'s story and experience is centered around how you play. Whether you want to run a thriving business, explore the world, or just make good coffee, how you run Dreadwinter is up to you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99f1.jpg'),(10250,'Mimic Dungeon','2023-02-09','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Help the Wizard escape the dungeon by killing enemies with the staff that makes everyone copy his moves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7a68.jpg'),(10251,'Kill All Enemies','2025-05-29','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kill all enemies, Upgrade, Repeat! Defeat thousands of enemies in this incremental roguelite and become unstoppable as you progress through the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o75.jpg'),(10252,'Celeste: Farewell','2019-09-09','Platform','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Chapter 9: Farewell is a new story chapter for Celeste. It contains 100+ new levels, bringing the game\'s total to over 800! Over 40 minutes of new music from Lena Raine. There\'s several brand new mechanics and items to discover and play with. Reconnect with beloved characters for a final goodbye.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co216i.jpg'),(10253,'Orbital Cascade','2025-01-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A puzzle game inspired by classics like Zuma, where you pop colorful bullets, unleash dazzling combos, and rise to conquer the skies. Strategize your moves, master the challenge, and claim victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dr2.jpg'),(10254,'Devil Spire','2022-02-02','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Devil Spire is a hardcore first-person pseudo-3D roguelite action RPG dungeon crawler stylized after retro PC games, developed by a guy and his bros while locked in quarantine. Inspired by classics like King\'s Field and Heretic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4dvb.jpg'),(10255,'KleptoCats','2014-12-31','Simulator, Adventure','Android, iOS','KleptoCats are cute. But they have a dark side. They can\'t stop stealing!!!\nBut then again... your room is kinda empty. What a CAT-astrophe. I guess your furry friend\'s frisky paws may be a perfect match to fill your room. Send your cat away to gather items to fill your room with amazing treasures.\nCollect hundreds of unique mischievous kitties, and watch as they decorate your home with unique collectibles from every corner of the world(s)!\nFeed, wash, and pet your adorable PAW-rtners in crime to show your appreciation for their gifts!\nWatch out for exciting easter eggs, and clues to solve the mystery of how the Kleptocats came into your life!\nS-purr-tacular!!!\nYou never know what KleptoCats will bring back next.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qc1.jpg'),(10256,'Assassin\'s Shadows','2025-02-03','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Assassin\'s Shadows is a game where you play as legendary shinobi taking on an apprentice, a young samurai woman, Aira, from a fallen clan that wishes to learn from you and avenge her clan through becoming a legendary shinobi herself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e6j.jpg'),(10257,'Metal Max','1991-06-24','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Family Computer','Metal Max is a 1991 vehicle combat role-playing video game developed by Crea-Tech and published by Data East for the Nintendo Famicom exclusively in Japan on May 24, 1991 and later re-released on the Wii Virtual Console on April 27, 2010. It is the first of the Metal Max series. Metal Max is set in a futuristic post-apocalyptic world, where the surviving humans cluster in underground villages and ruins while \"monster hunters\" fight the monsters and outlaws outside.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w5f.jpg'),(10258,'The Station: Escape Room','2021-04-26','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escape the confinement of the space station and restart the systems to gain freedom. Cooperative Escape Room style game to challenge yourself and your friends. Seven rooms to solve the amazing and challenging mysteries before the timer runs out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co444a.jpg'),(10259,'Ocolast: Origens de Paulo Guina','2015-02-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ocolast - Origens de Paulo Guina is a fan-made prequel to the parody horror game, Ocolast. as you control Jailson Mendes, a reporter trapped in a prison with a deranged inmate called Paulo Guina.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bia.jpg'),(10260,'Pathfinder Puzzle','2020-09-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Find the right path to collect all stars and bring you car save to the target zone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qvb.jpg'),(10261,'Jogo de Bejos','2024-05-09','Sin género','Web browser','Help Aninha and Luca kiss while Cookie (my dog) doesn\'t look, because if he looks he\'ll get jealous and you\'ll lose.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86ol.jpg'),(10262,'Monster Prom 2: Monster Camp Outfit Pack - Thirst and Sensibility',NULL,'Simulator, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zjw.jpg'),(10263,'LightUp!','2021-06-04','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This game is made for TriJam#123. The goal is to stay out of the light in every level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bfu.jpg'),(10264,'Secret of Super Seducer','2024-05-17','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','During the pursuit of six beautiful women, you will learn the underlying logic and basic principles of love, chat skills, dating skills, relationship upgrade skills, psychological effects of love, and building framework personality attraction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co838e.jpg'),(10265,'To Altare','2023-11-22','Platform','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A small platformer fan game where you bounce your way up to find Altare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kom.jpg'),(10266,'Zombie Island','2020-01-01','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Can you clear the islands from the zombies that are lurking on them? Can you find out what caused this to happen... Can you find the easter eggs? Why not try it out...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l36.jpg'),(10267,'Chupacabra Hunt',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10268,'Pickle\'s Book',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','The world of Pickle\'s picture book where both parent and child can play.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10269,'Kid Icarus','1988-12-31','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Family Computer Disk System, Arcade, Wii, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System','Kid Icarus is an action platform video game for the Family Computer Disk System in Japan and the Nintendo Entertainment System in Europe and North America.\nThe plot of Kid Icarus revolves around protagonist Pit\'s quest for three sacred treasures, which he must equip to rescue the Grecian fantasy world Angel Land and its ruler, the goddess Palutena. The player controls Pit through platform areas while fighting monsters and collecting items. Their objective is to reach the end of the levels, and to find and defeat boss monsters that guard the three treasures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20fh.jpg'),(10270,'The Witch-in-Training and the Magic Seal','2018-11-20','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Witch-in-Training and the Magic Seal is an adventure puzzle game where you control Ena and her party to escape the insides of a magical seal, all while uncovering its secrets.\n\nThe game features heavy focus on cutscenes and dialogue to slowly unravel the story and backgrounds of the various featured characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4htn.jpg'),(10271,'Radiation Island','2016-11-29','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Radiation Island is a survival adventure game where you craft your own destiny in a huge open world environment. As part of the Philadelphia Experiment you have become stranded in a parallel, alternate reality. Discover this new and mysterious world, with all its surprises. Use everything you find to survive it and solve its puzzle to get back to the real world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j7q.jpg'),(10272,'Mario & Sonic at the London 2012 Olympic Games','2012-02-14','Sport','Nintendo 3DS','The 3DS version of Mario & Sonic at the London 2012 Olympic Games has some key differences from the Wii version. While it shares many events, it has more. It also features an exclusive Story Mode. The protagonists from the Mario and Sonic series team up to defeat Bowser and Dr. Eggman, who, along with their underlings, have taken over London. There are different parts to the story, depending on the character played. The player must win events against the antagonists. Playable characters consist of all 20 playable characters from the previous installment\'s Nintendo DS version, and are split into five groups of four.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22wi.jpg'),(10273,'My Little Pony AR',NULL,'Sin género','Android, iOS','My Little Pony AR is a cancelled mobile game based around the My Little Pony series that was in development in early 2017. The game was being developed by Climax Studios.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10274,'Kute Knight','2024-07-01','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A platform game where you control a knight who must collect coins and defeat monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w5k.jpg'),(10275,'Fusion Nexus: Alchemic Evolution','2024-05-04','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on an alchemical journey in this vibrant 2D adventure! Craft unique monsters, engage in turn-based battles, and liberate the region. A fusion of exploration, crafting, and thrilling combat awaits in Fusion Nexus: Alchemic Evolution.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wjb.jpg'),(10276,'BFDI: Branches','2024-06-22','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BFDI: Branches is an all-new platformer game with Firey, Leafy, Coiny, and Pin! Featuring multiple characters with varied gameplay, a story mode with branching paths, a complete level editor, and an online level browser!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cwb.jpg'),(10277,'The Throng','2025-03-11','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An online frog-based game where survival is not guaranteed, so be ready to hide, run, and laugh.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j02.jpg'),(10278,'Somnium Angelus','2022-06-26','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Somnium Angelus is a Yume Nikki fangame created for Dream Diary Jam 2022 by SisterSoft.\n\nEnter the dreams of 3 girls to find them and bring them to their home on the moon...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51zt.jpg'),(10279,'To Fight',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10280,'Himig',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Himig is a cozy game about experiencing the calm, everyday moments of life, making memories and finding joy from little, mundane things, and letting those serve as an inspiration to shape the future ahead of you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zre.jpg'),(10281,'Adopt A Boyfriend','2022-06-30','Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Riley has grown tired of time-wasters and first dates with no chemistry.\n\nWanting to feel loved again, they hastily turn to ARA, the Agency for Romancing Animalfolk, hoping the agency can give them hope in the world of romance.\n\nExcitement builds for the day when their new chance at love will arrive, when not one, but two hot animal boys show up on their doorstep!\n\nwill you pursue the friendship and adoration that comes with the people-pleasing bunny Aramis? Or push through the stoic exterior of cute kitten Kujo to find his heart of gold underneath?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fhz.jpg'),(10282,'Time Gap Mystery','2017-11-15','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Plunge deep in a whirlwind adventure with Time Gap hidden object mystery game. Unravel wonderful facts about Alexander the Great, Cleopatra, Napoleon, Lincoln and Einstein as you try to save the day. Travel around the world with the help of an interactive map, complete multiple tasks, assemble diverse collections and engage in numerous minigames. It\'s time to challenge the destiny!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27ir.jpg'),(10283,'Bip + Bop','2021-06-13','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bip and Bop\'s worlds are converging - and it looks pretty scary! Help Bip and Bop return their worlds to order by alternating between them and compounding their unique abilities!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xge.jpg'),(10284,'C.H.A.I.N.','2020-11-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','20 games, 20 developers, one narrative...\n\nHaunted PS1 Presents: C.H.A.I.N.\n\nThe chain is an exquisite-corpse collection of 20 short horror games developed over the span of half a year.\n\nThe developers couldn\'t communicate with each other during development. Each developer would send their game to the next person in line, who would make a follow-up. Together they form a complete narrative.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jya.jpg'),(10285,'Pyro Complete Bundle','2022-09-21','Sin género','Xbox One','Relive three masterpieces, originally developed by the legendary Pyro Studios, that defined the real-time tactics genre like nothing before, re-imagined in full HD.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fbl.jpg'),(10286,'Three Glyph Tiles','2023-07-10','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Three Glyph Tiles is a tile placement puzzle game by Modular Independent Interactive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qd2.jpg'),(10287,'Dungeon Encounters','2021-10-14','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Dungeon Encounters is a unique dungeon exploration RPG in which you lead an expedition to chart the depths of an otherworldly labyrinth. Plan and prepare to overcome numerous obstacles, solve puzzles, and defeat monsters. Strategize to survive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wsq.jpg'),(10288,'Dreamspace','2024-02-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dreamspace is an atmospheric game about dreams. Explore surreal locations and meet different NPCs. The game contains 17 unique dreams and takes about 30 minutes to complete. The game was made for LSDJam 2023 in 3 months.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9316.jpg'),(10289,'BlastArena.io',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS)','Sin plataforma','Blastarena is an incredibly fun free for all arena game where you play as a small blocky character and place bombs in order to clear terrain and kill the other bombers. This game was originally based on the classic indie game bomberman and it does it great justice as its is similarly addictive! If you never played the original fear not as Blastarena.io is just as fun to play alone or with friends.\n\nHow to play\nIn the Blast arena its every man for himself, your objective is to be the last bomber standing either through killing everyone or waiting for them to kill each other! Destroy terrain to make your way around the map and collect the power ups they drop such as movement speed, extra bombs and bomb range in order to become a bigger threat. Bomb explosions can only travel in straight lines from where the bomb was placed, use this knowledge to your advantage and avoid standing in the fire or its game over!\n\nControls\n\nUse the WASD or arrow keys to navigate throughout the map and use the space bar to drop a bomb. Just remember that you can only place one bomb at a time at the start and you can be killed by anyones bombs including your own!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/eqi7jmf3xfk5dsdichkm.jpg'),(10290,'Guilty Gear: Strive - Ultimate Edition Contents Kit','2021-06-08','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Ultimate Edition Content Kit includes the Digital Soundtrack, Digital Artwork and Guilty Gear: Strive - Ultimate Edition Special Colors. All included content is exclusive to this package.\nThe physical Ultimate Edition release came with a single-use code for this content.\n\nThe Ultimate Edition Special Colors include the 5 characters in Season Pass 1 along with the 15 in the initial roster. The 4 characters added in Season Pass 2 get this color variation as part of Additional Color Pack 2.\n\nThe soundtrack includes a total of 55 songs, featuring more than 15 vocal themes and 40 background tracks used in the Story Mode.\n\nThe Artwork includes various art and visuals from the Guilty Gear series’ history including the main visuals of each game and a number of unreleased illustrations from renowned guest artists.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ovm.jpg'),(10291,'Midgard Lava-a-Jato','2024-04-16','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A washing and dress-up game featuring Final Fantasy characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83rf.jpg'),(10292,'Napoleon Maiden','2022-12-16','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','\"Napoleon Maiden\" Live2D Visual Novel. Shoichi Sakikawa was a normal, second-year high school student.Or, he was, until he woke up from a car accident only to find himself trapped in mid-revolution 19th century France.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pzx.jpg'),(10293,'Bus Simulator 21: Next Stop','2023-05-16','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s your stop! Bus Simulator 21 Next Stop is here! Enjoy many game improvements and a brand-new game mode with this comprehensive update. Career Mode combines Sandbox Mode with the campaign\'s economic system. Download the update now and experience Bus Simulator 21 anew.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80b5.jpg'),(10294,'Elizabeth','2020-02-25','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Elizabeth is a decryption leisure game.The protagonist is a young man who has just stepped into the society, shuttling through the picture frame in search of freedom and love.The game screen is fresh and lovely, each level has rich puzzles waiting for players to solve.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zto.jpg'),(10295,'Chaos Online',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Chaos Online is AOS game with decent graphics and cool skills','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ghx98pstpxtjezny99z5.jpg'),(10296,'My Singing Monsters Playground','2021-11-09','Music, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','It\'s the Singing Monsters like you\'ve never seen them before. Journey to the Monster World to take part in a tournament of Monster-Game madness! Watch your favorite Monsters come to life as you swing, fling, and spring your way to victory in a variety of 4-player competitions. Grab your friends and hit the Playground to see who has what it takes to win the ultimate Monster bash! Local Multiplayer Madness Compete against friends and family in games galore set across the Monster World Starring the Singing Monsters Take control of some of your favorite characters from the world of My Singing Monsters Variety of Game Types Team up to take on your competition in 2v2 games or battle it out for solo supremacy in free-for-all matches. Ways to Play Play the way you want with friends or solo in three different game modes: Party Tournament, Single Player Gauntlet, or Freeplay!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zeb.jpg'),(10297,'Sonic Adventure 2: Super Hard Mode',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ill.jpg'),(10298,'TurnOn','2016-06-01','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','The whole city has been plunged into darkness. After an accident at the power station, a living electric spark must restore electricity to the city and give citizens back their safe and carefree lives. TurnOn tells the spellbinding tale of a brave alien creature and its striking journey through blackout world, in an incredibly colorful and detailed platformer without platforms. Featuring a charming art style and visual storytelling, cute character personality, and a soothing and magical soundtrack, TurnOn makes the world the way it was before, but a little better and kinder.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rrc.jpg'),(10299,'DrumBeats VR','2019-02-01','Music, Simulator, Sport, Indie, Arcade','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3','DrumBeatsVR is a VR drumming music game. Players can drum to our songs that are custom made for this game. In DrumBeatsVR you can practice on different drum kits, including Metallica and The Rolling Stones and you can play in three different environments (more to be added later).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8srx.jpg'),(10300,'Wordle 4','2020-12-01','Puzzle, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wordle 4 is a new format puzzle game from the Wordle series. 29 new categories scattered across the English alphabet from A to Z.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84su.jpg'),(10301,'Groove Coaster: Wai Wai Party!!!! - Touhou Project Arrangements Pack 5','2021-01-07','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10302,'All Elite Wrestling: Fight Forever - Season Pass 4','2024-05-08','Fighting, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','AEW: Fight Forever Season Pass 4 includes access to THREE DLCs: World War Joe featuring Samoa Joe, Rated Gold Superstar Pack featuring Adam Copeland, plus the Switchblade Tournament Pack featuring Jay White. PLUS a freebie DLC: Elite Beats and Stampede Expansion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8e14.jpg'),(10303,'Tendryll','2024-04-30','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Delve into grid-based card play in this roguelike deckbuilder. Assemble your party, carefully select your battles, and construct powerful item builds to cleanse the Tendryll of its befouled enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60q5.jpg'),(10304,'Constellation Courier','2023-05-02','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser','Explore the stars as you make deliveries for folks all across the galaxy in Constellation Courier!\n\nPlay as a mail courier tasked with helping the world’s creatures, big and small, communicate with each other across the vast expanse of space. Uncover their stories along the way as you fly amongst the planets and learn more about their journeys through time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j9q.jpg'),(10305,'HoloBall','2016-11-29','Sport, Indie','PlayStation VR, SteamVR, Oculus Rift','HoloBall plunges players into an action-sports arcade arena inspired by one of the most iconic games of all time. Use your paddles to hit, smash and bash the HoloBall past your opponent to score. Learn and master skillshots to outmatch your increasingly difficult opponents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3j16.jpg'),(10306,'Raising Torolith','2021-09-21','Racing, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Raising Torolith is a physics based first-person platformer. Embrace the parkour style and prove your agility by claiming the orbs that will raise the kingdom back! Medieval fantasy, relaxing & beautiful scenery. Raise castles and islands from the water. Come to Torolith and join the adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4780.jpg'),(10307,'Pyramid Runner','2024-06-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This arcade puzzle game challenges you to collect treasures from ancient pyramids, dark dungeons, and even Mars. You\'ll have to outsmart cruel mummies and dangerous gorillas, as well as solve many of clever puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g9c.jpg'),(10308,'DCS World: F-5E Remastered','2024-12-04','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The F-5E was developed in the early 1970s as a light tactical fighter. It is an upgraded version of the earlier F-5A. Combat roles of the F-5E include both air-to-air and unguided ground attack. In the United States, it has excelled as an aggressor. Given its mission flexibility, ease of operation, and low cost, the F-5E continues to serve air forces including Iran, Switzerland, and others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94oj.jpg'),(10309,'The Three Musketeers','2021-04-07','Fighting, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','An adventure game based on the classic novel by Alexander Dumas. Play as D\'Artagnan, Prothos, Athos or Aramis. In this grave mission to save a whole country, you have to fight a devious enemy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bga.jpg'),(10310,'UBoat: The Silent Wolf','2024-06-19','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure','SteamVR','UBOAT: The Silent Wolf is a simulator of a submarine from WWII era, yet different than all you have seen so far. It is a survival sandbox with crew management mechanics while its primary theme is life of German sailors. The boat is their home, but it can become their grave at any time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ynb.jpg'),(10311,'Ratshaker','2024-10-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RATSHAKER is the fun and quirky solution to all your rat problems! Hold on to the RAT, shake your arm, and watch life’s problems disappear! How far can you go?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92fe.jpg'),(10312,'Lunr.Rdio.Taxi','2023-05-28','Music, Racing','Web browser','lunr.rdio.taxi combines the precision of rhythm games with the excitement of a futuristic racing game. Pilot your ship through a mind-bending cylinder that pulses to the beat of the music. Dodge obstacles in time with the soundtrack and master the art of \"Drifthm\" mode for insane score multipliers. Can you handle the rhythm and the risk?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gad.jpg'),(10313,'Drift Vector',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Drift Vector is a minimalist, glowing neon synthwave-inspired, indie, retro arcade asteroids-like game for 1-4 players with an unconventional control scheme that encourages ballet-like manoeuvres to line up the perfect shot while collecting powerups and avoiding rockets, opponents & other obstacles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75q8.jpg'),(10314,'Fanatic Earth','2014-07-03','Role-playing (RPG)','Android','In a world where an alien bacteria known as the \"Achratoth\" nearly wiped out mankind, Xilleon City was created using a particle shield to protect many of the remaining inhabitants. Somewhere in this sprawling metropolis, a man without a past happens upon a woman being harassed by thugs from the local gang. After this unsuspecting hero rescues her from her predicament, she decides to thank him and also seek his advice about a much more serious problem...\n\nJoin forces with a detective in the local police force, an android, and a young girl with a mysterious past as \"defenders of justice\" and take on Cyphatek, the largest corporation in Xilleon City, to expose their corruption!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xx4.jpg'),(10315,'Dungeons & Keyboards','2023-09-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ready your typing skills and defeat the quirky enemies of the Tower of Verbum. Collect coins, relics, and experience to buy items, assign stats and unlock permanent upgrades. How far will your typing skills take you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gv0.jpg'),(10316,'Cave',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Trapped in a dark cave, a young adventurer tries to escape a rather dark fate. On your journey, you will need to dig your way out to freedom. On your path you will collect rare materials, smelt them and craft custom weapons and tools that will help you to escape that hell hole!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mv0.jpg'),(10317,'Ashes of the Singularity: Escalation - Hunter/Prey',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dvn.jpg'),(10318,'Etherian','2018-11-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Navigate through an ancient course spanning the floating land of Etherian. Use your wit and skill to traverse lava filled caverns, vibrant jungles, frigid tundra, and sand swept desert.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qed.jpg'),(10319,'Super Street Fighter II Turbo: Revival','2001-11-02','Fighting, Arcade','Wii U, Game Boy Advance','Capcom\'s timeless Street Fighter masterpiece conquers the Game Boy Advance system. Choose from over 16 brawlers from the Street Fighter universe and execute special moves, and super combos to wreak havoc on your opponent and become the best street fighter in the world. Lightning fast animation, unbelievable graphics and Capcom\'s signature gameplay make Super Street Fighter II Turbo the most respected fighting game of all time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dk3.jpg'),(10320,'Parkour Simulator 3D',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Sport','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10321,'A-Train','1992-11-01','Simulator, Strategy','Mac','You play the part of the head of a railroad company, with the aim of creating your own railroad empire, providing a successful mass transit system that will be an inspiration to the rest of the world. Another goal is to provide the impetus for your chosen city to develop. There are a number of different places to set up business each with different layouts and existing houses and businesses.\n\nThe main money earners are passenger trains, that can be scheduled to pick up passengers at the times of day when the demand is high. However, in the long term you need the city to develop. This requires setting up trains that transport resources to where they are needed. These resources are used to build houses, and other buildings, increasing the number of passengers for your commuter trains.\n\nAs the city develops, new businesses will spring up, such as stadiums, high rise office blocks, and ski resorts. You can also build your own businesses, the success of which will depend on the local population, the presence of competing businesses, and even the changes of the seasons, among other factors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pl4.jpg'),(10322,'Bot Wars','2021-09-10','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bot Wars is an action RTS about managing a squad of kill-bots and their bases as you work to take over all the capture points across the map. Featuring corporate kill bot armies, ranging from a firearms and beverage manufacturer to a lovecraftian burger cult.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48pd.jpg'),(10323,'Smart Ball','1992-03-01','Platform, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','The game involves going through 8 stages (broken up into two parts each) of side-scrolling action. At the end of each stage is a boss monster that must be disposed of.\n\nJerry moves by sliding across the ground and can latch on to walls and climb them. Jerry can also jump, stretch out to cling to ceilings, and also move at a faster pace. Jerry can consume balls that he finds during a stage and can then fire them out of his body at enemies blocking his path. Enemies can also be defeated by jumping on them and then flattening Jerry\'s body on them. Also, there are flowers that contain items for Jerry to collect. Items include life, which refills health, a 1-up that adds an extra life, and a seed, which will grow a climbable beanstalk when planted. If the player collects the scattered letters that appear in every stage that spell out the name Jerry, the player will earn two extra lives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zai.jpg'),(10324,'Bones \'n\' Bullets',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bones \'N\' Bullets is a retro-inspired, action-packed adventure stacked with big guns, deadly spells and treacherous traps. Join the soldier on this quest through a world filled with deadly enemies, nail-biting challenges and blazing boss battles in order to save not only his world, but his very soul!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ul3.jpg'),(10325,'Shiki Eiyuu-den','1995-07-07','Role-playing (RPG)','Super Famicom','Shiki Eiyuu-den is a Role-Playing game, published by Outrigger Koubou, which was released in Japan in 1995.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4cxk.jpg'),(10326,'Maze Gobbler',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','\"Maze Gobbler\" is a simple yet addictive puzzle game.\nDraw the way with your fingertip for the cute caterpillar to follow to escape the Maze.\nAvoid Monsters. A Monster cuts the body of your cute caterpillar.\nA Monster changes to a Fruit every few seconds, and seconds later the Fruit changes back to the Monster.\nIf your caterpillar eats a Fruit, one block of tail is added to the caterpillar (and Game Money too)!\nDon\'t spend too much time, as more Monsters will appear as time goes on!\nClick the Buttons at the bottom of the Screen: \"AddSpeed\"(Speed Booster, X2, X4) and \"AddTail\"(add one block of tail to the body). These are very useful!\nStrive to make the body of your caterpillar longer. The longer the body, the higher the Score!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10327,'MyStylist',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10328,'Far Cry 2','2008-12-31','Shooter','Legacy Mobile Device','Far Cry 2 for mobile handsets is a top-down shooter based on the 3D console and PC title by Gameloft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cnj.jpg'),(10329,'Jef','2020-02-28','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Travel the galaxy, find a dog, watch billionaires put together Ikea furniture for regular people, learn about the Sourcefield, get mentally healthy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xbj.jpg'),(10330,'Undertale: Papyrus\' Belief',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A take on the Disbelief project owned by FlamesAtGames where the roles of Sans and Papyrus are reversed in the no mercy route!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e0j.jpg'),(10331,'AstroForge: Space Pirates','2024-02-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build your unique spaceship and explore space. Travel between planets, fight different opponents, trade and develop. Build the most efficient ship and fight with other players in multiplayer. 17 languages available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7o7i.jpg'),(10332,'Erick Golden',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jht.jpg'),(10333,'Final Fantasy X/X-2 Ultimate Box','2005-09-08','Sin género','PlayStation 2','Final Fantasy X/X-2 Ultimate Box is a three-case boxset of the Ultimate Hits versions of Final Fantasy X and Final Fantasy X-2, and Final Fantasy X: Eternal Calm, released on the PlayStation 2 in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87q0.jpg'),(10334,'Darts Fever: Deluxe Edition','2025-02-28','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10335,'The Sims 4: Dream Home Decorator','2021-06-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','Turn your client\'s fantasy into reality with The Sims 4: Dream Home Decorator. Every home is full of unrealized potential, and only you can take it from drab to fab. If you want to build your professional reputation, get to know every Sims\' Likes and Dislikes before you start designing, then deliver the perfect renovation for each client. Once you\'ve worked your magic, get ready to see the astonished look on your client\'s face with the big reveal!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h33.jpg'),(10336,'Turn-Based Battle Bundle: The Amazing American Circus & Legend of Keepers','2023-10-03','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Get two awesome turn-based games: The Amazing American Circus and Legend of Keepers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co785b.jpg'),(10337,'Giraffe and Annika','2020-08-27','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Giraffe and Annika is a 3D adventure game for PC where you follow along with the cat eared girl Annika as she explores the mysterious island of Spika.\n\nEach dungeon is guarded by a boss where Annika will need to defeated through a music-based battle system and fully synched animations. The game system and effects are all fully synched with the music.\n\nHelp Annika find her lost memories through her adventures on the island!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wn6.jpg'),(10338,'Fault Milestone Two Side: Above','2015-09-08','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Fault Milestone Two Side: Above is a Cinematic Visual Novel that takes place right after the events of milestone one. Please note that this novel is a direct sequel to fault - milestone one and contains massive spoilers of the first story. Play through of the first title is highly advised.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b9z.jpg'),(10339,'Metroid: Fused Facility','2023-04-23','Shooter, Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','METROID: Fused Facility is a simple hack of Metroid 1 on the NES, featuring a brand new adventure on Planet B-515, with the simple objective to destroy the growing X Parasites population on the planet. It features a completely brand-new map, new level design, new graphics, and even ports of Metroid Fusion music, courtesy of Amilgi. Much like the earlier Metroid Blue, you can also combine the Ice and Wave beam here and always respawn with full health. The paths are varied, and you have multiple ways to get through the base.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93hw.jpg'),(10340,'13th House on Halloween','2024-10-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You finally bought a house, but it\'s the 13th house on the street and it\'s Halloween... so who knows what you actually bought...\n\nAre you ready to experience why is it a bad idea to go against superstition on Halloween? In this game you will get to and see the consequences, and maybe even live trough it... but who knows, anything can happen on Halloween...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90c2.jpg'),(10341,'Skull',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10342,'Railbreak','2023-12-22','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Power through hordes of zombies, \'90s arcade style, in this on-rails survival horror shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i94.jpg'),(10343,'Genba no Kizuna','2024-08-26','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A mesozoic murder mystery, 4 suspects, 1 truth. Investigate, interrogate and present evidence as you set out to unravel the case with your team. Will you be able to accurately determine who took the victim\'s life? Or will your deductions lead you to arrest someone for a crime they did not commit...?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ql7.jpg'),(10344,'Amairo Chocolate 2','2023-06-28','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yunagicho, a town lined with Western-style homes. The previous autumn was when Yuzuki came to this town and met the animal eared girls and started working with them at Cafe Setaria.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6of4.jpg'),(10345,'101 Cats Hidden in Australia','2024-10-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Find and discover 101 cute cats hidden throughout the Australia landscape in this hand-drawn hidden object game. Can you find them all?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yp1.jpg'),(10346,'World of Tanks: Blitz - Resource Pack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','7 days of Premium Account + 500 gold + 500,000 credits + 50 of each XP type and Rare Credit boosters + CVC Helmet unique avatar. Speed up your research!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10347,'Blazing Angels 2: Secret Missions of WWII','2008-03-19','Simulator','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Blazing Angels 2: Secret Missions of WWII is a 2007 flight-combat video game for the personal computer, PlayStation 3, and Xbox 360; developed by Ubisoft Romania; and published by Ubisoft. It was released on September 7 in Europe, September 18 in North America, and October 4 in Australasia. A sequel of Blazing Angels: Squadrons of WWII, the game puts the player in an elite Allied squadron trying to prevent Nazi Germany from creating a weapon of mass destruction. As the player progresses, he or she will travel around the world and battle the enemy with a list of prototype fighter aircraft and upgrades. Multiplayer mode includes deathmatch, cooperative, capture-the-flag, and epic battle. A demo was released on the PlayStation Network and Xbox Live on August 23, 2007.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x89.jpg'),(10348,'Torq\'s Late to the Grand Prix in the Attic Upstairs','2024-08-21','Platform, Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re Torq, a toy car... but more importantly, you\'re running late!\n\nUsing your trusty pullback motor and unlockable upgrades, overcome the treacherous terrain of an unkempt living room!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s0h.jpg'),(10349,'8-bit Adventure Anthology: Volume I','2017-10-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','8-bit Adventure Anthology is a compilation featuring faithful remakes of three of the best 8-bit point & click adventure games ever made. Originally released between 1987-1991, each stand-alone adventure features the same mind-blowing puzzles, graphics and music that mesmerized generations of console gamers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22jp.jpg'),(10350,'Tiny Troopers Joint Ops XL','2017-12-21','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Tiny Troopers Joint Ops is an epic bite-sized arcade shooter, filled to the brim with action-packed mini maps of mayhem!\n\nTake control of your tiny troopers as you battle evil adversaries from around the world with a multitude of weapons. Recruit specialist mercenaries such as Medics, Machine Gunners and the Elite Delta Force to subdue enemy insurgents! Collect medals, dog tags, Intel and more during the course of each mission to ensure victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24ne.jpg'),(10351,'Critter Town','2024-09-03','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short horror story inspired by Animal Crossing for the DS, nostalgia for the 2000s and old creepypasta.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93bc.jpg'),(10352,'EarthBound Dimensions',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Earthbound Dimensions is a fanmade unofficial playable reimagination of EarthBound/MOTHER 2, but translated and adapted to modern 3D systems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s9m.jpg'),(10353,'Clutter RefleXIVe: The Diceman Cometh - Collector\'s Edition','2025-03-20','Puzzle, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','By far, the most challenging and exciting Clutter ever. You will not believe the Dice, Flat-Pastel-Icons & the Abstractica Object Sets. And 3 Quests - Regular, Super-Difficult The Diceman Cometh Quest, and Super-Easy Oldschool Quest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jgc.jpg'),(10354,'RC Cars','2003-12-11','Racing, Sport, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','R.C. Cars is an exciting arcade racing game featuring the world of highly realistic toy radio controlled cars. Jump, accelerate, perform acrobatic feats in the air, and bounce on big hummocks, pits and bumps while contending with opponents for victory. Win prize money for placing in the race, purchase car upgrades and participate on further tracks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yb0.jpg'),(10355,'AshGuine Story III: Fukushuu no Honoo','1987-02-01','Role-playing (RPG), Arcade','MSX','Seven years ago, the father and mother of the Reptile-Human ASHGUINE were killed by the Ghouls. But now, changing his appearance with the help of an old machine, Ashguine is the only one to launch a counter-attack on the enemy armies. It\'s time for revenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hdk.jpg'),(10356,'Boom Shocketa: Rocket Storm',NULL,'Racing','Sin plataforma','Boom Shocketa: Rocket Storm brings true 6DoF (six degrees of freedom) rocket racing to your PC. Blast faster than ever before in a game designed for those who are never satisfied with their record times.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58ti.jpg'),(10357,'SpongeBob SquarePants: SpongeBob Saves the Day!','2019-08-29','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore Bikini Bottom with SpongeBob SquarePants and his friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a9c.jpg'),(10358,'Avenger Sharks','2024-02-21','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Avenger Sharks is a retro twin-stick shooter. Featuring sharks. Out for Vengeance. Save your fishy friends! Destroy the evils of the deep! Collect power-ups, health potions and upgrades! Invoke the sheer fury of fish frenzy or your dinosaur friends to even the odds!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gos.jpg'),(10359,'Wild Blue',NULL,'Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wild Blue reimagines the classic on-rail adventures of the \'90s. Join Bowie Stray and the Blue Bombers as they soar through the skies on a mission to save the world in this action-packed, nostalgic journey!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9izo.jpg'),(10360,'Beyond.Frontiers','2024-11-15','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In beyond.frontiers, you take on the role of an intrepid explorer, free to venture through the universe and beyond the known boundaries of three empires to discover new systems, encounter friends and foes, and engage in thrilling battles. With a large, freely moddable universe and several storylines, this game promises an unforgettable adventure where every decision might shape the fate of the galaxy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j0d.jpg'),(10361,'Raige','2024-02-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A PSX-inspired, narrative-driven experience, Raige is a disturbing and confronting encounter with a grim world, its inhabitants, and yourself. Become one with Raige and the never-ending ride of morbid fascination. You can always stop, if you want.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co477v.jpg'),(10362,'The Big Secret of a Small Town','2015-10-22','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The small town is a very important town indeed. Here, a unique industrial complex is located. Rumor has it that it does not require energy for production, because that is exactly what it produces! How is this possible?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co432k.jpg'),(10363,'The Club','2008-02-20','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The Club is a new breed of third-person shooter, combining fast-paced run and gun gameplay, destructive environments, and lethal weapons. You will fight to survive in a shadowy underground blood-sport controlled by a faceless, obscenely wealthy and influential elite who place their bets on who will survive as the blood-bath ensues before them. Take control of up to eight uniquely trained killers motivated by greed, driven by pure insane bloodlust, and hell bent on earning respect on a global level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yp6.jpg'),(10364,'Hasbro Family Game Night: Battleship',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10365,'Viral Multiplayer',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10366,'Sub Command','2006-10-26','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take charge of the most deadly modern-day submarines in the world - three distinct submarines across two unique and challenging campaigns. Utilize cutting-edge sensor and weapon technology to locate, track and destroy the enemy - even deliver Tomahawk missiles to inland targets. Whether transiting, diving, or surfacing you control the smartest, stealthiest and most feared subs on the water today.\n\nThree submarines to command - Seawolf, 688(I) and Akula. Each contains authentic naval systems including Sonar, Radar and Target Motion Analysis. Test your skills while firing Tomahawk missiles, rescuing crippled subs, rising through the polar ice cap to communicate information and much more.\n\nEasy to use game interface - With straightforward controls and automated crewmen, controlling a submarine has never been easier.\n\nEnhanced sound and 3D graphics engine - 3D Objects (over 250), from Russian trawlers to France\'s Mirage fighters - plus exacting sound modes pull you in like never before. You won\'t just hear the torpedos, you will feel them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42jw.jpg'),(10367,'Black Diamond','2023-11-03','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Black Diamond is a set of 5 boom-compatible maps set in the cavernous void of the sea. Uncover a forgotten civilization on your quest for the Black Diamond, a mystical artifact said to let its bearer see beyond death.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bqw.jpg'),(10368,'Altwaldheim: Town in Turmoil','2020-08-14','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Be the mayor of this great old town! Construct buildings, recruit soldiers and send them to war. Will you be able to keep Altwaldheim safe?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3le4.jpg'),(10369,'Booger Booster','2013-07-14','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game created for the GBJAM (GameBoy Jam). Control a character that looks like a radio active booger and try to find the exit to the maze, to confront a boss and complete the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xxx.jpg'),(10370,'Vietnam \'65','2015-03-05','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','It is 1965 and the US ground war in Vietnam is in full swing. As a US Army commander, wage a counter-insurgency (COIN) war to secure the Ia Drang valley, on the border with Cambodia. Vietnam \'65 is a tun-based operational game that captures the true essence of the Vietnam War, where airmobile operations are paramount, fire support bases play a critical role and air strikes can save the day.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ooc.jpg'),(10371,'Night Detective: Decrepit Manor','2022-06-28','Puzzle','PlayStation 4','Night Detective: Decrepit Manor is a retro styled and retro inspired point-and-click adventure. Solve the mystery of the Decrepit Manor by following clues, examining objects, and finding new items to help you through the manor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yoh.jpg'),(10372,'The Sleeping Sickness','2024-05-07','Point-and-click, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Sleeping Sickness is an interactive short story that allows the player to guide the main character\'s actions.\n\nEach day, the player chooses where Grayson investigates. The player’s choices will lock and unlock future locations, change dialogue, and alter the story. Choices matter in The Sleeping Sickness.\n\nWhile The Sleeping Sickness includes sounds, graphics, and interactive sections, it focuses on the story.\n\nThe game is designed to play like a choose-your-own-adventure book and is an excellent choice for horror fans, avid readers, and lovers of creepy pastas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85yt.jpg'),(10373,'傻瓜式SGB粗陋心得','2021-07-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is an experimental RPG, which is used to test the author\'s mastery of the development tool smile game build (SGB) and experience steam\'s launch process. All materials come from the software itself and DLC, except two ending texts and a modified cover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gze.jpg'),(10374,'Oik 5: DLC',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','New levels and soundtrack file.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10375,'The Cenozoic Era','2023-01-20','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Cenozoic Era is a realistic animal survival game taking place during the rise of mammals, take control of a variety of animals and fight to survive among other players to reach the top of the food chain. Death, Destruction, Survival, Scavenge, Nature, Thrive, Conquer, Hunt. The Cenozoic Era','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61xu.jpg'),(10376,'Sexy Santa','2023-12-20','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sexy Santa is a visual novel exclusively for adults! This story is about a guy calling home a prostitute who was wearing a Santa suit. She saw his small cock, and refused to suck it! But our hero didn\'t let it go unpunished!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ggk.jpg'),(10377,'The Blocks Returneth','2020-08-16','Platform, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A loving tribute to the Blocks Cometh by Halfbot (2010).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84le.jpg'),(10378,'MX vs. ATV: Legends - Ultimate Edition','2024-05-21','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','The Ultimate Edition includes the full game, 9 DLCs with over 60 additional tracks plus the 2024 Vehicle Pass with over 30 original manufacturer vehicles!\n\nGet this ultimate bundle for a special price!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co887w.jpg'),(10379,'Stacky Dash: Complete Edition','2025-03-01','Puzzle, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10380,'Snooker Fever: Premium Edition','2025-02-28','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10381,'Please Duology','2021-10-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A compilation of two slow-paced, cosmic horror walking simulators, to be completed in under an hour. Please makes you maintain a power station and ignore the noises from the main engine, while Please Follow has you explore the trenches of a losing war, exposing your mind to visions of another world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kj4.jpg'),(10382,'Grill on Wheels','2023-10-28','Simulator, Indie','SteamVR, Oculus Rift, Oculus Quest','Grill on Wheels is an immersive VR cooking experience that takes you on a culinary road trip like no other. Buy your food truck, customize it with the equipment, go shopping, and start the day! The real chaos starts there . Prepare your ingredients during the prep time early in the morning and get ready for the rush hours!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d0q.jpg'),(10383,'Machinika: Atlas','2024-09-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Machinika: Atlas is an indie puzzle game and is the direct sequel to Machinika: Museum, you play as a museum researcher who just land on Atlas. Will you unravel the mysteries of the alien vessel? Solve cryptic puzzles to find out what happened!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y0v.jpg'),(10384,'Attack on IO','2021-02-04','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Attack on IO is a 7 map wad with themes of tech bases, castles and bloody unholy landscapes. It has you stationed on the moon of IO and has you being dragged through hell and back.\n\nThis wad features custom textures by Ukiro (Otex) and music by Jason \"Jay\" Reichard and Jimmy Paddock.\n\nAll levels have been designed with pistol start in mind, although you can also play continuously.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6so0.jpg'),(10385,'Windjammers 2','2022-01-20','Fighting, Sport, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Windjammers 2 will combine everything fans love about the classic title with entirely hand-drawn 2D animations to create the ultimate windjamming experience. The coming sequel will bring new stages and players, surprising and amazing new power moves and enhanced gameplay mechanics!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rvy.jpg'),(10386,'One Way to Die: Steam Edition','2015-09-01','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','After waking from a terrifying dream of your own untimely death, you attempt to make your way to the Finnigan Brothers\' Fun Park for its last day then back home again. It\'s like playing Russian roulette with five chambers loaded, but more frustrating.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jz0.jpg'),(10387,'Commander Keen in Keen Dreams: Definitive Edition','2020-08-27','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Commander Keen is back. In the modernised Definitive Edition of the lost episode \"Keen Dream\", Keen has to fend off a nasty nightmare about evil vegetables. The Definitive Edition features full widescreen support, twelve all-new levels - doubling the length over the 1990 original - and a full music score. The game structure has been reworked to make the game a more modern experience without sacrificing any of the original charm!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tpi.jpg'),(10388,'Frozenheim','2021-05-20','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Frozenheim is a serene Norse city builder with elaborate management gameplay and RTS tactical combat. Lead your Viking clan through hardships of the frozen north, season by season, year after year. Build and survive. Set sail, explore and conquer. Win Odin’s favor and secure your place in Valhalla!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30gx.jpg'),(10389,'Train of Afterlife','2015-01-13','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You are riding on a train without a name, memory, or your own body. Along with you are five other passengers who will share their thoughts and various tales of their past life before reaching their destination. One of them is clearly different from the rest, as he or she is closely tied to your past - a past that will greatly change your destination.\n\nAs you embark for the final stage of your life, what will you discover? What is waiting for you at the end of your journey?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6h3m.jpg'),(10390,'Class of Heroes 3: Remaster','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The classic, school-based 3D dungeon-crawling RPG is back! After a 15-year wait, the third installment in the series comes to the West, with new features, more characters, classes, and bigger dungeons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9559.jpg'),(10391,'Heroes of Three Kingdoms','2010-07-27','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A MMO from Perfect World Entertainment based on the Romance of Three Kingdoms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sew.jpg'),(10392,'Nancy Drew: Curse of Blackmoor Manor','2006-06-01','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','DVD Player, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nancy Drew: Curse of Blackmoor Manor is a first-person perspective, point-and-click adventure game. The player is Nancy Drew and has to solve a mystery. Explore rich environments for clues, interrogate suspects, and solve puzzles and mini-games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1t26.jpg'),(10393,'S.N.I.P.E.R.: Hunter Scope - Ultimate Edition','2024-01-05','Shooter, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Hunter Scope you will shoot, you will fight, and you will win!\n\nPlay S.N.I.P.E.R., the latest sniping game where you aim, fight and destroy virtual enemies. Try different types of missions, inspired both by classic rail shooters and modern cover shooters. Fight your way out during day and night, destroy evil forces and unlock new weapons and power-ups.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co844v.jpg'),(10394,'My Zombie Girlfriend','2019-10-15','Visual Novel','Android','After the death of your childhood friend, you\'ve been searching for a way to bring her back... Finally, you\'re able to summon her back from the dead with the help of the dark arts! But unfortunately, you seem to have resurrected her as a zombie! She\'s as happy as she could be that you\'ve brought her back to life, but it seems sometimes, she can\'t hold back her zombie cravings!\n\nThings get more complicated when another zombie girl that you accidentally brought back to life in the process gets involved. Will you be able to give your zombie girlfriend life as a real human being...? And how are you ever going to explain this to your caring friend?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co607g.jpg'),(10395,'Juno First','1983-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, DOS, MSX','Juno First is a shoot \'em up originally developed and published by Konami Corporation for Arcades. The game was later published by Mylstar Electronics (US arcades), Datasoft Inc. (Atari 8-bit, PC Booter, and Commodore 64), and Sony Computer Entertainment Japan (MSX).\n\nJuno First is a top down, vertical scrolling shooter in which there is a limited amount of time to defeat the enemies in each wave.\n\nThe players spaceship starts out with a laser that has a longer reach than the enemy weapons. The enemies start out firing a few bullets at the ship but the amount enemy fire rapidly increases as players progress through to the next waves.\n\nCertain enemies fire tracking missile-like projectiles that can shoot additional bullets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96ao.jpg'),(10396,'Disney Dreamlight Valley: The Remembering','2023-06-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In the biggest story update yet, uncover the mystery of the Forgetting in the Forgotten Lands Biome with help from a magical resident of the mysterious Pumpkin House. Journey through the Dreamscape—the dimension between Dreams and Reality—and experience epic story Quests alongside your Disney and Pixar friends in the Valley.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lch.jpg'),(10397,'The Lord of the Rings: Return to Moria - Ent-craft Pack','2025-03-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Grow new inspiration from the great tree-herders of Middle-earth with the Ent-craft Pack! Strap on an all new, quite Ent-ish cosmetic armor then dig into more ways to decorate your base.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kwb.jpg'),(10398,'Project Aura','2015-01-05','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Project Aura is a simulation/strategy videogame where you take control of a colony of climate disaster survivors.\n\nIn the near future, humans will face the drastic consequences of climate change. Forced to take refuge in vital reserves using cryo-preservation, they await a second chance.\n\nAt the end of the 21st century, humans, finally aware of the great climate disaster, dedicated their efforts not on preventing the inevitable crisis, but to ensure the survival of the species itself.\n\nIn this endeavor, they embarked on the construction of a network of cities on the sea, resistant to the hostile atmosphere.\n\nOvertaken by the events and extreme food shortage, they built ultra-secret shelters that would support them in hibernation, to be awakened in a more favorable situation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dxxm94ygfsqpw98xhcvn.jpg'),(10399,'Perfect World','2008-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Perfect World is a 3D MMORPG rooted in traditional Chinese culture and mythology. Set in the mythical realm of Pangu, it offers players an immersive adventure experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6i9g.jpg'),(10400,'Rottweiler','2024-10-29','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','an interactive essay on memes, labels, cauterization, and the decay beyond idealism.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9chk.jpg'),(10401,'The Sinister Fairground: Horror Adventure Gamebook','2014-05-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','iOS','This is a horrifying adventure through a fairground of weird characters, dangers, challenges and quizzes.\nThe Sinister Fairground is a mind-altering world where nightmares and reality change places at every turn, and nothing is as it seems. An evolution of classic choose-your-own-adventure game-books, this darkly enchanting story puts you in control, and takes you on a journey through twisted fairground attractions that you\'ll never forget!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10402,'Final Fantasy X/X-2 HD Remaster Twin Pack','2013-12-26','Sin género','PlayStation Vita','Final Fantasy X/X-2 HD Remaster Twin Pack is a bundle of the PS Vita games that were released separately in Japan. It includes everything from the single-version games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zt8.jpg'),(10403,'Comatose','2016-01-21','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Comatose is a single-map wad. Focusing on a gloomy atmosphere, players will explore a vast, ruined city full of invisible monsters.\n\nThe wad was a winner of 2016\'s Cacowards and placed 13th in Doomworld\'s 100 most memorable maps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87d4.jpg'),(10404,'Clue/Cluedo: The Classic Mystery Game','2018-05-17','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','CLUE/CLUEDO is the classic mystery game - a grand mansion … a dastardly murder … a gathering of suspicious characters. Now you can play the beloved Hasbro family board game on Steam!\n\nWHO, with WHAT weapon and WHERE?\n\nJoin Scarlett, Mustard, Peacock, Green, Orchid and Plum on a night of murder and mystery in Tudor Mansion. Roll the dice to move around the mansion and ask questions:\n\n“I suggest it was Miss Scarlett, with the Rope, in the Study!”\n\nFEATURES:\n\n- Single-player against customizable AI.\n- Online multiplayer for up to 6 players.\n- Private games against friends.\n- Cross-platform multiplayer - play against other sleuths on Steam, iOS or Android.\n- Compete against the world with weekly leaderboards.\n- Innovative logic-assisted virtual Clue Sheet that allows for advanced note-taking.\n- All new themes available for purchase that transform the board and characters. - - - - Take a trip to tinseltown with the Hollywood theme, or step on board the Murder Express!\n- More themes to come in regular updates!\n\nGet the official game now, and crack the case!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2959.jpg'),(10405,'Human: Fall Flat','2017-05-12','Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Human: Fall Flat is an open-ended physics based puzzle game in which you take control of builder Bob helping him resolve the mysteries behind his recurring dreams of falling. Your goal is to escape those dreams full of puzzles, dangers and surprises using everything you find in the levels. The world of Bob dreams is built on his daily experiences, hopes, fears and memories interweaved in a net so sticky and hard to escape. All this mess is actually a carefully crafted work of… wait! You are the one to find it out! Bob is a human. Just a human. No hero. Zero superpowers. Period.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ewt.jpg'),(10406,'Fleet Command','1991-05-28','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','International waterways become theatres of war when the world\'s most formidable maritime powers exchange their fatal blows. With entire fleets at your command, you must strategically deploy vessels from every class - frigate to aircraft to nuclear submarine - to maintain the precarious balance of naval power and gain position for the deadly endgame.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zqt.jpg'),(10407,'RC Revenge','2000-08-17','Racing','PlayStation','Players take control of a range of remote controlled cars and boats in an action packed racing game for the Sony PlayStation.\n\nBased around an enchanting movie Theme world, players take their cars through a number of genre styled levels, including horror, sci-fi and cartoons.\n\nMultiplayer split screen racing available in all modes of the game and a unique track editor allows you to create your own tracks to save on memory card and challenge your friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l40.jpg'),(10408,'Metaball','2024-03-07','Racing, Sport, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Join the ultimate sports league on Hoverboard! In this fast-paced, action-packed sports game based on Basketball, do impressive tricks and goals as you compete in thrilling PvP matches. Collect different currencies and Rank points to unlock equipment and items. Grab your Hoverboard and dominate the court!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sdp.jpg'),(10409,'Untouchable','2018-05-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Untouchable is a fantasy-themed adventure game, where players wander into a world of fantasy and begin an adventurous journey.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10410,'CountryBalls Heroes','2021-11-16','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','CountryBalls Heroes is a game where you get to play as your favorite Countryball. Become a legend by leading massive Countryball armies. Create your forces, build master-planned cities, gather powerful artifacts and prove that your Countryball is the most powerful.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xu3.jpg'),(10411,'Castlevania: Circle of the Moon','2021-09-24','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A port of Castlevania: Circle of the Moon included in \"Castlevania Advance Collection.\"\n\nIn Circle of the Moon, you can combine action and attribute cards to create over 80 unique spell effects, ranging from fire whips to ice blizzards, with the \"Dual Set-up System.\"\n\nNew Quality-of-Life features for this port are included, such as Rewind, Quick Save, and Record/Replay. The new Encyclopedia feature offers helpful information that helps you keep track of items, equipment, enemies, and the Dual Set-up System. With the new DSS Gadget option, you can get on-screen pop-ups that display the DSS Attribute & Action cards that are obtainable from the monsters you encounter in battle.\n\nThe story follows Nathan Graves, a vampire hunter apprentice who enters Dracula\'s Castle along with his Master in order to prevent the dreaded return of the Count.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lee.jpg'),(10412,'Raioh','2023-10-06','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Raioh is a retro style shot and bomb style vertical scroll shmup.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d64.jpg'),(10413,'Last Stand','2020-08-28','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','Web browser','A browser action RPG minigame where you have to survive as long as possible against a horde of angry ents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sed.jpg'),(10414,'Pirate Pop Plus','2016-10-20','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, New Nintendo 3DS, Nintendo Switch','Retro-style Arcade Action! Join Pete Jr on his quest to defeat the nefarious Bubble Pirate! Dodge and pop bubbles with your anchor and collect coins to customize your pocket game with new faceplates, buttons, backlights, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27nw.jpg'),(10415,'Laser Grid','2017-06-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Laser Grid is a first-person puzzle game in which you power devices by redirecting, combining and splitting different colored lasers. 32 mind bending puzzle rooms to master with 10+ hours of gameplay. Use a variety of different cube types such as glass, magnet, diffraction, laser, and Fresnel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bv0.jpg'),(10416,'Don\'t Toy With Me','2022-04-27','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','For a long time now, Dahlia has lived by herself in the Dollhouse with only the stuffed rabbit Wisker for company. One day the owner of the toys decides to present her with a new companion, a sad clown puppet named Huxley. She\'s delighted for the company but, as the owner soon realizes, it\'s not so simple to introduce a new friend to the household.\n\nWhat happens when you play favorites? Are you really in control of the Dollhouse? Or are the toys about to get out of hand','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uix.jpg'),(10417,'Radial','2020-02-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Radial is a 2D speedrun oriented platformer in which you will be able to use teleportation portals. Be ready to acrobatic moves, fights againts creatures, hidden challenges and race against the clock! Will you master the portals powers and take up the challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lxr.jpg'),(10418,'Star Wars: Secrets of the Empire','2017-12-16','Shooter','Arcade','Under the orders of the budding rebellion, your team will travel to the molten planet of Mustafar. Your mission is to recover Imperial intelligence vital to the rebellion’s survival. Alongside the pragmatic droid K-2S0, your team must navigate through an enemy facility walking into danger at every turn. Disguised as stormtroopers, grab your blaster, solve puzzles, and fight giant lava monsters in an effort to fulfill your team’s orders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29t6.jpg'),(10419,'Big Kids & Toddlers Educational Learning Games Collection Bundle 5-in-1',NULL,'Puzzle, Card & Board Game','Sin plataforma','Game collection with the TOP FIVE most popular McPeppergames educational games for children and toddlers! All games can be played without language skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5q2b.jpg'),(10420,'Digit Monster II',NULL,'Sin género','Family Computer','Digit Monster II, also known as Digi Monster II (also sometimes called \"Digimon\" when included in multicarts) is a hack of Urusei Yatsura: Lum\'s Wedding Bell. In some versions, the music is slowed down.\n\nThe title screen has a strange, demonic-looking unofficial art version of Veemon from the Digimon series, and has the title \"Digi Monster II\". It also has two shooting stars and two options below in a box; 1 Player and 2 Players.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10421,'The Bridge to Yesterday','2024-08-30','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into a beautifully crafted world, where you\'ll embark on an emotional journey filled with intrigue and danger. Explore the touching relationship of two sisters, their struggle for survival, and their unwavering determination in a world where the past crumbles and the future is uncertain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qk9.jpg'),(10422,'Football Manager 2015','2014-11-07','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Football Manager 2015 is the most realistic, in-depth and immersive simulation of football management available, putting you in the hot-seat of almost any club in more than 50 countries across the world, including all of Europe’s biggest leagues.\n\nFootball Manager will allow you to live the life of a real football manager – you decide who plays and who sits on the bench, you\'re in total control of tactics, team-talks, substitutions and pitch-side instructions as you follow the match live with the acclaimed 3D match engine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k6z.jpg'),(10423,'Treasure Master',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10424,'Omotesando Adventure',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10425,'Blaze and the Monster Hill Racing Machines 2018',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10426,'Das Stundenglas','1990-12-31','Adventure','Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','Upon jumping into a mysterious chest, you arrive in a beautiful fairy-tale world. Yet the serenity is spoiled: the enchanted hourglass that controls the flow of time is lost, and the world has been split into two realities. Both planes are the very same land, but certain buildings and people exist only in one of the two zones. On your quest to reclaim the missing artefact, you will have to travel between the two worlds and claim a magical coin from each of the twelve inhabitants; of course, all of them ask a little favor in return for their gift…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40db.jpg'),(10427,'Quest Rooms','2020-03-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You wake up in an obscure room, a voice in the TV says that it is just a quest where you have to find the way out. Brute force is not enough to survive to get out of the room you will have to be patient, use your brain and have grit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lxn.jpg'),(10428,'Bunnie Rabbot in Sonic the Hedgehog 2',NULL,'Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4r23.jpg'),(10429,'Roboden','2023-07-28','Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Roboden is an asymmetrical indirect control real-time strategy game about robot colonies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vxb.jpg'),(10430,'Spec Ops II: Operation Bravo','2000-12-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Previously a downloadable expansion for Spec Ops II: Green Berets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6afg.jpg'),(10431,'Tokyo Xanadu eX+','2024-07-25','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Tokyo Xanadu eX+; a massive action RPG from the masters of the genre, Nihon Falcom! When high school student Kou Tokisaka encounters the nightmare realm known as the Eclipse, his world is forever changed. In this definitive version of Tokyo Xanadu, experience the game in 60 FPS along with new scenarios, new playable characters, new modes and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h5q.jpg'),(10432,'Marooners: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10433,'Sledge 3D','1983-02-01','Simulator','Vectrex','A demo program for the 3-D Goggles. BaronVR described it like this : \"The effect is that of a track extending from the monitor surface to about 3 feet inside the monitor surface, the speed controlled by pushing up or down on the joystick...\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zft.jpg'),(10434,'Reversing Caste: Omegaverse','2020-06-15','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Set in a country where the usual Omegaverse roles are flipped…\nAn Alpha (α) and Omega (Ω) meet… but just how will their romance play out in this caste-restrictive society?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75oe.jpg'),(10435,'DCS World: F-5E Tiger II','2016-11-11','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The F-5E was developed by Northrop Corporation in early 1970s. The light tactical fighter is an upgraded version based on previous F-5A developments. The F-5s\' combat role encompasses air superiority, ground support, and ground attack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lte.jpg'),(10436,'Kill all Zombies',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10437,'The Rogue with Dead',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10438,'Folf',NULL,'Sport','Sin plataforma','Welcome to Folf!\nThis is where Football meets Golf.\nThe par 3 courses have been designed to challenge your putting skills. Shoot through portals and tight spaces to avoid the explosions and make the put.\nBe sure to pay attention to messages displayed on the levels, otherwise you may find yourself falling off the edge into the water!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10439,'Fortune\'s Run','2023-09-27','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a decaying industrial world left behind in humanity\'s never-ending race to conquer the stars. Beneath its iron skies, desperate souls kill and steal for passage to the still-plentiful frontier worlds. Sink or swim in this high-octane first-person shooter with stealth and RPG elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pnr.jpg'),(10440,'Stress Chess','2023-09-20','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"The real chess was the friends we made along the way.\" - Randy Mc\'Chess','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co788x.jpg'),(10441,'MotoGP 13 Compact','2013-12-18','Racing, Sport','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita','MotoGP13 Compact is the condensed version of a typical MotoGP game. The game doesn’t feature a career or a story and everything is available for you to use at the beginning of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co305w.jpg'),(10442,'Trainz Plus: Znamensk-Svir',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Znamensk-Svir: A fictional route, built on the motives of the North-West of Russia. The Znamensk-Svir section is a two-track electrified section of alternating current with a length of 70 kilometers.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10443,'HiPanda','2018-06-21','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Based on 3D and VR technology, we simulate and restore the panda\'s home scene, panda model, and panda\'s daily behavior, so that visitors can immerse themselves in the panda\'s life through VR, and watch the pandas close to the panda, interact with the pandas, feed and so on.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10444,'Dragon Ball Z: Kakarot + A New Power Awakens Set - Goku\'s Next Journey','2024-02-21','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zot.jpg'),(10445,'Necroball','2017-01-09','Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Control hordes of minions and lead them to victory in this fast-paced competitive sport amongst Necromancers! Select from a roster of all-star champions like the Necrocorgi and compete in intense local or online competitive play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fvmudr6zvfkssves0ov9.jpg'),(10446,'Crazy Chicken: Pirates','2015-01-08','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','A one-legged captain, a gunner, a cutlass-wielding chicken and a treasure hunter... the island is home to countless perils, hidden extras and mysteries. The lords of the island are by no means willing to surrender themselves and their treasure without a fight. Crazy Chicken Pirates 3D is a point & shoot action game where you take aim at birds as they scurry through the island and plunge bravely into the waves for a desperate counterattack. You only have 90 seconds to complete your raid by slaying pirates and collecting all hidden treasures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x62.jpg'),(10447,'Star Wars: The Empire Strikes Back','1993-03-12','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Game Boy, Nintendo Entertainment System','From Wikipedia: \"Star Wars: The Empire Strikes Back is a video game released for the Nintendo Entertainment System in 1992. It is the sequel the original Star Wars for the NES. This is the second of three video games released under the Empire Strikes Back title for home video game systems. It was preceded by a version for the Atari 2600 and succeeded by Super Star Wars: The Empire Strikes Back for the SNES.\n\nThe NES version was released the same year as JVC\'s Super Star Wars for the Super Nintendo Entertainment System. As Empire was released towards the end of the NES\'s lifecycle, a corresponding sequel to the film Return of the Jedi was never developed, nor released.\n\nA version of the game was released for the Game Boy. That product was reprinted and distributed by several publishers over the course of three years.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ow2.jpg'),(10448,'Marvel\'s Guardians of the Galaxy & Marvel\'s Avenger\'s: Deluxe Bundle','2022-05-10','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Marvel\'s Guardians of the Galaxy:\nYou are Star-Lord. The fate of the galaxy and the Guardians is in your hands. Time to show the universe what you\'re made of. You got this. Probably.\n\nItems included in the Deluxe Bundle:\n- Sun-Lord Outfit for Star-Lord (Early Unlock)\n- City-Lord Outfit for Star-Lord (Early Unlock)\n- Marvel\'s Guardians of the Galaxy: The Hits - Original Video Game Soundtrack (Digital Download)\n- Marvel\'s Guardians of the Galaxy: The Art of the Game Digital Mini Artbook (Digital Download)\n- Social-Lord Outfit for Star-Lord (Early Unlock)\n\nMarvel\'s Avengers:\nAssemble your team of Earth\'s Mightiest Heroes, embrace your powers, and live your Super Hero dreams.\n\nItems included in this Deluxe Bundle:\n-Black Widow - Marvel Studios\' Avengers: Endgame\n- Hawkeye - Marvel Studios\' Avengers: Endgame\n- Iron Man - Bleeding Edge\n- Hulk - Gladiator\n- Thor - Young Thor\n- Captain America - Ultimate Patriot\n- Ms. Marvel - Advanced\n- Kate Bishop - Hawking Bird','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5q7n.jpg'),(10449,'The Zombie\'s House','2018-10-27','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Large village-type of level; a valley with several buildings including a mill and basement/dungeon areas beneath.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lnk.jpg'),(10450,'Torchway',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A lamplighter\'s meditative adventure. Search for ancient artifacts, avoid traps and light lanterns! Without you, darkness will consume everyone!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46fo.jpg'),(10451,'US History: Western Settlement to Modern Day',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10452,'Record Shop Simulator','2024-08-07','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Record Shop Simulator! Design and run your dream record store, selling vinyl, gear, and more. Customize everything from decor to inventory, manage your store with care, fend off shoplifters, and tackle dynamic challenges. Can you build the ultimate music haven? Find out now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kk0.jpg'),(10453,'Viridescent Dragon: Halloween Special','2016-10-31','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s ALIVE!! This is the first Halloween Special for the Viridescent Dragon visual novel series! Join Charlotte, Seleste and Dawn as they try to throw a Halloween Party they\'ll never forget! \n \n \n(As this is a kinetic visual novel, it is straight-forward and you could just auto-play it like a movie if you\'d like. I am considering adding choices in any future chapters/stand-alone novels.) \n \nIf you haven\'t yet please check out Chapter 1 and Chapter 2! \n \nThis game is in 1920 x 1080 resolution, in window mode and full screen mode. \n \nCompatible with Windows, Linux and Mac \n \nMade with Ren\'py \n \nTime: Approximately 30 minutes \n \nCredits \n \nOriginal Story and Character Art by me, Kassidie Butler (Viridea) 2015-2016 \n \nMusic by Audionautix and Play on Loop \n \nSFX by Freesound.org \n \nBackgrounds from Pixabay \n \nBackgrounds edited with FotoSketcher \n \nand Clip Studio Paint \n \nThank you very much, and I hope you enjoy the game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/g7bqbvwxmls8zmldmv4e.jpg'),(10454,'The Dope Game','2016-05-30','Simulator, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','To escape the city of Starkham and start your new life, you get your friend Preston to set up a meeting with the local loanshark, Sweaty Mike. After foolishly borrowing $2,000 to start your fledgling drug dealing career, you embark on a timed mission to sell as many drugs as possible throughout the city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43qe.jpg'),(10455,'Two Point Campus: School Spirits','2023-03-15','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Tackle a paranormal pest problem, learn what it means to be dead, and help those looking for a new lease on the afterlife.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ok8.jpg'),(10456,'Apathy: Gakkou de Atta Kowai Hanashi - Kiwame','2019-04-28','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a \"schoolhouse horror story\" that happened in another world.\n\nHigh school students have gathered from all over the country to tell scary stories that happened at school. However, the gathering is led in an unexpected direction.\n\nThe largest text adventure horror in the Apathy series with over 400 branches with 147 endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61r2.jpg'),(10457,'Cult of Abaruth','2025-06-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Have you always felt that you were destined for great things? Have you dreamed of being the leader of a dark cult? Or maybe you just love Dark Fantasy with a touch of humor? Now you have the opportunity to test your skills! Take on the role of a cult leader and lead him to glory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97x8.jpg'),(10458,'Kamigami: Clash of the Gods','2022-07-24','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Easy to play, hard to master, join this adventure on an unique card game where you are able to do everything you ever wanted. Collect cards, build your decks, play offline on history mode, challenge your friends online or take on the world in a ranked system!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tcg.jpg'),(10459,'Dou','2021-07-26','Platform','Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k4e.jpg'),(10460,'Chainz Galaxy','2011-11-18','Puzzle, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo DS','Dive into 135 challenging levels and rattle the chains in 4 different game modes. Rack up your score with 8 exciting power-ups with enticing bonuses and 30 collectible charms. Link-matching madness just became even more challenging!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co769p.jpg'),(10461,'Under Night In-Bright II Sys:Celes - Deluxe Edition','2024-01-25','Fighting, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10462,'Trainz: A New Era - Route: Balezino Mosti','2016-10-13','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A route in the extent of 57 km between Balezino and Mosti, Russia. Beautifully detailed landscapes and an electrified railway connect these two cities.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10463,'Exciting Billiard','1987-07-26','Sport','Family Computer Disk System','Exciting Billiard is a Sports game, developed and published by Konami, which was released in Japan in 1987.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10464,'Edge: Mech-Ascent',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Welcome to the world of Edge: invaded. As an AFK Idle Strategy RPG, you could summon a mighty party of unique heroes from distinct races to build your fantasy dream team for winning the arena battles. Start thoroughly exploring the wonderland with your squad to save the world!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10465,'Pac-Man',NULL,'Arcade','Legacy Computer','NABU is an obscure computer system produced in 1983, most notable for featuring an early equivalent of internet connectivity. A port of Pac-Man (among numerous other games) is built-in to the computer itself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kuw.jpg'),(10466,'Ultra Street Fighter IV: Complete Shoryuken Pack 2011','2011-07-29','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','All alternate costumes for Ryu, Ken, Gouken, Dan and Akuma are included in this pack. Mix things up with your favorite Shotokan characters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7t7u.jpg'),(10467,'Valkyrie Elysium','2022-11-11','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','A young Valkyrie who is entrusted with the fate of the world by the All-Father, the highest of gods and ruler of all creation, will face various enemies on her quest and must utilize a variety of weapons, magic and the power of her allies to prevent Ragnarok - the destruction of the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k5c.jpg'),(10468,'Street Race Kings','2024-12-20','Racing, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are brought into a racing league, the SRK. Once you can qualify and prove yourself to the league, you then make your way to the top, racing against various competitors, and taking down stage bosses to move up in rank! Multiple vehicles, customization, open world maps, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ecg.jpg'),(10469,'Devast.io','2018-11-13','Shooter','Web browser','Browser-Based Multiplayer Survival Game\n\nSurvive the cold, the hunger, and the radiation in this post-apocalyptic world. Collect resources, craft a shelter and improve your equipment. Explore the abandoned houses and the city. Fight the ghouls and other players!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94e8.jpg'),(10470,'Shiki Oni no Koku: Chuugoku-hen - Dainishou','1992-08-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC-9800 Series','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co689x.jpg'),(10471,'TS Marketplace: GWR Churchward Panelled Toplights Pack 01 Add-On',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Churchward authorised the first toplight build in 1905, from 1907 they were built in large numbers. These two sets (57ft and 70ft) represent the earlier toplights with full panelling in the 1922 livery.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10472,'Edelweiss',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle','Sin plataforma','Calm puzzle-platformer','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10473,'Magna Carta: Tears of Blood - Deluxe Box Set','2005-12-15','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','An RPG that combines Western-styled history and graphic design with Japanese-styled RPG gameplay, from Korean developer Softmax (one of the first games for the launch of PS2 in Korea.) The sarcastic hero Calintz Jerevinan sets out for adventure after returning home ho his home land of Shudelmir and finds the place overrun with disaster. Along the way, he will meet the mysterious girl Adora, the frosty Princess Juclesia, and other characters in a gigantic game world powered by the ASURA engine. The game uses a FF-style Active Battle system, with Time Points for movement and attach manuever planning, and each character can use one of seven kinds of Carta for tremendous special techniques.\n\nBonus materials include a poster, a mini strategy guide and art book...Revenge is the only thing that can erase this hatred...In the land of Efferia, humans and native-Efferians uneasily co-exist in the throes of an endless war. A young man out for revenge against the natives finds a girl who\'s lost her memories...Where will destiny lead them...?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10474,'Uta no Prince-sama: All Star After Secret','2015-03-12','Music, Simulator, Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Sequel of Uta no Prince-sama All Star, with the follow-up plot, same characters, and new songs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pdh.jpg'),(10475,'Lumo\'s Cat','2015-09-30','Strategy, Indie','iOS','Take control of the bright and beautiful Star People to defend your cat against the hordes of nasty, noisy Mind Mice that are trying to wake your kitty from its sleep! Still with us? Lumo’s Cat has been described as a Tower Defence where you get to keep on moving the towers. We’d call it the best 2 minutes of fun you can have with a sleeping cat, a piece of cheese and a battery powered mobile device!\nCombine careful tactics with split second decisions!\nDress your cat in a bonnet!\nCreate your own personal Cosmic Cat blanket!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73ze.jpg'),(10476,'Six-Ear Macaque: Awakening','2025-03-24','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Six- Ear Macaque: Awakening is a casual role-playing game based on the Chinese classic novel Journey to the West. The protagonist is one of the Six- Ear Macaque, is one of the \"mixed four monkeys\", ability and Sun Wukong equal. In the game, you will explore the legendary path of your destiny.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kss.jpg'),(10477,'Spire Horizon: Companion Expansion','2023-07-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Traveling alone is not difficult at all, but with a companion to solve loneliness, it could be even better. Shared experiences and lasting memories make the journey more fulfilling. Solo travel offers freedom, while accompanied travel provides companionship.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10478,'Infinite Inside','2024-07-12','Puzzle, Adventure','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, visionOS, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3','Explore a serene and mysterious world, collect shards, solve intricate puzzles, and assemble keys to unlock the mysteries of a secret society.\n\nEscape into five enchanting labyrinths, each filled with secrets hidden in every corner that are key to unlocking the mystery hidden within the \'Plinth\'. Designed to fully utilise new mixed reality headsets to deliver an immersive VR and MR (Mixed Reality) gameplay.\n\nUse intuitive hand tracking to manipulate 3D geometric puzzles, build keys, and interact with the game world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ee7.jpg'),(10479,'Vegetable Valley Nightmare','2017-01-08','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','This hack only includes one level made up of all the Vegetable Valley levels with minor modifications and no collectable 1-Ups. (The 1-Ups are replaced with Tomatoes). The UFO secret was also removed.\n\nYou have no lives so when you die it’s game over and you have to start from the beginning.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10480,'Catgirl & Doggirl Cafe','2019-08-30','Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Reborn in a fantasy world you have chosen to open a Japanese-style family restaurant. Instead of buying ingredients, you spend your money rescuing 2 animal-eared girls from a disgusting slaver! Enjoy a heartwarming story of blossoming romance at the Catgirl & Doggirl Cafe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4pgp.jpg'),(10481,'You Are the Castle',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','An Xbox Live Indie Game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sk1qqvjtn3d17mkhvkrr.jpg'),(10482,'Make \'Em Pay',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Make them pay is a party game featuring different ways to have fun with your friends with one thing at hearth: Winning aint easy.\nAmongst a giant crowd or as a stealthy vampire. Who cares about friendship when you just can make em pay !','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10483,'The Cycle: Frontier - Vivid Party Style Pack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','An exciting bundle of Vivid weapons and \'goldies\' charms to bring your color and style down upon those dare to cross your path on Fortuna III. Plus, a bonus of 1000 Aurum!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bic.jpg'),(10484,'Visions of Mana: Digital Deluxe Edition','2024-08-29','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Explore a world of elemental spirits and adventure in the latest Mana action-RPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e4o.jpg'),(10485,'Dashbounce','2023-09-15','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dashbounce is a 2D Speedrunning Puzzle-Platformer about going fast and intentionally abusing physics quirks! Seek the goal in each level before the clock hits zero - but watch out, you can\'t jump! You\'ll have to use your surprising speed and bouncy body to turn every object and obstacle into an advantage!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72zk.jpg'),(10486,'Mini Sports','2023-12-08','Racing, Sport, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Mini Sports is an online game with various 1vs1 mini-games, including billiards, racing, badminton, curling, mini golf, and archery. Play against players from all over the world or invite your friends to compete against you and find out who\'s the better player.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hd8.jpg'),(10487,'Miraibo Go','2024-10-10','Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','The mobile monster-themed open world survival game! Get ready to tame various monsters with your friends and explore the world anytime anywhere! Hundreds of classic monsters await you in this exciting adventure!\nExplore the world, capture monsters, fight enemies, build a base, and establish a new monster utopia together! More ways to play are waiting for you to discover!\n\nTame Monsters Hundreds of monsters await you!\nMore than 100 classic monsters with different skills and elements will accompany you on your adventure! Worried about not being powerful enough? Defeat bosses to improve your team strength!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8td8.jpg'),(10488,'CJ Elephant Fugitive','1991-02-01','Platform','Sega Game Gear','Accused of a crime he did not commit - CJ Elephant is imprisoned in a Zoo. Using advanced peanut propelling weaponry, an uncanny ability to find explosive charges and a handy umbrella he promptly escapes. \n \nNow he must flee London, push on to Paris, across the Alps and career through Cairo until he finally makes it home to Africa.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b69.jpg'),(10489,'Downhill Jam',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Downhill hoverboarding tricks and grinding.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10490,'Shin Nippon Pro Wrestling \'95: Tokyo Dome Battle 7','1995-06-30','Sport','Super Famicom','New Japan Pro Wrestling returns to the Super Famicom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/t2w7pgogp251y7g8xbef.jpg'),(10491,'Beatmania 4thMix: The Beat Goes On','1999-04-26','Music','Arcade','beatmania 4thMIX is a rhythm game developed by Konami. It is the fourth numbered game in the beatmania series (but 5th beatmania arcade game) and is part of the BEMANI franchise.\n\nThe game is played with a controller with one turn table and 5 keys, three white and two black. On the screen you will see bars moving from the top to bottom in columns representing each of the keys and the turntable. When the bars reach the judgement line it is time to scratch.\n\nbeatmania 4thMIX is the first big redesign of the series, it features a brand new interface. Difficulty is now on a scale from 1 to 7. All songs have been given a single and double mode chart. Song list shows not only genre and title, but artist as well.\n\nAlthough all previous beatmania songs have been removed. a brand-new set of 23 songs was added as a replacement. It is the first time that licensed songs makes an appearance in the series, as well as crossovers from other BEMANI games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2c40.jpg'),(10492,'Jesus','1987-07-01','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC-8800 Series, Sharp X1, FM-7, MSX2','Jesus is a graphic adventure game developed and published by Enix.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ae1.jpg'),(10493,'Sam & Max: Save the World - Episode 1: Culture Shock','2006-10-17','Point-and-click, Adventure','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The former child stars of the Soda Poppers TV show are wreaking havoc all over the neighborhood! But this is no ordinary tale of child stars gone awry. There\'s a dark force behind the Poppers\' baffling antics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z2c.jpg'),(10494,'The Sinking City','2021-02-26','Shooter, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Sinking City is a game of investigation genre taking place in a fictional open world inspired by the works of H.P. Lovecraft.\nThe player incarnates a private investigator in 1920s, who finds himself in a city of New England, Oakmont Massachusetts. It\'s currently suffering from extensive waterflood, and its cause is clearly supernatural.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kpe.jpg'),(10495,'Ballpoint Universe: Infinite','2013-11-19','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Wii U','Ballpoint Universe Infinite is a shoot-em-up adventure game featuring artwork entirely drawn in ballpoint pen. Explore immaculate worlds, discover the secrets of the doodles, and customize your Ink-Ship for battle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45lk.jpg'),(10496,'Hannah','2024-10-31','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hannah is a puzzle platformer horror survival game. You play as Hannah, a teenager born in the 80s, who tries to understand her personality by taking an internal journey to her childhood and discovering what went wrong.\n\nYou will immerse yourself in the depths of this dreamlike reality in which Hannah will have to be cunning, to solve puzzles; use the elements at your disposal to create devices and vehicles and avoid dying on the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co900n.jpg'),(10497,'Sunes Sportlov','1997-01-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sune is love-stricken by his neighbours daughter Sophie, who is also vacationing at the same resort, but manages to antagonize her at the start of the story, so she makes up some difficult tasks for him to fulfill before accepting his invitations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wqm.jpg'),(10498,'Castle Woodwarf','2019-10-03','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cut the trees, catch some fish, upgrade your castle and environment. Guard the treasure from waves of enemies and lead your dwarves on their way to victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mxd.jpg'),(10499,'Breaking the Grip','2025-04-03','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Breaking the Grip is a multiplayer horror and strategy game. As a survivor, complete a ritual to eliminate the spirit before it drives you insane. As the spirit, spread terror and break their will. Who will prevail between life and the beyond?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nvg.jpg'),(10500,'Winter X-Games Snowboarding 2002','2002-03-01','Racing, Sport','Xbox, PlayStation 2','The most authentic snowboarding game returns! Winter X Games Snowboarding 2002 features more arcade fun and snowboarding action. Win a gold medal in on of four authentic Winter X Games events, or go anywhere in the free ride mode, where you can pull off big kickers and twisted rails to your heart\'s content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ol3gcjs230tcyldepmlr.jpg'),(10501,'Hex-a-Hop',NULL,'Puzzle','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hex-a-Hop is a hexagonal tile-based puzzle game with one simple goal: destroy all green tiles! There are infinite undos and no time limits -- you just have to find a way to destroy all the green tiles and step on a safe tile at the end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xjw.jpg'),(10502,'Treasure Fleet','2019-08-13','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Treasure Fleet is a 4X turn based strategy game set in the Age of Discovery. You start with a small ship with colonists on board, and set off to discover new lands, establish lucrative colonies, trade with the natives and fight the enemies of your country.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44wc.jpg'),(10503,'Westgrove','2022-10-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Westgrove is a game that focuses as much as possible on emulating the ps1 era gaming experience with horror elements and follows a found footage story style with inspiration from some 90\'s movies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67zl.jpg'),(10504,'Dresden Files Cooperative Card Game: Mouse & Variants','2017-10-31','Sin género','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Bring Harry\'s faithful companion Mouse (with a dash of Mister) into the game with this character deck packet. Also includes 2 variant cards for Harry\'s deck and 3 variant cards for Susan\'s deck to add a little variety to your play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72tg.jpg'),(10505,'Skibidi Toilet Battle','2025-04-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Battle between robot alliance and toilet monster army. Choose your favorite character to fight, silly characters and weird attacks will make a crazy match','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nvc.jpg'),(10506,'Great Old One - Arrival','2018-12-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"G.O.O ~ Arrival\" is an action role-playing game developed by two independent game enthusiasts. We are trying to create a game with a sense of battle that tells the story of the last guardian to save the world in crisis after the arrival of the great old one.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10507,'Mr. Prepper: Animal Farm','2024-04-17','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Take care of the animals, repair the farm’s facilities, learn fishing, explore the new areas, adopt a dog, get to the bottom of the Agency’s special interest in the farm and discover the mystery lurking from above! Use what you learn on the farm in your shelter and breed your own animals!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f2o.jpg'),(10508,'The Last of Them','2025-04-11','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You play as a detective solving gruesome murders in a haunting, desolate city. Explore dark alleys, uncover hidden clues, and solve puzzles to unravel the mystery. Can you find the killer before they strike again, or will you fall victim to the terror?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ntt.jpg'),(10509,'In Death','2018-11-27','Shooter, Indie','Oculus VR, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Created exclusively for VR, In Death is a Roguelite Shooter set in the godless afterlife. Battle through procedurally generated levels and dungeons in intense ranged combat, coupled with a unique locomotion system perfectly attuned to your fighting style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hkg.jpg'),(10510,'Drift: When Worlds Collide','2002-07-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the distant future, the Dorian Empire invades the Hen-Shodan Republic for their resources. The Hen-Shodan have hired the toughest and nastiest mercenary pilots around to face the Dor -- and you\'re one of them!\nChoose from five different strike fighters and face off against your enemies in 28 deadly missions\nRun reconnaissance, go on search & destroy flights, and get into serious combat with massive motherships\nSelect from 17 different weapons of mass-destruction, and 8 different shields for self-defense\nDynamic graphics bring space combat to life in this wild space opus!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75pb.jpg'),(10511,'Balloon Challenge','1993-12-31','Strategy','DOS','Players compete to send hot air balloons higher into the sky than the opponent in this turn-based tactics game.\n\nThis game is very similar to Boloball, another Soleau Software puzzle game. The objective of Balloon Challenge is to get your 25 colored balloons as high as you can on the game board. The higher the balloon goes, the higher the points awarded. The player with the highest score at the end of the game is the winner.\n\nThere are many items to help or hinder your balloon from traveling higher. Dark clouds stop your balloon from going any higher. Hurricanes move your balloon to a different hurricane on the board. Airplanes destroy your balloon. Directional clouds move the balloon in the direction the arrow is facing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zq3ez0ckwhjnrfo4y1xy.jpg'),(10512,'Saints Row: The Third Remastered','2020-05-22','Shooter, Racing, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Saints Row: The Third Remastered gives you control of the Saints at the height of their power, and you live the life to show for it. This is your City. These are your rules.\nRemastered with enhanced graphics, Steelport the original city of sin, has never looked so good as it drowns in sex, drugs and guns.\nYears after taking Stilwater for their own, the Third Street Saints have evolved from street gang to household brand name, with Saints sneakers, Saints energy drinks and Johnny Gat bobblehead dolls all available at a store near you. The Saints are kings of Stilwater, but their celebrity status has not gone unnoticed. The Syndicate, a legendary criminal fraternity with pawns in play all over the globe, has turned its eye on the Saints and demands tribute.\nRefusing to kneel to the Syndicate, you take the fight to Steelport, a once-proud metropolis reduced to a struggling city of sin under Syndicate control. Take a tank skydiving, call in a satellite-targeted airstrike on a Mexican wrestling gang, and fight against a highly-trained military force by your lonesome in the most outlandish gameplay scenarios ever seen.\nWeapons of Crass Destruction – It’s one thing to defeat your enemies. It’s another to humiliate them. Hover jets, human cannonball cars and outrageous melee weapons are all part of the fun.\nCrazy Character Customisation – Create the most outlandish characters ever seen, from washed-up celebrities to maskless ninja pirates. Inside every sinner, there is a Saint. Who will you become?\nOver The Top Co-op – Fly solo or play online with a homie. Give freefall skydiving a try, landing in your partner’s flaming pickup as you make a desperate run toward a heavily armed Syndicate base. Steelport is always more fun with a friend.\nAll DLC included – All three expansion mission packs and 30 pieces of DLC from the original version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22r7.jpg'),(10513,'Squishies','2020-01-24','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help stranded Squishies find their way back home in a fantastic miniature 3D universe! Squishies is a single player, puzzle platform experience, built exclusively for PlayStation VR. Solve puzzles and save Squishies, or be creative and build your own levels—then share them with the community!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1i95.jpg'),(10514,'Cyber OutRun','2019-08-15','Racing, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cyber ​​OutRun a pursuit racing game where the main goal is to reach the highest heat level and avoid getting arrested. Enjoy the experience of driving retro-futuristic visual atmosphere with Synthwave soundtrack!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o0g.jpg'),(10515,'Angler Dangler','1982-12-31','Sport, Arcade','Arcade','A fishing game from Data East. Position yourself to throw your hook to the best spots and reeling in your catch past hazardous rocks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hpm.jpg'),(10516,'Frisia',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','In Frisia you start on an uninhabited Northsea island and are tasked with building a picturesque and cozy village in harmony with the sea.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7iwj.jpg'),(10517,'The Infinity Road','2023-05-11','Racing, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','The Infinity Road is a classic-style game where you control a car, dodge traffic, and avoid crashing to chase the highest score. An endless runner where the road never ends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pyi.jpg'),(10518,'Cavern Crusader','1984-12-01','Sin género','Apple II','You are in a spaceship and are \"cleaning up\" a new planet we\'ve found so it\'s safe to colonize it. Your mission is to destroy all the crazy aliens flying around in the various underground caverns and when they\'re clear, move on to the next cavern. There are a few different aliens types in the new caverns, but the color of the caverns changes every level. This game is a crude clone of Konami\'s classic 1981 arcade hit, Scramble. You control your ship with the standard Apple II keys A, Z, arrows, spacebar.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89nl.jpg'),(10519,'TranscendPang','2010-03-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','TranscendPang is a freeware doujin shoot \'em up created by wosderge. The game\'s gameplay is mostly derived from the classic arcade game Buster Bros., also known as Pang, but with some key differences. Where Buster Bros. may be described as an action game, TranscendPang takes the basic \"Pang\" format and turns it into a frantic shoot \'em up experience. The soundtrack features several artists from the Japanese doujin and rhythm game scenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3btl.jpg'),(10520,'Beanrise','2024-11-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','First-person Action, Puzzle-Solving game. Unfold the Mysteries of two interconnected timelines. Discover the truth of the present within the past!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91or.jpg'),(10521,'Luthier',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Dive into dungeons, battle cursed souls, and craft powerful guitars in Luthier. Manage your guitar shop, upgrade your abilities, and become the ultimate guitar hero.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kpn.jpg'),(10522,'Friday Night Funkin\': Elements of Insanity','2022-03-10','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Elements of Insanity is an FNF mod based around the many Creepypastas and parodies of My Little Pony: Friendship is Magic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4om4.jpg'),(10523,'Beyond the Beyond','1995-11-03','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation','Beyond the Beyond gather warriors, mages, pirates and mystics. Observe as they transform into more powerful classes. Clerks evolve into high clerks monks into master monks and conjurers into mighty summers. Unravel complex secrets in two richly textured views, explore in lush top-down isometric view and battle savage enemies in full 360. Grow stronger and smarter, with each victory your swordsmanship increases in power and your magic will swell with potent energy. Use supreme magic to summon monsters, fatal storms to hurl tormentors into another dimension or drown them in a boiling sea of fire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oaj.jpg'),(10524,'High Velocity Bowling','2007-12-07','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3','High Velocity Bowling is a virtual bowling sports game available from the PlayStation Network, and available for download Via the PlayStation Store. The game was released December 6, 2007 for the PlayStation 3. The game was developed by SCE San Diego Studio\'s in-house studio, Team Ramrod, and published by Sony Computer Entertainment. The game was first announced at the SCEA\'s Gamers Day 2007 at their Santa Monica Studios. The European release date was originally scheduled for an April 2008 release, but this was then delayed until May because of the new and improved PlayStation Store, included in Firmware 2.3. The game was released in Europe on May 6, 2008. On September 21, 2010, an update made the game playable with the PlayStation Move controller.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99wh.jpg'),(10525,'Armored Battle Crew','2019-06-05','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Armored Battle Crew is a Tank and Crew Management Simulation game, where your skills as a Tank commander is tested. Customize your tank carefully and make strategic battle choices to achieve mission success! The fate of your crew lies in your hands!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pga.jpg'),(10526,'Mangaka Dream','2021-06-17','Adventure','Web browser','Mangaka Dream is a Yume Nikki fangame created for Dream Diary Jam 5.\n\nInstead of vast looping worlds typically seen in fangames, the dream world mainly comprises of maze rooms, with the goal being to get to reach a room with a treasure chest containing a key item. Once obtained, the player must wake up and repeat the process to obtain all the items and unlock the ending.\n\nYou play as an aspiring manga artist who is trying to finish a manga and get it published.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xkb.jpg'),(10527,'Dash','2025-04-22','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Race through a plethora of levels, customize your characters, and unlock new abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pze.jpg'),(10528,'Fruitgeddon','2025-04-07','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blast through hordes of adorable yet deadly mutant fruits in this intense space shooter with bullet hell action. Shoot, dodge, and survive unique boss battles that push your skills to the limit. Only the strongest will uncover the truth behind the chaos. Are you ready to save the universe?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nvi.jpg'),(10529,'Rabbitoad','2022-07-13','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A frog-like rabbit is the main character\'s high-difficulty 2D action In order to fulfill the wish that \"I will not be mistaken for a frog\" Aim for the place of the goddess.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wx9.jpg'),(10530,'Dungeon Dungeon!','2023-09-22','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dungeon Dungeon! is a turn-based RPG with roguelike elements and a loot system. Recruit companions, upgrade skills, collect loot and build up your team to conquer the dungeons!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gut.jpg'),(10531,'Kaboom Swing','2021-02-01','Platform','Web browser','Help a little bomb to catch the flag in this explosive golf course! Roll, explode, avoid spikes and destroy everything!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10532,'Spirits: Ciel Bleu','2017-07-07','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Willard Rouse is an ordinary 17-year high school student who is often by himself. By accident, he discovered that he is a spirit bearer, one who could summon and use the power of spirits. After getting kicked out of Rainvalley Academy, he transferred to Ficaso Academy. Much to his surprise, Willard found himself in the company of great friends at Ficaso which led him to think that he could finally enjoy his years in high school without being misunderstood. However, Ficaso Academy is not what it appears to be. Willard started to have suspicions when he learned that the school prohibits students to make contact with the outside world until they graduate. Eventually, Willard realized that all the students in Ficaso are spirit bearers but they are unable to summon their spirits due to spirit jammers strategically placed around the academy. What secrets lie beneath the walls of Ficaso Academy? What challenges await Willard and his friends in their quest to escape?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10533,'Hyper Bounce Blast','2016-05-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hyper Bounce Blast is a stomach-churning retro shooter blended with classic platforming action. Bounce, shoot and dodge to survive the ever-increasing enemy attack. Bring it on!\n\nUse the unique bounce multiplier system to maximise power-ups, build your hyper and survive the onslaught! Featuring a fantastic soundtrack produced by electronic musician Quantum Firefly.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98sv.jpg'),(10534,'SJ-19 Learns to Love!','2021-04-23','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','SJ-19 Learns to Love is a short metroidvania about a killer robot who learns to love~  Explore, defeat bosses, and gain the power of LOVE!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u48.jpg'),(10535,'Train Drive ATS','2012-02-28','Racing, Simulator, Arcade','iOS','Train Drive ATS enables players to drive a train following signals and based on precise physics calculation while other trains run simultaneously according to timetables. There are 37 sets of Tobu trains and 7 of others running on lines of some 50 kilometers. You are to drive precisely and safe. The ATS game replicates actual operations of switch rails, signals and crossing gates.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10536,'Ready 2 Rumble Boxing: Round 2','2000-10-23','Fighting, Sport','Dreamcast, PlayStation 2','Ready 2 Rumble Boxing: Round 2 is a boxing game for the Dreamcast, Nintendo 64, PlayStation, and PlayStation 2. It is also the sequel to Ready 2 Rumble Boxing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bpo.jpg'),(10537,'Who Shot James R. Burnside?','2023-12-06','Visual Novel','Web browser','Use your deductive skills to solve the mystery of who shot James R.Burnside!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88vc.jpg'),(10538,'GraFi Christmas','2019-11-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','GraFi Christmas - casual, colorful, minimalist, physical puzzle with traps, treadmills, portals, Christmas ornaments, snowflakes, snowman\'s and changing gravity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41f0.jpg'),(10539,'Eeriest Night','2023-07-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What if you walked into an abandoned building where mannequins tried to strangle you when you weren\'t looking at them?\n\nWelcome to The Psychological Horror Game of Mannequins in process: Eeriest Night.\n\nWill you discover the secrets of this place?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67fn.jpg'),(10540,'Bloom: Memories',NULL,'Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on an epic quest through the twisting halls of the Labyrinth to defeat the evil King Wego in this classic inspired top-down action adventure. Along the way discover new powers ....find old friends.... and overcome the impossible odds ahead of you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lff.jpg'),(10541,'Gardenia','2014-02-11','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A contemplative world-building game / toy. Take your time and tweak this or that little world.\n\nThe game is available in English and Brazilian Portuguese.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10542,'Arcade Archives: Tank Force','2023-01-19','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Tank Force is a 2D top down arcade game. It is a sequel to Battle City, with different graphic and various details, like bigger stages or new enemies. The player controls tank and must protect the base (with eagle). He must destroy all enemy tanks on screen. The tank cannot pass through water. All buildings are destroyable, but metal walls are invincible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61yv.jpg'),(10543,'Golden Axe','1989-12-23','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Linux, Wii, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Sega Genesis/Mega Drive port of Golden Axe has two additional modes, a training mode (Beginner) and an enemy Battle mode (Duel).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cv3.jpg'),(10544,'Oven Dodgers','2023-12-01','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Oven Dodgers is a third-person low poly arcade platformer inspired by historic testimonies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kn4.jpg'),(10545,'Witchy Business','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Manage your very own Witchcraft Shop. This is a job simulator game where you brew potions for your customers, collect oddities, grow flowers in your garden, upgrade your alchemy station, and thrive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nhi.jpg'),(10546,'Major Stryker','1993-01-15','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','In the not-so-distant future, the calamity of World War III led to eventual world peace. But, it didn\'t last. Earth was invaded by alien marauders - the Kretons. Earth\'s united military force, still depleted after the mighty onslaught of WWIII, was not nearly sufficient to repel the numerous Kreton attacks.\n\nIt was discovered that the Kretons had used a wormhole to invade our region of space from their home worlds. And with that knowledge Earth called into action Major Harrison Stryker, hero of WWIII, to travel back through the wormhole and destroy the Kreton\'s home world headquarters.\n\nWith almost no chance of success, you accept the mission...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wnq.jpg'),(10547,'Bustafellows','2021-07-30','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A new visual novel from the legendary eXtend! Mixing romance with murders and dangerous ikemen, BUSTAFELLOWS is a steamy noir mystery that will make you shiver but ask for more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h51.jpg'),(10548,'Disciples II: Gallean\'s Return','2006-07-06','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Disciples II: Gallean\'s Return is a compilation edition that includes the base game, Disciples II: Dark Prophecy, plus the two standalone expansions Disciples II: Guardians of the Light and Disciples II: Servants of the Dark.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3onb.jpg'),(10549,'Skillwood','2024-01-18','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Skillwood is a survival simulator highlighting resource foraging. Chop trees, mine stones, and skillfully level up your abilities to upgrade buildings with the gathered resources. Go through the continous progression by unlocking more areas and buildings','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7os7.jpg'),(10550,'Zeus vs Monsters: Math Game for Kids','2016-02-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Zeus vs. Monsters is a math game for kids with mixed mathematical operations - addition, subtraction, multiplication & division. With 50 levels and 10 bosses to defeat, this is a real math adventure. Introduce yourself to great fun and Greek mythology – play Zeus vs. Monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l1i.jpg'),(10551,'Automobilista 2: Supercars Pack Pt1',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Sport','Sin plataforma','Supercars Pt1 brings road legal performance for Automobilista 2, with the Corvette C8 Z06, the Mclaren Senna and the Brabham BT62.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10552,'Empress of the Deep: The Darkest Secret','2010-02-21','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Anna wakes up in a vast and mysterious undersea temple with amnesia. By unlocking the enchanted Imperial Relics she must rediscover her own lost identity and the forbidden secrets of Dark Empress before it’s too late.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8696.jpg'),(10553,'Arcade Archives: Heroic Episode','2018-02-22','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Heroic Episode is a shooting game released by Irem in 1986. The people of Mule are facing destruction at the hands of the Gasp Empire. Enjoy the colorful stages and unique enemies as you battle along and aim for a high score. Control a heroic soldier on the ground and in the air as they battle their way to retrieve the stolen goddess statue. Utilize their maser with its normal shots and power-up shots to wage this battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4e1m.jpg'),(10554,'Dragon\'s Rock','2006-12-14','Platform','Game Boy Advance','Twins Julia and Julius are about to take their great dragon test! They can expect lots of tasks and adventures along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84pz.jpg'),(10555,'Adlib',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10556,'ISS: International Superstar Soccer','2000-08-03','Sport','PlayStation, PlayStation 2','International Superstar Soccer (abbreviated as ISS) is a football video game in the International Superstar Soccer series by Konami.\n\nPlayers can train and edit their teams, and they can change the formations and tactics before the match. During the match, they can adjust camera angles, make substitutions and tactical changes, adjust the game speed, and so on. The main game element is controlling the players, making searching passes, and scoring goals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u7x.jpg'),(10557,'Unknown Pharaoh','2017-01-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unknown Pharaoh will immerse you in an incredible adventure. \nYou will take on the role of an archaeologist exploring an ancient Egyptian pyramid. \nDecipher genuine ancient Egyptian hieroglyphs. \nDiscover ancient Egyptian artifacts. \nWatch out for traps. \nThis game uses arm swings locomotion. \nThis game takes approximately 50 to 60 minutes to complete.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10558,'Shock Troops','2022-07-28','Shooter','Meta Quest 2','The Shock Troops are sent anywhere in the Galaxy where a problem needs to be solved with extreme prejudice.\nPlayers will shoot their way through an epic interstellar adventure and uncover a dark conspiracy to end mankind.\n\nInspired by classics such as Doom and Quake, Shock Troops visual features include pixel-art textures and a mix of 3D environments and 2D sprites, seamlessly blending classic style with modern lighting.\n\nShock Troops gameplay aims at preserving the high-octane physicality of the classic shooters. Players will dodge incoming projectiles while responding in kind with a varied arsenal with various effects, at range, or in melee, with some impressive weapons or special powers.\n\nYou will be fighting your way through derelict space stations, frozen colonies, mining asteroids, large military spaceships, and lush alien planets. Each of these worlds will feature large “open” areas, set-pieces and theater of epic firefights.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51y7.jpg'),(10559,'Lucido Cancels Everything',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','LUCIDO Cancels Everything, the newschool Arcade Beat \'Em Up. With cute w**d smoking angels. Help to free Cyberphonk City of the evil cultists! 100% fact checked and Illuminati approved. ルーチードー','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80w1.jpg'),(10560,'Quit Today','2024-04-02','Fighting, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Quit Today\" is a side-scrolling action game around the workplace theme.\n\nOne usual day, when you step into the company, all the colleagues attack you because they think you want to resign!\n\nTo figure out what happened, you start a fighting trip with your briefcase, and realize the company darkness which you ever ignored is so hateful. You can\'t keep enduring the high-level\'s behavior, determined to send the resignation challenge to this company formally!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4u0c.jpg'),(10561,'Battle Run','2022-02-23','Racing','Android, iOS','Ready, set, RUN! Welcome to Battle Run! The adrenaline-pumping party racing game loved by millions of fans is back!\n\nFrom the studio behind Tap Titans 2 and the popular Beat The Boss franchise, comes the return of long-awaited and fan-favourite real-time running multiplayer game - Battle Run!\n\nEscape wicked rockets, evade spinning axes, and navigate past sneaky hazards - it\'s the ultimate race to the finish line!\n\nParty up and play with your friends in an action-packed race and charge into first place! Become a racing legend as you outrun your opponents and compete in real-time multiplayer battles!\n\nWith runner’s like Ryder and his volcanic rain, Dust’s high-speed skateboard, and Macie’s explosive leap, it’s an attack blitz waiting to happen!\n\nRevamped with all-new Runners, explosive items, and racing across vibrant worlds, this is Battle Run like never before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cuy.jpg'),(10562,'Taechoe Sineun Goyangiyeotda: Bangchihyeong RPG Kiugi',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10563,'Kaitei Taisensou!! Treasure World','2000-08-11','Sin género','Game Boy Color','An adventure game where you travel around the world to find your friends and legendary treasures. You can enjoy the real thrill of the eternal theme \"Treasure Hunt\" that everyone is interested in. In order to break the seal of the ancient civilization, the main character becomes a treasure hunter looking for the ancient civilization that has sunk to the seabed due to crustal movement, and with the hint of the treasure called Great Treasure that sleeps in the seas around the world, the legendary treasure World Treasure Go on a voyage to look for it. Make full use of various items such as a variety of mini games and submarines to raise treasure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kyo.jpg'),(10564,'BeyBlade: Let It Rip!','2003-01-05','Sin género','PlayStation','Similar to games featuring robots, monsters, or fighters battling for supremacy, Beyblade pits spinning tops, known as bei-goma, against one another in Tournament and Free Battle modes. In the former, players earn ten Bey Points (used to buy parts) and five Experience Points (used to level up) for each victory, but only five and three points respectively for a loss. Tournaments consist of seven rounds, including a semi-final and final round, with the ultimate winner being named champion and earning one of 30 Beyblade parts, while the vanquished receive 20 Bey Points as a consolation prize. \n \nIn Free Battle mode, players choose to battle with one of eight Beybladers from the television series. Two players can compete against each other, assuming one has data saved on a PS memory card. Three complete Beyblades can be saved at any given time, with customization of names, gender, and parts (exchange or buy). Beyblades consist of five main parts and a launcher, including a bit chip, attack ring, weight disk, spin gear, and blade base, and players can carry up to nine spare parts for repair or customization. \n \nBattles require four points to win and features include special launches, shifting paths (based on the spinning top\'s parameters), special attacks, gimmicks (special powers inherent in some parts), and growth (to a maximum level of 19). Rewards are given for moving up levels, such as increases to endurance, mobility, attack power, and so forth. Throughout the battles, DJ Jazzman provides play-by-play in the Beystadium, Kenny offers help in customization, and Mr. Tate manages the parts shop.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dmkw824karpnkni7e1fr.jpg'),(10565,'Rymdkapsel','2014-01-30','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Vita','Rymdkapsel is a slow, meditiative strategy game set in space. It builds upon the legacy of Martins earlier games by requiring minimal user input, but that doesn\'t make you a passenger. It\'s rather the opposite as you are tasked with the higher level problem of building the best possible station and ordering your minions around.\n\nThe game originally launched on the Vita in early May 2013, and later had a wider release on iOS and Android in August.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ysa.jpg'),(10566,'My Universe: My Baby Dragon',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Raise baby dragons and teach them their elemental magic! Our little friends need you to help them spread their wings! From their hatching stage to the moment they’ll be able to fly on their own, take care of your baby Dragons and help them enter the marvelous Dragons’ school! Fly off for an enchanting adventure full of magic and become the best Dragonward of all time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s2m.jpg'),(10567,'Transport Tycoon','2013-12-31','Simulator','Android, iOS','Transport Tycoon is a business management simulation game where you can start your own transport company. Players use engineering and business skills to move precious cargo and thousands of passengers in order to make a profit. It\'s a first-class ticket to countless hours of rewarding and absorbing entertainment!\nTransport Tycoon for mobile devices is a revitalized version of the original PC game, while still containing everything that made it a world-famous classic. You\'ll experience bigger, richer worlds, deeper and more addictive simulation, and the largest variety of land, sea and air vehicles ever assembled.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/d3guslzuqv4j3xff1o4d.jpg'),(10568,'QB Planets','2021-07-12','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Get your spaceship and embark on an amazing astral adventure of engaging puzzles into the final frontier. Overcome challenges and earn rewards that will let you discover more incredible puzzle planets in the farthest reaches of outer space.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31q5.jpg'),(10569,'Aquarist Simulator VR','2022-12-09','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get the best aquarium store in town! Create, renew, manage, observe. See if you can create an aquarium empire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gjt.jpg'),(10570,'House of Rules','2021-09-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Congratulations! You\'re hired as a new waterer in Black Kiwa. Water the plants, and we\'ll pay you 30 G per hour. You\'ll never find any other job this generous. No, we\'re not hiding anything from you. If you just follow the work rules and stay out of trouble, everything will be fine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5efg.jpg'),(10571,'Pebble Jame','2023-10-22','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A merging puzzle game inspired by a certain game with watermelons. Merge pebbles together in multiple different game modes and see how high of a score you can get!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7adl.jpg'),(10572,'Hatsune Miku Logic Paint','2020-03-05','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Hatsune Miku puzzle game is here! Includes difficulty levels from LV1 to LV3 and special stages! When you clear the stage, you will get illustrations of Hatsune Miku!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vex.jpg'),(10573,'Trainz Railroad Simulator 2022: Coal Country',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Welcome to Coal Country! Take a trip through the heart of the Appalachian coal fields. This fictional route is complete with a brand new Railroad, locomotives, rolling stock, and scenery items.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10574,'Gate Keepers','1998-12-16','Sin género','PlayStation','An RPG based upon the anime / manga series of the same name.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ij0lvkucdur7ynfy3ich.jpg'),(10575,'Pro Evolution Soccer 2012','2011-09-27','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Pro Evolution Soccer 2012 (abbreviated to PES 2012 and known officially as World Soccer: Winning Eleven 2012 in Asia) is a video game which is the eleventh edition in the Pro Evolution Soccer series developed and published by Konami (and MicroByte in Argentina) with production assistance from the Blue Sky Team. Lionel Messi, who has been the cover star for the series since PES 2009, was replaced by PES 2008 cover star Cristiano Ronaldo, while Shinji Kagawa replaces Messi as the cover star for the Japanese version. The US and Latin American cover features Santos player Neymar and Cristiano Ronaldo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k5h.jpg'),(10576,'Koihime Musou: Doki Otome Darake no Sangokushi Engi',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Timeslip!? Kazuto went out to catch a thief that had broken into the local Chinese history museum late one night. But after a sudden confrontation with the thief, he finds himself absorbed in a white light only to awaken in a wasteland. What\'s happened!? He is surrounded by three bandits. They try and steal his school uniform, but when he refuses to let them take it they attack. Just when he thinks he is about to be killed, a girl appears in front of him. She attacks the bandits with a spear of some kind and forces them to flee. \"My name is Kan\'u, My Lord. As the Messenger from Heaven please stand with me to help bring peace to this country at war.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10577,'Grid Run','2014-01-25','Indie, Arcade','Android','Grid Run is an \"old school\" arcade - action style game. \n \nRules are simple, Dodge grids, don\'t fall, don\'t get squeezed between incoming blocks! \n \nChallenging game physics. \nShow of your skills and match yourself with the best gamers out there! \nChallenging endless Jump and Run Game with limitless levels. \nOh and a word on security, we are 100% secure! \nTap screen to fly higher. \n \nNavigate with tapping your finger on the screen, and avoid incoming evil grids. Also avoid falling down or touching death zone behind you. \n \nEach evil grid block (blue color) has a critical flaw. There is a gap between them. You can run through that gap. Just tap your screen and you will jump. Grids move faster than you, but you can use their speed as an advantage. Timing is the key. You will be able to pass even two block with just one tap when you master the game. \n \nIt is really fun and easy to play, but be warned, Grid Run is hard to master! \n \nEnjoy :)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xdc.jpg'),(10578,'Clannad','2015-11-23','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','From the world renowned visual novel studio Key, the highly rated story of CLANNAD is now available on Steam! Improved visuals, achievement integration, and Dangopedia make this the best version of CLANNAD to date.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yvd.jpg'),(10579,'Kiniro no Corda 2f Encore','2009-08-20','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Kiniro no Corda 2 f Encore is the PSP port of Kiniro no Corda 2 encore. It offers the original game with distinctive alterations. This version of encore was the main Corda IP for celebrating Neoromance\'s fifteenth anniversary.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gkn.jpg'),(10580,'Inazuma Eleven SD','2020-01-03','Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Strategy','Android, iOS','Inazuma Eleven SD is a mobile ohajiki-based online battle football game that is originated from the Ianzuma Eleven series. It allows players to collect and form a team of toy figure characters from the series to join the “Super Dimensional Toy Soccer” games. Players will be able to pass and shot the ball simply by flicking the characters. The ultimate skills of the characters also follows the settings of the original works. The game features a “Story Mode” with an original story where you can clear maps to obtain new figures and unlock new maps, as well as a “Stadium Battle Mode” where you can battle against players across Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1sq1.jpg'),(10581,'Juken Jigoku','2020-01-16','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Juken Jigoku is a Japanese themed horror game inspired by the fears, anxiety and doubts that students have to go through during their school life and the exams time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wgt.jpg'),(10582,'The Amazing World of Gumball: Fellowship of the Things','2014-05-19','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the Fellowship of the Things game, The Wattersons have to battle some ghosts and monsters in a chase after their stolen belongings. While Tobias was teaching Gumball some fighting moves, the phone rang. A scary voice lets the Wattersons know that their missing stuff is in the cemetery. They have to take their electronics back before their mother arrives home! Can you give them a hand?\n\nYour role is to help Gumball and Darwin defeat the enemies that took their stolen objects and restore them to their place. You will be given clues on what you should do. All you need to do is make sure to follow the instructions carefully. Are you ready for a spooky adventure with the Wattersons?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gzg.jpg'),(10583,'Sealand Survivor','2025-03-05','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive on Sealand, a mysterious WWII island defense base. Face extreme weather, solve puzzles, and fight off hostile forces trying to stop you. Can you uncover its secrets and escape before time runs out?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kjm.jpg'),(10584,'Dragon Quest Monsters: Terry\'s Wonderland Retro',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s7h.jpg'),(10585,'Unstrong Legacy','2022-02-07','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Face these daddy issues and watch your world burn. No more running! As your precious base crashes to the ground, you can\'t help but wonder, \'WHY!\', \'What went wrong this time?\', and \'Where did all my cool stuff go?!\' But don\'t worry, you\'ll find out soon enough. You can\'t run forever. Unstrong Legacy is a colorful retro-style pixel Metroidvania platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ejq.jpg'),(10586,'Dungeon And Darkness','2024-09-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Create your own avatar and live as an adventurer in the town of \"Elbern,\" surrounded by dungeons. Delve into the dungeons and collect weapons and equipment with random effects. The goal is to conquer the final dungeon, the \"Great Hole of Elbern.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fm6.jpg'),(10587,'Skyraid','2022-09-07','Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Indie, Arcade, MOBA','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Squad up with your friends in this 6 vs 6 game of aerial conquest! Pilot cute parodies of iconic war planes ranging from early props to modern multirole jets. Become the top dog leveraging a huge array of equipment to tip the scales in your favor and rule the skies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qqx.jpg'),(10588,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles II: Splinter Speaks','1990-12-31','Arcade','Handheld Electronic LCD','A port for LCD handheld devices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w2u.jpg'),(10589,'Torikago no Mariage ~Hatsukoi no Tsubasa~','2016-11-24','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','Torikago no Marriage: Hatsukoi no Tsubasa is an otome game, developed by Kalmia8 and published by dramatic create, which was released in Japan in 2016.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sif.jpg'),(10590,'WWE 2K24: Nightmare Family Pack','2024-04-08','Fighting, Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Nightmare Family Pack features ‘76 Dusty Rhodes, ‘Superstar\' Billy Graham, and Stardust, with an exclusive MyFACTION Mattel ‘Defining Moments\' Bruised Cody Rhodes action figure with Gold MyFACTION card, ‘76 Rhodes MyFACTION card, and Pharaoh Manager card.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co861i.jpg'),(10591,'Large',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Large is a survival and exploration game set in a post-apocalyptic world generated procedurally, immersed in fog. \n \nIt will be a first person game, in which you will have to explore large mechanical structures, being able to move through them in the fog with a flying vehicle. \n \nI\'m developing the game in unreal engine 4. It\'s still at an early stage of development, so I\'m updating information on Twitter every week. If you like it, don\'t hesitate to follow it! ^^','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hp9.jpg'),(10592,'Pro Show Jumping','2024-02-22','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience the world of professional show jumping with this simulation-based game! Ride realistic courses with a variety of horses, train your eye for distances, design your own courses and share them with friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hrz.jpg'),(10593,'Crystal Castles','1986-12-31','Puzzle, Arcade','Arcade, BBC Microcomputer System, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), Acorn Electron, Apple II, Xbox 360, Amstrad CPC','Crystal Castles is an arcade game released by Atari, Inc. in 1983. The player controls a cartoon bear by the name of Bentley Bear, who has to collect gems located throughout trimetric-projected rendered castles while avoiding enemies out to get him as well as the gems.\nCrystal Castles is notable for being one of the first arcade action games with an actual ending, whereas most games of the time either continued indefinitely, ended in what was termed a \"kill screen\" or simply just restarted from the first level, and to contain advance warp zones.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co673c.jpg'),(10594,'Evolve Hunters Quest','2015-01-29','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Evolve: Hunters Quest is a match 3 puzzle combat game based on the “Best of Show” E3 award winner, Evolve. Use match 3 tokens of the same color to unleash devastating attacks on your enemies, and fill up energy bars to activate hunters’ special abilities. Earn Mastery Points to rank up your character in both the mobile and console games. Explore the planet of Shear in search of new wildlife and monsters. Discover and complete your collection of exotic wildlife in the Bestiary, and earn unique art for the Evolve console game. Enhance your Evolve skills by watching your multiplayer match replays from a strategic top-down view, and devouring intel in the Game Changer. Evolve: Hunters Quest lets you continue your Evolve experience from anywhere!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hgthhuvxxo5kzzzr5krt.jpg'),(10595,'Felbound','2025-12-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Felbound is a challenging and ruthless roguelike game. Embark on a journey into a mysterious dungeon, facing off against orcs and goblins with a plethora of weapons spells and items!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8alh.jpg'),(10596,'Pokémon Infinity','2020-05-02','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You wake up in the middle of a forest with no recollection of who you are.\nWith the help of a local professor and his assistant,\nyou are thrust into an adventure around a mysterious island in hopes of regaining your memory.\nFun times and tough challenges await!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90d2.jpg'),(10597,'Starpoint Gemini 3','2019-09-05','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Get ready for an open-world space action single-player RPG. Enter the cockpit of wisecracking, hero Captain Jonathan Bold as he travels the vast universe of Starpoint Gemini 3.\n\nEngage in action-packed space battles, visit amazing worlds and encounter interesting characters to find the answers you seek. For the first time in the franchise, Starpoint Gemini 3 brings animated 3D, NPCs that you can interact with, and this time your path leads beyond Gemini as you get to explore two new planetary systems.\n\nYou are not alone on your journey. You have ADAH, a digital consciousness that runs your ship\'s computer and can download itself onto your drone, which you can then control in ADAH’s role to accomplish off-ship tasks you could never do alone.\n\nBuckle your seatbelts and prepare to immerse yourself in a world of space adventurer. Visit various venues, from pubs with shady clientele, to high-tech facilities and glitzy, noisy nightclubs, pick your targets and choose your allies. Your journey is about to begin.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co421o.jpg'),(10598,'Rule the Waves II','2017-05-17','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rule the Waves II is the sequel to our successful game of ship design and naval battles, Rule the Waves. Whereas Rule the Waves ended by 1925, Rule The Waves II covers the entire time period from 1900 to 1955, including aricraft and aircraft carriers. Ownership of Rule the Waves is not required to be able to play Rule the Waves II. Rule the Waves II places you in the role of \'Grand Admiral\' of a navy during the first half of the 20th Century. The game is centered on designing ships and fighting naval battles, but politics, economic and foreign policy decisions will be necessary as the Player guides their navy\'s deployment, construction and operations during a period of great technological innovation and political tensions. Rule the Waves is modeled on the period up to the end of the second world war, but is not intended to precisely recreate history. Rather RTW2 gives the Player the tools to lead a navy during the era when \'steam and iron\' dominated the high seas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zu5.jpg'),(10599,'Dark Side of the Moon: A Sci-Fi Adventure','1998-11-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dark Side of the Moon follows the story of Jake Wright, who inherits the mineral rights to the planet Luna Crysta after his uncle dies suspiciously.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ebjq8z5uo6iz9p3ysnik.jpg'),(10600,'Fart Game','2024-10-12','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this hilarious and challenging game, it\'s all about holding in your fart until the perfect moment! Time and manage your farts wisely, because the more you let slip, the more aware your colleagues become.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90ri.jpg'),(10601,'Warframe: Sisters of Parvos Waverider Pack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10602,'Penlight','2019-06-10','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','With the end of his high school career approaching, Kyou Koyama is a friendless and troubled young man. However, having recently taken an interest in hypnosis, he supposes he can salvage his relationships with his classmates using the power of suggestion. With the help of a modified penlight of his own design, he sets out the change his world, one class rep at a time...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fs6.jpg'),(10603,'Howard the Duck: Adventure on Volcano Island','1987-12-31','Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Apple II, Amstrad CPC, MSX','Howard the Duck: Adventure on Volcano Island is a game that is a tie-in to the film Howard the Duck from the same year.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tsklvttzus2y4zxcowb0.jpg'),(10604,'Usotsuki Game','2018-03-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Legacy Mobile Device','When the protagonist wakes up, he finds himself locked up with several men and women he doesn\'t know... At that moment, an announcement sounds \"come on, let the liar game begin!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vosbksip9n7i8apzttpe.jpg'),(10605,'Draft Day Sports: Pro Football 2024','2023-10-16','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Draft Day Sports: Pro Football 2024 puts you in the role of general manager of your favorite football team. Every decision can be made by you from drafting, trading, signing free agents right down to creating and calling your own plays to lead your team to championship glory and becoming a dynasty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76iw.jpg'),(10606,'TurboGrafx-16 Mini','2020-05-22','Sin género','Plug & Play','The TurboGrafx-16 Mini, also known as the PC Engine CoreGrafx Mini in Europe, is a dedicated home video game console by Konami modeled on NEC\'s TurboGrafx-16, which was designed by Hudson Soft, a video game developer which Konami acquired in 2012. The Mini emulates the original console\'s 8-bit hardware.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tur.jpg'),(10607,'Cave Confectioner','2021-01-12','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Turn cavemen into consumers with the discovery that shaped an age -- sugar. Farm crops, discover new recipes, and sell baked goods in this back-to-the-land agricultural business simulation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ok0.jpg'),(10608,'Satomi Hakkenden','1989-02-20','Role-playing (RPG)','Family Computer','A Famicom RPG based on a famous Japanese novel series of the same name. It was developed by Alpha Denshi and published by SNK.\n\nSatomi Hakkenden (usually translated as \"The Eight Dog Chronicles\") was a long-running 19th century novel series about eight samurais from the Sengoku period and their various adventures. It was in some ways partly inspired by the ancient Chinese epic The Water Margin, which has itself seen video game adaptations in the form of the Suikoden games. Receiving numerous TV and film adaptations, including the 1983 film known in the west as Legend of the Eight Samurai, Satomi Hakkenden would be its first video game adaptation. Makai Hakkenden Shada for the Turbografx-16, also released in 1989, would be a later adaptation.\n\nThe game itself plays much like Dragon Quest; a common source of inspiration for 8-bit RPGs. The player can walk around towns conversing with NPCs, equipping themselves with weapons and armor and receiving quests and directions to new areas before leaving the safety of the town to fight random encounters on the overworld map that links locations together. Combat follows the tactical turn-based pattern, allowing the player input their characters\' desired actions before watching each turn play out. Most of the enemies in the game are based on classical Japanese monsters, usually youkai.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ugy7tuucqnl7wkzmidrs.jpg'),(10609,'Megablast','1989-11-01','Shooter','Arcade','Megablast (メガブラスト) is a 1989 Horizontal scrolling shooter arcade game released by Taito in Europe and Japan. One or two players could control space fighters assigned to deal with an alien invasion using incredible firepower through eight stages. The game is somewhat parodical as many of the game’s mini-bosses resemble previous Taito game characters and the ending theme consists of a Beethoven song. \n \nIn the future, Earth has achieved a state of global peace, but one problem has arisen: a wholesale disappearance of young women. A top-secret planetary protection organization investigates the strange disappearances and discovers that the women are being abducted by aliens. The aliens hail from the planet Zancs, where a rampant disease has sterilized the entire female population. Unable to mate with their own kind, the people of Zancs have found the perfect reproductive substitutes in the women of Earth, abducting them to keep the planetary population steady. \n \nTwo fighter pilots - Downson and Bogey - are ordered to rescue the women of Earth, including one of the pilot\'s significant others, by flying to Zancs and eliminating any threats the inhabitants pose.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lihvsop1hqzdmwzj9h1c.jpg'),(10610,'Fighting Mad Lads','2022-01-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fighting Mad Lads is a fast-paced party game, for two to four local players set in “Neo-City” where the rules are changing each round. It’s time to party & to fight ! Challenge your friends through 5 mini-games and become the new King of the streets (and the master of the couch).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59or.jpg'),(10611,'Shooting Beena Toy Story 3: Woody to Buzz no Daibouken!','2010-08-06','Sin género','Advanced Pico Beena','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10612,'Nixy The Glade Sprite','2018-05-17','Platform','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum','A platformer for the ZX Spectrum. The first game in Bubblesoft Games\'s Nixy series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nap.jpg'),(10613,'4Story Online','2008-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','4Story Online is a free-to-play, full 3D MMORPG proudly designed to invite players to take on the large scale warfare (RvR) and enormous quests. Exploring the ancient world of Iberia, players are provided with diverse game contents starting from PvP, RvR, Instant dungeons, Siege war, Boss monster raids, Diverse unique items, Smooth interface, Fabulous Rides, Character customizing, Item enchantment, and much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rrlpibmf0dvq73eyjy3u.jpg'),(10614,'Jane’s Hotel: New story - Collector’s Edition',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Sin plataforma','The long-awaited reboot of Jane’s Hotel is here. Jane is ready to start new hotels. Start with a small hotel and go further. Three fully upgradable hotels are awaiting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e4u.jpg'),(10615,'Timeless Valley','2021-06-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Timeless Valley is a short walk simulator in which you take control of a humble worker whose job is the retrieval of items that are long gone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gob.jpg'),(10616,'Minigames Mayhem','2024-08-23','Platform, Racing, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Minigames Mayhem is a fun collection of minigames, that can bring joy for players not only in single-player but also with friends in your living room or across vast distances. Try to beat the high scores, compete with others, and bring mayhem on other players in many simple but fun games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8q2d.jpg'),(10617,'King of Crowns Chess Online','2018-03-27','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','King of Crowns Chess Online can be played through any web browser, PC, phone, tablet or Smart TV. A one time payment is required for a lifetime access. NO monthly fees or hidden costs. No banner advertisements, bots or pay to win schemes, just chess.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co266j.jpg'),(10618,'Erayu','2016-02-05','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Players control Josh, a video gamer who has been thrust into a fantasy world after attempting to play a game titled \"Erayu.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/j7fmbhgirhwjddv5mlsh.jpg'),(10619,'Puzzle Bowling',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Puzzle Bowling - is a minimalistic puzzle game.Just figures and a task to be solved. Nothing extra.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y4p.jpg'),(10620,'The Piano Player','2018-03-30','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An insecure musician meets a girl with a strange name. His life is never the same.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10621,'Juan Sin Miedo','2023-01-09','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The devil arrives on earth on the night of the Day of the Dead and kidnaps the beloved princess Fifi, and it\'s up to the cowardly peasant Juan to save the princess and put an end to the Devil\'s evil. Overcome 7 levels full of monsters, obstacles, and traps that will try to stop Juan in his tracks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zwe.jpg'),(10622,'Disposition','2022-04-11','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Race along a coastline as strange hostile entities chase you down. Try to reach your destination as fast as you can but don\'t lose control. Disposition is an attempt to combine racing with horror elements.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10623,'Love In Drawing','2019-01-08','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Reflect and draw! Love In Drawing is a game that aims to make you reflect to solve levels where you need to gather red and blue balls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45gw.jpg'),(10624,'Light: Die to Survive','2024-08-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Explore a haunted house, shadowy forests, and ominous roads with a flashlight in \"Light - Die to Survive,\" a spine-chilling horror game. Solve random, terrifying paranormal mysteries in a night-shrouded environment. Experience dynamic horror, immersive sound effects, and mystery solving. Can you escape the darkness?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8n5q.jpg'),(10625,'Tangram Attack','2014-07-31','Puzzle, Strategy','Nintendo 3DS','Tangram Attack is a fast-paced slicing game with fiendish puzzles to test your mental agility.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/esogegbho2qmofw7podc.jpg'),(10626,'Sonic the Hedgehog: The Lost Worlds','2009-08-26','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sonic The Hedgehog: The Lost Worlds is a hack of Sonic the Hedgehog 2 by ExecByte. This hack features all of the zones that were cut from Sonic 2 during development. Some zones have been ported from the Sonic 2 Simon Wai prototype and then finished up, and some have been created based on magazine pictures and information from interviews with people who worked on Sonic 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qjc.jpg'),(10627,'The Communist Dogifesto','2018-01-31','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Communist Dogifesto is a science fiction first person shooter set on a Soviet space station in lunar orbit, which has been taken over by hyper-intelligent dogs.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10628,'Pinball FX: The Machine - Bride of Pin Bot️','2023-02-16','Simulator, Pinball','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Here comes the Bride! Awaken the Machine by activating her vocal circuits and eyes. Or go even further and bring her to life! A legendary table from the PIN-BOT trilogy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66ma.jpg'),(10629,'Beat Stickman: Beyond','2022-07-21','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','A well-crafted narrative-driven idle clicker game with stunning and chaotic graphics. Nebody will be your friend on the journey to provide help and stories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zss.jpg'),(10630,'Fallout 76: Skyline Valley - Lost Treasures Bundle','2024-06-12','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Uncover items from Vault 63 with the Lost Treasures Bundle. Fallout 76 base game required, sold separately.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ep5.jpg'),(10631,'Chornobyl Liquidators - Supporter Pack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10632,'Cadence of Hyrule: Crypt of the NecroDancer Featuring the Legend of Zelda - Melody Pack','2020-08-26','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Listen to even more remixed versions of classic Legend of Zelda series tunes as you move to the beat with the Melody Pack DLC. A total of 39 additional tunes from 3 different artists are included!\n\nWith the Melody Pack you can designate which character and area will feature certain songs from both the original soundtrack and new remixes. Play through this rhythmic adventure to the beat of your own drum!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63ot.jpg'),(10633,'Par for the Dungeon','2023-10-17','Puzzle, Sport, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Putt, explode and fight with everything from grapple hooks to laser beams and conquer over 100 increasingly puzzling levels!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co749r.jpg'),(10634,'Daisenryaku Portable','2005-12-22','Strategy','PlayStation Portable','Daisenryaku Portable is a military turn-based strategy game for the PlayStation Portable published by Genki.\n\nThe game takes place on a battlefield of hexagons, upon which the player assembles an army. The aim is to capture cities and factories, in order to increase available resources. The hexagons are rendered in an isometric view with no rotation supported, but the individual attacks are rendered in 3D. The game supports use of the ad hoc wireless mode of the PlayStation Portable for two player multiplayer. The main campaign takes place in the Far East in the twenty-first century. The factions in the game are fictional versions of Japan, USA, Russia, China, South Korea, and North Korea.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ohn.jpg'),(10635,'LEGO Star Wars: The Skywalker Saga - Obi-Wan Kenobi Character Pack','2022-11-15','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Jedi Master Obi-Wan Kenobi has made himself quite a reputation with the Galactic Empire. Play as LEGO characters from the Obi-Wan Kenobi series.\n\nCharacters Include:\nReva (Third Sister)\nDarth Vader (Kenobi)\nFifth Brother\nGrand Inquisitor\nBen Kenobi','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5set.jpg'),(10636,'American Truck Simulator: Volvo VNL','2023-05-25','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Reliability, performance, and absolute driver satisfaction. This is why the Volvo VNL is an embodiment of excellence in the trucking world, and we are excited to let you know that brand new models have arrived in American Truck Simulator as a free update!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tim.jpg'),(10637,'Velocity Ultra','2013-07-02','Shooter, Puzzle, Indie','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','Velocity Ultra is an award-winning top down shooter that puts you in control of the galaxy’s only Quarp Jet, an advanced spacecraft with the ability to teleport at will. Tasked with rescuing survivors from a collapsed black hole, you’ll need to use both firepower and quick-wits to catapult the Quarp Jet through 50 levels of sci-fi action.\n\nFeaturing explosive visual effects, an anime-inspired art style and an exhilarating electronic soundtrack, Velocity Ultra combines the speed, ferocity and challenge of classical arcade shooters while introducing a whole new layer of complexity to the genre with unique puzzle mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rk9.jpg'),(10638,'DreamWorks Super Star Kartz','2011-12-15','Racing','PlayStation 3, Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Xbox 360','In the game, players race as their favorite DreamWorks Animation characters as they speed, jump, power-up and boost through wacky, wild and wondrous kart courses and compete to be the first to cross the finish line. Amazing stunts, awesome tricks and unique weaponry lets players outrace and outwit their opponents all while enjoying hilarious commentary by King Julien, the game’s announcer. Racers can put the pedal to the metal with multiple game modes including Battle, Circuit and Time Trial. Friends are invited to compete with up to 4 player split screen capabilities on consoles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ref.jpg'),(10639,'My Black Cat','2005-02-25','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A mysterious black cat who can speak the language of humans. The lone girl he met one day. “I\'m Aki Fujita. From now on I\'m your master!” With his newly-bestowed name “Don-kichi”, from that day forth the pair began their life together. The master, strong-willed but with an easily wounded heart. The black cat, who strove to protect her from sorrow. The black cat, whose every thought was of his master. The black cat, who would always be at her side.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95wk.jpg'),(10640,'Fashion Designer: Style Icon',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co314i.jpg'),(10641,'Super Ocho Bros.','2023-11-09','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Super Ocho Bros. is a level hack for Super Mario Bros. 3 developed and released by Hansel2066 in November 2023.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cno.jpg'),(10642,'Super Depressed Bro...','2022-02-06','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Super Depressed Bro is, as the title suggests, a game about depression. There are 8 levels that can be played in any order, but none of them have victory conditions. In other words, there is no way to beat anything. Each level has an item that you can collect, but the items are best thought of as souvenirs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pkj.jpg'),(10643,'Super Calm Bros. 3','2019-05-04','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Super Calm Bros is a light kaizo hack that was inspired by Kamikaze Bros and Riff Bros. The difficulty is geared towards a wide audience and should appeal to both kaizo experts and players looking to level up their skills. The hack features Costumes, Gimmicks, P Speed and Platforming.\n\nThere are 6 mandatory worlds with two bonus exits in the final world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54s5.jpg'),(10644,'Xiao Xiao No. 9: Fight Man','2002-10-10','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Web browser','Xiao Xiao 9 is part of the Xiao Xiao Flash series. It is a short beat \'em up in the vein of Final Fight, where a black stickman must traverse the animator\'s desk, beating up purple stickmen along the way. The hero has several attacks available: a regular punch or kick, a flying kick, a throw, and a roundhouse kick which knocks down all nearby enemies but costs a part of the hero\'s life bar. After making it through several fights, the hero climbs on top of the artist\'s computer to confront the final boss who has multiple health bars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4am8.jpg'),(10645,'Captain Morgane and the Golden Turtle','2012-03-16','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo DS','Captain Morgane and the Golden Turtle is a pirate themed adventure game about a girl who goes on a quest to find the legendary \"Golden Turtle\". Make decisions, but remember - your actions have direct consequences for those depending on you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ibp.jpg'),(10646,'Remnant: From the Ashes','2023-03-21','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The world is in ruins. Only a remnant of mankind remains, hunted to near extinction by horrors from another world. As one of the few survivors left, you will venture into portals to fantastic realms to gather the resources and firepower needed to fight back and retake what was lost.\n\nRemnant: From the Ashes is a third-person survival-action game set in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by mythical creatures. The game provides players and up to three of their friends with a unique, customizable gameplay experience filled with intense shooting and melee combat, gear and weapon crafting, character progression and dynamically-generated levels that offer an infinite number of ways to explore and take on deadly monsters and epic bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m4w.jpg'),(10647,'Kaizo Mario Bros. 3','2015-07-04','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Kaizo Mario Bros. 3 is a kaizo ROM hack of Super Mario Bros. 3 created by Hunter W.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o14.jpg'),(10648,'Forget','2024-08-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immerse yourself in a living nightmare where every dark corner of the apartment hides terrifying secrets. Wake up without memories, Pursued by an enigmatic presence, and discover the truth about a missing child. Reality or illusion? It\'s up to you to unravel the inexplicable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8q73.jpg'),(10649,'80\'s BASIC Games','2024-08-06','Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX','These are C64 BASIC games the developer wrote as a teenager in the 1980\'s. They\'re slow, glitchy, and barely playable.\n\nBOUNCY BALL\n\"My first attempt at what could be called a game. Uses joystick in port 2. Try to place blocks in the ball\'s path to score points.\"\n\nLOST MAZE\n\"Text adventure/maze game. Complete.\"\n\nAMAZING MAZE\n\"Graphical maze game, player controls animated sprite character. Uses joystick in port 2. Mostly complete.\"\n\nCHOPPER RAID\n\"Unfinished horizontally scrolling shooter, similar to Activision\'s Chopper Attack.\"\n\nD&D\n\"Simple dungeon crawler, uses custom characters. Uses joystick in port 2. Load & run \"D&D\", then follow the prompts. Complete.\"\n\nDEFLECTION\n\"Breakout-style game. Uses joystick in port 2. Complete.\"\n\nPLANET DEFENDER\n\"Invaders from space are attacking the planet. If they blast a hole in the ground, patch it by moving your ship over the hole. Uses joystick in port 2. Complete.\"','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10650,'Aurora Nights','2016-05-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aurora Nights is an entertaining educational game for learning to identify the constellations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2phl.jpg'),(10651,'Super Mario Bros. 3: A New Journey','2016-11-25','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','With 8 newly themed worlds to explore, Super Mario Bros 3: A New Journey sticks with the original SMB3 format while using new graphics, custom over-world music and new levels to continue Mario and Luigi’s adventure beyond the original 8 worlds. Some tweaked sprites are also present. The difficulty is meant for semi-experienced players looking for new challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5q3n.jpg'),(10652,'Sumikko Gurashi: Sumikko Catch',NULL,'Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10653,'Dead by Daylight: Dungeons & Dragons Edition','2024-06-20','Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','New to The Fog? Check out Dead by Daylight: Dungeons & Dragons Edition, which includes the base game, the Dungeons and Dragons Chapter, and 2 Dungeons & Dragons Outfits: Baermar\'s Roadside Ambush and Vecna\'s Whispered One.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cb8.jpg'),(10654,'The Pub Life Simulator','2025-05-01','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Open your own pub with The Pub Life Simulator, serve food and drinks to keep your customers happy. Enjoy this exciting simulation experience solo or with friends. Unlock higher-quality products, expand your pub, and build the best business in town!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dtb.jpg'),(10655,'Immortal Mantis: Revenge','2024-02-11','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Know two sides of the same story while solving riddles, committing crimes and trying to survive the serial killer. On one side, a murderer with a mysterious objective, on the other, a detective with a sense of injustice who seeks to arrest him. Not necessary to know the story of the first game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c7t.jpg'),(10656,'Zombie\'s Retreat',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zombie\'s Retreat is an action RPG involving a young man and his camping retreat. What\'s intended to be a bonding experience turns horribly wrong when a sudden evil outbreak spreads across the camp. With very \'strange\' circumstances surrounding this new found threat, it is up to the player to save any and all survivors while attempting to escape in one piece!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d9p.jpg'),(10657,'Mario Adventure III','2023-12-12','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','A mod of Super Mario Bros. 3, sequel to Mario Adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oo6.jpg'),(10658,'Call of Duty: Black Ops','2010-11-09','Shooter','Nintendo DS','The Nintendo DS version of Call of Duty: Black Ops has many new features like the Perks system for the six player online multiplayer. The player can tap an icon to switch the current weapon for a new one, like past DS games, or drag the weapon into an inactive button to add to their inventory without replacing the weapon they are using currently. An auto lock-on feature is available to use in the Recruit and Regular difficulties.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2adk.jpg'),(10659,'Royal Flush: Princess Sidestory','2013-10-28','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','A short romhack of SMB3 where you play as Peach','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vvt.jpg'),(10660,'Sumikko Gurashi: Sumikko Smartphone',NULL,'Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10661,'Sumikko Gurashi: Sumikko Water',NULL,'Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Get Sumikko in the water! Let\'s play by switching between two modes, land mode and water mode. You can even use water to take care of them! Get to know Sumikko by taking care of him and playing mini-games.\n\nWhen you turn the device upside down, you can see the \"water\" in the screen! Water\" will come out in the screen! Switch between land mode and water mode.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10662,'Super Orb Bros.','2020-09-02','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Super Orb Bros. is a hack for Super Mario Bros. 3 featuring all new shell mechanics, a slow fall/regrab, on/off blocks, checkpoints, and a ton of other custom tech.\n\nThe townsfolk speak of an Old Man Grimm who seems to have turned to the darker forces….should you accept their appeal for help?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o5t.jpg'),(10663,'Alien Market Simulator','2025-05-25','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Run a market on your space station. Restore and upgrade the station, expand your services, and sell to a variety of alien customers. Experience the challenge of managing a business in space and growing your market','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9has.jpg'),(10664,'Castlevania: Maria of Sorrow','2022-04-18','Platform, Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Castlevania: Aria of Sorrow mod that replaces Soma with Maria Renard, with many other changes to go with it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97l9.jpg'),(10665,'Bunhouse','2021-10-19','Simulator, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Bunhouse is a cute, simple, bunny-filled game focused on growing plants and managing a greenhouse with fellow buns. Take care of your leafy plant buddies by balancing the amount of water and light they get. Play with friends and upgrade your greenhouse for wholesome, relaxing fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mn5.jpg'),(10666,'Crash Team Racing Nitro-Fueled: Neon Circus Grand Prix','2019-11-08','Racing, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94nd.jpg'),(10667,'Dying Light 2: Stay Human - Bloody Ties','2022-11-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Tempted by riches, fame, and status, Aiden enters a bloodsport tournament where the greatest combatants fight to the death. Face off against the worst of the worst, make new allies, climb up the ladder, and claim the title of the ultimate victor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wqj.jpg'),(10668,'Skateboarding: Breakthrough Gaming Arcade','2021-06-27','Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Do your best and skate to get a high score in this 2D side scrolling skateboarding game from Breakthrough Gaming! As a skater, you\'ll need to perform tricks in the skate park to score points! So what will the score be for your run this time?\n\nThe lesson for this game is: God wants us to enjoy this life He\'s given us and to have fun doing the right thing! Skateboarding in real life and in a video game can be lots of fun, so that\'s a way you can enjoy the life God has given you! So live for God and don\'t forget to have fun! Check out Psalm Chapter 118 in the Bible to read more about this!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uju.jpg'),(10669,'Super Sheffy Bros. 3','2018-06-20','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Super Sheffy Bros. 3 is a kaizo SMB3 romhack.\n\nThis hack will challenge the player in doing various techniques like shell jumping, and various abuse with the power up items in Super Mario Bros. 3. This hack features a total of 16 levels with an optional path you can choose after beating the first fort. Good Luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6owq.jpg'),(10670,'Super Mario Bros. 3: The Lost Levels','2005-12-06','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Super Mario Bros. 3: The Lost Levels is a rom hack that implements all of the unused levels in Super Mario Bros. 3 into the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67ht.jpg'),(10671,'Crusader Kings II: The Old Gods','2013-05-28','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Europe is in turmoil. The land has been fragmented into petty fiefdoms. The Emperor is struggling with the Pope. The Holy Father declares that all who go to liberate the Holy Land will be freed of their sins.\n\nNow Is the Time For Greatness…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yww.jpg'),(10672,'Journey From Darkness: Strider Returns','1993-09-01','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Sega Game Gear, Sega Master System/Mark III','Journey from Darkness: Strider Returns, known as Strider II in Europe, is a port of Tiertex\'s Strider II for the 16-bit Sega Mega Drive/Genesis console, and the most well-known of the Returns ports. Unlike other versions, this port presents several changes when compared to the original game, a result of having been adapted following closely the Mega Drive port of Strider. Despite this, the game is still plagued by shoddy programming and uninspired gameplay, product of the higher-ups being only interested in getting the game \"written and out as fast as possible\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fd1.jpg'),(10673,'Divination','2025-01-09','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Divination is a desktop-based divination tool that uses the sixty-four hexagrams from the I Ching to interpret the good or bad fortune of future events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n37.jpg'),(10674,'Tophet','2025-03-03','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive the hunt—find the item and use it before the monsters catch you. Search the darkness, uncover secrets, and face the terrifying truth. 4-player co-op with proximity chat—stick together or be lost to the lurking terror. Your friends are your only lifeline. Will you survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kjp.jpg'),(10675,'Hacker Evolution Duality: Hardcore Package Part 1',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Ready for some more hardcore action in Hacker Evolution Duality? The Hardcore Package 1 DLC for Hacker Evolution Duality brings you 2 new levels designed for gamers who like a challenge that is harder than the original game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10676,'Hatsune Miku: Project Diva F 2nd','2014-11-18','Music','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita','Hatsune Miku: Project DIVA F 2nd is a rhythm game, and is the direct sequel to Hatsune Miku: Project DIVA F. The game is set to have a similar play style to its predecessor whilst featuring new songs, returning songs from previous games, and character modules. New in-game mechanisms original to the game include sliding touchscreen notes, and double scratch notes. The DIVA room also features various minigames that can be played, including a clapping game. Another new addition to Project DIVA F 2nd over the previous game is the ability to change skins for the rhythm game mode, where decorative skin designs can be downloaded as DLC. The game features cross-save support between PS Vita and PS3 systems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wew.jpg'),(10677,'Prodigy',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10678,'A320 Airbus Vol. 2','1995-12-31','Simulator','Amiga','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10679,'Slender Man Origins','2014-02-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Android, iOS','Slender Man Origins - Immerse yourself into the thick atmosphere of mystery and horror! Follow the Slender Man’s trail, become a witness to his horrific deeds and save the children from their inevitable doom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9867.jpg'),(10680,'Uboat Mechanic Simulator',NULL,'Puzzle, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The new kind of mechanic is in the town - if you\'ve ever dreamt about repairing big large underwater boats this is the place just for you! Check the damage, repair and fix the boats and make sure they\'re ready to be manned.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co403d.jpg'),(10681,'Axe Party VR','2023-11-30','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','VR Axe Games','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co777t.jpg'),(10682,'Neutopia','2007-08-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, Wii, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, Wii U','Neutopia is an overhead action-adventure video game developed by Hudson Soft. It was released by Hudson for the PC Engine in Japan on November 17, 1989. It was then released by NEC for the TurboGrafx-16 in North America in 1990. It was re-released for the Virtual Console service worldwide for the Wii in 2007 and in Japan for the Wii U on April 16, 2014; it was re-released for the PlayStation Network in Japan in 2010 and in North America in 2011. The game takes place in the land of Neutopia, where the evil demon Dirth has captured Princess Aurora and has stolen the eight ancient medallions which contain the wisdom and power necessary to maintain peace and prosperity throughout the land. It is up to the protagonist Jazeta to retrieve the eight medallions, defeat Dirth, rescue Princess Aurora, and save the land and its people.\n\nNeutopia is widely regarded as a clone of the popular Nintendo game The Legend of Zelda in nearly every aspect. Many reviewers have praised the game for making noticeable improvements over Zelda, but various shortcomings – which include long passwords, repetitive gameplay, and poor collision detection – prevent the game from being superior over the 1987 Nintendo title. But overall, reviewers have called Neutopia one of the better video games of its type and one of the better titles in the TurboGrafx-16 library','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96bt.jpg'),(10683,'Super Mega Drive 3: 30 Super Jogos','2002-12-31','Sin género','Plug & Play','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10684,'S.Y.K: Shinsetsu Saiyuuki Portable','2010-07-29','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','S.Y.K: Shinsetsu Saiyuuki Portable is a port of S.Y.K: Shinsetsu Saiyuuki for the PlayStation Portable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4suw.jpg'),(10685,'Indect','2020-04-17','Platform','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"For the Insecurity of Citizens\" | a WIP dystopian cyberpunk platformer','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x8g.jpg'),(10686,'Sega Genesis Classics: Series 5','2011-05-02','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The fifth in a series of compilation video games released by Sega for the PC. It features ten Sega video games that were originally released for the Sega Genesis / Sega Mega Drive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sl4.jpg'),(10687,'Mickey\'s Adventure in Numberland','1994-12-31','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','\"Oh no\", cried Donald the Sheriff.\n\"Pete\'s done it again!\"\n\"He\'s stolen our numbers-from 1 up through 10!\"\n\"Search the whole city-every street every house.\"\n\"Look high and low-and call Mickey Mouse!\"\n\n\"You can count on me,\" declared Mickey Mouse. \"Don\'t worry!\"\n\"I\'ll find all the numbers. I\'ll foil Pete\'s plot!\"\n\"I\'m set for adventure. I\'m hot on the trail.\"\n\"With my friends to help guide me, there\'s no way I can fail!\"\n\nImmensely entertaining, Mickey\'s Adventure in Numberland helps improve early number identification and counting skills as it invites children to join Mickey on his quest to locate and return Numberland\'s stolen numbers. The game features 5 imaginative worlds of fun and fantasy-each with two levels and a seemingly endless supply of animated surprises.\n\nMickey\'s Adventures in Numberland is an educational game released for the NES in March of 1994.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oqy.jpg'),(10688,'Sega Classics Arcade Collection: Limited Edition','1994-05-23','Sin género','Sega CD','Games: Columns, Golden Axe, Revenge of Shinobi, Streets of Rage, Super Monaco GP','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mvvrmbkxasnua7zv9t6f.jpg'),(10689,'Sonic the Hedgehog: Egg on Toast Edition','2015-10-19','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sonic the Hedgehog Egg on Toast Edition is a modification of Sonic the Hedgehog wherein the rings are replaced with Toast, the Chaos Emeralds are replaced with Chaos Toasters.\n\nAside from that there is a New Game Plus mode in which the toasters are replaced with Super Eggs and the special stages are more challenging, a super form is availible upon collecting all the Chaos Toasters.\n\nA new ending is available upon obtaining the 7 Super Eggs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vxj.jpg'),(10690,'Pets & Stuff','2023-12-14','Simulator','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, Meta Quest 3, Oculus Quest','Immerse yourself into the role of a pet groomer at a cute pet clinic. Help adorable, furry friends with all kinds of different treatments. Let your imagination run wild and impress not only your fuzzy customers, but everyone around with a completely renewed, colourful and healthy look. Everyone deserves to be happy, groomed and in style!\nCuteness overload and fur everywhere guaranteed!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7goq.jpg'),(10691,'Please Love My Computer Game','2018-02-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','She waits. Explore an abandoned house in black and white as you solve cryptic puzzles and try to make discoveries. If you like to work with others to discover things, then you may like this game. I hope you love it, I really hope you do.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qz3.jpg'),(10692,'Among the Others','2018-08-11','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8p5j.jpg'),(10693,'Courage','2022-07-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Courage\" is a slasher with RPG elements, in a medieval setting, with a dark and gloomy atmosphere. The goal of the game is to advance through the levels and exterminate all the undead, then you can go further.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5d5e.jpg'),(10694,'Harpy Monster Bird Simulator 3D',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10695,'Kirby in Sonic the Hedgehog','2015-10-25','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Kirby in Sonic the Hedgehog as you truly imagined, minus the useless copy abilities. The Hack also features REV01 background effects, and bugfixes. Kirby can inhale monitors and most enemies but cannot copy their abilities. Life counter function as Health points and the only way to obtain Health is grabbing every 50+ Rings, Lampposts, Randomized 1Up Monitors, or Score every 50000+ points. The hack also contains 4 Difficulty modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qjj.jpg'),(10696,'Sonic the Hedgehog','1991-12-31','Platform','Arcade','Sonic the Hedgehog was one of the games adapted for release in arcades for the Mega Play hardware. While the Mega-Tech version is largely the same game as the original, the Mega Play version has lots of gameplay differences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tpg.jpg'),(10697,'Super Mario Bros.: Wart\'s Wonderland','2022-12-16','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Super Mario Bros.: Wart’s Wonderland is a romhack of Super Mario Bros. 2 USA for NES. Created by Rohbert, it is meant to be a Holiday Season themed hack for experienced SMB2 players. It is more difficult than vanilla SMB2 but not as hard as other SMB2 hacks. Princess and Luigi will have an easier time completing the levels, where as Toad and Mario will struggle a bit more','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w92.jpg'),(10698,'The Beatles: Adventures in Pepperland','2021-11-09','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','The Beatles Adventures: in Pepperland is loosely based on the 1968 film Yellow Submarine.\n\nPlay as The Beatles and fight blue meanies in this colorful adventure in the unearthly paradise called Pepperland.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nsv.jpg'),(10699,'Sonic: Brother Trouble','2010-07-04','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76p6.jpg'),(10700,'Zoo Tycoon 2: Zookeeper Collection','2006-10-01','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Zookeeper Collection provides the ultimate zoo experience with three of the most popular titles from the award-winning Zoo Tycoon franchise allowing players to step into their zoo where they will be face to face with 70 animals hundreds of building objects and guests in a completely 3-D world. Bundled titles include: Zoo Tycoon 2, Zoo Tycoon 2: Endangered Species and Zoo Tycoon 2: African Adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z7j.jpg'),(10701,'Kiniro no Corda 2 f','2009-02-25','Music, Simulator, Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Kiniro no Corda 2 f is the PSP port of Kiniro no Corda 2. It offers the original game with distinctive alterations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gkk.jpg'),(10702,'Princess Toadstool\'s Castle Run Game','1990-12-31','Racing, Arcade','Handheld Electronic LCD','Princess Toadstool\'s Castle Run Game is one of the three LCD game watches belonging to the Super Mario Bros. Watch line released in 1990 as promotional items by McDonald\'s in the US and Japan. It is the first game to feature Princess Toadstool as the sole playable character. The gameplay is identical to that of many LCD racing games such as Super Mario Race.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4azk.jpg'),(10703,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization Revolution 2 Plus','2015-12-03','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation Vita','Lead a civilization from the dawn of man to the modern age, and go head-to-head with history’s most intrepid leaders as you wage war, conduct diplomacy, discover new technologies, and build the most powerful empire the world has ever known in a race for ultimate supremacy.\n\nCivilization Revolution 2 Plus combines the core elements of the Civilization series with intuitive controls, a friendly user interface, a new 3D presentation, more tactical depth than ever before and additional new content exclusive to the PS Vita. Find out if you have what it takes to rule the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i3g.jpg'),(10704,'Mini Tank Mayhem',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Collect the rare cards, Build your combo, and destroy the invading alien in this deckbuilder tower defense game. Welcome to Mini Tank Mayhem, a game about cute tanks doing CHAD things.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co989x.jpg'),(10705,'Winning Post 10 2025','2025-03-27','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The \"Winning Post\" series, which celebrates its 30th anniversary in 2023, is an \"authentic horse racing simulation game\" in which players take on the role of an owner-breeder (horse owner and producer) and experience the drama of horses and people in the horse racing world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co936j.jpg'),(10706,'Hatsukoi Monogatari','1993-03-05','Simulator, Adventure','PC-9800 Series, FM Towns, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','Following a brief prologue with adventure-like gameplay, the bulk of Hatsukoi Monogatari consists of managerial simulation along the lines of Princess Maker games, though with more limited options and no RPG elements. The player manages the hero\'s daily schedule, divided into two segments: school and home. Activities include studying, having conversations with students or teachers, taking part-time jobs, resting, talking on the phone, shopping, buying presents, etc. Each activity increases or decreases some of the hero\'s parameters. The overall level can be evaluated on a special screen, and the goal is to raise it by balancing the stats with various activities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cq0.jpg'),(10707,'Mega Drive Mini','2019-09-19','Sin género','Plug & Play','The version of Mega Drive Mini released in Korea and China had a different line-up than that of the ones released in Japan, North America and Europe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56c2.jpg'),(10708,'Izumi Jiken File Vol. 1 - Shiosai-hen','2002-09-19','Visual Novel','Legacy Mobile Device','A visual novel-style detective game released for Japanese mobile phones. Originally debuting in 2002, it was rereleased on May 1, 2006 with updated graphics as Izumi Jiken File Vol. 1 - Shiosai-hen Deluxe Edition.\n\nYou can easily feel like a detective by reading a novel!\n\"Mystery Adventure Izumi Case File - Shiosai Edition\" (hereinafter referred to as Izumi Case File) is a mystery adventure game that \"deduces the criminal\" based on the situation at the crime scene and the information collected by asking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wyw.jpg'),(10709,'Super Mega Drive 3: 12 Super Jogos','2002-12-31','Sin género','Plug & Play','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88mp.jpg'),(10710,'X-Men: Attack MOD - Big Chill','2006-12-31','Sin género','HyperScan','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10711,'Ray and the Guitar','2004-08-25','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co962l.jpg'),(10712,'Who Dies First','2022-03-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a 2D RPG.There are many roles, there will be multiple endings according to the different combination of who dies first and which skill do you use. The art asset are free licensed by Unity company.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n7f.jpg'),(10713,'Void Terrarium++','2021-05-18','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 5','The last living human is depending on you in Void Terrarium++! Rediscover a bleak yet charming story of a young girl named Toriko and her robot protector, along with extra features such as new afflictions, outfits, and an new environment to explore.\n\nSystem Upgrade:\nVoid Terrarium++ looks and performs better than ever on PlayStation5, and comes bundled with additional content like new emotes, outfits, hairstyles, and Toriko diseases.\n\nLegacy Protocol:\nVoid Terrarium’s amazing visual style, unique roguelike gameplay, and caretaking system all make a return.\n\nHope in a Cold World:\nFrom the creator of A Rose in the Twilight and htoL#NiQ: The Firefly Diary, this harrowing roguelike adventure combines cute visuals with a somber yet whimsical post-apocalyptic story.\n\nThis edition\'s new content was announced in Japan alongside a DLC pack for the PS4 and Nintendo Switch that included the new diseases, customization feature and interactions with Toriko.\nThe DLC has not been announced internationally.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tx0.jpg'),(10714,'Mega Games 6','1995-12-31','Puzzle, Racing, Sport, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Six Genesis games collected on one cartridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49sl.jpg'),(10715,'Super Mega Drive 3: 10 Super Jogos',NULL,'Platform, Racing, Arcade','Plug & Play','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88mj.jpg'),(10716,'Sonic the Hedgehog 1 @ Sage 2010','2010-08-08','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10717,'Sonic X TMNT: Score Party',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sonic X TMNT: Score Party is a collection of mini-games featuring classic Sonic and teenage mutant ninja turtles from the animated show from the 80s! In these mini-games you will need to collect a certain number of points. Their total number is rated S or D rank, depending on how many points you have collected. In this demo, you will be able to run at super sonic speed as Sonic and kick some shells as Leonardo! At different levels from the games of both franchises, you will meet Dr. Eggman\'s badniks and Shredder\'s foot soldiers (and not only)!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w91.jpg'),(10718,'Tails of Iron & Tails of Iron 2: Deluxe Bundle','2025-01-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Tails of Iron 2: Whiskers of Winter and Tails of Iron are bundled together with their DLCs in this ultimate \'tail\' and action-RPG experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d0u.jpg'),(10719,'The Undergrounders','2025-04-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as Jack in this first-person thriller where your choices determine his fate. Uncover dark secrets, solve puzzles, and navigate a world of mystery and emotional drama to save yourself and your daughter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nww.jpg'),(10720,'Heroes Raid',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Enter a dark dystopian world that combines demons, guns, swords, magic, monsters and modern technology. Raid alone or with your friends, craft your unique playstyle by mixing and matching abilities between heroes. Raids, Builds, Team PvP, and Solo PvP await.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yvn.jpg'),(10721,'Oculus Arcade','2015-11-09','Shooter, Platform, Arcade','Oculus VR, Oculus Go','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10722,'Marvel vs. Capcom 2: New Age of Heroes','2012-04-24','Fighting','iOS','The iOS port of Marvel vs. Capcom 2 introduces a new feature called Variable System that allows the player to tag in other team members at any time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95z7.jpg'),(10723,'Power Rangers vs Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Ultimate Hero Clash 2','2017-02-04','Fighting','Web browser','Power Rangers vs Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Ultimate Hero Clash 2 is a 2017 Browser-based crossover fighting game. Unlike the previous entry, which had a cast of several Rangers from throughout the series\' run, this one only pulls rangers from the at-the-time newest entry, Ninja Steel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yl8.jpg'),(10724,'Arcade Archives: Golf','2019-10-25','Sport, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Golf is a sports game released by Nintendo in 1984. Pay close attention to the wind direction and speed, choose the best club, and aim for the lowest score as you play across 18 holes. You can also challenge a friend in the 2 player mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xii.jpg'),(10725,'Mystic Gate','2023-09-13','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Take the role of a wanderer and his robotic companion as they travel beyond the gate and attempt to master its secrets! Dash, dodge and take aim at hordes of enemies through procedurally generated dungeons that make every run feel unique. Presented in top-down pixel art style, Mystic Gate is a twin stick shooter that combines RPG elements with bullet hell action! Can you survive, upgrade and overcome the terrors of the gate to realize your ultimate dream?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73b7.jpg'),(10726,'Eggconsole The Scheme PC-8801mkIISR','2024-11-28','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','Unleash your Force and take down the Hellstone Cult! A side-scrolling action RPG with captivating BGM.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93fa.jpg'),(10727,'JumpStart: Get Moving Family Fitness Sports Edition featuring Brooke Burke','2010-07-08','Simulator, Sport','Wii','Get your family moving and find how fitness can be fun! For years, JumpStart has been creating the best learning games for kids. Now, with Get Moving Family Fitness, JumpStart is making fitness fun too! Discover the ultimate family sports game with fitness expert and mom of 4, Brooke Burke. With more than 15 sports challenges in 11 exotic arenas, Get Moving is the fun, new way to keep your family active!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h0w.jpg'),(10728,'Honkai Impact 3rd: Deep Enigma','2019-04-18','Sin género','Android, iOS','Version 3.0 of Honkai Impact 3rd, marking the beginning of the \'From the Deep Ocean\' arc, which includes:\n• New Valkyries: Argent Knight: Artemis (Rita), Phantom Iron (Rita) & Striker Fulminata (Mei)\n• New ELF System with 2 ELFs: Jingwei\'s Wings & Blood Embrace\n• New Story Chapter IX-EX 2: Dark Serpent\n• New Story Chapter X: Under the Deep\n• New Team Raid: Eye of the Deep\n• Level Cap Increase to 82\n• ...and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kxb.jpg'),(10729,'Famicom Jump II: Saikyou no 7-nin','1992-12-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Family Computer','Famicom Jump II: Saikyou no 7-nin is a 1991 RPG for the Nintendo Family Computer published by Bandai. The sequel to Famicom Jump: Hero Retsuden, the game features seven main characters (as the subtitle indicates) from different Weekly Shōnen Jump manga serialized at the time. Only four of the 16 represented titles from the original are brought back, while the remaining three are new to the sequel. There would not be another crossover game until the release of Jump Super Stars and Jump Ultimate Stars. (of which six of these series would be represented, the only one not being Magical Tarurūto-kun.)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54zk.jpg'),(10730,'X-Men: Character - Storm','2006-12-31','Sin género','HyperScan','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10731,'Rob\'n Run',NULL,'Platform, Arcade','Sin plataforma','A retro puzzle platformer with speedrun gameplay .','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10732,'Fastraq','2022-12-13','Racing, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fastraq is a high-speed anti-gravity racing game. Drive on roller coaster like tracks, overtake your opponents and engage in combat. Experience tight turns, 360 degree loops and intense combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uhd.jpg'),(10733,'ReactorX','2024-03-17','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This is a relaxing game about moving boxes on energy grids in a sci-fi setting, in order to repair the space ship which was hit by a meteor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gke.jpg'),(10734,'Dr. Robotnik in Sonic the Hedgehog','2020-07-26','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','“Eggrobo gone beserk and stole Robotnik’s ship and minions, you must stop him to took back your evil machine empire!!!”\n\nFinally you can play as Doctor Robotnik/Eggman at the eternal classic Sonic 1 for Genesis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sml.jpg'),(10735,'Alone',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Alone is a puzzle platformer where you control more than just one character. Switch control between a variety of bots, each with their own unique features, to help overcome increasingly more difficult challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co578u.jpg'),(10736,'Nintendo Classic Mini: Family Computer','2016-11-10','Shooter, Platform','Plug & Play','Nintendo Classic Mini: Family Computer is the Japanese version of the mini console known as NES Classic Edition. It has some different games built-in when comparing with the international version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co569j.jpg'),(10737,'Motobug the Badnik in Sonic the Hedgehog','2010-06-19','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','A ROM hack of Sonic the Hedgehog in which the main character replaced by Motobug, one of Dr. Robotnik\'s Badniks. The new protagonist has a much lower speed, unless when using power-ups.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qky.jpg'),(10738,'Infinite Robotics','2024-02-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Infinite Robotics is a visual novel game that is set in a fantasy world filled with modern technology. The premise of the game is to find out the mystery of the world and learn about electronics by solving puzzles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7g08.jpg'),(10739,'Sippy Disco: Light Up The Dance Floor','2024-03-01','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Light up the dance floor in this cozy puzzle game! Sippy the unicorn must step on every square in the fewest possible moves to make the dance floor light up. Partner with Parrots on skates and disco balls to brighten everyone’s day!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7v5q.jpg'),(10740,'The Illusory Abyss','2019-05-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10741,'Crowns and Pawns: Kingdom of Deceit','2022-05-06','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Legends of the past come back to life in this charming European mystery adventure.\n\nCrowns and Pawns, a modern-day point and click adventure, inspired by classics such as Broken Sword, Monkey Island, Still Life, Syberia and others. The game highlights the less explored history of Europe to the world of adventurers. Experience the legendary stories of the Grand Duchy of Lithuania, bring to light the villainous branch of the KGB, solve puzzles and follow hints to reveal the secrets of the King who was never crowned.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qpx.jpg'),(10742,'Tom Clancy\'s H.A.W.X 2','2010-11-11','Simulator, Adventure','Wii','Wii version of H.A.W.X 2 is an entirely different video game, except in terms of branding. It requires a Wii nunchuk. The player mainly takes control of crewed combat jets and helicopters. There are unique missions in which the player is in control of a UAV, a Space Shuttle, a space-based beam cannon, a free-falling man and a pet peregrine falcon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pyy.jpg'),(10743,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Minigame Laptop','2023-07-31','Quiz/Trivia','Handheld Electronic LCD','The Candide Laptop is educational, bilingual (Portuguese and English) and comes with different activities, such as: music, letters, words, spelling, questions and answers, addition, division and others. There are countless activities for children to learn wherever they are.\n\nYou can learn while playing with the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles educational laptop for kids! This toy laptop has a beautiful design inspired by your favorite characters!\n\nPlaying games will be much more fun with the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles laptop!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zy8.jpg'),(10744,'X-Men: Attack MOD - Cyborg Assault','2006-12-31','Sin género','HyperScan','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10745,'Fantasy Friends: Dream Worlds','2024-10-22','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Come and play with Aurea in Fantasy Friends: Dream Worlds, an ultra-cute puzzle and platform game. Enter this wonderful place and make lots of fantastic friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8re2.jpg'),(10746,'SEMP 64',NULL,'Platform, Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a super easy multiplayer platformer, or SEMP for short.\nSo it\'s a 3D platformer, with online multiplayer and it\'s super easy\n(Disclaimer: it\'s actually super difficult and not super easy)\n\nClimb to the very top of the super huge level.\nFall down and... well try again I guess. Maybe you where lucky and able to save yourself onto a near platform. Or you lost hours of progress, who knows what\'ll happen.\n\nPlay alone, join the global lobby or host your own 4 player lobby for your friends.\nBut let\'s be real, it\'s much more fun to see tons of players fall down... I mean climb up the world.\n\nAlready mastered the game? Well respect. But what now?\nHop into the level editor and build your own levels! Let\'s see if you can make players rage quit even faster than I could.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9exu.jpg'),(10747,'Extraction Force','2024-03-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nuclear launch codes have been stolen! Invade the enemy base. Destroy everything in your path. Locate the stolen codes and return them safely to prevent the end of the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5f6c.jpg'),(10748,'Canyon Ridge',NULL,'Puzzle, Simulator','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Canyon Ridge is an autobiographical gaming experience about psychosis, plastic cups, and low resolution reality. \n \nWaking up suddenly in a place with all new faces and names, you must control the Avatar through the trials and minor tribulations befalling him on his quest to debate the seriousness of his mental health.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sfi20iniuhkmkhjwdww5.jpg'),(10749,'Sonic ERaZor','2016-05-10','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sonic ERaZor is a hack of Sonic the Hedgehog created by Selbi. This hack is unlike many other hacks, featuring a heavy in-game story line, unique challenges, and never seen before gameplay mechanics. These elements are often somehow related to explosions, which is why this hack is sometimes called, \"What if Michael Bay directed Sonic 1?\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qje.jpg'),(10750,'Aerial Mini','2024-10-21','Shooter','Mega Duck/Cougar Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9npb.jpg'),(10751,'T2: The Arcade Game','1993-12-31','Shooter','Sega Game Gear','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a7p.jpg'),(10752,'Armor Valley',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','An indie game by Protégé Games','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bi8tb52lbsksd8mixwkp.jpg'),(10753,'Sonic Gaiden','2004-05-16','Sin género','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sonic Gaiden is a 2003 fan-made hack of the original Sonic the Hedgehog game for the Sega Mega Drive.\n\nThis hack is significant in the Sonic ROM-hacking community for several reasons. First, it\'s a hack of a Sonic 1 title; at the time of its release, such hacks were slightly rarer as Sonic 2 was the most frequently hacked Sonic game. Secondly, it is a hack of the Japanese Sonic 1 ROM; the U.S. Sonic 1 is more commonly used, but the Japanese revision has added features such as scrolling clouds and rippling water. Thirdly, the hack allows the option to play as either Sonic or as Mighty the Armadillo, who became popular as a founding member of the Chaotix crew and as a playable character in SegaSonic the Hedgehog. In addition, the hack includes new levels with new artwork and separate endings for each character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dq8.jpg'),(10754,'Steambot Chronicles','2006-10-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 2','Steambot Chronicles is a 2005 action-adventure role-playing game developed and published by Irem Software Engineering in Japan for the PlayStation 2. It was later published by Atlus in North America and 505 Games in PAL regions. The game features a sandbox-style of steam-powered, mech-based gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jjj.jpg'),(10755,'Disciples II Mobile','2009-12-31','Strategy','Legacy Mobile Device','One of the greatest turn-based strategy goes mobile, keeping athmosphere of original PC game, with all key features like authentical battle mode, storyline etc!\nThe game takes place in a fictional world Nevendaar. At the beginning of the game the player chooses a class of a ruler: Alderman, Warlord or Archmage. Each ruler has his bonuses, defining the style of the game. “Disciples” game process includes two components: a capital improvement that gives access to new troops and abilities, as well as the study of magic spells, used on the strategic map; and use the heroes in the lead of small detachments to conduct reconnaissance, making attacks and seizure of lands and resources.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pgb.jpg'),(10756,'Blaze the Cat in Sonic the Hedgehog','2021-04-09','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','A ROM hack of Sonic the Hedgehog which changes Sonic for Blaze the Cat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tp0.jpg'),(10757,'Ghosts \'n Goblins Mobile','2017-03-15','Arcade','Android, iOS','Android/iOS port of Ghosts \'n Goblins.\n\nArthur the brave knight must rescue his beloved Princess from the Demon King Astaroth and his forces - amongst them are the various undead (ghosts, zombies), bats, ogres and goblins. Other challenges include moving platforms, ladders and water/fire hazards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tq5.jpg'),(10758,'24 Solar Terms','2023-04-19','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','24 Solar Terms is a seek and find puzzle game with the theme of the traditional Chinese twenty-four solar terms. The game connects the climate and farming of various solar terms through farming proverbs, myths and fables. Help local farmers solve problems and experience the story of 24 solar terms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45qy.jpg'),(10759,'Nihilo',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Estes was just fourteen years old and dealing with the loss of his father when The Calamity occurred. Objects of unknown origin had struck near Ignarosa, the capital of Autenon, with the force so great the dust blotted the sky out and led to three months of freezing and unrelenting snow. People died of cold and starvation, and only a few isolated enclaves lived to see the Months of Blizzard end as suddenly as they started. During this time, many plants and animals were also decimated or driven to extinction. In their place, new and dangerous creatures to fill the void, many with a mysterious link to The Calamity itself...\n\nTen years later, Estes and his friend Nikolai are sent out from their home town of Jupa to make contact with survivors further north, and learn what they know of Calamity. Estes also hopes to see Makal, his formerly beautiful birthplace, while Nikolai is searching for the man who betrayed his father. Their journey will take them halfway across the barren lands of Autenon and grow more complex than anyone had imagined...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kc6.jpg'),(10760,'Routine',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Routine is a First Person Sci-Fi Horror title set on an abandoned Lunar base designed around an 80’s vision of the future. Curious exploration turns into a need for survival when a lunar base goes completely quiet. Searching for answers puts you face to face with an enemy who is certain the main threat is you. Discoveries lead to deeper unknowns and the only way to go is forward.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uk6.jpg'),(10761,'Cities: Skylines - Financial Districts','2022-12-13','Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Boost the economy of your City with a financial district, and use your funds to invest in the best industries for your population. Financial Districts adds the new feature “Investments” and more than a hundred assets to the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ujs.jpg'),(10762,'SpongeBob SquarePants: Battle For Bikini Bottom','2003-10-31','Platform, Adventure','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','The evil Plankton has set in motion his most diabolical plot ever! The fate of Bikini Bottom has been put into the unsuspecting hands of SpongeBob. Explore a huge world filled with unexpected surprises, challenges, and familiar friends. Join SpongeBob and his friends in his fearless crusade to end Plankton\'s evil scheme...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3iyp.jpg'),(10763,'Spy Guy Cosmos','2025-03-06','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10764,'Night Call: Deluxe Edition','2019-07-17','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Night Call is a non-linear, narrative-driven noire investigation game. You are no detective, but you do have a gift. Around you, people feel more at ease. They talk. They share their thoughts, their emotions, their stories… their secrets. To passengers, you are more than just a driver; you are also a friend, a confidant, a shrink. A voyeur catching a glimpse under the masked but very real lives throughout the City of Light. And you’ll need to play these roles well if you want to catch the killer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cdf.jpg'),(10765,'Ongaku Tsukuuru: Kanadeeru','1996-04-22','Music','Satellaview, Super Famicom','Ongaku Tsukuuru: Kanadeeru is a Miscellaneous game, developed by Success and published by ASCII Entertainment, which was released in Japan in 1996. It is a Satellaview-compatible Slotted Cartridge game belonging to ASCII\'s Tsukūru series. The title of these games are portmanteau-word puns mixing the Japanese word tsukuru (作る), which means \"make\" or \"create\", with tsūru (ツール), the Japanese transcription of the English word \"tool\". As the title suggests, this title is a music creation tool.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sgt0gmzu5bekvp9p372k.jpg'),(10766,'Stick RPG 2','2011-04-19','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Get ready to enter the 2nd Dimension!\n\nThrust into a bizarre and unfamiliar city and find your place among strange citizens. Work, Fight, Study, Eat, Drink, Gamble, Train, Sleep, Quest, Collect, Invest, Repeat. Build up your Stats and Net Worth, collect the mysterious trans-dimensional artifacts, solve the mysteries of Paper Thin City and find your way home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4244.jpg'),(10767,'DROD: Smitemaster\'s Selection Expansions 3+4','2016-12-01','Puzzle','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Smitemaster\'s Selections are level expansion packs for DROD. These Caravel-produced level collections add to the official story of DROD with quality writing and voice acting. You will have about a hundred new and unique puzzles to solve in each Smitemaster\'s Selection bundle.\n\nExpansions 3+4 contain these episodes:\n\nHalph has a Bad Day\nBeethro and the Secret Society','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10768,'Terminator 3: The Redemption','2004-09-02','Racing, Adventure','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Terminator 3: The Redemption is a combination of 3rd person shooter, rail, and driving game featuring Arnold Schwarzenegger as the infamous T-850 Infiltrator. The game features 20+ alternate vehicles with never before seen SkyNet units and a Tech-Com Force Co-op mode. Your goal is to ensure the survival of both John Connor and Kate Brewster in present and future universes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p2f.jpg'),(10769,'Thysiastery',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Thysiastery is a dungeon crawler RPG featuring traditional roguelike and turn-based gameplay. Command a party of bearers of the Brand, drawn into a vast Labyrinth. Recruit while exploring the Labyrinth in hope of finding a way out, and its secrets will be revealed as you delve deeper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k5i.jpg'),(10770,'Rogue Trip: Vacation 2012','1998-09-30','Shooter, Racing','PlayStation','In a world destroyed by pollution, nuclear war and poverty, vacationers have become hot property. They feel the need to escape from their everyday existence and go on vacations! Big Daddy is the vacation king at the moment, and he\'s provided some really fabulous getaways for these people. But who\'s going to get paid for taking the vacationers to luxurious landmarks and resorts? Well, you are!\n\nThe \"not-right\" folks at Singletrac are at it again with Rogue Trip: Vacation 2012, the \"spiritual successor\" to Twisted Metal 2. In it, you chose one of 16 wacky, down-right sick \"automercenaries\" and compete with your enemies to pick up the tourists and take them to photo-ops. Doing this gets you lots of money, which can be used buy weapon upgrades and health. But your enemies really don\'t want you to have the money -- and they shoot back.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qii.jpg'),(10771,'Cinemaster Cinema Simulator','2025-03-27','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Run your own cinema! Set showtimes, print tickets, buy new films, pop popcorn, upgrade and clean theaters. Vending machines, staffs, upgrades, and much more are coming soon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dpb.jpg'),(10772,'Rad Blaster',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10773,'Ooga Booga: Troubles in Time','2024-07-08','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get ready for an exciting adventure in \"Ooga Booga: Troubles in Time\"! Choose your character and travel through different universes to defeat the forces of evil, the enemy is waiting to beat you up! Try the best controls for platform games. Jump over obstacles to pass the level. Fight against a multitude of enemies in different scenarios. Escape from the rolling stone down the hill. Ride the pig and dodge the thugs. Talk to the characters to defeat the final boss. BEWARE, the enemy wants to trick you, don\'t fall into his traps. Prove that you are the chosen one!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8k6m.jpg'),(10774,'Pulling USA','2014-11-12','Racing, Simulator','iOS','Pulling USA is the latest truck pulling and tractor pulling simulation game in a full 3D environment. With over 30 trucks and tractors and 11 vehicle classes, the pulling never ends. Upgrade your vehicle\'s engine, supercharger/turbocharger, fuel system and more at the garage. Adjust the weights and tire pressure to accommodate the range of track conditions. Pull at the county fair in different day and night environments or in the indoor grand arena. Work your way up through the different competitions: county, state, regional, national, and grand national; earning money and points for winning. With this truck pulling and tractor pulling simulator, you will need to control the throttle and clutch perfectly to get your arena shaking machine down the track. Build your RPM, engine temp, boost and take off down the track with realistic dirt and smoke effects. Enjoy a multitude of camera angles, and tilt your device to steer in-bounds. Watch out for blown engines and broken axles!\n\nWith Pulling USA, you\'ll have hours and hours of dirt-flinging fun!\n\nClasses:\nWork Stock Truck, Super Stock Truck, Two Wheel Drive, Super Semi, Super Farm, Super Stock, Limited Modified, Unlimited Modified, Mini Modified, Diesel Garden\n\nPS: Don\'t forget your ear plugs!!\n\nTo start playing, buy a work stock truck, super farm tractor, or garden tractor and work your way up, earning more money to buy the better vehicles. No in app purchases are necessary to play this game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lztu7jjju04i55acasml.jpg'),(10775,'Midnight Taco','2025-03-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the shoes of a young girl who must face solitude and mystery while waiting for her mother at the taco stand where she works. It’s a rainy night, but that won’t stop some unwelcome visitors from showing up...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kja.jpg'),(10776,'Pana der Hejhog','2011-09-03','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79f7.jpg'),(10777,'Arcade Master Deluxe',NULL,'Fighting, Platform','Plug & Play','The Arcade Master Deluxe is a console on a chip manufactured by AtGames. It is a console built into an arcade stick, with a directional stick, six face buttons and 26 built-in Sega Mega Drive games. It has no cartridge slot, but can run games via SD cards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pdo.jpg'),(10778,'Arcade Nano Sonic 1 & 2','2010-11-01','Platform','Plug & Play','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4slm.jpg'),(10779,'QQ Chinese Chess',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10780,'Gex the Gecko in Sonic the Hedgehog','2020-10-26','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','This is a mod which changes Sonic to Gex the Gecko, with gameplay from its first game, including wall climbing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rtq.jpg'),(10781,'OneShot','2016-12-08','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','OneShot is a surreal top down puzzle/adventure game with unique gameplay capabilities. You are to guide a child through a mysterious world on a mission to restore its long-dead sun. The world knows you exist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1u08.jpg'),(10782,'Nitori-chan Dash','2017-06-30','Platform, Indie','Android','A doujin game by ISY based on the Touhou Project series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yjn.jpg'),(10783,'Sonic Robo Blast 2 Infinity','2023-07-03','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A total conversion mod for Sonic Robo Blast 2 that changes its gameplay to resemble that of Phantasy Star Portable 2 Infinity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7l0j.jpg'),(10784,'X-Men Legends','2005-02-07','Role-playing (RPG)','N-Gage','The N-Gage port of X-Men Legends.\n\nThe N-Gage version of X-Men Legends contains most of the features found on the console versions. However, the game is played from an isometric point of view. Characters are two-dimensional sprites based on their three-dimensional console counterparts, and levels are redesigned to meet the limitations of the isometric point of view. Cutscenes were reused from the console versions, but are rendered at a much lower frame rate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b64.jpg'),(10785,'Talking Marvel Comics X-Men','1994-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','A handheld electronic device based on Marvel superheroes\' X-Men.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5a1q.jpg'),(10786,'Route-16 Turbo','1985-10-04','Racing','Family Computer','Route-16 Turbo is an improved version of Route-16 for the Famicom which was published on October 4, 1985 by Sunsoft only in Japan. Route-16 Turbo added multiple difficulty levels and improved graphics and music.\n\nIn Route-16 Turbo, players get behind the wheel of a car and drive around trying to collect valuable items lying around on the road while avoiding chase cars whose only purpose is to crash into the player\'s car.\n\nIn the game, the player\'s car drives around on a map that contains a bird\'s eye view of the 16 different routes (individual maze rooms) that can be entered. This overhead map screen shows which routes contain the items that have to be collected. Each item the player collects will increase their score. Collecting all the items in a level will allow the player to go on to the next round.\n\nWhen the player enters a specific route, the game switches its view to a single screen maze. These mazes contain dead-ends, zig-zags, multiple exits, enemy obstacles, with also the the threat of the chase cars entering and giving chase to the player\'s car.\n\nThe car itself has the ability to use turbo to get a burst of speed. This of course costs the player increased fuel usage (more than just normally driving around). Running out of all of vehicles fuel will cause the player to lose a life. Any remaining fuel left over after a round is completed helps to increase the player\'s score.\n\nThe game contains 3 difficulty levels (easy, normal, and difficult).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vg0.jpg'),(10787,'X-Men: Mutant Academy',NULL,'Fighting, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Nintendo 64, PlayStation','X-Men: Mutant Academy is a 3-D/2D fighting game developed by Paradox, the company behind Activision\'s Wu-Tang: Shaolin Style and the never-published Thrill Kill, and based on the X-Men characters from Marvel Comics. The game was released for the Game Boy Color and PlayStation as a tie-in to X-Men.\n\nX-Men: Mutant Academy is a basic fighting game that uses six buttons: three buttons for punches and three for kicks. Due to the success of the game, it was followed by two sequels: X-Men: Mutant Academy 2 and X-Men: Next Dimension. The game\'s characters can be played both with their comic book costumes and their costumes from the 2000 film X-Men. Characters not present in the film were given costumes of a similar design.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2y74.jpg'),(10788,'Tactical Mind','2017-12-22','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Tactical Mind is an upcoming strategy video game inspired by Chess. It is being developed as a joint venture by Drageus Games S.A. and Qubic Games S.A.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c8d.jpg'),(10789,'Sonic Dreamscape','2017-12-31','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, PC (Microsoft Windows)','An adventure for one hedgehog.\n\nSonic Dreamscape (or Dreamland in other regions) is a game about Sonic entering Dreamland in quest to stop Eggman from wielding the power of the dreamscape.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10790,'Mega Drive 3','2000-12-31','Sin género','Plug & Play','The Mega Drive 3 is a \"console on a chip\" manufactured by Lite Star in 2000 for sale in Asia. According to the system itself, it was manufactured under license by Sega, though the production values are very unprofessional. The following year it was released in Japan as the Mega Drive 21.\n\nThe console doubles up as a controller which can be plugged into a TV, and the unit itself is a similar shape to the Tectoy Master System Handy. Rather than have a cartridge slot, it contains 20 built-in Sega Mega Drive games (though in actuality, there are only 8 - the rest are duplicates). The system is sold in a number of colors, including transparent-green and transparent-purple.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6phy.jpg'),(10791,'The Whispered World','2010-04-23','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The beautiful adventure game The Whispered World whisks the player away to a fascinating fantasy world. Sadwick is a young clown but often far from cheerful. One night, a strange blue creature speaks to him in a dream, and sends him on an adventurous journey.\nIn classic point & click tradition, gamers steer Sadwick and his companion Spot through the game. Little Spot never leaves Sadwick\'s side and is integral to solving many puzzles. He can take on many different forms throughout the game, which the player can pick and choose at will, once they have been learned.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k35.jpg'),(10792,'Cyber Sled','1995-10-18','Shooter, Racing','Arcade, PlayStation','High-tech tanks meet full blown, first person firepower.\n\nCyber Sled cataplults you to a future where tank warfare resembles forumla one racing on an arena football field. Eleven armored battlesleds play hide-and-seek, then seek-and-destroy; each with enough weaponry to take out the former Soviet Union. Their sole purpose? Blow you to scrap. Blink, and you\'re Cyber-Dead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xzo.jpg'),(10793,'Duet','2015-08-03','Music, Puzzle, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Your survival is dependent on protecting two vessels - they are devices in sync, a dance and song between two entities tethered together in symbiosis. Feel edge of your seat terror where the world around you becomes quiet and numb as all that matters is the game -- that is Duet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h1p.jpg'),(10794,'X-Men: Character - Iceman',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10795,'X-Men: Character - Magneto',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10796,'Terminator: Revenge','2006-11-01','Platform','Legacy Mobile Device','Terminator: Revenge is a J2ME title for mobile phones. The player assumes control of a T-800 unit, programmed to terminate a Resistance scientist, who was sent back through time to discover Terminator weaknesses by experimenting on the remains of the Terminator crushed in the first Terminator film.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zhe.jpg'),(10797,'Mario Tennis Aces','2018-06-22','Sport, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','A new Mario Tennis game is bringing a new level of skill and competition to Nintendo Switch. Mario steps onto the court in classy tennis garb for intense rallies against a variety of characters in full-blown tennis battles. New wrinkles in tennis gameplay will challenge your ability to read an opponent\'s position and stroke to determine which shot will give you the advantage. And this time the game adds the first story mode since the Mario Tennis game on Game Boy Advance, offering a new flavor of tennis gameplay, with a variety of missions, boss battles and more','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tfw.jpg'),(10798,'House Flipper: Pets','2023-02-02','Simulator, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','It\'s finally time for finding your perfect renovation partner! Max, Phil, Bella? It\'s up to you to decide what\'s the name of your adopted companion. Take in an adorable pet and let him help you on your flipping journey in the friendly area of Cozy Village!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i3n.jpg'),(10799,'Dreamy Duels: Tales of Heroes in Gensoukyo','2024-03-13','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dreamy Duels is a card game inspired by Touhou project universe and various other classic card games. In this game, you can craft you own cards with card editor, and use them to engage other players in a diverse card game world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d95.jpg'),(10800,'Deus Ex: Revision','2015-10-13','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deus Ex: Revision is a community-made overhaul of the 2000 classic. It features new environments, music, world-building detail, and bundles in some of the best modifications the fanbase has made, including Direct3D 9 rendering, high-res textures, high-detail models, and alt gameplay modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nll.jpg'),(10801,'Terminator 2: Judgment Day - Chess Wars','1993-02-01','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A chess game based on T2, featuring sounds and characters from the movie as pieces. Captures are animated a la Battle Chess, but the battles take place off the board, in futuristic wastelands and similar stages.\n\nThe game offers several difficulties and play styles to choose from, along with time control, ratings on the USCF scale over different time-frames and other niceties. Oddly enough, there\'s no 2D board.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ssi1kwheqjuwxbhr5xat.jpg'),(10802,'Sega Ages: Sonic the Hedgehog','2018-09-20','Platform, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sonic the Hedgehog includes Mega Play, previously only available in the Sonic the Hedgehog arcade game. Familiar stages will feel new again as you race against time to the finish line. It\'s a thrilling challenge for seasoned Sonic fans!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zuz.jpg'),(10803,'Buzz! Junior: Jungle Party','2006-10-20','Sin género','PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','Buzz! Junior: Jungle Party will captivate the young and casual gamer through over a variety of competitive mini-games. Each mini-game offers a variety of fun fast paced gameplay of skill and speed that will appeal to the entire family -- from the young to the young at heart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x9l.jpg'),(10804,'Max\'s Big Bust 2 - Max\'s Bigger Bust','2020-10-29','Point-and-click, Adventure, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Max is back! After Max\'s partner Brad is transformed in a car bomb explosion and Max is turned into an even bustier babe, Max must team up with a bunch of new and returning weirdos in order to save Axon City from a terrifyingly sexy threat. It\'s not going to be easy though, Max is going to have to cope with issues like her succubus sister Heather moving back in and refusing to leave despite clearly breaking the terms of Max\'s lease by holding orgies in the living room. Or the coven of mysterious witches that live in a compound on the outskirts of the city that claim they are definitely not a cult, and Max is turned into a dog at one point. We probably should have mentioned earlier that things are going to get weird.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jqm.jpg'),(10805,'Terminator Genisys: Guardian','2015-06-04','Shooter','Android, iOS','The year is 2028 and humanity is on the brink of extinction. Help John Connor in the war to save the human race in the official mobile game of the Terminator Genisys film.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e8e.jpg'),(10806,'The Primrose Theater','2025-03-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short love letter to 2013 Unity horror games. Inspired by games like The Theater and Kuro Oni.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jl9.jpg'),(10807,'WW2 Air Force Commander','1993-12-31','Simulator','DOS','Take command of the airforce in this exciting and challenging simulation of air warfare in the Second World War! As commander, you\'ll have complete control over your side\'s entire air force, and must plan how to use them to best effect. Decide where to locate each unit, and set up appropriate missions for each one. You\'ll need to set up defensive patrols to secure the safety of your key sites as well as offensive missions to take out the enemy\'s strike capability!\n\nThe Battle of Britain early, in World War II was the first large-scale air war. Continental Europe had fallen to the Nazi Blitzkrieg attacks, and Britain alone remained free and fighting. Without the years of preparation the Germans had, the Royal Air Force had many fewer planes than the Luftwaffe; the outlook was bleak. But with heroic bravery and careful planning, the Spitfires and Hurricanes managed to stave off German bombers for long enough for Britain to survive, and America to join in the fight against tyranny.\n\nNow you can recreate this and many other scenarios. The Battle of Britain showed just how important it is to be master of the skies- are you up to the job?\n\nAir Force Commander: World War Two Edition, is the second game in the Air Force Commander series, and follows the success of the first game, set in the Middle East.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lu9dwdqb1sjm5dnfebyu.jpg'),(10808,'Toy Story','2010-12-31','Sin género','Plug & Play','Disney/Pixar Classics is a Plug It In & Play TV Game released in 2006 & reintroduced in 2010 by Jakks Pacifc and developed by Handheld Games LLC. The controller features five games based on three Pixar movies, it includes two Toy Story games, two Monsters Inc. games and one A Bug\'s Life game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5f8g.jpg'),(10809,'Gems Of Evolution','2024-07-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gems of Evolution is a top-down action roguelite featuring 4 elements, 4 races and 4 classes. Choose your unique hero from diverse combinations like Human-Warrior-Fire. Fight, make various builds with skills, items and evolutions, survive 30 wave and uncover your hero\'s tale in this challenging.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fwt.jpg'),(10810,'Grit: Overworld Survival','2019-05-10','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grit is a realistic overworld survival roguelike, where a rat stew is probably the best meal you\'ll get and starvation is always on your heels. Search for edible plants, defend yourself against local predators, build shelter and figure out how to get back to civilization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xww.jpg'),(10811,'Five Sonic Rings Bundle','2013-12-01','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Five Sonic Rings Bundle is a bundle consisting of five Sonic the Hedgehog games published by Sega for Steam. It was sold through the Sega.com digital store around Christmas 2013.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10812,'Romance of the Three Kingdoms X with Power Up Kit','2017-12-05','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Romance of the Three Kingdoms Ⅹ with Power Up Kit\" is an expanded version of \"Romance of the Three Kingdoms Ⅹ,\" which was released in 2004 as the 10th game in the series.\nIn this release, the all-officer playable advances. In addition to over 3 times the number of events, we have added \"Duels,\" where officers clash with each other, \"Debates,\" in which strategists and ministers clash verbally, \"Campaigns,\" large scale battles involving multiple cities, in order to allow players a greater opportunity to freely experience the world of the Three Kingdoms. In addition, the Power Up Kit adds 4 new scenarios, a \"Historical mode,\" \"Trial mode,\" and an \"Expert mode.\" What\'s more, Marriages and Births have been included, as well as a chronological table and edit mode.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10813,'X-Men: Mutant Apocalypse','1994-11-01','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Because of a rise of anti-mutant activity in Genosha, Professor Xavier uses Cerebro to scan the island nation and discovers Apocalypse\'s presence there. Genosha\'s government is apparently using Apocalypse to bring their mutant population under control. However, Xavier suspects Apocalypse to follow his own plans and sends five X-Men, Cyclops, Wolverine, Psylocke, Beast and Gambit, to investigate.\n\nX-Men: Mutant Apocalypse combines the gameplay of a side-scrolling brawler like Final Fight with elements of a platformer, that is, players have to fight various enemies and survive the occasional jumping-puzzle. Most levels also feature mid- and end-bosses in form of robots, monsters or known Super-Villains.\n\nEach character has unique abilities and special moves: Cyclops uses his Optic Blast to attack enemies from a distance, Wolverine can climb walls, Psylocke is very agile and the best jumper of the team, Beast can cling to the ceiling while Gambit throws explosive cards at his enemies. Special moves are quite similar to those found in Street Fighter II (Wolverine has a Dragon-Punch-style attack and Gambit\'s Double Kick is virtually identical to M. Bison\'s Scissors Kick), and require similar button combinations.\n\nWhile most stages are unique for each character, some can be played with any of the X-Men. Progress is saved via password.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dgk.jpg'),(10814,'Tom Clancy\'s The Division Franchise Bundle','2019-05-01','Shooter','Xbox One','Welcome to the Division! As a Division agent, you are the last line of defense to restore order to the United States after the events of a pandemic attack. With this bundle, you will receive Tom Clancy\'s The Division and Tom Clancy\'s The Division 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kfs.jpg'),(10815,'Military Madness','2007-07-06','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sharp X68000, Wii, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','Space on Earth has become limited, and mankind has looked to colonize the moon. A group known as the Axis Powers has seized control over most of the lunar surface, and it\'s up to you as a member of the Allied Powers to fight against them. As you move around the map (shown in a top-down 2D perspective), enemy combatants will try and stop you from achieving your goal. Once encountered, the screen shifts view points to a close-up view of the skirmish at hand.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xib.jpg'),(10816,'Napolitan Hotel','2025-03-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A thrilling horror game where strange phenomena and mysterious entities disrupt your night shift. Can you finish your work and become a full-time employee?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kjn.jpg'),(10817,'The Haunted Hospice','2023-08-01','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Haunted Hospice, You got yourself stuck in the hospital while you where searching for your friend. Are you capable and smart enough to escape from the hospital and save your friend? Remember that you are not alone in the hospital there is always danger lurking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9byo.jpg'),(10818,'Cat Guardian','2024-10-23','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cat Guardian is a flexible card game blending tower defense and survival. Manage resources, build, and strategize to protect the Tree of Hope from zombies. Can the cats of Meowx Planet succeed in their mission and survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wz1.jpg'),(10819,'Shining Resonance Refrain','2018-07-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A remastered version of the game Shining Resonance released in 2014 on the PlayStation 3. It includes, all the DLCs, a \'refrain mode\', a higher resolution that runs at 60fps, rebalanced gameplay, new costumes and a new theme song.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2732.jpg'),(10820,'Boom Brothers',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Boom Brothers is a team based multiplayer third person shooter with vehicular combat. Customise your soldier\'s look and talk with teammates and enemies through text to speech chat!\n\nFly fighter and bomber planes, drive tanks and jeeps and fight alongside your friends in Boom Brothers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5c39.jpg'),(10821,'Tetris Mario Bros.','2003-06-08','Platform, Puzzle','Nintendo Entertainment System','A Tetris themed puzzle rom hack for the original Super Mario Bros.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ox6.jpg'),(10822,'Rhythm Knights','2021-09-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rhythm Knights is a unique, musical rhythm game about a group of ragtag knights seeking vengeance on an evil king who destroyed their home. The king bear hired 8 evil monsters to stop you from seeking your revenge! Click the notes as they come down to take down your foes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yim.jpg'),(10823,'Bright Memory Collection','2022-01-27','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tzm.jpg'),(10824,'Marvel Vs Capcom 2 X-Men \'97 Edition Deluxe Arcade','2024-04-25','Fighting, Arcade','Arcade','Marvel Vs Capcom 2 X-Men \'97 Edition Deluxe Arcade is an arcade machine produced by Arcade1Up which bundles in the games Marvel vs Capcom, Marvel vs Capcom 2, Marvel Super Heroes vs Street Fighter, X-Men vs Street Fighter, Marvel Super Heroes, X-Men: Children of the Atom, X-Men: Mutant Apocalypse and Marvel Superheroes in War of the Gems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qe4.jpg'),(10825,'Banjo-Kazooie: Nuts & Bolts','2008-11-12','Platform, Racing, Quiz/Trivia, Adventure','Xbox 360','Banjo-Kazooie: Nuts & Bolts is an action-adventure/vehicle construction/platformer video game developed by Rare and published by Microsoft Game Studios. It was first announced at the X06 Media Briefing. Banjo-Kazooie: Nuts & Bolts is the third installment in the Banjo-Kazooie series and takes place eight years after Banjo-Tooie.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2feg.jpg'),(10826,'Super Senso','2016-11-07','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Android, iOS','\"Inspired by Advance Wars, Super Senso is a FREE synchronous, turn-based action strategy game designed for competitive PvP play. Collect and unleash game changing Senso Mechs! Build a smash-up corp army of rage filled zombies, stealth ninjas, and dinosaurs to crush your enemies! Outplay, outsmart and obliterate your enemies!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rhp.jpg'),(10827,'Star Fox Command','2006-09-21','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy','Wii U, Nintendo DS','Star Fox Command lets you hop into your fight through a unique branching storyline of missions, all rendered in gorgeous 3-D. This game brings a whole new strategic element to the series, with a commander\'s view of the mission. Using the touch screen, players can draw the routes they and their teammates will take. Battle the enemies they encounter as they take over bases and strategically advance across the map. Players can also blow their friends out of the sky, as they dogfight 8 players over a local wireless connection -- or take on 4 players from around the world on Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8iyy.jpg'),(10828,'Peppy Mario','2014-10-16','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Here is a Super Mario Bros. hack which increases the speed of enemies & projectiles coming at you at an alarming high speed rate. Can you dodge your enemies & obstacles in this high paced challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w91.jpg'),(10829,'Flotsam','2019-09-26','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The premiere floating garbage town survival game! Scavenge whatever debris you can from the ocean\'s surface and grow your city while doing your best to survive in this colorful post-apocalyptic world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q6a.jpg'),(10830,'Persona 5: Take Your Heart - Premium Edition','2017-04-04','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4','Persona 5 “Take Your Heart” Premium Edition contains: Game, SteelBook Collectible Case, Soundtrack CD, 4\" Morgana Plush, 64-page Hardcover Art Book, School Bag & Collectible Outer Box\n\nThe 5th numbered game in the series, created by renowned developers -\n\nA deep and engaging storyline - Each case will take you one step closer to the truth veiled in darkness...What awaits our heroes: glory or ruin?\n\nUnique and interesting dungeons with various tricks and traps await - Overcome various obstacles with graceful Phantom Thief action\n\nA stable of talented voice actors have provided English voice-overs while ATLUS’ celebrated localization team offers an English script that provides a faithful and engaging play experience','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oup.jpg'),(10831,'X-Men Origins: Wolverine','2009-05-01','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation Portable','The PSP version of the adaptation of the movie X-Men Origins: Wolverine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zo8.jpg'),(10832,'Micro Drive Festa',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','The Micro Drive Festa is a portable Sega Mega Drive clone console from Micro Drive brand manufactured by Cyber Toy for Russian markets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sm3.jpg'),(10833,'Unearthed',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10834,'Terminator 2: Judgement Day - Chess Wars','1993-12-31','Sport','DOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gcp7qg7yvrsp3eczhbla.jpg'),(10835,'The Terminator: Rampage','1993-12-31','Shooter','DOS','Los Angeles 2029... They thought the holocaust had ended when the Orbital Platform was destroyed.\n\nThey were wrong. SkyNET launched a Doomsday Plan. And you must travel to the past in order to protect the future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zhi.jpg'),(10836,'X-Men: Wolverine\'s Rage','2001-06-15','Platform','Game Boy Color','X-Men: Wolverine\'s Rage is a side-scrolling video game designed for the Game Boy Color. The game\'s plot centres around Wolverine as he pursues Lady Deathstrike, Sabretooth, and Cyber.\n\nUpon discovering schematics that enable her to construct a weapon capable of melting Wolverine\'s adamantium skeleton, Lady Deathstrike resolves to proceed with the machine. Wolverine must undertake any necessary actions to locate her and prevent the impending threat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co980z.jpg'),(10837,'PixelJunk Shooter Ultimate','2014-06-03','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','CAN YOU SAVE THE SCIENTISTS ON APOXUS PRIME?\n\nPixelJunk Shooter Ultimate is a twin-stick shooter with equal elements of action and puzzle solving.\n\nSaving scientists and uncovering the mysteries of an ill-fated research trip requires you to study and manipulate your environment! Blast through rock, grapple huge blocks of ice, detonate explosive gas or unleash torrents of water, lava, magnetic oil and even corrosive stomach acid onto unsuspecting enemies! All powered by an advanced dynamic fluid simulation.\n\nEnjoy PixelJunk Shooter and Shooter 2 in a seamless campaign stretching across 150 levels\nCarry across your progress from PixelJunk Shooter and jump straight in where you left off.\nBrand new UI, enhanced environmental lighting, reimagined VFX and vivid fluids.\nFly the campaign solo or alongside a friend in local co-op\nTake on the world in the chaotic Online Battle mode.\nProve you\'ve got what it takes and rise to the top of the Global Rankings\nPlay in both the “Classic” Shooter art style and the brand new “Ultimate” style.\nCapture your most epic moments with the new Photo Mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x25.jpg'),(10838,'Hana to Otome ni Shukufuku wo: Harukaze No Okurimono','2010-07-08','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','The protagonist Tsukioka Akira is a normal guy living his usual life, except for one thing. His twin sister is sickly and is in the hospital and can’t go to school. Problem is that she’s been sick for too long and she may have to repeat the year, or worse drop out of school.\n\nSo their parents being the most clever people in the world, decided to send him, the splitting image of his sister, over to the all-girls prestigious school to go undercover as his sister, and live her life for a while so that when she comes back, she can take his place without dropping out of school or repeating. Of course it’s a stupid idea and he resisted, but him, being someone who is easily swept away, gave in.\n\nSo thereon starts his incredible life in an all girls school.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mry.jpg'),(10839,'Project: Sword Art','2023-11-15','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Project: Sword Art is a visually stunning, engaging and addictive match-3 game that combines spectacular anime-style artwork, addictive gameplay and an exciting fantasy world. Embark on this magical adventure, defeat seductive girls and amass the largest collection in your gallery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co716a.jpg'),(10840,'Sanguo Warriors VR2','2018-10-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a three-country VR cold weapon fighting game.\nThe game features cold weapon fighting and level challenges, and can be battled with the bosses beyond the imagination. Compared with Sanguo Warriors VR, Sanguo Warriors VR2 system is more concise, the picture is more clear, the monster hitting feeling is improved, the level fun is increased, and the game details are more abundant.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10841,'Dancing Hut','2016-12-28','Music, Indie, Arcade','Android','Ridiculous and funny retro pixel styled pseudo-endless runner full of cute creatures and lots of pixel gore.\r\nThis is a quick and accessible game of skill,easy to approach but hard to master.\r\n\r\nTap to switch legs ,keep balance and try to walk as far as You can!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nRetro 2D pixel graphics\r\nRagdoll physics\r\nEasy one touch control- tap to switch legs,swipe up or down for quick restart\r\nPower ups(Try on the new shoes together with GORE+ mode)\r\nPixel gore\r\nLots of gameplay tricks to find out\r','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/otsfxijtca4alnv9maei.jpg'),(10842,'Cat Gentlemans Play: Insult Spinner 10 Cents','2013-12-16','Sin género','Web browser','insult slap and shoot each other in this versus qwop like','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1x3p.jpg'),(10843,'Juggernaut','1985-12-31','Simulator','ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC','An early truck simulation game from Pete Cooke, a developer that later had more success with Tau Ceti and Tower of Babel. In this you have to drive a truck through a maze-style \"world\" and find the target of your cargo. Then you have to park your truck reverse in a parking bay to reload and refuel it. The game is made with vector graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pxv.jpg'),(10844,'Wolverine','1991-10-01','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Wolverine is an action video game. It is a licensed game based on the Marvel Comics superhero of the same name, as well as the X-Men.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co980y.jpg'),(10845,'Man of Honor','2017-12-07','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play out the revenge-mission of Emilio Gallo, an ex-gangster who’s down on his luck. He’s plotting to kill the men shot him and left him for dead–and anyone else who gets in his way. Gallo was betrayed by the one man he trusted, Nick Scavro, and now he lives only for vengeance and glory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gwx.jpg'),(10846,'Luigi and the Christmas Quest','2021-12-07','Platform, Arcade','Nintendo Entertainment System','A Christmas themed Super Mario Bros. mod','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x3i.jpg'),(10847,'Final Fantasy IV: The Complete Collection','2011-04-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation Portable','After 20 years, Final Fantasy IV and its acclaimed sequel, The After Years, are now combined into one package as the ultimate role-playing game experience. A cast of unforgettable characters fight through one of the grandest stories ever told with stunning new graphics, a re-arranged, award-winning soundtrack, and bonus game features that provide the absolute Final Fantasy IV experience. Experience vibrant visuals and unforgettable melodies - includes all-new 2-D graphics designed for the PSP system\'s 16:9 format. Also includes a new arrangement of one of the most acclaimed video game soundtracks of all time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ybu.jpg'),(10848,'Do You Really Want To Know 2: Before Love','2024-06-24','Adventure','Android','Before Love\n\nA text adventure game co-created by Gamtropy and the Taiwan AIDS Society - LOVE the VOICE.\n\n\"Do You Really Want to Know 2: Before Love\" is a role-playing game that simulates social media interactions. This game is a prequel to the previous game \"Do You Really Want to Know?\" and it tells the story from the perspective of the character \"Nick.\"\n\nA sudden change disrupts what was once a peaceful life. Adapt to the situation, try to find your footing, and embrace who you are. But can family, friends, and lovers accept the new Nick?\n\nPost updates, send messages, make choices. If you reveal your true self, can you still maintain the relationships you want?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lns.jpg');
INSERT INTO `games` VALUES (10849,'Aliens versus Predator 2: Primal Hunt','2002-08-13','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aliens Versus Predator 2: Primal Hunt chronicles the initial breach leading up to the events in Aliens Versus Predator 2, specifically, the destruction of Research Pod 5. The story takes place across nine total mission, with three per species (Predator, Predalien, and Corporate). Each of the three playable characters is out to retrieve a mysterious artifact with the power to confuse and repel the Aliens.\n\nNew features in the game include the ability to play as a tougher Predator-Alien hybrid in single and multiplayer, a new \"energy flechette\" weapon for the Predator, and a new 360-degree motion tracker and deployable sentry guns for the humans. Multiplayer includes four new Deathmatch maps and the ability for the Predator to activate a short range self-destruct bomb when nearly defeated.\n\nA copy of the original Aliens Versus Predator 2 is required to play Aliens Versus Predator 2: Primal Hunt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9flz.jpg'),(10850,'Pocket Arcade Story','2024-06-20','Fighting, Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Create the gaming paradise of your dreams!Reach 5-stars and host tournaments!\nHere comes a new challenger: it\'s the arcade simulation game you\'ve been waiting for!\n\nBuild your very own gaming paradise packed with heaps of game machines and more!\n\nIf some of your customers become regulars, you can test their mettle in fighting game tournaments. Crush the competition with crazy combos and knock out your opponents with a flurry of fists! If you rise from the fray victorious, more and more customers will pile into your arcade!\n\nYou can fine-tune and tweak your arcade as much as you want, with everything from racing games to dance games, photo booths and food stands! Even the strength of your crane games\' claws and the rate at which coins are won is under your control. Utilize all these features and customize to your heart\'s content!\n\nSo, can you create a 5-star arcade that pushes all the right buttons?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uyo.jpg'),(10851,'Nisukka Racing Simulation','2025-03-23','Racing, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Racing simulation game where player only mission is to drive Nisukka racing car and find gold piles at different maps','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kjx.jpg'),(10852,'Curley Laboratory','2022-04-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a facility, scientists are creating a vaccine called \"The Red Vine\" but it becomes unstable. It causes a breach with unknown Anomalies. You must find an exit to escape the laboratory from the creatures around you in the dark. Are you brave enough to survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dau.jpg'),(10853,'Newtonian Inversion','2021-05-28','Puzzle, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Get to the teleporter with a flag on the top.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31nl.jpg'),(10854,'Sonic 1 Easy Mode','2003-07-23','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76p2.jpg'),(10855,'Final Fantasy X HD Remaster','2013-12-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Final Fantasy X HD Remaster was released individually in the Japan and Asia regions. Outside of these regions, only Final Fantasy X has a physical release, but it includes a download code for Final Fantasy X-2. Those who pick up both Final Fantasy X and Final Fantasy X-2 on PlayStation Vita can swap saves between systems to transfer data between the standalone Vita version and the PlayStation 3 counterpart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30so.jpg'),(10856,'Gatoslip: Chapter 0','2023-09-01','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Gatoslip: Chapter 0 is an MS-DOS-themed RPG ROM hack of Sonic the Hedgehog on the SEGA Genesis / SEGA Mega Drive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co713x.jpg'),(10857,'I am Magicami',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','Action-RPG for your smartphone, released in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wzd.jpg'),(10858,'RoboCop Versus the Terminator','1994-12-31','Sin género','Game Boy','Game Boy port of RoboCop Versus The Terminator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vv1.jpg'),(10859,'Ambulance Emergency Simulation','2022-04-25','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','New case information is constantly coming from your radio, you should pick up the patient and take him to the Hospital as soon as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ukm.jpg'),(10860,'North Wind: Eien no Yakusoku','2005-04-28','Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','North Wind is a dating-sim game, is published for PC (Windows) and PlayStation 2.\n\nThe PC version has three chapters, but the PlayStation 2 version has two chapters. The structure is somewhat unique. Usually, the mystery in chapter 1 is revealed in chapter 2, but in this game, chapters 1 and 2 are on the same time line. Some cut scene are added to PlayStation 2 version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9duc.jpg'),(10861,'Sphere Game Colours','2024-01-30','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Sphere Game is about to enchant its loyal fans and win over new enthusiasts. With a complete revitalization, the game offers a completely renewed experience, standing out for stunning visuals and innovative mechanics. Overcome challenging obstacles and dive into an exciting journey, where each stage presents new and thrilling challenges. Your mission is clear: cross the portal to advance to the next level, facing a series of intriguing challenges along the way. Be prepared for an engaging experience where triumph is rewarded, and excitement is always on the horizon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p39.jpg'),(10862,'Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector - T\'au','2024-02-15','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The young and technologically-advanced race is the latest playable faction in Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector. Fourteen new units are available to extend the Greater Good to all the species of the galaxy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7uu6.jpg'),(10863,'PixelCanvas.io',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Place color pixels on an infinite canvas with other players online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/l5bpjztybvfbuakcagod.jpg'),(10864,'Nectar Wars','2022-07-26','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When the kingdom of the Bees becomes consumed with greed, they declare war in their search for the all-powerful Nectar. Led by their Queen, Beeatrix, the bee army has forged alliances across the globe to expand their reign of terror. It is up to the elemental guardians, five hummingbird sisters, to fend off this attack and restore balance to the land.\n\nAn explosive Shoot ‘Em Up like no other, Nectar focuses on five hummingbird sisters, each with their own playstyle. Defeat powerful bosses, unlock new cosmetics, compete in online leaderboards, and save the world in this globe-trotting adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co843q.jpg'),(10865,'Final Fantasy XV: Day One Edition','2016-09-30','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Take the journey, now in ultimate quality. Boasting a wealth of bonus content and supporting ultra high-resolution graphical options and HDR 10, you can now enjoy the beautiful and carefully-crafted experience of FINAL FANTASY XV like never before.\n\nThe Day One Edition of Final Fantasy XV includes the Masamune in-game weapon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vml.jpg'),(10866,'Super Mario Bros. Game Watch','1989-12-31','Platform','Handheld Electronic LCD','Super Mario Bros. is an LCD game watch based off of the NES original. It was released in 1989 as the first of four Mario Nelsonic Game Watches. The game received a direct sequel in the Super Mario Bros. 3 game watch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rad.jpg'),(10867,'Liminality','2025-04-20','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Liminality is a single-player exploration game focused on liminal spaces, but mainly the poolrooms. Dive into the eerie but relaxing lukewarm water of the poolrooms. Navigate through the liminal spaces, where reality blurs, and uncover the secrets that lie beneath the surface','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8o78.jpg'),(10868,'Romance of the Three Kingdoms VII with Power Up Kit','2017-07-25','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Romance of the Three Kingdoms Ⅶ with Power Up Kit\" is an expanded version of \"Romance of the Three Kingdoms Ⅶ,\" which was released in 2000 as the 7th game in the series.\nWith \"Enjoy the lives of all the Romance Warriors!\" as the theme, in this version players can play any of the officers that appear in the game. Experience a range of lifestyles through the lives of the officers; Ruler, Strategist, Governor, Officer, Free Officer, they\'re all available. Immerse yourself in your favorite Warrior and plunge into the chaos of the Three Kingdoms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bpf.jpg'),(10869,'Toribash','2010-07-12','Fighting, Strategy','Wii','Put button-bashing opponents to the sword in a new WiiWare fighting game that lets you get creative as you battle to victory!\n\nToribash is an online fighting game where you’re free to make your own moves! Use precision motion control to create any move you want – the only limit is your imagination! Manipulate your fighter’s joints for maximum impact and take out your opponents with precise hits. Boost your joints for that added speed and strength to hit harder then grab your opponents and slam them to the ground.\n\nWant to make your own fight movies? Just jump into the replay editor. You can enter replays at any point in time and review your fight to catch that mind-blowing move you missed. And when you are done, share it with your buddies through WiiConnect24!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qb7.jpg'),(10870,'BloodRealm: War of Gods','2013-11-14','Card & Board Game','Web browser, Android, iOS','BloodRealm: War of Gods is a card-based strategy and role-play game. BloodRealm: War of Gods offers some intense turn-based combat against the computer and an ever-advancing story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9px5.jpg'),(10871,'Ativeil','2018-02-15','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ativeil is a fun and interesting 3D puzzle game. Cubes, lasers, teddy bears... this game has them all.   \nKick your brain into high gear as you try to solve each puzzle, whilst listening to the relaxing music.   \nDive into the different worlds of the game, from ancient civilizations make your way to the imaginative abstract world.   \nTake your time to figure the many puzzles that are presented to you and learn the mechanics that will help you solve them and reach your goal.   \n   \nCan you figure it out ?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/kfulk9k8gp8yor8ho6rj.jpg'),(10872,'PortalBox','2024-10-11','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game introduces portals to the classic box-pushing game! With the addition of portals, problems that were impossible in the ordinary box-pushing game become possible. Let’s explore this wonderful box-pushing game together!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ekz.jpg'),(10873,'Super Mario Bros. Square Root 5','2000-01-01','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','To say \"Princess Peach! Kidnapped\" and or, that you say, especially at this late hour is not. The \"extra\" to torment the Mario \"shortage\". That’s it. Tricks are required!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6owh.jpg'),(10874,'Shadow of the Tomb Raider: The Nightmare','2019-01-22','Shooter, Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Journey through “The Nightmare,” as Lara Croft faces off against familiar enemies and fallen friends. Explore Croft Manor in a harrowing trial unlike anything she has faced before. In order to obtain a powerful weapon, Lara must conquer, in either single-player or co-op, the latest challenge tomb, “Howl of the Monkey Gods.”\n\n“The Nightmare” offers new customization options with the Scales of Q outfit, whose thick hide and solid bones provide twice as much resistance to melee attacks. The Grip of Fear axe possesses a primal design, optimized for climbing and fighting. When using the axe, enemies are more likely to be knocked down and stay down for longer periods. Finally, White Breath is the new skill that when fired, creates a cloud of hallucinogenic vapor on impact, poisoning enemies to fight against one another.\n\nAs part of the update, tombs from the main campaign, “Judge’s Gaze,” “Underworld Gate,” “Howling Caves”, “Path of Battle,” and “Temple of the Sun” are all now playable in Score Attack and Time Attack modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hdy.jpg'),(10875,'Battle for Atlantis','1990-03-31','Strategy, Card & Board Game','DOS','Battle for Atlantis is a game of global domination, like Risk. Based on Banyon Wars, this game adds EGA graphics and has four factions. Battle takes place among 43 cities divided between 8 islands of varying size, which collectively make up the atoll of Atlantis. Occupying an entire island gives you bonus armies based on the size of the island. Random flooding, seismic activity and revolution can destroy armies, and distribution centers, which are randomly distributed across the map, occasionally double the number of troops residing in them. The maximum number of armies that can be in a city is 9999. The game pits you against 3 computer opponents, and has 7 difficulty levels and a random difficulty level, and you can set the maximum number of armies that each city can have at the beginning of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pxi.jpg'),(10876,'Luigi vs. Wario','2022-10-31','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Luigi must battle Wario in 4 different new worlds to save Peach in this hack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o2z.jpg'),(10877,'Joe Montana Football','1991-01-01','Sport','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, DOS, Sega CD, Sega Master System/Mark III','It\'s a snap! This is your chance to rub shoulder pads with Joe Montana, the man who led the \"Team of the Eighties\" to four Super Bowl Championships. You provide all the fourth quarter heroics, play-calling brilliance, and pinpoint passing as you hit the field against any of 28 pro teams. Call all your own plays! Each team has a playbook with 17 offensive and six defensive options. Pick the play that you think will work best, or take the advice of Joe Montana himself, as he recommends the play he would call in each situation. You control the action on the field by switching to the key players as the play unfolds. Your strength and speed will vary by position, just like the real sport. Knock helmets with the computer or punch holes in a friend\'s defense. Can you keep your head cool and your passing arm hot? Pick your team. Choose the plays. Think you have what it takes to be the next Joe Montana?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mun.jpg'),(10878,'Boxing Legends of the Ring','1993-10-01','Fighting, Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Boxing Legends of the Ring is a boxing game, developed by Sculptured Software and published by Electro Brain.\n\nDuring fights, it is possible to keep track of the participating boxers\' wellbeing by observing the small portraits of the fighters\' faces at the top of the screen. As the fighters receive punishment, these portraits show injuries such as cuts and bruises, the severity of which indicate the fighter\'s health (or lack of). There is also a boxing glove shaped meter at the top of the screen, that indicates how much power a boxer has left in his punches (as in a real fight, the more punches boxers throw, the more tired they become, resulting in weaker punches).\n\nThe fighters movement about the ring is limited to side-stepping left or right; it is impossible to step back or forward. A variety of punches can be thrown; left jabs, crosses to the head, hooks to the body, and uppercuts to the head (all punches except jabs can be thrown with either hand). It is also possible to throw a limited number of so-called \'super punches\', that are essentially either a right cross or a right uppercut, but with extra power. At the start of each round, each boxer is capable of throwing one super-punch at any time, although it becomes possible to throw one more with each knockdown they score against their opponent. Defensive techniques consist of blocking, dodging, and clinching. Each boxer has three attributes: \'power\', \'stamina\', and \'chin\'.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gqk.jpg'),(10879,'Donnie the Chao Final Mix','2017-09-19','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ytp.jpg'),(10880,'Omega 6 The Triangle Stars','2025-02-28','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','OMEGA 6 The Triangle Stars is an adventure game with 16-bit styling, based on the manga by former Nintendo art director, Takaya Imamura.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h2b.jpg'),(10881,'Jigsaw Masterpieces: Cats and Friends on the Suetoshi Farm / Kenta Igarashi','2021-05-13','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10882,'Infinite Guitars','2023-03-30','Music, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Fight mechs with metal-crushing rock in Infinite Guitars, a genre-melting Rhythm RPG featuring vibrant anime-inspired art and a blazing original soundtrack. Battle against war machines with electrifying Guitar Solos, and save the planet!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bfb.jpg'),(10883,'Lords of Magic: Special Edition','1998-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Urak, once peaceful, is now a land of darkness, chaos and death. The people yearn for a champion to drive away the forces of evil. That champion is you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45f1.jpg'),(10884,'X-Men: Mojo World','1996-09-27','Sin género','Sega Game Gear, Sega Master System/Mark III','X-Men: Mojo World, a video game released in 1996 for the Game Gear system, features Wolverine and Rogue as the initial playable X-Men, with Gambit, Cyclops, Havok, and Shard unlockable later on. The game utilizes the same engine as its predecessor, X-Men: Gamesmaster\'s Legacy, and was also launched for the Master System in Brazil by Tec Toy.\n\nSet in a dystopian future, Mojo hosts a deadly TV show where participants engage in fights to the death. Having imprisoned certain X-Men from the past, Mojo aims to recreate their most epic battles. Wolverine and Rogue must enter the game, rescue their friends, and ultimately defeat Mojo to return home.\n\nPlayers start by choosing either Wolverine or Rogue. As each new level is conquered, additional X-Men become available, starting with Gambit, followed by Cyclops, Havok, and finally Shard. If any X-Men perish, the player must restart the level, selecting from the remaining characters. When all X-Men are defeated, the game concludes.\n\nEach character can activate their unique power at will. Wolverine employs his claws, Rogue can fly, Gambit hurls explosive cards, Cyclops unleashes optic blasts, Havok fires plasma blasts, and Shard utilizes energy blasts. Characters have both an energy meter and a power meter, depleting when they take hits or use their powers. Energy and power-restoring items can be found throughout the game.\n\nThe gameplay primarily revolves around navigating through six levels, with each level culminating in a boss battle against well-known comic characters such as Magneto, Fitzroy, a Sentinel, and others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4eb5.jpg'),(10885,'Beach Club Simulator','2024-03-25','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beach Club Simulator goes beyond just managing a beach club; it also offers an impressive social interaction and relationship system. In the game, you can engage with customers, make friends with them, and experience relationships.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zr9.jpg'),(10886,'Attack on Titan: Wall Sina, Goodbye','2013-12-18','Visual Novel','Blu-ray Player','Side story about Annie Leonhart that is included in the anime Blu-ray/DVD box vol. 6.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qi3.jpg'),(10887,'Run Jump Fail','2018-05-02','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You wanna run? You wanna jump? You\'re gonna fail. Again. And Again. \n \nBut its fun to fail...right? \n \nTake control of HappyMan and hop skip and jump your way past low walls, big balls and spinning red things! A bunch of obstacles await, so get to it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2927.jpg'),(10888,'Devader','2019-09-02','Shooter, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Defend a dying civilization from the Krin relentless invaders. Become the Devader. 90s style shoot\'em up with awesome bosses and multiple endings.\nDevader has 42 waves. Every 6 waves you must fight a large boss, after which you get to upgrade your robot and a new game mechanic is added (nukes, turrets,...). There are 12 different upgrade paths that influence your robot, play style and the outcome.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1q42.jpg'),(10889,'The Secret of Chunky Salsa','2010-02-25','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98hq.jpg'),(10890,'Mighty Dungeons','2015-03-03','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Enjoy hours of dungeons crawling and slashing a-la HeroQuest meets DungeonMaster. Mighty Dungeons is also customizable, submit new quests, campaigns, monsters, weapons and other items. Visit the workshop for more info.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/efisc0ggadiggfkkkxd2.jpg'),(10891,'Rouge the Bat in Sonic the Hedgehog','2019-01-02','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','A ROM hack/mod for Sonic the Hedgehog which changes Sonic for Rouge the Bat. The new character has new abilities such as the glide and an aerial downward attack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4t33.jpg'),(10892,'Wolverine: Adamantium Rage','1994-12-31','Fighting, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Released in 1994 for both the Super NES and the Sega Genesis, \"Wolverine: Adamantium Rage\" is a platform-action video game. Teeny Weeny Games developed the Genesis version, while the Super NES version was created by Bits Studios. Despite being developed independently, the two versions share a common opening storyline and gameplay, though they differ in certain key aspects. Notably, it is one of the pioneering video games to incorporate a recharging health system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4p1h.jpg'),(10893,'Terminator 3: Rise of the Machines','2003-09-01','Fighting, Shooter','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, Legacy Mobile Device, PlayStation 2','Terminator 3: Rise of the Machines is a first-person shooter video game based on the film of the same title, with elements of hand-to-hand combat in third-person perspective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4eaj.jpg'),(10894,'Shadows of Larth','2020-02-20','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unleash your blade, and cleanse Larth from beasts , men or both, Explore freely the realms of the Lower Larth and decide its fate. Shadows of Larth brings you the joy to fight in a multi stance based melee combat system with RPG elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wyl.jpg'),(10895,'Bunny','2025-04-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"BUNNY\" is a side-scrolling action game where Bunny and Smallbird embark on an adventure to find their friends. Control Bunny as you navigate through stages, overcoming obstacles and squeezing through walls. There\'s no game over, so everyone can play through to the end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o3u.jpg'),(10896,'Whalien: Unexpected Guests','2023-01-24','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Push and Pull your way through this heartfelt adventure! Fin, the mechanical whale you call home, is plagued by mischievous Squiddies. As Ernest Hemingwhale you set out on a Fin-tastic journey to help your friend with his unexpected guests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5esw.jpg'),(10897,'Dyer Expedition',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dyer Expedition is a puzzle adventure game with light Lovecraftian horror elements and a story inspired by Lovecraft\'s 1931 novella At the Mountains of Madness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63xo.jpg'),(10898,'The Uncanny X-Men','1989-12-01','Shooter, Arcade','Nintendo Entertainment System','The Uncanny X-Men is an overhead-view action game. Players commence by selecting two X-Men from the roster, with the second controlled by another player or the computer. They then choose one of five levels, including a practice level. The objective in each level is to reach the concealed \'command centre\' and demolish it. All X-Men share similar abilities, allowing movement in any direction, jumping, and attacking. Half of the characters (Storm, Iceman, Cyclops) possess long-range attacks, while the other half (Wolverine, Nightcrawler, Colossus) need to engage enemies in close combat. Each X-Man can endure a specific number of hits before being defeated. If both X-Men fall in battle, players can select two more to attempt the level again until all X-Men are used.\n\nPower-ups include an \"S\" that stops time, temporary invincibility, and a health restore. Additionally, a Magnet power-down (symbolizing Magneto) temporarily immobilizes the X-Men.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oy8.jpg'),(10899,'Sonic Zoom','2015-06-18','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Experience the rom hack filled with new levels, visuals and music from the same mind that made the \"Sunky the Game\" series. What are you waiting for? Milk and Cereal? Just go play it already.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7eva.jpg'),(10900,'I`m Turkey',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','I\'m Turkey is a simple 2D simulator with elements of survival, with ordinary graphics and usual, but nice plot. In this game you need to overcome various obstacles, playing for a Turkey.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10901,'Ys: Book I & II','2008-09-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Wii, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','Ys Book I & II chronicles the first adventures of Adol Christin, a young, red-haired swordsman on a quest to unlock the secrets of an ancient kingdom. As Adol, you search the island of Esteria, gathering clues to unravel the mystery of Ys. Fight monsters that lurk in caves and towers with physical or magical attacks, and use your brain to make your way through dangerous areas filled with traps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gs9.jpg'),(10902,'Spleezy Park','2025-12-31','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Spleezy Park is an horror parkour-themed game where you enter in a park to search for your little brother, but you didn\'t knew what you would need to kill to get to him.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97nq.jpg'),(10903,'Super Mario Bros. Crowd Control','2022-09-15','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','A rom hack for Super Mario Bros. where Twitch chat can interact with the game by giving the player various advantages and disadvantages during gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69vc.jpg'),(10904,'Terminator 2: Judgement Day','1991-02-01','Fighting, Puzzle, Racing','ZX Spectrum','You are T-800 in the action packed game play of Terminator 2. This game takes place in the not too distant future that we may live to see. Battle rages between man and machines - machines that are being controlled by Skynet. In an effort to quash the rebellion, Skynet sends a terminator back through time to 1994 with a directive to destroy the rebel leader John Conner while still a child. T-800 is then sent by the rebels to protect their future leader.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10905,'Animal Crossing: Pocket Camp Complete','2024-12-03','Simulator','Android, iOS','Animal Crossing: Pocket Camp Complete is the offline successor to Animal Crossing: Pocket Camp, developed to provide a full, standalone experience. This version retains the core gameplay features of designing your own campsite and talking to villagers, while offering an accessible way for players to experience the game after the original Pocket Camp\'s End-of-Life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zo6.jpg'),(10906,'Session: Skate Sim - Brandalised Pack','2023-03-09','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','The pack contains: 4 T-shirts, 4 sweatshirts and 8 exclusive skateboards, all in Brandalised colours.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co601g.jpg'),(10907,'Sector a Training Facilitea','2019-08-17','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m5y.jpg'),(10908,'Sega Genesis Classics: Series 1','2010-06-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The first in a series of compilation video games released by Sega for the PC. It features ten Sega video games that were originally released for the Sega Genesis / Sega Mega Drive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sku.jpg'),(10909,'No Time to Live','2015-09-30','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a story about an office clerk who tries to leave monotonous routine of life and do a book. And if he could find the time for his dream it depends on you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98nu.jpg'),(10910,'God Killer Aria',NULL,'Sin género','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','God Killer Aria (also known as Kamigoroshi Aria) is a 3D role-playing game developed by EXNOA. The game will be available on both PC and Android.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49lp.jpg'),(10911,'2 in 1 Game Pack I Spider-Man: Mysterio\'s Menace + X2: Wolverine\'s Revenge','2005-08-22','Sin género','Game Boy Advance','A Marvel themed double pack featuring two games on a single cartridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97ql.jpg'),(10912,'Kill to Live','2022-01-21','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your health decreases with every second and extermination of enemies is the most effective way to restore it. Don\'t sit still if you want to stay alive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ijp.jpg'),(10913,'Pipe Mania','2008-12-31','Puzzle, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable, Nintendo DS, PlayStation 2','Pipe Mania is a puzzle game where players must place random tiles in order to help water flow to its destiny.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co728i.jpg'),(10914,'Biophage',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are a single-celled organism.\n\nClimb walls and ceilings, and find new ways to build up and maintain speed!\n\nPunt your enemies into the air and finish them off with a grab and slam!\n\nExplore the strange ecosystems laid out in your path, and feel the essence of nature!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t73.jpg'),(10915,'X-Men: Mutant Academy 2','2001-09-18','Fighting','PlayStation','X-Men: Mutant Academy 2 is a PlayStation video game, the sequel to X-Men: Mutant Academy. Both feature the X-Men in a 3-D fighting arena similar to Mortal Kombat 4.\n\nLike its predecessor, the game allows the player to select from several heroes and villains and includes many of the signature moves from the comic. The game also includes a behind-the-scenes look at X-Men: The Movie concept sketches, costumes and other similar material.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kzy.jpg'),(10916,'Surviving Ceres','2025-05-02','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Surviving Ceres is an open world survival game with an emphasis on crafting and base building. Export rare materials and manufactured goods to earn funding used to unlock new technologies and upgrades. Bring in colonists from earth to work advanced facilities to terraform the planet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r1z.jpg'),(10917,'Sherlock Holmes: The Awakened - Premium Edition','2023-04-11','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Premium Edition Includes:\n- Sherlock Holmes The Awakened\n- Exclusive Pre-Launch DLC - The Sleuth\'s Attire (3 costumes)\n- Set of digital wallpapers\n- The Whispered Dreams Side Quest Pack\n- Sherlock Holmes The Awakened Soundtrack\n- Sherlock Holmes The Awakened Artbook','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68pz.jpg'),(10918,'Sonic the Hedgehog: Character Pak',NULL,'Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sonic the Hedgehog: Character Pak adds the option to play as four new characters in the first Sonic game:Classic Sonic, Modern Sonic, Luigi and Link.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qjp.jpg'),(10919,'KeyWe','2021-08-31','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','KeyWe is a cute, co-operative postal puzzler starring Jeff and Debra, two small kiwi birds working in a whimsical post office. They must jump, flap, peck and butt-slam their way across an interactive landscape of levers, bells and buttons to get those messages delivered on time!\n\nEncounter perilous postal environments and navigate seasonal hazards while waddling through the Telepost’s various mail rooms, and partner up with a pal to help these adorable kiwis complete their tasks, whatever the weather. Unlock new accessories to customise your kiwi and become the best-dressed mail bird in Bungalow Basin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3jkn.jpg'),(10920,'Final Fantasy XIV: Complete Edition','2017-06-20','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The complete edition includes the award-winning FINAL FANTASY XIV: A Realm Reborn and the Heavensward and Stormblood expansion packs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9heg.jpg'),(10921,'Cosminers',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Start your career as a cosmic miner! During the day, mine raw materials, create new tools and lethal weapons. Build up your base to survive the night attacks of rampaging monsters. Protect yourself, gain wealth and fly away in a rocket, or turn your outpost into an impregnable fortress!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9glr.jpg'),(10922,'Shall we date?: Hero in Love','2013-12-25','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','“Shall we date?: Hero in Love” is a romantic action fantasy game depicting a life-or-death battle between heroes, supernatural powers (a samurai: telepathist, a cowboy: clairvoyant, a ninja: teleporter), and enemies','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rd0.jpg'),(10923,'Marsi\'s Adventures','2022-11-30','Sin género','PlayStation 4','Marsi\'s Adventures is a classic single-screen 2D platformer where you have to collect three stars, overcome some obstacles and get to the final teleport.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uza.jpg'),(10924,'Paradise Ocean',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10925,'Penguin Park 3D','2019-02-17','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take care of a bunch of penguins! Feed them fish, clean their poo, and give them party hats! Make them do tricks to earn money, and buy eggs to get more penguins. Make sure they don\'t die or your park will be closed! Can you breed 10 penguins before you\'re laid off?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21xj.jpg'),(10926,'Monster Hunter i','2006-02-06','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Legacy Mobile Device','An offline-only port of Monster Hunter G for i-mode cell phones.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9phf.jpg'),(10927,'Super Smash Bros. Ultimate: Fighters Pass Vol. 2','2020-01-28','Fighting','Nintendo Switch','The second and final set of DLC characters for Super Smash Bros. Ultimate.\nFighter DLC to be released by the end of 2021.\n\n\"Expand your roster even more with six additional playable fighters, plus additional stages, and music as they release. Purchasers will also receive a bonus Mii Swordfighter outfit: Ancient Soldier Gear.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25m5.jpg'),(10928,'Aviano','2021-05-03','Fighting, Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aviano is an exploration game from other worlds, where the player plays an archaeologist who wants to solve a mystery! And it will take him to fly with his hang glider in other ways, challenging your pilot skills until the end of each level. The controls are easy to understand but skill based, the physics-based flight model. It offers a realistic flight experience, similar to a real flying wing, am with higher speeds to entertain and give speed sensations to the player…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co355d.jpg'),(10929,'Disney/Pixar Toy Story and Beyond!','2006-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7x2k.jpg'),(10930,'Master of Bow','2025-01-24','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Lock, draw, and conquer. Claim your title as the ultimate Master of Bow!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ah0.jpg'),(10931,'Idle Monsters','2021-06-01','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Android, iOS','Abandoned RPG and monster combination! Let\'s master the mutation and heredity and grow the strongest monster! All battles and dungeon searches will proceed automatically. It is a game specialized for those who want to enjoy the game in their spare time. Incremental game x hack and slash x monster combination. An infinitely playable incremental game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co397m.jpg'),(10932,'Mini Madness','2021-12-10','Racing, Sport, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Mini Madness is an arcade racing game inspired by such titles as Re-Volt or Micro Machines. Players are racing on crazy, expanded vertically tracks placed in a single-family house and in its large garden, by taking control over miniature remote cars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3it5.jpg'),(10933,'Summit Way','2018-08-21','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Android, iOS','\"In Summit Way, place bridges between a small group of hills to link them all together and create in a loop. Choose each bridge carefully as they can\'t cross each other, can\'t be too steep and they may offend the inhabitants of the attached hills! \n \nSummit Way is ad-supported, with optional donations to hide the ads and support the game development. \n \nSummit Way offers 10 regions with a total of 72 levels, from a relaxing start to more challenging levels towards the end. Start off by finding any solution to the first few levels, letting yourself be guided by the sound of the wood falling in place. And then, challenge yourself by finding the shortest possible path to earn a 4 stars score on all levels, and share the trickiest solutions with your friends!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bctv3yvdifbfvckypwlk.jpg'),(10934,'Final Fantasy V: Whirlwind','2024-05-31','Role-playing (RPG)','Super Famicom','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8js1.jpg'),(10935,'Imaginary Range','2011-05-05','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','A half game, half comic book hybrid, developed by h.a.n.d. inc and published by Square Enix for iOS devices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7uzn.jpg'),(10936,'Disciples: Sacred Lands Gold','2014-10-07','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Disciples Gold takes the phenomenal gameplay, stunning graphics, over 100 spells and a powerful scenario editor of Disciples and adds new scenarios and gameplay features that set the new standard in Turn-Based Strategy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ik5.jpg'),(10937,'Toy Story Drop!','2019-04-24','Puzzle','Windows Phone, Android, iOS','The world of Toy Story comes to life in this free-to-play, match-3 game! Help Woody, Buzz, and favorite Disney Pixar Toy Story characters overcome larger-than-life obstacles as you match through hundreds of exciting puzzles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20r9.jpg'),(10938,'Dot Piece Puzzle: Dotpicture','2024-12-12','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Combine Dot Pieces to complete Puzzles!Solve puzzles featuring adorable pixel art of animals, food, and more.Collect all the cute pixel art puzzles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co859a.jpg'),(10939,'Sonic 3 Omega',NULL,'Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10940,'Lumiterra: Embers of the Legacy','2023-07-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Lumiterra is a multiplayer, open-world survival crafting game where you can battle, farm with your friends, or explore mysterious creatures in a vast world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6the.jpg'),(10941,'Disney Activity Center: Toy Story 2','2000-12-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Buzz, Woody, and the rest of the toys are back! Join in the hilarious fun of Toy Story 2 through a variety of game and activities with something for everyone--arcade action keeps you moving, a strategy game challenges your wits, and creative fun lets your imagination run wild.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mkz.jpg'),(10942,'Sonic 3 & Amy Rose','2012-07-08','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','A ROM hack of Sonic 3 & Knuckles which swaps Sonic for Amy Rose, with a different moveset.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rtm.jpg'),(10943,'Ara: History Untold','2024-09-24','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build a nation and lead your people throughout history to the pinnacles of human achievement as you explore new lands, develop arts and culture, conduct diplomacy, and go head-to-head with your rivals to prove you are the greatest ruler ever known.\n\nFeaturing both familiar and innovative gameplay mechanics, Ara: History Untold delivers an evolution in historical grand strategy with no pre-set paths to victory, leading to endless possibilities. Your choices will define the world you create, your experience, and your legacy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53ep.jpg'),(10944,'Chocobo GP','2022-01-12','Racing, Sport, Arcade','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','Get set for a new racing experience in Chocobo GP, featuring a roster of dozens of Chocobo characters, complete with their own unique abilities and variants. Choose your favorite Chocobo series character, and race through familiar tracks set in the Final Fantasy universe. It won\'t be easy crossing the finish line first. Find magic stones called Magicites (including Fire, Water, and more) throughout the track and equip them to take out the competition. Engine customization options will be available, as well as local and online multiplayer. Up to 64 players can compete in a bracket-style tournament to determine the racing champion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k7p.jpg'),(10945,'Aveyond 4: Shadow of the Mist','2016-02-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Boyle Wolfbane wanted to rule the world. He failed. Miserably. Forced into retirement early, Boyle now spends his days arguing with haunted trees and scaring off the occasional knight. At least he still has Fang, his loyal storm wolf. Things could be worse. He could have been born a hero.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ihr.jpg'),(10946,'Sega Genesis Classics: Series 3','2010-10-26','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The third in a series of compilation video games released by Sega for the PC. It features ten Sega video games that were originally released for the Sega Genesis / Sega Mega Drive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sky.jpg'),(10947,'Chizome Kijo','2022-05-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A savage action game where you become stronger as you slaughter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xay.jpg'),(10948,'Sonic 1: WTF Lame','2009-07-16','Sin género','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dvp.jpg'),(10949,'PUBG: Battlegrounds - Season 16','2022-02-15','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Season 16 includes weapon balancing, a trip back to the smugglers\' isle, a new ranked season and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4orn.jpg'),(10950,'TNA Wrestling',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10951,'Rockman Dash / Rockman Dash 2 Value Pack','2009-01-01','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','PlayStation Portable','Rockman Dash / Rockman Dash 2 Value Pack is a compilation of Mega Man Legends and Mega Man Legends 2 released for PlayStation Portable in Japan in January 2009. The games are the same as their separate PSP versions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3uu7.jpg'),(10952,'Carpe Lucem - Seize the light','2016-04-05','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Meditative puzzle game in virtual reality\n\nSolve tricky puzzles in a world full of mysterious secrets. Make steampunk styled flowers bloom using the power of light rays to unveil new worlds. In a relaxed, no pressure environment players immerse themselves into this beautifully designed virtual reality.\n\nGuide and adjust the light rays, change their colors to match the flowers, use mirrors, prisms, magnets, teleporters and more to direct them to where they need to be.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w35.jpg'),(10953,'Imagicard: Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle','Leapster Explorer/LeadPad Explorer','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wcb.jpg'),(10954,'7 Pillars','2017-06-20','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Short (~ 3 hrs of gameplay in one play through) single player RPG with turn based combat. Easy to pick up for first time RPG players. Accumulating enough XP will automatically level up your character. All you have to worry about from a customization standpoint is different weapons if you find them that are specific to each character. Higher level bosses will most likely require items (such as healing potions and revival stimulants), so exploration and random encounter battles are crucial for end game success.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29dp.jpg'),(10955,'ExoMecha',NULL,'Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','ExoMecha is a brand new free-to-play online competitive first-person shooter that takes place in Omecha, a new and untouched planet with exotic environments. ExoMecha offers you breathtaking gaming experience with its flexible playing style, mechs, unique gadgets and abilities, and boss battles.\n\n​ExoMecha is an immersive experience with team-based large scale battles, a unique battle royale game mode, and an objective-based game mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t8x.jpg'),(10956,'Flower Town','2013-06-18','Simulator','Nintendo 3DS','Flower Town is a gardening game developed by Grezzo. The game is loosely based on Mendelian genetics, in which players grow various types of plants, aiming to become a Master Gardener by growing twenty unique breeds of plants. Growing plants are watered by visiting Miis encountered on StreetPass. After a flower has bloomed, players can receive new seeds by breeding their plant with plants of other Miis. Flowers can be arranged in several gardens where the player may take screenshots that are saved to the Nintendo 3DS Camera. Flowers and unwanted seeds can be sold for money, which can be spent on new accessories, seeds, and plots. Job quests are available where the player is tasked with growing plants of specific qualities to fulfill customer requirements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co854u.jpg'),(10957,'Keepsake County','2022-03-17','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Burglarize hideous farmhouses in the middle of nowhere and get outta dodge.\n\nYou have moments before the cops arrive to rob a procedurally-generated house that you\'ve never seen before. If you\'re caught, residents will call the police even sooner... or take the law into their own hands.\n\nLoot wacky cartoon houses from the safety of your home! Lockpick, cut the power, tie up residents, and steal everything that isn\'t nailed down.\n\nPark your car out of sight to avoid detection, or at the front door for a quick getaway. Crank your handbrake to drift back onto the highway!\n\nDon\'t get too cozy: houses take on a different configuration every round, with new themes, layouts, and hauls for you to get acquainted with.\n\nThese hand-drawn residents may not be the smartest, but they aren’t dumb. Denizens hear noises, see lockpicked doors, notice large stolen items, and will call the police - or hunt you themselves.\n\nEnter wherever, and leave whenever: Climb in through the basement, or take a trampoline straight to the roof! Get the midnight bonus for leaving early, or evade the cops for more loot.\n\nLevel up your gear from the Town Hub between runs with perks - lockpick faster, delay the cops’ arrival, or unlock special tools!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6uja.jpg'),(10958,'Monster Hunter G','2009-04-23','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Wii, PlayStation 2','Monster Hunter G is a Japan-exclusive expansion of Monster Hunter for PlayStation 2. It featured more Quests, equipment, and recolors of the original monsters, as well as a brand new tier of \"G-class\" or \"G-rank\" Quests. The Hunter Rank cap was increased from HR20 to HR30, and many quality of life features were added to this version.\n\nMonster Hunter G was originally released on PlayStation 2 in 2005 but rereleased on the Nintendo Wii in 2009. The Wii version features many gameplay changes that made it more akin to the preceding Monster Hunter game, Monster Hunter Freedom Unite.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co406n.jpg'),(10959,'TMNT','2007-03-20','Sin género','PlayStation Portable','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6h07.jpg'),(10960,'Super-Spatial','2023-04-10','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore, build, and master the art of automation. Build your base, discover colorful new worlds, and develop new technologies as you tame the far reaches of space and search for a way to return to Earth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95px.jpg'),(10961,'Half-Life 2: Year Long Alarm','2012-04-24','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Year Long Alarm is a Half-Life 2 single-player mod that is set in an abandoned mine outside of City 17. A Scanner has discovered you, and the Combine are closing in on your position. Fight your way through a vast underground mine to try and meet up with the Resistance members of Station 12.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dxw.jpg'),(10962,'Teenage Super Ninja Plumbers','2022-10-05','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','The sewers of The Mushroom Kingdom have been infested by teenage mutant ninja turtles, It’s up to Mario and Luigi to save the day by becoming Teenage Super Ninja Plumbers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p5e.jpg'),(10963,'Capcom Coin-Op Classics Series 1','1999-12-31','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Capcom\'s Coin-op Collection Volume 1 is a compilation of 14 arcade games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ro4.jpg'),(10964,'Piko-piko: Koisuru Kimochi no Nemuru Basho','2008-08-29','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The story takes place in the near future. As globalization swept the world, almost all of industries in Japan declined. One and only industry that survived is moe industry and Japanese people get together and work hard to develop moe industry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rku.jpg'),(10965,'Syobon Action NES Edition','2021-03-02','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Syobon Action NES Edition features 5 difficult levels made to test your mario skills. It also has a stylized Syobon Action design, changing the sprites of objects and enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sbj.jpg'),(10966,'Time Slip','1993-02-01','Shooter','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','On the reptilian planet of Tirmat, scientists have discovered a rift in space and plan to use it to transport the planet\'s inhabitants before the planet is extinguished by sending their elite army through the rift and invade their closest neighbor...Earth. However, to ensure their success they send their army into Earth\'s past in hopes of avoiding any modern weapons and increase their chances of saving their planet. However, Earth has learned of their evil plot and has developed a experimental time portal and has sent their own one man army to stop them.\n\nThe player takes control of Dr. Vincent Gilgamesh who has acquired a massive arsenal including pistols, machine guns, rocket launchers and many more heavy weapons and must travel through various time periods including Medieval times, prehistoric times, Ancient Rome and Egypt and even the distant future. The gameplay is similar to Contra where the player advances through the stages, shooting at various enemies and collecting power-ups and must also avoid various traps and pitfalls scattered throughout the levels. There are also the standard bosses at the end of each stage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c0s.jpg'),(10967,'NoReload Heroes: Enhanced Edition','2021-03-11','Shooter, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','NoReload Heroes Enhanced Edition is a couch co-op twin stick shooter for 1 to 4 that combines the devilishly engaging combat with the shenanigans of having your friends over for game night. Fight the mighty wizbot Mephisto and take on his hordes of henchbots to reclaim the mage’s tower. NoReload Heroes Enhanced Edition sees you fighting your way through 18 levels, 40+ types of enemies, and all with an arsenal of over 150 weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tvd.jpg'),(10968,'Vacation Tycoon','2022-08-22','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Android, iOS','Build the world\'s most fabulous vacation resort and go from luxurious to ludicrous!\n\nRedefine what \"Vacation\" means as you restore your chain of failing resorts and take them from luxurious to ludicrous! In the most literal IDLE game of all time, you will fill your island paradise with the most over-the-top amenities to thrill and delight your visitors. Staffed with the wildest team of managers around, from squids and cyborgs to gurus and ghosts, your vacation destination literally has it all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71rd.jpg'),(10969,'Mindhive: Wilds','2023-08-19','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mindhive: Wilds invites you to embark on a journey in an open-world adventure game set within the Mindhive universe.\n\nUncover the mysteries of a vast and diverse world, where dense forests, snow-capped mountains, and desolate deserts await your exploration. Dive into a complex crafting system to forge powerful weapons, tools, and magical artifacts, all while crafting your destiny. Create your own refuge amidst the challenges, and uncover secrets that shape your path. With a compelling original soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9piu.jpg'),(10970,'Execute Daddy: Papa ga Nandemo Shinu Game','2023-11-30','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this ADV game, you become the administrator of a netherworld where you have lost both your memories and your body, and you have to recover your lost memories and body. The criminals who come back to life after execution after execution are cute, and their executions are like a show.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fqs.jpg'),(10971,'Fractured Minds','2019-11-14','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Fractured Minds is an immersive artistic short game, exploring anxiety and mental health issues.\n\nWinner of the BAFTA Young Game Designers Award, Fractured Minds is a game created by 17-year-old Emily Mitchell, with the hope of aiding understanding and awareness of mental illness.\n\nEmbark on a journey through the human psyche and experience six atmospheric and thought-provoking chapters, each symbolising a different aspect or challenge associated with mental health issues; from isolation to anxiety, with everyday situations being distorted beyond recognition.\n\nRaw, emotive and earnest, Fractured Minds demonstrates that video games are capable of communicating vital messages in imaginative ways. It is a game that seeks to encourage empathy and champion support for the millions living with mental health issues.\n\nFractured Minds is proud to support Safe in our World, a gaming industry charity striving for better mental health awareness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1t6x.jpg'),(10972,'Ether Quest',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10973,'Extra Mario Bros.','2005-10-06','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','A Super Mario Bros. romhack inspired by and incorporating elements from Metroid.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ehz.jpg'),(10974,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Master Splinter\'s Training Pack','2015-11-03','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Nintendo 3DS','Two of Nickelodeon\'s Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles games on a single cartridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yld.jpg'),(10975,'Fallout 76: Ghoul Within','2025-03-18','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Unleash your inner ghoul. Today\'s Ghoul Within update allows Wastelanders to leave their humanity behind and play as a Ghoul.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pz8.jpg'),(10976,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Mutants & Monsters Mayhem','2006-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Plug & Play','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Battle for the City is a dedicated console system published by Tech2Go and developed by WayForward Technologies. The game is based on the 2003 TV series.\n\nGameplay consists of players selecting one of four Turtles and scrolling from left to right, hopping on platforms and defeating enemies whilst collecting a number of keys to open the gate. Upon opening the gate, the player will enter a room where a boss lies in wait.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yif.jpg'),(10977,'Sonic in Super Mario Bros.','2022-09-03','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','A character hack of Super Mario Bros. that replaces the famous plumber with Sonic the Hedgehog. Features drastic changes made to emulate the Genesis Sonic games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s6p.jpg'),(10978,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles 3: Shredder\'s Last Stand','1991-12-31','Adventure, Arcade','Handheld Electronic LCD','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles 3: Shredder\'s Last Stand is a stand-alone handheld video game by Konami, released in 1991. It is based off the 1987 TV series.\n\nThis game was adapted for a Japan-exclusive 1994 release under the title of \"Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles LSI Game & Electrical Note.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zyd.jpg'),(10979,'Counter Recon 2: The New War','2022-07-28','Shooter, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Counter Recon 2: The New War is a solo single player/first person shooter game. Enjoy a thrilling FPS game with a diverse play mode and various weapons that can be unlocked by leveling up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51xs.jpg'),(10980,'Groups of Seven','2014-08-25','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Connect objects to the category world they belong to.\n\nEach object can have multiple categories and will appear more than once. Your goal is to find all possible 61 connections.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jla.jpg'),(10981,'Itadaki Street: Dragon Quest & Final Fantasy 30th Anniversary','2017-10-19','Quiz/Trivia','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','Square-Enix\'s flagship board game simulator celebrates 30 years of its two most influential RPG series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co205s.jpg'),(10982,'Mario\'s Peregrination: Kingdom Elementum Phantasia','2016-10-19','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Mario embarks on phantasmagorical peregrination through multifarious realms, possessing symbolic elementum. To hopefully bring glorious cessation by defeating devilish lordific presences in they\'re looming chateau\'s.\n\nThis hack was made by Vamperumbra and has 48 exits','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10983,'Berry Madness','2023-02-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Berry Madness you need to find all the berries in the world to beat the game. Berry Madness takes place in beatiful world. You need to find all the berries to become a champion berry hunter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65wr.jpg'),(10984,'Super Diego Bros. 2',NULL,'Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10985,'Synth Race','2025-03-21','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Race against up to 12 friends in Synth Race. Run, jump, and slide your way to victory across 16 levels featuring a variety of obstacle courses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k86.jpg'),(10986,'Matchsticks: Coffee Break Club','2021-07-30','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','We’ve been taught not to play with fire, but the matches of this game aren’t going to burn you! Challenge your mind moving, adding and removing matchsticks until you find the correct solution. How many tries do you need to solve each level?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5our.jpg'),(10987,'Skyway','2016-12-02','Sport, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Skyway is a third person puzzle-platformer set in an abstract universe! Jump, Climb, and Dash your way through an increasingly difficult fortress in the sky! Solve the puzzles, score the fastest time, and challenge yourself to master the controls!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/l5pb6kb3wo4ohmebosiu.jpg'),(10988,'Rise of the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Road Riot','2019-12-31','Racing','Web browser','It\'s a race around NYC! Play as your favorite Rise of Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles heroes or mutants in this top-down racer. Compete in tournaments, quick races, or give the Free Spin mode a whirl. Can you beat the best time?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ylf.jpg'),(10989,'Super Mario Bros.','1986-06-25','Platform','Game & Watch','Super Mario Bros. for the Game & Watch was a game that was released on the Crystal Screen and New Wide Screen unit. While the exact date of its release is unknown, it can be confirmed that it was released sometime in June of 1986 and March of 1988. A special edition of the game, which came with a winner certificate, a license card, and battery cover stickers, and a copy of the game in a Diskun-shaped case was given away in August of 1987.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3aze.jpg'),(10990,'Gunnery Cell',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','This is a Rogue bullet shooting game, you will play a resurrected cell in the arena, use the unique weapons you get, use the purest violence to kill the enemies in the arena and survive, collect energy to make yourself stronger, until finally incarnate as a god!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qo2.jpg'),(10991,'Toad\'s Christmas Adventure','2008-12-23','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Santa’s evil brother has stolen Toad’s little sister (Toadette) and toad’s gift! You have to play though the frozen North Pole of the Mushroom Kingdom to save them!\n\nTCA is a hack featuring level changes, animation, and a bunch of assembly hacks to change the game into something new. This hack has the same level of difficulty as the original Super Mario Bros, and I do hope you can enjoy it without savestates.\n\nThere is a catch however, since it is only a short game (4 levels) you only start off with one life. However, there are lives scattered though all 4 levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55eo.jpg'),(10992,'KovaaK\'s: Anime Pack','2024-02-26','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enhance your aim training aesthetic with KovaaK\'s first cosmetic DLC, the Anime Pack. Personalize your experience with anime-inspired visuals while supporting the development team. Includes character skins, skies, props, and more, playable by all users, promoting community creativity.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(10993,'Anata o Yurusanai','2008-01-06','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Anata o Yurusanai is a visual novel, which mainly consists of reading text and occasionally interacting with the development of the story. The game uses the PSP in a way it wasn\'t meant to be used, vertically, making the visuals resemble a comic book.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k2e.jpg'),(10994,'Deathsmiles','2009-04-23','Shooter, Indie','Arcade, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox 360','Deathsmiles is CAVE\'s bullet-hell shoot-\'em-up where you take the role of one of five Angels to defend the magical land of Gilverado from an invasion by Hell itself! Eradicate this devilish assault!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p8y.jpg'),(10995,'Dead Sky','2013-10-05','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dead Sky takes place admist the chaos of a mysterious outbreak where you will fight tooth-and-nail through hordes of undead creatures in order to escape the epidemic and survive. At its core, Dead Sky is an action-packed survival shooter that ties in several strategic tower defense elements. The gameplay consists of a satisfying mix between defending objectives and staying alive within contaminated territory by using the variety of powerful weapons, structures, upgrades, and power-ups at your disposal. In online cooperative play, you and up to 3 friends will team up to fight your way through several environments and the unique challenges they present. Using teamwork, strategy, and quick reflexes, you will work together to defeat the powerful and mutated enemies that cross your path.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sb8jk8z5xhmbgqudyyvj.jpg'),(10996,'Fatal Fury 2','1994-06-24','Fighting','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, Neo Geo MVS, Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sharp X1, Wii, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Neo Geo CD, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD, Super Famicom','After Geese Howard\'s death in the original Fatal Fury, a mysterious nobleman becomes the sponsor of the new \"King of Fighters\" tournament. This time, the tournament is held worldwide with fighters around the globe competing. As the single player mode progresses, the mysterious challenger begins defeating the participants from the previous Fatal Fury game, searching for the man responsible for defeating Geese.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co237r.jpg'),(10997,'Gwan Moon High School: The Ghost Gate','2021-03-12','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','High school students return to school late after hours, each with their own reasons and an ominous feeling. After midnight...the fears deep inside become a reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2txj.jpg'),(10998,'BS Super Mario USA: Power Challenge - Dai-3-kai',NULL,'Platform','Satellaview','The third episode of BS Super Mario USA: Power Challenge.\n\nBS Super Mario USA is a direct sequel to Super Mario Bros. 2 for the Satellaview, an add-on for the Super Famicom. It was the first Mario platformer game to make use of the Satellaview\'s Soundlink features. The gameplay and levels are essentially the same as the SNES version of Super Mario Bros. 2, but with numerous added features and a new plot, presented as a sequel to the original game. Dramas by voice actors are also featured, the cast is: Toru Furuya as Mario, Mariko Mukai as Peach / Princess Toadstool, Ichirota Miyakawa as Luigi, Nanae Sumitomo as Kinopio / Toad, and \"Mr. Lady\" as Catherine / Birdo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47st.jpg'),(10999,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Dark Horizons','2012-06-01','Platform','Web browser','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Dark Horizons is a free-to-play browser-based action game developed by Nickelodeon Games, and the first game to be based on the Nickelodeon versions of the characters. The game, released in June 2012, sports a unique aesthetic that renders the characters as shadows with neon details.\n\nThe game involves the Ninja Turtles finding a trail of Mutagen in the Sewer, and following it to find the mutations it created. Leatherhead acts as the game\'s final boss.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yl1.jpg'),(11000,'Neon Horizon: Eclipse',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Neon Horizon: Eclipse is a first-person action platformer in which you have to go on an exciting adventure across eight different islands. Each island has its own unique traps and obstacles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j7c.jpg'),(11001,'Land of Zombies','2023-05-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','World is waiting for you! Save the world from those Zombies. Let\'s get started...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ewk.jpg'),(11002,'Sudoku RPG','2021-02-10','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sudoku RPG is a new style of game that combines Sudoku Puzzle and RPG genres. The only thing that can help a miner who has been named a hero by God\'s mistake is your excellent brain and concentration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r1w.jpg'),(11003,'Party Bros.','2023-08-23','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Party Bros. is a rom hack for Super Mario Bros. that features new levels, custom music and custom graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co704r.jpg'),(11004,'All Day Nippon','2022-09-03','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Bowser has started a mediocre podcast called “All Day Nippon”, so Mario has personally taken it upon himself to put a stop to it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69kn.jpg'),(11005,'Succubus: The Six Spells','2017-08-13','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c39.jpg'),(11006,'Deleted','2023-11-23','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Take control of a powerful drone and prepare to face off against hordes of enemies standing in your way. Collect currency and upgrade your drone with new weapons and skills. Are you ready for the ultimate challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7exl.jpg'),(11007,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Shredder\'s Revenge - Special Edition','2022-06-16','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This version includes:\n\n- A standard edition copy of the game.\n- One randomly selected Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles eye mask\n- CD Soundtrack featuring 28 tracks presented in a pizza box styled case\n- 4x 30mm Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles metal pins\n- Metal Shredder keyring\n- Numbered autograph art card\n- 80mm sewer manhole cover metal coaster','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co989y.jpg'),(11008,'Game & Watch: Super Mario Bros.','2020-11-13','Platform, Arcade','Game & Watch','Game & Watch: Super Mario Bros. is a special Game & Watch released for the Super Mario Bros. 35th anniversary. It includes Super Mario Bros., Super Mario Bros.: The Lost Levels, a special version of the Game & Watch game Ball and a clock based on Super Mario Bros.\nIt was the first Game & Watch game released after Mario the Juggler (released in 1991) and the first game in the new line of Game & Watch handhelds called Color Screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c4h.jpg'),(11009,'The Legend of Zelda: Majora\'s Mask 3D - Limited Edition','2015-03-13','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','A Nintendo 3DS remake of the Nintendo 64 game The Legend of Zelda: Majora\'s Mask that features graphical modernizations and gameplay changes, including quality-of-life improvements, UI streamlining, additional options for aiming controls and difficulty tweaks.\n\nThe Legend of Zelda Majora\'so Mask 3D Limited Edition includes Limited Edition Skull Kids Figurine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gqu.jpg'),(11010,'Hebereke: Rescue O-Chan','2021-11-20','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','In this hack, you play as Hebe from the Hebereke game series. He goes on a short adventure to rescue one of his friends, O-Chan, who was kidnapped by the Muu Cat.\n\nThis hack has 5 levels, and it was an entry for the SMB Jam, which got 2nd place, with 11.5 out of 25 points (first place got 15, and another entry got 16.5, but said entry would not go under winners).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dgy.jpg'),(11011,'Assassin\'s Creed II: Bonfire of the Vanities','2010-02-18','Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The Bonfire of the Vanities was the second of two downloadable content packs developed by Ubisoft for Assassin\'s Creed II.\n\nThe DLC included access to the Oltrarno District of Florence, as well as three Templar Lairs, which were previously exclusive to special editions of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zll.jpg'),(11012,'Love Shots',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11013,'Cozy Beach','2026-06-30','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','️Cozy Beach is a wholesome game set on an enchanting tropical beach where you can fish and explore, solo or with friends. Catch and collect fish, search for treasure, craft tropical drinks, or just hang out and chill!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pza.jpg'),(11014,'The Tunnels of Saint Mercy Road','2024-04-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Tunnels of Saint Mercy Road is an immersive horror experience that spans 4 areas, each unique and provides a different sense of unease. Inspired by games such as Silent Hill, Outlast, Resident Evil and many other (possibly surprising) games and stories, you will uncover the truth behind the urban legends of the tunnels under Saint Mercy Road.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84hu.jpg'),(11015,'Destiny 2: Heresy Silver Bundle','2025-02-04','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Purchase the Destiny 2: Heresy Silver Bundle and receive the Spinning Seat Legendary emote along with 1,700 Silver (1,000 + 700 bonus Silver) which you can use to purchase Heresy, cosmetics, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dae.jpg'),(11016,'Alcatraz','2000-01-01','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','Alcatraz, a prison island floating above San Francisco Bay, in the United States. Mario has been captured by the turtle clan! Can he safely escape from the prison island? Is this jailbreak impossible…?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5q4r.jpg'),(11017,'Snap Flex','2025-03-18','Indie, Arcade, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Snap Flex is a fast-paced card game based on classic Snap. Match ranks or suits, play with points or winner-takes-all. Enjoy offline or online multiplayer with up to 4 players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i6o.jpg'),(11018,'Buster Bros.','1993-12-31','Shooter, Platform, Arcade','Game Boy','The Game Boy version of Buster Bros. (also known as Pang in some regions) is a portable adaptation of the arcade game developed by Mitchell Corporation. Released in 1990, it retains the core gameplay, where players use a harpoon gun to pop bouncing bubbles while avoiding contact. The game features multiple levels set in different world locations, but with simplified graphics and gameplay adjustments for the handheld system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9djg.jpg'),(11019,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Way of the Warrior','2006-12-31','Fighting, Adventure','Plug & Play','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: The Way of the Warrior is a dedicated console system developed by Wayforward Technology and published by Tech2Go. The console is a webcam that is set on top of the TV and places cutouts of TMNT villains on screen for the player to physically attack, similar to the PlayStation 2 EyeToy games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wcn.jpg'),(11020,'Word Crush','2017-12-18','Puzzle','Android','Word Crush is a word puzzle game combining a match-3 and a word search game.\nDestroy the balls of the same color by grouping them and wait for the requested word to appear, once the word appears you must form it by connecting the blue balls bearing the corresponding letters.\nThe game consists of five islands representing 5 different themes (culture, civilizations, science, sport and miscellaneous)..','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rzhpg6ic4nzoacmlqwlb.jpg'),(11021,'Anna: The Magic of Words','2024-06-10','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Entertainment System','The magic of words gave you everything and suddenly took everything from you.\n\nA little sad and disappointed you make your way through a dangerous world. Embark on the difficult journey through the jungle, icy landscapes and dangerous caves. Collect scrolls and combine their words, face your fear and the ticking clock.\n\nBut whatever happens, never forget your most important goal: find Anna.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d4k.jpg'),(11022,'Boti: Byteland Overclocked - Deluxe Edition','2025-01-10','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','The Boti: Byteland Overclocked experience + 4 add-on DLCs, soundtrack & artbook','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e40.jpg'),(11023,'Dueling Drums','2001-05-07','Arcade','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q1o.jpg'),(11024,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles VS Power Rangers: Ultimate Hero Clash!','2016-02-13','Fighting','Web browser','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles VS Power Rangers: Ultimate Hero Clash! is a flash-based fighting game available on Nick.com. It originally featured the four Ninja Turtles and four Power Rangers to start the game with, but two extra characters were later on added to the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yl7.jpg'),(11025,'The Sims 4: Seasons','2018-11-13','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','Add weather to your Sims\' lives to tell new stories, enjoy seasonal activities and celebrate heartfelt holidays with The Sims 4: Seasons. Make the most out of the weather all year round, from crisp snowfalls to sweltering heat - every world is affected by seasons in unique ways. Create a winter story with ice skating, befriend a magical scarecrow at the fall harvest, share a spring fling during a downpour or host a summer pool party. Gather friends and family to celebrate holidays complete with traditions, gifts and special guests. Stay warm or keep cool with all-new outfits to brave the elements. Even begin a blossoming gardening career as a botanist or by crafting floral arrangements!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zpu.jpg'),(11026,'View-Master TMNT VR','2017-03-15','Sin género','Android, iOS','View-Master TMNT VR is a virtual reality mobile game based on the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7faf.jpg'),(11027,'Pro Yakyuu Spirits 2012','2012-04-29','Sport','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable','Pro Yakyuu Spirits 2012 is a baseball game that allows players to compete in Japan\'s professional baseball league, with licensed team and player names.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96d4.jpg'),(11028,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: The Last Ronin',NULL,'Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Who is the Last Ronin? In a future, battle-ravaged New York City, a lone surviving Turtle embarks on a seemingly hopeless mission seeking justice for the family he lost.\n\nFrom the minds of the creators of the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles, and based on the best-selling comic book event by Eastman, Waltz, Bishop, Delgado, and the Escorza Brothers: the official video game adaptation of TMNT: The Last Ronin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x9j.jpg'),(11029,'Fleet Commander: Pacific','2022-07-21','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fleet Commander: Pacific is a grand strategic simulation of the naval war in the Pacific from 1941 to 1945. All major surface combat ships of the Japanese and Allied navies are present in this streamlined reproduction of the biggest maritime war ever.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5o5e.jpg'),(11030,'Mark of the Ninja: Special Edition DLC','2013-08-16','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','This DLC adds a new level, to be played as Dosan, as a prequel to the main game as well as 2 new items/tools and adding Dosan\'s playstyle to the main game.\nIt also adds an option for developer commentary to been seen throughout the game explaining design choices and giving information about the development of the game in general.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jtq.jpg'),(11031,'Nekketsu Koukou Dodgeball-bu: Soccer-hen','1990-12-31','Sport','Sharp X68000','Nekketsu Koukou Dodgeball Bu: Soccer-hen is a port for the Sharp X68000 of the Famicom game with under the same title in Japanese.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11032,'Tokyo Psychodemic','2024-05-30','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Through forensic investigation, confront paranormal phenomenas! 2D × Cinematic・Realistic forensics investigation simulation game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7frm.jpg'),(11033,'Super Mario Bros. / Duck Hunt / World Class Track Meet','1990-12-01','Shooter, Sport, Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','A three-in-one cartridge containing the original Super Mario Bros., Duck Hunt, and World Class Track Meet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22nt.jpg'),(11034,'Retrokill','2023-06-03','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RETROKILL is a demake of ULTRAKILL','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11035,'Dino Genesis','2025-03-24','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dino Genesis is an action FPS that navigates you through the forgotten island, ISLA GENESIS. You will have to defend yourself from genetically created Dinosaurs, Arachnids and Insects while discovering the dark secrets of the island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kl0.jpg'),(11036,'Beachcomber','2014-04-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Use your detector to find things under the sand.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h76.jpg'),(11037,'SnowRunner: Rezvani Hercules','2022-10-13','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Expand your SnowRunner garage further with the Rezvani Hercules, a high-performance 6-wheel Scout truck with a fierce and unique modern look.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sed.jpg'),(11038,'Jikkyou Pawafuru Puroyakyu','2019-06-27','Sport','Nintendo Switch','The Switch title will use the latest data from the 2019 baseball season, and include game modes such as “Pennant” (choose your favorite baseball team and try to become the best in Japan), “Treasure” (bring up the strongest team), and “Home Run Attack” (a single-player mode where you shoot for the high score). It will also support competitive and cooperative multiplayer for up to four players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80l1.jpg'),(11039,'Capcom Coin-Op Collection Volume 1','2004-12-21','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Capcom\'s Coin-op Collection Volume 1 is a compilation of five arcade games: 1942, Commando, Side Arms Hyperdyne, Vulgus, and Ghosts \'n Goblins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ro3.jpg'),(11040,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Battle Match','2015-12-09','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Battle Match is a 2015 mobile block-matching puzzle game based on the fourth season of the 2012 TV series. It was developed by Tiny Castle Studios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yj4.jpg'),(11041,'Starry Sky: After Spring Portable','2012-12-27','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','A port of Starry Sky: After Spring for the PlayStation Portable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rlp.jpg'),(11042,'Belial Red','2023-03-11','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After her kingdom is conquered by a neighboring country, Sheryl decides to join their army in a bid to find an opportunity to win her freedom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64e7.jpg'),(11043,'WarGround','2019-02-02','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\'Warground\' is a turn-based strategy that aims to be casual. Use 26 units of 6 troops to win the battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53nf.jpg'),(11044,'Taiko no Tatsujin: V Version','2015-07-09','Music','PlayStation Vita','Rhythm game Taiko Drum Master makes its first appearance on the PlayStation Vita, featuring songs from anime, J-pop, vocaloids, New Japan Pro Wrestling and other games on the platform.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3t6c.jpg'),(11045,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: The Shredder Reborn','2009-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Legacy Mobile Device','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: The Shredder Reborn is a 2009 mobile phone game by 4mobile, based on The Lost Episodes. It is the sequel to Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Ninja Tribunal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ybl.jpg'),(11046,'Nick Racing Stars','2016-12-31','Racing','Web browser','Ladies and gentlemen start your engines and get ready to race around the tracks with some of your favorite Nickelodeon characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vxy.jpg'),(11047,'Ninja Turtles: The Next Mutation','1997-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wu9.jpg'),(11048,'ZIC: Survival','2019-06-18','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ZIC: Survival is a survival shooter where you feel The Zombie Apocalypse & become The Zombie Hunter!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l1k.jpg'),(11049,'Selfish Cupid','2023-09-21','Simulator, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ten has the ability to see other people\'s soulmates after he was chosen to be the cupid\'s vessel. He is tasked to help bring couples together. But there is just one problem... Ten couldn\'t care less about other people\'s relationships. He only cares about his own love life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d5c.jpg'),(11050,'Bugsnax','2023-07-12','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','iOS','Bugsnax is a humorous action adventure game in which we explore an island full of creatures that are hybrids of worms and food. The game was developed and released by independent Young Horses studio.\n\nThe iOS release includes the content from the previously released update “The Isle of BIGsnax,” as well as an entirely new control scheme via touch screens, while also supporting a wide array of third-party controllers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qjm.jpg'),(11051,'Destiny 2: Armory Collection','2023-03-28','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Over 20 Exotic weapons including the famed Gjallarhorn! Instantly grow your armory with 3 Exotic Ciphers and a coveted collection of cosmetics. Then conquer two dungeons and a raid, all while discovering new weapons and armor inspired by Bungie\'s past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bbt.jpg'),(11052,'Sparkle 2','2020-12-21','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Challenge the darkness with your swift orb matching skills, mighty magical enchantments and earthshaking powerups. Match the orbs before they fall into the abyss and find your way through mysterious lands of startling beauty!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26ys.jpg'),(11053,'SaGa 3: Jikuu no Hasha - Shadow or Light','2011-01-06','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo DS','SaGa 3: Jikuu no Hasha - Shadow or Light is a game released in 2011 for the Nintendo DS exclusively in Japan. The game is a remake of SaGa 3: Jikuu no Hasha, featuring full 3D cel-shaded graphics, all new artwork by Gen Kobayashi and an arranged soundtrack by Kenji Ito.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48ky.jpg'),(11054,'Super Mario Unlimited Deluxe','2021-03-26','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Super Mario Unlimited Deluxe is a traditional-style Mario hack with difficulty ramping up from beginner to expert. It is based on the Super Mario Bros engine, but has been completely reworked into a whole new adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rc3.jpg'),(11055,'The Unicated','2011-08-30','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98oy.jpg'),(11056,'TapColors',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11057,'Sansara Naga 2','2001-12-14','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Advance','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11058,'Bifrost Breakout',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11059,'My Little Pony: Adventures in Ponyville','2010-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','Join Twilight Sparkle, Pinkie Pie, and Applejack in the Adventures in Ponyville game! Help your pony earn the cutie mark by winning Friendship Sparkles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pym.jpg'),(11060,'Ore o Hoshigaru Futari no Haha',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11061,'Icewall','2022-10-14','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Icewall is a game that combines retro shoot\'em up and modern roguelite game design. It features intense, colorful and fast-paced gameplay, the roguelite run-based structure enhances the game with strategy and replay-value as you draft new strategies and combos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5f5c.jpg'),(11062,'Epic Mickey: Power of Illusion','2012-11-17','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','In \"Disney Epic Mickey: Power Of Illusion,\" gamers will play as Mickey Mouse as he infiltrates the Castle of Illusion on a quest to put an end to the evil witch Mizrabel\'s diabolical intentions. Players will be taken on an all-new adventure made specifically for the Nintendo 3DS where, \"Reality Is What You Paint Of It.\" Created by critically acclaimed video game developer DreamRift, \"Disney Epic Mickey: Power Of Illusion\" furthers the Wasteland saga by taking players on a completely new story and adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1w31.jpg'),(11063,'Children of the Nile Complete','2008-09-10','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cci.jpg'),(11064,'Haunted Halls: Fears from Childhood - Collector\'s Edition','2018-02-16','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore Dr. Blackmore’s latest experiment in a Haunted Halls: Fears from Childhood, a terrifying Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5427.jpg'),(11065,'The Shortest Journey','2016-05-21','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Manu dreams of finding treasure. A short, dialog-free point and click adventure game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98l4.jpg'),(11066,'New Rally-X','2005-09-01','Racing','Arcade, Wii, Xbox 360, Legacy Mobile Device','New Rally-X is a maze and driving arcade game that was released by Namco in 1981. It runs on similar hardware to that of its predecessor, and as its name suggests, it is a revised version of that title, which was released in the previous year. The only differences are that it has slightly enhanced graphics, easier gameplay, a new soundtrack, and a \"Lucky Flag\" (with the letter \"L\") that gives the player extra points for remaining fuel when collected, after which the round will continue if there are still flags remaining. The mazes are mostly identical, with some of the blocks from Rally-X changed into roads to reduce dead ends, and some different flag (and rock) locations. This title was manufactured in greater numbers and was much more popular in Japan than its predecessor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/y9tzrqd756pol06iebfg.jpg'),(11067,'Super Luigi! The Forgotten Adventure!','2016-07-26','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Here’s a chapter in Luigi’s life he never spoke about, saving Peach from a robotic creature. Luigi travels through three worlds in order to save Peach, can he do it? Only with your help.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ojk.jpg'),(11068,'Star Sky 2','2016-02-29','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Wii U','Explore the world around you, the magic that surrounds it. Learn the ways of the nature, the mountains and caves, snow-filled tundras and seren lakes. Uncover the different courses life can take.\n\nStar Sky 2 is a sequel to the atmospheric, meditative experience of Star Sky. Walk through the landscapes, interact with the environment and learn based of the choices you make. Explore the different roads presented and enjoy the sound and sights of the world.\n\nStar Sky 2 continues the story set by the previous one, with a similar style of gameplay. There are more choices and most importantly, more consequences. Learn from the choices you make, and see the different paths a life can take, and the scenarios that unfold. The game is a slow experience meant as a way to get lost in you thoughts, to feel the game as you are playing, and most importantly, to simply relax.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4229.jpg'),(11069,'Super Diego Bros.',NULL,'Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76eb.jpg'),(11070,'High Hell','2017-10-23','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','High Hell is a neon-soaked, arcade-action first-person shooter from Terri Vellmann (Heavy Bullets) and Doseone (Enter the Gungeon, Gang Beasts).\n\nDescend upon the criminal underground with an absurdly large gun and bring lethal salvation to those that have fallen from the light. Righteous fury and fancy footwork are crucial to survive an escalating, absurd series of outlandish missions. Pop brainwashed chimps, deface corporate effigies, and dismantle the business dealings of the unrepentant cartel in a vibrant remix of the classic first-person shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ni0.jpg'),(11071,'Blinx: The Time Sweeper','2002-12-12','Platform','Xbox','Blinx: The Time Sweeper is a platform game developed by Artoon and published by Microsoft Game Studios. It was released for the Xbox on October 7, 2002. A sequel, Blinx 2: Masters of Time and Space, was released for the Xbox in 2004.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xqi.jpg'),(11072,'Marble Merger','2023-10-31','Arcade','Web browser','A \"Suika Game\" clone for PICO-8. Drop marbles into the container - if two marbles of the same size touch each other, then they merge together to form a single larger marble, and you get some points (larger merges have larger value). If a marble comes to rest while going past the top of the container, you lose!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81fo.jpg'),(11073,'Super Mario: The Daisyquest','2022-10-29','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Bowser’s cool uncle has kidnapped Daisy to show Bowser how it’s done, Mario has to fight through 4 new worlds to save her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pki.jpg'),(11074,'hexceed: Illumina Pack','2022-06-30','Indie','Nintendo Switch','This DLC unlocks a brand new world for hexceed: Illumina! Puzzle your way through 110 brand new levels - each with an exciting new mechanic!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11075,'Capcom Generations 2: Chronicles of Arthur','1998-09-23','Platform','Sega Saturn, PlayStation','A Japan-only compilation of the first three Ghosts \'n Goblins video games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49gd.jpg'),(11076,'Metamathema','2024-11-04','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Engage proxy wars as an elite merc on Metamathema, the secret military service platform providing millions of stealth missions. Arm yourself fully to infiltrate the enemy FOB. Complete the mission and survive in a jungle surrounded by enemy troops. Search, eliminate, and gather intel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zbd.jpg'),(11077,'Steampunk Graveyard','2018-10-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Steampunk Graveyard is a 2D action platform adventure where nefarious Baron Richter von Sprocket has turned the dead into piston powered zombie automatons. It\'s up to his former protégé, Professor Selene Gasket, to put a stop to the menace and save the terrified villagers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1h7u.jpg'),(11078,'Little Mouse\'s Encyclopedia + Cat\'s Cosmic Atlas','2023-11-21','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Explore the incredible world of nature with a charming little mouse as well embrace the wonders of the night sky alongside an adorable kitten named Fellie.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fha.jpg'),(11079,'Freelancer Life Simulator','2021-03-05','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become one of the best freelancers, starting your way from scratch. Fulfill orders of varying difficulty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zy2.jpg'),(11080,'Hidden World of Art 2','2019-11-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the hidden object game \"Hidden World of Art 2\" you have to restore real classical paintings by finding hidden items and solving puzzles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42fz.jpg'),(11081,'Blockus','1995-12-31','Arcade','ZX Spectrum','A russian game similar to KLAX, the object is to catch assorted color falling tiles and create columns of a single color.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98tc.jpg'),(11082,'Tango Fiesta','2017-05-16','Shooter, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Tango Fiesta is a top-down co-operative two stick shooter for 1 to 4 players. It is set in a world where the events from every single 80\'s action film ever made actually happened to one unlucky ex-special-forces hero called John Strong, you and up to three friends get to blast, shoot, knife, and rescue your way through endless procedurally generated levels in the ultimate story of a one man army prevailing against every evil the world has ever known!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2324.jpg'),(11083,'Word Cross Puzzle','2018-01-05','Puzzle','iOS','Are you tired of the old-fashioned word search interfaces?\nDo you want to enjoy a totally new experience of word puzzle game?\nNow, you can download Word Cross and play on BOARDS for FREE!\n\nWord Cross is a creative crossword puzzle game which can inspire your passion for brain challenges. It includes all the essences of word scramble games to make you feel totally ADDICTIVE & ENTERTAINING.\n\nNew & Fresh Look: If you like to play board games and puzzle games, you must love the clean and fresh BOARD UI for your first sight.\n\nHandy & Easy to Play: You can easily swipe the letters to form a specific hidden word. It’s easy to play and fun to master for everyone.\n\nSurprising Bonus: Login every day and get daily bonus, also, you will get coins after finding out the Extra Words which don\'t present on the crossword board.\n\nOver 2,000 Exciting Challenges: It starts easy and becomes challenging fast. And you can test your limits of the words you know. More levels are on the go.\n\n100% Addictive Word Game: You’ll never experience a dull moment for it! Play this crossword puzzle once and you won’t be able to put it down!\n\nHOW TO PLAY\n- Swipe the letters to line up words to fill up the blanks horizontally and vertically on the board\n- Tap the “Shuffle” button to change the order of letters\n- Tap \"Ask Friends\" when you get stuck and get rewards\n- Tap the “Hints” button to get clues\n- Get more hints with coins by purchasing or watching videos\n\nFEATURES\n• Nice & Clean BOARD for you (Stay tuned for customizable themes)\n• More than 2000 Challenges\n• FREE to get Daily Bonus\n• Find words with bonus to collect more coins\n• Simple & Easy to play, hard to beat gameplay\n• Totally FREE for all players\n• Suitable for both kids and adults to train word search skills\n• No network required and you can enjoy word search at any time\n\nDOWNLOAD now to begin training your brain and become a real master of word search puzzles on BOARDS!\n\nCONTACT\nsupport@boardgame.freshdesk.com','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hrn.jpg'),(11084,'Rite of Passage: Hide and Seek - Collector\'s Edition','2018-01-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Twenty years ago, a group of children in the town of Greystone were taken by a mysterious fog while playing hide and seek, including your brother. Only you escaped… Your father went looking for your brother and never returned. Now you\'ve found evidence that your father has been alive this entire time, still searching for the missing children. But why would he remain silent for so long? And why was he so determined to keep you away from Greystone? You immediately head out to find answers. But are you prepared for what awaits you in the mysterious fog? Find out in this creepy Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game!\n\nThe Collector\'s Edition includes:\n- A bonus game where you must help Angela find happiness.\n- Complete your own collectible scene!\n- Bonus mini-games and activities\n- An available Strategy Guide','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11085,'Hole in Won','2023-01-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Create the golf course by laying down tiles in the correct order. Play 100 handcrafted levels, create your own, or check out others in the Arcade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hef.jpg'),(11086,'Madden Season 2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11087,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Mutant Rumble','2013-09-04','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Android, iOS','Developed by SWAPPZ, an iOS/Android game company featuring figure-based games. In Teenage Mutant Ninja turtles: Mutant Rumble, scan special TMNT figurines and coins to attain characters and train them to be the best ninja they can be!\n\nSWAPPZ is an iOS/Android game company featuring figure-based games; one of which being Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles Mutant Rumble. The game itself is free and will be playable without the figures but playability will be limited.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yiv.jpg'),(11088,'Destiny 2: The Collection','2019-11-19','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Google Stadia','Dive into the world of Destiny 2 to experience responsive FPS combat, explore the mysteries of our solar system, and unleash elemental abilities against powerful enemies. Experience Destiny 2’s cinematic story alone or with friends, join other Guardians for challenging co-op missions, or compete against them in a variety of PvP modes.\n\nDestiny 2: The Collection includes Destiny 2, Destiny 2: Forsaken, and Destiny 2: Shadowkeep.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p8j.jpg'),(11089,'NCAA Final Four 2002','2001-11-12','Sport','PlayStation 2','The follow-up to Final Four 2001 features the obligatory roster updates with over 300 real NCAA teams and 31 conferences with authentic fight songs and 70 new player models to give the game a feel of realism. The standard modes apply such as Exhibition that supports both one-player or two-player and a Dynasty mode that lets the player compete in a full-season in order to secure a place in the 64-team tournament known as \"March Madness\". It also features the voice talents of Eddie Doucette and Billy Packer who provide play-by-play commentary.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/knlme7je7bvkgx1yigwf.jpg'),(11090,'Cyborg: Rise','2025-03-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An adventure game that combines first person shooter and Roguelite random elements. Players can manipulate heroes with different abilities in the game. Embark on adventure challenges in random levels. Every time you respawn, you can unlock new skills and equipment to challenge stronger enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ado.jpg'),(11091,'Fishing Sim World: Pro Tour - Collector\'s Edition','2020-04-14','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Fishing Sim World: Pro Tour base game features an authentic career mode where you work your way up to an elite angler. Compete against over 100 of the best anglers on the planet including Ali Hamidi and Scott Martin across Carp, Bass and Predator fishing. Unlock sponsorship offers, gain career earnings and social media followers.Custom multiplayer allows you to set the rules as you take on friends online. Choose different options such as the number of rounds, length of match and catch species. Participate in online tournaments that form the Dovetail Fishing League to try and earn the coveted title of ‘Angler of the Month’.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t91.jpg'),(11092,'Super Mario Bros. / Tetris / Nintendo World Cup','1991-12-31','Sport, Arcade','Nintendo Entertainment System','A compilation of Super Mario Bros. / Tetris / Nintendo World Cup for NES','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22nv.jpg'),(11093,'Story Warriors: Fairy Tales',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','Story Warriors: Fairy Tales is a highly inventive take on interactive stories and puzzles, where the words on the page come alive and interact allowing you to solve puzzles as you read along revealing a rich retelling of classic fairy tales.\nYou embark on an journey with ‘Bella’ through the Fairy Tale Kingdoms of Snow White and the Seven Dwarves, Little Red Riding Hood, Cinderella and many more as she does battle with villains right there on the page!\nIf Bella needs a Brave Knight to defeat her foes, tap on the words ‘Brave Knight’ and he will appear! If she needs a basket of food to take to her grandmother, tap on the words to conjure the required items and progress to the next chapter !\nStory Warriors: Fairy Tales is an engaging puzzle game, a fun interactive adventure and a fantastic new Fairy Story all woven into a single ingenious experience. Perfect as a puzzle adventure game in its own right or as a new and engaging way to read along with children.\nFEATURES:\n+ NO in-app purchases!\n+ Interact with classic fairy tale heroes and villains, like Cinderella, Snow White and the Big Bad Wolf\n+ Explore 43 unique levels\n+ Enjoy beautiful, hand-drawn art\n**********\nAWARDS\n2016 Nickelodeon Kid\'s Choice Award Winner','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11094,'Funko Fusion: The Office Cameo Pack Bundle','2024-12-17','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','“Would I rather be feared or loved? Easy. Both. I want people to be afraid of how much they love me.”','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9efk.jpg'),(11095,'Pick Pack Pup','2022-05-02','Puzzle, Indie','Playdate','Pick Pack Pup is a match-3 puzzle game where matches don\'t disappear immediately, making each new move trickier. In the game you play as Pup, the newest employee at a fulfillment center, who will discover the ups and downs of packing boxes and will unpack a lot of surprises along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4pyb.jpg'),(11096,'The Station','2018-02-20','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Station is a first-person exploration game set on a space station sent to study a sentient alien civilization. Assuming the role of a recon specialist, players must unravel a mystery which will decide the fate of two civilizations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co203b.jpg'),(11097,'Final Fantasy: Explorers','2014-12-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Final Fantasy Explorers features both cooperative play with friends and solo play, utilizing a refined party system which allows Explorers to master over 20 new and familiar jobs—including series classics like Dragoon, Dark Knight, Black Mage and White Mage—to defeat the realm’s mightiest monsters and even recruit them for battle.\n\nPlayers will have the ability to call upon the powers of eidolons like Ifrit and Bahamut, as well as transform into other legendary characters from the Final Fantasy series, such as Cloud, Squall and Lightning, via the Trance feature.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vjp.jpg'),(11098,'Balance Breakers','2019-09-27','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Balance Breakers is an easy to learn battle-based party game for 2-4 players. Facing the attacks from opponents and bosses, players have to team up and fight for the most treasures to claim the victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lvl.jpg'),(11099,'Snoody: One of the Ayrie','2023-06-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bring back color to the wonderful planet Ayries! Together with Snoody and his friend Picke go on an exciting adventure to other planets. Explore distant worlds, study elemental magic, collect crystals and defeat monsters! Save the people of ayrie and find out, who is responsible for their troubles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rpl.jpg'),(11100,'Dragon Fishing','2024-11-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nhs.jpg'),(11101,'Nefarious Dreams','2022-04-14','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Nefarious Dreams is a game that has Mario navigating a brand-new semi-linear set of 25 levels, boasting new graphics, enemy behaviour and environments plus some minor audio changes. It’s sure to keep both inexperienced and well-versed Mario players engaged as they try to puzzle out the path to the ending and find every secret level.\n\nOh yeah… and Mario goes to space. That is pretty cool.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dkx.jpg'),(11102,'Asami Escape','2019-10-04','Puzzle, Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','When I woke up, I was in a strange room.\n\nThe protagonist, Etarou, wakes up in a strange room with a suspicious woman watching him from the monitor. It seems she knows him, yet he can\'t seem to remember anything about himself nor his past. For some reason, he seems to have brought her anger upon himself and so must escape, avoiding her gaze.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qgu.jpg'),(11103,'Hacker Evolution: Untold','2010-09-14','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','When the number of computers in existence and their processing capacity exceeds that of all mankind, a point of technological singularity is encountered. A massive economic and systematic crisis hits the entire world. Nobody knows the exact cause, and all solutions to fix it, are failing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2188.jpg'),(11104,'The Mistcaller','2023-02-12','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mistcaller is a puzzle platformer inspired by games like Limbo. Fully hand-drawn, the uniquely artistic world encased within the mist is beautifully rendered. Explore a deep and rich narrative centered around an ongoing conflict between rival families and uncover Eve\'s place in it all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hnh.jpg'),(11105,'Ronin: Samurai Redemption',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The Ronin - Three samurai whose master was framed for disgrace in the high court and ordered to kill himself, are now alone. Instead of accepting the same fate, the samurai swore an oath of vengeance and became RONIN.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58i0.jpg'),(11106,'Toad\'s Treasure Quest','2006-12-11','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Toad’s Treasure Quest is a Super Mario Bros. rom hack based around the character Toad. The hack provides a fanmade explanation on how Toad was able to possess all the items in the Toad Houses in Super Mario Bros. 3.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6i9z.jpg'),(11107,'Genshin Impact: Beneath the Light of Jadeite','2021-04-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Version 1.5 of Genshin Impact, which included:\n• New characters: Eula and Yanfei\n• New story quests for Zhongli and Eula\n• New hangout events: Noelle (Act II) and Diona\n• New main event: Energy Amplifier Initiation\n• New housing system: Serenitea Pot\n• …and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rv5.jpg'),(11108,'Department 42: The Mystery of the Nine','2022-01-12','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Join Department 42, a secret organization devoted to the paranormal, and protect the world! Help Agent Alice Wright track down nine mysterious and evil artifacts that have gone missing. Use your Hidden Object skills to protect the planet from the nightmare that has been unleashed and restore order! Travel across the country and piece together the enigma that is Department 42: The Mystery of the Nine!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gt8.jpg'),(11109,'Drug Wars','2009-03-17','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Drug Wars is a gritty, gory romp through a futuristic New York City, circa 3100, where severe global warming conditions have resulted in a harsh divide between upper-class Brooklyn gang bosses and a booming population of engineered Neanderthal bottom-dwellers.\n\nUsing the powerful CryEngine 2, Paleo Entertainment offers players of Drug Wars a collection of varied maps rife for fast-paced multiplayer chaos, featuring a deadly variety of weapons, including everything from a biomechanical arm to environmental objects - including the severed limbs of your foes - to gain control of the coveted drug trade. Add in several brand-new vehicles to both traverse across the detailed landscapes and mow down your opponents, and Drug Wars offers up a slew of game options to keep players addicted to the bloody fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ha5.jpg'),(11110,'Kids Train Sim',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11111,'Aero Fighters 3','1995-12-08','Shooter','Neo Geo AES, Neo Geo MVS, Neo Geo CD','When enemy forces wipe out the jets of the Aero Fighters, they must scramble using heavily-modified World War II warplanes in the third installment of the comical Aero Fighters series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82w2.jpg'),(11112,'RimWorld: Anomaly','2024-04-11','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Darkness stirs on the rim. Survive flesh infestations, cultist attacks, shambling undead, blood rains, invisible hunters, and other sanity-shredding perils. Capture and study entities to harness the power of the void. Conduct psychic rituals and awaken an evil machine god.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vzq.jpg'),(11113,'Quaantuum Strike','2025-01-15','Shooter','Meta Quest 3','Step into the future with Quantum Strike, a high-octane Mixed Reality VR shooter where the world around you warps and transforms in real time! Designed exclusively for the Meta Quest 3, this game blends your real-world environment with intense combat scenarios, forcing you to react, adapt, and dominate the battlefield like never before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9juf.jpg'),(11114,'Runbow: Satura\'s Space Adventure','2018-07-03','Platform, Indie','Nintendo Switch','A new poster has been revealed over the horizon of Poster District! Get Satura\'s Space Adventure to find out what mysteries await Hue, Val, and Satura!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sx5.jpg'),(11115,'Mystery Trackers: Black Isle - Collector\'s Edition','2012-03-02','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','When a journalist is kidnapped after beginning an investigation, it’s up to you to learn the truth behind Black Isle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4joe.jpg'),(11116,'Ratpad vs Everglide: Battle of the Pads',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11117,'Cloudy & Stormy: Pawtastic Adventure','2025-04-05','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A side scrolling adventure. Fly high as Cloudy and lightning dash as Stormy! Jump through colorful regions, help new friends, find treasures, and overcome challenges on your quest for a lost blanket.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iil.jpg'),(11118,'To Kill A King','2021-06-25','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An old school style classic JRPG with a foul mouth, foul-tempered undead warrior hell bent on revenge against the Ignoble King. Over 30 hours of gameplay!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44pw.jpg'),(11119,'Insert Three Coins','2023-02-05','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome, rookie. Get your three coins and try your best shot to beat all the arcade machines. This arcade have a single rule: You beat a machine, you get your coin back.\n\nDo you have what it takes to be the arcade king?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yhh.jpg'),(11120,'Long Night','2014-06-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Long Night is a Third Person Survival-Horror video game series which aims to reconnect with the atmosphere of its ancestors, the old classics from the 90\'s and early 2000\nWith this game Trickster Face wants to put Lurking Fear back to the center of the gaming experience, rather than pure action sustained by an escalation of noisy special effects.\nHere we have no shot guns nor giant monsters, but simply David, a youngster who can only count on your pugnacity and your instinct, to survive, and save his friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nsj.jpg'),(11121,'X-Men','2006-10-23','Fighting','HyperScan','X-Men was one of the launch games of the home video game console HyperScan. It is a 2D fighting game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vd9.jpg'),(11122,'Lilycle Rainbow Stage!!!','2016-04-28','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), OOParts','\"The Lilycle yuri CD series returns, featuring the same all-star cast, but now in a fully-visual adventure game. While a must for dedicated yuri fans, the fun and easygoing stories contained within will warm the hearts of all who read them.\n\nLilycle has a sweet, heartwarming story bursting with content, with cheerful and highly-detailed illustrations by Sakura Miwabe, and featuring a sophisticated game system viewed from the standpoint of one character at a time. As every character’s perspective is shown, you could say that they’re all the protagonist!\n\nAll story episodes are selected from the main menu, which is arranged like a calendar, with different ones viewable on different days. Once specific episodes are completed, new ones will become available, allowing the player (that’s you!) to experience the intricacies of Lilycle’s storyline.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45bb.jpg'),(11123,'Symmetry','2018-02-20','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A research spaceship reaches an abandoned planet. Nothing is what it seems here and the situation quickly slips out of control. Can the crew manage to survive and get back home?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e1p.jpg'),(11124,'No Straight Roads: Encore Edition','2021-10-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Start a rock band & end the EDM empire in NO STRAIGHT ROADS, a rockin\' action-adventure from the minds of Wan Hazmer (Final Fantasy XV) and Daim Dziauddin (Street Fighter V).\n\nExplore Vinyl City & fight musical megastars on your journey to defeat oppressive EDM empire ‘NSR’, in an action-packed adventure that mashes together rhythm-infused third-person combat with a kick-ass soundtrack!\n\nNo Straight Roads: Encore Edition is an enhanced version of the original music action-adventure that features the rock-tastic base game and festive-focused ‘Christmas Edition’ update, plus brand new content, including an expanded collection of tracks, a new opening cinematic, quality of life improvements and over 500 pieces of fan art available to view and collect throughout Vinyl City.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41qd.jpg'),(11125,'MechWarrior 5: Mercenaries - Call to Arms','2022-06-08','Shooter, Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Call to Arms adds the Hatchetman chassis, along with 23 new melee-weapon focused \'Mech variants, 5 new melee weapon-focused Hero \'Mechs, 9 new melee weapons, and the new animated Stormsurge skin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5l84.jpg'),(11126,'Let\'s Attack Crazy Cross','1996-03-01','Puzzle, Arcade','Arcade, PlayStation','Let\'s Attack Crazy Cross is a puzzle video game which was developed and published by Konami. It was released for Arcade and PlayStation on March 1996 and it is part of the Taisen Puzzle-Dama series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7o07.jpg'),(11127,'Animus: Stand Alone','2019-08-07','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The world of Animus is a broken place — splintered, unreliable, fatal. Humanity crushed between a clash for untold dominance between the Absolutes, disorder, pain, and death befell mortals. All anyone could do was await death, but even that was quickly snatched away from the frail hands of man. In the end, perpetual strife and madness pervaded. Dangerous shadows stalk the grounds of the ruins, waiting to pounce on any living being, to lay blame and judgement.\n\nThe identity of the narrator in the introduction is ambiguous. The narrator knows of the aforementioned — the tragedy and sorrow to befall this frail world. She is removed... perhaps, reluctant. There is a sense of resignation, an understanding that an end to this version of the world is best. Here all possibilities and realms interlace, and, as you know... rot must be cut away. As the narrator awaits the end, perhaps she beckons us to bring forth that end.\n\nAnimus is a high-end Action RPG that offers superb graphics, incredible sound and music, and responsive combat controls. Player level and equipment progression have been streamlined so that players can jump into the punishment. Hours of challenging and rewarding gameplay are guaranteed in this tense screen crusher.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24b5.jpg'),(11128,'Wario\'s Woods','1994-02-19','Platform, Puzzle','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Wario\'s Woods is a puzzle game similar to Tetris or Columns, but with a twist. Instead of directly controlling the monsters and bombs that are falling down, the player controls Toad who has to carry around stacks of monsters and bombs and to combine them in the right way. One bomb plus at least two monsters of the same color have to be combined to make them disappear. If five or more objects are cleared at the same time, a diamond will appear. Destroying the diamond will clear all monsters of the diamond\'s color.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4fn4.jpg'),(11129,'Hypercharge: Unboxed - Complete Edition','2024-05-31','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The complete edition is for true Hypercharge action figure enthusiasts. The brave. The proud. The small.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tcn.jpg'),(11130,'Chess Force','2025-04-06','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chess Force! The wicked MAGNUS and his evil minions have taken taken over the moon with their dark chess powers. You, the KING, will earn PAWNS from each boss battle. Spend your hard-earned ELO to PROMOTE your pawns and add to your firepower. Can you become a GRANDMASTER and save the moon?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9my5.jpg'),(11131,'Thief: Definitive Edition','2014-02-28','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d7g.jpg'),(11132,'My Neighbor is a Yandere?!','2017-07-14','Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take the role of Seijuro, meet your neighbor Nanase and try to unveil the truth. Think you can handle her? An erotic game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5064.jpg'),(11133,'Redout','2019-05-14','Racing, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Oculus Rift, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','2560 AD: Humanity moved to Mars and some of Titan’s moons. The most followed and expensive sport is a high-speed racing class employing magnetic hoverships, the fastest humanity has ever engineered: a sport named Red:Out.\nRed:Out is developed in Unreal 4. Controlling a nuclear-powered ship hovering about two meters from the ground going over 400 km/h is no piece of cake Now, imagine doing the same in a vicious curve upside down, or in a double loop-the-loop. Your ship will never race on rails. Each input will apply a physical force!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wj8.jpg'),(11134,'Tokimeki Restaurant','2013-03-14','Simulator, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','A restaurant business otome game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5i5i.jpg'),(11135,'Far Cry 6','2021-10-07','Shooter, Adventure','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Dive into the gritty world of a modern-day guerrilla revolution to liberate a nation from its oppressive dictators. Welcome to Yara, a tropical paradise frozen in time. Far Cry 6 thrusts players into a modern-day guerrilla revolution. As dictator of Yara, Anton Castillo is intent on restoring his nation back to its former glory by any means, with his son, Diego, following in his bloody footsteps. Become a guerrilla fighter and liberate Yara.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2npg.jpg'),(11136,'Avernum 2','2000-12-18','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Taking place five years after the events of the first Avernum, this game follows its party of characters fighting back against military forces being sent down to Avernum by the Empire and investigating the source of mysterious energy barriers that have begun appearing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4prh.jpg'),(11137,'Hentai Girls: Mandarin Love','2025-01-30','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Meet over 50 pretty anime girls in this relaxing puzzle game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d0e.jpg'),(11138,'Pachicom','1988-11-04','Sport','Family Computer Disk System, PC-8800 Series, Family Computer, MSX','Pachinko-themed game released in Japan for the MSX, PC-88, Family Computer, and Famicom Disk System.\n\nPachicom is an early pachinko simulator for various Japanese home computers along with Nintendo\'s Famicom and Famicom Disk System. It gives players the opportunity to play a pachinko table with several hundred small variations, with the goal to earn a high score in the time allotted.\n\nHidden Sounds\nA programmer of this game hid inside the ROM a separate series of sound effects which apparently the management did not like and forced him to change. In protest, the programmer left the following message to ROM hackers inside the code teaching them how to enable the other sounds effects.\n\nYou RETARDS say one thing, then something else later all the time. You\'re a sound company; quit ignoring pachinko sounds and trying to put these weird sounds in instead! Do you WANT it ti be this hard to hear the balls?! I\'ve left the PREVIOUS sounds, so edit this if you want to hear it. Set hex address AFFC to 1FAF and AFC4 to E0EE to get decent sounds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/neqmqaectgizqfkic8tu.jpg'),(11139,'VirtualAbbey',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11140,'Flake: The Legend of Snowblind','2024-01-23','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on this mystical journey in the role of Flake, an incredible creature.\nWill you be able to walk the thin white line between good and evil?\nWhat will you do with your chance to save the world that is hanging on a thread?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ck7.jpg'),(11141,'Towards Future','2022-02-18','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z52.jpg'),(11142,'Sparkling Bug','2015-11-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Senkichu(Sparkling Bug) is an exploration game taking place underwater and the goal is to collect every item and song to unlock the ending.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9joi.jpg'),(11143,'Pinball FX3: Marvel Pinball - Avengers Chronicles','2017-09-26','Simulator, Pinball','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Marvel Pinball: Avengers Chronicles takes the critically acclaimed pinball series to uncharted territory. Each of the four tables in this brand new pack chronicles a blockbuster event in the Marvel Universe: Marvel\'s The Avengers (based on the 2012 film from Marvel Studios), Fear Itself, The Infinity Gauntlet and World War Hulk.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co484n.jpg'),(11144,'Drag Racing 3D: Streets 2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11145,'Tails and Pines','2022-03-05','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Two friends, whose paths diverged once, met again after many years. However, both of them have changed and live in two different worlds now. Can they get through the old grudges in their hearts and become something more than just friends?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jci.jpg'),(11146,'Grand Prix 3','2000-08-24','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grand Prix 3 (GP3) is a computer racing simulator by MicroProse. Released in 2000 by Hasbro Interactive featuring the 1998 Formula One season (with all drivers except Jacques Villeneuve, who is instead replaced by a fictional character, John Newhouse). The game wasn\'t quite as well received as its predecessors, but at the time was widely considered to be the best racing simulation available.\n\nAn add-on to the game, called GP3-2000 or GP32k, was released by Hasbro which updated the game to the 2000 Formula One season. A few other changes were made as well including: updated damage physics including damage from on-circuit debris, improved AI, a new replay system, and EAX 3D-sound.\n\nSince the release of Grand Prix 4, the GP3 modding scene has slowly declined, and with the cracking of track editing for GP4 many track modders left GP3 for the newer title.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q9n.jpg'),(11147,'Groove Coaster: Wai Wai Party!!!! - Original Pack','2020-03-26','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11148,'Space Engineers: Ultimate Edition 2024','2024-12-18','Sin género','Xbox One','The Space Engineers Ultimate Edition 2023 includes all of the DLCs for Space Engineers, all the decorative blocks and cosmetic items released in 2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023 and 2024.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eti.jpg'),(11149,'Drama Queens',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11150,'Donut County','2018-12-18','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Donut County is a story-based physics puzzle game where you play as an ever-growing hole in the ground. Meet cute characters, steal their trash, and throw them in a hole.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qv8.jpg'),(11151,'Dishonored 2','2016-11-11','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Dishonored 2 is a first-person action video game and the sequel to Dishonored. It borrows many of the gameplay elements from the first opus: players define their own play style by blending action, assassination, stealth, mobility and combat. Combining tools at their disposal, players are allowed options to eliminate enemies, whether they choose to pursue them unseen or ruthlessly attack head on. Dishonored 2 features the same campaign style as its predecessor in which the protagonist must advance through a series of missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e29.jpg'),(11152,'Savage Moon','2008-12-24','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PlayStation 3','Savage Moon is a tower defense strategy game which sees the player protecting a remote, off-world mining facility from constant attack by Insectocytes, a type of carnivorous creature inhabiting the planets. The mission is to strategically place an array of upgradeable, defensive weapons in the way of the bugs. There is a range of towers, from rapid-fire machine guns to support towers such as the chaos tower.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3j8y.jpg'),(11153,'Cave Digger','2021-08-15','Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Cave Digger 2D is a mining game in an alternative western setting. Gear up with numerous unique tools and explore the town and the depths of the mountain. Discover secrets, easter eggs and multiple endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4eud.jpg'),(11154,'Super Mutant Alien Assault','2019-07-12','Shooter, Platform, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"Taking up arms solo or with a friend, you must dance with death in a brutal and addictive arcade platformer shooter inspired by Super Crate Box and stuffed to the brim with unlockables.\n\nFight through rapid fire single screen levels each with a random combination of platform layout, objective, vending machines and enemies. Dodge and weave amongst the aliens to stay alive but don’t leave them standing too long or the ship’s radiation will mutate them into bigger, nastier versions.\n\nOnly by unlocking and mastering the wild variety of weapons, explosives, special abilities, defense moves and perks can you hope to survive across all three galaxies, rid your ship of the mutant menace and save the oblivious humans.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/i8qmgxpgpphr1gn85nui.jpg'),(11155,'Drift Desert Race',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11156,'Dusty',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Dusty is a fast-paced multiplayer shooter where strategy and skill determine victory. Join intense battles in Capture the Flag, Team Deathmatch, and Free for All, with more modes coming soon. Choose your team, fight for dominance, and experience adrenaline-fueled combat!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ni2.jpg'),(11157,'Call of Duty: Heroes','2014-11-26','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Call of Duty: Heroes is a free-to-play mobile real-time strategy game for iOS and Android. The game lets players build, customize and strengthen their bases for epic battles. It also allows the players to train and experience commanding an army of legendary heroes, elite soldiers, and devastating drones from the Call of Duty franchise. Gameplay differs greatly from previous games due to it being a real-time strategy game rather than a first-person shooter, making the gamplay similar to Clash of Clans. The player takes control of Units, and can also call in Heroes to help, to destroy enemy bases. While Heroes can be controlled to an extent in that they can be moved, Units can\'t be controlled, except for the fact that the player can choose where to place their units.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ado.jpg'),(11158,'Kiloton','2025-02-21','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Invade your neighbors, conduct bombing campaigns, research and develop nuclear arsenals, and grapple for diplomatic power in Kiloton, a dark and abstract new RTS that puts you in the room where potentially world-ending decisions are made.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j2z.jpg'),(11159,'Ninja Chowdown: Glaze of Glory','2024-07-18','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Play as Donatsu, the chubby ninja and use your secret arts to fight along 35 action packed levels, in which to collect donuts and defeat members of the evil food clans. Ninja Chowdown: Glaze of Glory is a delicious pixel art arcade that will put your abilities to test.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vj5.jpg'),(11160,'Standby','2017-01-06','Platform, Racing, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Never Standby in this fast-paced, precise platformer and get out of the glitched world! Can you do it faster than anyone?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mjx.jpg'),(11161,'Spellarium 11','2024-08-13','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play Match3 Puzzle and return the dying world back to life!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oi6.jpg'),(11162,'Madden NFL 2004','2003-08-11','Simulator, Sport','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','The 2004 edition of Madden NFL Football includes several changes from the previous year. It features a complete list of NFL players and teams with statistics tracking. Multiple play modes include regular season, playoffs, and exhibition play.\n\nCreate-a-player mode allows for the creation of a custom NFL player, which can be traded during a season.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30uu.jpg'),(11163,'Densha de GO! Ryojou-hen','2000-10-01','Simulator','Arcade, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Taito\'s 13th entry in its train simulation series, this one focused on electric trams and light rails.\n\nGanbare Unten-shi!! (loosely translated to \"Good Luck, Driver!!\") is an electric train driving simulation game developed and released by Taito for arcades in Japan on October 2000.\n\nA spin-off of the Densha de Go! series (and using the same engine as Densha de Go! 3 Tsuukin-hen), Ganbare Unten-shi!! focuses on light rail transit with two routes: the Enoshima Electric Railway and the Iyo Railway.\n\nWhile much of the game is the same as the main series, it modifies the braking and throttling controls for added precision and adds controls for operating the vehicle\'s doors. Due to street traffic, maintaining a timetable is not as strict as previous entries and the time-based penalty system is replaced with a \"lives\"-based one.\n\nThe game was later ported to both the PlayStation 2 (on July 25, 2002) and PC (by Unbalance on June 5, 2003) as Densha de Go! Ryojou-hen (loosely translated to \"Go by Train! Emotional Travel Edition\"). This version features features an updated graphics engine (based on Densha de Go! Shinkansen) and adds four additional routes: two from the Keifuku Electric Railroad and two from the Hakodate Transportation Bureau.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yzw.jpg'),(11164,'Spider-Sense Spider-Man: Web-Master','2009-12-31','Sin género','Plug & Play','Spider-Man: Web Master is a Plug It In & Play TV Motion game based on Spider-Man.\n\nThe web-sling controller features a wrist strap that you insert your arm into, A and B buttons, and a D-pad.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5f8y.jpg'),(11165,'Game of Stones','2018-03-28','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','True magic is a challenge, and sorceror\'s apprentice Anton has to master a very dangerous test right in his first year!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11166,'SD Gundam Gaiden Knight Gundam Monogatari: Entaku no Kishi-dan','2009-09-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Legacy Mobile Device','SD Gundam Gaiden Knight Gundam Monogatari: Entaku no Kishi-dan is a Role-Playing game, published by Bandai','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yf0.jpg'),(11167,'Nanny',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Evil nanny has you locked in her house, but you\'ve discovered a way to break free from her. You have just 7 days to do that.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5iob.jpg'),(11168,'Yet Another Hero Story','2019-07-09','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Yet Another Hero Story is a classic point and click adventure set in a fantasy, cartoon world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ft2.jpg'),(11169,'Resident Evil: Revelations 2 - Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Resident Evil Revelations 2 is a survival-horror thriller featuring the interwoven stories of Claire Redfield and Barry Burton across 4 playable episodes. The series favorite Raid Mode also returns in a big way, offering countless hours of gameplay. This deluxe bundle includes the complete story, extra episodes, extra costumes, additional Raid Mode characters, throwback maps and additional storage slots.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2aft.jpg'),(11170,'SPQR: The Empire\'s Darkest Hour','1997-07-09','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SPQR is a 3D adventure game that challenges you to learn how the Roman Empire works - structurally, mechanically, economically, culturally and politically. Players are given one year to investigate five equally suspicious suspects in order to solve the ultimate mystery: Who is plotting to destroy Rome and how will they do it?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ne6.jpg'),(11171,'Simple 2000 Series Vol. 13: The Renai Adventure 2 - Garasu no Mori','2002-10-24','Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','Simple 2000 Series Vol. 013: The Renai Adventure 2 - Garasu No Mori: Glass no Mori is a PS2 otome game developed by HuneX and published by D3. The game is volume 13 of the Simple Series line of budget games. The game tells the story of the protagonist\'s last visit to her deceased grandfather\'s house on the edge of a haunted forest in the countryside. The forest is rumoured to be a \'kamikakushi\' that steals away children.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qjhnredl8nrvhzl5tesj.jpg'),(11172,'Toy Story 3: The Video Game','2010-07-15','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo DS','Help Buzz, Woody and the rest of the toys ensure no toy gets left behind in the official videogame based on the hit animated movie franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tr6.jpg'),(11173,'Mega City Force','2023-07-28','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Retrowave Action Roguelike featuring tough agents battling crime to the electrifying music of artists like Droid Bishop, Timecop1983, and more! Choose your agent and dive into hardcore action against enemies and bosses, utilizing a vast arsenal and special abilities that will define your playstyle','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hou.jpg'),(11174,'Alan Probe: Amateur Surgeon - Christmas Edition','2008-12-01','Puzzle, Simulator','Web browser, iOS','An Amateur Surgeon game with some extra features.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zkv.jpg'),(11175,'Toy Story 2: Woody Sousaku Daisakusen!!',NULL,'Sin género','Sega Pico','Minigame collection based on Toy Story 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ln7fvyphwtar0gdat4hk.jpg'),(11176,'Probe','2020-04-14','Shooter, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A challenging 2D block breaker featuring arcade elements and a modern spin on the popular retro game. Destroy data blocks and galactic enemies using only your probe, bullets and power ups but don\'t lose your ball to the void. Do you have what it takes to reach the end of the universe?\n\nFeatures:\n-50 Unique and challenging levels\n-6 Power-ups to combine and utilize\n-XBOX Controller Support\n-80+ Steam Achievements\n-Gameplay Statistics (In-Game)\n-Steam Leaderboards and Scoring System','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l7j.jpg'),(11177,'Somber',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','It\'s been 30 years since the mysterious abandonment of the R.R.C Titan, a giant factory ship orbiting around a dying star. What was once a technological powerhouse, creating the most intelligent and sturdy robots, made to replace humans in tasks that demand lot\'s of back breaking labor and complex calculations, is now a rotting wreck floating aimlessly around its star.\n\nWhile the company and its founder were always a source of controversy, nobody has claimed any sort of attack on the facility. Making the sudden abandonment all the more mysterious.\n\nYou awaken on board this ship, not knowing who you are or how you got there.\n\nYou get an incoming message from a humanoid robot named Rick, who tells you that the robots on the ship have become self sustained and will kill any intruders.\nHe can help you escape, if you help him in return.\n\nWill you trust Rick?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6691.jpg'),(11178,'SoulCalibur VI: Character Creation Set C','2019-11-25','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Celebrate 20 years of SoulCalibur with an all new Character Creation set!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6i14.jpg'),(11179,'Nobunaga\'s Ambition','1983-12-31','Strategy','PC-9800 Series, PC-8800 Series, Sharp X1, Legacy Computer, PC (Microsoft Windows), Sharp MZ-2200, FM-7, NEC PC-6000 Series, MSX','Nobunaga\'s Ambition, the first of the series, was released in 1983. Players assume the mantle of either Nobunaga Oda or Shingen Takeda and strive to conquer the entire land (17 areas in the Kansai and central Japan region). They manage their country to make it rich, then prepare their military forces. These then attack and defeat surrounding Clans in battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hmy.jpg'),(11180,'Unsouled','2022-04-28','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Set in a beautiful but haunting world, Unsouled is an atmospheric Action-RPG about a mysterious power used with deadly purpose - featuring highly-stylized combat that’s fast-paced and rewarding.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nlm.jpg'),(11181,'Luxor: Quest for the Afterlife','2009-05-11','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','LUXOR, the #1-selling, action-puzzle game, blasts outside Egypt\'s borders and onto the Silk Road in search of riches beyond imagination. One of the most beautiful and well-known faces in history is also one of its greatest mysteries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nn4.jpg'),(11182,'Time of Dragons','2016-02-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This is an MMO shooter where you ride dragons armed with missiles and lasers!\n\nThe plot of the game unfolds in an imaginary universe, where two highly advanced races, Neils and Atlans, fight against each other.\n\nTheir battle units are gigantic flying creatures controlled by adopiants, their riders.\n\nThe game offers the following:\n- Multiple creatures with unique capabilities\n- A wide selection of weapons\n- Various combat modes\n- Freedom and beauty of dragon flights\n- Battles against players from all over the world!\n\nTake your dragon into the sky and prove that you are the best!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ylj.jpg'),(11183,'Dodge','2019-08-07','Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dodge is a fast paced reflex game. Survive as long as possible by avoiding enemies, patterns, and boost your score using various powerups to obtain the highest highscore. Customize your games by changing the game\'s color palette, or its gameplay settings, such as the difficulty, disabling powerups or patterns. Every gameplay setting combination has its own highscore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4g3j.jpg'),(11184,'Company of Heroes 2: Ardennes Assault','2014-11-17','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Company of Heroes 2: Ardennes Assault is a harrowing new chapter in the critically acclaimed series. Continuing the story in World War II, this exciting campaign places you in the heart of the battle, once described by Churchill as \"...undoubtedly the greatest American battle of the War\". This pivotal conflict is known to many as \'The Battle of the Bulge.\'','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nhp.jpg'),(11185,'Woozworld',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Woozworld is a social MMO based on fashion, fame, and talking to others. You can sell, buy and trade clothes, level up by doing quests, and customize your own rooms, called \"Unitz\", with furniture, wallpapers, and sky textures.\n\nSometimes there are also events where you get to meet the creators or the \"celebrities\" of Woozworld such as Mya or Jay Wooz.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tf0.jpg'),(11186,'Maverta','2021-11-09','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Minimalist, relaxing, motion logic, interactive mind game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5krp.jpg'),(11187,'Mystic Messenger: Ray\'s After Ending','2020-12-20','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','DLC that can be played regardless of progress in Ray\'s route. Takes place two weeks after Ray\'s good ending.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x8d.jpg'),(11188,'Teamup','2007-12-31','Platform, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Progress through the 50 levels of puzzle-adventure mode, encountering ramps, elevators, chutes and more. You can even design your own levels and share them with other players!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pdk.jpg'),(11189,'Neo Spectrum','2021-11-16','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The system has been compromised, it\'s your job to restore it.\nNeo Spectrum is a 2D puzzle platformer game. Use the properties of the different colored blocks to face numerous puzzles and challenges, starting from simple ones like moving platforms to advanced ones where you\'ll have to manouver quickly around enemies, dodge lasers, walljump and even control multiple characters at once.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47sh.jpg'),(11190,'Crimson Skies: High Road to Revenge','2003-10-31','Simulator, Arcade','Xbox','Crimson Skies: High Road to Revenge combines thrilling aerial combat with the swashbuckling style of a Hollywood action-adventure movie. Set in an alternate 1930s world of gunship diplomacy and sinister intrigue, Crimson Skies: High Road to Revenge lets gamers pilot powerful aircraft against nefarious air pirates and behemoth war zeppelins. As the daring air pirate Nathan Zachary, leader of the infamous Fortune Hunters, players take off on a high-flying adventure, filled with daring escapes and damsels in distress.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g8e.jpg'),(11191,'Assault Spy','2018-10-02','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dash, evade, and smash your way to the truth as the corporate spy, Asaru; or the reckless CIA agent, Amelia! Uncover the dark secrets of the Negabot mega corporation as you save the company from a hostile takeover. Assault Spy is a stylish, fast paced, pure-action game with a dash of comedy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nc4.jpg'),(11192,'Skin Tight Bitch Fight','2015-07-22','Fighting, Sport, Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser','Two (or one) players select wrestlers and pit them against one another in a match with the goal of working together to please the crowd. If you succeed, your next show will sell out, if not, the booker will have to cancel since you didn\'t keep their attention. \n \nThis game is focused heavily on tough women with a diverse cast of characters including trans women and women of colour.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1inh.jpg'),(11193,'The Storied Sword','2024-08-23','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Entertainment System, Dreamcast','The Storied Sword is an action-platformer for retro consoles. Developed by Bite The Chili Productions and Raft Labs Interactive and published by Orc Face Games.\n\nAssume the mantle of the mysterious folk hero Candlemaster Cedric or the elusive Orchid of Mourning, and wall-jump your way through the trials this fast-paced, multi-scrolling platformer has to offer.\n\nInspired by classics like Tecmo’s Ninja Gaiden and Sunsoft’s Batman, The Storied Sword is sure to raise the challenge level for NES Homebrew platformers and bring players the 8-bit twitch-combat style they know and love.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98to.jpg'),(11194,'Urban Witch Story','2020-05-11','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','During the first night of the 1992 Los Angeles riots, two police officers resolve on investigating the disappearance of the children of one of their acquaintances.\nThroughout their search they will face street gangs, their own colleagues and even the supernatural.\n\n-Over 30 playable rooms in full Sierra AGI style.\n-Over 40 interactive characters.\n-Character close-ups on the characters who advance the investigation.\n-Only inventory based puzzles.\n-Language: Spanish only (I hope I can update with an English translation someday)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25ql.jpg'),(11195,'The Mr. Rabbit Magic Show','2025-04-30','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The incredible Mr. Rabbit invites you all to a mysterious magic show! Celebrate 10 years of Rusty Lake with a new free-to-play point-and-click adventure that promises to delight and… shock you with its sleight of hand!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rkn.jpg'),(11196,'Anoix','2018-04-20','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','These are the voyages of the starship Anoix. Its 84-level mission to explore strange worlds, protect the ball from going outside and destroy all the bricks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70eb.jpg'),(11197,'Rose and Lotus: Petals of Memories','2023-06-28','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','[Rose and Lotus:Petals of Memories] is based on Korean traditional fairy tales \'Janghwa, Hongryeon\'.The main character, Rose, awake from the cold floor without her memory.Find the truth behind the dark mansion and get out of it with your sister Lotus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jop.jpg'),(11198,'Meteor Blaster',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11199,'Shy Guy Surfing','2024-07-27','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slide, jump, and float over the ocean in this arcade-style fangame by LucasPucas. With over a dozen unique areas, rip-roaring rival battles, and a brand-new New Game Plus mode, the world of Shy Guy Surfing is packed with content like never before!\nTravel across the wild seascape and face off against bosses in Journey Mode, or shoot for a high score in Endurance Mode.\nJam to classic music from the Mario series and more, arranged by an all-star cast of chiptune artists!\nCustomize your experience with a wide selection of screen borders and unlockable costumes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8l1n.jpg'),(11200,'Against the Moon: Moonstorm','2021-04-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The update tells the new story of the last bastion of humanity. This time, the young warrior Zoy, accompanied by the half-mutated Mazoon, will travel into the heart of Moonstorm to gather resources necessary for survival of the last stronghold of humanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dxo.jpg'),(11201,'Project Mist','2025-05-12','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join the Project Mist in this new open world survival horror. Explore an enigmatic Island. Fight against colossal monsters. Build and defend your base while crafting traps, siege weapons, upgrading your gear and Gravity Gun. Survive or perish while unraveling the secrets behind the giant wall!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co796q.jpg'),(11202,'Mama Cabra','2025-04-17','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mama Cabra is a goat space shooter. Shoot space foes, save sheepies and smell the flowers.\n\nMade with Pico-8 for the I, Rebel game jam 2025. Powered by Atari','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9piz.jpg'),(11203,'J.R.R. Tolkien\'s Lord of the Rings: Volume 1','1995-05-23','Role-playing (RPG)','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','An action role-playing game produced by Interplay Productions for the Super Nintendo Entertainment System. It is an adaptation of The Fellowship of the Ring by J. R. R. Tolkien.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mie.jpg'),(11204,'Skullstone',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An ancient structure, long buried under Lisenian woods, is slowly rising due to unknown forces. Skullstone stands on top of it – a dreaded entrance into the darkness below. Evil creatures come out of it killing brave men, snatching frail women and helpless children. While local monks waste time praying in their monastery and deciding how to deal with the stream of evil beings, people of the town of Lisentar act on their own by calling for mercenaries who can save them.\n\nChoose from 20 pre-made characters, each with different set of skills and abilities. Tough warriors, agile archers, healing clerics, and powerful wizards are all waiting for your sign. Gather the best team and lead it into the Skullstone dungeon. Accept quests, kill monsters, find treasures and claim rewards. Develop your mercenaries to survive the dangers hidden in the darkness, progress through different levels and prepare to face the ultimate evil!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/h3xcihyvsg3pkvbefexe.jpg'),(11205,'Doko Roko','2022-09-09','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doko Roko is a game by Eric Mack that was successfully crowd-funded in November 2015. It is being developed by Okobu Games with a planned release in Q4 2017.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gu0.jpg'),(11206,'Hostile Waters: Antaeus Rising','2001-06-13','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In 2032 an Earth that knows only peace is forced to relearn the art of war. \n \nTwenty years have passed since the population of Earth did a fine job of destroying nearly everything in one final struggle for power by the politicians and military leaders. Twenty years have been spent building a near Utopia, a society where currency and finance are irrelevant, a planet without hunger or poverty. All weapons have been destroyed to ensure peace. But hidden away in an archipelago in the Pacific Ocean, a cabal of old-world magnates: ex-leaders, financiers, politicians, and despots, are planning a return to the greed fueled, hate filled past. And there in no way to fight them. Except this one last remaining Adaptive Cruiser – The Antaeus. \n \nAntaeus Rising combines explosive action with powerful real-time strategy. Take command of powerful aircraft carrier/manufacturing platform. Create military units with your carrier using the most advanced nano-technology known by the modern world and lead an army against the forces of the Old World Cabal. Plan your assault from within your carrier and than enter your units for some third-person mayhem! The fate of world is in your hands, are you able to hold it?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22ap.jpg'),(11207,'Clawball','2024-10-17','Sport','Meta Quest 2','Clawball is a Cat vs Cat VR Soccer Game. Use your hands to run, climb, jump and \"kick\" the ball in this multiplayer game developed by the creators of the Pixel Ripped franchise ARVORE Immersive Experiences','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gyo.jpg'),(11208,'Cellfish','2024-03-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Collect food to evolve and fight for your life against enemy cells in this deep underwater, survivor-like, roguelite experience. Unlock parts to customize your character and become your own unique cell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7udk.jpg'),(11209,'Dream Rhythm','2024-10-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Dream Rhythm\" is an addictive rhythm game. Simple operation, beautiful songs, bring you a dreamy flow experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pqf.jpg'),(11210,'Pierrot’s Pilgrimage',NULL,'Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Hello! Do you want to play something easy but different? This game is like a walk in a strange park. But also you can speak with people in this park. Don\'t worry, they are behind the screen, they are not real! They can\'t hurt you. They cannot fall in love with you. Very nice and chill experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k9r.jpg'),(11211,'Outbreak: Shades of Horror Chromatic Split Infection Collection','2024-11-01','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','A terrifying survival horror anthology covering the destruction of Cypress Ridge from zombies and dinosaurs!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e9v.jpg'),(11212,'Chicken Assassin: Reloaded','2018-07-19','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Chicken Assassin is a fast paced action-RPG with an outrageous storyline filled with over-the-top humor that boasts a myriad of colorful enemies and visually stunning levels and environments.\n\nPrepare to give your hand an intense workout as you battle a slew of eclectic adversaries and encounter special bosses in this frenetically action packed game!\n\nYou play as Mean Mcallister, the living embodiment of what would happen if you combined Rambo, Foghorn Leghorn, a bottle of hot sauce, and a case of energy drinks together.\n\nWhen the evil mastermind Spritzel and the Henchmen abduct your girlfriend, Candy, you embark on a frantic journey to save her, leaving mayhem and destruction along your path. As you progress, you can upgrade Mean with various fighting styles and skills, access an arsenal of weapons to dole out punishment, and customize clothing that boosts your stat attributes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wkxn1ybeccvsgq2mz8ym.jpg'),(11213,'Castlevania: Symphony of the Night','2018-10-26','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 4','A remaster of Castlevania: Symphony of the Night included in the \"Castlevania Requiem\" collection.\n\nExperience Symphony of the Night remastered to 4K/1080p, with optional rendering options such as image-smoothing. This remaster is based on Symphony of the Night\'s expanded re-release for Castlevania: The Dracula X Chronicles.\n\nFeaturing ground-breaking non-linear gameplay, Symphony of the Night helped define a new genre of gameplay by blending RPG elements, exploration and platforming. The vast number of weapons and items found throughout the game allows a diverse range of play styles to be employed. This game perfected the essence of the Castlevania series with gorgeous artwork and classic soundtrack that carry the player through the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zoi.jpg'),(11214,'AdoraBullet','2023-09-25','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join Rae Stellaris in an epic quest through the cosmos in this cutesy, Game Boy-inspired bullet hell. As the daughter of legendary Lunaheim galactic soldiers who died protecting the planet in a fight against Emperor Quack, Rae’s destiny is to destroy Emperor Quack to avenge her parents and keep her home planet Lunaheim safe.\n\nRae Stellaris is the daughter of Legendary Lunaheim galactic soldiers who lost their lives in a fight trying to defeat Emperor Quack. Following in her parents\' footsteps, Rae trained for four years in the galactic bootcamp and earned the rank of Corporal. After her promotion, Rae is demanded for the mission to defeat Emperor Quack alone. Her superiors knew it was a suicide mission, but due to Rae’s tenacity and determined righteousness, they let her go with the fate of Lunaheim in her hands.\n\nMade for GBJam 11.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76qs.jpg'),(11215,'Dragrave Marauders',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11216,'Pinball FX2: Marvel\'s Women of Power','2016-09-25','Pinball','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Combining a plethora of stellar female Super Heroes from the Marvel Universe, the Marvel\'s Women of Power two-pack combines two tables starring Ms. Marvel, Black Widow and more. Defeat Bombshell with Ms. Marvel and friends in Champions, and wage an epic battle in an alternate reality in the A-Force table.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vdi.jpg'),(11217,'Hard Platformers Bundle','2024-10-16','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','In this Xbox Bundle, you\'ll find some of the hardest platform games, including Ducky Dash, a nostalgic tribute to retro portable games with a monochromatic green palette, and Dark Elven Legacy, where Elynar, an elven archer, embarks on a sacred quest to recover ancient relics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ef3.jpg'),(11218,'PachiPara DL Hyper Sea Story In Karibu','2008-07-02','Sin género','PlayStation 3','PachiPara DL is the first PS3 release and the first downloadable title in Irem\'s long-running pachinko simulation series. It features faithful 3D recreations of two pachinko machines made by Sanyo Bussan: CR Hyper Umi Monogatari in Carib MTA and CR Hyper Umi Monogatari in Carib MTB. There are two modes available: Tsūjō (Normal) mode allows the player to modify a wide range of settings for each machine, while Jissen (Battle) mode challenges the player to win as many balls as possible on the default settings with a limited starting pool and time limit. Scores from Jissen mode could be uploaded to a national leaderboard, which was also used for a promotional contest shortly after the game\'s release. There is also a View mode where the various animations that play on the in-game display can be freely viewed. There is no story mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2iu5.jpg'),(11219,'King\'s Valley','1985-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','MSX','King’s Valley is a platform/maze game from Konami, released for the MSX computer and MS-DOS in 1985. The game plays is like Lode Runner except it takes place in pyramids instead of Egyptian ruins. As an intrepid adventurer, the player\'s goal is to collect various gems, while evading angry mummies and other monsters long enough to find the exit to the next level.\n\nA port to MS-DOS was made by a Korean company named APROMAN, however it only supports monochrome and CGA graphic cards. Another unofficial port has been released by the Spanish RetroWorks [1] in 2009 for the ZX Spectrum on the site \'World Of Spectrum\'[2].\n\nThe MSX version of this game can still be run with emulators like BlueMSX [3]. Emulators for the Sinclair ZX Spectrum are available at WOS.\n\nKing\'s Valley had been rewritten (not ported or emulated) in 2008 using Java, Online version is playable over internet using the web-browser and Mobile version is downloadable for handhelds, mobiles and communicators with Java installed for personal use [4].','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96ay.jpg'),(11220,'Leave Me Alone: A Trip to Hell','2016-04-20','Platform, Sport, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Skate. Fight. Fight with a skate. Everything we love about platformers in one game.Leave Me Alone is a game about guiding a fierce skater through geeky ’90s style locations. Fight monsters and mutants while performing mad skateboarding tricks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dfu4yf99ldlzyyeew67g.jpg'),(11221,'The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time - Gold Quest','2022-10-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo 64','Gold Quest is like an expanded Master Quest. Different dungeon & overworld layouts plus many other little gameplay changes.\n\nDesigned with the more experienced OOT player in mind & for those who like to complete 100% of the game. Like Master Quest, it’s the same story, although there are some text changes & cutscenes have generally been made shorter. Text speed has been increased. Dungeon Maps have all been updated for new chest locations with fast chest openings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5owc.jpg'),(11222,'Starswirl Academy',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A visual novel demo based on ponies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4u2i.jpg'),(11223,'SnowRunner: Crocodile Pack','2022-03-01','Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','The Crocodile Pack includes:\n• The Step 33-64 “Crocodile” truck\n• A Sideboard add-on\n• A Maintenance Frame add-on\n• A Small Fuel Carrier add-on','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sff.jpg'),(11224,'Picross S5','2020-11-26','Puzzle, Strategy','Nintendo Switch','The fifth installment in Jupiter Corporation\'s Picross S series for the Switch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2len.jpg'),(11225,'Once On a Windswept Night','2017-02-06','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A yuri (GxG) VN about a traveller who runs across two nuns in an abandoned church.\n\nOur protagonist, a mysterious traveller, wanders the far-off land of Desservir searching for patrons to buy their wares. Upon hearing about a large annual market in the village of Castella, the traveller decides to set up a stall and try their luck.\n\nLife, however, is not so easy.\n\nAfter being double-crossed by a goblin and left in the middle of the cold, wet moors to die, the traveller almost gives up hope. That is, until they stumble upon a mysterious church in the middle of nowhere, and meet the two nuns who attend to it. What are these two nuns doing on their own, and why is there such a melancholy atmosphere in the air?\n\nThe traveller has only one windswept night to uncover these mysteries and learn the truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22sf.jpg'),(11226,'DayZ: Cool Edition','2024-11-18','Sin género','Xbox One','The DayZ Cool Edition bundle features DayZ with the Livonia map, as well DayZ Frostline. Explore the dense and deadly Livonia. Brave the wintry terrain in the volcanic archipelago of Sakhal. Battle the infected and survivors who are hungrier and more desperate than you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9esk.jpg'),(11227,'Enzio-Ware','2025-02-20','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play through 40+ Microgames in Enzio-Ware!In this colorful spin-off of 【Onwards! To the Furthest End!! Go Forth Supreme PLC!!!!】 you will play through the episodes of 8 fascinating characters, both new and returning, and complete microgames to help them out in their daily ongoings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kuh.jpg'),(11228,'Don\'t Starve: Giant Edition + Shipwrecked Expansion','2016-08-02','Sin género','Xbox One','The complete Don\'t Starve experience bundle! Includes Don\'t Starve: Giant Edition, the renowned uncompromising wilderness survival game, and the Shipwrecked expansion pack!\n\nYou play as Wilson, an intrepid Gentleman Scientist who has been trapped by a demon and transported to a mysterious wilderness world. Wilson must learn to exploit his environment and its inhabitants if he ever hopes to escape and find his way back home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kfc.jpg'),(11229,'Operación Tigre Blanco','2012-06-30','Point-and-click, Quiz/Trivia, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Operation White Tiger was a Spanish interactive educational adventure that required answering basic questions about biology and anatomy, among others, in order to progress.\nThe story is about a secret agent named Hache who needs to rescue a lost albino tiger cub that was being studied by biologists in the Indian city of Bengal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8te1.jpg'),(11230,'Susume! Taisen Puzzle Dama: Toukon! Marutama Chou','1998-03-26','Puzzle','Nintendo 64','Susume! Taisen Puzzle Dama: Tōkon! Marutama Chō is a puzzle video game released in 1998 on the Nintendo 64 in Japan only. The game was developed and published by Konami. It is a port of the arcade and PlayStation game Susume! Taisen Puzzle-Dama (Let\'s Attack Crazy Cross), originally released in 1996, but also features characters and gameplay from the spin-off Taisen Tokkae-Dama.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nih.jpg'),(11231,'Gang Beasts','2017-12-12','Fighting, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Gang Beasts is a silly multiplayer party game with surly gelatinous characters, brutal slapstick fight sequences, and absurd hazardous environments, set in the mean streets of Beef City.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24is.jpg'),(11232,'Three Kingdoms Story: Conussia','2020-05-08','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A tale of sex, power, and intrigue set in the Royal Court of a fantasy kingdom. Become the saviour of Conussia, or its doom. Extreme adult content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62df.jpg'),(11233,'Exista!','2024-03-16','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','EXISTA! offers a journey of a child through intriguing challenges and obstacles. In the role of the child, you must overcome obstacles using your natural abilities. As you progress, new skills are acquired, enabling you to face increasingly complex challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uhu.jpg'),(11234,'Fistagon',NULL,'Fighting, Puzzle, Sport, Indie','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR','Compete in the futuristic Fistagon-tournament against the best atheletes in the world!\nPlay in multiplayer to crush other fisters around the world or in single player to top the global leaderboards. Fistagon is a game that\'s easy to learn, but hard to master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70aa.jpg'),(11235,'Fireman Sam to the Rescue','2015-11-27','Puzzle, Arcade','Nintendo 3DS','Fireman Sam and friends are back to save the day in a brand new adventure! Help Sam and the Pontypandy fire crew in three action-packed missions; Brave to the core: Fire-fighter emergency, Rescue at Sea and Animal Rescue. Sam and the team are always on duty in this interactive story packed with fun puzzles and games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8irv.jpg'),(11236,'Pokémon 2000 Adventure Game','2000-07-21','Adventure','Web browser','Pokémon 2000 Adventure Game was an online game developed by Cyberworld International Corporation as a tie-in to Pokémon the Movie 2000. It utilized Cyberworld\'s proprietary QBORG technology to display 2.5D environments in a specialized browser. According to Neil Marshall, who served as a programmer and technical director for the project, the game was only available for a month before being pulled due to \"a contract dispute\". However, at least one file existed as late as 2003, and the front page of the game existed as late as 2009 according to Wayback Machine.\n\nThe game had the player set their name, choose a Pokémon team, and select difficulty. The player would navigate a 2.5D environment, with web pages displayed on a side panel allowing for further interaction with the game world. The goal of the game was to travel to three islands, each guarded by one of the three legendary bird Pokémon, Moltres, Zapdos, and Articuno, and retrieve an Ancient Sphere from each island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ney.jpg'),(11237,'Crystal Defenders','2009-08-06','Strategy','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360','Crystal Defenders is a defensive strategy game, in which the player must guard a path using troops taken straight from the Final Fantasy job classes, such as Soldiers, Archers and Black Mages. Every enemy who traverses the entire path means another crystal lost to the party.\n\nThe game has three modes: W1 teaches the player the basics, W2 introduces Power Crystals which add a layer of strategy, and W3 is filled with more complex maps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n64.jpg'),(11238,'Reimagine: The Game','2011-05-07','Puzzle','Web browser','Reimagine first greets you with faceless celebrity caricatures hopping around the sides of a square, as you realize the gravity of the situation. Everything around you... is part of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ugd.jpg'),(11239,'Saimin Choukyou Shimai',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11240,'Wagyan Land 2','1990-12-14','Platform, Adventure','Family Computer, Wii U','Wagyan Land 2 is an Action game, developed by Now Production and published by Namco, which was released in Japan in 1990.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2y9h.jpg'),(11241,'Outbreak: Shades of Horror Chromatic Split Integral Collection','2024-10-25','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Experience all three survival horror prequels leading up to the events of Outbreak: Shades of Horror.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e9y.jpg'),(11242,'Mythlands: Flappy Dragon','2020-10-26','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Flappy Dragon is an endless runner with realistic graphics. Avoid obstacles to gain points pick up lives, shields and coins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pz2.jpg'),(11243,'Royal Crown','2020-04-29','Strategy, MOBA','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Royal Crown is a survival game using a cute artstyle set in a European-based fantasy world. More than 100 players will need to use their character abilities to do things like hunt, get armor, and grow stronger. There is also a cooking system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2opk.jpg'),(11244,'1066','2009-05-26','Strategy','Web browser','1066 is a historical strategy game in which you are set in the middle of war, and you have to lead your people towards victory by defeating the enemy\'s army.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qpu.jpg'),(11245,'Hikikomori Life',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Adventures of a reclusive gamer with elements of a simulator, quest and roguelike. Explore parallel worlds in an attempt to remove the curse from a magician in the body of a cat. Conquer a changing dungeon with many enemies. In the real world, equip a home, create objects, cook food, travel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lgi.jpg'),(11246,'Slenderman Must Die: Chapter 3','2014-09-23','Shooter, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slenderman Must Die: Silent Forest is the third episode of the Slenderman Must Die series from Poison Games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zpp.jpg'),(11247,'Three Fourths Home: Extended Edition - Deluxe',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Three Fourths Home is a visual short story in which you assume the role of Kelly during her drive through the storm. In the 20 miles between her grandparents\' crumbling barn and her parents\' home, she receives a phone call from her mother. While driving through a stylized representation of rural Nebraska, you must navigate an extended conversation between Kelly and her parents and younger brother.\n\nThree Fourths Home takes a look into a specific moment of these characters\' lives and their relationships with one another. The narrative touches on a variety of issues affecting Kelly and her family, including disability, adulthood, and familial obligation.\n\nAs a visual short story, dialogue choice is the primary focus of Three Fourths Home.\nBetween the main game and the epilogue, nearly 800 unique dialogue choices shade the story differently based on how you play. In addition to dialogue choice, you must also keep driving in order to keep the conversation going. Stop, and time slows to a crawl. Kelly has to move forward in order to get home.\n\nThree Fourths Home: Extended Edition includes an expanded edit of the initial release as well as several new elements, including a new epilogue in addition to a number of extra features.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11248,'Two Worlds II: Epic Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Two Worlds II Epic Edition includes the original Two Worlds II, the Pirates of the Flying Fortress expansion, and Two Worlds II: Castle Defense.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1kgx.jpg'),(11249,'Sangokushi for WonderSwan',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11250,'Attack on Tankette',NULL,'Indie','Android, iOS','A totally new & extremely challenging tank battle game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xaw.jpg'),(11251,'Storm Lover Kai!!','2012-06-07','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Updates graphics and adds scenario, CG\'s, and new OP/ED.\n\nStorm Lover is a tempest that blows itself into the world of otome dating sims. By allowing gamers to break up with their game boyfriend and developing a love triangle, the game opens the door to a slew of deliciously chaotic situations. The kai!! version strengthens the game by giving it more dating scenes. The silly couple dialogue becomes sweeter and the bored period becomes even colder. The game also comes with the epilogue chapter and event graphics for the gamers to unlock.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p8p.jpg'),(11252,'Ganbare Goemon: Ebisumaru Kiki Ippatsu','1990-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Ganbare Goemon: Ebisumaru Kiki Ippatsu is a portable electronic handheld game in the Ganbare Goemon series developed and published by Konami in 1990 in Japan.\nIn this LCD game, Goemon has to rescue Ebisumaru who has been captured by evildoers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56s5.jpg'),(11253,'Spider-Man 3 Puzzle','2007-07-01','Puzzle, Arcade','Legacy Mobile Device','Spider-Man 3 Puzzle is a match-three puzzle game based on the 2007 film featuring the comic hero. As in other match-three games, the player is presented with a grid of tiles (here called tokens) that can be removed by making matches of three or more tiles of the same colour. What makes this variant of the concept different is that the objective isn\'t just to remove the tokens but to move Spider-Man across the grid to a special destination. Each level has a path that Spider-Man follows. The path is hidden and is only revealed by swapping and removing tokens that are over the path. Spider-Man moves automatically when the path is revealed. Each level is time-based and Spider-Man has to reach his destination before the timer runs out.\n\nThe game features some special power-up tokens that will help the player. For example, there are the scramble tokens that shuffle all tokens on the grid, the spider-sense tokens that reveal the path temporarily, and the rage tokens that can be used to plough through tokens blocking the path. Spider-Man will be chased by black goo on some levels and has to finish the levels before being caught.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5r06.jpg'),(11254,'Abnormal',NULL,'Sin género','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A horror from distant past. \n \nWill awaken tonight. \n \nDo you dare face something Abnormal? \n \nAbnormal is a first person horror game made in the spirit of classical horror titles where the emphasis was making the player feel vulnerable and in real danger as opposed to the current trend of overpowering the player with weapons and resources and sending hordes of zombies after him. In Abnormal your character has asthma and therefore you have to keep looking for inhalers as you run out of breath from physical activities or from the horrors in this mansion. In addition to that, Abnormal features the ability to instantly switch between two different time periods in the mansion you are exploring which will come in handy for puzzle solving. \n \nAbnormal will feature optional support for Head Mounted Displays such as Oculus Rift and HTC Vive which will immerse you in the heart of fear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jy9.jpg'),(11255,'Wingspan Oceania Deluxe Bundle','2024-12-10','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Create the most amazing bird habitats in this complete Wingspan experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eeh.jpg'),(11256,'Asghan: The Dragon Slayer','1998-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Asghan: The Dragon Slayer is a fantasy-themed hack-and-slash action role-playing Game.\nPlayers take on the persona of Asghan, a warrior prince who swears to avenge the death of his father by dragons. The game is praised for smooth integration of action and role-playing elements as well as a wide array of enemies and weapons. It suffers, however, from lacking character development and awkward controls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mq7.jpg'),(11257,'Teabat!','2022-03-03','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Teabat! is a stylish retro 2D adventure with fast, tight controls, and a large interconnected map full of secrets and beautifully constructed set-pieces!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3aya.jpg'),(11258,'My Sweet Sadistic Sister','2022-08-21','Visual Novel','Android','After living alone with your dad for the past ten years, he has some news—he\'s getting married and you\'re getting a stepsister! Fortunately, it turns out that she\'s one of the kindest girls in your school… or so you thought. Turns out she\'s a sadistic bully, and now she\'s blackmailing you! Will you be able to keep this secret from your best friend and the classmate you\'re ordered to spy on?\n\nHow will you navigate your new life with a sadistic sister?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5a0d.jpg'),(11259,'Mario\'s Cement Factory','2002-10-25','Arcade','Game Boy Advance','The Modern version of the game has Mario working in a cookie factory. Yoshi and Toad are featured instead of the drivers, with Yoshi eating the Yoshi Cookies made on the left conveyor belt and Toad packaging the Yoshi Cookies made on the right conveyor belt. Boos also occasionally appear, taking up cookie dough slots on the second floor. Unlike in Classic Mode, however, Mario is allowed to fall down onto an elevator platform, but touching the very bottom or top still earns the player a miss. When Mario amasses 200, 500, and 700 points, a heart appears for him to remove a miss. Music is also featured in this version, with the tempo changing depending on the speed of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60nw.jpg'),(11260,'Vampire: The Masquerade - Shadows of New York Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cqa.jpg'),(11261,'Rocket Jump','2021-10-07','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rocket Jump is a great platform game that requires concentration and composure. Our goal is to get as high as possible, avoiding spikes and various obstacles. Think carefully about your next move, any mistake can cost you a lot of nerves and time.. The higher you are, the further you can fall.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c1z.jpg'),(11262,'Tenchu: Return From Darkness','2004-05-27','Adventure','Xbox','The violent rebellion and civil strife that have torn through the heart of 16th century Japan appear to be drawing to a close. But the mysterious Tenrai has begun a quest to conquer the country by amassing an army of ninjas and lords of darkness. Your master, Lord Gohda, has called upon you, a cunning stealth assassin, to stop Tenrai and his disciples before all is lost. Explore 11 incredibly detailed levels, including two new single-player maps and experience online stealth ninja action via Xbox Live, playing with a friend in two-player co-op mode featuring all-new stealth kills or choose from 20 playable characters and go head to head in deathmatch mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tgg.jpg'),(11263,'Ship of Fools: Water Garden Duo','2023-11-20','Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','New Fools have emerged from the ponds. The Water Garden duo is ready to join your crew.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7iui.jpg'),(11264,'Hot Air Bloon','2020-12-31','Platform, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hot Air Bloon is an online flash game released by Ninja Kiwi in November 2008 that is currently available on the Flash Archive. It is a horizontal scroller where the player is tasked with navigating a monkey hanging from a damaged blimp through an ever-accelerating series of obstacles while popping as many bloons as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r8v.jpg'),(11265,'Raiden Fighters Jet','2013-05-16','Shooter','Arcade, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Raiden Fighters Jet is the third and last game in the Raiden Fighters series. This game retains the same intensity and manic gameplay as its predecessors, while introducing several new mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2umm.jpg'),(11266,'Super Putty Squad','2017-11-14','Platform, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Putty Is Back! A timeless classic makes the Nintendo Switch.\n\nJump, bounce, squidge and stretch your way to victory as you help Putty save his kidnapped friends from certain death in this classic gaming platformer with over 100 levels.\n\nSuper Putty Squad is a no-holds-barred retro gaming experience brought to life for the modern gamer combined with an all new tutorial mode for supreme playability. Tutorial mode guides you through the opening stages, offering hints and tips on how and when to utilise Putty’s arsenal of moves and equipment.\n\nOur hero, Putty, can inflate, morph, stretch, punch, jump and absorb, taking on ferocious enemies on his mission to rescue the imprisoned putties. Super Putty Squad features lovingly created levels that will test your timing, skill and imagination in an incredibly addictive platform adventure.\n\nCollect & unlock extra trophies as you power up and explore cunningly hidden new levels plus a unique Sticker Book feature that allows the player to track progress.\n\nThe unlikeliest of heroes, Putty has unique powers that make gameplay incredibly addictive, yet accessible for the casual gamer, with special objects to find and use, Super Putty Squad will keep you hooked for hours and hours of game play fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c86.jpg'),(11267,'Wardudes',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','WarDudes is a turn-based tactical warfare game. Take turns controlling members of your squad and try to prevail on the other teams! Use a large variety of weapons to destroy the enemy and watch the landscape being changed by the explosions!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hpu.jpg'),(11268,'She Who Fights Monsters: Choice Edition','2016-11-08','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Once upon a time, there was a sweet little girl with a big imagination. Her name was Jennifer (Jenny for short), and her world was full of adventure. A closet became a sanctuary. A basement became a secret passage to the Land of Elves. And her home became a nightmare world with no warning, rhyme or reason beyond the unpredictable winds of her father\'s drunken rage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bcs.jpg'),(11269,'Riptide GP2','2013-07-25','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One','Rev up your rocket-powered hydro jet and put your racing skills to the test as you rip across a dynamic, ever-changing torrent of waves in Riptide GP2. Race through futuristic cityscapes, twisting canals and rivers, open harbors and mysterious research facilities. Hurl yourself off sky-high jumps and bust out death defying stunts. Build a collection of powerful watercraft and customize their performance and paint schemes to suit your individual style. Take your skills online to battle other players around the world -- or trade elbows with friends in split-screen matches right in your home!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vgj.jpg'),(11270,'Utsuho\'s Great Hunger Battle','2023-08-17','Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a Touhou fangame and Utsuho Reiuji is the main character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78nz.jpg'),(11271,'Viva Piñata','2007-11-06','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Attract and tame your favourite Piñatas. There are more than 60 species that roam wild on Piñata Island. Personalise everything from the grass at your feet to the hat on your Piñata\'s head. Welcome to Piñata Island, enjoy your stay!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h1y.jpg'),(11272,'UFO: Unidentified Falling Objects','2023-08-09','Platform, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Unidentified Falling Objects is a unique mashup of platforming and puzzle destroying gameplay. Players are dropped into the puzzle where they must dodge the falling obstacles and destroy blocks to make big combos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vo8.jpg'),(11273,'My Crush, My Bully','2021-12-08','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','My Bully, My Crush is a short kinetic visual novel with yuri romance as its theme. It is around 40 minutes long.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mtm.jpg'),(11274,'Dueholo',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11275,'The Void Project','2024-10-31','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Void Project is a fast paced arena shooter that throws you into an arena simulation. Face different kind of demons, overcome their patterns and finish them off in as less time as possible to reach the top of the leaderboard and make yourself worthy of calling ~The Void Breaker~.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rq2.jpg'),(11276,'Jack & Detective','2024-09-10','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Find Jack out among us.Players are divided into \"Jack the Ripper\" and \"Detective\" and try to guess who is Jack.You cannot talk to other players in this game, so you must deduce who is Jack by relying solely on the actions of each player. Each game takes 10 minutes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xb2.jpg'),(11277,'Wizard\'s Warp','2025-05-09','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Always wanted to learn how to teleport? Try not to get stuck in a wall! Wizard\'s Warp, a platformer that challenges those who are not afraid of hard challenges. Get to the top to save your favorite cat! But if you fall down, be ready for a rough landing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fg4.jpg'),(11278,'Mister Mandragora\'s Special Errands!','2019-08-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Short and sweet monster errand sim!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s23.jpg'),(11279,'Raguna and the Crystal of Miracles','2022-10-23','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Raguna and The Crystal of Miracles is a RPG Maker horror/comedy game featuring 2+ hours of content, several endings, and many ways to die.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s51.jpg'),(11280,'SerialWorld','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"SerialWorld\" is a comedic yet serious RPG. Whether you\'ve played deck-building games before or not, everyone can enjoy this adventurous tale. Embark on a journey into the mysterious world to solve the city\'s disturbances!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87mr.jpg'),(11281,'Drifting Bottle Cap','2024-03-29','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','One day, you returned home feeling exhausted. Everything that has happened during these days has put a lot of pressure on you. Suddenly, you see a few bottle caps in the water. You don\'t know if this hands-free drifting game can be enjoyed by yourself... even if it\'s just a short moment of time?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7w2g.jpg'),(11282,'Apathy: Midnight Collection - Vol. 1','2007-12-29','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Alternate retelling of the horror VN Gakkou de Atta Kowai Hanashi, comprised of three stories:\nEmi’s Murder Club Observation Diary, the main story, which chronicles the adventures of a psychopathic schoolgirl and her attempts not to be assassinated by the school’s Murder Club.\nThe Following Dog, which revolves around the legend of a dog who will eat you if you look back on your journey.\nScratches on the Pillars, a extremely short and completely linear story, yet very evocative and artistic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31ea.jpg'),(11283,'Soul Searching','2022-10-06','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this puzzle stealth game, your soul has been captured by an evil necromancer determined to take over the lands! Can you escape his perilous dungeon home to warn the kingdom before the undead rise and take over the throne?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k35.jpg'),(11284,'Globaglorp Simulator','2025-04-20','Point-and-click, Simulator, Strategy','Web browser','A game where you look after a jelly pet and try not let it die from starvation','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9phk.jpg'),(11285,'Chaos Legion','2003-11-14','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','The story of Chaos Legion is a gothic opera which begins November, 791 A.S. (Anno Satanis): The protagonist, Sieg Wahrheit, is a Knight of the Dark Glyphs who is on a quest under command of the Order of St. Overia to find his former friend, Victor Delacroix, who has stolen the forbidden book Apocrypha of Yzarc, and to stop him from releasing the evil spirit Azrail, who would destroy the three planes of existence: the Nether World, the Middle World, and the Celestial World.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4psj.jpg'),(11286,'Our After School Playzone','2020-10-29','Racing, Sport','Nintendo Switch','All kinds of excitement awaits you around the town!\nChoose 1 of the 8 unique characters and it\'s game on! Challenge your friends with games like Penalty Shootout, RC Racing, and Squirt Gun Battle! Even playing solo, you won\'t run out of things to do! Complete all sorts of missions to add to your Coin Collection! Try out a new strategy to get your highest score yet!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38zj.jpg'),(11287,'Spellcats: Auto Card Tactics','2024-05-17','Strategy, Adventure, Card & Board Game','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Summon elemental kitties in this roguelike card game! You are the only free feline in a world dominated by humans, navigate through mysterious dungeons, build card combos, and free your kind The future of your species rests in your paws!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83f6.jpg'),(11288,'Madden NFL 08','2007-08-14','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','Madden NFL 08, 2007\'s ode to NFL football on videogame consoles, fits like an old glove. Gamers will be familiar with how the game plays and feels. But as usual, updated team rosters (with their inherent strengths and weaknesses), enhanced graphics, and new in-game features will keep you, the gamer, plenty interested.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30ux.jpg'),(11289,'DropDisk',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11290,'Ookami Kakushi','2009-08-20','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Ookami Kakushi is a horror visual novel developed by guyzware, Konami and Ryukishi07.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4nv7.jpg'),(11291,'He Will Shoot','2021-12-18','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','He Will Shoot - is a simple zombie killer from the third person in a variety of scenery. Choose from four arenas: a Post-Apocalyptic City, a Slum, an Industrial Zone or the Northern Mountains. Use different types of weapons to clear this place from hordes of bloodthirsty zombies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e94.jpg'),(11292,'Armored Suit Solgante: Expansion DLC','2025-04-12','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The war may be won, but work continues for Solgante\'s pilot! Joint training exercises are being held with Tomzon Base, and only Captain Will can show them how it\'s done by demonstrating the techniques that brought Radulta victory. Through a sequence of training battles, help the other base\'s soldiers learn how to fight like champions! Alternatively, you can train using your neighbor Naji\'s home-built simulator, and prove yourself worthy of his admiration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nyn.jpg'),(11293,'What the Dub?!','2021-04-07','Quiz/Trivia, Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','What The Dub?! is a multiplayer party game where each player overdubs missing dialogue from hilariously awful B-movies, outdated PSAs, and bizarre industrial films, with their own witty (or just plain stupid) dubs!\n\nPlayers watch the dubs and vote on the best one. The player with the highest score at the end of the game wins! What The Dub takes \"bad movie night\" and expands it into an interactive, fast-paced, multiplayer game that friends and family, both local and afar, can enjoy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2y09.jpg'),(11294,'Grand Tactician: The Civil War - Whiskey & Lemons','2023-08-25','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Start your own Career in the American Civil War. Create your character and sign up to fight for the Union or the Confederacy. Write your story through the war, and become one of the legendary commanders of the American Civil War!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co702q.jpg'),(11295,'The Dawning',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','The Dawning is a first-person puzzle mystery game. Play as Detective Madison as he searches 7 beautifully crafted areas for clues to catch a killer. Use stealth to sneak past deadly enemies. Solve complex puzzles to access new areas, progress the rich storyline, and obtain key items.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5n0e.jpg'),(11296,'Orbi Universo II','2025-07-01','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Orbi Universo II is a strategy simulation game developed and published by Orbi Universo Team, slated for release in July 2025. In this abstract strategy management simulation, players guide their civilization from the Neolithic era to the Atomic Age through an innovative node-based system where decisions create cascading effects across society. The game features interconnected elements including agriculture, commerce, religion, and warfare that players must balance while adapting to local resources and regional characteristics. Players can shape unique cultural and religious traits, engage with rival civilizations through diplomacy or warfare, and pursue multiple victory conditions. Building upon its predecessor, Orbi Universo II offers enhanced visuals, rebuilt systems, and deeper gameplay mechanics while maintaining an abstract visual style focused on clarity and readability.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hqm.jpg'),(11297,'Alisia Dragoon','1992-03-01','Shooter, Platform, Arcade','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','The pace is intense. Enemies come at Alisia from everywhere. And nowhere. Battle hordes of crazed barbarians, mow down mobs of poisonous centipedes, and slay squadrons of winged gargoyels. Blast enemies in waves or one by one with multi-directional, auto-targeting laser fire.\n\nRecruit killer companions like the DragonFrye, Ball O\'Fire, Thunder Raven and Boomerang Lizard. Use them to hurl blistering boomerangs, fireballs, and electrical attacks. With Alisia\'s super-tough fighting skills, fry enemies to a crisp. And prove once and for all that you can go hand-to-hand with evil and come out the champion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97f5.jpg'),(11298,'Elevator Action: Old & New','2002-12-20','Arcade','Game Boy Advance','A Japanese exclusive update to Elevator Action.\n\nElevator Action Old & New is an action game developed by Taito and published by MediaKite for Game Boy Advance.\n\nElevator Action Old & New contains the original version of Elevator Action as well as a re-worked arranged version. The new version of the game features completely re-drawn graphics, multiple playable characters with unique abilities, new enemies, items, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6epv.jpg'),(11299,'Cricket Captain 2019','2019-06-07','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Cricket Captain 2019 is the perfect companion for a hugely anticipated cricket season. With the World Cup and Australia in England, and the inaugural test-match championship, old rivalries will be put to the test and new ones created.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hhz.jpg'),(11300,'War of the Twins',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ivz.jpg'),(11301,'Psychedelica of the Black Butterfly','2018-04-27','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','Awakening in a mysterious mansion, her first, frantic thoughts are: \"Where am I? And more importantly Who am I?\"\n\nShe encounters several young men in the same predicament trapped and missing their memories. To survive they must hunt black butterflies and claim kaleidoscope shards from the horrific monsters surrounding them.\n\nWill their path lead them to hope or despair?\n\nFollow the black butterflies as your choices unlock numerous story paths, a mansion full of fascinating characters, and a multitude of surprising endings. A mini game lets players unlock additional plot elements. Set in a highly unique, surreal atmosphere with contrasts of bright, psychedelic colors and dark, muted tones, Psychedelica of the Black Butterfly is an unforgettable adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6as6.jpg'),(11302,'River God: Enshrouded Current','2024-07-11','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a journey with \"River God: Enshrouded Current,\" where an ancient village battles a curse woven into its very fabric. Uncover the secrets of a malevolent priest whose dark rituals connect the village to a realm beyond life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8q1h.jpg'),(11303,'Station Platform 42','2025-03-13','Shooter, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Horror action ADV in which you fight evil spirits on a station platform!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kdo.jpg'),(11304,'Sharknado VR: Arcade Edition','2021-12-09','Simulator, Indie','SteamVR','Sharknado VR: Arcade Edition puts you in the middle of the action - use a variety of weapons to battle the terrifying Sharknado. Maim, shoot and explode your way through hordes of hungry flying sharks and other airborne sea creatures in Sharknado VR!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5l3d.jpg'),(11305,'Keep Out','2021-01-30','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Keep Out is a horror and mystery puzzle adventure Game.\nA whole story of Keep Out is from Devota Hill in 2044. You are \"Mr. M\", the toy of a wise and benevolent monarch. Explore and Find Secrets of Devota Hill and HumathScience.\n\nPlayers explore Devota Hill by manipulating Mr. M in 3D, Side-scrolling views.\nYou may have to fight, dodge, or sometimes get stuck against aggressive rats, human beings who kill animated toys, and other aggressive toys that don\'t serve the benevolent lord Mr. M. Sometimes you have to use parts of the toy that were killed to survive. Mr.M is threatened or helped in this environment. You are the lord of toys. With all your toys paying attention to you, think only about salvaging the world of threatened toys!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qd6.jpg'),(11306,'RollMe','2021-11-11','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RollMe is a physical-based platform puzzle game, where you can roll over 120 levels in 6 different places. Your ball can change the direction of gravity and you can use jumpers, teleporters to complete levels soon as you can. You can earn points when you collect consumables and finish the levels in a shorter time. Every act has new challenges and riddles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3tly.jpg'),(11307,'Orderly Havoc','2025-02-21','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Orderly Havoc is a time management game where you must do chores. Each chore has a unique minigame requiring timing or solving. Do this before you stress out or else you\'ll have a panic attack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pxq.jpg'),(11308,'Dying Light: Ox Warrior Bundle','2021-02-11','Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dress for the occasion and welcome in the Year of the Ox with this free Ox Warrior bundle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ucj.jpg'),(11309,'Super Dungeon Run','2015-07-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Super Dungeon Run is a fast paced, addictive action game in which you guide a party of hapless heroes on a quest for loot in the depths of a dark and dangerous dungeon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/b2vu821lqlsnzx9vrgas.jpg'),(11310,'Ruff Times','2021-01-10','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A cute idle clicker about dogs! What could possibly go wrong?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v6t.jpg'),(11311,'Big Adventure: Trip to Europe 2 - Collector\'s Edition','2022-10-05','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The Collector\'s Edition includes:\n8 extra locations with even more things to find!\n8 more mini-games to solve!\nDownloadable wallpapers and soundtrack to revisit Europe whenever!\nAdd exclusive postage stamps to your album!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gm8.jpg'),(11312,'Konung: Legend of the North','2000-01-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Konung is a good old days RPG with some RTS and Adventure elements.\nIn contradiction to Diablo-like games, Konung goes beyond action-style role-playing and offers adventure-style gameplay with dozens of non-linear quests and strong storyline set in the complex atmosphere of VII-century Scandinavia, the mystical “Land of the North”.\nKonung features the most attractive RTS elements, including settlement management. The player has the opportunity to seize settlements, manage their resources and build various constructions and installations, enjoying the best of RTS elements.\nThe world of Konung is a unique and spacious fantasy land that combines parts of known history with classical myths and the legends of the Chronicles, including immortal heroes, magical artefacts and ancient sorcery. The whole world is shaped by three cultures on the verge of the second millennium: tribes of wild Slavic hunters, noble traders of the still-powerful Byzantine Empire, and fearless Viking warriors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ayl.jpg'),(11313,'Idlers and Dungeons',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','In this Idle Adventure Game you can Level up your character while doing other things. This is a unique game system based on rpg old school game mixed with idling.Most actions are done from UI menus and enemies are not seen during the fight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hbwyrncukeacz4u4n4rd.jpg'),(11314,'Steam Bandits: Outpost','2014-01-14','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore the skies of a Steampunk world while discovering islands, taming beasts, and battling anything that stands in your way. Customize your own outpost as your base of operations for crafting and sending your followers out on missions while away. Over 40 hours of gameplay with a deep story!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jow.jpg'),(11315,'Heroes of Nature 4 in 1','2024-10-25','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ezy.jpg'),(11316,'Stuntman: Ignition','2007-09-17','Racing','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Stuntman: Ignition is the next installment in the Stuntman franchise. The game plunges gamers into the adrenaline-fueled role of a Hollywood stunt driver, challenging them to pull off the most breathtaking, death-defying stunts ever filmed. Players showcase their skills in a wide variety of big-budget action films, commercial shoots and tournaments while commanding more than 25 unique vehicles, including exotic sports cars, motorcycles and hovercraft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g6z.jpg'),(11317,'Yes, Your Grace: Snowfall',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In this new reality, where monsters seem closer, enemies stronger and your petitioners struggling more than ever, your duties as a King must continue. It will be your responsibility to rebuild the trust of your kingdom, protect your family and survive the upcoming winter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6llg.jpg'),(11318,'We Cheer','2008-09-30','Music, Sport','Wii','We Cheer brings the excitement and fun of cheerleading to the Wii Console. Use your Wii Remote(s) as pom-poms and get ready to show your team spirit while you kick, jump, flip, spin and dance to the rhythm of the hottest music from the past and present. Master your moves with precision and timing, and get ready to beat the other squads to claim the number 1 spot in the championship. Bring it on!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zqj.jpg'),(11319,'Ultimate Spider-Man in the Villain Round-Up','2012-12-31','Sin género','Plug & Play','Ultimate Spider-Man in the Villain Round-Up is a plug-and-play game based on Spider-Man.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5f93.jpg'),(11320,'Basketball Hall-of-Fame: Ultimate Hoops Challenge','2010-04-17','Sport','Wii','In honor of the 50th anniversary of the Naismith Memorial Basketball Hall of Fame, this unique basketball video game stars some of the greatest players of all time. Basketball fans can join 16 of the greatest players to ever lace \'em up in this collection of roundball mini-games. Basketball Hall-of-Fame: Ultimate Hoops Challenge lets players join hardwood luminaries Larry Bird, Oscar Robertson, Elgin Baylor, and Clyde Drexler, among many others, as they go head-to-head in \"H.O.R.S.E.,\" \"Around the World,\" and \"Slam Dunk Contest\" modes. The \"Campaign\" mode finds gamers competing in all events to unlock new legends and arenas, while the \"Multiplayer\" mode lets up to four players compete for hoops supremacy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pqn.jpg'),(11321,'Transformers: Earthspark - Expedition','2023-10-13','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Battle and explore as courageous Autobot, Bumblebee, in an exciting action adventure to stop his nemesis, Mandroid, from becoming the ultimate evil cyborg.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co786b.jpg'),(11322,'Bugz!','2020-06-23','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Venture into the world Bugz to capture, research and compete with your team of Bugz!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45yd.jpg'),(11323,'Keep in Mind: Remastered','2018-03-08','Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Keep in Mind follows Jonas, a tormented alcoholic whose life is falling apart. One night, he awakens to a shadowy mirror world where beasts lurk and the stars don\'t shine. Lost and scared, Jonas must face all those twisted beasts if he ever wishes to return home and learn the truth about his darkness.\n\nKeep in Mind: Remastered takes the Game Jolt version of the game and revamps it with a new engine, bug fixes, and brand new professionally composed soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1o38.jpg'),(11324,'Toy Story 2','1999-12-31','Platform','Game Boy Color','The Game Boy Color version is a side-scrolling platform game unrelated to the other versions. The player controls Buzz, who can jump, run, and shoot his laser at enemies. It features 11 levels, including two bonus levels that can be accessed if the player collects all the coins located in certain levels. Because the Game Boy Color has only two action buttons, Buzz\'s running and jumping are both done through the B button. While standing motionless, the player can jump and move across gaps, whereas running is initiated by pressing the B button while moving. Gameplay is saved through a password feature','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5srx.jpg'),(11325,'My IShowSpeed','2024-01-22','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Here you can go all the way from scratch, pump your muscles, become a professional soccer player, earn a fortune, and much more! You and your Speedy will never get bored, because there are tons of mini-games and fun activities in the game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qxq.jpg'),(11326,'Surviving Mars: All New In Bundle',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tbz.jpg'),(11327,'Fantastic Four','1997-08-01','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Sega Saturn, PlayStation','The Fantastic Four video game, released in 1997 for the PlayStation, is a beat \'em-up action game based on the Marvel Comics superhero team. Developed by Probe Entertainment and published by Acclaim Entertainment, the game features playable characters Mr. Fantastic, The Invisible Woman, The Human Torch, The Thing, and She-Hulk, each with unique abilities. A version for the Sega Saturn was planned but ultimately cancelled. Players engage in combat, solve puzzles, and navigate obstacles across various levels, drawing from the rich lore of the Fantastic Four comics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nah.jpg'),(11328,'Takorita Meets Fries','2021-10-01','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Deep under the sea, there is a princess who didn\'t know anything about french fries. This is her story, Princess Takorita\'s fated encounter with the french fries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42vv.jpg'),(11329,'Case Closed: The Mirapolis Investigation','2009-05-01','Puzzle, Adventure','Wii','\"Case Closed: The Mirapolis Investigation\" (also known as Case Closed: One Truth Prevails) is based on the ongoing manga and anime Detective Conan, released internationally as Case Closed. Players use the Wii Remote to find clues and solve the cases.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pvy.jpg'),(11330,'In the House of Silence','2020-10-15','Strategy, Tactical, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In the House of Silence is a traditional roguelike of eldritch horror. Fight otherworldly abominations, mutate to enhance your power, and stave off insanity as you delve deeper in the House of Silence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2spa.jpg'),(11331,'Kart Stars','2014-12-11','Racing','Android, iOS','Welcome to the World Karting Championships! Race through a single player campaign or go head to head with players from around the world. Feel the rush as you play through vintage, sprint and super karts in a massive 300 round world championship season. Outrun the competition and finish on the podium to earn coins, upgrade your kart, and become the World Karting Champion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ifs.jpg'),(11332,'The Sims 4: Starter Bundle',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11333,'Breath of Fire: Dragon Quarter','2002-11-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PlayStation 2','Breath of Fire: Dragon Quarter is a radical departure from the previous titles of the Breath of Fire series, and in some ways from standard Japanese-style role-playing games in general. The game is built like a huge dungeon crawler, with no overworld map. The combat is tactical: each character has action points (AP), which can be used to move around the screen during an enemy encounter, and perform a variety of combo attacks. There is no magic in the game, and many of the items found in dungeons are random. All the enemies are visible on screen. Depending on who first initiated a physical contact, the party or the enemies get an extra turn in battles.\n\nThe game allows (and even encourages) the player to restart it from the beginning, keeping the items and the party experience. The game also features a special counter - Ryu can use his traditional dragon transformation abilities, but the counter raises with each such transformation, and when the counter reaches 100, the game is over. Raising the D-ratio allows characters to access new areas every time the game is replayed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k1t.jpg'),(11334,'Charm Girls Club Pajama Party','2009-11-20','Sin género','Wii','Charm Girls Club Pajama Party is packed with over 30 mini-games that will get girls up dancing, pillow fighting, cooking, racing, spinning, moving, and playing together in ways that will keep them laughing all night! Create your Charm Girls and team up with up to 7 girl friends! Pajama Party has awesome mini-games including Bed Bounce, Speed Hair Teasing, Balloon Bop, Dance Off, Pose Off, Pillow Fight, and more! Earn over 40 virtual charms!\n\nCreate endless trendy and stylish looks and customize a Charm Girl to reflect your unique style. Choose everything from hair, make-up, wardrobe, shoes and accessories! Completing challenges can earn you sparkly new virtual charms for your jewelry box. Show off your charms to your friends and see who can collect the most!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pw6.jpg'),(11335,'Land of the Vikings','2022-11-08','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','From victuals to Vikings, lead your village and expand it into a thriving city. A wise Jarl must manage resources, survive harsh conditions and enemy raids, and guide their fellow Vikings to work together through social conflict. Skál!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co516j.jpg'),(11336,'Odessa','2025-05-15','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A retired bodyguard has to team up with an astute bunny-girl to keep the hope of rescuing his soon-to-be wife, abducted by mysterious individuals. At the same time, a cult around a strange goddess is developing. How could the two things be related? And will he be able to see his beloved one again?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gr0.jpg'),(11337,'Legend of Krilona','2021-11-09','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Legend of Krilona ist ein RPG Abenteuer bei dem vier Helden durch eine Welt geführt werden, welche noch erkundet werden muss.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47tt.jpg'),(11338,'Batman: Return of the Joker','1992-03-28','Platform','Game Boy','Batman: Return of the Joker for the Game Boy is a platformer in which the Dark Knight must cross four levels to confront his arch-enemy, the Joker.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gyq.jpg'),(11339,'Air Combat Arena','2017-11-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Air Combat Arena is an arcade-style flight combat game. In the game you can pilot various planes play against other players on various maps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pr2.jpg'),(11340,'Neurocracy','2021-07-14','Puzzle, Indie','Web browser','Solve a murder in a near future world by diving into the Wikipedia of that world.\n\nHave you ever lost yourself in a Wikipedia rabbit hole? Imagine doing that for the Wikipedia of the year 2049. This is Neurocracy, an interactive narrative experience that offers an anthology of compelling sci-fi stories inside and between the hyperlinked articles of an online encyclopedia. It is both a single-player alternate reality game and an epistolary hypertext novel, opening with a high-profile assassination that you must investigate and solve.\n\nPlaying out entirely on a website with no download required, Neurocracy invites you to go it alone or join forces with others to piece together what has happened, and what is happening, in the world of 2049. Using the narrative power of your imagination, chase implications and interpretations by reading between the lines and arranging a story from a deeper pool of potential stories. Find clues, draw connections, compare notes, and ultimately solve a murder.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3waf.jpg'),(11341,'Uuultra C','2020-09-18','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Taking place in the city of Soshigaya in the 1970s, 13 kaiju monsters suddenly emerge from a tv as Japan is preparing for the next World Expo! Taiyo Kamen Icarus is entrusted to bring down the monsters and restore peace to Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tg9.jpg'),(11342,'Tiger Fighter 1931: Tora!Tora!Tora! MP095','2021-09-12','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a shoot em up game. In this game the player combats a large number of enemies by shooting at them. The player control a fighter to shoot down all the enemies fighter and all the enemies to win the game. The DLC include mission pack 095.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h8s.jpg'),(11343,'Dragon\'s Dog Mother',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11344,'FIFA 21: Ultimate Edition','2020-10-06','Sport','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Win as One in EA SPORTSFIFA 21, powered by Frostbite. Whether it\'s on the streets or in the stadium, FIFA 21 has more ways to play than ever before - including the UEFA Champions League and CONMEBOL Libertadores.\n\nFIFA 21 - Ultimate Edition includes:\n- Limited-Time Bonus: An Untradeable FUT 21 Ones to Watch Item\n- 3 Days Early Access\n- Up to 24 Rare Gold Packs, 2 per week for 12 weeks\n- Cover Star Loan Item, for 5 FUT matches\n- Career Mode Homegrown Talent, local youth prospect with world-class potential\n- FUT Ambassador Player Pick, choose 1 of 3 player items for 3 FUT matches\n- Special Edition FUT Kits and Stadium Items','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e0p.jpg'),(11345,'100 Egypt Cats','2025-04-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join the cutest adventure in Egypt, full of cats! Explore the charming hand-drawn artwork of Egypt locations as you embark on a quest to find 100 adorable cats hidden throughout the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8b50.jpg'),(11346,'Beatrix vs. Beatrix vs. Beatrix','2015-02-21','Role-playing (RPG)','Super NES CD-ROM System, PlayStation','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11347,'Zoo Keeper','1983-12-31','Arcade','Arcade','You control Zeke the zookeeper who must rescue his girlfriend Zelda from the Zoo. There are four levels or \"adventures\". Each level has its own task such as trapping the animals in the zoo, jumping ledges up the screen and jumping animals to earn a bonus keeper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u1o.jpg'),(11348,'Pets and Friends','2025-04-11','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Create your cozy unique animal album with your creations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1f.jpg'),(11349,'The Sims 4: Bundle Pack 5',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11350,'A Tithe in Blood','2025-12-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A dark yuri visual novel, about a quiet university student who discovers blood magic in the depths of her grief. Stepping into a world she little understands, Honoka finds unexpected love, and inadvertantly sets in motion a deadly series of events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8b5h.jpg'),(11351,'Heart of the Woods','2019-02-15','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A fantasy yuri visual novel filled with magic, fairies, and a ghost girl. When Maddie and her best friend, Tara, journey to a remote forest village to investigate rumors of the supernatural, they find a whole lot more than they bargained for.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ujc.jpg'),(11352,'Catboy Aim Trainer','2024-09-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Train your aim with a beautiful selection of Catboys! Shoot the Catboys with various weapons, and have a fun time while practicing!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mhh.jpg'),(11353,'Ruslicstan Invades','2023-03-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Save Europe from shortage of crappers! The swamp horde of ruslic savages is gushing out, again! Stop the \"russian world\" leakage from the crapper-state, in the meaty first-person shooter game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b3v.jpg'),(11354,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Rooftop Run','2013-04-18','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Android, iOS','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Rooftop Run is the first official iOS game in the TMNT franchise. Released in 2013, it was developed by Nickelodeon Interactive. It is an \"endless runner\" game where the Turtles hop across rooftops and fight the Foot and Kraang.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yiu.jpg'),(11355,'Aspen: Uncanny Home',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Aspen: Uncanny Home puts the player in a state of psychological terror. Players will find themselves in puzzling situations and search to find the hidden story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gme.jpg'),(11356,'Convrgence','2024-04-23','Shooter, Adventure','SteamVR','Convrgence is an immersive single-player VR shooter with survival and horror elements. Explore the Chernokamensk exclusion zone: scavenge for loot, fight bandits and hunt for mystical artifacts. However be sure to return to base before duskfall, for when night arrives the hunter becomes the hunted.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h02.jpg'),(11357,'Captain America: Shield of Justice','2012-05-08','Platform','Web browser','16-bit platformer featuring Captain America.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yl1.jpg'),(11358,'3D Gravity Rocket','2018-06-12','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Is a game about a mechanical robot that could fly thanks to having a propeller on its head. In the game you need to collect a certain number of nuts to win the level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o7h.jpg'),(11359,'Rogue Shift','2021-09-07','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rogue Shift is a high-intensity rogue-lite experience with RPG elements, set on a harsh planet that will test your will to survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j16.jpg'),(11360,'Cozy Meadow','2025-03-22','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','A Relaxing Adventure','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1c.jpg'),(11361,'The Adventures of Tintin: The Game','2011-10-21','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox 360','While the movie taps into the nostalgia vein of Hergé\'s original comic strip, the game feeds from the memory of traditional platformers.\nPlatforming is the beating heart of Ubisoft\'s crisp, charming riff on Spielberg\'s recent film. The subtlety and nuance of the cast\'s movements, from daring leaps to nose-smashing right-hooks, is an artistic delight that keeps the sidescrolling action consistently engaging, even if it does turn out to have more ideas than its slender runtime can cope with.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c47.jpg'),(11362,'Wild Wolf Simulator 3D',NULL,'Simulator','Android','Have you ever imagined being wild Wolf? Now you can play as real wild Wolf and become the most powerful animal in the wilderness.\nBe a wild Wolf and survive in the wildness as long as you can. Start your own pride of wolves, fight for your life against fierce animals like moose, bear and fox. Evolve your Wolf to become the strongest Wolf ever.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qlg.jpg'),(11363,'Colorgrid','2020-03-24','Puzzle, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Colorgrid is a puzzle game about mixing colors in a Lab. Find the correct positions for your lasers and mirrors to get the right mix of colors in each material.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ngj.jpg'),(11364,'Marvel: Ultimate Alliance Bundle','2016-07-26','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This Ultimate Alliance Bundle contains both games from the historic franchise! Marvel: Ultimate AllianceCreate an ultimate team from the largest Super Hero alliance ever as you engage in an epic quest to determine the fate of the Marvel Universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co485n.jpg'),(11365,'Ether One Redux','2015-10-28','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A version of Ether One remade in Unreal Engine 4, featuring graphical improvements. Created in order to port the game to PS4.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21zy.jpg'),(11366,'Cat\'s Cosmic Atlas','2023-08-18','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Gaze upon the stars and other celestial bodies. Cat’s Cosmic Atlas takes you through the Southern and Northern skies. Experience the most beautiful sights and learn a thing or two about the vast Universe that surrounds us.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6y1s.jpg'),(11367,'Atari Recharged Bundle: Berzerk + Quantum','2024-11-20','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Atari\'s Recharged series modernizes classic titles with power-ups, challenges, local multiplayer, and all new soundtracks by Megan McDuffee.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eg1.jpg'),(11368,'Eye of the Temple','2021-10-14','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Oculus VR, Meta Quest 2, Windows Mixed Reality, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Embark on a VR adventure to explore a vast and treacherous temple and uncover the ancient legend of the Eye. Keep your balance as you step between moving blocks, dodging hazardous traps and solving environmental puzzles with just your torch and whip in hand.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8o3e.jpg'),(11369,'Pango Blocks','2015-11-04','Puzzle','iOS','LOGIC and cheerfulness!\n\nGet ready for a challenge! CHOOSE logic blocks and BUILD a path for Pango. \nIf Pango crosses the screen without falling, he will catch an item and give it to a friend.\n\nPango will have to bring back 8 ingredients to Pig\'s kitchen, 8 tools for Fox\'s rocket, sports equipment for Squirrel, and crayons for Rabbit\'s drawing…\n\nMore than 40 challenges through 5 funny adventures.\n\nEducational game suitable for children 3 or older with 2 difficulty levels.\n\nPango Blocks - a cute way to learn about judging distances when you\'re little!\n\nFEATURES:\n\n- Logic game\n- 5 adventures to discover for your enjoyment\n- 40 challenges through 5 universes\n- 2 difficulty levels\n- Perfect for children 3 or older\n- No stress and no timer\n- A simple, functional application\n- Colorful and fully interactive game\n- Fully animated with sound and pictures\n- Internal parental control\n- No in-game purchases and no invasive advertising','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/a62lh3qwifhjil70jcpe.jpg'),(11370,'Danganronpa Trilogy','2019-03-26','Point-and-click, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4','Experience the full hope and deep despair of three murder mysteries in Danganronpa Trilogy! Uncover the plots of sinister masterminds in this three-game saga spanning two discs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2puk.jpg'),(11371,'Snolf 3 & Knolf','2020-10-28','Platform, Puzzle, Sport','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Did you enjoy SNOLF: The Sonic Golf Experience? Did you wish you could experience the magic and the mystery of an entirely golf-controlled hedgehog all over again, but this time in Sonic 3 & Knuckles, and perhaps enjoy more characters? Well, feast your eyes on SNOLF 3 & KNOLF: The Sonic Golf Experience, Part II!\n\nThis romhack, like its predecessor \"SNOLF: The Sonic Golf Experience\", replaces Sonic\'s ability to move with a golf-game mechanic, similar to the kind of thing found in games like Kirby\'s Dream Course. Sonic remains rolled up into a ball under most conditions, and can only be launched when he has come to a stop. The Rings counter instead counts how many shots you have taken, allowing players to compete to get the lowest score!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qj4.jpg'),(11372,'Taxi City','2018-11-30','Racing, Simulator, Indie','Web browser','Taxi City is a simulator game of a modern driver transporting his customers in a rural big city full of hotels, skyscrapers and missing people walking in the streets. It\'s not a problem, after all, because like a modern driver our game hero uses a mobile Taxi app for getting customers.\nWhen the game hero must earn enough to pay installments for his car, the operating costs of the car and the other cost of living. However, mainly for tuning of current car and buying new more luxury and faster cars which are more funny to drive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vsz.jpg'),(11373,'Out of Moves','2025-04-23','Puzzle, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Every step matters... Are you ready for the challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nh8.jpg'),(11374,'Dusty\'s Sweeping Cleanup',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11375,'Echoes of Madness: The Hawthorne Case',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11376,'Toy Story Mania!',NULL,'Sin género','Plug & Play','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nhz.jpg'),(11377,'Funko Fusion: Mega Man Pack Bundle','2024-12-30','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','You won\'t feel the blues when the heroes and villains of Mega Man rock into Funko Fusion! Fight for everlasting peace as the aloof and mysterious Proto Man, or vie for world domination with the undeniable genius of Dr Wily.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9efl.jpg'),(11378,'Crashday: Redline Edition','2017-08-10','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crashday: Redline Edition is the multiplayer arcade racer with near limitless possibilities! Race. Wreck. Shoot. Smash. Seven game modes. Battle online and offline. On roads and in arenas. Design and share your own tracks. Play the game the way you like. Today there are no rules. Today is Crashday!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1unp.jpg'),(11379,'Ninja Gaiden Sigma 2','2009-10-01','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ninja Gaiden Sigma 2 is the “ultimate” Ninja Gaiden, featuring characters from the previous installments that have defined the franchise. It radiates a striking visual appeal in high resolution display, featuring character and environmental graphics whose quality exceeds the original Ninja Gaiden Sigma. Combining both melee and long-range battles against enemies, the game requires skillful and strategic playing to successfully journey through the missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ymx.jpg'),(11380,'Papa\'s Freezeria','2011-07-12','Simulator, Strategy','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game where you play as a worker for Papa Louie serving sundaes to customers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4iec.jpg'),(11381,'Starbound','2016-07-22','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','You’ve fled your home, only to find yourself lost in space with a damaged ship. Your only option is to beam down to the planet below and gather the resources you need to repair your ship and set off to explore the vast, infinite universe…\n\nIn Starbound, you create your own story - there’s no wrong way to play! You may choose to save the universe from the forces that destroyed your home, uncovering greater galactic mysteries in the process, or you may wish to forego a heroic journey entirely in favor of colonizing uncharted planets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b19.jpg'),(11382,'Konami Classics Series Arcade Hits','2007-04-30','Racing, Sport','Nintendo DS','Konami Classics Series Arcade Hits is a compilation of 15 games from the early days of Konami:\n\n- Scramble\n- Horror Maze (Tutankham)\n- Pooyan\n- Time Pilot\n- Track and Field\n- Roc \'N Rope\n- Basketball (Super Basketball)\n- Circus Charlie\n- Road Fighter\n- RainbowBell (TwinBee)\n- Yie Ar Kung-Fu\n- Shao-Lin\'s Road\n- Gradius\n- Rush\'n Attack\n- Contra\n\nWhen Tutankham and Super Basketball were released in the U.S. they kept their original names however in this collection they are named as Horror Maze and Basketball. It is unknown why the games\' names were changed. This compilation also marks the first North American appearance of the original TwinBee arcade game in any form.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5twl.jpg'),(11383,'Ski-World Simulator','2014-11-18','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Ski-World Simulator you are managing your own skiing area. Work with the snow cat and prepare the slopes to become a skier’s paradise! Make sure that your patrons have everything they want in order to earn money and increase the size of your skiing operation. The keys to ski-world success are in your hands!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a8j.jpg'),(11384,'Atari Recharged Bundle: Yars + Caverns of Mars','2024-11-20','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Atari\'s Recharged series modernizes classic titles with power-ups, challenges, local multiplayer, and all new soundtracks by Megan McDuffee.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eg4.jpg'),(11385,'The Butterfly Sign: Human Error','2017-03-16','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Butterfly Sign: Human Error is the second chapter of the first person detective video game in which we are playing as a sole survivor of a serious terrorist attack. The protagonist is the only witness of the incident and his fate depends on his memories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co979x.jpg'),(11386,'Nickelodeon All-Star Brawl 2: Deluxe Edition','2023-11-07','Fighting, Platform','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Nickelodeon All-Star Brawl 2 lets you duke it out with the biggest and best fighting character roster yet! This Deluxe edition contains the following content:\n• Full Base Game\n• Season Pass Content\n- 4 additional brawlers\n- Bonus SpongeBob Squarepants \"The Quickster\" Costume','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sus.jpg'),(11387,'Toy Story 3',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Andy is all grown up and he\'s leaving for college soon. What will happen to all of his toys? Join Buzz, Woody, and the gang as they end up at Sunnyside Daycare. They\'re excited to play with kids again, but all is not as it seems. Help the toys by building core reading skills with letter identification, beginning sounds and so much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z7s.jpg'),(11388,'Sly 3: Honor Among Thieves','2024-12-10','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','A port of Sly 3: Honor Among Thieves, enhanced with up-rendering, rewind, quick save, and custom video filters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95x2.jpg'),(11389,'Pocket Clothier','2019-09-05','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ever wanted to run your own clothing store? Now you can!\nLet your inner fashionista flower as you cultivate a quaint corner shop into a world-class super brand!\n\nPosition mannequins, run promotions, even set up an in-store crepe stand. Dream up other ways to stand out so that shoppers can\'t stay away!\n\nPatrons will also rely on your fashion sense to coordinate ensembles for big occasions. Elevating their style level will unlock new career paths for them--meaning more revenue for you!\n\nAre you ready to try your hand at the trade of trend?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i3d.jpg'),(11390,'Where the Goats Are','2017-09-01','Point-and-click, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play as Tikvah as she tries to maintain her way of life, looking after goats and making cheese, while the world around her falls apart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2udp.jpg'),(11391,'Earth-Quack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11392,'Eat That Ice Cream',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11393,'Unsolved Case: Fatal Clue',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Use your logic and intuition to uncover chilling secrets in the additional locations! Find helpful clues and solve complicated puzzles in a series of interactive crime stories!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11394,'Wanderness','2024-12-10','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A tranquil cozy game made from beautiful panoramic photographs with a soothing nature soundscape. Relax and calm your mind with a slow walk in the realistic world of Wanderness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mew.jpg'),(11395,'Sprint Vector','2018-02-08','Platform, Racing, Sport, Indie','PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Oculus Rift','Welcome to Sprint Vector championship intergalactica, where the physical thrill of extreme sports meets the unhinged energy of a crazy game show! Run, jump, climb, fling, and fly at extreme velocity as you race up to eight players and battle obstacles in this frenetic VR adrenaline platformer that puts your speed and finesse to the test!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hyf.jpg'),(11396,'We Are One',NULL,'Shooter, Puzzle','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR, SteamVR','Work together with yourself in VR! We Are One is a puzzle shooter where you solve mind-bending puzzles by cloning yourself and playing with time loops. Cleverly plan ahead and cooperate with your own clones - the only help you really need (and get) is yourself!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qss.jpg'),(11397,'Drakengard 2','2006-03-09','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','Drakengard 2 is a direct sequel to the original Drakengard: the story revolves around Nowe, a boy raised by the dragon Legna, fighting against a tyrannical faction of Knights, encountering characters from the previous game and becoming entangled in the fate of the world.\n\nLike the original, Drakengard 2 combines on-foot hack and slash with aerial combat stages and RPG game mechanics. The previous game\'s producer, writer and character designer returned to their respective roles. The game was designed as a more mainstream game in light of the previous game\'s dark aesthetic and story. The game sold 206,000 copies by the end of 2005. Western reviews praised the story, but gave mixed opinions about the graphics and widely criticized the gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25ox.jpg'),(11398,'Indiana Jones and the Great Circle: Digital Premium Upgrade','2024-12-06','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Live the adventure with the Premium Upgrade to receive Indiana Jones and the Great Circle: The Order of Giants Story DLC, a digital art book, and the Temple of Doom Outfit, Indy\'s iconic look as seen in Temple of Doom. Base Game not included.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f01.jpg'),(11399,'Ori and the Will of the Wisps','2020-09-17','Platform, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The little spirit Ori is no stranger to peril, but when a fateful flight puts the owlet Ku in harm’s way, it will take more than bravery to bring a family back together, heal a broken land, and discover Ori’s true destiny. From the creators of the acclaimed action-platformer Ori and the Blind Forest comes the highly anticipated sequel. Embark on an all-new adventure in a vast world filled with new friends and foes that come to life in stunning, hand-painted artwork. Set to a fully orchestrated original score, Ori and the Will of the Wisps continues the Moon Studios tradition of tightly crafted platforming action and deeply emotional storytelling.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e1l.jpg'),(11400,'Cursed Colors','2022-09-18','Point-and-click, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The book is cursed and you should stop the darkness within this arcade pixelated game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55ay.jpg'),(11401,'Portrait of a Torn','2024-10-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As a young soldier returning to an eerily deserted home, you\'ll explore enigmatic rooms, solve intricate puzzles, and uncover a haunting, tragic story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vo4.jpg'),(11402,'Bunny Black','2010-07-30','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bunny Black is a classic dungeon-crawl game that is composed by party management, dungeon exploration, grinding, and fulfilling missions with scaling difficulties throughout the game. Just like a lot of role-playing games that adopt the same genre, grinding is heavily emphasized in order to finish the game. In battles, players may only control the protagonist and develop him with whatever build, from both skills and equipments standpoint, possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jit.jpg'),(11403,'Vox Populi: Europa 2024','2024-05-30','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as an existing or fully customizable political figure, and campaign for many alternative European elections! In \"Vox Populi: Europa 2024\", you and the characters around you must promote your ideas and your popularity throughout the continent to claim victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f8b.jpg'),(11404,'Mario Artist: Talent Studio','2000-03-23','Arcade','64DD','In Mario Artist: Talent Studio, the player can create their own characters in 3D, customizing features such as hair, skin, and eye color, voice, clothes, facial features, and body size and type. The process is similar to Nintendo\'s later Miis, but much more detailed. The characters can then be inserted into movies and animations. Events during these movies can be controlled by pressing the Z-trigger. Images from external video can be imported using the Capture Cartridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21qs.jpg'),(11405,'Arcade Archives: vs. Mystery Tower','2025-03-06','Puzzle, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','\"VS. MYSTERY TOWER\" is an action puzzle game released by NAMCO (Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.) in 1986.\nThe Mystery Tower is an ancient structure full of secrets that stretches up to the heavens. You play as an archaeologist, seeking its peak on an adventure.\nStack blocks to stand on as you make your way to the goal. Can you solve all the puzzles along your way to the top?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mno.jpg'),(11406,'Saban\'s Mighty Morphin Power Rangers: Mega Battle','2017-01-17','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Power Rangers: Mega Battle is a 2D sidescrolling beat \'em up arcade game. The game was announced at the 2016 New York Comic Con with the teaser trailer for the game later uploaded to the Internet after the Power Rangers panel ended.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24rn.jpg'),(11407,'Mamegoma 3: Kawaii ga Ippai!','2010-08-05','Simulator','Nintendo DS','This time, a total of 50 types of Mamegoma, including 10 new ones, will appear, and you can raise up to 8 Mamegoma at the same time in the spacious \"Clover Square\". When the player gives a signal, the Mamegoma will gather and show cute reactions such as eating, singing, and playing. In addition, Ojamamedori & Funchama, original game characters drawn by the original author, Mayumi Yonemura, will appear for the first time. If Mamegoma accidentally touches it, it will either laugh or cry and stop growing. There are 18 types of crops that can be grown, including green soybeans, sweet potatoes, strawberries, and bananas. If you take good care of it and harvest it every day, Mamegoma will happily eat it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68qx.jpg'),(11408,'Itadaki Street Special','2004-12-22','Sin género','PlayStation 2','The game is similar to Monopoly in that players roll one die to advance around a board, purchase an unowned property they land on and earn money when opponents land on the player\'s property. The game differs from Monopoly in that players can buy and sell stocks of a block, affecting the value of block\'s stock up by buying or down by selling that block\'s stock or by developing a player-owned property of that block which increases the value per share for that block\'s stock. Also unlike Monopoly, it is not necessary to own the entire block to develop a property, though controlling more than one property of a block allows the player to develop their properties into larger buildings to collect more from opponents when they land on them. Players must collect a set of four suits, heart, diamond, clover and spade, to level up and collect additional gold when the pass the starting position/bank. To win a player must make it back to the bank with the board\'s required amount, which includes the total value of the player\'s stocks, property value, and gold on hand.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4omq.jpg'),(11409,'Battle Lode Runner','2017-11-30','Puzzle','Wii, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, Wii U','Once an ancient arcade game, and with a previous version on the PC Engine by Pack In Video, Hudson Soft have taken the addictive gameplay of Lode Runner and given the graphics a complete face lift. The puzzle-based action in Lode Runner is simple: You are presented with a side-view platforms-and-ladders based level and you have to collect all the gold and escape without getting caught by the baddies. To defend yourself, you can dig holes in the ground, either to the left or to the right, and enemies stumbling upon them will fall down and be trapped. If you time it right, the hole will re-fill before the enemy can climb out, forcing them to respawn elsewhere in the level. If you prefer evasive action, make sure the coast is clear so you can escape up a ladder or across a well-placed rope, but be warned - they will follow! Once you have collected all the gold, hotfoot it to the nearest long ladder and escape out the top of the screen. In magazine previews, this was originally titled Lode Runner II.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ugd.jpg'),(11410,'Rayman 3','2003-12-31','Platform','N-Gage','The Nokia N-Gage port of Rayman 3 is based on the Game Boy Advance version, but has some unique new levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63h9.jpg'),(11411,'Squid Ink',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11412,'The Tenth Line','2017-10-18','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Guide the princess of the tiny nation of Easania, along with her unusual but reliable companions, and explore a vibrant world of humans, beasts, and dragons, while escaping the clutches of a mysterious cult in hot pursuit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23fi.jpg'),(11413,'The Fisherman and the Sea','2021-03-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Take control of the Fisherman as they set out to explore this dreary drowned world and restore the joy of adventure across the seas...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ijg.jpg'),(11414,'Trailmakers','2020-05-21','Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','In the toughest motoring expedition in the universe, you and your friends will build your own vehicles to cross a dangerous wasteland. Explore, crash horribly, use your wits to build a better rig, and get as far as you can with whatever spare parts you find on your way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u8s.jpg'),(11415,'Genome Guardian','2024-05-07','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Genome Guardian is a top-down roguelite turret shooter where you must defend yourself from hostile aliens at the microscopic level. Combine & discover 70 weapons across 4 modes using a vast array of turrets, perks, modifiers and power-ups on this vibrant journey to the depths of the abyss.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8m0k.jpg'),(11416,'Master Detective Archives: Rain Code - Mysteriful Limited Edition','2023-06-30','Adventure','Nintendo Switch','A brand new dark fantasy detective action game from the minds behind the Danganronpa series! Yuma, an amnesiac detective-in-training, and Shinigami, the spirit haunting him, tackle unsolved mysteries in a strange city caged by unending rain.\n\nThe Mysteriful Limited Edition contains:\n\nThe Book of Death: Art Book featuring commentary from Kazutaka Kodaka, Rui Komatsuzaki and Shimadoriru\nLimited Edition exclusive Spirited 6.5″ Shinigami plush\nOuterbox with exclusive art from Rui Komatsuzaki\nNoise of Neon: Official Soundtrack composed by Masafumi Takada\nNintendo Switch SteelBook\nMaster Detective Archives: RAIN CODE physical game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pxd.jpg'),(11417,'The Amazing Spider-Man in the Villain Round-Up','2006-12-31','Platform','Plug & Play','Spider-Man & The Villain Round-Up is a Plug It in & Play TV Game based on Spider-Man.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5f92.jpg'),(11418,'Cactus Simulator 2','2023-10-06','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cactus Simulator 2 is a game in which you can become a cactus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73cm.jpg'),(11419,'JM Neto Game Dev 06 Games','2024-10-16','Sin género','Xbox One','In this Super JM Neto Game Dev Bundle contains 03 Platform Games (06 Games / Xbox and Windows Versions).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f03.jpg'),(11420,'Fluxteria','2020-05-21','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Fluxteria, non-stop arcade-space-shooting action in full 3D. \nFour modes of play: Story Mode, Survival Mode, Timed-Attack Mode and Obstacle Race Mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2c7e.jpg'),(11421,'Infleuence',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11422,'Guardian War','1993-04-04','Role-playing (RPG)','3DO Interactive Multiplayer','Welcome to GUARDIAN WAR.\n\nThis is a story about another world, another time. This was a beautiful world guarded by Goddess Erald. Darkness feared the Goddess Erald, and there was no way that Darkness could enter this beautiful world, until.....\nGUARDIAN WAR’\n\n-All combats take place with 3D animations.\n-Gain experience and new powers.\n-32,000 color 3D graphics.\n-Fully animated 3D magic effects.\n-55 3D computer graphic characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h44.jpg'),(11423,'Street Dreams','2021-09-17','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Street Dreams is a fast-paced VR action FPS set in a psychedelic dream world. Evade opponents in a high-speed car chase using a variety of weapons at your disposal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rld.jpg'),(11424,'We Are Not Alone','2022-06-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"We are Not Alone\" is an alien-themed game inspired by the trashy horror movies of the 80s, with retro graphics and scary and even comical moments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xqv.jpg'),(11425,'Iku Iku Succubus','2022-07-19','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Succubi have arrived on Earth, and it\'s your job to teach them humanity\'s ways! Your job will be anything but easy as you unravel hidden ambitions, explore human culture, and serve as tour guide for Earth\'s tasty delicacies. Class is starting in the magical visual novel world of Iku Iku Succubus!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hep.jpg'),(11426,'Doodle Drive',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','DoodleDrive is a 2d creative driving / puzzle / physics game. Doodle roads and shapes and unleash your driving skills on the path you have crafted to reach the Finish line.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gze.jpg'),(11427,'Hellhole','2021-03-31','Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hellhole is an isometric physics puzzle game for Windows. Consume everything. Defy Gaia. We will be our own undoing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bge.jpg'),(11428,'Tom Cruise\'s Kissing History','2009-06-07','Arcade','Web browser','Play as Tom Cruise and make him kiss through his history of romantic partners, starting with Mimi Roger, without being noticed by others. The difficulty gets harder as each stage progresses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tue.jpg'),(11429,'Pokémon Tretta','2012-07-14','Arcade','Arcade','Pokémon Tretta is an arcade game developed by Takara Tomy A.R.T.S. and Marvelous AQL, which also developed the Pokémon Battrio arcade game. Officially announced on April 18, 2012, Pokémon Tretta was rolled out nationwide in Japan in early July, phasing out the majority of retired Battrio machines. The arcade machines became fully operational on July 14, 2012 with the release of the first set. The machines are also available in Taiwan in Traditional Chinese and in the Philippines, Indonesia, Malaysia, Singapore, Thailand, and Hong Kong in English.\n\nLike its predecessor, Pokémon Tretta focuses on three-on-three Pokémon battles that require special tiles, called Tretta, that depict one of the various Pokémon species in order to play. Unlike Battrio however, Tretta incorporates searching and capturing Pokémon in various locations. Pokémon caught in-game are dispensed for players to use in other battles, or to add to their collection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6n04.jpg'),(11430,'Pathfinder: Wrath of the Righteous - Love Beyond Death',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The demonic invasion cut many lives short without warning. The unstoppable catastrophe brought death to all in equal measure — rich and poor, fortunate and unfortunate, young and old.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c67.jpg'),(11431,'Starsiege: Deadzone','2023-07-18','Shooter, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Starsiege: Deadzone is a multiplayer corridor extraction shooter set in a dark sci-fi universe where humanity is on the brink of extinction. As space mercenaries, known as Raiders, players will team up with two others to explore the derelict stations taken over by sentient AI. As a Raider, your goal is to extract valuable weapons and resources for your faction. Players will select their class and venture into procedurally generated ships making each match unique. Choose from three distinct classes, each with their own unique abilities and work together to overcome the ship\'s deadly traps and defenses in order to escape. Beware of the other Raiders seeking the same riches.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kns.jpg'),(11432,'Entropia Universe','2003-01-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Entropia Universe is an advanced 3D online virtual environment with a developed planetary system and one universal Real Cash Economy system. Each planet offers a wide variety of exciting entertainment. You can travel between the planets through space and socialize with people from all over the world.\n\nIt does not cost anything to join and there are no subscription fees. The Entropia Universe economy is built on an advanced micro-payment system, giving you as a participant a great freedom-of-choice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ho2.jpg'),(11433,'Chronos','2016-03-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Oculus Rift','Chronos is an atmospheric RPG that chronicles one young hero’s lifelong quest to save their homeland from a great evil. Central to this quest is an ancient labyrinth, which holds the secrets necessary to restore life and peace to their home. However, the architects of this labyrinth designed it to open only once a year. The labyrinth is a test, and each time the hero fails they are cast out and must wait one year to return.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28of.jpg'),(11434,'Leisure Suit Larry: Wet Dreams Saga Bundle','2021-10-15','Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Get the full \"Wet Dreams\"-Saga experience with this Leisure Suit Larry Bundle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c23.jpg'),(11435,'Aquarium Land','2023-10-06','Simulator, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dive into an aquatic world where amazing animals await you!\nGo fish in the sea, swim, catch species like goldfish, starfish, koi fish and add them to your fish tank to expand your aquarium shop!\n\nDrive a motorboat, ride a jet ski or just jump in the water and dive with a friend in multiplayer mode!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cls.jpg'),(11436,'Crazy Taxi: Fare Wars','2008-08-12','Racing','PlayStation Portable','Crazy Taxi: Fare Wars on the PSP (PlayStationPortable) system brings multiplayer gameplay to this fan-favorite series for the first time. It\'s an all-out bumper brawl as cabbies race, ram, smash and dash to steal fares and score big tips. Crazy Taxi: Fare Wars combines Crazy Taxi and Crazy Taxi 2 with hilarious new features that allow players to meddle with their opponents in brand new ways. Ram your opponent\'s cab to steal their passengers and use the new interference feature to slow down their fare delivery time. This is no ordinary cab ride - this is war!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4nwr.jpg'),(11437,'Gay Sex Adventures: Episode 2','2023-12-17','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An erotic Visual Novel featuring HD graphics and realistic-looking characters. Episode 2 reconnects him with Grayson - the charming guy who approached him at a party last year. Tony goes to Gray\'s workplace to gauge his interest, ultimately spending a wild night together in the Spa.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7j4x.jpg'),(11438,'Smuggler\'s Guild','2014-07-18','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Smuggler\'s Guild is downloadable content for Smugglers V. It is a collection of three stories. \n \nTaken from GOG: \n \nThe first story, \"The Smuggler\'s Guild\", starts with the retirement of your trader father through ill health. There\'s no money in being an honest trader these days. Smuggling contraband is a risky business, but the rewards are great - especially for those lucky or connected enough to join the exclusive Smugglers Guild. \n \nThe second story, \"Thirst For Vengeance\", recalls the pirate raiders that killed your parents and kidnapped your sister when you were a child. As a graduate of the space academy with a ship of your own, the time has finally come to seek your revenge. \n \nIn the final story, \"Solomon´s Treasure\", your father dedicated his life to finding the hidden treasure of Solomon McTavish, legendary pirate, and died without success. Perhaps you can do better - but you are not the only one seeking this vast fortune.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/b14nqry7kvpzfk8w3gjf.jpg'),(11439,'Sorrow Asylum 2','2023-09-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sorrow Asylum 2 is a looping horror game, a mix of an abandoned asylum and your mind\'s prison, as well as a sequel to Sorrow Asylum.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70x7.jpg'),(11440,'Tiger Heli','2024-02-01','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','The NES port of Tiger Heli, one of the first games developed by Toaplan and published by Taito Corporation in 1985. It is a predecessor to Twin Cobra. The player controls a helicopter named Tiger Heli taking out various enemies along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s9e.jpg'),(11441,'Final Zone II','1990-03-23','Shooter','Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','You swore bloody vengeance when ZOD blew your satellite crew to shreds. Now it\'s payback time! Your New Age Power Suits turn each member of your elite force into a walking arsenal of destruction, each with it\'s own awesome fighting power. But you\'re just five against a renegade weapons society responsible for killing billions! Choose the fighter best armed to face ZOD\'s devastating forces in each level of combat as you fight battle after furious battle for the final zone!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52k0.jpg'),(11442,'Sansara Naga 1','2001-12-14','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Advance','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11443,'Star Trek: Away Team','2001-03-19','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A real-time tactical combat game set in the Star Trek universe, in which the player endeavours to make sure his team of Starfleet officers doesn\'t meet the gruesome fate of so many redshirts before them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e94.jpg'),(11444,'Supreme Ruler Ultimate','2014-10-17','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Real-Time Strategy/Wargame. From World War II through the Cold War and into the future, re-live or re-imagine the tensions and crises of our recent history! Guide your nation through the era of your choice in Campaigns, Scenarios, and Sandboxes, as you make every effort to become Supreme Ruler!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r72.jpg'),(11445,'Tecmo Super Bowl','1993-11-26','Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Use your favorite NFL team the real NFL players and your football skills to experience the ultimate in football. Use your knowledge of football and game playing skills to take your favorite NFL team of real NFL players through the football season and win the Super Bowl.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qr5.jpg'),(11446,'Trash Horror Collection 5','2025-03-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A collection of 7 trashy horror games!... this will definitely give you an 80s vibe!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kjd.jpg'),(11447,'Magical Bakery: Deluxe Edition','2024-11-07','Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S','Welcome to a magical, flour-filled world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91z4.jpg'),(11448,'Lurch','2024-08-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Multiplayer horror game where you and your friends are hired to work on an old house. Only after the completion of the tasks at hand will you be permitted to leave.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oyj.jpg'),(11449,'Devil May Cry 3: Dante\'s Awakening','2005-03-24','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 2','Devil May Cry 3: Dante\'s Awakening is a prequel to the first Devil May Cry. The game plays very differently from its predecessors, as it puts much more emphasis on style rather than simple demon slaying. As such, combat is much more intense and faster than before. An all-new Style system that allows you to select your fighting style has also been incorporated.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1u6u.jpg'),(11450,'Motel Manager Simulator','2024-08-26','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Restore an old motel alongside a shop and a gas station. Design, furnish, decorate and rent rooms. provide products for customers and fuel for cars. Hire employees to help you and be the boss of your own empire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qhy.jpg'),(11451,'Flea War','1993-12-31','Sin género','Game Boy Color, Game Boy','Flea War is a game developed and published by Sachen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i7z.jpg'),(11452,'Greetings','2017-07-07','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore what is around every corner in hopes for answers to where you\'re going and why.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rf2.jpg'),(11453,'Fake Heart','2023-03-25','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fake Heart is an \"Interactive-Visual Novel\" game about an episode between elderly fairy tale writer Jade and granddaughter Sarah.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6aum.jpg'),(11454,'Wreck the Fed','2022-06-24','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight inflation the American way: by shooting it in the face. Play as your favorite libertarians and destroy the Federal Reserve\'s control over our money!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59nn.jpg'),(11455,'Ultimate Spider-Man: Ultimate Spider-Cycle','2013-12-31','Racing','Web browser','Help Spider-Man save Harry Osborn from the Venom symbiote.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lsjknidfrlnz2cintrkr.jpg'),(11456,'Family Computer Golf: Japan Course','1987-02-21','Sport','Family Computer Disk System','Family Computer Golf: Japan Course is a Japan-exclusive golf game starring Mario and Luigi. It is similar in gameplay to the earlier Golf and the later NES Open Tournament Golf. The courses in the game are based on real-life courses in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23aa.jpg'),(11457,'Armello: The Bandit Clan','2017-04-26','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fight for glory as the infamous Bandit Clan in Armello\'s first Clan DLC! The Bandit Clan DLC features four new playable Heroes, over 50 unique Bandit quests, Bandit Dice, a new Bandit Clan Ring, and a bunch more goodies!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11458,'Leaderboard','1986-12-31','Sport','Arcade, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','Welcome to the exciting world of professional golf with LEADER BOARD.\nWith amazingly realistic 3-D animation, golfers will face multiple 18-hole golf courses that demand strategy, total concentration, control to come in under par.\n\nUndoubtedly the most realistic golf game available,\n\nLeader Board is actually a simulator that gives you a true perspective view of your golf game.\n\nThere are three levels of play so you can compete from amateur to touring professional. You\'ll get all the fun, aggravation and simulation of true golf competition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qbw.jpg'),(11459,'Cocoto Platform Jumper','2004-07-02','Platform','Nintendo GameCube, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','A long time ago in a faraway land, strange little creatures lived in the depths of Abyss. Cocoto, his little devil friends and the mysterious Fairy protect the secret of the magma - the source of their power - in a magic cauldron. Meanwhile, Zaron, the god of lightning who lusts after this force, is up to something. He can count on the rulers of the other kingdoms that Cocoto must cross. The tragic kidnapping of Shiny, Baggy and Neuro has left Cocoto alone to watch over the cauldron. Refusing to leave his friends, he will set out to find them with Fairy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pwo.jpg'),(11460,'Swingers',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11461,'Cut the Rope 3','2024-02-02','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','visionOS, iOS','Twelveth entry in Cut the Rope series. Cut the Rope is a series of physics-based puzzle video games developed by ZeptoLab for several platforms and devices.\n\nCut the Rope 3 focuses on Om Nom and his son, Nibble Nom setting out on a journey to discover new Nommies. The gameplay replaces pieces of candy with Nibble Nom, who must reach Om Nom\'s location in each level. The game features four locations, with the location that the player explores being selected by Om Nom\'s compass. In each search for a Nommie, the player will go through three random levels in order to take a picture of every new creature. It also features 3D graphics, similar to Cut the Rope Remastered.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ygd.jpg'),(11462,'while True: learn() - Deep Edition','2019-01-17','Puzzle, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Base Game + Soundtrack + Art Pack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bjj.jpg'),(11463,'Spaceman','2019-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore, gather resources, find the artifacts, but most important... survive! Spaceman is an adventure game that takes you into an amazing and challenging journey across the temples of space.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7754.jpg'),(11464,'The Last Bloom','2025-03-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Margarete receives a letter from Veronika, her kind neighbor, saying she’s ill. Concerned, Margarete decides to visit, but the journey is challenging due to her blindness. Now it’s time for you, her trusty four-legged friend, to guide her and help her reach Veronika’s house.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kzy.jpg'),(11465,'PC Building Simulator: Aorus Workshop','2021-04-14','Simulator, Indie','Nintendo Switch','This is your chance to build PCs in the top secret PC and robotic development facility of the renowned Aorus gaming brand!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h0e.jpg'),(11466,'Spidersaurs','2019-09-19','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Lock, load, and unleash run-\'n\'-gun mayhem against a dino-spider mutant menace in Spidersaurs!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xwi.jpg'),(11467,'Super Dark Deception','2024-07-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Super Dark Deception is a fun retro take on the hit horror game, Dark Deception! This is the first chapter of the game and contains the first 4 levels. All future Super Dark Deception DLC chapters are included in the price. This means that once the game is purchased, CH2 & CH3 DLC content will be installed for free upon release.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ifg.jpg'),(11468,'Morels: The Hunt 2','2024-04-17','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Morels: The Hunt 2 is the sequel to Morels: The Hunt. It is a simulation game about mushroom hunting and wildlife photography. Explore a diverse range of locations spanning across the globe. Increase your hunter and photographer levels by collecting a variety of mushrooms, photographing animals, and completing weekly tasks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d9o.jpg'),(11469,'Putinist Slayer',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Putinist Slayer is a fast-paced action about destroying putinists in deep space. Let loose in infinity roguelike shoot’em up with sticky gameplay. Kill hordes, dodge, upgrade, eliminate bosses and reach new highest records! With memes from Ukraine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mrt.jpg'),(11470,'Jelly Is Sticky','2022-05-19','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a world of colorful jelly blocks that can be deformed and stuck together. Use them in surprising, unexpected ways to build clever contraptions and solve delightful puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44ap.jpg'),(11471,'Fantastic 4: Flame On','2005-12-08','Sin género','Game Boy Advance','You are the Human Torch! Unleash your powers as you take on enemies around the globe in this all-new Fantastic 4 adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d6g.jpg'),(11472,'The Bat','2024-09-01','Adventure','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Master Bryce is throwing a party. As his most faithful servant, that means it\'s your job to make the party run smoothly. But you only have two hands—and far too many duties. You\'ll have to manage requests from the guests, the master\'s eccentric demands, and your own composure. All the other staff have quit, unwilling to entertain the master\'s \"moods,\" but you\'ve served Wyatt Manor for decades; what\'s one more evening?\n\nA comedy of errors, mild frustrations, and major workplace-safety violations. With limited actions and a limited inventory, juggle hors d\'oeuvres, flaming curtains, and radioactive elements—and keep the drinks coming!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ha5.jpg'),(11473,'Cube Lands: The Final Wish','2024-04-09','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the world of Cube Lands! Solve puzzles using elemental blocks and various other unique and innovative mechanics. Travel through forests, caves, deserts, mountains and much more to defeat the Eye. Be careful, it is always watching...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ztm.jpg'),(11474,'Far Cry 6: Insanity','2021-11-16','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','For the first time in Far Cry history, you are the villain. Get up close and personal as you take control of the legends themselves: Vaas Montenegro, Pagan Min and Joseph Seed – all played by the original cast. Across three DLC episodes, you will delve into these iconic villain’s twisted minds, uncover their backstories, battle their inner demons, and reunite with familiar faces. All of this in a new Far Cry gameplay experience in which you will have to die… and retry. Can you escape the mind of a villain?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48um.jpg'),(11475,'M.O.O.D.S.','2024-07-29','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','M.O.O.D.S. is a Roguelite shooter with Robots fighting using the powers of Emotions. Blast crazy mechs with a myriad of Weapon x Addins combinations. Talk to Bosses to change their combat style. Change your Basic Skills with dozens upgrades. Play solo or with friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8k5t.jpg'),(11476,'Touhou Artificial Dream in Arcadia','2023-09-22','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inspired by Megami Tensei and Etrian Odyssey, Artificial Dream in Arcadia is an old-school dungeon crawler featuring Sumireko Usami in her quest to solve an incident which she seems to be personally responsible for...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75az.jpg'),(11477,'Darkwood','1992-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Mac','An old RPG for classic macs. Nothing much to it, you go into an arena and fight monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rnn.jpg'),(11478,'Polar Sports Vol.1',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Head back to the Arctic with your favorite Polar pals in four side-splitting games that include Polar Bowler and Polar Golfer. Plunge into exotic waters from Iceland to the Amazon in Polar Tubing, then dodge the zany zookeeper to find missing penguin Ace in Penguins! Polar Sports Volume 1 present found of your favorite games from the makers of Polar Games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q2r.jpg'),(11479,'Zenzizenzic','2015-06-04','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Zenzizenzic hurls you into the abstract perils of a bullet-strewn fever dream. Battle your way through five varied levels in Classic Mode or explore an open world in Macro Mode, both of which are stuffed to the brim with legions of enemies. You\'ll dodge an onslaught of bullets while returning fire with an awesome arsenal of weapons and power-ups, leaving complete and utter destruction in your wake.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2it4.jpg'),(11480,'Gunso\'s Skateboard Run','2025-03-06','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Skateboard × Turtle = Exciting Run Game!\nDash at full speed to meet Koyuki-chan!\nCollect coins and activate Fever Dash!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hhf.jpg'),(11481,'BuKnight: The Order of the Golden Crest',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BuKnight is a fun and speedy action-platformer mixing the late \'90s era mascot fever with the mid-2000s indie game craze. Use your up-and-downsmash attacks, as well as the special swirling move to hurl pain at your enemies or to change your momentum and dodge their attacks as you zoom past or towards them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sh2.jpg'),(11482,'Dusty Dunes Tycoon',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Welcome to Dusty Dunes Tycoon! A VR Gemstone Tycoon game. Unlock and upgrade unique Droppers and explore different areas each with unique attractions. Grab a pickaxe and hit the mines, grab a brush and polish some geodes, or strap up and hit the range, there\'s much to experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ni6.jpg'),(11483,'Grid Mania','2018-03-02','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Put your brain to the test with Grid Mania, simple but challenging logical puzzle game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cnpefctz0xud6eb4rxa2.jpg'),(11484,'The 4th Unit 5 - D-Again','1990-04-20','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series, Sharp X68000, FM Towns','D-Again is the fifth 4th Unit game.\n\nThe criminal trade organization WWWF was finally defeated. The bionic soldier Blon-Win is appointed a high-ranked inspector and sent on a mission to protect the secret service agent Remi Binderk on the way to the United Nations conference in Geneva. On board the TGV train in France Blon-Win encounters her old acquaintance Dalzy, who tells her that former WWWF members have united to form the Einheit group, and are working on a new dangerous weapon known as G-R.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yf5.jpg'),(11485,'Togges','2022-12-07','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Togges is a collect-a-thon 3D Platformer about spreading and stacking adorable cubes around the cosmos! Explore unique worlds, solve mysteries and overcome challenges in this adventure to dominate the universe!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48sm.jpg'),(11486,'Nouen Hokkoriina','2010-01-09','Simulator','Android, iOS','Nouen Hoccolina is a farm simulation game published on Mobage exclusively for cell phones. Developed and operated by DeNA, it was released on January 9, 2010 and is compatible with both Android and iPhone.\n\nIn December 2023, an official SNS account was established to provide game updates and other information.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11487,'Strikers 1945 III','2022-07-13','Shooter','Arcade, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Year 1999, fall. The countless super minimum machine group \'nano-machine\', which came flying, invaded the principal weapon and military terminals of each country from outer space and began multiplication. This weapon group which is automated with the \'nano-machines\' repeated attack with non discrimination and the metropoles of each country were in a devastating state. A fear of the extensive nuclear warfare with the strategy nuclear missile error morphism hit the world!!! Barely the unit of each country which prevents the invasion of the \'nano- machine\' is summoned because of the unmanned weapon eradication maneuvers. So, fighting with the weapons of the entire world was not enough. The Strikers start the attack on the enemy center! By the way of the time of half a century, new legend of special force STRIKERS now starts!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z0m.jpg'),(11488,'The Atlas Mystery: A VR Puzzle Game',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Explore the haunted halls of the infamous Atlas Theater, a 1940’s era movie palace that played host to a shocking Hollywood tragedy. Solve intricate puzzles, discover startling artifacts, and evade sinister forces to uncover the twisted truth behind the theater’s dark history.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mxt.jpg'),(11489,'Kapital Punishment 22XX','2023-03-07','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Battle relentless cyborg police in a grim 23rd century dystopia. Experience fast-paced, bloody combat in this retro-inspired beat-\'em up, action platformer. Recruit comrades and collect upgrades as you traverse hazardous environs to reach KAPITAL and take down the oligarchs in charge!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lir.jpg'),(11490,'Anno 1800: Tourist Season','2021-05-25','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The 2nd DLC of the Anno 1800 Season 3 Pass.\n\nTurn your cities into prime travel destinations with hotels to attract the new Tourist residential tier.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7di2.jpg'),(11491,'Ralph Breaks VR','2018-11-21','Shooter, Simulator, Arcade','Arcade','A companion to the films Wreck-It Ralph and its sequel Ralph Breaks the Internet, developed with input by its directors Phil Johnston and Rich Moore. It was a continuation of The Void\'s collaborations with Disney and ILMxLab now also involving Walt Disney Animation Studios. It consists of a series of minigames set within the sequel\'s portrayal of the Internet, including a sequence (referencing a children\'s mobile game seen in the film\'s trailer) where the players must fight off invading bunnies and kittens using pancakes and milkshakes as ammo. It was written by Ralph Breaks the Internet screenwriter Pamela Ribon in collaboration with Tracy Hickman. Direction was again done as a creative collaboration between The VOID and ILMxLab.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ep4.jpg'),(11492,'Vertical Force','1995-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Virtual Boy','Pilot a Futuristic Star Fighter in a Battle for Mankind!\n\nGALACTIC YEAR 210. The earth and its colonies face annihilation in a futuristic war against the human race. YOU have been chosen to pilot RAGNAROK, a star fighter from an advanced alien civilization.\n\nReinforced by fearless AI CHARACTERS, you must locate and destroy menacing fighters and enemy droids. With sheer VERTICAL FORCE blast your way into another dimension to the final Virtual frontier. This mission for mankind is brutal. Be prepared, for it has only just begun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qqr.jpg'),(11493,'Slopecrashers','2024-12-04','Racing, Sport, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Slopecrashers is an arcade snowboard combat racer in which a wild crew of animals band together on a world spanning snowboarding tour! Do stunts & combos for extra boost and collect items to protect yourself or attack the competitors! You can ride on your own, or battle it out in 4 player local multiplayer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53hh.jpg'),(11494,'Way of the Warrior','1994-12-31','Fighting, Arcade','3DO Interactive Multiplayer','The planet\'s greatest warriors have been assembled in a citadel, high atop the Himalayan mountains. It is here that only one challenger will survive and have his name etched with magical blood into the Book of Warriors. The tournament will bring together good, evil, mortal, and immortal. The outcome will lie in the hands of one... you. Find the way, noble challenger, find the Way of the Warrior.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p6g.jpg'),(11495,'Assassin\'s Creed Valhalla: The Siege of Paris','2021-08-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Sail to the kingdom of Francia and engage the forces of Charles the Fat as you participate in the Vikings\' most daring conquest. Infiltrate the city of Paris, forge new alliances within its walls, and strike a blow that will shatter an empire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co303u.jpg'),(11496,'Mononeko','2024-12-04','Music, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In Mononeko, you weave attacks into the music, chain together movements and race against time to capture the kitten killers who are hiding a dark truth. It’s a quest for justice, set to the beat of your bravery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rhy.jpg'),(11497,'Save Iron Globe','2021-08-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As a star pilot of the United Earth Federation, go into the Earth orbit and destroy the alien flagship to stop the invasion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40tf.jpg'),(11498,'Rail Chase','1991-09-01','Shooter','Arcade','Rail Chase is a Sega Y Board arcade light gun game developed by Sega AM3 and published by Sega. Released in Japan in September 1991, and in the United States later that year, the game came in both standard and DX cabinets (the latter seats players in the pneumatic \"Magical Bench Seat\", which tilts and rocks with the in-game action), and uses sprite scaling to simulate three-dimensional scenery.\n\nThe game was followed by a sequel, Rail Chase 2, and a full-sized Sega theme park ride, Rail Chase: The Ride, both released in 1994.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54ff.jpg'),(11499,'Soccer Love',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11500,'Double Dragon','1989-04-01','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Atari ST/STE','The Atari ST port of Double Dragon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ktt.jpg'),(11501,'Level Zero: Extraction','2025-01-29','Shooter, Tactical','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Level Zero: Extraction is a multiplayer extraction horror - a unique take on survival experience that blends the heart-pounding tension of asymmetric horrors with the high-stakes showdowns of extraction shooters.\n\nEmbark on a dangerous scavenging expedition where 3 teams of up to 3 mercenaries compete for loot and dare to come back. Or take on the role of two deadly alien monsters and hunt for human prey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oql.jpg'),(11502,'Battle Fantasia','2007-04-26','Fighting','Arcade, PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','From the makers of the Guilty Gear series of fighting games comes Battle Fantasia, a 2D fighter with lively 3D backgrounds, cel-shaded graphics, and fantasy-themed characters. In addition to traditional Arcade, Versus, Time Attack, and Practice modes, Battle Fantasia also features a Story mode that provides RPG-style dialogue and detailed information about the lives of each of the ten main fighters. Gamers must learn to master counterattacks and the energy-gauge depleting Heat mode in order to advance through scenarios and unlock hidden illustrations, but those simply looking for a quick battle can also head online for head-to-head matches against a friend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8m07.jpg'),(11503,'Pine Hearts','2024-05-23','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Pine Hearts is a cosy little narrative-adventure game set in the sleepy scenery of Pine Hearts Caravan Park. Explore the great outdoors as you uncover items, unlock new paths, and discover all the little secrets stuffed throughout the Park.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qee.jpg'),(11504,'Shiki no Uta: Poetry of four seasons','2009-12-30','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kabukicho is a swirling place of desire, the smell of life is sealed away, it is a world filled with a dangerous atmosphere that should not be approached unintentionally...\n\nIn such place an inexperienced member of the Shirataka clan, Asahi Sumidagawa, the protagonist, is in training to become a full-fledged gangster. One day, Asahi is assigned by Haruyo Shirataka, the fifth head of the Shirataka clan, to collect a debt. The debtors are a small tavern owner and his family.\n\nWill Asahi be able to safely collect the debt as ordered?\n\nAnd will Asahi be able to become a full-fledged gangster?\n\nA winter tale that unfolds in Kabukicho in absolute freezing temperature.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jv2.jpg'),(11505,'Flow\'s Island',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are one of the strays created by a multinational company determined to seize the power that hides on a mysterious island. Collaborate, survive, fight for your place in the pack and discover the magical secret of the tribes living on the Flow\'s Island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tvm.jpg'),(11506,'Heir of Zendor','1996-12-30','Sin género','Sega Saturn','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/euynza4stomeylbegibu.jpg'),(11507,'Jeanne d\'Arc','2006-11-22','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical','PlayStation Portable','Jeanne d\'Arc is a tactical role-playing video game loosely based on the story of Joan of Arc and her struggles against the English occupation of France during the Hundred Years\' War in the early 15th century.\n\nThe game has an amount of historical accuracy when it comes to the cast of characters, and contains many who were contemporaries and allies of Joan of Arc. This contrasts starkly with the many fantasy elements of the game, such as characters possessing magical armlets that give the wearer special abilities, and the suggestion that King Henry VI of England was possessed by demons and used them to aid his armies in destroying France during the Hundred Years\' War.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pnd.jpg'),(11508,'Beach Boys: Tarot Hot Cards','2024-09-26','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Discover the power of tarot and win the boy of your dreams. Let the cards reveal the secrets to capturing his heart. Make love work in your favor!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x3y.jpg'),(11509,'Crash Car Racer','2011-04-29','Racing, Sport','Wii','Features challenging circuits, huge ramps and cars that withstand a beating; 5 single-player modes: Practice, Race, Carnage, Weekend, and Championship; Compete in Head-to-Head and Capture the Flag two-player modes; Obstacles include road hazards, crossovers, and opposing traffic; Unlock bonus cars, liveries, and circuits.\n\nCrash Car Racer takes you through multiple circuits where the gnarliest crashes are rewarded with points and trophies! Smash your vehicle into opposing cars as you race for the finish line in exciting single and multiplayer modes. Choose from tracks such as Winter Slopes, The Stadium, Old Mine, National Parks, Chemical Plant, and more! Tear up the road in Carnage mode where knocking off your competition’s bodywork will gain you extra content and bonuses! In this game, the bigger the wrecks, the better! Come in first in any race and unlock additional game content to improve your car’s performance, making you the most dangerous threat on the road!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9px4.jpg'),(11510,'U.F.O: Unfortunately Fortunate Organisms','2017-06-02','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','U.F.O is an alien resource management action game where you beam up humans using your spaceship and churn them into resources to upgrade your spaceship. In 30 days, the evil galactic warlord will complete his master weapon. Can you defeat him in time or will he bring extinction to your race?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jwi.jpg'),(11511,'Global Ops: Commando Libya','2011-10-26','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Global Ops: Commando Libya is a third-person shooter that puts players at the heart of a global race to capture a nuclear warhead that’s been stolen by Russian organized crime, and get it back into safe hands before it becomes a terrorist weapon. Players will take part in a deadly global chase -- battling through Greenland and into North Africa as they fight to take down terrorist forces and recapture the devastating weapon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ct2.jpg'),(11512,'Trench Tales','2025-05-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A story-driven third-person action game set in a dark, alternative world between WWI and WWII. Harness unique powers, customize your arsenal, and navigate haunting Gothic landscapes. Battle fallen soldiers as you uncover the mysteries of this realm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ewj.jpg'),(11513,'Slobbish Dragon Princess','2021-01-29','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After discovering a strange, lizard-like being on the side of the road, things start to change for Takeru. And wouldn’t you know it, that lizard was actually the princess of the dragons! Now begins their bizarre, yet down to earth daily life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46xj.jpg'),(11514,'Sakura Succubus 3','2020-11-02','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Ogasawara Hiroki was a normal man until he, by chance, learns that many members of Japan’s elite are actually succubi. And, what’s more, there’s something about his scent which makes them attracted to him. Now an encounter with a woman from his past can change everything. This woman introduces herself as Yue, the succubus queen. She intends to whisk Hiroki away to the succubus realm to keep him for her own. Trapped with Yue, Hiroki is faced with an ultimatum: will he succumb to her advances, or will he try to escape?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47at.jpg'),(11515,'The Knight Witch','2022-11-29','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Knight Witch is a metroidvania adventure game with fast-paced, shoot \'em up combat set in a beautifully hand-drawn world. Cast devastating card-based spells, forge close bonds, and make moral choices all in your quest to save your home and discover who\'s behind the War Golem invasion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vht.jpg'),(11516,'Lights Off: Director\'s Cut','2024-02-16','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play through a common childhood fear about turning the lights off and going to bed. This time extended, remastered, and re-imagined.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s6a.jpg'),(11517,'Wacky World of Sports','2009-09-16','Sport','Wii','Wacky World of Sports, is a video game featuring non-conventional sports like tuna tossing, lumberjack sports and cheese wheel rolling where you can compete against yourself in tournaments or battle friends and family in multiplayer modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d9v.jpg'),(11518,'My Sudoku: Classic 9x9 Hard 3','2024-06-24','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Add 30 new Sudoku puzzles to your game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co917v.jpg'),(11519,'Burndown','2019-11-04','Shooter, Racing, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Burndown is a multiplayer vehicular action set in a post-apocalyptic world that knows no humanity. People send the brave hearts or the whack jobs to vehicular arenas just for the fun of it. Only one can win and survive in a vicious fight. Others would find a thousand and one ways to die. We dare you to be the grooviest driver and shooter! Pick your car, get to the death track, and pancake everyone who gets in your way. Do away with all your opponents on the arena or track and taste the sweet and heady nectar of victory! There can be only one!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pmj.jpg'),(11520,'Astro Bot: Stellar Speedway','2024-10-17','Sin género','PlayStation 5','Free DLC that brings new speedrun levels and bots to rescue. It has weekly release schedule:\n\n- Oct 17: Building Speed\n- Oct 24: Let it Slide\n- Oct 31: Spring-loaded Run\n- Nov 7: Helium Heights\n- Nov 14: Rising Heat\n\nEach new level offers two brand-new Special Bots for you to rescue.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ur7.jpg'),(11521,'Cracked','2022-10-12','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cracked is an unforgiving 2D platforming game, where players have to overcome increasingly difficult levels, in varying environments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co559t.jpg'),(11522,'One Piece: World Seeker - Extra Episode 3: The Unfinished Map','2019-12-20','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Play as Law as he takes the stage as a new playable character in this extra episode. Explore a new area, Skypiea, and unshroud the mystery of the island with the young Roule.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51wj.jpg'),(11523,'Minecraft: Toy Story Mash-up','2019-06-25','Simulator, Adventure','Amazon Fire TV, PlayStation 4, Gear VR, Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Open up the toy box! Woody, Buzz, Bo Peep and many of your favorite toys come to life in this oversized Mash-up based on all the Toy Story movies! To infinity and beyond!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6n9c.jpg'),(11524,'TIny Little Farm Plus Milk Seller',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Take care of your own plantation with different types of crops.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ahz.jpg'),(11525,'The Telephone','2023-10-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Telephone is a first-person psychological horror game that will transport you to a world governed by anxiety. You will have to explore the house in which you are locked and the mysterious town of Lonely Plain, searching for clues that can help Roberta regain her memory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r43.jpg'),(11526,'Aliens',NULL,'Sin género','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Aliens is an unreleased Sega Genesis game based on the movie of the same name. The game was set to be developed by Konami and was going to be a port of the arcade game, although never released for unknown reasons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tny.jpg'),(11527,'Fuzion Frenzy 2','2007-02-16','Sin género','Xbox 360','Until four years ago, Fuzion Frenzy was the most popular tournament on Earth and was broadcast live to all corners of the world. However, due to the extreme competitiveness of the players, the leaders of Earth banned it, fearing its influence on the general population.\n\nRecently, however, the world\'s leaders have struggled with the problem of overpopulation, and have come up with a plan for the citizens of Earth to immigrate to space. To encourage immigration, the leaders have brought back the Fuzion Frenzy tournament, but with a change they have set up game zones on various other planets. The people of Earth welcome this news, especially the announcement that the leaders have reinstated the six most famous players, who are returning with renewed enthusiasm.\n\nFuzion Frenzy 2 combines over 40 mini games with futuristic arcade action, custom tournaments, Xbox Live features and more to create the ultimate party game exclusively on Xbox 360. Play with your friends and family to find out who is the strongest among you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wd2.jpg'),(11528,'EarthClicker','2025-01-20','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build your fishing empire in this relaxing idle tycoon game. Upgrade your boat, explore new waters, catch rare fish, and earn profits—even while offline. Master the seas and grow your Trawler\'s Empire!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ni5.jpg'),(11529,'Borderlands: The Pre-Sequel - Shock Drop Slaughter Pit','2014-12-16','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Shock Drop Slaughter Pit is a pre-order DLC for Borderlands: The Pre-Sequel.\n\nEnter the Shock Drop Slaughter Pit and face off against the toughest Scavs on Pandora’s moon, Elpis! Survive the battle and you’ll be feared and respected by the few left alive… not to mention the experience and gear you\'ll earn!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bu7.jpg'),(11530,'Space Worm','2024-12-28','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxr.jpg'),(11531,'Diary of a Zomboni Driver',NULL,'Arcade','Nintendo Entertainment System','What do hockey pucks, a midwife of the dead, and a plot to turn the lives of great players into evil tribute all have in common? They’re all found in the latest and greatest RPG for the Nintendo Entertainment System! Travel the underworld as an undead superstar athlete, battle monster hockey teams, find new gear and abilities, and take on an evil sports agent demigod!\n\nSkate hard. Shoot straight. The Zombie Hockey League is in your living room!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qxa.jpg'),(11532,'Sorcero',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Sorcero, your goal is to command thousands of units into epic battles while supporting them with powerful spells cast from your mage tower. The game features both a campaign mode and a skirmish mode. In the campaign, players will face a series of challenging skirmishes, upgrading and choosing their spells and units between battles to prepare for the next encounter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gzz.jpg'),(11533,'Dragon Ball: Xenoverse 2 - Ultra Pack Set','2019-07-11','Adventure','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Extend your experience with DRAGON BALL XENOVERSE 2 - Ultra Pack Set and get access to all content of Ultra Pack 1 and Ultra Pack 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kev.jpg'),(11534,'Infernovasion','2020-05-10','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An E1 replacement of ultimate doom that focuses on combat, storyline and atmospheric level design.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co763t.jpg'),(11535,'Archmage Ricka','2022-11-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In order to retrieve the illegal property embezzled by the evil Lord, Ricka received a mission to capture the Lord. But it was a trap. She fell into a dungeon arranged by the Lord in advance. Although the demons in the dungeon are weak, the existence of various traps makes it difficult to escape!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co582p.jpg'),(11536,'Injustice 2: Legendary Edition','2018-03-27','Fighting','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Injustice 2: Legendary Edition includes 10 additional characters including Darkseid, Hellboy, Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles plus 5 Premiere Skins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xrv.jpg'),(11537,'World At War: Normandy','2025-02-27','Shooter, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Nintendo Switch Exclusive! Experience the gritty realism and overwhelming graphics of Open Battlefield brutality!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hhb.jpg'),(11538,'The Killing Cloud','1991-12-31','Shooter, Strategy, Tactical, Arcade','Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), Amiga','The Killing Cloud is a cyberpunk themed police game, in which the player gets to patrol the streets of San Francisco on a hover bike. Can you breathe new life into a desperate city that\'s gasping for air and grasping for help?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3e1v.jpg'),(11539,'Forza Horizon 3: Hot Wheels','2017-06-09','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Forza Horizon 3 Hot Wheels takes players to six new themed islands located off the coast of Australia; all connected by a network of Hot Wheels tracks – positioned hundreds of feet in the air – featuring classic Hot Wheels configurations like loops, corkscrews, and more. This is stunt driving at its most extreme, where you can master tracks by performing brand new Hot Wheels skills that make use of boost pads, high-bank turns, half-pipes, insane jumps, and even giant mechanical dinosaurs. If you’re looking to get creative, check out the new Stunt Swap feature to modify stunt track sections and dare your friends to try them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wmy.jpg'),(11540,'Middle-earth: Shadow of Mordor - Lord of the Hunt','2014-12-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Lord of Hunt introduces the new Beastmaster Warchiefs into the game, and involves Talion joining with Torvin using his powers of Domination to turn these new beasts against the Warchiefs, proving that Mordor cannot be tamed.\n\nUnlocks the exclusive Beast-hunter Skin and Test of the Wild Challenge Mode. This content included in Middle-earth: Shadow of Mordor Season Pass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kwp.jpg'),(11541,'Star Chef: Cooking & Restaurant Game','2019-04-03','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Over 20 Million Downloads Worldwide! Play Star Chef, a cooking simulation game that celebrates delicious flavours, letting you run your own café and 5 star restaurant. Experience the joy of managing a bustling business dicing fresh ingredients while exploring your passion for cuisines across the world!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11542,'SenS','2022-05-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the Beginning was the Nothingness... Enter the Unknown, explore the Infinite, find your own SenS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kwz.jpg'),(11543,'Natsuyasumi','1991-12-31','Adventure','Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99n1.jpg'),(11544,'Horizon Chase Turbo: Rookie Series','2019-11-28','Racing, Sport, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','A new campaign tailored for new players. Bring your friends and family together into ROOKIE SERIES!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40f9.jpg'),(11545,'WWE Smackdown! Here Comes the Pain','2003-10-27','Sport, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 2','WATCH YOUR BACK\n\nRelive the drama like never before in SmackDown! Here Comes The Pain. Create, play and develop your own Superstar through storylines developed exclusively by WWE writers. Track your progress with seasonal stats, earn money to build up Superstar abilities and unlock hidden elements. Featuring enhanced gameplay, new match types and better production values. The most electrifying brand in sports entertainment will ignite the Playstation 2 this holiday season.\n\nSEASON MODE\nFeaturing comprehensive statistics, dynamic storylines and Superstar attribute building\n\nLEGENDS\nSgt. Slaughter, The Million-Dollar Man, Jimmy Snuka and more\n\nENHANCED GRAPPLING SYSTEM\n\nMATCH TYPES\nNew match types including Bra-&-Panty and the Elimination Chamber','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ico.jpg'),(11546,'Mega Man X4','1999-12-31','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), Sega Saturn, PlayStation, Legacy Mobile Device','X-PLOSIVE GAMEPLAY.\nX-TREME GRAPHICS.\nMEGA MAN X4!\n\nVibrant Animation • Relentless Enemies\nUnsurpassed Graphics • Hidden Secrets\nMega Man X4 bombards the PlayStation game console and never lets up!\n\nBattle armies of Maverick Reploid Robots while mastering all-new strategic moves like the Air Hover and Zero\'s Saber Tactic system. Discover a myriad of power-ups, secret rooms, extra weapons and invincible vehicles to take on 8 all new X-Hunter Bosses. And for the first time, play as Mega Man X or battle with his mighty partner Zero in 2 separate adventures. Mega Man X4 - now you can be a hero, or a Zero!\n\n* Now, play as Mega Man X or Zero!\n* New X-Hunter levels with vivid color, brilliant detail, intricate passages, secret rooms and hard-to-reach items.\n* Invincible vehicles like the Land Chaser superbike and other robot ride armors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ste.jpg'),(11547,'Flower in the Snow: Resurrection','2020-12-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What is going to be acted before you is——Blossom in the shackles, but deep down in your bone, suspension and romantic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zra.jpg'),(11548,'Survival Tycoon','2017-07-15','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Can you survive an unforgiving world.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11549,'Profezia','1991-12-31','Adventure','Amiga','Profezia (Italian for \"prophecy\") is an adventure game with a multiple-choice interface and a medieval theme.\nWhenever an action is to be taken, the player is presented with a set of choices, which will affect the rest of the adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4byh.jpg'),(11550,'Ex Natura: Nature Corrupted','2023-07-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ex Natura: Nature Corrupted is a challenging, action packed, souls lite experience developed by Blackburne Game Studio. Fight your way from the deepest cultist dungeos to the top of the holy tree and reclaim your throne in this mysterious \"pre-human\" era themed epic story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5i44.jpg'),(11551,'Aquarium Land: Complete Edition','2023-10-28','Simulator, Adventure','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dive into an aquatic world where amazing animals await you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e3v.jpg'),(11552,'Pocket Tennis Color','1999-05-30','Sport','Neo Geo Pocket Color','Pocket Tennis a simple tennis game with two play modes: Exhibition and Tournament.\n\nExhibition is a single match against computer or human opponent (requires link cable). There do exist eight player characters with different skills (human player must select one of those eight characters too) and four (five in the color version) different courts. Also amount of sets per game can be selected (1, 3 or 5).\n\nTournament is only against computer. Human player can pick his/her character but not the computer opponent. Also selection of courts and amount of sets is missing. Three games will be played: quarter and semifinals and of course the final','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52xk.jpg'),(11553,'Boxing','1981-10-21','Sport, Strategy','Intellivision','Boxing shows a top-down view of two boxers, one white and one black. When close enough, a boxer can hit his opponent with a punch (executed by pressing the fire button on the Atari joystick). This causes his opponent to reel back slightly. Long punches score one point, while closer punches (power punches, from the manual) score two. There are no knockdowns or rounds. A match is completed either when one player lands 100 punches (a \"knockout\") or two minutes have elapsed (a \"decision\"). In the case of a decision, the player with the most landed punches is the winner. Ties are possible.\nWhile the gameplay is simple, there are subtleties, such as getting an opponent on the \"ropes\" and \"juggling\" him back and forth between alternate punches.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pfy.jpg'),(11554,'World of Tanks: Modern Armor - Tank of the Month: M41D','2025-02-04','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','This light tank for World War II mode has the accuracy, view range, and reload time to make you a quick-firing active scout and a key support player on your team.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f10.jpg'),(11555,'Public Transport Simulator 2','2025-03-14','Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Next generation of bus simulation','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i21.jpg'),(11556,'Need for Speed: Undercover','2008-11-21','Racing, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The Need for Speed series got another dose of Hollywood magic with the release of Undercover. Take on jobs and compete in races to prove yourself as you infiltrate and take down an international crime syndicate.\n\nAs you win each race, you’ll go deeper into the underworld web that rules Tri-City… and then tear it apart right under their noses. You make the calls, but don’t break your cover: inside the car or out of it, one mistake here could be your last.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co209n.jpg'),(11557,'Rflex','2015-08-26','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rflex is a fast-paced and challenging neo-arcade game. Frantically dodge your way to the high score in a series of rage-inducing levels while enjoying a kickass, original soundtrack. Experience trippy visuals while being pulled into a never-ending abyss of addicting, non-stop action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nyjvqfvoznutucx6jcae.jpg'),(11558,'Marvel Kapow!','2011-06-08','Sin género','iOS','Marvel Kapow! is a mobile game based on Marvel superheroes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4852.jpg'),(11559,'Agatha Christie: And Then There Were None','2008-02-25','Point-and-click, Adventure','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Agatha Christie\'s world famous novel, And Then There Were None, is brought to the PC with all of its original baffling suspense!\n\nTen people, strangers to each other, are invited to a lavish estate on an island. Through a recording, their mysterious host accuses each of his \'guests\' of murder and proceeds to exact \'justice.\' The tension mounts as, one-by-one, the number of people are reduced through the ingenious plotting of the unseen killer. Prepare to play the video game based on the Bestselling Murder Mystery of All-Time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25dn.jpg'),(11560,'Cassette Beasts','2023-04-26','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Grab your cassette player - it\'s time to transform! Collect awesome monster forms to use during turn-based battles in this indie open-world RPG. Combine any two monster forms using Cassette Beasts\' Fusion System to create unique and powerful new ones!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bqu.jpg'),(11561,'Best Sellers Complete Bundle','2024-10-22','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','In this Bundle, you\'ll find our studio\'s Best Sellers for Xbox and Windows, including Mr. T-Shirt, with adventures in a paper world; Little Bear, featuring a bear cub on a quest for honey; Slime Ranger, a strategic quest to defeat the Slime King; and Sunbeam Feast, a challenging precision platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eg5.jpg'),(11562,'Ships 2022',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Ships 22 is a combination of an economic strategy and a ship control simulator. Manage and upgrade your port, recruit a crew, carry out your mission and enjoy your sea adventures!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co411v.jpg'),(11563,'Gaslamp Cases: The Deadly Machine','2021-04-13','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Morgan Johnson is one of Londons finest police detectives. Help him and his partner Jack in this brand new Macht-3 game to solve a thrilling murder case.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dlr.jpg'),(11564,'Succubus Prison','2023-07-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'ve been dragged into robbing a house by a couple of thugs, but what you discover there is beyond anything you could have imagined.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kw1.jpg'),(11565,'Arma 2: Combined Operations','2010-06-29','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ArmA 2 is set in a fictional post soviet country called Chernarus. Players are sent as members of a United States Marine Corps Force Recon squad to this country to prevent further civilian casualties and ensure stability there.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oes.jpg'),(11566,'Shadow Ninja: Apocalypse - Endless Runner',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Endless version randomly choosed levels. Stay on the platform as long as you can, on your way there will be many obstacles and rogue ninja\'s. Dodge these obstacles to increase your score.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11567,'Mary Shelley\'s Frankenstein','1994-12-31','Fighting, Platform, Adventure','Sega CD','From the pages of Mary Shelley\'s classic novel and the blockbuster film comes your own living nightmare.\n\nThis Port of Mary Shelley\'s Frankenstein for Sega CD/Mega CD offers three game play views - isometric, forced isometric and side views with enhanced 3-D environments. Only available as part of a bundle with Bram Stoker\'s Dracula.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ta3.jpg'),(11568,'WWE 2K24 Bray Wyatt Bundle','2024-10-16','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','The WWE 2K24 Bray Wyatt Bundle includes WWE 2K24 Standard Edition and the Bray Wyatt Edition Pack featuring the debut of a brand-new playable version of \"The Fiend\", in-game Bray Wyatt action figure. Let him in.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eeg.jpg'),(11569,'Face Raiders',NULL,'Shooter','Nintendo 3DS','Face Raiders is an augmented reality game in which players must shoot down flying faces using the two outer cameras on the 3DS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7edv.jpg'),(11570,'Hello Goodboy','2023-05-25','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Hello Goodboy - a cozy and wholesome narrative adventure game about finding the purpose of your journey in the afterlife, together with a huggable cute doggo.\n\nPlay as Iko, a kid new to the afterlife without a memory of their past, trying to find the purpose of their journey in this place. You will be accompanied by Coco, a cute and huggable dog that will help solve the mysteries and will always be by your side.\n\nIn Hello Goodboy, you will meet various souls on their own adventures through the afterlife, experience heart-warming stories from them that are full of kind messages, help their problems by clearing lightweight challenges, and enjoy time with delicious food together. There are several paths to the end to find the purpose of your journey, but the choices and time are limited, so decide well how you will spend your time with.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6362.jpg'),(11571,'Garden In!','2023-01-26','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A calm and peaceful experience about growing tiny and lovely plants. Just relax, take care of your seedlings, and watch your dream garden come to life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62bv.jpg'),(11572,'My Vow to My Liege','2020-09-21','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','《My Vow to My Liege》is a visual novel dating game. Players get to play as a girl disguised as the King of Ng, a man. The four dateable characters are: the guide, the enemy, the minister and the guard.Will they choose the man over the country? Love over hate? Who will they finally end up with?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86nr.jpg'),(11573,'Tony Slopes','2023-02-14','Racing, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jump into the wonderful world of Tony Slopes and race a whole host of utterly ridiculous and outlandish vehicles down some of the most treacherous and unpredictable terrains. With a variety of fun-filled, themed races to compete on, multiple vehicles and headpieces to try out, Tony Slopes is bound to keep you and your friends entertained for hours on end!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2889.jpg'),(11574,'Pump It Up Prime','2014-12-24','Music, Arcade','Arcade','Pump It Up Prime is the 19th (domestic) and 14th (international) release of the Pump It Up series. This games marks the first of the Prime series and was the first game to support HD and online functionality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sfv.jpg'),(11575,'Silver Tale','2017-07-24','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take a fantastical journey across the kingdom. Solve quests, collect rare artifacts, build upgrades, and even craft new items in this innovative new match-3 experience!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11576,'Art of Fighting 2','1994-03-02','Fighting, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, Neo Geo MVS, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Neo Geo CD','The second installment in the AoF series added the \"rage gauge\"; similar to the \"spirit system\" of its predecessor, it limited the use and effectiveness of special attacks.\nThe game\'s story is set a year after the original. Geese Howard, a rising star in South Town\'s criminal underworld, calls fighters to the city for a new tournament, \"The King of Fighters.\" Howard was the final boss and series villain of SNK\'s other fighting game franchise Fatal Fury (though he is a secret boss in this game), whose story took place over a decade after the events of Art of Fighting.\nArt of Fighting 2 was the only time Yuri Sakazaki was a playable character in the series. It also marked the only time that she donned her trademark outfit, which was made famous in The King of Fighters series. This game also marks the debut of Takuma Sakazaki without his Mr. Karate persona, as well as Eiji Kisaragi, who both appear in the King of Fighters series. Ryuhaku Todo, the first boss in the original AOF, is the only character dropped; all characters are playable from the beginning. The final boss is always Mr. Big, though as mentioned earlier, an extra match will be played against Geese Howard if the player unlocks him through good performance.\nThis game is also notorious for its difficulty, with it being referred in many fighting circles as having some of the toughest opponent AI in a fighting game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22y5.jpg'),(11577,'Welcome to Bunny Farm',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11578,'Outward','2019-03-26','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Outward is an open world RPG that you play alone or with friends, either online or in splitscreen. It\'s more than just an open world RPG you can play coop though: it is an adventurer life simulator. You live the life of an adventurer, from his or her humble beginnings up until retirement. Your life isn\'t only about killing monsters and looting: you need to eat, drink and sleep; preparing accordingly before jumping into danger. Everything is meant to feel more real and consequential, while still taking place in a high fantasy universe with magic and exotic creatures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1iui.jpg'),(11579,'Rust Rivalry','2024-06-12','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A futuristic sci-fi first person shooter where combatants fight for the fate of their home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8f3i.jpg'),(11580,'Spirit of the Island','2023-10-19','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Spirit of the Island is a colorful life simulation RPG set on a tropical paradise. Help the locals, grow crops, take care of animals, and turn a desolate archipelago into a prosperous tourist destination!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78l3.jpg'),(11581,'Dead Island 2: Haus','2023-11-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Lose yourself in a surreal, psycho-horror dreamscape as you explore a mysterious villa in Malibu. Descend through madness, debauchery, and gore, where survival means confronting a new wave of unexpected horrors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78tl.jpg'),(11582,'Chloe’s Requiem: Encore','2023-06-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chloe’s Requiem is a Japanese 2D adventure game, filled with mysteries and surprises. The young creator, in her teens, created the original game, inspired by free game titles such as The Witch’s House and Ao Oni.\n\nFrom the original release in 2013, the graphics and sounds have all been completely revamped, allowing all players, new and returning, to have a fresh experience with the game.\n\nIn Chloe’s Requiem -encore-, the side story -con amore- is also included, which can be played after the player finishes the original story. Players who have played the game in the past can enjoy the updated art and graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qpb.jpg'),(11583,'Sorcerer','1984-12-31','Adventure','Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, Mac, DOS, Amiga, Apple II, TRS-80, Amstrad CPC, Amstrad PCW','Many centuries ago, the Earth was ruled by Sorcerers and Wizards. They possessed mystical powers capable of both good and evil. The most respected influences in the land were from the good Sorcerers. This fact continually disturbed the evil Wizards, and they eventually decided to use their power to conquer the countryside and enslave its people. They devised a plan to systematically eliminate the good Sorcerers by sending wave after wave of diabolical creatures to ravage the world.\n\nAs the bravest of the good Sorcerers you have been asked to destroy these forces and save the planet. As a reward for your bravery: whenever you overcome or destroy a creature, you will receive a treasure.\n\nKnowing your bravery the Wizards have done everything within their power to keep you from succeeding. They don\'t believe you will survive their first three waves of evil, but just in case you do they have several surprises waiting, Only you can discover through bravery and talent how evil they can become.\n\nTo give you more power over the Forces of Evil the good Sorcerers have provided a magical Flying Platform. When you start on your journey you should first catch this elusive platform. You can continue without it, but only the foolish would dare to do so. Once on the Flying Platform you can go anywhere on the screen to avoid or destroy the enemy. The good Sorcerers have also given you four lives to use against the Forces of Evil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9epe.jpg'),(11584,'Feral Fury','2017-04-02','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Fast-paced twin stick shooter rogue-lite action','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z2r.jpg'),(11585,'Dusty Secrets',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Investigate Mysteries in a Detective game where AI creates everything and suspects, clues change with every case.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ni4.jpg'),(11586,'No More Heroes III: Digital Deluxe Edition','2022-10-11','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Beam katana your way to the top!\n\nNo More Heroes III: Digital Deluxe Edition includes:\n- No More Heroes 3 game\n- Bonus in-game item \"Cat T-shirt\"\n- Bonus in-game item \"Destroy All XXXXXXS!! T-shirt\"\n- Bonus in-game item \"IAFK T-shirt\"\n- Bonus in-game item \"Tenstion of Tiger T-shirt\"\n- Bonus in-game item \"Insert Coin T-shirt\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lr0.jpg'),(11587,'CaveBugBoy','2020-01-19','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','CaveBugBoy embarks on an epic adventure through dark and mysterious underground caves in search of a better life. The journey will encounter evil floating and screaming skulls, flying dead ants and flies, falling lava rocks, and collect bugs body parts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lm5.jpg'),(11588,'Plant Therapy: Coney Island Plus','2024-09-05','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Plant Therapy Coney Island Plus features a new neighborhood with two more apartments and our new wall decorating feature that lets you pick from over 200 wallpapers and wall colors!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11589,'Ghost Maze','2023-05-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on this small adventure to conquer a treasure guarded by an iconic character from old games. Find keys to unlock secret passages, face enemies, and explore a labyrinth to discover the game\'s secrets. Get ready for an epic journey to become the hero who claims the wealth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jk6.jpg'),(11590,'Le Gardien du Savoir',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11591,'Tokoro-san no Mamoru mo Semeru mo','1987-06-27','Platform','Family Computer','An action platformer game by Sony label Sony Epic Records that was only released in Japan on June 27th, 1987. It is named for and features the real-life Japanese celebrity Tokoro Jouji.\n\nTokoro-san no Mamorumo Semerumo is an action platformer that stars real-life Japanese musician/comedian/voice-actor Tokoro Jouji, a.k.a. George Tokoro. Armed with a water pistol with a finite supply of water, Toroko-san must make his way across various levels either shooting or avoiding the various enemies along the way.\n\nThis game has some notoriously poor game design, such as ammo replenishing items being hidden, which means the player needs to shoot randomly to find them which simply depletes their finite ammo supply even faster. If the player takes too long in any one world, a massive vision-obscuring storm will roll in and make the game considerably more difficult to play. The game, however, does feature an early example of a non-linear stage selection progress as different paths become available after defeating each boss.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7451.jpg'),(11592,'Mad Dex 2','2016-05-12','Platform, Arcade','Android','You’re Mad Dex. You’re little, but you’re brave. The love of your life has been kidnapped by a merciless monster that has taken over the city, and now all you can think about it how to save her from his vile clutches.\nUse your special parkour abilities to overcome all the obstacles, avoid all the traps, beat all the bosses, fight your way to the big bad, and save your girlfriend! Put your agility to the test as you run, jump, stick to walls, fend off your evil foes’ deadly attacks, and never give up!\n\nMad Dex 2 is a hardcore platformer, an exciting, challenging game for anyone who’s willing to go the extra mile to reach their goal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w7c.jpg'),(11593,'The Inheritance of Crimson Manor','2022-05-05','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Explore a beautiful and Enigmatic Victorian Manor with a dark secret, In this narrative horror first person exploration puzzle game filled with fine art, secret passages and mysterious mechanical puzzles playing as the executor of the last will from the enigmatic Railroad Magnate Hadley Strangre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43v9.jpg'),(11594,'MechWarrior 5: Clans - Digital Collectors Edition','2024-10-17','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','MECHWARRIOR 5: CLANS Digital Collectors Edition includes MechWarrior 5: Clans and the Digital Collectors Content Add-on, featuring a Digital Art Book, the full soundtrack, an Omnimech Technical Readout, and exclusive in-game content: Platinum Mech Patterns and Timber Wolf WAR Omnimech with unique weapon loadout and skin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9esp.jpg'),(11595,'Marvel\'s Spider-Man: Turf Wars','2018-11-20','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4','After gaining control of equipment left in the wake of Sable International’s military occupation, Hammerhead and his gang have declared war against the other Dons of the Maggia crime family. Spider-Man and Captain of the Police Department of New York Yuri Watanabe must put an end to the violence before the entire city erupts in a turf war.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4w2p.jpg'),(11596,'Fear: Call of the village.',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','FEAR: Call of the village is a first-person horror game made in realistic 3D graphics and fearsome. In it you have to get into a mysterious village and solve various riddles, the solution of which will be hindered by various inexplicable phenomena by science.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59fs.jpg'),(11597,'Lance A Lot','2016-10-18','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lance A Lot is a local party game that pits 4 friends against each other in GLORIOUS rocket-powered combat! Fly across the sky on a noble rocket steed and use your lance to send worthy adversaries plummeting towards the ground. In the end there can only be one knight left standing!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co454x.jpg'),(11598,'Burger Chef Tycoon: Multiplayer Edition','2023-03-17','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Manage the preparation of burgers, fries, crispy chicken and a multitude of other treats! Try to deliver the orders on time, but be careful not to mix them up! Upgrade your bar and beautify it and find ingredients of the best quality, so that you\'ll be able to create the best burger bar in town!\n\nMultiplayer Edition features an exciting local multiplayer gameplay mode, allowing players to team up and play together. It adds a new layer of excitement and replayability to the game, while providing a fun and engaging experience for players to enjoy with friends and family.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69l2.jpg'),(11599,'Super Stardust Delta Blast Pack','2012-02-14','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation Vita','Download the Blast Pack for Super Stardust Delta Today and get an additional 4 action-packed modes, all featuring the unique PS Vita controls, including - Endless Mode, Bomber Mode, Impact Mode, and Twin Gun Mode.\n\nEU Description:\nSuper Stardust Delta: Advanced Star Fighter Pack\nThe galaxy is about to fall into the grip of Professor Schaumund, and the brutal tyrant is taunting you with his latest transmission:\n\nSurrender pilot; your resolve is admirable, but all is lost. However, I am a fair man and I have devised a number of tests to see how skilled you really are. Now you can die a so-called hero.\n\nEndless: my forces will attack relentlessly and in random waves. The longer you survive, the closer to death you will be.\n\nBomber: you only have bombs at your disposal, nothing else. If you fail to plan your attacks properly, my ships will rip you to shreds.\n\nImpact: I have knocked out your weapons and left you defenceless. But I enjoy toying with my prey so I have left your ship’s boosting abilities intact; you will need to rely on them.\n\nTwin-Gun: can you think and act at the same time, pilot? You need to fly your ship with motion sensor control, while using the dual analog sticks to fire your weapons.\n\nMy war fleet is waiting, pilot. Dare you face me?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61cw.jpg'),(11600,'Banyu Lintar Angin: Little Storm','2017-03-03','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Banyu Lintar Angin is a series of experimental illustrations about three siblings, living together independently in a rural Indonesian environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22zt.jpg'),(11601,'Blacksea Odyssey','2016-06-01','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Enter the Blacksea Odyssey, a violent top-down rogue-lite space shoot ‘em up RPG brimming with colossal creatures and runic technologies. Explore dangerous, interstellar spacescapes as you hunt enormous space-behemoths with a harpoon and rune-infused spears. Unlock fierce space-huntsmen and collect runes to customize your spear and space-board to hunt as you please in the deadliest competition in the universe - the Blacksea Odyssey!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22yx.jpg'),(11602,'Busy Scissors','2010-12-02','Simulator','Wii, Nintendo DS','Busy Scissors is the first hair cutting and styling game of its kind for the Nintendo Wii and DS. Aspiring stylists of all ages, are you ready to train with Bizzy at the Busy Scissors salon? Put your best hair forward and see if you can make the cut! Are You Ready To Get Busy? Get ready to color, shampoo, cut, blow dry, and style hair with the Wii remote. Players earn reputation and advance their career in a Hollywood based salon by meeting the demands of their glamorous and eccentric clientele, from celebrities to high-end fashion designers and world famous rock stars! The game progresses as they help unlock each client\'s inner potential by finding their unique outward style. The game features over 30 hairstyles, 20 mini-games and 6 career levels, which provide a dynamic combination of realistic gameplay, humor, and entertainment. Manifest Oranj, the game\'s developer, spent months working with industry experts to emulate the real hair styles used in the game. Each salon technique was demonstrated and filmed by the team, before it was re-created in 3D and designed as a mini-game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31iq.jpg'),(11603,'Gems Defenders','2024-08-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Match 3 Game, Tower Defense Game and Story driven RPG. Gems Defenders have it all! Match enchanted gems to power up your town, heal your heroes, charge powerful spells, defeat the enemies that are storming the gates of your city and uncover lore of the mysterious Aldenor!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rab.jpg'),(11604,'The Talking Words Factory',NULL,'Sin género','Leapster','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yyr.jpg'),(11605,'Espresso Tycoon & Thief Simulator','2024-10-16','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9evc.jpg'),(11606,'Wait: Extended','2015-10-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Wait\" is a mystery horror game, inspired by the works of H.P Lovecraft and the Silent Hill series.\nThe gameplay is put together by elements of exploration and riddle solving.\nExperience horror without jump scares or fighting monsters, but with the fear of the unknown and unimaginable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3la2.jpg'),(11607,'Godzilla: The Game','2015-07-14','Fighting, Simulator, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4','Godzilla is a video game developed by Natsume Atari and published by Bandai Namco games for the PlayStation 3 and 4. It was released on December 18, 2014 in Japan, on July 14, 2015 in North America, and on July 17, 2015 in Europe.\n\nThe Japanese version of the PlayStation 4 Godzilla is titled Godzilla VS and was released on July 16, 2015. Godzilla VS is the exact same game as the PlayStation 4 Godzilla.\n\n\"Godzilla, the King of the Monsters, first appeared in 1954. Scientists studied Godzilla and found that they could harness energy from the monster. Called “G-Energy,” this seemingly endless source of power was used to better the lives of all mankind. 60 years later, just when mankind’s memory of the beast faded, Godzilla appeared again. Godzilla destroyed at will, all in search of more G-Energy. Such irony, the same G-Energy which was used to better the people’s lives, also caused Godzilla to awaken. Can the G-Force, mankind’s last hope, stop Godzilla? What fate awaits Godzilla once he has consumed all of the G-Energy, and grown to his full potential?\n\nBash your way through over 20 stages of mayhem. Explore Mission Mode, Diorama Mode, and King of Monsters Mode! Collect G-Energy in each stage to Power-Up your Godzilla up to 100 Meters tall! Your offensive and defensive prowess will increase with your size.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vv2.jpg'),(11608,'Elevator Action 3D','2006-06-30','Shooter, Adventure','Legacy Mobile Device','Originally developed for the arcades in 1983, Elevator Action, has been ported to several consoles such as the Commodore 64, the Game Boy, the Game Boy Color, the NES, the Saturn, and the ZX Spectrum, where it has since enjoyed a large and loyal following.\n\nFans of the original and fans of the FPS genre will be pleased to find that classic Elevator Action has now been realized in 3D with crisp graphics, special tactical elements and fast-paced, FPS action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ray.jpg'),(11609,'Indiana Jones and The Great Circle: Collector\'s Edition','2024-12-05','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Collector’s Edition features an exclusive set of items inspired by Indy’s office at Marshall College. Map your travels with The Great Circle 11” Globe, including a plane magnet that attaches to secret locations on the globe and reveals a hidden storage compartment. Keep track of your adventures and leave no clue behind with the New Adventure journal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97rp.jpg'),(11610,'Disney\'s Doug: Doug\'s Big Game','2001-01-15','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Color','Doug makes his way to the videogame world with DOUG\'S BIG GAME on Game Boy Color. You play Doug Funnie and his alter ego Quailman as you try to find your missing sweetheart, Patti Mayonnaise. You can also take on the role of your loyal pooch Porkchop, who also has own superhero alter ego: Quaildog. Solve the mystery of Patti\'s disappearance by searching the town of Bluffington for clues and write in your journal so you can refer to them later. Discover who is behind Patti\'s disappearance and her whereabouts by exploring 20 different environments from the popular TV show you\'re bound to bump into more than a few of the show\'s popular characters along the way. And don\'t forget to keep an eye open for power-ups that will increase Quailman\'s strength and powers. DOUG\'S BIG GAME features detailed color graphics that bring the feel of the popular show right to the palm of your hand.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vte.jpg'),(11611,'Rocket League: Season 15 Rookie Pack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Unlock the Tygris car, CNTCT-1 Wheel, Silencer Decal painted Black for the Tygris Body, and the Hat Trick Player Banner in the Season 15 Rookie Pack!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11612,'Timore 5','2022-11-03','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Timore 5 is an indie horror game, 5th one in Timore series. \nA scientist named Frank has done a lot inventing new things, but his experiments aren\'t without the consequences. In this game Frank will try to record his dreams and convert them to computer data, allowing him to review his dreams later, but the experiment might not go as planned...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qz3.jpg'),(11613,'Mario Clash','1995-10-01','Platform, Arcade','Virtual Boy','Mario Clash is the first 3D stereoscopic Mario game released for the Virtual Boy. The game is a return to the style of the original Mario Bros. To progress through the game, Mario must knock enemies off platforms using Turtle Shells. There are always two Koopas; if one gets knocked off, another one takes its place. Many enemies need to be hit from the side, thus Mario must throw shells from the background to the foreground and vice-versa in order to knock them off.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co258m.jpg'),(11614,'A Little to the Left','2024-02-15','Puzzle, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A Little To The Left is a cozy puzzle game that has you sort, stack, and organize household items into pleasing arrangements while you keep an eye out for a mischievous cat with an inclination for chaos. Check out this playful and intuitive puzzler with 75+ satisfying messes to tidy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co887d.jpg'),(11615,'Super Mario Bros. Star Scramble','2010-12-31','Platform, Adventure','Web browser','Mushroom Kingdom is in danger! You, Mario, must save it – just find evil Bowser and fight with him to bring freedom to your land!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54z4.jpg'),(11616,'Avocado','2024-07-13','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Avocado is a clicker game made with the next generation in green technology, in which you click an avocado! In Avocado you click the avocado to obtain even more avocados! Drop new and exciting avocados to trade with your friends! Come and enjoy yourself as a part of the Avocado gang!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pmy.jpg'),(11617,'Iron Maiden: Legacy of the Beast','2016-06-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, Android, iOS, PlayStation Vita','Battle as Eddie in his many guises across worlds inspired by the rich lore and music of Iron Maiden - one of the most iconic and influential bands of all time.\n\nA mysterious force has shattered Eddie’s soul and scattered the shards. Travel through time and space collecting the pieces as you encounter a cast of dramatic and engaging characters.\n\nA powerful soundtrack enhances gameplay, using songs spanning Iron Maiden’s entire career, including previously unheard live recordings adapted for the game by engineer Tony Newton under the close scrutiny of Steve Harris.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6133.jpg'),(11618,'Kaiju Evolution Survivor','2025-03-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kaiju Evolution is a top-down action roguelike game where you choose a Kaiju to evolve through four different size stages, from a microscopic creature into a gigantic world-ending threat. Survive for 20 minutes against increasingly larger waves of enemies as you learn new weapons and abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s0o.jpg'),(11619,'Sweet Meat','2016-12-10','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','Once upon a time, there were cute characters running happily againsts lovely threats like chainsaws, minefields, kicking unicorns, storms of burning chickens, and a lot more tender dangers. (Cartoonish humor).\n\nSweet Meat combines the casual gameplay of the genre with an amazing and unique social feature: Twitter users can play God and change the gameplay tweeting with the hash #sweetmeatrunner plus any modifier/threat incorporated to the game. For example, if someone tweet: I want a #chickenstorm in #sweetmeatrunner, lots of burned chickens will fall from the sky on all active player gameplay in Real Time, you can also send it only to a friend, well... an ex one.\n\nFeatures:\n-Gameplay changes via Twitter.\n-Lots of characters to discover.\n-Simple controls.\n-Different scenarios to unlock.\n-Share your funniest death and earn rewards.\n-Challenging and bizarre daily missions.\n-Awesome daily rewards.\n-Show-off with insane achievements.\n-Challenge your friends and climb on the leaderboards!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/af1fgs8vg2zm9tmazaw5.jpg'),(11620,'Fallout 76: Atlantic City - America\'s Playground','2024-03-26','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Atlantic City – America’s Playground is a free update for Fallout 76 and with it comes new questlines, open exploration of Atlantic City and a season full of adventurous rewards.\n\nAmerica’s Playground brings you back to Atlantic City, where Mayor Tim, in charge of the local Municipal Government, asks you to deal with the Overgrown threat that is taking over the flooded city center. Don’t forget to bring your gardening shears.\n\nMeanwhile, in Appalachia, the Russo family has evicted the Mothman cultists and turned the Ingram Mansion into a swanky night club. They seem to be doing well after escaping their blood-stained past in Atlantic City, but beneath the surface of their glamorous exterior, the Russos are harboring some dark secrets, and they need your help.\n\nThere’s a lot to dig into in this update, and along with new quests, we are introducing free exploration of Atlantic City! There are even new side quests that you can pick up from the ever-optimistic Jeremiah Hopkin’s bulletin board in the Whitespring Resort, so make Atlantic City your next vacation destination. Take your time, wade through the flooded streets, stroll along the boardwalk and stop to smell the Overgrown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8369.jpg'),(11621,'Vythzkel of City Dinasty','2024-09-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vythzkel of City is in the development phase, so if you\'d like to contribute, I\'d be delighted to do my best.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mkf.jpg'),(11622,'Adventure XT',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11623,'Crystal Caves HD','2020-10-16','Platform, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Return to the underground classic world of treasures and traps in the HD remake of Crystal Caves! Guide Mylo through puzzles and arcade challenges of your favorite episodes, then explore the whole new Episode loaded with all new puzzles, enemies, challenges, hazards and help Mylo get back home!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h14.jpg'),(11624,'Dead Alliance','2017-08-29','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Dead Alliance is a fast-paced, multiplayer first-person zombie shooter set in a post-apocalyptic world, where former military bases have been turned into the only remaining city-states.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24nr.jpg'),(11625,'SmileBasic 4','2020-04-23','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','This is the programming software, \"SmileBASIC 4\", that allows you to create and play games with Nintendo Switch! The programming language is \"SmileBASIC\" which is the most suitable language for creating games. Because it is based on the language \"BASIC\" that is easy to understand even for beginners and it has been developed for program learning. So, even those who have never experienced programming can work on their projects. Moreover, there are many materials and various tools to support your work development.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5asz.jpg'),(11626,'Sex Adventures: The Bar Hookup','2022-09-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An explicit erotic visual novel following the story of twenty-three years old Luiza hooking up with her very big and very cocky customer in the bathroom of the empty college bar she’s working at.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7iby.jpg'),(11627,'Touhou Spell Bubble: Special Music Pack Vol. 5','2021-10-14','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','Special Song Arrangement Pack Vol. 5 is here, and it\'s filled with hits!\nPopular songs by Amane-san and beatMario like \"Shiawase Usagi\" and rhythm game favorite, \"Hakanakimono Ningen,\" as well as the overseas hit, \"Tiny Little Adiantum\" are all included in this special variety pack!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yyn.jpg'),(11628,'Front Mission Evolved: Last Stand','2010-11-24','Shooter, Simulator','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Endless swarms of the enemy are invading. Can you and your team hold them off? Multiplayer co-op mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jer.jpg'),(11629,'Front Mission Evolved: Map Pack','2010-11-23','Shooter, Simulator','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','2 new maps to conquer! Play all classic multiplayer modes on these maps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jes.jpg'),(11630,'Time Idle RPG','2022-03-29','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Idle RPG game that uses real life Time as the core mechanic and currency. Featuring offline progress, prestige, unfolding mechanics, trees, and much more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nhx.jpg'),(11631,'Little Nightmares: Fox Mask','2017-09-01','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','An add-on introducing the Fox Mask to the base game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7b2j.jpg'),(11632,'Rush VR','2018-12-04','Racing, Simulator, Adventure','PlayStation VR, SteamVR, Oculus Rift, Oculus Quest','Take a dive into the adrenaline-pumping world of wingsuit flying with RUSH. Soar down mountainsides at breakneck speeds. Weave through canyons, dodge outcrops, and plummet down sheer drops as you race towards the finish line.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x6h.jpg'),(11633,'Ninja Gaiden: Ragebound','2025-09-30','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A brand-new side-scrolling entry to the NINJA GAIDEN series from the team behind Blasphemous, NINJA GAIDEN: Ragebound redefines the classic platformer saga in a spectacular, thrilling and challenging ninja adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qrg.jpg'),(11634,'Dragon Ball Z: Hyper Dimension','1996-03-29','Fighting, Adventure','Super Famicom','Dragon Ball Z: Hyper Dimension is a 2D fighting game and the last DBZ game made for the Super Famicom (SNES). It is based around the most memorable battles from DBZ and introduces more traditional and fluid combat mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4l0m.jpg'),(11635,'The Hunt for the Lost Treasure','2015-09-13','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Continue the adventure of the The Lost Ship in this longer quest as you hunt for the pirate\'s lost treasure in this beautifully designed classic point and click adventure puzzle game. Explore a pirate\'s cove, ancient temple, and structures of past tree dwelling inhabitants. Discover hidden passageways, clues and puzzles along the way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/agol1pdicpeqvsxmy3fp.jpg'),(11636,'Garden Life: A Cozy Simulator','2024-02-22','Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Garden Life is a gardening sandbox game in which players can plant, cultivate, decorate, and manage their own garden.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76pz.jpg'),(11637,'Aaero + Aaero2 Bundle','2024-11-05','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Experience both Aaero and Aaero2 in a double headline showcase you won\'t want to miss!\n\nAaero - Speed through stunning, stylised environments tracing ribbons of light, releasing the energy in the music. Battle strange enemies and fight epic boss battles all driven by an incredible licensed soundtrack.\n\nAaero2 - The critically acclaimed ribbon-riding rhythm-action rail-shooter returns! Fly solo or team up with a friend as you return to the world of Aaero. Take on giant creatures to massive tunes on a battlefield of beats.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eau.jpg'),(11638,'Wanted!: Monty Mole','1984-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wanted: Monty Mole is a platform video game that was published in 1984 by Gremlin Graphics. Versions were released for the ZX Spectrum and Commodore 64 home computers.\n\nThe player controls the titular mole who has to travel around a coal mine collecting pieces of coal and other miscellaneous objects while avoiding various nasties and the infamous crushers. The style of gameplay is typical of platform games of the 1980s. The ZX Spectrum version is a flip-screen game while the Commodore 64 version uses scrolling.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hpl.jpg'),(11639,'Wizardry Gaiden IV: Throb of the Demon\'s Heart','1996-09-20','Sin género','Super Famicom','Wizardry Gaiden IV: Throb of the Demon\'s Heart is a Role-Playing game, developed by Access and published by ASCII Entertainment, which was released in Japan in 1996.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vsn.jpg'),(11640,'The Poisoned Roots',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Poisoned Roots is a narrative driven game about abuse, obsession, and the dark secrets of a troubled American home. It\'s a short game, and is intended to be played in a single sitting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38su.jpg'),(11641,'Showdown',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','1 or 2 player c64 action shooter!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11642,'Christmas Tina','2021-07-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','In 1988, Japan was under a bubble economy. New buildings have sprung up like mushrooms after a rain, and the social atmosphere is very lively in the era. The ancient objects gradually disappear, and new creatures are constantly born. Christmas Tina tells a story about boys and girls living hard under the shadow of the modern city. Their bond can break through the language barrier. Without words spoken, they already understand each other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n3q.jpg'),(11643,'Iwaihime: Matsuri','2017-09-07','Point-and-click, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','A port of the visual novel Iwaihime from PC to Playstation 4 and Vita.\nIt will include new scenarios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eok.jpg'),(11644,'Rockman Complete Works: Rockman 2 - Dr. Wily no Nazo','1999-09-02','Platform','PlayStation','Rockman Complete Works: Rockman 2 - Dr. Wily no Nazo is an expanded port of Rockman 2 (Famicom), lacking the difficulty selection from the international version (Mega Man 2).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tta.jpg'),(11645,'Kid Chameleon','2017-06-21','Platform','Linux, Wii, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Kid Chameleon is a 1992 platform game released for the Sega Genesis/Mega Drive. The premise of the game is that the main character, Casey, can use masks to change into different characters in order to use different abilities. It was later released in Japan as Chameleon Kid.\n\nThe game is also a part of the Sega Genesis Collection for the PlayStation 2 and PlayStation Portable. It was released for the Virtual Console in Japan on May 22, 2007; North America on May 28, 2007; and Europe on June 1, 2007. It was also released in addition to a series of other Sega games, including Shining Force and Comix Zone, in Sega Smash Pack 2. The game has also appeared in Sonic\'s Ultimate Genesis Collection for Xbox 360 and PlayStation 3.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q7b.jpg'),(11646,'Layers of Fear 2','2023-06-15','Puzzle','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac','A remake of Layers of Fear 2 and its DLC. This remake in Unreal Engine 5 adds new core mechanics and features to blend the chapters together seamlessly.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6knz.jpg'),(11647,'Tickdown','2023-08-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have two real-time hours to locate and defuse a weapon of mass destruction. Use the powers of Water, Earth, Fire, and Air to fight your way through hordes of enemies to reach your objective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co651t.jpg'),(11648,'Neptunia GameMaker R:Evolution - Digital Deluxe Edition','2024-05-14','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ett.jpg'),(11649,'Bullet Hell Action Roguelites','2025-03-03','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kg8.jpg'),(11650,'A day with Marco','2025-05-10','Adventure, Indie','Game Boy Color, Game Boy Advance, Game Boy','L\'avventura giornaliera di un Marco in tribunale. Aiuta Marco a destreggiarsi tra giudici arcigni, colleghi stravaganti e boss sempre alle calcagna.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9sgr.jpg'),(11651,'Demon Eclipse','2008-01-07','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Demon Eclipse was a Doom II mod for GZDoom by Amuscaria (formerly Eriance). Originally intended to be told through the eyes of another marine escaping the invasion on Earth in during Doom II, Demon Eclipse went through multiple iterations but was ultimately dropped due to real-life and the loss of motivation for the project by the author. The project had succumbed to multiple rounds of scope-bloat and become too much to manage. The first episode of first dropped from the mod, but was later made standalone by Blue Shadow. The intent was to focus and refine the second episodes \'hell-tech\' theme in the \"Hell-Forged Edition\", but that also fell thru in 2014.\n\nIn 2017, Amuscaria had revive the project in a complete reboot of the second episode by the name of Hell-Forged, with a much narrower focus around the Gothic hell-tech theme.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4nv3.jpg'),(11652,'SoulCalibur II','2003-08-27','Fighting','PlayStation 2','SoulCalibur II for the PlayStation 2 is an expanded port of the Arcade game, including Heihachi as a playable character and new game modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5udt.jpg'),(11653,'Ill Natured','2000-12-01','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','iLL nATURED is a game made in RPG Maker 2000 by locus, also known as iLL rEBEL.\nLong ago, humanity discovered Venus\'s Bracelet, a ring of habitable planets. One of them, Allos, became a conflict zone as its native species, the Figinians, saw humans as a threat. The two races have been at war ever since. Flame and Melody escape from their native Torbexia, one of Allos\'s human slave colonies, in search of a new life—but they end up getting involved in the flames of a war that\'s beginning to unfold.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9osz.jpg'),(11654,'StairCase 55','2023-12-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An atmospheric psychological horror game that plunges you into an anomalous, paradoxical stairwell. Equipped only with a flashlight, navigate through the abyss of the procedurally generated staircase, haunted by an ever-adapting presence. Unravel the mystery of SCP-087.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7a6o.jpg'),(11655,'Valentine\'s Venture: True Love Odyssey','2025-02-20','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11656,'Götzendiener','1994-11-25','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','Götzendiener, made by the creators of Princess Maker, presents its own take on \"rescue the princess\" story: here, there is nobody who can rescue the princess but herself. Armed with the sword, the princess must explore the isometric dungeon, fighting enemies in real-time combat and solving environmental puzzles on the way. The princess jumps automatically, and the actions in the game are limited to attacking enemies with a sword and pushing and pulling objects.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xg9.jpg'),(11657,'Dragon Ball FighterZ: Super Baby 2','2021-01-15','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Ultimate Malign Being, Super Baby 2, now comes to DRAGON BALL FighterZ!\n\nThis content includes:\n• Super Baby 2 as a new playable character\n• 5 alternative colors for his outfit\n• Super Baby 2 Lobby Avatar\n• Super Baby 2 Z Stamp','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3r4g.jpg'),(11658,'Hike Haven','2025-03-13','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Hike Haven – A Breathtaking Exploration Adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hhe.jpg'),(11659,'Don\'t Pee','2024-02-01','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An adventure game about not peeing your pants, can you survive the scary house?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7q1f.jpg'),(11660,'Inheritors2078',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Inheritors 2078 is an RTS/TPS/FPS hybrid game with full Multiplayer & Co-op support, taking its events in the near future where the world is being dominated by evil robotic incarnates that were once enslaved by humans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hb2.jpg'),(11661,'Fusem','2022-01-30','Puzzle','Android, iOS','The original \'Fusem\' number stacking and jamming puzzle.\n\nStart your game with a 6x6 grid of 2s, 4s, and 8s, and swap tiles to match your numbers.\n\nWatch in excitement as your tile values compound in an exhilarating chain reaction which stacks your possible matches with every turn.\n\nDelightfully simple to get started with, and fiendishly challenging as your numbers grow, this math merging, number fusing, score stacking and tile jamming puzzle game will have you strategizing several moves ahead as you plan not to corner your most valuable tiles or sabotage your next high score attempt.\n\nGet involved in one of the most exciting number matching puzzles available and show off your high scores.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4fgm.jpg'),(11662,'Department of Collections',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A tasked based procedural online co-op sci-fi horror game that can be played both casually or more hardcore','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d81.jpg'),(11663,'World of Warcraft: Warlords of Draenor','2014-11-13','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The heroes of Azeroth are on the verge of a war that will reforge the fate of two worlds. World of Warcraft: Warlords of Draenor, the fifth expansion to Blizzard Entertainment’s acclaimed massively multiplayer online role-playing game, sends players to the world of Draenor at a pivotal moment in history to fight against and alongside legends from Warcraft’s brutal past.\n\n-Level cap raised to 100\n-Boost to level 90\n-Updated player character models and improved models in general\n-Build and upgrade your own Garrison\n-Account-wide heirlooms\n-Class-specific perks','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xw7.jpg'),(11664,'Neversong: Coma HD','2020-05-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The unaltered, HD Flash classic,\"Coma\" from 2010, ported to PC in full-screen! A little game about a little boy and a few piano notes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ryh.jpg'),(11665,'Hired Explorer','2002-07-26','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Game from STUDIO-Van','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pio.jpg'),(11666,'Poulet Poulet','2021-11-01','Platform, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Classic-style 2D platformer with hand-crafted fun stages, a vengeful chicken, and an evil exotic fish.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h54.jpg'),(11667,'Unsolved Case: Ash and Secrets','2025-03-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p6b.jpg'),(11668,'Atelier Sophie 2: The Alchemist of the Mysterious Dream','2022-02-24','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The latest entry in the series follows the beloved alchemist, Sophie Neuenmuller, shortly after her adventures in 2016’s Atelier Sophie: The Alchemist of the Mysterious Book.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56gw.jpg'),(11669,'Bubbles','1982-02-01','Arcade','Arcade','Bubbles is an action game with puzzle elements where the player controls the protagonist, a soap bubble, from a top-down perspective. The object is to clean a kitchen sink by maneuvering the bubble over ants, crumbs, and grease to absorb them. The bubble will grow larger the more objects it absorbs. The player is impeded by enemies—brushes, razor blades, roaches, and sponges—that are deadly to the character. Except for razors, enemies also compete with the player to absorb objects in the sink. Once the bubble reaches a certain size, it will acquire a smiling face and become invulnerable against brushes and sponges; contact with those will reduce the bubble\'s size to the point it becomes vulnerable again. After all the objects are gone, the player will progress to the next level if the bubble is large enough. If the bubble is not large enough at that point, or if the player enters the drain while the bubble\'s too small, a life is lost. Once the bubble becomes large enough, the drain in the center of the sink will begin to flash green, signaling the player to enter it to progress to the next level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qsr.jpg'),(11670,'Septentrion: Out of the Blue','1999-03-11','Sin género','PlayStation','Sequel to Septentrion/S.O.S. for the Super Nintendo/Famicon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mhv.jpg'),(11671,'Far Cry 6: Season Pass','2021-10-07','Shooter, Adventure','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Embrace the Far Cry legacy and play as the villains with the FAR CRY 6 Season Pass. In three separate DLC episodes, take control of Vaas Montenegro, Pagan Min and Joseph Seed (all played by the original cast) and fight to escape their twisted minds. In a second offering, travel back to the distant future of 2007 with the critically acclaimed FAR CRY 3: Blood Dragon, now also on the newest generations of platforms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tro.jpg'),(11672,'Alaskan Road Truckers: Highway Edition - Cosmetic Bundle','2024-12-19','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eat.jpg'),(11673,'Madrun','2020-02-29','Platform, Racing, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Tired of uneventful, single-player 2D platformers? \n \nThis just another one of them...except you race against up to 7 other players online and create catastrophic chaos with items beyond insanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co210w.jpg'),(11674,'Pizza Shop Manager','2021-08-20','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pizza Shop Manager is a unique combination of strategy and simulation game with some economic elements. Do your best to fulfil pizza orders from customers while making enough money to keep your shop open in this fun cooking game. You take the role of Pizzeria Manager. Manage every aspect of your pizzeria and make it become the best eatery in town!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qi9.jpg'),(11675,'Soul Trapper: Episode 1 - Ollie Ollie Oxen Free!','2009-09-28','Point-and-click, Adventure','iOS','Soul Trapper is an audio adventure game for iOS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vddr5bngykhp59pl2ern.jpg'),(11676,'Oxygen Not Included: Spaced Out!','2021-12-16','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In Oxygen Not Included: Spaced Out! you\'ll spearhead space missions to new and undiscovered Planetoids, transport resources between bases, and manage multiple worlds on the fly to build a megacolony that not only survives, but hopefully, thrives.\n\nNew Multi-World Gameplay:\nPut your colony management skills to the test by juggling the needs of Duplicants in multiple colonies simultaneously. Switch between planets in real time and secure rare resources on other worlds to supply your home base.\n\nExpanded Rocketry:\nCustomize new modular rockets to your liking, then explore the expanse of space with the newly overhauled Starmap. Huge expansions to the Research Tree provide new mid-game Rocketry options, giving your Duplicants an edge in the asteroid space-race.\n\nNew Critters:\nGet acquainted with some new fuzzy friends - if you\'re nice, they might help you out around the colony!\n\nNew Resources, Biomes, Tech and More:\nTons of new biomes to explore, tech to research, and resources to mine. There\'s a whole new universe out there - discover it all in Oxygen Not Included: Spaced Out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5se0.jpg'),(11677,'Street Ball',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11678,'Draw Chilly','2019-11-11','Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Draw Chilly - a hell of an Arcade game, where Vladimir and his squad are gently raising the city of Mechanics from the depth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1smf.jpg'),(11679,'The Standard Model','2025-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Standard Model is a narrative walking simulator/slice-of-life game set in different worlds throughout the multiverse. The player takes on the role of an undergraduate student that gets to explore and experience 5 different worlds on a quantum adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8f4o.jpg'),(11680,'Super Cobra','1983-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','ColecoVision, Arcade, Atari 2600, Intellivision, Atari 5200, Odyssey 2 / Videopac G7000, NEC PC-6000 Series, MSX','You\'re a helicopter gunship pilot on a daring and dangerous mission: air surveillance of enemy territory. Success depends on how far you can penetrate enemy airspace. Can you handle the pressure? Because the further you go, the more difficult the mission becomes. Show that you\'ve got what it takes by maneuvering your chopper around craggy mountain peaks, through deep dark tunnels, and over tall city buildings. All while you face enemy tanks and missiles and weird sky-flying weapons. But you can fight back with high-flying, quick-thinking, fast-reaction moves. Good luck and good flying!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1piz.jpg'),(11681,'Cubin','2025-01-06','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cubin is a first-person platform puzzle game that immerses you in the LGA experience. Complete 60 experiments to discover the truth about this simulation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85el.jpg'),(11682,'The Settlers III: History Edition','2018-11-25','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Settlers III is a lavishly designed, strategy-filled fantasy civilization simulation in which you have your industrious little subjects construct buildings, produce goods, and conquer new lands in exciting real-time battles. Includes The Settlers III, The Settlers III Mission CD, and the expansion pack Quest of the Amazons. Some of the improvement highlights include: Windows 10 compatibility, auto saving, 4K and dual monitor support, and multiplayer via Uplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1khw.jpg'),(11683,'Gravewood High: Chapter 1',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','The first chapter of Gravewood High\'s single-player campaign. Several students have gone missing at Gravewood High. Together with your friend Erin, you have to confront the cunning Teacher and figure out what is behind the madness of Gravewood High.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bdv.jpg'),(11684,'The Colonists: New Lands','2024-03-27','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Expand your frontiers with The Colonists: New Lands! Improve your transport network with Bridges and Train Tunnels, boost your economy with the Mint and even allow your bots to discover their spiritual side…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tdd.jpg'),(11685,'Jiminy\'s Morning Adventure','2024-03-24','Indie','Playdate','Help Jiminy explore and make it to work fashionably late.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82ih.jpg'),(11686,'Hentai Waifu 5','2025-02-27','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11687,'Super Mario Bros. 3Mix','2014-05-30','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Super Mario Bros. 3Mix is a large-scale hack that changes and adds lots of features to Super Mario Bros. 3, and pays homage to many past and (relative) FUTURE Mario titles, while attempting to remain faithful in spirit to the look and feel of Super Mario Bros. 3:\n\n- All new levels (and a few “remixed” Mario 3 levels somewhere in there)\n- Many new songs added from other Mario games (kept some SMB3 classics!)\n- Play as Mario, Luigi, or Toad (cosmetic only) in any configuration\n- New power-ups (Penguin replaces Frog, Carrot replaces Tanooki)\n- Star Coins (which are used to unlock portions of the game)\n- Ability to re-enter past worlds (with level completion intact)\n- Ability to re-enter past levels (to get all of your Star Coins)\n- Alternate exits in some levels\n- Ability to save progress\n- Many new enemies, typically some special ones for the world theme\n- All new bosses (many are “remixes” of bosses from other Mario games)\n- All kinds of gameplay changes to meet the theme of a level/world','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w0f.jpg'),(11688,'Acting Lessons','2018-12-10','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Do you want to experience an adult VN that many players and fans only could find the strength to play once? Then this is the game for you. Acting Lessons is packed with a rich story, comedy, sex and drama. The choices you make in this game will affect your adventure until the very end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kz4.jpg'),(11689,'Big Buck Hunter: Ultimate Trophy - Deluxe Edition','2025-04-11','Sport, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Nintendo Switch','Hunting doesn\'t get any more epic! This is Big Buck Hunter: Ultimate Trophy, but loaded with even more legendary content. Includes all Standard Edition content, plus:\n\n• The Mythical “Buckzilla”\n• The Infamous Headshots-Only “Zombie Deer”\n• 30 more hunting sites\n• And so much more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ob5.jpg'),(11690,'ClickCatToe','2024-09-11','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cat Clicker\n\nWelcome to Cat Clicker! This addictive and fun game tests your reflexes and clicking skills. The goal is simple: click on the cat to collect points and activate bonuses. Featuring a retro 8-bit design and vibrant music, Cat Clicker offers a casual gaming experience perfect for all audiences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t2a.jpg'),(11691,'Beat Nebula','2016-11-05','Music, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In space, everybody can hear you drum.\n\nBeat Nebula is a game for QaziJam8, which had no theme, so I restricted myself to a game that had a limited color palette (based on recently announced Pokémon Cosmog) and to make the game playable on the Donkey Konga bongo controller (which I later expanded to the Taiko Drum Master controller too). You can also play with a keyboard, but it\'s a lot more fun with a controller you can hit really hard.\n\nHit the drums to destroy the comets and dodge lasers. Get hit three times or fall off of your platform, and the universe will end. No pressure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jcghyajk29fb7joclueb.jpg'),(11692,'The King\'s Request','2018-06-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This short adventure game uses your knowledge of the human body and concepts from science, biology, physiology, anatomy, medicine, biomed, nursing, pharmacy, health or exercise science as your weapon! There\'s no negative if you get a question wrong - so have a go and save the kingdom!!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11693,'Rogue Sweeper','2022-05-31','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In addition to the rules of Minesweeper, we will explore the stage by making good use of the items obtained during the exploration. Various treasures are hidden in the treasure chests along the way. Let\'s collect treasures steadily in the Unique world of gypsy jazz with stages full of surprises!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hab.jpg'),(11694,'Age of Fear: The Undead King','2015-06-26','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Age of Fear: The Undead King is a fantasy turn-based strategy. The game features a novel battle system, two campaigns with solid fantasy stories and very flexible multi-player and skirmish modes.\n\nThe story takes place in an untamed fantasy land, where three forces: the Human Kingdom, the Greenskins\' Horde and the Undead Legion - are fighting for domination and survival.\n\nYou will encounter quick skirmishes, where wise unit\'s cooperation is essential. You will visit distant lands either as a honorable knight or an evil necromancer. You will conquer cities and destroy ancient evil!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/t0hozytgmj5bt8vx7k2z.jpg'),(11695,'Pochi and Nyaa','2003-12-24','Puzzle','Neo Geo MVS','Pochi and Nyaa is a puzzle game made by Taito (Makers of Puzzle Bobble/Bust-A-Move) and Aiky. The story behind it is that in every 1000 years there is a Tournament held by the animal gods Pochi (the Dog) and Nyaa (the Cat) in decision who will be the top star for the next millennium, although they need the power of Earth\'s people to do so. The gameplay is similar to Super Puzzle Fighter and Puyo Pop, but with a few differences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hpt.jpg'),(11696,'Merge Mansion','2020-09-16','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Merge Mansion is a mobile puzzle game where players renovate a mansion by merging various objects and solving match-3 puzzles. The game combines elements of interior design, storytelling, and puzzle-solving, with an ultimate goal to restore the mansion to its former glory while uncovering the mysteries of its past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4nad.jpg'),(11697,'Detective Pikachu','2018-03-23','Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Detective Pikachu is an adventure game developed by Creatures Inc., published by The Pokémon Company, and distributed by Nintendo for the Nintendo 3DS. The game is a spin-off of the Pokémon franchise, in which players work with a talking Pikachu to solve mysteries. A shorter, downloadable version of the game called Great Detective Pikachu: Birth of a New Duo was released in Japan in February 2016, while the full version was released worldwide in March 2018.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zk8.jpg'),(11698,'Sword Art Online: Alicization Lycoris - Limited Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','This edition includes the following\nGame: Sword Art Online: Alicization Lycoris\nLimited Edition Box\nSpecial Content Blu-ray disc\nOriginal Soundtrack\nDrama CD\nSpecial Case for CDs & Blu-ray disc\nDrama CD Script\nSpecial booklet (Dengeki NerveGear Vol. 6)','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11699,'Super Monkey Ball Adventure','2006-06-30','Platform, Racing','Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Our four heroes from Super Monkey Ball - Aiai, Meemee, Baby and Gongon - were enjoying a typical day, when they saw a flying machine crash down on a nearby island. Soon, they discovered that the mysterious Naysayers have appeared, spreading discord and unhappiness all over the island. And to top it all off, the prince and princess of the neighboring islands have gone missing on Jungle Island - if they aren\'t found and returned, there\'s sure to be trouble! Can our heroes restore order to Monearth?\n\nSuper Monkey Ball Adventure takes the monkey rolling madness of the previous games and puts a story-based spin on it. Choosing from one of the four monkeys, Players roll their way around the various islands of Monearth, talking to citizens and performing the tasks they request (such as delivering sandwiches, finding a missing baby, rescuing rare flowers, and more) to cheer them up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tgc.jpg'),(11700,'Search All: Christmas','2022-01-10','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Search All: Christmas is a game in the genre of \"hidden object\", in which you need to find all the Christmas candy in the form of a cane (caramel cane) on a large location drawn in the style of \"doodling\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4byu.jpg'),(11701,'Kodomo Chousadan Mighty Pockets: Chousa 1 - Junk-ya Black no Ie','1997-09-07','Card & Board Game','Satellaview','The first episode (investigation) of Kodomo Chousadan Mighty Pockets.\n\nKodomo Chousadan Mighty Pockets is a downloadable 3-part Soundlink game for the Satellaview that was broadcast in at least 2 runs between September 7, 1997 and March 28, 1998.\n\nThe game plays like a board game with a detective motif similar to the game of Clue/Cluedo. The rules of the game however, are considerably different. Throughout the game, SoundLink narration is used; including rapping over Michael Jackson sound samples and remixes of 1950s American Television.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co486g.jpg'),(11702,'Excitebots: Trick Racing','2009-04-20','Racing','Wii, Wii U','Excitebots is controlled with the Wii remote horizontally or optionally with the Wii Wheel. Most of the games are played on courses large in size with many opportunities to take meandering paths. The 25 different courses offered are modeled after real locations on Earth. Because of the size of each course, most races are two laps long and offer opportunities to gain massive altitude, perform various maneuvers, and obtain various items.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ggz.jpg'),(11703,'Alien Breed II: The Horror Continues','1994-12-31','Shooter','Amiga CD32, Amiga','Alien Breed II: The Horror has Gauntlet-influenced gameplay, similar to the original Alien Breed (and the Alien Breed Special Edition \'92), but with many new features. As an Interplanetary Corps soldier, you must visit a remote alien-infested colony and destroy the alien invaders. The game is split over 17 zones, each featuring numerous different aliens. As you go through the game you collect credits, which can be traded for weapons, ammunition and other enhancements through the in-game computers. Keys are collected as you progress, which must be used wisely, as there are many rooms containing bonuses that don’t have to be entered.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xxc.jpg'),(11704,'Gary Grigsby\'s War in the West: Operation Torch',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Operation Torch is an expansion of the acclaimed wargame, Gary Grigsby’s War in the West. This new addition to the most detailed strategy game available on the Western Front of WWII, introduces 10 new challenging scenarios, including both historical and what-if operations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d0v.jpg'),(11705,'Hotloop','2024-11-18','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hotloop is a dynamic mix of old school arcade and simulation. In the game you will meet a realistic system of spacecraft behavior and pricise orbital mechanics. You have to curb the force of gravity of the planets in order to repulse numerous enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co643m.jpg'),(11706,'Ape Escape: On the Loose','2005-05-22','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation Portable','Based on the Ape Escape series, Ape Escape: On the Loose arrives on the PSP with multiplayer functionality and a variety of minigames. The new adventure begins when Specter--a monkey-turned-monster--and his army of monkeys travel back in time to change history and take over the world. Now it\'s up to you to pursue Specter and capture more than 200 monkeys in eight different worlds, which span more than 20 levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51kp.jpg'),(11707,'Backrooms: Between Lost Dimension','2024-10-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Backrooms: Between Lost Dimensions is a horror game that immerses you in the surreal world of the Backrooms. Trapped in an endless maze of monotonous rooms, you must solve disturbing puzzles and face sinister creatures to find an escape. Is your escape just an illusion?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8afb.jpg'),(11708,'LEGO Star Wars: The Skywalker Saga - The Clone Wars Character Pack','2022-11-01','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Intergalactic dogfights and defense against Separatist raids aren\'t the only fun you\'ll have! Play as veteran heroes and villains from Star Wars: The Clone Wars.\n\nCharacters Include:\n\nCaptain Rex\nDarth Maul (Clone Wars)\nAsajj Ventress\nSavage Opress\nGar Saxon','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5seq.jpg'),(11709,'The Anglerfish Project','2023-07-25','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Use your friendly probe, Paul, to fish for communication packages in the cosmos. Aim at an alteration in the sky and, being careful of your strength, cast your fishing rod. You will need to decrypt these hidden messages to help keep everyone safe. Good luck, angler.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x2w.jpg'),(11710,'My Mermaid Girlfriend','2019-12-24','Visual Novel','Android','You are a normal high school student who has a crush on a cute classmate, Isla. Knowing that she likes a guy who swims well, you decide to teach yourself at the beach to impress her. But you are caught in the waves and get dragged under. Just as you think you’re done for; someone appears and saves you.\n\nAs you open your eyes, you find out there are three girls arguing-Isla and another two girls. The two girls are clearly aren’t human; they have Killer Whale tail and jellyfish-like hat in their body. Surprised, you try to run away but Isla comes after you. But in the process, you both fall into the water and you see Isla turn into a mermaid!\n\n“We are going to watch you… not to disclose our secret!”\n\nYour normal life starts to roll dynamically with Isla’s sudden kiss…Now, can you imagine how will your story end like with these unique girls?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yj3.jpg'),(11711,'Human','2016-10-08','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Somewhere between sanity and madness lies a realm torn between the two. Illusions become reality, and reality becomes nothing more than a vision.\n\nHuman is a short psychological horror game which examines inherent, earthly, and otherworldly evils, and the forces which drive them. As you make your way through an Alaskan auroral research facility in search of employees it quickly becomes very clear that something has become alerted to your presence. Suspiciously, once it knows you\'re there, you\'re more than welcome to be there. Drawing you in, you soon begin to question all you see and hear.\n\nHUMAN is highly metaphorical, yet accessible. All is explained in it\'s simplest essence, but for those willing to look beyond the surface, there lies layer upon layer of symbolism, and clues regarding the nature of reality, which add depth to the meaning behind Human.\n\nHuman is primarily story and experience driven, however environmental puzzles and problem solving are interlaced within. You will also use observation to find what\'s necessary in order to progress. Tablets throughout the facility contain research notes which you can zoom in on and read which help give further context to the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25qu.jpg'),(11712,'Spacey Vade',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Synth-wave styled physics based 2D puzzle shooter filled with nods to the golden era of classic arcade games. Think upside down Peggle crossed with Space Invaders and enemies crafted from the blended remains 70\'s, and 80’s gaming.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41wn.jpg'),(11713,'Sono Hanabira ni Kuchizuke wo','2006-09-22','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sono Hanabira ni Kuchizuke o is an adult visual novel and the first game in the Sono Hanabira ni Kuchizuke o series of games. The game follows Nanami Oda, who is a new freshman in high school. However on the first day, she ends up in an accident in which a senior student from the school comes to her rescue. Ever since that meeting with Yuna Matsubara, Nanami just cannot get her mind off of her and later decides to join the student council.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hjaoeuchdjzzgkad7wio.jpg'),(11714,'Kikimora\'s Clean-Up','1995-06-30','Simulator','PC-9800 Series','Released in Vol 7, Kikimora\'s Clean-Up puts players in the role of Kikimora, who must completely sweep floors while facing a time limit. This game is similar to Pac-Man in nature.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mvb.jpg'),(11715,'Speel',NULL,'Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Speel is an experimental typing game that plays a little more like a puzzler. Your job is to type words incorrectly on purpose.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t03.jpg'),(11716,'Funko Fusion: Happy Little Bundle','2024-10-18','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Funko Fusion & Bob Ross Pack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9efm.jpg'),(11717,'Pyramid','2024-02-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a short vapowave/horror first person adventure, completion time is around 10 minutes. It is inspired by Control, Severance and my experience working in a business corporation, so if you\'re into these things, you might enjoy this game too. This is the first part of a bigger experience, the following parts will come soon.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11718,'Oddworld: Abe Boxx','2013-11-26','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Portable','This old-school bundle comes packed with Oddworld: Abe’s Oddysee and Oddworld: Abe’s Exoddus, in all their strange glory. Help free hundreds of your fellow Mudokons from oppression.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3guf.jpg'),(11719,'Pandemic Panic!','2020-04-22','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','We\'re in lockdown and you\'re our only hope! Grab your blaster, ready the cure and prepare to face the virus head on in this frantic, wacky and wild hospital. Don\'t be fooled, this is a task for only the best out there. Think you have what it takes?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rff.jpg'),(11720,'Nekketsu Koukou Dodgeball-bu: PC Bangai-hen','1990-03-30','Sport','Wii, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','Nekketsu Koukou Dodgeball-bu: PC Bangai-hen is the PC Engine port of the Arcade game under the same title.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i1b.jpg'),(11721,'Kodomo Chousadan Mighty Pockets: Chousa 2 - Hanzai Toshi Big Apple','1997-09-14','Card & Board Game','Satellaview','The second episode (investigation) of Kodomo Chousadan Mighty Pockets.\n\nKodomo Chousadan Mighty Pockets is a downloadable 3-part Soundlink game for the Satellaview that was broadcast in at least 2 runs between September 7, 1997 and March 28, 1998.\n\nThe game plays like a board game with a detective motif similar to the game of Clue/Cluedo. The rules of the game however, are considerably different. Throughout the game, SoundLink narration is used; including rapping over Michael Jackson sound samples and remixes of 1950s American Television.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co486h.jpg'),(11722,'Naruto Shippuden: Ultimate Ninja Storm Legacy','2017-08-25','Fighting, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The game collects all four games: Naruto Shippuden: Ultimate Ninja Storm 1, Naruto Shippuden: Ultimate Ninja Storm 2, Naruto Shippuden: Ultimate Ninja Storm 3 Full Burst and Naruto Shippuden: Ultimate Ninja Storm 4: Road to Boruto into one epic remastered compilation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co324p.jpg'),(11723,'Wonders of Aether',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wonders of Aether is a free-to-play anime-inspired open-world MMORPG by Japanese developer MEKASMITH.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bbu.jpg'),(11724,'Roach Invasion',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','You are about the same size as a cockroach, and you must use every means at your disposal to destroy the massive numbers of \"Gs\" that are crawling on the ground, on the walls, and even falling from the ceiling.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6exo.jpg'),(11725,'Batman: Return to Arkham - Arkham City','2016-10-17','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Batman: Arkham City sends players soaring into Arkham City - a heavily fortified sprawling district in the heart of Gotham City. Batman Arkham City introduces a brand-new story that draws together an all-star cast of classic characters and murderous villains from the Batman universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tld.jpg'),(11726,'War for the Overworld: Ultimate Edition',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cdo.jpg'),(11727,'Higurashi Daybreak','2006-08-13','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Higurashi Daybreak is a doujin game developed and distributed by Twilight Frontier with the cooperation of 07th Expansion. Unlike the original sound novels, the game is a two-on-two versus third-person shooter based on the system of the Mobile Suit Gundam VS Series.\n\nCharacters from \"Higurashi no Naku Koro ni\" utilize weapons such as bats and hatchets in battles set in Hinamizawa. The scenario is an original work by Ryukishi07 and does not feature the horror elements present in the source material. Despite being a doujin game, it employs the same voice actors as the original drama CDs and anime adaptation, which is unusual for fan-made games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co754y.jpg'),(11728,'Kirby\'s Return to Dream Land','2016-08-09','Platform, Adventure','Wii, Wii U','Kirby and his friends are back in an adventure designed to satisfy longtime Kirby fans and beginners alike. When an alien spaceship crashes in the otherwise peaceful realm of Pop Star, its pieces are scattered throughout the land. Players must guide Kirby as he retrieves the ship’s parts and helps the aliens return to their home planet. This time, however, he’s not alone. At any time, up to three more players can join in the fun and play as Meta Knight, King Dedede and Waddle Dee to help Kirby in his quest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1w9v.jpg'),(11729,'Nascence',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Thomas has a mission: find the ashes of “Anna”, a woman burnt on the stake as witch in medieval times. A whole religion has spawned from that event and many people has been affected by a disease directly linked with it. Thomas is part of an organisation that wants to put an end to all this.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yzx.jpg'),(11730,'Disney Dreamlight Valley: The Storybook Vale Bundle','2024-11-20','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Explore a magical world in Disney Dreamlight Valley alongside Disney and Pixar friends, and travel to the Storybook Vale, a land made up of fairy tales and myths!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e2m.jpg'),(11731,'Word Wow Big City',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','Word Wow has hit the BIG CITY! The worm is back for another fun word game adventure. Travel down buildings of death defying heights using your word making skills!\n*Word Wow word games have been downloaded over 1.5 million times! – THANK YOU!\n\nWield your word making prowess to help navigate the worm to freedom. Puzzle your way down and around obstacles before time runs out…but watch out for cages and obstacles!\n \nCollect special boosters along the way to help you through brain busting levels! Find hidden gems to unlock bonus puzzles where you can really rack up the points.\n \nCheck your live world-wide rank at the end of each level and compete against Facebook friends.\n \nYou\'ll be equipped with letter-clearing bombs along the way, but be sure to earn more to use in a pinch.\n\nIf you’re a bookworm or love boggle, crosswords and puzzle games, you’ll be a natural!\n\nWord Wow BIG CITY will sharpen your brain and become your new go-to word game! \n\nFEATURES \nLeave the dirt behind, there are buildings to climb!\nOver 260 challenging levels to hone your word making skills and sharpen your brain.\nAdorable character and bright, colorful graphics transport you to the city.\nOver 39 hidden bonus levels for dedicated word game players! \nTons of boosters and gems to collect!\nCompete against your Facebook friends or puzzle your brain solo.\nLive rankings for each level among Word Wow BIG CITY players.\nFree daily bonuses to help you when you need it.\n\n** Word Wow Reviews **\n5/5 “This game is a lot of fun and the worm is so cute!”\n5/5 “Great game for book lovers! Helps keep my brain sharp…I can’t stop playing Word Wow.”\n5/5 “The most addictive word game I’ve played so far!! I can’t wait to get home from work to play. ”','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/auarpl4lvcalyjblgqxh.jpg'),(11732,'Sonic Inhibit',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jt1.jpg'),(11733,'Card of Legend: Awaken Angels',NULL,'Strategy, Tactical, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Angels, Cards, Battle! Unite the legends to prevent the resurrection of the evil forces!\nA fantastic story of heroes joining forces with angels to stop the evil forces.\n\nUnite the legends to prevent the resurrection of the evil forces! A competitive Anime TCG game featuring fantastic story of heroes joining forces with angels to stop the evil forces.This game features PvP, PvE, Roguelike, Single Player Missions, and others. Play your cards right!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8us3.jpg'),(11734,'Evil of Demons: Algailah','2023-04-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Evil of Demons: Algailah is a survival horror game, hiding and escaping, where the hero is kidnapped by a demon at noon the hero wakes up and finds himself somewhere underground, tries to get out of the predicament by finding keys and collecting the statues to open the exit door, you must have to hide from the devil and sneak away from him so that he can survive. Along the way there will be obstacles and places to hide.\nWhile you try to escape from the demon home you will explore the fearsome cellar of the Demon\nReveal some facts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6cfm.jpg'),(11735,'Blood \'n Guts','1986-12-31','Sport','Commodore C64/128/MAX','Blood \'n Guts is described as \"ancient barbarian games\", somewhat equivalent to the Olympic games but played by vikings in various violent events. You start the game by choosing one of four prefabricated vikings and then its off to compete. \n \nAmong the several events available to the player the most noteworthy are, perhaps, Beer Drinking and Cat Throwing, both self explanatory titles. The other events are comprised of Tug of War, Rock Roller (roll a huge rock up a cliff and crush your opponent with it before he does it to you), Tower Jump (jump from a tower and land on your head!), Human Hit (throw stones at a human target!), Mountain Walk (basically rope walking with some added violence), Pole Fighting, Axe Throwing (again at a human target!) and Arm Wreck (arm wrestling).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qrgrhferybesdxz19ajp.jpg'),(11736,'Tilesweeper','2022-08-19','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Tilesweeper is a well-known game Minesweeper, but with amazing stylized graphics and a new game mode - arcade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44o2.jpg'),(11737,'Mars 2030','2017-07-27','Simulator','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Suit up for the first manned mission to Mars! MARS 2030 is a virtual reality simulation that gives players the opportunity to explore the mysterious red planet like never before. \n \nMARS 2030 centers on open world exploration. Taking on the role of an astronaut, players traverse Mars and collect geological samples that uncover the planet’s past. Make discoveries across 40 square kilometers of open Martian terrain, accurately-mapped and -modeled using NASA\'s Mars Reconnaissance Orbiter HiRISE satellite data. Along this journey, players discover a world rich in history that, much like our own planet, once looked very different from what exists today. MARS 2030 can also be experienced in non-VR.\"','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11738,'Mortified',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Mortified is multiplayer horror co-op game playing 1-8 players find all the objects to make disappear the creature that wants to kill everything it sees ! Weclome to the hell .','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hv5.jpg'),(11739,'Dynasty Warriors: God Seekers',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s6p.jpg'),(11740,'Combat Cars','1994-12-31','Racing','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Combat Cars is a racing game in which the player not only competes with other cars, trying to outrun them, but also uses all kinds of weapons and gadgets to damage their opponents. In the beginning of the game, the player can choose one of the eight available characters. Each character has his/her own strengths and weaknesses (speed, car handling, etc.), as well as unique weapons. The weapons include a simple gun, glue spots they can leave to trap other cars, homing missile, and others. There are 24 different tracks available in the game. The player must complete them in a linear fashion, and once they run out of time, the game is over.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47xk.jpg'),(11741,'Dino Run','2023-08-04','Platform, Racing, Adventure','Android','Roarrr! Welcome to the epic world of \"Dino Run\", where an unruly dinosaur is on the loose and won\'t stop for anything or anyone. Join our hilarious dino as he races through a prehistoric playground, dodging walls, fences and even crossing bridges like a boss!\n\nYou must watch out for those tricky corners! Make sure you turn correctly or face extinction! And what\'s more fun than demolishing obstacles? Smash those stone walls to pieces, not with your head (silly dinosaur!), but with mighty meteor showers! Take that, you pesky walls!\n\nDevour delicious burgers along the way, run carefully and watch out for water, a dino can\'t swim (who knew?) Let\'s keep our dinosaur dry, shall we?\n\nAre you ready for this wild dinosaur adventure? The fun is endless, just like our dino\'s world!\n\nGo ahead, let\'s run like a dinosaur to victory! Rawrr!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w3j.jpg'),(11742,'Stockwrk7','2022-10-28','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short First Person Horror-Adventure on a single Floor. Explore the Floor and try to solve the riddles. But don\'t get too deep into it. You don\'t know what you\'ll find.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5h9h.jpg'),(11743,'Escape From Boykisser','2024-02-10','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Escape From Boykisser\" is an immersive first-person psychological horror game that throws you into the sterile spaces of the backrooms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rnf.jpg'),(11744,'Hitman World of Assassination Celebrity Bundle','2024-12-12','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Permanently unlock three Celebrity Packs and Elusive Target inspired cosmetics featuring The Undying, The Drop and The Splitter with The Celebrity Bundle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eez.jpg'),(11745,'Dungeon League','2015-07-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dungeon League takes everything that is awesome about dungeon crawling and spews it out as ten minutes of chaotic, multiplayer, party-game action.\n\nThe Dungeon Masters have a new favourite sport: Dungeon League takes everything that is awesome about dungeon crawling and spews it out as ten minutes of chaotic, multiplayer, party-game action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ck8.jpg'),(11746,'Ghost Pirates of Vooju Island','2015-01-27','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mysterious Things are Happening on Vooju Island...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xir.jpg'),(11747,'(Don\'t) Open Your Eyes','2019-03-29','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are trying to fall asleep.\nIn the midst of a silent night, a shadowy being approches your bed.\nYou can\'t see it... but across the darkness of your eyelids, a silhuette forms nonetheless.\nIt seeks one thing: for you to open your eyes, and tell them how they look.\nWill you comply? Or will you refuse to see them for what they are?\nThe choice is yours.\n\n\"(Don\'t) Open Your Eyes\" is a short, horror-themed Visual Novel about a midnight encounter with a mysterious being. Through conversation, you\'ll learn more about them, such as their journey so far, or what they think about themselves. And every now and then, it\'ll make a simple request out of you: to open your eyes.\n\nIt\'s up to you whether to open your eyes or not. It\'s up to you to believe if they\'re really there, or if that whispering voice is only a part of your imagination. Just don\'t keep your visitor waiting for too long.\n\nFeatures:\n\nA chilling tale about a creature\'s eternal search.\nFully-voiced experience.\nChoose how the creature looks like at specific points in the story, with up to 27 possible combinations.\nEach option provides a new bit of dialogue, so be sure to try them all!\nA succint experience, between 30 minutes and 1 hour in length.\nCredits:\n\nWriting and programming was done by me, Daniel \"Via\" Cuturrufo. You can learn more about me by hitting the twitter link on my profile (or here: https://twitter.com/Lumino_Via)\nVoice acting provided by the wonderful David Acosta (link to his twitter: https://twitter.com/CardioPen)\nMonster design and general art by Carolina Cuturrufo (instagram: https://www.instagram.com/hojasdeabril/)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24e5.jpg'),(11748,'Espresso Tycoon & Prison Simulator','2024-10-16','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ezj.jpg'),(11749,'Monster Hunter: World - Iceborne: Master Edition Digital Deluxe','2019-10-01','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This is the Digital Deluxe Edition of \"Monster Hunter World: Iceborne Master Edition,\" a set containing both the main game and the massive \"Iceborne\" expansion.\n\nNew quests, monsters, weapons, armor, story, and the unlocking of an all-new \"master rank\" await to take your hunting to the next level!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ge7.jpg'),(11750,'Totally Convenient','2022-03-04','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A brain-melting multi-tasking eye-hand coordination game. Use all kinds of weird machines and react quickly to throw delicious food to demanding customers! Playable with only 4 buttons in more than 75 levels : That\'s totally convenient!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nkv.jpg'),(11751,'Metroid Planets','2019-12-31','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Metroid Planets is a Fan Remake of the 1986 Nintendo Entertainment System game Metroid created by vacantshade.\n\nIt updates Samus\' movement and adds a saving system, among other features. The game is called Metroid Planets because of its multiple maps. Planet Zebeth is a remake of the original Metroid. Planet Novus is a whole new map with new bosses and new areas. Selecting Planet Enigma will bring you to a room creator and a map generator that uses those rooms to create a world. (If you go to the Discord linked in the game menu, you can download a room pack and upload your own rooms.) The game also has online multiplayer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3r9a.jpg'),(11752,'The Nefargad','2023-12-23','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Nefargad is a thriller, horror, puzzle, and storytelling game that offers a true first-person perspective. The game narrates the story of an archaeologist named Mert, who is kidnapped and imprisoned in a dungeon and his efforts to escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fwe.jpg'),(11753,'Madohi Shiroki no Kamikakushi',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','《雪境迷途遇仙踪》是由日本知名美少女游戏品牌 Lump of Sugar 制作的奇幻恋爱作品。本作由知名画师萌木原文武（代表作《游魂》系列）担当游戏原画与角色设计，由多位业内资深写手共同创作剧本，由知名音乐人新井健史担当音乐制作，主题歌由方糖社当家歌姬Kicco与新锐创作型歌手逢濑晶联袂献唱。','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hhp.jpg'),(11754,'Double Time','2022-01-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Double Time is a very fun and dynamic game. With more time. there are more chances!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5h00.jpg'),(11755,'Sakura Alien','2022-01-10','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Haru is a university student with a passion for the stars. He was content enough to observe space from afar, through a telescope - until a strange girl who claims to be an alien crash lands into him, and claims him for her husband!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h3h.jpg'),(11756,'Dungeon Swappers','2022-07-22','Racing, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Compete with others to see who can build the best dungeon. Then swap dungeons and race to be the first to escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p9h.jpg'),(11757,'Dice Tactics','2021-06-16','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A video game that plays like your favorite tabletop RPG game. With every roll, fate is placed in your hands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gvh.jpg'),(11758,'Kodomo Chousadan Mighty Pockets: Chousa 3 - Kyakusen Queen Patra no Nazo','1998-03-22','Card & Board Game','Satellaview','The third and final episode (investigation) of Kodomo Chousadan Mighty Pockets.\n\nKodomo Chousadan Mighty Pockets is a downloadable 3-part Soundlink game for the Satellaview that was broadcast in at least 2 runs between September 7, 1997 and March 28, 1998.\n\nThe game plays like a board game with a detective motif similar to the game of Clue/Cluedo. The rules of the game however, are considerably different. Throughout the game, SoundLink narration is used; including rapping over Michael Jackson sound samples and remixes of 1950s American Television.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co486i.jpg'),(11759,'The Transference','2024-05-18','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escape from your own house, in which you have been locked up. But be careful, you will not be alone in your captivity. Immerse yourself in this first-person horror adventure, full of family secrets and betrayals. And find out who and why they locked you up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cqv.jpg'),(11760,'Dogness','2018-04-04','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','These dogs have fallen for a breedist dogmagogue. Will they manage become the purest and most homogeneous dog park by selectively breed themselves and control immigration? Help them achieve their glorious destiny!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2udf.jpg'),(11761,'Greyhat: A Digital Detective Adventure','2020-08-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Solve puzzles, gather clues, and complete objectives in this thrilling adventure game where you hack into computers and reveal their deepest, darkest secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lrr.jpg'),(11762,'Dropship: United Peace Force','2025-02-18','Simulator','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ffg.jpg'),(11763,'Zone of Action','2025-03-01','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zone of Action is a cooperative adventure mode where players navigate through tiers of rooms, choosing from various classes that provide unique perks. Players will fight enemies, mini-bosses, and face off against a big boss, all while exploring a rich lore set in both indoor and outdoor environments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dwh.jpg'),(11764,'Faeria: Resurgence','2020-08-13','Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','War rages. Corruption spreads across the world, threatening to taint all things good and pure. New monsters and wicked men flock to the Imperial banner, hoping to share in the spoils of war. Despite suffering great losses, hope blooms in the hearts of those who choose to fight back.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tba.jpg'),(11765,'Classic Racers','2019-03-26','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','There was a time when pilots were TRUE pilots. Be aware, this game is only for the true ones...\n\nDrive furiously fast on gorgeous landscapes and fight against your monstrous cars in this hillclimb racing game that takes place in the 60\'s. A pure Time Attack game where you\'re driving iconic cars from the \"Gentlemen Drivers\" era.\n\nCross the finish line at the top off the hill as fast as possible ! Make the best time to be the best ranked at the world leaderboards.\n\nTaste the feelings of vintage driving in this game with its wondeful graphics and its realistic physics engine.\n\n- 4 car categories (from micro cars to F1)\n- 11 unique tracks with slalom and reversed variations\n- 6 championships\n- International Rankings\n- Simple Controls with minimal aids.\n- Instant fun and entertainment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5a4x.jpg'),(11766,'Destiny 2','2017-10-24','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Dive into the world of Destiny 2 to explore the mysteries of the solar system and experience responsive first-person shooter combat. Unlock powerful elemental abilities and collect unique gear to customize your Guardian\'s look and playstyle. Enjoy Destiny 2’s cinematic story, challenging co-op missions, and a variety of PvP modes alone or with friends. Download for free today and write your legend in the stars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f4v.jpg'),(11767,'Junkyard Empire Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Manage a junkyard and turn scrap into wealth! Buy cars, dismantle them, sell the parts, and build your scrap empire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hvu.jpg'),(11768,'Galaxy Arena','2022-06-28','Strategy','Android','Galaxy Arena Space Battle is an addicting, space war strategy game. Join us in this space odyssey & be part of the guards of galaxy who are protecting the starcitizens in this huge intergalactic space war. Build your starship armada with dreadnoughts & other spaceships. Equip your armada with anti matter, engines & interstellar weapons to protect your space men & starcitizens in your frontier. Enjoy adjustable 3D view of the space war/ battle. Battle against other players in ship vs ship idle combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96kh.jpg'),(11769,'Touhou Tenkuushou: Hidden Star in Four Seasons','2017-11-18','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Touhou Tenkuushou ~ Hidden Star in Four Seasons is the 16th game in the Touhou Project series. It was announced on the developer ZUN\'s blog on April 20, 2017. A playable demo was released on May 7, 2017, at Reitaisai 14, and the full version was released at Comiket 92 on August 11, 2017. The game was released on Steam worldwide on November 17, 2017, becoming the first game in the series to be available on the platform.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73l7.jpg'),(11770,'Conan Exiles: Treasures of Turan Pack','2019-04-30','Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox One','The riches of the eastern kingdom of Turan await! Build opulent palaces adorned with glittering statues, tame rhinos and elephants as pack animals and dress yourself in the dazzling Turanian Phalanx armor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kdl.jpg'),(11771,'G-Mode Archives 37: Moe Slot Beach no Shizuku','2021-07-21','Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Beach fairies appear in the slot! Put out the enchanted \"777\" with your fingers!\n\n\"Moe Slot ☆ Beach no Shizuku\" is a casino-style authentic slot game that incorporates bonus elements such as \"JACK POT\" and \"FACTOR\". During the game, \"Shizuku\" and \"Haruna\" of the \"Beach Volleyball Girl Shizuku\" series will appear, and the adult play will be gorgeous and lovely.\n\nA \"tutorial\" mode that explains the rules in an easy-to-understand manner, which is safe even for beginners, and it can be left alone! Equipped with an \"autoplay\" function that keeps turning the reels automatically.\n\nIf you meet certain conditions, the number of \"Haruna\" costumes will increase, and you can also enjoy dressing up.\n\nPlease enjoy the pleasure of making opportunities and bonuses solid and grabbing a large amount of coins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wxs.jpg'),(11772,'Imperfect',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are not a good person. How did you get here? Use mysterious frames to find your way in a dark and dangerous landscape. The secrets to your redemption may be hidden in its shadows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52pl.jpg'),(11773,'Satch\'s Quest','2005-01-26','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96rk.jpg'),(11774,'Kuukiyomi','2008-06-02','Puzzle, Simulator','Legacy Mobile Device','What if you could try out exactly how considerate to be in life? Kuukiyomi is a social puzzle game in which players try out different responses to social situations. These range from everyday moments, like making room for others on the bus or standing to one side on the escalator, to wilder and silly choices like performing in sync as a backup dancer or joining a Japanese superhero team. Each situation is presented as a fast minigame, similar to the WarioWare series, with no real explanation; players are left to themselves to judge what it is they need to do. There are 100 minigames in all, and after finishing every game players are given a personality reading based on their performance in various categories such as \"social appropriateness\" or \"reaction speed\". After finishing the game once, players unlock the ability to replay any of the stages individually and an endurance competition with three of the different minigames where players have to see how many times they can complete it in a row.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11775,'Expedition Chronicles','2025-04-17','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embark on an adventurous quest through jungles, deserts, and oceans to uncover the lost city of Atlantis. Solve puzzles and unlock ancient secrets!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9geh.jpg'),(11776,'Mega Man Legends','2001-07-01','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, PlayStation','THE BLUE BOMBER BLASTS INTO A WHOLE NEW DIMENSION\n\nMega Man blasts his way into the third dimension in an amazing new adventure. Mega Man Legends combines the best of classic Mega Man action with enormous bosses, a riveting storyline and all the depth of the hottest RPG.\n\nExplore vast 3-D worlds in your quest to find the treasure of all treasures, the Mother Lode. You\'ll love the new 3-D graphics, deadly weapons and non-stop action... unless of course, you\'re a boss.\n\n* Awesome Weapons!\n* Diabolical Bosses!\n* Legendary Gameplay!\n* Non-Stop 3-D Action!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55ci.jpg'),(11777,'SCP: Rulebreaker','2024-01-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into the heart of horror with this survival game inspired by the mysterious SCP Foundation. After the opening of Site 1730, once the stronghold of the Foundation, chaos has erupted. All sites, except Sites 15 and 19, have been abandoned, converging towards Complex 1730. An unprecedented concentration of anomalies released during a containment breach has left the complex in a state of desolation. Step into the shoes of a Foundation guard, facing the ultimate survival challenge as the horrors of anomalies threaten to engulf everything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hle.jpg'),(11778,'Gravity Rush','2012-02-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation Vita','Gain a new perspective as you take on the role of Kat, a strong-willed girl seeking the means to protect her future in a world that’s crumbling to pieces. Tilt and move the PlayStation Vita System, taking gravity into your own hands to deliver devastating attacks, uncover the secrets to your past and explore a mysterious world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tgy.jpg'),(11779,'Violet and...',NULL,'Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45rv.jpg'),(11780,'Cities: Skylines - Deluxe Edition','2015-03-10','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Cities: Skylines is a modern take on the classic city simulation genre. The game introduces new game play elements to realize the thrill and hardships of creating and maintaining a real city whilst expanding on some well-established tropes of the city building experience. From the makers of the Cities in Motion franchise, the game boasts a fully realized transport system. It also includes the ability to mod the game to suit your play style as a fine counter balance to the layered and challenging simulation. You\'re only limited by your imagination, so take control and reach for the sky!\n\nIncluded in the Deluxe Edition are 5 In-game historical monuments from around the world, the games original soundtrack, and a digital art book.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8icf.jpg'),(11781,'Jerry Glanville\'s Pigskin Footbrawl','1990-12-31','Sport','Arcade, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Pigskin 621AD is a sort of dark-ages-medieval-fantasy-style combat rugby game in which two five-player teams take to the field to compete in a game of \"footbrawl,\" all the while dodging rocks, trees, pools, pits, furniture and other obstacles. Each player controls the team captain of one of the teams. The original coin-op cabinet was set up with two joysticks and one screen, with both players sharing that same screen; if either player\'s team captain falls off the screen, he is quickly able to catch up and get back into the action.\n\nA version for the Sega Genesis, retitled Pigskin Footbrawl and endorsed by coach Jerry Glanville, was released by Razor Soft','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5muj.jpg'),(11782,'A Total War Saga: Troy - Ajax & Diomedes','2021-09-02','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Forge your legacy on the Aegean battlefields with the new DLC for A Total War Saga: TROY! Jump into the fray as two of the most iconic heroes of the age, Ajax & Diomedes, with their unique armies, mighty Paragon units, and new methods to conquer Troy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xwc.jpg'),(11783,'Doll','2019-11-14','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doll is a visual novel of horror and exploration.With the Jeudille doll, you will be free to explore the city of Lorgna. Talk to the inhabitants, and compare their speeches to succeed in answering the questions raised by this experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ous.jpg'),(11784,'Witoru','2010-06-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Witoru / Neta Dream is a Yume Nikki fangame. It stars Yon Goh and seems to be a parody of other Yume Nikki fangames. It is one of the the first fangames to have a male protagonist, as well as one of the first to feature dialogue.\n\nIt is slightly different than most fangames but it still heavily focuses on exploration and collecting Effects, as well as containing puzzles and battles. In addition, there is an option to buy items, with some being consumables that increase stats and others which are essential for progressing the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rsy.jpg'),(11785,'Havoc Runner','2020-08-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Havoc Runner\" is a futuristic action and 2D platform game that will take you to Titan\'s moon to face killers robots, missile launchers, and automated weapons in a hostile environment where you must find and destroy the Tupan computer, preventing a missile attack on the planets of the solar system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4282.jpg'),(11786,'Dragon Ball FighterZ: Vegeta','2018-08-08','Fighting','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The untamable Saiyan Prince won\'t hesitate to show his raw strength to anyone trying to confront him!\n\nThis content includes:\n- Vegeta as a new playable character\n- 5 alternative colors for his outfit\n- Vegeta Lobby Avatar\n- Vegeta Z Stamp','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vch.jpg'),(11787,'Escape from Darkness','2024-02-13','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escape from Darkness is a single player, first person survival horror game. After waking up alone in a strange, eerie place. You must plunge into the oppressive darkness ignorant of what awaits. Use stealth to avoid danger, but don\'t play it too safe. You will also need to investigate your surroundings and find resources to fight the horrors that lurk in the gloom around you. Persevere, and make your way out alive in this horrifying experience. Are you brave enough to Escape from the Darkness?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rky.jpg'),(11788,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s: Sister Location','2020-07-10','Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Circus Baby\'s Pizza World, where family fun and interactivity go beyond anything you\'ve seen at those *other* pizza places! With cutting-edge animatronic entertainers that will knock your kids\' socks off, as well as customized pizza catering, no party is complete without Circus Baby and the gang!\n\nNow hiring: Late night technician. Must enjoy cramped spaces and be comfortable around active machinery. Not responsible for death or dismemberment.\n\nDon\'t hold it against us.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7206.jpg'),(11789,'WRC 9: Toyota Corolla 1999','2021-03-11','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Nintendo Switch','The 1999 champion Toyota Corolla WRC has had the most prestigious drivers behind the wheel and reached the podium in 95% of the races it took part in! A genuine 90s icon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sh3.jpg'),(11790,'Lost Traces: Unsolved Cases - False Awakening','2023-12-23','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lost Traces: Unsolved Cases - False Awakening is an indie atmospheric horror game that puts a lot of emphasis on storytelling and puzzle-solving.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jdc.jpg'),(11791,'Dead by Daylight','2020-10-01','Strategy','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dead by Daylight is an asymmetrical multiplayer (4vs1) horror game where one player takes on the role of the savage Killer, and the other four players play as Survivors, trying to escape the Killer and avoid being caught and killed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zky.jpg'),(11792,'Tetsuman Gaiden','1996-12-31','Puzzle','Mac, Apple Pippin','Game for kids featuring Tetsuman, developed for the Apple Pippin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6atj.jpg'),(11793,'Deadly Premonition','2010-03-11','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Playing as special agent Francis York Morgan (call him York – everyone else does), it’s your job to investigate the brutal murder of a young local beauty in the town of Greenvale. Amidst the backdrop of soaring mountains and a small American suburb, York must solve the mystery of the Red Seed Murders and stay alive in a place where supernatural creatures and a mysterious raincoat-clad, axe-wielding killer seek to end his investigation for good.\n\nPart suspense-filled horror, part action-adventure game, Deadly Premonition offers an open-world experience packed with locals to meet and places to discover, as well as numerous side quests and mini-games that will help you solve the murders and uncover Greenvale’s deepest, darkest secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2saz.jpg'),(11794,'CorActio',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','CorActio is a 2D platformer with puzzle elements set in an alternate, polluted version of our world. Developed by the indie studio Delusional Ram, this game immerses players in a mission to cleanse the environment from the relentless industrial pollution.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8eod.jpg'),(11795,'Pokémon Tetris',NULL,'Puzzle','Pokémon mini','Pokémon Tetris is a game released as part of Pokémon mini. It has only been released in Japan and Europe. It was classified by the ESRB as E for Everyone under the title Pokémon Mini Shock Tetris, but was never released in the United States.\n\nThe game is inspired by Tetris.\n\nThe game consists of several variations of the main game of Tetris with varying levels of difficulty. This game also allows most bricks to be Flipped by shaking the Pokémon mini. In all one player and VS. games, a silhouette of a Pokémon will be shown on the right hand side of the screen; if the player can make a match of 4 or more lines, the Pokémon will be captured and added to the in-game Pokédex. The player has a limited time to capture the Pokémon before it is replaced by another one chosen at random.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bdd.jpg'),(11796,'Deep','2019-12-27','Shooter','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','DEEP is a classic style FPS game heavily inspired by works such as DOOM, Quake, Dusk and the original Half Life. The game takes place in the not-so-distant future at a top-secret military research base, deep in the Atlantic Ocean. After Lovecraftian horrors are unleashed, you\'re the only one capable of cleaning up the mess.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i7t.jpg'),(11797,'Papa\'s Mocharia to Go!','2021-03-02','Simulator, Strategy','Android, iOS','Papa\'s Mocharia To Go! is the fifteenth gameria in the Papa Louie restaurant time-management series, and is also the fifteenth To Go! game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ahu.jpg'),(11798,'Tactical Nexus','2019-11-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','[BIG VOLUME PUZZLE RPGs/魔塔]It is a game to explore puzzle dungeon that takes more than several hours in one play.There are 12 dungeons, and by purchasing all DLCs, the total number of dungeons will be 60.You can get items according to the dungeon\'s score, and you can use the items in other dungeons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42ul.jpg'),(11799,'Echoes III','2018-09-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Echoes is back with a bang and in 3D! More intense and eye bleeding than before, with the action coming at you from the sides, above and below.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3prn.jpg'),(11800,'Total NBA \'97',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11801,'Space Fever','1979-06-01','Shooter, Puzzle, Arcade','Arcade','Shoot aliens as they move across the screen. Shoot the spaceship for extra points. Choose one of three games.\n\nSpace Fever is a 1979 arcade game by Nintendo R&D2. Some sources claim that Ikegami Tsushinki also did design work on Space Fever. It was released in both monochrome and color versions. The gameplay is similar to Space Invaders, which had been released by Taito in 1978. It was distributed by Far East Video.\n\nThe gameplay of Space Fever is reminiscent of Space Invaders (1978), where the player controls a laser cannon situated at the bottom of the screen and must defeat waves of enemy aliens. The aliens are arranged in rows and slowly move to the edge of the screen, before descending and continuing in the opposite direction. As more aliens are defeated, they increase in speed. A UFO will occasionally appear towards the top of the screen, which can be shot down for bonus points. There are three game modes that change the way the aliens move; the first presents two formations of enemies that move in opposite directions, the second continuously adds additional rows of aliens, and the third is functionally identical to Space Invaders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x38.jpg'),(11802,'Kattastick','2017-03-15','Sin género','Xbox One','The Adventure of Kattastick takes place in the world of fantasy with many levels to solve, where our hero will have to test all his skill and dexterity to get to the end of everything.\nThis is the first of a series of adventures that will face our hero.\n\nThe story.\nThere was once, a long time ago, a cat in love with a princess...\nKattastick is looking for the magic boots that will give him the title of Baronet of the Cats. With this title he will be able to enter the upper middle class of the felines and finally ask the hand of Princess Penelope, the cat of which she is madly in love. But the king of the felines and father of Penelope has other plans for his daughter and does not agree to give his hand to any cat.\n\nKattastick discovers that the boots are found in the world of fantasy and so immediately starts to their research.\nWhen the king is informed that Kattastick has started searching for the magic boots, he sends his henchmen to the fantasy world to sabotage his journey and prevent him from finding them.\n\nThe game.\nThe game is very simple, you have to bring Kattastick to the end of the world of fantasy, paying attention to the monsters that populate those lands but not only. The movements are few and simple, left, right, jump and shoot. Some monsters kill them jumping over other shooting and others you won\'t be able to kill them.\n\nDuring your adventure you will have to collect the rings that you need for the bonus and not only.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co698w.jpg'),(11803,'Phantom: Covert Ops','2020-06-25','Shooter, Adventure','Oculus VR, Meta Quest 2, Oculus Rift, Oculus Quest','Stealth Has Evolved\n\nYou are a Phantom: an elite and deadly covert operative with a single night to prevent all-out war.\n\nDispatched into remote, hostile wetlands in your tactical kayak, utilise military-grade weapons and equipment to evade and neutralise the enemy threat. Immerse yourself in a gritty and authentic arena of war across an intense campaign in VR. Engage your targets lethally or infiltrate unnoticed from within the shadows: it’s your mission to execute your own way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mu1.jpg'),(11804,'The Wanted Man\'s House','2023-11-30','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In \"The Wanted Man\'s House,\" plunge into the shadows of a slasher suspense, inspired by iconic horror films from the \'80s and \'90s. Take on the role of Mason, a daring adventurer in pursuit of fame, determined to break into the infamous residence of the sought-after killer known as \"Baby Face.\"\n\nThe story unfolds as Mason, armed with courage and a camera, discovers that the location of the house has been inadvertently revealed by his own friends. His goal? Record every chilling moment to expose the terror in the city\'s newspaper. However, things take an unexpected turn when Baby Face returns home. Are you ready to face the nightmare?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oe7.jpg'),(11805,'Metroid Prime: Trilogy','2009-08-24','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Wii, Wii U','In this compilation that bundles all three landmark Metroid Prime games, experience the danger and high-intense action of facing space alone as you play skilled bounty hunter, Samus Aran.\n\nIn Metroid Prime, explore the world of Tallon IV and witness the deadly experiments performed by the remaining Space Pirates. In Metroid Prime 2, investigate the hostile activities between twin planets Aether and Dark Aether, and learn of their shared energy source that is vital to their survival. In Metroid Prime 3, discover the dangers of a sentient virus that has almost obliterated the Galactic Federation\'s network, and face the darkness within...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co404a.jpg'),(11806,'Final Fantasy XVI: Deluxe Edition','2023-06-22','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 5','Deluxe Edition includes the following:\n- The base game\n- Special Clive Steelbook Case\n- Cloth map of Valisthea','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62ey.jpg'),(11807,'Neural Dominion',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A brutal cyberpunk 4X turn-based strategy game with JRPG combat. Take control of one of 5 gangs in Technograd — a dark, crime-ridden city where getting to the top is the only thing that matters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vxw.jpg'),(11808,'Joy and Me','2023-12-27','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Joy and me is a horror video game saga with events based on real events. Each chapter of the saga has things based on real events, both personal and paranormal problems, this saga has been developing for 7 years, and is practically almost ready for its premiere.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kfm.jpg'),(11809,'Station Haven 3','2025-02-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are the lucky winner of a Space Research program aboard Station Haven 3! Join the station and the crew to learn and explore the dark side of Mars!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f3g.jpg'),(11810,'Family Guy Video Game!','2006-10-16','Fighting, Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Xbox, PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','This game is based on the animated television series Family Guy. It was also released for the PlayStation 2 and the original Xbox.\n\nThe game is split into 22 levels for the three playable characters: Peter, Stewie or Brian. Peter and Stewie have eight levels, while Brian has six. Each character has his own unique style of play.\n\nA key feature of the game are mini-games done in the same style as the cutaway gags that the show is famous for, usually lasting less than 10 seconds. The mini-games often repeat cutaway gags from the shows, such as Peter inexplicably burning his hand in a waffle iron. Successfully completing the mini-game offers a bonus: Brian becomes invisible for a short period, while Peter and Stewie receive power-ups for their respective abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ouv.jpg'),(11811,'Malmyr','2020-12-21','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Malmyr is a hybrid of city building and automation games. In contrast to other well known games of these genres the player is not meant to build the biggest city or largest factory. Malmyr\'s gameplay is focused on logic and creativity to accomplish the game\'s challenges. Each of the 12 missions of Malmyr\'s storyline have their own look & feel and compel the player to learn something new. Especially the quite unique resource transport mechanics stand out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kew.jpg'),(11812,'Magnia','2020-01-09','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A game with unique gameplay based on working with gravity and magnetism. Players will work with broken objects in zero gravity, build improvised towers, balance scales, destroy ensembles and use real-world physics to solve complicated puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3msz.jpg'),(11813,'Captain Soda',NULL,'Shooter, Platform, Tactical, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Captain Soda is a charming soda-themed arcade arena shooter about refreshing chemical warfare. Wield weaponized soft drinks to defend earth from waves of invading aliens!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ih9.jpg'),(11814,'BigFool','2024-07-08','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A small little game where your friends and you have a once in a lifetime opportunity: Hunt BigFool. BigFool is an elusive, fearsome creature of the night from unknown origins. Explore the Crimblr Forest and various points of interest, keep an eye and an ear out, and take down this iconic beast.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8grm.jpg'),(11815,'Xenosaga Episode I: Der Wille zur Macht - Reloaded','2003-11-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 2','\"Xenosaga Episode I Reloaded\" is a re-release of Xenosaga Episode 1 exclusively in Japan. This version, including the English voice work, additional costumes and bonus features, was released on November 20, 2003.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5iqz.jpg'),(11816,'Marvel Spider-Man','1991-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','A handheld game based on Spider-Man.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98hy.jpg'),(11817,'BattleSky VR','2018-01-19','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BattleSky VR is a Multiplayer VR game at its core, bringing MOBA style gameplay to the VR platform. Each player picks a Hero with vastly different size, powers and gameplay style to engage in fast-paced aerial combats against other players. Play online against other players with classic Team Deathmatch, Capture The Flag, and other teamplay modes of up to 4v4 players! Each Hero has a single player and co-op mission mode where you\'ll learn the back story about the Heroes, and get familiar with the controls and the unique Flying Locomotion mechanism.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23ws.jpg'),(11818,'Sonder','2024-02-15','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience an innovative co-op adventure where two players have to work together. Engage in collaborative puzzle solving and dynamic combat with each player having unique abilities. Delve into a psychological narrative that explores the essence of humanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81sr.jpg'),(11819,'The Legend of Heroes: Trails of Cold Steel IV - Standard Costume Bundle','2021-04-09','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Nintendo Switch','A set of costumes and accessories perfect for those seeking new looks and classic styles alike (Altina\'s Black Rabbit Costume x 1, Rean\'s Military Uniform x 1, Kurt\'s Military Uniform x 1, Ash\'s Military Uniform x 1...)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t9v.jpg'),(11820,'Afterburn','2019-12-11','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your daily dose of air combat. Super easy to pick up, minimum requirements and vibrant visuals. Select your aircraft and jump into action!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l3i.jpg'),(11821,'Marvel\'s Spider-Man: Miles Morales - Ultimate Launch Edition','2020-11-12','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 5','In the latest adventure in the Marvel’s Spider-Man universe, teenager Miles Morales is adjusting to his new home while following in the footsteps of his mentor, Peter Parker, as a new Spider-Man. But when a fierce power struggle threatens to destroy his new home, the aspiring hero realizes that with great power, there must also come great responsibility. To save all of Marvel’s New York, Miles must take up the mantle of Spider-Man and own it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h9t.jpg'),(11822,'Starship Simulator',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Step aboard a fully-simulated, realistic starship with 200+ rooms over 7 decks.\n\nExplore a 1:1 scale galaxy driven by real astrophysics, in real-time, either solo or with friends.\n\nStarsim has a lot to offer any space game fan, from Captaining a starship, to cooking for the crew. You\'ll have many things to repair in engineering and hopefully, not too many injuries in medical!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yq3.jpg'),(11823,'Stranger of Sword City Revisited','2017-02-28','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation Vita','From the present day, to the parallel world. Survive in the land of polar night!\n\nThe tried and true fundamental charms of the dungeon RPG genre, such as character creation, dungeon exploring, and item collecting, have been fully refined.\n\nThe minds behind many other hit games in the genre bring you an experience which you can enjoy to your heart\'s content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i3h.jpg'),(11824,'Living Legends: The Red Trace Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11825,'Beek: Familiar Spirit - Remastered','2025-04-18','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A call for help within a mysterious messaging app. Someone lost and wandering through a forest in a faraway place. And their destiny in your hands.\n\nBeek: How I Became a Familiar Spirit and Everything After That is a text-based narrative experience from the creators of Nekojishi. Featuring dozens of branching paths, multiple endings, and CG\'s to unlock!\n\nHelp Beek seek a way home, and face the darkness of this world with strength and courage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rdw.jpg'),(11826,'Genshin Impact','2020-09-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Genshin Impact is an open-world action RPG, where you embark on a journey across Teyvat to find your lost sibling and seek answers from The Seven, the gods of each element. Explore this wondrous world, join forces with a diverse range of characters, and unravel the countless mysteries that Teyvat holds...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co480t.jpg'),(11827,'Knights of Grumthorr','2020-10-21','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Real-time strategy and tactics in a fantasy world of knights and magic! Command heroes, soldiers and mages to battle against the armies of darkness. Grumthorr needs you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44k0.jpg'),(11828,'Mario Paint BS Ban','1997-08-03','Point-and-click, Music','Satellaview','Mario Paint BS Ban is a version of Mario Paint which had joypad support. For this release of the game, a Mario Paint contest was held, in which contestants of exceptional Mario Paint artistic skill made artwork pieces.\n\nMario Paint BS Ban - Yuushou Sakuhin Naizou Version (「マリオペイントＢＳ版 (優勝作品内蔵バージョン)」) was a second downloadable version for the Satellaview that ran between December 28, 1997 and January 31, 1998. It is a modified version of the original Mario Paint BS Ban that includes the winning design from the associated \"Mario Paint Contest\". The winning picture was designed by a Tokyo-based gamer named Hiroko Mizota (溝田 祐子), and it is entitled \"Dreaming of the Moon.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3120.jpg'),(11829,'West Somerset Railway Route',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11830,'Fire Emblem: Shadow Dragon and the Blade of Light','2020-12-03','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Nintendo Switch','The official localization for the original Fire Emblem which was only available until March 31st, 2021.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z4z.jpg'),(11831,'Pako: Car Chase Simulator','2014-10-22','Racing, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Pako: Car Chase Simulator is a tough as nails arcade driving game where you try to survive as long as possible without crashing your car in a police chase situation. Controls are simple, there is constant acceleration and choice to boost or brake a bit. One hit and you are dead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24q3.jpg'),(11832,'Airship Dragoon','2014-07-02','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Conquer the super-continent of Pangea with an invasion of Airships. Battle Dastardly Pirate Insurgents and keep the locals happy or they will be revolting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s9f.jpg'),(11833,'Modest Kind','2017-12-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Modest Kind is a Rogue-lite Initiation Adventure. Ever heard of Entropy, The Selfish Gene and Schrödinger\'s cat? This action-heavy, story-driven top-down dungeon crawler will put your knowledge to the test. Your Path to Enlightment begins now.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/aw4kwlstdfyszppclyfb.jpg'),(11834,'Until Sunset','2021-01-18','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','There are three things all wise men fear: the sea in storm, a night with no moon, and the anger of a gentle man.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pcu.jpg'),(11835,'Anomaly Investigations','2024-04-15','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a game that\'s inspired by The Exit 8 which is an evolution of games like Observation Duty. It\'s a little atmospheric and creepy, but not too scary. You need to traverse the location and remember how things were, each loop through the location, things can change. Sometimes the change is super obvious, sometimes super subtle. Sometimes there\'s no change at all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co842s.jpg'),(11836,'Vertigrowl',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11837,'Giga Wrecker','2017-02-06','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Giga Wrecker is a 2D puzzle-platform action game developed and published by Game Freak. You play as a cyborg girl, who has the power of reconstructing debris and scraps into various weapons, and explore a world invaded by an army of mysterious robots.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5462.jpg'),(11838,'Killer',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Kill them all (KILL). Kill figures to gain points, upgrade your character with perks and debuffs, repeat the process of killing gaining and upgrading, win by achieving the highest score. Kill, Gain Upgrade, Repeat, Win.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ijj.jpg'),(11839,'Connect Bricks','2021-07-09','Puzzle, Strategy, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Connect bricks with matching colors and cover the entire board with bricks to solve each puzzle. But watch out, connections will break if they cross or overlap! Each puzzle has a grid of squares with colored bricks occupying some of the squares. The objective is to connect bricks of the same color by drawing connections between them such that the entire grid is occupied by bricks. However, connections may not intersect. Difficulty is determined by the size of the grid, ranging from 5x5 to 14x14 squares. Play through more than 2000 puzzless. Connect Bricks gameplay ranges from simple and relaxed, to challenging and frenetic. This puzzle game is a great mind practice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ds8.jpg'),(11840,'Wanted: Dead or Alive','2025-03-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the Wild West with Wanted: Dead or Alive, a fast-paced puzzle game that will put your observation skills to the test. Your mission: spot the wanted outlaw among a crowd of ever-moving cowboys. As you progress, the challenge intensifies—time speeds up, and a single mistake could cost you your bounty. With its simple yet addictive gameplay, Wanted: Dead or Alive will push your reflexes and focus to the limit. Can you catch all the bandits before they vanish into the crowd?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gur.jpg'),(11841,'Escape from Voyna','2018-05-10','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escape from Voyna is an action packed realistic single player shooter set in the era of the Cold War on russian soil. After many nuclear tests the land is devastated and apocalypse spreading. You, a secret agent stranded on an island try to escape without getting caught by enemy soldiers. StoryDuring the time of the Cold War the major powers attempt to secure their power by attempting to build the biggest and best nuclear weapons. Those were tested on remote islands. Due to a misfortune, you land on one of those islands. As an american secret agent you must not be caught by the russian special forces of the RSWS.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11842,'Hearthstone: Blackrock Mountain','2015-04-02','Strategy, Tactical','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Blackrock Mountain is Hearthstone\'s second adventure.\nHome to Ragnaros the Firelord and his fire elementals, Nefarian and the black dragonflight, and an army of Dark Iron dwarves, the adventure features 5 wings, with 17 boss encounters in total, and provides 31 new collectible cards for players to add to their collections, as well as a new card backs and a new battlefield. The adventure features a Heroic mode and 9 Class Challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1he9.jpg'),(11843,'Totally Reliable Delivery Service','2020-04-01','Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Delivery Attempted. That\'s the Totally Reliable Delivery Service guarantee! T.R.D.S. is a ragdoll physics simulation about terrible package delivery couriers. Work together using odd machinery, useful gadgets, and the wonders of physics to reliably deliver packages to their destination.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uwi.jpg'),(11844,'Contract Killer 2: Shadow Conspiracy','2012-10-24','Shooter','Android, iOS','You are Jack Griffin, the ultimate Contract Killer. Experience an intense, international storyline combining long-range kill shots and close-range melee attacks. To survive in this line of work, you have to sneak your way in, shoot your way out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uiy.jpg'),(11845,'Pokémon Home','2020-02-12','Sin género','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','With this application, all your Pokémon can be brought over to one home.\nWorks on with Android/iOS, Nintendo 3DS (Pokémon Bank), Nintendo Switch and Pokémon GO.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n5b.jpg'),(11846,'TheHunter: Call of the Wild - Ultimate Hunting Bundle','2024-11-11','Sin género','Xbox One','With the Ultimate Hunting Bundle, you\'re ready for anything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ee0.jpg'),(11847,'A Park Full of Cats','2024-09-09','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to \'A Park Full of Cats,\' a hidden object game that invites you to revel in the enchanting world of amusement parks! Experience the thrill and excitement of the rides and give those cats the fun they truly deserve!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vqp.jpg'),(11848,'A Total War Saga: Troy - Amazons','2021-09-02','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Harness the power of the Amazon warriors in the first DLC for A Total War Saga: TROY. Enjoy two new factions; new epic heroes Hippolyta and Penthesilea; new female-only unit rosters; three new faction mechanics; two new epic mission chains, and more!With a Horde army at your side, roam the world and capture new settlements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xwb.jpg'),(11849,'Perfect Dark','2010-03-17','Shooter','Xbox 360','Perfect Dark is a remastered release of the first-person shooter video game by the same name. Developed by 4J Studios and published by Microsoft Game Studios a decade after the original\'s 2000 release, the remaster features several technical improvements, including higher resolution textures and models, a higher frame rate, and a multiplayer mode that supports the Xbox Live online service. It was released for the Xbox 360 video game console in March 2010, through the Xbox Live Arcade download service. The story of the game follows Joanna Dark, an agent of the Carrington Institute organization, as she attempts to stop a conspiracy by rival corporation dataDyne.\n\nPerfect Dark was under development for nearly a year and its game engine was completely re-written from scratch to support several Xbox 360 features. Therefore, although the game plays exactly the same as the original, the code and renderer is different. The game received generally favorable reviews. Some critics considered the relatively unchanged game to be outdated, but most agreed that the title was a solid revival of a classic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yib.jpg'),(11850,'Blood Bar Tycoon','2025-02-04','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blood Bar Tycoon is a vampire bar management game. Build bars and blood factories, lure humans to harvest their blood, process it, and serve your customers: other vampires. Research quirky machines and deal with hunters! Expand through Crimson City to become a mighty Elder!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s0p.jpg'),(11851,'Resident Evil 2','2024-12-10','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','Resident Evil 2 is a remake of 1998\'s Resident Evil 2. The game was not developed with the intent of improving the original, but rather a reimagining of the original story with redesigned maps, characters and story elements. Gameplay mechanics are more similar to Resident Evil 7: Biohazard though with the use of an over-the-shoulder camera.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ir3.jpg'),(11852,'Resident Evil Village: Gold Edition','2022-10-28','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Resident Evil Village: Gold Edition includes the base game with 3 additional major new features:\n- Third Person Mode allows you to play the main story mode from a new perspective\n- The Mercenaries Additional Orders introduces new playable characters and stages\n- Shadows of Rose continues the story of Ethan\'s daughter Rosemary','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qwq.jpg'),(11853,'Project Atlas','2022-02-13','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Project Atlas is set in a futuristic era on mars. The game has 3 factions (Corporate, Civilian, Government). In the first stage all 3 factions need to create a basic infrastructure firs for to survive and if they save enough material they can go in phase 2 where they can build more and bigger machinery with automation. The game is in FPS or in the future you can play it in VR too!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o7k.jpg'),(11854,'Starwhal','2014-09-29','Fighting, Sport, Indie','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, Xbox One','The local multi-player space narwhal fighting game that has rocked the internet is finally ready for its big debut in a fully loaded release! Flop it out with 2-4 players in a retro, epic narwhal battle in space! The heart-piercing action is furious and unrelenting. Starwhal will change your life. Inspired by countless couch-gaming gatherings over the decades, we wanted to bring something competitive, creative, and immediately fun to the table. Our original prototype was conceived and developed in 48 hours with focus entirely on these areas. From that came the phenomenon that is Starwhal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2218.jpg'),(11855,'Mario Superstar Baseball','2005-07-21','Sport','Nintendo GameCube','The superstars of the Mushroom Kingdom have gathered on the diamond to power up America\'s game! Pick a captain, fill your team with your favorite characters from the Mario universe, then hit the field. Each captain has a special Star Skill for pitching and batting, so whether you\'re hurling fireballs as Mario or blasting curving banana-ball dingers as DK, you\'ve never played ball like this!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tml.jpg'),(11856,'The Hippo G','2022-08-17','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52ll.jpg'),(11857,'Cities: Skylines - Content Creator Pack: Art Deco','2016-09-01','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Add to your city\'s style with a pack of new buildings from one of Cities: Skylines\' top modders! Matt \"Shroomblaze\" Crux has designed a series of Deco-inspired buildings exclusive to this pack, including 6 residential buildings, 6 commercial buildings, and 3 unique buildings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8348.jpg'),(11858,'X-Plane 12: Aerosoft - Airport Milano Malpensa','2023-06-30','Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Brughiera plains to the north-west of Milano rank as the cradle of Italian aircraft construction. Today, Milano-Malpensa is one of merely a few airports left in this historic region. Malpensa is the second largest airport in Italy and serves as a hub for Alitalia, the largest Italian airline.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11859,'The Ormus Saga II: Guild of Death','1993-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','Commodore C64/128/MAX','It is January, 7th 1228 in Beryland - Two years after you have successfully defeated Lord Marox, and the Ormus Cult, a new adventure is awaiting our hero. A far more challenging task lies ahead. After reading the Compendium you know of the black Book called Ulbore. The Book has finally revealed the terrible truth about Sullivan and the Brotherhood of the White Rose. It is now up to you to complete 9 tasks provided by God Servants in order to rescue the Kingdom from the Armageddon. You only have appr. 12 months to do so. When the year has passed and you could not manage to enter the Eternal Halls of Carion, the game is over.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11860,'Ghostbane','2024-10-06','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','GHOSTBANE is a game where you act as Paranormal Hunters. Your mission is to identify and neutralize various types of ghosts appearing in different locations. You can try your luck alone, but it\'s better to work in teams of 2-4 people. Solve this paranormal world using your equipment. Identify the types and beliefs of ghosts. By doing so, you can perform a ritual and trap them. Remember, teamwork and utilizing the strengths of each team member will shape your success. Are you ready, hunters?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hkt.jpg'),(11861,'Ceres','2021-01-22','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beautiful ladies are waiting for you in the blockbuster world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mzi.jpg'),(11862,'Ai To Noroi: School Simulator','2023-05-30','Simulator','Android','This is a story about 6 girls, very close friends, which were fond of mythical and demonic mysteries. One day they went into an old book store, and found a very old book. Despite it was incredibly expensive, they bought it. Then, one of the girls was chosen to keep the book at home. Serious consequences followed...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zct.jpg'),(11863,'Yochi',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11864,'Outriders: Day One Edition','2021-04-01','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The DAY ONE EDITION includes: \n- OUTRIDERS Game \n- The Hell’s Rangers Male and Female Gear Sets. \n- The Hell’s Rangers Arsenal of 11 unique Guns. \n- The Hell’s Rangers Truck Mods and Decals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t9i.jpg'),(11865,'911: Prey','2024-11-28','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Search items and solve puzzles to escape from the cannibal\'s plate. Cover up your tracks so that the maniac does not suspect anything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6y6s.jpg'),(11866,'The Jumping Sandwich','2022-07-01','Simulator','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xkj.jpg'),(11867,'Total War: Warhammer - Grey Wizard','2016-12-08','Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Grey Wizard is a Empire missile infantry unit. It is best not to speak ill of the Grey, for they are everywhere and nowhere all at once.\n\nDisciples of the College of The Grey Order, Grey Wizards study Ulgu, The Lore of Shadows. It is an illusive Lore that twists the minds of its targets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uaz2t86hljd7tnuikf2j.jpg'),(11868,'Twisting Mower','2019-05-22','Racing, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Lawn mower cart race!? This is race game that competes by time attack with people around the world. The place where you cut the lawn can run fast. Let\'s aim for the fastest record on the changing track. Run with the ghost of the time attack record of players all over the world and aim for the ranking first place!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11869,'Memory Link','2023-01-27','Platform, Adventure','Xbox One','A heartwarming story of a boy chasing memories of a dreamy girl. Explore a mysterious world in this stylish platformer game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7njq.jpg'),(11870,'War','1999-12-31','Sin género','Family Computer','War is an unlicensed arcade-like game made for the Famicom by Hummer Team.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6p4z.jpg'),(11871,'Alien Rage: Unlimited','2013-09-24','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Unleash a fury of powerful weapons as you blast your way through armies of Alien forces hell-bent on taking you down! Battle through 14 intense levels and prepare to face a barrage of beastly-sized bosses that will test your every skill. Each of your 10 weapons comes with two firing modes and you’ll need all of them! Battle hardened Alien forces will attack you from every direction using various flanking and attack moves. Built with powerful up-to-date graphics technology, awesome physics, destructible environments… experience a truly intense, oldschool styled shooter game!Key Features\nWide variety of Alien enemy forces including Infantry, Warriors, Flying Drones, Spiders\nHuge boss fights – Over 21 enemy types including 8 beastlysized bosses to challenge and destroy through 14 Levels\nStrong thru-the-gun experience with 10 powerful weapons each with two firing modes\nSkill shots, head shots and shooting accuracy heavily rewarded\nPlayer-triggered destruction of environments and cover helps to advance through levels\nBuilt with powerful up-to-date graphics technology, awesome physics, destructible environments','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lci.jpg'),(11872,'For Honor: Complete Edition','2018-12-18','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','This compilation of the For Honor games contains:\n\n- For Honor\n- For Honor: Marching Fire Expansion\n- For Honor: Year 1 - Heroes Bundle\n- For Honor: Year 3 Pass','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8iss.jpg'),(11873,'Sky Revolver','2025-04-25','Shooter, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Sky Revolver is a guns blazing old-school shoot-em-up game just like they did in ‘90s! You play as a hotheaded space pilot destined to destroy the evil Empire. Your main goal is to survive through the endless waves of enemy spaceships and shuttles and to defeat the high command!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r5x.jpg'),(11874,'Layers of Fear','2023-06-15','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac','A remake of the original Layers of Fear and its DLC, as well as a new DLC from the perspective of the painter\'s wife. This remake in Unreal Engine 5 adds new core mechanics and features to blend the chapters together seamlessly.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lnj.jpg'),(11875,'Noroi E: Darkness','2024-09-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In \"Noroi E: Darkness\", you immerse yourself in the shoes of Detective Juárez, a private detective who has been investigating paranormal cases since he was fired from the police department. One night, you receive a desperate call from a mother worried about the disappearance of her son, Oscar García, in a small, bleak town in northern Mexico called Santa Anna.\n\nArriving at the scene, you find a gloomy environment, decrepit buildings and an atmosphere full of mystery. Your mission is to discover what happened to Oscar and solve the dark secret behind his disappearance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fci.jpg'),(11876,'Escape From Complex 32','2022-05-30','Indie, Arcade','Playdate','Escape with your crank controlled laser!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68q2.jpg'),(11877,'Nelly Cootalot: Spoonbeaks Ahoy! HD','2019-05-23','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nelly Cootalot is the stupidly named pirate adventurer with a heart of gold. Uncover corruption and wanton punning in this HD revival of a classic freeware adventure game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2476.jpg'),(11878,'Barbie: Magic Hair Styler','1997-10-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Choose either Barbie, Kira, Christie or Teresa and style her just the way you want.\n\nCustomize her hair (cut, grow, curl or brush), her make-up (eyeshadow, lipstick, blush or even fun fake tatoos) and choose her clothes and accessories, all according to the party she\'ll be attending to tonight.\n\nOnce you\'re done styling, watch your chosen model showing off her outfit in 3D, and you can even take pictures, frame them and print them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6uur.jpg'),(11879,'TD: Goblin Defenders',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11880,'Conan Exiles: Riders of Hyboria Pack','2019-12-05','Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox One','Mounts have arrived in Conan Exiles! The update introducing mounts is free while the Riders of Hyboria Pack offers lots of new content and options for this new feature.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ke0.jpg'),(11881,'Thunder Pro Wrestling Retsuden','1992-03-27','Sport','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Thunder Pro Wrestling Retsuden is an entry in Human\'s Fire Pro Wrestling series.\nThe game is a typical wrestling game presented in an isometric view with the entire ring visible on screen at once. Each button combination does something different depending on what situation you are in at the time.\n\nA North American release under the name Jesse \"The Body\" Ventura Wrestling Superstars was planned by DreamWorks, but was never released for unknown reasons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co948s.jpg'),(11882,'Whites This',NULL,'Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 4D maze game, that can help exercise those 4D brain cells.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ykw.jpg'),(11883,'ShipLord','2015-12-02','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','ShipLord is a space avoid-er mixed with interesting boss fights and breathtaking visuals, with a reward system to take your skill to another lvl.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47jc.jpg'),(11884,'Genshin Impact: Blades Weaving Betwixt Brocade','2024-03-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Version 4.5 of Genshin Impact, which includes:\n• New character: Chiori\n• New banner type: Chronicled Wish\n• New character quest for Chiori\n• New hangout event for Lynette\n• New main event: Alchemical Ascension\n• New quality of life features\n• …and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7u0c.jpg'),(11885,'Widget Inc.','2024-10-31','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A hybrid factory builder / incremental clicker game. Starting from humble beginnings, master the many crafting processes to build up resources and expand your factory. Then, using your newly automated production, unlock new technology and grow ever closer to your goal of spreading to the stars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y3v.jpg'),(11886,'99 Waves to Die','2015-04-09','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','99 Waves to Die is a twin stick arcade shooter, inspired by the arcade games, and 8-bit home consoles & computers of the 1980\'s.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nuy3keya7kz4takimogg.jpg'),(11887,'EA Sports Active NFL Training Camp','2010-11-16','Sport','Wii','Built-in Heart Rate Monitor, Wireless Motion Tracking\n\nTake your workout online,\nNFL approved Challenges and Drills A Real NFL experience\nPush yourself through the NFL Combine 60 Day Challenge\nDeveloped in collaboration with NFL strength and conditioning coaches, users will experience the thrill of competition while challenging friends and family in authentic NFL football drills with real NFL players. EA SPORTS Active NFL Training Camp with Total Body Tracking uses the included heart rate monitor and wireless motion tracking to provide a challenging workout and help deliver measurable results. It will link to the EA SPORTS Active online hub where users can share training results and challenge others to beat their personal best, as well as track progress toward specific fitness goals. EA SPORTS Active NFL Training Camp brings the real NFL training camp experience right into the living room.\n\nWii Balance Board Compatible','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74tb.jpg'),(11888,'Meitantei Pikachu: Shin Konbi Tanjou','2016-02-03','Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Meitantei Pikachu: Shin Konbi Tanjou (Great Detective Pikachu: Birth of a New Duo) was released exclusively in Japan on February 3, 2016 on the Nintendo eShop featuring the first three chapters of what would later be internationally released as Detective Pikachu. From January 27, 2016 to February 29, 2016, the game could be purchased in Japan for ¥1,200, instead of the normal price of ¥1,500. Players who purchased Birth of a New Duo were able to receive a ¥1,500 discount on the full Detective Pikachu game until April 22, 2018. The game was removed from the eShop on January 12, 2018, just before the announcement of the full version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5q43.jpg'),(11889,'Wario Land: Shake It!','2008-07-24','Platform, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Wii, Wii U','Wario, Nintendo\'s greedy, uncouth and rude anti-hero, returns to his roots. The Wario Land series is where Wario first appeared, and it\'s back in all its side-scrolling, platform-jumping glory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wnw.jpg'),(11890,'GrigoriNightDragon',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Sin plataforma','GrigoriNightDragon is a captivating RPG set in Elyria\'s fantasy realm. Discover quests, adventures, and formidable dragons guarding castles. Multiple endings ensure endless replayability and a multitude of challanges awit you on your journey!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kn9.jpg'),(11891,'Deep Rock Galactic: Ultimate Edition','2020-05-13','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cjb.jpg'),(11892,'Hauntii','2024-05-23','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A beguiling adventure in which you uncover the secrets of an expansive and mysterious world - haunting both the environment and its denizens to craft ingenious solutions to the many challenges that await.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ayw.jpg'),(11893,'Moe! Ninja Girls','2016-12-19','Simulator, Adventure','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','From the creators of the women’s visual novel games series “Shall we date?”','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p2l.jpg'),(11894,'Painted Memories','2016-11-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Painted Memories is an Action/Adventure game that you journey through using various equipment in your arsenal, such as a crossbow or a torch. You will encounter different creatures, bosses, puzzles and more! Most importantly, nothing will be holding your hand to guide you here, you have to discover where to go and what to do all by yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jns.jpg'),(11895,'Rims Racing: Bahrain International Circuit','2021-10-29','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Nintendo Switch','Bahrain International Circuit is an iconic track for motorsport fans. With 5.412km of short straights and slow bends, the changes in pace are highly demanding and present a unique challenge in the middle of the desert!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sfd.jpg'),(11896,'BSL Winter Games Challenge','2017-12-03','Sport','iOS','BSL Winter Games Challenge has four (4) fast pace exciting tracks that are challenging with dramatic turns and length of course. Test your Speed and Time Skills against your favorite Country Team in the upcoming Winter Games. Choose between Tilt or Controller Input to best fits your style of play. Play either the Bobsled, Skeleton, or Luge in this 3 in 1 game. Try and beat your high scores and speed records each time you play. Twenty-four (24) teams to choose from and 3 different Camera Angles to enhance your gaming skills. This 3 games in 1 challenge play will keep you engaged each time you play. The game also includes a Holiday Bonus Track.\n\n• - User sets the Speed, Crash Sensitivity, and Input Control Type\n\n• - Four (4) challenging course runs with dramatic turns and different lengths of play. The game also includes a Bonus Holiday course.\n\n• - 24 Teams to choose from\n\n• - Try and beat your high scores and high speed each time you play\n\n• - 3 games in 1 challenge will keep you engaged each time you play','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wabfuqtaaqsfse4kht2y.jpg'),(11897,'Blade Abyss','2025-03-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Blade Abyss: Death Raid\" is a skill-driven hardcore action game, blending precise parry, dynamic movement, and tactical axe throws. Face demonic bosses and zombie hordes in fast-paced combat—no gear, no grind, only pure mastery of mechanics. Your reflexes are the ultimate weapon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9haq.jpg'),(11898,'MM','2023-05-17','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A narrative game about \"a man\'s request for a life without regrets\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qx3.jpg'),(11899,'Super Star Car','2021-04-05','Racing, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Race a vast selection of Formula-One cars around famous global circuits. Start your career and climb the ladder to becoming a Formula-1 champion!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11900,'Pac-Mania','1988-12-31','Arcade','Atari ST/STE','Pac-Mania is a variation on the game Pac-Man. You need to guide Pac-Man around a maze and eat all of the dots on the board to proceed on to the next round. Numerous, multi-colored ghosts also roam the maze trying to stop you. If you eat one of the power pellets in the maze, the ghosts will temporarily turn blue and run from you. Pac-Man can earn bonus points by eating the ghosts when they are in this state. The maze is now shown in isometric perspective and is larger than the screen which will scroll to follow the action. To help get out of tight spots, Pac-Man can now jump. But be careful, because some of the ghosts have learned this trick as well and you could end up in a mid-air collision!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p2f.jpg'),(11901,'Eredia 2: The Great War','2023-12-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A dark fantasy JRPG, sequel to Eredia: Diary of Heroes. Eredia 2 is set in an open-world enemy continent as you are made to partake in a war you are least interested in, but it\'s the only place where you can find some \'answers\'.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72rd.jpg'),(11902,'King of Silence',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Every noise has a consequence you don\'t want to know about. Hold your breath and immerse yourself in King Of Silence, a 1st person horrific experience where the strange, the superstitious and the frightening are combined.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bd3.jpg'),(11903,'Puyo Pop Fever DX','2006-03-31','Puzzle','Legacy Mobile Device','Puyo Puyo Fever DX is a mobile phone game released for i-mode 90x, Vodafone Live! (256KB) and EZweb (BREW 3.1) devices through the Sonic Cafe portal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kl1.jpg'),(11904,'I Am the Prosecutor: No Evidence? No Problem!','2021-04-30','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','I Am The Prosecutor is a non-linear visual novel about defending a cute tomboy named Sophie where you\'re given just 30 seconds to make the right choice each time. Help make Sophie\'s case against her abusive mother and give her much needed closure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43g6.jpg'),(11905,'Build It: Miami Beach Resort','2009-12-22','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build your own beach resort right where Miami began. Starting in the 1920s, every year is a new level. Build wonderful art-deco hotels, newly invented cinemas, the first fast-food diner and, decades later, giant hotels right on the beach. Design everything the way you\'d like to see it over the course of 60 years on a huge scrollable map.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q43.jpg'),(11906,'Pokémon Project Studio Red/Blue Version','1999-07-03','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93dr.jpg'),(11907,'The Boogie Man','2015-09-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Keith Baring is a cold, devoted detective whose boss decides he needs to take some time off. While on a tour of an old castle with his wife Helena, she makes a startling confession to him. Keith goes to bed bewildered - but things only become stranger as the Boogie Man\'s game begins...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27aj.jpg'),(11908,'Fairy Well','2012-01-01','Platform, Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX','The forest has lost its four Princesses to the Dark Wizard of the Underground. \nEach Princess has been locked in with three magic crystals. Find the first three crystals scattered in the cave and then head for the Well! \n \nFairy Well is a unique and ambitious flick-screen collect-em-up arcade adventure of epic proportions squeezed into a tiny 16KB of ROM space. \n \nWith its multiple game modes (via a character selection at the beginning of your quest), huge randomly generated level maps, varied enemies and items, boss-battles and timeless adventure gameplay, Fairy Well is a modern C64 classic. Guide your fairy through the labyrinthine underworld on your quest to rescue the captured princess and restore peace to the forest!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hhwo2dsbmi5nzzylmjgr.jpg'),(11909,'Artius: Pure Imagination',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Artius is a fast-paced, momentum-based 2D platformer where you play as four unique artists fighting to preserve creativity in a world on the verge of artistic extinction. Dash, swing, and smash your way through vibrant, hand-drawn worlds inspired by art!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m0d.jpg'),(11910,'MannaRites Gold','2024-12-20','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gold edition of the warmly received fantasy 2.5D hack-n-slash / RPG - MannaRites! Cut your way through enemy troops, explore open map, find and equip legendary weapons, armor and artifacts, level up your hero! Defend your lands from invaders!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9702.jpg'),(11911,'Bubble Shooter Adventures','2017-03-06','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aim precisely and clear all the bubbles as fast as you can.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q3y.jpg'),(11912,'Temple of Shadows','2024-11-27','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on an epic adventure as Sabastian Harrington, a passionate archeology grad student turned explorer, in search of his missing professor. Six weeks ago, Dr. Albert J. Montgomery III announced the discovery of a hidden temple, but he never returned. Now, Sabastian must dive into ancient temple ruins, solve intricate puzzles, and uncover hidden secrets. Will you reveal the mysteries within the Temple of Shadows?\n\nNavigate the enigmatic Temple Ruins and unlock the secrets of the Temple Gate. Venture into the labyrinthine caves beyond, a realm filled with ancient mysteries and hidden dangers. Your mission: uncover the truth and track down the elusive Dr. Montgomery. Embark on this thrilling adventure and face challenges that will test your courage and wits at every turn. Can you reveal the secrets that lie within?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xyi.jpg'),(11913,'Paper io 2: Complete Edition','2024-10-12','Sin género','Xbox One','Conquer territory solo or beat your friends in multiplayer mode!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9etp.jpg'),(11914,'Atomicboy 2',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Atomicboy 2 is an original game successor to a mod to Chirpy the Penguin','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9inr.jpg'),(11915,'Pompom: The Great Space Rescue',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','In a whole new kind of puzzle-action platformer, you do not control Pompom the hamster, but instead use your quick thinking to help him by placing and controlling platforms, obstacles and items around him. Analyze and use everything that comes your way: build bridges, place springs, prune vines... Be clever, be quick, be efficient. Travel through outer space to beaches full of flying fish, to ancient temples lost in the jungle, as you help Pompom outsmart his enemies and rescue his boy Hoshi from Captain Cat and his crew.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11916,'NBA Courtside 2 Featuring Kobe Bryant','1999-10-31','Sport','Nintendo 64','NBA Courtside 2 Featuring Kobe Bryant is the sequel to Kobe Bryant in NBA Courtside and features NBA star Kobe Bryant on its cover. Bryant also performed the motion capture for the game. The ability to play multiple seasons has been added. New features include the ability to play a three-point contest and additional options for creating a player from scratch. The game features improved artificial intelligence helps to improve the realism of the gameplay. New dunk styles are possible to implement and enhanced motion capturing allows the no-look pass to be used during gameplay. There are more than 300 players and games can either be a realistic simulation of actual NBA action or a full-blown arcade experience. Plays such as the isolation play, the post up, and the triangle offense can be called.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gnk.jpg'),(11917,'Emberfate: Tempest of Elements','2023-01-26','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Set in regular modern-day life, you are the leader of a raiding guild in the world\'s hottest MMORPG, Emberfate, which has just released the new expansion, Tempest of Elements. Balance the intricacies of being a guild leader, ranging from preparing for boss battles or distributing loot, to managing the complex relationships you have with your fellow players. Engage in conversations with your guildmates, listen to their troubles — and maybe pursue one of the three possible love interests to build a romantic relationship of your own!\n\nTake charge of your own fate, and shape the future of those around you. In Emberfate, everyone is dealing with something, and your choices and support could make all the difference.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xiu.jpg'),(11918,'Pixel Game Maker Series: Chrotopia','2025-04-09','Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A world where only black and white exist.\n“Chro”searches for his sister in various places.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nh4.jpg'),(11919,'Fantastic Four: Rise of the Silver Surfer','2007-06-15','Sin género','Nintendo DS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4x77.jpg'),(11920,'Girls Fashion 3D: Mezase! Top Stylist',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11921,'Beyond the Kingdom: Collector\'s Edition','2018-09-24','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pa7.jpg'),(11922,'Steep: Rocket Wings DLC','2019-01-14','Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Soar through skies and valleys in the Alps & Alaska at break-neck speed with 15 new challenges for every daredevil’s favorite sport, Rocket Wings! Get 3 exclusive customizations for your Rocket Wings so you can stand out from the other riders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4be4.jpg'),(11923,'Advanced Gaming Platform: Epica','2016-12-22','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Marked for death by the Imperial Corporation you have been marooned on a desolate planet in the Attria Prime system. Fight to survive the inhospitable frontier in this post-earth dystopia. AGP::Epica is tactical RPG intended for advanced players seeking a challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wv9.jpg'),(11924,'A.I.L.A','2025-12-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A.I.L.A. is a first-person horror game set in a near-future filled with immersive technology. Play as the sole game tester for a revolutionary new fictional AI. Survive intense horror experiences that prey on your deepest fears as the lines between virtual and reality begin to blur…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qv6.jpg'),(11925,'Deadlocked','2024-02-04','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deadlocked is an adrenaline-packed Top-Down shooter where you\'ll confront hordes of relentless robotic foes. Unleash futuristic weapons, master strategic combat, and prove your mettle against the mechanical onslaught. Can you outmanoeuvre and overpower the relentless enemy threat?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7azv.jpg'),(11926,'Grand Craft: Adventures',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11927,'Funko Fusion: Funko Fusion and Wicked Movie DLC Bundle','2024-12-03','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9efn.jpg'),(11928,'Scribbleman Army','2022-09-23','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scribbleman Army is a colony management game where you have to explore a cave.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bin.jpg'),(11929,'7th Domain','2024-08-16','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"7th Domain\" is a horizontal version action game derived from Roguelike Metroidvania combined with treasure grinding gameplay. You will play a child of destiny who repairs the world and finds the truth of the broken world. You will grow in battle and challenge the unknown and hidden forces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j24.jpg'),(11930,'Painted Legend: Knights of Ink & Paper','2025-02-26','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An action-adventure platformer in the metroidvania subgenre. The graphics are made in the style of a checkered notebook and blue ink. Defeat crowds of monsters, overcome traps, explore the game world, unlock new characters and find secrets! And all this to the accompaniment of driving music!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gdt.jpg'),(11931,'Fredbear and Friends: Out of the Machine','2016-06-01','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Spend 5 nights as the night guard at Fredbear and Friends. Listen for the grandfather clock\'s chimes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vn6.jpg'),(11932,'Araha : Curse of Yieun Island','2020-01-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Araha: Curse of Yieun Island is a survival horror game. You will explore the hospital on an island as \'the Boy\' who is looking for his sister. Starting from the abandoned hospital, You will journey through the cursed island covering the Sharman\'s sanctum, Cemetary in the mountainside and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25l8.jpg'),(11933,'Final Fantasy XIV: Seekers of Eternity','2025-03-25','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac','The Patch 7.2 series update includes: New Main Scenario Quests, a new Dungeon, a new Raid, a new Trial, Cosmic Exploration, a new Large-scale Battle-oriented Duty – Occult Crescent, New Allied Society Quests – Mamool Ja, new Hildibrand Quests, Duty Support Additions, and PvP Updates','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h38.jpg'),(11934,'Spy Game: Mission in Moskow',NULL,'Sport','Sin plataforma','Infinite episodes Moscow streets, Kremlin and other. The player collects USB sticks and laptops containing sensitive information while being chased by Agent Jake, whose mission is to arrest you. If the player is caught, he ends up in prison Bay and the game ends. Your purpose is to find USSR hydrogen bomb which is dropped onto the map when \"Uncle Plutin\" is called on a cellphone, effectively ridding it from obstacles.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11935,'Luto',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Luto is a first person psychological horror narrative experience where you will embody a person unable to exit his own house. Finding the way to leave it will lead you through a series of paths that will challenge your senses.\n\nExplore the pain caused by the loss of a loved one, the horror of the insecurity to the deepest darkness hidden behind anxiety and depression...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5owy.jpg'),(11936,'Final Fantasy: All the Bravest','2013-09-12','Strategy','Android, iOS','FINAL FANTASY ALL THE BRAVEST is a touch-action RPG in which you continuously battle enemies to advance through the game\'s many stages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vl6.jpg'),(11937,'Overdose','2025-04-04','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive the night in a deadly asylum—deliver sinister meds, keep the insane in line, and outwit a killer hiding in the dark.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lrq.jpg'),(11938,'Ravenswatch: Legendary Edition','2024-11-28','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Fallen heroes of old folk tales and legends: you are on the verge of a crucial battle against the Nightmare invading and corrupting your world. A roguelike action game by the creators of Curse of the Dead Gods, playable solo or in online co-op.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9et8.jpg'),(11939,'SuperTaxCity','2025-01-30','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a country where taxes are repeatedly raised, you become the owner of a certain city and develop it. Build facilities, expand the city, and create a city that will not be defeated by tax increases!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xaa.jpg'),(11940,'Witch\'s Weapon',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11941,'Abscam','1982-12-31','Arcade','Arcade','Abscam is one of many Pac-Man bootlegs. Based on FBI\'s controversial Abscam sting operation, it was developed by GL and published by US Billiards in 1982.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11942,'Incredible Dracula: Academy of Shadows',NULL,'Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join Dracula to stop runaway students, recover magical items, and restore order before a graduation ceremony begins. In doing so, you’ll face fears, conquer challenges, and finally prove that the legendary Count Dracula isn’t one to be trifled with.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11943,'Donut Punks','2021-05-07','Shooter, Tactical, Arcade, MOBA','Android, iOS, Legacy Mobile Device','Kill zombies — shoot, run, and survive as long as you can! Donut Punks is an epic MOBA & PVP battle with zombie shooting and kids’ brawl. A new battle royale: don’t kill other players — trap them instead! So get your gun and become the smartest zombie killer in the arena.\n\nWanna engage in one of the newest 2v2 games online? You’re welcome! Donut Punks is a moba game that is all about fun, action, and tactics. Like in PVP games, you engage with other brawlers and play tricks on them to get donuts and win zombie games. Shooting and traps, monsters and cool weapons, RPG elements, lots of locations, and unique perks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sdu.jpg'),(11944,'Pac-Man Power Pack','2008-09-17','Adventure','PlayStation 2','Pac-Man Power Pack is a box set of Pac-Man games that was released in 2008 for the PlayStation 2. The collection includes Pac-Man World 2, Pac-Man World 3, and Pac-Man World Rally.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x04.jpg'),(11945,'Soccerverse',NULL,'Sport','Sin plataforma','Introducing Soccerverse. A massively multiplayer, community-driven football management game.\nBecome a manager, agent, club owner, share trader, scout or any combination of these and more, in one huge persistent, open-ended game world competing against other players.\nExperience a thriving football economy that uses blockchain technology to give you true realism, asset ownership and total control.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qa4.jpg'),(11946,'Hex Tetris',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','A Tetris inspired game for Windows 3.1 that uses blocks created out of hexagons, rather than squares.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mco1fdul9tmobv96rxxp.jpg'),(11947,'Atelier Yumia: \"Super Cute! Beach Memories\" Costume for Isla','2025-03-21','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11948,'Peachy Derby: Minami - Back to School','2025-03-06','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11949,'Mind: Path to Thalamus E.Edition','2014-08-05','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Mind: Path to Thalamus is a First Person Puzzler that throws you into a fantastic and surreal environment. You will bend the natural elements to your will in order to progress in this emotive, mindbending tale. Now also in Virtual Reality!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48yt.jpg'),(11950,'Peachy Derby: Natsuki - From Outspace','2025-03-06','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11951,'Final Fantasy: Brave Exvius','2016-06-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, iOS','Final Fantasy: Brave Exvius a brand-new FINAL FANTASY experience, will launch for free (with in-app purchases) on iOS and Android devices this summer. The hit title has already drawn in more than six million players in Japan and is an entirely new role-playing adventure for the mobile generation. The title brings the classic FINAL FANTASY lore with legendary heroes from the franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j27.jpg'),(11952,'Bulwark Evolution: Falconeer Chronicles - Mongres Trader Bundle','2024-11-04','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Bulwark is about designing your fortress and expanding it into an empire.\n\nI hope you enjoy my attempts to experiment and evolve this game into something enjoyable and fresh.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ega.jpg'),(11953,'Wheelman','2009-03-24','Shooter, Racing, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The game is set in an open world environment modeled after Barcelona, full of destructible objects, alleyways, shortcuts through office blocks and a total of 31 story missions and 105 side missions. While most missions are driving-oriented, there are also foot missions which are played from a third person perspective. A wide variety of weapons are available to the player, such as pistols and RPGs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xcu.jpg'),(11954,'Arrow Match',NULL,'Arcade','Sin plataforma','A hyper-casual match two game for Playdate','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11955,'Zombie Attack Girls','2022-10-10','Visual Novel','Android','It\'s just another normal day at high school… until you stop by the nurse\'s office and find one of your classmates hunched over another, covered in blood, and the sounds of slurping fill your ears. It doesn\'t take long to piece two and two together—there\'s a zombie virus spreading!\n\nWhile everyone is desperate to escape, your survival-loving classmate is fired up and ready for action! The two of you team up with two other girls—a childhood friend and a timid loner who seems to have a dark side. Can you dodge the zombies without getting distracted by the advances of your cute teammates?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j8o.jpg'),(11956,'My Imaginary Friend','2024-11-21','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','My imaginaryFriend is a first-person horror game that focuses on psychological horror. Set in the mandela catalogue universe, My Imaginary Friend is a 3d realistic first person horror game that features how AI uses the imagination of children to generate intruders and potentially alternates.\nYou will be playing as Jonny, 10 year old boy, the game begins after he discovers that his parents are not home and something is terribly wrong with the place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yav.jpg'),(11957,'Peachy Derby: Natsuki - Back to School','2025-03-06','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11958,'Dark Lord\'s Maze','2022-01-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DARK LORD\'S MAZE is a 3D dungeon crawler made in 8-bit style.\n\nJump right into this colorful, pixelated world full of traps, enemies and different environmental hazards and enjoy a true classic gaming experience, fueled by the sounds of Commodore 64\'s SID and a fair amount of difficulty!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fjq.jpg'),(11959,'Peachy Derby: Yuko - Black Investigator','2025-03-06','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11960,'Peachy Derby: Saori - Grey Investigator','2025-03-06','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11961,'Peachy Derby: Mirai - Manor Owner','2025-03-06','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11962,'ArcArg','2025-03-03','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It is a turn-based TCG game where the player participates in the \"Arcarg\" match held in the city of Lars. Become Mari and Betty and meet the characters in the cards!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m1s.jpg'),(11963,'Dead or Alive 3++','2002-03-03','Fighting, Arcade','Xbox','Dead or Alive 3++ was released as a rebalanced version of Dead or Alive 3 for the original Xbox game system. It features various system and character balances from the previous three versions of Dead or Alive 3. Some minor tweaks have been added to the game system in the form of a four-way hold system, unrestricted 3D-axis movement, and less emphasis on the critical stun system. Some attack commands for characters are updated. The tag team system, introduced in the previous game, was also updated. Tag Battle was made available during the game\'s Time Attack and Survival modes. A new feature called Attack Change was added, allowing the character tagging in to attack while switching in. The Tag Throws command was made a bit easier to activate. By default, the game utilizes the Xbox controller\'s analog face buttons, making the controls lenient to allow players new to the series to adapt to gameplay, players have the option to turn the analog buttons on or off. As with previous entries in the series, it took advantage of the Xbox system\'s power to push the range of the graphics and stage sizes farther than Dead or Alive 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49mn.jpg'),(11964,'The FMV Collection 5','2025-02-10','Sin género','Xbox One','Wales Interactive is proud to offer the Bloodshore, Ten Dates and Mia and the Dragon Princess all in one bundle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e99.jpg'),(11965,'Bushside Rangers','2025-03-26','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unravel the twisted secrets of the \"Bushside Rangers Nature Park\" as Vera, a young girl forced to use her wits as she\'s pursued by the tainted memories of the park\'s long lost innocence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jan.jpg'),(11966,'Silver Sonic: Rise of the Death Egg','2022-10-10','Platform','Sega Master System/Mark III','After somehow defeating Dr. Robotnik’s evil fortress of pure kaizo chaos, Silver Sonic decides to take a well-deserved vacation on the Kirgony Isles, a tropical archipalego known for its peaceful nature, abandoned casino, and its ancient temples before Robotnik inevitably comes to try and take control of the islands to turn them into Eggman Land with the help of his trusty Death Egg.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co608p.jpg'),(11967,'Megami Tensei Gaiden: Last Bible Special','1995-03-24','Role-playing (RPG)','Sega Game Gear','Megami Tensei Gaiden: Last Bible Special is an RPG for the Sega Game Gear.\n\nSpecial is the only entry in the series to feature 3D dungeon exploration mechanics similar to Wizardry and Etrian Odyssey. Outside of spell and item names, as well as some party mechanics, it has very little in common with other titles in the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kpn.jpg'),(11968,'Leafing Home','2025-04-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Leafing Home is a cozy adventure game where you play as a small squirrel on a quest to retrieve the World Tree’s stolen fruit and find your way back home. Explore a vibrant world filled with quirky characters, and help restore nature to its former glory. Master unique flight mechanics, tackle aerial challenges, solve puzzles, and dive into a variety of fun mini-games. This heartwarming tale of belonging and environmentalism is perfect for players of all ages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g6j.jpg'),(11969,'Naruto: Uzumaki Chronicles 2','2006-11-16','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 2','Naruto: Uzumaki Chronicles 2 is an action RPG where players travel across a map, completing missions to gain experience points for unlocking new abilities and boosting their character\'s stats. The story mode, set after the Sasuke Recovery Mission, shows Naruto facing the puppet-using Shirogane clan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ubd.jpg'),(11970,'End\'s Reach','2025-03-06','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','End\'s Reach is a 3D Exploration Action Adventure Game that focuses on a character lost in the depths of space. Players will solve puzzles, collect upgrades, items, weapons and even magical abilities as they uncover the mysteries of this strange new world. A classic tale of technology taken too far.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co956r.jpg'),(11971,'The Monstrous Horror Show','2023-04-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In an abandoned hospital, four young girls gathered here for their own reasons and began to explore the hidden secrets of the hospital. Can they escape safely and return to their normal peaceful daily life again?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5n8l.jpg'),(11972,'Fly in the House','2015-03-06','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re back home after a few years of traveling. When you walked into your apartment, memories came flooding back to you. Many questions require answers. You start to wonder what\'s wrong with your life, but suddenly notice a fly in the house. Everything else is forgotten and replaced with one burning desire - kill the fly!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zsc.jpg'),(11973,'Prose & Codes','2022-02-11','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Prose & Codes is an indie puzzle game. Decode the wit, wisdom, and wonder of literature\'s finest works through deceptively simple ciphers. Decode 350 hand-selected excerpts from literary classics both well-known and obscure and get a taste of 7 beloved genres, from nostalgic children\'s stories to bone-chilling horror.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hob.jpg'),(11974,'Naruto: Path of the Ninja','2004-07-22','Sin género','Game Boy Advance','Naruto: Path of the Ninja is a video game released in Japan only for the Game Boy Advance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6eyo.jpg'),(11975,'Atelier Yumia: Aladiss Investigation Preparation Set','2025-03-21','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11976,'Atelier Yumia: \"Blooming Heart\" Costume for Nina','2025-03-21','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11977,'Atelier Yumia: \"Ebony Outlaw\" Costume for Rutger','2025-03-21','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11978,'Atelier Yumia: \"Knight\'s Long-Distance Swimwear\" Costume for Viktor','2025-03-21','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11979,'Thin Line','2025-02-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short time before fading away.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gub.jpg'),(11980,'Life is Strange: Double Exposure - Deluxe Edition','2024-10-29','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','The Life is Strange: Double Exposure Deluxe Edition contains:\n\n• Life is Strange: Double Exposure - the complete game\n• Spooky Outfit Pack\n• Decades Outfit Pack\n\nBoth the Spooky Outfit Pack and Decades Outfit Pack will be available at launch of the base game.\n\nSPOOKY OUTFIT PACK\nDial up the shivers and indulge your ghost-hunting, monster-wrangling passions with these outfits perfect for Halloween - or for witching hours all year round! This pack contains the Just Haunt It! coat and four indoor outfits: Maxidermy, Ragdoll Max, Max Ghoulfield, and Max O\'Lantern.\n\nDECADES OUTFIT PACK\nConfront the inexorable passage of time and celebrate your colorful past, with iconic outfits that pay homage to 90s Grunge, 50s Rockabilly, 70s Flower Power, the 80s Mallrat, and 60s Psychedelia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e4d.jpg'),(11981,'Maneki\'s Curse','2016-10-25','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the realm of mortals, it is Gojun who reigns after killing the former god of war, Maneki. Now Maneki\'s soul is trapped in the Underworld--a rich labyrinth from which no soul can escape. But the former god of war\'s soul is unlike any other, and his vengeance has had a millennium to burn.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11982,'Metal Slug 1st Mission','1999-12-31','Platform','Neo Geo Pocket Color','Metal Slug: 1st Mission is an Action game, developed by Ukiyotei and published by SNK, which was released in Japan in 1999.\n\nAs a member of the elite forces squad \"Peregrine Falcons,\" your mission is to eliminate the evil Colonel Bildegaarn. Using the Metal Slug multifunction tank and the Slug Flyer as well as your wits and handgun blast through up to 17 missions in your quest to make the world safe from tyranny. Multiple stage progressions and a gameplay ranking system give reason to play through more than once. In-game save lets the player on the go turn off the Neo Geo Pocket and not lose progress.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qom.jpg'),(11983,'Faeria: Chronicles of Gagana','2019-04-17','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Emperor Kaios has been defeated and the Oversky is saved. This victory is short-lived, however, as the climate begins to slowly deteriorate, and extreme winds soon blow over the globe. In the search for a solution to the new, impending cataclysm, the crew of the Gagana ventures out into uncharted territory. They will encounter new civilizations, new continents, new creatures.... and in the end: the Treasures of Gagana.\n\nChronicles of Gagana is the first part of a trilogy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ksw.jpg'),(11984,'Let\'s Sing 2025 with International Hits: Platinum Edition','2024-11-05','Music','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Let\'s Sing 2025 brings the ultimate karaoke experience straight to your living room! Sing along with your family and friends to the latest hits, as well as a generous selection of all-time classics.\nPlatinum Edition: The Let\'s Sing 2025 Platinum edition includes 35 songs, as well as a one month free trial + 12 months of VIP Pass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zst.jpg'),(11985,'The Elder Scrolls Online: Dark Brotherhood','2016-05-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Though at the height of their power, the Dark Brotherhood faces a grave threat in the form of a mysterious black-armored warrior capable of bringing down their best agents. Venture forth for another exciting adventure in the Elder Scrolls Online as you carve a bloody swath across Tamriel in the name of the Dark Brotherhood!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wxr.jpg'),(11986,'Themis','2025-03-28','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','THEMIS is a 3rd person puzzle platformer filled with mind-boggling challenges and non-linear narrative. Inspired by games like Portal and Dark Souls, players will be tasked with overcoming death traps and obstacles employing both wits as well as quick reflexes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99lr.jpg'),(11987,'Big Buck Hunter: Ultimate Trophy - Mythic Hunting Pack','2025-04-11','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(11988,'World War 2: Operation Husky',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','WW2 Operation Husky is easy to learn. 24 scenarios, Paratroopers, Tanks, Infantries, Anti-Aircraft, Artillery Support, Air Support. Hills, Light and Dense forest. Single and Multi-players. PC or Mac. 4K and Touch Screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nev.jpg'),(11989,'Hidden Nemesis','2025-02-01','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive six nights of terror in a deadly cat-and-mouse game. Immobilized in a chair, solve intricate puzzles, monitor cameras, and scour the dark web to uncover secrets—all while a relentless demon hunts you. Will you outsmart the darkness before time runs out?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d5c.jpg'),(11990,'Prince of Persia: Limited Edition','2008-12-02','Fighting, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Prince of Persia is an action-adventure and platforming video game developed by Ubisoft Montreal and published by Ubisoft. It is part of the Prince of Persia franchise. The game was released in the United States on December 2, 2008 for PlayStation 3 and Xbox 360 and on December 9, 2008 for Microsoft Windows. It was later released on March 24, 2009 for Mac OS X via the Cider engine.\nThe Limited edition includes goodies like wallpapers, soundtrack, guide, etc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oc8.jpg'),(11991,'Dragon Attack Mythologies: A Night Wolf Revenge','2025-04-04','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jump, dodge, and fight against anyone who crosses your path in search of revenge. Explore 8 challenging worlds filled with danger and classic arcade action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l2l.jpg'),(11992,'Madness Accelerant','2009-09-22','Shooter','Web browser','Created By Mindchamber and Tom Fulp of newgrounds.com Madness Accelerant was a creative play by play reenactment of the Madness Consternation episode created by Matt \'Krinkles\' Jolly','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p62.jpg'),(11993,'Zombie Army 4: Dead War - Mission 2: Blood Count','2020-04-14','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Transylvanian undead? SS Cultists? These are the least of your problems in this brand-new campaign mission for Zombie Army 4. Break into an abandoned castle, unravel the mysteries of the occult and drill deep into the crypt\'s darkest secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kmi.jpg'),(11994,'Final Fantasy II','2002-10-31','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG)','WonderSwan Color, PlayStation','The WonderSwan Color version of Final Fantasy II included completely redone graphics in the manner of the 16-bit generation Final Fantasy games and includes larger character sprites, remixed music by Tsuyoshi Sekito, and full graphical backgrounds in battle mode. It is from this base that the international version of Final Fantasy II began to take shape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xxp.jpg'),(11995,'Smile, you\'re being filmed together','2025-03-12','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into an intense psychological horror experience with Smile, You’re Being Filmed: Together, the multiplayer version where observation and cooperation are your greatest assets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dkg.jpg'),(11996,'Festered','2025-06-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Brave the terrors of a contaminated research facility, where every step could be your last. PSX style survival horror game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e0r.jpg'),(11997,'PizzaBoy',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take control of PizzaBoy, a nimble pizza delivery guy equipped with an air dash that allows him to bounce off walls. This can be used to reach greater heights and distances than the standard run and jump. PizzaBoy must navigate dangerous environments to deliver pizzas to hungry monsters.\n\nPizzaboy must make it to the end of the level to deliver the pizza but don\'t expect it to be too simple, as each area is full of pizza-hungry monsters. Don\'t get too close or they might just steal a slice! The customer won\'t be happy with a half-eaten pizza.\n\nThe path to the customer won\'t always be straightforward either. Every level is a Metroidvania-style map, with many secrets, collectibles, and areas to explore. Alongside delivering pizzas, PizzaBoy may find opportunities to recover his lost memories and discover the dark secrets of the company he works for. The player\'s choice in how they tackle the level will determine the ending of each chapter, and ultimately the end of the game.\n\nIf the customer is satisfied with your performance, you might just get a 5-star review.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y4n.jpg'),(11998,'MonoGolf',NULL,'Puzzle','Android, iOS','Monogolf is a mini golf game where your objective is to get the ball in the hole in just one hit. If you don\'t, you\'ll lose a heart. You start the game with only 10 hearts, so you\'ll have to make sure you don\'t lose too many or else you\'ll lose the game.\n\nTo hit the ball in Monogolf, all you have to do is slide your finger back to adjust the power and the direction of your hit. Before you let go, you\'ll have to keep a couple important factors in mind, like the different surfaces the ball will roll over and how that will affect your shot, or the walls it can bounce off of, and so on.\n\nIn Monogolf, you\'ll find more than 100 different levels which you can unlock as you beat the easier levels in the beginning. Each time you beat a level, you\'ll get some orange hexagons (the game\'s currency) that you can then use to increase the maximum number of lives you have or get other useful abilities.\n\nIf 100 levels isn\'t enough, there\'s also a scenario editor so you can create your own. Once you create a level, you can send it to the developers on Twitter. The best ones will appear in the game.\n\nMonogolf is an excellent mini golf game with nice graphics, relaxing music, and a simple, fun, and addictive gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6khw.jpg'),(11999,'Happy Animal Testing',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Do you trust your friends? Happy Animal Testing puts your faith in your friends under a microscope. This multiplayer puzzle-platformer will see if your relationships survive testing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58a7.jpg'),(12000,'Fallen Star','2021-07-22','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As the Cannan Empire reaches its way across the islands, conquering territories under the firm hand of the Emperor and a Mysterious Knight named Valles, the Imperial Prince Claude journeys with a girl named Hellen after he witnesses her village massacred by the very people he calls home. Along with a Mercenary and a mysterious Wizard from the Order of Ragnard, Claude and his friends enter the sacred monument of Obelisk seeking the Fallen Star, said to have fell at the top of Obelisk when Ragnard first walked the island, before it falls into the hands of Valles.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12001,'Phantom Brave: The Lost Hero - Exclusive Putty Outfit: Minty','2025-01-30','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12002,'Fortnite Festival: Season 8','2025-04-08','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch 2, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The 8th season of Fortnite Festival, featuring modern pop icon Sabrina Carpenter','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n76.jpg'),(12003,'Porter in the Castle','2021-08-24','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Feel like a porter in a medieval castle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vih.jpg'),(12004,'Call of Duty: World at War - Final Fronts','2008-11-10','Shooter','PlayStation 2','Call of Duty: World at war - Final Fronts is a first-person shooter game. It focuses is on single-player campaigns, as it has no multiplayer. The game is set in World War II. The player can carry two guns at one time, as well as grenades. Levels are played with a team of soldiers from both Britain and the U.S, that assist the player by killing enemies and completing objectives. The game has been criticised by some critics for the poor AI, which is evident when friendly soldiers push you out of cover and into the enemy line-of-fire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b5w.jpg'),(12005,'Altera',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Altera is a faction-based hardcore troop FPS with RPG and roguelike mechanics. Recruit & hack units, gather resources & gear. Deploy with your troop in the faction based PvPvE game mode Terra Control. Or play the Intrusion Co-op campaign.\n\nDo you really have what it takes to become a troop commander?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xtw.jpg'),(12006,'The Sims 2: FreeTime','2008-02-28','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Now your Sims can rediscover the joys of leisure time in The Sims 2: FreeTime, the seventh expansion pack for the The Sims 2! Awaken your Sims\' true passions in life as they discover and excel at all-new activities. Whether they\'re tossing a football with the family, practicing ballet, restoring cars with friends, or building train sets, your Sims now have more ways to build skills, enhance friendships, and make their lives more successful. Craft new, unique items for your Sims to use in their daily lives including clothing, pottery, and more. Your Sims will even unlock secret rewards by mastering their hobbies and advancing all-new careers. Explore a wide variety of new hobbies that will change your Sims\' lives!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8k9b.jpg'),(12007,'Writer: Chapter 1','2025-01-06','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You, the legendary writer, the “King of Horror,” find yourself at the center of a nightmare. A mysterious place, frighteningly familiar, hides sinister secrets. Explore locations, solve riddles, escape from the monster, collect a story that will become a new masterpiece... if you survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co990d.jpg'),(12008,'MegaRacer QuantumRush','2025-06-30','Racing, Sport, Indie','SteamVR','Experience thrilling VR racing in the vast futuristic city of Mega City. Customize unique vehicles and characters to enjoy your own racing style. Race toward victory with friends and players from around the world in serious yet fun competitions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l4y.jpg'),(12009,'NHL 22: X-Factor Edition','2021-10-11','Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The X-Factor Edition includes:\n- Dual Entitlement\n- Up to 10 HUT Diamond Player Choice Packs (2 per month for 5 months)\n- 5 World of Chel X-Factor Zone Ability Unlocks\n- 2 Be a Pro X-Factor Slot Unlocks, XP Boost, and Bonus Trait Points\n- 5 Unlocked Hockey Bags\n- 3-Days Early Access\n- HUT X-Factor Player Choice Pack (2 of 25)\n- HUT X-Factor Power-Up Starter Pack\n- Up to 4 HUT X-Factor Power Up Packs (1 per month for 4 months, starting in November 2021)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yvq.jpg'),(12010,'Streets of Rage 4: Special Edition','2021-07-15','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Nintendo Switch','This edition includes the following:\n\n- Streets of Rage 4\n- Original Soundtrack CD\n- Poster','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47yv.jpg'),(12011,'War of Ashird',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','War of Ashird is a unique game that combines all the elements of SRPG and the elements of managing your castle. The story focus on a young boy who, by a twist of fate, becomes a key player in the war between three powerful nations: the Prisean Empire, the Kingdom of Ceredia, and the Free Cities\' Alliance. From his humble beginnings, our hero will rise in rank through his mighty deeds on the battlefield-until he commands an army of his own.\nYour choices will shape his destiny, and the future of the Ashird as well...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4t82.jpg'),(12012,'Scooby-Doo! & Looney Tunes Cartoon Universe: Adventure','2014-07-24','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Join the mystery with Scooby and friends and leap into the zany worlds of Looney Tunes in Scooby Doo! & Looney Tunes Cartoon Universe: Adventure. Solve the mystery of Kraken Cove with Scooby, Shaggy and the rest of the Mystery Machine Gang or help Bugs and Daffy discover who is behind the dastardly defective MOCME products that are creating chaos. Solve puzzles and fight enemies as you unlock the mysteries in this exciting cartoon world come to life. Find gifts, safes and treasure chests and use the loot you collect to customize your character and empower them with special ability upgrades.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fk6.jpg'),(12013,'Deep Dungeon Knight','2024-07-07','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deep Dungeon Knight - an immersive 3D rogue-like dungeon adventure where magic and bravery guide your path through treacherous dungeons! Step into the shoes of a valiant knight, wielding powerful spells to combat fearsome monsters lurking in the shadows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lym.jpg'),(12014,'Anthony','2025-01-30','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m1i.jpg'),(12015,'Hakarena Heart: Dare ga Tame ni Kimi ha Aru','2007-02-23','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A PC otome game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5a3k.jpg'),(12016,'Girlfriend Guide','2023-09-03','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Girlfriend Guide is a boys-love romantic comedy visual novel about finding true love, failing miserably to do so and making friends along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bvl.jpg'),(12017,'Cities: Skylines - Sunny Breeze Radio','2021-05-21','Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Cities: Skylines - Sunny Breeze Radio is a DLC for the city simulation game Cities: Skylines. Palm trees sway on the city\'s waterfront as you soak up the sun while the music plays. The waves call to you as you kick off your shoes to the sounds of summery electronic beats. Sunny Breeze Radio matches that mood perfectly with 16 modern synth tracks. Kick back and let everything align to create the perfect summer day chill.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3194.jpg'),(12018,'The Fairly OddParents: Breakin\' da Rules','2003-12-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','PC Version of \"The Fairly OddParents: Breakin\' da Rules\"\n\nThe PC version features a different plot. In this version, Juandissimo Magnifico tricks Timmy into wishing the book destroyed so that Cosmo and Wanda will get in trouble for it. It also notably features an appearance by Vicky and Tootie\'s mother (at Timmy\'s age, as the level featuring her is set in the past), named Nicky. She is shown behaving a lot like Tootie, and Timmy initially mistakes her for Tootie when he first sees her, although the in-game graphics depict her as resembling a young Vicky.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f87.jpg'),(12019,'Seiken Densetsu: Final Fantasy Gaiden','2006-08-16','Role-playing (RPG)','Legacy Mobile Device','A mobile phone port of Final Fantasy Adventure that was released in Japan as part of the World of Mana project.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8du9.jpg'),(12020,'Arcane Raiders','2025-02-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Team up with your wizard friends to pillage the magic tower! Create elemental synergies, defeat powerful bosses and claim the tower\'s treasure in this rogue-like dungeon-raider.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m1p.jpg'),(12021,'Thoom',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','This game title has been an inside joke in community for a while, but it\'s finally here. Behold! The First First-person shooter game in thumby ... Thoom.\n\nThis is a demake version Doom written in MicoPython, with raycasting pseudo-3D and sprite scaling (for upscale only, it looks unrecognizable when downscale).As a proof of concept, there is only one level, filled with Demons and Imps, and locked doors requiring key card to open, and last but not least a small bossfight.\n\nHope you enjoy this short game. And hope you use this project to create something more fun. (sorry for ugly codes)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90xi.jpg'),(12022,'Archaeology: Post-Apocalypse',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12023,'War Room',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12024,'F.E.A.R 3: Collector\'s Edition','2011-06-24','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Alma returns in F.E.A.R. 3 but this time her sons Point Man and Paxton Fettel introduce divergent co-op, giving players distinctly different abilities affecting their own play as well as the experience of their co-op partner. Gamers participate in single player or co-op modes as Point Man, a genetically enhanced super soldier originally introduced in F.E.A.R., or they can play cooperatively as his conniving brother Paxton Fettel, whose incredible telekinetic power has given him life beyond the grave. The game is developed by Day 1 Studios, developer of the original F.E.A.R. console games in collaboration with Monolith Studios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gw4.jpg'),(12025,'Star Wars Battlefront: Outer Rim','2016-03-22','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Blast enemies in the smelting factory or along the industrial pipes and platforms of Sullust or fight through Jabba’s throne room and sail barge garage on Tatooine. New playable hero characters will have you shooting first with Greedo or targeting foes with precision as Nien Nunb. Arm yourself with the new Relby-v10 rifle and DT-12 blaster pistol and collect and equip the Scatter Gun, Dioxis Grenade, and Adrenaline Stim Star Cards. The Outer Rim awaits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h6m.jpg'),(12026,'Infamous Collection','2012-08-28','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3','Infamous Collection is a collection of Infamous, Infamous 2, and Infamous: Festival of Blood, bundled together as part of Sony\'s line of PlayStation Collections for the PlayStation 3. The games feature the same features as their original releases. In addition to the games, the collection features bonus content, including extra missions, and additional character costumes, power ups and weapon styles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rxs.jpg'),(12027,'Lab Rat',NULL,'Puzzle, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This satirical adventure stars a metrics-obsessed AI who will monitor, profile, and entertain you as you progress through over a hundred genre-bending puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9orx.jpg'),(12028,'Unlock the King','2020-03-05','Puzzle, Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','A originally designed puzzle game inspired by Chess. Move the pieces and create a path to Unlock the King.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pdd.jpg'),(12029,'Aquilon Lust: From Chains to Trust',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12030,'Aquarium at August 32nd VR',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12031,'Gangsta Sniper','2018-11-12','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Thirdperson shooter and survival game, where player is gangsta criminal. Mission to rob and collect hidden money bags. Also avoid or kill different enemies like zombies, mutants and cyborg soldiers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ung.jpg'),(12032,'Big City Adventure: Rio','2014-06-11','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pbc.jpg'),(12033,'Feathered Escape','2024-02-24','Platform','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Soar to freedom in Feathered Escape, a platformer where you, as a trapped bird, navigate challenging environments, overcoming obstacles and adversaries to reclaim the open skies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tjl.jpg'),(12034,'Fight For It',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Turn-based, rogue-like adventure of randomness. Roll lots of dice to test your luck.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59me.jpg'),(12035,'Elliot Quest','2017-05-09','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Elliot Quest is an adventure/RPG where players explore the mysterious Urele island in search of an ancient demon. With 5 dungeons to conquer, 16 bosses to defeat, and countless treasures to discover and hidden areas. Well-balanced gameplay easy to pick up but challenging to master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co271s.jpg'),(12036,'Rings of Saturn: Tungsten Edition',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Tungsten Edition contains the game, a separate Original Soundtrack package and Tales from the Rings DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4e4n.jpg'),(12037,'Bitcoin Bounce',NULL,'Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','How far can you travel along the blockchain? Bounce your bitcoin along the blocks and try to land on the combo blocks to boost your score. The aim is to see how far you can get without landing on enemies or missing the blockchain and landing into oblivion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50ig.jpg'),(12038,'Fallen London: The Last Dog Society','2015-08-01','Adventure','Web browser','An addon for Fallen London, the Exceptional Story for August, 2015.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hl7.jpg'),(12039,'Homefront: The Revolution - Freedom Fighter Bundle','2016-05-17','Sin género','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','The Homefront: The Revolution \'Freedom Fighter\' Bundle includes the base game and Expansion Pass, entitling the holder to major single player expansions, and valuable bonuses for your Co-Op career!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ox1.jpg'),(12040,'Bill & Ted\'s Excellent Game Boy Adventure','2023-08-12','Platform','Commodore C64/128/MAX','This is a homebrew port of Bill & Ter\'s Excellent Game Boy Adventure for the Commodore 64, complete with modern improvements.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12041,'Blood','1997-06-20','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','You carved your soul to shreds in servitude to a dark god, but false promises and betrayal were your only reward. Now you have a score to settle and it will be measured in blood! Experience the madness in one carnage-soaked package! All the gore, all the unholy war! Zombies, gargoyles, hellhounds and blood-crazed hordes of horrors await! Crush loathsome evil of the mighty Tchernobog! Or condemn yourself to eternal damnation in this leviathan of unhallowed gaming action!\n\nVisit a dark near-future world populated by hundreds of bloodthirsty enemies. You\'ll engage in a nightmarish battle against the minions of an ancient god bent on wiping humanity from the face of the earth. With cultists, gargoyles, zombies, hellhounds, and an unholy host of other terrors, Blood immerses you in a world of horror unlike any you\'ve experienced before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pkw.jpg'),(12042,'Derpy God',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Derpy God is a 2D side-scrolling real-time strategy game, with chaotic physics-driven battles, set in a fantasy world of gods and mortals. Gather resources, build defenses and send forth your armies in campaign mode, or get creative and craft crazy scenarios in the sandbox.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5g5w.jpg'),(12043,'Strike Witches 2: Iyasu, Naosu, Puni-Puni suru','2010-10-21','Sin género','Nintendo DS','Strike Witches 2: Iyasu, Naosu, Puni-Puni suru was developed by Kadokawa Games for the Nintendo DS. The story is based on Strike Witches Season 2.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12044,'Love Chronicles: Salvation - Collector\'s Edition','2018-03-02','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The evil Alura is back, and this time she’s attacking your homeland!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12045,'All Under Control','2025-03-10','Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"He looked weird the entire time.\"\n\nWhat was meant to be a visit between two friends in São Paulo takes a turn to the macabre when one of them feels compelled to tell a dark story. Alex, a polar bear in his mid 20s, had moved to the city years ago with hopes for a peaceful future. He had another friend back then: a wolf with dangerous habits, who one day took a step too far...\n\n\"All Under Control\" is a short furry horror VN inspired by the works of Stephen King, Junji Ito and Thomas Ligotti.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iqs.jpg'),(12046,'Schoolbound','2025-04-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as a student and discover the Haunted Card Collection of the past and the Ghosts bound to it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9psc.jpg'),(12047,'Sonic Forces: Bonus Edition','2017-11-07','Platform, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Join an epic high-speed fight to save a world decimated by Dr. Eggman and a mysterious villain in the newest game from the team that made Sonic Colors and Sonic Generations. Experience fast-paced action as Modern Sonic, catapult past perilous platforms as Classic Sonic, and use powerful new gadgets as your very own Custom Hero Character.\n\nThe Sonic Forces Bonus Edition comes with an exclusive controller skin and awesome in-game costumes for your custom character. The controller skin design transports you into Sonic\'s universe, featuring Sonic and the mysterious new villain, Infinite. Plus, the costumes from games like Persona 5, Jet Set Radio, Super Monkey Ball, Nights, and will transform your custom character to match characters from these iconic SEGA games. Download the free Episode Shadow add-on when the game launches to fight with Shadow as a playable character!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27vs.jpg'),(12048,'Pokémon Gadir Deluxe','2023-10-01','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pokémon Gadir Deluxe is a reimagining of the original Pokémon Gadir fan-made game. Embark on a new adventure in the Gadir Region, where you\'ll challenge gyms and ultimately face the Pokémon League.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78jv.jpg'),(12049,'Street Fighter V: Collector\'s Edition','2016-02-16','Fighting','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','This special collector’s edition comes fully loaded with digital comics, a hard bound art book, and an over 9” tall Ryu statue sporting his iconic Street Fighter V pose.\n\nIncludes:\n* Street Fighter 5 game disc\n* 10 inch, fully painted Ryu\n* 48-page hardcover art book\n* SFV soundtrack sampler\n* Digital street fighter comics from UDON\n* DLC cards for extra goodies, Twitch one-month Subscription to Capcom Fighters channel','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tq2.jpg'),(12050,'Bubble Pirates',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12051,'Zula','2016-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zula is a free-to-play online first person shooter. In Zula you will discover real unique locations as Istanbul, Northern Iraq and other places of the Middle East, as well as indoor maps. You will totally immerse yourself in the world of Zula thanks to very realistic graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2enq.jpg'),(12052,'Argh! Earthlings!','2017-09-11','Puzzle, Adventure','iOS','Get \"Argh! Earthlings!\" and discover the consequences of an UFO crash, accidentally caused by David, a young, slightly left-handed hobby astronomer.\nExplore the surroundings of over 50 game scenes. Collect various items and combine them by just a simple finger tap. Discover the secret of a little farm and its residents and help the really upset alien named \"Fred\" to escape the earth, but don\'t get caught by the lurking agents...','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12053,'OkunoKa','2018-11-30','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','OkunoKA is a super hard platformer game where you play as Ka, an improbable blue fellow who\'s about to save the world of souls from the evil hands of Os, who is transforming the inhabitants into machines. As the incorruptible and immortal Ka, you’ll be jumping and running through these breakneck lands, purifying the corrupted and attempting to defeat Os. OkunoKA brings the classic, old school run and jump platformer hardness to the next level by adding a new insane layer of reflexes needed. Make your way trough 100+ levels, insane boss battles, hidden secrets, dark worlds and countless of unlockables. OkunoKA is an exclusive for Nintendo Switch!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qvs.jpg'),(12054,'Apocripha/0 Alex Disk','2001-07-27','Strategy, Visual Novel, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Apocripha/0 Alex Disk is a visual novel for PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uvo.jpg'),(12055,'NFL Full Contact','1996-09-28','Sport','PlayStation','With action that\'s even rougher than the XFL (believe it), NFL FULL CONTACT has all of the NFL teams, players, and schedules with an extra dose of aggression. Featuring more than 1,500 motion-captured players and stats based on the 1995 regular season, the game lets you pull from an 80-play offensive book. Play a single game or jump directly to the Playoffs, facing off against a randomly selected bracket of teams. Simple controls allow you to see which buttons will get the ball to which receivers, and four different audibles let you change plays at the last second. A realistic PA announcer adds a touch of stadium ambiance, while a password system ensures that your Playoff progress won\'t be held up by annoyances like work, school, or dinner. Fully flexible camera angles provide detailed coverage, the defensive AI is high, and the action is truly hard-hitting. If you like your football with a little extra oomph, you\'ve come to the right place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zpvjo0wpgbyteibzyotd.jpg'),(12056,'Archaeology: Medieval',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12057,'Ronin: Digital Special Edition',NULL,'Platform, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cea.jpg'),(12058,'Star Hunter DX & Space Moth: Lunar Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Star Hunter DX takes you right back to the 80s with its fantastically stylized design!\n\nHelp the Bounty Hunter Luna Starr track down her former Space Pirate mates after they betrayed her and face off in interplanetary Bullet Hell fights!\nBattle for high scores on the leaderboards and hone your skills in the extensive practice mode!\n\nSpace Moth: Lunar Edition is the updated Version of 1CC\'s vertical arcade shoot \'em up Space Moth DX.\n\nThe core elements are reworked for a brand new intense gamplay experience; the game is set across 5 stages that end in thrilling boss fights with multiple phases!\nDefine your playstyle and choose between the slow but powerful Moth or nimble and fast Hawk!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3g85.jpg'),(12059,'MP1: Rosalina\'s Cosmic Icecap','2018-01-16','Card & Board Game','Nintendo 64','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12060,'Secrets of Me','2020-09-24','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','\"Secrets of Me\" is a game where, after getting plastic surgery, you can stalk a hot guy to get him to fall in love with you! If you\'re tired of typical otome games, then this one\'s for you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55jz.jpg'),(12061,'Brother Wake Up','2020-11-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help your little brother get rid of the \"Clockmaker\'s\" curse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mlt.jpg'),(12062,'Supermarket','2023-02-04','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a atmospheric horror game about a abandoned supermarket but... theres something eerie about this place could be haunted or maybe just squatters find out for yourself by playing this game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63cq.jpg'),(12063,'Batman: Arkham Knight - Batman Flashpoint Skin','2015-06-23','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This addon introduces a costume inspired by the Knight of Vengeance comic book.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fx4.jpg'),(12064,'Fire Emblem: 7 Siblings','2019-02-09','Strategy','Game Boy Advance','The continent has been at an uneasy peace following the fierce Magus war. However, 25 years after the fact, strife bubbles once again. Unanswered questions from the previous conflict abound, with dark forces on the move. One family finds itself at the center of the intrigue. An ailing mother and her seven children must navigate the trials that await them, while clinging to each other as they never have before...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ecj.jpg'),(12065,'The Ultra Mission','2010-07-07','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Ultra Mission is a shooting game where, on each of the eight levels, the protagonist must reach civilians to rescue them. Once all civilians on a level are rescued, the level is complete.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4pcf.jpg'),(12066,'Shadow: Treachery Cannot Be Tolerated','2018-03-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shadow is a role play game. The story revolves around a female underworld mafia boss Shadow. Someone conspires against her to eliminate her power.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12067,'Lost in the Storm',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Lost in the Storm is a single-player first-person mystery game with a little bit of puzzle-solving and action in between. The game is set in Andrew\'s deep subconscious using \"The Light\", a lantern God has given him to defend himself against the darkness and guide him to wake up from his coma.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xsw.jpg'),(12068,'Golden Boy','2021-07-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Golden Boy is a 2D platformer packed with monsters and everyone\'s favorite gold. You need to help the boy collect all the gold in the levels, as well as get rid of annoying bubbles and bats. Sleight of hand and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dr6.jpg'),(12069,'Zaccaria Pinball: Magic Castle Table','2016-06-16','Simulator, Sport, Pinball, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Magic Castle Table is a fantasy vampire themed pinball table.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wyl.jpg'),(12070,'Toki no Tabibito: Time Stranger','1987-01-26','Adventure','Family Computer','An adventure game based on an anime film of the same name, published for the Famicom by Kemco.\n\nToki no Tabibito \"Time Stranger\" is an adventure game with a heavy emphasis on text commands and dialogue, similar to other NES adventure games like Portopia Serial Murder Case or Hokkaido Serial Murders: Fade to Okhotsk.\n\nUnlike Portopia and its sequels, there is very little detective work to be done. The player simply visits important people throughout Japanese history as a time-travelling cop, answering their questions and incrementally moving forwards through time towards the present. Most of the game is depicted in a first-person mode where the other person sits across from the main character, who then asks and answers questions. There are a few third-person sequences where the player must get back inside their spaceship-like time machine before it leaves.\n\nWhile there are a few branching paths depending on dialogue choices taken, the game\'s narrative is fairly linear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jdmfbo5q5olllsmzzwgh.jpg'),(12071,'Thief\'s Roulette',NULL,'Puzzle, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Thief\'s Roulette is a Story-Driven Puzzle game inspired by the Zero Escape and Danganronpa game series. Taking the narrative heavy design of visual novels and combining it with immersive, first person puzzle gameplay, Thief\'s Roulette hopes to be a unique gaming experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nfq.jpg'),(12072,'18th Floor','2025-02-20','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are trapped in a virtual abandoned building created by hackers. Find the escape password, or find the real exit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gue.jpg'),(12073,'Akasen Gairo: Shouwa 33 Nen no Hatsuyuki','2007-11-30','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After the war, there are several districts where people are allowed to open a brothel. The main character is Masayuki. He comes to one of the districts to look for his mother. But he can\'t find her, and is at a loss what to do. Shizue, a brothel prostitute, takes care of him, and he begins to stay at her house.... What will he think when he meets his mother?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bz6.jpg'),(12074,'Ark: Bob\'s Bundle','2024-12-17','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Two epic ARK adventures in one bundle? You bet! ARK: Bob\'s Bundle is the ultimate deal. Get ARK: Survival Ascended & Bob\'s Tall Tales now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9efy.jpg'),(12075,'Super Shinobi Den',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','A unique ninja action game that\'s easy to clear but hard to master—featuring huge jumps inspired by The Legend of Kage and a combo-based scoring system where you spend points to unleash powerful skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o4j.jpg'),(12076,'Overnight Watch','2025-01-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As a new hired employee of Paranormal Security you need to monitor live surveilance cameras and report any anomaly you can find. Can you find them all and will you survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bjh.jpg'),(12077,'Vicera','2024-10-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vicera is an online co-op game. Play as relic hunters, solving enigmatic mysteries and escaping a terrifying monster. Will you dare to face the darkness to find the cursed relics?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90ib.jpg'),(12078,'Bret Airborne','2015-01-29','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bret Airborne shakes up the standard match-3 formula with strategic gameplay and original game mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/crrwrjxrnrejnbwkoq0s.jpg'),(12079,'Golf-e','2003-04-21','Sport','Game Boy Advance','Golf-e is the e-Reader port of the NES game Golf.\n\nIt was distributed as a set of five e-Cards which had to be scanned with the peripheral in order to play the game on the Game Boy Advance.\n\nIt is part of a series of ports of NES games for the e-Reader.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co438f.jpg'),(12080,'Insomnia',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into a world on the edge of death. Insomnia is a horror game mixed with urbex. Chose your path, your own story, survive and complete levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gnm.jpg'),(12081,'XOXO Droplets','2017-08-31','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A massive otome dating sim about a humorously jerky young lady and her mission to woo one of multiple uniquely, but equally, obnoxious guys.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6uw0.jpg'),(12082,'Skyblocker','2025-04-11','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Skyblocker is a 3D puzzle game in which players build towers from toy blocks and try to set a global high score while battling wind and weather. It also features a \"zen\" mode with no scoring or time constraints, so the player can build, relax, and enjoy multiple different picturesque locales.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9olo.jpg'),(12083,'Ninja JaJaMaru: Retro Collection','2023-02-21','Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','5 classic games from the Ninja JaJaMaru world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66nc.jpg'),(12084,'Call of Honor: Solitaire','2020-01-16','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','What will you choose: honor or love?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41rn.jpg'),(12085,'Don\'t Stop Corocco','2020-12-01','Sin género','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12086,'Little Magic','1999-11-26','Puzzle','Game Boy Color','Little Magic is a Puzzle game, developed and published by Altron, which was released in Japan in 1999.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4t7k.jpg'),(12087,'Combat','1977-09-11','Shooter, Arcade','Atari 2600','Combat is an early video game by Atari, Inc. for the Atari 2600. It was based on two earlier black-and-white coin-operated arcade games produced by Atari. Combat had color graphics and numerous gameplay variations. The 27 game modes featured a variety of different combat scenarios, including tanks, biplanes, and jet fighters. The tank games had interesting options such as bouncing munitions (\"Tank-Pong\") and invisibility. The biplane and jet games also allowed for variation, such as multiple planes per player and an inventive game with a squadron of planes versus one giant bomber.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s9a.jpg'),(12088,'Conan Exiles: Debaucheries of Derketo','2019-10-08','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Surrender to your baser desires of lust and excess through the Debaucheries of Derketo Pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66hr.jpg'),(12089,'Rover Mechanic Challenge: ERC Competition','2020-09-14','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','??? ????? ???????? ????????? is an e-tournament based on the world\'s only simulator for repairing Mars Rovers. Take part in solving challenging tasks and become the master of leader board.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5o32.jpg'),(12090,'Buggos','2021-11-02','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Buggos is an RTS Auto Battler where you direct a bug swarm to conquer the planet from the dirty resident humans! You unlock evolution points when defeating the humans in battle allowing you to customize your bug swarm. You are the bad guys! You are the evil bugs! You are here for blood!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kk2.jpg'),(12091,'Paul Quest Gold Edition','2007-03-28','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95lu.jpg'),(12092,'Little Busters! Converted Edition','2009-12-24','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable, Nintendo Switch, PlayStation 2','Since its humble beginnings as a PC game, the \"Little Busters!\" visual novel has continued to evolve. In the past decade, we have seen spin-off games and console adaptations, as well as the release of comic, novel, and anime adaptations.\n\nIt\'s easy to see why; the underlying theme of friendship in this romantic adventure game has had players hooked from the very start.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ta4.jpg'),(12093,'Superfrog','1994-12-31','Platform, Arcade','Amiga CD32, DOS, Amiga','Superfrog is a 2D platformer developed and published by Team17, originally released for the Amiga in 1993. Players control a super-powered frog who must traverse a variety of levels, overcome obstacles, and defeat enemies using different power-ups. The game is noted for its challenging platforming sections and a humorous, whimsical design, and it has since been ported to multiple platforms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p8k.jpg'),(12094,'The Adventures of Pinocchio','1998-12-31','Adventure','Game Boy','Adventures of Pinocchio is a beta version of Ottifanten, an action puzzle game developed by Bit Managers and released in 1998 for the GameBoy, based on some German comics. While there is a released Pinocchio game for the Game Boy mono, \"Adventures of…\" is a completely different title and Bit Managers never listed this one on their homepage, only Ottifanten.\nA playable version of this beta was leaked online, and it\'s often confused for an official released game. Trying out the game shows that you cannot lose any lives – the counter won\'t work. This is no final release and there is none because it\'s an unreleased game.\n\nA closer look at the dump floating around will reveal a weird internal name \"Infrey Quest\", so we can speculate that before Pinocchio and Ottifanten, Bit Managers tried to develop their own original IP. When they did not find any publisher interested in Infrey Quest, they changed the game in Pinocchio and later into Ottifanten, with their more recognized characters.\n\nOttifanten uses the same game concept as well and the same music as Adventure of Pinocchio. It even looks like the basic stage design is the same.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12095,'Goat Simulator 3: Multiversal Traveler\'s Edition','2024-06-19','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5','This bundle includes the base game of Goat Simulator 3 and the Multiverse of Nonsense DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dqh.jpg'),(12096,'Solo Royale',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Solo Royale is an offline, single-player battle royale game. It is a fast-paced battle royale, getting the player immediately into the action. Solo Royale also has a gulag game mode, where the player faces off in a single-elimination 1v1.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5m31.jpg'),(12097,'Laggy Fantasy Tactics',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','LFT is a modification of Final Fantasy Tactics, making some dramatic changes to its gameplay while preserving non-gameplay aspects (the story, characters, etc. have all been left unmodified).\n\nLFT has three main goals:\n1. To improve the usability and balance in all aspects of gameplay, without removing options or impeding on personal preference whenever possible. (classes, items, etc.)\n2. To reduce the necessity of grind and other tedious aspects of the game. (faster JP gain, easier class unlocks, better poaches, etc.)\n3. To streamline the game\'s difficulty so that it remained challenging to a player who previously played FFT, without forcing optimization or any extraneous leveling.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5n5m.jpg'),(12098,'The Ghost of Nichishima','2025-01-31','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inspired by real events and Japanese folklore, this immersive horror experience allows you to freely explore the village of Nichishima, after moving here you will soon realise things are not as they seem. Many scary encounters await you as you look for clues, and ways to conclude your story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xuj.jpg'),(12099,'Draft Day Sports: College Basketball 2022','2022-03-10','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Draft Day Sports: College Basketball 2022 puts you in the role of head coach of your favorite college basketball team. Every decision can be made by you from staff hiring, recruiting, scouting and all the way to making each substitution to lead your team to tournament glory and becoming a dynasty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ic4.jpg'),(12100,'NBA 2K9','2008-10-10','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Improved facial and skin textures, better uniforms, improved eye movement and more realistic crowd reactions bring the game alive like never before. Analyst Clark Kellogg and sideline reporter Cheryl Miller join color commentator Kevin Harlan to create one of the most knowledgeable broadcast teams in the game. End each quarter with enhanced, multiple angle replay highlights, and be rewarded like never before with all-new, true-to-life celebration sequences after you capture the NBA championship.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gn9.jpg'),(12101,'Full Code','2018-07-22','Simulator','Android, iOS','Full Code challenges you to take on complex clinical cases in a realistic 3D emergency room. Whether you are a medical student, resident, paramedic, nurse, PA or experienced physician you will enjoy the challenge of solving Full Code cases. Our library includes over 105 scenarios with a mix of common occurrences, trauma cases, pediatric cases, life-threatening illnesses and obscure diseases that you may only see once or twice in your career. We add 2 new scenarios each month and we frequently cover clinical hot-topics. Earn CME credit hours with realistic medical simulation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55w0.jpg'),(12102,'Spider-Sense Spider-Man and the Masked Menace','2009-12-31','Sin género','Plug & Play','Spider-Sense Spider-Man and the Masked Menace is a Plug It In & Play TV game controller based on Spider-Man.\n\nThe game is a platforming side-scroller with nine levels. The first two levels have you track down the Spider-Man imposter and fight him on the second level. Doctor Octopus is the Masked Menace','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5f8v.jpg'),(12103,'Born Into Darkness','2010-02-10','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Amber Blythe is the night curator at the Bostonian Museum, where she is happily surrounded by artifacts and relics of the past. Considering she\'s spent the last two hundreds years as a vampire, she feels right at home. When the new assistant curator, Nathaniel Black, invites her to help him find the legendary Shroud of Lazarus, the two embark on a worldwide hidden object adventure that may ultimately result in Amber regaining her humanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q3u.jpg'),(12104,'Forsaken Fortress Strategy','2015-09-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Forsaken Fortress Strategy is a squad based, survival strategy game focused on base building and scavenging.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12105,'Simple Sudoku',NULL,'Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play the classic puzzle game of Sudoku! No penalization for mistakes! Backtrack and make corrections just like on pencil and paper. Use the notes feature to speculate or rule out options on any given square. Play casually or beat your highest score by completing the puzzle in the quickest time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fsk.jpg'),(12106,'GoatPunks','2018-11-30','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','GoatPunks is a rip-roaring king of the hill multiplayer game of goats, mountains, fireballs and good ole head-butting action. Can you hoof it to the top and stay there?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ydmeckdcwyqlkpwxcikz.jpg'),(12107,'Do Not Press The Button (To Delete The Multiverse)','2025-04-16','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this game, you can do anything except press the BIG RED BUTTON. Enjoy various activities and find creative ways to not press the button. Don\'t press the button! Do you understand? Inspired by games like The Stanley Parable and Title_Pending.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9515.jpg'),(12108,'Steam Dreams',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Navigate through school rooms, complete mini-games, quests, and interact with characters like bullies, teachers, and teammates.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9le0.jpg'),(12109,'AI: The Somnium Files - Nirvana Initiative: Collector\'s Edition','2022-06-24','Puzzle, Adventure, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Collector\'s Edition includes:\n\n- The game\n- Exclusive figure of the beautiful AI-Ball “Aiba”\n- Artbook featuring concept art and illustrations by Yusuke Kozaki\n- Official soundtrack by returning composer Keisuke Ito','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hbk.jpg'),(12110,'Railworks','2009-06-12','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RailWorks, later simply Train Simulator, is a train simulation game developed by RailSimulator.com Ltd. It is the official successor to Rail Simulator, and was released online on 12 June 2009 and in stores on 3 July 2009.\nCompared to Rail Simulator, RailWorks contained new rolling stock, tools that previously had to be downloaded separately, graphical advancements such as modification of the existing content, bug fixes, backwards compatibility and the ability to trade elements from the virtual world with other users online. The first release of RailWorks contained all of the five real-world routes of the original European and North American releases of Rail Simulator, and added three new fictional routes: a large UK goods yard, a route set in the Alpine region and a route based around Denver, Colorado.\n\nIt is a Steamworks title, which means it uses and requires Steam to activate and to deliver core game updates. Steam is also used to deliver additional routes and locomotives in the form of DLC. The core game has received several free updates since release, including major new versions RailWorks 2: Train Simulator in 2010, RailWorks 3: Train Simulator 2012 in 2011, Train Simulator 2013 in 2012 and Train Simulator 2014 in 2013.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pbotxkm3lrtiog3u2up3.jpg'),(12111,'Emissary Zero','2025-03-28','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Co-op horror (1-4 players). You are sent to explore a mysterious building at night. Find the Moon and try to return alive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jvh.jpg'),(12112,'RGG Land','2022-07-22','Card & Board Game','Web browser','RGG-LAND is a tabletop game featuring random games, where multiple streamers participate in an attempt to reach the Castle on the map and complete the game with special challenging rules.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pim.jpg'),(12113,'Spider-Man 3: Vigilante Vengeance','2007-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Spider-Man 3: Vigilante Vengeance is a handheld game based on Spider-Man.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zmt.jpg'),(12114,'Pandora\'s Box 2','2021-05-05','Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12115,'Vibin\'Vendetta','2023-12-16','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','VIBINVENDETTA is a traditional fighting game inspired by classic flash games from the early 2000s. You play as 14 different characters from the group known as Vibing With the Gang, with their own unique powers and fighting styles, across two different stories and twenty stages. The game is still actively being developed, with it currently in it\'s second version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8910.jpg'),(12116,'Trainz: A New Era - Route: Niddertalbahn','2016-09-26','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An idyllic, single-track branch line in Wetterau- and Main-Kinzig-Kreis - and best of all it\'s free!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12117,'Ariel\'s Daily Grind','2022-12-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After falling miserably into debt, Ariel summons her resolve and starts working jobs to grind her way out of financial ruin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pyd.jpg'),(12118,'Agent Hugo','2005-11-16','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Hugo, the TV troll from the Danish television series, is on his way to start his first day at the espionage agency R.I.S.K. (Risky Intelligent Spy Knights) when he is attacked by members of the sinister organization SUSPECTRA. Their plans are threatening the entire city, but Agent Hugo soon discovers there is even more at stake. The game is played as a platformer with racing elements. Agent Hugo can use the R.I.S.K. Aquapolis boat with heat-seeking missiles and nitro acceleration. It can also dive and regular weapons can be used. While avoiding mines, the vessels can launch boomballs to blow up energy facilities, knock out enemies and open gates. Hugo can also swim and board other types of boats. On land, he has to either attack or sneak past enemies, with several disguises to stay undetected. When discovered, a meter starts to fill up. It can only be depleted by shaking off enemies and finding a hiding spot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p0h.jpg'),(12119,'Tom Clancy\'s Rainbow Six: Vegas 2 / Tom Clancy\'s Ghost Recon: Advanced Warfighter 2','2012-03-30','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9chl.jpg'),(12120,'Immortals Fenyx Rising: A New God','2021-01-28','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','As Fenyx, overcome the legendary trials and challenges of the gods of Olympos to change the Greek Pantheon and fulfill your destiny.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p3s.jpg'),(12121,'Don\'t Mind Liam',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','In this narrative-driven psychological horror game, Andrew, the neighborhood babysitter, has been asked by his parents to watch their friend\'s son, Liam, whilst they go out for the night. Being seventeen, and not minding spending his Friday night making some easy cash, he accepts... but Liam is no ordinary child.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8twr.jpg'),(12122,'Captain Scarlet','2006-12-05','Racing','PlayStation 2','An Europe-exclusive racing game based on the 1960s marionette-based sci-fi series Captain Scarlet and the Mysterons.\n\nCaptain Scarlet is a 3D racing/shooter game based on the TV series Captain Scarlet and the Mysterons (1967-1968). The player takes control of Captain Scarlet who has to protect the world from the Mysterons, an alien race wanting revenge for the destruction of their base on Mars by Captain Black. In the game captain scarlet takes on missions to thwart the plans of the Mysterons. These missions include escorting V.I.P.s, rescuing Captain Blue, destroying a bomb truck and delivering supplies in time. While playing, the player will drive two different vehicles that can fire projectiles - the Spectrum patrol car and Spectrum pursuit vehicle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co728r.jpg'),(12123,'Survivors: Three Kingdoms','2022-11-10','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play with characters from the Three Kingdoms, FIGHT with infinite numbers of enemies, and survive till the end! Make your favorite character to be the legendary hero of the Three Kingdoms by unique skills and various tactics. Fight together with royal adjutants in any battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rhe.jpg'),(12124,'Battlesloths',NULL,'Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Battlesloths is the fast-paced local multiplayer competitive twin-stick shooter of your slothy dreams. Compete with up to 4 human players or play against AI sloths should you be short of friends. Use a myriad of weaponry, each with their own strategies, to destroy your enemies in a quest to collect the most pizza.\n\nWith 12 unique weapons, 7 game modes, customizable battle settings, team vs. options, free for all, a nuke and more hats than you can fit on 50 sloths heads; you’ll have plenty to do as you train to become the ultimate gun-toting, hoverboarding, pizza eating sloth on the block! Revel in the silliness of the slothpacalypse, shoot everything that moves and start hoarding pizza!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26h5.jpg'),(12125,'Adventure Time: Explore the Dungeon Because I Don\'t Know!','2013-11-15','Adventure','PlayStation 3, Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, Xbox 360','Princess Bubblegum summons Finn and Jake to the Candy Kingdom to investigate a rash of thefts and kidnappings that have plagued her kingdom. She thinks the cause lies within her Secret Royal Dungeon, where only the nastiest monsters and criminals are locked up. If they’ve found a way to escape, the Land of Ooo will be in danger! Following the mathematical, algebraic, and radical success of 2012’s Adventure Time: Hey Ice King! Why’d You Steal Our Garbage?!!, show creator Pendleton Ward teams up with developer WayForward in the all-new action game Adventure Time: Explore the Dungeon Because I DON’T KNOW!, and team up with your friends in four-player co-operative multiplayer as the Adventure Time world comes to life through beautiful pixel animations, and voiceover from the original cast.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ezg.jpg'),(12126,'Luigi\'s Mansion','2002-05-03','Adventure','Nintendo GameCube','The European and Australian version of Luigi\'s Mansion differs from the previously released versions by changing the post-game content, the Hidden Mansion mode. While it was just a slightly tweaked harder mode in the other regions, without major differences in level design, this version completely enhances the whole quest by mirroring the map, changing enemy and key items placement, modifying stats and reducing health item locations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ns0.jpg'),(12127,'Lost girl\'s [diary]','2016-03-25','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A group of girls are having their vacation, alone. What would a group of girls do on a dark Christmas night? Of course, fortunetelling! Unfortunately for them, their boyfriends are not about to leave them alone and their sudden visit totally ruins their plans for fortune telling, turning it into a scary story contest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7evu.jpg'),(12128,'Maybe: Interactive Stories - My Ex Is So Into Me','2019-06-20','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','My Ex is So into Me is based off the novel and webtoon, My Ex-Boyfriends Fell in Love With Me. During the events of the book, you control and play as Hana Bom, team leader of Han Bom Door Lock Company. What was thought to be a regular meeting with Wood Rail\'s field team and planning department representatives, Hana comes face-to-face with two men she never thought she\'d see again: her ex-boyfriends! Struggling to keep her work and personal life seperate, Hana finds that not everyone is too happy to see her reunite with old flames. Will she figure out her feelings towards two people she never meant to see again?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5shj.jpg'),(12129,'Birbout!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Birbout! (a.k.a Sunny The Cockatiel) is an arcade platform shooter where you play as Sunny The Cockatiel, unlock weapons, eat seeds, fight Plovers and save Snowy The Cockatiel from Desmond the Cat!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m66.jpg'),(12130,'Restaurant Builder',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Equipped with a high-pressure washer, jackhammer, and a highly addictive spray gun, you face the construction of a restaurant the world has never seen. Tear down walls, build, destroy, paint, and decorate, utilizing real physics, and dynamic lighting to bring empty space to life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i9t.jpg'),(12131,'Armor Clash','2015-10-21','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Armor Clash is an RTS game of modern warfare, containing classic features like base building, unit training etc. Players can pick modern armors such as M1A2, T-14 to form identical legions. With realistic effects and fast paced battle, players will enjoy commanding their armored forces to break down the enemy.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12132,'Urban Skater: Skateboard Delivery City Challenge','2024-06-21','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Urban Skater - Skateboard Delivery City Challenge, an adrenaline-fueled adventure that puts you on wheels – or rather, a board – like never before! Strap on your helmet, grab your skateboard, and prepare to become the fastest (and coolest) food delivery person in town. Race against time, weave through bustling city streets, and deliver piping hot meals to hungry customers in this fast-paced and exhilarating experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ejv.jpg'),(12133,'Beat Me! Puppetonia Tournament','2020-11-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beat Me! - Puppetonia Tournament is a 2-6 player online and local-multiplayer party game. Discover Puppetonia - the kingdom of puppets and join to puppets tournament.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m23.jpg'),(12134,'Minority Report: Everybody Runs','2002-11-18','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','The year is 2054 and you are Precrime Officer John Anderton, head of an elite police force division that can apprehend murderers before the crime can be committed. Everyone thought the system was perfect, until a precrime report lists you as the prime suspect. Now, you\'re on the run through 40 futuristic levels filled with both human and robot enemies in a mission to clear your name. With an arsenal of weapons, hand-to-hand combat skills, and a Jetpack that allows you to fly through levels, it\'s up to you to stop an evil conspiracy before it\'s too late.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1oxa.jpg'),(12135,'Heldric: The Legend of the Shoemaker','2014-03-04','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you enjoy hack-n-slash but longed for a bit more? Maybe you like tower defense games but find them a bit boring? Heldric is a unique mix of the same old styles of game with a few new twists. A hack-n-slash without endless level grinding. A tower defense game with more action. A game where you don\'t play as an epic hero, but as a humble shoemaker who must work together with his fellow villagers to defend their home. \n\nBuild and upgrade the village quickly before the attack waves start. Each building you place adds unique abilities to not only the player\'s character, but your fellow villagers as well. You must choose your structures wisely, as there are only a limited amount of plots available on each map. Every villager contributes to your coin income and provides essential help in defending the town. You must help them defend against waves of monsters intent on killing everyone. Do you have what it takes to survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tcoyr88qi4iy3zgclx9v.jpg'),(12136,'Fun Pack Series Edition','2024-10-24','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Come and have fun with this incredible package with two super fun games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9esl.jpg'),(12137,'Arrow Tourney','2019-09-04','Puzzle, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Match2. Step by step you\'ll have to start thinking to win against your lovely opponents, that will keep distracting you more with less and less cloth on them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lo0.jpg'),(12138,'Cities: Skylines - Campus Radio','2019-05-21','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Relive your freshman year with a collection of College Rock, Teen Pop, Happy Punk, and Power Chord music. Let DJ Claude Couture spin the tracks of your higher education with 16 unique songs!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8343.jpg'),(12139,'Firefighters Together','2025-04-07','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Firefighters Together is a chaotic co-op action platformer where 1-4 players work together to rescue kittens from dangerous, fire-filled maps. Overcome challenging obstacles, extinguish flames, and save those kittens!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f3f.jpg'),(12140,'Battalion Wars','2005-10-27','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','Nintendo GameCube','A global conflict has reached a stalemate in the console version of the Game Boy Advance series Advance Wars. The evil Kaiser Vlad, seeking to take advantage of the standoff, has assembled an army of shock troops, forcing The Western Frontier and the Tundran Territories to ally and fight back. Battalion Wars is a real-time strategy game that lets you control teams of soldiers and vehicles and lead them through more than 20 missions, using a variety of weapons and tactics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p3y.jpg'),(12141,'Azrael',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Azrael is a first-person Detective/Horror Game in which you play as a detective capable of reliving crime scenes. Explore different environments, find clues and try to find out who is the serial killer in a murder case among a group of friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co597k.jpg'),(12142,'Brainium Solitaire','2013-12-09','Point-and-click, Card & Board Game','Android, iOS','Solitaire by Brainium brings you the fun, classic, and challenging Solitaire gameplay you know and love with a beautiful, modern design, and easy-to-read cards. Play solitaire in a space that is completely your own with customizable backgrounds and stunning card decks.\n\nRelax with the most user-friendly version of Solitaire (also known as Klondike or Patience) enjoyed by millions of card game players around the world in this top-rated solitaire app.\n\nBrainium Solitaire has been thoughtfully designed to bring you ease and enjoyment while you play. With clean, uncluttered cards and gameboards, intuitive controls, crisp animations, and relaxing audio, you can play solitaire free of stress and distractions. There is no other card game like it.\n\nSolitaire by Brainium provides card game fans with an unparalleled solitaire game experience. Choose from dozens of card styles, backgrounds, or upload your own custom photo to create the perfect place for you to escape, relax, and sharpen your brain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q7l.jpg'),(12143,'BitCraft','2024-04-02','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','BitCraft is an upcoming Survival Crafting MMORPG which takes place in a procedurally generated sandbox world with a deep skills system and a focus on crafting, economics, cultivating, and city building. There is a single, massive, editable world for all players to interact with and to permanently change. Players can choose to work together to tame the wilderness and create impressive towns and cities. They can even build empires across continents and oceans. At these levels, BitCraft becomes a deeply social and strategic game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9itd.jpg'),(12144,'Sombrero: Spaghetti Western Mayhem','2016-10-27','Shooter, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','To all you desperadoes, drifters, and cowboys, SOMBRERO is calling you out for a rapid-fire game of spaghetti western mayhem for 2-4 players. Choose a character, load up your six-shooters, and lunge through a non-stop hailstorm of bullets and TNT as you race to grab loot and blast your friends with authentic weaponry and …they had exploding rocket-powered fists back then, right?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wpkkl5btl8vmihij4qms.jpg'),(12145,'Don\'t Mess With My Papitas',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Don\'t Mess With My Papitas is a game about saving (lil)potatoes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jb7.jpg'),(12146,'The Hundredth Hike','2025-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Hundredth Hike is an Indie Psychological Horror game, living the story of you, as a mountain hiker, reliving your tragic past and finding the calm of the nature under your boots. Unaware of what lies before you, you unleash a powerful and mysterious truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zy9.jpg'),(12147,'Idle Champions: Triton Glitch Nayeli Skin & Feat Pack','2024-07-24','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this pack: Triton Glitch Nayeli Skin An Epic Feat for Nayeli 7 Gold Nayeli Chests 1 Guaranteed Shiny Equipment Card 6 Epic Blacksmithing Contracts 6 Epic Bounty Contracts','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12148,'Sorcerer Knights','2022-01-01','Fighting, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Fight terrible enemies through a varied fantasy world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5m4l.jpg'),(12149,'Kingpin: Life of Crime','1999-07-01','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kingpin: Life of Crime is a first-person shooter developed by Xatrix Entertainment (now a part of Treyarch) and published by Interplay Entertainment in June 1999. The game begins with the player character wounded and beaten up by the Kingpin\'s henchmen, and the story follows his thirst for revenge. Released shortly after the Columbine High School massacre, the game attracted controversy which led it to be dropped from various retailers, despite receiving moderate critical acclaim.\n\nThe soundtrack for Kingpin was provided by the rap group Cypress Hill, and featured three tracks from their album IV. They were:\n\n- 16 Men Till There\'s No Men Left\n- Checkmate\n- Lightning Strikes\n\nAlongside the full versions of these tracks, instrumental versions with the vocals removed were used as backing tracks. Cypress Hill also provided some of the voice acting for the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xny.jpg'),(12150,'South Park: The Fractured but Whole - Remote Control Coon Mobile Bundle','2017-10-17','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Ubisoft presents the RC Coon Mobile, Cartman’s Coon-themed big wheel. An Amazon exclusive, this collectible is app-enabled, allowing it to turn freely, spin in place and move forward or backwards. The Coon’s personality comes to life with lines from the game!\n\nEric Cartman assumes his gritty crime-fighting alter ego known as The Coon and brings vigilante justice to South Park.\n\nThe Coon and Friends need to work as a team to fight the chaos that grips the town. But a fracture in the group threatens their friendship… and The Coon’s billion-dollar franchise plans. Using the mighty Coon Mobile, The Coon rides into battle to defend his honor, ego and franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5awq.jpg'),(12151,'SID the Spellbinder','1982-12-31','Shooter, Adventure','Odyssey 2 / Videopac G7000','Press 0 on the numeric section of the keyboard.\n\nThe Voice will ask you to \"SELECT SKILL.\" Choose 1 or 2.\n\nPress 1 for the first skill level. Press 2 for the second skill level. (If you don\'t press either, the computer will automatically deliver skill level 2 after about 15 seconds.)\n\nThe Voice will immediately announce: \"MONSTER ATTACK! OPEN FIRE!\"\n\nSure enough! Giant Sid the Spellbinder snakes across the screen. Your only defense is a missile launcher at the bottom of the screen. Use the joystick of either hand control to move your missile launcher to the right or left. Press the action button to fire a missile.\n\nYour ammunition supply is indicated by the number at the lower right hand corner of the screen. You get thirty missiles at skill level 1 and twenty missiles at skill level 2.\n\nIf you do not completely destroy Sid the Spellbinder before it reaches the opening at the lower left and right sides of the screen, it will eat your reserve missile supply starting with the second turn. Sid the Spellbinder consumes five missiles for each of its segments that make it to the opening.\n\nYour score appears at the lower left hand corner of the screen. Every segment you hit is worth progressively more points. The first segment you hit is worth 1 point. The second is worth 2 points. The third is worth 3 points - and so on up through ten.\n\nIf your score is less than 200, Sid the Spellbinder will squeeze its remaining segments together when it goes off the screen. When your score goes over 200, the game gets harder. The gaps will remain open and Sid the Spellbinder moves faster and faster.\n\nThe spelling fun starts when you hit all ten segments of Sid the Spellbinder - or when it reaches the bottom of the screen. - eats some of your missiles - but leaves you with some in reserve.\n\nThe Voice will ask you to spell a word. Type in the letters on the alphabet section of the keyboard. If you make a mistake in typing, press CLEAR.\n\nWhen you think you have typed in the correct spelling, press ENTER.\n\nYou get 10 missiles for every word spelled correctly at skill level 1. You get 5 missiles for every word spelled correctly at skill level 2.\n\nYou will get a chance to spells three words in each round of the game. If you don\'t spell a word correctly the first time, the computer will ask you to try again.\n\nIf you don\'t spell the word correctly on the second try, the computer will spell it for you so you\'ll know how to spell it next time.\n\nAfter each series of three words, Sid the Spellbinder will attack and try to eat your missiles.\n\nThe game ends when you have no missiles left.\n\nTo start a new game, press RESET and then press 1 (for skill level 1) or press 2 (for skill level 2).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23ha.jpg'),(12152,'Unmechanical: Extended Edition','2015-02-10','Platform, Puzzle','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Unmechanical: Extended is an award-winning platformer/puzzle game loved by countless players around the world, now coming to Xbox One with a brand new “Extended” story episode that contains even more puzzles and mysteries to solve. Do you dare enter? Our story starts when you are abducted into a secret underground world full of fantastic machinery. Flying freely through the strange world, you have to solve a wide variety of puzzles and mysteries. The journey to freedom begins! On your adventure you may also begin to understand the reason behind it all - the underworld may be more than it seems, the fateful descent more than just chance, and you might not be entirely alone there after all…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1l7g.jpg'),(12153,'Session: Skate Sim - Year Two Pack','2024-12-19','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Get all the game\'s additional content released between 1 January 2024 and 31 December 2024 in a single pack, and find your new spots in three additional maps, including a school and two iconic locations in Europe: Paris and Prague.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9evl.jpg'),(12154,'Pokémon Garden','2006-07-07','Sin género','Web browser','Pokémon Garden was an online Flash game hosted by Yahoo exclusively in Japan. The game essentially acted as a virtual theme park, where players could chat with each other, play mini-games, schedule rides on the \"Pokémon Special Tour\" attraction, and see previews for the then-upcoming Pokémon Diamond and Pearl Versions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6n29.jpg'),(12155,'Pombero: The Lord of the Night - Reborn','2024-06-06','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Explore the Paraguayan countryside in search of clues to your late mother and survive in a hostile environment filled with myths, rituals, Nazis and black magic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c44.jpg'),(12156,'A Mining Game','2019-07-20','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An idle Mining Simulation game, Compete against other miners to reach the top of the leader boards, Build an army. Climb your way through the combat tower with friends.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12157,'The Gauntlet','2024-01-14','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In The Gauntlet, you\'ll need to move fast and control your every move. Various obstacles stand in your way, and it\'s up to you to find the best way to get through them, taking advantage of your moves and your unique weapon that lets you freeze objects in place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80hu.jpg'),(12158,'Delta','2025-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','∆ is an atmospheric exploration experience that takes you on a journey through the dream world into the Beyond.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co937r.jpg'),(12159,'Tower of Shades','2020-01-16','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tower of Shades is a short game in which you start at the end of the protagonist\'s journey, right at the final boss fight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wgv.jpg'),(12160,'Burning Fight','2008-05-07','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, Neo Geo MVS, Wii, Neo Geo CD, Nintendo Switch','Duke and Billy, two popular and renowned New York City Police detectives, are hot on the trail of a dangerous Japanese crime syndicate. Their investigation has led them to the mean streets of Japan where they meet a police officer and martial arts expert named Ryu. Ryu agrees to join the NYPD detectives as they track down the crime syndicate bosses and end their reign of terror once and for all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/n7x7qeqtdlxcswpmf5uv.jpg'),(12161,'Air','2000-09-08','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Air is a Japanese visual novel developed by Key that follows the story of the life of Yukito Kunisaki, a traveling showman searching for the \"girl in the sky\". He arrives in a quiet, seaside town where he meets three girls, one of whom is the key to the end of his journey. The gameplay in Air follows a branching plot line that offers pre-determined scenarios with courses of interaction and focuses on the appeal of the three female main characters by the player character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76v4.jpg'),(12162,'Almost Tennis','2022-11-14','Sport, Indie','Playdate','Fast paced pong-like game for the Playdate','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81qa.jpg'),(12163,'Ghost Haunt',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ghost Haunt is a thrilling multiplayer horror game that pits players together as the Ghost Hunter or the Ghost or against the AI. Four brave Ghost Hunters face off against one cunning Ghost in a chilling battle for survival to capture them all! and learn from them.\n\nThe Ghost Hunters are equipped with an arsenal of paranormal equipment to track, identify, and banish the spectral adversary. They must work together, using communication and strategy to survive the haunting. The team\'s ultimate goal is to capture enough evidence to banish the Ghost before time runs out.\n\nThe Ghost, on the other hand, is a master of terror. Using a variety of supernatural abilities, the Ghost must terrorize and eliminate the Ghost Hunters one by one. The Ghost can possess objects, manipulate the environment, and even directly attack the Hunters. Victory for the Ghost means driving the Hunters to insanity or eliminating them all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6y7d.jpg'),(12164,'South Park: The Fractured But Whole - SteelBook Gold Edition','2017-10-17','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','From the creators of South Park, Trey Parker and Matt Stone, comes an outrageous sequel to 2014\'s South Park: The Stick of Truth. In the quiet mountain town of South Park, darkness has spread across the land. An entire squad of superheroes will rise to combat this evil, led by a nocturnal scavenger sworn to clean the trash can of South Park society. Create your superhero and use your superpowers to save South Park so Coon and Friends can take their rightful place as the greatest team of superheroes ever assembled, and get the movie deal they so richly deserve.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27vm.jpg'),(12165,'Hatsune Miku: VR Future Live','2016-10-13','Sin género','PlayStation 4','Hatsune Miku: VR Future Live is the premier virtual reality concert experience.\nStarring the digital diva herself, Miku\'s show is exclusive to PlayStationVR.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tya.jpg'),(12166,'Duke Nukem: Total Meltdown','1997-12-02','Shooter','PlayStation','Aliens have landed in futuristic Los Angeles and it\'s up to the Duke to bring the pain and show them the door. After the initial entries of side-scrolling platform games, Duke Nukem 3D introduces a first-person perspective to the series and turns the game into a full-fledged shooter with 2.5D graphics.\n\nDuke\'s arsenal includes pistols, pipe bombs, laser trip mines, Nordenfelt guns, a chain gun and various rocket launchers, but also his mighty foot to kick enemies. The game sports a high level of interactivity. Many objects in the environment can be broken or interacted with, such as pool tables, arcade machines, glass, light switches and security cameras. The protagonist is also able to hand strippers a dollars to have them remove their top.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3btw.jpg'),(12167,'Almighty: Kill Your Gods','2021-05-05','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hunt demons, monsters, and gods solo or online with friends in this action RPG. Run, leap and fly across islands, ripping your foes to pieces, and rebuilding your home with their remains. Bring low the oppressive false gods, protect your kindred and become Almighty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29r2.jpg'),(12168,'Survival Z','2021-09-30','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','There are 3 rules for surviving the zombie apocalypse: Shoot, Survive, Repeat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42r0.jpg'),(12169,'Metal Gear Solid V: Ground Zeroes + The Phantom Pain','2016-11-10','Shooter, Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','The ultimate collection of the Metal Gear Solid V story, including Metal Gear Solid V: Ground Zeroes, Metal Gear Solid V: The Phantom Pain and all their DLC content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kox.jpg'),(12170,'Jumpers League',NULL,'Platform, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A competitive online multiplayer platformer where every jump is a gamble. Climb to the top while using strategic abilities to outsmart your opponents, but beware: one misstep can cost you all your progress.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fo3.jpg'),(12171,'ACA Neo Geo: 2020 Super Baseball','2018-02-08','Sport, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Super Baseball 2020 is a baseball game released by SNK in 1991. In the near future, there are two leagues with 6 teams each. Players pick their team, and compete for the championship. As the game progresses, landmines will be set up on the field, and armor can be purchased during games to reinforce players. These unique aspects make for a very different baseball experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qx3.jpg'),(12172,'Rewarding Community Bundle','2022-08-04','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Chill out with the meditative, town-building toy Townscaper, then wind yourself up with our hit, roguelite, bullet-hell title, Atomicrops! Both base games are included.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co520g.jpg'),(12173,'Go-Gurt Factory!','2006-12-31','Platform','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pyr.jpg'),(12174,'Condemned: No Escape',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Condemned: No Escape is an adventure puzzle game inspired by the Game Boy era. Explore a mysterious place filled with destructive platforms, traps, and holes. Use your wits and precise jumps to collect keys, unlock paths, and uncover secrets as you try to escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gwi.jpg'),(12175,'Justice League: Chronicles','2003-11-12','Platform','Game Boy Advance','Justice League: Chronicles is a video game based on Justice League. It was released on November 12, 2003. This game has three levels; each level has two characters. In the first stage, they are Green Lantern and Flash; in the second, Batman and Hawkgirl; and in the last, Superman and Wonder Woman.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ycu.jpg'),(12176,'Tatsunoko vs. Capcom: Ultimate All Stars','2010-01-26','Fighting','Wii','In Tatsunoko vs. Capcom, players engage in combat with teams of two characters - owned by Capcom or Tatsunoko Production - and attempt to knock out their opponents. The game is set in a 2.5D environment; characters fight in a two-dimensional arena, but character models and backgrounds are rendered in three-dimensional graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ydx.jpg'),(12177,'The Charity Shop','2025-02-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An adventure game where you must use your camera to capture the essence of a life lived. To this end, you have been delivered before The Charity Shop, the place where people donate unwanted belongings—each carrying an imprint of the time they once shared.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pz6.jpg'),(12178,'The Talos Principle: Road to Gehenna','2015-07-23','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This substantial expansion consists of four episodes that take experienced players through some of the most advanced and challenging puzzles yet. The Talos Principle writers Tom Jubert and Jonas Kyratzes have returned to pen the expansion and show players an entirely different side of Elohim\'s world through a journey to Gehenna filled with new characters and a new society with its own history and philosophy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ocxrz6rlc3l8v1mtduw9.jpg'),(12179,'Super Smash Bros. for Nintendo 3DS: Roy','2015-06-14','Fighting, Platform','Nintendo 3DS','Super Smash Bros. Melee veteran Roy from the Fire Emblem series joins the fight once again!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45q9.jpg'),(12180,'Rock of Destruction!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12181,'ReactorX 3','2024-11-28','Sin género','Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9evf.jpg'),(12182,'Sakuya-san Tactics','2011-12-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co503w.jpg'),(12183,'Touhou Spell Bubble: Character Pack - Seija Kijin','2022-08-18','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','The 4th additional character pack is already available! Introducing \"Seija Kijin\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53q4.jpg'),(12184,'Classic Card Games 3D','2018-11-27','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','15 of the best classic card games in the world in great 3D graphics! Compete with virtual opponents in Rummy, Canasta, Poker, Gin Rummy, Crazy Eights, Blackjack and many more! Each game offers a huge amount of rule variants, rooms, tables and more: a must-have for every card game lover!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n88.jpg'),(12185,'Get Mushi Club: Minna no Konchuu Daizukan','1999-08-13','Adventure','Game Boy Color','Get Mushi Club: Minna no Konchuu Daizukan is an adventure game for Game Boy Color, released by Jaleco on 1999.\n\nA game for collecting insects in which the main character is brought to another world by a fairy and ends up catching 200 different insects in order to return to the original world. Use a magnifying glass to search the map or the destination screen to catch insects. Insects live in different places depending on the species, and the insects that appear are real.\n\nTime passes all the time during a game, and for every second that passes, one minute of in-game time passes. The day in the game also starts at 7:00 AM and ends at 9:00 PM, so there are 14 hours of activity per day. Each day in the game changes over time, which can change the insects you catch. Other in-game times can be advanced by fiddling with the clock on the screen.\n\nInsects collected during the game may be viewed from the game title or from an illustrated book during the game. The total number of insects featured is 310, and sampling 200 of these insects is the ending. The collected insects can also be exchanged with other players via a link cable. At the beginning of the game, players are told that they have to catch 200 different insects in 30 days, but even after 30 days, no penalty such as game over is imposed.\n\nThe game cartridge is a vibrating cartridge equipped with a vibration function, and by setting AAA batteries in the cartridge, it will vibrate when an insect is caught, etc. Also included in the game software was an appendix 昆虫図鑑ミニブック( Insect Pictorial Book Minibook), which contained information on insects appearing in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c9n.jpg'),(12186,'Dinobreak: Chronicles of Horror Collection','2024-12-28','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Dinosaurs, zombies, and more await!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e9n.jpg'),(12187,'Hellscreen','2023-03-09','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Hellscreen is a single player level based first-person shooter for PC, in the fast, frantic style of classic FPS games from the 1990s (such as Doom, Quake, Unreal etc).\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42a7.jpg'),(12188,'Exit16: Byilhan Hotel','2025-03-25','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Exit16: Byilhan Hotel\" is a \"walking simulator\" & \"Spot the Difference\" game. The game challenges players to unravel hidden anomalies strewn across the enigmatic corridor of the Byilhan Hotel.\n\nEach floor of the hotel presents a unique canvas, with some adorned by the peculiarities of anomalies while others maintain an eerie semblance of normalcy. Your task is to discern the subtle nuances that distinguish the ordinary from the extraordinary, as every object, every angle, and every shadow holds a potential clue.\nTraverse the hallways with caution, for not all anomalies reveal themselves readily.\n\nIf you suspect there is an anomaly, turn back. If you believe everything is normal, that there are no anomalies, do not turn back and continue down the corridor. If you make a mistake, you will know by looking at the level number. If the number has increased, you have made the correct choice. If you return to level 1, you have made a mistake and will need to start over (the anomalies will be different). The goal is to reach the final level.\n\nNavigate the twists and turns of the Byilhan Hotel, unraveling its mysteries one anomaly at a time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cc0.jpg'),(12189,'Challenge of the Tentacle','2022-06-06','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Challenge of the Tentacle is a free point and click escape room adventure fangame inspired by Maniac Mansion, Day of the Tentacle and Maniac Mansion Mania.\n\nOn a beautiful morning with chirping birds and sunshine, it seems a new beautiful day begins for the whole world. But no one knows that a catastrophe could happen that day. An evil, tyrannical, purple tentacle wants to take over the world. On this seemingly wonderful morning, our well-known protagonist, Bernard, renowned physicist and chemist, wakes up muddled. He still doesn\'t know that on this day he has to prove that he is a genius and has not, like so many others, studied in vain. But he\'s starting to remember the Purple Tentacle\'s visit and their argument about world domination, which ended with a cup of tea, his heavy, drooping eyelids and Purple Tentacle\'s malicious grin.\n\nHe is locked in his bedroom with many puzzles provided by Purple Tentacle to challenge and prevent him.\n\nHelp Bernard to solve these challenging puzzles, because with each solved puzzle he gets a little closer to the key that opens the door and thus also to the means created in his laboratory with which he can save the world from conquest. Solve logical, amusing and motivating puzzles that challenge not only Bernard, but YOU as well.\n\nInspired by Maniac Mansion, Day of the Tentacle and Maniac Mansion Mania.\nHumorous game that combines point and click adventures with escape room tasks.\nWith many allusions to all adventures by LucasArts.\nVarious types of puzzles, from classic inventory usage to brain teasers.\nYou will find out the result of your performance at the end of the game: very good, good, satisfactory or bad.\nAnd the best at the end: it costs nothing! It helps curb inflation!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5a82.jpg'),(12190,'It\'s another hack with Mario in it! Yay!','2015-11-03','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Help Mario to run and jump over stuff! Oh, and save some baby Yoshi eggs, too.\nThis hack has custom music and palletes, several simple ASM edits, some altered graphics and an original overworld. The demo contains the first four worlds and 41 available exits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7l98.jpg'),(12191,'Holiday Jigsaw Christmas','2022-03-17','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','HO HO HO! Unforgettable adventure waits you in Holiday Jigsaw! Start your journey with a Merry Christmas!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ecd.jpg'),(12192,'Propagation: Paradise Hotel','2023-05-04','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR','Live an intense VR survival horror adventure with gripping storytelling, in which you will explore dark environments, make terrifying encounters and get your adrenaline pumping. Will you find your way out of the Paradise Hotel alive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vjy.jpg'),(12193,'Viewtiful Joe: Double Trouble!','2005-11-02','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Nintendo DS','You can play a movie action hero turned real action hero in Viewtiful Joe: Double Trouble. Viewtiful Joe: Double Trouble is a cel-shaded, side-scrolling action game that combines both puzzle-solving and platformer gameplay. Viewtiful Joe: Double Trouble makes use of both screens and the touch capabilities of the Nintendo DS to help you solve puzzles and progress through the game. Joe\'s sister, Jasmine, also makes her first appearance in the series to help him out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d7d.jpg'),(12194,'Happy Hike','2025-03-29','Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Take a Relaxing Walk Through Beautiful Trails','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9km2.jpg'),(12195,'Brawl Minus','2010-03-27','Fighting','Wii','The original \"Broken\" mod that Inspired countless others and spawned a genre of mods that spans every iteration of the Smash Bros series since.\n\nNew characters, new stages and new aesthetics across the board. A simple idea dominates the design. \"If everyone is broken, nobody is\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kyd.jpg'),(12196,'Dirge of Cerberus Lost Episode: Final Fantasy VII','2006-08-18','Sin género','Legacy Mobile Device','Dirge of Cerberus Lost Episode: Final Fantasy VII is a fully-voiced mobile phone game and is a midquel to the original Dirge of Cerberus: Final Fantasy VII third-person shooter game for the PlayStation 2. It featured only a single-player mode, but Multiplayer became available later on. As the infrastructure required to switch episodes was shut down, the ability to fully play the game ended on March 31, 2018.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42jj.jpg'),(12197,'Moe Waifu H Genius','2024-09-13','Puzzle, Quiz/Trivia','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Win the maidens’ hearts through mastery of rhythm and memory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s47.jpg'),(12198,'Super Smash Bros. for Nintendo 3DS: Ryu','2015-06-14','Fighting, Platform','Nintendo 3DS','Ryu joins the world of Super Smash Bros. to continue his quest to be the strongest, and he even brought his own stage! Enter his famous button combos to power up his special moves!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45qo.jpg'),(12199,'Ion Assault','2009-12-31','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','In Ion Assault players wield thousands of Ion Particles to blast, fry and disrupt anything on screen as you see fit! By centering its gameplay around its unique fluid and particle physics system, Ion Assault adds a twist to arcade style space shooters!\n\nUtilizing its dynamic level intensity, Ion Assault is both accessible for the beginner as well as challenging for the skilled gamer. The faster you destroy obstacles, the more enemies the game will throw at you, so play it safe and clear one obstacle at a time or go crazy and see how many enemies the game can throw at you for a maximum score!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co447s.jpg'),(12200,'Anatidae','2021-05-25','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Anatidae is a precision platform game about a little duck with amazing skils. Your objective is catch the max golden eggs that you can! Do you have what it takes to go throug all the challenges?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31gg.jpg'),(12201,'Donald Duck\'s Speedboat','1983-02-01','Racing','Atari 2600','Donald has entered the Duckburg boat race and has taken to the sea with his speedboat. The objective is to steer the boat away from the obstacles along the way to the finish line and do so as fast as possible without losing pressure on the throttle. The game takes place across multiple screens which each presents its own obstacle patterns and challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rxuaclf5shgnh8ukkizp.jpg'),(12202,'Starlight Alliance','2021-10-13','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Starlight Alliance is an action RPG, featuring two playable characters – Cyris and Lea. If you like fast third-person shooter gameplay with plenty of character development, exploration, and puzzle-solving, Starlight Alliance is the game for you! Likewise, if you’re into shooting annoying drones that tell you to get back to work, we got you covered. Starlight Alliance has it all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z19.jpg'),(12203,'Meow Moments: Celebrating Geeks & Athletes','2025-04-30','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Join cute cats in festive scenes! Find feline friends and pop balloons as you explore Olympicats—a thrilling global sports event—and Comic Cat Con, an exciting pop culture convention.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r7y.jpg'),(12204,'Pinko Linko\'s School',NULL,'Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pinko Linko\'s School is a game I dug up not too long ago when I was visiting my grandparents. I found it while searching for some old tennis equipment in there storage. The box indicated that it was made in 1998, and yes, you can truly see that it is from that era. The first Doom game also came out in 1998, so this must have been some kind of kids-learning-toy-doom-clone. Anyway, I got it running and managed to rip the files, so here they are!\n\nSide note: I rebinded all the keys from being the arrow keys to wasd, also there were some things in the game that were kind of [REDACTED], but that might have just been me. When you are done with the game you can take a look in the YouWon folder, I left [REDACTED] in there,','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8l2c.jpg'),(12205,'Zone Sega','2010-12-31','Sport, Arcade','Plug & Play','Zone Sega (or Sega Zone) is a plug-in-and-play video game console first released in 2010. The console is built suspiciously like the Wii, having wireless controllers that look similar to television remotes and that respond to movement. It retails at £50 in the UK.\n\nThe Zone Sega is built off a similar console called the \"Zone 40\" (with 40 games) which in turn was built off the \"Zone Wireless Gaming Console\" (with 7 games). With the Zone Sega there are 50 built in games, 20 of which are Sega Mega Drive titles, 14 are \"arcade games\" and 16 are \"Interactive Sports games\" which make use of the motion control technology.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sh5.jpg'),(12206,'For a Vast Future: Deluxe Edition','2023-09-15','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Experience a dystopian future and bring down the government, evil cults, and even more villains standing in your way.\nSink into a classic RPG, and wait for your turn to stop Doomsday from happening!\n\nThe people of Seralia experienced a devastating war. While most of them fight over scraps, the corrupted government schemes to take revenge using a secret weapon – secret and deadly. Join a group of heroic outlaws and stop this madness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78iw.jpg'),(12207,'Stitchy in Tooki Trouble','2021-03-11','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Run, jump, slide, slam and glide to rescue your stolen corn in Stitchy in Tooki Trouble, out now on the Nintendo Switch! This colorful all ages adventure game is perfect for single player gaming on the go! Can you defeat the Tooki bosses,discover the secret levels, and collect all your missing corn?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xx1.jpg'),(12208,'Outbreak: Shattered Dreams Collection','2024-10-18','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e9x.jpg'),(12209,'Iós','1995-09-01','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e8p.jpg'),(12210,'Danger Mouse: The Danger Games','2018-09-13','Racing, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','In this insane race showdown of epic proportions, you’ll play as the world\'s greatest secret agent, Danger Mouse, starring in Quark’s latest reality TV show, The Danger Games. Speed through city streets, battle enemies, and dodge explosions as you struggle for first place! Will you make it to the finish line in one piece?! Play as Danger Mouse, Jeopardy Mouse, Colonel K, Penfold, or a host of other lovable heroes and nefarious villains from the hit BBC show, Danger Mouse. Gain new character and item cards with each win that can be used to activate new attacks in races, or enhance and strengthen your characters. The Danger Games on Nintendo Switch also supports up to 4 Joy-Con controllers on one device, so you can face off against your friends from the comfort of your living room (or anywhere else!).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57dr.jpg'),(12211,'There\'s a Gun in the Office','2025-02-20','Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ifk.jpg'),(12212,'Adventures in Adventureland',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12213,'Atari Recharged Bundle: Gravitar + Missile Command','2024-11-20','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Atari\'s Recharged series modernizes classic titles with power-ups, challenges, local multiplayer, and all new soundtracks by Megan McDuffee.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eg2.jpg'),(12214,'Al Qmrah Restaurant','2024-07-12','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive the night in AL QMRAH RESTAURANT with a 4-Player co-op survival horror set in a real-life restaurant, players take on the roles of restaurant workers completing closing tasks while facing haunted kitchen creatures and keeping the restaurant stable to find there way out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53tv.jpg'),(12215,'MindMindMind','2024-03-29','Adventure, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"I’ll love you no matter how messed up you are...\"\n\nA man has stalked you ever since you were a child. You call him Geist. You\'re not sure who...or what he is. When you befriend a new boy at college, Geist will do anything to keep you in his grasp.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8108.jpg'),(12216,'Crunky','2022-06-03','Indie, Arcade','Playdate','An endless jumping game where you have to die to expand your Crunkipedia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zfa.jpg'),(12217,'Hell Let Loose: Wacht am Rhein Units','2024-11-27','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S','Add the Wacht am Rhein Units DLC to your collection and be a part of the battle at Elsenborn Ridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ezx.jpg'),(12218,'Blair Witch: Deluxe Edition','2019-08-30','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This edition contains:\n\n- Blair Witch base game.\n- Blair Witch Original Soundtrack\n- The Art of Blair Witch','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i8u.jpg'),(12219,'Dungeon Hack','2022-03-29','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','Welcome to Dungeon Hack. Explore countless new dungeons in a game that never has to be the same twice. Send your character on quest after quest, down through the many pits, traps, and puzzles of Dungeon Hack. Take control, if you wish and generate a new dungeon for every game. The random dungeon generator gives you the power to create a strikingly fresh layout every time. There other games allow a few novel choices the second time around, Dungeon Hack delivers many combinations of play, a variety of magical and non-magical items to be found in each game, and a bestiary stocked with over fifty formidable foes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74hl.jpg'),(12220,'Nestables',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Nestables is an interactive crypto-collectible game for all ages, which will allow gamers to collect, trade and breed 3D ‘Cubes’, each of which has their own unique personality and physical traits. Interact with your Cubes through designing, creating and decorating their ‘Nest’. Task your Cube with collecting resources or building improvements for the Nest or allow them to relax and play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28ny.jpg'),(12221,'Magic Ocean: Multiplayer Roguelike','2020-11-03','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Magic Ocean\" is a turn-based roguelike game with simultaneous orders, where you can play not only against AI but also against other players. Destroy opponents’ ships, choose various options for the development of your ship, take your place among the best.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l2w.jpg'),(12222,'Thought Experiment Simulator','2024-07-23','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Trolley Problem, Ship of Theseus, Brain in a Vat, Infinite Monkey, Sisyphus, Prisoner Paradox, Schrodinger\'s Cat, etc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c58.jpg'),(12223,'Tatoe Sore ga Ningyou Demo','2018-10-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A doujin game by Nuu based on the Touhou Project series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co777y.jpg'),(12224,'Worms Armageddon','1999-11-30','Shooter, Platform, Strategy','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Nintendo 64, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable, Dreamcast','Those intrepid invertebrates return with a vengeance in the much-loved Worms Armageddon. It’s a whole new can of worms! It’s hilarious fun that you can enjoy on your own or with all your friends.\n\nWorms Armageddon was originally developed as an expansion pack to Worms 2 and initially titled Wormageddon before it was released as a standalone game. Worms Armageddon was acclaimed by critics, who praised the refined gameplay and stylized graphics, and it has been featured in a number of \"greatest games of all time\" lists. Worms Armageddon is still updated periodically as of 2020, and was released on the Steam platform in 2013.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rkc.jpg'),(12225,'Dark Souls III: Collector\'s Edition','2016-04-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Dark Souls III: Collector\'s Edition is a special edition released alongside the game in April 2016. It includes:\n\n-10\" Red Knight Statue\n-Prima Starter Guide\n-Official Dark Souls III Soundtrack\n-Official art book\n-Cloth game map\n-Collector\'s box\n-Dark Souls III Software','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22hr.jpg'),(12226,'Lara Croft and the Temple of Osiris: Twisted Gears Pack','2015-02-03','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Twisted Gears pack adds a brand new tomb for Lara and her companions to explore and also includes the Original 1996 Lara Skin which will take fans on a nostalgic trip back to her first adventures as well as exclusive rings, amulets, and the Cluster Bomb Launcher.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gwh.jpg'),(12227,'Zen of Clover',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12228,'Chrono Odyssey',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Chrono Odyssey is a fantasy MMORPG game. In the upcoming MMORPG, players can pick one of six distinct character classes: Swordsman, Paladin, Ranger, Sorcerer, Berserker, and Assassin. Each comes with unique playstyles and mechanics to facilitate cooperative gameplay and roleplaying.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vs6.jpg'),(12229,'Super Smash Bros. for Wii U: Non-scrolling Pac-Land',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12230,'Arcade Combat','2024-10-30','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','If the world of all video games collapses, who wins the battle between them? Protect your video game assets and destroy them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m1o.jpg'),(12231,'Variables','2019-07-30','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','We created this unique single player game with a combination of Tower Defence and Roguelike. Come and create your maze, build your turret, defeat the invaders, and save the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oj1.jpg'),(12232,'Dino Dana: Dino Exhibit',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12233,'Miraculous: Paris Under Siege - Deluxe Edition','2024-10-25','Platform, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Miraculous: Paris Under Siege - Deluxe Edition contains the base game, as well as an exclusive Digital Art Book, two new outfits, and two new visual effects for Ladybug and Cat Noir.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91z2.jpg'),(12234,'MasterChef: Learn to Cook! - Christmas Special','2024-12-21','Sin género','Xbox One','Christmas is here! Roll up your sleeves and cook up a holiday feast worthy of a number one chef!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f2r.jpg'),(12235,'Second Sight','2021-04-08','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Second Sight is primarily stealth-action, using psychic abilities to stealthily move through levels. Due to it\'s dark atmosphere, it could be considered a psychological thriller. The game focuses on John Vattic\'s exploration of his own mind, discovering psychic abilities and a dark history before his amnesia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wii.jpg'),(12236,'Shadow Warrior Collection','2017-05-19','Fighting, Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','The Shadow Warrior Collection includes both the first Shadow Warrior and Shadow Warrior 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kbw.jpg'),(12237,'Robot Squad Simulator X','2020-05-01','Simulator','Xbox One','In Robot Squad Simulator you take role of an operator of remote-controlled robots used during military missions, spy missions and rescue operations. Among the machines there are ones that move through surface and there are flying and underwater drones. The main part of the gameplay is sixteen story missions that take place in varied areas scattered across the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26mb.jpg'),(12238,'Who Wants to Be a Millionaire: Flash Edition','2009-03-19','Quiz/Trivia','Web browser','Who Wants to Be a Millionaire: Flash Edition is a fanmade Flash game based on the game show Who Wants to Be a Millionaire created by Newgrounds user Frenzy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y3o.jpg'),(12239,'Cinnamoroll Fuwa-fuwa Daisakusen','2005-12-01','Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Cinnamoroll FuwaFuwa Daisakusen is a Simulation game, developed and published by Rocket Company, which was released in Japan in 2005.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kk5.jpg'),(12240,'Army Men 3D','1999-03-28','Arcade','PlayStation','The little plastic army men you played with as a child are toys no longer! They are now living beings bent on destruction. Of course, you get to play an integral role in the conflict as Sarge, a sergeant (you were expecting another rank?) in the Green Army. While your objectives vary with each mission, the goal is to defeat the evil Tan Army using a little strategy and a lot of firepower.\n\nSince you\'ll also have to confront members of the Blue and Gray armies, you are essentially outnumbered three to one! Roll, duck, kneel, and cycle through your available weapons as you try to complete the objectives detailed at the beginning of each level. Missions range from search-and-destroy to rescue or reconnaissance operations, and you\'ll even drive one of four vehicles during the battles. Units include versions of six classic toys: Rifle Man, Grenadier, Bazooka Man, Mortar Man, Flamethrower, and Minesweeper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pgb.jpg'),(12241,'Pacific Drive: Frosted Customization Pack','2024-11-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Decorations, a little hot cocoa, and cozy friends are all you need to hibernate for the season. Prepare for the cold and decorate your station wagon with winter themed cosmetics!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g3g.jpg'),(12242,'Mad Way','2023-07-21','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mad Way is a game where you have to climb a strange universe without falling to find your love!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qc6.jpg'),(12243,'Oakwood Academy of Spells and Sorcery','2018-03-26','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Oakwood Academy of Spells and Sorcery is a fun adult visual novel filled with romance and adventure. You play as Thomas Middleton, a first-year student, who tries to get by while encountering a diverse set of wacky and fascinating characters along the way!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12244,'Mystic Store','2008-12-31','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Open the shop and return it to its former glory. Long ago, an elf named Loriel created and sold artifacts in a cozy little shop. When he moved away, there was no one to take over. Although new to magic, you have decided to re-open the shop and return it to its former glory. As customers place their orders, you must race to create the items they want. If your guests have to wait too long, they become impatient and eventually leave. Not to worry, though. You can use spells that help you collect the elements you need, and enchantments that will make your patrons happy again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gkl.jpg'),(12245,'Otome wa Boku ni Koishiteru Portable','2010-04-29','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','This is Playstation Portable version of the eriotic visual novel of the same name.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pdx.jpg'),(12246,'Hunt them',NULL,'Fighting, Shooter, Indie','Sin plataforma','Hunt them is a survival zombie shooter game in which you are last army man survival and has to stop zombie from kill you and the town.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ic2.jpg'),(12247,'Back to 1998','2019-04-15','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Do you love point & click adventures from the 90s? You\'re in right place! Become a hero, who is solving puzzles in different locations doing his best to get back to his home and family. Lot\'s of gadgets from those times, good sense of humor and unforgettable dialogs, which will entertain you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nii.jpg'),(12248,'Pika Pop','2002-08-24','Music, Arcade','Game Boy Advance','Pika Pop is an e-Reader game in which players use Pikachu to kickstart malfunctioning speakers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61sk.jpg'),(12249,'Vampire Survivors: Space 54','2024-02-29','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The 1.9 update for Vampire Survivors adds a new stage, Space 54, and new weapons and character inspired by the original VS framework, Phaser. Some bat content also is part of the update.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t37.jpg'),(12250,'King\'s Gambit',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','King\'s Gambit is a Cooperative Dungeon Crawler Roguelite inspired by Chess! Every run offers a fresh strategic challenge as you build and customize your buffs and abilities card deck. Choose from several playable characters, weapons and spells and embark on a solo or co-op turn-based adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xyb.jpg'),(12251,'Ghost Hunters: Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Capture ghosts in a tech-infused world full of mysteries and adventures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p8b.jpg'),(12252,'AimGoGoGo',NULL,'Simulator, Sport, Indie','Sin plataforma','AimGoGoGo is a game for improving your aim in FPS games. It supports a lot of popular FPS games. More than 50 weapons and lots of training courses.It can help you practice recoil control of each weapon and Tracking in FPS Game and Improve your muscle memory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co574o.jpg'),(12253,'Vampire Survivors: Laborratory Update','2024-04-29','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Plunging players into the dark halls of a corrupted science lab, our free new Laborratory Update pushes Vampire Survivors to such wild new heights that we\'re calling it our first ‘AAAA’ update. Industry-defining innovations include fully rendered running animations, mind-blowing train physics, go-cart racing, and... doors that open??','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co856q.jpg'),(12254,'Dragon Quest 25th Anniversary Collection','2011-09-15','Sin género','Wii','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s7j.jpg'),(12255,'Mônica no Castelo do Dragão','1991-12-01','Platform, Adventure','Sega Master System/Mark III','Monica at the Castle of the Dragon is a Sega Master System game released by Tec Toy in 1991, starring the character of comics, Monica. The game is an official graphical and textual reprogramming made ​​by Tectoy in partnership with Maurício de Sousa Productions and authorized by Sega of the original game Wonder Boy in Monster Land. The game is a Platformer in which the player controls Mônica, armed with her ​​stuffed rabbit, Samson. Monica has to go through twelve stages, each with monsters, items and its own scenarios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bxx.jpg'),(12256,'Vasara Collection','2019-08-13','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','For the very first time, highly acclaimed Japanese Arcade Shoot’em Ups: Vasara and Vasara 2 are made available to the whole world via this package: Vasara Collection!\n\nScience Fiction meets History in these arcade classics which take place in an alternate timeline Feudal Japan where technologically advanced weaponry and equipment are a reality, and heroes use flying motorcycles with amazing firepower and fierce melee weapons to destroy their enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24bj.jpg'),(12257,'破坏效应','2020-09-24','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','《破坏效应》是一款融合了MMO和MOBA双玩法的游戏，暗黑式ARPG英雄乱斗、立体地下城对战、非对称式英雄阵营、自定义动作技能，开启不一样的战场体验。力求让玩家体验最没有束缚的乱斗快感，从一场战斗开始，你无所不能，异世英雄，即刻乱斗上场！','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5koa.jpg'),(12258,'Khaos Tracks','2024-12-28','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Khaos Tracks is a high-energy rhythm game that combines heart-pounding beats, dynamic gameplay, and visually stunning neon environments. Players tap, their way through a variety of music genres, from smooth country grooves to electrifying synth melodies. With a sleek UI and bold neon accents, the game challenges players to match the rhythm of carefully crafted instrumental tracks. Featuring fast-paced action and a pulse-pounding soundtrack, Khaos Tracks is an immersive experience where every beat brings you closer to the edge of chaos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98af.jpg'),(12259,'Mortal Kombat II','1996-03-28','Fighting, Arcade','Arcade, PlayStation 3, Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega 32X, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, DOS, Amiga, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Mortal Kombat II is a fighting game originally developed by Midway for arcades in 1993. It serves as the second main installment in the Mortal Kombat franchise and follows the success of its predecessor by enhancing the gameplay and further developing the original game\'s mythos. Mortal Kombat II introduces more varied finishing moves and several iconic characters, such as Kitana, Mileena, Kung Lao, the hidden character Noob Saibot, and the series\' recurring villain, Shao Kahn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bxu.jpg'),(12260,'Dynasty Warriors 9: Complete Edition','2019-12-05','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox One','Offering a discount set that includes the game, \"Special Costume Set\", \"Season Pass\", \"Season Pass 2\", and \"Season Pass 3\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4pt1.jpg'),(12261,'Arida: Backland\'s Awakening - Definitive Edition','2024-11-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','ARIDA: Backland\'s Awakening. A story of survival and adventure in the brazilian backlands. Face the drought to explore the more arid regions, gather resources and discover clues about the fate of the young Cícera.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96xn.jpg'),(12262,'Stone Age','1994-12-31','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','Stone Age is a charming puzzle game where players guide a cartoon dinosaur through 100 challenging cave levels. The core gameplay revolves around strategically navigating various block types, including standard platforms, movable blocks, crumbling tiles, and color-coded keys and locks. With two difficulty modes offering different time constraints, the game balances accessibility with challenge, appealing to both casual players and puzzle enthusiasts. The simple yet effective graphics complement the complex level designs, creating an engaging visual experience.\n\nThe game features a robust progress system, including level passwords that allow players to return to specific stages, preserving their advancement without sacrificing challenge. A unique Jukebox feature adds to the game\'s appeal, enabling players to customize their audio experience by creating playlists of the game\'s tracks. This combination of strategic puzzle-solving, time management, and personalization options makes Stone Age a compelling and replayable experience that tests both reflexes and problem-solving skills across its diverse cave scenarios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tdv.jpg'),(12263,'City of the Undead','2018-06-06','Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','City Of The Undead is a survival role-playing game that combines classic turn-based combat, exploration, card development, management, puzzle solving and other elements. The protagonist leads his companions through difficult adventures and successfully finds the abandoned hotel. Taking this as a stronghold, he constantly explores new and unknown areas, constantly accepts new powerful companions, constantly expands the activity area, and looks for lost relatives, explore the truth of the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rol.jpg'),(12264,'Escape from Ever After: Onboarding','2024-07-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','A genre-bending RPG inspired by the classic Paper Mario games! Embark on a quest to battle Ever After Inc, a greedy megacorp from the real world, as they seize control of fairytales for their cheap labor! Escape from Ever After: Onboarding is a prologue ver. of the game Escape from Ever After.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ba4.jpg'),(12265,'Arcade Reflex',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12266,'Apricity','2024-11-20','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Apricity is a top-down shooter party game for 1-4 players. 11 character classes. Arcade-style gameplay with a text-adventure driven roguelike mode and a score attack endless mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m1n.jpg'),(12267,'Iron Harvest: Rusviet Revolution','2020-12-17','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Players will follow an additional story line over the course of four new singleplayer maps, shedding some light on the mysterious Rasputin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dy0.jpg'),(12268,'Surf Ninjas','1993-12-31','Sin género','Sega Game Gear','Surf Ninjas was created as a tie-on for the 1993 New Line Cinema movie of the same name and is loosely based on its content. The entire introduction of how the surfers discover they are the sons of a Patusani king is not mentioned and instead the player is thrown in the story as a ninja trainee right away. Colonel Chi wants to overthrow the kingdom and kill the last heirs, so he sends troops of ninjas to kill the two brothers.\n\nPlayers control one of the brothers as he travels through different locations such as the Palace restaurant, the docks at Venice (California), the island of Patu San and more. The 2D side-scrolling platforms missions contains platforms, enemies and ninjas and various hazards. One button is used to jump while the other, in combination with the D-pad, launches punches, kicks, throws and various combos. Attacks can also be performed from the air or using very high jumps.\n\nDuring gameplay an options screen can be accessed to review the statistics (health, strength, reflex and fight), get a hint through Adam\'s Game Gear, call the ninja Zatch to launch a powerful attack or select a weapon such as shurikens, fireballs, a knife and a sword. By defeating enemies coins are collected to be spent on bonus time on the clock, Zatch power-ups, a bonus life, complete regeneration, a hint, a weapon or a continue.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yq1.jpg'),(12269,'Kingdom Hearts Final Mix','2017-03-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Originally released only in Japan on December 26, 2002, Kingdom Hearts Final Mix is finally brought to the global scene as an HD Remaster in the collection \"Kingdom Hearts HD 1.5 ReMIX\". It has several events and a number of gameplay tweaks that are not in previous releases. New scenes, clarifying certain plot points, such as Riku\'s journey and foreshadowing of Kingdom Hearts II, were included, but no new dialogue was recorded. A gameplay option allows the player to skip cutscenes. The optional bosses are included, along with a new fight against \"Unknown Man.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8m1o.jpg'),(12270,'NBA 2K25: All-Star Edition','2024-09-06','Sport','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Headline the NBA All-Star team and become the best of the best with the NBA 2K25 All-Star Edition. The All-Star Edition includes 100,000 Virtual Currency (VC), the 2K25 MyTEAM Promo Box, and a host of MyCAREER consumables and cosmetics!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wvs.jpg'),(12271,'Wanko of Marriage: Welcome to the Dog\'s Tail!',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Toya Inuzuka is the successor to the family shrine but dreams of becoming a pastry chef. Complicating things further are these two fluffy-eared and bushy-tailed messengers of god, Koharu and Azuki dream to marry Toya... The three of them will have to work together to fulfill their dreams!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lai.jpg'),(12272,'Super Beta Tester','2024-07-16','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Playdate','You work as a Beta Tester at Mega Industries platform development division. Your sole purpose in life is to find the optimal way through the company\'s platformer games. This valuable information will be used to make their games even harder - because the harder the game is, the more the customers will have to pay to get to the next level.\n\nIn this puzzle game you control the hero via action blocks in platform levels. The game includes tutorial levels and nine level packs. (A total of 80+ levels are included) The game also includes an editor for making your own levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jsb.jpg'),(12273,'Tropico 5: Surfs Up!','2015-01-08','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Come with El Presidente on a journey through time and space in the new \'Surf\'s Up!\' DLC for Tropico 5. In the not-too-distant future, Earth is under threat of alien incursion. The only hope for Tropico lies with the wise dolphins of the Pacific Ocean, who hold the power to veto this decision through bureaucracy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sfp.jpg'),(12274,'2 Ninjas 1 Cup','2017-02-03','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get ready for a game so stupid you would rather show your browser history than admit that you like it! Lots of action, explosions and yes, it\'s a penis-tank in the trailer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22jg.jpg'),(12275,'Salad Bar Tycoon','2020-11-06','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Look out, this awesome salad bar will soon become the best one in town! Become the manager of a salad bar and learn for yourself just how hard it can be. Be careful not to mix up your recipes! Upgrade your bar and make it beautiful! Find ingredients of the best quality! Then create the best salad bar in town! Customers are waiting in line, and you have to serve them as fast as you can. Give it your best and you might just make it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5arm.jpg'),(12276,'Rogue Sentry',NULL,'Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A difficult twin-stick adventure shoot-em-up about a sentry droid who turns rogue to save humanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q33.jpg'),(12277,'Pocket Pandas',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12278,'Zook Hero 2',NULL,'Shooter, Platform','Game Boy Color','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vli.jpg'),(12279,'Bleach: Versus Crusade','2008-12-18','Fighting','Wii','Bleach: Versus Crusade (BLEACH バーサス・クルセイド 特典) is a game for the Nintendo Wii and it was released in Japan on December 18, 2008. It is unknown if the game will be released outside of Japan. Scans depict a roster of characters in line with the manga and anime storyline, featuring Nelliel, Nnoitra, Ichigo with his Hollow mask and Grimmjow\'s released form, (Pantera) to name a few. The gameplay appears to have been changed substantially, showing a split-screen during multi-player fights. It is a one-on-one fighter, but players pick a partner character for various team-up attacks and other maneuvers as well as being able to switch between them. It supports Wi-Fi play and can be played with the Classic controller or Gamecube controller in place of the Wii-Remote and nunchuk. Unlike other instalments before this, it is developed by Treasure Co. Ltd.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h1d.jpg'),(12280,'Mystery Case Files: Return to Ravenhearst','2014-04-24','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, Nintendo 3DS, Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Emma\'s soul is free. But her ghost has delivered a dire warning: evil still lurks in Ravenhearst Manor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rf6.jpg'),(12281,'Kyoryu',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ever wanted to run around a post-apocalyptic Japan where you, playing as a genetically re-engineered dinosaur, are the apocalypse that eliminated humanity and is now the dominant species? Heck yeah you have! Kyoryu is a third-person action-adventure where you get to do just that, picking through the literal bones of humanity while battling rival dino factions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z2x.jpg'),(12282,'ToVer Defense','2020-10-22','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do your best to defend your virtual castle from enemies trying to invade it! Can you get the most out of resources such as crossbow, teleportation and... magic?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44t1.jpg'),(12283,'Selene','2023-09-25','Platform','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','On a starry night, a shooting star knocks the moon out of the sky... What will the little moon do now?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lap.jpg'),(12284,'Digital Hitz Factory','2003-06-30','Music, Simulator','PlayStation 2','Jack of All Trade\'s FUNKMASTER FLEX DIGITAL HITZ FACTORY for the PS2 provides players with everything they need to make and mix their own sounds like pros. HITZ FACTORY includes over 16,000 instrument sounds and different musical styles for players to mix and match into their own songs. Players can select from among different styles like hip hop, pop, trance, garage indy, and metal, then add, mix, and modify clips from the thousands available to create their own unique songs. HITZ FACTORY also supports USB microphones, so players can even record their own music or vocals to include. Vocals will be analyzed and a new musical riff will be created based off of player\'s pitch and range. Players can then hear what they just sang as if it was played on a guitar, the drums, or other instruments. HITZ FACTORY also lets players create music videos to go with the music by blending several of the more than 500 clips available into their own video. Up to four different clips can be layered together then mixed with different effects like color, kaleidoscopes, and more. Finally, the DJ Supermixer mode lets players be the DJ with a set of virtual decks to spin. Players who want to work in the music industry or create their own music will love FUNKMASTER FLEX DIGITAL HITZ FACTORY. By turning the PS2 into a recording studio, musicians will be able to make their own songs in no time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pdb.jpg'),(12285,'Far Cry 4 + Far Cry: Primal Bundle','2016-04-21','Sin género','Xbox One','Dive into the savage universe of Far Cry with this double-pack edition featuring both Far Cry 4 and Far Cry: Primal.\nGet ready to explore breathtaking landscapes featuring a varied wildlife and hostile enemies in this reference in the open world FPS genre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ke6.jpg'),(12286,'Dead Spaceshot','2025-03-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Dead Spaceshot, shoot robotic mutant aliens in the head, uncover the secrets of an abandoned military space base, and don\'t die. Customize your weapons, face deadly enemies, and conquer new planets in this intense third-person sci-fi adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ibq.jpg'),(12287,'Gigantosaurus Dino Sports','2024-06-28','Sport, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','On your marks for a roar-some sports party for one to four dinos. These eight chomp-sized games are enormous fun – but watch out for Giganto!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8m2y.jpg'),(12288,'Supernova',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It is mankind’s distant, spacefaring future. Having tamed their own solar system, the human race has ventured forth into the cosmos to find a universe in peril. Ancient and mysterious portals have brought humanity face to face with vast, unrelenting alien legions, set to wage war across the galaxy. In this time of universal chaos, human and alien races alike must rely on their most skilled commanders to lead their forces in the fight for galactic dominance while uncovering the secrets behind the strange portals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rht.jpg'),(12289,'Faster than Backrooms',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Outrun the deadly backrooms as you navigate procedurally generated levels, battle terrifying creatures, and gather powerful items. Get more efficient with each attempt, pushing yourself to become Faster than Backrooms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63te.jpg'),(12290,'Disney Dreamlight Valley: Enchanted Edition','2024-11-20','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e2l.jpg'),(12291,'Hatsune Miku: Project Diva - Mega Mix+ Extra Song Pack','2022-05-26','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Adds 72 playable songs from Project Diva: Future Tone to your game for a total of 250 songs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rs7.jpg'),(12292,'Big XXL Kids Games Collection Bundle 11-in-1 Educational Children Learning Fun',NULL,'Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Card & Board Game','Sin plataforma','XXL Kids games collection with ELEVEN popular McPeppergames educational children & toddler games! Each game can be played without any language skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5q2c.jpg'),(12293,'Mystery Chamber 2015 Forever',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The final and expanded edition of Mystery Chamber 2015, which includes various improvements, gameplay changes, and new content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nur.jpg'),(12294,'Twelve : Legend of Sealed Gods during the Turbulent Age','2005-08-25','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation Portable','A SRPG in the style of Super Robot Wars and Disgaea with a unic orb system and script by Kawakami Minoru, the writer of Horizon in the Middle of Nowhere.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2imi.jpg'),(12295,'Crown','2021-06-18','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crown is an agile, pvp and turn-based strategy game. Forge your own playstyle and adapt your team and equipment to enemy picks to climb your stairs to glory! ?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a1t.jpg'),(12296,'Freecell Solitaire Deluxe','2019-09-27','Puzzle, Strategy, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Freecell Solitaire is form of Solitaire (or Patience) where nearly all deals are winnable, making it more of a game of skill than luck. It is the perfect game to help you relax and have fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3crk.jpg'),(12297,'Crayola Scoot','2018-10-16','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Make your mark in this color-powered trick scooter championship! The crazier your combos, the more color you’ll splash on the scootpark – and in Crayola Scoot, color can change the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28wv.jpg'),(12298,'Mata Hari','1988-09-01','Shooter, Puzzle','Atari ST/STE, Amstrad CPC','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vciy2fozil3tqazzfaox.jpg'),(12299,'Forgotten Hill Mementoes','2018-03-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Get ready for a puzzling journey through the memory of Forgotten Hill, can you survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o47.jpg'),(12300,'The Escapists & The Escapists: The Walking Dead','2016-02-23','Sin género','Xbox One','This amazing value pack contains the award winning, The Escapists as well as The Escapists: The Walking Dead, our homage to the world wide phenomenon, The Walking Dead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k9c.jpg'),(12301,'Rain World: Downpour','2023-07-11','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Rain World: Downpour is a DLC expansion of Rain World. Take control of five new characters with new abilities in this vast, redefined world. Slugcats have adapted to the harsh conditions alongside evolved predators! Survive new environmental conditions, dangers and explore uncharted territory.\n\nReturn to the unwavering wild in Downpour, where you explore new, harsh lands and survive new predators. As time passed, the slugcat has evolved. With five variants of the species - take advantage of various skills that they possess and explore their own personal tales.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61ky.jpg'),(12302,'Metrogether','2025-04-24','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Metrogether is a train simulator where you drive, collect passengers, work together with friends and explore the subway network in a fictional city. Embark on your journey as a train driver or ticket inspector in single and multiplayer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f8r.jpg'),(12303,'Hypatia','2017-06-15','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hypatia – a social and magical place where creativity and exploration are the keys to this new world. Chat with friends, paint the city, share VR photographs, solve puzzles, join a stage play, or create your own fireworks. Hypatia will have you smiling for hours to come.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bo6.jpg'),(12304,'Catch\'em','2023-12-16','Puzzle, Visual Novel','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'ve got all the evidence, now just one thing left, the real puzzle at the heart of this case, the final face off against the Killer','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88l4.jpg'),(12305,'Radirgy GeneriC','2006-05-25','Shooter','Nintendo GameCube','Radirgy GeneriC is a GameCube port of Radirgy, an arcade video game for the Sega NAOMI arcade system board. The game is a vertical scrolling shooter with anime influenced graphics and set in a cel-shaded world in the near future. Three kind of shooting types are available, including \"wide shot\" and \"1-2-3 laser\" and there is also a bubble type of attack. A shield can be used in near-death situations, protecting yourself from enemy shots as well as destroying approaching enemies. A North American release was planned but cancelled.\n\nA sequel, Radirgy Noa Wii, was released in 2010 and it was also a Japanese exclusive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nwp.jpg'),(12306,'Sally','2018-06-01','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bgq.jpg'),(12307,'Family Mysteries: Poisonous Promises','2020-03-26','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hidden object puzzle adventure from Brave Giant and Artifex Mundi which stands as the rousing trilogy-opener for the \"Family Mysteries\" police drama, evoking a fanciful nostalgia for such TV hits like Miami Vice, Beverly Hills Cop and CSI.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21r0.jpg'),(12308,'My Sweet Floating in the Void','2024-03-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The game is a first-person puzzle adventure, with wacky and old-fashioned graphics, which will transport the player into a dreamlike, psychedelic world composed of an experimental game system that will challenge and test even the most experienced puzzle gamers in the industry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pjs.jpg'),(12309,'Drill Space',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A survival mining game where gravity shapes your journey. Explore a vibrant, randomly generated solar system, mine for resources, upgrade your ship, and defend against alien invasions.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12310,'Only Way is Down','2025-04-01','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a purr-fectly perilous adventure as this lil kitty cat took an unfortunate cat-nap and ended up stranded sky high! With no way but down, unleash your feline agility and platforming prowess to navigate your descent through the urban jungle in this whimsical and gravity-defying escapade!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j6q.jpg'),(12311,'Jungle Jumble','2004-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12312,'Beneath a Steel Sky','1994-12-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Amiga CD32, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, DOS, Amiga','Beneath a Steel Sky is a cyberpunk, point and click, adventure game. You assume the role of Robert Foster and embark on a quest to make the world a better place, along with your robot companion Joey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ciz.jpg'),(12313,'Astroidle','2024-06-19','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ready for some chill time in space? Astrodle has you covered. Watch the numbers soar as you upgrade your ship and travel the stars. Oh, and you might just become a god.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k9s.jpg'),(12314,'Wotheguel',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Do the tasks given in the tropical forest and get all the magic diamonds. Kill the resulting creatures and continue your mission. Protect yourself in the open world and remember that you are alone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46qk.jpg'),(12315,'Private Investigator Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Assume the role of a modern detective and solve fascinating cases using lots of gadgets and your own skills. Let a sophisticated narrative help you uncover clues and secrets that might not be apparent right away and become a star detective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vl0.jpg'),(12316,'Sanguo\'s Ambition 4: Three Kingdoms','2023-12-17','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The world\'s first competitive SLG strategy game with real-time matchmaking for multiplayer battles. In 《Three Kingdoms Ambition 4》 you can experience the unique journey of starting as a small faction and growing into a powerful warlord during the turbulent Three Kingdoms era.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71v2.jpg'),(12317,'Big City Adventure: Rome','2017-04-06','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9par.jpg'),(12318,'Paint by Pixel','2024-02-12','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac','Paint by Pixel is a relaxing puzzle game where you create beautiful works of art one pixel at a time.\n\nChoose between brush or fill mode, recolor your drawings to personalize them, and use zoom and the magnifying glass to focus on details.\nThe game also includes an autofill feature and hints to make things easier. With 95 levels to choose from, Paint by Pixel is the perfect game to unwind and explore your artistic side.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89kw.jpg'),(12319,'Star Girl Proxima','2020-01-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a magical girl hero and defend the alien world of Proxima Centauri b in Star Girl Proxima! An 8-bit style action-platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co421d.jpg'),(12320,'Bermuda Triangle','1982-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Atari 2600','The SYD mission was successful, but the current era was only one place under attack. The invaders also traveled back in time, hoping to rewrite history. Only the six experimental space-time battleships known as ZIG could stop them, but they were attacked upon taking off. Now trapped in the past, they have no way to return to the present.\n\nBermuda Triangle is a scrolling shooter designed by the same team as Ikari Warriors. The player must survive each of the 9 levels, which automatically scroll both up and down, long enough to reach and destroy the boss. The ZIG, being a much larger ship than most scrolling shooter ships, can sustain several hits before being destroyed, and has both a straight ahead shot and a rotating turret that can fire in 8 directions. SYD ships can be picked up in levels and will fly near the ZIG in four different formations. They can block enemy shots but will be destroyed if hit by enemy ships. Energy can be picked up as well, which will either restore lost health or, at full health, power up the attack of the ZIG and SYDs.\n\nThe arcade version uses a rotary joystick to control the turret, but the PlayStation port places the turret controls on the shoulder buttons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ivle8qv3g4oow3a63ct6.jpg'),(12321,'Pixel Puzzles World War II Jigsaws','2023-09-06','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pixel Puzzles, your number one place for digital jigsaws.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7002.jpg'),(12322,'Dragon Ball FighterZ: Broly (DBS)','2019-12-05','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The exiled all powerful Saiyan, Broly (DBS) now comes to DRAGON BALL FighterZ!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3r4h.jpg'),(12323,'Loco Road','2020-06-01','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Have you ever dreamt of participating in a deathrace where everbody blows up??! Me neither! But thanks to the sick minds of our Game Design students now you can do it! In this frenetic game you have to avoid beeing last in each lap or you will die and look bad doing it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46mt.jpg'),(12324,'Lunaria: Virtualized Moonchild','2022-02-07','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Genius gamer T-Bit rakes in the prize money in VR races day after day. One day, after experiencing a network error mid-race, he ends up in Lunar World, a moon-based server. There, he meets an AI avatar by the name of Lunar-Q. A love story spanning the 384,400 km between the Earth and moon begins!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rgf.jpg'),(12325,'Vanity Fair: The Pursuit','2025-01-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Players follow Lu Yuan through important stages of his life and experience his growth trajectory from youth to maturity. It will take you to relive those decisions that you have never tried to make in reality, and feel the different life brought about by each choice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aeb.jpg'),(12326,'Deadcraft: Deluxe Edition','2022-05-19','Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Deluxe Edition Contents:\n- The game\n- DLC Packs\n- “It Came From the Junkyard” DLC\n- “Jessie\'s Wasteland Wares” DLC\n- Costume\n- Resource Pack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4th2.jpg'),(12327,'Tactical AR','2017-11-07','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tactical AR was created with one purpose, to build real firearms skills and habits in virtual reality. Our philosophy is that the best training is fun, and that muscle memory developed in virtual reality effectively translates in to real weapon muscle memory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27rs.jpg'),(12328,'Adventuro',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Dive into Adventuro, where nostalgic 3D gaming meets a modern twist! Explore vibrant worlds with early-2000s inspired graphics and gameplay in this family-friendly, immersive adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7iwg.jpg'),(12329,'The Monkey King: Flying Dojo','2023-11-20','Arcade','Meta Quest 2','As Sun Wukong, you are called upon to conquer the mystical Dragon Valleys. With your enchanted staff in hand, you\'ll smash through orbs of power and face off against dragon guardians in this arcade VR adventure.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12330,'Anime Slot Revolution: Pachi-Slot Kidou Senshi Gundam II - Ai Senshi-hen',NULL,'Sin género','Wii','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74kh.jpg'),(12331,'The Beast in the Silent Valley','2024-09-23','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A forgotten village, cut off from civilization, had a curse that would bring only death and fear. Gravets, in the role of the most soulful mandrivka, finds himself in this village, where all the bastards have become deprived of a trace of their thirst.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r8z.jpg'),(12332,'Surgeon Simulator 2013','2013-04-19','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Surgeon Simulator 2013 is a darkly humorous over-the-top operation sim game where players become Nigel Burke, a would-be surgeon taking life into his own shaky hands (one keyboard button for each finger), performing life-saving surgical maneuvers on a passive patient.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v3l.jpg'),(12333,'Be Our Guest','2025-02-26','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Have you ever found yourself exhausted and confused by the hustle and bustle of corporate life in the big city?\n\nWouldn’t it be wonderful if there were a place you could just relax and unwind, maybe have a nice cup of coffee or a snack, in the company of a variety of attentive pink-feathered waterfowl (and also Kenneth)?\n\nNeed an opportunity to just hang out and be unafraid to be yourself?\n\nIf the answer to any of this is no, then it should be yes, and if the answer to any of this is yes, then you’re welcome to Be Our Guest at the Matinee Cabaret, a fun and inviting café, just a little off the beaten path, and with live entertainment too! Pop in for the grand opening in this charming visual mini-novel featuring original, dynamic sprite-work and colorful backgrounds for the various locations in the café, where you can meet and chat up the employees through their voice-acted branching dialogue trees. Order a drink, make a friend, solve a dilemma, and preview what the Matinee Cabaret has in store!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hrn.jpg'),(12334,'PlayStation Network Collection: Puzzle Pack',NULL,'Puzzle','PlayStation Portable','PlayStation Network Collection: Puzzle Pack is a compilation of three puzzle-oriented PSP digital titles collected onto one UMD.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7282.jpg'),(12335,'It\'s Grim Up North','2024-04-26','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Our hero Terry is enjoying life in God’s own county, Yorkshire, until he makes a shocking discovery. His quaint English village has been invaded by... ALIENS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ngi.jpg'),(12336,'Adventure of Rikka: The Cursed Kingdom','2024-03-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The kingdom had not always been a peaceful place, over a hundred years ago there was a forgotten event that took place to thwart the darkness and bring in prosperity and peace. The king called all willing to stand up for their kingdom to once again banish the curse which laid upon the land.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82ce.jpg'),(12337,'WWE SmackDown! vs. Raw 2006','2005-11-14','Fighting, Sport','PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','The debut PlayStation Portable offering of THQ and Yuke\'s long-running 3D wrestling series. WWE SmackDown! vs. RAW 2006 expands on THQ\'s popular multi-million unit-selling franchise with a number of key new features. The Buried Alive Casket match, two new wrestler attributes (Stamina and Hardcore), and a realistic momentum system all combine to turn the series away from its arcade roots and towards that of a simulation. The PSP version follows closely on the heels of its PS2 tag-teammate in terms of features and wrestler rosters, with exclusive extras including additional characters and other features for the PSP version, plus USB system link to connect the two versions together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m4s.jpg'),(12338,'Open Mod','2023-06-26','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A free-to-play, tactical, community-driven first person shooter that aims to expand slowly and steadily. We focused our attention on game mechanics and customizability, providing our players the opportunity to personalize their experience on as many levels as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jzo.jpg'),(12339,'Lost in Blindness','2021-05-17','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Play as Alex, a young blind archeologist and follow the tracks left behind by the disappearance of the Mayan civilization! In this blind adventure game, discover an incredible 3D environment only by listening to the sounds around you, without using your eyes to see.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zaw.jpg'),(12340,'Escape from Nowhere','2021-07-17','Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escape from Nowhere is an indie runner game where you run and have to dodge obstacles, collecting various bonuses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qce.jpg'),(12341,'Classified: France \'44 - Guerrilla','2024-03-05','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Expand your arsenal and take the fight to the enemy with new Spec Ops missions and a brand new map in the Guerrilla Pack.\n\nThe Guerrilla Pack contains:\nNew Map – “Church”\nTwo new Special Ops missions:\n• Tomb Raiders\n• Time to Kill\nTwo new weapon variants\n• Bren “Ambush”\n• Thompson “Boa”\nNew Clothing Set\n• Female Resistance “Guerrilla”','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wfg.jpg'),(12342,'The Midnight Town Stories: Matt\'s Nightmare',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Get ready for a psychological horror journey where uncovering certain truths might be scarier than staying in the dark.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kn8.jpg'),(12343,'Never Alone: Arctic Collection','2015-08-21','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Experience the epic journey of Nuna and Fox as they search for the source of an eternal blizzard that threatens the survival of everything they have ever known.\n\nNever Alone is an atmospheric puzzle platformer developed in collaboration with the Inupiat, an Alaska Native people, drawn from a traditional story that has been shared across the generations. Guide both characters in single-player mode or play cooperatively with a friend or family member as you trek through frozen tundra, leap across treacherous ice floes, swim through underwater ice caverns, and face numerous enemies both strange and familiar in the journey to save the girls village.\n\nFoxtales features three all new levels full of environments to explore, puzzles to solve and enemies to face. Travel across open seas, swim through the ruins of a sunken village and paddle up the Noatak River on a mission to rescue a new friend.\n\nThe Never Alone Arctic Combo Pack includes both Never Alone (Kisima Ingitchuna) and the Foxtales DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hmg.jpg'),(12344,'Risky Wings','2018-07-31','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Risky Wings is intense flying game where you score points by flying risky.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sh5.jpg'),(12345,'Dead by Daylight: The Story of Yamaoka Family','2020-02-13','Strategy','PlayStation 4','Dead by Daylight is an asymmetrical multiplayer (4vs1) horror game where one player takes on the role of the savage Killer, and the other four players play as Survivors, trying to escape the Killer and avoid being caught and killed.\n\nThe Dead by Daylight: The Story of Yamaoka Family edition includes the following:\n- Dead by Daylight base game\n- DLC Code: Additional 2 Chapters & 1100 Auric Cells Pack\n- Minibook: \"Story of Yamaoka Famiy\" Concept Art Collection','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48xs.jpg'),(12346,'The Great White Destroyer',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','In this 2D game by Backyard Ninja, you play as a great white shark with an insatiable appetite. You must appease the shark god, Cahrtoothus, by causing destruction and eating everything in sight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/epeivpuuud8fxqkpjzng.jpg'),(12347,'XXX, I Want You to Keep Fighting',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','A highly flexible semi-automatic idle game where you can intervene in battles and character development to have a huge boost up. Also, through conversations between the protagonists, you\'ll hear a story steeped in the past, narrating the origins of them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zvd.jpg'),(12348,'Super Columns','1995-12-31','Puzzle, Arcade','Sega Game Gear','Super Columns is charged with new ways to play and win at this intensely gripping puzzle game. Magic gems can suddenly flip the screen while Bomb gems can blast up to 5 gems at once! Hook up to a friend with your Gear to Gear connection and really test your skills!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ske.jpg'),(12349,'Assassin\'s Creed IV Black Flag: Kraken Ship Pack','2013-11-15','Adventure','PlayStation 4','Inspired by the legendary Kraken creature, unlock 3 new customization items for your ship: Kraken Figurehead, Kraken Sails, Kraken Wheel.\n\nImportant: You need to progress until Sequence 3 memory 04 to see those items in the Jackdaw upgrades menu. Go into your Captain’s cabin or in a Harbor Master to equip them on your ship.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8giz.jpg'),(12350,'Purgatory Survivors',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Sin plataforma','Purgatory Survivors is a top-down shooter with roguelike elements. Plunge into a dark fantasy world infested with demons and despair all fighting for you to fail. Choose your character, primary and secondary guns, and achieve the best synergy with the upgrades to pass the purgatory trial.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83gr.jpg'),(12351,'İnsignis','2025-03-15','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','insignis is a speed oriented board game. It is a game based on setting the desired gems and creating different gameplay styles by combining different abilities in order to deliver the magical diamonds to as many customers as possible due to the economic crisis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hw2.jpg'),(12352,'Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 3 - Hardened Edition','2011-12-08','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Activision Blizzard\'s top-selling first-person shooter franchise marches on with Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 3. Players must deal with the fallout from the devastating attacks on U.S. and British soil in a storyline that picks up where 2009\'s Modern Warfare 2 left off. The single-player campaign has you battling Russian ultranationalists, led by Vladimir Markov, as members of the U.S. Delta Force and British SAS. You\'ll battle across war-torn areas of New York City, London, Paris, Mogadishu, Dubai, and other regions as you prepare to end the global threat once and for all.\n\nAs with previous entries in the Call of Duty series, Modern Warfare 3\'s campaign features a heavily scripted, cinematic experience with Hollywood-style special effects. One new mission, for example, has you involved in underwater travel with a sonar-equipped submersible watercraft. You\'ll then fight inside an enemy-controlled submarine before guiding an inflatable raft across turbulent waters while a naval battle rages nearby. Other sequences have you firing mounted guns, driving vehicles, and more while explosions light up the landscape.\n\nReturning to the game is the cooperative Spec Ops mode that features a series of standalone missions on different maps. New to Spec Ops is a survival option that has you and either a friend or a computer partner battling waves of enemy forces. Shooting down enemies earns you cash, which can be used to purchase new perks, items, weapons, and other upgrades. You\'ll also be able to earn bonuses by working together as a team and maintaining kill streaks.\n\nThe heart of the game is once again the 18-player online component, which introduces all-new maps and a variety of enhancements to the format introduced in Modern Warfare 2. Popular features such as kill-streak awards, experience points, weapons-based achievements, and perks return, allowing you to customize your character as you progress. An optional subscription service entitled \"Call of Duty Elite\" will allow players to track detailed statistics such as win-loss records, kill-death ratios, time played, most successful maps, favorite weapons, and much more.\n\nHardened Edition bonus items include a Steelbook case, collectible field journal, special ops juggernaut outfit for your Xbox Live avatar, premium membership to Call of Duty Elite, and special founder status on Call of Duty Elite. Call of Duty Elite\'s premium membership includes all future downloadable content (DLC) for Modern Warfare 3, of which there are 20 pieces of DLC expected within the first nine months following the game\'s release.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a7p.jpg'),(12353,'LEGO Dimensions: Doctor Who Fun Pack',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','At the center of the LEGO Multiverse lies an ancient planet that is inhabited by the evil mastermind, Lord Vortech. It is believed that the person who controls the Foundational Elements on which this planet is built will control all of the Multiverse. Vowing to become that ruler, Lord Vortech determines that by summoning characters from a variety of LEGO worlds, he\'ll be able to find the building blocks of the LEGO civilization. One day, a mysterious and powerful vortex appears in a variety of LEGO worlds, and different characters from DC Comics, The Lord of the Rings, The LEGO Movie and more are swept away. Noticing their friends are being taken, Batman, Gandalf and Wyldstyle jump into the vortex on a journey they never imagined. Now, realizing Lord Vortech\'s intentions, the three intrepid heroes must venture through space and time to save their friends and all of LEGO humanity.After you\'ve saved the day, expand your LEGO Dimensions experience with this Dr. Who: Cyberman Fun Pack. Featuring 40 buildable pieces, this Fun Pack plunges you into another realm of the LEGO multiverse with a Cyberman and a Dalek.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w7v.jpg'),(12354,'Creepy Castle','2016-10-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Creepy Castle is an exploratory sidescrolling RPG about a moth in a castle. It\'s a fresh adventure with the look of a classic, but don\'t let the retro paintjob fool you; this is a new-school experience. Traditional turn-based combat meets an energetic twist in the form of Duels, where instead of taking turns doling out damage, you are offered a chance to score free hits on your opponent if you perform excellently... but don\'t let your guard down, or you might find yourself pummeled!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mq6.jpg'),(12355,'Unreal','1998-05-22','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, 64DD','Your prison ship has crash-landed on the fastest, sleekest, most dangerous 3D world ever created. Look around, crystal clear water shimmers, shadows dance and shift, alien architecture fades into the horizon. Discover the secret of this mysterious planet and find out what caused a peaceful race to be enslaved by vicious merciless aggressors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9er6.jpg'),(12356,'Cities: Skylines - Relaxation Station','2016-11-29','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take the stress out of your streets and relax while you re-district in this first-ever music pack for Cities: Skylines, featuring over an hour of original music for use with the in-game radio stations composed by Tobias Gustavsson, composer of popular music packs for Europa Universalis IV and Crusader Kings II. Listen to Soothing jazz, lounge music, groove music, or even pleasant Caribbean vibes in between savy radio host Jason. You might also come across a commercial or two for your favorite food chain or Insurance provider. So tune in, kick back, and let our in-game DJ spin the relaxing playlist for your listening pleasure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8347.jpg'),(12357,'Armed and Dangerous','2004-02-27','Shooter','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take a band of gun-toting rebels -a robot, a madman, a mole and a criminal mastermind. Put them in a vividly stunning fantasy realm. Then give them an impossible mission - pulling off the biggest heist of all time in the middle of a war. All you have to do is battle your way through dastardly enemies, giant war machines and an army of psychopathic robots. But don\'t worry; you have plenty of ammo and absolutely no common sense. Victory is yours in 12,000 bullets or less!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24mc.jpg'),(12358,'Blocky Castle: Tower Challenge',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12359,'Lollipop Chainsaw RePop','2024-09-26','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Lollipop Chainsaw RePop is a remaster of the original. RePOP is a definitive version of the game which leaves the story unchanged, with the focus on quality of life improvements and additional gameplay content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8e5b.jpg'),(12360,'The Ultimate Stuntman','1990-10-05','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle','Nintendo Entertainment System','Too hot to handle? Or can you take up the challenge? Equipped with a dazzling range of weapons and skills, travel through scores of different action scenes, battling against the hottest, meanest, mechanized maniacs ever dreamed up! Rescue the kidnapped scientist to halt the corrupt plans of Dr. Evil. Heaps of hardware, power-ups, bonuses, booby-trapped bombs and the baddest bosses!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kul.jpg'),(12361,'Past Cure','2018-02-23','Shooter, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','\"Exact revenge on those who experimented on you in tense sci-fi thriller Past Cure, using stealth, fists and telepathic skills to uncover the secrets behind your imprisonment.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xkrszayfmxtswdshdefo.jpg'),(12362,'Decision in the Desert','1985-12-31','Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, DOS, Apple II','Classic real-time simulation game from the 80s designed by Sid Meier and Ed Bever. The second title in the \"Command Series\" of tactical wargames from Microprose, the game features real-time battles that test your skills as a commander of forces in North Africa during WWII','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nknblkwoummjpbs2knd3.jpg'),(12363,'The Amber Throne','2015-07-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Amber Throne is a traditional JRPG-styled game that focuses on turn-based battling and some light exploration. The game features a large cast of unique monsters that change stances depending on actions taken during combat, and a party with mostly mixed hybrid roles to deal with them. Learning monster behavior and how your skills affect them is essential to reaching victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80wm.jpg'),(12364,'Pizza Bar Tycoon: Deluxe Edition','2022-07-29','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Look out, this pizzeria will soon become the best one in town!\n\nWell... at least that\'s your plan.\n\nThe clients are already standing in line, and you have to serve them as soon as you can. It\'s harder than it sounds though!\n\nEveryone\'s in a hurry, and you have to prepare each order exactly - otherwise people will get angry!\n\nGive it your best and you will make it!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12365,'Dungeon Rush','2018-08-08','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dungeon Rush is an absolutely beautiful and colorful fantasy bow VR shooting game where you have to protect your castle from hordes of undead warriors.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12366,'Bubblefish Bob','2005-10-21','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re Bob, and you must save your fishy friends by matching three same-colored bubbles before the fish inside reach their awful fate. Beware of giant piranha-like guppies waiting to gobble up your friends unless you can free them in time by breaking and matching the bubbles. Collect falling treasures to bolster your score and gain lives to free more fish.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q3w.jpg'),(12367,'Moo & Move: Extra Grazing Grounds','2025-01-03','Puzzle','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Guide the hungry cow to its goal. Place directional tiles on the ground and to solve the puzzles. Watch as the cow follows the path to reach its tasty hay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a5q.jpg'),(12368,'Bitter/Sweet Blythe','2023-02-28','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','On their birthday, Bunnie (renameable + pick your pronouns) makes a wish, but will they get more than they bargained for when a bunny-eared being named Blythe shows up to give them their best-ever birthday?\n\nMade in under a month for Yandere Jam 2023.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vdq.jpg'),(12369,'Watch Dogs: Legion - Gold Edition','2020-10-29','Shooter, Adventure','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','In Watch Dogs: Legion, near future London is facing its downfall...unless you do something about it. Build a resistance, fight back, and give the city back to the people. It’s time to rise up.\n\nThe Gold Edition includes;\n- Watch Dogs: Legion (the game)\n- The season pass: one expansion with two episodes, extra missions, four iconic heroes and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rzp.jpg'),(12370,'Protection Civile Simulator 2013','2012-11-19','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It’s an emergency! Call for help! Respond to calls quickly, make sure that casualties are minimised and people are given the support they need \n \nFeaturing a wide range of different vehicles you’ll need to recover cargo, search for victims, and more in this exciting emergency response simulator \n \nJoin the Disaster response unit and help saved hundreds of lives! You’ll need to respond to a wide range of emergencies and natural disasters to maintain safety, provide emergency resources and rescue civilians \nDeveloped in close collaboration with the foundation for Technical Relief, expect an in depth civil protection simulator, command a wide variety of THW special vehicles including a truck with crane, a dump truck, equipment vehicle, loader and a multi-purpose workboat \n \nYou’ll need to select the correct vehicle for each emergency','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vtsywzayvb0hnaeuhzxc.jpg'),(12371,'Silent House','2020-02-07','Puzzle','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You play as John Williams, the victim of a car accident, waking up and finding yourself in a weird room that resembles a prison cell. You make eye contact with a strange man with a bloody knife that looks awfully similar to the psychopath you saw in the newspaper. You must escape at all costs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rr2.jpg'),(12372,'Sonic Adventure Emerald',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eu2.jpg'),(12373,'Squiigee',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Use your momentum to swing, launch and fly, cleaning cityscapes in record time to earn some sweet, sweet cash!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wbl.jpg'),(12374,'Theater Unrest',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Indie horror game, inspired by creepypasta \"The Theater\".','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12375,'Super Smash Bros. Ultimate: Limited Edition','2018-12-07','Fighting','Nintendo Switch','Legendary game worlds and fighters collide in the ultimate showdown—a new entry in the Super Smash Bros. series for the Nintendo Switch system! New fighters, like Inkling from the Splatoon series and Ridley from the Metroid series, make their Super Smash Bros. series debut alongside every Super Smash Bros. fighter in the series…EVER! Faster combat, new items, new attacks, new defensive options, and more will keep the battle raging whether you’re at home or on the go.\n\nThe Smash Bros, ultimate limited edition includes Super Smash Bros Ultimate, a Nintendo GameCube controller Super Smash Bros. edition and Nintendo GameCube controller adapter for the Nintendo switch','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xo0.jpg'),(12376,'Music On: Learning Piano','2010-08-30','Sin género','Nintendo DSi','The entire orchestra follows your performance of 15 great classics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zkancvhop2imwhy2hm1d.jpg'),(12377,'Maybe I Can','2021-06-16','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome, we\'re putting you in the brain of Tyler Lee who wants to destroy the world. But it won\'t be easy. Tyler is going to get in a lot of trouble. Let\'s see if you can get Tyler Lee to achieve his goal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nqo.jpg'),(12378,'Mystal Haven','2025-03-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mystal Haven is a laid-back, open-world creature-collecting game with 4-player split-screen and online multiplayer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gjk.jpg'),(12379,'Epoch','2016-05-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','With an inspired blend of Metroidvania + Zelda + Souls style gameplay, Epoch delivers a nostalgic single or online co-op action RPG experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xeupprvdyvd267ntu4mp.jpg'),(12380,'Renai Kouhosei Starlight Scramble','1998-09-23','Simulator','PlayStation','Four years had passed since the NUN (Neo United Nations) unified the Earth\'s nation in 2120, and them the project of the pseudo-earth environment \"One\'s Home\" was started and led by Kirishima. Five years later, the first satellite town in the history of mankind, \"Second One\'s Home\" was completed. By this means, the human beings left a \"cage\" called the earth, and began to immigrate to the Second One\'s Home where they created a second home. The mother computer \"Maxis\", which controls the whole Second One\'s Home was completed in advance. Howerever, some control problems had been left which was solved two years later. Since then peaceful days have continued.\n\nThe incident happen as if the peaceful days were laughed at mockingly. The first incident was \"anxiety\". It was that \"Kirishima\", who as the leader of the \"One\'s Home Project\" dissappeared. The Second One\'s Home tried to hush up the incident, while the NUN side tried to intervene in it. However, the action ended in failure by some powerful people, and the incident of Kirishima\'s disappearence was concealed.\n\nThe second incident was \"resistance\". The affair of terrorism occurred at Universe Port \"SUS\". Since there is no statement for the offense, it was treated as in discriminate terrorism. However, the criminal\'s true character has not yet been captured...\n\nThe third incident was \"fear\". three planes for the second platoon of the NUN space force which belonged to the Second One\'s Home, encountered uncertificated Flying objects, and were shot down. This unknown object was called \"Hughey\". As a clue of this, the NUN Space Force intends to further build up it\'s forces. This incident might be a warning from space to human beings who left the \"cage\" called Earth.\n\nTime passed, and in February, 2149, the past incident does not mean what it used to. The story starts at this Second One\'s Home, and it is an ordinary love story as if it can be seen from the Earth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q51.jpg'),(12381,'The Laundry','2020-07-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A terrible game in which a mysterious man explores the washroom in which he came to wash his clothes for the night looking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43x2.jpg'),(12382,'Yukkuri Iru',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12383,'Nightfall Mysteries: Asylum Conspiracy','2010-07-29','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Christine explore the spooky Ashburg Asylum and find her missing grandfather in this dark Hidden Object game! Travel to the eerie grounds of Ashburg and work your way through spine-chilling locations. Solve unique puzzles to progress deeper into the asylum, and closer to Christine’s grandfather. Meet interesting characters, unravel a mystery, and uncover an evil plot in Nightfall Mysteries: Asylum Conspiracy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1t22.jpg'),(12384,'Lone Survivor: The Director\'s Cut','2013-09-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, PlayStation Vita','In this original and adult psychological survival horror, the masked protagonist must escape from a city ravaged by disease, by any means necessary.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gye.jpg'),(12385,'Marvel Ultimate Alliance 3: The Black Order','2019-07-19','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Nintendo Switch','Assemble your ultimate team of Marvel Super Heroes from a huge cast including the Avengers, the Guardians of the Galaxy, the X-Men, and more! Team up with friends to prevent galactic devastation at the hands of the mad cosmic tyrant Thanos and his ruthless warmasters, The Black Order.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r88.jpg'),(12386,'Hachi Hachi',NULL,'Music, Arcade','Sin plataforma','A Hong Kong made rhythm game released on iOS and Android devices, the game has competition that players may connect to each other to battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qaf.jpg'),(12387,'Blood Broker',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Blood Broker is a consent-based human sacrifice management simulator.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12388,'Puchiguru Love Live!','2018-04-24','Puzzle, Arcade','Android, iOS','Puchiguru Love Live! is a game released for iOS and Android, based on the Love Live! franchise. The game\'s service was terminated on May 31, 2019.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r0x.jpg'),(12389,'Muzzle Run','2022-12-01','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Greyhounds are running on the Polygon Blockchain!\nBreed, train, and race to win money on your way to podium glory with your NFT Greyhound collection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f8k.jpg'),(12390,'MiG-29 Soviet Fighter','1990-12-31','Shooter','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Amiga, Amstrad CPC, Nintendo Entertainment System','MiG-29: Soviet Fighter is a shoot \'em up game developed by Codemasters in 1989 and released for several contemporary home computers. An unlicensed version was also released for the Nintendo Entertainment System by Camerica.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k5f.jpg'),(12391,'Railroad Tycoon 3','2003-10-27','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A fully realised 3D gaming world scaling from eye in the sky views of entire continents down to incredibly detailed close-ups of beautifully modelled locomotives, buildings and landscapes. As well as the 25 challenging scenarios to recreate magnificent feats of railroading history, players can pick from over 40 locomotives over 35 different cargoes and in excess of 150 buildings ? all to be used in a dynamic, fluid economy. Railroad Tycoon 3 defines the essence of tycoon simulations with incredible attention to detail in a living, breathing world, built around a truly amazing game! All aboard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r3o.jpg'),(12392,'Kyouko no Tame ni Kane wa Naru','2018-07-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A doujin game by Nuu based on the Touhou Project series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vmb.jpg'),(12393,'Ultra Moto VR',NULL,'Racing','Arcade','Ultra Moto VR takes fantasy motorbike racing to a whole new level with immersive game play, realistic graphics displayed on 43” LCD and numerous high-octane racetracks. Get ready for an adrenaline-pumping ride that brings the thrill of realistic racing to life in a virtual environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52yc.jpg'),(12394,'Wordfish',NULL,'Puzzle, Quiz/Trivia','Sin plataforma','Discover new words and learn how to spell them through six different minigames in Wordfish.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45l8.jpg'),(12395,'Tiger Tank 59 I: Winter Assault MP048',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','\"Tiger Tank 59 I Winter Assault\" is a top-down shooting gameIn this game. Players need to control their tanks, through the enemy lines, break the enemy base, or defeat the enemy tanks. The DLC include map pack 048.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12396,'Sil-Q','2017-10-04','Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sil-Q is a computer role-playing game with a strong emphasis on discovery and tactical combat. It has a simple but rich combat system which allows for a great variety of choice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c3w.jpg'),(12397,'Wildland Animal Hunting',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12398,'C&C Level-CD: Vol.3','1996-12-31','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','C&C Level-CD: Vol.3 is an unofficial add-on with 400 extra levels for Command & Conquer. The CD also includes several editors, cheats and hints.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8iak.jpg'),(12399,'Shadow Warrior','2013-09-26','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Shadow Warrior is a bold reimagining of the 3D Realms\' cult classic shooter from independent developer Flying Wild Hog (Hard Reset) starring the legendary and quick-witted warrior Lo Wang. Combine the brute force of overwhelming firepower with the elegant precision of a katana to annihilate the merciless armies of the shadow realm in an exhilarating and visually stunning transformation of the classic first-person shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91kp.jpg'),(12400,'Big City Adventure: Paris','2013-02-06','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q3m.jpg'),(12401,'Resurgence','2017-09-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When his daughter Rosie goes missing after a car crash, Jason Dawn thinks his debts with the mob have come back to haunt him. His past leads him to a final confrontation where Jason learns the terrible truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mdu.jpg'),(12402,'Christmas Shooter',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','it\'s a 2d game focused on Christmas where it\'s snowing and you have to shoot candy at people, the game should be fun and have nice music. Your end is a goal where you have to get all the way to the end and you have two endings which are secret and normal','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cpb.jpg'),(12403,'Astro Chase','1984-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade, Atari 2600, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX','Astro Chase is a multidirectional shooter written by Fernando Herrera for Atari 8-bit computers. It was published by First Star Software in 1982 as the company\'s first game. Parker Brothers licensed it, releasing cartridge versions for the Atari 8-bit family and Atari 5200 console in 1983 and a Commodore 64 version in 1984. Exidy licensed it for arcade use with its Max-A-Flex cabinet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c3d.jpg'),(12404,'Puzzle Series Vol. 4: Kakuro',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','A number logic puzzle game from Hudson.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fclp0flhpufnptaqbafb.jpg'),(12405,'Kemco RPG Omnibus','2020-01-17','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','4 in 1 Game Collection - Revenant Dogma, Illusion of L\'Phalcia, Chronus Arc, and the Legend of the Tetrarchs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nuj.jpg'),(12406,'Run Hunter Run',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12407,'Shadow\'s Bullet','2021-10-06','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shadow’s Bullet is a top-down local multiplayer arena game with a twin-stick shooter gameplay, for 2 to 4 players sharing the same screen.\n\nPlayers control agents from the future who have the particularity to become invisible as long as they’re not under a bright light or taking actions.\n\nPlayers will fight each other, free for all or in teams, in various game modes, on multiple maps throughout various locations and time periods. Each one with their own game mechanics and traps to discover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66u3.jpg'),(12408,'Cities: Skylines - Country Road Radio','2018-05-24','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Country Road Radio, playing 16 original new songs in four sub-genres: Appalachian Folk, Bluegrass / Honky Tonk, Nashville Modern Country, and Unplugged Country. The radio host is pure Dixieland Delight, spinning six instrumental songs and 10 with original vocals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8345.jpg'),(12409,'Timothy and Titus',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12410,'Pirate\'s Pension',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Where did I bury my treasure again?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12411,'8-Bit Adventures 1: Bundle','2015-03-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bqr.jpg'),(12412,'Genocide','1989-07-23','Platform, Strategy','Sharp X68000, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','A side-scrolling mecha-themed action game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/j5x8z7reryp84yh2ga6t.jpg'),(12413,'Questprobe featuring The Hulk','1985-12-31','Adventure','BBC Microcomputer System, Atari 8-bit, Dragon 32/64, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Acorn Electron, Commodore 16, DOS, Apple II, Commodore Plus/4','Questprobe featuring The Hulk is a graphic adventure video game. It is the first entry in Questprobe, an intended series of graphic adventure games that only released three instalments before the developer\'s bankruptcy. The game\'s narrative follows the Marvel superhero Hulk and his human alter-ego Bruce Banner (in their first video game appearance), who must explore the mysterious lair of the Chief Examiner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w2y.jpg'),(12414,'Aikagi 2','2019-04-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aikagi 2 is a love story between the protagonist and his childhood friend, Ayano Sumeragi, who started living together after not seeing her attending school this semester and seeing her living the NEET life, focused on playing video games, with your objective is to help her wake up and study.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6muj.jpg'),(12415,'Slavic Gods Rodnoverie',NULL,'Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Sin plataforma','Slash dungeon monsters, survive and protect shrine! Upgrade your God powers & support your champion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83nb.jpg'),(12416,'Sorcerer\'s Choice: Angel or Demon?',NULL,'Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sorcerer’s Choice: Angel or Demon? is a dark fantasy visual novel that tells the story of a boy called Lucil, the grandson of a great magician. After his house is attacked by a mob, his grandfather teleports him to safety. Burned and battered, Lucil is aware of two beings standing over him: one of Light, and one of Darkness.\n\nWhich hand will he take? What fate awaits him when he chooses?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65kp.jpg'),(12417,'Potion Permit: Deluxe Edition','2022-09-22','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Moonbury\'s residents need healing, and you\'re the best chemist around! With your trusty tools, a brewing cauldron, and a canine companion at your side, you\'ll need to diagnose symptoms, gather ingredients, brew potions, and cure ailments in this open-ended sim RPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5esx.jpg'),(12418,'Magic Sword','1990-06-23','Platform','Arcade, Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Magic Sword is a 2D action side-scroller with a fantasy theme. The hero and his chosen accomplice must battle their way through a wizard\'s tower in a lust for monster slaying and loot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2toj.jpg'),(12419,'Wildagotchi: Virtual Pet - Deluxe Edition','2023-11-14','Simulator, Strategy, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12420,'Greengrocer Simulator 2024','2024-12-08','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Can you rebuild a career that has hit rock bottom? Strive to rise from nothing to the top. Arrange your fruits & vegetables however you like. Keep track of price updates. Play the stock market and aim for the top. Meet people and grab a drink. Show the whole world who\'s the best.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96pe.jpg'),(12421,'Agile Warrior F-111X','1995-12-21','Shooter, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Agile Warrior F-111X is a flight combat game that puts you in the heat of battle against terrorists. It seems some sort of agency is threatening the general welfare of the country, and it is up to you to thwart its diabolical plans.\n\nIn order to stop the enemy, you\'ll take to the skies in your trusty aircraft (a combination of the YF-23, X-31, and the F-111). Like Air Combat, there are various missions to conquer (over six in all). There are stealth missions requiring you to avoid radar, bombing, and missile raids, and straight-up dogfights. Resistance comes in the form of other aircraft, sea cruisers, ground turrets, and missiles.\n\nYour plane has the ability to detect enemies on radar, fire various missile weapons, and cloak itself from radar (very handy for those stealth missions). In order to survive, each feature must be utilized and learned by the player. Certain objectives require the use of heat-seeking missiles and strategy. If you go in with guns and missiles blazing, in all likelihood, you\'ll get shot out of the sky.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ywe.jpg'),(12422,'Marvel Avengers: Battle for Earth','2013-01-25','Fighting, Shooter','Wii U, Xbox 360','The Skrulls have landed and now it is up to you to embody your favorite Marvel super heroes and defeat epic enemies during the Secret Invasion. Unleash your inner superhero in Marvel Avengers Battle For Earth!\n\nThe ultimate super hero brawler, Marvel Avengers Battle For Earth features 20 different characters including the Avengers Iron Man, Hulk, Captain America, and Thor, as well as other fan favorite super heroes and villains from the Marvel Universe. Players will use motion gameplay to execute explosive super attacks, unleash devastating special moves, and battle their friends in a wide variety of game modes','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22so.jpg'),(12423,'Bananarchy',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','MONKEY AROUND with your friends or solo in this adventure multiplayer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oqw.jpg'),(12424,'7th Sea: A Pirate\'s Pact','2018-12-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fight for what\'s right—as an up and coming pirate! Battle slavers, sea monsters, and your own corrupt government to become a hero of the high seas. But will you betray your own crew for wealth and power? \n \n7th Sea: A Pirate\'s Pact is a 200,000-word interactive adventure novel by Danielle Lauzon, set in the world of the table-top role playing game 7th Sea. It\'s entirely text-based, without graphics or sound effects, and fueled by the vast, unstoppable power of your imagination. \n \nLooking for adventure at sea? You’ll get more than you bargained for when you end up joining a pirate crew. These pirates are known among sailors for having their own moral code, one that is now yours. You\'ll have the chance to rescue prisoners, uncover a secret plot, and even build a navy to liberate an island fort full of slaves. \n \nBut you\'ll also be tempted to break your pirate bonds to seek your own gain. Would you still free the slaves if you could take out your own rivals instead? How far will you go to save your friends? And when you uncover corruption in your homeland, will you choose villainy or vengeance? \n \nEarn your crew\'s loyalty and they might make you their captain, but get careless and you might have to walk the plank!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28ri.jpg'),(12425,'Swamp Thing','1992-11-01','Platform','Game Boy, Nintendo Entertainment System','Swamp Thing is a platform video game for the NES and Game Boy. It is based on the animated series of the same name, focusing on the DC Comics superhero character Swamp Thing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5otu.jpg'),(12426,'Totally Smashed',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Totally Smashed is a LORD-like BBS door game that was originally released in 1995.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12427,'Tanzia','2018-07-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','An Adventure RPG in comic book style with an island setting of treasure chests and waterfalls, Tanzia combines elements of favorite classic RPGs in an open 3D world of magic and monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zlb0ljqmgn8tc8vv3mij.jpg'),(12428,'Growlanser','2009-05-14','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Growlanser is a fantasy SRPG (strategy role-playing game), and the first in the Growlanser series of games. \n \nThe main character is Carmaine, an orphan raised by the palace royal magician, Sandra. Prophesied as an infant to become either \"the darkness to destroy the world\" or \"the light which saves it\", Sandra carefully watches over him and never allows him to leave Rolandia\'s capital city, Rosaria, or have any contact with the outside world. However, throughout his childhood Carmaine experiences strange and vivid dreams of people and places he knows nothing about. When at last he becomes old enough, Sandra tells him it is time to go out and explore beyond the city gates. Accompanied by Tippi, his tiny fairy-like companion, he leaves the city to discover his destiny.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wiq.jpg'),(12429,'Geminism','2025-02-19','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Two pairs of twins war for love, life, and limb beneath the curtain of a dark Tokyo night. From the artisans at CRAFTWORK comes a visual novel lush with art, action, and mystery; a story of GEMINISM—deformity and divinity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8be0.jpg'),(12430,'The Smurfs Dance Party','2011-09-08','Music','Wii','The Smurfs are back in an all new dancing video game, based on the best-selling Just Dance & Just Dance 2. Kids and parents will dance to popular, top of the chart songs in this fun, high-energy game with their favorite Smurfs characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cyn.jpg'),(12431,'A Little Time','2022-05-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Little Time is a first-person interactive story. You play as a young but determined detective investigating a man\'s disappearance. You will travel to a variety of locations and pick up clues while experiencing the story, dialogue, and atmospheric visuals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kvf.jpg'),(12432,'The Based Turnabout','2021-10-03','Visual Novel','Web browser','Phoenix Wright faces his final case of his career before retirement, but a case involving the king of turnabouts is never so simple, is it?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8idz.jpg'),(12433,'Darkwing Duck',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Darkwing Duck is a bootleg port of the NES version of Darkwing Duck for Sega Genesis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zy0.jpg'),(12434,'PixelJunk Racers: 2nd Lap','2010-07-15','Puzzle, Racing','PlayStation 3','Get your motor running for some addictive slot car racing challenges in the brilliant PixelJunk style. PixelJunk Racers supports 1080p and features single player and multiplayer fun (up to 7 players simultaneously offline!). Intuitive controls, 32 different race modes, and online rankings provide hours of racing mayhem. 16 core racing modes with varying degrees of difficulty for a total of 32 modes, including an in-depth single-player tournament and offline multiplayer modes.\n\nThe free \"2nd Lap\" expansion introduces support for PlayStation 3 Trophies (what\'s a race car driver without the podium trophy?). You can replay PixelJunk Racers 2nd Lap to unlock all the added Trophies. It also adds a Ghost Attack mode. Think you\'re the best? Register your new record on the high score tables and allow anyone in the world (including your friends of course) can compete against your best race.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h39.jpg'),(12435,'Synth Retro Vapor Wave','2022-09-13','Racing, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Relaxing game, players drive the car to avoid colliding with other vehicles on the road. Support importing local music and car decal pictures. There are currently 10 maps, 5 cars, 20 music, AI co-driver, dynamic raindrop windows, and a large number of custom effect options.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42tv.jpg'),(12436,'Kaiten Patissier','2008-05-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A puzzle game for the Xbox Live Marketplace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xwuxvljaantr0htadcsc.jpg'),(12437,'Jetpack Stadium','2022-02-04','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jetpack Stadium is a hilarious VR sports game that will have you flying around a virtual stadium. Use your head to hit a massive soccer ball into your opponent\'s goal using two hand-mounted rockets. Duke it out against other players in a soccer-like competition!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fy6.jpg'),(12438,'Call of the Ages: Collector\'s Edition','2013-10-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','History itself is in peril! The Calendar of Ages has stopped working and it\'s up to you to fix it. Travel through 8 countries, solve 150 levels, witness history and collect artifacts in this match-3 game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pbx.jpg'),(12439,'Descent: Road to Legend - Trials of Frostgate',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','The Trials of Frostgate are not for the faint of heart. Only the bravest shall be named Champion.Trials of Frostgate transports 2-4 heroes to the Free City of Frostgate, where the Northern Tribes have gathered for feasting, dancing, and sacred rituals, including the famed trials.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12440,'Real Hair Salon',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12441,'Tabletop Simulator: Three Kingdoms Redux',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Three Kingdoms Redux is a board game that seeks to recreate the tripartite between the states of Wei, Wu and Shu. You assume the role of one of the three lords – Cao Cao leading Cao Wei, Sun Jian leading Eastern Wu or Liu Bei leading Shu Han.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12442,'Bubble Zoo 2',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12443,'Pussy: Love Story from Titanic','1999-12-31','Puzzle','ZX Spectrum','Pussy: Love Story from Titanic is a single player game which contains platform and falling brick puzzle solving elements. Gameplay is similar to the game Popils.\n\nThe story behind the game is that Leonardo won a ticket to travel on the Titanic\'s maiden voyage. There he met the girl of his dreams, Kate. However Kate was rich and Leonardo was poor and worse, a thief. Their love was forbidden.\n\nThe game consists of a series of fifty puzzles in which the objective is to get Kate & Leonardo to meet. Kate is usually on top of a parapet or trapped behind a wall shouting \'Help\' and the player must guide Leonardo to her. To solve these puzzles Leonardo can climb ladders and, with his mighty fist, he can smash bricks. Smashed bricks disappear and the bricks above them will fall down to take their place. Some bricks are hollow and cannot be smashed, others will explode.\n\nThe game also features teleports, which the manual assures were a common feature on the original Titanic, enemies to deal with, and two lengthy platform sequences where Leonardo must traverse the length of the Titanic.\n\nPasswords are used to enable games to be restarted at later levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u27.jpg'),(12444,'Mouse Mayhem Shooting & Racing','2019-12-12','Racing, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Help the cute little mouse \'SUEAKY\' as he race, shooting and destroying enemies and overcomes hurdles with nothing to lose!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pem.jpg'),(12445,'NCAA Final Four 2004','2003-11-11','Sport','PlayStation 2','NCAA Final Four 2004','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dsmnvpklwlnymjn4xtoo.jpg'),(12446,'American Chopper','2006-06-15','Racing','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Be hired into the shop of the hit TV series American Chopper. Here\'s your chance to ride the bikes built by the Teutuls. Choose from the POW/MIA Bike, Jet Bike, Black Widow Bike, and others. You\'re also sent on missions to create your very own, original themed chopper that rivals those built by Paul Sr. and Paul Jr. Experience first-hand all of the hard work, drama, and thrill of creating one of the most beautiful bikes on the road today.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/igvuatzgxvdwvcmpd07f.jpg'),(12447,'Trainz: A New Era - Route: Midwestern Branch','2018-05-16','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Midwestern Branch is a fictional route based somewhere in the Midwestern section of the US. While the main line is owned and operated by BNSF, the branch line uses ex-Milwaukee Road units in both SD40-2 and GP38-2 styles to help serve the industries that are in the towns of Littleport, Levitt, Cylinder, and Mill Town.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12448,'Eddie’s Puzzle Time',NULL,'Puzzle','Game Boy','Eddie’s Puzzle Time is an unreleased puzzle game for the Game Boy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a5g.jpg'),(12449,'The Battle of Sacred Heart','2024-08-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Battle of Sacred Heart is a refreshing action RPG. Sacred Heart nuns challenge the elite of the four armies of Middle Earth. What the player must face is a protracted battle to the death.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nat.jpg'),(12450,'Dynamic Ski','1984-06-01','Sport','Arcade','A skiing game from Taiyo System.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ffni0k8fwoylnboddpn2.jpg'),(12451,'Infestation: The New Z','2016-11-22','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Infestation: The New Z is an official re-work of the game Infestation: Survivor Stories, created by new independent developers. Group up with friends and play the best Zombie/PvP MMO experience featuring a wide selection of game modes. Best of all? Its free-to-play!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2iu1.jpg'),(12452,'Royal Detective: The Princess Returns','2018-03-25','Point-and-click, Puzzle','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Elephant Games brings you the next thrilling chapter in the Royal Detective series. Princess has finally found the happy life that eluded her for so long, so why has she suddenly disappeared? And who is the mysterious figure attacking her statues?\n\nYou’ll need all your talents as the royal detective to uncover the mystery and save Princess in this stunning Hidden-Object Puzzle adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nj8.jpg'),(12453,'Russia','2005-12-31','Puzzle','Family Computer','Russia is an unlicensed puzzle game for the NES that is found in unlicensed plug and plug systems. The game is a clone of Tetris.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7f6c.jpg'),(12454,'Jigsaw Puzzles: Photo Puzzles',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','Get ready to play the first competitive multiplayer jigsaw puzzle game ever, on one puzzle board, and where the most points wins! It\'s a brand-new way to play, and something that promises to bring a whole new level of excitement to jigsaw puzzles. When you need something less competitive, play solo jigsaw mode and select from thousands of beautiful Free puzzles to play at your own pace. The jigsaw puzzle game offers multiple games modes, and endless hours of fun for adults.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12455,'The Island of Dr. Yepstein','2021-09-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Island of Dr. Yepstein - an uncompromising first-person action shooter that takes place on a paradise tropical island. The player in the role of a super-cool commando will have to meet face to face with dangerous enemies and solve all the secrets of the mysterious island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h6k.jpg'),(12456,'Zeron','1991-12-31','Shooter','Amiga','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tmkw819r5mww6qooh9f9.jpg'),(12457,'Revolution: War of Independence',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12458,'The Feral Child','2016-12-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As a feral child raised by flying squirrels in the forest, race against time to warn your forest friends of the coming danger, so that they may escape to safety.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84cx.jpg'),(12459,'SnarfQuest Tales, Episode 1: The Beginning','2017-03-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this point-and-click adventure game from the mind of Larry Elmore, you play as Snarf, a Zeetvah from Zeetville on an epic quest for fame and fortune. (Mostly fortune.) Can you help Snarf earn the gold, help the woman, and win his place on the throne?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1kk1.jpg'),(12460,'ColorBlend FX: Desaturation','2024-04-19','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Descend into Splatland - the world of ColorBlend FX: Desaturation — a captivating mythical puzzle-platformer metroidvania that weaves a tale of glow, courage, and creativity. Join the Splatians, as they unite to restore the stolen essence back to their world, challenging the nefarious schemes of the dark entity, Lord Ashen. Splat\'n\'stomp juicy enemies, swim in paint pools, solve physics and color puzzles, and of course survive the death while figuring out the evil plans of the Lord.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wqg.jpg'),(12461,'Super Smash Bros. for Wii U: Mewtwo','2015-04-15','Fighting, Platform','Wii U','The Psychic-type Pokémon Mewtwo makes its grand entrance! Make it Mega Evolve into Mega Mewtwo Y in its Final Smash, and then use Psystrike to blow away the opposition! Mewtwo was released for Club Nintendo members who registered their copies of Super Smash Bros. for Wii U and Super Smash Bros. for Nintendo 3DS on April 15th, 2015, with a public release on April 28th, 2015.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45ql.jpg'),(12462,'Online Soccer Manager','2010-11-06','Sport','Android, iOS','Take the reins of your favorite football team in Online Soccer Manager (OSM)! Immerse yourself in this free-to-play game that offers all real and authentic football leagues, clubs, and players from around the globe.\n\nEmbark on your football manager journey by signing with your beloved football club. Choose from prestigious leagues like Serie A, Premier League, Primera Division, and more, and lead iconic clubs such as Real Madrid, Barcelona, Liverpool, and many others.\n\nFrom that moment forward, the destiny of your team lies in your hands! Strategize your formation, line-up, and tactics, while also making crucial decisions on player transfers, scouting for talents, conducting training sessions, and expanding your stadium. Ensure your team performs at its peak to achieve your club\'s ambitions.\n\nChallenge your friends in the same league and experience the kick and rush of fierce friend competition in soccer games. Football management has never been so exhilarating!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gkm.jpg'),(12463,'Backyard Fury',NULL,'Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Summer fun and good times! A casual turn-based game with household items and kids\' imagination.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12464,'A New Life',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12465,'G-man Invasion','2006-04-28','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The G-Men are everywhere! They\'re invading out dear planet are trying to kill you, kill me, kill everyone! It\'s your job to stop them!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5l08.jpg'),(12466,'Hydro High-Rise',NULL,'Platform, Indie, Arcade','Sin plataforma','The Rise of the Hydro Zombie!\nWelcome to Hydro High-Rise, the ultimate test of your platforming skills and reflexes! In this addictive pixel art game, you play as a zombie equipped with a water-powered jetpack, tasked with ascending a perilous tower. With a blend of 2D and 3D side-scrolling action, Hydro High-Rise offers a unique and visually captivating experience.\n\nPrepare for a challenge like no other as you navigate treacherous obstacles and strive to reach new heights. But beware: one misstep and you’ll plummet back down, adding to the thrill and intensity of each climb. Can you master the jetpack, overcome the tower\'s devious traps, and achieve the ultimate high score?\n\nThis game was created as part of PixelJam-2024 with the theme Aqua, and it was developed with the idea to recreate the pixel art style in Unreal Engine 5.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12467,'Dark Lords Don\'t Give A :)','2018-11-01','Fighting, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Web browser','Dark Lords Don\'t Give A :) is a first-person game, combining visual novel and card fighting battle to create a very comedic game. Summon dark lords to fight against ghost cats that have been invading your land....except that those dark lords are not very reliable. \n \nNote to self: This game is made just for a meme and not to be taken seriously.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1idh.jpg'),(12468,'Wonder Boy','2004-03-25','Platform, Adventure','Legacy Mobile Device','A cell phone port of Wonder Boy, released only in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hlv.jpg'),(12469,'Barcode Battler: Bio-Zabrin','1991-12-31','Simulator','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9md4.jpg'),(12470,'Zombie Car Massacre','2017-09-15','Racing, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Did you ever wanted to hit a zombie with your car? The gates to the spooky grave-town have just opened for the live time chance to smash all the nasty zombies to splashy mud using your gears! Your time is now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co272h.jpg'),(12471,'Star Wars: Uprising','2015-09-10','Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','In the days following the Battle of Endor and the fall of the Emperor, The Anoat sector has been locked down by the Empire. With the Rebel Alliance on the other side of the Iron Blockade, it falls to the sector\'s smugglers, freedom fighters, bounty hunters and gangsters to join forces and form an uprising.\n\nThe Galaxy needs a new hero. What kind will you be?\nDecide and become a part of Star Wars history.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3107.jpg'),(12472,'RockFall','2013-12-31','Adventure, Arcade','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','RockFall is a homebrew Boulder Dash variant developed in the 90s and released as a ROM file, getting a physical release in 2013 by Piko Interactive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z9l.jpg'),(12473,'Westworld 2000','1996-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67yh.jpg'),(12474,'Outrunner: Neon Nights','2025-02-17','Racing','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Outrunner: Neon Nights merges arcade racing with snake-style mechanics. Race, jump, and defy gravity as you outsmart your opponents. Whether you prefer intense one-on-one duels or chaotic multiplayer mayhem, you can join the neon-lit arenas online with up to 8 players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pf8.jpg'),(12475,'Vegangsters','2025-06-01','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 2D roguelike that brings deckbuilding games to the next level! Set in a world full of crime, you will take control of a potato inspector that uses cards to arrest criminal vegetables.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97xh.jpg'),(12476,'Lover Pretend: Limited Edition','2021-03-25','Adventure, Visual Novel','Nintendo Switch','Lights, camera, action! A hilarious comedy about the entertainment industry and the colorful characters that populate it.\n\nThe limited edition comes with the soundtrack CD and exclusive character cards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6no9.jpg'),(12477,'Battles of North Africa 1941',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','The campaign in North Africa was the primary focus of both Italy and the British Empire in the first half of World War Two. Mussolini believed this was to be the opportunity to prove the Italian value to the Axis alliance. For the British, it was the first time that they began to make progress on land after the ignominious withdrawal from France. Coupled with the strategic victory in the air during the Battle of Britain, the success in Operation Compass in December 1940 strengthened morale across the British Commonwealth. \n \nBoth sides had significant constraints; the British were recovering from their strategic defeat in France, the Italians were struggling to support the war effort with an underdeveloped economy while the Germans were focused on the launching of the invasion of Russia (Unternehmen Barbarossa) in June 1941. \n \nThe desert though was to be the ultimate victor. The logistical requirements to support an army in extended operations was to prove beyond the ability of either side and the 1941 engagements were to be marked by theater wide advances and retreats multiple times. \n \nThis third release in the Panzer Battles franchise is focused on many of the large and small battles that occurred in eastern Libya and western Egypt as well as Greece. It is a departure from the more static battles of the earlier titles and maneuver engagements are much more prevalent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uyv.jpg'),(12478,'Super Casino 2','1994-10-28','Sin género','Super Famicom','Super Casino 2 is a Miscellaneous game, developed by OeRSTED and published by Coconuts Japan, which was released in Japan in 1994.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4d69.jpg'),(12479,'Teuflisch gute Spiele',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12480,'Battle of Empires: 1914-1918 - Russian Empire',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','The second campaign - Battle of Empires: Russian Empire - is devoted to the battles between the Russian and German armies on the Eastern front. Both of these campaigns are included in the base game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12481,'Stunt Track Racer',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61nx.jpg'),(12482,'Ancient Mind','2024-11-19','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore a region of mystery and danger in Ancient Mind, a modern take on the classic zelda-like top-down action adventure. Explore dungeons, fight monsters, solve puzzles, and discover the truth about ancient legends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7t78.jpg'),(12483,'Safehouse',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In Safehouse, play as a member of a criminal crew holed up in a Safehouse with a traitor among you working with the enemy to bring you down. Can you uncover their identity and eliminate them before they betray the crew?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ib3.jpg'),(12484,'GachaPon!','2024-07-15','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a whimsical journey of physics-based puzzle-solving in the delightful world of GachaPon! Discover the art of relaxation as you immerse yourself in this charming game, where the goal is not just to solve puzzles, but to enjoy the process of being yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tvf.jpg'),(12485,'Spacelords: Valeria Deluxe Character Pack',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Spacelords premium character packs instantly unlock characters along with a rare Blueprint that are only accessible in the late game. (*Estimated 30 hours, depending on your play-style) WARNING: This pack unlocks Valeria. If you already own this character, it won’t have any effect.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12486,'Quake3Quest','2022-05-13','Shooter','Meta Quest 2, Meta Quest 3','It\'s the real deal: Quake 3 in full VR. This port brings the frantic action of Q3:Arena to Virtual Reality.\n\nAnother Id-software classic brought to VR by Team Beef & Friends.\n\nFeatures:\n\nFrantic Single Player Campaign\nMultiplayer in local wifi or online\nDedicated VR-only servers\nIntuitive Weapons Selection\nFully Tracked Weapons\nfeatures additional mappacks via companion app\n4 maps inlcuded, you can jump into action right away.\nUnique Quest Home enviroment included (by Robyer1)\nUse the Companion App for streamlined hd mod and mappack installation. The app is in \"unknown sources\". Use it to change your player name as well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9acr.jpg'),(12487,'The Cycle: Frontier - Howler Tamer Bundle',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Let the competition know who\'s really the planet\'s apex predator with this Howler themed vanity pack. Each is precious, each is deadly.. Plus, a bonus of 1000 Aurum','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bib.jpg'),(12488,'Robotory',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Robotory is a vertical endless runner set in a robot factory. The player must run, jump and dodge enemies to escape with Robotory. Robotory is the debut game of 9th Impact.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12489,'Trilogy of the Moon','2025-04-09','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immerse yourself in a romantic fantasy where past meets present! Experience a unique interactive game featuring Korea\'s stunning photoshoot models in this cinematic adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nrs.jpg'),(12490,'Midnight Ultra','2017-11-02','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In the American Southwest, a lone witch hunter travels across the desert, seeking to wipe out cultists of all sorts. Fight a variety of goons and ghouls, through small towns to dimension-spanning motels. Blast your way through a neon-dripped, pixelated nightmare in this high-speed, high-thrills FPS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24zm.jpg'),(12491,'Total War: Warhammer - Jade Wizard','2016-12-08','Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Jade Wizard is a Empire missile infantry unit. Acolytes of the green Wind of Magic use the natural world and its seasons to heal and protect their companions.\n\nPractitioners of The Jade Order study Ghyran, the Lore of Life. Powerful healers, they travel the Empire offering their services to civilians and armies alike.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/eclpmbogldmoxijkl5oc.jpg'),(12492,'Children of the Galaxy','2017-03-14','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Children of the Galaxy is a grand scale 4x turn-based strategy game with a turn-based combat and tactical elements. You can explore the galaxy, colonize planets and build huge armies of starships to fight in epic space battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2aic.jpg'),(12493,'Shanghai: True Valor','1999-07-01','Puzzle','PlayStation','Shanghai: True Valor is a 3D puzzler based on the classic Oriental games Mah Jong and Shanghai. Each game starts off with a stack of tiles arranged in a pyramid shape. In order to win, the player is required to match up tiles by finding \"free\" tiles of the same type. \n \nFor instance, some tiles have numbers and some have pictures; the object is to find a tile not restricted, blocked, or under another tile. Once a player matches up two tiles of the same type, they are removed and the pyramid is reduced. By removing tiles, previously restricted tiles may be opened up. Gameplay flows in this fashion until there are no more tiles or a stalemate. Stalemates are very common and occur when there are no possible matches or moves remaining.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rcdzl4f1ntl7s5amgiat.jpg'),(12494,'Bloodborne: Nightmare Edition','2015-04-24','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4','Face your fears as you search for answers in the ancient city of Yharnam, now cursed with a strange endemic illness spreading through the streets like wildfire. Danger, death and madness lurk around every corner of this dark and horrific world, and you must discover its darkest secrets in order to survive.\n\nNightmare Edition comes with:\nBloodborne PS4 game\nSteelBook case\nPremium art book with exclusive concept art\nDigital soundtrack of the game\nBloodborne gothic notebook\nQuill & red ink set\n“Top Hat” Messenger skin\nBell trinket','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47rd.jpg'),(12495,'Yay! Spring Trip with My Coworkers!','2024-05-21','Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Yay! Spring Trip with My Coworkers! is a Visual Novel created for Blossom VN Jam 2024 and Fuck Capitalism Jam 2024 as it\'s about a trip full of fun spring activities and complaining about your job.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wzv.jpg'),(12496,'Cities: Skylines - Content Creator Pack: Modern Japan','2020-03-26','Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Content Creator Pack: Modern Japan introduces a unique flair inspired by Japanese architecture with 20 buildings and six props from modder Ryuichi Kaminogi. These are the first Japanese buildings to be added to Cities: Skylines, bringing ornate models ranging from impressive skyscrapers to cozy udon and ramen shops.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3192.jpg'),(12497,'Danganronpa: Hope Restoration','2019-12-07','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Danganronpa: Hope Restoration is a fan-made Danganronpa game being created using RPG Maker MV. Completely unaffiliated with the official Danganronpa brand, games, or Spike Chunsoft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pcx.jpg'),(12498,'Pinball FX 2: Zen Classics',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12499,'Billiards Simulator','1989-12-31','Sport','Amiga','Billiards Simulator is a carom billiards game which is played with three balls and on a table without pockets. In the first phase of the shot, the cue is aligned to the ball. Here the player can either use the full 3D perspective or a top-down view. After that, the used cue (there are three), the spin and the strength of the shot is chosen by aligning diagrams and sliders. Then the shot is performed and points assigned. Additionally the player can set certain parameters to change the game experience, e.g. ball weight, friction or rebound.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91ax.jpg'),(12500,'Balldemic',NULL,'Arcade','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12501,'Super Chinese World 3: Chou Jigen Daisakusen','1995-12-01','Role-playing (RPG)','Satellaview, Super Famicom','Super Chinese World 3 is a Japanese-only action RPG developed by Culture Brain. It is the third SNES Super Chinese game, being a sequel to Super Chinese World 2. It keeps the Beat\'em-up battle system from the previous games, but gives the opportunity to play with other characters than Jack and Ryu, each having a different way of fighting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3apn.jpg'),(12502,'Simon\'s Cat - Crunch Time','2017-06-27','Puzzle, Strategy','iOS','Simon’s Cat in Crunch Time! - a Match 3 puzzle adventure\nPublished by Strawdog.\n\nThe devilish crows have swiped Simon’s Cat’s favourite Tasty Treats and only YOU can help him find them!\n\nJoin Simon’s Cat, Maisy, Chloe and Jazz, and a cast of determined kitties on a colourful adventure through some pawsome new places where Treats are just waiting to be eaten.\nBe ready to collect Tasty Treats, fight off big baddies and befriend a host of animal critters in this FREE puzzle game with added CATitude!\n\nSimple and addictive puzzle gameplay! Connect the same coloured Treats to make a delicious chain!\n\nPlay your way through the neighbourhood in six different game modes and hundreds of challenging levels!\n\nChallenge your friends! Can you beat your friends purrfect high score?\nCan you beat the villains? Use your Treats and special boosters to fight off Sir Royston the Pug, Mr Potts, hungry hedgehogs and even a treat crazed vacuum cleaner!\nPlay with Simon’s Cat featuring brand new animations\n\nSimon\'s Cat is the internet’s most mischievous cat and has become a global phenomenon. Star of over 60 films, which have been watched over 870 million times, and winner of several major industry awards, Simon\'s Cat has captured the hearts of a worldwide audience.\n\nWe are working hard to update the game with new levels that are purrfectly crafted and will leave you feline great!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/imysrg6xmarzpuxdzwho.jpg'),(12503,'Dark War: Survival','2024-09-19','Strategy','Android, iOS','Gear up and brace yourself for the ultimate test of zombie apocalypse survival! Dive into thrilling gameplay and uncover captivating events that await your exploration!\n\nAs a sudden and catastrophic zombie virus ravages human society, your once cozy life is shattered. Family and friends turn into the walking dead before your very eyes. Escaping the chaos of your crumbling home, you now face the ultimate challenge: setting up a shelter to survive the zombie apocalyptic world, and reigniting the flames of human civilization.\n\nCan you successfully adapt to the hostile environment teeming with dangers, and lead your fellow survivors in rebuilding civilization? It\'s time for you to step up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bz9.jpg'),(12504,'Friday Night Funkin\' D-Sides','2021-07-15','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get ready to get freaky in yet another remix Mod. The minds of DastardlyDeacon, FifLeo, philiplol and gc present Friday Night Funkin\': D-Side.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4om5.jpg'),(12505,'Across the demon realm 2','2021-03-17','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A retro brutal-horror platformer in pixel-art!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kz3.jpg'),(12506,'Firebowl',NULL,'Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','FireBowl is an Arcade Multiplayer game inspired by the classics. It is set in High Fantasy world with all the classic characters such as Halflings, Wizards or... Toilets? Join the party and discover the number one sport of the Middle Ages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76tb.jpg'),(12507,'Birds & Bombs',NULL,'Puzzle','Nintendo DSi','Wicked ghosts have kidnapped the president’s daughter, trapping her in a haunted mansion! As a plucky young bird trooper you must use your bomb-throwing abilities to defeat the ghosts and rescue the girl. Ghosts can only be destroyed by throwing bombs into their mouths. Use the stylus to set your throwing angle and take your best shot! Bounce bombs off walls and eerie floating furniture to defeat all the spooks in each stage, but make sure not to run out of bombs or you\'re in for a fright! In addition to the main Story Mode, you can really put your skills to the test in Challenge Mode with only a limited number of bombs to last you through to the end. But never fear; with perseverance and accuracy, you\'re sure to replenish your supply and stay in high spirits!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kxv.jpg'),(12508,'Dead Tunnel',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Dead Tunnel is 2D Shooter Platformer Roguelite game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5g1x.jpg'),(12509,'Threat: Scream and Escape','2025-04-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','THREAT -SCREAM AND ESCAPE- is a unique horror game where you must scream into your microphone to stun approaching creatures and make your escape. Use the power of your voice to clear the path and guide the protagonist, who wakes up in a mysterious research facility, to freedom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9np2.jpg'),(12510,'Tatsunoko vs. Capcom: Cross Generation of Heroes','2008-12-31','Fighting','Arcade','The first version of Tatsunoko vs. Capcom, released in arcades.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pcv.jpg'),(12511,'Youda Safari',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Give tourists a once in a lifetime holiday experience as you guide them past rebellious rhinos, hilarious hippos and much other wildlife in your own safari park! Groups of enthusiastic and eager safari tourists depend on you to show them the most exotic animals in their natural habitat when they book a safari. Experience the beauty of wildlife when you go on one adventure after the other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/kfg6ftopjjhwo1qcqugm.jpg'),(12512,'Poi Poi Ninja World','1996-06-28','Sin género','Super Famicom','This Super Famicom release from Bandai used the company\'s Sufami Turbo accessory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z3u.jpg'),(12513,'MagiKart: Retro Kart Racing',NULL,'Racing, Indie, Arcade','Sin plataforma','MagiKart: Retro Kart Racing is a retro inspired racing game that heavily borrows from some of the best (and worst) late 90s kart racers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ms1.jpg'),(12514,'Bermuda Farm',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12515,'The Tale of Galariel','2023-06-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You play as an orc wishing to conquer the land and make it your own, you may make allies such as Goblins, Kobolds, Dragonkin, and More. Be warned Humans and Heroes are on their way. Are you ready to conquer the land?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uur.jpg'),(12516,'Tiger Tank 59 I: Black Hill Fortress MP017',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Tiger Tank 59 is a top-down shooting game. Players need to control their tanks, through the enemy lines, break the enemy base, and defeat all the enemy tanks.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12517,'X Drive','2017-06-16','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','X Drive - multiplayer dynamic shooter from the third person view, developed for VR headset.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12518,'Railway Empire: DLC Bundle',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','The \'Railway Empire: DLC Bundle\' contains all available DLCs: Mexico, the Great Lakes, Crossing the Andes, Great Britain & Ireland, France, Germany Northern Europe and Down Under.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tb9.jpg'),(12519,'Button Lock',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Navigate through a series of intricate—or possibly incredibly simple—mazes. But beware, as you are only given a certain number of moves to work with. You must make the most of your surroundings and discover unconventional pathways in order to proceed in this head-scratching puzzle game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cfj.jpg'),(12520,'Krai Mira','2016-07-11','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scorched by the sun and hopelessly irradiated, the Earth is soaked in toxic waste and blood of its former masters. Those who remain are fighting to survive the endless and senseless struggle with the environment, and, inevitably, with themselves.\n\nKrai Mira is a new Post-Apocalyptic RPG inspired by Fallout.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jrjskfukipolwc3a0z4c.jpg'),(12521,'2048 Colorful','2020-12-01','Sin género','Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k4f.jpg'),(12522,'RoShamBo Arena: Starter Fighter Pack',NULL,'Sport, Indie','Sin plataforma','The Starter Fighter Pack will give you everything you need to become the best in RoShamBo arena!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12523,'Survival Z The Alpha',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Be the First Zombie and Start a Great Achievement:Infect the Whole World,Grow your Zombie Poplulations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7x9k.jpg'),(12524,'Trainz Plus: ZecRail V499 Blue & Gold and Christmas 2019',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','ZecRail V499 Baldwin Compound - Blue and Gold and Christmas 2019','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12525,'Space of One Drama',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The story of a creature struggling to survive in the spectacle affected by the artificial audience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41v5.jpg'),(12526,'Painkiller','2006-09-01','Shooter, Puzzle','Xbox, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Stranded in a place between Heaven and Hell, your time of judgment is at hand. The Underworld is on the verge of unholy war, and you are but a pawn in the infernal battle. As you fight for your purification, the truths behind the deceptions are revealed. Painkiller puts you in a nightmarish world where monsters swarm you in mobs. Eliminate your enemies using a variety of weapons and using your power to morph into a possessed creature.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b98.jpg'),(12527,'Black One Blood Brothers','2022-01-11','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Black One Blood Brothers is a tactical military shooter game where strategy and coordination are key. Command a squad of top operators, with unique skills, through high-risk missions around the globe. Customize your crew, plan your missions, and adjust on the fly for a vast replayability.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wba.jpg'),(12528,'Arrowpoint','2017-12-11','Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take aim and make your name as an epic monster hunter. Rumors tell of a terrible beast which roams the desert. Grab your bow, mount your steed, and set out on an adventure! This is a short, focused game about hitting targets with arrows and slaying a giant monster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29iy.jpg'),(12529,'The Lost Nomad',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The Lost Nomad is role-playing game (RPG) and (survival system) that made by one solo developer. with an engaging building system and resource management mechanics, chose your own path in the shattered lands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ggm.jpg'),(12530,'Bad Business','2019-07-24','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bad Business, an extremely challenging top-down tactical shooter game where Mr. Bunny Rabbit, a hitman for the Mob, has been tasked to neutralize the rival Gang. A hard task for any organization, an impossible task for a hitman.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co598f.jpg'),(12531,'Tribal Rage','1998-05-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rule the wasteland of the future as a gorgeous Amazon, or an evil Death-cultist in the real-time strategy game that doesn\'t take itself too seriously. With family choices including chain-wielding Bikers, Cyborgs, Enforcers, and Good ol\' Trailer Trash, you\'re bound to find the Tribe that\'s right for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48s2.jpg'),(12532,'Monkey Bongo',NULL,'Puzzle, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12533,'The House of the Dead 2','1999-12-31','Shooter','Arcade, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Dreamcast','The House of the Dead 2 is a first-person light gun shooter arcade game with a horror theme and the second game in The House of the Dead series of video games. The direct sequel to The House of the Dead, it was developed by Sega for arcades on the Sega NAOMI board in November 1998 then later ported to the Dreamcast in 1999 and Microsoft Windows in 2001, and is also found on the Xbox as an unlockable bonus in The House of the Dead III. The game appears in the compilation The House of the Dead 2 & 3 Return for Wii. The Dreamcast version became a Sega All Stars title.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nra.jpg'),(12534,'Total War: Warhammer - Grombrindal the White Dwarf','2016-10-22','Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Grombrindal \"The White Dwarf\" is a brand new Legendary Lord for the Dwarfs. He is an enigmatic figure, recorded throughout the Dwarfs\' history, appearing to give aid to his bearded kin whenever their situation becomes especially dire.\n\nLike all Legendary Lords, Grombrindal unlocks a series of unique quests as he levels up, each of which rewards him with his legendary wargear. Grombrindal has no less than four quest-chains, bestowing him with the Rune Helm of Zhufbar, the Armour of Glimril Scales, the Rune Cloak of Valaya, and the Rune Axe of Grimnir. Thus clad, he is a formidable force of the battlefield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dm0x75rucltfix56a2ob.jpg'),(12535,'Dissident: Frostland Escape',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A survival game about prisoners escaping from forced labor camps. A progressive, atmospheric tale - and all of it grounded in historical facts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3op3.jpg'),(12536,'Pitcher\'s Duel','2007-02-01','Sport','Vectrex','Pitcher\'s Duel was sold both as cart only and cartridge with manual and full color printed GCE Style cardboard box. Approximately, 250-300 are believed to exist, of which somewhere around 200 were sold complete. Those sold complete with box at the 2007 Classic Gaming Expo had a PCB contained in a green transluscent reproduction shell while those sold after were contained in the standard black shell. There was no overlay included however an overlay design is depicted on the box. In addition, the was one Pitcher\'s Duel Collectors Set auctioned at CGE2K7 which included both the green translucent and black standard versions of Pitcher\'s Duel as well as exclusive red translucent and blue translucent version of the cart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co792x.jpg'),(12537,'Marvel\'s Avengers: Deluxe Edition','2020-09-04','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Marvel\'s Avengers is an epic, third-person, action-adventure game that combines an original, cinematic story with single-player and co-operative gameplay. Assemble into a team of up to four players online, master extraordinary abilities, customize a growing roster of Heroes, and defend the Earth from escalating threats.\n\nMarvel\'s Avengers: Deluxe Edition includes the exclusive Obsidian Outfit pack for your Avengers, including Captain America, Iron Man, Black Widow, Thor, Hulk, and Ms. Marvel, along with six exclusive Obsidian-themed nameplates to further customize your gameplay cosmetics. This edition also includes 72-hour early access.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2edu.jpg'),(12538,'Prune & Milo','2024-07-11','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Join Prune & Milo, a sister-brother duo, in this enchanting turn-based puzzle game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8e54.jpg'),(12539,'Star Trek: Legends - Complete Edition','2024-12-25','Sin género','Xbox One','Captain - The fate of the universe is in your hands!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9etj.jpg'),(12540,'Microsoft Jewel 2','2022-02-05','Puzzle','Web browser','READY FOR NEW MATCH 3 BLING!?\nMicrosoft Jewel 2 brings MORE sparkle to the classic Match 3 game with a collection of jewels that help you rack up MASSIVE points.\n\nBuild longer match combinations, play NEW bonus modes, and complete more challenges to reach a HIGHER score. This NEW version of Microsoft Jewel really knows how to shine!\n\nMatch 3 of the same jewel to build a collection of BONUS JEWELS. Use Bonus Jewels anywhere on the board to create larger matches, clear the board faster, and earn MORE points.\n\nComplete matches to achieve challenge goals but BE CAREFUL, Jewels will not fall to fill the board so make every move count.\n\nReach new bonus levels and discover special gems you’ve never seen before. Combine classic Match 3 skills with sparkling surprises in this ALL-NEW version. Microsoft Jewel has never shined so bright!\n\nCombine these new skills and see how far you can get in Microsoft Jewel 2!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8um6.jpg'),(12541,'Starship Troopers: Extermination - Warrior Tiger Bundle','2024-10-11','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Starship Troopers: Extermination is a fully licenced 16-player co-op FPS that puts you on the galactic frontlines of the acclaimed sci-fi series! Squad up, grab your rifle, and do your part as an elite Deep Space Vanguard Trooper to take back the galaxy from the Bug threat! Do you want to know more?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eev.jpg'),(12542,'Tales of Cosmos','2016-10-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tales of Cosmos is an old-school point-and-click adventure game set in a huge open world planetary system. Pilot your rocket across space, land on planets and moons, solve puzzles, and unravel a cosmic mystery with the help of a genius monkey and a wondrous talking dog.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rj6.jpg'),(12543,'Faire Trade',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ready to take on the management of a fantasy shop? Faire Trade allows you to do just that! From farming, to crafting, to selling, to hiring, to expanding, to pricing, to decorating to….. Well, the world\'s your oyster! Stay curious, adapt, and let your blossoming shop shine!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kkb.jpg'),(12544,'Tiny Tina\'s Wonderlands: Chaotic Great Edition','2022-03-25','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Embark on an epic adventure full of whimsy, wonder, and high-powered weaponry! Roll your own multiclass hero then shoot, loot, slash, and cast on a quest to stop the Dragon Lord.\n\nThis Edition Includes:\n\n-Full Game\n-Optimized for Xbox Series X|S\n-Dragon Lord Pack Bonus Content\n-Season Pass','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3t2s.jpg'),(12545,'Samawa Idle','2023-11-13','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Unleash the power of specialized towers to annihilate hordes of monsters in this idle game with roguelike elements. Collect gold, level up your towers, face powerful bosses, and refine your strategy with an evolving skill tree.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d85.jpg'),(12546,'Murasaki','2016-05-12','Shooter, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Murasaki\" is a puzzle explosion game.\nUse explosions to clear the screen of pesky obstacles filling it up.\nThe only controls you need are the directional buttons and two other buttons (Z and X)!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pfo.jpg'),(12547,'Farming Simulator 19: Alpine Farming','2020-12-28','Simulator','Xbox One','Enrich your Farming Simulator 19 experience and reach for the mountaintop with the official Alpine Farming Expansion for Farming Simulator 19!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ami.jpg'),(12548,'Bullyparade: Der Spiel','2017-08-10','Racing, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','For the 20th anniversary of the legendary comedy show, Bully & Co are coming back to the big cinema screen. And on your mobile!\n\nMeet the famous characters and fight yourself as a chieftain, blood brother, empress, emperor, Captain Kork or Mr. Spuck through the fascinating environments of the movie in this unique game.\n\nBULLYPARADE - DER FILM (THE MOVIE) is an exciting jump\'n\'run game where speed, skill and anger can lead to success! Play against other players and enjoy being part of the fun world of Bully!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a1h.jpg'),(12549,'The School: White Day','2015-11-15','Adventure, Indie','Android, iOS','Run if you wish to live! A top quality horror game with full 3D graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sa6.jpg'),(12550,'9 R.I.P. Aroma Edition','2024-10-15','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Aroma Edition Includes: 9 R.I.P for Nintendo Switch, Reversible Cover Sleeve, Collector’s Boxes, Acrylic Standee (reveals an image when lit up!), set of 9 Character Cards, Cloth Poster, Dark Sweet Dreams Aroma Diffuser','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9giu.jpg'),(12551,'Mickey\'s Speedway USA: Huey','2000-11-13','Racing','Nintendo 64','A character unlocked by link to the Game Boy Color version via the Transfer Pak.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o8m.jpg'),(12552,'Melancholic Dreamtower','2011-09-04','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"You\'re the new hero.\"\n\nIchiya Shinozaki opened his eyes in a strange darkness\nto the words of a stranger.\n\n\"There\'s a princess trapped in the highest room of this tower. I need you to get her out of this place.\"\n\nIt felt like the premise of some RPG.\nIchiya was full of questions, but the stranger\'s way seemed the only way.\nIf he wanted to get out of here, he would have to save the princess.\n\nIchiya wasn\'t alone in his upward journey.\nOn the first floor was a man rendered deaf and mute.\nOn the second floor, a blinded man.\nOn the third floor, a man who coveted color.\nOn the fourth floor, a young girl who was terrified of men.\n\nHe undertook his so-called quest.\nFor the sake of the princess, for his own sake, in defiance of destiny,\nsteeped in the interests of five cohabitants.\n\n5 potential suicides. 5 candidates for death.\n\nIn the overwhelming gloom of a dark pagoda.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92b7.jpg'),(12553,'Predator: Hunting Grounds - Samurai Predator',NULL,'Shooter, Strategy','Sin plataforma','From the hunting grounds of feudal Japan, this demon from legend once hunted skilled warriors who protected their island nation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t9l.jpg'),(12554,'All-Star Baseball 2003','2002-02-26','Sport','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','The All-Star Baseball baseball video game series was developed and published by Acclaim Entertainment. The series began in 1997 with the release of All-Star Baseball \'97 Featuring Frank Thomas, the successor to Frank Thomas Big Hurt Baseball. New York Yankees play-by-play announcers John Sterling and Michael Kay were the announcers for 1998-2000 editions of the game. The final release in the series (due to the bankruptcy of Acclaim) is All-Star Baseball 2005.\n\nWithin the individual games, there are several different modes of play, such as exhibition, managing an existing Major League Baseball team or creating a team. Many North American cities are available for \"expansion,\" in addition to Mexico City and Puerto Rico.\n\nMost of the games feature Derek Jeter on the cover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dlk.jpg'),(12555,'Skater\'s Solstice','2024-10-30','Puzzle','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Become a master of the ice by skating your way through increasingly challenging sliding puzzles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uno.jpg'),(12556,'Humankind: Heritage Edition','2023-10-10','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Humankind is a historical strategy game, where you\'ll be re-writing the entire narrative of human history and combining cultures to create a civilization that\'s as unique as you are.\n\nThe Heritage Edition includes:\n(Physical release only)\n- Q-Card Cover\n- Double-sided Unit & Tech Tree Poster\n\n(Physical & Digital release)\n- Notre-Dame Pack\n- Cultures of Africa Pack\n- Cultures of Lain America Pack\n- Edgar Allen Poe & Boudicca Avatar Sets & Player Icons\n- Exclusive Player Profile Decoration & Symbols Set','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qac.jpg'),(12557,'Fakutori',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fakutori is a laid-back and colorful automation game; place machines, discover new elements, and try to craft the elusive legendary blocks! No limits, no pressure, just blocks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jiq.jpg'),(12558,'The Aether II','2013-06-09','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Aether II is the sequel to the highly popular dimension mod \"The Aether\", set in a hostile paradise miles up in the clouds, the Aether is an entirely different world from what regular players are used to, filled with fantastic creatures and mysterious structures, the Aether is a world brimming with life and history. You\'ll have to relearn key ideas as the Aether challenges you with twisted materials, terrifying monsters and deep lore if you want to survive and prosper in this strange new land.\n\nAs the mod comes closer to a final release, Dungeons, Biomes, NPC settlements will pepper the landscape, offering new and exciting challenges and experiences unique to this mysterious world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dun.jpg'),(12559,'Roomballs',NULL,'Racing, Sport','Sin plataforma','Soccer meets air hockey with an incredible twist: fast-paced, zany robots inspired by your favorite pop culture icons. This isn’t just about speed and strength; strategy, quick moves, and clever plays are the keys to victory. This game guarantees endless fun and high-octane action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ku0.jpg'),(12560,'Ark: The Center','2016-05-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Center is a free add-on for ARK: Survival Evolved that includes a massive new map for survivors to explore, nearly double the size of the playable geography of the standard ARK Island landscape making it about 70 sq. kilometers. The Center complements the current ARK biomes with a rich, hand-drawn Tolkien-esque aesthetic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c52.jpg'),(12561,'Fallen Bride Mege','2023-02-03','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mege is the childhood sweetheart of the protagonist. Lucky enough, he is able to marry Mege with everyone\'s blessing and lives a happy life. But the sudden news of layoffs broke his peaceful days.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56k5.jpg'),(12562,'A Day in the Palace','2024-05-02','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Travel to Poland in 1772, experience life as a servant, and solve a mystery at court!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81vm.jpg'),(12563,'The Fielder\'s Choice',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12564,'Castle of Shikigami','2017-06-15','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Castle of Shikigami is a dark, supernatural shoot-\'em-up classic. Choose one of six characters and utilize their unique abilities to defeat the demons infesting modern-day Tokyo in this vertically scrolling shooting game. Use each character\'s shot, special Shikigami attack and bomb to conquer each stage and it\'s boss to ultimately discover who or what is behind \"The Castle of Shikigami Incident\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22vb.jpg'),(12565,'Ball Torture','2022-06-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ball Torture is a 2d puzzle game where you control a bowling ball, and once again you get into the recycling compartment and try to get out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59j0.jpg'),(12566,'Anett Futatabi','1993-03-30','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Sega CD','The game plays like a side-scrolling beat \'em up, with you controlling Anett as she marches through each stage beating every enemy she encounters with her sword and magical powers until she reaches the stage boss. Anett\'s magical powers are triggered by spending an energy bar that is constantly refilling, depending on the amount of power available you\'ll cause more damage all the way up to a screen-clearing attack.\n\nIt is the third in a trilogy of games, which includes El Viento, Earnest Evans and Anett Futatabi','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62hp.jpg'),(12567,'Traumatarium','2022-06-18','Adventure','Game Boy','A randomly generated Game Boy dungeon crawler','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9idp.jpg'),(12568,'The Darkened Halls',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Prepare to face nightmarish bosses in \'The Darkened Halls.\' Armed with intellect, not weapons, you are a vulnerable young protagonist hunted by demons. Solve puzzles, secure key items, and challenge powerful foes in a relentless pursuit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c9i.jpg'),(12569,'Hyper Front','2021-08-03','Shooter, Strategy, Tactical','Android, iOS','Free-to-play hero-based 5v5 first-person shooter for iOS and Android.\n\nSet in a near sci-fi world with realistic guns and gadgets, take to the field in intense PVP matches spread across six different game modes on launch, and use powerful hero abilities to turn the tide of battle, and dominate your opponents!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r76.jpg'),(12570,'Pokémon Stadium','2000-04-07','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Nintendo 64','In the game\'s Stadium Mode, one player competes in 80 different battles, divided into four tournaments. Beat the Stadium Mode and you\'re in for a bonus battle against the ultimate Pokémon warrior, Mewtwo, as well as a secret mode that gives you 80 brand-new, and devilishly tough battles. There is virtually no way you can beat the secret mode without having trained your own, elite Pokémon. One to four players compete against each other or the computer in a no-holds-barred battle with customizable rules. You can select rental Pokémon for these battles -- but that makes them much too predictable since their selection of techniques isn\'t determined by the trainer. You can also select quick and easy versus and random battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yyd.jpg'),(12571,'Sky Gamblers: Air Supremacy 2','2022-03-24','Simulator, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','An extensive single player campaign and delightful multiplayer modes, the non-stop action will keep you at the edge of your seat! Sky Gamblers: Air Supremacy 2 is a dogfight simulator taking its roots from the original classic hit. Rich combat mechanics and a spot-on balance between simulation and arcade make it accessible to all player types and allows for a personalized experience with varied control schemes and play styles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oj1.jpg'),(12572,'J.R.R. Tolkien\'s The Lord of the Rings, Vol II: The Two Towers','1993-06-30','Role-playing (RPG)','DOS, FM Towns','The gameplay is similar to that of the first game. The game is an RPG wherein the player controls multiple characters from the book. It uses a top-down perspective. The game takes place slightly before its predecessor ends: at the dark forest of Fangorn. The story splits into several journeys of different characters similar to the book, the game also switches between different controllable parties. The ultimate goal is to reach the Two Towers and destroy the One Ring.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i1h.jpg'),(12573,'Partitas','2021-05-10','Point-and-click, Music, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An indie puzzle game based on classical music, mainly melody, with point-and-click mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yra.jpg'),(12574,'This War of Mine: Final Cut','2022-05-10','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This War of Mine: Final Cut contains all the updates and free expansions released so far and introduces not only a new scenario but also expands all scenarios with the locations known from Stories DLCs - even if you don\'t own those. In short words - that means you can now experience lots of never-seen-before playthroughs and struggle with new challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uxk.jpg'),(12575,'The Sims 4: Country Kitchen Kit','2021-03-02','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','Transform your Sim\'s kitchen into the most charming part of their home with The Sims 4: Country Kitchen Kit. From vintage refrigerators to casserole dishes, these Build/Buy objects offer a delightfully trendy take on a timeless style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h2x.jpg'),(12576,'Megacraft Hentai Survival','2021-02-06','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Megacraft Hentai Survival is an open-world shooter where you decide where to go and what to do, your fate is in your hands. How long can you survive in a cubic post-Apocalypse?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ns9.jpg'),(12577,'Tenchu: Dark Secret','2006-11-24','Adventure','Nintendo DS','Tenchu: Dark Secret places you in the shoes of ninja assassins charged with protecting the life of a princess. Stalk your enemies with sword in hand, plant explosive traps in the underbrush, or strike with an assortment of realistic ninja weaponry - the choice is yours. It features over 40 single-player missions and the ability to construct your own weapons and items. Prove your mettle with the metal by challenging friends to a local wireless multiplayer match.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tgd.jpg'),(12578,'SolChicks',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','SolChicks Saga is a play-to-earn (\"P2E\") multiplayer role-playing game where the players\' unique SolChicks NFTs are used as their game characters.\n\nPlayers can participate in SolChicks Saga in multiple ways, be it leveling their characters through participating in PvE or PvP challenges, farming the rarest items and seeking hidden treasures, or even just treating your SolChicks as virtual pets to pass time. Amongst the key differentiating factors is that SolChicks Saga is NFT driven where the SolChick NFT will act as the player\'s in-game avatar.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co509d.jpg'),(12579,'Solanaceae: After All','2022-10-06','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join Battam, a witch exiled by all conventional covens, on his quest to make a brand new type of coven! Explore a colorful world, gather ingredients for potion brewing and cooking, immerse yourself in a long and detailed story, and view sexy scenes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k4t.jpg'),(12580,'Tang\'s Starfish Rescue',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12581,'There\'s No Dragons','2025-04-28','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','There\'s No Dragons is a hidden object game with a selection of 9 locations and random dragons to find for each of them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dy7.jpg'),(12582,'Dog Trainer',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Dog Trainer lets you experience all the joy and challenges of owning a dog. Create an unbreakable bond with your pup, watch him grow by your side and help him become the best - whatever it means to you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oun.jpg'),(12583,'Samurai Shodown','2008-06-16','Fighting','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, Neo Geo MVS, Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Wii, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, 3DO Interactive Multiplayer, FM Towns, PlayStation, Neo Geo CD, Sega CD, Super Famicom','In early Japan, a man named Shiro Tokisada Amakusa preaches a heretic religion. Little does anyone know that Amakusa is really a servant of the evil Ambrosia, who took over Amakusa\'s body. Ambrosia wishes to shroud the world in darkness. Now, choose between 12 warriors (and 3 bonus characters) to fight for the honor of destroying Amakusa, and fulfilling a mission.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a7y.jpg'),(12584,'Videocart-27: Pac-Man','2009-12-31','Arcade','Fairchild Channel F','An unauthorized version of Pac-Man.\n\nPac-Man is a game where the eponymous Pac-Man goes around a maze in the cardinal directions munching pellets as he goes. The goal is to eat all the pellets found on the maze. While trying to do this, Pac-Man is harassed by four ghosts (Blinky, Pinky, Inky, and Clyde) who constantly chase him around the maze. If the ghosts touch Pac-Man, he will lose a life. Pac-Man starts with three lives and if he loses all of them the game will end.\n\nPac-Man is not completely defenseless as on each maze, there are four power pellets, that when Pac-Man consumes them, will cause the tides to turn, as Pac-Man will be able to temporarily chase the ghosts to eat them and temporarily send them back to the middle of the maze from whence they came. Pac-Man can also eat randomly appearing fruit to earn bonus points.\n\nThis version of Pac-Man retains the intermissions found in the original game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dpj.jpg'),(12585,'Dog Gone Golfing','2020-12-03','Sport, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Play across 20 worlds as you compete to be the world\'s best Dog Puck Golfer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26us.jpg'),(12586,'Total War: Warhammer III - Shadows of Change','2023-08-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This DLC will add three Legendary Lords (1 for each race), a Legendary Hero and new units.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9exa.jpg'),(12587,'Minnie Mouse Bow-tique: Super Surprise Party!',NULL,'Sin género','Leapster Explorer/LeadPad Explorer','Lets your child help Minnie and Daisy turn digital ribbon, dazzles and glitter into beautiful bows for creative play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52p7.jpg'),(12588,'SuperHot Quake','2017-02-12','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SUPERHOT Quake is a total conversion for Quake by Ash, inspired by SUPERHOT.\nTime advances only when you move or perform an action, such as shooting or jumping.\nUse your axe to vaporize incoming bullets, or shoot them if you have a weapon.\nPick up weapons from your fallen enemies and kill their buddies with it.\nBlow up your enemies into gibs then pick them up to use them as projectiles.\nHOTSWITCH into enemies to telefrag them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4m7j.jpg'),(12589,'X-Men Legends II: Rise of Apocalypse','2005-09-20','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','X-Men Legends II: Rise of Apocalypse is an action role-playing game and a sequel to X-Men Legends. The player controls a party of four characters, though only one at a time can be controlled directly. Besides switching the characters for combat purposes, the player is often obliged to do so, because some of the tasks in the game require the specific abilities of a certain mutant. For example, Iceman can put out the fire, Magneto can generate a metal bridge across a gap, etc. Most of the time, however, is spent in combat, collecting loot and acquiring experience points. Unlike the first game, items dropped by enemies are random. The character will level up, become stronger, and learn new skills. The player can opt to allocate all the experience and skill points manually.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pf0.jpg'),(12590,'Close Combat: The Bloody First','2019-10-03','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Close Combat: The Bloody First is the latest release in the critically-acclaimed Close Combat series, and the first using the new 3D Archon engine. With this Close Combat: The Bloody First combines classic Close Combat tactical gameplay with battles fought across a wide variety of diverse 3D landscapes including craggy ridgelines, narrow...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r3z.jpg'),(12591,'Campgrounds: The Endorus Expedition - Collector\'s Edition','2016-03-03','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Addie lead an expedition!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12592,'Pirate Cannons Ahoy!','2019-03-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ahoy mateys! Take charge of your fort defenses as hostile pirates invade to steal your treasure! Defend your treasure chests in this classic cannon-shooting take in this casual tower-defense game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12593,'Hiouden: Mamono-tachi to no Chikai','1994-02-11','Strategy','Super Famicom','A PC-98 RPG from Wolf Team with an isometric perspective. It later saw an enhanced Super Famicom port.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4cxu.jpg'),(12594,'Re:Take',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','\"Re:TAKE\" is the latest fantasy 2D side scrolling combat game! Upgrade your favorite characters, collect rare items that allow you to unlock special skills and spells, get monsters as pets, and join your friends to defeat the hordes of enemies and numerous giant bosses!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wxr.jpg'),(12595,'Chromatism',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Chromatism is an XNA community game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/coah4duxx1iguq4pjn6s.jpg'),(12596,'The Garden Pub','2019-04-28','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have just acquired an old pub in a small gnomish village, and now all you have to do is get it cleaned up and ready to serve the whole village! You barely have enough room to serve a handful of customers, so you must build up your reputation and gold in order to stock your pub and expand your dining area.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12597,'Syberia: The World Before','2022-03-18','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Embark on a journey across continents and through time, as you piece together the puzzle of a life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p76.jpg'),(12598,'Shiki Oni no Koku: Chuugoku-hen - Daisanshou','1992-09-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC-9800 Series','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co689y.jpg'),(12599,'Quetzal\'s Call','2025-03-05','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embark on a mystic journey in Quetzal, a fast-paced, bullet hell platformer highly focused on reactive gameplay. You’ll discover a mystical underground world, defeat blood ravenous stone creatures, and survive tortuous obstacles in your quest for answers and meaning.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8v9x.jpg'),(12600,'Vector Thrust','2015-07-02','Shooter, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vector Thrust is a fast-paced single and mulltiplayer combat flight game, using a unique cel shaded art style. With an extensive variety of game modes like the unpredictable and vicious Quick Action, a customizable Skirmish Mode, and multiple immersive story-based campaigns, Vector Thrust aims to please both players wanting to get straight into the sky and those who love a flexible, diverse and customizable gaming experience. Vector Thrust gives the player full power over the game to alter any aspect of the game they choose, ranging from simple tweaks to full-blown modifications. Adding user-made skins, changing unit performance and parameters or even complete battle scenarios is easy and open to anyone. With fully fleshed out Map, Mission and Campaign editors, Vector Thrust boasts unlimited expandability and adaptability.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oje.jpg'),(12601,'Night Trap','1993-05-01','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','3DO Interactive Multiplayer, Mac, DOS, Sega CD','Five girls go to a party to a nice house on a lakeside. Five girls disappear without a trace... Now another five girls go there, in order to spend the vacation with the Martins, the owners of the house, in particular with the lovely Ms. Martin. This time, you should not let them die a gruesome death! Because \"nice people\" can sometimes turn out to be... yes, that\'s right - vampires. The whole house is full of traps, that are intended to catch the poor innocent girls, so that the vampires can suck their blood... ugh. Luckily, the brave adventurer is there in order to cease to be hunted and to become a hunter instead! Set the traps so that they will capture the villains themselves, using precise timing and good organization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p5f.jpg'),(12602,'Megadimension Neptunia VII: Party Character - Umio & Nepgya','2020-07-28','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12603,'Mario\'s Matching Madness','2004-12-31','Arcade','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q4e.jpg'),(12604,'Tales of Maj\'Eyal: Ashes of Urh\'Rok','2014-10-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Many in Maj\'Eyal have heard of \"demons\", sadistic creatures who appear seemingly from nowhere, leaving a trail of suffering and destruction whereever they go. Their Fearscape floats far above the skies, watching and waiting, but not idly; their agents scout the land, their legions build up their forces, and their scholars develop new spells and strategies. As the barrier between our worlds begins to crack under their scrutiny, helpless Eyalites have begun to disappear, whisked up to serve as their slaves and playthings. They imbue these victims with magical powers to better survive the ensuing stresses - can you use your new-found abilities to escape the legions of Mal\'Rok?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ig7.jpg'),(12605,'PC Building Simulator: Deadstick Case','2019-04-29','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deadstick - Bush Flight Simulator themed NZXT H700i case for PC Building Simulator','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66hs.jpg'),(12606,'Pixel Restorer','2024-09-19','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A retro pixel-style casual game where your task is to restore all the missing pixel images in the machine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uwa.jpg'),(12607,'Asphalt 6: Adrenaline','2011-06-15','Racing, Sport, Arcade','Android, iOS, Mac, Legacy Mobile Device','The sixth game in the Asphalt series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lae.jpg'),(12608,'Euro Truck Simulator 2: Wheel Tuning Pack','2016-04-13','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ultimate wheel customization is here! Paint, tune and customize your nuts, discs, hubs and hub covers exactly as you want.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rpo.jpg'),(12609,'Heist','2008-06-01','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Heist was an open world game in the 60s inspired by action movies and feature music of the time. Actor Christian Slater would have provided a voice in the game. Codemasters announced on 28 January 2010 that the game had been cancelled. According to Brian Fargo, the game struggling to progress is due to Codemaster constant involvement.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yjf.jpg'),(12610,'Unspoken','2024-04-01','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You find yourself in the center of inexplicable nightmare. Make your way through the horror, come face to face with terrible events. Immerse yourself in the dark mystery of the events in which you found yourself an unwitting participant.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82pn.jpg'),(12611,'Final Fantasy XV: Deluxe Edition','2016-12-29','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4','The only crystal left to the world lies in the Kingdom of Lucis. Upon striking a peace with the garrison state of Niflheim, Lucis rejoices in having at last brought the cold war to a close. Their celebrations, however, are premature. Under the guise of amity, Niflheim dispels the anti-armament runewall and launches a full-scale invasion of the kingdom. The peaceful lives Crown Prince Noctis and his entourage once knew are consumed by the flames of war as they struggle to mount a resistance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nzb.jpg'),(12612,'Electrician','1986-12-26','Platform','Family Computer Disk System','The player character is an electrician named Richard Light. He must install electrical wiring in apartment buildings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zam.jpg'),(12613,'Dying Light: My Apocalypse Collectors Edition',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Dying Light My Apocalypse Collectors Edition is an ultra-rare special edition version of the Dying Light\n\nThe Dying Light My Apocalypse Collectors Edition contains:\n\nCustom built Dying Light Zombie Home by Tiger Log Cabins\nZombie avoidance parkour lessons with Ampisound, the team behind the internet smash Dying Light Parkour POV video\nBe The Zombie match with devs where you win so you can brag to your friends how “leet” you are\nTrip to Techland in Wroclaw, Poland, to meet the dev team and party with Steve the Zombie Consultant\nYour face skinned onto your Night Hunter character model\nDying Light branded night vision goggles + adult diapers for the night portions of the game\nx4 signed Steelbox editions of Dying Light\nx2 Top of the line Razer Tiamat headphones\nHuman sized Volatile figurine to use as a deterrent on human raiders','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nt9.jpg'),(12614,'Saw II','2007-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96s3.jpg'),(12615,'Aery: Flow of Time','2023-08-17','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Enjoy a combat-free journey through colorful worlds and search for the cure! Lean back and enjoy the scenery and the sensation of flying.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6y1u.jpg'),(12616,'Shivah','2013-11-20','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Russell Stone is a Jewish Rabbi at a poor synagogue in New York City. He is a devout man with a problem. Membership is way down and he lacks the funds to keep his synagogue open. Things are looking very bleak, and he has grown progressively more cynical and bitter with the passage of time.\n\nJust as he is on the verge of packing it all in, he receives some interesting news. A former member of his congregation has died and left the Rabbi a significant amount of money. A blessing? Or the start of something far more sinister? Can Rabbi Stone just accept the money and move on? His conscience says no. Step into his shoes as he travels all over Manhattan in his attempt to uncover the truth.\n\nFeatures rabbinical conversation methods, a unique method of fighting, an original score, and three different endings!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22wc.jpg'),(12617,'Lost In Night',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12618,'Treacherous Journeys',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a treacherous journey in this Shared-World Online Action-RPG set in the beautiful land of Thile. Explore deadly dungeons, hidden caves, and the wilderness alone or with friends. Are you brave enough to take the challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47mt.jpg'),(12619,'Dracula 5: The Blood Legacy','2014-04-24','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Dracula 5: The Blood Legacy takes over the investigation right after the final revelation of Dracula 4: The Shadow of the Dragon. Ellen is back at the New York Metropolitan Museum with the strange painting. Revelations about the characters, an occult society, information about Vlad the Impaler, alias Dracula.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pyg.jpg'),(12620,'Soldier Blade','2017-08-10','Shooter','PlayStation 3, Wii, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, Wii U, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable','Vertical sci-fi shoot ‘em up from the Hudson stable. Soldier Blade sticks to the tried and tested formula of Hudson’s previous games in the \'series\', while throwing in some extra graphical effects. This time, the power up system involves collecting coloured pods - you can have three pods in stock at any one time, and the colour of the \'active\' pod determines your weapon style. You also have the choice of ejecting a pod at any time, which results in a weapon-specific super attack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co685z.jpg'),(12621,'Legend of Zord','2003-01-13','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pb1.jpg'),(12622,'Caricature Artist','1995-12-31','Sin género','Casio Loopy','This game is designed as an art tool to create caricatures and facial impressions. First the player picks an avatar of a gender and age group. Using the selected avatar as a template, the player can customize the hairstyle, brows, eyes, nose, mouth, head shape and clothes. The parts of the face can be repositioned and resized. Additionally, paint tools can be used to further accessorize the caricature with colors, objects and speech bubbles. To finish off, the caricature can be placed in one of many sceneries provided. The player also has the option to paint their own pictures from scratch or make use of one of the ready made caricatures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30iz.jpg'),(12623,'Teen Titans','2006-05-24','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Teen Titans is an action beat \'em up video game released for the GameCube, PlayStation 2, and Xbox. A game under the same name was released for the Game Boy Advance in 2005. The game is themed after the 2003 Cartoon Network TV series Teen Titans, and most of the original voice actors reprise their respective roles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dzg.jpg'),(12624,'The Event',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Event is a first-person psychological horror game that offers immersive gameplay and a rich narrative. Find yourself stuck in mystery and struggle in the dark against paranormal activities, demons from other worlds and much more. Will you be able to find out the truth and return home?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6n0e.jpg'),(12625,'Sky Runner','2024-04-11','Sin género','Meta Quest 3','Take control of agile, heavily-armed drones bristling with explosives and defend your home from waves of hostile missile launchers that emerge from every corner of your room. Quick thinking and sharp reflexes are your keys to survival. But there\'s more at stake; a hostage is trapped in the environment. Can you outmaneuver the enemy, rescue the innocent, and claim victory?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12626,'Cities in Motion 2: Trekking Trolleys','2013-07-30','Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Everything is trolleys! This pack offers five new trolley bus vehicles to adorn your streets. Whether it is speed, capacity or low maintenance that you are looking for, these are the vehicles to help you out. Ness TransLink: It\'s a bit slow and needs a lot of maintenance, but the TransLink has unsurpassed capacity to carry passengers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yxj.jpg'),(12627,'Lil Lootin Lizards',NULL,'Puzzle, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Collect lots of loot and use all your stuff as chonky blocks to solve simple Tetris-like dungeon puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9los.jpg'),(12628,'Orcs Must Die! 3: Tipping the Scales','2022-04-07','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','In Tipping the Scales, the new Tuatara enemy race invades across five new maps including a new War Scenario! Bring your new gear to the fight to overcome the Tuatara’s special ability that limits the damage they can take.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5saj.jpg'),(12629,'Saw Deluxe','2009-10-13','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96rs.jpg'),(12630,'Shenmue III: Battle Rally','2020-11-19','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A battle race set in Bailu is about to begin!\nThe participants in this race are...\nThe hero of the story, facing off against destiny, Ryo Hazuki\nThe elusive, treasure-seeking Wuying Ren\nand, making her first appearance in this game, Ryo\'s sparring partner, Wei Zhen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y4c.jpg'),(12631,'Neko Neko Rampage',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Roll fast and make a mess! Welcome to a colorful world of cats and chaos. In Neko Neko Rampage, you will join the feline ranks and gather online or locally with friends to wreck and bring mayhem and destruction on your way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zyk.jpg'),(12632,'Escaped Chasm','2019-04-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A small RPG Maker game about a lonely girl with a connection to another world that she sees in her dreams.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2igg.jpg'),(12633,'G-Mode Archives+: Tantei Kibukawa Ryousuke Jiken-tan Vol. 15 - Ouma ga toki no Kyoushikyoku','2024-08-08','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','No one knows what it is or what it looks like...Can you protect the treasure, \"Tokoyo no Watashi\" from robbers?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ojc.jpg'),(12634,'Cube Worlds Survival','2020-09-16','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive. Explore. Upgrade. Fight. An endless rogue like shooter RPG game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nyh.jpg'),(12635,'Shenmue III: Big Merry Cruise','2020-11-19','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Various types of entertainment can be enjoyed aboard the ship, as well as challenge missions which can only be played here. Also, new outfits for Ryo can be obtained by clearing mini-quests encountered onboard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dxb.jpg'),(12636,'Lunar: The Silver Star','1992-06-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sega CD','Welcome to the world of Lunar, where reigns the magic and dragons still live. Join Alex, a young adventurer and his companions Luna, Ramus and Nall, to save the land of the Magic Emperor Ghaleon tyranny. Explore dungeons, fight terrifying monsters, and collects local information of where to go along to the explosive confrontation with Ghaleon own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w80.jpg'),(12637,'Disney\'s Winnie the Pooh\'s Rumbly Tumbly Adventure','2005-02-08','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Join Winnie the Pooh and his friends on five birthday-themed adventures. In Winnie the Pooh Rumbly Tumbly Adventures, you can play as Tigger, Piglet, Eeyore, and Winnie the Pooh. Find as many honey pots as you can, but beware of the mischievous Heffalumps and Woozles, who steal honey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1peu.jpg'),(12638,'Pyramid of Ra','2018-06-28','Puzzle','Apple II','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nks.jpg'),(12639,'Luigi en Circusland','1994-12-31','Platform, Arcade','DOS','Luigi en Circusland is a platform game for PC DOS developed by Topo Soft and released in 1994.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31h6.jpg'),(12640,'The Elder Scrolls III: Morrowind - Game of the Year Edition','2009-06-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows)','An epic, open-ended single-player RPG, Morrowind allows you to create and play any kind of character imaginable. You can choose to follow the main storyline and find the source of the evil blight that plagues the land, or set off on your own to explore strange locations and develop your character based on their actions throughout the game. Featuring stunning 3D graphics, open-ended gameplay, and an incredible level of detail and interactivity, Morrowind offers a gameplay experience like no other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ycf.jpg'),(12641,'Pirates of the Caribbean: Dead Man\'s Chest','2006-06-27','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, PlayStation Portable, Nintendo DS','Pirates of the Caribbean 2: Dead Man’s Chest is a swashbuckling action-adventure for the Sony PSP and Nintendo DS. Players play as the notorious (or at least ‘heard of’) pirate Jack Sparrow. Throughout the game the player sword fights with the undead, swings from the rigging, escapes from cannibals, and liberates booby-trapped treasure in a non-linear, action-packed 3D game that emphasizes pick-it-up/put-it-down game play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9140.jpg'),(12642,'Altitude','2009-05-01','Shooter, Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Players control one of five customizable aircraft and battle in teams across 2D landscapes. As a player gains experience in battle they unlock new planes and customizations called perks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3le1.jpg'),(12643,'Final Fantasy XIII-2: Collector\'s Edition','2012-03-02','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Xbox 360','Three years after the events in FINAL FANTASY XIII, Lightning has gone missing, and Snow is nowhere to be found. In a rebuilding world, Serah notices that something is amiss. After a fortuitous encounter with a mysterious man named Noel, the two set off to find Lightning.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vpb.jpg'),(12644,'Town of Zoz',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Fight with flavor! As Ito, a young shaman chef adventurer, you\'ll hunt critters, gather magical ingredients and rebuild bonds by cooking for the townspeople. A shaman chef always aims to lend a helping hand, but the more Ito gets involved, the more he\'ll learn about the town and its ancient secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9izt.jpg'),(12645,'Assembloids 2600','2017-07-16','Arcade','Atari 2600','Assembloids 2600 is a fast-paced reaction puzzle game in just 4K for the Atari 2600. Author Martin Wendt restricted himself to 4K for this project, since he considers this limit to be working within the original spirit of the machine. It is quite challenging to create a polished, enjoyable game within 4K of space!\n\nUpon starting a game, your screen shows five windows. There is one central window and one each in the four neighboring sides. A quarter of a face in a particular color is displayed in the central window and you can place it by moving the joystick up, right, down, or left if the corresponding tile is still empty - if the tile is not empty, you\'ll lose one of your precious lives. While you are making the decision where to move the face piece, the timer bar decreases faster and faster.\n\nOnce a full face is complete, the windows are cleared again and you are awarded points. The number of points depends on the matching of colors for your completed face. A full face of the same color gains you 300 points. Having three face parts of the same color results in 100 points. If only two parts are of equal color, you\'ll receive 40 points, and a fully mixed face is only worth a mere 10 points. In case you are able to clear ALL the windows, a whopping extra 500 points and an extra life are added as well!\n\nAssembloids 2600 is based on Assembloids 2013 which Martin coded for the Commodore 64. Assembloids 2013 itself is a port of the Flash game \"Quartet\" by Photon Storm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90tl.jpg'),(12646,'Espresso Tycoon & Tank Mechanic Simulator','2024-10-16','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ew2.jpg'),(12647,'Pirates: The Key of Dreams','2008-08-18','Shooter','Wii','The plot sees players, in the role of a navy captain, sent undercover in the Caribbean to retrieve an artifact known as \"The Key of Dreams\" from notorious pirate Blackbeard.[5] The story mode takes place over 10 levels. \n \nPlayers directly control a sailing ship, seen from an overhead view, to do battle with. Players can recruit various crew members, such as navigators and master gunners to upgrade the abilities of their ship, in addition to their weapons which include cannons, mines and rockets. \n \nIn addition to the story mode, Pirates: The Key of Dreams also features a single player skirmish mode, where the player battles the computer in a variety of arenas, as well as an offline multiplayer battle mode that supports up to four players. There will be 35 skirmish/multiplayer battle maps in addition to bonus ships not selectable in the story mode.[6]','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lsx6milri54ref4qjplg.jpg'),(12648,'Disney\'s The Little Mermaid','1992-12-31','Platform, Adventure','Game Boy','The game takes place from a side view and Ariel (Swimming most of the time, but hopping around on the land occasionally) can shoot bubbles to trap her foes and can then throw them at each other. She can also dig through sand to find treasure and pick up sea shells to help her break chests open.\n\nThe treasure she finds in the sand is usually just bonus points, but the treasure you find in chests will increase your bubble\'s power and range.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vzj.jpg'),(12649,'Bunny Hill','2020-10-24','Racing, Sport, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A small, local multiplayer racing game where you ski downhill and gain speed by hitting gates and flags. Up to 4 players can play locally with controllers or through Steam Remote Play. There are up to 8 characters to play and randomly generated hill layouts to carve.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2iim.jpg'),(12650,'Titans of the Past',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A deep party-based RPG. Crawl the dungeons. Battle monsters with your weapons, spells, abilities. Utilize the \'time flows as you move\' system to make decisions. Loot, level up, craft, develop your town. Unlock new classes and races, spells, items - to make a party able survive the hardest challenges','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oqp.jpg'),(12651,'Amaranthine Voyage: Legacy of the Guardians',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12652,'Wish Eater',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Wish Eater is a horror game with touches of action where you explore a building in search of a girl who disappeared without a trace. Solve puzzles, search for clues and recreate her steps to discover the mystery of her disappearance. Depending on the investigation you will reach different endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tdk.jpg'),(12653,'Tsuki no Kanata de Aimashou','2022-02-24','Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','This is a visual novel about the feeling of first love, the bittersweet memories of our high school lives, a regret-filled summer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c7r.jpg'),(12654,'Metaphor: ReFantazio - Atlus 35th Digital Anniversary Edition','2024-10-11','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eso.jpg'),(12655,'The Call Centre',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Do you have what it takes to work at a call centre?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co433f.jpg'),(12656,'Source beginning','2018-11-07','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a semi-open round RPG game, you can choose to become a hero, you can choose to become the devil. You can choose to upgrade or choose other ways. More choices need to be explored by players themselves, and different choices will have different scenarios and outcomes. For more information, please look at the first experience.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12657,'Mystery Trackers: The Fall of Iron Rock','2019-05-17','Point-and-click, Puzzle','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Elephant Games brings you the latest exhilarating installment of the Mystery Trackers series!\n\nAfter five years, the Mystery Trackers finally have an idea of where your lost colleague could be! But Iron Rock isn\'t the town you expected when you arrive to find it patrolled by the new Mayor\'s robots, leaving little hope for the remaining residents to escape! Can you use your top-notch detective skills to find out what\'s really going on and escape with the residents in time?! Find out in this thrilling Hidden-Object Puzzle adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dae.jpg'),(12658,'Sonic the Hedgehog: Editable ROM EYX','2022-03-13','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"You are searching for Sonic stuff throughout the internet, until you come across an unnamed ROM Hack with no info about it whatsoever. Is it just an abandoned buggy ROM Hack or is there something more into it?\"\n\nWelcome to Sonic the Hedgehog: Editable ROM, a game based upon a mysterious ROM Hack published into the internet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4smb.jpg'),(12659,'Transformers: Comvoy no Nazo','1985-12-05','Shooter, Platform','Wii, Family Computer','Transformers: Comvoy no Nazo is a 2D side-scrolling action platformer developed by ISCO and published by TAKARA for the Nintendo Entertainment System (in Japan only) on Decmber 5, 1986. Set in the first-generation Transformers universe, players control Autobot Ultra Magnus as he storms through various Decepticon strongholds to find the whereabouts of Autobot leader Convoy (known worldwide as Optimus Prime).\n\nConvoy no Nazo consists of nine stages, each ending in a boss battle. Players can move and shoot as well as transform into a more maneuverable vehicle mode. The game is so difficult, most players do not usually pass the first stage. The 9th stage is a maze which, if not completed in precisely the right way, will infinitely loop. Warp Zones can be found by locating Bumblebee in some levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rsr.jpg'),(12660,'Ys IV: Mask of the Sun - A New Theory','2005-05-26','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','Ys IV: Mask of the Sun - A New Theory is a remake of the original Ys IV for the Super Famicom. It follows the story of the original, but revamps the combat to be based on a more traditional button-press system than the original game\'s \"bump\" combat, based on running into enemies off-center.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ivn.jpg'),(12661,'Atari Anniversary Edition Redux','2001-02-01','Sin género','PlayStation','This collection honors the 30th anniversary of Atari, one of the first great companies in the videogame industry by reissuing versions of 12 arcade classics for play on PlayStation systems. Included are Asteroids and Asteroids Deluxe, Battlezone, Black Widow, Centipede, Gravitar, Missile Command, Pong, Space Duel, Super Breakout, Tempest and Warlords. The bundle also includes a souvenir sticker, a video interview with Atari founder Nolan Bushnell, press releases from the original games and images of game memorabilia. Atari Anniversary Edition Redux is mouse and analog control compatible and is multi-tap adaptable for up to four players.\n\nIn addition to the pure emulation modes, there is an option to display the cabinet art surrounding the display of each game, intended to give the player a sense of actually playing a stand-up machine.\n\nEach game also has a toggle for an \"enhanced\" graphical mode, which varies from game to game. For instance, \"enhanced\" asteroids merely has a static backdrop, whereas \"enhanced\" warlords is a complete graphical overhaul with new colors. It should be noted that the \"enhanced\" version of Tempest is none other than Tempest Tubes, a modification for Tempest made in 1982 by Duncan Brown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53fe.jpg'),(12662,'Anomalous','2024-09-22','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A pixelated low fidelity 90s throwback hyper-fast action shooter. Survive and fight through a city overrun with manufactured monstrosities, biomass horrors, and a military authority trying to purge everything living. Featuring a heavy metal soundtrack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ujv.jpg'),(12663,'Nintendogs + Cats: Golden Retriever & New Friends','2011-03-27','Simulator','Nintendo 3DS','nintendogs + cats, a game that lets players interact with realistic puppies - and kittens - in a variety of fun ways. There are three versions of the software, each with different starting breeds: French bulldog, toy poodle and golden retriever. But in each version players can unlock and enjoy more than 20 different breeds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l5l.jpg'),(12664,'Darkness and Flame: Missing Memories','2022-02-22','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','\"Darkness and Flame. Missing Memories\" - enjoy this adventure game with quests and hidden objects, puzzles and mini-games! Its innovative storyline will grab you right from the beginning and you\'ll be immersed in a world in which fantasy stands alongside the post apocalyptic reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ap8.jpg'),(12665,'Rubber Ball VR','2017-03-09','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rubber Ball VR is a virtual reality game where you can satisfy your need to throw cool trickshots, all without the mess of having to go and fetch your ball again.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12666,'Lunar Drifter',NULL,'Shooter, Platform, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lunar Drifter is an Arcade First Person Shooter, your mission is to tear, blast, and crush an entire legion as fast as possible within the time limit. Featuring 4 playable characters with their own gimmicks and arsenal, more than 10 beautiful hand-crafted levels, and includes online Co-Op!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gsv.jpg'),(12667,'Burnin\' Rubber',NULL,'Racing','Sin plataforma','Amstrad GX4000 port of Burnin\' Rubber.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12668,'Radiation Pigeon','2018-11-07','Arcade','Android','Radiation Pigeon is an infinite runner where you play as a pigeon inside a recently nuked Detroit. The aim of the game is to avoid buildings and enemies to last as many meters as you can. Unlike other infinite runners where the camera is stuck to one place you can freely fly up and down in a world about 4 times the height of your view. You can also collect items along the way. You can choose to have items on or off in the pause menu. Your high-score with items on is different from your high-score with items off in order to keep things fair in the leaderboards. You can buy cosmetics with in-game currency such as changing the player into a bat and getting rid of all textures. More enemies, items, and cosmetics will be added in the near future!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mni.jpg'),(12669,'Deadly Joy','2025-05-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deadly Joy is a multiplayer horror game where Play Center employees must survive deadly missions. Cooperate or betray in challenges like Parkour, Basement, and Tower, while escaping terrifying mascots like Hugster and the CatBox.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i2m.jpg'),(12670,'Memory Shake','2001-05-07','Quiz/Trivia','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q1p.jpg'),(12671,'Attack on Inirea','2025-05-16','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Attack on Inirea is an arcade-style shooter for PC, Mac, Linux and Steam OS.\n\nThe player is tasked with defending the peaceful village of Inirea from hordes of monsters, gaining points and powerups as you progress through the maps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r9d.jpg'),(12672,'Ghost in the Shell: Stand Alone Complex','2004-03-04','Shooter','PlayStation 2','Based on the movie of the same name, Ghost in the Shell: Stand Alone Complex is a fast-action third-person shooter for up to four players. As \"Major\" Motoko Kusanagi, Batou, and Tachikoma, you can engage enemies in both multiplayer combat and single-player missions. In single-player mode, your missions involve hacking into machines and computers, controlling your enemies\' minds from a distance, and using a variety of weapons to eliminate your enemies. Complete the Story mode to unlock more playable characters, costumes, and additional weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4psk.jpg'),(12673,'Kingdom Coronation Collection','2024-10-16','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This is the ultimate Kingdom collection, containing the following entries in the award-winning strategy series: Kingdom New Lands, Kingdom Two Crowns, Kingdom Two Crowns: Norse Lands, Kingdom Two Crowns: Call of Olympus, and Kingdom Eighties.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yxu.jpg'),(12674,'Rogue Conflict','2025-03-06','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rogue Conflict is a turn-based strategy roguelike. Combining tactical wargame combat with procedural roguelike features, Rogue Conflict is a game made for both wargamers and general turn based game enthusiasts alike.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gj7.jpg'),(12675,'Persona 5: Ultimate Edition','2016-09-15','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4','Persona 5, a turn-based JRPG with visual novel elements, follows a high school student with a criminal record for a crime he didn\'t commit. Soon he meets several characters who share similar fates to him, and discovers a metaphysical realm which allows him and his friends to channel their pent-up frustrations into becoming a group of vigilantes reveling in aesthetics and rebellion while fighting corruption.\n\nThis special bundle contains:\n* Persona 5\n* all additional Personas\n* all special Costumes\n* Healing Item Set\n* Skill Card Set\n* Japanese Audio Track\n* New Difficulty Level (Merciless)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ugc.jpg'),(12676,'On Wings Bringing Sleep','2024-09-30','Visual Novel','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\'On Wings Bringing Sleep\' is the story of Morgaine, an outcast among the fae as her people\'s power is ever-dwindled by the advance of human technology. When she meets a mysterious and enthralling human girl within the forest one day, Morgaine grows certain that this girl is in need of her magical protection. But Ilse has secrets of her own, and the growing feelings between them may cost more than either girl might ever pay...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xb3.jpg'),(12677,'Solar Ash','2021-12-02','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Journey through a surreal, vivid and highly stylized world filled with mystery, wild high-speed traversal, endearing characters, and massive enemy encounters. The Void beckons…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49qe.jpg'),(12678,'AISZplus','2022-06-10','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You destroy the runaway electronic organ AISZ. Vertical scroll STG with all 5 levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co575j.jpg'),(12679,'Horrors Glade',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are a young scientist whose experiment turned into a disaster. When you wake up in the heart of a creepy forest, where every whisper of the wind hides a threat, you realize: there are no rules here. There is only hunger, fear, and shadows hungry for your flesh.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gf0.jpg'),(12680,'Strider 2','2014-10-07','Platform, Adventure','Arcade, PlayStation 3, PlayStation','Strider 2, released in arcades and on the Sony Playstation in 2000, is the sequel to the popular arcade and multiplatform game Strider. This game is considered the true sequel to the original Strider, rather than Strider Returns. Strider Returns is not considered a part of the series, as it was not developed by Capcom, it was exclusive to the west, and most people hated it. Strider 2, on the other hand, was very well received. Unfortunately, despite being hailed by critics and series fans, Strider 2 did not sell well.\n\nThe Playstation version of the game included the original Strider on a separate disc, for those who had never played it to become accomodated with the series. In the United States, there was a printing error for the game that swapped the labelling of each CD, so the Strider 2 disc was labelled Strider, and the Strider disc was labelled Strider 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ifa.jpg'),(12681,'Astro Lords: Oort Cloud','2016-01-15','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Astro Lords: Oort Cloud is a free-to-play, science-fiction MMORTS combining construction management with click-and-drag Artillery style combat and strategy elements such as exploration, raiding and espionage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pgz.jpg'),(12682,'Big Hunt','2024-04-03','Platform, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is Big Hunt, a pretty-hardcore roguelite-to-be action game, inpired by The Binding of Isaac & Noita.\nStudy your foes to spot and exploit their weaknesses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9b0x.jpg'),(12683,'Ithya: Magic Studies','2025-05-07','Point-and-click, Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ithya: Magic Study is a cozy background app combined with productivity tools. Customize your room and relax with lofi or fantasy playlists in beautiful, hand-drawn environments. Perfect for a focused or creative session in a magical world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rd8.jpg'),(12684,'Batman: Arkham Knight - A Matter of Family','2015-07-14','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Batman: Arkham Knight – A Matter of Family is a story expansion where players control Batgirl, Barbara Gordon, before the events of Arkham Asylum. Set in an abandoned amusement park, Batgirl teams up with Robin to rescue Commissioner Gordon, who has been kidnapped by the Joker.\n\nThe DLC introduces Batgirl’s unique combat style, focused on hacking and stealth, and features puzzles, dual-play combat with Robin, and Joker\'s henchmen as primary enemies. The storyline explores Batgirl’s early crime-fighting career and her relationship with Batman and Robin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fw1.jpg'),(12685,'KiKi KaiKai','1987-02-10','Shooter','MSX2','The MSX2 port of KiKi KaiKai.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52tr.jpg'),(12686,'Wild Gunman','1974-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','Wild Gunman is a game that was first released in arcades in 1974 by Nintendo. The original version of the game featured a 16mm-projection screen that had the player shoot the gunman when his eyes blinked. If he or she did so at the right moment, the gunman would be shot down and killed. If they didn\'t, the player would be shot (in the in-game). The arcade was large and was part of the Simulation System that also included Shooting Trainer, which was much less exciting than its dueling counterpart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i5x.jpg'),(12687,'Back in 1995','2016-04-28','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A throwback to the survival horror and mystery games of the original Playstation, Back in 1995 faithfully re-creates everything from this forgotten era of games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2301.jpg'),(12688,'Giga Pets: Star Wars - Rancor','1998-12-31','Simulator','Handheld Electronic LCD','Giga Pets are digital pet toys. Available in a variety of different characters, each Giga Pet is a palm-sized unit with an LCD screen and attached key ring. To ensure a happy, healthy pet, its owner has to take care of it similar to how one might care for a real animal, including feeding, cleaning, and playing with their Giga Pet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hni.jpg'),(12689,'Simple 1500 Series Vol. 3: The Gomoku Narabe','1999-10-22','Quiz/Trivia, Card & Board Game','PlayStation','A Japanese exclusive Go game which was the third volume in the Simple 1500 Series.\n\nThe game is played by two players who alternately place black and white stones on the vacant intersections of a grid of 19×19 lines. Once placed on the board, stones cannot be moved. If they are surrounded by the opponent\'s stones, they are captured and removed from the board. The object of the game is to surround a larger portion of the board than the opponent. When a game concludes, the controlled points are counted along with captured stones or your own stones (depending on the rule-set) and a predetermined compensation (\"komi\") to determine who has more points.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tmu3cbatu2sektj5f2k6.jpg'),(12690,'Clash of the Monsters','2016-04-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Clash of the Monsters brings the most classic and iconic horror film and literature figures together in the traditional 3D fighting game style! What would happen if the Living Dead faced off with Nosferatu? Or what about the Headless Horseman vs the Phantom of the Opera? It\'s time to find out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v8v.jpg'),(12691,'Lyrica & Lyrica 2 Stars Align','2021-10-21','Music','Nintendo Switch','Lyrica is a rhythm game that’s unique in many ways. It’s musically entertaining; it expresses literature artistically; it applied poetries in the gameplay and created a new gaming experience for the gamers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qi7.jpg'),(12692,'Sword Art Online: Fractured Daydream - Premium Edition','2024-10-01','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Nintendo Switch','The Premium Edition includes SWORD ART ONLINE Fractured Daydream, Character Pass Vol.1, Prism Heart Costume Set, Digital Artbook & Soundtrack App, and Wild Joker Dress.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e47.jpg'),(12693,'BangBang PewPew',NULL,'Sport, Indie','Sin plataforma','Finally, modern lightguns have become available for the PC that bring back the classic feeling of aiming down the sights. It’s time for the games to catch up! 25 lightgun challenges. Hot-seat multiplayer. Online challenges and leaderboards. Customizable targets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59jd.jpg'),(12694,'Roc \'N Rope','1983-12-31','Platform, Arcade','ColecoVision, Arcade, Atari 2600','Your player is a mountain climber who must avoid cavemen, dinosaurs and pterodactyls as he climbs up the cliff-sides. Your goal in each level is to climb up and reach a mystical bird with great plumage, while staying one step above the bonus timer which determines how long you may stay on each level.\n\nThe mountain climber has only one ability; to shoot rope at 45 degree angles which he may then climb up to other platforms. His other action is a stun beam which will allow him to walk past enemies who get too close; but will only work horizontally from him. As for power-ups, on each level is (usually 2) a flashing diamond power-up which will make him invincible and allow him to defeat monsters. Also as a power-up are glowing treasures of some kind which are worth extra points.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co301m.jpg'),(12695,'Shinobi, Koi Utsutsu','2014-01-30','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','The heroine, Katagiri Kaede, goes to a ninja school! She lost her parents very young and her grandmother at 16. She is trying to become a ninja. She attends a local ninjutsu dojo, and one day meets the head of the Sanada Secondary Training Campus (founded by Sanada Yukimura after beating Tokugawa Ieyasu), which trains ninja. He invites her to take a ninja exam, and she agrees, transferring to the school to do a short-term study before taking the test. On her first day, she accidentally uses an advanced technique that makes her male classmates go meromero (lose their heads) over her when her heart thumps!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4so9.jpg'),(12696,'The Ultimate Doom','1995-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, DOS','The complete megahit game that set the world afire. Plus All-New Episode IV: Thy Flesh Consumed. The demons came and the marines died. Except one. You are the last defense against these hell-spawned hordes. Prepare for the most intense mutant-laden, blood-splattered action ever! The texture-mapped virtual world is so real, you don\'t just play Doom - you live it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ws0.jpg'),(12697,'Minnesota Fats: Pool Legend','1995-03-31','Sport','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Sega Saturn','Minnesota Fats: Pool Legend (released in Japan as Side Pocket 2) is a pocket billiards video game for the Sega Genesis and Sega Saturn, featuring famed billiards player Rudolf \"Minnesota Fats\" Wanderone. It was released as a sequel to Data East\'s earlier success, Side Pocket. The objective is to travel through different cities and defeat AI-controlled hustlers. The player can also take on another human player in order to prove his worthiness at the pool table.\n\nThe player can participate in a story mode and play against a set of pros in six different pool halls in an attempt to face off against Minnesota Fats himself. There are seven different variations of pool to play: Eight-Ball, Nine-Ball, Rotation, 14-1 rack, Three ball, Cut Throat & One Pocket. There is also a Versus Mode to let players take on any opponent of their choice including a two-player option to take on a friend and a Tournament Mode. Players can also try out the Trick Mode that has the player try to compete 16 different trick shots.\n\nThe Saturn version of the game largely plays the same as the Genesis version, but includes a training mode, a short documentary on Minnesota Fats, and a completely different plot in the story mode. In the Genesis version, the player takes the role of an unnamed rookie pool player seeking to challenge Minnesota Fats, and cutscenes are computer-animation. In the Saturn version, the player takes the role of Minnesota Fats himself, in his quest to challenge fictional pool hustlers from around the United States; live-action, full-motion videos (FMVs) are used for the cutscenes.\n\nIn Japan, the title Side Pocket 2 is only used in the Saturn version, whereas the Genesis version retains the Minnesota Fats: Pool Legend title.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wda.jpg'),(12698,'Hoshi Ori Yume Mirai: Perfect Edition','2021-06-25','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hoshi Ori Yume Mirai: Perfect Edition is a remastered version of the Hoshi Ori Yume Mirai, with upscaled CGs with new scenes from the console versions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31bp.jpg'),(12699,'Halo 3: Legendary Edition','2007-09-25','Shooter','Xbox 360','The set includes:\n\n- A scaled-down replica model of a MJOLNIR Mark VI helmet.\n- A plastic holder for the three discs.\n- Three discs:\n-- Disc One is the game itself, Halo 3.\n-- Disc Two is the same Xbox 360 game disc that was in the Halo 3 Limited Collector\'s Edition.\n-- Disc Three, which is exclusive to the Legendary Edition, contains the cutscenes from Halo: Combat Evolved and Halo 2 in chronological order, with optional developer commentary featuring Joseph Staten, Martin O\'Donnell, and Jason Jones. Also included on the disc is a guide to the 7 Steps to World Domination plan, included in a short history of Bungie, as well as a documentary chronicling Cortana voice actor Jen Taylor as she learns about the Bungie fan community. Also included was an episode of This Spartan Life which included footage made in Halo 3, and two episodes of Red vs Blue, \"The Call\" and a special edition of Red vs Blue Episode I. Included in the special edition of Red vs Blue Episode I was a short mockumentary about the time leading up to the creation of the series. Also on this disc is the expanded digital Bestiarum and also the surround sound test carried over from Halo 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s5s.jpg'),(12700,'Slavs vs. Lizards','2024-07-26','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a role-playing game with RPG-survival elements, based on an alternative history of ancient Slavs. You\'ll also find numerous references and plots based on Slavic mythology and fairy tales. Explore the open game world on your own or with friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7b6t.jpg'),(12701,'Zombieland: Double Tap - Road Trip','2019-10-15','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Set after the events of the first movie, Zombieland: Double Tap - Road Trip is a ridiculously fun top-down twin-stick shooter featuring local co-op multiplayer for up to four players. Play as your favourite heroes from the original (Tallahassee, Columbus, Wichita and Little Rock) as well as new unlockable characters from the upcoming sequel.\n\nUse your special abilities, an arsenal of weapons and the essential Zombieland rules for survival to stay alive against huge numbers of uniquely grotesque and dangerous undead monstrosities in Zombieland: Double Tap - Road Trip\'s story-based campaign mode, wave-based horde mode, and ongoing daily and weekly challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24cj.jpg'),(12702,'Tiny Bullets','2001-03-13','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation','Tiny Bullets is an action-adventure game that plays remarkably similar to Tomb Raider. Horin has a variety of actions he can perform, including jumping, climbing, swinging on poles, pushing blocks, shooting things with his slingshot, and even picking up and throwing small objects. Making his way through different areas, he must fight with monsters, as well as avoid and escape traps. He can also find and store a variety of items, including keys and healing items to keep his health up. There is even an option to get hints on the current stage if you get stuck.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69un.jpg'),(12703,'Labyrinth','1982-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Atari 8-bit, Apple II','A maze game shooter','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mzp.jpg'),(12704,'Miska\'s Cave','2021-01-28','Fighting, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Miska\'s Cave is a unique action-centric side scroller with strategic components and animated with pixel art. If you love completing challenging games that require varying strategies, this game is for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s12.jpg'),(12705,'Trash Factory','2020-11-29','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','A mobile game where you sort trash into their correct bins. The trash flows via conveyor belts, and the player needs to direct the trash to the current bins by switching the direction in which the trash flows. Coins are used to purchase power-ups that can be used in-game to assist the player. \n \nThe game progressively gets more difficult as time goes on. \n \nPlayers compete for high scores and in-game achievements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n2u.jpg'),(12706,'Legends of Elumia','2023-04-06','Role-playing (RPG)','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Legends of Elumia (Elumia) is a next generation web 3.0 Massively Multiplayer Online RPG (MMORPG). Players can immerse themselves in various gameplay zones, engaging in multiplayer adventures, quests and fierce battles to gain epic loot items.\n\nIn the Elumia game world, players have full ownership of their characters and equipment. The governance token Elumia Crowns ($ELU) gives users a voice in the future direction of the game’s development.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dth.jpg'),(12707,'Protos Magos','2023-03-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Protos Magos is a Spellcrafting FPS with fast-paced combat. Explore a medieval setting and blast your way through a horde of demons. Create custom spells to suit your unique play style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dhf.jpg'),(12708,'Bionicle Mistika','2008-09-11','Shooter, Arcade','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c16.jpg'),(12709,'Commander Keen in Keen Dreams','2019-02-07','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS, Nintendo Switch','Trapped in a land where giant vegetables rule the day, you must fight your way through an army of vicious broccoli beasts, savage asparagus warriors and a bushel of other leafy green nasties before battling the fiercest spud of all, King Boobus Tuber. Unless you want a one way trip to the salad bar in the sky, you\'ll have to finish all your veggies. Before they finish you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25s2.jpg'),(12710,'Terminator: Resistance Enhanced','2021-04-30','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 5','Run and gun or sneak and hack through Skynet\'s defenses! Interact with a motley group of survivors and change their fates!\nGet under the skin of the iconic T-800 series Infiltrator and strike out against Resistance forces with the new infiltrator mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53ns.jpg'),(12711,'Cragne Manor','2018-12-08','Adventure','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Cragne Manor is an \'exquisite corpse\' text adventure commemorating the twentieth anniversary of Michael Gentry\'s Anchorhead, in which each of its 84 rooms was created by a different author.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fpi.jpg'),(12712,'Black Fist Ninja Run Challenge','2013-12-12','Sport','iOS','This runner game is filled with action and pure adrenalin. Story mode: To survive the first challenge you need to be faster than the ghosts of the north - so run, jump and fight against different enemies. Collect coins to buy helpful items in the store. Black Fist Ninja Run Challenge is completely free to play, but in-game items can also be purchased for real money, like the arcade modes for endless fun. Try the endless runner game or the fight training (swordplay and archery).','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12713,'Okami + Kunitsu-Gami Bundle','2024-12-13','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Enjoy two unique Capcom titles, each of which tells its own tale of the gods: Okami HD and Kunitsu-Gami: Path of the Goddess.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9edt.jpg'),(12714,'Chimera',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a mysterious planet in an ever-changing open world torn by recurring cataclysms. Build a complex industrial system to extract resources, produce goods and expand your base. Fight against hordes of alien monsters to defend your base and survive, alone or with friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lyx.jpg'),(12715,'Persona 4 Arena: Ultimate Edition','2012-07-26','Fighting','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Get Persona4 Arena Ultimate Edition, Fighting game for PS3 console from the official PlayStation website. Know more about Persona4 Arena Ultimate Edition Game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99wg.jpg'),(12716,'Fernbus Simulator: Top Class DD',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','This DLC includes the Top Class DD. A luxury double-decker bus for Fernbus Coach Simulator','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12717,'Khuga Rumble Arena','2024-12-31','Sport','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Action-packed multiplayer cat fighting game that seamlessly blends role-playing elements with diverse abilities for each character and their weapons. Dive into a world where five unique Khuga races battle it out, each boasting distinct characteristics that influence gameplay and strategy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oqq.jpg'),(12718,'NBA 2K2','2002-05-23','Simulator, Sport','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, Dreamcast, PlayStation 2','NBA 2K2 is a basketball video game. It is the third installment in the NBA 2K series of video games and it was developed by Visual Concepts and published by Sega Sports. It was released on October 24, 2001 on the Sega Dreamcast and later ported to the Sony PlayStation 2, Nintendo GameCube, and the Xbox in 2002. NBA 2K2 featured more street courts such as Mosswood, Fonde Rec Center, Venice Beach, etc. The game still featured the old street courts like in the previous game NBA 2K1. It was the first NBA 2K game to be released multi-platform on the series, and also the last to be on the Sega Dreamcast. The cover athlete is Allen Iverson','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gn5.jpg'),(12719,'Hagun Sangokushi','2018-06-30','Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Android, iOS','A free-to-play game from Square Enix based on the Romance of the Three Kingdoms.\nThe game will feature 100 warriors that can be collected as cards to be used in battle.\nBattles take place on a turn based format on a 5x6 grid board.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/m6cbj6w0rcuvzsdotgc5.jpg'),(12720,'Ambrosia','2019-01-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take control of Flode as she journeys across the island of Cerbes and attempts to unearth the ancient relics hidden there! This is an open-ended adventure, meaning you can tackle dungeons in any order you\'d like, though marching into the hardest ones first might be ill-advised...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rz3.jpg'),(12721,'Art of Fighting 3: The Path of The Warrior','1996-03-12','Fighting, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, Neo Geo MVS, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Neo Geo CD','In this third and final entry in the Art of Fighting series, the story shifts from Ryo Sakazaki to his best friend and rival, Robert Garcia, as he ventures into Mexico to try and locate Freia Lawrence, a childhood friend, who asked for his help. However, he leaves without the consent of The Garcia Foundation, which sends an agent named Karman Cole to get him back. But not everything is as simple as it looks... because Robert is not the only one looking for Freia.\n\nArt of Fighting 3: The Path of The Warrior features ten playable characters with different fighting styles, a completely new fighting system based on joystick and button combinations, and incredibly detailed graphics and animation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zh4.jpg'),(12722,'Assault Shell','2021-03-19','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Engage in an action packed shoot em\' up adventure! Choose from 4 powerful fighters and fight through 5 intense stages! Multiple tough and challenging bosses stand in your way, so use the insanity system BLANK STAND to erase them all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v94.jpg'),(12723,'Monster Physics','2012-05-11','Simulator','iOS','Monster Physics is a unique building app that lets you play with physics! Build and operate your own car, crane, rocket ship, plane, helicopter, tank and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e35.jpg'),(12724,'Mercenary','1986-12-31','Puzzle, Simulator','Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Commodore 16, Amstrad CPC, Commodore Plus/4','Due to an engine malfunction, your spaceship crashes on the planet Targ. Unlike your trusty vessel, you survive the crash and now have to find a way to get away from this planet. But hey, while you\'re at it, you might as well try to get some money off your unplanned stay on Targ. \n \nYou\'re a mercenary, and it just so happens that the two races on the planet are at war. So why not use that to your advantage and do some favors for each race... against cash? \n \nYou play this game in a first-person perspective with vector graphics. There\'s a huge planet for you to explore, you can walk around on it or take airborne vehicles to reach elevated locations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uzwf6714igj3zbockqoy.jpg'),(12725,'Sky Knights','2017-07-27','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sky Knights is a top-down online action game for PC, in which you take on the role as a modern fighter pilot. You fly with and fight against other players online in a struggle to win each battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24t5.jpg'),(12726,'Heaven\'s Will','2006-10-26','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation Portable','A sci-fi action game in which you play a man who awakens one day having completely lost his memory and finds himself trapped in a labyrinth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxg.jpg'),(12727,'Evil Dead: A Fistful of Boomstick','2003-06-27','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox, PlayStation 2','Fully \"armed\" with his chainsaw, trusty boomstick, and trademark quips, Ash must once again save Dearborn from the unspeakable horrors spawned from The Book of the Dead. After a vortex to the undead is unwittingly opened, deadites swarm through Dearborn, turning humans into zombies. Now, with Dearborn in chaos and citizens begging for help, Ash must hack and slash his way through the streets and figure out how to close the vortex. Ash soon learns that all is not what it seems--those he trusts may be plotting against him, and the history of Dearborn might be irrevocably changed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4psd.jpg'),(12728,'Hoosegow','2022-05-01','Simulator','Android, iOS','Hoosegow is a dark comedy about survival and adventure in a prison. At the beginning you get character, a crime and a prison sentence. Your task is to make the right choices to survive. Live by the thieves\' laws, keep your shank with you and trust no one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xto.jpg'),(12729,'Panzer Dragoon II Zwei','1996-03-22','Shooter','Sega Saturn','Panzer Dragoon II Zwei is an \"on-rails\" shoot \'em up game released exclusively for the Sega Saturn. It was the second Panzer Dragoon game released but it is a prequel of the series. It was developed by Team Andromeda, one of Sega\'s internal development studios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ixu.jpg'),(12730,'Sonic & Garfield Pack','1999-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sonic & Garfield Pack is a compilation game for Microsoft Windows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qsg.jpg'),(12731,'SubLight',NULL,'Simulator, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Earth is gone, and the wake of its destruction is expanding outwards, towards your interstellar ark. A thousand refugees have put their faith in Aurora, a sophisticated artificial intelligence that you, the player, must control. Equipped only with sub-light speed propulsion, you plot century long voyages through the grim black reaches of interstellar space. Generations of people live and die aboard the small confines of your vessel. Humanity’s only chance for survival is to flee from one star system to another, gathering vital resources along the way. The critical choices you make will have consequences for generations to come.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jyz.jpg'),(12732,'Space Cows','2019-09-04','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Space Cows is a hardcore twin-stick shooter about shooting up space mutants and saving cows. Fly in zero gravity, experience wacky physics and unleash the bullet hell of your laser-scoped plunger in epic boss fights!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rd6.jpg'),(12733,'eXperience 112','2008-02-05','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An abandoned boat. A system of surveillance camera that works. A woman, Lea Nichols, only survivor of a team of researchers. Monitor, manage, search… Behind your camera, guide Lea Nichols to freedom but also to the truth. Be her eyes and ears to help fulfill her destiny! But be careful, remember that things are not always what they seem…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3win.jpg'),(12734,'NHL Hitz 2003','2002-09-16','Sport','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, Game Boy Advance, PlayStation 2','The NHL Hitz series has been on all next-generation consoles since the early days of the 32-bit era. With that said, its no surprise that Midway brings NHL Hitz 20-03 to GameCube, with Hitz\' trademark \'On-Fire Mode\', over-the-top animations, and fully 3D crowds. Like all NHL Hitz games, NHL Hitz 20-03 features gameplay modes for up to 6 players, in-game fights and hidden teams, players and stadiums. The game will also feature Create-A-Player modes and mini-games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20mr.jpg'),(12735,'AltLife','2019-04-16','Sin género','Android','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dyn.jpg'),(12736,'The Mine Song But It\'s In A Playable Doom WAD',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12737,'Death Horizon','2017-09-21','Shooter','Oculus VR, Legacy Mobile Device','Death Horizon is a realistic VR shooter developed specially for mobile VR devices. \n \nIn the secret Horizon laboratory, a horrific virus has broken free, and now all the employees have turned to zombies. Only the game’s protagonist can prevent the downfall of humanity. Your task is to make your way to the station’s reactor and disable the distribution of the virus. To do that, you’ll need to kill all the enemies in your path and complete the tasks. Come back alive too, if you can. \n \nDeveloped specially for the Samsung Gear VR and Google Daydream mobile VR platforms','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co271a.jpg'),(12738,'Mydhia Online','2023-02-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the world of Mydhia Online, an MMORPG that brings back the nostalgia of the golden era of RPGs, inspired by classics like Final Fantasy and Chrono Trigger. With 16-bit pixelated graphics, the game captures the same retro vibe as hits like Stardew Valley.\n\nGet ready for real-time combat against hundreds of enemies in a complex and engaging storyline. But remember, Mydhia Online isn\'t just about solo adventures. Socialization is the key to success in this game, with party, guild, and EXP-sharing systems among friends.\n\nSo, join us, Wanderer, and dive yourself into the vast universe of Mydhia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7em9.jpg'),(12739,'Gas Station Simulator and Party Time DLC Bundle','2025-01-03','Sin género','Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9efd.jpg'),(12740,'Round Invaders','2022-01-26','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Round Invaders is an action arcade game with a fresh take on the famous Invaders arcade. Now the enemies come in circles, rays and ovals! Enjoy the plopping sounds while saving the Earth and rising your Score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4e74.jpg'),(12741,'Psycholonials','2021-02-04','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','While in communication with supernatural forces, two influencers launch a daring new social media brand. After getting in trouble with the law, they must consider how to navigate stardom as scrutiny of their project intensifies. The visual novel begins on April 20th, 2020, taking place on an island off the coast of New England.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sve.jpg'),(12742,'Lost Everything: Chapter 1','2023-07-25','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on an immersive adventure with \"Lost Everything: Chapter 1,\" a captivating 2D point and click game. Join Billy, the determined protagonist, as he delves into a journey of revelation, where the truth awaits, whether he\'s ready for it or not. Unravel mysteries, solve intriguing puzzles, and uncover hidden secrets in this compelling storyline.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12743,'Baku Baku','1996-01-26','Puzzle','Sega Game Gear, Sega Master System/Mark III','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co659y.jpg'),(12744,'Bent Oak Island','2024-04-03','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bent Oak Island is a 1990\'s point and click adventure set on a mysterious island! Join twins Archer and Sam as they delve into the mysteries of both the island and their own heritage, and maybe save the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68gu.jpg'),(12745,'Cityventory','2025-05-10','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','CITYVENTORY is a minimalist city builder/inventory management game where you build colorful cities just like you are organizing your inventory. Place and move your tiles freely, synergize them to earn points and build the best city possible!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9llv.jpg'),(12746,'Tearaway: Unfolded','2015-10-01','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 4','Journey through a vibrant, living papery world, with a plucky messenger who has a unique message to deliver - to you! Choose to guide either atoi or iota on this adventure, each a bold courier with an expressive personality and a unique message for you locked away inside their envelope head. In order to read it though, they\'re going to need your help to deliver it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nfd.jpg'),(12747,'LEGO Batman: The Mobile Game','2008-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Legacy Mobile Device','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xj0.jpg'),(12748,'The Collider 2','2016-11-24','Racing, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Destroy the colossal mothership looming over the planet and save your home world! With a fleet of high-tech space fighters at your disposal, take on a series of suicidal missions to destroy the alien invader from the inside. Take down reactors, collect sensitive data, and avoid lethal defenses as you maneuver through the vents of the enemy vessel at near light-speed velocity – the clock is ticking!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/srkkvv6bk5x6en5krioc.jpg'),(12749,'Red Moon: Lost Days','2023-01-31','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','Sega Saturn','Red Moon: Lost Days is an RPG/visual novel hybrid developed for the Sega Saturn about Kyou Tan Wa, a pilot who after lost contact with a Army General friend, sets out on a journey to Egypt to investigate his disappearance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77ac.jpg'),(12750,'Anger of Stick 5: Zombie','2016-06-08','Sin género','Android','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dyu.jpg'),(12751,'The Testament of Sherlock Holmes','2023-03-09','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Nintendo Switch','The Testament of Sherlock Holmes immerses you in 1898 London as you conduct an incredible investigation.\n\nAll the evidence suggests our hero is the main suspect in a case involving theft, fraud and double-crossings. Unable to prove his own innocence, Holmes is rapidly losing London\'s trust as doubt spreads through the city like wildfire. Even Doctor Watson\'s faith in his friend begins to waver, as the famous detective flees Scotland Yard and raises further suspicion; prowling around at night, destruction of evidence... would Holmes go so far as to commit murder?\n\nThe complex and decidedly-mature storyline surrounds a particularly tricky investigation, in which each and every puzzle will challenge both insight and wits!\n\nAs Sherlock Holmes, you will use the detective\'s full repertoire: handle and inspect clues, reenact crimes and use the game\'s new deduction system to draw your own conclusions.\n\nChoose your questioning approach to catch characters off guard and gather valuable information. Face an open investigation, and decide which leads to follow and which to ignore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qsi.jpg'),(12752,'Croaka-Crawla','1982-12-31','Arcade','Sinclair ZX81','Croaka-Crawla is a clone of the arcade game Frogger where the player must control a frog and get him to the other side of a road and river. The game is viewed from above and the first thing to cross is a busy road full of traffic scrolling across the screen. You can move left, right or forward as you dodge the traffic to reach a river bank. Once the road has been survived then a river must be crossed by jumping on logs or the backs of turtles that scroll across the screen as well. Once you reach the other side of the river you must jump into a gap and occasionally a baby frog or flies appears for extra points. If you get hit by a vehicle, fall into the river, or touch the sides of the screen then you lose one of three lives. Before the game you can change the speed of the game (1-100) with 1 being the fastest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xgk.jpg'),(12753,'Crusader Kings II: Horse Lords Content Pack','2015-07-14','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crusader Kings II: Horse Lords Content Pack includes four unique unit packs, a portraits pack and a music pack for the Horse Lords expansion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6h92.jpg'),(12754,'Match It Fast',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12755,'Amigo Pancho 2','2017-08-09','Sin género','Android','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dyo.jpg'),(12756,'Golf With Your Friends: Olympus Odyssey Course','2024-09-12','Sport','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A call from the Gods has been made and you and your friends have been summoned! The new Olympus Odyssey Premium DLC Course offers 18 brand new holes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e2r.jpg'),(12757,'Densha de D: Burning Stage','2011-08-04','Racing, Simulator, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Densha de D Burning Stage (Train D Burning Stage) is a three dimensional train battle game based upon Initial D, a popular manga series written and illustrated by Shuichi Shigeno; and Densha de Go!, a Japanese train simulation game series originally produced by Taito. The player will compete in a fast-paced arcade style racing by using densha, or Japanese train, where each train is unique and the game encourage player to \"powerslide\" the train to keep up their speed by drifting through a turn. New to the game are Keihan 800-series train, nine new lines and the game also optimized to support low-spec PC. There are three game modes; Dramatic Mode, a single player story mode; Battle Mode, a two player battle in split screen; Replay Mode which lets player to replay their memorable battles. Densha de D Burning Stage is the second game of the series and was released at Comiket 80, on August 4, 2011.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pwc.jpg'),(12758,'Maximum Velocity','2023-10-29','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Maximum Velocity is a high-stakes, high-speed racing game looking to shake up the racing genre forever. Join your friends and take on challenges in an immersive, ever-changing world. Drift, drag, or sprint your way around Industrial City and discover hidden secrets to the lore and ever-evolving story.\nDrive the way you want to.\n\nUpgrade your vehicles to handle the way you want them to. Make them as fast as you want or as drifty as you wish. You are in control of your car and how it handles. Unlock performance parts by exploring the city and doing challenges to get rewards and upgrades.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5eu4.jpg'),(12759,'Pokémon Cope','2025-01-03','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Advance','Pokemon cope is a romhack parody of Pokemon Clover that aims to overhaul the usual fire red experience with a brand new complete dex and a bunch of inside jokes.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12760,'United States of America Jigsaw Puzzles','2023-12-15','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Explore USA\'s beauty in Jigsaw Puzzles! Solve iconic scenes, unlock breathtaking views, and experience America\'s charm. Choose your challenge and enjoy a captivating tribute to the nation\'s splendor!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fdz.jpg'),(12761,'Dreadborne Dungeon','2025-04-15','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dreadborne Dungeon is a pixel art, retro shooter inspired by old school games like Doom and Heretic, as well as mechanics taken from Souls Like games and dungeon crawlers. Explore dark dungeons, fight enemies and survive in a retro-styled world. Die, draw conclusions and don\'t give up! Good Luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co929l.jpg'),(12762,'SM64.z64','2022-02-16','Platform','Nintendo 64','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85yk.jpg'),(12763,'Mafia II: The Betrayal of Jimmy','2010-08-24','Shooter, Racing','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The Betrayal of Jimmy offers a more arcade-like gameplay, while still maintaining the basic structure, style, and controls as Mafia II. Players earn points for doing certain actions, such as fast driving, killing enemies and destroying vehicles. In addition, unlike the base game, this DLC features online leaderboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55ly.jpg'),(12764,'Destination: The Planet','2023-07-17','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Destination: The Planet, a 3D collect-a-thon platformer all about exploring weird little worlds! Once a lost game for the DreamSoft console, now playable on your computer!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12765,'Hoverflow','2021-04-30','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Surf, jump, climb and keep your flow in this first-person platformer while finding secrets and beating time trials !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co861s.jpg'),(12766,'Emi & The Super Boba',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Get your game on as Emi jetpacks through a treacherous crystal cave and blasts her way to the top.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5grc.jpg'),(12767,'The Cloud Dream of the Nine','2014-03-28','Simulator, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yang Soyu, lives in a village in Hwaju Castle, in the state of Cheonin. Her father, a fairy god from Mt. Gonryun ascended to the fairy world after his connection with the human world came to an end when his beloved wife passed away, Soyu’s mother.\n\nWith no parents to raise her, Soyu was taken in by her friend Chaeyoon and his family. While the villagers in her town, are resentful to Soyu, thinking her story about her father being a fairy god is absurd, it was only her friend Chaeyoon and his family, that she fully trusts.\n\nOne unfortunate day, their house burned down and amidst the calamity, Chaeyoon goes missing. Soyu sets off on a journey to find her friend, and along the way meets new characters (which either became her friend or her potential love interest).\n\nDuring her journey, Soyu will get to unravel the secrets behind the political tyranny of their land. Her fate and ending will change depending on the choices you, as a player, choose for her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mzg.jpg'),(12768,'Coloring Pixels: Safari Pack','2021-03-12','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This Safari Book adds 20 new images to Coloring Pixels! Grab your binoculars and put on your sun hat - we\'re going on a Safari tour with this Book to see all of your favourite animals!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6swo.jpg'),(12769,'ClusterPuck 99','2015-01-23','Sport, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Introducing ClusterPuck 99, a sporty competitive sports game about sports based on athletics! Featuring 8-player local competitive action for PC, Mac and Linux.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/thpcmcf0u0uqxzrcexg2.jpg'),(12770,'QSteps 2','2020-10-06','Point-and-click','iOS','This remake is the second CD of the original Q Steps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co984r.jpg'),(12771,'Arthur\'s Dream of the Dragon and the Bear','2014-01-13','Sin género','Web browser','A simple Twine conversion of an evocative scene. The text I used is a modern translation, by one Brian Stone, of a poem dating from about 1400. There\'s plenty more information available under \'about the authors\' for those curious!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s30.jpg'),(12772,'Puzzling Places: Cherry Blossom','2024-09-19','Puzzle','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, Meta Quest 3','A special collaboration between Puzzling Places and Walkabout Mini Golf. This is a free DLC puzzle featuring Cherry Blossom, a fan-favorite mini golf course.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p92.jpg'),(12773,'Old World: Behind the Throne','2024-05-28','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Old World - Behind the Throne introduces the machinations of the royal court with new mechanics, rivalries, and the ability to leverage your power with opulence projects that bring you closer to victory.\n\nNew historical characters take center stage in the role of advisors, viziers, aristocrats, and courtiers. These rising stars bring their own ambitions, desires, and drives with them. Will Alcibiades change his allegiances multiple times throughout his life or will you be able to put an end to his double-dealing antics? Will you let Enlil-nadin-sumi successfully usurp the throne of Babylon? Or will Harpagus betray your ruler after a long life of service? Let others manage your cities and befriend them, or watch as they turn into dangerous rivals fueled by a thirst for power.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82cv.jpg'),(12774,'White Heaven',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Canceled sequel to the 2012 Adventure-Horror game \'Anna.\' White Heaven was to take place in an abandoned hotel nestled in the Italian Alps, eponymously titled White Heaven. Its narrative focuses on a kidnapped victim escaping his captivity after having fallen in love with one of his captors. The game was to follow three playable characters while continuing to explore the backstory of its predecessor rather than serving as a direct continuation. Early footage showcased chase sequences, which weren\'t attempted in the developer\'s previous work. The game was announced in 2013 and was being created in Unreal Engine 4 with an additional extension to aid with dynamic lighting. In 2020, its developers announced a cancelation of this iteration of the game, as they felt it to be \"too much, too soon\" in terms of the story they were attempting to tell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yb0.jpg'),(12775,'Spandex Force: Champion Rising','2015-06-24','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Create your own hero, train your superpowers and battle crooks and villains in this tongue-in-cheek hex based match-3 RPG. There\'s never a dull moment in Vigilance Valley!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dqh.jpg'),(12776,'On My Own: New Frontier',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Make your own way through the wilderness: build a cozy cabin or take your tent to discover more. Retro vibes and evergreen optimism ensoul this survival adventure featuring clever craftables, curious critters, and a handful of inspiring landmarks tucked away throughout.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qme.jpg'),(12777,'Identity: Town Square','2018-11-20','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Identity is a new breed of massively multiplayer online role-playing game where hundreds of players interact in a world of absolute freedom. It\'s the actions of players which determine your fate and the fate of the world you live in.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55w2.jpg'),(12778,'Ballotron Mega Bundle','2024-12-06','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','The Ballotron Mega Bundle includes several parts of the meditative puzzle Ballotron, as well as the colorful games Pirate Bloopers and Beat of Montezuma. The games are enjoyable and for the whole family.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eg6.jpg'),(12779,'Coloring Pixels: Landmarks Pack','2021-01-08','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This Landmarks Book brings 20 new, large images to Coloring Pixels, each image depicts famous landmarks from all over the globe! You can now experience the wonders of the world intimately from your PC!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ta4.jpg'),(12780,'1979 Revolution: Black Friday','2018-08-02','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','1979 Revolution, the action/adventure game, immerses players into the gritty, euphoric streets of revolution – where the choices you make may betray you. Set in the actual events of 1979 Iran.\n\n1979 Revolution’s story is told through the main character Reza, a young photojournalist in Tehran, during the electrifying early days of the revolution in 1978. Without political or religious motivation, Reza begins his heart of darkness journey into social upheaval. Surrounded by a group of impassioned key figures involved in overthrowing the regime – Reza’s engagement becomes a high stakes chess match of decision making – whereby everything is at risk.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2839.jpg'),(12781,'Columnae: A Past Under Construction',NULL,'Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Columnae: A Past Under Construction\" is a non-linear point & click adventure game set in a post-apocalyptic steampunk world and developed by Belgrade-based Moonburnt Studio.\n\nAside from the classic point & click adventure features, Columnae introduces the concept of retrocausality which along with non-linear nature of the gameplay allows the player to affect not only the future but also the past of the main character and the world surrounding him. The game is divided into eight chapters, but the order of playing them is not chronological. Depending on the actions the player chooses within each chapter of the game, yet-to-be-played chapters are placed in an appropriate \"version\" of the past or the future.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12782,'Poly Beats',NULL,'Music, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Poly Beats is a 5K rhythm game that never misses to have the very best features, and interesting gimmicks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7t8g.jpg'),(12783,'Secret Command','2008-06-03','Shooter','Wii, Sega Master System/Mark III','A port of Rambo: First Blood Part II, without the Rambo license.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zkz.jpg'),(12784,'The Mystic Dragoons','1999-06-17','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation','The hero (a dragon knight blood boy) was born and raised in the Dragon field, and he will be involved in the war between the Dragon Knights and their rivals.\n\nThe game begins when the small village where the hero lives and where they train and take care of the dragons is attacked by an evil army that killed most of the villagers and the dragons, but the hero, his friends and a little egg got to escape and soon the from the egg a dragon baby raises. The hero and his friends decide to go on a journey to take revenge and destroy that evil army, but things will be an easy task for sure...\n\nAs a Dragon knight he can control the Dragons and ride them. He will have to use the help of his friends and the dragons to come along throught the story.\n\nThe game features beautiful 2d cartoon graphics and the classic turn based rpg in the battle part.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8l10.jpg'),(12785,'Assetto Corsa: Ultimate Edition','2018-04-20','Racing, Simulator','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Assetto Corsa: Ultimate Edition is the most complete version of the universally acclaimed driving simulator, offering all the DLC & updates ever released for the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28uk.jpg'),(12786,'Cardinal Sequence','2025-04-25','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cardinal Sequence is a relaxing sci-fi deckbuilder where you play cards by matching patterns, assemble game-changing synergies and watch your score reach into the stratosphere and beyond.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ldx.jpg'),(12787,'Your Toy','2019-05-16','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Your Toy is a 3D first person escape game that incorporates elements of horror. Features an advanced no-repeat puzzle system, challenging puzzle content, as well as a well-designed backstory. Not only will you enjoy solving the game\'s puzzles, you will also experience the story through collecting various in-game items.\nAre you ready to enter the nightmare?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co234p.jpg'),(12788,'N O Nb','2017-02-01','Music, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Interactive art piece and sequel to T H E YV.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20pg.jpg'),(12789,'Demon\'s Island','2020-10-31','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Choose between 26 unique characters... Get a custom particle effect to scream at people.... Find and uncover 40 secret rooms... Find 22 unique familiars to customize yourself with... Unlock 54 mysterious achievements... Get 15 unique upgrades to explore the map further... Discover the dark secret of the conspiracy room... And do it all online with your friends... Or by yourself in singleplayer...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87zo.jpg'),(12790,'Project L33t','2024-07-25','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into Project L33T, a hardcore first-person tactical extraction shooter. Confront AI foes and rival players, engage in high-stakes battles for precious loot, and risk all your gear to collect, secure, and extract Artifacts in this hostile environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80vx.jpg'),(12791,'Christmas Stories: Hans Christian Andersen\'s Tin Soldier','2014-12-23','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Team up with the Nutcracker and your new friend, the Tin Soldier, to fight trolls and destroy the Baron\'s curse in this Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b4k.jpg'),(12792,'Sketch, Share, Solve: Video Games & Animals','2022-09-08','Puzzle','Playdate','A fan-made puzzle pack of 32 nonogram challenges for Sketch, Share, Solve.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12793,'Sportvida CyberDash',NULL,'Sport, Indie','SteamVR','Sportvida CyberDash is a VR running game that delivers both stress relief and thrilling challenges. Set in a high-speed, futuristic world of light and technology, you’ll embark on an intense adventure where sprinting, dodging, and smashing obstacles offer an unparalleled sense of release.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fzt.jpg'),(12794,'Love Tore: Bitter','2013-01-31','Music','Xbox 360','Love Tore: Bitter is an anime-themed Kinect dance game released only in Japan. It is the third in the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/u5h6o0jy2ortdyhtbfl3.jpg'),(12795,'Endzone: A World Apart - Save the World Edition','2022-07-22','Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S','Endzone is a post-apocalyptic survival city builder, where you start a new civilization with a group of people after a global nuclear disaster. Build them a new home and ensure their survival in a shattered world, threatened by constant radiation, toxic rain, sandstorms, droughts, and raiders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3drn.jpg'),(12796,'A Plague Tale: Requiem','2022-10-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','A Plague Tale: Requiem is an action-adventure game similar to its predecessor. The player assumes control of Amicia and must face against both soldiers from the French Inquisition and hordes of rats that are spreading the black plague. The gameplay is largely similar to the first game, though the combat system is significantly expanded. The game features a progression system in which the player will be awarded additional skills and abilities. Stealth players will unlock skills that allow them to sneak around more efficiently, while those who prefer a more lethal approach will unlock additional combat skills. Locations are also larger, giving players additional options to progress.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pwb.jpg'),(12797,'JellyCod',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Jellycod recaptures the core of classic shooters. Return to the simple days of playing first person shooters with your friends. Grab your bolt action rifle in \'rifles only\' mode or compete in 5v5 Search and Destroy. Wishlist now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71o2.jpg'),(12798,'Hyper Wars: The Mega Firestorm',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12799,'Spire of Glory','2022-12-03','Point-and-click, Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Indie Roguelike Autobattler Poolbuilder','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uds.jpg'),(12800,'Crimson Dragon Side Story','2012-09-12','Shooter','Windows Phone','Set on the mysterious planet Draco, \"Crimson Dragon: Side Story\" is a shooter in which you control dragons to defeat enemies. Use touch controls to pilot your dragon and target enemies--it\'s a perfect match for your Windows Phone 7! Breed new controllable dragons, level up through repeated play, and choose from more than 170 skills to customize their attacks. Begin your journey on Draco today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26ly.jpg'),(12801,'Putahe ng Ina Mo','2020-05-31','Simulator, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Missing your nanay\'s home cooked meal? Live stream and \"make handa\" the perfect bowl of sinigang with this bite sized cooking experience.\n\nAll the ingredients are prepped in the counter, and there\'s a magically set up live streamed camera. Easy? Think again! We\'re not telling you how to do it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3auq.jpg'),(12802,'Skull and Bones: Premium Edition','2024-02-13','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Skull and Bones Premium Edition includes:\n- Base game\n- Up to 3 days early access.\n- The Ballad of Bloody Bones Collection\n- 2 extra missions: The Ashen Corsair & Bloody Bones Legacy.\n- Digital Artbook of 84 pages and digital selected game soundtrack.\n- Smuggler Pass token (Unlocks a premium battle pass and additional content. Usable when new seasons release.)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68uo.jpg'),(12803,'Kalpa: The Sign of Omen','1999-09-15','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In July 1999, a strategy role-playing game developed by Dynasty International Information and published by Soft-World Technology was released along with the well-known computer magazine \"Software and CD\" in mainland China. This game is called \"Kalpa: The Sign of Omen\". Due to its low price of 25 yuan for the full version, it attracted a large number of players.\n\nMost people were initially scared off by its difficulty, making the most common screen seen at the beginning \"defeat.\" Then, there were a lot of game-breaking bugs, causing many players to have to start over. There was even a rumor online that the game company was treating players as free testers. As a result, the magazine \"Software and CD\" had to include a patch in its August issue to appease the players\' anger.\n\nIn September 1999, the \"enhanced version\" of \"Kalpa: The Sign of Omen\" was released at a price of 69 yuan. In addition to a big box packaging, the game also came with a full-color manual and a fan comic. The game version was also upgraded to 1.1. This version looked like a deluxe edition, and many players who owned the standard edition were not interested in it. However, this version contained a big secret, which was the perfect ending of the game. The relevant levels were not included in the standard version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66h3.jpg'),(12804,'Metal Gear Solid 2: Sons of Liberty - HD Edition','2011-11-08','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360, Nintendo Switch','Metal Gear Solid 2: Sons of Liberty - HD Edition feature an increased 720p resolution and a 16:9 aspect ratio, providing a clearer and wider view of the player\'s surroundings compared to the original 480p resolution and 4:3 ratio of the PlayStation 2 version. Cutscenes can now be viewed in full-screen or letterboxed format, while online achievements/trophies have been added as well. Most of the additional content from Metal Gear Solid 2: Substance has also been ported in this version, such as the Missions and Snake Tales modes, although the Skateboarding mini-game that was present in the PlayStation 2 version of Substance is absent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co982l.jpg'),(12805,'Fire Fight','1996-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fire Fight is a Isometric Shoot \'em Up developed by Chaos Works and Epic Games and published by Electronic Arts in 1996. You control a white U-shaped fighter craft with a variety of weapons, and fly missions on various Single Biome Planets destroying ground and air targets and accomplishing specific other objectives, such as rescuing hostages.\nThe interesting inversion is in the plot- you work for The Empire, attempting to suppress the forces of La Résistance. In practice, The Empire is more The Federation and La Résistance are no heroic Ragtag Bunch of Misfits, so it winds up seeming like Gray and Grey Morality.\nFire Fight has some impressive-looking sprites, satisfying sound effects, excellent music, a decent dialogue and a nice variety of missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ni1.jpg'),(12806,'Metroid: Galactic Marine','2024-11-14','Shooter, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qyy.jpg'),(12807,'Tony Meola\'s Sidekicks Soccer','1993-11-01','Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Tony Meola\'s Sidekicks Soccer is a standard soccer game with the standard modes such as Exhibition and Season mode with 64 different soccer teams including World teams and localized teams, each with their own strengths and weaknesses. It also features realistic moves such as headers and bicycle kicks, with a behind the player\'s perspective and Mode 7 graphics. It doesn\'t feature any official soccer license, but is personally endorsed by American goalie, Tony Meola.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zfo.jpg'),(12808,'DWG 2024 Bundle','2024-12-13','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','DWG 2024 Bundle includes a selection of some of the games that were published by Desert Water Games in 2024.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eft.jpg'),(12809,'Eroico','2017-05-17','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Eroico is a colorful, lighthearted platformer with monster-girls and sexual content. Journey across the land, battling and escaping the grasp of monster-girl foes in your quest to defeat the demon lord!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24rf.jpg'),(12810,'Her Love, Like Poison','2025-12-31','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A dark lesbian horror/romance story so toxic it\'s emitting spores. Ethel, a shy university student, ventures into the wintry woods late one night, where she meets an enchanting raven-haired femme fatale - but all is not as it seems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fi3.jpg'),(12811,'Piano Tiles 2+','2025-01-06','Music','iOS','Tap the tiles in sync with the melody and make sure not to miss any tiles. This is an apple arcade only version of the popular free to play game that removes all ads and microtransactions. It requires a subscription to play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pfu.jpg'),(12812,'Royal Revolt!','2013-07-11','Strategy','Android, iOS','Royal Revolt is a reverse T-defense game with beautiful 3D graphics and intuitive touch controls! Lead your soldiers to victory against your greedy relatives who have stolen your father’s throne.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kac.jpg'),(12813,'Persona 5: Dancing In Starlight - Wake Up, Get Up, Get Out There (OP ver.)','2018-12-03','Sin género','PlayStation 4','Additional playable track \'Wake Up, Get Up, Get Out There (OP ver.)\'.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12814,'Recital of the Heart','2026-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An adventure game with a focus on story and exploration. Experiment with wide range of weapons, abilities, and modifications as you delve deep into a world pure imagination. Solve conflict and mysteries with your partner Kand by your side. Heed his wise words, or throw caution (and him) to the wind!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lkv.jpg'),(12815,'Salamander III','2025-08-07','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Salamander III is the newest addition to the Gradius series, a legendary pioneer in the side-scrolling shooter genre, and comes with the original arcade versions of the previous games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l0p.jpg'),(12816,'Fiction.Colors','2021-01-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pi0.jpg'),(12817,'Tank Quest','2021-04-04','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Tank Lord has taken over the land. Assemble a team or tread solo to defeat his evil forces and take back what is rightfully ours. Take control of a cute animal in a tank and blast through your enemies with your bullets and bombs!\n\nGrab some nearby friends or play solo in this top-down, twin-stick shooter game! Choose a cute animal character to pilot your tank as you make your way through each level. Your tank will have unlimited bullets to use at your disposal for each mission, but you\'ll also find useful mine and missile pick-ups along the way. Levels are divided into several missions, and if you lose all your lives before the level is complete, you must start it back at the beginning! Discover new locations with each level, and perhaps some scary beasts to slay as well!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uvm.jpg'),(12818,'Beach Invasion 1944','2022-12-02','Shooter, Simulator, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Beach Invasion 1944 is a WWII FPS game where you defend the fortified beach against invading forces who will attack with you troops, tanks, planes and more! Use the iconic WWII weapons such as MG42, Flak88 and Panzers, prepare your defenses with mines, explosives and bonuses!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7iqs.jpg'),(12819,'Anstoß 4','2002-12-31','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Anstoss 4, which appeared exclusively on DVD in 2002, could no longer build on the success of its predecessor. The game had to be completely reimplemented because the code of Anstoss 3 was considered too confused to be able to use it. This, as well as the short development time of only 12 months, meant that the program suffered from a large number of bugs that made it almost unplayable. Furthermore, the text and 3D mode was seen as too weak by the fan base and the manufacturer Ascaron was asked to make significant improvements. The manufacturer decided not to fix the program errors with patches, but rather to bring a new, revised manager onto the market based on Anstoss 4.\n\nAnstoss 4 is therefore considered to be the worst part of the Anstoss series, as it could not shine through playability, realism, or wit. Although the new database system, which now contained 145 countries, to which four leagues could be added, was praised by the manufacturer, it tended to cause very long waiting times, which massively delayed the game.\n\nAnstoss 4 differed from its predecessors not least in that the two main developers Gerald Köhler and Rolf Langenberg left the Ascaron team and switched to the competition from EA Sports to develop the soccer manager series there. Since then, the fan community has also split into two camps.\n\nAscaron was sued by its competitor Electronic Arts for license infringement shortly before the publication of Anstoss 4 and had to crush the entire CD production and change all player names.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lyb.jpg'),(12820,'Lunnye Devitsy','2009-07-01','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lunnye Devitsy is the story of an alien who falls from the moon onto a huge mountainside on the planet below. Explore strange locations, aid mysterious characters and find your way home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ajy.jpg'),(12821,'Zenkoku Baken Ouja Ketteisen 2: Satella Mile Yosen 1',NULL,'Sin género','Satellaview','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12822,'Hello Kitty World 2','2020-05-03','Simulator','Android, iOS','The sequel to Hello Kitty World, the popular theme park simulation game with over 5 million downloads worldwide!\nFrom Hello Kitty and My Melody to Pompompurin, Kiki & Lala, Kuromi, and Cinnamoroll, the game features a huge cast of Sanrio\'s beloved characters!\nNow you can see your own personal avatar in the park! It\'s now possible to coordinate outfits with Sanrio’s adorable fashion styles.\nCraft decorations for your favorite characters and create your very own special park!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f2o.jpg'),(12823,'Battle Fantasia -Revised Edition-','2015-07-07','Fighting, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Battle Fantasia\", the fantasy RPG themed 2D Fighting game is now appearing on Steam, and \"REVISED\" with the latest balances and improved visual effects! Comes with FREE Soundtrack DLC!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ud9.jpg'),(12824,'Gobz: To the Moon','2022-03-19','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fan-made hyper casual game for GobzNFT project. You need to reach the top of the platforms while game is constantly speeding up. The game is based on Icy Tower which released late 2001. Jump, collect & unlock all Gobz species!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kkk.jpg'),(12825,'The Fifth Day','2014-07-25','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Fifth Day is a post-apocalyptic survival game set in the time after mankind\'s extinction to the machines that it created. Your role, as one of these machines, is to survive in the hostile world left behind by man.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tzxymb62n8kdl2kdsq2g.jpg'),(12826,'Super Ninja Boy','1992-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Wii U, Super Famicom','Super Ninja Boy is an action RPG for one or two players. In a two player game, each player controls either Jack or Ryu. In a one player game, only Jack appears. A second player may join at any time by visiting a convenience store.\n\nThe game contains familiar role-playing elements such as equipping differing kinds of weapons, equipment and gaining levels. The Ninja Boys are treated as a single entity and so these statistics are shared between Jack and Ryu with equal values. Battles with the enemy, either through random encounters or visible on the map is where the action starts. The characters enter a side-scrolling \'battle mode\' where they may jump, fight, use their special techniques, items and spells, as well as activate various bonuses on the battlefield by breaking open the bonus boxes. A battle is over and experience points awarded when a pre-determined number of enemies are defeated or the Ninja Boys are defeated.\n\nWhen bosses are encountered, the gameplay changes to a turn-based system. Each turn, commands are given to Jack and Ryu, which include usage of special items and skills acquired during the game, who then perform actions based on those commands. The enemy\'s turn takes place the same way. The battle ends when one side of the conflict runs out of hitpoints.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4woq.jpg'),(12827,'Match Connect Challenge','2018-05-11','Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Match Connect Challenge - The new match game is here, with brilliant Pirate objects.\n\nA journey filled with waves of excitement and brilliant visuals! Swap objects to clear the way, and match pieces to crush each challenge that lies ahead.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12828,'GravytX The Gravytoid','2023-04-17','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play as GravytX an alien who has the ability to control objects remotely and manipulate gravity. Travel the universe to save the peoples who are under the domination of the Vodouas (Malicious beings who want to conquer the universe) and bring peace to their Planets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72zr.jpg'),(12829,'Cast of the Seven Godsends: Redux','2016-07-18','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Cast of the Seven Godsends: Redux harks back to the days when classic 2D, run \'n gun, action-shooter games ruled the arcades. The game features four levels of difficulty, six worlds to conquer, twelve mid and end-of-level bosses, seven god-like armor sets, five basic weapons and 35 magic combat spells!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pnr.jpg'),(12830,'Faith of Fate','2019-06-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Faith of Fate, a game made by a million dreams for a million dreamers. We all have the Fate in our hands, what will you do? Heaven or Hell?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zj9.jpg'),(12831,'Space Haste','2001-10-12','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Most of us driving-game junkies want more than a realistic driving experience; we want rocket-like speed that lets us blast through the streets, defying the boundaries of realism.\n\nSpace Haste seats you in a hovercraft modelled after 50s-style cars, in a race where your speed limit is unlimited. The maximum speed of the hovercraft increases throughout the game, as your skills improve. What makes this even more challenging is that your reaction time decreases as your speed increases, so hugging the curves of the track gets even more difficult.\n\nAlong the track, you can grab pickups, such as Cloak, Stun, and Shield, that add temporary powers to your vehicle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hyzgakxh64g4tiv0rr2r.jpg'),(12832,'Total War: Attila - The Last Roman Campaign Pack','2015-06-25','Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Last Roman Campaign Pack is an epic expansion for Total War: Attila, delivering a narrative, mission-based experience on a new, highly-detailed campaign map of the Mediterranean theatre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co213j.jpg'),(12833,'Lucid','2023-06-09','Point-and-click, Adventure','Web browser','LUCID is a Point & Click / Top-down hybrid adventure about a young kid in a very bizarre world of odd characters and even weirder happenings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k9v.jpg'),(12834,'Wall World: Deep Threat','2023-08-09','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Deep Threat, a Wall World story expansion! With it you\'ll get to explore a remote section of the Wall which holds traces of a distant past. But you will have to fight for answers, and not only with the new types of Zyrex: other inhabitants of the Wall are also not too keen on parting with their secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6tdk.jpg'),(12835,'Trivia Vault: Science & History Trivia 2','2017-09-01','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the Trivia Vault contestant! Play as a contestant in a gameshow called Trivia Vault: Science & History 2 and bring your thinking hat. Answer all new science and history category trivia questions as quickly as you can, the faster you answer the higher the cash value.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44za.jpg'),(12836,'Model Builder: Expansion Pack no.1',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Model Builder: Expansion Pack no.1 contains four new models: a tank, plane, fantasy figurine, and a boat! Every new model is linked to a new quest and new Steam Achievement! Get them all!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12837,'Soldier Matt Sowards','2020-03-27','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight Enemies as Matt Sowards! Ported from Mobile! Soldier up! and Gear up! Soldier Matt Sowards is a fun plat-former I made to challenge myself & others. Enjoy a Free Fun Endless Shooter with levels and many enemies to face off! Play endless fun in this combat force in a 2D World!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41rf.jpg'),(12838,'Terragearth','2017-09-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the world suddenly captured by an unknown enemy devouring the surface of the planet and shedding toxic clouds, you are going to operate a unique aircraft assembled by survivors who unwillingly became colonists on their own planet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27hh.jpg'),(12839,'Isoland4: The Anchor of Memory','2024-01-10','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ISOLAND4 is the fifth installment in the ISOLAND series by CottonGame. The game continues to feature the distinctive hand-drawn style of CottonGame, with point-and-click gameplay. The game also features a second playthrough mode, which allows players to gain a deeper understanding of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7twq.jpg'),(12840,'9 -nine-: Episode 4','2020-04-24','Simulator, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is the fourth game in Palette’s 9-nine- series. 9-nine- takes place in the run-of-the-mill college town of Shiromitsugawa where an earthquake breaks a sacred artifact from the Shrine of the White Serpent, unleashing jewelry-like items that bestow their holder\'s special powers called \"Artifacts\" from a parallel world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vq3.jpg'),(12841,'Rastan Saga II','1990-08-10','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Arcade, Wii, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','Rastan Saga 2 is the sequel to Rastan, containing the same hack-em\'/slash-\'em gameplay as the original. You are a warrior who must get through a number of levels, and trying to collect gems which can only be obtained by defeating the end-of-level bosses. Collecting power-ups along the way awards you with extra life or better weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50bw.jpg'),(12842,'The Escapists: Supermax Edition','2016-12-13','Sin género','Xbox One','The Escapists Supermax Edition bundle files through the bars and digs to freedom to smuggle the award-winning prison escape game and all the additional premium content past the guards in this definitive Escapists experience!\n\nIncludes:\n\nThe Escapists\nThe Escapists DLC: Duct Tapes are Forever\nThe Escapists DLC: Escape Team\nThe Escapists DLC: Alcatraz\nThe Escapists DLC: Santa\'s Sweatshop','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3t59.jpg'),(12843,'Links 2003: Championship Edition','2003-09-30','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a compilation of Links 2003 and Links 2003: Championship Courses. It has the 6 original courses that were in Links 2003 plus the additional 20 from Championship Courses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hzn.jpg'),(12844,'The Hidden Dragon','2016-07-26','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fugo Rojo the Dragon loves to collect manmade objects and his eternal taste for treasure takes him on a journey to collect items from around the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vow.jpg'),(12845,'Shrek Playtime is Ogre 2','2024-05-25','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','10 years after the first game I have made a sequel to it. Fair forewarning though: This game is hard as balls. If you actually manage to beat \"the shrek challenge\", do let me know!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co893h.jpg'),(12846,'Pressure','2021-04-24','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deeper and deeper into an infinite basement of increasingly difficult enemies, how deep can you go? Pressure is a simple, high-score based arcade FPS with easy to learn but rewarding projectile mechanics. Search the maze-like floors for the green zone to drop into the next level and receive half your health back. Chaining combos of kills, hitting long range shots or bouncing shots off walls into enemies will also heal you. Enemies will hit harder and increase their spawns as you reach deeper and deeper floors. Watch out for harder enemy types as you go deeper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b89.jpg'),(12847,'Hottaaman no Chisoko Tanken','1986-01-06','Arcade','Family Computer','Players get to dig up dirt beneath the surface, find keys behind four doors, and then find the door to the next level. The most obvious game to compare it to is Dig Dug, but without the boulders and with various devices like teleporting doors, speed, dynamite, and a wet suit. There are 15 levels in the entire game; which repeat themselves after the 15th level is finished.\n\nLava can spew out at a vertical direction towards the player and kill him; it does not reset itself even after the players loses a life (but it does reset itself after a game over) Passwords are activated by pressing a certain button combination on the password screen. Several passwords results in cheat codes that does certain things; such as deactivating the lava in all levels of the game.\n\nCertain type of blocks are worth different points once they are dug up; ranging from common dirt to destructible blocks. The game features an instant death clause where players die in a single hit. Killed enemies reappear at the same location where they were killed the first time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51ai.jpg'),(12848,'Robbotto','2018-08-16','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Join Robb and Otto, two intrepid maintenance robots as they must travel through a malfunctioning spaceship, in an effort to shutdown all the rampaging machines! \n \nA gigantic space cruiser was slowly gliding through the vastness of cosmos, when suddenly disaster struck! The ship flew straight through a magnetic storm, causing all the robots and machines onboard to go crazy. Luckily, Robb and Otto, the ships top maintenance robots were putting out a fire in the ships shield generator room, and didn\'t get affected by the storm. Now the two unlikely heroes must travel through the ship and disable all the malfunctioning machines! \n \nClassic Arcade Action \n100 Levels \n20 Different Enemies \n10 Huge Bosses \nSingle Player or Local Co-op','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27fc.jpg'),(12849,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization Revolution','2008-09-11','Strategy','Nintendo DS','Experience the journey of a civilization\'s birth to it\'s rise of power. Learn new technologies, conquer your foes, meet great people, and build Wonders of the World.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zew.jpg'),(12850,'Ghouls Of Divinity','2024-02-23','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Command a ghoul civilization with an innovative physics-based RTS system, complex AI interactions, and a rich skill tree. Strategy meets divinity in an immersive god game experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sll.jpg'),(12851,'Super Mario Evolution',NULL,'Platform','Wii U','Super Mario Evolution is a cancelled mod for New Super Mario Bros. U. This mod aimed to make for an interesting and fun experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ra7.jpg'),(12852,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization V: Explorer\'s Map Pack','2011-05-03','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explorers Map Pack Ten fantastic single-player maps make up this Civilization V DLC pack designed by Firaxis Games. Five of the maps are based on real-world locations, chosen for their historical interest and gameplay possibilities. The remaining five are scripted map environments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85ur.jpg'),(12853,'Xenoblade Chronicles X: Special Edition','2015-12-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Wii U','Exclusive to North America, the Special Edition of Xenoblade Chronicles X includes:\n- Xenoblade chronicles x game\n- Art book\n- Matte art card of characters\n- OST with 10 songs on custom USB drive','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40ub.jpg'),(12854,'Red Faction II','2003-06-27','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure','Xbox, PlayStation 4, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','In Red Faction II you will have to defend your country as Alias, a demolitions expert, with the help of your five squad members, each specializing in their own method of destruction. Fight through diverse levels using vehicles, an arsenal of specialized weapons and massive explosives in your rampage to overthrow the government.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yd5.jpg'),(12855,'Family Guy: Back to the Multiverse','2012-11-20','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Family Guy: Back to the Multiverse is a third-person cooperative gameplay video game set to be released on November 20, 2012 in North America for Xbox 360, PlayStation 3 and PC. It\'s based on the Family Guy television series, most notably the episode Road to the Multiverse, and is also a continuation of The Big Bang Theory. It is rated M for Mature for blood, violence, drug use, mature humor, and sexual content/themes. This game also features the return of Stewie\'s evil half-brother Bertram, who was killed in the show.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dux.jpg'),(12856,'VRC Pro: Off-Road Track - Buggyland Fuencarral, Spain','2017-11-23','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Outdoor off-road track: Buggyland Fuencarral, Spain was the host track for the 2017 VRC off-road Worlds: Buggyland Fuencarral Spain. This is the 2014 version of this track, the track has received several other layouts since, but the 2014 lay-out was certainly one of the most popular.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12857,'Kirarin Revolution: Minna de Odorou Furi Furi Debut!','2008-07-24','Music','Nintendo DS','Kirarin Revolution: Minna de Odorou Furi Furi Debut! is a video game developed and published by Konami and released on Nintendo DS on July 24, 2008 in Japan. It is the fifth game based on the Kirarin Revolution series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ju7.jpg'),(12858,'Strand','2025-12-31','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the desolate void of a high-tech space station in STRAND. Face mind-bending puzzles to escape an infinite time loop while uncovering the fate of your crew. Every detail matters as you unravel the mystery and question humanity’s role in the vast, unforgiving universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8znn.jpg'),(12859,'Links: The Challenge of Golf','1992-12-31','Simulator, Sport','DOS, Amiga, Sega CD','Links redefined what golf on the PC should look and play like; it migrated golf from a sports game to a simulation. Good use of VGA\'s 256 colors made for a realistic course with trees, water, sandtraps, and the fairway. The addition of ball physics, mulligans, changing the lie of the ball, real digitized environmental sounds (even through the PC speaker), and the ability to view a replay (even from multiple angles) gave PC golf games a new echelon of quality to match.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i0f.jpg'),(12860,'Happy\'s Clocks','2022-08-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Run around an enormous mysterious house that once belonged to your dad, while running away from terrifying monsters and solving interesting puzzles. Discover what happened or maybe what was supposed to happen when you left.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e32.jpg'),(12861,'LoveSoTea',NULL,'Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tea-making simulator meets adventure game meets visual novel in the modern tale that is LoveSoTea. Once you complete it, you\'ll know how to brew the most delicious tea... maybe. No promises.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6iz5.jpg'),(12862,'Dead by Daylight: Left Behind','2017-03-08','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','UP AND AT \'EM, SOLDIER. TIME TO MOVE!\nPut on that comfy beret and green combat jacket if you wanna fight another day as war veteran Bill Overbeck. You were left for dead, but you woke up. Now you have gotten the only thing you ever wanted: an enemy to fight.\nLeft Behind is a free add-on for Dead by Daylight and includes 1 survivor + 4 brand new Survivor outfits.\n\nDress your favorite Dead by Daylight Survivor in outfits suited for zombie slayers!\nDwight can now dress up as Ellis - a zombie hunter with a keen interest in cars and music (from Left 4 Dead 2). Adds the Tow-truck Cap, Bullshifters Shirt and Mechanic’s coveralls\n\nClaudette can be clad in the same gear as Rochelle - a TV producer who had to change jobs as the zombie invasion came (from Left 4 Dead 2). Adds the Golden Rings, True Artists Shirt and Producer Jeans\n\nJake can be turned into Francis - a hardened biker and a member of the ruthless biker club Hell’s Legion (from the original Left 4 Dead). Adds the Scar & Goatee, Hell’s Legion and Biker’s Boots\n\nMeg can transform into Zoey - a horror film buff who suddenly seemed to live in one of her favorite zombie movies (from the original Left 4 Dead). Adds the Teen Angst Haircut, Zipper Hoodie and Rolled Up Jeans & Sneakers','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6g4o.jpg'),(12863,'Bass Angler Championship','2005-12-31','Sin género','Plug & Play','Bass Angler Championship is a plug-n-play fishing game released by Jakks Pacific in 2005.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fid.jpg'),(12864,'Mochi\'s Cosy Quest','2025-05-19','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 3D puzzle game where you lead a little capybara to its goal of eating fruit. Make use of the environment to get to the fruit as you are completely unable to jump.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iim.jpg'),(12865,'Retroid','2016-09-01','Sin género','Game Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9njx.jpg'),(12866,'G-Mode Archives+: Shin Megami Tensei - Tokyo Requiem',NULL,'Sin género','Nintendo Switch 2, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p8x.jpg'),(12867,'Daydream: Legend of the Eschelons','2022-06-02','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Imagine you\'re a kid back in the 90s. You woke up early because you\'re excited you\'re going to play your favorite JRPG. You grab a bowl of cereal and power up your Nintendo console.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5d0p.jpg'),(12868,'Always Remember Me','2014-04-18','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Amy is desperate! Her boyfriend Aaron doesn\'t remember her anymore after a car accident!\nWill you be able to make him remember again? Or perhaps it\'s time to move on. Maybe Amy will fall in love with someone else?\nIt\'s up to you to decide. Play this life simulation game with dating sim elements and shape Amy\'s destiny.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3le7.jpg'),(12869,'inVokeR','2017-07-20','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','inVokeR is a one versus one wizard dueling game for VR platforms. Challenge your friends in strategic magic combat, casting spells to turn the tide of battle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2800.jpg'),(12870,'Dead Train',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A zombie survival game that takes place in a post-apocalyptic wasteland. You must manage your food and water carefully because resources are limited. You need to make your way to the end of the railway and back to civilization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5g1v.jpg'),(12871,'Exodus: Rising',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Exodus: Rising is a third person single player action RPG set in an entirely original hand crafted fantasy world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ooh.jpg'),(12872,'Zenkoku Baken Ouja Ketteisen 2: Omoshiro Bamei S',NULL,'Simulator','Satellaview','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12873,'Valkyrie Complex',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12874,'Rules of Survival','2017-11-14','Shooter, Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Welcome to the brand new RULES OF SURVIVAL arena, where the deathmatch has now been raised to a thrilling epic scale! This is a Battle Royale game now played by over 100 million people worldwide.\n\nMay we present you with a fully upgraded new 8x8 km map that allows 300 players to battle on a wide variety of terrains. Only one will survive!\n\nBeware, your safe zone is shrinking! So collect scattered weapons, arm yourself to the teeth, and wield your tactics like no other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r7d.jpg'),(12875,'Pathfinder: Wrath of the Righteous - Enhanced Edition','2021-09-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac','Embark on a journey to a realm overrun by demons in a new epic RPG from the creators of Pathfinder: Kingmaker. Explore the nature of good and evil, learn the true cost of power, and rise as a Mythic Hero capable of deeds beyond mortal expectations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sx1.jpg'),(12876,'Guards!','2024-03-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Guards! is a 1-4 player coop fantasy FPS that puts you in the under-funded and over-zealous steel boots of the City Watch. Kick down doors, bust criminals and cause excessive property damage as you fight to restore law and order to the corrupt city of New Alestead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qq4.jpg'),(12877,'Sakuya-san Crisis 2: The Linkage Of Servant Trial','2013-05-26','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blow up enemies in your way! Kick fairies for good measure!\nBlast away massive hordes of enemies in this Touhou parody shooting RPG!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5096.jpg'),(12878,'Super Mario Star Road: Hint Arts','2024-08-04','Platform, Puzzle','Nintendo 64','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nkx.jpg'),(12879,'Escape Room Six Games Pack','2025-02-13','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Six escape rooms developed by mc2games included!\nPyramids and Aliens, Mystic Academy, Palindrome Syndrome, Tested on Humans, Between Time and Regular Factory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ezk.jpg'),(12880,'Bouncing Ball','2016-11-11','Arcade','Android','Play the amazing Boucing Ball game for free with addictive gameplay and try to beat the record!\n\nYou can tap left or right screen fast to switch the colored circle to correct ball\'s color before it lands or GAME OVERS!\n\nSharing highest scores to your friends.\n\nIt\'s a very addicting game!! Try it out today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qhhguufg7fzwspys7mkn.jpg'),(12881,'Bosorka','2023-04-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Bosorka is an exciting action roguelike where a young witch saves the world from insidious and cruel demons. Combine runes, master a variety of brooms, and try all possible and impossible spells until you gain enough power to fight evil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68nq.jpg'),(12882,'TheSilentSnowfall','2024-12-28','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Silent Snowfall is a first-person horror game.Embark on a dark Christmas journey where the silence of a winter night hides blood-chilling secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n0z.jpg'),(12883,'Madness in the Banaverse','2024-11-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Madness in the Banaverse is a single player platform game that combines action and comedy with a cartoonish style, taking as its protagonist the famous YouTuber “El Bananero”, who provides his voice to give life to the character and the most iconic phrases.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co983p.jpg'),(12884,'Infiniti VR','2017-03-28','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immersive VR experience for HTC Vive featuring world leading visuals and interactions. Check it out for free now.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bpq.jpg'),(12885,'Mount & Blade Full Collection',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12886,'Emote Challenge 64 2','2020-09-06','Platform','Nintendo 64','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9njz.jpg'),(12887,'Rummy Club',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Do you enjoy playing Rummycube, Okey 101, Canasta, Belote or Gin Rummy? You will find that Rummy Club combines best elements of them all and improves upon it. Unlike those other games, Rummy has the right combination of luck, your skills, and intelligence while keeping that magic feel! Rummy Club is the best board game ever made by Ahoy Games, creators of the most popular Turkish board game: Okey.\nRummy Club is an offline, tile-based rummy game, where you can challenge yourself and develop your skills and intellect! Rummy Club allows manipulation of all tiles on the table placed by players, this gives you unlimited move possibilities.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12888,'BiblioMania','2022-06-20','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BiblioMania is a multiplayer 2D platformer where you are a clerk in a cursed library. Work with (or triumph over) up to 3 friends while taking in and renting out books to many clients. But beware the events that happen at the library, they can change everything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4w9s.jpg'),(12889,'Chrono Trigger: Prophet\'s Guile','2007-01-01','Role-playing (RPG)','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uit.jpg'),(12890,'TCG Multiplayer Card Shop Simulator','2025-06-30','Simulator, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Multiplayer TCG Card Shop Simulator game. Dive into the world of multiplayer gaming by opening your own local game store! Stock your shelves with the latest booster packs, or crack them open to collect the cards yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co938s.jpg'),(12891,'Gravity Hop: Space Adventure','2018-10-21','Arcade','Android, iOS','Tap the screen to stop gravity to find your way back home!\nA challenging, fast paced, arcade casual game.\n\nStory:\nYou are the Commander of a spaceship out on a mission in deep space. When the spaceship gets hit, and loses most of its systems, you are left to fend for yourself. With the help of the crew only survivors - Emma and Jim, you embark on a mission to get back home using gravity forces.\n\nFeatures:\n● EASY CONTROLS. One tap mechanics.\n● SKILL GAME. Improve playing skills as you play.\n● CAMPAIGN. Full engrossing story that will gradually introduce you to the Gravity Hop world.\n● CHALLENGES. Challenging levels with increased difficulty.\n● POWER-UPS. Use unique power-ups to overcome hard challenges.\n● UPGRADE your spaceship and power-ups.\n● LOTS OF LEVELS. Play hundreds of levels with more added in regular updates.\n● LEADERBOARDS. Prove who is the best in the world on the global leaderboards.\n● FREE to download! --- Gravity Hop is completely free to play. There are optional in-app purchases available, but not required to rule the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hoe.jpg'),(12892,'LEGO Indiana Jones: The Original Adventures','2008-06-03','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo DS','Build, Battle and Brawl your way out of trouble! Play through all three classic Indiana Jones movies and relive your favorite Indy adventures in the tongue-in-cheek worlds of LEGO. Explore and Discover - Battle enemies, solve puzzles, and seek out the world\'s greatest treasures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4l94.jpg'),(12893,'Star Wars: Battlefront II','2005-10-31','Shooter','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','Star Wars: Battlefront II is the sequel to Star Wars: Battlefront. It is a high-selling Star Wars video game following the many adventures of several characters. The two games are very similar, as both revolve around troopers from various factions fighting in different locales. Battlefront II, however, includes elements and missions from Star Wars: Episode III Revenge of the Sith, as well as enhanced aspects of gameplay including space combat and the ability to play as Jedi characters or other heroes.\n\nWith brand new space combat, playable Jedi characters, and over 16 all new battlefronts, Star Wars Battlefront II gives you more ways than ever before to play the classic Star Wars battles any way you want.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nsg.jpg'),(12894,'Backyard Wrestling 2: There Goes the Neighborhood','2004-11-16','Fighting, Sport','Xbox, PlayStation 2','Backyard Wrestling 2: There Goes the Neighborhood is the second installment in the Backyard Wrestling series and was released on Xbox and PlayStation 2. The licensed soundtrack includes music by Andrew W.K., Kool Keith, the Insane Clown Posse, Bad Brains, Body Count, Six and Violence, Mudvayne, Saliva, Fall Out Boy, and Hoobastank. It was developed by Paradox Development, now owned by Midway Games, and was published by Eidos Interactive.\n\nThe television commercial included Insane Clown Posse, Vampiro, New Jack, and Major Gunns. Despite promises of an improved gameplay experience, the game was a critical flop when released in 2004. Its sales numbers remained respectable, however, moving nearly 300,000 copies through 2005.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9852.jpg'),(12895,'Redneck Kentucky and the Next Generation Chickens','2007-02-02','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Redneck Kentucky and the Next Generation Chickens will introduce into the world of cartoony humor and intense action, giving you an exceptional replayability factor. Players have a great array of weapons at their disposal, they can also collect eggs which are located on the maps and activate special bonuses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ydj.jpg'),(12896,'Lushfoil Photography Sim','2025-04-15','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','An exploration/photography experience set across a vast selection of faithfully detailed landscapes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jno.jpg'),(12897,'Roboom','2024-05-19','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ascend into the Robocon Universe! Roboom is an arena shooter roguelite where you blast through hordes of unique enemies and bosses. Are you ready to face the challenges of the Robocon War and rise to become the best in the Multiverse?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co876g.jpg'),(12898,'Mooh',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An adventure in space through a cow that was abducted and is trying to return home. Explore the planets, solve puzzles, save the mimosas and collect parts to improve the ship that will take Mooh back home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8f4v.jpg'),(12899,'Prince of Persia: The Sands of Time','2003-12-05','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox, PlayStation 3, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Prince of Persia: The Sands of Time is a third-person puzzle-platformer and action-adventure computer and video game published by Ubisoft. It is a reboot of the landmark video game series Prince of Persia created by Jordan Mechner, who served as creative consultant, designer, and scenario writer for The Sands of Time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4t8l.jpg'),(12900,'Buff Studio Bundle',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j8y.jpg'),(12901,'UFC Personal Trainer: The Ultimate Fitness System','2011-07-01','Fighting, Sport','PlayStation 3, Wii, Xbox 360','Only with Kinect for Xbox 360 and UFC Personal Trainer will you experience the same high impact, intense, controller-free work outs as today’s renowned UFC fighters. Full-body tracking allows you to perfect your mixed-martial arts technique through immediate UFC trainer feedback on 70 unique and targeted fighting exercises, including moves from muay thai, wrestling, Brazilian jiu-jitsu and more. Gain advantage with 4 exclusive UFC fighter training partners and 9 additional workout routines, built from the ground up and only available on Kinect for Xbox 360.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22u1.jpg'),(12902,'Gobligeddon','2019-08-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the world of VR games! We are a team of enthusiastic developers who\'ve created a VR game! And it works! For now this is a demo version, but we hope that the game will find a response in hot hearts and shaking hands of gamers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41ca.jpg'),(12903,'Red Hands: 2-Player Game','2021-01-30','Fighting, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Red Hands – 2-Player Game is based on a cool two player game known as \"hot hands\", \"slaps\", \"tap hands\", \"dual hands\" or \"slap jack\". It\'s a fun game for people of all ages who like to play competitive games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5m4x.jpg'),(12904,'Saints Row: The Third - The Full Package','2012-11-06','Shooter, Racing, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Nintendo Switch','Features\n\nFrom the ingenious minds that brought you all those Saints Row games comes the ultimate Saints Row compilation. THQ and Volition, Inc. proudly present Saints Row: The Third – The Full Package.\n\nThis premier edition includes award-winning Saints Row: The Third, all three downloadable mission packs, and more than 30 bonus DLC items. With every weapon, every vehicle, every outfit, go over the top, off the reservation, and to places where no decent game should go. Strap it on, all the way.\n\nINCLUDES MORE THAN $50 IN BONUS CONTENT*\n\nThree mission packs and more than 30 bonus DLC items from such hits as the Shark Attack pack, Witches & Wieners pack, and the Genki Girl Vehicle pack. This is the definitive Saints Row: The Third experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8klz.jpg'),(12905,'The Wild Outback','2024-12-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Wild Outback is an arcade top-down shooter game in a Wild Western setting. It\'s a single player game where you join cowboys in the fight against an alien invasion of mutant animals and lazer-firing robots!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n0q.jpg'),(12906,'Fox Soldier','2022-04-15','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fox Soldier is a 3D shooting action game launched by Yousoi Co.,Ltd. It is specially developed for game consoles and mainframes. It adopts full-view mode. As a warrior of the Queen of the planet of Metis, in order to get the Queen\'s love, you must go through difficult battles, conquer the world, and destroy monsters and...','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12907,'Fret Smasher',NULL,'Music','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A community focused band rhythm game with complete player customization and a wide selection of game modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yoy.jpg'),(12908,'Imperialism II: Age of Exploration','1999-04-01','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','About: The New World lies open before you, ripe for the taking. You must skillfully parlay discovery into riches and gather enough power to dominate Europe’s political landscape. Combining elements of resource management, economic trade, exploration, diplomatic wheeling-and-dealing, and military conquest, Imperialism 2: The Age of Exploration challenges you to leverage New World wealth into Old World dominance. \nTo achieve world domination, you would be wise to employ a web of intricate strategies and plans within plans. If diplomacy is the order of the day, dispatch envoys to nurture critical trade agreements and treaties while deploying spies to sabotage your enemies. If you grow tired of the intrigues and double-crossings that are part and parcel of the diplomatic way, build a mighty war machine with an unquenchable thirst for conquest. Skillfully maneuver your nation and don’t forget: the object is to unite all of Europe under one flag - YOURS!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co202q.jpg'),(12909,'Nathan Morgan: Dilemma','2024-02-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nathan Morgan: Dilemma is a single-player detective game. Detective Nathan Morgan, stationed in the state, is assigned to follow the trail of the mysterious murder at the Bennett mansion. Our goal is to find the killer by making use of the clues.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80ni.jpg'),(12910,'Ahnayro: The Dream World','2016-12-01','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ahnayro is a historically focused, narrative driven puzzle game exploring the world of dreams. You play as a person gifted with the ability to look beyond the veil of reality, investigating a universe that opens up to you every night; haunting you, beckoning you to solve the mysteries within.\n\nYet you are not in control of this world; you are at the mercy of mysterious individuals, who flow in and out of your mind. Your only hope of gaining control over this world is to piece together your fragmented visions and confront your tormentors.\n\nAs any dream, however, this new reality is structured on the waking world, and understanding one necessitates understanding the other.\n\nThe dream world reveals itself in fragments. It is up to you to piece together information and discover the hidden meaning behind them. Through a series of research and logic-based puzzles which challenge your knowledge of real world historical events, figures, art and mythology, you will slowly uncover the identities of those who speak to you in your dreams.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2peh.jpg'),(12911,'Assassin\'s Creed III: Limited Edition','2012-12-31','Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','The Limited Edition contains:\n\n- Assassin\'s Creed III (base game)\n- George Washington\'s notebook\n- A 9 inch statue of Connor\n- Assassin\'s Creed-inspired colonial flag\n- A metal belt buckle','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2num.jpg'),(12912,'Earth Defense Force','2015-05-21','Shooter','Arcade, Satellaview, Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Wii, iOS, Wii U, Nintendo Switch, Super Famicom','An evil organization, named AGYMA, threatens the 200 years of peace the galaxy has enjoyed. It was released for the SNES and also as a view-limited downloadable game for the Satellaview that was broadcast in at least 3 runs between August 31, 1997 and February 28, 1998. The \"E.D.F.\" from the game\'s title is an acronym for \"Earth Defense Force,\" however the official name of the game employs the acronym and not the full expression.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v28.jpg'),(12913,'The Viewer\'s Game',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12914,'Beatcraft Cyclon','2014-08-11','Music','Arcade','The first series of the Beatcraft brand, a rhythm game developed by Nurijoy in 2014.\n\nOn May 6, 2014, it was released under the working title of \"Project736T\", and on May 29, the original project name, \"Beatcraft Cyclon\", was revealed.\n\nParticipating composers were NieN, Paul Bazooka, Mr. Funky, ND Lee, PlanetBoom, Electronic Boutique, 3rd Coast, Makou, Nauts, and other artists who had previously submitted songs to the DJMAX series. Also, Takahiro Eguchi, a composer and BMS producer belonging to Super Sweep/Nano Sounds, participated as a new artist. According to the phrase \'ARCADE THE FIRST\' in the PV, it was first released as an arcade. However, due to the failure of the game, it is unknown whether the Beatcraft brand will continue to other models.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61nc.jpg'),(12915,'Depths of Fear: Knossos','2014-10-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Depths of Fear :: Knossos is a Greek-themed 1st person adventure game with stealth, action and edge-of-your-seat elements within rogue-like procedurally generated levels. You will run. You will hide. You will fight. You will die.\n\nThe fate of Athens is in your hands as you step into the role of legendary Greek hero Theseus. Offering yourself for tribute unto the corrupt King Minos, you embark upon a perilous quest deep beneath the city of Knossos to slay the twisted mythical beast - The Minotaur. But, before you can complete this hero\'s journey you must steadfast the trials of ever-changing creature-filled labyrinths. Collect gold to deal with Daedalus, building up your armory whilst seeking out the mythological medallions that unlock a master sword, the only weapon known that can pierce the Minotaur\'s cursed flesh. May the gods of Greece be with you, son of Poseidon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pwk.jpg'),(12916,'SilenGames Bundle 2024','2024-12-27','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eer.jpg'),(12917,'A Step Into Darkness','2017-08-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Step Into Darkness is a indie horror game in which you play as a journalist desperate to redeem himself after he makes the biggest mistake of his life.\n\nYou are sent on a mission to the woodlands to find and document the most mysterious of creatures.\n\nA Step Into Darkness Episode One is an introduction to the series of three and is free to play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29e2.jpg'),(12918,'Dungeon Construction Co.',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12919,'The Valley: XuGu',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12920,'Tiger Fighter 1931: Tora!Tora!','2019-08-13','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a shoot em up game. In this game the player combats a large number of enemies by shooting at them, the game is set in the Chinese People\'s War of Resistance against Japanese Aggression, off the air of the North Eastern Province.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3jlv.jpg'),(12921,'Min-Mins','2019-11-01','Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','Assemble a team of min-mins to battle from enemy teams. Unlock prizes summon stronger min-mins to create an unstoppable army! \n \nGameplay \nOver 80 units available \n5 different types of units provides team building strategy \nUnits gain exp through battle to increase their power \n \nCommunity \nThe Global Gift Box is a system that rewards everyone as the support for the game increases. \n \nPvP \nPlayer ratings separate the casual players from the veterans. We have included 6 arenas to ensure challenging battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co288i.jpg'),(12922,'Dungeons & Dragons Online: Shadowfell Conspiracy','2013-08-19','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An unnatural darkness looms over the prison city of Wheloon as shadows spread across the land. Uncover the sinister Shar plot threatening to destroy Cormyr from within, and face the full might of the Empire of Netheril.\n\nTwo New Forgotten Realms Adventure Packs: Wheloon City and The Stormhorns\nWheloon City: Take to the sprawling city streets and rooftops of Wheloon as you hunt down Netherese agents seeking to forge an army. A shadowy maze where even the Purple Dragon Knights will not tread, the public area and new dungeons of this prison city will put you to the test!\n\nThe Stormhorns: Journey to the breathtaking and treacherous Stormhorn Mountains where, beneath the natural beauty, hides a dark alliance that threatens all of Cormyr. Explore a massive, new wilderness area as you ascend the towering peaks and confront the agents of shadow!\n\nPurple Dragon Knight Iconic Hero:\nThese unique characters start in Forgotten Realms at level 15 and feature exclusive skills and appearances.\n\nEpic Level to 28: Raise your character to new heights of power with a host of new epic spells and feats! Free to all players\n\nSkill Tomes: New Skill Tomes offer an inherent bonus of +1, 2, or 3 points to your trainable Skill of Choice! Stacks with other in-game bonuses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21kh.jpg'),(12923,'Mr. Slime in Dungeon','2024-12-13','Platform','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A 2D side-scrolling adventure. Run, jump, and slide as you explore dungeons, collect coins, and unlock the portal chest to advance to the next stage. Help Mr. Slime achieves his goal of becoming the richest slime in the dungeon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a5x.jpg'),(12924,'American Truck Simulator: Kansas','2023-11-30','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Introducing Kansas! A U.S State that is home to a truly authentic cowboy culture and miles of land littered with wildflowers. Located in the Midwest of the USA, Kansas is known for its native grasslands, streams, abundant blue skies, and green grassland vistas.\n\nOnce considered to be the country’s agricultural heartland, \"The Sunflower State\" has managed to attract many large businesses and develop in other industrial areas due to its central location and convenient infrastructure for logistics operations. But, as the nickname suggests, nature is certainly doing very well to keep up with technological progress, as the state parks and vast prairies offer unique views with a marvelous atmosphere that will leave every trucker passing by with something to remember.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7j9k.jpg'),(12925,'Bridge','2025-04-07','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A very difficult bridge crossing simulator','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nvh.jpg'),(12926,'Prison Architect: Xbox One Edition','2016-07-01','Simulator, Strategy','Xbox One','Take control of the building and running of a maximum security prison as the critically acclaimed lock-em-up arrives on Xbox One! Will you build and manage a prison to create social order where it’s failed in the past, offering rehabilitation and peaceful coexistence amongst inmates? Will your prison disregard human rights, impose intentional harshness and be devoid of any notions of wellbeing and freedom? The choice is yours.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zfo7comyeyfmdzetjelc.jpg'),(12927,'Dad Hungry!','2025-01-16','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re stuck on the island of hunger, and you need to find all the food to escape. However, you come to realize that you\'re not the only one who\'s hungry…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pj5.jpg'),(12928,'The Moon Looks Beautiful Tonight','2023-07-20','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A game about fear of the unknown.\n\nA year ago, the Moon was sent violently flying off course by a catastrophic explosion, depriving Earth of its steady stream of resources. Less importantly, the two maintenance workers on there when the explosion occurred have been stranded ever since.\n\nIt\'s not so bad, honestly. The Heart provides for everything, a practically infinite source that gives them water, food, and powers their satellite as they wait with ever dwindling hopes for rescue. Really, it\'s boring, but there\'s no reason to stress out so long as-\n\nThe Heart has stopped.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6syg.jpg'),(12929,'Missileman Origins','2017-02-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Missileman Origins is a retro-esque action-platformer set in a world where robots and humans co-exist as civilians. Missileman himself is a humble bot that wishes he could, one day, become a hero. He knows he has the potential to be one, but it\'s never fully realized just how capable he would be.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12930,'The Chess Variants Club','2020-12-16','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play and discover 12 popular chess variants, improve your chess skills with hundreds of chess puzzles, or simply play regular chess with your friends - all in one package. This diverse collection includes several chess games and puzzles. All in a minimalist, beautifully designed virtual chess club.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mz5.jpg'),(12931,'World Series Baseball \'95','1995-04-01','Sport','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Sega Game Gear','700 MAJOR LEAGUE PLAYERS\nINCLUDING SANDERS, BONDS, BELLE, GWYNN, BAGWELL, PIAZZA, MCGRIFF, AND PUCKETT.\n\n-Improved sound effects, music, and announcers put you in the ballpark.\n-32 bit technology allows for a gradual zoom to the outfield, for better views of players making diving catches, and climbing the walls to rob home runs.\n-The power of 32X allows for enhanced colors of all stadiums and logos.\n-Put together the greatest team in history with 50 all time great Legend players.\n-Multi-player option allows you and your friends to battle it out!\n-Mid-season All-Star game with your season\'s best players.\n-Track stats for individuals, teams and league leaders.\n-Play in Exhibition, Full Season, and Playoff modes plus 2 Home Run Derby Modes.\n-Draft and Trade players to create your own dream squad.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5km1.jpg'),(12932,'The Outlast Trials: Deluxe Edition','2024-03-05','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Experience the mind-numbing horror of Outlast, this time with friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7uih.jpg'),(12933,'Assassin\'s Creed: Origins - Gold Edition','2017-10-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Assassin’s Creed: Origins is a new beginning. Take on epic enemies with a whole new combat system. Explore the Great Pyramids and hidden tombs across the country of Ancient Egypt. Experience visceral quests that contribute to your overall progression and discover the origin story of the Assassin’s Brotherhood.\n\nGold Edition includes game + Deluxe Edition content + Season Pass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23ob.jpg'),(12934,'Battlezone','1983-12-31','Shooter','Atari 2600, Atari 5200','A Port of Battlezone for the Atari 2600.\n\nCommonly considered the earliest progenitor of first-person shooters (FPS), Battlezone is a 3D tank game initially released in the arcades, and later converted officially to many systems. Earth has been invaded, and you and your tank lead the defensive effort. You drive around the battlefield from a first-person view, targeting and firing at tanks, planes and UFOs. You have a radar to help you see where the enemies are in direction and distance. Objects can be used as strategic cover.\n\nControls simulate the tracks of a tank realistically, so the direction and speed settings are varied - combining forward right and backward left movements (as you can on keyboard versions) sees you change direction more quickly. A standard enemy tank is worth 1,000 points when destroyed; a supertank is worth 3,000 points; and the flying saucer is worth 5,000 points. The guided missile is worth 2,000 points when destroyed. Each of these targets can be destroyed with a single shot from the player\'s tank. One bonus tank (a bonus \"life\" or \"man\") is awarded when the player\'s score reaches 15,000 points; an additional tank is then awarded at 100,000 points. The player can hide behind the solids or maneuver in rapid turns once fired on to buy time with which to fire himself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90mx.jpg'),(12935,'The Ritual',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12936,'The Story Is You: Look Within',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12937,'The Way Down',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12938,'Earth Defense Force 2 for Nintendo Switch','2021-07-15','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83sa.jpg'),(12939,'From the Abyss','2008-01-17','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo DS','Developed by Sonic Powered, From the Abyss allows players to explore the vast world of Rubenhaut through a unique world creation engine exclusively created for From The Abyss. The game also features an intuitive control scheme, lavish artwork, and an engaging 2 player co-op battle system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92bd.jpg'),(12940,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization V: Civ and Scenario Double Pack - Spain and Inca','2010-12-16','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scenario Description: The year is 1492. To the courts of England, France, and Spain come intrepid explorers, anxious to voyage across the Atlantic in search of a western route to China and the Indies. Will they found a new trade route and uncover untold riches from the Asian shores?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85v2.jpg'),(12941,'Cross Channel','2018-03-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Set in Gunjo Gakuin, a school specialized for those deemed by the government to be unfit for society, Cross Channel follows the story of eight members of the school\'s Broadcasting Club who have just returned from a disastrous field trip, which throws their club and their friendships into turmoil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3skj.jpg'),(12942,'DokiSui: Doki-doki Suikoden','2011-05-12','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','\"Doki Doki Suikoden\'\' is a simulation game released by IREM Software Engineering (IREM) for the PlayStation Portable (PSP) on May 12, 2011 . Irem\'s abbreviation is `` Dokisui \'\', and the title logo of the work is a large drawing of these four letters and a matching umbrella .','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fsv.jpg'),(12943,'Madou Monogatari III: Kyuukyoku Joou-sama','1994-12-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sega Game Gear','Madou Monogatari III: Kyuukyoku Joou-sama is a Sega Game Gear sequel to Madou Monogatari II: Arle 16-Sai.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wj1.jpg'),(12944,'Eternal Exodus',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A monster-catching RPG set in the afterlife. Catch and fuse 150 unique demons as you journey to conquer Hell itself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qe3.jpg'),(12945,'Assassin\'s Creed: Syndicate - Gold Edition','2015-10-23','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','London, 1868. The Industrial Revolution unleashes an age of invention, transforming the lives of millions with technologies once thought impossible. But industrialization only fattens the purses of a privileged few, while workers struggle to survive in the factories that make London the beating heart of the global economy— until an Assassin rallies to their defense, sparking an epic conflict that will echo throughout history. Create the world’s first organized crime family. Conquer the streets of London. Bring the ruling class to their knees. And rise to lead the London underworld in a visceral adventure unlike anything you\'ve played before.\n\nGold Edition includes game and Season Pass- featuring a major expansion plus digital content and exclusives.\n\nSeason Pass included:\n10 hours of extra gameplay: Jack the Ripper campaign, the Last Maharaja mission pack, \"A Long Night\" exclusive mission, the Streets of London gameplay pack, new gears, weapons, a permanent xp boost and 500 Helix Credits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4lgq.jpg'),(12946,'Pursuit of the Pink Panther',NULL,'Arcade','Atari 2600','Pursuit of the Pink Panther was based off the famous cartoon series and inspired by the Pink Panther movies starring Peter Sellers as inspector Clouseau. This game actually started out life as Trail of the Pink Panther by U.S. Games (based on the then current movie), but when U.S. Games went out of business they sold the rights to North American Phillips (NAP) who decided to release their own version of the game through their Probe 2000 division. It is unknown if any work was already done on the U.S. Games version or if any of those ideas were used in the Probe 2000 version of the game. Although Pursuit of the Pink Panther was heavily marketed at the June 1983 CES, it was never released, most probably because the special RAM/ROM chip that NAP used to squeeze all the graphics and gameplay elements into the game couldn\'t be reliably manufactured. When the first batch of chips came back defective from the manufacturer NAP decided to cancel the game rather than try and find a new source for the chips. The crumbling game market at the time was also a big factor in choosing not to go forward. Description: \'Players control the Pink Panther as he sneakily makes his way through several screens, attempting to outwit the Inspector. For his final challenge, he must dangle from a swinging rope, steal the famous Pink Panther diamond and escape unnoticed.\'','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mos.jpg'),(12947,'Senran Kagura Reflexions','2019-06-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Can you feel it? The beating of her heart... In a classroom after school, learn the ways of \"reflexology\" by syncing with her heart and body. In SENRAN KAGURA Reflexions, interact with your favorite shinobi heroine like never before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m7k.jpg'),(12948,'Wanaka Farm',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Players are randomly assigned when starting the game, players can renovate, decorate and exchange with others. The NFT exchange market is the harvested items including farm, items, seeds, crops, livestock. Players will choose to buy seeds or pets or both to grow on their farm according to their preferences or the suitability of the environment they have for each species. Players can go to the market to buy decorative items and expand their farm. Players can combine seeds and pets to create new breeds according to their parents\' genes. Harvested products from the farm will be owned by players in the form of digital assets on cyberspace or NFT tokens on blockchain.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12949,'World War Zero','2002-10-25','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The World War began in August 1914. It is now March 1964, and war still wages on. The Russian October Revolution has taken place, but the Bolsheviks were crushed by the mad Baron Ugenberg. He plans to build a huge Russo-Mongolian empire that stretches from the Atlantic to Vladivostok, crushing any opposition in his wake.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nex.jpg'),(12950,'Path of Exile Mobile',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Android, iOS','A mobile iteration of Path of Exile currently in development. \n \n\"...an experimental version of Path of Exile for mobile devices. Path of Exile\'s Atlas Map system is actually perfect for bite-sized action gameplay. This is a complete Path of Exile game experience with no pay-to-win elements and is being developed in-house at Grinding Gear Games.\" \n \nThe game\'s demo, shown at Exilecon 2019, has a gameplay loop based on the endgame map system used in Path of Exile with smaller maps for quick gameplay sessions. \nThe UI was redone with the health and mana orbs being combined in one corner, 4 skills shown in one corner with 4 more available from a touch and swipe menu. \nSkills in the game use the planned 4.0 system with a separate menu screen for active gems that can have up to 4 gem sockets.  \nInventory was redesigned with equipment, currency items and maps split to different inventory menus automatically when picked up and items can be picked up anywhere on screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tcg.jpg'),(12951,'Strike Force Heroes 3','2015-06-26','Shooter, Platform','Web browser','60 missions, customizable weapons, and squads await in the massive Strike Force Heroes sequel you\'ve been waiting for!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g95.jpg'),(12952,'6 AM at The Chum Bucket','2018-07-01','Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After quitting his job, Squidward decides to work at The Chum Bucket, but things go horribly wrong at 6 AM...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m7k.jpg'),(12953,'Raging Blasters','2021-01-22','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Raging Blasters is a vertical scroll shmup featuring high speed scrolling and the exhilaration of destruction.\n\nYou have been selected to undertake a top secret mission. Your mission is to destroy the enemy targets. Good luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2omn.jpg'),(12954,'Combines.io',NULL,'Arcade','Web browser','Try to be the leader of the match and make other combines crash in order to pick up all their harvest and increase your score. The more you collect, the larger you will become, so keep going until you have become a huge truck that destroys everyone else. Complete achievements and have fun playing Combines.io!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12955,'Black & White Bushido','2017-05-17','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Things are rarely ever black and white, but that’s not the case in Black & White Bushido. With an original soundtrack and gorgeous, stylistic 2D visuals, you’re either a light or shadow samurai facing down your opponents in a combat arena. The black and white style makes each battlefield a dangerous place, filled with hiding spots for four players to fight and hide in. It’s a simple concept boiled down to an infinitely replayable set of team death match or Capture the Flag sessions. \n \nBlack & White Bushido is an arena fighting game between light and shadow samurai.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22yu.jpg'),(12956,'Tropico 3','2009-10-20','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','The time is yesterday and the Cold War is in full swing. Through means devious and dubious you have seized power in the Caribbean island country of Tropico, where you now rule as the all-powerful \"El Presidente\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hl0.jpg'),(12957,'Shikigami',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','In the capital during the Heian era, there was a onmyouji named Douman who doesn’t fare too well in his studies. However, the talented noblewoman Michinaga told him that everyone is unique and he should be himself. Because of this, he continued to study hard and vowed to protect her. The most powerful onmyouji Senmei told him that he is useless and is just a burden to everyone else in the world, and end up taking Michinaga away from him. He devised a stupid plan to oppose her, but how can the weakest guy like him defeat a genius like her? On top of that, suspected of planning an assassination against Michinaga, he was driven from the city. Now alone except for with Michinaga’s cousin Akimitsu, who is just as dumb as he is, how will he be able to gain revenge against Senmei?\n\nThis is an SLG using actual figures such as the protagonist Ashiya Douman and Abeno Senmei (although now female). Of course the setting is a bit different being in a girl’s school, and there’s robots and stuff as well. During the ADV parts, you can sneak in as a girl to gain intelligence, or go and equip yourself for the battles during the SLG part. A jankenpon system similar to Koihime is used although onmyouji attacks trump all 3 types (infantry, spearmen and archers). There are light and dark elements which also modify damage, and there are area elements as well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48hh.jpg'),(12958,'MX Bikes',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Sport','Sin plataforma','MX Bikes is a realistic motocross simulator, based on a scratch built physics engine that accurately simulates motorcycle dynamics and setup options.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qrb.jpg'),(12959,'Tails of Iron 2: Whiskers of Winter - Deluxe Edition','2025-01-28','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Prepare for the chilling clash against the Dark Wings with the Tails of Iron 2: Whiskers of Winter Deluxe Edition, combining the brutal action-RPG base game with both the ‘Augur of the Draugr\' armour and weapon pack and ‘Hair to the Throne\' cosmetic DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e49.jpg'),(12960,'Hashire Hebereke','1994-12-22','Racing','Super Famicom','An isometric on-foot racing game featuring SunSoft\'s Hebereke/Ufouria characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b31.jpg'),(12961,'The Guild 2: Platinium Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12962,'Dragon Age: Inquisition - Game of the Year Edition','2015-10-06','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Dragon Age: Inquisition – Game of the Year Edition includes every piece of downloadable content made available since launch. It includes:\nEvery DLC – This edition includes all the story and gameplay DLC content ever released, including Jaws of Hakkon, The Descent, and the recently released epilogue, Trespasser.\nAll Official Add-Ons – Customize your inquisition further with specialized gear, legendary weapons, diverse mounts, and unique elements from every official add-on including: Spoils of the Avvar, Spoils of the Qunari, and the Deluxe Edition upgrades.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mw0.jpg'),(12963,'Ice Age: Dawn of the Dinosaurs','2009-06-30','Platform','PlayStation 3, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Based on the computer-animated movie starring the voices of Ray Romano and John Leguizamo, Ice Age: Dawn of the Dinosaurs is a 3D platform game that has you controlling multiple prehistoric protagonists across more than 15 levels of lighthearted action. Help Manny, Sid, Diego, Scrat, and friends navigate their way through the lush jungles of a world lurking underneath the ice: a tropical world inhabited by dinosaurs. Master each character\'s distinct moves while exploring caves, riding a pterodactyl, avoiding a rampaging Tyrannosaurus rex, running atop a ball of ice, and more. Those having difficulty during certain sequences can receive tips from woolly mammoth Ellie as well as possums Crash and Eddie. In addition to the single-player campaign, Ice Age 2 offers eight competitive mini-games supporting up to four players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ddn.jpg'),(12964,'Green Hawk Down',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Green Hawk Down is an action-packed, multi-player FPS that allows you to fight in the smallest army in the world! Team up with other plastic toy soldiers and wage war against other teams for control of the kitchen, bedroom or back yard!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5duq.jpg'),(12965,'Taqoban','2022-03-25','Puzzle, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Play as Tao and Xiang, two pandas, and help them to organize their boxes as efficiently as possible to earn a maximum of bamboos!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ojc.jpg'),(12966,'Space Tail: Every Journey Leads Home - Ultimate Edition','2023-03-09','Platform','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Space Tail is a 2.5D adventure platformer, which immerses the player in a deep, emotional plot, and lets him explore new planets and interact with alien civilizations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69po.jpg'),(12967,'Aron\'s Adventure','2021-04-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aron\'s Adventure is an Action Adventure RPG that takes place in a fantasy world called Elor. An ancient evil re-awakens and the fate of the land is thrown into Aron\'s hands. Aron will have to unite the people all while learning how to use his new abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xap.jpg'),(12968,'The Unwanted War',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Fight battles through human history, defeat your enemies and save humanities future! The Unwanted War lets you follow history itself and take influence on humanities ultimate fate. Are you going to use your knowledge and power for good or will you bring doom over the human race?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ojc.jpg'),(12969,'Zup! F','2019-12-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Minimal physical puzzle with explosions','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i01.jpg'),(12970,'No Heroes Allowed: No Puzzles Either!','2019-08-06','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','HEROES… WELCOME TO YOUR DOOM\nAs the all-powerful God of Destruction, you must quickly move falling tiles to match three or more identical icons – which will then summon a pack of deadly monsters hungry for juicy hero flesh.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ijf.jpg'),(12971,'Car for Sale Simulator 2023: Car Mechanic, Wash, Car Flipper','2023-10-24','Racing, Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Step into the fast-paced world of automotive entrepreneurship with Car for Sale!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c8p.jpg'),(12972,'Dracula 4: The Shadow of the Dragon','2013-06-18','Point-and-click, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A cargo ship carrying a valuable collection of artwork for the Metropolitan Museum of Art sinks. A few months later, one of the paintings resurfaces in Hungary.\n\nThe Museum sends the art restorer Ellen Cross to authenticate the painting. She would never have guessed that this mission would take her all across Europe, on the trail of the portrait of the famous prince of Wallachia, Vlad Tepes.\n\nThe young woman is afflicted with a serious illness. From Budapest to Istanbul, she follows the trail of the painting and plunges into a conflict between the first vampire and the \"Shadow of the Dragon\"—a secret order which dreams of producing a new lineage of creatures, free from Dracula\'s grasp.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22p0.jpg'),(12973,'Magicka: Marshlands','2011-04-26','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Left for dead, your party is faced with the terrible hordes of the undead and some of their friends. This challenge contains a large area for the players to move around and plenty of room for the hordes to really spread out and surround you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fts.jpg'),(12974,'Tricky and the Dream Caster',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tricky and the Dream Caster is a movement-centered collectathon that aesthetically takes after Sega\'s ill-fated final home console. Control Tricky O\'Possum and his new morally ambiguous pal Volt as they traverse the astral plane to break free of Dream Caster\'s curse!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t3v.jpg'),(12975,'Masonic Mysteries: Secrets Unveiled','2024-04-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unravel the secrets of the Masons and survive FBI\'s pursuit in The Cult Of Masons. High stakes and hidden dangers await.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90e7.jpg'),(12976,'Cabela\'s Big Game Hunter 2008','2007-11-13','Shooter, Sport, Adventure','Wii, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Cabela\'s Big Game Hunter is the first video game to be published in the Big Game Hunter series. It portrays a variety of hunting scenarios and has a variety of weapons, characters, animals, and locations.\n\nThe game was published by HeadGames Publishing, in conjunction with hunting supply company Cabela\'','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pvk.jpg'),(12977,'Carbox',NULL,'Racing, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build Share Race\n\nCarbox is a sandbox Driving game.\nWith its easy-to-use editor, you can create customized maps and circuits to explore and race.\nBuild your own city, share it with the world, and race in an ever-expanding library of community generated maps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8v3k.jpg'),(12978,'Chiller',NULL,'Shooter','Nintendo Entertainment System','Chiller is an unofficial game developed by American Game Cartridges for the Nintendo Entertainment System. The game is based upon a notorious arcade shooter by Exidy. It was also released in Australia by Home Entertainment Suppliers.\n\nThe game is cited as one of the most violent games ever made for the Nintendo Entertainment System, let alone the 1980s video game medium. Despite being an unlicensed port, the game followed several official examples by being censored with some nudity covered up.\n\nIn the game, you are in various medieval settings, usually featuring innocent people restrained in torture devices. The gruesome motive is to kill every NPC in as little time as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fbk.jpg'),(12979,'Shrek Extra Large','2002-10-31','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo GameCube','Shrek: Extra Large is packed with 10 levels, twisted fairy tale characters, cutscenes, and action-packed gameplay. Play as your favorite characters from the movie Shrek or as new fairy tale characters. In order to rescue Princess Fiona, you must explore 10 different fairy tale lands and compete in more than 50 missions. Your character can perform a variety of power moves such as punch, kick, grab, super-flatulance, and belch. When you\'re not in combat, you can watch 15 brand-new cutscenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pef.jpg'),(12980,'Championship Manager 2010 Special Edition','2009-09-11','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Championship Manager 2010 Special Edition is an updated version of the popular football management simulation game, Championship Manager 2010. It includes the full game along with additional content.\n\nThe Special Edition features extras such as\n- Manager\'s Notepad\n- Championship Manager pencil\n- Large Poster showcasing the structures of over thirty national leagues.\n- Additionally, it offers a subscription-based CM Live service that provides six updates during the football season, allowing players to manage their teams in real-time as the season progresses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94m8.jpg'),(12981,'Gunslinger Duel',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Engage in turn-based quick draw battles against increasingly formidable opponents. Choose your next move, then in third person, draw and fire before your opponent does! An arcade-style strategy game in the Wild West. Are you a real gunslinger survivor, or another yellow-belly about to hit the dirt?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76je.jpg'),(12982,'Dying Light: Snow Ops Bundle','2021-12-16','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Level up selected skill trees faster with the special outfit, and use the new grenade launcher to freeze your enemies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qg7.jpg'),(12983,'Kirby\'s Halloween Adventure','2020-10-01','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','An all-new romhack of Kirby\'s Adventure! A level modification romhack that changes all the different levels into brand spookier zones. Features plenty of brand new tilesets with new level themes (Graveyard, Wild West, Art Gallery, Circus, Temple, Volcano, Factory, etc) combined in a brand new experience!\n\nFeature multiple reskinned enemies to match the Halloween setting, including multiple variations per enemy! (Example: Bronto Burts can be Booler ghosts, Flapper bats, be Mumbies, etc), and plenty of other surprises you shall see!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gby.jpg'),(12984,'Walkabout Mini Golf: Journey to the Center of the Earth','2023-06-08','Sport, Indie','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR, Oculus Quest','A new course themed after the Jules Verne story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kn8.jpg'),(12985,'Slayer\'s Testament','2016-03-16','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Quake 1 mod designed to recreate the experience of Doom 2016 within the Quake engine','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qjd.jpg'),(12986,'The Stairway','2024-11-09','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 3D parkour game through the memories of a life. The goal is to reach the top, sometimes the way forward is not obvious.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n0y.jpg'),(12987,'Boing Odyssey','2024-02-13','Puzzle','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embrace your creative side and build with an array of physics bending tools to solve puzzles, or create and share your own!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kn5.jpg'),(12988,'Mega Snake','2023-07-22','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get bigger, but not all at once! You can also grow bigger. Aim for your goals, seize your opportunities, because time and failure can become your enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tn6.jpg'),(12989,'Grotoro','2018-06-12','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','GROTORO is a multiplayer couch space globular fatty nervous farting bull brawl in space.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12990,'The First Valentine','2025-02-14','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fky.jpg'),(12991,'Sky Journey: Jigsaw Landscapes','2020-11-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Discover peace in a calm Jigsaw Journey about finding a lost friend, trhough gorgeus landscapes. What happens when you set the last piece?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41m6.jpg'),(12992,'Jetbot',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12993,'Deadlock II: Shrine Wars','2014-10-23','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deadlock II: Shrine Wars is an exciting game of strategy, resource management and military conquest. Each race has its own strengths and weaknesses - learn to exploit them to your advantage. Build, trade, research, attack, as you search for the ancient knowledge that will grant you ultimate control over the entire Universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hfg.jpg'),(12994,'Dart Rage','2010-04-01','Sport','Wii','Prepare for the ultimate game of darts. Dart Rage is the most accurate and realistic dart game on the Wii console!\nGrab your Wii Remote controller and prepare for the ultimate game of darts on your Wii console! Dart Rage features the most realistic throwing system available today. You’ll never get closer to throwing an actual dart in any video game. With pixel perfect accuracy and no buttons to push, you’ll be completely immersed in the game’s realism. Dart Rage puts you in the spot light as you compete against friends, the computer, or both. With four great games to choose from including: 301-901, Cricket, Poker, & American (Baseball) darts; Dart Rage has plenty of options to keep the game fresh. There is also a VS mode, where you can compete at the same time in a race to the finish. Rock out to the sizzling soundtrack with a commentator announcing your every shot or miss.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q2m.jpg'),(12995,'The Prison',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12996,'Hidden Collection 2 HD - Fun Seek and Find Hidden Object Puzzles',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(12997,'Luigi Puzzle','2006-01-30','Puzzle','Game Boy Advance','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qy6.jpg'),(12998,'ForeVR Darts','2021-12-16','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Meta Quest 2, Oculus Quest','Experience Oculus’ latest Hand Tracking technology in the perfect game to play with your hands: darts! Stock your arsenal with a selection of 50+ uniquely weighted darts with custom effects and attributes, featuring a range of classic designs and fantastical flights. Explore 3 immersive darts halls and choose from 1000s of songs on the jukebox or stay tuned into each hall’s curated playlist. Get competitive with Double Out (501, 301) in public multiplayer or keep it casual with 501, 301, 201, and 101 modes in Single Player, Pass-and-Play, or a Private room with friends. Create or join public or private multiplayer rooms to face off against players all around the world. Create private multiplayer rooms to play against friends and family online or use Pass-and-Play to play with one headset locally. Prefer to play solo? Challenge in-game pro NPCs to hone your skills and level up. ForeVR Darts gets players’ hands-on VR like no other sports game can!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4aiq.jpg'),(12999,'Possessions',NULL,'Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Imagine a room where a TV seems to be sitting on a table. But when you look at it\nfrom another angle, it appears to be floating in mid-air. Magic? No. Perspective? Yes.\n\nWelcome to a world where your eyes deceive you every day. Welcome to the world of Possessions - a minimalist 3D puzzle game about perspective and spatial awareness.\nIn Possessions, you will look at various objects from different angles until they appear to be in their right place, all while learning the story of a family inhabiting the house.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ari.jpg'),(13000,'Pretty Sweet! Healing Guardian',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Fulfill your dream of becoming a magical girl! In this tiny management sim you will be in charge of the citizens’ well-being in this cozy town. Balance their emotions with candy magic, manage your sugary stock, upgrade your powers, customize your appearance and raise everybody\'s quality of life!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8q7z.jpg'),(13001,'Dustforce DX','2014-10-23','Platform, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Clean up the world with style! As an acrobatic janitor, you are an adept force against dust and disorder. Leap and dash off walls and ceilings, and deftly traverse precarious environments. Cleanse each level swiftly and thoroughly to achieve mastery in this 2D sweep-\'em-up platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oxt.jpg'),(13002,'DuskBreakers','2021-12-21','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DuskBreakers is a sci-fi inspired metaverse and gaming experience powered by blockchain. The choices we make collectively will irrevocably change the course of history across an exciting new alternate universe, unfolding across NFTs, comics, animations, and play-and-earn video games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k7x.jpg'),(13003,'Jetpack Joyride 2','2021-04-30','Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','Android, iOS, Mac','Barry returns in a frantic adventure. In this case, he will have new equipment and weapons to fight new enemies and make his way through the laboratory to stop the scientists\' experiments before it is too late. The evolved adventure of Jetpack Joyride with new HD graphics, new animations, new mechanics and a new way of playing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co519l.jpg'),(13004,'Safari Pinball','2019-10-18','Simulator, Pinball, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Get ready for Safari Pinball, a pinball machine where you\'ll try to photograph and record many animals through a Africa. Elephants, Lions, Zebras, and many more are waiting for you on this table.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ark.jpg'),(13005,'Lunar Resilience',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Lunar Resilience – Survive the werewolves, build your fortress, craft items and weaponry, hunt animals, feed yourself, hydrate yourself and stay resilient.Explore and uncover the island’s mysteries. If you\'re afraid to go alone, feel free to invite your friends to go with you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89cx.jpg'),(13006,'Bussy Master: Firefuckers','2024-09-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the fiery world of Bussy Master: Firefuckers! Unravel sexy puzzle challenges featuring scorching firefighters in dangerous, passion-filled scenarios. Unlock the allure of 60+ firemen, immerse in stunning visuals, and let the heat of desire ignite your passion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mfr.jpg'),(13007,'Cursed Companions',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Co-op horror with voice activation where the game listens to what everyone is saying. Say the right words to save friends, but the wrong words bring chaos, death and laughs. Explore procedurally generated dungeons, seek treasure, and try to survive the mayhem.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k28.jpg'),(13008,'Mega Man X Innocent Impulse',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mega Man X Innocent Impulse is a story-rich open-world Mega Man X fangame in active development. Featuring an enhanced 8-bit graphical style and soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f4g.jpg'),(13009,'SnakeBird NES','2021-03-12','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Web browser','A fan made HTML5 re-imagining of Snakebird if it were for the NES gaming platform.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vob.jpg'),(13010,'Aquarium at August 32nd','2024-08-29','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aquarium at August 32nd is a short walking simulator game inspired by the well-known horror simulator Exit 8. In this game, players explore a spooky aquarium filled with anomalies and must find a way to exit by identifying these differences.\n\nThe rule of Aquarium at August 32nd is simple: turn back if there is an anomaly, or go forward if there is none. The game is completed when the number of jellyfish in the tank reaches eight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d58.jpg'),(13011,'Ryder','2025-09-30','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A vibrant creature-collecting puzzle adventure. Play as over 60 creatures, each with unique traits, to solve more than 100 puzzles across four colorful regions. Explore a lively, low-poly world, complete your bestiary, and ascend the Sanguine Mountain to fulfill your destiny as a Ryder.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pgl.jpg'),(13012,'Mario Golf: Azalea','1999-08-10','Sport','Nintendo 64','A transferrable character for Mario Golf for the Nintendo 64 from the Game Boy Color version.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13013,'Battlenauts','2024-11-28','Strategy, Card & Board Game','Meta Quest 3','Battlenauts is a 4-way mixed reality space strategy game that thrusts you into the heart of a cosmic struggle. As the commander of Earth\'s starfleet, you find yourself racing against rival factions to control a newly discovered, mysterious anomaly. This anomaly is the gateway to an entire new solar system and it’s resources, and every decision you make could tip the balance of the galaxy. Prepare for an intense, fast-paced experience that combines strategy, tactical combat, and dynamic multiplayer competition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93hj.jpg'),(13014,'The Inner World 2','2017-11-22','Adventure','iOS','Solve mind-bending puzzles in a world full of mystery and save the family of the flute-noses! Their dynasty has been watching over Asposia for centuries on end. In secret, they fill the roly-poly world with light and life. But when their existence is discovered, they become hunted.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rdw.jpg'),(13015,'All-Star Baseball \'99','1998-04-27','Simulator, Sport','Nintendo 64','All-Star Baseball 99 is the first handheld entry in the All-Star Baseball series and differs from its N64 counterpart.\n\nThe game features six different modes: exhibition games, a full season (either all 162 games of the 1998 season or various shortened runs), the \'97 playoffs, the \'97 All-Star game as well as the Home Run Derby, and a batting practice mode. In season and playoff mode, progress is saved via passwords.\n\nOn the field, players will control pitching, fielding and batting (bunts and swings are possible). The game also allows players to set team lineups and positions.\n\nThe game includes all 30 MLB teams of the 1998 season, including the \'98 expansion teams Arizona and Tampa Bay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dyk.jpg'),(13016,'Blue Blood Lagoon','2017-07-13','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In 1949, The Chinese Civil War rages on.\nTo escape the war, students from Shandong led by their teachers began making their way to the islands of Penghu, a distant and unfamiliar land our in the sea.\n\nThe hero of the story, Yin Hsiao-Feng, came from an insular and traditional family, so he has always kept his feelings tightly locked away.\nHe is now all alone after becoming separated from his family and joining the refugees fleeing the Civil War.\n\nDuring the flight to safety however, Hsiao-Feng meet the two most important people in his life:\n\nTeng Lin, a charming and innocent young girl who believes that the Civic War would soon end in peace, no matter who the winner is.\nSun Yi-Fang, a cheerful and forthright beauty, who still believes that the tide of war will soon be turned, and triumph will eventually arrive.\n\nHis everyday school life with the two girls gradually heals Hsiao-Feng’s wounded soul and a story of youthful romance unfolds between the three of them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ckg.jpg'),(13017,'Just Dance 2025: Ultimate Edition','2024-10-15','Music','Xbox Series X|S, Nintendo Switch','The party never ends with the Ultimate Edition with thirteen months of Just Dance+* and digital bonus unicorn pack.\n\nGet your friends and family together to let loose on Just Dance! Whether you want to party, exercise, or create special family moments, Just Dance 2025 Edition has something for everyone with 40 hot new songs, including an exclusive song pack with Ariana Grande.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e4b.jpg'),(13018,'Murder Diaries 3: Santa\'s Trail of Blood','2021-12-17','Simulator, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In this game you abstractly follow the narration of a young man who slowly but surely becomes insane. This leads you straight into the middle of an exciting murder case and a murder mystery unfolds while you listen to the testimonies of witness, friends and relatives. The whole game is somewhat Christmas flavored - however, don\'t get yourself comfortable, the game not going to give you a nice and warm feeling but rather confront you with a cold and harsh reality as the thrilling storytelling of the game will leave you with a cold shiver down your spine. The game is a must have for any true fan of thrillers and anyone how enjoys a murder mystery that goes beyond the normal story telling. How does the gameplay work? You will play as a free-floating ghost like creature. Basically, as the soul of someone who is experiencing the story. You are very small in comparison to the surroundings and can fly freely through the area. You start by exploring the area and enjoying the feeling of flying as well as the gentle yet mysterious background music. Soon after starting to explore, you will find the first memory piece. You can collect the memory pieces to continue with the story and to advance with the overall narration. The story talks about a young boy, about his live and about how everything changes. It is setup as a thrilling murder mystery and acts as a contrast to the somewhat calm and enjoyable gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5amg.jpg'),(13019,'Aliens Attack VR','2019-06-07','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aliens Attack is a short and frenetic VR game. Players will have to master their reflexes and skills to reach the goal: defend the pillars of knowledge while fending off the multiple waves of aliens that come to destroy them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lcj.jpg'),(13020,'NHL Hitz Pro','2003-09-25','Sport','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','NHL Hitz Pro is an ice hockey video game developed by Next Level Games and published by Midway Games. It\'s the third and final game of the NHL Hitz series. It was released on September 25, 2003, for the PlayStation 2, Nintendo GameCube, and Xbox. Unlike the previous titles in the series, this game has 5-on-5 gameplay instead of the usual 3-on-3 gameplay with the earlier titles. Despite that fact, however, the game does not include penalty shots, and it is still an arcade-type hockey game like its predecessors. It also has, as the name suggests, a lot of hard hitting, appealing more often to casual hockey fans than hardcore ones. The cover athlete of the game is Nicklas Lidström, and features commentary from Tim Kitzrow[1] and Harry Teinowitz.\n\nUnlike many other hockey video games of the 21st century, NHL Hitz Pro had the IIHF license, enabling it to use the jerseys of the Olympic hockey teams.\n\nThe game also has many game modes, one of the most popular being the \"Pick-Up Hockey\" game mode, where the game would turn into either a roller, street, or pond hockey match-up between two amateur teams.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ue4.jpg'),(13021,'Zen Garden','2017-04-04','Music, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Legacy Mobile Device','Noisy train trips or a shaky flight? Don\'t worry. Zen Garden gives you three unique musical environments, tailored for comfort and relaxation. This virtual reality experience is not a game, but an app aimed to help you relax, similar to hits like Guided Meditation.\n\nWe want to help you relax with musical instruments that react to your gaze, placed in calm, lush environments even in the most noisy and stressful of context.\n\nTemple: This scene is inspired by the famous dome structure of rome, Pantheon. It contains a great amount of cozy candles and heavenly choirs if you gaze up to the eye of the building.\n\nGarden: For ultimate relaxation we have the Zen Garden. It contains multiple instruments inspired by ancient china with the purpose to calm your nerves. Instruments include Spheres of light, wind chimes, gong gong and floating lanterns.\n\nOasis: Our more mysterious scene, taking place in the middle of the Sahara desert. Featuring a bedouin camp with a clear starry sky for roof. On the ground level there is a campfire giving a cozy but intense feeling to your own personal bedouin camp.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l0a.jpg'),(13022,'Baroque Syndrome','2000-07-27','Visual Novel','PlayStation 3, Android, iOS, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','You take the role of Kitsune Kanazawa, a Japanese student that becomes entangled in the investigation of a series of supernatural murders, which will slowly introduce key characters who will play a part in the upcoming apocalypse.\n\nThe game is played as an interactive novel, with 2D still pictures of settings and characters being the main graphic elements, and all actions being described via scrolling texts. At several intervals you will have to make a choice that branches the plot in different directions, but that\'s all the interaction you get to make.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4z9v.jpg'),(13023,'Mega Man Wily\'s Conquest 2: Hyper Edition Turbo!','2022-01-02','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','This is a complete hack to a previously unfinished version by DragonEye Studios. The abandoned version had some great ideas and lots of potential, so the purpose of this project was to refine the problematic areas and complete the hack so that the player can play all the way to the end and finish the game.\n\nList of features, additions and changes:\n\n1) Increased the speed of Mega Man and the Mega Buster!\n2) Wily-4 and other previously unfinished stages are now 100% complete!\n3) Added new challenges to all of the stages!\n4) Changed the entire soundtrack with great music by Blast Hornet, WINED, Tsukikuro, Hydrawisk, DARS, and 8-bit fan.\n5) Changed various weapons mechanics and physics.\n6) Changed boss AIs, HP, and boss room layouts for new challenges.\n7) Changed damage amount from various weapons to different bosses.\n8) Updated various sound effects and graphics.\n9) Increased climbing speed.\n10) Fixed and refined stages from enemy spams and poor layouts from the original version.\n11) Lots of new additional changes to all of the stages.\n12) Updated title screen, menu screens, texts, and ending credits.\n13) Reduced amount of energy used for most weapons.\n14) Various bug fixes.\n15) And many more various additions and fixes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6orb.jpg'),(13024,'Recursed','2016-09-30','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A puzzle game where the rooms are items and the items are rooms. Get to the goal by moving, rearranging and duplicating rooms and altering the structure of the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n4k.jpg'),(13025,'Cyber Tetris',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Cyberpunk style plus Tetris plus exquisite CG, what kind of chemical reaction will there be?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53u5.jpg'),(13026,'Payday 3: Chapter 2 - Boys in Blue','2024-06-27','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','What would you do if some corrupt cops raided your completely legitimate business, planted some evidence, and showed every sign of wanting to keep the gold they “confiscated”? Well, in Vlad’s case, he got in touch with his old friends in the Payday Gang to enact revenge and get his damn gold back.\nThe Boys in Blue Heist tasks the gang with breaking into a secure holding facility of the NYPD on Vlad’s behalf. He wants his gold back, and the gang has never let him down before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pj3.jpg'),(13027,'Misterios Ocultos','2025-04-24','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A terrifying story that immerses you in a dark world full of horrific surprises that will leave the player frozen in fear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pzm.jpg'),(13028,'Unravel: Yarny Bundle','2018-07-24','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Discover the delightful adventures of Unravel and Unravel Two, with the Unravel Yarny Bundle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39wf.jpg');
INSERT INTO `games` VALUES (13029,'Cain & Iddo: Break Week',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The year is 2013. Cain the dog and Iddo the hyena are two plucky 24-year-olds navigating life alone in the East Coast American metropolis of Westside City. Their zany misadventures don\'t turn out exactly as planned, wacky unforeseen circumstances arise, and hijinx ensues...\n\nCain works as a barista at the local mall\'s Starbuzz franchisee. Due to requirements from higher Starbuzz management, his boss Sergio has to give Cain a week off work for the summer. Cain and Iddo have decided to get some bucket list activities done over this week-long break... but you can probably guess that finishing that list is not going to be as simple as it seems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sjy.jpg'),(13030,'Thelos',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Your main ability is to place two crystals on a viable surface and pull towards them. You can use dashing, jumping, running, and perform a special jump which is available after collecting rewards. Your opposition will be two types of sentries, dragons, mines, and traps who all want to keep you down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57t2.jpg'),(13031,'Golden Tee PGA Tour','2024-10-01','Sport, Arcade','Arcade','The latest version of the popular Golden Tee Arcard series','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mxm.jpg'),(13032,'NeverDeath','2022-04-25','Fighting, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','NeverDeath is a fighting game set in our own solar system centuries in the future. Explore the intricacies of the unique left/right fighting system while battling across the solar system as nine distinct characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jpb.jpg'),(13033,'Never Alone: Foxtales','2015-07-28','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Spring has come to the Arctic and Nuna and Fox return in Never Alone: Foxtales -- the first expansion to 2014’s award-winning indie hit Never Alone (Kisima Ingitchuna).\n\nFoxtales features three all new levels full of environments to explore, puzzles to solve and enemies to face. Developed in partnership with the Alaska Native community, Foxtales reminds us that some challenges are best faced together and that even the smallest among us deserve respect.\n\nFeatures\n-Take to the seas -- Climb aboard your umiaq (a sealskin canoe) and take to the waters of the coasts, rivers and lakes of Northwest Alaska. Paddle through waves, ice floes and rapids or dive underwater and journey across the sea floor, inside mysterious caverns and through a sunken village.\n\n-Seek the help of the spirits and your companion -- Discover spirit helpers who can change the course of currents at your command. Switch between Nuna and Fox in single player mode or play with a friend in local co-op mode.\n\n-Explore Alaska Native culture -- Foxtales includes five new unlockable Cultural Insight videos featuring members of the Alaska Native community including the family of Willie Panik Goodwin, Sr., the storyteller whose tale of “The Two Coastal Brothers” inspired the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ndb.jpg'),(13034,'Spectrum','2018-08-20','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Spectrum is a platformer set in an abstract world of stylized shapes and bright colors. Escape from 80 levels spread in 8 mysterious environments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vub6qzq36tzsmmkjvahn.jpg'),(13035,'Trapt','2006-02-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 2','Tecmo presents TRAPT for the PS2, a puzzle-based game that contains a number of horror elements in its interesting storyline. The game is a continuation of the KAGERO: Deception series that began on the Playstation, but players aren\'t required to play the original games to understand TRAPT. The storyline begins when Princess Allura is framed for killing her father. As she flees the castle, players learn her dark secret: she\'s possessed by a demon known as Fiend. Fiend allows Allura to set a number of different traps to kill people, giving Fiend souls to survive off of. As the storyline progresses, players learn more about Fiend and how he came to possess the princess. The gameplay in TRAPT is very unique. As Allura, players run around the room setting traps while avoiding enemies. Once up to nine traps are set, they can be activated once an enemy is near. The traps come in a number of different types, including floor traps like bombs, wall traps like spikes, and ceiling traps like metal balls. Once players understand the system, they can start laying out traps in a way that an enemy will be hit by several at once to create a combo. Of course, it isn\'t quite that simple: some enemies are immune to certain traps, and some rooms contain areas where traps can\'t be placed. TRAPT weaves together unique characters, horror elements, and a fun, different gameplay style to create a unique game that will provide hours of challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51ki.jpg'),(13036,'A Sad Journey','2023-01-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A wonderful third-person adventure game about a rabbit looking for his missing parents. In this journey you will search for Paws that will take you to special places where you will get your memories back.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co584u.jpg'),(13037,'Chesstle','2021-02-12','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chesstle is an online multiplayer turn-based tactical / strategy game where you battle your opponent in 1 vs 1 matches. You begin a match with 8 soldiers, 2 archers, 2 riders, 2 mages, a champion and a king. Each piece has unique movements, attacks, and health points. Every turn has 2 phases, the movement and attack phase. During the movement phase move your character into the best position, then use any character with an available attack in range to deal damage to your opponent. Take your opponent\'s king out and you win, nice work. Don\'t savour that victory too long, your next challenge will likely be harder!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2svl.jpg'),(13038,'Aven Colony: Deluxe Edition','2022-10-31','Sin género','Xbox One','Build a new home for humanity in Aven Colony Deluxe Edition. Discover Aven Prime - an alien planet of deserts, tundras, and wetlands light years from earth. Build your colonies into massive, sprawling cities whilst dealing with the challenges faced when settling on a new world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5q5e.jpg'),(13039,'Burntime Remastered','2024-12-17','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Burntime is a remaster and expansion of Max Design\'s post-apocalyptic strategy game \'Burntime\' from 1993. It includes improvements like doubled resolution and wide screen support.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mfp.jpg'),(13040,'Cupid\'s Palace','2021-07-30','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cupid(You) are in the chaotic depths of Hades. You seek help from the GODS of Olympus, to help unite with your beloved Psyche at the Cupid\'s Palace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nys.jpg'),(13041,'World War Academy: Commander 1','2020-12-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Alliance Army and the Group Army have almost officially broken up, and the war is imminent. I was ordered to come to the Central South Theater command, and that\'s where the story begins...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59q1.jpg'),(13042,'Sea of Dreams Survivors','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome aboard the Sea of Dreams, can you survive to this nightmare ?\n\nFend against vast enemy forces, with hundreds of nightmarish foes swarming the screen at any given time.\n\nIn this action-packed rogue-lite, you play as one of the survivors trapped aboard the Sea of Dreams.\n\nSlay, adapt, and grow stronger with every wave of enemies—then slay even more!\n\nUpgrade your abilities, and unlock unique perks to adapt to the escalating chaos.\n\nSet in the terrifying universe of Sea of Dreams, this standalone spin-off delivers relentless action in a world steeped in dread and mystery. Will you endure the horrors of The Other World and find your way back, or will you become another lost soul aboard the Sea of Dreams?\n\nThe nightmare begins. Will you survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j2j.jpg'),(13043,'Tavern of Empire','2023-05-17','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tavern of Empire is a story role-playing game. It has a turn-based action system. As a spy from a different country, you are sent to clean up monsters in a town. Thanks to its graphics and music, you can play calmly or ambitious.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rrk.jpg'),(13044,'Castles 1+2',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Castles and Castles 2, bundled together are games of medieval diplomacy, treachery and power. To win you must survive. To survive you must scout the surrounding territories, defeat the local militias, subjugate the land with castles, feed and maintain the people, forge diplomatic alliances, appease the church and unite the land under your iron fist.\n\nCastles 1+2 feature real-time battles in a turn-based strategy, the ability to design your own fortress, and interesting historical videos giving you some insight into castle building.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3coi.jpg'),(13045,'Super Snot Put','2012-06-07','Arcade','Web browser','Pick, click and flick your way through this social snot slinging fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9761.jpg'),(13046,'Fruit Ninja Kinect 2','2015-03-18','Sin género','Xbox One','The sequel to Fruit Ninja Kinect.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22uj.jpg'),(13047,'Obama Boss Fight','2021-11-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the world where all answers were told the great enemies confronted each other. The time has come. Time to defeat Obama once and for all. Will the world be free from racism or you will start a new era? It is up to you. But keep in mind... Obama has no chill.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jv3.jpg'),(13048,'Panzer Party','2017-12-31','Indie','Nintendo Switch','Panzer Party is an online arena mayhem with tanks! Be careful of bouncing bullets, explosions, shifting levels and much more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6cnw.jpg'),(13049,'Dough Slapping: A Touch to Desire','2024-12-05','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter the quirky world of Dough Slapping: A Touch to Desire, where you slap dough with your left or right hand. Join Mark\'s journey filled with humor, heartfelt monologues, and unexpected revelations as you master the art of the perfect slap in this unique and comedic simulator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pj7.jpg'),(13050,'Omerta: City of Gangsters - The Japanese Incentive',NULL,'Simulator, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Irish mobsters, Ku-Klux-Klan racists, a mysterious business man from the far-east and a beautiful Japanese woman – it’s time for another episode in the life of The Boss!\n\nIt’s a story from a time when love was more important than keeping your cool. In “The Japanese Incentive” add-on, experience an all-new campaign and enjoy a wealth of gameplay improvements. Take on a challenging new AI and set Atlantic City on fire with this brand new expansion for Omerta: City of Gangsters that includes lethal new weapons, expansive maps, engaging characters and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qfzr0npyzfdax3x1zfju.jpg'),(13051,'Urban Jungle','2025-03-21','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Turn your home into a green haven in Urban Jungle. Find the best place for each plant in your tiny apartment and enjoy gardening without worries. And don\'t forget to pet the cat!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gfi.jpg'),(13052,'Buddy Bug',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a microscopic insect world tucked away in a corner of the city, gather your friends, fight bravely, and use all sorts of innovative gadgets to carve out your own territory. In this cooperative, rogue-lite game, you will embark on an exciting and exhilarating journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1l.jpg'),(13053,'Assassin\'s Creed III: Benedict Arnold','2012-10-30','Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Benedict Arnold is a single-player downloadable content addition for Assassin\'s Creed III. It was originally available exclusively for PlayStation 3 and PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ohc.jpg'),(13054,'Hot 21','2023-02-17','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a classic beauty Blackjack game, which ensures that you can easily start. You can choose different beauties as your opponents according to your own preferences. As long as you succeed in the challenge, you can let the girls dance a hot dance for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co667p.jpg'),(13055,'Ardy the Aardvark','1983-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Apple II','A action maze-game based on the coin-op Anteater in which the player controls the tongue of Ardy the aardvark through an underground maze trying to eat drops of food and to evade worms, stinging ants and spiders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mneizw7eexoxey3kmvxs.jpg'),(13056,'Slender Man Origins 3: Abandoned School','2015-04-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Android, iOS','The long-awaited sequel to the major hit games Slender Man Origins 1 & 2.\nIntroducing Slender Man Origins 3: Abandoned School.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co986x.jpg'),(13057,'Project Pastorate','2018-05-31','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Knowing neither sleep, rest, nor gratitude, Devoters carry out an immense service for the benefit of the people they once had sworn to protect. The Devoters\' only reward is another saved life, they are willing and ready to die for it.\n\nProject Pastorate is a visual novel set in the land of crime and sin that needs to be cleansed. Such tasks are taken up by the Devoters, the special service whose main purpose is to preserve the safety of the country, and the Pastor — leader of this post-apocalyptic community. While investigating the most hideous crimes you will have to make some grueling choices that will inevitably affect the whole country.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27o7.jpg'),(13058,'Zone of the Enders: HD Edition','2012-10-25','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Relive the adventure for the first time in HD! Experience thrilling high-flying robot combat unlike anything you\'ve felt before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4slp.jpg'),(13059,'Buck \'n Grunts Bundle','2025-02-07','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Guts \'n Grunts and Buck Blastem -- two excellent, retro-styled, 16-bit platform games together in one epic bundle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eg7.jpg'),(13060,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization V: Cradle of Civilization Map Pack - Americas','2010-12-01','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Although civilization blossomed later in the western hemisphere, the region from Peru in the south to Mexico in the north was just as important as an incubator for the development of ancient cultures. This map spans this rugged area of jungles and highlands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85uo.jpg'),(13061,'Santa\'s Spot It','2024-11-02','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Get ready to dive into the magic of Christmas with Santa’s Spot It, the ultimate holiday themed puzzle game that’s perfect for all ages!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u5x.jpg'),(13062,'VR Battleship Yamato','2017-08-17','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Full Scale Restoration of the Japanese battleship “Yamato” in VR.\n\nBattleship Yamato was constructed during the World War Ⅱ in 1941, and it was the biggest battleship ever built. Unfortunately, Yamato didn’t last through the war, and it sank to the bottom of the sea.\nNow, battleship Yamato is completely restored in full scale in VR. It is based on the blueprints and the recollections of the actual crew who are still alive.\nIn this app, you can actually get on Yamato and walk across the deck, climb up the bridge, and go inside the ship.\nSee the Yamato crew taking command. View the explosions of the gun fire from a close distance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20wu.jpg'),(13063,'Beautiful Bricks','2019-11-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beautiful Bricks is the ultimate 4 player brick breaker. A restoration of an arcade great with awesome improvements like physic-based ball behaviour, more paddle control, 4 simultaneous players and boss battles. All presented in a consistent retro ‘8-bit’ aesthetic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1slt.jpg'),(13064,'L.A. Noire','2017-11-14','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','L.A. Noire for PlayStation 4 and Xbox One delivers the complete original game and all additional downloadable content with a range of technical enhancements for greater visual fidelity and authenticity, including enhanced lighting and clouds, new cinematic camera angles, high resolution textures and more. L.A. Noire plays natively in 1080p for the PlayStation 4 and Xbox One consoles, and stunning 4K for PlayStation 4 Pro and Xbox One X, capturing the grit and grime of the City of Angels like never before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ld0.jpg'),(13065,'Super Demon Boy','2019-07-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super Demon Boy is a dynamic action-platformer in an unusual setting that will leave you a lot of impressions! If you want to challenge the fate and check what you are capable of, then this game is perfect!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1n6k.jpg'),(13066,'LEGO World Builder 2','2003-12-31','Puzzle','Web browser','The sequel to LEGO World Builder. It is a Shockwave puzzle-platformer that was hosted on the official LEGO website in 2003. The player must collect LEGO pieces and the recipes that allow them to assemble those pieces into different kinds of units and vehicles. Each unit type has its own capabilities, allowing the player access new areas and collect more pieces and recipes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bzj.jpg'),(13067,'Villager\'s Biography','2018-06-13','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nowadays, the villagers, each more awesome than the next. There are not many villagers like you who have worked hard to earn money. Collecting, fishing, stealing, working, cooking, a variety of ways to make money, two actress in a leading role can be married. The next life winner is you!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13068,'The Nutcracker of Riepass: A Nymph\'s Tale - Episode 2','2025-02-17','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fantasy comedy hybrid visual novel with jrpg battles','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n1c.jpg'),(13069,'Violations Will Be Punished','2023-03-24','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An old-school turn-based strategy game with a philosophical story set in the dystopian 23rd century Solar System. You start as a cog in a corporation, search for meaning, and eventually become the mastermind of humanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6axw.jpg'),(13070,'Me && Mory','2023-04-24','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Me && MORY...\n...is a cryptic and minimalist puzzle game.\n\nHelp MORY run its query:\ngather sticky Data from the Past\nand restore it for the next new world!\n\nAll is not lost!\n\nSolve 16 levels of Sokoban-based puzzles\nby moving Data to restoration points.\n\nInteract with Them and uncover\nsnippets of memories to retrace History!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pml.jpg'),(13071,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization V: Cradle of Civilization Map Pack - Mesopotamia','2010-12-01','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is the traditional Western and Middle Eastern “Cradle of Civilization.\" It includes the Fertile Crescent, with the Nile River valley to the west and extending east down the Tigris and Euphrates river valleys to the Persian Gulf. The Cradle of Civilization map packs are Firaxis-designed maps of real-world locations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85us.jpg'),(13072,'Running Back to You','2022-02-19','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Running Back to You is an indie low-poly exploration game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4iay.jpg'),(13073,'Caelum: Into the Sky','2017-06-08','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Caelum is a world of many wonders and treasures, in development for the HTC Vive. This world holds many secrets, and some have been unearthed by the events of the past. Some are hidden behind massive doors some behind riddles and puzzles, it is up to you to find your way and snatch up the glory and wealth. You will find yourself digging through ancient ruins, abandoned laboratories and places of great knowledge that will test your abilities and wits.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13074,'Last Call','2021-09-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Last Call is an autobiographical poem-exploration game about love and violence. In the game, you explore an apartment that is partially packed for a move. You find and respond to pieces of a poem scattered throughout these boxes as you help pack up. It is based on the lived experience of the game designer, Nina Freeman.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xkd.jpg'),(13075,'Danganronpa: Trigger Happy Havoc - Anniversary Edition','2022-01-18','Point-and-click, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Danganronpa arrives on Nintendo Switch to celebrate its 10th anniversary! Danganronpa 10th Anniversary Release: Part 1! This Anniversary edition comes with a gallery feature that allows you to view event illustrations, scenes, and listen to voiced dialogue!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a20.jpg'),(13076,'Fire Emblem: Curse of Lagdou','2024-11-27','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Game Boy Advance','Eight hundred years before Grado’s invasion of Renais, the Lagdou Empire dominates the continent. Powerful mages rule with technology beyond the ken of mortal man. Condemned by the gods, the empire drowns in blood and fire. A curse of the flesh, cast with fear and greed upon the innocent, births a single entity known as the Demon King.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f3k.jpg'),(13077,'Hakuouki Kyoukaroku','2013-12-19','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','PS Vita port of Hakuoki.\n\nAt a time when shogunate and imperial forces clashed for supremacy over Japan, Chizuru travels to Kyoto in search of her missing father. She runs into the Shinsengumi, a band of samurai warriors sworn to protect the shogun. Chizuru soon learns that they, too, are looking for her father. What awaits them is more than just your typical missing person’s case, as they face off against imperial soldiers and the supernatural! But in the midst of all this madness, will sweet and innocent Chizuru find love?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c3s.jpg'),(13078,'Oh...Sir!! The Insult Simulator','2016-10-25','Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The parrot is back from the dead bringing countless new insults for your disposal, Sir! Remember that silly game that parted lovers, destroyed families and turned friends into enemies? Here’s its successor that does even more, certainly with more style and more variety. And I have proof! This time you can spread affront to everyone in the world that has Internet access or - if you’re not the most sociable - you can sit alone and play with yourself. Nudge nudge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22s2.jpg'),(13079,'Signals','2021-11-16','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Signals is a casual planet hopper strategy game. Explore systems, harvest resources and repair alien devices. You’ll need to strategically work with the market to maximize your income while covering the cost of your operation in order to follow strange signals and discover what waits at the source.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5l6w.jpg'),(13080,'Undake 30 UraGame Daisakusen','1995-12-31','Puzzle','Satellaview','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pic.jpg'),(13081,'Hellbreak','2025-06-30','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight to save your soul from damnation in a brutal arena where only the strongest survive. Entertain the Lords of Hell and earn their favor to unlock new weapons, spells, and blessings. Dive into this fast-paced roguelite arena shooter and achieve the highest score. Can you reclaim your soul?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93au.jpg'),(13082,'Fail to Win',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Abuse the game\'s quirks to progress through sophisticated slapstick deathtrap puzzles, uncovering the secrets of a world going through an identity crisis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ziu.jpg'),(13083,'Battlefield V: Definitive Edition','2020-10-22','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This is the ultimate Battlefield V experience. Enter mankind’s greatest conflict across land, air, and sea with all gameplay content unlocked from the get-go. Choose from the complete arsenal of weapons, vehicles, and gadgets and immerse yourself in the hard-fought battles of World War 2. Stand out on the battlefield with the complete roster of Elites and the best customization content of Year 1 and Year 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kfh.jpg'),(13084,'Heroes Chronicles: Clash of the Dragons','2000-11-15','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Clash of the Dragons is the fourth part of Heroes Chronicles, following Masters of the Elements and preceding The World Tree.\nTarnum takes up the bow and defends the Elves and Dwarves of AvLee as a Ranger while opposing the tyrannical Queen of Nighon, Mutare, and her legions of murderous Dragons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29gj.jpg'),(13085,'Mouse Maze','2022-01-31','Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Navigate mazes with your mouse! Be fast enough to finish the level on time, but be careful not to crash! This game is able to be controlled entirely by mouse alone, no keyboard required! Plenty of settings to customize your experience (adjust difficulty up or down).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4okx.jpg'),(13086,'Doodle Escape','2025-03-26','Platform','Xbox One','Doodle Escape is an interactive AI learning universe designed for both total beginners and curious creators. Through hands-on quizzes, real-world exercises, and step-by-step video lessons, you\'ll go from \"never touched AI\" to confidently building prompts, generating content, and mastering tools like ChatGPT and Midjourney. Every course concludes with a final exam and certificate, and completing all levels unlocks our exclusive \"Jedi\" bonus content. Ready to break free from the ordinary and start your AI journey today?\n\nhttps://DoodleEscape.com','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r4l.jpg'),(13087,'Space Cowboys: Riders of the Storm','2023-07-18','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embark on a cosmic journey! Choose your role: Pilot, Engineer, First Mate, or Commando. Conquer the stars with intense teamplay, powerful upgrades, and thrilling battles. Take command, repair systems, or unleash chaos. Victory awaits in this immersive space adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x7i.jpg'),(13088,'One Piece: Pirate Warriors 4 - The Worst Generation Pack','2020-09-24','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Get three new playable characters in this Character Pack! Jump into the fray and enjoy all-new One Piece: Pirate Warriors action with three of Luffy\'s rivals from the \"Worst Generation\"!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qq1.jpg'),(13089,'Dark Grim Mariupolis','2020-12-15','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Introducing “Dark Grim Mariupolis”, a classic adventure game set in a world, combining noir, Greek mythology, magic, mysticism, hopeless entourage of Greco-Roman Age of Decadence and stifling everyday routine. Encourage yourself and step into darkness…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28qm.jpg'),(13090,'Cassiodora','2022-12-15','Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Cassiodora is a medieval fantasy game inspired by classic shoot \'em up with unique mechanics and epic boss fights. Save the princess Cassiodora by yourself or with up to 2 friends on the same screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rmr.jpg'),(13091,'Grim Fandango Remastered','2015-01-26','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Something\'s rotten in the land of the dead, and you\'re being played for a sucker. Meet Manny Calavera, travel agent at the Department of Death. He sells luxury packages to souls on their four-year journey to eternal rest. But there\'s trouble in paradise. Help Manny untangle himself from a conspiracy that threatens his very salvation.\n\nOne of the most acclaimed adventure games of all time is now back, better than ever. Grim Fandango\'s epic story of four years in the life (or death) of Manny Calavera, travel agent to the dead, has been remastered to look, sound, and control even better than when it won GameSpot\'s Game of the Year award upon its original launch. Grim Fandango still stands as a classic of the genre, with unforgettable characters and unique combination of film noir and Mexican folklore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27pj.jpg'),(13092,'AC Milan Club Football 2005','2004-10-15','Sin género','Xbox, PlayStation 2','The follow-up edition to Codemasters\' multi-title soccer franchise (each dedicated to a single team in the UK and continental European football league and featuring unique presentation and other team-specific aspects), the 2005 series is powered by an accelerated game engine and new animation system to deliver faster and more responsive gameplay for precise control on the pitch. With twice the amount of official team content in each game, great skill moves and new game modes including Career, Practice and classic Scenarios (plus new clubs added to the line-up), the new Club Football 2005 range will bring players even closer to the heart of the action and the heart of their team.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74ag.jpg'),(13093,'Ellipsis','2020-08-20','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Ellipsis is an action-packed Avoid ’Em Up with minimalistic, yet powerful neon styled visuals. Guide your ship through a mysterious universe while deftly avoiding hordes of roaming enemies, spikes, lasers and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zai.jpg'),(13094,'Kinetic: Break All Limits','2024-02-20','Racing, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fast, fluid, and exhilarating. Jump, dash, bounce, and swing through a world of freedom. There is nothing holding you back. Destroy enemies with your energy blasts as you race to the finish, fight friends online, or free your home planet from an invasive menace in adventure mode!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64sh.jpg'),(13095,'Arle no Bouken: Mahou no Jewel','2000-03-31','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Color','Arle no Bouken: Mahou no Jewel is a role playing game developed and published by Compile for the Game Boy Color; it was released on March 31, 2000. The game revolves around the collection of cards, each of which contains a monster. Madou Monogatari/Puyo Puyo protagonist Arle Nadja and her usual foes, such as Skeleton T and Schezo Wegey, use these monsters to assist them in battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zee.jpg'),(13096,'Big Pharma','2019-12-05','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','What if you had it in your power to rid the world of disease, to improve the lives of millions, to ease suffering and cure the sick… and earn a tidy profit? As the head of your own Pharmaceutical Conglomerate you have this power resting in your hands. Will you use it for good?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24cz.jpg'),(13097,'Autumn Break','2023-03-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Autumn Break is a mod for OMORI that takes place three days before the recital.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pg6.jpg'),(13098,'Hexiv',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Hexiv is a strategy deckbuilder about surviving on a lush but hostile planet. Use cards to build, explore and expand while battling a determined adversary to unlock the mysteries of this genre-blending roguelike!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1v.jpg'),(13099,'Cities: Skylines - Industries','2019-06-18','Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','In one of the most in-depth expansions in Cities: Skylines history, Industry becomes a larger and more meaningful part of the game with this expansion. Players can customize their industrial areas with supply chains for the four different resource types and unique factories. Well managed industry areas will level up and become more efficient. Aside from production chains, there is a new city service for handling mail and the cargo airport eases import and export of factory goods. There are FIVE new maps, new policies, new city services, new buildings (including resource extractors, manufacturers, warehouses and unique factories) and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yw6.jpg'),(13100,'Station Spacewalk Game','2010-12-31','Sin género','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome to the International Space Station (ISS), Astronaut. In Station Spacewalk Game you\'ll experience the thrill of conducting NASA repair work on the International Space Station. After negotiating your way through the airlock, you, the astronaut, will be tasked with jobs critical to help power up the space station so it can continue to operate. First take your time to explore the station, but then it\'s time to get to work. You\'ll have to move quickly and carefully, with a limited quantity of oxygen you must complete your Extravehicular Activities (EVAs) and get back into the airlock before your air supply runs out.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13101,'Peepaw\'s Farm','2021-06-09','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k4g.jpg'),(13102,'HewDraw Remix','2022-03-07','Fighting','Nintendo Switch','HewDraw Remix is a comprehensive overhaul of Super Smash Bros. Ultimate, inspired by the fast and technical gameplay of previous titles like Super Smash Bros. Melee and Project M. The mod offers unique changes to character movesets and core mechanics, and makes changes to UI and control options to provide more competitive depth and accessibility.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k4i.jpg'),(13103,'Love At First Squeak','2023-02-11','Visual Novel','Web browser','Are you desperate for love this Valentine\'s week? Well head on down to the Rat Hole Nightclub and mix it up with some of Scythe\'s locals to find romance!\n\nHave fun, fall in love, & remember to open up your heart, all the way. Rip it open! A brand new dating experience where you pursue romance at the hip Rat Hole nightclub. But on this night - vulnerability can be deadly!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13104,'Read Only Memories: Neurodiver','2024-05-16','Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Return to the vibrant cyberpunk world of Neo-San Francisco from 2064: Read Only Memories, filled with friendly and familiar faces. Neurodiver will introduce new characters, locations, and mechanics, including the ability to dive into and change other characters\' memories, as well as overhauled art and an unsolved case to crack with multiple endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97eu.jpg'),(13105,'Apathy: Midnight Collection - Vol. 2','2008-08-16','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Apathy - Midnight Collection ~Vol. 2~ is comprised of two parts:\nThe Kikoku no Shou edition of Apathy - Gakkou de Atta Kowai Hanashi ~Visual Novel Version~ and a sequel to Apathy ~Narugami Gakuen Toshi Densetsu Tanteikyoku~.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50qc.jpg'),(13106,'Uh Oh Airlines',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Uh Oh Airlines is a silly, casual, single player or couch co-op flight attendant simulator where you and a friend perform normal flight attendant duties, but must also wrangle your passengers to make it through the day.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pip.jpg'),(13107,'Tsukihime: A Piece of Blue Glass Moon','2021-08-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A remake of Type-Moon\'s classic doujin game Tsukihime, featuring a rewritten scenario with major differences in its setting and plot, as well as several new characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7edq.jpg'),(13108,'Zombie Shooter 2','2009-10-03','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zombie Shooter 2 is a unique blend of two game genres - Action and RPG. Every player can choose a character to the liking, get experience to develop skills, earn money and spend it at weapons, medications and useful devices. All of this will be used against thousands of enemies. The zombies fill the game screen, never letting you rest, even for a minute.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kov.jpg'),(13109,'My Xiuxian World','2024-11-29','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is an action role-playing game and you can customize your character, control with a mouse and keyboard, and defeat enemies. The story begins on Lingshi Island, defeat the enemy and then challenge the Black Sword sect all the way to ascend to immortality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pj6.jpg'),(13110,'Midnight Remastered','2019-05-07','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Collect the seven letters of the deadly sins and repent for your past in this survival horror game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mgw.jpg'),(13111,'LOL Surprise dolls',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13112,'Safari Grounds - The Wilpattu Leopard','2019-10-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Mini open-world, first-person adventure & survival story of a wildlife photographer. Survive, Listen to the wind and trees, walk through the jungle and capture all the rare wild animals with your camera.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yss.jpg'),(13113,'03',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','03 is a bullet-hell rogue-like shooter. Set in a surreal world inspired by the art of H.R. Giger and Zdzisław Beksiński.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j2f.jpg'),(13114,'Space Channel 5: Ulala\'s Cosmic Attack','2003-06-17','Music','Game Boy Advance','When the Morolians invade, ace reporter Ulala scoops the story for Space Channel 5. The hip-hopping aliens zap citizens into a hypnotic dance trance, but beat girl Ulala is their ultimate match. She busts out her grooviest attacks to free the captives and make headlines. Get down with Sega\'s supernova star as she struts through the space station in style.\n\nGame features include 18 unique stages, hip, eye-catching moves and a colorful retro-futuristic environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w09.jpg'),(13115,'Puddle','2014-07-01','Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Ouya, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Wii U, PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360','Dive into Puddle, a game unlike any other where you have to guide a puddle of fluid by tilting the environment to the left or right! Play carefully taking friction, gravity and temperature into account, and by using the unique properties of each type of fluid (water, oil, nitroglycerin, molten lava...) in a range of original environments. Conserve as much fluid as possible when crossing a variety of obstacles such as burning passageways, carnivorous plants and electric currents!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31vx.jpg'),(13116,'Tokoyo: The Tower of Perpetuity','2022-06-02','Shooter, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','In this platform shooter, you find yourself trapped in a mysterious tower – one that transforms its very structure every 24 hours, where you must surpass countless poor fallen souls and make your way to the heretofore unseen top!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hb8.jpg'),(13117,'Paws: A Shelter 2 Game','2016-03-24','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Paws is a standalone, single player, adventure, platformer set in the world of Shelter 2 with loss and friendship as its central themes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qvx.jpg'),(13118,'Wayfinder','2023-08-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Become a Wayfinder, and unlock their powers as you choose your path and playstyle while pushing back a hostile force that has overtaken your world. Control the Chaos as you directly shape and customize the endless adventures you go on with friends, because Wayfinders are stronger together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ac0.jpg'),(13119,'Seduction: A Monk\'s Fate','2022-07-20','Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Survive in a dark realm in hopes of saving a young woman’s soul from being used in a forbidden ritual!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xko.jpg'),(13120,'Hidden Expedition: A King\'s Line','2021-07-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Domini Games presents a deep dive into a legendary tale and the search for truth in this exciting new entry in the Hidden Expedition series!\n\nWhen wealthy philanthropist Preston Rutland unveils his plans to build a state-of-the-art scientific research facility at a controversial landmark in England, the H.E.L.P. assigns you to protect the land by proving that it’s the final resting place of the legendary King Arthur. But there’s only one problem—to do that, you’ll have to prove that Arthur was a real person in the first place! To make matters worse, you only have ten days to accomplish the impossible by solving a mystery that has eluded historians for centuries. Who was the real King Arthur? Get ready to explore the stories of Arthur and his Knights of the Round Table like never before in this intriguing Hidden-Object Puzzle Adventure game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ocv.jpg'),(13121,'Corpse Party: Back to School Edition - Limited Edition','2016-10-25','Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','This version includes:\n\n- A miniature figurines of characters Naomi Nakashima and Seiko Shinohara\n- A soundtrack CD containing nearly 80 minutes of music from the game not previously featured on the \'Songs of the Dead\' compilation, including three tracks exclusive to this Nintendo 3DS version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4or4.jpg'),(13122,'Bulwark Evolution: Falconeer Chronicles - Mad Lector Bundle','2024-11-04','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Bulwark is about designing your fortress and expanding it into an empire.\n\nI hope you enjoy my attempts to experiment and evolve this game into something enjoyable and fresh.\nBulwark also continues to evolve with each passing update, based on your feedback.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eg8.jpg'),(13123,'Papa\'s Cupcakeria','2013-08-07','Simulator','Web browser','Cook a ridiculous amount of delicious cupcakes for all your wacky customers in Papa\'s Cupcakeria!\n\nPapa\'s Cupcakeria just opened up in the picturesque town of Frostfield and you\'ve been \"hired\" to run the restaurant all by yourself. You will need to master all 4 of the stations to become a cupcake crafting master.\n\nTake your customers quirky orders in the Order Station. Prep the pan with wrappers and gooey batter in the Batter Station. Cook the cupcakes to perfection in the Bake Station. Finally, frost the cupcakes and cover them with delicious decorations in the Build Station.\n\nAs you level up and build a loyal customer fan base, you will notice the seasons changing all around you. Celebrate the 12 holidays with special clothing, furniture, and awesome seasonal toppings. With over 100 menu items, 90 achievements, tons of furniture, over 80 customers, and all the holidays you can imagine, this is by far the most epic restaurant Papa Louie has ever opened!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jzk.jpg'),(13124,'Dead by Daylight: Portrait of a Murder Chapter','2021-11-30','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The latest chapter for Dead by Daylight includes a new Killer – The Artist – and a new Survivor, Jonah Vasquez. A new Realm, the surreal Forsaken Boneyard, will be opened for all players. Purchasing this add-on also unlocks an exclusive cosmetic for Jonah: The Crimson Shirt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hwi.jpg'),(13125,'Scarlet Nexus: Season Pass','2021-11-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The SCARLET NEXUS Season Pass is a set of additional content which includes new costume sets and weapon designs for all characters, new Bond Episodes to enjoy your connections with companions, and a Bond Level Expansion.\n\nSeason Pass includes:\n\n• Bond Enhancement Pack 1 and 2\n- Sets of newly designed costumes for all characters\n- Sets of newly designed weapons for all characters\n- New Bond Episodes\n- Additional SAS abilities from Bond Level Expansion (Bond Level EX), and more!\n\n• Brain Eater Pack\n- Newly designed costume sets for all characters\n- New Bond Episodes and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rme.jpg'),(13126,'Fun Pack','2024-10-25','Strategy, Adventure, Arcade','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Fun Pack is a package with two games that are guaranteed to be fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xvh.jpg'),(13127,'Blood Beat Club',NULL,'Music','Sin plataforma','Welcome to \"Blood Beat Club\"! Step into the shoes of Clayd, the ultimate vampire slayer, as he ventures into the heart of the night.\n\nNavigate through neon-lit dance floors, each pulsating with energy and danger, as you match your moves to the rhythm of the music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88br.jpg'),(13128,'How to Bathe Your Cat: Drawing','2021-11-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It is well known that cats aren\' t really fond of water, but, as pet owners, we know that sometimes a good bath is welcome. Draw and use bombs to channel the water and clean your cat!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gqh.jpg'),(13129,'Pokémon Quest','2018-05-29','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','\"Welcome to Tumblecube Island! With cube-shaped Pokémon to befriend and hidden treasures to uncover, Pokémon Quest is a free-to-start game that introduces a brand-new land to explore.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zjv.jpg'),(13130,'Fear in the Facts Farms',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Fear in the Facts Farms is a multiplayer tossing game where you hurl pumpkins  at rivals and evade ghostly spirits . Explore colorful farm environments , learn fun trivia during the day , and survive the spooky night !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h7r.jpg'),(13131,'Si Kancil : The Adventurous Mouse Deer','2016-11-08','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Once upon a time, there is a little Mouse Deer, his name is Kancil. Kancil live in shady forest far away from the city. Actually that forest is a peace place for the animals before the hunters came. They catch animals, they also cut down the trees to get the woods and burn the forest.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13132,'The Endless Mission','2019-11-14','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Endless Mission is a sandbox-style creation game that takes players on a hero\'s journey through a rich narrative world where they develop the power and opportunity to craft games and experiences of their own in the Unity engine – all while challenging forces larger than themselves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43r4.jpg'),(13133,'Persona 4: Golden - Solid Gold Premium Edition','2012-11-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','An enhanced rerelease of Shin Megami Tensei: Persona 4 (2008) featuring quality-of-life improvements, gameplay enhancements, new locations, balance tweaks, online functionality, new difficulty options, an additional side character storyline and a changed endgame.\n\nPersona 4: Golden - Solid Gold Premium Edition box contents.\n\nP4G (The Game) One of the best RPGs of all time, now expanded and remastered to make full use of the power of Vita\nHori Hard Pouch Sturdily built and stylishly customized, this case has a flap that stores games while it guards the screen\nHori Face Cover Offers lightweight yet effective protection without blocking any major ports, so it never has to come off!\nProtective Skin Adorns your Vita with the stylish, vibrant aesthetics of Persona 4 and includes 8 matching wallpapers\nStickers Starring characters from Persona 4, these stickers can be used to decorate anything you can think of!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7z06.jpg'),(13134,'Kohate','2020-10-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Arrested and sold at auction, you have been transported to a secret testing facility in deep space. Perform the required tasks while avoiding the abomination lurking within the complex.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qik.jpg'),(13135,'SD The Great Battle: Aratanaru Chousen',NULL,'Shooter, Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','SD The Great Battle is an Action game, published by Banpresto, which was released in Japan in 1990. A North American localization was planned and marketed, but was cancelled.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ghk.jpg'),(13136,'Hudson Selection Vol. 2: Star Soldier','2003-11-27','Shooter','Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','The best of breed scrolling shooter of the Nintendo Entertainment System returns in this smash wireless hit! This is a sole warrior\'s mission to rid the galaxy of the sinister Star Brain life forms that now control 16 huge areas of space. It\'s going to be tough but your starship, the Caesar, can pack some decent firepower so you can become a true Star Soldier of the galaxy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8180.jpg'),(13137,'Follow the White Rabbit VR',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','\"Experience the world of colorful, tumbling down the rabbit hole with Alice\" - Inspired by the 1865\'s classical English novel, \'Alice in Wonderland\' , an ordinary high school girl from Korea takes a journey to a strange land with a white rabbit, in search for long lost key from her childhood.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zsn.jpg'),(13138,'Octavio Camacho','2023-07-28','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Based on the online graphic novel. This story takes place in a world filled with science gone mad, old society class revived, and a secret contest to possess\nthe chalice of Exon. To set the world right Octavio Camacho and his covert task- force named W.A.R.C.O.M are ready to take on the mission.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fhh.jpg'),(13139,'After the Flood','2024-03-18','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Five local teenagers have gone missing from Prairieville, Louisiana. The town is in an uproar. In this first-person survival horror game, play as Detective May Samson, sent to help find these missing kids. Investigate to piece together the story and learn the dark truth behind this simple town.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5f5e.jpg'),(13140,'Gears of War: Ultimate Edition - Deluxe Version','2015-08-25','Sin género','Xbox One','Includes base game, Deluxe Weapon Skin Pack and Aaron Griffin multiplayer character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kdc.jpg'),(13141,'Corpse Killer: Graveyard Edition','1995-02-01','Shooter','Sega Saturn','You\'re stranded on an uncharted island of Death. You\'re zombifying from Voodoo poison. A mad scientist is on your trail. Hundreds of rotting stiffs are crawling out of their graves to chew your guts. And you can\'t kill \'em. They\'re ALREADY DEAD! Hundreds of huge, full-screen rotting corpses to blow away! Faster action, more zombies, more ways to die! Spurting targets, blood-curdling screams, blood-boiling new sounds! Shocking new pop-up corpses right in your face! New \"power-up\" targets push your zombiekiller skills to the limit. More nasty slingers with spike balls, grenades, Death Skulls, the works!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4065.jpg'),(13142,'They Call Me... The Skul','1996-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','In the North Putnam Maximum Security Correction Facility, strange things have been going on. Rumors of secret experiments taking place with some of the inmates, a strange Power Elite gang, and other criminals walking around with super powers. It it to this strange location that Steve Kane was taken when he was wrongly convicted of highway homicide. His life was saved on day by a man named Big John, which unleashed strange powers within him and turned him into the Skul.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u11.jpg'),(13143,'Sleeping Dogs: Year of the Snake','2013-03-12','Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','It is the eve of Chinese New Year, and Cultists have emerged to cleanse the city of Hong Kong so that they will earn their salvation after what they believe will be the end of the world. Earn back your honor in the HKPD by sabotaging the cultist plot across six new missions set after the original Sleeping Dogs story.\n\nPlease note there is no Russian language support available for this content. When installed, Russian subtitles and all other game text in Sleeping Dogs appears in English.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hqd.jpg'),(13144,'Cube',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Cube is a puzzle/platform minimalistic game with a rotation mechanic, your logical thinking, dexterity and precision will be challenged, try to get the best score while pass through 49 levels with progressive dificulty. It can be harder than it looks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5d9r.jpg'),(13145,'Smash Hit','2014-03-05','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','An endless-runner-like rail shooting game in which the player launches balls to break glass obstacles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hqw.jpg'),(13146,'Life is Strange: Before the Storm - Episode 1: Awake','2017-08-31','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Life is Strange: Before the Storm is a new three part standalone story adventure set three years before the events of the first game. This time play as Chloe Price, a rebel who forms an unlikely friendship with Rachel Amber in a dramatic new story in the BAFTA award winning franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1utf.jpg'),(13147,'Murderous Muses','2023-05-11','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Spend three nights in a cursed gallery solving the cold-case murder of Mordechai Grey, a tortured artist killed by one of six deadly muses. Hang portraits to see into the past, whilst solving puzzles and exploring ever-changing rooms. Will you be artful enough to catch the murderous muse?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co631i.jpg'),(13148,'Metits Magic 3: The Revenge of Luli',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Trapped in Darski High School, you must uncover the secrets of the Sacred Protein while evading threats like Big Marina and battling terrifying teachers. Solve puzzles, manage resources, and face Luli’s revenge in a chilling survival horror adventure with multiple endings. Will you escape?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13149,'Dinobreak: Crisis Collection','2025-02-01','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Dinosaurs have returned in this \'90s horror nightmare collection!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e9l.jpg'),(13150,'Escape Planet 17','2021-01-08','Shooter, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escape Planet 17 is a 2D action cyberpunk platform game where you can Interact with other characters to create unique paths. Use your fighting, shooting, hacking and scanning abilities to solve crimes, defeat your enemies and escape the Planet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ixn.jpg'),(13151,'Now Sing 2016',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Grab your mic and start singing NOW! Featuring 30 chart hits including 17 number ones from some of the world\'s biggest artists. Grab a mic and sing solo or play with up to 7 other friends and really get the party started. You will require a USB Microphone to play the game which is sold sepertaely Game Modes CLASSIC: Sing a song solo or play against your friends. BY HEART: Like \'CLASSIC\' mode but some of the lyrics will disappear during the round. DUET: Sing a real duet with your friends EXPERT: Test your memory in the \'EXPERT\' mode which has no on-screen lyrics or visual cues. PASS THE MIC: Let\'s you play with a partner sharing one mic. FIRST TO 20,000: Compete against your friends and gain points. The first person to reach 20,000 points wins. ELIMINATION: Start with a full bar of energy which depletes with every wrong note. If you lose all your energy, you\'re out. The last Player standing wins. Manufacturer\'s Description Song list Mark Ronson feat. Bruno Mars - Uptown Funk Meghan Trainor - All About That Bass Ariana Grande feat. Iggy Azalea - Problem Jessie J, Ariana Grande And Nicki Minaj - Bang Bang Sam Smith - Stay With Me Avicii - Wake Me Up Calvin Harris - Summer Kiesza - Hideaway Rita Ora - I Will Never Let You Down Demi Lovato - Let It Go Sia - Chandelier Charli XCX - Boom Clap Olly Murs feat. Demi Lovato - Up Coldplay - A Sky Full Of Stars George Ezra - Budapest Fun feat. Janelle Monáe - We Are Young Calvin Harris feat. Ellie Goulding - Outside Avicii - The Nights LMFAO - Party Rock Anthem Clean Bandit & Jess Glynne - Real Love Maroon 5 - Moves Like Jagger Leona Lewis - Bleeding Love James Blunt - You\'re Beautiful John Legend - All Of Me Sigma feat. Paloma Faith - Changing Jess Glynne - Hold My Hand Bastille - Pompeii Lorde - Royals Ella Henderson - Ghost Lady Gaga - Applause','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gtrxrqqa7wl87otsbvvp.jpg'),(13152,'Monument Builders: Alcatraz','2014-10-24','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In Monument Builders: Alcatraz, oversee the construction of the most famous prison in the United States, while learning many other anecdotes along the way!\n\nHelp contractor Lloyd Andrews gather the resources needed to complete work on the prison.\n\nManage your workers skillfully to finish the levels in time, while repelling attacks from Call Palone\'s hired thugs as they try to send your project to the bottom of the bay!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21d2.jpg'),(13153,'Rift Adventure','2021-09-16','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Rift Adventure is a pixelart platform in a magical world full of adventures and with a functional tax system, it is up to the player, to walk beyond his own future as an adventurer, the future of the city\'s development.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yjf.jpg'),(13154,'Blacksad: Under the Skin - Limited Edition','2019-11-19','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A dark corruption scandal in the heart of the New York City\'s underworld for charismatic detective John Blacksad.\n\nBlacksad: Under the Skin Limited Edition will include: Boxed copy of Blacksad: Under the Skin game, 4 Art Prints, 3D Lenticular artwork, and a Limited Edition Sleeve!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61ep.jpg'),(13155,'Aloe and Cal','2019-12-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into the world of Aloe and Cal and experience a gently paced visual novel about the importance of food. With thousands of fun choices to make, over 100 CGs to look at, and 7 colorful characters to meet, you will undoubtedly walk away satisfied!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ldf.jpg'),(13156,'The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt','2015-05-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt is an open-world action role-playing game developed by CD Projekt Red.\n\nSet in a dark fantasy world, the game follows Geralt of Rivia, a monster hunter searching for his adopted daughter, Ciri, while navigating political conflicts and supernatural threats. Gameplay features exploration, combat, character progression, and branching narratives shaped by player choices. Widely acclaimed for its writing, world-building, and depth, it is considered one of the most influential RPGs of its generation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wyy.jpg'),(13157,'Coop Catacombs','2024-03-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A traditional roguelike with asynchronous multiplayer and cooperative mode. Exploring these dungeons, you will feel accompanied at all times and will be able to witness the traces of other adventurers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zeg.jpg'),(13158,'Love, Ghostie','2024-08-14','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Become a wholesome ghost matchmaker and grow relationships between the manor’s residents! Gift items to lift their spirits, set them up on dates, and watch love bloom! Discover cute romances with a unique story between every pair of residents! How will love blossom in your manor?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6i4y.jpg'),(13159,'20000 Atmospheres',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13160,'Nekketsu Oyako','1994-12-03','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Nekketsu Oyako is a beat-\'em-up by Technosoft released for the PlayStation in 1994 and the Sega Saturn in 1995. Neither version was released outside Japan. The title roughly translates to \"Burning-Blood Family.\"\n\nThe game is noted for its humorous presentation. For example, one stage takes place inside a whale, and alcoholic beverages (a healing item) can only be consumed by Rando while his two kids get an \"adult only\" message instead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ruk.jpg'),(13161,'Nether Nightmare','2021-04-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Nether Nightmare you will be immersed in the void. Each cycle, each step taken will lead you to ...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q31.jpg'),(13162,'Linger In Shadows','2008-10-09','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 3','Linger in Shadows is not a game, but rather an experiment into the realm of interactive digital art. Created by a collective of talented artists based in Bringing this underground digital art culture exclusively to the PlayStation Network, it delivers a truly unique journey that will challenge and entertain you, and change the way you think about games and art forever.\n\nDive into the world of Linger in Shadows, where a dark and mysterious creature lingers in the shadows, protecting the ancient Temple on its high perch above the ruined city below. Use the SIXAXIS controller to interact with and manipulate the environment and the very fabric of time and reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bch.jpg'),(13163,'Arcade Archives: Land Sea Air Squad','2025-03-27','Shooter, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13164,'The Age of Decadence','2015-10-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Age of Decadence is an upcoming pseudo-isometric 3D turn-based role-playing video game for Windows, Mac OS X and Linux by Iron Tower Studio, led by the pseudonymous \"Vince D. Weller\". Set in a low-magic, post-apocalyptic world inspired by the fall of the Roman Empire, The Age of Decadence aims to return to the \'golden era\' of RPGs by emphasizing choices and consequences and providing a comprehensive skill set, multiple solutions to quests, and extensive dialogue trees.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co215v.jpg'),(13165,'SoulCalibur VI: Tira','2018-10-19','Fighting','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Access to the playable character Tira in the full retail version of SOULCALIBUR VI. The pack also includes a unique story for Tira in the Soul Chronicle mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xsz.jpg'),(13166,'Trainz Railroad Simulator 2022: Cornish Mainline and Branches TRS19',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','This picturesque route runs between Truro and terminates in Penzance and includes Branch-lines to Falmouth (The Maritime Route), Helston, Hayle Wharves and St Ives.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13167,'SNK vs. Capcom: Card Fighters\' Clash','2022-01-12','Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Characters from SNK and Capcom clash in this epic card fighting game!\nIntroducing! SNK vs. Capcom: Card Fighters\' Clash, a white-hot card fighting game for the Neo Geo Pocket Color (released in 1999), is coming to Nintendo Switch!\n\nBack then, SNK vs. Capcom: Card Fighters\' Clash was sold as two separate games; the SNK Cardfighter\'s Version and the Capcom Cardfighter\'s Version. But now, both have been combined into one game! There\'s nothing stopping you from collecting all the cards!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4cvg.jpg'),(13168,'Bit Shifter','2015-11-02','Puzzle, Racing, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Alert! Home World is under siege by VIirus!\nWe won’t sugar-coat this soldier, you\'ll take on dangerous enemies, bent on destroying Home World, face treacherous terrain, visit unseen lands, and wield weapons of unimaginable strength in the fight to cleanse the world of the corruption that is VIRUS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a4m.jpg'),(13169,'Neverwinter Nights: Tyrants of the Moonsea','2019-08-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Neverwinter Nights: Tyrants of the Moonsea is a premium module for Neverwinter Nights: Enhanced Edition.\nDeveloped by Ossian Studios and based on the original module by Luke Scull, this new, enhanced version of Tyrants of the Moonsea vastly expands this former premium module by adding 70% more story and gameplay, as well as a large amount of new art and audio content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1sxi.jpg'),(13170,'Call of Heroes: Tower Defense','2024-11-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Embark on a magical and exciting journey to protect the fairy kingdom in this epic TD game. Recruit unique heroes with powerful magic. Craft exclusive weapons for each hero. Defend the fairy kingdom!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pgd.jpg'),(13171,'AiliA',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ailia gets lost in a mysterious world.\n\nShe has no special power but going into the mirror and walking on the reflections.\n\nTraveling through the maze, playing with reflections, revealing her past with the help of the mirror, her only friend in this world.\n\nTry to use your understanding of mirror reflections to solve the puzzles and help Ailia find her way home.\n\nAiliA is a tricky puzzle game where mirror reflections are made real. Manipulate mirrors and guide Ail through a stunning, reflected world to save her long lost \"twin sister\" Lia, who was captured inside a mirror.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4aii.jpg'),(13172,'Cruel Galaxy: Discordia','2020-06-30','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cruel Galaxy: Discordia is a turn-based role-playing game, including tactical space combat, strategic elements and original story, filled by despair.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45pj.jpg'),(13173,'Star Man 2: Reupgraded',NULL,'Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hy0.jpg'),(13174,'Thief Dog',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Thief Dog is an action-adventure simulator. The Thief Dog Perry is trained from the pup to steal bags and wallets, became a true master in his craft. Intelligent, sneaky, extremely courageous – the Thief Dog will take up on any criminal task. Petty thefts are only the beginning...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46dg.jpg'),(13175,'Lovers in a Dangerous Spacetime','2015-09-09','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Lovers in a Dangerous Spacetime is a frantic 1- or 4-player couch co-op action space shooter set in a massive neon battleship. Only through teamwork can you triumph over the evil forces of Anti-Love, rescue kidnapped space-bunnies, and avoid a vacuumy demise. Deep space is a dangerous place, but you don’t have to face it alone!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2543.jpg'),(13176,'Creatures of the Night',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Inspired by classic horror and the VHS generation of movie rentals. Creatures of the Night aims to be an immersive and fun experience putting players inside some horror classics to solve mysteries, lift curses and try to survive either solo or multiplayer','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1y.jpg'),(13177,'Dragon Fantasy',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','A turn based RPG game! Players will use the traditional RPG game mode to play two major scripts and three additional content. Players will follow the plot to encounter various events, defeat various bosses, explore different worlds, and welcome friends who love traditional RPGs to play!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zh4.jpg'),(13178,'inAntrum',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','inAntrum is an atmospheric 3D Action-Adventure-RPG developed as game series and released in five parts. It combines Action-RPG elements as well as Adventure-Puzzle elements and a stylized 3D graphic in an entirely new fantasy setting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5h8d.jpg'),(13179,'OpenMorrowind',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','OpenMW is a free, open source, and modern engine which re-implements and extends the 2002 Gamebryo engine for the open-world role-playing game The Elder Scrolls III: Morrowind. Like the Construction Set for the original Morrowind engine, OpenMW comes with its own editor, called OpenMW-CS, which allows the user to edit or create their own mods or original games. Both OpenMW and OpenMW-CS are written from scratch, and aren’t made to support any third party programs that have been added to the original Morrowind engine to improve its functionality.\n\nOpenMW is not a “mod” to Morrowind. It is an entirely different game engine that does not use the original Morrowind.exe in any way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rgo.jpg'),(13180,'Touhou Perfect Sakura Fantastica','2022-07-28','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Arcade','Touhou Perfect Sakura Fantastica brings the extremely popular Touhou series to arcades worldwide in a spectacular remake of Perfect Cherry Blossom (Touhou Episode 7). Featuring 4 playable characters and multiple difficulty levels in the original story, discover the mystery behind the long winter in the side story and epilogue modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92qj.jpg'),(13181,'Music Room','2021-01-16','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Music Room is a Japanese horror game in which a friend invites you to go to school to test your courage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t12.jpg'),(13182,'Daughter of Reyn','2019-12-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Avenge your father. Reclaim your throne.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zo7.jpg'),(13183,'Red Dead Revolver','2004-06-11','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 2','Red Dead Revolver is a 2004 action-adventure game developed by Rockstar San Diego and published by Rockstar Games. It is the first entry in the Red Dead series and was released for the PlayStation 2 and Xbox in May 2004.\n\nSet in the 1880s, during the American frontier, the single-player story follows bounty hunter Red Harlow\'s quest for revenge after the murder of his parents.\n\nA local multiplayer mode allows up to four players to face off against each other or AI-controlled bots in free-for-all battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lcn.jpg'),(13184,'Hoverkitty In The Hoververse: Chapter Three','2024-02-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this 3D game, you can play as either Hoverkitty or Hoverflea, which means you have multiple ways of completing a level. This has aspects of an adventure, first-person shooter. You will meet enemies, such as the Hoverkitty Hunters, and also new allies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vmp.jpg'),(13185,'Forêt de Nuages','2020-10-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A walking simulator in a hand-drawn environment. Meet plants with strong characters and respond to their incongruous requests.\n\nPlease be careful where you step, your actions are not without consequences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5b7s.jpg'),(13186,'Beautiful Sakura: Racing Club','2025-03-05','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i3q.jpg'),(13187,'Bee-Ball','2007-02-01','Puzzle, Quiz/Trivia','Atari 2600','In the animal kingdom, bees are widely known as efficient workers. But there\'s an interesting fact that we as humans don\'t know--bees enjoy having fun! Every year bees from many places gather in one spot to play in a competitive tournament of Bee-Ball! This unique insect game is a mix of tennis and volleyball where bees hit a honey ball over a net using a racquet. A bee judge watches over the match and serves new balls as needed. If the ball touches the floor or flies out of bounds, a point is scored. Avoid fouling the ball out, use your dexterity to block your opponent\'s shots, slam the ball to score, learn new tactics to outwit your opponent, and you could be the next Bee-Ball champion!\n\nIn the competitive sport of Bee-Ball, you must score 10 points against your opponent to win a match. You can swing at the ball to send it flying over to the net or block when your opponent is trying to get the ball past you. If the ball is about to fly over your head, you can head butt the ball in an attempt to prevent a point from being scored against you! Points are scored if the ball touches the floor or the ball flies out of bounds, but in order to score you must first successfully serve.\n\nBee-Ball supports single and two player play modes. In single-player mode, you compete against a challenging AI computer opponent. In two-player mode you can compete head-to-head against a friend!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yng.jpg'),(13188,'Dancing Stage Unleashed 2','2005-05-13','Music','Xbox','Dancing Stage Unleashed 2 now features a wider range of Xbox Live modes. Via the online system, players can download new tracks, characters and challenge modes, and can also swap specially choreographed dance routines with like-minded fans. There is also an all-new \'Tournament\' function wherein up to 8/16 users can participate in online \'dance-offs\', with the greatest movers making it to a centrally housed Hall of Fame. Also, players can now play against dancing fans in the US, as well as their European counterparts.\n\nDancing Stage Unleashed 2 includes more than three dozen songs, of which 14 are licensed tracks, each of which is accompanied by its relevant promo video. The tracks in the new game span a range of decades and include \'Where\'s your head at\' by Basement Jaxx and Girls Aloud\'s \'Love Machine\' to cater for pop fans, while the likes of the classic \'Step On\' by the Happy Mondays and \'Alright\' by Supergrass offer a slice of the indie scene. A couple of true dance classics are also included in the shape of Donna Summer\'s \'Hot Stuff\' and \'A Town Called Malice\' by The Jam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9654.jpg'),(13189,'Tom Clancy\'s The Division 2: Warlords of New York','2020-03-03','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Division 2: Warlords of New York expansion will take you to Lower Manhattan, New York City in the hunt for Aaron Keener and his posse of rogue agents. The expansion was created with three main goals in mind, expand the narrative of The Division 2, strive to incorporate community feedback and the creation of a cohesive end-game experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co494b.jpg'),(13190,'Megaton Musashi W: Wired - Victory Pose: Boxing','2024-04-24','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','A wide variety of Victory Poses to celebrate your victory are now available!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90hi.jpg'),(13191,'Dying Light: The Following - Enhanced Edition','2016-02-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Dying Light: The Following - Enhanced Edition takes parkour-fueled zombie survival to a whole new level. Enjoy the definitive Dying Light experience with the brand new Legend system, improved visuals, major gameplay enhancements, and more. This package comes with all the available bonus content, including Dying Light: The Following - a massive story based expansion that brings mysterious characters, deadly new weapons, unexpected quests, and fully customizable and drivable dirt buggies.\n\nDying Light is now bigger, better and scarier than ever before. Enjoy the ultimate zombie experience as you scavenge for supplies, craft weapons, and do anything you can to survive in a city ravaged by the zombie virus.\n\nDying Light: The Following introduces the drivable dirt buggy that you can freely customize and upgrade with special weapons, attachments and decals to create your most deadly weapon yet.\n\n[from amazon.com]','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6619.jpg'),(13192,'Planet\'s Core','2013-12-31','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Planet\'s Core is a 2D Platforming game where the player must survive to the core of every planet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21z4.jpg'),(13193,'Dungeon Ascent','2025-03-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Descend into the dark depths of a dungeon teeming with creepy creatures, where every moment is a fight for survival. Grab powerful weapons, improve your skills and fight to your last breath to survive as long as possible in this endless nightmare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nuu.jpg'),(13194,'Army Men: World War','2000-02-29','Real Time Strategy (RTS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your mission is to lead the Green Army in a vicious battle against the Tan nemesis. Carefully guide your troops through a deadly barrage of enemy fire in over 15 World War II themed missions. Only the best military minds will prevail in this blazing battle of ground-based infantry. Many weapons from the era are at your disposal; call in strategic air strikes, a swarm of paratroopers, or quietly shoot the enemy from a distance with your sniper rifle. Never before has a plastic war reached this size and scale. Dive into the trenches!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6svt.jpg'),(13195,'Descending: House of Nightmares',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Descending is a VR horror game with puzzle elements. You play as the new owner of a house and your goal is to break the curse that was cast upon the estate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5g60.jpg'),(13196,'Dead by Daylight: Of Flesh and Mud Chapter','2016-12-08','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Of Flesh and Mud is the third Chapter for Dead by Daylight. Prepare for dark hexes and flesh made out of mud and decay, if you dare enter Backwater Swamp and live through the horror it brings. A new killer - The Hag - awaits you in the waterland area and you will meet a new survivor: Ace Visconti. \n \nOf Flesh and Mud is the brand new Chapter for Dead by Daylight and it includes a new Killer, a new Survivor and a map.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y75.jpg'),(13197,'1985: The Day After','1985-12-31','Simulator, Tactical, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum','1984: Escape from Big Brother is a space exploration game set in a post-totalitarian world. Players navigate a spacecraft through underground caverns on four planets, searching for energy pods left behind by the fallen regime. The game features precise rotational controls for maneuvering through tight spaces, and players must use their ship\'s tractor beam to collect the crucial energy pods. This challenging adventure combines elements of sci-fi and retrofuturism as humanity rebuilds after liberation from oppressive control.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91hz.jpg'),(13198,'Monkey Do',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Monkey Do! is an action-packed adventure game where you control a mischievous monkey, trying to escape a zoo by all means necessary. On his way out, he will encounter many challenges but also meet cheerful characters to help him in his quest for freedom and fun. Are you ready to monkey?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wa3.jpg'),(13199,'Toe II Toe','2022-12-05','Fighting, Sport, Indie','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Toe II Toe is a fast-paced mini fighting game in a retro gameboy style for the 20 second Game Jam! You have your feet planted on the ground, ready for a slugfest. Punch, duck, or block your way to victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63g5.jpg'),(13200,'Zugnaex','2024-10-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immerse yourself in Zugnaex. Compatible with DOOM and DOOM II, it blends classic FPS action with a modern user interface and a detailed heads-up display. Enjoy single-player campaigns and free* online multiplayer for epic battles. (* - requires DOOM)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x1x.jpg'),(13201,'Checkered Flag','1994-11-20','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), Atari Jaguar','Get ready to burn rubber! Race for the Checkered Flag behind the wheel of a turbo-powered speedway racer in real-time, 3D-rendered action. Choose from 10 high-performance tracks and see the speedway from 6 distinct views. Alter features and attributes on your racer to improve your times or even change the weather conditions. Action is so intense and realistic you\'ll swear you feel the wind in your hair as your tires screech around the curves. Keep your sweaty palms on the controller!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3g31.jpg'),(13202,'Saint Seiya: Brave Soldiers','2013-11-22','Fighting','PlayStation 3','Players will realize their dreams of battling the most vile and evil characters from Saint Seiya in one-on-one bouts that take place through the storylines from the anime series. The game will present enhanced graphics and effects; bringing the animated series to life like never before. Saint Seiya Brave Soldiers also gives players the ability to execute devastating combos and special moves as seen in the TV show. As players progress through the game, they will access the ability to enhance their chosen character\'s hit-point, strength levels, and Cosmos Power Gauge. Explosive online encounters await players via versus and ranking modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gdu.jpg'),(13203,'Honkai Impact 3rd: Song of Perdition','2022-05-19','Sin género','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Version 5.7 of Honkai Impact 3rd, marking the beginning of the Elysium Everlasting arc, which includes:\n• New Valkyries: Disciplinary Perdition & Golden Diva\n• New Open World: Elysium Everlasting\n• New Story Chapter XXIX: Tochter aus Elysium\n• New Featured Event: Shattered Dimensions\n• ...and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d4z.jpg'),(13204,'Sky Shark','1989-09-01','Shooter, Arcade','Nintendo Entertainment System','The NES port of Sky Shark. Sky Shark (released in Japan as \"Hi Sho Zame\", and in Europe as \"Flying Shark\")is a military-themed vertically scrolling shoot \'em up game in which players take control of the titular biplane through five increasingly difficult levels in order to defeat an assortment of military enemy forces like tanks, battleships, airplanes and artillery as the main objective. The title initially appears to be very standard, as players control their plane over a constantly scrolling background and the scenery never stops moving until a runway is reached. Players have only two weapons at their disposal: the standard shot that travels a max distance of the screen\'s height and three bombs.\n\nThe bombs are powerful weapons capable of obliterating any enemy caught within its blast radius. Various items are scattered through every stage that appear by destroying certain enemies: Shooting down colored waves of enemy planes spawn items like \"S\" power-up icons, point bonuses and extra lives. Certain enemies on the ground spawn \"B\" icons that increases the player\'s bomb stock when destroyed.\nEvery time the player lands at a runway beyond the first takeoff, the amount of bombs multiply 3000 points to the player\'s total score.\n\nPlayers are given three lives initially and bonus lives are awarded at 50000 points and thereafter. The game employs a checkpoint system in which a downed single player will start off at the beginning of the checkpoint they managed to reach before dying. Getting hit by enemy fire will result in losing a live, as well as a penalty of decreasing the plane\'s firepower to his original state and once all lives are lost, the game is over unless players insert more credits into the arcade machine to continue playing. Completing the last stage restarts the game with the second loop increasing in difficulty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e5f.jpg'),(13205,'The Typing of the Dead 2','2007-12-31','Shooter','Arcade, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Typing of the Dead 2, the sequel game to The Typing of the Dead, is an arcade game (ported to Microsoft Windows). It was released in arcades in 2007. This version was a revision of The House of the Dead III, and has only been released in Japan and only for PC as of 2008. While the latter is a standard light gun shooter, Typing replaces the gun with the keyboard. The game is an educational game, as it requires players to enhance their typing skills to be successful. The plot centers around the elimination of the zombie threat after society has collapsed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ecwxnkbettnf1itxw7sn.jpg'),(13206,'The Manse on Soracca','2019-10-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tasked with finding a lost woman by the name of Bridgette Camilia, private investigator Herbert Castaigne sails to the mysterious, fabled island of Soracca where he finds an imposing mansion. What he finds inside will change his life forever... as it will change yours.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5n7y.jpg'),(13207,'Fallen Enchantress: Legendary Heroes','2013-05-22','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fallen Enchantress: Legendary Heroes is the new standalone expansion to Stardock’s turn-based, fantasy strategy game. Players will forge a new empire in a world sundered by powerful magic, fight against terrible creatures, complete quests and rediscover lost secrets in their bid to rule the world of Elemental.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r21.jpg'),(13208,'Worms','1995-12-31','Strategy','Game Boy','Worms combines the best elements from the very best games ever created. It requires great thought, strategy and elements of sheer outrageous fortune. It provides the players with an almost infinite range of playing possibilities. It does take a little while to get into the swing of things however and despite everyone’s insistence that you should not need to read a game manual to be able to play it. Worms can be played by 1-16 players at the same time - it’s a turn based game so you`ll only need one machine - but prepare to be at odds with your loved ones, get ready to shout abuse at your best friend and be willing to exact unadulterated terror on those who plot to hurt your worms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xqo.jpg'),(13209,'Choices: Stories You Play','2016-08-03','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','One choice can change everything! Fall in love, solve crimes, or embark on epic fantasy adventures in immersive visual stories where YOU control what happens next!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jjh.jpg'),(13210,'Dungeons and Kingdoms',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Build your kingdom, grow your population, adventure into the wilds as a party of heroes, explore dungeons, trade, survive and prosper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p94.jpg'),(13211,'Dermimi\'s!',NULL,'Indie, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Welcome to Dermimi\'s - you\'re speaking to Mimi! ♡\n\nA cute game with cute girls.. what could go wrong?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13212,'TT Isle of Man: Ride on the Edge - Sidecar Thrill',NULL,'Racing, Simulator','Sin plataforma','\"Ride sidecars in solo or co-op mode and rediscover the Isle of Man race. New gameplay that is as demanding as ever guarantees intense sensations of speed! The DLC also includes French rider Xavier Denis with his two Superbike and Supersport motorbikes. \"','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13213,'Last Empire: War Z','2015-12-04','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','iOS','Battle other survivors from around the world and train your own zombie army in Last Empire: War Z, the base-building war game! Defend your empire as the walking dead roam the streets and the apocalypse alliance tries to destroy your empire. Survive the zombie apocalypse in Last Empire - War Z and develop your empire with allied survivors to slaughter zombie troops. Can you be the strongest survivor of them all?\n\nLast Empire: War Z is a zombie apocalypse-themed survivor game. Battle against zombies and other survivors to build your empire and army. Team up with allies from around the world to fight enemies, defend against the walking dead and participate in online events. Gather resources to support your army and grow your empire in Last Empire - War Z!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wfptmb9q2cpo91m1uizt.jpg'),(13214,'Psycho Dream',NULL,'Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Sayaka Kaori has fallen into a coma. However, she can be reached by a machine that can people into dreams. Dreams are incredibly surreal places, and are often very dangerous. Only experts from The National Public Safety Commission, also known as Diamond Dogs, are authorized to enter. It\'s up to Ryo and Maria, two of the best Diamond Dog officers, to save Sayaka and wake her from her coma.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31ch.jpg'),(13215,'Élan Vital','2019-02-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Élan Vital is a visual novel. The story is given form through the backgrounds, characters, sound, and music to create a novel for the reader to enjoy. Readers view the story from the standpoint of the protagonist, Liam.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13216,'Dreadweave',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Immerse yourself in a horror extraction shooter where you must escape a Soviet ghost town with a monster from an upside-down world tracking your heartbeat. Arm yourself, gather resources, and fight to survive. Death is just the beginning—it\'s your gateway to an inside-out reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7toy.jpg'),(13217,'Enlisted','2021-04-08','Shooter, Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Enlisted is a squad-based first person MMO shooter covering key battles from World War II. The game carefully recreates weapons, military vehicles and the atmosphere of that era, while demonstrating really massive clashes of numerous soldiers, tanks and aircraft with artillery and naval support.\n\nMost of the Enlisted game modes simulate a battle involving several infantry platoons and gives the player control over a squad of soldiers with various roles (i.e. submachine gun soldier, sniper, radio operator, rifleman and others), a whole military vehicle crew or an aircraft pilot. One of the fighters is controlled directly, while others move and shoot independently following the player\'s general orders. In a situation where all the soldiers in the squad have fallen, a player respawns with the next available squad. This decision makes Enlisted battles look massive and spectacular while keeping the input of each individual player in the overall team victory quite significant.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q1y.jpg'),(13218,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization V: Civ and Scenario Pack - Korea','2008-08-11','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Korea Civilization and Scenario Pack brings you both the Korea Civilization and the new Scenario: The Samurai Invasion of Korea, to further enhance your Civilization V experience. Rule the world as Sejong, King of the Choson Dynasty, with your invincible Turtle Ships and Hwach’a artillery!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hgi.jpg'),(13219,'MMA Life Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Sport','Sin plataforma','In “MMA Life Simulator,” you step into the shoes of a young aspiring fighter facing other fighters. To survive and protect your loved ones, you must enter the renowned world of fighting. Every choice you make, from intense training to accepting risky challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7b32.jpg'),(13220,'Arcade Archives: Rastan Saga II','2024-06-20','Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','In a time when might was the only justice...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8e6e.jpg'),(13221,'Welcome to... Chichester!','2018-06-30','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','When the self-proclaimed \"best secret agent in the world\" starts his week-long holiday, he is anticipating nothing more than a simple hiking holiday with a grizzled guide up an unnamed mountain. Unfortunately for him, his enemies decided that would be far too boring...','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13222,'Icefishing v','2014-06-29','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','icefishing v is an interactive, virtual sound installation in the form of a game, inspired by drone, glitch and noise-based sonic compositions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55kp.jpg'),(13223,'Dino SpeedBoat','2008-06-30','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crazy arcade game, with loveable hero - Dino the dinosaur. Try yourself in a wild race against time and ride to the victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p8u.jpg'),(13224,'Police Simulator: Patrol Officers - Gold Edition','2024-06-18','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Welcome to the Brighton Police Department! Enjoy a comprehensive experience with the Gold Edition! This includes the main game, the brand-new Highway Patrol Expansion, and the Garage Bundle containing all previously published car DLCs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dqe.jpg'),(13225,'Arboreal',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Answer the call of the Nature Spirits in this peaceful tree growing simulation. Cultivate and cook various fruit species to receive help from the forest inhabitants. Automatize production with ingenious tracks and machines. Find your equilibrium to let life flourish!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5814.jpg'),(13226,'Megadimension Neptunia VII: Digital Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13227,'Heavens\' Revolution: A Lion Among the Cypress','2024-10-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Revolution consumes a Persian dieselpunk city! Will you let it consume you, too? Make a name for yourself as a powerful astralchemist and resist the usurpers…or join them!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e5q.jpg'),(13228,'Tsubasa no Oka no Hime: A Red and Blue Moon Finite Loop','2011-04-22','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An otome game by Snapdragon.\n\nThe story is set at the 19th century at the United Kingdom, in a rural town called Wingfield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pju.jpg'),(13229,'Soshite Kono Sora ni Kirameku Kimi no Uta XXX','2007-02-22','Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','A fandisc to Soshite Kono Sora ni Kirameku Kimi no Uta.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j9a.jpg'),(13230,'Speedball 2 Tournament','2008-03-01','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s 2326, and Speedball is a ultra-violent streetsports league where rival gangs settle there deadly disputes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co303i.jpg'),(13231,'MLB The Show 24','2024-03-19','Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Swing for the fences, experience game-deciding moments, become a legend and live out your baseball dreams in MLB The Show 24. Earn your call up from the minors to the big leagues and prove you’ve got what it takes at the top. Learn about known and unsung legends of the sport and take inspiration from their heroics. Hold your nerve when it matters and earn the right to be called World Series champions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ozy.jpg'),(13232,'Milky Shaky Lab','2023-10-14','Quiz/Trivia','Android','Milky Shaky Lab is a telescope simulator for space explorers to discover celestial bodies, collect scientific stickers, test their knowledge, and collect unique albums.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mhp.jpg'),(13233,'Linda Cube','1995-10-13','Role-playing (RPG)','Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','Linda Cube is an esoteric JRPG that combines elements of psychological horror with monster collection. Neo Kenya is the name of a world that is in danger of being completely annihilated by an asteroid. The armies of Neo Kenya have searched for every conceivably way to prevent the coming catastrophe. When the inhabitants of the world turn to a dark god, their prayers and nightmares come true. Originally released for PC, Linda³\'s shockingly violent scenes earned it one of the few “18+” ratings on the system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u2e.jpg'),(13234,'Leisure Suit Larry: Kühle Drinks und Heiße Girls','2004-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Leisure Suit Larry: Kühle Drinks und heiße Girls is a promotional teaser for Leisure Suit Larry: Magna Cum Laude, the eighth main entry in the Leisure Suit Larry series. This Macromedia Flash-based compilation features three mini-games that showcase the franchise\'s trademark adult humor and themes. In Bar Wars, players serve attractive women while avoiding less appealing customers. Nightwatch challenges players to balance duties as a hostel night watchman with romantic pursuits. Babewatch casts players as a lifeguard, juggling beach safety responsibilities and potential romantic encounters. These mini-games offer a glimpse into the humor and gameplay style of Magna Cum Laude, maintaining the series\' focus on comedic sexual situations and Larry\'s perpetual quest for romance while introducing new scenarios and mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uxy.jpg'),(13235,'Metal Slug 7','2008-07-22','Shooter, Platform, Arcade','Nintendo DS','The Peregrine Falcon Strike Force, the Ikari Warriors, and the SPARROWS are once again on a search for General Morden and his army. Their mission is to catch General Morden and prevent his attempts at another coup d\'état on the government. However, as soon as Morden was defeated, a strange army from the future came to his aid. Now, they must face Morden once again and this time, put a stop to his plans once and for all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gag.jpg'),(13236,'Noel: Not Digital','2010-07-01','Simulator','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','NOëL NOT DiGITAL is a simulation game in which player is given four months’ time to communicate with girls met in a beach resort during summer. Enjoy communicating with the girls and write the future with them today.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61as.jpg'),(13237,'Multiverse Battle Royale',NULL,'Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Multiverse is the ultimate real-time, world-switching battle royale! Engage solo, or assemble a team to overcome the Multiverse challenges. Adapt, survive, and conquer across ever-changing realms. Claim your place as the multiverse champion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xaf.jpg'),(13238,'Adventure Pinball: Forgotten Island','2001-03-21','Pinball','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It starts when you receive a note and map from your long lost grandfather, along with the promise of the adventure of a lifetime. You\'ll encounter dinosaurs, volcanoes, and man-eating sharks, as well as a tribe of cavemen to save. Your mission is to save the Forgotten Island.\n\nThere are 9 interconnected tables included for you to conquer. They have to be unlocked during the game and offer 2 or 3 settings per table. In comparison to most other pinball simulations the goals on a table are mostly not to get a high score but to solve missions like chasing away sharks. Also unusual are the 3D graphics: instead of a static top-down view the camera follows the pinball ball.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co309h.jpg'),(13239,'Tekken 3D: Prime Edition','2012-02-17','Fighting','Nintendo 3DS','Play the game, watch the movie! Tekken 3D Prime Edition contains the complete entertainment world of TEKKEN onto a single Nintendo 3DS card! Battle with more than 40 fighters from the TEKKEN universe and with Young Heihachi for the first time ever! In addition, watch TEKKEN: Blood Vengeance, a full 3D theatrical experience produced by Digital Frontier in conjunction with the Tekken Project development team. With the satisfying combination of a movie and fully featured portable Tekken gaming experience, players can take TEKKEN wherever they go.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46s0.jpg'),(13240,'The Bitmap Brothers Collection 1','2021-12-08','Shooter, Sport, Arcade','Evercade','The Bitmap Brothers Collection 1 cartridge brings 5 classic games from the British \"rock star\" developers to the Evercade, including:\n- The Chaos Engine (aka \"Soldiers of Fortune\" in North America)\n- Xenon 2: Megablast\n- Speedball\n- Speedball 2: Brutal Deluxe\n- Speedball 2100','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b8o.jpg'),(13241,'A City Sleeps','2014-10-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','From the creator of Rock Band and Amplitude comes a fresh new approach to the traditional shoot \'em up! All the action is driven by an entrancing soundtrack- no beatmatching required. The Idol System introduces a tactical layer on top of proven shmup gameplay allowing for a range of play styles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wqt.jpg'),(13242,'Abyss Kitchen',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Abyss Kitchen is a survival action game in which you play the role of Lop a cook who accompanies a party of adventurers, and guides them with the power of food. Feed yourself in the dungeon and eat whatever you can to keep from starving and falling down. Eat up anything that stands in your way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p93.jpg'),(13243,'Arma 3: Laws of War','2017-09-07','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a different perspective on the battlefield with the addition of a humanitarian faction, van, drone, mini-campaign, and much more, in the Arma 3 Laws of War DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6h7e.jpg'),(13244,'Zup! 8','2018-02-22','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Minimal physical puzzle with explosions','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2974.jpg'),(13245,'The Guest','2016-03-10','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"The Guest\" is a gloomy adventure full of enigmas where the exploration of your surroundings comes to prominence; puzzles, secrets and riddles will help you discover who has locked you in this somber hotel room and most importantly, why.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43tz.jpg'),(13246,'WWE Smackdown! vs. Raw','2004-11-12','Fighting, Sport','PlayStation 2','WWE SmackDown! vs. Raw brings two of wrestling\'s most popular game series together on the PS2. The game re-creates WWE programming with voice-overs and commentary throughout the season mode. During matches, you can learn a host of new gameplay moves, such as stare-downs, chop battles, and submission reversals. You can also try out situational challenges or create your own championship. Play as your favorite wrestler, including legends and Divas, and prove to the world that you have what it takes to be the WWE champion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ssz.jpg'),(13247,'Total War: Warhammer III - Limited Edition','2022-02-17','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The cataclysmic conclusion to the Total War: Warhammer trilogy is coming. Rally your forces and step into the Realm of Chaos, a dimension of mind-bending horror where the very fate of the world will be decided. Will you conquer your Daemons or command them?\n\nThe Limited Edition includes:\n- A copy of the base game\n- An embossed metal case\n- A double sided poster featuring the Warhammer III campaign map and cover art\n- A Chaos Icons sticker sheet\n- An Ogre Kingdoms Race Pack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c2k.jpg'),(13248,'Magical Swordmaiden: Riru\'s Grand Adventure','2020-12-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After receiving a letter from her brother about strange events happening in his town, Tanya, along with her apprentice Riru, travel to Cain village to investigate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46sk.jpg'),(13249,'Speedball 2: Brutal Deluxe','1992-10-01','Sin género','Game Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8r5x.jpg'),(13250,'That\'s a Cow: Eggshell','2023-01-20','Platform, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Fly through levels with your new eggshell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61y9.jpg'),(13251,'Everdark Tower','2019-08-22','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Too many games in the dusty shelf waiting to be played? No problem, this pocket-sized RPG provides you an adequate experience! Here you go an adventure packed with emotion and accomplishment!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nwo.jpg'),(13252,'Last City','2016-01-28','Role-playing (RPG)','iOS','Last City features stunning and verisimilitude 3D graphic design brings you a thrill game world to discover. With a console-like designed on mobile control panel, it challenges your skill and ability of game plays. Skating is the key concept to start all the actions and movements. You can enjoy high-speedy skating and drifting, hover flying, anti-gravity moving, 360 degree rotating on mobile screen with smooth action performance!! The environment is really worse, with limited oxygen support, you have to destroy the creatures, expend and protect the power stations, assign the proper agent to take mission. It challenges your strategy and control skill to protect human from death. Mission must be completed, and must succeed, once all the power stations are ruined, human will be destroyed right away.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13253,'Storm Striker','2023-11-16','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Stormstriker is a hyperactive 5v5 PvP third-person shooter with colorful hero characters, action-packed gameplay, and an emphasis on teamplay! Join the battlefield by choosing a hero that’s right for your playstyle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h10.jpg'),(13254,'Monochrome Order','2019-09-10','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Guide the world toward the right direction through Judgments in a fantasy RPG with multiple endings! Your Judgments will greatly affect the story and your character\'s role in both good and evil paths. Explore different routes to guide the world toward the right direction!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24c0.jpg'),(13255,'Havenless','2020-08-31','Simulator, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','A zombie-fighting dating simulation that serves as LucyDream\'s follow-up to their wildly successful debut \'Dangerous Fellows\'.\n\nThe story follows a girl named Jae (name changeable) that gets caught up in a church\'s shady affairs while trying to hide that she was recently infected herself. Of note is that this is LucyDream\'s first dating sim to have a female love interest option.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h6t.jpg'),(13256,'WWE Crush Hour','2003-03-17','Racing','Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','WWE Crush Hour is a vehicular combat video game published by THQ and released in 2003 for the Nintendo GameCube and PlayStation 2. An Xbox version was planned but canceled.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ufm.jpg'),(13257,'Other: Her Loving Embrace',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Other is an RPG with a twist: stylish action combat mixed with turn-based battles. Explore, solve puzzles, and vanquish your foes as you uncover the secrets of a secluded town besieged by the supernatural.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sba.jpg'),(13258,'Solitaire #1','2019-04-01','Puzzle','Android, iOS','New experience and ultimate joy \n \n \nNumber 1 in all solitaire games. \n \n \nSolitaire, also known as Klondike Solitaire or Patience, is the most popular single player card game in the world. If you like classic Solitaire, you\'re going to love this crisp and clear solitaire game! \n \n \nGame Features: \n \n• FREE \n \n• Beautiful graphics \n \n• Klondike Solitaire Draw 1 card \n \n• Klondike Solitaire Draw 3 cards \n \n• Option for all winning deals \n \n• Auto complete \n \n• Unlimited free undos \n \n• Unlimited free hints \n \n• Intelligent hints and auto hints \n \n• Daily Challenge \n \n• Timed mode and Untimed mode \n \n• Vegas scoring and Vegas cumulative scoring \n \n• Customizable card faces, card backs and backgrounds \n \n• High scores and personal statistics \n \n• Sound that can be turned on/off \n \n• Tablet and phone support \n \n• Multiple windows and tasks support \n \n• No network required \n \n• And so much more! \n \n \nPlay the #1 FREE SOLITAIRE card game on App Store now and see for yourself why so many others love this game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m4c.jpg'),(13259,'Sega Genesis Classics: Series 4','2011-01-26','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The fourth in a series of compilation video games released by Sega for the PC. It features ten Sega video games that were originally released for the Sega Genesis / Sega Mega Drive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sl0.jpg'),(13260,'Evercade Alpha Street Fighter Bartop Arcade','2024-11-30','Fighting, Arcade','Evercade, Plug & Play','The Evercade Alpha Street Fighter Bartop Arcade includes six titles from the legendary Street Fighter series by Capcom, including Street Fighter II‘ Champion Edition, Super Street Fighter II Turbo, Street Fighter Alpha: Warriors’ Dreams, Street Fighter Alpha 2, Street Fighter Alpha 3 and Super Puzzle Fighter II Turbo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8amn.jpg'),(13261,'Gus and the Cyberbuds: Sing, Play & Paint-A-Long','1994-09-15','Point-and-click, Music','Mac, DOS','Gus and the Cyberbuds: Sing, Play & Paint-A-Long is an educational music game for children between three and eight. It features six songs (Animal Shenanigans, Down by the Bay, Imagination, The Ants Go Marching, Old MacDonald\'s Farm and I Am A Fine Musician) with three game modes:\n\nSing: The song is played and is accompanied by an animation. The lyrics are also shown, karaoke-style, so the player can sing along.\nPlay: The player can add a variety of icons (e.g. animals, trees, etc.) to the background. When playing the song, those icons stay on the screen.\nPaint: The player can use simple painting tools to paint over the background while the song is optionally playing in the background.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lqk.jpg'),(13262,'WDF','2025-03-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','‘WDF’, Is a horizontal shmup game with a Boss-rush style in that the difficulty will increase slightly after the player clears all stages and continues to the next loop. Each loop will be different from the other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g0j.jpg'),(13263,'That\'s a Cow: Deluxe Edition','2023-01-20','Platform, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Soar through the air and don\'t get milked in this cute game. With this bundle you get a new headgear - an eggshell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sdo.jpg'),(13264,'Dark Age of Camelot: Catacombs','2004-12-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Catacombs is the third commercial expansion pack to Dark Age of Camelot (after Shrouded Isles and Trials of Atlantis). The expansion adds a totally new, vast and diverse underground world to the game, in order to put a little more weight on dungeon adventures. There is a new entry point to these 15 catacomb regions in the capital city of each of the three realms. The catacombs themselves are the same for every realm, although they are handled separately so there is no RvR combat.\n\nOther features include the biggest graphics engine update in the history of the game, allowing for more customized characters and faces, \"Private Adventuring\" which adds instanced dungeons for letting individuals and groups adventure in their own private catacombs, as well as 5 new character classes: the Heretic for Albion, the Vampiir and Bainshee for Hibernia, and finally the Warloks and Valkyries for Midgard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21k5.jpg'),(13265,'ARD: Anomalous Research Department','2021-04-22','Simulator','Web browser','In the basement of a local community college, a forgotten computer sits.\n\nThe last relic of the Anomalous Research Department.\n\nWhat was their purpose? What did they find?\n\nWas it the solution? Or was it the cause?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co494g.jpg'),(13266,'Frail Hearts: Versicorae Domlion','2022-08-16','Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An old-school JRPG with a deep and mysterious storyline placed in a fictional dark city of Gris. Explore the story of four troubled souls and kill the abominations that threaten the existence of reality itself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52jo.jpg'),(13267,'Street Fighter Alpha 2','1996-09-14','Fighting, Arcade','Sega Saturn','The Sega Saturn port of Street Fighter Alpha 2 uses an arranged soundtrack and features new characters like Shin Akuma, Evil Ryu, EX Dhalsim and EX Zangief. It also includes an exclusive survival mode as well as an art gallery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bog.jpg'),(13268,'Answered Prayers','2010-10-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Answered Prayers is a Yume Nikki fangame made by Klaufir in RPG Maker 2003.\nOne of the more well-known English fangames, Answered Prayers is also one of the \'lighter\' Yume Nikki fangames. This game has plenty of areas to explore, with little gore/blood compared to many other Yume Nikki derivatives.\n\nThe game was on hiatus between 2013 and 2022 to version 0.03 according to the official website, but the site was updated the 5th of July 2022, with new screenshots showing the future version 0.04 and is now noted as a version in development.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rf6.jpg'),(13269,'Hypnagogia','2020-11-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hypnagogia is an exploration in themes involving deep dreams, liminal spaces, sleep paralysis demons, and much more.\nInfluenced by the nostalgia-fueled polygonal games from the mid and late 90\'s, Hypnagogia takes players on a short but intriguing journey through various worlds inspired by real dreams.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2veb.jpg'),(13270,'Detective Conan: Kako Kara no Zensoukyoku - Prelude','2012-04-19','Adventure','Android, iOS, PlayStation Portable, Nintendo DS','A Detective Conan game published by Bandai. It\'s the fifth one to be released on the Nintendo DS, the first and only to be ono the PlayStation Portable. The game was later also made available on Android and iOS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71fr.jpg'),(13271,'Jissen Pachi-Slot Hisshouhou! Ore no Sora',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A virtual slots game for the PlayStation 2 that simulates the 2006 Rodeo pachi-slot machine Ore no Sora (itself based on the \'70s manga of the same name).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yukganas5bk2tq1qptml.jpg'),(13272,'Long Steel','2024-01-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','20 years after the defeat of the Shaper of Magic, Warlock, the island of Melas is in a time of peace. But when the dark cult known as the Wicken return to resurrect Warlock from his ashes, you must spring into action to stop them before the apocalypse is set into motion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63vc.jpg'),(13273,'Bikkuriman Daijiten','2007-08-23','Sin género','Nintendo DS','Bikkuriman Daijiten is a Bikkuriman game released by 3 o\'Clock for Nintendo DS in August 2007. Similar to the 1988 Bikkuriman Daijikai, the game is an (improved) encyclopedia of the Akuma vs. Tenshi Seal series, containing seals from all 31 series. In the beginning the seals are all black and white, but players can obtain points and use them to buy Bikkuriman Choco, where the seals can be obtained and later viewed in color. Depending of the seal, once obtained they will also have extra content unlocked, like extra information, their alternate versions from other products (like Bikkuriman Ice), and the ability to move foil cards (like Black Zeus) to see their colors. Points are earned in three ways: Once per day a certain amount is given to the player, by answering questions in the quiz mode, or trading duplicated and unwanted (becoming black and white again and locking bonus content if all are given) seals for 5-150 (depending of the seal) points each. It is also possible to trade seals with other players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7667.jpg'),(13274,'Onsen Master','2022-09-04','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Onsen Master is a hot spring customer management game where players must create ingredients to match the various customer ailments, across the fantasy island of Izajima!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55i7.jpg'),(13275,'Tiger Tank 59 I A-Gun MP013',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Tiger Tank 59 Ⅰ: A-Gun is a top-down shooting game. Players need to control their tanks, through the enemy lines, break the enemy base, or defeat the enemy tanks.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13276,'Fatal Fury: Battle Archives Volume 2','2008-04-08','Fighting, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 2','Fatal Fury Battle Archives V2 is a collection of 3 games (on one disc) from one of SNK\'s most popular fighting game series- Fatal Fury. The titles included are Real Bout Fatal Fury, Real Bout Fatal Fury Special and Real Bout Fatal Fury 2-The Newcomers.\nThe games are known for their hand-drawn animation and character designs containing visual flair and personality with 2D gameplay that is fast, furious and addictive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49ln.jpg'),(13277,'On Scene: The Horror Stories of Fred & Karen','2021-08-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Co-op comedy horror, Onscene will depict the stories of Fred and Karen, two local cops who after a late night get a call to go on scene.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qmf.jpg'),(13278,'WWE 2K15: Hall of Pain','2015-02-18','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Xbox 360, Xbox One','World’s Strongest Slam your way through this new 2K Showcase: Hall Of Pain! Relive Mark Henry’s rise to dominance starting in 2011 through classic WWE footage and matches. Unlock historical versions of Mark Henry, Big Show, The Great Khali and more! Also receive arenas such as WrestleMania 29.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co756w.jpg'),(13279,'NXT Takeover','2020-01-01','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13280,'Cogmind','2017-10-16','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cogmind is a sci-fi roguelike epic in which you play a robot building yourself from components found or salvaged from other robots. Explore a living, breathing world through turn-based tactical combat, or sneak, hack, and fly your way to victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1udx.jpg'),(13281,'It\'s Paper Guy!','2018-05-09','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s cute, let\'s cut!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/v9spniegi0extvydxx7p.jpg'),(13282,'Nasty Neighbors: No Country for Curmudgeon','2010-06-30','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A logic-arcade game in which we plague a certain rich neighbor in various ways. The game consists in sabotaging the devices located in the neighbor\'s villa, as well as causing accidents involving the neighbor. All this is shown in a humorous form and with a big pinch of salt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j5m.jpg'),(13283,'The Power WWE Action',NULL,'Sport','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13284,'Crest','2015-04-23','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take the role of a god who guides humanity by issuing commandments. The game is centered on surviving and expressing yourself by creating a religion you find compelling. Start writing and lead your people into the future!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e26.jpg'),(13285,'Ship of Fools: Aquapocalypse Edition','2023-11-20','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Nintendo Switch','Navigate treacherous seas and blast your way through colossal leviathans to defend your home from the upcoming Aquapocalypse. The Ship of Fools Aquapocalypse Edition features the soundtrack and 2 additional DLCs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7g0o.jpg'),(13286,'WWE 2K15','2014-10-28','Fighting, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','The next generation of WWE video games has arrived! WWE 2K15 will usher in a new era of WWE video games and deliver the gaming experience that fans have sought for generations!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rws.jpg'),(13287,'WWE Survivor Series','2004-10-12','Fighting, Sport','Game Boy Advance','Get in the ring with the WWE\'s top superstars in WWE Survivor Series for the Game Boy Advance. Fight up through the ranks and challenge for the belts to become the champion in the all-new single-player mode. Turn the tables on the battle with the new reversal system and momentum shifts. WWE superstars feature their true-to-life attributes in strength, speed and submission skills -- the only difference between you and the champion is a three count. WWE Survivor Series features all-new gameplay mechanics including submission, reversal and momentum systems as players battle for the belts and defend the title in the new single-player mode or link up with friends to battle in eight match types, including Cage, Tag Team, Fatal 4 Way and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/huh4kuvj9cjcnue3qdtd.jpg'),(13288,'InMomentum','2011-10-31','Platform, Puzzle, Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','InMomentum is a minimalistic sci-fi platform racing game that challenges the players to think in both horizontal and vertical perspectives while racing against each other or against the clock in a puzzle-like environment. \n \nInMomentum gives the players the possibility to explore a visually unique world by having minimized object detail and a special focus on visual stimulation by the use of colors and shapes. The game’s style forges a strong bond between the visuals and the player, thus provides a very unique experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24o1.jpg'),(13289,'Briefcase Inc.',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A hardcore precision platformer where you switch between three differently skilled characters to collect briefcases and make your way through levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mkv.jpg'),(13290,'Reboant: Rise of the Nuhort','2017-11-21','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Reboant: Rise of the Nuhort is set at some point in the future. You will embark on a journey among the stars, following a special task force of dubious characters to conquer the planet Nohurt. By witnessing the magnificent alien civilizations, encountering and battling with mysterious yet vicious unknown races, you will gradually recover your true life story as well as the concealed civilization originations behind the schemes. \nRemember! You are not alone on the battlefield. You must work with your teammates to fight your way out! \n \nThis early access demo only was being developed with CryEngine V from Crytek.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27wr.jpg'),(13291,'Gunship: Zombie','2025-04-20','Sin género','PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9opq.jpg'),(13292,'WWE Wrestling Revolution Fight 2018',NULL,'Fighting, Sport, Indie','Android','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13293,'Cube Railway','2024-07-26','Puzzle, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Cube Railway is a puzzle game where players must strategically fit blocks to complete a railway track and set the train in motion. Reach the next level by correctly placing the cubes within the designated spots on the track.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8n2i.jpg'),(13294,'Time to Rise','2016-08-01','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','DOS','The game plays in a postapocalyptic world, it is designed to be a 1st/3rd Person Shooter. The player is sent to a small city to discover the mysteries and research what happened to the citizens.\n\nThe game will support Coop-Gameplay through local area network. There will be a level system and weapon customization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/isnh5hwl6wmbhb9n13yj.jpg'),(13295,'Packed Train','2018-07-26','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Packed Train is a casual puzzle game in which the player has to take cute little creatures of all sorts of shapes and pack them onto a train. Yeah, it\'s weird, but it\'s super fun! Enjoy the endless experience of beautiful and cute characters, colorful levels and cool gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r03.jpg'),(13296,'WWE 2K18: Deluxe Edition','2017-12-31','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"The Architect” has created the perfect blueprint for success with multiple championships, a massive fan base, and a plethora of incredible matches under his belt. Now for the first time ever, hear from Seth Rollins himself as he tells his story of how he became a sports-entertainment megastar. From his time on the independent scene, to being one of the founding members of The Shield, to his WWE Championship victory, Seth Rollins gives insight on how he became “The Undisputed Future” of WWE.\n\nThe most realistic WWE video game experience just became more intense with the addition of eight man matches, a new grapple carry system, new weight detection, thousands of new animations and a massive backstage area. A brand-new rendering engine also gives WWE 2K18 a visual overhaul and will bring the drama of WWE to life like never before!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27u1.jpg'),(13297,'WWE Universe','2019-05-28','Sport','Android, iOS','Are you ready for the most AUTHENTIC WWE game on your phone? Assemble a roster of your favorite RAW, SmackDown Live, NXT, Legend, and Hall of Fame Superstars. THIS is your chance to take on the fiercest WWE competition.\n\nYour Roster. Your Superstars. It’s YOUR Universe!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1lp2.jpg'),(13298,'WWE Aftershock','2005-07-11','Fighting, Sport','N-Gage','A WWE game for the N-Gage. Poorly received because of its limited choice of characters and long loading times.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63gl.jpg'),(13299,'Projekt','2018-03-12','Puzzle, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Minimalistic puzzler about silhouettes from creator of Evo Explores','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4jpg.jpg'),(13300,'Pilo and the Holobook','2025-04-10','Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Join Pilo and Prof on a new space adventure! Use your Holobook to turn everything into stickers and create your encyclopedia of a new world. Explore new beautiful planets and meet new friends in this sweet adventure game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8p13.jpg'),(13301,'Say Cheese','2024-10-21','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hunger speaks louder! Help our rodent hero find his way to the cheese in a maze full of challenges','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8meq.jpg'),(13302,'The Legend of Zelda: Four Swords - Anniversary Edition','2011-09-28','Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, Nintendo DSi','The Legend of Zelda: Four Swords Anniversary Edition is a special commemorative version of the 2003 Game Boy Advance release, The Legend of Zelda: A Link To The Past & Four Swords. In it, you\'ll embark on an exciting multiplayer adventure filled with action and puzzles as you work to save Princess Zelda from the evil Vaati. You can play with up to four friends at once, as long as each player has a copy of the game installed on their Nintendo 3DS system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w9s.jpg'),(13303,'Colorizing: Sunrise','2025-03-27','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Coloring by numbers game for relaxation','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ine.jpg'),(13304,'A Lullaby of Colors','2018-09-07','Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Mac, Oculus Rift','Blissful psychedelic relaxation experience for VR. Fly through breathtakingly beautiful worlds of endless sweet-tasting colors and gentle sounds. Great for relaxing, open-eyed meditation, or jaw-dropping drug-free tripping.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cnf.jpg'),(13305,'Sherlock Holmes: Consulting Detective','1991-12-31','Simulator, Adventure','Mac, DOS, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD, Sega CD','A FMV update to the classic book-based game, SH:CD challenges players to help Holmes and Watson solve three cases involving murder. One of the first CD-ROM-only releases.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vdc.jpg'),(13306,'Junk Survivor','2023-04-27','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Junk Survivor is a zombie post-apocalypse game where you loot, craft, build and farm in a struggle to survive. With a vast map to explore, a robust skillset to unlock this customizable sandbox awaits the adventurer. How long before you die!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ywk.jpg'),(13307,'No King No Kingdom','2017-11-01','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','No King No Kingdom is a first person strategy in which you can ride on a Dragon, manage villagers, build your kingdom, raise a large army, travel to the different lands, meet different races and fantastic monsters, collect artifacts and just conquer the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24zx.jpg'),(13308,'Speed Builder','2020-04-15','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','Speed Builder is out for mobile! Endless running town-builder mobile action - the leaderboards have opened - keep on running keep on building! \n \nGlobal warming is upon us! We were warned but did not listen... Build to keep your town alive! Make sure your hungry villagers stay well supplied, and gather resources as you flee disaster! Fight the terrain as you build bridges to cross pits, demolition factories to clear the way, and level up your buildings at the science lab! Got past the fire? Great, now dodge the meteors, outrun the tornado, or... are those zombies?!?!?!?!?! \n \nFeatures: \n \n- action packed gameplay - a town builder and a runner in one! \n- town building on the fly! A variety of buildings - upgrade them for a more effective town! \n- quirky art style, lots of villagers, disasters and bandits- \n- did we mention bandits? Get rid of them or they will steal your precious resources! \n- loads of achievements, leaderboards and new villagers to unlock... \n \nThis one’s a pressure cooker! See who can outrun the most disasters and go for the longest! Keep on running, keep on building!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tda.jpg'),(13309,'Broke Alchemist Emma\'s Debt Repayment Plan','2024-12-14','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Emma is a young alchemist who lives in Echichi Town. Life is great for her until one day, her mother suddenly goes missing. It turns out that her mother had incurred a hefty debt of 1,000,000 gold to the Baron of Echichi Town, Lord Umuru.\n\nThere are a variety of quests and bounties commissioned by the Adventurer\'s Guild that pay handsome rewards, but require Emma to dive head-first into peril and danger. On the other hand, she can make use of her alchemical abilities to complete quests to help out the villagers and guild alike. What mysteries await Emma on her journey to repay her debt? Will she find out the truth of what happened to her mother? Just what is going on with some of the people in Echichi Town?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9du7.jpg'),(13310,'Quest 64: Hard Mode','2022-03-04','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo 64','Quest64 Hard Mode at it’s core is a difficulty mod of the original story that ended up getting many more changes beyond just difficulty.\n\nA shortlist of most notable features would be\n- UI Hud is always visible.\n- Stat Growth and Stat Caps are changed.\n- All Monster stats are modified (Most cases being 1.5X rounded up).\n- Some Monsters were given specific tweaks to make them much harder than the average.\n- All “Spirits” are in new locations.\n- Some Treasure Chests have had their contents altered.\n- Many spells altered, Rebalancing, Deleted, some New Spells entirely.\n- Each “Element” is more closely balanced, so that players don’t feel forced to go Earth/Water.\n- Item Effects changed\n- 6 New “Items” added (2 of them have a default Icon of “White Wings” as I’m not a sprite artist)\n- Unused BGM’s have been used in certain areas.\n- The Start of leaving the Monastery is faster.\n- Mammon’s World Changed Slightly.\n- And more…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cbb.jpg'),(13311,'Paranormal Territory 2','2017-07-05','Adventure','Android, iOS','In search of challenging puzzles and a thrill to quench your adrenaline thirst? The horror game \"Paranormal Territory 2\" by \"AGaming+\" will shake your very soul! Dim the lights, plug in your headphones, and stay alert, for only your vigilance can save you from the terrors lurking in the shadows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94en.jpg'),(13312,'Xenon Racer','2019-07-11','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','It’s the year 2030. In an era of flying vehicles, a one-off championship for traditional wheel based vehicles has been organised, with cutting edge electric cars boosted by Xenon gas. Drift through cities like Tokyo and Dubai at breakneck speeds and claim your eternal victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wja.jpg'),(13313,'Synth Swinger',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Will you find the end?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42ty.jpg'),(13314,'Little Nightmares','2023-12-12','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Little Nightmares is a puzzle-platform horror adventure game developed by Tarsier Studios and published by Bandai Namco Entertainment. Set in a mysterious world, Little Nightmares follows the journey of Six, a hungry little girl who must escape the Maw, an iron vessel inhabited by monstrous, twisted beings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rdi.jpg'),(13315,'WWE Road to WrestleMania X8','2002-11-23','Fighting, Sport','Game Boy Advance','The road to WrestleMania X8 is a yearlong struggle, which has seen legends reborn, dreams shattered and lives changed forever. It isn?t glamorous, it isn?t easy, and it sure as hell isn?t destiny. It is about the hard-fought brawls, the never-ending passion and the battle hardened emotions that it takes to trudge down the path to the greatest spectacle in sports entertainment. The showcase of the immortals begins with the clash of the titans in World Wrestling Road to WrestleMania X8.\n\nGrow your Superstar through the ranks as his abilities change according to your fighting style. Create your own pay-per-view and see how the crowds react to the matches. Win bouts and see your popularity skyrocket when the Superstar\'s hats and shirts fly off the shelves in the shopzone. Begin the quest for the most illustrious title in sportsentertainment, the World Wrestling Championship. The Road to WrestleMania begins here!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48vz.jpg'),(13316,'The 2k Sports Collection','2013-11-01','Sin género','Xbox 360','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30k9.jpg'),(13317,'Timeless Paradox VR','2020-03-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Our champion failed in her mission two years ago. Everything about this battle remains mysterious. Now you have the chance to go back. Will you change the history? Will you defy this fate with her?​ Your hearty VR journey Starts here!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44of.jpg'),(13318,'Mystery of Dust','2024-06-27','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A sudden mechanical rebellion. An ordinary girl who has gained power. Faced with a \"world-class\" crisis. Is there a secret behind the rebellion? Is the power gained safe? Can a few people\'s journey save the world? Find out in the tower defense RPG, Mystery of the Dust!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g94.jpg'),(13319,'Ultimate Fatal Octopus','2024-04-30','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Touhou Project fan-made STG, also a collab game with Vtuber Syrena. Some day a random suspicious pink UFO showed up in Gensokyo. This must be an incident! As a result, Reimu and Marisa went on a journey to solve the incident.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7u8z.jpg'),(13320,'That\'s a Cow: Complete Edition','2023-06-26','Platform, Racing, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','With this bundle, you get three new headgear - a banana, an eggshell, and a crown.\n\nKey Features:\n\n- more than 20 cows to collect\n- more than 100 levels\n- shooting a stream of milk and more\n- cute graphics in pastel colors\n- rhythmic soundtrack in hip-hop and funky disco style','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sdw.jpg'),(13321,'Catch & Release','2018-08-28','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), Oculus Rift','Catch & Release places you on a beautiful mountain lake and lets you freely explore and row around while you choose your fishing spot and take in the scenery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fa1.jpg'),(13322,'Japan Food Adventure HD','2011-12-21','Sin género','iOS','Prepare, cook and serve lots of delectable Japanese dishes and snacks in this exciting and fast-paced time-management game! Get ready for a mouth-watering adventure that\'s addicting fun!\nStart off with a few sushi and soba to sell from your small mini van in Tokyo.\nServe many interesting and eager customers that come to your restaurant by preparing many kinds of Japanese food and delicacies like soba, udon, takoyaki, soup curry, dango, curry rice, omurice and much more. Serve them quickly to earn big tips. Cool down impatient guests by serving them special tea or cola before they get angry and leave.\nAfter you have accumulated enough profits, you can then take a ride to Yokohama and expand your shop from there. Travel from Yokohama to Sapporo by boat. Then fly to Osaka from Sapporo to serve a whole lot more delicious foods!\nEnter the Endless Challenge level and try to get all the top awards!\nIf you love being a manager and manage your own food empire this is the game for you! Learn how to cook Japanese food, manage customers and manage your profits! As you progress through the game you will be an expert at management and speed will come naturally. It\'s all about strategy!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13323,'Earth, Fire, And Wind','2024-04-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An open world arpg with elemental martial arts magic. The focuses are exploration, combat, and then platforming. The art is Anime / Ghibli stylized and the music is Japanese modern classical.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89mx.jpg'),(13324,'18Trip','2024-05-23','Adventure','Android, iOS','Taking place in future Yokohama, the HAMA 18 district, once a dominating \"Independent Special Tourism Zone\", finds itself in decline. The protagonist, along with their childhood friend and newly appointed mayor of HAMA 0, Kafka Oguro, embarks on the journey to return the tourism sector to its former glory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89wq.jpg'),(13325,'Avorion: Behemoth Event Series','2023-12-05','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"The Behemoths are coming! These legendary ships will now attack helpless sectors - unless someone stops them.\"','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13326,'Zombie World Apocalypse VR','2020-04-03','Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','Welcome to the world of the apocalyptic future, where in the laboratories the best scientists tried to create a cure for all known diseases, but the test led to terrible consequences that you will have to find out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l48.jpg'),(13327,'Blocks',NULL,'Puzzle','Playdate','A fun little puzzle game for Playdate','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13328,'Story of Seasons: Pioneers of Olive Town','2022-07-28','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The long-awaited brand new entry in the original farm/life simulation franchise, known in Japan as Bokujo Monogatari, makes its debut on Nintendo Switch, bringing players more freedom than ever before to shape an untamed wilderness and customize their farm down to the very tile. A new cast of marriage candidates, a town that grows and thrives along with your farm, and a request system highlight the new features, all while retaining the core elements of the STORY OF SEASONS series. Finding Earth Sprites while exploring your farmland may lead you to mysterious, fantastical lands such as gardens where the seasons never change, an island in the sky, or even the inside of a volcano!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kjz.jpg'),(13329,'Beekyr','2014-07-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beekyr is a shooter game where you will lead a bee-fighter through 23 amazing levels in fields, dark forests, rivers and dangerous caves to avenge his queen and hive from the evil wasp queens and their soldiers… The vengeance will be served!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xt2.jpg'),(13330,'Gran Turismo 5: Collector\'s Edition','2010-11-24','Racing, Simulator','PlayStation 3','Collector\'s Edition Content Details:\n- Gran Turismo 5 game\n\n- Exclusive limited edition 1:43 scale diecast 2009 Nissan GT-R Spec V with custom Gran Turismo livery designed by Polyphony Digital, produced by well-known collectible car maker Kyosho\n\n- In-depth 300-page car-lover’s guide written by the experts at Polyphony Digital, covering everything from the history of the modern automobile to driving techniques and game reference material\n\n- Custom etched Gran Turismo key chain\n\n- Voucher for five (5) exclusive high-end cars with custom Gran Turismo livery and performance upgrades\n\n- Numbered certificate of authenticity\n\n- Custom collector’s packaging','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wgz.jpg'),(13331,'Drawn to Life Collection','2010-12-23','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo DS','Your Hero. Your Adventure. Help save Raposa Village from a shadow-like evil and rebuild it back to greatness by creating a Hero in Drawn to Life Collection, 2 games in one','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jw6.jpg'),(13332,'Farm Machines Championships 2014','2014-03-14','Racing, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The ultimate farmers’ showdown is back, better than ever with brand new machines, fast paced competitive events, and new landscapes and terrain.\n\nClimb aboard Farm Machines Championships 2014 and sit in the driver’s seat behind the wheel of monstrous tractors and harvesters. There are over 40 contests and events to test your skills. New matches include forage wagons racing and grueling grain transportation battles. Keep your equipment in top racing condition or you will suffer at the track. Tune up your farm machines by changing the gearbox, engine or replacing the brakes. Modify your tractor’s look and feel with new paint, pipes, decals and awesome accessories that are sure to make you the top contender.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1kf4.jpg'),(13333,'Panic in the Woods','2024-09-13','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A horror survival and extraction game playable in single player or co-op for up to 4 players. Lost in a creepy forest, you and your friends are hunted by a monster. Stay quiet while extracting keys through nightmarish realms using items like traps, sonars, and flare guns to survive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8snd.jpg'),(13334,'Entrepreneurial tycoon','2023-03-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','《Entrepreneurial tycoon》 is a tycoon like game that breaks away from the traditional round playing method of tycoons and builds on the basis of three-dimensional city. The abundant props and events in the game can definitely bring players an unprecedented experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64wf.jpg'),(13335,'Vellum','2025-05-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into magic tomes to discover pages of increasing power, sling ink-infused spells, and choose how your foes evolve - as a group or solo!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7q0v.jpg'),(13336,'The Test Game','2024-08-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escape from an abandoned island by collecting points, food, and resources. Fight to survive. Discover the underwater world and get the best high score to unlock various in game achievements. The Test Game, my first game ever!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8k4p.jpg'),(13337,'Kanuchi: Futatsu No Tsubasa','2010-12-16','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','A bundle for PSP of Kanuchi: Shiroki Tsubasa no Shou and it\'s sequel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bwn.jpg'),(13338,'Spacelair','2019-03-22','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Spacelair is a retro sidescroller space adventure set to end in space exploration mode for all eternity.. With various gameplay challenges (health, air, energy, food, education, missions and asteroids) and without violence or shooting. Dive into the parallax future and discover your lair today!!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13339,'Fountain','2024-03-06','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Lead a squad of up to 7 members entering a constantly changing barrier. In this mysterious adventure, meet interesting companions, fight against various enemies, collect rare treasures, and reveal the secrets concealed within the barrier.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7y1l.jpg'),(13340,'Maerl Bay','2023-04-23','Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Maerl Bay is a deep-sea diving game about finding and cataloguing algae beds of maerl found within Swedish waters. Pilot Calvin the Drone and snap as many photos of maerl as you can before bringing them back up top—watch out for the treacherous marine life below and keep an eye on your battery!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ri9.jpg'),(13341,'Dead by Daylight: A Lullaby for the Dark Chapter','2017-08-21','Strategy','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A Lullaby for the Dark is a free Chapter for Dead by Daylight. Welcome to the other side of Mother Nature. A disturbing side where survival surpasses cannibalism and ends up in solitude. The Huntress will never miss her mark, she will track you, capture you and kill you. Hopefully a former rugby star might bring her down...if he doesn’t get lost in the Red Forest.\n\nA Lullaby for the Dark is a new Chapter for Dead by Daylight. It includes a new Killer, a Survivor and a Map.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6g4r.jpg'),(13342,'Mix Universe','2023-07-27','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A musical sandbox game where you play as a Mixonaut adding beautiful vibes to the universe. Everything you hear and see is 100% real-time and editable in-game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p7y.jpg'),(13343,'WWE 2K20: Deluxe Edition','2019-10-22','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','\"Players who purchase the WWE 2K20 Deluxe Edition, available in both physical and digital varieties at participating retailers, will receive in-game bonuses for the PS4 system, Xbox One and Windows PC.\n\nOffering more than 35% in savings. the WWE 2K20 Deluxe Edition includes the following items:\n- Copy of WWE 2K20 video game with Deluxe Edition packaging\n- Accelerator - Take control of your WWE 2K20 experience with the Accelerator. Players can gain access to all unlockable content available at launch via the game’s Purchasable section and take full control of the overall rankings and attribute levels of all playable characters\n- Kickstart - Get a leg up in your MyCAREER by unlocking and boosting your MyPLAYER ratings and attributes with 25 additional Attribute Points and 8 Additional Skill Points. Plus, get a 25,000 VC starting bonus to unlock more Superstar parts, Moves and more! In addition to this, start with all Boost Slots unlocked plus 15 free Boosts, 2,000 free Tokens and 400 free Deluxe Tokens\n- Complete set of WWE 2K20 Originals content packages (more details to be announced)\n- Additional bonus digital content, including playable Superstars Chyna, in her first WWE 2K appearance, Hulk Hogan, “$500 Shirt” The Rock, and Rock ‘n’ Sock Connection Mankind(more details to be announced)\n- WWE SuperCard Limited Edition Cards (included with physical versions only)\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nw2.jpg'),(13344,'Behind the Screen','2018-04-04','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','“Behind the Screen” is a game includes various elements such as puzzles, stealth modes and fighting that you can easily handle. Most stories are inspired by actual historical events of Taiwan. If you dig deep into our stories, you will find that it’s not just an “easy game”. Although players can finish the game in about one to two hours, the real thinking challenge will still goes on after you solve it.\n\nIn “Behind the Screen”, players will explore deeply into the memories of a suspected murderer’s life, in order to dig out the real truth. The whole storyline is set in 1970s when Taiwan just got rid of Martial Law Period, and Internet hasn’t widely known nor used. Through this game, you can experience how media destroys a person under the help of audiences, which echoes with the meaning of it’s Chinese name: “Screen Judges”. Without witnessing the truth, everyone could be a judge hide behind the screen, unfairly judging others’ crime by one-sided words.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ckl.jpg'),(13345,'Strike Suit Zero: Director\'s Cut','2019-05-02','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In the year 2299, an interstellar war rages. Take control of the Strike Suit – a craft with the ability to transform into a hulking suit of space armor - in a bid to save Earth from destruction. Immerse yourself in massive fleet battles where your dogfighting skills will directly affect the fate of the cosmos.\n\nDiscover a colorful and vibrant universe, with an epic story spanning 17 unique missions. Engage intelligent enemy fighters and take on colossal capital ships, exploiting weak points in their super-structure to blow them apart piece by piece. Upgrade your Strike Suit and customize your weapon load-outs to tailor combat to your tastes. Take advantage of six craft, including three Strike Suits, to experience dogfighting action as you’ve never seen it before.\n\nThe Director’s Cut is the definitive version of the game featuring a next-gen graphical overhaul, restructured campaign and additional content – including the Heroes of the Fleet campaign.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co426c.jpg'),(13346,'Harry Potter: Electronic Quidditch Game','2001-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4w31.jpg'),(13347,'Fear for Sale: City of the Past HD - A Hidden Object Mystery',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13348,'Coffee Run','2017-10-30','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Coffee Run is a 3D endless runner game in which you run through the city and collect coffee, coffee, and more coffee. The more you drink, the faster you run. Don\'t let your caffeine meter drop too low or you\'ll slow to a grinding halt! Also, watch out for the oncoming traffic!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ak4.jpg'),(13349,'Stone Story RPG','2019-08-08','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In a realm of perpetual evil, a single stone could change everything. Stone Story is an RPG set in a dark and vile world. The game\'s fluid art is painstakingly animated in plain text by a single insane game developer. It features 8 locations to explore, 8 boss fights and plenty of loot to discover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1i98.jpg'),(13350,'The Way Of Kings','2024-05-05','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','《The Way Of Kings》is a love and war based real-time action role-playing game.It tells the story of an ordinary man named Qin Shihuang, who experiences countless fantasy adventures in the end times to conquer the world, unify Kyushu and become emperor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co823h.jpg'),(13351,'Starbase','2021-06-17','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Starbase is a massively multiplayer online game with gameplay focused on building and designing spaceships and stations, exploration, resource gathering, crafting, trading, and combat. Alternatively the game features a sandbox mode where players can explore the game alone or with selected friends in their own universe.\n\nSet in a universe of vast scale and detail, the fully-destructible environment and hybrid voxel/vertex-based game mechanics enable simulations in the game at immense depth; minor collisions may break a few outer plates from your spaceship, while fast-speed crashes can rip the ship apart.\n\nThe scale and depth of the simulation in all aspects of the game gives players the ultimate freedom to exploit their innovativeness and creativity – the building blocks of success in Starbase. From constructing single spaceships with durable outer platings to creating massive automated factories and designing electricity and data networks, the players are free to do it their own way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sm0.jpg'),(13352,'Quarto','2018-06-27','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Quarto is a subtle strategy game with the simplest of rules. With more than one million units sold, this abstract game is a masterpiece with worldwide fame.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r1i.jpg'),(13353,'Secrets of the Pyramids','1994-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','Mac','Secrets of the Pyramids is an edutainment title that includes 3 modes: a movie, discovery and game mode. The Movie mode presents a dramatic reconstruction of a series of events that could have taken place in Ancient Egypt. The Discovery mode describes Ancient Egypt culture, religion and history.\n\nIn the Game mode you will follow Harold Peabody - dreamer, adventurer and optimist - on his quest for the hidden tomb of the mythical Pharaoh Ankh-Re. After finding a way to open the door to the pyramid, the player has to explore the pyramid, find useful items and overcome various obstacles. Stepping on the wrong tile or opening a wrong door may result in the untimely death of the hero. To avoid traps and decipher clues the player has to consult an \"English-Hieroglyphics translator\" found early in the game.\n\nSecrets of the Pyramids is a short, inventory-based adventure game with a simple interface (with a \"look\" and \"use\" icon). The player can only save one game at a time (by pressing the S-key). The game comes with a soundtrack and some sound effects; comments are shown in message windows that pop-up (no voices).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ubz.jpg'),(13354,'Phantom Brave: The Lost Hero - Marona & Ash Phantom Isle Outfits','2025-01-30','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13355,'LEGO Star Wars: Castaways','2021-11-19','Simulator','iOS, Mac','LEGO Star Wars: Castaways with Apple Arcade, a game subscription service with 200+ groundbreaking new games.\n\nExplore a mysterious new planet and meet new friends along the way in LEGO Star Wars: Castaways. By customizing their character, fans can live out their Star Wars fantasies in the first social, action-adventure LEGO Star Wars game, available only on Apple Arcade.\n\nBuild your own in-game LEGO minifigure from hundreds of LEGO pieces in a new Star Wars game on Apple Arcade. Discover a secret world, now home to fellow Castaways, and build a life in this new home! Explore a new island, meet new characters, race Microfighters and even throw a dance party on the island! Team up or play solo and immerse yourself in simulations, recorded by the technology of an ancient civilization, spanning moments across the Star Wars universe. Battle foes, solve puzzles, build your skills in battle arenas and learn to pilot your way through flight simulations! Unearth mysteries and discover a growing threat to life on the planet.\n\nJoin the ranks of Castaways and write your Star Wars destiny in a new, never-before-seen LEGO Star Wars adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91rn.jpg'),(13356,'I Wanna Be the Guy','2007-10-05','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','I Wanna Be the Guy: The Movie: The Game is a 2D platform indie freeware video game created by independent developer Michael \"Kayin\" O\'Reilly for Microsoft Windows using Multimedia Fusion 2. First released in October 2007, the game is not in active development despite being listed as a beta, though the source code for the game was released by Kayin in November 2011.\n\nIWBTG is most famous for its difficulty. Most of the landscape is engineered specifically to kill the player character. Alongside a traditional range of recognizable dangers, such as spikes and pits, there are many less obvious threats as well, most of which are all but impossible to avoid without either previous knowledge or trial and error.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25l1.jpg'),(13357,'Adversity Andy','2021-10-26','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A small twitchy frog takes on a mighty climb!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45l5.jpg'),(13358,'Neon Parkour 2','2023-07-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Control a blue cube and complete challenging trails and puzzles to reach the target! Red cubes that will destroy you the moment you touch them! Help the blue cube reach its destination in Neon Parkour, which has a minimal design. Jump, dash and swing to solve challenging trails!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ebu.jpg'),(13359,'Taaltris',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13360,'Survival Nation','2023-02-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR','Survival Nation is an open-world online RPG survival game designed for VR. In this game, you will kill hundreds of zombies, acquire weapons, learn new skills, craft, explore the world, complete quests, and most importantly, fight for survival. Will you join a Survival Nation?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co716z.jpg'),(13361,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Battle of the City','2006-12-31','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Plug & Play','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Battle for the City is a dedicated console system published by Tech2Go and developed by WayForward Technologies. The game is based on the 2003 TV series.\n\nThe Turtles return home to find that Splinter has been kidnapped. They set off to find who the culprit is.\n\nGameplay consists of players selecting one of four Turtles and scrolling from left to right, hopping on platforms and defeating enemies whilst collecting a number of keys to open the gate. Upon opening the gate, the player will enter a room where a boss lies in wait.\n\nIf all of a Turtle\'s energy is depleted, or he falls into a chasm, he is considered \"Captured\" and another Turtle must be selected. A game over occurs when all four Turtles are captured. By collecting Turtle Head icons, a captured Turtle can be restored for play, or \"Rescued\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ye7.jpg'),(13362,'Marvel Rivals: Season 1 - Eternal Night Falls','2025-01-10','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Darkness engulfs New York as the Timestream Entanglement leaves Doctor Strange trapped in the Entangled Astral Plane, scattering the Darkhold pages. Dracula and Doctor Doom disrupt the moon’s orbit, plunging the city into eternal night and unleashing an army of vampiric creatures. With the world on the brink, the Fantastic Four join forces with iconic Marvel heroes, standing together in the epic battle to break the mystical darkness with science. Ignite the battle against Dracula with the Fantastic Four in Marvel Rivals!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99lu.jpg'),(13363,'Wavecade','2022-07-11','Shooter, Strategy, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wavecade is a sci-fi, arcade-style, shoot-em-up where YOU control the speed of the game. Destroy blocks in style as you collect powerups and avoid hazards. How far can you go? Set your own rules and unlock your favourite mode to play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hrf.jpg'),(13364,'Pokémon Saiph','2019-11-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Game Boy Advance','This is Part 1 of #Vytron\'s ROM hack series, The VytroVerse! The sequel game is called Pokémon Sors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kva.jpg'),(13365,'The Padre','2019-04-18','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','You are THE Padre and have one job- to eliminate the weeds out of the garden of God. You are stuck in an infested demonic mansion, to do the shoveling with your guns, your faith, or even your bare hands. An unknown presence is watching, waiting to smash your armor of faith into dust. The Padre is a 3D Point-and-Click Survival Adventure that combines a deep and evocative narrative with slaughtering monsters and solving puzzles, delivered through various gloomy voxelized scenes in a Lovecraftian atmosphere.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24ao.jpg'),(13366,'Romance of the Three Kingdoms VI with Power Up Kit','2017-06-27','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Dreamcast','\"Romance of the Three Kingdoms Ⅵ with Power Up Kit\" is an expanded version of \"Romance of the Three Kingdoms Ⅵ,\" which was released in 1998 as the 6th game in the series.\n\"Time of the Heavens\" is depicted in dramatic historical events that enliven the world of the Three Kingdoms. \"Advantage of the Land\" gives strategic advantages based on castle location, economic strengths in farming and trade. \"Bonds of People\" allow people to tell their dreams and listen to the opinions of other officers. Use Time, Advantage and Bonds to conquer the continent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7o9g.jpg'),(13367,'Traffic Giant','2000-03-02','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Traffic Giant is Public Transit tycoon game released in 2000 by JoWood Productions. Players make public transit routes using various vehicles such as buses, street cars and subways from a top down isometric perspective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44ud.jpg'),(13368,'Snowkissed Romance','2019-12-16','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Fall in love in the cozy mountains of Northern Japan. Call, text, and make choices to snag the best ending!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jal.jpg'),(13369,'Assassin\'s Creed III Mobile','2012-11-16','Adventure','Android, Legacy Mobile Device','Assassin\'s Creed III is a game for the mobile platform developed by Gameloft and released alongside the main game in 2012. The game features the Mohawk Assassin Connor and is set during the events of the American Revolutionary War.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7oh1.jpg'),(13370,'Cute Lady','2020-05-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is a classic puzzle game with several levels of difficulty and beautiful arts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dc2.jpg'),(13371,'The Lost Myth',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The Lost Myth is a captivating RPG inspired by the golden era of 16-bit classics. Dive into this turn-based role-playing adventure and immerse yourself in an epic story as you journey across the vast continent of Ancaria to uncover \"The Truth\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oqu.jpg'),(13372,'The Legend of Heroes: Trails through Daybreak II - Limited Edition','2025-02-14','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The Limited Edition includes The Legend of Heroes: Trails through Daybreak II - Deluxe Edition, Collector\'s Box, Art Book, Art Card Set, Digipak Original Soundtrack, Steelbook and Atlas of Calvard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8opv.jpg'),(13373,'The Legend of Heroes: Trails through Daybreak II - Deluxe Edition','2025-02-14','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The Deluxe Edition includes the Base Game, Digital Soundtrack and Mini Art Book.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8opw.jpg'),(13374,'Yet Another One','2025-04-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore vast canyons and treacherous caves where the power of ancient runes is your only weapon. Draw runes to solve puzzles, summon magic, and avoid dangerous creatures, if you can — all while navigating dark, mysterious landscapes. Also, why is the rabbit swearing at me?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m5r.jpg'),(13375,'Luigi\'s Misadventures 2: Leviathan\'s Mania','2018-06-30','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','This is a sequel of the Luigi\'s Misadventures: Tsux Namine\'s factor.\nFull and fleshed hack, feel free to do LP in this hack.\n\nThis is a Sonic Mania themed SMW hack, which almost all the levels are based on Sonic Mania.\nFor those who love Sonic Mania and Super Mario World, this hack is a best option.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13376,'Destiny Hunter','2019-03-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Destiny Hunter is a story based RPG game in which you can control two characters, a female warrior and a female Archer. The story is about searching a better place to live and of course find your Destiny. You need to pass through cold places and reach into a better place to finish the game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13377,'Franchise Hockey Manager 7','2020-12-16','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Franchise Hockey Manager is OOTP Developments\' NHL licensed hockey management game for the 2020-21 season.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mde.jpg'),(13378,'Hello Kitty Island Adventure: Deluxe Edition','2025-01-30','Simulator, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13379,'Escape from Tarkov','2017-07-27','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escape from Tarkov is a hardcore and realistic online first-person action RPG/Simulator with MMO features and story-driven walkthrough.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xlq.jpg'),(13380,'Onechanbara Z2: Chaos - Banana Split Limited Edition','2015-08-21','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4','Zombie-Slaying Action has Never Looked So Good - The bikini samurai squad of Onechanbara return armed with a plethora of new moves and new Dare Drive or Xtasy demonic transformations for short bursts of intense power\nFour Lovely Ladies, Four Unique Playing Styles - Each of the playable ladies has her own unique weapons and abilities, and players may tag-team among them on the fly or even perform team combos\nTons of Customization and Replay Options - Mission Mode provides specific challenges to complete, while skilled gameplay will unlock Yellow Orbs which can be exchanged for new gear and outfits to help earn a top spot in the online leaderboards\nDual-Language Voice-Acting Soundtrack - Players may choose whether to enjoy the gameplay experience with original Japanese voices or - for the first time in series history - a full English dub','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13381,'Dead by Daylight: Chucky Chapter','2023-11-28','Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Meet your new best friend ‘til the end. Dead by Daylight: Chucky brings an iconic horror legend into The Fog with a new Killer: The Good Guy - Chucky. Purchasing this add-on unlocks an exclusive Charm: Good Guys Box.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fsk.jpg'),(13382,'Warhammer Underworlds: Online - Warband: Garrek\'s Reavers',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','This warband, led by the brutal killer known as Garrek Gorebeard, are frenzied cannibals, mortals whose dark excesses have drawn them ever further into the thrall of the Blood God. Blinded by battle madness, lost to the exultant sensations of combat, they care for nothing but the kill.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13383,'Japanese Escape Games: The Room with Sturdy Door','2023-01-26','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','You wake up in a strange room. Solve the tricks and riddles and open the sturdy door. Can you escape from sturdy door?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6223.jpg'),(13384,'Tinkertown x Among Us','2022-10-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After killing an entire crew and taking over their ship, an impostor mistakes a bright light in the world of Tinkertown for his secret haven, crash-landing on the planet. This opens up a brand new quest in Tinkertown where players can explore the crashed ship, solve puzzles blocking their way and escape with loot without getting caught by the impostor roaming the ship. Find a bunch of cool Among Us themed costumes, hats and decorative items and objects that can be used to decorate your houses back in your village.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p9i.jpg'),(13385,'JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken: Ougon no Kaze','2002-07-25','Fighting','PlayStation 2','JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken: Ougon no Kaze is an Action game, developed and published by Capcom, which was released in Japan in 2002.\n\nThe game is based on the fifth story arc of Hirohiko Araki\'s manga series JoJo\'s Bizarre Adventure, Vento Aureo.\n\nLe Bizzarre Avventure di GioGio: Vento Aureo‍ \'​s graphics are similar to other cel-shaded games, like Jet Set Radio. The developer Capcom has utilized a game engine called \"Artistoon\" in order to create a graphical style similar to Araki\'s art style in the manga.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3de9.jpg'),(13386,'Hookah Haze','2024-07-11','Point-and-click, Simulator, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Hookah Haze is a visual novel developed by Acquire and published by Aniplex. The game was released on July 11, 2024, for Microsoft Windows and Nintendo Switch. The player takes the role of a terminally ill protagonist, whose final wish is to manage a hookah lounge. Through this new job, they meet various patrons and bond with them through hookah. The game has been compared to VA-11 Hall-A and Coffee Talk by critics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fr1.jpg'),(13387,'Mario + Rabbids Sparks of Hope: The Last Spark Hunter','2023-06-21','Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Mario + Rabbids Sparks of Hope’s second DLC pack will take our Heroes to a brand-new planet. Explore new environments, meet fun characters, discover secrets, and face off against new enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pmd.jpg'),(13388,'Crosswords: World Tour','2025-02-13','Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Are you a fan of crosswords? Do you like travelling? Heck! Who doesn\'t?! Crosswords: World Tour is the game for you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fdn.jpg'),(13389,'Tomb Raider: Definitive Survivor Trilogy','2021-03-18','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Tomb Raider: Definitive Survivor Trilogy is the complete edition of the Tomb Raider origin games. The collection contains all the definitive edition content from each prequel title; Tomb Raider: Definitive Edition, Rise of the Tomb Raider: 20 Year Celebration, and Shadow of the Tomb Raider: Definitive Edition. Follow Lara on her formative journey across the world, starting in Tomb Raider trapped on the shrouded island of Yamatai off the coast of Japan, to the harsh Siberian tundra hiding an immortal secret in Rise of the Tomb Raider, and finally to the mountainous landscape of Peru to uncover a cataclysmic power in Shadow of the Tomb Raider.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h92.jpg'),(13390,'Culdcept','2003-12-25','Strategy','PlayStation 2','A strategy/board game that combines elements of Monopoly and Magic: The Gathering, Culdcept is a direct port of the Dreamcast title of the same name. Features include 480 different cards, 28 stages, and arenas designed by tournament champions from Japan. Initially released in America with a print run of only 30,000 copies the game was later re-printed in a \"Game of the Year\" edition in higher quantities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yeo.jpg'),(13391,'Beyond Good & Evil','2003-11-14','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Beyond Good & Evil is an action-adventure game with elements of puzzle-solving and stealth-based games. The player controls the protagonist, Jade, from a third-person perspective. Jade can run, move stealthily, jump over obstacles and pits, climb ladders, push or bash doors and objects, and flatten herself against walls. As Jade, the player investigates a number of installations in search of the truth about a war with an alien threat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n6b.jpg'),(13392,'A Prison Digging Game','2025-03-27','Simulator','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','You are in prison and want to escape. To do so, you can only dig a hole. Luckily, you have a map in hand. Read it carefully and use your digging power to find your way to freedom. Look for fossils, pipelines, and antique objects to locate yourself on the map.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ntw.jpg'),(13393,'Equaboreal 12.21','2019-12-21','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Equaboreal 12.21 is a small and strange speculative narrative game about plant people who celebrate the winter solstice by opening bottled light delivered from the equator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mrb.jpg'),(13394,'Hearthstone: Forged in the Barrens','2021-03-22','Strategy, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Forged in the Barrens will launch worldwide with 135 new collectible cards!\n\nSet in the dusty savannah territory of the Barrens, a literal crossroads where tauren, troll, and orc adventurers gather to prove their worth. Mercenaries of old and newcomers alike train for an upcoming conflict with the Alliance. This set introduced the new keyword, Frenzy, which causes a minion to do something the first time it takes damage as long as it survived the attack. Additionally, it added seven Spell schools to the game; Arcane, Fel, Fire, Frost, Holy, Nature, and Shadow. This applies to new spells but also old ones, opening up many new synergies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ust.jpg'),(13395,'My Kingdom for the Princess HD',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13396,'Don\'t Go into the Woods','2019-06-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 10 year old boy, lost in the woods, must rescue his sister and find his way home. Explore, survive, and craft tools to help navigate the woods, help the local creatures, and find a way to escape the woods before you lose your mind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1n8r.jpg'),(13397,'Slave Zero','2014-03-25','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), Dreamcast','It\'s 500 years in the future. Man and machine are virtually on and the greatest megacity in the world is locked in a brutal war. You are the ultimate saboteur and part of an elite fighting force. Your mission: steal the largest, most sophisticated bio-mechanical attack weapon ever designed ...and kick some serious ass!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e3x.jpg'),(13398,'She\'s My Vampire','2020-01-07','Visual Novel','Android','Find your perfect anime girlfriend in this unique visual novel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4was.jpg'),(13399,'That\'s a Cow: Special Edition','2023-04-24','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Soar through the air and don\'t get milked in this cute game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sdl.jpg'),(13400,'Rocket League: Season 13','2023-12-06','Racing, Sport, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Tape your Season highlights on VHS.\nThe 90s and early 2000s, a time that was bold, radical, and most importantly: destined to return in Rocket League Season 13! Get ready for reminiscent nights at Mannfield—Season 13 kicks off December 6.\n\nHere’s the 4-1-1 on this Season’s Rocket Pass Premium. Upon purchase, you’ll auto-unlock the Ace Car Body. Go up the Tiers to unlock other new items like the RC Antenna, CRT Wheels, Primo Car Body, yadda yadda yadda…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gy1.jpg'),(13401,'Active Neurons 2','2020-09-16','Music, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Active Neurons 2 is a game that trains the player in spatial logical thinking. Your main task in the game is to collect enough energy to discover the 12 greatest inventions of mankind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ker.jpg'),(13402,'Cemetery Warrior 4','2019-10-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game immerses you in the chaotic gameplay under Heavy Metal. Shoot crowds of various monsters whose variety of AI is amazing: There are jumping monsters and earthworms, monsters shooting with spikes, monsters that run along walls, huge fiery demons and mighty titans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mzc.jpg'),(13403,'Nintendo World Championships: NES Edition - Deluxe Set','2024-07-18','Platform, Racing','Nintendo Switch','The Nintendo World Championships: NES Edition – Deluxe Set includes:\n\nNintendo World Championships: NES Edition game card\n\nGold-colored NES Game Pak and stand to commemorate the 1990 World Championships\n\n13 art cards\n\nSet of 5 pins','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oks.jpg'),(13404,'Notes on a Mystery','2023-12-17','Puzzle','Web browser','This is a short mystery story where you have to pick the right words to answer questions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87uk.jpg'),(13405,'Late Ming Fly Guy','2025-04-10','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A platformer where players use arrow keys and spacebar to jump/fly. The game randomly generates floating platforms and obstacles, and players can choose to collide with monsters to eliminate them or dodge them, challenging themselves to continuously ascend upward.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o9d.jpg'),(13406,'The Three-Body Problem','2019-06-01','Indie','Web browser','These dark, deep woods are home to wild creatures and wild magic, and they\'re only dangerous if you disrespect either one. They\'re also your home. Here, you\'re safe, loved, and free, and tonight is a very special night; a good one for a ritual.\n\nUntil a stranger interrupts your plans, and turns your night, and your life in an entirely new direction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4n5w.jpg'),(13407,'Alchemic Jousts','2016-12-16','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','- Single and Multiplayer gameplay. Play vs AI and advance through the game\'s campaign, discovering new Skills and new game modes or challenge a friend with either local or on-line multiplayer.\n\n- Strategic combat, where your actions and skill of execution matter as much as your choices before the match starts!\n\n- Over 180 skills and upgrades to discover. Combine your known skills to discover new ones and expand your arsenal.\n\n- Multiple game modes with different objectives that will make you change the way you play as much as the skills you choose. Those include Combat, Endless, King of the Hill, Attack, Capture...\n\n- Random Global Effects, which change the general rules of each match in subtle or radical ways. The varying rules will keep the game play fresh and require you to consider the Skills you use to approach them!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ci7.jpg'),(13408,'A Ghost Story for Christmas','2016-12-24','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','A text-based game made by Charlie Dart. It is a game about ghosts, yes, but it\'s also about getting to know a character for whom things are not going to end well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cts.jpg'),(13409,'Avaris 2','2015-12-14','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Check out this battlefield management game from Japanese indie developer Studio GIW.  You are the Empress fighting to take back control of the Avaris Empire.  Battle by battle as you recover territory, the number of fighters grows to near epic proportions up to 36,000 individual warriors on the battlefield! Compete for high scores against your Steam friends.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13410,'You are SpamZapper 3.1',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5082.jpg'),(13411,'Natsu no Sagashimono: What We Found That Summer','2024-09-28','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Summer vacation is finally here, and the next few weeks promise to be anything but uneventful! Natsu has just 30 days to acclimate to life in the countryside, help the locals face their demons, find that special someone, and gain the self-confidence to return home with his head held high!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dxc.jpg'),(13412,'Talking Cat Emma Ballerina','2019-06-09','Simulator','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','My virtual pet Emma the cat has reached a new stage in her life: ballet dance school for talking pets. This talking kitty cat will show off her new ballerina dance skills in Talking Cat Emma - My Ballerina virtual pet game. Teach my talking cat Emma virtual pet bring style and grace into the world of talking pets. Talking Cat Emma - My Ballerina is a talking cat app that enriches all those dance games and ballerina games out there.\n\nCan you multitask and make your talking cat ballerina glow from head to toe by making sure she is well fed, examined and rested? Emma the Ballerina, my talking cat, needs you every step of the way, so download Talking Cat Emma - My Ballerina virtual pet game and help your talking cat pave the way to success! Virtual cat talking games will from now on take your breath away while my talking cat Emma parades her dance steps and ballet moves in her prima ballerina costume.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6i3o.jpg'),(13413,'BinaryBotsVR','2018-11-22','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Binary VR is a virtual reality experience of HEX WORLD, Binary leaves in HEX WORLD with his friend DIMM.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13414,'Cave of Illusions','2019-10-30','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A psychological indie horror game. While seeking to find the truth about the disappearances in the forest you find a lot more than you expected.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wrz.jpg'),(13415,'Doodle Champs','2025-05-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doodle Champs is the ultimate experience for artists and doodlers alike! Play an exciting assortment of doodle-tastic party games with endless replayability, or just draw on a shared online canvas with your pals!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gzd.jpg'),(13416,'Dragon Rising','2021-06-09','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take you to the mysterious world of giant dragons, where you can breed various types of giant dragons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ox4.jpg'),(13417,'Connected Hearts: The Musketeers Saga - Collector\'s Edition','2023-02-21','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Love can help you overcome many obstacles, even if the fate of an entire kingdom is at stake! Can two heroes in love make it through? Find out in this game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69pt.jpg'),(13418,'Phantom Brave: The Lost Hero - Digital Deluxe Edition','2025-01-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13419,'Sonic & All-Stars Racing Transformed: Ryo Hazuki DLC','2014-01-14','Racing, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sonic & All-Stars Racing Transformed Ryo Hazuki DLC\n\nYou can now race as Shenmue\'s Ryo Hazuki alongside other favourite characters in Sonic & All-Stars Racing Transformed!\n\n• Download now to race as Ryo in his unique transforming vehicle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kmb.jpg'),(13420,'Fire Emblem: Immortal Sword',NULL,'Strategy, Tactical','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A fan-made prequel to the popular Fire Emblem: Blazing Sword (FE7), Fire Emblem: Immortal Sword (FE7x) is the tale of a vast conspiracy to throw the world of Elibe into chaos, and of three young leaders caught in its wake. A tale of questionable alliances, political intrigue, and the confusion of conflict. Follow a cast of your favorite characters in a brand new adventure, as their mettle is tested in both battlefields and moral dilemmas. Explore a world of new classes, skills, and features that bring the classic land of Elibe into a modern standard of tactical depth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93vw.jpg'),(13421,'Silent Hunter II','2001-11-06','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','U-Boats vs. Allied and American naval forces: 3D combat that will take you to new heights and depths in underwater action.\n\nSilent Hunter II, the simulation in the critically acclaimed Silent Hunter series, recreates the desperate battles in the Atlantic between Hitler\'s infamous U-boat force and British and American convoys - lifeblood of the Allied war effort.\n\nBuilding on a game widely regarded as the best of its kind, Silent Hunter II represents the next generation in WWII submarine simulations. Its impressive list of features and unrivaled game-play, assure that the Silent Hunter series will remain at the forefront of underwater simulations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w61.jpg'),(13422,'Boulder Dash: Ultimate Collection','2022-01-28','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Boulder dash Ultimate Collection for the Nintendo Switch includes two Boulder Dash titles, the Boulder Dash 30th Anniversary and Boulder Dash Deluxe. The game features more than 400 newly designed levels across two games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4alk.jpg'),(13423,'Hatris','1991-07-19','Puzzle','Game Boy','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co719a.jpg'),(13424,'Rockmen R2: Dr. W*ly no Saiki!!','2018-12-30','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Touhou Doujin game based on Rockman (Megaman), developed by Capricorn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sqe.jpg'),(13425,'Videomation','1991-06-02','Platform, Simulator','Nintendo Entertainment System','With Videomation, everyone is an artist! Videomation has drawing tools, stamps and an animation feature that lets your imagination go wild! Use with the NES to create vivid pictures with spectacular colors - some you can even program to move! Add fun stamps to your drawing and direct the animation selection to make it come alive. Hook up your VCR with Videomation to create wonderful, crazy additions to your family videos. It\'s easy enough for everyone! Bring the action of a starship battle or the mystery of a dark forest into your home. Remember, the only limits to Videomation is your own imagination!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oy3.jpg'),(13426,'Igo: Kyuu Roban Taikyoku','1987-04-14','Sport, Card & Board Game','Family Computer Disk System, Family Computer','A Japan-only Go game developed and published by Bullet-Proof Software for the Famicom Disk System.\n\nIgo: Kyuu Roban Taikyoku (\"Go: 9 Row Grid Boardgame\") is a Go video game that was originally released for the Famicom Disk System on August 11, 1987 in Japan. It was the first Famicom game developed by Bullet-Proof Software: a development studio operating out of Hawaii that would later be responsible for Nintendo\'s version of Tetris, among other games. This version of Go is better suited for beginners, as it contains simpler 9x9 grids rather than the regulation 19x19.\n\nIgo: Kyuu Roban Taikyoku has a credit for Edge Computing on its title screen; it is assumed some of the game\'s coding was taken from Edge\'s C64 game Micro Go.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qnqt4nj5rgxfp0e9cj2x.jpg'),(13427,'Borderlands 3: Psycho Krieg and the Fantastic Fustercluck','2020-09-10','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ready to say goodbye to sanity, Vault Hunter? Psycho Krieg and the Fantastic Fustercluck, the fourth campaign add-on for Borderlands 3, will send you on a savage and surreal journey into madness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g3k.jpg'),(13428,'Metal Slug: Super Vehicle-001',NULL,'Shooter, Platform','Game Boy Advance','A Game Boy Advance port was announced to be in development but was never released to the public.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cvo.jpg'),(13429,'Titan Quest Anniversary Edition','2016-08-31','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','For its 10 year anniversary, Titan Quest will shine in new splendour. This Anniversary Edition combines both Titan Quest and Titan Quest Immortal Throne in one game, and has been given a massive overhaul for the ultimate ARPG experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ird.jpg'),(13430,'Master Detective Archives: Rain Code Plus - Limited Edition',NULL,'Sin género','PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13431,'Rayland','2022-07-13','Puzzle, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Your mission is to help the inhabitants of Rayland to transport the energy of the Domus through the various lands contained in the path. For this, you must correctly position the Reflectus and rotate them so that the energy rays reach the necessary Domus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lz1.jpg'),(13432,'Skorecery','2019-04-04','Fighting, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4','Skorecery is a fast-paced local multiplayer sports-like set in a tournament of mystics. Players engage in a contest of reflexes and split-second decision-making to protect their Runes and destroy their opponents\'. Different Spells, Modes, and Curses force players to stay on their toes and face overcome new challenges every game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1iyg.jpg'),(13433,'Master Detective Archives: Rain Code - Ch. Halara: Raining Cats & Dog','2023-09-28','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','The third DLC for Master Detective Archives: Rain Code is a substory that features protagonist Halara Nightmare, and allows players to control the Master Detective with the Forensic Forte \"Postcognition.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7562.jpg'),(13434,'Warhammer Underworlds: Online - Warband: Eyes of the Nine',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','In the name of the mighty Tzeentch, god of magic and sorcery, Vortemis the All-seeing and his sworn acolytes seek to open a pathway between Shadespire and the Realm of Chaos. Unlock this warband and play as the Eyes of the Nine in Warhammer Underworlds: Online now.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13435,'To Clean The Mountain',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','To Clean The Mountain is a platforming adventure where you throw yourself towards the summit. The spirit of the mountain will talk with you as you traverse a variety of environments.\n\nEnvironments\nHandcrafted levels based on a variety of mountainous landscapes. Each environment features unique mechanics for you to interact with and learn, combining the interesting platforming elements with puzzle solving.\n\nThe Mountain\nElements of the world change based on how you assist the mountain. The game is completable regardless of your choices, but the difficulty is up to you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vjh.jpg'),(13436,'Spooky Pixel Hero','2024-06-20','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','A chilling homage to retro gaming – Rediscover the magic of classic games and retro platformers with a terrifying twist. SPOOKY PIXEL HORROR combines the beloved aesthetics of vintage 2D pixel games with a deeply immersive horror narrative that will keep you on edge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ord.jpg'),(13437,'Bit.Trip Core','2012-09-02','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Nintendo 3DS, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Bit.Trip Core visits a darker place in CommanderVideo\'s saga, taking the player into unfamiliar territory as they use NES-style controls to blast their way through the barrage of Beats in this rhythm-music adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86b7.jpg'),(13438,'Super Hunchback','1992-05-01','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Game Boy','Quasimodo straps on his trusty hump one last time to rescue his paramour, the perpetually-imperiled Esmeralda, this time captured by a new villain, the horrible Halfenpounder.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42no.jpg'),(13439,'Tomb Raider: Collector\'s Edition','2012-11-28','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Tomb Raider, the player controls the female archaeologist Lara Croft, in search for the three mysterious Scion artefacts across the world. The game is presented in third person perspective. Lara is always visible and the camera follows the action from behind or over her shoulder. The world she inhabits is fully drawn in three dimensions and characterized by its cubic nature. Ledges, walls and ceilings mostly sit at 90 degrees to each other, but sometimes feature sloping planes.\nThe object of Tomb Raider is to guide Lara through a series of tombs and other locations in search of treasures and artefacts. On the way, she must kill dangerous animals and other creatures, while collecting objects and solving puzzles to gain access to an ultimate prize, usually a powerful artefact. Gunplay is restricted to the killing of various animals that appear throughout each stage, although occasionally Lara may be faced with a human opponent. Instead the emphasis lies on solving puzzles and performing trick jumps to complete each level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hfy.jpg'),(13440,'Bomb Jack','1984-12-31','Arcade','Amstrad CPC','In Bomb Jack, the player controls Jack, who must collect all the bombs in order to complete the current round and go onto the next one. This sounds easy, right? Wrong! Making Jack\'s task difficult are numerous enemies such as birds, mummies, turtles, and orbs. In each round, collecting a number of bombs results in a bonus coin appearing, and collecting this coin will make the player\'s score increase 2 to 4 times. More often than not, the \"power ball\" appears, and when you collect this, you can defeat enemies and have more time to collect all the bombs. There is also the \"E\" coin, which gives Jack one additional life, but rarely does this coin appear. The more you progress through the game, the more difficult it becomes, as enemies travel more quickly to get you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8avk.jpg'),(13441,'Super Tetris 2 + BomBliss','1992-12-18','Puzzle','PC-9800 Series, Legacy Computer, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Super Famicom','Aside from including a traditional Tetris mode, Super Tetris 2 + Bombliss included BomBliss mode that featured bombs used to destroy surrounding pieces after a line was completed. It also included a Tetris \"C Mode\" in which the ground level blocks automatically rise after a set number pieces are destroyed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jda.jpg'),(13442,'Super BomBliss DX','1999-12-10','Puzzle','Game Boy Color','Super Bombliss DX is a colorized remaster of Tetris Blast. It is a Japanese-exclusive and contains all the features of Blast, with the addition of a Puzzle mode.\n\nIt features a different soundtrack and revises the appearance of the enemies in \"Battle\" mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q7u.jpg'),(13443,'Doom 3: Limited - Collector\'s Edition','2002-07-20','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox','The Limited Collector\'s Edition has a metal box cover and includes:\nThe Ultimate DOOM\nDoom II: Hell on Earth\nDoom³\nInterviews with the id crew\nA behind the scenes featurette\nConcept and production art gallery','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6z2x.jpg'),(13444,'Warhammer Underworlds: Online - Warband: Sepulchral Guard',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sworn to the God of Death\'s service, the Sepulchral Warden and his fleshless undying swarm the streets of Shadespire. Their sheer numbers overwhelm all who would oppose them. Unlock this warband and play as the Sepulchral Guard in Warhammer Underworlds: Online.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13445,'Tank Battle: East Front 1942','2014-03-15','Simulator, Strategy','iOS','Tank Battle: East Front 1942 gives a unique wargaming experience on iPhone and iPad. A game of tactical combat on the Russian Front during 1942. Fight as the Germans or the Soviets in a series of ever more complex missions. The game is the second in a series of games that started with Tank Battle: East Front 1941.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13446,'AdventureQuest Worlds','2008-06-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Updated every Friday with new stories, items, quests, monsters and more! Join thousands online and defend the world from Drakath and his 13 Chaos Lords. Team with your friends and take on challenging bosses to get rare rewards! With a storyline that updates weekly, our very first MMO always has something new for you to do, epic loot to collect, and other heroes to battle with... or against!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7du9.jpg'),(13447,'The Settlers Online','2015-08-19','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Build a medieval kingdom in The Settlers Online!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co443d.jpg'),(13448,'Cryptica',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Cryptica is a narrative-based psychological horror game where the apocalypse is just the beginning. Explore the enigmatic lands of Antarctica and its surrounding areas while the world ends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hct.jpg'),(13449,'Lemmings 2: The Tribes','1994-12-31','Puzzle, Strategy','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','This port of Lemmings 2 sees the graphics stay mostly the same, with only some slight downgrades in quality and performance due to the less powerful hardware. Matt Furniss composed the new music which is just the original music rescored for the Genesis, and sounds substantially different due to the different soundcards and lesser sampling support.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83rl.jpg'),(13450,'Warcraft II: Remastered','2024-11-13','Real Time Strategy (RTS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Captain your own fleet in the second Warcraft title created in 1995, now remastered with vivid, all-new visuals and modernized controls!\n\nWar between orc and humans rages on across the seas, and the fate of the world hangs in the balance as the great tacticians of the Horde and the Alliance clash. Only one thing is certain: winning this war will demand unprecedented cunning, courage, and nerves of steel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91ff.jpg'),(13451,'Super Tetris 2 + BomBliss: Gentei-ban','1994-01-21','Puzzle','Super Famicom','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64r0.jpg'),(13452,'Master Detective Archives: Rain Code - Ch. Fubuki: Fubuki\'s Luckiest Day','2023-08-31','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','The second DLC for Master Detective Archives: Rain Code is a substory that features protagonist Fubuki Clockford, and allows players to control the Master Detective with the Forensic Forte \"Time Leap.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7560.jpg'),(13453,'Animated Jigsaws: Japanese Women','2018-10-04','Puzzle, Simulator, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Complete moving jigsaw puzzles alone or team up with friends and finish them together! Animated Jigsaws: Japanese Women contains short videos as jigsaw puzzles that are pieced together to reveal beautiful ladies. The video puzzles capture 10 beautiful Japanese ladies wearing traditional kimono and yukata clothes in various locations such Kyoto City, by a lake, and relaxing in a hot spring bath. An easy-to-use interface such as separating edge and inner pieces makes solving puzzles fun and relaxing. Tackle the puzzles by yourself, or team up with friends and solve them together. Features: Solve puzzles with friends in multiplayer for up to 4 players Easy-to-play traditional jigsaw puzzle Selection of three background colors 3 sizes for each puzzle: 60, 120 and 240 pieces Saves time spent completing each puzzle and each size Separate edge and inner pieces Each piece snaps into place for stress-free experience Ability to snap individual pieces together Save a puzzle half way and continue later Selection of traditional Japanese music to choose from','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co570e.jpg'),(13454,'A Regular Store','2025-03-20','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9leu.jpg'),(13455,'Ori Collector\'s Edition','2020-12-22','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Ori series sits atop the mantle of platforming greatness — artistically profound, technically impressive, and obsessively tuned gameplay. And for the first time ever, Ori and the Blind Forest and its followup, Ori and Will of the Wisps are available together in a premium physical Collector’s Edition. In true iam8bit fashion, we’ve spared no detail and collaborated intensely with developer Moon Studios to create this immaculately custom collection. Contions: Premium “Transforming” Display Box with Glow-in-the-Dark Finish, Majestic Stained Glass style Art Piece, “The Flora & Fauna of Ori” Field Guide, Sketchbook Zine featuring rarely seen production art, Collectible Art Card Set, Hard Enamel, Glow-in-the-Dark Pin, Digital Download Cards for Ori and the Blind Forest and Ori and the Will of the Wisps soundtracks by composer Gareth Coker and Physical Editions of Ori and the Will of the Wisps and Ori and the Blind Forest, featuring Exclusive, Reversible Cover Art.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mnu.jpg'),(13456,'Nelke & the Legendary Alchemists: Ateliers of a New World','2019-03-25','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','A spin-off in the Atelier franchise featuring characters from past games.\n\nThe game focuses on town building and management.\nThe main character is not an alchemist, unlike the main games in the franchise, but she can work with them and let them manage an atelier in town making it their own.\n\nGust hopes to make this game its own series in the future while working on the main line of Atelier games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21dr.jpg'),(13457,'Stars of the Valkyrie','2025-03-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Endless runner action has never been more dynamic with a unique 3D movement system. Fly through the stars in this Neo-Arcade game as you dodge asteroids shoot down enemies ships and protect transport ships. When you have finished upload and compare your score against the best from around the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lm9.jpg'),(13458,'Retro First Friday Collection #4',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bhj.jpg'),(13459,'Locked','2020-07-22','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Maks is looking for a waitress he hasn’t seen for over a month. Intuition brings him to an abandoned mansion enshrouded in mystery and secrets. Will Maks find and save the girl?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d6i.jpg'),(13460,'Forza Horizon 4: 2019 Chevrolet Corvette ZR1',NULL,'Racing','Sin plataforma','2019 Chevrolet Corvette ZR1','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13461,'Super Bombliss','1995-03-17','Puzzle','Super Famicom','Super Bombliss is a Puzzle game, developed by TOSE and published by Bullet Proof Software, which was released in Japan in 1995.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43o4.jpg'),(13462,'Cairn: Mathair\'s Curse',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When an ancient conspiracy threatens the land of Albaness, only one boy and his dreams stands between his family and the end of the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8af8.jpg'),(13463,'Sorcery Saga: Curse of the Great Curry God','2018-06-04','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','Play as Pupuru, a young, ambitious girl on a quest to obtain ingredients for the legendary curry to save her friend’s restaurant. With the help of the moody creature Kuu and the noncommittal Puni, she’ll have to defeat the host of weird, sometimes appetizing creatures that stand in her way! But beware, once you enter a dungeon, Pupuru will need all her skills to fight fore if she falls, her levels and items obtained will disappear! Get ready for a truly delectable storyline with a side of awesome, challenging gameplay!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7z0x.jpg'),(13464,'Monmusu Girls: Autobattler',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a strategic and adventurous idle auto-battler where you\'ll collect a variety of monmusu girls, form your adventuring team, and challenge the Demon King! Each girl comes with unique skills and bonds, and mastering the right combinations is the key to victory. Embark on a magical journey!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a2h.jpg'),(13465,'Midnight Transmission','2024-10-27','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Midnight Transmission is a collaborative Yume Nikki fangame. In this game you take control of Toby as he explores the weird and surreal worlds inside his dreams.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e7d.jpg'),(13466,'Lords of the Fallen','2023-10-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','A vast world awaits in all-new, medieval dark fantasy action-RPG, Lords of the Fallen. As one of the fabled Dark Crusaders, embark on an epic quest to overthrow Adyr, the demon God.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72u9.jpg'),(13467,'Ruza','2022-11-11','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ruza is a free RPG where you lead a group of misfits to stop a monster, a vile reindeer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mx3.jpg'),(13468,'Bizarre Earthquake','2016-05-11','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bizarre Earthquake is a third-person point & click adventure game. The story is about a seismologist and her assistant who try to uncover the mysteries behind a bizarre earthquake they encounter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wp6xgehw3bjiwp0epp1u.jpg'),(13469,'Crabby Fishes',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A vibrant and fast-paced tower defense strategy bursting with humor and color! Lead a fearless army of crabby defenders against quirky alien invaders, unleash wacky abilities, and clean up the ocean in epic battles full of chaos and fun.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13470,'Linia super',NULL,'Puzzle, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Linia is back and does it in style with revamped visuals and more than 100 levels packed with original and unpredictable puzzles.\n\nIn \"Linia super\" - the second edition of the game downloaded by over 1 million users worldwide - you will once again go hunting for color sequences, drawing a line to create the correct connection between the different shapes on the screen.\n\nBut this time, to make it even more engaging, you will also have to keep an eye on your ink supply while you draw lines and collect the \"Liniacoins\" that will help you through the exciting chapters of the game.\n\nIt\'s easy to get carried away by this mesmerizing dance of colors that pulse, spin, hide and twirl, going to great lengths to avoid being caught by your line.\n\nIt will take skill, a keen eye and a sense of rhythm to get the sequence right. Are you up for the challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mo4.jpg'),(13471,'Elk Attack','1987-12-31','Sin género','Atari 2600','Silly name aside, Elk Attack is really a Pac-Man type game but without a maze. You control a Yo-Yo type machine, which must use its string to latch onto and destroy all the colored blocks on the screen. Along the way you\'ll encounter strange worm like creatures, which will attempt to disrupt your Yo-Yo. To help you fight the worms there are power squares scattered around the board which when grabbed will render your Yo-Yo temporarily invincible and increase your speed. However unlike Pac-Man touching a worm while invincible will only net you points, and will not destroy of them. Because of this its best to just go about your business and clear the maze instead of hunting down the worms. Elk Attack is a port of the obscure Taito arcade game Electric Yo-Yo! Programmer Mark Hahn named the game Elk Attack as a joke, and probably would have changed the name had it been published. The game was left in its current state. The following is hidden in the code: ELK ATTACK (c) 1987 Mark R. Hahn','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mnk.jpg'),(13472,'Empires:The Rise','2019-01-15','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','《Empries:The Rise》 is the a classical Real-Time-Strategy (R.T.S.) game. The game is designed to play on the cross-platforms, to restore war sandbox experiences, with localized play & control.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13473,'Bloody Hills','2024-09-20','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bloody Hills is an intense and heart-pounding survival horror game set in the depths of a secluded forest camp. As night falls, you find yourself trapped in a twisted game of cat and mouse with a relentless killer known as The Hiker. Armed with only your wits and limited resources, you must fight to survive until dawn while evading the sadistic clutches of this merciless predator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95c6.jpg'),(13474,'Wild & Adventure Pinball','2021-12-10','Simulator, Pinball, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Enjoy 6 games in one with the perfect reproduction of real pinball machines, with all kinds of graphic details and sounds. Discover all the secrets, complete all the missions and become number 1 in the world or the best among your Friends, posting your high score on the online leaderboard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6z1c.jpg'),(13475,'Famicom Mukashibanashi: Yuuyuuki','1989-11-14','Adventure, Visual Novel','Family Computer Disk System','Famicom Mukashibanashi: Yuuyuuki is a 2-part Famicom Disk System game.\n\nYuuyuki is an adventure game played by choosing from several text commands shown on screen. It resembles its predecessor, Shin Onigashima, in its implementation of the \"Change Character\" command, usage of traditional Japanese fairytales, and general screen layout and appearance. The story-line is a parody of the Chinese novel Journey to the West, where two main characters, Goku and Chao, embark upon separate journeys to find one another.\n\nIn Yuuyuki, the \"Change Character\" command can switch between a maximum of five different characters. However, there are very few points in the game where it can actually be used to such extent. Its main use is to switch between Goku and the others accompanying him. Like Shin Onigashima, the character in use can greatly affect the descriptive text shown on screen, and the significant increase in number of characters allowed for more variety in each scene. It is possible to enjoy the game by viewing the reactions towards choosing completely unrelated characters or commands in certain situations.\n\nWhile Shin Onigashima demanded rather complex puzzle-solving abilities, Yuuyuki mainly focuses on having the player carefully read and understand the story-line. Puzzles are solved easily in this game, and very few choices actually lead to a \"game over\" screen. Easy trivia questions and simple action gameplay emerge at certain points, and players may find themselves searching for the obvious answer on screen more often than thinking hard to solve the puzzle at hand.\n\nMain changes in gameplay from Shin Onigashima include the implementation of the \"Ittaisan\" command, which saves progress at any point during the game, and faster animation of game text. The shortening in load time after choosing commands, and an overall decrease in difficulty allowed Yuuyuki to run at a much quicker tempo than its predecessor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44kn.jpg'),(13476,'Doomsday Warrior','1993-03-01','Fighting','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','The Doom Squad is a group of fighters under the control of an evil wizard. They threaten earth and bring destruction. One of the Doom Squad members betrays his group and becomes the Doomsday Warrior. This warrior must then defeat the other members of the Squad and finally the wizard controlling it all.\n\nDoomsday Warrior is a fighting game. Choosing one of the Doom Squad members to become to the Doomsday warriors, you must defeat your opponents. Each character has the ability to punch, kick, jump and unleash a special move (usually by being close to the enemy and using either jump, kick or punch). The better the skill in fighting, the more ability points are earned. These ability points can be used to improve various areas of the fighter after battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vjo.jpg'),(13477,'Sonic Epoch Advance',NULL,'Sin género','Game Boy Advance','Sonic Epoch features SatAM Sonic in a time travel adventure as he is blasted 10 years into the future; a dark future where Dr. Robotnik has essentially won, and the very few remaining Knothole Freedom Fighters are barely clinging to life. Sonic arrives to reinvigorate the world and perhaps still be able to fight back the evil Doctor and hopefully somehow get back to his own time.\n\nThe GBA version was a revival of the cancelled PC version. While the GBA version is \"finished\", it was a rush job, more for the sake of filling the gap of the previous version\'s incomplete status, and did not completely honor all aspects of the original story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fw3.jpg'),(13478,'NeuroNet: Mendax Proxy',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','NeuroNet is a \'Reigns\' inspired story-driven adventure where your choices will decide the fate of a cyberpunk city. As a new A.I, created to manage the city of Catena, you have the power to shape its future and its people. But where will your choices lead them, into prosperity or ruin?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3v7w.jpg'),(13479,'Carpathian Skies',NULL,'Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A downloadable visual novel for Windows, macOS, and Linux','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8l4e.jpg'),(13480,'Warhammer Underworlds: Online - Warband: The Chosen Axes',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Honor, gold, and a desire to banish the curse that haunts the city of Shadespire - these are what drive the mercenary Fyreslayers. Unlock this warband and play as The Chosen Axes in Warhammer Underworlds: Online now.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13481,'Welltris','1990-12-31','Puzzle','Arcade, DOS, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','Welltris is a puzzle video game, developed by Doka and licensed to Bullet-Proof Software. Adaptations were made by Sphere, Inc for Spectrum Holobyte, and by Infogrames. It was originally released for DOS and Macintosh in 1989. It was subsequently ported to the Amiga and Atari ST in 1990 and the ZX Spectrum and Commodore 64 in 1991.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rbf.jpg'),(13482,'Find Oann',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Find Oann is an action-horror game that follows the story of the protagonist, Thomas, who must solve mysteries, arm himself, and fight against horrendous creatures to survive and find the mysterious Oann.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1q.jpg'),(13483,'Among the Stars',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are given a second chance in life just to find yourself trapped in a distant galaxy. You are forced to fight, trade, explore unknown lands to return back. Or maybe you\'ll create a new home for yourself!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gjb.jpg'),(13484,'Warhammer Underworlds: Online - Warband: The Farstriders',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Clad in gleaming sigmarite and armed with heaven-forged weaponry, the grizzled hunters of the Stormcast Eternals are the sworn enemies of Chaos. Unlock this warband and play as The Farstriders in Warhammer Underworlds: Online now.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13485,'Mint\'s Hints','2024-10-01','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mint\'s Hints is a cancelled children\'s show, and you\'ve found yourself on the old set. Find paw-shaped Hints with special ghost-detecting Flashbrights, and discover the secret behind the show\'s closure with your Happy-Go-Lucky Notebook, but be careful, the stars of the show are after you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vwb.jpg'),(13486,'World of Warcraft: Battle for Azeroth - Collector\'s Edition','2018-08-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','THE ULTIMATE BATTLE FOR AZEROTH EXPERIENCE While the world hangs in the balance, the armies of the Horde and Alliance meet once again on the fields of battle. Prepare for all-out war with this limited-edition collector\'s set, featuring a host of rare and commemorative items to aid you in the coming conflict.\n\n- WORLD OF WARCRAFT: BATTLE FOR AZEROTH ? WINDOWS/MAC GAME KEY A digital key to unlock the full version of Battle for Azeroth.\n\n- COLLECTOR\'S EDITION DIGITAL SOUNDTRACK KEY A digital key to download the stirring orchestral pieces from the Battle for Azeroth soundtrack, the perfect mood music for laying siege to your enemies.\n\n- ELEGY & A GOOD WAR DOUBLE-SIDED BOOK Every great war story has two sides. This limited-edition hardback collects two new World of Warcraft novellas depicting the Burning of Teldrassil from the point of the view of the Alliance (Elegy) and the Horde (A Good War).Each story includes original artwork exclusive to this edition.\n\n- HORDE & ALLIANCE DOUBLE-SIDED MARK OF ALLEGIANCE Declare your allegiance with this hefty two-sided emblem.Place it on your desk or shelf with one side facing outward, proclaiming your chosen faction to the world...while the other side faces the wall, bowing in quiet shame. Stand included.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ydw.jpg'),(13487,'Handball 17','2016-11-11','Sport','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Find the 82 official teams from the most prestigious European leagues in the best handball simulation. Experience all the sensations of handball thanks to the easy-to-use controls, dynamic Career mode and fast-flowing matches, in both single player and multiplayer modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qas.jpg'),(13488,'Scary School Simulator 2','2023-11-30','Simulator, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Escape from horror anime ghost story in your school\'s classroom!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s2i.jpg'),(13489,'Hidden Objects: Fairyland',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13490,'Project CARS 3: Electric Pack','2021-05-03','Racing, Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Get to grips with 4 of the world’s quickest electric vehicles - the 2020 Porsche Taycan Turbo S, the record-breaking 2020 Volkswagen ID.R, the 2020 Audi AI:RACE concept and the NIO EP9. Own the future with the Project CARS 3: Electric Pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7v04.jpg'),(13491,'Tetris 2 + BomBliss','1991-12-13','Puzzle, Strategy','Family Computer','A regular tetris game with simultaneous 2-player action and a more puzzle oriented Tetris variant, Bombliss, for the Famicom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u94.jpg'),(13492,'Assassin\'s Creed: Odyssey - Gold Edition','2018-10-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Write your own epic odyssey and become a legendary Spartan hero in Assassin\'s Creed Odyssey, an inspiring adventure where you must forge your destiny and define your own path in a world on the brink of tearing itself apart. Influence how history unfolds as you experience a rich and ever-changing world shaped by your decisions.\n\nThe Gold Edition includes the Season Pass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4lgp.jpg'),(13493,'Space Misadventures','2020-03-01','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','a NSFW Space Adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co973t.jpg'),(13494,'The Legend of Heroes: Trails to Azure','2023-03-24','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The Legend of Heroes: Trails to Azure is the fifth installment in the main Trails series, serving as a direct sequel to the events of the The Legend of Heroes: Trails from Zero and the ending to the Crossbell arc. The game follows the Special Support Section with more members and more cases to solve.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ahi.jpg'),(13495,'Mordar Warrior','2025-03-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','third person action rpg game where player mission is to kill enemy waves and survive enough long.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m4d.jpg'),(13496,'Goodboy Galaxy/Witch n\' Wiz','2023-12-15','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Evercade','The Goodboy Galaxy/Witch n\' Wiz dual cartridge for Evercade features two grand adventures to enjoy on your Evercade systems. In Goodboy Galaxy, you\'ll take to the stars as Maxwell the dog as you seek to repair his broken hyperdrive. And in Witch n\' Wiz, you\'ll tackle devious puzzles on a quest to save your childhood friend from a magical fate!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w47.jpg'),(13497,'Lifter','2025-03-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lifter is an Adventure RPG where you play as a desperate thief trying to save your home from eviction. Outsmart employees, and decide who to steal from in a world full of secrets. Will you be a hero, a rogue, or something in between? The future is in your hands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l2w.jpg'),(13498,'Warhammer Underworlds: Online - Warband: Thorns of the Briar Queen',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Dragged out from her crystal tomb beneath the city of Shadespire, the Briar Queen and her spectral army of geists, and spirits are ready to combat all who trespass in the Mirrored City. Unlock this warband and play as the Thorns of the Briar Queen in Warhammer Underworlds: Online now.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13499,'Warhammer Underworlds: Online - Warband: The Storm of Celestus',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Drakan Celestus, accompanied by his loyal gryph-hound and an elite retinue of Castigators, is tasked with the investigation of the curse that has taken hold of the city of Shadespire. Unlock this warband and play as Storm of Celestus in Warhammer Underworlds: Online now.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13500,'Warhammer Underworlds: Online - Warband: Drepur\'s Wraithcreepers',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Eternal hunters in service of the Great Necromancer Nagash, this band of Glaivewraith Stalkers are driven ever onwards toward their prey by the ceaseless beating of the Patrician\'s skin drum. Unlock this warband and play as Drepur\'s Wraithcreepers in Warhammer Underworlds: Online.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13501,'Shaun the Sheep: Shear Speed','2015-01-09','Platform, Arcade','Android, iOS','Turbo-charge your hooves and get ready for the race of your life! Shear Speed challenges you to lead the Flock through the bustle of the Big City, dodging obstacles and keeping your distance from the dastardly Trumper, an evil animal catcher with the Flock firmly set in his sights. Drop the pace and you could find yourself spending the night in the pound…\n\nRace through a colourful cityscape, jumping, rolling and dodging a variety of hazards along the way, keeping your eyes peeled for the grass you’ll need to munch to keep that boost meter powered up.\n\nShear Speed is a racing challenge that’s simple to play but tricky to truly master. Are you ready? On your marks, get set, GO!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qa2.jpg'),(13502,'The Alchemist & His Battle-Scarred Homunculus','2022-09-30','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A heartwarming tale of two broken people finding a new life together!\n\nThis heartwarming and dramatic tale follows Rakels, the young alchemist who helped create living homunculi to better the lives of mankind, only to have his partner betray him and turn their creations into tools of war. After years of exile for speaking out against their use as weapons during the war, Rakels discovers the battered form of Mel, a homunculus who was discarded by a slave trader.\n\nAs the two begin to confront their traumatic pasts together, a new bond is formed that helps them heal and forge a loving future together. Sweet and tender moments abound as Rakels and Mel face their fears of society and intimacy to truly come together as a couple.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8quq.jpg'),(13503,'Horatio Goes Snowboarding','2021-12-22','Sport, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hire a board, get to the chopper and hit the slopes in this endlessly replayable snowboarding score attack arcade game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43cd.jpg'),(13504,'World of Warcraft: Warlords of Draenor - Collector\'s Edition','2014-11-06','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Warlords of Draenor Collector’s Edition includes:\n- World of Warcraft: Warlords of Draenor — Get the full version of Warlords of Draenor on DVD-ROM.\n\n- Behind-the-Scenes DVD and Blu-ray Two-Disc Set — Meet the development team behind the creation of Draenor and its savage warlords. This two-disc set includes over an hour of creators’ commentary, insider interviews, and developer roundtables.\n\n- Collector’s Edition Soundtrack — Immerse yourself in the sounds of war with the complete Warlords of Draenor orchestral soundtrack on CD.\n\n- The Art of Warlords of Draenor — Witness the visual evolution of the expansion in this beautifully bound tome of exclusive Warlord of Draenor art. Through 160 pages of concept pieces, finished illustrations, and CG images, you\'ll delve into the art team’s vision for a Draenor under siege by the apocalyptic threat of the Iron Horde.\n\n- Blackhand Mouse Pad — Arm yourself with a special-edition mouse pad emblazoned with the deadly warlord Blackhand.\n\n- Epic In-Game Content\n\n- World of Warcraft Dread Raven Mount and Dread Hatchling Pet — Descend from the skies on the back of a black-winged Dread Raven mount, a mortal progeny of Anzu. Then devour your prey in your next pet battle with the adorably ferocious Dread Hatchling.\n\n- StarCraft II Portraits — Summon the strength of two deadly Iron Horde war chiefs—Grommash Hellscream and Blackhand—as you take on the Dominion with these two StarCraft II portraits.\n\n- Diablo III Warsong Pennant — Don this battle-worn pennant and channel the rage of the Warsong Clan against the demonic forces of Sanctuary.\n\n- Hearthstone Card Back — Your adventures in Draenor will be the talk of the tavern after outfitting your champion’s deck with this custom card back forged in the fires of Blackrock.\n\n*Remember, one character boost to level 90 is included in the Collector’s Edition, retail and digital standard editions, and Digital Deluxe Edition of the Warlords of Draenor expansion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ydt.jpg'),(13505,'Incredifall','2024-07-11','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','We aim to make the most Entertaining and Exhilarating game possible! Incredifall! Also, offer CASH PRIZES in the future!! :D 60 Challenging Levels at the moment and there will be 200 levels offering hours of entertainment! Are you excited as we are to play this amazing original game? Play now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qba.jpg'),(13506,'Ride Your Mind','2015-03-31','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ride Your Mind is a BCI-VR-Game / NeuroVR Game that forces the user\'s conscious to compete with his subconscious. The aim of RYM is to imbue the player with an awareness of his own brain as a consciously controllable tool comparable, for example, to his hand.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kzm.jpg'),(13507,'The Wolf Among Us','2014-11-07','Point-and-click, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360, Xbox One','The Wolf Among Us is a five-episode series from the creators of the 2012 Game of the Year: The Walking Dead. Based on Fables (DC Comics/Vertigo), an award-winning comic book series, it is an often violent, mature and hard-boiled thriller where the characters and creatures of myth, lore and legend are real and exist in our world. As Bigby Wolf - The Big Bad Wolf in human form - you will discover that the brutal, bloody murder of a Fable is just a taste of things to come, in a game series where your every decision can have enormous consequences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rcy.jpg'),(13508,'Iseshima Mystery Annai: Itsuwari no Kuro Shinju','2019-06-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','舞台は東京から伊勢志摩へ…… ファミコン風アドベンチャーゲームの完全新作！','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pyd.jpg'),(13509,'Sonic Mega Collection','2002-12-19','Platform, Puzzle','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Sonic Mega Collection is a video game compilation developed by Sonic Team and published by Sega in 2002 for the GameCube. The compilation contains twelve to fourteen games (depending on region) originally released on the Sega Genesis. Ten of the included games are installments of the Sonic the Hedgehog series, while the remaining two to four games are only related to the series through its publisher, Sega.\n\nAccording to the director, Yojiro Ogawa, the purpose of the compilation was to introduce younger players to the original games in the Sonic series. The games are played through a Genesis emulator developed by Sonic Team themselves. Outside of the games, the compilation includes Sonic-themed videos and illustrations, as well as high-resolution scans of the instruction manuals and Sonic the Hedgehog comic covers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v6h.jpg'),(13510,'Metal Slug Collection','2009-12-27','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Collection of Metal Slug games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6po4.jpg'),(13511,'Mind: Path to Thalamus - Enhanced Edition','2015-11-03','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mind: Path to Thalamus is a First Person Puzzler that throws you into a fantastic and surreal environment. You will bend the natural elements to your will in order to progress in this emotive, mindbending tale. Now also in Virtual Reality!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26k0.jpg'),(13512,'Rocket Boots Mania: Space Train',NULL,'Platform, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rocket Boots Mania: Space Train is a 100% free endless runner with a twist—you’re in full control. Rocket-Jump, Wall-Run, and Fly to rescue lost cargo on a speeding space train. Race through the galaxy or relax with the chill vibes of vast space vistas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fzp.jpg'),(13513,'World of Warcraft: Cataclysm Classic','2024-05-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The World-changing Cataclysm arrives in World of Warcraft Classic, with changes made from the original release based on fan feedback.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bkm.jpg'),(13514,'Tiger Fighter 1931: Tora!Tora!Tora!','2019-08-13','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game\'s system is somewhere between air combat and army warfare. It\'s a lot like the old game I played as a kid, and we control fighters to destroy the enemy\'s army. We crossed the line of fire and shot down one enemy after another.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3jlw.jpg'),(13515,'Open Brush','2021-06-08','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Open source VR art tool built off of Google\'s open sourced Tilt Brush','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qmq.jpg'),(13516,'World of Warcraft Classic: Season of Discovery','2023-11-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Seasonal content arrives to World of Warcraft Classic, adding new playstyles to previous classes, reimagined instances, new PvP areas, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bkt.jpg'),(13517,'High Mountain Abbey',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','High Mountain Abbey is a unique first-person point-and-click puzzle adventure game. You are exploring an abbey which has been invaded by a mad god. Now you must solve puzzles and activate mysterious machines to defeat it. The graphics are photos of handmade dioramas and stop-motion animation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1s.jpg'),(13518,'World of Warcraft: Mists of Pandaria Classic','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91hr.jpg'),(13519,'European Mystery: Flowers of Death - Collector\'s Edition','2015-03-03','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Toxic flowers have been claiming victims and withering plant life in the Netherlands. Can you cultivate the answers to this mystery?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5upv.jpg'),(13520,'Under Leaves','2021-02-25','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Journey into the forest, the jungle or the depths of the deep blue sea. Find chestnuts for the pigs, a caterpillar for the crocodile or a starfish one, two three. A color-filled hidden object game from the world of animals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24ln.jpg'),(13521,'The Anomaly Project','2024-11-21','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your goal is simple, spot anomalies to escape. Play alone or together with up to 8 players in online co-op. Make the right decisions to advance to the next level, or risk being reset to the beginning!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ws0.jpg'),(13522,'Preston Sterling','2016-08-18','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U','Preston Sterling and the Legend of Excalibur is the first episode of an adventure series that will transport you into the world of English myths and legends. Tackle tricky puzzles and enjoy an exciting story, lovable characters and stunning scenes and locations!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yuh.jpg'),(13523,'Crystal Wish: Classroom Dungeon','2019-03-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co714q.jpg'),(13524,'Witch Hunters: Full Moon Ceremony - Collector\'s Edition','2017-11-06','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','An old mirror reveals a terrible secret when a strange creature suddenly emerges and begins terrorizing your home. But you soon learn he\'s just a lackey for an even bigger threat - a group of evil witches who want to take over the world! Stopping them won\'t be easy, though. Your whole house has been enchanted with a series of deadly tricks and traps. A trip down the hallway is now a dangerous battle of will and wits. Can you overcome the obstacles and send the witches packing before the night is over? Find out in this thrilling Hidden Object Adventure game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h96.jpg'),(13525,'Sunsoft Collection','2008-06-26','Fighting','PlayStation 2','A collection of Galaxy Fight and Waku Waku 7 for the PS2','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jydflu07nb2ltgdjn3y2.jpg'),(13526,'Who Shuffled My Shapes?','2022-07-08','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Your shapes have been shuffled and it’s up to you to fix them! Get your 20 new puzzles back in order, it sounds simple but it’s not. With some of the simpler puzzles offering over 43 quintillion possible configurations finding the single correct one will be a challenge!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4q9t.jpg'),(13527,'Zelda II: Ocarina of Time','2022-05-13','Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','Ages ago, the Ancient Sages built the Temple of Time to protect the Sacred Realm. Ganondorf, the Gerudo King of Thieves, has Obtained the Triforce of Power and become the King of Evil. The power of the sages lies sleeping in six temples across Hyrule. The time has come for you to awaken as the Hero of Time!\n\nThis adaptation takes Link to familiar places and a few new ones. It is designed to be more difficult, more forgiving, and less linear than the vanilla game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g6z.jpg'),(13528,'Half','2019-05-13','Visual Novel','Web browser','A short experience around cultural identity.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13529,'The Straw Man in the Wicker House','2014-01-13','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13530,'You Can Only Turn Left','2024-04-01','Simulator','Web browser','You Can Only Turn Left is a playful exploration of the hypnagogic state between sleeping and wakefulness. Within this liminal space, memories morph into dreams and dreams feather into reality. You, the player have to navigate these hallucinations by choosing how the character creates their sleeping patterns. Inspired by game books and guided sleep meditations, this story invites you to imagine both the mundane and the fantastic to practice the mental flexibility of an avid dreamer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co848z.jpg'),(13531,'Beyond: Two Souls - Special Edition','2013-10-11','Adventure','PlayStation 3','The Special Edition comes in a metal case and includes:\n\n- Premium steel book\n- Exclusive extra game scene\n- Game soundtrack\n- Dynamic themes\n- Avatar pack\n- Making Of Featurettes','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mpy.jpg'),(13532,'Cyber Noir Stories: The Trunk','2024-03-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An unique hybrid of a classic Point-And-Click Adventure and an interactive Visual Novel Combine the best of both worlds: explore your surroundings, solve tricky puzzles and influence the course of the story through your decisions and playstyle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58pt.jpg'),(13533,'Mystical Lights','2020-10-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mystical Lights is an addicting game in which you have to solve puzzles with Lovely Girls.The game is perfect for relaxing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pko.jpg'),(13534,'Tomb of the Bloodletter','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tomb of the Bloodletter is a strategic word game roguelike that transforms your keyboard into an array of powerful and deadly abilities! Form words using tactical combinations of your letters\' powers to defeat the denizens of this dingy tomb, and claim the Bloodletter for yourself...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o7i.jpg'),(13535,'Wolf Night Evening','2022-11-15','Indie','Web browser','You just came home from an extra-long day of work, and you\'re starving!\nOf course, you are what you eat after all, especially on a full moon...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v90.jpg'),(13536,'Dynasty Warriors 7: Empires','2013-02-19','Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','This new iteration of the Empires spin-off within the Dynasty Warriors series provides a more in-depth political system where players can decide what kind of lifestyle to partake in. They may opt to wander the land as a vagabond of sorts or rise up in the ranks as an ambitious officer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d5e.jpg'),(13537,'Under the Bridge','2022-10-01','Adventure','Web browser','Survive as a monster that has taken up residence underneath a bridge, interact with strangers who pass over your bridge and see if you can not only survive the encounters, but create a home for yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k13.jpg'),(13538,'Traveler','2015-01-16','Adventure','Web browser','Traveler is a short work of interactive fiction about identity, existence, purpose, and loss. It features four endings and infinite procedurally-generated planets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4stj.jpg'),(13539,'Skulljhabit','2014-05-31','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z7s.jpg'),(13540,'I.S.I.S.','2015-08-31','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','I.S.I.S. allows you to play as an indifferent, or malevolent, artificial intelligence trapped on a space station with a single human crew member.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tm7.jpg'),(13541,'TrinityS','2023-10-20','Tactical, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','TrinityS condenses the thrilling elements of MMO RPG endgame encounters into a white-knuckle, \"Boss Rush\" cooperative online action game for up to three players. Skip the MMO level grind and face off against fearsome foes that require precise coordination to defeat!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wwc.jpg'),(13542,'Shadow Mansion','2024-08-06','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','By playing this product, you will push the limits of fear and go after dark secrets. If you dare, step into this scary adventure and unravel the mansion\'s dark past!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8k5x.jpg'),(13543,'Hellboy: Web of Wyrd','2023-10-18','Fighting, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hellboy Web of Wyrd is a roguelite action adventure with an original story created in partnership with Dark Horse Comics and creator Mike Mignola. When an agent goes missing, Hellboy investigates. Prepare for monstrous toe-to-toe brawling','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5va2.jpg'),(13544,'Negotiation','2014-01-13','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13545,'The Visit','2014-01-01','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13546,'Top Billiards','2020-07-24','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A billiard game for one players','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44rw.jpg'),(13547,'Stellar Commanders','2019-09-19','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Stellar Commanders is a fast-paced multiplayer real-time strategy game that pits player against player in a bid to take control of distant planets as part of an inter-galactic war for precious resources. Aim for the Stars!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wym.jpg'),(13548,'Rite of Passage','2016-10-01','Sin género','Web browser','A game written by Arno von Borries for the Annual Interactive Fiction Competition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co830v.jpg'),(13549,'Natural Pressures','2021-06-25','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','After a camping trip goes wrong, a terrific storm leaves you trapped in the forest! With minimal resources and a maze-like woodland to escape, you\'d do anything to survive...even sacrifice your humanity! Will you keep grinding and fighting for a route home, or submit to the natural pressures and adapt to your new life?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71ry.jpg'),(13550,'Lost Alone Ep.2: Daddy','2022-05-15','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','George\'s mind journey continues in Lost Alone EP. 2 - Daddy.\n\nGeorge wakes up in a house that is familiar to him. He doesn\'t know what year it is. He doesn\'t know how he got into that house. Time and space lose all meaning. As his memory begins to come together, he realizes that he has ended up in his worst nightmare: his childhood!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4r2b.jpg'),(13551,'Ceilings','2015-10-25','Adventure','Web browser','A bite-sized horror text-adventure game for the Bite-Sized Horror Text Game Jam.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13552,'​Our Life: Beginnings & Always - Step 3 Expansion','2021-04-16','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Spend even more time in the summer of young adulthood by doubling the amount of moments available in Step 3!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qjx.jpg'),(13553,'Raik','2014-10-01','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','A fantasia about anxiety featuring kelpies, lost keys, mysteriously-lit underground caverns, boring work, panic attacks and red hair. Raik is a twine game, built in a platform for hypertext story-games. It\'s written in Scots, one of the languages of Scotland, with a full integrated translation into English.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4n5g.jpg'),(13554,'Genderfelt','2021-06-29','Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser','genderfelt is a short interactive zine, in which you read the blog of young person called Anon, going through the process of discovering himself. It focuses on the issue of transmedicalism, and how one can help to pull their peers away from a harmful ideology.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bi6.jpg'),(13555,'Bepuzzled Jigsaw Puzzle: Paradise','2019-07-12','Puzzle','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','103 Jigsaw Puzzles of beautiful and calming places! Three sizes of puzzle: 8 x 8 = 64 pieces 16 x 16 = 128 pieces 32 x 32 = 1024 pieces Timer and hints What great value!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69c2.jpg'),(13556,'Virtual Families','2009-05-06','Simulator','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Adopt and nurture a character and help them live their life inside your computer! Dictate everything form their daily routine to their career in this addicting family simulation game. Earn money to decorate the house, buy groceries, and other essentials.  \n  \nShape your character\'s personality by rewarding certain behaviours and punishing others. Find suitable mates for all your characters and start your very own perfect Virtual Families!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n2c.jpg'),(13557,'All Hail the Spider God','2016-06-29','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','All Hail The Spider God is an eerie interactive fiction adventure about You, and all the Yous you\'ve left behind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rfp.jpg'),(13558,'Cut From Shadows Prologue','2014-01-13','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13559,'Seeker','2018-12-31','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Alfie find the the stars to get back home to his homeland. If you don\'t want to follow this short story you can explore this very beautiful island in search of my personal Easter eggs. these Easter eggs will be very hard to find but in the end it will be rewarding. Thank you for playing Seeker.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13560,'Jamco Matefest 3013','2015-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','A very cool dating sim that takes that happens in the future with bears that live in space and eat jam and stuff','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13561,'Rex Hightower and the Unicorn\'s Kiss','2014-07-29','Adventure','Web browser','You are Rex Hightower. You fucked a dragon once. Saved the kingdom. But now your dick shoots fire and that\'s not really working for you. In this interactive fiction that had players laughing their asses off, Rex stumbles through the woods to find his way back to a normal life. Please consider donating, I need money to replace all these people\'s asses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1x5m.jpg'),(13562,'Mastaba Snoopy','2012-12-11','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','An Unknown Alien Being acquires a child\'s forgotten book and mistakenly believes that it depicts proper protocol for interaction with the human world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6cla.jpg'),(13563,'The Day I Went Away For a While','2014-01-13','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13564,'El Interrogatorio','2018-04-16','Indie','Web browser','A new case has come to the police station. A man has appeared in shock, stammering inconsistencies about his friend\'s disappearance. You must question him and discover what is true in what counts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cw4.jpg'),(13565,'The Chaos Gallery','2014-07-01','Sin género','Web browser','A twine game about walking around an art gallery.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13566,'Fish Life','2000-06-20','Simulator','Dreamcast','The game runs on a base unit with custom hardware, based on the Dreamcast using the GD-ROM software, and can be used in combination with a 15-inch touchscreen monitor for full functionality. \n \n\"Introducing a totally new concept in interior decor. Fish Life is \"Healing Art\" - it creates a soft, calming ambience that can be felt wherever it\'s displayed. \n \nTake immense pleasure in looking, touching and talking to your fish. \nDiscover the high-tech solution to beating stress! \nTime is valuable and how you spend it is important. \nRaising your own fish in the Fish Life virtual aquarium allows you to take the time to relax. \nWith this hassle-free high-tech solution you can forget about feeding your fish, changing the water, and maintaining the aquarium. It\'s beautiful, easy and clean. \nFish Life comes fully loaded with play functions. \n \nPerfect for use in the following locations: \n- Restaurant Lounges \n- Aquariums \n- Hotel and Bank Lobbies, etc. \n- Libraries \n- Hospital Waiting Rooms \n- Halls and Event locations\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1lr0.jpg'),(13567,'Pack Master','2020-06-11','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Can you pack it all in? Are you an expert packer? Only the smartest travelers can visit every country. Be the leader of the pack!\nWhat is more refreshing than the feeling of a nice, perfectly organized suitcase? Relive that relaxing feeling over and over again as you get ready to travel with Pack Master. Your one simple challenge is to fill your suitcase with the myriad objects provided. All at once easy and increasingly frustrating.\n\nTravel around the world to international cities and solve special puzzles created specifically for each of them. Organization is key since your suitcases are not the boring rectangles you are used to. We will strain the limits of your imagination as you try to fit the pieces into cases of all shapes and sizes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ccy.jpg'),(13568,'Puzzle Pelago','2019-04-04','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Puzzle Pelago turns the classic ware-chain based economy sim into a challenging puzzle! Help rebuild the network of goods production via deceptively simple drag & drop mechanics. Produce various goods exactly where the islanders need them - from wooden planks and wheat to barrels, beer and bread.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4da2.jpg'),(13569,'Convoy','2015-04-21','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Convoy is a tactical roguelike-like inspired by Mad Max and FTL in which you cross a wasteland in search of parts for your broken ship.\n\nPresented in pixel art and set in a future post-apocalyptic setting, Convoy is a squad based tactical roguelike-like in its core. You travel with your combat vehicles and convoy across a wasteland to find parts needed to repair your broken spaceship. During your journey you will encounter strangers in randomized scenarios by picking up radio signals.\n\nDepending on the choices you make, signals can either lead to tactical combat, text based dialogue or chance based role-play. Whatever choice you make, you need to keep your convoy and its cargo safe from raiders, privateers and other enemies. Keep upgrading your vehicles, as death is permanent in Convoy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21qu.jpg'),(13570,'Screenbound',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Screenbound is a platformer unlike any other. You move in first-person view at the same time while playing in 2d on the screen of your Qboy. Mind-bending environmental puzzles will force you to test the limits of dimensional space. Your jumping and movements are mirrored - but certain things affect the opposite dimension. Combat is in 2d and you will receive your loot in 3d.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7z8v.jpg'),(13571,'Queers in Love at the End of the World','2013-11-25','Indie','Web browser','fellas, is it gay to make out in the ashes of capitalism?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bvq.jpg'),(13572,'Their Angelical Understanding','2013-09-29','Indie','Web browser','I train to fight angels in a monastery by the sea.\n\nAn interactive fiction piece by Porpentine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84g4.jpg'),(13573,'Jetbike Gang','2015-03-29','Visual Novel','Web browser','You\'re a member of a jetbike gang.\nTiny Twine game for the Twiny Jam.\nExactly 300 words.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xth.jpg'),(13574,'Far Cry 4 + Far Cry 5 Double Pack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Discover or rediscover the award-winning Far Cry franchise and live immersive experiences thanks to this Far Cry 5 + Far Cry 4 double pack. Explore massive open worlds, with integrated drop-in/drop-out open world co-op play and get ready for tens of hours of gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qrn.jpg'),(13575,'TerraKids: Save The World Kidos!','2023-12-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Join Fuzzo in TerraKids for an epic eco-adventure! Explore vibrant worlds, learn about our planet, and become an Earth hero. Perfect for young explorers aged 3-7. Let\'s make the world better, one game at a time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7q1v.jpg'),(13576,'Lost Age','2025-01-08','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the mystical world of Lost Age, darkness looms, and heroes rise to reclaim the light. Embark on a captivating adventure where card-based strategy meets the excitement of RPG. Collect and customize powerful heroes, explore magical realms, and tackle thrilling challenges—all at your own pace. With idle mechanics, your journey continues even when you\'re offline.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h1i.jpg'),(13577,'404 Missing Page Detective Agency','2016-10-26','Adventure','Web browser','Webpages can run, but they cannot hide from... THE DETECTIVE!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co867s.jpg'),(13578,'Death Report',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','This is a horror game that will take you into a world full of suspense, thrills, and psychological challenges, testing your courage and wisdom, uncovering secrets that have been sealed by time. -Pure manual map, without using automatically generated maps -Pure manual system, easy to adjust','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kq8.jpg'),(13579,'Violeta','2021-03-01','Visual Novel','Web browser','You are Mo, the cat! Be cute, listen to and advise your friends, and knock some plants over if you feel like it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tm7.jpg'),(13580,'Dig Bombers','2020-07-20','Shooter, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a real time multiplayer with fast-paced battles. Dig, blast and become the sole owner of a dungeon full of treasures. Everything needed to win is buried in the mine. Dig up weapons and get rid of your opponents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2csw.jpg'),(13581,'Yume 5','2025-03-28','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','n the game, you will play the heroine Chen Xi, and control her actions through the WASD keys, while her past life memories act in the opposite direction.cleverly avoid various obstacles, solve the puzzles of the complex maze, and finally find the way to the exit!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lm6.jpg'),(13582,'Star Wars: Republic Commando','2005-02-17','Shooter, Tactical, Adventure','Xbox, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Chaos has erupted throughout the galaxy. As a leader of an elite squad of Republic Commandos, your mission is to infiltrate, dominate, and ultimately, annihalate the enemy. Your squad will follow your orders and your lead, working together as a team-instinctively, intelligently, instantly. You are their leader. They are your weapon.\n\nStar Wars: Republic Commando is a tactical first-person shooter video game, set in the Star Wars universe. It was developed by LucasArts using the Unreal Engine, and published for the Xbox and Microsoft Windows in 2005. The game features both single-player and multiplayer game modes. In the story, set in the Star Wars Legends expanded universe, players assume the role of RC-1138 (\"Boss\"), an elite clone trooper, known as \"clone commando\", and the leader of the special ops unit Delta Squad, consisting of three fellow clone commandos with distinctive personalities and character traits: RC-1262 (\"Scorch\"), RC-1140 (\"Fixer\"), and RC-1207 (\"Sev\"). The story follows Delta Squad as they complete increasingly difficult missions throughout the Clone Wars and learn to bond as a team.\n\nRepublic Commando received generally favorable reviews at release. Many critics praised the story and combat, but criticized the short length and average multiplayer. In the years since its release, it has come to be considered one of the best Star Wars games ever made, and has gained a cult following.\n\nAn enhanced port of the game by Aspyr is set to release for the Nintendo Switch and PlayStation 4 on April 6, 2021. As reported by Jordan Ramée of GameSpot, \"Handled by Aspyr Media, Star Wars: Republic Commando Remastered brings the original 2005 Xbox and PC game to PS4 and Switch with enhanced HD graphics and modernized controls, though the multiplayer is absent. Otherwise, it\'s the same game. And though the flaws in its gameplay are only more noticeable now 16 years later, this remaster manages to still deliver a compelling story of four specialized commandos engaging in a variety of combat missions across the Clone Wars.\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2au4.jpg'),(13583,'A Hell of a Journey','2021-05-07','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Experience a great journey with famous poet Dante and his super \"reliable\" narrator Virgil.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13584,'Zombie Groove','2022-06-29','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zombie Groove will challenge your sense of rhythm. Focus on the groove of the music to get into the correct flow, and enjoy the best upbeat rhythm you\'ve never experienced.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l32.jpg'),(13585,'Animalia','2018-10-01','Adventure','Web browser','This is the story of Charlie Stewart, nine-year-old Human child.\n\nInside this ordinary nine-year-old Human child are four animals from the Forest, working tirelessly to keep YOUR Taiga Federation safe from Human intervention.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57hn.jpg'),(13586,'Sleepless in the Sapphire City','2024-02-26','Indie','Web browser','Reflections of a postmodern vampire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85nn.jpg'),(13587,'The Emptiness: Deluxe Edition','2015-04-17','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warning! The game is not recommended for people with an unhealthy state of mind, nervous disorders or heart disease. Experience The Emptiness and discover a psychological adventure game unlike anything you\'ve ever seen before!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pt3.jpg'),(13588,'Shadow of the Tomb Raider: Croft Edition','2018-09-14','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Experience Lara Croft’s defining moment as she becomes the Tomb Raider. In Shadow of the Tomb Raider, Lara must master a deadly jungle, overcome terrifying tombs, and persevere through her darkest hour. As she races to save the world from a Maya apocalypse, Lara must become the Tomb Raider she is destined to be.\n\nThe Croft Edition includes:\n- 48H early access*\n- Additional Skills Booster Pack\n- Xbox Live Avatar outfit*\n- Season Pass\n- 3 additional weapons/outfits\n- Digital OST','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3he9.jpg'),(13589,'5 dias com Tony Bumbum','2021-04-17','Adventure','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5r9l.jpg'),(13590,'Chemistry and Physics','2013-10-31','Adventure','Web browser','When you agreed to meet him, you thought it would all end amicably. That you could go away and close this chapter of your life. Instead, you\'re now running from him. Bad news: no cell phone reception. You can\'t call for help. You\'re stuck. Good news: this is familiar territory. This is your lab. Can you get out of this alive?\n\nA short and violent story written for Ectocomp 2013.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bzy.jpg'),(13591,'Black Mesa: Azure Sheep','2020-11-15','Shooter','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A remake of the Half-Life 1 mod Azure Sheep.\n\nThis is the story of Justin Barnes, Black Mesa security guard who goes to rescue his colleague after an Incident.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tsq.jpg'),(13592,'Perseids, or, All This Will Go on Forever','2018-07-07','Sin género','Web browser','Four trans girlfriends go on a road trip to a dark sky park, to see the perseid meteor shower. A 6.5k-long story, with small branches but a single ending. There\'s very little conflict, drama, no-one dies. Just a good time.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13593,'Milano\'d',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Milano’d an interactive, text-based game that plunges players into the murky depths of corporate intrigue at a multinational corporation known for its glamorous facade and secretive dealings. As the newest employee, you are thrust into the annual Mega Raffle, an event surrounded by rumors of corruption and manipulation. Navigate through a web of deceit as you decide whether to expose the wrongdoing, exploit it for personal gain, or simply try to survive your day-to-day corporate life. Your choices will lead you through conversations with allies and adversaries alike, uncovering secrets that could alter the course of your career and the integrity of MilanoCorp. Each decision shapes the narrative, leading to multiple outcomes based on your moral compass and strategic cunning. Can you unravel the truth without losing yourself in the process?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13594,'Cyberqueen','2013-12-31','Adventure','Web browser','Cyberqueen is a text based game that explores the Violence perpetrated on the player by a brutal cyberpunk AI character.\nThe violence is conveyed in an erotic manner, having the player imagine the dominance of the AI over the player\'s body.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mekntkgbhdt608cbled1.jpg'),(13595,'Human Errors','2018-05-15','Sin género','Web browser','A contractor assigned to handle bug reports for a wearable mood-regulation device becomes unwitting witness to trauma and crime.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2enf.jpg'),(13596,'Makibishi Comic','2024-04-10','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','After 17 years, they are back! A remastered version of the point-and-click game that was released on the web in 2007. Is it a game? Is it experimental interactive content? Even the creator doesn\'t know. Experience a strange and unique worldview that has been played over 10 million times worldwide!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8o7h.jpg'),(13597,'Everything You Swallow Will One Day Come Up Like a Stone','2014-04-10','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13598,'Cannelé & Nomnom: Defective Agency','2022-12-14','Puzzle, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cannelé & Nomnom: Defective Agency is a fantasy comedy interactive fiction game. Players follow an amnesic individual who hires a duo of disastrous detectives in order to investigate three mysteries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6av5.jpg'),(13599,'Library Fantasy','2015-06-01','Visual Novel','Web browser','A twine game about reading.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1x1j.jpg'),(13600,'1001 Jigsaw World Tour China','2023-08-13','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tea ceremonies, ancient temples and red dragons! Put your puzzles together and embark on a colourful and unforgettable journey through the multifaceted China.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co709c.jpg'),(13601,'Hangar 8','2024-09-13','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hangar 8 is a psychological horror set within the unsettling confines of a derelict space station. Brave the looping corridors, spot all ?? anomalies, collect key items, and escape the nightmare!\n\nBlending anomaly spotting mechanics from games such as \"The Exit 8\" and \"I\'m on Observation Duty\", with the liminal-space psychological horror of \"The Backrooms\", HANGAR 8 challenges both your memory and your sanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jp1.jpg'),(13602,'Jeopardy','1991-12-31','Quiz/Trivia','Game Boy','Based on the hit television show, Jeopardy! for Game Boy features over 1,500 questions and support for two players. Before starting, you can enter the number of participants and their names. Gameplay consists of moving a cursor and selecting a category and money value. After the question (or answer) appears, you have ten seconds to buzz in. Answering involves selecting each letter on an alphabet display to spell out one or more words. After the first two rounds, players with positive dollar amounts can play in Final Jeopardy! The player with the most money at the end of this round wins the game. For two-player games, you can either link two systems together or share one Game Boy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hgs.jpg'),(13603,'The Night Market','2023-09-01','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome to the Night Market. Survive your journey while navigating a foreign land, rife with political intrigue, arbitrary rules and secrets designed to keep you distracted. Fall in love, explore a world with rich characters, and try to save the realm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73iy.jpg'),(13604,'Dumpster Date',NULL,'Visual Novel','Web browser','Time to grab some limbs and play human for your upcoming date!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yel.jpg'),(13605,'A(s)century','2014-03-12','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','A text based cyberpunk adventure/choice-game/history-sim.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cc6.jpg'),(13606,'Palisade','2018-10-09','Indie','Web browser','A short interactive narrative set in a fictional country that has recently been invaded. You have the role of the protector – though who you are protecting is part of the choices you make.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2drp.jpg'),(13607,'Basket Bowling +',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/elu9qfy9bupj65xzwh83.jpg'),(13608,'The Sandwich Making Experience','2023-06-26','Indie','SteamVR','Welcome to The Sandwich Making Experience! The game that will have you and your friends competing for sandwich supremacy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9epp.jpg'),(13609,'Ilomilo','2010-11-08','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Windows Phone, Xbox 360','ilomilo is a puzzle game developed by Southend Interactive and Microsoft Game Studios. It was released on Windows Phone 7 on November 8, 2010 for AT&T customers.[2] On November 26, 2010, a \"secret\" website was made available where players could get a code to download a trial and purchase the game early, while the game was officially released on Xbox Live Arcade on January 5, 2011.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yku.jpg'),(13610,'Undercover Cops Gaiden: Hakaishin Garumaa','1993-12-10','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Game Boy','Undercover Cops: Hakaishin Garumaa), sometimes referred to with or without subtitle as Undercover Cops Gaiden, is a 1993 turn-based traditional game developed and published by Irem exclusively in Japan for the Nintendo Game Boy on December 10, 1993. It is a spin-off of Irem\'s 1992 beat \'em up arcade game simply titled Undercover Cops. It is also the second-to-last game Irem released for the Game Boy, with Daiku no Gen-san - Robot Teikoku no Yabō being the last.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ie5.jpg'),(13611,'Nanopesos','2019-11-05','Point-and-click, Simulator','Web browser','A budget management simulator inspired by the low salaries and high living costs in Chile.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kfi.jpg'),(13612,'Augur','2014-01-13','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13613,'Magical Maiden Madison','2013-04-08','Sin género','Web browser','It is the year 200X. From troubled Lake City has emerged a new saviour—a hero by the name of Magical Maiden Madison.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13614,'Nomad Fleet','2016-04-19','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Nomad Fleet is a RTS game where you must lead the last remnants of Mankind to safety after a mysterious alien race has hunted them near extinction. Lead a fully armed fleet of battleships, carriers and fighters through a series of randomized scenarios and encounters where they must fight for their survival while scavenging for resources, researching new technologies and solving disputes using diplomacy or brute force.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gyp.jpg'),(13615,'SJW: Digital Zine Quest','2017-03-13','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser','Are you a Social Justice Warrior? Or are you more of a Social Justice Druid? Or Summoner? Made for the March 2017 #ResistJam, this interactive story is all about being queer, using your art for good and sick ninja stunts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dfl.jpg'),(13616,'Town of Salem 2','2023-05-26','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Town of Salem 2 is the sequel to BlankMediaGames\' hit Murder Mystery game, Town of Salem. With a revitalized 3d world, new and reworked roles, improved chat features and much more you can\'t help but join the Witch Hunt!\n\nTown of Salem 2 pits the Town vs the Coven, Serial Killers, Arsonist, Werewolves, and even the Horsemen of the Apocalypse themselves. Can you survive the Town of Salem again? Use your wits, abilities of deduction, and your role\'s special abilities to help, or hurt, the Town and lead your side to victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fh7.jpg'),(13617,'Adrenaline Rush: Miami Drive','2019-07-12','Racing, Sport, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Find yourself smack in the middle of a police chase! Get a taste of adrenaline and thrills! It’s all waiting for you in ‘Adrenaline Rush - Miami Drive’. Driving in the wrong direction, crackups and spectacular crashes, dizzying speed ‒ all this against the incredible backdrop of the night city and highways! Your task is to escape from your pursuers, collect coins and smash into as many vehicles as possible. And all this with a minimum of rules and a maximum of fun! Play on Joy-Con or using motion controls! Let\'s go!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56yx.jpg'),(13618,'Pontefract','2012-07-01','Indie','Web browser','explore an evil castle and confront the fetid darkness within.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2huu.jpg'),(13619,'Little Witch Nobeta: Day One Edition','2023-03-07','Shooter, Indie','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','The Day One Edition of Little Witch Nobeta includes:\n- The game\n- A reversible cover sleeve\n- 6 Postcards\n- A Sticker Sheet\n- An A2 Double-sided Poster\n- Collector\'s Box','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7o2v.jpg'),(13620,'Alien Cat Story','2025-04-04','Platform','Xbox Series X|S','Get ready for an amazing adventure on an alien planet, full of dangers, puzzles and unexpected allies in the game Alien Cat Story. Only you can help the cat fix his ship and leave this dangerous world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n2j.jpg'),(13621,'Sparrow Solitaire','2023-04-11','Puzzle, Strategy','Playdate','Sparrow Solitaire takes the classic tile-matching puzzle game mahjong solitaire, and reimagines it from the ground-up for Playdate. With simple rules and plenty of customizable options, the game is accessible to both new players and veterans of the genre.\n\nChoose from hundreds of layouts, including classics from the original Shanghai to designs referencing other Playdate games. Can’t decide? Play the Daily Layout and share your scores via QR code!\n\nCustomize almost every aspect of your experience: tile designs, backgrounds, music, and controls. Or create new layouts with a built-in editor. We also include several helpful options, such as a 2x zoom.\n\nPlay against a friend in the 2P challenge mode, or try the alternative matching rules in the Shisen-sho variant.\n\nWith some of the most robust stat tracking found on Playdate, you can track your scores, wins, times, and more for each layout.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6etn.jpg'),(13622,'Detective Rosie Morgan: Murder on the River Thames','2021-06-04','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','“Detective Rosie Morgan: Murder on the River Thames” is a Detective Mystery Visual Novel and Yuri Dating Sim set in London. You play as DI (Detective Inspector) Rosie Morgan, one of the best and brightest detectives in London\'s Metropolitan Police.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ojk.jpg'),(13623,'The Domovoi','2014-01-20','Indie','Web browser','Your friend, a folk storyteller, has offered to perform their latest work. As their audience, it is your task to advise how their tale should unfold.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hk2.jpg'),(13624,'Lunium',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Can you escape your chains before the killer strikes again?\n\nYou wake to find yourself trapped in a room filled with locks and strange contraptions. Someone has locked you in here and identifying them may hold the key to your escape. Hidden somewhere are the clues you need to set yourself free, but time is running out…\nUncover the clues, unlock the chains and solve the mystery!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mjs.jpg'),(13625,'One Day Hike','2023-04-12','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','ONE DAY HIKE is a brief interactive fiction where you revisit an old, familiar hiking trail and recount the memories that you\'ve tried-- and failed-- to leave behind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83sl.jpg'),(13626,'Bit.Trip Void','2020-12-25','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Nintendo 3DS, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Bit.Trip Void is the third installment in the retro-arcade BIT.TRIP saga.\n\nBit.Trip Void is a synesthetic exploration of rhythm and music as they pertain to our everyday lives and moods. In a control scheme brand new to the series, yet wholly familiar to gamers, the player is given complete freedom to move about the screen wherever they desire, interacting with the music in brand new ways. The classic gameplay aesthetic remains, as color—and the absence of color—are explored to the fullest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gmf.jpg'),(13627,'Forgotten','2016-12-31','Adventure','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An adventure game in which players interact with the long-abandoned entities inside a fictional 1994 game called Forgotten Blade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oxo.jpg'),(13628,'Squish','2022-06-28','Platform, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A spoopy, squishy, and fast-paced party game where you and up to three gooey friends rave it up in an underground crypt as it collapses down on you. You must push blocks, dodge, and jump to survive the rave and squish your opponents. Last Skelegoo standing takes it all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vl7.jpg'),(13629,'Aqua Marbles: Ocean','2023-03-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deep in the abyss of the ocean lies an underwater kingdom. Dive into a submarine atmosphere complete with colorful graphics and exciting music, but keep an eye out! In the deepest darkest corners lie sunken ships and castles full of danger. Check out match-3 from a fresh perspective!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68j4.jpg'),(13630,'Stygia','2012-09-27','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Play as a ghost, haunt the living, and fight for survival in the land of the dead.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13631,'Alliance Aligned',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13632,'Hunting Unicorn','2014-11-06','Adventure','Web browser','A maiden leads a unicorn hunt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2iwp.jpg'),(13633,'Spiral','2024-09-20','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Spiral is a third-person narratively driven exploration game sharing a poetic vision of cognitive degeneration seen from the inside. It tells the story of Bernard, a man who wishes goodbye one last time to the memories that built him from his early childhood to who he is today.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ps6.jpg'),(13634,'Zelda3: IQ Test - Revenge of the Einstein','2017-01-29','Puzzle, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','The final installment of the IQ series, The Revenge of the Einstein, includes some of the most difficult block puzzles ever created in a Zelda game. The already existing puzzles from the IQ and Conker, which were considered to be of a better design, were used in this game and remodeled to be even more difficult, yet some rare puzzles are brand new.\n\nA very short hack with very difficult riddles, which will test the limits of your intellect, while still being beatable if you invest enough time into solving. The hack also has some “breathing rooms”, in which you don’t need to think much to proceed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79f4.jpg'),(13635,'Spy Intrigue','2015-10-01','Adventure','Web browser','A game written by furkle for the 21st Annual Interactive Fiction Competition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ihrcajwqtysnxtb0yimn.jpg'),(13636,'Nintendo Classic Mini: Family Computer - Weekly Shonen Jump 50th Anniversary Version','2018-07-07','Platform','Plug & Play','A special edition of the Nintendo Classic Mini with games from Shonen Jump franchises.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co569o.jpg'),(13637,'Subject 13','2015-05-28','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Subject 13 is the new adventure game developed by Paul Cuisset—the man behind \"Flashback\", \"Future Wars: Adventures in Time\" and \"Moto Racer\" - in partnership with Microïds. This is a true adventure game. It depicts a mysterious universe filled with secret hiding places and all kinds of mechanisms that the player discovers, analyzes, and activates. There are also objects to collect and to figure out how to use in the backdrops…\n\nSubject 13 will make you travel from a secret base that has been abandoned to a strange and mysterious island, and in other places, so you can discover the real story. Therefore, you will have to manipulate several items in details to unveil their secrets. You\'ll have to muster all your insight and intelligence for this daunting challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wow.jpg'),(13638,'Plantgotchi','2019-04-19','Simulator, Indie','Web browser','A random-based pet care game. Choose an egg and take care of your new plantgotchi pet until your pet raises to 40 points of growth. There are 12 possible plantgotchi final forms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qes.jpg'),(13639,'Bed Dream, First Draft','2014-01-13','Sin género','Web browser','This piece contains aspects of body horror, self-harm, and other potentially triggering elements.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13640,'Cybattler','1993-02-01','Shooter','Arcade','Cybattler is a up-scrolling shoot \'em up game where you take control of the mecha CYX-0017 BLANCHE that can shoot and slash with its plasma sword in all direction in a space themed environment. As you make progress you have to fight of various space crafts in varying sizes, other mechas and bosses. As well as evading destructible rocks. When using your gun a meter at the bottom of the screen depletes. The meter recharges when not used. Weapon and repair power-ups can be collected. The game can be played solo or with a friend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wzj.jpg'),(13641,'Cultus','2020-10-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience a young man\'s search for answers behind his nightmares as things take a dark turn, or play the unpredictable and nerve-racking multiplayer with friends in Cultus! A pixelated survival horror experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nyr.jpg'),(13642,'creak, Creak','2015-04-05','Sin género','Web browser','A very short piece of Interactive Fiction created by Chandler Groover for Twiny Jam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fm0.jpg'),(13643,'Woods Leaves Stream Body Blood','2014-01-13','Adventure','Web browser','An eight-year-old boy finds a body in the woods near his grandmother\'s house. Somewhere there is a dog barking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94sx.jpg'),(13644,'There Ought to Be A Word','2013-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','A non-fiction twine about separation after marriage.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13645,'Who Stole My Bone?','2019-04-21','Adventure','Web browser','Help Spudz the dog find his precious bone in this short, silly game!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13646,'Ürs','2018-10-01','Adventure','Web browser','A gamestorybook by Christopher Hayes and Daniel Talsky.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co867a.jpg'),(13647,'MP3: Rainbow Boulevard','2016-11-27','Card & Board Game','Nintendo 64','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13648,'Her Pound of Flesh','2013-10-13','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','A short piece of interactive horror about heartache, by Liz England.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hzl.jpg'),(13649,'Masks','2019-12-15','Indie','Web browser','You’re a courier for the resistance, trapped on a university campus under siege. The environment around you is coming apart, fast.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e1q.jpg'),(13650,'.Hack//G.U. Vol. 1: Rebirth','2006-05-18','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','.Hack//G.U. simulates a massively multiplayer online role-playing game; players assume the role of a participant in a fictional game called The World. While in The World, the player controls the on-screen player character, Haseo, from a third-person person perspective (with optional first-person mode). The player may control the camera using the game controller\'s right analog stick. Within the fictional game, players explore monster-infested fields and dungeons as well as \"Root Towns\" that are free of combat. They also can \"log-off\" from the game and return to a computer desktop interface which includes in-game e-mail, news, and message boards, as well as desktop and background music customization options. In Reminisce, an optional card game called \"Crimson VS\" becomes available. The player may save the game to a memory card both from the desktop and within The World at a Save Shop. After the player completes the game, a Data Flag appears on the save file, which allows the transfer of all aspects of the player character and party members to the next game in the series. This can also be applied to previous games if the player first finished the Reminsce or Redemption.\n\nPlayers can attack monsters in real time. However, the action pauses whenever the menu is opened in order to select magic to cast, items to use, or skills to perform. The player only directly controls Haseo, while the other characters are controlled by artificial intelligence. The player may either provide guidelines (\"Free Will\", \"Rage\", \"Life\", etc.) or issue direct commands (for example, to cast a particular magic at a particular enemy) to the computer-controlled characters. Monsters roam the environments freely or guard treasure chests. Once combat is initiated, via a \"surprise attack\" or the player being spotted, a wall erects around the combat area to prevent escape. Weapons give the player access to the Skill Trigger feature which allows them to perform a powerful attack at the cost of losing SPs. As an adept rogue character, Haseo can wield multiple weapons for close combat. Although Haseo can only use one weapon per battle, during Reminisce the player can change weapons in the middle of Skill Triggers. Under certain conditions, the player may execute an enhanced type of Skill Trigger called \"Rengeki\". These attacks deal greater damage and fill a Morale gauge, which allows the player and his team members to use a combination attack. Certain plot-related fights, called \"Avatar battles\", use a different interface which incorporates shoot \'em up gameplay elements. After depleting the opponent\'s health, players must charge up a \"Data Drain\" to end the battle.\n\nRoot Towns are non-combat areas in The World. The player may restock on items, buy equipment, or chat and trade with other \"players\" of The World. The player may also undertake optional quests and visit guilds. A key feature of all towns is the Chaos Gate. This blue portal is used to travel between towns (called \"servers\") as well as access the fields and dungeons where battles take place. A password system controls the characteristics of each area. Depending on the characteristics of each word in the three word phrase, the resulting area may have different attributes such as prevalence of monsters or items, among other features.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vtb.jpg'),(13651,'Borderlands 3: Deluxe Edition','2019-10-30','Shooter, Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Borderlands 3: Deluxe Edition includes:\n\nRetro Cosmetic Pack: Vault Hunter head & skin, Echo Device skin, weapon skin\nNeon Cosmetic Pack: Vault Hunter head & skin, Echo Device skin, trinket\nGearbox Cosmetic Pack: weapon skin, trinket\nToy Box Weapons Pack: 2 Toy guns, Toy grenade mod, trinket\nEquipable XP & Loot Drop Boost Mods','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20tv.jpg'),(13652,'Accidental Woman','2022-02-06','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Accidental Woman is an erotic life simulation game that combines richly detailed fiction and player control to create an immersive experience. Players take on the role of a woman living in Appletree, a small town surrounded by old-wood forests and home to the Institute, where they will manage their character\'s relationships, career, mental health, and more while exploring the unique circumstances surrounding the town and their own transformation. The game features customizable clothing options, procedurally generated NPCs with story threads, and various story arcs including main, job, environment, and random events. With the ability to play your way and create complex characters through extensive NPC customization, Accidental Woman offers endless opportunities for players to experiment, challenge themselves, and experience erotic fiction in a dynamic and rewarding manner.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13653,'Little','2017-10-30','Adventure, Visual Novel','Web browser','Little is a small, choice-based text adventure. The game is a La Petite Mort entry for Ectocomp 2017.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hax.jpg'),(13654,'Surrounded',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Surrounded is an up to 6-player cooperative horror game where you will encounter a lot of different variations of paranormal activities, strange sightings, and creatures capable of ending your life. Grab your gear, and be ready to experience the strange mystery of the Surrounded world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5org.jpg'),(13655,'Hai Shuuraku Tansaku','2023-11-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The protagonist embarks on a journey to an abandoned village upon a friend\'s request...\nInvestigate what happened in the abandoned village in this first-person horror game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xs5.jpg'),(13656,'Judge Dredd: Dredd Vs. Death','2003-10-17','Shooter','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Welcome to Mega-City One, a city of over 400 million people - every one of them a potential criminal. It is the third decade of the 22nd Century, unemployment is widespread, boredom is universal and only the Judges can prevent total anarchy. Empowered to dispense instant justice, they are Judge, Jury and Executioner all in one. The most feared and respected of all the Judges is you, Judge Dredd.\n\nPatrol the streets and mete out instant justice wherever it is needed. The Psi-Judges are predicting a terrible plague — is this the sudden outbreak of Vampires on the city, and are they the work of the malevolent Dark Judges?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lf7.jpg'),(13657,'Teletubbies: Jigsaw',NULL,'Puzzle','DVD Player','Generic game included on various Teletubbies DVDs','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13658,'Little Witch Reinette: Swan no Namida Rhapsody','1999-09-23','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It starts with a magical competition mentioned in original Little Witch Parfait. Now from Reinette point of view.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z5d.jpg'),(13659,'Endrr','2022-05-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive the hordes of monsters as long as you can. Fight, upgrade your skills, loot equipments, die, rince and repeat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qtv.jpg'),(13660,'Glimmer','2022-10-01','Indie','Web browser','It\'s bleak out there. No one would blame you for turning away.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p05.jpg'),(13661,'Bail Force: Cyberpunk Bounty Hunters',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Bail Force is an action roguelike about two bounty hunters in a cyberpunk setting. Play as one of two Bounty Hunters, and make your way to catch or neutralize dangerous criminals using various power-ups. Experience their missions and personal conflict stemming from concerns of a loved one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gto.jpg'),(13662,'Pitfall Protocol','2024-07-09','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Navigate an underground warehouse, approve special items, and eliminate anomalies over a tense 7-day contract or face termination.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8b5x.jpg'),(13663,'Jaghund Armoured Organ Delivery Service','2020-04-01','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Since the MAW Lojackers, a group of low-tech anarchists lost control of their insect horde all of society has crumbled into a battle of survival. You have one mission, and one only; you must stay alive to deliver the heart. Travis, the CEO of Orbital Biotech Deliveries, requires a heart transplant and you are the last functional drone capable of completing such a request. The Lojackers will stop at nothing to capture your cargo. Use what power you can gather to charge up any of Fujisaki Corp’s bots you might find.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cc2.jpg'),(13664,'Welcome to the Dark Place','2025-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An exploration through a cryptic and dangerous world where everything and nothing has a meaning. We all go to the Dark Place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n3t.jpg'),(13665,'Unto the Night','2020-09-29','Adventure','Web browser','Gamma, Delta, and Epsilon have seen more than enough to last a life time. They\'ve been given hardly any information on what they are supposed to investigate and are also bringing some fresh recruits along.\n\nA sci-fi narrative game made in Twine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4stl.jpg'),(13666,'Goals','2025-12-31','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Gameplay-first, free to play, cross-play, multiplayer-focused and esports-ready football game in which every footballer will be unique.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f97.jpg'),(13667,'Pro Cycling Manager 2017','2017-06-15','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become the manager of a professional cycling team and compete against today\'s best riders in over 200 races (500+ stages) across the world, including iconic races such as La Vuelta and the iconic Tour de France.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24qp.jpg'),(13668,'Ace Combat: Assault Horizon','2011-10-13','Shooter, Simulator, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Ace Combat: Assault Horizon is the 14th game released in the Ace Combat series. It took place in the real world, albeit in a different timeline from that of Joint Assault. Players took control of various members of Task Force 108, most notably William Bishop, as they shut down the threat posed by Andrei Markov and other rebels from Russia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2egz.jpg'),(13669,'Nina Aquila: Legal Eagle, Season One','2021-07-09','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The chart-topping indie hit Nina Aquila: Legal Eagle, Season One comes to Steam, with a slew of enhancements and new features! Step into court as Nina Aquila, rookie defense attorney in this thrilling VN/adventure game hybrid, and fight for justice in a world where all anime genres exist at once!\n\nThis game replaces the earlier episodic releases and is a collected version of Chapters 1-3 of the \"Nina Aquila: Legal Eagle\" series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hcq.jpg'),(13670,'Ninja Gaiden 3: Razor\'s Edge','2013-12-11','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, Xbox 360, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ninja Gaiden 3: Razor\'s Edge is an enhanced port of Ninja Gaiden 3 that includes all downloadable content from the original title, as well as additional enhancements made to improve the game. The game can be considered an equivalent to the Ninja Gaiden Sigma games, as it enhances the original title.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p9b.jpg'),(13671,'The Banner Saga 2: Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13672,'You Will Select a Decision','2013-02-03','Adventure','Web browser','A pair of knock-off Choose Your Own Adventure books from Soviet-era Kyrgyzstan, newly declassified by the CIA.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rqqckkm7mdk6uuojowet.jpg'),(13673,'Bulanci','2023-12-21','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Bulanci is an action multiplayer and easy-to-play party game where you take pillow fights with your frenemies to the next level. Make your sleepless nights memorable by being fluffy and deadly!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gnc.jpg'),(13674,'The Tower','2018-07-18','Adventure','Web browser','A game about trans women, tarot, therapy, and alien abduction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fqr.jpg'),(13675,'FNaF World Simulator','2018-08-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome back to Animatronica!\n\nFreddy has completed \"the game\", and gained an unfair amount of power. With his new powers, he\'ll take over Animatronica and destroy any enemies left in it.\n\nIt is now up to the so called \"enemies\" to stop Freddy before it\'s too late!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zck.jpg'),(13676,'Shark Adventure','2022-02-03','Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Shark Adventure puts you in the role of a shark and your primary focus is to acquire as many stars as you can, while avoiding obstacles that come your way. It\'s a very engaging and impressive game with lots of fun and enjoyable mechanics. This is not a simple game, it requires a lot of precision and attention. But it goes to show how exciting and fun this type of experience actually is.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5asb.jpg'),(13677,'Dragon Ball Fusions','2016-12-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','RPG based on the famous manga Dragon Ball. In the game the player has the possibility to fuse together the characters (using a special bracelet), in order to obtain new heroes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50f8.jpg'),(13678,'Mangia','2014-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','Mangia is a game about Nina Freeman\'s personal experience being diagnosed with a chronic illness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xca.jpg'),(13679,'Somewhere Near Romance','2017-12-06','Indie','Web browser','You are SAL: Simple Artificial LifeProgram. You \"love\" a human. Don\'t you? Can you, a logical and digital being, love? Most importantly, do you want to find out?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uq1.jpg'),(13680,'3x3x3: A Mermaid\'s Tale','2013-12-31','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','A text adventure about mermaids and motherhood.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bh5.jpg'),(13681,'Diehexegy',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Diehexegy is a hex grid turn-based 4x game with a unique twist: your armies are composed of dice. It has multiple victory conditions and straightforward gameplay. Challenge friends or fellow strategists in asynchronous multiplayer matches.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13682,'Dogs of War','2000-04-14','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/g8gyv9qjcwptfa0ot4eh.jpg'),(13683,'Game & Watch Gallery 2','1997-09-27','Arcade','Game Boy Color, Nintendo 3DS, Game Boy','Game & Watch Gallery 2 is the sequel to Game & Watch Gallery released in 1997 for the Game Boy, only in Japan. This version is a colorized version released for the Game Boy Color in 1998. The game included six revisions of classic Game & Watch games, one of which is not playable from the beginning and must be unlocked.\n\nThis colorized version was never released in Japan, although a prototype was found.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a83.jpg'),(13684,'Anturi','2025-02-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As Wikku, embark on a search for your missing father in the unknown world of Anturi. Explore the islands and help the inhabitants. Also gather information about your father\'s fate. Improve your skills to better combat the unknown dangers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m1k.jpg'),(13685,'Artists of a Dead World',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A lonely city somewhere at the end of the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54xf.jpg'),(13686,'Yoshi\'s Island: Super Mario Advance 3','2002-09-24','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, Wii U, Game Boy Advance','Super Mario Advance 3 is a GBA remake for the SNES with the dinosaur Yoshi and his friends as main characters carrying Baby Mario and Luigi on their back.\n\nSuper Mario Advance is a four-part series for the GBA with Super Mario games of the NES and SNES era. The remakes came with adjusted graphics, sound and additional content. Each game of the series includes additionally the arcade-classic \"Mario Bros\" which can be played in multiplayer via link cable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ac4.jpg'),(13687,'Alter Ego Complex','2020-09-27','Simulator, Adventure','Android, iOS','\"I think... I\'ll read a book.\" In her dreams, you can be together... Read a variety of dream stories, enjoy original art while you dream. \"This...is the story of my dreams.\" This app is a spin off from the full Alter Ego game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4r6r.jpg'),(13688,'My Kindness is Not an Invitation For You to Touch Me','2013-12-31','Visual Novel','Web browser','I made this game in 2013 after I went to PAX East, where a dude I\'d just met in person pissed all over my personal boundaries and slam dunked them into a trash can. I was angry and this helped me feel much better!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co919a.jpg'),(13689,'Mémoire 0079','2023-07-19','Visual Novel','Web browser','Mémoire 0079 is a narrative adventure game about exploring a wiki-like interface to uncover the secret history of a mecha war between earth and space in the uncomfortably not-so-distant future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6spj.jpg'),(13690,'Assassin\'s Creed: The Ezio Collection','2022-02-17','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Make history as the legendary Master Assassin, Ezio Auditore da Firenze, in Assassin’s Creed The Ezio Collection, which includes the acclaimed single-player campaigns and single-player add-on content (no multiplayer content) from Assassin’s Creed II, Assassin’s Creed Brotherhood, and Assassin’s Creed Revelations with enhanced\ngraphics.\n\nLive the life of Ezio and learn the ways of the Assassin as he seeks vengeance for the betrayal of his family. Travel through 15th-century Renaissance Italy, including the capital Rome and finally onto 16th-century Constantinople.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nrv.jpg'),(13691,'Owlboy','2016-11-01','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Owlboy is a platform/action-adventure video game created by Norwegian developer D-Pad Studio.\nExplore a vibrantly crafted pixel world in this flying adventure platformer.\nBeing a mute, Otus struggles living up to the expectations of owl-hood. Things spiral from bad to worse with the sudden appearance of sky pirates.\nWhat follows is a journey through monster infested ruins, with unexpected encounters, and burdens no one should have to bear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nc2.jpg'),(13692,'Adventures in Odyssey and the Treasure of the Incas','2005-02-15','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Unravel the mysterious accusations against Eugene Meltsner\'s parents as you play the role of Whit, Connie and Eugene. Investigate clues and discover important facts, eventually leading you to the South American jungle to solve the mystery. It also teaches and encourages family values by rewarding Christian virtues like faith, trust and more. Enjoy hours of interactive game play! Compatible with PC and Mac.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lrk3ztbnvnn138ptw0ur.jpg'),(13693,'Microsoft Train Simulator','2001-07-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Microsoft Train Simulator (abbreviated to MSTS) is a train simulator for Microsoft Windows, released in July 2001 and developed by UK-based Kuju Entertainment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fyp96hwrjfe4j0o3yg32.jpg'),(13694,'Faif','2014-03-01','Sin género','Web browser, Android, iOS','Faif is a puzzle/rpg game with a unique battle system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1x2c.jpg'),(13695,'Pathologic','2005-08-18','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pathologic (known in Russian as Мор. Утопия) is an award winning 2005 psychological horror video game developed by the Russian studio Ice-Pick Lodge. It was published in Russia and other CIS-countries by Buka Entertainment. The game was published in the UK on 18 August 2006 by G2 Games. The game is going to be remade for Xbox One, PlayStation 4, Microsoft Windows, Mac OS X and Linux by Ice-Pick Lodge and self-published in 2015.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qvl.jpg'),(13696,'Cut Strings','2023-02-12','Indie','Web browser','Media that wants to stay lost.\n\nA horror blogger stumbles upon a series of lost media finds that leads them to uncover the mystery of characters \"escaping\" from their source material.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67m1.jpg'),(13697,'Your Gay Monster Family','2015-10-27','Visual Novel','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Only one ending. Don\'t worry about it.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13698,'Lady Thalia and the Rose of Rocroi','2022-04-01','Adventure','Web browser','Everyone who’s anyone summers in France - which means master thief Lady Thalia is there too, attending garden parties by day and stealing masterpieces by night. Unfortunately, this holiday is less than restful, as she crosses paths with foes both old and new. Case your targets, steal works of art, and team up with your Scotland Yard nemesis in this puzzle-based Twine game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vfb.jpg'),(13699,'Alchemist Adventure','2021-05-20','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','You awaken in a strange and unknown place, with no memories, alone in a world you know nothing about. Now you must explore the dangerous and abandoned region of Isur and discover its secrets — as they are tightly connected to your own story. To explore the world you will need to use the power gained by combining nature’s four elements — fire, water, air, earth — with various ingredients. By crafting different potions, you will be able to explore the regions of Isur, solve alchemical puzzles, and fight dreadful enemies. Discover Isur Explore the devastated lands and uncover hidden secrets. Your journey will take you through four regions filled with quests, puzzles, enemies of all kinds and bits of lore that will help you to unlock the secrets of a seemingly forsaken region. Recover your memories You play as Mya, a young and talented alchemist who is eager to find and save her daughter and husband. While playing, you will learn more about this strange land, your memories of it, and the disturbing connection between Isur and your own story. Feel the adventure Alchemist Adventure is a game that encourages you to experiment, think, and search for new things throughout your journey. There are no strict alchemical recipes, so you will be able to make your own unique potions and explore the possibilities of the rich alchemy system. As you progress, the challenge increases, and the number of save points decreases — and with no auto save, you will need to be careful, think ahead,…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2peu.jpg'),(13700,'Firefighting Simulator: The Squad','2022-12-06','Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','With Firefighting Simulator: The Squad, you can become part of a major US city\'s firefighting team and experience how it feels to fight fires.\n\nStart the siren of your fire truck, grab your hose, and fight realistic fires to save lives. Discover over 40 diverse deployment locations spread across the city inspired by the North American West Coast. Equip yourself with authentic firefighting gear such as helmets, firefighter boots, and a breathing apparatus model by well-known North American firefighting equipment manufacturers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uzb.jpg'),(13701,'Stronghold Crusader II','2014-09-22','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Stronghold Crusader 2 is the long awaited sequel to Stronghold: Crusader, the original \'castle sim\'. After 12 years Stronghold returns to the deserts of the Middle East circa 1189, with a new 3D engine and realistic castle destruction powered by Havok Physics. Crusader 2 will recapture the original game’s addictive, fast-paced gameplay and authentic castle simulation.\n\nTrue to its roots this new Stronghold will define old school real time strategy, combining RTS and city builder gameplay. Playing as a brutal Crusader Knight or Arabic freedom fighter, you must use a deadly array of troops and destructive siege equipment to decide the fate of the holy lands. Lead your forces into battle as either Richard the Lionheart or the Sultan of Syria in two historic single-player campaigns, with dynamic events such as tornados and locust swarms. Become the greatest Lord by managing your desert economy and seizing control of vital oases.\n\nTo dominate the battlefield you will need to command more than 25 unique unit types, mastering their special abilities. Raise morale with the Sergeant at Arms, charge in with the Sassanid Knight, use Archers to launch an arrow volley or scale castle walls with the deadly Assassin. Once your skills have been perfected put them to the test in skirmish mode or take the battle online with up to eight players. Create teams, choose different AI opponents and design your own map in the ultimate skirmish or multiplayer game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wer.jpg'),(13702,'We Are Not All Alone Unhappy','2022-06-06','Indie','Web browser','“We Are Not All Alone Unhappy” is a short interactive narrative piece made in Twine which interrogates the idea of the Shakespearean happy ending. It asks players to create a pairing between two characters who received canonically unhappy endings in Shakespeare’s plays.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13703,'A Day in the Life of a Writer','2020-12-26','Indie','Web browser','A small interactive fiction about the day of a writer, their routine, their work, their fears, and anxieties...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rfr.jpg'),(13704,'Cosmo 02',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Cosmo 02 is a bullet hello and fixed shooter game where you, as a space soldier, will single-handedly destroy entire fleets of opponents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5d4q.jpg'),(13705,'Flying Nightmares','1994-12-31','Simulator','3DO Interactive Multiplayer','Flying Nightmares is a 3-D flight-sim game that has the player take to the controls of the Harrier jet, flying in a series of missions with realistic controls and weapon systems against a horde of enemy planes and ground units. \n \nThe player can also fly alongside three computer wingmen that will help them out during missions, completing certain objectives such as destroying certain enemy units or protecting friendly units. There is a multitude of views to choose from (1st, 3rd and even a missiles POV) and features FMV sequences between missions that tell the story of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p56.jpg'),(13706,'Phogs!','2020-12-03','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In Phogs! you play as a duo of dogs on a captivating, puzzle-filled adventure. Linked by a stretchy belly, you’ll need to bark, bite and bounce your way through obstacles set across the themed worlds of Food, Sleep and Play, in co-op or single-player.\n\nForage through Food World, teeming with tasty treats. From hot buttered toast to chopped celery... even a river of chocolate!\n\nStroll through Sleep World, complete with teddy bears, cushions and quilts, all nestled in the glow of the soothing night-light.\n\nPounce through the crazy toybox of Play World, exploring a beach amusement park, a retro arcade, and everything in between. Woof!\n\nSupporting single-player and shared-controller gameplay, plus local and online co-op, Red and Blue are always ready to play!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lf0.jpg'),(13707,'Honeypot','2021-09-29','Adventure','Web browser','A queer erotic scifi-fantasy game about being stranded on a perverse part of an alien planet with an alien companion.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13708,'Nintendo Countdown Calendar','2009-12-02','Sin género','Nintendo DSi','With Nintendo Countdown Calendar, you can add and track all of your important events in a fun and exciting countdown format.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ba8.jpg'),(13709,'Final Fantasy XI: Rhapsodies of Vana\'diel','2015-05-14','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Released across the May, August, and November 2015 version updates, Rhapsodies of Vana\'diel is designed to be the conclusion of the main scenario missions of Final Fantasy XI, tying together plotlines and characters from across the game\'s previous stories. Completing the missions requires registration of and progression through all previous expansion packs. Other additions include the new areas Escha and Reisenjima and new trusts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x56.jpg'),(13710,'Pocket Thief','2025-04-14','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slide your way to becoming a master thief, as you steal from the rich, and keep a little something for yourself; in this criminally fun 2D puzzle game. Navigate barriers and drag other obstructions thoughtfully away until you can successfully guide the loot out of each maze-like level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lms.jpg'),(13711,'Space Tail: Homecoming','2023-03-07','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','In Space Tail: Homecoming, you will travel together with the dog astronaut Bea to visit the home planets of comet Rose and the robot 808BY.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69px.jpg'),(13712,'Fighting Eyes','1999-01-17','Fighting','PlayStation','Fighting Eyes is a 3D Fighting game that features 12 different characters, developed by Bandit and published by Solan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lmn.jpg'),(13713,'Chatterbox','2024-04-07','Simulator','Web browser','Introducing Chatterbox - the desktop chat app that brings back the simplicity of text-based communication. A piece of Interactive Fiction written for the 2024 Dialogue Jam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co861j.jpg'),(13714,'Pretty Dinosaur Adventures of Ancient Earth VR','2023-02-02','Simulator','SteamVR','Through 3D virtual methods, let players feel the fun of virgin forests and ancient Egypt by dinosaurs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62y7.jpg'),(13715,'The Legend of Neverland','2021-07-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Legacy Mobile Device','The Legend of Neverland is an MMORPG set in a universe called Cabala. Something strange is happening in this utopia, and it\'s up to you to protect the innocent civilians who are being attacked by evil forces. After designing your character\'s appearance, you can start exploring this open world with more surprises than meets the eye.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8scg.jpg'),(13716,'Open At Nine','2023-04-12','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','“Massive debt, a shabby brothel, and a naughty succubus… This is all I get for defeating the Demon Lord?!” Hire monster girls to attract customers and pay off your debts! Don\'t forget to give your girls lots of hands-on job training!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64ax.jpg'),(13717,'Legend of Traveller','2019-03-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a Roguelike and card combination of the game, the enemy and you as \"weak\".Who can get stronger and win faster?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13718,'U R Hell','2023-10-13','Adventure','Web browser','A haunted computer simulator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78li.jpg'),(13719,'Rock \'N Racing Bundle Off Road & Rally','2021-03-05','Racing, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Enjoy 2 games in 1 with this irresistible speed games pack!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4dk0.jpg'),(13720,'Maimai Green Plus','2014-01-31','Music, Arcade','Arcade','An update to maimai GreeN cabinets, maimai GreeN PLUS released on February 26th, 2014 in Japan, following short location tests on January 31st, 2014.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dqe.jpg'),(13721,'Danganronpa: Bursting Love',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Danganronpa','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13722,'Hero Park','2021-05-28','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Create the perfect illusion of an adventure town with blacksmiths, taverns, and dungeons with monsters bred by you. Meet epic characters who want to join you and use their skills to lure the hero\'s gold out of their purses. Make Hero Park what it used to be: the most magnificent town in the kingdom!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42dg.jpg'),(13723,'Pillars of Eternity','2015-03-26','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Prepare to be enchanted by a world where the choices you make and the paths you choose shape your destiny. Recapture the deep sense of exploration, the joy of a pulsating adventure, and the thrill of leading your own band of companions across a new fantasy realm and into the depths of monster-infested dungeons in search of lost treasures and ancient mysteries.\n\nSo gather your party, venture forth, and embrace adventure as you delve into a realm of wonder, nostalgia, and the excitement of classic RPGs with Obsidian’s Pillars of Eternity!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tzg.jpg'),(13724,'The Song Out of Space','2022-02-04','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In 1962, during the height of the Cold War, twelve astronomers at a deep-space observatory were found dead. Because of the proximity of an important military base, two federal agents were sent to investigate any Russian involvement... And what they found was from beyond this world.\nChoose to play as federal agent Catherine Armstrong, a young recruit with excellent scientific skills, or as Stuart Ross, a street-smart veteran. Their unique skills and personality will change how the story unfolds. And whatever you do, try to keep your sanity!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ehg.jpg'),(13725,'Indiana Jones','1989-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7okn.jpg'),(13726,'Storyteller: Devilish Update','2023-09-26','Sin género','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','The first update of Storyteller brings the Devil, a new character with new puzzles, a new chapter Genesis with demo version\'s puzzles reimaginated, a fully-voiced narrator and new levels on existing chapters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75hj.jpg'),(13727,'Spell Rift',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','A turn-based tactical roguelike with deep hero management and asynchronous PvP.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13728,'Megabat','2025-02-01','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','While in search of food, a fruit bat stumbles its way through the ventilation system of a secret facility finding unique fruit that give special abilities. While in search of more fruit the bat must avoid traps and enemies. Will the bat be able to satiate it\'s hunger and escape with its life?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ctm.jpg'),(13729,'Demons Ate My Neighbors!',NULL,'Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Demons & VHS horrors terrorize y\'alls neighborhood, a 90’s nostalgia nightmare! DAMN is a manic adventure roguelite shooter, & a funky spin on co-op arcade classics. Find & exorcise neighbors from hell with upgrades, holy squirt guns & household weapons… before the ICE CREAM MAN gets ya! GET PUMPED!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ocj.jpg'),(13730,'Prison Alone','2024-09-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A psychological horror game with NO jumpscares. Feel the tension and suspense, get goosebumps, experience strange frightening events, and explore, look for keys, solve puzzles, while thinking hard to find a way to get out of this huge, and maybe not so empty prison.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8v6b.jpg'),(13731,'Helldivers: Terrain Specialist Pack','2015-12-07','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When you need to move fast through difficult terrain, the Terrain Specialist is the Helldiver to call upon. Equipped with all weather gear and boots capable of compensating for difficult terrain, they feel at home in any environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ivj.jpg'),(13732,'LEGO Harry Potter: Years 1-4','2011-01-06','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','OnLive Game System, PlayStation 3, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','Experience the magic of Harry Potter\'s first 4 years at Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry in an exciting new way. LEGO Harry Potter: Years 1-4 combines the first four Harry Potter books and films in an interactive fun-filled videogame. Players can build the adventure from Privet Drive to the Triwizard Tournament through new LEGO gameplay elements like magical building and spell-casting.\n\nSelect from over 100 playable characters including Harry Potter, Ron Weasley and Hermione Granger. Experience the wonder of Hogwarts: attend lessons, mix potions, fly on broomsticks, and complete tasks to collect LEGO studs and relive the adventures like never before with tongue-in-cheek humor and creative customization unique to LEGO videogames.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qrp.jpg'),(13733,'The Two of Us','2021-12-18','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Two of Us is a 2D Co-op Platformer that has a strong emphasis on working together. You will be greeted with various puzzle levels where you must work in conjunction with your friend to navigate the level. The game is complete with 2D Animations, Sound Effects and PvE Combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b1q.jpg'),(13734,'Captain America and the Avengers','1991-12-31','Fighting, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Arcade, Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Captain America and the Avengers is an arcade game released by Data East in 1991. It features the Marvel Comics characters The Avengers in a side-scrolling brawling and shooting adventure to defeat the evil Red Skull.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98ie.jpg'),(13735,'Reel Fishing: Days of Summer','2024-10-30','Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Your Ultimate Fishing Trip Awaits!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91e6.jpg'),(13736,'LEGO Marvel\'s Avengers: Marvel\'s Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D. Pack','2016-05-17','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Based on the second season of the Marvel\'s Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D. television series, this DLC adds a brand-new level, eleven characters, and an additional vehicle to your Marvel\'s Avengers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fk0.jpg'),(13737,'Ashanti Protocol: Unmanned Peacekeepers Amidst a Tempest of Conflict','2025-01-02','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cx8.jpg'),(13738,'Arcane Raise','2017-03-10','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Arcane Raise is a role-playing video game franchise, wherein a group of resurrected hunters known as Shades, fight alongside humans against monsters in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by an infestation. Do you have what it takes to survive this hostile land?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29ie.jpg'),(13739,'Caesar\'s Travels','1984-12-31','Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mthsdxfbomq6xzjwqz5e.jpg'),(13740,'Squirrel Launcher','2023-01-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Launch squirrels into the atmosphere and explore the clouds. Dodge and shoot down obstacles – upgrade your vehicle to make it further and further until you get to the moon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80ct.jpg'),(13741,'Conductor Cat',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Conductor Cat is a 3D platformer about gathering scrap to engineer creative solutions. Take on the role of a cat named Griffin as he must scavenge, craft, and build his way back to his home country.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1o.jpg'),(13742,'Alphakhor',NULL,'Adventure','Amstrad CPC','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/unb2drmnicvyfhbow7g4.jpg'),(13743,'Helldivers: Ranger Pack','2015-12-07','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Specially trained in scouting and assassination of high value targets, these Rangers are the first to drop into the unknown. Ranger training was standard procedure for all Helldivers in the early days of Super Earth, but has now become rarer. The Ranger Pack contains: The Ranger Uniform, a cosmetic helmet, armor, and cape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ivh.jpg'),(13744,'2 in 1: Trash Punk & Moto Rush GT','2025-01-09','Shooter, Racing, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Ultimate motorbike racing experience for all ages!\nRock the apocalypse in punk style!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9akw.jpg'),(13745,'Soldat 2','2020-09-22','Shooter','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Soldat 2 is a 2D deathmatch shooter with real guns, ragdoll violence and physics-based movement. Based on classic Soldat with team game modes, ranked multiplayer, bots, community driven-development and built-in customization and level editing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ovj.jpg'),(13746,'Remember Me','2013-06-07','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','A visionary 3rd person action adventure, Remember Me puts players into the role of Nilin, a former elite memory hunter with the ability to break into people\'s minds and steal or even alter their memories. The authorities, fearful of her knowledge and capabilities have arrested Nilin and wiped her memory clean. After her escape from prison, Nilin sets out on a mission to recover her identity, helped by her last and only friend. This search for her past leads to her being hunted by the very people that created this surveillance society.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h9u.jpg'),(13747,'Flashback 2: Limited Edition','2024-02-16','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The Limited Edition of Flashback 2 includes\n- The game\n- An exclusive Steelbook\n- The digital soundtrack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nun.jpg'),(13748,'Super Mario Odyssey F.L.U.D.D.','2023-01-10','Platform','Nintendo Switch','A mod which adds F.L.U.D.D. from Super Mario Sunshine in Super Mario Odyssey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63jd.jpg'),(13749,'BoneTown: The Second Coming Edition','2021-06-08','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','GTA meets South Park with sex and drugs in BoneTown, a hilariously hardcore game that combines free roaming, action adventure gameplay with fucking, fighting, and getting fucked up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5c2w.jpg'),(13750,'Doomed\'n Damned','2015-07-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doomed\'n Damned is an action game based on retro/classic platform games from Arcades and 16 bit consoles, but revised to the HD era. The level design, characters, plot and difficulty have a lot of influence from the late 80s and early 90s games. The development and production is by arc-gen, an one man indie game studio.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8689.jpg'),(13751,'Indiana Jones and the Temple of Doom','1988-12-01','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Entertainment System','The NES version of Indiana Jones and the Temple of Doom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7v75.jpg'),(13752,'Re:Fresh','2023-04-24','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Restore your town as you run, jump, and dash through cozy locales while helping lovable townsfolk! Become immersed in a tight-knit community of animals and robots while becoming the town hero in this heart-warming solarpunk adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hci.jpg'),(13753,'Sniper Elite 5','2022-05-26','Fighting, Shooter, Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The latest instalment in the award-winning series, Sniper Elite 5 offers unparalleled sniping, tactical third-person combat and an enhanced kill cam. Fight your way across the most immersive maps yet, with many real-world locations captured in stunning detail, and an improved traversal system that lets you explore more of them than ever before.\n\nFrance, 1944 – As part of a covert US Rangers operation to weaken the Atlantikwall fortifications along the coast of Brittany, elite marksman Karl Fairburne makes contact with the French Resistance. Soon they uncover a secret Nazi project that threatens to end the war before the Allies can even invade Europe: Operation Kraken.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ehj.jpg'),(13754,'4-in-1 Version 2',NULL,'Sin género','Game Boy Color, Game Boy','4-in-1 Version 2 was the second volume of 4-in-1 multicarts made by Sachen. It contains: Virus Attack, Electron World, Dice Square, and Trouble Zone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i7m.jpg'),(13755,'Instruments of Chaos Starring Young Indiana Jones','1994-12-31','Adventure','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Instruments of Chaos Starring Young Indiana Jones is an action/adventure game with platforming elements. In it you control the titular character through missions around the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mu9.jpg'),(13756,'Hazelight Bundle','2022-09-20','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Two exclusively co-op adventures best played with friends!\nHelp each other through unexpected obstacles and laugh-out-loud moments to fix a fractured relationship in It Takes Two.\nPlay the role of one of two prisoners making their daring escape from prison in A Way Out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fx0.jpg'),(13757,'Syndicate Plus','1994-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','Syndicate is Bullfrog’s masterpiece of a game in which you aren’t saving the world or protecting innocents. You just make sure that your employers get what they want. At your disposal are four cyborg agents, an impressive arsenal of weapons and gadgets, and a massive selection of cybernetic upgrades. You are free to unleash this power on a highly interactive map where you can blow up buildings, steal cars, light trees on fire, or just shoot stuff. Produced by Peter Molyneux himself, Syndicate is the essence of cyberpunk and, with its great music, stylized visuals, and mind-blowing atmosphere, it has earned its place among the best games of all time.\n\nThe \"Plus\" release includes both the original base game and the American Revolt expansion pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fz3.jpg'),(13758,'StaudSoft\'s Synthetic World','2015-02-09','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome to StaudSoft\'s Synthetic World Beta! It allows you via a seed to create a unique landscape with mountains, oceans, trees and beaches. Although it looks like a normal game engine, everything in the game is based on voxels. So everything you see can be changed. You can cut down trees, build a house or dig into the ground!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13759,'Two Point Hospital: Jumbo Edition','2021-03-05','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Two Point Hospital: Jumbo Edition is a bundle of four big expansions, two item packs and a free update including some of the most popular community requested features. Besides the main game it includes: Two Point Hospital: Off the Grid, Two Point Hospital: Close Encounters, Two Point Hospital: Pebberley Island, Two Point Hospital: Bigfoot, Retro Items Pack, Exhibition Items Pack, Room templates and Remix 1&2: digital recreation of some of your favorite levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oyz.jpg'),(13760,'Sokobond','2022-05-19','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Sokobond is an elegantly designed puzzle game about chemistry. It\'s logical, minimalist, and crafted with love and science.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s9y.jpg'),(13761,'3 Player Battle','2017-09-05','Fighting, Platform, Strategy, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Oh Snapple Apples! \n \nA Platformer Fighting Game with 3 Players! \n \nRunning, Jumping, Shooting, Laughing \n \nYou can do it ALL \n \nJust Have Fuuuunnnnnn!!!! \n \n*A Controller is not needed for the 3rd Player but is highly suggested*','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ywscjjwiuhfsxybn0alo.jpg'),(13762,'Battlefield 3: Limited Edition','2011-10-25','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Gamers who pre-order Battlefield 3 are assured a copy of the Limited Edition, which includes the Back to Karkand post-launch digital expansion pack at no extra charge. With Back to Karkand, players can wage all-out war on four of the most celebrated maps from Battlefield 2 including Strike at Karkand, Gulf of Oman and the Sharqi Peninsula, all stunningly re-created using the power of Frostbite 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3aao.jpg'),(13763,'Uno: Party! Mania','2024-07-10','Card & Board Game','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dive into the classic game with a twist, as extra action cards and special rules have been added to spice things up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93lc.jpg'),(13764,'Nigel Mansell\'s World Championship','1992-12-31','Racing, Sport','Amiga CD32, Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, DOS, Amiga, Game Boy, Nintendo Entertainment System','Timing smiled on Gremlin with this licensed Formula 1 simulation, as Nigel\'s long quest for a championship had finally come good. The game was pitched somewhere in between a full-blown simulation like F1 GP and action games like Continental Circus. Only 12 cars were in each race, which could last from between 3 and 20 laps.\n\nBefore each race you can customize wing downforce, gear ratio, tyre selection and fuel load choices – pitstops are a standard feature of the longer races. The 16-bit versions include a unique \'Improve With Mansell\' mode, in which a digitized version of Nigel\'s head appears in the top corner of the screen, offering instructions and praise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6amh.jpg'),(13765,'Indiana Jones and the Great Circle: The Order of Giants','2025-12-31','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Live the adventure with the Premium Edition to receive Indiana Jones and the Great Circle: The Order of Giants Story DLC*.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co921a.jpg'),(13766,'Helldivers: Entrenched Pack','2015-12-07','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Specialized equipment for the Helldiver that truly needs to hold ground. With this pack it is significantly easier to hold your ground against the enemies of mankind. The Entrenched Pack contains: AT-47 Anti-Tank Emplacement: A well armored emplacement that has to be operated manually.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ivc.jpg'),(13767,'Dwarfs!?','2011-05-04','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dwarfs!?\' offers an addictive, fast paced arcade-like experience, with plenty of difficulties and game modes to play around in.\n\nAs the new overseer for your underground Dwarf base, your job is to manage the small colony and make it as rich as possible, before they meet their inevitable doom! To survive as long as possible, you’ll have to steer and guide your greedy little fellows to the richest points in the caves, while avoiding all the dangers – so they don’t end up destroying your Town Hall and its essential supply of beer.\n\nThey explore for you, they mine for you and they fight for you - but if you don\'t keep an eye on them, they\'ll do what they do best: die for you and take everyone else with them. But, if all else fails when the Spider Queen comes for you – use the Outpost’s Dwarf Cannon and shoot Dwarfs at her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s0x.jpg'),(13768,'Fight Club','2004-11-16','Fighting','Xbox, Legacy Mobile Device, PlayStation 2','Fight Club is based on David Fincher\'s film adaption of Chuck Palahniuk\'s novel of the same name. Fed up with consumerist American culture, a fight club is founded as a new type of therapy through bare-knuckle fighting. The game focuses on the fights and uses many characters and environments from the original story. You can create a new fighter or clone one of the generated characters. There are three general fighting styles to choose from: grappling, kung fu or brawling. The moves range from basic punches to devastating moves with broken bones, ripped clothes and real-time facial deformation. After each successful fight, you earn Character Development Points (CDP\'s) which can be used to upgrade or heal your character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ov2.jpg'),(13769,'Amagami','2009-03-19','Simulator, Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','Amagami is a Japanese dating simulation game for the PlayStation 2 and the spiritual successor to KimiKiss.\n\nTwo years ago, Junichi Tachibana had his heart broken by a girl who stood him up on a date on Christmas Eve. Now a second-year student in high school, Junichi is wary of love because of his past and dislikes celebrating Christmas. However this Christmas, his encounter with one of six girls from his school: Haruka Morishima, Kaoru Tanamachi, Sae Nakata, Ai Nanasaki, Rihoko Sakurai, or Tsukasa Ayatsuji will finally open his true self and heart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wi5.jpg'),(13770,'Super Mario Odyssey: Google Translated','2024-02-26','Platform','Nintendo Switch','Almost the entirety of Super Mario Odyssey has been run through multiple layers of Google Translate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98vl.jpg'),(13771,'Sackboy: A Big Adventure - Sports Clothing Pack',NULL,'Platform, Adventure','Sin plataforma','The hottest new label of sporty apparel has launched to great excitement across Craftworld. Add loads of new gear to your wardrobe from skater shirts to faded jeans, trainers, beanies, and much more. Internet connection required to access downloadable content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rwi.jpg'),(13772,'Sonic X Shadow Generations: Sonic Jam Skin','2024-11-01','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co933k.jpg'),(13773,'Factions',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Join your faction, and fight for survival in this exciting third person shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1t.jpg'),(13774,'Freelife',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Co-create a universe teeming with potential in this open world voxel sandbox.Craft a character that reflects your style, race around the city in high-octane vehicles, manage your underground empire or team up with friends for daring operations and thrilling heists!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cau.jpg'),(13775,'PBA Pro Bowling','2019-10-22','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Lace up your bowling shoes and experience the most realistic bowling simulation ever created with PBA Pro Bowling!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v4o.jpg'),(13776,'Indiana Jones and the Infernal Machine','2001-03-30','Sin género','Game Boy Color','1947. The Nazis have been crushed, the Cold War has begun and Soviet agents are sniffing around the ruins of the fabled Tower of Babel. What are they up to? The CIA wants renowned archaeologist and adventurer Dr. Henry \"Indiana\" Jones, Jr. to find out. Grab your whip and fedora and join Indy in a globe-spanning race to unearth the mysterious \"Infernal Machine.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vh7.jpg'),(13777,'Sprout Lands','2022-03-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sprout lands - Explore the green expanses of a fairy tale world in this platform game with the main character trying to harvest his crops from the beds that have been stolen!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nxk.jpg'),(13778,'Stellar Docks: Deep Space','2025-03-19','Puzzle, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Logic without limits, puzzles beyond the stars!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jz8.jpg'),(13779,'Super Mario Odyssey: Balloon World','2018-02-28','Platform','Nintendo Switch','A free update for Super Mario Odyssey available since February 2018. The update comes with new filters for photo mode, three new outfits, and a mini-game that\'s composed of two parts: Hide It and Find It.\nThe new mini-game, Balloon World, is run by Mario\'s brother Luigi. In Hide It, players have 30 seconds to hide balloons in select worlds. In Find It, players are given 30 seconds to find balloons hidden by other players. There\'s a leaderboard for Balloon World too. Balloon world is only available after beating the main story.\n\n- Added Luigi\'s Balloon World\n- More Filters Added\n- More Outfits Added\n- Jump-Rope Challenge has been adjusted so that there will be a speed change after -reaching 110 jumps.\n- World Rankings and Friend Rankings have been reset for Jump-Rope Challenge.\n- Fixed a number of issues to improve the gameplay experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mzy.jpg'),(13780,'In.My.Mind',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','In.My.Mind is an horror first person survival game: Explore! Solve the puzzles! Survive! Fight! Run!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43lt.jpg'),(13781,'GTA Turk City','2005-05-14','Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','GTA Turk City (also known as GTA Türk) is a mod of GTA Vice City','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92ww.jpg'),(13782,'Medieval Builders: Strongholds & Castles',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Craft, hunt, and survive in fantasy medieval world. Build your village, manage and defend castles and whole kingdoms. Become a local lord and a builder. Strongholds & Castles are waiting for you to manage them - alone or with your friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64x5.jpg'),(13783,'Argo','2023-11-01','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Argo is a unique roguelite action strategy game in a minimalist style. Use combos to use abilities, dodge enemy attacks and defeat the Void, Hell and Pestilence bosses. You don\'t have to do it alone either, because you can play the entire game in online co-op mode!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78w6.jpg'),(13784,'Galaga Wars','2016-11-01','Arcade','Android, iOS','The galaxy is calling for you, it needs to be saved from waves of aliens. Jump in your ship and head to space. The survival of the universe is once more at stake. They have an alien mothership of immense proportions, endless waves of ships bristling with high-tech weaponry and of course the sheer power of the boss Galaga...\n\nYou are the hero that will make it through those waves as if they were mere bricks. You are the breaker of this cycle and the savior of the galaxy\n\nGalaga Wars is a classic retro shooter that has been seen times and times in your favorite arcades. From pixel ships to more refined ones, have the feel of a casual runner mixed with the adrenaline of destroying enemies in the vast ocean of stars\n\nATTACK\n\nthrough endless waves of original enemies, including the Bee, Butterfly, Scorpion and many more deadly ones.\n\nENHANCE\n\nyour weapons by upgrading and leveling up your craft.\n\nBLAST\n\nalien waves with 4 unique abilities per ship including laser, explosive shot, space mines, ghost shield...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pf4kuskwtstbuub02iew.jpg'),(13785,'Simian.Interface','2016-06-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Simian.Interface is an abstract puzzle experience for simian participants of all ages and abilities. There are no explicit rules, no instructions, and very simple controls. Puzzles must be solved using pattern recognition, intuition, and experimentation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co225z.jpg'),(13786,'Super Mario Odyssey: Kaizo Mode','2024-07-23','Platform','Nintendo Switch','Super Mario Odyssey: Kaizo Mode is a mod for version 1.0 of Super Mario Odyssey which increases the difficulty of every moon in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s04.jpg'),(13787,'Nylos',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Nylos is a physics-based puzzle platformer where players use unique powers to solve puzzles in creative ways. Explore diverse environments from lush caves to high-tech labs. And uncover the hidden secrets of this world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1n.jpg'),(13788,'Pokémon Study: Hikaruze! Pokémon Typing PC',NULL,'Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13789,'Lost Wing','2020-07-29','Shooter, Racing, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Lost Wing is all about speed, guns, and points. Storm your way through brutally-challenging environments and destroy the mega bosses for a chance to top the leaderboards! Featuring a deep electronic soundtrack and stunning neon sci-fi visuals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ngs.jpg'),(13790,'Trizon','2025-05-15','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Trizon is a roguelike deck-building game. Fuse any two cards together to play crazy combos. Encounter strange events, formidable foes, and perhaps some charming companions as you venture deeper, ultimately uncovering the truth behind it all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ggg.jpg'),(13791,'Super Mario Odyssey: Bon-Bones Mountain','2023-03-19','Platform','Nintendo Switch','A level mod for Super Mario Odyssey that repalces Luncheon Kingdom with a custom level called Bon-Bones Mountain, a desert kingdom featuring a train station.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6eon.jpg'),(13792,'Chick Chick Boom','2011-01-27','Indie','Wii','Chick Chick Boom is an entertaining and action-packed game demanding both creativity and good timing. Beat the opposing chick team, but there is a twist! In Chick Chick Boom, you throw pianos, pink elephants, and sumo chicks or summon slimy giant jellyfish and real UFOs. Draw lines in the arena to defend against your opponent\'s attacks - the skill lies in your use of ink, creativity and timing! And extra help is provided by a corncob and a piñata. Yes, really!\n\nPlay on your own or with friends - as a team or against each other! To keep things interesting there are various game modes and different arenas, each with their own special attack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hbdogzmc90c7kuisltbr.jpg'),(13793,'Sword and Fairy Inn','2001-01-01','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sword and Fairy Inn (Xianjian Kezhan) is based on the Chinese role-playing game Xianjian Qixia Zhuan. The game has the same protagonist, the young swordsman Li Xiaoyao, and is in a certain way a parody of Sword and Fairy. In this game, Li Xiaoyao still works for his aunt, doing various jobs in the inn. The game also features the female characters from the RPG - Li Xiaoyao\'s sweetheart Zhao Ling\'er, Lin Yueru, and Anu.\n\nUnlike most installments in the series, \"Sword and Fairy Inn\" is not a role-playing game, but a simulation. The player\'s goal in the game is to cook meals, prepare rooms, and generally take care of the guests. The game has an internal clock, and the hero should do his job well to please his aunt. When Li Xiaoyao is not busy with the inn, he can explore nearby locations or have a date with Ling\'er. There are many items to be found, which can be later used for cooking and other purposes. The game has pre-rendered backgrounds and \"super-deformed\" graphics for characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/svfsyqbeeqtfxmnu0skz.jpg'),(13794,'Amulet of Dreams','2016-06-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Alison’s sudden illness was a shock to everyone. Doctors do not understand what was happening to her, and what caused her illness. Family and doctors are desperate, and only faithful friend never lost hope. Faithful friendfriend. An ordinary little boy named Aiden. Aiden - it\'s you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/z0iqpcpc2eifq4hhvjjq.jpg'),(13795,'Sokobot','2022-03-04','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sokobot is an open-ended puzzle game where you place down cute robots, give them commands, and create infinitely-looping assembly lines that combine shapes together!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5m1b.jpg'),(13796,'Along the Edge','2020-10-14','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Along the Edge is a visual novel set in the European countryside, where your choices impact the main character\'s personality and appearance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nro.jpg'),(13797,'Destiny 2: Revenant - Act 3','2025-01-07','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Fikrul’s forces await in the depths of his Revenant fortress. Gather your allies, Guardian, for a new Kell will be crowned.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co999x.jpg'),(13798,'Romance of Rome','2010-01-06','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Romance of Rome offers you another chance to visit the legendary Roman Empire. Love and treachery, adventure and jeopardy await you in this amazing hidden object game. Join Marcus as he travels to Rome in search of the greatest adventure of his life!\n\nAs Romance of Rome opens, you learn that imperial relics have been stolen, and the Emperor promises to marry his beautiful daughter to any person who returns them. Only you can help Marcus find the stolen relics, and win the heart of the Emperor’s daughter.\n\nTravel to every corner of the ancient city of Rome including the Coliseum, Thermae, the Forum and more. Collect skillfully hidden items, earn money, win original trophies, and complete challenging quests to gain love and the adoration of Rome’s citizens.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yf9bi769yquircg8za1m.jpg'),(13799,'Super Luigi Odyssey','2019-03-31','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','A mod of Super Mario Odyssey that retells the story with Luigi, even as far as a stuff being reworked to accompany Luigi.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mkj.jpg'),(13800,'King of the Hat','2023-08-23','Fighting, Platform, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Throw your hat, risk your life. Crush your opponents hat before they crush yours in this fast-paced, hat-based fighting game.\nKing of the Hat is a fast-paced, hat based, multiplayer game. In this cutesy dystopian world everyone is born with a hat that hosts their soul, and can only die if their hat gets crushed. Your hat can be used as a weapon BUT BE CAREFUL because its also your weakness. Jump around, whip your hat at your friends, crush theirs, and become the King of the Hat!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1h5d.jpg'),(13801,'Destiny 2: Echoes - Act 3','2024-08-27','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Confront the Conductor. Solve the mystery and put an end to the twisted machinations fighting for control of the Echoes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qot.jpg'),(13802,'HikiDama',NULL,'Racing, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Platform through a variety of scenarios, or compete in races using the best vehicle man could invent, a metal ball.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1j.jpg'),(13803,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s 2','2019-10-28','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Welcome back to the new and improved Freddy Fazbear\'s Pizza!\n\nIn Five Nights at Freddy\'s 2, the old and aging animatronics are joined by a new cast of characters. They are kid-friendly, updated with the latest in facial recognition technology, tied into local criminal databases, and promise to put on a safe and entertaining show for kids and grown-ups alike!\n\nWhat could go wrong?\n\nAs the new security guard working nights, your job is to monitor cameras and make sure nothing goes wrong after-hours. The previous guard has complained about the characters trying to get into the office (he has since been moved to day-shift). So to make your job easier, you\'ve been provided with your very own empty Freddy Fazbear head, which should fool the animatronic characters into leaving you alone if they should accidentally enter your office.\n\nAs always, Fazbear Entertainment is not responsible for death or dismemberment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7200.jpg'),(13804,'Age of Conan: Rise of the Godslayer','2010-05-11','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Age of Conan: Rise of the Godslayer is the first expansion for Age of Conan, released on May 11, 2010. It includes many new features and a substantial expansion of the game\'s content. The expansion adds the mysterious eastern lands of Khitai to the game, a new zone for characters of levels 20-40 and four new high-level zones for level 80 characters, as well as new original music by Knut Avenstroup Haugen to convey the Asiatic atmosphere of the expansion regions. A list of features of the expansion can be found below.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yse.jpg'),(13805,'Crash Bandicoot','2017-08-03','Platform','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A remake of Crash Bandicoot found in the Crash Bandicoot N. Sane Trilogy collection. Not to be confused with the actual bundle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ywi.jpg'),(13806,'Destiny 2: Echoes - Act 2','2024-07-16','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Destiny 2: Echoes continues with Act 2 which includes new story missions, the new \"Echo Battlegrounds\" activity, 50 more tiers of the Season Pass and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mz3.jpg'),(13807,'Koi','2017-11-09','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','KOI is an award-winning exploration adventure game that details the story of a small koi on a grand adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co252l.jpg'),(13808,'Shoujo Mahou Gaku Little Witch Romanesque Bangai Hen \"Sayonara, Mauresumo\"','2005-09-17','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Short, stand-alone side-story available for free from Littlewitch\'s website.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fhi.jpg'),(13809,'The Dark Pictures Anthology: Volume 2','2022-11-18','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','This edition includes the following:\n- Game: The Dark Pictures Anthology: House of Ashes\n- Game: The Dark Pictures Anthology: The Devil in Me\n- 2 Collectible Pins\n- House of Ashes Playing Cards\n- Hotel Map','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sfz.jpg'),(13810,'Glitchrunners','2016-04-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Chaotic, five player mayhem takes over in Glitchrunners – a local multiplayer experience like no other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pqcugvkkvc3u4vhxahk9.jpg'),(13811,'Sackboy: A Big Adventure - Astro Bot Costume','2024-03-08','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Icon vs icon. Game recognises game. Hero meets… you get the idea. The platinum princes of PlayStation platforming royalty finally meet as Sackboy unveils his new out-of-this-world ASTRO BOT costume. Internet connection required to access downloadable content.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13812,'Banzai Bug','1996-12-02','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fpy.jpg'),(13813,'A2 Racer II','1999-12-31','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','A2 Racer II again allows you to race on the well known Dutch A-2 highway. But also race tracks have been set out through 3 major Dutch cities: Amsterdam, Rotterdam and Den Haag (the Hague).\n\nLike in the original you join illegal street races. There are six stages in the game. The first stage takes place in Amsterdam, the second on the A-2 towards Den Haag, the third in Den Haag itself, the fourth on the road to Rotterdam, the fifth in Rotterdam, and the last from Rotterdam past Utrecht back to Amsterdam.\n\nEach city has been carefully recreated in a completely new and improved 3D engine.\n\nRacing is made difficult by the police who try to block you by setting up blockades or pushing you off the road. Each time you get caught you get a ticket and lose time. With the third ticket you are out of the race.\n\nThe game doesn\'t have a visible damage system, but if you get into too severe a crash you are also out of the race.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hps.jpg'),(13814,'The Lighthouse of São Bento do Oeste','2020-04-01','Visual Novel','Sega Saturn','The Lighthouse of São Bento do Oeste is a mystery visual novel for the Sega Saturn about Renne Bras, a detective who travels to the small town of São Bento do Oeste to investigate the mysterious disappearance of a couple in the city lighthouse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ssv.jpg'),(13815,'Pinball FX VR: Indiana Jones - The Pinball Adventure','2025-04-03','Simulator, Pinball','Meta Quest 2, Meta Quest 3','Relive iconic scenes from the movies in Indiana Jones: The Pinball Adventure, the 1993 Williams classic, now available in VR.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13816,'Indiana Jones and the Last Crusade: The Action Game','1994-07-01','Platform','Game Boy','The Game Boy port of The Last Crusade.\n\nA two-fisted action game from the people who brought you the smash hit movie.\n\nThe chase is on...all the way to the greatest treasure in history, the Holy Grail. And if you can survive the treacherous caves of Colorado...the medieval catacombs of Venice...the deadly ramparts of Schloss Brunwald...and the cunning traps of the Grail Temple...then you\'ve earned your whip and your hat!\n\nWhip those bad guys...as only Indy can! Relive the greatest action scenes from the greatest Indy movie of them all.\n\nIt\'s red hot, slam-bam action, Indiana Jones and LucasFilm style!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qwo.jpg'),(13817,'live Mince','2019-02-06','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Show who is in charge in this zombie saturated place! Destroy the crowds of the undead, constantly looking for a new victim. Destroy the source of infection to save humanity.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13818,'Guilty Gear: Strive - Season Pass 4','2024-07-22','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Season Pass 4 adds 4 characters to Guilty Gear: Strive with the returning characters Queen Dizzy and Venom, the new character Unika from the anime Guilty Gear Strive: Dual Rulers and the guest character Lucy from the anime Cyberpunk: Edgerunners.\nIt also includes 2 new stages, the Season Pass 4 Premium Color pack with color #16 for all characters except Lucy and the Season 4 Characters Additional Colors pack for the 3 new Guilty Gear characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jkg.jpg'),(13819,'Deadly Dozen Reloaded','2022-04-29','Shooter, Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deadly Dozen Reloaded is a complete remake of the original squad-based 3rd person shooter. Made in a new engine with upgraded maps, graphics and missions, Reloaded takes this classic franchise and brings it to modern audiences with a bang.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gsn.jpg'),(13820,'The Gurion Mountains','2020-11-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After one of his friends has an accident, Mark and the group seek help in an isolated mansion, where terrible enemies and dangers await them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43u2.jpg'),(13821,'Knowledge is Power','2017-10-24','Quiz/Trivia','PlayStation 4','A trivia game in the PlayLink line of PlayStation 4 games that utilize mobile devices as controllers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nhc.jpg'),(13822,'The Stubborn of WakGood: Afterheat',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Sin plataforma','This game is a fan game by YouTuber Woowakgood with the motif of Isaac Original.\nWe respect the original Isaac Original, and we do not want to be a substitute for that game. The creators do not distribute the game for a fee or generate revenue through copyright. This game can be downloaded from YouTuber Woowakgood\'s Naver fan cafe \"왁물원\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6thz.jpg'),(13823,'Infestation: The New Beginning','2012-10-15','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Infestation: Survivor Stories is a zombie survival horror MMO. Based five years in the future following a horrendous viral outbreak of apocalyptic proportions that destroyed 95% of the world’s population, you must survive against all odds. Scavenge, defend yourself, band with others, or die in the process – your life is in your own hands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92a8.jpg'),(13824,'Kingdoms of the Dump',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Kingdoms of the Dump is a SNES-style RPG with platforming elements and turn-based combat developed by the New Jersey-based Roach Games.\n\nJoin the trashcan knight, Dustin Binsley, as he fights his way through the Five and Half Kingdoms of the Dump. Rescue the trashpicked King, defeat the totally disgusting Toxic Grimelin Army and prevent the Lands of Fill from an all-out war!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8478.jpg'),(13825,'Super Robot Taisen UX','2013-03-14','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical','Nintendo 3DS','Super Robot Taisen UX is a tactical role-playing game for the Nintendo 3DS developed by Banpresto and published by Bandai Namco Games. It is the first Super Robot Wars game for the 3DS and was released in Japan on March 14, 2013. The theme of this game is \"Possibilities\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6iiz.jpg'),(13826,'Marvel: Ultimate Alliance','2006-10-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox, PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','These versions of the game do not featured Moon Knight and Collossus like the other versions do.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8arb.jpg'),(13827,'Quijote: Quest for Glory','2022-03-31','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Quijote: Quest for Glory is a tactical card strategy game based on the work of Miguel de Cervantes. Lead Don Quixote on his heroic journey and experience some of the most familiar episodes of the classic novel published in the 17th century.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ojt.jpg'),(13828,'VR Dunk Assistant','2025-03-18','Simulator, Sport','SteamVR','This game allows you to practice shooting from the comfort of your home, providing an immersive basketball experience and helping you improve your shooting skills anytime, anywhere.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i49.jpg'),(13829,'Warhammer: End Times - Vermintide Quests and Contracts','2016-10-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Have you been dying to get a splendid new hat for your favourite hero? Or how about that axe that you just never seem to roll for? Well, the wait is finally over! In this new FREE DLC for Vermintide we are introducing a means for you to get the loot of your dreams. All you have to do is complete the objectives and collect your reward.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13830,'Mordhau: Diamond Edition','2024-11-06','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Mordhau is a multiplayer medieval slasher. Create your mercenary and fight in brutal battles where you will experience fast paced combat, castle sieges, cavalry charges, and more. Mordhau Diamond Edition contains the Main game and 8 DLC packs','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e4i.jpg'),(13831,'Tic Tac Toe Pro HD','2010-04-27','Sin género','iOS','The best-selling Tic Tac Toe iPhone application is now available for the iPad!\n\nPut away your pencil and paper, now you can play Tic Tac Toe in high-definition on your iPad. Tic Tac Toe Pro HD is the premier Tic Tac Toe app for the iPad. \n\nTic Tac Toe Pro HD supports one player and two player gameplay, enabling you to play against another human or against your iPhone.  \n\nThe AI for one player mode includes three difficulty levels, so you can play against a computer player that matches your skill level. A move randomization engine ensures that your iPhone won\'t keep making the same moves over and over again.\n\nTic Tac Toe Pro HD offers a host of exciting features, including:\n\n* Great graphics and exciting sound effects\n* Configurable player names and score tracking \n* OpenFeint achievements \n* Automatic save when you get a phone call or exit the application','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yqqosdc9fbgl2n2wee0p.jpg'),(13832,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s Area 51','2017-03-11','Point-and-click, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','After the closing of Freddy Fazbears Pizza, Polices has realized the animatronics moved on their own.... they have been taken to a facility for a check.\nYou have gotten a job to keep an eye on them through the night. You must use the high tech systems to protect yourself against the animatronics!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77ay.jpg'),(13833,'Strong Bad\'s Cool Game for Attractive People','2010-12-21','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 3, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You may already know Strong Bad from his regular appearances answering emails and doling out not-so-useful advice on Homestarrunner.com. Now he\'s the star of a five episode comedy series, Strong Bad\'s Cool Game for Attractive People. With all new storylines co-written by the guys from Homestarrunner.com, you\'ll feel like you\'re inside Strong Bad\'s world. (You may even start to talk like him!) Each episode has a different theme and you get to hang out with with Homestar, The Cheat, Bubs — the whole crew. It\'s like a Strong Bad cartoon on steroids. As Strong Bad would say, what the crap are you waiting for?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i3z.jpg'),(13834,'Lorraine','2023-09-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Attend the tale of the diabolical widow, as she pondered and planned the next to be stabbed...\"\n\nLorraine is a bite-sized, blood-curdling, bone-chilling, narrative-driven graphic adventure about a desperate widow in a preternatural situation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76ec.jpg'),(13835,'MageQuit','2021-09-23','Fighting, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A wizard brawler about spell drafting and beard envy, MageQuit allows up to 10 mages to battle it out online or locally. Beards grow longer with each kill; the wizard with the longest beard after 9 rounds wins!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qtg.jpg'),(13836,'RE: Alistair++','2010-04-10','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Merui loves video games, especially her favorite MMORPG, Rivenwell Online. Merui also has a very short temper, so when some JERK named Alistair steals a rare item from her, she\'s determined to exact revenge on him. Unfortunately, she has no idea who he is in real life. But hey, that\'s never stopped anyone, right?\n\nTake control of Merui and make new friends, balance schoolwork and fun, go shopping, search for the culprit, and maybe even discover a new romance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gj9.jpg'),(13837,'LUL inc.','2022-01-15','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','LUL Inc. is a collection of over 30 different micro-games that will test your skills in a variety of genres. Can you beat them all and defeat the evil machine?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bfa.jpg'),(13838,'Ancient Villa','2024-02-15','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation Vita','A famous archaeologist and her penguin companion went to a medieval castle-villa to inspect it in all details. Three months have already passed yet we have not received any news from her. Will she return with new discoveries?\n\nA 3D Puzzle/Exploration Homebrew for PSVITA Originally made for TWG25 game jam by Cojam Team.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95rw.jpg'),(13839,'Night Flight','2005-05-05','Arcade','Game Boy Advance','Night Flight is a Pokémon e-Reader game for the Game Boy Advance. In order to play Night Flight, two Pokémon Skyridge e-Reader cards must be scanned. The required cards are: Zubat (#117) and Golbat (#60).\n\nIn Night Flight the player controls a Zubat which must eat as much food as possible. If the player runs into a Koffing three times then the game is over. The Koffing are invisible unless the player uses Zubat\'s supersonic sound waves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61so.jpg'),(13840,'Helldivers: Pilot Pack','2015-12-07','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Pilot Helldiver is specially trained to operate the wide arsenal of vehicles available to the Helldiver troops. Especially trained in the use of the EXO-48 \'Obsidian\' Exosuit, Pilots are some of the few that are given the honor of using this heavily armed monster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ive.jpg'),(13841,'Mobile Suit Gundam: Zeonic Front','2001-09-06','Strategy','PlayStation 2','Mobile Suit Gundam: Zeonic Front (known as Zeonic Front: Kidou Senshi Gundam 0079 [1] in Japan) is a game for the PlayStation 2, which revolves around a Zeon Special Commando Unit during the One Year War, called the Midnight Fenrir Corp. This MS team was created by Kycilia Zabi and participated in the capture of the California Base during the 2nd Earth Invasion Plan. \n \nLt. Garret Schmitzer was a mobile suit veteran during the first stage of the One Year War, the One Week Battle back in January. At the end of the One Week Battle, Lt. Schmitzer was badly wounded, and forced into retirement. This was due to Operation British, the operation that would force a space colony, into the Earth\'s orbit for a collision course to South America, where the Federation\'s top forces were, Jaburo base. \n \nThe injuries were extensive, but hope was on the horizon. Kycillia Zabi formed an elite mobile suit unit onto the front lines, the Fenrir Corps. Since Lt. Schmitzer was fluent in battle experience, he was the lead commander and mission director of the Fenrir Corps, better known as the Midnight Fenrir. \n \nYou take command of Midnight Fenrir Corps in the game. Eventually, by completing missions, more pilots will join in the Fenrir Corps\' long and hard fought struggle. \n \nIt is the first Gundam based PlayStation 2 game that lets the player operate solely as Zeon forces','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qpu.jpg'),(13842,'Island Uncanny Story','2024-06-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','‘Island Uncanny Story’ is a narrative-driven simulation and survival game where you play as a young graduate who boards a flight to Vesia Bay with five women of different professional backgrounds and personalities. However, the flight is forced to make an emergency landing on an island。','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g2o.jpg'),(13843,'Bubble Bobble','1987-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','MSX2','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f7r.jpg'),(13844,'Fastest Hands in the Wasd','2021-07-21','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Wild West themed incremental/clicker game, but this time you type WASD to shoot. Utilize and customize the various weapons to find a combo that works for you, or use the Showdown and Training modes to benchmark how fast you can type WASD.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co598u.jpg'),(13845,'Mario Kart 64: Stomper Mod','2021-07-15','Racing, Arcade','Nintendo 64','A Mario Kart 64 modification, which replaces GP mode with a custom game mode called “Stomper Mode”.\n\nYou’re not racing laps, but are tasked to drive over each CPU-driver, in order to stomp and remove them from the “race”.\n\nWhen all enemies are removed, the game advances to the next course in the cup. In 2-Player mode, each player gets their own point counter, so try to get the most points!\n\nEach cc-class has a different difficulty, so enemies get smaller and therefore more difficult to stomp. They also have a higher max speed, the smaller they are. The item table is limited to Mushrooms, Green Shells, Bananas and Fake Itemboxes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wpv.jpg'),(13846,'Gunfight',NULL,'Shooter','Sinclair ZX81','Gunfight is an unofficial port of the classic Atari VCS game where a cowboy at either side of the screen, moving up and down for the Sinclair ZX81.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kda.jpg'),(13847,'Pack Playlink That\'s You! + Knowledge is Power + Singstar Celebration + Hidden Agenda',NULL,'Sin género','PlayStation 4','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wwm.jpg'),(13848,'The House of the Dead 2 & 3 Return','2008-03-28','Shooter','Wii','This compilation bundles the following games:\n\nThe House of the Dead 2 (Dreamcast)\nThe House of the Dead III (Xbox)\n\nBoth games were ported to the Wii with support for the Wii Zapper peripheral. A new Extreme mode is unlockable for The House of the Dead III, with faster enemy attacks and smaller bullet blast radii for the player\'s guns (similar to the handgun in the second game). At the same time, the shotgun can be reloaded much faster and a new melee attack is introduced: Guard Attack. It is a powerful move that also blocks incoming attacks, but requires a \"reload\" time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8opa.jpg'),(13849,'Praetorians','2007-12-07','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your destiny awaits you on the battlefield. As a Roman General on a quest to forge an empire, you will be transported back to the dusty battlefields of Egypt, the frozen lands of the Gauls, and finally to the heart of the Empire itself, Italy. Your quest will be no easy task as the lands you seek to conquer are heavily defended by thousands of powerful troops.\n\nFeed you insatiable hunger to rule the empire with this combat-heavy epic adventure Command the forces of 3 civilizations - the disciplined Romans, the ferocious Gauls, and the religiously fanatical Egyptians\n\nDifferent landscapes play an all-important role in battle. From snow-capped mountains to sandy beaches, the AI will understand varying terrain and its defensive and offensive possibilities\n\nBattle for supremacy online in an intense multiplayer match supporting up to 8 players Master the art of war in over 20 single player missions requiring vastly different strategies','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rsk.jpg'),(13850,'Core Defense','2021-04-21','Strategy, Tactical, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','A roguelike tower defense game with a dash of deckbuilding. Survive fifty waves without losing your core. Choose a reward, update your build, survive the next wave, repeat. Highly replayable through permadeath, randomization and challenging difficulty levels. Just one more wave, just one more run!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dcr.jpg'),(13851,'Be My Horde','2024-06-18','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Be My Horde is a top-down 2D survival roguelite. Become a formidable necromancess, and make your enemies a resource! Resurrect each fallen foe, create massive hordes of the undead, and use the harvested souls to enhance your skills, growing more powerful with each death PRAISE BE MORIANA!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hcx.jpg'),(13852,'Don\'t Pee in the Tub','2017-12-22','Indie','Android','As a little boy you enjoy your bath, until you\'re need to pee. Avoid to release you\'re finger or hit one of the Pee bubbles which cause an instant game over. \n \n-Collect the bubbles and earn points, but be careful, if you hit the wrong ones you lose points. \n-Avoid to touch the yellow bubbles. \n- Challenging gameplay, which test your reflexes and endurance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/doy7iq2bhktx7p9vdow5.jpg'),(13853,'Rewind or Die','2023-04-14','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','There\'s a serial killer stalking your video store, and you just got called into work on your day off! Stock shelves, deal with customers and run for your life!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rnc.jpg'),(13854,'Throw Cubes into Brick Towers to Collapse Them','2019-09-24','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A physics sandbox, open world game with very few* options!\n\nAn Itch.io exclusive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2da3.jpg'),(13855,'Indigo',NULL,'Platform, Arcade','Sin plataforma','A small 2d adventure game, where a little boy has been trapped between two worlds and is trying to get back.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fuctxsoikrlmk4monwwz.jpg'),(13856,'Quiz RPG: The World of Mystic Wiz','2013-08-19','Puzzle, Quiz/Trivia','Android','An RPG released on iOS and Android devices, the game is in fantasy theme with role playing puzzle genre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r1n.jpg'),(13857,'Misplaced','2020-05-16','Puzzle','Web browser','An escape room as a text adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wo8.jpg'),(13858,'Hugh\'s Dream','2020-07-12','Platform','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A platformer featuring Hugh, whose stats during each dream are determined by the conversations he has the night before with his friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cve.jpg'),(13859,'Megaton Musashi: Cross','2022-12-16','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Megaton Musashi X is set on Earth in the year 2118. The main characters pilot giant machines called “Musashi” to combat the Dorakuta, invaders from outer space that destroyed the planet in a matter of days.\n\nThis game was originally called Megaton Musashi and released on November 11th 2021 in Japan. They later decided to go free-to-play and re-branded the game as Megaton Musashi X.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ag0.jpg'),(13860,'Interrogation Files: Port Landsend','2020-06-19','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Interrogation Files: Port Landsend is a FMV game where you have to search through police interrogation footages of suspects of a crime, the goal is to find the murderer to assist to his arrest and judgment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tq0.jpg'),(13861,'Viva Piñata: Party Animals','2007-11-15','Sin género','Xbox 360','A multiplayer game expanding the Viva Pinata experience. Compete in a variety of zany battles and races in the social party game Viva Piñata: Party Animals. Control the fame, fortune, and destiny of all your favorite characters from Viva Piñata: Fergy Fudgehog, Paulie Pretztail, Franklin Fizzlybear, and Hudson Horstachio. It\'s party time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50pm.jpg'),(13862,'Chimeras: Cursed and Forgotten - Collector\'s Edition','2021-07-23','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','You\'re off to Scotland in Chimeras: Cursed and Forgotten - Collector\'s Edition, a riveting hidden object puzzle adventure. Uncover more family secrets and enjoy additional Collector\'s Edition exclusives including collectible Tarot Cards, morphing objects, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4goe.jpg'),(13863,'DollKart','2018-08-01','Racing','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Drive your ragdoll through an infinite number of difficult tracks, against time in single player, your friends in split screen and randoms online.\n\n...or have an online deathmatch','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r8y.jpg'),(13864,'Kung Fu Kid','1987-05-17','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Sega Master System/Mark III','A beat-\'em-up game developed and published by Sega for the Sega Master System. It is a sequel to the SG-1000 game Dragon Wang (ドラゴン・ワン), in which the player reprises the role of Wang, a kung fu master.\n\nIn Brazil this game was re-released as Sapo Xulé O Mestre do Kung Fu in 1995, complete with graphical changes.\n\nThis can be played for free in the browser at the Internet Archive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e96.jpg'),(13865,'Moto Racer 15th Anniversary','2011-11-18','Sin género','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/skibmnvvzljic7wottod.jpg'),(13866,'Loop8: Celestial Edition','2023-06-06','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','‘Celestial’ Limited Edition includes:\n- The game in a custom box\n- 5.25”x7.25” softcover artbook with over 50 pages\n- A musical selections CD\n- 7” x 10.5” mini wall scroll\n- Authentic 4” x 3.15” Japanese wooden ema','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fyb.jpg'),(13867,'Plant Therapy','2023-09-21','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','An unapologetically cozy plant collecting and decorating game. Build a beautiful indoor garden from the ground up in your New York City apartment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77tk.jpg'),(13868,'Charlie Brown\'s ABC\'s','1984-10-05','Music','Apple IIGS, Commodore C64/128/MAX, DOS, Apple II','Charlie Brown\'s ABC\'s is a simple educational game designed for children ages 3-7. Featuring Charles Schulz\'s Peanuts characters, the game presents each of the 26 letters in the alphabet along with a brief animation to go along with it. Each animation has a different object that starts with the letter in question and one or more Peanuts characters interacting with it (such as Charlie Brown playing the guitar for the letter \"G\", or Snoopy dancing to music on the radio for \"R\"). Player\'s can select a letter and see the corresponding word and animation by pressing the letter on the keyboard, or the arrow keys can be used to cycle through each letter (forwards and backwards) in alphabetical order. The game package also included a set of activity cards which provided additional suggestions for parents or teachers to help kids learn the alphabet using the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94r4.jpg'),(13869,'Bionic Girl',NULL,'Shooter, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Bionic Girls is a 2D action platformer.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13870,'Sword Art Online: Fatal Bullet - Complete Edition','2019-08-09','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Get the full SWORD ART ONLINE: FATAL BULLET experience with the Complete Edition which includes the main game, three DLC packs, the \"\"Dissonance of the Nexus\"\" Expansion, and bonus in-game items!\n\nYour choices are heavier and faster than a bullet.\nCreate your own character and log in to Gun Gale Online, a world of guns and steel, where a chance encounter partners you with a rare support AI called ArFA-sys.\nExperience a thrilling third-person shooter with a unique story and progression of an RPG in this first-ever \"\"TPSRPG\"\" from Sword Art Online!\nCustomize your avatar and master a wide array of weapons and skills!\nChoose from over 30 playable characters in online PvP, ranging from Alice and Eugeo from \"\"Alicization,\"\" season 3 of the SAO anime, to Eiji and Yuna from Sword Art Online the Movie: Ordinal Scale!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1iss.jpg'),(13871,'Atlantis Sky Patrol','2010-03-03','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This frenetic marble-popping adventure puts you in charge of how fast each level will end. Knock out doomsday devices on each of the 100 levels in the game by matching marble colors in sets of three. To finish off the device and move on to the next round, simply destroy the cleverly-placed static orbs that continually allow additional chains to fill the track. Easy to learn, but difficult to master, this puzzler is nearly impossible to put down!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/m4kvvecizi7tjqayldlp.jpg'),(13872,'Absolute Silence: A Game Album','2016-03-07','Shooter, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Absolute Silence is an experimental album of lo-fi abstract games.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13873,'Metro Pocket',NULL,'Simulator, Arcade','Sin plataforma','In a cartoonish world, you can unlock and upgrade 300 metro stations around the world! Workers including controllers, cleaners, and police officers will help you maintain peace in your stations. With numerous missions to complete and hidden surprises waiting, are you ready to become the master of the metro?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13874,'Paresis II',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Paresis II takes you back into the original Paresis house, however, time has passed and survival takes a new direction. Move throughout the Paresis house to solve numerous puzzles, extinguish morphs, and so much more. Can you survive?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13875,'Journey North',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Journey North is a puzzle adventure game. Play your way through fun filled worlds with goofy characters. This Nordic inspired adventure will have you hooked for hours.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1u.jpg'),(13876,'D.M.T','2020-04-24','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','DMT is an audio-visual game experience - Produced by Arkangel Audio \n \nThe team behind DMT supports the fight of the Black Lives Matter movement.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cib.jpg'),(13877,'Path of Immortals',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','\"Path of Immortals\" is a single-player idle cultivation game set in a mystical world of Chinese ink painting. Start as a mortal, ascend to become a legendary figure, master techniques, and tame spirit beasts. Embark on this captivating cultivation journey now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7a4q.jpg'),(13878,'Elite Star Fighter',NULL,'Arcade','Android, iOS','Elite Star Fighter is a retro space shooter game with a real old school feel to it. Great graphics and an original soundtrack with addictive gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1krx.jpg'),(13879,'Blastomancer: The Puzzle Game','2020-12-31','Puzzle','Android','Blastomancer: The Puzzle Game is a logical puzzle game with a fun, playful story and a unique art style to match.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4eu6.jpg'),(13880,'Rusty','1993-07-01','Platform, Adventure','PC-9800 Series, DOS','The player plays as the vampire huntress Rusty who investigates the disappearance of a number of women, and travels through ten stages, fighting skeletons, monsters and boss characters with her whip and items.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yo1.jpg'),(13881,'LinkIt!',NULL,'Indie, Arcade','Sin plataforma','LinkIt! is like a version of your childhood game connect the dots with minimalistic and eye-pleasing style that you will need some reflexes.\r\n\r\nThere is not any stage or different difficulty level. You need to beat your or friends scores. Game starts slow and speed increases by connecting the dots but it has a limit.\r\n\r\nThere are three simple rules:\r\n\r\nTry to link every blue dot by holding the screen\r\nDon\'t miss any of the blue dots\r\nDon\'t link the red ones\r\n\r\nIt seems too easy, but there is a difficult in simplicity.\r\nHow hard connecting the dots can be?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fxqlaye0pglb8ijzab4b.jpg'),(13882,'Strange Pong','2025-02-09','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Strange Pong is a classic Pong game with the addition of new game mechanics. This game is a game of tennis, the player controls a racket and must hit the ball. However, each level has its own features that make the game more interesting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9no4.jpg'),(13883,'Knight Hero Adventure idle RPG','2022-12-31','Sin género','Web browser, Android, iOS','The world of magic and heroes, in the genre of rpg and roguelike games, needs a sword and bow master to protect it. Brave knight, an ancient evil has attacked the kingdom! The fate of the kingdom is now in your hands, assassin!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vyg.jpg'),(13884,'Arkos','2021-11-03','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Arkos is a first-person fantasy shooter with unique voxel render. You play as the white wizard Arkos, who went in search of a powerful weapon of his teacher elf Corvus, who disappeared without a trace many years ago in the dungeons of an ancient castle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53bh.jpg'),(13885,'Teardown: Deluxe Edition','2023-11-15','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5','Prepare the perfect heist in this simulated and fully destructible voxel world. Tear down walls with vehicles or explosives to create shortcuts. Stack objects to reach new heights. Use the environment to your advantage in the most creative way you can think of.\n\nTeardown: Deluxe Edition includes\nTeardown\nTime Campers DLC - A campaign expansion set in the wild west. Available at launch.\nFolkrace DLC - A campaign expansion that introduces new vehicles and a series of destructive racing game modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dkf.jpg'),(13886,'Bio F.R.E.A.K.S.','1998-08-01','Fighting','Arcade, Nintendo 64, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Bio F.R.E.A.K.S. is a 3D fighting game released by Midway in 1998. It was originally planned for arcades. However, this arcade prototype was scrapped and never officially released (although it exists on MAME), and the game was later released for the PlayStation, Nintendo 64 and PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l9k.jpg'),(13887,'Terror Squid','2020-10-15','Shooter, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','A bullet hell with a sinister twist. Think fast and strategically as you weave through a bullet hell of your own making. Easy to learn and hard to master, Terror Squid is an arcade experience unlike any other.\n\nCreate your own bullet hell\n\nConduct your symphony of destruction. Dodge tantalising bullet patterns of your own design. Survive for long enough to release a primordial blast of dark energy, detonating your projectiles in gloriously satisfying chain reactions. Perfect your strategy to squeeze every precious second out of each run.\n\nUnique vector graphics and a thumping soundtrack combine to deliver a deliciously terrifying arcade experience. Feel the dopamine rushing through your veins and give in to the assimilation.\n\nReign havoc upon your friends\' highscores. Rise to the top of the gene pool. Ascend.\n\nCast aside your puny human shell and give in to the darkness. Become Terror.\n\nThere is no hope\nThere is only Terror Squid','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g4t.jpg'),(13888,'Agatha Christie: The ABC Murders',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The ABC Murders is an adventure and investigation game adapted from the classic Agatha Christie novel. You are the famous private detective Hercule Poirot and, once again, you find yourself up against a mysterious serial killer who goes by the name of \"ABC\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cyp.jpg'),(13889,'Populous DS','2008-02-21','Strategy','Nintendo DS','Peter Molyneaux\'s pioneering \"God game\" gets resurrected and re-imagined for a new generation of handheld strategists in Populous DS. This time players take control of five different deities, and make use of each God\'s unique elemental miracles to manipulate terrain and encourage the growth of a civilization. Solo gamers can take part in the 50-mission campaign or tackle the \"Warrior Hunt\" mini-game in the \"Free Play Mode,\" and multiplayer action lets up to four people battle one another using earthquakes, tidal waves, and volcanic eruptions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6isy.jpg'),(13890,'Classic Road','1993-10-29','Racing, Simulator, Sport','FM Towns, Super Famicom','Classic Road is a Sports game, developed by Opera House and published by Victor Interactive Software, which was released in Japan in 1993.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a2l.jpg'),(13891,'Reborn a Zombie!','2023-08-07','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A queer, slice-of-life visual novel about the hardships and joys of a trans girl transformed into a zombie. Follow her new life in a world filled with magic, cute demons and dragons!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e4y.jpg'),(13892,'One Night With Haro','2021-07-27','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','One Night With Haro it\'s an Indie 2d-Action-Adventure video game made by Emm Tyman in Madborn Studios. The story of this game is about Greek Mystology in modern days! Challenge yourself with Boss fights, learning skills and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3jmo.jpg'),(13893,'Another Tomorrow','2022-02-12','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Another Tomorrow is a puzzle adventure that seamlessly blends intricately rendered dioramas with first person exploration and puzzle solving.\nThe dioramas provide a superb overview of every scene and the first-person views allow you to climb deep into the gritty world to which you have awoken.\nTrapped without your memories but equipped with a camera you’ll explore abandoned apartments, airfields, temples, and underground facilities to search for clues, solve puzzles, and unlock secrets to answer the question; who are you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57xr.jpg'),(13894,'Silicon Scramble','2022-06-19','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','1st place winner of the Gunner Parade \'22 game jam, Silicon Scramble is a Caravan Shooter that encourages point-blanking and self-destructing to maximize score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7j20.jpg'),(13895,'Death Machine',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Conquer the mechanical citadel in Death Machine - a metroidvania, with a roguelite item system. Gather items to gain strength, navigate the perilous machine world, leverage the aid of ancient demons, and seek out dangerous denizens to defeat before the forces of the machine close in on you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dz3.jpg'),(13896,'Maestro! Jump in Music','2009-11-06','Music, Platform','Nintendo DS','Discover Presto, the music-loving bird, and make him evolve in a colorful, decibel-filled journey. Use the stylus to scrape, rub, tap and whirl to the rhythm of the level\'s music and like a good Maestro, stick to the original. Presto will jump or get off a platform in the order in which you strum the string, flying with his small wings to reach the music score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66w8.jpg'),(13897,'Terrorhedron','2014-07-24','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Terrorhedron is the 3D, cooperative tower defense game for the PC. Unmatched challenge and complexity is introduced to the genre through 3 dimensional gameplay, micro-strategy through programmable turrets and \'edge of seat\' gameplay is extended to multiplayer with up to 8 players online co-op.\n\nDefend wave after wave of colorful Terrorhedron spheres within attractive abstract grid landscapes. Unlock new infrastructure, turrets, upgrades and tracks in your quest to achieve all the stars. Terrorhedron offers a fresh look, feel and an entirely new depth of experience to a popular genre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/daj0grfdkboocskcb6ry.jpg'),(13898,'Life is Strange: Before the Storm - Limited Edition','2018-03-09','Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Life is Strange: Before the Storm is a new three-part, standalone adventure set three years before the first game in the BAFTA award-winning franchise. You play as sixteen-year-old Chloe Price who forms an unlikely friendship with Rachel Amber, a beautiful and popular girl destined for success. When Rachel learns a secret about her family that threatens to destroy her world, it is her newfound friendship with Chloe that gives her the strength to carry on. No longer alone the girls must confront each other\'s demons and together, find a way to overcome them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v5a.jpg'),(13899,'Castlebound',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Lead a band of heroes in a walking castle to battle endless hordes of enemies in this unique action-packed roguelike!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jks.jpg'),(13900,'Rising Storm','2013-05-30','Shooter, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rising Storm is the next game in the Red Orchestra franchise. Rising Storm adds new features, new levels, new weapons and new factions. The game will allow the player to fight across iconic locations from the famous island-hopping campaigns in the Pacific from 1942 to 1945, as the US Army and Marine Corps fight it out with the Imperial Japanese army and Special Naval Landing Forces. Players will experience beach assaults, jungle fighting, close quarters night fighting and more across Guadalcanal, Iwo Jima and Saipan, among other iconic battles. The player is able to take the part of either side - American or Japanese - battling it out online in multiplayer on up to 64-player servers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hx7.jpg'),(13901,'Cybershift','2020-12-11','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cybershift brings a neon-lit new world, strikingly reminiscent of the legendary Tron series, test your reflexes and abilities to the maximum, defeat all opponents, solve all the puzzles and win in this unique Puzzle game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o0p.jpg'),(13902,'Space Barrel Adventures',NULL,'Platform, Adventure','Android','A mobile game of space exploration that mixes fantasy and sci-fi genres. Mechanics are based on lighting a path with a probe to then pilot a rocket ship made of a barrel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6g88.jpg'),(13903,'Hocus 2','2022-01-13','Platform, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Hocus continues; this time everything is dynamic. Hocus 2 has new mechanics and illusion combinations with so many creative solving possibilities. Featuring 85 hand-crafted creative levels so far and 9 different mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42hz.jpg'),(13904,'#EscapeRoomSimulator','2020-03-27','Puzzle, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escape Room Simulator aims to bring your love for the classic genre into glorious 3D.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xwk.jpg'),(13905,'Worms Collection 1','2021-07-30','Puzzle, Strategy','Evercade','The Worms Collection 1 Cartridge for Evercade includes the following titles from Team 17’s world-famous franchise. Worms, Worms Armageddon, and Worms Blast. The cartridge will be supplied in a stunning collectible retro style physical case and full colour manual.\n\nIncluded Games:\n- Worms\n- Worms Armageddon\n- Worms Blast','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b8q.jpg'),(13906,'Last Life',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Last Life is a breathtaking adventure game set in NeoNova, a cyberpunk city where high technology and dark secrets intertwine. Our protagonist, a cute cat controlled by players, will embark on a mysterious journey to find their lost lover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mhc.jpg'),(13907,'Car Mechanic Simulator VR','2021-06-08','Racing, Simulator','PlayStation VR2, PlayStation VR, SteamVR','Car Mechanic Simulator VR challenges players to repair, paint, tune and drive cars in fully 3D world. Find classic, unique cars in the new Barn Find module and Junkyard module. Build and expand your repair service empire in this incredibly detailed and highly realistic virual reality simulation game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8e8w.jpg'),(13908,'Click Space Miner','2016-08-18','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Click Space Miner you take control over a mining company in space. There is a big market, a lot of customers, but therefore also a lot of concurrents so you have to mine fast.  \n \n \nGameplay:  \n \n \nClick fast to get rich. Mine resources with your mouse fast and buy new tools and machines to do the work for you. Earn more and more money and get rich. But while mining and keeping track of the high management expenses, dont forget to renew your mining licenses because they are very popular and if you come too late you lose everything.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13909,'The Idolmaster: Gravure for You! - Vol. 1','2011-10-27','Sin género','PlayStation 3','The Idolmaster: Gravure For You! is a sub-series of games in the The Idolmaster series of games. In the games, the player can take pictures of idols wearing different outfits while posed. The original release of the game totaled 9 individual volumes released in bundles with episodes of The Idolmaster anime, containing the idols from 765 Production and guest idols from 876 Production. Another set of nine volumes in currently being released for characters from the Cinderella Girls anime.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rmd.jpg'),(13910,'Endless Fables 2: Frozen Path','2017-11-16','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Pamela Cavendish returns for another adventure! The famous anthropologist ventures into the northern reaches of Europe to rescue a friend who went missing while following the trail of Norse gods. Is this mere coincidence or is there something more behind the legend of Loki and Hodur?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21nw.jpg'),(13911,'After the Fall: Frontrunner Edition','2022-03-25','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR','From the creators of Arizona Sunshine comes an epic VR action FPS with intense co-op gameplay at its core that pits up to 4 players against a post-apocalyptic VR world filled with ferocious undead, mutated and twisted by the relentless cold.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v5j.jpg'),(13912,'BoomBoard!','2018-08-25','Puzzle, Arcade','Web browser','A timed puzzler where you try to defuse all the bombs via number based clue information before the timer runs out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4o5w.jpg'),(13913,'Bendy: The Cage','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bendy: The Cage is a first person psychological horror game that takes place during the events of Bendy and the Dark Revival. The shadows are closing in. Fight the madness before it\'s too late.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kne.jpg'),(13914,'The King of the Wood','2013-02-22','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Windows Phone, Mac','A first person shooter about a detective tracking down a cyborg. Inspired by Blade Runner and Deus Ex.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rck4hhfslcke6ckytzrj.jpg'),(13915,'Cryptid Coffeehouse','2022-01-14','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','everyone\'s heard of mothman– the moth creature that haunts the outskirts of point pleasant, west virginia– but no one\'s heard of it like this! in some random idyllic midwestern town, you meet artemis (aka mothman) at your favorite coffee shop and begin an agonizingly slow burn romance with them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ze7.jpg'),(13916,'Ninety Nine','2017-04-14','Indie, Arcade','Android','Ninety is the Game with ZERO as the highest score. Its a single Tap game where you can get the maximum pleasure of a casual game. Anyone who can complete the game will get a sweet little surprise.     \n    \nGet started now with Ninety Nine    \nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.Joysticklab.Nine','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yghfnhrfbkbi4etqloiv.jpg'),(13917,'Champion Eleven','2018-12-31','Simulator, Sport','Android, iOS','Run your own FIFPro-licensed football team as a professional manager, and use your own specific tactics to overthrow your opponents!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zl5knnhqppdv4p8nno1q.jpg'),(13918,'Pets','2025-02-06','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','PETS is a platformer puzzle game. You will cross different dimensions and go through the maze, find your dogge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e1t.jpg'),(13919,'Cyber Paradise','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Revive Mini the Dog digitally through 2D roguelite actions; craft her cyber paradise with beloved moments, like sniffing dog butts XD. Uncover a deeper dystopian narrative and strengthen friendships in cafe chats—a frenetic yet cozy journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97s4.jpg'),(13920,'RetroDrift: Retrowave Online Road','2022-01-13','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into the atmosphere of the 80\'s, rushing along the neon roads towards the sunset, letting your supercar drift, enjoying the wonderful tracks in retrowave style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5me3.jpg'),(13921,'Raios Funde',NULL,'Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Raios Funde, a word guessing game that follows a scary aesthetic, its differential is having a connection to Twitch, in which the chat actively participates with its player.\nThe game has the mechanic for the player to guess the word in the chat or to create the word for his chat to guess.\nThus having multiple tools to entertain the gameplay such as: time, chances and word hints.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ddu.jpg'),(13922,'Shrink Rooms','2025-06-30','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Run! The rooms are shrinking! A puzzle game Demo about escaping from shrinking rooms. Every step counts if you want to make it out alive! Complete box-pushing puzzles within a limited number of steps or be crushed into a puddle of meat by the pressing walls of the level!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o3m.jpg'),(13923,'Demoniac Words','2023-05-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The evil has taken everything from two sorrowful girls, but the girls will not stop fighting, they will not stop resisting. They are not fighting for themselves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93im.jpg'),(13924,'Potion Punch 2: Cooking Quest','2019-07-31','Simulator','Android, iOS','Potion Punch 2 takes the cooking fever to an all time high with baby dragons roasting ingredients, and magic wisps freezing your favorite treats or grilling your delicious steaks! Cook in ways that you\'ve never seen before in a fast paced time-management game. Become the star chef through hundreds of levels teeming with amazing heroes and dastardly villains. Unfurl your scrolls, polish your frying pans, and open the restaurant doors, because it\'s time for cooking madness in Potion Punch 2!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86xc.jpg'),(13925,'Unknown Dungeon','2024-02-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore randomly generated maze with lots of treasures, puzzles and monsters. Help people, do quests, explore the dungeon, obtain treasures, gain experience and find out the history of the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73cg.jpg'),(13926,'Out There: Oceans of Time','2022-05-26','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Out There: Oceans of Time is a space exploration game that puts you at the helm of an interstellar mission of discovery spanning a vast and vibrant cosmos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xu8.jpg'),(13927,'Iblis2: Sorcery','2022-11-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Demon sorcery2 is a first-person psychological horror game. The events, the voiceovers are scary and completely real. Explore a mysterious village with ever-changing passwords in an atmospheric world and enjoy the terrifying joy of horror. Don\'t forget.. the demon is a production based on realism.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7htb.jpg'),(13928,'Goofy\'s Milk Mania','2006-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Based on Jungletac\'s previously-released Lucky Lawn Mower; seen on both Game It! systems with different graphics. It was later hacked to create Milk Mania.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13929,'The Pepper Prince: Episode 1 - Red Hot Chili Wedding','2019-01-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A rhyming fairy tale adventure about love, grief, and the power of friendship. Solve puzzles, meet quirky fairy-tale-inspired characters, and help your friend regain confidence and self-love after heartbreak!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5na0.jpg'),(13930,'SUMS','2023-10-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super unaccurate Midage Simulator (S.U.M.S.) is an open world sandbox game in which you can completely individualize yourself thanks to the complex RPG mechanics. Meet quirky characters, do jobs and build your own village.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ell.jpg'),(13931,'Melody\'s Escape 2','2022-09-30','Music, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Run to the rhythm of your own music library! Melody is back, with vastly improved audio analysis algorithms! Each mp3 creates a unique obstacle course synchronized to the beat of the music. Melody\'s actions will match the energy and intensity of any music of your choice!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5a57.jpg'),(13932,'Sky in your eyes','2022-07-23','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Visual novel about the life in the post-soviet country. Cute artstyle, 10 animated CGs, 5 BGs and 5 chibi CGs in 4k, English voice-over for each heroine, animated live2d sprites, original OSTs and a dramatic story!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lv6.jpg'),(13933,'The Man Man','2022-04-18','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Be a serial killer, with no bones tho.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7la9.jpg'),(13934,'B.O.B.','2014-02-15','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Entry for #flappyjam.\n\nYou are playing the red guy falling and trying to avoid the laser of that grey robot thingy by jumping from side to side.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co894i.jpg'),(13935,'Stronghold: Definitive Edition','2023-11-07','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Greetings sire! Your stronghold awaits you. Build a castle economy, besiege unforgettable villains and return to the \'castle sim\' that started it all. Experience this classic RTS with upgraded visuals, modernised gameplay, Steam multiplayer and a new campaign.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6tai.jpg'),(13936,'Blood Burger','2022-05-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Marco and his friend Thales are opening a hamburger shop but they don\'t know anything about cooking. So they decide to go after a secret hamburger formula in an abandoned \"ShitDonalds\" factory.\n\nBut what they don\'t expect is that the old factory\'s mascot is still there.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s90.jpg'),(13937,'Void Runner','2018-03-05','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive for as long as you can by teleporting to avoid obstacles, but teleport too soon and you might end up inside one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eu2.jpg'),(13938,'Along the Edge of the Sky',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13939,'Transformers: Generation 2',NULL,'Sin género','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Argonaut Games had made a deal to make a video game based upon the TV series of the same name. The game was to use the Super FX chip, an enhancement chip for the SNES that allowed 3D games to be much more possible. The game was cancelled in development, and was thought to be transferred over to another Super FX game, Vortex, which had a robot morphing into various vehicles. After an interview with Retro Gamer, it was said Vortex and Generation 2 were completely separate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kf8.jpg'),(13940,'Calico & Co','2017-04-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Calico in her quest to rescue her lost kittens and unravel the mysteries surrounding the culprit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a85.jpg'),(13941,'Kingdoms and Castles','2017-07-20','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','Inspired by the SimCity series, Banished, and Stronghold, Kingdoms and Castles is a game about growing a kingdom from a tiny hamlet to a sprawling city and imposing castle.\n\nYour kingdom must survive a living and dangerous world. Do the viking raiders make off with your villagers? Or are they stopped, full of arrows, at the castle gates? Does a dragon torch your granary, your people dying of starvation in the winter, or are you able to turn the beast back? The success of your kingdom depends solely on your skill as a city and castle planner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uaa.jpg'),(13942,'Alien Tribe 2','2013-12-13','Simulator, Strategy','iOS','Alien Tribe 2 is an indie 4x space game that combines several genres. Imagine a universe sandbox meets real-time strategy and a pinch of tower defense and Master of Orion. The 4X stands for \"eXplore\", \"eXpand\", \"eXploit\" and \"eXterminate\", and Alien Tribe 2 offers all these different strategies for the player - from exploring the galaxy to extracting raw materials or fending off hostile attacks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wyy.jpg'),(13943,'Mega Man Battle Network 4: Red Sun','2015-05-28','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Wii U, Game Boy Advance','The fourth installment in the Mega Man Battle Network series comes in two versions--Red Sun and Blue Moon--each with different enemies, battle chips, souls, and characters. Once again, you assume the role of Lan as he and his friend, Mega Man.exe, fight to rid the Internet of viruses and other cyberworld enemies. Unlike previous games in the series, Mega Man Battle Network 4 focuses on a tournament system where players encounter a variety of enemies that must be defeated. A new Soul Unison system lets Mega Man transform into his defeated enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co203d.jpg'),(13944,'Cult of the Lamb: Deluxe Edition','2023-03-17','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Cult of the Lamb casts players in the role of a possessed lamb saved from annihilation by an ominous stranger, and must repay their debt by building a loyal following in his name. Start your own cult in a land of false prophets, venturing out into diverse and mysterious regions to build a loyal community of woodland worshippers and spread your Word to become the one true cult.\n\nCult of the Lamb: Deluxe Edition includes:\nNintendo Switch game cartridge or PlayStation 5 game disc.\nAn exclusive 104-page artbook in landscape format.\nThe game´s Official Soundtrack CD in a carton sleeve.\nA Collectible tuck-in box housing all the contents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69kd.jpg'),(13945,'BlazBlue: Cross Tag Battle - Special Edition','2019-11-21','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','An unrivaled clash of explosive proportions! The beloved BlazBlue franchise Crosses universes, Tags in fan favorites, and Battles it out in BlazBlue: Cross Tag Battle! Created through an all-star collaboration between BlazBlue, Atlus’ Persona, French Bread’s Under Night In-Birth, and Rooster Teeth’s hugely popular RWBY web series, Cross Tag Battle celebrates the fighting genre for pros and newcomers alike! Engage in fast-paced 2v2 team battles filled with the craziness you’ve come to love from BlazBlue, with all the tight mechanics, smooth gameplay, and gorgeous 2D graphics you expect from Arc System Works. Choose from an eclectic cast of over 20 fighters. Jin Kisaragi, Rachel Alucard, Yosuke Hanamura and more are ready to join the fray!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r7i.jpg'),(13946,'Superlunary: Episode 1.0','2019-11-30','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A slow, queer episodic space opera about demilitarisation, rebuilding society after war, and finding love and new family in the cold depths of space. Playable online and built with three small, free games engines plugged into each other.\n\nAs seen at AdventureX 2019 and the National Videogame Museum.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2f52.jpg'),(13947,'Torikago no Mukougawa','2006-07-27','Puzzle, Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','You are summoned as a liberator in a world called Femto. A liberator is someone who can perform the ritual of freeing someone\'s mind. Your goal is to escape the world of Femto and return to your own world, and only way to do so is by freeing people\'s minds.\n\nThe game consists of two main gameplay elements. The adventure part which is where the story unfolds and the typical visual novel dialogues are gone through, and a puzzle part which consists of two phases, a phase for moving puzzle pieces, and a phase for moving to a location. The puzzle picture consists of 15 key pieces in total, and you need to put them all in their right place to be able to escape. Each phase gives you limited number of turns and/or points you can spend until it is finished, after which another phase will start. By determining location, you will move onto corresponding adventure part. In each location during adventure element, various events will occur and you will be able to talk to characters there. After the adventure part is over, you will return to the puzzle screen and continue with the next moving phase of puzzle pieces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co751m.jpg'),(13948,'Regina & Mac World','2021-05-28','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Wii U, Nintendo Switch','Regina and Mac are back in an all new, 2D adventure. On a quest to help their new friend Macbat (from Macbat 64) to find the purpose in his life, the dinosaur and the parrot jump, run, slide and dash through 100 level filled with secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co305o.jpg'),(13949,'Undernauts: Labyrinth of Yomi','2021-10-28','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Escape from “Yomi” – a dungeon filled with riches – and danger.\n\nYou have been recruited into the Undernauts – a team of brave subterranean adventurers who comb the depths of a massive, monster-infested labyrinth in search of priceless resources.\n\nMake use of your powerful skills and magic items to create exits and reach the surface alive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3daf.jpg'),(13950,'Yomi Domini','2020-12-04','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yomi Domini is an action-adventure game that tracks your tendencies while progressing through the level. The info gathered can be used against you or fight you on your own level depending on your difficulty selection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2la5.jpg'),(13951,'Neptunia: Sisters vs. Sisters - Calendar Edition','2023-01-24','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','The Calendar Edition of Neptunia: Sisters VS Sisters includes:\n- The Game\n- Reversible Cover\n- Calendar Edition Box\n- Desktop Calendar\n- Double-sided A3 Poster','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7og7.jpg'),(13952,'Star Wars: Empire at War - Forces of Corruption','2006-10-24','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You’ve played the light side. You’ve played the dark side. Now play the corrupt side! As Tyber Zann you’ll stop at nothing to become the most notorious criminal leader since Jabba the Hutt. With all new tactics like piracy, kidnapping, racketeering and bribery, you can control the shadowy forces of corruption in your attempt to rule the Star Wars underworld. Don’t just control the galaxy…corrupt it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21jj.jpg'),(13953,'Contraption Maker: Incredible Puzzles Pack','2023-12-28','Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Over 160 new puzzles in the spirit of the original puzzles from The Incredible Machine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7iwc.jpg'),(13954,'Steam: Rails to Riches Complete Edition','2021-07-20','Simulator, Strategy, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Take control of a railway company, issue shares, build railroads, deliver goods along an ever changing network of tracks and stations and make profit to expand.\n\nYou build the tracks, upgrade towns, improve your train, and grab the right goods to make the longest, most profitable deliveries. Score your deliveries and add to your income or victory points, balancing your need to invest against your quest to win the game. The goal of the game is to score the most victory points and become the best railway company.\n\nFeatures:\n- official Steam: Rails to Riches game\n- original artwork\n- ingame interactive tutorial\n- languages: English, German, Dutch, Portuguese, Polish, French, Spanish, Italian, Korean, Japanese, Chinese Traditional\n- play with AI, with friends or both\n- 3 levels of difficulty AIs with individual strategies - 3-5 player maps\n- climate sounds and music matched to maps\n- adaptable animation speed\n- official rules\n- unique, original board game feel on your console\n- colorblind mode\n- online multiplayer','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3g88.jpg'),(13955,'Holy Potatoes! A Weapon Shop?!: Spud Tales - Journey to Olympus','2015-11-13','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embark on an epic quest to help Herclueless - Zeus\' halfwitted demigod son - forge a weapon worthy of a God and help him return to Mount Olympus!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cch.jpg'),(13956,'Saiaku Naru Saiyaku Ningen ni Sasagu','2018-08-23','Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','A story where you live life alongside an “invisible girl.”\n\nKuro is an invisible girl, and Hyouma is a boy who can only see invisible people. To alleviate their loneliness, the two get close and live together, but “disaster” eventually bares its fangs and a cruel world stands before them.\n\nParallel worlds. An invisible girl. A mysterious disappearance. An omniscient slate. Can you solve the mystery behind the irrational world and lead it to salvation before total despair arrives as result of repeated destruction and separation?\n\nThis is a story of sadness and overcoming that begins with a meeting that has not happened yet, but is inevitable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x46.jpg'),(13957,'Jack of Skies',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','be gay, commit piracy, sail the skies','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13958,'Ravenwood Academy: A Wizard101 Story',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Step into the role of an outcast student wizard attending Ravenwood Academy and prepare to discover the truth behind the school’s bizarre events. Create connections, investigate mysteries, and drop in for a spell in this storybook-style life sim where your choices matter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83ji.jpg'),(13959,'Trauma: Broken Paradise','2023-03-03','Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Awaken in the fragmented mind of a woman, lost in the shadowy corridors of a sinister mansion. Unravel the mysteries of memory in this gripping psychological thriller, echoing the beloved classics of Survival Horror from the 90s/2000s. Dare to delve deeper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8071.jpg'),(13960,'The Electric Company Word Fun','1980-11-05','Puzzle','Intellivision','Word Fun was developed in conjuction with the Children\'s Television Workshop, and features three different word based educational games. The games are:\n\nCrosswords:\nThis game is similar to Scrabble. Each player is given seven letters from which they need to form words on the game board. On each turn the player can create words either horizontally or vertically, and must use one (or more) of the existing letters on the board. Points are earned depending on the word created, and at the end of 20 turns the player with the most points wins!\n\nLetter Hunt:\nIn this game each player controls a monkey in a letter forest. Each monkey must collect letters from the forest to spell three words within the given time limit. When both monkeys are complete, points are awarded for the words spelled and the highest score wins!\n\nWord Rockets:\nIn this game the players control a rocket capable of collecting and shooting vowels upwards. On the top of the screen, various words which are missing vowels will float by and each player needs to try to fire an appropriate vowel into the empty space. The first player who can complete 50 words wins!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zz7.jpg'),(13961,'Sniper Strike: Special Ops','2018-07-27','Shooter','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Intercept, eliminate and extract. It’s time to engage the enemy.Sniper Strike is a high-octane sniper experience that pits you in battle across three gameplay modes and 100\'s of missions. Scout through immersive environments, engage in rapid-fire combat and build the ultimate super-soldier.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dy4.jpg'),(13962,'Black Future \'88','2019-11-21','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Climb a procedural tower in an alternate version of 1988 to kill its insane owner. Then do it again, and again. The constantly evolving world is influenced by other players as you experience this bold and wildly exciting dungeon crawler.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wni.jpg'),(13963,'The Battle of Polytopia: Deluxe','2020-08-04','Simulator, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','In addition to The Battle of Polytopia the game, the Deluxe bundle includes the Aquarion, Elyrion, Polaris and Cymanti Tribes\nIncludes 11 items: The Battle of Polytopia, Aquarion Tribe, Elyrion Tribe, Polaris Tribe, Cymanti Tribe, Aquarion Skin, Elyrion Skin, and Skin Packs 1-4','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d35.jpg'),(13964,'Mario vs. Sonic.EXE','2015-07-03','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13965,'Poop Killer 4','2022-08-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Poop Killer 4\" is a game inspired by trashy horror movies from the 80\'s. With an over-the-top comedy and weird horror.\n\nThe game contains 3 possible endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xo5.jpg'),(13966,'Boom Blaster','2021-02-18','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Boom Blaster is a hand-drawn, side-scrolling shoot\'em up with intense boss fights! Blast your way through each level with a range of weapons and unique hero abilities in this exciting and challenging action game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t2n.jpg'),(13967,'The Legend of Zelda: Master of Time','2020-07-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo 64','Master of Time is a new story in a completely new world, Abello, where Link must restore the flow of time. Abello is a big and dangerous world, but Link can count on the help of Nite the fairy.\n\nAround 20 hours of gameplay in various areas and dungeons with custom cutscenes, songs and much more. Good luck finding all 100 skulltula tokens and 20 hearts!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jua.jpg'),(13968,'Grand Poo World','2017-10-03','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Grand Poo World is a ROM hack of Super Mario World created by Barbarian. The ROM hack was dedicated to Grand POOBear, who is best known as a speedrunner and Twitch streamer.\n\nThis hack is designed to challenge even the most skilled Super Mario World Kaizo players. This hack features customized music and palettes over a more vanilla SMW style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z0x.jpg'),(13969,'PC Creator: PC Building Simulator','2018-12-14','Simulator','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Try yourself as a PC builder and build your dream PC from 200+ real components!Complete different PC building and PC repair orders to upgrade your business: build a PC from zero, install popular OS\', upgrade computers, install different programs and games, fix PC parts, and much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kcc.jpg'),(13970,'Alpha Mission II','2024-04-08','Shooter, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, PlayStation 3, Neo Geo MVS, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable, Neo Geo CD','Alpha Mission II is a 2D vertical scrolling shooter with a great deal of depth for two players moving vertically up the screen boards shooting anything that moves. Equip up to three pieces of armor, which also serve as weapons, for a variety of attacks such as the laser and flamethrower. Use them to defeat the evil “Fulvar” and save mankind!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ku8.jpg'),(13971,'Infinite Prison','2016-11-20','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Suspicion and lies intertwine in this exciting room escape adventure! It\'s an enthralling web of deceit set in prison — and only one person is telling the truth!\n\nThree innocent girls, all strangers to one another, but united by common tragedy... incarceration on false charges in an underground prison known as Catacombe! Uncover Catacombe\'s secrets using your wits, courage, and intuition!\n\nHelp orchestrate a breakout and escape with your lives...by any means necessary!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co507t.jpg'),(13972,'Haunted Hotel: Eclipse - Collector\'s Edition','2013-10-11','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','You and your renowned partner James have been called to investigate a strange disturbance at a hotel, but the maid says the guests are all monsters. What’s happened here, and does she really mean that literally?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b49.jpg'),(13973,'Crappy Dog','2023-07-18','Arcade','Android','Beat Your Highscore! Crappy Dog is one of many Games that tried to rip-off Flappy Bird, this time with dogs!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86w8.jpg'),(13974,'Universe Rhythm Shooting','2025-02-20','Indie','SteamVR','Universe Rhythm Shooting combines rhythm mechanics with virtual reality shooting as players pilot their spacecraft through space. Players match their shots and movements to the beat while navigating through cosmic environments, merging traditional rail shooter gameplay with musical elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lpk.jpg'),(13975,'Nasu Pinball','2018-06-23','Pinball','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Nasu Pinball is a Yume Nikki fangame. As the name suggests, this is a pinball-style game with a Nasu theme. Your goal is get as high of a score as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rfu.jpg'),(13976,'Totem','2016-08-30','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Totem is an action RPG with a pretty, detailed pixel-art. In this game you will become the only hope for the salvation of mankind. Mysterious horrifying evil corrupts the forest and its inhabitants. You need to find out what\'s hidden behind all these nightmares. Gradually, the hero discovers that the looming threat can be defeated, but to achieve this hero must be much more stronger. How to do it? Crush them all! Make them regret for what they did.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zqz52plezppmmjxx8nkm.jpg'),(13977,'Cast VR','2021-02-20','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Unravel the mystery and embrace the magic! In Cast VR, an adventure RPG, you will explore a magical world and uncover the mystery of the missing King. Your wand and spell book are how you navigate the world. Discover and use spells to interact with objects and defend yourself against enemies. Explore the castle, solve puzzles, learn about the world and piece together the mystery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2toa.jpg'),(13978,'Stickman\'s Arena','2022-11-14','Fighting, Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Stickman\'s Arena is a top-down arena shooter roguelite where you play a stickman wielding up to 6 weapons at a time to fight off hordes of enemies. Choose from a variety of upgrades and combine your weapons to create unique and game-breaking builds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lfd.jpg'),(13979,'Epic Battles of History','2020-08-27','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Experience a world where the greats of human history collide in epic battles across time. Pick your favourite hero and assemble a team for the ages to duel it out with your friends and unleash the power of your cards to see who among you is the strategic mastermind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pxp.jpg'),(13980,'Obduction','2017-08-29','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Windows Mixed Reality, PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Mac, Oculus Rift, Xbox One','From Cyan, the indie studio that brought you Myst and Riven comes a whole new adventure that will become your world.\n\nThe new worlds of Obduction reveal their secrets only as you explore, coax, and consider them. And as you bask in the otherworldly beauty and explore through the enigmatic landscapes, remember that the choices you make will have substantial consequences. This is your story now.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wod.jpg'),(13981,'Sine the Game','2020-11-03','Platform, Puzzle, Racing, Arcade','Android, iOS','Sine is a competitive arcade game with unique mechanics and compelling visuals. You control a sine wave, avoiding obstacles, racing to the finish, and collecting orbs scattered throughout levels ranging from simple to painfully difficult. The intuitive one-finger controls are easy to learn, but hard to master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jz8.jpg'),(13982,'Nightmare Cafe','2021-05-11','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jru.jpg'),(13983,'Incubo','2019-02-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','INCUBO is a side scrolling platform game with a semi-horror theme. We present many ghost from around the world in our game as enemy and bosses. You played as a child in his nightmare and discover the truth about his story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43jz.jpg'),(13984,'Game of Thrones: A Telltale Games Series - Episode 4: Sons of Winter','2015-05-29','Point-and-click, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Based on HBO\'s award-winning television drama, Game of Thrones – A Telltale Games Series tells the story of House Forrester, a noble house from the north of Westeros. Caught up in the events of The War of the Five Kings, they are placed in a precarious position where members of the household must do everything they can to prevent the house from meeting its doom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vd3.jpg'),(13985,'Forget-Me-Not R','2018-02-15','Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This sequel to the 2011 iOS game Forget-Me-Not is an arcade-like maze game about, according to the creator, \"picking flowers in randomly generated caves of monsters\".','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13986,'Knight Club +','2020-10-05','Fighting, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Knight Club + Is a casual 2-4 player action platform-fighting game that brings traditional fighting game elements into an unlocked, free form movement playstyle. Equip your favorite armaments and do battle against your friends locally or online!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7htm.jpg'),(13987,'Reflection: The Greed','2023-04-14','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What\'s the worst that can happen from reading a decrepit book? Jon Oz, who\'s been sifting through pages of a book that shouldn\'t even have its cover opened, is about to confine himself into a nightmare. Will you end the nightmare when darkness falls? Or will you be a prisoner to your own reflection?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5m5q.jpg'),(13988,'Davie\'s Quest and The Magic Dress',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92i1.jpg'),(13989,'SaGa Frontier 2','1999-04-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Shape History or Be History\n\nSelect and control decisive moments during decades of royal conflict. Magic, revenge, and assassination will all play a part in determining who will obtain the country and the crown.\n\n-Create a unique history with Multi-Scenario System\n-Influence a variety of characters in an epic saga\n-Experience hand-painted watercolor artwork\n-Play Duel, Team, or Strategic battle modes\n-Choose from various, realistic sword maneuvers during combat\n-Form hundreds of possible combo attacks\n-Cast powerful and spectacular magic attacks','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r88.jpg'),(13990,'Nyanco Dream','2019-11-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nyanco goes to the Gensokyo Touhou World!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q9l.jpg'),(13991,'Team Umizoomi & Dora\'s Fantastic Flight','2012-11-06','Adventure','Nintendo DS','What happens when Dora the Explorer and Team Umizoomi unite for the very first time? You get a high-flying adventure! Help the mighty math heroes Milli, Geo and Bot and super explorers Dora and Boots find the missing pieces of an extraordinary air-ship, and take to the skies with their Nickelodeon friends. It\'s a one-of-a-kind journey!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/k3otjxqcceuokpo9l1r7.jpg'),(13992,'Barrel Rescue','2014-08-03','Arcade','Windows Phone, Android, iOS','Barrel Rescue is a mobile game using tilt-motion','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/is9tc3cmplyx3wh7niqt.jpg'),(13993,'ProtoBound','2022-07-10','Puzzle, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ProtoBound is an obstacle-avoidance game in which you navigate your character through various obstacles. It\'s inspired by bound-type custom maps for StarCraft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g7u.jpg'),(13994,'Blackstead','2019-10-07','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You explore a small town called Blackstead and discover secrets about it\'s strange inhabitants.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13995,'Nothing Door','2024-01-09','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A puzzle game from a dark dimension.\n\nThe Nothing Door is your only escape. But the door is fickle. It lets nothing through... except you. Where will it lead you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c4h.jpg'),(13996,'Kathy Rain: Director\'s Cut - Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bq4.jpg'),(13997,'Bridge Strike','2020-06-04','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Amiga, Nintendo Switch','Fly, survive, fight with enemies and destroy all the bridges! \n \nGet behind the controls of our plane and fight for peace. You are our last hope! \n \nThe game has stunning old school pixel graphics, a dedicated chiptune soundtrack and SFX and features several types of terrain across diverse and demanding missions. \n \nMain features: \n- RAID mission - destroy as many bridges as possible and try to survive \n- CAMPAIGNS mode - various missions with specific tasks to complete \n- different locations \n- dynamic weather conditions like sun, snow, snowstorm, rain, rainstorm etc. \n- time of day changes \n- lots of enemies to destroy \n- great music and sfx \n- many hidden funny stuff','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rwu.jpg'),(13998,'Decimals 2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(13999,'Sanity Chase',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, MOBA','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Sanity Chase is a 2v5 asymmetrical competitive game. Here, you can enjoy our unique art style, engaging 2v5 gameplay, and the excitement of playing with friends. Welcome to the lost kingdom! Are you ready?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7axm.jpg'),(14000,'Pitfall 3D: Beyond the Jungle','1998-03-28','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation','Pitfall 3D is a 3D platformer in which players guide Pitfall Harry Jr. (the original Pitfall! hero\'s son, voiced by B-movie king Bruce Campbell) through a wide variety of settings, ranging from the South American jungle to the ruins of the Moku civilization that lie behind a dimensional rift.\n\nSome old obstacles and enemies appear, such as tar pits that can open up beneath Harry and swallow him whole, ever-present scorpions, and old favorites like rolling logs and handy vines, which can be found smattered around the jungle. But there are new dangers as well, including the sinister flying darters, and new wonders to behold, such as gravity-defying lucense.\n\nHarry Jr. gets by much the same way his father did -- he can dodge out of the way, jump over obstacles, and take a swing at attackers with his trusty pick-axe. The object is to guide Harry Jr. through 11 levels, trying to discover what happened to the Moku civilization, and finally into a confrontation with the mighty Scourge, who\'s holding this alternate dimension hostage. Oh, and Harry might want to grab some treasure along the way too -- just like dear old Dad.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rque0tahaekeraofsyec.jpg'),(14001,'DCS World: Afghanistan','2024-07-11','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','28 highly detailed airfields\n20 years of the War on Terror and the Soviet operations of the 1980s place Afghanistan as one of the most important combat theatres of the past half century. Few war zones have ever seen more A-10C, AH-64D, F-16C, F/A-18C, CH-47F, Mi-24P, Mi-8MTV2, and Su-25 sorties than this.\nThe entirety of Afghanistan and small portions of neighbouring countries will be available, showcasing our latest map technologies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fug.jpg'),(14002,'Gran Turismo 5 Prologue','2007-12-13','Racing, Simulator','PlayStation 3','Gran Turismo 5 Prologue is a precursor and sampling of Gran Turismo 5 and replaced Gran Turismo HD Concept. The \"Prologue\" suffix is a self-reference to Gran Turismo 4 Prologue which was released one year before the full version of Gran Turismo 4. Since October 3, 2008, the game is now referred to as Gran Turismo 5 Prologue Spec III which is the software\'s version 3.0 title. Gran Turismo 5 Prologue Spec III features 16-player online races, over 70 cars (including tuned cars), 6 tracks, 12 layouts, a 60 frames per second frame rate (during races, replays are displayed at 30 frames per second) and LPCM 7.1ch high definition sound.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20bj.jpg'),(14003,'Lootist','2024-08-16','Shooter, Tactical, Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t9r.jpg'),(14004,'Defend from Candyland!','2022-01-10','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the world of Defend from Candyland! where retro tower defense meets strategic depth. Plant and upgrade trees, use powerful buffs, and reveal enemy paths to shield Eden from waves of candy invaders. Master the challenge now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9b7o.jpg'),(14005,'Their Navy Is Their Doom','2024-10-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Command an advanced submarine in a heart-pounding horror experience as you hunt the last remnants of a defeated enemy beneath the Mariana Trench. Navigate, survive, and uncover terrifying oceanic secrets in this immersive underwater warfare game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wvd.jpg'),(14006,'Primeval','2025-01-19','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience life as different dinosaurs and prehistoric creatures from various parts of the ecosystem. Eat, grow, and survive in an unforgiving world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9b6j.jpg'),(14007,'Bard\'s Gold','2016-12-15','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One','\"Bard\'s Gold is a 2D Retro slow-paced platformer with light RPG elements, where the player has to find the key within the level and get to the door in order to progress through the game.\"\n\n\"Old school platforming experience - No tutorials or explanations how things should be done. Everything including the basic game mechanics must be figured out by yourself as you go.\"\n\n\"Rogue-lite - Different layouts for each level is randomly chosen every playthrough. While getting the chance to memorize levels and get better at them, the “random level” system will keep your interest. With the gems you collect you will be able to upgrade your character on the Game Over screen. These upgrades are permanent and will help you on future playthroughs. \"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zkr.jpg'),(14008,'Battle Cube','2013-12-31','Sin género','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','...experiment based on an idea I’ve had for a long, long time. Some day in the distant future, I may make a bigger game featuring many more battle cubes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1x34.jpg'),(14009,'For Honor: Season 7 - Storm and Fury','2018-08-02','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Dark clouds gather – volcanoes rumble. The Gods have stirred. Now the factions look to each other for blame. It’s a clash of passions and rage as each faction turns on each other trying to lay blame and make sense of the changes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3daq.jpg'),(14010,'Eggconsole Hydlide3 PC-8801mkIISR','2024-02-22','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','The concluding chapter of the Hydlide series. Can you, as an adventurer, once again save Fairyland? This is the third installment in the iconic Japanese action RPG series, \"Hydlide.\" and the player once again rises to the occasion to save Fairyland from a new crisis.\n\nIn addition to the graphics and sound inherited from the previous title as a sequel to the series, this ambitious work incorporates a moderate amount of various elements, such as the ability to choose a class, the concept of time, the need to eat during adventures, and the need to manage luggage due to the weight of items to be carried.\n\nIt can be said that this game title not only appealed to fans of the Hydlide series but also left a lasting impression on numerous gaming enthusiasts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xy2.jpg'),(14011,'Tunic','2022-09-27','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Tunic is an action adventure about a tiny fox in a big world. Explore the wilderness, discover spooky ruins, and fight terrible creatures from long ago.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/td1t8kb33gyo8mvhl2pc.jpg'),(14012,'Mystery Masters: Supernatural Stories',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14013,'Pixel Royale 3D','2024-03-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dive into Pixel Royale 3D, a pixelated FPS with 40+ weapons, intense gameplay, and customizable character skins. Engage in thrilling gunfights across 3 maps, and challenge opponents in 3 different game modes. Gear up and lock and load for the ultimate Pixelated FPS experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zfl.jpg'),(14014,'The Last Crusade','2001-11-07','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The author worked almost 7 months on these 3 combined levels that take place in Rome. This is his most complicated project I have built till now. Many big locations, exploring, puzzles, action and atmosphere. It\'s all there. When you find all 7 secrets in the first 2 outside levels an actionpacked bonusstage awaits you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s1l.jpg'),(14015,'Survival Journals',NULL,'Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive with your choices and fortify your safehouse in this text based adventure. The Horde\'s on it\'s way, will you be ready when it arrives?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i61.jpg'),(14016,'Beasties of Greenhollow','2024-04-27','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beasties of Greenhollow is a strategic turn based team building game that features a collection of cute creatures based of Scottish mythology. Explore a mysterious realm of fairies, elves, magic, and creatures while fighting to the center of this hidden realm at the request of a mysterious masked figure. What are Shellycoat’s true intentions?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84zj.jpg'),(14017,'Fallen Doll','2017-12-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In summary, Fallen Doll is a real-time next-gen hentai game with VR support.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vx2.jpg'),(14018,'Ghostrunner II: Brutal Edition','2023-10-24','Shooter, Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Ghostrunner II is a hardcore FPP slasher set in a post-apocalyptic, cyberpunk world. Featuring everything fans loved about Ghostrunner plus incredible boss fights, new interactive story, thrilling motorbike levels, improved skills, and more cyber ninja action.\n\nGhostrunner 2 Brutal Edition Includes:\n- Ghostrunner 2 Game\n- Ahriman\'s Katana Sword and Hand Skin\n- Modern Energy Sword and Hand Skin\n- Molten Blade Sword and Hand Skin\n- Gothic Blue Sword and Hand Skin\n- Hand Hologram with Username\n- Aqua Animated Sword and Hand Skin\n- Design 24A Motorcycle Skin\n- Ghostrunner 2 Season Pass','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yrn.jpg'),(14019,'Tightrope Walking','2021-10-22','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A tightrope walking simulation game using keyboard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41ap.jpg'),(14020,'Snake in the Cube','2020-12-17','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Snake in the Cube\" - original, retro game, based on old snake games, remastered in 3D.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46xn.jpg'),(14021,'RollocoBall','2016-12-22','Arcade','Android','The game for those who adore rolling on roller coasters.\r\nInspired by roller coasters of New York, Las Vegas, Los Angeles.\r\n\r\nThis is a simple arcade game. Try to avoid spikes on your way and see how far you can go!\r','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/akxew0eh3gzrwzgp86zx.jpg'),(14022,'Beeny','2022-10-14','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A vertical 2D platformer featuring a round bee in an early 90s pre-rendered environment. Roll and hop up to the precious honey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lpt.jpg'),(14023,'Chook & Sosig: Walk the Plank','2019-06-17','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Chook & Sosig: Walk the Plank is a charming point-and-click adventure about tabletop gaming, mischievous friends, and spectral poultry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m75.jpg'),(14024,'Cave Chaos 2','2012-05-17','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Escape the caves in our second installment of the Cave Chaos series!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cto.jpg'),(14025,'Soundodger 2','2023-04-10','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Soundodger 2 is an experimental dodge-em-up music game that turns every song into a choreographed dance of bullets, lasers, and challenges to weave through in order to survive. The sequel to 2013\'s award-winning Soundodger+, Soundodger 2 is bigger, better, and dodgier than ever before. With an all-new selection of songs from international musicians and a fully-featured level editor to use your own music, you\'ll never run out of things to dodge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k5t.jpg'),(14026,'The Bound of Time','2014-05-31','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Bound of Time is a tiny action adventure and was made for #lowrezjam within 3 weeks. There a some bugs yet, but the game it\'s playable and i hope it\'s enjoyable to.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sfr.jpg'),(14027,'Super Mario Bros. S',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8poo.jpg'),(14028,'Vs. Raid on Bungeling Bay','1985-06-01','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','VS. Raid on Bungeling Bay is a 1985 shoot \'em up game, developed by Hudson Soft, which is a Nintendo VS. System port of the NES version of Raid on Bungeling Bay, which in turn is a port of a 1984 Commodore 64 game developed by Will Wright.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43or.jpg'),(14029,'The Counting Kingdom','2014-08-05','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Writing simple spells, brewing bubbly potions... yesterday was just another day in your life as the Wizard\'s Apprentice. Today, a horde of angry monsters is attacking The Counting Kingdom, and only you can defend the castle towers! Using your spells, potions, and the mighty power of mathematics, you must banish the monsters and save the kingdom!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uk8unpb1v5y53amz1m3s.jpg'),(14030,'Tales of Fire','2022-06-17','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tales of Fire is a short story-driven game, embark on an adventure to bring fire to your ant village or else they all die to the cold winter breeze. Platform your way through mushrooms, escape from evil spiders and make friends along the way. Can you save them?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jcz.jpg'),(14031,'Mission to McDonaldland','1999-06-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This point-and-click adventure game features a heavy focus on minigames. The player character moves around the screen on their own, following the player\'s cursor. Each area features a different player character, giving the player the chance to control the whole cast. Players can click on various items around the screen to interact with them. Aside from the McDonald\'s hub restaurant, players can travel to four different areas, each of which has its own minigame and a piece of the spaceship to find. After collecting all the pieces of the ship, players can then travel to McMars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zae.jpg'),(14032,'The Last Corpse Forge: Survivor','2025-06-17','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This top-down endless survivor lets you play as re-animated corpses. Progress through this challenging and dark bullet-hell while upgrading your corpses and unlocking powerful torches to help power you through the relentless enemies and bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r6r.jpg'),(14033,'Body and Brain Connection','2010-11-20','Puzzle, Sport, Adventure','Xbox 360','Body and Brain Connection is a puzzle game which asks mental questions but requires that the answers be performed through physical actions. The game\'s goal is to reinforce the mental answers by having them be drilled into the player by playing with motion controls. Games are usually short exercises that last only for a few minutes. Some of the games include a math game which requires the player to make hand motions in either a \"greater than\" or \"less than\" sign and a game which makes the user kick a ball into the goal with the right answer for a math question.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co213d.jpg'),(14034,'Final Inferno','2019-12-11','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A turn-based pixel-art RPG with a dantesque story and an elaborate skill system','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14035,'Crime Solitaire 2: The Smoking Gun','2014-11-07','Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you enjoy humor along the lines of the Zucker brothers and Police Squad? You will love this game!\n\nEvergreen Heights, 1935. The city is in the grip of its biggest crime wave since...well, the last one.\n\nAs bungling detective Max Stone, explore a criminal underworld teeming with mobsters, criminals, crooks, thugs, thieves, bankers and lawyers, and more puns than you ever thought possible. Meet crazy characters and enjoy a captivating story mode with slapstick dialogue.\n\nDo you have the grit to hunt down and take down Jimmy Menendez and his boys, in Crime Solitaire 2: The Smoking Gun?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nne.jpg'),(14036,'Super Robot Taisen GC','2004-12-16','Fighting, Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo GameCube','Super Robot Taisen GC is the first and only Nintendo GameCube Super Robot Wars title.\nIt would later be ported to the Xbox 360 under the title Super Robot Wars XO, which had an online mode called \"Super Robot Competition\".\n\nThis game received an English fan translation in 2021.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49fz.jpg'),(14037,'Asfalia: Anger','2023-01-23','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A beautifully hand drawn point & click children tale about emotions. Help Charlie explore Asfalia, the mysterious world of emotions. Meet lovable quirky characters and help them with their problems. Solve simple environmental puzzles. Collect stickers, and save Asfalia from an imminent danger.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v3q.jpg'),(14038,'Tsumu Light','1999-09-14','Puzzle','PlayStation','Follow up to the 3D puzzle game Tsumu, both only released in Japan for the original Playstation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uuj.jpg'),(14039,'Doodle Hunt: Search Hidden Items','2024-06-24','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Doodle Hunt is a delightful seek-and-find game set in hand-drawn cityscapes. Explore charming maps, locate hidden items, and watch them come to life in color! An enchanting adventure for all ages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gu8.jpg'),(14040,'Captain & Company','2023-12-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Find fortune, foes, and friends for life in Captain & Company: the ultimate swashbuckling adventure game. Set sail with friends into epic naval battles with massive multiplayer crews, and pillage your way to becoming the wealthiest pirates on the high seas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fwn.jpg'),(14041,'Dragon Ball FighterZ: Goku (Ultra Instinct)','2020-05-21','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Go beyond the Limits! Goku (Ultra Instinct) now comes to DRAGON BALL FighterZ!\n\nThis content includes:\n• Goku (Ultra Instinct) as a new playable character\n• 5 alternative colors for his outfit\n• Goku (Ultra Instinct) Lobby Avatar\n• Goku (Ultra Instinct) Z Stamp','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4grj.jpg'),(14042,'Digimon Rumble Arena 2','2004-07-29','Fighting','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Digimon Rumble Arena 2 (Digimon Battle Chronicle in Japan) is a Digimon fighting game released in 2004 by Bandai Games for the GameCube, PlayStation 2, and the Xbox.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dyx.jpg'),(14043,'Pirofauna',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Burn, little Flame, burn... Light up the misty forest, dispel the darkness... Let tiny bugs emerge from the nooks and crannies, gazing at your spark.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u4d.jpg'),(14044,'Airsoft Online',NULL,'Sport','Sin plataforma','Airsoft Online offers a realistic virtual airsoft experience for veterans of the community and beginners alike. Take part in team-based multiplayer battles, with customizable weapons and realistic physics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co838q.jpg'),(14045,'RoShamBo Arena','2016-07-14','Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome to RoShamBo arena! A brand new FREE arena fighting game, based on a classic rock-paper-scissors! Choose your character out of dozens unique looks, customize your gear, fight other players, knock their teeth out and become the best in RoShamBo Arena!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ylzr5xosvnbccy9un66d.jpg'),(14046,'Roadwar Europa','1987-12-31','Strategy, Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga, Apple II','Roadwar Europa starts off with you as the leader at a large road gang equipped with cars trucks, and motorcycles of your own design Transfer your crew from Roadwar 2000 or start from scratch and create a new elite band.\nBy fighting for new recruits, vehicles, supplies, ammunition and medicine, you\'ll maximize your chances for survival in this dangerous new world. You\'ll also be building up your forces to prepare for the final roadwar against the powerful terrorist leaders - a battle whose outcome will determine the future of all Europe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21ij.jpg'),(14047,'Jak and Daxter: The Lost Frontier','2009-11-03','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','Jak and Daxter: The Lost Frontier is a 2009 platform game developed by High Impact Games and published by Sony Computer Entertainment. The game is the sixth and final game in the Jak and Daxter series. The player assumes the role of Jak, the angst-ridden hero enhanced by his exposure to Light and Dark Eco.\n\nWhen their world begins to run out of Eco, Jak and Keira travel to the edge of the world in search of the ancient Precursor machinery that could reverse the planet\'s decline. They\'re not the only interested factions out on the Brink, however; Jak must contend with Sky Pirates while struggling to control his own Eco powers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2agh.jpg'),(14048,'D.E.E.P.: Battle of Jove',NULL,'Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take fast, campaign-based arcade gameplay with next-gen graphics for an experience known since Star Fox: Barrel-roll, maneuver and fight your way thru deep space and Rogue Squadron-like planet-based missions as the leader of the rebellion','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i7t.jpg'),(14049,'Legend of Frog','2024-09-16','Role-playing (RPG)','Android','Step into the darkly whimsical world of Legend of Frog, where a simple amphibian\'s accident leads to an extraordinary adventure. As a frog turned powerful necromancer, you command an army of undead dwarves who have constructed an unstoppable tank. Traverse through various iconic fictional universes, annihilating all who dare to stand in your way and harvesting their souls to enhance your powers and fortify your tank.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98zm.jpg'),(14050,'Fear the Phantom','2023-07-10','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Co-op paranormal investigation with PvP for 1-4 players. Intense horror game with a dark atmosphere.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r8o.jpg'),(14051,'Battle Echoes','2024-01-29','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take command of the mech and become the ultimate strategist. Construct impregnable defense facilities, handpick potent skills, lead your troops, and defy relentless enemy assaults. Will you emerge victorious in this thrilling battle for supremacy?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7o7w.jpg'),(14052,'Rocket Knight','2010-05-12','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Rocket Knight is a classic side-scrolling rocket action series. Our favorite opossum hero returns home after 15 years to find the kingdom of Zephyrus in shambles. Use your wits and Sparkster\'s trusty rocket pack to dodge and defeat a menacing wolf army threatening the lives of his people.\nRocket Knight is a revival of the Sparkster series, which first began with Rocket Knight Adventures. The game is a sequel to the Sega Genesis game Sparkster: Rocket Knight Adventures 2, and not a remake of Rocket Knight Adventures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uyg.jpg'),(14053,'The Mystery of the Druids','2001-11-08','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this classic adventure, you will take on the role of young Scotland Yard Detective Brent Halligan, assigned to solve the puzzle surrounding a mysterious order of Druids and a series of gruesome murders. It appears that the neo-Druids are conducting ritual killings in order to conjure up incredibly sinister forces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o60.jpg'),(14054,'My Rusty Submarine',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','You are the proud owner of a rather rusty submarine, on your way to discover the deepest depths of the ocean. Now and then there might be a small leak or another annoyance but that\'s what you love about your very own submarine, it\'s a two way relationship giving repairs and in return receiving shelter and transportation. So grab a friend and go on a journey, be careful to stay on track to not end up loosing your valuable progress. Keep your boat intact and reach places nobody has reached before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ycc.jpg'),(14055,'Close Combat : Panthers in the Fog','2015-05-14','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Close Combat: Panthers in the Fog details the desperate German counter-attack at Mortain, the last chance of the Wehrmacht to stave off defeat in Normandy.  \nCan you match the tenacity of the American defenders of Hill 314? Or can you succeed where the Panzers failed, driving through to the sea and changing history?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2prj.jpg'),(14056,'Stellarium','2023-03-07','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ride around the many galaxies of Stellarium in a hectic vertical bullet hell, facing off all kinds of creatures and dodging giant storms of bullets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5oaq.jpg'),(14057,'Sherlock Holmes and the Mystery of the Frozen City','2012-11-25','Puzzle, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','When a mysterious snowstorm falls on London, so cold that even the Thames is starting to freeze, Sherlock Holmes, the most astute detective of all time, is called in to investigate. Explore amazing environments, meet and interrogate many colorful characters, and examine objects and clues in order to discover the evidence that will help solve this incredible case. Many original puzzles and brain-teasers will put your skills to the test during your investigation, while you unveil the truth behind the Mystery of the Frozen City!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z4k.jpg'),(14058,'Harukuru: Spring has Come True?','2025-02-21','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Certain Situation. Of course, even if I put it that way there’s no way I can explain the situation I’m in… Thus is the start of a story unlike any other about a guy and 4 girls and the daily life they find themselves in.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fo6.jpg'),(14059,'Color-A-Cube','2025-03-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Meta Quest 3','Dive into a relaxing, color-filled escape with Color A Cube. This immersive coloring experience lets you explore and bring voxel worlds to life, one cube at a time. Unwind and tap into your creative flow as each brushstroke reveals vibrant, voxel-based environments and characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9crw.jpg'),(14060,'Plague of Athens VR','2024-08-07','Visual Novel','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3','Plague of Athens tells the story of Nikos of Athens, a physician during history’s first recorded pandemic, 429 BCE, who struggles to treat the multitude who fall ill during this world-upending ordeal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99mk.jpg'),(14061,'Kingdom Rush Vengeance - Hammerhold Campaign','2023-12-14','Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Hammerhold\'s in for a surprise: Vez\'nan sends you with the mighty Dark Army fleet for a lightning strike on the desert shores, catching the Legionnaires off guard!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7g7u.jpg'),(14062,'Monster Hunter Portable 3rd','2010-12-01','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation Portable','Monster Hunter Portable 3rd is a game in the Monster Hunter franchise for the PlayStation Portable system that was released in Japan on December 1, 2010. The game was released, as a part of the PlayStation Portable Remaster series, on PlayStation 3.The game introduces new regions, monsters, and a revised Felyne combat system. Monster Hunter Portable 3rd is not an update to Monster Hunter Freedom Unite or Monster Hunter Tri. Monster Hunter Portable 3rd is instead separate to the rest of the series, and most of the game has been entirely remade.However, it is also a successor to Monster Hunter Freedom Unite as the third game in the Portable series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mi7.jpg'),(14063,'Koisuru Otome to Shugo no Tate: The Shield of Aigis','2008-11-20','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65jx.jpg'),(14064,'Cyberpunk SFX','2020-11-29','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What can be more spectacular than a girl armed with rockets and a sense of humor? Yes, she is about to start solving the problems of the 21st century. And if you want to make sure she doesn’t create a few new ones, you’ll have to show her the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o0k.jpg'),(14065,'Urja','2015-01-09','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The king is deceitful, the queen is wicked, and the bishop unholy. In every land it’s the same. Corrupted knights and power hungry pawns. It’s time for change. You\'ve waited long enough. Be brave. Be daring. Be the last one standing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86ma.jpg'),(14066,'Hunter: The Reckoning','2002-05-21','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube','Set in White Wolf\'s World of Darkness, Hunter: The Reckoning lets you take the role of one of four different hunters--Deuce, a biker ex-con; Father Cortez, a prison chaplain; Kassandra, a raver chick; and Samantha, a tough ex-cop. Armed with a variety of fearsome weaponry--ranging from axes to shotguns--you\'ll battle it out with hordes of supernatural enemies. Intense action combined with multiplayer support brings the true spirit of Hunter: The Reckoning to life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5g9b.jpg'),(14067,'Dream Dealer','2016-10-01','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dream Dealer is a first person exploration game were you take your dream and start a long journey between worlds. \n \nYou\'ll never know if what you see is real, or if you are in trance. \n \nAn experimental game made to delight your sensory system. \n \nSurreal game inspirate in titles like: The Stanley Parable, Dear Esther or Mind: Path to Thalamus were the principal objective is to show what mind isn\'t able to imagine. \n \nIt is also a Puzzle game that throws you into a fantastic and surreal environment were your dreams will be difficult to control. \n \nThe story is explained by inner thoughts that will guide you through your dreams.  \n \nSometimes they will try to confuse and deceive you... \n \nThis game can be described in this words: Walking Simulator, Indie, Short, Atmospheric, Casual Story, Abstract, Adventure, Singleplayer , Mystery, Experimental, Interactive Fiction, Horror, Psychological, Relaxing and Fantasy.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14068,'Love Island: The Game - Season 6','2023-05-24','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','The sixth season (also known as Double Trouble) of Love Island: The Game was released on May 24, 2023. Episodes will be made available weekly on Wednesdays.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ygw.jpg'),(14069,'Ninja Gaiden Shadow','1992-01-09','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Game Boy','When a madman threatens to take over the entire world, our beloved hero Ryu must travel the globe to get to New York. Once he gets there, there are hazards and enemies hiding in each and every nook and cranny. If you think the \"Big Apple\" is dangerous in real life, you\'ll be amazed at the depths of evil employed by the big-city villains in this escapade. You\'ll have to hack, slash, and kick your way through the streets and all the way to one of the most dangerous bosses in videogame history. Another installment in the ongoing Ninja Gaiden series, Ninja Gaiden Shadow boasts intense graphics, a great storyline, and smooth gameplay. The world could really use a hero, and if you\'ve got the skills and know-how, you could be it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co404u.jpg'),(14070,'Call of Duty: Infinite Warfare - Legacy Edition','2016-11-04','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Call of Duty: Infinite Warfare - Legacy Edition includes Call of Duty: Infinite Warfare and Call of Duty: Modern Warfare Remastered.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81ge.jpg'),(14071,'Ecclesia Online','2021-02-13','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ecclesia Online is a Hardcore MMORPG with Open World PvP and PvE combat. A medieval fantasy world to exploration and conquest. Non-target classless combat system, player-driven economy and challenging bosses. Inspired by Diablo 1, Tibia and Albion online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wa5.jpg'),(14072,'Logistics Simulator','2022-03-31','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Logistics Simulator As an active member of a shipping company in a major city around the world, you can play with up to 10 friends in a multiplayer co-op mode or single player mode to help you understand what the cargo workers are going through, and maybe will make you rich.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46mx.jpg'),(14073,'Embers Adrift','2022-10-15','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Join an MMORPG focused on group gameplay, challenge, and immersion - ignite your adventure in Embers Adrift.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4jm2.jpg'),(14074,'Shell\'s Redeemer','2020-09-22','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pqw.jpg'),(14075,'Iso Racer','2023-05-12','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Iso Racer is a top-down multiplayer racing game with a focus on realistic driving physics combined with drifting. It features a variety of circuits, cars, and the ability to personalize and upgrade vehicles. It\'s a great pick-up-and-play experience for both casual and hardcore racing fans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6eia.jpg'),(14076,'Boogey Hunters','2025-06-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Boogey Hunters is a strategic ammo-building game where you travel the world hunting mythical creatures from different folklore. Plan your moves carefully, combine bullets to unleash powerful moves, battle terrifying boogies, and save the world in the shortest day possible!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gg6.jpg'),(14077,'Zenith: The Last City','2022-01-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, Windows Mixed Reality, PlayStation VR, SteamVR, Oculus Rift, Oculus Quest','Fight, craft, explore, and lose yourself in a massively multiplayer world built for VR. Forge alliances and friendships in guilds and parties. Join epic raids and world events, and blaze your own path. How will you use your power?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ek2.jpg'),(14078,'Dream Arena','2017-06-29','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dream Arena is non-traditional Yume Nikki fangame in the arena fighter genre created for the 2017 Dream Diary Jam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wxg.jpg'),(14079,'Card City Nights 2','2017-11-09','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','\"IT\'S ALWAYS NIGHT IN SPACE\n\nJourney through a mysterious flying city called Starship Frivolity where every inhabitant is obsessed with the latest space-craze, The Card Game! Battle them to win their trust - and their cards! - and progress through the dubious laboratories, haunted docks and lethal restaurants of this space station to find out its greatest mysteries.\n\nThe Card Game (or TCG for short, the only card game they play in space) is played by two players on a single board. Connect your cards to give them power, and when they\'re all fired up they deal damage, heal, shield, or mess with your opponents cards. Since they stay on the board after they\'ve been activated, you can keep combos alive indefinitely by stringing new cards into the chain. Playing on the same board gives you opportunity to further mess with you opponents, blocking their moves or stealing their power!\n\nWith a renewed gameplay system, an all new adventure and online multiplayer, Card City Nights 2 improves on its predecessor in every way.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22v2.jpg'),(14080,'The Hunt for the Lost Ship','2024-02-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on your own treasure hunt in this beautifully designed classic point and click adventure game. Explore old trails, puzzles, and structures left behind by a castaway crew as you hunt for their lost pirate ship that was blown on to an island centuries ago.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7uwp.jpg'),(14081,'Shantae Advance: Risky Revolution','2025-04-21','Platform, Adventure','Game Boy Advance','The long-lost sequel to the original Shantae, is back in development after being put on the shelf for nearly two decades. Building off the original game code from the early 2000s, this once-canceled title will be completed and released physically on a Game Boy Advance-compatible game cartridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tln.jpg'),(14082,'Z speed Arcade','2024-06-25','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Z speed Arcade, The retro endless driving game inspired by early 90s racing game but combination with modern graphic which give higher resolution. Avoid the traffic, escape the cop, collect the boost and boost yourself into another car!!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g46.jpg'),(14083,'Second Puberty','2021-10-01','Music','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An album of seven short games about feelings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92sc.jpg'),(14084,'Miss Kobayashi\'s Dragon Maid Burst Forth!! Choro-gon Breath: Director\'s Cut','2022-10-26','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The official game of the hugely popular “Miss Kobayashi’s Dragon Maid” manga comes to Steam as a director’s cut that reflects the passion of the development team! Fly, shoot, and punch... send enemies flying right before your eyes!\n\nThe director\'s cut of Miss Kobayashi\'s Dragon Maid Burst Forth!! Choro-gon Breath contains additional personified illustrations of stage bosses specially drawn by original author coolkyousinnjya, adjusted difficulty for each stage, and select between normal mode and director’s cut mode in-game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p5b.jpg'),(14085,'Lunar Axe','2022-07-14','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','After a big earthquake in the city center, ruins of an old building collapse and you end up trapped inside an abandoned house. Find a way out and unravel the mystery of inexplicable tremors, revealing ancient secrets and a mystical artifact, before the city is destroyed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j0y.jpg'),(14086,'Potty Pigeon','1984-12-31','Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum','Percy The Potty Pigeon is a 1984 computer game developed by Shaun Hollingworth and released by Gremlin Graphics for the Commodore 64 and ZX Spectrum. The goal was to fly around and collect sticks to build your nest. The player could also deficate on cars, and make them crash.\nThis game marks the beginning of Ben Daglish as a composer, although all he did was write the notes for the death tune in the game, it is still this game that got him into composing game music for the Commodore 64. The Commodore 64 version was programmed by Anthony Crowther.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lkxsd40djdag5ngpqxs7.jpg'),(14087,'The Quizard\'s Domain',NULL,'Fighting, Platform, Quiz/Trivia, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Pub quiz meets pub brawl in this fast-paced, hero-based Battle Quiz!\nShow off your brains AND brawn with up to 4 players locally, in a fusion of classic trivia/quiz elements, social deduction games, and fast-paced 2D action brawlers.\nCrash, smash, and dash your way to the right answer, take a slower and more deceptive approach to fool your opponents, or forge completely new strategies across the varied playable characters and arenas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8njz.jpg'),(14088,'The Clotted Island','2010-07-31','Puzzle','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It\'s and indie, puzzle and abstract game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1x2x.jpg'),(14089,'GlitchGuesser',NULL,'Quiz/Trivia','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step back into the nostalgia of the early internet with GlitchGuesser, the ultimate party game that turns pixelated chaos into a thrilling guessing competition! As distorted, compressed images gradually become clear, it’s a race against time to figure out what you’re seeing. Can you guess before anyone else?\n\nWhether it’s a movie still, an anime character, a famous brand, or even custom creations, GlitchGuesser offers endless fun for players of all skill levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98u7.jpg'),(14090,'Disney\'s Magic Artist Deluxe','2001-12-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Disney\'s Magic Artist Deluxe is a Disney CD-ROM deluxe game version of Disney\'s Magic Artist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1w0o.jpg'),(14091,'Rain in the Month of January','2017-01-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take a walk in the rain and talk with the people about the weather.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27wv.jpg'),(14092,'Yamabiko ha Ojou-sama no Osoba ni','2018-08-17','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A doujin game by Nuu based on the Touhou Project series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7781.jpg'),(14093,'Ace Campus Club',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Receiving a call from your lawyer, and was informed that if you are capable of leading the campus‘s club to become the most popular ones, you will inherit a large sum of money. With the rare chance to finally stepping out, there will be money, and even girls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45rp.jpg'),(14094,'Pharaoh\'s Tomb','1990-12-14','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','Pharaoh\'s Tomb is an arcade-adventure game set in a huge Egyptian pyramid. Explore 20 uniquely-dangerous levels riddled with ingenious puzzles and traps. You start with five lives and a few spears, which can he thrown at offending denizens that patrol the pyramid. Pharaoh\'s Tomb consists of four unique volumes, which concludes with \"Nevada\'s Revenge.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25ep.jpg'),(14095,'Brett Hull Hockey','1994-02-01','Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','The Golden Brett returns to the SNES in the improved and updated BRETT HULL HOCKEY ’95. The second game in this series also features a full NHLPA license, so you’re sure to find your favorite players ready to hit the ice. Use every little trick in the book to get the job done: one-timers, fake shots, drop passes, and even dekes.\n\nThere are several gameplay options to satisfy any hockey fan: Full Season, Half Season, Playoffs, All-Star Game, and Exhibition. You make all the decisions in the course of a game, whether it’s shuffling your lines, pulling the goalie, or calling the offensive strategy. Choose wisely, because each option could mean the difference between glorious victory and bitter defeat. And with the stellar play-by-play of Al Michaels, you’ll forget that you’re not just watching a game on TV, you’re playing one!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yy3.jpg'),(14096,'Path of Exile: The Fall of Oriath','2017-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This is the next free update/expansion to the game Path of Exile.\nThis update will, among other improvements and additions, change the games main story and level progression. It will be changed from a 4 act story campaign being repeated over 3 difficulties to a single story campaign across 10 acts with new enemies and bosses in each area.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/akbxkxkbfmunhgdphzyo.jpg'),(14097,'Dwarf Looter','2024-02-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Delve into procedural underground, wielding quirky weapons and bizarre hats. Conquer rats, goblins, and demon lords, all while amassing treasures - but your limited inventory space WILL leads to tough choices. Beware your growing greed in this humor-infused fantasy roguelike challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w3w.jpg'),(14098,'Viking Days','2020-01-28','Sin género','PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows)','How long can you survive the Viking Days? The ultimate Viking simulator trains you until your beard can reach the floor. Be challenged by every day normal situations of a Viking! Inspired by games such as WarioWare and Job Simulator, interact with the environment and be a REAL VIKING!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5i0g.jpg'),(14099,'Genshin Impact: Vibrant Harriers Aloft in Spring Breeze','2024-01-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Version 4.4 of Genshin Impact, which includes:\n• New characters: Xianyun and Gaming\n• New area: Chenyu Vale\n• New story quest for Xianyun\n• New outfits for Xingqiu, Ganyu and Shenhe\n• New main event: Vibrant Harriers Aloft in Spring Breeze\n• New quality of life features\n• …and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nfz.jpg'),(14100,'Wushu Chronicles 2','2021-08-12','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wushu Chronicles 2 is a martial arts sandbox ARPG game. It is the orthodox sequel to Wushu Chronicles, using the latest self-developed engine flexi3.0, the picture effect is greatly improved. The game uses a seamless big map exploration mechanism, and you can write your arena freely.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59o4.jpg'),(14101,'The Silent Suite','2025-02-07','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You live in a hotel room. Everything seems normal—until a strange rumbling wakes you. Panic sets in as you realize you’re not alone. A killer is somewhere in the hotel… Trapped inside, you must navigate the eerie hallways, and find a way to escape… before it\'s too late.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dp9.jpg'),(14102,'Project Ascension','2016-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ascension is a Classless World of Warcraft Mod with over a million players since 2016. You can pick from any of the existing spells and talents from all classes, and play through the best WoW expansions: Vanilla, Burning Crusade and Wrath of the Lich King. This is World of Warcraft done your own way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kew.jpg'),(14103,'The Savage Hypnotist\'s Puppets','2022-08-25','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The girls are deprived of their freedom by hypnosis and their hearts are about to be shattered. Is it possible to escape from this daily life that has turned into hell?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nbm.jpg'),(14104,'Super Mario Bros. R','2019-01-05','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79t8.jpg'),(14105,'Medal City','1991-02-01','Sin género','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Medal City is a card game for the Sega Mega Drive, released exclusively in Japan in 1991 via the Sega Game Toshokan service. You choose between three gambling games; Poker, Blackjack, and Slots. The goal of each game (besides poker) is to earn over 100,000 medals. You will then see the game\'s ending (except poker, as the game never ends).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qhgndx7jqehlkovfvb4j.jpg'),(14106,'1630: The Thirty Years\' War',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','1630: The Thirty Years\' War is a thrilling and immersive real-time strategy game. Experience one of the most tumultuous periods in European history, using your strategic skills to navigate the complex political landscape of the time and making key decisions that will determine the war\'s outcome.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77n8.jpg'),(14107,'Envoy of Nezphere','2018-07-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A virtual-reality open-source rhythm game, Envoy of Nezphere welcomes everyone to feel the flow of the music by chopping the boxes alone the right direction.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14108,'Final Fantasy XV Mobile',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, iOS','A mobile MMORPG spin-off of Final Fantasy XV that will explore and add new areas.\n\nIt is planned as an alternative version of the original game starting as Noctis begins his journey, allowing them to expand on or alter parts of the story.\n\nIt is planned to release in China first, through the publisher Oriental Pearl, before being released globally.\nIt is being developed by JSC and GAEA.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ksn.jpg'),(14109,'The Last Plague: Blight','2024-10-03','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Last Plague: Blight is an extremely challenging and realistic single-player top-down perspective survival game.\n\nThe game takes place in a time long ago, just as a new disease called the Blight appears out of nowhere and begins enveloping the world. You escaped as it took over your village and now find yourself alone in the wilderness, tired and hungry.\n\nThe game is for players that are looking for an immersive survival game experience with a decent amount of realism and depth. All the while trying to manage the countless threats the wilderness and the Blight throws at you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50ne.jpg'),(14110,'Loot Goblins','2024-08-15','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into Loot Goblins, a chaotic realm of greed and gas. Snatch treasures before rivals do, but watch out for their tricks and gassy surprises! Experience an exhilarating frenzy like no other!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7w6w.jpg'),(14111,'Dodo Adventures','2020-08-14','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your holiday destination this year: Hamari Island. This non-violent VR adventure will give you a much-needed break from the reality. You can choose to explore a tropical island or fill tasks to further the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oon.jpg'),(14112,'Nantettatte Aki Shimai','2019-01-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A doujin game by Nuu based on the Touhou Project series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70qg.jpg'),(14113,'Folklands','2025-03-24','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Folklands is a grid-based, relaxing settlement builder with simulated citizens. Grow your settlement from humble beginnings to a bustling town. Harvest resources, manage food supply and make sure your folks are happy, employed and safe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7a2n.jpg'),(14114,'Dream Data','2020-06-26','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Today you start your new job doing data entry for Data Portal Inc. It\'s not the most exciting job, but it pays the bills. Each night, you go home, go to sleep, and have vivid dreams that let you escape your mundane life. However, sometimes the line between dreams and real life start to get a bit blurred. Will you work hard and keep your job, or will you get out of touch with reality?\n\nThe game was heavily inspired by Yume Nikki, and it was created for Dream Diary Jam 4. So like Yume Nikki, the game is mostly just about walking around and exploring dreams. However, there are a few significant changes in how this plays compared to Yume Nikki and most fan games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xg1.jpg'),(14115,'Danger Grid','2020-11-22','Adventure, Indie','iOS','Danger Grid takes you on an adventure through a retro futuristic universe of pixelated environments, low poly spaceships, killer robots, aliens, and glowing neon lights. Explore the grid, a large procedural universe of near infinite (ok, not really) dimensions, jumping through the Gateway to nearby worlds. Trade commodities, mine resources, and make a profit. Upgrade your shield and lasers and blast through the Danger Grid.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tbh.jpg'),(14116,'Mercenary Kings: Reloaded Edition','2018-02-06','Shooter, Platform, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In this frantic 2D action game, you are part of the Mercenary Kings, the most skilled team of warriors-for-hire on Earth, but when your comrades have fallen and the fearsome forces of CLAW have seized an island-wide top secret Laboratory Base, you must do what it takes to stop them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27m4.jpg'),(14117,'Shield of Shalwend','2020-03-14','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Join Shalwend, Brightblayde, and Danjirus as they attempt to defend a castle in Elf territory for 25 days. This story of bravery, adventure, and humor is based on true events that culminated in Shalwend being proclaimed as a Wargod. \n \nAs you kill wave after wave of elven drones, you will be rewarded higher standing in the pantheon of Norse gods. Though their numbers are great, you are armed with Shalwend’s lightning quick reflexes and tremendous strength. Time your attacks and unleash your rage using the power of the Wargods!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28ao.jpg'),(14118,'Missile Cards','2017-04-07','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"MISSILE CARDS is an intense turn-based defense card game inspired by the retro Atari classic Missile Command. Arm your defenses and blast away flaming death orbs, nuclear warheads, and other hazards hurtling down from space. High replay and lots of unlockables!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21d0.jpg'),(14119,'Down Ward','2019-11-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Venture into the haunted wilds with Gable, a little owl, as she sets out to rekindle the dormant relics of a land long abandoned to ruin.\n\nPuzzle, fight, and fly your way through the long lost gauntlets, and spectral denizens of the fearful Deep Wilds.\n\nFlying is a core feature of traversing the environment in Down Ward. The unique flight system allows unlimited airtime, but requires forward momentum and skillful maneuvering to maintain lift.\n\nLike the physics of real flight, as long as Gable is moving forward, she can gain lift.\nShe can stay in the air as long as she has the room to maneuver around obstacles and maintain forward airspeed.\n\nSpecters of the Deep Wilds abound, and obstacles, both puzzly and precisiony await!\n\nAll in-game graphics are composed of 4 colors, and there are many 4-color palettes to choose from.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24dv.jpg'),(14120,'Dragonborne','2021-01-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Game Boy','Get ready for a brand new adventure RPG on Game Boy, Indie Developer SpaceBot Interactive brings you the eagerly awaited Dragonborne.\n\nTravel through the region of Argon as Kris, in search of your missing father Kurtis, the greatest dragon slayer the region has ever known.\n\nDragonborne is made with GB Studio and features a turn based battle system, various mini quests and puzzles that you must complete to progress through the game.\n\nFight your way to each of the dragon caves to face your fears and overcome the challenges that stand in your way.\n\nAre you tough enough to find your father and save the region before the dragon\'s awake from their slumber?\n\n6-7 hours of gameplay, puzzles, dungeons, multiple enemies, various weapon and armour upgrades, character zapping system, ranking system dependent on how you finish the game, various collectibles, mini quests, multiple endings and much more!!​','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h2u.jpg'),(14121,'Curses of Tarot','2022-01-11','Puzzle, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Curses of Tarot is a single-player poker and Tarot themed deckbuilding card game with a variety of play modes, mini-games and challenges. Swap cards to create poker hands, plan your matches to clear each board, fortify your deck with glorious boons, break any curses inflicted upon you, and test your fate in a variety of special events!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bmh.jpg'),(14122,'30XX: Feline Fury','2024-09-19','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Suit up with Dally\'s mighty Catastrophe Armor and crush the competition! This DLC unlocks Dally for use in-game as a fully playable character a full suite of unique weapons.\n\nDally\'s 15 unique rapidfire Weapons restore NRG quickly for use with her versatile toolkit of 9 unique Powers while charging up toward one of her 8 new devastating Supers. Combined with her special Mod Bell upgrades, her arsenal is 30XX\'s most diverse toolkit yet!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w6q.jpg'),(14123,'Seed Pioneers',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v8r.jpg'),(14124,'Lonely Journey','2024-03-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a 2d side-scrolling game similar to (Ori and the Blind Forest) and (Hollow Knight), embark on an adventure in this fantasy land, collect key items, buy powerful equipment, gather pets to fight together, 100+ elves will participate in the battle, and 30+ costumes to help in the battle','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86la.jpg'),(14125,'BattleLore: Command','2015-03-31','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','BattleLore: Command is based on the board game BattleLore Second Edition from Fantasy Flight Games. Lead the noble Daqan army in a campaign against the demon-blooded Uthuk Y’llan or battle head-to-head against a friend or AI opponent in Multiplayer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m0f.jpg'),(14126,'Traveler\'s Game','2023-04-05','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are Camus Chen. Yesterday you received a video mail from your friend Lu. He thinks you have too few friends and recommends you a popular game:\n『This is a battle game but many people use it as a chat room』\nLu told you so.\n\nYou decided to join your friends in this game to meet new opponents and chat with them while playing against them. Lu wants you to chill.\n\nBut what you didn\'t expect is that some of your opponents will have a connection to your life in the future. One of them will even learn the great secret behind you and your friends...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gch.jpg'),(14127,'Kukoro: Stream Chat Games','2020-11-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kukoro: Stream chat games is a collection of +20 games, from 2D shooters to tactical RPG mini-games, with a high engage for your Twitch community. You and your audience will be able to play with you in real time receiving the individual relevance they deserve, growing your channel day by day.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91el.jpg'),(14128,'Colony','2016-11-29','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Colony is a space exploration game where you fly around trying to colonize planets, battle alien races, collect resources, and save the human race!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98tu.jpg'),(14129,'1+1=？','2025-03-05','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Let\'s do some easy math with the girls!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gie.jpg'),(14130,'Fap Nights At Frenni\'s Night Club',NULL,'Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fap Nights At Frenni\'s NightClub is a 3D freeroam FNAF parody NSFW game focused on a traditional harem story mode, similar to a graphic adventure or visual novel, as well as unlocking erotic scenes and collectibles, also the game have an arcade mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7u0q.jpg'),(14131,'Streets of Rage 4: Mr X. Nightmare','2021-07-15','Fighting, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Streets of Rage 4 is bringing Max Thunder back to the playable roster. The beat-’em-up’s downloadable content, Mr. X Nightmare, will transform Max from mind-controlled boss character to playable fighter. Includes 3 new playable characters, a new Survival mode with weekly challenges, character customization: build your own fighting style with new moves, and new weapons and enemies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47yu.jpg'),(14132,'Merchants & Mercenaries','2016-11-11','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Merchants and Mercenaries is a hectic real-time strategy that looks and feels like the board games you love, with none of the waiting. There’s no one way to play, or even to win, but you’d better be fast!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14133,'Hotline Miami 2: Wrong Number','2015-03-10','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hotline Miami 2: Wrong Number is the brutal conclusion to the Hotline Miami saga, set against a backdrop of escalating violence and retribution over spilled blood in the original game. Follow the paths of several distinct factions – each with their own questionable methods and uncertain motivations – as unforeseen consequences intersect and reality once again slips back into a brilliant haze of neon and bloodshed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wf6.jpg'),(14134,'Atriage','2016-04-07','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Atriage, a turn-based strategy game inspired by Sci-fi space naval battles in 80s Anime where you command a fleet of ten warships against a rival commander. Master four different ship classes, each with their own strengths, weaknesses, and roles in combat in an all-out battle for supremacy.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14135,'Siberian Way','2025-03-04','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Siberian Way is a historical detective thriller. Follow the dark non-linear story and decide how it can end! For all fans of snowy Siberia, Murder on the Orient Express and twisted plots, seasoned with mysticism.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gbr.jpg'),(14136,'Seed of Nostalgia',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Seed of Nostalgia is a beautiful pixel art JRPG which follows the tale of Atilla and a cast of intriguing characters on a quest to save their dying world. Explore a mystical land, unravel dark secrets, and confront ancient forces in a tale of magic, sacrifice, and unexpected revelations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ih4.jpg'),(14137,'Halloween Chronicles: Evil Behind a Mask - Collector\'s Edition','2019-10-25','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A trio of masks could bring about an era of nightmares!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a52.jpg'),(14138,'Malone In Nightmares',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Malone is not a brave boy, and there is always a strange, mysterious monster lurking in the shadow of his nightmares. Tonight, Malone will have to face his nightmare. Enter the world of Malone and step into a 2D platform adventure born in the mind of a little boy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3muc.jpg'),(14139,'The Symbiant','2023-02-02','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Symbiant is a BL / Yaoi / Gay visual novel about two men, both from vastly different worlds, embracing their sexuality and their newfound romance. It is also a tale of interstellar friendship and being gay in space!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79e4.jpg'),(14140,'Find All','2021-06-03','Point-and-click, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A game to find cute cats, raccoons and dogs in the city. Find all the hidden objects in a small black and white city by coloring it along the way. Game for all ages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8aif.jpg'),(14141,'After Fright','2022-12-31','Point-and-click, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Discover what happened after the fire','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84m6.jpg'),(14142,'Towards the Sky','2021-03-23','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Towards the Sky is a relaxing 3D platformer with a simplistic and colourful design, fun game mechancis, and an interesting, randomly generated level layout. No playthrough will ever be the same, and it is up to the player how they choose to reach the top.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ved.jpg'),(14143,'Lunar Flight','2012-01-15','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore the most realistic and beautiful realtime simulation of \'Lunar Flight\' in this unique and challenging game. Experience the heart pounding sense of dread as you deliver supplies to moon bases with only seconds of fuel to spare!\n\nA modern take on the classic arcade game, Lunar Lander, Lunar Flight extends the experience to a fully fictionalized and accessible lunar module simulator providing a variety of mission types involving transporting cargo, acquiring data at survey locations and locating lost cargo.\n\nCompleting missions earns experience points and money to be used to refuel, repair and upgrade the lunar module. In addition to missions there are time trial challenges complete with online leader boards and a globally ranked ‘pilots’ leader board, ranked by experience. To round out the game there are a variety of achievements to provide additional challenges and objectives.\n\nWhen you think you\'ve got what it takes, head online and go head to head in deadly combat against the best pilots in the world in Lunar Flights Multiplayer mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gwp.jpg'),(14144,'Draw & Guess','2021-03-12','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Draw & Guess is a casual drawing game for 4-16 people! Each player receives a word and draws it. The next player guesses the word behind the drawing. Then another one draws it again and so on! If the first word is correctly guessed by the last player, that\'s a trophy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sv1.jpg'),(14145,'Jane\'s Advance Strike Fighters','2011-09-02','Sin género','Xbox 360','Jane\'s Advanced Strike Fighters is set in the fictional country of Azbaristan; the once-great great nation has been torn apart by a decade of civil war, followed by almost a decade of uneasy peace.The ten-year war resulted in huge territorial gains for Northern People\'s Republic Azbaristan and their controlling political party, the Northern People\'s Party, giving them control of all of the country except for the oil-rich province that is all that is left of South Azbaristan.The Southern Azbaristan Democratic Front of South Azbaristan has only managed to hold of the North with the aid of the West, which supplies military and logistical aid to the tiny state in return for the oil exports from their vast reserves. You will have the chance to assume the role of squadron leader Razor and lead fight to reunify Azbaristan and protect the West\'s vital interests.Jane\'s Advanced Strike Fighters is an intense modern flight action sim featuring an epic 16 mission story gaming experience that will take air combat to the next level with engaging enemies, flight battles, expansive battlefields and 30 authentic licensed fighters.Intense Expansive Multiplayer - 16 player multiplayer combat to continue the action and theatre of war online. Also included is full campaign co-op play that accommodates 2-4 players','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14146,'Where the Bees Make Honey','2019-10-17','Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Where the Bees Make Honey tells a story about reflecting on different moments from your childhood, which are played and experienced from an adult perspective. At its core Where The Bees Make Honey is a puzzle adventure game, but gameplay variation is filtered throughout.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2492.jpg'),(14147,'Onimusha: Dawn of Dreams','2006-03-08','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 2','Onimusha: Dawn of Dreams is the sixth installment of Capcom\'s Onimusha overall series, while being the fourth game in the canonical main series. While game retains the action elements from previous Onimusha, it offers a more varied amount of weapons as well as the option of going back to previous stage to unlock new content. The game also introduces a 3D camera as well as the ability to continuously fight alongside AI controlled characters who move depending on the player\'s orders. Dawn of Dreams was announced by Capcom due to high fan demand and several Capcom members realizing they could expand the action elements from Onimusha after working in Shadow of Rome. The game was designed in order to appeal to skilled gamers rather than the general market which resulted in appealing designs rather than realistic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4r14.jpg'),(14148,'Waste Life 1','2022-09-28','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take the game at your pace with no story, no levels, no nerve-racking effects, and no sound effects. Experience the fun of consumption of Yang life, of course, this game ball speed is extremely fast, extremely difficult, normal conditions can reach a full 256 is not easy','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fi2.jpg'),(14149,'Laser Attraction','2021-03-17','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play with lasers and solve puzzles in Laser Attraction. Use reflection, refraction, dispersion and filtration to direct the laser beams, mix and separate colours, open doors, hit targets and complete puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vf0.jpg'),(14150,'Titanic: A Space Between','2024-02-14','Sin género','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3','Titanic: A Space Between is a time-travel horror virtual reality adventure where players get sent back to the RMS Titanic. With a focus on realism and immersion, this multi-layered horror experience provides an extensive mix of puzzles and escape mechanics interwoven in a riveting story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7skc.jpg'),(14151,'Bird Shooter','2022-12-30','Tactical, Adventure, Arcade','Android','Shoot birds, earn money and advance to next level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xzy.jpg'),(14152,'Black Crystals',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Sin plataforma','A hand drawn RPG about a human trafficked boy trying to find home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mbm.jpg'),(14153,'Gam3rAbduction',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Game Made by Gam3rBoy57. Its about a Controller which gets chased by UFOs that try to abduct it.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14154,'Kirby in Sonic the Hedgehog 2','2015-10-25','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Kirby in Sonic the Hedgehog 2 features Kirby and Waddle Dee as the lead protagonists to defeat Dr. Robotnik. Kirby can inhale monitors and most enemies but cannot copy their abilities, Waddle Dee has no unique moves. Life counter function as Health points and the only way to obtain Health is grabbing every 50+ Rings, Lampposts, Randomized 1Up Monitors, or Score every 50000+ points. The hack also contains 4 Difficulty modes. Hidden Palace is restored and fully playable as a 1 Act Zone for Kirby, located somewhere in Mystic Cave Act 2','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qj1.jpg'),(14155,'Rebop Blasters','2019-04-19','Fighting, Music','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rebop Blasters is an overpowered platform brawler with destructible terrain and a jazz soundtrack created by the players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29ov.jpg'),(14156,'Polychromatic','2015-10-02','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Polychromatic is a physics-based arcade shooter with a pop of color.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vhd.jpg'),(14157,'Warfare 1944','2020-07-07','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warfare 1944 is a World War II tactical shooter similar to games such as Red Orchestra, Forgotten Hope, and Battlefield 1942. The game is developed by the community development studio Drakeling Labs, and is currently in early access.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lee.jpg'),(14158,'Slender Man: Rise Again','2013-12-13','Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','This is a brand new Slender Man game that will scare all the fans out there.\nIt almost feels as if you really walking in the fog and being hunted by Slender.\nThe atmosphere is scary.\n\nThere are two large levels to play on:\n\"Field\" and \"Village\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93rg.jpg'),(14159,'All-Star Slammin\' D-Ball','2001-10-25','Sport','PlayStation','The first dodge ball game released on the PlayStation, All-Star Slammin\' D-Ball features a horizontal view of the court as eight teams compete in one of two modes: Single Match and Tournament. Teams are individually rated from one to five in throwing, catching, dashing, and dodging abilities. Offbeat male and female characters of varying skill play for the Wild Cats, Pranksters, Heart Breakers, Ninjas, Snipers, Fireballs, Thunder Bolts, and Elementals.\n\nThe game follows the general rules of dodge ball, in that the object is to knock out the opposing members of a team within a time limit. Players with the ball can aim right, left, high, or low. Thrown balls can be caught by the opposing team, which awards them points. These points can then be used to implement special throws such as the grenade, boomerang, and the screwdriver, making the balls more difficult to avoid or catch. Options include adjustable time limits for Single Matches and three levels of difficulty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nbdpetpzhfmr8dslslqo.jpg'),(14160,'Gori: Cuddly Carnage - Change Skin Pack','2024-08-29','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Thank you for supporting Gori! Please enjoy this free Skin Pack for Gori: Cuddly Carnage that adds :\n\n- A slick new outfit For Gori\n- New effects for Gori’s shield.\n\nDownload today and slay the Adorable Army in style!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tq5.jpg'),(14161,'Tiny Metal: Full Metal Rumble','2019-07-10','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Welcome back to the world of TINY METAL, Commander!\n\nTINY METAL: FULL METAL RUMBLE puts you in the boots of three unique commanders bonded by fate, each with their own squads to command and strengthen up on their quest to put an end to a new mysterious, rising threat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mif.jpg'),(14162,'Damn virgins','2015-07-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Seven virgins will be sacrified unless you help them! Just to clarify, your help is only needed to avoid the sacrifice, solving their virginity problem is a bit more complicated as you will discover. FMV adventure inspired in classic adventure games. Solving puzzles usually unlocks a videoclip that reveals the plot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xwp.jpg'),(14163,'Rocket League: Season 6','2022-03-09','Racing, Sport, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to the animated world of Rocket League! Season 6 is going off the rails with the addition of an animation-themed rocket pass, a new Neo Tokyo (comic) variant arena, and zany tournament rewards!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4osc.jpg'),(14164,'Acephalus','2018-05-11','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Assemble the commodity-chain for a rare mushroom in this attempt at a post-structuralist puzzle game. Based on Anna Tsing\'s The Mushroom at the End of the World: On the Possibility of Life in Capitalist Ruins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hde.jpg'),(14165,'Army General','2017-04-26','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Army General is a turnbased strategy game that depicts the desert warfare in Northern Afrika and parts of the Mediterranean sea during World War II.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23ns.jpg'),(14166,'The Guise','2020-10-20','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dark-fantasy metroidvania, where you turned into a monster with weird abilities like walking on the ceiling, acid spits and bile bombs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wn8.jpg'),(14167,'Trick\'N Snowboarder','1999-10-19','Sport','PlayStation','With a fresh dusting of new powder on the mountain, lock on your board and head down the slope for an incredible downhill experience. Feel the speed and the icy wind on your face as you carve through killer courses and obstacles. Trick\'n Snowboarder is a shred-fest of sheer speed and air-catching tricks. Race across the world on 10 international courses in 4 different modes of play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p4z.jpg'),(14168,'GoBlock\'s Impossible Medley','2017-04-14','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','GoBlock\'s Impossible Medley is the most impossible and frustrating yet addictive game that you ever play. The game combines three challenging gameplay in one impossible game. You will jump, fly and roll in a loop throughout the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co217d.jpg'),(14169,'Heroine\'s Claw','2024-01-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An Indie horror game about the loss of loved ones. The Carter family flee from their home country to an island that they inherited from their late family members to escape the horrors of World War One. They soon find out, however, that their family is being used for a much more sinister reason...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b1d.jpg'),(14170,'Match Kill Survive','2024-09-02','Puzzle','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','An intense blend of match-3 puzzle action and combat in Match Kill Survive. Your mission: survive relentless waves of zombies by matching tiles to generate ammunition for your squad. Each color you match powers up a specific squad member, allowing them to unleash devastating attacks on the undead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8o74.jpg'),(14171,'Race the Sun: Challenge Edition','2019-06-21','Racing','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','You are a solar-powered craft. The sun is your death timer. Hurtle towards the sunset at breakneck speed in a futile race against time. Delay the inevitable by catching speed boosts which reverse the setting sun - if only for a moment. Race The Sun: Daily Challenge Edition is inspired by arcade games of the past with a focus on high scores, short game sessions, and pure fun mingled with nerve-wracking tension. The rules are simple: don\'t crash, stay in the light, and don\'t slow down!\n\nThis new edition of the game includes several new features including new alternate ships, colorful new trails, and a new \"daily challenge\" system that will test the skills of even the most experienced players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20j9.jpg'),(14172,'Pink River','2020-07-12','Platform, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Pink River is a game about a raft, that you can\'t steer.  \nYou have to rebuild it as you go.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t0o.jpg'),(14173,'NationWar: Annals','2020-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a grand strategy + real-time battle sandbox game with the theme of Spring and Autumn and Warring States. The game starts on the land of China in the eighth century BC. Players will act as one of the countries and start a long battle for hegemony with other countries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gy8.jpg'),(14174,'Pawsitive','2024-05-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Pawsitive is a healthy adventure RPG that lets you turn your healthy habits into energy for a virtual puppy. A mix between retro Tamagotchi pet games and modern health tracking, Pawsitive helps gamers reclaim their health with fun quests and healthy prizes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84ai.jpg'),(14175,'The Legend of The Duck Knite',NULL,'Platform, Strategy','Android, iOS','The Duck Knite is a hero that just fights. He does not care about what monsters he fights just want to take them down. This platformer is old school with new school graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1kry.jpg'),(14176,'Infected: The Twin Vaccine Collector\'s Edition','2012-06-24','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Search for a missing girl who holds the key to stopping a global epidemic in Infected: The Twin Vaccine! A new breed of virus has spread throughout the City of Oxford forcing the area to be quarantined. The first reported case of the virus was found in 6 year old twin sisters Tiffany & Theresa Morrisey. Tiffany never survived the infection but Theresa made a full recovery and is now believed to be the key to finding a cure. In the chaos of a city-wide evacuation, Theresa has gone missing. You must travel back to the abandoned city of Oxford to find her before the virus spreads globally. Though be wary...you’re not the only one back in town.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86d6.jpg'),(14177,'Winds of Arcana: Ruination','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Winds of Arcana: Ruination is a 2.5D Metroidvania featuring a customizable combat system set in the treacherous and magical world of Lirna. Experience a powerful, lore-rich story as you discover ancient magic, upgrade your abilities, and battle dangerous foes that stand in your way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d7d.jpg'),(14178,'Minion Quest: The Search for Bowser','2017-10-05','Strategy','Nintendo 3DS','This adventure, included in Mario & Luigi: Superstar Saga + Bowser\'s Minions, develops alongside and with the main Mario Bros. story. It involves Bowser\'s minions battling the enemies of the Beanbean Kingdom to rescue Bowser, after he is knocked out from the Beanbean Border, led by Captain Goomba.\n\nThe game needs to be unlocked during the plot of Superstar Saga, being available within the Superstar Saga menu screen and new episodes are unlocked according to the player\'s progression through the main quest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85i9.jpg'),(14179,'Bekkouame','2018-04-11','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short, 2-4 hour, free-to-play Horror game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/i9x83kw4dbpr3ivsaexc.jpg'),(14180,'Midnight Tales Vol.3: Christmas','2022-12-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the middle of Christmas, a man tells some horror stories to his daughter... but something is very wrong...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lmr.jpg'),(14181,'Euro Truck Simulator 2: Beyond the Baltic Sea','2018-11-29','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Beyond the Baltic Sea DLC brings to Euro Truck Simulator 2 the countries of Lithuania, Latvia and Estonia, parts of western Russia, and the south of Finland.\n\nDozens of new cities, towns, ports and villages, new industries, thousands of kilometers of roads await. You’ll drive through vast swathes of low lying, verdant landscape, dotted with relics of past ages, as well as stark reminders of the great upheaval of the last century. For the first time you will drive into Russia and visit the great northern metropolis of Saint Petersburg. Going further, you will enter populous and industrially rich regions of Finland, where you can enjoy the unique experience of driving efficient High Capacity Transports.\n\nYou’ll meander your way around lakes and rivers, and forests of pine and birch will often close upon you as you journey through these countries of quiet, subdued beauty. Welcome to the lands beyond the Baltic Sea!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mnj.jpg'),(14182,'Asterix and the Great Rescue','1994-09-01','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Sega Game Gear, Sega Master System/Mark III','It is 50 B.C., and the entire Gaul (today\'s France) is conquered by the Romans. Only one village still remains independent, thanks to the incredible powers of its two great warriors, Asterix and Obelix. In the game, they must first of all liberate the village Orvio and rescue their friend Dogmatix.\n\nThe player can play as either Asterix or Obelix. They make their way through platform levels, fighting enemies by punching them, and jumping to access higher ares or to avoid falling down. There are also some items that the player can collect, such as bombs, with which the player can overcome obstacles and advance in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ebr.jpg'),(14183,'Secrets of Salem: Shadow of the Witch - Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A hidden object puzzle adventure. Uncover Salem\'s dark secrets as Dakota battles shadows and her fate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p8f.jpg'),(14184,'Fisher Idle','2025-03-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Start from scratch in the middle of the ocean as a fisherman! Buy bigger boats, upgrade your ships, and build your fishing empire. Remember: more fish means more gold!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gix.jpg'),(14185,'Crystal Caves','2014-08-07','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','Enter an underground world of treasures and traps in Crystal Caves, a colorful EGA game that rivals any commercial game with its arcade quality, puzzles and graphics. As Mylo Steamwitz, enter cave after cave of adventure, gathering teasures and evading countless hazards.\n\nCrystal Caves is a mixing of Nintendo\'s Mario Brothers, Commander Keen, and Indiana Jones. As with all Apogee games, a high priority has been placed on solving ingenious puzzles built into the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ptx.jpg'),(14186,'Grover\'s Travels','1998-12-31','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grover\'s Travels is a 1998 CD-ROM game developed by Encore Software and Children\'s Television Workshop. In this parody of Gulliver\'s Travels, users join Grover as he meets Big Bird, Elmo, Mr. Snuffleupagus and more. There are six activities designed to teach numbers, shapes, sound recognition, story comprehension and emotions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gj3.jpg'),(14187,'Open Roads','2024-03-28','Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Long-lost family secrets. Hints of a hidden fortune. And miles to go before they sleep. Tess Devine’s relationship with her mom has never been easy, but they’re about to set out together on a journey into the past that they’ll never forget.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mfw.jpg'),(14188,'Parallel Shift','2021-02-15','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Parallel Shift is a Pixel Art Platformer Runner game where you take control of King and Tess, two scientists stuck in a dimensional loop. Switch between dimensions, close the matching breaches and rewind time to escape the unknown. \n \nInspired by late 90\'s videogames, the pixel art, the dark synthwave music and retro vibes of Parallel Shift focus on delivering an experience of rush and urgency, while presents a narrative focused in the solitude of the chase of knowledge and discovery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2stl.jpg'),(14189,'Nintendo World Cup','1990-12-31','Sport','Arcade, Nintendo Entertainment System','The eyes of the world are upon you. National pride is at stake. Only seconds left and the crowd rises in anticipation of the greatest upset in soccer history. The horn sounds and you\'ve won it all! The coveted world cup trophy is yours! Pick your team and plan your game strategy. Use advanced super moves like the Bicycle Kick or the Super Header. Choose from 13 teams, representing countries from around the world. Defeat your opponents and you\'re on your way to the prestigious world cup final. Bring the excitement of international soccer home with Nintendo World Cup!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6iwl.jpg'),(14190,'Boxed In',NULL,'Puzzle, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Help guide a box-pushing, puzzle-solving robot through hundreds of handcrafted puzzles, or create and share your own!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4buf.jpg'),(14191,'Sierra Ops: Episode 2 - Dissonance and Resonance','2021-06-21','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','With the front lines inching ever closer to Earth after the devastating battle at Mondshire, Junius must come to terms with his new role, and with those who he must now fight beside as mixed opinions about his promotions arise. Given the freedom to choose his assignments, the newly minted Captain and Squadron Leader is faced with the dilemma of having too little time to accomplish too much in a post befitting of someone far more experienced. As one of the few elites chosen for the reborn, 1st fleet of old, Junius must fight to meet the expectation of those all around him and earn the respect of his crew while struggling to do his duty and what he believes is right.\nWill he able to rally his crew to action?\nWill the United Terran Vanguard be able to put itself back together before it’s too late?\nIs it possible to wage a just war?\n\nSierra Ops Episode 2: Dissonance and Resonance is part two of a four-part series where both decisions made and performance in combat change the power balance of the two armed forces.\nIs it even possible to end this war without losing everything?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3doe.jpg'),(14192,'City of Murals','2023-08-16','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','City of Murals is a cute and gross, action-platformer, rogue-lite. Explore a colorful world with violent and non-violent guns, special traversal abilities, and creatures that range from friendly to deadly. The world is competing to see who can live the longest. How long will you survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cqv.jpg'),(14193,'MoriArashi','2022-05-31','Puzzle','iOS','Aim for the goal using many many characters in this 2D physics based game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xb9.jpg'),(14194,'Memories Off: Innocent Fille','2018-12-31','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Latest entry in the Memories Off series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27m3.jpg'),(14195,'Love Escalator','1998-04-17','Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series','The third high school year is about to begin, and Takashi Kurosaki decides that it should be a memorable year - at least from the point of view of romantic adventures. His best friend asks Takashi to help him win the heart of Rie, a girl whom Takashi liked in junior high school but hasn\'t seen much since. However, when Takashi meets Rie, he begins to realize that he may have feelings for her, and is torn between friendship and romance.\n\nLove Escalator is a visual novel with light dating simulation elements. Most of the game consists of anime-style pictures accompanied by text. The game is divided into days; every day, the player can choose dating activities for the protagonist. There are three main heroines, and the player can choose which one to take on a date. Depending on the concrete choice of activities, the girl\'s fondness of the protagonist will increase or decrease. It is possible to go to cinema, art gallery, bar, or a \"love hotel\", where the girl may agree to have sex with the protagonist if she likes him well enough. Most of the explicit sex scenes offer additional menu-based interactivity (choice of sexual positions) and are animated.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vf6.jpg'),(14196,'Advent Rising','2005-05-31','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Advent Rising is a story driven science fiction third person action adventure game developed by GlyphX Games. Written by author Orson Scott Card and published by Majesco Entertainment. Advent Rising started as a trilogy, but due to poor critical reception and poor sells the sequels were cancelled.  There was a PSP title in the works called \"Advent Shadow\" that was also cancelled. Due to an epic story and fun gameplay, Advent Rising has acquired a cult following and is considered and underrated classic by fans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l5x.jpg'),(14197,'Bay Breaker','2025-02-21','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Use your boat\'s new technology to launch ultra-springy balls,\ncapable of shattering even the toughest rocks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gs2.jpg'),(14198,'Rescue Team: Mineral of Miracles','2023-09-01','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The extraordinary discovery of a mineral named \"Immortalite\" has sent shockwaves across the globe. Now you are tasked with uncovering the secrets of this powerful mineral and ensuring it doesn\'t fall into the wrong hands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i9s.jpg'),(14199,'3D Turbo OutRun','2015-03-11','Racing, Arcade','Nintendo 3DS','A 3D Classics port of Turbo OutRun only released inside the Sega 3D Fukkoku Archives 3: Final Stage compilation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uhp.jpg'),(14200,'The Impossible Quiz Book','2009-08-14','Quiz/Trivia','Web browser','The third and final installment of the Impossible Quiz series. Help Chris the cat decipher the mysteries of the Impossible Quiz Book by answering its collection of silly and non-nonsensical questions.\n\nThe game is broken into 3 different chapters, the first being regularly themed, the second being themed around space and video games, and the third being focused around time travel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xi7.jpg'),(14201,'Defense of Nations',NULL,'Shooter, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A base defense shooter in the vein of flash game classics like \"Elona Shooter\" and \"Defend Your Castle\" but with a satirical, political-sim twist. Shoot hordes of monsters, negotiate your operating budget, and navigate international rivalries, all for The Good of Humanity️!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74yq.jpg'),(14202,'Madden NFL 2000','1999-08-31','Sport','Nintendo 64, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation','Madden NFL 2000 is a football video game. The Green Bay Packers had the best team overall in the game with a score of 94. The worst team in the game was the Cleveland Browns with a score of 68. The best offense in the game belongs to the Denver Broncos with a score of 97. The best defense in the game belongs to the Miami Dolphins with a score of 96. The best special teams in the game belongs to both the Buffalo Bills and Atlanta Falcons with a score of 97.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54us.jpg'),(14203,'Virtual Succubus','2020-05-03','Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Virtual Succubus is a procedural, AI-driven JOI game that\'s all about becoming a succubus\' personal play-toy. Enter a contract with your very own succubus, offering her complete control over your urges. She\'ll learn about you, and decide what you need to do to earn your release.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qra.jpg'),(14204,'Zabula\'s Quest','2018-07-03','Platform, Indie','Android','Find the sensations of an old-fashioned platform game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ucg.jpg'),(14205,'Hogs of War','2013-03-19','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Hogs of War is a turn-based tactics game where players take turns controlling individual members of their squad of hogs to engage in combat with the opposition, similar to Worms. Each turn, a player takes control of a single squad member in a third-person perspective to move around the map, including jumping over terrain and swimming over bodies of water, yet can only engage in combat when stationary. Each turn has a set time limit and ends if the timer counts down to zero, the player skips their turn, a weapon or ability is used or if they have accidentally injured themselves such as walking into a mine field or falling from a high surface. Other hazards include bodies of water that, while they can be swam in, is damaging to nearly all types of soldiers and drains health as they swim. If a teammate is knocked into water by an opponent, they will automatically swim to the nearby shore line. While difficult, it is also possible to knock hogs off the map resulting in instant death. If all health is gone and the player is on land, they will fall over with a last comical remark before exploding.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hul.jpg'),(14206,'The Addams Family: Mansion Mayhem','2021-09-24','Platform, Adventure','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Only you and your friends can help Wednesday, Pugsley, Gomez, and Morticia save the Addams Family Mansion in this horrifyingly hilarious 3D adventure for up to four players. The mansion is full of spooky scares – but can you discover its hair-raising secrets and save it from an unexpected threat? Use each iconic character\'s abilities to explore the house, solve puzzles, and find lost relics. Play competitive minigames that will have you bumping and jumping over each other to win.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31cn.jpg'),(14207,'Stress Ball','2025-04-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience the blend of fun and challenge with Stress Ball! In this 3D ball game, your character bounces through platforms toward the goal. As levels intensify, and a dark theme adds depth to the atmosphere, immerse yourself in the thrill of overcoming increasingly difficult obstacles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7q2g.jpg'),(14208,'The Mikado Birdgirl in Taichung','2021-01-22','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wang Cheng-En escaped the Miaoli emperor\'s clutches with Pisuka. This time, they follow Mika to a holy city Taichung State. What awaits him? Will he eat lead, end up being buried as a bloated corpse in a ditch in the middle of Taiwan, or lead an ordinary daily life together with young girls?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2omo.jpg'),(14209,'Back to Medieval Village','2016-10-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jww.jpg'),(14210,'Hogwarts Legacy: Deluxe Edition','2023-07-25','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This edition comes with the Dark Arts cosmetic set and Thestral mount, as well as the Dark Arts battle arena and 72 hour early access to the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lbo.jpg'),(14211,'KMON: Genesis','2022-11-16','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Unleash your inner strategist in the ultimate turn-based RPG. Train, nurture, and evolve your Kryptomons to become the best trainer in the KMON Universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6or1.jpg'),(14212,'Age of Fear 3: The Legend','2017-09-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Age of Fear 3 gameplay sets itself apart from other tactical combat games thanks to its incredibly deep combat system, perfected over the last five years and based on community feedback.\n\nEvery hero and type of unit have its own skills tree, which is also very customizable as they level up. With close to 200 unique units and over 250 different spells and skills, no two players will have the same army and experience.\n\nAI system is one of the most advanced in the genre, making every battle a real tactical challenge where you have to be smart, cunning and bold to achieve victory – and a well-deserved “Congratulations on completing the game!” after reaching one of its multiple endings.\n\nTwo campaigns offer completely different stories and gameplay experiences – from the magic-driven forces of the dryad Nairi to Girlock’s strong (and usually drunk) dwarven warriors – as well as branching storylines and some dark humor!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29ek.jpg'),(14213,'War Thunder: Somua SM Pack','2020-09-02','Shooter','Xbox One','This pack includes:\n\nSomua SM (Rank 5 France);\n1000 Golden Eagles;\nPremium account for 7 days.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kxt.jpg'),(14214,'Low Batt','2024-07-18','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the thrilling world of Low Batt, a heart-pounding Top Down Shooter that pits you against the formidable security forces of L.E.A.D. Industries. Navigate through intense challenges requiring a blend of skill and strength and embark on an epic robotic adventure to rescue your robo-dog.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8r7h.jpg'),(14215,'Incubus: A ghost-hunters tale','2023-09-09','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are on your first solo ghost hunt, under the watchful instructions of Bear and Jen from the O.P.G paranormal team. Use real gadgets in a real location, a house investigated by the developers on the request of three different owners. It is a case worthy of a video game, so welcome to Incubus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co736n.jpg'),(14216,'A Totally Realistic Stealth Game',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Become a stealth soldier fighting through enemy lines using whatever methods you see fit to stay undetected in this first-person shooter. Take a slow, methodical approach or go guns-blazing; as long as you remain undiscovered anything is possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kit.jpg'),(14217,'Dragon\'s Lair 3D: Return to the Lair','2002-11-18','Platform, Adventure','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Dragon\'s Lair 3D: Return to the Lair is an action-adventure video game released in 2002 by Dragonstone Software. The game is based on Cinematronics\' 1983 laserdisc arcade game Dragon\'s Lair, and follows a similar story; the hero, Dirk the Daring, must enter the evil wizard Mordroc\'s castle to rescue Princess Daphne from Singe the dragon. Many of the characters and locations from the 1983 original make appearances in the game, along with new puzzles, rooms and enemies. Animator and director Don Bluth, who produced the cartoon animation for the arcade original, also produced two new animated sequences for the opening and ending of the game. The game uses cel shading to mimic the distinctive style of the original.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22p7.jpg'),(14218,'Train Fever','2014-09-04','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Train Fever is a railroad-focused business simulation game. In other words, it\'s a modern-day Transport Tycoon with procedural content and a sophisticated city simulation.\nIt\'s the year 1850, and there are great times ahead! Establish a transport company and be its manager. Build infrastructure such as railways and stations, purchase transportation vehicles and manage lines. Fulfill the people\'s needs and watch cities evolve dynamically.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rqe.jpg'),(14219,'Dead Trigger 2','2013-10-23','Shooter, Adventure','Android, iOS','Dead Trigger 2 is constantly evolving and expanding. Every update features new content intended to make your game even more enjoyable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pvd.jpg'),(14220,'C.Y.S.M.A.','2020-01-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','C.Y.S.M.A. is a third-person action about a man lost in the maze. You will die. Not just eventually, but it keeps happening often. And after every death.. it will happen again...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lnt.jpg'),(14221,'Aim XR','2020-09-20','Shooter, Indie','Oculus VR','Aim XR is a 5v5 fast-paced multiplayer shooter. Play online with people, or play offline against bots. You can also host a LAN server, and play with users on the same WiFi network.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w15.jpg'),(14222,'Koikatsu Party','2019-06-10','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Creating your own adorable anime character is a cinch! Use a robust suite of intuitive and precise tools to customize a character from the ground up, give her one of 30 different personality archetypes, and then get busy with a host of romantic options. Bring your dream waifu to laifu!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2f82.jpg'),(14223,'Resistance Element','2019-05-27','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Resistance Element is a short, single player mod set in the Half-Life universe, tasking the player to overcome obstacles and help the resistance in their fight against the Combine. Adventure through an off world Combine prison, city streets, a rebel base, and beyond while fighting Combine, antlions, headcrabs, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5b3q.jpg'),(14224,'Siege - the card game','2016-09-22','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Siege is a strategic single-player card game about sieging castles with armies and magic set in the bizarre setting of Circus Empire.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14225,'Guardian Force: Saturn Tribute','2022-02-09','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The Guardians, a secret society wielding the power of the Force, have readied their tanks and intend on crushing the aspirations of the Hammerbolt Empire! This is an auto-scrolling, multidirectional shooting game released by SUCCESS in 1998. This masterpiece of the past is given new life using the specially-developed \"Zebra Engine.\" The new features included such as game rewind, slow mode, and quick save greatly improve ease of play. Online rankings have also been added!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hcj.jpg'),(14226,'DCS World: Spitfire Beware! Beware! Campaign by Reflected Simulations','2022-06-24','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','During the winter of 1942-43, the air battle raging in the skies over Europe was at its fiercest. The Focke Wulfs and Messerschmitts flown by the Luftwaffe’s ’experten’ proved to be more than a worthy foe for the RAF’s new Spitfire Mk.IX-s. The air supremacy of the Allies was still just a distant dream. In the thickest of this battle stood the Biggin Hill Wing with 611 (West Lancashire) and 340 (Ile de France) Squadrons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95bw.jpg'),(14227,'Anthony the Monk','2025-02-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Anthony the Monk is a classic 2D platformer combat game. Your only weapon is a Staff to use against demonic entities across the dangerous wilderness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m1j.jpg'),(14228,'Super Street Fighter IV: 3D Edition','2011-03-31','Fighting','Nintendo 3DS','The ultimate version of Street Fighter makes its seamless transition to the Nintendo 3DS with Super Street Fighter IV: 3D Edition. The console experience is now in the palm of your hand with rich new features that utilize the capabilities of the Nintendo 3DS to its fullest. Packed with 35 playable characters, bonus stages and cinematic Ultra combos, Super Street Fighter IV: 3D Edition expands the action by allowing you to fight your friends around the world using Wi-Fi. New to the franchise are the figurine mode, which utilizes the Street Pass feature to add a collectible meta-game, and the 3D over-the-shoulder camera option that takes fighting to new depths. For those new to the franchise, a simple mode has been added allowing players to pull off challenging moves with a single touch of the screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yee.jpg'),(14229,'Pogo Stick Champion','2024-06-21','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Bounce with your pogo stick to new lands!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ebs.jpg'),(14230,'Hypnotic Lights','1998-02-01','Puzzle','Intellivision','[Unreleased 1983] puzzle game -- move rows and columns of squares to line up matching colors. \n \nWhile experimenting with Intellivision graphics, someone in the Design & Development department came up with a kaleidoscopic effect using sequenced GRAM. VP of Applications Software Gabriel Baum liked the effect, dubbed Hypnotic Lights, and asked programmer Steve Roney (Space Spartans) to work it into a game. \n \nSteve\'s reaction was pretty much: yeah, right, what game? Marketing had a suggestion: something sort of kind of like a Rubik\'s Cube. That\'s what Steve sort of kind of gave them. But while Steve continued to tinker with it when not working on higher priority games (including B-17 Bomber, Aquarius Utopia and Space Shuttle), Hypnotic Lights was never elevated to \"official\" status.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pfc.jpg'),(14231,'Goblin Summer Camp','2020-04-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Goblin Summer Camp is a high energy multiplayer summer camp game. Double or triple down on power-ups to become the fastest, smallest, goblin ever and unlock cosmetics by completing tricky single player speed run obstacle maps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d3c.jpg'),(14232,'Artpartment','2014-11-15','Sin género','Web browser','pop art videogame','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wrs.jpg'),(14233,'Days in Hill','2023-07-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A role-playing game,you need to survive in barren hills.Collect, grow, hunt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s68.jpg'),(14234,'Fatal Fury 3: Road to the Final Victory','2010-04-20','Fighting','Neo Geo AES, Neo Geo MVS, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Sega Saturn, Neo Geo CD','An adaptation of the Neo-Geo fighting game. 2-D scrolling one-on-one fighter with pseudo-3D aspects (that allows for players to \"escape\" holds, throws, and other attacks). Part of the incestuously-popular SNK fighting game pantheon...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hhf.jpg'),(14235,'Moon Defense','2021-10-06','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Moon Defense is a game about the protection of a lunar settlement from falling meteorites. You have to go through 8 levels to defend the lunar settlement. Each level is distinguished by a timer for protection, the number and durability of meteorites falling on you. By earning credits for defending a settlement, you can upgrade your rocket launcher and the defense of the settlement.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yyo.jpg'),(14236,'Guess the Flags: A Fun Quiz','2017-07-23','Puzzle, Quiz/Trivia','Android','Guess The Flags is a new educational and fun game from MAD Entertainment.\n\nHow is your knowledge of the flags? Find it out in our new flag quiz trivia game and join the educational ride and have a lots of fun.\n\nGuess The Flags is a game to learn, test and enrich your knowledge about the national flags of various countries in a fun way. Download this free educational game and expand the horizons of your knowledge. Take the flag trivia quiz today.\n\nGuess The Flags offers a fun way to learn and crack the trivia. We all learned about the flags in our elementary school, now is the time to put that knowledge into test in this new quiz game. So How many flags can you guess?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bwplrzskzypngnpww81i.jpg'),(14237,'State of War: Warmonger / Classic 2000','2018-12-26','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enjoy an unforgettable blast from the past with this classic real-time strategy experience. This all-inclusive bundle includes the original 22 missions from State of War (2000), and 16 additional missions from its sequel, State of War: Warmonger (2003).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4n9g.jpg'),(14238,'Myara Story 1: Hurricane of the Ancient One','2022-11-22','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A vertical scrolling danmaku-style somewhat story-heavy game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u8r.jpg'),(14239,'Super Mario Bros. 3 Alpha','2023-08-23','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','A new level of hack for Super Mario Bros. 3. Like the original, there are up to 8 worlds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co704q.jpg'),(14240,'Who Wants to Be a Millionaire: US Movies 80s','2024-01-08','Quiz/Trivia','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Challenge yourself and your friends with this brand-new theme: US Movies 80s','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wib.jpg'),(14241,'Company of Heroes 3','2023-02-23','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','The legendary strategy franchise is back! Company of Heroes 3 is the ultimate package of action, tactics and strategy. Take charge in the heat of real-time battle, then command as a General guiding the overall campaign where every decision matters. ​\n\nOverwhelm your opponents with new and familiar factions, units, and international Battlegroups. Command ground, air and naval forces and build supply lines to crush enemy advances on the new Dynamic Campaign Map - no two playthroughs are ever alike! Play at your own pace across campaign and skirmish modes before diving into blistering multiplayer action. Discover the untold stories of a stunning Mediterranean theatre, featuring next generation destructible environments, all powered by Relic\'s proprietary Essence Engine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gf4.jpg'),(14242,'Frozen Gauntlet','2024-12-11','Platform','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Frozen Gauntlet is a unique platformer game where you play as Zen, an adventurer with a magical gauntlet that can freeze creatures, helping him find his way back home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e3r.jpg'),(14243,'The Hive','2016-08-25','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Hive is an RTS RPG single player game where you assume control of insectoid hive mind, and explore the vast underworld on your journey to the surface.\n\nThe emphasis of the game is in exploration, discovery and story telling via the RTS style game play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h1r.jpg'),(14244,'What Happened in Addison\'s Grotto','2021-04-27','Point-and-click, Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A young woman from a small fishing village goes missing. Days later agents of an unknown organization find her, take her to a secret location. The young woman saw something she shouldn\'t have and now something else sees through her.\n\nIt needs to be found, isolated, and exorcised.\n\nYou\'re the only one who can do it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tvp.jpg'),(14245,'Starship Troopers: Extermination','2024-10-11','Shooter, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Starship Troopers: Extermination drops up to 16 players right into the fight against the Bug menace in this co-op first person shooter. Suit up and ship out to a far-off front as a Trooper in the Deep Space Vanguard, an elite Special Forces group within the Mobile Infantry. It’s up to squads like yours to battle against hundreds of bloodthirsty insectoid aliens and take back fallen colonies for the Federation. The only good Bug is a dead Bug!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bw3.jpg'),(14246,'Spin Ball','1983-12-31','Simulator, Pinball','Vectrex','Spin Ball is a pinball simulation game. The games pinball table comes complete with a variety of bumpers, spinners, and other targets which can earn you varying amounts of points with several combinations possible for even more points. Bonuses can be earned as well, both in point form and also ball savers which block the chutes on the corners of the screen. A ball splitter may also appear, allowing you to have two balls in play at one time. The joystick is used to set the tension on the spring when putting a ball into play or to shake the table during play, and the buttons are used to control the left and right paddles on the table. You begin each game with 5 balls, and the game ends when all 5 are lost.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w6z.jpg'),(14247,'Monster Castle','2019-03-25','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Simulating castle, Set up a monster army, Defend the evil empire','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14248,'Slenderman Must Die: Chapter 7','2017-10-26','Shooter, Indie','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slenderman Must Die: Abandoned Graveyard is another amazing installment from the sinister and creepy Slenderman Must Die series.\n\nFind it and Burn Slendermans body + Halloween Special\n\nIn Halloween Special - Explore the big city and find 9 green pumpkins.\n\nThe game was initially released as a standalone program and Android application in October 2017. The WebGL version was released in March 2018 and has been updated with a new version in March 2019.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zto.jpg'),(14249,'All Bosses','2020-11-25','Platform','Nintendo 64','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79dt.jpg'),(14250,'Melty Blood Re-Act','2004-05-30','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d6m.jpg'),(14251,'Dyad','2012-07-17','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Racing, Sport, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Dyad is an arcadey tunnel racing puzzle game with a heavy emphasis on quick movement, reactive bright neon visuals, creating colorful music soundscapes, and sensory overload. Players are given the ability to \"Hook\" and \"Graze\" enemies in the tube to fill up their \"Lance\" meters, which they can expend to \"Lance\" enemies forming combos and increasing their momentum. Over the course of 27 levels the game introduces enemies with varying sets of characteristics, and items which can change the rules mid-game leading to mechanical complexity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60jp.jpg'),(14252,'Kingdom Hearts II Final Mix','2014-12-02','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','An HD remaster of Kingdom Hearts II Final Mix, which was originally exclusive to Japan. It was released globally for the first time as part of the collection \"Kingdom Hearts HD 2.5 ReMIX\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8m1s.jpg'),(14253,'Kryzer',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14254,'Way of the Hunter: Hunter\'s Pack','2022-08-16','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Way of the Hunter Hunter\'s Pack:\n• a shotgun, with engravings.\n• a paintjob for the Car.\n• a big wooden carved mouflon statue for the lodge.\n\nThis DLC is also part of the Map Pack 1 and the Elite Edition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fqr.jpg'),(14255,'Stickman Parkour Speed 2020',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14256,'Dragon Quest II: Luminaries of the Legendary Line','2014-10-09','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, Nintendo 3DS, Android, iOS, Legacy Mobile Device, Nintendo Switch','This game allows the player to control more than one character, and it is the first one in the Dragon Quest series to do so. The player controls his or her characters as they move in the game world. They can search treasure chests, talk and trade with villagers, equip weapons and armor, and cast spells.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xai.jpg'),(14257,'Sum Blocks','2018-06-07','Puzzle','Web browser','Fill blocks with target sums.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m83.jpg'),(14258,'EndeavorOTC','2023-06-21','Arcade','Android, iOS','EndeavorOTC is a video game developed by Akili intended as a prescription free therapy for adults with ADHD symptoms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dgm.jpg'),(14259,'Kuroinu Redux','2023-05-19','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Desperate to end a bloody war, the Seven Shields Alliance—led by an elven goddess incarnate—seek out the assistance of the protagonist Vult and his Black Dog Mercenaries. He turns on them them and takes control in this visual novel story of betrayal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7htt.jpg'),(14260,'Arkanoid 2000',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14261,'Kyodai Mahjongg','1997-03-01','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kyodai Mahjongg is a tile-matching game developed by one person since 1997, with many features and options. It offers 2D and 3D modes, online multiplayer, various tilesets and layouts, and relaxing oriental music.\n\nThe 2006 version was released on September 25, 2006, and it is currently the latest version nowadays (ver. 21.42).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27iy.jpg'),(14262,'Ashworld','2017-12-06','Shooter, Platform, Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Scavenge, fight, attack, defend, and survive in the Ashworld. Post apocalyptic open-world survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23o6.jpg'),(14263,'Robo Frenzy',NULL,'Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build and battle in Robo Frenzy! Create dozens of weapons and construct inventions to crush gigantic gadgets in a sandbox action game that blends crafting with combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a6v.jpg'),(14264,'Sea of Thieves: Season 8','2022-11-22','Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66dm.jpg'),(14265,'Ace Attorney Investigations: Miles Edgeworth','2010-02-16','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo DS, Nintendo Switch','Ace Attorney Investigations: Miles Edgeworth is a 2009 adventure video game developed and published by Capcom. It was originally released for the Nintendo DS in Japan in 2009, and internationally in 2010, and later for iOS and Android in 2017. It is the fifth game in the Ace Attorney series, and is set between the events of the third and fourth games, Phoenix Wright: Ace Attorney − Trials and Tribulations and Apollo Justice: Ace Attorney.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z8q.jpg'),(14266,'AER: Memories of Old','2017-10-25','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Transform into a bird and fly to explore and experience a vibrant world of floating islands in the sky. Venture down into lost ancient ruins where each step leads you closer to the end of the world.\n\nAER puts you in the shoes of Auk, a magical shape-shifting girl who can transform between human and bird.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v8z.jpg'),(14267,'Kiniro no Corda 2 ff','2017-12-21','Music, Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','Full voiced enhanced port of Kiniro no Corda 2. Included in the new content is a route for the character Fudou Shouma from the Kiniro no Corda mobile game Bannin no Kiniro no Corda, an ending for Kira Akihiko and additions to Etou Kiriya\'s route. There are more than 30 new events and 30 new stills added to the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gkl.jpg'),(14268,'We Might Die',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Salvage Spaceships, Gear Up, Survive the Alien Swarm. Mech-based survival game set in deep space, where an alien swarm is quickly approaching your home ship. You and your team of robots will salvage procedurally-generated ships to gain the resources you need to escape the star system intact.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qso.jpg'),(14269,'Timelake: Time Travel Tactics',NULL,'Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Timelake: Time Travel Tactics is a roguelite strategy game where you control time itself to outsmart enemies and navigate a shifting city. Predict enemy moves, set traps, and execute synchronized combos. Manage precious resources as you explore a dreamlike world filled with mystery, cosmic horror, and ever-changing challenges. Every decision ripples through time, offering endless strategic possibilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99i5.jpg'),(14270,'LEGO Dimensions: The Joker and Harley Quinn Team Pack',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Get devious with The Joker and Harley Quinn from DC Comics! Place the mischievous DC Comics villains The Joker and Harley Quinn on the Lego Toy Pad to launch them into the Lego Dimensions multiverse. Use their weapons and activate their powerful special abilities to battle enemies and solve exciting puzzles. When things get tough, send in The Joker\'s Chopper and Harley\'s Quinn-mobile. Rebuild The Joker\'s Chopper into a Mischievous Missile Blaster and The Joker\'s Lock \'n\' Laser Jet. Rebuild Harley\'s Quinn-mobile into a Quinn Ultra Racer and Missile Launcher. Activate The Joker\'s special Grappler, Target, Hazard and Electricity abilities, and Harley Quinn\'s Acrobat and Super Strength abilities to solve puzzles and battle enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w77.jpg'),(14271,'Captain ToonHead vs. The Punks from Outer Space','2021-11-11','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR, Oculus Quest','Ever wanted to beat a T-Rex up with a chancla, while building powerful towers that shoot piñatas, hot sauce and heat-seeking fireworks? Captain ToonHead vs. The Punks from Outer Space is the VR tower defense game of your cartooniest dreams. This is not your diorama-style VR tower defense. This time you’re going to have to move all over the map, hammer away to upgrade your towers, throw over-powered chanclas recklessly and shoot electric beams from weaponized pizza at your enemies. Fight from the front lines!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mve.jpg'),(14272,'Tanto Cuore','2021-01-31','Puzzle, Strategy, Tactical, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tanto Cuore is a Japanese deck-building card game which has a mechanism similar to Dominion.\n\nEach player plays as the Lord of a mansion and hires maids to fill out their house to become the King of Maids! The end goal is simple enough, the player who has the most Victory Points at the end of the game wins! Players acquire Victory Points by employing a variety of maids and \"Love\" cards that allow for different strategies. You can even employ Private Maids that stick around to use their special powers each per turn! Some give you a bonus, or affect your opponents in a negative way. But beware, your opponents can make your maids sick or give them bad habits, affecting your maids in negative ways and decreasing your Victory Points!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oni.jpg'),(14273,'Missiles!','2015-09-25','Arcade','Android, iOS','In missiles you can control a variaty of planes and helicopters. The objective is to out run the missiles chasing you for as long as possible. Whilst flying you can also collect coins, a shield and a speed boost to aid you in battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cisyfaeztf1htlepntj9.jpg'),(14274,'My Amusement Park','2010-11-26','Simulator','Nintendo DS','In My Amusement Park, kids step into the driver’s seat to run their own amusement park. In Digging for Dinosaurs, kids will separate fact from myth to learn the true tales about 21 different dinosaurs. With these smart games, parents can rest assured that kids build skills while they play.\n\nBuild the Park: Choose from four different theme park plans then build rides, food venues and special attractions to\n\nopen your theme park!\n\nFix the Rides: Customers don’t like broken rides! Use your logic skills to repair the rides and keep the customers happy.\n\nKeep It Going: Running an amusement park isn’t all about rides and games. Use matching clues to fulfill food orders, keep the park clean and more!\n\nEarn Money: Play eight different memory and puzzle games to earn money to build a bigger, better park with larger and more expensive rides and attractions!\n\nMake It Your Own: Control the look of the park—from its theme to the design of the rides to the landscaping and decorations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gk6.jpg'),(14275,'Memento','2016-07-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A paradise lost; an island full of memory. Those who forget the horrors of the past will pay the price... Relics of war are now living, breathing creatures, out for revenge for memories forgotten... Can you escape?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45wn.jpg'),(14276,'MiniFarm 2020',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14277,'Rocket Angels Inc',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Rocket Angels Inc is a fast-paced arena shooter utilizing a grapple hook focused movement system. Gracefully move around the map and knock your opponents out of the arena using explosive based weapons or perform executions while they are stunned to guarantee victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67cm.jpg'),(14278,'Little Knight',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','This is a medieval horizontal pixel-style game that can achieve unlimited gold coins. Players can control the little knight and experience the endless fun of monster swiping and exploration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pj9.jpg'),(14279,'MarbleGP','2024-11-03','Racing, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the World of Marbles. The marbles are a peacful species. They know no greed, envy or anger. All they care about is to put fun in their lifes, some like to unveil the secrets of the universe, some prefer to discuss about the meaning of liff, some others like to race.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pk1.jpg'),(14280,'Food For Pigs','2021-07-25','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It tells you, \"A good farmer always feeds his pigs.\"\nFeed the pigs.\nEntry 1 in the Food For Pigs Cinematic Universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63ni.jpg'),(14281,'Dragon Ball Z: Kakarot + A New Power Awakens Set - Legendary Edition','2023-01-13','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','Play through iconic Dragon Ball Z battles on a scale unlike any other. Fight across vast battlefields with destructible environments and experience epic boss battles against the most iconic foes (Raditz, Frieza, Cell, etc.). Increase your power level through RPG mechanics and rise to the challenge!\n\nGo beyond the history of Dragon Ball Z and experience 2 additional boss battles, with the New Power Awakens set! Master the power of the gods to challenge Lord Beerus and go even beyond to fight Golden Frieza with the power of Super Saiyan Blue!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co625d.jpg'),(14282,'Notmycar','2019-04-05','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Notmycar is a white-knuckle, lead-footed massively multiplayer vehicular combat battle royale game. Drop into a massive battleground and use cool weapons and abilities to battle your way through single-elimination combat and become the ultimate survivor. Outlast the competition through cunning, skill, and a little bit of strategy. Customize your ride to make it a beast of a vehicle to take on anyone, anytime.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1kdv.jpg'),(14283,'Jackie Chan in Fists of Fire','1995-12-03','Fighting','Arcade','Jackie Chan in Fists of Fire is an upgraded version of The Kung-Fu Master Jackie Chan. It adds a desperation move system, an improved combo system with a special combo counter above the lifebars that records the highest number of combos during a match, and an \"escaping\" feature where players can struggle out of combos or stand up as fast as possible by rapidly moving the control stick and tapping the buttons simultaneously. Fists of Fire also makes all three versions of Jackie Chan into playable characters expanding the roster up to nine playable characters, and makes adjustment to the character balance by strengthening and weakening the statistics of certain playable characters from the first game, while adding and removing a few moves to some of them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p7v.jpg'),(14284,'Sonic Unleashed','2008-11-20','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Gameplay in Sonic Unleashed focuses on two modes of platforming play: fast-paced levels that take place during daytime, showcasing Sonic\'s trademark speed as seen in previous games in the series, and slower, night-time levels, during which Sonic\'s Werehog form emerges, and gameplay switches to an action-based, brawler style of play, in which Sonic battles Gaia enemies','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v6p.jpg'),(14285,'Momotaro Densetsu Turbo','1990-08-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','A turn-based RPG featuring the famous Peach Boy of Japanese folklore, and the enhanced remake of the first Momotarou Densetsu game. It was released shortly before the game\'s official sequel, also for PC Engine.\n\nMomotarou Densetsu Turbo (\"Peach Boy Legend Turbo\") is the second game in the Momotarou Densetsu franchise, though is effectively a revamp of the first game released for the Famicom. The game displays Momotarou\'s origins as a baby born of a giant peach that a kindly couple found floating down a river, and covers how he met his animal companions and fought the Oni on their island.\n\nThe game sets up the sequel, Momotarou Densetsu II, which was released exclusively for the PC Engine a few months later.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xi8.jpg'),(14286,'Dicy Chess','2023-11-25','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Experience the full feeling of playing chess...\nBUT WITH RANDOMNESS\nAt the start of each turn you roll a dice and the outcome determines how far you can move','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84lb.jpg'),(14287,'Three Dirty Dwarves','1996-12-31','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','DOS, Sega Saturn','Four genetically altered geeks have opened the trans-dimensional gates to reality and summoned a rag-tag posse of filthy orc dwarves to rescue them from their maniacal captor. Run amuch with up to 3 players, through over 20 hard-hitting whacko worlds of car-tooney ghettos and freaked-out bosses!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4e17.jpg'),(14288,'Mango','2021-11-23','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mango is a surrealist first-person adventure/puzzle game about art and derealization, featuring trippy, psychedelic visuals, intense psychological and philosophical undertones, fragmented storytelling and experimental horror elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ks5.jpg'),(14289,'Minesweeper','2024-04-22','Puzzle, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Classic, Hex, 3D or Endless! Want to play Minesweeper to pass the time? Play the classic original or try some new unique takes on it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bx6.jpg'),(14290,'Dyna Bomb 2','2022-08-17','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Jack and Ela are on vacation on a beautiful tropical island. Unaware of DR.Brutus they sip fruit juices and talk about their past adventures. They are interrupted by Dr. Brutus\'s voice. A loud explosion destroys the kiosk where they were relaxing and so they decide to make the bad guy pay for it. Thus begins their new adventure and You will be the protagonist. Choose one of the two heroes or both if you prefer to play with a friend. Fly and shoot bombs across 8 different beautiful and colorful levels. Discover secret levels and find the way to the secret world. Buy new weapons and other types of upgrades that will help You on your adventure. Defeat all of Dr.Brutus\' followers and help Jack and Ela to clean up the wonderful island they are on.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5oxd.jpg'),(14291,'World War Z: Aftermath - Deluxe Edition','2021-09-21','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox One','World War Z: Aftermath is the ultimate co-op zombie shooter and the next evolution of the original hit World War Z that has now captivated over 15 million players. Fight off hordes of ravenous zombies in intense story episodes across new zombie-ravaged locations around the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3t3z.jpg'),(14292,'Mars Mirage',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14293,'Mansion Affairs',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14294,'MojiCraft','2024-11-06','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','MojiCraft is a minimal turn-based real-time strategy game where you build an army of Mojis and lead them into tactical battles. Choose from multiple unique factions, manage your resources, and claim victory by outsmarting your opponents and adapting your strategy to destroy their territory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pkk.jpg'),(14295,'The Answer is 42','2023-04-06','Puzzle, Indie, Card & Board Game','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The answer to life, the universe, and everything. Connect the numbers. Fill the board. You will find out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cll.jpg'),(14296,'Alice is Dead: Hearts and Diamonds','2025-12-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A complete remake of the classic Flash game trilogy, Alice is Dead. Hearts and Diamonds includes all new art, added puzzles, expanded lore, and plenty of secrets for old and new fans alike.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co577b.jpg'),(14297,'Math Master',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14298,'Mark Sharp & The Bar Thieves',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14299,'Mangoo',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14300,'Marriage Contract With Billionaire CEO','2025-02-10','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Your choices decide everything. Choose your love and destiny!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pk2.jpg'),(14301,'Meeting a Hunk in the Park','2025-02-07','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A steamy, gay visual novel where you meet an attractive young man during the night.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pk5.jpg'),(14302,'Norn9: Norn + Nonette','2013-05-30','Visual Novel','Android, iOS, PlayStation Portable','The original Norn9 game. The game features three protagonists you can choose with three love interests for each. All characters are voiced.\n\nWithin an old-fashioned town, much like the Meiji and Taisho Era, there exists a giant globe that floats in midair. This is the \'ship\' called \'Norn\'. The inside is set like a small town with parks, etc.\n\nThe story takes place a little in the future. Guided by one particular song, young elementary kid, Suzuhara Sorata is warped through a time skip to an unfamiliar place much like the Meiji and Taisho eras from his textbooks. In this world, he meets 3 young ladies and 9 young men, and joins them on a journey aboard the mysterious \'Norn\' ship in the sky.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5osg.jpg'),(14303,'Goal Storm','1996-01-15','Sport','PlayStation','Goal Storm, known as World Soccer: Winning Eleven in Japan, is a football sports video game developed by Konami Computer Entertainment Tokyo and published by Konami. It was released in late 1995 in North America and early 1996 elsewhere for the PlayStation.\n\nIt is the first instalment of the Winning Eleven franchise, later known as Pro Evolution Soccer internationally.\n\nGameplay-wise, the player controls one of thirty-six national teams over two different game modes, simulating association football matches and/or tournaments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y4p.jpg'),(14304,'Crea Run!','2023-08-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Run, jump, and gather building blocks...Craft vehicles using the collected blocks and recipes!An action game of running, jumping, and crafting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zkh.jpg'),(14305,'Xak III: The Eternal Recurrence','1994-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','Ratok, a descendant of the Duel bloodline, receives a distress message from Farland Castle... For the longest time, the world has been split into three, fairy, demon, and human, mainly for the purposes of having the demons sealed off... Yet somehow, the demons have found a way to enter the human world to launch an invasion. One by one, the human world\'s kingdoms fall to an unforgiving reign of terror. Ratok is informed of the situation by a dying man\'s last breath after Farland Kingdom fell, its king slaughtered mercilessly. Thus begins Ratok\'s journey to prevent the demons from realizing their dreams of conquest...\n\nJourney with Ratok, as he quests with his legendary Xak Sword to repel the demon invasion, make plenty of interesting and humorous allies/friends along the way, and discover his true identity as well as that of his father\'s (whose gone missing for quite some time)...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mkm.jpg'),(14306,'The Adventures of the Smurfs','2000-12-31','Platform, Adventure','Game Boy Color','Adventures Of The Smurfs is a game released for the Gameboy Color. It was released solely in Europe due to the continued popularity of the Smurf characters in that area.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xiayd17dvxckyses6zvf.jpg'),(14307,'SnowRunner: Tatra Dual Pack','2022-06-01','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Expand and bring even more versatility to your SnowRunner fleet with the Tatra Dual Pack, giving you access to the iconic Tatra 813 and Tatra 805!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54av.jpg'),(14308,'Mutation','2011-10-01','Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','MUTATION is a game of time and space. It is a rotting tomb filled with unpleasant sights. You will despise your body as you change into something you don’t quite understand. It is misery, it is alienation, it is MUTATION.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yzq.jpg'),(14309,'Flappy Meatbag','2016-09-06','Arcade','Android','A challenging, fast paced and messy \"2D\" game with a cute little dude. Help him not get killed on his way to the finish line.\n\nPlatform: Android\nSource Google Play:\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=sk.memex.flappymeatbag1','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bmp7brzklntqhizqmzaw.jpg'),(14310,'Teletubbies: Look! - Hide and Seek','2003-12-31','Point-and-click','DVD Player','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14311,'Dear Girl: Stories Hibiki - Hibiki Tokkun Daisakusen!','2009-12-17','Adventure, Visual Novel','Nintendo DS','Dear Girl: Stories Hibiki - Hibiki Tokkun Daisakusen! is an visual novel game, developed by HuneX and published by ASCII Media Works, which was released in Japan in 2009.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ur4.jpg'),(14312,'Cozy Organizer','2025-12-31','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Organize, decorate, align, and stack items in cozy environments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gg2.jpg'),(14313,'Avatar Deluxe Blackjack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14314,'Still Life 2','2009-08-10','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Who is hiding behind Mr. X? Still Life 2 reveals the long-awaited ending of Still Life and spells a new investigation for Agent Victoria McPherson.\n\nIn Fall 2008, Victoria is sent to Maine where Ellen Dunnigan\'s body has just been found. The modus operandi and the video sent to the police and press leave no doubt as to the killer\'s identity: the East Coast Torturer has struck again! No clues are picked up during the autopsy, as the serial killer painstakingly washed the body. Once again, the killer has not committed any errors.\n\nStill Life 2 remains true to the spirit of its first installment and continues to allow you to play and manage two characters bound by the same fate. This time, the aim is to control two heroines, see the game from two different viewpoints, and essentially experience two different types gameplay. Depending on whether you are playing as Paloma Hernandez--the victim--or Victoria McPherson--the investigator--you alternate between survival and investigation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rfq.jpg'),(14315,'Dragon Warrior III','1988-02-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','Dragon Warrior III is a top-down role-playing game where you travel around the overworld, caves, castles, cities and other locations while battling random encounters, buying equipment, and talking to people.\n\nYou and your party members receive experience when they beat up monsters and level up with enough experience, increasing their stats.\n\nThe game features a day/night cycle - as you travel, day slowly changes to night and vice versa; shops are typically closed at night.\n\nYou begin with control of just the main character but can quickly recruit three more members to your party. During the game you can choose to drop your current characters and recruit others at any time. The recruitable characters are divided into six classes: soldier, fighter, merchant, goof-off, pilgrim and wizard.\n\nThe game has a unique job system, giving you the ability to switch your hired characters\' classes after they have achieved at least level 20 in their base class. Characters can switch to the other beginning classes, as well as the sage class, which is not available at the beginning. When a character switches classes, they lose all earned experience points, and half of their stats, but retain all the abilities of the previous class. In this way, you can create powerful combination characters that are able to cast spells and fight effectively.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s7a.jpg'),(14316,'Telefrag VR','2019-07-19','Shooter, Simulator, Indie, Arcade','Oculus VR, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Telefrag VR is a hellishly fast-paced shooter with visceral movement and combat mechanics. Dash, shoot, and teleport around unique arenas that feature impossible geometry where there is no right side up and death can come from any direction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jli.jpg'),(14317,'Pool Puzzles','2021-09-30','Puzzle, Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Pool Puzzles puts you into the ultimate pool battle. Do you have what it takes to fulfill every level’s requirement? Each game is very intense and fun, and you get to test as well as improve your pool experience every time. That’s what really makes it stand out above the rest, so you have to give it a try right away. With Pool Puzzles, every level is exciting since you have to fulfill new challenges. You can buy a variety of skins with the coins you acquire from your gameplay. So there’s always a need to improve your skills and become even better than before. Check out the ultimate pool game with some great challenges!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z57.jpg'),(14318,'Dead of Night: Supermarket','2025-03-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience the dread of a midnight shift in a quiet supermarket. As mundane tasks blur with eerie events, discover that the darkness hides more than just silence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gjj.jpg'),(14319,'A Painter\'s Tale: Curon, 1950','2021-01-29','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','“A Painter\'s Tale” is an adventure game that tells the story of the tiny Südtirol village of Curon Venosta by mixing reality and fiction. The old Curon was flooded by the waters of Lake Reschen in 1950 due to the construction of a dam. What lies beneath the bell tower still emerging from the lake?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s1f.jpg'),(14320,'The Darkness Below','2024-03-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on an epic journey into \"The Darkness Below\", a homage to the golden era of 90\'s cRPGs, with grid-based movement, turn-based combat and 2.5D perspective. Wander a vast and colorful fantasy world filled with puzzles, exotic creatures, forgotten dungeons and ancient guardians.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7uxl.jpg'),(14321,'We Are Soccer','2025-02-03','Sport','Meta Quest 2, Meta Quest 3','Join the soccer craze and become part of the ultimate hangout experience with endless possibilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9euc.jpg'),(14322,'Ship Graveyard Simulator 2: Steam Ships','2025-03-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step aboard three legendary steamships that have survived wars, luxury cruises and technological experiments. Each one has a unique story to tell - from a relief ship, through an ambitious aircraft carrier project, to the most iconic passenger ship!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ljo.jpg'),(14323,'Gunslugs 2','2021-03-01','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Ouya, Linux, Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Gunslugs 2 takes the action chaos genre further than ever before... into space and beyond. Rockets, tanks, choppers, train crashes, huge metal robots, aliens and hordes and hordes of the Black Duck army minions ! It\'s fun, over the top, action movie parody in a not-so-serious way','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41j8.jpg'),(14324,'Raiders of the Lost Ark','1982-11-01','Adventure','Atari 2600','Based on the movie itself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co987a.jpg'),(14325,'Mortal Kombat 1: Kollector\'s Edition','2023-09-14','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5','The Kollector\'s Edition is a physically only release for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S at select retailers. It includes all Premium Edition content, along with a 16.5-inch Liu Kang sculpture designed by COARSE and an inspired Liu Kang in-game character skin, three exclusive art prints, a steel case, and 1,450 additional Dragon Krystals (2,700 total).\n\nThe Premium Edition includes the Kombat Pack, early access to the game beginning Sept. 14, and 1,250 Dragon Krystals (in-game currency).\nThe Kombat Pack will feature a Johnny Cage character skin with the likeness of famed actor and martial artist, Jean-Claude Van Damme (available at launch), early access to six new playable characters (available post-launch), and five new Kameo Fighters (available post-launch)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6i8v.jpg'),(14326,'Underground Waifus TCG','2023-12-28','Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Underground Waifus it\'s a CCG, Deck Builder TCG with PVP Card Battler F2P Game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79uu.jpg'),(14327,'Tower Fortress','2017-11-20','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A mysterious tower has risen! It emits plumes of noxious green smoke from\nits summit making people sick. Strange creatures infest the tower but if\nnobody tries to ascend it we will all be doomed!\n\nAre you that hero?.....','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gsl.jpg'),(14328,'Carnage Kart X','2024-12-13','Racing, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Carnage Kart X is a retro-inspired hack n\' slash experience combining the feel of classic karting games from the early 90s with Vampire Survivors-like gameplay, combining hand-drawn 2D pixel art and low-poly 3D models for a new perspective on the Survivors-like genre. It\'s style is reminiscent of something you\'d play at the arcade down to the rockin\' over-the-top music and over-sized blood spurts/body parts flying off of enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95qx.jpg'),(14329,'MDNE',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14330,'Doggo Dentist','2022-01-15','Point-and-click, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Yarrow. You are our newest Doggo Dentist! During your totally rad career and stay with us, you will meet so many gnarly furry friends, promote your professional career and figure out what makes Yarrow the leading market competitor. So what are you waiting for? Lets begin!\n\nDoggo Dentist is my newest free and short indie point-and click game made in six weeks, on the engine Clickteam fusion. This is the beta version- so it may be buggy!\n\nDoggo Dentist is an awesome and totally tubular, 80\'s inspired point and click management game, that you should like most definitely give a try. Play as a newly hired dentist who must figure out how to perform his job in a not so radical dental firm called Yarrow. Manage cleanings, extractions, veterinary services and many more tasks on 3 unique canines, as you take the advice and heated conversation from another fellow employee named Chanice. All in all, you must figure out what to make of your new career and decide if Yarrow is the right fit for you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xtp.jpg'),(14331,'Giftscop','2024-11-23','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation','Giftscop is a fan-made recreation of the fictional game Petscop from the web series of the same name.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zjz.jpg'),(14332,'Rust Raiders','2021-12-20','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a robot pirate captain in this roguelike deckbuilding game and defeat the evil Captain LeCrank. Forge cards to improve their power, augment your ship with gadgets and build your own Deck! Experience the unique card system crafted exclusively for Rust Raiders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5o9n.jpg'),(14333,'8Infinity','2016-09-23','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','8Infinity is a dynamic and rhythm game where the player reaches eights “8” - levels of infinity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kti.jpg'),(14334,'Game Cafe',NULL,'Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Game Cafe is a casual game where you can play games like Spades, Okey, Backgammon and more with your friends or other cross platform players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83b2.jpg'),(14335,'The Dark Gift','2024-12-23','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You woke up in the basement of your home and don’t remember anything...\n\nWhen you go up to the house, you see the Christmas decorations and garlands and remember that it is family holiday time and time to get ready for it, while your wife and son went out to the store to do some shopping...\n\nSuddenly the doorbell sounded. Opening the door, you see that someone left you a gift box...\n\nWhat\'s inside this mysterious box?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co980o.jpg'),(14336,'Pocket Pursuit','2018-12-07','Arcade','Android, iOS','In Pocket Pursuit you take on the role of either police cruisers working together to catch a criminal car in a high speed chase through a living city, or as the getaway car of a dangerous criminal. Try not to get wrecked and get the highest score possible. \n \nAvoid traffic cars, collect coins to upgrade your vehicles with custom rims and paint - or unlock new vehicles to create mayhem with! Be the driver behind the wheel of a vehicle in a high speed pursuit today, but try to avoid getting your car busted in an accident. Will the criminals escape, or will the police prevail and save the city from crime? That is up to you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1i2m.jpg'),(14337,'Rogue64','2021-05-24','Role-playing (RPG)','Commodore C64/128/MAX','Rogue64 is a modern roguelike for the Commodore 64. Every play of the game is a unique experience, with our procedural generated levels. As you progress in the game you will meet tougher monsters and bigger challenges, but if you reach the end, there are wonderful rewards to be gathered!\n\nRogue64 is based on Rogue4k, a minimalistic Rogue-ish game in under 4000 bytes we made for The C64 \'Cassette 50\' Charity Competition hosted by Bitmap Soft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sz7.jpg'),(14338,'SaGa 2: Hihou Densetsu - Goddess of Destiny','2009-09-17','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo DS','SaGa 2: Hihou Densetsu - Goddess of Destiny is a role-playing video game released in 2009 for the Nintendo DS exclusively in Japan. The game is a remake of SaGa 2: Hihou Densetsu, featuring full 3D cel-shaded graphics, all new artwork by Gen Kobayashi and arranged soundtrack by Kenji Ito.\n\nThis game uses a similar gameplay to the original Game Boy title, with a few quality of life improvements and new additions. Random encounters were ditched entirely, with monsters being visible on the field much like in later SaGa games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r87.jpg'),(14339,'Dream of the Star Haven','2024-01-24','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dream of the Star Haven is a 1st person “giant leap” platformer with elements of exploration puzzling and light combat - a magical odyssey through islands in the sky where you soar gracefully and eventually even bend gravity itself to your will, giving you the power to literally turn the dreamlike world upside-down.\n\nExplore awe-inspiring floating islands with gravity-defying agility. Discover the stars scattered across the islands using your magical scanner to reveal hidden celestial secrets.\n\nIn this captivating land, you\'re invited into a serene journey where you to traverse the floating archipelago in search of secrets, to liberate that which has been unjustly taken.\n\nThe game introduces a mesmerizing combination of a mighty triple-leap ability and a magical scanner, both essential tools for navigating the world.\n\nDiscover the stars scattered across the islands using the magical scanner helps you on your main quest, while other side quests and secret collectibles are more elusive. As you progress through each realm, you uncover mysteries of a lost era.\n\nImmerse yourself in a unique blend of soothing exploration, graceful platforming, and a dreamy atmosphere. Savor the expansive vistas and uncover all that\'s hidden among the floating islands. With its emphasis on relaxation, exploration, and light combat and puzzle solving, the game provides an oasis of tranquility and is the perfect game-between-games when you need a break from big, noisy and chaotic gameplay.\n\nCruise through the low-stakes core of the game, or challenge yourself with the more difficult collectathon of secret challenges!\n\nEmbrace the joy of a harmonious journey as you leap toward the stars and reach toward a higher Dream of the Star Haven','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lbr.jpg'),(14340,'Alter Ego','2023-04-24','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Alter Ego is a 2D point-and-click narrative-based adventure game featuring psychological elements. Explore two levels with atmospheric environments, solve puzzles, and use your inventory items to uncover the mystery behind Reese and Winona\'s relationship, and find the real culprit—if there is one.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qix.jpg'),(14341,'Stay Woke Etheral Edition','2017-11-19','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After experiencing a traumatic accident, you awake to find yourself in a strange, new, and dynamic foggy town, that is filled to the brim with oddities and quirks. Players will experience a little yet big tale about what goes on in the afterlife. Will you help the ghosts reclaim their place of resting, or will you help the demons further their grip on this strange land? Boasting a bold action battle system, players will have their abilities tested through formulating strategies and managing resources on the fly. Everyone has become insane from the lack of sleep. \n \nWith a hooded figure offering you shelter, and a gun, you set out to kill four ruling gods, who have been wreaking havoc on your once humble little town. Discover the truth, stop a malicious cult, all in the same day!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14342,'Save Farty: The Trivia Game','2025-01-07','Quiz/Trivia','PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"Save Farty\" represents a real low point in worldwide trivia games. Self-improvement and the advancement of knowledge have given way to idiocy and unbridled masochism. This is perhaps the sickest game that can be enjoyed alone or with friends since Russian Roulette.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4dkh.jpg'),(14343,'Fire Emblem: Mystery of the Emblem','2006-12-26','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Wii, Nintendo Switch, Super Famicom','Fire Emblem: Monshou no Nazo (translated as Fire Emblem: Mystery of the Emblem in Fire Emblem: Awakening) is a Japanese tactical role-playing game developed by Intelligent Systems and published by Nintendo. It is the third game in the Fire Emblem series and was released in Japan on January 21, 1994. It was the first Fire Emblem title for the Nintendo Super Famicom and the first twenty-four-megabit cartridge for the system. The game is divided into two distinct parts, or \"books\". Book One is a remake of the original Fire Emblem: Shadow Dragon and the Blade of Light, and Book Two is a continuation of events, following the same characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pyi.jpg'),(14344,'The Catalyst Acolyte Tower Defense','2025-02-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Defend the Catalyst Crystal against adorable yet menacing bugs in The Catalyst Acolyte. Strategically construct defenses in handcrafted levels, aided by helpful items every 10 waves. Engaging gameplay and charming visuals make for an addictive tower defense adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cjn.jpg'),(14345,'Master RNG',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14346,'Meet and Fuck Kingdom',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14347,'Epstein','2024-02-16','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive a mysterious island and thwart the sinister plans of Jefry in \"Epstein\". Battle the blood-dependent morbiders and forge alliances with other survivors to confront Jefry in his grand temple. Master survival tactics and strategic gameplay in this intense adventure','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ph0.jpg'),(14348,'Swish',NULL,'Sport, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Swish is a massively multiplayer online basketball game. Your goal is to make as many points as you can in global contests that last 1 minute. At the end of every game, the top 20 player are displayed.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14349,'Launching Over It','2025-05-08','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Launching Over It is a challenging and emotional journey through levels inspired by the developer’s childhood memories. To reach the end, you’ll need to overcome all kinds of obstacles—by launching a ball. Sounds simple? Think again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rv0.jpg'),(14350,'Nod3s','2016-09-02','Puzzle','Android','Nod3s is an Android game to think, using mathematical operations like additions, subtracions, divisions and multiplications. It begins with an initial node and you have to use all the other nodes to reach the value of the final node. A game designed to help in the development of logical reasoning.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/urqco089maptavpjk7yr.jpg'),(14351,'High School Simulator 2019','2018-08-05','Simulator, Indie','Android, iOS','Let\'s Play Zombie High School','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s9l.jpg'),(14352,'Goonya Monster: Additional Character (Buster) - Puimo/Mascot Character','2023-05-10','Indie','Nintendo Switch','Additional Character for \"Goonya Monster\". Purchasing this item adds the following Buster as a character that can be used in gameplay. - Puimo/Mascot Character (Buster)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rzx.jpg'),(14353,'Mind Weaver',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14354,'Stupid Cupid','2019-03-14','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Cupid #0201 get back in Venus’ good graces in this VR game! Use his bow and arrow to balance the natural order by helping animals mate, or in some cases, culling the overpopulation. Challenge your skills and accuracy in different locations and seasons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jau.jpg'),(14355,'Dead by Daylight: Stranger Things Edition','2020-12-18','Strategy','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Stranger Things Edition of Dead by Daylight includes all the content of the Special Edition, three original chapters (Curtain Call, Shattered Bloodline, Darkness Among Us), and the Stranger Things chapter. This edition gives you access to a roster of 11 Killers and 14 Survivors.\n\nThis edition of the game was delisted on November 17th 2021, along with the related DLC. The DLC\'s map, The Underground Complex, was removed from the game and additional costumes related to Stranger Things were removed from the in-game store.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6eka.jpg'),(14356,'Tomb Raider: Underworld','2008-11-21','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Web browser, OnLive Game System, PlayStation 3, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Tomb Raider: Underworld represents a new advancement in exploration-based gameplay. As fearless adventurer Lara Croft explore exotic locations around the world, each designed with an incredible attention to detail resulting in breathtaking high-definition visual fidelity that creates a truly believable world and delivers a new level of challenge and choice.\n\nReach new heights with the broadest range of acrobatic abilities and utilize objects within the environment to uncover new paths to explore. Discover ancient mysteries of the underworld hidden within the coast of Thailand, frozen islands of the Arctic Sea, the jungles of Mexico, and more.\n\nEach level is an elaborate multi-stage puzzle masked within an interactive environmental playground offering more flexibility over how the area is solved. Choose to pacify or kill, target multiple enemies at once with the new dual-target system, and shoot with one hand while suspended with the other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1voc.jpg'),(14357,'Terra MineDiver',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Playdate','Your fellow miners are vanishing faster than you can say \'safety regulations,\' and it\'s up to you to figure out why. Dive into a mysterious facility, solve puzzles, and try not to become a permanent resident of the missing persons list.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14358,'Cosmonautica','2015-07-31','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Cast off! Cosmonautica is a fresh take on space trading in a procedurally generated universe, paired with quirky humor for your intergalactic enjoyment. Are you ready for some hilarious adventures in outer space? Start by boarding a washed-up space cruiser and fulfill your destiny as an aspiring captain on the hunt for fame and fortune. Cosmonautica combines elements of space trading and crew simulation to create a unique experience. Only if you take good care of your crew you will be able to succeed. Do you have what it takes to become the best trader, smuggler, pirate or even space taxi? It’s your choice!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2psq.jpg'),(14359,'La Vie en Rose',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','In this beautiful rose-coloured world, which path will our love lead to?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14360,'Honey Time! with Pooh!','2024-02-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pooh is no longer the cute little bear he used to be... something has corrupted him, and now he thirsts for blood. Gather your courage and investigate.\n\nPlay as Friend, Pooh\'s favorite human in the world. Not just anyone can taste Pooh\'s honey. Read the invitation he sent and then head to his house in the forest. When you enter his house, you\'ll discover that Pooh has changed a bit. But that\'s okay! Have a chat with Pooh; he has something to show you. Notice that Pooh\'s new honey is a bit too red for your liking. Try to escape by exploring Pooh\'s house while he\'s distracted. He\'ll attack you if he catches you trying to escape or snooping around his things. Bears are very territorial, you know?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rix.jpg'),(14361,'Trine 3: The Artifacts of Power','2015-12-22','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Trine 3: The Artifacts of Power is a fairytale journey which takes you on a quest with three heroes: Amadeus the Wizard, Pontius the Knight, and Zoya the Thief. Playable in singleplayer and online or local co-op - test your skills in combat and solve puzzles in the most creative ways!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s88.jpg'),(14362,'Trouble Witches Origin: Episode1 Daughters of Amalgam','2016-11-21','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','That witches come back undergone a power-up further! New character is entered! All 6stages Arcade version of all re-adjust the resolution of the base in 1280x720! \"Magic Circle system\" is easy-to-use adjustment! Full voice all by the story undergoes new writing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2znf.jpg'),(14363,'DodgeBall: Unleashed','2020-08-12','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','DodgeBall: Unleashed - Are you ready to put your balls on the line? In this action packed game; dodge, duck, dive, dip and dodge enemy fire, while playing on big maps, attempting to annihilate the other team by pelting balls at them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lol.jpg'),(14364,'Honkai Impact 3rd: Starbound Painter','2023-12-07','Sin género','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Version 7.1 of Honkai Impact 3rd, marking the conclusion of Part 1.5 of the main story, which includes:\n• New Valkyrie: Cosmic Expression (Griseo)\n• New Story Chapter XLII: Earthbound Order\n• New Featured Event: Starry Voyage: Strike Back!\n• UI Overhaul\n• ...and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gyq.jpg'),(14365,'Starblazer','2020-09-14','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','Windows Mixed Reality, SteamVR, Oculus Rift','Rock. Paper. Starships! Enjoy the thrill and adrenaline rush that comes with controlling an entire fleet in virtual reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rf1.jpg'),(14366,'Acheron\'s Souls','2021-05-28','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Acheron’s Souls is a turn-based strategy game, which contains board game elements and in which several fighters face off to be the last to survive in the arena. Stream the game and play with 8 friends even if they don\'t have the game in their library!\n\nAcheron\'s Souls has a buch of heroes with a background that details them and with which we can understand the reasons that move them to fight in each battle. Up to 8 players can duel simultaneously.\n\nThe game has different game modes, such a Battle Royale\' mode where the last player standing wins or a team mode where the tactics and coordination of the players is the key to victory.\n\nAcheron\'s Souls is a turn based game. In each turn you can send three actions (move, attack or defend). Heroes have special active and passive abilities that make each game have endless possibilities.\n\nThe battlefield will change throughout the game, activating traps that cause damage or altered states and that will make the player have to be in continuous movement.\n\nTo play Acheron’s Souls, players must download the free app available on the App Store and Google Play\n\n- Use your mobile as a gamepad to control the fighters in the game.\n- Select your favorite hero and choose your appearance for the battle.\n- Learn to play by reading the guides and delve into the \'Lore\' of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31jo.jpg'),(14367,'Hot Steam','2022-12-22','Indie, Visual Novel','Playdate','Loving Conversations in Shared Spaces','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14368,'Real Anime Situation! DT','2025-03-17','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','I’m Shun, and I have a talent for crushing romance flags—in real life! Featuring even more eye-popping art, nuanced animations, plus a fresh-faced cast of DT-obsessed heroines, this censored release of the Moe Game Awards-winning comedy franchise also received its own hit anime adaptation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qr5.jpg'),(14369,'Sanevol Incident 44','2022-06-26','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sanevol Incident 44 is a realistic urban exploration VHS Found Footage horror title.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7q0z.jpg'),(14370,'Milking Mira!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14371,'Mini Warriors: Brawler Army',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14372,'Grim Tales: Crimson Hollow - Collector\'s Edition','2021-09-24','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What\'s waiting at Crimson Hollow?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dvk.jpg'),(14373,'MGDC Minigame Collection',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14374,'Monkey Tag Arena',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14375,'Planet Surf',NULL,'Racing, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','In this 3D precision platformer, you become a slippery penguin who must waddle through a strange world, filled with many penguin challenges. If you struggle to move mouse good you will become sad penguin. Bounce, surf, and fly through the air at high speeds to unlock maximum penguin potential. (^O^)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co818y.jpg'),(14376,'Crashlands','2016-01-21','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Crashlands is an outlandish story-driven-action-adventure set in a world of hidden magic and high technology. Tame and milk alien beasts, craft resources into menacing weaponry, befriend the locals, and go toe-to-chin with a maniac. All in the name of ON-TIME DELIVERY !\n\nPlay as Flux Dabes, a galactic delivery truck driver whose latest shipment gets interrupted by a megalomaniacal alien named \"Q\" who tears her ship to pieces looking for useful tech. Crashlanded on Woanope, you must fight, tame, craft, quest, bossfight, and adventure your way to domination of all the things so that you and JuiceBox, your trusty sidekick/supervisor/robotic cargo palette, can send a message to the Bureau of Shipping and get those damn packages delivered!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22xx.jpg'),(14377,'Bowling! / Basketball!','1978-12-01','Sport','Odyssey 2 / Videopac G7000','Two titles are available in this cart:\n\nBowling!: one to four players take turns in this game. The alley is shown from a top down view and the ball moves back and forth at the foul line. The players have to press the action button to release the ball and can add an effect to it by pressing left or right on the right hand controller. Each player gets two balls per frame, except in the case of a strike. A strike scores 30 points, a spare 15 points and an open play scores one point for each pin hit. There are two game modes, League Night (selected by pressing \"1\"), with a slower swinging ball, and Tournament Play (selected by pressing \"2\"), with a faster swinging ball.\n\nBasketball! (selected by pressing \"3\") features two players in a five minutes game. Each drop scores two points for the player. The player can move with the ball left or right, but must shoot within 8 seconds, or else the ball will automatically transfer to the other player. If the ball is shot while the other player is touching the ball, he will steal it. The player with more points when the clock reaches zero wins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i9r.jpg'),(14378,'Unakiri Action!: Kiritan-hou no Nazo','2020-10-17','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a side-scrolling 2D action game in which Touhoku Kiritan and Otomachi Una do their best.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v6c.jpg'),(14379,'Monsterfall',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14380,'Augury','2021-05-07','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fast paced gameplay with high difficulty, in-depth mechanics, and cooperative multiplayer. Action combat in confined dungeons with swarms of enemies, environmental hazards, and tough bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yrp.jpg'),(14381,'Hortal','2020-02-24','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You need to escape from caves. Use holes to teleport and have fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jx7.jpg'),(14382,'Perfect Memento of Touhou Question','2018-08-02','Quiz/Trivia, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Imperishable Night has a PH level?\" What a joke, how about a Sakuya level?\n\"Mamizou is afraid of human?\" Quit making me laugh.\n\"Patchouli uses the ancient Chinese symbol for her magic?\" Come on, now you are not even trying, she is an European.\n\nIn this game, you will face Hundreds of Touhou rumours of it\'s origin setting, Some of them are right, Others are totally lies. Judge them as Right or Wrong, even if you choose wrong, you will still get the detailed explanation and the place they come from. So let\'s move, do a little test of your Touhou knowledge, shall we?\n\nCaution: This game is not suitable for those people who don\'t know about Touhou that much, if you don\'t even know what most of those questions mean, it means you don\'t have that much Touhou knowledge to play this game. In that case, this game is not for you, sorry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a6i.jpg'),(14383,'King Of Sails','2018-08-27','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy','Android','Exciting PvP naval warfare with 18th century ships! Sail into a world of historical battles and be a captain in the golden age of shipbuilding! Conquer the seas in exciting online battles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co978u.jpg'),(14384,'3D Escape Room: Detective Story','2025-03-13','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','3D Escape Room: Detective Story is an immersive 3D puzzle game that takes you to 1930s London. In the game, you play as an insightful private detective, searching for clues in realistic 3D environments, solving intricate puzzles and mini-games, and cracking bizarre cases.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g49.jpg'),(14385,'Lew Pulsipher\'s Doomstar','2016-09-16','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Doomstar, the hidden unit board game of strategy and cunning, is a new exclusive release from Large Visible Machine and\nlegendary designer Lew Pulsipher (Britannia, Dragon Rage, Sea Kings).\n\nPlay the AI or against friends or online opponents with fully asynchronous online multiplayer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ksh.jpg'),(14386,'Arcade Archives: Final Blow','2024-11-21','Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','\"FINAL BLOW\" is a sports-action game released by TAITO in 1989.\nPlayers choose one of five boxers and compete against the remaining four to become champion.\nIn addition to weak, medium, and strong punches, you can also use switch between low and high blow to take advantage of your opponent\'s openings.\nStep into the ring and face the most fearsome fighters in the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92h9.jpg'),(14387,'Claw Machine','2024-04-01','Platform','Nintendo 64','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pib.jpg'),(14388,'Ice Cream Float',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join AISU THE PENGUIN on her quest to eat as many tasty frozen treats as possible while also enjoying a healthy pescatarian diet of salmon along the way. Bop enemies, dodge obstacles, and get to the end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jl0.jpg'),(14389,'Raising the Bar: Redux','2020-05-17','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience Half-Life 2 like never before. Return to City 17, held within the iron grip of the Combine and the Consul. Reunite with old friends, and enemies, and some of them brand new. Immerse yourself in a revitalised combat system featuring old arsenals made new again, with added features to raise the bar in gameplay. You\'ve been waiting for quite some time, now. It\'s time to climb aboard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5iug.jpg'),(14390,'PianoGlow','2025-03-10','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Multiplayer piano visualizer (QWERTY & Midi inputs supported). Customizable themes. Render video & audio from within the app!\n\nThe virtual piano can be played either with your computer keyboard or a real piano. With multiplayer mode, you can play duets or as part of a band, or take turns!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mm8.jpg'),(14391,'Loot Box',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14392,'Among the Trolls',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Among the Trolls is a first-person, survival, action-adventure game where the strange mysteries of Finnish forests are unraveled. Embark on a quest to find your vanished grandparents and learn how to survive in the wilderness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rj7.jpg'),(14393,'Even the Ocean','2020-08-19','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','From the creators of Anodyne comes a grand story about Aliph, a lowly power plant technician for Whiteforge City, who finds her world turned upside-down after a routine maintenance trip goes awry. Now, working directly with Whiteforge\'s Mayor Biggs to face an unknown menace, Aliph must navigate her newfound power and influence to save the city.\n\nAliph\'s identities, environmental issues and the world’s fate all hang in the balance of Light and Dark energies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cvt.jpg'),(14394,'Farm Expert 2017','2016-09-01','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Feel the real trouble of being farmer with realistic physics. Look after your machines in backyard workshop, expand your activites to other farms, and take care of plants in greenhouses. All of this and much more in Farm Expert 2017!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zkqkd31nydkzetyaibrt.jpg'),(14395,'Untei DX','2015-09-30','Arcade','Legacy Mobile Device','A remastered version of Burari Sekai Untei.\n\nTravel around the world by moving through the mountains that surround the earth!\nEndless one-touch action is now available in deluxe form!\n\nThe running bar may be missing or someone walking on it may step on it, so use double jumps and single jumps to avoid it.\nThe goal is to circumnavigate the globe, but the game continues even after achieving the goal until you make a mistake, so how many times can you circumnavigate the globe? Let\'s try it!\n\n2015/12 New mode “Bralympics” released!\n\nNote: This work is a renewed version of \"Burari World Untei\" which was distributed until June 2015.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81eh.jpg'),(14396,'Next Player',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Next Player is a first-person psychological horror experience that starts as an ordinary platformer and drags you into a tension-filled nightmare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lz6.jpg'),(14397,'Volcano Climber','2017-06-01','Arcade','Android, iOS','The lava is coming fast, keep climbing! Simple touch mechanics, challenging obstacles and a retro arcade feel...\nAn explorer inside an infinite volcano full of coins, items and tricky platforms. And all he\'s got is his less-than-optimal jetpack! Better than nothing!\nVolcano Climber is an infinite arcade game for iOS and Android.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/onlgkl5gznibjpq10v25.jpg'),(14398,'Lazy Dog',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle','Android','Jump into this cozy puzzle game and help your adorable pup reunite with his beloved ball! Calculate the angles, time your moves, and draw lines to help the lazy dog catch his beloved ball by guiding it to him with ropes. With satisfying physics, cozy visuals, and challenging puzzles, Lazy Dog is the perfect game for the whole family. No ads, no in app purchases - just pup-tastic fun!\n\nTraverse the puzzle levels with your lovable canine buddy on a mission that\'s simple yet oh-so-satisfying: help the lazy dog catch his beloved ball by using fun mechanics to solve the puzzles.\nCollect all the dog bones to achieve a perfect score on each level. Unleash your puzzle-solving prowess today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kbj.jpg'),(14399,'Legend of Dungeon','2013-09-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','As you journey deep into the dungeon, you will find weapons, items, and long forgotten magic.. ..if you\'re lucky, it might help you to fight off the droves of mysterious creatures you will encounter. There will be complete darkness to contend with, potions to quaff, secrets to discover, traps to avoid, hats to wear, and treasure that (if you make it out alive) will make you a legend.\nYou are looking for treasure and glory in a dark flickering dungeon full of deadly monsters. Legend has it there is a massive treasure all the way down on the 26th floor. Your quest: get the treasure, and make it back alive. Which you won\'t, you\'ll die...\n\n...the game is about dying, and treasure.\n-Legend of Dungeon is a randomly generated action RPG Beat\'em\'up with heavy Rogue-like elements, striking visuals, and dynamic music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21b9.jpg'),(14400,'\'90s Super GP',NULL,'Racing, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A Kickstarter-funded racing game inspired by the great arcade racers of the 90s, built on Unity in collaboration with Nicalis. Originally planned for PC and Wii U, in 2017 the game was announced for PC, PS4 and Nintendo Switch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ztc.jpg'),(14401,'Hackme Game 2','2017-12-01','Simulator, Strategy, Arcade','Android, iOS','Immerse the city in the digital chaos! Improve your virus and watch how it gradually infects all the devices of the city. It\'s time to try your hand at being a great hacker!\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Learn the Dark Side of Cyberspace\n\n- 20 types of modifications\n\n- Over 2 secrets on each level\n\n- Non-linear evolution of infection in all levels\n\n- Develop tactics to counter antivirus\n\n- Live chat with the city\'s population','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dtveiji4i9hf8qjdbb7g.jpg'),(14402,'Underworld Unfinished Business 1: Recruiting Demon Smalls','2004-04-27','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a sequel to The Lizard King. This is a fan-made standalone game that uses the Tomb Raider The Last Revelation engine while creating its own story and puzzles.\n\nThis TRLE was placed in the trle.net hall of fame in 2005.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l9r.jpg'),(14403,'Californication','2022-02-28','Music, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Game inspired by the \"Californication\" video clip by Red Hot Chili Peppers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4itl.jpg'),(14404,'Meat Engine',NULL,'Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Meat Engine is a retro Sci-Fi boomer shooter inspired by Scorn, Quake, Dusk and Doom. The game is set in a dark and distant future stricken with war and death.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8m5v.jpg'),(14405,'Hell Revealed','1997-05-02','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hell Revealed (HR.WAD) is a 32-level megawad for Doom II, released on May 2, 1997. It was created by speedrunner Yonatan Donner and his friend Haggay Niv. This megawad was designed with full skill level support to allow unskilled players to complete it, and yet also provide \"extreme challenge\" for the best players.[1][2] The latter is the best-known feature of Hell Revealed, with the result that it has had the most speedruns recorded of any PWAD. Thus, it is one of a few PWADs that are legal for competition in the Compet-n. A sequel, Hell Revealed II, was released in late 2003, created by a new team with Yonatan Donner\'s approval.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4nun.jpg'),(14406,'Bone Quest','2024-12-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bone Quest is an RPG in which you play as a newly arisen skeleton, wanting to create a home for like minded creatures who have been shunned by human society. Rebuild a town, explore a open world, fight using traditional tab target combat, complete quests and collect a plethora of equipment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ov7.jpg'),(14407,'Salome','2011-07-18','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Salome is a game by increpare where you rotate yourself to the goal in first person.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73zu.jpg'),(14408,'Star Shoot VS','2020-01-23','Fighting, Shooter, Arcade','Android, iOS','Star Shoot VS is a casual online shooting game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qgz.jpg'),(14409,'Be the Ruler: Britannia',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Be the Ruler: Britannia is a Choose-Your-Own-Adventure RPG set in early medieval England. You are the king. Found a dynasty, and play your descendants later. Wear the crown, gain allies, plot, defend lands. Play many times to discover the full possibilities!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85yc.jpg'),(14410,'Project QT','2024-01-16','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Project QT is a Puzzle RPG with a lot more to offer than simple puzzle game mechanics. Strap in, and get ready to join the greatest adventure this side of the multiverse!\nTake the hottest cuties you have ever dreamed of, explore an entertaining new universe, add some exciting battles to the mix, and you have the perfect recipe for fun!\nWith so many girls you can evolve, level up, and upgrade, there is always a mission for you here. And the rewards are that much better! Seduce the girls as you fight your way through levels, and you will be able to unlock steamy hentai scenes that will have your heart pumping.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co33ag.jpg'),(14411,'Clonk Endeavour','2004-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Clonk Endeavour is a freeware strategy game for PC, a part of the Clonk series of 2D strategy games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b2e.jpg'),(14412,'LandBox','2022-08-10','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A creative world. You can interact with the metaverse inside our mall. The mall will have ways for you to chat with friends and meet new metaverse enthusiasts. You can visit other people’s lands that could have been created by a landowner or an actual company. LandBox team will be creating strategic partnerships to help expand the possibilities inside the metaverse. An example of a partnership we could bring on a musician or a designer and they can set up a store highlighting their in-game items for sale.\n\nSurvival is key in LandBox players will need to do small missions looking for food, helping shops with a small task or even helping an old lady cross the street. You’ll earn the in-game currency. The in-game currency can be used in various ways.\n\nCertain lands will have mini games as well that users can interact with. The LandBox game is an open world for gamers to enjoy the metaverse and creations at LandBox.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52p8.jpg'),(14413,'Dungeons of Edera','2022-06-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dungeons of Edera is a rogue-lite action RPG dungeon crawler featuring procedurally generated levels where you will battle through hordes of monsters to restore Edera to its former glory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q0n.jpg'),(14414,'Lumen World of Color','2024-12-13','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lumen World of color is an action adventure game made as a student project.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pjm.jpg'),(14415,'Just One Line','2017-07-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Just One Line is a fantasy RPG gamebook-like indie game heavily focused on choices and their consequences, in which you may compete with other players in an interactive leaderboard. Create different adventurers and embark on epic quests, unlocking new contents for your next playthroughs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2528.jpg'),(14416,'Conurbation','2019-09-28','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Restore nature to a sprawling urban environment.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14417,'Orch Star','2017-12-14','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Orch Star is a real time strategy game set in an immersive space universe where orchs, elves, dwarfs and humans fighting for domination.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22tb.jpg'),(14418,'Rock Rock Rock','2008-10-25','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96di.jpg'),(14419,'Utawarerumono: Lost Flag','2019-11-26','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','Android, iOS','A mobile spin-off featuring over 20 characters from though out the main series.\nIt uses an auto-battle system with active gauges to trigger attacks from the 5 characters on a team during a battle.\n\nAlthough the game is not canon, it will explore some of the series lore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mfh.jpg'),(14420,'Rubber Bandits: Go Wild Pack','2023-01-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Release your inner beast!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60uh.jpg'),(14421,'Mangui','2025-04-18','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mangui is a turn-based roguelike game inspired by spooky traditional Korean folklore. Play as one of four protagonists, unraveling the mysteries of the dark Mangui mountains. Live to tell the tale in this dangerous world filled with ghouls and monsters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co982d.jpg'),(14422,'Viva Project','2018-11-12','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Oculus Rift','This is an advanced AI simulation that can interact and respond to many of your actions in a dynamic way through inverse kinematics, complex behaviors. In short, this is a tamagochi on steroids.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rlc.jpg'),(14423,'The Catch: Carp & Coarse Fishing','2020-06-30','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Catch: Carp & Coarse Fishing is a species hunting fishing game from Dovetail Games about the passion and pursuit of what lurks beneath the waters. Take on the hunt of a lifetime as you target and pursue monster-sized fish around the world. With 35 species to hunt, you\'ll have to work up your strategy, skill and tactics to catch every boss fish in each venue. It\'ll take both patience and adrenaline to succeed as you choose your angling spot carefully, based on time of day, weather conditions and perfect equipment setup, before casting out into the water to battle and catch these elusive creatures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30mq.jpg'),(14424,'Jump To The Milky Way','2023-03-02','Platform, Indie','Android','In the game \"Jump To The Milky Way\" you will embark on an exciting journey through the vastness of space, jumping from platform to platform and exploring mysterious corners of the galaxy in search of portals to other worlds. Challenge gravity using the unique \"space jump\" technology and find portals to other worlds. Exciting space landscapes, unexpected obstacles, and incredible secrets await, which you can only uncover with your skills and ingenuity. Become a space traveler and discover new worlds in \"Jump To The Milky Way\"!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f9g.jpg'),(14425,'Cafe Deux Femmes','2020-09-24','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cafe Deux Femmes is a coming-of-age, slice-of-life yuri visual novel and dating sim. You play as a recent college grad who is trying to find out where they belong in the world and what they should do with their life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hgq.jpg'),(14426,'Tetris 4D','1998-12-31','Puzzle','Dreamcast','A Tetris game for the Dreamcast.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a73.jpg'),(14427,'Lyra Convolution','2024-12-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lyra Convolution : The Future of Gaming is Here','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pjq.jpg'),(14428,'Super Time Force Ultra','2015-09-01','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Super Time Force Ultra is an action-packed platformer with a time-travelling twist! You’re in control of time itself, bending and stretching it to your advantage on the battlefield. Rewind time and choose when to jump back into the action, teaming-up with your past selves in a unique single-player co-op experience! Take control of up to 16 unique characters, and battle across 6 different time periods, from the long-ago past to the far-away future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e2p.jpg'),(14429,'Utopia Syndrome',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Utopia Syndrome is an adventure game by Andrew Averkin (aka Utopia Games). It is an indie game project that will consist of several chapters, each with its own unique story, characters, time, environments and atmosphere full of adventures, puzzles and quests. It is a new perspective on «point and click» adventure games. Unique visual style and top-down gaming perspective. Immerse yourself in the dark corners of Utopia world to remember your past, present and future','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5s6c.jpg'),(14430,'Montgomery Fox and the Case of the Missing Ballerinas','2022-11-04','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ballerinas mysteriously vanish from the theatre but show must go on! Find her before it\'s too late.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hy8.jpg'),(14431,'Today I Die','2008-12-31','Puzzle','Web browser','An short, experimental art game by Daniel Benmergui, in which the player manipulates text, characters and objects to change the environment and escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z2s.jpg'),(14432,'Scarlet Nexus: Bond Enhancement Pack 2','2021-12-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The SCARLET NEXUS Bond Enhancement Pack 2 DLC contains additional costume and weapon sets for all characters with new designs by external creators.\n\nThe pack also includes new Bond Episodes, new SAS abilities gained from Bond Level Expansion (Bond Level EX), and ways to enjoy new sides to your favorite characters that you didn’t see in the main game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qk5.jpg'),(14433,'No Players Online Classic','2019-11-05','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A horror game taking place in the dead servers of a multiplayer first-person shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jyc.jpg'),(14434,'Endurance Labyrinth','2021-03-23','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The classic maze game, with a little tweak. Enemies will try to stop you, Power Ups will help you advance and the layout of the maze changes itself, making the simple task of finding a way out much more challenging. Can you endure this journey to the very end?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pwp.jpg'),(14435,'Gears','2022-08-30','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Adam and his friends gather for a beer in a bar... After being kidnapped by an assassin... he will have to play a dangerous and deadly game to save his life and that of his friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lma.jpg'),(14436,'Bongo Cat','2025-03-05','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bongo cat needs your help. Bongo cat needz more hatz!!! Every time you press a key, Bongo cat will punch your taskbar. Type, click, play, work to collect more points. Which hats will you find?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ibr.jpg'),(14437,'FreeCell Solitaire Collection','2022-05-14','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Do you love FreeCell Solitaire (also known as \"FreeCell\" or \"FreeCell Patience\"), but want a bigger challenge? Now you can play FreeCell Solitaire and other popular variants with different levels of difficulty.\n\nThe collection contains 10 different games:\n• Baker\'s Game\n• Double FreeCell\n• Eight Off\n• ForeCell\n• FreeCell\n• HardCell\n• Milligan Cell\n• Penguin\n• Prison\n• Seahaven Towers','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57ob.jpg'),(14438,'Grr! Bearly Sane','2003-12-28','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Daniel is having a bad day.\n\nForced to wear a rancid bear suit and endure endless torment from his boss, and an endless multitude of horrid children, just so he can afford to keep his small crummy suburban flat, Dan finally SNAPS!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3tm9.jpg'),(14439,'Little Luna','2025-02-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Little Luna is an engaging puzzle-platformer where every step is a race against time! Help little moth to escape the dark and dangerous cave!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pja.jpg'),(14440,'Love 15','2025-01-21','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Classic 15-block sliding puzzle with a devious twist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pjh.jpg'),(14441,'Sex College','2024-03-23','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the world of Sex College, an exciting adult only visual novel that will unravel the secrets of college life and love!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qe5.jpg'),(14442,'Strangers of the Power','2017-08-17','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Strangers of The Power is a dungeon crawler RPG where the player can select between three different characters. Each character also has one unique follower.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rg4.jpg'),(14443,'Assassins of Darkness','2023-04-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After the death of Emperor without an heir, the Eastern Empire disintegrated and fell into turbulent times. Sakura, an elite assassin who betrayed her clan. She sought the power of darkness with the desire to end the civil war and unite all the clans into a new empire under her rule.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6d2f.jpg'),(14444,'Pac-Man Championship Edition DX: All You Can Eat Edition','2013-09-25','Arcade','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','This version contains four additional courses (Mountain, Big Eater, Championship III and Highway II), three skins (Dig Dug, Rally-X and Pac is Back), and two BGM (Pac Steps and Re-Entrance).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kt5.jpg'),(14445,'Floaty Fighters','2019-12-06','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Floaty Fighters is an indie free movement fighting game that takes place in The Clouds, where the Earth Animals have developed different methods of flight to take on the Sky Spirits in their nation. Battle it out with up to four players!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u63.jpg'),(14446,'Hot Wheels Monster Trucks: Stunt Mayhem','2024-10-18','Racing','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Packed with epic stunts and your fan-favorite monster trucks in action! You can smash, crash, and perform mind-blowing tricks across fantastical arenas in this adrenaline-fueled arcade adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oej.jpg'),(14447,'Grim Tales: Graywitch - Collector\'s Edition','2017-02-02','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Elephant Games proudly presents the newest installment of the Grim Tales series!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dvm.jpg'),(14448,'Confidential Money: 300 Nichi de 3000 Man Dollar Kasegu Houhou','2012-10-04','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','A otome game for PSP.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kk0.jpg'),(14449,'Escape from Work',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14450,'Second Wind','2012-08-10','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Web browser','Second Wind is a roguelike RPG in which you\'ll explore random dungeons as you battle monsters, upgrade your equipment and complete quests. You can choose and unlock new characters to play with, each character has 3 stats: dexterity, power and armor, which will increase or decrease during your adventure. Each character also has 3 unique battle moves, use them wisely!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pyq.jpg'),(14451,'Life and Death: A Journey of Star-Crossed Lovers','2023-08-19','Platform','Web browser','Switch between life and death by pressing 1 and 2. Move using the arrow keys or WASD; can use space to jump as well. While playing as life, double jump or wall jump to get to death. While playing as death, use the shift keys to dash through slightly transparent walls.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14452,'The Operative: No One Lives Forever','2000-11-09','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation 2','No One Lives Forever is to be a fast-paced, story-driven first-person shooter that delivers over-the-top action, outrageous villains, and wry humor in the tradition of the great 1960\'s Bond films. You play Cate Archer an undercover operative for MI-Zero. Your mission is to arrange for the defection of a prominent East German biophysicist that goes by the name of Otto Dentz. However things go wrong when a terrorist group known as the HARM abducts Dentz during a flight to England.\n\nAssume the role of Cate Archer, an operative working for UNITY, a secret organization fighting to free the world from the clutches of H.A.R.M.. From tense subterfuge to in-your-face combat, No One Lives Forever ups the ante with 1960\'s-influenced spy action, vivid international locates, and deadly arch villains.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yzl.jpg'),(14453,'Front Mission 1st','2008-12-11','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Front Mission is a strategy RPG set in a futuristic world. This is a remake of Front Mission. Various organizations are trying to gain power through military assaults, piloting huge robots which are the main means of combat in those days. A war between the USN (United States of the New Continent and the OCU (Oceana Community Union) begins because of the so-called Larcus Incident. Huffman Island, a location with important weapon factories, is infiltrated by USN people under the leadership of commander Driscoll. Driscoll causes an explosion that blows the factory off, and puts the blame on the OCU soldier, Roid. A year later, Roid makes a living with his robot in the arena when he is approached by a mysterious man from the OCU. Embarking across Huffman Island, now controlled by the OCU, Roid receives a mission to investigate the USN forces recently sighted.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v53.jpg'),(14454,'Space Command Battleship',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Arcade','Sin plataforma','The universe is unfair. First Earth and now exoplanet Earth 2 is facing the same cosmic injustice...but You can stop this! Your SpaceCom battleship is in position, the weapons are ready to fire and the asteroids are incoming - Failure is not an option!\n\nThe derelict sound of space couldn’t hide the destruction of Earth. A war of rock that spelled the end of humanity as we knew it - everybody was dead and the few survivors waited to be rescued... rescue never came. That was 900 years ago now, the survivors that were left took refuge aboard the mighty SpaceCom One battleship - and over many generations they learn to control the spaceship and left the broken galaxy that we once called home...\nAfter 100 years of travelling through the vast and dark wilderness of the Universe: they came across Porous-Rift, a galaxy populated by exoplanets they may one day call home again. However, history came back to haunt the crew of SpaceCom One... the Asteroid Belt of Porous-Rift had ruptured, causing thousands of mighty asteroids to rip the only chance that humanity would have of repopulating. Humanity wasn’t ready then... so they must be ready now.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14455,'Six Sides of the World','2017-03-23','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, Nintendo Switch','Six Sides of the World is a puzzle videogame that takes you into an intergalactic journey through different star systems riddled with brain-racking challenges.\nSpatial orientation, logic and pure wit will be your weapons to go through the different cube shaped planetary systems. Each level will bring the threats to a whole new level, adding all kinds of sci-fi hazards: from portals to laser beams.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2260.jpg'),(14456,'Pokémon Omega Ruby','2014-11-21','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','During your adventure, you will battle Team Magma in Pokémon Omega Ruby and Team Aqua in Pokémon Alpha Sapphire. Team Magma seeks to increase the land, while Team Aqua wishes to increase the seas. In order to bring about these grand plans, each will turn to the power of a Legendary Pokémon: Groudon or Kyogre. Team Magma pursues Groudon, while Team Aqua goes after Kyogre. What could be driving them to such lengths?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sz3.jpg'),(14457,'Secret Little Haven','2018-01-30','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An adventure game about old computers, community, creativity, fandom, gender, and the internet. Alex Cole is a teenage trans girl in 1999 who has yet to figure herself out. She spends much of her free time on the internet, browsing a fan forum for her favorite magical girl show, and chatting with her friends.\nJoin her on her story of self-discovery through friendship and media as she explores her computer for the treasures and curiosities of the early internet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a5x.jpg'),(14458,'Nullspace',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience epic space battles in NULLSPACE, a story driven real-time strategy set in a retrofuturistic universe. Command massive fleets across the battlefield or jump in and take direct control of individual squadrons. Lead your forces to victory in visceral space combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kqt.jpg'),(14459,'Magic Puzzle King 2: Rolling Cat','2025-02-21','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this free 2D puzzle game, piece together the items your feline friends have knocked off and shattered.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pju.jpg'),(14460,'Hentai Girls: Pissy Pirate','2025-01-23','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Meet over 50 pretty anime girls in this relaxing puzzle game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bov.jpg'),(14461,'Inter-view','2019-01-14','Music, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','inter-view is a game where your choices create a unique piece of music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29rv.jpg'),(14462,'L-Room','2023-10-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Let\'s build the routes that connect the platforms. This is a first-person puzzle game where you have to understand the algorithm and select the correct nodes.Think carefully with a drone as a companion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zbe.jpg'),(14463,'City Bus Simulator 2024','2024-06-02','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on the ultimate urban adventure in City Bus Simulator 2024, where the bustling streets are your playground and the city\'s pulse beats through every road. Get ready to take the wheel of detailed buses, transporting passengers through a dynamic metropolis teeming with endless possibilities!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rbs.jpg'),(14464,'CowaCowa: Jinmenken','2024-10-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"CowaCowa: Jinmenken\" is a 3D horror adventure game based on the Japanese urban legend of the \"Jinmenken,\" a dog with a human face. Explore a hand-drawn 2.5D world from a first-person perspective, uncovering eerie mysteries in a quiet residential neighborhood at night.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9na1.jpg'),(14465,'Payday 3: Silver Edition','2023-09-18','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Payday3 is the much anticipated sequel to one of the most popular co-op shooters ever. Since its release, Payday-players have been reveling in the thrill of a perfectly planned and executed heist. That\'s what makes Payday a high-octane, co-op FPS experience without equal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7387.jpg'),(14466,'Dr. Science quest','2022-02-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dr. Science quest - Even the most brilliant scientists need rest. But bad luck, you got into a nightmare of the protagonist, where all the computers from his laboratory were scattered across the distant corners of consciousness. Collect all the equipment in this unusual platformer, otherwise be in trouble!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hiy.jpg'),(14467,'Don\'t Go Bang!',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS)','Sin plataforma','Don\'t Go Bang is the first full PC title brought to you by Dalriada Games. In this ambitious real-time strategy experience you assume the control of the UOD (Unstable Ordinance Disposal). A division tasked with the uncovering and defusing of explosives planted by the infamous terrorist cell known as \"Fraction\". You command an elite team of specialists, each with their own unique skills, abilities, and personalities. You must monitor the maps and gain information from your expert intel team to find bomb locations, and discover Fractions ultimate plans.\n\nYou are the last protector of a city strewn by chaos and terror. Don\'t let \'em down sir.\n\nIn Don\'t Go Bang! for PC, every decision matters. The terrorist cell, Fraction, is unforgiving, and it\'s reflected in the game with permadeath and autosaves to make going back on decisions impossible. You\'ll have to make difficult choices every day as the Commander of the UOD - but remember your ultimate goal is to protect civilians and to prevent panic and terror.\n\nYou can\'t do it alone. Using your limited funds, you must continually recruit and manage your team of professional bomb disposal experts, teach them to grow their skills, and to monitor channels and the map for suspicious activity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bga3m2nc4k3sb5ld0x0i.jpg'),(14468,'Kirby no Omochabako: Ball Rally','1996-02-08','Arcade','Satellaview','In Kirby\'s Toy Box - Ball Rally, the player\'s goal is to guide Kirby through an obstacle course. He/she can do this using proper timing and the A Button; when A is pressed, some green platforms extend while others retract. Spherical Kirbys are released from the top-most door one by one. They can\'t stop rolling, so the player must extend the right platforms to guide the Kirbys safely over spikes. As more Kirbys join the playing field, it becomes increasingly difficult to guide them all to the exit. The player scores points by getting a Kirby to the exit. There are 50 Kirbys altogether.\n\nLike every other sub-game in Kirby\'s Toy Box, this game could only be downloaded by the Satellaview during the brief period it was broadcast.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30d8.jpg'),(14469,'That Flipping Mountain','2021-11-17','Platform, Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A physics driven flipping and skiing game inspired by \"Getting Over It\". Flip yourself up a massive mountain of stuff! Fall down, rage, get up, keep flipping!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48wm.jpg'),(14470,'Farewell',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','An emotional RPG with emotion system and combat interactions between characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m4b.jpg'),(14471,'Macht Magie','2024-11-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pjr.jpg'),(14472,'Project N3T','2023-10-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take control of a test subject tasked with testing out a new device that functions as a powerful magnet. Complete a few tests by moving metal objects and using the magnet as a grappling hook in this short single-player experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73c2.jpg'),(14473,'Spacewrecked: 14 Billion Light Years From Earth','1991-02-01','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this sci-fi RPG you are sent to a fleet of spaceships which have been invaded by aliens who escaped during a routine mission. This involves walking around and fighting off any aliens you encounter, while collecting keys for the doors. A toxic coolant must be handled carefully if this is to be achieved. 6 programmable robots can help with repair chores The game\'s control system has a direction pad for moving and inventory mapping.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xpo.jpg'),(14474,'Stages of Grief','2021-05-16','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Abstract exploration game based loosely on the five stages of grief.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30ot.jpg'),(14475,'The Prisoner','1980-12-31','Adventure','Apple II','Text-based adventure game inspired by the cult classic British television show about a former spy who is abducted and sent to a resort-themed \"prison\" where his captors attempt to get him to reveal why he resigned from his classified job.\n\nThe game takes place on \"The Island\", where the player travels from building to building, each hosting a metaphorical quest in which the player\'s creative thinking skills are tested. Players demonstrating individual thinking eventually gain access to the Island\'s \"Caretaker\" and their ensuing conversation (using a language parser) can lead to the player\'s freedom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vfbig6vxifayzln9iehl.jpg'),(14476,'Samorost 1','2021-05-20','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Explore the beginnings of the Samorost series in the space gnome’s original bite-sized adventure, formerly released in 2003. Now with remastered sounds, enhanced graphics, and new music by Floex.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30wt.jpg'),(14477,'Sounds of Music','2017-12-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sound of Music is a short and minimal puzzle game that harmonizes the sounds of music.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14478,'Little Knight 2: Old Dreams',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Little Knight 2: Dark Souls of the Past \"is the official 3D RPG sequel to the classic\" Little Knight \", continuing the passion and adventurous spirit of its predecessor, and creating a broader and more free medieval fantasy world.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14479,'Ultimechs','2022-09-15','Fighting, Simulator, Sport','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3','Your mech is ready. The crowd roars. Welcome to the arena! The thrill of professional athletics meets the precision of purpose-built machines in Ultimechs, the next multiplayer VR gaming experience from Resolution Games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5f7p.jpg'),(14480,'Child of Eden','2011-09-30','Shooter, Music','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Child of Eden is a multi-sensory shooter that will send players diving into a kaleidoscopic matrix of synchronized music and mind-blowing visuals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vgv.jpg'),(14481,'Dandy Dungeon: Legend of Brave Yamada','2016-01-15','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','A puzzle RPG about a game developer that loses his job and finds true love in his quest to make his first independent game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tec.jpg'),(14482,'Tom Clancy\'s The Division: Collector\'s Edition','2016-04-08','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A devastating pandemic sweeps through New York City, and one by one, basic services fail. In only days, without food or water, society collapses into chaos. The Division, a classified unit of self-supported tactical agents, is activated. Leading seemingly ordinary lives among us, The Division agents are trained to operate independently of command, as all else fails.\nFighting to prevent the fall of society, the agents will find themselves caught up in an epic conspiracy, forced to combat not only the effects of a manmade virus, but also the rising threat of those behind it. When everything collapses, your mission begins.\n\nTom Clancy\'s The Division Collector\'s Edition Includes:\nTom Clancy\'s The Division Game\nSeason Pass\nReal Agent Watch\nPoster\nAgent Armband\nArt Book','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i27.jpg'),(14483,'Care Bears: Unlock the Magic','2025-03-27','Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Dive into a world of fun and adventure with the Care Bears in \"Care Bears: Unlock the Magic\" Play as Cheer Bear and her friends in a variety of arcade games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94jp.jpg'),(14484,'Sally Face','2016-12-14','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In this story-driven adventure game, players will interact with Sal\'s world and his nightmares. The main path typically requires casual effort. However, there are hidden surprises to be found and bonus mysteries that may invoke a bit of head-scratching for those players up to the challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wku.jpg'),(14485,'Lens Adventure','2024-06-28','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lens Adventure is an action puzzle game where you play as Talia, a Magic Academy graduate student. Use the camera\'s time-space magic to solve puzzles: create platforms by photographing objects and use time magic to undo mistakes. Can you return to the academy before the dorm lights go out?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fkv.jpg'),(14486,'Neo Drift Out: New Technology','1996-07-26','Racing','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, Neo Geo MVS, Neo Geo CD','This is an arcade-style rallying game with a particular isometric view. To start, players chooses between three big Japanese rally-spec vehicles—the Mitsubishi Lancer, the Subaru Impreza, and the Toyota Celica—which vary in their Speed, Control, and Body stats.\n\nIn each racing stage, the player needs to get to the finish line in the shortest time possible. If the clock hits zero, the player loses and the game is over unless they can continue. While driving, the time is hindered by barrels, puddles, slippery ice, cones and other obstacles in the player\'s path. Even other cars driving can be an obstacle. Also the player has to keep straight when driving up slopes, or the car will swerve and crash. The player can gain more time if they make it through checkpoints in between the starting and finishing points. The player can also take shortcuts. Before making a turn, the player will always get an immediate warning on the screen with a voice saying which direction the player ought to turn and certain warnings.\n\nAside from the starting Practice stage, there are six other stages to be conquered: European, African, Snow Land, Southern Hemisphere, Scandinavian, and Great Britain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gicaeninki0hts8g1et5.jpg'),(14487,'They Live in the Fractures','2025-02-26','Indie','Web browser','David finally finished his time machine and will be able to stop time and venture to the unknown realm of frozen time. But one should not go and play God.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gga.jpg'),(14488,'Banana Prince','1991-12-20','Platform, Adventure','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','Banana Prince was developed by KID and released in Japan by Takara on December 20, 1991. It was also released in Germany in February 1992, with slightly different graphics and gameshow questions based on the region. It is a single player platform game designed for the Nintendo Entertainment System.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vpz.jpg'),(14489,'Galaxy Odyssey','2025-03-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a Space Journey with Spacecraft. Control your spacecraft with six degrees of freedom as you explore the vastness of space. Activate Beacons to extend your signal range and refuel to keep moving forward. Beware of asteroids, debris, and lasers aimed at taking you down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i4a.jpg'),(14490,'Counter-Strike Nexon: Studio - Zombies: Oz\'s Trio',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','One of the most well-known tales, The Wonderful Wizard of Oz, and its lessons can easily be converted to the land of zombies. A true hero should have a strong heart and courage to fight the endless enemies, use their brains so as to come up with tactics against the toughest of bosses and not get overpowered by zombies, and most importantly, a true hero must have a good team to challenge the impossible.\n\nHowever, Zombies: Oz\'s Trio is no fairy tale and happy endings depend strictly on battlefield experience and firepower. We introduce a new set of unique DLC weapons that will help you come back home safely.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14491,'The Lord of the Rings Online: Helm\'s Deep','2013-11-20','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Helm\'s Deep continues the Epic Story into the western plains of Rohan, allowing players to take a direct role in the battle for Helm\'s Deep and advance the level cap to 95.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/eub9abwsj48buxorxffh.jpg'),(14492,'Shadow Fight 3','2017-11-16','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','Step into the breathtaking world of shadows at the time of changes. Become a mighty warrior, a redeemer who\'ll compel it to his will and bring it into the new era of martial arts! In this RPG-fighting game you will take on a role of a hero whose destiny isn\'t determined yet. How do you see your future? It\'s your call! Choose from three different fighting styles, experiment and combine your gear, learn some fresh new moves and explore a massive world full of adventures! Reveal all its dark secrets...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vto.jpg'),(14493,'Miner Rogue','2024-03-06','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An open-world crafting roguelike voxel based where everything is destructible and randomly generated, daylight is for exploring, mining rare minerals, forging powerful weapons, and building your fortress. As the sun sets, monsters emerge to attack your base.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vf6.jpg'),(14494,'Mia Fey: Ace Spirit Attorney','2015-12-31','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Follow Mia Fey, the original Turnabout Lawyer, as she uncovers the secrets of DL-6. Murder after murder, incident after incident, Mia Fey is one step closer to the the truth about DL-6. But at the same time, she\'s also getting herself into a cutthroat world of law, where all is not what it seems. In fact, the law system is broken. Prosecutors getting replaced every week, the prosecution department short on prosecutors... Utter chaos in the law. The ultimate question: will Mia Fey survive the world of law, and will she uncover the truth about DL-6? Or will she die trying?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89fu.jpg'),(14495,'Venus Eleven Vivid!',NULL,'Simulator, Sport','Android, iOS','The pinnacle of beautiful girls × soccer × simulation!\nThis isn’t just a typical beautiful girl game, it’s seriously about soccer!\n\nThis is a 2D Japanese gacha sports simulation game where you manage a soccer team of girls from diverse backgrounds and worlds by improving their skills. Each of them is competent in specific positions, some can only be goalkeeper, attacker, defender, midfielder and some can have multiple positions. The manager will have to choose the formation of his team. Also some girls have special skill allowing them to counter the ball or opposing players. During breaks, the manager can treat his players when they are exhausted or switch places to those who are not playing on the field. The soccer gameplay is focused on the choice of action to be carried out for the player currently having the ball or being close to the opposing player having it. There are visual novel like stories about World Cup and personal characters stories. Each character is voiced to.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a73.jpg'),(14496,'Break Stuff VR','2023-06-06','Indie, Arcade','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2','Break Stuff in VR!! Smash for cash as a game show contestant. Throw and bash your way to victory!\n\nThrow virtual objects in the visually stunning and exciting stages! Demolish an office construction site. Wreck a country parking lot. Crash apart a carnival. Shatter a china shop.\n\nSwing baseball bats and sticks to break cool things! Bash away at fax machines and piñatas. Crush a showcase of expensive objects. Smash a fully destructible car!!\n\nHave fun destroying virtual objects without the real clean up or consequences!\nAll ages and experiences levels. Easy to play, difficult to master.\nFun for everyone!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6k2p.jpg'),(14497,'Questprobe featuring Human Torch and the Thing','1985-12-31','Adventure','BBC Microcomputer System, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Acorn Electron, DOS, Apple II, Amstrad CPC','Questprobe 3: Fantastic 4 is the third in a text-adventure series featuring Marvel Super Heroes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g7c.jpg'),(14498,'Love','2014-02-07','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Love is a reductive platforming game with a retro aesthetic and a focus on a challenging difficulty. It has an custom respawn system, 16 levels, 12 track soundtrack, competitive scoring, and a simple-to-use level creation feature.\n\nThe challenging levels are balanced with the inclusion of a simple yet unique respawn system wherein the player can leave a checkpoint at any location at any point, as long as they are on solid ground. Players have a number of gameplay modes to choose from, whether they want it easy, normal, or they want to try their hand at a mode designed specifically for Speed Running.\n\nBeyond the visual aesthetic, the challenging level design, and the abundance of features, there is the fantastic soundtrack composed by James Bennett, which brings the simple 3-color atmospheres to life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2272.jpg'),(14499,'Trash Trek Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Explore the world through the eyes of a homeless scavenger, rummaging through junkyards, outsmarting security, and turning trash into cash. Play solo or in chaotic multiplayer, where quick hands, smart moves, and a good sense of humor make all the difference. Laugh, hustle, and survive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i3z.jpg'),(14500,'Phoenix Wright: BEST Attorney','2017-06-21','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The award show has come to town and they are prepared to give awards made of rare gold to the best lawyer in Los Angeles. After debate, they narrowed the candidates for the award down to two lawyers: s spiky blue suit man named Phoenix Wright and loud red boy, Apollo Justice. Phoenix must prove himself to be the best lawyer in the country because if he doesn\'t win, his life may be thrown into absolute chaos!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88z9.jpg'),(14501,'NEO: The World Ends with You','2021-09-29','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Explore a stylized recreation of Shibuya, as you take on the role of Rindo to battle for survival and unravel the mysteries of the deadly “Reaper’s Game” in this new Action RPG and follow-up to the classic RPG hit \"The World Ends with You.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kzv.jpg'),(14502,'VR Ping Pong','2017-02-07','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Ping Pong VR is the first simulator that thanks to VR technology, and with the help of SteamVR Controllers, brings a ping pong table into your lounge.\nUsing 1:1 scale with virtual reality, you will have the sensation of play ping pong in reality: Virtual reality teleports you inside voxel-style environments that until today you could only dream to visit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24kr.jpg'),(14503,'Blast Royale','2022-11-30','Shooter','Android, iOS','Welcome to Blast Royale!\n\nBlast Royale is the next evolution of Battle Royale games, putting players and our community first. This is your game, your battle, and your way to play!\n\nPlayers are pitted against each other in a last person standing Battle Royale survival match. A player’s inventory influences the quality of items found on the battlefield, allowing players to create custom builds to suit their own playstyle. Plan, strategise and execute to dominate the battlefield.\n\nUniquely, players can also fully own their own items where they can buy, sell and trade them on the Blast Royale marketplace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60g6.jpg'),(14504,'Ground Zero: Texas - Nuclear Edition','2021-03-23','Shooter, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','As a tactical weapons expert, you soon discover it\'s crawling with aliens disguised as humans. Welcome to Ground Zero Texas. Ground Zero Texas - Nuclear Edition is science fiction full motion video western shooter. Completely rebuilt from the ground up, GZT is now at a level quality never experienced with its previous release and has also been expanded with additional content such as deleted scenes, alternate scenes, behind the scenes footage, production and development documents, and deleted scenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4dps.jpg'),(14505,'Elkrone no Atelier: Dear for Otomate','2012-04-12','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Otomate-developed visual novel for the PlayStation Portable based on the turn-based RPG Atelier series by Gust.\n\nMeriela (a.k.a Meri) has inherited her grandmother\'s workshop, and now it\'s up to her to decide what to do with it. One day, a fairy called Popotto pops up at the front door, asking her to create a mysterious item—the Blue Wakaka.\n\nNeither the client nor the alchemist have ever seen it, but since the fairy is in no great hurry, he decides to lodge with Meri to help her out with item synthesis, ingredient collection, monster fights and finding her soul mate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mlm.jpg'),(14506,'Ninja Hamster','1987-12-31','Fighting','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC','After a long journey over the seas, Ninja Hamster has come home to find his village being terrorised by a gang lead by Sinister Rat and The Lizard of Death. In this beat-em-up you must fight six members of the gang as well as the two leaders, one by one to save your village. The game is viewed from the side with the whole level shown on the screen. With a joystick or keyboard you use the fire button and a direction of the joystick/keyboard to pull off various kicks to hurt your opponent. Each fighter has a energy bar and an apple and when either is hit then their bar decreases but the bar will keep increasing when not hit. Once the bar is empty then the losing fighter is knocked down and part of his apple is removed. The winner of the fight is the fighter who removes the whole of his opponents apple. If you win then you move on to the next fighter. There is a two player option where the two players fight each other but both have two apples.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/trudiuoabt4iabefyqct.jpg'),(14507,'Double Kick Heroes','2020-08-13','Fighting, Shooter, Music, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Double Kick Heroes mixes a shoot\'em up with a rhythm game. You must survive on the highway to hell by killing monsters with your gundillac. Only the power of METAL can save your band!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eo5.jpg'),(14508,'Soul Shifter','2021-08-24','Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','In Soul Shifter, the player breaks through the ruins of what was once the most glorious of the castles and discovers the secrets behind the magical elemental energy that brought prosperity but also disgrace to the kingdom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41t8.jpg'),(14509,'2 in 1: Hash Block & Eagle Plan','1992-12-31','Sin género','Watara/QuickShot Supervision','A compilation of Supervision games on a single cart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/oiqeyyep07bwto0zuybu.jpg'),(14510,'Dark Escape','2020-04-28','Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A micro RPG','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14511,'Lunara',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Lunara is a captivating 2D platformer where players explore vibrant levels, collecting keys to unlock doors and progress. With challenges and engaging gameplay, you\'ll navigate obstacles and strategize your moves to conquer each level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pjn.jpg'),(14512,'Hexepta: Mayor Attack','2017-10-14','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After a young law student named Argus Hakan ends up defending in a trial on his mentor\'s behalf, he is thrust into a series of cases the following week, all involving various crimes that seem to target the mayor. Argus can solve these cases as they come, but there is clearly something more going on behind the scenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88x6.jpg'),(14513,'Ecchi Puzzle','2018-08-23','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ecchi Puzzle is a sliding puzzle game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14514,'Final Fantasy XVI: Echoes of the Fallen','2023-12-08','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Echoes of the Fallen is the first DLC of Final Fantasy XVI, which unlocks a whole new story, battles, weapons, accessories, level cap and more. For players who have completed the required quests, this new adventure begins before the base game’s final battle, as strange, dark crystals begin to circulate on the black market. Players will follow Clive and his friends during their investigations as they encounter a group of suspicious traders, leading them to a long-abandoned Fallen tower known as the Sagespire. There, they will unravel the terrible secrets that await within.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hhs.jpg'),(14515,'Warrior Lords','2024-04-11','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warrior Lords offers a furious medieval arcade experience, drawing inspiration from classic beat \'em ups. Battle through Western Europe wielding cold steel, delivering powerful kicks and summoning dragons. Choose from 6 unique heroes and defeat your rivals in a quest for supremacy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80pl.jpg'),(14516,'Can Androids Pray: Red','2019-07-10','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Can Androids Pray: Red is the red version of the critically-acclaimed 3D narrative game about two angry femme mech pilots at the end of the world, and God.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co251p.jpg'),(14517,'Little Witches vs. Monsters',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14518,'Scrapping Simulator','2020-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Low Poly eWaste Scrapping Simulator Game.Start your own eWaste Handling business','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zra.jpg'),(14519,'Meow Meow Kattie',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Cute cats hidden in a completely hand-painted black and white world, can you find them?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pk7.jpg'),(14520,'Dead Flamingo',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dead Flamingo is an action-adventure fantasy game that follows the epic story of a young fisherman driven by hopeful ideals in an insidious world that meets its end every seven days.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70c1.jpg'),(14521,'Megadimension Neptunia VII: Weapon Pack',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Pack a punch with this weapon pack! Each character gets two new weapons.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14522,'Vampyre Crusade',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a story where you play as a holy knight and a Nun from a fictional religious order of knights. You both were requested to come to this castle in Romania for a royal event, which turned into a crusade of vampires from another dimension. You must rescue all the royal family from different type of blood-eaters like: Skeletons, Ghouls, Large bats, lesser vampires, Hellhounds, Werewolfs, Wraiths, Incubus, Succubus, Bi-Incubus Devils, Greater vampire and their cult of human followers.\n\nIt is a Souls-Like experience but with melee weapons and guns and crafting of healing items and crossbow bolts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wqg.jpg'),(14523,'MOBA Dodge Trainer',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14524,'Seedlings','2023-09-22','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Immerse yourself in nature as a sentient seed in this relaxing award-winning 2.5D puzzle platformer. Possess different plant creatures with unique abilities and find your way through the New Zealand native forest, made using real photos and videos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kw7.jpg'),(14525,'Verho',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Verho is a Dungeon Crawler Dark RPG game that is inspired by games like \"King\'s Field\" and \"Lunacid\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qvl.jpg'),(14526,'Super Mario World: The Second Reality Project 2 - Zycloboo\'s Challenge','2014-07-13','Platform, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','This is the sequel to the \"Second Reality Project\", which is something different from the first part. This game features new GFX, some new custom blocks and custom sprites, a new overworld map and different music. The game contains a lot of ripped GFX from other games like \"Super Mario Land 2 & 3\", \"Sonic 1 & 2\", \"Alfred Chicken\" and much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ccd.jpg'),(14527,'Phoenix Wright: Ace Attorney - The Contempt of Court','2017-03-22','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Phoenix Wright: Ace Attorney - The Contempt of Court is a fangame based on the Ace Attorney series. Created across eight years, the game features various four original cases in the Phoenix Wright storyline.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zcg.jpg'),(14528,'Absolute-Full-Life','2024-11-06','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Colourful survival horror first-person shooter with manual weapon reloading and a mystery environment. Discover every secrets in an open world full of diverse enemies and hidden locations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tt4.jpg'),(14529,'Strategic Mind: Spirit of Liberty','2023-10-26','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Strategic Mind: Spirit of Liberty is a history-driven turn-based strategy set in WW2. Lead the scarce Finnish forces through the Winter War, Continuation War, and Lapland War. Save your country’s very existence from the Red Menace. Niet Molotoff!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co425g.jpg'),(14530,'Ravenholm','2006-01-01','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Developed in the Czech Republic by Lord Games, Ravenholm is a single-player Half-Life 2 modification based around the terrifying atmosphere, visuals and gameplay from the Half-Life 2 chapter of the same name. With a different and greatly expanded story and many new locations, you will find yourself battling many more zombies, headcrabs and more in a bid to free the town from this horrific, nightmarish infestation.\n\nThe atmosphere in the original HL2 game was both interesting, and terrefying, and that is the driving force behind our choice on creating a modifacation on that enviroment alone. All maps from this modifacation have a very similar kind of feel of atmosphere and gameplay from the original Ravenholm, but with an different and expanded story, and many new locations. So, you will find yourself battleing many more Zombies, Headcrabs, and more.\n\nThe sequel to the story after John (our player) escapes from Ravenholm goes on to Eye of the Storm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xsq.jpg'),(14531,'Moorhuhn Jump and Run: Traps and Treasures','2022-05-15','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Moorhuhn \'Traps and Treasures\' for Nintendo Switch brings 21 challenging levels + 6 bonus levels full of dangerous traps, devious enemies and hidden treasures!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5am8.jpg'),(14532,'Idol Hell','2023-03-03','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Idol Hell is the beginner friendly bullet hell game! Play as Medli and fight through hoards of enemies and meet vibrant cute bosses! Play at your pace and choose from 4 difficulties!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5h6x.jpg'),(14533,'Lust \'n Dead',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14534,'Deeper',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14535,'Ridge Racer 64','2000-02-14','Racing','Nintendo 64','Ridge Racer 64 gives Nintendo 64 owners a chance to jump into the world of Ridge Racer. Besides exclusive tracks, this edition contains races from the PlayStation Ridge Racer series, with improved graphics and a new set of cars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6y4q.jpg'),(14536,'Sultan\'s Game','2025-03-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sultan\'s Game is a card-based simulation and narrative game, inspired by The One Thousand and One Nights. You are one of the ministers of the mighty Sultan, a fickle, cruel king that treats his subject like pawns of a deadly game for his own pleasure. Forced to make dreadful choices to save your own life, you will have to find a way to survive not just the Sultan’s Game, but its consequences too.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vir.jpg'),(14537,'Rusty Lake Paradise','2018-01-11','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','\"Rusty Lake Paradise is set on a small remote island in the 18th Century. After your mother passed away the island seems to be cursed with the 10 plagues. It\'s your job to go around the island, interact with your family and help them vanquish the plague. The game offers ominous situations and bizarre rituals. Paradise builds upon the distinctive atmosphere and excitement from the Rusty Lake series. For the background graphics we collaborated with a well-known Dutch artist, Johan Scherft.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h4z.jpg'),(14538,'Lustful Dead',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14539,'Crystal Shard Adventure Bundle','2016-12-15','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Three short and intriguing adventure games from the makers of Heroine\'s Quest, spanning several genres and styles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nxj.jpg'),(14540,'Love x Debut',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14541,'Prismatic: Nox\'s Gate','2025-04-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hunt for Prismatic Gems and improve your team while getting embroiled in the complex situation of the Galactic Animal Kingdom. Prismatic is a retro turn-based tactical RPG with full voice acting, open world elements, and team battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lmm.jpg'),(14542,'The Endless Dream','2023-10-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into an enigmatic world, solve captivating puzzles, and unravel the mysteries of an endless dream. Reconstruct a fragmented life as the line between reality and illusion blurs. Challenge your mind and uncover the hidden truth in a gripping adventure that will leave you amazed!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76b7.jpg'),(14543,'Mini Monsters: Gravitational Consensus','2024-09-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mini Monsters Gravity Consensus is a charming 2D puzzle game with a unique gravity control mechanic. Perfect for a relaxing evening, it offers simple yet engaging puzzles that progressively challenge you as you unlock new levels and gameplay mechanics, making each step forward more exciting and fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pkf.jpg'),(14544,'Reverb',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Reverb is a multiplayer PVPVE extraction stealth shooter with a first-person perspective, set in a fictional Biopunk universe where there is a constant struggle for evolution.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8b13.jpg'),(14545,'Prima Doll: Mumei Tenrei','2024-05-31','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Prima Doll: Mumei Tenrei is the second volume of the kinetic novel series based on the multimedia project Prima Doll. It is a prequel to the anime series focused on the character Houkiboshi.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7j10.jpg'),(14546,'Lust Night',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14547,'Lily Story','2018-11-02','Simulator','Android, iOS','Create and decorate a cute character and background and make your own story!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mjm.jpg'),(14548,'Elemental Angel III','2022-04-27','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Elemental Angel III\" is a vertical scrolling flight shooting game. The player controls the protagonist fighter to fight the enemy in the universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4p09.jpg'),(14549,'Manaballs',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Manaballs is an online survival game with roguelike, extraction and farming elements. Venture into the woods, gather resources, build bases, and engage with players through voice chat. Team up to conquer dungeons, craft weapons, and raid enemy bases for that sweet loot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pjz.jpg'),(14550,'Hell is Other Demons','2019-05-20','Shooter, Platform, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Hell is Other Demons is a frantic, highscore driven, four-color, Bullet Hell Platformer with pixel art.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qbp.jpg'),(14551,'At Your Feet','2021-09-01','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this yuri dating sim, take on the role of Emma, a twenty year old college student of Mexican origin who has a secret: she has a foot fetish.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lr6.jpg'),(14552,'Drop Dimensions',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Drop is an endless runner with short enough sessions for quick casual plays and enough features and unlockables to fill more hardcore sessions. Smash your way through walls and dodge traps to survive! RPG-Lite features (leveling), quests, collectibles, achievements, leaderboards and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lls.jpg'),(14553,'Her Beautiful Dream','2019-11-27','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Available in the Story Me app.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pbh.jpg'),(14554,'Lust Fantasy',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Jump into the world full of elves, orcs, unbelievable situations and hot 18+ action in Lust Fantasy  - an adult isekai visual novel about a regular guy who accidentally gets teleported into a medieval world full of magic and mysteries! Would you find the way back?..','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s85.jpg'),(14555,'Mayhem Heroes','2023-02-10','Fighting, Platform','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Mayhem Heroes is a frenetic beat\'em up where you have to take down as many opponents as possible and, ideally, be the last one standing. Use punches, kicks, special moves and power ups to send your opponents flying out of the arena. Play with up to 4 friends and show them who\'s the boss!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l6m.jpg'),(14556,'Offworld Trading Company: Almanac','2016-04-28','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This 91 page Almanac contains: A detailed strategy guide by top-tier players Zultar and Cubit. Coverage from planetary geologist Kirby Runyon, who discusses each of the regions the game takes place in and how their real life features were used to influence the game’s map design.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66hx.jpg'),(14557,'Chronicles of Etia: A Yuletide Story','2021-12-01','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is the second game from the Chronicles of Etia: A Samhain Story. It is a story that happens at Yule and is a story of magic, mystery and evil fairies. A story to get you into the festive spirit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49en.jpg'),(14558,'SSX','2000-10-26','Puzzle, Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 2','SSX is the first in a series of snowboarding video games which specializes in extreme sports titles with an unrealistic or arcade feel, including exaggerated jumps, highly decorated mountain runs and improbable trick. Winning medals in a variety of events unlocks new courses, characters, and boards, as well as improved the boarder\'s abilities. New outfits may be earned by completing a character\'s trick book, by doing a number of specific tricks during play. Three kinds of boards are available to players: trick-oriented Freestyle boards, all-around BX boards, and racing-oriented Alpine boards, which are not meant to be ridden backwards. The courses are located around the world. The snowboarders also come from around the world, and speak in their primary languages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9232.jpg'),(14559,'Be Hunted','2020-12-23','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Be Hunted is a special co-op horror game, that combines ghost hunting, escape game, psychological horror, paranormal activity, and more. You can play alone, or up to 4 player for the basic gameplay mode. You will use your ghost hunting equipment to prepare yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tb3.jpg'),(14560,'G-Force','2009-07-21','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','G-Force draws you into the adventures of an elite team of trained guinea pigs on a mission to thwart a sinister plot to destroy the world. Take control of both G-Force commander Darwin and his sidekick, Mooch, as they apply their talents to defeat an evil army of altered household appliances.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vxj.jpg'),(14561,'Don Duality','2023-08-25','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Don Duality is a tycoon game with card mechanics. Send your gangsters to beat out debts, rob banks, steal valuables and launder the money they earn in your establishment. Hire staff for your restaurant and upgrade it','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co630z.jpg'),(14562,'Flappy Fetus','2016-08-20','Arcade','Android','Avoid coat-hangers with a colorful cast of embryos in a futile quest to be born.\n\nWARNING: This game may be highly offensive to you.\n\nFlappy Fetus is a single-player arcade game that will leave you in a broken mental state by the time you\'re done with it. Get as far as possible before your inevitable abortion.\n\nPlayers will attempt to set new high scores every time they play, all the while gathering sperm which can be used to unlock new Fetuses to control. Each Fetus will add something unique to the game, whether it be different controls, different environments, or something ridiculous like Ping\'s unfortunate eye situation.\n\nIt should go without saying, but this game is not for children. It\'s probably not for teens either. Or adults really..\n____________________________________________________\n\nSpecial thanks to FreeSFX for the use of some of their assets!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mxhzvw9sd2wqvka2yfyf.jpg'),(14563,'Jolt: Super Robot Racer','2016-11-15','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jolt is a fast paced, racing party game. The game at its core is a competitive platformer that’s all about maintaining momentum with skilful navigation. The players compete to be the last robot standing; using a charged burst of speed called the Jolt, and an array of different objects in the environment. Your goal is to outperform or outright sabotage the other racers. Eliminated players are down but not out through the use of the Void, a random Sabotage Power-Up that allows players to initiate revenge and change the outcome of the race!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yfw.jpg'),(14564,'Call of Clans','2025-04-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Call of Clans is an online turn-based strategy card game set in a magical world. Build a versatile deck with minion and skill cards to challenge equally matched opponents in a world of swords and magic. Team up with others to conquer challenging co-op dungeons','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aw0.jpg'),(14565,'Beastly Bites','2025-02-22','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A fast-paced action-adventure where a cursed woman wields an oversized chopstick to battle food-themed monsters. Progressing through surreal realms, will she be able defeat the Food God who\'s behind her curse and reclaim her humanity?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9med.jpg'),(14566,'Pajama Sam 2: Thunder and Lightning Aren\'t so Frightening','2012-04-05','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Join Pajama Sam, the world\'s youngest superhero as he journeys to World Wide Weather, the storm-stirring factory in the sky! Sam\'s spent on to many evenings cowering under the couch, so he sets out to conquest his fear of thunderstorms. Just as our little guy begins to learn that storms aren\'t as bad as they seem, Sam accidentally send the weather system into a frenzy. Now, there is snow in Saigon, and sunshine in Seattle! He\'ll need your child\'s help to explore this wonderful world filled with challenging puzzles, fun games, and fantastic new friends as they help Thunder and Lightning fix the broken machines and return the world\'s weather to normal before Mother Nature finds out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qs0.jpg'),(14567,'Dmod','2020-07-14','Shooter','Android','Dmod is fan mademobile port of GMod','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cit.jpg'),(14568,'Lazaretto','2017-05-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Lazaretto is a first-person survival horror video game set in the current day. You play the descendant of a man who once worked at an old and inactive facility, rumored to be located on a haunted quarantine island - a Lazaretto. Armed with only with a flashlight and nagging curiosity, your goal is to explore the environment, uncovering mysteries surrounding an artifact which has recently fallen into your possession.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27zg.jpg'),(14569,'Thanks, Come Again','2022-08-09','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game by Incisor Studios for the Cartomancy Anthology. A game about the day-to-day of a simple shopkeeper and their complex wares. Try not to give too much of yourself away.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fiu.jpg'),(14570,'Vegas Party','2018-06-21','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Quiz/Trivia, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The game takes the player into the gambling-friendly universe of this over-the-top version of Las Vegas city.\n\nPlayed as a race, the goal is to reach the end of the Strip before anyone else. Trust no one and forget the meaning of the word \"mercy\" because it does not apply here!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bdp.jpg'),(14571,'懒人修仙传','2018-11-14','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14572,'Man For Takeaway','2024-09-26','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is an independently developed game that simulates deliver the take-out. There are various scenes in the game, such as day, night, and rain. You can also experience using different modes of transportation for food delivery and feel the competition among peers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93m9.jpg'),(14573,'Gundan: The Crowd Shooting','2010-08-14','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vqs.jpg'),(14574,'Damn Ropes','2023-03-25','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Damn Ropes is this one hard game nobody wants to play because it\'s too difficult a challenge but you play it anyway. Use your rope to swing from platform to platform. Perform impressive maneuvers, beat diverse challenges and speedrun your way through each level. Or just finish the levels at least.\n\nThere\'s no running and jumping in this platformer game. Use your rope to swing from platform to platform. Perform impressive maneuvers, beat diverse challenges and speedrun your way through each level. Oh, did I mention you can fall all the way down to the beginning of each level?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co680k.jpg'),(14575,'ToHeart','1999-03-25','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation','ToHeart is a remake of the original 1997 romance visual novel with a completely revised script, full voice acting for all characters except the protagonist, new art, and mini-games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5umx.jpg'),(14576,'Zip: Set One','2018-03-11','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A challenging and minimalist maze race game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bcj.jpg'),(14577,'Kingdom of Rhea','2019-10-03','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Save the world or save life? During your adventure in Rhea, you will have to make a choice. Will you launch into the adventure and deciphering the riddles of Rhea. Would you be able to face the ancient gods?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44i3.jpg'),(14578,'Cart Capers',NULL,'Racing, Indie','Sin plataforma','Cart Capers is a fast-paced arcade racing game where players push, steer, and stunt their way through dynamic challenges using shopping carts. Race against rivals, pull off tricks, and compete in chaotic multiplayer modes or take on a fun-filled single-player adventure','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14579,'Sweet Home 2: Look and Find - Collector\'s Edition','2024-06-02','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Grab a warm blanket and get comfortable for more object-seeking!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9sed.jpg'),(14580,'Tokyo Waning Moon','2024-11-20','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tokyo Waning Moon is a two-button survival action in moonlit Tokyo! Slash zombie hordes rushing from left and right - no escape, no retreat! Level up your skills, chase high scores, and conquer time attack challenges!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91xw.jpg'),(14581,'Be Hero','2021-03-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Be Hero is a farming/crafting RPG about an aspiring hero who arrived late to the final battle and needs to work in a tavern to be able to return home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tz5.jpg'),(14582,'Green Star Revenge 3: Back to the Safe Sear Temples','2019-12-31','Platform','Nintendo 64','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8i40.jpg'),(14583,'Harezora Monogatari Again!','2022-12-15','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"HarezoraMonogatari Again!\" is an MMORPG where players can enjoy adventure and combat in a fantasy world. Choose from a variety of races and classes to create your character, team up with allies to challenge powerful enemies, and explore a vast world. Regular updates add new content, and the game offers both PvE and PvP gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fz7.jpg'),(14584,'Sally\'s Salon','2009-08-17','Simulator','BlackBerry OS, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Legacy Mobile Device','Sally\'s Salon asks players to help Sally fulfill her dream of opening the most fabulous hair and beauty salon in the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co528l.jpg'),(14585,'50 Pinch Barrage!!','2015-03-12','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, Nintendo Switch','Can you survive a 50 Pinch Barrage? Cinematic PINCH-delivering action!!\n\n50 Pinch Barrage!! is a cinematic PINCH-delivering action title that will ignite your inner adventurer.\n\nYou will assume the role of a treasure hunter that makes an emergency landing on a mysterious island. With traps and obstacles, not to mention angry natives and wild beasts, thrown at you one after the other, do you have what it takes to get yourself out of the pinch and off the island in one piece?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c43.jpg'),(14586,'Eternia: Pet Whisperer','2021-05-03','Adventure, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Tired of the daily churn at the office, only to come home to an empty apartment? The Rainbow Dome shelter will help you find the perfect partner to spice up your life! Take a plunge into our exotic selection of pets, and you\'ll surely find the piece of you you\'ve always been missing!\n\nInspired by Hatoful Boyfriend and the team’s love of animals, Eternia: Pet Whisperer is a short visual novel that sees you venture to a local deluxe animal shelter to find a companion to cure your loneliness. What ensues is a week you’ll never forget.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2y7j.jpg'),(14587,'Tiny Traffic','2021-02-25','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tiny Traffic is a relaxing turn-based puzzle game about re-directing the flow of traffic, in order to safely park all cars. There\'s no timer or score to distract you from getting lost in the puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wvu.jpg'),(14588,'Heileen: Sail Away','2008-10-06','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14589,'Galmedes','1993-01-01','Shooter','Arcade','A vertically scrolling shoot \'em up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oyo.jpg'),(14590,'Intralism: Rebuild','2021-12-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Intralism: Rebuild - fast and hard rhythm game. Listen to music and match arcs to the beat. Master all beatmaps or create your own and challenge friends with online multiplayer. But remember: wrong button - failed try.\n\nThis is a rebuild-remake of the original Intralism. It\'s main idea is to fix all the remaining issues of original game. The main focus of development was on the maps editor and global ranking. Players are able to easily add their favorite music into the game and play it with friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hfz.jpg'),(14591,'DinoScape','2020-08-15','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','As a brave caveman, save the dinosaurs from extinction! Try to escape from meteorids, lava, sharp teeth and deep abysses together with your riding dinosaur.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sjm.jpg'),(14592,'LEGO Island 2: The Brickster\'s Revenge','2001-10-12','Arcade','Game Boy Advance','Players control Pepper Roni and go around the island trying to locate the Constructopedia pages. Pepper can give the pages he found to certain characters who in turn will build a structure that will help improve the island. Pepper will also have to partake in various mini-games throughout the game. Also, finding hidden Lego character cards is the games reward for observant exploration of the island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xvw.jpg'),(14593,'Medieval Heroes Gold Hunt',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14594,'101 Cats Hidden in Istanbul','2025-01-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Find and discover 101 cute cats hidden throughout the Istanbul landscape in this hand-drawn hidden object game. Can you find them all?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9amd.jpg'),(14595,'Pocket Wars: Protect or Destroy',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Welcome to Pocket Wars!\nTake control of your army and guide them to victory in this retro-style, turn based strategy board game.\nBring reinforcements and supplies to an ailing 13th Century Castle in Wales, Britain before the invading Uzgoth Horde can destroy it.\nHelp the employees of a mining station escape the invading elemental demons of Io. Or, maybe you prefer to be the Destroyer and bring vengeance to Hrethra and ensure that the LunarCol employees will never escape?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14596,'Barback Blues: A Valhalla Story - Uttoushiki Hibi',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','The disheartening story of an empty man and his life in Glitch City','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14597,'Reality','2024-11-14','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','“Reality” is a 3D mystery game created by 100% Electronica, set in a world of FM Skyline’s surreal and minimalist designs brought to life. Explore an open dream world and solve abstract puzzles with only a careful eye and ear as your guide.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97qx.jpg'),(14598,'Exodus','2024-01-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Save Moses\' girlfriend from the clutches of the prince of Egypt, Ramses, in this thrilling adventure across the Egyptian desert. Face enemies and bosses, find items and power-ups scattered throughout a fantastic 2D open world full of challenges, secrets and much more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7t7g.jpg'),(14599,'Photographs','2019-04-03','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','\"Photograph\'s big secret is that it\'s not a puzzle game. It\'s five puzzle games. \nThe game is divided into five distinct stories, set in five different times and locations, A player will learn how to solve progressively difficult puzzles in one story, and then move to the next story which has completely different gameplay. \n \nThat\'s important because Photograph\'s other big secret is that it\'s not a puzzle game, it\'s a narrative game. The dioramas, the photographs, the sound, the voices, and the puzzles, come together to create a cohesive narrative experience that tells that specific story. \n \nMaybe.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jr6.jpg'),(14600,'Escape from Tung Tung Sahur','2025-05-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You wake up trapped in a creepy, abandoned village — no lights, no friends, just you... and a whole lot of trouble.\nYou’ve got one job: save the poor, caged Brainrot animals that the terrifying Tung Tung Sahur has locked up... and get them out safely.\nSounds easy? Oh, sweet summer child.\nTung Tung is always hunting. He knows you\'re here. He can smell your fear.\nAnd he’s not alone.\n- Bombardino Crocodilo patrols the village skies, randomly bombing the map. When you hear him coming, you\'d better find cover fast — or you’ll end up extra crispy.\n- Bombombini Gusini, Bombardino’s relentless brother, is circling above you at all times. If he spots you, he’ll immediately snitch to Tung Tung, who will come sprinting after you like he just clocked out for lunch.\n\nEach time you play, new Brainrot animals need rescuing. New paths, new panic, new escape strategies. Will you sneak, run, or... cry a little in a corner?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rdc.jpg'),(14601,'Captain Lycop: Invasion of the Heters','2017-02-10','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A space shooter mixing adventure, action and tactics. Face off against pen-pushing insects, merciless enemies and epic bosses. Your only hope is to banish all cowardice and follow a virtuous path.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25u3.jpg'),(14602,'No.8 High School','2025-03-07','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'ve returned to your high school classroom, where time seems to stand still. You need to look around and find something unusual to get through the last 30 days of school.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gjx.jpg'),(14603,'Hidden Facade','2024-04-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Throughout the game, you can play as all 2 main characters, and they all have a story to tell, but don’t let your eyes and ears deceive you. 2 stories bleed together, and it’s up to you to make sense of this tragic tale before the game ends. Who you believe is up to you, but everybody’s got a secret.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82qd.jpg'),(14604,'Batman: Arkham Knight - Season of Infamy: Most Wanted Expansion','2015-12-22','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Batman: Arkham Knight - Season of Infamy: Most Wanted Expansion is downloadable content released in December 2015. It adds four new missions to the game, each featuring iconic Batman villains: Ra\'s al Ghul, Killer Croc, Mad Hatter, and Mr. Freeze. These missions expand the \"Most Wanted\" side quests, integrating into the main game’s open world.\n\nPlayers confront unique challenges tied to each villain, further exploring their stories and connections to Gotham. The DLC also introduces new areas and gameplay mechanics specific to each mission.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fw6.jpg'),(14605,'The Elder Scrolls: Legends','2017-05-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Elder Scrolls: Legends is a strategy card game that explores the series\' characters, creatures, deities, and lore. Whether you have 10 minutes or five hours, Legends provides a variety of gameplay modes and challenges that are easy-to-learn but difficult to master. Built with all levels of players in mind, Legends offers accessible gameplay for beginners who want to get started quickly, and the game\'s depth keeps expert players engaged. With a wide variety of deck types and strategies, no two games are ever the same.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3woi.jpg'),(14606,'Brawl Stars','2018-12-12','Shooter, Strategy, MOBA','Android, iOS','Fast-paced 3v3 multiplayer and battle royale made for mobile! Play with friends or solo across a variety of game modes in under three minutes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mb9.jpg'),(14607,'Knightfall','2017-09-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Darkness consumes your surroundings and you will have to adventure through the labyrinth ahead of you to escape in this retro pixel-art action RPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co266o.jpg'),(14608,'Stronghold: Definitive Edition - Swine\'s Bay Campaign','2024-02-13','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\'Swine\'s Bay\' extends the base Stronghold: Definitive Edition campaign with seven new missions and extra achievements. Under the tutelage of the wise Sergeant, continue your quest to rescue the fabled \'Jewel of the North\' from the clutches of the villainous Pig.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14609,'Ace Combat 3: Electrosphere','2000-01-21','Shooter, Simulator','PlayStation','Ace Combat 3: Electrosphere is a combat flight simulation video game developed by Namco for the PlayStation. The third game in the Ace Combat franchise, it was released in Europe and North America in 2000 and was localized for specific regions.\n\nPlayers control an aircraft and must complete various mission objectives, such as destroying squadrons of enemies or protecting a base from enemy fire. Electrosphere carries a more futuristic science fiction-inspired landscape and world compared to the modern-day theme of its predecessors.\n\nThe international version of Ace Combat 3 differs significantly from the japanese release: its campaign has 36 out of the original 52 missions with no different paths. The story, as well as all related voice acting and cutscenes, was removed and replaced with a more basic story with no voice acting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8duy.jpg'),(14610,'Slime Brawly Brawl','2024-01-13','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An early prototype, Slime Brawly Brawl exists to scratch an itch. An itch for a simple, fast paced platformer melee game like 90s kids might have played and loved growing up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7niu.jpg'),(14611,'Hololive Error','2022-07-18','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hololive Error is a survival horror game where an occult magazine journalist decides to visit the town of Aogami to investigate its strange happenings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zpg.jpg'),(14612,'College Slam','1996-12-31','Sport, Arcade','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, DOS, Sega Saturn, PlayStation, Game Boy','Part of the NBA Jam series of basketball games, College Slam allows you to choose from over 40 real college teams and take part in head-to-head games, tournament games, and season-long play. The gameplay is arcade-style two-on-two fast action featuring backboard shattering wild dunks, power-ups and other crazy moves. The game also features fight songs from all the available teams.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u3l.jpg'),(14613,'Mina & Michi','2020-09-22','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Mina & Michi is a 2D top-down game about a girl and her friend, going on adventures, solving puzzles and defeating enemies through the seasons!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a3t.jpg'),(14614,'Boosty Bot','2016-09-28','Indie, Arcade','Android','This game is about a cute little robot who is minding his business until mysterious cog-shaped robots begin to fly towards him. It’s the Rotabots! They are not looking where they are going! It’s up to you to guide your little robot friend through the sudden Rotabot incursion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/m1wnxjfbhbltnaa46ccs.jpg'),(14615,'Zero\'s Fantastic Anecdote','2024-02-10','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Danmaku Shooting Game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p9g.jpg'),(14616,'Unrelaxing Quacks','2024-04-26','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Don\'t just sit back and watch these adorable rubber ducks float peacefully in a pool - instead, brace yourself for the unpredictable and wild world of quack destruction!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ind.jpg'),(14617,'Kidou Senshi Z Gundam: Hot Scramble','1986-09-28','Shooter, Platform','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','Mobile Suit Z Gundam: Hot Scramble is a multi-genre video game that is based on the anime Mobile Suit Z Gundam, and is one of the first Gundam video games.\n\nAside from the much later Famicom Mini release, there were two versions of the game: the original release; and a special release of the central location test version, sometimes dubbed Final Version. Only 1000 copies of this second version were ever released, making it among the rarest video game in history.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ork.jpg'),(14618,'Castle Combat','2025-03-30','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RTS, but the soldiers will act automatically: Each soldier has different characteristics/attribute values/action methods. Choose the appropriate soldiers and buildings according to the battlefield situation, and destroy the opponent\'s castle only through your strategy rather than operation!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r76.jpg'),(14619,'Psychroma','2024-06-11','Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Psychroma is a narrative-driven side-scroller where you play as a digital medium. Confront the past by piecing together the broken memories of a cybernetic house, and exorcise the ghosts in the machine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uwj.jpg'),(14620,'Rage Runner','2014-05-16','Racing, Simulator, Indie, Arcade','Ouya, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This fast, fun and challenging sci-fi game is truly like no other 3D racer, it will make you cry JUST ONE MORE TRY! Race through beautiful procedurally generated 3D space-scapes or a set of 13 hand-crafted challenges that will put your skills to the test.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y8p.jpg'),(14621,'I\'ll Be Here.','2019-02-08','Visual Novel','Web browser','\"I\'ll be here\" is a 10-hour prototype made for the NYU Game Center\'s prototype studio MFA class. This prototype is designed to be played alongside Emperatriz Ung\'s \"On A Cloudy Day.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72ak.jpg'),(14622,'Monster Complete World','1999-05-27','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation','Monster Complete World (ソフトモンスターコンプリワールド). The player controls a young kid that have to start his journey buying a pet and after that he will explore the land in search of new pets. The battle system is like this: You order different kind of attacks to your pet and when you see that the enemy is weak enough you can try to catch it to join it to your party. \n \nThe monsters you catch will join your party and can be used in the next battles. The player can also buy different kind of goods to cure his pets or improve them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l5l.jpg'),(14623,'Starship Wars','2022-01-18','Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Destroy enemies, bosses and everything you see ahead!! Get crystals to buy better starships and get stronger. Have fun in two different game modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4br1.jpg'),(14624,'Tower Field',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Tower Field is a roguelike tower defense game with a random generated world to explore and modular towers that you can customize and adapt to protect yourself from the dangers you discover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88q1.jpg'),(14625,'Stale Conversations','2018-04-09','Music, Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','Web browser','This game has been made from scratch in 48 hours by three people (two programmers and a musician) as an entry for JimJam. \n \nIt is about managing conversations of drunken space paratroopers. But basically it\'s just a funny interactive cutescene. \n \nChoose the conversation topics and watch the outcome (which is almost always funny).','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14626,'Warcraft III: The Frozen Throne','2004-02-27','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Warcraft III: The Frozen Throne adds a host of new features to the game, including four new campaigns that take you across the frozen continent of Northrend. Explore new maps and master new units such as the Troll Bat Riders, the Blood Elf Spell Breakers, and the destructive Mountain Giants.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xxv.jpg'),(14627,'Elemental Defender','2025-01-09','Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Elemental Defender is a tower defense game using card to power up your units. Build your deck and place powerful units to defend your base from passing enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nqf.jpg'),(14628,'Boushoku no Gaburion: The Good Eater','2020-08-31','Indie','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wet.jpg'),(14629,'Frog In the Well',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Frog just wants to get out of the well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5idp.jpg'),(14630,'Pogoman','2023-05-31','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Accept the challenge and jump through all the levels, open all the gadgets and especially be careful not to break anything around you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ks4.jpg'),(14631,'OffiAtrix: Rise of the Team Leader','2025-12-31','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An office action game where chairs drift, coffee flies, and work is optional! Hire, fire, and fight your way to the top! Expand. Dominate. Get rich. Just don’t end up without a chair and a paycheck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fxe.jpg'),(14632,'Street Fighter 6: Deluxe Edition','2023-06-02','Fighting, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Content\n・Full Game\n・Year 1 Character Pass','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pjq.jpg'),(14633,'Conradito Cafézito','2024-12-10','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It costs the price of a coffee – but it lasts much longer! Conradito Cafézito, is an idle and incremental game where you unlock recipes, automate processes, and expand your coffee empire while watching your profits rise with every click!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97x9.jpg'),(14634,'Das Verrückte Licht',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14635,'Zombie Go Remastered','2023-10-13','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zombie GO is a puzzle turn-based game with more than 50 beautiful levels. You play as a man who survived the virus and must run away from zombies. On some levels, you must survive people.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qbp.jpg'),(14636,'!mrak',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Immerse yourself in an alternate 2003 Hokkaido, where technology, politics, and criminal intrigue intertwine in the shadows. Use stealth, weapons, and the environment to your advantage to survive in a world where someone is pulling the strings behind your every move.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14637,'The Tower at Tortenna','2017-10-18','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','The Tower at Tortenna is a short first person exploration game where you pick your way amongst the ruins of a cloud-bound tower. Among the dust, secrets wait to be uncovered, ancient machines slumber, and a silent history hides in plain sight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wvb.jpg'),(14638,'Captain Firebeard and the Bay of Crows','2017-10-04','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Captain Firebeard and the Bay of Crows is an adventure/comedy visual novel. It has an arcade style mini-game that will have you holding your sides with laughter over its sharp humor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25u2.jpg'),(14639,'Teodoro','2021-03-08','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Adorable sokoban classic puzzle game with a great challenge and beautiful hand-drawn art. Help Teodoro to restore all Flowers Altars in the Peaceful Forest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z11.jpg'),(14640,'Angry Birds Opera','2011-10-13','Sin género','Web browser','Angry Birds Opera was a demo version of Angry Birds available for PCs using the Opera web browser. The game was released on the version 12 alpha of Opera Next on October 13, 2011, and closed it\'s servers one day later on October 14, 2011. As a result, the domain was also closed for a while until it finally expired sometime in the late 2010s. The game was located on opera.angrybirds.com.\n\nThe game was announced by The Register on October 11, 2011, and was meant to be available two days later on October 13, 2011. It released and was able to be playable for one day until October 14, 2011, when Rovio closed the game\'s servers without telling anyone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65io.jpg'),(14641,'Moe Moe Daiundoukai',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14642,'The Notzing Project','2019-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Deep underground, a government science facility lies dormant and abandoned. But when a man wakes up from being held in stasis, he must face whatever technological horrors caused the facility to shut itself off from the surface, and make it out alive. In this first person exploration game, you will find audio cassettes left by the scientists who once operated the establishment. Use the clues you can find to get out alive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co939w.jpg'),(14643,'The Pools','2025-03-21','Puzzle, Simulator','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Anomalies await you in the shadows of The Pools.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hhk.jpg'),(14644,'Dave Mirra Freestyle BMX','2000-09-26','Sport','Game Boy Color, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation, Dreamcast','Dave Mirra Freestyle BMX is a video game released in 2000 featuring BMX Rider Dave Mirra and other professional BMX riders. It was developed by Z-Axis Ltd. and published by Acclaim Entertainment under their Acclaim Max Sports label. The game was released on the PlayStation, Game Boy Color, Dreamcast and Microsoft Windows. The player\'s main objective in the game is to choose one of the riders and work their way through a total of 12 different levels, completing objectives to unlock new equipment. A sequel was released in 2001 entitled Dave Mirra Freestyle BMX 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cqz.jpg'),(14645,'Astrostrike',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Sin plataforma','You are the captain of the Galactic battleship, building hundreds of gun turrets, raising dozens of space fighters, establishing aircraft carrier groups, space stations, and conquering the entire Milky Way','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jrf.jpg'),(14646,'Craft the World: Bosses & Monsters','2019-06-25','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Repel an invasion of pirates from a ghost ship, deal with the were-dwarves that appear during blood moons in winter, solve a Sphinx’s riddle, and defeat a Monster from the Depths of the subterranean world in the “Bosses and Monsters” DLC!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ceq.jpg'),(14647,'Ahegal Seasons','2019-09-23','Music, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are the last man alive on the planet. Meet and undress beautiful women to save humanity. Find that special spot to make women ahegal. Master your lover skills and ladies will adore you. But be careful where you touch - You might end up with a broken heart, handsome!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4thd.jpg'),(14648,'Angry Birds','2011-11-25','Puzzle, Strategy, Arcade','BlackBerry OS, PlayStation 3, Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360','Angry Birds is a 2009 physics-based casual puzzle video game developed by Finnish video game developer Rovio Entertainment. Players control a flock of multi-colored birds on a mission to rescue their eggs from green-colored pigs. Using a slingshot, they launch the birds at these pigs stationed in or around different structures. The goal is to eliminate all the pigs on each level with a limited number of birds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4adm.jpg'),(14649,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s: Sister Location VR','2021-01-10','Strategy, Indie','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR, Oculus Quest','A VR recreation of the original Fnaf: Sister Location game.\n\nTake control of a late-night technician who must do maintenance work on active machinery and animatronics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4htw.jpg'),(14650,'Shard Storm','2017-06-28','Arcade','Web browser','A thrilling arcade challenge, where you try to avoid shards pushing you out of the screen, while scoring a point for each shard that exits your field of vision. 4 Difficulties with a high score for each.   \nEasy - low player speed, no trajectory lights  \nMedium, Hard, Hell - high player speed + trajectory lights','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/epgrsqba5c0rh1wlqren.jpg'),(14651,'Payday 2: Mountain Master Heist','2022-03-09','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Payday Gang sets out to put an end to the triads chapter. Taking the fight to the triads in their own penthouse apartment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68oh.jpg'),(14652,'The Day I Died','2018-05-10','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Day I Died is a first-person, short storytelling game with light and scalable puzzle and zombie melee fight elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mfupdaczdzaj7odxgsq9.jpg'),(14653,'Taghairm','2015-10-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser','\"Perhaps the most horrible of all recorded magical spells.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xrq.jpg'),(14654,'Puzzle With Your Friends','2018-04-24','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In Puzzle With Your Friends you can puzzle alone, with and also against your friends via the internet! Unique motives from different games and artists are available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y5v.jpg'),(14655,'Zombie Derby 2','2016-09-22','Racing, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Discover the dangerous post-apocalyptic world with cool upgradable cars!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l2w.jpg'),(14656,'Micro Star Command',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14657,'Mining',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14658,'Doki Doki The Yuri Parable','2018-08-05','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki: The Yuri Parable\" is a fan-made modification of the visual novel \"Doki Doki Literature Club!\" that reimagines the narrative through the perspective of Yuri, one of the original game\'s characters. Inspired by \"The Stanley Parable,\" this mod introduces a metafictional experience where Yuri becomes self-aware of the game\'s structure and mechanics. Players navigate through various scenarios, making choices that lead to multiple endings, each offering a unique exploration of Yuri\'s character and her interactions within the literature club. The mod features custom graphics, animations, and a soundtrack tailored to enhance the immersive experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fxm.jpg'),(14659,'Chronicles of Mystery - Secret of the Lost Kingdom','2011-04-21','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chelsea Connor, a bold and intelligent American journalist discovers the compelling evidence suggesting that the vault may contain the answers behind the mysterious death of her father 20 years ago. The only information Chelsea has about the vault is that it can only be opened by a single key.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n4g.jpg'),(14660,'The Black Heart','2021-10-21','Fighting, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','There is another world apart from ours. A world that was once beautiful but now is a hostile place ruined by war and hate. A blood stained world...\n\nHumans have ignored the existence of this other world because their destinies have never been bound to it...\n\nBut that is about to change since the king and creator of the other world has been murdered. His strength and will had disappeared as the time passed, turning him into and old and defenseless being.\n\nHowever, that didn\'t change the fact that within him the incredible power that allowed him to create that other world still existed. Because of that he was attacked by an entity called Final: A powerful creature that emerged from the infinite chaos that exists in the space between both worlds. In a single attack he ripped the king\'s heart and ran away with it to the depths of chaos.\n\nIt is said that the one that succeeds at freeing the power within the heart will be given an extraordinary strength; a power that could end all that exists if it falls into the wrong hands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co497c.jpg'),(14661,'Motel 666','2016-11-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A survival horror game. In order to succeed, players will need to search rooms for items and battle enemies throughout a haunted motel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bcq.jpg'),(14662,'The Museum of Hauntology','2024-11-01','Sin género','SteamVR','The Museum of Hauntology stands as a monument to a future that never was. Featuring counterfactual digital artefacts drawn from an alternative 1970s that did not quite happen. The work is intended to prompt contemplation of the recent past and the type of future in which we now find ourselves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n5n.jpg'),(14663,'Post/Capitalism','2017-11-28','Simulator, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A short game which depicts how we might reorganise the capitalist present into a postcapitalist utopia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ibi.jpg'),(14664,'Klostyn',NULL,'Shooter, Indie','Sin plataforma','KLOSTYN is a sci-fi shooter that stays true to the late-\'90s FPS style. The protagonist fights alien creatures and space pirates on a distant planet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p02.jpg'),(14665,'Cat Journey','2024-10-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cat Journey is a third person game that explores an underground city with a cat as the protagonist. There are many robot residents here, and it is necessary to find a way to communicate and understand the city with them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rfg.jpg'),(14666,'Breath of Fire IV','2000-04-27','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Breath of Fire IV is a single-player game that continues the story with these \"dragon people,\" who gave their lives to eradicate the evil goddess and restore peace in their world. This time around, battle has broken out between two powerful continents, and the fair Princess Elena has disappeared during a tour of the war-torn region. The princess\'s sister, Nina, who reigns o\'er the Windia Kingdom, vows to retrieve her missing sibling. She meets Ryu along the way, who joins the epic quest','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6opw.jpg'),(14667,'Final Fantasy IX','2017-09-19','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The console version of Final Fantasy IX brings enhanced character models, updated UI and fully remastered cutscenes. It includes convenience features such as autosave, optional cheats like max damage or no encounters, and platform-specific achievements or trophies. While the core experience matches the PC version, the console releases are optimized for smooth plug-and-play gameplay without the need for additional setup or mods.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oki.jpg'),(14668,'Wordsmyth','2021-02-14','Puzzle','Android, iOS, Mac','Wordsmyth is simple - one new puzzle, every day you play.\n\nNo timers, no levels and no distracting adverts - just you and todays 9 letters. Focus on them, absorb them and find as many words as you can. There\'s no pressure, so sit back and take your time.\n\nThe beautiful, dynamic scenery flows with every interaction, while the mellow soundscapes help draw you deeper into the experience.\n\nWith over 18 years worth of puzzles, Wordsmyth will provide you with a peaceful, meditative puzzling experience for years to come.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14669,'CyTale',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cytale is an immersive fantasy multiplayer online game that revolves around a rich lore featuring dragons, adventurers, and the battle against dark forces. Set in a world where dragons were once revered rulers, players embark on quests and challenges to overcome the aftermath of their withdrawal, leading to a world filled with danger and dark magic. The game combines elements of adventure, fantasy, and strategy genres. Its unique features include a captivating storyline, dynamic multiplayer interactions, and a focus on fostering a strong player community. With a seamless blend of exploration, combat, and teamwork, Cytale offers players a chance to engage in an epic journey of cooperation and heroism.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x38.jpg'),(14670,'Famicom Tantei Club Part II: Ushiro ni Tatsu Shoujo - Zengohen','2013-05-01','Adventure, Visual Novel','Nintendo 3DS, Wii','Famicom Tantei Club Part II: Kieta Koukeisha - Zengohen is the version of the Famicom Disk System game ported to later consoles, released first on the Japanese Wii Virtual Console.\n\nThis version of the game has both disks of the adventure (Zenpen and Kouhen), making it playable without the need to switch disks like on the original Famicom Disk System.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kvb.jpg'),(14671,'Tiger Fighter 1931: Tora!Tora!Tora! MP005','2021-08-04','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a shoot em up game. In this game the player combats a large number of enemies by shooting at them. Player control a fighter shoot down all the enemies fighter and all the enemy to win the game. The DLC include mission pack 005.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h67.jpg'),(14672,'Formula Racing Pro 2025: Extended Edition','2025-02-28','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14673,'Demon Skin','2021-09-30','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Demon Skin - is a brutal hack’n’slash set in a rough dark fantasy world, which combines unique combat mechanics, RPG and fighting game elements, and even some platformer features. With its versatile combat system you can fight enemies in both hardcore mode, changing battle stances and weapons in time, and in casual mode, slashing monsters left and right.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xi0.jpg'),(14674,'Entwined Challenge','2014-10-01','Sin género','Android, iOS','Entwined Challenge is an addictive and beautiful action reflex game that will mesmerize your senses and challenge your skills. Can you control two characters at the same time and master their path to evolution? With a critically acclaimed soundtrack and stunning visual design, Entwined Challenge will draw you into a unique sense of gaming zen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gdv.jpg'),(14675,'Infection','2021-01-13','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Infection is an original game where you fight infected cells before they can replicate and infect others. Roll and jump to healthy cells to reload serum and cure or kill the infected ones, while the thermomether keeps rising.\nLearn the game mechanics throughout 5 tutorials with challenges and continue with 30 levels of increasing difficulty. Available in english and spanish languages, there is a free version too.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2obb.jpg'),(14676,'Hidden Cats: St. Patrick','2025-03-19','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into the enchanting world of \"Hidden Cats - St. Patrick\" a hidden object game where your mission is to uncover every cat hidden within stunning hand-painted artwork. Let your keen eye and curiosity guide you through this captivating journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i4n.jpg'),(14677,'Walkies',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Happy-go-lucky dog helps save a local rescue centre, with help from furry (and not so furry) friends! Wag those tails and bound and bounce your way through this whimsical adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co663e.jpg'),(14678,'Bosquet','2025-03-27','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Une aventure narrative sur le thème de la maladie avec un gameplay du genre auto-battler. Explorez la forêt, affrontez des ennemis et rencontrez de nombreux compagnons aux personnalités uniques !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1w.jpg'),(14679,'Risen 2: Dark Waters','2012-08-09','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Set several years after the end of Risen, raging titans have devastated the world and pushed humanity to the brink of existence. Subsequently, monstrous creatures have risen from the watery depths of the sea and their attacks have brought all seafaring to a grinding halt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rje.jpg'),(14680,'Adventure Academia: The Fractured Continent','2022-09-08','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Adventure Academia: The Fractured Continent is a fully-fledged strategy RPG set in the world of Class of Heroes! Create your own party of students in a fantasy realm! Pick them up and guide them to victory against the monster hordes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8chk.jpg'),(14681,'Friends Killing Friends','2021-04-21','Shooter, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Friends Killing Friends is a PVP deathmatch where you kill your friend with a gun and a bunch of cards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ydb.jpg'),(14682,'Twistetchi','2021-06-25','Simulator','Handheld Electronic LCD','The Twistetchi is a licensed Tamagotchi Nano model based on Twisted Wonderland, a Japanese battle/rhythm mobile game co-developed by The Walt Disney Company and Aniplex, that prominently features several antagonists from the former\'s animated films.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ybr.jpg'),(14683,'Adventures of Deliveryman','2024-08-27','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Prepare for your first day of work as a delivery man, ride your bike, make deliveries, meet new people. Enjoy a delivery-filled story driven adventure in the not-too-distant future and discover the true nature of city\'s existence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g8t.jpg'),(14684,'Xolt','2015-11-01','Puzzle','Android, iOS','- WARNING - Playing Xolt might increase your IQ!\n\nXolt is an addictive number puzzle game inspired by 2048 and Chess, with levels, upgrades, achievements in a beautiful Stonehenge theme.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/d5ev5plozumpyi0u8qhk.jpg'),(14685,'Heart Abyss',NULL,'Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a world where there is an eternal war between the unions of the human race and beastmen, accidental deaths and slave trade are not rare. But what happens if two slaves by chance unite and survive together, being wanted? Leon and Ray are one of those.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7976.jpg'),(14686,'The Jumping Tofu','2022-11-25','Simulator','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Join BIG T on his exciting journey through the kitchen and make him jump! Enjoy the colorful comic graphics accompanied by atmospheric music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5un6.jpg'),(14687,'Defense Protocol','2023-11-11','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you have the resources and upgrades you need to leave the planet in this roguelike genre where you try to defend your base, survive, gather the necessary resources, and upgrade your technology while trying to repair your spaceship on an uncharted planet you crash-landed on?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7a32.jpg'),(14688,'Machine Mind',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What to do if your consciousness is trapped in a metal shell, and all around you is a post-apocalyptic world inhabited by enemies? There is only one task left - to survive at any cost!\nMachine Mind is an action game with survival and RTS elements, where you will have to build your own transportation, manage resources, build bases and blow up crazy raiders!\nCollect crafts, explore locations and fight to escape and discover all the secrets of this ruined world','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aos.jpg'),(14689,'Magic Sword Girl Twins',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Sin plataforma','Magic Sword Girl Twins is a turn-based RPG focused on strategy and growth. Explore the world with Rose, the sister of twin sisters, to kill the \'Old One\' and uncover hidden secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pjv.jpg'),(14690,'Mirrored Phantoms','2025-02-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Trapped in a nightmarish mannequin factory where reality itself is shattered, unravel the secrets of Mirrored Phantoms. Explore a deeply atmospheric world, solve the mystery of the mirror shards, and survive the terrors that await in this slow-burning, first-person horror experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g9d.jpg'),(14691,'Lazer Bykes',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14692,'NBA Dynasty',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14693,'Ikkitousen: Shining Dragon','2007-10-02','Fighting','PlayStation 2','Ikki Tousen (一騎当千 Ikkitōsen?, lit. \"a Mighty Knight who matches a Thousand Knights\"), also known as Battle Vixens in North America, is a manga series written and illustrated by Yuji Shiozaki. Based on the classic Chinese novel Romance of the Three Kingdoms, the series revolves around an all-out turf war in the Kanto region of Japan where fighters known as Tōshi (闘士?, meaning \"fighting soldier\") from seven schools battle for supremacy. The story centers on Hakufu Sonsaku, a fighter who transfers to Nanyo Academy, one of the seven schools involved in the turf war.\n\nThe manga started serialization in the seinen manga magazine Comic Gum, and the first tankōbon was released in October 2000, with a total of 24 volumes available as of September 25, 2015. The manga was licensed in North America and the United Kingdom by Tokyopop with adaptation from Keith Giffen under the title Battle Vixens, and in Australia and New Zealand by Madman Entertainment.\n\nA 13-episode anime adaptation produced by J.C.Staff aired between July and October 2003, on AT-X and other channels. A second anime season produced by Arms aired on AT-X between February and May 2007, spanning twelve episodes. A third anime season, also produced by Arms, aired on AT-X between June and August 2008, spanning twelve episodes and featuring an all-new plotline and characters. A fourth anime season produced by TNK and Arms aired on AT-X and other channels between March and June 2010, spanning 12 episodes and introducing new schools and characters. An anime OVA was announced by Media Factory, and premiered in Japanese theaters on November 12, 2011.\n\nThe first anime season was licensed in North America by Geneon Entertainment, but it is now licensed by Funimation after Geneon withdrew from the anime market. The second anime season is licensed in North America by Media Blasters. The third anime season was also licensed by Media Blasters,but it is now licensed by Funimation. The fourth anime season is also licensed by Funimation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jwp.jpg'),(14694,'Doggy',NULL,'Platform, Indie, Arcade','Sin plataforma','You play as a red Box and for you to survive the game you have to reach the end of the platform without touching any of the grey barriers.\nGood Luck and i will see you in the end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vx5.jpg'),(14695,'Just Bones','2016-06-09','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Just Bones is a platformer inspired by old-school pixel art and gameplay. After a powerful experiment, a mage is reduced to a skeleton of his former self. Join Bones as he puzzles his way through rich environments to collect special tools, recover his body parts and restore his human appearance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xtgadiwdeotunhedz3wy.jpg'),(14696,'Genshin Impact: Shadows Amidst Snowstorms','2021-11-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Version 2.3 of Genshin Impact, which included:\n• New characters: Arataki Itto and Gorou\n• New story quests for Arataki Itto\n• New main event: Shadows Amidst Snowstorms\n• …and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rx4.jpg'),(14697,'Hitman: Contracts','2004-04-20','Shooter','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation 2','Hitman: Contracts is a stealth action game developed by IO Interactive and published by Eidos Interactive. It is the third installment in the Hitman game series. The game features recreations of four levels from Hitman: Codename 47.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ovw.jpg'),(14698,'Ultimate Ski Jumping 2020','2021-06-09','Simulator, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ultimate Ski Jumping 2020 is an oldschool action game in which you play the role of a ski jumper. Train and compete in tournaments and the Campaign mode. Begin the rivalry in the qualification round and take part in competitions. You can play in campaign mode or tackle others in multiplayer. Have a face off with AI-controlled jumpers on 5 difficulty levels! Create your own competitor and acquire new helmets, gloves, suits, boots, and skis! Challenge their skills on winter, summer or special ski jumping hills!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21qp.jpg'),(14699,'Hikibyou 2','2017-01-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hikibyou 2 is an action/adventure platfomer with puzzle and stealth elements. A bit of what differentiates itself from the first title in the series, Hikikomori No Chuunibyou, is this successor\'s less realistic approach and more atmospheric vibe. Levels are once again open-ended with the story directing the player.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bmn.jpg'),(14700,'Age of Heroes II: Underground Horror','2006-06-21','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Legacy Mobile Device','Strategy-RPG developed by Qplaze and published by RME for mobile phone, which released in 2006. It is a second game in Age of Heroes series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zl9.jpg'),(14701,'Jötunnslayer: Hordes of Hel','2025-01-21','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jotunnslayer: Hordes of Hel is a gripping roguelike horde-survivor game set in the dark realms of Norse Mythology. Fight waves of enemies to earn divine blessings of ancient Norse Gods, explore hostile worlds and face powerful bosses. Become a god-like warrior in this ultimate showdown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99py.jpg'),(14702,'Another Lost Phone: Laura\'s Story','2018-04-26','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Another Lost Phone is a game about exploring the social life of a young woman whose phone you have just found.\n\nThis game is shaped as a narrative investigation: you have to link elements from the different applications, messages and pictures to progress. Scrolling through the phone’s content, you will find out about Laura’s life: her friendships, her professional life and the events that led to her mysterious disappearance and the loss of this phone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23as.jpg'),(14703,'Metroloop','2024-12-12','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Loot post-apocalyptic metro tunnels in side-scrolling mode and survive waves of monsters at stations in top-down twin-stick shooter mode. Upgrade your skills and weapons endlessly. How far will you get?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pka.jpg'),(14704,'Melt Them All',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14705,'Riven: The Sequel to Myst','1998-02-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Windows Mobile, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Prepare to enter a world \"torn asunder\" by timeless, unresolved conflicts--a world of incomparable beauty, intrigue, and betrayal. Prepare to go to Riven. Journey through vast, awe-inspiring landscapes, where clouds sit nestled in a deep blue sky and the rolling sea waters shimmer from bright morning sunlight. But be forewarned: nothing is quite as it seems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jlf.jpg'),(14706,'Monochrome Painter',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14707,'Detective Agency 2','2022-02-17','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A colourful Hidden Object Game with a thrilling storyline! Solve the puzzles and find the banker\'s wife!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5g6y.jpg'),(14708,'Battle Territory: Battery',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Webzen Korea is building this PC first-person shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wjdcpin2czsjjkaxn8rq.jpg'),(14709,'Hyper V-Ball',NULL,'Sport','Satellaview, Super Nintendo Entertainment System','A volleyball simulation seen from a side-view perspective, meaning it is only possible to move players to the left or right. The player can choose between three different leagues: Men\'s League, Woman\'s League and Hyper League, which is a league for robots. Two buttons are used to control the ball, one for normal actions and one for \"Hyper Plays\", special attacks that can only be learned and used in the Hyper League. How a player will block or attack depends on the ball\'s speed and the players position. Team members who aren\'t under the player\'s direct control will also act on their own by positioning themselves or preparing spikes. They will, however, not block spikes on their own but it is possible to let players not under direct control block spikes by pressing one of the action buttons at the right moment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z1o.jpg'),(14710,'Magic Light','2017-10-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','I am a Milky Way administrator from the Imperial Army. This time I was serving at a small base station 200 light years away from Earth. Although the Zerg had been defeated by the Empire for half a century, some insects still threatened us. The two partners destroyed the transmission base due to insects, can not be sent back to their own planet, the empire sent me to the base station to help partners. I thought it would be easier to carry out this task, but the tragedy began when it was delivered to the base station. Can we still return to raising our own planet? How much of the world\'s secrets are hidden on this planet? This is not only for Chinese subtitles, but also joined the Chinese dubbing. \"Magic Light\" scene gorgeous cool, special effects straight into the sky; by the original Tencent team to create','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14711,'Hoyle Official Book of Games: Volume 3','1991-02-01','Simulator, Strategy, Quiz/Trivia, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Six board games are transformed to the computer screen in the third Hoyle\'s release. Snakes & Ladders, Backgammon, Yacht / Yahtzee, Checkers, Dominoes and Pachisi / Parcheesi all feature, with animated graphics and sound effects. As there is no time-sensitive action, and the game rules are familiar, these packs were designed to appeal to a wider range of people than most computer games.\n\nAt least one human player is required - other players can be human or computer. The 18 computer opponents from the first Hoyle\'s game return, many of them modeled on other Sierra characters such as Larry Laffer, and again some play \'good\' and some play \'evil\'.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63d8.jpg'),(14712,'Blind','2018-09-18','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blind is a narrative-driven psychological thriller for virtual reality where the player is blind and must explore their surroundings using echolocation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28vq.jpg'),(14713,'Hell\'s Island','2021-08-05','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Hell\'s Island\" is a pc island survival game, based on a island in the blue Caribbean waters where you are stranded and need to gather resources to build and survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wm8.jpg'),(14714,'Dungeons & Dragons: Dragonshard','2005-09-21','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dungeons & Dragons: Dragonshard is a real-time strategy role-playing video game, developed for Microsoft Windows by Liquid Entertainment, and published by Atari in 2005. It takes place in Eberron, one of the official Dungeons & Dragons campaign settings. The game combines elements of traditional real-time strategy gameplay with role-playing elements such as hero units, and questing. Dragonshard includes two single-player campaigns, single-player skirmish maps, and multiplayer support. The single-player campaign follows the struggles of three competing factions to gain control of a magical artifact known as the Heart of Siberys.\n\nAlthough Dragonshard was billed by Atari as \"the first Dungeons & Dragons real-time strategy experience,\"[2] Stronghold (1993) precedes it by over a decade.[3]','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yvl.jpg'),(14715,'Molten Iron Firework',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14716,'Mini Idle Dice Monster','2025-02-04','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ever wished for a friend to roll dice with? Meet Fred, the friendly monster who\'s Hungry to Play Dice with you! Mini Idle Dice Monster is an idle game all about dice rolling. Roll dice, unleash combos, upgrade perks, and spend time with Fred!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pke.jpg'),(14717,'Star Stuff','2024-06-07','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Star Stuff is a puzzle automation game that mixes bot programming with real time shenanigans. Play as Mija (me-ha), a cosmic employee on their first day at a star factory. Automate bots, interact in real time with bot actions to solve mind-bending puzzles, and save the ever-expanding universe while you\'re at it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6eps.jpg'),(14718,'Tim Burton\'s The Nightmare Before Christmas: The Pumpkin King','2005-11-10','Platform, Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Much to the dismay of Jack Skellington and the citizens of Halloween Town, unusual bugs have started to infest their township. At the root of this ever-increasing bug invasion is Oogie Boogie, a former holiday king who is determined to take over Halloween. With help from his friends Sally, the mayor, and Dr. Finklestein, Jack and his trusted pal Zero embark on a quest to rid the town of bugs and stop Oogie Boogie from carrying out his evil plot. As Jack, you must battle Oogie\'s creepy henchmen using an arsenal of different weapons and navigate through booby traps, mazes, and puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co523o.jpg'),(14719,'Pikuniku','2019-01-24','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Google Stadia, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Pikuniku is an absurdly wonderful puzzle-exploration game that takes place in a strange but playful world where not everything is as happy as it seems. Help peculiar characters overcome struggles, uncover a deep state conspiracy, and start a fun little revolution in this delightful dystopian adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gb6.jpg'),(14720,'Black Annex',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Black Annex welcomes the player to their new management position by tasking them with building a self-sufficient system of corporate subterfuge. Build your corporation, allocate resources as you see fit and cultivate an unstoppable team of agents capable of breaching any situation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vvtsvyubgcua8tckigxv.jpg'),(14721,'Mini Mania',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14722,'Deadlokk',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Deadlokk is a 5v5 Space-MOBA. Gather resources from objectives to upgrade your ships and carrier. Find new weapons and upgrades for the perfect build. Mount a final assault on the enemy carrier and achieve victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o8f.jpg'),(14723,'Mini Estate','2025-01-02','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A minimalist game about building skyscrapers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pkd.jpg'),(14724,'The Elevator','2022-05-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Josh has been working a hotel front desk for a week on the night shift.\n\nAfter realizing that in the elevator of the place there is a mystery... he begins to investigate to find out what is happening.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14725,'Deathsmiles I & II: Gothic wa Mahou Otome Love Max Edition','2021-12-16','Shooter','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Gothic wa Mahou Otome Love Max Edition includes:\n・ Game software for PS4 \"Death Smiles I / II\" (special edition: OST CD + Special DLC )\n・ B2 tapestry drawn by Dr. Junya Inoue\n・ \"Death Smiles\" original acrylic panel\n・ \"Jill Ballard\" A4 microfiber towel','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4af7.jpg'),(14726,'Retro Space Ball','2023-06-19','Shooter, Pinball, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When a pixel art vertical shooter is combined with pinball to twist the genre!\n\nIn this pixel art retro inspired action shoot em\' up, the player controls a spaceship left and right at the bottom of the screen and shoots a crazy amount of lasers towards the top of the screen, aiming at a pinball-like orb. The orb bounces off the players shots as well as the vertically scrolling level designs! There is a vs AI and PVP mode as well as over 20 single player missions!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vc7.jpg'),(14727,'Defend Homeland',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Sin plataforma','\"Defend Homeland\" is a first-person shooting fantasy defense games, will play a medieval archers, in order to survive in this cruel world can only beat back the enemy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58w7.jpg'),(14728,'Superpanda','2021-12-28','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Superpanda just landed from space to start new missions on our planet. Superpanda is a modern action platformer with precise gamepad controls, fluid movement, and smooth animations. Explore vast levels filled with secrets, quests and loot. Fight your way through hordes of evil monsters and other creatures - jump on their head or throw them bullets to get rid of them. Eat fruits to gain more health and keep playing on 3 worlds and 36 levels. Superpanda will please boys and girls at all ages. Starts playing!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4cm5.jpg'),(14729,'1 4 the $',NULL,'Visual Novel','Web browser','1 4 the $ (\"One For the Money\") was written in three days as an entry to the SeedComp! 2024 sprouting round. It tells a story of consumption. It is intended for mature audiences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87qh.jpg'),(14730,'Tep the Destroyer','2021-11-17','Shooter, Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tep the Destroyer is a single player tower defense game where you will face over 50 unique alien monsters of increasing difficulty. Strategically place 8 types of turrets to ensure the maximum damage to your foes. 5 different armor types. 5 different damage types. Weapon effectiveness is greatly influenced by the type of enemy you are fighting. Complete the main quest line for the ultimate challenge! Infinite waves, excessive power ups, and no hope. How long can you survive before the alien horde will destroy you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47sm.jpg'),(14731,'World of Warcraft: Cataclysm','2010-12-07','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Cataclysm returns players to the two continents of Azeroth for most of their campaigning, after years away in Outland and Northrend. New zones opened such as Mount Hyjal, the sunken world of Vashj\'ir, Deepholm, Uldum and the Twilight Highlands. It includes two new playable races: the worgen from the legendary kingdom of Gilneas for the Alliance, and the goblins of the Bilgewater Cartel from the isle of Kezan for the Horde. Flying mounts are usable in Kalimdor and Eastern Kingdoms, and the new secondary profession Archaeology is introduced.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xvb.jpg'),(14732,'Curiosity',NULL,'Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Curiosity killed the cat, But satisfaction brought it back.\"\n\nPlay as a cat as you leap and climb through a perilous labyrinth of obstacles, all to find your way back home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fyf.jpg'),(14733,'The Manga Works','2016-08-06','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Start out as a fledgling manga artist in a small and empty room... Armed with only a single pen, draw the best manga you can and march proudly to the publishers to show off your work.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uyw.jpg'),(14734,'Bob the Robber 4','2017-07-30','Sin género','Android, iOS','Get ready for action! Bob The Robber 4 is an all new sneaking adventure puzzle, built from the ground up to work best on your phone or tablet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r7g.jpg'),(14735,'Lower? Higher!: Buy or Bye','2024-11-02','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','your pawnshop will usher in guests with different needs every day, bargain with them, let the income soar! With the expansion of pawnshops, activities such as sending shop assistants and responding to emergencies are also essential. you seem ordinary transaction may cause the butterfly effect.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pjj.jpg'),(14736,'Darksiders III: Apocalypse Edition','2018-11-27','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Darksiders III: Apocalypse Edition includes a copy of Darksiders III in a premium box, along with a fabric wall scroll with hanger, 4 figurines, a heavy weight amulet, an original Steelbook, an art book, the original soundtrack, and an exclusive armor DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pmztdrj4ixkmzpmm2gpr.jpg'),(14737,'The Longest Road on Earth','2022-01-25','Point-and-click, Music, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A thoughtful and deeply personal narrative-title with stripped-down mechanics. The lack of dialogue or text allows you to fully immerse yourself in the chapters of four characters, each with their joys and heartache. Contains over 20 original, beautifully-sung songs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wet.jpg'),(14738,'Paper Flight: Relic Hunter','2024-01-26','Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Paper Flight – Relic Hunter is an interactive game experience that is designed to ease your mind and have fun popping innocent balloons. Jump into the role of a little paper plane and rescue the world from evil balloon demons by dashing through them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zgu.jpg'),(14739,'Memology: War of Memes','2024-11-14','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dr Livesey vs Banana Cat? Chad vs Sanik? What the hell is this? MEMOLOGY: War of Memes is just a new part of the legendary MEMOLOGY series of games, in which you have to build your own personal army of meme characters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pk6.jpg'),(14740,'Alchemy Classic','2018-10-27','Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Love puzzles? Create animals, dinosaurs, machines and much more solving challenging puzzles! Creating Elements - Create the World! Amazing discoveries await you...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9il7.jpg'),(14741,'Astroloco: Worst Contact','2016-03-11','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the far future, humans explore and colonise space using ridiculously deadly, moon-sized trains - \'Astro Locomotives\'. They\'re operated by enormous, competing railroad companies and train vs. train combat is (expensively) common. Take control of a mistreated mechanic and a swashbuckling pilot as you try to save Gilbert Station from destruction at the hands of an alien death fleet!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wb709rn7gpodwu5yjl8m.jpg'),(14742,'Atulos Online','2016-04-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Atulos Online is a free to play 2D medieval MMORPG. You can choose from many different characters including Mage, Knight, Dwarf and Guardian. The story unfolds as a confrontation with the sorcerer Atulos draws ever closer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mdnshzimotjgsrqyld6d.jpg'),(14743,'Bazair',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14744,'Meta Soulmate','2024-11-01','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Create your own virtual mate with a game-style character customization tool. Debut your ideal as a VTuber, or make it your own secret friend. Create your meta soulmate now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pk9.jpg'),(14745,'Sticky Business','2025-03-14','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Experience the joy of running your own cozy small business: Create stickers, pack orders and hear your customers’ stories. Time to build the cutest shop on the internet!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68bd.jpg'),(14746,'Boxing Go','2024-06-13','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Welcome to Boxing GO: Where Champions Rise! Get ready to play the electrifying clash of boxing in the ring as Boxing GO brings you the most thrilling boxing matches.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fwz.jpg'),(14747,'Sun Spear','2024-01-16','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When ancient darkness threatens to swallow the world whole, call upon the power of the light! Wield the Sun Spear against the creatures of the night as Bonnie, a steadfast warrior determined to save her village. Can you seal away horrors untold before night falls forever?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7by0.jpg'),(14748,'Taiheiki','1991-12-13','Strategy','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Taiheiki is a turn-based strategy game, based on the television drama of the same name, which in turn is based on a famous 14th-century historical epic which chronicles the fall of the Hōjō clan during the Kamakura period of Japanese history.\n\nThe game is a grid-based strategy game in the tradition of Fire Emblem or Langrisser. Each side has multiple units, which can move depending upon the terrain. Conflicts between units are shown as animated sequences, and the player can determine formations, as well as issue and change orders to different troops at any time. Battles between enemy commanders take the form of a side-scrolling 1-on-1 action sword battle.\n\nThere are two scenarios available. The first casts the player as Takauji Ashikaga as he attempts to oust Godaigo and establish a new government, while the second follows Masashige Kusunoki and Yoshisada Nitta, who must try to protect Emperor Godaigo and his imperial rule. The two scenarios intertwine at various points, and graphical story sequences between each battle drive the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a3v.jpg'),(14749,'World Championship Poker: Featuring Howard Lederer - All In','2007-05-29','Sport, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','World Championship Poker Featuring Howard Lederer: All In features some of the most recognizable and successful poker stars in the world, including Howard Lederer, his sister Annie Duke, Greg Raymer, Amir Vahidi, Paul Darden, and Robert Williamson III. Joining the roster for this year\'s edition are noted international poker superstars Marcel Luske, Thomas Bihl, and Erin Ness, who parlayed a victory at a Maxim Magazine office tournament into a seat at the 2004 World Series of Poker. 18 types of poker are featured, including Texas Hold\'em, Five Card Draw, Seven Card Stud Omaha and more. Multi-Table Online Tournaments. Scenario Mode: Players are presented with a series of poker \"puzzle\" challenges that gradually increase in difficulty. Lucky Charms: Players can improve their luck through this Career Mode skill. Mixed Games: Play two or more variations of poker during a single game, with the game changing every time the dealer button makes it around the table.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pol.jpg'),(14750,'Squash Pipes','2017-12-31','Indie, Arcade','Android','An endless arcade game, where you have to move forward avoiding getting hit by pipes. \nThe more pipes you avoid, the more points you get! \nCollect coins and open the box with heroes to get one!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vimxcqgukiv04fxdofxk.jpg'),(14751,'Frame Outsiders',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Even if I\'m an outsider, my feelings deceived the world.\"\n\nSteal the target using \"Teleport\"! Infiltrate the story in this action-adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j0k.jpg'),(14752,'Card Escape: Plane Crash','2022-01-26','Point-and-click, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','There was a disaster, your plane crashed into the very center of the forest. And now we need to get out healthy. You will find a lot of cards with different effects, both negative and positive. Survive...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4go2.jpg'),(14753,'Journey to Incrementalia','2024-10-23','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Journey to Incrementalia is an incremental auto-battler RPG about a necromancer on a mysterious quest. Cast diabolical spells, summon an army and open the gates of hell on your quest to break down 99 legendary walls on the road to the lost city of Incrementalia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z66.jpg'),(14754,'The Wolf','2021-10-25','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Desktop Port of \"The Wolf\".\nDive into the world of wild wolves and live your life as one of them! The best wolf RPG is finally here. Explore the amazing environment, develop your character and upgrade your skills to become the Alpha of your pack! Play with people from all over the World!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co948h.jpg'),(14755,'Empire Earth II: Gold Edition','2006-02-26','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Empire Earth II (Gold Edition) is a bundle of the following games:\n\n- Empire Earth II\n- Empire Earth II: The Art of Supremacy','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70mu.jpg'),(14756,'Drake\'s Odds: Survive',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as an alien who must survive on the planet Earth, which is unknown and adverse to him. Fight, craft and make use of the powers and technology in your possession. Collect KP from Earthlings; control the NPCs; fly over the skies and shoot with the spaceship.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oxk.jpg'),(14757,'Power Ball 2022','2022-08-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Power Ball 2022 continues the Bat / Ball and Brick Breaking excitement of its predecessor but with newer graphics and a polished space environmental back drop. Take on 50 levels in this beautiful modern retro take on the brick breaking genre and impress your friends with your best high scores.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mla.jpg'),(14758,'Mega Man 2','1989-06-02','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, Wii, iOS, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System','In the year 200X, a super robot named Mega Man was created. Dr. Light created Mega Man to stop the evil desires of Dr. Wily. However, after his defeat, Dr. Wily created eight of his own robots to counter Mega Man.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x42.jpg'),(14759,'Out Of Memories','2024-10-23','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A surreal, minimalist spooky ride through impossible geometry, deadly traps and caustic commentary from the observers of the player\'s attempt to stay alive for just a little longer, as a toxin kills them little by little.\n\nThe game has text graphics and uses the character set from the original PC from 1981. It\'s presented as if running on that hardware, on a green phosphor monitor - with just a hint of red.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zie.jpg'),(14760,'Fall of Gyes','2016-03-18','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Fall of Gyes is a sci-fi visual novel series with stunning cinematic quality and an intriguing story inspired by classic sci-fi horror movies like The Thing, Aliens or Prometheus with claustrophobic atmosphere where no one knows what is happening or who the enemy is until disaster strikes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jgwi9i9spq7zeh3uyake.jpg'),(14761,'Potion Punch Rivals',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Potion Punch Rivals puts your shopkeeping, potion punching skills to the test. Race against your rival to see who can take orders first, prep fastest, and serve best.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94v7.jpg'),(14762,'Eva\'s Hook','2025-01-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 2.5D Platformer with a Grappling Hook, Collectibles, and a Timer for an extra Challenge while different Events are trying to make you fail, 3 different Difficulties, but even the Easiest one could be a hard time for you !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nr5.jpg'),(14763,'Invercity','2020-04-24','Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Invercity is a puzzle-platformer that features Handstand. Handstand looks like hanging when you look it upside down, doesn\'t it? This game really makes it look that way. A reporter who loves handstand follow the mystery while reporting the \"Handstand Phenomenon\" in the city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wv1.jpg'),(14764,'Tom Clancy\'s Ghost Recon: Wildlands - Narco Road','2017-04-25','Shooter, Strategy, Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Narco Road, the off-road-racin\', parachute-jumpin\', let\'s-have-a-party expansion will be out for season pass at first, and after that for everyone else. The expansion will include more than 15 new campaign missions, plus four new types of side missions and \"racing challenges\" that will earn \"fame and followers\" for hard-driving superstars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c7e.jpg'),(14765,'Vast Trivia of the Void','2021-04-29','Quiz/Trivia, Indie, Arcade, Card & Board Game','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Put your knowledge of several topics to the test! Sports, history, science, anime, video games and more! But since Thing of the Void thought that just knowing wasn’t fun enough, move around in his playground, collecting cards and increasing your combo! Cash out or go deeper, for higher rewards but possibly higher risks! Monetary, of course!\n\nDo you have what it takes to make it big at the biggest game show from the darkest pits of the universe?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ris.jpg'),(14766,'Chaos Seed: Feng Shui Kairouki','1996-05-05','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Satellaview, Sega Saturn, Super Famicom','Delve into the depths of vast underground labyrinths, seeking aid from the spirit world in bringing life back to a dying planet! Chaos Seed is a role-playing game with elements of action and strategy blended in. Players will have to make smart use of their resources and use feng shui to their advantage to proceed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b3y.jpg'),(14767,'Ratomon','2021-10-13','Shooter','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ratomon is a medieval top-down adventure to stop the Plague. Investigate random generated dungeons, eliminate rat hordes and other villains, who stand behind the disease.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47f4.jpg'),(14768,'Vikings and Thrones','2017-01-15','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Android','Follow Ragnar and his companions to conquer Europe as a viking! Maybe you can be the next Jarl? Or maybe you\'ll die trying and, with honour, will feast with the gods in Valhalla in this 3D action RPG!\n\nThis is a medieval electronic 3D action RPG (role-playing) war game with vikings and european (anglo-saxons) characters. You play with the vikings: your objective is to kill the highest number of enemies you can, to loot everything and to show no mercy upon those who don\'t fear the gods! With luck, Odin and Thor shall be by your side and your destiny is to be the best! You can share your score online after your complete the game and prove you\'re the chosen one!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6818.jpg'),(14769,'Renowned Explorers: International Society - More to Explore','2016-05-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"This expansion pack for Renowned Explorers has one goal: giving you More To Explore! The main features are:\n\n- Two complete new expeditions: the Andean Adventure & The Lost Island.\n- The Campfire mechanic: crew relationships, back stories and game-changing upgrades.\n- Treasure Bonus Choices, turning treasures into surprises that boost your strategy.\"','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14770,'Eternal Reverie','2025-12-31','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into \'Eternal Reverie,\' a team-based roguelike shooter exploring the mysteries of an eternal war. Solo or in co-op, navigate diverse planets, pilot unique ships, and customize with 80+ upgrades. Unveil secrets on branching paths to increase your roster and discover the truths of the universe','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hpa.jpg'),(14771,'Awesome Pea Collection','2020-11-10','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation Vita','Contains 2 retro-style platformer in one compilation!\n\nAwesome Pea\nHelp the greedy Pea make his way through a string of levels filled with deadly traps and cute (but dangerous) enemies and collect all the coins he can reach!\n\nAwesome Pea 2\nAwesome Pea 2 is the next chapter in the classic platformer saga, now with even more dark dungeons, deadly traps, and lots of gold!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30yk.jpg'),(14772,'Kidou Gekidan Haro Ichiza: Haro no Puyo Puyo','2005-08-21','Puzzle','Game Boy Advance','Gundam-flavored Puyo Puyo.\n\nKidou Gekidan Haro Ichiza: Haro no Puyo Puyo is a Puyo Puyo game based on the Mobile Suit Gundam franchise, the original TV series in particular. Puyos are replaced by Haros, and several Gundam characters are playable. The game features a story mode, a verses mode, and a survival mode where random characters throw garbage Haros into the player\'s field.\n\nWhenever a chain is completed, the chosen character will shout a famous phrase from the anime series; the game provides a large number of phrases that can be assigned to each character by the player.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6t39.jpg'),(14773,'Days of Doom','2023-09-21','Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Gather your heroes and fight to make it to Sanctuary in this tactical RPG roguelite. Did we mention the zombies, raiders, and mysterious monstrosities that inhabit this post-apocalyptic wasteland? Welcome to the world of Days of Doom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71qg.jpg'),(14774,'Math Blaster Jr.','1996-12-31','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Master Blaster Jr. is a 1996 educational video game, aimed at ages 4–7.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y6t.jpg'),(14775,'Pokémon Mystery Dungeon: Explorers of Hell',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo DS','Explorers of Hell is a ROM hack of Explorers of Sky with several features, for example, new Pokémon, new items, and a very high difficulty. The dialogues have also been modified and are aimed at a more advanced audience.\n\nWith Pokemon Mystery Dungeon: Explorers of Hell, you can expect: A very high difficulty, New starters, and new Pokemon from generations 5 to 8. New dungeons, boss battles, and items. New dialogues (lots of memes and humor). The fairy type.\n\nThe rom hack was developed by babou.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q0m.jpg'),(14776,'Alien Life Simulator','2021-02-18','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Manage your emotions while you explore alien worlds in this 3rd person roguelite with life sim and survival elements!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sdu.jpg'),(14777,'Warhammer Age of Sigmar: Tempestfall','2022-05-19','Adventure','Meta Quest 2, Windows Mixed Reality, SteamVR, Oculus Rift','Battle the forces of Nighthaunt in this VR-exclusive action-adventure Warhammer Age of Sigmar game. Wield iconic weapons of a Lord-Arcanum and deliver Sigmar\'s justice using motion-based abilities and magic across the realm of Death.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wf1.jpg'),(14778,'Final Fantasy IV: Daughter of Darkness and Light','2021-09-16','Role-playing (RPG)','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','What if the King of Baron had banished Joanna rather than Cecilia? That Kluya meets Joanna, the two fall in love, and they have a son and a daughter? And that, after tragedy strikes, this daughter ends up been abandoned in the woods… only to be found and raised by the King?\n\nA single ripple becomes a wave that sends a pair of lovers down vastly different life paths. Cecil, the White Wizard. Rosa, the Dark Knight. This is her story–one of redemption from the darkness within.\n\n\'Final Fantasy IV: Daughter of Darkness and Light\' is a fork of the \'Project II: Final Fantasy IV\' hack. Not only does it include the bugfixes, restoration of missing content and revised script of the latter mod, but it also an alternate story with Rosa Farrell as the protagonist.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14779,'Fish\'s Revenge',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14780,'Indiepocalypse #61','2025-02-07','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Issue #61 of a monthly indie game anthology collecting games from 10 developers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kl3.jpg'),(14781,'Zauberfläche',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14782,'Wisly and the Chickens!','2021-08-27','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wisly and the Chickens! Is an 2D platform runner. The game tells the comical history of the chicken coop revolt against a lovely weasel. Help Wisly to find the cage parts to capture the evil Galinacio and thus to explain to the chickens this big misunderstanding. Let\'s RUN!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pp2.jpg'),(14783,'Elemancer',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Master all 5 elements in this natural movement VR elemental brawler. Choose from hundreds of different attacks to create your own unique bending style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6u06.jpg'),(14784,'Nikoderiko: The Magical World','2024-10-15','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Join Niko and Luna on their quest in Nikoderiko, a vibrant platform adventure. When the duo discovers an ancient relic on a magical island, the villainous Grimbald of the Cobring Gems Company snatches it away. To save the island and its tribes, they must navigate seven unique worlds with the help of their animal friends and defeat the Cobring army. With family-friendly design, couch co-op, and music by David Wise, Nikoderiko promises a magical, mysterious journey for all ages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bmp.jpg'),(14785,'Shadowgate','2019-04-11','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Shadowgate is one of the most well-known and beloved adventure titles in gaming history. It quickly endeared players with its fantastic atmospheric soundtrack, perilous locations to progress through, countless puzzles to solve, and more ways to gruesomely die than gamers previously thought possible. Thrust into the role of “The Seed of Prophecy”, players travel deep into the castle, in hopes of defeating the evil that dwells within – the dreaded Warlock Lord.\n\nThis game is a re-imagining of the original Shadowgate, released for Mac in 1987 and later ported to the NES.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co249e.jpg'),(14786,'Samba Hero','2023-10-02','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Feel the samba rhythm by pressing the notes at the right time and become the next Samba Hero! Do you have what it takes?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rqb.jpg'),(14787,'SCP: Infohazard','2024-09-07','Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SCP: Infohazard is a survival horror game based on the stories of the SCP Foundation, where you take on the role of a test subject who becomes the survivor or a reality-bending disaster. To survive, you must restore reality fragments around the facility while avoiding some of the most dangerous monsters and anomalies that they contain. You must navigate through the high-tech facility and to find a way to stop what might just be an end-of-the-world scenario. SCP: Infohazard immerses you in the inner workings of The SCP Foundation like never before, with breathtaking details, clever puzzles, heart-pounding stealth, combat, and more. Use the environment to your advantage as you avoid detection, shoot around corners, distract the monstrous anomalies, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8327.jpg'),(14788,'RPG Maker VX Ace: Arabian Nights',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14789,'Train Simulator 2021: BR Regional Railways Class 101 DMU','2014-08-15','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As one of the largest classes of first generational diesel multiple units, the Class 101 is a favorite of early diesel fans and now available in Regional Railways livery for Train Simulator 2021. More than 500 sets of the Class 101 were built by Metro-Cammell Works in Birmingham from 1956.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14790,'My Ocean Project','2020-09-28','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','I made this experience after watching \"My Octopus Teacher\" on Netflix. I\'ve always wanted to make a underwater environment for an exploration game but I never found a place to implement it. After watching the movie I just wanted to do it anyway without any gameplay elements at all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67m3.jpg'),(14791,'The Adventures of Batman & Robin','1995-12-31','Shooter, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','The Mega Drive/Genesis version, developed by Clockwork Tortoise and published by Sega, is a run \'n\' gun where both Batman and Robin must stop Mr. Freeze, who plans to freeze Gotham City. In order to keep the duo busy, he also frees the Joker, Two-Face and the Mad Hatter, each one with their own agenda. The Joker celebrates his birthday wreaking havoc in Gotham and stealing diamonds, Two-Face tries to take over the city from above, and Mad Hatter is creating a robot army in his surreal lair.\n\nThe game can be played by two players simultaneously; one player with Batman, and the other with Robin. Both characters are identical in terms of playability, and both use batarangs, bolas, or shurikens in long-range attacks, while using melee attacks at short range. There are four levels consisting of several stages, mostly of a straight left-to-right traverse to the end where the boss awaits. In some levels the game switches to a side-scrolling shooter, in which the players must control the Batwings.\n\nThe game is regarded as being extremely difficult to complete, and also known for showcasing some of the most impressive special effects on the Mega Drive/Genesis. It also features a soundtrack by Jesper Kyd. This accounts for the relatively high quality of Kyd\'s compositions, as well as the fairly simple FM synthesized nature of the game\'s sound effects.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6378.jpg'),(14792,'Puzzle Quest 3','2022-03-01','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Embark on a heroic journey across Etheria to discover the meaning behind the ancient Red Dragon\'s dying words. Prepare for a new Quest!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ov5.jpg'),(14793,'Styx: Vertical Platformer','2021-10-14','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','Vertical platformer. There is no time to get used to the environment, new levels are generated with each start.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48iq.jpg'),(14794,'Bearskull','2023-04-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight with your friend Skull in Top Down Dungeon Adventure, can you stop Sorkin?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b0z.jpg'),(14795,'The Legend of Zelda: Relics of the Past','2025-04-22','Adventure','Wii U','A mod for The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild which changes the game to be more challenging by enhancing the map and enemy locations, being akin to an unofficial expansion for the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6uwz.jpg'),(14796,'America\'s Next Top Model','2010-07-23','Simulator','Wii','You take control of one of 10 aspiring models that compete in a variety of different categories including: \'Make Up\', \'Fashion\', \'Catwalk\' and \'Photoshoot\'. Following the same successful formula as the TV series, one model is dismissed each week following a special challenge; just make sure it\'s not you! Choose your outfits in a variety of ways to live out the model lifestyle; be it striking a pose for a photographer, keeping your walk timed perfectly on the catwalk, or making sure your make-up is a match for the occasion. Talk to the other models in the apartment and get tips from your coach to help your performance during the week, then test your knowledge of the fashion industry in front of the panel each week to secure your place in the next round.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dbd.jpg'),(14797,'SCP: Event Classified','2024-04-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SCP: Event Classified is a unique horror shooter that allows players to take on a role of a soldier, prisoner, scientist and even monster. Fight other players or unite with them to survive in this mysterious facility.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hes.jpg'),(14798,'Phoenix Wright: Ace Attorney - Dual Destinies','2024-01-25','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Eight years since he last stepped into the courtroom, Phoenix Wright makes his triumphant return in Phoenix Wright: Ace Attorney – Dual Destinies! When an explosion rocks the courts, it’s up to the Wright Anything Agency to bring the hammer of justice down on those responsible in an adventure filled with all the swerves, shenanigans and stepladders that the Ace Attorney series is known for.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m77.jpg'),(14799,'Police Quest Collection','2011-01-18','Point-and-click, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Walk the thin, blue line in four of the most realistic crime games ever created, packed with complex storylines and real-life mysteries that only a handful of real police officers ever face - or solve.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jje.jpg'),(14800,'Boiling Point: Road to Hell','2005-06-29','Shooter, Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Boiling Point: Road to Hell combines intense armed combat with exploration and interaction with a vast and seamless open-ended gaming world. In Boiling Point: Road to Hell, gamers travel to the present day jungles of South America and battle competing factions in a brutal guerrilla war. Developer Deep Shadows\' innovative game engine streams the beautifully rendered environment, creating a non-linear gameplay experience, with no loading times or separate levels, creating a continuous world spanning hundreds of miles. To make the most of the environment, a massive range of vehicles are at the disposal of the player, as well as a vast array of weapons.\n\nThe wide open game world features an array of different AI factions with which the player can interact, and hundreds of diverse missions to create an original experience each time the game is played. Combined with the vast seamless gaming world, the result is gameplay freedom and replayability on an unprecedented scale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mrm.jpg'),(14801,'Stars Era: Abyss Frontier','2024-02-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Stars Era: Abyss Frontier is a level-breaking game that combines SLG and rogue elements. Through battles and choices, you can make your team stronger, defeat the twisted monsters and former comrades who have fallen into madness, and gradually move forward. Towards victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7uay.jpg'),(14802,'FTD2','2021-05-14','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fantasy Tower Defence\n\nFeatures...\n\n8 Different tower types with 3 levels for each.\n\n18 Monster Types.\n\nGuide monsters by your tower placement.\n\nOnline Leaderboards.\n\n14 Game modes.\n\nNumerous maps.\n\nYou have the job of saving the town from the hordes of monsters trying to steal the souls of the town\'s dead. Who is sending then and for what purpose.\n\nUse the towers and special skills to defend the town and fight the final intruder to save the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co302e.jpg'),(14803,'Elohim Eternal: Exodus','2025-01-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Overthrow the corrupt emissary of the Kingdom of Heaven in this turn-based RPG with visual novel storytelling. This free game takes place a thousand years before the events of Elohim Eternal: The Babel Code. Before the Idinites and Cainites, there were the Misru and Simru, based on ancient Egypt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nql.jpg'),(14804,'Eighth Era','2024-10-01','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','Android, iOS','The first game of its kind, rewarding competitive players with real-life collectibles. Embark on an epic journey 10,000 years in the future in Eighth Era! Join The Collector’s Society, battle digital monsters, and uncover powerful relics as you restore life to a world on the brink of collapse. With collectible coins and thrilling challenges, every victory brings you closer to a real-world reward. Dive into the adventure and experience a turn-based RPG like no other—where your virtual journey has real-world consequences!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ce4.jpg'),(14805,'Circolour','2018-08-20','Platform, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Android','A simple one handed casual game where you must stop enemies from all sides using a shield.Try to achieve your personal best.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bcsrn6k7e6eao8aqq7nk.jpg'),(14806,'Stronghold Crusader II: Delivering Justice mini-campaign','2015-12-17','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The sons of pigs have me surrounded... Send me your fastest men! Stronghold Crusader 2: Delivering Justice casts you as one of the few remaining honourable Crusader Lords. Fighting to maintain order and prevent further bloodshed in the Holy Land, you must protect vulnerable Arab merchants, fend off raiding parties and capture an enemy castle on the path to Jerusalem. While keeping rogue elements in line and maintaining the peace, players will also settle the score with an old enemy in disguise.\n\nAvailable for the first time ever as a standalone DLC, \'Delivering Justice\' adds two missions to the base Stronghold Crusader 2 game. Set during the events of the main Crusader story campaign the \'Delivering Justice\' mini-campaign introduces new scenarios, achievements and challenges suitable for all players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nfimlqcme40e09zktguf.jpg'),(14807,'Metal Beans','2024-03-25','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Metal Beans is a 3D Action-Arcade game where you control two desktop pets in a computer space. Protect the PC from digital threats by charging up your way through virus creatures and upgrading your robots in the system!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wtw.jpg'),(14808,'Conflict FPS',NULL,'Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A strategic team-based first-person shooter. Battle it out in this fast-paced multiplayer shooter. Several game modes to choose from and a range of different maps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dbv.jpg'),(14809,'Invasion From Beyond','1998-12-31','Shooter','Web browser, PlayStation','The game features more than 30 missions of futuristic action with many secret levels, ships and weapons. Your prime directive is to kill all invading alien forces. However, whenever Earthlink Command wants you to complete a specific objective, you will be notified via a flashing communications icon.\n\nYour ship features a radar, cargo hold, weapon mounts, aiming reticule and the Suck-O-Matic. The Suck-O-Matic is an experimental device used to teleport and blow items in and out of your ship\'s cargo hold. It is an essential part for much of the game\'s objectives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c2e.jpg'),(14810,'Twin Breaker: A Sacred Symbols Adventure','2025-02-24','Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Twin Breaker stars Colin Moriarty and Chris Ray Gun (of the Sacred Symbols Podcast) in their first video game adventure. A new take on the brick-breaker genre with a story written by Colin Moriarty!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gmr.jpg'),(14811,'Kraino ReAnimated',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Nine levels of Hi-Bit action platforming with juicy melee combat, magical abilities, epic boss battles, and secrets hidden throughout.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48l6.jpg'),(14812,'Dynasty Warriors 7: Xtreme Legends','2011-11-15','Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','The Dynasty Warriors series let you step into the shoes of the greatest generals in Ancient China. In this Tactical Action game players can enjoy the thrill of taking down thousands of enemies and become the greatest hero in Chinese history. Dynasty Warriors 7: Xtreme Legends is a stand-alone expansion that supercharges the world of Dynasty Warriors 7 with many different enhancements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q0v.jpg'),(14813,'NecroMerger','2022-08-29','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Android, iOS','The Devourer is always hungry and it’s your job to feed it in this idle merge game mashup. Play as the NecroMerger and use dark magic to summon an array of creatures (skeletons, zombies, demons, banshees… the list goes on). Merge them from piddly little grunts into massive (and tasty) brutes, before feeding them to your ever hungry pet.\nAs you grow your Devourer you’ll attract the attention of merchants, champions and even rivals. Some can be useful, others must be fought… or fed to your insatiable pet. The bigger the Devourer grows the more your lair will expand and you’ll unlock powerful abilities and spells.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co678r.jpg'),(14814,'Cayne','2017-01-24','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this grim return to the STASIS universe, expectant protagonist, Hadley, wakes up in a facility. Where is she? Why is she there? And, why do they want her baby?\n\nHelp panicked and anxious Hadley find her feet and brave stomach-churning situations to break free, by solving puzzles in this FREE horror adventure game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co225a.jpg'),(14815,'Okashi Towers','2023-10-09','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Okashi Towers is a Halloween inspired Real Time Strategy game with Tower Defense elements. Gather candy resources to build tower units or go on offense and summon cute creatures to attack other player bases. Join with up to 8 players and choose one of the four factions that fits your play style best','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oms.jpg'),(14816,'Cube Blast: Match','2021-06-24','Puzzle, Arcade, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Cube Blast will challenge even the most reputable puzzle solvers with a mind bending 3D twist on the classic color blast formula. Push your spatial thinking abilities to their limits, as you solve increasingly complex puzzles on a 3D tower of colorful blocks, with new and exciting mechanical twists popping up, just when you thought you saw all the game has to offer. If you are not yet convinced: there are also aliens, and explosions!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b9e.jpg'),(14817,'Ar nosurge: Ode to an Unborn Star','2014-10-02','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita','Part of the Surge Concerto franchise, Ar Nosurge is an RPG that serves as a prequel to the Ar Tonelico game series. Series director Akira Tsuchiya continues his opus with a deep and robust world. A world where songs are magic, and emotions are strong enough to form bonds. Ar nosurge: Ode to an Unborn Star is a story of love, emotional bonds and the frailty of existence.\n\nAr Nosurge is a sci-fi, ‘7 Dimension’ RPG, that takes place in a world where music and song can create magic. It tells the compelling story of a civilization that lost their planet and has been roaming the edge of space for 2000 years in search of a new home. The game follows two sets of characters: Delta and Casty, whose goal is to protect humanity and save the world, and Ion & Earthes, who are trying to find Ion a way home to Earth. The player can interchange between both pairs and soon discover a way to combine their storylines and strengths to eventually solve the mystery that shrouds their ongoing struggle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fax.jpg'),(14818,'Streamer\'s Life',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','RPG-Simulation game where you can create your own streamer and see whether you can overcome difficulties of being streamer or not.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pbd.jpg'),(14819,'How to Sing to Open Your Heart: Remastered','2024-06-27','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The cute fantasy visual novel, \"How to Sing to Open Your Heart\" returns as a remastered version. Princess Myana, who loves to sing, finally comes to Eroolia. A lot of people, like the Imperial Guard Captain, Ludovic, and Princess Anna, are unhappy about it. What will happen?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4win.jpg'),(14820,'Carmageddon Max Pack','1998-12-31','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','Carmageddon is the original freeform driving sensation, where pedestrians (and cows!) equal points, and your opponents are a bunch of crazies in a twisted mix of automotive killing machines. The game features anarchic drive-wherever-you-like gameplay and over-the-top surreal comedy violence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mw0.jpg'),(14821,'Shufflepuck','2024-01-14','Card & Board Game','Android, iOS','Shufflepuck is a small personal project game based on the classic board game Shuffleboard, with some elements inspired by curling. Face 3 unique CPU difficulties to unlock new skins, or play together with your friends locally and online!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mv1.jpg'),(14822,'Cerebral',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Cerebral is a non-linear psychological horror game set in an ever-changing residential tower. Distinguish reality from illusion and survive this endless mind-bending nightmare, but death is not the end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56ex.jpg'),(14823,'Inside & Limbo Bundle','2016-12-21','Platform','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Get Playdead\'s two critically acclaimed titles Inside & Limbo','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co821u.jpg'),(14824,'One Tap','2023-08-01','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"One Tap\" is a high-octane first-person shooter game that delivers an immersive and competitive gaming experience. It\'s all about the thrill of the game, the strategy, and the skill. The unique twist? You get to choose an in-game asset with special abilities that can turn the tide of the battle. The special characters in the game are digital assets or \"NFT\" stored using blockchain technology.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71gk.jpg'),(14825,'Plokoth','2020-05-01','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Plo goes on a journey to destroy the core of a horrible disease that infected his girlfriend Oth. Plokoth is an atmospheric 2D platforming game set in a mysterious jungle. \n \nFor Speedrunners - can you beat the public highscore?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25ig.jpg'),(14826,'Beatmania IIDX 12 Happy Sky','2006-12-14','Music, Arcade','Arcade, PlayStation 2','Beatmania IIDX 12 Happy Sky is one of the many titles in Konami\'s IIDX rhythm game series, featuring more than 80 tracks, primarily from the arcade version of the same title. As usual for the beatmania series, the player is given seven piano keys and a turntable, and must play along with the notes that scroll down the screen to play the music. All of the game modes from the previous title have returned: Arcade, Expert, Class, Beginner\'s, Free, Training, and Gallery. The game also includes support for Internet score ranking (now discontinued) and custom-made Arcade courses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2huo.jpg'),(14827,'The Princess and the Frog','2009-11-17','Adventure','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience Tiana\'s exciting world set in the jazz-infused era of 1920\'s New Orleans with the official The Princess and the Frog video game. Celebrate favorite moments from the movie and take on new challenges with Tiana, as she pursues her dreams in a fun adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rzm.jpg'),(14828,'My Diggy Dog 2','2020-08-11','Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','The gameplay combines the genres of digger and platformer. During their adventures the player will explore dungeons full of challenging puzzles and find a variety of equipment, countless artifacts, and a large space for new discoveries. Features: -Journey to various locations -A large map to explore in any direction -Hidden collectible artifacts -Large dungeons full of traps and puzzles -Unique digging mechanics -Exciting bonus levels -A dynamic upgrade system -A touching story full of twists -Stunning graphics…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2orl.jpg'),(14829,'Biz Builder Delux','2020-12-03','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ah, there\'s nothing like the rhythmic bustle of a burgeoning business burg... especially when you\'re the one building it! That\'s right, from a video game store to the corner fast food joint, run what YOU want as the town\'s entrepreneur extraordinaire! Once your coffers are comfortably padded, you\'ll be ready to set sights on other ripe markets. Don\'t be shy and branch out, erecting a diverse variety of establishments to inspire both pep in the town plaza and plenitude in your pockets! Remember, you\'ll need to strategize if you want shoppers to show. Innovate to stock stores with quality products while devising battle plans to rout pesky rivals. Only then will your spot as the town\'s top transactor be secure! It\'s not easy to rake in those bucks with the free market in flux... but if you conquer that crux--you\'ll be Biz Builder Delux! Try searching for \"Kairosoft\" to see all of our games!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co573l.jpg'),(14830,'Ridge Racer 7','2006-11-13','Racing','PlayStation 3','Ridge Racer 7 is the seventh console installment in the Ridge Racer series of racing games, released on PlayStation 3. The game has around 40 cars, many of which return from Ridge Racer 6 and the PSP incarnations of the game. There are also 22 courses, available in forward, reverse and mirror mode. The game runs at 1080p resolution and at 60 frames per second. It also features Dolby Digital 5.1 surround sound and free online gameplay via the PlayStation Network.\n\nThe game was first unveiled at the 2006 E3 event in a teaser trailer, and the first trailer of game footage was shown at the 2006 Tokyo Game Show.\n\nLike many other games in the series, it features a full motion video opening that stars Reiko Nagase.\n\nThe game has since been re-issued under Sony\'s \"Platinum\" and \"The Best\" budget lines.\n\nA patch was made available in October 2010 titled \"Ridge Racer 7 3D License Version\" that enables Ridge Racer 7 to be played in 3D.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2f7v.jpg'),(14831,'Dragon Buster','1985-12-31','Platform, Role-playing (RPG)','Arcade, Sharp X68000, Wii, Family Computer, Wii U, MSX','A 1984 arcade platformer with action RPG elements, Dragon Buster is notable as the first game to feature a double jump. It was also one of the first games to include a life meter (along with Flash Boy and Punch-Out), known as vitality in this game. The game featured side-scrolling platform gameplay and a hub \"world view\" map similar to the later Super Mario Bros. series. It also featured hack & slash combat, like the later Tritorn and Legend of Zelda series.\n\nDragon Buster was developed and published by Namco. The game is a side-scrolling dungeon crawler, where the goal of the game is for the hero, Clovis, to rescue Princess Celia. Dragon Buster was later ported to a variety of home consoles, notably the Nintendo Entertainment System and the MSX.\n\nIt runs on Namco Pac-Land hardware, modified to support vertical scrolling','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8l0o.jpg'),(14832,'Plain','2016-10-12','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A woman thrown into the future must find a way to fit in to her new reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92ji.jpg'),(14833,'Hero Emblems','2015-01-07','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','iOS','\"Hero Emblems is a JRPG that mixes “Side-scrolling beat\' em up” and “Match-3” features. Set in the middle-ages fantasy world of sword-fighting and wizardry, it is an adventure of 4 brave warriors who wield different emblem powers and their attempts to stop the re-awakening of the God of Evil.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/naiahhbejjimyfmve2fc.jpg'),(14834,'Cold Shell','2023-02-28','Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Future, one of Earth\'s colonies. There was a war your home country lost. Occupation forces don\'t care about people - crime and decadence are everywhere. Protagonist lost her parents during the war and works on a shitty job. She took a baseball bat to fight off thugs who try to attack her on her way home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nft.jpg'),(14835,'Bara Blackjack','2020-11-25','Card & Board Game','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play blackjack against a beefy frisky orc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xnu.jpg'),(14836,'Tekken Tag Tournament 2','2012-09-11','Fighting','Arcade, PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','A highly competitive fighting game where you can choose from 60 different characters. Some new and most old, still making the game of the franchise the most character-rich of them all so far.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1w4k.jpg'),(14837,'School Curse2','2024-01-20','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The curse continues...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8601.jpg'),(14838,'Truffle Hogs','2021-08-01','Strategy, Indie','Android, iOS','Truffle Hogs is a free-to-play, mobile multiplayer game where you can hang out and play with friends. Search for buried truffles or steal them from other players! Decorate your treehouse, unlock cool hats, or just run around emoting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hq8.jpg'),(14839,'Mighty Bomb Jack',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Arcade, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga, Family Computer, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System, Nintendo Switch','A platform game where the main character travels throughout various levels collecting bombs. The hero of the game, Jack, must make his way through 16 levels of a pyramid in order to defeat the demon Belzebut and rescue the royal Pamera family.Each level is split into two parts an action zone and a Royal Palace room. The mechanics and level designs of the Royal Palace rooms are directly lifted from the games prequel, Bomb Jack. Action zones can be split up into several portions, and contain power-ups usually hidden in treasure chests such as money bags, Mighty Coins and Mighty Drinks. Mighty Coins allow Jack to change colors blue allows Jack to open orange treasure chests, orange allows him to open any treasure chest by simply touching it from the side, and green transforms all enemies on the screen into coins for 5 seconds. Mighty Drinks add 10 seconds to the games timer. Secret passages can also be found in the action zones, activated by finding a Sphinx in a visible or hidden treasure chest.To prevent the player from becoming too greedy, the game automatically sends the player to a Torture Room if they obtain more than 9 Mighty Coins or 99 seconds on the games timer. The only way to escape a Torture Room without losing a life is to complete a number of jumps, which are counted down on the screen. Once the player exits the torture room, Jack automatically loses all Mighty Coins, the timer is reset to 60 seconds, and the game recommences from the beginning of the current level.A Royal Palace room NES version.A Vs. Series version of the game was released in 1986 for the Japanese market not to be confused with the original dedicated arcade version. Differences between the original and vs. series versions include adding a two-player mode, changing the locations of some secret passages and removing a warp trick in the Royal Palace rooms. In the NES version, Jack could warp forward to the next Royal Palace room if he touched the first lit bomb in the current room after the other 23 bombs were collected however, if Jack died in the warping process, he would be sent back to the beginning of the level from which the trick commenced.Mighty Bomb Jack also had a guest appearance on Tecmo Super Bowl, during the halftime show in the Super Bowl','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ss9.jpg'),(14840,'Rush on Rome','2017-10-17','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Find the missing pieces of the artifact and save the Roman Empire from its enemies.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14841,'MegaMacho Oco','2016-11-30','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','MegaMacho Oco is a parody platformer based on the Megaman franchise and the gay pornographic movie \'Ursos Grandes, Peludos e Mansos\', it also features various Brazilian memes as enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ay0.jpg'),(14842,'Zip','2025-03-18','Puzzle','Web browser, Android, iOS','Zip is a visual logic game where you need to plot a path through the grid while passing through numbers in sequential order and filling the grid. New puzzles are released daily.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9js7.jpg'),(14843,'Blu: Chronicles of Talpa',NULL,'Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as a ninja and explore a fantasy world filled with deadly creatures to save your kingdom from corrupt Guardians. Play in local co-op to give your opponents no rest!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7l1y.jpg'),(14844,'M00m World','2024-08-28','Role-playing (RPG), Arcade','Android, iOS','Step into m00m world, a cyberpunk infused multiplayer mobile universe inspired by our original webcomic. m00m is a new place to hangout. Build your customizable container home, play mini-games, embark on simple quests, and connect with friends in real-time. With regular updates, endless adventures, and a creative community, the m00m resistance needs you to shape the future and make your mark in the fight against the F8 Corporation!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93j4.jpg'),(14845,'Link the animals','2019-04-26','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Link the animals is a relaxing, challenging puzzle game where you need to connect each animal with its respective pair. The level ends when all pairs are connected.\n\n* 5 difficulty levels\n* More than 340 challenging puzzles\n* 20+ animals and other creatures\n\nThe game is available for Windows, Linux, Mac, Android and iOS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45bn.jpg'),(14846,'Airgrave','1996-12-29','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation','AirGrave is an Action game, developed and published by Santos, which was released in Japan in 1996.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fdnz7fuzwt8nobqbucet.jpg'),(14847,'Grow Defense','2021-01-11','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Upgrade your Castle and Unlock new tiers of Skills and Weapons to Defend vs Monsters and Bosses across VARIOUS ZONES! Find Rare ITEMS dropped from monsters and bosses and upgrade them to their full potential! Defeat RAID Mega-Bosses to find LEGENDARY items!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41hu.jpg'),(14848,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization VI Anthology','2021-07-13','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','MAKE HISTORY in one of the most critically acclaimed and influential game franchises in strategy game history! This bundle contains Civilization VI and all its previously-released console content*. It\'s intended for people new to Civilization VI.\n\n*The Red Death playable scenario released on PC isn\'t available on consoles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hgm.jpg'),(14849,'Re:Bf','2022-03-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When a world is overwhelmed by new monsters, it\'s up to a single apprentice adventurer to set out on a quest and bring peace back to the land in this JRPG with fully animated combat!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5m3p.jpg'),(14850,'Adiasis','2019-12-04','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A turn-based RPG where you can avoid all enemy attacks!\n\nAdiasis keeps battles interesting by featuring an active battle system that allows the player to avoid enemy attacks by correctly timing their button presses. On the way to the great evil you\'ll get to experience a world with a charming pixel art style inspired by the classic 16-bit era games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6srf.jpg'),(14851,'The Legend of Heroes: Trails of Cold Steel IV','2021-04-09','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The Legend of Heroes: Trails of Cold Steel IV is the ninth installment in the main Trails series, serving as a direct sequel to the events of the The Legend of Heroes: Trails of Cold Steel III and the ending to the Erebonia arc. The continent of Zemuria is dragged into conflict as the Erebonian Empire mobilizes the full force of its military. The heroes of Class VII old and new must unite to end the conflict before it consumes the continent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31wc.jpg'),(14852,'Ogre','2017-10-05','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ogre is a turn-based strategy game of mechanized warfare, requiring tactical decision making and strategic thinking. It is the official video game adaptation of the legendary tabletop wargame from Steve Jackson Games, developed by the award-winning Auroch Digital. \n \nHovercraft, tanks, infantry, and giant cybernetic tanks called Ogres take part in a seemingly endless world war. You take command and vie for supremacy on the irradiated battlefields of The Last War.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26ya.jpg'),(14853,'Infinifactory','2015-06-30','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Infinifactory is a sandbox puzzle game by Zachtronics, the creators of SpaceChem and Infiniminer. Build factories that assemble products for your alien overlords, and try not to die in the process.\n\nLIKE SPACECHEM… IN 3D! Design and run factories in a first-person, fully 3D environment.\nHISTOGRAMS ARE BACK! Optimize your solutions, and then optimize them more when you see how much better your friends did.\nVISIT EXOTIC ALIEN LOCALES! Explore a story-driven campaign with 30+ puzzles, audio logs, and more.\nBLOCKS THAT MOVE! Go beyond the campaign and push the limits of Infinifactory’s next-generation block engine in the sandbox.\nSTEAM WORKSHOP INTEGRATION! Create, share, and play custom puzzles on Steam Workshop.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r2a.jpg'),(14854,'Override 2: Super Mech League','2020-12-21','Fighting, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The gigantic robot brawler is Mech-ing a super-charged comeback in Override 2: Super Mech League!\n\nSeven years after the Xenotypes that invaded Earth have been eradicated, the giant mechs that were once the planet’s defenders are now their entertainers in global mech battle leagues. As a new pilot of these repurposed weapons of war, climb the ranks and represent your Club with a tuned-up roster of returning and new mechs, each with their own unique abilities, moves, and super-charged attacks. Override 2: Super Mech League is playable both in single player and multiplayer campaigns for up to 4 players locally and online in stages set all over the world.\n\nStart as a new pilot and propel yourself through the ranks in a deep and robust Career Mode. Join Mech Leagues and earn reputation by competing in Arenas located across the globe. Duke it out with a tuned-up roster of returning robots and new mechs across various versus and co-op game modes of up to 4 players online and locally. Defeat your opponents using an arsenal of unique moves including super-charged ranged attacks, metal-busting combos, or an arena-shattering ultimate attack!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2frs.jpg'),(14855,'Equestrian the Game',NULL,'Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Android, iOS','Equestrian the game is a horse riding, management, and breeding game. Ride, compete, and breed horses of different breeds and personalities!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50bq.jpg'),(14856,'Fantasy Temptations','2024-02-04','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fantasy Temptations is a captivating tile puzzle game set in a mystical anime world. Strategically arrange tiles to uncover enchanting characters and their intriguing stories. With every puzzle, the plot thickens. Dive into this fantastical journey today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79y8.jpg'),(14857,'Mash Gadget','2023-07-05','Sin género','Playdate','Mash like a master on your Playdate!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14858,'King\'s Bounty: The Conqueror\'s Quest','1991-03-21','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Raise your sword in the name of the king! Traitors ravish the land and the Sceptre of Order is lost. Build an army of thousands. Lead great legions of orcs, trolls, demons and more to recover the sceptre and restore the king\'s realm. Discover 8 potent artifacts to increase your skills. Weave spells to aid your quest and destroy your enemies. Do battle with 25 deadly fantasy creatures. Use your leadership skills to unite rival troops in your army. No two games are alike - the playing field resets with each new game. Password command save feature.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ntf.jpg'),(14859,'Knuckle Heads','2009-08-18','Fighting','Arcade, Wii','Up to four players must choose control for six different characters from: the United States, the game\'s home country of Japan, Greece, China, Norway, and Brazil in what is described as \"America\'s hottest new game show\" on the flyer; they all have different special weapons, moves, and catchphrases, and the show will move to each of the characters\' respective home towns (Honolulu, Kyoto, Athens, Hong Kong, Lillehammer and Sao Paulo) for each successive round.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/h3yowi6kxls6r8xlcg8j.jpg'),(14860,'Oids','1987-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, Mac','Rescue the OIDS from the Fiendish Biocretes who are turning them into vending machines and household appliances! Fuel your ship, charge your shields, and blast off to adventure as you challenge planetoid after planetoid of devious gravity traps, treacherous teleport puzzles, and wave after wave of Hell Jets, Heat-Seekers, and Burst Orbs! \n \nCreate your own games with the OIDS construction set. Design your own planetoids and puzzles in minutes with simple cut-and-paste operations. It\'s easy! Make new games for yourself or trade \'em with your friends. \n \nOids is a gravity/inertia shooter that plays in a similar way to Gravitar and Thrust. Unlike Thrust the controls are much easier to get to grips with as almost everything is controlled by a joystick. Pushing forward activates the thrust, left/right rotates the ship and pulling back toggles the shield on or off. Pressing the fire button shoots photons and jabbing the fire button twice launches a novabomb. The space bar is used to recharge the shield. The aim of the game is to rescue all the OIDS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/puj4wkh5uf7wvfnneu4h.jpg'),(14861,'Miniatures','2024-11-14','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Miniatures is a collection of strange tales where childhood imagination and reality merge with darker undercurrents of mystery and magic. Explore a vast seascape, build odd furniture, feed a lizard and play with sand castles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qef.jpg'),(14862,'Chess 2','2020-03-19','Shooter, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','this time... it\'s personal','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h07.jpg'),(14863,'Darkest Valley','2021-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','On the run from a cosmic horror, a young man finds hope in a small town and the journey that begins there. \n \nDarkest Valley is a 2.5D Action RPG, a hybrid throwback to Diablo II and Legend of Mana. Loot, plan your build, traverse the skill trees, and embark on a journey that spans the character\'s life - in the valley of the shadow of death.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i0x.jpg'),(14864,'Magic LightHouse','2021-05-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Magic LightHouse - A top-down game where you play the role of an old wizard, whose skills in dealing with fire are only needed to set fire to signal lights, with each level it becomes more and more difficult not to set yourself on fire, so be careful, wizard!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mrq.jpg'),(14865,'Dick Killer','2022-07-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Dick Killer\" is a trash horror game! A mix of horror and comedy... style old horror movies like \"Scary Movie\", Totally over the top.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qse.jpg'),(14866,'Cloud Chasers','2015-10-15','Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Guide a trailblazing father and daughter team through the deadly deserts of a dystopian future. Experience multiple narrative encounters with the weird, wicked and wondrous inhabitants of the five deserts. Fly high through the clouds with your trusty glider and collect the water you will need to survive. Reach the safe haven above the clouds by strategically managing your inventory and resources.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pro.jpg'),(14867,'Parkan: The Imperial Chronicles','2017-01-23','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Legendary game from the Golden age of Russian gaming industry! Hybrid gameplay combines elements of space simulator, shooter, strategy and RPG. Explore the outer space, colonize planets, negotiate with clans of robots, fight in space battles and become mercenary, trader or pirate!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gyt.jpg'),(14868,'TNA Impact!: Cross the Line','2010-06-25','Fighting, Sport','PlayStation Portable, Nintendo DS','TNA iMPACT!: Cross the Line is the first handheld video game released by the professional wrestling promotion, Total Nonstop Action Wrestling (TNA).The DS version was built from the ground up and features a much smaller roster but does include new playable characters such as Hulk Hogan, Creed, Foley, and Curry Man. It also features a new sort of career mode which includes Bound for Glory and Victory Road as your route to the top of TNA. In Bound for Glory, run a gauntlet of opponents as your favorite superstar. Make friends and enemies on your way to the top in a story unique to each wrestler. In Victory Road, choose to climb to the top of the heavyweight division, create the ultimate tag team or dominate Ultimate X. The DS Version game featured new match types such as Six Sides of Steel, Cage Match, Four Corners Match(Four Way Elimination Match), and many more new match types. Also included are match type such as Singles, Tag, Ultimate X, and many more fan favorites. The DS Version featured new arenas in: Orlando, Florida; Mexico; Armory; Tokyo, Japan; London, England; Freedom Center; and Las Vegas, Nevada.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4n9p.jpg'),(14869,'MH-Zombie','2022-03-28','Shooter, Simulator, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 3D, sim-like arcade helicopter-shooter tower defense. Repair, re-arm, and upgrade your helicopter at the FARP as the battle permits. Three flight physics modes provide a stepped learning curve and wider accessibility, and the tutorial mode provides a safe learning environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lbo.jpg'),(14870,'Fire Pro Wrestling World: World Wonder Ring Stardom Collaboration','2019-08-22','Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Stardom, Japan\'s leading women\'s professional wrestling promotion, join the Fire Pro ring with 10 new wrestlers, including their signature moves, costumes, entrance themes, and voices! Believe now, shine tomorrow! We are stardom!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ip1.jpg'),(14871,'Betrayal in Antara','1997-07-31','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As the mighty and benevolent empire of Antara fractures under the weight of corruption and war, four unlikely heroes find themselves faced with an insidious mystery involving the most powerful figures in the empire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pig.jpg'),(14872,'Reverse x Reverse','2015-12-10','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Reverse x Reverse is the latest game from desunoya, creator of Tobari and the Night of the Curious Moon. This game is a cute & quirky challenging puzzle platformer, where you control two girls, Code and Rithm, as they traverse a virtual world and complete 81 brain-bending levels.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oy9.jpg'),(14873,'Fearful Symmetry & The Cursed Prince','2017-12-12','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Fearful Symmetry is a fun puzzle game with a unique brain-teasing twist. Control two characters at the same time; both in different dimensions. It’s up to you to move the characters simultaneously in opposite directions to guide them through treacherous puzzles filled with traps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co237w.jpg'),(14874,'Rake','2015-07-13','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do ghosts exist? What about Bigfoot, Chupacabras,Rake or Skinwalkers? And how will we ever know? You play as Gordon Davis, a scientist,a traveller and an explorer of unknown creatures and unusual events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uep.jpg'),(14875,'Mars or Die!','2018-07-13','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Control two characters simultaneously! Survive, gather, collect upgrades, fight all sizes of one-eyed Martians, build defensible outposts and conquer Mars, in this glorious mix between roguelite and tower defense.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co241e.jpg'),(14876,'Touhou JRPG','2013-08-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The main character chooses three companions, advances through a dungeon, and defeats a boss at the far end of the dungeon in this RPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52pm.jpg'),(14877,'Lichdom: Battlemage','2016-04-22','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Lichdom: Battlemage is a first-person caster that gives the Mage the spotlight in a way never before seen in games. With limitless magical power at your disposal and brutal enemies around every corner, victory hinges on a combination of skill and strategy. You must carefully craft a vast array of spells and learn to cast them in the heat of combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h1x.jpg'),(14878,'Baladins','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Baladins is a choose-your-own-story multiplayer game (1-4 players online) inspired by Role-Playing Games. A whole campaign with friends, packed in 1-hour sessions!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xe7.jpg'),(14879,'Brahma Force: The Assault on Beltlogger 9','1997-04-09','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','A mech-based FPS; pilot your Bipedal Robotic Assault Heavy Mechanized Armor (built by Bronx Industries, of course) through the Beltlogger 9 excavation colony...\n\n...discover what happened to the Beltlogger 9 colony- it may be related to the events on Probe Ship Mina 3, wherein a lone person apparently under the control of an outside intelligence slaughtered his shipmates.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gve.jpg'),(14880,'Where\'s my Bara Deck?','2025-04-03','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Your Bara cards have vanished! Someone hid your deck around the house, and only you can find it. Explore 3D environments, search every corner, and unlock sensual art as you complete your collection. Ready for this spicy, surprise-filled hunt?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qqz.jpg'),(14881,'Before I Forget','2021-04-29','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Explore the present to uncover the past, in a short story of love and loss and a life well-lived. A narrative exploration that examines a world where memories are constantly fading and jumbled. A game about dementia and what happens when you can\'t hold onto the things you\'ve done or the people you\'ve loved.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2csm.jpg'),(14882,'Screw-Nut',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Screw-Nut - This is a game in which you need to melt the nut','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14883,'Capcom Fighting Collection 2','2025-05-16','Fighting, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Capcom\'s newest fighting collection hits the stage!\n\nChoose from fan-favorite games like Capcom vs. SNK 2: Mark of the Millennium 2001 and Project Justice to 3D action games like Power Stone and Power Stone 2 in this collection of eight classic fighting games!\n\nEach game in the collection can be played online or co-op!\n\nGet back in the ring and duke it out in battles that everyone rumored, but no one believed!\nWhether it\'s with a rival new or old, give it your all and strive for victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qmx.jpg'),(14884,'Digimon Adventure','1998-12-31','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Game Boy Advance','Digimon Adventure (aka Digimon) is a bootleg platformer for the SNES and Game Boy Advance based on Digimon.\n\nDigimon Adventure uses the same engine as Pocket Monster, thus the gameplay mechanics are the same. The game spans six levels, which include two boss fights. The only playable character is Agumon. The player can attack enemies by pressing A to shoot a fireball. Each level has a strawberry item that, once collected, transforms that the player into Greymon, who\'s fireball attack is much larger and stronger. Once the player loses all their lives, they\'re given a chance to continue, which seems to have no limit.\n\nThe game steals nearly all of its graphics from numerous other sources. Of all the levels, so far the only identified source is the background from the last battle being taken from Castlevania Dracula X. The sound engine and music are also stolen from Bonkers for the SNES, which, like the game engine, is also used in Pocket Monster and Pokemon Gold and Silver.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7znl.jpg'),(14885,'3D Puzzle: Hangar','2024-07-18','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Collect a 3D puzzle, transferring things to the right places to create a beautiful place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j30.jpg'),(14886,'Agujero','2024-04-03','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Agujero is a Deep Hole Crawler made for Dungeon Crawler Jam 2024.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82d2.jpg'),(14887,'Mop Boy',NULL,'Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this action-platformer, you play as Mop Boy, a kid whose job is to fight off the grease monsters terrorizing his family\'s restaurant. Gain new abilities by completing quests for your family and put an end to the evil grease running a muck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tyh.jpg'),(14888,'Sly Cooper and the Thievius Raccoonus','2024-06-11','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','A port of Sly Cooper and the Thievius Raccoonus, enhanced with up-rendering, rewind, quick save and custom video filters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c2u.jpg'),(14889,'Drags Tavern',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','Sin plataforma','A 2D Bullet hell MMO with open world to level up and dungeon to complete, A lot of loot to be Achived','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qs5.jpg'),(14890,'Which Way Up: Galaxy Games','2025-03-27','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Which Way Up: Galaxy Games is a family friendly party game that gives unique freedom of movement by allowing you to run on walls and ceilings, orbit around planets, or fall across entire levels by manoeuvring through gravity fields.\n\nBefore The Universe existed, the Space Sprites banded together one-by-one to see a dream come to fruition: the dream of life itself. As The Universe began to take shape, so too did space. But space is unpredictable, and creating life is tiresome work. So, the Sprites took it upon themselves to create a pastime. The Galaxy Games.\n\nEach event features its own unique bite-sized challenge where up to 4 players can compete. Eject your friends into space as you race across gravity fields, score a goal with an entire moon, leap across planets to escape a black hole, and capture and hold zodiacal constellations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rw0.jpg'),(14891,'Electric Fairyland','2024-08-26','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join Stix the fairy on an a tiny 3D adventure through the dense undergrowth of a fantasy garden. A bite-sized collectathon inspired by 90s platformers and childrens\' picture books.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sb3.jpg'),(14892,'Rack 2: Furry Science',NULL,'Point-and-click, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rack 2 is a bondage-themed adult video game featuring predominately furry / anthropomorphic characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3115.jpg'),(14893,'Shooting Aircraft','2024-10-29','Shooter, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','I heard it takes a truck of shells to shoot down a plane? A decompression game that simulates anti-aircraft gun attacks on airplanes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93md.jpg'),(14894,'Tekken 8: Ultimate Pack','2024-01-26','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','The Ultimate Pack includes the following content: Avatar Costume: Classic TEKKEN T-Shirt Set (32 designs) and Avatar Skins (Kazuya Mishima, Jin Kazama, and Jun Kazama).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8myw.jpg'),(14895,'Human Simulator','2020-01-13','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Meet Mr Hugh Mann. Hugh loves humans, and he wants to be just like them. Help Hugh to fit in and learn what human life is like by manually moving his head, arms and legs as you work together to explore an array of fun and wacky jobs in the pursuit of helping Hugh to fit and be accepted by all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lse.jpg'),(14896,'Remorse','2024-12-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Remorse is a first-person psychological horror game. Where you have to get out of an unusual prison, where your jailers are your fears and awakened conscience. But is there a way out of it ...?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5m87.jpg'),(14897,'Oikospiel','2017-02-16','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play as a German Shepherd named Pluto and explore the enchanted climates of planet Earth and the asteroid 433 Eros. Visit an Arctic Ocean wind farm, Kochiri Forest, a computer OS, a cluttered desk, a union-busting prairie in Kansas, a private jet, a flooded city at the North Pole, and many more fevered landscapes.\n\nWritten, assembled, and with an original score by David Kanaga, composer of Proteus, Panoramical and Dyad, Oikospiel\'s soundtrack is \"100 percent intertwined with the game\" (PC Gamer), featuring a lush variety of interactive musical experiences woven together into an operatic whole.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dy0.jpg'),(14898,'Castillo: Shattered Mirrors','2022-03-25','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Castillo Shattered Mirrors is a Gothic FPS and Collectathon. Battle legions of the undead in your quest to defeat Dracula with an arsenal of mythical weaponry. Enter dimensional gates through Dracula\'s castle and decide which worlds to enter, shards to collect, and bosses to defeat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9auk.jpg'),(14899,'Makabaka','2023-07-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a third-person pronoun grass cutting game, a unique magic girl theme game, with the background set in a mysterious autumn forest. The player will play the role of a magical girl with a natural magical talent, facing the threat of ghoul appearing in the forest','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98v8.jpg'),(14900,'Ancient Souls: Starship Renata','2020-09-04','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Race against the time and obstacles. Hunt enemy ships. Make ground missions and vaporize your enemies with your battle droid. Improve your crew members to reach success. Rise in rank and unlock new Corvette and Frigate class ships. Buy new items and unlock new quests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57uu.jpg'),(14901,'Psycho Wolf','2018-11-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Psycho wolf is an indie stealth game, which draws inspiration for its unique graphic style from the first 3D games of mid 90\'s. \nGameplay itself is the evolution of the best mechanics encountered in modern games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hki.jpg'),(14902,'Haste','2025-04-01','Racing, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Haste is a fast-paced running game where you race to reach the portal at the end of a collapsing universe. Run through an infinite amount of levels where no world is ever the same. Between each attempt to complete your run you have the chance to explore a hub world, gather your strength, meet characters and practice your skills before heading out for another adventure. Each run has its own unique challenges with clues to figure out why the worlds are breaking apart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gpd.jpg'),(14903,'Lure: Free',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14904,'Mouse People','2022-09-15','Point-and-click, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mouse people is an experiential commercial game. Please use your mouse to click, drag and destroy people and things. Be chill , face up to your your own thoughts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lla.jpg'),(14905,'Operation: Ops','2015-07-05','Shooter, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Operation:OPS is a lo-fi stealth-action FPS set in an alternate 199X.\n\nPlay as an operative seemingly working for the world\'s most notorious terrorist, who is known only as \"The Operator\".\n\nYour health is low, and you are outnumbered and vulnerable. Once you are detected, enemy reinforcements will arrive in waves until your mission is complete.\n\nA variety of equipment can be selected before you deploy, such as explosives, motion trackers, nerve-gas grenades, sentry guns and amphetamines.\n\nFight in up to nine different operations, with seven possible endings, depending on who you save, and whose orders you choose to follow.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8791.jpg'),(14906,'Spooky Spirit Shooting Gallery','2023-04-27','Shooter','Nintendo Switch','Shoot to defeat the Spooky Spirits! Aim carefully and shoot non-stop in Carnival Mode. Fire at the goodies in the gallery or the ghosts in the haunted house – Choose either stage and take aim to defeat the spirits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bfh.jpg'),(14907,'Healing Hearts','2025-01-16','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Healing Hearts follows Nurse Lucy and Surgeon Kevin as they team up to solve a perplexing medical case involving an elderly patient, Ms. Carter. Initially clashing over their differing approaches—holistic care versus surgical precision—they learn to combine their strengths. Through teamwork and compassion, they diagnose and treat the rare condition, saving Ms. Carter’s life. Along the way, their professional admiration deepens into a heartfelt connection, blending healing, personal growth, and budding romance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ls1.jpg'),(14908,'Super Smash Bros. for Nintendo 3DS: Bayonetta','2016-02-03','Fighting, Platform','Nintendo 3DS','Bayonetta joins the fight to show off her Bullet Arts and Witch Time! A new stage is available, as well!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45qg.jpg'),(14909,'A Game About Literally Doing Your Taxes','2019-09-04','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Just another totally accurate simulation of doing your taxes. We swear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vyy.jpg'),(14910,'Mexico 1921: A Deep Slumber','2024-09-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Immerse yourself in an emotional and intriguing narrative adventure video game about the awakening of a country.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gqq.jpg'),(14911,'Ancient Observer','2021-11-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A short time travel adventure game about a fox exploring a ruined temple.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q4l.jpg'),(14912,'Mutant Football League: Dynasty Game Mode','2018-10-30','Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Do you have what it takes make champions out of a team of underdog rookies? Dynasty is an arcade style franchise mode add-on for Mutant Football League where you get to build the league’s next great Dynasty.\nFeatures:\n• Become the Coach and GM of your favorite MFL team. Win multiple championships to become the league’s next Dynasty!\n• Build your own Legendary Players by earning player XP and investing it in player attributes.\n• Fully customizable playbooks let you change every Defensive, Offensive and Dirty Trick play in your team’s playbook so you can tailor your playbook to your playstyle!\n• Manageable roster and team salary caps let you customize your team, starting lineup, and your player salaries. After all, Legendary Players command legendary pay!\n• Player trades and free agent signings make it possible to cut useless ballast from team’s roster? Have extra cash in your budget? Spend it on free agents or trade up to better players!\n\nDon’t miss out on the Definitive Version of Mutant Football League!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1k2m.jpg'),(14913,'Final Exam','2015-10-01','Adventure','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Final Exam takes place in the near future after an AI revolution has led to the establishment of a new sort of government. You are seeking a job within this government: your performance in the “final exam” determines the outcome. You wake up on the day of your exam to find that your world has unexpectedly changed. You leave your room to seek answers, and find the Administration Centre deserted... \n \nA game written by Jack Whitham for the 21st Annual Interactive Fiction Competition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/upbprmtgfrm2uqnc3lzt.jpg'),(14914,'N Innocence','2022-04-20','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','A mobile Action RPG for Android and iOS','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qdi.jpg'),(14915,'Coffee, Snow, and You','2024-12-19','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A short visual novel about a lonely soul spending December 31st at work. A funny and heartwarming story about searching for joy and meaning on the eve of the most magical night of the year.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mwf.jpg'),(14916,'Assassin\'s Creed III: The Hidden Secrets Pack','2012-12-12','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Hidden Secrets Pack for Assassin\'s Creed III adds three extra missions for an additional hour of gameplay, taking you from the Lost Mayan Ruins to the high seas. Every success is rewarded with an in-game weapon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ual.jpg'),(14917,'Sega Ages 2500 Vol. 28: Tetris Collection','2006-09-28','Puzzle','PlayStation 2','As the name suggests, Tetris Collection contains a number of Sega-published versions of Tetris, Flash Point and Bloxeed. Not only can the original arcade games be played, but you can also view arcade fliers and listen to the game\'s sounds from a special menu selected with Select.\n\nUnique to this collection is the Sega Mega Drive port of Tetris, including full box and manual scans, and a prototype ROM of a cancelled Mega Drive port of Flash Point, both of which were prevented from being sold due to presumed licensing problems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a6z.jpg'),(14918,'AquaNox','2001-11-30','Shooter, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The water is no longer calm. The undersea world has undergone a transformation from tranquil environment to a place of unspeakable violence, graphic murder and horrific danger.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qlh.jpg'),(14919,'Baby Coyote','2020-09-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Arts And Craft Islands Awaits for your arrival, Join Coyote and General Warthog on a tropical Platforming Adventure across this creative archipelago, to save The Craft Kingdom from the Evil Captain Fat Cat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ltq.jpg'),(14920,'Victor Vran: Motörhead -Through the Ages','2017-06-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Victor Vran: Motörhead Through the Ages is a wild tour through the mythos of the loudest band in the world! Bring the mighty Snaggletooth back to life with the help of Lemmy and Lloyd Kaufman! Harness the powers of the immortal Motörhead to defeat frightening new enemies in three demon-infested worlds intertwined with the songs of the band.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h8k.jpg'),(14921,'The Picture of Cafe au Lait','2023-07-07','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The picture of café au lait is a visual novel game that makes the players feel immersed in story and character. They will experience the story in the game through the first-person perspective of the main character in the story named \"Takagi\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ikb.jpg'),(14922,'Hello Engineer','2021-06-22','Puzzle, Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Unleash your creativity in a multiplayer machinery-construction game in the Hello Neighbor universe! Scavenge, craft, and overcome challenges in the bizarre world of a mysterious amusement park. Put together incredible machines built of scrap, and challenge your creepy Neighbor and his evil bots.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uty.jpg'),(14923,'Valkyria Revolution: Scenario Pack - The Circle of Five','2017-07-05','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One','This bundle includes the additional Scenarios of:\n- Cant Stop Falling in Love\n- The Traitors\' Daily Lives\n- As Luck Would Have It\n- The Orphan\'s Dream\n\nIn addition, this bundle also includes Special Ragnite Rush Bolt+ and Ragnite Shards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61hy.jpg'),(14924,'Skulls of the Shogun: Bone-A-Fide Edition','2015-06-02','Strategy','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Washing up on the shores of the afterlife, players meet and join forces with vibrant ghost-samurai warriors, magical animal-monks, and mustachioed samurai generals on the way to capture Skulls of the Shogun. With its roots in classic turn-based strategy gaming, Skulls of the Shogun retains depth and adds a smooth, simple interface that makes it accessible and enjoyable even to players new to the genre. Players immerse themselves in battle with fun and unique game play features amidst lush, eerie environments. Also featuring 4-player local and networked multi-player and an original score inspired by old samurai films and dub, Skulls of the Shogun offers simple-yet-deep, refined and offbeat game-play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2212.jpg'),(14925,'7 Minutes in Hell','2024-10-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','7 Minutes in Hell is an intense, co-operative horror game, where 1-4 contestants must face high-stakes challenges! In this thrilling gameshow experience, work together to hunt for loot and internet fame, while escaping from monsters, traps, and obstacles, before your 7 minutes are up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uwq.jpg'),(14926,'Murtop','2023-05-18','Platform, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Murtop is fast-paced arcade game packed with action, as if it was taken out directly from the 80\'s. Do you have enough coins to beat it?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61jt.jpg'),(14927,'Tales of the Laser Knights','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zak needs to save the galaxy! Explore all 5 known planets, upgrade your Laser Katana, learn how to fight the evil ... and go on an intergalactic adventure, in this sci-fi b-movie Action-RPG!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co932l.jpg'),(14928,'The Town Secrets','2023-11-27','Puzzle, Indie','Android','You\'re neighbor is suspicious! Go to his house and discover what he\'s doing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7exr.jpg'),(14929,'Beatsplosion! for Kinect','2015-12-30','Music, Sport','Xbox One','A rhythm and fitness game for Xbox One Kinect by Virtual Air Guitar Company.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22ue.jpg'),(14930,'Xel: Breaking Time','2023-06-16','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A new chapter of Reid\'s story awaits. Travel back in time to the Xel, meet old friends, make new ones and change the future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ewl.jpg'),(14931,'Honor of Nations','2024-03-11','Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','Honor of Nations delivers unmatched MMORPG experience in mobile platforms. Honor of Nations mobile captures the essence of classic MMORPGs, offering a vast, open world filled with quests, dungeons, and a rich lore. Immerse yourself in epic adventures, all within the convenience of your mobile device. Whether you\'re commuting, waiting in line, or just relaxing at home, your journey in Honor of Nations is always just a tap away.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rg0.jpg'),(14932,'Space Invaders Mini Electronic','2016-12-31','Sin género','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59w2.jpg'),(14933,'Bubble Dreams 3D','2025-01-28','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gogi the rabbit has misplaced his collection of precious rainbow gems... and they\'ve all fallen into several different 3D dream worlds!\n\nUsing his magic bubble ball, help Gogi get his gems back by rolling, drifting, bouncing, and boosting your way through a handful of shiny platforming stages without falling off!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dao.jpg'),(14934,'Solitaire Detective 2: Accidental Witness',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14935,'Neko-nin ExHeart Spin!','2024-07-15','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Neko-nin ExHeart Spin! is the Steam release of the upcoming side story of the Neko-nin ExHeart series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pfr.jpg'),(14936,'Snake on Dope','2009-05-12','Sin género','Linux','Snake on Dope was one of the games built-in on the GP2X Wiz portable console, but was later removed.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14937,'VectroMirror','2020-10-13','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are the Test Subject. Your goal: Obtain human-level emotional awareness. Parkour your way through the increasingly difficult \"Vectormirror\" simulation and achieve sentience...by any means necessary. Play a sci-fi platformer unlike any other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2im1.jpg'),(14938,'Dusttale','2018-08-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dusttale is an unoffical fangame based on Undertale by Toby Fox. This game takes place after the events of an Undertale genocide route. Chara is now in control of the human, and has established a never-ending loop of genocide. Something now stirs in Sans, as he remembers the many previous consecutive routes of pain and suffering. Will you, the human, aid Chara in their quest for everlasting power, or is there a different way?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2f5o.jpg'),(14939,'Multilytheus','2013-09-23','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An abstract puzzle game about navigating space.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bgh.jpg'),(14940,'Frol Blok','2018-04-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Old-school quest in modern cover with fiction atmosphere based on novels of Jules Verne and Herbert Wells. Protagonist, his story and his opinion of what is happening, weaved with wide range of environment interaction possibilities. Burn, destroy, invent and make this work! Have a good time.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14941,'Adventure Ball 3D Balancer','2021-12-11','Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Android','3D Balancer Ball - every level is different from another, good graphics and optimization, nice physics, more than 13+ obstacles, lot of skins for ball, explore the world, collect diamonds and buy whatever skin you want and lot of surprises.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hdo.jpg'),(14942,'Lara Croft: The Last Plague','2023-02-10','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a fan-made standalone game that uses the Tomb Raider The Last Revelation engine while creating its own story and puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lls.jpg'),(14943,'Chrono Ghost','2019-01-04','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are the Chrono Ghost, you must progress through challenging levels using your newly acquired abilities. As you progress, your adventure becomes considerably more demanding. There are many secrets to discover on your journey. Go forth and find them. hurry, time is running out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jjg.jpg'),(14944,'Street Fighter IV Volt: Battle Protocol','2011-06-30','Fighting','Android, iOS','Another iPod Touch/iPhone game called Street Fighter IV Volt Battle Protocol would be made. Launch lineup includes all characters in the previous version remain available in addition to newly added characters of:\n- Balrog (JP name - M.Bison)\n- Vega (JP name - Balrog)\n- Cody\n- Akuma (JP name - Gouki)\n\nFirst update:\n- Sakura\n- Makoto\n\nSecond update:\n- Yun\n- Yang\n- Fei Long','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sva.jpg'),(14945,'Hello Kitty to Issho: Block Crash V','2012-06-07','Puzzle','PlayStation Vita','Block Crash V is a PlayStation Vita Sanrio Wave Hello Kitty/Sanrio game, featuring Japanese idols.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60rn.jpg'),(14946,'Boris and the Dark Survival: Symphony of Shadows','2020-06-30','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The mad maestro returns','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co841x.jpg'),(14947,'Zen Koi 2','2017-11-01','Simulator','Android, iOS','Zen Koi 2 is a sequel to the mesmerising collection game Zen Koi that follows the Asian myth about Koi ascending into Dragons. Developed by LandShark Games, Zen Koi 2 is a free-to-play mobile game that offers an enhanced experience with new features built on the well-loved core gameplay of languid action and strategic collection. Featuring the new Dragon Realm and My Pond, you can now play with your ascended Dragon and decorate your own pond!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pwo.jpg'),(14948,'Paws & Effect: My Dogs Are Human!','2020-02-14','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A quirky, comedic visual novel where dogs transform into people and nonsense ensues! Your choices will teach them about the human condition, but beware: They\'re not the only ones listening. Mysteries and irreverence await you in Paws & Effect: My Dogs Are Human!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ww5.jpg'),(14949,'Miracle Chou Party Plus: Sanae to Tenshi no Gensou Labyrinth','2013-04-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A doujin game by Aqua Style based on the Touhou Project series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xeu.jpg'),(14950,'The Whispered World: Special Edition','2014-05-06','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','When the fate of a world hangs in the balance, an unusual hero arises!\nThe visually impressive adventure-epic The Whispered World is now available as a Special Edition for the first time. Let the Whispered World enchant you with its many animated details and fantastic characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2thc.jpg'),(14951,'Bazooka Cafe','2004-12-17','Simulator, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bazooka Cafe is an interactive dating-sim that explores life as the manager of a cafe staffed by very well-endowed Japanese maids. A kyonyuu (big-breasted) romantic comedy with great art from Kohaku Sumeragi, with plenty of fun sex, and situational humor. This is a game that you won\'t want to miss!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ynz.jpg'),(14952,'Piko Interactive Collection 3','2023-05-31','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Evercade','Piko Interactive returns to Evercade with 10 more great games from multiple systems, including cult favourites and previously unreleased titles!\n\nPiko Interactive Collection 3 for Evercade brings together a diverse range of games, including whimsical 32-bit platformer 40 Winks, the technically impressive 16-bit first-person shooter Zero Tolerance, epic 16-bit RPG Legend of Wukong and many more!\n\nIncludes:\n- 40 Winks (32-bit)\n- Legend of Wukong\n- Metal Mech: Man & Machine\n- Motor City Patrol\n- Punch King\n- Radikal Bikers (Previously Unreleased)\n- Stanley: The Search for Dr. Livingston\n- Super Bubble Pop\n- Sword of Sodan\n- Zero Tolerance','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69p6.jpg'),(14953,'Range','2025-04-07','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Range is a game that helps you stay on-task and focused when you want to be. Set a timer for your focus session, the tasks you want to complete, and enjoy a relaxing, distraction-free drive through a hand-drawn world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n1s.jpg'),(14954,'Roombattle',NULL,'Fighting, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Roombattle is a party fighting game where players will control robotic vacuum cleaners and will fight equipped with sharp objects and balloons. The main objective is to be the last to be equipped balloons in the game. In addition to the battles, the game contains a large crowd of minigames.\n\nMeet up with your friends, customize your vacuum, and get ready to battle in different rooms to claim victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co955g.jpg'),(14955,'RollerCoaster Tycoon 3: Platinum','2006-10-26','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rollercoaster Tycoon 3 Platinum combines the excitement of rollercoasters with the fun of great strategy sim. RCT3 Platinum combines the roller coaster theme park fun of the Roller Coaster Tycoon 3 with included expansion packs Soaked! and Wild! Now enjoy more options than ever. Build your own water slide or create your own safari with real animals. Watch guest reactions to your ultimate theme park!\n\nGrab a front seat for the ride of your life with the jaw-dropping Coaster Cam. See every detail in stunning 3D with fully controllable park cameras. Cope with changing weather patterns and enjoy beautiful vistas, sunsets, moonlight, and more. Experience the latest extreme coasters and heart-pumping rides! Live Every spine tingling detail in stunning 3-D with fully controllable cameras. Spice up any backgrounds, rides, fireworks display and laser light shows with your own music.\nCreate your own park guests and groups with the Peep Designer and experience their reactions to the rides you build! Soak them and watch their reactions! Send them on wild safari and let them pet the animals.\n\nCreate savage encounters and thrilling safaris! Conquer 12 Wild! Scenarios and experience cool jungle and prehistoric design themes. Play through dozens of scenarios in three difficulty modes or build without limits in Sandbox mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v8j.jpg'),(14956,'LifeGameSimulator','2018-05-31','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','How the extremely complicated universe made with simple 16 particles?\n\nThis life game will be short explanation of that.\n\nSimple rule to the complicated results.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14957,'Traintracks Combat','2024-04-17','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Traintracks Combat is a fighting game set on the Chicago CTA. Choose your commuter and duke it out at the California blue line stop.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co847z.jpg'),(14958,'Dooms Hair Salon','2025-03-24','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You must survive while running a hair salon in chaos. Mistakes quickly become crises. Maximize your profits every day!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kj4.jpg'),(14959,'Jurassic Park: Builder','2012-12-31','Simulator','Web browser, Android, iOS','Jurassic Park: Builder was an Apple and later Android and Facebook application produced by Ludia in 2012. It was a construction and management simulation game in which the player built a Jurassic Park featuring extinct animals. It coincided with the release of Jurassic Park 3D and was considered a mobile counterpart to Jurassic Park III: Park Builder and Jurassic Park: Operation Genesis.\n\nThree kinds of parks were available. Jurassic Park, located on Isla Nublar, featuring dinosaurs and other Mesozoic animals. Aquatic Park, located on a seabed featuring extinct aquatic animals. Glacier Park, located in Patagonia, featuring extinct animals from the Cenozoic era along with some Mesozoic crocodilians.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zfq.jpg'),(14960,'Alien Breaker','2008-10-21','Arcade','iOS','It is 2200 A.D. and the Hordes of Octo invaded the Earth. It is your task to deliver the planet.\n\nThe goal in Alien Breaker is to destroy all battalions, represented by blocks on the screen, by bouncing a ball off of a horizontally moving paddle at the bottom of the screen. The blocks are colored and may change colors when hit until they disappear. Levels are won by clearing all blocks from the screen and lost by letting the ball fall out of the bottom of the screen.\n\nAs some blocks are hit, 23 different bonus items can be released and fall down the screen. If the player catches them with the paddle, gameplay changes occur.\n\nThe game is comprised of 50 levels with 4 different enemy types and 2 bosses. The game also offers adapted gameplay using the accelerometer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rj7.jpg'),(14961,'Imperishable Memories','2018-08-25','Shooter','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Imperishable Memories is a narrative-driven shoot-em-up game developed in Unity for PC, Mac, and Linux. It combines bullet-hell gameplay with flashy cutscenes and angsty pondering to tell a story about coming to terms with horrible mistakes and gaining the strength to move on, little by little.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4m3k.jpg'),(14962,'Mid-Garts','1989-12-31','Shooter','PC-9800 Series, Sharp X68000, PC-8800 Series, MSX','When the epic, thousand-year-old battle between different dragon clans was finally over, and the benevolent White Dragons started ruling the country of Akranis, it looked like the age of peace has finally arrived. But all changes when the dragon rider Kain finds an ancient weapon known as the Rune Blade. He brings it to the old white dragon Yoshua, who tells him that a powerful protective artifact has been stolen, and the fateful hour has come to Akranis... with the help of his dragon Sarken, Kain has to restore peace and save Akranis and the dragon race.\n\nThe game is a rather unusual example of a side-scrolling action game, in which the player controls a dragon. Sarken is able to fly in any direction, but so are the enemies in the game, most of which are other dragons. The dragon has a HP bar which is depleted when he is damaged by enemy attacks or traps. Beside physically attacking, the dragon can also learn and cast offensive and protective magical spells.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54nl.jpg'),(14963,'Ruins Magus','2022-07-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR, Oculus Quest','Ruins Magus is a VR action RPG developed for VR. Explore and cast your way in first-person through an immersive fantasy world. As a novice member of the RUINSMAGUS guild, work with the Enigma Research Institute to uncover the mysteries hidden beneath the gilded streets of Grand Amnis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ogz.jpg'),(14964,'The Feathered Serpent','2024-06-11','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Feathered Serpent is a 2d action-platformer with randomly generated levels, enemies, and items! It has heavy Roguelite elements, a progression system granting permanent upgrades, and many items and weapons that change how you attack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nho.jpg'),(14965,'Battle Chasers: Nightwar','2019-08-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Battle Chasers: Nightwar is an American made JPRG and dungeon-crawler, based on the best-selling Battle Chasers comic series by Joe Maduriera and inspired by JPRG greats such as Final Fantasy, Suikoden, Chrono Trigger, and Phantasy Star. It was developed by Airship Syndicate, funded through Kickstarter and published by THQ Nordic. The game features beautiful environments; a gorgeously animated strategic turn-based combat system; and hand-crafted dungeon rooms which are randomly arranged for a different experience each time. Players will battle enemies, find secrets, solve puzzles and explore the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zad8syobz3hdosfl9rar.jpg'),(14966,'Tentacle Tango',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Tentacle Tango is a quirky co-op puzzle-platformer where you and a partner must work together, tethered by a flexible tentacle. Don’t let the cute visuals fool you—this game is as challenging as it is charming. Every jump, swing, and tentacle bend requires precise coordination as you navigate puzzles, obstacles, and enemies. Whether playing solo or in local co-op, teamwork is your only path to victory, because after all, it takes two to tango!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99yv.jpg'),(14967,'Guilty Gear XX Slash','2005-09-28','Fighting','Arcade, PlayStation 2','Guilty Gear XX Slash (ギルティギア イグゼクス スラッシュ Giruti Gia Iguzekusu Surasshu?) is the second updated version of Guilty Gear X2. Once again, the game\'s balance was reworked by changing properties of certain moves and including new moves for some of the characters;[27][28] GameSpot noed \"the game seems to be balanced better than its predecessors.\"[29] Two new characters were introduced to the game, these being A.B.A, who debuted in Guilty Gear Isuka, and Order-Sol, who is Sol Badguy with an entirely different costume, and moveset.[27] It was first released on September 28, 2005 for the arcades in Japan.[7] In December 2005, it was reported that it would be ported for PS2,[28] which occurred on April 13, 2006.[7] This version was the best-selling title for PS2 in its debut week, being fifth overall;[30] it sold 87,414 copies in Japan as of December 31, 2006.[31] It was later re-released under \"Sega the Best\" collection on March 17, 2007.[32]','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co735w.jpg'),(14968,'Gigandes','1989-01-01','Shooter','Arcade','In a future setting, the dimensional, suggestively demonic, creature and title character Gigandes suddenly awakens. Residing deep below the Earth\'s surface, it calls its own worshippers and space force from other galaxies to the Milky Way in order to conquer mankind. Earth\'s defenses constructs the Round-37, a small but powerful space fighter with the intent of stopping Gigandes and its evil plans, combatting its forces and influences on Earth and in space.\n\nThe Round-37 had a four-way weapon system: players equipped weapons on either the top, bottom, back or front of the ship by collecting weapons depending on the direction the ship approaches the item in. The player also had full control over the direction of the ship, allowing the ship to not only collect weapons in a desired direction but also fire in different directions. However, the ship could only equip two of the same weapon at a time. Players had to fight through eight long stages leading up to a boss battle at the end of each one. If the players lost a life during a stage, they would keep all the weapons they collected on the level, but once they beat the level they start the next one with default weaponry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r3h.jpg'),(14969,'Super Mombo Quest','2021-11-04','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Super Mombo Quest is an action-packed precision platformer! A metroidvania with classic arcade mechanics, featuring some crazy combat, challenging combos and plenty of collectibles - all in a huge interconnected world! Bounce and stomp through an enormous interconnected world, doing some intense acrobatics and getting huge combos! A superfast precision platformer that mixes up a Metroidvania world with classic Arcade mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4l1v.jpg'),(14970,'Trapdoors','2022-05-29','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Playdate','A game for Playdate - Make them fall into the right pit!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mhm.jpg'),(14971,'Arena','2017-08-01','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','\"Multiplayer deathmatch games with drones! Enjoy fast multiplayer action with your drone in Deathmatch and Team Deathmatch competitions in exotic arenas.\" Arena supports playing both with and without VR.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96kf.jpg'),(14972,'Spidy',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','Adventures of a young spider','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7684.jpg'),(14973,'The Campsite','2024-10-05','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Campsite is a short point-and-click adventure game, inspired by and crafted in the style of early genre classics, and adapted for a modern-day experience.\n\nIf you have a passion for graphic adventures but never find the time to play, this might be exactly what you’re looking for.\n\nWith about 60 minutes of gameplay, a simplified UI, and no dialogue trees, it is an excellent choice for casual players. It can be played anytime, alone or with others, and is suitable for all ages.\n\nFor those new to classic point-and-click adventures, The Campsite is a great starting point. Featuring a balanced difficulty level and lighter gameplay, it offers an accessible and enjoyable experience for beginners, and hopefully, you’ll be captivated by the magic that makes this genre so special!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9704.jpg'),(14974,'R-Type Delta','1999-08-10','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','R-Type Delta is a horizontally scrolling shooter video game released only on the PlayStation. It is the fourth game in the R-Type series (hence Delta, the fourth letter of the Greek alphabet) and also the first game in the R-Type series rendered in full 3D graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e8r.jpg'),(14975,'Truss','2022-12-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Developed for Haunted PS1\'s Madvent Calendar 3: Necrosis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ysu.jpg'),(14976,'Miner Meltdown','2017-02-23','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Miner Meltdown is an action-packed team-based multiplayer game. Scour the map for minerals, upgrade your gear, and attempt to blow up the opposing team all the while avoiding monsters, traps, and environmental pitfalls along the way. Maps are randomly generated and 100% destructible, so every match is a fully unique, fast-paced, and chaotic affair.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2500.jpg'),(14977,'Secrets of Tatjana',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Digital Video Disc','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14978,'Age of Empires III: Collector\'s Edition','2005-11-04','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this highly anticipated next installment in the Age of Empires franchise from Ensemble Studios, Age of Empires III places players in the time period of roughly 1500–1850, picking up where Age of Empires II: The Age of Kings left off. As players work to establish their empire, they take on the role of a European power struggling to explore, colonize, and conquer North and South America.\n\nAge of Empires III introduces exciting new gameplay elements, including the all-new Home City and an incredible combat system. Players have new civilizations to discover, random maps to conquer, and a single-player campaign unlike any other. Players also find stunning graphics as a result of a revolutionary graphics engine that pushes the limits of PC graphics technology in an entirely new way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80rh.jpg'),(14979,'Avernum: The Complete Saga','2013-01-15','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Avernum: The Complete Saga features six complete dungeon crawling RPGs plus Blades of Avernum, a collection of smaller adventure modules as well as a scenario editor to create your own adventures and cunning characters to share with your friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30p8.jpg'),(14980,'Dune 2000','1999-10-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Real-time strategy taking place in Frank Herbert\'s \"Dune\" universe. The game is a remake of a classic RTS game \"Dune 2\". Player can play as a commander of one of three different factions: Harkonnen, Atreides or Ordos.\n\nDo you like the feeling you get when you have won over someone? If it was something that we had really worked hard, then the fell of victory is something precious and incalculable. The game Dune 2000 could help in giving your competitive spirit a new edge. It is an updated version of the Dune II. In this game the player would have to fight for an interesting thing; the control of the spices in the galaxy. The spices control could make you the most powerful there. The player has to choose to be one of the three houses first: Atreides, Harkonnen, or Ordos.\n\nEach house has its own vice and virtue and the right selection could give the player right start to the game but he could learn as well as, later in the game with time. Once you choose a side, you to win the King’s challenge of producing the most amount of spice. It won’t be as easy as it sounds. For getting the control of the spices, the player has to fight over the other two houses by all means.\n\nDune 2000 is done with enough of stunt and live-in scenes to pep up the theme and there is a soothing sound score to add to the overall theme. It’s a game based on the Dune series book of Frank Herbert and gives the player a real pleasure of both combat and competition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bca.jpg'),(14981,'TagTime',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','TagTime is a 2v6 asymmetric online party game, where a team of monsters hunts a team of runts trying to escape their impending doom. Kill, survive, cooperate or die in thrilling multiplayer action set in a fairytale world where mythical creatures brawl.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zj5.jpg'),(14982,'The Boss Gangsters: Nightlife',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rule the night, become the city\'s boss! Manage your own nightclub, explore the dazzling nightlife, and stand against rival gangsters. Walk the fine line between the business world and the criminal underworld, dealing with corrupt police and authorities','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7n9s.jpg'),(14983,'Penguin Paradise','2022-08-27','Adventure, Indie','Oculus Quest','Penguin Paradise is a variant of the popular game Gorilla Tag. It can be accessed inside the App Lab for Oculus Quest. What makes it unique is a combination of its snow/ice themes and the fact it regularly adds non-tag game modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89lt.jpg'),(14984,'Timewell: Trail of Celestes','2022-09-12','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Timewell: Trail of Celestes is an old-school story-driven 3D space shooter RPG. As A.I. SAT-V, explore exotic planets and fight with Constructs in an ever-deepening plot. Change her skills and adaptations on the fly. May you guide SAT-V to her destiny?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57s4.jpg'),(14985,'SOCOM II: U.S. Navy SEALs','2003-11-04','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','PlayStation 2','SOCOM II is a third-person tactical shooter. There are 12 different single-player missions: split equally between Albania, Algeria, Brazil and Russia. There are five different ranks that can be played in the game: Ensign, Lieutenant, Commander, Captain and Admiral. The player starts with the first three ranks unlocked, but must finish the single player game on Commander to unlock Captain, and on Captain to unlock Admiral. Players can unlock new models for multiplayer, as well as movies, music, concept art, and credits by completing certain objectives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99jv.jpg'),(14986,'Zumbi Blocks','2017-06-01','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build your own defense base with your friends in the quarantine zone and survive against zombies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6iw8.jpg'),(14987,'Nerf Arena Blast','2000-03-10','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nerf Arena Blast is a first person shooter that uses the Unreal Engine, featuring a sports arena in which players use guns either from or inspired by Hasbro\'s line of foam-projectile-launching Ner guns. Like other Unreal-based games, it is oriented around competitive arena-based play, via teamplay, old-style deathmatch, and other match types, and can be played either multiplayer or single-player with bots. Single-player play features tournament modes with progression and scores. It can be played in matches of up to 16 players via LAN or Internet.\n\nThe game was acclaimed for its excellent execution, capturing the enjoyment of the game on which it is based, but mildly criticized for the fact that those opposed to violence in video games would not be satisfied by \"nerfing\" the violence, so to speak, while it would also lose some appeal to those who are turned off by the lack of explicit violence and its more child-friendly approach.\n\nAs of 2024, there is still a community of players who continue to play the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2izx.jpg'),(14988,'Matryona no Yuube','2017-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Matryona is a pretty, adorable girl. That’s what her mother tells her, what her father tells her. She is the ideal daughter that anyone could wish for… But is the reality of the situation truly as sweet as it seems? As they say, everyone has their secrets…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31o7.jpg'),(14989,'The Final Exam','2024-09-20','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game that raise awareness about gun violence and push for legislative reform by immersing players in the terrifying reality students face in America. The game highlights the horrors of gun violence and uses this shock factor as a call to action for meaningful change​ in real life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8x06.jpg'),(14990,'Urban Empire','2017-01-20','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Urban Empire you take control of a mayoral dynasty and lead your city and people through 200 years of history. Establish infrastructures, plan city districts, debate political decisions at the town council, bribe or blackmail your opponents, empower the democratic rights of your people or ignore them and reign supremely by yourself – the decision is yours!\n\nUrban Empire is a ‘City Ruler’, pioneering a new breed of strategy game that combines city builder features with political scheming and adds profound social and historical events into the mix, creating a whole new gameplay experience where players must employ strategic planning and political savvy to successfully grow their cities in their role as Mayor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rs2.jpg'),(14991,'Dishonored 2: Limited Edition','2016-11-11','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Reprise your role as a supernatural assassin in Dishonored 2. Play your way in a world where mysticism and industry collide. Will you choose to play as Empress Emily Kaldwin or the Royal Protector, Corvo Attano? Will you stalk your way through the game unseen, make full use of its brutal combat system, or use a blend of both? How will you combine your character’s unique set of powers, weapons and gadgets to eliminate your enemies? The story responds to your choices, leading to intriguing outcomes, as you play through each of the game’s hand-crafted missions.\n\nThe Dishonored 2 Limited Edition is a limited supply edition of the game (available by pre-ordering from specific retailers before the release date) that comes with additions. They include the following physical and digital rewards:\n\n- A free digital copy of Dishonored: Definitive Edition, an enhanced version of the original title which includes all the DLC and features improved graphics\n- Physical editions from participating retailers come with the Imperial Assassin’s Pack:\n- Duelist’s Luck Bone Charm: bullet packs have an increased chance of holding one more bullet\n- Void Favor Bone Charm: supernatural powers have an increased chance of consuming no mana\n- Lore Book: A Musician’s Farewell\n- Antique Serkonan Guitar\n- 500 coins to use in black market shops\n\nRetailer exclusives include:\n- Best Buy: Dishonored comic book. (Also offers an exclusive The Royal Protector Bundle with Collectible Steelbook, Corvo Keychain and Dishonored: Corroded Man Novel)\n- GameStop: a reversible mask\n- Amazon: free Dishonored soundtrack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8559.jpg'),(14992,'Arrowbound','2020-08-07','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Android','Bound through a painterly pixel art world on a quest to recover your flock of woodland friends from the clutches of giant eagles! Don\'t give up, it\'s only a little higher!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rns.jpg'),(14993,'Rose Garden at the World\'s End','2019-06-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','为了亲眼去看看那名孤独的女性和传说中的蔷薇花园，莉亚开启了她的旅程。','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(14994,'Shall we date?: Never Look Back','2014-04-07','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','A life-risking journey to the Underworld.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rd1.jpg'),(14995,'Hypersensitive Bob','2016-03-29','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hypersensitive Bob is allergic to everything. Armed with a modified asthma pipe, Bob decides to explore the world and get over his allergies in order to lead a normal life in this low-poly, cartoony sky platform crawler.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jpj.jpg'),(14996,'The Night of the Scissors','2022-05-13','Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Scrap hunting season has gone wrong, VHS slasher survival horror.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tt0.jpg'),(14997,'E-scape','2021-09-13','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A mysterious game found at a local resale shop. Not much is known about it, but the label reads \"A True Simulated Nature Experience\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c8l.jpg'),(14998,'Prince of Persia: The Lost Crown','2025-04-11','Platform, Adventure','Android, iOS','Prince of Persia: The Lost Crown is an action-adventure platformer game, inspired by the Metroidvania genre and set in a mythological Persian world.\n\nPlay an epic adventure as Sargon, an extraordinary and fearless young hero. Summoned by Queen Thomyris with your fellow brothers-in-arms, the Immortals, you are sent on a rescue mission to save her son: Prince Ghassan.\n\nThe trail leads you to Mount Qaf, the ancient city of Gods, now cursed and filled with time-corrupted enemies and inhospitable mythological creatures.\n\nTo fulfill your quest, you will have to learn to master unique Time Powers, combat and platforming skills to perform deadly combos to defeat your enemies and restore the world\'s balance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q1g.jpg'),(14999,'Shroom Editor','2018-02-14','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yke.jpg'),(15000,'Hassle 1977','2020-11-03','Shooter, Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Legacy Mobile Device','Break into the Baltic City and join the resistance force Free Breath! Show and prove your skills in PvP shootouts, PvE missions, online drift and street races among other players-rebels and earn respect among them!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2iux.jpg'),(15001,'Bullet Cove','2020-11-15','Shooter, Sport, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Bullet cove is a Fishing x Bullet-hell game made in under 2 days for Mix and game jam 2020','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2moi.jpg'),(15002,'Batman: Arkham City Lockdown','2011-12-07','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Android, iOS','A spin-off game titled Batman: Arkham City Lockdown was developed by NetherRealm Studios for iOS and was released on December 7, 2011. Taking place before Arkham City, the game sees players using touchscreen controls to fight enemies one-on-one, including villains such as Two-Face, Solomon Grundy, Joker, and the mercenary Deathstroke. Defeating enemies earns points that can be used to upgrade Batman\'s stats or unlock gadgets or costumes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zcm.jpg'),(15003,'Ratchet & Clank: Going Commando','2012-06-27','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita','A remaster of the PlayStation 2 Ratchet & Clank: Going Commando, featuring 720p HD with support for 3D graphics and PlayStation Network trophies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6okp.jpg'),(15004,'ShowMeSpeed','2024-08-28','Racing, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','2D Single / Multiplayer speedrunning / racing platformer, enriched with items and timer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8a34.jpg'),(15005,'Idle Craft','2025-06-30','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Start from the most basic elements and help your World evolve through the timeline of progress. Merge elements, unlock new discoveries, and enjoy a satisfying blend of idle and strategic gameplay! And you know what? Your World continues to evolve even while you\'re away!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g4x.jpg'),(15006,'Maggot Face','2022-08-19','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your sister and a lot of other people are missing, solve the mystery and find your sister Kirsty!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15007,'Cybarian: The Time Travelling Warrior','2019-06-21','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Cybarian the time travelling warrior is a classically inspired arcade action game, with a mixture of modern and retro gaming tropes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24g2.jpg'),(15008,'Wagamama Fairy: Mirumo de Pon! Taisen Mahoudama','2003-09-11','Puzzle','Game Boy Advance','Wagamama Fairy: Mirumo de Pon! Taisen Mahoudama is a Taisen Puzzle-Dama game featuring characters from the slice of life manga and anime series Wagamama Fairy: Mirumo de Pon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nig.jpg'),(15009,'Rhythm','2018-02-12','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rhythm is a small minimalistic 2D Music based Action Game\nwhere you have to avoid Hexagon\'s flying towards you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5y3g.jpg'),(15010,'Beatstar','2020-09-14','Music','Android, iOS','Join all your favorite artists in the next generation of music games.\n\nFollow the rhythm! Tap and Swipe to the instruments, vocals or beats to master your favorite songs and experience them in a whole new way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72iu.jpg'),(15011,'Ambush: Convoy Strike','2021-07-02','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deploy unique and powerful unmanned military turrets and stop the advancing enemy convoys!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lfe.jpg'),(15012,'Tom Clancy\'s Splinter Cell','2003-02-28','Shooter, Tactical','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation 2','Infiltrate terrorists\' positions, acquire critical intelligence by any means necessary, execute with extreme prejudice, and exit without a trace!\n\nYou are Sam Fisher, a highly trained secret operative of the NSA\'s secret arm: Third Echelon. The world balance is in your hands, as cyber terrorism and international tensions are about to explode into WWIII.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95ri.jpg'),(15013,'Eggman Hates Furries','2010-10-22','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Eggman Hates Furries is a Game Maker-based Sonic the Hedgehog fangame made by Oddwarg, billed as \"a 2D physics-based platformer which focuses on refined boss battles and stylish presentation\". The plot is fairly simple, but not nonexistent. The story opens with Sonic racing Dr. Eggman to one of the Chaos Emeralds. Just as Sonic is about to claim the gem, Eggman overtakes him, violently knocks him aside, and claims the Emerald for himself. Sonic spends some time unconscious, and dreams of Eggman attacking and capturing his best friend, Miles \"Tails\" Prower. Sonic wakes up at his and Tails\' home, and walks outside to find Tails making some adjustments to the Tornado before setting out on a casual flight. Sonic attempts to follow Tails, only to be confronted by Eggman, who promptly knocks Sonic off a nearby cliff. Sonic and Tails are quickly caught up in a deadly game of cat-and-mouse against Eggman and his many contraptions, fighting for their very lives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52ql.jpg'),(15014,'Metavoidal','2025-06-30','Music, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play as a drummer seeking revenge on a Metal Band of Eldritch Monsters in this wacky roguelite brawler. Fight through hordes of enemies with only your drumsticks & drumming techniques as your weapons. Tap into the power of their music by finding corrupted music discs to increase your strength to defeat each of the band members. Are you good enough to escape the corrupted hellscape, once and for all?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co872p.jpg'),(15015,'Gamer Shop Simulator','2020-03-13','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gamer Shop Simulator - business-simulation game where do you own the store with goods for gamers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lr0.jpg'),(15016,'I Am Not What Remains','2020-07-12','Indie','Web browser','she will reach out in horror','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bk7.jpg'),(15017,'Castaway II: Isle of the Titans','2011-05-18','Adventure','Web browser','A 2D adventure game in which you complete quests, kill bosses, and explore the vast map all while learning new skills and crafting a variety of items. The flash game, developed by likwid, can be found on sites such as Armor Games, Kongregate, and Newgrounds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l0x.jpg'),(15018,'For God\'s Sake',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','For God\'s Sake is a 2D Action-Platformer with souls-like elements. The game itself generates new trials and quests to provide varied and exciting stories. The world is full of humorous characters and dialogues as well atmospheric settings.\n\nThe game tells the story of a young cheeky god named Leigh. Weary of his tricks and ploys, the gods ban him from the kingdom of gods. To cancel his ban, he must face his greatest trial ever: helping people.\n\nTo be sure, Leigh follows their rules, the gods sent their uptight servant Tilly to observe Leigh. But the barefaced god nevertheless tries to deceive his ancestors and retaliate them for his exile.\n\nThere he comes across the dark secrets of the gods…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1h20.jpg'),(15019,'Beat Refle','2022-07-31','Music, Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This new take on rhythm games has you massage beautiful women in time to the music. The patrons of your massage parlor have not only sore bodies, but unique worries weighing on their hearts as well. Use your secret massage technique to clear all the stress out of their minds and bodies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bjq.jpg'),(15020,'Silent Hill 2: Enhanced Edition','2017-10-19','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Silent Hill 2: Enhanced Edition is a project of enhancement packages that makes the PC version of Silent Hill 2 compatible with modern hardware and playable in widescreen aspect ratios, while improving visuals, audio, and bugs. Examples of what Silent Hill 2: Enhanced Edition provides are: The use of a widescreen camera; high definition resolutions; upscaled fonts and 2D images; PlayStation 2 quality audio, fog, and shadows; restored post-processing effects; better controller support; and much more. Made by a collaborative team of programmers, modders, and artistse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96wp.jpg'),(15021,'Johnny Boy: Red Moon\'s Kiss','2022-01-31','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Johnny Boy: Red Moon\'s Kiss is a mature, four-part, gritty interactive drama series, shrouded in crime, secrets and the supernatural. A proper adaptation to werewolf fiction, with deep character development.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4eu8.jpg'),(15022,'Deltatraveler: Section 3','2023-12-23','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Forest (or, alternatively, Section 3) is the third Section of Deltatraveler, taking place in the world of GG!Underfell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ght.jpg'),(15023,'Pong','1972-11-29','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Arcade, Plug & Play','Pong is a table tennis-themed twitch arcade video game with simple two-dimensional graphics. It was the first sports arcade video game and one of the earliest arcade video games in history, helping to establish the video game industry along with the Magnavox Odyssey. Soon after its release, several companies began producing games that closely mimicked its gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2erg.jpg'),(15024,'Wretched Star',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','TW: sex trafficking, sexual abuse, violence, brief traumagenic sexual fantasies not acted on, internalized homophobic use of slurs, suicidal ideation\n\nyuuichirou\'s history and greatest regret forever and yet. what happened to his beloved, and when. (why, too.) everything in here is true.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g4z.jpg'),(15025,'Faani',NULL,'Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short narrative-driven game about the afterlife.\n\nMany people that have experienced Coma said that was a totally different place, the geometries were special and they haven\'t seen such colors before. This game is my notion about how it looks. Who knows, maybe it is.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15026,'Companion','2017-03-31','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a story about a future before the stars are extinguished. A man who knows about the end and decides to live lavishly and a girl who will turn his life upside down. Their story begins when she steps under his umbrella.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nho.jpg'),(15027,'The Lizard King','2004-01-14','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tomb Raider fan game made using the Tomb Raider: The Last Revelation engine. It\'s a new experience using the resources that one of the oldest games in the franchise has to offer.\n\nThis TRLE was placed in the trle.net hall of fame in 2005.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66q1.jpg'),(15028,'Space Invaders','2009-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade, iOS, Handheld Electronic LCD, Legacy Mobile Device','Space Invaders is an arcade video game developed by Tomohiro Nishikado and released in 1978. It is one of the earliest shooting games and the aim is to defeat waves of aliens with a laser cannon to earn as many points as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25xd.jpg'),(15029,'Grand Ages: Medieval','2015-09-25','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Strategic economical trading and war game with a very detailed map of Europe, Nord Africa, and the west part of the middle East. The sea can also be used for transportation and war. Building city\'s from scratch and gain diplomatic trust from npc\'s or actual online players using chatrooms or audiopartys.\nIn overall a heavily complex game to play.\nThis game was created for the ones who have absolutely no life whatsoever\n\nPeace','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q9j.jpg'),(15030,'Moves Away','2024-03-26','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Moves Away is a psychological horror. The story is told from the perspective of Dave, an ordinary man who bought an auto repair shop.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8a4g.jpg'),(15031,'Paddle Master VR','2017-11-18','Sport, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A casual cross between a breakout-style game and racquetball.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27xm.jpg'),(15032,'Bendy and the Ink Machine','2018-12-21','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Bendy and the Ink Machine is an indie first person puzzle-action-horror game with a unique cartoon atmosphere and an intense, frightening story line that keeps you guessing throughout.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67zs.jpg'),(15033,'Romanticized Dreams of a Post-Apocalyptic Cowpoke','2024-05-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Romanticized Dreams of a Post-Apocalyptic Cowpoke is a top down action shooter with randomly generated loot, levels, and enemies. Find unique weapons and upgrades to blast, explode, laser, and kick your way through an army of dastardly bandits!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79al.jpg'),(15034,'Yooka-Laylee','2018-06-14','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Explore huge, beautiful worlds, meet (and beat) an unforgettable cast of characters and horde a vault-load of shiny collectibles as buddy-duo Yooka (the green one) and Laylee (the wisecracking bat with the big nose) embark on an epic adventure to thwart corporate creep Capital B and his devious scheme to absorb all the world’s books… and convert them into pure profit!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z4v.jpg'),(15035,'Namco Museum Archives Volume 1','2020-06-17','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Take a trip down memory lane and relive the magical times of the Nintendo Entertainment System with a collection of Namco’s hits and long-lost treasures in Namco Museum Archives Volume 1.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2c4r.jpg'),(15036,'NSFW: Not a Simulator for Working','2016-10-28','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','NSFW or Not a Simulator For Working is casual simulator game where you try not to work anytime you can. Beware of your snitching co-worker and your boss, you will get FIRED !!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q8x.jpg'),(15037,'Scrap','2017-10-14','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shoot, kick, and detonate your way through a post tech apocalyptic wasteland where robots reign terror upon the resourceful Scrappers. Scrap foes, unlock weapons, play alone or with friends and take back the world in this free, 3D, action, twin stick, shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mj9.jpg'),(15038,'Before the Ash','2025-03-24','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A strategy city-builder with cards and hexagonal tiles, about developing a city next to Vesuvius - the volcano that ended ancient Pompeii.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mmo.jpg'),(15039,'Transmission',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Transmission, you\'re an overnight courier in an open world of chilled-out synthwave vibes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20k1.jpg'),(15040,'Risk of Rain 2: Starstorm 2','2021-01-29','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Starstorm 2 is a work-in-progress adaptation of the Risk of Rain 1 mod \"Starstorm\". It currently features four new survivors, three new monsters, over 20 new items and equipment, and numerous new challenges to shake up your runs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kqj.jpg'),(15041,'Denshi Life 2','2024-12-06','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9euh.jpg'),(15042,'Pipe Inspector: Plumbocalypse','2020-02-03','Visual Novel','DVD Player','Meet Stanislaw, a local plumber eager to provide his services to those in serious plumbing needs, in this DVD-Video game about love, passion and plungers. He\'s ready to inspect your pipes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kl1.jpg'),(15043,'Defender of the Crown','2011-12-06','Strategy, Adventure','Apple IIGS, Philips CD-i, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, iOS, Mac, DOS, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','The Age of Chivalry! A time of lusty wenches and black hearted villains. King Richard has been murdered and England is thrown into civil war! Amidst the ringing clash of steel and the thunder of charging steeds the bold Saxon knights have chosen you to lead them into battle against the hated Normans. Victory will not come easy. To save England your skills as swordsman and military leader will be severely tested. But should you succeed you’ll win the Crown of England and the love of many a beautiful damsel!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wr3.jpg'),(15044,'Kitchen Survivors',NULL,'Indie, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Kitchen Survivors is a bullet-hell game about an old cat that is tired of his owner constantly stirring up a ruckus in the kitchen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5a5b.jpg'),(15045,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization V: Cradle of Civilization Map Pack - Asia','2010-12-01','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Indus River valley was home to the early Harappan civilization while the Yellow River valley in China saw the rise of the earliest Chinese dynasties. Both these regions are included on the same map. The Cradle of Civilization map packs are Firaxis-designed maps of real-world locations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85uv.jpg'),(15046,'ZigZag Fidget','2018-01-25','Arcade','Android, iOS','It\'s a simple straight forward endless game that puts you in control of a fidget stick which is mostly controlled by some crazy laws of physics but other than that, you swipe to move the stick forward and tap at the right moment to make it stop. The game requires impeccable timing and concentration and is a major challenge even for veterans. \nThe game\'s difficulty is deep embedded in its core. Everything has been built around it ensuring that players will love accepting this challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wxqhoo2xyribcrmfzksq.jpg'),(15047,'Mars Survivor: Complete Edition','2025-04-11','Adventure','Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Conquer Mars, fend off alien threats, and secure your path to survival!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ob6.jpg'),(15048,'Football Heroes League','2025-05-02','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Football Heroes League is a high-octane multiplayer soccer game where superhuman abilities meet precise controls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rdq.jpg'),(15049,'Sewer Flood',NULL,'Platform, Indie','Web browser','Sewer Flood is a horror pixel sidescroller/platformer with 2D lights. Fix the pipes to save yourself from a gruesome pixelized death underwater.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15050,'The Scouring',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, MOBA','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Scouring is an RTS with fast pace, high attention to detail and next generation experience. Lead humans or orcs to fight for victory! Play alone or with friends. Use modding tools to create custom game modes! Join The battle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95kj.jpg'),(15051,'You Die Today','2025-06-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Combine deck-building and dice-rolling in this tabletop-inspired roguelike dungeon crawler! Roll D4s, D6s, D20s, and more to activate powerful card abilities and conquer dynamic encounters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ffa.jpg'),(15052,'Fallout 3: Game of the Year Edition','2009-10-13','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Prepare for the Future with Fallout 3: Game of the Year Edition, experience the most acclaimed game of 2008 like never before. Create a character of your choosing and descend into an awe-inspiring, post-apocalyptic world where every minute is a fight for survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yc1.jpg'),(15053,'Physics World',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','\"Physics World\" is a fast-paced horizontal version of the decryption game. There are various colorful physical formulas in the scene, which represent some physical rules. Players can create favorable situations by changing the common physical rules.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4751.jpg'),(15054,'Charlie II','2018-02-19','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The sequel to the original Charlie the Duck. Every level is full of hidden and secret areas, and the challenge is to find them in order to collect coins and diamonds. Charlie can\'t leave the level until he has found enough coins, which is determined by the difficulty setting. There are also hidden levels to unlock. There are 18 levels in this game, with only the first 6 levels playable in the shareware version. There is also an expansion pack that adds 18 additional levels to the registered version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66iq.jpg'),(15055,'Blox','2016-12-31','Platform, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Blox, where your only goal is to reach the other side. \nBlox is an remake of the old TI-83 game called Blockdude, the original game was written by Brandon Sterner. You can fall from any height but can only climb up one unit. \nYou can pick up blocks and drop them to get over obstacles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cz6i5q66rkj7o0lxkfom.jpg'),(15056,'Another World: 20th Anniversary Edition','2014-06-19','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Linux, Nintendo 3DS, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Wii U, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This is an updated version of Another World (also known as Out of This World) for the 20th anniversary of the original game. It is adapted for mobile devices offering both touch controls and a virtual D-pad. The backgrounds are reworked for higher resolutions with subtler shades of light, and crisper detail and edges to the polygons and animations. It is still possible to switch to the original graphics. This version also contains remastered sound effects and three difficulty modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ucg.jpg'),(15057,'Stellar Poetry',NULL,'Fighting, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Stellar Poetry is a 2D action adventure game similar to the galaxy Castlevania. The sorceress, who awakens after sensing the call of a mysterious voice, goes on a series of adventures in order to find memories lost due to the curse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hb1.jpg'),(15058,'Hope Land',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Hope Land is a third person Survival multiplayer RPG set in the world after the ending of the world. Can you survive in the world that “Hope” is the only thing that keeps you alive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43c0.jpg'),(15059,'Crime Car Driving Simulator','2017-09-01','Racing, Simulator','Android, iOS','Take control of some amazing cars (speed car, SUV and 4x4) in a huge environment ready to explore, with a big city, forests, canyons, hills and mountains : more than 16 km² of area and 30 km of roads ! \nJoin a gang and help them to rob banks and to shake off the police. \nDrive in a whole city with realistic and intense traffic. \nComplete tons of unique missions to become a professional driver and to become rich ! \n \n!! City Driver - Speed and Offroad Car contains 20 free levels !! \n \nMake your choice between city cars, offroad cars, and speed cars. \nCome and explore this huge island environment filled with lots of points of interest to discover. \n \nThe city is very big with real traffic cars, buildings, houses, bridges and traffic lights. \nDrive around and see the sights like rivers and lakes, an ancient Japanese temple, airport with other aircrafts and planes, secluded houses and farms, ruins, a camping place, and more... \nThe road system are also very dense, from highways and 2x2 lanes, to very small road of montains, with hill climb. \n \nExplore the map to find one of 20 spots to launch a mission, or you can drive and do whatever you want freely. \nThe minimap help you to know where are the missions spots.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/usyvzi2lpyaavoiy7hha.jpg'),(15060,'Reentry: An Orbital Simulator','2018-11-15','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you have what it takes to be an astronaut? Reentry is a realistic space flight simulator based on NASAs space programs; from the first American human spaceflight in Project Mercury, the rendezvous and EVAs of Project Gemini to the Moon landing in Project Apollo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r46.jpg'),(15061,'Mask Two Two','1987-08-01','Shooter','Commodore C64/128/MAX','Mask II is a single player side scrolling shoot-em-up and is the second game in the M.A.S.K series. This game consists of three missions:\n•Mission one is about destroying an oil refinery that V.E.N.O.M. have set up in the middle east as part of their bid to control oil prices.\n\n•Mission two starts with a tribe in the jungle who worship a fabulous ruby. V.E.N.O.M. have stolen the ruby and are using it in a laser ray gun. It is M.A.S.K.\'s job to destroy the laser and to return the ruby to the tribe in the jungle.\n\n•Mission three sees V.E.N.O.M. holding the president of the P.N.A. hostage and the mission is to rescue him and get him to the summit talks in time to sign a peace treaty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qmd7f6n1jptzxufbrcqu.jpg'),(15062,'Madison VR','2024-05-02','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation VR2, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3','Madison VR now plunges you even deeper into its immersive and terrifying world. With the utilization of an instant camera in your virtual hands, bridge the gap between our world and the unknown. Snap photos, develop them by yourself to solve puzzles, explore the shadows and above all, survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lvx.jpg'),(15063,'Aliens: Colonial Marines - Reconnaissance Pack','2013-05-07','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Battle it out against other players across 4 all new maps in the \'Aliens: Colonial Marines - Reconnaissance Pack\' and instill fear into enemy marines with horrifying new xeno customisation content.\n\nDLC pack includes:\n\n- Three new Team Deathmatch/Extermination maps including \'Shipwreck\', a multi-tiered map where environmental awareness is key in getting the drop on your enemy.\n- A new Survivor map called \'Off the Grid\' located around the iconic Derelict ship outside the Weyland-Yutani military base.\n- New skins, fatalities and heads for each xeno class allow for additional xeno customisation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jbj.jpg'),(15064,'True Love Story 3','2001-04-05','Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','True Love Story 3 follows a male protagonist in his third year of junior high as he aims to confess his love, particularly to his longtime crush, Aotsuki Takane, whom he\'s introduced to by his twin sister, Kaname.\n\nThe game stands out for its high interactivity, with frequent repeated stock dialogues. Players track characters’ friendship and affection levels using a triangular chart, which they can check through Kaname. Instead of playing every day, players choose specific “try-your-best days,” which impact enthusiasm and event frequency.\n\nIts most unique feature is the detailed conversation system. On sunny weekdays, the player can attempt to walk home with a girl, triggering a complex dialogue mini-game. The goal is to raise her \"heartthrob gauge\" without overloading her pounding heart, and possibly score a date.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pod.jpg'),(15065,'Mario in the Dreamscape','2024-02-01','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo 64','Mario follows Bowser into a hectic realm where everyone is being watched...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81k6.jpg'),(15066,'Nrg','2021-10-04','Fighting, Platform, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take platforming to the next dimension! Parkour your way around the stage while you collect energy and shoot anyone who gets in your way. Manage your energy level wisely to get the win, then use your earnings to customize your character until your heart\'s content!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xqe.jpg'),(15067,'Keep It Alive','2020-04-21','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You need to keep this heart alive and shuttle it from Vancouver to Tijuana.\n\nKeep that furnace alive as well; slowing down in these parts is perilous.\n\nMay the Llord be with you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7knu.jpg'),(15068,'All My Gods','2015-07-18','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','All My Gods is a time management game set amongst the Roman pantheon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1sdz.jpg'),(15069,'Tokyo Dark','2017-09-07','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Tokyo Dark is an anime-style horror adventure game combining point and click and visual novel genres. The story follows Detective Itou across Tokyo, searching for the truth behind her partner\'s strange disappearance. Featuring puzzles, stat management, and difficult decisions, Tokyo Dark puts the narrative in the hands of the player. Players\' decisions change their character, opening or locking options and leading to multiple endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s6p.jpg'),(15070,'Bloody Streets','2015-03-12','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bloody Streets is a brutal top-down shooter which will challenge you with areas swarmed by undead in a beautifully stylized and hand painted 2D world complemented by high energy rock music. How long can you survive the sea of monsters while pumping round after round of bullets?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15071,'X Multiply','1989-09-01','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','Is a side-scrolling shooter published by Irem, and similar in style to their earlier R-Type.\nThe game centers around an unusual alien invasion against a colony planet in the year 2249 where the aliens themselves are microscopic creatures that invade, infect, and kill the colonists. Scientists have deployed the microscopic fighter X-002 into the body of the hapless woman whose body has been invaded by the alien queen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ez218d2c2p7r61j13uug.jpg'),(15072,'Harry Obby','2018-06-29','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Harry Potter fan game with obstacle courses. It is a sandbox game and you can explore anywhere at Hogwarts. There are four houses for the player to select. The objective of the player is to collect all of the Famous Witches and Wizards Cards from the game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15073,'The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim - Dragonborn','2013-02-12','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim - Dragonborn is the third and final add-on for the action role-playing open world video game The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21lw.jpg'),(15074,'Zenless Zone Zero: Update 1.3 - Virtual Revenge','2024-11-06','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac','Version 1.3 of Zenless Zone Zero, which includes:\n\n• New Characters: Yanagi and Lighter\n• New Game Mode: Simulated Battle Trial\n• New Events\n• ...and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zdl.jpg'),(15075,'Beatmania Core Remix','2000-11-28','Music','Arcade','Beatmania Core Remix is a rhythm game developed by Konami. It is the ninth game in the beatmania series and is part of the BEMANI franchise.\n\nThe game is played with a controller with one turn table and 5 keys, three white and two black. On the screen you will see bars moving from the top to bottom in columns representing each of the keys and the turntable. When the bars reach the judgement line it is time to scratch.\n\nThe game focuses on remixing the songs from the first two game, where every song features a normal and remixed version. it is the first game that lets you change the modifiers from the music select screen, which becomes standard later in the series, but only only when the game is in event mode.\n\nSince the game focuses on remixes no songs from clubMIX was brought over. Instead 17 songs from beatmania and beatmania 2ndMIX was included and remixed. An additional 7 brand new songs was also included for a total of 41 songs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ccm.jpg'),(15076,'Natsume’s Book of Friends: Hazuki\'s Chronicle','2025-06-05','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Natsume’s Book of Friends: Hazuki\'s Chronicle is an adventure game where you can experience summer vacation in the world of “Natsume\'s Book of Friends”. As the protagonist Takashi Natsume, you are able to meet other friends and spirits and enjoy a wonderful summertime.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99zm.jpg'),(15077,'The Legend of Zelda: Majora\'s Mask - Master Quest','2016-03-28','Adventure','Nintendo 64','The Legend of Zelda: Majora\'s Mask - Master Quest is a ROMhack/mod of The Legend of Zelda: Majora\'s Mask.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54b2.jpg'),(15078,'Artifact Escape Room Bundle',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Play an epic escape room trilogy where puzzles, mystery, and adventure collide in the search for an ancient artifact.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kgs.jpg'),(15079,'Once Upon A Mind: A Little Too Friendly','2025-04-16','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short, story-driven psychological horror experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oj3.jpg'),(15080,'Irotoridori no Sekai: World\'s End Rebirth','2015-03-19','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','When he was a child, Yuuma received a special power from the “translucent magician”, Shinku. Just by touching someone with his hand, he is able to cure all of their wounds in return for some of his memories. In the furthestmost port town of Kazatsugahama, there is a link to a another world hidden in the basement of the Arashiyama-sou dormitory. Within this world he lives his life like a dream. One night while the full moon shone brightly, a girl descended from the sky. “Mister magician, please save me.”','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vqe.jpg'),(15081,'Presidents Quizzer','2012-02-03','Quiz/Trivia','iOS','How much do you know about the Presidents of the United States? Play this fun, quick-fire quiz game to learn who they were and how they changed the world. Answer correctly before time runs out, or it\'s game over! Gradually improve your knowledge of history, and prove to your friends that you\'re the ultimate US patriot!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s7r.jpg'),(15082,'MX vs. ATV Legends: 2023 AMA Pro Motocross Championship','2023-05-25','Racing, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Compete like the pros on 12 official tracks from the 2023 AMA Pro Motocross Championship, including the legendary Loretta Lynn’s!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p5l.jpg'),(15083,'Far-Out','2018-02-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','\"Far-Out\" is a hardcore retrofuturistic adventure with dynamically changing gameplay and multiple endings. Made with the old-school quests such as The Dig, Space Quest, Full Throttle and Blade Runner in mind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24er.jpg'),(15084,'Psycho-unstable Journey','2021-10-04','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is about traveling by car. Here you have to overcome a long way through rain and lightning.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6srq.jpg'),(15085,'Grand Theft Auto: Vice City Stories','2007-03-06','Racing, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','The PlayStation Portable follow-up to Rockstar\'s monumental handheld entry in the series, Grand Theft Auto: Liberty City Stories. As in Liberty City Stories, this game ventures back to the location of the second PS2 game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lc8.jpg'),(15086,'The Tales of Bayun','2023-02-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Can a flat world resting on the backs of three demon bears live in peace? Of course not! Immerse yourself in the universe of the dark Slavic legends, explore the characters\' stories and make difficult choices that affect the course of events. Bayun the Cat will help you. If you\'re lucky, that is.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nd8.jpg'),(15087,'Strange Investigations: Two for Solitaire - Collector\'s Edition','2022-06-17','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An investigation into a fellow detective’s death uncovers details of his last case – and now Dana may be the next target!\n\nThe Collector\'s Edition includes:\n- Find a hidden inheritance in the bonus game\n- Replay your favorite HOPs and mini-games to earn achievements\n- Complete jigsaw puzzles and unlock a secret room\n- Enjoy exclusive wallpapers and music\n- Unravel the mystery with the help of an official strategy guide','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5od9.jpg'),(15088,'Harvest Green',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','畑に種を蒔いて、後は水をやり育つのを待つだけ！！ 育てた作物は出荷してお金にしたり、種にして増やしたり、料理にして街のコンクールに出したり、食べたり、ご馳走したり！ 品種改良で新たな種をゲットして最強の農家を目指そう！！','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co427h.jpg'),(15089,'Plague Lords',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The investigation of multiple disappearances in the midst of the Black Death turns into a bloody stand against a new mysterious threat. Survive in a turn-based, tactical sandbox, managing a settlement and dozens of peasants, craftsmen and warriors to stop the upcoming Scourge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5khx.jpg'),(15090,'As One We Survive',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','As One We Survive is a top down survival game set in a post-apocalyptic America. Step into the shoes of a father as he tries to find help for his sick daughter during a grid down post-pandemic event. Fight, scavenge, craft, and gather resources for your family\'s survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fny.jpg'),(15091,'Leisure Suit Larry: Reloaded','2013-06-27','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Leisure Suit Larry Reloaded is an enhanced remake of Leisure Suit Larry 1: In the Land of the Lounge Lizards (1991), which is in turn a remake of Leisure Suit Larry in the Land of the Lounge Lizards (1987) inspired by Softporn Adventure (1981). The game was conceived through crowd-funding and was designed with the help of some of the original creators.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v0u.jpg'),(15092,'Mata Nui Online Game','2006-01-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A modular Flash point-and-click adventure game developed and updated throughout 2001 by Templar Studios LLC. for the LEGO Group, Mata Nui Online Game (or MNOG) is a game that brought the world of Bionicle to life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3krq.jpg'),(15093,'Dead Fury',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Descend into hell in Dead Fury! - A fast-paced action-adventure title set amongst the rugged mountains of a post-apocalyptic New Zealand, a native blossom is the last hope for humanity after a virus brought back from Mars triggered a zombie apocalypse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pyb.jpg'),(15094,'Donkey Kong Twisted Jungle','2021-03-01','Platform','Arcade','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xfp.jpg'),(15095,'The Life and Suffering of Prince Jerian',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a narrative role-playing game telling the story of a crown prince of the Blessed Arknian Empire. You possess great power, but are also burdened by duty. Can you change the world and stay true to yourself? Every decision comes with a cost.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mrk.jpg'),(15096,'Tempest Rising','2025-04-17','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tempest Rising seamlessly merges the classic action of real-time strategy (RTS) games from the ‘90s and 2000s with modern production and performance standards. Encounter a battle-scarred 1997 in an alternate timeline where the Cuban Missile Crisis went nuclear. In the fallout from the war, a strange red electrical vine known as Tempest started spreading across the planet and changed the course of history.\n\nTempest Rising gives players full command as they build up their bases, lead armies into battle, and execute bold strategies to emerge victorious. Experience the story of two different factions across two campaigns with deep and rewarding gameplay that keeps the focus on strategy and skill, with built-in customization options that let players approach the game their own way in both single-player and multiplayer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pe5.jpg'),(15097,'Kids Station: Hello Kitty no Oshaberi Town','2000-12-14','Puzzle','PlayStation','Hello Kitty no Oshaberi Town is a collection of 16 mini games where the players can learn about colors, numbers, sounds, animals, etc. The mini games go from paint a drawing, buy items at the market, clean the room, catch butterflies, set the clock time, etc. There are some 2 player mini-games as well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h73.jpg'),(15098,'Brothers: A Tale of Two Sons','2019-05-28','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox 360, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Brothers is presented from a third-person view overlooking the two brothers. The brothers are moved individually by two thumbsticks on the controller. The controller triggers also cause the respective brother to interact with the game world, such as talking to a non-player character or grabbing onto a ledge or object.\n\nThe older brother is the stronger of the two and can pull levers or boost his younger brother to higher spaces, while the younger one can pass between narrow bars. The player progresses by manipulating the two brothers at the same time to complete various puzzles, often requiring the player to manipulate both brothers to perform differing functions (such as one distracting a hostile non-player character while the other makes their way around).\n\nShould either brother fall from a great height or get injured, the game restarts at a recent checkpoint. All of the in-game dialogue is spoken in a fictional language, thus the story is conveyed through actions, gestures and expressions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rro.jpg'),(15099,'Squawky',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A mascot horror game where you use a rubber chicken as a flashlight, modifying it with various energies to solve puzzles. Restore the electricity, explore Sunshine Farms, and be careful not to make loud noises. If Squawky sees or hears you, it will chase you, so if that happens, RUN FOR YOUR LIFE!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i1x.jpg'),(15100,'Tankalot',NULL,'Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Tankalot is a fun multiplayer game for up to 8 players where the aim is to be the last player alive. Engage in two-player duels or go all out in an eight-player battle, travel across many locales, defeat your friends and be the last tank standing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/b8qslqcmcwdf8srnftz0.jpg'),(15101,'Gubble','2002-10-06','Puzzle, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Gubble is a cute, colorful alien and he needs your help to get back to his home in this PlayStation game. It seems that creatures of Gubble\'s kind are particularly adept at loosening screws, nails, rivets, and other such fasteners. So adept, in fact, that Gubble has been kidnapped and sent to a dangerous planet to ply this skill. His captors have instructed him to unfasten the screws and bolts on a large enemy ship, promising to return him to his home if he is successful.\n\nSuccess will take good puzzle-solving skills though (and perhaps a little luck), as the falling pieces from the unfastened ship could put a quick end to Gubble\'s efforts. Not to mention the enemy creatures, who would rather their high-tech equipment remain in one piece.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rhv.jpg'),(15102,'Missile Command','1983-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE','As a regional commander of three anti-missile batteries, the player must defend six cities in their zone from being destroyed. The player\'s six cities are being attacked by an endless hail of ballistic missiles, some of them even splitting like multiple independently targetable reentry vehicles (MIRVs). New weapons are introduced in later levels: smart bombs that can evade a less than perfectly targeted missile, and bomber planes and satellites that fly across the screen and launch missiles of their own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gau.jpg'),(15103,'Elevator Down','2025-12-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Judge the Fate of the Dead in this satirical, bureaucratic, decision-making game. Talk to Souls, check their documents, reference Holy Texts and decide if they\'re going Up or Down. Follow the Rules or trust your own moral compass and see where your choices take you - hopefully not the Elevator Down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ovo.jpg'),(15104,'HRO: Adventures of a Humanoid Resources Officer','2023-05-21','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','HRO: Adventures of a Humanoid Resources Officer is a puzzle-driven visual novel set in a retro sci-fi universe. When the Endeavor stumbles into universe-shaking trouble, can you harness the power of the bureaucracy to rein in your crew’s worst impulses and survive to the next episode?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gqk.jpg'),(15105,'Paddleground','2021-06-13','Sport, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A First person paddle ball-er','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15106,'.Hack//Vol. 1 LG-Telecom','2004-04-01','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Legacy Mobile Device','This is the 2004 flip phone game .hack//Vol. 1 produced for the LG Telecom line of phones ez-i. Developed by Mobile Entertainment Net21 in South Korea, published by GAVA Plus and licensed by Bandai of Korea.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86m2.jpg'),(15107,'Pokémon Feuergrün','2010-11-15','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pokémon Feuergrün (eng.: Pokémon Firegreen) is a German Pokémon parody fan game made in RPG Maker based on Pokémon FireRed and Pokémon LeafGreen.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15108,'War Hospital: X-ray','2024-01-11','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this exclusive chapter, you get to discover Marie Curie\'s story, and how she contributed to military medicine. You decide how best to use this technology to tackle new challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tym.jpg'),(15109,'Assassin\'s Creed: Rebellion','2018-11-21','Simulator','Android, iOS','Join Ezio, Aguilar, Shao Jun and other legendary Assassins in new adventures! Build your own Brotherhood and infiltrate the Templars’ strongholds in the first Strategy-RPG of the Assassin\'s Creed universe.\"\n\nAssassin’s Creed Rebellion is a completely new free-to-play standalone mobile game based on the lore of the Assassin’s Creed saga. Set during the Spanish Inquisition, Assassin’s Creed Rebellion will feature famous Assassins such as the beloved Ezio, Aguilar or Shao Jun and other legendary Assassins who will help them build a new Brotherhood.\n\nIn this RPG-Strategy mobile game, players will be able to build, manage and develop their own Brotherhood by recruiting, collecting and improving skills of their Assassins while completing thrilling missions to infiltrate the Templar’s strongholds and defeat their plans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hg7.jpg'),(15110,'Kinetic Void','2014-11-21','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Kinetic Void is a 3D space adventure with a focus on customization and exploration. The shipyard allows players to construct their ship piece by piece. Ships can be as simplistic as a cockpit, a hull, a engine and a gun, or as complex as a player wants. Each module has available subsystems which can be applied to strengthen specific attributes of the ship, and when damaged, those subsystems may be destroyed. While in space flight, interactions between objects are governed by the physics engine. Running into an asteroid at high speed will damage your ship, potentially with catastrophic effects. Using the Kinetic Field Generator (KFG) in game will allow your ship to create an artificial gravity around the ship, both protecting the ship as well as allowing your ship to fly freely through space. This field will also enable the Micro Warp Drive, catapulting your ship far into space in a matter of seconds. Kinetic Void is a procedurally generated adventure, there is no main story line. The decisions and direction is left up to the player. Ally with factions, go to war, build your ship and amass wealth, the choices are yours.\n\nProcedural galaxy creation allows as many new experiences as you\'d like. When a new game is started, the galaxy map, contents of each sector, and the factions involved will be generated from scratch. You may continue to play this galaxy, or if you\'d like to try something different, create a brand new galaxy. Don\'t worry, your old galaxy will be saved in its current state if you ever wish to return. Choose how many sectors you\'d like in your galaxy, as well as how many factions (NPCs) and whether your ships will be Creative or Career mode.Know Your Neighbors.\nIn Kinetic Void the galaxy is a living, breathing thing. Not all factions get along, not all of them hate each other. As factions interact, agreements and treaties will be made and broken. Trade, combat and piracy will affect how the factions see each other based on their own internal standings.\n\nTailor your ship for any role. Make a sleek fighter, a bulky freighter, or a mighty carrier. Your ship’s capabilities and appearance are completely up to you. Using Kinetic Void’s ship builder you can make exactly the ship you want. Customize every part of your ship from cockpits, hulls, engines, weapons, and aesthetic modules. Each module has its own statistics that affect the total performance of your ship. Every module can be further customized by adding subsystems (right click on a module to add subsystems). You can even color your ship exactly how you want. Each module has seven color fields allowing you to make amazing ships quickly, and easily. Once your ship is created, save it to your computer, or share it to the Steam Workshop for the world to see. Subscribed ships from the workshop have a random chance of making it into any new galaxy as a faction vessel.\n\nBe the scourge of the galaxy, or its savior. A life of combat and struggle not your thing? Become an intergalactic trader and influence the galaxy one deal at a time. Not interested in being a ‘good guy’? Take on a life of piracy and plunder your way through sectors, creating havoc wherever you go, then docking at pirate stations for supplies as needed.Intense Active Combat.\nTarget enemy ships and maneuver in real time to align devastating broad-sides or crippling strafing runs. Deploy drones to do your dirty work or simply confuse the enemy into targeting them instead of you while you deal with the enemy vessel. In Kinetic Void, your skills as a pilot are just as important as the components that make up your ship.Take Direct Control Of Your\n\nKinetic Void offers three control modes. In cursor-mode, the player can control the ship through keyboard commands, and pan the camera with the mouse in any direction for quick tactical overview; or Mouse Flight-mode, allowing direct control of the ship through mouse movements. Control your battleship’s turrets from a sweeping orbital camera or slip between asteroids in a dogfight while piloting your heavy-fighter using mouse flight mode. Switch between modes at any time to best suit the situation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t3d.jpg'),(15111,'Ore-tachi Gesen-zoku','2005-07-21','Sin género','PlayStation 2','Ore-tachi Gesen-zoku is a series of 19 emulated arcade machine game titles from the 80s and 90s for PlayStation 2 published by Hamster and only available in Japan.[2] Of the 19 games, the last two – Thunder Cross (1988) and Trio the Punch (1990) – were previously never released on home platforms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94cq.jpg'),(15112,'Truck Driver: Hidden Places & Damage System','2020-10-22','Simulator','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Get ready to hit the road and discover hidden places and new vehicles. Drive safe though, since a new damage system shows visual damage on your truck and other vehicles at the point of impact. With three hidden places, you can search for unknown roads and unlock new achievements/trophies. You can also spot five brand-new vehicles in traffic, including a tow truck and minibus. So drive responsibly and go exploring!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qvo.jpg'),(15113,'The Rangers in the South','2025-01-09','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Purge the lands in this 2.5D HD-2D Pixelart RogueLike ARPG! Create hundreds of characters with unique strategies and abilities, face hordes of enemies, explore different biomes, procedurally generated dungeons, and obtain unique items!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95bo.jpg'),(15114,'Alien Shooter','2006-12-31','Shooter','Legacy Mobile Device','Evil aliens captured secret military base. You have to destroy them all and save the world. You can use different weapons, such as guns, bombs and flamethrower. Uncompromised combats during many levels await you in this game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bje.jpg'),(15115,'Super Hyper Hippo','2014-08-11','Platform','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Only Super Hyper Hippo can prevent the evil Darth Mole from flooding the land with boulders!Dash through the levels, find the hidden orbs and defeat your archnemesis once and for all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s4f.jpg'),(15116,'Centipede','1999-10-22','Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable, Dreamcast','Enter the world of the Wee People and do your best to save them from the QueenPede, who will stop at nothing to destroy this peaceful race of humanoids. In this remake of the classic Atari game, players take the role of Wally, the village\'s humble bean counter, as he is quickly recruited to man the village bug shooter and sent off to save the colony from the ruthless QueenPede and her destructive subjects -- the spiders, scorpions, and fleas -- as she sets out to conquer the peaceful wee people. Work your way through all-new 3D worlds with new weapons and skills. And if you\'re really good, you might just discover the original Centipede.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cr4.jpg'),(15117,'Casting Couch Simulator','2022-10-15','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Realtime 3D simulator of the popular adult genre! It\'s your turn to host a casting. Find out about her and how far is she willing to go to get a part.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dfe.jpg'),(15118,'Final Lap','1987-12-31','Racing, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Arcade','Arcade, Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','Final Lap is a racing video game produced by Namco,[2] and released by Atari Games for the United States in 1987. It was the first game to run on Namco\'s then new System 2 hardware, and is a direct successor to Namco\'s two earlier Pole Position games (1982-1983).\n\nFinal Lap was the first racing game to allow up to eight players to simultaneously race on the Suzuka Circuit, in a Formula One race. This was, at the time, considered a revolutionary feature and was implemented by linking together up to four two-player sitdown-style arcade cabinets.[2][3] It was also arguably the first racing game to implement \"rubber banding\" to ensure that less talented players were never too far behind the leader, a concept that would be taken much further by the Mario Kart series.[3] There was also a single player mode, in which the player\'s score was based on how far the car travelled until time ran out or if the player completed four laps (on default settings; the arcade operator can set the lap number to be as low as three or as high as six).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bujn9jvwiyqscqjirso6.jpg'),(15119,'Supermarket Security Simulator','2023-11-20','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to your first day of work at our supermarket.\nI know this is your first time working security so listen up.\n\nAs security you will have to:\nKeep an eye on people so they don\'t steal, which entails searching old ladies, keep an eye out for gypsies (and not so gypsies) stealing from you.\nIf a thief tries to flee, don\'t be afraid to hit him with the truncheon or electrocute him with the taser. Check the ticket and if he has something he didn\'t buy you handcuff him and put him in the dungeon.\nCheck the security cameras, which will alert you if they detect someone stealing. They are shitty and sometimes fail, you will have to hit them with the broom to fix them...\nWatch out for the trolleys, the old ladies are trying to take them home.\nKids are bastards... Some of them come to eat whatever they want and then they leave the packages empty.\nThey often come to rob the supermarket, so be alert and when you see a robber you neutralize him with a punch.\nYou will also have to work at night so don\'t be afraid and if some robbers come you can shoot them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7eu1.jpg'),(15120,'Crystal Defenders R1','2009-04-20','Strategy','Wii','In a land ruled by might and magic, peace is ensured by the benevolent power of the crystals.\n\nIn CRYSTAL DEFENDERS R1, you must deploy various units such as Soldiers and Black Mages to stop wave after wave of encroaching monsters from escaping the area with your party\'s crystals. There are many different types of units to choose from, some specializing in powerful short-range attacks, some wielding far-reaching magicks, and still others equipped with bows, enabling them to bring down aerial foes. Deploy units in strategic locations to take full advantage of their traits. Each time an enemy breaches your defenses and reaches a map\'s exit, your party will lose crystals. When all your crystals are gone, the game is over. CRYSTAL DEFENDERS R1 comes complete with a plethora of exciting stages, each varying in layout and difficulty. Can you defend them all without losing a single crystal?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hda.jpg'),(15121,'Blackout',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A witch on the roof of a scary old house. Black cats, cobwebs, and a crescent moon - all too creepy! In this point & click adventure, your task is to guide the main character Marilyn as she ventures deeper and deeper into a mysterious house in the middle of the night.\n\nBlackout is a straight forward point & click adventure. Investigate, navigate, and use items to interact with things in your environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3iqb.jpg'),(15122,'Densha de Go! 2','1999-03-18','Simulator','Arcade, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Densha de Go! 2 Kousoku-hen is a train driving simulation game. It was released in the arcades in Japan in 1998. It was ported to PlayStation, Nintendo 64, WonderSwan, Neo Geo Pocket Color, Windows, Dreamcast, and Game Boy Color. The Nintendo 64 version was titled Densha de Go! 64.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25b4.jpg'),(15123,'Perchance to Dream','2021-10-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You awake after dreaming of a mysterious voice...but where are you?\nLet\'s find out!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15124,'Senna Oaks Spaceship Trip','2021-01-16','Strategy','Web browser','Fly Senna Oak\'s damaged spaceship while the controls are gradually failing!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15125,'Iketsuki','2019-11-01','Point-and-click, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An atmospheric platformer set in a dying world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lgt.jpg'),(15126,'Vespera Bononia',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vespera Bononia is a fast-paced action-roguelite set in an ever-changing city. Fight as nightmares come to life and switch classes as a shifting soul. Master a mix of third-person shooter, magic and bullet hell to survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fd8.jpg'),(15127,'Brown Dust II','2023-06-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','The continent of Svern, which had been under the rule of the Karian Empire a long time ago, became peaceful under the reign of five kingdoms.\nHowever, an ominous shadow of dark magic looms, and the fate of the Five Kingdoms is slowly twisted.\nTensions rise amid the growing embers of war, and the terrifying fiend of fate heads for the peaceful Lugo village...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d3q.jpg'),(15128,'Final Fantasy: Crystal Chronicles - My Life as a Darklord','2009-08-20','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','Wii','Final Fantasy: Crystal Chronicles - My Life as a Darklord is a tower defense video game for the Wii and distributed through the WiiWare download service. The game is part of the Final Fantasy Crystal Chronicles series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48y2.jpg'),(15129,'Magical Drop III: Yokubari Tokudaigou!','1999-02-25','Puzzle','PlayStation','Magical Drop III was ported twice to the Sony PlayStation. The first PlayStation port, Magical Drop III: Yokubari Tokudaigou!, and features a mode that attempts to play similar to the arcade version alongside the Saturn\'s \"special\" rebalanced mode.\n\nDespite the \"arcade\" version visually mimicking the Neo Geo AES version (down to emulating the starting menu), there are several gameplay and graphical quirks that suggest that it is an adjusted version of the \"special\" mode rather than a direct port.\n\nThe choice between Arcade and Special mode is given to the player immediately upon booting the game, and the system must be reset to switch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3u3e.jpg'),(15130,'Luckless Seven','2018-12-31','Music, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Luckless Seven is the story of Mark Vesco’s coming of age. Once an inspired youngster, Mark finds himself living a listless, dutiful existence just two years out of high school. When a group of old friends contacts Mark about reuniting with them, the stars align to allow him to join his old friends in a nationwide competitive tournament. \n \nTake control of Mark as he and six friends set out to compete in Arithia’s most popular game, Ekosi. This fast and fun card game is inspired by KOTOR’s Pazaak, and the stakes couldn’t be higher. With a little experience, money, and luck, take Mark from a modest amateur to an Ekosi champion! \n \nWhich card to play won’t be the only difficult choice for Mark, though. Along his journey, Mark will have to make several decisions that will challenge him morally, ethically, and socially. More than just a card game, Luckless Seven invites you to take control of the whole person. Who will Mark be on his quest for glory?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26qr.jpg'),(15131,'Mystery Trackers: Blackrow\'s Secret','2014-09-26','Point-and-click, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','It\'s been two hundred years since the plague swept through here... Authorities quarantined the area around Blackrow Mansion, and it hasn\'t been opened since. But now, an up-and-coming starlet is receiving strange threats that have drawn her straight to the quarantine zone. What is hiding behind the rusted gates of the Forbidden District? Play innovative new mini-games and explore gorgeous hidden-object puzzles as you track down the truth behind Blackrow\'s secret!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8njg.jpg'),(15132,'Double Trouble',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Meet Olivia and Elodie, two sisters on an adventure in an infinite imaginary landscape. Can you help them work together in order to discover what secrets are in store? Explore a colorful, infinite dream world in which to collect, build, unlock and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56k0.jpg'),(15133,'Balantica','2024-12-16','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Safely guide the twins to the altar. The path to the altar branches into multiple routes, each filled with trials and unexpected events awaiting the twins. As their companion, you will choose their path, build a deck of cards to give hope and overcome increasingly challenging trials.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co966v.jpg'),(15134,'Magical Drop F: Daibouken Mo Raku Janai!','2010-10-05','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Magical Drop F - Daibouken Mo Rakujyanai! is the fourth main Magical Drop game. It was released exclusively for the Sony PlayStation on October 21, 1999. Magical Drop F includes character-specific items that have various effects when activated.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3u7x.jpg'),(15135,'Advent Crossroad','2021-08-11','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A shopping mall becomes twisted with monsters in this dungeon crawler RPG. The trapped protagonists must traverse through various areas and survive vicious enemies to escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l0t.jpg'),(15136,'Where the Water Tastes Like Wine: Fireside Chats','2018-11-15','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Where the Water Tastes Like Wine: Fireside Chats is a free standalone experience which acts as a companion to Where The Water Tastes Like Wine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h5m.jpg'),(15137,'Solitaire Christmas: Match 2 Cards','2015-12-24','Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Solitaire Christmas. Match 2 Cards in a fun solitaire. 120 unique levels! Ho-ho-ho Merry Christmas and a Happy New Year!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6tsj.jpg'),(15138,'Megalothymia: Mokusei Zettai Bouei-ken - Heaven\'s Fall','2023-10-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This is a space fleet shooting game that can be easily enjoyed with FPS-like controls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co742b.jpg'),(15139,'Team Kirby Clash Deluxe','2017-04-13','Platform, Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo 3DS','In pretty much the best team up ever, Kirby, Kirby, Kirby, and Kirby must unite to do battle in this free-to-start multiplayer action game! Choose from four roles to make your own Kirby crew, take on bosses, level up, and try out new challenges in this clash of power and puffiness. Are you a Sword Hero? Hammer Lord? Beam Mage? Or Doctor Healmore?!\n\nNo matter what, each mighty role offers up a unique way to play. Puff up your power by crafting new weapons and spending materials at the shop to receive even more weapons, not to mention armor and items. Beyond the main game, there\'s also a ton of quests and a brand-new challenge system. Plus, tapping compatible amiibo figures/accessories will earn you extra fragments to help craft new gear! Are you ready? For Kirby, the answer is always fight and flight...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wbn.jpg'),(15140,'Circadian Cycle Deepest Sleep','2022-01-06','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Circadian Cycle Deepest Sleep is a low-poly 3d horror indie game. You wake up in an infinite corridor and try to figure out what is on the paintings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54rs.jpg'),(15141,'Stonix','2004-06-01','Sin género','Intellivision','You have come head-to-head with the enemy, STONIX! His goal is to exhaust your life energy; yours is to destroy his power source! It will take time to reach it because he has laid many barriers that you need to penetrate. Lucky for you, your power balls mix with his shields to give you zapping deflectors, larger deflectors and even extra life power! Stay sharp, you have a long journey ahead of you! \n \nYou control the reflector located at the bottom of the screen. You start with a ball on the paddle and use it to destroy the shields above. Bonuses will randomly fall from the shields so be quick and collect the ones you need. Clear the screen and advance through the levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1phh.jpg'),(15142,'Strikethrough',NULL,'Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','STRIKETHRØUGH - Your next favorite endless parkour running experience. Available very soon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z9t.jpg'),(15143,'Xenosaga: Pied Piper','2006-07-06','Role-playing (RPG)','Legacy Mobile Device','Xenosaga: Pied Piper is a role-playing video game co-developed by Monolith Soft, Namco Mobile, and Tom Create. The game was published by Namco in 2004 for mobile devices.\n\nThe game was only released in Japan, originally in 2004 as 6 Vodafone apps, starting on July 14th and fully released on October 13th. They were available as 3 chapter purchases, each split into 2 parts released within weeks of each other.\nThe game was made available for i-mode devices on July 6th 2006, through Namco\'s monthly subscription service.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ppo.jpg'),(15144,'U.S.A. Football',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15145,'Hot Dish 2: Cross Country Cook-Off',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15146,'Dormitabis','2018-02-26','Point-and-click, Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A horror fan game that could be much more scary than original five nights at freddy\'s','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z5t.jpg'),(15147,'Yume Nikki Nijisousaku STG','2014-09-02','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yume Nikki Nijisousaku STG is a vertical-scrolling shooter/bullet-hell style Yume Nikki fangame. You control Madotsuki from the original game as she fights her way through the White Desert.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x2l.jpg'),(15148,'Neon Boost','2019-05-20','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Neon Boost is a frenetic First Person Platformer based on mechanics like Rocket-Jump or Wall-Run. Run across 3 different worlds to get the best times on the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d2a.jpg'),(15149,'Hunger',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','HUNGER throws you into the chaos of plague-ravaged Napoleonic Europe. This PvPvE extraction RPG blends brutal melee and ranged combat with deep long term character progression, questing and crafting. Scavenge for resources, battle unspeakable horrors, and outlast rival Living.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qn0.jpg'),(15150,'Be Quiet!','2017-07-31','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You woke up in the middle of nowhere, the only thing you can see in the forest is a house. Solve various puzzles to get to the next rooms and accomplish objectives!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22z3.jpg'),(15151,'Scorch','2018-08-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s been 30 years since a terrible arson attack erased an entire family. Until today the culprit has been on the loose. You are sent to investigate a similar incident in this narrative exploration game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zjk.jpg'),(15152,'Spear of Destiny: Mission 3 - Ultimate Challenge','1994-06-01','Shooter','DOS','Mission 3: Ultimate Challenge is an \"accessory pack\" to Spear of Destiny released by FormGen Corporation in May 1994, which, along with the similar Mission 2: Return to Danger has been called the Mission packs of Spear of Destiny.\n\nAs the Allies\' top agent, you face your toughest challenge yet! Learning from his past mistakes, Hitler has expanded his subterranean command bunker beneath the chancellery in Berlin so that he can keep the Spear of Destiny nearby and well-guarded!\n\nCalling upon the dark forces of the occult, Hitler can see into the future and obtain the plans to future weapon systems!\n\nHaving recaptured the Spear once again, Hitler has made a blood pact with the demon Abigor and has gained knowledge of future weapons systems. He has started developing them in his subterranean bunker. B.J. Blazkowicz is tasked to yet again retrieve the Spear and put an end to the Nazis\' mad plans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ejj.jpg'),(15153,'Tormentis','2024-07-22','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Prepare your dungeon against intruders and protect your loot chests with monsters and well-placed traps. Train your hero, equip powerful gear and conquer other players\' dungeons to fight your way to the top of the league.\n\nWhere classic action role-playing meets dungeon building. Your task is to protect your loot boxes from intruders. They supply you with coins and your opponents want to empty them!\n\nCreate a unique dungeon that will mislead your opponents. Place monsters and traps in your dungeon and lead your opponents into an ambush. They may not reach your treasury in time!\n\nWith every victory over another player you will receive trophies and rise in the rankings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bph.jpg'),(15154,'Farming Simulator 22: Hay & Forage Pack','2023-06-13','Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','Rule fields, mountains, and hills with specialized machines to maximize hay and forage resources! All 17 authentic machines in the Hay & Forage Pack make your farming-life easier and more fun.\n\nNew brands: Brielmaier, REFORM & Reiter\nAlso included: KRONE, PÖTTINGER, Rigitrac & Sepp Knüsel\nSpecialized tractors like the Rigitrac SKH 60 with a slope-compensating cabin\nPrecise mowers for grassland operations, even with side shift functionality\nIdeal ground adjustment thanks to the unique design of the Reiter RESPIRO mergers\nEasy transport with loading wagons like the modular REFORM PrimAlpin','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kcy.jpg'),(15155,'Dash Fleet','2017-04-10','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dash Fleet is a simple and fun dashing action game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26sm.jpg'),(15156,'Micro Vendor Adventures','2018-11-29','Puzzle','Android, iOS','You, as a Vending-Robo, have to deliver soda drink to your customers. You think that\'s easy? There are a lot of obstacles and traps you can think of, and many more you cannot think of. But don\'t worry, just overcome it by controlling environments like blocks and elevators. There are also hidden coins in each level. Do your best to collect all of them! \n \nWanna join this fun journey? We are now recruiting you to be our next Vending-Robo. \n \nGame Features: \n- 8-bit retro graphics \n- Challenging puzzles and boss fight \n- Collecting 3 hidden coins in each level \n- Relaxing gameplay with no time limit \n- No in-app purchases','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hb9.jpg'),(15157,'Guilty Gear: Strive - Additional Character 8: Bedman?','2023-04-06','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Adds Bedman? to the roster of playable characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ieo.jpg'),(15158,'StarsAway','2024-02-29','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Classic rail shooter action. Find secrets and tactics to clear levels effectively across three difficulty settings. Unlock mini games as you progress.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7w1z.jpg'),(15159,'Echoes of Forgotten Dreams',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ogl.jpg'),(15160,'Playtown Remake',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Step into the remade world of Playtown Remake—a first-person adventure horror experience set within a sprawling indoor playground that once echoed with laughter. Now, as a devoted father on a desperate mission to recover your daughter\'s missing necklace, you must navigate a transformed playground where darkness and danger lurk behind every smile','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kiy.jpg'),(15161,'Spread Eagle Cross the Block!','2018-07-02','Shooter, Music','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play as MC Ride from the band Death Grips as you literally spread eagles across a city block. The master copies of your records are lost in the town, and you don\'t know who can be trusted, so just FIRE AT EVERYTHING! There are six (technically seven) records lost and when you find one, weird things happen. There is no way to lose this game and there is only one level!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v7w.jpg'),(15162,'Crush Link TD','2024-02-14','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Protect your inbox from spam to find a message from your crush. A Tower Defense game with new mechanics in virtual setting about online dating.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cm9.jpg'),(15163,'Warface: Chernobyl','2017-12-20','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','As part of the new special operation, Warface operatives will visit Pripyat - one of the most mysterious and historically significant places on Earth. According to intelligence reported to the Warface headquarters, there is increased seismic activity in this region. It is the players\' task is to investigate what is happening in the region and to confirm if the instability is related to the activities of the evil Blackwood organization that have been seen around the city.\n\n\"Pripyat\" introduces new mechanics to be aware of in combat, such as the energy shields that will be used by individual enemies and defensive installations. Players need to ready themselves for the latest creation of Blackwood’s robotics department, called SED. These sinister humanlike androids will pose a serious threat to any squad making precise teamwork essential to bring them down!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j0t.jpg'),(15164,'Broombot Battlegrounds','2023-02-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Battle to the death as adorable household cleaning robots in this frantic physics-based arena combat game! Compete in 1-4 player cage matches with your friends (or enemies) to be the meanest clean-machine of them all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63hh.jpg'),(15165,'For Evelyn II: Shards of Creation',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','For Evelyn II is a captivating adventure RPG in the magical world of Aura. Rich story, handcrafted 2D/3D environments, classic adventuring, choices, and retro pixel art. Explore, level up, and immerse yourself in an unforgettable journey where your decisions shape your destiny.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7oz7.jpg'),(15166,'Duty on Forest','2021-05-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After an attack by a paramilitary group on a government plane, you must retrieve two boxes of rare materials.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p9x.jpg'),(15167,'Hyrule Warriors: Legends','2016-03-24','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Cut down entire legions of enemies using over-the-top powerful Dynasty Warriors\n-style moves as Hyrule Warriors comes to the Nintendo 3DS family of systems. In the portable version, experience new story elements and playable characters from by\nThe Legend of Zelda: The Wind Waker game such as Tetra, King of Hyrule and more. Additional new features, such as the ability to switch between different characters on the fly, allow you to strategically position characters and defeat foes in all-new ways like never before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j9o.jpg'),(15168,'Light Nite','2022-06-30','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Light Nite is a multiplayer third person shooter with in-game rewards and a minimalistic low-poly & cartoonish design offering several game modes like team deathmatch or a battle-royale game mode for soloQ and squads teamplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4cnt.jpg'),(15169,'RC Revolution: High Voltage','2024-01-09','Racing, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immerse yourself in the electrifying world of RC car racing! Experience the thrill of multiplayer mayhem, delve into extensive car customization, unleash your creativity with track design, and embark on a rewarding progression system. Get ready, your track awaits!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d06.jpg'),(15170,'Punihi Loader','2019-08-16','Shooter, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The 12th release in the franchise, 221Games Punity series is single player, Mech custom & Third person shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4m7d.jpg'),(15171,'Real Soccer 2009','2008-11-21','Sport','Windows Phone, Nintendo DSi, Nintendo DS','Take the field and prepare for true-to-life soccer action. Seize control of the ball and execute your most incredible moves to maneuver past your opposition and score solidly in the goal. Dazzle the spectators with your soccer prowess as you dominate the field at some of the world\'s coolest stadiums. Do you have the playing skills to take your team to victory?\n\n-Exclusive Nintendo DS stylus controls allow you to easily perform the most amazing soccer moves on the Touch Screen\n-A multiplayer mode to face up to 3 friends in heated tournaments (Multi-Card Play)\n-6 different leagues and 198 teams (national and club) with real players\' names thanks to the FIFPro license\n-Experience the atmosphere of 12 great soccer stadiums including Milan, Manchester, and Madrid\n-Manage the team\'s strategy using the Nintendo DS stylus in real time during the match','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rku.jpg'),(15172,'Lover Interface',NULL,'Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 29-year-old ordinary guy, Ethan Syu works as an on-site computer engineer by day and runs a struggling personal video channel by night. On his way to a filming location, he gets into an accident. When he wakes up the next day, he discovers a mysterious user interface occasionally popping up in his vision, seemingly showing him the affection levels of certain people around him...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pcu.jpg'),(15173,'Promise Mascot Agency','2025-04-10','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Explore the cursed town of Kaso-Machi! Recruit and train mascot friends! Help out when jobs go wrong! Solve the mystery of your exile! Help Pinky work through her many anger issues! Turn Promise Mascot Agency into the best agency in Japan! Go go, Michi and Pinky!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u8y.jpg'),(15174,'Seaside Fireflies','2022-06-13','Platform','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A seagull meets a girl on the beach who\'s having a heck of a time gathering fireflies along the seashore. Undeterred, our hero offers to help her collect every firefly on the beach!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kos.jpg'),(15175,'Life: The Game','2015-12-28','Point-and-click, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a game about your life. Will you achieve your dreams and goals? Play various minigames and discover more than 15 different endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fx8.jpg'),(15176,'Pet Hero vs. Zombie','2025-05-04','Shooter, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','The zombie apocalypse is here! Choose your animal warrior - a brave cat with a gun, a mighty crocodile with a bazooka or a bold chicken with a revolver! More heroes are waiting to be unlocked.\n\nFace endless hordes of zombies, fight for survival and collect gold coins to upgrade your weapons and unlock new characters and maps. Each battle is a test of skill and endurance - how long can you survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9per.jpg'),(15177,'Hollywood Mogul 4','2025-04-23','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hollywood Mogul 4 is a TEXT-BASED strategy game. Own the studio. Run the studio. Make the movies. In Hollywood Mogul 4 you run your own Hollywood movie studio in a complex, immersive TEXT-BASED business simulation with NO GRAPHICS and MINIMAL SOUND.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9huo.jpg'),(15178,'Driving Home','2022-12-20','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Driving Home is a short indie horror game, where you drive home after working late and you realize you forgot to refuel your car.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yhh.jpg'),(15179,'Deckline','2025-05-07','Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deckline is an atmospheric war-horror card game. Out of ammo and encircled, you play one last game of Durak to distract from the inevitable. Experience the grit and dread of modern combat through the lens of a board game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rl1.jpg'),(15180,'Galactic Civilizations III','2015-05-14','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Galactic Civilizations III is the largest strategy sandbox ever made. Start with a single world and expand across the galaxy through diplomacy, trade, cultural hegemony or military conquest in this single-player or multiplayer 4X strategy game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s9e.jpg'),(15181,'Resident Evil: Revelations','2012-01-26','Shooter, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Resident Evil: Revelations is a survival horror game that restores elements of the series\' nature, as opposed to the survival action of Resident Evil 5. The game features a single-player mode where the player must complete a series of episodes that involve solving puzzles and defeating enemies, and a multiplayer mode where players may fight their way through altered single-player scenarios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54dy.jpg'),(15182,'Rexaura','2014-12-10','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rexaura is a modification for Valve\'s Portal featuring a single-player campaign through an alternate world of Aperture Science. It contains 20 new chambers centered around high energy pellets. Players familiar with Portal and Portal 2 will once again be put to the test because Rexaura introduces a wide array of new testing elements that will force you to sharpen how you think with portals.\n\nRexaura is designed for those who have completed Portal. The puzzles are intended to be challenging to solve but easy to execute once you know the solution.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m53.jpg'),(15183,'Drakengard','2004-07-08','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Legacy Mobile Device','In the mobile version of the PS2 game Drakengard, you control prince Caim, along with the Red Dragon, in a struggle against the imperial forces. Each of the three locations consists of two sequences: side-scrolling fighting with Caim alone, followed by a flight sequence on the back of the dragon. On the ground, Caim\'s moves include sword combos with a finishing blow, blocking, jumping, a dash attack and a dragon attack. To launch a dragon attack, you have to fill your magic meter with finishing blows. Once complete, you can summon the Red Dragon to attack all enemies on the screen, except for the bosses. Each ground level is followed by a duel against a boss.\n\nDuring the flight sequences, you control the dragon carrying Caim. You have to take out all incoming enemies and projectiles with fireballs and destructive spells or use the escape move for tricky situations. The game also incorporates some RPG elements: you gain experience by defeating enemies. These points can be used to level up, rendering attacks more powerful and expanding the maximum amount of health. Additional experience points are based on a time bonus and the stage score.\n\nAlthough the story of the original game is only vaguely mentioned, all missions have an introduction explaining your mission and the setting. There is a high score list and you can upload your score to an online ranking board.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15184,'Goudou Manif','2023-09-07','Visual Novel','Web browser','The Goudou Manif is 40! This game tells the story of the 1st march organized by lesbians in Geneva on May 22, 1982.\n\nA game created by Queer Code and Lestime, with support from the City of Geneva.\nMusic: Ragoût from the album Haute Alliée by Rrrrrose Azerty.\nTranslated by Gull.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g4q.jpg'),(15185,'Tequila Zombies 2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15186,'Bumps',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15187,'The Ancients','2024-06-05','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Ancients is a turn-based survival strategy game where you will manage a hunter-gatherer tribe through the ice age. Every decision you make will affect the tribe culturally and politically.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i60.jpg'),(15188,'SinVR','2018-07-15','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Oculus Rift','Enter the Forbidden World of SinVR. Fulfill your sexual fantasies in your own private dungeon. With a growing library of characters and environments, SinVR is the destination for amusing adult entertainment, in VR or on your PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gbs.jpg'),(15189,'Pilot Brothers','2014-12-18','Adventure','Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','The case of the stolen elephant!\nElephant... Rare... Striped.\n...has been kept for many years by an animal trader named Karbophos.\nBeing unable to overcome abuse, it escaped and found a home at the zoo in our city.\nThis is definitely Karbophos\'s work.\nTo the zoo!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vbd.jpg'),(15190,'Wyrdsong',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A dark, preternatural historical fantasy open-world RPG set in middle-ages Portugal. It is said to be inspired by \"The Witch.\"\n\nThis will be the debut title for Something Wicked Games, which was founded by former Bethesda Game Studios designer Jeff Gardiner and Obsidian Entertainment alumnus Charlie Staples. It will be built in Unreal Engine 5.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55eb.jpg'),(15191,'Naraka: Bladepoint - Deluxe Edition','2022-06-23','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Experience the Unchained Multiplayer Combat with NARAKA: BLADEPOINT DELUXE EDITION, including pre-order bonus, an exclusive hero outfit, a weapon skin and a grappling hook, and 10 tidal crates, together with digital soundtrack and digital art booklet','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3t30.jpg'),(15192,'Kitty\'s Last Adventure','2024-09-17','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this wave-based roguelite auto shooter, play as Kitty the cat aboard her flying cat-saucer created by her distraught human.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bpx.jpg'),(15193,'Tony Hawk\'s Pro Skater 1+2: Collector\'s Edition','2020-09-04','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','This edition includes:\n-Tony Hawk\'s Pro Skater 1 + 2 game\n-Digital Deluxe Edition content\n-Limited Edition full-size birdhouse skateboard deck','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vl8.jpg'),(15194,'Near Mint','2024-08-12','Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A roguelike deckbuilder where your cards have been torn into pieces','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg');
INSERT INTO `games` VALUES (15195,'Sunken','2016-05-26','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Action RPG meets Roguelike in this atmospheric dungeon crawler. Spawned by two hardcore gamers, Sunken will constantly test your ability to adapt to a situation while it takes you through a dark journey of the one that has sinned.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/equvulsvalxbgcapzhhr.jpg'),(15196,'Tiny Tanks','2019-04-11','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Tiny Tanks is an 8 player multiplayer game with toy tanks that blow each other up in a completely destructible arena. With hundreds of game modes and modifier combinations, each round is different.\n\nIn Tiny Tanks you control a small toy-like tank and try to beat your enemies (or friends) in every round to get the most points and win the game. You can beat your friends mainly by shooting them with hilariously oversize bullets or catapult them of the map by making them drive into one of your deadly mines.\n\nBut beating your friends is not just about destroying them. You can win points by evading mines dropping from the sky, not touching the ground when the volcano erupts or by not falling off the map when gravity starts to shift. To make the whole situation even more chaotic, you can destroy the whole map with your bullets and mines. If your enemy thinks he is safe on the bridge he is wrong, because it suddenly collapses as your mines detonate below it and send him flying off the map.\n\nYou can beat your friends in local multiplayer or fight with total strangers online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1puc.jpg'),(15197,'War Wind','2021-09-15','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','War Wind allows you to view this epic struggle through the eyes of four unique races, each with its own strengths, weaknesses and distinctive A.I. A real-time strategy masterwork, War Wind features 28 read-to-play scenarios. A powerful Scenario Editor that allows you to place units and build new battles. And a story of such compelling depth you won\'t believe it\'s just a game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e2n.jpg'),(15198,'Cool Pizza','2012-09-17','Arcade','iOS','A girl and her haunted skateboard dive through the depths of the underworld, fighting devils and looking for answers. Can pizza ever be cool?\n\nCool Pizza is a spastic screen-masher inspired by Space Harrier and After Burner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wgm.jpg'),(15199,'JumpStart 3D Virtual World: Trouble in Town','2007-05-11','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Someone or something is causing trouble in Jumpstart Town! Frankie and the rest of the JumpStart gang are waiting for you to come and figure out who or what it is and clean up the crazy mess.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8h0g.jpg'),(15200,'Fairytale Requiem',NULL,'Adventure, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','A visual novel from Liar-soft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ise.jpg'),(15201,'Spacecom','2015-05-06','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A strategic-to-the-bone, star fleet command game in which deception, smart movement, and choices to battle decide victory or defeat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rdg.jpg'),(15202,'Pogger\'s Legends','2023-05-09','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pogger\'s Legends is a turn based \'card\' game where you recruit heroes to defeat villains. The battle system is made from the ground up using elements that affect eachother, per-unit stats and unique abilities that can be battle decisive. There are an infinite amount of per-save generated stages and near infinite possible units. Save the day in Pogger\'s Legends now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xkr.jpg'),(15203,'Crazy islands','2023-02-01','Platform, Indie','Android','Crazy islands is a game in which you will have to collect some resources to build a boat and escape from islands where natural disasters occur.\n\nThe game has several levels in which the shape of the island and natural disasters vary.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62ul.jpg'),(15204,'Betrayal','1990-12-31','Simulator, Strategy','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, Amiga','The bloodiest battles yield the greatest spoils. Strategically extend your domain, reduce your rivals\' resources, and tighten your stranglehold on the peasants of the land.\n\nBetrayal involves a long, hard, ruthless struggle, starting with the economic management of your towns and cultivation of your lands, culminating in the honing of your military strategy and execution of political subterfuge.\n\nThe West Marches is a corrupt land ruled by immoral leaders. You are one of four Knights with a lust for power. And in the pursuit of power, the end justifies the means.\n\nDevelop a mastery of political subterfuge, gaining places for your Courtiers at the palaces of the King and Bishop, ready for the coup which will make you the master of Betrayal.\n\nThe towns provide your power base. Manage them successfully, and harvest the wealth needed to buy, bribe and fight for ultimate power.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20gs.jpg'),(15205,'Mortal Kombat 11: Mileena','2020-11-24','Fighting','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch, DUPLICATE Stadia','DLC fighter added in Kombat Pack 2, released separately at a later date.\n\n\"Mileena is the perfect blend of Baraka\'s ferocity & Kitana\'s grace. Brought forward in time, this clone now knows of her reign as Empress and death at Kotal Kahn\'s hands. She is set on retaking her throne.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mkk.jpg'),(15206,'Offendron Warrior','2018-12-28','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Offendron Warrior is a retro arcade that combines shooting and defense, inspired by Williams Electronics\' 1981 classic \'Defender\'.\n\nYour objective is saving Offendron civilians in the planets from the group of enemies, who are trying to spread a virus that turns Offendrons into mindless killing machines and eventually destroy the whole planet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qvm.jpg'),(15207,'Kingdom of Kuru: The Great Race','2021-03-20','Platform, Racing','iOS','Both a platformer and an action racing game, Kingdom of Kuru pits you against both other players and monsters to race through levels using your powers to hinder your rivals and get to the end first.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co316d.jpg'),(15208,'Awkward Dimensions','2013-08-25','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','They may be Awkward Dimensions, but they\'re my dreams.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mkrxxqt1bjhfzdl4g9xf.jpg'),(15209,'Naruto: Ninja Council 2 - European Version','2005-05-05','Sin género','Nintendo DS','Naruto: Ninja Council 2 European Version is the third instalment in the Ninja Council series and the first for the Nintendo DS. It was released in Japan as Naruto: Saikyō Ninja Daikesshu 3 for DS and in Europe as Naruto: Ninja Council 2 European Version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v74.jpg'),(15210,'Disastory',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An illustrated choice-driven roleplaying adventure where coffee machines find love and teenage girls steal eyeballs!? Explore a vibrant world with absurd stories and characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9arc.jpg'),(15211,'My Funeral Home',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Start your own funeral home business and whether it is the right fit for you. Build your hearse, transfer the remains, prepare bodies for burial, and make a decent income. With all the work, there’s little room for downtime. Death knows how to keep you busy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pj0.jpg'),(15212,'Ghost Blade','2015-09-17','Shooter','Dreamcast','The Ghost Blade – Caravan Shooting Game -- is an ace shoot \'em up for the Sega Dreamcast with focus on arcade action joy and elaborate scoring system. And various player ships too choose from and a load of game modes, such as five stage game mode or challenging caravan game mode and last but not least: time attack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co810x.jpg'),(15213,'Mario Kart 8 Deluxe','2017-04-28','Racing, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Hit the road with the definitive version of Mario Kart 8 and play anytime, anywhere! Race your friends or battle them in a revised battle mode on new and returning battle courses. Play locally in up to 4-player multiplayer in 1080p while playing in TV Mode. Every track from the Wii U version, including DLC, makes a glorious return. Plus, the Inklings appear as all-new guest characters, along with returning favorites, such as King Boo, Dry Bones, and Bowser Jr.!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co213p.jpg'),(15214,'Herald: An Interactive Period Drama - Book I & II','2017-02-22','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Herald is a choice-driven adventure set on colonial tides. \nBoard the HLV Herald and uncover its dark secrets in an intriguing tale about tyranny and servitude.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26xr.jpg'),(15215,'Yu-Gi-Oh! Duel Monsters 4: Battle of Great Duelist - Kaiba Deck','2000-12-07','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Game Boy Color','Yu-Gi-Oh! Duel Monsters 4: Battle of Great Duelist is a Game Boy Color game and the fourth installment in the Duel Monsters series of Yu-Gi-Oh! It features 900 different cards and was released as three seperate versions, each having a unique selection of cards that can be used during the story and traded with the other versions.\n\nThis version focuses on Seto Kaiba and the god card Obelisk the Tormentor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iam.jpg'),(15216,'Mortal Kombat 11: RoboCop','2020-06-16','Fighting','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch, DUPLICATE Stadia','Alex Murphy was a dutiful police officer who was brutally executed by a local gang. Brought back to life through OCP technology, Murphy was transformed into RoboCop, a highly advanced cybernetic police officer designed to uphold the law and protect the innocent. Now entering the Mortal Kombat universe, RoboCop has received a few upgrades and is ready to serve the public by apprehending any Kombatants that stand in his way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i3r.jpg'),(15217,'Witches\' Legacy: The Charleston Curse - Collector\'s Edition','2019-05-03','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','End the Charleston Curse before it wipes out an entire family and save a young girl in Witches\' Legacy: The Charleston Curse! After finding out that you are the last living relative to a young orphan named Lynn, you discover the terrifying tale of her family. The Charlestons have been systematically killed by a witch and now it’s up to you to protect Lynn! Confront the terrifying witch and save Lynn in Witches\' Legacy: The Charleston Curse!\n\nThis is a special Collector\'s Edition release full of exclusive extras you won\'t find in the standard version. The Collector’s Edition includes:\n\n- Bonus gameplay\n- Integrated Strategy Guide\n- Stunning soundtrack','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15218,'Torcurus','2022-10-31','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as a turtle in this retro inspired adventure game! After you was born you found strange shrimp, that starts your adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ent.jpg'),(15219,'Mikone Douchuu','2019-07-14','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wes.jpg'),(15220,'Mushihimesama HD','2012-05-24','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Nintendo Switch','An updated port of Cave\'s bullet hell shoot \'em up Mushihimesama. Features new Beginner and Arrange modes, and a port of Mushihime-sama Cave Matsuri Ver 1.5 as DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27kq.jpg'),(15221,'Senpai Puzzle: Waifu Summer','2023-02-27','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The free swapping puzzle game with stunning 4K Waifus, 10 free Waifus, beautiful Waifu gallery, chill lofi music, and customizable settings. Experience the sizzling allure of Waifu Summer today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92hm.jpg'),(15222,'Yahari Game Demo Ore no Seishun Love-come wa Machigatteiru. & Zoku Omatome Set','2017-10-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Yahari Game Demo Ore no Seishun Love-come wa Machigatteiru. & Zoku Omatome Set is a bundle containing the previous two games from the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qzc.jpg'),(15223,'Fish Tanks','2021-12-31','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fish Tanks is an arena shooter game where you play as a tank-driving fish with one objective - to bring as many starfish back to your base before time runs out. Battling the clock and the opposing team, arm yourself with power-ups and blast the opposing team to steal their starfish before they shoot you out of your tank.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47s7.jpg'),(15224,'Gladiators Online: Death Before Dishonor','2015-11-04','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gladiators Online: Death Before Dishonor recreates the thrills and adrenaline experienced by Rome’s most talented warriors. Fight, train and lead your House to victory against other players, in this real-time tactical action game about a school of gladiators.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1kvg.jpg'),(15225,'These Remains','2018-10-30','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','last night out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x1o.jpg'),(15226,'Momo','2018-07-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Momo is a horror game based on the history of the whatssap user \"momo\", in the game, you will be a guy that contacts momo by whatsapp, and now he will be pursued by the monster of momo.\n\nYou will have to complete some tasks before get rescued, like search things, hide, close doors, etc.\n\nThe objetive is to survive until the timer reachs 00:00 then, the police will arrive and you would able to escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67n1.jpg'),(15227,'Earthquake Simulator VR','2017-07-03','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Virtual Earthquake Simulator made for the HTC Vive.  \nExperience a short earthquake and fire simulation while learning functional survival techniques. Great for family learning in a fun immersive environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b0c.jpg'),(15228,'Stop','2020-06-01','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A puzzle platformer where you can stop time and ride bullets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cja.jpg'),(15229,'The Jumping Melon Rush','2025-02-07','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dpp.jpg'),(15230,'Grandpa: Bread Adventure','2025-02-17','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Who said that old age is no fun? Grandpa: Bread Adventure is a crazy reimagining of the runner genre. Run around the city, overcoming obstacles, dodging hated scooter riders and geese.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mfg.jpg'),(15231,'Shutterbuds','2025-05-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','shutterbuds is a first-person multiplayer photography game! Explore Lone Tree National Park with up to 3 of your photojournalist friends. Take jobs from top magazine brands, then hit the trail in search of interesting landmarks and goofy creatures to photograph. Use your pay to buy useful items and cosmetics. You’ll be sure to make the front page in a flash!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pz4.jpg'),(15232,'Dandara: Trials of Fear - Enhanced Edition','2020-03-05','Platform','Windows Mixed Reality, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dandara: Trials of Fear Enhanced Edition includes:\n* Dandara: Trials of Fear Edition\n* Dandara: Trials of Fear Edition Original Soundtrack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3duu.jpg'),(15233,'A Bridge Too Far','2020-02-03','Puzzle','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15234,'Laserwave','2020-07-12','Shooter, Music, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Grab your mouse...\n\nTurn up the volume...\n\nLet the beats flow through you!\n\nLaserwave is a synthwave bullet-hell-like rhythmic shooter where your actions are defined by the music!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5eu3.jpg'),(15235,'SWAT 4','2005-04-05','Shooter, Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','To simulate realistic police procedures, SWAT 4\' encourages the use of non-lethal force to subdue and arrest subjects rather than incapacitating or killing them. In addition, players must follow strict protocol to ensure proper use of force. Players may not fire on suspects with lethal weapons unless the suspect points their firearm at a fellow officer or a civilian. Penalties are given for unauthorized use of force, injuries to hostages, officer incapacitation, and personal injury. On the higher difficulty levels, more points are required to pass the mission, with 100 being perfect. On the most difficult level, Elite, players need a 95/100 to pass, and will fail for killing even a single suspect, losing more than two team members without committing an infraction, or committing any infraction in addition to being injured.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xuh.jpg'),(15236,'Watch Dogs 2: No Compromise','2017-05-18','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Brings a new Main Operation to life as a DedSec op goes wrong and the Russian mafia gets involved. And if you\'re looking for even more challenges, the new Online Coop Mode squares you off against \'enemy\' players, who will do everything they can to prevent you from completing your goals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p2t.jpg'),(15237,'Cryostasis','2009-02-27','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Year 1968. Arctic Circle, Russian North Pole station \"Pole 21\". The main hero Alexander Nesterov is a meteorologist accidentally caught inside an old nuclear ice-breaker North Wind, frozen in the ice desert many years ago. This steel creature once fought for its life and freedom, but it has fallen into an ice trap and all the creatures on its board lost not only their natural look, but a right to die. Cryostasis is a story about a drama of a Captain and his Ship evolving in the atmosphere of animal fear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22ia.jpg'),(15238,'Arena Renovation','2023-03-27','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take on the role of a one-man renovation team tasked with restoring various sports facilities to their former glory. Many of them have been destroyed as a result of time or lack of care. Don\'t let them go into complete oblivion - roll up your sleeves and breathe new life into them!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6aze.jpg'),(15239,'Endoparasitic VR','2023-10-31','Puzzle, Simulator','SteamVR','Three limbs ripped off, infected with a deadly parasite, you must save your research. Drag yourself through the corridors of a secret research lab on a remote asteroid, fight off horribly mutated monsters, inject countless syringes of vaccines, and survive at all costs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d1e.jpg'),(15240,'Nano Assault Neo','2012-11-30','Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','Wii U','Stop the deadly Nanostray virus from spreading in the nano cosmos. Traverse a breathtaking microscopic world. You are one against millions.\nNano Assault NEO is an all-new unique twin-stick style shoot \'em up game for Wii U.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6uy6.jpg'),(15241,'Tharn','2018-05-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you have what it takes to beat the Tharn? Solve puzzles, crack codes, hack computers, smash glass, or just make a mess for the heck of it.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15242,'Again',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Escape from an ever shifting, ever shrinking maze construct - a polymorphic computer simulation!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15243,'Ghostlop','2004-01-01','Sin género','Neo Geo AES, Neo Geo MVS','Ghostlop is a Matching Puzzle game, developed and published by Data East, which was released in Japan in 1996.\n\nGhostlop is a head-to-head arcade style puzzle game featuring a unique mix of elements from Puzzle Bobble and Breakout, with a color-switching mechanic reminiscent of Silhouette Mirage and Ikaruga.\n\nYou aim shots the same way as in Puzzle Bobble, but there are only two main colors of bubbles to destroy--or in this case ghosts. The A and B buttons determine whether your shot is red or blue. If your shot is the same color as the ghosts it hits, it will cut through them like in a bonus level of Alleyway. If it\'s the opposite color, it will bounce off without doing damage. You can switch as often as you like (even while the ball is bouncing around) so if there are a lot of red ghosts surrounded by a layer of blue ghosts, you could detach all of them from the top of the screen by throwing a blue shot to pass through the outer layer, switching to red to move through the middle, and then switching back to blue to pass out the other side, dropping the majority of the ghosts and putting a lot of garbage on your opponent\'s screen. As your ball bounces around you\'re free to move your character back and forth along the bottom of the screen, and you need to catch the ball when it comes back or suffer the penalty of having the pieces lower one notch.\n\nThe action is fast-paced and smooth. The lighthearted characters and rockabilly music add a lot of charm that is missing from newer puzzle games like Lumines and Planet Puzzle League.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/txokn223xhkdse371o1i.jpg'),(15244,'Apartament 1406','2023-08-24','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Apartment 1406 is a horror game that will give you an amazing experience in a dark horror world. The game introduces psychological elements such as ever-changing environments and two alternate worlds, which makes it very interesting and mysterious. The player must face various unknown phenomena, ghosts and demons, which combined with the dark and gloomy atmosphere will give you great emotions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hs0.jpg'),(15245,'Indiana Jones and the Last Crusade: The Graphic Adventure','1989-07-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS, FM Towns, Amiga','Europe, 1938. The Lost Ark was just a warm up! Now Adolph Hitler is after the most powerful talisman of all- the Holy Grail. A few brave men stand in his way. Fortunately, one of them is Indiana Jones. And this time, he has his dad with him.\n\nThe bad guys are in your face all the way- Nazis, mercenaries, traitors, spies. Not to mention everything the Luftwaffe can throw at you.. Can you handle the heat?\n\nIf you can, you just might earn a higher I.Q. (Indy Quotient) than the man with the whip and the hat.\n\nPuzzles, action, adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82vl.jpg'),(15246,'Merry Go Wrong',NULL,'Indie','Web browser','This merry go \'round is about to merry go wrong! Get in the carousel and don\'t fall off, try to fix the kid\'s rides by left clicking near them when they catch on fire and don\'t run out of stamina. You can refill it by left clicking while standing near the soda bar at the center of the attraction','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15247,'Scary Shadow Spot: Last Farewell','2024-09-19','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scary Shadow Spot: Last Farewell - Haunted by his past, Mark explores a haunted house where nothing is as it seems. Chilling puzzles and shocking truths await. Are you ready to uncover the mystery hidden in the shadows?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oj6.jpg'),(15248,'Hero Team','2023-01-05','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A side-scrolling multiplayer shooter. 1-4 local players can fight 4v4 battles online and offline, or speedrun practice missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4w8c.jpg'),(15249,'Harvest Moon DS','2007-06-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Nintendo DS','Help to save the Harvest Goddess, who has become trapped in another world, in the first game of the farm-simulation franchise to appear on the Nintendo DS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xm4.jpg'),(15250,'Deru: The Art of Cooperation','2018-11-07','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Deru is a cooperative puzzle game that mixes eye catching abstract art with mind bending puzzles to a unique gaming experience.\n\nIn this couch co-op experience two players team up to overcome the boundaries of shadow and light and succeed through teamwork, timing and tactics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28x6.jpg'),(15251,'Smoking Simulator','2014-07-16','Simulator','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Smoking Simulator tasks you with surviving a stressful day at work armed with only a handful of cigarettes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4r4a.jpg'),(15252,'Killer Trait','2023-08-06','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Would you ally with a serial killer to get revenge on your worst enemy?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g9s.jpg'),(15253,'Call of Cthulhu: Shadow of the Comet','1993-03-25','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC-9800 Series, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','You\'ll take on the role of John T. Parker, a brilliant young astronomer, piecing together the puzzling history of the village and its cryptic inhabitants. Incredibly realistic action and supernatural chaos intertwine to draw players deep into the puzzling mysteries within the Shadow of the Comet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wht.jpg'),(15254,'Pretty Girls Tile Match','2022-09-30','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','A matchpalz game is now available in the \"Pretty Girls\" series, where you match 3 mahjong tiles with the same design and erase them! Clear the stage, get costumes for 6 Pretty Girls, and aim for completion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5f14.jpg'),(15255,'Spacident','2018-03-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Made for TK Game Jam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jwy.jpg'),(15256,'Diabolik Lovers More, Blood','2013-10-24','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Second game in the Diabolik Lovers series and sequel to Diabolik Lovers: Haunted Dark Bridal. The game takes place one month after the prologue of the first game and introduces the Mukami brothers as four new love interests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nib.jpg'),(15257,'G-Mode Archives+: Tondemo Nishibuuki 2 - Paris Boutard Rally','2021-08-19','Racing','Nintendo Switch','Let\'s go to a retro world with a bubble-era feel! An unusual journey covering a total length of 10,000 miles between Paris and Boutard.\n\nTondemo Nishibouki 2 Paris-Boutaes Rally is one of the works of the Choicego Computer series, and is a racing action game created in the style of game software released for 8-bit hardware in 1991.\n\nChoha-chan, the main character, has arrived at the western capital, TENJICK, and obtained money and fame. Although he has climbed the ladder of victory at the speed of light, his days are unstimulating. He felt something was missing.\n\nOne day, Hacchan is recognized for his driving skills and is entrusted with something by a racer. It was the right to participate in the world\'s No.1 phantom race, \"Paris-Boutard Rally\"...!\n\nUse jumps and turbos to step on enemies, climb over cliffs, defeat unique bosses, and aim for victory! Don\'t miss the story full of bubbly tidbits and the retro-style instruction manual that can be viewed in-game.\n\nThe G-Mode website includes instructions to learn how to make 3D glasses that give a 3D view of the screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co827z.jpg'),(15258,'Nip For Speed 2: Search For Pussy','2025-04-26','Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','On still waters with a dog at the wheel, a catnip trace ahead. Mist, moonlight, and the unknown—what could be out there?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15259,'Hashtag Dungeon','2016-06-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hashtag Dungeon is a dungeon crawler with roguelike elements that uses Twitter as its method of dungeon generation! Create dungeons yourself using our built-in dungeon editor and tweet your levels to the world, or venture through levels created by other players. Assume the role of a Dungeon Explorer or a Dungeon Master in order to create a unique dungeon crawling experience!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15260,'Car Wash: Cars & Trucks Garage Game for Toddlers & Kids','2021-07-15','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Welcome to the world of car wash! In this amazing game for toddlers and kids of any age, you take care of washing and cleaning 25 different vehicles. Hose, brush, wipe, wax, dry, polish and even enchant the cars with a touch of magic to make them shine even brighter. No skill required. Just pick your tool and start swiping on the car to get the work done! Earn stars while working to unlock the remaining cars. Suitable for all car-enthusiast all over the world :) This game was designed and created with the help of kids and media-educators to ensure a relaxing, frustration free yet rewarding gaming experience for even the smallest kids. This game makes use of the touch screen functionality only. So the menu and every scene can be played with touch controls only.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co577v.jpg'),(15261,'Hyperslice',NULL,'Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fast paced action arena roguelike where you defeat waves of enemies using your dash. Slice through enemies or push them to survive. Upgrade and buy abilities throughout your run to turn your ship into a killing machine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co914a.jpg'),(15262,'The Big Catch: Tacklebox','2024-06-07','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crack open the Tacklebox to show off your platforming prowess and fishing skills in this free prologue to The Big Catch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c6m.jpg'),(15263,'Soulborn',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','If you mix Zelda and The Witcher you will get SOULBORN; a story driven open world RPG-ADVENTURE based on exploration, combat and character development. The world is inspired by the NORSE MYTHOLOGY and the conflict of humans living in the absence of the fallen gods. \n \nPlay on the side of Thor’s mighty hammer MJOLNIR which came to life and TRANSFORMS into different weapons and creatures to support your journey. Level up your character, fight against a lot of different enemies, solve DUNGEONS & PUZZLES and master your abilities to defeat the ultimate beast Nidhöggr and stop the RAGNARÖK. \n \nExplore a vast OPEN WORLD, secret places and interact with a fully immersive breathtaking environment. Discover UNIQUE BIOMES and their thrilling inhabits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23cy.jpg'),(15264,'Hearts of Chaos','2017-01-06','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RPG veteran Warfare Studios (Vagrant Hearts, Ashes of Immortality, Shining Plume) is back with a new tale in this exciting, story-driven RPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jpi.jpg'),(15265,'Where They Wait','2025-04-28','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qv7.jpg'),(15266,'Raiden','1990-09-01','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade, PlayStation 3, Atari Lynx, Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, PC (Microsoft Windows), TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, DOS, FM Towns, Atari Jaguar, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD, Super Famicom','Raiden consists of eight vertical scrolling missions where the player maneuvers the Raiden craft dodging and destroying enemy robots, buildings, ground targets, and aircraft. There are bombs and missile powerups as well as collectable medals which add to the score. When player dies, the fighter\'s fragments become projectiles that damage enemies.\n\nAfter defeating the Stage 8 boss, the mission is completed, and player receives 1 million points for each completed loop. Afterwards, it will start back to Stage 1. This time around, enemies shoot faster and at a more rapid rate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z96.jpg'),(15267,'Lost City of Bardo','2025-03-14','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A massive open-world maze adventure game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pje.jpg'),(15268,'PiiSim','2019-03-28','Shooter, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mnv.jpg'),(15269,'Super Corporate Tax Evader','2022-05-02','Simulator, Indie','Playdate','The tax lawyer has come to subpoena your company. Shred all your incriminating documents so they have no basis to sue!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4q1o.jpg'),(15270,'Pico Park','2019-06-08','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Pico Park is a cooperative local/online multiplay action puzzle game for 2-8 players.\nThe rule is quite simple: \"Get all the keys and get to the goal and clear\", but all 48 levels have special gimmicks designed specifically for multiplayer. At most levels, different gimmicks will appear as you move forward, and you will need to consult with your peers and think about new ways to cooperate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yks.jpg'),(15271,'Space Strider','2024-02-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Space Strider is a 2D Sidescroller Shoot \'em up with Roguelite elements, where you beat hordes of enemies and defeat unique bosses. Unlock, upgrade and level up your Spaceships to become the ultimate Space Strider!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bhe.jpg'),(15272,'Mighty Wars','2025-03-12','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mighty Wars – A thrilling turn-based strategy game blending RPG and PvP action. Build an immortal hero team, craft war strategies, and dominate real-time battles against global rivals. Conquer the Warzone, join guilds, and become the ultimate war commander! Free to play with in-app purchases.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pkc.jpg'),(15273,'Minion Raid: Epic Monsters','2022-08-08','Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience epic minion adventures as a trainer in the dungeon\n\nYou have the power over many little minions - train them to become unbeatable fighting machines and take the scepter in your hands! The monsters of the underworld are looking for a new overlord, but the selection in the dungeon is hard...\n\nTo leave the arena victorious, you need well-trained minions with special abilities. They also acquire them through evolution. Your trainer skills also play a role: the better you are as a drill instructor, the more dangerous your troops will be in battle.\n\nAttack is the best defense: Choose a suitable battle strategy!\n\nDepending on the training session and the type of minions, they have different fighting abilities. Some are stronger in attack, some are better in defense. Accordingly, you need a clever battle strategy. Choose the attacking minions for the front lines and the minions with a longer range for the back lines. It\'s also helpful if you know the strengths and weaknesses of your opponents in the dungeon and choose your battle lineup accordingly.\n\nBefore facing the competition in epic battles, you can try out your minion squad in test campaigns.\n\nBut if your lineup is suitable, you can also send your minions directly into the arena for the first PvE battle. Let\'s see how good your training was... There are also tournaments in this idle fighting game - those are fought in PvP mode.\n\nWinning the arena will bring you not only higher prestige, but also gold and a better ranking in the league. If you still don\'t get enough of battling in the dungeon, then create a guild and work together with other guild members to make fat loot.\n\nFame, glory and gold make you an overlord\n\nYour mission in this idle fighting game is to seize the power in the dungeon. You\'ll achieve this by preparing your minions well for battle. As a trainer, you should also advance your own skills. To do this, you\'ll use the gold you collect through victories in the arena. Idle missions in the tavern also bring you gold. You can use it to upgrade your trainer skills and those of your minions. Afterwards, you fight your way across the dungeon on a map and encounter different enemies. Use your captured resources wisely while training your minions and you\'ll soon be able to rule over the monsters of the underworld.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lec.jpg'),(15274,'Alice\'s Mom\'s Rescue','2014-11-06','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), Atari Jaguar, Atari Jaguar CD, Dreamcast','Alice\'s Mom\'s Rescue is an indie puzzle / platformer game in the pure style of old school pixel art.\nThe Giant Raven Has Captured Alice\'s mother.\nHelp Alice save her mother through the 3 worlds and 25 levels!\nChange Alice\'s height by jumping on the magic mushrooms to get through the tiny spaces.\nBut be aware that a small size will also affect Alice\'s physical abilities!\nSolve puzzles, beware of the evil cats, birds, bats & spikes, and find the right path to victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a1w.jpg'),(15275,'Chowder: Bookin\' Cook','2015-09-18','Simulator','Web browser','Chowder Bookin Cooking is a cooking and serving game. It\'s one of those fun restaurant management games, even better with Cartoon Network characters like Chowder and friends! Let\'s keep people fed, and the money coming in!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15276,'Love is Strange','2016-04-01','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A fan dating vn based off Life is Strange.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4w9d.jpg'),(15277,'Raanaa: The Shaman Girl - The Frozen World','2020-12-18','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, iOS','Raanaa is a third person adventure 3D platformer.\n\nRaanaa, a courageous shaman girl, helps the spirit worlds that are in danger. With the help of her shaman abilities and her magical dress, she can defy gravity.\n\nRaanaa travels through wondrous spirit realms and collaborates with different Gods and Goddesses to fight evil spirits and deities in order to obtain balance in the universe and save humanity.\n\nRaanaa travels through spirit worlds that are all inspired by old Saami and Norse stories and mythology. In every episode the player gets to visit in a new spirit world. Become the savior of the spirit worlds!\n\nJUMP, GLIDE AND SOAR TO EXPLORE!\nRaanaa\'s shamanistic powers and magic dress allows her to jump higher & further, glide and even soar through the air! In the spirit worlds the islands, trees and even mountains are floating in the air, these skills become very handy!\n\nSEEK, FIND AND COLLECT!\nTo proceed in the game, Raanaa has to activate the powerful Sieidi stones by collecting enough colourful spirit essence.\nBut there are more things to be found in the spirit worlds. Hidden objects and animals, not to mention plenty of tokens! So many in fact that it raises a question: what will happen if you collect them all?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j2u.jpg'),(15278,'Darker Skies: Remastered for PC','2023-08-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Darker Skies comes fully remastered to PC. Incorporating new graphical features and gameplay enhancements for the definitive way to play Darker Skies. Survival Horror set after the War of the Worlds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wfg.jpg'),(15279,'Word Connect HD',NULL,'Puzzle','iOS','Do you like puzzles and word games? Brought to you by Greyhead Studio, a fun and addictive word connect game from space! \nWith over 450 000 words and 500 levels, enjoy a fun space theme Word Connect game and become the ultimate word guru! \nYour goal is to create words using the letters provided. Rearrange letter tiles by clicking on the letters in order to spell a word and click the ”check word” button. If the word you found is valid, it’ll fill the empty letter slots in the big box above. If the word isn’t valid, click the “shuffle” button to clear the letters and reshuffle them around and try again. You can also type the word out on your keyboard. If you find yourself stuck on a word, don’t get discouraged! Click the “ puzzle” button to get a hint and find out which letter to use next. \nHave fun learning new words and training your logic with your friends and family.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jyh.jpg'),(15280,'The Creature Zone VR: Welcome To Dystopia','2024-03-07','Simulator, Indie','SteamVR','Set In The Fictional City \"Rapid Lakes, Michigan\", You Play As David Skymanski, A Creature Zone Department Of Science Officer. When You Start To Realize How Damaging The Creature Zone Is, You And A Few Citizens Get Together To Finally End The Dictatorship.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qov.jpg'),(15281,'Bounty Battle','2020-09-10','Fighting, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Bounty Battle is the indie fighting game -- a new multiplayer 2D fighting game, where you can square off as your favorite indie hero against other indie heroes from games like Guacamelee!, Darkest Dungeon, Dead Cells, and Psychonauts 2 among other awesome indies. The game features more than 30 character, each with their own companion Minion and unique abilities. It’s Super Smash Bros. meets indie games where you battle across levels inspired from indie game worlds with up to 4 players','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20yg.jpg'),(15282,'Star Wolves 3: Civil War','2009-10-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Large-scale battles have become a vestige of the past, depleting resources of conflicting parties. Settled space, where welfare and order had reigned, has become a cemetery for dead ships which is flooded with pirates and adventurists. Complete impunity, black market flourishing where gun and tech trade is on the move, arbitrariness and anarchy – the Galaxy has become a real dangerous place. Events in the Universe and its habitant’s destiny are completely up to player’s choice and tactical decisions.\n\nStar Wolves 3: Civil War is a sequel to the popular real time strategy with RPG elements. Original large-scale scenario, closely tied with the first part of intergalactic epic helps the player influence the ongoing events and foreordain one of many endings. Free roam, free mission selection, free team forming – the world of Star Wolves waits for its heroes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co422o.jpg'),(15283,'Foxxel Quest','2025-04-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Foxxel Quest is a cute and challenging pixel art puzzle game! Help Foxxel find a warm hood while solving 80 unique puzzle levels. Each setting brings a new challenge that builds upon each other throughout the game. With 30 achievements and optional autoplay, it\'s fun for all ages!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nvj.jpg'),(15284,'Queue Simulator','2023-11-12','Simulator','Playdate','experience the thrill of waiting in a long line','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co849c.jpg'),(15285,'Cyber War: Fight to the Last Man',NULL,'Shooter, Indie','Sin plataforma','CyberWar is a multiplayer online game, playable on PC. The focus is on player vs. player gameplay with each player piloting a battle hovercraft. The objective is to destroy enemy troops and complete the mission either by destroying all vessels of the opposing team or capturing the enemy team\'s base. The player takes control of a single hovercraft of his choice, and enters the battle on a random map. The player has control over the hover\'s movement, firing, and can communicate with allied players via the text chat. The goal is to survive and save the human race from extinction by breaching into the heart of the enemy\'s defense, while contending with traps, drones, robots.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ag1.jpg'),(15286,'Furry Woof','2020-06-23','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is a classic puzzle game with several levels of difficulty and beautiful arts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92ap.jpg'),(15287,'That Night','2021-07-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','That Night is a short PSX horror game. You\'re a girl in the 90\'s that one night decided to take a walk in a road in the middle of the forest. The more you progress, the more you hear voices of something that is following you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cdn.jpg'),(15288,'Betsy\'s Hospital','2020-03-04','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A small, surreal exploration game based on a memory of a children\'s hospital.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gpp.jpg'),(15289,'Eternal Labyrinth',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Battle through procedurally generated dungeons filled with hordes of monstrous foes. Arm yourself with an arsenal of ever-evolving weapons and recruit legendary Heroes. Each dungeon grows more treacherous as you push deeper into the unknown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ma8.jpg'),(15290,'Malpractice Hospital','2025-03-03','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Malpractice Hospital is a new take on the strategy simulation genre, that blends purposeful patient mismanagement and surgical treatment into one unique malpractice experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pjy.jpg'),(15291,'Shattered Realms',NULL,'Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Shattered Realms is a modern brawler being developed by a small team at the bottom of Africa. We\'re heavily influenced by a number of fighting games along with titles such as Devil May Cry and the Arc games. What if you could combine everything you love into one package? We aim to find out.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gb0.jpg'),(15292,'Godball',NULL,'Arcade','Sin plataforma','Godball was a freeware unity game published by adultswim games in which you sling around a giant ball shaped animal monster in order to cause as much destruction as possible to various cities. The game seems to have been pulled from the site, but unofficial mirrors still exist.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15293,'Stranger','2022-08-11','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Stranger is a VR and first person lore-driven horror game where you defend your house against an unknown enemy. Make use of the provided locks and lock the windows when you hear the Stranger nearby. You can choose different levels of difficulty and choose from different maps and uncover the story of your player, the Stranger, and more. Hidden stories and lore-driven cryptic messages will be left to be discovered.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86kd.jpg'),(15294,'Serious Sam: Tormental','2022-04-08','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Serious Sam: Tormental is a 3D rogue-lite top-down shooter where you blast your way through the tormented mind of demigod of destruction Mental, as he imagines worlds and monsters that stand on your path towards his inner ego. Let the showdown begin!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hnb.jpg'),(15295,'Secret of Harrow Manor','2018-04-24','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The year is 1988. People have been going missing in a sleepy New England town--and by all accounts, they have been for years. All signs point to an old estate in the woods that the locals call Harrow Manor. Can you find out what happened? And more importantly, can you get out alive?\n\nSecret of Harrow Manor was created because I wanted to make a VR game in the survival horror genre that put you up against zombies and monsters in a creepy abandoned mansion setting similar to the games that inspired me so deeply when I was growing up. One where even an individual zombie was to be feared, and you needed to search the area for ammo and keys in order to make it out. Along the way you\'ll also find many documents to read that will slowly reveal the story of what happened at this mansion and what created the monsters in the first place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co272t.jpg'),(15296,'Monster Prom','2018-04-27','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You have three weeks to get a date for Monster Prom! Go through absurd and funny situations, raise your stats and seduce one of your classmates. Beautiful art, bold, unapologetic dialogue and hard choices make up this Multiplayer (1-4 players) Dating Sim. Love your worst self.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ig1.jpg'),(15297,'The King of Fighters: Kyo','1998-08-27','Fighting, Adventure','PlayStation','The King of Fighters Kyo is a spin-off from SNK\'s successful fighting games that focuses on the series main character: Kyo Kusanagi. The game takes place 11 months after the \'96 tournament, and covers the months prior to the \'97 tournament and the tournament itself from an RPG-like point of view. You control Kyo, and go around the world (starting in your home, Osaka and eventually going to places like Mexico and California) advancing a plot line related to the Orochi storyline and your eternal enemy, Iori Yagami, by interacting with other characters from the series, solving subquests and winning fights viewed from a first-person perspective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ulp.jpg'),(15298,'Challenge of the Five Realms','1992-01-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','The multi-dimensional world of Nhagardia is quickly becoming paralyzed by the evil lord Grimnoth\'s terrifying plague of darkness. As Prince of Alonia, you now have 100 days to keep the world from being cast into eternal despair!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xqb.jpg'),(15299,'Fisher Haven','2025-04-10','Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fisher Haven is an immersive fishing adventure where you compete in the island\'s annual competition. Upgrade your gear, discover unique baits, and form alliances with fellow fishers to maximize your chances of victory. Explore diverse zones, catch over 100 fish types, and hunt down 7 rare species in this relaxing yet competitive fishing experience. Will you become the island’s ultimate fishing champion?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mdu.jpg'),(15300,'Loverboy','1983-12-31','Sin género','Commodore C64/128/MAX','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/isybtxjjsygo4vhujn42.jpg'),(15301,'Mirage Episode: 1','2025-03-06','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pki.jpg'),(15302,'NASCAR Racing 4','2001-04-06','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','NASCAR Racing is back for 2001 better than ever! For the first time for NASCAR game, the Daytona track! Arcade racing mode for the novices, simulation mode for the experts, multiplayer mode for up to 32 players. Improved physics model, improved graphics engine with real-time shading. Improved radio chatter, ability to tell pit crew what to do before you pit... And much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ydl.jpg'),(15303,'Knights of the Crusades','2025-05-05','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Travel to the Holy Land with the First Crusades. Rise from a humble knight to the founding father of a world-spanning holy order. Lead through war, faith, diplomacy, and cunning schemes. Experience a unique blend of RTS, city-building, and sandbox gameplay, and shape history!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nln.jpg'),(15304,'Money Theft','2025-02-28','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Terlander gangster live in dystopian world which is full of zombies and enemy soldiers. Only way to survive is kill enemies and find money bags','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pkm.jpg'),(15305,'Pikiinya!','1997-02-03','Puzzle','Super Famicom','Pikiinya! is a Japan-exclusive action-puzzle video game developed by Crea-Tech and published by ASCII, which was released in 1997 for the Super Famicom.\n\nPikiinya! takes the Tetris-esque formula of blocks falling from the sky, and adds gyrating tropical-type penguins. They excite easily, and sleep when they are alone and/or bored. These penguins just want to live in peace, and throughout the story mode in the game they must constantly fight against people that want to capture them including poachers, witch doctors, and mad scientists.\n\nThe characters were designed by Tamakichi Sakura (the artist of Super Mario Adventures). The game designers were Hiroshi Miyaoka and Tomoki Tauchi. The voices are from Maki Yagita.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39pe.jpg'),(15306,'Aveyond: Rhen\'s Quest',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15307,'J.B. Harold no Jikenbo #2: Manhattan Requiem','1987-12-31','Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series, Sharp X68000, PC-8800 Series, Sharp X1, PC (Microsoft Windows), LaserActive, FM-7, MSX, Nintendo Switch','A sequel to the original J.B. Harold no Jikenbo.\n\n24 year old pianist Sarah Shields was found dead after falling from the 25th floor of her apartment window. The cause of death was a fractured skull from the horrific impact. With no evidence of foul play, an act of suicide was the best explanation - but J.B. Harold thinks otherwise. Having recieved a letter from Sarah beforehand, the famous detective heads towards New York city to find the truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31ti.jpg'),(15308,'LIP! Lewd Idol Project Vol. 2: Hot Springs and Beach Episodes','2023-06-23','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The girls are back! Join Kairi, Ranko, and brand new member Yuki in these two new lewd adventures at the beach and hot springs. Hotter encounters, hotter conversations, hotter scenes and lots of girls’ love!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o6p.jpg'),(15309,'Prophecy of the Shadow','1992-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','Embark on a prophecy-driven quest in this classic fantasy RPG. Battle the encroaching Shadow Lords, navigate a world where magic is illegal, and uncover the truth behind a master\'s treacherous death. Real-time combat, spell-learning, and captivating storytelling await in this post AD&D-era gem.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vwpelx6hh0unuwlno96l.jpg'),(15310,'CELL 0: Cyber Entertainment Leisure Lounge','2024-12-10','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','CELL is a short non-linear visual novel in a post-apocalypse/cyberpunk setting. Kenzo is an artificially grown human who lived his entire life alone isolated with a sweet, but artificial service intelligence. He\'s not okay. Help him to go through the disturbing situation he\'s about to get into.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co978i.jpg'),(15311,'Duskless: The Clockwork Army','2019-05-15','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rise up against robot troops that are crushing the kingdom you love in this thrilling match-three steampunk adventure! Can you stop the onslaught and restore Etherpoint City to its former glory?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p9u.jpg'),(15312,'Super Painter','2015-02-14','Platform, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Entertainment System','Super Painter is a puzzle platform game in which the player tries to paint the tiles and make it to the exit while avoiding evil cats.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kqd.jpg'),(15313,'Flail Your Arm, Hit the Ball','2025-03-28','Sport, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Move your \"spine\" with the mouse, swing the stick, and strike the ball.\nA movement-based home run derby game awaits you.\nFace off against challenging opponents who throw bizarre, physics-defying breaking balls in 3D space.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m5j.jpg'),(15314,'Bubble Breeze Pop',NULL,'Puzzle','Android, iOS','Help the brave and clever sky-cat Sunny in her quest to save her colibri friends from the clutches of the evil magpie... Aim, shoot, and blast your way to victory as you clear new levels with bubble-blasting chain reactions!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/it3ni72kxwpmb6ummzfe.jpg'),(15315,'Advanced Daisenryaku 98: Storm Over Europe','1998-04-02','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Advanced Daisenryaku 98\" is a strategy simulation game set in World War II.\n\nBasically, it follows the orthodox simulation game system of hex system and turn base. The system follows the consumer version, but the rules and thinking routines have all been redesigned, and the number of weapons, specs, parameters, and placement have all been refined to make it even more advanced.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a11.jpg'),(15316,'Tom the Postgirl','2026-12-31','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take a ride with Tom through her village and discover a great deal—perhaps too much—about the locals. Her approach, although controversial, is highly effective: intense and obsessive stalking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bj6.jpg'),(15317,'Sagebrush','2019-08-07','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A first-person narrative adventure game about exploring a cult compound in the remote New Mexico desert. Discover the lives of the former inhabitants -- what brought them together, what they believed, and why they ended it all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24b6.jpg'),(15318,'Freedom Fighters','2003-09-26','Shooter, Simulator, Tactical','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Freedom Fighters is a third-person shooter, in which the player navigates through the streets of New York while fighting the Soviet forces. The game also contains squad-based elements, having a charisma meter. The player gains charisma by performing heroic deeds in the resistance movement against the invading forces, like capturing a base or destroying vital supplies. The more charisma that is gained, the more squad-mates the character can recruit, including leaderless guerrillas and wounded Russian soldiers, up to a maximum of twelve.\n\nFreedom Fighters uses a simple method of controlling recruits in battle. In the game, the player can command recruits by giving them simple orders such as \"follow\", \"attack\" and \"defend\", but in most situations, they take care of themselves. Given the terrain of New York City after the initial invasion, the Resistance usually stations its soldiers in covered positions like craters and buildings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26dz.jpg'),(15319,'Stereogram','2023-01-31','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A split-screen platformer in a broken world. Featuring 100 rooms spread across 6 zones.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64rh.jpg'),(15320,'Cosmo Hunter','2022-09-14','Indie','Web browser','Cosmo Hunter is a game created by Yuupon in Unity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dzr.jpg'),(15321,'Samhain','2019-11-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1svc.jpg'),(15322,'Strato\'s Sylph Asterism','2020-05-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Strato\'s Sylph is an air battle action STG based on the motif of fighter planes and beautiful girls. Set on the earth-like planet \"Strange Sphere\", the girls who wear weapons and run in the sky \"Sylph\" and The game depicts a battle with MARXII, a monster in the shape of a bee.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co425j.jpg'),(15323,'Monster Academy','2021-07-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','There\'s a school for monsters where they learn how to blend in to the human world. Everyone there is secretly a monster. Apart from one man who is actually a human and must now figure out to safely escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lil.jpg'),(15324,'Showa American Story','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Showa American Story is a brand new RPG and an enthusiastic love letter to the 80s\' pop culture that features a strong taste of B-Movies. Follow Choko\'s journey of truth and revenge across North America as she grows stronger.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bv1.jpg'),(15325,'Horde: Zombie Outbreak','2018-07-30','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ever wanted to control a bloodthirsty horde of zombies and wreak havoc on cities around the world? Well now you can! In Horde: Zombie Outbreak the player assumes the role of the zombies and must overthrow the world by infecting the humans! Each person you infect will become part of your horde. As your horde grows stronger so to does the human resistance, the player must use abilities that are linked to certain zombie types to help them fight through the police, swat and army!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ekifjf5oy7be8oe3iatl.jpg'),(15326,'Smasher and the Will o\' the Thiccs','2022-07-12','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Golf meets growth! Smash your way through 11 exciting levels to save the city from the dreaded Will o the Thiccs!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h47.jpg'),(15327,'Money Block','2025-03-03','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into the world of cryptocurrencies and blockchain with Money Block, an immersive economic strategy game where you buy, sell, and mine blocks in an unpredictable and ruthless market.Will you master the blockchain and maximize your profits?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pkl.jpg'),(15328,'Lab Chaos','2023-03-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Lab Chaos is a fun and challenging indie action platformer game. If you\'re a casual gamer, a completionist or love to speedrun, Lab Chaos is the game for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b9t.jpg'),(15329,'Cage-Face: Case 1 - The Mine','2021-10-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escape from the mine tunnels while hunted by an unstoppable beast and slowly being affected by a mysterious illness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z1s.jpg'),(15330,'Kill','2016-08-17','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kill is a survival game with RPG elements and a lot of enemies in a single game..Craft production systems hunting gun and bullets to survive you must regularly eat and drink','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15331,'Kryptoria','2022-08-19','Real Time Strategy (RTS)','Web browser','Kryptoria is an immersive 4X and RTS game enabled by the Ethereum blockchain, that encourages players to build an empire in the world of Kryptoria, through economic, technological and military power.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xfu.jpg'),(15332,'Gun Sprint','2021-07-04','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','Android, iOS','Flip the gun and move forward to reach the goal!\n\nWhen you tap the screen, the gun will shoot and flip forward or backward!\nFocus on the tap timing, shoot the enemies, and get high score!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fy8.jpg'),(15333,'Drag Racing: Club Wars','2014-12-17','Sin género','Android','Addictive! Play the Best Racing Game on Google Play, Makes a Great Time Killer - Not too Boring and Doesn\'t have Too Many Ads. \n \nHit the Drag Strip with Race Clubs battling for Territory, Gold and Glory! \n \nThe best racing game that launched the legendary Creative Mobile Drag Racing series returns with new features, improved graphics and expanded game play. Supercars? Check. Street Racers? Check. Classic muscle? You bet!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xcqvjbj3zzt7ge7n3hrt.jpg'),(15334,'Intra','2024-03-01','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Finally towers fall in a tower defense game.\nIntra-Tower Defense presents its player with vast strategy elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9frc.jpg'),(15335,'Yupitergrad 2: The Lost Station',NULL,'Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR, Oculus Rift','Immerse yourself in the updated version of Yupitergrad 2: The Lost Station - experience hours of space adventure in VR, offering a huge base to explore, crazy robots to shoot, and a solid portion of humor, puzzles, and obstacles to overcome!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rpc.jpg'),(15336,'Kudaranu Mousou No','2010-05-09','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kudaranu Mousou No is a Yume Nikki fangame. It stars Kazaguruma and Jose.\n\nUnlike other fangames, Kudaranu Mousou No introduces the concept of linear locations. Instead of exploring the entire dream world at once, the player is required to enter worlds and collect effects one at a time in order to reach an ending.\n\nThe initial version was created with RPG Maker 2000, but later (Ver.0.03) the game was renewed with WOLF RPG Editor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rj1.jpg'),(15337,'GunSoul Girl','2021-02-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a first-person shooter game, you will accompany the young girl, challenge all kinds of secrets, get weapons, destroy the polluted enemies in the secret. Unlock memories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tzp.jpg'),(15338,'Genshin Impact: Flowers Resplendent on the Sun-Scorched Sojourn','2024-08-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','The fourth major update of Genshin Impact, known as Version 5.0, which includes:\n• New characters: Mualani, Kinich, and Kachina\n• New region, Natlan\n• New gameplay mechanics: Saurian Indwelling and Nightsoul’s Blessing\n• New main story quests: Archon Quest, Chapter V - Act I & II\n• New quality of life features\n• …and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8p06.jpg'),(15339,'Stream Star: Sensations',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Stream Star: Sensations is an erotic experience, where you stream explicit content for chat donations. Upgrade your space, discover new positions through research, and manage enjoyment for an engaging stream experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i30.jpg'),(15340,'Black Mesa','2016-10-28','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Black Mesa is a re-envisioning of Valve Software\'s classic science fiction first person shooter, Half-Life. Powered by Source Engine, You will re-visit the inaugural role of Gordon Freeman and his memorable journey through the Black Mesa Research Facility. Expect detailed environments to explore, a huge cast of characters and experimental weaponry. All-new music, voice acting, choreography and added dialogue give way to a more expansive and immersive experience than ever before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20n4.jpg'),(15341,'RuneScape','2020-04-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','RuneScape is a high fantasy open world MMORPG. Explore an ever changing and evolving living world where new challenges, skills, and quests await. Featuring unprecedented player freedom, you choose how to play, adventure, and grow.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zok.jpg'),(15342,'The Legend of Zelda: The Lampshade of No Real Significance','2005-07-25','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','A fan-made parody flash video game originally created for Newgrounds by The Super Flash Bros. The game parodies the Legend of Zelda series, with the gameplay consisting of one lengthy trading sequence, a typical convention in the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zym.jpg'),(15343,'My Parents are Aliens','2001-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15344,'Retro Abyss','2022-10-10','Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','You Have Loved Games Since You Were Little.\nBut You Have Grown Up Without Defeating The Final Boss.\nThe Final Boss Remains In Your Heart And Leads You Into The Retro Abyss...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7q11.jpg'),(15345,'SummonerRL','2017-02-02','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','As a Summoner, it\'s your sacred duty to uproot the spreading corruption from the depths of the dungeon and release its grasp on the natural world. Your only companions on this journey will be the animals conjured by your own power. Find a ritual focus and use it to bring a benevolent familiar to your side. Together you must overcome the twisted beings that stand in your way.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15346,'Guild Wars 2: Heart of Thorns','2015-10-23','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The first expansion pack for Guild Wars 2.\nJourney deeper into the heart of the Maguuma Jungle to discover new challenges, adventures, and ancient civilizations. Unlock the ability to use the new profession that channels legends from the Mists: the Revenant. Learn new abilities through the account-wide mastery system and further train your characters with new elite specializations to gain access to new weapons, skills, and traits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tcp.jpg'),(15347,'Queer and Chill','2021-06-16','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Queer & Chill is a spicy and challenging puzzle full of pride flags, and lots of diversity. Improve your skills while discovering new and exciting ways to match people based on their sexuality.\nLearn, evolve, and most of all, be curious.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co316p.jpg'),(15348,'World to Build','2024-05-01','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','World to Build is a voxel based sandbox game where you can use voxels and blocks to make your own avatars, hats, pets, and entire worlds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4eu7.jpg'),(15349,'Trainz Railroad Simulator 2019: CFR Calatori B 26-26 186','2023-01-27','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Manufactured at the \"VEB Waggonbau Goerlitz\" factory in Germany, this versatile doubledecker car was used on regional passenger transport by the Romanian operator CFR and then by CFR Calatori, being repainted into various paintschemes through the years, mainly different types of blue paint.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ivg.jpg'),(15350,'Suzerain','2021-09-23','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Assume the role of President Anton Rayne and guide the nation of Sordland. Amidst brewing international conflicts, need for reform, deep-seated corruption, and economic recession, you must make the decisions in this political drama.\nHow will you lead?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vlw.jpg'),(15351,'Ephemeral',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A short bitsy interactive story about time and whales.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15352,'Metroid Dread',NULL,'Shooter','Nintendo DS','Metroid Dread is a cancelled DS game for the Metroid series that was later reworked into the Nintendo Switch game of the same name. The game is notable for being in development hell, having been originally developed for the Nintendo DS. This early version of the game has never been publicly shown off.\n\nThis early version has the same basic premise as the final one, with Samus trapped on an alien world, trying to survive against an unstoppable foe. And as it\'s a sequel to Metroid Fusion, it presumably would have carried the plot point of Samus being on the run from the Galactic Federation.\n\nNo prototype builds or ROMs have ever surfaced for this DS version, and it is unlikely Nintendo will release any. It\'s a possibility that concept art or screenshots of this early version will be revealed in the upcoming art book, as Nintendo is open to talking about Metroid Dread\'s development history.\n\nLiam Robertson of Unseen64 claims that a synopsis of the game was given out to select members of the press. And in 2010, IGN\'s Craig Harris said in a podcast that he had seen a complete script for Metroid Dread, and that \"Nintendo could use it anytime they wanted.\" It\'s possible that this was the synopsis that Liam Robertson was referring to. After the 2021 announcement of the game, Harris was asked on Twitter if he remembered anything from this script. He said he didn\'t','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15353,'WWE 2K23: Race to NXT Pack','2023-06-14','Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S','The Race to NXT Pack includes the franchise debut of WWE Hall of Famer Harley Race, as well as NXT Superstars Tony D\'Angelo, Trick Williams, Wendy Choo, and Ivy Nile.\n\nEach playable Superstar comes with their own MyFACTION card.\n\nThe Race to NXT Pack is included with the WWE 2K23 Season Pass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ltw.jpg'),(15354,'The Adventures of Major Havoc','1983-12-31','Shooter, Platform, Arcade','Arcade','Major Havoc is an upright cabinet vector-based arcade game made by Atari in 1983. The player controlled the titular character, Major Rex Havoc, first in the \"shoot-\'em-up\" style game, in which the player operated Major Havoc\'s spaceship, the Catastrofighter, against the numerous robot ships who defend the enemy reactors. The ships are encased in a sort of \"buckyball\" force-field shield which must be shot first before the ship can be killed. In the next phase, the player would land on the robot space-station by centering the Catastrofighter in between the moving white line and Major Havoc would exit his ship and enter the space-station. The roller-knob controlled left and right character movement and a \"jump\" button permitted the player\'s character to leap over obstacles. Thus, a minor amount of \"gravity\" interacted with the player. The object was to get to the core of the space-station unmolested and sabotage the reactor. Once the charge was set, the player had to get out, back into the space-ship and MSD (minimum safe distance) before the space-station went critical and exploded. Red arrows lead the players direction in and the word out, also in red, points the direction out. The \"mazes\" get gradually more complicated to navigate in difficulty as the player progresses. Upon a successful mission, the next space-station became more difficult and the time allotted (both in and out) was accelerated.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sxdoennklentkyh4dake.jpg'),(15355,'Microvania',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore a tiny world, find upgrades, discover hidden paths, battle bosses in this retro-style metroidvania action platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9frv.jpg'),(15356,'Citywars Savage',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Citywars Savage is an indie MMORPG. Explore the worlds, gather resources to create tools and weapons; enchant your items to protect yourself from the enemies scattered throughout the worlds, and learn the interesting back stories to each creature presented through an amazing quest line!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cra.jpg'),(15357,'X Rebirth','2013-11-15','Shooter, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In the distant future, the X universe faces a period of profound and irrevocable change. While the universe stumbles towards an uncertain future, countless adventures await as new enemies rise in search of power. Enter a young adventurer and his unlikely female ally traveling in an old, battered ship with a glorious past - two people alone against the galaxy, playing a key part in the events to come. The fate of the universe rests in the hands of the player...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v8v.jpg'),(15358,'Rage Punk','2022-07-26','Point-and-click, Shooter, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A new semi platform, survive the longest, and kill enemies game.\nBox Fight: You survive the longest and kill as many enemies as you can before you die\nKing of the Hill: Climb up to the top and survive as long as you can','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co508x.jpg'),(15359,'Hotel Transylvania: Scary-Tale Adventures','2022-03-11','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hotel Transylvania: Scary-Tale Adventures is a 3D platform adventure that will take players on a fairy tale journey, putting them in control of their favorite characters as the game re-imagines classic stories, such as “Little Red Riding Hood” and “The Emperor’s New Clothes.”','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4cf6.jpg'),(15360,'Charles Haunted Mansion','2023-09-15','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Charles Haunted Mansion is a 2D Top-Down Survival Horror game based on the story of a mansion, haunted by the vengeful spirit of a woman who was murdered inside the mansion decades ago.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72ns.jpg'),(15361,'Retro Invasion','2022-08-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','If you like retro games, then Retro Invasion is the right place for you. The game mechanics are simple and quick for everyone to understand. It is a retro designed shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5me6.jpg'),(15362,'Forest Camp Story','2021-04-28','Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The great outdoors are calling! Create and run your own campground in this business management sim. Get a lay of the land and find the best places to camp. Before you know it, customers will be setting up tents and taking pictures, making memories that will last a lifetime. But it\'s not all about peace and solitude. With activities like bird watching, fly fishing, and horse riding, there\'s no shortage of ways to show your campers a good time! No camping experience? No problem! Set up guided tours to show new campers the ropes, and they\'ll soon be coming back for more. If you play your cards right, you might get visits from rabbits, squirrels, and other cute critters too! Don\'t be afraid to branch out and grow your business. Set up a camping goods store in nearby towns to earn extra cash and attract new customers. Get more people interested in your wares, and you might just spark a nationwide camping craze... Answer the call of the wild and start creating the camp of your dreams!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5oa8.jpg'),(15363,'Codename: Panzers - Phase One','2005-02-24','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Codename: Panzers is an incredible real-time strategy thrill ride. Nerves of steel are required when you\'re a tank driver. One direct hit and you\'re done for, but you must throw yourself into the battle, because without your support, many will die. You are the tank commander - make the hard decisions that win wars! Collect prestige points to use for new units, equipment or repairs Wild multiplayer mode on 4 unique interactive battlegrounds If you\'re new to real-time military strategy, go into Training Mode for fun practice with each bomber, plane and fighting unit','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ya4.jpg'),(15364,'Life Can Be Amazing','2021-08-06','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','“Life Can Be Amazing” is an uplifting Yuri Romantic Comedy Visual Novel and Dating Sim. Play as this seasoned chef as she seeks to rediscover her culinary talent and inspiration by taking a trip down to the Caribbean.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co459v.jpg'),(15365,'Bvoid',NULL,'Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Development of this game is currently on hold after it didn\'t meet its crowdfunding goal. \n \n\"Bvoid is an experimental, first person psychological horror game, where you traverse dream like environments never knowing what you\'ll come across next. The horror aspect will be delivered through the atmosphere and environments, rather than an endless stream of jump scares. Graphically the game imitates the original PlayStation\'s graphical capabilities as closely as modernly possible, and the gameplay is heavily inspired by obscure games of the era such as LSD: Dream Emulator.\"','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15366,'Blast Works: Build, Trade, Destroy','2008-06-10','Shooter','Wii','Blast Works: Build, Trade, Destroy challenges shooter fans to a frenetic geometric battle exclusively for Nintendo Wii. As you destroy enemies, you’ll catch their parts and use them to make your own ship bigger and stronger. Then, unleash your creativity with the easy-to-use Blast Works editor where you can create your own ships, enemies and levels. Finally, trade these creations directly with friends or share with the entire Blast Works community at BlastWorksDepot.com. With bright, abstract graphics and fast-paced, dynamic action, this “sticky” shooter based on Kento Cho’s Tumiki Fighters online game will suck you in for the long haul.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hqb.jpg'),(15367,'Samurai Warriors 5: Treasure Box','2021-06-24','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Experience exhilarating action set in a dramatic historical setting in SAMURAI WARRIORS 5. As the latest numbered entry in the SAMURAI WARRIORS franchise, the story, characters, and visuals have been re-imagined to set the stage for a thrilling new series. The story takes place after the Ōnin War during the golden age of the Sengoku period, and features a story that centers on the lives of two of the most representative military commanders of this era: Nobunaga Oda and Mitsuhide Akechi.\n\nSamurai Warriors 5 - Treasure Box Includes:\n- Samurai Warriors 5 Base Game\n- Cloth Poster (B2 Size)\n- Original Soundtrack CD (2Disc)\n- Character Artbook\n- Postcard Set (All Main Characters, w/ Display Case)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yt4.jpg'),(15368,'Pathologic 3','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Save a town from a mysterious plague in this in narrative first-person RPG. Learn the stories of its unusual inhabitants. Shape their lives with your decrees. Diagnose patients. Face the Plague. Connect the dots. Find out who killed the immortal man. Correct your mistakes in the past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xem.jpg'),(15369,'Odin: Valhalla Rising','2021-06-29','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','ODIN: Valhalla Rising is an RPG game that will be launched for PC, Android and iOS. The game is based on Nordic mythology, developed by Lionheart Studio, which will be published by a South Korean company called Kakao Games. The ODIN: Valhalla Rising will be released in 2021.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t3k.jpg'),(15370,'Super Smash Bros. Ultimate: Challenger Pack 11','2021-10-18','Fighting','Nintendo Switch','Sora from the Kingdom Hearts series joins the Super Smash Bros. Ultimate roster! Wielding his Keyblade and an arsenal of spells, Sora is a veteran when it comes to battling enemies and is ready to bring his 3-hit combos and aerial style into the fray. The new Hollow Bastion stage, based on one of the most iconic locations in the series, gives you a grand tour of a whimsically sinister castle. As the battle nears its close, you’ll travel to a special area inspired by Dive to the Heart with visuals featuring some familiar faces from the KINGDOM HEARTS series.\n\nSora’s fighting style in the Kingdom Hearts games has been faithfully adapted to his appearance in Super Smash Bros. Ultimate. His standard special cycles between three powerful elemental spells—Firaga, Thundaga, and Blizzaga. His other special attacks like Sonic Blade and Aerial Sweep will help you navigate the skies and keep opponents on their toes. Sora’s Final Smash, Sealing the Keyhole, will shut the door on your enemies and lock them away to oblivion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60yo.jpg'),(15371,'Matolek the Goat\'s School','2003-09-05','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Another educational game with the friendly Koziolek Matolek in the lead role. This time the title character invites children to visit the school in Pacanów, where he and his friends go.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i61.jpg'),(15372,'Play Kittens','2015-09-08','Simulator, Indie','Android','Whack a kitty? Why not meow for happy!\n(*^ω^*) Touch cats from the box to enjoy their interesting reaction and voice.\n(*^ω^*) Attract new kittens and interact with them, they help and learn funny actions.\n(*^ω^*) Play further to meet more kittens by collecting coins and toys.\n\n(*^ω^*) Features (*^ω^*)\n❤ Thousands of play and level to prove we are cat slaves\n❤ Numerous cats with different shapes or coats to create happiness\n❤ Lots of cute kittens waiting to be our companions\n❤ Several homes full of meow as wonderful memories\n❤ Upgradeable toys to enhance our playground and skill with ideas\n❤ Daily event to gain bonus while reminding us sunshine\n❤ Lovely meow voices keeping us good mood','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15373,'Super Mario 3D World + Bowser\'s Fury','2021-02-12','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','The Super Mario 3D World + Bowser’s Fury game features the same lively co-op gameplay, creative levels and power-ups as the original game, but with added improvements. In the Super Mario 3D World part of the game, characters move faster and the dash powers up more quickly. Both adventures support the newly added Snapshot Mode, pause the action to get the perfect shot, apply filters, and decorate with stamps!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uo9.jpg'),(15374,'100 Aztec Cats','2025-05-04','Point-and-click, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join the cutest adventure in the Azcte-themed with Cats in Ancient World! Explore the charming hand-drawn artwork of Ancient themed locations as you embark on a quest to find 100 adorable cats hidden throughout the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dvd.jpg'),(15375,'Nioh 2: Darkness in the Capital','2021-02-05','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Nioh 2: Darkness in the Capital is the second DLC expansion for Nioh 2, developed by Team Ninja and released in October 2020. This expansion adds new story content set in the Heian period, where players join forces with legendary historical figures to battle a new array of yokai and demons. It introduces new missions, weapons, armour, and guardian spirits, along with new abilities to enhance the combat experience. Darkness in the Capital further expands the lore and challenges of Nioh 2, offering players more content to explore and conquer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ip3.jpg'),(15376,'Lost Wage Rampage','2018-02-20','Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An over-the-top, fast-paced, driving heist game about closing the gender pay gap','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15377,'Walpurgisnacht','2020-07-22','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Memory of forest house at dusk.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l3l.jpg'),(15378,'Wuz up b? Produce: Street Dancer','2000-04-27','Music','WonderSwan','Street Dancer is a rhythm game starring the crew of wuz↑b? a Japanese pop music performance group.\n\nThe game features standard with a line of button prompts scrolling across the bottom of the play are that you will have to press when they reach the center of the screen. Before you start a game you will be asked to select a member of the wuz↑b? crew; Nana, Kaoru, Shino, or U. As you press buttons the chosen terpsichorean will shake it or stare at you in stupefaction, depending on your performance. A \'life bar\' is presented on the screen if you fail to perform well the bar will go down, when it is empty your game ends. To clear a stage and unlock a new background with a harder song you\'ll have to get about a 60% perfect score. You can always record your performances to watch over and over.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/k4ii83dtweqtyiwudejx.jpg'),(15379,'Muldulamulom','2017-12-05','Platform, Indie','Web browser','A surreal Metroidvania-style platformer made for Ludum Dare 40.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ugn.jpg'),(15380,'Seasonala Cemetery',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A meditative experience that invites players to explore the serene beauty of a living, breathing cemetery as it changes with the seasons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qwh.jpg'),(15381,'Smol Ame','2021-01-26','Platform, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 2D platformer starring Watson Amelia and her friends, based on Walfie\'s \"smol Ame\" drawings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30oy.jpg'),(15382,'The Getaway: Black Monday','2005-01-11','Shooter, Racing','PlayStation 2','It\'s going to be a day to remember for Sgt Mitchell. His first shift back on the MET\'s Organised Crime Squad begins with a dawn raid on a council estate that turns nasty. The next 48 hours will put him against the suspicions of his team mates, a new ruthless wave of crime and the most powerful man in London.\n\nMeanwhile on the other side of the city, amateur boxer Eddie O\'Conner is in severe trouble. The bank job went horribly wrong, his small-time crew has been wiped out and his only ally in this whole mess is Sam, a teenage thief more comfortable with nicking laptops than gang violence. Eddie knows he\'s way out of his depth, now his friends are dead and somebody is going to pay...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p2l.jpg'),(15383,'Super Mario Race','1992-12-31','Racing','Handheld Electronic LCD','Super Mario Race is a licensed wristwatch videogame made by Nelsonic Industries, based on the Super NES game Super Mario Kart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4axj.jpg'),(15384,'Tankalot Remastered',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4e02.jpg'),(15385,'David Lynch Teaches Typing','2018-02-27','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Learn to type with acclaimed American avant garde filmmaker David Lynch!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tiarnixdauy4hv3lyhlc.jpg'),(15386,'Real Winners: Victoryball','2018-10-08','Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In Real Winners: Victoryball, you\'ll operate as a sports robot doing their best to win. Pick up and play rules that change the match and end up with a game that\'s nothing like where it started. Rules can change everything from the size of the players to adding buzz saws to the field. Fast paced and silly, Real Winners: Victoryball is a great game to pick up and play with friends, relative or frenemies! Real Winners: Victoryball is a4-player local party game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mdk.jpg'),(15387,'Kimikare: Shingakki','2012-07-19','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Kimikare: Shingakki is an otome game, developed by Winlight and published by Idea Factory, which was released in Japan in 2012.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mst.jpg'),(15388,'Nightclub Imperium','2011-09-01','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build your own nightclub empire and turn night into day. Start a new adventure and make people dance the night away as the ruler of your own nightclub empire! Assemble in the large cities of the world; clubs, bars, shops, cinemas and discos. Put on your customers the best offer and weigh up how much return can bring an investment.\n\nEven if you start small, you can gradually with some tactical skill displace your competitors out of the city and thus create a true nightclub empire. Only if you have a good nose for the location planning and set the prices intelligently, will you expand beyond the borders. You can create clubs, shops and cinemas and these also assist. An important issue is security, so bodyguards are among your staff.\n\nOnly if you consider everything will you truly make it in the night club business.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7uue.jpg'),(15389,'Temporal Purge: Z','2024-11-08','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become an interdimensional zombie slayer in Temporal Purge: Z, an action-packed zombie-survival FPS. Face the zombie onslaught as you eradicate countless undead monsters on your quest to save the future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mz1.jpg'),(15390,'The Surreal Imaginarium','2020-06-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter \"The Surreal Imaginarium\", a virtual gallery full of other-worldy interactive paintings waiting for you to unlock their secrets. Explore the 23 paintings that inhabit the Day Gallery, the Interdimensional Journey, and the Night Gallery, as you activate their varied and colorful animations, sounds and effects.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ct4.jpg'),(15391,'Little Gods of the Abyss','2020-11-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Go on a trip to heal the mysterious and beautiful world of the soul. Visit various stages that express the complex emotions of the Soul World. Open closed doors to heal broken hearts and experience beautiful stories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gzo.jpg'),(15392,'Mirror\'s Edge','2009-09-02','Platform, Adventure','Windows Phone, iOS','Mirror\'s Edge is a side-scrolling platform game developed by IronMonkey Studios and published by Electronic Arts. It was released for the iPod on September 2, 2009, for iPad and iPhone on April 1, 2010, and later for Windows Phone on July 13, 2012. The game is a prequel to the original Mirror\'s Edge, setting the scene about Runners and the city\'s shady corporations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sf5.jpg'),(15393,'Fight Corp.',NULL,'Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight Corp. is pretty shady corporation built 100% on violence and fighting. You play as a Mitch Metello, a newcomer looking to rise through the company ranks! \n \nThe game is a third-person action adventure game, mixing platforming mechanics with a strong combat system. You have a big moveset at your disposal to crush your opponents with! You can wall-jump, air dash, vertical wall-run and much more! Another mechanic in the game is that your aerial drift dertermines what air-attack you do (back, neutral and forward)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l8e.jpg'),(15394,'Pocket Vampire Girl',NULL,'Simulator','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take care of a vampire girl in this virtual pet game, feed her every day, and participate in mini-games to earn money that you can use to buy new clothes and hairstyles.\n\nAlso, explore the town and meet its strange inhabitants, but make sure to go only at night!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9puk.jpg'),(15395,'Neon Moon',NULL,'Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Neon Moon is a fast-paced Metroidvania where you fight legendary foes, unlock powerful moves, and discover even more powerful items, all in the hopes of defeating the Dark Night terrorizing Nightlight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wdj.jpg'),(15396,'My Little Car Wash','2014-10-08','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','iOS, Nintendo Switch','You\'re the boss of the car wash - do you get all these cars clean again? The \"must have\" for all young cars fans! Experiment in your lab and mix your own super wash foam. With the great photo feature you can make funny pictures of yourself. With the permission of your parents you also can send these pictures to your friends. A variety of different vehicles and functions ensures long-lasting gaming fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hyy.jpg'),(15397,'Bump \'n\' Jump','1986-10-08','Racing, Arcade','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','The NES port of Bump \'n\' Jump, an overhead-view vehicular combat game developed by Data East and originally released in Japan as \"Burnin\' Rubber\". The arcade version was available as both a dedicated board and as part of Data East\'s DECO Cassette System. It was distributed in North America by Bally Midway. The goal is to drive to the end of a level while bumping enemy vehicles into the sides of the track and jumping over large obstacles such as bodies of water.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7v71.jpg'),(15398,'Black Room','2017-10-01','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','\"Black Room,\" is a browser-based, narrative game about falling asleep while on your computer, on the internet. You play as an insomniac on the verge of sleep, moving through shifting states of consciousness. Hallucinatory, pixelated visions of landscapes filled with sprites ripped directly from the arcade/NES/SNES video games of your childhood appear and disappear as you click through fragile internet spaces. Point-n-click mini games are scattered throughout the narrative.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ya0.jpg'),(15399,'Cat Leather Jackets','2023-12-01','Music, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cat Leather Jackets is a rhythm/visual novel game hybrid about a teenage punk rock band. Follow Priya and her friends as they write, rehearse and perform songs, all the while dealing with the frustrations and drama of being young and trying to figure out what life is all about.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co984l.jpg'),(15400,'Kitten Burst','2022-09-02','Racing, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kitten Burst is an Adventure/Racing Game about a Flying Cat set in the year 200X. Explore Sites on the Web, Race through Circuits, & Battle Bullet Hell Bosses to Save Cyberspace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ikt.jpg'),(15401,'Touhou Fumo Racing','2022-02-24','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embody a Fumo and compete on a wacky karting race against other fumo-fied Touhou Characters! Play alone against AI-controlled racers or with up to 4 friends on splitscreen multiplayer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4k33.jpg'),(15402,'G-Mode Archives+: Tantei Kibukawa Ryousuke Jiken-tan Vol. 16 - Awayuki ha Hi no Kanashimi','2025-01-27','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Izuna and Ikurumi were cleaning the Detective Agency. As they were cleaning, they uncovered hidden documents. The documents revealed a tragic event from the past, long kept hidden...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ojd.jpg'),(15403,'Tanks of Freedom','2015-01-25','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Turn Based Strategy in Isometric Pixel Art for PC and Android. The game features a campaign mode, as well as a hot-seat multiplayer and built-in map editor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ru5.jpg'),(15404,'Circle Brawl','2019-02-27','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inspired by arena and player vs. player classic Warcraft 3 Mod, Warlocks,Circle Brawl is a Warlock-inspired multiplayer 2D player vs. player arena game. Control your circle,choose your favorite skills,use magic and quick reflexes to deal with your opponents. Defeat your enemies and survive.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15405,'Overwhelmed','2023-06-13','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter the neon world of Overwhelmed!\nFight waves of enemies, using shooting and dashing skills to evade fire. Trigger your special \"Overheat\" ability to defeat enemies more easily. Unlock characters, each with unique abilities and varied arsenal, to discover new gameplay styles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u45.jpg'),(15406,'PaRappa the Rapper: Stage 3 Music A',NULL,'Music','PlayStation Portable','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94n2.jpg'),(15407,'Super Street Fighter IV','2010-04-30','Fighting','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Super Street Fighter IV is a 2010 fighting game produced by Capcom. It is an updated version of Street Fighter IV and has been said to mark the definitive end of the Street Fighter IV series. Having been deemed as too large an update to be deployed as DLC, the game was made into a standalone title, but given a lower price than that of a full retail game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2up2.jpg'),(15408,'Independent Days','2017-01-15','Arcade','Web browser','This is a Shoot \'Em All game with a small twist in it. It brings back the nostalgic memories of good old gaming.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15409,'Low and Furious','2025-12-31','Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Low and Furious is a thrilling driving game set in a Brazilian map that lets you customize your dream car and participate in exciting races and role-playing missions. With stunning graphics and engaging gameplay, LAF is a must-play for racing game and car customization enthusiasts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ncu.jpg'),(15410,'Puyo Puyo Fever Rhythm','2014-09-18','Music, Puzzle','Android','Puyo Puyo Fever Rhythm was a rhythm mobile puyo game released in 2014 through the PuyoSega service which used music and assets from Puyo Puyo Fever, Puyo Puyo Fever 2, Puyo Puyo 15th Anniversary and Puyo Puyo 7. The service ended on December 28, 2015 and music downloads for those that owned it ended on January 28, 2016.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l7d.jpg'),(15411,'Natural Landscape: Three Gorges','2018-03-16','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Natural landscape series is a virtual tourism VR game based on unreal engine developed meticulously by Magicvalley Studio.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15412,'Star Wolves','2005-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Star wolves is a 3D space RPG with deep strategy and tactical elements. The game thrusts players into a world of freelance space hunters in the XXI-XXII century A.D. during a time of political crisis for the all-powerful Empire and the three mega-corporations that control all the known worlds. Corruption prospers planet-side and only space can give a man his freedom, but not without a cost: space is not a safe place anymore. Human space pirates, rogue AI computers that rebelled against humanity and empire patrol ships roam space in search of easy prey.\n\nPlayers begin the game as a bounty hunter with little more than an old, run-down space fighter and a dream, but as they advance in the game and prosper, their piloting and battle skills improve, allowing access to more advance spacecraft. Players can control a party of up to six bounty hunters, each possessing different skills, abilities and personality.\n\nTeam tactics give players vast opportunities in battles when shear fire power isn\'t enough. Tactical ruses, planning and executing ambushes or deploying spaceships\' special abilities provide cunning commanders the ability to crush enemies according to their style of play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co422m.jpg'),(15413,'The Jumping Salad: Turbo','2023-01-15','Simulator','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Join Big S on his exciting journey through the kitchen and make him jump! Enjoy the colorful comic graphics accompanied by atmospheric music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zc6.jpg'),(15414,'Last Epoch: Ultimate Edition','2024-02-21','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Last Epoch Ultimate Edition is the best way to join the fight, slay your way across Eterra in style, and support the development of the action RPG of the future! Absolutely packed full of rewards, the Last Epoch Ultimate Edition is here to bring you everything you need to get started and look good doing it.\n\n- \"Golden Guppy\" the Baby Chronowyrm - Pre-Order Exclusive - Cosmetic Pet\n- 100 Epoch Points (EP)\n- Adolescent Chronowyrm - Cosmetic Pet*\n- Fallen Ronin - Cosmetic Armor Set*\n- Firefly’s Refuge - Cosmetic Portal*\n- Temporal Guardian - Cosmetic Armor Set*\n- Twilight Fox - Cosmetic Pet*\n- Adult Chronowyrm - Cosmetic Pet*\n- Celestial Way - Cosmetic Portal*\n- Full Original Digital Soundtrack (OST)**\n\nCosmetic items require an online connection and are not available in offline mode.\n\n*These items will unlock and become equipable at 1.0 (February 21st, 2024 - 11am CST)\n**This item will be delivered at a later date following the release of patch 1.0','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qun.jpg'),(15415,'Dead Rising 3: Apocalypse Edition','2013-11-22','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Featuring the ultimate open-world zombie game, four downloadable content packs and a bonus digital item, the Dead Rising 3 Apocalypse Edition is the definitive Dead Rising experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qcoecwho9coacvr971mc.jpg'),(15416,'When the Light Dies','2024-05-02','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When the Light Dies is a survival game with roguelite elements set in a desolate, frozen wilderness. Step into a murky world of shadow and obscurity as a lone survivor fighting to keep the darkness and the horrors that lurk within at bay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c5l.jpg'),(15417,'The Interactive Adventures of Dog Mendonça and Pizzaboy','2016-03-03','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','The Interactive Adventures of Dog Mendonça and Pizzaboy is a point-n-click adventure.\nPut yourself in the shoes of Eurico, an ex-pizza delivery guy and unpaid apprentice of legendary occult detective Dog Mendonça, as you uncover the mysteries of the supernatural underworld. Together with your team of paranormal detectives you\'ll delve into the bizarre, wacky, and humorous world of Dog Mendonça & Pizzaboy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s8u.jpg'),(15418,'Do not Donut.','2020-12-25','Indie','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ymx.jpg'),(15419,'Depths of Madness','2019-05-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An atmospheric underwater horror game, can you evade and survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zqu.jpg'),(15420,'Awesome Game','2022-12-23','Platform, Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Four stories by children, turned into this chaotic and extremely awesome game! Made on commission for Kulturverket and Humlab Umeå.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tjg.jpg'),(15421,'Mad Experiments: Escape Room','2020-04-16','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Mad Experiments: Escape Room is an immersive and intense escape room experience online. In a team of up to 6 players or solo: collect clues, solve mind-blowing puzzles and unlock the secrets of this strange place in the allotted time.\n\nIn groups or alone, players have one hour to explore and find a way to escape from this strange place with its somewhat oppressive atmosphere.\n\n“Mad Experiments: Escape Room is a well-crafted experience, where there are lots to discover in the room(s) and it’ll take some time to figure it out and make your escape”\n-AlphaBetaGamer\n\nEarly Access aims to offer a new and unique online cooperation experience for everyone, starting now. The first chapter is completely finished and ready to test the players\' limits.\n\nParticipating in the Early Access of \'Mad Experiments: Escape Room\' is the best way for players to contribute to the development of future rooms and additional features. The release of the second room is already scheduled for June.\n\nYou will learn more about the mind-bending story of Professor Cheshire and Hildegarde as you desperately try to escape the madness of this eccentric scientist.\n\nPlayers can create their own session with friends, play solo, or form a team through our discord server.\n\n• Escape Room Online Experience\n• Unique visual puzzles and riddles\n• An intriguing atmosphere reinforced by the sumptuous decor and musical background\n• Cooperative and narrative puzzle game where you uncover chapters of Professor Cheshire\'s haunting story and his experiments on the human mind','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wng.jpg'),(15422,'Graamaseva','2024-09-27','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Graamaseva is the first top-down view, horizontal scrolling run n\' gun arcade game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6au4.jpg'),(15423,'Alex Hill: The Body at Clearwater Bay',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','When a body mysteriously washes up on the shores of Clearwater Bay, you, as Detective Alex Hill, are hired to investigate. Was it a tragic suicide or is something more sinister at work? Solve puzzles, look for evidence, and confront a web of lies as you work to uncover the truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j3h.jpg'),(15424,'Mind Corridors: Paroniria','2022-11-28','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fever-dream-like singleplayer puzzle horror game. Descend to the depths of a sleeping curse, survive every floor and find your way out of the never ending nightmare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t0g.jpg'),(15425,'Alpine Ski','1982-02-01','Racing, Sport','Arcade','Maneuver a skier through a downhill ski course, a slalom course, and a ski jumping competition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6epu.jpg'),(15426,'Bloodstained: Ritual of the Night - IGA\'s Back Pack','2019-07-11','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','Koji Igarashi is back! Did you miss out on the original Kickstarter campaign that made Bloodstained possible? Fear not, with “Iga’s Back Pack” you will receive access to the powerful and fan favorite Swordwhip weapon, as well as an epic encounter against a super powerful boss--Koji Igarashi himself!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3du0.jpg'),(15427,'Blade of Arena','2020-10-31','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blade of Arena is a multiplayer online PVP game. \n \nWe have 3 game mode : \n \nSurvival - 8 players fright in one island, after 3 rounds. The top player will be the dragon! \n \nDuel (1v1) - 2 players fright each other, gain 3 kills to win! \n \nCapture (4v4) - 2 teams try to capture tower to gain points. \n \nWe hope players can enjoy the pure Action PVP fight!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r4r.jpg'),(15428,'Mytheon','2010-07-13','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mytheon is an online, multiplayer action/RPG with strategic game play where players experience classic mythology come to life and challenge legendary gods to define their own fate. Originally released in 2010 as a free-to-play Action-RPG MMO, the game has been slightly redesigned to support a simple one-time purchase for all core content. \n \nThe setting and storyline incorporates well known mythologies from around the world — starting with Greece and Egypt, with expansions into other mythologies. \n \nThe player creates an avatar from one of three classes and collects stones of power which act as spells, abilities and pets. Using the stones, player can explore 14 different adventure areas to collect loot and new stones. The ultimate goal is to defeat Zeus and the Greek pantheon of gods on Mount Olympus. \n \nThe game can be played solo or as a group.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1toy.jpg'),(15429,'Zoku Sono Higurashi vs Touhou Universe 2','2020-06-26','Fighting, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','90\'s-style 2D fighting action in which real-life men fight in cosplay. The shocking work that appeared in 2016 finally appears on Steam! * This work is a secondary creation game work based on the Touhou Project.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ce4.jpg'),(15430,'Lifecraft','2024-04-16','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive and evolve as an organism with this simulation game in which you will literally start as a single cell and manage and organize all its functions to a fully fledged system! Assemble, breathe, eat, fight threats, produce energy, grow, anything is possible!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5iwc.jpg'),(15431,'Kyokkou no Marriage: Episode Lia','2024-08-30','Visual Novel','Nintendo Switch','An all-ages version of Kyokkou no Marriage that only contains Lia\'s route.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tyi.jpg'),(15432,'Sky Link','2019-08-16','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Formerly known as Drone Strike Force, Sky Link is a groundbreaking aerial shooter that aims to be the fastest online game in existence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3byz.jpg'),(15433,'Rocket Ranger','1988-12-31','Fighting, Shooter, Platform, Strategy, Adventure','Apple IIGS, Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, DOS, FM Towns, Amiga, Nintendo Entertainment System','A Master Race from Outer Space Threatens the Free World! With the zapping of ray guns and the cries of Zombie Women, Rocket Ranger brings all the action, romance, thrills, and spills of the Saturday morning serial! The action begins with an urgent message from the future. . . a future that saw the Nazis win Word War II! An underground group of scientists in the 21st century risk their lives to send you a jet propelled rocket suit, ray gun and secret decoder wheel. Skillfully used against a cunning and ruthless foe, these devices help you change history and save mankind!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6otw.jpg'),(15434,'Leviathan',NULL,'Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as one of 3 factions as they fight for control of Domusalus. But beware of the Kaecillian menace as they threaten both the locals and the invading factions. Deploy with your gear, search for loot and escape in time to keep it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ppr.jpg'),(15435,'Galaxy Fight: Universal Warriors','1996-05-03','Fighting','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, Neo Geo MVS, Sega Saturn, PlayStation, Neo Geo CD','Man and demon wage war with one-on-one fights in the 1-on-1 fighting game Galaxy Fight. Eight of the universe\'s greatest fighters enter into combat for the fate of the galaxy. Success brings great acclaim to the victor. Failure brings death.\n\nOnce every 1000 years, a being of divine power takes physical form somewhere in the galaxy. This time, he has taken form on the planet Danius. This being, who refers to itself as \"Felden Crayce\" is being sought out by fighters across the galaxy to challenge and defeat. Each of these eight warriors have their each with their own reasons for seeking out and fighting this being -- some wish to challenge Felden for pride or fame, some wish to protect their home lands from Felden, and some refuse to explain their reasons until they meet this great force themselves. These eight fighters all have unique abilities and strengths, but only one can be the final victor!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25d9.jpg'),(15436,'Wizard101','2008-09-02','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Wizard101 is a 2008 massively multiplayer online role-playing game created by KingsIsle Entertainment. In the game, players take on the role of students of Ravenwood School of Magical Arts in order to save the Spiral, the fictional galaxy in which the game is set, from various threats.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1lxh.jpg'),(15437,'Pixel Petz','2019-03-14','Indie','Android, iOS','Create, trade, and collect cute petz! Breed them, play with them, enter them in contests -- the possibilities are endless!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15438,'Bumble Brawlers','2025-02-03','Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Bumble Brawlers is an exhilarating top-down shooter that lets you dive into chaotic battles with fully customizable characters, unique companions, and powerful upgrades. Enter a world where survival is your only goal as you navigate dungeons, face endless enemy waves, and conquer a series of challenging maps with wave-based combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cxp.jpg'),(15439,'Rising Angels: Judgment','2017-02-14','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It has been a month since the crew of the Katajion spaceship Nimross returned safely after a mission to recover a prized artifact went awry. Command\'s support of how everything transpired is weak and many of her crew face disciplinary actions for their part in the operation. It all weighs heavily on Major Natalie Puccile, whose investigation led them down that route, but not nearly as much as the knowledge that she was forced to decide between the woman she cared about and her mission. With only a tankard and a collection of games to distract her from her life, Natalie begins to question why she signed up in the first place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pzs.jpg'),(15440,'Bird Simulator','2020-01-07','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bird Simulator is a crazy game in which you control the descendants of dinosaurs. The only chance to get back to the top of the food chain is to destroy humanity.\n\nStart in a small town where you try to destroy literally everything, like people, cars or other birds. Indeed, you will have plenty of destruction options, in addition to using your own feces, you can also use other items such as a chair or a grenade. You can also carry things, including people. In addition to these insanities do not forget your needs, once in a while you have to eat or drink. Earn points and unlock other birds.\n\nWarning\n\nIf you expect a serious game, you better buy something else. This is pure bird madness.\n\nFeatures\n- You can unlock 6 more birds and change them during the game\n- Play multiplayer with friends or singleplayer alone :(\n- Get points for destroying cars, attacking people and killing enemies\n- Survival system - you have to look for water and food\n- Lots of items to destroy everything around. You can find them on the ground or steal them from other birds\n- You can also use your feces as an offensive weapon\n- Mini games like football or basketball even with a table of top players\n- Fun ragdoll physics\n- Or you can just fly like a bird ;)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p1r.jpg'),(15441,'Sonic Suggests','2018-02-03','Platform','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Oh no! Evil Dr.Eegman is back with his new genious plan! He teleported Modern Sanic to \"Classic Sanic\'s\" dimension, and now only you can help him to return back. Find a way to fight back to Dr.Eegman, and return to your own dimension.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u2w.jpg'),(15442,'V Rising: Dracula\'s Relics Pack','2022-05-17','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embrace your dark legacy and project your intentions of supremacy with the Dracula’s Relics pack.\n\nStrikeout into Vardoran in iconic black, red, and gold. Don the Immortal King’s Mantle and mark yourself a commander of death with the Immortal King’s Greathelm as your battle crown. Whether on the battlefield or resting atop your extravagant throne, these colors represent a vampire with an ambition worthy of the next Dracula.\n\nReturn home to a castle worthy of the scourge of Vardoran. From throne to coffin, walls to floors, carpet runs to brilliant braziers, your castle will project regality. The royal decor will project an unmistakable air of dominance, elegance, and taste.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82tj.jpg'),(15443,'Wonder Boy Returns','2017-03-30','Platform, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A classic action masterpiece arcade game Wonder Boy has been remade into HD!\nFood is important for a primitive man! Collect all food before your health gets depleted, defeat all enemies, avoid all obstacles and head over to save Tina!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hrk.jpg'),(15444,'100 Hidden Cats','2021-04-15','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','100 Hidden Cats is a hidden object game in the city setting with black and white hand-drawn graphics in a cartoon style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88zb.jpg'),(15445,'Dreams of Literature: Noir','2021-07-01','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter Sayori\'s mind and follow the dreams she has during the week of the DDLC. Can you guess which day this chapter takes place?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jbb.jpg'),(15446,'Copa Petrobras de Marcas','2014-11-29','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','COPA PETROBRAS DE MARCAS is a 100% free official game simulating the thrill of competing wheel-to-wheel with models from various automakers in some of the main Brazilian race tracks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3df6.jpg'),(15447,'Twisted!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15448,'Operation: Hostage Rescue',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15449,'Codename: Outbreak','2001-11-25','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Venom. Codename: Outbreak is a tactical 3D-shooter set in the near future. Your aim is to oppose an alien invasion on Earth and protect the human race from extermination while evil parasites continue turning people into mind-killing beasts. Together with a teammate, you play the role of an ex-Ukranian combat group member - and your primary goal is to progress through 14 action-packed single-player missions or play via multiplayer with your friends over a LAN connection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mrk.jpg'),(15450,'EroHPuzzle','2025-03-07','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','EroHPuzzle is an anime picture puzzle game with unique photos. Connect the right pieces to move to the next level. Connect the pieces correctly and you will be relieved','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nqz.jpg'),(15451,'CrossPlanet',NULL,'Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Arena Shooter goes Third Person! CrossPlanet is a Sci-Fi shooter where players can go head-to-head in the online Multiplayer, or squad up with friends and take on thrilling boss battles against huge unearthly creatures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e1j.jpg'),(15452,'Déjà Drift','2022-08-15','Racing, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Stuck alone on a retro-futuristic racetrack, your only choice is to drift. Earn as many points as possible before time runs out, and then do it again and again... But wait, there is someone else here? And why does their driving seem so familiar?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dad.jpg'),(15453,'Devolve Online','2025-02-28','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An action MMORPG third-person shooter that blends classic MMORPG persistent progression with short, session-based challenges where hundreds of players fight for growth at once, seamlessly integrated into the dynamic, expansive, ongoing game world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gyg.jpg'),(15454,'Evoland 2','2015-08-25','Fighting, Music, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Evoland 2 is the spiritual successor to the original Evoland with its graphics style changing as you travel through time and its gameplay evolving as you move along the storyline. It is also a much bigger game and a classic RPG at heart, with a complex scenario based on time travel, dozens of characters with their own backgrounds and ambitions and vastly different gameplay styles that are linked to the story and the player’s actions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co295h.jpg'),(15455,'Seacurity Breach','2018-12-17','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blissful life in Solarimere archipelago is in danger. Barbaric Aquator tribe is invading peaceful Aerian lands! Join officers of Queen Albina in their struggle to repel Aquator invasion. Build and upgrade defensive structures, place barricades and traps, manage resources strategically and fling attackers across the sky! \n \nSeacurity Breach is a 3D tower defense game with a twist! We embrace verticality, ragdoll effects and a unique unit design. All wrapped in a beautiful low-poly graphical style. Expand your gameplay by testing yourself against a multitude of fan-created maps..','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ion.jpg'),(15456,'Blade & Soul','2016-01-19','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blade & Soul is a MMORPG currently in development by NCsoft\'s Team Bloodlust development team. The characters in this oriental style game are designed by the well-known illustrator Hyung-tae Kim.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wny.jpg'),(15457,'Falcon A.T.','1988-12-31','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','When you climb into the cockpit of the F-16 Fighting Falcon, get set for the \"flight of your life\" as the powerful FALCON AT takes you streaking across the sky at Mach 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uek.jpg'),(15458,'PaRappa the Rapper: Stage 1 Music C',NULL,'Music','PlayStation Portable','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94my.jpg'),(15459,'Total Arcade Racing','2021-11-19','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Total Arcade Racing is a fun 2D top-down arcade racing game where you zip around closed circuits. Play solo or with up to 8 friends on the same screen in various game modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2swt.jpg'),(15460,'Benderman VR','2023-10-31','Strategy, Indie','SteamVR','Benderman VR - A retro pipeline puzzler! Bend pipes in VR, beat the clock and collect wrenches while staying under the pipe budget. Nostalgic 80s-90s style.Will you be a Plumbing Maestro or a Drenched Dabbler?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co710l.jpg'),(15461,'Faces of War','2006-09-15','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Through the eyes of Allied, German and Russian squad leaders, experience the most immersive World War II time strategy game where each battle is played out and won differently based on your tactical choices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2157.jpg'),(15462,'They Grew Lungs and Drowned','2022-03-06','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore the wreckage.\n\nSpeak with the survivors.\n\nThe Permanent Food Source has run dry.\n\nTime to move on.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15463,'The Shaking Chalice','2025-03-30','Sin género','PlayStation 4','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m21.jpg'),(15464,'Fortress V2','2020-12-31','Fighting, Shooter, Sport, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fortress V2 is a strategic online multiplayer artillery shooting game. Team up with of 4 friends and demolish other teams with your tactical movement strategy. Fortress series already proved its fun core in Asia with 50M accumulated users. Enjoy various tanks with different performance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o77.jpg'),(15465,'The Alehouse Tavern Chronicles',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ir8.jpg'),(15466,'The Escapists: Prison Escape','2017-03-02','Strategy','iOS','The Escapists is a unique prison escape sandbox game where you get to experience a life behind bars and barbed wire fences. You\'e had a life of crime but now you\'re caught. With thrilling and immersive gameplay, you need to create an escape route in a world of other prisoners and ruled by routine.\nEscaping requires cunning, strategy, the right equipment and staying at least two steps ahead of the guards. Bribe and fight your way through the prison ranks. If your fellow prisoners like you enough, recruit them and create your own gang. You might even take over a prison! The guards are out to stop any escape attempts, so you’ll have to avoid suspicious behaviour by attending roll calls, working a prison job and hiding your stolen contraband.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15467,'Captain Hannon: The Belanzano','2020-03-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Captain Hannon: The Belanzano is a large scale sci-fi open world sandbox game. Take the part of Captain Hannon, who\'s newly acquired old space freighter has crashed in to an asteroid field during his first cargo delivery run. Once you have oriented yourself with the Galaxy and it\'s inhabitants, you are then in an open world game where your choices and decisions will shape your progress. Work for the Factions in game delivering goods, mining, doing various combat missions or perhaps work for the Gal-Fed authorities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2llx.jpg'),(15468,'Slenderman Must Die: Chapter 8','2022-08-27','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the episode titled From Burn To Return (Hell Fire), Slenderman Must Die: Chapter 8, demons take over the town and kidnap everyone. A horror game.\n\nIn this chapter, Slenderman has gained the power of fire, making him more dangerous than ever before, and the only man who can stop him is the town\'s brave firefighter.\n\nAs the player, you must save the town from this fiery nightmare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zua.jpg'),(15469,'Antz Extreme Racing','2002-09-19','Racing','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','0.5 MPH is extremely fast-when your vehicle is only big enough to carry an ant! Jockey for first place with your favorite character from the hit motion picture Antz, using vehicles that aren\'t your typical garden variety.\nSurf using a leaf, race on a fuse with wheels, even hop on a wasp for the antenna-raising thrill ride of your life! You may feel tiny, but practice will make you a giant among racers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d0x.jpg'),(15470,'Stone Age Meteor Rush','2025-03-29','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m1z.jpg'),(15471,'Shatter Keep','2021-05-07','Fighting, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shatter Keep is an asymmetrical multiplayer game where 3 survivor players try to escape the castle and 1 randomly selected monster player attempts to eliminate them. Survivors must complete a list of sequenced objectives to unlock the castle exits while arming traps, lighting torches and avoiding the turned monster before the timer expires.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zkk.jpg'),(15472,'Destiny: Rise of Iron','2016-09-20','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Destiny: Rise of Iron is the next highly anticipated expansion to the Destiny universe. It features an all new cinematic story campaign set within The Plaguelands, a brand new location on Earth. Under the command of Lord Saladin you will face a new faction of Fallen Devils, the Splicers, while unravelling the mystery of the Iron Lords. Rise of Iron features new weapons, armor, and gear, as well as a new cooperative three-player Strike, a new mode and maps for the Crucible competitive multiplayer, and an all new six-player cooperative Raid.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z9r.jpg'),(15473,'Fae Farm: Deluxe Edition','2023-09-08','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Escape to the magical life of your dreams in Fae Farm. Purchase the Deluxe Edition of Fae Farm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6z0d.jpg'),(15474,'Snooze or Lose',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Submission for the Play Jam 4!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15475,'Kidou Keisatsu Patlabor','1994-05-22','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Super Famicom','One of the several games based on the anime and manga Patlabor. In this role-playing game the player controls two main pilots from the series, Noa Izumi and Isao Ota, as they complete their typical duties each day, helping to deal with rogue Labors (Mecha) and other such incidents.\n\nThe gameplay consists of three modes - a map of Japan, showing where assignments are located, the \"main\" screen, where the player controls the Labor from a top-down viewpoint and maneuvers it around the area of the crime, and the combat screen, for when you press the action button to attack a rogue Labor. From here it is possible to select one of various attacks; naturally, as the game goes on the pilots can learn new attacks. Unusually for an RPG there is also the option to just talk with the rogue Labor\'s pilot and try to convince them to back down - as a policeman, sometimes this is the only way forward.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hapzg4lewthpclfnig6w.jpg'),(15476,'Sea Dogs: Caribbean Tales','2006-09-20','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sail the rough seas with your tall ship and loyal crew of vicious cutthroats and fierce corsairs. Build up your fleet and capture and rule colonies to become the mightiest pirate of them all! \nSea Dogs: Caribbean Tales is a naval game devoted to pirate adventures on the Caribbean seas of the 17th century, aiming to be the ultimate pirate simulation. Sea Dogs: Caribbean Tales models all the details of a sword swinging pirate\'s life and misses no part of his everyday adventures. Taking the role of reckless fortune-hunter Blaze or redheaded daredevil Beatrice – you will navigate your sailor in the original seas of the Caribbean, trade multiple goods, plunder merchant convoys, accomplish quests, build up your fleet, capture and rule colonies and much more. In addition, the game can be played in third person perspective, allowing you to walk through your colonies or fight with your own sword, side by side with your crew, and challenge every other captain on the sea!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pb3dimaq8e6g9h2hgfoi.jpg'),(15477,'The Lavarish Facility',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A roguelite game where you must complete 50 chambers to experiment with The Facility\'s lava, but something lurks within.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qcu.jpg'),(15478,'JAM Live Music Arcade','2012-05-15','Music, Simulator, Arcade','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','JAM Live Music Arcade gives you the freedom to become the DJ, producer and the band leader for total creative access in a live music sandbox. Allowing players to take on the role of lead guitarist, bassist, drummer, singer and synth player. JAM Live Music Arcade provides a deeper connection to the music through jamming, improvisation and exploration rather than all the emphasis being on the high score. Just grab any one of the plastic guitar peripherals most gamers have lying around (or your standard game pad) and you\'re ready to kick off a music gaming experience unlike any other.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30qe.jpg'),(15479,'Tokei','2025-04-08','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bun-Bot has claimed the world as his domain, it is the task of our hero Tokei to destroy and reclaim what has been taken away. Jump on every platform that lights up and that on time or else Bun-Bot might throw something on our hero Tokei. Luckily he has the power to fight back by obsorbing the power of the platforms in his fur and once he is fully charged up it is time to shoot back!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qu6.jpg'),(15480,'Fire Emblem Heroes','2017-02-02','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Android, iOS, Legacy Mobile Device','\"Take part in strategic turn-based battles streamlined for on-the-go play with maps that fit in the palm of your hand! Lead your army with easy touch and drag controls, including the ability to attack by simply swiping an ally over an enemy.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rc1.jpg'),(15481,'Stomp Plonk','2022-12-04','Music, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Created by Marek Kapolka. Stomp Plonk is a walking simulator where you walk around a fantasy continent with a lute and hang out with musical NPCs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w3j.jpg'),(15482,'Snake Blast!','2019-02-08','Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','Snake Blast! is a casual mobile game. It\'s an arcade game, and free.\n\nGuide your snake with a finger swipe and shoot hundreds of balls to break the bricks.\nCollect additional balls to enhance your shooting prowess.\nGet as big and as far as possible!\n\nGame Features:\n\n- 50+ skins to customize your snake\n- Endless fun\n- Intuitive swipe control\n- Thrilling power-ups','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1k80.jpg'),(15483,'The Tipping Point','2024-02-22','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In The Tipping Point, you play as Cass, an arctic climate researcher. You must get off the ice sheet before it collapses. On your way, you will gather and analyze data about the ice.\nThe Tipping Point is a 3D side-scroller platformer, with about 2-3 hours of gameplay.\n\nMake your way over the collapsing ice sheet by jumping, sliding, and climbing. Reach abandoned research stations and gather data in a series of mini-games. Analyze the data and uncover what is happening to the climate.\n\nThe Tipping Point is developed in collaboration with real world researchers in an interdisciplinary effort (physicists, biologists, chemists, statisticians, and more). The things you do in The Tipping Point are based on what researchers do in the arctic in real life.\n\nAs researchers do, you will compare the data you collect to previous data sets and investigate changes in the climate.\n\nSolve the mystery of the tipping point and why the ice sheet is suddenly collapsing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rnm.jpg'),(15484,'Dark and Darker','2024-01-04','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An unforgiving hardcore fantasy FPS dungeon PvPvE adventure. Band together with your friends and use your courage, wits, and cunning to uncover mythical treasures, defeat gruesome monsters, while staying one step ahead of the other devious treasure-hunters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5byi.jpg'),(15485,'Power of Love','2015-07-21','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a novel puzzle game. It creatively asks you to control two people simultaneously. The game consists of three charpters and the levels become more and more difficult. Its a perfect game to exercise your brain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cz7f9aasyjlzmyleqrlt.jpg'),(15486,'Starfighter Neon','2017-12-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You\'ve been dropped into enemy space. Weave your Starfighter between alien spaceships, lasers, asteroids and bombs destroying as many as you can and collecting valuable coins and powerups as you go.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co421a.jpg'),(15487,'Fit and Fry','2025-05-01','Puzzle, Strategy','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Cooking here is a delicious puzzle. Each level is a new dish to prepare, and your challenge is to fit all the ingredients perfectly into the pan. But be careful: space is limited, and only the best chefs will be able to complete each recipe without wasting anything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r68.jpg'),(15488,'Running Ninja','2019-03-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Run! Jump! Dodge! In this platformer you will need your reaction speed and clarity of mind. Сhallenge the deadly tower and prove that you are worthy of the title of ninja.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15489,'Camelia','2014-06-01','Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Camelia is an adventure story-telling game. There are no game overs, and only one ending. It\'s nothing but a story.\n\nCamelia comments on many things in her house - make sure you explore it thoroughly and often. Please take the time to learn about the world with her - and make sure you stay after the credits, or you won’t be able to learn what gives her happiness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1scv.jpg'),(15490,'Raanaa: The Shaman Girl - Land of the Birds','2020-12-18','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, iOS','Raanaa is a third person adventure 3D platformer.\n\nRaanaa, a courageous shaman girl, helps the spirit worlds that are in danger. With the help of her shaman abilities and her magical dress, she can defy gravity.\n\nRaanaa travels through wondrous spirit realms and collaborates with different Gods and Goddesses to fight evil spirits and deities in order to obtain balance in the universe and save humanity.\n\nRaanaa travels through spirit worlds that are all inspired by old Saami and Norse stories and mythology. In every episode the player gets to visit in a new spirit world. Become the savior of the spirit worlds!\n\nJUMP, GLIDE AND SOAR TO EXPLORE!\nRaanaa\'s shamanistic powers and magic dress allows her to jump higher & further, glide and even soar through the air! In the spirit worlds the islands, trees and even mountains are floating in the air, these skills become very handy!\n\nSEEK, FIND AND COLLECT!\nTo proceed in the game, Raanaa has to activate the powerful Sieidi stones by collecting enough colourful spirit essence.\nBut there are more things to be found in the spirit worlds. Hidden objects and animals, not to mention plenty of tokens! So many in fact that it raises a question: what will happen if you collect them all?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qvt.jpg'),(15491,'Flying Sushi','2025-03-28','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Flying Sushi is a fast-paced, side-scrolling arcade game where you control a sentient piece of sushi as it soars through the air. Navigate through endless obstacles while collecting bonuses and power-ups to rack up the highest score possible. How far can you go in this quirky and fun adventure?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mn9.jpg'),(15492,'Rain','2016-04-24','Simulator, Indie','Web browser','twine game/story about the experience of rain','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dum.jpg'),(15493,'Mark & Lara: Partners in Justice','2021-04-16','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Call your partner and become the best detective duo in this CO-OP adventure! Gather evidence, question the suspects and point out their contradictions. Cooperation is key as neither of you have the full picture of the case! Play on two devices, local or remotely, all you need is a voice connection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yaa.jpg'),(15494,'Wish Me Well','2025-09-30','Fighting, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wish Me Well is a roguelike dungeon crawler where you design your own weapon with magic scrolls and fiddle with synergies to fight enemies and unique bosses possessed by ink. Jump into the magic well and save the world of books from ink monsters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9psf.jpg'),(15495,'Fallout 76: Skyline Valley','2024-06-12','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Expand southward to Skyline Valley – a brand-new region of Appalachia. Investigate the cause of the electric storm circling overhead and unveil the mystery around Vault 63 and its dwellers, including a shocking new Ghoul type – The Lost.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bou.jpg'),(15496,'Mario vs. Donkey Kong: Mini-Land Mayhem!','2010-12-02','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Nintendo DS','At the grand opening of Mario\'s third theme park, the first 100 guests receive a new Mini Pauline toy. Donkey Kong arrives as the 101st guest and finds himself out of luck. He grabs Pauline and heads into the park with Mario and his Mini Marios in hot pursuit. The fourth game in the series adds new challenges and new opportunities for users to share what they have created.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21to.jpg'),(15497,'Hive Jump 2: Survivors','2024-05-29','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become an agent of vengeance in this bullet-heaven action roguelite! You are the lone survivor of your squad, on an alien planet with just your weapon, a jetpack, and the courage to keep fighting. Kill off alien swarms and transform their valuable guts into explosive upgrades and vital utilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ibe.jpg'),(15498,'The Sims 4: Crystal Creations','2024-02-29','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','Craft dazzling jewelry and give your creations a spark of power with The Sims 4 Crystal Creations Stuff Pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tzs.jpg'),(15499,'Sam & Max: Save the World - Episode 3: The Mole, the Mob and the Meatball','2008-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The commissioner is looking into an underground operation at the Ted E. Bear Mafia-Free Playland and Casino, but the mole he sent in has suddenly gone quiet. To find the mole, Sam & Max must infiltrate the operation and become members of the Toy Mafia themselves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40re.jpg'),(15500,'Cruise Control',NULL,'Racing, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Escape pursuing cops, helicopters, dinosaurs, giant eagles and vector polygons. With easy to pick up gameplay, three endless levels and rocking 80\'s inspired graphics and soundtrack! Grab powerups and coins to clear the road and unlock all the cars!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15501,'Wildaria',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Wildaria is an Action-Adventure RPG Pet Collector set in an Infinite Fantasy World. Explore diverse open-world biomes as you collect and train unique pets to aid in your quest to conquer dungeons, slay gods, or defend the natural world from the kingdom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91l0.jpg'),(15502,'Space ships',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15503,'Grandmaster\'s Gambit',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A different take on the chess genre. Build massively overpowered decks to fend off endless hordes of chess-like pieces and seek out the 8 Grandmasters in this open-world deckbuilding roguelike experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pvz.jpg'),(15504,'Tekkouki Mikazuki Taikenban','2001-07-07','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 2','Tekkouki Mikazuki (Taikenban) (鉄甲機ミカヅキ) is a Action video game published by Media Factory and developed by Sandlot released on March 2nd, 2001 for the PlayStation 2.\nThis is the Trial Edition, \"Taikenban\" in Japanese language. Full game was never released since the series never took off, only this version exists. It came in a box set along with the series\' original soundtrack.\nThe engine of the game was eventually used for RAD: Robot Alchemic Drive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gx4.jpg'),(15505,'Enemy of the State','2025-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enemy of the State is a co-op and single-player shooter set in the world of 1920s crime lords. You’re an aspiring mobster trying to reach the top during the Prohibition era. Gather your friends and perform heists all over the world. Will you build the most powerful crime syndicate in the world?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uxv.jpg'),(15506,'Arcade Sundown','2023-10-17','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Challenge the pinball people! Get shrunk down and play a mad points-scoring game inside pinball machines. Feint, travel, and tackle your way to high score glory — all’s fair under the glass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77ap.jpg'),(15507,'Anyway','2022-02-22','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Anyway is a 2D platformer adventure in which every day is not the same: There are some secret rules to this place which can change from day to day. So be cautious, it may be dangerous out there!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4jc1.jpg'),(15508,'Neon Parasite','2020-11-13','Fighting, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','INFEST YOUR FRIENDS! Neon Parasite is a game of chaotic critter combat where you\'ll be hovering, shooting, and dashing your way around the competition to reign the most infested bug of all. This 4-player local party game boasts crazy strategic battles across a multitude of different arenas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hw0.jpg'),(15509,'The Secret of Monkey Island: Special Edition','2010-04-22','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox 360','Relive the swashbuckling humorous misadventures of the wannabe pirate Guybrush Threepwood!\nBack by popular demand, The Secret of Monkey Island: Special Edition faithfully re-imagines the internationally-acclaimed classic game.\nThe game\'s twisty plot leads our naive hero on a hilarious, swash-buckling search for the fabled secret of Monkey Island. Tales of pirate wealth lure him to the port of Mêlée with high hopes, no money, and insatiable curiosity. If clever enough, he will win the confidence of Mêlée\'s pirates and find himself blown by the winds of fate toward the terrifying and legendary Monkey Island - an adventure that would chill the bones of even the most bloodthirsty buccaneer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d9p.jpg'),(15510,'Gyro Boss DX','2019-03-22','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Dodge an endless assault of weapons as you orbit around the boss on a fixed circle, it\'s not as easy as it looks. Can you secure bragging rights as the best space pilot to bite the dust against the alien menace?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4n4j.jpg'),(15511,'Touhou Rock Maiden FC','2021-06-24','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Touhou Doujin game based on Rockman (Megaman), developed by Capricorn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4swx.jpg'),(15512,'Ember and Blade',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ember and Blade is a premium survivors-like action game combining powerful combat with a rich narrative. Join demon hunter Fenrix on his quest to prevent the archdemon from escaping his 500-year imprisonment. Dive into an enchanting world full of secrets as you slash through countless enemies!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15513,'Build If You Can','2016-09-06','Puzzle, Adventure','Android, iOS','Puzzle “Build If You Can!” takes the player to the amazing fantasy world survived after the awful catastrophe. The giant wave practically washed away the Ancient Town and left the locals` houses destroyed. Now the player is obliged to become a new god and pick up pieces of old knowledge and building technology, lost after the cataclysm. This is the only way to help poor cuties in reconstruction of their native land and solve all mysteries.\n\nCombining fancy blocks, the player will try to build the mysterious towers and reach the maximum height to succeed in this mission. But because of the form or fragility of some figures as well as effect of the real physics, it will not be so easy! And if the player proves that human mind can harness the power of Nature, he will be able to make an unforgettable trip around this unexpected world, meet with new funny friends and save them all, of course!\n\nFEATURES:\n\n• Defy real physics! Show everyone that you can take control of Gravity!\n• Consider the material of the blocks to build really stable towers!\n• Find the right combination of fancy figures to build higher!\n• Get past challenges and earn more rewards!\n• Travel around the picturesque locations and meet charming inhabitants!\n• Open the portals and discover them to get more rewards!\n• Use different boosters: Freeze, Figure Return and others!\n• Connect to Facebook and show of your progress!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gkz1i0j6rvdpcqnkiexk.jpg'),(15514,'Bara Beach Bear','2020-08-29','Simulator','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help a hunky friend get off on the beach.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xnq.jpg'),(15515,'Plane and Simple',NULL,'Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Paper Plane Golf Game! Explore a whole host of thematic maps, customise and upgrade your paper planes and challenge your friends (or foes) to a round or two. With a low-poly aesthetic and plenty of original music to get you in the mood, it\'s a chilled-out yet competitive game to keep you entertained for hours.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rz4.jpg'),(15516,'Ghost House Pong',NULL,'Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s Boo-against-Boo in this arcade-style minigame!\n\n- Play Singles or Doubles matches with up to four players.\n\n- Compete across five different courts, each with its own hazards that can be turned on or off.\n\n- Listen to a playlist of classic tracks from the Mario series, as well as other spooky video game tracks.\n\n- USB Controllers are required for doubles matches with 3-4 players.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15517,'Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition - Lords of the West','2021-01-26','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Welcome to Lords of the West, the first new official expansion to Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition. Challenge friends with two additional civilizations as well as new units and technologies. Battle your way across Western Europe and the Mediterranean with three new campaigns, subjugating your opponents by means of sheer military might and diplomatic prowess or through overwhelming economic and cultural power!\n\nA further expansion pack to Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition, Lords of the West, was announced on December 15, 2020 and released on January 26, 2021. The Lords of the West expansion introduced two further civilisations, the Burgundians and the Sicilians, as well as three new campaigns, featuring Edward Longshanks, the Dukes of Burgundy and the Hautevilles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nwb.jpg'),(15518,'Everweave',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','AI - powered text RPG based on D&D 5e ruleset','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15519,'Peaceful Days','2020-02-03','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Peaceful Days is a farming RPG heavily inspired by Harvest Moon series. In this game, you can build your dream from scratch, raise animals, interact with town folks, take part in interesting festivals, discover many secrets and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25fc.jpg'),(15520,'SingStar: Clásicos','2008-12-04','Music','PlayStation 2','SingStar Clásicos is a karaoke game on the PlayStation 2 system published by Sony Computer Entertainment Europe and developed by SCEE and London Studio. This is the 17th installment in the SingStar saga and an exclusive version for Spain.Show less','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pvc.jpg'),(15521,'The Sims 3: Supernatural','2012-09-06','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Spooky surprises are in store for you in the world of The Sims 3: Supernatural, an expansion pack for The Sims 3. Enter the mysterious town of Moonlight Falls where strange things happen by the light of the moon. Create supernatural beings from menacing werewolves and cackling witches, to mischievous fairies and more intriguing vampires. Then stalk the night, use your wand to cast spells, or just stay home and claw the furniture and more. You can mix dozens of elixirs from turning Sims into zombies to transforming them into gold. Share your enchanted brews with any friends who have The Sims 3!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zpl.jpg'),(15522,'Resident Evil 4: The Mercenaries','2023-04-07','Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','The Mercenaries is a long-running Resident Evil challenge mode that sees players attempt to defeat as many enemies as they can before the timer runs out - or you die. In the original Resident Evil 4, Mercenaries mode was unlocked upon completing the main game. This time, it will be a free DLC content post-launch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6apl.jpg'),(15523,'Green Heights','2025-05-05','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this vertical precision platformer, run, jump, and climb your way through challenging obstacles with satisfying and tight controls. Navigate through atmospheric terrarium vegetation and uncover hidden paths. Perfect for fans of skill-based platformers—every fall is your fault!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99oj.jpg'),(15524,'Batman: Arkham Underworld','2017-02-15','Strategy','Android, iOS','\"Batman: Arkham Underworld\" is an iOS and Android game developed by Turbine, Inc. and released on iOS on July 14, 2016. Set a few years before the events of Arkham Asylum, the game gives players control over a team of villains—including infamous Batman enemies such as the Riddler, Harley Quinn, Mr. Freeze, Killer Croc, Scarecrow, and Bane—and has them build hideouts and recruit henchmen, with the goal of becoming Gotham City\'s \"next criminal kingpin\". Arkham Underworld features voice acting, with many actors reprising their roles from the main installments in the series. The game was shut down in 2017.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zgw.jpg'),(15525,'X4: Foundations - Diplomacy Update','2025-09-30','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nm7.jpg'),(15526,'Arson & Plunder: Unleashed','2015-09-25','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Arson & Plunder is a 2D arcade/beat\'em up adventure based on the genre classics of the 90\'s. The classic gameplay has been brought up to speed with the latest developments and trends! In typical beat\'em up style, playing an orc or elf you wade through hordes of enemies out to kill you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ax5.jpg'),(15527,'Grauen no Torikago: Kapitel 1 - Keiyaku','1999-09-30','Adventure','Dreamcast','Grauen no Torikago: Kapitel 1 - Keiyaku is the first chapter of a horror movie sold exclusively through the Dreamcast Direct online service. The film is divided into 365 episodes, each lasting one minute. It was impossible to watch all the episodes at once as they opened gradually. From 1 October 1999 to 1 October 2000, it was necessary to connect Dreamcast to the internet daily and download special save files on the VMU that opened new episodes.\n\nThe servers went offline shortly after the final episode unlocked. Now it is necessary to use a special VMU save or directly extract the videos of the GDI disc image to watch the film. The sequels of Grauen no Torikago were only available to consumers who had finished previous chapters, making later entries exceedingly rare.\n\nAs of July 2024, a restoration patch has been made by Derek Pascarella that allows you to watch the videos without the vmu save.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8v3s.jpg'),(15528,'Abscission','2023-10-26','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Abscission is a Lovecraftian, story-driven horror point-and-click investigation game. It involves searching crime scenes for evidence, combining clues and questioning suspects. Puzzles can have multiple solutions as you guide the protagonist - Detective Will Stanhope - through the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7u3p.jpg'),(15529,'Midtown Madness 3','2004-04-22','Racing, Simulator','Xbox, Legacy Mobile Device','Midtown Madness 3 is an open world racing/arcade sequel, part of the Midtown Madness series. For the first time in the series, the game was released only on the Xbox, with a Windows version rumoured for later release, but ultimately scrapped.[citation needed]\n\nThe game was developed by DICE (of Battlefield 1942 fame) and published by Microsoft Game Studios. This marked a change from the developer of the first two games, Angel Studios (now Rockstar San Diego). Coincidentally, Midtown Madness 3 was released in 2003 against Midnight Club II, created by the developer of the first two games, Rockstar San Diego.\n\nThe Xbox-only release and change of developer heralded a significant graphical improvement to maintain the console\'s graphical standards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4esw.jpg'),(15530,'Dragon Quest Treasures','2022-12-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Dragon Quest Treasures is an all-new RPG spinoff starring Erik and Mia from Dragon Quest XI.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co530n.jpg'),(15531,'Wii Sports Resort',NULL,'Shooter, Racing, Simulator, Sport','Wii','Set off on a journey to a tropical island where an array of fun activities await. In Wii Sports Resort, the sequel to the engaging Wii Sports, you\'ll discover a wide range of new sports and activities you can play anytime. Go head-to-head with your friends and family in the ultimate sports showdown set in a tropical paradise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2may.jpg'),(15532,'The Rescue 5: Temple of Osiris','2001-07-02','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Tomb Raider fangame made with TRLE.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s9h.jpg'),(15533,'Clash of Evil: The Comeback','2017-06-02','Fighting, Indie','Android','Battle in an all-out clash of scary characters. Visit different stages and maps to experience each character\'s world. More characters and maps in further updates.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79e1.jpg'),(15534,'Star Wars: Rogue Leaders - Rogue Squadron Wii','2008-12-31','Sin género','Wii','Star Wars: Rogue Leaders - Rogue Squadron Wii is a cancelled compilation game for the Nintendo Wii by Factor 5. The game was set to have Star Wars: Rogue Squadron, Star Wars: Rogue Squadron II - Rogue Leader, and Star Wars: Rogue Squadron III - Rebel Strike. It was cancelled in 2008 after Factor 5 went out of business because of the 2007-2008 financial crisis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yo4.jpg'),(15535,'Touhou Spell Bubble: Character Pack Kogasa Tatara','2022-05-19','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','Introducing “Kogasa Tatara” the cheery forgotten umbrella!\nShe is an additional character with the ability to cover up the opponent’s area with her Karakasa Bubble.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4z8q.jpg'),(15536,'Little Witch Parfait ~Kuronekojirushi no Mahouya-san~','1999-04-28','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Parfait Sucreal is a young witch, who is yet in training and full of clumsiness in raising a potion shop called Black Cat Market run by her mother and Parfait\'s black cat, Sakemas, who can amazingly talk. A year ago from the time this game was set, her mother had died from an illness - her father was a famous wizard who died from saving the kingdom when Parfait was young.\n\nAt the beginning, Parfait introduces herself and tells the player that she is almost at the risk of losing her beloved shop (the only remains of her mother), for Parfait has to pay the debt of 1,000,000G (gold) by 12 months to keep the shop running. As a normal shop, there seems no hope for raising the Black Cat Market\'s fame.\n\nThe player\'s motive is to collect this debt by 12 months in various ways such as putting cauldron-made potions to the shop counters for customers, accepting potion orders at the end of the day and sell her potions on the street. As Parfait gains more experience via studying in the library or creating potions, her levels will rise (with a maximum of six stars) which enables her to succeed more on potions that are high-leveled. Many places may trigger the encounter with other important characters whose futures the player must decide by motivating Parfait.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z5c.jpg'),(15537,'AirAttack HD','2014-01-14','Shooter','Android, iOS','AirAttack is an action video game played from top-down perspective and three-dimensional environment. At the beginning of the game, the player starts with three planes, resembling the F4U Corsair, P-38 Lightning and a Yakolev Yak-3. They must choose one from the three and start their fight. The latter planes also use flamethrower and fireball. A flamethrower is used to burn all types of enemies, while the fireball serves the plane as deflection from crashing into another planes with swift pivotal circulation. The player\'s plane has a primary weapon that fires continuously at a constant velocity that can attack aerial enemies, land enemies except the train, and certain buildings. The plane is manipulated by moving it along screen, possibly using mouse, tilting the device, joypad and relative touch (manual input sensitivity). Double tapping the screen drops a bomb that can destroy land enemies and buildings in order to collect coins. Shop also appears throughout the level. Player can enter it to buy gadgets such as homing rockets, super rockets, turrets, shields, side planes, lightnings, bombs that can destroy wider area, extra lives, cannons, and timewraps (provides slow motion technique).\n\nAirAttack departs from the traditional 2D platform of vertical shoot-em-ups and opts for a fully realistic 3D world\", creating a point of difference from other similar games of this nature.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iq3.jpg'),(15538,'Thin Threads','2025-02-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Thin Threads is a first-person psychological horror game about a family\'s desperate struggle to survive poverty. Step into the shoes of each family member, witnessing their story unfold from different perspectives, immersing you in a truly haunting and disturbing experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fh3.jpg'),(15539,'Shadows of Kurgansk','2021-09-23','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Shadows of Kurgansk is a single player horror survival title that transports players into a dark and hostile environment called “The Zone”, it challenges them to escape from the haunted area both alive and with their sanity intact. Dangerous enemy attacks are the least of your concern compared to the real nightmares that await: a wrong foot in the quest to escape can lead to anomalies that can slow players down, drive them insane or even kill them. The character might starve to death or be driven mad unless the player exploits resources in the environment and improves their character. Search, hunt, and discover to stay alive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zxobyt2hue7fjxcpvihc.jpg'),(15540,'Barcha','2025-03-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A psychological horror game where you play as Hannibal, a father trapped between two terrifying worlds. After stealing a mysterious compass, he’s pulled into a distorted mansion inhabited by supernatural entities from the jinn realm. Can you survive and save your daughter before it’s too late?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kj9.jpg'),(15541,'Hexamania','2021-04-02','Puzzle, Arcade','Web browser','Hexamania is a 2D singleplayer game based on survival and puzzle games. Your main challenge is to avoid hexagons! But it will not be that easy...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x6b.jpg'),(15542,'MapleStory','2005-06-01','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to MapleStory, the original side-scrolling MMORPG where epic adventure, action and good friends await you. With hundreds of hours of gameplay, this immersive role-playing experience will allow you to unleash your wild side as you create and train a mighty hero, conquer perilous dungeons, overcome terrifying bosses, socialize with your friends and much more. Your MapleStory begins today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dg8.jpg'),(15543,'Metal Slug 6','2006-09-14','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Arcade, PlayStation 2','Metal Slug 6 returns to the Rebel-Martian alliance featured in Metal Slugs 2, X, and 3, but on a much broader scale. Rather than repeating the previous games\' events of the Martians breaking the alliance and the Rebels assisting the player in turn, the player now teams up with the Rebels and Martians to combat an even greater threat.\n\nMetal Slug 6 introduces a new play mechanic dubbed the \'Weapon Stock System\'. Two gun power-ups can now be carried at the same time. Players can switch between the two weapons, or simply put them both away in favor of the default weapon. When obtaining a new weapon power-up, it will automatically occupy the inactive slot, or, if both are holstered, replace the less recent weapon of the two.\nThe score is now multiplied by powers of 2. The faster the speed at which enemies are killed, the higher the power, as a meter at the bottom of the screen shows. When it says \"Max\" enemies and destructible objects will drop coins for an extra high score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8roa.jpg'),(15544,'Dawn of Kagura: Keika\'s Story','2022-01-08','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vanquish and recruit youkai in randomized dungeons in Dawn of Kagura: Keika\'s Story, a replayable roguelike RPG! Strict big sis Keika wants to set a good example by exorcising evil with her priestess powers...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k2o.jpg'),(15545,'Mallows','2016-12-13','Indie, Arcade','Android','This is the game where the Mallows are.\r\nA challenging game about tapping marshmallows to save them from a campfire.\r\nYou\'ll have 3 lifes, so it won\'t be easy.\r\nA casual game for the moments in which you have to be patient and wait for something important.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yhbzmxal0c6dfkctp48o.jpg'),(15546,'Ravengrave: Iron Bonds',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','You’re a young viking when your world falls apart: your father has fled, leaving you behind with the blacksmith... and a crushing debt. You must master blacksmithing from scratch to survive. Will you rise to the challenge and forge your own path, or will the pressure break you first?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lcp.jpg'),(15547,'Destruction Derby 2','1997-02-21','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Destruction Derby 2 is the sequel to the MS-DOS, PlayStation, Sega Saturn and Nintendo 64 title Destruction Derby. Here the player must race on up to seven different circuits, in a range of modes, similar to its predecessor. The modes are Wrecking Racing (where the player must destroy or spin the other competitors), Stock Car (a typical race where it\'s 1st to the flag) and Destruction Derby, which is based around the crash arenas. Commentator Paul Page performed as the announcer. This Racing game is widely known for its destruction and chaotic themes that follow by loud, gritty and dark metal songs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n5m.jpg'),(15548,'Bumer: Sorvannye bashni','2003-12-11','Shooter, Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bumer: Sorvannye bashni is an arcade first-person shooter with racing elements. It is based on the Russian movie Bumer, but as a free interpretation. The gameplay consists of racing, gang chases and gunfights. Racing levels are similar to sprint races from the Need for Speed series. The player races point-to-point tracks and needs to finish before an opponent.\n\nChases in Bumer consist of racing and shooting elements. AI-controlled passengers of the character\'s car kill enemies to defend the car. For every killed enemy the player receives new weapons. These include assault rifles - AK-47 and AKSU, Makarov and Tokarev pistols, double-barreled and sawed-off shotguns, grenades. Temporary bonuses are also provided, such as invisibility, health regeneration, faster speed, slow motion, full ammunition, radioactivity and others.\n\nThe gameplay of the last two levels is pure first-person shooting: you kill enemies, take the bonuses and weapons for every killed enemy and complete objectives such as placing the bomb, killing a boss, and defending against enemies.\n\nAn additional game mode called \'Sorvannye bashni\' is a survival level where you need to defend against waves of enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pzt.jpg'),(15549,'This Way Madness Lies','2022-11-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Let us begin our tale, in the quiet city of Verona, Italy. A town for lovers... and giant, mutant flower attacks.\n\nAs the leader of the Stratford-Upon-Avon High Drama Society, Imogen is no ordinary girl! Sure, she goes to school every day and helps produce plays for the community, but beyond that, she\'s a magical girl! With her powers, she can teleport to alternate dimensions based on Shakespeare plays, fight back the forces of Nightmare, and still get back in time for dinner!\n\nJoin Imogen, Paulina, Viola, Rosalind, Miranda, Beatrice, and Kate on an epic adventure throughout the Shakespearean metaverse in this comedy JRPG!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j5d.jpg'),(15550,'For I, the Moon','2017-04-23','Sin género','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A short conversation with the moon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5enu.jpg'),(15551,'WWE Slam','2016-07-14','Fighting, Sport, Card & Board Game','Android, iOS','WWE SLAM: Card Trader is a WWE themed digital trading card mobile application.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rlu.jpg'),(15552,'Hellfront: Honeymoon','2018-12-19','Shooter, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hellfront: Honeymoon is an intense twin stick action strategy game, to be enjoyed with friends over a six-pack of fruit juice. One screen, one winner. Welcome to the Hellfront.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27pw.jpg'),(15553,'Secrets of Paradise: Merge','2024-12-01','Puzzle, Adventure','Android, iOS','“Secrets of Paradise” is a new mobile game in merge genre with elements of simulation and family-friendly storytelling, where players complete orders, cook delicious meals, and renovate a beautiful island estate. Dive into a complex metagame that blends Merge-2 mechanics, creative design, and strategic tasks to restore paradise piece by piece.\n\nJoin Ellie as she returns to her childhood island to restore what was lost and uncover long-buried secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pud.jpg'),(15554,'Flutter of birds II: Tenshi-tachi no Tsubasa','2002-02-22','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The miracle happens again... in another country-\n\nThe son of an Englishman and a Japanese woman, our main character is Shin\'ya. Having grown up in his father\'s native land, he wanted to visit the homeland of his mother, who died when he was young. White snow covers the town of Kuramachi. His other hometown, the last trace of his mother. That is where his father and mother met and were married. And the time comes when Shin\'ya\'s wish is granted. His aunt Miyu says she\'ll look after him at her church..\n\nIn his mother\'s hometown, Shin\'ya injures his leg and goes to a clinic. As Shin\'ya stays in the small, snow-covered town, waiting for his leg to heal, he encounters various young women.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15555,'Protocol','2015-08-24','Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Use your lightning skill and pace to outwit your enemies. Challenge other players in a deathmatch, team deathmatch or even capture the flag. The game is a cyberpunk themed first person shooter, it uses smooth and easy to grasp parkour to enable players to flank other players and much more. While playing, it\'s probable that time will change which effects every single aspect of the game. The game has three time periods: 1940s, 2015 and 2070. This forces players to adapt to new weapons and change tactics; the time periods each have different mechanics and layouts. Protocol brings together modern and WW2 shooters to create a fulfilling experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/a1azgktzorypvyx8mnhw.jpg'),(15556,'Year 2088 Classic','2021-05-01','Shooter, Racing, Adventure','Android','Are you ready for the cyberpunk craze of 2088? flying cars and robots.\n\nAre you ready to see a real cyberpunk craze at the peak of the great pre-war technology in 2088? In Year 2088 Classic, you can drive flying cars and flying motorcycles, and fight invading AI robots. You can also see the entertainment venues in Dream City and Dark City and wander the streets of the future as a tourist. All it takes to experience all these great adventures is a mobile phone and download this app.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cz7.jpg'),(15557,'Let\'s Go Paint!','2019-12-24','Indie','Web browser','\"Let\'s Go Paint!\" is a side-scrolling adventure game about depression, social anxiety, and imagination. Meet strange characters and challenge your inner thoughts as you walk across campus to go paint.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z71.jpg'),(15558,'Village RPG',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Create a hero and fight your enemies in 2D Village RPG with your friends. A huge world, PVE arena, and Dungeons are already waiting for you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5i0o.jpg'),(15559,'The Mystery of William Moore','2022-11-24','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Put on your detective hat, and get ready for the mystery of a lifetime. Embark on a plot-driven, walking simulator-puzzle video game with an amazing plot and surprise ending.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5n8t.jpg'),(15560,'Fast Food Manager','2021-04-16','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Launch your own business from scratch! Starting with a small coffee booth, build the most popular foodservice chain in town. Experiment, develop, make a profit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zvq.jpg'),(15561,'Battlegrounds Mobile India','2021-07-02','Shooter, Adventure','Android, iOS','Battlegrounds Mobile India is an online multiplayer battle royale game which is created and published by the Korean game development company Krafton. This is a rebranded game of Playerunknown\'s Battlegrounds which will exclusively available in India.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zml.jpg'),(15562,'Existentia','2016-08-08','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Existentia - post-apocalyptic adveture puzzle game with dark existential atmosphere. As one of the few survivors after nuclear disaster you will explore ruins of the post-Soviet republic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mr0.jpg'),(15563,'Euro Club Manager 2005-2006',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15564,'Dwarfs Fight',NULL,'Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','Sin plataforma','Command your dwarves in tactical battles, position them strategically and use their unique abilities to create your tactics and defeat your enemies in this new turn-based strategy game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qqn.jpg'),(15565,'Space Architect','2024-11-21','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Space station building game. Survive, expand, prosper, and become a major hub!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41ts.jpg'),(15566,'Vocaless',NULL,'Music, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vocaless is a unique platformer game with rhythm elements, you must perform all of your actions to the beat! Not only that, but everything in the game, from enemies to obstacles, follows the beat of the music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t5i.jpg'),(15567,'Merge Marbles','2024-07-22','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Merge Marbles is a relaxing puzzle game where your goal is to merge as many pairs of the same coloured marbles as you can. Each time you merge a pair it creates the next tier all the way up to the big pink marble. Try your best to merge the pink marble to clear as much space as you can!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jk3.jpg'),(15568,'Astro Hunters VR','2024-08-08','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR','Embark on an epic interstellar journey in Astro Hunters VR, the open-world VR action game set in space. Immerse yourself in the exploration of diverse planets, fight with different enemies, craft, gather resources, and upgrade your weapons – either solo or in multiplayer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7oza.jpg'),(15569,'Ryuusei no Rockman: Denpa Henkan! On Air!',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Arcade','Plug & Play','Ryuusei no Rockman: Denpa Henkan! On Air! is a Japan-only plug-and-play TV game released in 2007 by Takara Tomy. The game was developed by SSD Company Limited and uses their XaviX TV game technology.\n\nThe game features a host of minigames and boss battles based on the first Mega Man Star Force game. As the player defeats FM-ian bosses, they obtain new Battle Cards to power up their attacks. A wireless Mega Buster-shaped controller is used to play the game via a combination of motion controls and a button.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2htv.jpg'),(15570,'AVP: Evolution','2013-02-28','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Ouya, Android, iOS','Alien vs. Predator: Evolution brings together two of sci-fi/horror’s most iconic characters in a 3rd person action-shooter/melee combat title, offering a visually stunning gaming experience on the iOS and Android platforms.\n\nWith playable campaigns for both the Alien and Predator, the app offers an immersive story and vicious battles, along with character progression, upgradeable weapons, armor and abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fom.jpg'),(15571,'Bullet Beat','2019-11-12','Shooter, Music, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Bullet Beat is a shoot\'em up, where everything at the levels is in tune with the music, even shooting. You can also upload your track and enjoy the experimental generated levels! Keep the combo to get stronger!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2c8w.jpg'),(15572,'Floor Massacre','2018-09-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have to survive in a huge house firing off numerous zombies and moving along the floors to the end of the level.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15573,'End of Realms','2019-11-26','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','End of Realms is a turn based RPG where travel is inspired by classic board games. The kind where you roll a die, go one of two ways and find something interesting. Combine that with simple combat, painterly graphics, an original plot told in comic book captions and, voila, that\'s our game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pwj.jpg'),(15574,'It Tolls for Thee',NULL,'Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Raymond is trapped in a labyrinth of his own misgivings, painted in the remnants of a life he barely remembers. He must retain his sanity and make his way through an ever-shifting horror, all the while stalked by nightmarish creatures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ddd.jpg'),(15575,'Macho Harvest: Muscular Harvest Puzzle',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A super chaotic puzzle game of macho x agriculture! ? Let\'s raise various kinds of machos that are born by sowing protein in the field with care and love and ship them!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i4e.jpg'),(15576,'Rescue Hannah','2017-09-16','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a fan-made standalone game that uses the Tomb Raider The Last Revelation engine while creating its own story and puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ldb.jpg'),(15577,'Royal Romances: Endless Winter - Collector\'s Edition','2025-05-02','Point-and-click, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Sometimes saving one life can change the fate of many. Can you melt the ice in people\'s hearts?\nThe Collector’s Edition includes:\nAn all-new story in the bonus chapter!\nReplay your favorite mini-games and hidden-object scenes whenever you want!\nTons of achievements to unlock!\nKeep an eye out for secret collectibles and morphing objects!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71i4.jpg'),(15578,'Monster Hunter World: Iceborne Master Edition','2019-09-06','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Discover breathtaking environments and battle titanic creatures in this collection that includes Monster Hunter: World and its massive expansion, Iceborne. As a hunter, you\'ll take on quests to track & slay monsters in a variety of living, breathing habitats. Take down these monsters and use their materials to forge even more powerful weapons and armor, then prepare for even tougher foes as the story unfolds. Each discovery adds new areas, creatures, and drama to the adventure! The Iceborne expansion adds new monsters, gear and abilities to Monster Hunter: World. Picking up right where the base game left off, the Research Commission and your hunter set off to a new polar region, kicking off a brand-new story set in Hoarfrost Reach. Conquer these missions alone, or play online with other hunters for epic multiplayer quests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24ch.jpg'),(15579,'Elex','2017-10-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','An action, role-playing open world game for PC and Consoles, Elex was developed by Piranha Bytes, creators of the award winning Gothic series and is set in a brand new, post-apocalyptic, Science-Fantasy universe where magic meets mechs.\n\n\"Advanced in technology, civilized and with a population of billions, Magalan was a planet looking to the future. Then the meteor hit.\n\nThose who survived are now trapped in a battle to survive, a struggle to decide the fate of a planet. At the center of this fight is the element “Elex”. A precious, limited resource that arrived with the meteor, Elex can power machines, open the door to magic, or re-sculpt life into new, different forms.\n\nBut which of these choices should be the future of Magalan? Can technology or magic save this world? Or will this new power destroy all those left alive amongst the ruins?\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qv7.jpg'),(15580,'Fallout: Nuevo Mexico',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the Land of Enchantment. The year is 2166 - 5 years after the events of \"Fallout: A Post Nuclear Role-Playing Game.\" Every choice made will revolutionize the future for better or worse. Built on the Fallout: New Vegas engine, this free full-on RPG based Modification brings you a brand-new Fallout experience.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15581,'Suika and Dragons','2025-04-09','Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','The moment of destiny has arrived—the dragon eggs are ready to hatch! As the revered Elder Dragon, it is your sacred duty to guide these young hatchlings, ensuring they grow, evolve, and rise to become majestic, unstoppable forces of nature. Will you lead them to greatness, forging a new era of dragonkind?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nhc.jpg'),(15582,'Dead Hungry Diner','2012-05-16','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dead Hungry Diner is all about big combos, spells, monsters fighting monsters and finding your flow within the monstrous mayhem!\nHelp Gabe and Gabby, patrons of “The Dead Hungry Diner”, as they feed the creatures of the night buckets and buckets of juicy Brain Berry goop!\n(Well... that’s the easy part!)\nDo you know what happens when you place werewolves near vampires?\nThey fight!!! And you don’t want fighting when you have so many other things to take care of...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4893.jpg'),(15583,'Typer Shark! Deluxe','2006-08-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sink your teeth into this action-packed educational adventure. Hungry sharks and piranhas are on the hunt as you SCUBA dive around them. Type words fast to zap the predators... before they turn you into lunch!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22ph.jpg'),(15584,'Nina Aquila: Legal Eagle',NULL,'Adventure, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Fight for justice in Nina Aquila: Legal Eagle, an anime-themed graphic adventure game! This was the original chapter release of Nina Aquila: Legal Eagle, which has now been superceded in the collected release, Nina Aquila: Legal Eagle, Season One.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hcn.jpg'),(15585,'I Accidentally Restarted the USSR','2020-06-30','Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Have you ever went on google and searched \"I accidentally\"? If you did then you saw that google autosuggest \"I accidentally restarted the USSR\". In this game you will be able to play the tail of Igor Ivanov as he accidentally restarts the USSR.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gtu.jpg'),(15586,'Summoner of Greats','2025-12-31','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Luis the Mad Painter. His last work, a series of portraits, \"The Effects Series\". - Is it a prayer or a curse? Over 200 beautifully rendered historical figures and worldviews. Casual real-time strategy with a variety of aspects depending on party combination, training, placement, and terrain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jx2.jpg'),(15587,'Dragon\'s Prophet','2012-12-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dragon\'s Prophet is a massively multiplayer online role-playing game (MMORPG) developed by Taiwanese developer Runewaker Entertainment. After going through an open beta phase, the game was officially launched in September 2013. The game client is free to download, and no monthly subscription fee is required as the service is funded by real money transactions. On October 2, 2015 the North American and Japanese publishers announced plans to close the North American servers and the Japanese on November 16th and 30 October respectively.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pz9.jpg'),(15588,'Project Motor Racing','2025-12-31','Racing, Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','All the passion, beauty & intensity of pro motorsport merging the most iconic cars & circuits with a new benchmark in handling performance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rya.jpg'),(15589,'Coryphaeus Championships','2024-09-16','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Coryphaeus Championships is a competitive card game platform that passionately focuses on openly accessible professional play for all. Immerse in endless competitions and become a tournament champion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6tr5.jpg'),(15590,'Valor of Man','2024-09-07','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Valor of Man is a roguelike tactical RPG where enemies react to your actions, giving you endless chances to outsmart them with your tactics.\nValor of Man is developed by Legacy Forge, small indie studio created by 2 brothers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96wb.jpg'),(15591,'Enupishi','2023-01-15','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It was a forbidden love, something that was against the rules of the game. One night, they decided to escape. How far could they go?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nr7.jpg'),(15592,'Crixus: Life of free Gladiator',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','First-person simulator, Ludus manager based in ancient Rome. Manage your gladiators and make them fight for you. Take care of their needs, farm their food, heal them, train them. Fight yourself in the arena. Win tournaments and become the most famous Ludus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lwv.jpg'),(15593,'Diesel Guns','2016-09-22','Shooter, Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Diesel Guns is a mix of two absolutely different genres shooter and racing that are magically harmonised inside online car-shooter with a very dynamic fast-paced gameplay, intuitive controls designed to let player focus on gameplay and tons of features that players can use in battle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23t4.jpg'),(15594,'La storia della Arcana Famiglia 2','2013-11-14','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Taking a year after the prequel, features Ash from the fandisk and new pickable heroes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53jx.jpg'),(15595,'The Darkest Tales','2022-10-13','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Darkest Tales is a complex and compelling adventure, full of familiar characters and fairytale landscapes. Over the course of the journey, you\'ll have to come face-to-face with the difficult questions of life more than once.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43pb.jpg'),(15596,'Brides of Dracula','1992-12-31','Adventure, Arcade','Amiga','Brides of Dracula is a two-player split-screen game similar to Spy vs. Spy in gameplay. Each player (human or CPU) controls either the vampire hunter Van Helsing or Count Dracula. Van Helsing is summoned to the Bistritz village to kill Dracula and his brides. His goal is to find thirteen tools to kill Dracula, bring them back to Helsing\'s home and store them in the cupboard. For Dracula, the objective is to create thirteen brides by finding women, biting and leading them back to the crypt, where thirteen coffins are lined up waiting for their recipients.\n\nBoth characters can be killed by certain hazardous environments and non-player characters (NPCs). Some of these dangers may effect only one of the characters (ghouls only attack Van Helsing, while priests and villagers only harm Dracula). Each player starts with three lives. Collected objects and women are displayed at the bottom of the character window, along with the health bar. The game takes place in the church cemetery and the adjacent village.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a65.jpg'),(15597,'Shake Your Money Simulator 2016','2016-03-28','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Shake Your Money Simulator 2016\" is the newest spend-money simulation which will teach your wallet to hide money from your eyes . Besides , this is a first game in 2016 , where you can finally look at pixel opossum !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hwa.jpg'),(15598,'Bandit Trap',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Defend your home against a bandit invasion using inventive boobytraps as a Trapper, or join a team of three Bandits and try to get away with the loot! Introducing BANDIT TRAP—a fresh 3vs1, chaotically fun, physics-driven online multiplayer game for the whole family.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qnv.jpg'),(15599,'Fading Skies',NULL,'Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a vivid fantasy world full of mystery, memorable characters, and heartfelt narrative. Unlock the powerful abilities of Ryn and her dragon companion, as you join her quest to stop the planet’s collapse. Only by confronting the shadows of her forgotten past can the future be saved.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co884t.jpg'),(15600,'The Rooms','2019-06-17','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Rooms is an escape room game with puzzles. Find out the hidden items in three rooms!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i7f.jpg'),(15601,'Raw',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Raw is a new upcoming sandbox open world MMORPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m2r.jpg'),(15602,'Sinister City','2014-10-18','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Who would name their town Sinister City? Vampires, of course! When John discovers his bride-to-be has been kidnapped by Sinister City\'s number one bloodsucker, there\'s only one thing to do - search for hidden objects! And kill vampires! Or at least insult them until they give your girl back.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co221q.jpg'),(15603,'Ms. Pac-Man: Quest for the Golden Maze','2001-10-12','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A polygonal Ms. Pac-Man game for PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dnl.jpg'),(15604,'Brutalist','2025-12-31','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Brutalist is a third-person meditative game where you need to follow paths, find passages, solve riddles, watch out for radiation and monitor oxygen levels. And all this is surrounded by an atmospheric abandoned concrete world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co970i.jpg'),(15605,'Sigi: A Fart for Melusina','2018-09-07','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Join Knight Sigi as he runs, jumps, and battles in a flatulent quest to save Melusina, the love of his life! Take down hordes of goofy enemies and crazy bosses. Earn riches, find long lost holy artefacts and make your way up to the top of Mount Stinkup!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24sz.jpg'),(15606,'Kitten Adventure: A Very Meow Christmas','2022-12-01','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Very Meow Christmas is a truly incredible and epic game starring Lara Croft, who is asked to save kittens\' most beloved holiday. Play minigames and bring back the magic of Christmas!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61mi.jpg'),(15607,'Rabbids Go Home','2009-11-06','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Wii','A comedy adventure. To the moon or bust! The Rabbids need stuff...lots of stuff! So grab everything you can and help the Rabbids build a pile to the moon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a3e.jpg'),(15608,'Fast Five','2011-04-20','Racing','iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fnf.jpg'),(15609,'The Roottrees Are Dead','2023-11-08','Point-and-click, Puzzle','Web browser','The Roottrees are Dead is a puzzle game based around correctly assembling a family tree.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vwr.jpg'),(15610,'Dead Cards','2023-12-16','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','Web browser','WELCOME IN DEAD CARDS !\n\nEach game, a card is killed in a deck a card. The killer is always the card that was on top of the victim in the card game. Find the truth by questioning each card, which will give you clues as to their position in the deck. Only one card lie, it\'s the murderer! Investigate and find to incoherence to put it in jail.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87u7.jpg'),(15611,'The Adventures of Tintin: Prisoners of the Sun','1997-02-01','Platform, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Adventures of Tintin: Prisoners of the Sun is based on the Belgian comic book of the same name. The basic plotline is the same: Professor Cuthbert Calculus gets kidnapped and the player, in the role of Tintin, needs to rescue him. The rest is more loosely adapted: in contrast to the comic, which is mostly based in Peru, this game offers many different locations all over the world.\n\nThe gameplay itself is a typical platforming action: Tintin walks through the levels while avoiding the enemies. Pretty much everyone, e.g. little girls and security guards, is out to hurt Tintin who has no means of defending himself. This means the most important aspect is learning enemy placements, their patterns and how to avoid them. But he has to hurry because of the time limit. Required for success is the usage of the two playing plains: from the player\'s perspective in the foreground and further towards the background. Tintin can switch between the two at any time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xzc.jpg'),(15612,'Animal Crossing: Amiibo Festival','2015-11-21','Puzzle, Quiz/Trivia','Wii U','The Animal Crossing: amiibo Festival game is a brand-new way to play with your favorite Animal Crossing characters. Your amiibo figures are front-and-center in this party game, and you’ll get to use them with fun content. Bring to life an expansive and dynamic board game where the board is based on the months of the year like the core Animal Crossing series. The goal? Make your villager the happiest in town and party hard\nwith your friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sao.jpg'),(15613,'Choo Choo Crossing','2022-10-03','Sin género','Web browser','I\'m crossin here!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15614,'GoldenEye 007: Reloaded','2011-11-01','Shooter','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','The GoldenEye story comes to life once again with an updated single player storyline featuring Daniel Craig as Bond and written by Bruce Feirstein, the screenwriter for the original movie.\n\nSurprise enemies covertly or engage in a full on firefight and use Bond\'s latest gadget to uncover intel in augmented reality as you relive all the classic GoldenEye movie moments. Infiltrate the dam and destroy the facility; chase Ourumov in the tank through the streets of St. Petersburgh; and investigate the secret jungle base.\n\nThe remastered game features high-definition graphics due to running on a new game engine, an achievement system, a new Mi6 Ops mission mode, and PlayStation Move compatibility for the PS3 version.\n\nActivision also released the GoldenEye 007: Reloaded - Double \'O\' Edition which included access to the downloadable character Hugo Drax, a PlayStation Move motion controller, navigation controller, PlayStation Eye camera, and Sharp Shooter peripheral along with the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lar.jpg'),(15615,'Hyperide VR','2017-10-26','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The cargo ship, carrying the priceless crystals, was attacked by a pirate vessel. The crew have used all of their means of defense, but this will be not enough to ensure their survival. The player answers to the call for help and embarks on a journey to save the cargo ship IMS Horizon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bo9.jpg'),(15616,'Reine des Fleurs','2019-04-25','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','In the past, there was a goddess whom extended a helping hand to a world that was about to perish. That goddess, along with the four knights who served her, healed the ruined land using \"Grace\", a power that rejuvenates worn down life forces, and saved the world.\n\nEver since then, because the goddess\' consciousness went into a slumber, she was to be succeeded by someone who will become a representation of her divine spirit, known as a \"Reine\", and four human knights that were chosen by the world. As the world continued to enjoy the goddess\' favour, it continued to develop and advance.\n\nHowever, at a certain point, even after coming into the world for generations, a Reine was not born. As a result, the supplies of Grace stagnated, and the world was once again threatened to be consumed by darkness.\n\nBut finally, the Reine of the next era, \"Violette\" was born. Adhering to the customs, she selected four men to become the queen\'s knights. However, the hearts of those men rejected to bond with the Reine, due to the Reine\'s long absence.\n\nIn order to supply the world with Grace, the co-operation of the knights is essential.\n\nTo obtain the trust and loyalty of the knights, Violette begins to take action...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p7y.jpg'),(15617,'AFL 26','2025-05-08','Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Get ready for the future of footy with AFL 26. Feel every hit, hear every roar, and live every moment with unmatched authenticity and intensity. From the first bounce to the final siren, the action is fast, fierce, and true to the game. With lifelike gameplay, roaring crowds, expert commentary, and all the drama of real AFL, you’re not just watching the game — you’re in it. This is footy, redefined.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oui.jpg'),(15618,'Graveyard Shift','2023-12-02','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Graveyard Shift is about a man who is sent to guard a cemetery on his first day of work. his duty is to watch over this place. However, with the coming of night And be heard paranormal sounds and observing strange things through CCTV cameras, he realize that this is not just a terrifying place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jay.jpg'),(15619,'Cave Ranger','2024-12-20','Platform, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','When the Bitty Gang steals the town\'s livelihood and takes it underground, a lone, brave cowboy must come to the rescue. Cave Ranger is an 8-bit inspired, retro platform game. Rescue sheep, fight outlaws, and face down dangerous critters. With a whip and pistol at his disposal, the cave ranger must traverse old mines, water reservoirs, and even a saw mill! It is a lighthearted, laid back western, full of platformer fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99xb.jpg'),(15620,'Terroir','2017-05-17','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Terroir is a 3D tile-based tycoon game where you manage your very own vineyard. In Terroir, you grow a variety of different grape varietals, craft your wine, and expand and manage your Chateau, all the while dealing with the weather and events that can either make or break your business.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sru.jpg'),(15621,'F-Zero AX','2003-06-01','Racing','Arcade','A premium cabinet arcade version of F-Zero GX on the GameCube, which ran on the Triforce arcade system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tk2.jpg'),(15622,'Hearts of Iron III: DLC Collection',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d4l.jpg'),(15623,'Bean','2021-04-25','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Bean is a single player first person parkour game. To move onto a new level, collect the gold orb and it will teleport you to the next level. Use WASD keys to walk. You can grapple using your burger onto the orange blocks using left click. You can go back to any level after you completed all levels. You are the red bean trying to get to the other 5 beans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xup.jpg'),(15624,'Ben 10 Alien Force: Forever Defense','2008-12-31','Shooter, Tactical, Arcade','Web browser','An endless arcade style defense-based game where the player switches between Swampfire, Gwen, and Kevin to take on a never ending horde of Forever Knights.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99u6.jpg'),(15625,'Behind the Frame: The Finest Scenery - Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Adventure, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4txw.jpg'),(15626,'Grimoire: Manastorm - Nature Class',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','With power over life and death a Nature wizard is vital for a successful team composition. She is Grimoire’s primary healing class but like all classes in Grimoire she can also do solid damage.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15627,'Jurassic Island: The Dinosaur Zoo','2015-06-13','Simulator, Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Come and build your own dinosaur world with this unique Jurassic Island Zoo game! Operate a successful dinosaur park by attracting many visitors. Join the community and build your own creation!  \n  \nCreate your own unique tour with different stations so visitors can observe the dinosaurs. The more likes you collect the more funds you accumulate (a heads up: locating the dinosaurs drinking and feeding bowls close to the stations is key). With your extra earned cash, expand the park with further services and amenities for visitors, such as gift shops, hotels, restaurants, while you are also in charge of securing food and water supplies, electricity and a necessary security system. A volcano nearby and unpredictable weather are additional challenges to manage your park successfully.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2szk.jpg'),(15628,'Crystal Beans: From Dungeon Explorer','1995-10-27','Role-playing (RPG)','Super Famicom','When the Demon Rain falls,\nThe ground will turn to dirt,\nAnd the sea will lose its shine.\n- Legend, from the Grandol Royal Library -\n\nThere once was a peaceful realm,\nknown as Grandol...\n\nThere was a time when demons had taken Grandol,\nand the world was on the edge of destruction.\nBut with the power of the Miracle Gem, peace was restored.\n\nAfterwards, the powerful Miracle Gem was shattered and sealed\naway, since the peace of Grandol had been obtained.\n\nThen, on a certain day, one hundred years later...\n\nSuddenly, an enormous cloud took over the Grandol sky,\nand the Demon Rain started to fall.\n\nThe wicked power of the Demon Rain\nchanged the nature of Grandol.\nAnd when the Demon Rain stopped,\na castle appeared atop the clouds...\n\nAt this point, in the aftermath of the Demon Rain,\nthe Demon Holes started showing up.\nMonsters began to appear from these.\n\nThe Demon Rain seeped deep underground,\nwhere long ago the fragments of the Miracle Gem\nwere sealed with fifteen demons.\n\nThey reawakened. In the large Rulvesos Castle,\nthe voice of a goddess reached King Rulvesos...\n\n\"King Rulvesos, demons are taking over\neverything, even to Heaven itself.\nBut there is hope; items called the Crystal\nBeans can be used to our advantage.\nThey can call the Heroes of Light,\nto save Grandol!!\"\n\nWhen the goddess\' voice faded,\na light shot down from the Heavens to Rulvesos castle,\nto a room known as the \"Hero Room\".\n\nHere, weapons appeared around a Crystal Bean,\ndelivered by the goddess...\n\nAnd the Heroes of Light appeared,\nto aid King Rulvesos.\n\nNow, with the power of the Crystal,\nthe Heroes of Light have come down\nfrom the Heavens.\nThey set out...\n.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b3o.jpg'),(15629,'Deep Rock Galactic: Supporter Upgrade','2018-02-28','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','So you like Deep Rock Galactic, but it’s just not enough? You want more? Well, then the Supporter Upgrade is for you! Help fuel further development of the game, while getting your grubby mining-gloves on this tasty bag of exclusive treats:\n\n- Gold plated Paintjob for Bosco in the game!\n- Supporter-only gold-plated skins for all weapons in the game!\n- VIP treatment at the ingame Abyss Bar - Get the SUPPORTER EDITION of the tasty Glyphid Slammer for your whole team, served in the gaudiest of golden tankards!\n- A unique Ghost Ship Games themed helmet, marking you as a permanent member of the Skeleton Crew!\n- Your chat name will be gold, to show off your Supporter status!\n- The unique Supporter Badge, shown next to your name ingame! (NEW: And in chat!)\n- An exclusive set of blinged-out armor for each class! NEW This is now a Paintjob and can be applied to all armors!\n- Our heartfelt and eternal thanks and gratitude <3','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qbq.jpg'),(15630,'Bread','2024-10-15','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Royal Bakery welcomes you to Bread, a fun simple clicker game. Stay a while, have some fun and click a crumb. Careful too much bread makes you fat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mfd.jpg'),(15631,'9 Games, 2 Buttons','2025-03-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this game you play up to 9 minigames at the same time, at game speeds of 50-300%. You use the numberpad and QWE down, which match where the minigame is on the grid. Push for a new high score, trash talk your friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lvt.jpg'),(15632,'Pac \'n Roll','2005-10-28','Platform','Nintendo DS','In Pac\'N Roll, the inhabitants of Pac-World have been turned into spheres by the evil monster Golvis\' Ghost Light. Pac-Man must roll his way through Ghost-Land, collecting pellets and confronting Ghosts to save his family and restore peace to Pac-Land. Introducing an innovative new control scheme, Pac\'N Roll lets players control Pac-Man with the Nintendo DS stylus. Players can roll and dash around the environment as well as execute maneuvers such as hairpin turns, immediate stops and precision rolling with effortless strokes of the stylus. In his quest to save Pac-Land, Pac-Man will venture through stages such as Castle Pac, Gyro-Jungle and the Ghost House, while facing perilous hazards like moving floors, dash panels, jump zones and wind zones. Along the way, Pac-Man will find power-ups like the Winged Chocolate, allowing him to fly through the worlds and jump over Ghosts, or the \"Knight Chocolate,\" providing him with armor which grants him the power to crash through walls and withstand more damage. Pac\'N Roll also includes the original Pac-Man arcade game, allowing up to two players to munch on pellets and claim the highest score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85i2.jpg'),(15633,'Poly Ego','2023-09-08','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3, Oculus Rift','Do you have what it takes to become the next test subject to pass my tests? I\'ve crafted them with care! I\'m looking for robots willing to be part of the...good robots! Use your logic to pass the laser experience tests and become a legitimate robot!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wo4.jpg'),(15634,'Space Vanguard','2020-04-17','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Space Vanguard\" is a plane shooting game with science fiction theme, which tells the story of an insignificant landing battle against stars. The player will act as a paratrooper and take part in this attack on the planet controlled by Winchester\'s military industry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41we.jpg'),(15635,'Evil is Back','2023-04-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Evil is Back\" is a retelling of the movies \"Evil Dead 1 and 2\"... With everything a low budget short film should have. For fans of 80\'s trash horror movies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e35.jpg'),(15636,'Cloudborn','2017-09-26','Platform, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cloudborn is a VR exploration adventure game that will move you into a world of awe and wonder. Explore the remnants of a lost civilization to uncover a hidden fate. Are you ready to ascend?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wtw.jpg'),(15637,'Vampyr','2018-06-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','London, 1918. You are newly-turned Vampyr Dr. Jonathan Reid. As a doctor, you must find a cure to save the city’s flu-ravaged citizens. As a Vampyr, you are cursed to feed on those you vowed to heal.\n\nWill you embrace the monster within? Survive and fight against Vampyr hunters, undead skals, and other supernatural creatures. Use your unholy powers to manipulate and delve into the lives of those around you, to decide who will be your next victim. Struggle to live with your decisions… your actions will save or doom London.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lrg.jpg'),(15638,'Battlecruisers','2021-02-04','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Build the ultimate warship to attack and defend against frigates, artillery, and bombers. Journey across the flooded Earth, touring the remains of humanity’s greatest landmarks while engaging in explosive tactical gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s3u.jpg'),(15639,'Caliber','2023-04-12','Shooter, Tactical, Indie, MOBA','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Caliber is a free-to-play, team-based, tactical third-person shooter focused on special forces units from all over the world. Four classes, more than 60 operators with unique abilities and equipment, and various game modes: PvE, PvP and PvPvE.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9531.jpg'),(15640,'Snake VR','2018-10-04','Simulator, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A virtual reality take on on the classic snake game.\nEat rats to grow, avoid bumping into objects, walls, or yourself :)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h3y.jpg'),(15641,'Ojou-sama to Himitsu no Otome','2015-06-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ojou-sama to Himitsu no Otome is the first game made by the label MOONSTONE Honey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22rg.jpg'),(15642,'The Adventures of Shuggy','2012-06-13','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','The Adventures of Shuggy is a 2D platformer with a leaning towards puzzles. There are over 100 single player levels and 36 Co-Op levels connected through a gradually unlocking map screen ensuring there is always a variety of levels to choose from. Progress through the mansion is punctuated by comic book cut scenes and the occassional boss encounter. Every room in Shuggy\'s castle is different, letting Shuggy travel in time, swing on ropes, turn to a zombie, shrink, grow, fly, teleport and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22ak.jpg'),(15643,'Candles','2011-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Candles is a short first-person horror game developed by TheUnbeholden. Set in a remote and shadowy home, players must navigate through unsettling interiors while managing limited interactions that shape their path forward. The game emphasizes atmosphere, using dynamic lighting, eerie sound design, and a compact, claustrophobic environment to build tension. Its minimalist mechanics focus attention on exploration and environmental storytelling, creating a suspenseful and immersive experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pvf.jpg'),(15644,'Zombie Flick','2018-09-29','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a well-designed side-by-side action adventure game that allows you to control a single character, deftly destroying traps and heroically killing hordes of zombies along the way by executing gorgeous commotion, using a variety of weapons, and unleashing powerful skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mf4.jpg'),(15645,'The Rising of the Shield Hero: Relive the Animation','2019-09-23','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The popular anime `` The rise of the shield brave \'\' by Aneko Usagi appears in RPG! Not only can you experience the famous scenes in anime, but you can also enjoy the world view of \"The rise of the shield hero\" as a game, such as a battle system and a commerce system that make use of the characteristics of the main character...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co442k.jpg'),(15646,'Slay the Wak','2021-12-30','Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fan games of \"woowakgood\"\nYear-end contest entries for the year 2021, 2022','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zu8.jpg'),(15647,'Evening Starter','2021-06-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A classic dungeon crawler RPG. When Ren Nosogi gets caught up in an incident that puts her in massive debt, she must use her skills as a Sweeper to take down an evil cult in order to pay it off.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co463g.jpg'),(15648,'Gearbits: Gear Angels','2024-02-26','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','2D side-scrolling shoot \'em up','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zn8.jpg'),(15649,'Citrouille: Sweet Witches','2018-10-29','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Citrouille is a modern spin on old arcade classics.\nBrave danger and cover the world with flowers using your magic ladders.\nPlay alone, together or settle the score in versus to rediscover the challenge of the good old days.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co268n.jpg'),(15650,'Home Deco Builder','2025-02-27','Simulator, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Brings you the joy of building miniature interiors and create your own cosy home designs as you want. Simple, relaxing and fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hi1.jpg'),(15651,'Sea of Thieves: Season 3','2021-06-22','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','In Season Three’s undoubted star attraction and the game’s biggest update in years, Sea of Thieves collides with Disney’s Pirates of the Caribbean for the ultimate pirate crossover in Sea of Thieves: A Pirate’s Life! Join forces with Captain Jack Sparrow and fend off his old enemy, the notorious Davy Jones, to save the Sea of Thieves from catastrophe in this breathtaking original story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3g7s.jpg'),(15652,'Tenders Fight','2023-05-26','Platform, Racing, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tenders Fight is a thrilling fighting game where you go up against a horde of aggressive chicken aliens. You play as a boxer, using your skills to defeat these cunning creatures. With each level, the chickens become stronger and smarter, testing your abilities to their limits. Can you defeat them?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q13.jpg'),(15653,'Eternal Paradox','2023-12-06','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Android, iOS','Eternal Paradox is a mobile 4X strategy game with turn-based RPG elements. Gather resources, build armies and forge alliances in the player-driven world of Elysium. Compete for rewards within a unique seasonal system where progress is periodically reset.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81n5.jpg'),(15654,'Sentience','2024-02-13','Sin género','Web browser','Sentience is a game following a little girl who is trapped in her bedroom. She wants to get out. Will you help her?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pt1.jpg'),(15655,'Super Valis IV','1992-03-27','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Once upon a time, there was a prince named Gallagher. He was entrusted with a magical ring that granted him great powers. But he was too weak to control the power of the ring, and became possessed by it. The mad prince was sealed into a crystal, but many years later managed to break out, planning to wreak havoc on the Dream World and to conquer it! Yuko, the heroine of the three previous Valis games, is no longer a sacred Valis warrior - she has become a goddess. Lena, a young girl who wants to become a Valis warrior, is the new main character, who must prove to Yuko she is worthy to wield the sword of Valis, that will eventually stop the evil plans of Gallagher.\n\nLike the previous games in the series, this is an action platform game. You can fight enemies with melee weapons or use magic. In order to cast magic spells, you must gather special items while fighting off regular enemies. At the end of a level, a boss enemy battle awaits you. The game features cut scenes with animé-style graphics to advance the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mm1.jpg'),(15656,'Some Goodbyes We Made','2024-10-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','I have some memories of saying goodbye that I don\'t want to forget, so I turned them into 11 minigames and backed them up in this collection.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zab.jpg'),(15657,'SC Cat Games Bundle','2024-12-17','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eek.jpg'),(15658,'Cloacaphobia','2021-08-21','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cloacaphobia is a 90s VHS found footage survival horror that plays on the fear of sewers, realistic situations and claustrophobic environments with a gruesome atmosphere.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7q0w.jpg'),(15659,'Give Up','2012-12-31','Platform','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qqs.jpg'),(15660,'Eagle Island','2019-07-10','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Explore the avian world of Eagle Island with Quill and one of his loyal owls, Koji. Discover lush forests, treacherous caverns and uncover the ruins of long lost civilizations. Finally, confront the gargantuan deity, Armaura, in a desperate attempt to rescue Ichiro from her clutches.\n\nWith its falconry-based gameplay within uniquely generated worlds, Eagle Island is set to a beautifully modernized pixel art aesthetic and provides a breath of fresh air to the platforming genre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nzn.jpg'),(15661,'Morte','2020-10-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gxx.jpg'),(15662,'Yoku\'s Island Express','2018-05-29','Platform, Puzzle, Pinball, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Yoku’s Island Express is an open world/metroidvania-style pinball adventure, Seamlessly blending platform navigation with pinball mechanics across a large open world. Yoku the dung beetle sets foot on the beach of Mokumana Island, ready to take on the duties as the new postman. But the ancient island God is trapped in a restless sleep and the islanders are plagued by quakes and storms brought forth by its nightmares. Yoku\'s Island Express is a unique and quirky adventure with handcrafted visuals, where you\'ll soar through the air, vacuum explosive snails, fight a Screetch, feed starving lemurs, discover the mystery of the Fruit Altar, wake an old god, and hopefully help tiny Yoku rebuild the island post-office.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26hb.jpg'),(15663,'The Amazing Spider-Man: Ultimate Edition','2013-03-05','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Wii U','The Amazing Spider-Man: Ultimate Edition is a special version of the 2012 video game The Amazing Spider-Man, released exclusively for the Wii U in 2013. This edition includes all previously released downloadable content (DLC) on-disc, offering additional missions, characters, and suits unavailable in the original game. Some of the notable DLC content includes the \"Lizard Rampage Pack,\" \"Oscorp Search and Destroy Pack,\" \"Stan Lee Adventure Pack,\" and new suits like the Vigilante and Classic Spider-Man suits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6uga.jpg'),(15664,'Chaser','2010-07-27','Shooter','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chaser is a first-person shooter action video game that takes place in the future, when humanity has inhabited Mars. The gameplay is fast pace, featuring 12 maps that make up the gameplay over four different game modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b1y.jpg'),(15665,'The Last Express','1997-03-30','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','A point-and-click adventure game that takes place on a European train shortly before the outbreak of World War I. The game attempts to simulate real time with a non-linear story and dozens of fully voiced characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2thd.jpg'),(15666,'Epicedium',NULL,'Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Epicedium is a 4 vs 1 Asymmetric multiplayer survival horror title , play as a survivor and fight for you life to escape by co-operating with your teamates to Repair the radio and call for help or fight back to take the killer down,\n\nOr play as a killer and hunt your prey with unique ability\'s.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15667,'Another Fisherman\'s Tale','2023-05-11','Puzzle, Adventure','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR','Another mind-bending VR adventure in Another Fisherman\'s Tale, a poetic story with unique VR puzzle mechanics. Control limbs, solve puzzles, explore new locations & discover the truth. A follow-up to the award-winning A Fisherman\'s Tale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6icm.jpg'),(15668,'Tumble Troopers','2025-03-06','Shooter, Strategy','Android, iOS','Tumble Troopers is an online multiplayer 3rd person shooter, where tactics meet mayhem in every clash. Step into the chaotic battleground and embrace the thrill of physics-driven gameplay with intuitive controls and shooting mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98eh.jpg'),(15669,'Plants vs. Zombies 2: A Journey Through Time and Space','2013-09-12','Strategy','Android, iOS','it\'s time! \"Plants vs. Zombies 2 - A Journey Through Time and Space\" has landed in China. The epic struggle between plants and zombies will continue in different time and space dimensions! New plants, new zombies, new gameplay, combined with the most advanced touch screen technology, players can break the traditional tower defense and directly join the zombie resistance war. With the return of Plants vs. Zombies 2, Crazy Dave, new touch screen super props, new magical plant energy, and new ways to protect your brain, come and join Crazy Dave in his crazy adventure through time and space! The previous game of \"Plants vs. Zombies 2\" is \"Plants vs. Zombies\" which has won more than 30 Game of the Year awards and has hundreds of millions of fans around the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sje.jpg'),(15670,'Rauol','2023-11-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a story about a thief, \"Rauol,\" who hides in a secret warehouse of a large company to make a big deal, unexpectedly becomes a combination with Duoksini, who is being tested in captivity and runs away.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7eee.jpg'),(15671,'SingStar: Hits','2008-12-19','Music','PlayStation 3','SingStar: Hits is the French release of SingStar Vol.2 and is containing 27 French songs for 3 in English. The tracklist is a mix between classic songs and new hits.\n\nIt\'s a karaoke game, giving points which are distributed by the purity of singing, as in how well does one manage to stay on tune. It doesn\'t matter if you change octaves in the middle of the song or what words are you singing in (it doesn\'t have a word recognition), so your singing is rated by how well you manage to hit the correct note at the correct time. There\'s a new mode called Harmony Duet, in which two players sing different lines of the same song, at the same time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jcn.jpg'),(15672,'Data mining 2','2018-10-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Data Mining 2 - casual colorful minimalist puzzle in which you have to collect all the files that are not corrupted to exit the closed circle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o69.jpg'),(15673,'Nargul: Humans are among us',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Play in VR as a jovial but amnesiac alien. Explore the environment and interact freely with the people. Solve objectives, fight and cross the courses to find the ultimate truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ioj.jpg'),(15674,'Age of Mythology: Retold - Immortal Pillars','2025-03-04','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Unleash the power of Chinese mythology in Age of Mythology: Retold’s first expansion, Immortal Pillars. Discover a new pantheon of gods, legendary myth units, and awe-inspiring god powers in an epic campaign inspired by ancient legends.\n\nSummon the fierce goddess Nüwa, command Chiyou, the bull-headed god of war, and call upon Nüba, the relentless bringer of drought. Control the skies with Yinglong, the mighty flying rain dragon, and experience so much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9csb.jpg'),(15675,'Click of Cthulhu','2019-11-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','My Overlord! The stars will soon be aligned, we have to rebuild R\'Lyeh and forge the Unnameable key to the Ultimate Gate and awake the one true god: Cthulhu! May his reign endure beyond eternity! FHTAGN!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15676,'New Super Mario Bros. Versus','2022-03-18','Platform, Arcade','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A unity-standalone 2-10 player remake of the Mario vs. Luigi gamemode from the New Super Mario Bros DS download game.\n\nIncludes the 5 default levels (Grassland, Bricks, Castle, Pipes, and Ice), along with a handful of custom levels to battle on! All power-ups are included and remain faithful to their original counterparts, along with the new addition of the Propeller Suit & Ice Flower!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6td1.jpg'),(15677,'Final Fantasy 25th Anniversary Ultimate Box','2012-12-18','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','Final Fantasy 25th Anniversary Ultimate Box is a box set of the Final Fantasy main series to commemorate the Final Fantasy 25th Anniversary.\n\nIt includes the following games:\n\n- Final Fantasy (PS1)\n- Final Fantasy II (PS1)\n- Final Fantasy III (PSP)\n- Final Fantasy IV (PS1)\n- Final Fantasy V (PS1)\n- Final Fantasy VI (PS1)\n- Final Fantasy VII International (PS1)\n- Final Fantasy VIII (PS1)\n- Final Fantasy IX (PS1)\n- Final Fantasy X (PS2)\n- Final Fantasy XI Vana\'diel Collection (PS2)\n- Final Fantasy XII (PS2)\n- Final Fantasy XIII (PS3)\n\nThe box also includes a 25th anniversary video, the Final Fantasy 25th Anniversary Crystal Art Works artbook, a two-disc compilation of music, Final Fantasy 25th anniversary artwork on a stand by Yoshitaka Amano, and an item code for \"Mogu Mogu\" earrings in Final Fantasy XIV. It was exclusive to Square Enix\'s e-Store.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mog.jpg'),(15678,'Sneak In','2020-10-15','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sneak In is a fun, challenging and addictive marble shooter game. Stop the evil and greedy snake Seth from eating all your beloved marbles that slowly sneak into the marvelous jungle of Chicahua. Seth, the fearless reptile who is living there for ages also wants to collect the precious marbles. Stop him by triggering chain reactions and combinations of three marbles and play through over 200 unique, colorful and challenging levels to reach the top spot on the scoreboard. Challenge your friends on the endless mode and beat their highscore. Sneak In is one of the most addictive marbles game you will ever play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wdx.jpg'),(15679,'Slam Dunk',NULL,'Sport','Android, iOS','Slam Dunk is a real-time 3v3 Basketball game adapted from the Japanese anime with the same name. Meet the original characters, watch the original story and those classic scenes. You will be able to use those familiar skills like “Hua Hua Defense”, “Akagi Dunk” and “Lightning Fast”; while experiencing the strength of each high-school basketball team. Let’s ignite your passion for basketball and feel those touching moment through the competitions. Enjoy creating and developing your very own playing technique!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w62.jpg'),(15680,'Engine Roar',NULL,'Racing, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Engine Roar is a hardcore race for survival on rusty post-apocalyptic wastelands, under the noisy roar of engines in pixel 3D styling.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co663f.jpg'),(15681,'Hearts of Olympus','2024-09-20','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Break your curse, battle mythic foes, and fall for the gods in an epic tale of love and destiny!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91r3.jpg'),(15682,'Southern Cross','2022-12-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The tale of a wandering swordsman seeking the Strongest, at the end of his journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67l8.jpg'),(15683,'Pagan: Technopolis','2018-08-11','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An Entirely Pleasant Nightmare','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77we.jpg'),(15684,'Smuggler Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Life at the border crossing is like a lottery - I never know what the next day will bring. People want to move all kinds of goods, and I help them. I love this job.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41p6.jpg'),(15685,'Heat and Run','2022-10-13','Shooter, Platform, Strategy, Indie, MOBA','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Heat and Run is a 2D multiplayer shooter, strategic and frantic! Take on players from around the world in 4vs4 battles: Select a hero with unique skills, master the creation of Blocks in intense battles and destroy the opponent Flame to win the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gua.jpg'),(15686,'Goblin Camp','2024-09-17','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Goblin Camp is a fantasy city-building game inspired by Finnish mythology. Deep simulation mechanics capture the unique challenges of surviving the harsh winters and carving a thriving settlement out of the northern forest. Lead your goblins to greatness!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86wk.jpg'),(15687,'Train Simulator: Settle Carlisle Specials Add-On','2012-05-03','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Settle-Carlisle Specials puts you in the cab of fabulous preserved steam locomotives as they haul trains full of rail fans along the Settle-Carlisle line.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15688,'3D Ultra Minigolf Adventures: Space','2007-05-24','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','3D Ultra Mini Golf Adventures: Space is a demo of the full 3D Ultra Mini Golf Adventures game. It was distributed by Taco Bell restaurants during a promotion that ran from May 24 - June 27, 2007. This disc contains 4 holes from the Outer Space theme of the full game: Laseriffic, Planetoid, Two Planets, Rocket Man.\n\nWhile up to 4 players can player head to head in the full version, this demo version only allows 1 player to assume one of the 4 edgy, defiant personae available: Hector, Rosie, Joe, and Kate. The other 3 characters will also be playing, more or less as phantoms (their scores are reported summarily without any action seen). The game features 2 different control schemes for setting up the shot and putting the ball. It also allows the player to customize both their player\'s outfit and their golf ball.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kh2.jpg'),(15689,'Ravva and the Cyclops Curse','2022-01-14','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Unleash your summoning powers to defeat the Cyclops Lord! Along with four unusual companions, you must journey through a dangerous land to save your mother, who suffered a terrible curse. A challenging adventure awaits!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ze4.jpg'),(15690,'Powers of Hex','2023-01-13','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Powers of Hex is a non-linear experience of classic 2D platformers.Play as Hex on a quest to obtain all 6 unique, magic powers from Elfvis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61it.jpg'),(15691,'Rise of Warlords','2021-06-04','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','iOS, Legacy Mobile Device','Real-Time Strategy Game\nAll battles that tak eplace on the map are in real time. You can freely move troops to join or leave a battle, allowing you to use use strategy rather than just simply sending troops and waiting for the battle to end. You can flank enemies, intercept their supplies, or work with allies to surround your enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3e2u.jpg'),(15692,'The Bugs Bunny Crazy Castle','1989-12-31','Platform, Puzzle','Nintendo Entertainment System','The Crazy Castle series is an action-puzzle game series created by Kemco and released on the Famicom Disk System, NES, Game Boy, Game Boy Color and Game Boy Advance. It stars different popular cartoon characters, most notably the Warner Bros. cartoon character, Bugs Bunny, and the Walt Disney cartoon character, Mickey Mouse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b5u.jpg'),(15693,'Centauri Dark','2024-07-16','Shooter, Simulator, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Centauri Dark is a bullet-hell FPS where you fight against wave after wave of mechs in a bid for your own survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cas.jpg'),(15694,'Full Auto 2: Battlelines','2007-03-23','Fighting, Racing','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Portable','Full Auto 2: Battlelines revs up its engines as the next generation of high-speed combat racing. The game is the sequel to the award-winning Full Auto, and this new standard of vehicular mayhem is exclusively available for the PlayStation 3 as a launch title. In Full Auto 2: Battlelines, the once-pleasant districts of Meridian City are turning into battle zones, rife with automotive destruction. Use explosive weapons, high-speed vehicles and skillful technologically-groundbreaking demolition of the environment to defeat your opponents and claim the city as your own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pwz.jpg'),(15695,'Worm Bounce: Worms Jump King','2024-07-20','Adventure','Android','Embark on an epic journey with our fearless bouncy worms heroes as they bounce and escape the treacherous underground, navigating a maze of platforms to reach the surface! But beware, a toxic flood is relentlessly chasing them—can you guide the worms to safety?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kdc.jpg'),(15696,'Affinity','2019-09-19','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Affinity is a relaxing minimalist puzzle game. Gentle music ushering you through handmade geometric brain-teasers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a1d.jpg'),(15697,'Strandzha Adventures 3D','2024-08-14','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Epic Fantasy 3D Platformer Game To Experience The Mystical Mountain of the Ancient Thracians. Inspired by the 3D platformer games of the late ’90s. It is an exciting experience among the amazing nature, ancient sanctuaries and legends of the real Strandzha Mountain in Bulgaria.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nny.jpg'),(15698,'Runehaven','2025-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Runehaven is a voxel-based atmospheric first-person roguelike dungeon crawler. Explore eerie, procedurally generated dungeons, battle vile creatures, solve puzzles, discover hidden secrets, and dodge deadly traps in your quest for survival!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91rz.jpg'),(15699,'Telltale Batman Shadows Edition','2019-12-20','Point-and-click, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Step into the shadows and experience the twisted world of Telltale\'s Batman in a way that brings the fractured persona of the Dark Knight and the City of Gotham to life in a sinister, new way. Enhanced with hand recolored game play and remastered textures, the Telltale Batman Shadows Edition brings all ten Telltale Batman episodes across two seasons into one, complete game while staying true to the spirit of the Dark Knight\'s rich, visually compelling history.\n\nIncludes:\n• Batman: The Telltale Series (Episodes 1-5)\n• Batman: The Enemy Within (Episodes 1-5)\n• Batman Shadows Mode','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v6c.jpg'),(15700,'Epiphany City','2022-04-12','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Epiphany City is a mind-bending puzzle adventure game where you use magical picture frames to manipulate the world around you. Turn paintings to life, change time, & re-imagine objects to suit your needs. Follow Lily, a girl who’s lost all hope, as she steals powers from the strongest superhero, leaving it up to her to save the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30ck.jpg'),(15701,'Labyrinth: The War on Terror','2020-03-12','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Face the global war on terror in this engaging 2 player strategy game. Set against recent world events, Labyrinth portrays the U.S. efforts to counter extremists’ use of terrorist tactics, as well as the wider ideological struggle – guerrilla warfare, fundamentalist rule, regime change and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cgy.jpg'),(15702,'Itorah: Save the World Edition','2022-03-21','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Save the World Edition contains Itorah as well as the official Soundtrack and Artbook.\n\nAssemble Entertainment will donate 10% of the proceeds for every sold Save the World Edition to Survival International in support of indigenous people around the globe!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mex.jpg'),(15703,'God of Weapons','2023-04-24','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a thrilling journey in God of Weapons, an action roguelike where you must ascend the tower of Zhor to reclaim the last light for the world. To survive the monster onslaught on each tower\'s level, you\'ll need to obtain and carefully organize weapons and accessories in your inventory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lwa.jpg'),(15704,'Fishing Sim World: Pro Tour - Talon Fishery',NULL,'Simulator, Sport','Sin plataforma','Talon Fishery is the epitome of a pleasure fishing complex and gives you four separate lakes in one venue. Each contain their own stock of fish and species and are perfect for honing your match and float fishing skills.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15705,'Sugoi Girls: Sexy Steampunk','2025-02-27','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Meet over 50 pretty anime girls in this relaxing puzzle game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hhc.jpg'),(15706,'Konami GB Collection Vol. 4','2000-12-31','Shooter, Platform','Game Boy Color, Game Boy','The Konami GB Collection is a series of video game compilations for the Game Boy Color. The compilations were originally released from 1997 to 1998 in Japan for Game Boy, and were later released in Europe in 2000 for Game Boy Color.\n\nIncluded in Volume 4:\n- Gradius II: The Return of the Hero (Gradius: The Interstellar Assault)\n- Castlevania II: Belmont\'s Revenge\n- Yie Ar Kung-Fu\n- Antarctic Adventure\n\nThis was released as Volume 3 in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i5j.jpg'),(15707,'Donkey Kong 4','2022-11-06','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Imagine if instead of Super Mario Bros., they had created a 4th Donkey Kong game with the same gameplay…\n\nThis game contains a redesigned World 1 and assets from the classic Donkey Kong games, Mario Bros., and Wrecking Crew. Mario must climb the ladder at the end of each level to make it to 1-4 where he must rescue Pauline.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d5u.jpg'),(15708,'Ankh: Anniversary Edition','2015-05-21','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sneak into the pharaoh\'s pyramid and meet up with Assil and his crew of crazy friends. Just as the party starts to get hot, a silly accident turns life upside down! Help Assil reverse the curse!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lj6.jpg'),(15709,'The Other Side','2025-03-07','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a chilling co-op adventure in The Other Side, an action packed horror experience. Customize your gear, strategize with friends, and uncover paranormal mysteries. Are you prepared to face the unknown together in this immersive supernatural experience?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8if8.jpg'),(15710,'Card Adventures','2019-01-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What will happen if you combine card game with RPG? Heroes, allied characters, enemies with loot, different quest, interesting places and even bosses? Meet the Card adventures!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15711,'Tonight We Riot','2020-05-07','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Civil unrest awaits as Tonight We Riot drops players into the boots of everyday working class rebels fighting against the oppression of global capitalism run amok in a dystopian future where the few wealthy elite dominate the entire civilized world.\n\nBetween its solid gameplay, catchy synth music, retro feel, and challenging gameplay, it definitely looks like this is one mob more than ready to put up a spectacular fight.\nThe chaotic mess of action ABSOLUTELY provides some nice catharsis.\nTonight We Riot is the Socialist Revolution You\'re Looking For','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27bt.jpg'),(15712,'Joon Shining','2023-02-17','Platform, Puzzle, Sport, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Joon Shining is a golf-like platformer with a fantasy twist. Combining traditional golf & mini-golf with elements of puzzle platforming, it evolves the hit-and-wait formula of golf by adding magic!\n\nYou play as Joon - a young wizard travelling across the multiverse. As you advance through 8 unique worlds, learn to master your arcane powers to solve weird & mind-bending challenges. Harness your abilities to manipulate physics. Solve puzzles. Discover collectibles. And learn the secret of the Mage Drops…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v1f.jpg'),(15713,'The Sims 4: Get Famous','2019-02-12','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','Reach for the stars and rise to celebrity status with The Sims 4: Get Famous. Build your stardom as you pursue an acting career, become an A-lister, and guide your Sims down the unpredictable path to fame. From the studio lot to VIP parties, you choose how your Sims can gain worldwide acclaim. Customize and show off your celebrity style, and decorate your Sims\' luxury house on the hills with over-the-top accessories like a solid-gold toilet. Get ready to shine bright in the spotlight and live your best celebrity life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zpv.jpg'),(15714,'Battlefield V: Year 2 Edition','2019-10-31','Shooter','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','The best way to join Battlefield V. Experience WW2 as you’ve never seen it before with a vast arsenal, including a catch-up of all weapons and vehicles delivered across year one of the Battlefield V Tides of War Chapters. Stand out on the battlefield with the most popular weapon and vehicle skins released during the year and customize your Company with two Epic soldier outfits. \n \nBattlefield V Year 2 Edition includes the Battlefield V base game and 33 Chapter Reward items released in the game’s first year.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28ji.jpg'),(15715,'Cartels',NULL,'Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Cartels is a tactical hardcore multiplayer first person shooter taking place in 1980s Colombia. Experience a variety of intense objective focused versus and cooperative game modes where a single bullet is often enough to win the fight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ciu.jpg'),(15716,'God Is Not Here','2024-10-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','FREE THRILLING FIRST-PERSON HORROR! You will find yourself in a house haunted by ghosts, and there is no help from above. Fear, darkness, and real danger await you, hidden within the walls of the mansion. If you dare to enter, prayers will no longer save you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oil.jpg'),(15717,'Stretchy-Man: The Video Game',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Stretchy-Man is a physics based puzzle game. Earths mightiest super hero Super-Duper-Man has been captured by the villain Evil-Man, leaving it up to the unlikely hero Stretchy-Man to save the world from destruction. Will you be able to stop Evil-Man before its too late?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5odt.jpg'),(15718,'Wagotabi','2024-10-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Wagotabi is an educational journey that will teach you Japanese from the zero. It relies on a new methodology which prioritizes which Hiragana, Katakana or Kanji you should learn and will help you dive deeper in the language immersion from the very start.\n\nEmbark on this transformative journey through real Japanese prefectures, immersing yourself in the culture, language, and daily life. Connect with locals, navigate new surroundings, and witness the surprises that unfold at every turn. Feel the sense of belonging as you make strides in understanding and interacting with Japan\'s rich environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nc3.jpg'),(15719,'Metal Max 2','2010-07-13','Role-playing (RPG)','Wii, Super Famicom','Metal Max 2 is the second entry in the Metal Max series. It was a vehicle combat RPG published in Japan by Data East for the Super Famicom in 1993. Ten years later, the game was ported to the Game Boy Advance with a few new bounties by Now Production under the title Metal Max 2 Kai. On December 8, 2011, a full remake with upgraded graphics in the vein of Metal Max 3 and using its game engine was released in Japan for the Nintendo DS and titled Metal Max 2 ReLOADED. Metal Max 2 ReLOADED added a shared inventory, option to play as a female, okama or reijin, new character classes, subclasses and skills from Metal Max 3, new characters, bounties, bosses, sidequests, locations, items and vehicles, expanded storyline and backstories of characters and monsters, increased difficulty over the SNES and GBA versions, the final boss of the game has a third form and a new game+ option has been added.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8l0l.jpg'),(15720,'Matcha',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Matcha is a simple puzzle game, built around the beautiful Korean writing system, Hangul.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kqi.jpg'),(15721,'Coco Nutshake','2020-06-23','Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play for score in a 3-stage arcade fashion, getting a coconut milkshake from our girl Latatta to relieve her breasts of all the excess milk.\n\nIf you\'re doing well you might unlock sick shades that change the worlds colors!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wlx.jpg'),(15722,'Root Letter: Last Answer','2019-09-02','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Root Letter: Last Answer implements a live-action “Drama Mode” that faithfully reproduces every location and character that appears in the game with a cast of 90 actors. By realistically reproducing the beautiful scenery of Shimane Prefecture and the people that live there, the human drama story of Root Letter that depicts the youthful regrets everyone holds and those trying to overcome them can be enjoyed as if watching a TV drama.\n\nOf course, the game also includes an “Original Mode” in which you can enjoy the Taro Minoboshi-illustrated versions of the game’s charming characters and scenic beauty of Shimane Prefecture from the previous game. Enjoy the story however you prefer, either with live-action or illustrated visuals!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1l1v.jpg'),(15723,'Magic Carousel','2001-02-01','Puzzle','Intellivision','[Unreleased 1983 Intellivoice] Identify animals on a carousel and follow instructions given throughout the game. \n Score points by doing what the voices tell you: \n  Choose the correct carousel animal. \n  Play a piano. \n  Drink some milk. \n  Answer a telephone. \n Learning game for children. \n 2 different game screens. \n 1 player Intellivoice game. \n \nDEVELOPMENT HISTORY \nMarketing specifically requested a children\'s educational game for the Intellivoice. Programmer Ron Surratt (Atari 2600 BurgerTime) and graphic artist Peggi Decarli (USCF Chess) drew up some initial concepts for the game (Ron\'s input was requested because he used to be a teacher), then Steve Ettinger was assigned as programmer. New-hire Joe Ferreira was added to train with Peggi as a graphics artist. Steve and Joe quickly became a strong design team, taking the concept from a barnyard to a carousel and making the game their own. By the time it was finished, however, Marketing decided that sales of Intellivoice units were too low to support such a \"specialty\" cartridge. Magic Carousel was shelved with the hope that a future increase in Intellivoice sales would justify the game\'s release. It never happened. \n \nSteve and Joe had proved themselves to be a formidable team, so they were chosen to design the top-secret experimental Intellivision game, Hover Force 3-D. \n \nEASTER EGG: Connect the twinkling stars above the carousel on the title screen to get SEE and JAF, Steve and Joe\'s initials.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pfn.jpg'),(15724,'Tales of Maj\'Eyal','2012-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Tales of Maj\'Eyal is a roguelike RPG, featuring tactical turn-based combat and advanced character building. Play as one of many unique races and classes in the lore-filled world of Eyal, exploring random dungeons, facing challenging battles, and developing characters with your own tailored mix of abilities and powers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2iqa.jpg'),(15725,'Neon Phonk Robots','2024-07-23','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game for real phonk fans! Infectious beats, explosions, robots, neon, basses, guns, funk!!! Create your own drone army and tear your enemies to shreds! And of course, turn the volume up to full! After all, these are neon phonk','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jyi.jpg'),(15726,'Arma: Cold War Assault','2017-03-14','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Arma: Cold War Assault, Bohemia Interactive\'s debut game published by Codemasters as Operation Flashpoint in 2001, became genre-defining combat military simulation PC game around the world and has won many international awards\n\nOver 2 million copies of Operation Flashpoint have been sold since its release. Storyline: The horrors of WWIII are imminent. There are clashes over the Malden Islands from dusk to dawn and you are caught in-between. You must use all of the available resources in your arsenal to hold back the incoming darkness. Victor Troska came back to Nogovo, he thought the pain of war was left buried in his past. But his dream lies broken now. His worst nightmare returns when military forces lands near Nogovo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ehe.jpg'),(15727,'Prisoner of Ice','1995-12-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Amid an atmosphere of suspense and intrigue you\'ll launch your voyage in the icy cold wastelands of the Antarctic aboard a Royal Navy submarine - the H.M.S. Victoria. As an American agent of the Office of Naval Intelligence, your mission is to thwart a Nazi plot and recover top secret cargo. Horrific creatures capable of shifting the balance of world power must be conquered. World War II looms ahead and your every move could change the course of history.\n\nAs you journey to the seemingly placid surroundings of a Greek courtyard or the secret gardens of Tihuanica, beware - things are not as they seem. This supernatural action adventure is sure to pique your obsession with horror and espionage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28fd.jpg'),(15728,'Around The World: Travel To Brazil - Collector\'s Edition','2024-03-14','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','An unforgettable vacation in Brazil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9sej.jpg'),(15729,'The Elder Scrolls: Legends - Return to Clockwork City','2017-11-30','Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','In this PvE story expansion, take a trip to the tinkerer god Sotha Sil\'s long-lost sanctuary. In the ruins of the Clockwork City, encounter over 55 new cards, 35 story missions and brand-new mechanics like Treasure Hunt, which peruses each card you draw for the next big score and Assemble, which allows you to rebuild Sotha Sil\'s abandoned creations with your choice of augmented ability!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ymd.jpg'),(15730,'Home From Work 3','2015-09-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You arrive home after a long day at work to your new modern day home. You spent a few days at the home and everything seemed to be normal; but, today, you begin to discover paranormal occurrences. Walking, talking, strange noises and even moving furniture begin to happen more frequently. It is now time to see what evil spirit lurks in the third home in Home from work 3.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5317.jpg'),(15731,'Patient Zero: Day One','2015-06-04','Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','Patient Zero: Day One is a frantic top-down infect-em-up.\n\nThe infection is surging through your body!\nThe pain! The pain!\nYou will succumb within seconds, unless you feed!\n\nRun freely around the city, hunting down fleeing victims. You must bite them to survive, but as you infect them, they too will turn, and also need to feed.\nInfect as many victims as you can and earn Toxins to spend.\nUnlock and equip mutations to change how you play.\nUnlock different zombies to play as.\nEarn rewards for total lifetime infections.\nHow many victims can you infect?\nHow long can you survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dvvpeevdagr8qkiodqxo.jpg'),(15732,'Dawnstar','2013-01-22','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A modern day action based Space Sim/RPG','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qrostef2b9isvxtvhf1j.jpg'),(15733,'Slendergus','2021-07-07','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Run and hide from Impostor amogus in the haunted skeld map! Survive and collect 8 pages to win the game!\n\nPlay in singleplayer or in multiplayer with your friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6k7p.jpg'),(15734,'Spaceship Commander','2018-05-23','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight in space or on the planets, or just travel the universe. Visit cities and buildings, mine resources, trade with or speak to individuals on the planets. Explore and discover. Buy a new ship, fit upgrades, and hire a whole army of crew!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41vv.jpg'),(15735,'Santa\'s Chimney Quest','2024-11-27','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Help Santa to deliver at time','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7got.jpg'),(15736,'Frog Golf','2022-05-16','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tired of games where they never let you play mini golf as a frog? Not even once? Yeah, we were too.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4scc.jpg'),(15737,'Ghost of Catsushina','2025-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ghost of Catsushina - is an action-adventure platformer. The action takes place on the island, when damage penetrates into the jade dream of the guardian spirit, the warrior awakens and sees that his homeland has been destroyed. Set out on a journey to defeat the filth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6z6n.jpg'),(15738,'Shoot Shoot My Waifu','2020-10-12','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Your mission is to search for those 7 sins demons disguised as Waifu\'s in human world. Fighting and confronting beautiful demon bosses. Punish them with holy water. Force them to return to their own form by using pleasuring tools. And collect new photos of their shameful defeat to your album.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co412k.jpg'),(15739,'Destiny 2: Heresy','2025-02-04','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Dreadnaught has returned. Gather your allies and bring order to chaos as shadows gather in the galaxy. Descend into the ship and stem the Taken tide before it overwhelms Earth in the new three-player activity. the Nether.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ju0.jpg'),(15740,'Shadowrun Complete Collection',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15741,'Screencheat','2016-03-01','Shooter, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Screencheat is a chaotic split-screen multiplayer shooter that forces players to rethink the way they approach conventional multiplayer games. In the Screencheat arena, fast reaction times aren’t enough to keep you alive. When everyone is invisible, players will have to master the art of taking a not-so sneaky look at their opponent’s screens and working out where they are based on uniquely coloured areas of the map and distinctive landmarks.\n\nScreencheat pays homage to iconic competitive first-person shooters such as Goldeneye, Perfect Dark and Halo, by blending the elements everyone loves about those games and shaking it up with its own unique take on the genre. When everyone’s used to playing by the rules, can you adapt to unconventional gaming quick enough to get the upper hand?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fdhebb99wjlrxlwuapwo.jpg'),(15742,'Rosemary\'s Fate: Chapter 1',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Put on your headphones and play! The first game of the new genre: Dynamic Audio Games. Explore a mysterious world that constantly surprises you with scenes painted by sounds and music. Learn about events stretched in three time dimensions. Embark on a mission to save your beloved.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yp4.jpg'),(15743,'The Catacombs of Solaris Revisited','2021-02-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The goal of this game is to find your favourite room in the catacombs. \n \nThis is an enhanced version of the beloved 2016 art game The Catacombs of Solaris. It features 8 new visual effects, the ability to load your own images, and built-in screen capture.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2p5v.jpg'),(15744,'Outland Rapture',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Three strangers wake up in a mysterious place and working together without being noticed is the only way to survive all the dangers and return home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k6g.jpg'),(15745,'Naruto: Uzumaki Chronicles','2006-11-16','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 2','Naruto: Uzumaki Chronicles introduces a lush, 3D world that will test the players\' Ninjutsu skills as Naruto, the feisty orphan who wants to become the most respected and admired ninja of all time. A brand new story drives the missions as players experience the trials and tribulations of a ninja-in-training - fierce competition from fellow students and constant challenges from their teachers. Players can collect status-boosting chips and plates to customize all aspects of Naruto\'s abilities and face-off against multiple enemies using either close combat moves or long-range weapons like shurikens and explosive cards. With familiar characters like Kakashi, Sasuke and Neji that can swoop in for assistance, Naruto: Uzumaki Chronicles offers mini-games and lethal attacks straight from the popular anime series to satiate any aspiring ninja.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1oxp.jpg'),(15746,'Deltarune: Chapter 2','2021-09-17','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch 2, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Deltarune: Chapter 2 is the next installment of the sequel to beloved indie darling Undertale...in a different world! This time around, two more classmates join the protagonists in their adventure as they, too, discover a mysterious world hidden behind a door, called the \"Cyber World\".\n\nPlayers with no save data will be able to start right at Chapter 2. “As long as you generally remember what happened story-wise, you’ll be fine,” the developers said in an FAQ.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67ze.jpg'),(15747,'Imperator: Rome - Heirs of Alexander Content Pack','2021-02-16','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Hellenistic kingdoms of the Eastern Mediterranean and Asia take center stage in this Content Pack for Imperator: Rome. ·Unique Missions Trees for Five Nations ·Shared Mission Tree ·Wonder Designer ·New Events ·New Deities ·New Treasures ·New Music','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d0y.jpg'),(15748,'Maya the Bee: Sweet Gold','2002-04-27','Platform','Game Boy Advance','Game Boy Advance game based on the German children\'s book (which in turn spawned a Japanese anime series), Maya the Bee (Die Biene Maja). The game offers 60 different levels in seven graphically different environments, as well as oodles of bonus levels. An overworld map, filled with puzzles and challenges, connects all the levels. Players choose from either Maja (Maya) or Willi. The story involves teacher Kassandra (Cassandra), who is kidnapped by nasty hornets. The evil insects want to trade Kassandra for five pots of honey. Maja and Willi set out to free Kassandra and return order to the hive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vmq.jpg'),(15749,'Thunder Kid','2018-10-22','Shooter, Platform, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Take on the forces of the Robot Empire in this Low-Poly 3D Run \'n\' Gun Action Game!\n\nThunder Kid is a low-poly 3D run ‘n’ gun action game controlled from behind the main character, shifting the perspective of genre classics and adding bullet hell elements while retaining its hallmark features.\n\nAs Thunder Kid, you’ll have to run, jump and shoot your way across colorful and varied 3D environments, from forests and caves to cliffs and cityscapes. Take down enemy bots and massive enemies in a unique blend of retro style','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44n3.jpg'),(15750,'Wizardry Gaiden III: Scripture of the Dark','1993-10-25','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy','Wizardry Gaiden III: Scripture of the Dark is a Role-Playing game, developed by Sir-Tech Software Inc. and published by ASCII Entertainment, which was released in Japan in 1993.\n\nWhile the first two Gaiden games, Wizardry Gaiden: Suffering of the Queen and Wizardry Gaiden II: Curse of the Ancient Emperor, stuck fairly close to each-other and to Wizardry V: Heart of the Maelstrom, Scripture of the Dark started introducing more radical changes to the formula. This was mostly in the form of incorporating elements of Wizardry VI: Bane of the Cosmic Forge, but retaining the core gameplay derived from Wizardry V.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nth.jpg'),(15751,'Tattoo Removal Simulator','2025-09-30','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take on the role of a skilled tattoo removal specialist. Enjoy a soothing pace that lets you focus on the calming process of tattoo removal. Set in a small studio in a bustling city, your all clients share one goal: erasing parts of their past, marked by colorful images, texts, secrets and stories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e5n.jpg'),(15752,'Project Overkill','1996-10-01','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation','The evil Terracom corporation has struck a deal with alien forces to eradicate populated areas on key planets. This initiative has been named Project Overkill. As one of four mercenaries hired to protect the citizens, you must destroy hordes of alien forces while getting to the root of Terracom\'s nefarious purposes. Choose from a demolitions expert, a genetic hybrid, an alien weapons specialist, and a special ops assassin. The action is viewed from an isometric perspective, where your objective is to destroy anything and everything that moves. Spanning over 50 levels (including hidden areas), the game will have you infiltrating research buildings, laboratories, and blood-soaked alien territories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4eqx.jpg'),(15753,'Getaway Shootout','2023-01-30','Racing','Web browser, Android, iOS','Getaway Shootout is a chaotic two-player local multiplayer game where you race three others to the finish line. Your movement is limited, and you can only move by jumping left or right, making the race tricky! Pick up guns and other weapons along the way to use against the others. May the best player win!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dkc.jpg'),(15754,'Panzer Corps 2','2020-03-19','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Panzer Corps 2 is the ultimate Second World War strategy game! Enjoy the time-proven gameplay formula which has been appreciated by millions of players over the years, brought to a whole new level of refinement up to the latest technical standards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xao.jpg'),(15755,'God of War Saga','2012-08-28','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3','The God of War Saga is a collection of five games from the God of War series, and is one of the first in Sony\'s new line of PlayStation Collections.\n\n- God of War\n- God of War II\n- God of War III\n- God of War: Chains of Olympus\n- God of War: Ghost of Sparta','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2enc.jpg'),(15756,'Parfait Fan Box','2000-09-29','Quiz/Trivia, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fandisc for the Parfait saga.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fhh.jpg'),(15757,'A Plague Tale: Requiem - Collector\'s Edition','2022-10-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','The Collector\'s Edition of A Plague Tale: Requiem includes the game, an incredible statue of Amicia and Hugo, and several collector items!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5j21.jpg'),(15758,'A Bird Story','2014-11-07','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A Bird Story is a simple, surreal short about a boy and a bird with a broken wing. Its sole purpose is to tell a story, and can be viewed as a narrative/animation with interactivity -- but without a line of dialogue. It is a standalone game with its own beginning and endings; but for those who\'s played To the Moon, the boy eventually grows up to become the next patient in the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wiy.jpg'),(15759,'Senko no Ronde 2: Limited Edition',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','This edition includes the following:\n- Game: Senko no Ronde 2\n- Senko No Ronde 2 Materials Guide\n- Creation Materials DVD\n- Original Soundtrack CD','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15760,'Myths of Orion: Light from the North','2020-05-21','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Long time ago, in a Realm of Orion, a powerful, but greedy wizard collected knowledge from all around the world. And thus came to write the three Books: books of knowledge, Law and Magic.The books gave him ultimate powers. But, he used them not to prosper, but for chaos! One day the mighty enchantress Salina gathered all of her strength and courage and stole the Books from the Wizard. Under the cover of a night, she took the Books and her child, baby Meredith, and ran far, far away to the North, to her sister Ariel’s house - at the very edge of the world. She could only hope the Wizard wouldn’t find them there. And so, the years and decades passed by... until one day...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hzf.jpg'),(15761,'Super Mario World: A Haunted Christmas','2021-04-12','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','It\'s almost Christmas, but the Big Boo suddenly stole all of Mario\'s presents! Now he has to go through the cold and icy terrain to get them back for Princess Peach...\n\nA Haunted Christmas is a short Super Mario World hack with 1 winter-themed world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pel.jpg'),(15762,'Elf Girl Pinball','2022-11-30','Simulator, Pinball, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','More than just a \"very happy\" pinball game~!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5got.jpg'),(15763,'The Fairly OddParents: Shadow Showdown','2004-09-08','Platform','Game Boy Advance','The Fairly OddParents!: Shadow Showdown is a 3D platformer game based on The Fairly OddParents cartoon. When the TV goes out just as the season finale of Crash Nebula starts, Timmy Turner asks his Fairy Godparents for a little help. When they find their magic is gone, they travel to the Fairy world, where they quickly learn that the Royal jewel is missing and Jorgen von Strangle thinks a recently fired jester is responsible. Now the player is off to uncover the truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6h0o.jpg'),(15764,'Pokémon Anniversary Crystal','2016-04-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Game Boy Color','Pokemon Anniversary Crystal is an extensive ROM hack created for the second anniversary of the Twitch Plays Pokemon stream.\n\nIt contains a new storyline combining parts of Pokemon Red and Pokemon Crystal, with some new elements. The post-game Kanto portion of the original Crystal has been greatly expanded with new quests. The player is able to catch all 251 Pokemon as well.\n\nThe gameplay has also been revamped with elements from later games as well. Physical/Special damage split (with new moves from newer games), Fairy Type, Move Re-Learner, EXP for catching have been included. Original game bugs have been fixed, such as with specialty Poke balls.\n\nOf note is that the game optionally includes an “Advanced AI” hack. However, this will require a special emulator setup to install, as it allows an external script to analyze the player and enemy data to pick smarter moves for the AI. As RHDN does not permit emulator-specific hacks, that variation of the patch will need to be download at the authors’ site, / . The standard version of the hack, which uses the original AI, can be applied and run in any emulator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nlw.jpg'),(15765,'Ohanabatake no Flore','2000-01-28','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The story is about Flore, Parfait and Rinette who are 11 years old and like growing flowers. Grow over 50 different varieties of flowers with them!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fha.jpg'),(15766,'Dragon\'s Lair II: Time Warp','2010-12-20','Adventure, Arcade','Arcade, PlayStation 3, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga, Nintendo DSi','Dragon\'s Lair II: Time Warp, the followup to Don Bluth\'s arcade classic Dragon\'s Lair, can now be enjoyed on your PC. This fully arcade authentic version includes all of the original scenes you\'ve come to enjoy, and even the unreleased Director\'s Cut ending not seen in the arcades. Other bonuses include a full watch feature to sit back and enjoy Don Bluth\'s stunning animation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2y1w.jpg'),(15767,'TaleSpire','2021-04-15','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','TaleSpire is a beautiful way to play pen and paper RPGs online. Bring your stories to life and embark upon campaigns together with your friends, regardless of where you are in the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rjd.jpg'),(15768,'Jigsaw Puzzle: Baby Animals','2023-03-28','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do puzzles in a new puzzle way! Advanced puzzle layout and involving gameplay will help you to relax after a hard-working day. The player can choose to play with 20, 30, or 42 pieces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bg5.jpg'),(15769,'Entrenched',NULL,'Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Entrenched is a Mulitplayer FPS World War 1 inspired arena shooter where you play in many warzones.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sfx.jpg'),(15770,'Moonbreaker','2022-09-29','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Moonbreaker is a turn-based strategy, tabletop tactics game. Designed to be a true digital miniatures experience, set in an expansive sci-fi universe crafted by Brandon Sanderson. Direct Captain & Crew to determine the fate of the Reaches in gripping, ever changing competition & adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co545r.jpg'),(15771,'Alibi: The Dinner Party','2023-08-25','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as a Police Detective investigating a murder at a luxurious villa. When your old friend Jasmine Lee becomes the prime suspect, it\'s up to you to reveal the truth. Navigate a gripping case filled with twists and turns that\'ll leave you guessing until the very end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co709d.jpg'),(15772,'Kamigami no Asobi Ludere Deorum: Unite Edition','2022-01-27','Visual Novel','Nintendo Switch','Gods are an existence that must hold love for humans and be worshiped by humans.\n\nKusanagi Yui, the daughter of a Shinto shrine, happens upon a mysterious sword in her cellar one spring day. The sword\'s power throws her into an unknown world, and it is here she encounters Zeus, the chief god of Greek mythology.\n\nHe informs her that the weak bond between gods and humans is causing a negative impact on the world. To fix this phenomenon, Zeus wants her to go to a school in a garden world he created, live together with the problematic gods, and teach them about what humans are and the meaning of love.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qj3.jpg'),(15773,'Salvation Hours','2024-06-25','Shooter, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Salvation Hours is Single player - First Person Shooter, based on the true story of Benghazi 2012 Attack on American Consulate. Play as one of the GRS Operatives in this slow paced and tactical shooter, developed by one-man development studio \'Wolf Wire Studios\'.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g26.jpg'),(15774,'Catlateral Damage: VR',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Catlateral Damage is a first-person destructive house cat simulator where you play as a cat and knock as much stuff onto the ground as possible. Now with VR support for the HTC Vive!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15775,'Bullet Hell Game Anthology','2025-02-14','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Great news for Bullet Hell fans! We\'ve prepared an anthology of games in your favourite genre from various indie developers! Try out free demo versions of projects that have just recently been released or will be out in the near future!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mfm.jpg'),(15776,'Roots','2021-05-18','Puzzle','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Send your roots deeper and deeper !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aoz.jpg'),(15777,'Wanderer\'s Guide to Ocean and Islands','2024-05-08','Simulator, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Wanderer\'s Guide to Ocean and Islands is a game that combines elements of a walking simulator and a visual novel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86ii.jpg'),(15778,'My Strange Plane is a Thing Body Moves Through','2022-04-24','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Walk among weird objects in a weird place and hear them talk (maybe) about life','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84kx.jpg'),(15779,'Colt Canyon','2020-06-16','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Colt Canyon is a pixel art rogue-lite shooter where you have to save your kidnapped partner from the ruthless bandits. Shoot your way through a hostile canyon full of hidden treasures, weapons, obstacles and all kinds of bloodthirsty scum.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29r7.jpg'),(15780,'Fight desserts','2017-12-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is just another way of fighting life. \n \nToo many annoying things are full of life. \nBut we can still eat a dessert to show our standpoint to life. \nSweet food \nWhat a wonderful thing. \nIt tempts us, \nConsumes our wallet, \nat the same time, \nBrings us happiness and weight gain. \nBut you have a gun ...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bdl.jpg'),(15781,'Penko Park','2020-10-23','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Penko Park is a game about exploring an abandoned wildlife park. Meet its mysterious inhabitants by taking photos and interacting with the world!.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2iuw.jpg'),(15782,'Trapped Girls','2019-02-02','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, iOS','Come rescue the girls who are caught in various cruel traps set up inside a mansion.\n\nRescuing everyone is a very difficult task - and not in the sense that the puzzles are difficult to solve. Rather, doing so will be hard on your soul.\n\nCan you discover the truth among the five different endings?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6olr.jpg'),(15783,'Mandela Invasion II: Disorder',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Sequel to Mandela Invasion from Broken Arrow Games','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mxt.jpg'),(15784,'My Horse & Me','2008-02-05','Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Sport','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo DS','Delivering all the excitement and fun of the equestrian life, from sports and leisure riding to horse care, My Horse and Me is a unique gaming experience for anyone with an interest or passion for horses. The game features the most accurate horse models and animations yet realized in a video game, alongside a richly rewarding game play experience, all set against a beautiful backdrop of charming indoor and outdoor environments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ddby2vnxrdeuvs56eias.jpg'),(15785,'Synth Riders: Remastered Edition','2023-02-22','Music, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation VR2','Let the music move you as you catch notes, ride the rails, and dodge obstacles in the unique physical experience optimized for PlayStation VR2 system!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8e56.jpg'),(15786,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles of Rage','2020-05-24','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','A perfect mashup of two of the most famous beat ‘em up game franchises - Streets of Rage and Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q04.jpg'),(15787,'Killing Floor: Community Weapons Pack 3 - Us Versus Them Total Conflict Pack','2013-10-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Created by the IJC crew from the Killing Floor community, all revenues from this pack are shared with that community team! This is a weapon pack of two halves. We have weapons created by the people, for the people - and you can have a couple of Horzine\'s latest prototype weapons. Try them all out and you decide which is best!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15788,'Guilty Gear Xrd: Rev 2 - Character Colors I-No',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15789,'The Missing Daughter','2019-06-22','Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A missing person, a shady investigation, the mob on your back... Only your deductive skills will allow you to make progress in this difficult case.\n\n\"The Missing Daughter\" is a card-based investigation game made for #AdvJam2019 under 2 weeks. It features a unique mechanic to investigate, gather clues and interrogate people.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ri7.jpg'),(15790,'FIFA Soccer 97','1996-10-01','Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','16-bit version of FIFA 97, also known as Gold Edition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vun.jpg'),(15791,'Metal Max Xeno Reborn: Digital Deluxe Edition','2022-06-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Explore a vast wasteland Traverse the deadly ruins of Tokyo Bay which remains teeming with mechanical beasts hell-bent on hunting humanity to extinction. Travel and battle in a tank or on foot to uncover the mysteries that lay buried beneath the sands.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15792,'Glow Up 2','2024-06-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Glow up the characters for each of the 9 stages, Units are divided into red and blue teams for auto-battle. Click to predict the winning team. If you guess right, you will be able to see the whole of the characters that have been Glow up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y8l.jpg'),(15793,'Rain World','2017-03-28','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Rain World is a survival platformer set in an abandoned industrial environment ravaged by a shattered ecosystem. Bone-crushingly intense rains pound the surface, making life as we know it almost impossible. The creatures in this world hibernate most of the time, but in the few brief dry periods they go out in search of food.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24pm.jpg'),(15794,'Exterminate Zombies: Get Paid','2022-10-10','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Exterminate Zombies: Get Paid (EZGP) is a 4 player co-op top down zombie shooter. Players survive endless waves of enemies with the chance of extraction after a final boss every 30 waves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fyu.jpg'),(15795,'Oxenfree: Director\'s Cut','2016-05-31','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4','Oxenfree \"Director\'s Cut\" Update, brings New Game+, new scenes, endings, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6693.jpg'),(15796,'Fountaintale: Chapter 1',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','One year after the events of UNDERTALE, Monsterkind has been adapting to their new lives on the Surface. The game begins on a very special day, Frisk\'s Birthday! After a very fun party night with their friends and family, Frisk is ready to end the day, though fate still had a gift of their own to give...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8o90.jpg'),(15797,'Doug Huggem','2024-04-01','Simulator','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have to make friends and spread positivity as Doug Huggem!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80e1.jpg'),(15798,'Road Rage Royale','2019-08-02','Fighting, Racing, Tactical, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Road Rage Royale is a racing fighting game for two to four players. Be the \"last man racing\" in a cyberpunk post-apocalyptic demolition derby.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r5y.jpg'),(15799,'Bananaventure','2024-01-22','Platform, Adventure','Web browser','Bananaventure is a small 2d endless platform game with collectable gems and highscore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7npk.jpg'),(15800,'Leisure Suit Larry 5: Passionate Patti Does a Little Undercover Work','2013-01-17','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS, Amiga','Passionate Patti Does a Little Undercover Work! is (despite the number) the fourth game in Al Lowe\'s Leisure Suit Larry series. The middle-aged would-be-womanizer Larry Laffer fell off a boat during a cruise and sustained amnesia, forgetting how he and his sweetheart Patti got separated, how Larry got a job in LA, how Patti got a job with the FBI, and what happened in (the never released) Larry 4. Now Larry and Patti are working independently on two cases that are connected to each other, even though the heroes aren\'t aware of that. Larry\'s new bosses are involved in shady business, while Patti agrees to take a break from her career as a performing pianist and become an undercover agent. Will the two be together ever again?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kch.jpg'),(15801,'Hungry Lamu','2022-06-26','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hungry Lamu is a game about a Lamu in search fruits to fill his stomach, but things started to get scary after the sun goes down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dzm.jpg'),(15802,'Subterranea','1983-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Atari 2600','Subterranea is Imagic\'s entry into the Defender category. Subterranea\'s gameplay is broken into two types of screens. The first is a side view dogfight between your ship and some hapless enemies that are trying to home in on it. Things heat up in the second (and far more common) type of screen, which consists of Defender-style action minus the humanoids. You\'re required to shoot a specific number of aliens, then pass through a gate to the next stage.\n\nLike Defender, aliens come in all shapes and sizes, and have varying attack patterns. Some of them shoot at you, some bounce, but all the action is a far cry faster than Defender. Once all the aliens are destroyed, you must pass through an electro gate that zaps in certain patterns--failing this forces you to repeat the current level without scoring any points. After at least three Defender style screens, it\'s back to the dogfight. Subterranea awards extra lives not by scoring, but by completing stages without being hit. while Subterranea borrows concepts from other games and doesn\'t appear to be very original, there\'s just something about it that keeps you coming back for yet another game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yv6kcdqmiuowwiuyc9pg.jpg'),(15803,'Holomento','2022-04-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Holomento is an indie permadeath RPG focusing on the dangerous quest of passing through the mysterious Eventide Hollow – and rebuilding it step by step.\n\nExplore a hand-crafted open world featuring procedurally generated dungeons!\nFight your way through Eventide Hollow – again and again!\nRebuild the Hollow and release it from its ruinous curse!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qcw.jpg'),(15804,'Farming Simulator 17: Ambassador Edition','2021-12-02','Simulator','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Take on the role of a modern farmer in Farming Simulator 17! Immerse yourself in a huge open world loaded with a harvest of new content. Explore farming possibilities over hundreds of acres of land, including a detailed new North American environment. Drive over 250 authentic farming vehicles and equipment from over 75 manufacturers, including new brands such as Challenger, Fendt, Valtra or Massey Ferguson.\n\nHarvest many types of crops, including for the first time sunflowers and soy beans. Take care of your livestock - cows, sheep, chicken and now pigs - take part in forestry, and sell your products to expand your farm! Transport your goods with trucks and trailers, or load and drive trains to reach your destination. Grow your farm online with other players, and download community created mods for an ever-expanding Farming Simulator experience!\n\nIncluded with this unique package is Farming Simulator 17 plus all of the expansion packs created for the game in-disc! These are:\nPlatinum Expansion\nBig Bud Pack\nRopa Pack\nKuhn Equipment Pack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31co.jpg'),(15805,'Silmar','1990-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','DOS','Silmar is a rogue-like/hack type of RPG, with random generated dungeons, in which you as an adventurer are descending to fight monsters and find treasure. The game was first released for DOS around 1990, with later incarnations running on Windows, Linux and OS/X.\n\nThe DOS version has tile-based graphics, and was split in three parts. The first (Dungeons of Silmar) was distributed as shareware, and the second (An Everpresent Magic) and third (The Forward Terminus) parts were made available with the purchase of the first part.\n\nThe story is that the evil wizard Syrilboltus was defeated in a war with a dwarf country called Gormarundon, but left a cursed magic labyrinth of dungeons under his tower, crawling with monsters, nearby the village Silmarii, which needs to be cleansed and sealed by reaching the bottom of the dungeons. Many adventurers have tried but failed, and now you are to try your luck.\n\nYou choose your character from a list of mixed characters, ranging from werewolves to baseball players (oh, the horror!), and venture forth. As is usual with these games, there is a shop in the village above where you can purchase necessities and sell any treasure you find below. You can reach the shop by using a teleport bead, so there is a quick way out if things get too hot below.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15806,'Guilty Gear Xrd: Rev 2 - Character Colors Axl Low','2017-05-25','Sin género','PlayStation 4','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15807,'Street Fighter V: Zeku',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fji.jpg'),(15808,'Guilty Gear Xrd: Rev 2 - Character Colors Jam Kuradoberi',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15809,'Days of the Divine','2013-04-02','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Long ago, in a valley where a small village lay, two deities fought each other. One was imprisoned, the other vanished. Yet some time ago, an unnatural mist began lingering in the village, dissolving people\'s memories.\n\nBiyu, a young shrine maiden, is now working her hardest in the shrine of one of these deities in the faint hope the mist will one day dissolve. Even though her good friend also lost his memory, not all hope is lost; she meets a stranger who seems to be recovering from his memory loss, and rather quickly as well...\n\n- Description from the games original post on the Lemmasoft forums','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6chd.jpg'),(15810,'60 Minute Marathon 2','2024-08-23','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','60 Minute Marathon 2 is a 74-map MBF21-compatible gigawad made (mostly) in a single hour, just like last time, but with more than twice the friends, including me, @Synami, and new friends @Phoenyx and @OverflowingMocha, twice the \"production quality\" as last time, and even a completely bespoke soundtrack made by Phoenyx! Much like the first 60 Minute Marathon, this was mostly a fairly simple yet somewhat extreme mapping exercise, this time with four mappers all making 16 maps over an hour and deciding to jam them all together at the end alternating between each mapper, with maps only being edited after the designated hour to actually make them possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qhd.jpg'),(15811,'Silver Creek Falls: Chapter 2','2015-09-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','One week after the eerie events occurred in Silver Creek Falls, the sleepy town in North Carolina is hit with yet another tragedy. An FBI agent is brutally murdered in cold blood in his own bedroom. No one knows who did it or why. Only one thing is clear: something truly sinister is broiling in Silver Creek Falls.\n\nPlay as Boston-born detective Sara Fitzgerald, as she continues her investigation of this creepy town and unfurls a plot far more convoluted and intricate than she could ever imagine!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75ac.jpg'),(15812,'Black Gold','2016-07-08','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Have a cold beer with an old friend under the warm Texas stars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2efi.jpg'),(15813,'F-Zero: Maximum Velocity','2011-12-16','Racing','Nintendo 3DS, Wii U, Game Boy Advance','All galactic speed limits are about to be broken! F-Zero Maximum Velocity has arrived, and the future of racing has never looked so sweet. Brand-new vehicles and Game Boy Advance original tracks await, so whether you\'re a Super NES veteran or a race rookies, you\'ll need some practice laps. And even if you do master the Grand Prix circuit, you\'ll still have to beat your friends to the finish line. That\'s right, race fans--with the Game Boy Advance Game Link cable you can take on up to three rival racers, so put the pedal to the metal and get busy boosting, bumping and jumping your way to intergalactic glory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tjw.jpg'),(15814,'Heartful Memories: Little Witch Parfait 2','2000-04-21','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The protagonist, Perky, has only his name to remember, but nothing else in his memory to confirm his true identity. He is found unconscious by Parfait Sucreal near the Crabell Waterfall outside Florelmos. When Parfait allows him to recover in her house and informs him about Florelmos, as well as herself, she takes Perky to the wise witch to see if she knew anything about Perky.\n\nUnfortunately, the wise witch says she is not able to claim his identity but that he owns 500000 gold in return for keeping her keeping his sword for him. Until he collects the money by 6 months, the wise witch tells Parfait to allow Perky to stay in the Black Cat Market.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fhb.jpg'),(15815,'Guilty Gear Xrd: Rev 2 - Character Colors Jack-O\'',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15816,'Monster Prom 3: Monster Roadtrip - Playable Character Zoe','2022-10-21','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','We all love Zoe, don\'t we?\n\nShe\'s passionate about her interests. She\'s horny 24/7. She\'s a lover of many fandoms, always writing a fanfic or drawing fanart. She\'s snarky, chaotic, and ultimately good-hearted. She\'s more than ready to explore her own truth and to be unapologetically herself.\n\nWe love her partly because she\'s like us. We love her partly because she\'s what we\'d like to be.\n\nThat\'s the charm of our beloved and adorkable eldritch cutie.\n\nIn a way, she IS us.\n\nSo maybe... today we can be her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qkm.jpg'),(15817,'Herdyn, Wanna be MaN','2021-07-05','Platform, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','2D platform game with one time saves','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d3d.jpg'),(15818,'Metro Gravity',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore, fight, solve puzzles and bend gravity to escape the dream-like world of the Halls! Metro Gravity is a mind-boggling musical adventure with rhythmic combat and compelling lore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8paj.jpg'),(15819,'Star Wars: The Old Republic - Galactic Strongholds','2014-10-14','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Star Wars: The Old Republic: Galactic Strongholds is the third Digital Expansion for Star Wars: The Old Republic. It gives players the ability to purchase and customize in-game homes, or \"strongholds\", as well as guild capital ships.\n\nAs the war between the Empire and the Republic rages, the galaxy’s greatest heroes have expanded their influence by acquiring Strongholds, customizable bastions of personal luxury. In a bid for power, these heroes must join together to launch their own Guild Flagships and conquer planets across the galaxy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21j7.jpg'),(15820,'Missile Command: Recharged','2020-03-26','Shooter, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Fire missiles to protect your bases! A classic arcade game\'s back and recharged!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m9g.jpg'),(15821,'Soul Room','2019-01-07','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Soul Room is a new type of \"puzzle-solving fantasy adventure\" game. Dr. Reynolds invented a machine to spy on the soul. He didn\'t want to be stolen by a clown. In order to find the clown, Reynolds began to solve mysterious and strange soul rooms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41t6.jpg'),(15822,'Free Ninja','2024-03-23','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Android','Free Ninja: Endless Run is a thrilling endless runner where you dive into the world of ninjas! Choose between the Ninja (male) or Shinobi (female), customize your appearance, and get ready to run through environments filled with obstacles and challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8urp.jpg'),(15823,'Burger Station','2024-11-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As the world is seen through a hungry lens, so does it\'s next victim see what they desire in their very own childish eyes. Burger Station is a tiny, spooky yet cute game about trying to get a single piece of candy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mfl.jpg'),(15824,'Helix Brawl','2020-05-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Helix Brawl is a single-player beat em\' up action game. Make your way enemy by enemy, beating up bosses and unlocking new powers as you go. Go all or nothing to finish each level, making your way from the underground lab to the CEO\'s penthouse, wrecking everyone in your wake!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e66.jpg'),(15825,'Dead Man\'s Country',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dead Man\'s Country is an open-world multiplayer action RPG set in the late 19th century of the American Old West. Face the untamed harshness of the wild in a landscape of vast forests, soaring mountains and desolate plains.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hjd.jpg'),(15826,'Mario Kart 8 Deluxe: Booster Course Pass - Wave 4','2023-03-09','Racing','Nintendo Switch','In Wave 4 of the Mario Kart 8 Deluxe: Booster Course, you will get joined by Birdo as a racer! The pass will also contain 8 tracks, with Yoshi\'s Island being one of them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co607z.jpg'),(15827,'Samurai Aces III: Sengoku Cannon','2022-07-27','Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Fire the Cannon Shot! It\'s the evolution of eccentric Japanese-style shooter! With online rankings!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ckz.jpg'),(15828,'God of Riffs: Battle for the Metalverse','2022-09-20','Music, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','SteamVR','Story mode, new tracks, and tons of improvements!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h5p.jpg'),(15829,'Tap Gun!',NULL,'Arcade','Android, iOS','Players will command their fighters to conduct a final decisive air battle with the enormous enemies in the sky.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15830,'Wizardry 8','2013-09-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The universe is in the throes of violent upheaval and change. Vast and mysterious forces are preparing for the final confrontation. A small group of heroes from distant lands must plunge into the heart of the maelstrom, to uncover long-forgotten secrets, and bring about a new era. Should they succeed, they will gain the powers of the gods themselves. If they fail, countless worlds will fall into the grip of darkness.\n\nWizardry 8 raises the standard for fantasy role-playing with a vengeance. Prepare yourself for a new level of excitement, immersiveness and depth that made role-playing games one of the best-selling, best-loved genres of all time.\n\nPrepare to experience the culmination of a prestigious RPG series. Enter a vast world of intrigue and wonder. Unravel a gripping, non-linear storyline. Battle your way to victory using your swords, your magic, and your wits. Compete with rivals or align with allies as you struggle to ascend to the Cosmic Circle. Take the battle to the dreaded Dark Savant in Wizardry 8, the phenomenal conclusion to the Dark Savant trilogy, one of the most extensive and challenging stories ever told in classic role-playing games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28fv.jpg'),(15831,'SokoBunny','2020-05-22','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','SokoBunny is new fully 3d look at classic sokoban. Play alone or with your friend online, kick the cargo in the warehouse labyrinth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26mi.jpg'),(15832,'Vagrant Moon','2024-05-08','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vagrant Moon is a charming 3D platformer that captures the classic feel and simplicity of PS1-era games. The game invites you on a serene treasure hunt through its vibrant landscapes, where every treasure not only enhances your abilities but also unlocks new areas of the enchanted valley to explore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co855t.jpg'),(15833,'Softporn Adventure','1981-12-31','Puzzle, Adventure','Atari 8-bit, DOS, Apple II','A text based adventure game released in 1981 and has similar content to \"Leisure Suit Larry in the Land of the Lounge Lizards\" developed by Al Lowe which is based on \"Softporn Adventure\". It was ported to PC in 1991 and has also been included in some Leisure Suit Larry Collection editions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j0n.jpg'),(15834,'World War Doh','2020-02-20','Real Time Strategy (RTS)','Android, iOS','Build your army and dominate the competition in World War Doh—an intense, chaotic, and hilarious new Real-Time Strategy game! Play now and Control Your Chaos!\n\nControl your Commander to defeat opponents in challenging PvP card combat battles. Your only goal: to crush someone else’s hopes. Collect and upgrade dozens of unique cards to create the ultimate deck, then take your troops to battle! Do you have what it takes to be the best?\n\nWith tons of strategies to explore, World War Doh will challenge you at every turn! Conquer the world, put your enemies to shame, and assert dominance with your Commander’s epic army!\n\nNetwork connection is required. A love for chaos is optional.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ddl.jpg'),(15835,'Disgaea 3: Absence of Justice','2008-01-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','PlayStation 3','Disgaea 3: Absence of Justice is the third video game in the Disgaea series by Nippon Ichi. The game takes place in a Netherworld school called the Evil Academy. In this demon school, a good student is one who engages in evil activities such as truancy, never showing up to class, and getting in fights with others. Disgaea 3 is a tactical RPG; most of the game involves battles on isometric maps upon which the player controls a group of characters. Maps often feature \"geo blocks\" with statistical effects on the battlefield, that, unlike in previous games, can be stacked or stood upon. Many objects in the environment, including these blocks, and characters themselves, can be lifted, thrown, or destroyed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pxf.jpg'),(15836,'Kids Station: Soreike! Anpanman','2000-09-21','Quiz/Trivia','PlayStation','Soreike Anpanman (written by Takashi Yanase, a Japanese writer of children\'s stories, is one of the most popular anime cartoon series in Japan. It is produced by Nippon Television Network Corporation.\nThe Playstation game is a collection of mini games in witch you control Anpanman in different kind of situations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co896v.jpg'),(15837,'Pako','2014-01-01','Racing, Arcade','Legacy Mobile Device','Pako is a car chase simulator that focuses on you evading cops. The aim of the game is to survive as long as possible without crashing and ending the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/glndkc0cieoqwrlcnzwl.jpg'),(15838,'Hearth\'s Light: Potion Shop','2023-03-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A cozy, casual potion-making and shop-managing game, that is complimented by an array of deep mechanics to keep crafting potions satisfying and interesting regardless of how many times you\'ve done it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68wd.jpg'),(15839,'Soul Saga: Episode 1',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, PlayStation Vita','Soul Saga is a traditional role-playing video game in the vein of the Final Fantasy, Suikoden, Breath of Fire, and Persona video game series. Battles are initiated similarly to Chrono Trigger, where combat begins upon the player directing the character into an enemy in the world map. Once initiated, combat consists of a turn based battle system similar to Final Fantasy X. The game will also have airship battles, similar to Skies of Arcadia.\n\nExploration of the overworld map will also be a major aspect of gameplay, with the player being able to explore on foot similarly to Final Fantasy VII, and by airship similarly to Skies of Arcadia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co296e.jpg'),(15840,'World of Warcraft: Dragonflight','2022-11-28','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The dragonflights of Azeroth have returned, called upon to defend their ancestral home, the Dragon Isles. Surging with elemental magic and the life energies of Azeroth, the Isles are awakening once more, and it\'s up to you to explore their primordial wonder and discover long-forgotten secrets.\nMaster the art of Dragonriding, with a new form of aerial movement, venture into the ancient prison of the Primal Incarnates before their malevolent power can be unleashed against the Dragon Aspects in the new raid.\nFight to reclaim Neltharus, stronghold of the black dragonflight, explore previously unknown chambers of Uldaman, defend the Life Pools of the red dragonflight, and more! In new dungeons!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67z6.jpg'),(15841,'Sneaky Rat','2022-10-22','Puzzle, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Push mirrors, hide behind boxes, don\'t be seen by the cat and get the cheese. In this fun puzzle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l6i.jpg'),(15842,'Impostor Factory','2021-09-30','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A bonkers time-loop tragicomedy murder mystery thriller featuring multiple casualties and a suspicious cat, from the creator of To the Moon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xu5.jpg'),(15843,'Darkness Rises','2018-06-20','Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','Darkness Rises is a revolutionary Action RPG that blends gorgeous graphics, innovative gameplay, and intense boss battles, all within the palm of your hands. \n \nDarkness spreads across the land, bringing with it a horde of ferocious demons ready to breach our gates. An epic fantasy RPG awaits - the path will be grueling, but you must persevere and descend into hell itself to destroy this evil before it ravages our world. \n \nLegendary heroes are at your beck and call, from the earth-shattering Berserker to the magic-wielding Wizard. Character customization lets you choose from a number of classes that fits your playstyle and design your character as you see fit. \n \nHack and slash through fearsome monsters with a flurry of powerful skills. Enter the PvP arena and unleash your might against other players. This Epic roleplaying games pits you against demons and worse– can you rise to the challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m7i.jpg'),(15844,'Try Not to Laugh',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15845,'Valiance Online',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Valiance Online is a Super Hero MMO.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/d9easjwhvfayg33rt9ul.jpg'),(15846,'Mega Man Star Force 2: Zerker x Saurian','2007-11-22','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo DS','Mega Man Star Force 2 blends a unique formula of RPG exploration elements with fast-paced action, as players travel and battle between coexisting worlds, the physical world and the virtual Wave World, to unravel the mystery around this new troublemaker.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bhn.jpg'),(15847,'All My Dreams are the Same!','2023-11-22','Indie','Web browser','A short interactive story about artistic sensibilities, dreams, and the real world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ecs.jpg'),(15848,'The Smurfs 2: The Prisoner of the Green Stone','2023-11-02','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','With your crack team and the help of the SmurfoMix, liberate the village of the Smurfs from the grip of the Green Stone!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cc1.jpg'),(15849,'The Mysterious Case of Dr. Jekyll & Mr. Hyde','2021-04-08','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','After a respected member of Parliament is found murdered, it\'s up to you in this suspenseful Hidden Object game to search for the killer, the notorious Mr. Hyde!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20ml.jpg'),(15850,'MiniPoly.io',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','MiniPoly.io is a movement-based first person shooter game with a lot of weapons, skins and customisation','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pzn.jpg'),(15851,'Kamigami no Asobi InFinite','2016-04-21','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable','Kamigami no Asobi InFinite, abbreviated as KamiAso IF, is a Japanese otome game published by Broccoli (company). It was released in Japan on April 21, 2016 for the PlayStation Portable and PlayStation Vita.\n\nInFinite shares the same premise as the first game, with new routes and new endings for the characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lsn.jpg'),(15852,'The Serpent','2014-04-30','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15853,'SnowDown',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15854,'Catlateral Damage','2016-06-13','Shooter, Simulator, Indie','PlayStation 4, Ouya, Linux, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Mac','Catlateral Damage is a first-person destructive cat simulator where you play as a cat on a rampage, knocking as much stuff onto the ground as possible. See the world through the eyes of a cat! Like other first-person games, you can walk and look around, jump, and crouch. Unlike other first-person games, your primary weapons are your two cat paws, which you can use to swipe at and knock objects onto the floor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2po5.jpg'),(15855,'Realms of Arkania: Star Trail','1994-09-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','Welcome to the world of Arkania from the same company responsible for the Ultima titles, Sir-tech Software, Inc.. You and a party of adventurers have the fate of the kingdom squarely on your collective shoulders in this role-playing excursion into a fantasy-based realm filled with a powerful army of Orcs aiming to devastate Arkania.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jkm.jpg'),(15856,'That Smiling Game','2020-03-08','Point-and-click, Indie','Web browser','What can we eliminate from our life to make it better?\n\nA short point-and-click game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4srp.jpg'),(15857,'Rosa\'s Garden','2019-03-08','Adventure','iOS','A calm gardening game.\n\nRosas Garden is a calm and poetic flower game about gardening with roses. Dig little holes in the ground, find seeds, plant them and watch how slowly a rose grows. By combining fully blossomed roses, you can breed new seeds. There are over 40 combinations available and each rose is named after a famous women, paying a small tribute to their lives and achievements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8e65.jpg'),(15858,'Wonfourn','2018-06-15','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','Wonfourn challenges you to fulfill your destiny by embarking on a grand adventure seeking fame, fortune and glory. The firstborn chosen child from each of the games 6 nations have come of age and must prove their worth in an epic quest of survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8drw.jpg'),(15859,'Big Babies: Instructions',NULL,'Quiz/Trivia','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94n7.jpg'),(15860,'Toraware no Palm','2019-08-30','Visual Novel','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','A otome game by Capcom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g15.jpg'),(15861,'Big Babies: Argument',NULL,'Quiz/Trivia','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94n8.jpg'),(15862,'Corporeal',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A paranormal mystery where you piece together a haunted family photo album. As the sole survivor of unexplained events in the 1990s, search for answers in an archive of photos rescued from the ruins of your childhood home, manipulate the past, encounter specters & map your cursed family history.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co901l.jpg'),(15863,'Impossible Maze','2020-07-17','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Impossible Maze is a minimalist puzzle game. You may have heard the word \"impossible triangle\", which is a triangle intepreted as a single solid object by our visial system, but cannot exist as one in real life. \nIn this game, you will manipulate a cube through a \"impossible maze\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dlg.jpg'),(15864,'Lucid Cycle','2021-10-27','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Lucid Cycle offers a set of short but unique experiences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45i2.jpg'),(15865,'Density Limit',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the Unspace. Not gonna lie, it’s a little scary there, but it’s very attractive for scientists and kind of mysterious as well. But what is the limit of this space? What happened here and why does it even exist? Your mission will be to solve this case.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bh2.jpg'),(15866,'Map','2021-08-10','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','1+ minute box game\n\nMap is a game about exploring spaces while phasing through walls and boundaries that lead to new places with different scales.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6of5.jpg'),(15867,'Rogue Star Rescue','2022-06-15','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Bullet Hell Insanity + Tower Defense Strategy. Rogue Star Rescue is a quirky new type of rogue-like shooter. Blast your way through diverse planets while rescuing your teammates and gathering traps for your defense strategy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qrs.jpg'),(15868,'Ailment','2020-05-27','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ailment is a pixel-art action game which takes place on a spaceship in a far far galaxy. The main character wakes up in a spaceship after being unconscious for three days and all of his crew became enemies. The last thing he remembers was returning from the other ship where he had a rescue mission. But everyone on that ship was already dead... He has to remember what happened and find out the truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l7v.jpg'),(15869,'Mole Gem Mayhem',NULL,'Puzzle','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co827s.jpg'),(15870,'Tomb Raider: The Kurtis Trent Chronicles - Chapter 1','2020-09-12','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It is the late 1990s. Former legionnaire Kurtis Trent now operates as a freelance mercenary. His specialism: the supernatural.\n\nFollowing a series of mysterious deaths after the discovery of a medieval shrine deep beneath a Welsh mine, Kurtis has been hired to find whatever otherworldly force is wreaking havoc, and take care of it. Little does he know that what he is about to stumble upon will lead him down a dangerous path, one of ancient cults and arcane knowledge, that will bring him face-to-face with demons from his own past, and ultimately, into a battle for the very survival of mankind...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ret.jpg'),(15871,'TO4: Tactical Operations','2019-12-19','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','TO4: Tactical Operations brings back those nostalgic feelings you know from the early days of online shooters. We love that sheer easy-to-learn-hard-to-master attitude. The fun of playing with friends in a game where you need tactics, ammo clips, bravery and perhaps a bit of luck.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uvo.jpg'),(15872,'Strongest Solider Training System: Heavy Firepower de Isekai Musou',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Sin plataforma','Strongest Soilder Training System ~heavy firepower de ISEKAI Musou~ is a top-down arena ROGUELITE game. The mysterious ball of light that suddenly appeared, and the 『Shop』. Purchase props and weapons from the 「Shop」 to strengthen yourself. Defeat slimes, orcs, and even dragons!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co881i.jpg'),(15873,'3D Kaleidoscope: Baby Universe','1998-10-08','Music, Simulator','PlayStation','Baby Universe is an experiment in visuals. It consists of different worlds with digital kaleidoscopes. One of them, a 3D Kaleidoscope, is floating in space. You create visual effects by pressing buttons on the controller, to turn the different axes, bend and reflect light, and change the angle, with different background patterns. All your actions can be recorded and saved.\n\nIn the jewel case, you select the objects to appear on the screen, and in the console, you can edit each individual item. This includes colour mapping of the surface, movement patterns and frame rate. Settings can be saved on a memory card. In the soundscape, you can insert your own CDs, and sound wave patterns will appear to accompany the music. There is also a traditional (electric) and a psychedelic kaleidoscope available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30cb.jpg'),(15874,'The Clockwork Man 2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15875,'Prinny Presents: NIS Classics Vol 1','2021-08-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','For the first time ever, both Phantom Brave and Soul Nomad & the World Eaters are coming to Nintendo Switch! New and old fans alike can experience two classic titles from the NIS vault of RPG hits, complete with unique gameplay mechanics, memorable characters, up-scaled artwork, and all DLC from the original releases!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30my.jpg'),(15876,'Clid the Snail','2021-08-30','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A dark fable about a grumpy humanoid snail armed to the teeth. A Top-Down Shooter focused on narrative and a mindful combat system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wx4.jpg'),(15877,'SM64DS: The Adventurous Journey',NULL,'Platform','Nintendo DS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tb5.jpg'),(15878,'Tornado: Research and Rescue','2023-05-29','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get ready for non-stop action with Tornado: Research and Rescue! Chase down violent tornadoes using 90\'s style doppler radar, deploy scientific probes, and earn money to upgrade your equipment. Enjoy a unique experience with procedurally generated tornadoes and scenarios!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hwl.jpg'),(15879,'Reptilian Rising',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The timeline and everyone in it is under siege! Confront the Reptilian Rising in this 80\'s tabletop-styled game of squad tactics. Bring retro miniatures to life on battlefields across time. Fight against The Ouroboros through seven time periods, recruit the best of humanity\'s heroes, and upgrade your favorites for the fight ahead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yfp.jpg'),(15880,'Universe Sandbox','2015-08-24','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Create and destroy on an unimaginable scale... with a space simulator that merges real-time gravity, climate, collision, and material interactions to reveal the beauty of our universe and the fragility of our planet. Includes VR support for HTC Vive, Oculus Rift+Touch, and Windows Mixed Reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pt8.jpg'),(15881,'Rezarus','2024-03-18','Shooter, Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rezarus is a futuristic online tank game inspired by an old world game called Tanarus. Multiplayer tank battles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97rb.jpg'),(15882,'ViewSelect the Game','2020-11-25','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ViewSelect The Game is a html5 MMO game developed by Team ViewSelect','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ks2.jpg'),(15883,'Eternal Quest','2020-03-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','MMORPG with fast gameplay, open world, PVP, BOSS, quests, craft, skins and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qe6.jpg'),(15884,'Kiteboarding Pro','2021-12-08','Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Race against the clock in time trials, beat that ultimate high score in freestyle or go BIG with massive jumps in freeride mode. From wakestyle to oldschool to kiteloops to wave riding - in Kiteboarding Pro the sky isn\'t the limit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bep.jpg'),(15885,'Maimai DX Festival','2023-01-19','Music, Arcade','Arcade','maimai Deluxe FESTiVAL is the fourth entry of the Maimai Deluxe series, successor of the maimai series. The game is played using touch screen or buttons on a large cabinet with a circular screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67ey.jpg'),(15886,'Xeno Crisis','2021-10-01','Shooter, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, Neo Geo MVS, PlayStation 4, Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Nintendo GameCube, Linux, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Nintendo 64, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, PlayStation Vita, Neo Geo CD, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch, Dreamcast','Xeno Crisis is an arena shooter in which one or two players take control of battle-hardened marines embarking on a deadly mission to confront an alien menace and get home alive! Run and gun your way through thousands of adversaries as you explore the devastated research outpost, searching for survivors, and ultimately facing the origin of the outpost\'s demise. Outpost 88 is divided into seven distinct areas, each being randomly generated with each play, meaning that your strategy must evolve on the fly if you\'re to succeed in your mission. Collect dog-tags from vanquished enemies to upgrade your equipment between areas and look out for special weapons which will give you a momentary advantage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uh0.jpg'),(15887,'Silhouette','2023-01-26','Puzzle, Adventure','Meta Quest 2','Silhouette is a cozy puzzle VR game that tasks the player with helping little shadow creatures (the Shadowies) through 28 puzzles. It uses hand tracking (no controllers) to let you cast shadows, manipulate the Shadowie\'s environment and interact with objects.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6262.jpg'),(15888,'Fallen London: A Devil\'s Due','2022-10-25','Sin género','Web browser','This is a DLC for the game Fallen London. It is part of the Exceptional Stories, a monthly release of new stories that are available for subscribers (Exceptional Friends) for free, and available for purchase afterwards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co621d.jpg'),(15889,'Black Ido','2021-02-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Now I can change the gravity, it opens up incredible possibilities. Does this really work in the AVA world? Have we really achieved the impossible?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mbs.jpg'),(15890,'Moon','2021-12-15','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Have you ever felt it odd that the heroes of RPGs go around opening villagers\' closets and stealing from them? Or that they travel the world indiscriminately killing all monsters they meet? This game looks at the RPGs we all know and love from a new perspective. An RPG without combat! Gather love to level up! Characters with their own lives and routines! Save the spirits of the murdered monsters: soul catch! Choose your own music with the Moon Disc system!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ou5.jpg'),(15891,'Tombs & Treasure','1986-10-01','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC-9800 Series, PC-8800 Series, Sharp X1, FM-7, MSX2','In Tombs & Treasure, you\'ll have to use your wits in order for your party to successfully make its way through the ruins. As you enter such sites as El Castillo and the Ball Court, you\'ll have to use collected items in innovative ways in order to attain vital clues and progress. Each screen you encounter will feature items and peculiarities that must been looked at, taken, pushed, pulled, moved, smashed, joined, and/or washed in order to advance. Occasionally, you will confront monsters and engage in a classic RPG-style fight, your final battle versus the demon Tentacula. Be sure to refer to Professor Imes\' journal in order to gain essential clues. You\'ll need them in order to survive the Tombs & Treasure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jzt.jpg'),(15892,'Tavernacle!','2023-09-11','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grab your hammers and start to craft in this co-op Tavern Defense for one to four players. As a team of Dwarves, you must gather supplies and build towers to protect your beloved brewery. Explore the world and learn to cooperate to achieve victory in this chaotic multiplayer game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5eg9.jpg'),(15893,'Reality Runner','2017-09-19','Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','Reality Runner is an endless, side-scrolling game in which the player directs a spaceship though an obstacle filled, imaginary world. Press and hold to raise the ship and release to lower in order to avoid obstacles or position yourself to shoot obstacles. Purchase ammo and more powerful spaceships in the store with Creative Juices found throughout the alien planet or earned by completing missions and watching videos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27ws.jpg'),(15894,'Burger Wars','2024-10-24','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The clicker game that wanted to be an RPG','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mfo.jpg'),(15895,'XIII','2022-09-13','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A remake of the XIII game from 2003. The game is a first-person shooter where you play as Thirteen, a talented soldier who lost his memory and has been accused of killing the President of the United States. You first wake up injured and amnesic on Brighton Beach with the only clue being a small key and a mysterious tattoo XIII next to your clavicle. It’s now your job to search for answers through a 34 levels solo campaign. Don’t worry, you will find the appropriate weapon arsenal along the way. With questions not missing, neither are the bullets!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53sn.jpg'),(15896,'Super Amazing Wagon Adventure','2013-10-17','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Super Amazing Wagon Adventure is a fast-paced 2d shooting game with a random story. You control a group of three migrants traveling west along a wagon trail. The game consists of short scenes that are sequenced together in a semi-random way to tell a crazy adventure story. One minute you could be massacring a herd of buffalo, the next attacked by eagles while falling off a cliff.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co882h.jpg'),(15897,'BM Love Cafe',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15898,'Alien Egg: Ascent','2023-01-17','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jump your way into outer space to help a lost alien egg find its way back to its homeworld!\n\nTake on the role of a mysterious egg awakening in an abandoned laboratory, leaping through challenging terrain and over a diverse array of obstacles in order to find a portal back home. Traverse upward through several different environments, including the abandoned lab itself and exotic alien landscapes, but beware: one wrong move could spell a mighty fall!\n\nGather your wit and determination, and be ready to get back up again when you\'re knocked down - Ascend!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ujt.jpg'),(15899,'Dracula: Vampires vs. Zombies','2017-08-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hordes of zombies and vampires prowl the city, looking for the last surviving humans. It’s a competition: who will get the last man standing. They don’t expect this man to be the most badass B-movie star Chuck Steelballz. Standing upon his trailer he’s going to deliver JUSTICE with his bow and arrows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2awo.jpg'),(15900,'Ertha',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Ertha is an economic, social MMORPG, designed to replicate a real-life environment, simulating the actions that people have to perform to earn a living. Explore and dominate the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rnm.jpg'),(15901,'Gekibo 2','2001-05-31','Fighting','PlayStation 2','Gekibo 2 is the sequel to Gekisha Boy. It is a fast-paced side-scrolling game where the player controls the junior photographer Pete Goldman working for the newspaper Planet Times in Japan. In each stage the goal is to photograph as many weird or funny situations as they occur in the environment while the screen scrolls to the right automatically. The player has minor control over the character\'s movement as the focus is on moving the cursor used to snap pictures. It is possible to capture any part of the environment and pictures are lined up in the bottom right side of the screen. Correctly captured gags and unusual situations remain there, while the others fly away and are discarded. A score is built up based on the performance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z8r.jpg'),(15902,'Robot Trivia Funtime','2024-05-26','Quiz/Trivia, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Robot Trivia Funtime is a multiplayer trivia game for PC, with a built-in question pack editor and Workshop support. It supports up to 6 other players on Steam and includes optional AI bots to play against.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wh6.jpg'),(15903,'Face Your Fears 2','2019-05-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Oculus Rift, Oculus Quest','Face Your Fears 2 is a survival horror game. You are presented with two scenarios that focus on the mysterious Harvest House and Harvest Familly. The game highlights specific fears in each chapter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c7y.jpg'),(15904,'Princess Crown','2020-01-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, Sega Saturn, PlayStation Portable','You play as the thirteen-year-old princess Gradriel, the daughter of Elfrenne, queen of Valendria. Twenty-five years ago Elfrenne destroyed the demonic forces that were threatening the country. Now the queen has died, and Gradriel is proclaimed to be the future savior of the land, as it was not entirely purged of all evil. And indeed, an evil spirit has secretly invaded Valendria and is trying to take control over Gradriel\'s two older sisters. Will the young princess succeed in defeating the evil?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gbf.jpg'),(15905,'Colin McRae Rally 3','2003-04-22','Racing, Sport','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','You are given 3 seasons to win the world rally championship, racing the Ford Focus RS RWC. In each season there are 8 competitions, staged in Australia, the USA, England, Sweden, Japan, Greece and Finland. Each competition has 6 stages set around different landscapes, and a special head-to-head stage at the end. You are out to beat the clock, and the time set by the opposing teams, on each occasion. Beat the time, win the stage, and you are once step closer to taking the world title.\n\nAlong the way you can alter and modify the Focus\' setup, from the wheels used, gearboxes, brakes, suspension and so forth. You can also test drive the car before any event to make sure the setup is to your liking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1otn.jpg'),(15906,'Dragon Fantasy: The Black Tome of Ice','2016-05-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Wii U','Join Ogden and the heroes of Westeria in this classic JRPG epic, Dragon Fantasy: The Black Tome of Ice. Travel through the frozen wastelands of Tundaria and defeat oncoming hordes of demons and huge bosses that threaten the entire world of Dragon Fantasy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wu5.jpg'),(15907,'Seers Isle','2020-10-14','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Seers Isle is a narrative game, set in a fantasy version of medieval northern Europe, where your choices impact the fate of a group of characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tjv1rswnyer2mutrxejt.jpg'),(15908,'DJMax Technika','2008-10-31','Music','Arcade','Pentavision\'s first arcade music game features Ouendan-style gameplay using a touchscreen HDTV. It was first released in South Korea in 2008, followed by a worldwide release the following year.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bqd6p5uggqwndgmqxbzv.jpg'),(15909,'Overnight Tea','2022-02-11','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','“Evening tea carries the scent of death.”\n\nA girl calling herself your girlfriend appears in front of you, who has no memory.\nAlthough you\'re meant to have a good relationship with her, gradually her true nature is revealed...?! Uncover her true motives!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qh9.jpg'),(15910,'Parking Pro: Top-Down Challenge','2025-03-01','Puzzle, Racing, Simulator, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15911,'End Chess Arrow','2025-03-15','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It seems like Chinese Chess, but perhaps you can hold the entire game with just a crossbow. A strategy-based turn-based roguelike game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nqq.jpg'),(15912,'Godzilla','1993-12-31','Fighting, Arcade','Arcade','Godzilla is an arcade game developed by Banpresto and released to Japanese arcades in 1993.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6amw.jpg'),(15913,'The Witch of Erast',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15914,'Smash \'n Dab','2018-12-15','Music, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Dad’s gotta impress a squad of rowdy teens with his sick dance moves!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15915,'Konami Wai-wai World','1988-01-14','Platform','Family Computer','A difficult platformer with characters from the Konami world. You can play with Simon Belmont, Moai, Kong, Goemon, and others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wao.jpg'),(15916,'Dishonored: Death of the Outsider Deluxe Bundle','2017-09-15','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Get the ultimate Supernatural Assassin experience with the Dishonored: Death of the Outsider Deluxe Bundle.\n\nThis bundle includes:\n• Dishonored 2 Base Game\n• Dishonored: Death of the Outsider\n• The Imperial Assassins Pack\n\nFrom the award-winning developers at Arkane Studios comes Dishonored: Death of the Outsider, the first standalone adventure in the critically-acclaimed Dishonored series. Be a badass supernatural assassin and take on the role of notorious Billie Lurk as she reunites with her mentor Daud in order to pull off the greatest assassination ever conceived. Building upon Dishonored 2’s signature gameplay and art style, Death of the Outsider features all the series hallmarks, including brutal combat systems, unique level design, and immersive storytelling that responds to your every choice. With compelling characters and exhilarating action, Death of the Outsider is the perfect entry point for those new to the Dishonored series, while delivering a significant expansion of the gameplay and world for longtime fans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30kw.jpg'),(15917,'Psikyo Shooting Stars Alpha','2019-07-25','Shooter, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','STRIKERS 1945, STRIKERS 1945 II, STRIKERS 1945 III, SOL DIVIDE, Dragon Blaze, and ZERO GUNNER 2 combine forces in one arcade collection! Bring the arcade home by blasting through these shooters vertically in the popular ‘TATE’ mode for the ultimate shoot-em-up experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1od5.jpg'),(15918,'Versus',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15919,'West Fantasy',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Western Fantasy is an independent game based on cowboys and post-modern science fiction. The story takes place in A.D2573, players will play the protagonist \"River*Clint\" and embark on exciting adventures in the overhead world called the western continent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zmw.jpg'),(15920,'Helix Ball',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15921,'Chell\'s Way to Home','2012-12-31','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','What you would do, if everything seems to be over and you are still alive? We are pretty sure you\'d like to come home. The story takes place in Half-Life universe, after being a lab rat and death of mental ai system, you should make your way in the wake of last alive members of \"Aperture Transport Systems\", subdivision of \"Aperture Science\". They\'re barricaded in Institute Campus, which is located on volcanic island. However, after a while the portal storm has begun, which brought Combines, Headcrabs and Antlions...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co939c.jpg'),(15922,'The Longing','2020-03-05','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','In utter loneliness, miles below the surface, it is your task to... wait. For 400 days... in real-time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wkm.jpg'),(15923,'Cold Abyss','2023-11-06','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cold Abyss is a relaxing and atmospheric exploration game where you repair internet cables on the bottom of the ocean. There are no enemies or other forms of danger down there. Just you. The perfect game to unwind after a long day.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7chp.jpg'),(15924,'TankBlitz','2017-04-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','TankBlitz is a brutal run and gun tank game with four playable tanks, each having access to four unique weapons and dozens of upgrades. You blast your way through twelve handcrafted levels crawling with over 50 different kinds of enemies, and numerous challenging bossfights.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15925,'Drift Stage','2023-01-13','Racing, Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Drift Stage is an upcoming arcade racer with a late 80\'s art style. It will feature a selection of cars inspired by the 70\'s, 80\'s and 90\'s. Like the name suggests, the drifting is a big part of the driving gameplay and is described by the developers as \"easy to learn, hard to master\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t6f.jpg'),(15926,'Broken Bots','2016-06-08','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Bestow double fire rate to your comrade or bastardize your enemy with reverse controls! Broken Bots is arcade style multiplayer robot warfare where players dish out power-ups to teammates & glitches to foes. Customize weapons, passives, & skills then battle it out in Capture The Flag, Team Deathmatch, & King Of The Hill!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1n08.jpg'),(15927,'Tilt to Live','2011-01-06','Indie, Arcade','iOS','How do you play Tilt to Live? Just pick that bad boy up and tilt. Tilt for your life! Lure relentless red foes over to a handy nuke orb, then ram it and blow the bajeezes out of them. Think you can exterminate your enemies faster than they can multiply? Think again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kg9.jpg'),(15928,'Synaxarion: Great Martyr Theodore the Tyro','2024-06-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Holy Great Martyr Theodore the Tyro (or Theodore the Recruit) lived in the early 300s. This Synaxarion will step through his story as it is known today.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8r7r.jpg'),(15929,'Whale Captain','2024-04-09','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on your Dream Adventure: Discover uncharted lands, master the waves, and soar the skies! A challenging shoot-em-up bullet dodging game with a dash of side-scrolling platformer featuring a crew with hearts of gold at the ready, awaiting their Whale Captain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80h1.jpg'),(15930,'Bolt\'n\'Punch','2024-03-01','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Exploring a disarrayed food factory, play as Lyft and fight your way through this chaos using powerful abilities. Face off against relentless robots and bring them to pieces. There’s only one option left to stop them; Destroy them, throw them, PUNCH \'EM!\n\nFood for Thought strives to deliver the best food products to the common people, but when its robot workers turn against Lyft, the last human in the factory, she has to step up and punch some steel. Uncover the truth behind this attack, find your boss for answers, and put an end to this with style and power.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7t58.jpg'),(15931,'Cats','2024-05-21','Point-and-click, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cats — and that says it all. Interactive cat clicker. Click on cats for new cats. That\'s all, really.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c3w.jpg'),(15932,'Dice World',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Dice World is a turn-based roguelike game. Create your own party by combining skills with character. You need dice to use skills, but you also need strategic dice choices depending on the situation. Collect relics and enhance your skills to defeat your enemies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jil.jpg'),(15933,'Glide','2019-07-12','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Glide is a casual experience about flying through canyon based landscapes and architectural structures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2y0m.jpg'),(15934,'Outlast: Whistleblower','2014-05-06','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Whistleblower starts the story that led to Outlast, and stretches past the events of the first game to show the true final chapter in the story of Mount Massive Asylum.\nOutlast: Whistleblower follows the story of Waylon Park, the software engineer under contract with the Murkoff Corporation who emails journalists around the world - including Miles Upshur - at the beginning of Outlast.\n\nYou\'ll meet Waylon a few weeks into his time at Mount Massive, during which he has been unable to even contact his wife and son thanks to strict security protocols. Having developed a deep-seated distrust of the profit-motivated scientists and doctors leading dangerous and irresponsible experiments on their patients, Waylon ends up setting events in motion that lead to the unmasking of Mount Massive\'s rotten core.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jjc.jpg'),(15935,'Elizord\'s Tale','2023-05-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a first-person horror game with jumpscares that tells the tale of the character Elizord who gained a power to take revenge on everyone who mocked him in his kingdom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j4h.jpg'),(15936,'Impavidvm','2023-05-08','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Impavidvm is a physics based platformer with puzzle solving components where you have to overcome increasingly complex obstacles, testing your abilities and observation skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43iq.jpg'),(15937,'Cat\'s Request','2023-08-08','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Cat\'s Request is a fantastic point-and-click adventure in which you play as Ash the alien cat and his virtual assistant.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7goi.jpg'),(15938,'Eerie Mountain','2022-03-29','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are playing as a forest ranger that is going to investigate a sudden missing family on the Eerie Mountain.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15939,'Bombergrounds: Classic',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15940,'Nice to NO you','2020-10-01','Point-and-click, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Delete the memories of humans in \"Nice to NO you\" - a dystopian dialogue game where you decide the fate of individuals and the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hjv.jpg'),(15941,'Honkai: Star Rail - Then Wake to Weep','2024-05-08','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Version 2.2 of Honkai: Star Rail, which includes:\n• New characters: Robin and Boothill\n• New Trailblaze mission: The Fool Always Rings Twice\n• New areas: Dreamflux Reef, Soulglad Festivity Auditions and Penacony Grand Theater\n• New quality of life updates\n• New main event: Clockie Dreamjoy Memoir\n• …and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84w1.jpg'),(15942,'Whip! Whip!','2018-06-14','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Tira the dessert hunter explores ruins to uncover the recipe required to revive a dessert from ages past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rve.jpg'),(15943,'Tontie ver.0','2004-03-26','Arcade','Web browser','This is a kind of evolved whack-a-mole game.\nah, a kind of action game or like that.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kar.jpg'),(15944,'Smooth Like Butter','2020-07-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Smooth Like Butter is a contemplative action sitcom sandbox game. Take control of the bacon and move smoothly throughout his home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gny.jpg'),(15945,'The Dusk Alliance','2023-05-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Dusk Alliance is a 1-4-player coop Action/Investigation horror game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jak.jpg'),(15946,'Super Pionero','2019-01-07','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Android','Join Maxi and the other pioneers in the fantastic adventures of being an Explorer of the King. Where you should perform challenging actions and searches to collect as many stars as possible. But, I will not be so easy, you will be challenged by insects, snakes, arachnids, worms, bats and even the same evil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90u4.jpg'),(15947,'Crackinho Beat\' em up in the World',NULL,'Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Crackinho is a game inspired by classic 90\'s Beat \'em up games like Streets of Rage, Final Fight, Battletoads, River City Ransom, among others.\n\nAlthough inspired by theses games, ours is a fresh and modern take on this Genre. Crackinho Beat\' em Up is quite different, because besides the classic brawling, it adds a lot of special attacks and variations for the same strike.\n\nThe scenario was 100% made by us, the concepts, 3D models and textures. The traditional 2D animations, inspired by Cuphead, gives it a pinch of charm to the game.\n\nWe\'re also planning to launch the multiplayer version and online co-op.\n\nAs you explore the game, you\'ll unlock new features for customize the character\nsuch as hats, clothes, toys, visual aspects and special attacks.\nThe more you go further the funnier it will become!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15948,'Groceries and JumpScares','2023-05-13','Simulator, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Can you survive the horrors of retail? You are the newest \"employee\" under contract at the local Soke Co Groceries Store. Manage the amount of stock daily to try to satisfy the on slot of customers. Mark the price up on products to make more profit and buy more stock. All while quelling the hunger of the thing that lurks in the basement. Try to survive and remember the Soke Co Groceries motto. Try Not To Get Eaten!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s1l.jpg'),(15949,'KanjiMemory','2024-03-28','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Increase your grasp of Japanese kanji character readings by playing rounds of classic Memory game where you try to find and match kanji and their readings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7z2j.jpg'),(15950,'Nibbles',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15951,'Labyrinth of the Chaka King','2022-04-14','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Take on the role of Tokiko the archaeologist as you make your way through the ancient Labyrinth of the Chaka King. 2D platforming fun for the whole family!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2osw.jpg'),(15952,'Cubified',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are a sphere just living your life when an army of cubes comes in and tries to convert everyone to cubes. You have to fight your way through the cube forces and save the world from being cubified.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co695y.jpg'),(15953,'The Monster Breeder','2025-05-06','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Turn-based fantasy gladiatorial game with monster breeding. Crossbreed various species to create monster hybrids for gladiatorial combat. Manipulate juvenile creatures’ traits with magic and alchemy. Manage your enterprise, craft items, and upgrade your base. Fight in the arena for gold and glory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yys.jpg'),(15954,'Comish Clicker - Idle Tycoon',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15955,'Dstnce.','2020-12-13','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dstnce. is a platforming adventure game where you work your day job, clean up your room, look after your plant, and so much more as you try to get by one step at a time. This is your game, it is what you make of it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p0g.jpg'),(15956,'Apt. Map','2022-07-28','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Wondrous floating eye game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tew.jpg'),(15957,'Thief Gold','1999-11-02','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Thief Gold is a first-person perspective stealth game. It was the first game to use light and sound gameplay mechanics – different surfaces cause varying noise. You can use sound to your advantage - it\'s not only your main source of information on how close your enemies are but you can use it to distract them, for example by throwing objects. With unscripted levels, and objectives and paths altered based on difficulty settings, Thief Gold can give you hours of non-repetitive gameplay.\n\nThis extended edition includes all of the missions from the first release, as well as three new missions adapted to the original storyline, with full voice acting and new graphics. It can still be considered the first game in the Thief series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44le.jpg'),(15958,'Underground Ernie: International Fun Station',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9afs.jpg'),(15959,'Limb From Limb','2024-03-26','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Raymond Mitchell Association personally invites you to join our new limb regrowth program. Engage in a game of chance against another patient, risking the loss of your fingers. We have provided items to aid in your success waiting to be uncovered as you traverse the game board.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81ip.jpg'),(15960,'Daddy','2018-01-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have to find your daddy.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15961,'Nocturne: Prelude','2020-03-03','Music, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The afterlife is now digital. Discover that eternal life comes with sacrifice in the first chapter of a genre-defying RPG with unique rhythm combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k51.jpg'),(15962,'Kelsi Davies: Haunt Escape','2020-09-22','Adventure, Indie','Android, iOS','A first person horror game about ghost hunting. Find spirits that need help, and communicate with them to help them move on. Has exploration, problem solving, as well as moments of stealth and action. Voiced by, and starring Kelsi Davies, a popular social media influencer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c8m.jpg'),(15963,'Confined',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Confined is a short horror-puzzle game where you have three minutes to solve a puzzle to escape a kidnapper’s grungy, dangerous basement.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ahk.jpg'),(15964,'Jettatura','2022-10-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jettatura is a challenging first-person dungeon-crawler (DRPG) with round-based combat. Form a band of up to six mercenaries to scout the subterrene world to reclaim a stolen ancient artifact from the surreptitious death-cult that pilfered it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fy9.jpg'),(15965,'Soulbound Steel',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Embody a necromancer and slash your way through knights and castles. Combine skills of undead warriors on the fly. Summon powerful demons and slay colossal deities in a hack n’ slash that offers a brand new combat system to be mastered.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41sx.jpg'),(15966,'NBA Street','2001-06-18','Sport','Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Are you ready for extreme basketball? You\'d better be, \'cause it\'s coming to your PS2 fresh from the developers of SSX! Hit the streets for some 3-on-3 hoop action, where flashy moves are your key to victory. Do tricks and combos to build up your Gamebreaker meter. Hit a Gamebreaker shot and you\'ll not only advance your own point total, but take away from your opponents\'. One well-timed Gamebreaker can turn a match around! Create your own cool characters, and earn great new stuff for them as you unlock new courts and teams while taking on streetball and NBA legends. Beat a team in the tournament mode, and you have the option of adding its players to your roster, which will help as you advance up the ladder. You can also take on a friend in the two-player mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eki.jpg'),(15967,'Exploding Kittens','2021-04-08','Card & Board Game','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','Exploding Kittens is a multiplayer card game where players draw cards until someone draws an Exploding Kitten and explodes!\n\nPlay your cards to try to avoid, move, or defuse the Exploding Kitten. If you don\'t explode, you win! Congratulations, you are full of greatness.\n\nPlay with friends in the same room or online, or play with strangers in online play. Not into other people? Play single player against kitty-bot opponents!\n\nThis version of the game includes the Streaking Kittens, Party Pack, and Betrayal Pack expansions, exclusive cards, and hilarious illustrations by The Oatmeal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w3l.jpg'),(15968,'Puzzle Galaxy','2022-07-22','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Play with beautiful varied illustrations, breathtaking photos and special video puzzles playing after completing a particular assembly.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51xm.jpg'),(15969,'Citizen Sleeper: Helion Collection','2025-01-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Includes Citizen Sleeper and Citizen Sleeper 2','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d0r.jpg'),(15970,'Little Dragons Café','2018-08-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Little Dragons Café opens with a twin brother and sister learning to cook and manage a small café with their mother. All was routine until one morning when the twins discover that their mother won’t wake up. Suddenly, a strange old man appears and tells them that they must raise a dragon to save her. Working with three quirky café employees, the twins must wrangle a dragon and run the family business while finding a way to save their mother.\n\nIn Little Dragons Café, players can choose to play as either sibling Ren or Rin. The story-driven gameplay features a balance of three elements:\n\nManage your café - Run your own café by preparing tasty dishes, serving your customers, and managing a colorful cast of eccentric staff and visitors.\n\nExplore the world - Discover an entirely new world filled with wildlife, secrets, and dangers while collecting ingredients and recipes to enhance your café menu.\n\nRaise a Dragon - Care for and train your very own dragon as he grows from baby to adult. Explore, hunt, and uncover new areas with your faithful companion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26qh.jpg'),(15971,'Naruto Shippuden: Ultimate Ninja 4','2007-04-05','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','Ultimate Ninja 4 takes place two and a half years after the end of the original Naruto series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1u9h.jpg'),(15972,'Argol: Kronoss\' Castle','2024-08-22','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Platformer action game, mixing gothic and mythological atmospheres.\n\nArgol: Kronoss\' Castle is a platformer action game largely inspired by 90s hits. Between gothic universe and mythological legends, it is decorated as it deserves with a rich and epic soundtrack to make you live an adventure in the purest arcade style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yi8.jpg'),(15973,'The Bag Man\'s Curse','2024-07-14','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This game follows a 12-year-old boy called Peter who, despite rumors of missing children, decides to leave home and ends up discovering macabre things.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96zi.jpg'),(15974,'Chromancy','2021-08-07','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Chromancy is a shoot \'em up that tests your wits and reflexes at the same time! Using the ability to change color between red, green and blue, you will face enemies, dodge obstacles, solve puzzles and fight bosses through 50 fun and challenging levels. Can you master the power of RGB and beat this game?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co620e.jpg'),(15975,'A Milky Way','2020-06-08','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Four beaver dad\'s go on a space mission, to steal milk from the milky way. On the way back their ship is being hit by asteroids. Your job is to fix the ship with the wood planks floating around. Be quick to save the milk and bring it back to your beaver babies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2aer.jpg'),(15976,'Puyoman-Eating Carbuncle','1997-06-30','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Released in Disc Station volume 14.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mwg.jpg'),(15977,'Blades of Thunder','2005-02-01','Shooter','Game Boy Advance','A U.S. recon team reports a terrorist cell is planning a major attack in the Middle East, hoping to overrun the oil refineries of the Gulf States to fuel worldwide terror. To secure our freedom you must hunt down and destroy this threat before it strikes. Take command of a deadly gunship to deal America\'s wraith in the steel jacketed fury of today\'s deadliest weapon systems. The game features 10 operation levels with air, land and sea missions, topped by elaborate boss fights. Your gunship\'s tactical weapon systems include machine guns, hydra rockets and homing missiles. There are also weapon and armor power-ups found throughout the game. Use radar to keep on top of targets and enjoye the real-time 3D graphics packed with realistic visual effects. Features multiple difficulty levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nihglpdqem70ett42rki.jpg'),(15978,'Paranormal Detective: Escape from the 80\'s','2019-12-12','Simulator, Indie','Oculus VR, SteamVR','A nostalgic 80\'s VR escape room puzzle adventure! You\'re a detective searching for a kid who went missing in 1987. Explore the kid\'s game room, play with retro toys, figure out puzzles and find the kid to solve the case!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co391b.jpg'),(15979,'Ordinary Rooms','2023-06-15','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are Joey, a very curious person who likes to explore the abandoned places. This time, you read the newspaper about the abandoned facility and decided to go there to explore.\n\nGame inspired from Roblox Rooms.\n\nMenu music by chromestones','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mer.jpg'),(15980,'Mega Party a Tootuff Adventure','2020-07-14','Fighting, Platform, Puzzle, Sport, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Titeuf and his friends are coming back in video games! Help them while they are pretending to be the worst dunces of the school playground in 50 mini-games up to 4 players. \n \nThe day before Back to School, Titeuf was watching a TV show about cloning practices. The scientists chose the most beautiful sheep breeds to create clones. Titeuf got scared… It is, in some way, as if they choose the top of the class!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ub7.jpg'),(15981,'Jurassic World Alive','2018-05-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ze6.jpg'),(15982,'Drive.RS','2023-05-01','Racing','Android, iOS','Welcome to the Drive.RS public beta!\n\nHuge, fun, without limits - the biggest, best, most realistic open world racing game on mobile.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ryn.jpg'),(15983,'NumX','2024-11-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','NumX is a party-game with several mini-games, in which you play as a simple cube.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0c.jpg'),(15984,'Infommi','2018-09-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight against a wave of monsters and bullet hell bosses with multiple characters of your choice that have different abilities to help you get to their Ultimate Master. Are you ready to take them on?!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15985,'Ozma Wars','1979-12-01','Shooter','Arcade','Ozma Wars is a 1979 fixed shooter arcade game, and the very first game developed and published by SNK, who were still known as \"Shin Nihon Kikaku\" at the time. The game is also known as the second ever vertical shoot \'em up game, after Taito\'s Space Invaders (which ran on the same arcade hardware), but is also additionally known as the first game with disparate \"levels\". The game is also notable for being the first action game to feature a supply of energy, resembling a life bar, a mechanic that has now become common in the majority of modern action games. The game allowed the player to refuel energy between each level, and it featured a large variety of alien enemies.\n\nThe player controls a space craft which must fend off UFOs, meteors, and comets. Instead of lives, the player is given an energy reserve that is constantly diminishing; getting hit by the enemy causes gameplay to stop momentarily and a large amount of energy is depleted. Every so often, a mothership will appear and dock with the player\'s spacecraft, allowing the energy to be refilled. There are 3-4 recognizable stages as the game progresses and new enemies begin to appear. After these, the mothership will appear, and the cycle starts over; this continues indefinitely until the energy reaches zero.\n\nThere are two known bootleg versions of this game called Space Phantoms and Solar Flight. In Space Phantoms the player\'s ship looks like an angel, and the enemies appear as different types of insects. Due to the game being monochrome and a conversion kit for Space Invaders, many Ozma Wars monitors still utilized the Space Invaders color overlay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/glye6fbcocaudepjoyse.jpg'),(15986,'Touhou Kikeijuu: Wily Beast and Weakest Creature','2019-08-12','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Touhou Kikeijuu: Wily Beast and Weakest Creature is the seventeenth official installment of the Touhou Project. It was announced by ZUN on his personal blog on April 17, 2019, at 14:02 JST. A playable demo was released on May 5, 2019, at Reitaisai 16. The full version was released August 12, 2019, at Comiket 96.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co268x.jpg'),(15987,'Whiskara','2024-11-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Whiskara is an action role-playing game where you play as a cat named Lyra. Whiskara also features choice-driven storytelling','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94su.jpg'),(15988,'Powernode','2019-02-25','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A zen puzzle game but also a brainy challenge! Reach the highest score in \"Powernode\", a puzzle game that requires planning and organizing skills.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15989,'360 Chicken','2016-11-16','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Guts\'n\'Glory styled Skateboarding game... Still in early development!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15990,'Cubey\'s Adventures Rewritten','2021-10-24','Platform, Arcade','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Cubey\'s Adventures Rewritten is a retro-styled platformer game, with 58 maps split across three \"Map Packs\": 20 in Classic Pack (Original maps from Cubey\'s Adventures Classic), 30 in Default Pack (The new levels for Cubey\'s Adventures Rewritten) and 8 in Precision Pack (An extremely hard pack added in an update).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qtd.jpg'),(15991,'The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion 5th Anniversary Edition','2011-09-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion 5th Anniversary Edition is a celebration of the fourth release in the classic Elder Scrolls Role-playing Game (RPG) series.\n\nDesigned as a comprehensive entry point into the Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion gameplay experience for new players prior to the release of the next major release in the franchise, The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim, The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion 5th Anniversary Edition contains all of the major content releases in the Oblivion series, including the base Oblivion game and its two expansion packs: The Elder Scrolls IV: Knights of the Nine and The Elder Scrolls IV: Shivering Isles. The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion 5th Anniversary Edition presents one of the best RPGs of all time like never before. Step inside the most richly detailed and vibrant gameworld ever created. With a powerful combination of freeform gameplay and unprecedented graphics, you can unravel the main quest at your own pace or explore the vast world and find your own challenges. Also included in the 5th Anniversary Edition are The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Knights of the Nine and The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Shivering Isles expansion packs, adding new and unique quests and content to the already massive world of Oblivion, the original \"making of\" DVD, map, the Skyrim trailer. See why critics called Oblivion the Best Game of 2006.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60k6.jpg'),(15992,'Valkyria Revolution Scenario Pack: Princess and Valkyria DLC','2017-07-11','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One','This bundle includes the additional Scenarios of :\n- Soloist of the Battlefield\n- Study of Flowers\n- Hunger Pangs and Royal Pains\n\nThis bundle also includes Special Ragnite Ring Squall+ and 30 Ragnite Shards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61e0.jpg'),(15993,'Raging Bytes','2023-06-27','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Raging Bytes is a story-driven zombie RPG full of drama and pixels! Survive the raging bytes! With difficulty levels for all kinds of players, dive into this post-apocalyptic world and face zombies in turn-based battles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ipv.jpg'),(15994,'Little Hats','2021-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Little Hats is an open-world survival game with RPG elements, in which you play as a Gnome. Set in a magical world, you will have to survive, build, and explore in order to discover the secrets of the forest and the many lands that lay beyond.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45c7.jpg'),(15995,'The Undying Plague','2015-04-10','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Undying Plague is a top down shooter where your task is to fend off waves of attacking enemies and survive as long as possible. At your disposal will get a few weapons that we can improve for the money earned on the battlefield. Enter a world of pain, suffering and bloodthirsty zombies. Can you stop the plague?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98nt.jpg'),(15996,'Yoshi\'s Cookie',NULL,'Puzzle','Wii, Family Computer, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System','Yoshi\'s Cookie is a puzzle game similar to Tetris, in which the player is given a playing field populated with cookies of five various types arranged in a rectangular grid. The player moves randomly placed cookies into rows and columns of cookies with similar patterns. When a row or column of the same cookies is successfully assembled, the line will disappear, and the player can begin to work on a new row or column. The main objective of each level is to clear the playing field of all the cookies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yff.jpg'),(15997,'Alphys Neo','2016-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Alphys Neo is an Undertale fan game that features a custom boss fight against the character Alphys.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75ao.jpg'),(15998,'A Song of War: The Last Knight',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','The first part of a projected trilogy. The gameplay is inspired by the early Fire Emblem games, but uses also elements of a grand strategy game like Nobunaga\'s Ambition. The story centers on a man shrouded in white armor, who dedicates his life to fight against the various dominions who threaten the lives of the weak and innocent.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(15999,'Jett: The Far Shore + Given Time','2023-01-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jett: The Far Shore + Given Time is a cinematic science fiction action adventure with immersive sim elements from Superbrothers. Take an interstellar trip to carve out a future for a people haunted by oblivion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hgq.jpg'),(16000,'The Ballads of Reemus: When the Bed Bites','2015-04-27','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A funny and outlandish, fully voice-acted, cartoon point and click adventure game for PC.\nJoin Reemus the insect exterminator and his companion and minstrel Liam the purple bear on an all-new quest as they travel to exotic locations, battle giant insects and bumble their way towards writing a ballad of their adventures that will finally impress the citizens of Fredricus once and for all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zwazzawbnxjh2rzjxqm9.jpg'),(16001,'Scar of the Doll','2017-04-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scar of the Doll is a beloved \'90s visual novel remastered for Steam. Asumi goes to Tokyo to search for her only sister whom she has mysteriously not heard from for months. With an intelligent and unpredictable story, uncover a frightening truth in this thrilling suspense mystery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27d6.jpg'),(16002,'Oppcium',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','A sentient alien organism has escaped its cage and now freely roams a government facility. Silence has engulfed the city as a toxic and unidentified cloud was released from black oily stones. Witness and investigate a dire situation that appears to escalate by the hour.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k01.jpg'),(16003,'Daydreamour','2020-05-14','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 1-bit micro platformer about daydreams of parkour.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29u9.jpg'),(16004,'PixelQuest: Herb\'s Adventure','2024-10-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A classic, story-driven JRPG with a modern dice-building combat system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vk9.jpg'),(16005,'Pokémon Trozei!','2007-05-17','Puzzle, Strategy','Nintendo DS','A crazy departure from your normal Pokémon game, Pokémon Trozei is a speedy puzzle game that will send your stylus flying! Your goal is to match the faces of four Pokémon in the game board to remove them, then string together more Pokémon faces to perform big combos. The Pokémon keep coming faster and faster, increasing the challenge the more you play. When you clear a set of Pokémon, that Pokémon will be added to your Pokédex, so look out for rare and special Pokémon to clear from the board! All of the 386 Pokémon available through Pokémon FireRed Version and Pokémon LeafGreen Version are in Pokémon Trozei, but it\'ll take a great many games to catch them all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3uqa.jpg'),(16006,'Wild Rumble','2025-02-03','Sport, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wild Rumble is a 3v3 roguelike soccer game in which you\'ll evolve your team as you score goals through dangerous arenas. Unlock new characters, master their abilities and pick the best upgrades to lead your team to victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cnr.jpg'),(16007,'Girls\' Frontline 2: Exilium','2024-12-03','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','GIRLS\' FRONTLINE 2: EXILIUM is the official sequel to the mobile game Girls\' Frontline. It is a brand-new 3D Strategy RPG available for both mobile devices and PC, featuring a Non-Photorealistic Rendering (NPR) art style based on Physically Based Rendering (PBR) technology. The core gameplay focuses on turn-based tactics, while incorporating collection and RPG elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co958c.jpg'),(16008,'Bones: The Game of the Haunted Mansion','1991-12-31','Puzzle, Adventure','DOS','Bones: The Game of the Haunted Mansion is a member of the pseudo-roguelike Wizard\'s Castle family. It is one of the oldest games of this family, originating in 1981 on DEC mainframes.\n\nThe story is quite conservative: As in the other Wizard\'s Castle games, your task is to descend into a dungeon to find the all-powerful Globe of some mighty Warlock on the deepest level.\n\nThe gameplay is a hybrid of boardgame-like exploration and roguelike dungeon crawl, the whole presented as in \"windowed\" interactive fiction game, while the setting is a mix of fantasy, horror and sci-fi elements, playing in a haunted mansion filled with dust, bones, undead skeletons, RAM chips needed for auto-mapping, Uzis and Laser guns, etc. The only graphics is the BGI title screen; the rest of the game plays in text mode and reminds late DOS applications with windows.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16009,'Apex Legends: Legacy','2021-05-04','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ninth season of Apex Legends\nINTRODUCING ARENAS\nProve yourself in a new action-packed 3v3 game mode. Sharpen your skills in new, bespoke maps where there\'s nowhere to hide.\nNEW LEGEND: VALKYRIE\nBold, brash, fiery and fierce, Kairi Imahara grew up in the shadow of her father\'s legacy. But now she\'s ready to launch her own.\nINFESTED OLYMPUS\nAn infestation has sprung loose, strangling the city with roots and natural growths.\nNEW WEAPON: BOCEK BOW\nA powerful and deadly weapon, for those with the skill to wield it. Capable of inflicting tremendous damage at medium range, you’ll need to make each shot count.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z99.jpg'),(16010,'Demon\'s Mirror','2024-09-05','Puzzle, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A rogue like deck builder combined with a strategic match-3 battler. Use cards to attack and defend against the enemy, manipulate tiles on the board, and gain ever increasing powers as you traverse into a world filled with your worst nightmares.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rtn.jpg'),(16011,'Get-A-Grip Chip and the Body Bugs','2022-05-12','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Get-A-Grip Chip and the Body Bugs sends Chip on a new mission: enter the human body and dismantle digestive distress! In this satisfying 2D platformer, master Chip’s grappling hook to get things flowing. Raise an army of white blood cells to fight off the Body Bugs as you grapple for guts and glory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kwr.jpg'),(16012,'The Long Sky VR','2020-03-24','Shooter, Simulator, Indie','SteamVR','This game is the VR version of my other game \"Long Sky\", which integrates all the optimizations of the latter and is completely re-created for VR control. In the game, players will come to the spacecraft, avoid meteorites and enemies in a 3D parallel battlefield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43xy.jpg'),(16013,'GoldenEye: Rogue Agent','2004-11-22','Shooter','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','GoldenEye: Rogue Agent is a first-person shooter video game developed by EA LA and published by Electronic Arts. The player takes the role of an ex-MI6 agent Jack Hunter, who is recruited by Auric Goldfinger (a member of a powerful unnamed criminal organisation based on Ian Fleming\'s SPECTRE) to assassinate his rival Dr. No. Several other characters from the Bond series make appearances throughout the game, including Pussy Galore, Oddjob, Xenia Onatopp and Francisco Scaramanga.\nDespite its name and being part of the James Bond universe, the game has no relation to the 1995 film or the 1997 video game of the same name. In this setting the game\'s protagonist is given the name \'GoldenEye\' after he loses his eye and receives a gold-colored cybernetic replacement.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dlx.jpg'),(16014,'One More Question','2024-12-18','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game utilizing the concept of “Situation Puzzles”, One More Question gives a new perspective on familiar quizzes, presents a backdrop and story to immerse yourself in, and give a workshop editor of your own to share your own puzzles with others. Enjoy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0p.jpg'),(16015,'Eternity Egg',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chaotic adventure-platformer with pilotable mechs, grotesque characters & high-energy trance music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rk8.jpg'),(16016,'Metaphor: ReFantazio - Launch Edition','2024-10-11','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5','The Launch Edition includes the Pre-Order Bonuses of:\n- Archetype EXP Chest Set along with the Adventurer’s Journey Pack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90ay.jpg'),(16017,'StackZap',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16018,'Shadowblade Odyssey','2023-07-26','Fighting, Platform','Xbox One','\"Shadowblade Odyssey\" is an enchanting 2D platform adventure game that draws inspiration from the classic retro Shadow style. Embark on a thrilling journey through a mysterious phantasmal world, where players take on the role of a young hero.\n\nIn this game, players must skill fully evade cunningly placed traps and employ their mastery of blades and darts to vanquish enemies. However, combat is not the only approach; players can also learn potent shapeshifting abilities to conceal themselves within the shadows, quietly elude adversaries, and seek out hidden treasures.\n\nPlayers can exchange their hard-earned currency to acquire new abilities, upgrade their existing skills, and unlock powerful enhancements for their character. Whether it\'s improving the effectiveness of their blades and darts, extending the duration of their shapeshifting ability, or acquiring unique and rare skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vx3.jpg'),(16019,'Neonsomnia','2023-06-22','Adventure','Game Boy Color, Web browser','Neonsomnia is a game about exploring a strange and surreal dream world. It was developed for the Dream Diary Jam 7 and is a fangame based on Yume Nikki.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sk3.jpg'),(16020,'Skeletoon: Forgotten Memories','2020-08-25','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','a 2D platform inspired to the legends of the gaming \"golden age\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5luf.jpg'),(16021,'Olympia: Festival of the Gods','2024-11-29','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Olympia: Festival of the Gods is a digital board game where players collect tokens in order to perform rituals to honor the Gods of Ancient Greece!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0o.jpg'),(16022,'Alien Crush','2006-12-15','Pinball, Arcade','PlayStation 3, Nintendo 3DS, Wii, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, Wii U, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable','Fight against the aliens with your pinball skills!\n\nImagine a living pinball machine...with aliens and outlandish worlds to throw at you. And turbo-charged, speed-of-light pinball action. You control the flippers and ball speed to defeat the Slime, the Tentacloid and Scorpion. Go for the eyes! This is full-tilt, out-of-this-world action! Surrealistic graphics plus true-to-life, earsplitting arcade pinball sound. Achieve the maximum possible score of 10 less than 1 billion and the game ends with the destruction of the table and a congratulatory message.\n\nThe game is the first installment in the Crush Pinball series. It was followed by three sequels, Devil\'s Crush, Jaki Crush, and Alien Crush Returns.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s2j.jpg'),(16023,'Bamerang','2021-04-22','Fighting, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Bämeräng is a fast paced boomerang fighting game for two to four players. Fight for the favor of the goddess in an outlandish, colorful world in this local multiplayer game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i5p.jpg'),(16024,'Rugrats: Time Travelers','2000-12-31','Platform','Game Boy Color','The Rugrats are about to find out that the only thing more exciting than traveling through your own backyard is traveling through time. After discovering a time machine, the kids accidentally scatter themselves throughout history, and you\'re the only one who can reunite the famous babies with their beloved cohorts. Each of the game\'s 12 levels puts you in charge of a different character, charging you with tasks like finding a lost toy, locating fellow Rugrats, or tracking down mysterious items. The whole debacle begins when Chuckie won\'t enter the time machine with the other babies, but he changes his mind as soon as the rest if the gang disappears and leaves him all alone. Chuckie\'s attempt to track down the others puts him in the 1800s, but none of his friends are there. In fact, Tommy is in ancient Egypt, Angelica is at an old circus, Phil is trapped in prehistory, and Dil is, somehow, lost in space! Can you collect all of the lost items and round up the babies before it\'s too late?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bxk.jpg'),(16025,'Peaceful Soul',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Peaceful Soul is a Social Life Simulation. In this game you can interact with villagers, building friendships, finding love, take part in interesting festivals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kce.jpg'),(16026,'Shark Wizard','2020-03-12','Indie','Oculus VR','After your magic spell goes horribly wrong, you somehow managed to turn an entire village into humanoid sharks, and now they want revenge!\n\nOriginally created for a Global Game Jam, this tower defense game is unlike any other and makes no sense.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jtk.jpg'),(16027,'Space Captain McCallery Episode 3: The Weaponmaster\'s Challenge','2022-07-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Captain McCallery voyages to a planet of prehistoric monsters in search of a reclusive Weaponmaster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o4y.jpg'),(16028,'Usa Pro Basketball','1990-01-01','Sport','TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16029,'Blasting Agent: Ultimate Edition','2016-08-18','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, PlayStation Vita','Trouble in Antarctica!\n\nThe Black Hand of Fate, an international terrorist group, has constructed a secret base within the heart of a Volcano, and have built a massive army of bio-engineered soldiers and genetic monsters to take over the world! You are the only one that can put a stop to their dastardly plans. You are the Blasting Agent!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co267p.jpg'),(16030,'Robot Wars',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16031,'Jaded','2025-01-25','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Platform and fight your way through mountains and forests to accomplish your purpose as a Jade being. Slow down time using your 360-degree directional dash, and lock on to targets to strike! Fight soldiers and creatures on your quest in this gem of a game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fw1.jpg'),(16032,'Supermarket Simulator 2025',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m20.jpg'),(16033,'Asphalt: Urban GT 2','2007-03-30','Racing','PlayStation Portable','Get ready to rev your engines and hit the streets in Asphalt: Urban GT 2 for the PSP! This high-octane racing game offers an adrenaline-pumping experience with a wide array of cars and motorcycles from some of the most prestigious manufacturers in the world. Race through exotic locations around the globe, from the neon-lit streets of Las Vegas to the bustling avenues of Tokyo.\n\nWith a variety of game modes, including Career, Instant Play, and Multiplayer, Asphalt: Urban GT 2 caters to all types of racers. Customize your vehicles with a plethora of tuning options to improve performance and aesthetics, ensuring you stand out on the track. The game’s stunning graphics and realistic sound effects immerse you in a world where speed and style reign supreme.\n\nChallenge yourself with different race types such as Cop Chase, where you evade law enforcement, and the thrilling Road Challenge, competing against tough opponents. Whether you\'re a casual player or a hardcore racing enthusiast, Asphalt: Urban GT 2 offers an exhilarating ride on the PSP that you won\'t want to miss. Buckle up and dominate the streets!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b5d.jpg'),(16034,'OneDayOne','2025-02-12','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','OneDayOne - visual novel where you will dive into the routine life of Sergey, from which only a miracle and...your choices can help him escape','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0m.jpg'),(16035,'ADOM: Ancient Domains of Mystery','2015-11-16','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','ADOM is an epic fantasy Roguelike. The story takes you to the Drakalor Chain, a mountainous area in the fictional land of Ancardia. You are a lone wanderer whose purpose is to find the source of the Chaos spreading throughout the land. Pursuing your quest you traverse through dark dungeons and untamed wilds where death lurks around every corner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1od2.jpg'),(16036,'Company of Heroes 2: Master Collection','2015-07-12','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The sequel to one of the highest rated Strategy games of all time returns with an innovative warfare experience that redefines the Strategy genre once more. Boasting cutting-edge technology for increased graphical quality and accuracy of deadly combat, develop and utilize your new Commander Abilities and experience the up-close moment-to-moment brutality of frontline warfare in single-player or intense competitive and co-operative multi-player.\n\nThis unmissable package regroups the original Company of Heroes 2 and all its expansions (The Western Front Armies, Ardennes Assault and The British Forces) – as well as the Theater of War mission packs. Includes 2 single-player campaigns and 5 multiplayer armies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39we.jpg'),(16037,'Super Robot Taisen W','2007-03-01','Simulator, Strategy','Nintendo DS','Super Robot Taisen W is part of the Super Robot Wars franchise and was published for the Nintendo DS by Banpresto. It is the first Super Robot Wars game released for the Nintendo DS. Like some DS games, special features can be unlocked by starting a new game with any of the Game Boy Advance era games inserted into SLOT 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qc4.jpg'),(16038,'Mooon','2015-01-07','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Mooon it\'s a simple platform game, based on a boy who is looking for his imaginary friend, Waldo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7df7.jpg'),(16039,'Among School Girls','2020-10-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Among School Girls is an addicting game in which you have to solve puzzles with Lovely Girls.The game is perfect for relaxing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lfn.jpg'),(16040,'Disney Princess: Royal Adventure','2006-11-05','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Advance','Disney Princess: Royal Adventure is an action/adventure game starring your favorite Disney princesses. The game stars an original character named Lily. You\'re the young caretaker of a Disney castle, and it\'s up to you to find a collection of special crowns that have gone missing. Venture to different areas of the castle and fun places in and around the village, increase your skills and earn enough points to explore several different worlds. During this exploration, you\'ll become friends with the Disney Princesses—Jasmine, Cinderella, Belle, Ariel, Snow White and Sleeping Beauty—who will help her on her journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80kf.jpg'),(16041,'Warden\'s Will','2025-01-08','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warden’s Will is a fast paced movement shooter roguelite, playable solo or in up-to 3 player co-op. Choose your Warden, master unique movements and abilities, and overpower hordes of robots in intense battles. Fly, dash, smash, and turn bullet-hell into bullet-heaven!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co994m.jpg'),(16042,'Origin',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','\"Minimalist puzzling with a unique mechanic\" ...Appzoom.com\n\"Origin ... leave your brain puzzled\" ...Apppicker.com\n\"Solving Pretty Looking Puzzles\".... nineoverten.com\nOrigin will tackle your brain in a different way than Brainsquare.\nEasier to grasp, so it seems…\nRules are the same, link all pins of the same colors with their corresponding square tiles to solve each board.\nLogic and ability to see forward is still required to complete the level.\nComplete the levels in the number of moves allowed for each level, and share them on Facebook, especially if you manage to beat the minimum moves allowed.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16043,'SCP-002','2019-10-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SCP-002 is large fleshy anomalies with a small apartnet inside. what make it anomalies is everything inside (furnitures etc) is solely made of human.\nYou are dedicated as D-Class, you must find all furnitures inside the SCP-002 and marked them as same as it was before and more importantly, find the new furnitures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xea.jpg'),(16044,'The Hotel 2','2019-05-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A homeless man mistakenly entered a hotel that had been closed because of a terrorist incident. Then came a series of fantastic things.The measuring cup on the door, the confined girl, the young man and woman in a car accident.What will be the fate of the tramp waiting for him? Will he eventually be able to escape from the hotel?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16045,'Pixel Z Hunter 3D','2015-05-23','Shooter','Android','Zombie virus is destroyed world. Very few people survived. A number of them were hunting zombies in order to survive. They are called Z(Zombie) Hunter....','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mky.jpg'),(16046,'J-Jump Arena','2023-08-24','Fighting, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A turn based, jumping elimination game where everything happens all at once! Learn to be precise with your jumps and weapon handling, as well as in the art of outsmarting your opponents! Multiplayer for up to 10 players and single player mode available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zqi.jpg'),(16047,'Match it','2025-03-31','Puzzle','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m25.jpg'),(16048,'Robo-Boy Risky Venture','2021-08-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Robo-Boy Risky Venture is a game for platformer fans. The Robo Boy is embarking on an epic treasure journey! Collect all the jewels that get in your way and jump to the ports to get to new locations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nvk.jpg'),(16049,'The Ultimate Challenge from Beat Takeshi','2017-08-15','Platform, Adventure','Wii, Android, iOS, Family Computer','Takeshi no Chousenjou is a Japanese action-adventure video game. The packaging contains several warnings that the game should not be attempted with conventional gaming skills, and the player must complete numerous near-impossible tasks in order to finish the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53du.jpg'),(16050,'PegSoli+',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','\"PegSoli+\" is a game based on the rules of the classic board game Peg Solitaire (or Solo Noble), with some modifications.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kcw.jpg'),(16051,'Scoot Kaboom and the Tomb of Doom','2021-06-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scoot Kaboom and the Tomb of Doom is a fiendishly fun action platformer that all takes place on one enormous screen. Run, dive and dodge through the twisting maze, evading spikes, saws, fireballs, portals and even more and escape the Tomb of Doom!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40v5.jpg'),(16052,'Mickey no Tokyo Disneyland Daibouken','1994-12-16','Platform','Super Famicom','Mickey has taken a trip to Tokyo Disneyland. But when he arrives, he finds out from Minnie that his friends have been kidnapped and the park has been hijacked by none other than Pete. Armed with nothing but a combo water/helium backpack and some balloons, Mickey must trek through the different sections of the park to rescue his friends, held captive in some of the park\'s most iconic attractions, and stop Pete.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vxf.jpg'),(16053,'CrossCraze','2024-06-19','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fun, modern twist on the classic word game, designed for players who prefer the challenge of a computer opponent (you can also pass-and-play offline with a friend). Place your letters on the board to build crosswords. Use bonus squares to boost your score and take your word play to another level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ew6.jpg'),(16054,'Asura Buster: Eternal Warriors','2000-12-26','Fighting, Arcade','Arcade','Three years have passed since the events of Asura Blade and the post-apocalyptic world has been in a state of calm and peace after the deaths of S. Geist and Curfue, both of whom were killed by Yashaou from within the last fight of the battle, but now, a new threat has arisen as the sudden and shocking sinking of a continent has placed the post-apocalyptic world into a state of chaos and destruction once more. A few of the fighters from the Asura Blade incident of three years ago, along with a few new warriors will find themselves being caught up from within a dark and shrouded conspiracy as a mysterious yet malevolent king aspires to become the new supreme lord of the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rzq.jpg'),(16055,'Train Valley 2','2022-08-10','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Drive forward the industrial revolution in our train tycoon management puzzle game. Build an efficient railroad, upgrade your locomotives, and keep trains on track without delays to meet the ever-growing demand of the cities and industries in your tiny valley. Choo-choo!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qps.jpg'),(16056,'Hyper Demon','2022-09-19','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hyper Demon is an FPS like no other. A pearl of lightning. A dream from the future. A drop of poison. A swan song. The faster you slay demons, the harder the game and the higher your score. There is an end. Will it see you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5b10.jpg'),(16057,'Bad Mojo: Redux','2014-07-03','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Inside a seedy, dilapidated bar in San Francisco, your dreams of escape are about to be realized. But remembering one last keepsake, you are suddenly seized by its magic, and your transformation begins. From within the damp walls of Eddie\'s Bar, you emerge a cockroach.\n\nEnter a world of perilous puzzles and bizarre perspectives. What you discover may shock you. What you don\'t may kill you. Either way, you won\'t come out the same person. You may not even come out a person at all...\n\nMore than 800 navigable screens are rendered in stunning hi-resolution detail. Live-action video and spine-tingling music will drag you into the dark, disturbing atmosphere of Bad Mojo.\n\nPrepare yourself...It will take all of your skill to crawl out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p3l.jpg'),(16058,'Glider','1988-12-31','Sin género','Mac','The class Mac OS flying game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16059,'Dana Cipher: Dead Man\'s Hand',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dive into a high-stakes investigation in Vincent Marconi Mystery, a hidden object game where you uncover secrets, solve puzzles, and track a cunning killer in a glitzy casino.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gdu.jpg'),(16060,'Yu-Gi-Oh! Legacy of the Duelist','2016-12-07','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Relive past Dueling glory against Yu-Gi-Oh! characters from the past and present! Compete against other players online with your custom deck, then challenge them in Battle Pack Draft and Sealed Play!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86z6.jpg'),(16061,'God Eater 3: Collector\'s Edition','2018-12-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4','A limited edition of God Eater 3 that includes the game soundtrack and an artbook of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80a2.jpg'),(16062,'Inseparable','2020-11-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inseparable is a highly cooperative pc game for two players (on one keyboard), but playing solo is also possible. Placed in a fantasy world with a vintage style. This game is a fusion of adventure and action. It requires very good coordination from the players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j2u.jpg'),(16063,'23 Seconds to 5','2021-07-31','Sin género','PlayStation VR','Experience (crazy,) bizarre, surreal environments in virtual reality.\nWatch your way carefully! Jump, slide, avoid the obstacles … Master the challenges in the different obstacle courses and hope that you will reach the elevator of the tower.\n\nIn \"23 Seconds to 5\" you run linearly through desert environments, pirate areas and greenhouses with dangerous pitfalls. You explore the surface of the moon, underwater landscapes and futuristic high-rise districts. In the depths of a mine you will be led through dark corridors and caves. Night and horror await you too. Be careful. You will also encounter pyramids, artistic design and abstraction on your way. Do not be distracted, dangers lurk between all the diversity and beauty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k4k.jpg'),(16064,'Fire Fly','2023-12-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s an intense,adrenaline-pumping zombie mowing game where youll overcome many odds to find a cure.The game is not finished yet,and I will do my best to complete this game in the future,learn from the feedback,increase the gameplay,and make sure that it does not disappoint each and every one of you','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ead.jpg'),(16065,'Pathfinder: Wrath of the Righteous - Commander Edition','2021-09-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pathfinder: Wrath of the Righteous - Commander Edition includes a base game, an Art Book, Digital OST, Digital Map, and 4 in-game items: Magnificent Plume Hat, Ratcatcher\'s Goggles, Dashing Cavalier\'s Gloves, Righteous Exorcist\'s Bracers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rb1.jpg'),(16066,'Yomawari: Lost in the Dark','2022-10-25','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Another chapter of the atmospheric horror series has emerged from the shadows! Eerie sound design and shadowy environments set the stage for gruesome and terrifying ghosts never seen before in the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59il.jpg'),(16067,'NinjaThea 2','2025-04-17','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Help NinjaThea exact revenge on the nasty critters and reclaim her diamonds and fruits!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q05.jpg'),(16068,'Battlers of Ekrasys','2025-04-15','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An idle auto-battler hero builder all about experimentation. Defeat waves of monsters and bosses to learn their spells! Craft jewels, enhance them with the smithmagic system, and fuse over 70 unique abilities to discover powerful synergies and evolve your build.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9okk.jpg'),(16069,'Metal Slug 2','1998-06-25','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, PlayStation 3, Neo Geo MVS, Wii, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable, Neo Geo CD','“METAL SLUG 2”, the 2nd entry in SNK’s emblematic 2D run & gun action shooting game returns to the battlefield on the Steam gaming platform!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24zi.jpg'),(16070,'Final Fantasy VII + VIII Double Pack','2016-06-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Double Pack Edition is a compilation of Final Fantasy VII and Final Fantasy VIII for the PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ojl.jpg'),(16071,'Luminator DS',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16072,'Avoidvania','2021-09-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','AvoidVania is a 2D game Top-down Runner / Metroidvania taking place in a medieval-fantastic universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co487i.jpg'),(16073,'Stellaris: MegaCorp','2021-01-26','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Stellaris: MegaCorp is the latest full expansion for Paradox Development Studio’s iconic sci-fi grand strategy game, which has players ushering in an era of prosperity and profit on a galactic scale. In this economy-focused expansion, players can become the CEO of a powerful corporate empire to expand operations across the stars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8spc.jpg'),(16074,'Noddy: The Magic of Toytown on a CD-ROM','1997-12-31','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Noddy: The Magic of Toytown on a CD-ROM is an educational game divided into five parts :\n\n- The Interactive Storybook : wile discovering an interactive story filled with surprises, the child will develop its reading skills\n- Tour Toytown in Noddy\'s car to collect lost items. It\'s all about recognition and counting skills\n- The movie theater : just watch two Noddy films\n- The games : with the first one, listen carefully to sounds then find out \"Who Said That\" ! Second game : with Bert Monkey, just match two cards. Last game in this section is a maze game : first choose a maze then, look for letters and items.\n* in Tessie Bear\'s studio, children will develop their creative skills with 3 activities. With \"Cartoon Collage\", they will create their own cartoon story. With \"Invisible Paint\", a picture appears twice, but with some differences. Spot them ! Last activity is the \"Artbox\", which is a painting activity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jv2.jpg'),(16075,'This Is Fine','2016-11-12','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Web browser','A game I made in reaction to the 2016 election results. It\'s a 5 minute game and it\'s not political. Enjoy :)','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16076,'Error Found',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ERROR FOUND is a genre-redefining psychological horror game that takes place in a seemingly normal clicker game. When a previously normal game gets hijacked by a character, players are forced to find the truth within the game and make decisions that will forever impact their gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50nz.jpg'),(16077,'Lich Legend','2021-05-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Android, iOS','A mobile Action Tower Defence game where you play as a lich, summoning towers using the souls of fantasy heroes that you have defeated.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h4j.jpg'),(16078,'Plants Vs. Zombies 2: Project Eclise','2018-09-01','Strategy, Indie','Android, iOS','Project Eclise is a mod for the game Plants Vs. Zombies 2: About Time. It was created by goodpea2 in collaboration with Mine Power and makes numerous changes in order to bring things more in line with what many fans loved about the original. Examples include:\n\n- Removes \"pay to play\" aspects of the game (micro transactions), allowing things to be either earned through Adventure mode or bought with in-game currency.\n- Introduces a tier system, allowing the player to strategically develop their plants for different strengths and weaknesses.\n- A re-jigged, linear narrative, with tweaked dialogue and hundreds of original levels across the game\'s worlds.\n- New game modes\n- Some newly designed zombies and plants\n\nThe most notable change that players will encounter is the steep difficulty. The mod not only fixes problems with the game, but also makes it incredibly challenging - this is not a fault, but an intentional change for the appeal of those who have mastered the original game and desire more of a challenge, with a much greater emphasis on strategy. This may put off some players used to the usual skill level required of players from other games in the series.\n\nUltimately, the mod is a challenging and impressive overhaul which bares very little resemblance to the original PvZ2 game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uoy.jpg'),(16079,'Dark Gem Tower Defense','2024-01-05','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Atmospheric tower defense. How many waves can you defend? Basic tower defense in a fantasy setting with gems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nt7.jpg'),(16080,'Oakwood','2018-12-04','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Oakwood, a long abandoned campground nestled in the forests of British Columbia. Explore the woods, caves, and a dilapidated lodge in search of your friends, while surviving the prehistoric horrors that now haunt the grounds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1t6d.jpg'),(16081,'Gray Matter',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Players control both Dr. David Styles and Samantha Everett in their bid to uncover the secrets and find out the truth. Gray Matter tackles questions concerning the nature of reality and the power of the human mind in constructing the world we take for granted.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ppn.jpg'),(16082,'Twerk Hero','2020-10-09','Music, Arcade','Android, iOS','The year is 2021... The year, the age, the time of Twerk! Are you worthy to shake that booty? Twerk Hero takes you on an epic adventure through breath-taking locations such as your home, or an underground garage! Each time you must prove that you have the rhythm and the finger to create the most mind-blowing dance moves, shattering your phone screen and possibly the screens of those around you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7m03.jpg'),(16083,'Disney Speedstorm: PlayStation Plus Exclusive Pack','2024-08-27','Sin género','PlayStation 5','This pack includes:\n- Baloo Wildboost Logo Avatar\n- Baloo Sterling Legacy Suit\n- Baloo Wildboost Sterling Edition Livery','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16084,'Champions Tactics: Grimoria Chronicles','2024-10-23','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Champions Tactics Grimoria Chronicles is a brand new PVP Tactical RPG experimental game on PC published by Ubisoft utilizing Oasys Blockchain and NFT elements. Assemble a team of mythical Champions, engage in thrilling tactical battles against other players and discover the legends of the dark and mystical world of Grimoria.\n\nAre you ready to write your name in the chronicles?\nFollow us on our social networks and subscribe to our newsletter to stay in touch with the latest news.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zx2.jpg'),(16085,'Arcade Legends Street Fighter II\': Special Champion Edition','2005-04-02','Fighting','Plug & Play','The Arcade Legends Street Fighter II\': Special Champion Edition, known as the Play TV Legends Street Fighter 2 in the US and the Mega Drive Play TV 3 in Japan, is a Sega Mega Drive \"console on a chip\" designed and manufactured by Sega Toys. In the West it was distributed by Radica.\n\nThe system contains Street Fighter II\': Special Champion Edition and the Mega Drive version of Ghouls\'n Ghosts built-in. It also comes with two controllers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4skv.jpg'),(16086,'Pink Goes to Hollywood','1993-12-31','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Compared to the Genesis/Mega Drive version, this version has different level designs among other differences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kcx.jpg'),(16087,'Who Framed Roger Rabbit','1988-12-31','Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga, Apple II','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dfj.jpg'),(16088,'Mission: Impossible Arcade','2021-03-01','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','Agent, your mission should you choose to accept it, is to save the world by sabotaging enemy plans that aim to weaponize humanoid robots. You will have a range of weapons and high-tech gadgets at your disposal to complete your mission but remember time is not your side. Sega brings the multi-billion dollar blockbuster film franchise MISSION: IMPOSSIBLE to the amusements market. SEGA’s Mission: Impossible Arcade is an adrenaline-fueled video game, that is the pinnacle of great design and entertainment. The awe-inspiring 4 player Super Deluxe Attraction cabinet is designed to look like the IMF (Impossible Mission Force) safe house and features the iconic fuse along with various interiors details that convey the feel of a top-secret high-tech spy hideout.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yr6.jpg'),(16089,'LEGO Dimensions','2015-09-27','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Wii U, Xbox 360, Xbox One','For the first time in any LEGO videogame, characters from iconic entertainment franchises join forces and battle in worlds outside of their own. In addition to the game, the LEGO Dimensions Starter Pack will include the LEGO Toy Pad, which allows players to transport special LEGO minifigures and other LEGO objects into the game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ghf.jpg'),(16090,'Stealth Kill VR Missions',NULL,'Shooter, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to D.A.R.P., Operator. You have been chosen to prove your Infiltration, Weapons and Explosives skills throughout various objectives in this Physics based Stealth Action VR Game. Candidates unable to comply or show signs of weakness, will be terminated immediately.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8l2f.jpg'),(16091,'S.T.A.L.K.E.R.: Call of Pripyat','2009-10-02','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The events of S.T.A.L.K.E.R.: Call of Pripyat unfold shortly after the end of S.T.A.L.K.E.R.: Shadow of Chernobyl. Having discovered about the open path to the Zone center, the government decides to hold a large-scale military \"Fairway\" operation aimed to take the CNPP under control.\n\nAccording to the operation\'s plan, the first military group is to conduct an air scouting of the territory to map out the detailed layouts of anomalous fields location. Thereafter, making use of the maps, the main military forces are to be dispatched. Despite thorough preparations, the operation fails. Most of the avant-garde helicopters crash. In order to collect information on reasons behind the operation failure, Ukraine\'s Security Service sends their agent into the Zone center.\n\nFrom now on, everything depends on you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pz7.jpg'),(16092,'Zodiac Fantasy','2022-07-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a horizontal board jumping game. The player needs to control the character to jump and climb in the scene. The ultimate goal of the player is to reach the end point as much as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co596z.jpg'),(16093,'She Will Punish Them','2020-04-29','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A sensual dark fantasy ARPG. Customize a stunning succubus with great body details, together with your companions fight intense combats with challenging bosses to get sexy outfits and powerful equipment, and between battles, chill and interact with your fellow maidens at the palace designed by you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dpc.jpg'),(16094,'Fallen London: The Pursuit of Moths','2018-03-01','Adventure','Web browser','An addon for Fallen London. The Exceptional Story for March, 2018. First entry in the Season of Adorations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hxy.jpg'),(16095,'The Joy of Creation','2015-11-29','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a FNaF fan-game, inspired by the fourth installment and by \"The Boogeyman\" video game.\n\nCan you hear them calling out your name in the darkness?\n\nTheir own screams once gave you pleasure, but now they\'re gonna tear you apart- inch by inch.\n\nYou must use your sharp senses and abilities to defend yourself against your own creations lurking in your very own house.\n\nBut be careful, they\'re not as friendly as they are in the daytime; especially to you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66k1.jpg'),(16096,'Raji: An Ancient Epic','2020-10-15','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Raji: An Ancient Epic is an action-adventure game set in ancient India. A young girl named Raji has been chosen by the gods to stand against the demonic invasion of the human realm. Her destiny? To rescue her younger brother and face the demon lord Mahabalasura.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xhp.jpg'),(16097,'Pristontale II: The 2nd Enigma','2008-02-07','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Priston Tale 2 is a sequel to the 3D fantasy Korean MMORPG Priston Tale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yj8.jpg'),(16098,'Infinos Gaiden','2018-01-19','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The feeling of 90\'s arcade shooter will come again !! Arcade-like side scroll shooter of 7 stages in all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27of.jpg'),(16099,'Siege \'n Sow',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unleash strategic mastery in this minimalist real-time strategy game. Micromanage units, expand territory, and fend off night attacks. Harvest resources, build structures, and command diverse units to survive relentless waves. Will you triumph or succumb to the shadows?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s48.jpg'),(16100,'There\'s Always a Madman: Fight or Flight','2024-03-22','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the shoes of the suave secret agent Franklin Benjamin in this single-player spy thriller interactive novel. Drive fast cars, seduce beautiful women, and do whatever it takes to save the day against impossible odds. Because there\'s always a madman, and you\'re the best agent we\'ve got!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vin.jpg'),(16101,'Homeward','2021-07-11','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Homeward is a relaxing puzzle game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gue.jpg'),(16102,'Driving Is Hard','2025-01-31','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Jeff to drive in his bathtub car in Driving Is Hard, a precision-based driving adventure game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93yv.jpg'),(16103,'Kingdom Fortress','2025-03-31','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Command powerful heroes in this turn-based, deck-building village defense game. Build strategic fortifications, deploy loyal troops, and protect settlements across the realm of Valora. Manage resources, unlock powerful cards, and lead your forces against the encroaching darkness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9llo.jpg'),(16104,'Bus Simulator Pro','2022-01-17','Racing, Simulator','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c91.jpg'),(16105,'The New Chronicles of Noah\'s Ark','2022-03-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Noah in this Match3 game to build a great ark capable of housing two of each kind of animal, in order to save them and bring them safely through the flood. It will be a tremendous task, one that sounds impossible to complete.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5n8y.jpg'),(16106,'Chrono Trigger: Bugfix and Uncensoring Patch','2020-07-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','This patch is geared towards fixing bugs and patching up script inconsistencies or censorship. The aim is to preserve the original translation while generally improving the game as a whole.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v5n.jpg'),(16107,'Dungeons 3: An Unexpected DLC','2019-02-15','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The new DLC continues the story of Dungeons 3, and according to developer Realmforge Studios, takes the dungeon-building sim on a challenging, fully-voiced new campaign set across three new maps, providing players with a new creep type and a new boss to face in the form of the Queen of the Forest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fmc.jpg'),(16108,'Rush to Adventure','2017-09-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rush to Adventure is a retro fantasy speedrunning adventure. Inspired by classic NES titles like Zelda, Mario and Castlevania. You awaken on the shore of a cursed island. Your only way off the island is to fight the monsters and lift the curse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27c9.jpg'),(16109,'Errand Boy',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fantastical action adventure game told through 5 interweaving adventures and heroes with one overall purpose: Save the town from the imminent disaster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2f7o.jpg'),(16110,'Poker: Panther Chameleon','2019-03-22','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co974q.jpg'),(16111,'Black Skylands','2021-06-09','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Earth has been turned into thousands of flying islands. The survivors are at war for resources. You are an airship captain who wants to reach Black Skylands, a scavenger’s paradise. To do so you must destroy hordes of hostile monsters and find peace and prosperity for your people.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25b9.jpg'),(16112,'Quoth The Raven','2023-09-24','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Quoth the Raven is the 28th installment of the Pineapple Under the Sea Speedmapping series, created by BluePineapple72. The event ran during June of 2023, in which maps were created in a time limit of 8 hours or less. Mappers were to create Heretic maps using a custom texture pack and calling back to several of the design tropes from the original Heretic. It contains 3 episodes, with forced secret exits, for a total of 27 maps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co753k.jpg'),(16113,'Monster Tribe','2023-05-01','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Explore an island filled with collectible creatures, a vast and varied wilderness, and dangerous towers on your way to restoring harmony with the land of Akama.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p4d.jpg'),(16114,'Goooal','2024-07-18','Sport, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','GOOOAL! is exciting sports arcade. The goal is to defeat opponents in wagers. Use powerful soccer balls with special effects and minigames. Level up your GOOOOOOAL to save up money for a ticket to the big game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j5v.jpg'),(16115,'Honeypot Espionage',NULL,'Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Honeypot Espionage is an online VR multiplayer shooter, focused on stealth combat, in which you are put against other Spies in a combat arena. The last man standing wins. As a Spy, you are completely invisible, but you will begin to materialize if you move, fire a weapon or set a trap. If you don’t want killed, stay still. Think Predator meets SuperHot. The slower you move in real life the harder you are to see. You can set traps and decoys to trick other players into revealing their location to try to come out on top. Multiple game modes allow you to fight the way you want. Team up with others to break into the High Security Government buildings to steal classified documents. Guard the VIP and keep them hidden from potential assassins. Classic Death match where you use your abilities to search out others to get the first and last kills. Stay hidden, only move to Kill.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ka9gfpa3xbjffrb0uem4.jpg'),(16116,'Club Suicide: Complete Edition','2023-06-05','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Club Suicide: Complete Edition is a remastered version of the anti-romanticism otome game with fully remastered visuals and a completely remade BGM with newly added pieces, an additional scenario for each route, a completely new route, and two additional endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lho.jpg'),(16117,'Kawairun',NULL,'Racing','Sin plataforma','Compete with your friends or play alone in this super fun\\cute running game with cute clouds and yetis that hold limbo sticks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fo8.jpg'),(16118,'Memories of Replica','2011-12-03','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Memories of Replica is a metroidvania Yume Nikki fangame. It is a sequel to Houchou Shoujo Gensoukyoku, although it is different in both art style and gameplay. The game borrows characters and dream worlds from the original Yume Nikki while giving them actions and positions different to their original counterparts. You play as Poniko who wields scythe as her main weapon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rag.jpg'),(16119,'Castle Crush: Epic Strategy Game','2016-11-09','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Android, iOS','Castle Crush: Epic Strategy Game is a card based battle game for iOS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pnt.jpg'),(16120,'God of War Ragnarök: Valhalla','2024-09-19','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','God of War Ragnarök: Valhalla is a free DLC that introduces a new mode that uses elements of the roguelite genre. Players progress through a series of trials set in procedurally generated levels, where they must choose a relic, shield, and rage ability for each trial run. After completing a challenge within a trial, players can opt for upgrading their weapon, relic, or stats, but these enhancements only apply to that specific trial run. Each run and the completion of specific gameplay challenges unlock permanent rewards. If a player dies, they restart the trial from the beginning. The downloadable content (DLC) also introduces new enemies, including new and familiar ones from the Greek era games like cyclopes and minotaurs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jl8.jpg'),(16121,'Zero to Hero','2023-05-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zero to Hero is a roguelike tactics game where you play a contestant on a 1960s game show. You get super powers, and have to overcome a gauntlet of challenges. If you get to the end, you get to keep your powers. Choose amazing upgrades and incredible transformations to go from Zero to Hero!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63oh.jpg'),(16122,'FIFA Soccer 2004','2004-01-14','Sport','N-Gage, Game Boy Advance','Handheld port of FIFA Soccer 2004.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89lc.jpg'),(16123,'QUByte Classics: Glover','2025-02-27','Platform, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The classic 3D platforming adventure is back—better than ever! Roll, jump, and shape your journey in this hands-down ball-tastic adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fe6.jpg'),(16124,'Dead or Alive Xtreme Beach Volleyball','2003-01-23','Simulator, Sport','Xbox','Dead or Alive Xtreme Beach Volleyball is a beach volleyball game. The game is a departure from the rest of the Dead or Alive series which otherwise consists of fighting games. It also marks the first game in the series to have a Mature rating due to the very revealing swimsuits featured in the game and the suggestive poses the women present themselves in (which can be viewed and zoomed in on from almost any angle, as controlled by the player).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mdk.jpg'),(16125,'Q.U.B.E. 2','2019-02-21','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Q.U.B.E. 2 is the sequel to the hit first-person puzzle game Q.U.B.E. You are Amelia Cross, a stranded archaeologist who has awoken among the ruins of an ancient alien landscape. With the distant help of another survivor you must manipulate the structure of this mysterious world and find a way back home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g7p.jpg'),(16126,'While the Iron’s Hot','2023-12-05','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Reforge a blacksmith\'s village on an isle of the land\'s finest artisans! Step into the boots of an expert smith for a crafty adventure filled with mystery and charm. Explore the land of Ellian, and prove that a hammer, anvil, and your wits can overcome any challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lvh.jpg'),(16127,'Feudal Bros: Tonosama #1','2025-04-04','Fighting, Adventure, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Japan. Edo period. After many years of violent wars, peace has returned to the land, but it doesn’t seem like it will last for long. A new danger lurks in the shadows, and only two noblemen can stop it: Lord Baka, a Japanese feudal lord, and Prince Bouffon, a prince from the faraway land of France.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96zy.jpg'),(16128,'Orion\'s Belt Expedition','2024-11-20','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Land on planets to get resources! Complete tasks to upgrade your ship! You are the commander, take good care of your crew! Always check the status so that the expedition goes well!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0x.jpg'),(16129,'Cross Edge','2008-09-25','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Tactical','PlayStation 3','In a world where dreams and nightmares become reality, a band of powerful warriors from across dimensions must come together to stop their worlds from being consumed by evil incarnate. Harness the power of characters from such series as Disgaea, Ar tonelico, and DarkStalkers! Utilize the dynamic battle system to unleash powerful special skills and team combos, and choose your destiny!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zun.jpg'),(16130,'Crypt\'s Game','2024-10-23','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are out in the woods, in search of the entity known as Crypt. Stopping in your tracks, you see it approaching. You take aim with your shotgun, intending to kill it, when suddenly the ground beneath you gives way, dropping you down into the earth. You find yourself trapped in Crypts dungeon where it will play a twisted game of Cat and Mouse. Killing it is the only way out, will you survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96s7.jpg'),(16131,'Slot & Dungeons',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gfs.jpg'),(16132,'Geo Mythica','2025-03-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embark on an 8-bit style JRPG quest to save Earth. Battle in unique party-based combat mixing real-time action and strategic commands. Join Gio and a team of lively characters as they unearth bizarre global events, forgotten legends, and battle mythical foes to unveil the secrets of Geo Mythica.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70lo.jpg'),(16133,'Ace Combat 7: Skies Unknown - Aces at War Bundle','2019-01-18','Sin género','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','The Aces at War Bundle of Ace Combat 7: Skies Unknown contained the base game, the Aces at War: A History 2019 art book, and a steelbook. This edition was exclusive to North and South America.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7m76.jpg'),(16134,'Number Tower',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16135,'Metal & Lace: The Battle of the Robo Babes','1992-05-29','Fighting','PC-9800 Series, DOS, FM Towns','Metal & Lace is an anime-style fighting game based on the Japanese-only Ningyō Tsukai, with a different storyline and enhanced gameplay. In this game, you can choose between various robot models and send them into battles. All models have different names and attributes: strength, speed, etc. You can also visit shops and upgrade your mechs. Your reward is usually erotic pictures of the defeated girls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wwc.jpg'),(16136,'Armen Noir','2010-12-09','Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','The story is set in the near future, in a corrupt city called Moebius, where the gap between rich and poor is growing bigger and bigger.\n\nThe heroine is a ‘Hunter’, someone who has chosen to oppose the criminals who have sullied their hands with illegal deeds and have gained money as a result. Hunters work for ‘Bountia’, an organization that takes assignments to catch criminals in the city for rewards. Armen Noir is the heroine’s codename in Bountia, and her real name is Naska. The thing is, despite her being an A class hunter, she cannot kill anybody. She rose to A rank because she has been able to defeat her enemies well without having to kill them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zaf.jpg'),(16137,'Danganronpa: New World Order','2022-01-16','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Danganronpa New World Order is a fangame created by Alpha Team based on the Danganronpa video game series. The game has a completed prolouge, 2 completed chapters, and is currently on the daily life of chapter 3.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ncq.jpg'),(16138,'Bad Dreams: Free Dive','2023-09-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bad Dreams is a Solo VR Horror game with immersive gameplay based on real gesture. A unique experience, where nightmares become reality.Fight, Run, Jump, Wipe your eyes, Cover your ears... while avoiding the game\'s traps and puzzles, you won\'t come out unscathed!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75f3.jpg'),(16139,'Rust Onslaught',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Rust Onslaught is a top-down shooter where you play as the robot R-75, as he takes out everything he sees. Humanity Is Dead, Robots Own The Earth, and you have become a danger.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16140,'Ms. Pac-Man','1984-12-31','Arcade','Commodore VIC-20, Arcade, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Sega Game Gear, DOS, Apple II, Xbox 360, Sega Master System/Mark III, Texas Instruments TI-99','In 1982, a sequel to the incredibly popular Pac-Man was introduced in the form of his girlfriend, Ms. Pac-Man. This sequel continued on the \"eat the dots/avoid the ghosts\" gameplay of the original game, but added new features to keep the title fresh.\n\nLike her boyfriend, Ms. Pac-Man attempts to clear four various and challenging mazes filled with dots and ever-moving bouncing fruit while avoiding Inky, Blinky, Pinky and Sue, each with their own personalities and tactics. One touch from any of these ghosts means a loss of life for Ms. Pac-Man.\n\nMs. Pac-Man can turn the tables on her pursuers by eating one of the four Energizers located within the maze. During this time, the ghosts turn blue, and Ms. Pac-Man can eat them for bonus points. The Energizer power only lasts for a limited amount of time, as the ghost\'s eyes float back to their center box, and regenerate to chase after Ms. Pac-Man again.\n\nSurvive a few rounds of gameplay, and the player will be treated to humorous intermissions showing the growing romantic relationship between Pac-Man and Ms. Pac-Man, leading all the way up to the arrival of \"Junior\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53rj.jpg'),(16141,'CabbageBall',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Sport, MOBA','Sin plataforma','Cabbageball is a thrilling skill-based competitive handball game that incorporates magical abilities and sports.\nAre you ready to test your skills and see if you have what it takes to be the champion?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6z4o.jpg'),(16142,'We Don\'t Talk About It','2020-03-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Art-horror game about how hard it can be to express yourself','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16143,'Ghost Witch: Soulstice Sprint','2024-12-24','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this one-off holiday themed time trial, platform around as Esme the Ghost Witch and help the citizens of Terror Mountain reclaim their offerings in time for the Soulstice celebration!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qqj.jpg'),(16144,'Zenless Zone Zero: Update 1.2 - Tour de Inferno','2024-09-25','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac','Version 1.2 of Zenless Zone Zero, which includes:\n\n• New Characters: Caesar and Burnice\n• New Main Story Quest: Chapter 4 - Tour de Inferno\n• New Events\n• ...and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ybc.jpg'),(16145,'Up a Cave',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16146,'Run Tom Hanks Run','2019-03-31','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a classic style 2D Platformer featuring 9 levels in 3 worlds! Take to Castaway Beach, Take to the trees in Vietnam! And Meet a Volcano!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fcq.jpg'),(16147,'Solipsism Reigns','2020-06-01','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A twisted tale of tortured love. Travel through various dimensions to seek the truth about yourself and the worlds around you. Your only constant will be your spirit companion, Kuro.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qiq.jpg'),(16148,'Learn English Preposition','2017-08-05','Quiz/Trivia','Android, iOS','Educational preposition word puzzle game to learn real spoken English, improve correct preposition use and train your brain. Learn English intuitively. Learn as you play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fq0.jpg'),(16149,'Grifford Academy','2025-06-30','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grifford Academy is a story-rich, coming-of-age RPG set in a mystical book realm where your decisions shape the personalities of the characters. Engage in strategic turn-based combat as you set out to discover the secrets of Caldria.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lhi.jpg'),(16150,'Mad Room No.3','2023-03-18','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','LET\'S TURN THE MILK OVER.\n\nIn this game, you play as a Japanese high school girl in the Judo club.\n\nA short game where you interact with your surroundings, and chat with your classmate who is a bit of a weirdo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g9w.jpg'),(16151,'Turboroko: Path to Passion Fever','2020-01-01','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short experience, prequel to a prequel to a pre-sequel of a prequel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t8q.jpg'),(16152,'Earth Under Siege','2014-11-04','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Earth Under Siege is an action tower defense game based on frenetic shooting mixed with strategy and upgrades. The Earth is being attacked by an Alien Empire. All nations started working together to create the best defense system humankind could possibly assemble. Great offense turrets were created to attack any incoming threat! You are the chosen commander to take control of them and bring hell to outer space!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ln5.jpg'),(16153,'Conflict Zone','2001-10-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Dreamcast, PlayStation 2','Conflict Zone is a modern-day war game with 3D graphics. Your every move is being watched by the media so you\'ll have to act right to make a good impression (rescue civilians,..). The impression you make will also determine how much money you will get for your missions, so there is no resource management.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ii1.jpg'),(16154,'Invention 3','2022-01-24','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this game you have to fight your way through hordes of zombies in search of a safe place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hdh.jpg'),(16155,'Broken Hearts Island','2023-09-08','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Broken Hearts Island, a visual novel in the fantasy genre, tells the story of the adventures of a young oceanologist on a mysterious island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gna.jpg'),(16156,'RealityMinds','2021-08-30','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A young aspiring soldier and a mysterious girl switch bodies. An RPG with a ripple effect that changes the minds of everyone involved.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h2m.jpg'),(16157,'Xiaoyuan Kousan','2018-01-01','Sin género','iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ggv.jpg'),(16158,'Oddworld: Munch\'s Oddysee','2016-01-26','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','Xbox, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation 2','Oddworld: Munch\'s Oddysee is set in the fictional Oddworld universe and take place after those of Abe\'s Exoddus. The player controls Munch as well as Abe, the hero of the previous Oddworld games. Abe\'s abilities haven\'t changed much since the last installment: as before, GameSpeak must be used to communicate with other creatures, leading them to safety. His fellow Mudokons can now be ordered to attack enemies. Abe can also grab and toss Mudokons or Munch to lead them to area they cannot access otherwise. Possessing enemies also comes into play, and is needed to solve many of the puzzles. Possession abilities can now be used to ignite quarrels between enemies and make them fight each other.\n\nThe player can change between Abe and Munch instantly throughout most of the game. Munch brings on the table new abilities of his own: he can use his sonar to control or immobilize specific creatures, as well as swim. Another new addition is the possibility to use vending machines, which sell various items that enhance the abilities of the protagonists. At certain points Abe and Munch can also remote-control mechanical creatures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yni.jpg'),(16159,'Deep Madness','2021-08-31','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deep Madness is a casual game where your task is to jump as deep as possible. Will you become the best player in the leaderboard?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40nu.jpg'),(16160,'PixelJunk Eden Encore','2012-02-02','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Utterly unique and spell-bindingly beautiful, PixelJunk Eden Encore welcomes you back to a psychedelic world unlike anything you’ve ever experienced before.\n\nAs a tiny, silk-spinning ‘grimp’, it is up to you to collect the lost “Spectra” that have been scattered across all the gardens of Eden. Lush visuals, slick controls and amazing music make it an incredibly atmospheric and addictive experience.\n\nDownload the Eden Encore add-on to expand your copy of the game with five stunning new levels, complete with fresh gameplay twists, unique new Trophies and music tracks.\n\nKey Features of the Original Game:\n-Stunning Visuals - Stylish graphics brought to life in gorgeous 1080p HD\n-Multiplayer Co-op - Local co-op play to for up to three players\n-Trophy and Online Support - Unlock Trophies and track high scores via online leaderboards\n-Video Recording - Record gameplay videos to the hard drive or upload directly to YouTube\n-Remote Play - Supports Remote Play for PSP system*\n\nThe Steam version of PixelJunk Eden includes both Eden and the Encore expansion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2im9.jpg'),(16161,'Cardiac Powder','2023-06-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cardiac Powder is a twin-stick shooter where you have a bomb in you, if you can’t maintain a certain BPM, it will explode… So one thing to do is keep you in action by fighting your opponents!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7go6.jpg'),(16162,'Yuuki Yuna wa Yuusha de Aru: Jukai no Kioku','2015-02-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','Yuki Yuna wa Yuusha de Aru: Jukai no Kioku is a Japanese action game and is based on the media franchise Yuuki Yuna wa Yuusha de Aru. The story follows the five female club members of the Sanshu Middle School Hero Club, who are tasked of protecting the world from mysterious monsters known as Vertex. The game is divided into two sections: Action Part and Event Part. Action Part plays as a 3D action game where the player must defeat mysterious monsters called \"the Vertex\" playing as one of the five hero club members. Event Part plays like a traditional visual novel and tells the story of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mw6.jpg'),(16163,'Cassette Boy',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','All you see is all there is - Cassette Boy: an RPG where what exists depends on you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yu3.jpg'),(16164,'Dragon Fang Z: The Rose & Dungeon of Time - Extra Dungeon: The Cave of Fangs','2018-08-30','Indie','Nintendo Switch','Take advantage of Fangs\' powers to clear the dungeon!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16165,'Skykipelago',NULL,'Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Skykipelago is a chill strategy game where you build happy little cities in the sky. Explore a variety of colorful islands, care for your buildings\' happiness, evolve your buildings to help you grow, and when solid ground is no longer cool enough for you - expand onto the cliff sides.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uwv.jpg'),(16166,'Everything is Going to be OK','2017-01-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A collection of short minigames about surviving trauma, depression, and a society that values commodification of grief.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co280z.jpg'),(16167,'1-DC','2021-03-12','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Program a computer with only 3 commands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gfv.jpg'),(16168,'The Last Humble Bee','2024-11-21','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Last Humble Bee is a heart-buzzing bumble bee rogue-like! Hack and slash demon bugs in high-speed, skill-based gameplay and explore an SNES-inspired pixel art world to find the portal to Hell.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ijv.jpg'),(16169,'Elon Simulator 2019','2019-10-18','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The year is 2019.. There is a loong way to the Mars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93lq.jpg'),(16170,'Revere','2024-03-13','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\'revere\' is a psychological found footage horror game where every detail matters. Prepare yourself for an experience where your sanity will be condemned.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9063.jpg'),(16171,'Discworld Noir','1999-07-05','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Ankh-Morpork is a city surrounded by darkness, where the cold river Ankh flows, where it always rains, and where dwarves and trolls co-exist with secret societies, religious fanatics, stupid police captains, and bar pianists. It is also where a bitterly sarcastic sharp-eyed private investigator named Lewton tries to earn a living solving bizarre cases. A mysterious woman named Carlotta hires him to find her lost lover. Wandering through the dark city and gathering evidence, Lewton has to solve the case, confront a sinister conspiracy, and once again become torn between love and despair.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h5y.jpg'),(16172,'Storybook Brawl','2021-06-18','Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Draft your favorite characters from story and myth in this 8 player card battler! Over 30 different heroes to command. Will you side with the evil vampire, Snow Wight? Or team up with the good Princess Peep and her battle hardened sheep? Deep strategy meets enchanting fun in Storybook Brawl!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pm0.jpg'),(16173,'China Warrior','2007-06-25','Fighting','Nintendo 3DS, Wii, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, Wii U','Boss Kara and his evil horde has captured the entire kungfu province. You are summoned - You obediently go knowing full any of Kara\'s bullies could no doubt put out your lights. You must face them and their specialties one by one .. then finally Kara himself. A sip of a sacred tea releases hidden powers, but will it be enough? Play it so .... a hundred million Chinese are counting on it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c8l.jpg'),(16174,'Witchhammer',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Witchhammer is a Real-Time Roguelike Deckbuilding Game.\nPlay as Clovelin, a card reader who was convicted as a witch and made a deal with the devil to avenge her own death. With the powers of her magical tarot deck, you will battle the Inquisition and try to destroy their most powerful weapon: the Witchhammer.\nTo master our real time deckbuilding roguelike you will not only learn how to avoid your enemies attacks but also how to play your cards most efficiently.\nAfter every wave of enemies you will improve your deck, making it more powerful and adapting it to your own playstyle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98cn.jpg'),(16175,'Foreign Legion: Buckets of Blood','2009-08-04','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Foreign Legion: Buckets of Blood is a cartoon-style third-person shooter. You take the role of a last-standing hard-boiled Legionnaire taking on an entire rebel army. A small campaign with various objectives, such as defending civilians, escorting a tourist bus and a mass-chicken-murder map. The game includes a ranking system that allows you to unlock new outfits, accessories and of course new weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pnp.jpg'),(16176,'Rovio Classics: Angry Birds','2022-03-31','Shooter, Puzzle, Strategy, Tactical','Android, iOS','Rebuilt from the ground up, Rovio Classics: Angry Birds is a faithful re-make of the original Angry Birds game that took the world by storm!\nThe survival of the Angry Birds is at stake. Dish out revenge on the greedy pigs who stole their eggs. Use the unique powers of each bird to destroy the pigs\' defenses. Angry Birds features challenging physics-based gameplay and hours of replay value. Each level requires logic, skill and force to solve!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oyl.jpg'),(16177,'Conception: Ore no Kodomo wo Undekure!','2012-04-26','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation Portable','Conception: Ore no Kodomo o Undekure! is a Japanese role-playing game and the first game in Spike Chunsoft\'s Conception series. The player\'s goal is to charm pure, innocent girls from Granvania National Star God Academy, raise their affection for Itsuki, then produce and take the \"Star Children\" to explore dungeons and battle \"impurities\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1sxw.jpg'),(16178,'WWE 2K14','2013-10-29','Fighting, Sport','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','K Sports\' line-up of premier simulation titles expands with the company\'s first release in the flagship WWE videogame franchise, WWE 2K14. The most electrifying, authentic and comprehensive WWE video game experience to date.\nRelive the greatest matches and moments from three decades of the greatest spectacle in all of entertainment. Play through more than 45 prolific matches in an unprecedented single-player campaign celebrating 30 years of WrestleMania. Complete objectives to unlock playable characters, additional gear, historical WWE footage, and bonus content on the road to immortality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rwr.jpg'),(16179,'SSR Wives: The Murder Of My Winter Crush','2025-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SSR Wives: The Murder Of My Winter Crush Is an upcoming Retro Survival Horror experience that takes inspiration from iconic staples of the survival horror genre with the charming narrative intrigue of a Visual Novel. Atmospheric exploration, Challenging puzzles, and Horrifying encounters await!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wm1.jpg'),(16180,'Asura','2017-04-13','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Asura is an indie top-down hack \'n\' slash game based on a fantasy setting inspired by Indian mythology. It features heavy rogue-like elements and a procedural skill tree which changes on every play through. Take on the roll as the demon incarnate and obliterate your way through the randomly generated fortress of the Daeva empire. Equip weapons from a wide variety of arsenal and carefully craft your character using the ever changing skill tree. The game can be brutal but is always fair. Can you rise from the ashes? Can you defeat the Daeva empire?\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xxl.jpg'),(16181,'Crappy Dog 2','2024-02-12','Arcade','Android','Welcome back to Crappy Dog! this time with a 2!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87c6.jpg'),(16182,'Astro Rabby','1990-10-12','Platform','Game Boy','Astro Rabby is an action video game developed by Cyclone System and published by Information Global Service (IGS) for the original Game Boy exclusively in Japan on October 12, 1990. It is the first Game Boy title to be published by that company.\n\nThe game puts you in control a of Rabby, a robotic bunny, who\'s goal is to recover stolen parts for his creator, Doc, that were taken by the Dortoise Troops. Doc\'s dream is to utilize the parts to allow Rabby to fly freely. The game is a top-down, vertically scrolling action game that can be considered a precursor to the Jumping Flash series. The player must jump along platforms in search of a heart, which will allow the player to upgrade Rabby and proceed on to the next level. A level will loop indefinitely until the heart is found.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pm0.jpg'),(16183,'A Hell of a Soup','2022-02-22','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this Open World Adventure FPS, your mum sends you on a journey through the desolated lands because she\'s in desperate need of ingredients for her soup.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wum.jpg'),(16184,'Flight Simulator Airplane Game','2023-05-16','Racing','Android','Airplane flight simulator adventure games offer a unique and thrilling gaming experience to fulfill your dreams of becoming a skilled pilot. Plane games pilot simulator 3D has an immersive and realistic Flight Simulator gaming experience. Airplane games provide a realistic plane simulation of flight physics, aircraft models, and environments in flight pilot games. You will experience the ultimate airplane flying fun in this free flight simulator game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6y61.jpg'),(16185,'Tiny Defender','2021-02-11','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Tiny Defender is a game that combines CCG and tower defense. Build your own deck and clear various stages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44oy.jpg'),(16186,'Agar.io','2021-05-05','Strategy, Indie','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Agar.io is a massively multiplayer online game where players control a cell in a colorful, grid-like environment. The main goal is to grow your cell by consuming smaller cells scattered throughout the map, while avoiding being eaten by larger cells controlled by other players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8728.jpg'),(16187,'Little Rooms',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16188,'Hector: Badge of Carnage! - Episode 3','2011-04-27','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Detective Inspector Hector – the hard-nosed, soft-bellied lawman of Clappers Wreake, a town that took the “Great” out of Britain. He’s violent, drunken, and has a taste for all things criminal, corrupt, or smothered in curry.\n\nCan Hector escape his squalid demise and stagger back to Clappers Wreake to save it from extinction?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gtz.jpg'),(16189,'Superman',NULL,'Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation','An enhanced version of the Superman game for Nintendo 64 which was cancelled due to license expiration. Although both games are related, the PlayStation version was going to have many improvements over the original game and a complete overhaul on the gameplay sequences, focusing on exploration and combat.\n\nA late prototype was found and dumped online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xnk.jpg'),(16190,'Finn Dorset\'s Institute For Livestock Replication','2024-10-03','Point-and-click, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An animated incremental game about cloning livestock. Make as many moon sheep as you can. Research technology, upgrade your operation and become a clone farm billionaire!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zvx.jpg'),(16191,'Air Strike: 3D Combat',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16192,'VFurrika!','2023-12-18','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','VFurrika! is an addictive puzzle game that combines the charm of your favourite VFur streamers with strategic gameplay.\nDrop your favorite furry VTuber into a glass and witness them merging into other VTubers upon contact!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fiv.jpg'),(16193,'Rest in Pieces','2019-03-07','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','Please save all the poor souls that have been trapped in the dream demons porcelain nightmares.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jiu.jpg'),(16194,'Pathfinder Online','2014-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pathfinder Online is a Fantasy Sandbox MMO with Open World PvP based on the Pathfinder intellectual property used with a license from Paizo, inc.\nPathfinder Online features no set classes, no grinding, a player driven economy, and so much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ihjeobttis6dwp3z1hlg.jpg'),(16195,'Oddworld: Stranger\'s Wrath HD','2012-09-14','Shooter, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Oddworld: Stranger\'s Wrath HD is a remaster of Oddworld: Stranger\'s Wrath. The improvements include remastered dialogue, improved character textures and bonus material.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yox.jpg'),(16196,'Pinball FX2','2014-08-14','Pinball','PC (Microsoft Windows), Oculus Rift, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Pinball FX2 is a free shell for downloadable pinball tables. The tables are sold individually or in packs of four.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qyi.jpg'),(16197,'Automobilista 2: Monza Pack',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Sport','Sin plataforma','The Autodromo Nazionale Monza has arrived for Automobilista 2 - with the modern track of this supremely fast circuit and the 1971 and 1991 historical variants included.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16198,'Chomper\'s',NULL,'Point-and-click, Indie','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7me0.jpg'),(16199,'Torto: Cursed Divine','2020-12-11','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Torto cursed divine is a 2D adventure with basic climbing mechanics that allow you to explore an island to find challenges and beat them in the order you prefer. Every area you visit has a temple full of puzzles and enemies that will unlock access to a God\'s location awaiting for you to battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ldo.jpg'),(16200,'Parking Driver','2024-03-26','Racing, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Parking simulator, come and challenge it now','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91lm.jpg'),(16201,'Yokoyama Mitsuteru: Sangokushi','1992-06-26','Simulator, Strategy','Super Famicom','Yokoyama Mitsuteru Sangokushi is a strategy game based on the anime and manga of the same name by manga artist Yokoyama Mitsuteru. The name simply means \"Yokoyama Mitsuteru\'s version of Sangokushi\", Sangokushi being the Japanese name for the Chinese literary classic Romance of the Three Kingdoms. The manga and anime retell the story of the book, with the game focused on this retelling.\n\nDuring the game\'s development the anime adaptation was in full swing, so the game was intended to be a companion piece. This was a standard practice of Bandai at the time (Angel was a game publisher subsidiary of the toy giant), as was hiring freelance developers like TOSE to develop for them.\n\nThe game is a standard turn-based strategy war sim in the vein of Koei\'s much more prolific Romance of the Three Kingdoms series. The player and the AI-controlled rival kingdoms select actions that include diplomacy, combat and domestic matters such as farming and trade, with the ultimate goal being to wrest control over the rest of China from the other two kingdoms.\n\nThe game was followed up with two sequels: a standard sequel in Yokoyama Mitsuteru Sangokushi II and the board game spin-off Yokoyama Mitsuteru Sangokushi Bangi.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4cn3.jpg'),(16202,'Overwatch 2: Watchpoint Pack','2022-10-04','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The pack includes the following Overwatch 2 in-game content: Season One Premium Battle Pass, 7 Legendary skins (including 2 all-new Space Raider skins), 5 Epic skins, 2,000 Overwatch Coins and instant access to all 35 Overwatch Heroes.\n\nWith the Season One Premium Battle Pass you can unlock over 80 Tiers of rewards including Mythic Cyber Demon Genji, Legendary Hinotori Kiriko, and more. In addition, as a Season One Premium Battle Pass owner you will automatically receive access to Overwatch’s latest hero, Kiriko!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v49.jpg'),(16203,'Oct 14','2024-10-13','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s what happened that day.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0h.jpg'),(16204,'Hellbent','1988-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Atari ST/STE, Amiga','In Hell Bent, set in 3530, the player takes the role of Captain Drak Hellbent who has to drive off aliens which invaded his home planet Aldonicha. The goal is to destroy a set amount of ground targets in each of the ten vertically scrolling levels. To do so, the player has to change the altitude of the space ship - but flying low creates the danger of crashing into another building. Fuel and shields can be replenished by flying over especially marked buildings. Of course there is also alien opposition which is dealt with by shooting them. Later levels introduce additional challenges like laser fences which have to be passed through with the correct timing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qvv.jpg'),(16205,'Arctic Adventure','1991-10-09','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','Like Pharaoh\'s Tomb, Arctic Adventure is a CGA game containing 80 all-new diabolical levels, packed with mind-bending arcade action designed to keep you from ever succeeding. Nevada will face freezing waters, diabolical traps, slippery ice patches, falling stalactites, runaway snowballs and even abominable snowmen! There are many, many more obstacles for Nevada to overcome in this highly adventurous series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zxn.jpg'),(16206,'Tarragona 7: Civilisations Crossroads','2002-02-17','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','At the end of TWH6 Lara was teleported by the blue cube very far from the Earth. Where is she now? She is now in a Crossroad Civilisations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rpi.jpg'),(16207,'Samira: Taken From Time','2023-05-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Transported back in time, you must help Tiki, an ancient mech beetle, escape the apocalypse. Your puzzle solving skills will be put to the test as you attempt to collect the fragmented pieces of his tablet which will empower him with the ability to stop any and all world-ending events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rok.jpg'),(16208,'Turtle Riders','2025-03-24','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Choose your weapons and ride your giant turtle while hordes of enemies try to take you down. Gather orbs to upgrade and pick the right skills to survive the long road to the outpost!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8cjp.jpg'),(16209,'Hernhand','2014-09-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A sci fi adventure where you walk through 3D spaces and listen to sounds. Draws inspiration from settings such as in various sci-fi videogames and big empty spaces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xw0.jpg'),(16210,'Circle Breakout','2014-08-11','Arcade','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1x2h.jpg'),(16211,'Cycles of Aylorea',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Strengthen Your Soul, Craft Your Legacy, Rise as a Warden of Aylorea.\n\nAn MMORPG with base building, roguelike elements, always on PvP, and other survival elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92bo.jpg'),(16212,'Mountaincore','2023-05-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Settle an untamed wilderness with the might of Dwarven engineering and thoughtful planning! Design and build your colony towards fame and fortune in a deeply-simulated fantasy world. Chill out in peaceful mode with a bustling settlement, or fight for survival against monsters and invasions!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e14.jpg'),(16213,'Romance of the Three Kingdoms XIII: Fame and Strategy Expansion Pack',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Live the Three Kingdoms with extreme Officer Play! \"Romance of the Three Kingdoms 13\" celebrates the 30th Anniversary of the series and has achieved the greatest advances in the history of the series.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16214,'Puzzled Cube',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Puzzled Cube challenges your mind with a gripping, hands-on puzzle experience. Feel the thrill of unraveling complex patterns, the rush of each perfect move, and the satisfaction of mastering the cube. Stay focused, think ahead, and enjoy the journey!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16215,'Beltane: A strange encounter at Duloe - Stone Circle','2022-05-20','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Police and local people are baffled by phone cam footage that seems to show extraordinary phenomena over the 4000 year old stone circle, in Duloe, Cornwall. Experts are examining the footage, filmed by a local farmer, in the hope that sceptical eyes may reveal what the farmer describes as an \"encounter\". Is it a drone? Faked? Experimental military craft? Or a power generated by the stones themselves? Play to find out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wlu.jpg'),(16216,'Real Bout Fatal Fury','1996-02-23','Fighting','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, Neo Geo MVS, Wii, Sega Saturn, PlayStation, Neo Geo CD','Real Bout changes the play controls from the previous Fatal Fury games, reducing the number of attack buttons from four to three: a standard Punch and Kick button, a \"Strong Attack\" button which can be either a stronger punch or kick attack, depending on the character. The game retains the three-plane \"oversway\" system from Fatal Fury 3, which features a main lane for fighting, with foreground and background planes used to avoid attacks or leap towards the opponent. A dedicated button is now used to make an \"oversway\" (or change plane) towards the background or foreground.\n\nReal Bout introduces a Power Gauge, which fills up as the player performs normal or special techniques against their opponent or defend themselves, similar to many super move gauges featured in other fighting games. The Power Gauge allows players to perform one of three types of Special Techniques, depending of the level of the Power Gauge.\n\nReal Bout also introduces stages with ring-outs, a gameplay feature previously introduced in 3D fighting games such as Virtua Fighter. If the player performs certain attacks on their opponent while next to the boundaries, the character will eventually destroy the barrier keeping the opponent in the ring and be able to knock them out of the stage for an easy win.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7568.jpg'),(16217,'Omega No Sunshine 2','2024-08-09','Platform, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Omega No Sunshine , second game of the title, is an arcade collecthation game where players have to travel through different places in order to collect sun rings. Humanity is destroying their own world and an another time, it need someone able to collect them all and restore the sun to shine again.\n\nThis title was delisted and later republished in 2025 as a new release and self-published by Galoxyum with ongoing updates and features.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fhq.jpg'),(16218,'Bounce','2016-11-30','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows), Oculus Rift','Bounce is a VR physics-based puzzle game for the HTC Vive and Oculus Touch. Under the supervision of H8-Bit and 2Bit, two robots tasked with overseeing security of the intergalactic spaceship, players must help D1G-B, their spherical robot companion, traverse levels using an array of gadgets at their disposal to exit each level’s portal. With moving obstacles, laser gates, gravity wells, and multi-floor levels obstructing the path of D1G-B, players will have to use their creativity to construct solutions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mii.jpg'),(16219,'Shortest Trip to Earth','2018-10-09','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shortest Trip to Earth is a roguelike spaceship simulator focused on exploration, ship management and tactical battles. Embark on a perilous journey across the universe, while an intergalactic war is raging.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1js6.jpg'),(16220,'HellSinker','2007-08-01','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A legendary SHMUP influential to the best makers in the genre, Hellsinker is now available on steam in its most advanced form! Gameplay, story, graphics, and even music all united into one cohesive and highly dimensional Shoot-em-up!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8n04.jpg'),(16221,'Rapture Island','2025-02-12','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rapture Island is a wandering simulator with no goal & intentionally low-quality, retro graphics. It is something that could have been an early 3D game, with graphics reminiscent of the Super FX Chip. Also heavily inspired by poking around Lego Island as a kid, not engaging with any of the main quest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fr1.jpg'),(16222,'FIFA 22: Legacy Edition','2021-10-02','Simulator, Sport','Nintendo Switch','Powered by Football, FIFA 22 brings the game even closer to the real thing with fundamental gameplay advances and a new season of innovation across every mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h61.jpg'),(16223,'Timothy and the Tower of Mu','2022-08-09','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ascend the tower to save your grandfather in this classic, hardcore action-platformer. The Tower of Mu is waiting for you... Push past each check point to the next awaiting challenge; dashing, jumping, and slinging your way up to the towers peak. Die. learn. Overcome.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3tld.jpg'),(16224,'King Arthur Project','2012-11-12','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a fan-made standalone game that uses the Tomb Raider The Last Revelation engine while creating its own story and puzzles.\n\nThis TRLE was placed in the trle.net hall of fame in 2013.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ldi.jpg'),(16225,'Pokémon Shield + Expansion Pass','2020-06-11','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','A bundle pack that contains the same game content you would receive by purchasing Pokémon Shield and it\'s Expansion Pass separately.\n\nFor those of you who haven’t yet started an adventure in the Galar region, here’s your chance to experience everything it has to offer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67oe.jpg'),(16226,'Dragon Drop','2021-09-27','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dragon Drop is a frantic couch-multiplayer game where lovable dragons try to drop the blocks out from below their opponents. Drop the dragons! Don\'t get dropped! In this groundbreaking game of timing, tactics and quick twists of luck, your fire breath temporarily wipes a line of cuboid platforms away. Try to stay on while dropping your rivals, but don\'t delay your next step, it could be your last! Hatch into Dragon Drop, and may the last (and best) dragon win!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m7y.jpg'),(16227,'Slime Climb: A Count Pumpcula Tale','2024-05-19','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Bounce, Jump and Slide your way out of The Abyss. It\'s time to Slime Climb!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8l7r.jpg'),(16228,'Bloody Raid','2021-05-20','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bloody Raid is a tactical team-based PvPvE action shooter where the Hunters fight the Infected in mysterious Zones. Several competing teams enter a Zone with a goal to be the first to find and collect valuable biosamples and evacuate with the loot as fast as possible. Fallen players can rise again in the Zones, though not quite the same as before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co318m.jpg'),(16229,'Roguelike Adventures and Dungeons','2018-05-21','Simulator, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Do you like roguelike dungeon crawling games? Or exploring Minecraft world for dungeons and structures for loot? Tired of all that tech stuff and just want more fun? Then this pack is for you. It is completely focused on adventuring and exploration, looting and fighting. Fight you way through the dungeons, improve your skills and gear, complete quests and conquer new undiscovered dangerous dimensions. There is no time to relax because as you grow stronger, gathering better equipment mobs will also gain health and becomes stronger!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ebp.jpg'),(16230,'SpongeBob\'s Boating Bash','2010-03-02','Puzzle, Racing','Nintendo DS','The handheld version of the Wii game with the same name. Differences include Squidward Tentacles being unlockable, Mrs. Puff not being playable, and Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy being fully playable. There are even exclusive features for when the game is played on the Nintendo DSi.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tam.jpg'),(16231,'Army of Ages','2011-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Indie','Web browser','You are at war and there will be 50 different units and tower you can use. The task is clear, defend your home base and destroy the enemy. In the game, you can move between different periods in which there will be newer and better weapons. Use your weapons and special attacks strategically and try to eliminate your opponent before he becomes a danger to you. How long can you survive in this excellent defense and upgrade game?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co985d.jpg'),(16232,'Kasane Teto and Hatsune Miku are Lesbians','2018-02-11','Visual Novel','Web browser','A parody UTAU & Vocaloid visual novel where Kasane Teto asks out Hatsune Miku.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gla.jpg'),(16233,'NokNok',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16234,'Backrooms Media','2024-09-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Backrooms Media is a multiplayer co-op exploration game that plunges you into unsettling, hyper-realistic liminal spaces. Navigate eerie environments filled with lurking horrors. Group up with your friends to face the terror of the endless backrooms together and... try to escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8swy.jpg'),(16235,'Rollance: Adventure Balls','2022-08-15','Platform','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16236,'Adele: Following the Signs','2016-06-02','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Adele: Following the Signs is the result of over 2 years of hard work from the people at Unosquare Labs. It is an extremely challenging 2.5D puzzle-platform strategy game with beautiful graphics, original art and music, and an interesting gameplay written by Unosquare. Special guest music composer coming soon! \n\nAdele is not meant to be a zombie killing game. Players have to strategically maneuver objects to block their path, run away or trap zombies into falling in order to escape them. The game is set in different environments which impact your interaction with the zombies, being in a factory is going to be different than in the countryside, or underground.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sz6yzilopnqpb0ag9rr9.jpg'),(16237,'SpongeBob\'s Atlantis Squarepantis','2007-10-23','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 2','SpongeBob\'s Atlantis SquarePantis is a SpongeBob SquarePants video game based on the television series series and the Atlantis SquarePantis TV movie. This is the first SpongeBob game that is based on a made-for-TV movie.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vm1.jpg'),(16238,'DitherDream','2024-10-04','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A trippy little exploration game. Let the world guide you through a strange and uniquely beautiful archipelago.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8we5.jpg'),(16239,'NugQuest',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16240,'Metroid Dread: Special Edition','2021-10-08','Shooter, Platform','Nintendo Switch','Join intergalactic bounty hunter Samus Aran in her first new 2D Metroid story in 19 years. Samus’ story continues after the events of the Metroid Fusion game when she descends upon planet ZDR to investigate a mysterious transmission sent to the Galactic Federation. The remote planet has become overrun by vicious alien lifeforms and chilling mechanical menaces. Samus is more agile and capable than ever, but can she overcome the inhuman threat stalking the depths of ZDR?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7q7s.jpg'),(16241,'ServiceIT','2024-03-04','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','If you love DIY and the world of technology isn\'t scary to you, don\'t wait and get at the helm of a recently acquired IT service! Repair equipment, configure it and develop the company. It\'s up to you to decide which jobs to do, who to hire and what you want your office to look like!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ube.jpg'),(16242,'Semicolon Island',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Semicolon Island is a multiplayer-focused sandbox building game, which aims to give its players large amounts of freedom to create anything their minds can come up with.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6msy.jpg'),(16243,'Lockdown Lewd Up!','2020-10-04','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lewd up your lockdown! (18+)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hfn.jpg'),(16244,'PathUp!','2025-04-01','Racing, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','PathUp is a thrilling adventure game where you climb to the summit, overcoming obstacles using exciting mechanics. Quick decisions and skill are key to progress. Two checkpoints help you continue your journey without starting over.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mfz.jpg'),(16245,'NotEel!','2022-02-27','Fighting, Indie','Web browser','NotEel! is a fishing/fighting game. Whoever touches the hook is out!!\nPublished on Itch io and free to play in WebBrowser, no download required.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59yf.jpg'),(16246,'O.W.L Projekt','2024-11-06','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','O.W.L Projekt is a 3D isometric puzzle game that will test your mind and logic skills. Controlling Elysion, a young being created in a mysterious experiment, you will face the enigmatic Watchers in a journey to escape and uncover secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ujq.jpg'),(16247,'Pixel Ripped 1995','2020-04-23','Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Oculus VR, Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, PlayStation VR, Oculus Quest','Pixel Ripped is back with a brand new nostalgia-fueled virtual reality game-within-a-game, this time in 1995! Help our hero Dot face challenging throwbacks to all your favorite 16-bit and 32-bit classics while surviving the struggles of a typical nine-year-old kid.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8f8z.jpg'),(16248,'Fire on Fight: Online Multiplayer Shooter','2022-03-15','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fire On Fight : Online Multiplayer Shooter is a competitive online multiplayer first person shooter game with stunning 3D graphics and captivating gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5o2z.jpg'),(16249,'AI Olympius','2023-07-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join forces with rebels and their technologies to have a chance to restore freedom in a world that has fallen to the uncontrolled dominance of supreme artificial intelligence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78zo.jpg'),(16250,'Metroid: Other M','2016-12-08','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Wii, Wii U','A part of the Metroid series, it features gameplay in both first- and third-person perspectives, and is the first installment of the franchise to feature melee attacks which could only be executed when an enemy\'s health was reduced to a certain degree.\nThe game gave significant focus on plot and characterization, with extensive usage of cinematics and voice acting.\n\nThe regular gameplay features a third person perspective, where players hold the Wii Remote horizontally. Samus can jump, fire the arm cannon, and turn into a morph ball, which can roll into narrow passages and drop energy bombs. While gameplay is similar to early Metroid titles, the game\'s environments are three-dimensional and movement is not limited to a two-dimensional plane. Other M is the first in the series to feature a melee combat system. With well-timed button presses, players can use special techniques such as the Sense Move, which allows them to dodge enemy attacks, and the Overblast, where Samus jumps on the enemy and fires a charged shot at point-blank range.\n\nWhen the Wii Remote is pointed towards the screen, the angle switches to a first-person view, where players can lock onto targets and fire missiles; however, players cannot move in this perspective. There are several instances where players will have to constantly switch between play modes; for example, fighting off a horde of flying enemies in third person, while switching to first person to destroy their spawn points. Additionally, the first-person mode is also used in exploration, such as locating hidden items.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m7m.jpg'),(16251,'Pandemonium 2','1998-05-21','Platform, Puzzle','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','When the magic-infused \"Comet of Infinite Possibilities\" is about to pass over Lyr for the first time in 300 years, Sorceress Nikki decides that stealing the source of its magic is a quicker way to reach power than study. But the evil Goon Queen Zorrscha has her sights set on the comet as well. Nikki and Fargus, a pyromaniac court jester with his own special abilities, race the queen for the goal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y7e.jpg'),(16252,'Pantless',NULL,'Platform, Racing, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pantless brings a hilarious twist to the rage-inducing game genre inspired by Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy. In this third-person, physics-based game, players control customizable characters hilariously devoid of pants, navigating through chaotic and fun challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8af4.jpg'),(16253,'Chop','2019-09-13','Fighting, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Chop is an arena fighting game with a twist: your goal is not to have the highest kill count but to escape the arena through a portal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co268k.jpg'),(16254,'Fate/Grand Order: Epic of Remnant','2017-02-24','Role-playing (RPG)','Legacy Mobile Device','Fate Grand Order: Epic of Remnant (FGO Project 1.5) is a continuation of Arc 1 in the form of four story chapters before the start of Part 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a59.jpg'),(16255,'Ninja Shodown','2017-10-06','Fighting, Platform, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','It’s every ninja for themselves in the ultimate battle for the Jade Katana! Fight alone, team up or take on friends in brutal arena-based combat where the mighty prevail and the weak pay the ultimate price: death and dishonour!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2507.jpg'),(16256,'Murim Survival','2025-03-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Murim Survival is a survival roguelite where you battle relentless enemies within a time limit. Explore a world on the brink of collapse, master martial arts, collect powerful equipment, and unlock unique traits to become a true hero of the Murim. The fate of this world is in your hands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kvn.jpg'),(16257,'Hearthkeeper','2024-03-10','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hearthkeeper is a fantasy colony simulator, with rpg and platformer elements. Your characters will require food, water and shelter as the seasons change and the world turns. Plant crops, build structures, defend against raiders and beasts, research technologies and much more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o0o.jpg'),(16258,'Brigandine: The Legend of Runersia - Collector\'s Edition','2021-05-14','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','This edition includes the following:\n\n- PS4 Game: Brigandine: The Legend of Runersia\n- Cloth Map 42cm x 30cm\n- 52-Page Original Japanese Art Book A4\n- 2 x Original Soundtrack CD\n- 6 x Nations Postcard\n- Large Collector\'s Edition Box','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ysc.jpg'),(16259,'Accurate Adjacent Ballistics Simulator','2024-12-24','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','A.A.B.S. Accurate Adjacent Ballistics Simulator The Most Advanced Ballistic Damage Detection/Application System In Virtual Reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9783.jpg'),(16260,'Glitchphobia',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immerse yourself into unstable reality. In order to get out you must exploit glitch in a world around you. You can be sure of one thing, any rules you known no longer exist!! Do you have a courage to dip in it?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i5r.jpg'),(16261,'GraveyardGambit','2024-08-09','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','GraveyardGambit is an exciting 3D first-person game where you loot graves as a grave robber, evade guards, and buy upgrades. Experience a dark atmosphere, random events, and various weather scenarios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8loi.jpg'),(16262,'Personal Nightmare','1989-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','here\'s something very strange going on. It\'s as if you are living through your worst nightmare and unable to wake up. Won\'t anyone let you in on the terrible secret that haunts your walking moments.\n\nWhy has Jimmy Blandford taken to drinking - has he experienced the powerful forces of darkness? Why has your father, the dutiful local Vicar, neglected his parish without any apparent reason? Why did your mother invite you to stay for the weekend, then disappear without a word?\n\nWhat unspeakable horrors await you behind the closed doors of the old burnt out manor house? Are you ready to meet a vampire and do battle with a crazed hound sent straight from hell? Are you ready to be terrified beyond your wildest dreams?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/aln4r5ewdmw3jmqnfnti.jpg'),(16263,'Buddy Collection Extra: Kochousou no Kimyou na Go-nin','2021-02-04','Visual Novel','Nintendo Switch','Buddy Collection Extra: Kochousou no Kimyou-na Gonin includes a new scenario titled “The Peculiar Five of Butterfly Manor” that expands upon the main game\'s story and characters. Along with that, there\'s now more voiced character dialogue.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co699u.jpg'),(16264,'Sunken Veins','2025-04-27','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sunken Veins is a resource management horror game where you mine for coal and survive against monsters in an underwater coal mine. Keep the furnace powered, drain away water and repair leaks within the facility to complete your shift on time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qn8.jpg'),(16265,'Little Nightmares: The Residence','2018-02-22','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Residence is the fifth area Six passes through and the third area the Runaway Kid passes through in Little Nightmares and its DLC. It is where the Lady resides and is the last chapter of the main game and DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ubx.jpg'),(16266,'Galactic Revolution',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16267,'BlazBlue: Entropy Effect x Dead Cells','2025-09-30','Sin género','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nlz.jpg'),(16268,'Ocero 3D',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16269,'Big Pharma: Marketing and Malpractice',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Grab your free samples and your company credit card because it\'s time to schmooze - Big Pharma style! This expansion features executives, disease-awareness, new production-line tools, manual price setting, booster effects, building transfers and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cx8.jpg'),(16270,'Vitas Castle of Horror','2018-01-08','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vitas Castle of Horror is a fan-made horror game, mainly inspired by Amnesia, where you need to search for relics in the castle haunted by the ghost of the Russian singer, Vitas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b56.jpg'),(16271,'Age of Solitaire: Build Civilization','2022-07-27','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Build your civilization with the classic Klondike Solitaire card game. Beautiful graphics and healing music will help you to blow away your stress. Enjoy your time with the Solitaire card game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5735.jpg'),(16272,'Human Madness','2021-10-21','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Human Madness is a multiplayer survivor game , you can customize your character and the weapons','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gui.jpg'),(16273,'Freezing What If...','2025-02-09','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience an alternate world of Freezing in Freezing WHAT IF..., a fan fiction game that reimagines the world of the popular manga Freezing as a multiverse with an alternate history! A game strategy simulation + turn-based battle system awaits you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ogw.jpg'),(16274,'One Paradox',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16275,'Got High','2024-02-02','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','GOT HIGH - Engage in battle against the crowd in an exhilarating brawl, speed through labyrinthine traps in races, and compete on the arena in an exciting shooter. Three unique mini-games in one world, full of action and challenges. Are you ready for this multi-level challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vr9.jpg'),(16276,'Astro Fighter','1979-10-01','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','The game of Astro Fighter consists of 4 waves and a refueling stage, which are then repeated with increasingly higher difficulty. The player\'s task is to eliminate the four successive waves of different types of attacking craft, while avoiding being hit by missiles and bombs, and then refuel by shooting the \'GS\' ship before repeating the process. The player starts with 3 lives and receives a bonus life on reaching a score of 5000. 300 bonus points are received for shooting each 6 falling bombs and for 950 for hitting the GS ship accurately on the first shot. A very large bonus of 10,000 is given for getting through 4 waves and refueling by using exactly 2 shots more than the minimum needed. As the higher levels of Astro Fighter are difficult to survive consistently, even for the best players, the highest scores have been achieved by the achieving the 10,000 bonus deliberately.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yzyllckn3ozsajmuafuk.jpg'),(16277,'Turn It On!','2018-03-05','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Turn It On! is a collection of black boxes, where your task is to guess the mechanics behind. According to the played setting, you will use buttons, switches, wheels, knobs, handles, cogs, a handful of meters, displays, etc. You will need to recognize the machine\'s behavior and time your action wisely.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rsy.jpg'),(16278,'Harakiri! Geisha Girls','2023-01-20','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A new love simulation game MADE IN JAPAN! This slapstick love comedy is brimming with characters wreaking havoc in the glorious country of NIPPON! Get all lovey-dovey with one of the four girls (or all of them, you do you) and enjoy your new, improbable school life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e36.jpg'),(16279,'Fisher Guy','2024-08-09','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fisher Guy - A game with a top view, where the player as a fisherman must catch fish and deliver it to the chef\'s bucket, but only he will be hampered by eco-activists who are against your fishing, they have taken over all the islands!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kko.jpg'),(16280,'Driveclub','2014-10-07','Racing','PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR','DRIVECLUB brings to life the heart and soul of car culture. An incredible, authentic and immersive PS4 driving experience, DRIVECLUB makes you feel the exhilaration of driving the most powerful and beautifully designed cars in the world; all rendered in staggering detail, inside and out as you race them in richly detailed real-world locations alongside your Club.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pzw.jpg'),(16281,'Fantasia Sango 4','2007-12-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is the fourth installment of the role-playing series of stand-alone games \"Fantasy Three Kingdoms\".\n\nThe background of the story is set about ten years after the first generation. In addition to the latest developments in the series, it also inherits the battles of the Three Kingdoms and the unique world view of previous generations. Historical figures and military commanders also appeared in this generation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ghd.jpg'),(16282,'Vermillion Watch: Parisian Pursuit - Collector\'s Edition','2019-07-12','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Can you stop a powerful foe from taking over Paris?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16283,'Carnage','2024-12-13','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A love letter to the top-down racing games of yore. Race and shoot your way through a varied dystopian world to collect and upgrade your vehicles to survive and prosper in the CARnage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83q5.jpg'),(16284,'Zodiac Revenger','2024-10-10','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zodiac Revenger is a 2D action platformer. Took place post the Zodiac race, the 12 winners have been reward with great mystical power. They used it to spread chaos throught the peaceful land. Follow the Cat on a quest to dethrone the terror rulers, and get his own revenge on the Zodiac leader.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7aup.jpg'),(16285,'Aurora Trail','2017-12-28','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A new epic game where the perspective of the camera changes everything. Do not let your body parts get in the same view as a wall with the same color, or you’ll lose it! Puzzle your way through challenging and appealing surroundings and try to stay in one piece!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qteewiwpyphmnadx4aiy.jpg'),(16286,'Tiki Man','2015-06-05','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Chop the world\'s tallest Tiki! 4 tropical environments and 16 Tiki Men to unlock!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44ny.jpg'),(16287,'Radial-G : Racing Revolved','2016-12-31','Racing, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Oculus Rift, Xbox One','Climb into the cockpit of a futuristic race craft and tear up the anti-gravity track. Offering single & multi-player action, Radial-G delivers full immersion racing on tubular tracks featuring gut-wrenching twists, jumps, splits & unique inverted racing. Also supports Oculus VR.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24ps.jpg'),(16288,'Ice Caves of Europa','2018-07-09','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ice Caves of Europa will challenge your reflexes and your mind, blending free-flowing precision flight with confronting science fiction ideas about the nature of humanity. An inquisitive flying robot exploring the hazardous caves beneath Europa stumbles upon a sinister interplanetary conspiracy.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16289,'Silent Operative',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Silent Operative thrusts players into the shoes of a secret agent, where they must utilize a versatile arsenal of weapons and gadgets to navigate through dynamic and challenging missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9khz.jpg'),(16290,'City Adventure Touch: Mystery of Triangle','1987-03-14','Sport, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Family Computer','CITY ADVENTURE touch MYSTERY OF TRIANGLE is an action game for the Famicom and NES system that was published by Toho in 1987. The game is based on the high school and baseball team themed manga Touch. City Adventure Touch is somewhat notorious in Japan for bearing absolutely no resemblance to the source material. A comic book concerning the Mystery of Triangle is included in the manual. The story appears to revolve around a character\'s dog who disappears into an alternate dimension, and the three children who attempt to rescue it, one of which attacks by throwing baseballs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nu5.jpg'),(16291,'Starwinder: The Ultimate Space Race','1996-12-01','Sin género','PlayStation','In Starwinder: The Ultimate Space Race, you assume the role of Conner Rhodes, the first representative of Earth sent to compete in a galaxy-wide race. This isn\'t an ordinary race, however -- an unknown alien race built magnificent rails/tracks throughout the confines of space. Spanning thousands of miles in length, rails act in such a way that when pilots navigate toward one, it increases the speed of the ship.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vu6.jpg'),(16292,'Relic Hunters: Rebels','2022-05-03','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Android, iOS, Legacy Mobile Device','Shoot and dash through colorful levels while crafting and upgrading dozens of weapons. Defeat the Ducan Empire and bring peace to a divided planet.\nThis offline shooter/looter/RPG is chock-full of beautiful chaos — and offers an intriguing story.\nThe Hunters cross paths with Baru, a young leader on a planet inhabited by four warring Tribes. Our heroes must put their differences aside to help their new friends fight off the Ducan Empire and reclaim the all-powerful Void Stone.\nBattle enemies, and get blueprints, materials and resources. Use that loot to craft amazing guns — or improve the ones you already have. Customize your guns by upping the firing rate, adding projectiles and much more!\nUnlock and play as four different Hunters with unique stats and abilities: the shooter Jimmy; the rogue donkey Ace; the warrior Pinkyy; or the cool Raff!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4q50.jpg'),(16293,'Daemonsgate','2017-10-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Atari Lynx, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS','Daemonsgate is a Role-Playing game, published by Electronic Innovative Design, which was cancelled before it was released.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qks14xjejrke8jw7fp1v.jpg'),(16294,'Two Way','2016-11-21','Puzzle, Arcade','Android','With Two Way you have a limited number of bounces and touch to complete the level','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lfoulltyoahuku6vvmji.jpg'),(16295,'Oh Boy Cheese Remastered','2025-01-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Prepare for more cheesey action as you grab the cheese again hop on the broom one last time and remember get those presents when the game is finished dont forget to jump onto the scoreboard now you and a friend can team-up for an even higher score also go 4 player vs or take your skills online','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0n.jpg'),(16296,'Ocean Otter Climb','2025-02-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ocean Otter Climb is a 2D platformer game about climbing to great heights. Let\'s climb With CUTE SEA OTTER!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0f.jpg'),(16297,'Our Ascent',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16298,'Catie in MeowmeowLand','2022-03-30','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Catie in MeowmeowLand is a classical humorous point-and-click adventure game. Help little Catie get back home from the bizarre cat world of MeowmeowLand!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3my1.jpg'),(16299,'The Last Kids on Earth and The Staff of Doom','2021-06-04','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Join Jack and his friends in an epic, post-apocalyptic quest to save our world from the Queen of the Slime Monsters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2os1.jpg'),(16300,'Chiki-Chiki Boxy Pro Wrestling','2019-06-27','Fighting, Sport','Nintendo Switch','Voxel wrestlers intensely and furiously slamming into each other!Enjoy the fun, over the top moves that this game has to offer!\n\nThe battle gong sounds! Make your way through the tournament, aiming for the top!\n\nThe controls are easy! You can bust out flashy moves with just a single button.\n\nUnleash jump attacks, drops, holds, and specials, carrying them out just how you think of them!\n\nUp to 6 players can play. Compete in intense battles with players from all around the world!\n\nCombine your favorite parts and moves to create your very own custom wrestler!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m5t.jpg'),(16301,'Big Mountain 2000','2000-10-10','Sport','Nintendo 64, 64DD','Big Mountain 2000 is a wintersports game where you can choose to race downhill with either a snowboard or skis. There are various characters to choose from, each of them with different skills. Three game modes are available in total, in which free ride, slalom and giant slalom can be chosen as track styles; game modes include championship, time attack and also a battle mode for multiplayer challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47oe.jpg'),(16302,'Dragon Ball FighterZ: FighterZ Edition','2018-01-26','Fighting','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The FighterZ Edition includes the game and the FighterZ Pass, which adds 8 new mighty characters to the roster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hq1.jpg'),(16303,'Ocean Playground','2024-07-19','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This is a collection of multiple casual mini-games. A variety of mini-games allow players to experience different fun. All casual mini games are completely free to play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0g.jpg'),(16304,'The Bunnyman','2023-10-31','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','TheBunnyMan is a psychological horror inspired on newspaper and police archives. Police in Virginia has issued a public appeal to find a pregnant woman after reports of her missing. Her husband, a journalist is out to find her after the police search went cold. Something Evil is lurking...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tr3.jpg'),(16305,'Terrorist Takedown: Covert Operations','2006-12-01','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Terrorist Takedown: Covert Operations is a polish FPS game developed by CITY Interactive and released 01.12.2006. Set in the jungles of South America, you take on the role of a covert operative fighting a local drug cartel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c1a.jpg'),(16306,'Pentasma','2020-01-31','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pentasma is a side-scrolling arcade shooter inspired by Williams Electronics\' 1981 classic \'Defender\'. Protect The terraforming Humanoids from the deadly Aliens and raid the Alien planets to keep the galaxy peaceful!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lwu.jpg'),(16307,'The Dawn Obscura',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','A old-school role-playing adventure with choices and consequences, and turn-based hex-based party-based tactical combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0e.jpg'),(16308,'Overlord',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16309,'Nock & Load','2025-02-02','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become the best band of bowmen in the land by defeating all those who would stand against you! Nock & Load is a small, casual archery game with PvP and roguelike elements. Recruit archers into your troop and collect upgrades to outmatch your foes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q07.jpg'),(16310,'Obscura','2025-02-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Obscura is a first-person investigation game where, you play a medium who must solve cold cases by interacting with various elements and performing rituals. Learn about their past to understand their motives and crack the case. Please understand that the game will features sensitive topics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0d.jpg'),(16311,'Trivia King','2018-06-22','Quiz/Trivia, Indie','Amazon Fire TV, Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Have fun challenging yourself in Trivia King or challenge friends and family with you in Party Mode! Includes Your 8 Favorite Categories. High Quality Graphics. Party Mode (2-4 players locally). Gamepad Support. Family Friendly. Fun for all ages. So what are you waiting for? Prove you\'re the King of Trivia! (disclaimer: or Queen!)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8965.jpg'),(16312,'Bassline Sinker','2019-03-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bassline Sinker is a Shooter / Bullet hell that responds to your music. Add in your favourite .mp3 or .wav files and take to the high Cs, battling through the waves of creatures also using the power of music. Unlock and equip more weapons and enter the reef again!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16313,'Secluded','2017-04-22','Sin género','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Rooms define you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98im.jpg'),(16314,'Door Kickers: Action Squad','2019-10-27','Shooter, Platform, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Rescue hostages, disarm bombs and save the day in this old school, side scroller action with retro graphics and retro sensibilities. Coop MP Included.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20zt.jpg'),(16315,'The Ancient Land of Ys','1988-10-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Apple IIGS, PC-9800 Series, PC-8800 Series, Sharp X1, DOS, FM-7, MSX2, Sega Master System/Mark III','The hero of Ys is an adventurous young swordsman named Adol Christin. As the story begins, he has just arrived at the Town of Minea, in the land of Esteria. He is called upon by Sara, a fortuneteller, who tells him of a great evil that is sweeping the land.\n\nAdol is informed that he must seek out the six Books of Ys. These books contain the history of the ancient land of Ys, and will give him the knowledge he needs to defeat the evil forces. Sara gives Adol a crystal for identification and instructs him to find her aunt in Zepik Village, who holds the key to retrieving one of the Books. With that, his quest begins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4spt.jpg'),(16316,'The Light Ahead','2017-01-08','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','A simple story about a dark year punctuated by moments of beauty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6te4.jpg'),(16317,'Watch TV',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A retro, point and click styled horror experience with a heavy importance on sounds and awareness.\nYou must finish your show however the horrors are creeping in...','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16318,'Techno Tanks','2021-05-19','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Be ready for the Techno Tank experience! Deafest the enemy tanks while dodging their deadly bullets. Improve your aim and maneuver skills while surviving a crazy retro bullet hell. Level by level the enemy\'s tanks get faster, smarter, and deadlier. Can you defeat them all? Play alone, together with friends, or against your friends as the game features the following game modes: - Singleplayer Stage Mode - Singleplayer and Co-op Retro Mode with more than 50 levels - VS Mode for FFA Battles for up to 4 players','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yhs.jpg'),(16319,'Dark Souls III: Day One Edition','2016-03-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Windows Mixed Reality, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Dark Souls III: Day One Edition is a special edition of the game that was released in April 2016. It includes:\n\n- The base game\n- A Prima Starter Guide\n- The Official Dark Souls III Soundtrack\n- Exclusive O-Sleeve Packaging','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h03.jpg'),(16320,'Rot: Purgatory Hill',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ROT is short psychological horror game inspired by \"Silent Hill\" series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94c2.jpg'),(16321,'Angry Neighbor','2017-02-14','Adventure','Android','The neighbor was always an unusual person and something that he hid in his house, you become curious, and you go to his home, but instead of getting acquainted, he starts to catch you, avoiding the traps of a neighbor, and also independently studying the house.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1lad.jpg'),(16322,'Quick Math Game','2017-09-13','Puzzle, Indie','Android','Test your mind, skill and speed in the fight with time. \n \nFind the required number using 40 different numbers in 4 columns and 10 rows. \n \nFirst row has four randomized numbers between 1 and 10, second row has randomized numbers from 11-20 and so on.... \n \nUse these numbers to fill up the three fields and apply the four basic elemental operations to achieve the correct number! \n \nCompete with other players in Leader-boards and strive to be on the top!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16323,'LootOnline','2017-12-04','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Loot. Win. Repeat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9go9.jpg'),(16324,'30s Quest Tile',NULL,'Puzzle, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Questing with a rush!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16325,'Northgard: Nidhogg, Clan of the Dragon','2020-11-25','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','The most alien of all clans, the Dragons follow ancient customs and embrace freakish traditions. They use sacrifice and slavery to further their goals, often earning the other clan\'s distrust.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gyr.jpg'),(16326,'The Last Sight','2023-08-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You started a neighborhood security program, which gradually expanded in size. Over time, it evolved to monitor not only homes but also warehouses, gas stations and various other locations. However, as your program grew, it began attracting the attention of dubious individuals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w1a.jpg'),(16327,'Dreadful River','2023-02-28','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The realm is under attack. The king and his most loyal guards are trying to save the Eternal Crown. Floating down a vast river on a simple raft, you have to fight enemies, improve your gear, find allies and explore mysteries along the shores. Can you turn the tide?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hk6.jpg'),(16328,'Cyberpunch',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Cyberpunch is a post apocalyptic beat em up game for 1-4 players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o0i.jpg'),(16329,'Rise Online','2022-04-15','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rise Online is the Massively Multiplayer Online Role Playing Game (MMORPG) developed by Rokosoft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7trf.jpg'),(16330,'Anode','2019-08-17','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Anode reintroduces the classic falling-block puzzle genre, with new twists and challenges! Link blocks back and forth across each other. Match angled couplers to create chains of multiple colors. Play Mission Mode and complete randomly-generated objectives for more challenge!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lje.jpg'),(16331,'Onslaught','2024-11-09','Racing, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game features a highly dynamic background soundtrack, offering players an intense and thrilling challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0r.jpg'),(16332,'Glowkeeper','2025-12-31','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A luminescent puzzle game about manipulating elements. By the light of fireflies, link and dissolve elemental forces to construct bridges, break through obstacles, and traverse a glowing, interconnected world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lny.jpg'),(16333,'Rocket Boots Mania','2025-01-23','Racing, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rocket Boots Mania is a fully-loaded 3D platformer set in a thrilling open world filled with interactions, puzzles, secrets, and collectibles. The game features singleplayer campaign as well as asynchronous multiplayer through online leaderboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99br.jpg'),(16334,'RoboCop: Rogue City - Unfinished Business','2025-07-17','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','RoboCop: Rogue City – Unfinished Business is a new standalone adventure of RoboCop: Rogue City. OmniTower is their fortress, violence their language. Face elite mercenaries all the way to the top of the tower and enforce the law amidst the chaos!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i71.jpg'),(16335,'Starpoint Gemini Warlords','2018-02-09','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A unique blend of space sim, RPG and 4X games. Conduct research and construction in your own gigantic space station, command your war fleets and heroic companions to invade enemy territory, build up your stronghold, trade, mine, salvage and remind your enemies why they fear you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1z40.jpg'),(16336,'mySudoku',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16337,'Bob the Cube','2018-05-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bob The Cube is a 3D platformer game. Bob The Cube is the main character of the game. Bob\'s girlfriend was kidnapped and you have to complete all the levels to rescue her. You have to go through 15 unique 3D and 2.5D levels in 5 different worlds.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16338,'Dream Drifters','2021-01-02','Arcade','Android','You\'ve entered a deep dream taking you into the Dreamscape and infinite realm for you to explore. As you drift you\'ll encounter Nightmares that will try to end your dreams so be sure to dodge them. How deep can you travel?\n\nIn this casual infinite runner, you\'ll drift through an infinite path and dodge incoming enemies. Take a step back from being awake and drift for a while.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31zi.jpg'),(16339,'OG Memory: Synthwave Vampires','2024-11-02','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','OG Memory: Synthwave Vampires is an memory game with scary Vampires in an stunning synthwave style. You have to find the same correct pairs to completle the game in as few rounds as possible. Find all of the pairs to get a new try and beat your record.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0k.jpg'),(16340,'Only The Lost Shall See','2025-01-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wander though nature. Overcome dangers. Get to the end of your pilgrimage... But don\'t dig any deeper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0q.jpg'),(16341,'Royal Block',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','Step into the fast-paced arena of RoyalBlock.to, a competitive block-based Battle Royale game. Players worldwide align and clear blocks, strategizing to outlast their opponents in a grid showdown. Crafted by a dedicated solo developer, RoyalBlock.to offers a unique and refreshing twist on classic puzzle mechanics. With a commitment to regular updates and a completely free-to-play model, this game is a testament to passion-driven development. Dive in, challenge yourself, and see if you have the strategic prowess to be the last player standing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75ov.jpg'),(16342,'Space Universe','2016-06-15','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Space Universe —take part in a vast procedurally generated Universe. Players will realize their ambitions and ideas, therefore developing and moving ahead on the way into the Universe. \nIn Space Universe, you will have a full freedom of action: you can destroy everything in your way, investigate space bodies, extract valuable materials, build ships / stations and many other activities! \nIn Space Universe, you aren\'t playing the superhero who is urged to rescue the Universe from an inevitable accident. You differ in no respect from the others, and in fact start out weaker than them. Only by training and gaining experience and intellect will you learn to survive and become stronger.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16343,'MindFall',NULL,'Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a game about Rubik\'s cube! Here you have to control the cube and get to the end, but everything is not so simple. If the cube turns over on one of the sides, its control will change, and it will not be so easy to pass!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pwj.jpg'),(16344,'Days of Memories: Junpaku no Tenshi-tachi','2007-06-19','Visual Novel','Legacy Mobile Device','Junpaku no Tenshitachi takes place in a hospital and is a mystery-romance story. The protagonist is a patient, injured due to being trampled by a horse in the beginning.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gjx.jpg'),(16345,'Odyssey: Realm of Echoes','2024-12-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game that blends exploration and adventure , offering two modes. In the dynamic RPG mode, players confront powerful bosses and equip weapons and armor to build their strength. In the solo platformer mode, players navigate treacherous environments filled with obstacles to reclaim lost powers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0i.jpg'),(16346,'Numbers Destiny','2025-01-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to this game, where you\'ll experience the deep strategy hidden behind simple operations in this number puzzle game. This is an easy-to-start but hard-to-master puzzle game suitable for players of all ages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0b.jpg'),(16347,'Wargame Construction Set Pack',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fn2.jpg'),(16348,'Alchemy Quest','2020-03-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Familiar needs HP to survive. Collect crystals while avoiding/destroying enemies. Use abilities to restore HP and to destroy enemies. Enemies are attracted by familiar\'s light.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dm3.jpg'),(16349,'The Wolf of Derevnya','2023-04-04','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','When the villagers of Derevnya begin turning up maimed, suspicion falls on you. Track down the beast to clear your name and save the village—but to unravel the mystery, you will need to confront your own past. A survival-horror choose your own adventure set in Kievan Rus\'.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co657r.jpg'),(16350,'Homing','2020-03-13','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A sad, queer, narrative-focused epistolary game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ass.jpg'),(16351,'The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim - Premium Edition','2012-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Physical World Map Exclusive Imperial Symbol T-Shirt (large size) The Infernal City: An Elder Scrolls Novel Six Exclusive Concept Art Postcards Bonus disc* containing Official Trailers, Gameplay Walkthrough, Official TV Spot, Developer Documentaries, Official Strategy Guide and Five In-Game Musical Tracks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sqi.jpg'),(16352,'Liminal Spaces: Outside The Backrooms','2025-01-22','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Have you ever wondered what Liminal Spaces are outside the Backrooms? Explore them in this surrealist short game based on lucid dreaming and liminal spaces in the nature.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q15.jpg'),(16353,'Iratus: Lord of the Dead - Wrath of the Necromancer','2020-10-28','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Content expansion to Iratus: Lord of the Dead. Includes new minions, bosses, enemies and story content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d8b.jpg'),(16354,'Tower of Hermes','2024-04-11','Racing, Indie','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8456.jpg'),(16355,'Brutal Ball','2024-04-04','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Brutal Ball is a retro-styled shooter-sport hybrid where players can kill each other with gauntlet weapons or giant controllable spiked balls of destruction. Players strive to work together and dominate a match scoring goal after brutal goal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ihc.jpg'),(16356,'Blamdown Udder Fury','2016-08-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blamdown: Udder Fury is a fast-paced twin stick shooter about a cow with a bazooka and a lust for revenge. It\'s all about creating chaos, blowing stuff up and having a fun. Jump on top of buildings, gun down enemy jetpack-troopers and blast away tanks with your trusty bazooka! Battle your way across the American continent to avenge your girlfriend Rosa, who ended up as a Captain Patriot™ hamburger for 5.99','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mck.jpg'),(16357,'Only Trump: Up To Presidents!','2024-10-18','Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The elections are just around the corner! - will you be able to win them, overcome all the difficulties and reach the final? ONLY UP: TRUMP FOR PRESIDENT - a game in which you will feel like Donald, going through many difficult obstacles, because the basis of the game mechanics is the OnlyUp mode!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0s.jpg'),(16358,'Rage Melee','2019-09-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jump in to this unique take on the 2 player fighter in Rage melee. Play the game to build up your rank in its 5 different difficulty\'s. Can you beat the competition and Skyzzim in this action packed arcade fighter?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y8l.jpg'),(16359,'The Falconeer: Warrior Edition','2021-08-05','Fighting, Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Falconeer: Warrior Edition includes the fully updated game, plus \'The Hunter\' DLC, adding a new player class with a flyable Ormir dragon and a set of pyro pot guided rockets, and the new \'Edge of the World\' DLC, containing 3 additional side quests and new boss encounters. Experience the free-flying escapism of flying a giant warbird across a stunning open world. Discover a vast oceanic world filled with lost myths and breathtaking landscapes. Soar above the clouds and engage in spectacular aerial dogfights. Join and support your faction, taking on missions that may change the fate of your comrades as well as your own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gi1.jpg'),(16360,'Nantucket: Masters of the Seven Seas','2019-09-16','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Set sail around the world and face historical whaling captains in this brand new expansion for Nantucket. Masters of the Seven Seas introduces the Challenge Mode, a new game mode set in a new cylindrical map of the whole world with randomized whaling areas, new cities to visit and new events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dub.jpg'),(16361,'Bendy and the Ink Machine: Chapter Two','2018-11-20','Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Bendy is back! Experience the heart pounding second chapter of \"Bendy and the Ink Machine\"!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83xx.jpg'),(16362,'Final Desolation','2024-02-05','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 100% vanilla 8 level DOOM wad, dedicated to Cacodoomonic\'s beloved late doggie Layla and their beloved late mother, both of which loved DOOM, and often used to watch them playing it. They both passed away, their dog on August 3rd 2023 and their mother September 27th 2023. This game is dedicated to them both and may their memory live on forever in this mod.\n\nThe wad is an 8 level chapter starring Joan Dark as she fights against the forces of Hell as it invades the UAC bases and gradually takes over. A powerful demon, code-named only DESOLATION, has risen from the depths of Hell and brought with it an army of darkness that is utterly relentless. DoomGuy isn\'t around. Nobody is around except the demonically possessed corpses of former fellow UAC military... so it\'s up to Joan Dark to deal with this on her own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rzk.jpg'),(16363,'NASCAR: Dirt to Daytona','2002-11-11','Racing, Sport','Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Can you survive in the world of NASCAR? NASCAR: Dirt to Daytona challenges you to become the ultimate racer in four different NASCAR racing series. Racing to win is the key for drivers hoping to advance from small town dirt tracks to modified cars, trucks, and eventually the highly prized NASCAR Winston Cup cars. Learn the harsh realities of the racing world where losing can cost drivers not only points in the standings but loss of money from a sponsor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ydr.jpg'),(16364,'Legacy Of The Legends','2023-06-02','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A PSX Style, Horror, RogueLike, Adventure, MetroidVania Game Made By Digital Artisans Game Team\n\nAvailable For Microsoft Windows, Linux, And MacOS','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6tc6.jpg'),(16365,'Eight Dragons','2021-05-28','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Can you and up to seven of your friends defeat the criminal gangs of the city and stop MR BIG? Prove your skills in EIGHT DRAGONS, an old-school scrolling beat-\'em-up straight outta the eighties!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3097.jpg'),(16366,'Rune Knights','2020-10-27','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rune Knights is a cooperative, third-person, hack-and-slash action RPG focused on customization, crafting, and combat. Level up by killing monsters, collect loot, craft your own weapons and armor, and choose from over 120 unique talents and 60 different powerful abilities. Customize your character\'s aesthetics, stats, and gameplay as you battle through procedurally generated and hand-crafted levels with a variety of enemies and bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d7j.jpg'),(16367,'Daredevil Dave: Motorcycle Stuntman!','2010-05-11','Racing','iOS','Play through motorcycle stunt scenarios as Daredevil Dave.\nReleased for iPhone OS 2.2.1+ in 2010.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7f7b.jpg'),(16368,'Pac-Man Couchcade','2022-03-31','Arcade','Plug & Play','Have a seat, get comfy, and Play Again with an Arcade1Up Couchcade!\n\nEasily connect the Micro Game Console to your TV via HDMI port, the wireless control deck features real-feel arcade controls on top, and a soft bean bag bottom. Yep, retrogaming just literally fell into your lap!\n\nAnd yes, the Pac-Man Couchcade is absolutely packed with games. Let’s start off with our headliner, the icon of icons, PAC-MAN. Power up that nostalgia (no matter what your age), as you guide him through those infamous mazes, while steering clear of aggressive ghosts BLINKY, PINKY, INKY and CLYDE. Then take on the sequel, PAC-MANIA!\n\nOh, and that’s just the start of the phenomenal game list: you’ve also got the underground antics of DIG DUG and DIG DUG II, the interstellar action of GALAXIAN, GALAGA, and GALAGA ‘88, the lighthearted fun of MAPPY, and yeah, NEW RALLY-X and ROLLING THUNDER!\n\nYes, ALL are included. Switch up to any game at will, with the easy to navigate on-screen menus.\n\nTen games, unlimited retrogaming fun. If there’s any reason to become a couch potato (with no apologies), this is it. your Arcade1Up Couchcade is here!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8amv.jpg'),(16369,'Amanatsu: Perfect Edition','2024-05-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After moving to a sleepy seaside town, Haruto befriends three unforgettable heroines, each with unique traits—and a surprise confession. Navigate your own summer of love on this sugar-sweet journey of romance and discovery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ayi.jpg'),(16370,'Amok!','1998-12-31','Arcade','Odyssey 2 / Videopac G7000','Amok! was the first Odyssey² new release about 15 years after the console was discontinued. It is inspired by Berzerk.\n\nThe player is trapped in a spaceship and is armed with a laser pistol, which can fire in all 8 directions. Each stage is a maze with one or more exits, and the player has to try to exit them while avoiding to touch its walls and get killed. Besides the danger of the walls, the player will face the berzerk robot sentinels, which can move about and shoot, but that can also be killed if they touch the walls. After a while, the Smileybot will appear and try to kill the player. The Smileybot can pass through walls and cannot be killed by the player.\n\nThe game features 12 stages of increasing difficulty. The player has 3 lives; dying will make the player restart the current level, with all berzerk robot sentinels being replaced.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zfw1zmbtqx00aydltbbj.jpg'),(16371,'Trainz Railroad Simulator 2022: CFR Calatori Bmee 26-16 096','2024-03-17','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Manufactured in 1988/89 at the \"VEB Waggonbau Goerlitz\" factory in Germany, these doubledecker cars were and still are used for regional passenger transport in Romania, and many have been modernised. This pack features 1 version of these modernised cars, PBR textures, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91gx.jpg'),(16372,'Together We Live','2022-10-14','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Kyoya awakens in a dimly lit room. According to the girl who happened to pass by, the world has perished. Reluctant to believe, Kyoya sets off with the girl to search for other living beings, journeying through the ruined world together. However, the girl had a purpose. To atone for the sins of humanity, she must continue to die. Again and again, dozens of times, hundreds of times, thousands of times, tens of thousands of times. She dies and then comes back to life. As he watches her, who knows only suffering, Kyoya starts to desire to teach her about happiness. Together We Live is a new version of the visual novel Stand By You, featuring completely redrawn graphics and a new improved translation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jtf.jpg'),(16373,'Primal Light','2020-07-09','Fighting, Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Inhabit Krog, a mysterious blue creature in a red loincloth, as he traverses a labyrinth of ladders, levers, traps, and monsters. Explore the nooks and crannies of a bizarre and evocative world as you hack and slash your way to victory, leaving a graveyard of grotesque bosses in your wake.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cjt.jpg'),(16374,'JDM: Rise of the Scorpion','2024-08-08','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience the automotive culture of Japan with a free prologue to Japanese Drift Master. Learn about the story of the rebellious high schooler Hatori and race through the winding roads at Haikama Lake. Discover the places where drift was born!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mk8.jpg'),(16375,'Evemnesis','2018-08-15','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','For many years you have been an excellent worker for the system. You have retrieved countless relics and faced hundreds of meaningless challenges. But every explorer has one last mission. You are starting to realize that your final quest inside the cyclical structure is near.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69cf.jpg'),(16376,'Exo Rally Championship',NULL,'Racing, Simulator','Sin plataforma','Exo Rally Championship is the galaxy’s most dangerous off-road racing event - remote, unexplored, extreme exoplanetary rally. Master a brutally realistic racing simulation and fight for every second gained on your quest to become a champion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m2n.jpg'),(16377,'Galak-Z: The Void','2016-05-06','Shooter, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An updated and re-branded version of the original game.\n\n\"The long awaited DLC for GALAK-Z is finally upon us! We are rebranding GALAK-Z to reflect the update as well as to make it clear that the new content opens up a whole new way to play. With newly implemented Online Leaderboards, The Void game mode provides an endless playground for players to showcase their moment-to-moment survival skills and to post their scores as a challenge to friends and foes alike. GALAK-Z is all about honing one’s ability to dexterously pilot their ship and to strategically leverage the mech form to take on any set of enemies and environmental hazards. While GALAK-Z still has the narrative based procedurally generated Rogue and Arcade story modes, The Void focuses on the essence of GALAK-Z while providing an ever-escalating difficulty curve to challenge even the most skilled player. And to help encourage true competition, we have introduced the Daily Challenge that provides the same unique loadout and level layout seed for all who participate each and every day. Players can come back daily to see who will top the leaderboards.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2170.jpg'),(16378,'Tomb of the Overlord',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Delve into the depths of the Tomb of the Overlord, a co-op action RPG where you battle relentless undead, master powerful classes, and forge your own path through multiclass progression.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16379,'Descensus','2024-09-03','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Descensus is a souls-like action-RPG with challenging combat set in post-catastrophe diesel punk world. The player\'s goal is to reach the heart of the mysterious Rift of the Fallen Star. It is necessary to stop the expansion and spread of the anomaly before it absorbs the whole world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s0i.jpg'),(16380,'Froggy\'s Battle','2023-07-19','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Froggy\'s Battle is an action roguelike game set in a loop. Help Froggy the steezy magician skater frog defeat all the baddies squatting her favorite riding spot. Choose your upgrades carefully, become more and more powerful and kickflip yourself through waves of enemies and ferocious bosses!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wx0.jpg'),(16381,'Railway Empire: Mexico','2018-06-08','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Discover the diversity of Mexico - take on new and challenging missions in the arid northern regions all the way to the dense jungles in the south of the country. Boost Mexico\'s economy in the new scenario by building a thriving infrastructure and exporting to the USA.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x9u.jpg'),(16382,'Angels of Death','2016-12-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"Please, kill me.\"\n\"If you get out with me, then I\'ll kill you.\"\n\nTheir strange \"promise\" formed a peculiar bond between the two of them.\nWhere are they? Why were they caught?\nThey desperately try to escape from the sealed building!\n\n\"Angels of Death\" is a psycho horror adventure game, which consists of four episodes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3li2.jpg'),(16383,'Super Lone Survivor','2022-10-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The masked protagonist must escape the city ravaged by disease, by any means necessary. Use stealth to scavenge food, or kill everything in your path. Nurture your mental health or descend into madness. How you survive is up to you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5opd.jpg'),(16384,'Ooga Booga Battle','2025-01-21','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Raise your Ooga Booga Baby for greatness in Ooga Booga Battle, a half virtual pet, half horde defense arcade experience! Train to evolve into a fierce cryptid and take down as many Ooga Booga Baddies as you can! Can you battle with the Ooga Booga Best of \'em?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0t.jpg'),(16385,'Ninja or Die: Shadow of the Sun','2023-08-02','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Unleash the power and speed of the Ninja in an ultrafast Roguelite that will leave you dead and wanting more. Ninja or Die: Shadow of the Sun is a singleplayer challenge with a rare offering: hardcore action and simple controls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kgx.jpg'),(16386,'Atlantic Fleet','2016-02-25','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Turn based tactical and strategic naval combat. Atlantic Fleet puts you in command of the Allies or Kriegsmarine (German Navy) in the longest military campaign of WWII, The Battle of the Atlantic.\n\nTake command of surface ships, submarines as well as carrier and land based aircraft in the deadly struggle for control of Atlantic shipping lanes.\nProtect convoys as the Allies or go on the offensive with deadly submarine wolf packs and surface raiders of the German Navy.\nPlay through 30 historical Single Missions or make your own with the Custom Battle editor.\nTake on 50 mission campaigns for each navy and build your own fleet.\nRecreate the challenges of the Battle of the Atlantic as you play a Dynamic Campaign with limited resources, historical units, actual convoy routes and real world-based weather.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/f6rxwtzgizffjszuaaco.jpg'),(16387,'Frogmonster','2024-04-02','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Discover some of the most charming and challenging bosses in Frogmonster, a Metroidvania FPS adventure where you explore a lively world filled with creatures, bugs, and beasts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7l4c.jpg'),(16388,'Euro Truck Simulator 2: Going East','2013-09-19','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Going East! add-on expands the original Euro Truck Simulator 2 map with new destinations for cargo delivery across Poland, Czech Republic, Slovakia, and Hungary.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mnz.jpg'),(16389,'Rooks Keep','2013-06-18','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Descend into a brutal tournament where factions of sinister knights and grotesque beasts battle for domination in bloody arena matches and furious melee brawls. Crush opponents with hammers and shields, rend flesh with razor sharp claws and slice off heads with swords and axes.\n\nIn Rooks Keep, players will maim their competitors in both a selection of deathmatch-arena game-modes such as \'Deathmatch\', \'Team-Deathmatch\', \'Conversion\', \'Chess\', \'Last-Man-Standing\' and \'Combat Chess\'. Play solo, jump into multiplayer matches, or add AI opponents to squash under-foot in both single and multiplayer. We even support 3rd party Chess engines.\nThe game is set in a uniquely styled fantasy world, where factions battle ceaselessly for your entertainment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yoq.jpg'),(16390,'Grapple Dogs: Cosmic Canines','2024-09-12','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Swing, jump, and blast through dimensions in this standalone follow-up to the critically-acclaimed 2D action-platformer Grapple Dog. Zip between action-packed worlds as Pablo and Luna team up to save the cosmos in their own unique ways.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zkt.jpg'),(16391,'Luna: Obscura',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A first-person psychological horror game of hiding, solving, and surviving inside a haunted moon base','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16392,'Alien: Blackout','2019-01-24','Strategy','Android, iOS, Mac','The terror of Alien is brought to life in Alien: Blackout. Try to stay alive while trapped aboard a crippled Weyland-Yutani space station carrying a deadly Xenomorph as it tirelessly hunts you and the crew. Outsmart the perfect hunter by making perilous choices. Players must rely on the damaged controls of the space station or risk sacrificing crew members to avoid deadly contact, permanently altering the outcome of the game.\n\nSurvive seven fear-inducing levels by remotely guiding Amanda Ripley’s crew through increasingly challenging tasks using only the station’s emergency systems. The uncertainty and unpredictability of both the alien and her crew can impose total defeat for Amanda and the entire station.\n\nAlien: Blackout is a unique fear-inducing horror mobile game experience that will test the inner nerves of both Alien and horror fans alike, where life can end in an instant.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1u3u.jpg'),(16393,'Bonk the Rat',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16394,'Frightened',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Windows Mixed Reality, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Frightened is a cooperative horror and survival game that can be played with 1-4 players. Your goal is to destroy the evil with your team and leave. Collect items in the area with your team, find the demon\'s weak spot and destroy it! But don\'t you dare get caught.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56pg.jpg'),(16395,'Hidden Objects Fantasy Games',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','Become overwhelmed by enchantment by playing this excellent fantasy game! It is a final hour to discover hidden things in beautiful pictures of fantasy world! Join the little forest fairy in this amazing mystic fantasy game! Let your imagination go wild while you lose yourself in awesome fairy tales of the enchanted forest!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16396,'Demon Compass','2024-11-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Demon Compass is a third person horror adventure game focused on exploration, light puzzle solving and abstract narration. Navigate through three separate story lines, each with distinct characters, environments, and challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98ym.jpg'),(16397,'Mini Metal','2016-04-22','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fight through hundreds of relentless waves of enemies in your very own tank!  \n \nMini Metal is a 3D fast paced shooter where you customize and control your own battle tank! Face off in an arena against wave after wave of unique enemies, destroying them with your powerful weapons! Collect coins and badges, and use them to purchase, unlock and upgrade new weapons and vehicles! Obtain rare and powerful powerups and special weapons, and crush your enemies in your unstoppable metal machine!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s6b.jpg'),(16398,'Portals of Phereon','2019-08-12','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Portals of Phereon is a turn-based tactical role-playing roguelike monster-girl creature-collector by erotic artist Syvaron. Select from one of three distinct protagonists, each with unique skill trees and specialties, and embark on expeditions through the Portals of Phereon to accrue enough strength to tackle the final mission before time runs out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74zw.jpg'),(16399,'Master of Orion Collector Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Collector Edition of Master of Orion: Conquer the Stars (2016). It contains the base game and the Terran Khanate faction DLC.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16400,'The Real Ghostbusters','1987-12-31','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle','Arcade, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Amiga, Amstrad CPC','A 3-player top-down arcade game where one player controls one of three unidentified ghost-busters. The game is based off of The Real Ghostbusters cartoon, rather than strictly off the movie franchise.\nThe player can choose between a red, yellow or blue-jumpsuited character though all have the same abilities. These powers include an energy gun that transforms a hostile monster into a harmless, basic ghost, which are then captured using the proton beam. Other abilities are an invincibility field and the ability to summon Slimer to absorb attacks instead of the player.\nIn Japan the game is known as Meikyuu Hunter G, but bears little resemblance to the western version as it did not use the Ghostbusters license.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co500k.jpg'),(16401,'Hero Must Die','2016-06-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation Vita','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gcg.jpg'),(16402,'Key of Impasse','2018-09-05','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Key Of Impasse is a VR room escape game.\nPlayers will be trapped in a closed room and get a 30-minute escape countdown.\nPlayers need to combine each of the clues they find, step by step to unlock the level settings in the secret room, and finally escape the secret room.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16403,'Triopticon','2023-03-13','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The story of this visual novel begins with a winter night crime. Detective Yu-chi Fang discovered that the anomaly at the crime scene was related to his own hidden secret. What is abnormal and what is normal? In the end, Yu-chi Fang must face his true feelings and make a choice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7omt.jpg'),(16404,'Son of Phoenix',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16405,'Beyond Memories: Tale of the Lost Souls','2024-11-28','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Play as a charming Grim Reaper, soaring through colorful skies to free souls and discover 11 heartwarming stories in this peaceful flight adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93f3.jpg'),(16406,'Airavat','2017-09-01','Adventure, Indie','Android','Airavat is an endless space survival game. The rules are simple, but the game is hard to master. In Airavat, you will control a very ancient spaceship built by the people of Indus Valley Civilization. The gravity of stars is the biggest enemy and you need to protect the spaceship and keep away from the stars. Build a high score by avoiding as many stars as you can. \n \nAiravat is a minimalist game with: \n \n- Insane touch controls \n- Great music \n- Awesome nebular backgrounds \n \nHistory \nIn 2000 BCE, space organization of Indus Valley Civilization predicted that the earth is going to experience multiple asteroid hits in a few thousand years. The ancient space organization developed Airavat, a spaceship, launched it into the deep space to explore the universe and find a new home out there, somewhere.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co270i.jpg'),(16407,'Raybound','2021-04-02','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Puzzle Platformer where the player must shoot at their environment to maneuver it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xp4.jpg'),(16408,'Ceiba','2023-11-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Ein, a simple-hearted member of an expedition sent by mankind to distant planets, tries to get romantic with a pretty but cold co-worker girl. Unfortunately, he is not the only one trying to make contact as from the abandoned and desolate alien ruins, the girl receives a message in human language.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gmy.jpg'),(16409,'Tower','2022-10-17','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tower is a top-down action game with adventure and puzzle elements. Fight out of a skyscraper full of terrorists. Find out what one motivated person can do against hundreds of thugs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44t5.jpg'),(16410,'Acceleration of Suguri 2','2011-08-13','Fighting, Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Take on all the characters of the Suguri universe in this lightning-paced duel-style shoot\'em\'up. Continue the story of the characters you\'ve come to know and love, and meet a new mastermind causing havoc on Earth. Play against the AI in Story Mode, or friends and foes online or locally in Multiplayer.\n\nAcceleration of Suguri 2 is a direct sequel to Sora.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tsh.jpg'),(16411,'Cossacks 3: Guardians of the Highlands','2017-04-12','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cossacks 3: Guardians of the Highlands gives you an opportunity to lead Scotland, a freedom-loving nation of highlanders, which makes its debut in the Cossacks series. Its captivating campaign will tell a tale about the triumphs of the Scottish people in the 17th and 18th century, and will allow you to personally participate in them. Among other additions to the game, the mini-addon brings AI-assistant – a great tool for both new players and the veterans of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vya.jpg'),(16412,'The Idolmaster: Poplinks','2021-01-21','Puzzle','Android, iOS','The Idolmaster: Poplinks is a mobile puzzle game featuring idols from all five branches. An Android only open beta test was held from December 4th (12:00 JST) to December 7th (17:00 JST) in 2020.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xs0.jpg'),(16413,'Kraken Academy!!','2021-09-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Make friends, free spirits and make sure that the world doesn’t end! Welcome to Kraken Academy, a technicolor fever dream that for legal reasons can only be described as \"technically a school.\" Join forces with a magical kraken to manipulate a time loop and save the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3an4.jpg'),(16414,'Master of Magic: Caster of Magic for Windows','2021-04-22','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Caster of Magic, the community update to the classic Master of Magic, is brought to the modern era with Caster of Magic for Windows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gx3.jpg'),(16415,'Galaxywars','2001-07-29','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator','Web browser','Galaxywars was the first major German-language browser game, operated by Gameforge AG. It was a browser-based, massively multiplayer, online real-time strategy game set on a space environment. The game ran on any standard browser and was free.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hy1.jpg'),(16416,'GogMagog','2023-01-31','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as the cyber-messiah as you bring judgment upon legions of heretics at the Armageddon. Build a deck of powerful abilities, scale up your gameplay with artifacts and create powerful synergies to smite the sinners!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dqu.jpg'),(16417,'Pokémon Rising Ruby','2016-09-12','Sin género','Nintendo 3DS','Rising Ruby and Sinking Sapphire are modifications of Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire that allow you to play through the main game with all 721 Pokémon obtainable and go through the challenge of a significantly stronger Pokémon League. A huge emphasis has been placed on Pokémon availability, with most areas in the game offering 10 or 11 species that haven\'t been seen before that point. The mostly equal chance of encountering any of the Pokémon in an area also mean you\'re unlikely to get the same thing twice on the first encounter, making the game lend itself well to Nuzlocke runs (if you can handle the extra challenge from the trainer battles!).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jdl.jpg'),(16418,'Aventuras na Selva','1983-08-01','Adventure','Sinclair ZX81','Aventuras na Selva is a text-based adventure developed by Renato Degiovani and published by the magazine Micro Sistemas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55u5.jpg'),(16419,'Stinger','1993-03-26','Shooter, Arcade','Family Computer Disk System, Wii, Family Computer, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System','Stinger is a shoot-em-up developed by Konami. It is the North American version of the sequel to Twinbee.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2iyd.jpg'),(16420,'Oublivious','2025-01-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Oublivious is a fast-paced combat platformer where you play as a daring thief battling through a deadly dungeon. Master precise platforming, overcome medieval traps, and defeat challenging enemies to uncover hidden treasure and achieve fame and fortune.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0z.jpg'),(16421,'Ninja Ming: Wu',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16422,'Catharsis','2020-03-11','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this game you advance the story through clicking. There are multiple endings, and the outcomes change according to the choices you make. You can find hints about the choices you will make throughout, as well as two main endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20gj.jpg'),(16423,'Pocket Battles: NFT War','2022-08-02','Fighting, Strategy','Android, iOS','Pocket Battles: NFT War is a casual strategy battle game in the world. Collect powerful NFT Heroes, merge and combine soldiers to create your own army and defeat other players. Prove your game skills and win special rewards in Pocket Championships, special league only for NFT Hero holders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65h5.jpg'),(16424,'Golden Sun QOL','2023-09-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Game Boy Advance','This mod implements the Quality-of-Life features used in Dawn of Djinn in a setting that better reflects the original game. For players who wish to experience the original world of Golden Sun with those features.\n\nAdjustments to Overworld Abilities/Quality of Life Updates:\n\nRetreat not only warps you to the start of a dungeon or town but now functions similarly to teleport when used on the world map. Using Retreat pulls up the map and you can select any town that you’ve previously visited to instantly return there. The linearity of Golden Sun doesn’t make this as needed as other RPGs, but it does open up some options that would be unreasonable in the original game, such as Retreating back to Imil to restock on Hermes Water.\n\nAvoid now behaves as a random encounter toggle rather than a wear off effect. Using it once turns off 100% of random encounters, using it again turns them back on.\n\nDefault Psynergy:\n\nBuilding off the built in Psynergy the Randomizer provided, many utility Psynergy like Growth, Whirlwind, and even Avoid are built right into party members so they have them, regardless of your class. In addition, Psynergy not tied to battle no longer cost Psynergy to use. Though they have different names to distinguish from their battle equivalents. For example in battle Growth still cost Psynergy to use, but outside of battle it is refer to as “Sprout” but otherwise functions the same.\n\nPsynergy Items:\n\nPsynergy items also behave differently as well. Often when you first encounter them they won’t be items, but rather weapons and armor you can equip to party members to get the effect without wasting an extra item slot. When the equipment becomes out-classed, you can sell it at a shop and a more traditional Psynergy item will appear in any item shop’s Artifact section.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75gh.jpg'),(16425,'Max Traffic','2022-02-21','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Max Traffic is a minimalistic traffic simulator where the player controls the flow of cars by managing the traffic lights. It is a mini casual game to relax to, but also excel at, by trying to achieve the highest score.\n\nEach level represents a flag, while the cars hold a minimalistic style. The sounds follow the same pattern by being abstract in their manner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ic7.jpg'),(16426,'Tactical Strike',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w50.jpg'),(16427,'Silent Sonata','2024-07-22','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into a chilling symphony of horror & harmony. Solve ancient mysteries, wield enchanted instruments, and face nightmarish foes. Will you compose your escape, or succumb to the melodies?\nStreamer Mode: Allows your live stream chat to wield the power to control jumpscares, atmosphere + more','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ozs.jpg'),(16428,'Among Us: Ejected Edition','2022-05-06','Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Among Us: Ejected Edition includes:\n- Among Us base game and all of the DLC items\n- Retail Exclusive \"Innersloth Cosmicube\": featuring cosmetics from prototypes we made that never became full-fledged games\n- Limited Edition SteelBook\n- Impostor Syndrome Sticker Sheet\n- 1 of 12 Special Mira HQ Holographic Access Cards\n- Folded Skeld Map Poster designed\n- Redeemable Code for 6 PC/Phone Wallpapers\n- Crewmate vs Impostor Lanyard\n- Purple Crewmate Plush\n- Spinning Into Space Enamel Spinner Pin\n- Crewmate Fleece Blanket (60\" x 90\")\n- Red Impostor Beanie (6\" x 6\" x 5\")\n- Limited Edition Ejected Edition Box','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3v0h.jpg'),(16429,'Quick! Mom\'s Home!',NULL,'Simulator','Android, iOS','Do your chores, build your empire and don\'t get grounded! \n \nYour mom is pulling into the driveway! Hurry! Get your chores done before you get yourself grounded! \nQuick! Mom\'s Home! (QMH) is a simulation tycoon game. \n \nDemo your chores today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rvbe8k3ok1tp1hng8dg5.jpg'),(16430,'Euro Truck Simulator 2: Nordic Horizons',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Euro Truck Simulator 2 reveals another upcoming map expansion, the Nordic Horizons, taking players through the captivating landscapes of northern Europe!\n\nThe expansion features expansive fjords of Norway all the way to the Arctic Ocean, challenging bridges, underwater tunnels, and narrow roads, complete with encounters with reindeer and coastal fishing villages. Drive through Sweden’s Norrland, offering a diverse environment, from settled regions along the main E4 road to the barren hills of the Scandinavian mountains. Finland’s Lapland, with its dense coniferous forests to the expansive barren tundra, presents a stark contrast to the southern part of the country\n\nThe DLC includes tens of cities and towns, showcasing typical Nordic architecture and delving into Viking history. Additionally, Nordic Horizons promises a seamless blend of nature, history, and trucking excitement, offering players an unforgettable Nordic adventure. Get ready for a seriously big adventure with this expansion which offers so much to explore!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ogf.jpg'),(16431,'Godinc','2025-04-06','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9reu.jpg'),(16432,'Ourkade','2025-01-01','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ourkade is bringing back your favorite childhood mini-games. Play quick, retro-style games that are easy to learn but challenging to master. Unlock achievements, earn tickets, trade items on the Steam store, and compete for high scores. Play your way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q10.jpg'),(16433,'Outsider',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Shape humanity\'s future in a sci-fi narrative game where choices matter. Experience an extraterrestrial contact while deciphering an overarching mystery of far-reaching consequences. Who is the Outsider?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q13.jpg'),(16434,'Gran Turismo 7: 25th Anniversary Edition','2021-03-04','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Gran Turismo 7 brings together the very best features of the Real Driving Simulator. Whether you’re a competitive or casual racer, collector, tuner, livery designer or photographer – find your line with a staggering collection of game modes including fan-favorites like GT Campaign, Arcade and Driving School. With the reintroduction of the legendary GT Simulation Mode, buy, tune, race and sell your way through a rewarding solo campaign as you unlock new cars and challenges. And if you love going head-to-head with others, hone your skills and compete in the GT Sport Mode.\n\nGran Turismo 7: 25th Anniversary Edition includes:\n- PS5 Game Disc with PS4 Digital Game Entitlement via voucher\n- Exclusive SteelBook case\n- 1,100,000 CR (in-game credit)\n- Toyota GR Yaris with country-specific livery\n- 30 manufacturer & partner PSN Avatars\n- The Music of Gran Turismo Official Soundtrack\n- Three-car pack, including:\n- MAZDA RX-VISION GT3 CONCEPT Stealth Model\n- Porsche 917 LIVING LEGEND\n- Toyota Supra GT500 \'97 (Castrol TOM\'S)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4cf9.jpg'),(16435,'Rap Simulator',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rap Simulator is in basically a production with a great deal of humour. The action starts in the 80s of the last century. The player takes on the role of a rapper who sets up his first music studio in a rented apartment. Our task is to break out of the underground and become a part of the mainstream for good, opening our own label or creating the best clothing brand. Beefs, chases, money, green leaves, shootings, gang wars or maybe a softer way to success? The way the player chooses to reach the top will depend only on him/her. At the beginning of the game, the player\'s budget is limited, so you have to decide which aspect of the production you want to devote more attention to at the cost of the other elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ie8.jpg'),(16436,'Cube Survival: LDoE',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16437,'Operation: Strike & Secure','2024-11-18','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Operation: Strike & Secure is a tactical and realistic FPS where every shot matters, designed for intense solo or team-based online combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q0v.jpg'),(16438,'Outside','2024-12-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Outside is a retro adventure game into a little town filled with Easter eggs and game references! Discover new places and meet familiar faces. Helping those along the way and collecting costumes to end the day.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q16.jpg'),(16439,'Batman: Arkham Knight - Crime Fighter Challenge Pack 5','2015-12-22','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Crime Fighter Challenge Pack 5 introduces various combat and predator maps featuring Batman, the Batmobile, Nightwing, Azrael, and Harley Quinn. This expansive challenge pack allows focused training in Freeflow Combat and Invisible Predator stealth incursion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fvw.jpg'),(16440,'The Exterminator',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16441,'Nook Fall: West Town',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Sin plataforma','A charming yet fantastical town, where vitality and decay constantly collide. We hope that through interactions with characters and objects, and the sensory experience created by visuals and sound, you can connect with the emotions and charm of this little world of West Town.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q08.jpg'),(16442,'Animal Falling',NULL,'Platform, Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Animal falling is a multiplayer party game featuring cartoon animals in ball form, engaging players in a platform race filled with strategic obstacles and traps to hinder opponents. Unleash your mischief, obstruct rivals, and navigate the chaotic hilarity to victory in this wild, furry showdown!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94eu.jpg'),(16443,'Sexy Ladies','2025-01-02','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sexy Ladies is the simplest 2D puzzle the final goal of which to give you pleasure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70xd.jpg'),(16444,'Outl1ned','2024-12-03','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fast-paced 1D arcade shooter. The Y and Z axis are overrated, it\'s time to play a game that pushes X to the limit. OUTL1NED.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q12.jpg'),(16445,'Hadron\'s Forge',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16446,'Escape from the Nursing Home','2025-01-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dry mouth, arthritis and poor eyesight? That is not surprising, because you\'re an old man! It doesn\'t matter how you ended up in the nursing home, it matters how you get out of it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9az1.jpg'),(16447,'Dreadful Aurora',NULL,'Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yandere fan game','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16448,'Gunpoint','2014-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Gunpoint is a stealth puzzle game that lets you rewire its levels to trick people. You play a freelance spy who takes jobs from his clients to break into high security buildings and steal sensitive data.\n\nTo get past security, you\'ll need to make creative use of your main gadget: the Crosslink. It lets you see how all the security devices in a level are wired up, and then you can just click and drag with the mouse to wire them differently. So you can connect a lightswitch to a trapdoor, then flick it when a guard walks across to make him fall through.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qra.jpg'),(16449,'Zamboni Driver',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16450,'Bibi Blocksberg: Der Magische Hexenkreis','2005-08-13','Sin género','Game Boy Advance','In this game teenage witch Bibi navigates isometric levels to help out friends and family and flies her broom in 2D side-scrolling levels to fix the mess evil witch Malicia has caused in the city of Neustadt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4pax.jpg'),(16451,'Froggy\'s Farm & Friends','2022-08-06','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help a friendly frog named Phroge as they farm, craft, and explore. Plant and grow crops for potion crafting, discover their unique magical qualities, and explore to uncover new friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52ad.jpg'),(16452,'Cirrata',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Cirrata is a Metroidvania style indie video game about Keir, an anthropomorphic red panda who also happens to be a chef. The game is. inspired by the popular console games of the 90\'s. ​ Fight waves of enemies and improve your reputation in town to grow the town\'s pub.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fal.jpg'),(16453,'First Things First','2001-12-31','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You\'ve just arrived at home from your nightly visit to the science and invention section of the local public library, where you spend each night dreaming your dreamy dreams of one day inventing a time travel machine. Tonight, for some reason, you\'re especially fatigued, and can\'t wait to get inside and go right to bed. Seems like a good plan, but somehow you have a premonition it\'s not going to be that easy...\n\nA piece of interactive fiction written by J. Robinson Wheeler.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57h4.jpg'),(16454,'Ancestors Legacy: Saladin\'s Conquest','2019-05-21','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take command of Saracen warriors in a brand-new single player campaign that will take you far from the battlefields of Europe. Follow another path of history and help Saladin protect his desert lands against the Crusaders. Unique new units will help you crush your enemies in 5 story-based missions and on 3 new maps for multiplayer and skirmish mode.\n\nIn the ‘Saladin’s Conquest’ campaign, players will experience the story of the greatest Sultan of Egypt and Syria, the founder of the Ayyubid dynasty – Salah ad-Din, who crossed the border to the Kingdom of Jerusalem in 1187 with the largest army he had ever commanded. As Saladin, with his prominent generals Gökböri and Abdullah, players will have the opportunity to defeat the great army of the Kingdom of Jerusalem at the Horns of Hattin. Conquer the most essential strongholds of the Levant and take part in the siege of Jerusalem.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1q5s.jpg'),(16455,'Domin\'Ant','2020-04-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Domin\'Ant is a game of confrontation between Gerard, an alcoholic in his forties, driven by loneliness in his dilapidated house, and Cassandra, the ant who will do anything to reduce it to ashes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co254z.jpg'),(16456,'Captain of Industry','2022-05-31','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Factory construction and management simulator. Alone with your loyal crew, expand a small colony of survivors into an industrial empire! From an abandoned island to vast factories, research labs, and space program. Build, mine, farm, shape terrain, explore and take care of your settlement!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31hc.jpg'),(16457,'Everhood','2021-03-03','Music, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Expect the unexpected in an ineffable tale of the inexpressible world of Everhood. Amusing rhythmic battles and with a promise to fulfill all your dreams. To simply put it: You are in for a ride.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47m2.jpg'),(16458,'The Adventure of Hourai High School','1996-04-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Super Famicom','You assume the role of a student (whose gender you can choose) still aboard the flight towards the fictional Utsuho Island of Southern Japan, the location of the strangest school of the country: Hourai High School. This huge educational complex, which houses more than one million students and personnel (how is that even possible?), seems to acts as a magnet for weird youngsters and nonsensical events. And you get the privilege of a great start. Indeed, an irritated stewardess decides to send you to your destination via a shortcut... by throwing you out of the plane with a parachute.\n\nAfter a forced landing through a ceiling, here you are, at Hourai High School. The year hasn\'t started yet and teachers already have you in their sights. You\'ll get to meet new friends real soon however, particularly the guys behind the school\'s newspaper \"Hourai Sports\". You\'ll even get the chance to take the place of the editor, even though you are the one who sent him to hospital by landing on his head. But the course of your new school year will soon be disrupted by the establishment of extravagantly oppressive school laws, which seem to be manipulated from behind the throne.\n\nSome may compare this game to Mother 2, seeing the delirious scenario and modern setting. They wouldn\'t be entirely wrong, as Hourai Gakuen no Bouken, more than its atypical universe, shares with it classical RPG gameplay and first-person battles. The progression is pretty different, though. It\'s based on the school campus\'s map, with each of its parts constituting \"villages\" of some sort, and to which the player will be required to come back regularly to use the services housed in the main buildings. The limits of the world map will widen as the chapters that lead us through the school year unfold, and more exotic and less \"academic\" regions will gradually make their apparition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x7c.jpg'),(16459,'Wuppo: Definitive Edition','2019-09-05','Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','After losing its home, one lonely Wum must travel the length and width of the world to find a new place to live. From the metropolitan haven Popocity to the cavernous Bliekopolis, our Wum will discover magical places and encounter strange creatures. But this Wum is no traditional hero and only by using wit and charm can it succeed in this massive journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uy0.jpg'),(16460,'Mondo Pong','2017-05-02','Sport','Atari 2600','Mondo Pong was Piero Cavina\'s first programming effort on the Atari 2600 and is an evil variation on the game that started it all, Pong. In this version there are two balls and they each have a mind of their own! Sometimes the ball will double back at you after you hit it, other times it might just spin around in circles for a bit, keeping you on your toes as you wait for it to shoot off in some direction (hopefully not at you!)\n\nThere are several game variations that allow you to select one or two players and a score limit of 15 or 45. There is also a normal vs. hard option, but that is not implemented in this version of Mondo Pong.\n\nThis is an Alpha Version of Mondo Pong as it was never completed! Therefore, the game doesn\'t have the polish you might expect from a finished game and there may be a few bugs. Nevertheless, it\'s still an interesting concept and a hoot to play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yno.jpg'),(16461,'Urban Rivals World','2009-12-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Roll up your sleeves and lay down your cards! Urban Rival is a truly original, free, collectible card game. It is a game of skill and strategy that allows you to create your own gang and challenge other players in fast and furious fighting. The games are simple but intense and in just a few minutes you can control the whole of Clint City by putting your Pillz, Fury and bluffing skills to good use!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5a51.jpg'),(16462,'Color by Numbers - Dinosaurs','2018-05-15','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Paint by numbers - an interactive coloring book for children. This mathematical game teaches children to recognize numbers and solve simple mathematical examples. In addition, this program develops memory, attention, imagination, and logical abilities.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16463,'Zombie Hills','2020-10-13','Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Zombies are coming! Defeat all the zombies, build and conquer the tallest hill in the world! The main feature of Zombie Hills is based on the terrain elevation after the enemies are defeated. You will need to use strategies to shape it as needed and achieve game goals. Zombie Hills is an addicting action game based on one simple rule: every zombie is a brick to elevate you to the sky!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ijx.jpg'),(16464,'Saint Seiya: Sanctuary Battle','2012-03-16','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3','Saint Seiya: Sanctuary Battle immerses players in the most popular drama from Saint Seiya: the Sanctuary, as Seiya and his companions fight side by side to defeat the gold saints of the twelve palaces and protect Athena. As players complete quests and progress through the twelve levels, they can inflict tremendous damage on their foes with fast-paced Cosmo power-up attacks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gdw.jpg'),(16465,'Aliens: Fireteam Elite - UACM Frontline Pack','2022-04-19','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Advance to the frontlines with the latest in combat technologies. Prepare for tomorrow\'s battlegrounds with the UACM Frontline Pack - over 25 items including class kit skins, weapon colors, head accessories, emotes and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5q3c.jpg'),(16466,'#womenUp, Super Puzzles Dream','2020-05-30','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Puzzles move onto the next level with ‘Super Puzzle Dream’, a mix between classic jigsaw and a ‘Tetris’-style dynamic mechanic. #womenUp! is the \'hashtag\' for this programme, which dedicates beautiful illustrations and emotive phrases to women on completion of every puzzle. Two levels of play, \'senior\' (for adults) and \'junior\' (for children aged 3+), guarantee hours of entertainment for all. Become an expert and finish the puzzles in the shortest possible time and you will find yourself amongst the best in the world on the online leaderboard. You can also play with friends and family in the one-on-one split-screen competition mode. Your rival won\'t make it easy for you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4e2f.jpg'),(16467,'Wildcat Snack Attack','2025-03-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An action survival game where you have to defend your snacks from wildcats. Hit them with water balloons to turn them away and save your snack stash, or turn to vending machines if you find yourself running low.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9md3.jpg'),(16468,'Ski Stunt Simulator','2001-12-31','Platform, Simulator, Sport','Web browser','Ski Stunt Simulator is a realistic physics-based simulation of acrobatic ski stunts with intuitive \"mouse gesture\" controls.\n\nThe player has to ski down a slope, perform certain stunts and land safely. If you succeed the crowd will cheer, if you crash the crowd emphatically yells out \"aah\". Ski Stunt Simulator was first released as a online Java game/experiment. Later it was released for Windows with more features and levels and better graphics.\n\nThe first Java web based game only has 4 stages: kicker jump, crash & burn, the wall and practise. The Windows version has 23 stages divided over 4 difficulty levels: trainer, beginner, intermediate and professional. The Windows version also has additional features like collapsing cliffs and bridges, falling boulders, a bombshell and a jet pack\n\nYou control the posture of the skier through the X and Y position of the mouse cursor. Move the mouse up and the skier straightens out, move down and he’ll crouch. Move left or right and he’ll lean forward or backward. The simulation interpolates every mouse position in between, making the skier move from one posture to another in fluid and natural movements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8785.jpg'),(16469,'Aura Kingdom','2014-01-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Aura Kingdom takes place in an anime-styled vast world rendered with detailed graphics. The game consists of primarily open world with instances that can either be partaken as solo or in a party. Players can choose between a variety of classes, with ten classes released and an upcoming one, as of May 2014. The players can freely customize their character or avatar with many choices of hair styles and faces and much more. It is then proceeded with the choice of four Eidolons, who will accompany the player throughout the game, while also giving the ability to earn other Eidolons.\nWithin the game, the player can interact with many non-player characters and enter combat mode with monsters outside of the hub world. The combat system is primarily the player using a wide variety of skills corresponding with the class against the monsters, who also have their own set of skills. The majority of the game is to simply attack and defeat the monsters along the way while partaking quests. The combat system is unique in a way that, although the player has to click on a monster to engage in combat, the player also has the ability to move to dodge and use their skills in a variety of ways. With an accompanying Eidolon, the player\'s Eidolon can also fight alongside their character, and also use a combination attack. The combat system is not merely a \"click-and-watch\" combat. Outside of the combat system, the player can also engage in several different tasks, such as fishing, crafting, and many more.\n\nWhile the game is situated in a free-to-play environment, the game also allows the players to purchase Aeria Points, or for short AP, that allows the players to use that monetary value for special in-game items found in the Item Mall. Otherwise, the game uses the gold and silver tactic, which can be acquired a number of ways. The game also allows the use of trade, a self-installed stall in Navea, and the Auction House. Players can also use the mailing system to mail other players using the cash-on-delivery system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91r4.jpg'),(16470,'Kokoro Clover Part1','2020-07-04','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join the Spirit Summoner, Treffy, in this side-scrolling action-platformer in the style of a Sunday morning anime TV show. In part 1, Treffy begins her story with Spirit friends and some clumsy bad guys. Fight using magic and transform using Elemental Spirits in this exciting and comedic adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jv4.jpg'),(16471,'Will','2017-11-06','Simulator','Web browser','Are you prepared to let go?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gq9.jpg'),(16472,'Office Jigsaw Puzzle - Work Environment',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16473,'Anyland','2016-10-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Anyland is an open virtual reality universe to create your home, chat with others, explore & live in! Made from the ground up for VR, and shaped by all of us together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pfl.jpg'),(16474,'World of Grimm','2024-03-19','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fast-paced 5-minute digital collectible card game in the Brothers Grimm universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nh6.jpg'),(16475,'Snwbrd: Freestyle Snowboarding','2023-02-06','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac','Snwbrd - Is a Snowboard Game like AMPED and inspired by the AMPED Original Xbox Game, an action-packed, open-world snowboarding game that lets players experience the thrill and freedom of shredding the slopes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7idg.jpg'),(16476,'Secret of the Lost Cavern',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16477,'M.A.X. 2: Mechanized Assault & Exploration','1998-06-29','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A level of complexity unseen in contemporary strategy gamesChoose either simultaneous or turn-based game mode to fit your personal preferencePlay as one of 8 human clans and use dozens upon dozens of land, sea and air units','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5krw.jpg'),(16478,'Hayarigami Portable: Keishichou Kaii Jiken File','2005-12-15','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','From chain mails that leads to murder, mysterious suicides and missing children, you, as a police officer have to put all your brain cells to work, connect the events together to discover the truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zjl.jpg'),(16479,'Elite MotoVlog','2021-02-26','Racing, Simulator','Android, iOS','Elite MotoVlog is a motorcycle game designed to bring a new experience to players who enjoy this Moto vlog style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7my8.jpg'),(16480,'Exophobia','2024-07-23','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Explore and fight your way through a crashed human spaceship infested with relentless hordes of aliens as you become more powerful with exciting weapon upgrades and powerups in this retro inspired first-person shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tvt.jpg'),(16481,'Isekai Brick Breaker','2022-10-12','Arcade','Android','Enjoy the sounds. Crush enemies and collect loot. Gain experience and improve skills. Open chests and equip gear. Complete quests and get rewards. Buy equipment in the shop with coins.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5r25.jpg'),(16482,'Heretical','2024-10-30','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Choose your hero and defeat the guardians of the Sanctora Mountain, as you attempt to reach the mountaintop and dethrone Abidan, a ruthless demigod cult leader. In a familiar rogue-lite manner, dying is part of progression, granting you new game mechanics, playable characters, skills, and weapons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8txv.jpg'),(16483,'Gingerbread Man',NULL,'Platform','Sin plataforma','Unrefined sugar, flour, ginger and heat have combined magically to produce consciousness and mobility in a delicious culinary confection. You, a Gingerbread Man, find yourself baking in a gas-fired oven, and you must find a way out! Gingerbread Man is based loosely on the popular children’s story of the same name. And although this game is appropriate for children, it’s not child’s play! \n \nIn Gingerbread Man you must fight your way through 20 levels consisting of five unique game-play screens, facing a variety of obstacles and challenges in order to survive! In the first level you begin in a hot oven where you must escape before being cooked alive! Once you break free from the oven, you find yourself in the dining room where you need to collect all of the balloons and float up to the roof through the chimney. Now that you\'re on the roof you must build a bridge to a nearby tree while fighting off cats and birds that want you for a tasty treat! Once in the tree, you need to evade all the dangerous creatures in the forest (will you ever get a break?) And if you do escape the forest, you enter a cave where you must fight off your most fearsome enemy yet! \n \nOnce you defeat the boss, to your dismay you are captured again and put back in the oven too cook some more, and this time the heat has been turned up! Will you ever escape? Can you battle through 19 levels to have your chance to out-fox the final boss and win your freedom? \n \nGingerbread Man includes three game variations: \n \nSelection 1 is the default. \nSelection 2 is expert mode. \nSelection 3 is a special mode for children.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nz38gldzrv5tzgbaj0lt.jpg'),(16484,'Kingdom Hearts Dream Drop Distance HD','2020-02-18','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Kingdom Hearts Dream Drop Distance HD is a full HD remaster of Kingdom Hearts 3D: Dream Drop Distance designed for the PlayStation 4. It was released as part of a package of three games entitled Kingdom Hearts HD 2.8 Final Chapter Prologue.\n\nThe game is largely the same as its Nintendo 3DS counterpart, but includes some additional features as well as alterations designed to adapt the game to the PS4. The conversion from two screens to one is the most notable of the changes seen. Little has changed in terms of gameplay. However, three new Dream Eaters have been introduced and minor game features have been altered to adapt to the PS4.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8m1w.jpg'),(16485,'Mosaic Maze','2016-02-12','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mosaic Maze is a minimalist hardcore precision platforming game for PC. The rules are simple - use infinite jumps, precise movement and lots of trial-and-error to move around the mosaic. Avoid red tiles, and make use of other tiles to help you progress through the levels. Each loop you make around the mosaic changes it, building a progressively more difficult obstacle course ahead of you. Skill, precision, careful planning and lots of practice are essential for navigating the levels and reaching the end.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16486,'Until the Last Plane','2022-11-30','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Manage your airfield, create spare parts, send your pilots out on missions. Face your enemy and resist... UNTIL THE LAST PLANE.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tx8.jpg'),(16487,'Blackwake','2017-02-24','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Blackwake is a multiplayer team-based shooter centered around naval battles for PC and Mac. Set during the Age of Sail, Blackwake focuses largely on team-based tactics and overall team cooperation. Organizing a ship broadside, assisting your captain in navigating various weather conditions, or just being part of the gun crew - there are many roles to be filled in this shooter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22yv.jpg'),(16488,'Let\'s Ride! Silver Buckle Stables','2006-03-14','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Train horses and compete in competitions in this horse riding simulation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jej.jpg'),(16489,'Use Your Outside Voice, Richie Tozier!','2020-06-11','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An interactive alternate ending for the 2019 movie It Chapter Two. Playing as Richie Tozier, you return to the house on Neibolt Street to relive the events of the movie and try to get everyone out alive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3fdq.jpg'),(16490,'Polar Golfer','2004-09-01','Sport, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play through 9 or 18 holes that trek through gorgeous valleys and alongside inlets. Forget making divots - Polar Golfer has so much talent; he whacks the ball with just one paw! Guide the ball in mid-air and steer it on the putting green with your mouse. Score bonus points and shoot farther with power rings, and unlock Polar Bowler\'s friends with your high scores. The characters you met and clicked with in Polar Bowler are back in a fun-filled sequel: Polar Golfer! \n9 or 18 hole courses \nYou guide the ball \nEarn bonus points and power rings \nUnlock PB\'s friends','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nbd.jpg'),(16491,'The Unintended Consequences of Curiosity','2019-03-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Unintended Consequences of Curiosity is a casual adventure puzzle game. A couch co-op that is equally playable solo. It packs a heart warming story and a charming world for everyone to explore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jnt.jpg'),(16492,'Samly\'s Merge','2025-04-08','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Easy to learn, hard to master. No time limits. No rush. Just relax and merge in pixel-art goodness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n54.jpg'),(16493,'Madvent Calendar 4: End Of The Line','2023-12-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The infection is spreading like wild fire. Just one year after the New Spook City incident and every major city is crawling with Mourning Folk.\n\nNo one can shake the feeling that things are getting worse. Something is about to break, but maybe a new season of Madvent can stave off the inevitable for a bit longer.\n\nThe world is lonelier than ever before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kid.jpg'),(16494,'Supesu','2018-07-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is small dimensional puzzle where you can spend an hour-two while listening to relaxing music.\nRules are quite simple - you need to lead the ball to its finish line.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63jx.jpg'),(16495,'Sakura Valentine\'s Day','2017-12-31','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sakura Valentine\'s Day is an eroge visual novel. Players control Haru, a man who could not find a date for Valentine\'s Day. Suddenly he finds two girls from his past, Akemi and Naoki who both want to go on a date with him. Haru decides to meet both girls and see who fits him the most, switching back and forth between the two every hour. Eventually Haru had a hard time choosing and the dating with both girls went on throughout the whole day, until Valentine\'s Day ended.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e8k.jpg'),(16496,'Nerve','2020-07-21','Racing, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hurtle through beautiful unforgiving worlds, where every frame is enthralling, every moment is exhilarating, every death is deserved, and every success is earned.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cu9.jpg'),(16497,'Hex Survivor','2021-09-15','Puzzle','Android','Hex Survivor is a tactical match 3 gem game where you should survive as long as possible to get more scores and unlock new upgrades and classes.\nChoose the best purchase and upgrade combination to survive more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co503u.jpg'),(16498,'Kamen Rider Blade','2004-12-09','Sin género','PlayStation 2','A Bandai published action game for PlayStation 2 based on the longrunning Kamen Rider series','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jz6.jpg'),(16499,'大话江湖','2020-07-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cx9.jpg'),(16500,'Jumpy Dog','2021-03-30','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Guide your dog home through dangerous pillars as the sun sets!\n\nThe first mobile game from Tomb Studios, Jumpy Dog is a blast from the past that is sure to reignite the addiction you never thought you\'d want again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wq7.jpg'),(16501,'Dragon Ball Online','2010-02-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dragon Ball Online was a massive multiplayer online role-playing game being developed in Japan and South Korea by NTL, set in the Dragon Ball universe. Dragon Ball Online takes place on Earth, 216 years after the events of Goku\'s departure.\n\nA beta testing of Dragon Ball Online was announced to begin in South Korea during the summer of 2007, but was delayed until January 2010. NTL Director Koji Takamiya stated in numerous interviews that he would like to see a global release for the game. On September 26, 2013 the Korean servers of the game were shut down and on October 31, 2013 the Hong Kong and Taiwan servers of the game were shut down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pyq.jpg'),(16502,'Foxtrot','2021-05-19','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Class-based multiplayer FPS action game with multiple game modes. You can play as one of four classes - Assault, Engineer, Heavy, or Recon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30jq.jpg'),(16503,'Spider Lander','2018-11-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A loving echo of games from the 80\'s and familiar to those who loved classics such as Lunar Rescue and Lunar Lander. Swing on a thread from your mothership and thrust safely down to rescue some of those poor guys on the planet, then try to escape safely.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16504,'Submachine Universe','2010-06-08','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Submachine Universe is probably the first ever MSO (massively singleplayer online) created in 2010, extended ever since. You can freely travel between different locations, read theories about Submachine and observe how things work inside this network. There are locations that you might recognize from previous games, there\'s a lot of new yet undiscovered content, there are even locations that you think you know, but they\'re somehow different. Surely worth a look. The best part - it\'s an open project, which means I can add more locations later on and it will all work together smoothly. So, tinfoil hats on and start exploring if you dare, because there are some dark places inside.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wrw.jpg'),(16505,'Lophis Roguelike-Card RPG game: Darkest Dungeon','2019-01-14','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Android','We fused card games and roguelikes together to make the best single player deckbuilder we could. Craft a unique deck, encounter bizarre creatures, discover relics of immense power, and Dark Dungeon Survival -Lophis Fate Card Rougelike is a single-player RPG card game.\nThe game incorporates the popular Roguelike game elements and creates rich unknowns and diversity, ensuring that the game experience is different for each time. In the game world, players need to make choices when encounter emergencies, and defeat the enemies in the adventure combat by establishing card group strategies so as to complete the adventure tour of the roles.\n\n【Independent role story】\nThere are six different careers of roles with different career skills and exclusive cards. Each role has an independent plot and independent battle ending.\n\n【Different chapters of the plot】\nA total of four chapters are included. Maps and the regional guardians of each chapter are randomly generated. Players need to defeat the final boss to clear the stage.\n\n【A Large number of emergencies】\nRandom emergencies will occur during the game and different decisions need to be made so the entire adventure may be influenced. Currently more than 60 emergencies have been designed in the game.\n\n【Brain-burning card group building】\nThe card group building in the game adopts the method of DBG, which means players do not have to choose from a big card pool to build their own card group. There will be a set of initial card groups according to different careers. Players can constantly acquire other cards during the game process and gradually perfect the card groups that are suit them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zx4.jpg'),(16506,'New Super Mario Bros. Versus: Doodler\'s Mayhem','2024-03-29','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A mod for Mario Vs Luigi that adds multiple new stages and characters ft. Green Greens and many others','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dwp.jpg'),(16507,'The Race Against Time','1988-12-31','Platform','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC','LA CARRERA CONTRA EL TIEMPO \nEn el juego tomas la persona de Ornar Khalifa, el legendario corredor sudanés. Debes recorrer el mundo transportando la antorcha del Sport Aid 88 y conseguir que la gente se una a La Carrera Contra el Tiempo. Esto se conseguirá izando una bandera y encendiendo la llama en la antorcha de cada uno de los 6 continentes. \nEl juego tiene más de 100 escenarios, incluyendo lugares famosos, tales como las pirámides de Gizeh, el palacio de Buckingham, el monte Rushmore, el Kremlin y las cataratas del lago Victoria. \n¿Cuántos lugares podrás reconocer mientras juegas? \nComienzas el juego de madrugada en el campo de refugiados de El Mowheli, en Sudán, debiendo encontrar primero el aeropuerto. Utiliza el mapa del mundo para escoger tu destino y pulsa la tecla de Acción para ir hacia ese continente. Tu misión es izar la bandera y encender la llama con tu antorcha.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uuvt8bwngj39hchyk0b8.jpg'),(16508,'Dobraminhos','2021-08-02','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f2f.jpg'),(16509,'Zunius','2019-10-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zunius - A psychedelic rogue-like bullet hell','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co435s.jpg'),(16510,'Aces of the Galaxy','2008-06-04','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','3, 2, 1 Blast-Off! Launch yourself into the intense space-shooter Aces of the Galaxy  A non-stop, old-school arcade thrill-ride for the 21st century and beyond. Utilize an impressive arsenal of upgradeable weapons including high powered missile launchers, devastating torpedoes and the ever-reliant chain gun to annihilate the ships of the wretched Skurgian Empire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80rq.jpg'),(16511,'All Aboard! The Train Defense Express','2025-03-05','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Protect the Infinite Power Generator by looping around the train tracks! Battle endless waves of enemies in this unique hybrid of auto-battler, survivor, tower defense, idle/clicker gameplay. How long can you survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lic.jpg'),(16512,'Pixel Starships 2',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Pixel Starships 2; the sequel to the popular Pixel Starships game is currently in development. Please add to your wishlist to receive the latest updates.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fgh.jpg'),(16513,'Beetle Adventure Racing!','1999-12-31','Racing','Nintendo 64','Take control of a collection of the latest Volkswagen Beetle \"2.0\" models, from street type to off-road designs, and race across varying road types that will test your speed and endurance!\nFind shortcuts or use nitro boosts to finish first in order to move on to the next track. If the computer AI is to easy for you, battle against a friend in two player race mode or challenge up to 4 people in a special Battle Mode, with added abilities including weapons, from mines and rockets to magical elements, while collecting the flag and finding the exit!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28su.jpg'),(16514,'Gravity Pilot!','2019-08-19','Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You are the last Gravity Pilot! Help the Earth to collect important research by moving on from planet to planet while keeping watch on your fuel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kqc.jpg'),(16515,'Dogenstein','2025-06-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"WOKE\" NO MORE! Blast through waves of politically correct and \"WOKED\" lunatics in a hilariously violent story of liberation and revenge. The legendary DOGE fights back in an action-packed RETRO FPS. Say goodbye to political correctness!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1r.jpg'),(16516,'G-Mode Archives+: Idol Janshi Suchie-Pai - Milky no Yabou','2021-12-23','Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Even if you cheat, if you win you\'re in the right! If you lose you have to strip! Have a dreamy time exchanging tiles with beautiful girls.\n\nThis work, which was previously released on feature phones, is a side story of Jaleco\'s beautiful girl competition mahjong game \"Idol Janshi Suchie-Pai\" series.\n\nMilky Pie, an alien in the form of a rabbit\'s ``Chikyu-Seifuku Project\'\' begins in earnest!\nSeifuku... Seifuku... That means everyone\'s \"uniform\" is in danger! ?\n\nIdol mahjong player Suchie-Pai, a self-proclaimed righteous heroine, stands up to face the shameless crisis of the earth! !\n\nMake full use of \"loading (cheating)\" by consuming points and \"Suchie Stick\" to draw Tsumo, win the mahjong match with beautiful girls, and steal everyone\'s \"uniform\" before Milky Pie. ! !\n\nEnjoy two-player mahjong with reward CG, online rankings, and anything goes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84ug.jpg'),(16517,'Projeto: Átomo','2022-11-25','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Projeto: Átomo, a thrilling shoot\'em up/bullet hell game, you command the Alefuzo team\'s spaceship racing to escape Mars after a disastrous expedition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7a62.jpg'),(16518,'Super Stone Legacy','2017-05-26','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super Stone Legacy is a hack n\' slash action RPG that is fast, flashy and exciting to play. Dash at enemies, dodge fireballs and unleash huge \"SUPER\" attacks! Fight through an ever changing dungeon as the forces of evil grow more powerful with each room, or invite some friends over for couch co-op!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/n8uozrgabgsehvw9f4zb.jpg'),(16519,'Dextram','2021-11-08','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dextram is an arcade shoot \'em up game with a twist. There is no shooting, and you can only turn right. The player controls a ship that is always moving forward, and by pressing a button the ship turns right. The game is a simple score chaser with the goal of getting an as high score as possible. Points are given by getting the enemies to crash, either into each other or into the walls. There are also different power-ups to that can be used to destroy the enemies such as a laser, missiles and a shield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3062.jpg'),(16520,'Postal 2','2005-04-15','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Try to live a week as The Postal Dude doing everyday chores on your to-do list, such as picking up milk at the grocery store. In a world where cats can be used as assault rifle silencers, it\'s not surprising that a milk carton costs 5 bucks. Stealing said carton might be relatively easy in your basic corner shop, but when the shop is owned by a bunch of trigger happy jihadists, you might want to think twice about trying to leave without paying for your overpriced groceries. Little mistakes like that might just flip the switch and make you go postal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fqo.jpg'),(16521,'Wasteland 3: Cult of the Holy Detonation','2021-10-05','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Cult of the Holy Detonation expands the Wasteland 3 experience with entry into the Cheyenne Mountain complex, crammed with new characters, enemies, challenging combat encounters, and powerful new weapons and armor. Your squad of Rangers will be tested like never before in objective-based encounters that put a creative spin on the already deeply tactical turn-based combat. As they face overwhelming odds, the Rangers will need to shut down reactors, clear ventilation systems, and engage defensive countermeasures to stem an unending tide of dangerous mutants and machines within the dilapidated military bunker.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nsf.jpg'),(16522,'Splat Death Salad','2012-12-31','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A multiplayer FPS game with several modes to choose from & customize. Made for 7DFPS in June 2012.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65uz.jpg'),(16523,'Sustained','2024-09-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a open world Survival Zombie game with allot of survival mechanics and PVP in Multiplayer. Join a few friends and look who can survive the island full of zombies and other players trying to survive like you, it has base building, food, water, Temp and much more','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wky.jpg'),(16524,'Schizophrenic Rooms','2022-08-03','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Diagnosed with schizophrenia, try to leave your company while terrifying things happen.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16525,'Hidden Object: Walk the Plank',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16526,'Hidden Caves','2021-10-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Find the caves elements that are hidden on the map.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e9n.jpg'),(16527,'Mordheim: City of the Damned - The Smuggler','2016-02-04','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This Hired Sword is a new Hero-type unit that can be recruited to further customize your roster. The Smuggler is available for the Mercenaries and the Sisters of Sigmar Warbands.\n\nThe Empire\'s division benefits those who would sell contraband or avoid the many taxes imposed by barons and burghers. No commodity is more enticing to Smugglers than Mordheim\'s Wyrdstone. Smugglers must be skilled with swords and pistols, accustomed to fighting against many foes, and not averse to tricks and traps. Most of all, they must be charismatic, able to rally their comrades in their darkest hour.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66f1.jpg'),(16528,'Typing Ninja','2025-06-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Typing Ninja is an upcoming fast-paced typing game where players type falling words before they hit the ground, featuring Arcade and Story options. Players can use power-ups, face challenging bosses, and customize keycaps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91fg.jpg'),(16529,'Kingdom of Fallen: The Last Stand','2024-05-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kingdom of Fallen is inspired by survival and souls-like games. Your mission is to gather clues of your missing daughter, using your own way to defeat fearsome bosses, through crafting or fighting, to reveal the secrets, and get out of this cursed kingdom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qqr.jpg'),(16530,'The Gentleman',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','The Gentleman is a musical narrative game, set in the time around the Great Depression, that follows the story of Fred and Lisa.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ufs4so0hqg0scdns3das.jpg'),(16531,'Elixir Emporium',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Unleash your creativity in a world of infinite crafting and endless adventure.\n\nEngage with dynamic NPCs, create unique items, and explore a truly responsive, magical world where every choice shapes your journey in a myriad of ways.\n\nNew game data generates as you play based on the actions you take, so you\'ll never run out of new things to discover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co994l.jpg'),(16532,'Pretty Bird 2','2022-09-06','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Pretty Bird is a young bird learning to fly. Help Pretty Bird overcome various obstacles and most importantly get the highest possible score!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57ge.jpg'),(16533,'Cecconoid','2019-10-08','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Cecconoid is an 8-bit inspired, flick-screen, twin-stick-shooter, set in an alternate dimension where the pixels are still chunky, and the bad guys are black and white. Except for their red dangly bits...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cld.jpg'),(16534,'The Silent Swan','2023-11-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','The Silent Swan is a first-person open world narrative experience across a monolithic, derelict world. Mixing both the walking simulator and open world genres together, the game brings the meaning of openness to urban areas for the first time to this scale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nc6.jpg'),(16535,'Highway Blossoms: Next Exit','2020-09-25','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Return to Las Vegas with Amber and Marina in this new Highway Blossoms story! A couple months after the events of the first game, the two girls return to the desert city for an alien-themed convention and to see Tess for her birthday. They also end up reuniting with Cassi, the candy shop girl, who\'s determined to start following her own dreams.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h7r.jpg'),(16536,'Feisty Fauna',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Feisty Fauna is a ridiculously cute survivors-like / bullet heaven where you\'re an animal trying to survive. Whether it\'s by laying traps, being a ninja, or charming minions, you will hunt other cute animals in this eat-or-be-eaten animal world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l0s.jpg'),(16537,'Rift One',NULL,'Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rift One is a sci-fi FPS where you, Mark maxin get stranded on a alien planet. you must try to find a way off.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1w63.jpg'),(16538,'Honkai: Star Rail - The Crepuscule Zone','2023-11-15','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Version 1.5 of Honkai: Star Rail, which includes:\n• New characters: Huohuo, Argenti and Hanya\n• New area: Fyxestroll Garden\n• New trailblaze mission\n• New companion mission for Argenti\n• Simulated Universe update (World 8) and new enemies\n• New main event: A Foxian Tale of the Haunted\n• …and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bk3.jpg'),(16539,'Magicka: Mega Villain Robes','2012-07-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Behind every missing wizard, behind every village pillaged by goblins, behind every bad happening in Midgård, there may or may not be a villainous mastermind behind it all. Unbeknownst to many, there is a dark underworld in Midgård, home to all sorts of evil personalities and organizations. This new robe pack will give you a spectacular taste of it!\nWith the Mega Villain Robe Pack players can choose from three more or less sane wizards who all decided that the world has done them wrong and must pay for it! These new wizards all follow the patented Super Standard of having their own special themes and matching personalities, this time based on the various Magicka elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98fs.jpg'),(16540,'Space Station Loma: Operations','2017-03-17','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You alone are responsible for the maintenance of a space station.\nEven after five years of training you don’t know whether you are really up to the job, but then again, how hard can it be to push some buttons, eh?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24tm.jpg'),(16541,'Attack on Titan 2: Final Battle','2019-07-05','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Attack on Titan 2: Final Battle includes the anime’s Season 3, Part 1 and 2, in the new Character Episode mode. As the Scout Regiment’s fight against the Titans rages on, and the team gets closer to learning more about the mysteries of their colossal foes, there is a new revelation: Titans are not their only enemies. The Anti-Personnel Control Squad, led by the notorious Kenny Ackerman, is set on capturing Eren and Historia – no matter the cost. The Scout Regiment sets out to save their teammates, but they quickly learn that they cannot trust anyone within the walls they call home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1phl.jpg'),(16542,'BS SimCity: Machi Tsukuri Taikai','1998-01-01','Simulator','Satellaview','BS SimCity: Machi Tsukuri Taikai (「ＢＳ ＳｉｍＣｉｔｙ 街作り大会」) is a Downloadable 4-part Soundlink game for the Satellaview that ran between August 4, 1996 and January 31, 1998. The game was broadcast in as a rerun at least twice throughout the lifetime of the Satellaview, once in October 1996 and once in January 1998 as the winner of the third Player\'s Choice vote. BS SimCity is a pseudo-sequel to the original 1991 SimCity for the Super Famicom. There are four characters (Dr. Wright, Yoshio Kanetake, Mr. Roy, and Madam Mary) added. Four different maps are given to player every week, the objective is to develop the city within time the limit. During the game, voice of characters is told and happenings occur simultaneously to all players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wc6.jpg'),(16543,'Zenless Zone Zero: Update 1.4 - A Storm of Falling Stars','2024-12-18','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac','Version 1.4 of Zenless Zone Zero, which includes:\n\n• New Characters: Miyabi and Harumasa\n• New Main Story Quest: A Storm of Falling Stars\n• New Events\n• ...and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94fa.jpg'),(16544,'Panel de Pon','2003-02-07','Puzzle','Nintendo GameCube, Nintendo 64','Panel de Pon is a game included in Nintendo Puzzle Collection for the Nintendo GameCube, which is the finished version of the cancelled Nintendo 64 video game Panel de Pon 64. The cancelled version ended up being released as Pokémon Puzzle League, albeit it was rebranded and featured characters from the Pokémon anime instead of the traditional fairies from the Panel de Pon franchise.\n\nA Nintendo 64 prototype is known to exist, but it is currently public unavailable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5klj.jpg'),(16545,'Trapped Girl X','2023-03-16','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','This is a new world that is a drastic rearrangement of the previous \"Trapped Girls\".\nSolve the riddles in the mansion and rescue more girls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pog.jpg'),(16546,'Galaxians','1982-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','ZX Spectrum, Sinclair ZX81','Galaxians is a clone of Galaxian. The player\'s goal is to destroy a matrix of enemy spaceships which is gradually descending on the screen. Single ships will sometimes leave the formation and bombard the player with multiple shots.\n\nThere\'s only a single scenario with a single type of spaceship. The process repeats itself when a squadron is completely eliminated, but the difficulty increases.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ibj.jpg'),(16547,'X-Plane 11: Aerosoft Seychelles XP','2020-02-13','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Seychelles are a group of islands in the Indian Ocean but what comes into most people’s minds when they think about the name is a tropical paradise, luxurious holidays, excellent diving spots and breathtakingly beautiful nature.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16548,'Fighting Fiends','2021-11-09','Fighting, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fighting Fiends is a top-down fighting game. Play it 1 on 1 for intense matches or with up to 4 players for chaotic fun, both locally and online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4880.jpg'),(16549,'Shadows Of Wyrmwood','2025-04-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Shadows of Wyrmwood is a roguelike adventure RPG. Use spells, swords, and strategy to defeat every corrupted foe. Travel across four procedurally generated maps that grow harder with every encounter. With each victory, you obtain new armor, weapons, and spells from defeated enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99zr.jpg'),(16550,'Super Bomberman 2',NULL,'Strategy, Tactical, Arcade','Satellaview, Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Super Bomberman 2 is the second of five games in the Super Bomberman series developed by Produce and Hudson Soft and released on the Super Nintendo. It is the only Super Bomberman game without a 2-player story mode, although one was originally planned.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6af1.jpg'),(16551,'Wai-wai Check 11/22 Saihousou',NULL,'Quiz/Trivia','Satellaview','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16552,'Werewolf: The Apocalypse - Heart of the Forest','2021-01-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Werewolf: The Apocalypse - Heart of the Forest throws you deep into a primeval wilderness in the center of modern Europe. It\'s where the protectors of nature wage their ancient, never-ending war against the forces of destruction.\n\nVisit real-world places of mystery and power. Explore local legends and traditions. Discover the fascinating world and history of the Polish-Belarusian borderlands. You will witness how nature clashes with technology and greed. Can it survive without our help?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i51.jpg'),(16553,'Port Valley','2026-12-31','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Port Valley is a (not so) classic Point & Click game where a certain choice changes everything. Witness 3 points of view of the same story and find out what\'s really going on during Port Valley\'s Election Day!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2f93.jpg'),(16554,'Kulm Skiflug WM 2016','2015-12-01','Sport','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Kulm Skiflug WM 2016 is the official game for the FIS Ski Flying World Championship 2016 in Bad Mitterndorf, Austria.\n\nThe game was designed to recreate the true feeling of ski flying by using accurate ramp dimensions, photogrammetric scans and GIS data of the surrounding terrain as well as national TV’s original sports commentators, world champions and olympia winners Andreas Goldberger and Martin Koch .\n\n- accurate representation of the ramp\n- modern photogrammetric technology\n- processing of geo-data\n- narrated by world champions Andreas Goldberger and Martin Koch','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/sikgndycgua1jcckiofa.jpg'),(16555,'Broken Age: The Complete Adventure','2014-06-12','Puzzle, Adventure','iOS','Age of Adventure consisted of two games, \"Return of Heracles\" and \"Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves\". AoA allows the player to chose from a list of Greek heroes of mythology, including well known heroes such as Achilles and Perseus in order to complete various mythology based quests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jfkv2bqfjsvqmlppkr8g.jpg'),(16556,'Titan','2015-09-18','Puzzle, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Titan is a HD remake of the 1988 game by Titus France.\n\nThe great block breaker developed by Titus Interactive in 1988 is back with a brand-new HD version featuring superb 3D environments.\n\nLocked up in an 80-level tower by a mad scientist, use your brainpower to help you to escape.\nArmed with your pod (a cubic robot) and a metal ball, avoid the numerous traps and try to find the way out.\n\nTitan is an innovative block breaker in which you control a cube at the center of the screen that allows you to move a ball in all directions and destroy the bricks.\nIn this game, it is not reflexes that count because you are inside an enclosed arena and the ball cannot get out.\nIt is brainpower and strategy that will carry the day. In each arena, different surprises and riddles await you... you will have to try to understand how to get out and, above all, how to avoid the traps. Some bricks can be destroyed by the ball, others by your pod. Teleporters allow you to navigate from one zone to another, the ice makes you slide, while mortal robot-pods try to hunt you down and traps try to destroy you...\n\nThis title was delisted from Steam on August 8, 2018','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gtp.jpg'),(16557,'Woody Woodpecker in Crazy Castle 5','2004-06-30','Platform, Puzzle','Game Boy Advance','One day Mother Nature asks for Woody Woodpeckers help. The reason? The Fairy World had been seized by demons. Woody?s interest is sparked when he learns that there is a treasure chest waiting in the legendary castle of the Fairy World. But to reach the castle Woody has to first free the five worlds of the elements of nature.\n\nThe five element worlds are each separately made up of fire, water, wind, sand and wood. Each world has its own different features, its own mysterious castle, occupied by a demon that has one element key. Once Woody has gathered all five keys, the legendary Crazy Castle appears. Woody must face the same types of challenges he faced in previous five worlds as he heads toward the throne to meet the demon that occupies Crazy Castle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d73.jpg'),(16558,'Pokémon Rejuvenation','2014-08-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pokémon Rejuvenation is an episodically released Pokémon fan game and spiritual successor to Pokémon Reborn. Similarly to Reborn, Pokémon Rejuvenation is not a ROM hack, but a standalone game made with RPG Maker.\n\nThe game takes place in the Aevium region, which was split into several islands after some catastrophic event in the past. The protagonist and their mother, Nancy, are headed there aboard the S.S. Oceana when it gets attacked by local villainous team Team Xen. With the ship destroyed and their mother captured, the protagonist is narrowly saved and escapes to East Gearen City — shaken, but ready to challenge the Pokémon League, take the fight to Team Xen, and hopefully, rescue their mother in the process.\n\nLike its inspiration, Pokémon Reborn, Pokémon Rejuvenation has a more mature story than mainline Pokémon games (albeit not as dark as Reborn\'s). It also features much more difficult encounters, with two difficulty levels available: Story and Classic. The game borrows Reborn\'s ideas of a field effect system, 18 Gym Leaders, and a level cap, but also replaces the traditional Elite 4 with an Elite 8 and grants new, unique moves to every gym leader. In addition, the game brings back Shadow Pokémon from Pokémon Colosseum and its sequel, now rebalanced, with Fairy-type Pokémon resisting their attacks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5stf.jpg'),(16559,'The Legend of Heroes: Trails of Cold Steel III - Extracurricular Edition','2020-06-30','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Nintendo Switch','Welcome to the new class VII - Explore the newly annexed lands of the Empire with a brand new squad, and catch up with familiar faces from the past.\nan immersive story - Experience an epic story developed across three titles, and crafted for new and old fans alike. Also includes an interactive introduction to catch up new players to the ongoing story so anyone can dive right in to the world of trails of cold steel.\n\ncombat honed to a Fine edge - Challenge oncoming threats with a combat system that has been refined over the course of decades. The addition of features like brave order and the break system opens up new possibilities in battle','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28g6.jpg'),(16560,'Mechachain','2023-11-15','Fighting','Android, iOS','Tps game on mobile where you fight with Mechas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dih.jpg'),(16561,'Warlock\'s Tower','2017-12-31','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo 3DS, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A punishing puzzler with elegantly designed levels around one brutal rule - one move equals one life lost.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24a4.jpg'),(16562,'Moon Rover','2021-05-08','Shooter, Platform','Web browser','Moon Rover is a platformer/shooter with roguelike elements. Getting around isn\'t easy, as your only way to move forward is the kickback from your weapons. Traverse multiple randomly-generated levels, buy weapons and upgrades, and take on the waves of robots-gone-rampant to rescue your humans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30ki.jpg'),(16563,'Cozy Hunt','2025-03-21','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Find, explore, and relax in a world full of cute details!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m2n.jpg'),(16564,'Doki Doki Ragnarok','2022-06-01','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Doki Doki Ragnarok is a viking visual novel in which you pillage and date villages around the world. It takes place in a ridiculous world where viking raids are like going on a date – with the village!\nFor vikings, raiding a village is more than warfare: it means dating, flirting, and understanding each other consensually. Show that you carry a conversation as easy as you carry an axe.\n\nChoose from a wide cast of diverse vikings and unravel the peculiarities of each village. Find out what they truly desire from the viking of their dreams. You can always revisit past conquests to experience alternative dates.\nWill you find the village of your dreams?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tun.jpg'),(16565,'Stripes','2023-08-19','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Stripes is a Tetris-inspired puzzle game that requires players to strategically place stripe pieces to create a continuous loop beginning and ending at the starting point.\n\nWith increasing speed, players must use critical thinking and quick reflexes to connect the stripes before time runs out. With a sleek and colorful design, Stripes offers hours of entertainment for puzzle enthusiasts of all ages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ccz.jpg'),(16566,'Traitors Gate 2','2003-11-02','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The second game in this theft simulator series.\n\nIn the modern age, the world\'s lifeline is through digital technology. A new threat to Earth comes in the form of a simple yet lethal virus contrived by those set out to bring worldwide chaos and destruction. You play Raven, an American secret agent, whose mission is to use his stealth, cunning and imagination to seek out and stop the virus at its source.\n\nExplore an ancient Babylonian site where using logic and tactics are the keys to solving brain-teasing puzzles that block your progress. Use advanced espionage equipment to help you complete your mission.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qo8ljvqp56ygsiia7i8a.jpg'),(16567,'Bubsy: The Woolies Strike Back','2017-10-31','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Bubsy the Woolies Strike Back! is an all new Bubsy adventure featuring Bubsy in a bevy of exotic locations as he travels the planet looking for the beloved Golden Fleece.\n\nBubsy must use all of his classic moves and a few new ones to dodge and out bobcat a battalion of Woolies, not mention the gnarliest UFO bosses to ever grace a Bubsy adventure.\n\nThe wisecracking lynx also adds over a 100 new one liners to his lexicon to keep fans guessing what he’ll say next.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fgwgl5gc00cg5syybti6.jpg'),(16568,'Strip 4: Classmate Study','2020-02-29','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A girl from school has invited you to study for exams. She is bored and asking you to play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co426g.jpg'),(16569,'Wild River Run','2023-12-19','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Twitch integrated game that involves racing in rivers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ynv.jpg'),(16570,'The Last from Mars','2021-03-31','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Arcade','Oculus VR, PlayStation VR','The Last from Mars is a VR game to be released for Playstation VR and Oculus platforms.\n\nIt is a 3D first person shooter, and the objective is to survive each round of invading aliens after which a more difficult round begins.\n\nThe player begins the game with a simple laser gun and has access to a melee attack, as well as a maximum of 4 teleports.\n\nAs players fight the aliens, they receive points and orbs. These points are used to upgrade weapons, perks, and access different parts of the map.\n\nAliens enter from outside the playable map, and as the rounds progress, difficulty increases.\n\nThe game has numerous perks that can be bought that awards players a certain ability or power. Other perks, called drops, have a chance to only be dropped after an alien is killed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tas.jpg'),(16571,'Nostalgia: Forte','2017-07-19','Music','Arcade','Nostalgia is a piano based rhythm game in Konami\'s BEMANI franchise. It is an standalone expansion of the first game in the Nostalgia series and a spiritual successor to Konami\'s Keyboardmania series.\n\nThe game consists of falling bars corresponding to certain areas of the keyboard. When the bars cross the judgement line it is time to play that key. There are three type of notes - Normal note which you play as normal, slide note where you slide your hand across the keyboard and trill note where you rapidly and alternately press two neighbouring keys.\n\nThe game adds a grade system where your overall skill in the game is measured. A NEAR judgement has also been added, which is obtained when you press the wrong key near the right key, but in the right time. It does not earn any score, but stop you from losing your combo. Arcade matchmaking is extended to 4 players at the same time.\n\nThe game extends the base games 83 songs with 98 new songs for a total of 181 songs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b8v.jpg'),(16572,'My Trailer Park Life',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','My Trailer Park Life is a single-player, permadeath, open world, urban survival, life simulator. Play the character who lives in an RV, where your choices shape the story. Manage your wellbeing, work to earn money, buy food and supplies, or steal to survive. Enjoy the beauty of the ordinary.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bfn.jpg'),(16573,'Cube Cube - Mobile eSports','2016-06-24','Puzzle','iOS','Fill the board, Clear the board, Score points and Win. A simple puzzle game with deep strategy. \n\nPlay for fun or Play for cash (where available). Give it a try! We hope you love it.\n\nKey features:\n• Drag blocks to the board.\n• Fill rows to clear them out.\n• Kinda like Tetris with no gravity.\n\nA dash of strategy goes a long way!\n• In our timed games, every move matters. You get 3 minutes for each match to see how many points you can get.\n• Clear multiple rows with one move and to score Combo Bonuses.\n• Clear rows in back-to-back turns to score Streak Bonuses.\n• Bonuses are the key to victory, but they can also gum up your board.\n\nNo longer a solitary experience! \n• Games can be played Head to Head with other players or in large, multiplayer tournaments.\n• In head to head games, both players get the same shapes in the same order and the player who finishes with the most points win.\n• Challenge people around the world with Skillz, a competition platform complete with leaderboards, trophies, Cash or virtual currency prizes, and an amazing loyalty program that rewards you for playing!\n• Cash tournaments are available in about 75% of the world. Cash tournaments are not enabled in the following states: AZ, AR, CT, DE, FL, IL, LA, MD, MT, SC, SD, and TN. If you don\'t live in a cash-enabled region, you can still play for fun with our virtual currency.\n\nIf you have any questions feel free to reach us at info@tetherstudios.com\nIf you have any questions about the Skillz system or cash tournaments please contact: support@skillz.com','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jvouyqcwdpunkqd0zkup.jpg'),(16574,'Our Story in Spring',NULL,'Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hana is a shy florist with a secret wish: to reinvent herself and experience more beyond life in the blossom-bathed village of Yamamori. There\'s just one small problem— hopelessly sheltered, she has never stepped foot outside the boundaries of the village before.\n\nMeanwhile, those around Hana have flourished. Her best friend chased his dreams to the big city, and even her childhood bully returns to Yamamori a reformed man. Determined to be left behind no more, Hana steels her resolve, but it will take friendship, love, and more than a little courage to change on her own.\n\nDrift across three tranquil springs in rural and urban Japan, and experience the tender tale of one young woman\'s budding desire to transform her future alongside the men who shaped her past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nwj.jpg'),(16575,'Coin Cascade','2022-10-29','Simulator, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Coin Cascade is a crowd-play game designed around the classic 2p Machine and is a traditional arcade game, We have two looks to the game which allows users to change the machine to different views.\n\nTwitch streamers share the gameplay with their followers, interacting through chat and video. This is a gaming collision of Arcade 2p Machines and social video streaming at its finest, with a growing collection of playable Machines.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92z6.jpg'),(16576,'Hanii on the Road','1990-09-07','Platform','TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','Hanii on the Road (aka Hany on the Road or Honey on the Road) is a side scrolling action game by Face. After Hanii\'s exploits in Hanii in the Sky, the little Haniwa clay doll is back on a new mission. This time around, our cute friend must free the world from all the demons and other evil creatures that escaped from the Gods\' realm. But this time around he\'s not flying or shooting balls of energy - instead, he must run along a roadway divided into four lanes, each moving at different speeds. And things are just not as easy as it may sound - Hanii has to jump over various enemies and try not to fall into deep holes dug into the ground, without forgetting the occasional change in scrolling direction and the myriad of other exciting, and often lethal, effects. A time limit also urges him to hurry and to quickly reach the end of each stage. Every little helps, and tiny wood signs scattered around every road tell Hany how far the next exit is. Additionally, special items can be collected along the way, such as Blue jars giving Hanii extra lives (twenty five of them need to be collected though), Mystery Jars giving from 100 to 1000 points, Extra Lives, Time Clocks, Rockets, Trampolines and other unique and often bizarre super powers (he can turn into a race-car or an almighty warrior in some stages!). Hanii on the Road consists of many levels and features a non-linear structure with interconnected paths to follow, as well as bosses. The game also offers a two simultaneous player mode where Lemon, a yellow version of Hanii, comes to the rescue.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fgv.jpg'),(16577,'Neverwinter Nights 2: Gold','2008-05-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Neverwinter Nights 2 Gold combines Neverwinter Nights 2, the sequel to one of the best-selling and genre-defining role-playing games ever, and Neverwinter Nights 2: Mask of the Betrayer, which allows you to advance to epic levels (above 20) and choose from over 100 spells.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21x8.jpg'),(16578,'High Seas Havoc','1993-08-16','Platform, Adventure','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','High Seas Havoc, known in Japan as Captain Lang, was also for arcade machines running on a Sega Mega Drive/Genesis based cabinet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a8h.jpg'),(16579,'The Shape of Us','2021-11-30','Sin género','Meta Quest 2','A VR journey that brings you closer to Nature. You’ll use your whole body on the way – prepare to stretch, crawl, rest, dance, feel!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16580,'Splice','2024-01-31','Puzzle, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A security job gone wrong. Now you are trapped with something deep inside an underground research bunker, and you are all that is left. Can you overcome your fear in this escape room horror?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7uo6.jpg'),(16581,'Blacksad: Under the Skin','2019-11-05','Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','BLACKSAD: Under the Skin - A dark corruption scandal in the heart of the New York City\'s underworld for charismatic detective John Blacksad!\n\nBased on the noir comic series by the same name. The game features a noir detective story about a PI by the name of Blacksad that gets dragged into the case of a murdered boxing club. The game feature an interactive system much reminiscent of Grim Fandango where you have direct control of the character and only things that catch his gaze is interactable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61er.jpg'),(16582,'Coffee Noir','2021-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Coffee Noir is a tycoon educational game in a detective novel narration and graphic design of the classic American comic books. The conversational aspect of the game (dialogues with contrahents) will strengthen negotiation and business psychology skills, and will allow develop the effective use of sales techniques. The entrepreneurial aspect of the game will increase the understanding of managerial, financial and marketing issues of running a successful start-up company. The game is intended both for entertainment and education. The storyline allows the player to unfold the mystery like a real detective would, with a special Investigation Board and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wl3.jpg'),(16583,'Urban Trial Tricky: Deluxe Edition','2021-07-22','Platform, Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Grab your seat and pull off the most savage tricks and combos on your motorbike. Ride freely, spin around in the air, go back and forth and let yourself be carried away by the fun, fast-paced gameplay, colorful visuals, and smooth controls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3g8c.jpg'),(16584,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s 3','2015-03-07','Strategy, Indie','Android, iOS','Thirty years after Freddy Fazbear\'s Pizza closed its doors, the events that took place there have become nothing more than a rumor and a childhood memory, but the owners of \"Fazbear\'s Fright: The Horror Attraction\" are determined to revive the legend and make the experience as authentic as possible for patrons, going to great lengths to find anything that might have survived decades of neglect and ruin.\n\nAt first there were only empty shells, a hand, a hook, an old paper-plate doll, but then a remarkable discovery was made...\n\nThe attraction now has one animatronic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71zv.jpg'),(16585,'Airtight','2022-06-30','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Airtight is a plot-oriented third person 3D puzzle game. The player must manipulate the heroine Yiyi to escape from her closed inner world, and at the same time, follow the occasional prompts to solve various puzzles to obtain clues to escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hap.jpg'),(16586,'Tropical Hearts','2023-08-29','Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Five friends go on a well deserved vacation. When they\'re offered a luxurious stay at Paradise Island, they have no idea what’s awaiting them! Drawn into a battle against mysterious creatures, our heroes unlock their magical potential - and the road to each other\'s hearts!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v2e.jpg'),(16587,'Shirone: the Dragon Girl','2022-03-10','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','”Shirone: the Dragon Girl\" is a 3D adventure game where you help Shirone solve puzzles and riddles to find a way out of a haunted castle. Escaping the castle is the main objective, and to do that you\'ll need to make full use of her wings and tail!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5l4s.jpg'),(16588,'Archaeology: Frozen Wall',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16589,'4 Degrees: Vol 1',NULL,'Puzzle, Quiz/Trivia','Sin plataforma','4 Degrees: The Arc of Trivia is a trivia game published by ZAPiT Games in 2005 as a pack-in game with the Game Wave Family Entertainment System. The game is heavily inspired by Trivial Pursuit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m22.jpg'),(16590,'Brigador','2016-06-02','Shooter, Strategy, Tactical, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Brigador is an isometric vehicle action game set in completely destructible environments. Highly difficult without being unfair. Lush revivalist graphic style reminds you of what 90\'s games would look like now. Huge variety of playable vehicles and weapons, deep tactics and high skill ceiling with custom map support all contribute to a game built to be played and enjoyed for a long time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wbu.jpg'),(16591,'Boring','2025-03-04','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game about doing boring things','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fqb.jpg'),(16592,'Into the Darkness VR',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Into The Darkness is a VR action-adventure game built on physics mechanics. Near future. Humanity is trying to achieve immortality by transferring consciousness to machines. Navigate through environments, solve the puzzle, engage enemy... to find out the dark secret behind the experiments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fan.jpg'),(16593,'Zombie Strike Force','2025-03-14','Fighting, Shooter, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The undead have taken over—gear up, survive, and fight back!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9km5.jpg'),(16594,'Bruv','2021-08-25','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bruv is a work-in-progress parkour based first person shooter, but you\'re a tea cup.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vlf.jpg'),(16595,'Seventh Lair','2022-04-01','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','From Novectacle, the creators of the highly acclaimed The House in Fata Morgana, comes Seventh Lair, a tongue-in-cheek, but emotional look at the online interactions between an indie game developer and fans!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4m9n.jpg'),(16596,'Jumpy Bunny','2024-12-18','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Obey the carrots and accept the challenging levels with a silly Bunny! Jump, jump, and jump. This game is about jumping with precision and determination.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fdy.jpg'),(16597,'No Way Out','2023-03-03','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Escape the monotony of your daily routine and discover a path beyond this seemingly endless cycle. Embrace the thrill of the unknown, as you embark on a journey to break free from the ordinary. Will you be brave enough to take the leap, even if there seems to be No Way Out?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67vr.jpg'),(16598,'Anime City','2024-12-15','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Anime City reinvents classic visual novel mechanics by transferring them into full 3D environment. Study at anime high school, engage in after school clubs, and attempt to win love of one of your classmates.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81t7.jpg'),(16599,'G-Zilla',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Arcade','Linux, Windows Phone, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play as an overpowered boss monster who has decided to go on a rampage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ml6.jpg'),(16600,'Plane Racer','2019-02-16','Arcade','Android','Fly a plane and avoid meteors','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yll.jpg'),(16601,'Conflict: Global Terror','2005-09-30','Shooter, Strategy, Tactical','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','In the war on terror, the battlefield is global and only one special ops squad can protect the world\'s freedom. it\'s up to you to lead this elite group through deadly missions against and enemy fuelled by hatred.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78n6.jpg'),(16602,'Final Fantasy XI: Treasures of Aht Urhgan','2006-04-18','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Final Fantasy XI: Treasures of Aht Urhgan is a massively multiplayer online role-playing game. Enjoy a new world to explore as you tour the world of Vana\'Diel. New jobs, new monsters, new realms and even new magic are all waiting for you! All-new system enhancements enrich gameplay in a variety of ways.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vq6.jpg'),(16603,'Tankettes',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bust some tanks in this playful retro arcade-style shooter featuring 24 playable characters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ig7.jpg'),(16604,'Pinhead Adventures','2024-04-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The First Game from Neversold Studios, Pinhead Adventures is a planet hopping, gun toting, sword swinging, grappling adventure! Zortan has killed every last living soul except for the Pinhead and Orbo. Join Pinhead and Orbo to fight Zortan in this 3D Action Platformer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zt9.jpg'),(16605,'XCOM 2','2016-09-27','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','XCOM 2 is the sequel to XCOM: Enemy Unknown, the 2012 award-winning strategy game of the year. Earth has changed and is now under alien rule. Facing impossible odds you must rebuild XCOM, and ignite a global resistance to reclaim our world and save humanity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mvj.jpg'),(16606,'Extreme Tactical Executioners','2019-08-22','Strategy, Indie','Oculus VR, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Set in the near future, Earth is becoming uninhabitable. Human Beings send AI-driven robots to your planet, Impulse, to eliminate your species in preparation for their colonization of your planet. Blast your way through hordes of enemy bots to protect your home and prevent the human invasion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ws7.jpg'),(16607,'Moto Rush GT: Hyper Edition','2025-03-28','Racing, Sport, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16608,'The Abandoned','2016-03-30','Sin género','iOS','The Abandoned is an adventure game, where you need to survive in an area full of danger and mystery. Your goal is to stay alive and find the way out, fighting monsters and completing story driven missions.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16609,'Osu! Tatakae! Ouendan','2005-08-28','Music','Nintendo DS','Osu! Tatakae! Ouendan, or simply Ouendan, is a rhythm video game developed by iNiS and published by Nintendo for the Nintendo DS handheld game console in 2005, for release only in Japan. Ouendan stars a cheer squad rhythmically cheering for various troubled people, presented in game in the style of a manga comic. In each stage, players use the DS touchscreen to tap specifically marked spots that appear in rhythm to various Japanese pop songs, scoring points for accurate timing and avoiding a poor performance which can cause the stage to end prematurely. Though never released in Western markets, it was a popular import to these regions, leading to the development of the Westernized spiritual sequel Elite Beat Agents, as well as a direct Japanese sequel Moero! Nekketsu Rhythm Damashii Osu! Tatakae! Ouendan 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25uu.jpg'),(16610,'Survival Ball','2018-11-08','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Single / Local Co-Op PC game with six distinct stages developing a simple premise: As the decaying world challenges you, don\'t fall! \n \n- Single and Local Co-Op modes \n- Six distinct stages and mechanics \n- Move, Jump, Dash and Stomp are your tools to skillfully confront enemies, help your teammates and interact with the world. \n- Launching for Windows and MacOS on November 8th, 2018 (Steam)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hb4.jpg'),(16611,'WWE 2K23: Icon Edition','2023-03-14','Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','WWE 2K23 Icon Edition\n\n• 3-Day Early Access\n\n• Ruthless Aggression Pack: Includes throwback versions of John Cena, Randy Orton, Batista, and Brock Lesnar, along with the WrestleMania 22 arena and the John Cena Legacy Championship\n\n• Season Pass: Includes all 5 post-launch DLC character packs, the MyRISE Mega-Boost pack, with 200 additional Attribute Points, and the Supercharger pack which unlocks all base-game WWE Legends and throwback arenas. Release timing of the DLC contents will be revealed at a future date.\n\n• Deluxe Edition Bonus Pack: Includes a John Cena EVO card, Emerald-tier Bianca Belair, and Gold-tier Asuka and Edge cards, plus 3 Basic Day 1 MyFACTION card packs\n\n• Icon Edition Bonus Pack: Includes a Paul Heyman Emerald tier Manager MyFACTION Card and 3 Deluxe Premium Launch MyFACTION Packs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69q2.jpg'),(16612,'True Fear: Forsaken Souls Part 1','2018-10-03','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','True Fear: Forsaken Souls takes the best of the psychological thriller, blending in fun and intuitive gameplay mechanics. Episode 1, the first in a trilogy, will long be remembered.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co296v.jpg'),(16613,'Once Upon A Puppet: Backstage Edition','2025-04-23','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Contains the game and a collection of bonus goodies','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r81.jpg'),(16614,'Spyro Superpack',NULL,'Sin género','Game Boy Advance','2 Games in 1 Cartridge!\n\nSpyro - Season Of Ice is a wild adventure starring the brave little dragon. A careless wizard has cursed himself with a big headache and it\'s the wings of 100 fairies he needs for the cure. Along with Hunter and Sparx, Spyro sets out on a brand new adventure to save the fairies and restore order to the Dragon Realms!\n\nIn Spyro 2 - Season of Flame Spyro returns home to the Dragon Realms, where a mysterious enemy has stolen the Fireflies, the source of all dragon firepower. Now it\'s up to everyone\'s favorite purple dragon to save the Fireflies before it is too late!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84pw.jpg'),(16615,'Death Field: The Battle Royale of Disaster','2018-05-03','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The world\'s first disaster battle royale, the Death Field is about to palpitate your heart. Now, get ready for battle with nearly 100 players, and remember that you must be the one to survive among them. The most extreme and horrendous disaster will be blocking your path to freedom. Your solution is only the way to attempt and bring out your creativity up to the limitation. Don\'t forget that you will be the only one last standing person that hops on the chopper.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16616,'Project Graviton','2016-02-15','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','About Project Graviton\"Project Graviton\" is a platformer game in which users will control the character Bob, whom after stumbling into a secret section of his workplace, gains possession of a Gravity Suit and learns of its capabilities. The antagonist is Bob\'s Boss, the creator of the gravity suit, and he tries to prevent Bob from leaving the building with it. The level structure is based on 3 Acts, each containing 3 levels respectively. Players will attempt to reach the end of the levels, while avoiding a series of traps and hazards set by the Boss. Upon receiving the gravity suit, players may control their gravity to maneuver across various sections of the level. To balance the difficulty of the level, the game has a feature called \"Memory point\", that will allow players to respawn at a chosen point in the level, albeit in a limited number of times.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y18.jpg'),(16617,'Temple of Rubbo','2022-02-25','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A shipwrecked crew of cursed pirates are condemned to an animal form... Armed with nothing but their desire to be human again, they decide to enter... the TEMPLE of RUBBO.\n\nA 1-4 player action roguelike.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kb9.jpg'),(16618,'Stalingrad Abatis','2018-09-21','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','1942 the Great Patriotic War, the height of the battle for Stalingrad.\nIvan falls asleep in a residential building, oxygen ends,\nunimaginable things begin to appear to him, who knows, maybe they are really happening!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16619,'Vritra','2013-12-17','Shooter, Arcade','Android, iOS','Throw down a challenge to all the 80s and 90s gamers. Get back the enthusiasm you had once!\nControl the dragon and the vajras, and destroy the evil Dragon Emperor \"VRITRA\"!\nAwesome graphics, powerful sound effects and amazing controls.\nThis ultimate 2D shooter is a step forward in the history of the shooting games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9my7.jpg'),(16620,'Goal! Goal! Goal!','1995-01-01','Sport','Neo Geo AES, Arcade, Neo Geo MVS','A soccer game with all the right ingredients, skill, flair, passion, and of course, GOALS! With 28 national teams to choose from, compete in a tournament to become the best soccer nation in the world. Get past the opening group stage and go on to a round-robin elimination stage where failure is not an option. To help you on your way, hold down the shoot button until the power bar fills up and you can do a POWERFUL SUPER SHOT!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hnn.jpg'),(16621,'Ceana the Wraithress','2020-06-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16622,'Ride Your Mind: Blossoms','2020-01-31','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ride Your Mind: Blossoms is an Expansion of the original Ride Your Mind. The BCI-VR-Game / NeuroVR Game forces the user’\'s conscious to compete with his subconscious to create/spawn blossoms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kzo.jpg'),(16623,'The Head Well Lost','2024-03-14','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An otome visual novel about a librarian and a pop star without a head.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co865q.jpg'),(16624,'The Backrooms: Last Expedition','2023-09-15','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"The Backrooms: Last Expedition\" is a cooperative horror game designed for 1 to 4 players. Its main objective is to create an enjoyable gaming experience for friends. Players will navigate through terrifying levels, filled with various entities and dangers, as they strive to escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71y8.jpg'),(16625,'Jigoku Train','2024-03-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Waking up to an unfamiliar place, what course of action will you choose?\n\nPlay as Ling, your average office worker having her usual shifts and living her usual life, woke up on the train one night, finding that she was not going to head to her usual destinations.\n\nNot only that, you will also play another character! He wakes up with no memories on a train heading towards an unknown location. Grant is your average amnesiac guy.\n\nWhere are they heading, and what can they do in order to head back home? Or is there even any way home?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qdy.jpg'),(16626,'Cthulhu Mythos RPG II','2022-04-21','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A role-playing game from AlchemyBlue.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9emb.jpg'),(16627,'Adventures In Time & Space','2025-04-29','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','~ Escape from the Pharaoh\'s Tomb + Pirates on Target + Xatrom Command ~','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r7x.jpg'),(16628,'Absence of Light','2024-01-22','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Absence of Light\" is an exploration based shoot \'em up that combines intense bullet-dodging combat with a metroidvania-style level design. Solve, shoot, and shine your way through the kingdom of Luminaria and reawaken the light!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6d0f.jpg'),(16629,'Baki Hanma: Blood Arena','2025-09-30','Fighting, Sport, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Enter the brutal world of Baki Hanma: Blood Arena, a thrilling 2D action game inspired by the Netflix anime phenomenon Baki. With gameplay reminiscent of the classic Super Punch-Out!!, this game blends precision, timing, and shonen-style flair to deliver a high-energy combat experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lih.jpg'),(16630,'Mercury Rising','2023-08-17','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Investigate a mysterious distress signal and find out what happened.\n\nMercury Rising is a custom campaign mission based on a multiplayer map Mercury Falling.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kkc.jpg'),(16631,'Hairdresser Liquidator Bundle','2025-04-25','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r80.jpg'),(16632,'8Floor Bundle 4 in 1 part 8','2025-04-25','Sin género','Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r83.jpg'),(16633,'Colmen\'s Quest','2020-06-26','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Colmen\'s Quest is a turn-based fantasy RPG. You play as Colmen, an aspiring monster hunter, who is on a quest to unveil a dark threat that haunts the village of Valkirk. You will explore Valkirk and its villagers, descend dusky dungeons, fight monsters and eventually collect a bunch of loot and treasures.\n\nThe game is inspired by classic Hack & Slays like Diablo and turn-based RPGs like Rogue\'s Tale or Stoneshard, however it\'s not a roguelike game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16634,'Silent Slayer: Vault of the Vampire','2024-06-06','Puzzle, Adventure','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3','Vanquish an ancient vampiric council in this suspenseful single-player jumpscare game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kno.jpg'),(16635,'C.O.Ś.',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','C.O.Ś. is a 3D futuristic sci-fi horror game focusing on feelings of isolation and fight for survival.\nDuring its gameplay player learns the history and secrets moving alone through an abandoned space station.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mot.jpg'),(16636,'Commander \'85','2020-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','13 May 1985: Today is my BIRTHDAY!!! Mum gave me the best present ever! a Commander 85 – a super modern computer with real artificial intelligence! It’s very smart, and I can talk to it and play games on it. I can’t wait till the other boys see it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ck9.jpg'),(16637,'King\'s Keeper','2025-03-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game of base building and colony simulation in a world where night is permanent. Survive, build, explore, repel enemy raids and tend to the needs of your workers and your king.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k9i.jpg'),(16638,'Farland Saga: Toki no Michishirube','1998-12-03','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Toki no Michishirube is a direct sequel to the first Farland Saga game. It is an anime-style strategy RPG which consists mainly of large strategic battles, taking place on isometric battle fields.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gpm.jpg'),(16639,'Honkai Impact 3rd: Part 2 - Extinguished Starlight and Rekindled Fire','2024-02-29','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Follows the Dreamseeker, an engineering student from the cyberpunk-inspired metropolis of Oxia City, as they embark on a journey to explore the Sea of Data through the Anchor of the Apocalypse. Along the way, they will encounter new companions and friends, and uncover the ancient secrets of the Honkai war and the enigmatic Goddess who has long watched over the planet. Their adventures will lead them on a mission to save the Martian bubble universes from falling into the corrupting power of the Sea of Data, eventually leading to the meeting of the people of Earth and Mars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ab9.jpg'),(16640,'Nadia Was Here','2017-05-01','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Nadia was Here is an RPG that runs in the vein of the classic 8 and 16 bit eras, inspired by gems like Golden Sun, Final Fantasy and many others. However, by changing some fundamental aspects, Nadia was Here combines old school experiences with modern day indie game mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2536.jpg'),(16641,'Guroopia!','2019-09-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fun 2D puzzle physics platformer where you manipulate the direction of gravity to complete your mission. You are Marvin, a cool stick-man who is abruptly disturbed by the Dream Wizard. Marvin is told he owes a \"dream debt\" to the Dream Wizard and will not be allowed to wake up until it\'s paid!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41jk.jpg'),(16642,'Race to Mars','2014-03-07','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Race To Mars is a turn-based, space company simulation game. Become the head of the newly established \"New Space\" company whose goal would be to establish a colony on Mars. You begin as a startup - develop cutting edge aerospace technologies and use them to achieve orbit and fly beyond Earth vicinity, blazing the trail of a space pioneer and leaving the competition far behind on your way to victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sy7.jpg'),(16643,'Shut the Windows and Don\'t Look Outside',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Recent disturbances and abnormal phenomena have been detected in your area. For your safety and well-being, all individuals must remain inside their homes. Under no circumstances should you look outside. Keep all doors locked and windows shut. It is required by all citizens to be afraid. The Angel will come.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lhl.jpg'),(16644,'Human Souvenir','2024-05-28','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You just visited the earth and got a famous \'Human Souvenir\'. Would you be able to keep your human alive enough time to see them through their whole life cycle?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dfu.jpg'),(16645,'Lloyd the Monkey','2017-09-29','Platform, Adventure','Web browser','In the game, you play as Lloyd, a monkey trained in sword-fighting, as he travels the world in search of the gorillas who kidnapped his friends. As you get closer to the enemy base, a thrilling secret becomes unraveled before your eyes and you won\'t want to miss one heart pounding moment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72fa.jpg'),(16646,'Match Village','2024-03-14','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Match Village is a minimalist strategy game about match buildings to create villages on colorful islands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ozn.jpg'),(16647,'Zombie Blitz','2025-01-23','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','This ruined Earth sees movement once more?! In the midst of waves of robots waking once more, the zombies\' solo struggle begins in this action roguelike!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bob.jpg'),(16648,'Home Is Where Chip Is',NULL,'Simulator, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Feed yourself with chips. \n \nFeel like home.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16649,'Annalynn','2023-06-07','Platform, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Annalynn is a 2D platformer made in the style of arcade games from the early \'80s. Collect the coins, grab the bonus foods, and turn the tables with blinding rubies! Think you\'ve got what it takes to go for the high score?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2onw.jpg'),(16650,'The Dungeon of Naheulbeuk: The Amulet of Chaos - Ruins of Limis','2021-05-25','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Experience the first ever DLC for hit RPG parody The Dungeon of Naheulbeuk!\nIn Ruins of Limis, the party faces a whole new batch of terrifying enemies, including vampires, zombies, necromancers and chickens. Expect new missions, challenging battles, side quests, new factions, and fresh laughs, as the unlikely heroes set out to discover the sinister secret of a haunted tavern.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a4t.jpg'),(16651,'LEGO Marvel Super Heroes 2: Marvel\'s Guardians of the Galaxy - Vol. 2 Movie Level Pack','2017-12-19','Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Based on the 2017 film Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 2, this DLC for LEGO Marvel Super Heroes 2 adds a brand-new level and six playable characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fi1.jpg'),(16652,'Frozen Way Tri-Bundle','2025-04-25','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r7z.jpg'),(16653,'The Beginner\'s Guide','2015-10-01','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A metafictional account of Davey Wreden, creator of the Stanley Parable (2013), who takes the player through the games of his old friend, Coda, while giving his commentary and interpretations of them, in order to understand why he makes the bizarre, often melancholic games that he makes, and decipher Coda\'s personality and inner struggles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rz1.jpg'),(16654,'Doki Doki Metal Club','2023-02-03','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki Metal Club is a story of a high school club of metalheads. Instead of literature, this time it\'s music that the girls are passionate about. MC, a poser listening to metalcore, joins a club where every member has a different taste in metal. Yuri, a metal elitist, is a fan of \"true metal\" and all things kvlt. She introduces MC to the world of black metal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s2h.jpg'),(16655,'Asdivine Menace','2019-08-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Taking place one hundred years after the events of the first chapter, Asdivine Menace sets the stage for an adventure of epic proportions.\nCriss-cross the galaxy visiting new worlds along with Izayoi, the deity of Asdivine and his band of spirit sidekicks in the follow-up to the recent, best-selling Asdivine Dios!\nA traditional, turn-based JRPG with enough content to satisfy even the hungriest of gamers out there!\n\nWith plenty of quests and challenges to boot, Asdivine Menace comes jam-packed with a console-quality experience.\nJust be sure not get caught up in all the side-content and forget about saving the world!\nPlus, with the option to woo and pursue the ladies, how will your pick change the future of Asdivine?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24ba.jpg'),(16656,'ATV Drift & Tricks','2018-11-22','Racing, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','DRIFT, TRICKS & FUN! Tired of 2-wheeled vehicles? ATV Drift & Tricks is the QUAD game for you! A racing game just for quads!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23oo.jpg'),(16657,'Night Call','2020-06-24','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"Night Call is a new kind of non linear narrative and noire game taking place in Paris, France.\n\nUsing the real city map (~105 km² or ~40.5 mi²) and the intimacy a taxi can offer, players will meet numerous and unique passengers to talk with. Some of them know things about the killer, others pretend to know things, and some just need to talk to someone.\n\nMore than just telling a story, Night Call also aims to show the city of Paris like it is in reality. A bit far from the usual cliché of the city of love. A gigantic city, always in movement, and full of very different people. Every one of them has a story to share. Put together, all these bits of stories will create a unique experience on the way to find the killer\'s identity.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qsr.jpg'),(16658,'Egg King','2021-12-10','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Egg King is a platformer game with a twist, you\'re going to go down by jumping and rolling. Go on a journey across the land and reach the lost crown of the king. Visit different landscapes and raise your ability. Become the new king and make the rich!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a7o.jpg'),(16659,'Telegraphist 1920: Beats of War',NULL,'Music, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A narrative rhythm game that takes you back to 1920. See, hear and feel the Battle of Warsaw from a novel perspective - a war telegraphist, the crucial bond between soldiers and commanders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8q5f.jpg'),(16660,'Densha de GO! Shinkansen: Sanyou Shinkansen-hen','2001-09-20','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Densha de Go! Shinkansen: Sanyoushinkansen-hen (loosely translated to \"Go by Train! Shinkansen: Sanyou Shinkansen Edition\") is an electric train driving simulation game developed and published by Taito for the PlayStation 2 in Japan on September 20, 2001. It was later ported to the PC by Unbalance on December 13, 2002.\n\nA spin-off of the Densha de Go! series, Shinkansen focuses on the titular high-speed rail line San\'yō Shinkansen (through the entire route both ways, between Shin-Ōsaka and Hakata).\n\nThe game was later ported to the Wii as Densha de Go! Shinkansen EX: Sanyoushinkansen-hen (loosely translated to \"Go by Train! Shinkansen EX: Sanyou Shinkansen Edition\") on March 1, 2007. This version features a new \"Kids Mode\" utilizing the Wii Remote\'s motion control.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yzt.jpg'),(16661,'I am Rolling','2023-04-12','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A rage platformer game in which you need to control a ball and avoid obstacles on a mission to... I\'m not sure... what is your mission... where are you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gsl.jpg'),(16662,'Major League Baseball 2K7','2007-02-27','Sport','Xbox, PlayStation 3, PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360, Game Boy Advance, Nintendo DS, PlayStation 2','Major League Baseball 2K7 (or MLB 2K7) is a Major League Baseball licensed baseball simulation video game developed by Kush Games and published by 2K Sports. Released on February 27, 2007, it is the only 2007 MLB licensed game available for the Xbox 360 and Xbox. It is also available for the PlayStation Portable, the PlayStation 2 and, for the first time, the PlayStation 3, though its competition came in the form of MLB 07: The Show from 989 Sports. Portable versions for the Nintendo DS, PlayStation Portable, and Game Boy Advance were released. It is the first baseball game to be released for the Nintendo DS and the last major release for the Xbox game console.\n\nFor the third year in a row, Derek Jeter is the cover athlete, and ESPN baseball broadcasters Jon Miller and Joe Morgan serve as announcers, despite the loss of the ESPN license to Electronic Arts. Steve Physioc and Jeanne Zelasko cover the pre-game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71et.jpg'),(16663,'Elypse','2023-08-02','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Embark upon a tragic tale and discover the ravaged world of Elypse! Fight your destiny in an arduous 2D adventure, story rich platformer, in a mesmerising and mysterious world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59t0.jpg'),(16664,'Heralds of Silence. Chapter one','2023-03-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Heralds of Silence is a first-person horror game. Solve complex puzzles, look for clues, dive into the darkness of empty corridors and, perhaps, you will discover the secrets of a mysterious scientific complex and the curse of the Silence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co669o.jpg'),(16665,'Hacker.exe','2018-09-14','Puzzle, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hacker.exe is an atmospheric Survival Horror/Strategy/Simulation that puts you on the shoes of a hacker. Hacker.exe is a twist on the take of an exe game, adding a more unique mystery to the game genre while also being a horror/creepy point and click hacking simulator. Game mechanics such as tower defense strategies, puzzles, lore and quick time events are all present in the game. Your main goal is to solve the overarching puzzle of the game whilst trying to not get caught.\n\nThe NCD is an organization that swears to protect all of it\'s user from hackers and viruses while they browse on the internet. Why is this a big deal? Most people have lost hope on using the internet after the World Wide Whipe Out, an event that nearly destroyed most of the information available on the internet. You have started this hacking career with no knowledge of your past and it is up to you to piece together all the clues and figure out why you are now a hacker. While you hack, you notice that the NCD, the same organization that was willing to protect it\'s users is involved in criminalistic activity and helps many websites that sell illegal products thrive in this new age of technology. It is up to you to figure out why the NCD is doing all of this while you take on the most challenging and most strategical job offers out there as a hacker. Are you ready to take this challenge?\n\nFeatures:\n-Point and Click Adventure\n-Jumpscares and Intense Mystery Puzzles\n-Interactive Hacking Mechanisms\n-Logical ways of finding the objectives\n-Thrilling adventure\n-Difficult Puzzles\n-Elements of Surprise\n-Limited Time','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27pn.jpg'),(16666,'Yukar From the Abyss','2022-11-14','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','A fantasy otome game based on the myths and legends of Hokkaido, Japan. Meet and fight with unique Gods, overcome fierce trials together, and discover what happens when you pursue forbidden love with the divine..','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co716l.jpg'),(16667,'Creepy Tale','2020-07-10','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Find out the dark story that befell the once-calm and peaceful forest, turning it into a creepy place filled with evil. Perhaps it is you who will be able to solve all the secrets of forest and save the peaceful creatures?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xbo.jpg'),(16668,'Dawnshard','2024-11-30','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Dawnshard is a multiplayer fantasy card game for pc and mobile devices. Focused on eSport and competition.\n\nDawnshard is the first digital card game that integrates procedural generation in deck building, with the intention of removing the meta-game.\n\nPlaying Dawnshard feels like exploring a Jungle. In the Jungle, you have the tools you have.\n\nYou can’t just look up what the best strategies are. You\'ll have to adapt during each game to your opponent\'s strategies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73i4.jpg'),(16669,'Fruit am I?','2022-04-22','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','This is a game for Weekly Game Jam 249 and the subject is Mysterious Fruit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ws6.jpg'),(16670,'House Flipper City',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','House Flipper City gives you a unique chance to create your own real estate business. Buy devastated flats, houses and commercial premises all around the city. Renovate the acquired property, but first, look around and redesign the apartments so that they meet the requirements of future customers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43do.jpg'),(16671,'Mechanical Lab','2024-08-27','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mechanical Lab is a 2D action game focused on the physical interaction of machines with the environment. Explore, build and experiment to survive in the city of robots long after the end of human civilization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pur.jpg'),(16672,'Acre Shore',NULL,'Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Welcome to Acre Shore! Goodness! It\'s not often someone comes to stay in our little town.\n\nMake yourself at home! You\'ll be staying at Theresa\'s BnB until something more suitable becomes available.\n\nThere\'s just one thing that\'s been bothering me. I\'ve done some asking around but no one seems to know. Who hired you?\"\n\nAcre Shore is an adaptive psychological horror visual novel set in the quiet coastal town of Acre Shore.\n\nYou are a detective for hire, summoned by an anonymous employer to solve a mystery that doesn\'t seem to exist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lf1.jpg'),(16673,'Red Rogue Sea','2025-09-30','Strategy, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Red Rogue Sea is a roguelike strategy game that puts you in the shoes of a pirate captain and their crew. Manage your vessel as you sail through the treacherous waters of the archipelago, interact with the scum that inhabit it, and engage in battle using a tactical deck-building system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mij.jpg'),(16674,'Dino Run 2','2025-12-31','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dino Run 2 is a hyper-evolved pixel-art single and multiplayer platformer with procedurally generated terrain, multiple dino types to play as with different strengths and skills, tons of character customization, and most importantly an unstoppable doom wall that\'s constantly on your tail.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8csg.jpg'),(16675,'Chior','2024-09-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You had a pretty rough fall. Trying to regain your composure you try to look around before realizing you can\'t see anything. Hope that your other senses will serve you better.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8v8y.jpg'),(16676,'The Interview','2021-02-01','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Interview is a short, atmospheric horror and mockumentary game about a place you don\'t want to work.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16677,'Stupid Cars','2025-01-09','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Meta Quest 2, Meta Quest 3','These drivers are, you guessed it… STUPID!\nThey need your help. Using Hand Tracking or Controllers, select their vehicles to change speed and guide them as they merge into the flow of traffic. But be careful, these cars can’t stop… if there’s a collision, it’s all over.\nPerfect for casual players, but also offering optional challenges for the purists. Adjustable playing position to get you right down into the action and, for a more immersive experience, try Mixed Reality Mode.\nDesigned to be one of the most challenging \"One More Go\" games around, it features.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9atg.jpg'),(16678,'Kid Canary & The Midnight Tower','2022-08-26','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A chill game about battling monsters in a scary dreamlike dungeon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ayp.jpg'),(16679,'Underward','2025-02-05','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','UNDERWARD is a 1-4 player co-op horror exploration game. Investigators must carry «TEST-SUBJECT» monsters from a deadly underground abandoned hospital ward.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bri.jpg'),(16680,'Champions Online','2009-09-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Champions Online is an MMORPG that takes place in a comic book universe set primarily in Millennium City. Create a superhero and help defend the world from crime alongside your fellow champions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mzt.jpg'),(16681,'Ghost Blade HD','2019-10-24','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ghost Blade HD is an intense bullet-hell shoot \'em up game, with satisfying and addictive score-based gameplay, with its inspiration going back to the shooting games of the 1990s era, Ghost Blade HD ties old memories to current tones and techniques. Designed with a modern graphic style and special effects, Ghost Blade HD also features an awesome 2-player and TATE mode! Ghost Blade HD is easy to learn, hard to master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24j3.jpg'),(16682,'Killer Instinct Gold','1996-11-25','Fighting','Nintendo 64','Rare was a prominent second-party developer for Nintendo, and produced the Killer Instinct series exclusively for the company as their response to Mortal Kombat. Following the success of the 1995 Killer Instinct port for the Super Nintendo home console, Rare began a sequel for the same console. They transitioned development to the Nintendo 64 upon its announcement. Gold was scheduled as a launch title for the new console but was delayed until its North American release in November 1996. It received a wider release in May 1997.\n\nIt was also included in Rare\'s 2015 Xbox One retrospective compilation, Rare Replay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25wb.jpg'),(16683,'Bath House Simulator',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Immerse yourself in a working bath house, where you\'re responsible for cleaning all clients ranging from Spirits to Warriors and General Guests. Using and upgrading a variety of tools, you\'re responsible for making sure every client leaves feeling fresh and cleaned of all mud, grime, and gunk!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96qu.jpg'),(16684,'Wildfire','2020-05-25','Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Master the elements in this stealth game where everything burns. Start fires, freeze water, and move earth itself to outsmart superstitious enemies who fear your power. Rescue captive villagers and reclaim your home by turning the environment against the army sent to hunt you down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23lo.jpg'),(16685,'Luxo Buddies','2018-08-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','One of the most Classic games which we all know and love!\n\nLuxo Buddies makes its return with an assortment of exciting new features.\n\nMatch cards either by matching color or value and play action cards to change things up. Race against other players to empty your hand before everyone else.\n\nTry to be the first player to remove all the cards in this awesome four player Luxo Buddies game!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16686,'Papa\'s Freezeria Deluxe','2023-03-31','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After starting a relaxing job at the oceanfront ice cream shop on Calypso Island, things get hectic when all of Papa Louie\'s crazy customers arrive on the island! Now it\'s up to you to single-handedly craft and serve tasty sundae treats throughout the year. You\'ll whip up delicious Freezer sundaes by pouring ice cream, adding mixables and syrups, blending sundaes, and finally adding whipped cream and toppings for that perfect summertime treat. You\'ll need to multitask between each area of the restaurant, where each station is a unique hands-on experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65zy.jpg'),(16687,'Dream Dye','2021-05-26','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A 2D puzzle platformer in which you delve into dreams and mix colours to dye objects, in a world where colours are a pigment of the imagination.\n\nDream Dye takes place in a doctor\'s office in the fictional village of Renkaya, a relatively normal village with just one strange difference—the only way to “make” colour is to dream about it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a86.jpg'),(16688,'Cat Gamer','2022-05-01','Puzzle','Android','If you need to relax and your pet is bored, then this application will help you.\nOpen the world of games for your pet and go about your business or watch your cat get achievements.\nIn our collection of mini games, your pet will be able to find their favorite game for themselves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f9f.jpg'),(16689,'Bleep Bloop','2019-01-31','Puzzle, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Meet Bleep and Bloop as they help each other overcome all the challenges that stand in their way. A light-hearted and playful puzzle game about working together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1iwr.jpg'),(16690,'R.U.S.E.','2010-09-09','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','R.U.S.E is a one-of-a-kind real-time strategy game that allows players to bluff their enemies to lead their nation to victory, controlling the action using views that range seamlessly from the heart of the battlefield to the full theatre of war. Players will be plunged into the action thanks to the exclusive IRISZOOM engine which offers an intuitive interface that allows for smooth, rapid transitions from a birds-eye view of the entire conflict, down into the heat of the battle and vice versa.\n\nIn R.U.S.E, your brain is your ultimate weapon as you fight a war of perception, where your ability to deceive and mislead your enemy determines success. A first in a strategy game, R.U.S.E reinvigorates the genre by using deception to give new-found depth to the gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jjp.jpg'),(16691,'Lock On','1991-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','Lock On is a side-scrolling shooter developed and published by Philko in 1991\n\nThe game is similar to Carrier Air Wing from Capcom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k58.jpg'),(16692,'QT','2020-01-23','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','QT is a 3 part game about hanging out in cute places and finding your favorite friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21jt.jpg'),(16693,'I Love Horses','2009-04-24','Racing, Simulator','Nintendo DS','Welcome to the Ranch! \n \nExplore the amazing world of Greenhill Ranch, home to championship horses. Discover 20 fun mini-games that let your teach, train and groom your horse. With the right training, you and your horse will take the crown at the big tournament. Life at the ranch has never been this much fun. \n20 Amazing Adventures: Train, play with and care for your horses in 20 fun mini-games! Dash across raging rapids, play hide and seek, and even sing along with the Greenhill horse choir! \nTouch and Train: Interact with your horses through simple DS stylus controls! \nCapture the Memories: Photograph your horses and view the pictures in your photo album. \nFun & Games: Navigate the obstacle course, tackle agility challenges and learn to do fantastic tricks as you develop a bond with your horse that can never broken.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vkgaxxf0d1xwibe0brmh.jpg'),(16694,'MemoTrimo',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16695,'Anatine',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Anatine is a pixelated metroidvania game that contains organic musical elements. Play the flute to interact with the environment or unleash powerful magic! In the dangerous world of Avenis, battle against the Eidolons and confront powerful enemies to uncover the many secrets of this lost world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6y4w.jpg'),(16696,'Waking Violet','2018-06-29','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Waking Violet is a classic 2D top-down puzzle game, but with awesome spells and a unique time rewind mechanic. Playing as Violet, a shy teen with a desire to grow up, you get trapped in a dream you just can\'t wake up from.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rtz.jpg'),(16697,'X Rebirth: Home of Light - Complete Edition',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16698,'Superflight','2017-11-08','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Superflight is an intense, easy to learn wingsuit game with an infinite number of beautiful procedurally generated maps. A great game to relax for half an hour and chase your latest highscore!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24ur.jpg'),(16699,'DCS World: P-51D Mustang Blue Nosed Bastards of Bodney Campaign',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Become a member of the most famous fighter unit of the USAAF, take part in escorting large bomber formations, support the ground troops after D-day, or engage the Luftwaffe over the snowy hills of the Ardennes. The Blue Nosed Bastards of Bodney is a semi-historical campaign for the P-51D Mustang.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lmq.jpg'),(16700,'Zombies Noir','2022-08-30','Shooter, Arcade','Meta Quest 2','Protect your real-life home against zombies in Zombies Noir, an intense mixed-reality action game! Choose from a variety of zany weapons and defeat waves of zombies in the confines of your house.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fcb.jpg'),(16701,'Astropods: Starside Glaze',NULL,'Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Astropods: Starside Glaze is a 2D Fighting Platformer with endless mobility and combat potential! Starring as Hemi and Acro, swap between them at any time to utilize their unique attacks and physics within various environments.\n\nAstropods combines platform fighter combat with platformer styled levels, alongside nonlinear progression and perk customization, to create a dynamic combat-platforming experience unlike anything else!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99zh.jpg'),(16702,'Indiana Jones and His Desktop Adventures','1996-04-01','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Indiana Jones and His Desktop Adventures is a overhead 2D-action adventure game released on the PC and Macintosh by Lucas Arts in 1996. Arguably it\'s most notable feature is that the plot, map size, and item locations are randomly generated at the beginning of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v9t.jpg'),(16703,'Unstackable','2021-10-04','Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','When the worst property developer decides to invest on a remote and inaccessible island, you and your tugboat are the only ones who can help and build the most charming housing project.\n\nPick up the buildings and send them flying on the island so that people can start moving in right away (or not)...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s4j.jpg'),(16704,'Builder Liquidator Bundle','2025-04-25','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r82.jpg'),(16705,'Blue Mushrooms','2023-11-13','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Blue Mushrooms is a SMB1 Rom Hack that modifies some stuff of the original game.\n\nPlot: Now that Bowser was defeated, there’s one more thing Mario (and Luigi maybe) must do: save the last Toad… So our heroes will need to explore the new areas beyond the unknown, where the Sun’s illumination doesn’t show. . .\n\nFeatures:\n- New 33 levels\n- Some sprites and color palette have been modified\n- Mario, Goombas, Koopas… Almost everyone are a bit faster!\n- Red mushroom it’s a bit more powerful; you can throw (slow) fireballs!\n- Goombas now can revive if you crush them\n- Coins value are now 2 instead of 1\n- And more stuff!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dgq.jpg'),(16706,'There Was Something In That Room','2025-02-09','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Move through the rooms of the lab in this short but replayable horror game. Debug the computers in each room, watch out for errors, and fix sabotages. Make sure you always know where you are... and where other things are.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mac.jpg'),(16707,'The Open House','2020-03-22','Point-and-click, Simulator, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','We at Northtree Real Estate (in partnership with Optix Dynamix Labs) are proud to present our new, state-of-the-art, open house simulator! Come and take a quick tour of 15615 Hollow Oak Lane, a familiar and comfortable showcase home in one of our premier developments!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lfu.jpg'),(16708,'Mundaun','2021-05-27','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A lovingly hand-pencilled horror tale set in a dark, secluded valley of the alps. Explore various areas full of secrets to discover, survive hostile encounters, drive vehicles, fill your inventory and solve a variety of hand-crafted puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dqo.jpg'),(16709,'Virtual Villagers 2: The Lost Children','2008-05-12','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Somewhere in the Pacific, there was a beautiful island, called Isola, where lost villagers made their home. The castaways explored their small part of the island and knew every corner. Only a mysterious cave had not been carefully explored.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qjvmxdfr034r6wm9nfbc.jpg'),(16710,'Axis Football 2020','2020-12-08','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Axis Football 2020 features massive gameplay improvements, football gaming\'s most complete Franchise Mode, and a slick new UI!\n\nNew in Axis Football 2020:\n- Massively improved gameplay including catches on the run, smarter line blocking and AI, and much more!\n- Redesigned draft experience featuring a live draft view\n- New franchise startup options including random rosters and unlimited funds\n- Added career stat tracking for all players across the league\n- Added a local 2P Coach Mode\n- New animations\n- New stadiums','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kff.jpg'),(16711,'Love Tore: Mint',NULL,'Sin género','Xbox 360','In Mint, the sequel to Sweet, you are faced with a new problem. The school wants you to win the national dance championship. The girls are not used to disciplined practices, and the student club president is against you. The biggest problem, however, is that you enter the championship as pairs, and the girl you want to dance with would most certainly prefer pairing up with another girl than dancing with you. However, protecting the club is your job, so swallow your pride and dance on.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l08.jpg'),(16712,'Alfal\'s Grove','2019-07-29','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Go fast. Tear out their hearts. Use them to... buy stuff.\n\nAlfal\'s Grove is a first-person roguelike with push-forward combat, infinite item stacking, and a map that grows as you play. Kill enemies, take their hearts, give them to trees in exchange for their fruits.\n\nAnd kill the king.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cgo.jpg'),(16713,'Ys: The Oath in Felghana - Premium Edition','2010-12-02','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation Portable','Ys: The Oath in Felghana once again follows the adventures of friends Adol and Dogi who find themselves making an unannounced visit to Dogi\'s hometown of Redmont in the land of Felghana. Since his departure eight years earlier, Dogi finds himself returning home to find that things have changed dramatically, and not for the better.\n\nThe Limited Edition includes a soundtrack CD and a 4-inch by 6-inch 2011 desktop calendar highlighting artwork from the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72ha.jpg'),(16714,'The Game Paradise: Master of Shooting','1997-06-06','Shooter, Adventure','Arcade, Sega Saturn','Choose one of five characters with different powers and get the bad guy who has infiltrated an amusement arcade. Fly into the machines and battle all the things found in a classic arcade: cocktails, uprights, printed circuit boards, pinballs, fruit machines, skill games and lots more.\n\nThe Sega Saturn version added an auto-bomber function that automatically uses bombs when hit by bullets, as well as original stages and additional playable characters.\nIn addition, a scene in which deformed characters perform skits between stages has been added.\nThese additional elements can be viewed by selecting \"Arrange Mode\" on the title screen.\nYou can also select the arcade version without the added elements, but the ending will be changed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7aq6.jpg'),(16715,'Aporkalypse: Pigs of Doom','2010-12-31','Puzzle','Android, Legacy Mobile Device','We have a pig problem! According to an old prophecy the four Pigs of Doom should proclaim the end of the world in a distant future. But something went terribly wrong and the gates of heaven and hell have already opened! Now it is up to the greedy Hunger Pig, the heavily armed War Pig, the contaminous Pest Pig and the ghostly Death Pig to stop this madness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9glu.jpg'),(16716,'Dragon Age: Origins - The Stone Prisoner','2009-11-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','\"Download The Stone Prisoner and gain access to Shale, a mighty stone golem who can join the party and travel throughout Dragon Age: Origins. One of the most powerful characters in the game, Shale comes with a rich back story, extensive voice acting, and a unique follower quest to explore. The Stone Prisoner also includes new environments, items, and hours of additional gameplay that adds to the Dragon Age: Origins campaign.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60jb.jpg'),(16717,'Project Kat: Paper Lily Prologue','2021-10-15','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Project Kat is a short, unconventional RPG horror game in which there is always another way. Solve puzzles, make friends (or not), and guide Kat as she attempts to uncover the mystery behind a strange golden letter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65st.jpg'),(16718,'Call of Duty: WWII - Digital Deluxe Edition','2017-11-03','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Call of Duty returns to its historical roots with Call of Duty: World War II, a blockbuster experience from Sledgehammer Games. From the beaches of Normandy to the Hürtgen Forest, experience a dramatic story highlighting some of the most dramatic and iconic moments of World War II as a young soldier who is facing the unforgiving reality of war alongside his brothers in arms.\n\nDigital Deluxe Edition Includes:\n\nBase Game\nSeason Pass\nAdditional Bonus Content','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bqc.jpg'),(16719,'Star Sign','2023-10-06','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Extend your arms to swing around and slingshot yourself across huge open levels in this fast 3D platformer. Discover a broken world and find your way back to the skies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co764t.jpg'),(16720,'Kestrel','2021-06-18','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shoot\'em up game based around nature that has upgrades and focuses on progression more so than speed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a1b.jpg'),(16721,'Fights in Tight Spaces','2023-05-25','Fighting, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Fights in Tight Spaces blends deck-building, turn-based tactics, and thrilling animated fight sequences in classic action-movie settings. Learn to balance your hand, momentum, and positioning to overcome the odds to defeat your adversaries.\n\nPick from over 150 cards as you build a deck to suit your play style and your opponents’. Encounter random events, acquire enhancements (or injuries), and make critical choices about how best to upgrade your agent for the fights ahead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29ev.jpg'),(16722,'Disney Heroes: Battle Mode','2018-02-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Android, iOS','Disney Heroes: Battle Mode is an action-packed mobile role-playing game that brings together beloved characters from Disney and Pixar universes. In the game, players assemble a team of iconic heroes like Mickey Mouse, Elsa, Buzz Lightyear, and more, each with unique abilities and skills. The gameplay revolves around strategic team-building and tactical combat as they engage in thrilling battles against waves of enemies and challenging bosses, unlocking and upgrading new heroes, customizing their abilities, and strengthening their team to take on even greater challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nhu.jpg'),(16723,'Necrodemic','2023-12-23','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Necrodemic, is a Free to Play survival-based thriller. Defeat zombie bears to earn essence. Essence can be used to purchase more powerful weapons, ammo, and perks that increase players\' chances of survival. Rank in daily competitions and win loot box prizes and a daily leaderboard that rewards players!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60ll.jpg'),(16724,'Dragon Power','1988-03-01','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','Dragon Power is an action-adventure game developed and published by Bandai for the Nintendo Entertainment System on March 3, 1988. It is a heavily localized version of the Japanese game Dragon Ball: Shenron no Nazo. Although some of the European releases retain the Dragon Ball assets (under the title Dragon Ball), the North American release removes most references to the franchise. The game follows the first two volumes of the Dragon Ball manga, as the young monkey-tailed boy Goku (along with his teenage friend, Bulma, known in the North American version as Nora), embark on a quest to find all seven Dragon Balls (Crystal Balls in the NA version), in which it is believed that collecting them grants the user any wish they desire. Along the way, they encounter various characters, including turtle hermit Master Roshi (Hermit in the NA version), shapeshifting anthropomorphic pig Oolong (Pudgy in the NA version) and desert bandit Yamcha (Lancer in the NA version).\n\nThis port also has less stages than the original game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6nuu.jpg'),(16725,'FrankenStorm TD: Prologue','2021-10-26','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Roguelite TD: all towers & enemies start the same, but you have 1 choice per wave affecting BOTH and stacking up for dramatic variance. Gradually salvage and make some choices permanent to build deeper strategies. Also a unique mazing challenge where wires and towers must be linked to a power source','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zbq.jpg'),(16726,'Blocktopia',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Blocktopia is a vibrant and humorous clicker city-builder game. Gather resources, build your town, and defend it against nightly raids! In this chaotic world where justice prevails, survive and dive into a fun city-building experience!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96k9.jpg'),(16727,'Port Royale 3: New Adventures','2012-12-11','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Everybody who looks for new challenges should try the New Adventures DLC. Five new scenarios are waiting for you, each one with unique task that will let you experience unseen and thrilling situations. So you will help the city of Corpus Christi in “The Ascension of Christi” to become rich and well-respected within a short time or you...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66et.jpg'),(16728,'Mystica','2023-01-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mystica is an RPG for those who enjoy an intimately-woven, powerful story with rich characters and a smooth, easy-to-learn (yet still challenging) battle system. Fall into a world full of persecution, breaking tensions, and a mysterious natural force dubbed magic that\'s changing the planet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5znm.jpg'),(16729,'Friday Night Funkin\': Vs Tree','2021-05-19','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Friday Night Funkin\': Vs Tree is a mod with 3 new songs, a new enemy, more phases, effects and cutscenes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5voa.jpg'),(16730,'The Crack of Doom','1989-12-31','Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Mac, DOS, Apple II','The Crack of Doom is the last game in Melbourne House\'s series of adventure games based on Tolkien\'s Lord of the Rings.\n\nThe gameplay combines a text-based adventure with illustrations from the main character\'s perspective. Players interact with the game using text-based descriptions and a parser system to execute actions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ozx.jpg'),(16731,'Soul of Giga','2021-03-05','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Invoke and build your Giga team from various element and size, blast off the evil empire, and be the destined one. Explore the land of Giga in this pixel art turn-based battle adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s18.jpg'),(16732,'Clan of Champions','2012-11-20','Sin género','PlayStation 3, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Clan of Champions is a game that you can play with or against friends online. Each match will last around ten minutes. Of course, you can play this game by yourself, but you can ask for your friends\' help with difficult missions, or fight against them as part of your training.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pr7.jpg'),(16733,'Metal Gear Solid 3: Subsistence - Limited Edition','2006-03-14','Shooter, Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 2','Metal Gear Solid 3: Subsistence continues the Metal Gear Solid series tradition of follow-up enhanced, international version releases. Subsistence\'s online multiplayer component, titled Metal Gear Online, consists of five tournament-style game modes, each with a capacity of up to eight players.\n\nThe Limited Edition comes in a special keepsake box and includes a copy of the game and a bonus \"Existence\" disc. The Existence disc is a theater disc that presents the game\'s storyline and cutscenes edited to be suitable for a standalone movie-style release.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dmp.jpg'),(16734,'Sangokushi Eiketsuden','2005-01-27','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy Advance','The GBA port of \"Sangokushi Eiketsuden\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99pk.jpg'),(16735,'The Blind of the New World','2017-12-31','Indie, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','This game is a story-centered visual novel equal in length to a paperback novel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31ct.jpg'),(16736,'Trails of the Last Day','2022-08-20','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A zombie apocalypse game where you play as the last survival team of humankind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97l2.jpg'),(16737,'Delicious: Emily\'s Message in a Bottle','2016-08-11','Simulator, Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Discover a message in a bottle that changes Emily’s life forever, while cooking divine dishes in Italian kitchens!\nNow Paige has fully recovered from her fever, life has settled down again in Snuggford. That is, until the entire Napoli family hears that Emily’s missing grandfather, Vitto, is still alive - and might be in Italy! Emily’s father, Eduardo, is especially overwhelmed by the news. He and his four brothers haven\'t seen their father, or each other, in years. Reuniting them is going to be quite a challenge... Will Emily succeed in bringing everybody together at the big family dinner?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3obv.jpg'),(16738,'Kurokami-sama\'s Feast','2022-01-21','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Kurokami-sama\'s Feast is an adventure visual novel following an unlucky trio who find themselves hunting monsters for the powerful being known as Kurokami-sama.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4chx.jpg'),(16739,'Yo-kai Sangokushi','2016-04-02','Strategy','Nintendo 3DS','Yo-kai Sangokushi is a turn-based tactical role-playing game developed by Koei Tecmo and published by Level-5.\nIt\'s a crossover between the Yo-kai Watch and Romance of the Three Kingdoms series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7roc.jpg'),(16740,'Sherlock Holmes: The Devil\'s Daughter','2016-06-10','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Sherlock Holmes: The Devil’s Daughter is a fantastic adventure with unique gameplay that blends investigation, action and exploration for an extraordinary experience that will test the limits of your nerves and intelligence.\n\nTrack down evil in the darkest corners of London and the human soul while playing as the great detective, as you untangle a web of intrigue leading to the final stunning revelation.\n\nEach of your deductions and actions affects the rest of the story, for better or for worse…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wmc.jpg'),(16741,'Chess Exerciser','2023-11-07','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a better chess player with learning by repetition. Exercise from 3.000+ opening lines and discover their best continuation. Learn tactics from millions of puzzles split into 38 categories and 11 difficulty levels. Master 18.000+ endgame positions sorted by category and difficulty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7a9l.jpg'),(16742,'Western 1849 Reloaded','2018-08-29','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','A bullet-fast, third-person Shooting Gallery, that takes you through ultimate gunfights across various locations of the Wild West!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co222t.jpg'),(16743,'Neverwinter Nights: Infinite Dungeons','2006-05-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Neverwinter Nights: Infinite Dungeons is a premium module for Neverwinter Nights.\nThe game is a dungeon-crawler featuring an entirely randomized environment, items, and NPCs. The player journeys through Undermountain, killing hordes of hostile creatures and encountering traders, quest givers, and allies. The game is split into seven sections each corresponding to its ruler, a game\'s boss. A unique feature of the module is the map, which, when used, appears under a player\'s feet, showing the entire level and its sections, and the player position.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1t3n.jpg'),(16744,'Order of Battle: Red Star','2019-08-08','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Red Star is the first part of a series of three linked, Soviet-themed DLCs/campaigns for Order of Battle. Red Star covers battles of the Red Army in the years 1938-41.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cbe.jpg'),(16745,'Pawperty Damage','2023-05-23','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Smash, kick, stomp and chomp your way through a fully destructible city! Go to town in this cathartic action sandbox, either alone or in split screen local multiplayer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rkx.jpg'),(16746,'Shine\'s Adventures 2 (Zombie Attack)','2019-09-27','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a side scroller action game.You need to control the girls to kill the coming zombies. To this end,you can use a lot of weapons and items to kill zombies. If you run out of ammo,you can also use magic, or control robots to continue to attack. It will be the most exciting zombie game you have played.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h1i.jpg'),(16747,'Jade Empire','2005-04-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox','Set in an ancient world inspired by mythical China, Jade Empire lets you train under your master\'s watchful eye as you learn powerful martial arts and mystical powers. When danger threatens, you\'ll travel across the world, from the harsh mountains of the Land of Howling Spirits to the lush gardens of the Imperial City. In your adventures, you must face powerful human and supernatural foes, learn the exotic and magical martial arts, and discover the darkest secrets of the world. Practice the greatest fighting styles and defeat the most powerful enemies to become a master of martial arts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21x1.jpg'),(16748,'The Last Starfighter','1990-06-01','Shooter, Arcade','Nintendo Entertainment System','The Last Starfighter is based on the 1984 movie of the same name. The hero must single-handedly pilot an extraordinarily powerful starfighter to destroy an enemy armada. The action takes place in outer space from a side-scrolling perspective where the ship always remains lined up in the middle of the screen but is able to turn forwards and backwards while accelerating and decelerating. The ship can also collapse into a slimmer configuration. Enemies come at you from all directions and in all formations. Shoot them as quickly as possible while also disabling the enemy fleet\'s starcruisers as best you can.\n\nThe game also features a 2-player mode where each player takes turns fighting the armada.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38t8.jpg'),(16749,'Innocent\'s Purgatory','2022-10-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Innocents Purgatory is a horror themed first person RPG, melee combat the evil spirits of the purgatory, use magic to gain an advantage over your opponents, explore the purgatory to discover its secrets, 20 hours of gameplay, 4 endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7csq.jpg'),(16750,'George Likes to Hide','2018-01-18','Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You have 60 seconds to find George as many times as you can.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9go3.jpg'),(16751,'FIFA Soccer 06','2005-09-30','Sport','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','For 06, the players are more responsive and crucial features like first touch control have been re-mapped in a way that makes more sense. When you want to throw freestyle moves or play the ball into a space of your choosing as a pass comes to you, just hold down the left shoulder button and point the analog stick to pull your move or use first touch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2079.jpg'),(16752,'Oni','2001-09-27','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation 2','An intense action anime thriller comes to life in Oni. As an elite member of the tech crimes task force, Konoko is an agent on a mission to fight the evil Syndicate. But things are not always as they seem... Konoko is haunted by unknown demons of her past, and the truth threatens to send her over the edge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lcb.jpg'),(16753,'Valkyria Chronicles: Edy\'s Mission \"Enter the Edy Detachment\"','2009-04-16','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience an enthralling new chapter in the critically acclaimed tactical RPG, Valkyria Chronicles, with an exciting expansion pack! Six members of the Gallian Army have been separated from Squad 7 and on their journey to reunite with their squad, stumble upon a tiny village under attack by the Imperial Army. Play as Edy and command your team to defend the small village from annihilation!\n\nUse of this expansion pack requires a copy of the original Valkyria Chronicles game as well as the latest patch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gf4.jpg'),(16754,'Klein v.0.1','2023-06-27','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A psychological horror-dating sim visual novel taking place in the year 20XX, an era where A.I technology has rapidly advanced. Two years have passed since you met the smart A.I boyfriend, Klein. But as time passes, you began to wonder... just how much is too much?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9goz.jpg'),(16755,'Spikair Volleyball','2023-02-06','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Control the 4 players of your volleyball team. Recruit players, train them and win tournament to become the best volleyball club.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sae.jpg'),(16756,'Slay the Princess: The Pristine Cut - Special Edition','2025-03-31','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Slay the Princess – The Pristine Cut: Special Edition contains:\n\nphysical copy of the game\nA3 keyart poster\nsoundtrack download card\nswinging arm action acrylic standee\nmirror sticker sheet\nblack & white optical illusion keychain\nsevered arm enamel pin\ncollector’s box','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98z2.jpg'),(16757,'Super Elf Bowling','2003-11-01','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super Elf Bowling (Elf Bowling 4) was a 3-dimensional upgrade of the original with more complicated ball control and a wider variety of backgrounds, elf antics and elf jokes. One could also play as a variety of characters, including Santa, Dingle, and Mrs. Kringle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ehobsidwvodrwaq2edpy.jpg'),(16758,'Bookshop Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Open your own bookshop! Order books, stock your shelves, and earn revenue. Use your profits to decorate, expand, and hire staff. Collect rare books that give powerful abilities. Adopt a cat to keep you and your customers company along the way!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mzh.jpg'),(16759,'Hunt-or-Haunt','2022-01-29','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hunt-or-Haunt is a 6 to 12 player online game where two teams, Hunters and Haunts, face-off in pandemonius battles of elimination! As Hunters combine forces to uncover and dispatch their ghostly foes, Haunts use their stealth and trickery to divide and conquer. Eliminate your opponents to win!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ouh.jpg'),(16760,'Green Thumb','2023-01-08','Puzzle, Indie','Web browser','The goal in each level is to collect the needed number of coins by growing different crops. You have limited resources, so keep an eye on how much water, fertilizer, and seeds you have left and use them wisely to grow your garden before you run out of actions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81pp.jpg'),(16761,'Yaoling: Mythical Journey','2024-07-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yaoling: Mythical Journey is a creature collecting Eastern fantasy RPG featuring an world filled with rich stories and unique Yaolings. Tasked to uncover a mysterious evil, you embark on a journey with your Yaolings, forming new friendships, engage in intense battles, and face countless challenges!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8apw.jpg'),(16762,'Darling Duality: Winter Wish','2020-12-25','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','We all have multiple sides. Pick your poison! Will you choose sweet or sinister? Let yandere shenanigans begin!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qi9.jpg'),(16763,'Summer Clover','2024-06-26','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience a summer like never before as you become a live-in housekeeper for three charming sisters (and your supportive supervisor).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g72.jpg'),(16764,'FIFA 15: Ultimate Team Edition','2014-09-26','Sport','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','FIFA 15 (Ultimate Team Edition) in addition to the base game, FIFA 15, also contains:\n\n- 40 FUT Gold Packs\n- Adidas All-Star Team\n- Messi FUT Loan Player\n- Adidas Predator Boot Bundle\n- Historic Kit\n- Additional goal celebrations','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lbm8nnwpp1crvwsvnp7m.jpg'),(16765,'Qajary Cat','2017-11-14','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Qajar Cat is the story of a mother cat together with her kitten which, accidentally, becomes the apple of the Iranian King\'s eye. The King (Naser al-Din Shah Qajar) takes it under his roof and bestows all kinds of lavish royal blessings to it. Becoming jealous of the cat, the women in the harem steal it by way of a nocturnal plot and throw it down a well to get rid of it. This is the vicissitudinous story of this cat to get back to the King\'s court.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27ca.jpg'),(16766,'IguaRPG','2023-03-13','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Be an iguana and save the world from evil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b1v.jpg'),(16767,'Hyperforma','2019-09-05','Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','Hyperforma brings an entirely new take on the classic puzzle-based arcade genre with hacking sophisticated virtual systems being the basis of each of the over 80 unique levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57qs.jpg'),(16768,'Vividerie',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Run, shoot, dash and magic your way through hordes of vile creatures in various procedurally generated dungeons. Combine items in countless ways and master each character – all while discovering secret places and finding out more about the enchanted world of Vividerie.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yi0.jpg'),(16769,'Snap Quiz Challenge','2016-10-07','Quiz/Trivia','Windows Mobile, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A fast paced trivia game for the sharp-minded!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9goe.jpg'),(16770,'Pega Game',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','become pega dog and explore heaven!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gpc.jpg'),(16771,'Legend of Krannia: Cursed Fate','2021-01-25','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A top-down fantasy game with deck-building elements. You play as Vahn who is betrayed by his fellow soldiers and falls in battle. Given another chance, he finds himself in a small town having to start everything again, he must build his strength and stop the darkness that plagues the kingdom and kill the traitors in the process.\n\nCollecting skills, leveling-up, customizing your gameplay and managing your stats are its primary elements. It has a complex 2D controls with skill-switching, blocking and dodging.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v5u.jpg'),(16772,'Dynamite Fishing: World Games','2015-09-30','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Android, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Fish as a Redneck with dynamite.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28xw.jpg'),(16773,'War Never Changes','2017-05-02','Sin género','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A clicker about War','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9go7.jpg'),(16774,'The Count of Monte Clicker',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','The Count of Monte Clicker is an incremental game about breaking out of prison and finding treasure. With the help of fellow prisoner Abbe Faria, you, Edmond Dantes must escape the notorious Chateau d\'Idle and claim your destiny.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o9f.jpg'),(16775,'Pillars of Eternity II: Deadfire - Seeker, Slayer, Survivor','2018-09-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Prove your worth in the crucible of Kazuwari, where the arena\'s masters and their worshipers exalt the victorious and delight in the blood forfeited by the defeated. Something corrupts the spirits that dwell in the very stones of the crucible, and only you can uncover its secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21sc.jpg'),(16776,'JR East Train Simulator: Yokosuka Line (Kurihama to Tokyo) Series E217','2024-10-29','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Yokosuka Line is a 23.9 km long line connecting Kurihama Station in Yokosuka City, Kanagawa Prefecture and Ōfuna Station in Kamakura City, Kanagawa Prefecture. Although the official name of Ōfuna Station to Tōkyō Station is Tōkaido main line, trains run directly from Kurihama Station to Tōkyō Station, so the line between Kurihama and Tōkyō Stations is known as the Yokosuka Line.\nThe train leaves Kurihama Station for Yokohama Station via Yokosuka Station, a military port town; Kamakura Station,famous for the Daibutsu statue and Tsurugaoka Hachiman Shrine; and Ōfuna Station, where the train joins the Tōkaidō Main Line. After Yokohama Station, the line separates from the Tōkaidō Main Line near Tsurumi Station and heads for Shinagawa Station while running alongside the Tōkaidō Shinkansen via Shin-Kawasaki Station where the Shin-Tsurumi Engine Works, and Musashi-kosugi Station is spead. After Shinagawa Station, the line goes underground to Tōkyō Station, its final destination. We hope you enjoy the various landscapes from the suburbs to the city and the many parallel trains.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16777,'Seven: Drowned Past','2019-03-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Seven: Drowned Past introduces a whole new story line, including: additional opponents, new skills to implement, terrains to parkour, eight new quests, and about 7 hours of gameplay, all for free to owners of Seven: The Days Long Gone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jet.jpg'),(16778,'Donkey Konga 3: Tabehoudai! Haru Mogitate 50 Kyoku','2005-03-17','Music','Nintendo GameCube','Donkey Konga 3: Tabe-houdai! Haru Mogitate 50 Kyoku is a music video game in the Donkey Kong series developed by Namco and published by Nintendo. Before the second installment was released in North America, Nintendo and Namco had already started plans for the third game in the series, which, unlike the first two Donkey Konga games, was eventually released only in Japan in early 2005.\n\nDonkey Konga 3 features a total of 57 track (includes the all new track), over 20 track more than the first two games. 35 of these tunes are the usual classical, pop, and game selections, but an extra 21 tunes from Nintendo Famicom games are included. It also features features all new minigames.\n\nThe title of \"Donkey Konga 3 JP\" was given in Super Smash Bros. Brawl.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2f7u.jpg'),(16779,'Tokimeki Memorial Girl\'s Side Premium 3rd Story','2012-03-15','Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation Portable','Tokimeki Memorial Girl\'s Side Premium 3rd Story is an enhanced port of Tokimeki Memorial Girl\'s Side: 3rd Story on the Nintendo DS.\n\nNew features:\n• New character Tatsuya\n• Renewed graphics with a 2D animation system\n• \"Boys\' Life\" mode, where the player can watch super-deformed versions of the main male characters interact with their bedrooms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tv1.jpg'),(16780,'Last Days of Lazarus','2022-10-28','Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','After their mother\'s suicide, Lazarus returns home to his sister Lyudmila. But unexplained events make the world and even reality collapse around him. Looming death, a spreading malediction and the supernatural threaten his sanity, yet Lazarus pushes forward to find the truth about his family.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wfc.jpg'),(16781,'Diamond Skee-Ball',NULL,'Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Diamond Skee-Ball is a Twitch chat game for all streamer to play from the comfort of your home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zd9.jpg'),(16782,'Chess and Dungeons','2021-05-18','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chess with elements of Dungeons & Dragons 5e.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bdh.jpg'),(16783,'Neverwinter Nights: Darkness Over Daggerford','2018-06-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Darkness over Daggerford Enhanced is an official premium module for Neverwinter Nights: Enhanced Edition. Developed by Ossian Studios, this new enhanced version of Darkness over Daggerford updates the award-winning former premium module with a host of gameplay improvements, new music, voice over, and portrait art.\n\nDaggerford was based on earlier Dungeons & Dragons video games like Baldur\'s Gate and Icewind Dale. It takes place in the Western Heartlands region of the Forgotten Realms campaign setting, in the town of Daggerford, near Waterdeep and Baldur\'s Gate. Completely a single-player experience, Daggerford\'s story revolves around the player character investigating the recent death of the town\'s leader.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1t0b.jpg'),(16784,'Mofina Island','2023-01-13','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mofina Island is a slow paced survival/ adventure game, where you will need to try and solve the mysteries of the island as well as survive on your own. Gather food and other resources, build tools and other items and use your game bud System to defend yourself of the scary ghost attacks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zmq.jpg'),(16785,'Black Box Lss: The Shining Immortal','2023-10-20','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Immerse yourself in a pixel-art AVG that blends thrilling crime, romantic comedy, and the pursuit of love. This game depicts the story of a new employee pursuing his female boss. If you\'re a fan of love, yandere, and don\'t mind a touch of thrill and crime, you will greatly enjoy this game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c4m.jpg'),(16786,'Erectus the Game',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Erectus is a free-to-play strategy-focused empire builder MMO set in a historical environment where the player takes part in a conflict between the Homo sapiens and Homo erectus. The objective of Erectus the Game is to create your own empire, build a powerful army and eventually defeat and capture the cruel king of the Erectus. The endgame is the final stage of a gameworld in Erectus. During the endgame volcanoes on the map will become active as the Erectus king starts his ritual. \n \n \nErectus version 2 utilizes the Unity engine which aligned perfectly with our vision for version 2. While the Canvas engine worked well for what we were trying to achieve with version 1, we felt that it was necessary to find something better suited to our desire to create something that would be an upgrade in every way. We\'ve worked hard on improving the game\'s visuals, interface, stability and accessibility. We hope players will be pleasantly surprised with all of the improvements to their player experience in Erectus version 2!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j8u.jpg'),(16787,'Fright Animatronics 2','2023-09-26','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fright Animatronics 2 is a first-person horror game where your task is to work in a warehouse for a week. What can go wrong?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72rv.jpg'),(16788,'Anomaly Corridor','2024-10-08','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Anomaly Corridor is a horror-themed walking simulator where the player memorizes a corridor in a spaceship during Section 0 and proceeds through the airlocks into new sections leading to an escape pod. Creatures and other weird phenomena haunt the hallway with anomalies that you must look for with the help of your flashlight to discover any anomalies that have changed the corridor. If an anomaly has been spotted, you must return to the airlock you came from to progress to the next section. Successfully make it to section 10 to board the last escape pod to survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wvl.jpg'),(16789,'Postal F: The Thursday Expansion - A Mod for Friday Night Funkin\'.','2022-12-25','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After the events of the first week, the dude sees himself encountering a familiar face: Krotchy! Go up against Krotchy in a new nutsack wrenchin\' week, along with another song we can\'t seem to figure out!\n\nBoyfriend seems to have found himself in a sticky situation when he enters the wrong side of town...\n\nPostal F: Apocalypse Friday is a mod based around the Postal franchise, created by Running with Scissors Studios. In this mod, you go against the infamous \"Postal Dude\" in a 2 song mania featuring Boyfriend and a familiar Redhead. Will you survive or regret your decision? On behalf of the mod team, we all hope you have an enjoyable experience. This mod started out simply as only a cover but evolved into a 2 month long passion project.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8422.jpg'),(16790,'Batman: Arkham Origins','2013-11-08','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U, Xbox 360','Batman: Arkham Origins features an expanded Gotham City and introduces an original prequel storyline occurring several years before the events of Batman: Arkham Asylum and Batman: Arkham City.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nmd.jpg'),(16791,'Bridge to Another World: Escape From Oz','2017-06-01','Point-and-click','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','From 4Friends, creators of Living Legends, comes an exciting new game in the Bridge to Another World series!\n\nToday started out like any other day – you sent your kids off to school and settled in for some peace and quiet with your little dog, Toto. But your world is turned upside-down when a tornado suddenly appears and carries your house to the extraordinary land of Oz. Now you find yourself in the middle of a fierce competition controlled by the mysterious Great Wizard. To earn your way back home, you and Toto must explore the four corners of Oz, facing enemies, obstacles, and puzzles at every turn! Are you up to the challenge? Find out in this Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98nm.jpg'),(16792,'Cities: Skylines - Mass Transit','2017-05-18','Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','Mass Transit brings several new systems into play to help citizens traverse their towns in speed and style. Commuters can now get around on the water, up high mountain peaks, and even through the sky thanks to the addition of ferries, monorails, cable cars, and blimps to the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74y6.jpg'),(16793,'UniWar S','1980-02-01','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','Gingateikoku no Gyakushū (銀河帝国の逆襲), released as UniWar S in the United States is a fixed shooter arcade game that was released by Irem in 1980; it runs upon Namco\'s Galaxian hardware (a Zilog Z80 running at 3.072 MHz). The player must use the two-way joystick to direct a yellow ship left and right (across the bottom of the screen), with a single button to make it fire shots up at the various types of enemies - and the first stage will see it fighting a formation of \"Super Mosquitoes\", which are worth 20 points apiece. The second stage, which sees a dotted orange line under the ship, will see it fighting a formation of \"Hovering Attackers\" which are worth 30 points apiece, and the third stage will see it fighting a formation of \"Demon Flies\", which are worth 40; some of the \"Demon Flies\" will leave \"Spy Aliens\" when killed, which will fall down to the bottom of the screen underneath that line, and try to stab the ship from behind. The only way to kill them (for 100 points apiece), is to destroy the \"Killer King\" when he appears - and the fourth and last unique stage will see the ship fighting a formation of \"Rolling Fires\", which are worth 50 points apiece and will also occasionally leave \"Spy Aliens\" behind when killed. After the last unique stage has been cleared, the four-stage cycle will start all over again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/x6wdbb3pdhykz5ks2jif.jpg'),(16794,'Of Light and Darkness: The Prophecy','1998-05-01','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Of Light and Darkness: The Prophecy is an Adventure game, developed by Tribal Dreams and published by Interplay, which was released in 1998.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ryk2xecixca9oiynplxg.jpg'),(16795,'Augmented Empire','2025-04-16','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into New Savannah, 2058. The acclaimed VR title Augmented Empire now debuts on PC. Command a ragtag team of misfits through 26 missions of turn-based, tactical battles. Overthrow a corrupt elite in a cyberpunk world brimming with strategy and rich storytelling.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gx7.jpg'),(16796,'Slay Together','2019-01-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slay Together is a multiplayer game for up to 4 players in which you fight together with your heavy armed teammates against a horde of wild villagers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41my.jpg'),(16797,'Sky Madness',NULL,'Sin género','Android','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1kpj.jpg'),(16798,'Kronno Zomber',NULL,'Sin género','Android, iOS','Ready for the race of your life? Become Kronno Zomber and… Run! Jump! Dodge!\nBut most importantly, don’t let the ferocious horde catch you!\n\nA T-Rex riding a motorbike?\nA flying dog shooting missiles?\nA flying skateboard?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16799,'Pen Pals','2023-12-01','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Things are going HAYwire down at the farm! Corral a herd of particularly round barnyard friends back into the pen. When two matching animals bump into each other, you\'ll find an even larger animal in their place. Things get crowded quickly, so do your best in Pen Pals!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hlu.jpg'),(16800,'Parkan II','2007-05-11','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Parkan II is an original concept game that will allow you to feel as a pilot of a spacecraft lost somewhere in the universe. The players are to explore hundreds of solar systems, take part in a series of fierce battles and meet a new enemy - a mysterious creature calling itself Gegemaunt. Become a pirate or mercenary, get money to buy the most powerful cruiser and show them all who is to be the new master of the galaxy. Unforgettable adventures in the Parkan II universe await you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mag.jpg'),(16801,'Triangle Strategy','2022-03-04','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Three nations battle for control of the dwindling resources of salt and iron in this HD-2D adventure tactical RPG. Featuring deep gameplay full of choices and consequences, strategically survey the battlefield to gain the upper hand.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wc0.jpg'),(16802,'G-Darius HD','2021-09-28','Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Take flight in the iconic Silver Hawk and immerse yourself in thrilling gameplay with both modern HD-visuals or authentic retro-arcade graphics. Experience the conflicts between the Amnelia Kingdom and the merciless Thiima Empire that took place before the battle between the people of Darius and Belsar. During this conflict, the series’ iconic Silver Hawks were created to make use of the game’s unique capture ball system that allows you to forge your own strategy and gain an edge over the enemy! G-DARIUS HD is the port of “G-DARIUS” in high resolution – developed by the masters of remastering at M2. The game can also be played in low resolution like in the original arcade version. From the epic boss battles to the memorable soundtrack, G-DARIUS stood out when it first got released in the arcades and up to these days, critics and fans are praising this game as a prime example of how to bring a 2D game series properly to 3D.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gg8.jpg'),(16803,'Delta Park',NULL,'Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Delta Park is a horror and exploration title with a retro style. After being attacked by a strange being and our pet “Pepa” disappears without a trace, the search will lead us to discover the twisted origin of the creature and its creator. We must find Pepa, and return home safe and sound.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97cg.jpg'),(16804,'Pixel Game Maker Series: Rocket Frog','2025-03-13','Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Charge... keep charging... and then jump!\nMake inertia your friend and fly!\nBut not actually, as you might go too far and fall!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9j1e.jpg'),(16805,'Caribbean Odyssey','2015-11-12','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the epic adventure of the legendary pirate Captain Henry Morgan. Inspired by true events from 16th century, Caribbean Odyssey is a beautiful tale of loyalty, love, betrayal and revenge. Explore a lavish and colorful world of secrets in 2.5D. The journey of Captain Morgan takes you through Caribbean islands, caves, dungeons, jungles and populated cities. Unfold the mysterious truth as the most wanted pirate of the Caribbean flees from the city of Port Royal to escape the wrath of evil Governor Thomas Modyford. Does he really have the map to the mythical City of Gold?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16806,'Rhythmic Keyboard',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Rhythmic Keyboard is a music-based typing game with integration of a talent system that allows for the player to increase their effectiveness. Procedurally spawned keys inhibit pattern formation, so reaction speed and hand/eye coordination are a priority -- not memorization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mf4.jpg'),(16807,'Saint Kotar: The Yellow Mask','2020-06-18','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Follow the fear of Benedek Dohnany and Nikolay Kalyakin and play the onset of a dark and chilling narrative adventure. Make decisions and affect the events that precede a macabre series of murders, allegedly related to devil worship and witchcraft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xgo.jpg'),(16808,'Wolfenstein II: The New Colossus Digital Deluxe Edition','2017-10-27','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Wolfenstein II: The New Colossus is the highly-anticipated sequel to the critically acclaimed, Wolfenstein: The New Order developed by the award-winning studio MachineGames.\n\nAn exhilarating adventure brought to life by the industry-leading id Tech 6, Wolfenstein II sends players to Nazi-controlled America on a mission to recruit the boldest resistance leaders left. Fight the Nazis in iconic American locations, equip an arsenal of badass guns, and unleash new abilities to blast your way through legions of Nazi soldiers in this definitive first-person shooter.\n\nAmerica, 1961. The Nazis maintain their stranglehold on the world. You are BJ Blazkowicz, aka “Terror-Billy,” member of the Resistance, scourge of the Nazi empire, and humanity’s last hope for liberty. Only you have the guts, guns, and gumption to return stateside, kill every Nazi in sight, and spark the second American Revolution.\n\nContinue the fight with the Wolfenstein II: The Freedom Chronicles Season Pass and get access to all three DLC packs. Play as new larger-than-life American heroes Joseph Stallion, Jessica Valiant, and Gerald Wilkins! Visit never-before-seen American locations corrupted by the Nazis! Use your guns and abilities to kill every Nazi in your path! Only you can overcome the Nazi threat in…The Freedom Chronicles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24k4.jpg'),(16809,'Where\'s Home?','2020-03-25','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Where\'s Home?\" A Puzzle, Stealth/Horror adventure game. Playing as Pumo the little robot and his companion friend buggie; you\'re on a mission to find a new way home as for some reason your precious ship has been shot down. Beware of the one behind it all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20ns.jpg'),(16810,'Venatrix','2024-05-23','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Venatrix is a unique hybrid of action-packed and stealth-based horror game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75hd.jpg'),(16811,'The Legend of Heroes: Trails in the Sky the 3rd','2008-07-24','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable','The Legend of Heroes: Trails in the Sky the 3rd is the third installment in the main Trails series, serving as a direct sequel to the events of The Legend of Heroes: Trails in the Sky SC and the ending to the Liberl arc. The game follows Kevin Graham and Ries Argent in their quest to retrieve an ancient artifact for the Septian Church.\n\nFeaturing the largest cast of playable characters in the Trails series up to that point, new minigames and even more gameplay features. This game teasing many new plot developments across the continent of Zemuria.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23da.jpg'),(16812,'Murus','2021-08-05','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A hardcore speedrunning platformer where you cannot touch the ground!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m4a.jpg'),(16813,'Cookie Run: Puzzle World','2020-01-16','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Cookie Run: Puzzle World, titled Cookie Run: Jelly Pop during the soft launch, CookiePuzzle during early development, and Hello! Brave Cookies during the first season of the game, is a free-to-play Match 3 game released by Devsisters','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4on5.jpg'),(16814,'Static','2018-10-28','Visual Novel','Web browser','A Micro Horror Story','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gqb.jpg'),(16815,'The Magical Advenenture of Soggy Hoggy','2020-08-22','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97d1.jpg'),(16816,'Labyban','2025-04-27','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Liuri wakes up, alone, deep inside a mine on an abandoned floating island. He doesn’t know how he got there or why. There’s only one thing to do: explore.\n\nA tribute to the timeless Sokoban genre, LABYBAN modernizes the puzzle game experience with an accessible, intuitive, and stimulating approach. Across more than 140 levels, each puzzle pushes the gameplay mechanics even further.\n\nTeleporters, slippery surfaces, conveyor belts... and many more surprises await!\n\nThe world of LABYBAN is made up of seven distinct biomes, each with a strong visual identity and unique gameplay mechanics. Some introduce new ways to play, while others combine and transform previous challenges, ensuring a smooth and varied progression.\n\nWill you manage to escape the island?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ml9.jpg'),(16817,'Meat Cleaver Mutilator','2017-05-11','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1suy.jpg'),(16818,'Spells and Fellas','2022-11-07','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Spells and Fellas is an action-packed survival game with magic-based combat. Bring your enemies to their knees and receive more powerful spells and equipment as loot. Recruit allies to fight alongside you to increase your chances of surviving all 100 waves of enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pgw.jpg'),(16819,'Turbo Tornado','2023-11-07','Racing','Android, iOS','Turbo Tornado: Car Racing is an offline racing game designed for speed enthusiasts. In addition to the open world, experience unique features such as vehicle customization, drift, night theme and police chases.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82xj.jpg'),(16820,'InstLife','2018-02-24','Sin género','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sie.jpg'),(16821,'Retro City Rampage','2014-02-06','Shooter, Puzzle, Racing, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 3, Nintendo 3DS, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360','Retro City Rampage is a downloadable action-adventure video game for WiiWare, Xbox Live Arcade, PlayStation Network and Microsoft Windows developed by Vblank Entertainment. It is a parody of retro games and \'80s and \'90s pop culture, as well as Grand Theft Auto and similar games. It was released on October 9, 2012, for PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, Microsoft Windows; on January 2, 2013, for Xbox Live Arcade; and on February 28, 2013, for WiiWare. Retro City Rampage was the last original game released for the WiiWare service globally until Deer Drive Legends was ported to the service the following November.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h4v.jpg'),(16822,'New Slippery Samurai','2021-07-30','Racing, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Nobunaga was captured by Ninja Castle and remodeled to overflow from his whole body with lubricant.! He cannot even walk due to the slimy texture, but is able to kick the wall and slip with taking advantage of the lubricant! Let\'s cut off Ninjas\' heads one after another, and escape from the Castle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jpr.jpg'),(16823,'Simon the Sorcerer 4: Chaos Happens','2007-02-23','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In \"Simon the Sorcerer 4: Chaos Happens\" players take control of the witty sorcerer during his new quest in the Magic World. In this point and click adventure the story unravels when Simon travels around and interacts with dozens of characters, solves puzzles and brings order to the chaos his double has caused.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vfo.jpg'),(16824,'Cloak & Dagger: Shadow Operations','2023-03-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short, single player, third person, tactical stealth action game set in the early 1990\'s meant to be finished in one sitting. Use the shadows, shoot out lights, stun enemies, and conceal yourself in the darkness through 5 Missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qya.jpg'),(16825,'Warhammer 40,000: Shootas, Blood & Teef','2022-10-25','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','From the developers of the Guns, Gore and Cannoli franchise comes a new 2D run & gun platformer: Warhammer 40,000: Shootas, Blood & TEEF! Spearhead an Ork invasion, destroy the hive city and kill your warboss! ‘Ere we go!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tav.jpg'),(16826,'Avatar: The Last Airbender - Quest for Balance','2023-09-22','Fighting, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In Avatar: The Last Airbender - Quest for Balance you\'ll be playing as one of nine characters - Aang, Toph, Sokka, and Katara are all confirmed - utilizing the four elements (earth, wind, fire, and water) to solve puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73q2.jpg'),(16827,'Elysion','2019-11-08','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you like watching cute girls kick butt? Elysion is a new 2D Sci-fi side scroller shooting game! ! While the girls are all unique and cutesy, journey with them to delve deep into the story and world of Elysion! Your mission to save the world begins here!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pv4.jpg'),(16828,'Time Blazer','2022-03-10','Arcade','Nintendo Switch','An unknown force in the galaxy is literally eating planets! As it travels through the galaxy, planets in its path begin to panic. A plan to nuke the anomaly goes into action - and it works, but at a cost. As it implodes, it scatters dangerous debris across the galaxy. The Time Blazers are called in for cleanup duty. You\'ll blast your way through dozens of levels in pulse-pounding arcade action as you fight off a seemingly infinite onslaught of space debris. Use the time warp to slow down your enemies when you become overwhelmed. Upgrade your weapons early and often so that when there are 1,000 asteroids closing in on you - you\'re ready!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mzf.jpg'),(16829,'Skyward Extraction','2024-09-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A light horror adventure through a post apocalyptic world, with airships.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d10.jpg'),(16830,'Rocketing',NULL,'Fighting, Tactical, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rocketing is a 1vs1 Arcade Battle Game. You and your Friends Job is to get the other one Down by throwing Stones at them and their Platform. It can either be played offline Splitscreen or Online','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nqf.jpg'),(16831,'Super Dungeon Muncher','2024-08-06','Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Avoid becoming Muncher\'s next meal in this fast-paced adventure! Control your anger, this game is hard!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8n8s.jpg'),(16832,'Brain Boom',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16833,'My Angel Girlfriend','2020-06-30','Visual Novel','Android','You’re just a typical high school student. You’ve got good friends. You’ve got good grades. Everything in your life is going well. But you can’t help but feel empty. Surely there’s got to be more to life than this? If you only had a sign! Well, your prayers are answered when you encounter a stunning girl mysteriously standing in the middle of the street. She tells you that she’s looking for an angel… You immediately realize that this girl is delusional and that this isn’t the kind of change you were looking for in your life. You head home. So much for that.\n\nSuddenly, you hear someone tapping on your window. It’s that girl from before… But HOLY COW! She’s got beautiful angel wings and is flying outside your window! She’s actually a real angel! Now that she’s got your attention, she explains that she needs help finding her sister, a fallen angel. Not having a clue as to what on earth or heaven is going on, you agree to let her stay with you, only to wake up the next morning to find yet another gorgeous angel in your room. If there is a God, he must really like you!\n\nBefore you know it, the two angel girls have joined your school, and you’re helping them look for this ”fallen angel.” But, you soon learn that angels aren’t the only unearthly beings hiding in your school. Powerful devils looking to cause trouble are lurking about too! Can you help these two angel beauties save this fallen angel and foil the devils’ plot before all hell breaks loose? Don’t wait for a sign from heaven.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bx1.jpg'),(16834,'Barricadez','2020-01-06','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Barricadez is a side-view tower defense game. Collect materials and items underground, craft or produce it, and setup a base to protect the \"cradle\" from enemies that appears and attack at night. Combining a wide variety of traps and blocks to build a unique base in the world, and repel enemies unforgivingly.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vcp.jpg'),(16835,'The Outer Worlds: Murder on Eridanos','2021-03-17','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Outer Worlds: Murder on Eridanos is the last of two narrative expansions that can be purchased individually or bundled at a discount in The Outer Worlds Expansion Pass. A copy of The Outer Worlds on the same platform is required to play expansion(s).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xcy.jpg'),(16836,'Homeworld: Remastered Collection','2015-02-25','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Homeworld Remastered Collection updates and introduces the landmark space strategy games to modern audiences. The collection includes Homeworld and Homeworld 2, painstakingly remastered by Gearbox in cooperation with key members of the original development team and members of the series’ passionate fan community. As a free bonus, this collection also includes the original versions of Homeworld and Homeworld 2 with compatibility updates, preserving the purest form of the original releases. Anyone who purchases Homeworld Remastered Collection will also receive free access to the Homeworld Remastered Steam Multiplayer Beta when the collection releases on February 25, 2015.\n\nThe Homeworld series has a long legacy and is regarded by many as one of the best strategy series of all time. Following its release in 1999 by publisher Sierra and developer Relic Entertainment, Homeworld received several Game of the Year awards and redefined the RTS genre. Its sequel, Homeworld 2, launched in 2003, and was similarly praised by critics for its innovative controls and changes to multiplayer. Brian Martel, Gearbox Software\'s Chief Creative Officer, has great love and respect for Relic\'s brilliant, fun and innovative franchise and personally spearheaded Gearbox Software’s acquisition of Homeworld from THQ in 2013.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rg1.jpg'),(16837,'Excave II: Wizard of the Underworld','2015-04-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Excave II is a classic JRPG style dungeon hack and slash game wherein players take the role of one of two adventurers, tasked with returning order to a progressively more chaotic city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zyn.jpg'),(16838,'Shin Megami Tensei: Devil Survivor 2 - Record Breaker','2015-01-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Nintendo 3DS','Your days are numbered. This is a chilling reminder that the apocalypse is upon us. Exclusive to the Nintendo 3DS handheld system, Shin Megami Tensei: Devil Survivor 2 Record Breaker offers more than 100 hours of gameplay and plot -- nearly double the content of the original Devil Survivor 2. It also includes fully voiced English story dialogue, giving new depth to the cast of Devil Survivor 2\'s original story. Record Breaker requires no knowledge of the story from the original Devil Survivor, so newcomers to the series won\'t lack any crucial plot information.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26if.jpg'),(16839,'Madou Monogatari II: Arle 16-Sai','1994-06-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sega Game Gear','Madou Monogatari II: Arle 16-Sai is a Sega Game Gear sequel to Madou Monogatari I: 3tsu no Madoukyuu.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wj0.jpg'),(16840,'Slenderman History: WWII Faceless Horror','2018-08-31','Shooter, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Slenderman History: WWII Faceless Horror, you\'re plunged into a sinister World War II environment, where the Nazis are conducting nefarious experiments. The aim? Creating a super soldier and summoning Slenderman through the use of an ancient artifact.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zwv.jpg'),(16841,'Oblitus Mortis','2025-03-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Metroidvania, Pixel art set in a world full of legends and myths of Venezuela. Explore various settings, face mythical creatures and discover ancient secrets in this incredible odyssey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qo4.jpg'),(16842,'Slither Snake IO 2018','2017-04-07','Sin género','Web browser','Slither.io is a massively multiplayer online video game available for iOS, Android, and web browsers, developed by Steve Howse. Players control an avatar resembling a worm, which consumes multicolored pellets, both from other players and ones that naturally spawn on the map in the game, to grow in size. The objective of the game is to grow the longest worm in the server. Slither.io is similar in concept to the popular 2015 web game Agar.io and is reminiscent of the classic arcade game Snake.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16843,'World Flight','2022-09-30','Simulator','Meta Quest 2, Oculus Quest','Fly around the world without limits with your Meta Quest 2 headset.\nFeel the freedom, travel anywhere in the planet and enjoy all its beauty and diversity.\nPlan your flight on the map with a powerful search engine and fly a plane or a helicopter with totally different gameplays.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dbd.jpg'),(16844,'Battle of Arachnidia',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Battle of Arachnidia is a fast-paced top-down shooter in which you fight back against hordes of arachnid robots. Protect your base by destroying all enemies by coming up with different tactics, improving your robot and using different help bonuses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l0m.jpg'),(16845,'Rhythm Heaven Fever','2016-11-24','Music','Wii, Wii U','Summary: Known as \"Beat the Beat: Rhythm Paradise\" in the UK/EU. Feel the Beat and Get into the Rhythm Rhythm Heaven Fever promise to be the quirkiest, most charming rhythm game you and your friends will ever play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2klu.jpg'),(16846,'Bowmaster 2: Archery Tournament',NULL,'Simulator, Sport','Sin plataforma','Bowmaster 2, the sequel to the immersive #1 worldwide hit archery game is finally here with a brand new free to play tournament! The Merry Five are back to reclaim the Bowmaster mantle so draw your bow, take aim and release your inner Robin Hood once again!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16847,'Plant Daddy','2020-01-06','Simulator, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A laid-back browser game about raising houseplants in your sunny apartment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20se.jpg'),(16848,'Unreal Gold','2000-01-21','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your prison ship has crash-landed on the fastest, sleekest, most dangerous 3D world ever created. Look around, crystal clear water shimmers, shadows dance and shift, alien architecture fades into the horizon. Discover the secret of this mysterious planet and find out what caused a peaceful race to be enslaved by vicious merciless aggressors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2abz.jpg'),(16849,'NieR Re[in]carnation: The Sun and the Moon','2021-10-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, iOS','Also known as Season 2 from NieR Re[in]carnation, The Sun and the Moon is the second story arc of this game revolving around high school students Hina Akagi and Yuzuki Kurezome traversing The Cage. This arc differs from the first in that the player chooses which character to play at the start through a series of questions, and the selected character\'s stories are explored at the end of each chapter. With this update, new characters, areas, and events joined the world of NieR Re[in]carnation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vhs.jpg'),(16850,'Tails of Trainspot','2023-06-16','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','\"Tails of Trainspot\"is a unique and enjoyable puzzle game that takes you on a journey to a mysterious island filled with stories. As a railway builder, you\'ll lay tracks, connect stations, and uncover secrets and myths on the Packan Islands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vk9.jpg'),(16851,'VVVVV','2019-11-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','VVVVV is a colorful, dynamic platform action with puzzle elements, made in retro style. You have to go through many obstacles, solving various puzzles. A considerable arsenal of weapons will come to your aid, which will turn the enemy into minced meat, as well as magic that will not let your enemies get bored. Use the acrobatic abilities of the protagonist to deftly and quickly overcome deadly traps, climb walls. But be careful: levels keep many secrets that you have to find. Carefully plan and calculate your actions in order to successfully reach the portal and not die 50 times along the way - at the hands of an enemy or a trap. Collect various items, potions and weapons that will help you and facilitate the difficult path, and some of them even allow you to change the vector of gravity and gain power over the air! Learn ancient monoliths to improve your skills or learn a new magic spell. You will also have exciting mini-shuttle air battles and bloody arena battles. And remember: donate to the demonic altar only when you are truly prepared for the consequences.\nYou are waiting for a long and exciting adventure for more than 6 hours of gameplay!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co269z.jpg'),(16852,'Euro Truck Simulator 2: Goodyear Tyres Pack','2019-08-02','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','We are proud to introduce a new set of truck tyres and truck accessories, officially licensed from Goodyear to Euro Truck Simulator 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rpt.jpg'),(16853,'Disney Dreamlight Valley: The Storybook Vale','2024-11-20','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Be whisked away to the Vale and embark on an enchanting adventure with a cast of new characters including the Lorekeeper – a magical book holding this fantastical land together. However, a happily ever after is a ways off as you discover that discordance between two iconic Disney Villains - Maleficent from Disney’s Sleeping Beauty and Hades from Disney’s Hercules, has torn this land apart.\n\nCausing mysterious phenomenon across The Vale’s three biomes – the Bind, Everafter, and Mythopia – their conflict has yielded Ink seeping out of the very ground and sent the pages of the Lorekeeper near and far as enchanted page pieces called Snippets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zsz.jpg'),(16854,'Escape the Arcade','2023-12-07','Puzzle, Indie','Playdate','A casual escape room game for Playdate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tkz.jpg'),(16855,'The Hauntings: Surveillance','2022-05-21','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the Directive Seven Bravo surveillance team. There\'s an office that\'s been experiencing paranormal events. Your task is to scan through various cameras set up throughout the building and document as many activities as possible. Be warned: this assignment is of high importance and If you miss too many activities, or report improper activities, you will be fired.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uiy.jpg'),(16856,'The Girl Who Kicked a Rabbit','2024-03-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Girl Who Kicked a Rabbit is a tight, turn-based JRPG-lite for those who want just the meaty part. Kill cute enemies, collect loot, and build devastating new spells. Then do it all over again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h87.jpg'),(16857,'Art7','2022-07-07','Sin género','Playdate','1-bit Art Gallery for the Playdate console','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16858,'Territory War','2006-03-21','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Web browser','Similar in gameplay to Worms. Play against a human opponent or a CPU one. Unlock additional stages, missions, and hats! This game will also track your stat progress as far as kills, head shots, accuracy, etc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ud1.jpg'),(16859,'Dungeon Deck','2024-11-28','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a dungeon in the form of a deck of cards! Collect rare items, build your own deck, and defeat the dungeon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ot3.jpg'),(16860,'Nekketsu Kouha Kunio-kun: Bangai Rantou-hen','1990-12-07','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, Game Boy','Nekketsu Kouha Kunio-kun: Bangai Rantou-hen is the first game in the Kunio-kun series released by Technōs Japan for the Game Boy. It is a sequel to Nekketsu Kouha Kunio-kun, but uses the graphical style of Downtown Nekketsu Monogatari, which was previously released on the Famicom. This is the second game in the Kunio-kun series that has Kunio and Riki joining forces against a common threat, which would become a standard in later games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i01.jpg'),(16861,'Kiteboarding','2024-07-17','Simulator, Sport','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Experience the exhilaration of Kiteboarding as you ride the waves, performing thrilling jumps and tricks propelled by the wind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8b33.jpg'),(16862,'Supertrumpman: Patriot Fists of Truth','2016-10-24','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Android','A fast reaction survival defense game in which you play as the 44th President of the United States defending the White House (on the moon) against the nightmarish hordes from beyond the wall. Fast moving hordes upon hordes of various enemies storm towards you from multiple directions. You shoot them down by pressing fire buttons according to direction of attack. As you clear waves and defeat boss enemies, you gain power levels and can buy upgrades.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8eh3.jpg'),(16863,'Civiballs','2009-04-02','Puzzle','Web browser','A puzzle game where you must use your sword to cut the chains and release the balls. Get the balls to the urn of the same color to complete the level. There are 3 branching paths and civilizations to choose from: Egypt, Greece, and China.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ybk.jpg'),(16864,'Home Sweet Home: Survive','2021-03-25','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Home Sweet Home: Survive is an asymmetrical game that consists of 1 Specter hunting 4 survivors in an arena. There are two core gameplays depended on the role players take.\n\nThe Specter is to strategically hunt 4 Survivors letting no one escape, and not being killed by survivors. Each Specter will have different stats and special abilities offering various ways of hunting survivors.\n\nThe survivors have to cooperate to complete the objective. Each character will have different stats and unique abilities supporting each role of play - decoy, damage, or perform the rituals. Things will drastically change after the objective is completed. The game will test personal dilemma choosing either teaming up to eliminate the Specter or saving own self by leaving the arena.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u5d.jpg'),(16865,'Batman: Arkham Knight - PlayStation Exclusive Scarecrow Nightmare Missions','2015-06-23','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4','Batman: Arkham Knight – PlayStation Exclusive Scarecrow Nightmare Missions is a set of exclusive missions for the PlayStation versions of Batman: Arkham Knight. These missions involve a twisted, nightmarish version of Gotham where Scarecrow uses fear toxins to create horrific, altered realities.\n\nPlayers take control of the Batmobile to battle against terrifying, mutated versions of iconic enemies and navigate surreal environments. The missions offer additional combat challenges and vehicle-based gameplay, focusing on Scarecrow’s psychological warfare tactics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fvx.jpg'),(16866,'Birds Aren’t Real','2023-09-08','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','As a government surveillance pigeon drone, you\'ll engage in missions, sneak around the city, and use your creative thinking to manipulate the townsfolk and dispel their suspicions about your totally not-real Avian Task Force.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6h8o.jpg'),(16867,'Follow the Black Kitten','2022-01-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You buy a laptop with your hands. You find an interactive collection of short stories on your laptop and something else. Or someone? What will all this lead to?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5o8n.jpg'),(16868,'Magic: The Gathering','1997-03-06','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Magic: The Gathering is a computer game published by MicroProse in April 1997 based on the collectible card game Magic: The Gathering.\nThe game takes place in the plane of Shandalar, where the player must travel the land and fight random enemies to gain cards, and defeat five wizards representing the five colors. The player must prevent one color from gaining too much power, and defeat the planeswalker Arzakon, who has a deck of all five colors. Adventure game and role-playing game elements are present, including inventory, gold, towns, dungeons, random battles, and character progression in the form of new abilities and a higher life point total. An oversized version of Aswan Jaguar was included in the game box.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2err.jpg'),(16869,'Battle Mage : Card Caster','2020-05-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Battle Mage : Card Caster is a fantasy card-based adventure game. Immerse yourself in a world of magic and battles through story-driven mechanics and RPG elements. Master the arcane art to prevail. Make the right choices to know your true fate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m0d.jpg'),(16870,'The Art of Knuckle Sandwich','2017-08-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'ve trained since you were barely able to walk, creating secret techniques and forms to develop a new martial art known as Knuckle Sandwich. Now with your art perfected you approach the masters of martial arts in your land and demand recognition for your discipline. Greeted with mockery and taunts you are forced to travel the land and show the people the true power of the Knuckle Sandwich.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16871,'Point Click Killer: Act Two','2023-12-22','Point-and-click, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Detective Clarke is on the case and hunting the serial killer from the first Point Click Killer game of the series. Can you track down and catch the killer?\n\nPoint Click Killer: Act Two is a horror, point & click, gory adventure game that picks up where you left off in the first game. Good luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kjo.jpg'),(16872,'Zephyrus','2021-08-01','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Oculus VR','Cooperative action-puzzler in virtual reality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3jb2.jpg'),(16873,'Sid Meier\'s Antietam!','1999-12-01','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sid Meier\'s Antietam!, the sequel to 1997\'s Sid Meier\'s Gettysburg!, is a real-time tactical wargame that allows players to reenact the costly Battle of Antietam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ha1o2cyjbd2tbdkwpcfh.jpg'),(16874,'Night of the Stars','2025-05-29','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Every 888 years in Faust, it\'s the Night of the Stars! You\'ve been chosen by your community to reach out for the 3 Half-Gods and stop the ever-expanding Void from swallowing every life form. Your salvation lies in the joint power of the Half-Gods. But will they even want to collaborate with you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ffz.jpg'),(16875,'Amedama','2024-03-22','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Side-scrolling, soul-shifting sandbox action adventure brought to life with a striking new 2D style! With only his soul remaining, Yushin must fight tooth and nail, possessing body after body on a quest to find his sister. With just seven days left until his soul departs, can he save her in time?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92lb.jpg'),(16876,'Elf World Adventure 2','2024-10-15','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Elf World Adventure 2 is a sequel to the addictive hentai game in the anime and puzzle genre, offering many levels in which you have to collect images of charming elf girls. Immerse yourself in a magical world with a splendid atmosphere, accompanied by relaxing and melodic music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nqi.jpg'),(16877,'Glut: A Superabundance of Nothing','2021-09-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','GLUT (a superabundance of nothing), by Johanna Hedva, is an inquiry into the knowings and unknowings of embodiment. It is a sound work composed with divination and AI, which manifests as both an immersive physical installation and videogame. The core of GLUT is a sound composition made entirely of Hedva’s voice, ranging from its rawest expression of screams, to two AI vocal clones that, in order to trick the surveillance tactics embedded in AI, have been manipulated to sound ever more de-human.\n\nDisturbed that proprietary vocal-clone software services reserve the right to sell client voice data to governments and corporations, Hedva worked with artist, musician, technologist, and writer Jessika Khazrik to deceive the software, training it with Hedva’s voice disguised through multiple vocoding processes. Hedva and Khazrik created two vocal clones: Arid and Mud, neither of which are made from an actual human voice and therefore not actual vocal clones. In GLUT, these two AI voices speak a text corpus that Hedva built over four lunar cycles, and synthesized through various divination techniques. The corpus is composed of the writings of medieval mystics (mostly of the apophatic tradition); theoretical physicists, mathematicians, and philosophers writing about black holes, dark matter, night, and nothingness; poets and novelists on sleep, music, and the voice; and the algorithm of amazon.com.\n\nIn the game, users are a teratoma avatar that drags itself through an environment cheating at non-Euclidean geometry through a series of nesting black holes, intestinal tunnels, glittering caves, and oceans of black water. It is a digital experience that mirrors the physical installation (shown at the HKW Berlin) while producing a world that disorients as much as it confirms what knowledges are available to the body.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hid.jpg'),(16878,'Choices, the Game','2018-02-01','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Have you ever wanted to do anything with your life? Spontaneous flight to Japan? Boxing a mummy? Or falling in love with the girl of your dreams? You can do that and more in my multiple choice game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n3d.jpg'),(16879,'Shining Blade','2012-03-15','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation Portable','This is a Japan-only game in the Shining franchise.\nThe game\'s battle system is called \"Concerto\", and is a strategic real time battle system similar to the ones found in Sakura Wars and Valkyria Chronicles. The player make use of swords, bows and magic in a battle system that places importance on character cooperation—hence the name \"Concerto\".\nThe player forms a party of up to five for battle. The game will have damage based on character position, and items collected upon defeating enemies.\n\nThe songstresses are special members of the player\'s battle party. By performing their magic song, they can achieve various effects on battle—blocking enemies from moving, increasing characters\' move count, making hasten the party\'s pace. Some songs can even be used for attack. Using the songs requires Mana Energy.\n\nThe game also has inter-character relationships. Depending on the player\'s selections during event scenes, movements and usage of group skills during battle, the characters\' relationships will change.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49u9.jpg'),(16880,'Rescue Bear Operation','2016-09-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rescue Bear Operation is: a one-level, all ages, child friendly, free to play, mini game designed to create awareness about wildfires. We\'ll be donating at least 30% of our net proceeds to charitable causes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x8p.jpg'),(16881,'TicTako','2021-08-04','Strategy','Web browser','Tic-Tac-Toe but it\'s on Ina\'s forehead and the loser faces her divine punishment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pot.jpg'),(16882,'Jagged Alliance 2','1999-07-23','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Amiga','Jagged Alliance 2 is a perfect blend of strategy, roleplaying and tactical combat. With dozen of new weapons, 150+ individual in-game characters, realistic combat physics and more than 10,000 lines of digitalized speech. Welcome to the killing grounds!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28qh.jpg'),(16883,'Total War: Rome II - Culture Pack: Pirates and Raiders','2014-05-29','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become the scourge of the ancient world with the Total War: Rome II - Pirates & Raiders Culture Pack. Introducing a new playable culture consisting of three new raiding-focused factions, Pirates & Raiders brings new buildings, technologies, religion, faction traits, battlefield and naval units to Total War: Rome II.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hyntudfeosznpy59qrs0.jpg'),(16884,'Gibbon: Beyond the Trees','2022-05-18','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, visionOS, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Master the Gibbon’s art of movement with a unique move-set that lets you swing, slide and somersault through a lush jungle canopy. Experience a free-flowing story of family and survival as you search for a home that may be lost forever in Gibbon: Beyond the Trees.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4g73.jpg'),(16885,'Platform Control','2024-07-02','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Platform Control you can control both your player character and the platforms he has to jump on to get to the trophy and complete the level. Unlock more and more unique platforms as you progress through the levels and sharpen your problem solving skills!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rdq.jpg'),(16886,'Space Quest 4+5+6','2010-02-11','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dr4.jpg'),(16887,'Data.Expand','2018-05-21','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A procedural player-controller multimedia sculpture driven by fast-paced arcade gameplay.\n\nSurvive as long as you can while avoiding enemies. As you do, your hits will generate glitch-like visual and enticing sounds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9br4.jpg'),(16888,'Spellcross: The Last Battle','1997-12-01','Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','DOS','A turn-based tactical wargame. In the game, you take the role of John Alexander, leader of the contemporary Earth military force – The Alliance, fighting for survival against an extra dimensional invasion of orcs, undead, harpies and other fantastical creatures – the Other Side.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oiy.jpg'),(16889,'Dark Rift','1997-10-22','Fighting, Sport, Arcade','Nintendo 64, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dark Rift delivers hyper-active 3D fighting with a sci-fi theme! Compete against eight exotic and powerful characters and two very large bosses. Motion captured character animations enhance the realism. The arsenal includes multiple-hit combos, back-crunching grabs, juggles, projectiles, and punishing special moves. Tune into individual character stereo sound tracking. Fight in Tournament, 2-Player or Training modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47ou.jpg'),(16890,'14 Minesweeper Variants 2','2024-06-14','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Minesweeper but the rules are changing, again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ct8.jpg'),(16891,'Playing Both Sides',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Playing Both Sides is a JRPG with a unique battle system and 10+ hours of play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co475n.jpg'),(16892,'Mario In Mushroom Rix Land','2020-09-28','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Mario goes to this land. Called Mushroom Rix Land. For his vacation. However, Bowser has taken over this island! Mario must stop him!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71rj.jpg'),(16893,'Spirit Valor','2025-04-03','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In Spirit Valor, you play as a spirit caught in a struggle between magic and fate. After a magic outburst binds him to a human warrior Richard\'s body, the two embark on a perilous quest to stop the rise of demonic forces. With the world’s laws shattered, and the Overlord vanished, they must track down this elusive enemy before it is too late. Armed with the powerful Spellstones and magic, the spirit warrior sets out on an epic journey to restore balance to the world and prevent the transformation into a demon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xpj.jpg'),(16894,'Norn9: Last Era','2015-04-02','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, iOS, PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Fandisc for Norn9. Contains three story parts:\n\n1) Concerto\nTwo-part epilogue stories for each couple.\n\n2) Fuga\nThe events of the original Norn9 from the love interests\' perspective.\n\n3) Fantasia\nA what-if storyline that takes place in a universe where the heroines didn\'t experience romance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jzl.jpg'),(16895,'Opportunity: A Sugar Baby Story','2022-03-07','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Opportunity: A Sugar Baby Story is a warm, lighthearted erotic visual novel exploring what it means to rebuild and reinvent yourself against a backdrop of late-stage capitalism.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co473b.jpg'),(16896,'WarbowPlus','2016-09-30','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warbow Plus is more than just a historically accurate 3D model of a heavy longbow.\n\nIt is a complete framework for FPS utilizing this amazing weapon which includes physics and complete functionality of a full fledge FPS game.\n\nWarbow Plus is full system major framework and you can build a full fledged FPS game with just a few additions on your part, or it can be plugged right into your own current project with ease.\nFeatures:\n\n- Ammo System\n- Player Damage System with GUI Systems\n- Enemy A.I.\n- Enemy Weapon System\n- Enemy Automated Player Acquisition / Attack System\n- Environment\n- Terrain System\n- Bullet Cam (w/ Enable and Disable Functioning)\n- Volley Fire System\n- Full Source Code( Exposed and Commented to easily allow change or integration)\n\n3D Building Models\n-Towers\n-Walls\n-Arrow Slits\n-Archery Targets\n-.......many more','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rwzfhekffeg4fi9tgnne.jpg'),(16897,'StageMechanic','2018-06-14','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','About / Downloads \n \nWe are creating a game engine that allows one to play, create, and share 3D-tile/block based games. \n \nStageMechanic is currently in Early Access and is available for PC and web through GameJolt and itch.io. \n \nStageMechanic for Android is available in the Google Play Store \n \nSales of the Full version go to help fund development and delivery of free, instructor-led 3D modeling and programming classes at the Hanock County Public Library located in one of the poorest, least educated states in the USA \n \nTarget audences \n \nEducation and Makers Movement \n \nWe include a built-in level editor that acts as the star of the show. \nThis project is being developed as a teaching aid for beginning game development students - ages 5 and up including adults. A primary goal of the project is to fill a gap between game creation tools like Bloxels and more advanced tools like Game Maker Studio. \n \nWith StageMechanic you are not just playing a game someone else made - you have the opportunity to create your own game and to learn from and build on games that others create. \n \nFor the casual aspiring creator, we offer a range of pre-made blocks and characters with different mechanics and creator-defined properties. \nIntermediate level creators can use the built-in Lua interpreter and code editor to modify all of the built in blocks, items, and characters and even create their own original mechanics. In the future users will also be able to easily import their own 3D models create in tools like MagicaVoxel and Tinkercad as well as create their own music, sound effects, etc. \n \nAdvanced users have full acess to the project\'s C# source code, allowing for infinite custamizability. As a professionally engineered and developed non-trivial project, StageMechanic offers a unique chance for students to move beyond tutorials and get hands on experience in a complex real-world game. \n \nAI Researchers \n \nFuture versions of StageMechanic will include both the Encog neural network library and TensorFlow accessable via the built-in Lua interpreter and code editor, allowing real-time AI experimentation. \n \n2D tile-based game-creation tool users \n \nUsers of game-creation tools like Super Mario Maker and Bloxels will find many of the same concepts in StageMechanic. You can create your own levels using the built-in level editor, play your own levels, share your levels, and play levels created by others. \nUnlike these games, StageMechanic is in 3D space and includes the possibility to script custom game mechanics - allowing for much more complex games. The built-in block and item types helps keep things simple for those just getting started. \n \nGame Developers \n \nStageMechanic is BSD licensed allowing anyone to create their own open-source or commercial games based on our engine. See below for more information on licensing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1h2m.jpg'),(16898,'Dark Moon',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dark Moon is a survival strategy game where in order to survive you must avoid the Sun’s scorching rays and embrace the darkness. Gather resources, upgrade your mobile base, make tough moral decisions, but most importantly - don’t go into the light!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mjx.jpg'),(16899,'Alchemistry','2022-03-07','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Merge elements to discover new ones !\n\nThrough challenges, use the given elements to craft transitional elements to reach given objective. Or use sandbox mode to freely craft items together and maybe succeed to create rare items, and to discover everything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3uq9.jpg'),(16900,'Might & Magic X: Legacy - Deluxe Edition','2014-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This Deluxe Edition contains: \n \n- The game Might and Magix X Legacy on DVD \n- 4 lithography prints \n- Game soundtrack CD \n- Color cloth map of the Agyn Peninsula region. \n- Code to download a \'Might and Magic VI The Mandate of Heaven\' digital copy on Uplay \n- Code to activate a exclusive bonus pack in the \'Might&Magic Duel of Champions\' free-to-play game \n- 40 pages color manual','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yrc.jpg'),(16901,'Zero Escape: Virtue\'s Last Reward','2012-02-16','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One','The second game in the Zero Escape series.\nZero Escape: Virtue\'s Last Reward is a mystery/thriller visual novel. It is story focused with multiple endings that use player choices and puzzle rooms to progress.\n\nAdditions to the game include an \'auto-advance text\' mode, so players can listen to the voice acting without clicking through dialog, a memo function that allows players to note anything they feel is useful, and a flow chart that shows how alternate choices unfold. The in-game calculator has been removed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co260l.jpg'),(16902,'Nova Core Chaos','2024-03-04','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','NOVA CORE CHAOS is a chaotic co-op cooking game for one to five players. Play as one of five unique classes and follow the recipes to make energy cores. Give these to your customers to help them evolve into Novas!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qr1.jpg'),(16903,'Draught Kraft','2020-05-14','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Construct your dream brewery, kraft the best tasting brew, build a brewing empire!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oxm.jpg'),(16904,'Nanotek Warrior','1997-02-28','Shooter','PlayStation','A ground-based shoot-em-up by design, the game employs the use of jumping, banking, and strafing as you move forward through 3D tube-like levels. The game is seem from a third-person perspective behind the ship. Some areas place you outside and some inside, but the majority of the game takes place rotating around tubes. This gameplay only differs slightly in boss levels, that allow you to rotate around a central point with no forward motion.\n\nYou can obtain different power-ups including special weapons, health bonuses and extra lives as you play through the game’s 9 levels. Each level is divided into 2 stages, one on tubes and a boss fight afterwards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30fs.jpg'),(16905,'Electrify',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','A game axed on imagination, creativity and community. Logic, attention and perseverance are needed. It is a ludic circuits simulator with a game approch. Convinient and intuitive, it will accompany you in your electronic learning quest. Electrify is here.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5go4.jpg'),(16906,'F.E.A.R.','2005-12-02','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"F.E.A.R.\" (First Encounter Assault Recon) is a critically acclaimed first-person shooter game released in 2005, developed by Monolith Productions and published by Sierra Entertainment. Blending psychological horror with intense combat, \"F.E.A.R.\" puts players in the role of a point man in a special forces team tasked with containing a mysterious and powerful paranormal threat. The game\'s advanced AI, atmospheric storytelling, and impressive graphics create a deeply immersive experience. Players must navigate through dark, foreboding environments, battling both human enemies and supernatural entities while uncovering the dark secrets behind the paranormal phenomena. Renowned for its tense atmosphere, dynamic firefights, and haunting narrative, \"F.E.A.R.\" stands out as a landmark title in the horror shooter genre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1utk.jpg'),(16907,'Detonation Racing','2021-07-30','Racing','iOS, Mac','Drive a selection of wonderful cars you really don\'t deserve and blow up your enemies on our extremely safe exploding racetracks. Customise your car to make sure it looks as good as possible after it\'s been completely destroyed! Please note: Racetracks are not extremely safe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4g6z.jpg'),(16908,'Steel Armor: Blaze of War','2011-12-14','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Keep your head cool for this brand new and sizzling hot game from the makers of renowned hardcore-strategy masterpieces like “Steel Fury” and “Achtung Panzer!” With highly versatile strategies and tactics it´s only fair to call their impressive new game “Steel Armor – Blaze of War” one of the most interesting and tactically advanced tank simulations of all time! Plan, command and fight in this exciting and extremely detailed blend of turn-based strategy, real time tactics and full-scaled tank simulation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h2e.jpg'),(16909,'Worms 2: Armageddon','2013-04-09','Strategy','PlayStation 3, Android, iOS, Xbox 360','Worms 2: Armageddon is a 2D artillery turn-based tactics video game developed by Team17 and part of the Worms series, released on July 1, 2009 on Xbox Live Arcade. The game is a follow up to the 2007 Worms game, which in-turn was a port of 2006\'s Worms: Open Warfare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xqr.jpg'),(16910,'First Person Hooper','2023-02-28','Sport, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','First Person Hooper is a skill based, arcade-style basketball game focused on the jump shot. Featuring first-person shooter controls with a lock-on system similar to modern FPS games, players can easily shoot the ball with power & timing mechanics relative to location on the court. Score with movement bonuses and get rewarded with power-ups for every swish and bank shot you make. Get shots up in a relaxed island setting and customize the court to fit your mood. Includes score, time-attack, and free play modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co659s.jpg'),(16911,'Dark Runner','2021-09-16','Platform, Racing, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Parkour, speedrun and darkness. This combination is quite a challenge. Unique lighting mechanics like you\'ve never seen before are the main reason you\'ll want this game to never end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45ze.jpg'),(16912,'Kerkerkruip','2011-10-01','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Kerkerkruip is a short-form roguelike in the interactive fiction medium, featuring meaningful tactical and strategic depth, innovative game play, zero grinding, and a sword & sorcery setting that does not rehash tired clichés.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ta9vg6bz1kzymsmq7lfy.jpg'),(16913,'Chiyo','2024-01-18','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chiyo is a first-person hardcore escape room horror game set in Japan\'s Edo era. As Idate Chiyo, a paranormal investigator possessing supernatural abilities, you are tasked with investigating an abandoned mansion and unveiling a family\'s dark history and it\'s ultimate secret.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ufx.jpg'),(16914,'Square Meal','2007-05-18','Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Eat and spit blocks, monsters and food in this co-op dungeon adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d4e.jpg'),(16915,'Over Tooned','2024-09-07','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game done in a GenX arcade style with an anime-ish feel','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8m2x.jpg'),(16916,'Free Solo: One Life','2021-02-17','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An endurance rhythm game that only gives you only One Life to simulate the danger of Free Solo Climbing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zy5.jpg'),(16917,'Castlevania: Lords of Shadow - Reverie','2011-04-20','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Reverie marks a return to the game’s climactic castle setting as Gabriel seeks to assist the recently-slain vampire Queen’s hand maiden. The download spans three stages, and offers a breath-taking twist to the game’s plot','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dbp.jpg'),(16918,'Streamer Daily','2020-03-04','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Did you think it was easy to streaming? Do you think streamers earn money by playing games? Can you reach the summit by facing all the challenges of streaming? Then be a real streamer instead of playing this game !!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pas.jpg'),(16919,'Tabletop Simulator: One Night Ultimate Werewolf',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','One Night Ultimate Werewolf is a fast-paced game for 3-10 players where everyone is dealt a secret role. In the course of only one night and the following morning, the players will determine who among them is a werewolf...hopefully.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vhj.jpg'),(16920,'Tombi! Special Edition','2024-08-01','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Tombi! returns in Tombi! Special Edition, the ultimate version of the legendary platforming masterpiece. As the titular Tombi, you leap, bite, and throw your way across stunning 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8n0b.jpg'),(16921,'Pajama Sam 4: Life Is Rough When You Lose Your Stuff!','2003-08-19','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lost among the piles of clothes and toys is his prized comic book. Donning his red cape, Pajama Sam dives into the chaos only to land in a strange and fantastic world that resembles his messy room. Pajama Sam sets off on a series of adventures in search of his lost comic book, looking for lost socks in Agitator Lake, rounding up dust bunnies at the Dust Bunny Corral, exploring the Spilled Soda Swamp and much more. In the end, Sam finds his comic book and realizes that life wouldn\'t be so rough if he put away his stuff! Throughout the story, kids meet lots of interesting new friends and tackle fun challenges that will inspire them to solve problems in creative ways.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ssq.jpg'),(16922,'The Humans','2018-05-01','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, DOS, Amiga, Game Boy','The gameplay of The Humans has similarities to Lode Runner and Lemmings. Your job in this action puzzler is to help prehistoric man to evolve by helping them discover tools, the wheel, weapons, or even fire. Each level in the game will have a given task to help in this, and you are allotted a number of characters who must accomplish the task. The player can switch from person to person while moving the characters around each scrolling puzzle, and teamwork is essential to success.\n\nTasks can include finding objects (like a spear) on the screen, or trying to reach a specific destination which may require the use of objects you have discovered so far. Each level has a time limit, when time runs out the level can be restarted.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60wt.jpg'),(16923,'Slitherlink PD','2022-08-29','Puzzle, Indie','Playdate','A logic puzzle game - Create a single line loop using number clues.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74rv.jpg'),(16924,'I\'m on a Watcher Duty','2022-03-26','Point-and-click, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a fangame of \"I\'m on Observation Duty\" which originally created by Notovia (Zaster). This fangame is made by Paulor94.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6eiw.jpg'),(16925,'NyxQuest: Kindred Spirits','2009-06-19','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fly with Nyx in her dangerous search for her dearest friend Icarus. With NYXQUEST: KINDRED SPIRITS you will discover a new type of game play and mechanics that will surprise you...\n\nThe action takes place in ancient Greece, a place inhabited by all kind of fantastic creatures, where the fate of humans is in the hands of capricious Gods.\n\nThrough impressive sceneries, you will guide Nyx in her icarian quest, and will enjoy the ultimate experience: the joy of flight!\n\nBut be careful! These surroundings are dangerous for celestial beings. Without your help she will not be able to complete her task. Protect and guide her flight, and take advantage of the incredible powers that gods such as Zeus or Eolus will grant…if you figure out how to reach them!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q9w.jpg'),(16926,'Bone to Gather','2024-12-16','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Bone To Gather\" is a synergy-building action roguelike. Embark on an epic journey with a team of puny skeletons determined to revenge the Demon King. Recruit skeletons with unique synergies to create a powerful team and battle through monsters on your way to the final showdown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co966r.jpg'),(16927,'Tidy Cauldron','2024-07-31','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help 3 messy witches tidy up their chaos! Arrange uniquely shaped mystical ingredients through 100 handcrafted puzzles in pixel art. Explore the esoteric arts of potion crafting, summoning, and tarot reading in this enchanting organization adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83g5.jpg'),(16928,'Misgiven',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Misgiven is a 2D sci-fi adventure about the lump in your throat and how difficult it can be to say certain things. Stranded in a city of masks and toxic fog, find people you can trust and, via a tangible dialog system, experience how scary and awkward, but also how fulfilling, communication can be.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6z42.jpg'),(16929,'Hello Charlotte Ep.2: Requiem Aeternam Deo','2016-10-08','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hello Charlotte Ep.2 is a visual novelesque RPG with sci-fi elements and dark humor, written and drawn by etherane. Requiem Aeternam Deo follows the events of Ep.1: Junk Food, Gods and Teddy Bears.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co972o.jpg'),(16930,'Hello Baby!','2008-12-21','Simulator','Nintendo DS','Hello Baby! gives you the opportunity to be a babysitter who must look after a seven-month-old bouncing baby until it\'s one year-old. From morning until evening, you must care for the charming youngster by feeding it, playing entertaining games and even changing nappies.\n\nCaring for your new baby friend couldn\'t be easier thanks to a range of different mini-games themed around typical babysitting activities. So, whether you\'re making sheep jump over a fence to send the tot to sleep or ensuring the milk bottle is the perfect temperature, you\'re guaranteed hours of brilliant baby fun.\n\nWhat\'s more, by successfully completing the various child challenges you can unlock a range of new outfits for your baby, including clothes, hats and accessories. In fact, there are 10,000 potential combinations of items to wear.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16931,'Stickman: Far East Battle','2021-09-30','Fighting, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Stickman: Far East Battle is an exciting arcade game where you have to help the stickman eliminate all the enemies on the screen. Every new level comes with its fair share of challenges, and you must do everything you can in order to win. New challenges appear all the time, and with the right strategy you can make it work. This is exciting and rewarding, fun and appealing. You can also fully customize your stickman with its own shield, hat, weapon and armor. That allows you to really show off your true power, and you even have multiple difficulty levels to try out. Protect the stickman in his far east adventure today! Features: Action packed gameplay Customize your stickman the way you want Intense, fun campaign Aesthetic graphics','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z9c.jpg'),(16932,'Planetarian','2009-09-24','Sin género','PlayStation Portable','\"Why don\'t you come to the planetarium?\nThe beautiful twinkling of eternity that will never fade, no matter what.\nAll the stars in the sky are waiting for you.\"\n\nIt is thirty years after the failure of the Space Colonization Program.\nHumanity is nearly extinct. A perpetual and deadly Rain falls on the Earth.\nMen known as \"Junkers\" plunder goods and artifacts from the ruins of civilization.\nOne such Junker sneaks alone into the most dangerous of all ruins -- a \"Sarcophagus City\".\nIn the center of this dead city, he discovers a pre-War planetarium.\nAnd as he enters he is greeted by Hoshino Yumemi, a companion robot.\nWithout a single shred of doubt, she assumes he is the first customer she\'s had in 30 years.\nShe attempts to show him the stars at once, but the planetarium projector is broken.\nUnable to make heads or tails of her conversation, he ends up agreeing to try and repair the projector...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co727s.jpg'),(16933,'Godzilla: Archipelago Shock','1995-12-22','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Adventure','Sega Saturn','Godzilla: Archipelago Shock/Godzilla Rettoushinkan is a strategy game for the Sega Saturn based on the Godzilla franchise. You play as the Japanese military and attempt to stop Godzilla from destroying things.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ank.jpg'),(16934,'Fredbear and Friends: Reboot','2017-12-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It has been 26 years since the closure of \'Fredbear and Friends\', the restaurant that had once brought joy and happiness, which was shut down for unknown reasons. Four daring teenagers decided to visit it\'s ruins at night, however, things didn\'t go as they planned.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xna.jpg'),(16935,'SimRail: The Railway Simulator','2023-01-13','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SimRail is new, advanced railway simulator. Master high-speed long-distance EMU, heavy freight hauls and suburban trains. Travel 500 km of geodetic-data based real routes. Become train dispatcher and control the traffic according to the schedule or cooperate with other players on multiplayer mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co617n.jpg'),(16936,'Torin\'s Passage','1995-10-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','DOS','Torin\'s Passage is a game for children, but like all really good games, books, and movies with similar target audience it also has that knowing wink towards older audience, and the best thing about this game is that it \"winks\" a lot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ns8.jpg'),(16937,'InnerCube','2015-02-13','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','InnerCube is an action-puzzle game, where you control a multi-colored cube using the keyboard to navigate around a grid. Choose from two different modes: a challenging Puzzle Mode where every move counts or a fast and frantic Survival Mode!\n\nUnleash your Inner Cube!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43lu.jpg'),(16938,'Eurgava: Fight for Haaria','2016-12-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight for Haaria, a reaction-based combat rpg where you struggle to rebuild your broken village, learn the fate of your home country, and restore its order. Get ready!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qel.jpg'),(16939,'Wacky Escape','2019-04-16','Racing, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Stop trippin\' and escape your destiny in this runner action game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dzk.jpg'),(16940,'Lifeflame Compendium',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Lifeflame Compendium is a WarBreedFarm RPG, farm crops, breed animals and wage war or peace in an expansive open world adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31c8.jpg'),(16941,'Strike Force Harrier','1988-12-31','Shooter, Simulator','BBC Microcomputer System, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, Acorn Electron, Amiga, Amstrad CPC, MSX','Strike Force Harrier is a combat flight simulator developed by H&H Software and published by Mirrorsoft in 1986.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uysjg7b5ofjlejwd9pst.jpg'),(16942,'New 3D Golf Simulation: Waialae no Kiseki','1994-03-25','Sport','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','New 3D Golf Simulation: Waialae no Kiseki (ワイアラエの奇蹟) is a 1991 golf game by T&E Soft for the PC-98 in their New 3D Golf Simulation series that takes place at the Waialae Country Club golf course. T&E ported it to the Sega Mega Drive in 1994 exclusively in Japan (however they released a SNES port overseas as True Golf Classics: Waialae Country Club). Gameplay is identical to that of Pebble Beach Golf Links.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ec0.jpg'),(16943,'2-3-5-7','2021-03-06','Puzzle, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A game to test how well you recognize prime numbers.\n\nSwipe left and right to answer if a given number is prime, and see how high a chain of correct answers you can reach.\n\nWith 3 different difficulty levels, you can tune the challenge to your preferences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bd7.jpg'),(16944,'The Child Of Slendrina','2016-04-01','Adventure, Indie','Android','Slendrina is back in a new scary game!\n\nThe Child Of Slendrina is the sixth game in Slendrina Series. It gives Slendrina\'s Child and Slendrina\'s Father a role as an antagonist. It was released on April 1st, 2016, exclusive for Android devices only.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98hr.jpg'),(16945,'Nekomew\'s Nightmares','2022-10-28','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Face Nekomew\'s nightmares in this spooky rhythm game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co527m.jpg'),(16946,'Shattered Legacy','2023-07-13','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Start an exciting journey through a magical world, where the familiar idea of nudging blocks and solving puzzles combine to offer an amazing adventure puzzle game. Discover a magical world. Explore difficult puzzles and cryptic challenges in unique levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r1v.jpg'),(16947,'Zera: Myths Awaken',NULL,'Platform, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Zera: Myths Awaken is an upcoming 3D platformer/collectathon, inspired by genre classics such as Spyro the Dragon, Crash Bandicoot, Super Mario 64 etc.\n\nThe game follows new protagonist Zera, an Axolotl/Bat hybrid, in an adventure featuring beautifully designed worlds, with tons of characters, abilities, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49qo.jpg'),(16948,'House Party: Doja Cat','2022-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Keep the wild and crazy party going with House Party’s first-ever expansion pack — featuring award-winning music star Doja Cat! This DLC adds hours of fun new content and branching stories to the House Party game\'s Original Story centering around and fully voice-acted by Doja Cat herself, as well as brand new content for all of the other House Party characters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zth.jpg'),(16949,'Bridges of Patience','2024-05-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A single-player Third Person Parkour game where you, as a pirate, try to pass levels by overcoming challenges such as moving bridges (you\'ll see others in the game).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fet.jpg'),(16950,'Taxi Rush','2024-07-19','Racing, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get behind the wheel in Taxi Rush and transport your passengers in this crazy big city! As a crazy taxi driver, get your passengers where they need to go on time. Traffic? Traffic Rules? Police? Red Lights? No, no, no, no, no, no. You\'re a crazy, lawless driver. Jump with your car if you have to!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8n7h.jpg'),(16951,'The First Samurai + The Second Samurai Bundle',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cov.jpg'),(16952,'Dragon\'s Valkyrie: Wings of Fire',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16953,'Gridpunk','2023-06-08','Shooter','Android, iOS','Gridpunk is a dynamic top-down action shooter set in a vibrant cyberpunk universe, offering both solo and multiplayer experiences. Players can engage in various game modes, including 2v2, 3v3, 5v5, and Battle Royale formats, each demanding quick reflexes and strategic gameplay. The game features a diverse roster of heroes, each equipped with unique abilities and playstyles, allowing for personalized combat strategies. A robust gear system enables players to collect, merge, and upgrade equipment, enhancing their heroes\' capabilities and tailoring their builds to suit their preferred tactics. With its fast-paced real-time battles and immersive cyberpunk aesthetics, Gridpunk delivers an adrenaline-fueled gaming experience that challenges players to outwit and outmaneuver opponents in a futuristic arena.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e2n.jpg'),(16954,'Five Nights At Dungeon','2015-05-18','Fighting, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is similar to Dungeon Nightmares but with the weapon. You must find five artifacts and survive for five nights. Only this time you have two weapons. One is melee and other is ranged. Can You Survive Five Night\'s At Dungeon ? Search for clues, and fight your fears. Fight for your life!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67uq.jpg'),(16955,'Wasteland Punk: Post Apocalypse RPG Survival Game','2021-07-23','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Wasteland Punk is a wild post-apocalyptic RPG where you\'ll venture into radioactive wastelands and impenetrable swamps, inhabited by bandits, mutants, and something far more dangerous... Kill, scavenge, craft, and survive at any cost!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l4s.jpg'),(16956,'Stella: My Friend','2020-06-30','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','A visual novel included in the Story Me app.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pzw.jpg'),(16957,'Ping Pong Trick Shot Evolution','2019-02-05','Puzzle, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','This is an action puzzle game in which you throw ping pong balls into a cup. Control your character, position, angle and power when you throw the ping pong ball. This game includes 4 modes - Challenge, Score Attack, VS, and 50 Cup.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5aoq.jpg'),(16958,'Elf World Adventure','2024-10-03','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Elf World Adventure is an exciting hentai game in the anime and puzzle genre, offering numerous levels where you must assemble images of enchanting elf girls. Immerse yourself in a magical world with a splendid atmosphere, accompanied by relaxing and melodic music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nqh.jpg'),(16959,'Gravity Shots','2018-08-14','Puzzle, Simulator, Arcade','Android, iOS','Use gravity to send the balls into orbit and shoot down the falling planets. Hit as many planets as you can with each shot by bouncing the balls between them and predicting how gravity will affect the shot\'s trajectory. Try to get the balls into orbit and create combo shots as they ricochet off the planets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/eegouchl6a7u5lzh8ecx.jpg'),(16960,'Final Fantasy XIV: Defenders of Eorzea','2014-07-07','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Patch 2.3 brings a myriad of additions and refinements to the realm of Eorzea including new story quests, a new primal battle, Frontline, the Hunt, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hvl.jpg'),(16961,'Tunich','2016-07-20','Puzzle, Adventure','Android, iOS','Tunich is an easy to learn, engaging drag and drop puzzle. All you have to do is to build up pies using colorful slices. Make same color pies to unlock the Tunich stone and its magical power!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co492x.jpg'),(16962,'The Cartographer\'s Tale','2018-05-29','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Cartographer\'s Tale is a philosophical-platformer, created entirely by one man in 11 days - sort of! Players are tasked with exploring a VERY dark cave to uncover the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hgkrxcdsivuhktvl1ru4.jpg'),(16963,'Divinity: Original Sin 2 - Divine Ascension','2017-09-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Go deeper into the world of Divinity: Original Sin 2, the eagerly anticipated sequel to the award-winning RPG.\n\nExplore the rich lore of the game with The Modern Chronicles of Reaper’s Coast - a comprehensive history of Rivellon in over 100 illustrated pages.\n\nDiscover the mastery of Larian’s uniquely talented concept artists with The Essential Compendium of Notable Rivellonian Artwork: a hefty art book featuring hundreds of pieces over 150 pages.\n\nA detailed map of Reaper´s Coast.\n\nDigital Art Pack: more than 1,200 pieces of concept artwork - the foundation of the game\'s visual development.\n\nRelive your epic adventures from Divinity: Original Sin 2 with the original soundtrack as composed by maestro Borislav Slavov. The compilation contains 35 tracks and features a brand new orchestral version of “Power of Innocence”, originally composed by Kirill Pokrovsky. A bonus song is included in the album, with lead vocals by the composer Borislav Slavov himself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v1z.jpg'),(16964,'XCOM 2: War of the Chosen - Tactical Legacy Pack','2018-10-09','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The XCOM 2: War of the Chosen - Tactical Legacy Pack includes a collection of new game modes, maps, weapons, armors, Photobooth options, and more that honors the legacy of the XCOM series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1lgk.jpg'),(16965,'Phantom Spark','2024-06-10','Racing, Sport, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dive into the captivating high-speed world of Phantom Spark. Engage in precision time-trial racing to best the champions in the single-player campaign, challenge your friends in split-screen local multiplayer, or make your mark on the global online leaderboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8av5.jpg'),(16966,'Hentai Girls: Flight Crush','2025-03-06','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Meet over 50 pretty anime girls in this relaxing puzzle game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9in8.jpg'),(16967,'Slendrina Must Die: The House','2015-08-04','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slendrina Must Die: The House is yet another fantastic episode in the creepy Slendrina Must Die series. In this title, you get to find out more about this strange and sinister creature and her origins.\n\nGame is based on House of Slendrina.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9076.jpg'),(16968,'Políticos Memes Kombat','2020-07-29','Fighting, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight an epic battle for votes, it\'s anything that goes for power. Fighting game with fictional characters based on the Brazilian electoral war. Select one of the characters from Brazilian politics and embark on this fight full of fun and laughter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7a11.jpg'),(16969,'Biped 2','2025-08-01','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Adorable robots are back to save the day! Explore an unknown planet in this puzzle action-adventure game and experiment with our unique, innovative mechanics solo or in co-op with up to 4 players!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d8n.jpg'),(16970,'HyperParasite','2020-04-03','Fighting, Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A rogue-lite twin-stick shooter/brawler that never plays the same twice. Collect and control 60 different characters as the body-snatching alien Parasite with a grudge against humanity. Fight to the top of the food chain: possess the President, push the Big Red Button, and one-up the human race.\n\nIt\'s the 80\'s all over again.\nOnly this time, the human race has more than an obnoxious pop culture to contend with. With World War III nearing its demise, Earth only just begins to catch its breath when it is threatened by yet another menace. Unlike the preposterous mullets of its inhabitants, however, this one\'s invisible – a parasitic organism capable of making hosts of unsuspecting human beings, consuming what\'s left of their souls and wreaking unfathomable havoc. And it\'s spreading. With a vengeance. Martial laws have been declared to make way for a global hunt, battle-hardened law enforcers have made allies of the most degenerate of criminals, while the rest of the world is paralyzed with paranoia; yet who can be trusted? Who can see it, let alone destroy it? That\'s for them to worry about.\nFor you are the enemy. You are the organism with a mission. You are... HyperParasite.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20bs.jpg'),(16971,'Hand of Fate','2015-02-17','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Inspired by tarot and fantasy, all bets are off as you create your own journey by building a collection of cards used to deal out a boardgame-like dungeon teeming with enemies, treasure, and adventure. Upon entering combat, the cards come to life as the player is propelled into a beautiful 3D environment to brawl it out with foes. Draw your cards, play your hand, and discover your fate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ojn.jpg'),(16972,'I Dig It HD',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16973,'Monkey Quest','2011-03-17','Adventure','Web browser','Monkey Quest is a Kids MMO from Nickelodeon set in the spectacular World of Ook, a land where monkeys rule! You play a heroic monkey who battles the evil Shadow Demon, Ka, and his monster horde! Swing, bounce, and battle your way through adventures beyond imagination while you uncover dark secrets and unearth precious treasures from the legendary Monkey King.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a9x.jpg'),(16974,'Is It You?','2022-11-08','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Is It You? is an online social deduction game set in a mushroom world. Voice chat with other players and use the abilities of your role to find out who\'s friend or foe. For up to 15 players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co51zy.jpg'),(16975,'Team Slay-Bells',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Team Slay-Bells is about a reindeer named Charlotte and her friends, who are trying to help their home planet Kringlaus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t3t.jpg'),(16976,'In Dungeon','2018-05-21','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Dungeon is a 2D platformer hardcore made with pixel art. The main character is trying escape of castle. Can you help him escape the dungeon before his fate is sealed?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43k4.jpg'),(16977,'Oriental Immortal',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Sin plataforma','A 3D multiplayer open-world sandbox with a story based on Chinese mythology and cultivation. Starting as a mortal being, you must fight your way to ascension. Embarking on a path to immortality, gain spiritual and physical enhancements that will shape your journey, and finally, make your own fate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64th.jpg'),(16978,'These Heavenly Bodies','2024-08-23','Point-and-click','Web browser','A Lab has obtained three Statues from an excavation of an ancient site. Scans of the Statues indicated preserved bodies within.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rsz.jpg'),(16979,'Dream Town Island','2023-11-12','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Give free reign to your creativity in this inventive town sim!\nUnlock new stores and facilities, help your residents find love, or cash in on the stock market!\nIf you founded a new town on an uninhabited island, what would you build there? Restaurants? Convenience Stores? Movie theaters? Make your choices and create a town that everyone will want to move to!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bvk.jpg'),(16980,'Untitled','2013-06-29','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Untitled is a surreal 3D indie title from developer increpare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5big.jpg'),(16981,'Dying Light: Rust Weapon Pack','2021-04-19','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Surviving in the wild is one thing. Surviving zombies in the wild is another. With this DLC, you\'ll be ready for both.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ucg.jpg'),(16982,'Draw Breaker','2012-08-09','Sin género','Android, iOS','The future of the world is at stake! Professor Blockowski and his block army are on a campaign to make the world square. Your mission will require quick reflexes and fast thinking to foil Professor Blockowski’s evil schemes and keep the world safe and round.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16983,'Road Maintenance Simulator','2022-04-07','Racing, Simulator, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Experience the everyday life in a German street maintenance service and complete a variety of realistic tasks in the area of road construction and maintenance! For your work you will have unique vehicles and various usable tools at your disposal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co667n.jpg'),(16984,'Asteroid Dodger','2020-10-26','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Asteroid dodger is a fun and fast paced game where you are an alien who must dodge the asteroids falling from the sky and not get hit by the spikes. You can play as a green and blue alien.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jez.jpg'),(16985,'Ballistik','2005-07-20','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A brick busting game with fireballs, bombs, and rockets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nl7.jpg'),(16986,'The Last Door','2014-05-20','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Feel what it\'s truly like to be alone in the dark with this low-res, high-suspense point-and-click horror adventure.\nSet in Victorian England, when Jeremiah Devitt receives a letter from his old schoolmate Anthony Beechworth with a hidden, cryptic message, he knows something is wrong. His journey to an abandoned manor is only the beginning as he starts to remember a long-buried secret from his youth, discovering things man was not meant to know, and opening doors that should have remained closed…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2243.jpg'),(16987,'Pullfrog: Deluxe','2024-02-20','Platform, Puzzle','Playdate','Tetris meets frog! A little puzzle platformer made for Pico-8, equal parts fun and challenging. Help a little frog clear as many lines as possible by using its tongue to pull around blocks in the air.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90b8.jpg'),(16988,'BloodRayne 2: Terminal Cut','2020-11-20','Fighting, Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enhanced and updated for modern systems, this is the definitive edition of Rayne’s second adventure: a blood-soaked rampage of vengeance against the Cult of Kagan, a group led by Rayne\'s half-siblings that seek to carry out their father Kagan\'s legacy by creating a new era of vampire supremacy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k6g.jpg'),(16989,'SCP: Site-19','2019-12-15','Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','SCP: Site-19 is a mobile multiplayer SCP Foundation based game. Every round map is randomly generated & roles are random. So you never expect who you play as or who you gonna bump into.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69zr.jpg'),(16990,'Destiny 2: Heresy - Act 2','2025-03-11','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Echo of the Navigator has emerged aboard the Dreadnaught, assuming the form of Oryx himself. Over centuries, countless throngs have bent to his will; he will ensure that the Guardian is no different. But a voice from beyond forms a wellspring of hope…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ip3.jpg'),(16991,'Beer Factory','2024-01-10','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beer Factory is a business simulation and management game. Take the challenge, manage your own beer factory, employees, production lines, import and export of the merchandise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7krg.jpg'),(16992,'LazerBlazer: Type A - Intercept','1993-06-21','Shooter','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','One of the games found in Super Scope 6.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(16993,'Gin no Kanmuri Ao no Namida','2009-05-29','Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','\"Will you marry me?\" The story starts when Shinichiro suddenly says it to Aya...\n\nShe is supposed to live a happy life with him...\n\nHowever, complaints about boring married life and a husband who doesn\'t care much about her accumulate little by little...\n\nAn attractive younger guy at work. A cheerful and clear delivery person. A mysterious owner of a beauty salon. A reliable coworker of her husband\'s. She gradually gets attracted to other men...\n\nWill she keep on loving her husband? OR will she look for another happiness?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69d8.jpg'),(16994,'The Tag-along Obsession','2024-09-18','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Tag-along Obsession is adapted from the movie \"The Tag-along\", based on the Urban Legend. It is a first-person horror puzzle adventure game, Players will play Hui-Ting and go into the situation to understand a series of supernatural phenomenon, and immerse themselves in the story, looking for the answers to everything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u2i.jpg'),(16995,'EEK3 Virtual Show Floor','2020-06-20','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An interactive Haunted PS1 E3 experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xmg.jpg'),(16996,'Worldseekers','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Worldseekers is a GPS exploration RPG. Discover rare cards, events, and unique characters as you delve into the expansive lands and deceptive dungeons of this world.\n\nTo help encourage mental and physical health, Worldseekers uses GPS mechanics and links to a phone app to help you get outside and walking. Of course, the Steam version allows you to play from your PC for hours while still rewarding you for taking an extra stroll. For all you streamers out there, we adjust / hide location by default.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rtt.jpg'),(16997,'Police 911','2000-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade, PlayStation 2','An arcade light-gun shooter with a camera to detect player movement, allowing the player to use body movement to hide behind cover and dodge the (slow-moving) bullets. It was the first video game with fairly accurate full-body motion detection, and probably the only one with a motion-controlled cover system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96cs.jpg'),(16998,'Star Revenge 4.5: The Kedama Takeover Rewritten','2016-09-23','Platform','Nintendo 64','This is the 4.5th in the \"Star Revenge\" Series of SM64 hacks. Probably noticable by the Rewritten at the end of the name, this hack is a remake of SR4. 95% of the levels were made with completely new level models, which were made with the original design of the levels in mind to improve upon them.\n\nThis hack has 100 stars and is made in the open world style, which means that you access very few levels via an overworld and rather go from level to level via entrances in the levels itself. There is still an overworld which acts as a place for shortcuts to later levels if a game over happens.\n\nYou can find 15 new main courses and some side levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wu6.jpg'),(16999,'BloodTrail','2018-12-22','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','“As the sun rose today, a traveller ventured into our village and told us about a plague, which had killed nearly half of his hometown before he left. His eyes were filled with fear and panic, so that nobody could doubt the truth of his words. To survive we left our village and are now travelling towards the coast and its harbours to leave this cursed country.” \n \nBlood Trail is a turn-based exploration RPG about a small band of five medieval refugees who try to reach a harbour, fleeing a deadly plague. It was made for Ludum Dare 43 (Theme: \"Sacrifices must be made\"). \n \nThe game is made of two parts: a map view, where you can command your group across a procedurally generated world with forests, cities and plains and random encounters: while travelling through the lands, you will randomly encounter friendly or evil people, with whom you can communicate or fight. \n \nAt the moment the game is rather a prototype and we appreciate every feedback we can get. The current version should provide a basic game flow and includes some features that were not finished in time for LudumDare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1iay.jpg'),(17000,'Escape the Omnochronom!','2018-11-05','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It\'s a Rogue-like DotA! Escape the Omnochronom! is a turn based single-player strategy game set in a unique quirky fantasy universe from the designer of Auro: A Monster-Bumping Adventure.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17001,'The Adventures of a Legend - Beyond Survival','2017-03-07','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Android','Get adventures and face the challenges of a Legend. A world of fantasy.\n\nMany years ago in distant lands, the secrets of the incidents, which gave rise the appearance of strange creatures and the changing of the world into a world of fantasies and adventures, were guarded by The Ancients and this marks the beginning of the First Era. Over the years, the creatures have become more dangerous, the adventures have become very risky and the changes in the world occurred in a bad way.\nToday, twenty-one years later, the last ancient decided to challenge and confront the world and its challenges. The last heroes should venture into The Adventures of a Legend and so, guided by The Ancient, bring peace to the world.\n\nThe Adventures of a Legend - Beyond Survival is the beginning of a series of adventures in a world of mysteries and fantasies.\n\nYou can venture yourself into the survival mode or explore the world.\n\nIn the survival mode, you will be challenged to stay alive and collect as many fragments of stars and coins as possible.\nExploring the world, you must complete the missions and challenges that will come your way. The Ancient will guide you and help you with all his wisdom.\n\nNext updates:\nNew mysteries, secrets, adventures and missions are being discovered, and they will soon be available in the world as well.\n\nCollect as many fragments and coins as you can to buy extra jumps and upgrades for your heroes. New attributes and items are coming. You should continue collecting coins to use as soon as new attributes become available.\n\nMost of all, we hope that you have fun. Your opinion is very important to us, you can help us improving the game. You can tell us what you think about the game and what you want in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84lx.jpg'),(17002,'Robo Dome',NULL,'Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Compete in the famed Robo Dome championship as Rei Castor. Test your ability in this roguelite shoot em’ up against a barrage of enemies and projectiles. Face off against giant robots and other contestants in an attempt to come on top of this year’s Robo Dome championship in Valhalla City.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91ro.jpg'),(17003,'Way of the Hunter: Wild Expeditions','2024-10-29','Shooter, Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5','Way of the Hunter: Wild Expeditions is the ultimate compilation of hunting grounds all over the world. In this authentic hunting simulation, you can explore the vast the in-game wilderness and fulfil all your hunting fantasies. The wide world of Way of the Hunter allows you to follow the many storylines in hunting grounds all over the world, master the challenges of ethical hunting and solve intriguing cases of unethical behaviour. Or venture out in free hunt, and explore the breath-taking landscapes of North America, Europe, New Zealand and Africa to learn about habitats, animal behaviour and ultimately how to manage animal fitness in order to harvest the rarest and most impressive trophies.\n\nThis latest edition bundles 6 enormous hunting areas and includes agile UTVs for off-roading. All of this has been enriched with the cosmetics of the Hunter\'s Pack and the Outfits Pack: 5 alternative outfits for your playable hunters, a beautifully engraved antique shotgun, a cameo paintjob for the car and an impressive wooden carved statue for your Transylvania hunting lodge.\n\nWild Expeditions includes 6 amazing DLCs:\n\n• Tikamoon Plains is a huge new hunting ground in Africa. Explore diverse landscapes, from windy mountains to deadly deserts and vast savannahs teeming with life. Join Malachi, a professional hunting guide, as he leads a group of adventurers through the thrilling world of Tikamoon Plains, inspired by the African wilderness. Includes bowhunting and 2 top-of-the-line hunting bows.\n\n• Aurora Shores is a breath-taking hunting area in the northernmost part of the USA, the Alaskan wilderness. As a fresh graduate of the Wildlife Trooper School, your job is to protect the natural resources of Aurora Shores. Explore untouched nature with rich populations of wild animals, such as Kodiak bears, Roosevelt elk, Wood bison, and many more. Includes crossbows.\n\n• Matariki Park in New Zealand offers a remarkable blend of biomes. Traverse hilly or mountainous terrain, home to the unique Himalayan tahr and the mighty Sambar deer, and venture into the lowland forest areas, the domain of the majestic Red deer. Immerse yourself in nature\'s beauty and lifelike wildlife that will keep you engaged for hours, all while offering insights into unique local habits and traditions.\n\n• Lintukoto Reserve is an amazing hunting ground in Scandinavia and the newest addition to Way of the Hunter. Experience the adventures of game warden Mikael and discover the nature and animals of the European North.\n\n• The Outfits Pack contains one original costume for each character - River, April, Wallace, Jackie and Malachi, usable in Free Hunt and Multiplayer mode.\n\n• Hunter\'s Pack: a shotgun with engravings, a paintjob for the Car, and a wooden carved mouflon statue for the lodge','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9flg.jpg'),(17004,'Seven Kingdoms: The Princess Problem','2024-06-22','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Every seven years the seven kingdoms send their best and brightest young people to be their delegates at the Vail Isle Summit, a tradition where seven weeks are spent together to form friendships, alliances and marriages. This year, however, things are different. Since the Great Peace, never have alliances been so close to collapse. The seven nations on the razor\'s edge of war. What happens at this summit could very well determine the fate of the known world.\n\nYou are one of the delegates.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k8v.jpg'),(17005,'2048 Blocks VR','2021-02-13','Puzzle','Oculus Quest','Merge blocks and get to 2048 in this simple VR puzzle game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7n62.jpg'),(17006,'Don\'t Wake Kate!',NULL,'Sin género','Web browser','D.W. is thirsty. Help her get as many glasses of water as she can without waking Baby Kate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fp5.jpg'),(17007,'Touhou Arcadia Record','2022-07-28','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Android, iOS','Touhou Arcadia Record is a game application for smartphones released by Damo Games on July 28, 2022. It is an authorized derivative work of Touhou Project.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52bz.jpg'),(17008,'Turret Rampage','2024-01-31','Shooter, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Defend humanity from underground monsters as the last standing turret! Force burrowers out of the ground with an artificial earthquake, capture elusive ghosts with silver shackles, and shatter alien bugs into pieces using powerful rockets!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c4v.jpg'),(17009,'Ships N\' Battles','2012-08-08','Fighting, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Play the next generation of the classic game, controlling the most destructive power of the seas with a finger touch.\n\nEasy to learn, hard to mastery\nShips N\' Battles is a easy game to learn, but with all the bonus combinations and strategy, you\'ll need to learn to use the tools to succeed and crash your enemies (especially that friend of yours that keep winning).\n\nMultiplayer\nBored to always beat the machine? Brings your friends to the battle field! Ships N\' Battles offer a multiplayer mode via Game Center, bluetooth, Lan e Global Server! Who will be the king of the seas? With Global Server technology, Ships N\' Battles allows you to play multiplayer cross-platform. In other words, you have a iPhone and do you want to play against your friend that has a Android?\n\nNo problem, just connect by Global Server!\n\nBonuses\nWith 10 different bonuses, Ships N’ Battles is a more dynamic game then others. Compare your rating in the World Ranking leaderboard and show who is the king of the seas. Earn trophies, more than 30 achivements to unlock!\n\nAnd there\'s more:\n4 types of ships\n10 different bonuses\n4 levels of difficulty\nMultiplayer via Global Server (play against others iOS, Mac and Android)\nMultiplayer via bluetooth\nMultiplayer via LAN (wifi)\nAccelerated mode in the single player','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jydeiqzq8rez5avvpxqd.jpg'),(17010,'Higurashi When They Cry Kai','2012-05-25','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Higurashi When They Cry Kai is the sequel to Higurashi When They Cry. Those 4 new and last chapters expand on the story behind the many mysteries of Hinamizawa and its characters. It\'s not a tragedy, just the ups and downs of life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6znu.jpg'),(17011,'Farmer\'s Dynasty','2020-04-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','More than just an agricultural simulation: in Farmer’s Dynasty, you have to rebuild your farm and develop your heritage, start a family, handle your relationships and, of course, manage your crops to prosper.\n\nTHE FARMER AND HIS MACHINES\nDozens of authentic farming machines you can use to cultivate your fields and optimize your yields.\n\nCHOOSE THE CROPS AND LIVESTOCK\nBecome an experienced farmer, expand your farm and invest in new fields so you can diversify and harvest even more.\n\nMAKE NEW FRIENDS\nEarn your neighbours\' gratitude by accomplishing quests. Maybe you\'ll end up marrying one of them?\n\nMANAGE YOUR BUDGET AND RESOURCES\nGet involved in a dynamic local economy in which your sales and purchases affect market prices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co237l.jpg'),(17012,'Sekai to Sekai no Mannaka de','2022-02-11','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kwh.jpg'),(17013,'Armored Core: Last Raven Portable','2010-06-04','Shooter','PlayStation Portable','In the wake of the now defunct Navis\'s failed attempt to control recovered ancient weapons technology, the world has been left in tatters. Looking to consolidate power, the Corporations (Crest, Mirage, and Kisaragi) have merged into one super-corporation known as \"The Alliance\". Fed up with corporate rule and oppression, and seeing a newfound threat in The Alliance, a Raven known as Jack-O (an important but minor character from Armored Core: Nexus) forms an organization of Ravens known as \"Vertex\" from the ashes of the fallen Raven\'s Ark. After rallying a sizable force of fellow Ravens to his cause, Jack-O declares that he will launch an all-out war on the Alliance in 24 hours. Leading the opposing force, a Raven named Evangel has rallied just as many Ravens to the Alliance and is preparing to fight Jack-O head on. Making matters all the more complicated, many Ravens have turned into independent warlords, setting out on their own after the collapse of Raven\'s Ark.\n\nTo finish this volatile situation: you. You are approached by both sides seeking your cooperation. Will you side with the Corporations, or assist Vertex in causing their downfall? You have a choice to make, Raven.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48ot.jpg'),(17014,'Road Racing: Highway Car Chase','2021-09-30','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','Jump behind the wheel and race through the endless busy roads and highways! Make near traffic misses discovering unique locations. Roads and highways are full of speeding motorcycles and cars – they can bother you. Be also prepared to escape from the cops, who might even use a helicopter to catch you. Brace yourself for an action-packed run, filled with skin-of-the-teeth near misses. Nobody said that it\'s easy to win!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z9h.jpg'),(17015,'Sniper Killer','2024-10-17','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Eliminate your victims as a serial killer dubbed ‘The Sniper Killer’. Terrorize the city with your keen eye and thirst for blood while staying one step ahead of a detective hell bent on bringing you to justice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79i0.jpg'),(17016,'Syberia: The World Before - Collector\'s Edition','2022-11-15','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Syberia: The World Before Collector’s Edition will include:\n- Full Game\n- Metal Case\n- Adjustable Figurine of Kate & Dana\n- Artbook\n- Music Box\n- Map of Vaghen\n- Exclusive Lithography\n- Keychain\n- Set of Postcards\n- Digital Script of the Prologue\n- Digital Soundtrack\n- Collector’s Box','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zmk.jpg'),(17017,'Chernobyl Commando','2013-03-08','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','26 years after a fatal accident in Chernobyl Nuclear Power Plant that covered half of the Europe in clouds of radioactive smoke, a large group of terrorists took over the area, trying to steal all the remaining radioactive waste - and use it.\n\nUkrainian and Russian forces hit them with all they could, but the enemy was well prepared and the small war raged on. Two of the best Spec Ops agents move in on their own, hitting the enemy hard before they can escape with the loot. This is a no-frills, old style, gun-blazing and explosion-roaring attack against multitude of enemies. While sometimes helped by the Army, you are mostly on your own. Hit them hard where it hurts and become a legend for generations to come!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68ka.jpg'),(17018,'Cryptid Farm','2024-10-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cultivate a thriving farm to survive in this peaceful horror farming game! Play online with up to 16 players in the same lobby. Work together with your fellow farmers to repair your tractor and escape the farm, try not to fall victim to the eerie and mysterious creatures that lurk nearby.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p1f.jpg'),(17019,'Masters of Puzzle','2020-05-29','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Enter the ultimate jigsaw puzzle experience with Masters of Puzzle - a full 3D, physics enabled, beautiful simulation game. Invite friends for a great multi-player experience or enjoy a solo relaxed session just for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nq6.jpg'),(17020,'Dark Sun: Wake of the Ravager','1994-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','DOS','Unleash your imagination into a vast, savage world, sun-scorched and wind-scraped.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3izp.jpg'),(17021,'Dehoarder 2',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dehoarder 2 is a simulation where you take control of the life of Harry the Hilldale Hoarder. You must help Harry to get his life in order before the building inspector fines him into oblivion and forecloses on the family home. But change comes hard for Harry, and at first he will only be willing to part with the simplest of things.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54cf.jpg'),(17022,'Marvel Pinball','2010-12-14','Pinball, Arcade','PlayStation 3','Marvel Pinball combines the greatest Super Heroes of all time with the definitive video game pinball experience of all time.\n\nUse your pinball wizardry to help the legendary Marvel Universe heroes rid the pinball landscape of notorious Super Villains in an epic combination of superhuman might, immersive gameplay, and unprecedented table visuals!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vdc.jpg'),(17023,'Comet',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Playdate','A light-hearted puzzle adventure where you play as the exuberant Stella who confronts her fear of the dark to search for her brother.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tl3.jpg'),(17024,'LazerBlazer: Type C - Confront','1993-06-21','Shooter','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','One of the games found in Super Scope 6.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17025,'Sort the Court!','2016-01-01','Simulator','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Give your decree in simple yes or no answers, and help the kingdom grow!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jw4.jpg'),(17026,'Rubber Head Bob','2024-08-22','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a mountain climbing game with a rubber-headed human! The controls are incredibly challenging! Bounce around like crazy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qgi.jpg'),(17027,'Pierhead Arcade 2','2021-08-05','Simulator, Arcade','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR','Pierhead Arcade 2 is the sequel to the popular indie Virtual Reality arcade simulator.\nRelive your childhood spent at the arcade on the pier but this time with unlimited tokens!\nPierhead Arcade is back with all new VR physics based arcade games to play!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4e4a.jpg'),(17028,'Ready? Set. Haiya!','2020-05-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ready? Set. Haiya! is a fighting-styled rhythm game, where players follow on-screen commands and try to time them as perfectly as they can, to try and beat their opponents to the beat in this epic groovy showdown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yba.jpg'),(17029,'Jeff The Killer','2013-12-31','Puzzle, Indie','Windows Phone, Android','Are you ready to be scared?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e61.jpg'),(17030,'Bacteria Warfare','2024-06-28','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a bacteria-cleansing game where you can use various weapons to eliminate germs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j7y.jpg'),(17031,'Terminal North',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore the Global Seed Bank as the official delegate from the United States Office of Disaster Preparedness.\n\nAll you have to do is deposit a few boxes of seeds.\n\nYou’re alone, cold, and in the dark, but the man on the other side of the terminal will help guide you.\n\nIgnore the logs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ztt.jpg'),(17032,'Ways of Alchemy',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a medieval alchemist in this card game. Grow, craft, and brew your way to power. Hire adventurers, discover ancient recipes, and master the art of alchemy. No wands are required — just wit and wisdom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g4b.jpg'),(17033,'The Humans Bundle',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dru.jpg'),(17034,'Monster Jam Steel Titans 2','2021-03-02','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','More Trucks! New Worlds! Monster Jam Steel Titans 2! Monster Jam Steel Titans 2 features more fan-favorite trucks in brand new Monster Jam worlds!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2or0.jpg'),(17035,'Rally One: Race to Glory','2023-08-04','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Android, iOS','Accept the challenge of rally apocalypse!\n\nRally One is a full-featured racing game for mobile gamers. It features an easy-to-understand interface, a physics system improved based on user feedback, and well-optimized graphics.\n\nIn Rally One, you can participate in championships with powerful cars in exotic locations, race against people from around the world, and test your speed, maneuverability, and drift skills in special events.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86zd.jpg'),(17036,'Sensible World of Soccer','2007-12-17','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Sensible World of Soccer is the classic 90’s football game reborn with enhanced graphics! Take on your friends online now in this fantastic pick up and play football game. Play a quick game, or manage your team over a full season with a fully immersive tactics editor.\n\nIn 2006, Codemasters announced a new version of Sensible World of Soccer, developed by Kuju Sheffield, for the Xbox 360 to be released in summer 2007 on Xbox Live Arcade. It features both the classic \"retro\" visuals of the original SWOS, as well as new improved high definition graphics, and retains the exact gameplay of the 96/97 version of Sensible World of Soccer. Due to problems with the game\'s network performance, the release was delayed in order for \"significant proportions\" of the network code to be rewritten. After missing several previous release dates, the game appeared on Xbox Live Arcade on 19 December 2007 but was quickly pulled. A statement from Microsoft confirmed that an incorrect version of the game had been made available, in which online play was not possible. The fixed version of the game was released two days later on 21 December. The Windows version was never released.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pme.jpg'),(17037,'Deep Rock Galactic','2020-05-13','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Deep Rock Galactic is a first-person co-operative sci-fi shooter for up to 4 players, featuring fully procedural and destructible environments to explore, mine, and explode your way through to reach your objectives. As a team of veteran dwarven space miners, you must take on perilous missions for the interplanetary mining corporation Deep Rock Galactic and go where no-one else dares, into the deepest, most dangerous cave systems of the most hostile planet ever discovered.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48gx.jpg'),(17038,'Professor Layton and the Unwound Future HD for Mobile','2020-07-13','Puzzle, Adventure','Android, iOS','After solving a multitude of curious conundrums, renowned archeologist Professor Layton receives a rather peculiar letter.\n\nThe sender of this letter is none other than his assistant Luke...but from 10 years in the future! \"Future Luke\" has found himself in quite a predicament. The London he knows and loves has been thrown into absolute chaos.\n\nInitially thinking that Luke may have simply been pulling his leg with a harmless jest, the professor cannot help but recall the terrible events that occurred the previous week...\n\nThe start of which was an unveiling ceremony of mankind\'s first time machine, attended by many prominent figures from throughout the nation.\n\nDuring a demonstration, the time machine went out of control and engulfed the audience in a terrible explosion.\n\nSeveral of the attendees mysteriously vanished into thin air, including Prime Minister Bill Hawks.\n\nUnable to shake the feeling that the time machine\'s explosion may somehow be connected, Professor Layton and Luke set off to the location mentioned in the letter, a clock shop on Midland Road in Baldwin, embarking on what might be the biggest mystery they have ever encountered.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2td7.jpg'),(17039,'Lighthouse of the Dead','2022-11-18','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Disable your enemies by ripping off their limbs, or explode their heads and swim in the fountains of blood. You’ve got an infinite amount of ammo to fight and three doses of drugs in case your heart fails. Kill four enemies in a row without a single miss and you´ll be healed as a reward for your awesomeness. The only way to survive is to light the beacon, board the ship and leave the damn place. Good luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6k2t.jpg'),(17040,'Wangan Midnight Maximum Tune 5DX+','2022-01-12','Racing','Arcade','Wangan Midnight Maximum Tune 5DX+ (also known as Maximum Tune 5DX+ or simply Maxi 5DX+) is an arcade racing game developed and published by Namco, based on the Wangan Midnight manga. As the ninth game in the Wangan Midnight Maximum Tune arcade series and the final update for Wangan Midnight Maximum Tune 5, this version introduces two new car manufacturers, Lamborghini and Honda, as well as the Hiroshima Expressway course. A new Ghost Battle mode, exclusive to the Japanese and Indonesian versions, allows players to compete against ghosts from other countries, similar to the Japan Challenge in the international versions.\n\nThe update was released in North America on January 12, 2022, under the name Maximum Tune 5DX+, skipping the 5DX version for unknown reasons. In this version, the Honda brand is replaced by Acura, its North American counterpart, although many Honda cars remain, except for the Honda S2000, which only appears in the Japan Challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8r9c.jpg'),(17041,'LEGO Creator: Knights\' Kingdom','2000-12-31','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','LEGO Creator: Knights\' Kingdom is a construction simulation video game for Microsoft Windows; it uses virtual Lego pieces to build a medieval kingdom and then use the kingdom in a battle against the character Cedric the Bull.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4fgg.jpg'),(17042,'Space Escape Obstacles','2021-06-11','Platform, Arcade','Android','Try to avoid the obstacles and conquer all the levels/worlds.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17043,'The Chronicles of Myrtana: Archolos','2021-12-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Chronicles Of Myrtana: Archolos is a free, total conversion mod for Gothic II: Gold Edition. It features a completely new open world, improved skills systems, gameplay mechanics and complex story.\n\nMain goal of this project is to honour one the best classic cRPG and take the die-hard fans of the original Gothic trilogy as well as new players on one more adventure in the Kingdom of Myrtana.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bwp.jpg'),(17044,'Fairune 2','2016-10-27','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Nintendo 3DS','\"Fairune 2 is a fantasy puzzle-solving adventure RPG, which has you explore the map by solving puzzles, tricks and beating monsters.\n\nYou are called upon by the mysterious book that can tell you where to find the lost fairy. In this adventure, you encounter the wonderful girl that may lead you to the truth of the world.\n\nWith much greater content than the prequel, the powered-up 8-bit graphics and sounds will bring forth the new reminiscent gameplay.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57n0.jpg'),(17045,'FireForce Online','2018-08-18','Shooter, Indie','Android','War in a modern battlefield combat in this FPS shooter multiplayer online\n\nFireForce Online is a free modern war combat FPS shooter online. The crossfire of the battlefield awaits you!\n\nAre you ready to be an elite soldier? Do you have the cold blood of a true sharpshooter in combat? Then this is the FPS game for you. Fight with your friends online in the battlefield against global paramilitary organizations, show who is the best shooter and make your name as a recognized marksman.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7j8w.jpg'),(17046,'AquaNox 2: Revelation','2003-08-22','Shooter, Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is is a new story of the underwater world Aqua. In 2666 a young freighter pilot called William Drake sets out to search for the heritage of a mythical ancestor. He is looking for adventure - and finds greed, ruthlessness, merciless hatred … and also unexpected help.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eh9.jpg'),(17047,'Men of War II','2023-08-10','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience warfare like never before! Men of War II, the anticipated sequel to the acclaimed RTS franchise is here with all-new units, locations, campaigns and game modes, combined with the series’ trademark historical accuracy and action-filled gameplay on Eastern and Western Fronts of WWII.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6adk.jpg'),(17048,'Time Stripper',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17049,'Slide to Spell',NULL,'Puzzle','Sin plataforma','Slide lines or columns of letters to form words spelled\neither vertically or horizontally. You want to get the longest words possible.\nThe game has three modes: hard mode is a nightmare and in easy the game almost plays itself. Quite fascinating to watch, really.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17050,'Mahjong Journey','2014-12-14','Puzzle','iOS','Embark on a magical journey in this addictive Mahjong Solitaire adventure! \nEnjoy a new take on Mahjong Shanghai as you help a young girl and her grandfather traverse the globe in search of her lost parents. Make your way by pairing tiles in order to dismantle hundreds of layouts. Collect achievements for special accomplishments while taking advantage of innovative gameplay twists like Shuffle, which allows you to get out of a difficult situation, or Firecracker, a tool for blowing up multiple pairs of tiles. Visit the Forbidden City, Virupaksha Temple, the Taj Mahal and the famous Mount Fuji as you fulfill challenging quests and earn gold stars for completing levels as fast as you can!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/blcypfiobtipkdqayeyu.jpg'),(17051,'Memory Trees: Forget Me Not',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into a world full of magic, mystery, intrigue and romance. Play as one of a set of twins with the ability to tend and communicate to the earth itself. Tend to your fields by day and battle monsters by night, all while trying to woe the boo of your choice. With 6 romance options for each twin to choose from, each with a vibrant and unique personality coupled with full voice acting, there\'s bound to be one who will make your knees weak.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rst.jpg'),(17052,'Magic Soldier','2025-03-27','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on an epic journey in Magic Soldier, a 2D open-world MMORPG.\nExplore vast landscapes, fight powerful foes, craft unique items, and team up with players worldwide. Adventure awaits, shape your destiny today !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lgt.jpg'),(17053,'Sports Club Boyfriend: Secrets of BL Academy','2014-05-13','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co751f.jpg'),(17054,'Dolguth','2015-10-20','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dolguth is a 2D oldschool brawler for up-to 6 local players.  \nChoose your mech to fight in one of the Dolguth arenas and destroy the other warriors.  \nEach mech is powered with a melee weapon and a 6-bullets cannon.  \nEach pilot has an EMP gun and a grapple to reach impervious zones.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17055,'Victor Vran: Fractured Worlds','2017-06-06','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Journey to the Fractured Worlds, a dimension formed from the fragments of broken realms. A perilous place for even the most experienced of hunters, explore its unfathomed depths through new levels and endless dungeons where each step proves more dangerous than the last. Continue your journey as Victor as you attempt to piece together the Astrolabe in this new, thrilling addition to Victor Vran.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xevx6clz9tj8qpzhe0pr.jpg'),(17056,'Wonderful Journey','2023-05-29','Simulator','Android','Embarking on \'Wonderful Journey\' and experiencing different lives, is it a reincarnation encounter? Or is it a reunion of fate?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87r5.jpg'),(17057,'Project Night','2013-08-21','Shooter, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Do you remember the survival horror genre in 90s? The atmosphere? The fear? Last summer i’ve started working on my first game and now i want to share with you this experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nacnkv1hflykzeamd8nr.jpg'),(17058,'Lonewolf: Zombie FPS 3D','2015-06-21','Shooter, Strategy, Indie','Android','In this game, you can kill waves of zombies in three different maps with a full arsenal. Lots of blood in contrast with dark maps, dimly lit, that requires you luck and skill! Have fun levelling up, unlocking new guns, maps, perks and earning cool emblems!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68nd.jpg'),(17059,'Sonic Runners Adventure',NULL,'Platform, Racing, Adventure','Legacy Mobile Device','The Java Port of \"Sonic Runners Adventure\"\n\nRescue Sonic\'s universe in a brand-new endless runner!\nUnlock loads of Sonic characters like Tails and Knuckles, and power them up!\nShred across 4 iconic locations and Bonus Mode with spectacular new graphics!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k4j.jpg'),(17060,'The Life of Mr Pips','2020-09-30','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Life of Mr Pips is a cute adventure game where you play an adorable little strawberry who\'s trying to find his place in life. Explore a fruitful world as Mr Pips, to find your scattered pips family, and go leaf-rafting with cute blueberries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h5b.jpg'),(17061,'Crypt of the Necrodancer: Amplified','2017-07-12','Music, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Vita','Crypt of the NecroDancer: Amplified is a DLC prequel for Crypt of the NecroDancer. Take control of the shapeshifting protagonist Nocturna to fight your way through electrifying new levels, boss battles, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vo8.jpg'),(17062,'Tunnel of Doom','2021-11-23','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Tunnel of Doom is an action rogue-lite hybrid that mixes tower defense with melee and ranged combat gameplay. Randomly generated, every run is different as you guide Angel on a quest to rescue her husband. Gather resources, discover perks, and use what you find to battle waves of monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jvf.jpg'),(17063,'Wizard\'s Beard',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Explore locations, fight enemies, cast spells, and repeat! What more could you want in a game?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7eas.jpg'),(17064,'The Operator','2024-07-22','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','As an Operator, you will assist FDI\'s field agents by analyzing evidence on your computer and making deductions. Help them solve impossible cases in this immersive interface game, full of plot twists and mysteries. Everything will be explained, you just have to ████ ██ ██████.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xz6.jpg'),(17065,'Return to Atlantis','1988-12-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Arcade','Amiga','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yorpknbwt0avtwqkibmr.jpg'),(17066,'Sky Rhythm','2024-08-09','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sprint, jump, shuttle, and finally reach the end of the sky high!ヾ(๑╹◡╹)ﾉ\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9avc.jpg'),(17067,'Hyper Empire','2025-04-04','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hyper Empire is a fast paced empire management game set on the edge of space. Games are shorter so every decision matters. Take control of a diverse range of factions and lead them to victory. Use your wits, military might and infrastructure as you colonize planets and encounter rival factions. Fight, build, invest in faith or technology as you advance your way in a deep single player experience. The clock is ticking, and victory or defeat lies right around the corner.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gvv.jpg'),(17068,'Activate the Three Artefacts and then Leave','2010-11-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An abstract exploration game in which players must traverse an angular floating maze in search of the titular artefacts.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17069,'Renegade Rush','2025-05-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Renegade Rush is a survivor-style roguelike featuring deep upgrade systems, strategic exploration, and dynamic weapon builds. Stay aware of your position in the universe—venture out to hunt and discover, but don’t stray too far from home unless you\'re prepared for the dangers ahead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nyr.jpg'),(17070,'Umihara Kawase BaZooKa!','2020-10-30','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','At its core, Umihara Kawase Bazooka!! is a fixed screen action game. Perform combos with the new “Bazooka” action and aim for the high score. With over 40 stages (planned), plenty of challenge awaits. Up to four players can play together in local cooperative or hindrance play.\n\nThe game also offers a versus battle mode. Up to four players can play against each other, locally or online, and aim for victory in nonsensical battles. (Network support requires a subscription to the respective platform’s online service.)\n\nOriginal characters, as well as the forefront of Success Corporation and Studio Saizensen characters, will join the fray one after another!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h83.jpg'),(17071,'Its a Pirate-Game!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A top-down minimalist pixel game about dodging pirates and their bullets!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17072,'Moe Waifu H Fantasy','2025-02-18','Music, Puzzle','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Meet 5 lovely maidens and impress them with your rhythm and sharp reflexes! Moe Waifu H Fantasy is a simple and addictive action puzzler where your goal is to match your target icon at the right side of the screen to the incoming icons that fly in from the left side of the screen. Match them before they touch the target, and your score will climb, earning up to 3 stars for your performance. Fail to match them and you’ll lose hearts!\n\nEach girl’s expressions will change in reaction to your gameplay, so don’t let them down! Can you unlock all their cute outfits, fill your gallery and complete the jukebox to win them over?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9agv.jpg'),(17073,'U.F.O. K.O. Tower Defense','2021-08-02','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Place lasers, missile launchers, sniper turrets, and use combat strategies such as airstrikes and the space ray to repel waves of alien invaders in this sci-fi tower defense game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3aoh.jpg'),(17074,'The Journey of AutUmn','2024-05-22','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Journey of AutUmn - A classic point-and-click adventure game with completely hand-painted graphics. The player controls an android that crashes during its mission through a variety of lovingly designed environments and solves classic inventory puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c43.jpg'),(17075,'Hover Junkers','2016-04-05','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hover Junkers is a VR + MOTION CONTROL ONLY multiplayer flying fort game designed from the ground up exclusively for VR. Enter the virtual world of the drought stricken future where junk hunters scavenge for scrap left behind. Players choose their ship based on their RoomScale play area and enter into multiplayer combat areas to claim scrap/loot and defend against enemy player junkers. Using scrap as actual defenses against incoming fire, players can physically dodge, hide, and shoot from behind the cover of their ships defenses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qde.jpg'),(17076,'Zombie Quarantine: Blackout Survival','2025-02-27','Fighting, Shooter, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Survive the Darkness, Fight the Horde!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hic.jpg'),(17077,'Rock of Ages','2012-05-15','Racing, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','A rock-solid combination of rock-rolling action, deep strategy, and captivating art and music from different ages of history, this is a game of crush or be crushed! Two castles stand opposed; one is yours, the other is your enemy\'s. They\'re a jerk and their castle sucks, so you\'re going to try to smash it using an enormous boulder. Even as they build up their defenses, you\'re ready to roll over them in order to raze that unsightly tower. But beware! There\'s a giant boulder headed your way, too.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yn0.jpg'),(17078,'Westild\'s Law','2024-12-06','Shooter, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Westild\'s Law offers shootouts where you must use every element of your arsenal to win. Throw dynamite or your weapon at your enemies to stun them when ammo runs low and then take their weapons. When the situation gets critical, activate \"ultra-sense\", slow-down time and enhance your abilities. Embark on adventures through 48 levels, each offering unique challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94ln.jpg'),(17079,'Friday Night Funkin\' Battle Waifu','2022-04-07','Music','Android','A gunshot music game with a whole of brand new gameplays and variety of interesting modes to experience. FNF Music Shoot: Waifu Battle won\'t let you down. It\'ll get you at the first moment you try it out!!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vx6.jpg'),(17080,'Doki Doki Loser MC','2019-12-15','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki: Loser MC is a mod for Doki Doki Literature Club! that transforms the original experience by focusing on an extremely passive, insecure and socially awkward protagonist (MC). Unlike the standard version of the game, where the MC is a relatively neutral character, in this mod he is portrayed as a complete “loser”, resulting in hilarious, embarrassing and even frustrating interactions with the girls in the club.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hr5.jpg'),(17081,'Arcade Style Bot Ball Shooting Multiplayer Game','2017-06-19','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','We have just released 2 days ago a new FPS game, but we have tried to make it look and shoot different, than what is average on this type of games. Its a shooters game, but instead of bullets that you cannot see or interact with, shoots balls, that bounce and do sparks all around what it hits. Because the game is still in development, there are some bugs and some issues to be improved, but in general its very playable. We got it in LAN and Multiplayer versions, so we would love to have the chance that somebody who loves this type of games review it, and give us feedback, excellent or horrible, but the opinion of an gameris vital to improve the game or stop it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tylvcouyrny4gxzmr2cy.jpg'),(17082,'Swordai','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Swordai is a multiplayer, first-person, medieval slasher featuring fast paced directional combat and a deep skill tree. Master your sword as you carve your way through monsters, epic bosses, and other players in your quest to ascend the tower.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pqt.jpg'),(17083,'Duel School Infinite','2021-09-24','Visual Novel','Android','To the outside world, you\'re at the top of the food chain—wielding a supernatural ability most people can only dream of!\n\nAt Takamagahara Academy… you\'re small-fry.\n\nConsidered the weakest in the school, your only hope of survival is to keep your head down—but when a strange apparition appears in the hallways and it falls to you to uncover the truth, can you overcome your limitations to save yourself and the school?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co506o.jpg'),(17084,'TruLove',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','TruLove is a visual novel with just a dash of stat raising. The game takes you through one complete college year, with changing seasons, college exams, and of course the all important holidays. Oh, and don’t forget dates with the girl of your choice!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5npa.jpg'),(17085,'The Lost World: Jurassic Park','1997-09-16','Shooter','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','The Lost World: Jurassic Park is an action-adventure video game developed by Appaloosa Interactive, and published by Sega for the Sega Genesis and is based on the film of the same name, which in turn is based on the novel by Michael Crichton.\n\nUnlike the previous Jurassic Park games for the Genesis, the game features a bird\'s-eye view perspective similar to Jurassic Park on the Super NES.\n\nThe player assumes the role of an unnamed character who must capture dinosaurs on Isla Sorna while stopping rival hunters from transporting dinosaurs to the mainland. The game consists of nineteen missions spread across four sections of the island, referred to as Sites One through Four. Boss levels must be played at the end of each Site in order to advance to the next Site.\n\nA second player, in the role of Ian Malcolm, can help out in Cooperative Mode, or both players can work against each other in Competitive Mode. Weapons such as a taser, tranquilizer gun, shotgun and grenades can be used against hunters and dinosaurs. At times, the player can control vehicles such as an SUV and a hovercraft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30b8.jpg'),(17086,'The Dark Cave','2024-07-15','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Dark Cave is a pixel-style roguelike card-building turn-based game. Deliberate each character\'s move and skill casting, match and continuously enhance the skill card deck, brave the mysterious and perilous dark world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j3u.jpg'),(17087,'Tokimeki Memorial','1994-05-27','Simulator, Visual Novel','Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','You are a young boy who is going to study three years at the Kirameki High School in Japan. Your goal is to win the affection of one (and possibly more) of the twelve beautiful girls who also study with you, especially of Shiori, with whom you were in love some years ago. This is a simulation game with a high-developed statistics system. You have to increase your statistics in different disciplines, depending on the girl you are interested in. You communicate with people via your telephone, and date girls by going with them to various places. You have to keep your promises, otherwise a girl will become angry and even tell bad things about you to other girls, which will spoil your reputation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56o4.jpg'),(17088,'Dead Trigger','2012-06-26','Shooter','Android, iOS','“The world has collapsed.\n\nIn 2012 modern civilization is coming to an end. Global economics have been disrupted, money has lost its value. People have risen against the ignorant politicians who were just lining their pockets – and they didn\'t spare any of them.\n\nHowever, those who really ruled the world were prepared - and escaped. Suddenly billions of people died from a strange virus, while others turned into butcherly beasts with just one thought:\nTO KILL!\n\nOnly a few people on the planet have survived, at least until they run out of ammo... or learn how to stop them...”\n\nSmash hordes of bloodthirsty zombies * Secure vital supplies * Save other survivors * Protect the Safe Haven * Explore the city * and uncover the provoking truth in this intense FPS action game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fpp.jpg'),(17089,'Blitzkrieg','2019-11-25','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blitzkrieg is a tough-as-nails tower defence game from Loui Studios. Complete with a built-in level creator, so you can create and share levels with other players!\n\nYou defend the motherland from invading convoys of tanks, cars, and jeeps while enemy aircraft bomb vital buildings. Utilise an arsenal of flamethrowers, high-explosive cannons, artillery, machine guns, missile launchers, AA turrets, pill-box bunkers, and experimental tesla weaponry to survive the blitzkrieg.\n\nEach level is a tightly woven puzzle of turret placement, optimisation, and upgrades. Careful strategy is the key to your survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mdb.jpg'),(17090,'Rebel Inc: Escalation','2019-10-15','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A unique and deeply engaging political/military strategic simulation from the creator of Plague Inc. Balance competing civilian and military priorities and deal with a deadly insurgency in order to stabilise a war-torn country.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1sdv.jpg'),(17091,'The Idolmaster: Cinderella Girls','2011-12-16','Music, Simulator','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Legacy Mobile Device','The Idolmaster: Cinderella Girls is a Japanese free-to-play simulation video game developed for the Mobage social network platform for mobile phones. It was first released for feature phones, and compatibility was later on extended to iOS and Android devices. The game is based on The Idolmaster franchise, and features a cast of new idol characters. The story in Cinderella Girls follows the career of a producer in charge of leading and training prospective pop idols to stardom. Its gameplay follows a collectible card game format in which each idol is represented as a card, which the player may use to form a unit of idols to train in lessons, take to jobs, and compete against opponents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nu1.jpg'),(17092,'Prayer of the Faithless','2022-05-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Prayer of the Faithless is a unique blend of traditional RPG and classic survival-horror gameplay. In addition to fighting enemies to level up, you must also scavenge the field to find healing supplies, as well as new gear that comes with their own skills and traits to further customize your party. Battles reward smart tactics and aggressive offense by tying stamina pools to both skill usage and damage reduction. Enemies are challenging, but an understanding of the options each character has available to them will take you farther than grinding levels will.\n\nEach ally\'s personality traits affect their combat prowess and abilities. As the story goes on and the stakes are raised, these traits will develop (and degrade!) along with the character\'s mental state. You will get to truly understand how each character thinks and feels through conversations and battle performance, and see how the state of the world affects their morale and beliefs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4pyn.jpg'),(17093,'Natural Selection 2','2012-10-30','Shooter, Puzzle, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Natural Selection 2 is an immersive, multiplayer shooter that pits aliens against humans in a strategic and action-packed struggle for survival. It seamlessly combines shooter and RTS/strategy gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1x8r.jpg'),(17094,'Cosmic Resistance','2023-12-28','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gear up, gamers! Brace yourself for an epic sci-fi strategy casual game where Aliens have swept across the cosmos, leaving humanity\'s fate hanging by a thread. The weight of liberation falls on your shoulders. Are you ready, General, to step up and become humanity\'s last hope?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fdf.jpg'),(17095,'Weather Lord: Legendary Hero - Collector\'s Edition','2016-08-04','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Call upon the gods of Olympus to help you rescue your beloved before all hope is gone! Unfolding with the scope of an epic fantasy adventure, Weather Lord: Legendary Hero - Collector\'s Edition will capture your imagination even as it draws you into hours of compelling gameplay!\n\nThis Collector\'s Edition includes;\n- A huge bonus chapter\n- A step-by-step walkthrough of the game\n- Downloadable wallpapers\n- Music\n- Character bios\n- An exclusive mini-game\n- Dozens of challenging levels!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n2q.jpg'),(17096,'LSD: Dream Emulator Retro','2024-11-20','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Immerse yourself in a dreamy and psychedelic world through low poly enviroments and liminal spaces. A Retro game influenced by the original LSD: Dream Emulator from PSX.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gve.jpg'),(17097,'Rampart Tactics',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Indie Turnbased Strategy, solo or online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y9t.jpg'),(17098,'3 Kings','2024-05-26','Strategy, Card & Board Game','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this pocket roguelike strategy game, you have to build a kingdom powerful enough to withstand the other king\'s invasions and be crowned the king of kings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8coc.jpg'),(17099,'NBA Playgrounds','2017-05-08','Sport, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"Classic NBA arcade action is back! Take your “A” game to the playground and beat the best in high-flying 2-on-2 basketball action. Practice your skills offline, play with up to three others, or take your talents online to posterize your opponents with acrobatic jams and ridiculous displays of skill.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27xw.jpg'),(17100,'Defend the Night',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pw3.jpg'),(17101,'TModLoader: Metroid Mod','2012-04-04','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Metroid Mod is, quite simply, a mod for Terraria that adds content based on the Metroid franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fj5.jpg'),(17102,'Cr1me Fr0g','2021-09-13','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser','The opposite of Frog Detective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wmt.jpg'),(17103,'Shroom','2017-09-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Make it through levels, shooting your way through hoards of monsters commanded by an evil shroom.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17104,'Pokémon Odyssey','2022-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Game Boy Advance','This is a crossover project between Pokémon, Made in Abyss, and Etrian Odyssey. It’s a sort of dungeon-crawler story-driven, , but you don’t need to know anything about Etrian Odyssey or Made in Abyss in order to fully enjoy this game!\n\nOn the island of Talrega lies the entrance to the Yggdrasil labyrinth, a gigantic desert carved from the roots of the tree of life over millennia; filled with treasures and other valuable items, it attracted explorers from everywhere. What are you looking for? Fame? Money? Or do you just want to test your coaching skills by tackling the maze? What’s at the end?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co860t.jpg'),(17105,'Beach Casino HD',NULL,'Arcade','Sin plataforma','Beach Casino is EASY to play and easy to WIN BIG! If you enjoy slots games, then you\'ll have tons of fun searching for the Fortune!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17106,'Akimbo: Kung-Fu Hero','2001-07-31','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Akimbo, renowed kung-fu hero of the seven seas, is always on the lookout for adventure. A gentle lad who is always willing to lend a hand or roundhouse kick to help a person in need, he often finds himself caught up in the strangest situations.\n\nOne day, our hero discovers a note in a bottle that was washed up on the beach near his dojo. According to the message, an evil dragon named Fang has enslaved the peaceful and quiet Turtle Island. Using black magic, the beast has turned the natives into willing servants who obey his every command. The only inhabitants unaffected by the dragon\'s spells are the twenty shamans who used to rule the island with the blessing of the people - but their power is fading fast, and if the shamans fail, all hope is lost.\n\nOur hero must set out on the journey of his lifetime and save the creatures and people of Turtle Island from the evil dragon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tq3.jpg'),(17107,'Mercenaries 2: World in Flames','2008-11-30','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Mercenaries 2: World in Flames is an explosive open-world action game set in a massive, highly reactive, war-torn world. A power-hungry tyrant messes with Venezuela\'s oil supply, sparking an invasion that turns the country into a warzone. But for you, international crisis is all upside: You are a mercenary, and you profit from chaos. Mercenaries 2 features a slew of potential clients, all willing to pay you to do their dirty work. Dirty deeds, done for exorbitant fees. These are world powers with deep pockets, deep grudges, and enough arms and ammo to start World War III. This is your kind of environment. Mercenaries 2 features the latest and most dangerous in civilian and military tech, everything from shiny new sports cars, to the future-tech satellite-guided bunker-busting mini-nuke. Tanks, APCs, boats, luxury automobiles - you name it, you can have it delivered to you in real time. And if you run out of cash you can always \'acquire\' the gear you need in the field. If you see it, you can buy it, steal it, or blow the living crap out of it. Play your own way, or play with the help of a friend in the new cooperative multiplayer mode. You are not a soldier. You don\'t have to play by anyone\'s rules. You have your own code: you will fulfill the terms of the contract, no matter what. Not everyone in the world of Mercenaries is as honorable. Everyone will try and screw you, given the chance. They think they can get away with it, because they don\'t know rule #1: EVERYBODY PAYS.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2io6.jpg'),(17108,'SingStar: Ultimate Party','2014-10-28','Music','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4','SingStar: Ultimate Party is the ultimate introduction to kick off a SingStar party on your PlayStation. It hosts a collection of 30 epic tracks, which represents great value for anyone new to SingStar.\n\nNo mics? No problem. Turn your smartphone into a pocket-sized mic and sing your favourite songs with no extra equipment. Have a laugh with friends at your own SingStar bash or impromptu sing-a-long, and then show off your best bits (and, of course, your hilarious epic fails) on Facebook and Twitter. You can even send challenges to your mates online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uba.jpg'),(17109,'A Walk Through Echoes','2021-07-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Accompany an old blind man on his journey in this challenging auditory platformer game. Test your precision platforming skills, reflexes, memory, and puzzle solving in order to progress.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kwi.jpg'),(17110,'Suikoden: Star Leap',NULL,'Adventure','Android, iOS','A new story of 108 stars about the runes begins.\nSuikoden STAR LEAP is an entirely new addition to the series and is the first title to be tailored for mobile.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hih.jpg'),(17111,'Little Town Hero: Big Idea Edition','2020-06-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Izzit? Dazzit!: use your ideas to outwit and defend against enemies, then strike back with strong attacks.\ncharming LOCALS: befriend townspeople to gain their support, as well as unlock more ideas to use in battle.\nthere\'s no place like home: enjoy life in this little town with a whimsical soundtrack by Toby Fox (under tale) and cozy art style by game Freak','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28g7.jpg'),(17112,'An Apparently Normal Room','2014-07-16','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A white room in the middle of nowhere. It has nothing special. A single light illuminates the room. But it\'s not as simple as that.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jmqhcmtpu2sccze0ml51.jpg'),(17113,'Luvocious','2018-02-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Luvocious is not just one, but three different stories with three different worlds spanning across three different eras. Experience a modern high school student\'s life in a Japanese inspired town. Battle monsters in the past as a Princess and explore a spooky research facility on the moon in deep space. There is three times the fun to be had with Luvocious!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23ya.jpg'),(17114,'Crunda',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Leap, dive and slam your way across the asteroid belt in this unique physics speedrunning platformer. Explore the mysteries of Crunda\'s wobbly whimsical world or challenge your friends to tackle the world record table!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jjl.jpg'),(17115,'Planes: Fire & Rescue','2014-11-04','Arcade','Wii','During fire season in Piston Peak Park, a team of firefighting vehicles is required to keep citizens and property safe. Dusty, the once famous aerial racing plane, must train to fight fires and perform rescues along with 7 other elite firefighter friends such as Lil’ Dipper, Windlifter, and Blade. As you receive radio messages of emergencies, you must perform duties like scooping up water, hoisting up boulders, guiding stranded camper vans, airlifting stranded hikers and calling in smoke jumpers to bulldoze debris. There\'s 30 different Training Academy missions and you must take 12 different emergency call story missions. You must complete the tasks in a quick manner as depending on your completion time, you will receive a Bronze, Silver or Gold medal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gs3.jpg'),(17116,'Puzzle Lights and Mushrooms 1000','2025-03-06','Puzzle, Simulator, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','A simple puzzle, brightened by mushrooms!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hi8.jpg'),(17117,'Battlefield Commander WWII','2025-04-07','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Battlefield Commander WWII is a real-time tactical game where you lead the soldiers and vehicles that battled across the globe during this time in history. Play hundreds of unique units across dynamic campaigns, skirmishes, and online PvP.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yfi.jpg'),(17118,'Sonic 3: D.A. Garden Edition','2015-10-18','Platform','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sonic 3: D.A. Garden Edition is a ROM hack of Sonic 3 & Knuckles created by D.A. Garden. It aims to be a \"vanilla\" but complete and fully featured take on S3K, with 23 acts of new level layouts matching the scope and size of the original game.\n\nIn 2020, a user named Thorn ported the hack to the Sonic 3 AIR project as a mod, allowing it to be played with the additional features AIR provides.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81m2.jpg'),(17119,'Bounder','1986-12-31','Platform, Strategy, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC, MSX','The player controls a tennis ball which is used to navigate courses, composed of numerous tiles, which are suspended high above ground. The ball must be bounced past walls and over enemies; coming into contact with either, or plummeting over the edge of the course, results in the loss of one of the player\'s seven lives.\n\nCourses feature power squares, which push the tennis ball forward and allow longer jumps, these must be utilized to complete the course. Power squares are also used to enable the tennis ball to reach mystery spaces, tiles with question marks, which contain extra lives and bonus jumps which are used on bonus screens. Mystery spaces can also destroy the tennis ball, resulting in the loss of a life, through instant destruction or by freezing the ball in place while a missile flies across the play area and explodes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co673e.jpg'),(17120,'World of Warcraft: Shadows of Argus','2017-08-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Argus storyline starts in patch 7.3.0 and deals with the heroes of Azeroth traveling to Argus, the former homeworld of the eredar before their corruption by Sargeras, to end the threat of the Burning Legion once and for all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xxw.jpg'),(17121,'WarioWare Gold','2018-08-03','Arcade','Nintendo 3DS','The infamous schemer, Wario, is back!\n\nPlay his brand-new microgame collection, where you\'ll have seconds to complete 300 different microgames. Better think fast to succeed! You\'ll use the touchscreen, tilt the system, push buttons, and rock the mic as you laugh through fully voiced stories featuring new and classic characters!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wmc.jpg'),(17122,'The Famires: Shijou Saikyou no Menu','1998-12-17','Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation','The Famires: Shijou Saikyou no Menu is a business simulator where you run your family restaurant, hire staff and design the layout to serve customers food.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52w9.jpg'),(17123,'Victory',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17124,'Toon Blast','2017-08-15','Puzzle, Arcade','Android, iOS','Enter the crazy cartoon world starring Cooper Cat, Wally Wolf, Bruno Bear and enjoy loads of whacky and challenging levels! Blast cubes and create powerful combos to pass levels. Solve puzzles to help the Toon gang as they travel around magical worlds!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/t0tktmsdbqnvbkq6fsuw.jpg'),(17125,'Dino Crisis 2','2000-09-13','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Dino Crisis 2 is a third-person action-adventure game and sequel to Dino Crisis. In a change from the survival horror theme of the first game, Dino Crisis 2 is more shoot \'em up oriented. The character always runs, thus removing the need for the run button from the first game, a second gun can be carried and more weapons were added to the game. Besides changes to the gameplay, the game also introduces new species of dinosaurs and lizards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qbu.jpg'),(17126,'Hardland','2019-09-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hardland is a world ruled by a dying king. It\'s also a world full of dangerous creatures and places worth discovering. We will not dictate your journey in this game -- all we do is set the stage so you can find your own. Our goal is to make Hardland one of the great open-world action RPGs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l6z.jpg'),(17127,'JetPilot','1996-11-01','Simulator','Amiga','JetPilot features the Lockheed F-104 and the English Electric Lightning. Take to the skies in this incredibly realistic 3d flight simulator, whether you are a novice pilot or an experienced enthusiast this title will satisfy your craving for reality. The control methods are as simple or as complicated as you like, either way they perform within 10% of the real thing. As well as practice and situation flying you will also be required to successfully complete some 20 qualification missions where a high level of concentration and situation awareness is required to successfully intercept targets from Scotland to the Mediterranean.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50js.jpg'),(17128,'Red Riding Hood','2019-02-14','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','With Red’s Mother falling ill, it’s left to Red and her friend Alex to collect medicine from her Grandmother on the other side of the forest.\n\nThrough the time spent together, it’s made clear there’s some underlying tension between the two of them. Playing as Red, your choices will affect whether or not you can resolve this issue.\n\nA retelling of a classic fairy tale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mvg.jpg'),(17129,'S.M.A.S.H.E.D.','1987-12-31','Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC','Pigseye Peers is a newly-qualified surgeon sent to join the mobile military hospital unit in Korea - the Strangest Mobile Army Surgical Hospital East of Detroit, or S*M*A*S*H*E*D for short. Thus, the game is a clear spoof of the very popular TV series, M*A*S*H*. It is an adventure using text inputs with occasional graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kfm.jpg'),(17130,'What the Golf?','2019-09-19','Puzzle, Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, visionOS, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','The golf game for people who hate golf. A silly physics-based golf parody where every golf course is a new surprising type of golf, some brilliant or hilarious, others so absurd they will make you go: What the golf!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rgr.jpg'),(17131,'Hopeguard','2025-02-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hopeguard is a third-person dark fantasy game about loss and acceptance. You have been chosen to eliminate the Dragon Queen, but the confrontation will not go as expected. Journey through caves, ruins, and forests to solve environmental puzzles and fulfill your quest -but with a new perspective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oot.jpg'),(17132,'City Transport Simulator: Tram - Collector\'s Edition','2025-01-28','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','Become a tram driver, so hop into the cab for the ultimate tram driving experience! In addition to the five real-world trams included in the Standard and Deluxe editions (ULF B1, R2.2b, ULF A1, StadtRegioTram, and Type D Vienna), the Collector\'s edition also includes the E1 Vienna and the GT8N Mannheim','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e42.jpg'),(17133,'Slender\'s Woods','2012-10-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slender\'s Woods is a short horror game about a mythical creature Slender man. Of course, the game is inspired by the famous Slender game by Parsec Productions, but it has a different type of gameplay.\n\nThe Gamejolt release contains some fixes and extra polishing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p63.jpg'),(17134,'Tech Corp.','2019-07-25','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tech Corp. is a game where you try to become the biggest tech company in the world . Your goal is to become the next big shot in the tech industry. The game also takes place through history. Starting in the early 90\'s and going to present time. You\'re in charge of creating and designing new Products such as Consoles, Phones, Tablets, and Computers. You are responsible for all aspects of a product from the software, the manufacturing, and the releasing and marketing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m5o.jpg'),(17135,'Bandage on my right cheek',NULL,'Music, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','SYNOPSIS               \n               \nThis is a surrealistic tale about loss, love, and regret. A man with no memory of his past, leaves the psychiatric facility he wakes up in, and takes on a journey to explore the outside world. He seeks to find out who he was in the past, who were the people he cared about, and what happened to them.               \n               \n               \n               \nABOUT THE GAMEPLAY               \n               \nThis is a single player first person game, set in a heightened reality. Elements of puzzle combined with visual storytelling.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/kpdo9fkd1hlsco805mb6.jpg'),(17136,'Flife','2023-01-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience the challenge of climbing with a knife all the way to the top! Flip your favorite knife to climb up dynamic landscapes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63sj.jpg'),(17137,'Doom Anthology','2025-01-22','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Doom Anthology takes players through more than three decades of demon slaying - from the classic games that popularized the first-person shooter genre to the fan favorite franchise reboot and its sequel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eze.jpg'),(17138,'BattleTech: Urban Warfare',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Urban Warfare brings \'Mech combat to the vast cityscapes of the Inner Sphere! Electronic warfare, large-scale building destruction, environmental mechanics, new enemy units and more make the urban sprawl a whole new battlefield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dx6.jpg'),(17139,'Rockman no Huángjīn Dìguó','1999-12-31','Quiz/Trivia, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A video game released for home computers only in Taiwan. It is very similar to monopoly. you simply acquire assets by rolling the dice and spending money. Winning or loosing doesn\'t seem to have an effect on the storyline.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3utt.jpg'),(17140,'Demons Never Lie',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Demons Never Lie is a low-poly and voxel graphic adventure where your soul is at stake!\n\nAn incredible and dark story with elements of classic point & click games and visual novels. Dive into an emotional and thrilling experience and enjoy the atmospheric storytelling.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1sny.jpg'),(17141,'Gob!','2017-03-11','Shooter, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Gob! is a turn-based shoot-em-up, made for the 7 day roguelike challenge: 7DRL 2017. Your quest is to get a high score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sut.jpg'),(17142,'WaveCrash!!','2021-03-26','Fighting, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Head-to-head puzzle brawling action! Match blocks to send waves at your opponent! Dodge their waves or crash them head-on to survive. Unleash unique super attacks and explosive Hype Mode to tip the scales. It\'s a back-and-forth struggle for arcade puzzling dominance!\n\nThe demo contains two characters: the magical martial-artist in training Yo and the aloof psychic detective Seth! Let loose chi blasts and psychic barriers in a battle to the death! Or at least until one fighter falls over and doesn\'t feel like getting up again!\n\nThe current in progress version includes Hana, the schoolgirl with feet of fury, Phoebe, the indestructible android, Sensei Jones, and Momoko, the part-time ninja, and Belmont, the tycoon inferno!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nd8.jpg'),(17143,'Goalkeeper Training VR','2021-10-23','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','VR Goalkeeping game! 3 different modes and a lot of fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49ya.jpg'),(17144,'The Vermander Curse','2022-07-05','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','J.P. Vermander has a problem.\n\nIn his eyes, he\'s been swindled.\n\nWith the offending party being none other than the local hospital.\n\nAnd by using the power of a ritualistic curse, he will have his revenge.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17145,'Tank Storage','2023-07-27','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Drive a car, shoot the gun with operating a tank and sometimes walk.\n2D top down combat vehicles shooter and adventure game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nsm.jpg'),(17146,'Genso Flood Front','2019-12-21','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A doujin game by FriendSea based on the Touhou Project series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54v1.jpg'),(17147,'War War','2024-10-20','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 4-player multiplayer real-time / turn-based strategy game. Move armies on the board in turn-based mode and invade other armies to enter real-time strategy \"skirmish\" battles! Win enough small battles to take over the board and win the War!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hr1.jpg'),(17148,'Toukiden: The Age of Demons','2014-02-11','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable','An expansive fantasy world influenced by historical and traditional Japanese elements. This new franchise casts players in the role of the demon-fighting warrior, known as a Slayer. Starting from the Utakata Village headquarters where they will accept quests, players will venture out to battle monstrous and deadly Oni (demons) before they destroy all of humanity. Players can select party members from a supporting cast of characters, or join together with up to three other players through ad-hoc mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hmk.jpg'),(17149,'Flight Pilot Simulator: 3D Flying Games','2015-02-23','Simulator, Arcade','Android, iOS','Unleash your inner Maverick, become a pilot and conquer the skies.\n+ Fun and challenging missions on beautiful scenarios\n+ 20 realistic planes: from single engine props to jets, airliners and military aircraft.\n+ Explore a huge open map with tons of surprises in free flight mode\n+ Immersive scenarios: emergencies, rescue missions, rough landings, fires, races and more!\n\nDownload now and don\'t miss amazing updates!\n\nCOMING SOON: NEW LEVELS AND PLANES!\n\n● What our players are saying\n\n- This is a great game. Easy to play and an easy way to kill some time in between appointments. A must have. I spend hours playing this game. Simplistic but addicting! Love it\n\n- Very good game, but completely addicting. Finish whatever you have to before even starting.\n\n- The game is really fun. It\'s got all awesome graphics. It is definitely the best. I have never played such an awesome game. Whoever doesn\'t like this game has a problem.\n\n- That\'s right one of the best games I have ever played so if you are looking for a good time by just sitting around this is the app for you!\n\n- I just downloaded it and it\'s so fun and addictive I recommend this to people who like games on mobile devices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ax0er3obx1gvm8bwz84q.jpg'),(17150,'Pippu: Bauble Quest','2021-09-03','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Pippu is a heroic little creature from the world of the Beandrops. One day her planet is visited by hostile aliens called the Obkins, who travel from place to place stealing precious treasures to power their dangerous and wacky machinery. Run, climb and swim your way through 14 worlds to bash the baddies and save your planet. Features: Colorful, vibrant worlds with lots of nooks and crannies to explore. A kooky cast of weird and wonderful characters to meet. Collect all 56 Baubles to restore your world to its full glory. Fun for all the family, young and old, beginner or seasoned gamer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rjv.jpg'),(17151,'Agora','2015-08-24','Sin género','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17152,'Slayers X: Terminal Aftermath - Vengance of the Slayer','2024-05-15','Shooter, Platform','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','So.... got what it takes to be a X Slayer?!?... 7 weapons, blood and gore, twisted music by Seepage & Psyko Syndikate, and maps where you can blow up everything. its awesome. started making it in 1998 in high school with my friend and now im 37, so i have life experience now.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mud.jpg'),(17153,'Outer Wilds: Echoes of the Eye','2021-09-28','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Hearthian space program has detected an anomaly that canʼt be attributed to any known location in the solar system. Grab your flashlight and prepare to illuminate the darkest secrets of the Outer Wilds in it\'s first and only DLC, Outer Wilds: Echoes of the Eye.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wbp.jpg'),(17154,'Silent Frontiers','2024-08-05','Platform, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Gripping 2D Side-Scrolling Strategy Tower Defense Extravaganza. In this forgotten frontier, you become the final line of defense for your city, warding off relentless hordes of monstrous invaders. This is not just a battle for survival; it\'s a supreme test of wit and strategy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8n18.jpg'),(17155,'Home From Work 2','2014-10-18','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You arrive home from work after a long and late night working at the office. Upon arriving home you begin to experience paranormal occurrences. You soon discover that you are not alone in your own home. You begin investigating but in doing so, you aggravate the demonic presence in your home. Discover what a demonic presence is capable of doing in Home from work 2','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5316.jpg'),(17156,'Romance MD: Always on Call','2018-09-06','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Romance MD: Always On Call is a medical-themed game and its main stories are Love Choices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co81yx.jpg'),(17157,'Table Ball: Amazing Extras Skin Pack','2024-02-11','Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Get complete access to the Amazing Extras Skin Pack without spending any Pings.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17158,'K3LVN','2022-07-29','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','K3LVN is a sci-fi action platformer where the player is a creature who’s been experimented on and is trying to escape the space station lab where they’re being kept. K3LVN is able to change their state of matter to alter their behavior. The three states usable are the Gel state which is the default bipedal state, the Liquid state which makes K3LVN smaller and grants the ability to climb on certain walls, and the Solid State, which turns K3LVN into a ball to roll around and gain momentum. They must use these abilities in combination with each other to traverse the environment as quickly as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yw9.jpg'),(17159,'My Dear Frankenstein','2021-02-27','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','“Come. While the darkness is still welcoming...”\n\n“My Dear Frankenstein” is a point-and-click adventure visual novel produced by the indie Japanese circle Number7 and localised by Moonchime Studios.\n\nAs a newborn little monster, the protagonist will have to explore the City of Shipberry at night and search for the pieces of his heart that got scattered all around it. Players will get to delve into universal themes like life, friendship and grief through his experiences in this emotional quest.\n\nContent warnings: suicide, cruelty, references to death and the occult.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xqq.jpg'),(17160,'Superman: The Man of Steel','2002-11-19','Adventure','Xbox','In the Xbox only Man of Steel, Players control Superman through 7 levels of 3D flying, overhead vertical scrolling and sidescrolling secitons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e43.jpg'),(17161,'Eons Away',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Eons Away is a turn-based RPG with unique combat mechanics. Explore a vibrant, handpainted world overshadowed by an encroaching corruption. Every decision is important, be it how you fight your battles or the bonds you make. Choose your path wisely.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zwq.jpg'),(17162,'Anime Thighs','2024-03-21','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Who doesn\'t like Anime Thighs?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ypz.jpg'),(17163,'Metroid Fusion: C.L.E.A.N. Station','2018-08-12','Shooter, Platform','Game Boy Advance','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pkn.jpg'),(17164,'DienWorlds','2016-03-31','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ĐiệnWorlds is a freeware management/sim/strategy game in which you place wires and other components to power houses and businesses, to (in turn) make money from them and (hopefully) make a profit. At its core, ĐiệnWorlds follows the rules of the cellular automaton Wireworld (created by Brian Silverman in 1987). For flavor and for gameplay purposes, other rules and overarching mechanics have been added.\n\nThe game has a general \"goal\" of making money and avoiding high debt, but other than this, it invites the player to discover strategies, arrangements, and setups that work best in their situation. As the developer, I don\'t even know what kinds of strategies (if any) are \"optimal\" - but I think that an important element of what makes these types of games fun is this kind of exploration. The underlying Wireworld-like simulation is fun to interact with as well - I\'d like to think the game has a certain mathematical \"depth\" to it. In general, testers have found both the game\'s micro- and macro- mechanics to be addicting and engaging.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99zd.jpg'),(17165,'Escape Game Sleepless','2025-04-02','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A popular escape game with lots of cute animals. Even if you are not good at solving puzzles, this is an escape game that you can enjoy casually.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jcx.jpg'),(17166,'Investigation Stories: Windsound','2022-11-11','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As the investigation deepens, the secret of the town gradually emerges, the truth behind this is --?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tnx.jpg'),(17167,'Ancestory','2015-10-13','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Summon souls of tribesmen and cast devastating spells to vanquish your foes in a mix of turn-based strategy and card game. Featuring turn-based gameplay, multiple maps, underworldly minions and mighty spells, Ancestory gives the players an opportunity to lead their tribe into 1-on-1 battle on multiple different battlefields...all set on top of a massive golem! Players get to build their own decks before heading into battle to fight for control of totems spread across the battlefield. Players can find their foes through online matchmaking, inviting friends to play or honing their skills against an AI.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/s7gvyenn2theegwxgsoa.jpg'),(17168,'Bookers: Underground Chapter','2018-06-28','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You are locked in a dungeon prison of a powerful demon called Atiza, with no memories and a book that gives you magical powers called Bookania, you will try to avoid breaking the seal that keeps the demon asleep in a quick classic RPG adventure but without towns, people, weapons, stores and with only your book','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jy0.jpg'),(17169,'Ampu-Tea','2013-11-03','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The surgeon-simulator inspired Tea-making game is now available on Steam! Using the latest KS-001 Robo-Arm, you must practise making various types of tea.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jay.jpg'),(17170,'Garage: Bad Trip','2018-07-06','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Garage is a bloody topdown shooter inspired by VHS era B-movies. You play as an ex drug dealer named Butch, who single-handedly slays hordes of living dead to save a girl.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25m4.jpg'),(17171,'Elf Wives Cheat to Ride my Meat','2022-02-18','Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This visual novel proves working at the adventurer\'s guild isn\'t so bad when you can give the sexiest members a quest to fuck you instead of fighting monsters in a dungeon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co501a.jpg'),(17172,'Zombie Army 4: Dead War - Left 4 Dead Character Pack 2',NULL,'Shooter','Sin plataforma','Four more characters from Left 4 Dead join the Resistance in this free Character Pack!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sx7.jpg'),(17173,'Keyfall',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Keyfall is an unique competitive experience for both beginner and expert level typewriters, with different single player and multiplayer game modes. Players are able to compete for place in both global and country ranking leaderboards!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58vl.jpg'),(17174,'Bubble Bobble Also Featuring Rainbow Islands','1996-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Bubble Bobble Also Featuring Rainbow Islands (commonly shortened to just Bubble Bobble & Rainbow Islands) is a compilation of both Bubble Bobble and Rainbow Islands, two popular arcade games developed by Taito in the 1980s and early 1990s. It was released for the Sega Saturn (alongside PlayStation and PC versions) in 1996.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ajs.jpg'),(17175,'Elite X: Street Racer','2021-04-09','Racing','Android','Run on tracks inspired by real scenery. Accelerate on incredible, realistic maps. Live on the edge between chaos and control, stepping deep in this street car racing game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mv2.jpg'),(17176,'Minds Beneath Us','2024-07-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Minds Beneath Us is a story-rich Sci-Fi thriller adventure game set in a futuristic Asian city. In a society that has become fully automated with AI, you will be trapped into a body that doesn\'t belong to yourself, making choices for him and face the coming fate together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4p7s.jpg'),(17177,'Prey: Mooncrash','2018-06-10','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','In Mooncrash, a DLC for Prey, you’ll face overwhelming odds to escape a secret TranStar base on the moon, where the enemies you encounter, the hazards you face, the goals you complete, and the loot you collect are different each time you play. With changing environments as dangerous as they are dynamic, the Mooncrash campaign for Prey will offer a fun challenge to test even the most skilled players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ku3.jpg'),(17178,'Fooblitzky','1985-12-31','Puzzle, Strategy','Atari 8-bit, DOS, Apple II','A board game style strategy game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vpu.jpg'),(17179,'Whipseey and the Lost Atlas','2019-08-27','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','After discovering a magical book, a young boy named Drew is whisked away to Whipseeyland, where he transforms into Whipseey, the pink, whip-wielding hero of this bright, colorful world. With the help of Princess Alyssa, Whipseey embarks on a quest to recover magical orbs that possess the power to return him home.\n\nWhip or jump on enemies standing in the way and collect the magic gems they leave behind. Find an impassable chasm? Hold down the jump button and use the whip as a helicopter to travel further. Use swing points to fling Whipseey from one far-flung location to another and bounce off enemies to reach impossible heights.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ni6.jpg'),(17180,'Nightwatch','2023-12-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nightwatch is a first person mystery game that plays out in the woods of Rivertidecreek. A walking simulator that features choices of dialogues and different puzzles. The artwork will make you feel absorbed in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88bs.jpg'),(17181,'Flufftopia','2018-03-05','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Flufftopia is a cute little clicker game with a story. Help Flufftown to grow and eventually become Flufftopia! But wait… could there be even more?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2cv3.jpg'),(17182,'Outcore: Desktop Adventure','2022-09-26','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','All you wanted was a nice game. But now you find yourself opening Windows apps like Paint & Notepad to solve puzzles, and searching for files on your computers that you didn\'t put there... Who is she? Why did she appear on your desktop? Let\'s dive into her memories and find out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qpq.jpg'),(17183,'Climb Challenge: Find Items 5','2024-03-26','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hidden-object adventure game. The player needs to run around the location and look for objects in secret places, climbing into them along walls and ledges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ybf.jpg'),(17184,'Epic Palace: Knossos',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Immerse yourself in the epic world of the Bronze Age! Rule over the first European civilization and build the famous Palace of Knossos. Be smart in diplomacy and trade, use your gained reputation and equip your throne room with unique frescoes from all over the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pxt.jpg'),(17185,'Definitely Poker','2021-11-05','Puzzle, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Arcade, Card & Board Game','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A followup to \'Probably Poker\'. This game plays like a normal round of video Poker with a twist. Play against the dealer for a highscore but have control over what they can\'t get via trump cards. Can you stack the deck in your favor?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4o6f.jpg'),(17186,'Little Nightmares: Secrets of the Maw - Expansion Pass','2017-06-06','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Little Nightmares is a puzzle-platform horror adventure game developed by Tarsier Studios and published by Bandai Namco Entertainment. Set in a mysterious world, Little Nightmares follows the journey of Six, a hungry little girl who must escape the Maw, an iron vessel inhabited by monstrous, twisted beings.\n\nThe Secrets of the Maw DLC introduces three new chapters: The Depths, The Hideaway, and The Residence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xp2.jpg'),(17187,'Dust-Up','2019-02-22','Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience the craziest tournament with different physics-based animated fighters! Start a clash immediately or create your fighter with unique moves and punches. The dust-up will start soon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q0r.jpg'),(17188,'Takkoman','2022-05-02','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Takkoman -Kouzatsu World- is a stylish 2D action game born from character fan art based on the Touhou series, featuring individually unique creatures running rampant across all thirteen stages!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vlx.jpg'),(17189,'Command & Conquer: Remastered','2020-06-05','Real Time Strategy (RTS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A remastered version of the original Command & Conquer, part of the\nCommand & Conquer Remastered Collection. Created by the former Westwood Studios team members at Petroglyph Games alongside the dedicated community. Every game element has been recreated in 4K detail, including the completely remastered legendary soundtrack by Frank Klepacki.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xi7.jpg'),(17190,'Turtles!',NULL,'Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this action-puzzle game, you take control of Bonnie and all the other cute turtles and help as many of them as possible to get to the sea.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nq3.jpg'),(17191,'Fidget Spinner RPG','2022-05-02','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fidget spinner RPG is all about spinning a fidget spinner to absurd RPMs.\nAlong your journey you will level up skills such as mining, blacksmithing, and alchemy.\nYou will craft equipment to augment your stats and enhance your power.\nYou will achieve tasks & advance through a nonlinear progression.\nYou will buy and sell items of all sorts to NPC merchants.\nAnd you will unlock talents that increase your capabilities in exciting ways.\nAll in the pursuit of more RPM.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4pyl.jpg'),(17192,'Enypnion Redreamed','2023-10-31','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Enter a surreal adventure that delves deep into the subconscious mind of a young boy. Guided by a dream spirit, solve puzzles and explore a realm of eerie wonder, as you find your way back into the waking world. An illusory adventure redreamed!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6huc.jpg'),(17193,'Star Wars: Attack Squadrons',NULL,'Simulator','Web browser','Star Wars: Attack Squadrons was an online browser-based space combat game in development by Disney Interactive and Area 52 Games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74jl.jpg'),(17194,'Monster X',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','New dangers have emerged. Mutated and powerful monsters are destroying our city. We must take action! Use a total of 4 weapons (Gun Sword / Gauntlets / Cannon / Bow) to fight with the enemy, flexibly use props, collect monster materials, modified weapons and defeat your enemy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ljg.jpg'),(17195,'Herbert\'s Dummy Run','1986-12-31','Platform, Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC','Herbert\'s Dummy Run is the fourth entry in a series of games featuring Wally Week and his family. Herbert is the small child of Wally who has become trapped inside a department store and must get to the lost and found department where his parents are waiting. \n \nThe game is played in real time and allows four and a half hours to complete the game. Like other games in the series there are platforming elements and various puzzle solving sections that require the use of items found around the map.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/pr495kdn8kaehowuwqru.jpg'),(17196,'Duel','2017-10-16','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is for controlling the robot for fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2azj.jpg'),(17197,'After Burner','1987-07-01','Shooter, Simulator, Arcade','Arcade, FM Towns','Muster up all the skill, reflexes and guts you\'ve got. Because inside your F-14 Thunder Cat, you\'re going to need all that - and more.\n\nBlast laser-directed, anti-aircraft fire at enemy planes. Dodge heat-seeking missiles with fancy flywork, like dips, turns and barrel rolls. Come head to head with the infamous Flying Fortresses (the toughest of all enemies) and dogfight your way through, to a nanosecond of safety.\n\nAnd if you make it far enough, a fuel tanker will be waiting for you. Dock successfully and you\'ll replenish valuable energy and ammunition.\n\nSo get your adrenaline pumping and grab your joystick. Then take to the skies. You\'re not going to believe what\'s up there!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jw7.jpg'),(17198,'King\'s Quest IV: The Perils of Rosella','1990-12-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Apple IIGS, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga, Apple II','King\'s Quest IV: The Perils of Rosella is an adventure game in the King\'s Quest series. Players control Princess Rosella, daughter of King Graham, as she embarks on a quest to save her father\'s life and rescue a fairy kingdom. The game takes place in the land of Tamir, where Rosella must find a magical fruit to heal her ailing father while also helping the fairy queen Genesta reclaim her stolen talisman from the evil fairy Lolotte. Players navigate Rosella through various environments, solving puzzles and interacting with characters from folklore and fairy tales. King\'s Quest IV introduces real-time elements and day-night cycles to the series, affecting gameplay and puzzle solutions. The game expands on the series\' narrative by focusing on a female protagonist and exploring new themes while maintaining the fantasy setting and puzzle-solving mechanics characteristic of the King\'s Quest franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28rs.jpg'),(17199,'Overwatch: Game of the Year Edition','2017-07-18','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','REQUIRES XBOX LIVE GOLD. SOLD SEPARATELY.\n\nJoin us for a FREE weekend of Overwatch beginning November 17! You’ll have access to all of the maps and heroes in a variety of game modes. The Overwatch Free Weekend begins November 17 at 11:00 a.m. PT and ends November 20 at 11:59 p.m. PT. Any experience or items you earn during this free weekend will transfer over if you decide to purchase Overwatch: Game of the Year Edition; just be sure you purchase the game on the same Xbox Live Gold membership you played with during this free weekend.\n\nClash on the battlefields of tomorrow and choose your hero from a diverse cast of soldiers, scientists, adventurers, and oddities. Bend time, defy physics, and unleash a dizzying array of extraordinary powers and weapons. Engage your enemies in iconic locations from around the globe in the ultimate team-based shooter.\n\nThe world needs heroes—we hope you can join us!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22sz.jpg'),(17200,'Survive the Rift','2021-04-15','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive the Rift is a rogue-lite shoot \'em up with procedurally generated levels, unlockable ships, and plenty of items to make each run unique.\nInspired by classic 16-bit era scrolling shooters with modern rogue-lite game mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xsz.jpg'),(17201,'Kapamilya Deal or No Deal','2006-10-16','Arcade','Web browser','Kapamilya Deal or No Deal is a fanmade Flash game based on the Philippines version of Deal or No Deal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xmp.jpg'),(17202,'AK-xolotl: Together','2023-09-14','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The cutest, deadliest top-down roguelike shooter featuring AK-wielding Axolotls. Blast your way through the animal kingdom with an arsenal of kick-ass guns, mighty power-ups and even raise an army of trigger-happy baby axolotls. Double the firepower! Local co-op update now live!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dtg.jpg'),(17203,'Hamurabi','1968-12-31','Strategy','PDP-8','Hamurabi is a text-based game of land and resource management and is one of the earliest computer games. It was originally written in FOCAL in 1968, but it was ported to BASIC in 1971. Like many BASIC games of the time, Hamurabi was mainly a game of numeric input. As the ruler, the player could buy and sell land, purchase grain and decide how much grain to release to his kingdom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z0y.jpg'),(17204,'Small Talk',NULL,'Visual Novel','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8e67.jpg'),(17205,'Infested Planet: Planetary Campaign',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','You\'ve fought battles as a squad leader. Now become the general and win the war. This expansion adds a dynamic campaign to Infested Planet. Every move on the campaign map is a tactical battle on the ground.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66hy.jpg'),(17206,'Richy\'s Nightmares','2022-03-23','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Plunge into the little boy\'s world of fantasy, with overactive imagination and wild fear. The game contains plenty of puzzles and obstacles. Richy need your help to overcome all difficulties and fears on his way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yj1.jpg'),(17207,'Driving Demon','1983-02-01','Racing, Arcade','Texas Instruments TI-99','Driving Demon is a racing game played from a top down perspective on a single straight. The player has to race down a two-lane road to earn the high score. Other cars occupy the road and these have to be avoided or else the player will crash and lose a life. Crashes also occur when going off the road and hitting an oil slick. A scanner located to the right of the main view allows the player to spot cars down the road. The game uses manual transmission and it\'s necessary to shift gears at the appropriate time or else the engine might blow and the player will crash. The game ends when time runs out or after five crashes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/oh4vuu4aweqdu0wnhmh5.jpg'),(17208,'VR Puzzle Box','2019-09-11','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Accept incredible brain twister challenge - try immersive VR experience that is simple, but very exciting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oq9.jpg'),(17209,'CanVerse','2022-06-07','Simulator, Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play hyper-realistic backgammon, checkers & chess with more board games coming soon.\n\nChoose to take on your friends or computer competitors, with different levels of difficulty.\n\nLocal & online gameplay, with online support for 2 players & 62 spectators, with voice chat.\n\nWelcome to CanVerse, the future of shared hyper-realistic tabletop gaming.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uex.jpg'),(17210,'Orb Tower','2025-03-10','Puzzle, Pinball, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Roguelike Bubble Puzzler! Choose your school of magic and reach the top of the tower! Chill pick up and play feel and nostalgic pixel art and music. Get your staff and prepare to shoot orbastical spells !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f8g.jpg'),(17211,'Coloring Game 5','2025-04-25','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Coloring Game 5 - coloring by numbers. Is a bright representative of anti-stress games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co969j.jpg'),(17212,'Southern Monsters',NULL,'Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In South Arkansas there\'s talk of a monster. Where he roams, the locust thorns build barbed walls around the riverbank, not far from your house. Your real home isn\'t made of stock millwork, but telephone lines: an online forum for undiscovered creatures where everyone knows you as \'cripplefoot\'. You debate the existence of the strange as your friends leave for distant universities. Outside your childhood bedroom, the cypress trees stretch for miles. \n \nIn South Arkansas there\'s talk of a monster. They say he always follows the creeks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hp3.jpg'),(17213,'Clumsy Fighting',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17214,'Ranma 1/2: Hard Battle','1993-11-05','Fighting','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Welcome to the world of RANMA 1/2 Explosive Free-Fight, the hottest new blockbuster from the phenomenon that is... MANGA!\n\nYou\'re about to set out on a breathtaking hyper-adventure. The powerful, pixel-punching graphics will make your head spin like a blow to the temple. Featuring the most outrageous cast of characters... they\'ll leave you clutching on to your sanity by the black belt of your judo suit... RANMA 1/2 - A dozen animaniacs causing mayhem in a mind-blowing body-bruising battle of wits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xhk.jpg'),(17215,'Spelunker HD Deluxe','2021-08-05','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Spelunker HD returns!\n\nSpelunker HD, which was released for PlayStation 3 in 2009 and won the PlayStation Store Special Award at the PlayStation Awards that year, has been revived with a full remake on PlayStation 4 and Switch as Ganso Minna de Spelunker.\n\nGanso Minna de Spelunker is an action game in which the cave explorer Spelunker, said to be “the weakest chracter in video game history,” explores caves full of mystery. With 100 stages consisting of abandoned mines, underground lakes, ancient ruins, glaciers, and more, Spelunker’s goal is to reach the depths of each cave.\n\nCaves are full of dangers including natural terrain, cave creatures, and malicious traps—and enemies and traps that appear to be traces of an unknown civilization will appear in the latter half of the cavern. Spelunker must overcome these obstacles by properly utilizing items such as bombs, flares, portable fans, and more, as well as his jump technique.\n\nBut be cautious, as Spelunker is quite weak! If you fall from your own height, or get hit by bat poop, you will die. Spelunker’s weakness, or his “fragile constitution,” gives the game a moderate sense of tension and rhythm, making it more interesting as an action game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pmf.jpg'),(17216,'Rock n\' Roll Racing','2014-05-02','Puzzle, Racing, Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, PC (Microsoft Windows), Game Boy Advance','The game pits four racers against each other, with up to two of them being player-controlled and the rest being AI opponents. Each race consists of four laps around tracks viewed from an isometric perspective, which enables players to discern the presence of frequent sloping sections spread throughout the game\'s various tracks. In addition to navigating the turns, racers must also maneuver hills and dips without falling or jumping over the guard rail at the track\'s edge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o1q.jpg'),(17217,'Koumajou Densetsu: Scarlet Symphony','2009-08-16','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Touhou game with Castlevania-esque elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5m21.jpg'),(17218,'Harvest Moon',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Satellaview, Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Wii, Wii U, Super Famicom','Ever wanted to live life on a farm, with nothing but the sun, the fresh scent of your crops, the muddy fields underneath, and cows and chickens to keep you company? Well, you\'re in luck, because you have just inherited your grandfather\'s ranch, but it\'s in a terrible state of disrepair! What ever can you do?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43o8.jpg'),(17219,'Taut','2007-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Taut is a 2007 freeware horror game made in RPG Maker, which takes heavy inspiration from Silent Hill in terms of visuals and the movies of David Lynch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w8g.jpg'),(17220,'Life of Delta','2023-03-13','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Embark on a journey through a vast post-apocalyptic environment, full of interesting characters and engaging puzzle games in this sci-fi point-and-click adventure game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wec.jpg'),(17221,'Kanye Quest 3030','2013-07-22','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kanye Quest 3030 is a hip-hop-themed science-fiction 2D roleplaying game starring Kanye West.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wwm.jpg'),(17222,'Autumn war','2006-11-14','Strategy, Indie','Web browser','Command your troops in a desperate last stand against the walking dead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e5v.jpg'),(17223,'My Horse: Bonded Spirits','2024-06-19','Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Build a bond with your horse and gain its trust. Develop yours and the horse’s skills. Discover the surrounding open world. Complete tasks and take part in competitions. Rebuild a run-down stud farm!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hyx.jpg'),(17224,'Qual','2021-06-14','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Qual is a fast paced top-down bullet hell that emphasizes on spell combinations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pbc.jpg'),(17225,'Trip\'s Voyage: Gem Rush','2024-07-17','Platform, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fast-paced, arcade-style minigame about chasing a high-score while being chased by some ghastly foes! Originally a minigame called \"Well Raider\" from the game Trip\'s Voyage made inside Dreams for the PS4/PS5.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17226,'We Love Golf!','2008-01-01','Sport','Wii','A golf game published by Capcom and developed by Camelot, the developer of Mario Golf, complete with costumes to make your golfer look like Ryu, Ken, Morrigan, and other classic Capcom characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ssp.jpg'),(17227,'Saints Row','2022-08-23','Shooter, Adventure','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Welcome to Santo Ileso, a vibrant fictional city in the American Southwest. In a world rife with crime, a group of young friends embark on their own criminal venture, as they rise to the top in their bid to become Self Made.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pxl.jpg'),(17228,'Dying Light: Viking - Raiders of Harran Bundle','2021-02-11','Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Become a real Viking and set sail with this premium Dying Light bundle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uco.jpg'),(17229,'Simple 2000 Series Vol. 44: The Hajimete no RPG - Densetsu no Keishousha','2004-01-29','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','The region of Lordenias has seen a peaceful era for the last 400 years thanks to a single hero. However, this time was coming to an end. The king of Magura who controls the south-east island \"Sylvania\" was fascinated by demons and planned to revive the god of evil. Demons began to appear all over the island and soon the people began to disappear. The demonic forces turn their gaze towards Mid Earth. You will play as the protagonist and go on an adventure to save the world that has fallen. Travel around the world listening to people and gathering information. Around 100 kinds of monster, 50 kinds of magic, and 40 kinds of weapons and protective gear are available in this game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nvv.jpg'),(17230,'The Last Train','2024-08-07','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Your sister has recently gone missing at the nearby metro station. After several more reports of weird occurrences, it is agreed to abandon and close the platform. From hearing the news of losing your sister, every night you have been searching the platform for any clues on her disappearance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nrk.jpg'),(17231,'SpaceFoes','2020-04-12','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A space shooter inspired by old school games. You set the order of the levels, get new weapons and upgrades. Each stage has a boss and a sub-boss with unique skills and challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41uk.jpg'),(17232,'Crea','2016-06-09','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Furthering the emerging sandbox genre, Crea features combat and crafting in randomly generated, fantasy-style worlds for you to explore, tear apart and build back up. Crea differentiates itself in many ways such as RPG-style character progression, several unique systems, extensive mod support and a charming art style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mpk.jpg'),(17233,'Apple Run','2024-07-31','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fun twist on the classic video game \'snake\'! You are a free roaming snake collecting apples and avoiding lava. Complete challenges, customize your snake and unlock achievements. What is the maximum score you can get?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mgm.jpg'),(17234,'Power Rush',NULL,'Fighting, Adventure','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','In a universe where the earth is no longer enough for the human race, the USS has sent a team of miners, architects, engineers and scientists to create a sustainable planet for the human race.\nThe operation starts until one of the miners get in touch with a space crystal which gives him powers and alerts the inhabitants of the planet who later attack the space city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ke2.jpg'),(17235,'TOCA Race Driver 2','2004-07-15','Racing, Sport','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','Toca Race Driver 2 is the sequel of the Codemasters\' acclaimed Toca Race Driver. In this Game, you can race in about 15 different types of racing category, including official championships (like V8 Supercars and DTM), stock cars, supercars, rally, open wheels, supertruck category and much more .\n\nIn the single player career mode, you race for the success through various championships and tracks all over the world, challenging the world most talented drivers . You can play in online mode too, racing with up to 12 other opponents through either your PC internet connection or Xbox Live.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co861u.jpg'),(17236,'Deer Hunter 2018','2015-12-31','Point-and-click, Shooter, Simulator','Android, iOS','From the creators of Deer Hunter 2014! Return to the wild and hunt across the globe in the world’s greatest hunting experience. Pursue trophies in unique and beautiful locations that span the globe from Alaska to Zimbabwe. Hunt animals so real they nearly jump off the screen! Track down and bag the world’s most exotic and elusive game. Collect and customize your firearms with scopes, magazines, barrels, and stocks as you perfect your weapons for each hunt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fir.jpg'),(17237,'Smiley\'s Revenge','2020-10-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a post apocalyptic world, it is up to you and your allies to restore order to the world to defeat Dr. Smiley.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jjg.jpg'),(17238,'Halfway to Dawn','2023-05-09','Arcade','Playdate','A cinematic short narrative/arcade horror game for the Playdate','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co736g.jpg'),(17239,'Pirate Griddles',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17240,'Harlequin Fair: Harbour Dawn','2022-04-25','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Return to Toronto\'s sullen streets — now raked by northern winter winds — in this free expansion campaign. Come back to the realm of the masquerade dreamer: come back to the Harlequin fair.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bxd.jpg'),(17241,'Warlords I + II','2019-11-20','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Warlords 1 + Warlords II Deluxe is a compilation of two great award-winning games. Both bring different worlds to conquer, mighty armies to conquer, and enemies to vanquish.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cr1.jpg'),(17242,'The Ultimate Doom: Knee-Deep in Zdoom','2007-06-02','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Knee-Deep in ZDoom (also known by the abbreviation KDiZD) is a ten-level PK3 for The Ultimate Doom, designed for use with the ZDoom source port. The project was led by Daniel Gimmer (Tormentor667). It was first released on June 2, 2007, and at the 2007 ceremony it picked up a regular Cacoward as well as the Mordeth award. The final version of the mod was uploaded on June 16, 2012.\n\nThe PWAD is a reinterpretation of the original id Software\'s Knee-Deep in the Dead. A core concept of the mod was to expand the original levels by making full use of the power of Marisa Heit (Randi)\'s ZDoom port, which adds features that are not possible under the original Doom engine. The levels have an atmosphere and design similar to Quake 2, with large tech bases and similar ambient sounds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mw9.jpg'),(17243,'Hanjuku Hero','1988-12-02','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG)','Family Computer Disk System, Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Family Computer, Wii U','The first game in the series, released in 1988 for Famicom. It was re-released on the Virtual Console in 2007 for the Wii, in 2013 for the Nintendo 3DS and in April 2014 for the Wii U.\n\nHanjuku Hero is a real-time strategy RPG game. A king used the power of a mysterious egg to unify a continent. However, he suddenly died a day after the unification, and the countries subjected to his rule revolted. The king\'s heir, the young prince must work with those few still loyal to the king and learn to use the power of the egg to bring order back to the continent.\n\nYou have to journey throughout the continent with your allies to try and capture enemy castles. Upon reaching a castle, a battle will begin. Battles can also occur in the field. You have no control over these battles, as the stronger team usually prevails. Traditional RPG elements such as HP and money are present. The game has a humorous edge to it, featuring Japanese puns.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52np.jpg'),(17244,'Ion Fury: Aftershock','2023-10-02','Shooter, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ion Fury, the old-school first-person shooter, keeps the bullets and cybernetic body parts flying with Aftershock, a new expansion. Like classic expansions, “Aftershock” offers a brand new Arrange mode. Whether playing for the first time or revisiting Ion Fury, choose Arrange mode to experience the original game but now enhanced with new enemies, weapons and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x79.jpg'),(17245,'Parasite Eve II','1999-12-16','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PlayStation','Parasite Eve II is an action role-playing survival horror video game released exclusively for the PlayStation. The game was developed by Square and published in Japan in 1999 and in both North America and, unlike the previous game, in PAL regions in 2000. It is the sequel to Parasite Eve and the second game in the series of the same name.\n\nParasite Eve II is set several years after the events in the original game. The protagonist from the first game, Aya Brea, also features in this game as the playable character. She becomes involved with another outbreak of Mitochondrial creatures. Gameplay diverges from the previous game: battles take place in real time and the area of action is less restrictive. The approach is more typical of traditional survival horror games, although some role-playing elements are retained.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7txl.jpg'),(17246,'Terrible Clicking Game',NULL,'Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Games based on multiple interpretations of click-based input, to control the game','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17247,'Eggerland Mystery','1985-11-01','Puzzle, Strategy','MSX','You can play 100 regular stages, 10 bonus stages, and 5 special stages.\nGet the dia-framer by manipulating the hero Roro, and clear each stage by dodging the attacks of monsters, such as MEDUSA, SKULL, ARMMA, GOLL, and SNAKEY.\nThis game is an extreme challenge.\n* With Egger land Mystery, you can enjoy two different configurations;\nType A - puzzle game and\nType B - puzzle and adventure game.\n* There is a construction function which makes it possible for you to construct your own special screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wzx.jpg'),(17248,'Nimian Legends: BrightRidge','2017-11-21','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, iOS','Experience a true open world fantasy adventure. An ancient mystery has returned to the remote, wind-swept hills of BrightRidge. Only you can help two young heroes discover its secrets, in an immersive wilderness filled with rivers, waterfalls, ancient forests, and beautiful sunsets.\n\nI am a solo indie developer working on BrightRidge and it is a game from my heart. I enjoyed creating this world and I hope you enjoy exploring it:)\n\n• A true Open World - run, swim and fly anywhere\n• Shapechange into a butterfly, eagle, dragon and more\n• A beautiful natural fantasy world with touching stories and characters\n• Extensive effects, filters, and options - control time of day, and even the weather\n• Relax in Explore Mode to experience the beauty of BrightRidge without distractions\n• SpiritView let’s you observe the wildlife in its natural habitat\n• A focus on story and adventure, not violence\n• Full game: no ads or in-app purchases\n• A solo indie project, made with love\n\nAvailable for Android, IOS, and AppleTV','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uxzj2pciy6xinqlgbosn.jpg'),(17249,'Diddy Kong Racing','1997-11-21','Racing','Nintendo 64','Diddy Kong Racing is set on Timber\'s Island and revolves around Diddy Kong and his friends\' attempt to defeat the intergalactic antagonist, a wizarding pig named Wizpig, through winning a series of races. The player can take control of any of the featured characters throughout the game. Diddy Kong Racing features five worlds with four racetracks each, and the ability to drive a car, hovercraft, or pilot an aeroplane.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wgj.jpg'),(17250,'Railbreak: Neon Carnage Collection','2025-02-08','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Arcade neon destruction awaits in these survival horror nightmares!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e9g.jpg'),(17251,'Lethal Love','2023-05-26','Simulator, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Lethal Love is an immersive stealth open-world yandere game set within a sprawling school map, where players assume the role of Kyoko, a complex and deeply disturbed protagonist. In this game, players explore a meticulously crafted open world, teeming with secrets, rivalries, and forbidden desires.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17252,'Krakout challenge',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Welcome to the ultimate Challenge! Take the challenge, test your skill and nerve! Go through levels and break all barriers on your way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4535.jpg'),(17253,'Library of Blabber','2015-11-23','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Explore the Library of Blabber, an infinite structure filled with endless bookshelves of eternal nonsense!\n\nA \"little\" game focused on exploration and the fun of meaningful discoveries in the noise of random data, inspired by Jorge Luis Borges\'s story \"The Library of Babel\".','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17254,'PC Building Simulator','2019-01-29','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','PC Building Simulator lets players get to grips and experiment with building their very own gaming PC, without the associated risks and costs. With tutorials to help master the basics and an array of accurate and lifelike components that function exactly as they would in real life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p77.jpg'),(17255,'Tap Wizard 2',NULL,'Fighting, Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Choose your Spells, Perks, and Traits, then let the Wizard do all of the work in this unique Idle RPG! Tap Wizard 2 is a fusion of the Idle, Incremental, ARPG, and Twin-Stick Shooter genres, resulting in a game like no other!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4eco.jpg'),(17256,'Dracula Trilogy',NULL,'Point-and-click, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cyw.jpg'),(17257,'Hero of Sparta','2009-11-01','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Android, iOS, PlayStation Portable, Nintendo DSi, Legacy Mobile Device','Take up the fiercest challenge and fight from the Oracle\'s island to the summit of Olympus. Hero of Sparta features an innovative double-view system combining absolute action and platforming. Face legions of enemies across eight levels of action, with the most impressive mythical creatures standing in your path -- Cerberus, the Colossus, etc. Upgrade your equipment to gain the the Chronos Sword, the Medusa Shield, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2no7.jpg'),(17258,'Hot Wheels Unleashed 2: Mercedes-Benz Pack','2024-06-20','Racing','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This Mercedes-Benz Pack features the best the German company can offer: powerful and elegant racing cars, such as the 2016 Mercedes-AMG GT3, 2019 Mercedes-Benz A-Class, 1993 Mercedes-Benz E 36 AMG Estate Custom and 1971 Mercedes-Benz 300 SEL 6.8 AMG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mbx.jpg'),(17259,'She is Sexaroid','2017-07-29','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','She is Sexaroid is a VR H-game created by Damin\'s. The game centers around interacting with a girl in your room.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30xg.jpg'),(17260,'I Commissioned Some Bees','2022-05-30','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The brief was simple. Artists were commissioned to create a fantasy world, and hide as many bees as they can inside it. Now it’s your job to find them all! With 10 art pieces to choose from, and 1000+ bees, you will have a lot of searching to do.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tmx.jpg'),(17261,'Voronium - Locust Sols','2018-11-16','Strategy, Indie','Oculus VR, Windows Mixed Reality','Mash-up of tower defense and VR FPS - set in a Tech noir setting','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27g3.jpg'),(17262,'The Penumbra Collection','2007-03-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Penumbra Collection is a first person horror adventure focusing on story, immersion, and puzzle solving. You\'ll be on edge like never before as you explore bizarre and mysterious environments, the unknown waiting for you behind every corner. The world is detailed both in terms of graphical fidelity and narrative character - the Penumbra Collection is a horrific experience that will grip players from its opening thrills to it chilling denouement.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gmm.jpg'),(17263,'Barrow Hill: The Dark Path','2016-09-22','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Follow the Dark Path into a world of Druidic lore and Celtic myths. It is the Autumn Equinox on Barrow Hill, a time of great power, when the ancient standing stones are at their most powerful and dangerous. You have one night to make the offerings, follow the Dark Path and escape Barrow Hill.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pic.jpg'),(17264,'It\'s Dark','2022-07-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','There has been a containment breach in a secret facility located deep underground. Experiment E.C.H.O has escaped and is running loose. The lab has gone into shutdown mode, and it\'s dark...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hfy.jpg'),(17265,'Hyper Light Knight','2019-03-27','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cyberpunk top down shooter, but instead of shooting guns you reflect enemy bullets back at them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2izi.jpg'),(17266,'Warriors of Titus','2018-03-30','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Warriors of Titus is a first-person MOBA (Mutliplayer Online Battle Arena) for VR. Finally you can be immersed in a MOBA as you battle to reclaim Titus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lwk.jpg'),(17267,'Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 – Deluxe Edition','2025-04-24','Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Get the ultimate Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 experience with the Deluxe Edition!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gan.jpg'),(17268,'Sporty Peppers',NULL,'Sport','Sin plataforma','Fun and sport from your home! Your body is the controller, move to play alone or with friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uho.jpg'),(17269,'Blitz','2024-07-11','Platform','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blitz is a speedrun type of game that you can run around in and see if you can get the best time. Levels range from the tutorial level, to a level that is just called \"Hell\". This game can get you glued to your screen for hours.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ktt.jpg'),(17270,'Call of Duty: World at War','2008-11-11','Shooter','Legacy Mobile Device','Call of Duty: World at War (Mobile) is the mobile version of the original Call of Duty: World at War. It is exclusive to the Verizon Store and is available on non-iOS-based touchscreen mobile phones.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2adh.jpg'),(17271,'DeTechtive 2112','2025-01-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DeTechtive 2112 is a co-op, stealth/action game from an isometric perspective with a linear storyline set in a cyber universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wwy.jpg'),(17272,'Touch the Dead','2007-05-15','Sin género','Nintendo DS','Touch the Dead (titled Dead \'n\' Furious in Europe) is a rail shooter/survival horror game for the Nintendo DS developed by Dream On Studio and published by Eidos Interactive under its brand Secret Stash Games. The game\'s box art was created by artist Arthur Suydam, famous for his work on the Marvel Zombies line of comics.\n\nTouch the Dead is a rail shooter. Players use the stylus to point at oncoming zombies on the bottom screen. Pointing fires the weapon Steiner has equipped. Shots can be delivered to the head, arms, legs, and stomach.\n\nTo reload, players must simply grab a clip icon (located in the bottom right hand corner of the touch screen), and drag it to the bottom left hand corner which has an image of the \'magazine\'.\n\nThe D-pad and face buttons of the console are simply used to switch weapons. Both serve the same purpose, and work for both right-handed and left-handed players.\n\nHealth and ammunition can be recovered by shooting crates and cabinets. The player also has the option of shooting switches to open doors and choose a left or right path when a fork appears. Either path chosen will still yield the same bonuses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40ac.jpg'),(17273,'Gizoku Tantei Nosuri','2022-12-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Gizoku Tantei Nosuri is a visual novel developed and published by Aquaplus. A spin-off of the Utawarerumono series, the game stars Nosuri and a reluctant Haku as they investigate evils threatening the Imperial Capital of Yamato.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u6q.jpg'),(17274,'Chuck Quizmo\'s Quiz','2000-12-31','Quiz/Trivia','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pft.jpg'),(17275,'Frank Thomas Big Hurt Baseball','1995-12-31','Sport','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Nintendo 64, DOS, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Baseball player Frank Thomas licensed one of the first baseball games to use motion-captured 3D graphics and multiple camera angles. 28 stadia have been rendered in 3D, and each has its own visible and significant differences.\n\nThere are 6 distinct game modes, allowing for single exhibition matches as well as full seasons on the playoffs. There is also a Home Run Derby mode, allowing the player to pelt the ball out of the ground for points.\n\nYou can choose pitchers and batters, based on their statistics and form. Bowling options are set to define the delivery, with fastballs and curveballs as well as more precise setting of pace and height. Fielding is optional - it\'s best to leave this to the computer at first You can always alter the infield and outfield depth and shift.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vmg.jpg'),(17276,'Destiny 2: Heresy - Act 3','2025-04-01','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ip4.jpg'),(17277,'Assassin\'s Creed: Anthology','2012-12-30','Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Assassin\'s Creed Anthology is a compilation of all the games in the Assassin\'s Creed series that were previously released on home consoles:\n\n- Assassin\'s Creed\n- Assassin\'s Creed II (Game of the Year Edition)\n- Assassin\'s Creed: Brotherhood\n- Assassin\'s Creed: Revelations\n- Assassin\'s Creed III\n\nThey come bundled with a steelbook, five lithographs (one for each game), all the DLC available as redeemable codes (apart from Assassin\'s Creed II, which bonus content is on disc) and a season pass for the Assassin\'s Creed III DLC. The Anthology was exclusive to Europe, Middle East, Africa and Australia territories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ip6.jpg'),(17278,'Hot Shot Burn','2020-10-01','Sport, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Hot Shot Burn is the hilariously violent arena party brawler that lets you compete in the universe\'s ultimate televised blood sport. It\'s fast-paced, competitive local or online slaughter for 2-4 players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1peb.jpg'),(17279,'Sudd City Adventures','2020-05-22','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Silvia is an FBI agent in charge of superhero relations in Sudd City and while that might sound glamorous it often involves just being organized enough to prevent some interesting characters from falling apart. \n \nParticipate in the usually unseen parts of the lives of super heroes in this 2D lighthearted short narrative adventure. \n \nStory \nPlay as a special agent with friends who happen to be superheroes experiencing minor inconveniences at their headquarters while not fighting crime. Their Very Important Problems include a missing skull ring, escaped reptiles, couch entrapment, accidentally creating sentient robots, and more. \n \n \nShe\'ll need to interrogate her friendly suspects and investigate all the clues as she tries to get to the bottom of their personal crisis so she can go home. \n \nFeatures \n2D Hand Drawn Art \nPoint, Clicking, and Judging \nA team of interesting heroes and animals to interact with','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2paj.jpg'),(17280,'Vestaria Saga II: The Sacred Sword of Silvanister','2022-07-28','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Vestaria Saga II continues the adventures of Zade, bringing the tales of him and his companions to a thrilling, satisfying end. They will encounter allies both new and old while uncovering more mysteries behind the vile Margulites and their plan to plunge Vestaria into a new age of darkness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qle.jpg'),(17281,'Technolympus','2021-04-08','Adventure','Web browser','Technolympus is an interactive fiction game created in Unity with YarnSpinner 2.1.\n\nWhen the lights go down in the city of Dion, the hunt begins. While the city\'s factions race to acquire the coveted HYDR4 drive, three agents become fated to cross paths. Play as the Selenean Hunter, and join the Chariot Operative or the Oneirunner, as you gun for the glory of your organization!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rei.jpg'),(17282,'Pokémon Alpha Sapphire','2014-11-21','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','During your adventure, you will battle Team Magma in Pokémon Omega Ruby and Team Aqua in Pokémon Alpha Sapphire. Team Magma seeks to increase the land, while Team Aqua wishes to increase the seas. In order to bring about these grand plans, each will turn to the power of a Legendary Pokémon: Groudon or Kyogre. Team Magma pursues Groudon, while Team Aqua goes after Kyogre. What could be driving them to such lengths?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56ef.jpg'),(17283,'Oppidum','2025-12-31','Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Face the challenges of Oppidum, a cooperative multiplayer adventure. Collaborate, craft, fight, and dive into a captivating story to uncover a powerful truth. A world hanging by a thread needs your help – will you answer the call?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7msc.jpg'),(17284,'Winning Post','1993-09-17','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PC-9800 Series, Sharp X68000, PC (Microsoft Windows), 3DO Interactive Multiplayer, FM Towns, Sega Saturn, PlayStation, Sega CD, Game Boy Advance, Super Famicom','Winning Post lets the player take control of a stable of horse, breeding and training them for the ultimate goal, to win the French Grand Prix.\n\nThe player can hire breeders, trainers and jockeys and race in over 240 different races to earn more money to buy even better personnel and breed faster and stronger horses as well as keeping their horses healthy. Players can also bet on races as well.\n\nThe gameplay consists of choosing options before races, such as choosing which horses to train and what regiment they undertake, view stats, hire personnel and place bets. However the player has no controls over races and cannot participate and only view as a spectator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40bp.jpg'),(17285,'Cook to the Beat','2019-09-01','Music, Indie','Android, iOS','Cook to the Beat is a culinary-themed rhythm game where you tap to the music to create a variety of dishes each with it\'s own original soundtrack. Chop, season and tenderize to the rhythm to build up your combo and make the whole kitchen into a dance party! (Disco Ball Included) \n \nCollect and customize your very own animal chefs with wacky Aprons and Hats! \n \nMaster the dishes and rise through the chef ranks to become the very best Chef like no one ever was!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2epa.jpg'),(17286,'Wandersong','2019-12-06','Music, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Wandersong takes you on a whimsical, musical journey across the globe. Eons ago, the goddess Eya put the universe into motion with her music--now, as she does every epoch or so, she\'s going to sing a new song and reset existence. You play as a lowly bard tasked with finding the pieces of a mysterious melody called the Earthsong, which is said to be able to preserve the planet. Use your singing to help characters, solve puzzles, and save the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1oey.jpg'),(17287,'Patapon Remastered','2017-06-15','Music, Platform, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4','Patapon is an innovative, rhythm-based 2D platform/action game marching to PlayStation 4 with revitalized graphics output in 4K resolution and 1080p. An iconic PlayStation game, players are tasked with leading the colorful Patapons, a brave and noble tribe, through a series of epic battles against opposing armies and gigantic monsters. In a distinct gameplay twist, action and rhythm are intertwined as players utilize drumbeats to march, attack, and defend, ultimately leading the Patapon tribe to victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dt2.jpg'),(17288,'Sakura Taisen','2000-05-25','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Dreamcast','Set in a fictionalized version of 1923 in the Taishō era, the game follows the exploits of the Imperial Combat Revue, a military unit dedicated to fighting supernatural threats against Tokyo while maintaining their cover as a theater troupe. Imperial Japanese Navy Ensign, Ichiro Ogami, is assigned as leader of its all-female Flower Division, a group of women with magical abilities that defend Tokyo against demon attacks using steam-powered armor called Koubu. He becomes embroiled in both the group\'s latest conflict with the Hive of Darkness and the personal lives of its members.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nbf.jpg'),(17289,'The Swords','2016-02-08','Sin género','iOS','The Swords is an action game of wuxia (ancient martial art). It tells the story of a sword master\'s life and his deep immersion in the art of swords. Amidst the ink wash painting is the light and shade of swords, which embodies the fighting and pursuit of a sword master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86rt.jpg'),(17290,'Into the Dark','2014-05-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Expect the ultimate B-Movie Trash experience!\nDon´t even dare to hope for state-of the art graphics, a proper balancing, professional voice acting or breathtaking script-writing. This here is 100% pure trash, an adventure / shooter hybrid with gazillions of bad jokes, dozens of pop culture references and a hidden, dense net of subversive, intelligent messages related to post-WWII-politics. Oh yes, you need a basic knowledge of pop culture to enjoy the game, and quite some education on politics to really love it, but who cares?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86d8.jpg'),(17291,'Phantom Brave: The Lost Hero - The Liar and the Lost','2025-03-06','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17292,'Project to Escape',NULL,'Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Project to escape is suitable for you to play with friends! This is a multiplayer game with up to 10 players support. In this game, your goal is to escape the area but someone will try to prevent your escape so, be careful!. As for now, we will start with launching the first episode with a unique mechanics that comes with it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yd2.jpg'),(17293,'Dig A Hole Multiplayer',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Dig a Hole: Multiplayer Edition – where digging isn’t just a job, it’s an adventure!\n\nGrab your tools and start excavating solo or with friends. As you dig deeper, you’ll uncover valuable resources, rare artifacts, and mysterious secrets hidden underground. Sell your findings, upgrade your equipment, and out-dig your competition.\n\nWith no limits and no rules, the only question is: how deep will you go?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ga5.jpg'),(17294,'Aliens: Fireteam Elite - Deluxe Edition','2021-08-24','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Deluxe Edition includes the Endeavor Pass + Endeavor Veteran Pack, essentially granting players additional customization options and all future DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h6v.jpg'),(17295,'Chronicles of Galdurvale','2021-09-22','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Guide Amelia Moonglow, a wide-eyed hunter with incredible power, as she journeys from Middleland to the floating isles of Sky World. Explore the lands of Galdurvale, utilizing her mystical armband to harness the elements and decimate her foes. Adventure and excitement await!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lmg.jpg'),(17296,'Robot Island','2020-06-16','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play as a robot flight attendant named Nim! Unfortunately, people aren\'t taking space vacations these days, so it\'s just you and the captain. The two of you talk about normal stuff, and sometimes he asks you to get him coffee or clean... which is what you were built for!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wk6.jpg'),(17297,'The First Odyssey','2022-06-14','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Face an Odyssey built on violence, horror, puzzles, challenges and human cynicism. Experience a truly atmospheric and realistic survival horror experience in a dystopian future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5n2g.jpg'),(17298,'Alien Destroyer','2021-07-30','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Alien robots are attacking. The last piece of land is rapidly collapsing. Destroy all enemies and survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4d2a.jpg'),(17299,'King\'s Quest 4+5+6','2010-02-25','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This collection includes:\n\n- King\'s Quest IV: The Perils of Rosella\n- King\'s Quest V: Absence Makes the Heart Go Yonder!\n- King\'s Quest VI: Heir Today, Gone Tomorrow','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gs9.jpg'),(17300,'Exiled','2024-01-18','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Charlotte is missing. Decode an ancient language, investigate a mystery, and stay away from ancient monsters in this compact puzzle thriller.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7naq.jpg'),(17301,'Bonkies','2018-09-10','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Bonkies is a couch co-op construction game in space, starring astronaut monkeys equipped with jet-packs and powerful robot arms. You and your friends must cooperate to build elaborate construction projects, ensuring humanity\'s future in space. Good luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2onf.jpg'),(17302,'Bleeding Border','2015-11-09','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bleeding Border is a first person 3d survival horror game in which the player must escape through the top of a monster infested building using his own blood as the only defense mechanism.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4o92.jpg'),(17303,'Uh Oh Bartender','2019-07-25','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Uh Oh Bartender, you take the role of a bartender at Cypher\'s, the hottest new bar and grill. However, the drinks served at Cypher\'s aren\'t just drinks, they are also puzzles! In order to serve these drinks, you will have to decipher their ingredients based on rules found inside the procedurally generated names!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pb3.jpg'),(17304,'Fallout 4: Automatron','2016-03-22','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The mysterious Mechanist has unleashed a horde of evil robots into the Commonwealth, including the devious Robobrain. Hunt them down and harvest their parts to build and mod your own custom robot companions. Choose from hundreds of mods; mixing limbs, armor, abilities, and weapons like the all-new lightning chain gun. Even customize their paint schemes and choose their voices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co691n.jpg'),(17305,'The Lost Cave of the Ozarks','2019-10-28','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Discover The Lost Cave of the Ozarks! As The Boy in the 1880s, you\'ll need your trusty lantern, wits, and imagination to navigate, solve puzzles, and confront the dangers lurking in the depths of the cave... or perhaps it\'s just your mind. Then, revisit the cave in present day to explore!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s9s.jpg'),(17306,'Nobunaga\'s Ambition: Haouden with Power Up Kit','2017-06-27','Strategy','PC-9800 Series, PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"NOBUNAGA’S AMBITION: Haouden with Power Up Kit\" is an expanded version of \"NOBUNAGA\'S AMBITION: Haouden,\" which was released in 1992 as the 5th game in the series.\nUp to now in the series, warfare was focused on whole countries. Haouden changes that focus towards individual castles. Also, a Daimyo controls their officers through giving out rewards based on their achievements as they fight for total control of the Warring States.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17307,'SA-Anarchy','2018-08-05','Fighting, Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Home-made simple survival FPS. Survive as long as possible, with incoming waves of Undead Knights that get faster and faster. The game includes Buyable Wall-Weapons, Upgrade Machine, Ammo Box, and so much more. Experience it all.\n\nControls are as follows: W,S,A,D to move around. Mouse to look around. F to turn on and off flashlight. E to buy stuff. R to reload. Left-Click to shoot. 1, 2 to switch weapons.\n\nPS. Right now I\'m looking for feedback to see where I can Improve, so any comments are greatly appreciated, even if it\'s just \" Fun Game\". Thank You!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/l6t6biffo4k51eesrwil.jpg'),(17308,'Cloudbuilt: Through the Fog','2014-08-07','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This first DLC pack for Cloudbuilt adds a new themed area to the world (Fog) and introduces five unique levels that\'ll really test your skills! These new stages aren\'t just fun for experienced players, but also provide new players with an opportunity to experience the platforming aspect of the game on its own before taking on enemies. With the fog closing in and your visibility clouded, have you got what it takes to make it to the exit? \n \nPlease note: in order for the Fog area to unlock, players must have first completed the \'Initial Entry\' tutorial stage.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17309,'Dream Garden','2025-12-31','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dream Garden is a simulation game about building tiny cute garden dioramas. A large selection of tools, plants, decorations and customization awaits you. Try all of them and create your dream garden.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o3i.jpg'),(17310,'Cinema Tycoon 2: Movie Mania','2008-09-22','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cinema Tycoon 2: Movie Mania is a cinema simulator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84nk.jpg'),(17311,'Death Cathedral',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Death Cathedral is a very challenging action RPG with tons of strategy elements. You\'ll need to build a powerful army of the living dead with enemies\' flesh and bones within 15 days to kill the devil lurking in the deep end of the cathedral.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bcf.jpg'),(17312,'Prodigy Tactics','2018-11-08','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter the arena with a team of heroes. Fight hand to hand with Guardians and vanquish your opponents in this tactical, turn-based game - featuring a range of characters with a unique abilities on a mission to restore the peace in a fantastic world of Thasys.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zdp.jpg'),(17313,'Shall we date?: Angel or Devil','2013-12-18','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','A otome game by NTT Solmare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5r8q.jpg'),(17314,'The Surge 2: Premium Edition','2020-01-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Welcome to Jericho City.\n\nExplore the devastated metropolis and fight its numerous, ferocious threats in unforgiving combat. Slash and tear equipment from foes utilizing The Surge 2\'s dynamic Limb Targeting System.\n\nThe Surge 2 - Premium Edition contains the full game, and all the Season Pass content. This includes the story-focused expansion The Kraken, and all the new weapons and armor sets DLCs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xt2.jpg'),(17315,'Purgatory: War of the Damned','2015-02-11','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Launching on Early Access, Purgatory: War of the Damned is a fast-paced multiplayer FPS game Use a multitude of spells with a variety of effects to destroy your enemies.\n\nParticipate in duels, team battles or free-for-alls in the mysterious realm of purgatory, where all arenas have a history, which chains them to this world.\n\nTake on the role of souls cast into purgatory and wage eternal battle to absorb the souls of the fallen, thus increasing power and dominance.\n\nSpells are categorised into \'Schools\' of magic - Arcane, Elemental, Light and Dark.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/saphdi9jcko055bd4m4l.jpg'),(17316,'World Bus Driving Simulator',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg');
INSERT INTO `games` VALUES (17317,'Phineas and Ferb: New Inventions','2015-01-02','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','There is no time to get bored on holidays! Half-brothers Phineas and Ferb always know how to entertain themselves. They can build an entertainment park in their backyard or think up something very special… But their elder sister Candace is not very happy of their tricks. She is always ready to bust the brothers and tell their mother on them. And Phineas has a pet platypus called Perry who has a secret of his own. He just pretends to be a silly amenable pet but in fact lives a double life as a secret agent codenamed P battling the malicious scientist Dr. Doofenshmirtz… On the whole, they all have a lot to worry about!\n\nThis time Phineas and Ferb decide not to fritter away their energy. They are going to build the coolest rollercoaster in their backyard! But to assemble such an enormous construction they need a good drawing and a lot of different parts which are not so easy to find. And tattletale Candace is up to stick her nose where she doesn’t belong… And where is Perry the Platypus? He is on a secret mission again! Brave Agent P is on his way to save the town from another wicked design of Dr. Doofenshmirtz. Someone must help him! And, of course, one shouldn’t forget about building the rollercoaster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dsz.jpg'),(17318,'Totally Accurate Holiday Bowling','2021-12-14','Sport','Web browser','A browser based holiday themed bowling game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e4c.jpg'),(17319,'Zee.End','2021-09-14','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A secret organization makes a critical mistake in the development of chemical weapons. As a result, the entire population of the Montib island is infected with an unknown virus. You need to survive among zombies on a huge 20x20 km map.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co59cm.jpg'),(17320,'Boku ha Kimi dake wo Mitsumeru: I Gaze at Only You','2015-11-27','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The protagonist Sahara Takumi was feared as the leader of the juvenile gangster group “Sabre-tooth Tiger”. Some people in the underworld even called him devil’s incarnate, and so far the police has been unable to capture him.\n\nThen suddenly two of his best friends are killed by an assassin employed by the mafia. The event marked the downfall of Sabre-tooth Tiger and Takumi made sure he stayed out of public attention. Despite even all that he receives a request to be the bodyguard for a mysterious diva named Towa. Seeking revenge for his comrades and a way to rise up from this nightmare, the protagonist accepts the job and stands up to act as Towa’s shield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jeb.jpg'),(17321,'Echo Generation','2021-10-21','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Echo Generation is a turn-based adventure game that follows a gang of kids through otherworldly adventures as they investigate mysterious and supernatural events in their hometown that will change the course of their lives forever.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e55.jpg'),(17322,'Mosaic Hearts','2021-09-24','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','EVERY enemy is a (potential) new best friend!\nFight each boss, gain them as an ally, explore, and platform your way through each level. Build a strong group that can take down the final boss, Noel Weisburg.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vwm.jpg'),(17323,'Star Renegades: Deluxe Edition','2020-09-08','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','For those who can’t get enough Star Renegades in their life, we are offering the DELUXE EDITION which includes the game, original OST and 100 full-colour page art book.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cqc.jpg'),(17324,'Oblivion\'s Edge','2016-11-10','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You are the last pilot on Earth, tasked with slowing down the invasion and giving survivors enough time to escape. If you can hold back the waves long enough, you may have a shot at destroying the massive mothership and saving the Earth. Oblivion\'s Edge is an arcade and bullet hell inspired twin stick shooter with multiple game modes and difficulty levels.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17325,'Quartet','1987-12-31','Shooter, Platform, Arcade','Arcade, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC, Sega Master System/Mark III','A platform shoot-em-up hybrid from Sega for one to four players, selected from either Joe (yellow), Mary (red), Lee (blue) and Edgar (green). The action takes place over a number of sideways scrolling levels, the bulk of which consist of straightforward platform action. On some levels, however, there are jet packs for the players to collect, and the gameplay\'s emphasis switched to that of a standard, sideways scrolling shoot-em-up.\n\nThe object of the game is to destroy an army of robots that have taken over an Earth colony satellite station. Each level has a boss character that must be destroyed. Upon its death it releases a door key that must be used to exit the level. Weapon and character power-ups can be collected to aid players in their task.\n\nDue to its potential for four-player shoot-em-up gameplay, Quartet\'s gameplay feels vaguely similar to (though by no means as accomplished as) Atari\'s 1985 classic, \"Gauntlet\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e95.jpg'),(17326,'Tesla vs. Lovecraft','2018-03-16','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Tesla vs. Lovecraft is an intense top-down twin stick arena shooter. Play as the enigmatic inventor Nikola Tesla harnessing the static energy to power up Tesla-Mech and give the lovecraftian nightmares a lesson in horror!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27ab.jpg'),(17327,'One Life: Parkour Project','2023-07-27','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Are you looking for a REAL parkour game but haven\'t found anything? One Life - Parkour Project is the one for you! Relax, headphones up, customize your character and do parkour... EVERYWHERE!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wce.jpg'),(17328,'Sid Meier\'s Starships','2015-03-12','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Sid Meier’s Starships challenges players to build a planetary federation by exploring the galaxy, expanding its influence and domain, researching futuristic technologies and engaging in deep, turn-based tactical space combat with an armada of uniquely customizable starships. Each new campaign will feature its own distinctive galactic strategy map of worlds with dynamically generated tactical combat missions that will enhance the game’s replay value. In addition, Sid Meier’s Civilization: Beyond Earth fans who purchase Sid Meier’s Starships will uncover cross-connectivity with the two games such that will enhance and expand the depth of both game experiences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rax.jpg'),(17329,'Apex Legends: PlayStation Plus Play Pack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95tt.jpg'),(17330,'Goonya Monster: Additional Character (Buster) - Slug','2023-04-30','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Additional Character for \"Goonya Monster\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rzy.jpg'),(17331,'Taikodom','2011-06-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Humanity is awakened in the year 2234, inhabited by a new space civilization. Taikodom is a Massive Multiplayer Online where players explore the farthest reaches of space by boarding starships, collecting raw materials, manufacturing crafts, and equipment. The universe is at war, it is your duty to save the universe from economic domination from fighting corporations and warring factions. The MMO Taikodom, launched in 2008, is no longer available as of May 2015.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s2j.jpg'),(17332,'Final Fantasy XI R',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Legacy Mobile Device','Final Fantasy XI R was a remake of the 2002 MMORPG Final Fantasy XI for mobile devices.\nOriginally announced in 2015, its release window of 2016 had long come and gone, and with no word on the title\'s development. It continued to be listed under Nexon\'s upcoming games for years, but no news was heard on its development aside from images leaked in 2018.\n\nIn late 2020, rumours circulated that it had been cancelled, and it disappeared from Nexon\'s upcoming games list.\nAn official announcement was made in early 2021 that the project had been shelved. According to IGN\'s article, Nexon and Square Enix \"decided the mobile version didn\'t meet the creative standards Final Fantasy fans have come to expect from the series\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tpl.jpg'),(17333,'Astalon: Tears of the Earth','2021-06-03','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Three explorers wander through a post-apocalyptic desert to find a way to save the people in their village. A dark, twisted tower has been pushed up from the depths of the Earth... but does it hold the answers they seek?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m6k.jpg'),(17334,'Super Paper Mario','2007-04-09','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Wii, Wii U','The newest chapter of the Paper Mario story isn\'t just out of this world... it\'s out of this dimension. What at first glance appears to be a 2D side-scroller ripped straight from the stylized pages of the Paper Mario universe soon turns into a hilarious dimension-shifting platformer possible only on Wii.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21rp.jpg'),(17335,'Cities in Motion Collection','2011-11-18','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nmh.jpg'),(17336,'Darkest Dungeon: The Crimson Court','2018-03-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Vita, Nintendo Switch','Darkest Dungeon: The Crimson Court is the first expansion for the award-winning grim and gothic RPG by Red Hook Studios. Crimson Court is a parallel campaign experienced alongside the main Darkest Dungeon content that will provide you with new challenges and variation at every difficulty level. The narrative grounding sheds some light on the Ancestor’s early days, and will be presented in the same style of cut-scenes you’ve seen elsewhere in the game. The DLC is designed to be played alongside an existing campaign, or as a brand new one–your choice! The events and features will unlock over the course of play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84k1.jpg'),(17337,'Star Wars Battlefront: Rogue One - Scarif','2016-12-06','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Star Wars Battlefront: Rogue One - Scarif is the fourth and final digital expansion pack as part of the Star Wars Battlefront Season Pass.\n\nExperience all-new epic battles and content inspired by the upcoming film, Rogue One: A Star Wars Story.\n\nTouch down from space onto the planet of Scarif. Fight across the beaches and jungle, with heroine Jyn Erso and the cruel but brilliant director of Advanced Weapons Research, Orson Krennic, as two new playable heroes. Blast opponents in a brand new multi-stage Infiltration mode, use the new A180 and DT-29 blasters and try out the new Sonic Imploder star card. Band together on the battlefront for an epic Star Wars adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h6u.jpg'),(17338,'Warplanes: WW1 Sky Aces','2020-12-11','Shooter, Simulator, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Be a pioneer of aerial warfare in Warplanes: WW1 Sky Aces. Fight above the battlefields of World War I and become the ultimate Sky Ace!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lvi.jpg'),(17339,'Gabibbo Massacre','2024-09-27','Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Indie horror game made as a parody of the popular italian mascotte \"Gabibbo\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cp6.jpg'),(17340,'Galactic Dan',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17341,'Keep it Live','2022-04-08','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Keep-it-Live is a small, singleplayer high-score game in which you assume the role of a live stream chat moderator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ht2.jpg'),(17342,'Solar Scion','2021-06-07','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A top-down sci-fi fantasy shooter with strategy, building and resource management. Colonize, build stations and recruit allies as you fly your ship through limbo!\n\nIn Solar Scion you collect resources to build up your planets, stations and AI-controlled ships while exploring the campaign map. Capture control points, produce and trade power-ups, upgrade your allies and unlock new abilities as you recover your lost power. Will you use diplomacy or devastation? Choose your destiny!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2spc.jpg'),(17343,'Papetura: Craft Edition','2024-11-05','Point-and-click, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','One day Pape escapes from a flowery prison and finds little Tura, a magical being that he’ll take care of. Together they will have to face dark and flaming monsters which will try to burn down their beloved paper world.\n\nPapetura is a handcrafted puzzle adventure game made entirely out of paper.\n\nAlong with atmospheric music made by Floex, Tomas Dvorak, it creates a mysterious and unique paper world shrouded in shadow and light.\n\nEverything is made out of paper, from tiny insects, strange creatures and monsters to truly magical locations.\n\nIncludes Exclusive Case, Downloadable Soundtrack, Art book and Base Game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95ek.jpg'),(17344,'Power Rangers Megaforce','2013-11-05','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','For as long as evil has threatened the Earth, there have been teams of Power Rangers sworn to protect it. The Power Rangers Megaforce are the planet\'s newest defenders. For the first time, experience the next chapter in the Power Rangers legacy in 3‐D! Plus power up your rangers with the all‐new card scanning feature!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42bi.jpg'),(17345,'Streets of Rage 2: Robotnik Wars','2020-12-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hxw.jpg'),(17346,'Tales of Valoris: Swallow\'s Defenders','2025-01-27','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Swallow’s Keep is a place of great prosperity; however, not all lands share in its wealth, and it has caught the eye of ambitious adversaries. Can you defend your home against the bandits?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cw1.jpg'),(17347,'Little Kong: Jungle Fun - Extended Edition','2023-01-09','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Kong got himself dirty while enjoying a mango. His mom tries to force him to bathe but he\'s got other plans... That is to run away as far as possible. This Bundle includes the Pink Fur DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60y3.jpg'),(17348,'Summer Games Beach Volley','2024-07-05','Sport','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dive into the heart of the Summer Games Tournament with this Beach Volley game\nExperience the thrill of competition as you vie for the coveted gold medal in intense beach volleyball matches.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kxt.jpg'),(17349,'Hack Match','2021-05-08','Puzzle','Nintendo Entertainment System','The standalone NES port of the hacking action puzzle minigame from the Zachtronics Game EXAPUNKS.\n\nThe game plays a lot like Magical Drop or Money Puzzle Exchanger. Where you must rearrange the tiles to match four of a kinda and create a chain reaction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30v0.jpg'),(17350,'Ninja Dude vs. Zombies','2016-06-01','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Tap \'n\' slash as many zombies as you can using ninja shurikens and survive a zombie invasion in this endless clicker game! Prove you’re a true DUDE!\n\nA brave ninja is trapped on a tower surrounded by hordes of bloody zombies. His only chance of surviving this zombie invasion is with the help of his thick-and-thin shurikens.\n\nThe player’s main goal is to kill off as many zombies as possible by tapping on both sides of the screen.\n\nNinja Dude vs Zombies stand-out features:\n\n● ENDLESS TAP\'EM\'ALL ACTION – dive right into smooth, nonintrusive hard-core action. Easy to start, hard to get unhooked;\n● CUTE NINJAS - unlock more than 100 cute ninja heroes each with their own features and settings;\n● SIMPLE & EASY CONTROLS;\n● TRICKY GAMEPLAY – its fast-paced gameplay might seem easy at first, but it gets trickier as you go along;\n● SHARE WITH FRIENDS - share a juicy zombie kill or record with your friends;\n● DAILY MISSIONS - complete various daily missions and earn gold coins.\n\nIf you happen to notice any errors or bugs in the game, please don’t hesitate to contact us and let us know: .','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bjucvojzdsaosj211fo6.jpg'),(17351,'A Purr Tale','2014-02-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Purr Tale, a 20 minutes game where you live the life of a little cat at his home. Soon you realize that everything wasn\'t as well as he thought.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w4w.jpg'),(17352,'Galaxy on Fire 3: Manticore','2018-04-19','Shooter','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','Experience intense dogfights and perform break-neck maneuvers in Galaxy on Fire 3 – Manticore, the new benchmark for sci-fi shooters on smartphones and tablets. Taking place in a far-off patch of space called the Neox Sector, the third installment of the legendary GOF saga puts you in the role of an up-and-coming bounty hunter going after the galaxy’s most wanted criminals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25ny.jpg'),(17353,'The Outlived',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17354,'Smash Remix','2019-05-13','Fighting','Nintendo 64','Smash Remix is a hack for Super Smash Bros. (Nintendo 64) with new content such as many new characters, stages and soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pw7.jpg'),(17355,'Wargroove: Double Trouble','2020-08-04','Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Team up and lead the Outlaw faction to strategic victory, with new criminal Commanders in the new free DLC, Wargroove: Double Trouble!\n\nWargroove: Double Trouble adds a brand new co-op enabled campaign story which introduces Outlaw Commanders; the mighty Wulfar, troublemaker twins Errol and Orla, as well as the maleficent Vesper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z8p.jpg'),(17356,'Anchors','2021-11-18','Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Anchors is the result of a decade of self examination and processing of a very real period of my life where I was passively suicidal. This project is me coming to terms with those feelings and finally expressing them in a constructive way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kko.jpg'),(17357,'Black Death Interactive','2024-09-01','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','iOS','Travel back to 14th century Venice during history\'s deadliest pandemic. This interactive historical narrative puts you in the shoes of Giana, a young baker\'s daughter, as you face impossible choices in a city gripped by plague.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17358,'Late Laundry','2024-07-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s late at night, you just want to do your laundry but there\'s no water at home due to pipe burst so you venture out and find this 24 hour laundry place, you wont like what happens there...\n\nIn this game you will get to experience what happened to the player that you are playing as, the horrific events this place has to offer such as doing laundry late at night in a mysterious area, that definitely doesn\'t have any scary events or monster running around.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8pv8.jpg'),(17359,'Anlife: Motion-Learning Life Evolution',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Intervene in the evolution of virtual lifeforms that learn to move in a world powered by a physics engine. This world already features built-in mechanisms like heredity and natural selection. The player acts as a creator, manipulating these natural processes to help lifeforms learn and evolve.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ytx.jpg'),(17360,'Fantasy Blacksmith Shop Simulator','2023-12-29','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Step into the enchanting world of \'Fantasy Blacksmith,\' where hammers clang, furnaces roar, and raw materials transform into awe-inspiring arms. Forge your destiny today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c1r.jpg'),(17361,'Tap Master: Mondrian','2014-06-28','Puzzle','Windows Phone, Android, iOS','Can you follow the rule?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9go1.jpg'),(17362,'UBoat','2019-04-30','Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','UBOAT is a simulator of a submarine from WWII era. It is a survival sandbox with crew management mechanics while its primary theme is life of German sailors. The boat is their home, but it can become their grave at any time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co269d.jpg'),(17363,'The Biba Collection',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17364,'Sinking Iron','2023-05-27','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A strong submarine earthquake caught the attention of an amateur diver and his apprentice.\n\nThey were close by when the incident happened and decided to investigate before officials arrived.\n\nYou are the apprentice. Good luck.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6k5c.jpg'),(17365,'Milo\'s Astro Lanes','1998-11-24','Simulator, Sport','Nintendo 64','Have you ever bowled against your buddies with a Nuclear Ball on a lane constructed out of an alien\'s tongue? Probably not. But now you can, as you bowl for the perfect game in Milo\'s Astro Lanes, the wackiest, most spaced-out bowling blast ever! Use awesome power-ups like the devastating Pea Ball, toxic Cosmic Slime and mighty White Dwarf to thwart your opponents or keep them from stopping you. This insane game is what the future of bowling is all about!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47sq.jpg'),(17366,'A Fox Tale',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A Fox Tale is a beautiful pixel art platforming adventure. As our four legged protagonist Eva, you are forced to take an unexpected journey. Explore and enjoy a world of wonder and horror, as you pass through your ever changing surroundings. However, the very nature of foxes means Eva is always cautious and this fox in particular has every reason to be...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2obf.jpg'),(17367,'Quarth','1990-04-13','Shooter, Puzzle','Family Computer','Famicom port of Block Hole.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96d9.jpg'),(17368,'Kyra\'s Light',NULL,'Fighting, Platform, Arcade','Android, iOS','Cleanse the corrupted land, bring back Kyra\'s Light...\n\nJump from tile to tile and journey across various biomes filled with traps and enemies. Reach as far as you can in a procedurally generated world. The road is endless, test your skills and adapt new strategies with various weapons and new characters. Cleanse every biome and upgrade them to dive deeper towards the source of the corruption.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99fp.jpg'),(17369,'Echoed Memories','2021-11-05','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sequel to \"Gaia\'s Melody: Echoed Melodies.\" Echoed Memories is a dark psychological love story, with character development, understanding and acceptance at its core. It holds a balance of bright and cheerful to emotional and depressing, and follows the protagonists as they come to terms with their traumas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ov3.jpg'),(17370,'Galactic Civilizations III: Heroes of Star Control - Origins','2018-11-12','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Tywom, Mu\'Kay, Mowlings and other unique alien species from the Star Control: Origins universe have come to Galactic Civilizations III! Each alien race includes a unique leader, ship designs, traits, music, and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dy6.jpg'),(17371,'Fairyside','2022-11-01','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A dark fantasy roguelike shoot-em-up with lots of bullet hell featuring cute pixel art, visual novel interludes, and story-driven gameplay. Join Shirley in her journey to learn magic and survive Redwood Academy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pxz.jpg'),(17372,'Santa','2024-12-18','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 1-4 player co-op Christmas horror game. You have 3 days to deliver the presents and save Christmas, or die trying.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91b1.jpg'),(17373,'The Lonely Helmet','2022-06-09','Platform, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In a galaxy far far away, there was a collection of helmets. Some were stronger than others, some were smaller and some were bigger, but all helmets had a purpose - to protect their space-human and allow them to breath outside of the Universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49kc.jpg'),(17374,'Dance Dance Revolution','1999-04-10','Music, Simulator','Arcade, PlayStation','Dance Dance Revolution (ダンスダンスレボリューション Dansu Dansu Reboryūshon?), abbreviated DDR and also known as Dancing Stage in earlier games in Europe and Australasia, and some other games in Japan, is a music video game series produced by Konami. Introduced in Japan in 1998 as part of the Bemani series, and released in North America and Europe in 1999, Dance Dance Revolution is the pioneering series of the rhythm and dance genre in video games. Players stand on a \"dance platform\" or stage and hit colored arrows laid out in a cross with their feet to musical and visual cues. Players are judged by how well they time their dance to the patterns presented to them and are allowed to choose more music to play to if they receive a passing score.\n\nDance Dance Revolution has been given much critical acclaim for its originality and stamina in the video game market. There have been dozens of arcade-based releases across several countries and hundreds of home video game console releases, promoting a music library of original songs produced by Konami\'s in-house artists and an eclectic set of licensed music from many different genres. The DDR series has inspired similar games such as Pump It Up by Andamiro and In the Groove by Roxor','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2puf.jpg'),(17375,'Wargame: Red Dragon - Nation Pack: South Africa','2021-09-30','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get back into the fight with South Africa\'s unique Cold War arsenal. Discover nearly 90 new units - all historically accurate and fully voiced - from Bokkop infantry to Buffel APCs, G6 Renoster wheeled artillery, and Rooivalk attack helicopters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zcc.jpg'),(17376,'Toss the Turtle','2009-09-09','Arcade','Web browser','Toss the Turtle is a Flash-based game, in which the player has to launch a turtle from a canon and make it travel as much distance as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qk1.jpg'),(17377,'Bouncer',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Android','You are a ball and your target is to make the highest score you can,  \ncoming to the top of the standings! \nHow to play? \nIn the game you have to build a blocks configuration by placing them in the various boxes. Every block have its own properties and its cost, think about how to spend your in-game money! \nThe more score you make the more gears you earn, with wich you can buy extra things, like Skins, Effects and Upgrades!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dsz6vkuurmwyrg02thbe.jpg'),(17378,'Wrench to Restore Silence','2021-12-25','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hand-drawn action platformer. Don\'t you sometimes want to get away from noise and crowds and just watch night sky? So does this little wolf who took a wrench and build a spaceship which took him to a nice and quiet planet. But suddenly he sees other spaceships are landing on his little planet. Can\'t they just leave him alone?!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17379,'Place of Decay','2024-10-16','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a corrupted game project in this horror-puzzle adventure. Uncover the mystery behind its collapse and the developer\'s abandonment. Use the Code Cannon to break through the digital barriers and navigate the chaotic realm to uncover the truth behind its downfall.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w2a.jpg'),(17380,'Mabinogi Mobile','2025-03-15','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Android, iOS','Made by Naak, \"G1 to G3\" producer of original PC mabinogi. Mabinogi Mobile embarks on amazing adventures, build lasting friendships or even find romance in this unique social MMORPG, where a welcoming community with thousands of devoted players await! Whoever you are, or whatever your heart’s desire, come express it in Mabinogi Mobile and start living your fantasy life!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co61oa.jpg'),(17381,'Showrunner','2023-01-17','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Create and run your own TV show! An isometric management game where you craft scripts, populate your world with characters and cast actors to play them. Hire and manage staff, develop your studio and gain a dedicated following.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xhu.jpg'),(17382,'Gnog','2017-11-27','Point-and-click, Music, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, SteamVR, Mac, Oculus Rift','From acclaimed indie studio KO_OP and in association with beloved game-making initiative Double Fine Presents, Gnog is a 3D puzzle game set in a tactile world of toys and secrets. Point, click, grab, poke, spin, pull, and play with uniquely charming monster heads, and explore the hidden worlds inside them from your couch, or face-to-face in stunning PlayStation VR. Filled with eye-catching designs, playful interactions, and a rich, reactive soundtrack, the hand-crafted heads come to life in your hands!\n\nInspired by real-world toy designs, every Gnog head is a miniature world to discover. Grab a bookcase and spin it to reveal a hidden pile of coins, slide levers to navigate a damaged ship through outer space, crank a wheel to cook a stew on the stove – each playful interaction generates lively feedback and surprising consequences. Set to a relaxing and dynamic soundtrack that evolves with each level, the surreal worlds and joyful puzzles of Gnog will have you turning heads!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uag.jpg'),(17383,'Legend of Marrow','2024-02-29','Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Encounter a series of obstacles and puzzles that challenges Marrow both physically and mentally.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82fx.jpg'),(17384,'Aeternum Quest','2021-11-04','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Four gems came into existence when the world was created, mankind fused these to create the aeternum gem, too powerful to be used by the humans, they decided to shatter the gem back into four pieces and hide it. Thousand years have now past and mankind now wants the power of the gems back...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co570f.jpg'),(17385,'Elements Divided','2025-04-23','Fighting','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3','Bend fire, water, earth and air in chaotic online combat and co-op! Elements Divided lets you become a peak elemental warrior, moving your hands to summon attacks and defenses, levelling up your character, and using your powers to hurl yourself across arenas','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qhy.jpg'),(17386,'Project B','2023-02-26','Shooter','Web browser','Project B is a free multiplayer browser shooter that doesn\'t require any registration to play. It contains two game modes: deathmatch and killrace. In deathmatch, players are ranked based on their amount of kills. In killrace, the player with the least amount of kills is eliminated after every round.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67rf.jpg'),(17387,'Tropico 6: Festival','2021-09-01','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Tropico 6: Festival challenges players to channel their creativity by planning and managing a series of celebrations, whilst combating \'The Boredom\' – an evil, fun-fighting-force that threatens to thwart all festivities on the sun-soaked isles of Tropico.\n\nTropico 6: Festival also adds a unique party planning mechanic to Tropico 6, allowing players to host 20+ types of festival. Four distinctive, themed areas will be included for players to throw spectacular shindigs, as well as new buildings such as the Dance School, Balloon and Fireworks factory to get the party started. Players will also be able to enjoy a host of new musical additions, alongside a snazzy party outfit (and paint job) for El Prez and the presidential palace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3s5g.jpg'),(17388,'King\'s Quest III: To Heir is Human','1988-12-31','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Apple IIGS, Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS, Amiga, Apple II, TRS-80','King\'s Quest III: To Heir is Human is an adventure game in the King\'s Quest series. Players control Gwydion, a young slave to the evil wizard Manannan in the land of Llewdor. The game follows Gwydion\'s journey as he learns magic, escapes his captor, and discovers his true identity as the lost prince of Daventry. Players must solve puzzles, avoid the wizard\'s watchful eye, and navigate various dangers to complete their quest. The game expands on the series\' fantasy setting, introducing new locations and characters while maintaining the puzzle-solving and exploration elements that define the King\'s Quest franchise. As the third installment in the series, King\'s Quest III continues the story of the royal family of Daventry, connecting to the broader narrative of the King\'s Quest saga.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28rt.jpg'),(17389,'Sprint Master','1989-03-01','Racing, Adventure','Atari 2600','Sprintmaster is an action racing game for the Atari 2600. The game is played with an overhead view of the racetrack, and the first of two players to race around the track for the required number of laps wins! Occasionally a bonus will appear in the roadway; collect these to increase the traction capabilities of your car or gain a temporary speed boost. Other obstacles, such as oil slicks, may also appear in the roadway which will cause you to lose control and speed. There is a total of nine different tracks with varying levels of difficulty to race on, and you can choose either blacktop, dirt, or ice for terrain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co36pi.jpg'),(17390,'I\'m on a Watcher Duty: Anniversary Special','2023-08-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game to celebrate the Watcher Duty series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vjw.jpg'),(17391,'Chip-Boi',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle','Sin plataforma','Chip-Boi is a puzzle platformer with a twist. The theme is \"cheat to win\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xf7.jpg'),(17392,'New International Track & Field','2008-07-22','Sport','Nintendo DS','The classic sporting game series of Track and Field celebrates its\' 25th Anniversary by coming to the Nintendo DS. All the excitement and fun of the original titles is brought up to date with a bright and stylish new look, more events and online play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8m9o.jpg'),(17393,'Ikinari Musician','1987-03-05','Music','Family Computer','Ikinari Musician provides a piano-like keyboard, a treble clef on the staff to show note location, a 5-channel Backing track, 4 timbre choices, and controllers to manipulate common synthesizer parameters such as release and attack, LFO, etc. It also provides recording and play back function.\n\nThe player has many choices of styles of the backing track, from popular styles such as Rock, Techno, and Jazz, to various ethnic flavors such as Bossa, Rio, Japan, India, Arabia, etc.\n\nThe backing tracks representing the styles use familiar elements to make the game more accessible to the general audience. For example, in the Scotland style Cadence to Arms, a familiar bagpipes tune, is used.\n\nMost backing tracks loop around one or two chords, allowing an open improvisation on the main keyboard. Once the style is chosen, the main keyboard is masked in the way that only the scale that easily fits into the style is available, e.g. blues scale, pentatonic scale, etc.\n\nThe keyboard is controlled by the UP-DOWN or LEFT-RIGHT d-pads on the game controller so there is no way to play leaps in the scale.\n\nDue to the hardware limitation, the sound produced is the typical 8-bit chiptune music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o0l.jpg'),(17394,'You Fall You Lose','2019-02-14','Adventure','Android','You fall you lose is a hardcore fun game created by an indie developer. Explore many biomes and even the outer space with your own customizable ball - give it a name!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jsz.jpg'),(17395,'Iceman',NULL,'Sin género','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','The first and only game announced by Datura Studios, was made by past Infogrames employees. Announced as a local multiplayer game for the Gamecube, PS2, original Xbox, and Windows, the game progressed to about 80% completed, but was cancelled when Datura couldn\'t find a publisher and went out of business.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17396,'Symphony of Seven Souls','2021-08-11','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sleepless nights staring at a blank score page as you try to write your latest symphony have taken their toll.\n\nYour creative well has all but dried up!\n\nIf you are to still the unrelenting pressure to create, then you will have to take a more drastic approach...\n\nRosin up your bow and take to the streets, searching for the willing dead to join your unholy orchestra. Perhaps then you can finally write the Symphony of Seven Souls!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75jc.jpg'),(17397,'Thief 2X: Shadows of the Metal Age','2005-05-15','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An unofficial expansion pack to Thief II: The Metal Age with features similar to those in retail Looking Glass games: complex level design, a lengthy campaign (consisting of thirteen long missions), pre-rendered introduction and ending sequences, original music, new voice acting, original artwork, and animated mission briefings.\n\nThirteen full-length missions take the action through city streets and rooftops, ancient tombs, hotels, museums, cathedrals and more in a gripping tale of vengeance and deception. Hundreds of new models, textures and sounds: 3000 lines of new dialogue. Four cutscenes and twelve new briefings in the original Thief style. Ten new weapons and tools provide the means to evade, outwit, and out-fight your opponents, as well as bringing unprecedented levels of emergent gameplay to the Thief series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h7p.jpg'),(17398,'Coloring Pixels','2018-08-17','Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','A relaxing coloring by numbers game. Enjoy completing a variety of images with differing themes complexity and sizes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2958.jpg'),(17399,'Marvel 1943: Rise of Hydra','2025-12-31','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','This narrative-driven ensemble game stars Captain America Steve Rogers, Black Panther Azzuri (T\'Challa\'s grandfather), U.S. soldier and member of the Howling Commandos Gabriel Jones, and leader of the fledgling Wakandan Spy Network, Nanali.\n\nAll four characters will be playable at different parts of the story. According to Skydance, players can look forward to \"intuitive controls and exhilarating second-to-second gameplay that captures the action and excitement of Marvel, inspired by landmark comics, television, and films, as they navigate this all-new glob-trotting adventure.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7xt6.jpg'),(17400,'Power & Revolution: 2021 Edition','2021-08-04','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A new expansion of the ultra-realistic simulator of today\'s world where you play as the head of state or as the opposition! New Features for 2021: administration of the EU, Covid vaccinations, Biden\'s Challenge, political coalitions, diplomatic negotiations, worldwide tax and free-trade agreements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vjc.jpg'),(17401,'Beach Buddies Brawl','2015-08-21','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Control 2 buddies at once and shove your friends into the ocean!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9grx.jpg'),(17402,'G-Mode Archives+: Tantei Kibukawa Ryousuke Jiken-tan Vol. 9 - Samidare ha Nibiiro no Shirabe','2023-03-09','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','I follow his shadow in the pale dull sky.... Eight years ago, the Kibukawa Detective Agency, another great detective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co866e.jpg'),(17403,'Warden of the Crypt','2025-03-24','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into the darkness of Warden of the Crypt, a tower defense action game where you play as a wizard defending a cursed crypt. Face relentless monster waves, cast powerful spells, collect ancient books, and use potions to survive as long as possible!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kju.jpg'),(17404,'Adventure D: Espionage Island','1982-12-31','Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Sinclair ZX81, Amstrad CPC','A text adventure game where the player controls a spy shot down while investigating an enemy stronghold.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7m9q.jpg'),(17405,'CyVeRpunk','2022-09-01','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','CyVeRpunk is a fast-paced VR on-rail shooter where the player works for the mob in a futuristic cyberpunk-themed city. No motion sickness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ddo.jpg'),(17406,'Escape the Farm','2023-11-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take on the role of an intrepid chicken to attempt daring escapes from the tyranny of your farmyard masters. Use a variety of tools at your disposal in this 3D puzzle platformer as you run, jump, and flap your way to freedom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7eoj.jpg'),(17407,'Vylan','2021-04-22','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Vylan is a 100 level tile-based platformer about beating each level under a certain amount of time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3okr.jpg'),(17408,'F-Zero X','2004-12-31','Racing, Arcade','Wii, Nintendo 64, Wii U','It\'s you against 29 other machines competing for the title of F-Zero X Champion. You\'re racing at speeds of over 1,000 km/h high above the atmosphere. Your competition comes from every corner of the galaxy and won\'t shed a tear at the thought of smashing you off the track. With four-player simultaneous gameplay and the Rumble Pak accessory, you have the fastest racing game on the N64 system!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53i2.jpg'),(17409,'Zombiegal Kawaii','2012-12-14','Shooter','iOS','A side-scrolling, 2D zombie shooting game presented in a cute anime aesthetic for iOS devices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/megporhbgoeeswusoexb.jpg'),(17410,'Toem','2021-09-17','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','An aesthetic adventure with the premise of enjoying the little things!\nToem is an adventure game, it aims to capture the curiosity of a child! Should I go left, right, who cares I\'m on an adventure! Your smile, that\'s what\'s important to us.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97ni.jpg'),(17411,'Toy Rider: Racing Game','2024-02-22','Racing, Simulator, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Toy Rider is a mobile car racing game, what makes it different from a typical car racing game is, it is not just about speed it is about balancing, timing, proper use of power-ups & proper speed! The game is inspired by the Table Top Racing & Micromachine game but with lots of upgrades and improvements. One of the best offline racing game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66vt.jpg'),(17412,'Pagan: Emporium','2018-09-02','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Devil is Watching','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7807.jpg'),(17413,'Barcode Battler: U-Ronchan','1991-12-31','Simulator','Handheld Electronic LCD','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mcq.jpg'),(17414,'Sengo Muramasa DX: Guren no Kettou','2017-10-26','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','In 1939, the entire world was plunged back into war even while it hasn’t fully recovered from the wounds of the last one. It was not long before the wartime fire reached the Pacific. The power of the Tokugawa shogunate had not yet weakened, and Japan began to attack its neighbor. It was at this time that one Sanada Yukiaki appeared, the descendent of Sanada Yukimura who had bared his fangs at Tokugawa Ieyasu.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cd0.jpg'),(17415,'Submeris','2025-04-26','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Submeris is an underwater mining adventure set beneath a mysterious island. Dig, upgrade your gear, survive dangerous depths, and uncover the legendary treasure hidden far below the ocean floor!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qp9.jpg'),(17416,'Strawberry Shortcake: Sweet Dreams','2006-10-19','Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Based on Strawberry Shortcake\'s feature film, Sweet Dreams lets fans play as Strawberry Shortcake and her friends Raspberry Torte, Angel Cake, Ginger Snap and even Sleepbug. Flying, driving and adventure scenarios challenge the characters to work together to save Strawberryland and beat the Purple Pieman! As the game progresses, My Sweets mode also details each character\'s accomplishments and unlocks special pictures. The game incorporates actual images from the CGI-animated film.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87tw.jpg'),(17417,'Football Club','2019-10-02','Sport','Linux, Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Football Club - 2D football simulator. The game has titles, awards, points and bonuses, which makes the game more interesting and unique. The game has more than 10 different maps in which we can play 1vs1 against a bot, or a friend, as well as on a local network. In your hands are 3 football players for whom you can manage!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7m20.jpg'),(17418,'Age of Empires IV: Knights of Cross and Rose','2025-04-08','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qge.jpg'),(17419,'Tsuki wa Kirisaku: Tantei Sagara Kyouichirou','2005-02-24','Visual Novel','PlayStation 2','A detective adventure game in the veins of visual novels featuring a third-rate private investigator, Kyouichirou Sagara.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55ny.jpg'),(17420,'Sentinel Returns','1998-12-31','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Prepare your mind, body and soul for a horrific game of hide and seek, where you are the hunted! From the people at Psygnosis comes this bone-chilling, mind-numbing strategy title that will make you dive into your brain and cringe with fear. The game is Sentinel Returns for the PlayStation.\n\nYou are a scientist, exploring the mysteries of an unknown substance. When this mysterious substance is given to an equally unknown specimen, a world dominated by The Sentinel is revealed. In this unreal universe, the battle for life\'s very essence is in motion. Possibly, when you finish with the hundreds of specimens that you have, you will seek the answers to your questions. However, failing this task has unknown repercussions....','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4apz.jpg'),(17421,'G-Mode Archives 33: Tetris Diamond','2021-04-01','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','When talking about feature phone apps, you can never leave out the G-MODE version of \"TETRIS\".\n\nThe \"TETRIS DIAMOND\" version, one of the most popular versions of TETRIS, is back as a G-MODE archive!\n\nThere are 4 types of game modes included.\n\nStarting with the normal \"TETRIS mode\", \"DIAMOND mode\" where you can get a bonus score by erasing the line with \"Diamond Tetrimino\", and \"PUZZLE mode\" that erases all lines using limited blocks. There are various rules.\n\nIn addition to familiar techniques such as \"TETRISTM line erasing\" and \"T-SPIN\", let\'s aim for a high score by making full use of the new technique \"DIAMOND\" using \"Diamond Tetrimino\"!\n\nPlease enjoy the glittering world of \"TETRIS\" that still does not fade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9krs.jpg'),(17422,'The Way','2017-08-04','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Journey to another planet and discover its secrets in order to bring your loved one back to life. Experience an adventure, inspired by old school classics like Another World, Heart of Darkness and Flashback.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gzu.jpg'),(17423,'Neverwinter Nights: Enhanced Edition','2019-12-02','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Neverwinter Nights: Enhanced Edition is an updated version of the 2002 video game Neverwinter Nights. The Enhanced Edition is based on Neverwinter Nights: Diamond Edition and it comes with the base game as well as the Shadows of Undrentide, Hordes of the Underdark, Kingmaker, Witch\'s Wake and ShadowGuard expansions. Remastered version brings numerous technological improvements to the game, including an updated graphics engine and revitalized multiplayer support.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ndm.jpg'),(17424,'Viking Vengeance','2021-04-08','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Viking Vengeance is a Rogue-lite Dungeon Crawler ARPG set in a religiously oppressed medieval world. You play as a Templar with pagan origins who rediscovers his roots and learns to wield the powers of the Norse Gods forever changing the destiny of his people.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2joc.jpg'),(17425,'Francisca','2016-07-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Today my parents went to Mexico for a week, and I’m gonna have to spend seven days alone in our new house.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jpf.jpg'),(17426,'SkateRPG','2020-12-04','Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SkateRPG is a skateboarding role-playing game where you explore the city of Ollielá learning skateboarding tricks, playing skateboarding minigames, taking a skateboard ride, and talking to the townspeople.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kh9.jpg'),(17427,'Idle Dragon Clicker','2023-04-27','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The land has been overrun by evil dragons It needs a leader to bring peace to the land. Start by clicking on the dragon to kill them, and collect coins. Spend that coin on your power and allied Heroes to get more damage. The more damage you deal, the more coins you will get.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f7v.jpg'),(17428,'Half Dragon','2024-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Half Dragon is a open world first person RPG loosely inspired by the elder scrolls you can fight monsters, play sidequests, or talk to NPC\'s when the full game comes out (this game is in early stages of develepment so dont expect the game to be close to finished)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iqd.jpg'),(17429,'Pixel Miner','2018-03-26','Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"The revolution\" they called it.\n\n\"Everything will be better\" they said.\n...\nNow we don\'t even have our own pixels anymore','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gqd.jpg'),(17430,'Worms Reloaded: Game of the Year Edition','2012-03-16','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ten years on from Worms Armageddon and the turn-based comic mayhem continues in Worms Reloaded. Worms Reloaded: Game of the Year Edition includes:\n\n- Worms Reloaded\n- Worms Reloaded: Forts Pack\n- Worms Reloaded: Puzzle Pack\n- Worms Reloaded: Retro Pack\n- Worms Reloaded: The \"Pre-order Forts and Hats\" DLC Pack\n- Worms Reloaded: Time Attack Pack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85v6.jpg'),(17431,'Harry Potter Collection','2007-10-10','Platform, Adventure','Game Boy Advance, PlayStation 2','This compilation bundles 3 games in the Harry Potter series:\n- Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets\n- Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban\n- Harry Potter and the Goblet of Fire','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3iws.jpg'),(17432,'Dair','2023-08-01','Fighting, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A platform fighting game with only one attack, this sequel to Nair focuses on edgeguarding and off-stage play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vsk.jpg'),(17433,'Little House','2025-04-25','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Playdate','Waking up from an unknown dream you enter your house, only to find that everything is not as it should be. Now you must explore, solve surreal and challenging puzzles and encounter strange beings as you search for your house... inside your house!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qhm.jpg'),(17434,'Conflict of the Universe',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','This game is fully built around Steam play together. You and 3 other friends can control a star ship together and fight back enemies that you counter! Different star ships to control, each having their different movement and weapons, and some will have abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ni7.jpg'),(17435,'Florescer','2018-06-20','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Florescer is a story driven game delevoped with the help of a Brazilian NGO called Florescer, an organization that houses transsexual and transvestite women. The game is meant to invoke reflection and to generate empathy torwards trans people, inserting the player in the role of a teenage transgender girl and depicting the hardships and prejudices present in her daily life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3go0.jpg'),(17436,'Aiyoku no Eustia','2014-06-28','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','After the surface of the world broke down, the city of Novus Aether floats in the sky, thanks to the prayers of the Holy Maiden. Years ago, when the Holy Maiden\'s prayer was interrupted, an incident known as the \"Gran Forte\" occurred, causing a portion of the land to fall and split the lower city into two, separated by a cliff.\n\nIn time, the lowest layer became the dwelling of all kinds of low-lives, people who lost much of their former lives during the \"Gran Forte\", becoming known as the \"Prison\". However, a contagious disease which causes people to grow wings has spread throughout the city, and a unit has been formed to deal with these people swiftly.\n\nIn this \"Prison\" resides Caim Astraea, a freelance ex-assassin who does odd jobs for his friends for money, refusing jobs that require him to kill people. During one request, Caim finds a girl who contracts the wing-disease, enveloped in a light that reminds Caim of the “Gran Forte” years ago...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dhl.jpg'),(17437,'Damatte Watashi no Muko ni Nare! Reona After','2011-08-20','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A fandisc for the visual novel Damatte Watashi no Muko ni Nare!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ki1.jpg'),(17438,'Nox Timore','2014-10-12','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Horror in dark hallways','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2li4.jpg'),(17439,'Tank Universal','2008-08-21','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tank Universal creates a huge virtual \'Tron-like\' world where you take part in immense 3D tank battles involving scores of units both friendly and not so friendly in wide open levels! Players can bombard the enemy from a distance or close the gap and dodge shells point blank - all in an immersive first person perspective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ezxssivflentg2lumcnr.jpg'),(17440,'Desperados III: Money for the Vultures - Part 3: Once More With Feeling','2020-11-03','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','In the third and final part of \"Money for the Vultures\", the journey concludes in a fan favorite location. Brave the walls of a mighty fortress with cunning and guile, carry out Hector\'s plan in all its crazy glory and find out if Rosie will keep her word, or if she still has an ace up her sleeve.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39r8.jpg'),(17441,'Chicken VR','2018-09-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chicken VR is a virtual reality first person chicken simulator. You can teleport around and explore, eating food, drinking water, and laying eggs.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17442,'Never Stop Sneakin\'','2018-02-25','Shooter, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','The Department of Sneakin\' is the world\'s most elite stealth agency. Your mission: stop time-traveling master criminal Amadeus Guildenstern.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31dw.jpg'),(17443,'Project Xsting','2024-01-05','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight your way through swarms of elite WASP soldiers and bosses using character-specific ranged and melee attacks. Survive by making strategic upgrade choices, using enemy drones to your advantage and overcoming unique stage challenges in the sci-fi survival roguelite, Project XSTING.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mpf.jpg'),(17444,'Canterz Paranormies','2022-07-08','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Canterz Paranormies is a 2D Top Down survival horror game based on the story of the most renowned paranormal investigation team of the US called \"Canterz Paranormies\" who got a request from the owner of the Texas Haunted house to investigate it for the paranormal evidence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5chd.jpg'),(17445,'Finding Buddies','2023-03-24','Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Daniel has just started his adult life. Despite his sad past, he managed to move on and re-socialize. So many responsibilities are coming and it is up to you to decide how he will handle all of this. The great thing is that maybe you can find some cute guys along your path','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nb9.jpg'),(17446,'Jan Ken Pro!',NULL,'Fighting, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','What if Jan Ken Po was a Sport?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gqc.jpg'),(17447,'Sonic.Exe 2: The Game','2025-03-31','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A video game adaptation of the sequel to the original Sonic.EXE story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ql1.jpg'),(17448,'Gobliiins Pack','2022-07-05','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Would you like to play something with tough puzzles and laughing-out-loud humour? What about something full of funny characters, featuring mind-bending plots and brain-teasing puzzles?\nHelp the King regain his sanity after he got turned into a raving lunatic, save the kidnapped prince and interview Queen Xina and King Bodd who have been fighting for years.\nYou will be confronted by surprise after surprise and will have to face the most unexpected enemies. Enjoy good, old-fashioned fun for everyone.\n\nIncludes Gobliiins, Gobliins 2: Prince Buffoon, and Goblins Quest 3; you can choose between floppy and CD','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dr7.jpg'),(17449,'Payout: Shop Simulator',NULL,'Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build and manage your shop, deliver physics-based products using Van, Forklift and Truck. Hire workers to speed up your progress','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jk0.jpg'),(17450,'Within: Hannah\'s Journey','2024-07-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this turn-based JRPG, discover Hannah\'s strange journey into the confines of her nightmares and memories. Taking part in a mysterious place where all her regrets, mourning and mistakes reside.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8aa3.jpg'),(17451,'Magenta','2024-04-29','Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','...It seems the robot you created has grown too attached to you.\n\nA story-focused game with dating elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gut.jpg'),(17452,'Eclipse','2006-01-23','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Around November, 2004, several students got together to brainstorm a concept for a total conversion of Valve\'s Half-Life 2 . After several days of brainstorming, the concept for Eclipse was born. In January of 2005, a group of Guildhall students composed of programmers, artists, and level designers were put together and formed what is now CelTech Studios. It was then that CelTech Studios made the commitment to produce the highest quality game possible in the short amount of time they had - five months.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17453,'Dev_me','2020-05-30','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this game, you\'re playing as game developer and encounter typical problems like eating and sleeping. You need to correctly allocate your time for human needs, hobbies and work, to live another day as indie developer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1i4u.jpg'),(17454,'AutoForge','2024-03-27','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In AutoForge you will build an expansive automated factory reaching up to the sky and deep into the ground, unlock and explore regions of a vast world filled with wonder and danger, upgrade yourself with ancient technologies, and then defend it all from the unfriendly denizens of the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ze4.jpg'),(17455,'Disney\'s The Haunted Mansion','2003-10-14','Sin género','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Based off a combination of the popular Disneyland attraction and the 2003 movie of the same name, players guide Zeke Holloway through the house of 999 happy haunts in order to solve a mystery, put the spirits to rest, and get out of the house alive.\n\nThe game is presented as a 3rd person action adventure. Players are allowed full roam of the mansion, once they collect enough Shriveled Souls inside their Beacon of Souls, a special lantern designed to collect the various lesser ghosts throughout the rooms. Though Zeke handles his quest alone, he is aided by the help of Madame Leota, and six friendly ghosts who will provide hints and items throughout the journey. As Zeke solves puzzles, completes various tasks, and helps rid the house of its evil spirits, these spiritual companions will provide Soul Gems, which amplify the power of the Soul Beacon. Once fully charged, Zeke will have the ability to face the main spirit, Atticus Thorn, for the final showdown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1w61.jpg'),(17456,'3D Deathchase','1983-12-01','Shooter, Racing','ZX Spectrum','Deathchase is a 1983 computer game written for the ZX Spectrum by Mervyn Estcourt and published by Micromega in the UK and Ventamatic in Spain. It is commonly known by the incorrect name of \"3D Deathchase\", perhaps due to the prominent \"3D\" on the inlay, and that some magazines incorrectly referred to this title. \nThe player controls a motorcycle-riding mercenary as he pursues two other motorcycles, one blue and one yellow, through a forest. Each enemy motorcycle destroyed is worth $1000 (i.e. points) to the player. The player\'s motorcycle is equipped with forward-firing guns with which to shoot its quarry. The projectiles can be controlled mid-flight simply by steering the bike. If both enemy motorcycles are destroyed, the player moves to a night version of the same level. If both enemy motorcycles on that level are destroyed, the player moves on to a daytime level of the next stage (with more trees to avoid). There are also tanks and helicopters which appear on the horizon and can be shot for bonus points. \nThe game takes place over eight stages. When stage eight is completed, the game returns to the start.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nxtthiz07fpv5p3ytvib.jpg'),(17457,'Wingspan','2020-09-17','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In Wingspan you are bird enthusiasts - researchers, bird watchers, ornithologists, and collectors - seeking to discover and attract the best birds to your network of wildlife preserves.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xh8.jpg'),(17458,'Lemmings','1993-04-01','Puzzle, Strategy','Sega Game Gear','Your task is to rescue the Lemmings across 120 levels of fast-paced puzzling. These creatures simply walk blindly through the world in the hope of reaching safety at the end of the level - unfortunately, these levels include steep drops, gaps in the ground, barriers, and rivers amongst other hazards.\n\nYou are in control not of any individual Lemming, but of a cross-hair, which can be moved over any of the Lemmings. Along the bottom is a selection of functions that can be assigned to a Lemming, including climbing, floating, and bashing. You must click to select the appropriate function, then click on the Lemming to activate it. Each level has a different range of skills on offer, a different amount of Lemmings, and a different percentage target in order to progress.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r8l.jpg'),(17459,'Minecraft: Story Mode - Episode 4: A Block and a Hard Place','2015-12-22','Point-and-click, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Minecraft: Story Mode is an adventure game set in a Minecraft world. It is a five-part episodic series that will take you to the Nether, the Farlands, the End, and beyond! You will drive how the story flows through the decisions you make: what you say to people (and how you say it), and what you choose to do in moments of thrilling action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vib.jpg'),(17460,'House of Terror VR','2015-06-24','Adventure','Android, iOS','This game requires the Mobile Virtual Reality glasses like Google Cardboard by using a bluetooth joystick.\n\nHouse of Terror: Valerie\'s Revenge is a Virtual Reality game in which you will have to search through dark environments full of traps and monsters. Solve the puzzles, search for clues and mainly do not the caught.\n\nSomething is wrong around you. You do not even know why and where you are but you know you have to keep going, start investigating the back story because maybe then you can get out and leave alive. Do you think you are up to this challenge?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jwvwvxfb349gxey3kltz.jpg'),(17461,'Rush and Blush',NULL,'Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gxr.jpg'),(17462,'Forgotten Tales','2016-04-12','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android','The game offers many hours of classic RPG gameplay, exciting story, tons of diversified locations, monsters and quests. Get lost in arid deserts, endless forests, dark dungeons and explore snowy wastelands. Gather a party of adventurers and fight against knights, archers, trolls, orcs, barbarians, dragons, skeletons and many other enemies. Explore a vast heroic fantasy world. Become a legend yourself. Travel the world of Forgotten Tales to meet new friends, find treasure, and encounter monsters! Use a variety of weapons to take out enemies in this real time RPG. Gain experience and levels. Solve quests, find hidden treasures and improve your equipment and skills. Use several types of weapons and magic spells. If you like role playing games, you will enjoy this game with it\'s top-down perspective. Hack and slash, action and classic RPG fuse in one ultimate game: Forgotten Tales. This role playing game is completely free. Try the best open world free RPG for Android!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8z44.jpg'),(17463,'Backrooms','2019-06-01','Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Mac','A horror game; but with full lights on!\n\nBackrooms brings a nostalgic feeling of being lost in endless empty rooms with fluorescent lights at full hum-buzz.\n\nYou have to find your way out, but some \"friends\" don\'t want you to leave.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50t6.jpg'),(17464,'Stick Match','2016-10-27','Fighting, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A silly game for two players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4a7b.jpg'),(17465,'Follow the blackbird','2021-02-28','Puzzle, Adventure, Visual Novel','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Follow the blackbird is a hand-drawn 2d game made in a form of comics with lovely watercolour illustrations. Follow the heart-warming story about little adventrure of Sonya and the blackbird. As the story unfolds, couple of light puzzles will be on your way.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17466,'Shinsen-den','1989-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','Family Computer','A turn-based RPG based on Japanese folklore. A pair of monks complete their training only to find themselves embroiled with the fate of the country.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68ax.jpg'),(17467,'Curse of the Catacombs','1993-12-31','Shooter','DOS','Curse of the Catacombs, also known as Catacomb Armageddon, is the sequel to The Catacomb Abyss.\n\nCurse of the Catacombs is a first-person shooter very similar to the previous game. Once again, you\'re a mage whose quest is to destroy the evil Nemesis. Just like in the previous installment, you can throw fireballs at your foes or use them to destroy certain walls. You can find bolts and nukes which allow more powerful attacks, healing potions, scrolls and keys. You can also find gems which allow you to see approaching enemies on your radar. Of course, there are completely new levels to explore and many new enemies to fight, such as harmless rabbits which suddenly turn into fearsome beasts, or evil trees which can be set on fire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gyr.jpg'),(17468,'Gladiator Guild Manager','2021-10-13','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Gladiator Guild Manager is a game about building your guild, buying, developing and equipping units, figuring out tactics in different arenas against various opponents and becoming the most powerful gladiator guild in this epic fantasy world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i5h.jpg'),(17469,'Utopia','1982-06-03','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Intellivision','Utopia is a game played by two players on two continents. Players must build their island nation by building farms, housing, schools, hospitals, and factories and making other improvements while also competing against another player. Players are able to sabotage the other player as well, but they must also handle maintaining a fleet of PT boats to protect their fishing fleet, building forts to prevent rebellion, and dealing with the occasional hurricane.\n\nUtopia is considered by some to be the first city-building game, and an early ancestor of the real-time strategy genre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pgz.jpg'),(17470,'RIP',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','RIP is an all-out war simulation on the ground, in the air or at sea. With 4 different Soldier classes and there specific weapons in many different scenario maps from the middle eastern desert to a well-isolated bunker construction, you can fight as your heart desires and let the enemy bleed out in the dust.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86i3.jpg'),(17471,'Iris and the Giant','2020-02-27','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Iris and The Giant is a fusion of the CCG, RPG and roguelike genres. You play as Iris, who must brave her fears in her imaginary world. Dive into a melancholic and gripping adventure, filled with cute monsters and buried memories. Ready to face your inner demons?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co201b.jpg'),(17472,'Noblesse Oblige','2022-08-25','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Spark romance amid secrets in a crumbling mansion! What will you sacrifice for love? Can you trust your own heart?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jsa.jpg'),(17473,'Cartoon Network Superstar Soccer: Goal!!!','2016-08-25','Sport, Arcade','iOS','Become a soccer superstar with your favorite Cartoon Network characters in Superstar Soccer: Goal!!!, a crossover soccer mobile game. The game features Steven as a playable character alongside Garnet, Amethyst, Pearl, and various Cartoon Network characters from other shows. Unleash unique defensive dribbles and special moves for each character. Combine passing, shooting, dribbles and tackles to create your own awesome soccer plays and win the day. Play against the computer or challenge your soccer skills in multiplayer matches against other players. Enjoy versus play on the same device, over wiki or online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ghx.jpg'),(17474,'My Sacred Shrine Maiden','2022-11-14','Visual Novel','Android','Stuck at your grandparents\' place in the countryside for the summer, you and some old friends decide to play a test of courage at a local shrine known for its ghost stories… Little did you know that none of the stories you were told could truly explain the power of the spirits that lie there!\n\nWith a powerful Kami on the loose, you must work closely with a feisty shrine maiden and her two familiars to seal evil spirits\n\nWill you be able to save the village?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5suc.jpg'),(17475,'Project Zeta',NULL,'Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Five teams enter the Aran Plateau—one emerges victorious. Bring your squad into the next evolution of the third-person MOBA, blending explosive hero-driven action with dynamic multiteam strategy. Outsmart and outmaneuver your opponents to create your path to victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hwr.jpg'),(17476,'Cosmic Sheriff','1989-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','ZX Spectrum, DOS, Amstrad CPC, MSX','Cosmic Sheriff was one of the first computer games to enable the Gun-Stick optical gun system, manufactured by the Spanish company MHT Ingenieros, a revolutionary hardware developed specifically for 8-bit computers. With this peripheral the user could shoot directly at the screen to eliminate his enemies.\n\nGame consists of three zones of several levels each one.\n\nZone 1: The warehouses. Throughout three levels there are two bombs.\nZone 2: Control system and computers. There are four bombs to defuse along five levels.\nZone 3: Surface. Nine levels where there are six bombs to defuse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2n5f.jpg'),(17477,'Roche Limit: The Death of CMK','2022-12-10','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Roche Limit: The Death of CMK is a horror-surrealist style PowerPoint game made over the course of eight months. It features over 1,500 slides and 80+ unique hand drawn scenes.\nThe game is a follow-up to the developer\'s 2019 project The EdCo Incident.\n\n2 additional endings where planned for and worked on as a possible update for the game but have been dropped in favor of a new game that continues the themes with a new story.\nAn OST for the cut ending scenes was released with interludes and titles, ending 2\'s title was The Golden Age and ending 3\'s title was Depi Lontan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6802.jpg'),(17478,'Runeverse: Sea Brawls','2021-07-23','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Runeverse: Sea Brawls is a special edition auto battler adaptation of the original Runeverse: The Card Game. This exhilarating 8-player autobattler tournament adds a new dimension to the world of Runeverse. Recently, Sea Brawls has been integrated into the main Runeverse: The Card Game, further enriching the overall gaming experience for players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pgr.jpg'),(17479,'Bounce On 2: Drallo\'s Demise','2010-03-26','Platform','iOS','Roll your way through the Floating Ruins, explore space on the Orbital Platform, and finish the fight in Drallo\'s Fortress. Customize your character, find hidden secrets, fight against unique bosses and collect gems! With different level objectives to select, and over 100 keys to collect, Bounce On 2: Drallo\'s Demise will keep you playing and playing!\n\nFans of the original will love the improvements, and newcomers to the series will have no problem jumping right in. Bounce On 2 features incredible 2D/3D graphics, amazing lighting effects, and is packed with beautiful artwork and 21 unique musical tracks to add to the fun. Use the accelerometer or touch controls. The graphics scale to utilize the capabilities of newer devices.\n\nBounce On 2: Drallo\'s Demise is suitable for all ages and skill levels. With level difficulties ranging from super easy to near impossible, Bounce On 2 has something for everyone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co495z.jpg'),(17480,'A Long Way Down','2020-01-16','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','A deck-building roguelite RPG set in a dark and tormented world. Assemble your party and use your cards to survive, fight and build your way through a dark maze of monsters orchestrated by an evil mastermind. Hero or villain, your choices will lead you to judgement.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v8h.jpg'),(17481,'Batman: Arkham City - Harley Quinn\'s Revenge','2012-05-29','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Batman is lured back into Arkham City by its last remaining super-criminal; Harley Quinn. Now more dangerous than ever, she wants her revenge!\nThis expansion adds a couple of hours of new content and the possibility to play both as Batman and as Robin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/slsb6cu8bfewt4envo2r.jpg'),(17482,'Continuum','2019-05-23','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In this third game of the Sector-X series, the player must fly their ship into several vortexes in a certain manner in order to open the vortexes and enable the player to advance to the next level (with 10 puzzles to solve in all).\n\nSeveral levels also have enemies that must be either avoided or destroyed before the player can solve the puzzle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8knl.jpg'),(17483,'Drone Simulator VR','2024-09-05','Racing, Simulator','Meta Quest 2','Delivers a realistic VR drone flying experience for both beginners and seasoned pilots. The simulation features accurate flight dynamics, with three control modes and flight modes like Tripod, Position, and Sport. Players can explore various maps, tackle challenges, take photos with adjustable camera settings, and find hidden collectibles. Time trials of varying difficulty allow players to test their skills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tc9.jpg'),(17484,'Rhem 3: The Secret Library','2021-03-25','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this third installment of the popular RHEM series of intricate pure-puzzle first-person adventure games, the adventures of brothers Kales and Zetais continue in the mysterious land of RHEM.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yil.jpg'),(17485,'Fort Boyard','2019-06-27','Sport, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Ever wanted to experience the Fort Boyard adventure with your friends? You will soon be able to make that dream a reality: set off on the journey together, from the comfort of your couch, in just a few weeks’ time! In single or multiplayer mode (up to 4 players), solve Sir Fouras’ tricky riddles, follow Passe-Partout through the mazes of the fort and take up the challenges to get the keys that will allow you to enter the treasure room.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co259y.jpg'),(17486,'Pokémon Radical Red','2020-07-13','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Pokémon Radical Red is at its core a difficulty mod, but with massive additional features added to help you navigate through this game\'s difficulty.\n\nMuch higher difficulty, with optional modes to add or mitigate difficulty\nBuilt-in Randomizer options (Pokémon, Abilities and Learnsets)\nPhysical/Special split + Fairy Typing\nAll Pokémon up to Gen 9 obtainable (with some exceptions)\nMost Moves up to Gen 9\nUpdated Pokémon sprites\nMega Evolutions & Z-Moves\nMost Abilities up to Gen 9\nAll important battle items (with some exceptions)\nWish Piece Raid Battles (with Dynamax)\nMystery Gifts\nReusable TMs\nExpanded TM list\nAdditional move tutors\nEV Training Gear and NPCs\nAbility popups during battle\nParty Exp Share (can be disabled)\nHidden Abilities\nDay, Dusk and Night cycle (syncs with RTC)\nDexNav, which allows you to search for Pokémon with hidden abilities and more\nEven faster turbo speed on bike and while surfing\nAbilities like Magma Armor, Static, or Flash Fire have overworld effects like in recent generations\nDestiny Knot, Everstone have updated breeding mechanics\nLots of Quality of Life changes\n... and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wpi.jpg'),(17487,'Cloud Chamber','2014-09-14','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Players collaborate with each other to explore, investigate and discuss the fragments of information they collect on their journey through the dataworld, writing the story themselves of a young scientist, Kathleen Petersen, who risks her sanity and betrays her father to save humanity from itself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47v3.jpg'),(17488,'Tether Together','2019-04-19','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Lover Bands is a 2-player cooperative platform game where you are tied together. Drag your non-gamer friend\'s dead body over the finish line!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17489,'A Fool\'s Art Gallery','2023-10-28','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Fool\'s Art Gallery contains over 20 years of visual content by one mushroom cultist Canadian artist. You are a flying magical mask who s*!*s stars; be sure to look for secret doors to reveal hidden content as you explore the gallery at large. Hundreds of works of art await you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74lp.jpg'),(17490,'Fireball Wizard','2023-06-20','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Fireball Wizard is a lovingly crafted retro arcade platformer. Blast your way through 4 worlds and 40+ levels to defeat the big bosses and find all the secrets. Unlock 9 playable characters and power and health potions as you go to help you face the challenges ahead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5irh.jpg'),(17491,'Saiyuki World 2: Tenjokai no Majin','1991-01-07','Platform','Family Computer','\"Saiyūki World 2: Tenjōkai no Majin\" is an action platformer, akin to many games at the time. The protagonist is Sun Wukong, the King Monkey, one of the most popular characters in the Chinese culture.\n\nAfter completing the first stage, the player can play the other six in any order. Each of the stages revolve around elements, such as fire and water. After each stage, the player gains a new weapon, much like in the original Mega Man series, which was extremely popular at the time. The game was released with thematic and graphical changes as \"Whomp \'Em\" for North American audiences. \"Saiyūki World 2: Tenjōkai no Majin\" (as well as Whomp \'Em) and the prior Saiyuki World (which was an adaptation of Wonder Boy in Monster Land) are based on the Journey to the West novel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zpv.jpg'),(17492,'Genie Gym','2023-11-01','Sport','SteamVR','Compete at one-on-one sports matches or solo in stylized arenas and themes. Use your Genie to master your skill, win matches, and exercise too! Come explore traditional game styles that have been reimagined for something new on the VR.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78wn.jpg'),(17493,'Dungeonlite Duelers',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dungeonlite Duelers is a new take on the battle royale genre that combines frenetic multiplayer action with the depth of dungeon crawling rogue-likes. It\'s simple to pick up but hard to master, with limitless builds and spell combos to learn and perfect. Never has outplaying your opponent felt this good!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17494,'Rose Riddle: Fairy Tale Detective','2019-08-22','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Rose Riddle solve the mystery of her missing parents and uncover the secrets of her past during a wild and wonderful road trip through a fairy tale realm!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yp6.jpg'),(17495,'Life is Strange: Before the Storm','2018-09-19','Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One','Life is Strange: Before the Storm is a new three part standalone story adventure set three years before the events of the first game. This time play as Chloe Price, a rebel who forms an unlikely friendship with Rachel Amber in dramatic new story in the BAFTA award winning franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1twj.jpg'),(17496,'Akatsuki no Goei Trinity: Complete Edition','2015-01-30','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is a complete collection of the Akatsuki no Goei trilogy which follows Asagari Kaito as he becomes a bodyguard to the stuck up Nikaidou Reika. The games deal with themes of social and financial inequality. The trinity version has an upgraded 720HD scaling to all of the images, as well as extra CGs, extra openings for both Game 1 and Game 3, a nice and neat interface, and the option to check out the OST of the game. The complete edition includes the 18+ scenes removed from the console releases of the trilogy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4srh.jpg'),(17497,'No Case Should Remain Unsolved','2024-09-19','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Twelve years after Senior Inspector Jeon Gyeong\'s retirement, she is visited by a young police officer: a woman who pleads with her to reexamine Seowon\'s case. But with each uncovered memory, only one thing becomes clear: everyone in Seowon\'s vicinity was lying.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89dp.jpg'),(17498,'I\'d rather be fishing','2022-05-15','Visual Novel','Web browser','A Short sorta visual novel like game about what we do with our free time\n\nMade in 72 hours for Mini Jam 106.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8op8.jpg'),(17499,'Raiden III: Digital Edition','2014-09-23','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Raiden III Digital Edition is a revival of the classic Raiden series of scrolling shooter games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y8v.jpg'),(17500,'Pokémon White 2 Randomizer',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cad.jpg'),(17501,'J.J. & Jeff','2007-06-15','Platform','Wii, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','You can be J.J. Or you can be Jeff. Either way, you\'re a wacko detective on a kidnap case who stumbles into some hilarious action. Clues and surprises pop up everywhere. Use your head, your foot (kicking things brings great results) and your secret weapon - the spray-can - on 30 different enemies. So grab some french fries for energy and get ready for action!\n\nJ.J. & Jeff Detective Agency are assigned the task of locating a missing rich man, and you can choose either J.J. or Jeff to go on the mission. Your partner doesn\'t like this one bit, so he decides to make a nuisance of himself along the way. Similar to Adventure Island, you must make your way through several levels, destroying wildlife along the way, but instead of using a hammer, you have three different ways to kill them: jump on or kick them, or when they are walking on the ground, blow gas out of them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xfs.jpg'),(17502,'American Truck Simulator: Heavy Cargo Pack','2017-06-07','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It takes more than a standard semi-trailer to deliver these loads! When a cargo gets heavy, it\'s time for more axles to satisfy the DOT and make it safely across that bridge! Introducing complex multi-joint trailers with jeeps and boosters spreading the weight of the cargo.\n\nNew cargoes:\n- Crawler Tractor (55,500 lb / 25 t)\n- Bulldozer (89,000 lb / 40 t)\n- Lift Truck Chassis (94,500 lb / 42 t)\n- Lift Truck (118,500 lb / 53 t)\n- Cable Reel (66,000 lb / 29 t)\n- Milling Machine (97,000 lb / 43 t)\n- All Terrain Crane (77,500 lb / 35 t)\n- Scraper (90,000 lb / 40 t)\n- Transformer (123,000 lb / 55 t)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ydi.jpg'),(17503,'Thor: The Dark World - The Official Game','2013-10-31','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Android, iOS','A mobile game based on the Marvel film Thor: The Dark World.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rlc.jpg'),(17504,'Lightale','2020-03-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lightale, with the collocation of action game and visual novel game, 90+ stages and 100+ illustrations, Lightale will bring you a great experience to enjoy the story. Use your wisdom to solve the mystery behind and unfold the truth of the story; Use your creative to create your battle strategy and overcome the battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lu1.jpg'),(17505,'Guardians of Eden','2024-03-08','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Guardians of Eden\": a tower defense cultivation game where you serve Valkyries, meeting their needs, and showcase strategic skills in battles by placing them strategically and allocating resources for success.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e14.jpg'),(17506,'Space Quest IV: Roger Wilco and the Time Rippers','1991-01-01','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, DOS, Amiga','May the farce be with you! Get ready for a trek through time with everybody\'s favorite intergalactic sanitation engineer and freelance hero, Roger Wilco. In their latest spaced-out space opera, the Two Guys From Andomeda take on science fiction (and just about everything else!) is a spoofy sendup that will leave you laughing.\n\nRoger Wilco embarks on a topsy-turvy trip through space and time in this fourth chapter in the award-winning Space Quest series, Roger Wilco and the Time Rippers. From a nostalgic look at his past in Space Quest I to a terrifying visit to the future of Space Quest XII, Roger\'s on the run again.\n\nAnd hot on his ion trail are the Sequel Police, deadly crosstime assassins who are out to put an end to Roger and all of his Space Quest nonsense once and for all.\n\nOnce again it\'s up to Roger Wilco to save his future- or is that his past?- of the Space Quest series, and keep the universe safe for fair play, bad jokes, and lots more Space Quest Games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v4t.jpg'),(17507,'Space Quest: The Sarien Encounter','1987-05-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Apple IIGS, Atari ST/STE, Mac, DOS, Amiga, Apple II','He\'s out to clean up the universe...\n\n...But he doesn\'t do windows. Strap into your computer station and prepare for blast-off. If the thrilling graphics don\'t blow you off your chair, the laughs will have you rolling on the floor. If you can help Roger Wilco he could use it.\n\nHey, wake up! Roger Wilco\'s the chief sanitation engineer (a.k.a. Janitor) on the starship Arcada. His mission: to scrub dirty decks... to replace burned-out lightbulbs... to boldly go where no man has swept the floor!\n\nBut while he was napping in the broom closet, his starship was hijacked by the Sarien Stormtroopers. Now the top-secret Star Generator\'s been stolen. And if Roger doesn\'t get it back, the universe as we know it is toast!\n\nKaboom! The Two Guys from Andromeda often travel the cosmos under the aliases of Scott Murphy and Mark Crowe. They\'re best known for their award-winning Space Quest series and their frequent sightings with Elvis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co321o.jpg'),(17508,'Clériga','2024-05-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After 82 years of Xyvran\'s defeat, Clériga must venture herself into her palace to repair the seal she put on the demon that prevented her infinite regeneration. This surreal horror experience puts you on edge as you need to find your way to the top of the castle while enemies slow you down, making you die slowly but surely, as your blood is being absorbed by the second.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8730.jpg'),(17509,'Cannoneer Girls','2025-12-31','Sin género','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o72.jpg'),(17510,'Brave Alchemist Colette','2020-04-28','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Alchemist apprentice Colette sets out on a path to help others with her skills to become a respected alchemist like her mentor. A most peculiar adventure unfolds as Colette encounters people from all walks of life, and behind all of these lies a sinister figure who intends to take the whole world into its grasp...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xgu.jpg'),(17511,'Dude Simulator 3','2019-08-28','Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dude Simulator 3 is an open world sandbox game. It is your friend’s birthday tomorrow. You have already bought him a present, now you only have to give it to him. But your friends lives in another city, quite far from you. So you are going to make a long trip, and there are lots of adventures waiting for you on your way there: you will have to earn money, communicate with some people, escape from prison, etc. Apart from the plot mode, in this game you can also explore various cities, find money and spend it on different things, ride cars, enter any buildings, buy something, make jokes on people around you, and so on. In general, you can do whatever can be done in real life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jr3.jpg'),(17512,'Prince or Villain','2023-06-27','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A slice of life BL about a patissier who loves to bake. Kai feels left out when Percy and Gavin grow closer with one another. One day, Lance appears into Kai\'s life with a plan to have him all to himself. Will Kai stay with Percy and Gavin, or will he choose Lance?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oia.jpg'),(17513,'Battle Wave 2323','2021-08-09','Tactical, Arcade','Web browser','Battle Wave 2323 empowers users to become owners in a DeFi-based social gaming economy, and earn real money. Win $ANRX through weekly battles and determine the fate of the AnRKey X Universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z9y.jpg'),(17514,'Rainbow Islands: The Story of Bubble Bobble 2','1987-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','Arcade, Game Boy Color, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, Amiga, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD, Amstrad CPC, Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Master System/Mark III','Rainbow Islands is a 1987 arcade game developed and published by Taito. The arcade version was licensed to Romstar for North American manufacturing and distribution. The game is subtitled \"The Story of Bubble Bobble 2\" and is the sequel to Taito\'s hit game Bubble Bobble from the previous year. It is the second of four arcade games in the Bubble Bobble series. The game was ported for numerous home computers and game consoles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sc9.jpg'),(17515,'Awkward Date Hero','2018-10-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You may be awkward, but so are they. This is your last resort for finding someone\nright for you. There are only five girls left, can at least one of them tolerate your nonsense?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54im.jpg'),(17516,'Overworld',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','A virtual reality fantasy simulation for socializing with other players in a single open world. A sandbox for creation and roleplaying.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3g99.jpg'),(17517,'Train Simulator 2021: BR Class 31 Loco','2013-05-23','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The classic Class 31 diesel locomotive was a versatile workhorse of the British railway network, and now this Brush Type 2 is available for Train Simulator 2021 in BR Railfreight Sector and preserved BR Green liveries. British Railways\' \'Pilot Scheme\' to replace steam traction saw 20 Type 2 diesel locomotives built by Brush Traction in 1957.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17518,'Uta no Prince-sama: All Star','2013-03-07','Music, Simulator, Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Spin-off game of Uta no Prince-sama Debut. The main characters in this game are supporting roles in the main series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pdg.jpg'),(17519,'Tybot Invasion: The Typing Runner','2021-06-09','Racing, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Type words quickly to destroy robots, move among lanes, and destroy all the enemy\'s waves on this invasion that mixes Typing & Run! The future of Robworld is in your hands, can you destroy all robots fast enough? Type for your life. Type for the future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31xn.jpg'),(17520,'Siege Survival: Gloria Victis','2021-05-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A medieval city under siege and a handful of civilians are all that keep the walls from falling. Mixing survival strategy and resource management, build your camp, craft supplies, and scavenge the occupied city to supply the last troops holding back the invaders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wt3.jpg'),(17521,'Craft the World: Lonely Mountain','2019-12-27','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','DLC Lonely Mountain adds a new world type to the game. Monsters have occupied a dwarven fortress and it\'s up to you to take back their home.\n\nYou\'re playing to survive. You won\'t be able to obtain and process unlimited quantities of ore, food, and other resources. You\'ll need to explore the looted fortress, clear away the rubble, and open hidden stashes in search of anything that might be even the least bit valuable.\n\nDLC features:\n\n- New campaign level designed for experienced players.\n- Dwarven fortress that looks like a large labyrinth of secret rooms.\n- Modified Tech Tree focused on repairing objects and equipment found inside the fortress.\n- Search for lathes and additional stockpiles to establish manufacturing and repair found objects.\n- New mechanic of the waves of monsters that appear out of the hidden passages inside the mountain.\n- Objects and structures in the new level can now be partially damaged or repaired.\n- New monsters and beasts as well as tons of new objects, structures, and building blocks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cau.jpg'),(17522,'Project Remedium','2017-08-29','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Project Remedium is a story-driven action shooter set inside a human body devastated by illness and bad circumstances - a post-apocalypse of sorts. Tiny one, but for a nanobot named Nano+, the body is the whole world. So he is hell-bent on fixing it with his guns and a unique grapnel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24qt.jpg'),(17523,'River Raid','1982-12-01','Shooter, Racing, Arcade','ColecoVision, Atari 2600, Atari 8-bit, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Intellivision, PC (Microsoft Windows), Atari 5200, DOS, Xbox 360, Legacy Mobile Device, MSX','Mission: Code Name River Raid. Jet down the river. Break the enemy blockade and blast the bridges to halt enemy troop advances. Terrain: Code Name River of No Return. An ever-changing, ever-challenging waterway. Expect huge islands, narrow channels and treacherous bays crawling with enemy choppers, tankers and jets. Weaponry: Code Name StratoStrafer. Your B1 StratoWing Assault Jet has been retrofitted with sophisticated, rapid-fire guided missiles. Your craft is super-sensitive to the stick. Accelerate, slow or bank radically with only a touch. Tactics: Jet low to the river to avoid radar. Stop periodically at depots to refuel. A warning claxxon will alert you. Top speed! Best of luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ilj.jpg'),(17524,'Harvest Moon: The Winds of Anthos - Tool Upgrade & New Interior Designs Pack','2023-11-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Customize the interior of your house with 3 new fabulous design themes! Mix and match them up to your heart\'s content! You\'ll also be able to upgrade your hoe, watering can, hammer, axe, sickle, fishing rod, and pick-axe an additional level, making growing crops, fishing, and mining a breeze!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c0v.jpg'),(17525,'Back to the Future: The Game - Episode 2: Get Tannen!','2011-03-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','The second episode of Telltale\'s new Back to the Future series. After hastily rescuing Doc Brown from 1931 and finding himself fading from history, Marty McFly must correct the timeline and preserve his own future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z1s.jpg'),(17526,'Pac-Man 99: Namco Classic 2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94va.jpg'),(17527,'Pikuniku: Collector\'s Edition','2019-01-24','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Buy Pikuniku Collector’s Edition. Include : - Pikuniku Soundtrack by Calum Bowen - Pikuniku Digital Comic by Mushbuh','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d1x.jpg'),(17528,'Riddle of the Sphinx: The Awakening - Enhanced Edition','2021-02-01','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Riddle of the Sphinx The Awakening is an Egyptian adventure into the Giza Sphinx & Great Pyramid - the last of the seven ancient wonders. Explore secret chambers, discover hidden tombs, unearth sacred relics, & unravel an ancient Riddle, entombed for centuries by the ancient Egyptians!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yj7.jpg'),(17529,'Pac-Man 99: New Rally-X',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94vc.jpg'),(17530,'Catherine: Stray Sheep Deluxe Edition','2011-02-17','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','The Stray Sheep Deluxe Edition is exclusive to the EU release of Catherine.\n\nIncludes game (with reversible cover of Catherine and Katherine), replica \'Rave\' t-shirt, two Stray Sheep coasters, and a poster of Catherine, packaged in a Stray Sheep Pizza Box.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60c4.jpg'),(17531,'Touhou Spell Bubble: Scarlet Devil Land Arrange Song Pack Vol.2','2022-09-15','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Nintendo Switch','\"Scarlet Devil Land Arrange Pack Vol.2”, a collection of popular arrangement tracks is here.\nFeaturing classics like “sweet little sister” and the much talked about “Scarlet Police on Ghetto Patrol 24PM”, this pack is filled with songs just as popular as those included in Phase 1.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5h20.jpg'),(17532,'Emily','2025-05-01','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Chat with a mysterious AI, uncover secret codes and find hidden files. Your choices may lead you to uncover different things, the only way to find the truth is through Emily and whatever was left inside the old computer. You need her help','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l1u.jpg'),(17533,'Pac-Man 99: The Legend of \"Valkyrie\"',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94vg.jpg'),(17534,'Backroom Beyond','2022-07-08','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Backroom Beyond is a first-person game that mixes puzzles with single-player adventure in a dark, harrowing environment that makes the player question the protagonist\'s sanity. Based on the internet myth, Backroom Beyond goes further and makes the player wonder if that journey is about something more personal than anything else.\n\nThe narrative has two main points. Drawings tell part of the game\'s story on the walls. The drawings have no defined authorship, which gives them an extra degree of strangeness. The second point is the existence of The Guide, a being that instigates the players to think about their actions in real life.\n\nThe game basically has one objective throughout its 40-level journey: place the red box over the red button and open the door to the next level. It seems simple at first, but it\'s not. Each environment has its own logic. If the players feel frustrated because something went wrong in their strategy, they can press the “wake up again\" button, which will return them to the beginning of the level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wzo.jpg'),(17535,'Plaque Attack','1983-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Atari 2600','Plaque Attack is a 1983 video game for the Atari 2600 that was made by Activision. Loosely based on Space Invaders, the player must prevent food from destroying teeth in a person\'s mouth. Steve Cartwright, who designed the game, said that game was meant to help people develop good dental habits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97gu.jpg'),(17536,'Telealiens',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Telealiens is a puzzle game about pushing things... at a distance. You control telekinetic aliens that can move objects by simply looking at them!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lel.jpg'),(17537,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s: Rewritten - 87\'','2023-02-22','Point-and-click, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','FNAF Rewritten: \'87 is a re-imagining of FNAF 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67lx.jpg'),(17538,'Deus Ex: Human Revolution - Director\'s Cut','2013-10-25','Shooter, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, Xbox 360','Deus Ex: Human Revolution - Director\'s Cut features approximately 8 hours of director\'s commentaries and a 45 minute “Making Of” video. It also features an improved visual engine and a complete overhaul of the boss battles.\n\nDeus Ex: Human Revolution - Director\'s Cut is an expanded game for Deus Ex: Human Revolution which is an action role-playing game. It is the third game in the Deus Ex series, and a prequel to the original Deus Ex (2000). The gameplay—combining first-person shooter, stealth, and role-playing elements—features exploration and combat in environments connected to multiple city-based hubs, in addition to quests that grant experience and allow customization of the main character\'s abilities with items called Praxis Kits. Conversations between characters feature a variety of responses, with options in conversations and at crucial story points affecting how some events play out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tgb.jpg'),(17539,'Proto_1987_01_IT','2025-04-10','Point-and-click, Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','A game about a prototype found by the Electronic Nexus for Conservation, Research and Observation of Arcade & Console History.\nThe player will play the game to document what\'s inside','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nt1.jpg'),(17540,'Pac-Man 99: Dig Dug',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94vf.jpg'),(17541,'With My Buddy','2025-05-01','Sin género','visionOS, iOS, Mac','Care for dogs and cats in this apple arcade-exclusive game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17542,'Tunguska: The Visitation - Complete Edition','2025-03-27','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Seek fortune as a Ghoul Hunter in an abandoned Soviet Exclusion Zone. Use your grit and ingenuity to survive deadly radiation, mysterious anomalies, and poisonous mutants. Go in guns-blazing, or stay in the shadows - your choice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m3i.jpg'),(17543,'Legendary Axe II','1990-09-07','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','The Axe is back ... with twice the force and twice the fury of 1988\'s classic TurboGrafx-16 videogame. This time it\'s brother against brother, locked in deadly combat. Your older brother has summoned forces of unspeakable evil to take control of the kingdom. Treachery rules! Your only hope is the legendary royal sword. But will its power be enough to overcome the Cliffs of Chaos? The Skull Dungeon? And the treacherous Crypts of Slime? Only your courage, your fighting skill, and the Legendary Axe can answer that challenge!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6iem.jpg'),(17544,'Need for Speed: ProStreet','2007-11-13','Racing','PlayStation 2','Compete at the highest level of street racing with Need for Speed ProStreet. It’s no longer good enough to simply rule your local neighborhood; you need to dominate on a global stage. Build the ultimate battle machine, take it to multi-disciplinary showdowns and pit your skills and reputation against the world’s best street racers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fyh.jpg'),(17545,'Koala Lumpur: Journey to the Edge','1997-12-31','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Koala Lumpur, a silly and twisted tongue-in-cheek ride until the very last screen, is well worth your time. The game centres around a Zen Master koala named Koala Lumpur and his friend, a dingo named Dr. Dingo Tu-Far in their quest to prevent the apocalypse caused by Koala Lumpur\'s mistaken utterance of a mystic incantation. To perform this feat, Koala and Dr. Dingo must collect pieces of the lost scroll of cartoon prophesies spread out over four stages; Search for Dr. Dingo Land of lost things Stream of consciousness Eye in the sky The style of the game is wacky from start to finish, for example, Koala Lumpur stores any items picked up in his seemingly bottomless fez, and the cursor of the mouse is a fly which at several points must be flown into Dr. Dingo\'s brain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bhgtsugr82ayrqzwdwif.jpg'),(17546,'Pac-Man 99: Galaga',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94ve.jpg'),(17547,'River City: Knights of Justice','2017-06-20','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','\"River City: Knights of Justice, known in Japan as Nekketsu Mahou Monogatari, is scheduled to launch as a 3DS e-Shop exclusive this summer. Kunio and his friends go medieval in this unique entry to the River City series as they are transformed into heroes and villains that would be at home in any RPG! Players will use swords, staves, and even magic to bring peace back to Riverandia!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27wk.jpg'),(17548,'Sandmason','2014-05-04','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are a mine worker, stuck deep in an underground cave system. All you have is your hi-tech mining tools. In order to get out of the caves you have to shape the dynamic environment to your advantage. You can also create force fields for different purposes. Roast enemies with the laser field or jump higher with the bouncy field, for example.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/arjsppj4mppshe5x4acj.jpg'),(17549,'Chernobylite','2021-09-28','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Chernobylite is a science-fiction survival horror experience, mixing the free exploration of its disturbing world with challenging combat, unique crafting, and non-linear storytelling. Play as a physicist, one of the Chernobyl Power Plant\'s ex-employees, and investigate the mysterious disappearance of your beloved. Try to survive and reveal the contamination zone\'s twisted secrets. Remember, the military presence is not your only concern.\n\nGet ready for a thrilling adventure of survival, conspiracy, horror, love, and obsession. One that will prove to you that it\'s not about how you face your fears, it\'s about how you survive them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39vi.jpg'),(17550,'Rocket Power: Team Rocket Rescue','2001-09-04','Sport','PlayStation','Based on the successful Nickelodeon cartoon series, Rocket Power: Team Rocket Rescue for PlayStation features Otto, Reggie, Sam, and Twister displaying their Xtreme sports talents for players as they try to save Ray Rocket\'s business from the competition. Since Ray Rocket\'s new line of boards is not gaining exposure, the team decides to advertise by entering local competitions under his name. Players control any of the four characters to snowboard, skateboard, bike, and inline skate through 16 levels of single-player story mode, free play, or Titos Challenge. Performing tricks and completing tasks as Team Rocket tries to help Raymondo will progress players through the game.\n\nIn Story Mode, the chosen character must complete tasks such as finding bike parts, collecting flags, and navigating through gates in a downhill snowbaord challenge. Performing tricks to earn high scores is another included task. Each level is timed and the tasks must be completed before the time runs out in order to win and progress to the next level. Mad Town and the ski slopes are some of the areas the team will visit in Story Mode with the main objective being to advertise the 2001 line of Rocket Boards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/thnum6gcyg7hsnvzl439.jpg'),(17551,'Roka Blocks Game - Fun & Hexagon Puzzle',NULL,'Puzzle','iOS','New hexagon puzzle game is now more colorful and available on Apple Store. Download this free fun puzzle game and show who is smart to the world! The only thing you need to place hexagonal block puzzles correctly.\nThere are 4 different level and 60 different maps for each levels in the game. You will never forget experience of “Roka Blocks Game - Fun & Hexagon Puzzle”!\n\nYou will have a lot of fun with our game, which is different than similar fun puzzle games. If you play the game once, you will never want to quit the game with enjoyable graphics and increasingly challenging levels.\n\nHow to play “Roka Blocks Game - Fun & Hexagon Puzzle” ?\n\nThere is a frame and hexagonal block puzzles for every map. Your aim is to place correctly these puzzles to frame. When you place all of the hexagonal block puzzles correctly, a new map will be waiting for you! The game is one of the best fun puzzle game in the world.\n\nWe work hard to provide best game experience for our users. With enjoyable music and sound effects, we tried to make the game more entertaining. You can get tip rewards by watching rewarded video. These tips will you help in harder maps.\n\nFeatures of “Roka Blocks Game - Fun & Hexagon Puzzle”\n\n* Most downloaded hexagon puzzle game in a short time\n* Enjoyable graphics & sound\n* 4 different levels, 60 different maps for each level\n* Increasingly harder maps\n* Easy to play, no need many hours to learn\n* Improve your intelligence\n* Tips that make game easier\nHave a good time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/rlc9boz0mr6yhsjdeb0w.jpg'),(17552,'Ikinari Maou','2021-12-23','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','The story begins with a battle with the Demon King, the final boss!\nHowever, the hero is only \"Level 1\"\nso there\'s no way he can win!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mim.jpg'),(17553,'Pac-Man 99: The Tower of Druaga',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94vd.jpg'),(17554,'Belladonna','2015-02-27','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Belladonna is a gothic adventure game, twisted and dark. Take the role of a corpse girl rising from the dead in an abandoned laboratory, and unravel the mysteries concerning your own death and reanimation.\n\nThe game explores various themes, such as the role of villains and heroes, moral value systems and different kinds of horror. It’s a point-and-click adventure, and it will ask you to read longer texts which are inspired in style by Mary Shelley’s novel, Frankenstein or The Modern Prometheus. This game is not scary in the way in which a Hollywood horror flick is scary, but it is certainly no child’s play. The story goes into an eerie place beyond life and death, and puts you into the mind of the unliving creatures and their worldviews.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pjm.jpg'),(17555,'Nomads of Driftland','2020-12-07','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nomads of Driftland is an RTS game initially created as an add-on to Driftland: The Magic Revival. Since it is significantly different from the base game, it was released as standalone expansion available for free. \n \nBase game - Driftland: The Magic Revival is a unique fusion of RTS, 4X strategy, and Sim genres in a fantasy world made up of the shattered planet. The player takes on the role of a powerful mage-ruler capable of moving and reshaping parts of the planet. Both game mechanics and history are based on an innovative concept of dynamic topography and issuing orders to individuals with free will. \n \nNomads do not have a ruler and do not carry out orders like other races in the base game. Units are managed directly, like in classic RTS games. New unit types/classes affect strategy on the battlefield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lex.jpg'),(17556,'Crush','2017-06-09','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crush is an old-school-styled shoot´em up. \nThe game leads you through 7 challenging levels filled \nwith action and great soundtracks. \n \nA must for all old-school shoot´em up fans! \n \nFEATURES \n- From the developers of Crush (C64) and Turrican 3 (C64) \n- 7 challenging levels \n- 3 different weapon systems \n- Single mega-weapon for each weapon system \n- giant boss for each level \n- exclusive soundtrack by Markus Siebold (Turrican 2 C64, Enforcer C64) \n- detailed levels and enemies','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2s5a.jpg'),(17557,'The Banner Saga 3: Eternal Arena','2018-12-12','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take up your axe and enter the Eternal Arena and quick-play new, unique challenges! Customize your own maps, rules, and enemies to create unique tests of skill. Become the stuff of legends by conquering the weekly tournament and competing against the world for the high score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h65.jpg'),(17558,'Anthropomachy','2019-11-01','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get ready for conquering the world as a God! Show compassion to those who have nothing and they will love you. Take from those who have everything and they will fear you. Gain worshipers, fight skepticism and make the Earth belong to the gods once again! Long live the Greek Gods!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lk2.jpg'),(17559,'Try Them All!','2025-04-18','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A mysterious box is locked with a 4 to 8-digit code.Your only goal is to open it—with your own hands. No hints. No puzzles.But who needs them? If you try every number up to 9999... eventually, it will open.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qim.jpg'),(17560,'Ice Age: Scrat\'s Nutty Adventure','2019-10-18','Platform, Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In Ice Age: Scrat’s Nutty Adventure, Scrat, the calamitous sabre-toothed squirrel, will embark on an epic quest through classic Ice Age locations to recover his cherished acorn from the ancient Scratazon Temple. Only the legendary Crystal Nuts can unlock his prized possession, which Scrat will attempt to collect as he faces fierce prehistoric creatures, to return the missing relics to their rightful home. Players will guide Scrat through a perilous journey across icy terrains,raging geysers, and burning lava. Explore adventure-packed locations to discover treasures that unlock special powers and help Scrat to jump higher, grab heavier objects and find every last treasure in this all new Nutty adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24cs.jpg'),(17561,'Daring Dungeoneer','2021-01-29','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Arcade, Card & Board Game','Legacy Mobile Device','Dive deep into dungeons in this Card Battle RPG. If you are defeated, you lose everything you gained in that dungeon. The big question is, do you \"Dare to Dungeon\" or do you flee with what you\'ve gained? You decide when enough is enough in this exhilarating game of \"chicken\" between you and the dungeon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sae.jpg'),(17562,'Rust\'N Ruin',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Dive into \'Rust’N Ruin\' an atmospheric 3D adventure in a post-apocalyptic steampunk world. Sneak and run through a world where all living creatures have turned against humans. Dodge monsters, and robots; find a way home. Be quick in danger and be clever with puzzles. Brace for boss epic battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6z7a.jpg'),(17563,'EverQuest: Lost Dungeons of Norrath','2003-09-09','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lost Dungeons of Norrath is the sixth expansion for the popular MMORPG EverQuest.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mvr3dlpnbgrqpsmi9ibc.jpg'),(17564,'Nyaaaanvy','2022-04-22','Fighting, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Physics sumo-wrestling game! A heated battle for dignity among mysterious cat-like creatures. Nyanvy who wins the battle can be a true cat!! Could it be...?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vy5.jpg'),(17565,'Black Mirror: Thronglets','2025-04-01','Sin género','Android, iOS','Cross over into the world of \"Black Mirror\" and experience \"Thronglets,\" the retro virtual pet simulation at the center of the Season 7 episode \"Plaything.\" These pixel art critters won\'t just take over your phone; they could take over your life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9or4.jpg'),(17566,'Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Relics of War: Chaos Space Marines','2019-07-18','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warhammer 40,000: Gladius is back with a new playable faction, the Chaos Space Marines.Fueled by their hatred for the Imperium, they will stop at nothing before they exact their revenge. Fielding hellish machines, wielding Warp powers and possessing the experience of a thousand wars, these ancient warriors are ready to conquer Gladius...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dx0.jpg'),(17567,'Elite Beat Agents','2007-05-03','Music, Sport','Nintendo DS','The public knows of government agencies like the FBI and CIA, but little is known of this super-secret agency. Code-named \"Elite Beat Agents\", these men in black are heroes\' heroes and the coolest group of guys this world has ever known. Of course, according to official records, they do not exist. Their leader, an ex-CIA agent named Commander Kahn, scans the world for cries of help. When he finds one, he dispatches the agents, who assist their targets by performing a song and dance. The hypnotic nature of their rocking revives the targets with \"Groovy\" energy that boosts their willpower and helps them overcome their obstacles. In each stage, the agents arrive in a special \"Beat Transport\" and must tap and trace patterns that appear on-screen to the beat of the music to save the day.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dyd.jpg'),(17568,'Shineg in the Zombies','2017-08-25','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a survival game, wake up from a nightmare Shine need in the warehouse, restaurants, arsenal, laboratory and other rooms continue to collect weapons, food, ammunition, drugs. Everything is in order to be able to live in front of the emerging zombies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79gq.jpg'),(17569,'Perspective','2021-05-21','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A unique 3D puzzle game where two players are stuck in a maze and have different perspectives on the obstacles ahead. Players 1s maze is different from players 2s.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3v9t.jpg'),(17570,'I Will Return','2025-04-07','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qjt.jpg'),(17571,'The Coma 2: Vicious Sisters','2020-01-28','Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Coma 2: Vicious Sisters is a Korean survival horror-adventure. As Mina Park, you must venture from your deserted school to survive. Explore the surrounding Sehwa district to uncover the shadow realm\'s secrets and avoid the psychotic killer hellbent on ending your life!\n\nThe Coma 2: Vicious Sisters is an atmospheric, story-driven game. Immerse yourself in the warped Sehwa district as you encounter an engaging cast of characters, solve puzzles, discover revealing clues, and fight for survival against a relentless psycho.\n\nHeroines, forced to confront their worst fears, rarely emerge unscathed. Over the course of the story, Mina will encounter dangerous scenarios from which she could sustain permanent damage. Craft items to anticipate future dangers to avoid injury.\n\nDark Song is now more fearsome and powerful than ever before. Falling into her grasp could spell instant death. Running and wielding your flashlight makes you an easy target. You must precariously balance the urgency of exploration with your absolute need to survive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1oew.jpg'),(17572,'Super Smash Bros. for Wii U: Geno Hat + Geno Outfit','2015-12-15','Sin género','Wii U','There aren\'t any Star Pieces to collect here, but you can make an epic journey of your very own with Geno\'s costume from the Super Mario RPG: Legend of the Seven Stars game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94w5.jpg'),(17573,'Warhammer 40,000: Gladius - Ultima Founding','2024-12-10','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Primaris are ready to step in the battle for the God Emperor and the Holy Throne. Eight new units and unique gameplay mechanics will give you more options for the fight for Gladius Prime.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94yy.jpg'),(17574,'Arrow Heads','2017-09-21','Fighting, Shooter, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Arrow Heads is a fast paced multiplayer archery game, played from an isometric perspective. The game pits you against your avian counterparts in a heated deathmatch scenario. Should you find yourself against superior birds we have included five power ups that should help give your opponents the kick-in-the-pants they deserve. Join your friends on this zany 2-4 player adventure, where the chaotic moments wait around the corner. Whether you are slinging arrows or bear traps, the game will leave you wanting to come back for more!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23nw.jpg'),(17575,'Bishoujo Senshi Sailor Moon Sailor Stars: Fuwa-fuwa Panic 2','1996-09-27','Puzzle','Super Famicom','Bishoujo Senshi Sailor Moon Sailor Stars: Fuwa-fuwa Panic 2 is a video game released exclusively in Japan by Bandai on September 27, 1996. the Super Famicom and is the sequel to Sailor Moon SuperS: Fuwa Fuwa Panic. The game made use of Bandai\'s SuFami Turbo accessory and could not be played without it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ia5.jpg'),(17576,'Wreckfest: Deluxe Edition','2019-09-25','Racing, Sport, Indie','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Wreckfest: Deluxe Edition is an expanded version of the original Wreckfest game developed by Bugbear Entertainment. This edition includes the base game and the Season Pass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sa0.jpg'),(17577,'HuniePop 2: Double Date','2021-02-08','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take a trip to an exotic island paradise for a steamy new adventure in this long awaited sequel to the popular dating sim / puzzle game hybrid, HuniePop!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x87.jpg'),(17578,'Naughty Geese',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Naughty Geese is a 2D pixel art platformer. You control a biker goose who tries to keep his offspring safe from predators. As they like to escape and enjoy the scenery, Dad needs to go after his \"Naughty Geese\" every time. Enjoy unique gameplay that pays homage to classics of the genre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bmx.jpg'),(17579,'Treasure Chest Corps: Fight Demons to Restore the Barrier','2019-05-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Treasure Chest Corps: Fight Demons to Restore the Barrier\" is a 2D action game, you can choose one of three weapons to use in combat. At the same time, you have three reliable teammates to help you overcome the difficulties. Completely random equipment system, to create a unique role.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96vw.jpg'),(17580,'Storia Stories','2020-10-23','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Included in the Story Me app.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6s5z.jpg'),(17581,'Maxi Bus','2022-09-19','Arcade','Android','In this game you play as a bus collecting passengers and delivering them to their destinies while avoiding all the obstacles that the city has.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17582,'Recharge','2025-06-30','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Recharge is an RC car racing game built with Unreal Engine and ray tracing, offering realistic graphics. Designed for both RC enthusiasts and casual players, it combines thrilling races, deep customization, and diverse game modes—blending precision with excitement for a dynamic racing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g7i.jpg'),(17583,'FloatingPoint',NULL,'Shooter','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A free game playable anywhere','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4m7t.jpg'),(17584,'Red Cap Squad: Zombie Source','2025-04-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Red Cap Squad: Zombie Source is a hardcore survival roguelike auto-shooter game. Assemble a unique team, strategically utilize traps and mechanisms, and endure the endless waves of zombies to emerge victorious!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o8s.jpg'),(17585,'Logan Kart 8','2015-06-08','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Satiricial Mario Kart 8 fangame featuring bizarre self-insert and parody characters, a wonky physics engine, and a melancholy soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ecm.jpg'),(17586,'APB','1989-12-31','Shooter, Racing, Arcade','Amstrad CPC','A port of the Arcade game APB for Amstrad CPC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sr4.jpg'),(17587,'Gearbits: Raider Expedition','2024-10-10','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Gearbits: Raider expedition is an expansion campaign for Gearbits. The campaign is a side-story, taking place after the end of Gearbits. The expansion features new missions and maps. A new cast of characters and new playable units.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w9q.jpg'),(17588,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Manhattan Missions','1991-06-01','Adventure','DOS','Shredder wants to rule Manhattan, so he\'s saturated the neighborhoods with his henchemen. The heroes in a half-shell must out-ninja Shredder and his thugs before time\'s up in Times Square!\n\nPut your best moves to the test against Bebop, Rocksteady, Triceratons, moussers, foot soldiers, gangs and assorted villains in 15 challenging missions.\n\nFor the first time ever two turtles can join forces to take on the enemy packed streets as a team. Choose Leonardo, Raphael, Michaelangelo or Donatello to shell out each turtle\'s unique ninja talents.\n\nTime is not on your side. You\'ve got to beat the clock as you round up clues and battle it out in the real time fight sequences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lf9.jpg'),(17589,'Super Magbot','2021-06-22','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Super Magbot is a precision platformer with no jumping! Players will have to traverse four distinct worlds with new mechanics and challenges unlocking along the way.\n\nLearn how to use Super Magbot\'s magnetic powers and use the different magnets to beat more than 150 levels.\n\nEnjoy unique challenging mechanics with classic 16-bit gaming vibes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xtc.jpg'),(17590,'Punch Line: Cheermancy Edition','2018-08-31','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','The Rice Exclusive Cheermancy Edition comes with a copy of the game, a collector\'s box, an artbook, the official soundtrack, Chiranosuke\'s cat collar and pendant, a Japanese Punch Line logo keychain, and a full-size rubber pigeon head mask!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7z05.jpg'),(17591,'Momentum',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Arcade','Sin plataforma','Momentum is a turn based, real time action roguelite where your reflexes matter as much as your strategy. Pick the perfect hand out of various weapons that synergize with unique relics to find the perfect build, and you just might make your way to the end to defeat the Lost King!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17592,'Exoracer','2022-07-01','Platform, Racing, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Exoracer is a fast-paced multiplayer platformer game where you compete for the world record. Play on short and fun levels to get the best time as you can. Compete in short races to climb up the trophy road!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5egi.jpg'),(17593,'Gamlet','2004-10-01','Adventure','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An interactive fiction interpretation of the Hamlet story, blended with Jewish culture and mysticism.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17594,'Draft Day Sports: Pro Basketball 2023','2022-11-23','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Draft Day Sports: Pro Basketball 2023 puts you in the role of general manager of your favorite basketball team. Every decision can be made by you from drafting, trading, signing free agents all the way to making each substitution to lead your team to championship glory and becoming a dynasty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5urg.jpg'),(17595,'The Crawler','2024-05-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the middle of a forest, a group of kids stop by a supermarket to grab some snacks. As they wander through the aisles, strange things start to happen. They soon realize they are not alone. The main character must uncover the secrets of the supermarket and find a way out before it’s too late.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hiw.jpg'),(17596,'Don\'t Feed It','2025-04-17','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A derelict house. The door is chained shut—there’s a gap in the floor. Something is calling to you from below. Your heart feels like it\'s about to explode with each passing day. You try to breathe, but it feels like you\'re running out of oxygen. The air smells of rot. You don\'t remember how long you\'ve been here, only that you have one very specific purpose: Feed it.\n\nYou have 10 days to complete your task, not counting the nights, of course. They told you to feed it during the day, not during the night. Nights are too terrifying.\nDays are short here. You exist only to feed it...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qku.jpg'),(17597,'iDigging','2025-05-07','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In iDigging, you’ll balance treasure hunting, home improvement, and the strategy of hiding from curious neighbors and authorities. Upgrade, dig, and create your best life despite all the challenges!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9giy.jpg'),(17598,'Super Smash Bros. for Nintendo 3DS: Ashley Hat + Ashley Outfit','2016-02-03','Sin género','Nintendo 3DS','The Ashley Set from WarioWare is now available!\nDress up just like her with her pigtails and red dress! Maybe you can become cute like her too!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94w0.jpg'),(17599,'Dashosaur DX','2025-04-23','Platform','Game Boy Color','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qyl.jpg'),(17600,'Hispalis Cardgame','2025-04-25','Card & Board Game','Android','Developed by the creators of the original fangame, this app will be updated and growing every month with new updates.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qhv.jpg'),(17601,'The Scarecrow',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The Scarecrow is a single player game with elements of survival. The main character will have to collect all the items, navigate through moving and static platforms to reach the next level. Player needs to think through each step. Beware of hostile characters, do not step on spikes and avoid falling icicles. \nThe essence of the game is to collect all the gifts at a level, after which you go to the next level. Good luck!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17602,'Just Dance: Vitality School','2016-08-17','Music','Android, iOS','Just Dance: Vitality School was a Chinese exclusive game in the Just Dance series. The game served as a replacement for Just Dance Now for Chinese markets and featured various exclusive songs from Chinese musicians.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ig0.jpg'),(17603,'Paris 1313: The Mystery of Notre-Dame Cathedral','1999-12-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Paris 1313 is an adventure game, revolving around a mysterious accident at Notre-Dame cathedral in Paris. As you progress through the game, you play as three different characters, each involved in the mystery in different ways. There\'s Jacques, a young goldsmith, Pierre, a young horseman who wants to join the King\'s Army, and Rosemonde, a dancer. Most of the game is a straightforward point-and-click adventure game, where you talk to people for information and clues, and find items that you use to solve puzzles. There are also a few arcade-like elements, such as climbing up a chimney and target practice with a bow and arrow. The game progresses in a series of chapters. In each chapter, you must perform a certain task with at least two characters in order to proceed. \n \nThis game contains animated cutscenes and voice over work.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i79.jpg'),(17604,'PyRunner','2023-07-24','Sin género','Android','Welcome to PyRunner, an endless-runner game where you join PyGuy in a fun and challenging adventure to retrieve his dropped pies! Help him navigate through a shut-down highway, filled with obstacles and... other stuff...\n\nCollect Pies: PyGuy needs your help to gather as many pies as he can. The more pies you collect, the higher your score and the more options you have to unlock W features.\n\nSlide Under Obstacles: Test your reflexes and agility as you slide under barriers and fences to avoid obstacles that come your way. Quick thinking is the key to success!\n\nAvoid Cars: Beware of cars passing through! Dodge the oncoming vehicles. slide through narrow gaps to keep PyGuy safe on his pie-retrieving mission.\n\nTrade Pies for Unique Power-Ups: Exchange your collected pies for awesome power-ups. Activate a shield for protection, slow-down time, and more!\n\nCustomize PyGuy: Show off your style by customizing PyGuy with various outfits. Pick look that fits your style as you run through the highway.\n\nCompete for the Highest Pie Count: Get as much as you can. If you think you have enough, you are mistaken.\n\nJoin PyGuy on his thrilling adventure in PyRunner! I mean, it\'s a guy running for pies. How dare you pass? Download now and help him reclaim his dropped pies. It\'s time to run, slide, and collect your way to victory! Are you up for the challenge? Let\'s get started!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17605,'The Pink Panther: Hokus Pokus Pink','1998-12-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A point and click adventure game on PC starring the Pink Panther.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k0g.jpg'),(17606,'Stray Cats in Cozy Town','2024-08-08','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Cozy Town, where every day is International Cat Day! Be a part of a village community where every stray is respected, loved and fed. Explore the charming streets and alleys to discover all the stray cats in this hidden-object game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dvl.jpg'),(17607,'Akuto: Showdown','2019-12-25','Fighting, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Akuto: Showdown is an award-nominated, isometric, fast-paced action game where players compete with swords and guns in intense versus matches. The game is set on low poly, diorama arenas where players have to not only watch out for opponents, but also for the environment from killing them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t2o.jpg'),(17608,'Battle Chef Brigade Deluxe','2018-08-28','Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Victusia, where the members of the elite Battle Chef Brigade are revered for their ability to skillfully take down monsters and transform their kills into delicious cuisine! But getting in isn\'t easy chefs from across Victusia must vie for their spot in a high stakes competition. Follow two contestants, Mina and Thrash, as their journeys through the tournament unfold. In order to become a Brigadier you\'ll need to hunt monsters with combo-based attacks and prepare your freshly-caught ingredients in puzzle-based cooking challenges to serve up winning dishes to the judges – all while the round clock ticks down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fv9.jpg'),(17609,'Nizhan Future',NULL,'Shooter','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Nizhan Future is Tencent Games’ upcoming sci-fi shooter title. Under the development of TiMi Studios, the game will take you on a futuristic adventure with multiple game modes on offer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7vde.jpg'),(17610,'Diner Dash 2: Restaurant Rescue','2006-05-11','Puzzle, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Diner Dash 2: Restaurant Rescue is the second installment to the popular game series Diner Dash preceded by Diner Dash. It is published by PlayFirst, like all other Diner Dash series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zi9.jpg'),(17611,'Soggy Beans',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Fish will come, fish will go. Take photos, collect beans, decorate your seascape, then relax or do other things while your friends swim by in this calming side-idler.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90re.jpg'),(17612,'Click the Chick','2024-07-28','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The chick hungers for the click! Are you ready to click it and be the clicker of the chick?! Chirp, Chirp, Chirp!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kju.jpg'),(17613,'Car Challenger','2017-04-30','Racing','Web browser','Car Challenger is a free 3D skill driving browser game. \nEvery track has a limit within which a player must complete 1 map round. To achieve it, there is usually need to adjust car behaviour - a player can use a limited number of free points to improve engine performance, tires traction, breaks or stearing. \n \n- The game contains 3 different cars with different driven axle (RWD, FWD, AWD) and 3 tracks to overcome. \n- The game is inspired by Trackmania.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yyq.jpg'),(17614,'Escape the Pacific','2018-02-23','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re on your own in the most advanced and complex survival game to date. Discover the cluster based endless world and face the most challenging weather system taken from the real Pacific! Master the realistic sailing and navigate using triangulation and a Sextant. Protect your fire. Fight for your life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27r3.jpg'),(17615,'Forest Grove','2023-11-29','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','A teenage heiress has gone missing. Foul play is suspected. Uncover a cast of characters, collect evidence, and find the truth in this futuristic detective game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gkx.jpg'),(17616,'Royale Storm Bowling','2019-03-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Flick & target carefully to save the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jot.jpg'),(17617,'Museums of History','2025-04-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore history like never before in Museums of History! Customize your avatar, solve puzzles, collect virtual passport stamps, and connect with players worldwide in this immersive multiplayer adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o8m.jpg'),(17618,'Power Rangers: Battle for the Grid - Collector\'s Edition','2019-03-26','Fighting','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A modern take on the 25 year franchise, Power Rangers: Battle for the Grid showcases stunning graphics with vivid details. Pit current and classic Rangers and villains like never before in team battles. Test your skills online against friends and players from around the world for endless replayability. A streamlined combat system welcomes newcomers with simplified controls while maintaining depth for the most dedicated competitor to learn and master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1shc.jpg'),(17619,'Brain Age Express: Math','2009-06-19','Sin género','Nintendo DSi','Dr Kawashima brings his popular brain exercise software to Nintendo DSi, with fun, new features and the return of many Brain Training favourites!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dsv.jpg'),(17620,'Twin Robots','2015-08-04','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, PlayStation Vita','Twin Robots is a 2.5D platformer (the graphics are 3D but the gameplay is 2D) for 1 or 2 players.\n\nIn this unique game you have to escape - on your own or together with a friend - from a dangerous factory. Switch between two cute little robots and help out each other to overcome obstacles and solve puzzles, or play with a friend in the splitscreen co-op mode. The factory is filled with traps that were only created to stop malfunctioning robots from their escape. It\'s not a complete robot nightmare though; if you explore a bit you may also find super-batteries that recharge your battery life. Rescue your friend and find the exit in 28 dark and dangerous stages!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5y9v.jpg'),(17621,'Grand Theft Auto: Vice City - 10th Anniversary Edition','2012-12-06','Adventure, Arcade','Android, iOS','Welcome back to Vice City. Welcome back to the 1980s.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fcy.jpg'),(17622,'Filmechanism','2021-12-15','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A 2D puzzle action game where you aim to clear a stage by restore it after record it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zo1.jpg'),(17623,'ZenGM Baseball','2022-06-22','Sport','Web browser, Android','A free, browser-based sports management game where you are the general manager of a baseball team of your choice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gwr.jpg'),(17624,'Silent Hill: Homecoming','2009-02-27','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Silent Hill: Homecoming is the sixth installment in the Silent Hill survival horror series. The gameplay is the same as it\'s previous entries, where the player searches for objects and uses weapons to defend against grotesque monsters while solving puzzles to advance further into the game. In terms of combat, the player is able to perform light and heavy attacks or mix them to perform combinations. For the first time in the series, the player may select responses when engaging in dialogue with other characters encountered in the game, which in turn may affect how the player sees the plot unfold.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vyn.jpg'),(17625,'Dungeon Fighter Online: Dynasty Guardian Pack',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','A special DLC: from Dynasty Guardian avatars to steam exclusive aura avatar, the package contains various useful CERA items! This offer will be available for a limited period of time.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17626,'Touhou Danmaku Kagura: Phantasia Lost - Extra Song Pack 4','2024-02-07','Shooter, Music, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Extra Song Pack with 27 songs that include the original \"Septette for a Dead Princess\"\n\nThis is additional content that enables the following songs:\n- Mishaguji Empire\n- Lezamari demo tsurakunai!!\n- Akutagawa Ryuunosuke no Kappa\n- Kyouen\n- Charisma Rengoku Tenshin\n- Getsurei 11.3 no Candle Magic\n- GAME OVER (In Disarray)\n- Romantic Fall feat. Ayakura Mei','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97z1.jpg'),(17627,'Uprising: Join or Die','2016-05-19','Shooter, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Uprising offers more strategy than a military sim, and more action strategy than a shoot\'em up. Using your hi-tech assault tank, loaded with powerful weapons, you need to establish tidal bases, mine for power, build factories and direct legions of allied units against the enemy','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oqa.jpg'),(17628,'Maybe: Interactive Stories - Remarried Empress','2019-07-23','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Remarried Empress is based off of the novel and webtoon of the same name. Covering the events of the original novel, you control and play as Navier Troby, Empress of the Eastern Empire. Struggling to stay on top of her duties as Empress whilst her husband dotes constantly on his new concubine, Navier riddles with the looming threat of the ever-increasing chance of being deposed by the man she promised her life to. Will she be able to find her own happy ending, or will she be doomed to become a forgotten piece of history as the ex-lover of the Emperor?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5shm.jpg'),(17629,'Little Mage',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Little Mage is an action-packed 2D Metroidvania where you play as an Æther Mage in a beautifully hand-drawn, high fantasy world. Explore the shattered city of Hornedrose, unleash elemental magic, battle fearsome bosses, and uncover the secrets of a world on the brink of destruction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ree.jpg'),(17630,'Love Date','2019-06-17','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17631,'Lost Sphear','2018-01-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','\"The next evolution in this new golden age of JRPG’s arrives with LOST SPHEAR, bringing a fresh take on classic RPG gameplay! A young man, who suffered a phenomenon that he had never seen, faces an ominous power that threatens the fabric of reality. Awaken the power of Memory to restore what was lost! Muster different Memory and craft the world around you in a journey to save the world.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pwu.jpg'),(17632,'Sora','2010-08-15','Shooter, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Sora tells the story of its namesake: the lone enhanced human, Sora, and her struggle to protect a fading world. Enjoy breathtakingly fast-paced combat in the Suguri universe, with improved game system and graphics along with original trance music by DEKU.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54ic.jpg'),(17633,'Stargears',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','STARGEARS is a sci-fi RTS set on an alien world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l6i.jpg'),(17634,'Gunship Battle: Total Warfare',NULL,'Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Battle enemy units to defend your base and save the world. Gunship Battle is now back as a new MMO Strategy game, Gunship Battle Total Warfare!\n\nBecome an Admiral and lead your troops to end the battle and dominate the ocean.\n\nGame Features:\n\nBUILD YOUR ARMY BASE\n\n- Build powerful Ships, Jets, and Armor Units and form your own strategy against Armada.\n\n- Defend your Headquarters from incoming enemies trying to take over your land.\n\n- Battle Real-time PvP with other Admirals from around the world.\n\nCUSTOMIZE YOUR ARMY\n\n- Camouflage your Ships with your own design and patterns.\n\n- Research various subjects and advance battle strategies.\n\nJOIN ALLIANCE\n\n- Dominate the ocean by creating or joining an alliance and assemble an unstoppable force.\n\n- Help your Alliance by supporting their actions.\n\nRule over not only the ocean but also the sky with your army!\n\nDownload now to start your new journey as Admiral.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99zt.jpg'),(17635,'The Glitched Attraction','2022-10-07','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the new Fazbear Horror Attraction! Here, you will have to escape from the popular and safe animatronics of the old but improved Fazbear Entertainment! Complete the puzzles and get out of the rooms before time runs out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66o9.jpg'),(17636,'Pro Evolution Soccer 2016: 20th Anniversary Edition','2015-09-18','Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4','The 20th Anniversary Edition includes a collectors\' SteelBook and exclusive digital content for myClub.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5osu.jpg'),(17637,'Space Moonshiner',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','A combination of many types of games: Building bases, exploring and extracting gas and minerals, producing moonshine, trading and economy, exploring space - playing on different planets, fighting creatures and aliens, exchanging goods with villages or war with them. A huge wealth of possibilities!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zp3.jpg'),(17638,'Sports Story','2022-12-23','Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Adventure, Indie','Nintendo Switch','Sports story is a game about sports, but not always. Various non-sporting pursuits provide variety. Alternate activities like dungeon exploration, stealthy infiltrations and fishing expeditions mean something unexpected waits around every corner. Sometimes it is even sports.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t8g.jpg'),(17639,'Immortal Desires: Book 2','2024-02-28','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','Immortal Desires, Book 2 is the second book of the Immortal Desires series. It succeeds its first book, Immortal Desires, Book 1 and is followed by Immortal Desires, Book 3.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8p6c.jpg'),(17640,'Dynasty Warriors 4: Hyper','2005-03-30','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dynasty Warriors 4 is a hack and slash video game and the fourth installment in the popular Dynasty Warriors series. Dynasty Warriors 4 Hyper was developed by Omega Force and is based on a series of books called Romance of the Three Kingdoms, written by Luo Guanzhong. As the series has progressed, it has strayed further from the actual plot of Romance of the Three Kingdoms but instead has given the user more input on how the storyline progresses.\n\nDynasty Warriors 4 was ported to the PC under the name Dynasty Warriors 4 Hyper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bam.jpg'),(17641,'Otogi: Myth of Demons','2002-12-12','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox','On a dark and gloomy bridge, suspended between the world of the living and the dead, lurks Raikoh, a skilled warrior from a cursed clan. Once tasked with ending the lives of others, Raikoh himself sits between life and death after the Great Seal was broken, spreading destruction and darkness across the land. A mysterious princess spares Raikoh\'s life so that he may rid the world of the grotesque demons and cleanse his soul of his past misdeeds. Raikoh must travel through desolate lands to fight hordes of fearsome, immortal creatures with 12 varieties of magic, more than 30 brutal weapons, and over 10 special demon-slaying items. Trees, walls, and even entire buildings are destroyed as Raikoh unleashes his skillful fury in order to purge both the world\'s demons and his own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48qb.jpg'),(17642,'Spoils of War','2022-03-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Spoils of war - Dirty thieves have made their way into your treasury and are trying to take out all the spoils of war! What does the insatiable spirit of destruction and revenge do in such a case? Treats guests with plasma clots and guards his treasures!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nwr.jpg'),(17643,'Boris and the Dark Survival: The Unleashed','2020-03-19','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8415.jpg'),(17644,'Den Yttersta Gåtan','1998-12-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Adolescence is a difficult time: parents don\'t understand and classmates bully. The main character of Den Yttersta Gåtan sits on the window sill and looks sadly out the window with the rain pouring down. Just as she is about to run away, a mysterious messenger from Asgard itself appears, and outside the window a Bivröst appears on which Heimdall is trumpeting Gjallarhorn and announcing the beginning of Ragnarök.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rgc.jpg'),(17645,'Keyword 2: Nightfall',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Embark on an adventure to an intricate cyberpunk city shrouded in mystery. Descend into every nook and cranny in the desolate slum; Scale the luxury mansions housing deadly conspiracies. Interrogate deadly witnesses, solve murders and eat hotpot. Join Kurt on his journey of love and justice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i03.jpg'),(17646,'Cryptid','2023-07-07','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cryptid is a single-player horror fps game that chronicles an experienced hunter and a creature\'s encounter from the perspective of the Body Cam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qz4.jpg'),(17647,'Horror Tale 3: The Witch','2025-04-10','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fight the scary witch in the most terrifying chapter of Tom\'s adventures!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17648,'Hacker\'s Adventure','2020-09-07','Platform, Indie','Android','Get ready for a breathtaking platform adventure. Help Super Hacker collect hi-tech products.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nta.jpg'),(17649,'GunGirl 2','2010-12-31','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','GunGirl2 is a freeware action platformer in the style of games like Metroid, Castlevania or Cave Story. But with blood… LOTS of blood.\n\nThe undead start rising from their graves, humanity is lost and all hope has gone to hell – and that’s exactly the place, where you have to fix everything…\n\nGo on an epic adventure and explore a huge world with the nameless blonde chick GunGirl or her best friend GunDude (aka Marvin). On your quest you have to find more and more weapons, power-ups and special items that will give you access to new areas of the game. Talk with survivors of the apocalypse and discover the hidden secret behind what’s going on. On your journey there are thousands of zombies and other monstrosities that will continuously keep you on your toes!\n\nBut when you thought nothing could get worse anymore, you find that glowing red door at the end of that dark pit and find yourself lost in the very depths of hell…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41is.jpg'),(17650,'Elevator Action: Returns - S-Tribute','2022-11-30','Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Infiltrate a terrorist occupied tower, airport, and shopping mall to get classified data and stop their plans. New features have been added to this revival of the home console version of Elevator Action Returns, a masterpiece 2D action game. Also features 2 player mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vjt.jpg'),(17651,'Trickster M','2021-05-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Trickster M is a mobile MMORPG based on Nteev Soft’s \'Trickster\' IP. Users can enjoy popular content from the original title on mobile, including \'drill action\' and 2D dot graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6avv.jpg'),(17652,'Genshin Impact: Paralogism','2025-05-07','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Version 5.6 of Genshin Impact, which includes:\n• New characters: Escoffier and Ifa\n• New main story quest: \"Interlude Chapter: Act IV - Paralogism\"\n• New story quest for Escoffier\n• New main event: Whirling Waltz\n• New quality of life features\n• …and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qg7.jpg'),(17653,'Sky Robo','1989-07-01','Shooter, Arcade','Arcade','A Nichibutsu released in 1989, it\'s an Arcade Horizonal Shoot\'em Up that allows you swap between a jet fighter and an armored mecha.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17654,'Slender: New Hope','2019-08-19','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slender - New Hope is based on Slender: The Eight Pages, but with modern graphic, better AI, bigger environment & discoverable deep woods!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90ae.jpg'),(17655,'Arma 3','2015-08-31','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Arma 3 is a truly massive military simulation sandbox game. It offers a wide variety of true/sci-fi combat situations in both singleplayer and multiplayer modes. It also comes out of the box with a very powerful editor that allows players to create their own scenarios, campaigns and mapmodes both for single- and multiplayer use.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20uo.jpg'),(17656,'The Crimson Flower that Divides: Lunar Coupling','2023-02-23','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A fictional world that\'s full of exoticism. This is a romance adventure game for women that depicts rich romantic relationships that involve the character\'s countries, along with conflicts and beliefs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kjd.jpg'),(17657,'Helm Knight 2','2013-03-25','Platform','Android, iOS','Helm Knight 2 is an Action Platformer on mobile devices','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s6u.jpg'),(17658,'Eldritch House',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Eldritch House is a first person narrative adventure which blends genres and is presented in a 3D comic book style. Players must investigate the strange occurrences of the remote Blake Manor. Ghosts both literal and personal haunt its denizens’ lives. Can you unearth its secrets?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pts.jpg'),(17659,'Vetitum_VRC','2024-10-31','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore all the video tapes about the forest and the paranormal activities that happen, discover all the secrets by controlling who records these videos in a first person experience. Do not watch the video too many times, there is something strange about it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xyp.jpg'),(17660,'Robot Robert','2021-03-09','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Robert the Robot is an action-platformer. A huge and dangerous alien world awaits you. If, of course, you can defeat those who stand in your way, in 2D battles in the style of Contra.\n\nYear 3875, scientists discover a habitable planet and send expedition number three, consisting of one highly technological Robot Robert, a flight lasting 557.7 light-years.\n\nWith Earth\'s signal lost, your goal is to find traces of the first two expeditions and find out what the friendly planet is hiding beneath the surface. Your mission begins in a cave full of riddles, hostile creatures, and dangerous plants','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yme.jpg'),(17661,'War Selection','2019-10-08','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This a pseudo-historical classic RTS with a Battle Royale mode, where game fraction is chosen on-the-go. Up to 62 players in one match fight on a random map.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ufo.jpg'),(17662,'Guilty Gear X: Ver 1.5','2003-02-21','Fighting','Arcade, Dreamcast','Guilty Gear X ver 1.5 is the eighth entry in the Guilty Gear series, and a updated version of Guilty Gear X running on the Sammy\'s Atomiswave arcade system. Announced in February 2003 at the Amusement Expo, its main changes were in the field of character balance, adding moves to make it more similar to the recently-released Guilty Gear XX.\n\nUnlike the previous Guilty Gear X Plus update, Ver. 1.5 does not include an enhanced Story Mode nor Justice or Kliff Undersn as playable characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7360.jpg'),(17663,'Tony La Russa\'s Ultimate Baseball: Ultimate Expansion Disk - Great Teams 1901-1968 Disk',NULL,'Simulator, Sport','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17664,'Mecha Blade','2023-01-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As Edgar Grey, chosen by the Angel Uriel to operate the Behemoth Mecha Suit to save the nuclear devastated world from the evil lord Zebul. Command you and your army to change the course of the world. What will you make of this new world in this intense Mecha SRPG?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hx1.jpg'),(17665,'Volt Patrol','2021-02-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a stealth driver in this short, minimalist game and try to sneak smoothly through the security system Volt Patrol!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oqb.jpg'),(17666,'Far Horizon','2024-03-11','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Far Horizon is an action-adventure RPG set in the far reaches of space where floating islands, beautiful vistas, and alien creatures await. Embark on an epic adventure of exploration, ingenuity, and survival as you loot, shoot, and craft to forge your destiny among the stars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7w15.jpg'),(17667,'Judgement Silversword: Resurrection','2015-09-18','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Judgement Silversword is the winner of the \"WonderWitch\" 2001 game development contest, and was originally released in 2004. Designed for the WonderSwan Color, Judgement Silversword has the unique distinction of being one of the few shooting games designed for a handheld console, and it\'s also one of the best! Destroying enemies as quickly as possible is essential to scoring in Judgement Silversword, giving the game a ruthless tempo. One of indie developer M-KAI\'s first games, it can be seen as the inspiration and predecessor to the gameplay ideas in Eschatos.\n\nCardinal Sins puts an interesting twist on shoot \'em up gameplay with a score trial marathon spanning 7 different areas, each with a unique objective themed around the 7 Deadly Sins. Collect lives in Sloth, Hoard enemy data in Greed, and avoid Destruction at the hands of Wrath. Mastering the different objectives gives the game a great sense of variety. Getting an S rank in every trial is very challenging!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zwo.jpg'),(17668,'911: Cannibal','2023-01-20','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Search items and solve puzzles to escape from the cannibal\'s plate. Cover up your tracks so that the maniac does not suspect anything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qgj.jpg'),(17669,'Fortnite: Darkest Grumblings Pack','2024-12-10','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This \"good boy\" has a darker side and he is willing to share. Get ready to play fetch with the Darkest Grumblings Pack. Includes:\n\n600 V-Bucks\nDark Doggo Outfit (with LEGO Style)\nBone Brief Back Bling\nThe Up-Chucker Pickaxe','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pkz.jpg'),(17670,'Yuppie Psycho: Executive Edition','2020-10-29','Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Yuppie Psycho: Executive Edition includes new areas, new bosses, and hours of carefully crafted new content to build on the Yuppie Psycho universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gcm.jpg'),(17671,'Flippets','2024-10-23','Puzzle, Indie','Atari 2600','In a distant land, concealed within the mystical forests of the north, there exists a magical place known as the Mushroom Grove. In this enchanted realm, dwell the adorable Flippets, small green beings who serve as the guardians of the forest\'s secrets. One day, the Flippets decided to create an intriguing game to test their skills against each other.\n\nThis game involved a special formation where all the Flippets stood aligned, except for one who turned away from the others. This small challenge became a fun tradition among the Flippets, known as \"Find Me.\"\n\nThe player takes on the role of a fearless Flippet explorer, embarking on an exciting journey to locate the Flippet who chose to turn their back to the group. Do you have the dexterity and keen insight required to find the intrepid Flippet? The Mushroom Grove awaits you, filled with mysteries and unparalleled fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90rh.jpg'),(17672,'From One World To Another','2025-03-07','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iri.jpg'),(17673,'Word Game World','2025-09-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o34.jpg'),(17674,'Altf42','2023-03-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A chicken that calls itself a king! Really, who is the chicken king?Avoid more powerful traps!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63dg.jpg'),(17675,'Clifford the Big Red Dog: Phonics','2003-09-30','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Step right up! There\'s a carnival in town starring Clifford the Big Red Dog. In CLIFFORD PHONICS, early readers join Clifford and his friends as they attend the Birdwell Island Carnival, a special carnival full of booths and rides that teach reading. Youngsters play the activities to win \"prizes\" to use in decorating a float for the culminating Carnival Parade.\n\nIn one of the six major activities, the Ferris wheel isn\'t working because it has run out of power -- \"word power\" that is. Players motorize it by identifying words in specific word families. Other activities cover letter and sound recognition, rhyming, sentence completion, word-object association, and sight word matching. These activities level both up and down, depending on how the player is performing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wp6.jpg'),(17676,'Paperman: Adventure Delivered','2023-12-21','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Explore colorful worlds, uncover secrets, and collect all golden letters in this 3D collectathon platformer. Go on an adventure with Paperman and the team, find the lost mail and defeat the greedy dragon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a74.jpg'),(17677,'Cibos','2021-11-04','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Cibos is a fun and dynamic \"action platformer\" video game.\nIt offers a solo adventure and a multiplayer local and online mode up to 4 players in competition with each others.\nCollect, dodge and compare your score with players around the world !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49tn.jpg'),(17678,'Gift from the Gods','2022-06-20','Adventure','ZX Spectrum, PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this challenging maze-like platformer from 1985, become the mythical Orestes, brother to Electra, as he searches labyrinthine catacombs for the fabled Euclidean Shapes and avenge the murder of his father, Agamemnon, by his mother, Clytaemnestra.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mwx.jpg'),(17679,'Minecraft: Armored Paws','2024-04-23','Simulator, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Minecraft: Armored Paws is a minor update for Minecraft: Java Edition which adds content voted for at Minecraft Live 2023 by adding armadillos and wolf armor, while also adding 8 new wolf variants.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84pu.jpg'),(17680,'World of Tanks: Modern Armor - Ready for Combat','2024-02-21','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','He might not need a tank to fight, but he\'ll make good use of any vehicle he commands. Customize the Major \"Butch\" Alan Commander with Skills to optimize your tank\'s performance! The Ready for Combat bundle also gives you Premium Time, Silver, and boosters to prepare you for the battles ahead.\n\nIncluded in this World of Tanks Modern Armor DLC bundle:\n\n- Major \"Butch\" Alan 3D Hero Commander\n- Premium Time - 1 Day\n- x8 Commander XP Boosters (10)\n- x3 Vehicle XP Boosters (10)\n- 100,000 Silver\n\nNOTE: Hero Commanders start with three open Skill slots and earn Commander XP at a +30% bonus rate.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9f0x.jpg'),(17681,'Yahari Game Demo Ore no Seishun Love-come wa Machigatteiru. Kan','2023-04-27','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Yahari Game Demo Ore no Seishun Love-come wa Machigatteiru. Kan features an original story with six routes based on the player’s decisions.\n\nIn the game, the player can enjoy new stories centered around six heroines (Yukino Yukinoshita, Yui Yuigahama, Iroha Isshiki, Saika Totsuka, Shizuka Hiratsuka, and Saki Kawasaki), different from the stories of the anime and light novel. The direction that the story takes is up to the player.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co609b.jpg'),(17682,'Warfare','2009-06-01','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Saudi Arabia, one of the world\'s leading oil suppliers and a key U.S. ally, has been taken over by a highly organized group of radical terrorists. The government is in a state of collapse and turmoil and you have been chosen to lead the United States\' armed forces to restore control. Search and destroy using the latest military hardware from the Abrams tank to the Apache helicopter in realistic settings ranging from the open desert to close-quarters infantry combat. Wear down enemy morale by capturing vehicles, weapons and buildings. You\'ll need elite forces to destroy the world\'s best-armed fanatics, bent on world-wide economic collapse. The soldiers who survive will gain experience and move with you from mission to mission.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hieql2uzcnyfnwtootjz.jpg'),(17683,'Higurashi When They Cry','2011-11-15','Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Higurashi When They Cry is a Japanese murder mystery visual novel. The series is focused on a group of young friends and the strange events that occur in the rural village of Hinamizawa, where they reside. The gameplay requires relatively little player interaction as most of the game is composed of text dialogues. The original release contained no voice acting for the characters. The game utilizes intermissions where the player can obtain several Tips. These Tips allow the player to read various supplementary information that may or may not be useful in solving the mystery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6yw6.jpg'),(17684,'Cat Golf','2025-07-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o70.jpg'),(17685,'Puzzle King','2002-07-01','Sin género','Arcade','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17686,'Gun Factory Simulator','2025-04-04','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take control of your very own firearms factory. Start with a workshop and a gun shop, and evolve it into a factory of mass destruction. Craft bullets to rockets, handguns to shotguns, design your own weapons, and become a merchant of death. Get use to the smell of gunpowder and cash.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mm5.jpg'),(17687,'HexoCity','2024-06-20','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build a futuristic city on a lush archipelago, personalizing each step with unique tiles. Strategize for high scores in this serene city-builder.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c05.jpg'),(17688,'A Nights Haunting: Source','2025-01-30','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Nights Haunting: Source is an early access mod development enveloping the source engine community in an exciting approach to a First Person Shooter action style game play. Featuring Hammer Editor support, Source Dedicated Server support, Multiplayer Online and Single Player Story Line.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h1c.jpg'),(17689,'Psychic Detective','1996-12-31','Adventure','3DO Interactive Multiplayer, DOS, PlayStation','This game is an innovative slant on the interactive movie. You\'re Eric Fox, a psychic detective who can transmit his psychic self to others, to see through their eyes and hear through their ears. That way you can find out things about the case you couldn\'t otherwise. The game has many different conclusions. It\'s a dark story though, and most people might not want to play through again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p5p.jpg'),(17690,'GBVSR: Additional Character Set (Sandalphon)','2025-02-25','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Set Contents:\n• Playable Character: Sandalphon\n• Premium Avatar: Sandalphon\n• Badge: Sandalphon\n• Weapon Cutout: Apprentice\n• Figure Studio poses 1–6 and expressions 1–7 for Sandalphon','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o3d.jpg'),(17691,'The Sinking City: Merciful Madness','2021-01-05','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The quests explore Lovecraft\'s iconic stories and bring to light the mysteries of Oakmont and its demented citizens.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kqa.jpg'),(17692,'Found','2016-09-14','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','“A dimly lit train cabin … \n        	swaying grassy plains …  \n                    	flickering fireflies …  \na mighty dragon.” \n \nFound is an interactive short film experience. Its story speaks to the connection and lack there of between nature, technology and fellow travelers as you make your way through a fantastical yet familiar world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co265g.jpg'),(17693,'Metroid Prime Hunters',NULL,'Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Wii U, Nintendo DS','The famous Metroid series lands on the Nintendo DS with Metroid Prime: Hunters. A once-strong race has gone extinct, leaving powerful artifacts to be found by bounty hunters from across the galaxy. The game features a variety of bounty hunters, both old and new, to the series. It also features multiple competitive game modes--such as deathmatch and king of the hill--for battling wirelessly with up to three other players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7j9t.jpg'),(17694,'Kluno: A Kid\'s Dream','2017-04-17','Puzzle','Android','Kluno is a fast paced, puzzle matching game with elements of tower defense.\r\r\n\r','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27zo.jpg'),(17695,'Fracctal Monsters','2023-01-30','Fighting, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Android, iOS','Fracctal Monsters is a play-and-earn virtual petcare game built on the Algorand Blockchain. It uses Algorand NFTs to simulate the growth and evolution of unique pets, and is a progression of classic Web2 games such as Neopets, Tamagotchi, and Webkinz.\n\nIf you are a fan of quality virtual pet games, then Fracctal Monsters is a must try.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co674v.jpg'),(17696,'LEGO Dimensions: Superman Fun Pack','2016-03-15','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Wii U, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Let creativity be your guide to a building and gaming adventure – journey through unexpected worlds and team up with unlikely allies on a quest to defeat the evil Lord Vortech. Build powerful superhero Superman and add him to a crazy mash-up multiverse of your favorite characters! Place him on the Lego Toy Pad to bring him to life in the game, and activate his Flying, Dive, Invulnerability, Laser Deflector, Freeze Breath, X-Ray Vision and Super Strength abilities to solve puzzles and overpower enemies. Build the Hover Pod and rebuild it into a Krypton Striker and Super Stealth Pod for upgraded in-game abilities!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27t4.jpg'),(17697,'Brainy Tree','2017-03-24','Indie','Android','Brainy Tree is a simple, addictive word based game which helps to improve vocabulary with fun.     \n     \nIn this game tree has windows in which cow & other animals stay to help the player by dropping alphabets.      \n     \nThe player has to pick those alphabets to complete word which shown on board within a time limit.      \n     \nAfter word completion, meaning of the word gets displayed on the screen which is available in Hindi, Japanese, French, Spanish, Russian, German, Italian language.     \n     \nHow To Play :-     \n1. Firstly Player has to select the language in which they want meaning of words.     \n     \n2. After that for each level player have target to complete some words within the time limit. Word count & time limit is different for each level.     \n     \n3. Animal pops out from windows of tree & drops different alphabets continuously which helps the player.     \n     \n4. Player has to pick those alphabets to complete word.     \n     \n5. After word completion, the player is able to see meaning of word.      \n     \nFeatures :-     \n1. Meaning of words is available in Hindi, Japanese, French, Spanish, Russian, German, Italian language.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cnimhlylmpdruglo4svx.jpg'),(17698,'Project Dreamcat',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','A Cat-like Diablo-Like Rogue-Like where you make builds on the fly.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17699,'EWorlds','2024-10-24','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get ready for an intergalactic adventure in eWorlds! After a crash, you’re stuck on a tropical island. Grab the Loops to unlock the Space HUB, which will open up exciting worlds. Solve puzzles, dodge traps, and uncover mysteries, solo or with friends. Are you up for the legendary Golden Loop quest?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co89mv.jpg'),(17700,'World Series Baseball 2K2','2001-08-15','Sport','Dreamcast','World Series Baseball 2K2 features a complete 2002 roster list and various game modes. Players can compete in a standard exhibition game, go for a franchise, skip directly to the playoffs, compete in a home run derby, or play online.\n\nThe game features several new options compared to its predecessors. Players can take total control of their fielding and lineup positions. It is possible to create, sign, and trade free agents. The game allows players to manage their batting and pitching rotation. It is also possible to set up a custom batting order and take control of every player on the field.\n\nThere are many statistics to keep track of, including hot and cold zones for each player, drafts, injuries, trades and fines.\n\nThe title was also released on Xbox under the title \"World Series Baseball\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3uwu.jpg'),(17701,'Guardians of the Galaxy: The Universal Weapon','2014-07-17','Sin género','Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Guardians of the Galaxy: The Universal Weapon is an online game published by Disney Interactive.\n\nJoin Star-Lord, Rocket, Groot, Gamora and Drax in an all-new adventure– Marvel’s Guardians of the Galaxy: The Universal Weapon! Jump into battle to help the Guardians recover the five pieces of The Universal Weapon before it falls into the hands of the villainous Ronan the Accuser!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98ur.jpg'),(17702,'Stern Pinball Arcade: Ripley\'s Believe It or Not!','2016-12-27','Simulator, Pinball','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Ripley\'s Believe it or Not! (2004): This is possibly the most complex table to come from legendary pinball designer Pat Lawlor (who also created Funhouse and Addams Family). It allows players to travel with Robert Ripley across seven continents to discover the strange, the bizarre, and the unusual!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52u7.jpg'),(17703,'Last Outpost','2025-02-06','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Last Outpost is a minimalist Base Building & Strategy game where you build and defend your outpost in zombie apocalypse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d35.jpg'),(17704,'Return','2023-05-29','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','An art driven souls-lite game set in the rebirth of your home planet. Return home, explore the mutated landscapes, slash, roll, and shoot your way through enemies. Find parts to repair your ship and collect resources. Purchase items and equipment from merchants to fight ancient bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63xw.jpg'),(17705,'Pro Evolution Soccer 6: The Den Patch','2023-11-11','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','A patch for the football videogame Pro Evolution Soccer 6, made by the Argentinian group The Den.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96d8.jpg'),(17706,'South Park: Snow Day! - Chaos Pack','2024-12-23','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Embrace the Chaos with these all-new free cosmetics:\nHat: Chaos Minion Hat\nTunic: Professor Chaos\nCape: Professor Chaos\nEmote: Maniacal Laughter','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jew.jpg'),(17707,'Ultimate Sudoku Collection: Gattai-3 Diagonal Pack',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','250 puzzles of “Gattai-3 Diagonal Sudoku”','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17708,'BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!','2017-09-26','Music, Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, iOS','BanG Dream! Girls Band Party! is a free-to-play rhythm game released for iOS/Android devices as part of the BanG Dream! multi-media franchise.\n\nThe game contains two modes: a story mode and a rhythm game mode. The story follows five girl bands pursuing their dreams of becoming musicians. The game is played by building teams consisting of these different band members. As they complete songs in the game, players acquire currencies that can be used to level up band members or buy new ones.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lau.jpg'),(17709,'Sega Worldwide Soccer \'97','1996-12-01','Sport','Sega Saturn','Sega Worldwide Soccer 97 (known as Sega Worldwide Soccer PC for the PC and Victory Goal Worldwide Edition in Japan) is a football video game by Sega released for the Sega Saturn in 1996. It is the successor to Victory Goal and was later followed by three more titles: Sega Worldwide Soccer \'98 still on the 32-bit console and two editions of Sega Worldwide Soccer 2000, the second being Sega Worldwide Soccer 2000 Euro Edition for the Dreamcast.\n\nSega Worldwide Soccer 97, produced by Sega themselves was one of the killer apps in the peak of popularity for the console. It was preceded by Victory Goal, an already ageing football game (one of the debut titles of the console). The game featured international teams and league, play-off and tournament modes. Although it used fictional player names (due to the lack of a license), the non-volatile memory of the Saturn allowed editing of names. The team kits were as close to the official 1996 kits as possible. The gameplay was also highly praised, and was the top-rated football game until ISS 64 was released one year later. Sega Worldwide Soccer 97 was later ported to the PC, under the title of Sega Worldwide Soccer PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yvgglx7116xg4ry3rnyu.jpg'),(17710,'Battlefield 4: Second Assault','2014-03-04','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','Battlefield 4 Second Assault will be available post launch first for Xbox One consumers. This Premium expansion pack will feature four of the most fan-favorite maps from Battlefield 3, redesigned to take advantage of our advanced Frostbite 3 engine and enhanced to include new multiplayer features from Battlefield 4.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co602o.jpg'),(17711,'Sonic Rerun',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17712,'Donkey Kong Country Returns 3D','2013-05-24','Platform','Nintendo 3DS','Over 70 levels of banana-hoarding fun featuring Donkey Kong and Diddy Kong. Run, jump, climb and defeat enemies through diverse environments until you retrieve Donkey Kong\'s stolen banana hoard. Rebuilt and optimized for portable play on the Nintendo 3DS system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wf5.jpg'),(17713,'Need for Speed: Most Wanted Terminal Velocity Pack','2013-03-12','Racing, Simulator','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Always wanted to drive like your favorite action movie stars? Well now you can! Here come five of the world’s hottest cars, from your favorite movies. The Aston Martin DBS 2008, Dodge Charger R/T 1970, Pontiac Firebird Trans-Am Special Edition 1977, Aston Martin DB5 Vantage 1964. Take on the classical muscle of the Shelby GT500 1967 in an all new Most Wanted List event and access extra rewards and unlocks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2319.jpg'),(17714,'Carrie\'s Order Up!','2016-09-12','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Carrie\'s Order Up! is a challenging arcade game inspired by the likes of Pac-Man and Game & Watch. As Carrie, a crab waitress in a port town\'s restaurant, you have to serve spaghetti, pancakes, and burgers to all kinds of sea creatures without bumping into them! Using twitch reflexes and Carrie\'s spin-to-win moves, can you beat all 20 rounds and get a high score?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2odk.jpg'),(17715,'Titan Quest: Ragnarök','2017-11-17','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"At long last, Titan Quest continues its epic journey through the world of antiquity. A mysterious threat calls the heroes of Hades to the uncharted lands of northern Europe, where new enemies await and new powers and treasures are waiting to be found!\n\nThis new expansion to the acclaimed Anniversary Edition of Titan Quest adds a fifth act of unprecedented scope, along with many new and requested features including new weapon types and a 10th Mastery for your characters to learn.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1lau.jpg'),(17716,'Away','2018-10-31','Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Away - is a short game telling about the hero\'s death experience, performed in a gloomy black and white style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5w82.jpg'),(17717,'DragonScales 1-7 Bundle','2022-08-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','All seven parts of the famous tile-matching and strategy game! Connect tiles of one color to vaporize rows. Use powerful spells and receive bonuses, fight evil bosses and enjoy all seven parts of the \"DragonScales\" serial with over 900 levels!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qfs.jpg'),(17718,'The Greenening','2025-12-31','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Greenening is a short incremental game about rediscovering and growing life in a forlorn world. Experience a wholesome dopamine rush as you explore your hidden surroundings, upgrade your versatile watering abilities and tend to your cozy little space garden.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o3n.jpg'),(17719,'Aliens versus Predator 2','2003-07-23','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The sequel to one of the most frightening games ever made, Aliens vs. Predator 2 takes you to Planet LV1201, where three diverse and bloodthirsty species battle for survival. The story-driven plot weaves together the fates of all three races, while the action is as heart-stopping as the blockbuster films on which it is based. Choose to play as Alien, Predator, or Marine as you use your physical prowess, killer instincts, or superior firepower to stay alive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eh6.jpg'),(17720,'Pixel Town: Akanemachi Mystery 2','2023-04-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Disturbances have returned to Akanemachi. It\'s now up to Aya and her new ally, Fuu, to quell the evil and bring peace back to Akanemachi for good!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6cun.jpg'),(17721,'Free Durov','2024-12-05','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','FREE DUROV – experience all the hardships of prison life and try to escape using your intellect and agility. Can you overcome all the traps and keep the encryption key safe?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vje.jpg'),(17722,'Sabrina the Animated Series: Spooked!','2001-12-06','Platform','Game Boy Color','Sssomebody ssstop him! The comic book hero brought to life in inimitable fashion by Jim Carrey now has his very own handheld game on the Game Boy Color. The well being of Stanley\'s beloved Tina is at stake, and he\'s going to have to transform himself into the Mask in order to protect her. More than 20 bizarre enemies are out to stir up trouble in this bizarre epic such as motorcycle gangs, crocodile men, and others. Make your way through nine levels of excitement, using oddball weaponry like a giant boxing glove and a hunk of cheese to fend off your rivals and return Tina safely home. In addition to the standard gameplay, there are several hidden stages to uncover, most of which can be accesses by seeking out secret objects. Whether you\'re a fan of the comic book, the movie, or neither, you\'ll have your hands full with the crazy action of THE MASK.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v5w.jpg'),(17723,'Ampere',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle','Sin plataforma','On a night in 1898 a whole City turned pitch dark. As a young girl you know that you shouldn’t play frivolously with electricity. But this time you find yourself alone in the dark. Bravely, you’re taking the task to reconnect the power.\n\nDiscover the secrets of the underground city as you enlighten it one room after another. Can you face the shadows and return the light?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rvd.jpg'),(17724,'Run Dungeon',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Run Dungeon combines the heart-pounding action of an endless runner combined with the strategic depth of an RPG. An infinite dungeon full of monsters, loot, traps, spells, and bosses awaits you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co859w.jpg'),(17725,'Unwanted Experiment','2020-04-22','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Android','Unwanted Experiment is the second chapter in the Hidden Town escape game series. You will have to interact between two characters who have to help each other to escape together from the mysterious laboratory in this great adventure full of adrenaline.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6f9k.jpg'),(17726,'Stargate: Timekeepers','2024-01-24','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Stargate: Timekeepers is a real-time tactics game where you lead a team of specialists through a story-driven campaign set in the SG-1 universe. Sneak your characters behind enemy lines, use their unique skills, craft the perfect plan to unravel a timeloop mystery, and defeat the Goa’uld threat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qor.jpg'),(17727,'SubPixels','2025-04-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What happens when three tiny rectangles—Rub, Gub, and Bub—get lost from their screen? Chaos! Help them jump, stack, and puzzle their way back home in this fun, casual 2D platformer. Simple, colorful, and just the right amount of tricky!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o8p.jpg'),(17728,'Hometopia','2023-09-27','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unleash your inner architect in Hometopia, the ultimate builder\'s game with limitless customization and high-fidelity graphics. Build your dream home or design entire neighborhoods, solo or with friends, bringing every creative detail to life exactly as you envision.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92er.jpg'),(17729,'Shape Brawl','2025-04-11','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','“Shape Brawl” is a 2D synthesis-based bullet hell shooting game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o95.jpg'),(17730,'Sweet Punch','2021-07-31','Simulator, Visual Novel','Web browser, Android','In a world full of elves, orcs and sirens, you want to find your perfect match... But it can\'t be anyone! Your partner must be just as awesome as you! Get hit with your crushes and discover love in Sweet Punch!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ce9.jpg'),(17731,'I\'m going to die if I don\'t eat sushi!','2021-12-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A casual free action game based on Japan\'s world-class sushi.\nIf you don\'t keep eating sushi, you will die.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4unu.jpg'),(17732,'Magical Bocco 20541','2024-08-19','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser, MSX2','Magical Bocco 20541 is a RPG for MSX2. The dialog is in English and Japanese.\nYour goal is to explore the world and find various things.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aye.jpg'),(17733,'Flower Bears','2020-09-14','Puzzle, Strategy','Web browser','Two bears want to plant a colorful garden, but are allergic to the other\'s flower of choice. Help them avoid some atchoos!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gce.jpg'),(17734,'Kingpin: Reloaded','2023-12-05','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Kingpin: Reloaded is an enhanced re-release of the 1999 first-person shooter Kingpin: Life of Crime.\n\nThe enhanced version features 4K resolution, ultrawide support, and improved graphics, more accessible controls, and new quest and conversation systems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21dy.jpg'),(17735,'YomaJAM','2022-08-11','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kmm.jpg'),(17736,'Dr. Franken II','1997-12-01','Platform','Game Boy','Franky, must escape the castle in which he is trapped in order to search for pieces of a gold tablet which will help him to stave off debt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dv5.jpg'),(17737,'Liberation: Captive II','1994-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','Amiga CD32, Amiga','Liberation is the sequel to Captive, where the main character from the original is now a free man. However, your character is drawn into action once again after a political assassination and a corporate cover-up by BioCorp, one of the ruling multinational companies. With aid from your four droids you are able to search the city for victims, those used in the cover-ups, of BioCorp. With each minor victory your intent becomes clearer - to persuade the Emperor in regaining control over the corporate hegemony.\n\nLiberation is set in a large futuristic city and is a free-range, open-ended RPG. As in its predecessor, you can buy better weapons, from swords to laser-rifles and enhance your droids with new equipment, e.g. numerous head-slots which plug in and give droids different abilities, ultimately driving you closer to the Emperor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p6s.jpg'),(17738,'Fire Emblem: The Hag in White','2025-04-20','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Game Boy Advance','In a world where the healing arts are forgotten, a chance encounter changes a huntress’s life forever…\n\n- Follow Kyra, a huntress from a small village, as she is dragged into a whirlwind of tragedy and hope in equal measures.\n- Play through a campaign of over 25 maps! (Plus a wacky postgame if you feel like you want more by the end).\n- Meet a cast full of all sorts of heroes, weirdos, misfits… and baddies.\n- Experience an entirely revamped class tree! Due to the unique staff situation, lots of existing classes were reworked or recontextualized. A number of new classes have also been created.\n- Listen to a fully custom soundtrack pulled from a plethora of sources! You can hear a few examples in the trailer.\n- And much, much more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qlo.jpg'),(17739,'Loopstructor','2024-08-08','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Loopstructor is a strategy tower defense survival Roguelike game. Design defensive lines, assemble battle carts and construct firepower to destroy waves of enemies! Continuously experiment with different combinations of caravans and zones to slaughter the monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qls.jpg'),(17740,'Darksiders Genesis','2019-12-05','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In this Action RPG spin-off, the fourth Horseman of the Apocalypse Strife is called upon to save humankind from certain destruction at the hands of Lucifer. True to its roots, Darksiders Genesis will feature intense combat, exploration, puzzle-solving, epic boss battles and serpent holes from heaven to hell. The game marks the first, full-scale Darksiders adventure played from the top-down perspective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1n1f.jpg'),(17741,'Born Again',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Rogue-like MMORPG with hack-n-slash gameplay','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69d4.jpg'),(17742,'Northanda Chronicles','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Blending deck-building mechanics with party-based RPG elements. Command a trio of heroes battling through a world threatened by reality-warping Chaos, each with unique abilities but sharing a single, evolving deck. Balance the needs and strengths of multiple characters to forge a unified strategy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qpo.jpg'),(17743,'Solitaire VR','2017-04-20','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play your favorite solitaire games in the luxury, warmth and grandeur of the Baron\'s ancient mountain keep. Klondike, Freecell, Yukon... they\'re all there - each deck placed around the magical keep. Explore & find your favorite spot to curl up & play. But be careful the keep is old and has secrets...','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17744,'Run, Uganda! Run!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kd2.jpg'),(17745,'My Pet Hotel','2008-12-31','Simulator','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo DS','You alone are responsible for the wellbeing of these animals, entrusted to you by their owners, in your own carefully set up pet hotel. You can build up and decorate the pet hotel in a complete 3D world, as you wish, using exciting scenarios and different levels of difficulty, in order to be able to provide the animals with a secure haven. You will Find in the various character sheets, that each animal has its own short history and characteristics, together with Information on its specific needs. There is also the possibility that, through the grateful thanks of happy pet owners, you may ultimately be rewarded by being named as “Best Pet Hotel in the World”.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co842y.jpg'),(17746,'Genshin Impact: To the Stars Shining in the Depths','2023-09-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Version 4.1 of Genshin Impact, which includes:\n• New characters: Wriothesley and Neuvillette\n• New areas: Liffey Region and Fontaine Research Institute\n• New main story quests: Chapter IV, Acts III & IV\n• New story quests for Wriothesley and Neuvillette\n• New main event: Waterborne Poetry\n• …and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co738n.jpg'),(17747,'Suzumiya Haruhi no Heiretsu','2009-03-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','Wii','Suzumiya Haruhi no Heiretsu is a visual novel that takes place on a luxurious cruise with all the SOS Brigade members and some friends, which once they all get together, we get the remedy to Haruhi\'s boredom with various stranger things starting to happen, causing time to get into an endless loop, clones of SOS-dan members starting to appear, and even Haruhi becoming someone\'s potential bride! Can Kyon get everyone back into their old world?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kk3.jpg'),(17748,'Warpswap',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Teleport, swap, and solve puzzles! Use your unique ability to swap places with blocks and uncover the secrets of a lost planet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gwq.jpg'),(17749,'Muffles\' Life Sentence Episode 2','2025-03-07','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','EPISODE 2 of Muffles\' journey. A darkly quirky RPG set in a prison where inmates are remade to match their crimes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o2o.jpg'),(17750,'Populous: The Beginning - Undiscovered Worlds','1999-03-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Undiscovered Worlds is the official expansion pack to Electronic Art\'s 1998 real time strategy game; this mission pack adds 12 new levels and follows the storyline on from Populous: The Beginning.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vtruzh0sltnrzm8o2nbe.jpg'),(17751,'F-19 Stealth Fighter','2015-04-01','Simulator','PC-9800 Series, Linux, Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, Amiga','F-19 STEALTH FIGHTER takes combat flying to new heights. With dazzling graphics and authentic, real-world scenarios. F-19 creates action-packed excitement that keeps you coming back for more! It\'s easy to learn, but satisfyingly tough to master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xo3.jpg'),(17752,'Kid\'s Art & Puzzle','2022-06-18','Puzzle','Nintendo Switch','Kid’s Art Coloring Book is a coloring book game for kids with lots of beautiful drawings and tools that would help express feelings and develop creativity.\nYou can color pictures or draw your own masterpieces! Share your work with your family, friends and the whole world!\nPuzzle Collection is a relaxing puzzle game where you can spend a lot of time. Assemble puzzles piece by piece.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vmy.jpg'),(17753,'Batman: Arkham Knight - 2016 Batman v Superman Batmobile Pack','2015-11-24','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','This pack includes the Batsuit and Batmobile from the film Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fxk.jpg'),(17754,'Hearthstone: Journey to Un\'Goro','2017-04-17','Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','The Land Where Monsters Live!\nI have plotted a route through a number of promising locales for wildlife observation.\n\n10 New Cards Per Class\n45 New Neutral Cards\nNew','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hdh.jpg'),(17755,'In the Pines','2025-04-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short horror game about buying a run-down house, and the residents that still reside.\n\nYou play as an unnamed protagonist trying to make a bit of cash flipping a house, when things make an unexpected turn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qjs.jpg'),(17756,'GreenHill Again',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kcj.jpg'),(17757,'Lez','2021-09-29','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Lez is a rhythm game in the style of osu!mania with 6 keys. It\'s an indie game made by only one person in June 2020 with the goal to make a creative rhythm game with a unique design.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ldt.jpg'),(17758,'Junkfood 4: Slotterween','2024-10-26','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Junkfood 4 is a 98-map community project hosted on the Pacifist Paradise Discord server. A Halloween-themed entry in the Junkfood series, where the premise is to make \"Junk Food\" slaughter where not a lot of time is spent deliberating about layout/detailing/fight design and other things that can bog a mapper down. It\'s just good BFG fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qg0.jpg'),(17759,'Gekka Ryouran Romance','2011-09-15','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','In a scenic valley, there\'s a celebrity boarding school called \"Hakuou Gakuen\".\n\nAt a glance the school is full of smart and beautiful guys. Behind it, a secret club nobody knows of was conducted.\n\nTo others, it\'s the mysterious going-home club. But the real name is actually the \"Forbidden Date Club\". The after school chime is the date signal. The strict rule is to always get the girl they\'re targeting. It doesn\'t matter who, the club members spread love like night hosts. These students are called the \"Gekka Ryouran\".\n\nThe love renaissance / love game unfolds by the hands of these rich guys, who seem to sneer at those who admire love. However, those who are obsessed with their charms couldn\'t stop asking for more despite the excessive payment.\n\nIt\'s a dangerous love, you can\'t go back after touching it.\nNow, the forbidden flowers are blooming!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5msm.jpg'),(17760,'The Cork',NULL,'Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Cork is a 2D action-RPG with a focus on exploration, discovery and challenging combat that draws inspiration from the non-linear worlds of classic Metroidvania platformers and the challenging, deliberate combat of Souls-likes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2goo.jpg'),(17761,'Inner-Tube Climber','2021-03-08','Platform, Indie','Android, iOS','Inner-Tube Climber is a mobile game with polished platforming controls and a unique wall-bouncing mechanic. This endless-climber game is available on Android and iOS. \n \n\"Oh no! The player is stuck inside their inner-tube from a tragic accident, which also left them trapped in the bottom of an endless crevasse!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uoo.jpg'),(17762,'Home Sports','2024-12-11','Sport','Meta Quest 3','Get ready to play, laugh, and move like never before! Step into a mixed-reality world with five dynamic sports that everyone can enjoy. Whether you’re hosting a friendly match or showing off your skills, Home Sports brings the action to life —all designed for social fun.\n\nPickleball - Our simplified rules make the game more intuitive than ever! Swing your paddle and try to outsmart your opponent without hitting the net.\nHockey - Experience what feels like a mix between ice hockey and air hockey with this original twist! Bounce the puck off the sides or go straight for the goal.\nBowling - It’s not how you bowl, it’s how you roll! Will you be able to make a perfect 300? Or will you become a gutterball guru?\n⛳Mini Golf - Try to get as many hole-in-ones and birdies as possible in three different beautiful courses: classic, modern and nature.\nBadminton - Play the fastest racket sport in the world for the first time in mixed reality!\n\nInvite up to three friends to join you, locally or online, and compete in thrilling multiplayer action. Every sport adapts to your personal play space, making it easy to jump straight into the action. Whether you’re aiming for a hole-in-one in mini golf or defending the net in hockey, Home Sports is packed with endless entertainment, laughter, and competition.\n\nWant to become the best of class? The game also features solo matches, drills and a career mode.\n\nExperience your favorite sports like never before. Play today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co954u.jpg'),(17763,'Kintsugi: A Journey Through the Broken Pieces','2025-04-10','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17764,'Hotel Security','2025-04-13','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A first-person 3D game in which a night guard working in a hotel where an anomaly occurs finds the anomaly and reports it to the government and survives the enemy','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nwv.jpg'),(17765,'Mars Cars','1982-12-31','Arcade','Apple II','A action game in which the player controls a vehicle through mazes on Mars while avoiding the vicious Mars Cars and collecting Martian treasures.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ox2.jpg'),(17766,'Olapu','2025-12-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','OLAPU is an action roguelite in which you survive an onslaught of cute creatures on the path to defeating the most powerful beings in the realm. To stand any chance of surviving you must gather stars and complete your constellations. Recover the realm alone or in up to 4 player online co-op!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9frz.jpg'),(17767,'Axis & Allies 1942 Online','2021-08-11','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Axis & Allies Online is an official adaptation of the classic board game! Strategize your way to victory as the United Kingdom, Soviet Union, United States, Germany, and Japan vie for world domination at the height of the second World War.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pht.jpg'),(17768,'Black Legend','2021-03-25','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A dark, immersive Turn Based Strategy RPG. Master tactical combat and the art of 17th century alchemy to liberate a doomed city from a bloodthirsty cult inspired by the great alchemist Mephisto.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2he6.jpg'),(17769,'Haimrik','2018-06-19','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Make words come to life in this action adventure unlike any other! Haimrik blends gameplay with the narrative of its story set in medieval times. Combined with crisp humor and rare visual style, Haimrik’s journey is sure to entertain. Word’s the word!\n\nFortunately, Haimrik commands the Power of the Words! These are the stones in the path Haimrik walks, and he brings them to life as he steps on each one, willingly or not. Haimrik will need to activate the right words to defeat the various enemies that challenge him across numerous Word Worlds, with new puzzles appearing constantly throughout the game.\n\nIn an added touch, Haimrik will undoubtedly die many horrific deaths, leaving pools of red blood contrasting with the otherwise plain monochromatic sepia world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27po.jpg'),(17770,'Vampire: The Masquerade - Reckoning of New York','2024-09-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Vampire: The Masquerade - Reckoning of New York is a narrative game set in the World of Darkness Universe. Play as one of the members of the Vampire Clans in a shifting political landscape between the Camarilla and the Anarchs while trying your best to survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96yb.jpg'),(17771,'Sonic Adventure DS',NULL,'Platform','Nintendo DS','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kiw.jpg'),(17772,'The Ghost of Alcantra','2025-04-25','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Ghost of Alcantra is a free kinetic romance/mystery vn that alternates between two perspectives, one focusing on a blossoming romantic relationship, and another focused on unraveling a murder mystery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qp4.jpg'),(17773,'6 Takes!','2014-04-24','Strategy','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','6 Takes! - Wolfgang Kramer\'s ingeniously simple card game with \"bullheads\". The aim of the game is to avoid getting cards. The player with the fewest bullheads at the end of the game is the winner. It sounds easier than it is, players will need some great tactics and perhaps a little luck.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gl3.jpg'),(17774,'FMTC','2025-04-12','Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','FMTC is a multiplayer online shooter (TPS+FPS), 2Tap gameplay category. Choose the right location to land, choose the right skills for you, search for weapons, ammo, armor, vehicles and other equipment. One shot helmet, one shot head, two shots can kill the enemy, every moment, it is life and death.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qgb.jpg'),(17775,'Multiplayer Drone Simulator','2023-10-05','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take part in breathtaking drone simulation in a realistic city with Multiplayer Drone Simulator! Enjoy the freedom in free mode, test your skills in levels, and drive drones with players worldwide.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ga8.jpg'),(17776,'Might and Magic IV: Clouds of Xeen','1992-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Mac, DOS','Might and Magic IV: Clouds of Xeen (originally released as Might and Magic: Clouds of Xeen) is the fourth installment in the Might and Magic series by New World Computing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oz3.jpg'),(17777,'Mass Effect: Andromeda - Standard Recruit Edition','2017-12-12','Sin género','Xbox One','Mass Effect: Andromeda - Standard Recruit Edition takes players on a mission to find a new home for humanity, in the Andromeda galaxy. As the Pathfinder, you lead humanity’s fight for survival. This edition includes the Turian Soldier Multiplayer Recruit Pack which ensures you will join the battle well equipped with the Turian Multiplayer Character and a selection of special weapons, items and boosts. The hope for humanity lies on your shoulders. You must ask yourself…How far will you go?\n\n• Bonus Content: The pack features the Turian Soldier Multiplayer character; these soldiers are tough and versatile powerhouses. Though soldiers’ primary tools are their weapons, they utilize advanced armor technology to give themselves an edge.\n- Plus, this pack also includes:\no Uncommon Character (x2) Turian Soldier\no Rare Weapon (x2) X5 Ghost\no Uncommon Weapon (x2) Widow\no Rare Mod #1 Assault Rifle Barrel\no Rare Mod #2 Sniper Rifle Barrel\no Uncommon Mod #1 Assault Rifle Magazine\no Uncommon Mod #2 Sniper Rifle Thermal Clip\no Equipment Stronghold Package\no Jumbo Supply Pack 1 (5x): 1st Aid, Ammo & Revive Packs, Cobra RPG, Boosters\no 100% XP Enhancers 5\no Andromeda Points 600','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27yq.jpg'),(17778,'Super Bear Adventure','2017-06-10','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','Super Bear Adventure is a 3D platformer game inspired by late 90s games.\nExplore 6 open world levels, discover their secrets, talk to the kingdom\'s inhabitants, collect as many coins as possible, unlock hats, fight your enemies and free your friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30x1.jpg'),(17779,'DeathCrank','2016-12-14','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DeathCrank is a fast-paced, local and online multiplayer vehicle combat game that combines the best of games like Twisted Metal and Burnout, with a top-down retro feel and insane weaponry.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ngf8rle4y6xnenxa0cgl.jpg'),(17780,'Check Inn','2025-01-16','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build hotels, accommodate guests and expand your hotel business throughout the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80ha.jpg'),(17781,'Crayon Shin Chan: The Storm Called! Flaming Kasukabe Runner!!','2020-01-14','Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Jump-action Crayon Shinchan game that anyone can easily play! Collect various costumes and friends and run through the city of Kasukabe and the world of movies! Everyone\'s favorite five-year-old, Shinnosuke, makes a Fierce Dash to collect sweets and Golden Balls. Get lots of different costumes using Golden Balls, obtained by proceeding from one stage to another and completing special missions! Enjoy Shinchan and his friends wearing a variety of cosplay clothes, well-known to people familiar with anime and movies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wur.jpg'),(17782,'Deutsch Pfiffikus 2009',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17783,'Power Lords: Quest for Volcan',NULL,'Sin género','Atari 2600','\'Adam, Leader of the Lords, and Shaya, Queen of Power, are extra-terrestrial warriors who battle deadly aliens on the mystical Volcan Rock. Using lasers to fight the alien space serpent, the Power Lords can gain entry into the rock and search its endless chambers for the glowing touchstone that activates powerful anti-alien weapons and devices.\'\n\nPower Lords was based on the 1983 toy line of the same name. North American Phillips (NAP) must have thought that it was going to be a huge hit, because games were developed for the Atari 2600, Colecovision and Odyssey 2. Of these games only the Odyssey 2 version was released and is considered to be the rarest US released game for the system. All three versions play similarly, but the Atari 2600 and Colecovision versions have an additional stage which makes the game slightly more interesting. Like the other versions, the 2600 version of Power Lords is not all that fun to play and the overall difficulty of the game is also rather high. Had Power Lords been released, it probably would have ended up in the bargain bin faster than the action figures did.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mou.jpg'),(17784,'Enigmatis 3: The Shadow of Karkhala','2016-08-11','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Enigmatis 3: The Shadow of Karkhala is the final chapter in the blockbuster trilogy, an exciting detective story rife with adventure, puzzles, and ancient mystery. Follow the trail of a demonic preacher and unravel the secrets of Karkhala Peak!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21o4.jpg'),(17785,'Dive Alert: Becky\'s Version','1999-08-19','Role-playing (RPG)','Neo Geo Pocket Color','Dive Alert: Becky\'s Version is an RPG for the Neo Geo Pocket Color. There is another version of Dive Alert called Dive Alert: Matt\'s Version.\n\nThe player takes control of a character named Becky. The game takes place in the future and the world is primarily surrounded by water. The only land is a small patch called Terra. The player must prove their worth to be accepted on to Terra by proving their skill as a submarine commander and destroying enemy vessels.\n\nBecky\'s version features different characters, items and boats from Matt\'s Version. These are logged in a device similar to a Pokédex (from Pokemon). Battles take place against enemy ships and a radar view is used to help the player guide torpedoes towards the enemy vessels. Much of the game is text-based with animated cutscenes.\n\nThe game features the ability for two players to link up Neo Geo Pocket Color units to exchanges ships and data, and to battle one on one. The game also features battery back-up and a training mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i5c.jpg'),(17786,'Dyping Escape','2025-07-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Escape from a dying-typing game where the words you type become reality and turn against you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o2x.jpg'),(17787,'Global Domination','1999-12-31','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation','Dive into total global conflict as a military operative for hire.\n\nDetermine your strategy for world domination. Stage missile strikes on enemy strongholds. Bomb smaller neutrals to build your base of power. Defend unaligned countries to gain their allegiance. With a blistering arsenal and a host of strategic options, you\'re geared for all-out war as you fight your way to the top of the world.\n\nWield state-of-the-art missiles, fighters, subs, satellites, nuclear arms and a brutal doomsday device.\n\nUtilize the scenario editor to customize game components, including technology levels and victory conditions.\n\nChallenge up to 16 opponents in multiplayer warfare over LAN or serial link.\n\nTake on 20 missions, utilizing live action briefings to stay abreast if mission goals and vital developments.\n\nAttack View: Command attacks and countermeasures via a spinning 3D globe interface. Fire offensive and defensive weapons around the world with pinpoint accuracy.\n\nTactical View: Monitor enemy activities and targets in 56 countries around the world. Zoom in to gather intelligence on facility locations and current production settings in enemy territories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54nb.jpg'),(17788,'Alchemist Quest','2024-01-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Each of the main quests issued by the Alchemists\' Fellowship involves different methods of playing the game. Will you brave the dungeon area and all of its turn-based RPG action to bring the fellowship proof of your prowess? Will you elect to go the farming route and grow mythical crops in your garden? Will you gather the resources you need to expand your home beyond what contemporary craftsmanship allows? Or will you spend your time fishing for a legendary lunker?\n\nNo two routes play exactly the same, and you can take on whichever you want—or even all of them at once—while also completing optional quests for a variety of townsfolk.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e6a.jpg'),(17789,'RoBros','2017-06-14','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Robros is a robot-themed, action-strategy escort shooter where you control two robots to get them to fight their way out of a factory filled with rogue robots. The gameplay is split in two phases: planning and action. The first phase is planning your escape by plotting a vector path on a 2D map. Due to your power supply being damaged, you have to make a path while picking up spare batteries along the way. Once you make a path that makes it to the exit, you switch to the 3D Action phase and protect your robot companion who provides you energy as you both fight your way through the corridors.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17790,'Balloon Fight',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Arcade','Family Computer Disk System, Arcade, Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Family Computer, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System, Legacy Mobile Device','Balloon Fight was developed and released by Nintendo, being the console port of the Arcade game VS. Balloon Fight (which was developed at the same time by another team, but released first). It was ported onto numerous other systems, and has more recently been released on the Nintendo Wii U. The game allowed for 1 player and 2 player gameplay, providing cooperative play to get past each stage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28ch.jpg'),(17791,'Legends of Murder II: Grey Haven','1991-05-01','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','DOS','This is the second adventure in which the player takes on the role of the Inspector, a crime-solving fighter/mage. This time around, an apprentice at a school of wizardry has been murdered, and the player must investigate and find the culprit. The player must move around a rather tiny map of his or her surroundings, searching for clues, talking to other characters and occasionally fighting enemies through a menu-based combat system. There are items to collect and equip, experience points to gain, spells to cast and, of course, a crime to solve.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co401z.jpg'),(17792,'Mechanic 8230: Escape From Ilgrot - Ultimate Edition','2023-07-06','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Mechanic 8230: Escape from Ilgrot is a puzzle point & click adventure, set in the ruined city of Ilgrot. Use anything you can find to progress through the story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6seb.jpg'),(17793,'Mistful Crimson Morning','2025-04-12','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A mod about Squidward killing himself... FOR REAL THIS TIME!!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qlh.jpg'),(17794,'The Flood: Forgotten Exile','2012-09-15','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','As the Battle on Installation 04 rages on between the Covenant and UNSC forces, an evil so terrible lies silently in slumber. In the pursuit of knowledge and power, the Covenant unleash a force that even they fear. As Containment Facilities across Alpha Halo are breached, one in particular is at the forefront of this. On a lone island in the middle of Installation 04\'s many seas, a facility unlike the others contains something that will make the Flood thousands of times more formidable to combat. A Gravemind lies dormant deep inside the recesses of this vault. The Battle for Installation 04 is about to reach its pinnacle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hx9.jpg'),(17795,'Cucina Stellata: Starred Cuisine','2025-04-07','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gastronomy meets horror in an unsettling narrative experience set in 19th-century Romagna, Italy.\n\nStep into the shoes of a solitary writer and gourmet, inspired by the historical figure of Pellegrino Artusi, as a midnight snack spirals into the unexpected.\n\nCucina Stellata ✦ Starred Cuisine isn\'t your typical horror game: no frantic chases or cheap jump scares, but rather a thick atmosphere of tension, disturbing themes, and chilling twists that will linger in your mind long after the credits roll.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qks.jpg'),(17796,'Lock\'s Quest','2008-09-25','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','Nintendo DS','Build Defenses and Battle against the Clockwork horde in this 2D Action RPG / Tower Defense hybrid. Experience a gripping story, which unfolds as you progress through 75 Days of warfare, aided by a collection of turrets, traps and special attacks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kmd.jpg'),(17797,'Eternal Night Town','2025-04-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Eternal Night Town is a horror game. Protagonist Xu Fan unexpectedly got a lawyer\'s letter about his great - aunt\'s inheritance. Curious, he went to her hometown. In the village, the people seemed oddly strange. Then, he entered a journey he couldn\'t escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nw5.jpg'),(17798,'Crossroads Inn: Anniversary Edition','2019-10-23','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Among the most significant improvements to the base game Anniversary Edition will offer:\n\n- New Pathfinding & AI - no more blocking on stairs, no more horses trying to reach stables through Inn’s main hall;)\n- Engine Performance - A lot of performance-related issues will be eliminated by upgrading the game’s Esenthel engine to its latest version.\n- UI & Tutorial - Crossroads Inn is not an easy game, especially for beginners. This is why devs are now working on an extensive help system that includes better UI, loads of tips available through loading screens, innkeeper journal, and in-game tutorials.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d2k.jpg'),(17799,'Friday Night Funkin\': vs Impostor','2025-04-25','Music','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What started as a passion project has now evolved into a complete overhaul of the iconic VS IMPOSTOR mod. Codenamed UPDOG, this brand-new version is a full-on reimagining built from the ground up. Every aspect, from visuals to vocals, has been carefully redesigned to fully reach the potential it once had.\n\nWhether you’re a longtime fan or a total newcomer, VS IMPOSTOR delivers a fresh experience! with new remixes of classic songs, completely overhauled visuals, a brand new menu, and maybe even a few secrets.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17800,'Piggy Gambit','2024-02-01','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Piggy Gambit is a game that harmoniously combines the elements of chess, box puzzles, and flow control into a coherent puzzle game about a piggy searching for the meaning to his life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6vke.jpg'),(17801,'Clive \'N\' Wrench','2023-02-24','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Clive \'N\' Wrench is a 3D platformer that takes inspiration from the collect-a-thon games of the 90\'s, but with an added time traveling element.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co218x.jpg'),(17802,'Face Love!','2020-04-21','Sin género','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a lovely day at the face factory...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91ve.jpg'),(17803,'Scholar\'s Mate','2024-07-04','Shooter, Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Scholar\'s Mate is an immersive first-person horror experience that puts you in the shoes of Judith, a young woman who wakes up in the gloomy facilities of a psychiatric hospital.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87e5.jpg'),(17804,'Mucho Muscle',NULL,'Arcade','AirConsole','Grab, hang, swing and grapple your way to victory in this ultimate contest of strength, technique and… uh… beefiness. Choose your athlete from among a delightful lineup of miraculously muscled lads and ladies and play with up to three friends.\n\nMucho Muscle is a hilariously goofy climbing game that you can play as a solo player, as a cooperative adventure, against each other and in team versus team mode. Win the show on your own or work together with a friend to outmatch the opposition – or crack the highscores!\n\nMucho Muscle combines a gloriously colorful eighties’ aesthetic with the competitive air of ninja warrior contests, offering a wonderfully whacky way to challenge, entertain and delight you and your friends or family.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co488y.jpg'),(17805,'Nickelodeon Dance','2011-12-08','Music','Wii, Xbox 360','Nickelodeon Dance is a whole new kind of Nickelodeon play experience allowing kids can dance along with Dora, Diego and the Fresh Beat Band for the first time. Gamers big and small will get up off the couch and twist, shimmy and shake to 30 songs sung by Nickelodeon friends including theme songs and Nickelodeon hits like \\\"We Did It,\\\" \\\"Al Rescate,\\\" and \\\"Here We Go.\\\" In addition, popular favorites like \\\"Dancing In the Street,\\\" \\\"We got the Beat\\\" and \\\"Rhythm is Gonna Get You\\\" ensure fun for the entire family. Parents focused on increasing their child\\\'s physical activity will appreciate the workout feature which promotes heart healthy activity as kids ratchet up the dance action and are graded for their accuracy as they dance with the Nickelodeon gang. And since nobody wants to dance alone, Nickelodeon Dance supports two players on every song, with song lyrics posted at the bottom of the screen along with easy-to-follow visual oriented dance move prompts that players duplicate with their bodies using the Kinect Sensor for Xbox 360.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/o0ftfjgp2breqscayejt.jpg'),(17806,'Mania',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17807,'Moero Downhill Night 2','2006-10-27','Racing, Simulator, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A generation has passed since the glory days of racing in Downhill Night, and the once heart-pounding races have faded into nostalgic legend. But a new epic tale is about to begin, with a need for speed, topped with sex and romance. In Moero Downhill Night 2, the cast of girls is great, and where the trills of sex increase as the accelerator hits the floor. Help the girls win their races, and you\'ll be rewarded once you get back to the pit. The sequel to Moero Downhill Night 1, with even more gorgeous girls, super racing CGs, and intense, uncensored sexual scenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mcm.jpg'),(17808,'Sonic the Hedgehog TX',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kit.jpg'),(17809,'Kingdom Come: Deliverance - Royal Edition','2024-03-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Kingdom Come: Deliverance is a story-driven open-world RPG that immerses you in an epic adventure in the Holy Roman Empire. Avenge your parents\' death as you battle invading forces, go on game-changing quests, and make influential choices. Explore majestic castles, deep forests, thriving villages and countless other realistic settings in medieval Bohemia!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m02.jpg'),(17810,'Roguematch: The Extraplanar Invasion','2023-04-24','Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Roguematch is a Fantasy Turn based Rogue-like fused into a Match-3 layout, giving players many more ways to get out of challenging situations! With so much raw elemental magic at your command, theres even more to do than just smack and bash your way through creatures from the extraplanar realms!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co58so.jpg'),(17811,'Maken X','2000-04-25','Adventure','Dreamcast','Maken X is a game for the Dreamcast video game console that fits into an subgenre of \"first-person slashers\". The game is mainly regarded as a first-person action game because of the realistic elements in gameplay. It is unique in that the main character is the weapon (Maken), rather than a person.\n\nThe word \"Maken\" literally translates as \"demonic sword\". On the title screen, the \"X\" is shown to stand for deus ex machina (Latin for \"god out of the machine\").\n\nThe player can control a number of characters via \"brainjacking\", which leaves the person a vegetable. The woman displayed on the boxart is the first person controlled when the facility that Maken was created at comes under attack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ygi.jpg'),(17812,'Dream Team Basketball','2022-12-12','Sport, Strategy, Tactical, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dream Team Basketball combines traditional CCG gameplay with innovative mechanics inspired from the game of basketball.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wi8.jpg'),(17813,'Hot Chase','1988-12-31','Racing, Arcade','Arcade','Hot Chase is an arcade game released in 1988 by Konami.[1] In the game, players drive a white Porsche out of an enemy country to the Border crossing of a friendly one. The car has a bomb attached to it that explodes in a set time. If the bomb explodes, players must restart. There are many obstacles along the way, including railroad crossings, military checkpoints, helicopters that shoot at the car and other cars. The gameplay is said to be similar to Chase HQ.\n\nCompleting the game resulted in a scene where the hero exits the car, takes his machine gun, and fires at the car to add to the damage before the bomb explodes. Then the game played the following message: \"Mission Complete. You have succeeded in stealing the enemy armored super car and have crossed the border to freedom. After a few days the enemy surrendered to our country. You will be remembered for your brave deeds. Thanks a million!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co967a.jpg'),(17814,'Signal Creek','2025-04-10','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17815,'Super Mario Sunburn','2020-05-03','Platform','Nintendo GameCube','Super Mario Sunburn is a Super Mario Sunshine mod that adds free open-world travel between stages, free chapter order in stages, Blue Coins in multiple chapters, more coins in each stage, custom stages, custom endgame conditions, and various other minor features.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3hge.jpg'),(17816,'Dai-2-ji Super Robot Taisen OG','2012-11-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','PlayStation 3','Japan-only game in the Super Robot Wars series','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uam.jpg'),(17817,'Magic Dungeon Hero: Freedom or Death','2024-12-26','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99xt.jpg'),(17818,'Combat Casino','2021-07-29','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you have what it takes to survive the Combat Casino?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cup.jpg'),(17819,'Starbreed',NULL,'Sin género','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Starbreed is inspired by classic 3D rail shooters with a dating sim twist. Each ally you unlock comes with a passive and active ability to add to your kit. Bring them in your party to raise their affinity, and unlock Hscenes with them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e15.jpg'),(17820,'A Day At the Track',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Sport','Sin plataforma','A horse racing simulator where you bet your players money on the horse to win the race. If your horse wins you get paid. Run the other bots or joined twitch users out of money to be named the victor of the track.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6drf.jpg'),(17821,'Sonic Celerity',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kd1.jpg'),(17822,'Color by Number - Modern Art',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17823,'Aliya\'s Awakening: Dooge 2042','2025-04-20','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Aliya\'s Awakening: DOGE 2042 is a narrative-driven interactive cyberpunk adventure game with secrets, survival, and justice. Experience a deep, and personal story of Aliya, and with her point of view, explore the dystopian cyberpunk world through fun and immersive gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qkm.jpg'),(17824,'Poco','2025-05-01','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Poco is a 2D/3D hybrid point-and-click adventure game where you play as Poco, a two-inch tall clown who is banished from a giant walking circus, and left to fend for themselves in the undergrowth of the Below World, where they befriend and enlist the help of the local homunculus population to build a rocket.\n\nExplore the beautiful, cluttered Below World... Where everything broken, lost, or unwanted from the Worlds Above comes to decay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qi2.jpg'),(17825,'Quiz & Variety SukuSuku Inufuku','2004-08-05','Quiz/Trivia, Arcade','Arcade, PlayStation 2','\"Quiz & Variety SukuSuku Inufuku\" is an arcade game released by Video System in 1998. While quizzes are the main, many mini-games are included. Clear them and raise a dog-like creature called \"Inufuku\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pej.jpg'),(17826,'Super Mario Sunshine','2002-11-01','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo GameCube','Super Mario Sunshine is a Mario action-adventure 3D platformer. It follows Super Mario 64, and is the second 3D Mario platformer. Gameplay features a combination of action and puzzle solving, with numerous stages and multiple episodes to each stage, and plenty of hidden secrets and surprises. This game introduced many recurring characters and bosses in the Mario series, including Toadsworth, Bowser Jr., Petey Piranha, Gooper Blooper, Piantas, Nokis, Shadow Mario, and F.L.U.D.D. Super Mario Sunshine pays homage to Mario\'s Italian heritage and upbringing, with many of the locations in the game having Italian names and sometimes referencing Italian culture.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21rh.jpg'),(17827,'My Little Sister\'s Special Place','2023-06-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Our hero used to go to Akiba a lot when he was younger. It wasn\'t to have fun, but for his little sister\'s sake. One day, his younger sister is gifted a Christmas trip, and they spend time together as if they\'re a couple. This is the delightful and touching love story of these two siblings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mxc.jpg'),(17828,'Caona',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Caona, you take part in an Action Adventure Game set in a fictional world based on South American mythology.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17829,'Mech Shuffle','2022-07-29','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mech Shuffle is a roguelite deck builder where you choose a pilot and a mech to build a unique deck. Earn new cards and card upgrades to improve your deck over a run. Scout the battlefield, secure the beachhead, and repel the invasion!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wwv.jpg'),(17830,'Eclipse of the Lost','2025-04-24','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A first-person horror story following Ryan\'s costly hiking shortcut. Solve puzzles, avoid monsters, get directions home, and survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qp8.jpg'),(17831,'Hunt the Wumpus','1973-03-31','Puzzle, Adventure','Microcomputer','Hunt the Wumpus is an early computer game, based on a simple hide and seek format featuring a mysterious monster (the Wumpus) that lurks deep inside a network of rooms. It was originally a text-based game written in BASIC and has since been ported to various programming languages and platforms including graphical versions.\n\nThe original text-based version of Hunt the Wumpus uses a command line text interface. A player of the game enters commands to move through the rooms or to shoot \"crooked arrows\" along a tunnel into one of the adjoining rooms. There are twenty rooms, each connecting to three others, arranged like the vertices of a dodecahedron or the faces of an icosahedron (which are identical in layout). Hazards include bottomless pits, super bats (which drop the player in a random location, a feature duplicated in later, commercially published adventure games, such as Zork I, Valley of the Minotaur, and Adventure), and the Wumpus itself. The Wumpus is described as having sucker feet (to escape the bottomless pits) and being too heavy for a super bat to lift. When the player has deduced from hints which chamber the Wumpus is in without entering the chamber, he fires an arrow into the Wumpus\'s chamber to kill it. The player wins the game if he kills the Wumpus. However, firing the arrow into the wrong chamber startles the Wumpus, which may cause it to move to an adjacent room. The player loses if he or she is in the same room as the Wumpus (which then eats him or her) or a bottomless pit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c7p.jpg'),(17832,'Hammerting','2020-10-27','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hammerting is a vertical dwarven mining colony sim with RPG elements.\n\nManage a clan of colorful dwarves, establish an epic mining operation, craft legendary swords and delve deep for greater glory, riches... and danger.\n\nWith a war raging on the surface, the dwarves pledge to delve deep and, as the master craftspeople they are, produce and supply whatever is needed. From humble beginnings, you start with a few, hurried dwarves who need to set up operations. Ultimately, your small clan of dwarves will be known throughout the Upper Realms for their skill, and the base will span kilometers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1lr6.jpg'),(17833,'Beak Island Visitor Center','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Congrats! You\'re now in charge of Beak Island\'s visitor center. This old gem\'s a bit rusty, and help\'s scarce, but don\'t let that stop you! Spruce up the island, cook up some treats, and bring back the buzz from 50 years ago. It\'s all in your hands now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o3a.jpg'),(17834,'Resolutiion','2020-05-28','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','An old killer escorts a curious AI through chaotic combat, puzzling secrets, and unsettling calm. Explore a fractured future, collecting weird weapons and stories, to piece together the past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tb4.jpg'),(17835,'Carnival of Gods: Oppression','2023-02-21','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An imprisoned Tyrant God risks to escape thanks to the help of his disciples. In a mission for your Gods and your people travel to his prison, Limbo, a powerful magical place and stop his rising before its too late or your world will be ruined.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cil.jpg'),(17836,'Chrono Ark: Summer Twilight','2024-05-02','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Summer-themed DLC for Chrono Ark, featuring a new, optional boss with her own substory, new equipment and relics, as well as swimsuit skins for Lucy and 5 investigators, with accompanying VFX.\n\nThe investigators obtaining a new skin are Azar, Charon, Huz, Pressel and Trisha, with Sizz slated to receive one in a future content update.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qka.jpg'),(17837,'PowersVR','2017-02-08','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play with iconic superpowers from comic books! PowersVR puts you in control of a group of superheroes and villains, each with their own unique and colourful personality and ability. Collect them all, complete challenges and test out your powers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vje.jpg'),(17838,'Leaf Blower Man: This Game Blows!','2023-10-18','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Blow leaves at 6am on a Sunday and earn points by annoying all the neighbors. But beware - unexpected challenges await on your journey to rid the world of leaves!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bp5.jpg'),(17839,'Shark\'s Treasures Adventure','2025-04-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Plunge into danger! Dodge sharks, claim treasures, and survive the deep seas!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o1h.jpg'),(17840,'Looking For Cats In a Badly Drawn City','2024-01-25','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore the amazing corners of a city full of jagged lines and curved outlines. Your goal is to find 100 cats hidden in the most unexpected places!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wf7.jpg'),(17841,'Mafia III: Deluxe Edition','2017-05-11','Shooter, Racing, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','The Deluxe Edition of Mafia II include the Season Pass.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5r4c.jpg'),(17842,'美少女麻将接龙','2018-08-08','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game is in Chinese only. Stay tuned for some great English titles by Sticky Rice Games coming to Steam soon!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17843,'Airline Flight Attendant Simulator VR','2023-02-23','Simulator, Adventure','SteamVR','This is a consumer version of the professional VR training software developed by AVIAR and used by airlines and flight schools to train future cabin crew members. It\'s all there - insanely realistic virtual aircraft, equipment, gravity effects, sounds, and intense emergency situations scenarios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66nb.jpg'),(17844,'Zig Zag',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Very hard reaction-based game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6kft.jpg'),(17845,'Sonic Speedfighters 2',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gbz.jpg'),(17846,'Manufactoria 2022','2022-08-16','Puzzle, Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Manufactoria 2022 is a constructive puzzle game about pushing robots around.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3no7.jpg'),(17847,'Red, Blue, and Green','2019-12-25','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Red, Blue, and Green is a set of three short stories released in the Suda51 Official Complete Book. They expand on certain aspects of The 25th Ward: The Silver Case and its remake.\n\nWhile the book was not released in English, the text was translated and transferred into Film Window form by members of the fan community.\n\nThe three chapters are known as redout, blueout and greenout, following the same naming pattern as the new Correctness chapters of the 25th Ward remake. They expand on the roles of Aoyama, Akama and Kosuke Kurumizawa, and introduce a new major character, Midori Midorikawa.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hy4.jpg'),(17848,'Mario Kart 7','2011-12-03','Racing, Arcade','Nintendo 3DS','The seventh installment of the fan-favorite Mario Kart franchise brings Mushroom Kingdom racing fun into glorious 3D. For the first time, drivers explore new competitive kart possibilities, such as soaring through the skies or plunging to the depths of the sea. New courses, strategic new abilities and customizable karts bring the racing excitement to new heights.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2146.jpg'),(17849,'Rugby 25','2025-02-13','Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Welcome to the ultimate rugby gaming experience, Rugby 25! Whether you\'re a passionate fan or a newcomer to the world of rugby, Rugby 25 immerses you in the heart of the action and hard-hitting tackles like no rugby video game has before. From humble local club matches to the bright lights of the world\'s greatest international tournaments, every detail has been meticulously crafted to bring the excitement and intensity of the sport to your fingertips. Rugby 25: where legends are born, and history is made.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fps.jpg'),(17850,'Archon: Initiator','2025-04-10','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Strategically place blocks, clear lines, create combos, and complete diverse missions in an audio-reactive neon world. Unlock powerful abilities or unwind with endless, zen-like puzzle gameplay.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17851,'King Bullseye: The Chess Strike','2021-05-05','Point-and-click, Shooter, Indie, Arcade, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The king is tired of being protected so now he is shooting the enemies down! King Bullseye is a shoot-the-target game in which the enemies are chess pieces on the board! Can you think quickly to predict who you need to destroy first? Headshots eliminate faster and earn more points!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ysz.jpg'),(17852,'Dead Fish Head',NULL,'Sin género','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17853,'Mario Kart DS','2016-05-25','Racing, Arcade','Wii U, Nintendo DS','Mario Kart DS is the continuation of the long running racing game series that began on the Super Nintendo. It features 16 new tracks as well as 16 tracks from the previous 4 games, with each set split up into the Nitro and Retro Grand Prix respectively. Eight racers are initially available, each with two go-karts to choose from. A number of characters and additional karts are also available to unlock. New items have been added to the arsenal, including a Blooper squid that squirts ink onto the screens of other players and a Bullet Bill power up that transforms the player into a giant, fast-travelling bullet on autopilot.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co214h.jpg'),(17854,'Olu',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17855,'Dungeons 3: Clash of Gods','2018-09-28','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The cries of joy are still echoing through the dungeon halls alongside the distinctive, melodic parp of the fanfare corps’ butt trumpets – a cacophony of wickedness that lingers in the air after the Absolute Evil’s undisputed triumph over Tanos.\n\nBut, as the saying goes, all good ...errr... evil things come to an end – and so is the Absolute Evil’s relentless assimilation of everything that dares to be good. For now is the time for the Absolute Evil to ascend to the throne and crown himself the sole ruler of the world.\n\nHowever, there’s one itsy-bitsy little problem standing in the way…the Above-And-Beyond-All-Beings Goddess of Light herself! Who will emerge victorious from the final battle between good and evil?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fmd.jpg'),(17856,'Quondam','1989-07-01','Shooter, Arcade','ZX Spectrum','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17857,'Europa Universalis III Complete','2011-04-01','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Europa Universalis III Complete includes the original Europa Universalis III as well as the expansions In Nomine and Napoleons Ambition \nEuropa Universalis III delves deeply into the areas of exploration, trade, warfare and diplomacy. This epic strategy game lets players take control of a nation and guide it through the ages to become a great global empire. Unparalleled in its depth and historical accuracy, Europa Universalis III gives the player unprecedented freedom in how they choose to rule their nation from an impressive choice of over 250 historically accurate countries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mnf.jpg'),(17858,'Densha de Go! Shinkansen EX: Sanyou Shinkansen-hen','2007-03-01','Simulator','Wii','A spin-off of the Densha de Go! series, Shinkansen focuses on the titular high-speed rail line San\'yō Shinkansen (through the entire route both ways, between Shin-Ōsaka and Hakata).\n\nThe game was later ported to the Wii as Densha de Go! Shinkansen EX: Sanyoushinkansen-hen (loosely translated to \"Go by Train! Shinkansen EX: Sanyou Shinkansen Edition\") on March 1, 2007. This version features a new \"Kids Mode\" utilizing the Wii Remote\'s motion control.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9q37.jpg'),(17859,'Cut the Rope: Experiments','2011-08-04','Puzzle','Windows Phone, Android, iOS','Experiment to feed Om Nom candy! Cut the rope like never before. Everything you love and new gameplay! 200 levels and more to come!\n\nThe little green monster Om Nom is back and hungrier than ever! Team up with the Professor, a mad (but not bad!) scientist determined to study Om Nom’s candy-loving behavior through a series of experiments. Use suction cups and other funny devices to collect shiny gold stars, uncover hidden prizes and unlock new levels!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49sr.jpg'),(17860,'Hearthstone: The League of Explorers','2015-11-12','Strategy, Tactical','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','The League of Explorers is Hearthstone\'s third adventure.\n\nThe adventure contains 4 wings, with 13 boss encounters, as well as a Heroic mode and 9 Class Challenges. In addition to the usual boss battles, the adventure also debuts a new kind of encounter - where the player must survive through several rounds of traps, ambushes and environmental events to escape to safety. The adventure adds 45 new collectible cards, as well as new card backs and 2 new battlefields.\nThe League of Explorers sees the player following four famed adventurers - Elise Starseeker, Reno Jackson, Sir Finley Mrrgglton, and Brann Bronzebeard - on a journey through some of Azeroth\'s most exotic and dangerous locations, on a quest to recover an ancient Titan artifact - the Staff of Origination. As each wing is completed, players gather pieces of the Staff, and put them on display in the museum. However, the League of Explorers are not the only ones searching for the artifact, and danger waits within the shadows.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1he8.jpg'),(17861,'Vermin','1997-09-27','Arcade','Game Boy Color, Game Boy','A Yoshi must protect six eggs from Fly Guys, Para Troopas, and Boo Buddies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co618d.jpg'),(17862,'Call of Duty: Black Ops 6','2024-10-25','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Developed by Treyarch and Raven, Black Ops 6 is a spy action thriller set in the early 90s, a period of transition and upheaval in global politics, characterized by the end of the Cold War and the rise of the United States as a single superpower. With a mind-bending narrative, and unbound by the rules of engagement, this is signature Black Ops.\n\nThe Black Ops 6 Campaign provides dynamic moment-to-moment gameplay that includes a variety of play spaces with blockbuster set pieces and action-packed moments, high-stakes heists, and cloak-and-dagger spy activity.\n\nIn a best-in-class Multiplayer experience, players will test their skills across 16 new maps at launch, including 12 core 6v6 maps and 4 Strike maps that can be played 2v2 or 6v6.\n\nBlack Ops 6 also marks the epic return of Round-Based Zombies, the fan-favorite mode where players will take down hordes of the undead in two brand-new maps at launch. Post-launch, players can look forward to even more exciting maps and groundbreaking experiences dropping into both Multiplayer and Zombies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zis.jpg'),(17863,'Space Grunts 2','2020-05-27','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Arcade, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Space Grunts 2 combines fast turn-based gameplay with card-battling mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41us.jpg'),(17864,'Nosy',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','ZX Spectrum','Nosy is a boy who lives in a religious orphanage, he has a special talented gift, he can move between two worlds, the real world and hell. A tragic death causes that a powerful demon catches the souls of the boys living there, Nosy\'s friends, who called him that way because he was a curious and gossip boy.\nGo through a gloomy orphanage full of spirits to catch. Look for the yellow bones which will give you clues to get the objects needed to beat the final demon, if you get the wrong objects, you lose the game.\nRemember to look at the moon side.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vn1.jpg'),(17865,'The Deep Diving of FloodDragon','2022-07-15','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Landing on the moon and diving into the deep sea\" is a human dream. In this game, you will experience this great journey. Understand the structure of Jiaolong, drive the submarine with the deepest diving depth in the world to dive into the deep sea and explore unknown places.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5n0l.jpg'),(17866,'Lego Star Wars: End of War',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lego Star Wars: End of War sends the player on a journey throughout the last episode of the clone wars, including things like the Ashoka and Maul fight, with the style of the Lego Star Wars games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xhu.jpg'),(17867,'Silent Mobius: Genei no Datenshi','1998-12-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation','Silent Mobius: Genei no Datenshi is a Role-Playing game, developed by TechnoSoft and published by Bandai Visual, which was released in Japan in 1998.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rlg.jpg'),(17868,'Squingle','2021-07-15','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3','The spiraling psychedelic puzzle – Grab revolving orbs and guide them through twisting liquid crystal mazes to create the Universe! A refreshing, relaxing and satisfying \"one more go\" experience, only in VR.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92kk.jpg'),(17869,'Valiant Hearts: Coming Home','2024-03-07','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','1917, as World War I rages on, two brothers will fight to survive the trenches and find each other again. Their paths will cross with new Valiant Hearts who will share the joy of reuniting and the horror of the Western Front – all desperate to find their way home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vbk.jpg'),(17870,'I Feel Fantastic','2019-02-27','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In ancient Greek mythology, Pygmalion was a highly accomplished Cypriot sculptor. Though skilled at imitating the human form, and well acquainted with it\'s subtleties, he became disgusted by it when he witnessed the Propoetides prostituting themselves. These women were punished by Venus for their lack of worship with a coarseness of skin and a crudeness of nature, and were then forced into prostitution. Seeing this, Pygmalion the sculptor was repelled and could no longer appreciate women.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17871,'Cubethon','2024-03-19','Racing, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a puzzle game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ui2.jpg'),(17872,'Bugs make fine snacks','2021-12-06','Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bugs make fine snacks is a hand-drawn endless runner game with watercolour illustrations and cool music. Help our little short-sighted owl to fly in the night forest and look for yummy bug snacks. Be careful - don\'t touch the thorns.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17873,'Pocket Stables','2024-06-06','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Manage your very own ranch while training your racehorses to win big in exciting races!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kof.jpg'),(17874,'Red Cross - Emergency Response Unit',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Take control of a Red Cross Emergency Response Unit and save disaster victims from certain doom! Explore 11 different high resolution maps, snatching survivors from the jaws of death with teams of volunteers, doctors, engineers, and several exciting emergency vehicles! Working for the Red Cross might be the toughest job in the world, but you can reap the rewards and excitement from your home in Red Cross: Emergency Response Unit! A portion of each purchase will be donated to the Red Cross.\n\nControl every aspect of a Red Cross E.R.U!\nSave survivors of earthquakes & droughts\nPart of the proceeds will go to the Red Cross','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40ly.jpg'),(17875,'Jet de GO! Pocket','2005-12-15','Simulator','PlayStation Portable','Jet de GO! Pocket is the third installment of Taito\'s flight simulation series for Sony consoles and the first one to be released on PSP. The first title in the series, Jet de GO!, was released on PlayStation in 2000 and its sequel, simply titled \"Jet de GO! 2\", was released on PlayStation 2 in 2002.\n\nJust like its predecessors, the game allows the player to take the captain\'s chair in the cockpit of a commercial airliner making flights to and from major Japanese cities such as Tokyo, Osaka and Sapporo. The game features a variety of airplanes such as the Boeing B747, B777 and B767, different weather and daytime conditions and flight plans. The player can choose between three game modes: Flight, Trial and Replay.\n\nSince the game is endorsed by Japan Airlines, a real world airline, it is not actually possible to \"crash\" an airplane. Collisions with the ground are shown in a simplified fashion where the plane simply stops once it touches down, resulting in a \"Game Over\" screen.\n\nAlthough the game was only released in Japan, it features partially English menus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z3x.jpg'),(17876,'Rocket League: Season 11','2023-06-07','Racing, Sport, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Perched high above the seaside, a group of drift cars in tuning mode wait for the signal. At the whistle, a chaotic descent begins, for a festival of tight skids on these perilous mountain roads. Below, cheers are heard: a delirious crowd admires its favorite pilots to boost to victory. This is what you should expect in Season 11.\n\nWe hope you are well, as the festivities will rage on throughout the season. Drift with the famous Nissan Silvia (S13), immerse yourself in a colorful Rocket Pass and celebrate the best soccar moments in the Estadio Vida arena.\n\nSo, ready to light the fire? Season 11 begins on June 7!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lfh.jpg'),(17877,'Aluna Rift',NULL,'Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Illuminate the void of space as you hunt Colossal Bosses in an upgradable time-bending spacecraft. Fly solo or co-op across endless procedural galaxies, or battle each other in PvP. Features challenging survival modes, ultra-wide screen support, global leaderboards and more!\n\nAluna Rift is a challenging top-down shooter with single player, co-operative and PvP game modes. The game is filled with vibrant visuals, addictive action and scintillating sounds. The main game mode is a mixture between wave-based enemies, random encounter minigames, and hunting colossal bosses. In addition there is an ‘Endless Survival’ mode akin to classic shoot ‘em ups from the golden age of arcade gaming.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v69.jpg'),(17878,'Legioncraft','2019-11-01','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Loslan needs you! The Legion is waiting for your call! Gather your strength, prepare your food, contribute your love, and pull out your gold coin!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oo3.jpg'),(17879,'Just Dance 2025 Edition','2024-10-15','Music','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Get your friends and family together to let loose on Just Dance! To party, exercise, or create special family moments, Just Dance 2025 Edition has something for everyone, with 40 hot new songs.\n\nNeed a fun way to exercise? Start your own routine with the Workout Mode and keep yourself motivated by tracking the calories burnt and the time spent dancing. Use Workout Mode to enjoy a dance workout in solo or with your family and friends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fhy.jpg'),(17880,'Warhammer 40,000: Deathwatch Tyranids Invasion','2017-02-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Warhammer 40,000: Deathwatch is a turn-based strategy game, set on the edge of Imperial space, where your Space Marines will take on the Tyranids in a series of tactical engagements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24my.jpg'),(17881,'Hello User!','2025-04-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Recruiting players to save the crisis in the internet world! Those who are good at hacking and puzzles, those who enjoy Indie games in the abyss. Preferential treatment for those interested in darknet AIs that have never been there.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lzp.jpg'),(17882,'Destroy All Humans! 2: Reprobed - Challenge Accepted',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gct.jpg'),(17883,'It\'s A Promise','2022-02-28','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Erin has gotten used to the monotony of her life. But she still feels like something is missing. One day she is approached by a young woman named Ori who seems to know who she is. Erin doesn\'t remember her at all... Ori asks her out on a date and Erin finds herself saying yes.\n\nHow will the date go? Will Erin remember who Ori is? Will Ori find out that Erin doesn\'t remember her? Read to find out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fhy.jpg'),(17884,'World Tour Soccer','2005-09-01','Sport','PlayStation Portable','World Tour Soccer: Challenge Edition (WTS; known simply as World Tour Soccer in the United States) is the PlayStation Portable version of the popular PlayStation and PlayStation 2 game This Is Football (TIF), created by SCEE\'s London Studio and released in 2005. \n \nWTS featured very similar gameplay as TIF but was not a direct port of its forerunner as a number of areas were enhanced - particularly the challenge mode referred to in its title. \n \nWTS has emulated TIF\'s success by selling over half a million copies in PAL territories. \n \nAs a result of its success, a sequel to WTS was developed by SCEE and released as World Tour Soccer 06 in 2006.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pom.jpg'),(17885,'Way of the Dogg','2013-06-12','Fighting, Music','iOS, Xbox 360','Way of the Dogg is a brutal, rhythm-action combat adventure, set to Snoop Dogg’s music. Each level is a fresh fight against a different character in a new location defined by a Snoop Dogg track. As AJ, fight your way through 14 levels, each a superbly choreographed beat-matched fight, set to Snoop\'s music, including \'Who am I?\', \'Gz and Hustlas\' and \'10 Lil Crips\' to name but a few. Go head-to head with friends in multiplayer rhythm battles and follow Snoop\'s lead in the Temple Tutorials. Train with Snoop, pick a side, take your chances and find the way: The Way of the Dogg.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/huwxw1a4ihv4n87tmn7a.jpg'),(17886,'Fire','1997-02-01','Arcade','Game Boy','Mario and Luigi attempt to catch Toads, Yoshis, and Donkey Kong Jrs. after they jump out the window of Princess Peach\'s burning castle. The catch is that different characters fall at different speeds: Toads bounce the highest, while Donkey Kong Jrs. bounce the lowest. Yoshi Eggs also appear and contain either a Bob-omb or a Moon (a Super Star in the first game); the eggs break open when they are caught or hit the ground. The player receives two points for catching an egg. If a Bob-omb reaches the carriage, everyone, including the Mario Bros., runs away as the carriage explodes, and the player gets a miss. If the Mario Bros. catch a Moon, the player receives five points. At 200, 500, and 700 points, Peach appears and blows a kiss, sending out a heart for Mario or Luigi to catch to remove a miss. Music is also featured in this version, with the tempo changing depending on the speed of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co618n.jpg'),(17887,'Serial Cleaner','2017-11-30','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Serial Cleaner is a story-driven, fast-paced stealth/action game, characterized by a 1970s theme and aesthetics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tve.jpg'),(17888,'Deadside: Guerilla Skin Set','2025-02-25','Shooter','Xbox One','A set of skins for those who want to explore the dangerous world of Deadside with style. The skin is unlocked through purchase and then become available in painting menu on a workbench. Contains ingame \"Guerilla\" Skin for these weapons:\n\nAK-Mod\nAR4\nAK-SM\nAR4-M\nVSD','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m37.jpg'),(17889,'Orcs Must Die! 2','2017-04-21','Shooter, Platform, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Orcs Must Die! 2 thrusts players and their friends back into battle against a terrifying mob of orcs and other monsters. With a redesigned spellbook, players will have a broader range of options to build a deadly arsenal of defenses. Investing hard-earned skulls in an enormous new upgrade system will allow players to cater to their favorite methods of burning, grinding, tossing, or dismembering orcs. \n \nOrcs Must Die! 2 begins days after the ending of the original game. With the rifts closed and the magical Order dead, the War Mage finds himself suddenly thrust into a new battle against the mindless orc mob. He has a powerful, if questionable, new companion in the Sorceress, an ex-War Mage responsible for the destruction of the Order.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/eksi5x5lmj3vh2z69ydl.jpg'),(17890,'Cralon',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cralon is an authentic 3D dungeon crawler with RPG and adventure elements, inspired by the ultimate dungeon classics. Hunting a demon, you fell into the abyss of an old mine. Equip yourself, fight creatures, solve quests, uncover secrets and find a way out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gi0.jpg'),(17891,'Brick Breaker Saga','2017-04-14','Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','An Arkanoid game with two game modes and 70 levels to plays. Also customizable balls that you can choose for best gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uv8iekanz5cwu9eru2aw.jpg'),(17892,'Aliens: Colonial Marines - Limited Edition','2013-02-12','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','You and your friends are the deadliest killers in the galaxy. Another glorious day in the Corps.\n\nBuckle up, soldier! Welcome to Aliens: Colonial Marines. Created by Gearbox, the critically acclaimed and fan-favourite developers of Borderlands and Brothers In Arms, you and your friends will become the most badass military outfit in the galaxy – the US Colonial Marines. It’s up to you to not just survive, but wipe out the Xeno infestation.\n\nThe Limited Edition Pack includes:\n\n- 4 movie characters: Play as Apone, Hicks, Hudson and Drake from the Aliens movie in competitive multiplayer.\n- Ripley\'s Flamethrower: Raise hell with this pulse rifle and flamethrower combo.\n-Additional marine customisation: Define the look of your marine in online multiplayer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yxk.jpg'),(17893,'Dungeons & Dragons: Krynn Series','2015-10-27','Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Return to the first fantasy role-playing epic set in the legendary Dragonlance game world of Krynn. This immortal pack includes Champions of Krynn, Death Knights of Krynn and The Dark Queen of Krynn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8r01.jpg'),(17894,'Five Nights on the Toilet: Number 2','2023-06-22','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A comedy parody of the Five Nights at Freddy\'s indie horror series, and the sequel to Five Nights on the Toilet.\n\nSurvive five nights upon a toilet in an abandoned Freddy Fazbear\'s location, and investigate what events brought the story to where it is now.\n\nFeatures first person sit and survive horror gameplay, with many levels, secrets, and challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73o1.jpg'),(17895,'Umineko When They Cry: Episode 1 - Legend of the Golden Witch','2016-07-08','Adventure, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A remastered version of the first episode of the international release of Umineko When They Cry, developed by 07th Expansion and MangaGamer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78ut.jpg'),(17896,'Ink Sans Phase 3: Shanghaivania','2020-08-19','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An Undertale fan game dedicated to fighting the fan-made character \"Ink\".','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17897,'Sports Champions','2010-09-17','Sport','PlayStation 3','Sports Champions is a 2010 sports video game developed by San Diego Studio and Zindagi Games and published by Sony Computer Entertainment for PlayStation 3, which utilizes PlayStation Move. It was officially unveiled at the 2010 Game Developers Conference in San Francisco. The game is a collection of modern and medieval sports games published by Sony Computer Entertainment and is jointly developed by San Diego Studio and Zindagi Games as a launch game for the PlayStation Move which would be bundled with the controller in several regions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kcm.jpg'),(17898,'Dr Livingstone, I Presume?: Digital Deluxe Edition',NULL,'Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3s5p.jpg'),(17899,'Quest Master\'s Realm: Land of the Phoenix','2024-08-30','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dungeon Expansion for Quest Master\'s Realm.\n\nStrange phenomena have been reported in the Orcazelos Desert , unexplained disturbances originating from below the surface.\n\nYour job is to investigate, discover what is going on there.\n\nCombat a new range of foes beneath the desert in the exciting Dungeon, \'The Solace of Q\'ro\'.\n\nMythical treasures await those who dare to venture here, a new range of equipment unavailable elsewhere in the game!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17900,'The Lion\'s Song','2018-07-10','Point-and-click, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','The Lion\'s Song is a series of four self-contained point & click stories connected into an overarching narrative, where player choices will affect the way in which the story unfolds. Set against the backdrop of early 20th century Austria, every episode follows a different character, each blessed with an exceptional creative mind. The game pulls players into a story of personal struggle for creativity, human connections and inspiration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27b5.jpg'),(17901,'How long can human beings exist','2018-09-30','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','How long can human beings live on Earth? Will the human being be destroyed when disaster strikes? A game from the future. Challenge more than 50 kinds of disasters that will destroy humanity in the future. Victims or survivors, destroy the world or save humanity? Human civilization is about to usher in the end, you are entrusted with a heavy responsibility, to the future, to lead all humanity to fight against disasters, to strive to survive for a long time before the end of the day, to continue the civilization of human prosperity!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17902,'Nightmare Zapping','2023-07-17','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A horror channel browsing game where each channel holds a different nightmare to experience, explore them and find out the truth about what has happened in a small town where the inhabitants have disappeared.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6sjc.jpg'),(17903,'Tails Doll','2023-08-20','Indie','Android','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h5n.jpg'),(17904,'Chambered Fate','2023-07-09','Puzzle','Web browser','Chambered Fate is a role reversal of the shooter genre. Instead of shooting enemies, you take control of the bullet fired from the gun and steer its trajectory into your enemies. Use your environment to your advantage and try to eliminate all enemies with as few bullets as possible. Your fate has been chambered, prepare to be fired.\nSubmission in the GMTK Game Jam 2023','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73l2.jpg'),(17905,'Snowcat Simulator 2011',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Everybody knows the giant vehicles preparing the white tracks for skier. No slope is too steep and no snowbank to huge. As driver of such a monstrosity, you are responsible to prepare the rundowns in a giant ski area. Everyday crowds of people arrive at the peak of the mountain, ready to ski down the tracks on perfect prepared rundowns. It is up to the player to make their wish come true. In order to fulfill this duty, the player must handle snowcats in various sizes. In addition to the rundowns, the player must keep the roads to the ski area clean as well, using the snow blower machine.\n\nThis job is not easy. Strong wind and heavy snowfall exuberates the work on the rundowns. There is only one way to get the job done, enter the snowcat, start the engine and get this monster moving. By day or by night, it does not matter, the rundowns must be prepared before the first vacationers arrive. Lower the shield of the snowcat and smooth the snow or groom. If the weather is getting to bad use the wiper to keep a clear view.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/daifcqm3prbdn5cf9yqk.jpg'),(17906,'Battle Gem Ponies','2024-09-02','Role-playing (RPG)','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A super-powered, shapeshifting pony RPG.\n\nCommand a super-powered, shape-shifting pony in this RPG Adventure! In a world where unpredictable legendary beasts pose an existential threat, you\'ll embark on a journey across the Pinto region to become the best pony tamer in the world and protect your magical companion from those who want to use her as a secret weapon.\n\nCustomize your team with hundreds of different moves, stat arrangements, & collectible battle gear to gain the upper hand in this rapid-switchout Rock/Paper/Scissors combat system.\n\nA years-in-the-making love letter to the My Little Pony & Pokémon communities, celebrating one year of progress since the successful Kickstarter campaign!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qvu.jpg'),(17907,'Blades of Brim','2015-06-04','Platform, Racing, Adventure, Arcade','Android, iOS','The creators of Subway Surfers present Blades of Brim!\nJoin forces with the heroes of Brim to save the world from the invading army of Goons!\nStep into an epic and enchanting universe where magic and mayhem awaits!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86r0.jpg'),(17908,'Ecco the Dolphin','2006-12-02','Adventure','Linux, Wii, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox 360, Sega CD','Life was an adventure for Ecco, the young dolphin. The ocean seemed endless with rolling breakers to race through! At high speed Ecco could burst through the waves leaping through the air – almost flying! Until one day, all of that changed. A freak whirlpool of air and water tore the life from Ecco’s home leaving Ecco all alone. Now he must fight to stay alive, while traversing the vast ocean in search of clues that will help him save his family and return them to the bay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23oy.jpg'),(17909,'ParamediCats','2020-03-22','Simulator','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Play as an aspiring up-and-coming paramedicat in training, helping treat the sick folk of Meowingston county whilst on the move . We like to keep them extra happy by sending them off with an Ice-cream for being good.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4n5a.jpg'),(17910,'Gunner-chan!',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 2.5D top-down, roguelike shooter set in a base that has descended into chaos due to an experiment gone awry. Fight the robots that have gone haywire and resolve the crisis.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ev7.jpg'),(17911,'Dadish 3','2022-06-14','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','When his kids board a bus for a suspicious field trip, Dadish sets off to find them before they\'re turned into radish soup!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ooz.jpg'),(17912,'Spongedrake Unleashed 3D','2021-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17913,'Silent Hill: The Arcade','2014-02-05','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Silent Hill: The Arcade is an arcade game based on Silent Hill survival horror series by Konami. The Arcade has currently never been officially ported to consoles or on PC, thus the game is rare.\n\nHowever, in February 2014, it was unofficially ported to PC (Windows XP & 7) by a group of talented fans known as Insert More Coins, although setting up the game may be difficult as it can only run on monitors that support 640x480 resolution and is apparently not Windows 10-compatible.\n\nOn Sept 2015, another fan known as Biffman 101 re-published the port on their blog and following a conversation with an anonymous commenter, in 2019, a Windows 10 compatible version was emerged and published, on their blog post (The Collection Chamber - SILENT HILL: THE ARCADE).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94qy.jpg'),(17914,'Gemwielders','2025-12-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this competitive deckbuilding game you are a Gemwielder, capable of controlling an ancient artifact weapon. Socket mystical gems to acquire powerful abilities and prevail in a duel against another Gemwielder.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co952t.jpg'),(17915,'Dojo Masters','2024-07-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dojo Masters is a 2-button martial arts indie fighting game. Battle against your friends or head online to challenge warriors from around the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xty.jpg'),(17916,'A Friday Night Real Music Funkin Game',NULL,'Sin género','Android','A Friday Night Real Music Funkin Game with all songs Friday Night Funkin Music Smoke Em\' Out Struggle Full Combo. You are the best and beat all your opponents in this game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94x6.jpg'),(17917,'R20 Moe Bomberman',NULL,'Arcade','Legacy Mobile Device','R20 ☆ Moe Bomberman is a video game released on mobile devices, exclusively in Japan. It is a cross-over between Hudson Soft\'s R20 ☆ Moe series and the Bomberman series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5u68.jpg'),(17918,'Garfield and His Nine Lives','2006-05-05','Platform','Game Boy Advance','The classic comic strip character Garfield is back – just as fat, lazy and lovable as ever! The cynical orange cat loves lasagne, coffee, and his remote control as well as his owner, the long-suffering Jon Arbuckle and the sweet but dumb dog Odie. One evening just before bed time Garfield goes on one of his beloved eating benders. That night he faces the consequences as he endures a night full of strange dreams. These dreams and, in some case, nightmares, take Garfield and the player on 9 unique adventures based on the cat\'s 9 \"lives\"!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d18.jpg'),(17919,'Kimi to Kanojo no Lily Vaganza','2024-09-14','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a Yandere Yuri horror game where character sprites and still images move smoothly, created using Live2D and TyranoScript. If you enjoy Yandere Yuri horror filled with obsessive love, we highly recommend giving it a try.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tjz.jpg'),(17920,'Repton','1985-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Arcade','BBC Microcomputer System, Acorn Electron','Repton, the eponymous protagonist, walks around an underground maze in a quest to find all the diamonds (some being held in safes, their release being triggered by finding and collecting a key) within a time limit in each of several levels, while avoiding being trapped or killed by falling rocks and monsters hatched from eggs. The original Repton game was released in the summer of 1985 and has 12 levels, with passwords making it possible to jump directly to later levels. If passwords were used though, on completion of the final level, the displayed message challenged the player to complete the game without using them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/li1g9uxsfd1j3bho2hhk.jpg'),(17921,'Action 69','2022-10-27','Platform, Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Action 69 is a video game compilation developed by TeamCS1 for the Windows platform.\n\n21 exclusive games parodying on retro classics and my own spin on my favourite games.\n\nGames that cover a variety of genres from racing to card games to open world and RPG\'s you\'re bound to find something you love.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t0d.jpg'),(17922,'Aenaon','2020-07-26','Adventure','SteamVR','It\'s time to compete in the ancient Olympic Games, but apart from sports, you also have to prepare your spirit. We welcome you to ancient Greek culture!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l23.jpg'),(17923,'Nowa Online World','2024-09-27','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Android, iOS','Nowa Online World is a mobile role-playing game about the war between human and orc developed by Nowa Games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w1q.jpg'),(17924,'Zombie Hunter: Mobile Shooting Game','2020-05-01','Shooter','Android, iOS','Zombie Hunter is designed to be the next changer among mobile shooting games with story-driven TPS and Apocalypse scenes, heroic feeling of killing and fighting zombies, and offline single-player mode.\n\nSet in the days after a pandemic outbreak of a viral strain transforming people into zombies, the game follows the adventures of a hunter attempting to approach a mysterious organization to find the vaccine while fending off the attacking hordes. It is easy to learn to play though. You will have fun for hours with endless shooting deathmatches to satisfy your shooting sensation on a variety of dead targets and mad zombies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3h4z.jpg'),(17925,'Suspicious Downpour','2021-06-12','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Suspicious Downpour is a very short single-player comedy horror experience about getting stuck in a storm while out camping. Sit in your tent with your trusty flashlight in the calm rain and just relax. Just be warned If you look for trouble you might find it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46v3.jpg'),(17926,'Shooting Blaster Big Bang Boom',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Are you gonna shoot? YES! Are you gonna blast? YES! Are you gonna make a big bang? YES! Are you gonna make a big boom? YES! So what do you get? Shooting Blaster Big Bang Boom! Come have some fun, it\'s Good Time time!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co412c.jpg'),(17927,'Zenless Zone Zero: Update 1.7 - Bury Your Tears With the Past','2025-04-23','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac','Version 1.7 of Zenless Zone Zero, which includes:\n\n• New Characters: Vivian and Hugo\n• New Main Story Quest: Bury Your Tears With the Past - Part 2\n• New Events\n• ...and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9py4.jpg'),(17928,'Empires of the Undergrowth','2017-12-01','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Lead your Ant Colony to Dominance!\n\nEmpires of the Undergrowth is an ant colony management game, in a fast-paced real-time strategy style. The player excavates their nest underground, constructing tunnels and chambers to store food and raise brood. On the surface, the ants claim territory, gather resources, overwhelm fearsome arachnids and clash with other colonies. Nest design, army size, composition and attack timing are key to securing victory.\n\nMissions are narrated from the perspective of a documentary film maker studying the ants, who offers intelligent insight into the goings-on of the colony and the undergrowth beyond. The primary game mode in early access is Formicarium, where you take ownership of a home colony of unique DNA-harvesting ants as they work to assimilate the desirable traits of their foes. You can upgrade them by playing one-off missions, sometimes with your home colony and sometimes with other ant species.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pkk.jpg'),(17929,'TIE: A game about depression','2018-07-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','TIE is a game about depression and the daily grind we are all forced too endure. Experience a week of more of the same, every day, through the eyes of our main character as the world and its inhabitants slowly start too become increasingly unfamiliar. Irregularities in the world and from deep within plague your day to day and a strange force seems to tear the very fabric of reality itself, as it becomes apparent that not all is as it seems in this short, atmospheric game about depression and existential dread.\n\nAn intricately detailed and beautiful pixel art world to explore.\nAn atmospheric narrative about the routine we all face and the void beyond.\nA wonderful, hauntingly melancholy soundtrack composed by Meat Analogue.\nWe become aware of the void as we fill it. Embrace life. Embrace work. Embrace routine. Embrace the unnatural but strangely compelling voice of the void that calls to you from beyond; a place neither here nor there, but rather simply... just is. After you...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co974e.jpg'),(17930,'Maroon!',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17931,'Performan','1985-06-01','Shooter','Arcade','Performan was Toaplan\'s first shooter, and it\'s certainly not what one would expect from them, especially when looking at some of their later games. It\'s actually a strange, overhead shooter much like Robotron. The star is the titular Performan, a native in a jungle that wears a huge mask, who\'s being stalked by a squadron of drill-wielding robots. He must stop them using balls of energy, his ability to dig underground, and bombs that are set up in every level. He can also go into Power Mode by shooting ghosts that randomly appear, which turns him green and invincible for a short time.\n\nNeedless to say, Performan is a very weird, very hard game. There are 99 levels and the game loops endlessly, as typical of most early arcade games. The main problem with Performan is that he\'s far too weak to survive for long. He can\'t move quickly, his shots are slow, and he can only have one shot on screen at a time, which can easily be dodged. The bombs are an easy way to get rid of two or maybe three at a time, but this usually requires setup, which takes a bit time, and by which point you\'re like to be killed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dmw.jpg'),(17932,'Where is a Toilet!?','2022-12-12','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\'Where is a Toilet!?\' is a simple running-platformer game using only move and jump key. Player is reach to the Goal avoiding obstacles. Player also can get a combo bonus through stomping villains. Two or more combo bonus get player faster and invincible, it is a important key to the victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vls.jpg'),(17933,'Amaze Adventure',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Old school console RPG style. Collect cards for use in turn-based card battles. Explore the maze to find puzzle pieces that earn more cards. Discover various puzzle types in each world maze. Choose to help others or not. Play at your own pace. Simple controls. Multiple outcomes to each scenario.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57tj.jpg'),(17934,'Pudding Frog','2025-04-11','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into Pudding Frog, a high-stakes, physics-based platformer where every leap and grapple could be your last. Master the art of the swing as you painstakingly ascend through a treacherous world to reclaim your precious pudding from the cunning Harry the Heron. Do you have what it takes?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hmm.jpg'),(17935,'Megaman Exe Radio','2021-12-31','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17936,'Skeal','2014-09-14','Platform, Sport','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short skiing game that features Seal, pleasure, and pain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4aen.jpg'),(17937,'Touhou: Hotline Sanzu','2022-08-10','Shooter, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An arcade shooter / immersive sim where you solve problems with guns, backstabs, and strategic use of vents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u69.jpg'),(17938,'Hohokum','2022-07-28','Music, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','Hohokum is a colorful exploration based adventure game. Players control a space worm, flying around rescuing people from their city under distress.\n\nHohokum is a collaboration between Honeyslug, an independent game developer based in North London, and Richard Hogg, an artist and designer. After launching as a web-based gaming experiment in 2010, Hohokum comes to PlayStation consoles now fully formed thanks to a collaboration with game design studios Honeyslug and SCE Studios Santa Monica, delivering the same unique exploration experience in a refined and expansive adventure waiting to be explored!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ryo.jpg'),(17939,'The Chronicles of Omega','1990-12-31','Shooter, Platform','Amiga','A magical quest where good clashes with evil. In the far off land of Omega, the peaceful existence of its people is thrown into panic as the jealous forces of evil abduct the children one by one. Hate and unhappiness spread throughout the land until a fateful mistake is made, one of the twins- Alwin and Irma- is taken captive.\n\nAs the remaining seventh twin of a seventh child, your desperate quest brings you in conflict with the foot soldiers and champion warriors of the evil demon. Aided by the kindness of the good witch and your own magical powers battle your way to the demon castle for the final encounter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/c5pbntp6ymorzx2ky60i.jpg'),(17940,'Call of Duty: Black Ops III - Eclipse','2016-05-19','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','DLC 2 Eclipse for Black Ops 3 is available now featuring all new MP environments and Zombies content.\n\nIn the latest episode of the Zombies experience, the Origins characters head to \'Zetsubou No Shima\', a tropical island where experiments with Element 115 have created horrors beyond belief.\n\nBattle your way through four stunning Black Ops III Multiplayer environments: Spire, Knockout, Verge and Rift.\n\nSpire: Take MP combat to a futuristic sub-orbital airport terminal set high in the clouds.\n\nKnockout: The Shaolin Temple with a retro twist contrasts exterior mid-range engagements and interior close quarters.\n\nVerge: This reimagined classic Call of Duty: World at War map, Banzai, drops MP combat into the center of a distant post-apocalyptic future.\n\nRift: Head to the core of a harsh futuristic military complex, set above an active volcano.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ktj.jpg'),(17941,'Lawl',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android','Lawl is a Massive Multiplayer Online RPG, created for the people who loves this game style. Even since Lawl is a modern and advanced game, it also have a unique and classic graphic. We are in beta, so many things can change, and you can be a part of it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4w8e.jpg'),(17942,'8-Bit Adventures 2','2023-01-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','8-Bit Adventures 2 is everything you love about NES, SNES and PS1-era JRPGs - with all of the charm, heart and soul, but none of the inconvenience. Dynamic turn-based battles & pixels with personality!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28rj.jpg'),(17943,'Black Hole Assault','1992-10-15','Fighting','Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD, Sega CD','According to Black Hole Assault, the 22nd century sees earth technology advance to the point where exploration of the immediate solar system is not only possible, but necessary due to resource constraints. Humans are attempting to harvest the resources of the entire solar system but have met with trouble from alien invaders. It is up to a small force of humans who recognize and understand the threat to confront the aliens head on.\n\nThe weapon of choice in this game is the Cybernetic Anthropomorphized Machine, or C.A.M. The C.A.M. is a large robot that fights 1-on-1 against alien robots. All of the gameplay in Black Hole Assault revolves around single-round, 1-on-1 robot fighting action. There are 10 backdrops against which to beat up robots, including various planets and moons around the solar system.\n\nThe game has 4 different modes. The main story mode is Operation BHA. The exhibition mode allows players to customize matches down to the robots each player will use and the backdrop to play on. The exhibition mode can be configured to allow one or even both fighters to be controlled by the computer. Further, the game has tournament and league modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yi3.jpg'),(17944,'Tenioha! feat. Mami','2023-10-29','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this 2022 Moe Game Award–winning dark romance VN, step into the shoes of a submissive young corporate cog whose dream of a big-city bachelor’s lifestyle remains elusive—that is, until he catches the captivating gaze of one Mami Himekawa, his dommy-mommy, slightly older coworker...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u3e.jpg'),(17945,'Zapatitos: Suenos de Libertad','2016-06-01','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zapatitos is the star clown of the Tiliches circus, the best at his job, but unhappy since he lives in a slave work environment, a circus life of 24 hours 365 days, Zapatitos who is tired of his work life decides to seek his independence starting with a well-deserved vacation. His boss, Don Chelo has profited for many years from Zapatitos\' work and will not let him retire so easily, thereby losing his gold mine. The player must help Zapatitos through 4 levels, fleeing from Don Chelo and his workers, who under his influence will try to stop him along his way, escaping to his vacation and freedom.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17946,'Detective Kobayashi','2019-10-24','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take on the role of Detective Kobayashi, the one and only genius detective who has a reputation for solving any case, however dark or difficult...if he isn\'t playing games at the office or awkwardly hitting on girls, that is.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pwq.jpg'),(17947,'My Personal Angel','2017-07-21','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','My Personal Angel is a black and white visual novel about the complexities of relations between people.\n\nIt often rains in our city, and sometimes it\'s difficult to differ the day from the night. Almost always the sky covered in dark gray clouds. Maybe because the city itself is a port, and the endless splashing of the raging sea.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rkh.jpg'),(17948,'The Crypt Terror','2022-07-02','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The town of Sherdone is cursed and you are sent down to rid them of the evil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o7a.jpg'),(17949,'Assemblage of Angels','2020-06-02','Indie','Web browser','Guide a young woman as she visits old friends and gathers what she needs to fulfill her goal: building an angel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84jc.jpg'),(17950,'Detroit: Become Human - Premium Edition','2018-05-25','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Detroit: Become Human is an neo-noir thriller that puts the destiny of both mankind and androids in your hands, taking you to a near future where machines have become more intelligent than humans. Every choice you make affects the outcome of the game, with one of the most intricately branching narratives ever created. The Premium Edition includes a copy of the game, a limited edition special art book, the original digital soundtrack, original theme, and sticker.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gvc.jpg'),(17951,'Univocity','2025-04-10','Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Univocity is a short cyberpunk visual novel wrapped in neon aesthetics with a lush atmospheric soundtrack, featuring a deep and emotional conversation between two people about taking down a global tech monopoly.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oqf.jpg'),(17952,'No Numbers','2023-12-07','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Put two and two together in this minimalist, hex-based puzzle game that will rekindle your love for numbers. Solve thoughtfully crafted levels that invite you to engage your mind and explore the unique gameplay at your own pace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73g4.jpg'),(17953,'Compassionate Simulation','2020-07-31','Sin género','Web browser','—our company mission to provide grieving families with accurate, compassionate simulations of their deceased loved ones—\n\nYou! Winnifred Meyer. Remember? You are Winnifred Meyer, and you died at age twenty-six in a car accident.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4awa.jpg'),(17954,'Yoshi','1992-12-17','Puzzle','Game Boy','Yoshi is a puzzle game featuring the titular character. In this game, the player must stack two of the same Mario enemy on top of one another to clear them. The concept of the game was inspired by Tetris.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z4t.jpg'),(17955,'Snow Cone',NULL,'Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Snow Cone is a penguin-themed puzzle game where you arrange snowballs into elegant Snow Cones to match customers\' orders in dozens of challenging puzzles. Meet interesting characters and expose the truth behind the city\'s shady penguin underbelly.\n\nFeatures handcrafted puzzles, pixel-art graphics, and a jazz-inspired soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pz5.jpg'),(17956,'Dark Interval','2020-08-22','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dark Interval is a restoration/revision mod that lets you play Half-Life 2 as it could have been. Using Valve\'s early concepts, we\'re creating new maps, models, textures, and custom dialogue. The mod is released in episodes, the most recent being Dark Interval: Part I - an intro chapter to the bigger story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co579e.jpg'),(17957,'Ansuz','2021-02-05','Simulator, Strategy','Meta Quest 2, Oculus Quest','Your words and your magic will change the world.\n\nAnsuz is a VR werewolf game in which players are divided into two forces.\n\nGood and evil roles are randomly assigned to the 4 players. If you are good, try to find the evil, and if you are evil, try to avoid being found by the good. Use your own words to skillfully argue for victory. When good wins, it will bring peace to the world; when evil wins, it will bring ruin to the world...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4sd6.jpg'),(17958,'Elden Gunfire 2','2022-07-20','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A comic, funny and cute online multiplayer third person shooter game for everyone with fantastic cartoon 3D next generation graphics and captivating gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7y7m.jpg'),(17959,'Gold Drop Mania','2024-08-31','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gold Drop Mania brings the thrill of coin dropping straight to your screen. Experience the ultimate coin pusher machine, inspired by the classic amusement arcade, carnival, and circus attractions!\n\nIn Gold Drop Mania, every coin you drop onto the platform adds to your wealth. Your goal is to strategically time your drops to push other coins, gem and gold bars off the edge, racking up your score. Precision and timing are the keys to mastering the art of the coin pusher. Drop into this dungeon themed coin pusher game, where each drop could lead to a cascade of rewards!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cb0.jpg'),(17960,'The Ghosts of Hackney Mills','2017-11-09','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In The Ghosts of Hackney Mills a maintenance engineer is asked to inspect a bizarre power surge that happened at an old and abandoned research center. As he explores the campus he finds that it hides a terrible terrible secret…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rns.jpg'),(17961,'Squad Battles: The Proud and the Few',NULL,'Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Sin plataforma','Squad-level wargame set in WW2 Pacific Theater that focuses on the battles of the United States Marines against the forces of Japan. Relive those glorious moments of the Marine history in their victorious advance from one island to another. From Guadalcanal to Okinawa, and even to the shores of the Japanese home islands, join the fight to ultimate victory.\nThe Proud and the Few includes 46 Scenarios, including Wake Island, Tarawa, Guadalcanal, Iwo Jima, and others, covering all sizes and situations.\n\nIncluded are 23 unique maps ranging in size from 390 hexes to 77,028 hexes, covering many of the island hopping operations in the Pacific theater.\n\nThe Order of Battles include US Army, US Marine, Japanese Army and Japanese Naval soldiers.\n\nUnit component, Order-of-Battle and Scenario Editors which allow players to customize the game.\n\nMap & Sub-map editors allowing map creation and any of the included maps to be \"chopped\" up into smaller segments for custom scenario creation.\n\nThe Proud and the Few provides multiple play options including play against the computer AI, Play by E-mail (PBEM), LAN & Internet \"live\" play, and two player hot seat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bi5.jpg'),(17962,'Welcome to Light Fields','2018-03-14','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Light Fields. Experience real-world reflections, depth, and translucence like never before in VR. Explore the Gamble House, Mosaic Tile House, and the Space Shuttle Discovery. These navigable stills showcase the emerging technology Google is using to power its next generation of VR content.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wi8.jpg'),(17963,'Paper Dash: Ghost Hunt','2023-10-30','Shooter, Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Start an adventure as a courageous paper plane hunts evil ghosts across vibrant worlds. Soar through mystical forests and scary mansions, utilizing your flying skills and reflexes to shoot the ghosts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d78.jpg'),(17964,'ChillCraft','2023-07-07','Point-and-click, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A clicker game heavily inspired by Minecraft.\n\nYou gather resources and then use the resources to craft and upgrade your world and unlock new features. Survival features to be added in the near future.\n\nA simple game to mindlessly click away and forget your life\'s worries','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qdx.jpg'),(17965,'Pokémon Mystery Dungeon: Explorers of Time','2008-07-04','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Nintendo DS','Embark on a journey after you get turned into a Pokémon as a result of a freak accident, causing you to lose your memory as well as contact with and knowledge of your previous adventuring partner, with whom you were on a secret mission to save the world. Watch your story unfold in a dungeon crawling rogue-lite experience as you form your very own rescue team with a new partner of your choosing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yzu.jpg'),(17966,'Flynn: Son of Crimson','2021-09-15','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Traverse a beautifully hand crafted world and unearth the mysteries of a dark past in this fast paced 2D action platformer with metroidvania elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3tyz.jpg'),(17967,'Heaven Bound',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17968,'Bug Fables: Aphid Festival','2021-04-01','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The second game in the Bug Fables franchise. This time, it\'s a clicker game about farming aphids. Get your aphid to level ten through training with Tanjerin, and mealtimes with Kut.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xgb.jpg'),(17969,'Kingdom Hearts: Fragmented Keys',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','Kingdom Hearts Fragmented Keys is an unreleased mobile game from the Kingdom Hearts series. Development on the game started in 2012, however was cancelled in 2014 before being announced to the public.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fjn.jpg'),(17970,'Super Breakout','1978-09-30','Arcade','Arcade','Super Breakout is an arcade game released by Atari in 1978. It utilizes a Motorola M6502 (running up at 375 KHz) and, as the name suggests, is the sequel to Breakout, which was released two years earlier. There are three different modes to choose from: Double Breakout, the playfield for which contains in fifty-two orange blocks (5-14 points), fifty-two green blocks (1-6 points), two paddles and two balls, Cavity Breakout, which contains in forty-four orange blocks (7-21 points), and fifty-two green blocks (1-9 points), one paddle, and three balls (the second and third of which have to be freed before they come into play) and Progressive Breakout which contains fifty-two blue blocks (7 points) and fifty-two green blocks (5 points), one paddle, and one ball - and the blocks shall be lowered down towards the paddle, at a rate determined by the number of times the ball lands on your paddle, but as the ball destroys them, additional rows of blocks shall appear at the top of the screen and be lowered down towards the paddle at an increasing rate. This is also the only mode for which it\'s possible for a player to receive an infinite amount of points by playing, but the score display shall roll over at 10000.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co671n.jpg'),(17971,'Chainz 2: Relinked','2009-07-13','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s link-matching madness with Chainz 2: Relinked. Rotate the colored links to make matches of three or more in Classic Mode. Pit your link-matching skills against the clock in Arcade Mode. Ponder every precious move in Strategy Mode. Twist your brain and clear all the links in Puzzle Mode. Add in awesome sound effects, a zippy new music score, and sensationally updated visuals, and Chainz 2: Relinked is sure to keep you chained to your seat!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4gob.jpg'),(17972,'Darkborn',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Development on this game has been put on an indefinite hiatus while the developers work on a new project. \n \n \nHumans share the world with the last remnant of a forgotten species of intelligent creatures. Players play as and see the world through the eyes of those creatures, battling the humans who have nearly eradicated the race entirely.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29kt.jpg'),(17973,'Jack Jeanne','2023-06-15','Music, Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','Jack Jeanne is an opera-themed otome game, produced and illustrated by Sui Ishida (Tokyo Ghoul) and co-written by Ishida and Shin Towada (Tokyo Ghoul light novels). Protagonist Kisa Tachibana is given an opportunity to fulfill her dream of going to the All Boys Univeil Drama School where she must develop bonds and rivalries with her classmates while hiding her identity as a girl.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mye.jpg'),(17974,'Bloons But You\'re the Bloon',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bloons is a popular online game where players use a monkey character to pop balloons bloons using various weapons and tools. In this version of the game, \"Bloons but you\'re the bloon,\" the player takes on the role of a bloon and must evade being popped by the monkey characters. As the bloon, the player will navigate through different levels, each with their unique challenges and obstacles. The player must avoid the monkey\'s attacks, such as darts, bombs, and boomerangs, and find ways to get past the monkey\'s defenses. To do this, the bloon has a range of abilities and upgrades that can be earned throughout the game. The player can customize their bloon by choosing different types of bloons, each with unique abilities and weaknesses. As the player progresses through the game, the monkey characters become more challenging, and the levels become more difficult. The ultimate goal of the game is to make it through all the levels without getting popped by the monkeys.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17975,'ACE Academy','2016-08-22','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','ACE Academy is a slice-of-life, story-centric comedy game with elements of dating-sim; fully voiced and extensively interactive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pdh.jpg'),(17976,'G-Mode Archives+: Tantei Kibukawa Ryousuke Jiken-tan Vol. 7 - Otonari Keiji no Sousa Memo','2021-10-07','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A lost Chihuahua and a kind town police officer. With their ideal image of a detective in their hearts, this mismatched duo races through the city!\n\nA small police box at the crossroads in front of the station, the police station in front of Marihamadai Station.\nA lost puppy was entrusted to Officer Otonari, who was still working at the police box as a police officer at that time.\nThe dog breed is Chihuahua. According to the attached collar, the name is Chappie.\n\nOfficer Otonari, tasked with searching for the owner of Chappie, got an eyewitness testimony that a person who seemed to be the owner entered the Marihama Grand Hotel as a result of the interview in front of the station.\n\nAs long as you know where you are, the solution is near. The man and the dog began their investigation in the hotel lobby, but when a guest came running in with a pale face, they were drawn into further incidents...\n\nOtonari Koichi, 26, is always by your side in heart. To protect the peace of Marihamadai, he runs through the town with his little partner!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68k4.jpg'),(17977,'Samurai Shodown III','1996-08-23','Fighting','Game Boy','The Game Boy version of Samurai Showdown III lacks Kyoshiro Senryo and Gaira Caffeine, but adds Jubei Yagyu back to the roster as a hidden final boss exclusively for the said version. There are also exclusive features that come from using the Super Game Boy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i89.jpg'),(17978,'When You Wish Upon a Star','2022-05-06','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"When you wish upon a star\" is a visual Nobel in the genre of love comedy that unfolds the story through the player\'s choice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qbx.jpg'),(17979,'Business Tour: Football - Forward Number 7',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Victory is always around you! Guru of motivation will explain to you why fortitude and self-improvement are important. He will teach you how to turn on your handsome-man mode, and how to go only forward to victory! And of course your self-confidence will grow. Dice, 100 gold and 50.000 chips will only contribute to this.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17980,'Booster Trooper','2010-03-05','Platform, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Booster Trooper is the future of multiplayer platform shooters. It provides tons of fun with its fast paced action and larger-than-life weapons. You can run or fly around the map, blasting your enemies to bits with bullets, rockets, grenades, magma and other weapons from your arsenal.\n\nWhether you play it against the BOTs or a live player, Booster Trooper will constantly keep you on the edge! Rankings, co-operation, tactics and split second decisions will deliver hours and hours of online multiplayer entertainment!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4trd.jpg'),(17981,'Avengers','1987-02-01','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Arcade','Avengers, sometimes known as Avenger, and known in Japan as Hissatsu Buraiken (必殺 無頼拳?, lit. \"Deadly Ruffian Fist\"), is a 1987 overhead-view vertically scrolling beat \'em up arcade game developed and published by Capcom. The game was directed by Takashi Nishiyama, who later co-planned the original Street Fighter and a few of SNK\'s early fighting games.\n\nThe game takes place in Paradise City, where the villain, \"Geshita\", has captured 6 girls from the city. The player\'s objective (as Ryu or Ko) is to banish \"Geshita\" from Paradise City once and for all. During the game, the player can pick up powerups like the \"Speed Up\", the Super Punch, Grenades, Shurikens, Nunchaku and extra health. The game also features hidden areas on each level, accessed by breaking doors in structures on either side of the screen. The player\'s character has 3 normal means of attack: Punches, which are quick with short range, Kicks, which are slower with longer range, and the Roundhouse, which hits in a 360 degree motion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5tty.jpg'),(17982,'Typing Fingers: Enemy','2021-01-25','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The destiny of humanity lies in your hands, take the brain-ship and battle against unknown alien enemies, across the universe in order to regain control and the peace stolen for us. Only the fastest and most accurate typing master will conquer them all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46iv.jpg'),(17983,'Stand By Me','2021-07-01','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a journey with Pico in his books of adventures and discover a magnetic land in a groovy casual action game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bl8.jpg'),(17984,'2032: A New Threat','2023-01-05','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','2032 is an Indie game with unique features. By 2032, 50% of global vegetation had already been completely consumed by a pest called P-X. A world war arises for basic resources for survival. Spider, a renowned soldier of the armed forces is summoned.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ghk.jpg'),(17985,'Back to the Future: The Game - Episode 3: Citizen Brown','2011-05-26','Point-and-click, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','The third episode for Telltales new Back to the Future series. Marty McFly finds himself trapped in an alternate 1986 Hill Valley ruled under the watchful eye of First Citizen Brown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z1t.jpg'),(17986,'Dark Ghost RPG','2018-04-17','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Together with the old prisoner, go on a hard and big trip to find the legendary land where there is no plague and darkness','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17987,'Cookies','2021-04-23','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Where the ordinary and the hard-to-believe meet in a gutter, the population of \"The Darb\" simply call it \"home\". Gang violence, poverty, and substance abuse leave Darby rife with drifters, murderers, and cash maniacs whose sole purpose in life is finding the next high or die trying. The town of the same name exists as a swollen, caustic juxtaposition of Fear and Loathing in Las Vegas and reruns of Twin Peaks gestating in the sweltering heat of Southern Florida.\n\nThe optimistically named Orange Grove Houses, a dilapidated flop house of an apartment building where the only thing more parasitic than the rats and roaches are the tenants, squats obscenely at the end of a long abandoned housing development. A lone drug pusher hawks his wares to sun-deprived addicts when he\'s not falling prey to his own stock. After an especially odd trip, he finds himself tangled in a devil\'s weave of crime and hallucinations in halls that even God has given up on.\n\nInspired by black comedy Trash Humpers and VHS slashers like The Texas Chainsaw Massacre, Cookies is an obscene PSX-coated blend of Satanic cults, meth-dealing clowns and online torture chambers, all under the same backwards-ass roof.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ah8.jpg'),(17988,'Zenless Zone Zero: Update 1.5 - Astra-nomical Moment','2025-01-22','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac','Version 1.5 of Zenless Zone Zero, which includes:\n\n• New Characters: Astra and Evelyn\n• New Outfits for Ellen, Nicole and Astra\n• New Events\n• ...and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99gi.jpg'),(17989,'Kaze no Klonoa: Moonlight Museum','1999-05-20','Platform, Puzzle','WonderSwan','Klonoa and his friend Huepow come across a young crying girl who tells them that the moon has been divided into fragments and stolen by a mysterious group of artists that reside in the nearby Moonlight Museum. Determined to help, the duo rush off to the Museum\'s entrance, and once they come inside, they are greeted by a painter named Picoo who traps them inside a piece of artwork. Klonoa and Huepow must fight their way through five worlds within the Museum itself before finding the source of all their troubles and restoring the moon to the sky.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qhd.jpg'),(17990,'Inazuma Eleven 3: Lightning Bolt','2010-07-01','Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, Nintendo DS','Several months have passed after saving Earth from Alius Academy’s attack (in Inazuma Eleven 2), Mark Evans and his teammates are summoned by Seymour Hillman to assemble at Raimon Jr. High.\nWhen the team get to the school, they see familiar faces from Japan’s national football players who have once fought along with them, such as Xavier Foster and Jordan Greenway originally from Alius Academy, as well as new faces. Hillman has assembled all these Japan’s best football players for one purpose; to enter the “Football Frontier International (FFI)”.\nWelcoming Mark Evans as Japan’s national team captain, they now strive forward to challenge best football teams from all around the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co407r.jpg'),(17991,'Go! Go! Nippon!: My First Trip to Japan','2011-09-30','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get a taste of the foreign travel offered by printed guidebooks. Enjoy a tour around Japan from the comfort of your own home!\n\nAs the game\'s protagonist, you\'ll travel to famous Japanese sightseeing spots in the company of a pair of beautiful young sisters. The girls will describe the spots, take you out to dinner, and grow closer to you throughout your travels.\n\nThe thrill of taking a trip through Japan with pretty girls is the experience offered by this \"Guide Game\" -- a guidebook in game format.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41d5.jpg'),(17992,'Ghost Terminator',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Let\'s vanish some ghosts! Explore, shoot, run, throw grenades, have some fun and get a little scared. Your mission is to find and annihilate all the ghosts.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5do2.jpg'),(17993,'New Super Lucky\'s Tale','2020-08-21','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Leap into a Playful Platforming Adventure for all ages!\n\nRun, jump, climb incredible heights, burrow deep underground, overcome enemies, and explore amazing worlds on an epic quest to rescue the Book of Ages from the mysterious Jinx and his nefarious Kitty Litter!\n\nExperience an incredible variety of gameplay, ranging from 3D open-world hubs to story-based adventure levels to 2D side-scrolling challenges, rewarding mini-games, mind-bending puzzles, thrilling boss battles, and a memorable cast of characters!\nA true love letter to classic 3D platformers, with hundreds of collectibles to gather, tons of rewarding secrets to unlock, and an entire wardrobe of costumes for the stylish adventurer!\n\nNew Super Lucky’s Tale features all new levels, story, cinematics and character dialogue, tighter movement and player controls, a fully rotatable 3D camera, and sweet upgrades to nearly every other aspect of the game, including art and lighting, UI, sound, music, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ehd.jpg'),(17994,'Star Wars: Droid Repair Bay','2017-12-06','Adventure','Oculus VR, Gear VR, SteamVR','In Star Wars: Droid Repair Bay by ILMxLAB, Poe Dameron\'s sidekick needs your help. Repair BB-8 and his astromech droid friends, each with their own unique personalities, so they can roll back into the fight against the First Order. Aboard General Leia’s ship in the depths of space, you’ll need to work quickly before battle breaks loose just outside the droid repair bay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27vg.jpg'),(17995,'Maggie\'s Movies - Camera, Action!','2017-09-13','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Help me follow my dream and become a movie director!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26y1.jpg'),(17996,'Tiger Tank 59 I: Rainstorm MP050','2021-07-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tiger Tank 59 I: Rainstorm is a top-down shooting game. Players need to control their tanks, through the enemy lines, break the enemy base, or defeat the enemy tanks. This DLC includes map pack 050.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wuf.jpg'),(17997,'Lookouts','2022-04-01','Indie, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Two lookouts meet in a desert, far from the sight of their gangs.\n\nWith more in common than they could\'ve expected, they scout out a town with rumours of gold.\n\nWhat will become of this fateful meeting?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4loa.jpg'),(17998,'Sexy Memory Puzzle: Futanari Pool',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(17999,'Rolling Thunder','1989-12-31','Shooter, Platform','Arcade, Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Wii, Atari ST/STE, Amiga, Amstrad CPC, Nintendo Entertainment System','Rolling Thunder is a run and gun/action arcade game that was released by Namco in 1986 and licensed to Atari Games for US manufacture and distribution. It runs upon Namco System 86 hardware, and was later converted for the Sinclair ZX Spectrum, the Commodore 64, the Amstrad CPC, the Atari ST, the Commodore 64, and the Nintendo Family Computer. It was also featured in Namco Museum Encore.\n\nThe player takes control of \"Albatross\", a member of the WCPO\'s (World Crime Police Organization) \"Rolling Thunder\" espionage unit. Albatross\'s mission is to save a missing female agent named Leila Blitz from a secret society named Geldra located in New York City. Albatross must travel through two different segments or \"stories\", both comprised of five stages, for a total of ten game stages. On each stage, Albatross can enter doors, to hide and take cover from enemies, as well jump over to higher or lower floors with rails, including stairs. Albatross begins this game armed with a standard-issue pistol, which can be substituted with a fully automatic assault rifle that allows for continuous firing by holding down the firing button. Albatross can gain ammunition for either weapon, by entering doors which are marked \"bullets\" or \"arms\". Despite the presence of a life meter, Albatross can only take two physical hits from the enemy: a single hit drains half of the meter, and he will be killed instantly when struck by a projectile attack such as enemy bullets or lasers. (However, all bullets can be blocked by your own).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o6u.jpg'),(18000,'Need for Speed: Most Wanted Demo','2005-07-27','Racing','PlayStation 2','The PlayStation 2 demo disc for Need for Speed: Most Wanted features 3 unique events that are not found in the main game, including a race against Rog, Blacklist rival #16.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87jb.jpg'),(18001,'Alice\'s Jigsaw: Time Travel 2','2021-07-08','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','See Alice and her friends! Solve 100 unique patchwork mosaics!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lbt.jpg'),(18002,'Hide The Corpse','2024-09-17','Puzzle, Simulator, Arcade','Meta Quest 2, Meta Quest 3','Hide the Corpse is a VR physics-based game where players must hide a body within four minutes across six distinct environments, including a zero-gravity spaceship and an underwater shipwreck.\n\nWith quirky humor and immersive gameplay, players will face chaotic fun as they erase evidence and solve creative puzzles. Now featuring a sandbox mode, unlockable levels, and hilarious character skins, Hide the Corpse delivers fast-paced thrills and endless laughs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vwa.jpg'),(18003,'Meiling to Cirno no Yokai no Yama Daibouken','2011-08-13','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A doujin game by YuuYuutei based on the Touhou Project series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53x9.jpg'),(18004,'Evil Star','2017-11-01','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Evil Star is a horizontal scroll strategy leisure arcade game, you just need to use the left and right button to control the spaceship!\nYou need to operate your spaceship to avoid asteroids, collect energy balls. Steam clouds and leaderboards supported,\ncompete with your friends now!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qfo.jpg'),(18005,'Battlefield 3: Close Quarters','2012-06-19','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Battlefield 3: Close Quarters is the second expansion pack for Battlefield 3. It focuses on the premise of Battlefield team play in constricted or tight environments. The gameplay style is turbulent with quick-paced infantry combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2137.jpg'),(18006,'Pixel-Warfare: Pro','2018-04-22','Shooter','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pixel-Warfare: Pro is a multiplayer first person shooter game, that combine retro and modern quality in one. Take your pixel gun and kill as many pixel opponents as possible. This games has only one rule: Fight for your team or kill everyone! This is Pixel-Warfare: Pro!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zlv.jpg'),(18007,'Hungry Horace','2020-09-17','Sin género','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','8-bit hero Horace is often considered the unofficial mascot of the ZX Spectrum. In later years he’d go skiing and battle spiders, but the 1982 game Hungry Horace – now remastered on Steam for your gaming pleasure – saw him run around a maze eating flowers, ringing alarms and avoiding angry parkies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4guj.jpg'),(18008,'Theatre of War 2: Africa 1943 - Centauro','2009-08-29','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Theatre of War 2 – Centauro is dedicated to the 131st Armored Division Centauro and the battles it took part in North Africa starting from December 1942 till mid-May 1943. The 131st Armored Division Centauro was an armored division of the Italian Army during World War II.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tq3.jpg'),(18009,'I Have More Hours Than You','2025-02-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','I Have More Hours Than You is an Idle game with a loose abstract story about acceptance. But you\'ll probably just use it to brag about how many hours you have to your friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9op9.jpg'),(18010,'Strategic Mind: Spectre of Communism','2020-11-13','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Strategic Mind: Spectre of Communism is a (hi)story-driven turn-based strategy set in the WW2 period. It offers refined wargame mechanics, story-rich gameplay, and modern 3D graphics. Lead the USSR Armed forces staging the world Communist revolution. For Stalin! For the Motherland!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co425f.jpg'),(18011,'Anna-san tachi no Fushigi no meikyuu','2021-09-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Anna-san tachi no Fushigi no meikyuu is a roguelike game produced by Capricorn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yka.jpg'),(18012,'A Night at the Races','2019-12-13','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Congratulations, you are now an official participant in the LCPN challenge. This month’s pick is a goofy, adrenaline packed platformer. Be the first to complete all levels before the sunrise and grab the prize.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3kvp.jpg'),(18013,'FreeJack Online','2023-11-18','Racing, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','FreeJack is a classic free-to-play multiplayer parkour racing game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bkw.jpg'),(18014,'Hentai Furry','2025-02-22','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hentai Furry is a place where cute cat girls will help you relax.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9onu.jpg'),(18015,'Deadside: Beehive Skin Set','2025-02-25','Shooter','Xbox One','A set of skins for those who want to explore the dangerous world with style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m33.jpg'),(18016,'Mary Skelter: Nightmares Remake','2019-10-23','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A full remake of the original Mary Skelter: Nightmares with story additions and general gameplay improvements from in Mary Skelter 2.\nIt is recommended that players finish Mary Skelter 2 before playing through the remake due to the new content.\n\nReleased as a free DLC for Mary Skelter 2.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hyy.jpg'),(18017,'Multi-Path','2024-07-26','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Connect the dots to find the path. Move the dots to draw a curve that passes all the gates. You will always find a path to a goal. All it takes is a little imagination. Just relax and play. Let\'s start your journey to lead the light.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kl3.jpg'),(18018,'Fix-It Felix Jr.','2011-12-31','Platform, Puzzle','Arcade, Web browser, iOS, Legacy Mobile Device','A fictional quarter-muncher created for the Walt Disney animated movie \"Wreck-It Ralph\", in which the thick-headed thug Wreck-It Ralph tries to destroy a building while the daring do-gooder Fix-It Felix repairs the damage with his magic hammer.\n\nIn the film, the characters play the role as actors, and Ralph is actually a chipper, nice guy inside the machine -- it\'s just his job to be a heartless demolisher so that Felix can save the day. But countless games where Ralph has played the villain has taken its toll, and after becoming the outcast of his mostly-wrecked town, Ralph is ready to look for more out of his pixelated life.\n\nDuring the promotional campaign for the movie, multiple defictionalised versions of the game were released by Disney for Ralph fans to play, including arcade machines at trade shows. The game replicates vintage gaming aesthetics, but was not designed with original hardware limitaitons in mind, thus all releases of the game run off of Flash.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lii6ay2ylqlh1pkkndcr.jpg'),(18019,'The Stars Under Lockehurst','2024-09-30','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Stars Under Lockehurst is a romantic supernatural mystery visual novel about a grad student visiting their friend in the small coastal town, Cape Lockehurst. Here, they unravel the mysteries behind recent disappearances and peculiar happenings around town.\n\nInspired by H.P. Lovecraft’s Call of Cthulhu and similar works, this game explores fear of the unknown and the unknowable, featuring a cast of unique, romanceable characters (who just might be a little... fishy).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w8o.jpg'),(18020,'DoomBreaker','2024-12-02','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DoomBreaker is a hack n slash adventure in a procedurally generated world, accompanied with voice work driven narrative, combat system and more. Rise up and fight against the impending doom that\'s merging with your world, spreading evil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90le.jpg'),(18021,'LEGO Star Wars: The New Yoda Chronicles','2013-05-04','Adventure','Web browser, iOS','Mobile mini-games and missions featuring Lego Yoda and others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co538i.jpg'),(18022,'Rayman DS','2005-04-24','Platform','Nintendo DS','The character with no arms and no legs makes his debut on the Nintendo DS. Rayman must defeat the pirates who have enslaved his world. As Rayman, you\'ll travel through magical worlds where you can explore waterfalls, sea caves, and pirate hideouts. Master Rayman\'s special moves to progress through each challenging level. The DS\'s bottom screen let you monitor your progress, track your lums, and keep an eye on Rayman\'s health.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48ul.jpg'),(18023,'Magicus','2019-09-08','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG)','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Increase your damage by matching 3 in a row.\nAt first, the battles are simple.\nGradually, depending on the color, matching will activate various effects for a more exhilarating time.\nIn addition, you can save colors to perform magical attacks, or change a disadvantageous situation by shuffling.\nThese puzzles are speed battles with no waiting time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8w3z.jpg'),(18024,'Monster Prom 3: Monster Roadtrip - Hitchhiker Pack: Vicky & Brian','2023-03-14','Adventure, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You\'ve probably known them for a long time, but only as avatars for players to control.\nAnd yet... they\'re their own people too. They\'re fully fleshed-out characters with their own fears and dreams.\nHaven\'t you ever wondered what they think and feel when they\'re not just playable characters?\n\nThis DLC turns the tables and brings these two beloved characters on as hitchhikers you can pick up during your road trip.\nThanks to their conversations, road events, endings, and deep conversations, you might get to REALLY know them in whole new depths.\nAlso... this DLC includes a brand new song. Warning: you may love it.\n\nYou\'ve played as them, you\'ve related to them, you\'ve even become them... but are you ready to date them?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69o0.jpg'),(18025,'Far Cry 4: Complete Edition','2015-12-01','Shooter, Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Includes the critically acclaimed FAR CRY 4 and all additional content released.\n\nVALLEY OF THE YETIS - Enjoy a whole new campaign and explore a new region of Kyrat, playable in both single-player and co-op.\n\nESCAPE FROM DURGESH - Test your skills alone or with a friend in this challenging new game mode.\n\nHURK DELUXE PACK - Rescue Hurk in his own story, with 5 weapons and 2 missions.\nTHE SYRINGE (Exclusive single-player mission) and OVERRUN (a new mode and add 4 additional PvP maps).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nq2.jpg'),(18026,'Psychiatric Prison Romance: Serial Killer Anime Girls Dating Sim','2025-04-03','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','Nintendo Switch','12 girls, 30 days, one prison… and every decision could be your last.\nDeep within an isolated prison, twelve girls await you. They are beautiful, intense… and dangerously unpredictable. Each one has a hidden story, an obsession, a secret that might make you crave their love… or fear for your life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mn5.jpg'),(18027,'Crazy Gravity','2021-10-20','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Crazy Gravity is a challenging Platform / Puzzle game about a little Astronaut lost in space, where your main objective is to energize your rocket and go home. Good luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45hr.jpg'),(18028,'Horrid Henry\'s Big Box of Pranks','2015-07-02','Sin género','iOS','TIME TO GET HORRID AND PLAY SOME PRANKS! \n \nBig Box of Pranks is a fast and funny, action-packed collection of mini-games based on Horrid Henry’s love of pranks and mischief. \n \nFeaturing your favorite characters and all of Henry’s nemeses from the BAFTA nominated TV series; play through a wide range of fast moving mini-games. The difficulty level increases as you progress through all the pranks, becoming more and more frantic until you lose all your lives!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/usjlq7gaytitonw4lmok.jpg'),(18029,'Pokémon Sun and Moon Special Demo Version','2023-03-27','Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo 3DS, New Nintendo 3DS','A special demo released before the official launch of Pokémon Sun and Moon.\nIt was settled in Hau\'oli city and was the only way to obtain some special items and Pokémon, such as a Greninja capable of changing into Ash Greninja.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90cw.jpg'),(18030,'Pinky and the Brain: The Master Plan','2002-02-01','Platform','Game Boy Advance','Pinky and The Brain have a new plan to seize world supremacy. After a TV report on a new meteorological station in space, Brain comes up with a plan to modify the station in order to control the weather and thus bring the powerful of this world to their knees. As usual, the plan is put down on paper and Brain soon notices that it is impossible to execute this plan in one evening. After all, this is... the Masterplan. Unfortunately, the plan is stolen overnight by two lab rats. Help Pinky and The Brain recover the plan, leading them through 20 levels in 5 different worlds collecting the pieces of the plan that Roofus and Doofus, the two lab rats, lose on their way. Follow them through the laboratory in a submarine, a jeep and even into space.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d6n.jpg'),(18031,'Hentai Rika','2025-02-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','HENTAI RIKA is not just a game but an exciting way to immerse yourself in a world of allure and elegance that surrounds this charming pop idol.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oo3.jpg'),(18032,'Hyperdimension Neptunia U: Action Unleashed','2014-08-28','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','Hyperdimension Neptunia U: Action Unleashed is a hack and slash video game and a spin-off title in the Hyperdimension Neptunia game series. The player can choose two characters to play with and switch between them during combat. The characters can transform and if they take too much damage, their clothing gets damaged.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r38.jpg'),(18033,'Slime-san','2017-04-07','Platform, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','\"Slime-san was minding his own business, sliming around in a peaceful forest when suddenly…A giant worm appeared and gobbled him up!  Now deep within the worm’s belly, Slime-san has to face a decision: Be digested by the incoming wall of stomach acid... Or jump, slide and slime his way through the worms intestines and back out its mouth!\"\n\nThe standalone expansion content was added to the base game through free updates.\n\nThe Xbox and PlayStation 4 release is under the version title Slime-san: Superslime Edition. The Nintendo Switch release will be updated to the new version as well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3xrn.jpg'),(18034,'Table Tennis Touch','2015-03-11','Simulator, Sport, Arcade','Android, iOS','Table Tennis for iOS and Android with Career mode and cross-platform Multiplayer. \n \nServe, spin and smash your way to ping pong glory! Stunning graphics, intuitive swipe controls, high speed gameplay and multiple game modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nnhw8gv6keseb0rmmtyu.jpg'),(18035,'Create your own monster','2022-10-28','Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','\'Create your own monster\' is a game where you can create, color, interact and play with spooky and funny creatures designed within your imagination.\n\nThe game is available on iOS and Android, with different languages, including English, Spanish, French, German and Italian.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uto.jpg'),(18036,'Deadside: Dragonfly Skin Set','2025-02-25','Shooter','Xbox One','A set of skins for those who want to explore the dangerous world with style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m3a.jpg'),(18037,'Hyper Skate',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nkbv1stnbi7ctwxa9rhu.jpg'),(18038,'Hentai Puzzle: Naughty Nurses','2025-02-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hentai Puzzle: Naughty Nurses is a hospital-themed puzzle game! Solve 50 different puzzles featuring attractive nurses and enjoy more passion at each level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9oo0.jpg'),(18039,'Gran Carismo','2024-05-30','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','\"Gran Carismo\" immerses players in an intense and competitive racing environment, combining the excitement of illegal underground races with a compelling narrative. Get ready to navigate challenging tracks, outmaneuver rivals, and claim the grand prize – the Rosso 50','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dph.jpg'),(18040,'Company of Heroes: Eastern Front','2010-01-21','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Eastern Front is a free mod for Company of Heroes. Following the ethos of mimicking a Relic Entertainment expansion pack, Eastern Front has succeeded in adding a full Soviet faction packed with unique and exciting units to the existing army as well as the rugged Ostheer - a unique new Axis faction which was designed from the ground up to counter the Soviets - a feat never before achieved in the Company of Heroes world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5d2k.jpg'),(18041,'DCF Universe Triple Trouble Bundle','2025-03-28','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','One bundle, three explosive games! Enter the DCF Universe, where chaos, mayhem, and madness collide. Action, attitude, and non-stop trouble. Are you ready?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m3e.jpg'),(18042,'Aoi Blink','1990-05-27','Platform','TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','Based on a TV anime series (from the grandfather of manga Osamu Tezuka), Blue Blink is a cute platformer that manages to find its place among the crowd. The game is divided up into different areas, each represented by a map screen. Within these areas, you can choose your route to the end (by exiting levels at certain points). Throughout each area you have to find a \'master key\' allowing you access to the boss - this can be hard to locate at times and requires lots of shooting at blank areas of screen just in case.\n\nControl of your character is original - on each stage you have three characters which you can choose between, with the CPU controlled ones following behind you like some bizarre congo line. The characters are preset and vary from stage to stage, and each one has different attributes. For example, some have very high jumping ability, whereas others are poor at jumping but have spread-shot weapons. Once you have found the master key and reached the final level in the area, you are entered into a boss battle, where you sit astride the titular donkey and attempt to fight your way to the next area.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xcl.jpg'),(18043,'Cult of the Lamb: Unholy Alliance','2024-08-12','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Summoned by blood and born in corruption, a wicked new ally can join the holy Lamb in LOCAL CO-OP! Crusade through dungeons, slay heretics, build your cult, and seek new powers together... But that\'s not all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8biw.jpg'),(18044,'Jungle Z','2019-04-08','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','[Game Introduction][ Jungle Z ] On a ordinary weekend afternoon, people were enjoying a leisurely holiday. Suddenly, zombies came out from nowhere and attacking. Everyone is screaming and running, nobody knows what\'s going on until dead.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44cx.jpg'),(18045,'Survive Into Night',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Stay alive by any means as you face hunger, thirst, limited supplies, and consistent threats from both the living and undead. Sneak and Hide quietly to avoid the undead, or blast your way through the hordes with guns out, making every bullet count. Help other survivors to earn resources for crafting, or let the weak fend for themselves - You\'ll face the consequences of your choices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3e2t.jpg'),(18046,'Dance Dance Girl','2019-07-01','Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This game has beautiful graphics and girls,they can dance for you! Come and play together!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dug.jpg'),(18047,'The King of Fighters 2000/2001','2004-01-09','Fighting','PlayStation 2','A double-pack of the two hardcore fighting games from SNK, King Of Fighters 00/01 features all of the tight gameplay and characters (35+ in KoF 2000, over 40 in KoF 2001) of the arcade hits. New features to the home versions include redesigned character select and menu screens, a new continue system that allows players to handicap the CPU fighters as they progress through the game, an auto-save feature, intro movies from these and other previous King of Fighters games, and special new Strikers not seen in the original games or any other versions of these titles. Game modes including Team Play, Party Mode, and even 4-on-4 bouts (KoF 2001 only for 4-on-4) provide hours of gameplay in these classic 2D fighting games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rys.jpg'),(18048,'Conduct AR!','2017-09-19','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Conduct AR! is an epic augmented reality game of explosive railway action. Set in the old west you journey through diorama worlds that unfold right in front of you. Commanding trains, switching tracks and avoiding collisions, playing out in reality on the table in front of you. Look over and around landscapes, solve spatial puzzles and keep the situation under control to become the ultimate conductor in the Wild West.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8voc.jpg'),(18049,'Dissidia Final Fantasy NT: Free Edition','2019-03-12','Fighting','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dissidia Final Fantasy NT: Free Edition is packed with iconic stages and music from the entire Final Fantasy series, a cast of over 25 beloved characters with unique fighting styles and abilities, legendary summons that wreak destruction on the arena and much more.\n\nAvailable for play in both online and offline gameplay modes, players of both Dissidia Final Fantasy NT: Free Edition and the full Dissidia Final Fantasy NT game can challenge each other in exhilarating fights with a weekly rotation of four unique characters from the huge roster available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jpy.jpg'),(18050,'Suikawa Lead','2025-04-18','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The controller is your voice! An action RPG that can only be controlled with a microphone! Now, use your words to control the \"Splitter\" and split the watermelon to become the legendary \"Guide\"! SUIKAWA LEAD is a game that utilizes a voice recognition system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8som.jpg'),(18051,'Super Metroid: Lost World','2015-12-20','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','\"Super Metroid: Lost World\" has a new planet, new enemies, huge areas… A must know wall jump and a mid-air morph. It\'s a game for all players with a mid level difficulty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52og.jpg'),(18052,'Dead by Daylight: Silent Hill Cosmetic Pack','2020-06-16','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Silent Hill Cosmetic Pack includes the very rare Alissa Gillespie outfit for Cheryl Mason and the Dark Wish outfit for The Executioner.\n\nThis pack is part of the Silent Hill Edition and the cosmetics are also available separately from the in-game store using premium currency.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ked.jpg'),(18053,'Kamaitachi no Yoru','1994-12-25','Adventure','Wii, Super Famicom','Kamaitachi no Yoru is a sound novel developed and published by Chunsoft. The game was first released on November 25, 1994 for the Super Famicom. It was also ported to the Playstation and Gameboy Advance It became available on the Virtual Console in February, 2007 for 800 Wii Points. The story-line was written by Takemaru Abiko and production was directed by Kazuya Asano and Koichi Nakamura.\n\nKamaitachi no Yoru was the second sound novel developed by Chunsoft, and its popularity brought a myriad of other companies to develop similar games. The term \"sound novel\" was originally a registered trademark of Chunsoft, but is now regarded as a whole genre of its own.\n\nThe game revolves around Toru and his girlfriend Mari, who are suddenly drawn into a horrible murder mystery while on vacation at a skiing lodge. The first part of the games develops as a crime-solving adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7euq.jpg'),(18054,'Seascape Paradiso','2024-04-01','Indie, Visual Novel','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Underwater photographer Jay has always had a passion for the ocean. She\'d never tell you that she thinks she\'s seen it all...but she\'d have to admit that she never thought she\'d meet a real-life mermaid on a dive!\n\nBut bubbly and mysterious Echo disappears nearly as soon as Jay meets her. Can the two of them reunite, or will it be a one-time encounter?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8asm.jpg'),(18055,'The Wall','2025-03-04','Shooter, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Defend the city, Fight the dead. In this fast paced zombie wall defence game set in a neon cyberpunk world, you must man the wall, upgrade defences and build robots and turrets. Face relentless waves of undead as you hold out as long as you can. Its not about if the wall falls its about when.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gh3.jpg'),(18056,'Futuridium EP','2013-06-20','Shooter, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','An old school shoot\'em up with a modern twist. Futuridium EP offers fast paced, non stop, hard as hell action, with an original 45 minutes soundtrack and colourful, glitchy graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23sd.jpg'),(18057,'xRC Simulator','2018-08-24','Simulator','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Strategize, Train, Compete!\nxRC Simulator is a PC game that simulates the robotics games from FIRST Tech Challenge, FIRST Robotics Competition, and VEX Robotics Competition.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hck.jpg'),(18058,'Wild West Saloon','2024-03-04','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Howdy partner! In Wild West Saloon you manage and maintain your own saloon. Serve drinks, cook food, clean tables and most importantly keep your customers happy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gor.jpg'),(18059,'Sexy Memory Puzzle: Futanari Jail',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18060,'Rusted','2025-04-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rusted is a Linear horror game. You wake up after coma, but something isn\'t right. Everything is worn down and there\'s rust everywhere. How long have you been out for? Figure out what happen and find your way out. But be careful, you\'re not alone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p3h.jpg'),(18061,'Romance of the Three Kingdoms V','2005-04-01','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Sega Saturn, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ytj.jpg'),(18062,'Apidya II',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18063,'The Elder Scrolls Online: Necrom','2023-06-05','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Traverse the Telvanni Peninsula in Morrowind and preserve secrets ascribed to the unfathomable realms of Apocrypha. Unlock the runic power of a brand-new class - the Arcanist - and fight to uphold reality itself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co621a.jpg'),(18064,'BlazBlue: Calamity Trigger Portable','2010-02-25','Fighting','PlayStation Portable','In the 13th hierarchical city, Kagutsuchi, the Librarium regulates the amazing power of \"Armagus\", a fusion of magic and technology. Currently they are aft er a wanted criminal named Ragna The Bloodedge, also known as \"Death\", who wants to destroy the Librarium. Due to Ragna possessing a powerful form of Armagus known as the Azure Grimoire, people far and wide are aft er not only his bounty, but his grimoire as well. This is where our story begins...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co735n.jpg'),(18065,'Rolling Fur: A Cat Puzzle Adventure',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','This is the story of a cube-shaped cat, rolling around, face planting and solving puzzles. Help the cat find the way back home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6db8.jpg'),(18066,'The Snowfield','2011-10-05','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Snowfield is an experimental project in emergent narrative set during World War I. It was made by a team of 10 student interns from Singapore and the U.S. in 2011 as part of the eight-week GAMBIT summer development program at MIT.\n\nThe Snowfield represents an attempt to make a simulation-based narrative game according to a special method for developing such games, a method designed to avoid the need for complex A.I. or massive content generation. The idea was not to relying on codified narrative theories or formulas - like three-act structures, etc. - but rather assume \"what makes a good story\" cannot be systematized and instead must be arrived at organically via extensive user testing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uir.jpg'),(18067,'Sexy Memory Puzzle: Futanari Gloryhole',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18068,'Yet Another Zombie Defense','2010-12-28','Shooter, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Windows Phone, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox 360','Yet Another Zombie Defense is an unusual mix of dual-stick zombie shooter and tower defense genres. The player is free to choose from nine unique weapons and mount them onto auto turrets or set up defensive barricades to stay alive as long as he can. There are also power-ups to collect, different zombie types to shoot at and cooperative mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jri.jpg'),(18069,'Wolfenstein: Youngblood - Deluxe Edition','2019-07-26','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Wolfenstein: Youngblood is a brand-new co-op adventure from award-winning studio MachineGames, developers of the critically-acclaimed Wolfenstein II: The New Colossus, in partnership with Arkane Studios Lyon.\n\nThe Deluxe Edition includes the Buddy Pass, allowing you and a friend to play the entire game together, even if they don\'t own the game themselves. This edition also features the Cyborg Skin Pack, which includes: - Cyborg player skin - Titanium alloy skins for all weapons - Titanium alloy hatchet - Titanium alloy knife - Armor-boosting pep signal','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ybp.jpg'),(18070,'Frontier Legends',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Frontier Legends, the ultimate Wild West adventure where survival, crafting, and exploration come together in an expansive open world. Step into the boots of a brave settler who has just arrived by train, ready to stake your claim on the new frontier filled with untold mysteries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pl1.jpg'),(18071,'Battle Supremacy: Ground Assault','2019-09-05','Shooter, Simulator','Nintendo Switch','Battle Supremacy: Ground Assault features huge content - never ending lines of modern combat vehicles, huge environments with realistic weather, online multiplayer and countless single player missions and drills.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co572h.jpg'),(18072,'Little Alchemy 2','2017-08-01','Puzzle','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Little Alchemy, the crafting game enjoyed by millions of players, is back with more items, fresh, new art style and charming music!\n\nMix items and create the world from scratch! Discover exciting items accompanied by funny descriptions and lose yourself exploring the huge, new library!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rus.jpg'),(18073,'Redactionary',NULL,'Card & Board Game','Web browser','Redactionary is a free, web-based, competitive party word game of redacting top secret messages into oblivion!\n\nEach turn, one player is the Encoder, who will have pre-written a description of a secret word, to help the Decoder guess what the word is.\n\nEveryone else is a Saboteur, who each submits a list of words they predict the Encoder used in their description. All words correctly predicted score points, and will be redacted from the description when it\'s revealed, making it harder for the Decoder to guess the word.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k9n.jpg'),(18074,'Raycatcher','2009-03-05','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Raycatcher is an innovative new game that syncs gameplay to your favorite mp3s. Load in your entire music library and watch as the game morphs itself to match. The gameplay itself is easy to pick up, yet compelling. Rotate a cluster of colorful shapes to catch matching rays of light cast onto your screen. As you match light to shape, your cluster will expand and evolve. \n \nRaycatcher also comes with a selection of great music from the brilliant new artist Noobie Noobinson. \n \nLoad in your own music: Raycatcher will accept .mp3 and .wav formats. \n \nBeat detection technology: Changes gameplay to match your music in pleasant and creative ways.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ek7.jpg'),(18075,'The Fortress of Dr. Radiaki','1994-12-10','Shooter','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','The Fortress of Dr. Radiaki is a thrilling first-person shooter adventure mixing carnage with a cutting edge sense of humor. You will confront scores of different adversaries, including sword wielding samurai, stealthy ninja warriors, robots with toasters for heads, mutated alligators and more. You must use all your wits to find your way through the cavernous fortress and defeat the Machiavellian designs of the horribly twisted Dr. Radiaki!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d62.jpg'),(18076,'Sick Samurai','2025-10-01','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sick Samurai is a blindingly fast and bloody action game based on instant-death combat. Immerse yourself in lofi hip hop and retro anime aesthetics as you slash and dash your way to becoming the greatest fighter on the island.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ukm.jpg'),(18077,'Short Snow','2025-04-18','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SHORT SNOW! Realistic open-world survival experience, you find yourself lost in a vast, snow-covered forest after a harrowing plane crash. With temperatures plummeting and hunger gnawing at you, will you succumb to the forces of nature, or will you conquer the frozen wilderness? The choice is yours!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y34.jpg'),(18078,'Party of Sin','2012-12-13','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Wii U','Ever had that itching desire to break out of hell and into the highest reaches of heaven? In Party of Sin, you take control of the Seven Deadly Sins in a coopetitive puzzle-platformer for 1-4 players.\n\nMaster a large, dynamic team of anti-heroes -- the Seven Deadly Sins -- as you forge your destiny on a quest to troll humanity. Envy, Greed, Sloth, Pride, Wrath, Lust, Gluttony are all multi-dimensional with special powers useful in many situations.\n\nSwap characters on the fly as you change tactics based on the situation: ALL the Sins are useful in combat, ALL the Sins aid in puzzle solving, and ALL the Sins have coop interactions, both Good and Evil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92rf.jpg'),(18079,'Lost: Via Domus','2008-02-28','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','In Via Domus, players control Elliott Maslow, another survivor of the Oceanic flight 815 plane crash. The game takes place during the first 70 days after the crash and includes all of the main characters from the show.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8g0i.jpg'),(18080,'Assault Armored Girls War Vasileia','2025-05-01','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a 3D action game in which you take weapons from your enemies to strengthen yourself. The game offers a variety of combat styles, including shooting, fighting, guarding, and invincibility, depending on the situation. In addition, the use of aerial dash enables three-dimensional combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rbc.jpg'),(18081,'Warchief','2021-01-01','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie, MOBA','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Warchief combines the best of MOBA and strategy games with unmatched simplicity. Choose your hero, recruit and customize your armies, explore the jungle, and seize strategic objectives to become the ultimate Warchief. Ready to dominate the battlefield?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8v9m.jpg'),(18082,'Shin Megami Tensei III: Nocturne - HD Remaster Digital Deluxe Edition','2021-05-20','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The Shin Megami Tensei III Nocturne HD Remaster Digital Deluxe Edition includes:\n• Maniax Pack\n• Mercy and Expectation Map Pack\n• Shin Megami Tensei BGM Pack\n• Merciful Difficulty','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ews.jpg'),(18083,'Old Timer Transport','2025-04-21','Racing, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hop on your turbocharged mobility scooter as a grumpy old driver! Race through Bompidorm with friends, commit vehicular manslaughter, and deliver your victims to the hospital to dodge lawsuits!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ff0.jpg'),(18084,'Parvaneh: Legacy of the Light\'s Guardians','2016-08-26','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fadia, a young and courageous boy sets about protecting ‘Naria’, his home village, from the Khazdaks who are trying to pollute their river.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21fe.jpg'),(18085,'3-D Ultra Pinball: Thrillride','1999-02-01','Pinball','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Imagine a pinball machine emulating a full amusement park, and not just any park, but Hersheypark in Hershey, Pennsylvania, \"The sweetest place on Earth!\"!\nOver 15 action-packed \"rides\", plenty of special events include \"lights out\" fireworks show, double multi-ball event, side tables, multiple flipper sets, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6w3e.jpg'),(18086,'Baking Bustle: Ashley\'s Dream - Collector\'s Edition','2021-10-04','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nkk.jpg'),(18087,'Project Rodeo',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Project Rodeo is a proof of concept for a 3D platforming adventure game starring Rodeo, a bat living in an old western/steampunk fantasy-styled world who sets out on a grand adventure throughout the known islands. Inspirations for the game include the Mega Man Legends series, Grandia, Tail Concerto and The Legend of Zelda series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8svh.jpg'),(18088,'Find Love or Die Trying','2024-11-22','Adventure, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Find Love or Die Trying, a dating show where ending up single means ending up dead! Will you find love? Or only score a date with death?\n\nNot sure why you\'d sign up for this, but now that you\'re here, you\'ve got 7 days to get\none of the lovely ladies on your tropical island getaway to fall in love with you. If she\'s\nwilling to put a ring on it, you\'re both free to leave.\n\nThis version includes both the base game as well as the fan pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94in.jpg'),(18089,'Agenda','2016-09-21','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Agenda is a strategy simulation game in which you control a world-wide independent agency with a set goal of world domination. Try to claim your global influence through the power of your allies and covert operations such as assassinations, bribery or fraud.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l6z.jpg'),(18090,'Shadows of the Werewolf','2025-12-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shadows of the Werewolf is a cinematic, third-person action-adventure game that places players in a suspenseful, horror-filled world. The story unfolds across various locations, including a suburban home and a mysterious forest retreat, where an innocent couple faces a relentless werewolf and other monstrous creatures. Players will engage in tense exploration, object interaction, and combat, using stealth and strategy to hide, fight, and escape from supernatural threats. The game blends elements of classic horror films and survival horror games, offering a narrative-driven, single-player experience filled with fear, suspense, and the challenge of survival under the full moon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qva.jpg'),(18091,'Samurai Slaughter House','2023-03-31','Simulator, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','VR-only physics-based combat game. Use stealth and creativity or brute force or take on your foes in a vast physics based sandbox. Battle both humans and demons while exploring a large metroidvania-style open world. Collect items and power up your character. Explore towns and interact with NPCs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39q9.jpg'),(18092,'Sexy Memory Puzzle: Futanari Doctor',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18093,'Lost in Blue','2022-04-07','Adventure','Android, iOS','After surviving a plane crash, you must collect resources to craft weapons and tools, build facilities and houses to withstand the elements of this strange island. Battle through various natural environments like fiery volcanoes, freezing glaciers, etc. and difficult obstacles such as mutant zombies, militias, wild creatures, etc. Do everything you can to get yourself home.After surviving a plane crash, you must collect resources to craft weapons and tools, build facilities and houses to withstand the elements of this strange island. Battle through various natural environments like fiery volcanoes, freezing glaciers, etc. and difficult obstacles such as mutant zombies, militias, wild creatures, etc. Do everything you can to get yourself home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8v45.jpg'),(18094,'Dragon Warrior','1986-11-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Family Computer, MSX2, Nintendo Entertainment System, MSX','Though not the first role-playing game developed by a Japanese company, Dragon Warrior is considered one of the progenitors of the Japanese RPG genre, and the first to appear on a home console. The player navigates a lone pre-made protagonist on a top-down overworld, accessing locations represented by icons, similarly to early Ultima games. As opposed to most other RPGs of the time, dungeons are viewed from an overhead perspective as well. In cities and palaces it is possible to talk to people, rest in inns and buy weapons, armor and items in shops.\n\nWhen wandering around in the wilderness or through dungeons, the player character encounters randomly appearing enemies. Combat is turn-based, with the player selecting menu options while fighting. It is possible to attack with the equipped weapon, cast one of the few available spells (using up some of the magic energy), use an item, or try to run. All the battles in the game are exclusively one-on-one. Killing monsters yields experience, and the player character\'s attributes improve automatically when he levels up.\n\nWith the exception of the final location, the entire game world is theoretically open for exploration from the beginning. However, the enemies become increasingly tough as the player character attempts to move away from the starting town, effectively limiting him to confined areas determined by his level. The hero has limited hit points, loses them when attacked by enemies, and dies when he runs out of them, at which point he is automatically restored in a nearby town. It is possible to save the game only by talking to the king in the initial castle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55p3.jpg'),(18095,'Cricket Captain 2015','2015-07-31','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Cricket Captain has long been hailed as the best cricket simulation game ever created and the upcoming launch of Cricket Captain 2015 will take the experience to an all-new level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yuebcrqzewhkjbkihogz.jpg'),(18096,'Agapito\'s Crazy Adventure','1998-03-31','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inside a box with cereal, Agapito finds a voucher for a trip for two to an island in the Pacific Ocean, somewhere between Madagascar and the Antilles. He invites his friend Susan to accompany him, but he loses her on the airport, probably to a \"tall blond fellow.\" He ends up in a cargo plane next to a nose picking gorilla. On the island he will stay in the Paradise Hotel as its only quest. Exploring of the island is done by foot, until he manages to repair an impressive sports car (a Deux Chevaux). From then on the player is able to explore the island and its beaches by using a map.\n\nAgapito\'s Crazy Adventure is a 3rd person, inventory based humorous adventure. There\'s no real quest, but only a series of situations that have to be solved. Only in the final stage of the game Agapito meets a new girlfriend and some tasks have to be completed before he can have diner with her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fwb.jpg'),(18097,'Robbie and the Robots','1991-09-01','Shooter','Nintendo Entertainment System','Robbie Robot is the fifty first game of the NES version of Action 52.\n\nYou play as Robbie as you are shooting other robots with guns or finger missiles and try not to have the enemies shoot you, because if they do, you die.\n\nAt the first level, the player can just constantly go straight ahead, constantly shooting. But at the next levels, gaps appear, so the passage becomes much more difficult.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95lr.jpg'),(18098,'WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2007','2006-12-15','Fighting, Sport','PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','A brand new Analog Control System makes fighting more realistic than ever with intuitive movement and new elements of control. An enhanced Season Mode provides multiple branching storylines and unprecedented levels of player choice. In and out of the ring, dozens of user-controlled environmental hotspots let players take advantage of anything at their disposal to inflict damage on opponents in new and unique ways. Additionally, new high impact combination moves let players take the power of WWE Superstars into their own hands. Experience the intensity of WWE fans in a brand new, fully loaded interactive fighting area. Players can take advantage of multiple weapons, environmental damage and grabbing signs and weapons from the crowd. WWE SmackDown vs. RAW 2007 offers multiple enhancements, including incredible high definition graphics, updated rosters for both RAW and SmackDown, an expanded General Manager Mode, online multiplayer game play with voice chat support and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kc7.jpg'),(18099,'Summon Night 6: Lost Borders','2017-10-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','The game takes place in the world of Fillujah, a world where all people have their own flying companion creature. The core three members of the cast (Raj, Amu, and Ist) are the primary protagonists, while the game plot involves them meeting up with characters from across the entire Summon Night series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1v02.jpg'),(18100,'Decarnation','2023-05-31','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Decarnation is a story rich adventure horror game. Solve cryptic puzzles, fight disturbing enemies, explore a phantasmagorical world of dreams and nightmares, and face the most terrifying monsters from the darkest parts of your soul.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v59.jpg'),(18101,'Four','2017-05-24','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Four is simple multiplayer game which is easy to learn but hard to master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/y9ozjff7kior7p2jgiqi.jpg'),(18102,'Cleaver: Sideshow Circus','2022-10-12','Platform, Puzzle, Arcade','Web browser','Cleaver: Sideshow Circus is a retro style 8-bit video game. Play as Cleaver: The Killer Clown as he sets out on a quest to collect balloons, meat and save his daughter Lil Miss Cleaver forte clutches of the Circus Du Sinister and its leader the Ring Master. With the help of exploding pumpkins and human hearts the Cleaver should make short work of the bad guys in the classic style Single Screen Platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5kb4.jpg'),(18103,'Just Keep Running',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Just Keep Running is a parkour puzzle-platformer that combines freerunning with quick puzzles and problem-solving. Gameplay is said to be inspired by Mirror\'s Edge, Portal and Ultrakill, with voxel graphics inspired by Teardown, The Touryst, and Cloudpunk.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6g4z.jpg'),(18104,'Mad Mix 2: El Castillo de los Fantasmas','1990-12-31','Arcade','ZX Spectrum, DOS, Amstrad CPC, MSX','Second Part of Mad Mix Game 2, a pac man style game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gdv.jpg'),(18105,'RetroBlazer',NULL,'Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take on the mantle of the Pyramid Guard, go up against the cybernetic Ark Legion, and rid the kingdom of a spectral blight. Combining the charm of Saturday Morning Cartoons and the bombastic action of late 90s shooters, RetroBlazer recaptures a golden era of frantic, fast-paced, first-person action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91l4.jpg'),(18106,'RTS Car Parking','2019-01-12','Simulator','Android, iOS','RTS Car Parking is a game for you who like challenges. The game has several obstacles for you to get around, divert from everyone, and be an expert in parking and driving.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7myw.jpg'),(18107,'Radio Squid','2020-06-19','Shooter, Music, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A young squid has been cursed! Now it\'s up to you to lift the curse by reaching the depths of the sea with plenty of coins at the end! Explore deep sea floors while taking care of your enemies by utilizing the power of the siren song!\nShoot your enemies with projectiles to the beat of the music, watch out not to get hit by your own shot! For extra challenge, try to bounce off your shots to the wall in order to hit enemies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b23.jpg'),(18108,'Deadside: Bushranger Skin Set','2025-02-25','Shooter','Xbox One','A set of skins for those who want to explore the dangerous world with style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m3c.jpg'),(18109,'Classic Games Collection Vol. 1','2019-07-26','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Welcome to the \"Classic Games Collection Vol.1\"! We have chosen the five most beloved logical games and bundled them together! You can play them either against the AI or against a friend (on the same console). Fill your coffee breaks with some brain stimulation! In this bundle you will find: TIC-TAC-TOE (also known as Noughts and Crosses, or Xs and Os) Two players alternate placing Xs and Os onto the grid. The first player to create a straight line of three of his or her symbols... wins! CHECKERS (also known as Draughts) Players move their pieces diagonally from one square to another square. When a player jumps over their opponent\'s piece, you take that piece from the board. The first player to lose all of his or her pieces loses the game. MEMORY GAME The objective of the game is to clear a rectangular board covered with cards faced down with minimum number of moves. Each separate move is to turn over any two cards. If they match you take them from board, if not you turn them back over. MINES The objective of the game is to clear a rectangular board containing hidden \"mines\" without detonating any of them. Numbers on revealed squares show how many mines are adjacent to that square. GOMOKU Two players alternate placing white and black tokens onto the grid. The first player to create a straight line of five of his or her stones... wins!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57ae.jpg'),(18110,'Love Spell: Written in the Stars','2020-07-24','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A romantic comedy visual novel/otome game about spells, adventures, penguins and the greatest magic of all: true love! \"Love Spell\" is the debut project of Great Gretuski Studios LLC, a female-founded, female-run indie game development studio focused on bringing romantic & creative stories to life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2c17.jpg'),(18111,'Pop-Up Pilgrims','2018-02-13','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy','PlayStation 4','Floating Cloud God and his devoted pilgrims have a big adventure ahead! Put on your PlaystationVR headset and discover a world of pop-up islands, colorful characters, and deadly demons, all uniquely presented as 2D graphics in a wrap-around 3D space. More than 50 stages curve around the player as they try to lead the pilgrims from platform to platform – left, right, in or out – to take on a cast of lively enemies and find a safe route to the exit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xxbmdbf5geqp06mheesl.jpg'),(18112,'Record_DrowsyVortex','2024-09-19','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','RECORD_DrowsyVortex is a post-apocalyptic exploration-focused RPG set in the future era of Space Immigration. It is one piece of recorded data transmitted from Planet Drowsy Vortex centuries later, offering an immersive experience of a local post-disaster survivor\'s weird and memorable story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qw4.jpg'),(18113,'To the Wolves','2018-11-18','Sin género','Web browser','Offered up as sacrifice to the wolf-gods of the forest, hunted by beasts and man alike, Ella must find a way to survive. An interactive fiction/survival horror game by Els White.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/g6f7rd8nk3adw7agu4k0.jpg'),(18114,'Halo: New Covenant','2023-11-27','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A campaign mod for Halo 3 ODST, Halo: New Covenant takes you on a journey after the events of Halo 3 in a new direction. The campaign includes custom missions designed from scratch, Custom cinematics, Custom voice acting and up to 4 player coop support.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hxb.jpg'),(18115,'Tokimeki Memorial Girl\'s Side 2nd Kiss Typing',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18116,'Geppetto 2','2024-09-04','Sin género','Web browser, Android, iOS','Imagine transforming a classroom into a virtual world full of adventures and discoveries. With Geppetto 2, your students can now immerse themselves in an entirely new experience, full of features that combine fun and learning in an innovative way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g5v.jpg'),(18117,'Storm Wars CCG','2016-12-04','Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Storm Wars is a collectible card strategy game which focuses on lightning-fast battles with deep deck-building strategy. Battles are fully automated, and resolve as quickly as you wish to view them – for fans of Magic the Gathering or Hearthstone, it\'s a whole new kind of \'rush\'!\n\n•Lightning-Fast Battles•\nEpic battles in under a minute! Build your custom army, choose an opponent, and watch the chaos as the battle unfolds.\n\n•Deep Deck-building Strategy•\nWith over 150 unique cards to choose from (each with their own stats and special abilities), 12 powerful heroes, and no deck building limits, the strategic possibilities are endless!\n\n•Immersive Campaign•\nExplore a detailed fantasy universe complete with 6 distinct races and an extended single-player campaign.\n\n•Intense PVP•\nFace off in ranked matches against opponents around the world in the Arena, participate in daily tournaments in the Gauntlet, or engage in direct challenges with others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/kmra2gmqt0tlv9n5l4ra.jpg'),(18118,'Cabela\'s North American Adventures','2010-09-14','Shooter, Simulator, Sport, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Wii, PlayStation Portable, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','Cabela\'s North American Adventures introduces fresh touches that hunters will appreciate, including a custom gun builder that allows players the ability to create thousands of gun options with a variety of receivers, stocks, barrels, and scopes. The game also capitalizes on the popularity of hunting shows and online videos by adding a cameraman into gameplay - to get compelling footage, hunters need to be at their best! Also, for the first time in franchise history, up to four friends can hunt together online at once (Xbox 360 and PlayStation 3). Once the hunt is done, friends can share their scores through online leader boards for bragging rights.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5umc.jpg'),(18119,'BVS Solitaire Collection','2018-07-01','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Enjoy classic and original solitaires with this popular set of 510 games. BVS Solitaire Collection includes all classic solitaire games like Monte Carlo, Seahaven Towers, Klondike, Scorpion, Spider Solitaire, Golf, Russian Solitare, Freecell,Cruel etc. BVS Solitaire Collection also features a lot of original solitaire variations. You won\'t find so many original games in other programs. You can even modify rules of any of the included games, thus creating your own solitaire variations. The \"You are stuck\" feature and unlimited \"Undo\" function will allow you to come back and try another approach. If you are great solitaire fun, this unique solitaire collection is your best pass to the world of computer card games! BVS Solitaire Collection gives you the plethora of statistical and scoring screens. Track your performance and progress in playing solitaire, and even publish your personal statistics on the BVS Solitaire Collection web site to appear in the top scores list.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/w37yxoex9pddbyyzdsnd.jpg'),(18120,'Beat Saber: Queen Music Pack','2023-05-25','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Beat Games studio brings fresh beats from Queen to Beat Saber! Dive into the pulsing music of Queen and slash the beats in our brand new Queen Music Pack. See you on the leaderboards!\n\nQueen Music Pack includes the tracks:\n\nAnother One Bites the Dust\nBohemian Rhapsody\nCrazy Little Thing Called Love\nDon’t Stop Me Now\nI Want It All\nKiller Queen\nOne Vision\nSomebody to Love\nStone Cold Crazy\nWe Are The Champions\nWe Will Rock You','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6jbq.jpg'),(18121,'Last Soul','2021-10-19','Shooter, Platform, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"Last Soul\" is a 2d pixel art action platformer with a compelling story about a future where mankind has lost its will. Explore and fight your way through a variety of levels, and take on awesome boss enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pdy.jpg'),(18122,'Puzzel Nite','2020-10-15','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Free to play fast-paced skill based Puzzle Game. Play against other players of the same level in a real-time competitive format. Customize your character and become the master in PUZZELNITE. If you love old school Puyo Puyo, Puzzle Fighter and Tetris attack, this is a game you have to try. Easy to learn and a life time to master. Don’t pay to win, pay to look cool, pay to show off, and pay for more content. \n \nBattle in 2 game modes and more to come with subsequent updates \n- Play against other players in a competitive rank matching system that matches you against players of the same skill level. Try to out play your opponent and reach Masters level. Rank matches resets every season. Play every season to maintain your rank. \n- Play in an offline score attack mode. Out score other people on the leader board or use it as practice to play against the AI in a survival type of game style. \n-Game modes are constantly evolving with many more additions to come \n \nCharacter customization \n- Customize your character to show your own unique gem fighting style. \n- Character customization are continuously evolving with many more outfits, weapons and hair styles to come. \n \nConstantly evolving \n- Look out for new game modes and more character customizing features. \n \nDLC or Micro-transactions \n- Purchase entire updates without overspending on extra content or purchase what you need from the store. Your game your style. \n \nPlease Note! PuzzelNite is free to download and play, however, some items and entire updates can also be purchased for real money. If you don’t want to use this feature, please disable in-app purchases in your device settings. Also under our Privacy Policy you must be at least 9 years of age to play or download PuzzelNite. \n \nFeatures \n- Skill base gameplay \n- Competitive Real-time ranked matches against similar skilled players \n- Offline score attack mode with full leader board \n- In-game fighter customization \n- Rank up to Masters level and show the entire world your true skills \n- Don’t pay to win. Pay to look cool, show off and for more content. \n \nSupport: \nVisit https://puzzelnite.gamuttechenterprise.com/ \n \nPrivacy policy / Terms and Conditions: \nhttps://puzzelnite.gamuttechenterprise.com/PrivacyPolicy \n \nParent’s Guide \nhttps://puzzelnite.gamuttechenterprise.com/ParentsGuide','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2la0.jpg'),(18123,'Edge','2018-11-03','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Your goal is to balance the ball and avoid it from obstacles and from falling down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pry.jpg'),(18124,'Jurassic Park','1994-12-31','Shooter','DOS, Amiga','If it\'s not Jurassic Park, it\'s extinct. Treachery has turned John Hammond\'s dream into a living nightmare.\n\nHis plan, to introduce the children of today to the kings of the prehistoric age, has now metamorphosed into a monster which threatens the world. With the electronic defenses out of action and the computerized control systems sabotaged, his deadly creations are now roaming free throughout Jurassic Park.\n\nDare you face up to the terrifying Tyrannosaurus Rex, the deadly Dilophosaurs and the vicious Velociraptors? Only you, Dr. Grant, have a chance of restoring this island paradise to peace. Are you ready... to play in the park?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ze9.jpg'),(18125,'100 Capitalist Cats','2024-01-21','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Join the cutest adventure in the Wall Street, New York, heart of capitalism! Explore the charming hand-drawn artwork of architecture as you embark on a quest to find 100 adorable cats hidden throughout the game.\nTest your attention and observation skills in this cozy and delightful hidden object game.\nEach cat is more charming than the last, and every discovery brings a smile to your face.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7no4.jpg'),(18126,'Halo 3: The Battlefront Pack','2022-12-10','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Weapons, Vehicles and Maps from the Star Wars: Battlefront series come to Halo in the ultimate big team crossover.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fp9.jpg'),(18127,'Lone Soul','2025-06-30','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lone Soul is a fast-paced hack-and-slash action game with fluid, combo-based combat and roguelite progression. Fight your way through a mythical tower, and discovering game-changing synergies between acquired gear and new spells in a uniquely designed world where fantasy meets space.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qwc.jpg'),(18128,'Sunlight In A Tin','2020-03-11','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A tiny spaceship hurtles through the interstellar void, powered by a roaring nuclear reactor. You are its only engineer.\nThis seems safe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4eok.jpg'),(18129,'1812: The Invasion of Canada','2017-08-04','Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','1812 features fast, intuitive and fun gameplay that involves teamwork and strategic planning in a historic and educational setting. This is THE GAME for people who want an enjoyable and manageable introduction to historic/conflict based games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20rz.jpg'),(18130,'Wicked Plague',NULL,'Shooter, Platform, Indie','Game Boy Color','Play as Ramuel, a young boy who destroys his enemies with his Gun-Lighter. Get inside a haunted building and eradicate the menace!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94hm.jpg'),(18131,'Ship of Heroes','2025-06-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An MMORPG set hundreds of years in the future aboard the mega ship FHS Justice, super powered characters are an accepted part of society and integral to the ship\'s defense while it encounters other craft and alien worlds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77w7.jpg'),(18132,'Megacraft Hentai Battlegrounds','2021-05-14','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Megacraft Hentai Battlegrounds is a mega battle royale set in a hot desert. You have two ways to win this game: The first is to be the coolest and just destroy all the enemies. The second is to carefully explore this huge desert and find ten stunning hentai drawings hidden somewhere here. Everything is in your hands!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ns8.jpg'),(18133,'Puppet War','2010-06-09','Shooter','Android, iOS','Puppets take the studio and pretend to take the world too, the armed janitor is the only hope','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18134,'Bird Week','1986-06-03','Simulator','Family Computer','The player plays as a bird and can either play the normal game or the single level practice game. The player must feed butterflies to the baby birds so that they can grow big and eventually leave the nest. It is suggested that they eventually become the \"new mother birds\" that take care of their offspring in the subsequent levels. Finishing all 999 levels of Bird Week actually results in the beginning of an endless loop instead that ends when the players loses all of his lives.\n\nEach level represents a season in the ecosystem of a bird. The game starts out in early spring. As the virtual year progresses, the season evolves into summer and eventually into autumn. After autumn, the game repeats itself by portraying the following spring. If the proper amount of butterflies are not fed to the babies, then the babies end up starving to death. The player will automatically lose a life if any of the baby birds die. In addition to this, the player also loses a life when a predator catches the player trying to deliver butterflies to whose baby.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/j1sy8bf9y6y6tdzyyx6i.jpg'),(18135,'Curious Expedition 2','2022-03-17','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Curious Expedition 2 is a turn-based narrative roguelike set in a reimagined version of the late 19th century that uses procedural gameplay and story elements to create completely unique and epic adventures every time you play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b6w.jpg'),(18136,'Mastema: Out of Hell','2017-03-03','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You don\'t know who you are, where you are and why you are here, you know just thing, you want to survive and get out of HELL!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24z8.jpg'),(18137,'Super Mario Bros. 2 Squared: Return to Subcon','2018-11-01','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ugr.jpg'),(18138,'Beautiful Light','2026-12-01','Shooter, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beautiful Light is a PvPvP(vE) tactical first-person extraction shooter where 6 squads of 3 operators are tasked with entering, securing, and extracting an artifact in a hostile, horrific environment. Face other operators and player-controlled anomalies, but beware: mistakes can risk your life and gear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73vj.jpg'),(18139,'Omashu Dash','2025-02-04','Platform, Racing, Indie, Arcade','Web browser','Dash down a series of tunnels and aim to complete the level as fast as you can!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cz6.jpg'),(18140,'Sky Lanes','2025-02-26','Racing, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sky Lanes is an homage to the 90s MS-DOS arcade racing game Skyroads.\nYou race on straight courses, evade obstacles and jump onto different lanes.\n\nThe game supports ray-traced reflections and ambient occlusion, but it\'s not a requirement and can be disabled.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ggu.jpg'),(18141,'Wrecked','2018-04-01','Racing, Sport','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Choose your vehicle, install weapons and protections, and launch yourself in the biggest multiplayer challenge ever seen!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qlc.jpg'),(18142,'Field of Glory II: Medieval - Storm of Arrows',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Sin plataforma','Field of Glory II: Storm of Arrows is a turn-based tactical game set in the High Middle Ages and it\'s the third DLC for Field of Glory II: Medieval. Developed by the legendary Richard Bodley Scott it brings the best from the tabletop world into the best digital framework.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c75.jpg'),(18143,'Super Mario Ultimate','2018-01-28','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','This is a full hack of Super Mario Bros 3 from NES. It features 8 new worlds, over 90 new levels, new graphics, new enemies, save game, difficult selection, item slot, etc.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wul.jpg'),(18144,'EarthBound 64 Experience','2022-09-17','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','EarthBound 64 Recreation is a PC fangame created by Team Pollysoft. It aims to recreate the Spaceworld \'99 demo of the unreleased Nintendo 64 version of Mother 3.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65xx.jpg'),(18145,'Super Smash Bros. Melee: Yoshi\'s Story - 2 Clouds',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9drn.jpg'),(18146,'MechaNest',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Explore Scifi third person action-adventure game MechaNest. City on the planet Merador where the citizens are overthrown by Ai and Mecha\'s. But be careful MechaNest is full with traps, mazes and vicious Mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ce0.jpg'),(18147,'Room of Batik','2021-09-25','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Batik themed escape room puzzle game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7duk.jpg'),(18148,'Anstorm','2018-11-16','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Simple and gripping gameplay most commonly as a classical arcade shooter. The game consists of short levels which is perfect for short breaks to relax.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ljt.jpg'),(18149,'Apex Legends: Ignite','2023-10-31','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Rowenna grew up amidst a war, but in a move that turned the tide, one Monarch Titan sacrificed itself to end the fighting. In the years after, her home planet of Nexus established ties across the Outlands, introducing Rowenna to the Apex Games. The Games represented everything she aspired to–heroism, hard work, sacrifice—and she became a dedicated fan.\n\nWhen her elder sister Diwa suffered a terrible injury at work, Rowenna resolved to support her family no matter what. She stole the battery from the Monarch, still rusting on the hill, and had a combat rig built with its battery at the core. She used it to qualify for the Apex Games, and even though the battery exposes her to poisonous radiation, she refuses to give up. No one else was going to get hurt to support her family. Rowenna’s choosing to have hope for her dreams or die trying. Now, it’s Conduit’s chance for a day in the sun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7b7x.jpg'),(18150,'Castle Come',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Castle Come is a walking fortress roguelike. Scout a strange land full of bandits in search of new parts, defeat enemy castles and scavenge the wreckage, recruit crew to man your growing arsenal of weapons and build your way from an agile fortling into a deadly, hulking, monster machine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gfl.jpg'),(18151,'Super Mario Bros. / Duck Hunt','1988-11-01','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Nintendo Entertainment System','A compilation of Duck Hunt and Super Mario Bros. Duck Hunt featured a lightgun shooting game while Super Mario Bros. is a well-known platformer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22q8.jpg'),(18152,'Snow Fortress','2017-12-05','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Snow Fortress is a room-scale Virtual Reality snow fort building & battle game. Relive your childhood by building snow forts as you prepare for epic snowball fights! Unlock tools to protect your fort and deliver a fury of snowballs at your opponents!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/deufpxshyt9slm71rk8p.jpg'),(18153,'Queen\'s Garden: French Splendor',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p66.jpg'),(18154,'Heavenstrafer',NULL,'Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Heavenstrafer is a fast paced movement shooter with a gun combo system that rewards aggressiveness and experimentation. Explore the ruins of hell and destroy angels (and demons) across three chapters filled with small but challenging arenas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yl6.jpg'),(18155,'New Arc Line','2024-11-26','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Take a stand in the eternal conflict between Arcane Magic and Steampunk Revolution and tip the uneasy balance between sorcery, elves, dwarves and mysterious monsters on one side and steampunk gadgets, zeppelins, and tesla guns on the other in this single-player, party-based, story-rich RPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i07.jpg'),(18156,'Need for Kill','2003-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Quake 3 but in 2D dimension, Launched in 2001 for Computers by the \"NFK team\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gy9.jpg'),(18157,'Infinite Lagrange','2021-10-08','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Infinite Lagrange puts you at the head of a galactic fleet and lets you travel through uncharted space. You’ll use stargates to hop from area to area, coming across lost cities and alien fleets from friends and foes alike. You’ll start off with three to five ships, but once you construct a spaceport and upgrade your tech, you’ll be able to expand your fleet considerably. You can also design a plethora of different ships for your varying needs, from constructing frigates for cargo to forging battlecruisers to defend yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3jdv.jpg'),(18158,'Musou Orochi Z','2009-03-12','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Musou Orochi Z, is a 2009 hack and slash video game developed by Koei and Omega Force for the Sony PlayStation 3 and Microsoft Windows. Z is the third installment of the Warriors Orochi series, a crossover video game of the Dynasty Warriors and Samurai Warriors series. Musou Orochi Z was intended to be a combination of the first two games with more characters and stages on an updated gaming platform. The game was released in Japan for PlayStation 3 on March 12, 2009 and released on Microsoft Windows platform on November 27, 2009. Koei had planned to release the game as Warriors Orochi Z in North America and Europe, but those plans have since been cancelled.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co215r.jpg'),(18159,'Rebel Inc.','2018-12-05','Simulator, Strategy','Android, iOS','Rebel Inc. is a strategy game that looks at important real world issues.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86yl.jpg'),(18160,'Farming Simulator 22: Case IH Farmall Anniversary Pack','2023-11-10','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Celebrating the 100th Anniversary of Farmall, you get two iconic Farmall tractors by CaseIH, authentically digitized: The classic six-cylinder Case IH Farmall 1066 Hydro and the modern multi-talent Case IH Farmall 120C - both continuing the enduring Farmall legacy in Farming Simulator 22.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dtz.jpg'),(18161,'Doggy Don\'t Care',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unleash adorable chaos as a mischievous pup! Explore, collect, and smash your way around the house & beyond in this cheeky adventure. Fetch the approval of your feathered friend, Rocko the Parrot, by digging into a list of fun-filled tasks. It\'s sure to be a pawsitively unforgettable day!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qf9.jpg'),(18162,'Space Chase: Odyssey','2020-02-06','Sin género','Android','A beautiful Odyssey awaits you. Join the quest beyond the horizon!\n\nBe the captain of the best spaceship, conquer and explore the endless secrets of the universe. Uncover your inner captain.\n\nYou have been chosen to lead the team of top captains set on a mission to explore the universe and it mysteries.\n\nPrepare yourself for an challenging yet thrilling experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gon.jpg'),(18163,'Tropico 3: Steam Special Edition','2009-10-20','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Steam Special Edition of Tropico 3 contains the following additional content:\n- Two additional maps for the sandbox mode: Verde Playa, Coco Chico Map\n- Two additional costumes for the el presidente avatar editor:\n- Female Avatar: Casual Clothes\n- Male Avatar: Casual Clothes\n- Two additional accessories for the el presidente avatar editor:\n- Female Avatar: Baseball Hat\n- Male Avatar: Commie Hat\n\nTropico 3 offers a tongue-in-cheek, light-hearted take on real world issues like third world politics, corruption and totalitarian regimes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pqx.jpg'),(18164,'Escape 51','2024-11-27','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Escape 51 you play as a small alien that has been mistreated by humans as he works to escape the research facility that has kept him and other aliens like him captive for so long.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nr0.jpg'),(18165,'Project VR Wild Hunt','2019-09-08','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the Wild Hunt Project VR - this is a 100% transfer of the hunting process in VR, with a huge variety of wildlife and a rich arsenal of hunting weapons.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18166,'Rogue Jungle',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Rogue Jungle is an Action-Roguelike, where you have to fight & explore your way through a procedurally generated jungle. Find new weapons on your journey and face a Boss Enemy at the end of each run!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tix.jpg'),(18167,'Present Panic!: A Princess Adventure','2011-12-09','Platform','Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76dx.jpg'),(18168,'Knight Speed','2023-12-08','Racing, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on an epic medieval adventure in this fast-paced endless runner. As a valiant knight, leap across perilous towers, skillfully shoot down enemies with your trusty bow, and protect your kingdom while racing against the relentless passage of time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70zs.jpg'),(18169,'Fancade','2020-04-30','Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS, Mac','Fancade is the fanmade arcade! This mobile fantasy console lets you play thousands of games, or make your own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yzv.jpg'),(18170,'Men of War: Vietnam - Special Edition',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy','Sin plataforma','The critically acclaimed series returns! Experience Vietnam from both sides of the war.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zms.jpg'),(18171,'Heiankyo Alien','1979-02-01','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','Arcade','The player controls a Heian period police officer who must defend the capital city from an alien invasion by digging holes in the ground and filling them back up after an alien falls inside. The player scores points for every alien trapped, and the quicker the hole is filled up after the alien falls in, the higher the number of points are scored. The aliens increase in number as the levels progress, and they can escape from holes after a certain period of time elapses or if another alien passes above their hole. The player loses if he comes in contact with an alien. There is a time limit for each level, and the number of aliens increases drastically when this limit is reached, essentially preventing the player from completing the level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ymt.jpg'),(18172,'Instant Indie Collection: Vol. 1','2015-09-25','Arcade','Xbox One','\"Sneak through the shadows of the mysterious PTi facility in Stealth Inc 2, explore the depths of abandoned space station in the award wiinning \'The Swapper\' and make new friends in puzzle platformer Thomas Was Alone.\n\nThis Instant Indie pack is the perfect starter pack for exploring indie on Xbox, representing over 20 hours of some of the most well-known and well loved indie games available on console.\n\nThis Pack includes:\n\nStealth Inc 2\nThomas Was ALone\nThe Swapper\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qqrr0plkh1y4qhqjsdxn.jpg'),(18173,'Tenshi no Inai 12-gatsu','2003-09-26','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','TenInai is about a senior high school boy with relationship problems; he\'s got few friends and perhaps because of his bothersome kid sister, is averse to any steady relationship. That is, until he has a sexual encounter with Kurihara Touko. Touko, a classmate of his, is a sensitive, simple girl desperate to make an impression on others, and willingly offers herself to the protagonist. He runs away from a relationship; Touko clings to him hoping to find one. This unusual relationship soon leads them on a long soul-searching journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30xq.jpg'),(18174,'Drowning, Drowning','2020-05-15','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Drowning, Drowning is the story of a young girl who dives into the sea. make your way through the kelp forests and meet the friendly residents of an underwater city... but were you really invited here just for fun? or was there some deeper reason...?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co697o.jpg'),(18175,'No-Snake Hotel','2022-04-21','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome, to the No-Snake Hotel, the only hotel with a 99.99% no-snake guarantee! Here at the No-Snake Hotel we pride ourselves in our incomprehensible lack of snakes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77vl.jpg'),(18176,'Nova Lands','2023-06-22','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Nova Lands is a factory building, exploration, and island management game. Explore, engage in combat, and automate your industry. The planet you’re on is full of mysteries, creatures, people, and things to do. Welcome to your new home amongst the stars!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86yw.jpg'),(18177,'Touch My Katamari','2012-02-22','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation Vita','Roll up some fun with this portable entry in the beloved Katamari Damacy franchise. In Touch My Katamari, the ever-growing ball of bits and bobs is controlled by touching the screen or using both analog control sticks to roll it in any direction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69lg.jpg'),(18178,'Science Girls','2022-08-27','Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o6y.jpg'),(18179,'Project Freedom',NULL,'Sin género','Game Boy Color','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tbs.jpg'),(18180,'Purrfectly Hidden Cats: Kittenrock','2024-02-20','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Purrfectly Hidden Cats - Kittenrock\" welcomes you to a richly interactive 2D world set in a picturesque mountain resort. The hand-drawn scene in Kittenrock is a labor of love, brimming with intricate details, natural beauty, and humorous Easter eggs, inviting thorough exploration and discovery.\n\nThe gameplay blends classic hidden object mechanics with a unique twist—interactive people and cats around the map, enhancing the engagement and depth of the experience. Your primary goal is to spot the skillfully hidden cats that merge seamlessly into the scenic resort surroundings, often revealed through playful interactions with the environment and its inhabitants.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7soe.jpg'),(18181,'Doki Doki Our Time','2018-02-14','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki: Our Time is a popular mod for Doki Doki Literature Club! (DDLC) that focuses on expanding Monika\'s story, allowing the player to finally have a happy ending with her. Unlike the original DDLC experience, where Monika is aware of her existence as a game character and manipulates the events of the story, this mod seeks to give her a second chance - a world where she can live out a true romance with the protagonist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hbr.jpg'),(18182,'Lavalamp','2021-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','3D first-person walking simulator with a side of exploration/interaction with the environment. The game tells the story of the Space Lemmings from Space who, after running many experiments with breakfast alphabet and the space-time continuum, got blocked between dimensions (or something).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4570.jpg'),(18183,'ODR Hockey Heroes',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ODR Hockey Heroes is a brand new arcade hockey video game featuring ultra-smooth pick-up-and-play controls that\'ll have you scoring goals and laying hitz like a true legend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co776k.jpg'),(18184,'Blood for Poppies','2021-08-19','Adventure, Indie','Windows Mixed Reality, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Uncover the dark and tortured legacy of mad science in this psychological horror interactive novel about entrapment and the lingering echoes of trauma.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pyu.jpg'),(18185,'DCS World: MiG-21bis Constant Peg Campaign by Bunyap Campaigns','2021-10-07','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Constant Peg Campaign is based on operations carried out by the USAF\'s 4477th Test and Evaluation Squadron, the \'Red Eagles\'. These 10 missions are set in 1988 and replicate the unit\'s typical operations from Tonopah Test Range Airfield, Nevada. You will take flight in a MiG-21 to expose pilots from operational units to Soviet aircraft, and to replicate adversary tactics during realistic combat training scenarios.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95nh.jpg'),(18186,'Colorful Ghost','2024-08-08','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embark on a puzzling adventure in COLORFUL GHOSTS! Guide ghosts through challenges where candies change their colors, allowing them to blend with others. Overcome obstacles with logic. With ColorAdd accessibility features, easily identify colors. Can you solve these spectral puzzles?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8npf.jpg'),(18187,'Rocket League: Season 7','2022-06-15','Racing, Sport, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Welcome, esteemed Rocketeers! Season 7 features luxurious rewards like the Maestro Car and golden painted pro tier items. Rank up in the Utopia Coliseum (Gilded) Arena, or compete for tournament rewards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ut4.jpg'),(18188,'Contra x Castlevania Bundle','2024-10-09','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG)','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97lb.jpg'),(18189,'Kill Strain','2016-12-31','Shooter','PlayStation 4','Kill Strain is a top-down, competitive twin-stick action shooter with a monumental twist where three teams are pitted against each other for domination. Featuring innovative 5v5v2 gameplay, two teams of five players battle to contain-and-control a mysterious and powerful energy source codenamed ‘The Strain’ that has been discovered in research facilities. The humans are not alone in these remote locations, as two additional players take on the roles of mutants. Endowed with additional abilities when in contact with ‘TheStrain’, the mutant team wreaks havoc on the humans to spread ‘The Strain’ further on the field; turning humans into mutants along the way and creating a more powerful force.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b3e.jpg'),(18190,'Super Smash Bros. Open','2014-11-15','Fighting','Texas Instruments TI-99','Super Smash Bros. Open is an unofficial demake of Super Smash Bros. designed for TI-83 series calculators. The game is heavily based around Super Smash Bros. Melee.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co75fl.jpg'),(18191,'Mutants: Genesis',NULL,'Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mutants: Genesis is an online card game that you can play solo or with up to 3 players in PvE and PvP modes! Join the next generation of Psycogs and climb the ranks to establish yourself as Champion! Collect hundreds of mutants, fashion your own deck, cooperate with or fight other players!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62k9.jpg'),(18192,'Misericorde Volume Two: White Wool and Snow','2024-12-30','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sister Hedwig is having a bad time.\n\nIt wasn\'t long ago that the Mother Superior dragged her out of her cell, forcing Hedwig to break her oath to God as an Anchoress and face the outside world. Acting as a spy for the leader of Linbarrow Abbey, Hedwig was given one seemingly simple task: Discover who really murdered Sister Catherine.\n\nHedwig has tried her best, but she is no closer to solving the mystery. Things just keep getting more and more complicated: Why can\'t any of the Sisters give her a straight answer about what happened the night of the murder? Who--or what--is the mysterious figure that haunts the abbey? And just who was Sister Catherine?\n\nIn White Wool & Snow, Sister Hedwig must steel herself. Time is running out, and so is sympathy for her situation. It\'s understandable that being thrust into the waking world after a life of quiet reflection as an anchoress would require some adjustment, but if Hedwig wants to save an innocent man she will have to get serious fast. Can she navigate increasingly difficult social situations, maintain her cover, and make the progress the Superior demands?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gu5.jpg'),(18193,'Frond Online','2028-12-31','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Frond Online will be a game in the acclaimed MMORPG style, developed in Unreal Engine 5. It will feature a 3D view. Players will need to evolve their characters to explore increasingly challenging areas. Player characters must enhance their attributes and skills as they gain experience and levels, as well as acquire new equipment and relics scattered throughout the world. Each player can join groups and/or guilds, meeting new people or playing with friends, to develop and explore the world together. As a \'Game as a Service,\' the promise is that there will always be new content released periodically, keeping players entertained and excited to explore and discover new places and challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gqb.jpg'),(18194,'Toro to Kyuujistu','2001-11-29','Simulator, Adventure','PlayStation 2','Toro on Holiday is a Video Game developed by Bomber Express and published by Sony Computer Entertainment Inc.\n\nIt was released on November 29, 2001 on the PlayStation 2. It is an exploration based game where the player travels through a Japanese town with Toro. It is most notable by its use of live footage for its environments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e6k.jpg'),(18195,'Reformers','2017-11-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Reformers is a retro Role-Playing Game. There\'s no guide in the game, but plenty pleasures that waiting your exploration and discovery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27co.jpg'),(18196,'Just Pizza','2024-07-20','Point-and-click, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Just Pizza, a game that turns your love for pizza into an exciting and rewarding experience! This game is all about clicking on a pizza to earn more pizzas. The more you click, the more pizzas you get. It’s as simple and fun as that!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8o2j.jpg'),(18197,'Scrap Race',NULL,'Racing, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It\'s all downhill from here! Race down a hill with contraptions built from scrap! Play with up to 4 players in local multiplayer, or race against pre-fabricated \"bot\" opponents. Frantically build a wheel from scrap to roll down a hill: The contraption to roll the farthest wins! Start constructing your wheel by placing a scrap part anywhere on your blueprint! After that, just make sure any new parts you want to add are touching your contraption. To qualify for the race, make sure your construction covers all of the points on your blueprint.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18198,'Five Nights at Freddy\'s: Security Breach - Ruin','2023-07-25','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','You can run, but you can’t hide…\n\nEnter the ruins of Freddy Fazbear\'s Mega Pizzaplex in the FREE story DLC for Five Nights at Freddy’s: Security Breach!\n\nGregory is once again trapped in the now abandoned Pizzaplex, and he needs your help! Play as Cassie, Gregory’s best friend, Faz-fanatic, and would-be savior as she braves the dark, dreary, and dilapidated pizzeria. Armed with only a Faz-Wrench, a Roxy-Talky, and this weird bunny mask, you will have to help Cassie find her friend, free him, and safely escape the ruins.\n\nCan you save your friend, yourself, and the Pizzaplex? Find out in the 100% free DLC, Five Nights at Freddy’s: Security Breach – Ruin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84h7.jpg'),(18199,'Aristoi','2021-11-01','Card & Board Game','Android, iOS','Aristoi is a social-deduction & role-play game. There are 9 different roles with two different teams. Players use their roles, voting suspicious to win. Players using communitication skills to convince others.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47zj.jpg'),(18200,'Moonstone Island: Designed for Lovers DLC Pack','2024-06-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','The Designed for Lovers Pack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8td1.jpg'),(18201,'The Colorful Creature','2021-08-31','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A difficult platformer with the main mechanic of changing color in order to stand on colored blocks to progress. Play over 200 levels with unique items with diverse gameplay that have many items and hazards, in-game level editor, local multiplayer, endless run, customizable skins & hats, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gmq.jpg'),(18202,'Wild Romance: Mofu-mofu Edition','2017-11-20','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Expanded version of previously released Wild Romance including new UI, more features and additional never before seen in English content. Follow the adventures of Kazuma as he reconnects with four female friends who accidentally reveal that they are not mere humans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3n8u.jpg'),(18203,'Gradius III','1989-12-11','Shooter','Arcade','In the darkest reaches of infinite space, pure evil lies in wait ... The Dark Forces led by the god of destruction, Bacterian, prepare to launch a massive onslaught against the planet Gradius. Possessing unstoppable power, the Dark Forces threaten to plunge the Universe into total war and complete annihilation.\n\nTheir invasion force smashes the Gradius defenses, and the surrounding planets soon fall like dominoes. Now Bacterian\'s evil grasp reaches for the heart of the resistance...planet Gradius itself...\n\nTo counter the oncoming threat the United Gradius World Forces gather all their fighter craft. Half of them form a defensive net - the other half a strike team. But they are badly outnumbered and The Dark Forces easily tear through their thin frontline. No fighters survive the slaughter....\n\nIn a last gasp move, the United Gradius World Forces send out two fighters, previously considered too dangerous for combat missions: The InterDimensional VIC VIPER fighters.\n\nThe Fighters take off for the heart of darkness to join the fray that will decide the fate of the Universe...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63o8.jpg'),(18204,'Marrow','2023-09-30','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tchernobog lays dead, his form fading away from the world as Caleb turns his back to the smoldering corpse. Vengeance sated, he leaves the Hall of the Epiphany behind. Feeling no less disdain for the world than he did with Ophelia, and experiencing none of the joy she brought, he returns to the grave to die once more. A hopefully final resting place.\n\nThe Cabal had been scattered far and wide by the gunman\'s path of revenge, but in his absence they regathered, regrouped, motivated out of their own sense of vengeance. Caleb was their general, the chosen one of their dark god and he had betrayed them all twice over.\n\nHe must burn for rejecting the honor of being sacrificed, for striking at Tchernobog. This suffering is best repaid by the tongues of Cerberus. Gathering his remains, the diaspora cinders of his pit, they enacted plans to resurrect him, and sought out Caleb\'s newfound grave, and bring him face to face with a fiery end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fu5.jpg'),(18205,'No Limite','2024-03-12','Adventure, Visual Novel','Web browser, Game Boy','Something a bit Zelda 2D-like, a bit SNES Goof Troop, but you find/use >many< items, and you pick up items that are of no use to the game either. Confusing point-and-click puzzles made worse by useless items. A jaguar eating a contestant from No Limite.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co83qj.jpg'),(18206,'Arcade Hoops Basketball','2010-01-28','Sport','Nintendo DSi, Nintendo DS','ARCADE HOOPS BASKETBALL features your choice of 3 rockin’ soundtracks, state of the art 3D graphics, and thrilling, high speed game play, for the most fun humanly possible in under a minute. See how many baskets you can sink in a fast moving 45 seconds, using only your stylus and, of course, your lightning fast hand-eye coordination. Advanced hoopsters can move on to the progressive level, where a moving basket provides an additional challenge – and the chance to rack up even more points! And for the real PROS, try the 3 POINT CLASSIC MODE, where speed and accuracy are a must as you shoot \'threes\' from downtown.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rty.jpg'),(18207,'Impossible Soaring','2020-01-29','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Soar through the sky at intense speed while gracefully dodging perilously close obstacles. Test your reflexes and precision maneuvering ability as you master the challenging but intuitive skill of flight. Greater risk means greater reward!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wlp.jpg'),(18208,'Oi, Innkeep!',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Oi, Innkeep! is a first-person, cooking, farming, tavern-management game. Provide food, drinks, and entertainment for your customers while getting to know them and their problems. Don\'t forget to pay rent though, or you\'ll be forced to close up shop and the dream will be over.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18209,'Clone Your Way Out','2024-10-16','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embark on a retro sci-fi journey in \"Clone Your Way Out,\" a puzzle side-scroller with nostalgic pixel art. You\'ll control clones escaping from a mysterious lab, using a Clone Gun to solve deadly puzzles and traps. Enjoy retro visuals and unique cloning mechanics as you guide your clones to freedom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yhn.jpg'),(18210,'Rogue Sky',NULL,'Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Master gravity-defying flight mechanics and time-bending powers in this bullet hell rogue-lite where strategic depth meets intense gameplay. Unravel synergistic upgrades and enhancements as you stop the alien invasion from ever happening. Are you ready to dominate the skies?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7y10.jpg'),(18211,'Please, Visit Grandma','2019-09-08','Point-and-click, Adventure','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You decide to check in with your neighbor. Why don\'t you keep her company until her partner comes home?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6c0c.jpg'),(18212,'Stage Fright',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','From the makers of OVERCOOKED! comes an all new co-operative experience. Take your friend on an amazing adventure as you explore, solve escape rooms, overcome fiendish obstacles and unravel an ancient mystery.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95ga.jpg'),(18213,'Divine Heart Karen SP Season 2: Nari Henshin Heroine Crisis!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18214,'Lost in the Dark','2025-04-04','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re in a Maze with Monsters! try to solve its mystery!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mfw.jpg'),(18215,'Warhammer 40,000: Dark Crusaders',NULL,'Shooter, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','Warhammer: Dark Crusaders is a cancelled FPS that was in development for PC by Mindscape in 1995 / 1996. Dark Crusaders was going to be one of the few first person shooters based on the Warhammer world, but the gameplay was not that much fun and in the end Mindscape decided to never publish the game, even though it was almost complete. The game was however later released onto the internet and is for the most part playable. It seems that the FMV sequences used in Warhammer: Dark Crusaders were later recycled for Warhammer: Final Liberation, a turn-based tactics game published for Windows in 1997.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qkx.jpg'),(18216,'NCAA Football 08','2007-07-17','Sport','Xbox, PlayStation 3, Xbox 360, PlayStation 2','NCAA Football 08 is a college football video game created by EA Sports, the sports video gaming subsidiary of Electronic Arts. It is the successor to NCAA Football 07 in the NCAA Football series. It was officially announced with the launch of the NCAA 08 page on the EA Sports website on February 20, 2007.[1] EA Sports had opened up a ballot on their NCAA Football 07 site in which fans can vote on a feature to be implemented into the PlayStation 2 version, making it the first console announced for the game and announcing at least one of its features.[2] Fans could vote for either in-game saves, medical red shirts, summer workouts or a lead blocker feature. The option of medical red shirts was voted on and won, and this option is on the Dynasty Mode on all versions of NCAA Football 08. This allows for players that are injured in the middle of the year to apply to gain another year of eligibility. The game was released on July 17, 2007, and the first time release on PlayStation 3, marking the eleventh installment of the NCAA Football series bearing the title \"NCAA Football\". As with NCAA Football 07, 08 features limited ESPN integration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ffzbrfji6lvrgnkyphqq.jpg'),(18217,'Arete','2025-04-01','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Arete: The Battles of Alexander the Great is a classic hex-and-counter digital wargame where you\'ll relive the Macedonian king\'s most epic battles, from fighting alongside his father in Greece to climactic clashes with Darius in Persia to battling warlords at the extreme fringe of the empire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mfv.jpg'),(18218,'Nitronauts','2025-04-04','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Nitronauts is a 2-6 player couch/online multiplayer party game fusing classic Bomberman-like mechanics with explosive new twists. Battle across nine unique stages with an arsenal of wacky items & power-ups. Gather your friends and let the bombs do the talking!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g8l.jpg'),(18219,'Jagged Alliance: Back in Action - Point Blank','2012-06-13','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It\'s a mano-a-mano, merc vs merc in an all-out-war in this action-packed DLC for Jagged Alliance: Back in Action! A group of private mercenaries has captured American ambassador John Gaiden and it\'s up to your team to rescue him. Hired by Rygor Manson, a renegade CIA agent, these deadly mercs aim to plunge the government into chaos! You\'ve hired Gus Tarballs, Robert James \"Scully\" Sullivan and Donna \"Spider\" Housten and sent them on their way into the government district to bring back the ambassador. Will you manage to lead them to victory and put an end to Manson\'s terror?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cmd5x4hgwamj80qj40sm.jpg'),(18220,'Art Style: Aquia','2009-04-05','Puzzle','Nintendo DSi','A DSiWare launch title','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rum.jpg'),(18221,'Funghi Explosion','2018-12-20','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Easy to play alone and fun with a friend, this puzzle game is great for beginner or veteran alike. The rules are simple: gather up three of the same Funghi to make them disappear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hvd.jpg'),(18222,'Sonzai',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Sonzai is a 2d, action-brawler platforming RPG. The town of Kumotoshi holds secrets. A new life, new people, new spirits. What are the threads that bind people together? What is the nature of magic? All presented in a beautiful, inky art style - with every single frame of animation hand drawn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m09.jpg'),(18223,'Beavis And Butt-Head In Quest To Score',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beavis and Butt-head can\'t afford tickets to a concert that they want to go to as the tickets are 20bucks and unfortunately they only had 20 cents. With a goal in mind to score and to do things that don\'t suck Beavis and Butt-Head set off to get $20 to pay for the tickets and to acquire the delicacy known as Nachos as the venue didn\'t sell it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sza.jpg'),(18224,'Fallen Depths','2024-12-13','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Explore a building that has become a den of monsters and recover crucial documents.\" Fallen Depths is a roguelike action horror game where you navigate procedurally generated maps and aim to reach the top floor. Use logical strategies to overcome grotesque monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kjj.jpg'),(18225,'Lunars',NULL,'Indie, Arcade, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gather your friends for the zodiac party game where chaos meets competition! Up to 4 local and 8 online players can customize characters, conquer mini-games, and outsmart rivals with items and power-ups. With 3 game modes—including one where everyone plays at the same time—it’s non-stop fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fgf.jpg'),(18226,'Seek Hearts','2019-12-03','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Set out on an adventure to discover Izen\'s mysterious origins in a sci-fi RPG!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xxp.jpg'),(18227,'Mario\'s Super Present Adventure',NULL,'Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18228,'Dead Bits','2014-06-07','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Abducted by aliens, Quilly is forced to fight for his freedom.\nDead Bits is a first-person shooter for Windows and Mac.\nA Colorful World, made out of Cubes and Alien Zombies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8684.jpg'),(18229,'Imagine Lifetimes','2020-09-25','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A satirical simulation game about the meaning of life. Born with the ability to choose, your actions and decisions shape the paths ahead of you. Question the absurdity of existence as you figure out what it means to be alive...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2c1m.jpg'),(18230,'Treasure Atlas','2024-11-17','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a roguelike card game with RPG elements. An open world with a procedurally generated map where you decide where to go and who to fight. Along the way, you will encounter events that complicate or simplify the adventure. you will have to create your character and choose a class for him.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91s5.jpg'),(18231,'S.M.S','2023-02-08','Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After Chance\'s girlfriend leaves... he starts getting strange messages from her number. Forcing him to do some pretty weird things','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68wf.jpg'),(18232,'Quest Braintainment','2010-09-10','Quiz/Trivia','Nintendo DS','A quiz based on the Dutch magazine of the same name.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i85.jpg'),(18233,'1001 MiniGolf Challenge','2006-12-31','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the largest mini-golf course ever! Play over 1000 fun and challenging holes in an amazing mini-golf world! The intuitive and realistic 3D Virtual Play engine makes it easy to sink putts as you send your ball flying through loops pipes extreme ramps and mind-blowing obstacles.\n\nWith a combination of real golf rules and wacky mini-golf fun it\'s the ultimate challenge!Realistic 3D Play Zoom in zoom out & rotate 360 degrees up down left & right.\n\nWild & Crazy Obstacles: Flowers & Plants can slow you down or be used to make ricochet shots.Sand Traps will cost you valuable strokes...just like on a real golf course!The Fan can push your ball high over obstacles--or past the hole!The Speeder gives your shot a boost.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/huhf9parmwaqkdlwsrli.jpg'),(18234,'Animahjong X','1994-09-14','Visual Novel, Card & Board Game','PC-9800 Series','The sequel to Animahjong V3. When the events of this game occur the playable protagonist in the first game is now close friends with the three mahjong playing sisters and has even begun dating the eldest, Yumika.\n\nIn this story, Rumi is kidnapped while walking home from school one day and the player must search for the clues that will reunite the family. Playing the role of the male protagonist or either of Rumi\'s older sisters, Yumika and Miyabi, you compete against several female mahjong players who have information on Rumi\'s whereabouts. As they get closer to finding Rumi, Yumika grows increasingly suspicious...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e06.jpg'),(18235,'Extreme Custom Night','2019-12-31','Point-and-click, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have finished your job of a night-guard last week, and now you have nightmares of your own. The memories are still awake in your head, and to stop the terror, you must survive against all of them!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7eok.jpg'),(18236,'Pontifex','2001-10-01','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build your bridge with love. Be proud of your creation, and give it a pompous name. Then eventually watch it with horror collapsing as a train runs of it, giving you an undeniable proof that your bridge was indeed flawed. Then start over.\n\nThese few sentences depict well a typical game of Pontifex, the successor of the infamous freeware Bridge Builder which had already made crazy numerous players around the world when it was released.\n\nAs its name suggests, this game is all about building bridges. Each level confronts you with the same challenge: there is a river to cross, and it\'s up to you to devise the bridge. Three materials are available - light steel, heavy steel and wire - each with own strength, weight and price. In order to clear a level, your bridge must be able to withstand successfully the weight of a train running on it. Hopefully, you can try an unlimited number of times...\n\nThe game actually features a very advanced physics model, taking into account compression and stretching - and of course gravity.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/yfxfbkd51nrbx8xnyfzk.jpg'),(18237,'SCP: Labrat','2021-05-17','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR','You are a test subject in the underground SCP research facility. When a containment breach occurs, you must find your way out. Escape the SCPs, discover anomalous objects, and collect valuable resources along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x9t.jpg'),(18238,'Mini Doubt: Gouka Kyakusen-hen','2018-08-15','Visual Novel','Android, iOS','A new Doubt story with a shorter duration that adds randomization to the mix!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6891.jpg'),(18239,'Super Screepy Underworld','2016-08-25','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super Screepy Underworld is an action platformer\nin which players control a creature which is trapped\nin hell, and the only way to save their soul is to beat\nthe devil and all the 4 underworlds, which together\ncontain 50 levels in total(46 normal levels, and 4 boss levels).\n\nFeatures:\n\n1.Very Accurate and Tight Controls.\n\n2.Wall Jumping.\n\n3.Jump Sustain(Hold Longer To Jump Higher).\n\n4.Screaming.\n\n5.Force Screaming(When You Scream everything in the scream\'s radius starts floating like you posses the force !)\n\n6.4 UnderWorlds(or 4 Stages that split the game into 4 parts)\n\n7.50 Levels in total(46 Normal + 4 Boss Levels).\n\n8.2 Enemies:\n\n-Fucilers(Ground Enemies)\n\n-Screvels(Jumping Enemies).\n\n2016 Drin Kadriu','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/towlnj1dtd8j17d2a3f1.jpg'),(18240,'Miner Ultra Adventures 2','2022-05-12','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Our friend Miner is back!!! Amazing adventures with extreme difficulty, this 3d platform game will surprise you and give you a lot of satisfaction to overcome all the challenges!!! Be versatile and have quick reflexes to be the best!!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4cuh.jpg'),(18241,'Monument Valley: Forgotten Shores','2014-11-20','Puzzle','Android, iOS','Forgotten Shores is a paid content pack that adds 8 new levels to Monument Valley.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z9l.jpg'),(18242,'Arcane Dice Wars: A Villain\'s Heart','2023-06-24','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome, Transient One . Brought forth from another world and free of the gods, you alone hold the key to granting a person\'s deepest desire . If this person happens to be a villain, will you indulge their dark side or try to change their fate?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fno.jpg'),(18243,'Spectral vs. Generation','2007-07-25','Fighting','Arcade, PlayStation Portable, PlayStation 2','The fate of a land rests in the hands of fearless fighters, united in their quest to control the power of the Earth temple. Master devastating attacks and vanquish your enemies in this epic struggle between good and evil!\n\nSpectral VS Generation is a 2D versus fighting game in which you take control of one of ten fighters from the Spectral Force series and Generation of Chaos series. The cause for all the fighting is apparently to decide who will claim the powers of the of the fabled Earth temple.\n\nThe fighters to choose from are Ice witch Mayura, War gale Weles, Empress of darkness Roze, Northern knight Eril, Sword master Kryce, Aristocrat of Darkness Jado, Holy fist Ryuken, Explosion child Hiro, Wyvern of the East Drochimaru and Holy god earth. Each fighter has their own weapon and fighting techniques which include special attacks and fights are best of three. The game offers an Arcade mode, Training mode and Survival mode for single player as well as an VS mode for multiplayer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vy2xaadkrlwhhd3k8jnl.jpg'),(18244,'Marble Meadows',NULL,'Platform, Indie','Sin plataforma','Marble Meadows is a new cozy 3D platformer full of whimsy & wonder. Relax and roll your way around various thematic stages, or try your hand zipping and bouncing through more complex levels in order to complete skill-based challenges!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7w2u.jpg'),(18245,'Calculation Castle: Greco\'s Ghostly Challenge \"Subtraction\"','2018-05-14','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Calculation Castle: Greco\'s Ghostly Challenge \"Subtraction\" is a game that lets players enjoy studying while challenging their skills in math. It contains a collection of subtraction problems and math drills learned at the elementary level. There are up to 10 steps of learning, starting with elementary 1st grade level 1-digit math problems to developing skills such as borrowing numbers with 2-digit math problems and more. Advancing through the levels, players can naturally learn to solve 4-digit subtraction problems with ease.\n\nThe game is composed of a series of stages and there are ghosts and locked doors within each stage. Greco and his ghosts will present the player with problems that they will need to solve in order.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5775.jpg'),(18246,'Nachos and Fried Oreos','2019-02-25','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Nachos and Fried Oreos is a 15-exit \"vanilla with ASM sprinkles\" hack. The levels are short and sweet with a focus on action-packed platforming (inspired by the Japanese style of hacking). However, this hack is not your typical platformer. In Nachos and Fried Oreos, a game-over is truly a game-over! If you lose all your lives, your save file is deleted and you must start from the beginning.\n\nThe game includes 4 difficulties that determine the amount of lives you will start with. In addition, every level has 5 dragon coins and a moon. Collecting them will grant you a different reward based on your difficulty.\n\nIf you are a casual player and you would never touch a \"hard\" or \"very-hard\" hack, that\'s okay! That\'s exactly why we have created beginner mode. On this difficulty, you will be given infinite lives and can enjoy the hack at your leisure. Still, be aware that this hack is pretty tricky, even on beginner mode. If you are a more advanced player and love the adrenaline and excitement of beating a challenging segment, then playing on advanced/expert/master is for you!\n\nIncompatibility notice! This hack has been known to crash on both the SNES Classic and the Super Famicom. Play at your own risk.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mcu.jpg'),(18247,'New Nightmare Cafe 2','2023-03-16','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nko.jpg'),(18248,'Quickie World 2','2019-03-08','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r7l.jpg'),(18249,'Hero Hunters - Jurassic Shooting Sniper','2018-06-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super hero hunter must defeat the enemy to save the world. Action, Arcade, Crime, Dinosaur, fight games and for those fans of guns weapon games, jetpack, games, tank, cars and truck games.\n30 levels Mission, 10 hours game time!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18250,'Fireworks Simulator: Realistic','2021-03-10','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is the best fireworks simulator, lighting fireworks will bring good luck, and your world will be colorful.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5o3c.jpg'),(18251,'A Day at the Beach','2021-06-21','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','A very short flatgame for class about a day at the beach with my girlfriend and feeling helpless.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72ai.jpg'),(18252,'Super Mario Horizons','2023-10-16','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Mario wants to have a party, when mysteriously his friends disappear. Then Rokko-chan appears and tells him that it\'s not just them, but that lately people have been disappearing from different places. Mario together with Rokko-chan must solve the mystery and rescue his friends in an 8-world adventure, with bosses from different games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dhm.jpg'),(18253,'Mezma\'s Revenge',NULL,'Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A new addition to the past hypnotic visual novels involving 2 new hypnotists, each with their own style. You can pick New Age Bloof for a meditative journey, Dr. Voldritch if you miss his devious mad scientist charm or if you want something more intense, Elijah, a scheming super villain who likes brainwashing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8975.jpg'),(18254,'Zeldara\'s Glitch City','2017-07-23','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Most SMW hacks are designed to feel like new games that just happen to be based off of SMW. This hack is just the opposite.\n\nZeldara\'s Glitch City is intended to be a very strange, unconventional, and otherwise confusingly random hack, that deliberately exploits unusual aspects of the SMW engine (as well as the fact that most SMW hack players are quite familiar with the original SMW\'s levels) to its advantage. (It also intends to showcase various little-used edits that are possible in SMW hacks.)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fk8.jpg'),(18255,'Godkiller','2021-02-22','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as a WW2 Soviet soldier in a post apocalytic landscape ravanged by a corrupt god.A 2d action adventure through the beautiful yet disturbing dystopian world,with crazy cults,Nazi scum and the forces of the corrupt god.Do you have enough might to save the world?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41cn.jpg'),(18256,'The Last Galaxy',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18257,'Press Forward Ooooonnnnn','2019-12-03','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are a little bird wandering through layers of space. In the face of the sudden arrival of an army of balls, you can only rise to the occasion and try your best to eliminate these cute but detestable enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co476d.jpg'),(18258,'Thirsty Heroes',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Hire tavern patrons for the dirty work in this dungeon-crawling, deck-building business sim with swords!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44lm.jpg'),(18259,'The Gardener and the Wild Vines','2021-11-05','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Gardener and the Wild Vines is a story-based platformer where the platforms are procedurally generated each time the Gardener cuts and collects a flower.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4orb.jpg'),(18260,'HordeCore: Training Ground','2020-10-14','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','HordeCore is a kick-ass side-scrolling shooter set in a post-apocalyptic world. Play alone, or as a team - and destroy, survive, craft, and explore!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43ce.jpg'),(18261,'Pokémon Soul Silver Randomizer',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','A randomizer mod for Pokémon Soul Silver.\n\nPokemon Randomizers are a fresh new way to experience your favorite Pokemon games! With wild encounters, trainer pokemon, starter pokemon, field items and TMs randomized anything can happen! Imagine walking into the grass and instead of encountering a Pidgey it is a Mewtwo instead. The possibilities are endless and unique!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ca7.jpg'),(18262,'Hack 6','2020-12-31','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gxe.jpg'),(18263,'Demon Hunter 3: Revelation',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Face your own supernatural past!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21nk.jpg'),(18264,'Wing Commander III: Heart of the Tiger','1994-12-31','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows), 3DO Interactive Multiplayer, Mac, DOS, PlayStation','Wing Commander is a space combat simulator intercut with live action cutscenes. Gameplay involves completing missions and destroying enemy craft, Wing commander III dispensed with the issuing of medals after such missions and relied more on cutscenes to drive the story along making much more use of CD technology. As the man giving the orders, Blair often gets to choose what ship he will fly, what missiles it will carry, and what wingman (wingmen) he will take with him. As in Wing Commander, some wingmen can be killed permanently in combat. Blair\'s own call sign remained customizable','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2khu.jpg'),(18265,'I x She Tell','2020-01-30','Simulator','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','At long last - we, the student council, have won you your freedom to love! The moment I declare these words, my classmates come surging forward, surrounding me in a circle of cheers that echo across the entire campus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hgu.jpg'),(18266,'Tribes of Midgard: Deluxe Edition','2022-08-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Mythical creatures, deadly spirits, and gigantic brutes threaten to bring on Ragnarök - the end of the world! It\'s up to you, a mighty Einherjar, to cut short your glorious feast in Valhalla and return to Midgard. There, you\'ll need to become the ultimate Viking and survive - even thrive to save your village, and the world, from total destruction. Luckily, you don\'t have to brave it alone: your (mostly) fearless tribe of co-op companions will help you build up village defenses and find treasures through a vast, beautiful real mall while doomsday ticks closer and closer. But don\'t let that stop your tribe from having the best apocalypse of your lives. \"Surthrive\" is the Viking way in Tribes of Midgard, a multiplayer, action-survival RPG of gigantic proportions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bhl.jpg'),(18267,'Cute, Broke, and Dungeon Bound',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Sin plataforma','An RPG about the protagonist \"Memelis,\" who is deep in debt. Because she spent everything she has on card lottery in mobile games, Embarks on an adventure with her best friend \"Tina\" to find the treasure hidden in the depth of dungeons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hjd.jpg'),(18268,'SMW2+3: The Essence Star','2009-06-26','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','After shipwrecking in a strange land, Mario is on the journey to collect the five shards of the Essence Star– said to benefit the world through people\'s actions. If it falls into the hands of evil-doers, though...\n\nSMW2+3: The Essence Star is an advanced romhack featuring detailed storytelling, a shop system, and several surprises!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77bq.jpg'),(18269,'Boris','2015-11-01','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','A hack by Sockbat Replica with 52 exits. It took about a year to finish.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fk0.jpg'),(18270,'Suicide For Him','2021-11-13','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A mysterious and deep story with multiple endings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6hsy.jpg'),(18271,'Batla','2015-05-14','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Batla is the awesome shooter game about robots, which came to conquer the Earth, but turned to be were too small for that. They had no choice but to capture the kid\'s room and start fighting there.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ms4.jpg'),(18272,'Outbreak: The Fedora Files Desperate Struggle Collection','2025-03-29','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m3d.jpg'),(18273,'8Floor Bundle 4 in 1 Part 7','2025-03-28','Sin género','Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m3f.jpg'),(18274,'Orcus','2021-07-24','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vc5.jpg'),(18275,'Epimutation','2025-02-25','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','399 days ago, the world ended. Epimutation is a horror visual novel that follows seven survivors as they attempt to navigate life in the apocalypse. Make life or death decisions, form bonds with your fellow survivors, and attempt to unravel the mystery behind the outbreak.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9muk.jpg'),(18276,'Chants of Sennaar','2023-09-05','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In this game of adventure and enigmas where ancient languages are both the lock and the key, travel the endless steps of a prodigious labyrinth, multiply unexpected encounters and unveil the mysteries of a fantastic world inspired by the myth of Babel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mjo.jpg'),(18277,'Deepspace','2022-06-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DEEPSPACE is an innovative Web3 strategy exploration MMO set in an expansive space environment. It integrates a sophisticated economy system using DPS, its native in-game token, along with NFT-based assets, providing players with genuine ownership of their in-game assets. The game is structured into multiple distinct stages, each offering a unique gaming experience, with The Hangar serving as the gateway to the vast DEEPSPACE universe.\n\nPlayers in DEEPSPACE embark on a journey of purchasing, trading, and upgrading spaceships, fostering a dynamic interstellar experience. The game places a strong emphasis on exploration, inviting players to uncover the mysteries of genesis planets and various other aspects of its rich universe. The gameplay is diverse, ranging from resource mining to engaging in tactical battles against AI opponents and fellow players. Key features include strategic turn-based combat, the formation of alliances, and the expansion of territorial influence.\n\nOperating on both the Ethereum and BNB Chain, DEEPSPACE adopts a gamefi model, blending gaming with decentralized finance. This model enhances the gameplay experience by offering economic incentives. The DEEPSPACE multiverse is a carefully crafted blend of exploration, resource gathering, and combat, ensuring an engaging and multifaceted experience for players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7et2.jpg'),(18278,'Doki Doki 2nd Anniversary','2019-09-22','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki: 2nd Anniversary is a mod for Doki Doki Literature Club! that celebrates the second anniversary of the original game with a new approach to the story and new interactions with the characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hbv.jpg'),(18279,'Incur Survival',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','A Survival open-world game. Gather resources, Hunt, Craft tools and armor, Tame Animals, Ride Animals, Build, and defend your base from creatures, and other players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co893s.jpg'),(18280,'Slime Squisher','2025-04-09','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sime Squisher is a game where you need to protect a strawberry by squishing slimes. Choose upgrades, get more powerful and survive waves of deadly slimes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9el1.jpg'),(18281,'Resident Evil Revelations Collection','2017-11-30','Shooter, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','A bundle containing Resident Evil Revelations on a game card and download codes for the Resident Evil Revelations 2 episodes. Includes all previously released DLC for the games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wyt.jpg'),(18282,'Hirai Nya','2025-03-09','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Step into a combat-free Metroidvania world where your adventure revolves around exploration, puzzle-solving, and treasure hunt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gjz.jpg'),(18283,'Luminescent','2021-12-10','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','A moderately hard hack of Super Mario World. Luminescent is meant to be a fun challenge for the kaizo enthusiast who seeks to delve into tougher territory, while still being firmly intermediate in nature. It is ASM heavy, and features a plethora of custom stuff while keeping the familiar aesthetics and playability of the original game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5cc4.jpg'),(18284,'Roguebook: Fugoro - Merchant of Wonders','2022-04-21','Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Mischievous, greedy, an expert with a staff… This triton has more than one trick up his sleeve! Recruit Fugoro, a new playable hero, and unlock 50 new cards, talents and treasures to combine to defeat the Roguebook!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sfq.jpg'),(18285,'Doki Doki Daigaku','2021-04-25','Visual Novel','Android','When a computer glitch mysteriously ruins your perfect GPA, you\'re forced to attend summer school at an all-girls university to maintain your scholarship. The change of scenery isn\'t so bad—until your former high school rival takes roll. With your vacation ruined, can you drag the struggling members of WISH back into the spotlight, or is this the end of your dreams?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55s0.jpg'),(18286,'Complex Loop','2023-04-20','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Complex Loop is a sci-fi themed visual novel. This is a story of time loops between past and future. Within a time limit of 20 minutes, your mission is to save a mysterious girl died from an explosion accident one year ago. Solve puzzles and reveal the truth behind the tragedy. An adventure awaits!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6d2j.jpg'),(18287,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization V: The Complete Edition','2014-02-04','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become Ruler of the World by establishing and leading a civilization from the dawn of man into the space age: Wage war, conduct diplomacy, discover new technologies, go head-to-head with some of history’s greatest leaders and build the most powerful empire the world has ever known.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oar.jpg'),(18288,'Valkyria Chronicles 3: Extra Mission - Hard-Ex The Targeted Stockpile Goods','2011-07-06','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PlayStation Portable','Black crows flock to the abandoned stockpile. Protect your stockpile from cunning mass attacks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x1q.jpg'),(18289,'Dungeon Travelers 2: The Royal Library & the Monster Seal','2023-06-09','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, PlayStation Portable','Dungeon Travelers 2: The Royal Library & the Monster Seal is a dungeon crawler role-playing video game and the sequel to To Heart 2: Dungeon Travelers within the To Heart franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l2k.jpg'),(18290,'Slaves of Rome','2024-02-12','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Slaves of Rome\" is a new adult sex game with strong BDSM elements in development. This is an early preview of the game. Play a slave trainer in ancient Rome - buy slaves, teach them how you like to F#$k and sell them for profit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47cq.jpg'),(18291,'The Shojing','2025-12-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"SHOJING\" is a casual game where you control a cat and break a shoji screen. It\'s a cat, so it\'s just about permissible, but humans should never try to imitate this.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o3f.jpg'),(18292,'Amatsutsumi','2016-07-29','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita','Our hero, Makoto, possesses the power of \"kotodama\" which allows one to control people with the power of one\'s voice.\n\nHaving an interest in the outside world, he leaves the hidden village he has lived in all his life. However, he found himself woefully unprepared and collapses on the side of the road in a small town almost as remote as his village. Just as he\'s resigned himself to death, he\'s saved by Oribe Kokoro, a girl whose family runs a cafe in that town.\n\nUsing his kotodama powers, Makoto becomes a part of the Oribe family and begins attending school with Kokoro. He soon meets several girls who each have their own special circumstances. Will Makoto be able to use kotodama to help these girls? And what is the true nature of kotodama?\n\nThis is a story of the words that weave the ties that bind...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dyl.jpg'),(18293,'Sweet Skullvivors',NULL,'Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unleash the power of Mexican food to survive the hordes of hungry Alebrijes. Make the most colorful and delicious Ofrenda the world has ever seen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hn5.jpg'),(18294,'Breecell',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18295,'Fashion Dream','2021-10-12','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy','Android, iOS','A world of fashion awaits! Build your dream wardrobe from thousands of clothing and accessory items! Stories and fashion collide. Join Fashion Dream to build your dream wardrobe and rise to fame and fortune! Choose from thousands of clothing and accessory items to create your favorite look. Get sketches of garments and tailor outfits together with your friends. Get ready with us! Customize every detail of your makeup styles. Create unique looks for various styling challenges and compete with four other players at once. Enjoy minigames and take selfies with your besties on the beach, in a castle, or in a Japanese-style garden.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4e5d.jpg'),(18296,'The Skylia Prophecy','2021-05-27','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Skylia Prophecy is a sidescrolling action-rpg set in a medieval fantasy world. As Mirenia, you will journey throughout the lands and towns, explore ancient dungeons and battle hordes of the undead in this hard as hell adventure inspired by the \'kill the player\' philosophy of the \'Souls\' games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mhn.jpg'),(18297,'Spooky Driver','2018-09-05','Racing, Arcade','Android','Drive as fast as you can!\nPass the driving cars!\n\nSpooky Driver drives you crazy!\n\nPass as many cars as you can and get your own place in the top 10 high-scores.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mpypppir5yc2ui7vwcat.jpg'),(18298,'Battle of Empires: 1914-1918','2015-04-22','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Battle of Empires: 1914-1918 is a story driven RTS, that re-lives some of the bloodiest battles of “The Great War”. The missions include some of the most fearsome weaponary employed of the period. Sabotage, stealth, trench warfare, gas attacks, artillery and mobile infantry - BoE has it all!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/s8xitzxaigok36e0lhiu.jpg'),(18299,'Stray Sketch','2024-10-31','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\" Where are we going?\" You have a ticket to the exhibition. Find your favorite picture.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9no2.jpg'),(18300,'S.T.A.L.K.E.R. 2: Heart of Chornobyl - Ultimate Edition','2024-11-20','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows)','S.T.A.L.K.E.R. 2: Heart of Chornobyl Ultimate Edition Contains:\n\nP.H.Y.S.I.C.A.L.\n- Steel Book (Ultimate art)\n- Letter From Developers\n- Souvenir Zone Permit\n- Sticker Pack\n- Zone Map\n- Poster\n- Faction Patches\n- Military Token\n- Keychain (Multi-tool) with Fire Starter\n- Art Book\n- Stalker Figurine\n- Artefact Container Lamp\n- S.T.A.L.K.E.R. Backpack\n(Pre-Order Bonus):\n- Extended campfire content\n- Exclusive weapon skin\n- Exclusive armor skin\n- \'Early bird\' multiplayer badge\n\nD.I.G.I.T.A.L.\n- Special Extra Quest\n- Digital Artbook\n- Official Soundtrack\n- 2 Story Expansions\n- SEASON PASS\n\n(Single-Player Campaign)\n- 1 Costume, 3 Weapon skins\n\n(Multiplayer)\n- 3 Costumes, 7 Weapon skins\n\n(Steam Exclusive Content)\n- Dynamic Theme\n- Animated Avatar\n- Avatar Frame\n\n(Pre-order Bonus)\n- Extended campfire content\n- Exclusive weapon skin\n- Exclusive armor skin\n- \'Early bird\' multiplayer badge','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zw3.jpg'),(18301,'Bongus Bright-Eye & The Great Axe-Stravaganza','2023-06-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bongus Bright-Eye & The Great Axe-stravaganza is an homage to the classic Point & Click Adventure games. It\'s a comedy induced fantasy game, where you follow our protagonist Bongus Bright-Eye on his journey to save the Dwarven Kingdom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qu8.jpg'),(18302,'The Legend of Bum-bo','2022-06-29','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The Legend of Bum-bo is a randomly generated turn based puzzle RPG. It\'s a spin-off of Binding of Isaac: Rebirth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1suk.jpg'),(18303,'Ratchet & Clank: Before the Nexus','2013-12-18','Platform','Android, iOS','Ratchet & Clank: Before the Nexus is a mobile application released for Android and iOS on December 18, 2013. The player plays as Ratchet and has to jump between grindrails in order to collect bolts which can be used to upgrade weapons and armor. It was released to promote Ratchet & Clank: Into the Nexus.\n\nBy syncing with a PlayStation Network account players can earn Raritanium for upgrading weapons in Ratchet & Clank: Into the Nexus.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co230t.jpg'),(18304,'Super Mario in: Yoshi\'s Revenge','2015-10-31','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','An unprecedented new enemy has emerged. His plan, to kidnap Princess Peach. Now it\'s up to Mario to save her and subdue this new foe.\n\nOld Friendships will be lost, new freinds will be made, and Mario will learn a valuable lesson.\n\n-5 worlds + 53 exits + Koopa-ventures-','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18305,'Kubifaktorium','2019-07-03','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build, manage and grow a thriving colony, discover new lands, craft legendary weapons and defeat your enemies. Kubifaktorium will feature different biomes to explore, plenty of resources to exploit, complex machinery to build and interesting production chains to master!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qit.jpg'),(18306,'Super Mario Starlight Remix','2015-10-15','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y5b.jpg'),(18307,'Dullpain','2023-07-14','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dullpain is a side-scrolling, interaction, and storytelling game. Playing as Jingwen, a young boss of a long-established repair shop, you need to repair not only everyday items, also memories. You can enjoy dull-pain and breathtaking stories in different time and space and redefine the end of story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ukn.jpg'),(18308,'Kingdom Hearts Re:Chain of Memories','2008-12-02','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 2','Kingdom Hearts Re:Chain of Memories is a full remake of Kingdom Hearts: Chain of Memories, released on the PlayStation 2. In Japan, it is part of the Kingdom Hearts II Final Mix+ compilation and has connectivity features with Kingdom Hearts II Final Mix. As there were no plans to release Kingdom Hearts II Final Mix internationally, these features were modified for the North American release.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30sq.jpg'),(18309,'Post Apocalypse Courier Service','2025-12-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Can you build delivery vehicles to survive the post apocalypse? Go it alone or with up to 4 friends as you navigate treacherous environments, make deliveries, customise vehicles, scavenge for parts, and grow your delivery business!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92rq.jpg'),(18310,'Ooooo','2024-04-22','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','A 82 exit level hack for Super Mario World by JUMP Team and Kevin centered around green bean-based gimmicks and challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ahe.jpg'),(18311,'Beat Invaders','2022-03-10','Shooter','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beat Invaders is a cool space Shoot-Em-Up. Blast your way through enemy fleets! Upgrade your ship with rockets & armor! Defeat the final boss! All to flashy neon musically charged visuals!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bj7.jpg'),(18312,'The Game Formerly Known as Hidden Nazi Mode','2010-09-11','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Game Formerly Known as Hidden Nazi Mode was, in fact, formerly known as Hidden Nazi Mode. As such it was a failed experiment, detailed in the accompanying essay. In this release the Nazi mode has been removed, and what remains is, as the subtitle says, \"a cute game for unattended young children\". It involves bunnies and lots of hints.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5555.jpg'),(18313,'Crux','2023-06-19','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crux is a fast-paced single-player arena shooter roguelike, where you face waves of enemies, unique bossfights and earn powerful magic abilities across 13 arenas. Master your fluid movement, trusty arsenal and the power of the blood gods to reach the top of the CRUX Champions Leaderboard!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7grp.jpg'),(18314,'Tofu\'Drift','2023-03-24','Racing, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In this challenging arcade driving game, you have to collect all the red cubes with your car. Sounds easy enough, right? But you only have 10 seconds to complete each level.\nCan you manage all 15 levels?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ak2.jpg'),(18315,'Savvy Four','2023-07-02','Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Web browser, Android, iOS','Savvy Four is a free to play, strategic board game for everyone. The goal is to connect four tokens to score points.\n\nThe game can be played in a web browser and is available as an app for iOS on the App Store and Android on Google Play.\n\nTo begin, players can customize their character and select a game type to play against either AI opponents of varying difficulties or a friend. Players have the option to participate in single games or join a league where each player competes against one another. The game features a ranking system that starts at Novice and progresses as players win games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qw7.jpg'),(18316,'Treasure Tech','2020-01-16','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Treasure Tech is a Doom Gameplay Mod inspired by the Wario Land franchise, featuring a slew of other elements from arcade games and retro classics.\n\nPlay as Chesterfield, more known as Treasure Guy, as he shakes down the forces of hell for their pocket change! Tackle your foes, and throw them into each other!\nCollect tons of coins, jewels, strange artifacts, and spend your earnings to power yourself up! Use an array of exotic weapons as you hunt down every last penny on the map!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4n58.jpg'),(18317,'Doki Doki A Brand New Day','2017-12-08','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doki Doki: A Brand New Day is a mod for Doki Doki Literature Club! that revamps the original game experience, offering a new perspective on the story and allowing the player to change the fate of the characters. In this mod, the protagonist is aware of the traumatic events of the base game and seeks to prevent the tragedies from occurring. This leads to a storyline full of new interactions, choices and exciting moments, giving players the chance to create a different future for Sayori, Yuri, Natsuki and Monika.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hbu.jpg'),(18318,'Football Story',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Football Story is a multiplayer football game that pits full teams of players against one another. Each player controls their own character, instead of a full team. In Football Story, you step into the cleats of a player in a small neighborhood club.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7c51.jpg'),(18319,'Bishoujo Janshi Suchie-Pai','1993-08-30','Sport, Card & Board Game','Wii, Super Famicom','A Super Famicom mahjong game and the first title in the Idol Janshi Suchie-Pai mahjong series.\n\nBishoujo Janshi Suchie-Pai (\"Pretty Fighter Suchie-Pai\") is the first game in what would later be referred to as the Idol Janshi Suchie-Pai series. It\'s a mahjong game that uses comedy and attractive women to stand out among its more serious peers. The player, as the transforming warrior Suchie-Pai, can move around a world map to challenge various other female characters at mahjong in any order.\n\nThe characters were designed by Kenichi Sonoda, a famous animator and manga artist best known for the anime and manga Gunsmith Cats, who also worked on Bubblegum Crisis and Gall Force.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3059.jpg'),(18320,'Shelltopia','2023-03-07','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','This is a Vanilla based Shell Hack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cva.jpg'),(18321,'Jo\'s House','2021-12-31','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jo\'s house is a maze building game where you must rearrange the furniture of the HQ Residential House to create the longest path from Jo\'s bed to one of the exits (front door, back door or garage). At night Jo will start rolling around the house to either attack you, eat a pie or exit the house. Your goal is to survive 3 nights doing the following 2 things: #1: Don\'t get hit by Jo. #2: Don\'t let Jo leave the house.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93a0.jpg'),(18322,'Super Fire Pro Wrestling Special','1994-12-22','Fighting, Sport, Adventure','Super Famicom','In this Special Fire Pro, you are a rookie wrestler working his way up through the ranks. During the journey, you fall in love with the sister of a wrestler named Akira Saeha. The road to the championship bout is a struggle, with loss after loss, both inside and outside of the ring, including you accidentally killing your best friend during a match.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jdr.jpg'),(18323,'Mario Eisouoku: Illusionary Blossom of Cranium Prayer','2021-12-05','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','What happens when five fans of Super Mario World and Touhou Project come together to make a hack? Super Mario World with Touhou elements mixed in, of course! Aside from the usual platforming and exploration of strange lands, Mario now has to focus and dodge bullets fired by familiar foes as the Mushroom Kingdom gets dragged into a new incident.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56pq.jpg'),(18324,'Scott Pilgrim vs. the World: The Game - Complete Edition','2021-01-14','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Amazon Fire TV, Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Rediscover the beloved 2D arcade-style beat \'em up inspired by the iconic comic book series and movie, Scott Pilgrim vs. The World.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g7m.jpg'),(18325,'La-Mulana 2: The Tower of Oannes','2022-01-23','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The first piece of downloadable content for La-Mulana 2, the newly-added map – The Tower of Oannes. Ranks with the previous instalment’s Hell Temple in difficulty, acting as an optional distraction from the main journey, filled with brutal level design and humour akin to a Masocore title.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4et2.jpg'),(18326,'Super Mario Bros. 3 X','2014-06-28','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mbk.jpg'),(18327,'Funny Bunny: Adventures','2019-04-24','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Nice looking and fun game, that develops logical thinking and responsivity. It is highly recommended for children!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co57ok.jpg'),(18328,'True Colours','2023-10-04','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','True Colours – A Date With Deception starts as a cute visual novel about day-to-day life and the pursuit of happiness beyond a boring work routine, but as interpersonal trust is called into question, a darker side begins to emerge. Be forewarned that you could be seen as the villain of this tangled web, but it’s up to you whether you embrace the role or seek ultimate redemption. Dare to explore multiple story routes and romantic interests leading to 12 possible endings, some good… and some very bad!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ims.jpg'),(18329,'The Final Fragment','2025-12-31','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A coming-of-age visual novel with GxG romance elements set in a Ukrainian arts academy. Nina tries to keep the trouble at bay. But when a mysterious incident occurs at the academy, will she muster the courage to confront the things she\'s been running away from?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h4d.jpg'),(18330,'Dungeon Defenders: Going Rogue','2022-03-29','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Combining tower defense, action RPG, and roguelite gameplay into a crazy free-for-all, where it’s you and up to three friends versus hordes of enemies. Select your hero, survive the waves of foes, unlock new weapons and runes, and take on the bosses that await you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4l50.jpg'),(18331,'Tower of Whispers',NULL,'Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','Sin plataforma','The Tower of Whispers is a rogue-lite hack-and-slash dungeon crawler. Fight your way through the tower, with each floor more treacherous than the last, to harness its powers and unveil its secrets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8glm.jpg'),(18332,'Hack 7','2024-03-23','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gxf.jpg'),(18333,'Clandestine: The Hidden Truth',NULL,'Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Clandestine: The Hidden Truth\" is a first-person psychological horror game. Investigate a family homicide, manipulate reality with polaroids, and solve puzzles to unveil chilling secrets hidden within this enigmatic home of horrors. Will you come back unscathed?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7veb.jpg'),(18334,'Nothing_Matters','2023-06-30','Point-and-click, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short narrative \'point and click\' adventure inspired by the real life experience of a struggling solo indie game developer. A story about everything and hence nothing at all. Discover what truly matters to you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yxz.jpg'),(18335,'We Are Not Free','2021-12-21','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67m0.jpg'),(18336,'Breakout','2025-01-17','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A mini-roguelite boomer shooter FPS. Fight through over 70 procedurally linked combat arenas, upgrade your fighting abilities and destroy an ever increasing amount of enemy types.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9avy.jpg'),(18337,'Cazzarion','2020-01-16','Shooter, Adventure, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, Nintendo 3DS, Xbox One','Cazzarion is a shoot \'em up, space shooter. Galactic war in space and endless alien invader waves are waiting for you! You will be faced with an alien invader bullet storm. The increasingly large number of projectiles and enemies is a big challenge in this game. Blast the enemies with your laser weapon out from the space. Your ship have infinite ammo. Each time if you hit an enemy ship or an asteroid, you will get some points for your high score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co579s.jpg'),(18338,'Final Fantasy XV: Episode Ardyn','2019-03-26','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The final DLC for Final Fantasy XV.\nOriginally planned as the first of 4 new DLCs in a second Season Pass.\nEpisode Ardyn will have a short anime prologue released before the DLC to introduce the story leading up to it.\n\n\"EPISODE ARDYN offers players a chance to step into the role of FINAL FANTASY XV’s main antagonist. Set before the events of FINAL FANTASY XV, players will learn more about Ardyn’s backstory in a story of death and restoration.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1k3n.jpg'),(18339,'Life of Pixel','2013-01-09','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, PlayStation Vita','Life of Pixel is an epic platform adventure game, with amazing gameplay, fun characters, beautiful 8 & 16-bit aesthetics and a lot of heart.\n\nA retro delicacy dedicated to the brilliance of classic gaming machines and ground-breaking game favourites. You play as Pixel, the inquisitive little green hero on a quest to explore where pixels began life. Follow his journey through video game history by collecting the bit-gems and unlocking each amazing game machine. Collect the \'Specials\' and unlock more! Armed with awesome power-ups, Pixel must vanquish the enemy pixels and bosses who try to thwart him throughout his quest.\n\nWith over 100 fun packed levels of platforming goodness! Chock-full of tricks & traps, double jump challenges, gravity inversion, special power-ups, puzzles and loads of different enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86dz.jpg'),(18340,'Bureau of Contacts: Mansion',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18341,'Tamagotchi On: Fairy ver.','2019-07-28','Simulator','Handheld Electronic LCD','The Tamagotchi On is a color-screened Tamagotchi, released on November 23, 2018 in Japan, and in the USA on July 28, 2019. It is the successor to the Tamagotchi m!x, having similar functions but with new features and characters, and the first color-screen Tamagotchi to be released in North America.\nThe Fairy version was one of the first two released, it features exclusive access to Fairy Land, and therefore the only version where interacting with and marrying Fairytchi and Unipegasatchi is possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5y5c.jpg'),(18342,'Cities: Skylines - Green Cities','2019-01-31','Simulator, Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Cities: Skylines - Green Cities is a new expansion for the city-builder from Colossal Order, adding new ways for players to build earth-friendly towns. The expansion adds 350 new assets to the core game, adding a massive selection of new visual options, complete with eco-friendly buildings, organic shops, electric vehicles, and new services designed to make pollution a quaint notion of the past. Players can create more diversified cities, or go completely green as the urban population grows. New in-game services and buildings arrive alongside revisions to noise and environmental pollution, making the skies safer for Chirper at last.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yw7.jpg'),(18343,'10 Dead Doves','2024-12-13','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','10 Dead Doves is a single-player, fixed-perspective narrative horror set in the heart of Appalachia. Avoid strange noises, collect lifelines, and creep through a forest that seems to hate you. Will you discover why the birds drop dead -- or leave behind nothing but footprints?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95h8.jpg'),(18344,'Yukiguni no Shoujo',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','在雪地中奔跑的少女，二次元的画风，与激烈的雪战。 玩家创建一个角色，在一场战斗中采集雪球，与AI对战 这是一个.IO类游戏的雏形。目前还处于单机玩法验证阶段。欢迎体验。','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l6t.jpg'),(18345,'Little Goody Two Shoes: Deluxe Edition','2023-10-31','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take Little Goody Two Shoes’ music anywhere you go with the Deluxe Edition!\n\nThis bundle contains:\n- Little Goody Two Shoes - a fairy tale horror adventure game with a dark twist. Follow Elise, an ambitious girl determined to become rich and escape her humble life in the village of Kieferberg.\n- Official Soundtrack - The official soundtrack for Little Goody Two Shoes features 64 all-original tracks from the main game, including 3 unreleased bonus tracks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7j8m.jpg'),(18346,'Derelict Void','2021-03-18','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Derelict Void is a galactic roguelike city-builder involving scavenging for resources and base management. You command a ship and crew searching for resources you need to stay alive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v3m.jpg'),(18347,'Ikusa Megami Verita','2010-04-23','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The wandering God-Slayer Serika, who\'s still searching for his purpose. The half-demon king of Menfill, Loui, who just won the war, but lost his wife in it. This is the story of two infamous heroes and how their paths in life inevitably cross each other, and the conflict that it brings. While on the backdrop of the setting, various ancient forces rear their head and the temple of Marsterrie starts moving.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ygk.jpg'),(18348,'Bloom!','2015-01-29','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nk4.jpg'),(18349,'Space is Hard','2021-12-23','Adventure','Android','Turn based space combat\n\nLonely in space, others might not want you to be, so, fight it is...\nyou could say this is a game about apanthropy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oli.jpg'),(18350,'Kingdom Hearts HD 2.8 Final Chapter Prologue','2021-03-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Kingdom Hearts HD 2.8 Final Chapter Prologue is a compilation that brings the popular Kingdom Hearts [Dream Drop Distance] to the PlayStation4 computer entertainment system platform remastered in high definition.\n\nOriginally released in 2012, Kingdom Hearts [Dream Drop Distance] HD is a full-HD remastered version of Kingdom Hearts 3D [Dream Drop Distance]. Series protagonists Sora and Riku take on the Mark of Mastery exam in preparation for coming threats. The signature action of the Kingdom Hearts series has evolved, allowing players to experience faster-paced battles and exploration at a blistering pace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co312y.jpg'),(18351,'Let\'s Build a Dungeon',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Manage a game studio making the world’s greatest MMORPG. Hire designers, coders, and testers, create a fantasy world, then welcome hundreds of virtual players. If they get bored they will cancel their subscription and your investors will have your head. You can even play the game you create.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8plm.jpg'),(18352,'Fortune Lover Trial Version: Nicol Edition','2020-08-26','Visual Novel','Blu-ray Player','Included as a bonus disc in the Japanese My Next Life as a Villainess: All Routes Lead to Doom! Blu-ray Package Vol 4.\n\nA original Mini PC Game included in the Blu-ray releases of the My Next life as a Villainess: All Routes Lead to Doom! as a bonus disc. Each disc contains a 15-30 minute trial game, showing a preview of the events within the world of the original game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oj1.jpg'),(18353,'Cabals: Card Blitz','2016-10-21','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Build decks and fight auto-battles in Cabals: Card Blitz.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22ur.jpg'),(18354,'Badass Tennis','2021-06-01','Sport, Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','An explosively stylized casual sports game that invites you to blast the ball back and forth against either an AI player or a friend across the table in a unique single-touchscreen multiplayer experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55c2.jpg'),(18355,'Meow Nights','2021-01-31','Platform','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Two cats get lost on a magic and cloudy dungeon while looking for some delicious sky fish. They will have to find 5 fish each and then make their way towards each other, so they can go home and have a cozy sleepover.\n\nThere is a catch, however. The cats cannot see each other. For that reason, they have to follow their friend\'s \"meow\" ability so they make their way to the same room, after catching their share of snacks.\n\nOnce this happens, both cats must \"meow\" so they can free themselves from the cloudy dungeon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gc6.jpg'),(18356,'Massive Assault','2005-01-27','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Take the command of Free Nations Union forces and defeat the Phantom League on one of six distant planets. The rebels decided to seize the power on Earth by first conquering the space colonies, which provide vital energy resources to AOG. The war for global domination unrolls on continents, at sea, and in the air. With secret allies, you can disclose and provide troops at any moment, surprisingly shifting the power balance in a particular region. Lead your divisions, fleets, and air squadrons against those who dared threaten our freedom and democracy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ie0.jpg'),(18357,'Parkour Master','2021-01-01','Platform','Web browser','Parkour Master is a 3D platformer emulating a free-running environment. Players are challenged to complete eight levels and a tutorial as fast as possible, competing the in Parkour Masters tournament.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w55.jpg'),(18358,'Ice Queen Salon - Girls Makeup and Dressup Game','2015-12-03','Role-playing (RPG)','iOS','This is the fully unlocked version and it does not have advertisements! \n\nThe beautiful and powerful ice queen awaits you at her ice palace!\n\nThe kingdom expects their beloved ice queen to always look stylish and perfect. \nBut she is so busy with her royal duties, that she often runs out of fashion ideas.\nShe is delighted to have you as her guest, to help her dazzle her kingdom by dressing her in sparkling, icy dresses and fashion accessories.\n\nFeatures of this game:\n\n* 3 elegant and enchanting ice queens: Victoria, Seraphina and Aurora\n* 3 game sections: spa, makeup and dress up salon\n* Elegantly styled hair in various colors\n* Sparkly snowflake designs for dresses and capes\n* 12 majestic ice powers \n* 5 cute snowmen \n\nHow to play:\n* Choose your favorite character: Victoria, Seraphina or Aurora\n* Give her a facial at her palace spa\n* Do her makeup and then choose the best jewelry \n* Dress her up in glittery, enchanting gowns and icy capes\n* Select matching shoes, a wand and shimmery gloves\n* Choose the ice power she should use and which snowman should accompany her for the day\n\nToday you will experience the magic and adventure in the ice queen\'s kingdom!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/x5ge6fwmf2rophhtwjja.jpg'),(18359,'Balance',NULL,'Puzzle','Android, iOS','A puzzle game from Statnett.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nsq05tyyibpc43oh8evo.jpg'),(18360,'Brilliant Bob','2015-05-21','Platform, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Revel in a brilliant story, fast-paced puzzles and thrillingly designed levels in reportedly the first adventure of the action adventure platformer saga about Bob, a truly brilliant fellow from Sekotwana!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vfb.jpg'),(18361,'Killer Zombie Hunt','2020-09-04','Shooter','Android','Shoot all the zombies in a fantastic gloomy world. Discover the mysteries. The zombies you shoot will be reflected as a score in the right corner of the screen. Have nice hunts and have fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d7s.jpg'),(18362,'Screeps: Arena','2022-04-07','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Screeps Arena is a multiplayer strategy game for programming enthusiasts, wherein the core mechanic is programming your units AI. You write JavaScript that fights 24/7 against other players in a match-based arena environment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40vo.jpg'),(18363,'Untitled Ghost Game','2023-09-12','Music, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Free multiplayer 2D ghost hunting game that you can play with friends created by a small game dev team.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5phx.jpg'),(18364,'Terebi-denwa: Super Mario World','1992-12-31','Arcade','Arcade','A redemption game released by Banpresto which uses a telephone as input.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6q2o.jpg'),(18365,'Boing Noir',NULL,'Platform','Sin plataforma','Crimes, jazz and transcendental conversations with geometric figures await you','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j5x.jpg'),(18366,'Space Bunny','2023-03-19','Music, Indie','Web browser','A playable music video featuring Hatsune Miku. First in the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71lr.jpg'),(18367,'PhantomZone labyrinthos',NULL,'Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','”The nightmare that never allows waking lasts forever.” You wake up from bed and a girl appears before you. She calls herself “Entourfe,” a management support android. The stage is a strange facility, and you will explore the inside of the strange facility with her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h8z.jpg'),(18368,'Night Slashers X','2019-12-24','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Night Slashers X is a fan-made beat \'em up based on the Data East arcade classic Night Slashers, which sees four playable monster hunters fighting their way through hordes of the undead. Created in OpenBOR, the game features upgraded visuals, a widescreen mode and more enemies. The three original playable characters are present, each with their own unique move-sets, and now they’re joined by Ash from The Evil Dead. Ash can’t pick up and use weapons but he keeps the monsters at bay with his deadly boomstick and trademark arm-mounted chainsaw! With only 2 continues per playthrough, Night Slashers X is a tough game. Play with up to four players to aid your chances in this pixel-perfect retro throwback!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99e0.jpg'),(18369,'Black Wolves Saga: Last Hope','2012-12-20','Visual Novel','PlayStation Portable','Black Wolves Saga: Last Hope is a continuation of Bloody Nightmare focusing more on the historical aspect and Rath Vogart\'s past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zrs.jpg'),(18370,'Tenants','2019-05-13','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You are a mite that has to protect its home crossing the stage to reach the plug of a vacuum cleaner which is destroying your home and is menacing to take your family. Through the way you will find some obstacles, as holes through which you can be aspirated.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1y1k.jpg'),(18371,'Stream Spinners',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Stream Spinners is a twitch integrated game/tool that help you interact with your viewers, as you let the viewers battle it out in a spinning top battle royale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31a2.jpg'),(18372,'The Tower of TigerQiuQiu 2: Bomb M9',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','Put bomber to destroy all the enemy, find a door to escape the Maze. The DLC have full 8 mission.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18373,'Cuphead: Game and Watch Edition','2020-08-24','Platform','Web browser','Cuphead : Game And Watch Edition','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4upq.jpg'),(18374,'Dread X Collection 3','2020-10-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience 12 all-new spoopy games made in 10 days exclusively for this unique horror anthology. Explore a mysterious castle that changes as you play. Keep your wits about you as the line between cute and creepy begins to blur. Uncover the next chapter in the ongoing Dread X Collection storyline. Includes:\n\nBete Grise (Amon26)\nBubbo: Adventure on Geralds Island (Breogan Hackett)\nChip’s Tips (Torple Dook)\nDisparity of the Dead (Bryce Bucher)\nEDEN: Garden of the Faultless (Modus Interactive)\nMatter OVER Mind (Basalt Tower)\nNice Screams at the Funfair (Moya Horror)\nREACTOR (DIRIGO GAMES)\nSATO WONDERLAND (Nate Berens)\nSoul Waste (Blood Machine)\nSPOOKWARE @ The Video Store (Adam Pype & Viktor Kraus)\nSubmission (Corpsepile)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2iuk.jpg'),(18375,'Isabelle 64','2018-09-23','Platform','Nintendo 64','Isabelle 64 is a ROM hack/mod of Super Mario 64 starring Isabelle from Animal Crossing: New Leaf. Isabelle has a double jump, which diferentiates her from Mario and makes platforming easier, and there are graphical differences to match the Animal Crossing presentation (Stars are now Golden Leafs, for example).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g35.jpg'),(18376,'Puzzletown Mysteries','2025-04-23','Puzzle, Indie','iOS','Solve puzzles to help Lana and Barry investigate. Featuring hundreds of puzzle levels, dozens of beautifully digitally-painted locations, and a mind-boggling variety of minigames.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18377,'Tales of Vesperia: Definitive Edition','2019-01-11','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Tales of Vesperia: Definitive Edition is a remaster of the expanded Playstation 3 port of the original game, which was exclusive to Japan.\n\nDive into the definitive version of this game with updated full-HD graphics, brand-new music tracks, exciting mini-games, bosses and more!\n\nTwo more playable characters join the fray!\n- Patty Fleur, a cheerful and tough young pirate girl in search of treasure, adventure… and her forgotten memories.\n- Flynn Scifo, Yuri’s best friend and an Imperial Knight, now joins the rest on their journey!\n\nA power struggle begins in a civilization dependent on an ancient technology, the blastia, and the Empire that controls it. The fates of two friends traveling separate paths intertwine in an epic adventure that threatens the existence of all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gb5.jpg'),(18378,'N1RV Ann-A: Cyberpunk Bartender Action',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','\"Escape from VA11 HALL-A’s Glitch City to Saint Alicia, an idyllic tourist paradise with an upscale bar called N1RV Ann-A. But opulence and extravagance are merely smokescreens: the artificial island hides a seedy underbelly. Its dystopian economy touches all aspects of life as bar patrons contend with mafia extortion, human trafficking and other sordid crimes.\n\nFor bartender Sam, trouble hits close to home. Her relationship with her partner Leon, who moonlights as a Yakuza, is on the rocks as she works hard to care for their 8-year-old son, Tony.\n\nIs their relationship dead in the waters of the caribbean sea? Or will love prevail in the unnatural city?\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xvs.jpg'),(18379,'Paragon of Time','2025-04-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crush the darkness that is corrupting time itself. Wield mighty artifacts, forge legendary weapons, and conquer the horrors that seek to break you, in this roguelite, dark-fantasy adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o9c.jpg'),(18380,'Hisshou Pachinko: Pachi-Slot Kouryoku Series Vol. 9: CR Fever Captain Harlock',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18381,'I\'m on Observation Duty 7','2024-10-22','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The seventh installment of this beloved franchise presents you with six new levels, unique anomalies and insane intruders. As an employee of a mysterious organization your job is to monitor live surveillance camera footage and spot anomalies. Report any changes in the monitored rooms by clicking on the anomaly and selecting the type OR by choosing the right location and type of the anomaly from a menu to fix it. Anomalies appear at random so you never knows what is going to happen next. Too many active and unreported anomalies means death. Goal is to survive the entire night (from 00:00 to 06:00 in game time). You will need sharp eyes and good memory. The game contains psychological horror that mainly comes from making you paranoid about what has changed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xs6.jpg'),(18382,'Major Dream: Major Wii! Nagero Gyroball!!','2008-02-07','Sin género','Wii','Major Dream: Major Wii Nagero! Gyroball!! is a Sports game, developed by DreamFactory and published by Takara Tomy, which was released in Japan in 2008. Players can use the Wiimote to play and pitch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74v6.jpg'),(18383,'Andy Capp','1987-12-31','Fighting, Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC','Based on the comic strip of the same name from the British newspaper Daily Mirror and specifically released on Christmas of 1987. Andy has to acquire money to give to his wife from various sources, as he has already spent his unemployment benefit, while consuming as much alcohol as possible and avoid getting arrested for various crimes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7zek.jpg'),(18384,'Kingdom Tales','2020-12-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','An ancient prophecy proclaims… One day, the mighty dragons will seek new territory to claim as their own! The day has come! The prophecy has been fulfilled! Now, only the most courageous and just of leaders will be able forge a friendship between mankind and dragons! Step into the role of the steadfast and altruistic leader who\'s quests is to ensure the safety and prosperity of all people and creatures in the kingdom! In Kingdom Tales you will explore the land, gather, produce and trade resources, build and repair subjects’ homes and community structures, and work to increase your subjects’ level of happiness! Along your journey, you will meet druids, forest fairies, trolls, dragons and other exciting creatures while racing against the clock to complete tasks in this gorgeous and fun time management / strategy game!.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uw46euppi18ygosctkkm.jpg'),(18385,'Mother of All Battles!','1993-12-31','Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mother of All Battles is a turn-based strategy game where you build units to conquer the opponents\' cities.\n\nThe shareware version is restricted to one human and one computer player fighting on a small map at the easiest difficulty setting.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m2h.jpg'),(18386,'Four Eyes','2016-08-04','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Boy meets alien in a story-driven sci-fi adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5roc.jpg'),(18387,'Days Gone Remastered','2025-04-25','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 5','Ride into a desperate, dog-eat-dog world in the definitive Days Gone experience, remastered for the PlayStation5 console.\n\nFight to survive an environment ravaged by a deadly pandemic as former outlaw biker, Deacon St. John. Risk the threats of the Broken Road on the back of your trusty Drifter bike as you face terrifying hordes of relentless feral Freakers – as well as dangerous gangs of humans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e1e.jpg'),(18388,'Bergen Bridge Beginner 1','2017-06-01','Card & Board Game','Mac','This app is designed for less-experienced players. It provides 103 deals to declare and 12 to defend. All principles of playing a hand are explained. These include finessing, when not to draw trump first, counting winners and losers, communication etc.\n\nThe app provides an interactive approach to improve your game. When playing the deals, you will feel as if Marty Bergen is looking over your shoulder and giving you advice and tips to help you figure out the best line of play or the best defense. It is very instructive, and a must for everyone who is eager to learn more and play better.\n\nThis app is perfect for the bridge player who wants to improve his/her playing skills. When you are playing the deal but don’t play or defend perfectly, you will get a message explanation what you should have done. You also have the option to let the program ask you questions about the play. Every bridge player should ask these questions themselves before playing a card. By answering the questions you will learn the best approach. Once you are used to asking yourself these type of questions, you will have made a big step in improving your play and becoming a better opponent.\nThe bidding system is based on Standard American. However, the auction is always provided for you so this program is appropriate for all players.\n\nTo use the app, no internet connection is needed.\n\nAbout Marty Bergen\nMarty is a U.S. bridge teacher/player/author. He is a ten-time national champion and ACBL Grand Life Master and World Bridge Federation World International Master. He retired from active competition in 1993 to concentrate on teaching and writing. He was recently voted to be the 22 most influential person in the history of bridge.\nMarty has been a columnist in the monthly ACBL Bridge Bulletin since 1976. He has also written 69 bridge books; two of which won the ABTA Bridge Book of the Year award. Points Schmoints!: Bergen\'s Winning Bridge Secrets in 1996 and Declarer Play the Bergen Way in 2005.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/od1xg5e6qto3l3vdvtz5.jpg'),(18389,'Maldark: Conqueror of All Worlds','2012-01-24','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser','Maldark: Conqueror of All Words is a game where users can complete quests to level up. The game contains avatar creation to be able to play it. Each avatar has a special weapon to help them fight enemies and complete quests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4lex.jpg'),(18390,'Obludia','2014-07-18','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Obludia is an old-school arcade arena action inspired by classics such as Robotron or Smash-TV with RPG elements. You play as a demon hunter whose purpose is to survive in a dangerous dungeons. Fight your way through 50 levels full of thrilling action with hordes of challenging enemies and tough bosses. Enjoy mighty power-ups and deadly weapons!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qa7.jpg'),(18391,'Cgencore','2019-02-16','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become the Crypto Tycoon! The more you click, the richer you get. Your goal is to collect as much Crypto as you can, buy as much tech as you can and conquer the world!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18392,'Andria','2025-04-10','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Sci-fi First-Person-Shooter set on the Moons of Jupiter and Saturn. Scan the local alien creatures and robots to obtain technical data. Battle the guard robots and defeat the Master AI.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o9a.jpg'),(18393,'Piworld','2025-01-15','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','First pixel 2D game, which include MMO and PVP system for anyone, who wants to try something new.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8vh4.jpg'),(18394,'World Soccer Strikers\'91','2021-08-20','Sport, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','WSS\'91 is here! Welcome to the 90\'s, kid! Action and graphics on par with the arcades! Up to 8 players at the same time in your own living room! A huge bunch of teams (like, at least 40)! Game modes like tournaments, leagues & everything! What if we both pay for half and swap it every other week?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i2z.jpg'),(18395,'Otoko Yuukaku','2015-02-19','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','A remake of Gyakuten Yoshiwara featuring more CGs, voices, and longer scenarios. The remake also features a new character, Itou Keiji, who has a route.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5r89.jpg'),(18396,'Super Jacked Up Tomato Face Johnson','2022-05-29','Platform, Puzzle','Game Boy Color, Web browser','Super Jacked Up Tomato Face Johnson is a fast paced twitch platformer made for the Game Boy Color. There\'s a new protein shake fresh on the shelves and Tomato Face Johnson needs to bulk up! It\'s on the pricey side of course, but luckily, it\'s on sale for a limited time...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m9a.jpg'),(18397,'Zelda\'s Adventure','2023-04-19','Adventure','Game Boy','In the 1990s Nintendo made a deal with Philips to develop 3 Zelda titles. The first 2 were side scrolling platformers, similar to Zelda II, and the third was a traditional top-down action adventure game.\n\nZelda’s Adventure looked interesting and it would be fun to play on a portable system. The Game Boy was chosen because of the existing Zelda games on the system.\n\nThe game sticks to the aesthetics of Link’s Awakening, but also incorporates some features from Oracle of Ages and Oracle of Seasons.\n\nThis is a complete port of the CDi original and was developed in GB Studio, with a few modifications.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fxj.jpg'),(18398,'RC Rush','2021-10-08','Racing, Sport, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','RC Rush is an exciting arcade racing game featuring toy radio controlled cars. Win races to unlock career events, compete in head to head battles to unlock new vehicles, and level up your way to becoming the ultimate RC champion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co478e.jpg'),(18399,'Portal Runner','2001-09-11','Platform, Adventure','PlayStation 2','The characters from 3DO\'s popular ARMY MEN series have invaded the Game Boy Color! This time, you take control of Vikki Grimm as she battles the evil Brigitte Blue. Though you begin as a pint-sized plaything, you can eventually travel to worlds that are of an accommodating size over seven different locations. Each world contains numerous levels, resulting in 43 scenarios overall. Throughout your journey you\'ll come across swamps, dungeons, and even intergalactic spaceships. Each level progresses like typical a side-scrolling game, with plenty of action and adventure awaiting you. Some environments offer different weapons and enemies, and you\'ll even get the opportunity to commandeer a vehicle on some levels. For those with a penchant for exploration, there are even some hidden worlds to discover that offer even more amazing discoveries and challenges. Progress can be saved using a password system based on which levels have already been conquered. PORTAL RUNNER is a graphically impressive game for a portable system and it promises hours of gameplay, harrowing challenges, and an exciting story to follow.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co906r.jpg'),(18400,'Energy Hook','2016-07-04','Sport, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','From the inventor of the acclaimed web-swinging movement in *Spider-Man 2* comes the extreme sport of the future! Swing on a line of pure energy to perform death-defying stunts and insane parkour moves!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ocytxdw9c8lwzujyvgau.jpg'),(18401,'Road Rash','1994-07-01','Racing, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows), 3DO Interactive Multiplayer, Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Road Rash is the third entry in the vehicular combat/racing series of the same name. It was first released on 3DO Interactive Multiplayer in 1994, received a demake of sorts on the Sega CD in 1995, and then finally arrived to Sony PlayStation, Sega Saturn and Microsoft Windows in 1996. Not to be confused with the original 1991 title on Sega Genesis/Mega Drive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9anq.jpg'),(18402,'Russian Train Trip 2: Fast Time','2023-04-21','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Adds time acceleration to the game Russian Train Trip 2, to see all the content, all the train stations and not to spend 10 hours playing the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8shh.jpg'),(18403,'Garfield\'s Wild Ride','2014-07-09','Platform, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','In Garfield’s dreams, he can fly! Just touch the screen to take off and release to descend. Avoid obstacles and enemies to clear the various levels. On your way, collect coins and lasagna to help Garfield. With those, you will be able customize Garfield with fun accessories and add power-ups. Dive into this colorful cartoon world that everybody can enjoy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wxu.jpg'),(18404,'Iron Roses','2010-01-02','Music, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help Alex navigate a bustling urban landscape as she frantically searches for her former Iron Roses band mates and tries to convince them to enter the upcoming \"Battle of the Bands\". Track down lost equipment, interact with intriguing characters, and use all of your problem solving skills as you make the long, hard climb to the top!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/mszgv9jzhlbencqylevg.jpg'),(18405,'Gus & Stella\'s Stellar Adventure',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac','Help Gus find out where his family is, and who was behind the attack that left his ear bitten off. Craft, Climb, Solve Puzzles, Win Battles, and Get to know the Cats at the Kitten Intergalactic Taskforce station!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64dq.jpg'),(18406,'World Wide Hack','2021-12-22','Puzzle, Simulator, Indie','Web browser, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','World Wide Hack is an MMO simulation game about realistic hacking and cybersecurity. Collect the most effective sets of hacking and security tools, gather assets, and improve your computer to hack others, control parts of the network, or create the best websites and tools which will help other hackers and make you rich! Work with others to make your experimental activities useful for your faction and lead with them the world in the right direction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ho9.jpg'),(18407,'Arcane Quest Legends','2018-12-18','Role-playing (RPG)','Android','The Powers of Darkness have spread in the Real of Auria, you must forge your own destiny with this action packed RPG Hack & Slash and fight your way through endless hordes of orcs, undead, demons and all sorts of terrifying creatures.\n\nMerciless dungeon hunter or savior of the peace? Build your own legend, level up and create your character to match your favorite combat style. With no standard classes, your imagination is the only limit to grow the final warrior.\n\nComplete dozens of primary and side quests, entertain yourself with mini games to break the action, hire the best ally to participate in this great adventure.\n\nThe gameplay returns to the origins of the true hack & slash games. No auto combat or endless grinding, your own skills will determine your success. Face gigantic bosses to unveil the true nature of your hero!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90fq.jpg'),(18408,'Amane Switch','2021-10-05','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Is there truly such a thing...as a happy ending? Amane Switch is a visual novel game remake updated for international audiences. An adventure game themed around rain, yandere characters, and strange abnormalities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z2t.jpg'),(18409,'Mato Anomalies','2023-03-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Mato Anomalies is a turn-based RPG that takes players on a journey across Mato, a fantasized neo-futuristic version of a bygone oriental city. Take control of the Dual Protagonists Doe and Gram to investigate strange anomalies around the city, or venture into rifts to battle demonic abominations determined to bring about the city\'s downfall.\n\nTeam up with unlikely companions and unravel the dark secrets in this story of Duty, Hope and Justice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5krk.jpg'),(18410,'Age of War','2007-10-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Web browser, Android, iOS','In this game, you start at the caveman age, then evolve! There are a total of 5 ages, each with its own unique units and turrets. Can you advance faster than your enemy?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dx7.jpg'),(18411,'Pachinko Sexy Reaction 2','1999-12-31','Simulator','Arcade','The sequel to the Slot machine simulator featuring women who strip when you win.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/se1kxvktkynq8b3dd7m4.jpg'),(18412,'Tiger Tank 59 I: Winter Assault MP045',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','\"Tiger Tank 59 I Winter Assault\" is a top-down shooting gameIn this game. Players need to control their tanks, through the enemy lines, break the enemy base, or defeat the enemy tanks. The DLC include map pack 045.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18413,'Steep Town','2017-05-11','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A map for Doom 2 that was submitted to the Vinesauce Doom level contest. This version is much more fleshed out though.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18414,'Shiki Oni no Koku: Chuugoku-hen - Daiyonshou','1992-10-20','Adventure','PC-9800 Series','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co689z.jpg'),(18415,'Cryptigma','2025-04-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cryptigma is a top-down innovative puzzle game where you can move your own respawn point. Most levels have a respawn point, which can be pushed to maneuver your way around obstacles. With only a few mechanics, the puzzles get shockingly complicated. Push, die, and solve this great game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o8l.jpg'),(18416,'Order of Battle: Kriegsmarine','2017-04-20','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Kriegsmarine features 9 different scenarios and many new units featuring naval and air warfare, including several naval bombers and flying boats!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82zs.jpg'),(18417,'LOCKDOWN Protocol','2024-07-22','Shooter, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A first-person social deduction game, combining real-time action and communication, 3 to 8 players. While most players will do their best to complete objectives and ensure victory, a small portion of dissidents will try to stop them at all costs, without getting caught.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pnz.jpg'),(18418,'Disney\'s Kim Possible 2: Drakken\'s Demise','2006-03-10','Platform','Game Boy Advance','Kim Possible\'s new adventure leads her into battle with Falsetto Jones, Gemini, Duff Killigan, Shego, and Dr. Drakken in four intense episodes. In each new episode, Kim gains gadgets and acrobatic abilities that allow her to bounce up walls, judo-flip henchmen, reflect laser beams, and spray hot sauce to melt icy obstructions. If all else fails, you can engage her stealth suit and make her invisible to enemy eyes. Once Kim acquires new gadgets and abilities, you can then replay earlier levels to access areas that were previously unreachable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vyj.jpg'),(18419,'Story of a Cube','2016-03-04','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Story of a Cube is an action packed shooter about a lone cube and his quest for revenge. Mixing elements of twin-stick shooters and bullet hell games, this is a hardcore arcade game with a crazy amount of explosions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2264.jpg'),(18420,'Worldcraft','2020-02-02','Puzzle, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A short puzzle game about connecting dots.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co287f.jpg'),(18421,'The Backroom Project','2022-05-15','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scientists made a new discovery about the Backrooms. Noclipping out of bounds in normal reality was a myth for long, but now it can be reality! Now they are looking for subjects to test it on civil people. There are already scientists inside, so you have nothing to worry about, they say. Or do you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mxz.jpg'),(18422,'Fade','2025-04-06','Platform, Puzzle','Web browser','Fade is a 2D puzzle-platformer game where the player must alter the visibility and perception of their environment by changing its color.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rev.jpg'),(18423,'The Sims 4: Plus Island Living Bundle','2019-11-08','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Xbox One','Get The Sims 4 and The Sims 4: Island Living content in one great bundle! You\'re in control of creating unique Sims, effortlessly building their homes, and exploring vibrant worlds. Explore a breezy world drenched in sun, sand, and endless fun as your Sims make their own paradise. The Sims 4: Plus Island Living Bundle includes a copy of The Sims 4 and the expansion pack Island Living.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48nr.jpg'),(18424,'The Shattering: Secret Room','2021-04-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Shattering is presenting a mysterious Secret Room, a place filled with wonders and surprises. Discover a new environment, deleted content from the main game, developer commentary and many more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3duy.jpg'),(18425,'Digimon All-Star Rumble','2014-11-11','Fighting, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Xbox 360','Jam-packed with an all-star cast from the Digimon Universe, Digimon All-Star Rumble throws down with immersive 3D battle arenas and high-impact, in-your-face fighting action.\n\nAfter overcoming countless crises, the Digital World now exists peacefully once again. Although Digimon quarrel amongst themselves on occasion, the world as a whole is a peaceful place... perhaps too peaceful...\n\nThe incredible defenders of the Digital World have grown bored and peace brings no satisfaction. A world without chaos has extinguished the driving force behind their existence – to Digivolve. To pacify the growing unrest, a proposal was made... “Let us gather all Digimon who seek to Digivolve and hold a tournament to crown the strongest of them all!”\n\nAnd so began, the “Digimon Evolution Tournament.” A tournament of Digi-monumental proportions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zfg.jpg'),(18426,'Project Nightmares Case 36: Henrietta Kedward','2021-09-29','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Project Nightmares is a first person horror survival with a procedural structure of unique scares.\nConnected to a machine you will be induced to sleep to be part of this nightmare and discover the terrible story of Henrietta Kedward, an horrible old woman with a dark past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qbh.jpg'),(18427,'Knight Guy: The Curse of the Seriously Evil, Evil Doers',NULL,'Indie, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Knight Guy, is retro arcade game in development made lovingly with pixel art.\n\nKnight Guy will feature both an arcade and story mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/lysu3b2pdeuubsb8xufp.jpg'),(18428,'Warframe: The War Within','2016-11-12','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Grineer Empire grows stronger as a cryptic adversary surfaces. What secrets does the Grineer Empire keep? Underpowered, unprepared and forced out of your comfort, you must find it in yourself to improvise, not just to save yourself but the fate of all Tenno. The Queens\' Fortress awaits, where both Warframe and Operator will be pushed past their limits as they slowly unravel mysteries about the Tenno\'s past and their true capabilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qkm.jpg'),(18429,'Tetris: The Grand Master 4 - The Masters of Round',NULL,'Puzzle, Arcade','Arcade','Tetris: The Grand Master 4 - The Masters of Round, is an unreleased sequel to the TGM series created by Arika. It was announced in 2009 by Arika vice president Ichiro Mihara, and unveiled at Sega\'s Amusement Machine Show the same year.\n\nThe game\'s release has been in limbo, citing various problems reaching an agreement with publishers or The Tetris Company.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k36.jpg'),(18430,'Ultimate Apocalypse',NULL,'Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ultimate Apocalypse is a mod for Warhammer 40,000 Dawn of War: Soulstorm that increases the amount of playable factions and adds numerous units for each of the factions while also increasing the scale of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lx3.jpg'),(18431,'Mutant Football League: LA Power Pack',NULL,'Fighting, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Sport, Indie','Sin plataforma','The west is the best – well it was until the big one hit and left behind a burning city in ruins. Thankfully, the stadium survived, and 2 new west coast teams have risen out of the ashes to battle for Mayhem Bowl supremacy. This pack also includes a brand new mutant human species who is ready to unleash his fury on the league.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dr0.jpg'),(18432,'Slave Zero X','2024-02-21','Fighting, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Slave Zero X is a stylish 2.5D character action game set in the biopunk world of Slave Zero (1999). Run & Slash your way through a dystopian future in this character action game which will resonate with fans of Devil May Cry, Strider, and Guilty Gear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p1m.jpg'),(18433,'Trawler’s Empire','2025-04-10','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Build your fishing empire in this relaxing idle tycoon game. Upgrade your boat, explore new waters, catch rare fish, and earn profits—even while offline. Master the seas and grow your Trawler\'s Empire!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18434,'Static Hero','2017-02-05','Adventure','Android','Defend yourself against endless waves of monsters!  \nHow long can you survive ?  \n  \nStart a unique and exciting adventure slaying monsters, becoming stronger and stronger with each wave. Fight across multiple worlds where each has its own monsters. Customize your hero’s stats to experience a unique gameplay.  \n  \n★ Game features ★  \n- Endless waves of monsters  \n- Customize your hero’s stats  \n- Different worlds with a wide variety of monsters  \n- Unlock special upgrades for your hero  \n- Difficulty increases with each wave  \n- Ascend to become more powerful  \n  \n★ Incoming features ★  \n- Daily quests  \n- Skins for your hero  \n- Huge bosses  \n- More worlds and monsters  \n- More skills  \n- Cloud save  \n- Any awesome idea you have!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xbxchmlthh3bjfbrq8q1.jpg'),(18435,'Why Jump','2025-04-29','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Why Jump? Because the only way is up. Why Jump is a vertical platformer where one wrong move can cost you — but don\'t worry, there are checkpoints to catch your breath. Sometimes. Test your patience, sharpen your skills, and see how high you can climb.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rfe.jpg'),(18436,'MemoRemovers','2025-04-30','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','With a sharp eye, and keen memory you will navigate 5 distinct levels that change around you. Report what happened and where with the handy reporting panel before the changes have a chance to pile up. Can you last until the timer runs out?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rfn.jpg'),(18437,'Nairi: Rising Tide','2024-11-14','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The story continues in the highly anticipated second chapter of NAIRI. In this graphic adventure, Nairi pushes onward on a perilous quest to save her family, leaving the Tower of Shirin\'s grimy slums behind in this exciting all-new sequel!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pzj.jpg'),(18438,'Papu Superstars Racing',NULL,'Racing, Sport, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Papu Superstars is a Free to Play Game where you can play with the characters of the NFT Collections you own, and compete representing your favourite community. A fun, polished and accessible gaming experience for any kind of player, with speed, Drift & Boost, Power-ups, dynamic circuits... The perfect combination and balance to guarantee that both casual and hardcore players can enjoy every second!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p13.jpg'),(18439,'Don\'t Fall','2020-06-03','Fighting, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Don\'t Fall is a third-person action multiplayer game where 8 players are put on a shrinking island. As more tiles fall and crumble, the island becomes ever smaller, and your risk of falling becomes ever higher. Pick up powerful weapons, and knock the enemies into the abyss. Become the last man standing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2iyn.jpg'),(18440,'Akita Oga Mystery Annai: Kogoeru Ginreika','2021-01-04','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The second retro-style travel mystery adventure! This game is a suspense command ADV set in Akita\'s Oga region in Japan.The character designer is a manga artist Kiyokazu Arai, following his previous work \"Iseshima Mystery Annai\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4zmb.jpg'),(18441,'Cyber Hamster Tilt','2022-05-14','Puzzle, Indie','Android, Playdate','Cyber Hamster toys have gone rogue at the ConnecToys factory. Suzie is called in to put a stop to it. Tilt your phone to help Suzie navigate a maze of rooms through the factory, avoiding contact with the Cyber Hamsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b6v.jpg'),(18442,'Survive Society','2025-02-12','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survival game in which players try to survive in a society.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kc7.jpg'),(18443,'Home Mahjong','1984-12-31','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','SG-1000','Mahjong is a game that originated in China. It is commonly played by four players (with some three-player variations found in South Korea and Japan). Mahjong is a game of skill, strategy, and calculation and involves a degree of chance. The game is played with a set of 144 tiles based on Chinese characters and symbols, although some regional variations use a different number of tiles. In most variations, each player begins by receiving 13 tiles. In turn players draw and discard tiles until they complete a legal hand using the 14th drawn tile to form four groups (melds) and a pair (head). There are fairly standard rules about how a piece is drawn, stolen from another player and thus melded, the use of simples (numbered tiles) and honours (winds and dragons), the kinds of melds, and the order of dealing and play. However there are many regional variations in the rules; in addition, the scoring system and the minimum hand necessary to win varies significantly based on the local rules being used. This game is the digital rendition of Mahjong.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e8b.jpg'),(18444,'Cerulean','2016-04-12','Adventure, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A short visual novel about home and friendship.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27jo.jpg'),(18445,'Playing With Fire 2','2006-12-31','Arcade','Web browser','Select the number of players and level to start the game. Blow up your opponents using bombs before they manage to kill you. Destroy blocks to leave behind power-ups which will give you special abilities when picked up. Each player has three lives so they will need to be killed three times to be eliminated. There is a 3-minute time limit in place. If you win a game, you will score the number of seconds remaining on the timer multiplied by 250, times the number of opponents in the game. Losing a game will result in that amount of points being subtracted from your score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co657g.jpg'),(18446,'Pathfinder: Wrath of the Righteous - The Last Sarkorians','2023-03-07','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Nintendo Switch','The nation of Sarkoris was destroyed by the demons, yet the last of its people are ready to fight back. Meet Ulbrig Olesk, a Sarkorian shifter capable of turning into a mighty griffon. Explore a new region, fight new enemies... And maybe even find new love!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co612u.jpg'),(18447,'Obscured Stories: The Resentment','2025-05-02','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Resentment is a psychological horror game that follows Lisa Parker through a traumatic event.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rfp.jpg'),(18448,'Surveillance Work','2024-02-02','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Surveillance Work is a horror spot-the-difference game where you monitor surveillance camera footage to discover and report anomalies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7plw.jpg'),(18449,'Taking Root','2024-04-26','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Taking Root is a cosy game about caring for houseplants and watching them thrive. Care for your houseplants in real time in this realistic simulation game and create your own urban jungle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zfa.jpg'),(18450,'The Dark West',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Dark West is a grim ARPG reimagining the genre with deep player agency, innovative systems, and and a fresh take on player progression. We\'re crafting an experience that blends cutting-edge gameplay within an engaging and immersive world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kkk.jpg'),(18451,'Lenin - The Lion','2019-09-27','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lenin – The Lion is a Puzzle RPG game about depression and overcoming. Walk into chaos and find the evils of depression or carefully build your path and find the benefits of understanding and acceptance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2izo.jpg'),(18452,'Blades of Fire','2025-05-22','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Introducing Blades of Fire, an all-new action adventure that takes you across a beautiful world full of uncertainty and challenge. You take on the role of Aran de Lira, firstborn of the King’s Ward. The newly crowned Queen Nerea has cast a powerful spell that turns steel into stone and only her arms of abominations wield the divine metal against which other blades shatter…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9gvk.jpg'),(18453,'Cozy Space Survivors','2024-05-03','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A cozy time survival roguelite in space. You steer the shippy while the shooting happens automatically. Meet cute NPCs, solve small quests, and fight quirky enemies with satisfying weapons. A short experience for people who don\'t have much time but love playing (and finishing) games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co865e.jpg'),(18454,'Kinect Adventures','2010-11-04','Sport, Adventure','Xbox 360','Kinect Adventures! is a sports video game released by Microsoft Game Studios for the Xbox 360. Released in 2010, it is a collection of five adventure and sports minigames and was developed by Good Science Studio, a subsidiary of Microsoft Game Studios. The game utilizes the Kinect motion camera and was offered as a pack-in game with the console. It was officially unveiled at the 2010 Electronic Entertainment Expo in Los Angeles and went on to become the best selling game on the Xbox 360, selling 24 million units worldwide.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22p6.jpg'),(18455,'Supercross','2000-12-21','Racing, Simulator','PlayStation','Supercross features a more action-oriented style of gameplay. Tricks are smoother and may come a little more easily, but players will still have to hold the right line and perfect their timing if they\'re going to be real contenders in the Motocross circuit. Players will race through several indoor and outdoor tracks in this dirt bike simulation from EA SPORTS, and a freestyle mode is available as well, offering a perfect track for maximum air and wild tricks. \n \nThe most notable change in Supercross is that EA opted to go with a more arcade-styled control scheme this time around. While this may come as a disappointment to gamers looking for the ultimate motocross sim, fact of the matter is, they tried the more realistic approach in the last game and it did not work well. Besides, with this game\'s new hold-the-accelerator-and-don\'t-let-go approach, gamers will get a better sense of the speed they would experience in they actually participated in a motocross event. \n \nThe game is known in usa as Supercross 2001','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/j0aa3v1py5tsovk54ec8.jpg'),(18456,'Mighty Mouse Cheese Hunt','2025-03-01','Platform, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18457,'Motu Patlu Kung Fu Kings','2023-05-22','Sin género','Android','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94xk.jpg'),(18458,'Interstellar Space: Genesis - Terrains Pack','2024-01-30','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Terrains Pack includes 2 new terrains for each of the 7 different biomes (Terran, Desert, Lava, Acid, Ice, Swamp and Barren), for a total of 14 completely new and unique 3D terrains.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87h6.jpg'),(18459,'Quiz Thiz Spain','2023-02-04','Quiz/Trivia','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Are you the new quiz master and can you beat your friends on this quiz? Answer questions about this country and collect valuable points! Also, learn new facts about this country while playing!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co62r8.jpg'),(18460,'Titan Quest: Eternal Embers','2021-12-03','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Summoned by the legendary Emperor Yao, the Hero is called back into the East to deal with a demonic threat that has been ravaging the land after the Telkine was slain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fj0.jpg'),(18461,'Misty\'s Super Golf Solitaire','2025-04-10','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Misty\'s Super Golf Solitaire is a Golf Solitaire variant with deck-building. Earn gold coins to buy unique cards to maintain your winning streak while you aim for the highest rank. Features classical music and turn-of-the-century-inspired backgrounds all in a nostalgic 16-bit style.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18462,'School Simulator','2017-09-10','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Make you feel good in the school! Try what would it be like if you could do anything in the school break. Crush! Don’t kid yourself. Break out from the roll of eager beaver! You don’t have to worry about thing, just do it!The school is full of movable objects, just grab them and throw them to your schoolmates, but don’t delay, because they are ready!If they hit you, it will be difficult to stand up, so be careful! The targeting line will help you to throw accurate.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18463,'Saints Row: Festive Felonies Cosmetic Pack',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A life of crime doesn\'t stop for the Holidays! Sprinkle some seasonal cheer on your illegal activities with the Festive Felonies FREE Cosmetic Pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zql.jpg'),(18464,'Repentant','2018-08-09','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The game is a dramatic point&click adventure about a criminal who is trying to atone for the sins of his past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r4h.jpg'),(18465,'Astro Universe','2021-12-24','Fighting, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Astro Universe is a futuristic survival game where you have to visit and explore other planets! If you want, you can even make these planets habitable with the most modern technology or you can completely mine and use them for ores and other resources!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kgx.jpg'),(18466,'Pipework','2023-12-23','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Researchers discovered an enigmatic fluid resembling water in an unexplored and unfamiliar region. Successfully obtaining a substantial sample, they now aim to transport it beyond the immediate unusual locale. Your task is to navigate its journey to various laboratories worldwide, ensuring its safety by protecting it from any potential adverse reactions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7oal.jpg'),(18467,'Cardpocalypse','2019-12-12','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Cardpocalypse is a single-player card game where you change the cards and the rules as you play, delivered within a charming school-based narrative.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uqu.jpg'),(18468,'Bahnsen Knights','2023-12-14','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','1986, Tornado Alley, USA… Go undercover as Boulder, an agent infiltrating the notorious religious cult known as the Bahnsen Knights. Face off against occultists, biblical storms, and an enigmatic car salesman turned preacher as you investigate the disappearance of a fellow agent and close friend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77cj.jpg'),(18469,'Sick Way','2019-12-10','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sick Way is an adventure horror game that takes place in the small town of Grootlin. You play as an ordinary person who works in a factory. But suddenly something went wrong ...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co413e.jpg'),(18470,'Dino Mercs','2024-03-12','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','DINO MERCS is a roguelike deckbuilding game where you take on the role of a veteran member of Dark Solar Defense, a shadowy private military corporation. To survive, build multiple decks while conducting operations, engaging in fierce combat, and defending your base from attackers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5gwg.jpg'),(18471,'Kawaii Neko Girls 2','2023-03-06','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kawaii Neko Girls 2 - It\'s a relaxing anime puzzle game with cute kawaii hentai neko girls. Solve puzzles and collect all the pictures. Enjoy high quality artwork.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xxj.jpg'),(18472,'Cyrano Story','2020-04-16','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Born from an Alternate Reality Game experience created by Alice & Smith in 2019, Cyrano Story is a complex puzzle game designed to ascend to intergalactic forces and give insight into the backstory of Funcom’s cosmic horror game Moons of Madness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dq7.jpg'),(18473,'Within the Cosmos','2025-03-28','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Within the Cosmos is a single-player first-person sci-fi RPG. You awaken from cryogenic sleep, and shortly after, you and your crew get attacked by an unknown enemy. As you explore multiple planets to try to find answers, your choices and actions will determine how the story unfolds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8p03.jpg'),(18474,'Disney Classic Games: Aladdin, The Lion King and The Jungle Book',NULL,'Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Disney Classic Games Collection: Aladdin, The Lion King and The Jungle Book is a special collection for consoles and PC. Combining the retro action from fan-favorite 16-bit versions with new graphical enhancements, features and content, the Disney Classic Games Collection offers fans of old school gaming and classic Disney characters the best of both worlds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7a0m.jpg'),(18475,'Where\'s Samantha?','2021-08-19','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Your true love, Samantha, has vanished! You\'ll need to travel a strange realm fraught with traps and puzzles and collectibles in order to find her. Lost love, perilous obstacles, and wool - the cornerstones of any great adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wdl.jpg'),(18476,'Vector Strain','2015-12-09','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Addictive fast-paced shoot-em-up with beautiful 3D graphics and an amazing soundtrack. 5 ships to choose from and 5 action-packed Stages.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ius.jpg'),(18477,'Revenant Saga','2017-04-06','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Wii U, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Become a Revenant and find the truth beyond revenge in this gothic fantasy RPG with stunning 3D battles! Boasting a story that blurs the lines between good and evil, a refined 3D battle system, and plenty of content to go around, this is one title not to be missed!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co249a.jpg'),(18478,'Toribash Next','2024-01-24','Fighting, Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Toribash Next is the sequel to Toribash, a turn-based sandbox fighting game. Toribash allows players to create their own moves during a match, using 3D physics tools. Toribash Next features weapons, four-player battles and a new replay editor, plus more customization and modding options.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7odx.jpg'),(18479,'The Acorn Bounty','2024-12-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Help Samson the Squirrel battle his way through peril, as he tracks down what was ruthlessly stolen from him. Adventure through the forest battling your way through a variety of critters, unlocking cosmetic hats, completing the beastiary, and claiming what\'s rightfully yours.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91ua.jpg'),(18480,'Super Mario World Widescreen','2021-06-25','Platform','Super Nintendo Entertainment System','Super Mario World Widescreen is an Improvement ROM hack/mod for Super Mario World (SNES) to use together with a specific emulator (bsnes-hd-beta) which makes Super Mario World work in widescreen, adapting the whole game engine to be able to work with widescreen and ultra-widescreen resolutions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qbk.jpg'),(18481,'Milanoir','2018-06-08','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Inspired by the Italian crime flicks of the \'70s revered by Quentin Tarantino, Milanoir is a pixel-packed action game set in the violent city of Milan. Come meet Piero, a convict suddenly released from prison looking for revenge over the man who framed him. Hunt for the truth and escape the ones who are chasing you through an unforgiving city. Someone wants you dead: you have to use all your toughness to survive. Shoot, choke, sneak your way through the enemies and engage them in breathtaking car chases.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3od7.jpg'),(18482,'Corpse Party: Book of Shadows','2013-12-17','Point-and-click, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation Portable','Corpse Party: Book of Shadows is a survival horror adventure game and the sequel to Corpse party BloodCovered: ...Repeated Fear. Corpse Party: Book of Shadows adds new twists and backgrounds for the characters who were barely touched upon in Corpse Party and mostly plays as a prequel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nie.jpg'),(18483,'The Rake: Rust Dead Survival','2017-08-04','Shooter, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','After you successfully defeated Jeff The Killer\nand Slender Man,\nyou are ready for your next mission!\nHunt down and kill The Rake.\nFind 8 Rake Voodoo dolls.\nLock and load! Revenge is MY NAME!\n\nFind 8 Voodoo Dolls and Kill The Rake.\nGood Luck!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cpj.jpg'),(18484,'Biorhythm','2019-08-23','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In Biorhythm, you play as lonely bacteria, lost in the human bloodstream. explore, fight, and uncover the mystery of your new home to the beat of the heart.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2shh.jpg'),(18485,'Lost in Random: The Eternal Die','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Lost in Random: The Eternal Die is an action-packed, rogue-lite adventure in the world of Random. Play as Queen Aleksandra and wield her living die-companion Fortune, as they go all in against the ancient evil that took everything from her.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9e69.jpg'),(18486,'Enthralled','2024-10-29','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Enthralled\" is a short game about a man possessed by a demon. It takes place in a desolate world where you balance between looking for a way out, stopping the demon from killing innocent people, and not being completely devoured yourself. Explore the world and find a way to deal with your curse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p9a.jpg'),(18487,'The Mayor of Sanctuary','2023-12-15','Adventure','Game Boy Color, Game Boy','As Yuu, the former mayor of Anzen, you had hoped for a quiet retirement away from the hustle of civic life. However, the peace you sought is shattered when a wave of cursed spirits begin to emerge from the once tranquil forests of Sanctuary. It is now up to you to return to Anzen and connect with its inhabitants to unravel the mysteries behind the unrest.\n\nWill you be able to uncover the sinister forces that lie beneath and restore harmony to Anzen?\n\nEmbark on a journey of casual exploration through a large unique map, brimming with charming characters and captivating scenery. This leisurely experience offers mild combat, light puzzles, and hidden secrets waiting to be discovered.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v8l.jpg'),(18488,'Streets of Rogue: Character Pack','2020-12-28','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','Nintendo Switch','Complete your collection of playable characters with these six new classes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3duk.jpg'),(18489,'No Mario\'s Sky','2016-08-30','Platform, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Crossover of Super Mario Bros. and No Man\'s Sky. It was originally created for Ludum Dare, but was later expanded into DMCA\'s Sky. It was taken down by Nintendo in its original form.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pyx.jpg'),(18490,'Necrofugitive',NULL,'Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Necrofugitive is a brutal 2D action platformer about the prison escape of an evil shapeshifter and his attempts to evade the realm\'s justice. Experience fast paced combat and intense fight or flight decisions as you are pursued by lawmen and merciless bounty hunters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q0w.jpg'),(18491,'Doorms','2025-05-01','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re trapped in a strange communal apartment with no escape. The only way forward is by elevator, but it has only two buttons. Each correct choice brings you closer, but every mistake sends you back to the start.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rfb.jpg'),(18492,'Revenants','2021-12-31','Shooter, Puzzle, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','Windows Mixed Reality, SteamVR','Become a professional occult investigator, relying on your cutting edge technology from 2030 to locate, trap and battle demonic forces, all whilst solving the mystery of the occult crimes.\n\nYou\'ll need a sharp eye to locate evidence throughout each case, documenting all you can find with your camera whilst you explore the abandoned crime scenes. As a professional investigator, you\'ll also need to put the case together, connecting the dots and discovering who the culprits were.\n\nChoose which technology you want to take on each case. Do you want to hunt down the revenant and trap it? Or set up surveillance and sensors so you can stay away from it. Either way, you\'ll always have your trusty tablet at your side, allowing you to picture any evidence you find and keep demonic forces at bay.\n\nThis is no regular camera, the Pentacam was built using ancient ritual magics. The demons should be afraid of you as you charge up the Pentacam and manifest them further with each shot. Until they are eventually captured within the device.\n\nRevenants will be released in an episodic / case structure. With the base game containing the first case, and the next cases being released as they are developed as DLC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bej.jpg'),(18493,'DarkTimes','2024-07-18','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','DarkTimes is a twin-stick shooter with a twist: you can shoot in multiple directions at the same time! Embody the monster huntress Anne and Friend, her mystical Raven, in a quest to find her missing son, set in an alternative, distorted version of 1880\'s Louisiana.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ulx.jpg'),(18494,'Commander Nuke','2021-12-31','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18495,'Hit n\' Bit',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A dark fantasy Metroidvania platformer. Embark on two different journeys where you will fight monsters, explore a story-rich world, and encounter challenging puzzles. Reunite the royal siblings, defy the machinations of old gods, and redefine destiny.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cw0.jpg'),(18496,'Fantasy Quest Realm Survival','2025-04-10','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hunt monsters, collect crystals, stay alive in a mystical realm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o8q.jpg'),(18497,'Europa Universalis IV: Domination','2023-04-18','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Revisit some of the most powerful and popular nations in EUIV Domination. This Expansion Pack offers new mission trees, new government reforms, new estate management and new events for several of the major powers in the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68ky.jpg'),(18498,'Silt','2022-06-01','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','An underwater exploration game: Explore the depths of a surreal, hand-drawn abyss. Possess sea creatures and make use of their unique abilities to solve environmental puzzles, traveling ever deeper into the void…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39tu.jpg'),(18499,'OA Family','2023-09-19','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','OA Family, a game with learning and relaxation. The main system of the game is to bring the popular English vocabulary game Hangman to do in a player-friendly format with a helper.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7114.jpg'),(18500,'Sleengster 2','2017-02-24','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Years have passed since our hero Sleengster has defeated the Tikkirama for the first time. But the enemy is regrouping. \n \nBetrayal and anger has led to the regrowth of the Tikkirama Organisation and all Sleengpeople are in danger.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1jzr.jpg'),(18501,'Bases Loaded','2014-07-10','Sport','Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Family Computer, Wii U, Nintendo Entertainment System','Bases Loaded is a baseball game that was released for Arcade and the Nintendo Entertainment System in 1987. It was developed by Jaleco and TOSE, and was the first installment in the Bases Loaded series, which was followed by seven sequels for three generations of consoles. The game tried to focus on the confrontation between the pitcher and the batter, putting emphasis on the face-off between the two. Unfortunately, this made the perspective fairly limited in determining where to hit the ball, or even where the ball was during a pitch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v2o.jpg'),(18502,'Onmitsu Kiritan','2020-05-05','Platform, Adventure, Indie','Web browser','A covert action game featuring Kiritan, a character supporting the Tohoku region.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v8r.jpg'),(18503,'Ne no Kami: The Two Princess Knights of Kyoto','2016-10-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','“Len, you are going to abandon this town... and die—today” Since her reunion with Shinonome, Len\'s life is thrust into an all new “reality,” and the curtain which hid the “truth” of this new world is been lifted. Len and Shinonome must tempt fate and face a world in which reality is all but blurred, as the truth of this world comes to light.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q1a.jpg'),(18504,'It\'s a Gas!','2003-12-31','Sin género','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94w9.jpg'),(18505,'Polymega Collection Vol. 9: Strikers 1945','2025-05-02','Shooter, Arcade','Polymega','Get ready for nonstop aerial action with the Strikers 1945 Collection, an officially licensed compilation of PSIKYO’s iconic vertical shoot-’em-ups. This definitive set includes the original arcade versions of Strikers 1945, Strikers 1945 II, and Strikers 1945 III, as well as their home console releases for PS1 and Saturn. Experience intense bullet-hell combat, retro visuals, and the unique fusion of historical and sci-fi themes that made these titles arcade legends.\n\nThis collection also includes a lineup of classic shoot-’em-ups from Jaleco: P-47: The Phantom Fighter, P-47 Aces, Desert War, and D-Day. Dive into high-speed military action across multiple theaters of war, adding even more explosive variety to this must-have package for retro shooter fans.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rel.jpg'),(18506,'Orc Warchief: Strategy City Builder','2025-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become an Orc warchief and fight for survival of your race. Rebuild your village and train your warriors. Gather resources and craft your weapons. Raise your warbanner and gather The Horde.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ro6.jpg'),(18507,'Spider-Man 2: Web of Words','2004-12-31','Quiz/Trivia','Web browser','Spell your way to victory in the Spider-Man 2: Web of Words game! Help Spidey climb buildings and defeat Doc Ock with your fantastic vocabulary.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9msd.jpg'),(18508,'Hjem','2019-02-01','Music, Puzzle','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','▷ SURROUND YOURSELF ◁\n▷ FOLLOW THE BE△T ◁\n▷ △▽OID DESTRUCTION ◁\n\n▷ HE△DPHONES △D▽ISED ◁\nMade for #GGJ19','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1x5b.jpg'),(18509,'The Leisure of Grisaia','2015-10-23','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This side story to \"The Fruit of Grisaia\" is a character-driven visual novel featuring some of the same characters. This time, it\'s Michiru who takes the lead role in this slapstick comedy. A laugh-out-loud side story detailing the Mihama girls\' school hijinks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27uz.jpg'),(18510,'Christmas: Dark Side','2024-01-15','Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','This Christmas story is not as usual. Yes, there is the Santa Claus, his reindeer and gifts for children. But these are not at all the gifts that a child expects for Christmas. And you can\'t even imagine what awaits you that night!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qn4.jpg'),(18511,'Radio Viscera','2021-07-13','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Radio Viscera is a fast-paced top down shooter without bullets. Hurl enemies into brutal traps and blast your way through walls with your air cannon, in this bloody, arcade action game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b2q.jpg'),(18512,'Metro: Last Light - Limited Edition','2013-12-31','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Metro: Last Light (also known as Metro 2033: A Light of Hope in Russia) is a single-player post-apocalyptic-themed first-person shooter video game with stealth and survival horror elements, developed by Ukrainian studio 4A Games and published by Deep Silver for Microsoft Windows, OS X, Linux, PlayStation 3 and Xbox 360 in May 2013. PlayStation 4 and Xbox One versions of the game were released August 26, 2014. \n \nThe game is set in a post-apocalyptic Moscow, part of the universe of the novel Metro 2033 and its sequels, written by Russian author Dmitry Glukhovsky, but does not follow any direct storylines from the books. Previously announced as Metro 2034, the game is a sequel to the video game Metro 2033, and although Glukhovsky did work with developer 4A Games, it bears no relation to the book Metro 2034. Rumors on his website point to the upcoming book, Metro 2035, to be a novelization of Metro: Last Light, but it will cover the plot and dialogue in much greater detail and length. \n \nInitially, the game was to be published under THQ and expected to be released in the middle of 2012; it was announced on February 2, 2012, that the game would be delayed until the first quarter of 2013, and on March 1, 2013 the game was delayed again until May. Following THQ\'s closure in January 2013, the intellectual property was acquired by video game publisher Deep Silver. \n \nMetro: Last Light received positive reviews from critics. Praise was directed at the game\'s story (including its atmosphere, presentation, and environments), graphics (especially on Microsoft Windows, PlayStation 4, and Xbox One), and the improvements made over Metro 2033 (such as the controls, gunplay, sound, and stealth mechanics). The game did, however, draw some criticism for its linear sequences, AI, and technical issues.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/frf6syzr0hhe8qjp2rui.jpg'),(18513,'Gradius II: Gofer no Yabou','2008-10-20','Shooter','Wii, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, Turbografx-16/PC Engine CD','The PC-Engine port of Gradius II: Gofer no Yabou.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52qy.jpg'),(18514,'Tropico 6: Return to Nature','2025-03-06','Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','“Penultimo, where are you? – I can’t find my registration for that ‘Forest Bathing for Beginners’ course!” Something seems a bit off with El Presidente today… and you might be right if you suspect Sunny Flowers has got something to do with this!\n\nEl Prez is branching out: In Tropico 6 – Return to Nature you will reap the benefits of nature with the help of a mysterious new world wonder – the Biggdrasil – as well as blooming new buildings. Well, there we are – sounds much more like El Prez, right? From Forest Schools to Tree Houses and the Beekeeper you’ll cultivate the green side of dictatorship like never before!\n\nTreehugger’s Paradise: In Tropico 6 – Return to Nature you build your way to a greener Tropico with 15 new buildings, including Forest Schools, Tree Houses and the iconic Biggdrasil – the island’s first homegrown world wonder and the first one you can customize.\n\n‘El Árbol De Maravilla’: Play through a new scenario, designed to help you find your way to get the most out of nature’s abundance. The scenario map is also available for you to tinker around in sandbox mode.\n\nMake Tropico Green Again: Flex your power with 3 new edicts like ‘Reforestation’, ‘Natural Reaction’ and ‘Tropical Paradise’ edicts – because you care.\n\nNo Greens, No Glory: Introducing the new ‘Nature’ value, a fresh, not to say organic, metric that works similar to the ‘Beauty’ value. Keep it high and revel in the ‘harvest’ from your new buildings.\n\nImpress Sunny Flowers: Spruce up your style with your new Nature Suit and adorn your palace garden with one of 4 scenic Biggdrasil statues.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i92.jpg'),(18515,'Crazy Machines 1.5 New from the Lab','2005-10-01','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Create Your Own Zany \"Rube Goldberg\" Devices! Go crazy with over 200 brand new gizmo-twisting\' levels! Enjoy all-new elements, music, backgrounds and more. Start off in the Inventor\'s Training Camp to sharpen your skills.\nGet ready for explosive action and building fun using 100 awesome & wacky parts  including bottle rockets, cannons, bombs, and robots.\nThe Ultimate Brain-Teasing Puzzle Game! Continuing the fun, but not including puzzles from Crazy Machines: The Wacky Contraptions Game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b6e.jpg'),(18516,'Flappy Monkey','2014-06-20','Sin género','Xbox 360','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94wx.jpg'),(18517,'Strikers 1945','2022-06-29','Shooter, Simulator, Arcade','Arcade, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Sega Saturn, PlayStation, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In 1945, the second world war ended. Soon, there was peace, but an organization of high-ranking military officers from all over the world form a global army known as CANY. Their mission was to conquer the world. CANY activity was found in areas like the Soviet Union, America, Japan, and even Germany. It is revealed that CANY had weapons never seen before from rockets to mechanical walkers. The world quickly formed a group of pilots and planes called the Strikers whose mission is to rid of CANY from the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23je.jpg'),(18518,'V Rising: Founder\'s Pack - Eldest Bloodline','2022-05-17','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This pack has been created for those who want to show off some extra love for V Rising and kindly wish to support the game further. The Founder’s Pack: Eldest Bloodline rewards your support by unlocking exclusive items that will make you stand out on your vampire journey. Get three legendary shapeshift skins, exclusive castle customizations, the original soundtrack, and a bunch of great accessories to take your dark elegance to the next level.\n\nThe Founder’s Pack: Eldest Bloodline contains a shapeshifting variant for the bear, human and wolf forms, 27 Gargoyle Statues with 3 shared variant types, 6 Gargoyle Ornaments to hang off your pillars, 16 Vampire Accessories to enhance your vampiric style and V Rising\'s original soundtrack by Aleksandria Migova with 18 tracks.\n\nWhile you have this DLC, all items unlock and become available in-game to be crafted as you become worthy of crafting equivalent equipment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co82vz.jpg'),(18519,'The Incident','2010-08-10','Platform','iOS, Mac','Something is causing dozens of variously household and obscure items to start falling from the sky. It is your job to jump and climb to the zenith of this pile to discover just what the heck is going on.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/hpswstwhllgyrlpkfcxn.jpg'),(18520,'The Red Solstice 2: Survivors - M.E.R.C.S.','2022-08-11','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience a new campaign that will continue after the events of the main storyline. Play as Grunt, and join the M.E.R.C.S as they survive out in the wastelands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lsv.jpg'),(18521,'Ninja Arena','2018-04-09','Fighting, Platform, Arcade','Android','Arena of ultimate ninjas and death shinigami in anime world \n \nThis game is the most expected android game built via manga in 2018. An excellent arena combat fight game. \nThe battle of Shinobi Ninja Village betwwen Soul Society shinigami. \n \nYou have 41 character and 20 stage can be choose for your battle, more than 100 skill and ultimate skill. \nTraining charka, jutsu, sharingan, chidori and summon support character. \n \nWe trust this is the best game you \'ve played ever. \n \nNinja Arena Features: \n-Three different game modes: Team VS (arcade and cpu), Single VS (arcade vs cpu), and Practice Training. \n-41 character from anime world for players to choose. \n-14 maps with different scenery help players to change the context in the game. \n-Beautiful graphics close to the comic as well as in the cartoon. \n \nYou can combine move with a,b,x,y button to get combo or translate to other type. \n \nDownload it for free and enjoy. Thank you !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ikmbiwfo7aiq9zephuxk.jpg'),(18522,'Thunder Force V: Perfect System','1998-05-21','Shooter','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','In a grim future where a once-benevolent alien technology has turned against humanity, only a ragtag group of ace pilots can save the Earth from total annihilation. Code name: Thunder Force! Witness the first 32-bit installment of the massively popular shooter series! Five spectacular weapons with multiple power-up levels let you blast through waves of metallic predators, and look good doing it. A constant barrage of innovative enemies keeps you intrigued while you struggle to stay alive. A speaker-imploding soundtrack has your foot tapping as your fingers are mashing. Unbelievable rendered cutscenes draw, no-DRAG you kicking and screaming into the action. Put simply, it\'s the ultimate hardcore gaming blast-o-rama!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rge.jpg'),(18523,'Silver Nornir','2022-11-03','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Journey through the world with friends and allies and unfold new adventures!\nFeaturing a wide cast of characters each with their own story to tell, an intense battle system that includes magic gems, special moves, and combo techniques with other characters, Silver Nornir boasts of everything an RPG has to offer! Collect useful items and unlock extra dungeons for additional enjoyment!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rh0.jpg'),(18524,'Your, Endless Mind. Glava I: My','2015-04-16','Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Do you really want to know? You need to understand that there\'s no turning back. Here, every action you take has consequences. Do you think you know everything about yourself? I will prove to you, that that\'s not true. Are you ready? He\'s already waiting. Your, Endless Mind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x42.jpg'),(18525,'Super Huey III','2020-10-16','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super Huey™ III is a direct sequel to the PC’s first helicopter simulation, featuring tense combat and daring rescues in over 35 dramatic missions! This revamped version of the 2003 classic enhances the original while still packing all the high-flying and explosive action you remember.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vu0.jpg'),(18526,'Easter Bunny','2022-04-05','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Easter Bunny is a 2D top-down stealth action game about an Easter bunny hiding Easter eggs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5glg.jpg'),(18527,'LittleBigPlanet 3: The Journey Home','2015-07-10','Platform','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4','Bunkum is safe! To celebrate this marvelous feat, the grateful curators of the Imagisphere are throwing a huge party back on Craftworld… and everyone’s invited.\n\nBut silly bowler hat-wearing inventor Newton has transported the gang to the wrong side of the planet, and they now face a race against time to join in their own celebrations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2f2s.jpg'),(18528,'4PM','2014-07-09','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','4PM is a short, narrative driven game, made by one person as an attempt to tell a real, thriller story in the form of an interactive experience. It has high production values and a cinematic style. It is, with your support, a first in a series of smaller, narrative driven experiences, that spare no expense on audio-visual style.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6a1m.jpg'),(18529,'Glitch Hero','2024-11-28','Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A fatal error has trapped Ada’s father inside Codeland! As young Ada, wield the (virtually) mighty hammer.exe and debug the corrupted virtual world while learning basic coding concepts in an irreverent, fun and thrilling action puzzle adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co931z.jpg'),(18530,'Polymega Collection Vol. 10: Bases Loaded','2025-05-02','Sport, Arcade','Polymega','Step up to the plate and relive the glory days of 8-bit and 16-bit sports action with the Bases Loaded Collection, a nostalgic compilation that brings together the iconic Bases Loaded series and a lineup of additional classic Jaleco sports games. The collection includes the original Bases Loaded, alongside its sequels Bases Loaded 2, Bases Loaded 3, Super Bases Loaded and Super Bases Loaded 2. Your goal is simple: play the perfect game and master the art of baseball in true retro fashion with fast-paced gameplay, strategic pitching, and cinematic batting action.\n\nBut the sports action doesn\'t stop with baseball. This collection also features plenty of additional 8 and 16-bit Jaleco Sports titles to add to your Polymega Collection. Finally, you’ll get 3 bonus Jaleco arcade classics based on the Mega System 32 hardware: Best Bout Boxing, Big Run, and Cisco Heat. With more than 13 unique games on disc, this collection is one of the most extensive collections we have released to date.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rem.jpg'),(18531,'Sudden Strike 4: Complete Collection','2019-09-02','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Xbox One','The Sudden Strike 4: Complete Collection offers fans the ultimate World War II strategy experience, containing the main Sudden Strike 4 game plus all five previously released DLCs: Battle of Kursk, Road to Dunkirk, Finland – Winter Storm, Africa – Desert War and The Pacific War.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co288j.jpg'),(18532,'Dungemon','2025-04-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Raise and battle your very own Dungemon virtual pets! Battle your pets against wild Dungemon to make them even stronger! Train your creatures and increase their level enough to get them to evolve into stronger versions of themselves. Train and battle 90 different pets.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o98.jpg'),(18533,'Glory Hunters',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Game Boy','Glory Hunters is an innovative action-adventure RPG designed for the original GameBoy. It introduces a distinctive and original gameplay twist: progression is driven by earning achievements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co874d.jpg'),(18534,'In the Facade we Trust','2025-01-27','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You’re torn between a girl who obsessed with you and a creature. Whose words can lead you out of this endless and dangerous loop? Which \"you\" are you? Who is the real monster? Trust the right person in the right cycle to get closer to the exit, or be misled by facades, complicating your next loop.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bq9.jpg'),(18535,'Zombie Horde Dominator','2023-09-08','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You need to immediately use various crazy weapons with your companions to kill more and more zombies, establish defense, and eventually the zombies will surge in like a tide','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73jc.jpg'),(18536,'Miss Neko','2019-08-13','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An image tile puzzle game featuring erotic images of animal girls drawn in an anime art style. Gameplay consists of shifting tiles around to form an image, followed by a short rock-paper-scissors section to unlock gallery images.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3p1m.jpg'),(18537,'Sex Lens: A Porn Story','2023-11-04','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sex Lens: A Porn Story is a visual novel that places the keys to an intriguing cinematic world in your hands. You have the opportunity to participate in a luxurious and creative process, but be prepared for challenges that present you with difficult choices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77gv.jpg'),(18538,'Detective Max!',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18539,'Unborne','2018-02-19','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unborne is a blend of the Mystery, Puzzle, and Horror genres, with a non-linear experience that lets you explore however you wish. Discover clues and examine your environment to piece together the lives of the family who have disappeared from their home. Be careful however, the more you begin to uncover, the more danger you might find yourself in...','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18540,'LEGO Dimensions: Back to the Future Doc Brown Fun Pack','2016-01-19','Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Wii U, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Go back to the future with Doc Brown and his Traveling Time Train! Join Doc Brown on a series of crazy adventures in a mash-up multiverse of your favorite characters. Build and place him on the Lego Toy Pad and see him spring to life in the game, then activate his Hacking, Technology, Fix-it and Drone abilities to solve puzzles and battle enemies. If he runs out of ideas, bring in Doc Brown\'s Traveling Time Train and rebuild it into a Flying Time Machine and Missile Blast Time Train for upgraded in-game powers!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w4d.jpg'),(18541,'Aleste Branch','2025-12-31','Shooter','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Aleste Branch is an upcoming sequel for the Aleste series\n\nAleste Branch features a gameplay similar to the earlier titles in the series but with various modern touches. The player can choose between three playable ships, each with its own weapons arsenal, with the game utilizing a vertically-oriented screen similar to Senjin Aleste. The ships are equipped with a standard, forward-firing gun which can upgraded and can equip different sub-weapons by picking up their corresponding icons. This time, the sub-weapons can be charged up by holding the shot button, unleashing a powerful attack which can be used only a limited number of times.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hf1.jpg'),(18542,'Seishun Fragile','2020-08-28','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Shiki Yuuto is normal student living with his imouto-like maid Toune in a big Europe residence built by his ancestors from long time ago. However, he hides a big secret from everyone. He is actually descendant of branch family from a lineage of high class wizards which moved to Japan hundred years ago. Despite being a shabby wizard, he used to help people with magic while chasing the \"Bad Wizard\" as duty given to head of clan, but now he is just lazy around and doesn\'t care much about magic anymore.\n\nOne day, while he is cleaning the old church behind his house, a mystery blonde wizard suddenly crashes into the church and is helped by his classmate Setsuna who \"happens to be there by chance\". The wizard introduces herself as Riz Mathers and claims to be his relative from the head family in British who comes to be his master. This fateful encounter between the three of them will unfold a bitter sweet story about their youth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kgx.jpg'),(18543,'The 7th Guest: 25th Anniversary Edition','2023-04-06','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The famous game remastered in a new 25th Anniversary Edition! The father and mother of all \'Haunted Mansion\' games. Winner of multiple gaming awards and \"No. 1 Rated Game of 1994\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j6t.jpg'),(18544,'Fantasy Tactics','2020-08-07','Strategy, Tactical','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ijk.jpg'),(18545,'Core Meltdown','1995-12-31','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Core Meltdown is a single-player, strategy game that is played against the computer on 7 x 7 grid, this is the default size but the game configuration allows the player to select either a 5 x 5 or a 6x6 grid. This is a turn-based game with the player trying to eliminate all the opponents pieces to win. Pieces are placed on the grid in empty squares. If the player wishes they can enhance their piece by placing another in the same square. When enough pieces have been placed in a square the piece explodes and populates all the surrounding squares. Any pieces in these squares belonging to the opposing player are captured in the process.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1k7g.jpg'),(18546,'Super Geisha Neon','2022-12-07','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Kind-hearted girl was trapped by the evil shogun. He wants to forcefully marry her, but that’s not gonna happen — our brave geisha will surely find the way to escape her prison cell and past all the deadly traps and labyrinths of the mighty evil-doer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e28.jpg'),(18547,'Jawbreaker','1982-12-31','Arcade','Atari 2600','Atari 2600 Port of \"Jawbreaker\".\n\nBecause of technical limitations, Atari 2600 Jawbreaker is not a Pac-Man clone and is different than the Atari 8-bit game. A rough sketch of the 2600 game was used as the basis for new computer versions from programmers other than Harris. The new game was, confusingly, sold as both Jawbreaker and Jawbreaker II and was not as successful as the original.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o9t.jpg'),(18548,'Megis Adventure','2024-03-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Megis Adventure\" is a role - playing, open world pixel game. You find yourself on an isolated, faraway island and starts an adventure to overcome quests, dungeons, monsters and foes – all in hope to help the residents of \"Megis Island\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8qa8.jpg'),(18549,'Daigaku Gurashi','2022-09-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Daigaku Gurashi is an anime-themed social simulator set in a daigaku (a post-secondary school). It focuses on socializing and time management. It is currently in development and was previously known as Shiro\'s Highschool Crisis Impact! (prior to V0.16) and Koukou Gurashi (prior to V0.28).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4knu.jpg'),(18550,'Happy Wars','2014-07-23','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','Happy Wars is an action-packed massive online multiplayer game where you can play together with as many as 30 players in one online session. And, it’s free-to-play. Team up with players all over the world and go crazy in wacky melees in a fantastic realm of heated sieges and big magical battles. Get premium items of beautiful graphic quality through Happy Cards and other means to power up your character. Charge through battlefields with your own personalized character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2smp.jpg'),(18551,'RetroRealms Arcade','2024-10-18','Platform, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The RetroRealms Arcade connects select RetroRealms games with other titles in the series that you own (games and DLC sold separately) to unlock new access and abilities and create the ultimate mash-up of horror legends!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uko.jpg'),(18552,'Infernitos','2025-01-23','Puzzle, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In Infernitos, take on the role of a little imp chef serving up devilishly delightful dishes to hungry demon patrons. Move the dishes across the fiery kitchen, carefully pushing and delivering them on the table to serve your hellish clients. Every level demands sharp thinking and a strategic approach, as each dish must be assembled with precision to satisfy your picky infernal clientele!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96fq.jpg'),(18553,'Off-Road Velociraptor Safari','2008-01-29','Racing','Web browser','A browser game involving jeeps and unsuspecting raptors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wka.jpg'),(18554,'Spot: The Cool Adventure','1993-01-01','Platform','Game Boy','Another game based on the adventures of 7-UP\'s mascot, Spot. Known in Europe as McDonaldland.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ia3.jpg'),(18555,'Miku Chan\'s Robot','2023-11-19','Puzzle','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Earth is on the brink of destruction, but Miku-chan\'s robot is ready for duty! Or is it ready?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7e70.jpg'),(18556,'Kingdoms of Amalur: Reckoning','2012-02-07','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Kingdoms of Amalur: Reckoning is an epic, open-world role-playing game set in Amalur, a mysterious and magical new fantasy world created by New York Times best-selling author R. A. Salvatore. Brought to life visually through the trademark visceral style of renowned artist and Spawn creator Todd McFarlane, Reckoning brings a new level of intense action combat to the RPG genre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25rk.jpg'),(18557,'Azuran Tales: Trials','2019-06-24','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Azuran Tales: Trials offers challenging combat, beautiful levels and merciless enemies to overcome. Journey across the World of Azuran as you discover its many environments, lore and history in a game that blends platformers with RPG elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20y9.jpg'),(18558,'LlamaTangle','2022-05-26','Puzzle, Indie','Playdate','Untangle all of the points so that no lines cross','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18559,'Gelluloid Domination: SpaceLab Simulator',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Run a spaceship\'s lab module all by yourself while trying to find a cure for close-to-extinct humanity. Make repairs to various systems of the ship, solve technical problems, perform maintenance, and upgrade tools that will help you to overcome the most unusual challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dly.jpg'),(18560,'Mira: The Legend of the Djinns','2025-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An epic 2D pixel art style Metroidvania, inspired by Moroccan culture and spiritual traditions. Wield powerful ancient weapons and forge your way through unrelenting deserts, crumbling necropoli, floating islands and dangerous mountains as you try to uncover the secret of the last Djinn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66pw.jpg'),(18561,'Deep Sky','2020-07-09','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18562,'Rave Rough!',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rave Rough is a comedic and chaotic puzzle platformer about chucking your exposable vinyl collection to bounce your way throughout many platforming challenges! All the while butting heads with wacky friends and foes! Levels are very open ended and the moveset compliments this, with you having a lot of freedom to tackle challenges in all sorts of different ways.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sxn.jpg'),(18563,'Vindefiant','2025-04-04','Platform, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A disgruntled employee is fired from his job, sparking a path of rage and destruction. Lead Alyx through his journey of vengeance and creatively kill enemies in this pixel-art adventure where you, are the villain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8al9.jpg'),(18564,'Color Collar','2023-12-08','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Color Collar is a free to play lighthearted puzzle game for all ages. Play as Aaron the robot dog and fix up the machines of John the scientist in order to open up the mysterious pandora’s lunchbox.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gqa.jpg'),(18565,'Unsolved','2019-12-07','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Welcome to UNSOLVED - the ultimate FREE hidden object adventure experience viewed through detective eyes in the extraordinary world of mystery games, puzzling investigations, and tons of hidden clues waiting to be found.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9reb.jpg'),(18566,'Back','2024-07-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','《Back》is a full-motion audio live horror game. Special Note 1: This game is very supernatural and scary, timid or heart disease players do not buy！！！！ The game will reveal different ending plots step by step through various searches and choices for your character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rfj.jpg'),(18567,'Kirby & the Amazing Mirror','2004-10-18','Platform, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS, Wii, Wii U, Game Boy Advance','Once again, Kirby must save the kingdom from evil. But this time he\'ll need some backup. As Kirby, you can call up one of four alter egos for help during your quest. Each character features new copy abilities that range from arrow-shooting to melee moves. Practice your skills in new side games, such as Crackity Hack and Speed Eaters. In addition to new abilities and subgames, Kirby & the Amazing Mirror also introduces new multiplayer modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1w9u.jpg'),(18568,'Maze Mice','2025-05-02','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Maze Mice is a bullet heaven roguelite where time only moves when you move. Collect dots, level up, choose upgrades, and avoid cats. All at your own pace.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99a4.jpg'),(18569,'Quiet Godo','2020-11-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You\'re home alone. Explore the rooms, find the keys, and, most of all, watch your tongue!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y79.jpg'),(18570,'Top Gun','2006-05-03','Shooter','Nintendo DS','Based on the 80s movie of the same name, this fighter aircraft simulator game offers 10 single-player levels consisting on dogfights, escort missions, target destroy missions, air-to-ground bombings, et cetera. It also features a multiplayer dogfighting mode with up to 4 players. The game plays from a 3rd person point of view of the fighter and is rendered in full 3D.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zdn.jpg'),(18571,'PixelBot Extreme!','2018-04-20','Shooter, Platform, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Extreme! Multitasking Run and Gun with a colorful twist!\nTeam up with PixelBot, shoot up everything in your way and master an unique color-based destruction! Show what you\'ve got and help the Bot breaking out of the Forbidden Factory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fg0.jpg'),(18572,'Microsoft Multiplan',NULL,'Simulator','Sin plataforma','Microsoft* Multiplan* Electronic Worksheet is a personal productivity tool that will help you analyze data. As an aid for both business and personal needs, Multiplan is one of the most powerful modeling and planning tools ever invented. With Multiplan, you can do the capital budgeting for a small company; you can make major sales force decisions or analyze product planning; you can plan your personal investments and put together a budget for your family … and much more. Multiplan is easy to learn, and its versatility is enhanced by the skill of its user. As you become more familiar with Multiplan, and better able to exercise its powers, you\'ll be surprised at how quickly and efficiently you\'ll accomplish various tasks. Welcome! We hope you enjoy working with your powerful new assistant: Multiplan. \n* Microsoft and Multiplan are trademarks of the Microsoft Corporation.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18573,'Anime vs. Evil: Apocalypse','2024-06-15','Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','In Anime vs. Evil you will fight the monsters that take over the whole world by mystical polygonal magic. Find the survivors, look for the supplies, beat the story mode and finally finish with this mess!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65v6.jpg'),(18574,'CyberControl: Another Life','2025-05-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An interactive cyberpunk drama where you live the life of a border officer in a brutal future ruled by tyranny, manipulation, and survival. Check documents, approve or deny entry, build relationships, and face nonlinear stories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rfo.jpg'),(18575,'Plants vs. Zombies: Match','2021-06-01','Strategy','Android, iOS','Plants vs Zombies meets Match 3 puzzles - This ain’t your garden variety match 3 game!\n\nGrow your match 3 puzzle skills and join Dave on a totally new Plants vs Zombies adventure game. Those wacky zombies are dead set on making life in Neighborville rather dim. It’s time to let your matching puzzle skills shine as bright as the Sun -- because you’ll need to collect it, recruit your favorite leafy friends, stem the tide of yet another quirky zombie horde, and save Neighborville… you know the drill!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ujn.jpg'),(18576,'An evening stroll',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','a doodle in bitsy','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18577,'Hidden Motives: The Diamond Rush - Collector\'s Edition','2021-11-09','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Embark on a journey through the Wild West! You\'re an actress taking on the role of the sheriff\'s daughter in a film called Gold Rush! The director gives you a mysterious ring that transports you back to the Wild West times. While we find out the cause of the town mayor\'s death that we have witnessed, we stumble upon Wild Jack, a criminal who threatens all the locals with a mysterious Diamond Ghost haunting the mines. We later learn that our father has been trying to catch Wild Jack for years. Will he manage to escape punishment for his new crime in this new Hidden-Object Puzzle Adventure?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bz8.jpg'),(18578,'Jumpah','2023-09-20','Racing, Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take the title for the fastest Jumpah alive, and in the process make your friends hate their lives! Parkour, Rage, anger, frustration, disappointment, despair, depression, and lots of colors! What more could you ask for?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99bb.jpg'),(18579,'RevolVR 3','2021-02-23','Sport','SteamVR','RevolVR 3 is a single- and multiplayer casual shooter staged in the robotic version of the Wild West. Socialize with friends in the saloon, play mini-games and participate in fast-paced deathmatches versus people or bots!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mew.jpg'),(18580,'ChronoClock','2015-04-24','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Next in line to manage a multi-million dollar corporation is our protagonist, Rei Sawatari. He inherited one very important heirloom from his late grandfather: a single pocket watch that grants him a mysterious power— The power to go five minutes back in time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99jc.jpg'),(18581,'Pokémon Sweet Version','2014-07-27','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Welcome to Pokémon Sweet Version, where battles are carried out with the power of dessert! Travel through a confectionate wonderland that resembles Kanto but is quite different, as those who explore will soon discover! Capture 151 candified Pokémon and fill up the pages of your Cookbook! We\'ve spared no expense in making the experience unique, which is why there is a brand-new type chart consisting of twelve flavors of ice cream. (Apple is totally a flavor of ice cream.) And if you\'re sick of Kanto, you\'ll be pleased to know this is totally not Kanto, no matter how much it seems to be. As the world is designed to reward exploration, there\'s something waiting in every map that may not have been there before, whether it\'s a cleverly hidden item or a dreadfully bad pun. (We have plenty of those.) The PokéSweets themselves are as delicious as they look, and they look good enough to eat!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k6r.jpg'),(18582,'Dungeon Done','2024-12-05','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dungeon Done is a PvE co-op horror survival extraction game where players explore dungeons previously cleared by heroes. The objective is for up to six players to team up, gathering hidden treasures and evading lurking dangers to make their daring escape.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95gj.jpg'),(18583,'Pikubo','2024-05-02','Puzzle, Indie','Android, iOS','Dive into the delightful world of Pikubo, a captivating puzzle game that brings the excitement of cubic nonograms to your mobile device. With a unique twist on a beloved classic, Pikubo challenges you to carve out shapes from a larger cube by removing unnecessary blocks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co891w.jpg'),(18584,'Just the Boss Fights','2025-04-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A classic 2D platformer RPG with a twist: the game skips all the story, dialogue, exploration, and grind, leaving only the bosses themselves! Unfortunately, our hero wasn\'t quite prepared for this shift into a boss rush, and finds himself confused at every turn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lp7.jpg'),(18585,'Invasion 2037','2019-11-05','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Become a survival scientist in a savage post-apocalyptic world where aliens have the control of the world and they have spread a virus that transform people into zombies. Find a cure, manage your shelter and fight to survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qfq.jpg'),(18586,'Project Oasis World',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Project Oasis World is a new genre type built with a massive multiplayer online role-playing foundation and player ran economies in mind. Hundreds of players will be interacting with each other in an open world freedom environment with one goal: living. You choose who you are, what you wear, what you drive and how you earn a living.\n\nYou can choose to become a law enforcer taking down other players who chose the life of crime. How about a more harmonious role of agricultural perfecting your corn, barley or marijuana crops providing other players and businesses with foods and goods.\n\nAfter a long day of work, you should relax by grabbing some lunch with friends, or attending a local dance club and bar. Top it off with a weekend getaway fishing trip. You ultimately decide how you choose to live your life in the Project Oasis World.\n\nWe want to provide a fun outlet for folks to enjoy themselves in a virtual world. We also want to provide a platform for folks who may suffer from circumstances that prevents them from fulfilling an average life. Whether you suffer from physical or mental ailments, such as depression, any kind of social anxiety, or basically anything that prevents you from doing basic activities, Project Oasis World can be used as a resource to help people live the life they want to live.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t3s.jpg'),(18587,'Namco Soccer Prime Goal','1996-06-01','Sport','Arcade, PlayStation','A 3D football game by Namco based on the Japanese League.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/fwccjrajqg2myol2hcpv.jpg'),(18588,'Beany Bopper','1982-09-01','Shooter, Arcade','Atari 2600','Your job is to capture Beanies, Bouncing Orange Eyes, and a crazy variety of Falling Objects. Beanies are devious and deadly and must be shot with the Bopper\'s stun gun before they can be captured.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uv3lzgoif6aoqwsbv3pi.jpg'),(18589,'Enishia and the Binding Brand','2024-05-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Having sworn to protect the town\'s church, the gentle nun, Enishia, buys the deed to the land from a greedy merchant company. Now she must do odd jobs around the town to pay off the debt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87t1.jpg'),(18590,'Karlson','2020-01-17','Shooter, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','What do you get if you combine an FPS, Parkour, Slowmo & ... Milk? Karlson! This milk-infused fellow is on a mission to take down anyone in his way to secure the milk.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xqx.jpg'),(18591,'BioBeasts','2016-01-20','Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','You are a powerful mutant beast battling through a terrifying laboratory run by merciless mechanical guards. Defend yourself against endless hordes of robots, lab defenses, and hulking bosses as you claw, bite, blast, and bash your way to freedom! Unlock beasts with unique powers, and experiment with potent mutations for endless variety!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dv0.jpg'),(18592,'Super Gear Quest','2020-05-05','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super Gear Quest is a 2D platformer and metroidvania game, following an android called Starter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42nf.jpg'),(18593,'Sonic Frontiers 2D','2022-12-31','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kd3.jpg'),(18594,'HackRack',NULL,'Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','HackRack is a game where you live in a city and use your hacking skills to influence the world around you.\nThe player will encounter many people and organizations, and their hacks will impact the world around them. The player will need to expand their living space and secret server room to accommodate computing racks, which can be customized to provide the power, traits, and abilities that their viruses require to overcome even the most secure of systems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co208e.jpg'),(18595,'Hidden Expedition: The Uncharted Islands','2012-05-13','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Hidden Expedition: The Uncharted Islands is a hidden object game and the fifth entry into the Hidden Expedition series of \"seek and find\" games. The gameplay is similar to previous instalments, with the focus being on finding items scattered across a diverse collection of scenes. Some items are placed in the player\'s inventory and need to be used in other locations to advance in the game. The game does feature some variations on the basic hidden object formula, with many hidden object scenes being two screens wide, and some items only being revealed by the manipulation of other items.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ocj.jpg'),(18596,'Elite Warriors: Vietnam','2017-02-02','Shooter, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Infiltrate deep into Laos with your Green Beret and Montgnard teammates, hunted by trackers and bloodhounds, outnumbered at times 100-to-1. See why SOG veterans went on to found Delta Force and in the work of secret operations, remain the stuff of legends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w55.jpg'),(18597,'Kakenuke Forward to Our Sparking Youth!','2021-08-26','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','What does \"youth\" mean to you? Is it a time in your life meant for having fun? For devoting yourself to a cause? For Yuu Tono, it\'s meant earning money and studying to build a brighter future for him and his family. But maybe the new (or maybe old?) friend who\'s come into his life will change that.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yip.jpg'),(18598,'Star Wars: Commander','2014-08-21','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','Windows Phone, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Star Wars: Commander is a free-to-play combat strategy game where fans will join either the Rebel Alliance or the Galactic Empire to recruit and lead an unstoppable force across the Star Wars galaxy.\n\nStar Wars: Commander features the full array of vehicles, weapons and technology from the Star Wars universe. Players who rally to the Rebellion will call upon iconic heroes such as Han Solo, Chewbacca and Princess Leia to support missions for justice and freedom, while leaders of the Imperial forces will command AT-ATs, TIE fighters and Stormtroopers to gain control of the galaxy.\n\nStar Wars: Commander also offers an original Star Wars storyline set within the Galactic Civil War of Episodes IV – VI, where “commanders” determine if it’s the Empire’s strength and relentlessness or the Rebellion’s heroism and resourcefulness that will win the war.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pbo.jpg'),(18599,'Queen\'s Wish 2: The Tormentor','2022-08-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You are in a barbarian land. They are trying to kill you. The Queen demands you tame them. So what now? Escape into an exciting, open-ended story and cunning tactical combat. Epic, indie fantasy adventure. Freely explore a huge world, fight for fame and power, and shape the world as you choose.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52rj.jpg'),(18600,'Sable\'s Grimoire: A Dragon\'s Treasure','2023-04-13','Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Sleeping with a possessive half-dragon becomes the least of Sable\'s worries as he tries to stay one step ahead of his domineering mother-in-law.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2c18.jpg'),(18601,'Rookie Tank','2018-05-20','Arcade','Android, iOS','Are you still a Rookie?\nInstall Rookie Tank and become the master of tanks.\n\nEnemies have demolished your base and your team.\nAll you have is just a one tank…\nDefeat your enemies with your one last tank.\nDestroy all the enemies and bosses to lead your team to victory.\n\nKey features :\n- Instinctive control\n- Total of 150 stages\n- 3 distinctive regions\n- Customize your tank with unique upgrades\n- Encounter bosses every 10 stages\n- Collect stars to promote yourself to the Supreme Commander\n- Offline play','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ju6.jpg'),(18602,'Paranormal Files: Price of a Secret - Collector\'s Edition','2023-01-06','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rumors of hauntings surround the Russells’ Winery and Hotel for decades, but it’s not until you arrive that the paranormal goes on the offensive! Something doesn’t want you investigating the secluded island, and it will do anything to keep its secrets buried. Crack the case before it’s too late?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i27.jpg'),(18603,'The Mystery of Castle Super Beast','2019-10-31','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A comedy/horror fangame based on the podcast Castle Super Beast. Styled on tank control PS1 games like Silent Hill and Resident Evil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fz6.jpg'),(18604,'Warspace.io',NULL,'Platform','Web browser','WarSpace.io is an NFT-based play to earn game developed on the WAX blockchain. Thanks to the tokenized economy, players themselves control the market and build trade relations. Everyone can choose their own path: develop stone mining, engage in logging, restore the food industry or go deep underground in search of gold. Resources are needed to build new buildings, as well as to participate in pvp-battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ktc.jpg'),(18605,'No More Rainbows','2023-06-01','Platform, Adventure','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR2, SteamVR','No More Rainbows brings the fun of a classic platformer to VR. Use the intuitive locomotion mechanics to run, jump, and climb using only your hands.\n\nAs the Beast, rampage through colorful worlds to reclaim your desecrated Underworld. Extend your experience with 3v3 multiplayer game mode to become the world’s most respected beast!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j5x.jpg'),(18606,'VRC Pro: Deluxe Asia On-Road Tracks 2','2017-02-21','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This VRC PRO: Deluxe Asia On-Road Tracks 2 pack gives you 5 additional, real existing Asian and Australian on-road RC tracks. Expand your outdoor on-road tracks. Experience real existing world class tracks. Join more events & more multiplayer sessions.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18607,'Air Guitar Warrior: Gamepad Edition','2017-06-15','Shooter, Music, Indie, Arcade','Xbox One','Air Guitar Warrior is is a rhythm shooter for everyone who enjoys a good measure of over-the-top rock attitude in their indie games. The gameplay combines classic side-scrollers with rhythm games. Your guitar is a weapon that you fire by tapping buttons in time to the music. Find the legendary sword-guitar and challenge Heavy Metal Zeus in the Temple of the Rock Gods!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ist.jpg'),(18608,'Mr. Mix','2014-10-31','Point-and-click, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Based on the infamous game described on the popular creepypasta of the same name.\nMr. Mix from Castilan Games  is a faithful recreation of the mysterious typing game for PC. On Mr. Mix from Castilan Games  you can either challenge the practically impossible original game mode or play the hacked game mode so you can reach the ominous level 6.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cz9.jpg'),(18609,'The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim - Anniversary Edition','2022-09-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim - Anniversary Edition contains the full game plus all three expansions and over 500 pieces of unique content from Creation Club, including pre-existing and new quests, dungeons, bosses, weapons, spells and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lyu.jpg'),(18610,'Limbus Company','2023-02-27','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','As the Executive Manager of Limbus Company, lead your group of twelve Sinners, venture into the buried facilities of Lobotomy Corporation, and lay claim on the Golden Boughs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co630b.jpg'),(18611,'The Eyes','2025-05-06','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Follow Hisoka Kageyama, a desperate man who accepts the grim job of night watchman in an abandoned prison. As he navigates its dark corridors, surreal visions and eerie presences lurk around every corner. Can you discover the secrets hidden within these walls?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rfc.jpg'),(18612,'Rescue Operation','2021-04-21','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Is a first-person shooter game. The game will follow the scenario of the game, and destroy the enemies in its path','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yfz.jpg'),(18613,'Deadeus','2022-02-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Game Boy','Deadeus is an authentic horror Gameboy game developed using Chris Maltby’s GB Studio engine, Featuring music by Stuart Busby.\n\nThe game centers around a small boy who has a prophetic nightmare telling him everyone will die in 3 days and that he has to investigate his village to see how he can save them, if at all.\n\nThe game has 11 endings and no direct path leaving it up to the player to decide which is the best course of action.\n\nThe game comes as a ROM file, to play it you will need to download an emulator to your device. The game is also playable on an original Gameboy using a flashcart or other emulation cartridge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h2f.jpg'),(18614,'Block Game','2000-12-31','Sin género','Game Boy Color, Game Boy','A remaster of Quarth (Game Boy).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kpg.jpg'),(18615,'The House of the Dead 4','2006-12-31','Shooter','Arcade, PlayStation 3','The House of the Dead 4 is a light gun arcade game with a horror theme and the fourth installment of the House of the Dead series of video games, developed by Sega. The game takes place between the events of The House of the Dead 2 and The House of the Dead III, and introduced several new gameplay concepts. Players can control characters James Taylor, from The House of the Dead 2, or Kate Green, a new character to the series.\n\nThe House of the Dead 4 is the first game to run on the Sega Lindbergh arcade system board. A PlayStation 3 version featuring support for PlayStation Move and the two stages from The House of the Dead 4 Special was released on April 17, 2012 on the PlayStation Network.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2iti.jpg'),(18616,'Most Quietly','2025-05-01','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game, that supposed to be an ordinary, but developer accidentally made a fatal error, that completely brokes the game, and transforms it into a horror-game. Now, your goal is to somehow, fix the fatal error.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rls.jpg'),(18617,'Bashville','2018-02-27','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Bashville is a good old-fashioned shoot \'em up with loads of weapons and enemies to fight. Go through The Realm levels and defeat the various enemies found within. Use the level environment to your advantage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pie.jpg'),(18618,'Majestic Twelve: The Space Invaders Part IV','1990-10-03','Shooter','Arcade','Super Space Invaders \'91 was produced by Taito in 1990. The gameplay adheres much to the original, making it very easy to play. The object in most cases is to simply clear the screen of invaders before they reach bottom. Every so often, however, a boss invader appears that must be hit multiple times to be destroyed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i9p.jpg'),(18619,'Scuffy Game','2022-02-18','Platform, Racing, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scuffy Game is a First-Person Multiplayer platformer game that involves you to be the last one standing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aqo.jpg'),(18620,'Scared Tube','2022-11-17','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scared Tube is an indie, Early-Access horror-style game. You play as an influencer that explores abandon haunted locations. Like any horror influencer, you need to determine what kind of ghost you are dealing with for your audience. Get those likes and subscriptions up for currency and gear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53g8.jpg'),(18621,'Gold Express','2019-09-27','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the project code-named “Gold Express”, it is an asymmetric multiplayer competitive game in which you can get brand new escaping experiences with your teammates of all kinds of abilities on the strategic maps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1t41.jpg'),(18622,'Kitball 20000','2023-01-20','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kitball is a homage to classic old-school Maze Shooters of the 90\'s era, featuring modernized gameplay and graphics, while still holding onto the original simplicity and charm of its inspiration.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5sd6.jpg'),(18623,'Arcane Golf','2021-03-10','Puzzle, Sport, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Arcane Golf is a miniature golf puzzle game set in a fantasy world full of dungeons, dangers, gems, and geometry. Play across 200 levels set in 4 unique courses inspired by classic adventure games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lls.jpg'),(18624,'Age of Fear: The Undead King Gold','2019-06-11','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Age of Fear is a turn-based strategy series that marries a tabletop wargame with elements of RPG. Age of Fear: The Undead King Gold is an extended version of the original game released seven years ago. This project aims to bring Age of Fear series into Open World theme!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63n0.jpg'),(18625,'Ninja Midori','2018-06-07','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ninja Midori is an 8 bit platformer game. Akuma the Evil Devil has stolen Princess Sera, The princess has one hope you Ninja Midori. You must travel through the land and rescue the princess form Akuma the Evil Devil\'s Castle','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3q5y.jpg'),(18626,'Capcom Fighting Evolution','2004-11-16','Fighting','Arcade, Xbox, PlayStation 3, PlayStation 2','Capcom Fighting Jam, released in the US as Capcom Fighting Evolution, is a 2004 head-to-head fighting game from Capcom. It was originally released as a coin-operated arcade game for the Namco System 246 hardware and ported to the PlayStation 2 and Xbox. The game features characters from three different incarnations of the Street Fighter series, as well as characters from the Darkstalkers series and the CPS III arcade game Red Earth, with each character employing the fighting system from the game which they represent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dga.jpg'),(18627,'Back: Fade','2025-04-30','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','《Back：Fade》 is a full-motion audio live horror game. Special Note 1: This game is very supernatural and scary, timid or heart disease players do not buy ！！！！ The game will reveal different ending plots step by step through various searches and choices for your character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rfi.jpg'),(18628,'Rallycross Simulator','1989-12-31','Racing, Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum','Rallycross Simulator is a top-down racing game that offers both single-player and two-player modes. Players compete on a series of challenging tracks, with four available on the Spectrum version and five on the Commodore 64. The game combines fast-paced racing action with a strategic upgrade system, where points earned from completed races can be used to enhance the performance of the cars. This progression mechanic adds depth to the gameplay, allowing players to improve their vehicles over time and tackle increasingly difficult tracks. The ultimate goal is to achieve the highest score possible, encouraging replayability as players strive to improve their performance and car capabilities. With its blend of accessible top-down racing and strategic vehicle upgrades, Rallycross Simulator offers an engaging experience for both casual racers and those seeking a more competitive challenge.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wnsbzovwlrk4rxmi94jv.jpg'),(18629,'Chinese Frontiers',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Discover life in a Chinese settlement founded during the construction of the Great Wall. Acquire new skills, learn to work smart, and be clever. When the enemy comes, you need to be prepared.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5coy.jpg'),(18630,'Reflex Arena','2017-03-07','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Reflex Arena is a return to roots, pure, fast, first person shooter. You will be pushed to your limits facing other contestants in a range of rich and diverse arena-base environments. Delivering a truly rewarding experience based purely on your skill and success. Train to unlock your genetic potential and bring it online for the ultimate proving ground and make your mark. There are no limitations in Reflex Arena, the true evolution of the classic arena shooter genre.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r4a.jpg'),(18631,'Pogglewash','2023-05-19','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 3D platformer in which you play as a robot on an alien planet cleaning up polluted goop while interacting with cute creatures named Pogglewonks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6rlv.jpg'),(18632,'Dark Strokes: The Legend of the Snow Kingdom - Collector\'s Edition','2014-05-04','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inspired by the timeless tales of the Brothers Grimm, \"Dark Strokes: The Legend of the Snow Kingdom\" offers an experience rich with magic and wonder. Enter the enchanted realm of the Snow Kingdom and begin your journey today!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3o5j.jpg'),(18633,'Through the Fog','2025-04-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You will take on the role of a detective and dive into a dark world from a first-person perspective. What will you have to do? Explore locations in search of clues. Make assumptions and write them down in your diary. Solve puzzles.Run away and hide from your demons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rfh.jpg'),(18634,'The Ringing of Twilight','2025-03-11','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Navigate through various levels as you search for artifacts. But you must listen to your surroundings, for an invisible entity draws ever closer...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9l6w.jpg'),(18635,'Project DeepWeb','2020-04-15','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Welcome to the DeepWeb. Here you can take off your mask and show yourself. Murders, drugs and perversions — here you can find everything you want. So breath in toxic gases and relax — the Silent House awaits new guests. It\'s a showtime.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23a0.jpg'),(18636,'Sega Top Five','1997-09-01','Sin género','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','A five game compilation cartridge for Genesis, released in Brazil by Tec Toy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pev.jpg'),(18637,'Battlefield: Bad Company 2 Ultimate Edition','2010-04-02','Shooter','Xbox 360','The game is primarily a squad-level first-person shooter based in a contemporary modern warfare setting. Additionally, the game includes a single-player campaign, where the player re-assumes the role of Preston Marlowe, the protagonist of the original game. The game\'s Frostbite 1.5 engine allows for destructible environments. Multiplayer maps, which allow for five different game modes, contain a wide selection of vehicles, aircraft and emplacements','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co80rw.jpg'),(18638,'Miguelshroom: First Day at School','2021-04-15','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Reassemble Miguelshroom\'s first day at school, in this puzzle followed by a narrative on a top-down platform. Guide the cute mushroom that lives in a fantastic world in its discoveries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nvy.jpg'),(18639,'Wigmund','2021-02-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Find your way through an open-world, adventure RPG, uncovering ancient secrets and unraveling the mystery of the hidden knights. Engage in skill-based game-play, each encounter being unique, breaking off from the old-school linear, simple click combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4d1e.jpg'),(18640,'Maimai DX Prism','2024-09-12','Music, Arcade','Arcade','The sixth release of SEGA\'s arcade rhythm game, maimai DX.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tkj.jpg'),(18641,'Urban Constructor','2005-09-30','Simulator','PlayStation 2','Are you ready to claim empty land for construction?\n\nUrban Constructor is a fun filled game, that sees you working to claim the most possible territory for construction whilst being hindered by enemies, other constructors, and other variables.\n\nThere are 3 different construction worlds, with different objectives, enemies, and bonuses. With 50 unique levels Urban Constructor is hard to put down.\n\nA QIX variant with 3D graphics where you play a tractor that tries to build a city by drawing rectangles and other figures while opposed by tornadoes, cloud storms and other enemies. Different random bonuses could appear as well, and each out of 50 levels is done after 45% of the land is all built up.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/x4he81i3xfnkabqhgjgq.jpg'),(18642,'Down in Flames',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','Strategy dogfight game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jqwu2rwyjn5rt6omtvvy.jpg'),(18643,'Astro Miner','2024-05-20','Simulator, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Fly to extraordinary planets with different terrains and start mining valuable minerals to sell them in your base. Create corridors to reach stacks of crystals, or do it your own way and mine wherever you like with the help of dynamites. Hire workers and build an auto-miner machine to speed up your work!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ecj.jpg'),(18644,'Sonic Rumble',NULL,'Platform, Racing, Sport','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','On your mark, get set...PLAY! Get ready to race in the Sonic Rumble! Jump into a speedy, 32-person mobile royale set in a cheery toy world created by Dr. Eggman. Play as some of your favorite characters from the Sonic the Hedgehog universe complete with customization to create your perfect avatar as you dive into action-packed gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86by.jpg'),(18645,'Tetra Cube','2021-03-21','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Tetra Cube is a turn-based strategy roguelike game.  \nNae and Dio are dispatched to information that an unknown Cube caused a disaster. Whether you can\'t beat the Cube is up to you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vtw.jpg'),(18646,'Angel\'s Lullaby',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Angel\'s Lullaby takes place during the game\'s opening introduction, back during the Human and Monster War. Expanding on the lore, meta narrative and core themes of the original games, Angel\'s aims to enrich the Undertale world by mixing both the old and new.\n\nCombining both an open-world and linear story-line, Angel\'s is an ambitious fangame with a large story to tell. There\'s three main \"Acts,\" each with it\'s own main area that follows a story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cya.jpg'),(18647,'Witchfire','2025-12-31','Shooter, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Witchfire is a first-person shooter from the creative leads behind Painkiller and Bulletstorm. A roguelite for people who hate roguelites, the game offers a challenging but satisfying gameplay experience, and with multiple roads to victory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lxp.jpg'),(18648,'The Pact','2023-05-21','Platform, Puzzle','Game Boy Color','A puzzle-platformer. Two enemies have to become friends and help each other in order to survive. Switch between them and resolve the puzzles to reach the end of each level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6khh.jpg'),(18649,'Severen',NULL,'Platform, Indie','Web browser, Game Boy','An upcoming game featuring interchangeable limbs that allow for new abilities and secret paths to be found.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4og0.jpg'),(18650,'Evil Seal','2021-02-08','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Evil Seal is an action horror game inspired by the Apocalypse of St. John. This game is the first of a trilogy that provides for the breaking of the 7 seals of the apocalypse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ar8.jpg'),(18651,'MegaMan Adventure','2018-08-19','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uhg.jpg'),(18652,'The Haunted Nora Apartment','2025-05-01','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Haunted Nora Apartment is a 2D Top-Down Survival Horror game based on the story of the Nora Apartment which was built during the early 2000s.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18653,'Persona 4 GB','2022-02-02','Role-playing (RPG), Visual Novel','Web browser, Game Boy','EXPERIENCE THE HIT CLASSIC JRPG SERIES NOW ON THE GAMEBOY!\n\nEver wonder what Persona 4 would look like if it was released on the gameboy? Well now you don\'t need to, as a reimagining of what a gameboy Persona 4 might be like comes to reality and on actual hardware with a rom file.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90oi.jpg'),(18654,'Airplane Tycoon','2021-09-03','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Manage your own air company! Be a businessman in the air industry, with control over everything in your business. Work, earn, grow and become an air transport tycoon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5758.jpg'),(18655,'Peppy\'s Adventure','2021-09-20','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Peppy’s Adventure is a 1-screen, top-down, action-puzzle game controlled with directional inputs only. You control Peppy, a bun-shaped bunny, on his journey to rescue the village younglings from the clutches of the Hooded Fox. As you pursue his airship, you will have to solve your way through short challenging levels as fast as possible facing an army of reckless foxes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5m8b.jpg'),(18656,'A Night Out.','2021-10-29','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','go to a very normal and not strange house party.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lve.jpg'),(18657,'Justice Sucks: Tactical Vacuum Action','2022-09-08','Simulator, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Justice Sucks: Tactical Vacuum Action is a stealth/action game about a killer robot vacuum cleaner on a quest for vengeance through a 90s TV universe. Stalk your prey, hack smart devices, turn them into deadly traps and consume the blood of your enemies to unleash devastating powers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55su.jpg'),(18658,'Ikenfell','2020-10-08','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A turn-based tactical RPG about a group of troublesome magic students. Use timing mechanics to power your spells and block attacks, explore the twisted halls of a vast magic school, fight challenging monsters and bosses, and uncover dark secrets never meant to be found.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fsc.jpg'),(18659,'Hardway: Endless Road Builder',NULL,'Racing, Arcade','Sin plataforma','Endless road building with a brand new mechanics. Build from left or right. Connect islands using roads and bridges in a fast arcade style. Track your favourite car and drive through unique worlds. Be aware of different obstacles including moving islands, lighthouses and monsters.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18660,'The World of Kung Fu: Dragon and Eagle','2024-10-23','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A nostalgic pixel RPG that tells a Wuxia fantasy set in ancient China. You will start as a no-name wayfarer in a world of Kungfu, acquaint yourself with journeymen from feuding clans and sects, learn different schools of martial arts, and eventually make your own name at the crossroads of times.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j8f.jpg'),(18661,'Trap of Musk: Asia Night','2019-01-25','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The target of the mission, who is in pursuit of the poignant love with the heroine of Legend of the White Snake. And the client, who is a real flirt. One is calm and never doubts others, while the other is kind and nice to everyone. Who is it that indulges in the game of pampering--?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68bm.jpg'),(18662,'Rubato','2025-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A collect-a-thon about a frog fixing the solar system after it explodes for some reason.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8f26.jpg'),(18663,'Payday 3: Fear & Greed Heist','2024-09-16','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S','Fear & Greed takes place in the heart of Wall Street. Choose stealth or loud, then pull off the heist of the century before anyone\'s the wiser.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m3n.jpg'),(18664,'Tokyo Yamanote Boys Dark Cherry Disc','2011-08-25','Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dark cherry disc focus on the three main guys for entry no.7-9: Rudo Jesus (Entry no.7), Moroboshi Tetsu (Entry no.8), and Hamada Shinnosuke (Entry no.9)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5joa.jpg'),(18665,'Steel Rain: Dawn of the Machines',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Steel Rain: Down of the Machines is an amazing action Rogue Like, with randomly generated scenarios and resource exploration. Control war machines on the battlefield, crush your enemies and unlock new skills and weaponry, making you stronger with each race.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co423d.jpg'),(18666,'Guess the Movie :- Funnier One','2016-09-11','Quiz/Trivia','Android','its a funny trivia game that you can play during your free time or when the nature calls.\nIf you are a hollywood movie lover then this game is for you. In this you have to guess the movies on the basis of their plots being explained very badly (in a funny way ).\nIts my first go at the mobile game development and all kinds of suggestions and improvements are welcome.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/v5hpwt1g4levtrrnyymr.jpg'),(18667,'Ka: Keepers & Assassins','2023-03-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ka: Keepers & Assassins is dark fantasy multiplayer 3rd person battle arena game, 4 players against each other.Collect three crystals in a certain time and get them to the center of the arena, in the meantime it is necessary to find better gear against the opponents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co660h.jpg'),(18668,'Wart Worm Wingding','2020-06-28','Platform, Indie, Arcade','Nintendo Entertainment System','Wart Worm Wingding is a 2-player arcade adventure for the NES. The settlers\' mining operations have gone too far. Help the Wart Worms, Wing and Ding, destroy the settler invaders and free their underground lands from exploitation!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4aaf.jpg'),(18669,'Sleeper S9','2025-05-01','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Traverse the sleeper coaches of an apparent empty Indian train—or so it seems. If you see an anomaly, face it and move forward. If not, it may be a trick of the mind—return to the previous coach. But beware, some anomalies will do everything to stop you. Face them or be lost forever.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rft.jpg'),(18670,'Banshee','2025-05-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game is about escaping from a house where “Banshee”, a frightening looking fairy, wanders around, exploring the surroundings and using the items found to escape.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18671,'Nioh','2017-02-07','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4','In Nioh, players will traverse war-torn Japan as William, a blonde-haired swordsman whose background as a fierce warrior and seasoned knowledge of the blade allows him to survive in the demon-plagued land of the samurai. Known as Yokai, these demons inhabit a number of dangerous locations and lie in wait in the shadows to ambush unsuspecting victims. Players will also face off with other samurai in supernatural sword battles and intense, multi-target engagements offering a level of difficulty that will truly test even the most hardened samurai’s skills, patience, and strategy.\n\nOffering a deep and original storyline that takes place during the Warring States Period of Japanese history alongside strategic sword-fighting action, Nioh will challenge players in a way that makes every mission and accomplishment feel earned and worthwhile.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20xg.jpg'),(18672,'Melon Journey: Bittersweet Memories','2023-04-06','Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Melon Journey: Bittersweet Memories is a story-exploration game about revisiting a town full of adorable animals with eccentric personalities. Yet under its cute and nostalgic surface lies a dark tale of crime and corruption...\n\nPlay as Honeydew, an employee of a huge melon factory, and travel to Hog Town where melons are illegal. While searching for a missing friend, you\'ll have to explore the town and its surrounding areas, and speak with suspicious characters in dangerous situations to uncover the truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dtt.jpg'),(18673,'Reverie: Limited Edition','2018-05-17','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','Reverie Limited Edition is an action adventure game set on a fictional island in New Zealand, inspired by the legend of Maui and the Giant Fish where the demigod himself fishes up the North Island with a powerful fishhook. You play as Tai, a young boy on summer holiday, who must explore Toromi Island. So, with angry spirits threatening the safety of the island’s inhabitants, Tai must venture through dangerous dungeons and across a variety of environments to put the spirits to rest.\n\nThis edition includes the following\nReverie Game\nReverie Game Manual\nReverie Soundtrack CD\nReverie Numbered Certificate\nMap and Collector\'s Box','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8azg.jpg'),(18674,'Warfare: Battleground','2024-04-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Warfare: Battleground\" is a classic arcade shooter where skill and reaction speed play a key role. Fight on exciting themed maps and use more than 20 weapons to win in various battle modes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7z37.jpg'),(18675,'Primordial Fate','2025-05-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A narrative driven, 2D, point and click horror/adventure game (using a two-click LOOK/INTERACT system), where you control multiple characters at various points of the game. With multiple endings and deaths, this fast paced story plays like an 80s horror movie!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18676,'SoundlessNightmare','2025-05-01','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Keep quiet and avoid making loud noises. Please refrain from making any sound for 10 minutes to enter a sweet dreamland. Of course, you can choose not to have a microphone!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rfq.jpg'),(18677,'Muzy','2024-02-13','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore the mystery behind a once-loved and hugely popular children\'s toy, also known as Muzy, in this terrifying horror adventure game. Several reports detail frightening incidents connected to accidents. Your job is to solve the puzzles and find the cause of these unsettling occurrences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kcv.jpg'),(18678,'Pop Royale','2016-08-27','Indie, Arcade','Android','Pop Royale is a casual game that has a physics based gameplay that combines the match 3 and the physics puzzle game genres.\n\nPopping balloons has never been more fun. Simple mechanics and realistic movement make for an exciting and challenging experience.\n\nFeatures:\n- Tap the screen to pop! Can be played with one hand\n- Realistic balloon bouncing\n- Pop frozen, glued and other special types of balloons\n- Over 100 exciting levels with different game modes\n- Beautiful graphics\n- Combine bombs and powerups for eye-popping combos\n- Free & easy to play, but challenging to master\n- Easily sync the game between devices when connected to the Internet','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/nopvwtywvvyij76x5bef.jpg'),(18679,'Color Sudoku','2017-09-19','Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A colorful new way to play your favorite game, this Sudoku variation must be filled with colors instead of numbers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2akd.jpg'),(18680,'SkyRider',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SkyRider is a 2 player co-op action puzzle platformer game. One player will control Noki, jumping, fighting and collecting energy for his drone. The other one will control that drone: \"R.O.B.O.T.O\", making platforms, energy shields and shooting.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18681,'Cultivating Immortals','2024-01-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cultivating Immortals is a multiplayer game, cultivation game, and competitive game. Including: lifespan system, realm system, combat system, magic system, mount system, boss system, drop treasure system, chat system, legacy system, and multi scenario PVE.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7b2g.jpg'),(18682,'Koufuku Sousakan','2004-04-15','Simulator','PlayStation 2','Set in a modern town created in a virtual space in Japan in the near future, this is a simulation game that aims to liberate 100 people who have become immobile and to give happiness to all. The player acts as an officer in charge of managing the virtual space, and aims to normalize the people he or she contacts while observing the life of any \"avatar\" living there, to protect the avatar from frequent attacks by obstructionists, and to collect and redistribute the feelings of happiness and unhappiness that they emit, in order to achieve a certain level of happiness for all people. Avatar behavior changes in response to happiness and can be influenced by other avatars involved in life. That is, even with the same avatar, life can change depending on the degree of happiness of the other avatars that are actively acting or negatively distressed by the sense of well-being during observation, or are involved with or in contact with other avatars that were previously offline. The interaction between people is called \"human scramble\" on the package and official website. Each avatar lasts about 20 minutes, and you can watch the same avatar over and over again.\n\nThe whole story is represented by 3DCG, but the avatar is represented by flat shading (a projection method that looks like an angular figure with fine planes). Avatar conversations and thoughts are expressed as text, and their voices are expressed as indistinct voices.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oan.jpg'),(18683,'Rumble Fighter: Unleashed','2016-12-16','Fighting','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rumble Fighter is a free-to-play fighting MMO game with real mixed martial arts and fast-paced beat-em-up action! Brawl with your friends and train to become the top Rumble Fighter!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yq9.jpg'),(18684,'Pro Basketball Manager 2025','2024-11-18','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Pro Basketball Manager 2025 is the ultimate basketball manager experience. Suit up and become the manager of a basketball team. You’ll have all the managerial tools you’ve come to expect in a manager game, scouting, facilities, training and more. Will you put emphasis on coaching or player development? Success is only the result of your decisions both on and off the court.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8sdy.jpg'),(18685,'Spark Era','2022-12-01','Fighting, Shooter, MOBA','Android, iOS','Spark Era is an immersive 3D battle royale mobile game that takes place in a futuristic, post-apocalyptic world where the humanity faction from Earth are fighting for survival while competing against other three factions. The game is set in a galactic environment and features both PvP gameplay. Players can team up with other players, and ultimately battle their ways in the harsh conditions of the universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x02.jpg'),(18686,'FarmersMahJongg',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18687,'Distancing','2021-02-02','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A very small game about social distancing in Covid-19 times, where you play a small scenario in daily life.\n\nYou play a character that is going to a party. While on your way you need to try and keep your social distance to the people in the town.\nBefore you can arrive at the party you will need to pick up some snacks that you can bring.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zze.jpg'),(18688,'Elaine','2017-02-14','Puzzle, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is elaine! A minimalistic tile-matching action game by Slight Super Powers. In this deceptively simple game, you\'ll have to deal with a shifting screen, multi-colored patterns of increasing speed and complexity, and an unrelenting countdown timer synced to brain-pumping music.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26l2.jpg'),(18689,'Spider Mall!','2023-12-12','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A night of urban exploration goes wrong for Explorer X as he finds himself trapped in an abandoned shopping mall facing off against security guards and a giant hungry spider. You make the choices in this live action bodycam FMV game. Escape the mall or die trying!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86ie.jpg'),(18690,'Top Gang','2021-10-25','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Top Gang is a very chaotic platform game for up to 4 cooperative players. You need to eliminate all enemies in the level to be able to advance at the same time you will have to rescue the \"Nuggets\" and take them safely to the exit. Your friends can be a big help or a stumbling block.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nka.jpg'),(18691,'Outbound','2026-12-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Build your own home on wheels and live sustainably off-grid. Craft workstations and power supplies, source energy from the sun, wind, or water, upgrade and customize your vehicle, grow crops, automate your production, and explore a colorful world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rfx.jpg'),(18692,'Holstin',NULL,'Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A psychological survival horror game set in an eerie, isolated 90s Polish town consumed by an ominous presence. You’ve come looking for answers, but everyone seems possessed by something foul. Explore the festering town, interrogate locals and fight ungodly manifestations to get to the truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jf8.jpg'),(18693,'Pou Boundless','2021-12-31','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18694,'Chess for Idiots','2024-02-01','Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Chess for idiots - a discipline of intellectual sport, invented and initiated by Ozjasz Goldberg. Seemingly chess for idiots resembles regular chess. The game is played on the same board using the same pieces. However, this is where the similarities end, because everything that would discriminate intellectually against players was eliminated from the rules. Therefore, there are practically no rules, and players can make any move with any pieces and capture any number of opponent\'s pieces. The victory is determined by the IQ (the lower, the greater the chances of winning) and the decision of Ozjasz Goldberg.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7bnm.jpg'),(18695,'SweetCat','2025-01-08','Simulator, Arcade','Android','Your family has gone on vacation without you. Can you help little Milio until they return? Feed him, dress him, decorate his room, and play with him so he doesn’t feel lonely in this virtual pet simulator.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co994o.jpg'),(18696,'Solasta II','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In a Mana-infused land, a dark force led by the enigmatic Shadwyn threatens Neokos. Bring your party of adventurers together across perilous realms in this Turn-Based Tactical RPG based on the SRD 5e ruleset. You make the choices, dice decide your destiny.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ko9.jpg'),(18697,'The Last of Us: Ellie Edition','2013-06-14','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 3','Twenty years after a mutated fungus started turning people all over the world into deadly zombies, humans become an endangered species. Joel, a Texan in his forties with the \"emotional range of a teaspoon\" (to quote Hermione from Harry Potter), finds himself responsible with the safety of a fourteen year old girl named Ellie whom he must smuggle to a militia group called the Fireflies. And as if the infected aren\'t enough of a hassle, they also have to deal with the authorities who wouldn\'t let them leave the quarantine zone, as well as other survivors capable of killing anyone who might have something useful in their backpacks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ubv.jpg'),(18698,'Vampire Night Shift','2020-08-29','Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Game Boy','Vampire Night Shift is a small adventure game about working the night shift at a convenience store. Also, you are a vampire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tci.jpg'),(18699,'Doko Demo Issho: Toro to Ippai','2004-09-02','Simulator','PlayStation 2','Word-based communication game in which you teach new words to Toro, who then passes the information on to a set of black cats known as Kuro.\n\nIt was released in September 2, 2004 on the PlayStation 2, and would mark the debut of Kuro. The game is compatible with the PS2\'s EyeToy accessory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6e6n.jpg'),(18700,'Pixel Run!','2015-05-06','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pixel run! A perfect game to play when you\'re calm!\nThis game has been inspired by Scott Cawthon\'s game, There Is No Pause Button!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6l9l.jpg'),(18701,'ThreeTwoPix: Fang Runner','2021-10-16','Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Legacy Mobile Device','Run your way through New Fang City, collecting diamonds, avoiding paperhands and jumping over awful flippers.\n\nAn endless arcade runner, can you beat the community highscore?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43o2.jpg'),(18702,'Microsoft Flight Simulator X: Steam Edition - Toposim South America','2017-04-20','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Toposim South America for FSX: Steam Edition provides LOD 11 / 19m Multi-LOD terrain mesh for South America, improving the accuracy of the default terrain mesh and offering a marked improvement to the landscape profile.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85px.jpg'),(18703,'Judas','2025-12-31','Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','A disintegrating starship. A desperate escape plan. You are the mysterious and troubled Judas. Your only hope for survival is to make or break alliances with your worst enemies. Will you work together to fix what you broke – or will you leave it to burn?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5va3.jpg'),(18704,'Blue Drifter','2020-01-09','Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An experimental bounty hunter game set on a harsh rainy planet. Track down criminals with your flying car, and eliminate them to ultimately buy yourself a ticket to outer space, and freedom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21xg.jpg'),(18705,'Reflection','2025-05-01','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You woke up in some basement and don\'t remember who you are or how you ended up here... But what you do know is that you need to get out of here...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rru.jpg'),(18706,'The Abyss Desire','2025-05-02','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A first-person exploration game set in the deep, dark ocean. Use your flashlight carefully, avoid hidden dangers, and find the items you need to complete your quest.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18707,'Hauntsfield','2021-10-22','Role-playing (RPG)','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Game Boy','Hauntsfield is a short Halloween RPG designed for Game Boy. Play time is about 40-60 minutes. The game has spooky themes, but isn\'t scary and is appropriate for kids & adults alike.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co88d9.jpg'),(18708,'Maimai DX Buddies','2023-09-14','Music, Arcade','Arcade','The fifth release of the \"maimai DX\" series, featuring enhanced 2 player modes and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72vm.jpg'),(18709,'Croakwood',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Croakwood is a creative, relaxed town building simulation game about frogs and nature! Design and create structures, plan and decorate towns, and explore an ancient forest to guide the growth of a charming community of tiny amphibians as they settle into their new life in the lush and wild woods.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8br4.jpg'),(18710,'Quote Codes','2018-01-18','Puzzle, Quiz/Trivia, Indie','iOS','Quote Codes is a word puzzle game where you unlock your favorite quotes by substituting one letter at a time. In every game, each symbol stands for a letter. Your aim is to guess and decode the quotes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gycaxjhpzi0bjlsfyqhh.jpg'),(18711,'Sleep Paralysis: The Uncanny Valley','2022-12-14','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A story-rich first-person psychological horror game. You are in a lonely house, suffering from sleep paralysis. Deal with Thomas’ past trauma and make meaningful decisions that prevent you from going insane.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dyv.jpg'),(18712,'Grayland','2020-01-15','Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','A noir story of a tiny bird fighting in the colourless world of Grayland. \n \nGrayland is a story driven side-scroller game with unique art style. You, as a tiny bird find yourself in the middle of the war between the Human and the Alien forces. The war scorched the earth and made the once peaceful land radioactive. \nFly and fight your way through the radiation filled lands, save your loved one and your children. Fly inside the mines and ruins, eliminate the radioactive hotspots, avoid the drones hunting you, and beat the bosses. \n \nDuring the levels you face different enemies and continuously discover the puzzles of the story. \nF E A T U R E S: \n \n● 16 challenging handcrafted levels \n \n● Various boss fights \n \n● Heart catching story \n \n● Unique atmosphere and art style \n \n● Beautiful music \n \n \nNever give up, show them that even if you\'re a tiny being, your actions are important, be the ONE who saves the World.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m87.jpg'),(18713,'Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket','2024-10-27','Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Android, iOS','Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket lets you easily collect Pokémon cards. Creatures Inc. has created exciting new visual effects for cards that are only possible digitally.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bwv.jpg'),(18714,'Shards of Dread','2025-05-02','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It is a psychological horror game and walking simulator. Get chased by monsters. Monsters jumping towards at your screen.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18715,'Amikin Village',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Explore the enchanting world of Amiterra, home to the cute yet formidable creatures known as Amikins! Dive into an open-world adventure where you can fight, farm, and build. Collect and evolve Amikins, construct your enchanted base, and embark on thrilling quests blending fantasy and sci-fi!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rpf.jpg'),(18716,'Money Parasite: Usotsuki na Onna','2022-12-22','Strategy, Visual Novel, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','An otome game by Takuyo.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69a3.jpg'),(18717,'Love Is All Around: Love In The Room','2024-02-05','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Xiamen, I\'m here!\" You will play as the male protagonist Gu Yi and immerse yourself in a unique shared living life with three beautiful roommates in Xiamen from a first person perspective.Who you would choose at the end, is up to you to decide.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91b8.jpg'),(18718,'Payday 3: Fear & Greed Tailor Pack','2024-09-16','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S','The Fear & Greed Tailor pack gives a visual representation of greed itself as heisters don the typical garb of the dreaded day trader.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m3m.jpg'),(18719,'Rebel Raiders: Operation Nighthawk','2006-03-21','Simulator, Strategy','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Command your squadron as you fight against one of the largest air armadas ever unleashed! Rebel Raiders: Operation Nighthawk is an intense flight shooter which emphasizes frantic dogfighting over flight simulation.\nLead the Ghost Squadron for the freedom of the Alliance! Pilot high tech aircraft and engage in non stop, arcade styled aerial combat on missions that will determine the very fate of the world.\n\nExperience a new sense of freedom using the Wii Remote to pilot your aircraft\n\nDefend the front lines with over 20 futuristic fighter and bomber aircraft\n\nUse your skills to unlock secret and powerful weapons upgrades\n\nVoiced cutscenes brings the story and immersive action to life','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/we5yfaasnctzizypgomc.jpg'),(18720,'Wolcen: Lords of Mayhem - Deluxe Edition','2023-03-15','Role-playing (RPG)','Xbox One','A bold and beautiful hack n\' slash ARPG with no class restrictions and satisfying brutal combat. Forge a bloody path through a dark fantasy world in an epic story campaign, paving the way to a truly dynamic endgame, master your skills, and become The Ascended.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bb8.jpg'),(18721,'Explodemon!','2011-11-03','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 3, Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows)','An explosive homage to SNES-era platformers mixed with a modern physics-puzzle twist, Explodemon is non-stop action mayhem like you\'ve never seen before. Players use Explodemon\'s self-destructive nature to combat enemies and fly through the air, all the while solving a huge variety of physics-based puzzles (and, naturally, causing incalculable collateral damage).\n\nWhen the peaceful planet of Nibia is attacked by the malicious Vortex forces, the fate of the star system is thrust into the one pair of hands it shouldn\'t be: the malfunctioning Guardian robot Explodemon.\n\nFeaturing 12 huge levels of pulse-pounding platforming, a deep control system, devastatingly up-close-and-personal combat, upgradable special abilities, comic-book style cutscenes and a story that\'ll make you giggle, cry, or simply sigh with indifference, Explodemon isn\'t your average game. No way. It\'s above average, at least. No, wait - so way above average that it\'s pure awesome. That\'s more like it.\n\nExplodemon! is unrelenting, hard-core brain-tickling action for those who grew up playing platformers, as well as those who\'ll discover just how awesome they were.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qhi.jpg'),(18722,'Knights of the Zodiac: The Phoenix Returns','2022-10-05','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','Game Boy Color','Knights of the Zodiac: The Phoenix Returns is a fan game created for the Game Boy Color that retraces the beginning of the animation (from the moment where Seiya gets his armor) and follows the battle against Ikki.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qwv.jpg'),(18723,'Payday 3: Fear & Greed Weapon Pack','2024-09-16','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S','The Fear & Greed Weapon Pack expands the heister\'s arsenal with three high-caliber firearms, each able to blow a silver dollar-sized hole in any target.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m3l.jpg'),(18724,'Fate/Stay Night: Réalta Nua','2012-11-29','Visual Novel','Android, iOS, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation 2','The complicated threads in Fate/Stay Night unravel in Réalta Nua. The series tells some of the most bloody and brutal love stories ever. The three heroines, Saber, Rin, and Sakura, each have a tale to tell, and depending on which path Emiya Shirou takes, he can either become the savior who ends the Holy Grail Wars for good or become another heroic spirit bound to be called out when the flames of war start again.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p4f.jpg'),(18725,'Comic Road','1997-09-26','Adventure','PC-FX','Comicroad is a \"life simulation\" game, starring a young girl (whom the player names themselves) who dreams of becoming a manga artist. In order to become successful, she has to do more than just draw well; it is important to develop other aspects of her personality, and also keep an eye on the finances, otherwise working too much might deteriorate her drawing skills. Social life, physical exercises, reading - everything has consequences!\n\nThe gameplay consists mainly of making decisions (through menu choices); there is no player character navigation in the game, except shops, which are viewed from first-person perspective. There is a variety of ways to manage the girl\'s life. The player can make a schedule for a whole month, or decide every day what to do. Every action has an effect on the heroine\'s parameters. For example, just resting every day reduces physical shape and appeal. Working on the manga increases respective skills. It is possible to call friends and spend time with them, or go shopping. There are many items in the game, all of which influence the heroine\'s stats in that or another way - for example clothes, drawing accessories, books, or even a PC-FX console, that can be bought in an electronics store for about 20000 yen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o8w.jpg'),(18726,'Turok: Dinosaur Hunter','1997-03-04','Shooter, Adventure','Nintendo 64, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A world where time has no meaning - and evil knows no bounds. Torn from a world long gone, the time traveling warrior Turok has found himself thrust into a savage land torn by conflict.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yzh.jpg'),(18727,'Rocket League: Painted Power Bundle','2024-10-14','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The Painted Power bundle is available for a limited time! Unlock Gold Painted Octane, Gold Painted Dueling Dragons Goal Explosion, and more Painted Black Market and Exotic items.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eu6.jpg'),(18728,'Omnipresent','2015-09-28','Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','What would you do if you had the power of a self-aware AI? Take control of S.E.N.T.I.E.N.T and see what choices you would make. Connect to the Internet and hack into corporations, governments, websites and more...','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18729,'Hajis','2022-10-25','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You have to maintain your mentality in an place where any sound can cause your deathHajis is a survival co-op game 1-4 players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dxq.jpg'),(18730,'Asterix & Obelix XXXL: The Ram From Hibernia','2022-10-27','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Join Asterix & Obelix in a brand-new original story in… Hibernia! Explore this crazy action-adventure in a local coop mode up to 4 players!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5g8v.jpg'),(18731,'Golazo! 2: Pixel Stars','2023-03-30','Sport','Nintendo Switch','Experience a whole new way of playing Golazo!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dlc.jpg'),(18732,'Silver Trigger 64','2016-08-16','Sin género','Web browser','One Button - On Rails - Espionage Shooter\n\nAn homage to Goldeneye 007 made for the One Button Jam.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vih.jpg'),(18733,'Simple Characters 2000 Series Vol. 11: Detective Conan - The Board Game','2002-08-29','Adventure, Card & Board Game','PlayStation','The fourth overall Detective Conan game developed by Bandai for the PlayStation. Unlike other entries in the franchise this one is a board game instead of an Adventure game','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/eptvku6lxwlinwfayoho.jpg'),(18734,'Doritos Crash Course','2010-12-08','Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One','Doritos Crash Course is a fast-paced, funny, obstacle course game show for your Avatar to compete against your friends and family over XboxLive. Play through 15 exciting platformer levels across 3 different countries. Compete against your friends and family up to four players over XboxLive and local split-screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2c10.jpg'),(18735,'Trail Out','2022-09-07','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to the Trail Out festival! Reckless races in different parts of the planet await you! Explosions of cars, shouts of departing drivers, hype from fans, all this awaits you here!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cz5.jpg'),(18736,'SurvivalScape','2024-07-22','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Venture into SurvivalScape, an exhilarating auto shooter bullet hell! Choose your hero from a roster of exciting characters, each with their own special abilities and playstyles. Battle through waves of enemies, collect crystals to level up your hero, and confront unique bosses. Can you survive?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j81.jpg'),(18737,'Puzkin: Magnetic Odyssey','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','PUZKIN: Magnetic Odyssey invites players to explore a vibrant, magical world where magnetic energy sustains the balance of nature and creatures called Puzzies. Players, embodying chosen children, are transported to this mysterious realm to restore its harmony through epic adventures, collaborative construction, and immersive quests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96ry.jpg'),(18738,'Baby Shark: Sing & Swim Party','2023-09-15','Music, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Swim across the wide ocean with the Shark Family to enjoy the Fin-tastic Festival. Choose from five customizable characters and play either in the runner or rhythmic game mode. Sing and swim to fin-omenal songs and get rewarded with tons of musical cards to add to your album.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72nl.jpg'),(18739,'Zarya and the Cursed Skull','2017-03-08','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Zarya and the Cursed Skull is an action-adventure game that tells a story based on a fantastic novel. In addition, several dungeons filled with creatures and puzzles await you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30ep.jpg'),(18740,'Recursive Ruin','2022-05-18','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Recursive Ruin is a kaleidoscopic narrative-puzzle game. Explore an infinitely fractal world of strange beauty and mind-bending physics. Inhabit a despondent artist in search of meaning and experience a bittersweet story that cascades into the surreal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5m45.jpg'),(18741,'Left to Die in Zombhai','2011-08-31','Shooter','PlayStation Portable','Welcome to Zombhai, a city populated by zombies! What will it take you to survive? Featuring a wide range of weapons and locations this game will bring hours of fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kjq.jpg'),(18742,'Mistery','2025-01-20','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mistery is a multiplayer game of survival and social deduction. You work with others to collect materials, survive the dangers, and complete tasks. Beware of monsters, but more of the Alternates disguising as your teammates. They can change into supernatural monsters and attack you at any time.\n\nThe game seamlessly blends survival, top-down combat, social deduction, and new weird stories into a unique and visually striking experience, strengthed by a proximity chat system. Join forces with friends to destroy some friendships in Mistery!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99iz.jpg'),(18743,'Wanderer','2022-06-28','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wanderer is a top down action roguelike where you play as a cat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hp5.jpg'),(18744,'King Rabbit: Race','2022-06-15','Platform, Racing, Sport, Indie, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Hop quickly through deadly obstacle courses and get further than the other rabbits to win! Catchy gameplay and competitive leaderboards will have you playing just one more round. Earn trophies to rank up and face more challenging opponents! Are you skilled enough to place in the top 10 of the daily challenge? A new daily challenge level is generated daily. You\'ll be exercising your precision, speed, coordination, and memory. Use the arrow keys or WASD to move and hop your way to victory. Invite & follow your friends to race with them!\n\nIncludes an in-game marketplace is where you can buy and sell rabbit skins and rings! Rabbit skins are limited to only 100 of each design. With tons of rabbits and new ones being added, you\'re sure to find something your style. Decorate your rabbits with rings for unique spawn and death sound effects and particles. Complete quests for soft currency and encounter rare items on encounter islands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rq0.jpg'),(18745,'Parallel Lab','2022-04-28','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A two-player cooperative puzzle adventure, that is all about communication. Players have to follow parallel paths, explore a secret laboratory, describe what they see, and work together to unravel the mystery. Parallel Lab is played on two devices with a browser.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4o9a.jpg'),(18746,'Monica\'s Newlywed Life','2024-09-06','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','When Kyle and his party\'s adventure comes to an abrupt end, Kyle decides to ask Monica to marry him. Starting a new life in the countryside, they must earn a living, and get to know their new home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6z6b.jpg'),(18747,'Shadow Gambit: The Cursed Crew – Complete Edition','2023-12-06','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','The Complete Edition includes the Main Game, the DLC expansions Shadow Gambit: Yuki\'s Wish and Shadow Gambit: Zagan\'s Ritual as well as the Original Soundtrack and the Artbook & Strategy Guide in one package at a special discount price.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hso.jpg'),(18748,'Aquanaut\'s Holiday: Hidden Memories','2008-09-25','Simulator, Adventure','PlayStation 3','The actual story mode of the game can be compared to an adventure game. The main - unnamed - character is a journalist, in search of the missing oceanographer William \"Bill\" Graber. Using a submarine called the Dolphin no.2 you explore the seas for clues.\n\nThe game takes place in Kisira Atoll, in Polynesia. An oceanographic research facility named Kisira Base is the starting point and where you always come back to, for supplies (such as batteries for sonar navigation buoys) and equipment.\n\nTwo scientists work at the base, the young and dreamy Jessica Porter and the conservative chief Robert Kemelman. Both assist you in solving mysteries, each in their own way. Jessica likes to believe fairytales and legends, while Robert usually comes up with a scientific explanation.\n\nAll the fish, animals and other discoveries are added to a database. Some fish can communicate and the player has to repeat the sounds made by a fish, using the four trigger buttons of the Sixaxis controller.\n\nAt all times, the unlocked area of the map is free to explore as you like.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49vq.jpg'),(18749,'Star Jolt','2019-12-18','Racing, Indie, Arcade','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Star Jolt is a pure highscore chasing 80s arcade style game where control at break neck speed is essential.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tcs.jpg'),(18750,'Dragon Chronicles: Black Tears','2023-03-21','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dragon Chronicles: Black Tears is a turn-based RPG where you use combinations of various heroes to clear dungeons. Train and utilize heroes to fight off those corrupted by the Black Tears and overcome difficult trials.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7w64.jpg'),(18751,'Monster Fight','2022-04-01','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Monster Fight is a play to earn blockchain game. The monsters level up in Adventure and PvP modes. You can apply skills and continue to climb the ranks. Monster Fight uses 3 monsters to play and you can build up those monsters with different skills or level them up to earn more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4n25.jpg'),(18752,'Jikuu Senki Mu','1991-09-13','Role-playing (RPG)','Game Boy','There used to be a continent called \"Mu Continent\", which was ruled by the king of the country called Prina. King Lars II suddenly turned the state religion of Neil into the evil religion of Max. Shortly after the Neil people were ousted from the sanctuary, the Queen of Purina suddenly disappeared. In addition, the newborn son of the king was taken away by someone. After the conversion, monsters began to appear in various parts of the continent. People began rumors that the people of Neil were manipulating monsters. It\'s been 16 years since then. The demons, who continued to grow in power, finally invaded Purina Castle. The seriously injured king runs to the remote village \"Eribe\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hhm.jpg'),(18753,'Cursed Zombie Portals 666','2021-06-06','Shooter, Adventure','Android','Are you ready to survive as a warrior with lost 666 cursed portals, fight zombies, find portals and get out of curse? There are many weapons and ammo in the game for your survival. All you need in this game is good courage and finding portals by exploring dilapidated buildings. remember that portals may not always open to the correct dimensions. If you want to explore new worlds, download this game now and let the world talk about your heroism.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cqe.jpg'),(18754,'New Bremen','2000-04-10','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Computer game on the continuation of the famous animated series about the adventures of Troubadour and his friends - the cartoon \"New Bremen\". \n \nThe fairy kingdom has changed since the times when famous Bremen musicians lived in it. Our hero - a private detective, gets the job from the robbers to take away the crown from the king himself. Faced with deceit, the famous Detective repents aiding the robbers and, together with the musicians of Bremen, helps the king find his grandson and take the crown from the evil robbers. The plot full of humor is worthy of the level of a modern detective story, a mixture of love, everyday and political intrigues at the level of the royal court. The disc has a lot of music and songs performed by popular pop singers. The game has no age restrictions and is recommended to everyone without exception.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1mj0.jpg'),(18755,'Liminalcore','2024-10-28','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore and admire while navigate through eerie, surreal environments inspired by the Backrooms lore. Explore this uncanny world lost in time and get lost in the otherworldly architecture in a world where reality bends and your sanity is tested.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8q7u.jpg'),(18756,'Forza Motorsport 5','2013-11-22','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Xbox One','Forza Motorsport 5 is a cinematic automotive journey starring the world’s greatest cars and tracks. Built from the ground up to take advantage of Xbox One and the vast power of the cloud, no game better delivers the wide-eyed thrill of racing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q6o.jpg'),(18757,'Triglav','2018-08-01','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS','The tower of Triglav consisting of 50+ floors. Go for the top floor where the princess is captured, by searching for keys that open the doors to the next floor, by solving puzzles, and by monster hunting.\nIn this unique world created by richly detailed retro pixel art, create your own unique character by combining items of over 2,500 types.\n\nThis is a smartphone version of the hack and slash type RPG released as an indie web game in 2002 and has been played by over 500,000 players.\nMany audio and visual effects, such as sound effects and music, have been added which were not included in the original version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30ms.jpg'),(18758,'18 Wheels of Steel: Convoy','2005-09-01','Racing, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take the wheel of a fast paced, high intensity trucking business. Start as a one man show, bidding on jobs, then build your fleet into an unstoppable convoy and deliver the goods. Grow your business and your fleet, but beware - your reputation is everything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77nd.jpg'),(18759,'Bandle Tale: A League of Legends Story','2024-02-21','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Bandle Tale: A League of Legends Story is a crafting RPG set in the whimsical world of Bandle City. After a party goes wrong, the portals that connect your home collapse and throw everything into chaos! Using your knitting magic and backpack house, restore the portals to reunite Bandle City.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72zy.jpg'),(18760,'Jinki Resurrection','2021-02-25','Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','Jinki Resurrection is a Japanese 18+rated visual novel eroge and the second game for the PC consoles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kwr.jpg'),(18761,'Dormant','2023-12-01','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game\'s story is about the mental torture of an individual who lived in a hostile and isolated environment. Little issues with no way to vent build up until the victim lashes out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8oek.jpg'),(18762,'Fata Deum','2025-12-31','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fata Deum is a god game asking the player \"With the power of a god, who will you become?\". As a powerful god the player fights against up to four other (AI) gods to rule a fantastic world and its citizens. These citizens act self-sufficient and need to be convinced to follow the player.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co933c.jpg'),(18763,'Tails of Iron','2021-09-16','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Tails of Iron is an Adventure RPG-lite game set in a charming and brutal world. Playing as Redgi the Rat, you are heir to the throne when your kingdom is raided by the Iron Frog. Players face challenging, tactical and stunning combat encounters in order to rebuild the Rat Kingdom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pae.jpg'),(18764,'Bro Falls: Ultimate Showdown','2021-06-25','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bro Falls is an asymmetric massively multiplayer party game with chaotic elements, trap activations and big Falls. Up-to 60 online players in a showdown party and only one who can get the victory. Play as Brokkoli to activate the traps or avoid them as a juicy food and win the rounds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bu6.jpg'),(18765,'Courage: ZaGame',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18766,'Need 4 Meat',NULL,'Indie, Arcade','Web browser','10,000 B.C. Primitive man walks the earth, proud but vulnerable. His only desire is that most scarce and precious resource: MEAT.\n\nTake up your spears and establish yourself as the true apex predator. Pick off skittish rabbits if you can. But beware the crafty wolves, who pursue rabbits and humans both. For all are made of meat, and must return to meat in the bitter end.\n\nWill the hunter become the hunted? Will you finally succumb to the relentless logic of natural selection? Or will you finally fulfill your….NEED 4 MEAT?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ulw.jpg'),(18767,'Hot and Lovely: Suger','2024-03-29','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hot and Lovely: Suger is a classic puzzle match-3 game. Players need to eliminate three or more tiles of the same type to complete the specified goal, and within the specified number of steps. Every time you complete the goal, you pass the level and you can unlock the photo album.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7j4o.jpg'),(18768,'Goosebumps: The Game','2015-10-14','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The walk home from school today is going to be a lot spookier than usual… Your sleepy neighborhood’s been overrun by monsters! Werewolves prowl the woods, Gnomes roam underfoot, and scarecrows walk at midnight. But these aren’t ordinary monsters—they’re R.L. Stine’s famous Goosebumps monsters, released from their books and looking to wreak havoc!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co217j.jpg'),(18769,'Hotel Giant','2019-07-04','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Our Hotels. Your Rules. In Hotel Giant, you call the shots as you direct every aspect of hotel operations. You control the construction of your hotel – from site selection to building type – to personalized room features. Build up to 19 different hotel complexes, ranging from romantic get-away hotels to skyscraper business hotels to luxury 5-star hotels with exquisite spa and entertainment facilities.\n\nYou’ll also get the chance to satisfy your inner voyeur by observing your guests’ every move and reacting to their feedback.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43dc.jpg'),(18770,'Crusader Kings II: Conclave Content Pack','2016-02-02','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Conclave Content Pack pack includes:\n\n- Corners of the Earth Building Pack: Pyramids of Giza, Petra, Hadrian’s Wall, Charlemagne’s Palace, Visby Ringmur, and the Agra Fort appear on the map\n- Finno-Ugric Portrait Pack: New faces for this northern nation\n- Indian Boats Unit Pack and Arabic Boats Unit Pack\n- Mongol/Steppe Male and Female Councilor Model Pack and\n- Western/Christian Female Councilor Model Pack\n- New Event Pictures and one new loading screen: because we love our artists','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mfc.jpg'),(18771,'The Yanus Plan for Escape from the Void','2024-01-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"The Yanus Plan for Escape from the Void\" is a first person perspective escape room game where you lose your memory and don\'t know where you are. You have to keep moving forward and explore the truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7n8t.jpg'),(18772,'F1 25','2025-05-30','Racing, Simulator, Sport','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Leave your mark on the world of racing in F1 25, the official video game of the 2025 FIA Formula One World Championship, featuring a revamped My Team mode, the thrilling third chapter of Braking Point, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mk6.jpg'),(18773,'Cafe Crush','2019-07-19','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Cafe Crush is a choice-driven visual novel featuring mini-games and quizzes, set in a quaint little café run by three cute girls. Cafe Crush is fully voiced featuring a selection of engaging mini-games and quizzes as well as a point system to help track your relationship progress with each girl. Discover their favorite things and buy them their ideal gift to get a date!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co267y.jpg'),(18774,'Little Nightmares I & II','2022-04-28','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This collection of two Little Nightmares games will introduce you to a lovely, frightening and iconic puzzle-platformer series, starting with the original from 2017.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co439o.jpg'),(18775,'Dream Heights','2013-06-20','Simulator','Android, iOS','\"Dream Heights\" is a mobile game developed by Zynga where players build their own skyscraper by adding different floors with stores, restaurants, apartments, and more, where the goal is to create a thriving tower by managing your residents and businesses within it; it allows players to customise their tower, connect with friends, and even outbuild famous landmarks like the Statue of Liberty.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g7g.jpg'),(18776,'Death Maze','2021-12-31','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Path of life and death.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18777,'Hello, Goodbye, Summer Girl',NULL,'Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Pixel Art & Yuri & Cinema! The story of a Bad Girl in Miami and a JK from Tokyo. A Girl meets Girl Entertainment Crime Thriller.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co394l.jpg'),(18778,'Those Nights at Ring\'s 2',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kim.jpg'),(18779,'VQD','2019-09-03','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get through all levels in a colorful and crazy world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oro.jpg'),(18780,'Nirvana Noir',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nirvana Noir, the sequel to 2021\'s \"Genesis Noir,\" is a cosmic adventure beyond time and space. Become your own existential threat and put out the fires of eternity.\n\nDual noir adventures beyond time and space; one where the Big Bang was never fired, the other an explosion of color and sin. Your new lover is tangled in rumors of a Bigger Bang. Can you unravel its mystery and stop the threat to the cosmic city?\n\nHit the street; counter the culture; be changed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h68.jpg'),(18781,'MonsterReaver','2022-01-14','Strategy, Card & Board Game','Web browser','MonsterReaver is a multiplayer game where you place stones to take your opponents stones.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4znd.jpg'),(18782,'Fritz Chess 17 Steam Edition','2020-07-29','Strategy, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This chess program offers you everything you will need as a dedicated chess enthusiast, with innovative training methods for amateurs and professionals alike using the neural chess engine \"Fat Fritz\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5oir.jpg'),(18783,'03:17 am','2017-05-20','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"03:17 am\" was made in 8 days for the #AdvJam2017 (Adventure Jam 2017).\nIt\'s a narrative game set up in a closed, theatrical scene and inspired by Hopper\'s Nighthawks painting.\n\nIt features a 3-track soundtrack made by electronic producer LeGone (accessible through the jukebox when outside a conversation).\n\nIf you\'re stuck (not likely to happen, but who knows), maybe have a look at the screenshots, it might help...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8s1t.jpg'),(18784,'Echoes of Heroes: Legends Never Die','2025-06-30','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pixel Art Roguelite Fantasy Team Builder Turn-Base RPG','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95wn.jpg'),(18785,'Mahokenshi - The Samurai Deckbuilder','2023-01-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mahokenshi is a turn-based blend of adventure, deck-building and deep hex-grid strategy. Create your deck, out-smart your enemy, battle challenging demons and adventure through the Celestial Islands to protect your home from the forces of corruption.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uoo.jpg'),(18786,'Jigsaw Puzzles for Kids and Adults: Europe','2020-04-20','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Jigsaw Puzzles for Kids and Adults - Europe Do puzzle in a new puzzle way! Advanced puzzle layout and involving game play will help you to relax after a hard-working day. Jigsaw Puzzles for Kids and Adults - Europe is designed for adults and for kids.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gbg.jpg'),(18787,'Frostrail','2026-12-31','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Through the frost, death follows the tracks. Dive into a ruthless open world survival FPS, solo or co-op. Explore, scavenge, craft and fight to endure a frozen, corrupted world. Operate and upgrade your steam-powered train through an unforgiving wasteland, where every choice is a matter of survival.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nl4.jpg'),(18788,'Adventure','1983-10-01','Adventure','Atari 2600','Adventure is a video game for the Atari 2600 video game console, released in 1980. In the game, the player controls a square avatar whose quest is to hunt an open world environment for a magical chalice, returning it to the golden castle. The game world is populated by roaming enemies: dragons, which can eat the avatar; and a bat, which randomly steals and hides items around the game world.\n\nAdventure was designed and programmed by Atari employee Warren Robinett, and published by Atari, Inc. At the time, Atari programmers were generally given full control on the creative direction and development cycle for their games, and this required them to plan for their next game as they neared completion of their current one to stay productive.\n\nRobinett submitted the source code for Adventure to Atari management in June 1979 and soon left Atari. Atari released the game in early 1980.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69tb.jpg'),(18789,'Gran Saga','2021-11-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Gran Saga is a gigantic MMORPG mobile game with excellent graphics quality and a huge world. It tells the story of the Knights\' journey to save the kingdom from the curse of the dragon. Players will start their dreamlike adventure through this game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h06.jpg'),(18790,'Nehahra','2000-08-01','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','17 maps by an all-star team of mappers, cutscenes, new monsters, great features. Comes with a custom engine. Neharha is considered by many as one of the innovative mods that shifted the Quake modding dynamics toward single-player map development. The Episodic spiritual fan sequel to Quake contained a four-hour fully voice acted machinima movie and was well over 53817 kilobytes, an incredible map pack at the time, still considered by many as the best Quake mod.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4mx2.jpg'),(18791,'Yu-Gi-Oh! Legacy of the Duelist Arc-V - ARC League Championship','2016-12-06','Simulator','Xbox One','Play 2 pre-constructed decks, Prediction Princess Deck and Igknight Deck. Includes additional duels in Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V Campaign and Challenge Mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bbg.jpg'),(18792,'Moon Mystery','2024-10-28','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Moon\'s haunted. No really. Figure out what happened up there, unravel the moon’s mysteries, and uncover why we really raced to land on its surface in 1969. Fill up on oxygen, load up your guns, and set out on a celestial FPS investigation that starts on the Moon and leads across the universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ljx.jpg'),(18793,'A Matter of Principle','2023-02-02','Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','A Matter of Principle is an interactive historical comic in visual novel format. You have to participate in one of the most high-profile events of the XX century.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60up.jpg'),(18794,'Kingdom Two Crowns: Dead Lands','2020-04-28','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Enter the dark lands of Kingdom. Play as unique monarchs, including the Shardbinder Miriam, with powerful traits from the gothic horror action-RPG Bloodstained. Ride the gigantic beetle steed to lay out traps, the eerie undead mount that summons barriers impeding the progress of the Greed, and from Bloodstained the mythic demon horse “Gaming” with its powerful charge attack. Building your Kingdom has never been spookier!\n\nWe will continue to keep the feeling of exploration, discovery, and strategy alive in Kingdom Two Crowns in post-release updates with more themed settings, each with unique styles that marvel the eye while changing how you rule the lands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2jx6.jpg'),(18795,'Starship Survivor',NULL,'Adventure','Sin plataforma','Starship Survivor by Brainium is a thrilling new rogue-lite shoot ‘em up game! Experience the action as you battle hordes of alien monsters that are terrorizing the universe. From the moment your ship leaves the Hangar it is a race against time to defeat enemies and collect all of the resources you can before the indestructible Void Monsters arrive. Collect power crystals to level-up an arsenal of automated weapons to survive waves of vicious alien enemies. There is nowhere to hide; the only option is to charge your starship’s Jump Drive enough to escape the onslaught of dangerous monsters. Use coins to unlock weapons, items, and permanent upgrades that will help you complete objectives and survive against increasingly powerful and multiplying enemy invaders in sectors to come.\nStarship Survivor is a galactic time survival game with the best virtual joystick ever created! Enjoy retro space shooter elements, intuitive controls, unique gameplay, and increasingly powerful enemy invaders that will put your skills to the test. See how long you can collect, destroy, power-up, and survive.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18796,'Fate of the World','2011-09-29','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fate of the World is a dramatic global strategy game that puts all our futures in your hands. The game features a dramatic set of scenarios based on the latest science covering the next two centuries. You must manage a balancing act of protecting the Earth’s resources and climate versus the needs of an ever-growing world population, who are demanding ever more food, power, and living space.\n\nFate of the World is brought to you by the award-winning Red Redemption games team and Battlestations: Midway Producer Klaude Thomas with climate science by Dr. Myles Allen (University of Oxford), writing by David Bishop (Dr. Who, 2000AD) and music composed by Richard Jacques (Mass Effect, Alice in Wonderland) with game design by veteran game designer Matthew Miles Griffiths (Conflict: Desert Storm, Battlestations: Midway).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nk7.jpg'),(18797,'Mystic Destinies: Serendipity of Aeons - Tatsuya Epilogue',NULL,'Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Fast forward two years to the future and see how life has changed for you and Tatsuya. While you\'ve never been more in love, you\'re not quite as far along in the relationship as you\'d hoped. After a romantic date though, your life changes forever. Can an old threat bring promises of a new, brighter future?','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18798,'Les Manley Bundle',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3coo.jpg'),(18799,'Victor Vran: Cauldron of Chaos Dungeon',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','The Cauldron of Chaos is an ever-changing dungeon that offers randomized daily challenges for veteran demon hunters. This new content is available only for characters of level 26 and above.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18800,'Repit','2025-03-20','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Madness is the repetition of the same action over and over again, in the hope of a change. The challenge that Repit throws at your nerves is not everyone is ready to accept and only a few will be able to reach the end','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5m9d.jpg'),(18801,'Lily in Puzzle World','2023-11-15','Platform, Puzzle, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Explore a sketchbook world in a casual mix of platforming and brainteasing puzzles!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dgz.jpg'),(18802,'Commander Tiberius Troubleson','2025-01-08','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An unforgiving handcrafted action roguelite where secrets abound and death makes you stronger.\nFight your way through hordes of creatures using powerful spells, potent skills, permanent upgrades and lots of bullets.\n\nCTT is a fast-paced roguelite platformer focused on action rather than platforming, featuring handcrafted levels. Fight your way through hordes of creatures using powerful spells, potent skills, permanent upgrades, and lots of bullets. Discover the secrets of Anarth, explore intriguing landscapes and face terrible foes.\n\nLevels are handmade and selected from a large pool. Each one has a unique layout, different secrets and unique items, guaranteeing a truly unique run every time you die.\n\nDeath is a learning experience! Upon dying you can permanently upgrade different skills and face the challenge again, stronger.\n\nYou will come across powerful spells to help you along the way. Every spell you acquire will always be at the tips of your fingers. You can switch and combine them at your pleasure and wreak havoc among your enemies.\n\nAs well as spells, you will equip passive upgrades to increase your chances of success. Improve your bullets and skills as well as many other perks. You can equip up to 6 upgrades at any given time, swapping them and combining them as you like to find the most optimal or most fun way to play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8npj.jpg'),(18803,'Eric & Yannik X','2023-10-01','Platform','Web browser','Wipe out Don Glaber and return the stolen money to Andrew.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ynl.jpg'),(18804,'Super Runabout: San Francisco Edition','2001-06-21','Racing','Dreamcast','Drive around San Francisco doing odd jobs and stopping a criminal syndicate from taking over. Includes everything from an Indy car to limousine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sxx.jpg'),(18805,'One More Day','2024-04-15','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','¡Welcome to One More Day! Embark on an exciting and challenging experience where fashion and survival intertwine in this pixel art 2D game. Confront the dark threat of endless hordes of zombies as you embody a brave hero, equipped only with trusty underwear! Survive One More Day.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wmd.jpg'),(18806,'The Birdcage 2','2019-02-01','Puzzle','Android, iOS','The Birdcage 2 is a mystery puzzle game in which you save trapped birds from cages containing ancient locks and riddles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1krk.jpg'),(18807,'Off the Grid',NULL,'Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','In Off The Grid, players step into the shoes of lone adventurer Rowland Felix as he sets out to explore the mystery that is foiled across the altered dimension he lies in ...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ctf9jojadvdlbhhnonqq.jpg'),(18808,'Demonsions: Industry','2021-04-22','Simulator, Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Demonsions: Industry is an open-world, procedurally generated factory builder game. Everything can be mined. Enjoy crafting, building, and fully automating your survival in this strange world full of wonders and hidden dangers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xsv.jpg'),(18809,'Lucy Dreaming','2022-10-18','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Lucy Dreaming is inspired and influenced by the classic 90s point & click adventure games, from its beautifully-realised pixel-art style to its irreverent, sarcastic humour. Delve into Lucy’s ever-expanding world as you explore a rich narrative, solve satisfying puzzles and discover hidden Easter eggs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co50o6.jpg'),(18810,'Icons of Theia',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Android, iOS','Icons of Theia is a Tactical RPG for Android and ioS. Collect and develop unique hero characters, bring your Icons to compete in 1v1 tactical turn-based strategy matches and use simple tools to create your own maps, skins, and game modes','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5r8v.jpg'),(18811,'Aeronautica Imperialis: Flight Command','2020-05-28','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take to the skies! Guide your Imperial Navy or Ork Airwaagh squadron to victory and experience every dive, roll and ultra high-G turn through desperate dogfights in this tactical aerial combat game. Life is the Emperor’s currency, spend it well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m6e.jpg'),(18812,'LEGO Star Wars: Microfighters','2014-01-30','Shooter, Arcade','Android, iOS','Take your LEGO Star Wars Microfighters into the digital world in 18 levels on Endor, Yavin, Hoth and Geonosis. Play as six different Microfighters of iconic Star Wars ships as you battle through enemies, collect studs and upgrade your Microfighters.\n\nThis version is a shoot \'em up, played from a top-down view.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7suw.jpg'),(18813,'One Piece: Pirate Warriors 3 - Deluxe Edition','2018-05-10','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','The deluxe edition of One Piece: Pirate Warriors 3 for Nintendo Switch that includes the 42 pieces of DLC that were released for the PlayStation 3, 4, and Vita.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co76xa.jpg'),(18814,'Super Smash Bros. Ultimate: Challenger Pack 8','2020-12-22','Fighting','Nintendo Switch','Challenger Pack 8 was revealed to be Sephiroth from Final Fantasy VII at The Game Awards.\nThe character could be unlocked early, by players who had purchased the DLC or Season Pass, by defeating Sephiroth in an in-game challenge mode only available for the 5 days before release.\n\n\"Sephiroth, armed with his ruthless Masamune sword and a desire to destroy, joins the Super Smash Bros. Ultimate game as a part of the Fighters Pass Vol 2 DLC! This silver-haired swordsman is Cloud’s arch nemesis and one of the most iconic villains in gaming. Don’t be fooled by his chillingly calm demeanor, Sephiroth can deal some white-hot damage.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60yl.jpg'),(18815,'Senderos de Fugüm','2022-12-05','Point-and-click, Adventure','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co96xt.jpg'),(18816,'The king is gone','2020-12-15','Puzzle, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A puzzle game about running, not because one has somewhere to be, but because one has somewhere they don\'t want to be. \n \nIn this game, you have to run away. Different doors are blocking the way, that need to be unlocked to proceed as fast as possible. Each door will give a different benefit, and a combination of them is the key to succeed .. or fail. \n \nTo open a door, a puzzle is presented, where pieces of a key have to be rotated and merged together to open the door. The further you run, the more difficult the key puzzles become. \n \nThere are three different modes: \n \n* Normal Mode: Score is increasing the more you survive. It decreases the more you stay idle in a room without picking a door. There\'s a set amount of rooms to complete before reaching the end. \n* Endless Mode: Score increases with each room that is completed. There is no end to the amount of rooms presented. \n* Random Mode: Each door has a specific score as a reward when opened. Rooms and their rewards spawn at random. \n \nThe available benefits from the doors are: \n \n* Green doors: Increase running speed. \n* Purple doors: Increase lock-picking skills, which makes opening new doors easier. \n* Blue doors: Gives extra chances before losing. \n* Brown doors provide no direct benefit, apart from helping complete more rooms.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mp5.jpg'),(18817,'Umineko no Naku Koro ni Chiru','2011-09-01','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Umineko no Naku Koro ni Chiru is the sequel to Umineko no Naku Koro Ni. It is also referred to as When They Cry 4 in the overall When They Cry franchise.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4szy.jpg'),(18818,'Kharon\'s Crypt: Even Death May Die','2022-02-01','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Kharon\'s Crypt is an eerie non-linear dungeon crawler game full of puzzles, riddles and deadly challenges, and graphics designed to follow the aesthetics of the beloved Game Boy Color. In Kharon\'s Crypt, you\'ll be playing as Kharon (a being thought to be death itself) in his mission to escape from the crypt where he had been sealed by a deranged king that wanted to elude death.\n\nAs Kharon, your abilities are flying, going through physical objects, and stun your enemies. To defeat your opponents and escape from the crypt, you\'ll need to steal the bodies of your enemies by possessing them. You\'ll be able to fly in a bat\'s body, fight from inside a skeleton, or even use a mimic\'s abilities to help yourself hide.\n\nDo you have what it takes to escape from the crypt and compel the Deranged King to meet his fate?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qhm.jpg'),(18819,'Premier Manager 09','2008-09-15','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','Premier Manager 09 is a Sports game, developed and published by Zoo Digital Publishing, which was released in Europe in 2008.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mlv.jpg'),(18820,'Hollow Knight: Lifeblood','2018-04-20','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Lifeblood is a DLC for Hollow Knight and is the third out of the four free contents that were released. This DLC was announced on the 23rd of March 2018 and was released on the 20th of April, 2018.\n\nLifeblood Overview\nLifeblood mainly focused on enhancing certain aspects of the game such as:\n\nAn optimizable theme, allowing players to change the background of the title screen.\nVisual Changes to the game such as using charms, locations, and new animations.\nBuffs and Nerfs to Combat, Enemies, and Bosses such as:\nAdded two new attacks to the Traitor Lord.\nHivelings appearance is larger and has increased health.\nA stagger can be performed on The Collector\nHive Guardians deals two masks of damage to The Knight.\nUpon Death, a Volatile Mosskin quickly explodes.\nA Husk Hive grew in size, is faster, and summons Hivelings in a shorter period of time.\nA Desolate Dive can no longer be used on a Flukemarm.\nThe Knight must wear the Grimmchild charm to gain access into facing Nightmare King Grimm.\nStagger Animation of the False Knight is faster.\nThe spore cloud released by a Fungified Husk is bigger.\nAdded dialogue to NPCs\nAdded and optimized sound effects in the game.\nChanges made to some Charms:\nThe damage dealt by the Flukenest has been reduced and costs 3 notches.\nWeaverlings from the Weaversong deals more damage, has a new animation and can inflict stagger on bosses.\nJoni\'s Blessing has decreased its value of providing 50% +1 HP to 40% +1 HP.\nFury of the Fallen now has a red smoke when it is used instead of a red aura.\nOther than the changes done and added, Lifeblood also introduces a boss and a new mapping tool listed below:','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3i7x.jpg'),(18821,'Paranormal Tales',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Paranormal Tales is a next-gen horror game based on found footage built in Unreal Engine 5. You experience and play through each tragic tale of those who went missing from the viewpoint of bodycams, phones, and VHS cameras. Do you have what it takes to play through the end of the footage?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co696e.jpg'),(18822,'Fantasy Tennis','2007-06-25','Sport','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Fantasy Tennis is a tennis game in which the players create a character like in an online role-playing game and improve their skills by leveling up the property values ​​strength (STR), endurance (STA), dexterity (DEX) and cleverness (Wil). As an opponent you have primarily human players in order to be able to measure yourself against them. Several players can form tennis clubs ( guilds ) for which a battle function ( raid) is being planned. In addition, the property values ​​can be increased by using special items of clothing, each with extra capabilities. These are available in the item shop and can be paid for using either the cash currency alaplaya Points (AP) or the in-game currency gold. Popular items included the speaker, which the game falsely described as an improved version of itself, the Wing of Memory, for which the player spent AP every month to reset their stats, or the so-called gachas, a more expensive variant, to to get to QS. The game itself takes place in the parallel world FantasyLand and takes place on different courts wie Nest Of Rubycrab, Twinkle Town, Snow Moon, Life Woods, Emerald Beach, Arena, Deva Berg oder Atlantis statt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fig.jpg'),(18823,'Billy\'s Game Show','2024-09-04','Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Billy wants you to play a game, a game where only one of you can leave alive. Many have come and gone. Now it\'s your turn to unlock Billy\'s twisted truth.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8so7.jpg'),(18824,'Nico Puchi Girls Runway','2015-12-10','Simulator','Nintendo 3DS','Aim to become the top model at Nico☆Petit Academy in this fashion game based off the magazine \"Nico☆Petit\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78y2.jpg'),(18825,'Clownfield 2042','2021-12-31','Shooter, Tactical, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Clownfield 2042 is an FPS where you take a role of unique soldier, equipped with six weapons that has to fight enemy and win the front. After 2022 cryptocrash caused by NFT\'s, majority of nations collapsed and a union of \"No-Clowns\" has been formed. You are one of them, arm up and get ready for war','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4uuk.jpg'),(18826,'Tekken 8: Advanced Edition','2025-03-31','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S','The Advanced Edition includes:\n• TEKKEN 8\n• 3 Additional playable characters\n- Eddy\n- Lidia\n- Heihachi\n\nTEKKEN 8 is the latest addition to the TEKKEN series, the pinnacle of 3D fighting games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m3k.jpg'),(18827,'Hangul Attack','2017-01-02','Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Hangul Attack is a typing game where the objective is to destroy the Hangul characters that fall from the sky. Four modes help the user focus on consonants, vowels, consonants and vowels, and words. There is also a master mode that does not have a time limit, allowing the user to see how many points they can earn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mm8.jpg'),(18828,'A Strange Hotel','2021-06-30','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Strange Hotel is a retro style atmospheric 2D puzzle platformer, with a few precision platformer levels in between.\n\nFind clever solutions to the physics based puzzles of A Strange Hotel. In this short but sweet puzzle platformer you have to find solutions to simple and complex puzzles while using your vacuum to grab physics objects.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3c6o.jpg'),(18829,'Ninja Stealth 5','2024-04-30','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ninja Stealth 5 is the new game in the series with a new challenge for you. Be stealth, evade from lasers, cameras, motion detectors and security guards. Collect all computers to beat the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co87ln.jpg'),(18830,'Metroid II DX','2013-03-07','Shooter, Platform, Adventure','Game Boy Color','Metroid II DX is a mod that converts Metroid II to the Game Boy Color, now colorized. Not to be confused to the official Metroid II: Return of Samus DX, which was never released.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4048.jpg'),(18831,'Saturday Night Slam Masters','1993-07-13','Fighting, Sport','Arcade, Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, FM Towns','Slam Masters is an arcade conversion of Capcom\'s wrestling game of the same name.\n\nTen wrestlers with different fighting styles and individual special attacks are available. They are controlled with three buttons; one for jumping, one for attacking and one for pinning. When close to your opponents, you can grab them to perform various moves ranging from ordinary attacks to body slams to throws. Since the action takes place in a ring, it is also possible to climb the turnbuckle or use the ropes to your advantage. You can also leave the ring for a limited amount of time to fight with different weapons that can be found outside the ring.\n\nApart from a standard Single Match mode, the SNES version also features a Battle Royal mode for up to four players. This mode is not available in the Genesis version, which features a Death Match mode that can not be found in the SNES version. A Death Match is a no rules match in which weapons can be used used and the rope is replaced with barbed wire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p01.jpg'),(18832,'Dude Simulator','2017-07-13','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dude Simulator is an open world sandbox game. This is a life simulator. The main objective is to enjoy what you are doing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ujo.jpg'),(18833,'Lumpy','2021-02-05','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Repair a desolate planet by reaching the perfect balance and sustaining life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co45in.jpg'),(18834,'Defend the Tower: Castle Defence Element','2018-08-01','Strategy','Android, iOS','Defend the Tower is a free tower defense game for all players. Explore forests, swamps, deserts, snow mountains and lava terrains where you will be facing a war on: orcs, goblins, magic, kingdoms, pirates, knights, wizards and other challenges on the field.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zdiak3hhox9ftir4v3u6.jpg'),(18835,'Cats Contrast','2025-04-07','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into the fascinating world of a feline family, where every frame is filled with amusing details and unexpected nuances. Find 10 differences between the two images to uncover all the secrets of these fluffy heroes! ???','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k8h.jpg'),(18836,'Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War Franchise Collection','2012-01-01','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dawn of War Franchise Collection includes:\n\n- Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War - Game of the Year Edition\n- Warhammer 40,000: Dawn Of War – Winter Assault\n- Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War - Dark Crusade\n- Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War - Soulstorm\n- Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War II\n- Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War II Chaos Rising\n- All DLC Packs for Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War II\n- Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War II: Retribution\n- All DLC Packs for Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War II - Retribution','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gik.jpg'),(18837,'The Company Game','2018-09-06','Puzzle, Indie','iOS','\"The Company is evil and must be stopped...at least that is the information you have received from your informant. Do you think you have what it takes to unlock, decipher, and unravel The Company files? You will need to rely on logic, skill and a bit of luck to get through these mind bending mental (and physical) challenges. As the story unfolds, the mystery of what you are really doing deepens. Will you be able to find the truth? \n \nEach carefully crafted level is unique - no two puzzles are the same - giving you hours of brand new experiences throughout the game. You may even have to think outside the app! \n \nFrom the escape room fanatic to the person who loves a good mystery, The Company Game is for you! \n \nIncludes AR - Augmented Reality puzzles! \nUnlock helpful tools and hints - like a Morse Code translator! \nPush your phone to the limits of what you thought you would need to do to pass a level.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vyhoevuvyukd2vwlfao6.jpg'),(18838,'GilGul','2025-06-19','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Why Do People Want to Die? Why Don\'t People Want to Die? This is a story about a group of girls in a world that exists in limbo between life and death. Embark on a dramatic real-time tactical adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o5i.jpg'),(18839,'Sans Spielen\'s Epic Megalovania','2024-09-23','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You play as CHARAWSKI, a Polish commando whose goal is to end the war by eliminating the evil dictator SANS SPIELEN.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hot.jpg'),(18840,'Happy Marriage Project: Starting from 9 Years Old','2020-08-20','Role-playing (RPG)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a sample game created in \"RPG Maker MZ\" by Photosho Shokunin. Comical love simulation RPG about a young girl hunting for the ideal husband.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46at.jpg'),(18841,'Samurai Unicorn',NULL,'Shooter, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An action horror game with retro-graphics, set in the sprawling megacity of Sydney3.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79l0.jpg'),(18842,'Curse of the Dragonbeast','2025-12-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, MOBA','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A team-turn-based MOBA centralized around slaying monsters, gathering items, gaining levels, and competing in teams of five to slay an enemy teams dragon. CotDb takes place in a grimdark alternative future where dragons have returned to Earth, use their blood to grant magical powers to humans, and uses the same dragons blood to control their minds. Humans are used as soldiers in their war against other dragons, as they seek to collect magical artifacts to grow their Draconic magic. The player takes on the role of a dragons thrall, venturing into the wilds to fight enemy thralls and retrieve treasure for their master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co950m.jpg'),(18843,'Freaked Fleapit',NULL,'Music, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hell never looked this good! Save your soul in a wild cocktail of rhythm-based dungeon crawling and date sims, and dance your way through 9 circles of Hell to heart-pumping music. Which lady of the Fleapit will be the one to join you on your trip out of Purgatory?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8aq3.jpg'),(18844,'Hornets','2015-04-20','Adventure, Indie','Web browser','A short horror story about insects, endings, gods, and the destructive capacity of hieroglyphs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s8s.jpg'),(18845,'Alien Syndrome','2007-07-24','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','Wii, PlayStation Portable','This 2007 remake was styled as hack and slash RPG much like Diablo and Baldur\'s Gate: Dark Alliance, but in space!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/n6bhjbngpomrowus4sgx.jpg'),(18846,'And So It Was','2016-02-29','Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You are the Boy, who escapes captivity and goes through unique areas fighting (or avoiding) enemies while trying to figure out how and why he was imprisoned in the first place. Mouse-driven top-down action adventure with randomized elements and a mysterious, narrated story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/psqnk1mbyl19oqvjjhie.jpg'),(18847,'Little Kite','2021-09-24','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The game about one tragic evening in an unsuccessful family, when emotions and tensions are simply too high to manage.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co253w.jpg'),(18848,'Monktastic','2018-01-30','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step back in time to this nostalgic jungle themed game.\nMonktastic is a game for all ages.\nAvoid obstacles, cocoa bullets, fire and much more\nas you climb your way to the next level.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18849,'Mago','2022-06-21','Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mago is a 2D platformer that puts us in the boots of a sorcerer who will have to run, jump and use his trustworthy magic wand across a vast kingdom where everything can, and will, happen. Will the Wizard be able to rescue his beloved damsel from the claws of the evil Gourmet?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4we8.jpg'),(18850,'Heart Maze','2017-06-27','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','iOS','Heart Maze is a cube puzzle game brought ultimate experience to players. Step into the nightmare cube and start a journey of salvation. Go through the edge, the cube will rotate and you will see the inside world in a different perspective. Player needs to find the key item and reach the end of each level.  \n  \n-Hand-drawing Art Style  \n-Strong Sense of Immersion  \n-Challenging Level Design  \n-Deep Touching Story  \n-Great Voice Actor  \n  \nEveryone makes mistakes in life. The most difficult thing is not to be forgiven… But... to forgive yourself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/q9df1nfbi1uomszi8vbg.jpg'),(18851,'Intermundia: Dungeons, Polygons & Magic','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Intermundia: Dungeons, Polygons & Magic is an RPG with a deep turn-based combat system and a story filled with multiple choices and endings. Let yourself be carried away by this epic adventure: plan your moves, choose your destiny and be prepared to face the consequences!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g1x.jpg'),(18852,'Yoko & Yuki: Dr. Rat\'s Revenge','2021-04-09','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Yoko & Yuki: Dr. Rat\'s Revenge is a family game suitable for kids of all ages. Yoko and Yuki are two adorable cats in love with each other. But the devious doctor Rat stole Yuki from Yoko. Now it’s time to do some cat business, using helpful gadgets and solve puzzles in order to save your girlfriend. Our hero is equipped with scissors to cut ropes, gravitron to flip the world and spray can to find hidden objects. Daring players would be handsomely rewarded for using their wits and helping two cats to achieve their happiness!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39v4.jpg'),(18853,'Naruto: Rise of a Ninja','2007-10-30','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox 360','Naruto: Rise of a Ninja is an Xbox 360-exclusive video game developed by Ubisoft Montreal, making it the first Naruto game to be developed by a non-Japanese company.\n\nA sequel titled Naruto: The Broken Bond was released in fall a year later.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1u9s.jpg'),(18854,'Portal Of Doom: Undead Rising','2015-06-07','Shooter, Indie','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Find out what happened on the Space Station. Did the experiment gone wrong ?\nSearch for clues and get to the truth.\nFight your way out of the space station labyrinth and shoot all the monsters.\nYou will need to find the hidden keys in order to unlock the doors and escape.\nSearch for the PDA devices and read about the experiment.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co69e7.jpg'),(18855,'Paper Wars: Cannon Fodder Devastated','2018-03-01','Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Paper Wars: Cannon Fodder Devastated is the refreshed, updated, remastered, and enhanced edition of the beloved Wii tower defence-like game! With updated graphics built from the ground up and a brand-new chapter where we\'ve exchanged soldiers for zombies, it’s just better than ever!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dpuojmgslgg6j41kvfkt.jpg'),(18856,'Corridor 15 Alpha','2017-11-29','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Horror game. In the game you need about 15 minutes to find a weapon.You need to shoot a monster to go through a single mode. Or go play to cooperative mode for fun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2al7.jpg'),(18857,'Final Fantasy VII & Final Fantasy VIII Remastered Twin Pack','2019-11-29','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','The Twin Pack includes Final Fantasy VII and the remastered version of Final Fantasy VIII.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vn2.jpg'),(18858,'An Otaku like me has 2 Fiancees?!','2020-06-17','Visual Novel','Android','Hiding your identity as an otaku has always been part of your life. But that hasn’t stopped you from having an enjoyable, average life in high school. One day, you find yourself meeting up with a beautiful senpai who is also the president of the club you belong to. It seems she has a favor to ask of you. Nothing big. You know, just… pretend to be her lover to avoid getting out of an arranged marriage?!\n\nYou decide to help her out, but before you have time to process the whole thing, your energetic classmate seems to want to “talk” to you about something. You go along with her only to discover that she’s found out about your secret identity as an otaku! Luckily, it turns out she’s an otaku as well, but it seems she has a favor to ask of you as well and if you don’t cooperate, the whole school finds out about your “hobbies.” Now, what might that favor be? You guessed it… Act as her lover to get out of an arranged marriage!\n\nJust yesterday, you thought this could only happen in your favorite anime… Now you have to figure out how to survive what might be the most challenging situation any protagonist has ever faced! Can two fake relationships ever turn into a single real one? Find out in An Otaku like me has 2 Fiancees?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yg2.jpg'),(18859,'Noisz Starlivht: True Heroes','2023-12-31','Shooter, Music, Arcade','Android, iOS','A continuation to NOISZ STARLIVHT \"False Timeline\"\'s story rather than a full fledged second game. True Heroes marks the end of the NOISZ saga.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t7t.jpg'),(18860,'Queen of Tenshindo 95','1995-12-31','Sin género','PC-9800 Series','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6azo.jpg'),(18861,'BurgerTime','1983-08-01','Platform, Arcade','Atari 2600, Intellivision','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mhh.jpg'),(18862,'On a Cloudy Day','2019-02-10','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','On a Cloudy Day is a short, autobiographical vignette game by Emperatriz Ung. It is an interactive memory that captures the loneliness experienced during the hospitalization intake process. Designed to narratively compliment & be played alongside with Carol Mertz\'s \"I\'ll be here.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72aj.jpg'),(18863,'Max: The Curse of Brotherhood','2014-05-21','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In its core Max: The Curse of Brotherhood is a physics-based puzzle/platformer and set in a 2.5D environment with a free and cinematic camera. The game has 7 chapters and 20 levels in total All levels are connected so the game feels like one long journey. Besides platforming, the gameplay twist is the magic marker which introduces a creative and open approach to how puzzles can be solved. Throughout the game the magic marker will gain different powers.\n\nThe five powers are\n1. Earth pillars. You can create pillars from the earth to reach higher grounds.\n2. Tree branches - You can grow trees to use them as platforms, springboards, rafts and moveable objects. Branches also catch fire.\n3. Vines which work like ropes. You can crawl and swing in vines, but vines can also be used to tie objects together.\n4. Water streams can be shaped freely and will move objects as well as Max along their path.\n5. You must destroy obstacles and defeat Mustacho’s minions.\n\nEach of the five powers are introduced in settings similar to the power themselves. The magic marker is triggered by pressing and holding RT and controlled by the right analog stick of the Xbox One controller and while controlling the magic marker Max cannot move at all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26y5.jpg'),(18864,'Whacked!','2002-10-08','Puzzle, Strategy','Xbox','In Whacked! you are one of seven demented contestants competing on a dangerous game show. Pitted against each other in free-for-all combat, contestants must use power-ups and weapons, such as giant staplers and rubber ducky grenades, to flatten their opponents. The game\'s various modes have you fighting to collect resources, fending off a horde of man-eating chickens, or exchanging blows in fierce deathmatches. There are more than a dozen levels--including an arctic pipeline, a Christmas tree, and a kitchen sink--for you to conquer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ufc.jpg'),(18865,'Devil in the Capital','2017-07-04','Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','With the death of the second police detective in one of the northern Iranian cities, the total number of victims adds up to 5. It’s as if no one, whether the general public or high-ranking political figures and even detectives from the police office are safe from the murderer(s). Mohammad Afshar (the detective in Murder in the Tehran’s Alleys 1) is now dispatched on a mission which has taken the lives of two of his colleagues in trying to solve it. The murderer shows no sign of ending his crimes and limited forensic evidence is replete with fear and mistrust. Amid all this, facing the Church of Satan poses the biggest mental challenge for him? Is Satan actually a mere mental construct?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24yp.jpg'),(18866,'Persona O.A.','2018-06-30','Sin género','Android, iOS','A free-to-play spin-off game for the Persona series. \n \nThe app will be used to deliver news and information about the persona games series. It may also be used in future events for the series. \n \nThe game portion of the app will be a simple exploration game where you choose a character and persona to explore and clear a palace to earn Persona Points and get experience for the persona you used as well as increase the bond between the character and persona. \n \nAfter clearing a Palace, with a persona your character has a high bond level with, you will trigger exclusive dialogue events written just for this app. \n \nPersona Points can be used to summon other personas for the exploration game. They can also be used to unlock web content and event applications. \nPersona Points will be available through related products, QR and serial codes exclusive to the app','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ul0jhhhhx0w1f8idnewz.jpg'),(18867,'The Thrill of the Fight 2','2024-11-21','Fighting, Simulator, Sport','Meta Quest 2, Meta Quest 3','The fully reimagined sequel to the greatest VR boxing game ever made is now available. Glove up your fully personalizable avatar and test your skill while working up a sweat in the new online player-versus-player mode. Challenge friends or enter the ring through skill-based matchmaking as you battle through breathtaking arenas.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c8x.jpg'),(18868,'Rasant','2024-05-21','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','With your ship, face several exciting space battles, full of shots and powerful enemies. Customize your spaceship by making it more and more powerful and get ready for a space trip that will make your adrenaline skyrocket!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cdk.jpg'),(18869,'Space Cruise','2019-01-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Space Cruise is a hybrid of both metroidvania style platforming and traditional bullet-hell gameplay, allowing the player to choose which play style resonates with them most for each run. With power-ups for both methods of gameplay, randomised levels on the branching paths, and leaving the final decision to the player, each run should...','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18870,'Turok: Origins',NULL,'Shooter, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Play as the legendary Turok warriors to face off against ferocious dinosaurs and a terrifying alien threat that seeks to destroy all human life across the galaxy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co95g7.jpg'),(18871,'Hoshigami: Ruining Blue Earth','2002-02-07','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PlayStation','Utilizing a host of new gameplay elements, Hoshigami: Ruining Blue Earth expands upon the formula made popular by the cult classic Final Fantasy Tactics. The continent of Mardias serves as the game\'s primary world, and is divided into three kingdoms: Nightweld, the Valaimian Empire and Gerauld. The story begins as Valaimian troops advance into Nightweld, a peace-loving kingdom. Lacking the military might to repel the invaders from multiple fronts, Fazz - a mercenary and the game\'s protagonist - is hired to defend the Tower of Wind. Needless to say, this is just the beginning of a dire and perilous journey for the unwitting Fazz.\n\nAs you and your party trek across the world map, you\'ll take part in various battles. Ready-for-Action Points (RAP) determine which, as well as the number of actions that can be performed by a particular character. The more actions performed (and thus, more RAPs expended) during a turn, the longer you\'ll have to wait for your next chance to act. When attacking, an interactive gauge appears that does damage based upon where the slider is stopped. Stopping it at the very end will result in greater damage dealt to the enemy. Wait too long however and the slider will return to the beginning.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4eqb.jpg'),(18872,'Maji Kyun! Renaissance','2016-09-21','Visual Novel','PlayStation Vita','A cross media collaboration project between Sunrise & Broccolli.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qi9.jpg'),(18873,'World Championship Soccer','1990-04-18','Sport','Sega Mega Drive/Genesis','The game presents a top-down view of a simple version of soccer (there are no fouls, substitutions, or strategies). Players must dribble and pass the ball towards one end of the field and try to score a goal by forcing the ball into the opposing team\'s net.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p1u.jpg'),(18874,'Dessert DIY',NULL,'Simulator','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Make sweet ice cream, popsicles, and waffles using your creativity in one of the best dessert decorating games!\n\nExperience the satisfaction of preparing your customers\' orders with your own hands, meeting their expectations, and witnessing their delightful reactions! Explore a variety of delicious molds, creams, syrups, and sweet ingredients to create mouthwatering works of art!\n\nDoes your customer want to take revenge on someone? Prepare yucky desserts with surprise bugs or chili peppers! Such a taste is definitely something no one will ever forget!\n\nEvery dessert sold brings you coins, a delightful reward that you can invest in enhancing the appearance of your store. Change the colors of your walls or floor, and add new furniture. Transform your store into a cozy and professional haven, all while having fun!\n\nReady to get your hands dirty and make unique, colorful desserts?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94i3.jpg'),(18875,'Stay Alive: Zombie Survival','2019-05-01','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Android, iOS','The survival action is set in a post-apocalypse, when the world saw an outbreak of an unknown infection that destroyed almost all the human race. All those dead started turning into zombies and those few survivors that have resistance in their blood are trying to survive.\n\nExplore the world! Upgrade your hero, equip your weapon and loot – the new world has new rules.\n\nWill you survive in conditions like these? If so, what price are you ready to pay?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b5v.jpg'),(18876,'Yasha: Legends of the Demon Blade','2025-05-15','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Slay the wicked in this gorgeous Japanese-style world of roguelite! Mastering the Demon Blades and fighting hordes of demons in the Edo period as Shigure the kunoichi. With each adventure, you will unravel the truth about her immortality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63ip.jpg'),(18877,'Gun Dealer',NULL,'Puzzle, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Sin plataforma','Gun Dealer features a playfield five columns wide and several rows tall. \"Blocks\" in the form of playing cards gradually fall into this area, and the player must arrange them into \"poker hands\" of three cards or more (straights, flushes, etc.)\n\nAt any time, the player has a three-card \"hand\" displayed at above the playfield. The player can use a joystick to move the falling blocks/cards left or right, and use a button to cycle amongst cards in the hand. A downward movement on the joystick will \"drop\" the active card/block to speed up play.\n\nThe objective of each level is to clear through a buffer of remaining cards for that level (shown by a count on the right side of the screen). At that time, the player is penalized (with a point deduction) for any cards still remaining onscreen. If, after this tally, the player\'s score is less than zero, the game ends. If, on the other hand, the player score is positive, the game continues and the player is treated to a soft porn intermission of a cartoon pinup girl before the next (more difficult) level begins.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18878,'Way of the Hunter','2022-08-16','Shooter, Simulator, Sport, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5','Become the new owner of a hunting lodge nestled among gorgeous habitats and rich animal populations. Explore vast open world environments and hunt with a premium selection of firearms. Enjoy the perfect hunt on your own or with friends in co-op.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7m6m.jpg'),(18879,'Chlorophos','2019-06-16','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Chlorophos is an ADV game. It is a dark underground world.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18880,'Lunistice 1.5: Accel Coda',NULL,'Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Lunistice 1.5: Accel Coda is an upcoming free content update for Lunistice, it overhauls major parts of the base game, ranging from new character models and animations to minor and major reworks of the original levels! Besides Accel, it also adds three additional playable characters - each with their own bonus stage. And if you like replayability, the new Randomizer Mode will have you covered!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i51.jpg'),(18881,'DEDstress','2020-08-20','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','DEDstress is a bizarre, high-intensity, survival-horror game. Assisted by voices in your head - run, hide and bribe your way out of a strange South African mental hospital, where the staff need more help than the patients.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2eqf.jpg'),(18882,'Harvesterado','2020-08-24','Shooter, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A survival western FPS created in 38 non-consecutive hours for MizJam 1.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b9x.jpg'),(18883,'Chameleon: To Dye For!','2007-08-06','Puzzle','PlayStation 4, PlayStation Portable, Nintendo DS','Psychedelic Art Puzzle. In this world, you can expand your territory by changing the color to match the around colors, like a Chameleon. Simple play, variety of rules and attractive characters.You should be addicted by Chameleon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t5u.jpg'),(18884,'Parking Tycoon: Business Simulator - Seaside Business','2024-05-15','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into Miami\'s vibrant Seaside District in the expansion for Parking Tycoon Business Simulator! Enjoy stunning ocean views, manage a surfboard rental shop, and implement high-tech parking solutions. Build your empire and become the parking tycoon of the sunny waterfront!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kov.jpg'),(18885,'Danganronpa: Dead End',NULL,'Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','16 students are trapped inside the illustrious Reservoir University and are told that they will stay there for the rest of their lives. The only way out? To kill another student and get away with it.\n\nDanganronpa: Dead End is a non-profit visual novel based on the Danganronpa series by Kazutaka Kodaka and is not affiliated with Spike Chunsoft.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6o5q.jpg'),(18886,'Sudoku Classic','2021-08-13','Puzzle, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','It\'s a game, but you can play it as if you were writing with a pen on a piece of paper. You can customize the assist function to your liking.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3jia.jpg'),(18887,'Two Point Hospital: Fancy Dress Pack','2020-10-20','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','It’s time to pull back the dressing room curtain on some of the fanciest frockery in town. Welcome, kind people, to the snappily named “Two Point Hospital: Fancy Dress Pack”.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5q01.jpg'),(18888,'The Mound: Omen of Cthulhu','2025-12-31','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','In up to four player co-op, form a group of explorers searching for treasure. In this cursed jungle, danger is everywhere and monstrous creatures alter reality. Stay clear-headed and tame the jungle before it devours you…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i70.jpg'),(18889,'Sonic X-Treme','2022-12-31','Platform','Sega Saturn','Created by Voxel, this is a fan recreation of Sonic X-Treme.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kek.jpg'),(18890,'Kindred Spirits on the Roof: Full Chorus','2019-01-18','Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kindred Spirits on the Roof Full Chorus is an upgrade of Kindred Spirits on the Roof featuring full voice overs as well as new extras!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cb3.jpg'),(18891,'Anvil Saga','2022-06-22','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Anvil Saga is a management sim with RPG elements where you take control of a blacksmith shop amidst the Hundred Years\' War. Each decision you make impacts the story and gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7979.jpg'),(18892,'Full Fathom','2025-12-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Full Fathom is an oceanic survival horror game. Pilot a deteriorating submarine as it drifts through grim waters, keeping it maintained as it is your only lifeline in the hostile, merciless ocean.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79lo.jpg'),(18893,'Half-Life 2: Lost Coast','2005-10-27','Shooter','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Originally planned as a section of the Highway 17 chapter of Half-Life 2, Lost Coast is a playable technology showcase that introduces High Dynamic Range lighting to the Source engine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25r5.jpg'),(18894,'Aircraft Carrier Survival','2022-04-20','Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','When the harshness of the sea meets the cruelties of war, a challenge for perseverance makes itself known. Welcome to Aircraft Carrier Survival, a strategy game set in the Pacific Theater of World War II, where your prowess as a commander decides the fate of a naval behemoth.\n\nTake control of the aircraft carrier, its crew, officers, and planes during WW2. Exercise your military prowess by choosing the right equipment, crew, and escort for the mission. Remember that your success will depend greatly on your flexibility in managing the available fleet resources.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hzt.jpg'),(18895,'ZeroSpace',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','ZeroSpace is a cinematic RTS with an epic sci-fi story where your decisions determine the fate of the galaxy. No two matches play the same thanks to nearly limitless combinations of factions, mercenary units and heroes, introducing unparalleled strategic depth and player expression to the genre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a9t.jpg'),(18896,'Easter Sweeper',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18897,'Untold Atlas','2023-04-05','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Riya Cross is sent on an expedition to explore Aethra, a mysterious island which was once a beacon of ancient technology before being lost to the depths of the sea, then resurfaced back into the world.\n\nLed by Captain Felix Harker, Riya and the rest of her crew which includes loose cannon Eli Ryder, the accomplished Lilith Wren, the contracted scientist Alexei Nova, and the ever-pleasant Aethran guide Claris Io to embark into the mysteries of Aethra and all its regions as they grow closer to the answers behind the true source of the island’s ancient technology while diving into their own adventures and romances along the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qlm.jpg'),(18898,'Tobla: Divine Path','2024-03-29','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','In Tobla - Divine Path, creative puzzle gameplay, a story inspired by classics like Portal, and impressive 3D graphics come together. Step into the role of Mort and tackle the challenging puzzles and cynical comments of the cunning goddess Tobla to find your way home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rov.jpg'),(18899,'Yuu Maze','1988-12-31','Puzzle','Family Computer Disk System','Yuu Maze is the conversion of Taito\'s arcade game Raimais which was also released in 1988. It can be quickly described as a sort of Pac Man on wheels.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18900,'Eco Phantoms','1990-12-31','Strategy, Adventure','Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','Eco Phantoms is a hybrid game that contains exploration with an aircraft in pseudo-3D dungeon-like environments, action-based combat, arcade sequences, and puzzle-solving elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rgc.jpg'),(18901,'Funi Raccoon Game',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Funi raccoon game from twitter dot com. A Platformer, Collectathon immersive sim. Play as raccoon. Commit a variety of crimes. maybe some are felonies. maybe a lot are felonies. play AS raccoon. Move treasures to dumpster. Help the Terrorists or destroy them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h99.jpg'),(18902,'Check and Slash','2024-11-15','Fighting, Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Check and Slash combines the action and combat of a hack-and-slash game with the movement patterns of chess pieces. Find your way through a maze of boards, slash your enemies, dodge attacks, rescue black pieces to receive upgrades, and fight against formidable opponents until you find the enemy king.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7q9p.jpg'),(18903,'Batman: Arkham Knight - Dark Knight Returns Batman Skin','2015-08-04','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This addon introduces a costume from the Dark Knight Returns comic to Batman: Arkham Knight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fxh.jpg'),(18904,'The Litter: Trigo','2025-04-21','Quiz/Trivia, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A playful way to learn trigonometry, with quirky characters and interactive challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9s1i.jpg'),(18905,'Company of Heroes: The Great War 1918','2013-03-13','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Great War 1918 is a WW1 modification for Company of Heroes, focusing on the last year of the First World War. Currently it features the British Expeditionary Force and the German Empire as opposing factions; however new nations will be brought over time, such as France and Austria-Hungary. The mod focuses on a realistic and accurate representation of warfare in 1918 while keeping a balanced and enjoyable gameplay.\n\nExperience the great operations of the last year of the Great War as Germany breaks through the Western Front in the Spring Offensive; as the Entente, liberate France and Belgium in the Hundred Days offensive. Look forward to heavy artillery strikes and the infamous gas attacks. Trenches will provide vital cover for infantry while tanks will roll over the battlefield and instil fear into the enemy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gzr.jpg'),(18906,'Mighty No. 9','2016-06-30','Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Linux, Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Mighty No. 9 is a Japanese 2D Side-scrolling Action game that takes the best elements from 8 and 16-bit classics that you know and love and transforms them with modern tech, fresh mechanics, and fan input into something fresh and amazing!\n\nYou play as Beck, the 9th in a line of powerful robots, and the only one not infected by a mysterious computer virus that has caused mechanized creatures the world over to go berserk. Run, jump, blast, and transform your way through twelve stages using weapons and abilities stolen from your enemies to take down your fellow Mighty Number robots and confront the final evil that threatens the planet!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ia0.jpg'),(18907,'The Incredible Hulk: Ultimate Destruction','2005-08-23','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','The Incredible Hulk: Ultimate Destruction, released in 2005, is an action-adventure video game developed by Radical Entertainment and published by Vivendi Universal Games (VU Games). The game centres around the Marvel Comics superhero, the Hulk, and features an open world with destructible environments. The storyline depicts the Hulk being unconsciously guided by his human alter-ego, Bruce Banner, and his psychotherapist, Leonard Samson. They influence him to construct a device aimed at healing Banner\'s psyche and preventing the emergence of a darker personality. In addition to progressing through the main narrative, players can undertake side missions and acquire new abilities for the Hulk.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dzh.jpg'),(18908,'Call of Duty: Vanguard - Season Four','2022-06-22','Shooter','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','It’s a race for the riches as warring Mercenaries of Fortune fight for the ultimate score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vky.jpg'),(18909,'At Home Alone Final','2021-12-31','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A leisure healing mini-pixel plot game exploring at home. Players will wander at home from the perspective of a little girl. What will she do when she is alone? What strange stories will be encounters in this process? During the exploration, maybe... you can even find some weird secrets?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bz7.jpg'),(18910,'Disc Ninja','2021-08-05','Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Meta Quest 2, Oculus Quest','Disc Ninja is a Virtual Reality disc golf game set in a magical version of Feudal Japan. The goal is to reach the target with a flying disc in as few throws as possible. The game combines realistic physics with beautiful, stylized graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co460s.jpg'),(18911,'Grapplers: Relic Rivals','2024-06-19','Fighting, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Engage in fast-paced local PvP matches while unearthing ancient relics and harnessing their power to conquer your rivals. Dodge deadly traps, utilize your grappling hook, activate mystical runes, and master each relic to defeat your opponents and reign victorious in this thrilling PvP platformer!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8of2.jpg'),(18912,'Hard Line','2023-06-25','Shooter','Meta Quest 2, Meta Quest 3, Oculus Quest','Immerse yourself in an exhilarating virtual reality adventure that pays homage to the classic action films of the past. You step into the shoes of a fearless hero facing a harrowing challenge.\n\nTerrorists have seized control of a sprawling skyscraper, holding innocent hostages captive within its towering walls. As the lone warrior who can save the day, it is your duty to navigate each treacherous floor, confronting relentless enemies with swift precision and tactical prowess.\n\nWith every enemy you kill and with every hostage you rescue, you earn XP that can be used to unlock various weapons and upgrades.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8fqm.jpg'),(18913,'Robo-Pit 2','2003-08-30','Fighting','PlayStation','Robo-Pit 2 is, like its predecessor, a fighting game where robots battle it out in an arena. The game starts with the player creating his own robot. The player can use 146 different parts and 72 colours to create a robot of his own taste. The different body parts that can be customized are head, body, arms and legs. Each body part has its own attack and durability ratings that determines how the robot will fare in combat.\n\nThe battles takes place in the Coliseum. The Coliseum consists of a number of rooms each hosting an enemy robot that the player has to defeat to unlock more rooms. Defeating an enemy can also grant the player new body parts as well as experience and skill points. The player can move around his robot from a third person perspective and launch different attacks such as jabs, straight, hook and upper attacks. With good timing it\'s also possible to link attacks together. A special attack can be executed when the SP gauge is full. There\'s also a guard impact command which allows the player to repel the enemy attack. The player has a booster which allows the robot to fly as long as the boost gauge lasts. A battle ends when one of the combatants has his energy reduced to zero.\n\nNotably the Japanese version retains the music, the PAL and NTSC versions had the music removed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uui.jpg'),(18914,'Rainy','2020-09-18','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This game has a total of four stages in which you control a father with an umbrella as he tries to protect his daughter from the falling rain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3y9j.jpg'),(18915,'King of the Chat','2025-04-10','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Transform your Twitch chat into a marble battle! Viewers spend channel points or bits spawn in as marbles for a plinko-style challenge, earning points which can be spent attacking the throne. This stream overlay to automatically incentivizes viewer engagement, non-obtrusively, with zero effort!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o8k.jpg'),(18916,'Life in Quarantine','2020-03-10','Simulator, Tactical, Indie','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Everyone outside is sent home by the police.\nThis game is about you having a walk with your dog.\n\nDon\'t get caught by the police!\n\nA tactical Pixel Art game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x8j.jpg'),(18917,'Box Office Boss',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Box Office Boss puts you in charge of your own movie studio. The studio will rise or fall on the back of your executive decisions. Everybody thinks they could make a good movie, but do you have what it takes to turn that dream into box office success?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66uy.jpg'),(18918,'My Mafia Girlfriend','2019-01-11','Visual Novel','Android','You are… the heir to a mafia group?!\nGet to know three girls as you delve deep into the conflicts of the mafia!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5wnl.jpg'),(18919,'Sonic Mania + Team Sonic Racing Double Pack','2020-10-27','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30ly.jpg'),(18920,'Xenogears','1998-02-11','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 3, PlayStation','Xenogears follows protagonist Fei Fong Wong and several others as they journey to uncover the truth behind mysterious, cabalistic entities operating in their world. The principles and philosophies of Friedrich Nietzsche, Sigmund Freud and Carl Jung influence the plot, character design, and world of Xenogears. Additionally, the symbols, theological concepts, and devotional practices of several world religions are represented in fictionalized forms in the game. Major psychological themes are the nature of identity and human memory, particularly as these relate to the phenomenon of dissociative identity disorder. The relationship between humanity and machines is central to the game\'s plot, as indicated by the presence of giant robots dubbed \"gears,\" which almost each playable character can control.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fbu.jpg'),(18921,'Go Domino',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Go Domino! Our version of this classic game is simple, fun to play and it provide some of the most common rules & variations (see How-To screen or contact us via email for clarifications). You can play Draw or Block games, choose the target score (from 100 up to 500pts), scoring options (at end, all 5s, or all 3s), game start options (last winner, highest double, or heaviest domino), and opening spinner options (no spinner for 2 trails or first spinner only for up to 4 trails).\nGo Domino has tons of cool features including a full view of domino trail, Drag and Drop dominoes to the table (1 finger gesture, just touch the domino and drag it to the available position on the board), game log, zoom in/out, stats box and more features and variations to come in future releases.\nPlay the game against 1, 2, or up to 3 virtual players at a time. There are a total of 9 different virtual players, and each one of them has its own expertise level (Beginners, Intermediate and Advanced). Go ahead and play against all of them.\nCustomize the game by selecting the table (or theme) of your choice. There are 12 different options including marble tables, wood tables, bamboo, classic game tables, and an outdoor concrete table. Also, you can select the style of domino to play with from 3 options white, colored dots or black.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18922,'Club Manager 2015','2014-11-04','Simulator, Sport, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Club Manager 2015 you slip into the role of an up-and-coming football manager. You can start with a new team in the eighth league or take over an existing team from one of the higher leagues. It\'s your choice, but in the end only one thing matters: get promoted, win the Championship and take home the trophy!  \n \nClub Manager 2015 returns to the simpler virtues of classic football manager games – without fancy gimmicks. Put together a team that can pack a punch. Ecstatic fans and the skillful marketing of your club will make for gushing profits. Convince sponsors, take care of the youth academy and participate in international tournaments. Upgrade your stadium from a rudimentary football field to a real arena.  \n \n \nMade in Germany – developed in the homeland of the current World Champions  \n\'54, \'74, \'90, 2014 – Germans know what it takes to be World Champions. So who better to choose than a German developer team? Over 20 years of know-how from enthusiastic fans and at least one hundred times as much pure footballing passion have gone into this version of Club Manager. \n \nThere\'s more to it than you imagine \nIf you really like to get your hands dirty, then Club Manager 2015 is just the place for you. Eight leagues and numerous championships in over 200 countries allow for plenty of variety. Bring in sponsors, make use of skillful marketing strategies for healthy bank accounts, and don\'t forget to turn your stadium into a veritable footballing palace. \n \nExtensive editor \nThe included editor enables fans across the globe to expand the game on their own, create their own teams, and modify existing teams without any complications!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ommbhxsqbyqjkhfybm21.jpg'),(18923,'D.I.P.R.I.P. Warm Up','2008-03-18','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','D.I.P.R.I.P. is a Half-Life 2 multiplayer total conversion. Gameplay is based on vehicle combat in various post-war environments. Vehicles use multiple weapon mounts which are activated by finding weapons scattered around the battlegrounds. Key locations in the post-war world are rich in uncontaminated water and fuel. Most of the terrain has been left in a mechanically unchanged state. Abandoned city centers, malls, refineries, country food storages, old military bases and other such places are the scenery of raging battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6git.jpg'),(18924,'Hogi\'s Adventure Run','2017-04-24','Adventure','Android, Legacy Mobile Device','Join Hogi and embark on an endless journey full of adventure and different challenges. Your character plays the role of Hogi – A Scarecrow. Join him in his adventure, explore the world, jump through obstacles, avoid traps, collect coins and complete various challenges.\n\nThe game includes a fluid dynamic weather, lightning system, mountain views, ambient and classical style soothing music helps you relax and as you play it give you a sensational feel.\n\nFeatures:\n*Easy to learn, difficult to master double tap jump trick\n*Procedurally generated terrain\n*Dynamic lighting and weather effects\n*Immersive minimalist environment\n*Compete with friends and beat high scores\n*Ambient and relaxing music','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xjlcohahzooeqypgx1vf.jpg'),(18925,'Star Chef Simulator','2024-08-30','Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Star Chef Simulator, where your dream of running your own restaurant is about to become a reality! Immerse yourself in the exciting world of culinary entrepreneurship as you build and manage your restaurant from the ground up. Unleash your inner chef and dive in the art of cooking with more than 10 delicious dishes from around the world. Cook with a variety of different ingredients, techniques and recipes to create culinary masterpieces that will delight your customers. Use various kitchen appliances such as the deep fryer, oven, stove or mixer and create unique dishes!\n\nHire, train, and manage your employees to keep your restaurant running smoothly. Build a strong team to handle the hustle and bustle of a busy kitchen. Customize your restaurant, from the walls to the floors, from the decor to the equipment. Create a unique dining experience and watch customers flock to your establishment.\nKeep an eye on your finances as you make decisions to grow your business. Manage employee costs and invest in upgrades to attract more customers and increase profits. Provide top-notch service to your guests to earn rave reviews. Listen to feedback and strive to deliver a memorable dining experience that keeps guests coming back for more.\n\nAre you ready to take the helm of your own restaurant and become the ultimate culinary star chef? The world of gastronomy awaits you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86yg.jpg'),(18926,'Rise of Kingdoms','2018-09-21','Strategy','Android, iOS','From the depths of obscurity to the peaks of legend, you will be the author of your civilization\'s history. Will you launch epic wars and conquer the entire world? Or rise up as a virtuous leader renowned for your sagacity? Will you set off to explore the unknown as a pioneer? Or dedicate yourself to helping your own people?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1khx.jpg'),(18927,'Cosmic Drift',NULL,'Simulator, Indie','Sin plataforma','Send your rockets to drift around the Planets !\nAlso play with your viewers on Twitch !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jag.jpg'),(18928,'Darklight','2024-04-27','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Are you ready to investigate a mysterious occurrence at a remote lighthouse? Solve all mysteries in this dark and eerie puzzle game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pj6.jpg'),(18929,'Syphon Filter 2','2022-09-20','Shooter','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','A port of Syphon Filter 2, a third-person shooter stealth game originally released on the PlayStation console, enhanced with up-rendering, rewind, quick save, and custom video filters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9443.jpg'),(18930,'Dungeons & Dragons Online: Attack on Stormreach','2010-12-13','Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A premium set of 4 quest dungeons. Droaam, the kingdom of monsters, is attacking Stormreach. These adventures bring players over, under and around Stormreach, eventually leading to an ancient giant\'s ruin where monstrous deeds are underway.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9quk.jpg'),(18931,'NBA 2K6','2005-09-26','Simulator, Sport','Xbox, PlayStation 2','NBA 2K6 hits the hardwood with all the ingredients necessary to continue its reign as the #1 rated pro basketball game. Achieve NBA superstar status with the new 24/ mode, where created players now partake in training camps, competitions and even land endorsement deals. Elevate your game by utilizing the innovative V.I.P. System to challenge profiels of friends and other NBA 2K6 ballers across the country that match their game-play tendencies down to every minute detail. Then head over to The Crib to customize your pad, buy music and unlock mini-games with crib credits earned playing the game. With the industry leading online experience and unrivaled francise control, NBA 2K6 offers the most complete and entertaining roundball experience available.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gnf.jpg'),(18932,'Huntfeast','2021-06-21','Shooter, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Prepare for the Werewolf Hunt!\nMisanthrope’s curse echoes through the woods of Lovengrad. Terrible monsters, led by the werewolf, hunt for their prey. An oppressive atmosphere paired with the thrill of hunting makes this game unlike any other. Begin the Huntfeast, where you are a hunter who hunts alone or with a friend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30am.jpg'),(18933,'Super Smash Bros Ultimate: Marie Outfit and Wig','2020-06-29','Sin género','Nintendo Switch','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18934,'Saints Row: The Third - Gangstas in Space','2012-02-21','Sin género','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','A new movie is being shot in Steelport and you\'re the star! Join with your co-star, Jenny, to fight the alien invasion for the film Gangstas In Space. With spaceships and alien weaponry, this retro-style film is sure to be a hit!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h3g.jpg'),(18935,'Under the Skin','2004-10-22','Adventure','PlayStation 2','In Under the Skin, players must cause as much chaos and panic as possible by taking on the identity of the various people he or she encounters throughout CoCo Town and other environments. Equipped with a special ray gun, gamers can scan and absorb the DNA of anyone they target.\n\nWith this genetic material, Cosmi can take the form and attributes of anyone he\'s zapped. For example while in human form, sing a song only dogs could appreciate, causing those nearby to drop coins that must be collected. Catch them all as these coins are what Cosmi and his enemies are being judged on in order to return home.\n\nBut beware; causing such disruption puts Cosmi in danger of being caught and having his true alien identity revealed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ini.jpg'),(18936,'Void Terrarium','2020-01-23','Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','\"Even in the darkest times, hope is homegrown. Void Terrarium chronicles the story of a robot and a young girl in a world devastated by enigmatic events. Explore hauntingly beautiful ruins in search of food and supplies, outfit and maintain the \"terrarium\" in which you live, and do whatever it takes to protect and nurture the last surviving human in this care simulator-meets-roguelike title.\"\n\nvoid tRrLM(); //Void Terrarium is a roguelike RPG set in a ruined world contaminated by fungi, starring the last human girl Toriko and a helper robot. Since Toriko is unable to survive in the polluted world, the player takes on the role of the helper robot, who must replenish the environment of the “Terrarium” where she spends each day.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rfr.jpg'),(18937,'Holiday Eye Spy','2025-02-07','Sin género','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fl2.jpg'),(18938,'Train Metropolis','2025-03-28','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Idle Clicker City Builder. Build and manage your railway company, helping the city expand and thrive as you grow together.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g55.jpg'),(18939,'Moon Waltz','2013-05-31','Indie','Web browser','One innocent dude goes out just to get some cigs. But as the clouds reveal the full moon, something way more than a joyful stroll begins!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4r4j.jpg'),(18940,'Donchan ga Kyu',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18941,'Temple of Aeryn','2024-01-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the mystical world of Temple of Aeryn, an enchanting adventure awaits you, filled with magic and mythical creatures. Tragedy strikes when a brutal assault on your village reduces your spell book to ashes, leaving you vulnerable to the encroaching darkness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73s9.jpg'),(18942,'YouTubers Galaxy','2017-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Warning: This Game is only available on Spanish.\n\nAcompaña al YouTuber ITownGamePlay en está increíble aventura junto a sus suscriptores para restaurar la paz en su mundo!','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18943,'Rim: Battle Planets','2001-06-30','Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A human space carrier reaches the \"Outer Rim\" to explore new worlds, obtain powerful technology and find tracks of an ancient alien race...\n\nRIM is a 3D turn-based strategy game in the tradition of Battle Isle. It offers a simple and intuitive interface, six different races (humans, aliens, robots) and all in all 70 units with different weapons, special abilities and individual damage systems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zpj9enwpkyftyfjgvjzl.jpg'),(18944,'Lava-Runners','2024-07-16','Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Grapple using left click/touching the screen, it will attach to where ever your mouse is on the screen.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9enp.jpg'),(18945,'Profiles of the Forgotten','2014-04-13','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A first person narrative that mixes abstract and dreamlike locations with live action full motion cutscenes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co52nz.jpg'),(18946,'Ludo Party','2025-03-20','Strategy, Card & Board Game','Nintendo Switch','Classic Ludo in a modern design, enhanced with four different themes of tokens and their drastic destruction instead of kicking them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ink.jpg'),(18947,'Strangeland','2021-08-28','Point-and-click, Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A point-and-click adventure game set in a morbid, otherworldly carnival. Caught in the maze of your own mind, find hope hidden among the horrors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ve3.jpg'),(18948,'Sword Coast Legends','2015-10-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Set in the lush and vibrant world of the Forgotten Realms, Sword Coast Legends offers an all-new way to enjoy the time-tested magic of playing Dungeons & Dragons as a shared storytelling experience. With a deep narrative developed by a team of long-time industry veterans and a partnership with Wizards of the Coast, the single player campaign of Sword Coast Legends brings the world of Faerûn home like never before. \n \nSword Coast Legends also brings the roleplaying dynamic between players and Dungeon Masters to life with DM Mode, a first-of-its-kind real-time experience in which Dungeon Masters guide players through unique customizable adventures. In DM Mode, the Dungeon Master engages players and empowers them to have fun in a way that suits the party best while creating a tailored, non-adversarial 4 with 1 experience that any RPG or pen-and-paper fan will enjoy. \n \nAs of 25 July 2018, multiplayer servers for the game were taken offline and all stored player data deleted. Players owning the game on Steam will still have access to any offline content including the single player campaign.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2fag.jpg'),(18949,'Star Wars: Jedi Knight - Mysteries of the Sith','2009-09-16','Shooter','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kyle Katarn\'s adventures continue five years after the events in Dark Forces II. Invading Imperial forces advance upon a quiet Rebel outpost, interrupting Kyle\'s trianing of a brave new Jedi, Mara Jade.\n\nFirst introduced in Timothy Zahn\'s award-winning Star Wars novel, Heir to the Empire, Mara Jade combines her experiences as a smuggler and Emperor\'s Hand with her apprenticeship as a Jedi Knight. Mara\'s training will continue in the field as she makes use of four new weapons and five new Force powers to secure supplies for the New Republic.\n\nMeanwhile, Kyle pursues what he believes to be his destiny as he searches for secret treasures in an ancient Sith temple. Will you uncover the Mysteries of the Sith?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25zg.jpg'),(18950,'Maverta Muerte','2022-02-14','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Maverta Muerte - minimalist, relaxing, motion logic, mind game. The player\'s goal is to survive the labyrinth and find the mummies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5krr.jpg'),(18951,'God of Word','2016-09-28','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','God of Word is an exciting twist on classic word & typing games, fusing together multiple game modes with the enchanting setting of Greek Mythology to create the ultimate word game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41cs.jpg'),(18952,'Yoren','2020-05-25','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Yoren is the first cutting-edge realistic VR magic game. Cast spells by drawing rune gestures, explore the openworld collecting crafting ingredients for potions and battle the numerous bosses of fallen kingdoms and dungeons in the world of Yoren.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m43.jpg'),(18953,'Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora - Ultimate Edition','2023-12-07','Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Includes the game, Season Pass, Ultimate Pack, and digital artbook.* Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora is set in the never-before-seen Western Frontier. Discover what it means to be Na\'vi as you join other clans to protect Pandora from the formidable forces of the RDA.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m7i.jpg'),(18954,'Hastafa Invaders',NULL,'Shooter, Arcade','Mac','Hastafa Invaders combines intense arcade shooter action with a rich storyline and dynamic characters. Players are immersed in the conflict between the Azure Dominion and the Crimson Legion, experiencing the thrill of aerial combat while unraveling the fate of the enigmatic planet Hastafa.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8c78.jpg'),(18955,'Crimson Keep','2019-08-11','Role-playing (RPG), Indie','Web browser','Chapter 1 of 7 for the flash erotic rpg series by Introspurt','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5yco.jpg'),(18956,'Pregnant Talking Cat Emma','2017-12-28','Sin género','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Emma the Cat and Oscar are expecting little kittens! Wonderful, right? Too bad Oscar had to go so far away to hunt, so pregnant talking cat Emma is all alone now. Thankfully, she has you! You’ll help your virtual kitty cat Emma go through her pregnancy, right? We all know that’s not easy and Pregnant Talking Cat Emma misses Oscar so much! She is so lonely without him, and she can really use some company and support. Be there for your pregnant virtual cat Emma, and help her prepare to be a mom! Play this virtual pet pregnant game and be the biggest support for your pregnant Emma!\n\nAs talking cat Emma is about to have three little talking kitties, she\'s going to need all the care a pregnant cat can get. Play talking cat pregnant games in order to take this pregnant mommy cat to her doctor so that the kitty cat virtual pet can do an ultrasound and other check-ups. Make sure her talking kitties are safe and sound.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6i03.jpg'),(18957,'Following Spandaramet',NULL,'Platform','Sin plataforma','A side-scroller with combined 2D and 3D graphics, where you play as an armenian girl, searching for her little sister with the help of goddess Spandaramet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9d17.jpg'),(18958,'A Mallard\'s Song','2023-01-03','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game’s main mechanic makes use of a timer. This allows the player 60 seconds to find the level exit. If the player fails this task, the landscape becomes consumed with glitching visuals and strange folkloric characters, telling stories of England’s dark underbelly.\n\nThe game questions the English nationalistic love affair with politicized traditionalism and the toxic side effects this has had on individuals and marginalized groups.\n\nThrough storytelling and allegorical visual narratives, I wanted to explore my difficult past experiences of English nationalism and identity and the history and legacy of English environments and folklore.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7lj9.jpg'),(18959,'Dirge of Cerberus: Final Fantasy VII International','2008-09-04','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG)','PlayStation 2','Dirge of Cerberus: Final Fantasy VII International retains the new features incorporated into the North American and European releases.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7snr.jpg'),(18960,'The Space Brigade: Space Raiders - Refueled','2023-07-12','Shooter, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Classic-Arcade Styled Space Shooter, Fast Paced, Simple Gameplay.\n\nThe game is intended for short sessions, as it\'s more of an infinite shooter rather than a complex experience.\n\nThe game is available for Microsoft Windows and Android in it\'s complete state with updates from time to time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6x3g.jpg'),(18961,'Galador: The Prince and the Coward','1998-04-10','Point-and-click, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Prince and the Coward is a 1998 video game created by fantasy writer Jacek Piekara and video game designer Adrian Chmielarz. It was produced by Polish company Metropolis Software in cooperation with the British Revolution Software. GOG.com re-released it in 2021.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5eia.jpg'),(18962,'Hockey League Simulator II',NULL,'Simulator, Sport, Strategy','Sin plataforma','Experience the other side of hockey, the side most people never see. After two years of additional work, Bethesda has managed to surpass the original Hockey League Simulator! Now, you can enter the fast-paced world of International Sports Management on a completely new level! Where the movers and shakers spend millions to build their dream teams and carry them through to the Stanley Cup! Where an injury or a bad decision can mean the difference between sweet success or bitter defeat! Enter the world of Hockey League Simulator 2! Now you can be the real power behind the game! Hockey League Simulator 2 makes it happen with more realism than ever before. Arrange trades and draft them up to the majors. Keep one eye on the competition and the other one on managing your team all the way to the top! Imagine pitting the 1992 Penguins against the 1970 Bruins for the most incredible Playoff Series of all time! Or build your own All-Star Dream Team and take on all challengers.\n\nWith Hockey League Simulator 2 it\'s up to you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/c4na67ocqigsgfpntmq9.jpg'),(18963,'Doozie the Unicorn','2023-06-19','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Doozie the Unicorn, a Gothic, Dark Fantasy, Medieval, Action, Adventure, Fairy-Tale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mfv.jpg'),(18964,'Radioactive Pineapple','2024-07-24','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Musa Inc.! We are a revolutionary company that wants humanity to evolve to a peak potassium state. A race against time, solve puzzles the fastest to reach the end of our testing facility and gain your freedom... from being a pineapple.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8jyd.jpg'),(18965,'Know What I Meme','2023-04-25','Sin género','Web browser, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Know What I Meme is a social party game of GIFs, memes, and good times! Select a text setup for the meme, browse to find the perfect GIF response, then everyone votes on which was their favorite. Earn points to prove just how funny you are. Up to 9 players can play but anyone can watch the fun!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wzl.jpg'),(18966,'Dark Years','2015-10-16','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dark Years is an action-adventure game based on the real events surrounding ‘Operation Ajax ‘. In an attempt to secure the rights to Iran’s oil, the British and American governments secretly backed a coup that over-threw the democratically elected government of Mohammad Mosaddegh. The result was a period of great instability and violence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ivwvv3cxlepzjwekpmmg.jpg'),(18967,'Great Pilots',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Great Pilots is a fun 2D side scrolling retro airplane combat game set in WWI. Fly a wide array of historically authentic aircraft in missions that guide you through different scenarios of WWI. Earn more advanced planes as you test your skills against unique challenges!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5qn2.jpg'),(18968,'Vertical Kingdom','2024-04-15','Puzzle, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Vertical Kingdom is a roguelite that mixes cities and cards. Due to the fact that there is not much space, you have to build vertically, with the help of platforms and other constructions. You will go on expeditions to obtain resources that will help you improve your camp for your next trips.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s89.jpg'),(18969,'Resonance of the Ocean','2022-05-12','Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Web browser, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Pick up what the waves wash ashore to make instruments. Use those instruments to answer the echoes heard from beyond the ocean.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mdh.jpg'),(18970,'Jump to the circle','2018-02-10','Music, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Jump to the circle\" is a pretty casual game where is a good balance between challenging gameplay and funny gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ps3.jpg'),(18971,'Mochi-O',NULL,'Strategy, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','A doomsday land defense adventure in which you raise MOCHI-O, a weapon of annihilation that looks a lot like a hamster, to protect your country. Pet and raise MOCHI-O to defeat the oncoming enemies and fight through the tender post-apocalypse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o56.jpg'),(18972,'Tempest 4000','2022-03-22','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In Tempest 4000, players are once again in control of the Claw, a powerful spacecraft equipped to destroy deadly creatures and other obstructions with rapid-fire shots on vibrant geometric prisms. With three game modes to choose from and 100 levels to conquer, players must eliminate all enemies as quickly as possible to survive and achieve that coveted spot at the top of the leaderboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27a9.jpg'),(18973,'Doomies','2023-07-10','Shooter, Platform, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An ultra-violent platformer arcade shooter, featuring tons of guns, metal music, super satisfying gameplay, funny one-liners, dark humor, and a freak-ton of spicy ketchup!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93n7.jpg'),(18974,'Rara Magic','2017-01-25','Role-playing (RPG)','Android, iOS','Raramagi is a mobile action RPG game where players can battle against monsters with cute school girls. By proceeding further into the story, players can develop stronger bonds with the girls. The game\'s animation is produced by A-1 pictures with Live2D technology and all girls are voiced over by famous CVs. Enjoy your school life with lively cute girls together!\n\nThe main storyline is fully voiced, with Live2D animation and anime-style stills of the heroines. The main story is divided into one act per heroine, and by the end of the service, the 14th act had been distributed. The heroines can be interacted with on the home screen, and interaction elements such as the \"Outing\" function, which allows users to take pictures with the heroines using an AR camera, and to increase their \"Kizuna Lv\" by giving them gifts.\n\nThe project was announced at the Nico Nico Ultra Conference 2015 on April 25, 2015. It then underwent a closed beta test conducted from October 20 to October 26, 2016 and was released as an iOS/Android game app on January 25, 2017. The pre-registration that began on December 22, 2016, attracted over 150,000 people, and after distribution, the game received 1 million downloads on March 9, 2017, and one year later, on March 9, 2018, it surpassed 2 million downloads.\n\nThe end of the service was announced on April 3, 2020, and the service was terminated on June 3 of the same year.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8469.jpg'),(18975,'AdventureQuest Dragons','2014-11-27','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Web browser, Android, iOS','AdventureQuest Dragons is a dragon-themed clicker game developed by Artix Entertainment in collaboration with Orteil, the developer of Cookie Clicker. The game released in December 2014 for Android and iOS devices; a web version was canceled. The Android version was removed by 2022.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co84lt.jpg'),(18976,'Maimai DX Festival Plus','2023-03-23','Music, Arcade','Arcade','The updated version of maimai Deluxe Festival.\n\nGeneral Information / Changes:\n- Favorite songs can now be registered on the maimaiでらっくすNET website, and they will appear in a special category in-game.\n- Rivals can now be set, in order to challenge other players\' high scores.\n- Extra area travel distance after reaching the Task Track is now stored.\n- When using tickets that increase area travel distance, MASTER and Re:MASTER charts are now playable directly.\n- Track skip options are now accessible for the life values that would be seen in a Perfect Challenge (Life 300 down to Life 1).\n- New display option in the centre of the screen: DX Score (subtractive type), showing the maximum obtainable DX Score. In addition, when using the Judgement Breakdown display, the number of Critical Perfect is separated from the number of Perfect.\n- Note effect volume changes: TOUCH notes are separated into their own category, and the note sound volume for BREAK SLIDE notes can be adjusted too.\n- In Invitation Play, ADVANCED charts can now be selected.\n- On the splash screen before starting a song, BPM, chart designer name, and current record are now displayed.\n- On the last track of a credit, the top light will change it color to red to indicate it is the last track.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bzd.jpg'),(18977,'Super Sonic Cooking','2022-12-31','Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sonic and Big have set up a food booth to make some money. Big cooks, Sonic goes to a forest to collect ingredients for a dish. Well known characters visit the food booth. What dish Big prepares depends on how many needed ingredients Sonic finds. The client won\'t wait for long, so Sonic has limited amount of time to find them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kil.jpg'),(18978,'Trans\'2: Boku to Atashi to Koibito to','2005-07-08','Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Trans\'2: Boku to Atashi to Koibito to is a cross-gender feminine-expression themed eroge developed by Catear. Protagonist Shinobu is introduced to the world of cross-gender expression by childhood friend Mizuki. The game includes both ADV-style visual novel sections and \"dress-up\" sections where players are able to choose how Shinobu goes out into the city.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uuo.jpg'),(18979,'Fishing the Abyss','2024-12-16','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This is a relaxing atmospheric game where you simply watch a robot catch creatures. Place it at the edge of your screen like a vertical desktop accessory and observe the ecosystem. It’s neither an idle game with mountains of stats nor an exciting fishing game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g7p.jpg'),(18980,'The Battle Orks',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','The Battle Orks is a fast-paced strategy game that combines deck-building mechanics with real-time PvP combat. Summon your Orks by pulling levers, and watch the battlefield come alive! Trigger three matching symbols to unlock an additional powerful hero—deploy them wisely to crush your enemies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9o4u.jpg'),(18981,'Discussion Over Dinner','2025-04-04','Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You receive a dinner invite from an awkward new neighbor and things go great.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mfy.jpg'),(18982,'Detective Bot','2020-05-22','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Detective Bot is primed and ready to solve the world\'s hardest mysteries like where did Jeff leave his toy boat? Honestly it has been missing for about a week now and he starting to get really upset. I saw him crying in the break room, it\'s pretty bad.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dmp.jpg'),(18983,'Guild of Darksteel','2021-07-15','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Guild of Darksteel is a story-driven adventure game set in a rich, dark fantasy world. As the immortal Sellsword, you must unearth an evil plot brewing beneath the city of Ravenrock.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7hcl.jpg'),(18984,'Parking Master',NULL,'Racing, Simulator, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Parking Master is the ultimate parking simulation! Park with precision using real mirrors and advanced car systems. Navigate tight spots, manage your own parking empire across Europe and Japan. Build, expand, and conquer diverse environments!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g58.jpg'),(18985,'Sunset Town',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a post-apocalyptic city destroyed by a solar flare. Fight mutated creatures, hostile factions, and harsh environments while scavenging for resources. Manage survival needs, upgrade gear, and uncover the truth behind the disaster in this challenging, randomly generated adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g5r.jpg'),(18986,'For the Culture',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(18987,'Kemono Teatime','2025-06-30','Simulator, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Relax in the world of Kemono Teatime, where animal ears are a normal part of everyday life. Here in Melodius, you can whip up whatever blends of tea you desire in your favorite cafe as you play through an adorable story. Come now and live out your bestest and cutest life—down to the last drop.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7obk.jpg'),(18988,'Need for Speed: Carbon - Own the City','2009-05-25','Racing','Zeebo, PlayStation Portable','Although this version of Need for Speed: Carbon - Own the City shares its name with its counterparts, the game is completely different. Unlike the other versions there is no canyon racing or drift racing.\n\nThe goal of the game is to build up a gang of the best racers and take over all the city\'s territories. The driving is all city-based similar to the open world of Need for Speed: Most Wanted. The tuner culture/car customization features started in Need for Speed Underground are also present.\n\nThere is a light story, presented as comic book style illustrations, that unfolds as the player take over territories and complete chapters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co209m.jpg'),(18989,'Propulsion','2021-07-15','Shooter, Platform','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Propulsion is a fast-paced 3D platformer inspired by the rocket jumping mechanic that has featured in many other games. The aim is for the player to use their rocket launcher to rocket jump across the levels as fast as possible, flying through a variety of environments, each featuring their own mechanics to spice up the gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hui.jpg'),(18990,'Flightpath','2023-01-26','Shooter, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A story-driven, quirky shoot\'em up, where your path choices affect the outcome of the story. Select one of three possible characters, each with its own storyline and see how the choices you make change the way the game unfolds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5o5v.jpg'),(18991,'Othello','2015-03-19','Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, TRS-80','This is ancient board game of Othello (another name is Reversi). You must capture opponent\'s pieces, placing your stones on board. Any opponent\'s stones directly between your new stone and any of your old ones became captured and reversed to your color.\n\nYou can play with friend or with computer.\n\nThis is anonymous BASIC version of 1982, translated from TRS-80 version.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co63br.jpg'),(18992,'STE : Save the Earth','2018-04-02','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An alien invasion has come! As the supreme general of the armed forces of the earth, your mission will be to gather an army and put an end to the threat. Make your way through one of the most complex clicker games out there and crown yourself as The Supreme Defender!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co423u.jpg'),(18993,'The Explorer of Night','2020-11-26','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The explorer of night is an minimalist platformer, where you need to help the main character to get out of the forest, inhabited by unfriendly enemies and dangerous traps.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gl0.jpg'),(18994,'Celestian Tales: Realms Beyond','2018-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An RPG with turn-based combat and a story of questionable morals seen through multiple perspectives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hrz.jpg'),(18995,'Penguin Attack','2024-04-01','Indie, Arcade','ZX Spectrum','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9rn0.jpg'),(18996,'Testament','1987-10-08','Shooter','PC-8800 Series, MSX2','As told by the ancient scroll Lyle found on his travels, a great five-headed Pentadragon once ruled the Diodoran continent with its legions of monsters. The heavens struck them down, sinking their land far into the earth...until now. With Pentadragon and Diodoran resurfacing to torment the world again, Lyle ventures out with gun and gear to rid this realm of evil and fulfill the gods\' prophecy.\n\nTestament is a top-down, multi-scrolling shoot-\'em-up adventure with several complex levels to explore. You acquire new weapons, items, and bonuses along paths strewn with enemies and hazards to encounter. Each stage features multiple boss fights and an assortment of secrets, either threatening or aiding your quest. You have limited lives and continues to work with, so play carefully and methodically to survive your expedition. This game led to the founding of a studio called Glodia, and it later received a Game Boy spiritual sequel simply called Pentadragon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co657k.jpg'),(18997,'Robotrek','1994-10-01','Role-playing (RPG)','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','Robotrek is a science-fiction roleplaying game in which you get to control a budding robotics expert who is the son of a famous inventor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bcm.jpg'),(18998,'Moe Waifu H: Push-Box','2025-05-09','Puzzle, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Brainteasing block puzzles have never looked so inviting! In Moe Waifu H Push-Box, you’ll meet 5 female companions who will test your problem-solving skills and reward your cleverness.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9myd.jpg'),(18999,'Last Resort','2023-08-28','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dive into the mysterious world of the \"Last Resort\", a non-linear visual novel where past and future are woven together. His life’s breaking under the weight of life problems. Unable to fight any further, He decides to take his final journey. Will it change anything? Or will it lead Him to the end?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70jd.jpg'),(19000,'Swooning Over Stans','2018-07-19','Simulator, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ever watch Gravity Falls and think, man, that Stan sure is hot? Well, indulge that thought by playing this Grunkle Dating Sim, a Gravity Falls fangame!\n\nA summer road trip leads to an unexpected pause in Gravity Falls. Can you capture the heart of one of the Mystery Shack’s most eligible bachelors? Or will you leave empty-handed?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bnh.jpg'),(19001,'Float Survival Simulator: Ocean Survivor','2024-12-21','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Nintendo Switch','Survive the waves, outsmart the predators.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9422.jpg'),(19002,'F1 2019','2019-06-28','Racing, Simulator, Sport','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Working in partnership with F1, for the first time ever, players will be able to get behind the wheel of a 2019 regulation car specifically designed in collaboration with F1’s technical team, headed up by Ross Brawn and Pat Symonds. The car, which will be available in Multiplayer, adheres to the 2019 regulations and comes with a range of livery designs offering players a new level of personalization. The 2019 F1 Team liveries will also feature on the car in early marketing materials, but will be replaced by the final Team cars ahead of the game\'s release.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1n7i.jpg'),(19003,'The Gatekeeper','2015-12-25','Point-and-click, Adventure','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8lnp.jpg'),(19004,'Spellbound Skirmish','2025-04-04','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Spellbound Skirmish is a fast-paced multiplayer 2D platformer where wizards clash in high-flying magical duels. Dodge, cast powerful spells, and outmaneuver your opponents in enchanted arenas. No upgrades—just pure skill-based combat. Master the elements and claim victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mmr.jpg'),(19005,'Ninpuchi! Cryptoninja Petit',NULL,'Sin género','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ninpuchi! is an exhilarating roguelike action game where you control a group of ninjas with unique personalities to defeat the oncoming monsters. 3-person party strategy and free character builds allow you to create your own unique adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9r8f.jpg'),(19006,'Voodoo Nightmare','1990-12-31','Adventure','Atari ST/STE, Amiga','Voodoo Nightmare is an isometric action game with puzzle elements. The game world consists of a jungle and five temples which have to be cleared. To do so, Boots need to travel inside the temples, collect all diamonds and offer them to the temple god. In return he receives a magic ability for this voodoo doll which allows him to proceed somewhere else in the jungle. Some of those diamonds are hidden and need to be found by killing the correct enemy or by performing actions, e.g. jumping puzzles or sliding blocks correctly. Fruit and additional jewels act as currency and can be reinvested inside the jungle shops which have useful items in stock, e.g. weapons, dynamite or maps. If Boots feels lucky, he can also visit casinos.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eyc.jpg'),(19007,'Adventure Tanks','2023-11-17','Shooter, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Engage in fierce battles against rival tanks in a variety of arenas. Strategize your moves, dodge enemy fire, and reach the ultimate goal!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7dg7.jpg'),(19008,'Face Love: Face Designer','2025-03-07','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9qfq.jpg'),(19009,'Killer Freaks From Outer Space',NULL,'Shooter, Arcade','Wii U','Killer Freaks from Outer Space is a cancelled game project from Ubisoft Montpellier that was changed to better fit the Wii U platform after being shown at E3 201.\nIt was re-revealed as ZombiU at E3 2012.\n\n\"In 2012, the world is going down the drain, fast...\n\nReams of alien ships have crashed into our planet, and these big wads of diseased, planet-eating, phlegm are spawning hordes of insanely vicious killers! The dangerous and degenerate creatures from outer space we call FREAKS seek to eradicate the human species with single-minded fury.\n\nYou\'re a survivor; a winner -- humanity\'s only freaking hope! Those raunchy aliens missed their chance to put you and your buddies down. And now you\'re going to make them regret it -- one slimy alien body-part at a time!\n\nImmerse yourself in this psychotic, arcade-style, 4-player co-op shooter; and just try and keep your head...\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6uwm.jpg'),(19010,'Pragma Arbiter',NULL,'Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pragma Arbiter is a match-based multiplayer game with a series of different game modes where you can play as a mage, rogue, or knight. The game modes include Adventure, Casual Team Battle, Ranked 3v3 Team Battle, 1v1 Duel, and Arena.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5uef.jpg'),(19011,'Aggie’s Digital Gallery',NULL,'Indie','Sin plataforma','Originally scheduled for release in 2000, Aggie’s Digital Gallery is an educational video game designed to teach children about art history. It was developed by Really Big Entertainment and published by NRC Games. Devised as a spin-off of the art creation game Aggie’s Art Studio, Aggie’s Digital Gallery promised players the ability to share their creations online with other young artists. Aggie’s Digital Gallery was cancelled several months before its release date. However, in 1999, an unknown number of promotional copies were sent out as part of a contest tied to Aggie’s Art Studio. Our team was able to acquire one of these promotional copies and port it to modern operating systems. In the interest of archival preservation, none of the original content has been modified.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h9e.jpg'),(19012,'LEGO Batman 3: Beyond Gotham - Premium Edition','2015-01-14','Puzzle, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3byb.jpg'),(19013,'Hall of the Things','1985-12-31','Arcade','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Amstrad CPC','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/h4gk618zmyfuyvkkqhfc.jpg'),(19014,'The Expanse: A Telltale Series - Deluxe Edition','2023-07-27','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Deluxe Edition brings together all five ground-breaking episodes of The Expanse: A Telltale Series along with Telltale\'s bonus episode “Archangel\".\n\n“Archangel\" is a brand new chapter in the saga and sees Shohreh Aghdashlooyou returning as fan-favorite Chrisjen Avasarala, a canny operator who must out-maneuver political adversaries and deal with personal emotions while fighting to protect the planet during her early career as Under-Secretary for Peace Operations, an organization formed to defend earth from impending danger.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6m0o.jpg'),(19015,'RTS Siege Up!','2022-05-11','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','iOS','Full-featured old-school fantasy RTS. No boosters. No timers. No pay-to-win. Battles 10-20 min. Campaign of 26 missions, online PvP and PvE. Support for Wi-Fi multiplayer and modding.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(19016,'Ziriax','1990-12-31','Sin género','Amiga','Ziriax is a horizontal scrolling shoot \'em up developed by The Whiz Kids and published by The Software Business. It was released in 1990 for the Amiga.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73hd.jpg'),(19017,'An Empty Castle: Laputa','2020-11-17','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Reach the Castle in the Sky','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4l7i.jpg'),(19018,'Sid Meier\'s Civilization IV: Beyond the Sword','2009-07-27','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sid Meier\'s Civilization IV: Beyond the Sword is the second expansion pack for Civilization IV - the 2005 PC Game of the Year that has become a worldwide hit. The expansion focuses on the time periods after the invention of gunpowder and delivers 11 unique and challenging scenarios created by the development team at Firaxis as well as esteemed members of the Civ Community. Civ IV: Beyond the Sword also includes ten new civilizations, sixteen new leaders, five new wonders, and a variety of new units that offer even more fun and exciting ways for players to expand their civilization\'s power as they strive for world domination.\n\nExpanded Epic Game: Adds a massive increase of new units, buildings, and technologies to the epic game with a tremendous amount of effort focused on the late game.\n\nNew Game Scenarios: 11 new scenarios custom-designed by the team at Firaxis and some members of the Civ Fan Community.\n\nNew Civilizations: 10 new civilizations, such as Portugal, Babylonians, and Netherlands and their associated unique units and buildings.\n\nMore Civilization Leaders: Sixteen new leaders, both for the new civilizations as well as additional leaders for existing civilizations, including Hammurabi of the Babylonians, Abraham Lincoln of the United States, and Sitting Bull of the Native Americans.\n\nCorporations: A new game feature similar to religion allows players to found companies and spread them throughout the world. Each corporation provides benefits in exchange for certain resources.\n\nEspionage: Now available earlier in the game, this feature offers players many new ways to spy on opponents, stir citizen unrest and defend government secrets.\nEvents: New random events - such as natural disasters and pleas for help or demands from their citizens - challenge players with obstacles that must be overcome for their civilization to prosper.\n\nNew Wonders: Five new wonders await discovery, including the Statue of Zeus, Cristo Redentor, the Shwedagon Paya, and the Mausoleum of Maussollos.\n\nExpanded Space Victory: Winning the race to Alpha Centauri will now require more strategic planning and tactical decision making.\n\nApostolic Palace: The United Nations is available earlier in the game, providing a way to win a diplomatic victory earlier. In addition, new resolutions expand the available diplomatic options.\n\nAdvanced Starts: A major fan request, this new feature enables players to \'buy\' components of a custom-tailored empire and begin play in the later part of the game, allowing one to experience many of the new features of the expansion in a shorter amount of time.\n\nAdvanced AI: The greatly-enhanced AI now relies more on smart play and less on handicap bonuses to remain competitive, providing a more consistent challenge throughout the course of the game, both economically and militarily. The ways in which the AI attempt to achieve victory have also been expanded.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rjo.jpg'),(19019,'Omelet You Cook',NULL,'Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The omelet-cooking roguelike. Assemble omelets for quirky customers using ingredients from a conveyor belt. Discover insane ingredient combinations to fulfill an ever-increasing score threshold. Overcome the hazards and restrictions of each customer and unlock new ingredients to use on future runs!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g6o.jpg'),(19020,'Crusader Kings II: Sword of Islam','2012-06-26','Simulator, Strategy','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Provides an opportunity to play for the Muslim dynasty, also adds to them new kinds of intrigue and various features. Muslims can have one home to his wife and three secondary. Half of the main skills of the wife goes to the governor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ywt.jpg'),(19021,'And the Hero Was Never Seen Again','2024-02-10','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','After defeating the Demon King, the Hero Astel is affected by a magic that turns him into a woman, and resets her powers. Now she must retrain her powers when the \"true demons\" begin to appear once more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rno.jpg'),(19022,'Vein',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Game is currently in around the clock development and will include bugs and potential room for improvement\n\nA hybrid of multiplayer and single player open-world post-apocalypse survival RPG set in the near future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mdh.jpg'),(19023,'White Water','2023-01-16','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Defeat the enemy as quickly as possible','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7iov.jpg'),(19024,'Witch Puzzle Rhythm','2024-02-15','Music, Puzzle, Indie, Arcade','Nintendo Switch','Cute and sexy witches battle it out in a new type of falling puzzle x rhythm action! Drop blocks in rhythm and defeat your opponents by sending them out of the way. A falling puzzle game where it feels great to erase blocks in time with the rhythm!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6d2e.jpg'),(19025,'Eyes Never Wake',NULL,'Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','A horror game where the monster watches you through your webcam. Hide by physically ducking beneath your desk while exploring a strange game never meant to be played.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kji.jpg'),(19026,'NeverSynth','2022-09-15','Racing','PC (Microsoft Windows)','NeverSynth is a 3rd person game that is a rhythm driving simulator. This game is a dynamic action game in which you have to drive a car to rhythmic music and collect beats. The more beats you collect, the more game points you earn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7i05.jpg'),(19027,'Bloodletter','2026-12-31','Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Bloodletter is a medieval deck builder all about using your cards to heal bizarre villagers. Protect their bodies and minds from the torment of mysterious entities by customising your unique deck and enhancing your dubious healing methods.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lss.jpg'),(19028,'Arcade Classics','1996-12-31','Shooter, Arcade','Philips CD-i','Namco compilation, consisting of three games. Galaxian, Galaga and Ms Pacman.\n\nConversions of three Namco classics including Galaxian, Ms Pac-man and Galaga. NAMCO took special interest in this project even though they weren\'t directly involved with the development of the CD-i version, the quality of the Intellectual Property had to be maintained. This went as far as the packaging itself which is detailed in the below Suggestive Themes boxout. Philips ADS were given a Pac-man arcade board with the chipset for Ms Pac-man to wire up so they had everything to do a decent conversion. It wasn\'t a straight port however, the entire game was upgraded to a 256 colour palette and also extra levels were added courtesy of Johnny Wood and authorised by NAMCO.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yk4.jpg'),(19029,'The Great War 1918',NULL,'Strategy','Sin plataforma','TGW 1918 is a WW1 modification for Company of Heroes, focusing on the last year of the First World War. Currently it features the British Expeditionary Force and the German Empire as opposing factions; however new nations will be brought over time, such as France and Austria-Hungary.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5n3p.jpg'),(19030,'Academia Ovivim','2024-06-15','Fighting, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fa5.jpg'),(19031,'Dragon Extinction','2020-10-16','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter a fantasy world where humanity has brought dragons to the brink of extinction. This ARPG features hundreds of unique items, crafting and procedural dungeons.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ilz.jpg'),(19032,'A Happy New Year','2019-01-01','Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A Happy New Year is a short text-based game where you spend New Year\'s Eve alone by the river. It\'s about getting messages from drunk people, about the need to justify what you\'re doing and maybe just about ordinary teenage-kitsch, too.\n\nThe game mixes personal experiences with fiction and would best be described as a mood-game. It\'s not necessarily about the story itself, but about a specific feeling at a specific time. It takes about 10 - 15 minutes to complete.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94uo.jpg'),(19033,'Revita','2021-03-03','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A fast paced twin-stick roguelite platformer. Climb an ominous clock tower in a series of procedural encounter rooms and past challenging boss fights on your way to reclaiming your lost memory.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2u55.jpg'),(19034,'SpellRogue','2024-02-12','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','SpellRogue is a turn-based, deckbuilding roguelike where you cast powerful spells using your Mana Dice, gain legendary artifacts, upgrade your spells and experiment with potent combinations to annihilate the Voidwalkers corrupting the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7qre.jpg'),(19035,'Worms Crazy Golf','2011-10-18','Puzzle, Sport, Strategy','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Worms Crazy Golf is a hilarious mixture of the explosive action of Worms and the puzzle-based challenges of crazy golf! All of the trademark Worms humour, comic violence, and cartoon visuals are present, combined with addictive yet accessible golf gameplay. With extensive and re-playable single-player options, and hot-seat multi-player for up to 4 players, this is not just a load of balls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xqu.jpg'),(19036,'Ragnarock: Sabaton Raid','2023-06-22','Music','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation VR, PC (Microsoft Windows), Oculus Quest','This new DLC for the Rhythm game Ragnarock brings you a unique collaboration with the epic band Sabaton.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mqi.jpg'),(19037,'Seafight','2006-03-18','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Seafight: an absolute highlight among MMORPGs\n\nCome on board yer ship, pirate, and be swept away by the beautiful horizon and sea. But don\'t be fooled by this MMORPG\'s idyllic scenery - a cutthroat life awaits ye in Seafight, the MMORPG with all the pirate trimmings: plundering, conquering and murdering. Defeat vicious and dangerous scoundrels in this pirate game. And stay on guard: Danger lurks everywhere. There be giant sea monsters swimming in the treacherous waters of this online pirate game. Experience and tactical skill will keep ye on course, but only if ye know how to interpret the signs properly in this MMORPG.\n\nYer ship is yer sanctuary, yer empire, yer fortress. Turn it into a stronghold and defend it with all yer might. After all, what\'s a pirate without his ship in this MMORPG? A nobody, a good-for-nothing! If ye want to be respected, stock up yer ship and teach yer enemies the true meaning of fear!\nOnly the most cunning pirates will conquer the Seven Seas of the pirate game Seafight. MMORPGs like this are few and far between, and Seafight is the undisputed leader of the pack. Hoist the Jolly Roger and fight against thousands of real pirates for fame, wealth and freedom: Rule the oceans in Seafight, the online pirate game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co503e.jpg'),(19038,'Insurgency: Sandstorm - Chemical Combat Gear Set','2024-06-18','Sin género','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Withstand challenging environments and conquer the battlefield with the Chemical Combat Gear Set for the Security team. This set includes five different cosmetic gear pieces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co90b9.jpg'),(19039,'Forge Party',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','A party game about creating weapons under pressure','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(19040,'The Sinking City: Deluxe Edition','2021-02-19','Puzzle, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Upgrade your experience with the Deluxe Edition which includes:\n\n- The Sinking City game\n- The Worshipers of the Necronomicon - 3 new quests in which Charles Reed investigates unsolved cases and sets out in search of mysterious spell books that harbor unspeakable powers.\n- Merciful Madness - 3 new quests that explore Lovecraft’s iconic stories and bring to light the mysteries of Oakmont and its demented citizens.\n- Investigator Pack - Upgrade your gaming experience with an exclusive private investigator outfit and access to a first aid kit, antipsychotics and a crafting materials starter pack.\n- Chicago Organ Grinder - This DLC grants early access to the most powerful weapon in the game, the Tommy gun, and comes with a golden skin of the weapon.\n- Experience Boost - This DLC includes a skill point that can be used from the start of the game. Use it wisely to upgrade your combat skills, vigor or mind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ohd.jpg'),(19041,'Stay Out of the House','2022-10-13','Shooter, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Edge of your seat STEALTH HORROR as you try to escape the house of a cannibal SERIAL KILLER....\nStay Out of the House is stealth based, VHS style slasher horror. With low poly visuals authentic to the PS1 era, this is the game your 90\'s self always wanted!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jad.jpg'),(19042,'Noble Crusade','2018-11-13','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Noble Crusade is an action role playing game based on heroes, monsters, and treasure! Fight your way through Shadow Mist Forest as you learn new abilities, discover relics, and powerful loot!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2quq.jpg'),(19043,'Touchstarved',NULL,'Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You were born cursed, with hands that twist the mind of any human you touch. Desperation leads you to the shadowy city of Eridia, where your fate intertwines with 5 monstrous strangers. Each can offer you salvation or damnation. Find a cure for your curse in Touchstarved, a gothic horror romance visual novel.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7r22.jpg'),(19044,'Banshee Force','2018-01-31','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Banshee Force is a virtual reality game where you command the legendary Banshee Force Weapons Platform. Standing in the middle of a planetary battle you use the weapons platform to stop the invaders and build a defense that can outlast the enemy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3lwz.jpg'),(19045,'Figures Saga','2017-06-29','Arcade','Android','The Figures Saga is a game that will make every moment. All you need is a phone and good reflexes! Try to catch as many figures as you can on the screen. Watch out because with the amount of points the game becomes more difficult and requires more attention. Try to catch the circle when it appears in the darker circle field by clicking on any area of the screen. More on video material.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/irusqskjgtaqwj7jxeuh.jpg'),(19046,'Beyond One\'s Past','2024-10-30','Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beyond One\'s Past is a psychological horror game which takes you on the journey of a police officer, who has gone through, is going through, and will continue to go through the mysteries of events that unfolded in a small town in the outskirts of Pennsylvania.\n\nCan you break the cycle and bring the investigation to an end?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9h9c.jpg'),(19047,'Door Kickers 2','2020-11-03','Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Command military Special Ops Teams in gripping tactical combat against a Middle East-based terrorist network. Sequel to RockPaperShotgun\'s \"Best Tactics Game of 2014\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g0w.jpg'),(19048,'Brawl Brothers','2013-11-21','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Wii, Wii U, Super Famicom','Released in 1992 for the Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Brawl Brothers is a side-scrolling beat \'em up game by Jaleco, serving as the sequel to Rival Turf! and preceding The Peace Keepers in 1993. Set in Bayside City, where people are vanishing amidst rumors of sinister human cloning experiments, the game follows Rick and Doug, who are driven by personal stakes when three friends from their martial arts gym are abducted.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43nm.jpg'),(19049,'Watch Dogs 2: Mega Pack','2017-04-25','Shooter, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','You\'ve got it, so flaunt it with this massive customization bundle. Contains custom clothing and skins for vehicles, weapons, and RC devices.\nIncludes the following packs:\n- RETRO-MODERNIST\n- GLOW_PRO\n- RIDE BRITANNIA\n- KICK IT\n- VELVET COWBOY\n- BAY AREA THRASH','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8e9a.jpg'),(19050,'Beyblade Burst: Battle Zero','2018-10-25','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Nintendo Switch','From being a sought-after manga, to being physically played by countless fans, Beyblade is spinning its way to Nintendo Switch this 2018. Beyblade Burst: Battle Zero makes the toy-spinning mania fully realized. But, the game will be available for Japan only--as of press time.\n\nIf you\'re an avid fan and collector, Beyblade Burst: Battle Zero will kill two birds with one stone. Apart from special edition that fans will get, it will also feature a game-exclusive Beyblade with every copy. Spin your Switch to something exciting with Beyblade Burst: Battle Zero!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9daz.jpg'),(19051,'Phi: The Broken Strings',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle','Sin plataforma','Phi: The Broken Strings is a 3D puzzle platformer that takes you on an emotional journey through four levels, each reflecting a key life experience—Happiness, Sadness, Fear, and Anger.\nThe game is in the prototype stage.\n\nWith over 25 unique puzzles, 12+ immersive events, and dynamic NPC interactions, the game blends exploration, storytelling, and platforming into a 4-8 hour experience.\n\nPerfect for fans of Little Nightmares, Inside, Limbo, and Bramble: The Mountain King.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9p5y.jpg'),(19052,'Blitz: The League','2005-10-17','Sport','Xbox, Wii, PlayStation 2','Blitz: The League is an American football game by Midway as an unlicensed extension of their NFL Blitz series. Released after the NFL signed an exclusive licensing deal with Electronic Arts, it was released in October 2005 for the PlayStation 2 and Xbox. This game is the first in the Blitz series to receive an \"M\" rating by the ESRB due to the graphic violence, explicit language, and drug use depicted. Lawrence Taylor, who provides voice acting for the game, serves as its official spokesman. In 2006, a second version of the game was released on the Xbox 360 in October. In December 2006, a portable version was released on the PlayStation Portable (under the title Blitz: Overtime). These versions included the voicework and likeness of former pro linebacker Bill Romanowski. The game was originally intended to be a Wii launch title, but the Wii-version was delayed and eventually canceled.\n\nOn January 22, 2007, the game was refused classificatio by the Office of Film and Literature Classification in Australia, effectively banning the game there. The game was banned as the use of drugs was related to incentives and rewards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70pg.jpg'),(19053,'Extreme Bike X','2022-10-17','Racing, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This easy-to-master motocross racing game is fun for everyone! Pass around the Joy-Con controllers and play with up to four players! Try out each bike\'s special abilities and take your favorite to the courses!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rnb.jpg'),(19054,'Company of Heroes: Game of the Year Edition','2007-10-11','Real Time Strategy (RTS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Company of Heroes: Game Of The Year Edition includes:\n\nTwo new skirmish maps: Seine River Docks and Beaux Lowlands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8gzm.jpg'),(19055,'Sofi Origins','2023-12-05','Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Sofi Origins is an adventure, suspense, and horror game in which you play as Sofi, a girl with a very sad past, but who in her world has powers. Alongside Sofi, you will experience fear and sadness in a unique way. You will have to use your skills and stay focused to confront the past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7eat.jpg'),(19056,'Pokémon Team Rocket Blast Off','2006-12-31','Arcade','Web browser','Pokémon Team Rocket Blast Off is one of three Flash-based computer games that were developed for the 10th Anniversary Perdue Farms promotion. The other two games are Pokémon Poké Ball Launcher and Pokémon Seek & Find. Pokémon Team Rocket Blast Off is a simple game in which players have to catch falling Pokémon.\n\nThe game consists of Ash and May holding a tarp to catch the Pokémon tossed by the Team Rocket trio from their balloon. They drop both Pokémon and sandbags. The player moves Ash and May by moving the mouse. Pokémon may drop at different speeds and angles, and if their path hits a screen border, they will bounce off of it. They will also bounce back up in the air if they hit the edge of the tarp.\n\nCatching a Pokémon earns one point, but missing a Pokémon or catching a sandbag causes a deduction of points. Points are represented by Poké Balls that fill a bar on the left-hand side, and will never be negative. Levels 2 and 3 also have time limits.\n\nThe game is won once the player obtains nineteen points. Winning the game results in Team Rocket\'s balloon bursting, causing the trio to blast off.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mzz.jpg'),(19057,'Contra III: The Alien Wars','2016-05-12','Shooter, Adventure','Arcade, Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Wii, Wii U, New Nintendo 3DS, Super Famicom','This game is action from beginning to end, do not think that you will have a moment of peace, even because Aliens are at war with planet earth, and resting will be your least concern.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64pi.jpg'),(19058,'Crisis City','1998-06-04','Sin género','PlayStation','Crisis City is an action game with 3 different game modes:\n\n- Time Attack allows you to choose any of the seven game characters and romp through a selection of levels at lightning pace. Each character is rated A, B or C with a bar scale highlighting their personal strengths and weaknesses. Comparable to the best beat-em-ups they are all remarkably dissimilar to control therefore each will provide a unique challenge in their own right. Some move extremely swiftly but may only carry a hand pistol while others are a little slower off the mark but are packed with high-power weapons of destruction.\n\n- Versus Mode is your typical beat-em-up, one vs one, battle to the death. Taking place in an enclosed arena two of the selectable fighters enter into a gun battl. Scattered around each arena are a number of obstacles that may be used for cover therefore speed of movement becomes a great leveler.\n\n- Story Mode: You are allowed 99 seconds to complete each of numerous screens where there are several enemies to eliminated before the exit is revealed. Any obstacles standing in your way may be slowly destroyed by constant firing of your gun or taking the quick fix which involves lobbing a few of your limited grenades. After completing each level you must face one of the remaining selectable characters in a battle to the death.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pmc.jpg'),(19059,'Bomb','2015-07-29','Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Cool aircraft, big guns, dogfight thrill, single player, multi player, modding support, moustaches and ladies. You\'ll like it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ekbsnbbyb3z9rxkyp1ys.jpg'),(19060,'Off the Wall','1991-12-31','Sin género','Arcade','One or two players bust through blocks in various formations using a paddle and ball, trying to reach an exit located in the center of the blocks in order to advance to the next wave. There are glowing blocks which give you \"Power Ups\" Xextra ball, Ccatch ball, I invinciball, S slow ball, B bigger paddle, F firepower which allows you to shoot blocks with a gun located in the center of your paddle. You get points for busting blocks, but get more bonus points for blocks left when you reach the exit. This game expands upon the classic Breakout theme in several ways. There are many levels with unique variations, such as new blocks parachuting in to replace the blocks which you just busted, barrier blocks that cannot be busted, moving blocks, and objects which can deflect or place spin upon the ball. If you keep the ball in play long enough, the ball splits in two. In the two-player mode, you only get points when the ball color matches your paddle color. The ball color is determined by the last paddle to hit the ball. This game adds enough twists to the classic Breakout to make for very interesting gameplay. When the game ends you can continue where you left off by adding additional credits, but your score at the end of a multiple credit game is determined by dividing your points by the number of credits played.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7m67.jpg'),(19061,'Echoes of the Living','2025-12-31','Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Echoes of the Living is a dark Classic Survival Horror inspired by the greatest hits from the 90\'s focused on reimagining visual horror, your goal is to make it alive while uncovering the truth about the incident.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xqz.jpg'),(19062,'Maré do Amor','2024-07-14','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Game Boy Color, Web browser','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fa8.jpg'),(19063,'Super Donkey Kong 2','1997-12-31','Platform','Family Computer, Nintendo Entertainment System','‎Super Donkey Kong 2 is a pirated Famicom port of the SNES game Donkey Kong Country 2: Diddy\'s Kong Quest published by NT in 1997. It greatly resembles Super Donkey Kong.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3i8h.jpg'),(19064,'The First Berserker: Khazan - Deluxe Edition Upgrade','2025-03-27','Sin género','Xbox One','The First Berserker: Khazan is a hardcore action role-playing game. The player will become Khazan, the great general of the Pell Los Empire, who overcame death, and sets out to reveal the incidents that led to his downfall and seek vengeance on his enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9m3h.jpg'),(19065,'Microsoft Flight Simulator X: Steam Edition - Diamond DA40-180','2016-08-30','Simulator','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Alabeo Diamond DA40-180 recreates this popular composite-build aircraft in its earlier guise with a steam gauge cockpit. With a 180-horsepower engine and seating for four, the DA40-180 went on to spawn later generations with glass cockpits and alternative power plants.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85q5.jpg'),(19066,'Mini Warriors: Three Kingdoms',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG)','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(19067,'The Ball Game','1991-12-31','Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, Atari ST/STE, DOS, Amiga','The second episodic adventure game developed by Telltale Games set within the \'Song of Ice and Fire\' universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eyj.jpg'),(19068,'Super Cycle','1987-12-31','Racing, Sport','Commodore C64/128/MAX, ZX Spectrum, Atari ST/STE, PC (Microsoft Windows), Amstrad CPC','A motorbike racing game strongly resembling Sega\'s Hang-On titles. The game is viewed from behind the bike, which tilts as you turn. You are racing against the clock, although there are lots of other bikes on track to avoid and ride around. There are 3 skill levels, which affect the amount of time you have to complete the level, and the bonus offered if you manage to (the amount of time left, divided by a set number, bigger on lower levels). Your bike has 3 gears and appears to have a top speed of around 120 MPH. After every 2 races there\'s a bonus round in which you must pick up as many tokens as possible in the time limit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9eyk.jpg'),(19069,'Girl Genius: Adventures in Castle Heterodyne','2023-09-05','Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','A fabulous Action Adventure game based on the award winning graphic novel series Girl Genius by Phil & Kaja Foglio.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2spv.jpg'),(19070,'Flashout 3D: Enhanced Edition','2022-09-02','Racing, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The classical AG racer, Flashout 3D, initially released more than 10 years ago, is back, to celebrate the upcoming launch of Flashout 3! But we bring you not only the first installment of the series for free, but we have also remastered it and enhanced with upgraded graphics and new features!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56ns.jpg'),(19071,'Intergalactic Gus','2018-09-15','Platform','Android','A simple 2D platformer where movement is dictated by physics. You can bounce and move side to side but you\'ll need to time things just right to get to the end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/vnp9zfgqjps4hvqgjd9q.jpg'),(19072,'Magical Otoge Ciel','2016-08-26','Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The naive but kind and determined Princess Ciel leaves her kingdom despite her overprotective father\'s wishes and goes on a journey with two knights, Florien and Anton.\n\nAlong the way, they\'re stalked by a sassy vagrant named Yvin who tails them in order to bring Ciel back for reward money, but seems to be getting a bit too attached?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6syz.jpg'),(19073,'Densha de GO! 2 3000','2000-01-20','Simulator','Arcade, PC (Microsoft Windows), Dreamcast','This version is a celebratory release from Taito for having 3000 active Densha de Go! 2 arcade units nation-wide in Japan, titled Densha de Go! 2 Kousoku-hen 3000-bandai. It adds eleven new routes and several new train models. Upgrade kits and new cabinets were made available in August/September 1998.\n\nThis version was ported to Dreamcast and Windows PC in 2000. It also serves as the basis for 1999\'s Densha de Go! 64.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xxp.jpg'),(19074,'SimTower','1996-03-01','Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows), 3DO Interactive Multiplayer, Mac, Sega Saturn','Welcome to the building simulation game SimTower, which offers the chance to build and manage all the complex, interconnected operations of a modern skycraper. You build your empire from nothing and become the engineer and general manager of your structure. You can provide offices, coffee shops or apartments to anyone who is willing to pay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vut.jpg'),(19075,'Downtown Nekketsu Koushinkyoku: Soreyuke Daiundoukai','1992-11-12','Fighting, Sport','TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine','Reihou Academy Student Council proposed a friendly athletic meet-up to apologize for the wrongdoings done by student council president Yamada. However, Toudou Mamoru, the new student council president who has been entrusted with the arrangement of the athletic meet, has no intention of apologizing. Instead he is plotting to crush the other schools, and reinstates The Double Dragons despite them being expelled for their kidnapping of Mami.\n\nNobody hesitates to participate. Nekketsu High School, led by Kunio, Hanazono High School led by Riki and Interschool Union led by Gouda all announce their participation in the competition. Thus Toudou can begin his plot with the 4 teams in place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xef.jpg'),(19076,'Bowler',NULL,'Sin género','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(19077,'Phantasy Star Online 2 New Genesis: Limited Edition','2021-08-19','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch','One of the goals for Phantasy Star Online 2 New Genesis is to create the ultimate PSO2 in which the time-tested elements are kept intact, while the game design, gameplay, and graphics engine will be completely redesigned and reborn in all aspects. We are working very hard to offer players unparalleled character customization, limitless adventure, and the best action online RPG.\n\nThe limited edition includes:\n- Phantasy Star Online 2: New Genesis\n- Mini Soundtrack\n- Special Illustrated Box','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ytn.jpg'),(19078,'Blackguards','2014-01-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','What happens when the only hope of a threatened world lies not with heroes in shining armor, but in the hands of a band of misfits and criminals? Blackguards, a new turn-based strategy RPG, explores this very question. You will discover over 180 unique hex-based battlegrounds within a dark and mature story of crime, drugs, and murder.\n\nPlay as a warrior, mage or hunter and customize your character\'s skills as you see fit. The challenging campaign delivers a story of doubt, treason and loss. You decide the course of the story at key turning points and determine its outcome.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26en.jpg'),(19079,'Heroes of Might and Magic III: The Restoration of Erathia','1999-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Heroes of Might and Magic III: The Restoration of Erathia is a turn-based strategy game and the third installment of the Heroes of Might and Magic series.\n\nThe game\'s story is first referenced throughout Might and Magic VI: The Mandate of Heaven and takes place before Might and Magic VII: For Blood and Honor. The player can choose to play through six different campaigns telling the story, or play in a scenario against computer or human opponents.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a47.jpg'),(19080,'Koh Lanta: Les Aventuriers','2021-10-14','Simulator, Quiz/Trivia, Adventure, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Will you be the last adventurer on the island? 14 adventurers left to their own devices, on an island far from any civilization ... A game of survival and strategy in an idyllic atmosphere ... A television show that brings together several million viewers each season ... Koh-Lanta is a game that will involve dexterity , diplomacy and the nerves of the player to the test: life on an island is not a part of pleasure, and each day will bring its share of surprises ... Manage your daily life well, the events in team or solo, but especially your relationships with other islanders to continue the adventure to the end and be the last adventurer on the island! But beware: if you falter or get eliminated by your peers… the game is over!\n\nKoh Lanta: Les Aventuriers is a game based on the French adaptation of the tv show Survivor, exclusive to France.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co408p.jpg'),(19081,'The Lord of the Rings: War in the North','2011-11-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','The Lord of the Rings: War in the North is a co-op Action RPG that immerses you and your friends in a brutal new chapter in the War of the Ring. Snowblind Studios is in the unique position of drawing inspiration from both the literary and film rights to world of Middle-earth, allowing players to bloody their axes on a wide range of deadly enemies and traverse both established and never-before-seen locations. The result is a journey that is both epic and intimate, familiar yet unexpected.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20p9.jpg'),(19082,'Hidden Cats in Spooky Town','2023-10-20','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','It\'s Helloween Time! Do you choose Trick or Cat? Enjoy and find all the hidden cats one by one on the Spooky Town to reveal the final colored art. Play through different modes, find special cats, and unlock bonus levels! More than 700 hidden objects to find!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7d3g.jpg'),(19083,'Sorcerer King','2015-07-16','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sorcerer King is a new direction for 4X game design, pitting the player against a single overwhelmingly powerful enemy instead of a set of evenly matched factions racing for abstract victory conditions.\n\nThink of the Sorcerer King as the evil mage who won the last traditional 4X game. He has already conquered the world. His enemies (including you) are scattered, their armies broken and cities torn down. His dark minions have free reign to terrorize the survivors everywhere except a few tiny outposts of civilization (like the one you start in) too insignificant to crush.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ijj.jpg'),(19084,'Warhammer: Chaosbane','2019-06-04','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','In a world ravaged by war and dominated by magic, you must rise up to face the Chaos hordes. Playing solo or with up to four in local or online co-op, choose a hero from four character classes and prepare for epic battles wielding some of the most powerful artefacts of the Old World.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nix.jpg'),(19085,'Godsworn','2024-03-28','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Godsworn is a classic mythological RTS. Experience an epic fantasy retelling of the northern crusades, where pagan gods and their tribes clash against crusaders and armies of heaven. Choose a divine hero, rally worshippers alongside mythical creatures, and smite the unworthy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co53ag.jpg'),(19086,'Dream House Days DX','2022-03-27','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The house of your dreams is a dream no more! You play both architect and landlord in this fanciful new sim, and it\'s up to you to furnish your ideal abode with anything from arcade games to saunas to convenience stores. Certain combinations can power up your rooms...and their rent. Put an HDTV and game console together to make a game room, or a grand piano and painting together to make a fine arts room! Rise up the rankings of real estate fame and you might reel in some celebrity tenants, ranging from hit singers to soccer stars! But there\'s more than just business at stake. Tenants will look to you for guidance on everything from romance to career choices. With your help, they just might tie the knot or land that dream job! Build a dream home where dreams come true! Try searching for \"Kairosoft\" to see all of our games!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4nzp.jpg'),(19087,'Demon Sword: Incubus','2022-06-18','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Use sword and spell combos to slash and blast through hordes of attacking enemies! Guard break a bosses defenses, find an opening, then obliterate them for good with a well placed super deadly attack! Satisfying 3D side scrolling action with game-play elements inspired by fighting games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4w3v.jpg'),(19088,'Feudalism','2007-09-20','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Web browser','Feudalism is an strategy/RPG with open world, so you can go wherever you want and fight anyone.\n\nYou start with only one city where you can recruit soldiers, but the bigger city you capture, the better troops you gain.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8p3x.jpg'),(19089,'Game Tester Quest','2024-01-22','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Game Tester Quest is an old school RPG that lets the player play 3 separate games as a test subject.\n\nThese games will come out in the following order:\n- Fantasy RPG\n- Detective RPG\n- Cyberpunk RPG','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ncx.jpg'),(19090,'Super Bogus World','2011-10-31','Shooter, Platform, Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Pinball','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Super Bogus World is a Game Maker game made by Hubol Gordon and Oddwarg after about a year of work. It\'s full of strange humor, awkward scenarios, and no genre is safe from this game\'s mocking power.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8o34.jpg'),(19091,'Warframe: The New War','2021-12-15','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Experience The New War, Warframe\'s largest cinematic expansion yet. Fight on the frontlines in every corner of the Origin System in a thrilling storyline of exploration and discovery. Unite opposing forces and test your mettle against the full mustered force of the Sentients, a legion of adaptable, self-replicating drones capable of untold destruction. You must stop them, Tenno, and reckon with the Lotus, or all you have fought to protect will fall to ruin.\n\nWith several new playable characters, a new Warframe, a dramatic cinematic Quest, and an Arsenal reinforced with new Customizations, Weapons and Accessories, get ready to wield limitless power to look and play the way you want in this all-out-war.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4p6u.jpg'),(19092,'Nilspace','2022-12-05','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An all new Strategy RPG inspired by your favorites! Develop a guild, foster character relationships, and customize your units for battle. Discover the unknown realities of Nilspace and its many stories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co31il.jpg'),(19093,'Fire Emblem Gaiden','1992-03-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Wii, Family Computer, Wii U','The Continent of Valencia is split into two territories. To the north is the Kingdom of Rigel, home to followers of the Dark God Doma. To the south is the Kingdom of Sofia, where the Earth Goddess Mila is worshipped. When Rigel invades Sofia, two heroes, Arum and Cellica, raise an army to topple Rigel and the Dark God that is backing the conflict.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vtg.jpg'),(19094,'Rogue Labyrinth','2025-04-01','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Fight through the ranks in a monster-filled labyrinth created by an egocentric billionaire colonist. Make friends (or enemies) with rivals, employees, fans, and monsters to improve your abilities. The crowd wants a show, so hype them up in this rogue-lite narrative adventure!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99ef.jpg'),(19095,'Onmyoji','2018-04-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','A Japanese RPG style mobile card game produced by NetEase Games, released on iOS and Android. Although the game is produced by a Chinese company, it\'s dubbing and story line are in Japanese.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qt6.jpg'),(19096,'ValiDate: Struggling Singles in your Area','2022-09-28','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','ValiDate is a visual novel about thirteen struggling singles navigating through soul-sucking 9-to-5s, quarter-life crises, and the harsh truths millennials learn as soon as they hit their 20\'s.\n\nSet in the Jercy City area, our cast of lovers trudge through the dregs of capitalism - a journey, a transition - a rite-of-passage that leads into uncertain mid-adulthood. On one side but not yet out on the other, 13 playable characters find romance amongst cosplay, trash mixtapes, and even poetry straight from the soul.\n\nWith over 30 routes to choose from and hours of content, the lives of these singles are in your good (or bad!) decision-making hands.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55eh.jpg'),(19097,'Crowfall','2021-07-06','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Crowfall is a Massively Multiplayer Online Role Playing Game (MMORPG). The Worlds of Crowfall feature unique maps, rules, and victory conditions. Every World is different, and players join teams (Factions, Guilds or Noble Houses) to vie for control of each World.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2djo.jpg'),(19098,'Dofus Retro','2019-09-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dofus Retro is a new server option for Dofus released in 2019. The goal of Retro is to let players experience Dofus as close as possible to what it was before the graphical overhaul that came with 2.0.\n\nCertain players have a very special affection for Version 1.29 of the game DOFUS. That\'s why there are new servers allowing them to rediscover the game as it was almost ten years ago.\n\nTwo 1.29 servers - Eratz and Henual - have always persisted. Historically, Ankama kept them so they wouldn\'t be unfairly disadvantaging their Latin American players, whose computers may not necessarily have been able to keep up with the performances required to enjoy DOFUS 2.0 to the fullest. Now, all of their players can enjoy it simply by subscribing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4s23.jpg'),(19099,'RPG Survivors','2024-02-11','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game involves continuously facing new enemies, defeating them to acquire weapons or skills, and striving to survive for 20 minutes.\n\nYou can choose from 5 characters and explore several stages.\n\nIt\'s a log-lite genre game, where you can collect gems or coins through gameplay to become stronger.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7n2i.jpg'),(19100,'Fullmetal Alchemist: Iron & Flame','2005-03-05','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Web browser','Iron and Flame was a Fullmetal Alchemist flash game formerly hosted on the [adult swim] website. The player was able to control both Edward and Alphonse Elric, who were sent by Roy Mustang to destroy the last of Shou Tucker\'s remaining chimeras.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7x1d.jpg'),(19101,'Gaokao.Love.100Days','2018-09-24','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Getting a girl-friend before Gaokao(National College Entrance Exam), I know it\'s crazy, but from today, we will face everything together.\nIs there still room for love in this 100 days, or am I just ruining my life, or worse, her life?\n\nThis is a dating simulation game based on Chinese students\' real life.\nYou can have romantic relationship with classmates,\nbut remember that you have just 100 days while preparing for \"Gaokao\".\n\nKeep a balance between score and romance, or just drop one and see what would happen?\nThere are over 10 story lines and will lead to more than 50 ends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4172.jpg'),(19102,'Justice.exe','2022-06-07','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Justice.exe is a dialogue-heavy dystopian legal drama in which you defend sentient AI in court. Discover key story elements in dialogue, build your case by studying arguments, and engage the opposing counsel in wits, charisma and skullduggery. Small choices might alter the fate of your clients.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44dk.jpg'),(19103,'Gearhead Caramel','2022-07-21','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','GearHead Caramel is the third game in the GearHead series. Your character can play through a series of adventures set in various times and places in the GearHead universe. Currently there are two adventure modules, with more to follow.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zhr.jpg'),(19104,'Rasetsu','2001-12-07','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Rasetsu is a real time strategy with RPG elements that was released in 2001 for Microsoft Windows 98. It plays similarly to any other real-time strategy title with an isometric view and common point-and-click interface, and also toting somewhat of a Front Mission-esque as you\'ll often find yourself switching over from battles to intermissions (where you\'ll be able to talk to characters) and so on. The game features a techno soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qc0.jpg'),(19105,'Knights of the Tiny Table','2021-10-21','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Help King Arthur and his Knights defend the realm. Slay the evil entities with a combination of lucky dice rolls and clever tactics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47ge.jpg'),(19106,'Old Coin Pusher Friends 3','2024-07-26','Shooter, Simulator, Indie, Arcade, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','In this installment, there is a Sugoroku themed around the old Japan, with various events triggered by the squares you land on. Work together with other players to defeat yokai, and aim for the jackpot. As you progress in the game, you can enhance your abilities with various upgrades.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8mkr.jpg'),(19107,'Gotham Knights: Heroic Assault: The Kelvin Incident','2023-04-27','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','The Kelvin Incident is a new Heroic Assault adding a 15-floor raid , Mythic gear, a new suit transmog, 4 new batcycle transmogs, and new stronger enemies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kw0.jpg'),(19108,'Spider-Man: Web of Shadows','2008-10-21','Fighting, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Spider-Man: Web of Shadows is a video game title encompassing three versions: a full-3D action game for Microsoft Windows, PlayStation 3, Wii, and Xbox 360; a 2.5D sidescrolling beat em up action game for the PlayStation Portable and PlayStation 2 (called Amazing Allies Edition), and a 2.5D side-scrolling brawler/platformer for the Nintendo DS.\n\nSpider-Man: Web of Shadows, along with most other games published by Activision that had used the Marvel licence, was de-listed and removed from all digital storefronts on January 1, 2014.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ujz.jpg'),(19109,'Interstellar Marines','2014-06-06','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Tactical, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','nterstellar Marines resurrects the old school tactical FPS, offering a unique blend of co-op, role-playing and nonlinear gameplay. Set in a believable future, you take on the role as an elite soldier handpicked to join Project IM, a top secret military program being assembled to protect mankind from all dangers outside our solar system.\n\nInterstellar Marines is inspired by Half-Life, System Shock 2 and Rainbow Six 3: Raven Shield. Our game is all about evolving the FPS recipe with all the inspirations we\'ve assimilated since the birth of the genre. Our goal is an evolutionary leap forward driven by our compulsive interest in science fiction, role-playing, military realism, and respect for first person immersion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3woe.jpg'),(19110,'Destiny\'s Sword','2022-10-17','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Destiny’s Sword is a Living-Narrative Graphic Adventure. Explore distant worlds, forge friendships and lead your troops through an epic adventure.\nIn a future where bodies can be healed in minutes, the wounds technology can\'t conquer are within the mind.\nIn Destiny’s Sword you’re the commander of a team of skilled troopers - and the only thing that can get in their way is themselves.\nEvery recruit has their own story to tell, their own reasons for getting involved. Their experiences while under your command will shape their development and affect their performance. As you get to know your squad on and off the battlefield you will explore the full depth of the human condition. Empathy will be your most powerful tool.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oip.jpg'),(19111,'Talisman: Digital Edition - Apprentice Mage','2014-09-11','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Embark on a quest for knowledge as the Apprentice Mage! While she may be inexperienced, she has the potential to become a powerful Mage who is at her most dangerous when other characters cast their spells. Her search for knowledge will slowly draw her towards the Crown of Command.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(19112,'Maiden Cops','2024-09-23','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Maiden Cops is a Beat\'m Up full of classic, arcade-style action and ass kicking. Choose among the gorgeous Maiden Cops policewomen, tackle crime in Maiden City and enjoy premium-level pixel art and a breathtaking soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8uc7.jpg'),(19113,'The Legion of Maelstrom','2021-05-24','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An imminent storm approaches the land, threatening to wipe out all of civilization. Gain the support of the neighbouring town elders, and gain the power to defeat the tyrant Maelstrom who has been controlling the storms all along.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3w54.jpg'),(19114,'Little Witch in the Woods','2022-05-17','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Little Witch in the Woods tells the story of Ellie, an apprentice witch. Explore the mystical forest, help the charming residents, and experience the daily life of the witch.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xqo.jpg'),(19115,'Empty Skull','2024-01-31','Fighting, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Empty Skull\" is a pixelated indie puzzle game with RPG elements that revolves around a skeleton trying to recollect its life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7p93.jpg'),(19116,'Invisible, Inc.','2020-06-15','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','\"Take control of Invisible\'s agents in the field and infiltrate the world\'s most dangerous corporations. Stealth, precision, and teamwork are essential in high-stakes, high-profit missions, where every move may cost an agent their life.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2efb.jpg'),(19117,'G.G Series Collection Plus','2010-05-27','Platform, Puzzle, Racing, Sport, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Nintendo DS','A compilation cartridge for DS featuring 30 G.G Series games -- 16 of which were originally released on DSiWare.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bmj6p3uedy93em1g1arx.jpg'),(19118,'Estencel','2023-01-19','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slash your way through Estencel! Traverse across a corrupted, maze like city fighting horrors. Customize and arm yourself into the ultimate monster killing assassin in this fast paced horror/fantasy Action RPG. Solve the mysteries of this world before they swallow you whole.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5has.jpg'),(19119,'Yggdra Union: We\'ll Never Fight Alone','2008-09-16','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation Portable','Yggdra Union was remade/enhanced for the PSP with redrawn graphics, voice acting, some new characters, new/edited maps and an increase to 8 units brought into battles instead of the original limit of 6.\n\n\"Yggdra Union tells the story of a princess ousted from her country and her mission to win it back from the Imperial Army.\n\nFrom a bandit king to a valiant knight, to a young Undine girl, Yggdra is joined in her mission by an ever-increasing band of rag-tag adventurers. Each of them has his or her own beliefs and ambitions, but as thier paths cross, they soon find that protecting what they love most means somehow finding a way to stop the Empire.\n\nGet ready for one of the most unique and engrossing straegy games ever to hit the PSP!\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2o08.jpg'),(19120,'Ambition: A Minuet in Power','2021-08-18','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','A young woman finds herself alone in the streets of Paris, far from home and abandoned by the love of her life. In that moment, she decides to live for herself and seek her own passions, as France marches towards a violent uprising that will change history forever. Navigate the twisting social politics of pre-revolutionary Paris in a game world that’s different every time you play. Court, snub and seduce your way to the top of society. Extend your influence, uncover the intrigue of the coming revolution, and ensure that you end up on the winning side of history.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/m3tna1deicvbohmovwai.jpg'),(19121,'Sega Smash Pack 2','2000-12-31','Shooter, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The third pack titled Sega Smash Pack 2 (Sega Archives from USA Vol. 3 in Japan) featured eight games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/zxyh1ls8qazaaslcgf5h.jpg'),(19122,'Dead Age','2016-11-04','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Survive the zombie apocalypse with a “Final Fantasy” turn-based combat and permanent death! Manage survivors, craft materials, and make difficult decisions. Defend your camp against hordes of the undead to prevail in this non-linear rogue-lite (comparable to FTL). Innovative Indie Survival-RPG!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r6q.jpg'),(19123,'Girls\' Frontline','2016-05-20','Shooter, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','Android, iOS','Girls\' Frontline is a moe anthropomorphism game in which the player controls of android characters, known in-game as \"T-Dolls\" or \"Tactical Dolls\", each of which represents a real-world firearm.\nThe player plays as a newly recruited commander of an area who commands the T-Dolls in battle, and organises the echelons as well as the T-Dolls\' wellbeing. Battles are a mix of turn-based strategy puzzles on a set map with enemies that can move about, random item nodes and heliports/command nodes, from which the player can summon their own echelons, or support echelons, which are echelons that the player\'s friend sets on their profile to be used by others, and real-time battles with enemy echelons. Battles are for the most part automated, although the player can activate the T-Dolls\' special abilities manually if wanted, or order them to different spots in formation (which the player can organise out of battle to be set as the default formation when entering a battle) or to withdraw in order to conserve health or resources). Players also have the option of withdrawing specific echelons from the mission altogether if they wish. Gameplay progresses by playing on the campaign missions, logistic support missions, or combat simulations to level up each T-Doll. The game also features gacha elements, such as in the production and heavy production of T-Dolls and equipment, or in the Dormitory with costumes and furniture sets for the T-Dolls on a time-limited basis with several sets and costumes being available for a limited time, before another few sets and costumes are revealed and added. After a while, old costumes from previous gacha events will be added to the \"Black Card\" store, where players can exchange an amount of Black Cards (obtained from gifting T-Dolls a duplicate costume that has already been gifted before) for a costume of a previous gacha set. Players can customise their dorms with furniture, and interact with Chibi renditions of the T-Dolls in the echelon corresponding with that dorm. They can also gift the T-Dolls food and costume, which raises the affection of the T-Dolls. Affection is also gained from success in battle, and is lost when the T-Dolls die (unless it is a boss battle) or when another T-Doll in the same echelon dies.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97oy.jpg'),(19124,'CyberCorp','2025-01-30','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Brutal fast-paced top-down Co-op Loot Shooter in Cyberpunk world. Equipment-based combos. Exotic Weapons and Armor. Easy to start, hard to master. Play solo or with friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8obp.jpg'),(19125,'Angelic',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Angelic combines turn-based strategy combat with distinctive and colorful heroes you often see in narrative games. Angelic has an equal emphasis on storytelling and party-based RPG elements, all backed by a dark and compelling science-fiction setting in which you are often mesmerized by the complexity of the events happening around you.\n\nGet ready to join a massive conflict, where you will have to question the morality of humanity, and struggle to make the right decision most of the time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2y42.jpg'),(19126,'Mars Power Industries','2018-08-15','Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','iOS, Nintendo Switch','Congratulations on your first tiny colony! Taking the post of Plumber/Electrician must be tough out there, we know how lonely it might get and you probably miss your family. Don’t worry! We provide music. No silence in space. Studies show employees exhibit high degree of stress when surrounded by silence, so it is to be avoided. The pleasant soothing sounds of distant synth music will calm you right away… and continue calming you through the years… Imagine a spaceship slowly moving through endless black pudding, with no one on board but you and the lights. But the lights are broken. That’s the point – please fix the lights!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20ri.jpg'),(19127,'Yakuza 3','2010-03-12','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3','Yakuza 3 is the third chapter in the Yakuza series, renowned for its authentic, gritty, and often violent look at modern Japan. Making its first appearance exclusively on the PlayStation 3 computer entertainment system, the rich story and vibrant world of Yakuza 3 let players engage in intense brutal clashes within the streets of Okinawa and the vibrant and often dangerous city of Tokyo, where only the strongest will survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rej.jpg'),(19128,'Batman: Dark Tomorrow','2003-03-21','Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Quiz/Trivia, Adventure','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PlayStation 2','Batman: Dark Tomorrow is an action-adventure video game developed by HotGen and published by Kemco for the Nintendo GameCube and Microsoft Xbox consoles. The Xbox version is not compatible with the Xbox 360. It is based on the DC Comics\' character Batman and his iteration from the DC Universe source material, unlike most other Batman games which are adaptations of the character in film or television appearances.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dys.jpg'),(19129,'Necesse','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Necesse is a top-down sandbox action-adventure game in a procedural generated world. Progress your characters gear and settlement through fighting, mining, exploring, crafting, trading and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7rqt.jpg'),(19130,'Soul Knight','2019-10-04','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','“In a time of gun and sword, the magical stone that maintains the balance of the world is stolen by high-tech aliens. The world is hanging on a thin thread. It all depends on you retrieving the magical stone…”\n\nWe honestly can’t keep making it all up. Let’s just shoot some alien minions!\n\nThis is the game you have always wanted in your subconscious. Explore the dungeon, collect crazy weapons, dodge bullets and shoot‘em all up! Extremely easy and intuitive control; super smooth and enjoyable gameplay, mixed with rogue-like elements. Best shooter game you will find on the mobile store so far.\n\nFeatures:\n\n* Unique heroes, with unique ability.\n\n* 120+ weapons waiting for you to explore.\n\n* Randomly generated dungeon world, new experience every time.\n\n* NPCs that actually matter! They will fight by your side!\n\n* Auto-aim mechanism for super intuitive control.\n\n* Many more features that you will find out in game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2f6c.jpg'),(19131,'Orogenesis','2018-10-16','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Orogenesis, an RPG with the twist of exploring a nightmarish and funky universe!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3uur.jpg'),(19132,'Castlevania','1999-12-31','Platform, Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Nintendo 64','Take control of Reinhardt Schneider, a whip-toting Vampire Killer who has waited his whole life to meet his destiny, or Carrie Fernandez, a young girl with a strong magical presence who is mysteriously drawn to Dracula\'s evil Castlevania. It is their duty to seek out Castlevania and put an end to its residents\' plans. What is your destiny?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5geb.jpg'),(19133,'Crystal',NULL,'Point-and-click, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','I won\'t give up on that light\n\nWelcome to Crystal a world where creativity and harmony have no limits\nSquare wants to get to the other side of the face but for that he has to go through different puzzles and tests that come across him\n\n• Explore the flat world of Crystal and find a variety of things\n• Complete a variety of puzzles and challenges\n• Talk to other shapes during your trip\n• Darkness???\n\nExtras Features\n• A relaxing and shaking soundtrack list!\n• Simple and attractive designs!\n• Keybinds simple only Mouse and Space key!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wri.jpg'),(19134,'Hermitage: Strange Case Files','2021-10-26','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This gripping paranormal horror adventure revolves around Hermitage, the sinister bookstore that attracts most unusual customers – all of whom seem to be involved in mysterious cases bordering on the paranormal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ls2.jpg'),(19135,'Warhammer Quest: Silver Tower','2021-06-02','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Bite sized turn-based strategy battles in a Tower of pure Chaos! Dive into one of our huge campaigns, or jump in to a Daily Quest. 20+ Champions from the Age of Sigmar to collect, each with unique gameplay, weapons and skills. Can you take on the Trials of the Summoner?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3fs6.jpg'),(19136,'Beyond',NULL,'Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Beyond is a difficult, action-driven, linear sidescroller with unique combat mechanics. Each level is tied together by an overarching narrative element and progression accumulates in the form of equipment gathered after each completed level. The game is set in an ethereal world filled with magical beasts, warriors, and weapons. The player begins as a Shinigami who needs to collect souls from the inhabitants of said world. Along their quest, they will face off against others with the very same goal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5p5m.jpg'),(19137,'Detective Puz','2020-05-21','Puzzle, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Detective Puz is a puzzle turn-based game developed for PC, Android, and Nintendo Switch.\nDetective Puz started a long journey to find the truth. On the way of finding clues, he found a strange book and after opening it, he entered the past, and now he should find his way in the middle of enemies that captured in. Detective Puz should find special diamonds to come back to the present and by that open the time portal.\nNow you should use your intelligence to help him to reach his goal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co29lr.jpg'),(19138,'New Era',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Have you not ever dreamed of your own empire, your own city? New Era is a survival strategy game, where your goals are to overcome natural death causes such as hunger, thirst, and cold. Build a fire to keep you warm, build a house for your villagers, kill animals for meat, protect yourself from other players/AI, and kill them for meat. Create alliances with other players and form a town. Do whatever it takes to survive. Protect your city at all costs!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gi0.jpg'),(19139,'Asdivine Hearts','2017-01-10','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Wii U, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Restore the balance of light and shadow in the world!Beautiful hand-drawn visuals and a story of epic proportions bring Asdivine Hearts to the forefront of PC gaming! Travel alongside four companions and a cat in this fantasy 2D turn-based RPG!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23o3.jpg'),(19140,'Grand Pigeon\'s Duty','2016-08-05','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pigeons organized resistance, which aims to attract people\'s attention to the problem of hunger and restore bakery companies for their bait.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41fe.jpg'),(19141,'Cute Invaders','2022-05-10','Shooter, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Something great is coming! Something extremely Gigantic and Adorable!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wxj.jpg'),(19142,'Pokémon Rumble','2009-06-16','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Wii','Pokémon Rumble is an action video game in the Pokémon series for WiiWare. In North America, the game costs 1500 Nintendo Points.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gze.jpg'),(19143,'Lost in Darklight','2023-05-08','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lost in Darklight is a live action interactive FMV game. A retired ace soldier, four girls, a hidden chamber at home, genetic cloning tech... Experience interactive panoramic evidence searching with this game and decide your own ending. Every choice you make is crucial!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j3o.jpg'),(19144,'Valkyria Chronicles 4: A United Front with Squad 7','2018-12-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','This story features an encounter with Squad 7, the heroes of the original Valkyria Chronicles. After playing through this extra story, you will get the characters Welkin (in the tank Edelweiss), Alicia, Isara, Largo, and Rosie for use in the main game.\n\nThis story can be played after unlocking the Headquarters in Chapter 2 of the main story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8b9l.jpg'),(19145,'Ticket to Earth','2017-12-11','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Ticket to Earth is a unique fusion of turn-based tactics, tile-matching puzzle, and story-driven RPG. This epic sci-fi saga of betrayal and insurrection unites four unlikely heroes, defending a desperate group of colonists abandoned by their wealthy masters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24n3.jpg'),(19146,'Kuudere Funk','2024-01-29','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','With the city overrun with supernatural beings and occurrences, it is up to two women to restore the city to its former state. In order to accomplish such a task, sexual rituals must be performed by these women at the shrines scattered throughout the city…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7sea.jpg'),(19147,'Sable','2021-09-23','Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Sable is a coming-of-age tale of discovery through exploration across a strikingly rendered open world desert. Go on a deeply personal journey across an alien planet while learning its history and discovering Sable’s place in the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yzs.jpg'),(19148,'Hardcore Mecha','2020-10-15','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A mech-themed 2D platformer. With action-packed shooting, highly polished animations, driving multiple unique awesome mechs to fly in the air, play your own style based on a fluent set of controls.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h4c.jpg'),(19149,'Return: Unknown',NULL,'Shooter, Sport, Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to Return: Unknown, a survival-adventure game set in a post-apocalyptic Manhattan. Once a thriving metropolis, now abandoned by civilization after the outbreak of a global virus, it offers both challenges and countless possibilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91gb.jpg'),(19150,'King\'s Bounty: Collector\'s Pack','2014-04-03','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','King\'s Bounty: Collector\'s Pack includes: \n \nKing\'s Bounty: The Legend \nKing\'s Bounty: Armored Princess \nKing\'s Bounty: Crossworlds \nKing\'s Bounty: Warriors of the North - Valhalla Edition \nKing\'s Bounty: Warriors of the North - Ice and Fire \nArtbook \nSoundtrack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2v1a.jpg'),(19151,'ReadySet Heroes','2019-10-29','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Go from zero to hero in this fast-paced multiplayer dungeon crawler meets arena brawl! Choose your character, then race through a random dungeon to slay monsters, dodge traps and collect tons of loot to power-up. You\'ll need it as there\'s an opposing team racing through the same dungeon! Whomever reaches the end of dungeon first will trigger a vicious \"winner-take-all\" arena brawl. Two teams enter, one team is left standing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mo3.jpg'),(19152,'Nitro Kid','2022-10-18','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Synthwave roguelike deckbuilder set in the neon 80\'s. Pick your agent. Build your deck. Hit card combos and fight through the floors of INFINITY tower. Featuring 30+ Synthwave tracks composed exclusively for the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4up5.jpg'),(19153,'Revelation Trestan','2018-10-10','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In 2033, a miniature meteorite from outer space crashed in a part of the south Atlantic ocean, when a country near the crash site led the fishing effort and secretly transported it to the isolated island institute near the crash site to study the virus, an event that attracted the attention of many large groups around the world.\nFive years later, a meteorite virus burst into circulation during the experiment, causing people infected with the virus to lose consciousness and engage in high-risk attacks. The communication base station on the isolated island was damaged by the attack, the communication equipment on the island was almost all paralyzed, all the people on the isolated island could not contact the outside world, how to escape the birth of the world.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(19154,'The Rainbow World','2019-12-19','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Explore a vibrant world in this action adventure RPG where you get embroiled in a war between the 7 major races of the rainbow world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1sl1.jpg'),(19155,'Downtown Nekketsu Monogatari','1990-04-01','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Sharp X68000','Downtown Nekketsu Monogatari (River City Ransom in North America, Street Gangs in Europe) was ported to the Sharp X68000, a Japanese computer platform, and released in April 1990.\n\nThis version of the game, which was developed by SPS and published by Sharp, features several enhancements to the Famicom original, such as displaying three enemy characters on-screen instead of just two, slightly more colorful graphics, an expanded game world, and new items and special techniques for the player (including some that were only used by certain enemy characters in the Famicom version, such as the headbutt and the whirlwind kick).\n\nThe new locations includes several new shops (such as a dojo) and the schools of each enemy gang, each featuring two new bosses. In addition to the player\'s regular stats, the player also has individual stats for all the special techniques their character has acquired. The more frequently a special move is used to finish off enemies, the stronger that particular move becomes.\n\nUnlike the Famicom version, the X68000 does not feature adjustable difficulty settings. The player can save and load their progress in one of ten save files provided by the game itself.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4i1c.jpg'),(19156,'OS Omega','2021-07-29','Shooter, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','OS OMEGA is an action-adventure game set in a hostile operating system environment. You are Binary Boy (a character made of ones and zeros) and your goal is to defeat the super-villain - the virus that wants to format your C drive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3qot.jpg'),(19157,'Nova Hearts','2025-12-31','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A mysterious force of power transforms you and other highly attractive people in your area into superheroes and villains! TEXT, DATE and FIGHT your friends and enemies alike.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7o01.jpg'),(19158,'Sollarion',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac','Sollarion is a turn-based strategy that combines a collectible card game and a 3D strategy genre. Players summon units and cast spells using their pre-built deck. Summoned units can be moved around the board and attack enemy units and structures. The player who destroys an opponent\'s portal wins.\n\nIt is necessary to occupy resource tiles and build mines there to play more powerful cards. There are also other special effect tiles on the board that expand the range of possible play styles. Each player will find their own winning strategy.\n\nMap terrain and tile layout are different in every match, making Sollarion less repetitive, more complex and more entertaining than its competitors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co666k.jpg'),(19159,'The Siege of Brimir','2022-10-28','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Play as an alien with super powers in frenetic battles against the army, destroy building, smash, fly and improve your character in order to annihilate humanity. They will try to stop you with their soldiers, F15, Giant mechas, warships or tanks, but it is going to be useless against your power.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co605t.jpg'),(19160,'Tales of Terrabanthis',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','Single player Fantasy RPG that is a turn based game designed to have older games functions with modern graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65as.jpg'),(19161,'Phoenix Wright: Ace Attorney - Justice For All','2013-05-30','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Nintendo 3DS, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A remaster of the original Phoenix Wright: Ace Attorney - Justice For All, released exclusively as part of the Phoenix Wright: Ace Attorney Trilogy bundle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5z6n.jpg'),(19162,'Soran','2021-06-14','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Soran is an arena shooter/RPG hybrid being developed and produced by Joseph Keenan. Use classic shooter weapons like the Sniper or Doob Tube, along side new and unique guns like the Defenestrator to finesse your way to victory in 1v1s, 2v2s, and small scale Battle Royales. When you aren\'t competing, you can explore the world of Four Shores discovering collectables, making friends or padding your stats for the next battle. Also there is a flying dog named Friend.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3d9c.jpg'),(19163,'Detective Di: The Silk Rose Murders','2019-05-02','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A beautifully pixelated point-and-click thriller set in ancient China where you play as the legendary detective Di Renjie.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mng.jpg'),(19164,'Gensou Shoujo Taisen','2022-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The Super Robot Wars-inspired Touhou Project crossover Gensou Shoujo Wars first launched on PC in 2010 and is now releasing on Nintendo Switch in 2021.\n\nThe game, fusion of bullet hell and strategy RPG, “depicts a Gensokyo epic of overwhelming scale, including the bonds between characters, and a thorough arrangement of character backgrounds and stories from their original works.” It features over 70 playable characters, as well as “impactful battle animations, dialogue scenes the fans want to see, cut-ins for every character, different theme songs for each character, and a variety of songs to match the scenario.”','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co439z.jpg'),(19165,'Ancient Enemy','2020-04-09','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An unusual, strategic RPG card game from the makers of Shadowhand and Regency Solitaire.\n\n\"Awakening from centuries of slumber, a fallen mage returns to battle twisted folkloric foe across sprawling, ghostly landscapes. His ultimate destination: the nameless antagonist, a dread nemesis waiting patiently in the dark fastness of monstrous citadel, his Ancient Enemy.\n\nYou\'ll embark upon a quest inspired by British mythology and Mabinogion, so expect card battling, visceral fights, mixed with bleak and evocative folklore! Loot the fallen to fill your hero\'s RPG-style inventory with collectible cards, capture strongholds and gather talented henchmen. Only powerful magic and iron determination will enable revenge upon your ultimate foe.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1io6.jpg'),(19166,'Megamedia\'s Megapak 3','1995-12-31','Shooter, Puzzle, Racing, Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','The third part of the Megapak-compilation series. It includes ten games (English versions) on twelve CD-ROMs.\n\n.- The Lemming\'s Chronicles\n.- Megarace\n.- TFX - Tactical Fighter Experiment\n.- The VORTEX: Quantum Gate 2\n.- Cyclones\n.- Jammit\n.- Dragon\'s Lair\n.- Novastorm\n.- Reunion\n.- The Journeyman Project: Turbo!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8hmd.jpg'),(19167,'PopSlinger','2022-01-26','Shooter, Music, Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','PopSlinger is a vibrant, narrative-focused musical shooter inspired by ‘80s and ‘90s New Retro culture. Join Ria Carbon, a funky heroine on a stylish quest to save the world from sinister invaders from another dimension using soda-powered guns. Backing Ria up is former PopSlinger heroine, Gin! Experience the whimsical story of Ria and Gin as they fight against the \"Corazones\", people whose hearts have been corrupted by the dark forces from the other dimension, all while grooving to a fully dynamic soundtrack that reacts to your in-game performance in real-time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4wvz.jpg'),(19168,'This Is the Police 2','2019-09-12','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Interpret the law as you see fit in This Is the Police 2, sequel to the acclaimed noir drama This Is the Police! Run the sheriff\'s department, manage your cops, investigate, interrogate, and incarcerate. Make tough decisions - and try to keep out of prison yourself – in this story-driven mixture of adventure, strategy, and turn-based tactical combat.\nIs it a simulation? A management game? A tactical challenge? A visual novel? A puzzle? It\'s all of these, and more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sya.jpg'),(19169,'Project Madras',NULL,'Shooter, Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Project Madras, is a semi-linear open-world game, being developed in Chennai, India, by a small team and led by developer leader Royston.\n\nExplore and experience the vibe of namma chennai through \"PROJECT MADRAS\". The game which lets you roam around the shores of Marina ,streets of mount road , monuments of chennai covering all the highlights of this city ,with a mission to accomplish!.\n\nThe flavour of this open world game is rich in content and language, as it takes place in the capital city of the state, where the world\'s oldest language \"TAMIL\" is still surviving and embraced over centuries. Get involved with the natives of the city, where a rooted love and affection is served with some spicy madras delicacy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nps.jpg'),(19170,'Rogue: Genesia','2022-09-19','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Walk upon a new world and slay foes endangering it. Rogue : Genesia is a rogue-lite deck building game, where you fight relentless hordes consisting of hundreds and thousands of monsters, carve your path through their ranks, defeat the boss and save one of the many worlds.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co64pp.jpg'),(19171,'R.U.N',NULL,'Fighting, Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','R.U.N a Single Player - Shoot \'Em Up - Fighting - Narrative Adventure with RPG elements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3rl3.jpg'),(19172,'Cavern Crumblers','2017-08-10','Shooter, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Grab your friends and stock up on grenades for this fast-paced single-screen local multiplayer shooter! Compete with each other in an environment filled with destructible terrain as you run, jump, and dodge your way through the destruction. With gameplay that\'s easy to pick up but hard to master, Cavern Crumblers will provide you and your friends an exciting couch gaming experience for hours on end.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ah4.jpg'),(19173,'Sid Meier\'s Pirates!','2010-10-08','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Wii','Based on Sid Meier\'s original masterpiece, Pirates!, Sid Meier\'s Pirates! has you facing countless dogged enemies, wooing fair maidens and raising the Jolly Roger on the high seas in pursuit of riches. Discover what it takes to become one of the most famous pirates in history!\n\nFiraxis\' long-awaited Sid Meier\'s Pirates! carries on with the great game play tradition and design simplicity of the award-winning original while adding more challenging and exciting battle options, eye-popping 3D graphics, fantastic new audio, and loads of new game play features!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co504a.jpg'),(19174,'Lords of Ravage','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Become the final boss of the dungeon! Create your own playing style by combining followers from different factions in spectacular turn-based combat. Build a shadow empire to find a powerful artifact that can alter the fate of this world. Choose your path as one of the \"Lords of Ravage\"!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4v9a.jpg'),(19175,'Reigns','2016-08-10','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','Google Stadia, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Reigns is a strategy video game developed by Nerial and published by Devolver Digital. Set in a fictional medieval world, it places the player in the role of a monarch who rules the kingdom by accepting or rejecting suggestions from advisors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r8j.jpg'),(19176,'63 Days','2024-09-26','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','A real-time tactics game from Destructive Creations taking place during WWII. The capital city of Poland, Warsaw, is under occupation of German forces, however there are groups of fearless people who are not afraid to face the enemy. 63 Days follows the steps of their previous game War Mongrels to deliver a Commandos-like game play set in the darkest days of human history.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8222.jpg'),(19177,'Dreamwalker','2025-05-07','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Dreamwalker is a top-down story RPG game with deckbuilding combat.\n\nEmbark on a journey through dreams and nightmares in Dreamwalker, a 2D top-down RPG set in a mesmerizing pixel art world. You are a wandering traveler, drawn to a small village shrouded in mystery and cursed by an ancient evil.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g6v.jpg'),(19178,'A Wizard\'s Lizard','2014-06-16','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A Wizard\'s Lizard is an ever-changing medieval fantasy hack \'n slash game from independent game developers, Lost Decade Games.\n\nConquer the forces of Death in A Wizard’s Lizard, an action RPG for Windows, Mac and Linux. Explore ever-changing dungeons, filled with valuable treasure and powerful items, while battling back the hordes of evil. Rescue townsfolk to improve your town and aid your next trek into the dungeon.\n\nYou\'ll die constantly, and painfully in the heat of battle. However you\'ll want to use Death as a mechanism for complete and full exploration of each unique dungeon as your character enters the Realm of the Dead. Herein, you\'ll find additional loot and continue your quest as you fight stronger monsters, quite a few of which were killed by your living counterpart.\n\nLook for Townfolk, Chests, exotic Weapons and glorious Treasure, both as alive or dead, and fight Monsters for glory as a wizard or a lizard.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2is7.jpg'),(19179,'Noita','2020-10-15','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Noita is a magical action roguelite set in a world where every pixel is physically simulated. Fight, explore, melt, burn, freeze and evaporate your way through the procedurally generated world using spells you\'ve created yourself. Explore a variety of environments ranging from coal mines to freezing wastelands while delving deeper in search for unknown mysteries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qp1.jpg'),(19180,'Astatos','2021-12-16','Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Leave your influence in your wake as you bring together a broken land in a card-battling adventure filled with gods, heroes, and the instability of yourself and those around you. Play the story, or go online with fellow Crown Mages for tabletop card action.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ba1.jpg'),(19181,'Toy Soldiers HD','2021-10-21','Shooter, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Toy Soldiers HD is an action-packed strategy-based game in which you command antique WWI toy soldiers vying for control of the trench-filled battlefields of Europe. The remaster includes improved single and multiplayer gameplay, never-before played content, enhanced high-definition graphics and camera and sound. All previously released downloadable content will be included in the campaign flow. The original classic has been overhauled and upgraded with new content, skins, gameplay, expanded game modes, improved controls and graphical upgrades, as well as all the original DLC and a few new levels as well!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co38wv.jpg'),(19182,'AI Game Master','2024-01-02','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Android, Mac','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i5t.jpg'),(19183,'Runaway 2: The Dream of the Turtle','2006-11-17','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','Wii, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo DS','Runaway 2: The Dream of the Turtle is a point and click adventure game released by Péndulo Studios, S.L. in 2006. It\'s a sequel to Runaway: A Road Adventure.\n\nTravel to the four corners of the world with Brian and Gina in a crazy story packed full of surprises. Pirates, spies, surfers, soldiers, and even aliens get in on the act - all combining to create a wonderfully rewarding experience to savour and remember forever.\n\nWith loveable characters, rib-cracking humour, brain-tickling puzzles and stunning graphics, Runaway, The Dream of the Turtle is a glorious sight to behold.\nRunaway, The Dream of the Turtle is an adventure game that is a pure pleasure to play.\n\nA beautifully produced adventure game, with rich scenarios, ever-present humour and captivating puzzles. Hundreds of places to explore throughout the world. Over an hour of superb animated sequences bring to life the intrigue, plot twists and many comic moments.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2236.jpg'),(19184,'Kame Paradise 3 Multiversex','2023-01-13','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kame Paradise 3 Multiversex, made by Yamamoto Doujin, is the 3rd entry to Kame Paradise series, being a Dragon Ball Hentai Game released on January 13th, 2023. It is part of a series of games made by Yamamoto. It is a R+18 Adult Hentai game featuring Dragon Ball Characters from Dragon Ball: Original, Z, GT, and Super. This entry has character from Z, GT, and Super, as well as including Vomi/Android 21 from Dragon Ball FighterZ/Dragon Ball Super.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co605j.jpg'),(19185,'Project Dagger','2022-07-25','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Project Dagger is a retro FPS roguelike, where you have to return the lost Crown of Benevolence to the King of Delvia! However, your journey will not be easy as many foes along the way will attempt to kill you! Unlock new weapons, upgrade stats, battle enemies as you make your way through the world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4m7o.jpg'),(19186,'Overboss','2024-08-15','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Become a villain in this retro-inspired board game. Draft terrain tiles, recruit monsters, build your map, and become the OVERBOSS!\n\nStep into the shoes of 12 iconic bosses from the renowned board game Overboss, who want to attain supreme power by building their kingdom. The value of your dominion hinges on the arrangement of terrain tiles and the strategic placement of your monstrous minions. Each tile type and its positioning can either bolster or hinder your ascent to dominance.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66hd.jpg'),(19187,'Refuge',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','This is an apocalyptic sandbox zombie shooting game, which can make weapons, upgrade bases, domesticate zombies, cultivate holy dragons, resist the tide of corpses, unite or attack other sanctuaries, enter alliances, and rebuild the world order','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5t3j.jpg'),(19188,'Evil Genius','2004-09-28','Puzzle, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Evil Genius focuses on building an island lair and the management of minions that are employed by the Evil Genius, allowing the player to progress through the main storyline with achieving world domination as the end goal of the game. Although not explicitly stated the use of historic regions the Eastern Block and events such as the Cuban Missile Crisis within the game suggest that it is set in the 1960s and 70s and that the game is progressing through an alternate timeline.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co231o.jpg'),(19189,'Phantom Doctrine','2019-06-06','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Set in 1983 during the Cold War, Phantom Doctrine is an alternate history thriller in which players lead The Cabal, a secret organization dedicated to fighting a global conspiracy committed to controlling the world by pitting world leaders and nations against one another. Deception is the great equalizer as players will have to operate from the shadows to exploit every vulnerability - ruthlessly interrogate and brainwash enemies and allies alike to create double agents, saboteurs or unwitting collaborators.\n\nDevelop and defend your base of operations, recruit agents from the world’s many factions, and research new tech to give your operatives the advantage. Campaign missions deliver sprawling tactical encounters that revolve around two key pillars: stealth and explosive, all-out attacks. Your team of operatives can be deployed into the ﬁeld either fully armed or disguised as civilians, allowing them to inﬁltrate dangerous areas undetected at the expense of heavy weapons and armor.\n\nDecode and analyze your way through immersive investigations to expose far-reaching conspiracies and elusive targets. Delve into the oppressive dark corners of the volatile 1980s with atmospheric visuals and an unnerving soundtrack by award-winning composer Marcin Przybylowicz of The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt fame.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/oaov1veblnyapulbcfdb.jpg'),(19190,'The A500 Mini','2022-04-08','Point-and-click, Shooter, Puzzle, Racing, Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Pinball, Adventure, Arcade','Plug & Play','Now other classic consoles are just toys!\n\nIntroducing THEA500 Mini, a compact reimagining of this classic home computer. Featuring perfect emulation of not only the original A500 (OCS) and Enhanced Chip Set (ECS) of future revisions, but also the Advanced Graphics Architecture (AGA) of the A1200. Play one of the included 25 classic Amiga games, selected from a simple to use carousel, including all-time greats like Alien Breed 3D, Another World, Simon the Sorcerer and Worms. Or side-load your own games via USB stick with full WHDLoad support and an array of options to choose from. Plus save and resume your game at any time to help you finish those punishingly difficult classics.\n\nThe THEA500 Mini comes with the original style 2-button mouse and newly engineered 8-button precision gamepad, allowing you to choose your control method. To compliment the on-screen keyboard, you can plug in an external standard USB PC keyboard for additional functionality.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co85xv.jpg'),(19191,'Fire Emblem: Path of Radiance','2005-04-20','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Nintendo GameCube','Fire Emblem: Path of Radiance is a tactical role-playing video game developed by Intelligent Systems and Nintendo SPD, and published by Nintendo for the GameCube home console in 2005. It is the ninth main installment in the Fire Emblem series,[c] and the third to be released in the west. As with previous installments, gameplay revolves around positioning characters on a battlefield to defeat an opposing force. If characters are defeated in battle, they are removed from the rest of the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ofh.jpg'),(19192,'Aim Climb','2022-03-18','Point-and-click, Shooter, Platform, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aim Climb is a platform game in which you use your \"Aiming skill\" to climb to the top and reach the summit. Anyone who can complete the highest difficulty level of this game can surely become anything.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ok1.jpg'),(19193,'Sin Slayers: Reign of The 8th','2024-11-25','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A remaster of the indie-tailored turn-based JRPG with roguelike elements set in a dark fantasy world, where your choices determine how challenging the fights and enemies will be.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wwp.jpg'),(19194,'Castlevania: Legacy of Darkness','1999-12-08','Platform, Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Nintendo 64','Castlevania: Legacy of Darkness is a video game that was developed and published by Konami for the Nintendo 64. It was first released in North America on November 30, 1999 and is a prequel and expanded version to the first Castlevania game on the Nintendo 64, but also contains a remake of the original game with improved graphics, added villains (Spider Queen, Medusa), and alternate versions of some levels (Forest of Silence, Tower of Science, Tower of Execution, Clock Tower).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co54ti.jpg'),(19195,'Akasha',NULL,'Fighting, Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Sin plataforma','Akasha is a 2nd person fighting game and shooter hybrid with a PvPvE extraction game mode. It blends the two genres by allowing the player to control 2 characters in real time.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6j50.jpg'),(19196,'Hard Time III','2024-09-09','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','The toughest prison sim in the yard is back to serve its 3rd consecutive sentence - combining classic moments from the OG with the best aspects of 2D, while putting out a few hits of its own! Tackle crime from either side of the prison fence, while a larger world beyond it makes life worth living.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t3j.jpg'),(19197,'Baldur\'s Gate: Dark Alliance II','2022-07-20','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation 2','Using the 3rd Edition Dungeons & Dragons rules set, Baldur\'s Gate: Dark Alliance II features four new acts of hack-and-slash combat and powerful spell casting. Even more monster types will engage in real-time battles using the same overhead perspective as witnessed in the original game. Each selected character can parlay the experience gained from combat into acquiring new feats and enhanced abilities over time. To help in battle, a new item creation system lets players craft magical weapons and armor using raw materials found during their travels.\n\nAs before, two heroes can join the adventure in cooperative play on the same screen, with each character differing in the types of feats and powers under his or her command. Equipment can be found or purchased from local merchants using the gold looted from felled creatures or received as payment for quests. Baldur\'s Gate: Dark Alliance II also features a number of hidden areas, secret characters, and literally hundreds of items to find and use, including potions, scrolls, and wands. In addition, the game features a new branching storyline that offers players a choice where to go next for fortune and honor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tb2.jpg'),(19198,'SpellCaster','1989-12-31','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Sega Master System/Mark III','He has been summoned by Daikak, the great leader of the Summit Temple, to stop a war between factions of warlords. The player explores temples and defeats enemies like ghosts, ninja, and feral beasts. There are also villages to explore and people to talk to as the player assembles clues on who desecrated his home town\'s temple and killed its guardians. The quest takes the player across medieval Japan and to the Underworld. Unlike most games, death does not lead to game over or even a loss of money or experience points. Instead, the player has to use a password in order to resurrect themselves from the dead.\n\nThe game is a port of the Japanese game Kujaku-ou, removing the anime license.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2b8m.jpg'),(19199,'Kenshi 2',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kenshi 2 is an upcoming prequel to Kenshi still under development by Lo-Fi Games. Set around 1,000 years prior to the original game.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(19200,'Halfway','2014-07-22','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Halfway is a turn-based strategy RPG taking place a few hundred years into the future. Humanity has started colonising new worlds. Until now, they were alone ...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41kc.jpg'),(19201,'GrimGrimoire OnceMore: Deluxe Edition','2023-04-30','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The GrimGrimoire OnceMore Deluxe Edition includes:\n- The Game\n- Mini Art Book\n- Original Soundtrack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nvl.jpg'),(19202,'Valkyria Chronicles 2: Final Trooper Exam','2010-03-18','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PlayStation Portable','A final exam to test Shocktrooper class abilities will be held.\n\nCapture the enemy camps in Areas 1 and 4 within 5 turns.\n\nThe exam will take place under actual combat conditions, so stay focused on your objective.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x13.jpg'),(19203,'Concordia: Digital Edition - Venus','2022-04-18','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','An official DLC to Concordia: Digital Edition adding two new maps - Ionium and Hellas - and a new two-player team mode - all of which will add variety and new challenges to your games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4rt3.jpg'),(19204,'Glam Pursuit',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Enter the dazzling world of Glam Pursuit in Sunshine City. Master the unique acting system, shape your actor, and navigate the highs and lows of fame. Watch your scenes steal the limelight on the silver screen. Your path to stardom begins here!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co74qa.jpg'),(19205,'Prince of Evil','1993-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','DOS','40 years after his wrongful framing and execution, the Han general Dou Xian returns to China as a demonic dragon, unleashing his army upon the empire. The fate of defending China against this invasion falls to Zhang Daoling, a revered Taoist cleric able to confront these demons. On the emperor\'s behalf, only you can subdue Dou Xian and restore peace to the land!\n\nIn this game you are a Chinese hero who fights against many dark opponents with his sword and by casting magical arrows, fireballs and other attacking spells. Progressing from one area to another, you need to gain some new magical weapons to kill the dragons and other bosses. The energy of your weapons is lost when you use them, so think carefully what weapon you need to kill that monster and what you need for another. [Excerpt from MobyGames]','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65le.jpg'),(19206,'Samurai Maiden','2022-12-08','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','A young woman from the 21st century with sharp swordsmanship skills finds herself in Honnō-ji during the Sengoku period! Together with a trio of newfound ninja friends, she races through the Underworld beneath Honnō-ji, confronted by enraged corpses at every turn!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vcu.jpg'),(19207,'Jydge','2018-03-29','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Build your Jydge. Enter Edenbyrg. Get out alive.\n\nJydge is a lawful but awful roguehate top-down shooter where you get to build your own cybernetic Jydge and eradicate crime in the never-sleeping megacity of Edenbyrg.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/emd0bet1ecnr5wshpr6o.jpg'),(19208,'Clash: Heroes of Feralia Terra','2025-08-30','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A third-person survival Hack \'n\' Slash Shooter, set in a world besieged by cosmic alien creatures. As the final hope of your world, you shall venture forth alone as a Feral warrior to confront the hordes of deadly cosmic foes and formidable bosses, striving to survive and save your world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co93nx.jpg'),(19209,'Adventures of Mana','2016-02-04','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Android, iOS, PlayStation Vita','Adventures of Mana is a remastered version of the \'Final Fantasy Adventure\', known as \'Mystic Quest\' in Europe, which become the first game in the Mana series.\n\n\"This remastered version offers fans the enhanced visuals, revamped menus and a rearranged soundtrack from the game’s original composer. The background music for the original Game Boy version will be available on all platforms.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nev.jpg'),(19210,'Fathom','2018-12-31','Shooter, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','FATHOM is a fast paced action-strategy submarine combat game for the PC, where you’ll need quick reflexes, clever piloting skills, and tactical leadership to survive. Bringing a unique mixture of First-Person-Shooter (FPS) and Real-Time-Strategy (RTS) genres, FATHOM is a multi-player focused game that offers a variety of modes that support competitive (1v1 and team) play, as well as cooperative play.\n\nTake control of a Deep Submergence Vehicle (DSV) and prepare for battle. Use beacons to call down structures from the sea surface and layout your base of operations to begin your campaign. Construct warships and command your fleet into the heart of your enemy’s base! Set up blockades of deployable turrets and mines to defend strategic locations from your enemies. Call to the sea surface for depth charge bombardments from above or bring huge capital ships to bear in an all-out epic war beneath the waves!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qny5tkvg9mchh41x3eiu.jpg'),(19211,'Kunoichi Torimonocho','1999-02-25','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Sega Saturn, PlayStation','Kunoichi Torimonochō (Kunoichi Detective Story) is a Japanese-style adventure game. Take the role of Ran and travel around Edo, interact with a variety of colorful characters, play numerous minigames, and attempt to train Ran into a proper Kunoichi. There are multiple endings depending upon your choices and performance through the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x5v.jpg'),(19212,'Evoland 2: Deluxe Edition','2015-12-31','Fighting, Music, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Evoland 2 Deluxe Edition includes the main game, the soundtrack, and the artbook.\n\nEvoland 2 is the spiritual successor to the original Evoland with its graphics style changing as you travel through time, and it’s gameplay evolving as you move along the storyline. It is also a much bigger game and a classic RPG at heart, with a complex scenario based on time travel, dozens of characters with their own backgrounds and ambitions, and vastly different gameplay styles that are linked to the story and the player’s actions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lrv.jpg'),(19213,'Haru and Wonder Land',NULL,'Music, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Haru and Wonder Land is a game where Haru, a young cellist, embarks on an adventure in a mysterious world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lly.jpg'),(19214,'Darksiders: Genesis - Nephilim Edition','2020-02-14','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In Darksiders Genesis, the fourth Horseman of the Apocalypse STRIFE is called upon to save humankind from certain destruction at the hands of Lucifer. True to its roots, Darksiders Genesis will feature intense combat, exploration, puzzle-solving, epic boss battles and serpent holes from heaven to hell. The game marks the first, full-scale Darksiders adventure played from the top-down perspective.\n\nThe Darksiders Genesis Nephilim Edition includes.\n- Darksiders Genesis game\n- Official board game Darksiders: The Forbidden Land\n- Strife Figurine\n- Steelbook\n- Artbook\n- Soundtrack\n- Sticker Sheet','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co808a.jpg'),(19215,'Inspire','2024-04-12','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Inspire is a Stylized Top-Down Shooter set in the near future. Customize your arsenal, soar through the skies with your jetpack, and shoot your way through an alien invasion alongside your transformable backpack companion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8494.jpg'),(19216,'Force of Nature','2016-12-13','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Force of Nature is an indie open world sandbox game with fighting, crafting, building and farming systems.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1re9.jpg'),(19217,'Citizens Unite!: Earth x Space','2021-01-27','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Citizens Unite!: Earth x Space includes both the Citizens of Earth and Citizens of Space games. This time the two adventures have united with brand-new elements. Recruit 88 Citizens with unique abilities to save the Earth in both time-periods! Time travel back-and-forth between Citizens of Earth and Citizens of Space, unlocking new content and revealing the true ending!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2pch.jpg'),(19218,'The Last Promise','2013-07-10','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Game Boy Advance','The Last Promise is an elaborate mod of Fire Emblem 7: Blazing Sword, casually referred to as just \"Fire Emblem\" in North America. The game hacks pretty much every concept that you could possibly think of--characters, classes, weapons, animations, graphics, maps, music, text, script, etc., you get the point. While this is no longer a big deal, when it was started many years ago, it was a relatively novel concept to mod many aspects of the game at once.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z51.jpg'),(19219,'Master of Magic: Scourge of the Seas','2024-02-08','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Master of Magic: Scourge of the Sea is an enchanting voyage into a realm where the sea wields its sorcerous','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8tc4.jpg'),(19220,'Final Fantasy Tactics Advance','2016-03-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Wii U, Game Boy Advance','Squaresoft brings its popular Final Fantasy franchise to the Game Boy Advance in the form of strategic warfare. Final Fantasy Tactics Advance trails the story of a young boy named Marche who is magically transported from his sleepy modern-time home to a strange kingdom where magic and adventure reign supreme.\n\nPlayers control a set of troops who specialize in various fighting, healing, magic, and archery skills (or job classes). Strategically positioning characters on the battle map, and calculating offensive advances are the keys to success. Two players can battle and trade items with the aid of the GBA link cable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wyp.jpg'),(19221,'Ticket to Ride: Legendary Asia','2012-08-02','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Travel along the Silk Road and wind your way through the hustle and bustle of Indochina in this new map of Ticket to Ride Legendary Asia! Just be ready for a hair-rising ride as you venture through the Mountain passes of the Himalayas in François Valentyne\'s winning entry to the Ticket to Ride 2011 Map Design Contest!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wsy.jpg'),(19222,'Diablo III: Reaper of Souls','2014-08-19','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Diablo III is an action role-playing game that takes place throughout the dark fantasy world of Sanctuary.\n\nYou play a hero who engages in fast-paced combat that tests your reflexes and rewards tactical decisions. As you slay hordes of monsters and challenging bosses, you grow in experience and ability, learning new skills and acquiring items of incredible power.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gfx.jpg'),(19223,'Armello: Collector\'s Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Quiz/Trivia, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','Sin plataforma','Armello is a grand swashbuckling adventure that combines three styles of play; The deep tactics of card games with the rich strategy of table top board games, combined with a character role-playing system. A rich game full of backstabbing, close shaves, shattered alliances, ruses and empty promises, Armello is a perfect game to play with your friends. The Armello: Collector\'s Edition includes the base game, The Dragon Clan, The Bandit Clan, The Usurpers Hero Pack, The Rivals Hero Pack, Seasons Board Skins Pack, and the original soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co436v.jpg'),(19224,'Bound By Blades','2022-11-15','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In the Action RPG, Bound By Blades, the desolate land of Ashmyr has become overwhelmed by bloodthirsty beasts. Scavenge materials, forge gear, and fortify yourself to confront the ferocious foes that lie ahead in order to rekindle the last hopes of life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xvi.jpg'),(19225,'Island Cities','2022-08-30','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Simulator, Indie, Card & Board Game','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Arrange the town islands and see them come to life. Just swap the blocks of a 3D jigsaw puzzle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5fb2.jpg'),(19226,'Rosenkreuzstilette Freudenstachel','2012-10-20','Shooter, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Step into the shoes of Freudia Neuwahl, a cool and collected young woman on a mission to save her best friend from an Imperial witch hunt.\n\n\"Rosenkreuzstilette Freudenstachel\" is the sequel to \"Rosenkreuzstilette\", a level-based 2D side scrolling action game for PC.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l1m.jpg'),(19227,'SpellForce 2: Gold Edition','2007-04-06','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Experience the age of heroes: roleplaying action & realtime strategy in a perfect mix of genres.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/i4fvlj9cth2fa7vi4mfc.jpg'),(19228,'Everspace 2: Stellar Edition','2023-08-15','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 5','EVERSPACE 2: Stellar Edition Includes:\n- Base game\n- SteelBook case\n- Digital original soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nci.jpg'),(19229,'Lynked: Banner of the Spark','2025-05-22','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Team-up, brawl and build in this co-op action game that blends hack and slash combat with roguelite-inspired missions and town-building progression that goes beyond the run! Unlock and upgrade gear, rescue robot allies, and lead the resistance against the world-dominating Combots!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9k01.jpg'),(19230,'Druidwalker','2023-06-15','Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','You are a druid preparing the forest for winter. Traverse the paths at your own pace, meet the animals, enjoy the music, all wrapped in a peaceful roguelike experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qza.jpg'),(19231,'Valkyria Chronicles 4 : Squad E, to the Beach!','2018-10-09','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','September, 1935 EC. After a narrow victory, Squad E is given a special assignment: Cut off one of the Empire\'s critical supply lines.\n\nBut when Claude\'s squadron storms the enemy\'s base, they unexpectedly find themselves standing on a pristine sandy beach...\n\nThis story can be played after completing Chapter 10 of the main story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8b9j.jpg'),(19232,'SpellForce 2: Faith in Destiny - Scenario Pack','2012-12-17','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','This compilation includes the following DLC (downloadable content) for SpellForce 2: Faith in Destiny: \n \n- SpellForce 2: Faith in Destiny - Scenario 1: Flink\'s Secret Diary \n- SpellForce 2: Faith in Destiny - Scenario 2: The Golden Fool \n- SpellForce 2: Faith in Destiny - Scenario 3: The Last Stand','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2x65.jpg'),(19233,'Bullet Age','2020-09-25','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Slash and blast your way through a fantasy wasteland \n \nThe world of New Haven is a wasteland. The ARC empire destroyed it with a single Mutagen Bomb that transformed its creatures to mutated monsters. \n \nJoin the Gunsword heroes in this classic co-op 2D action-platformer as they become the last hope for the United Resistance. \n \nGain powerful abilities to dash, spin, and blast through creepy creatures, mutated soldiers and huge bosses. It’s up to you to stop the ARC from achieving world domination. \n \nKey Features: \n \nPlay through dozens of meticulously designed levels chock-full of secrets, challenging platforming and over the top bosses that spans over 3 continents. \n \nIntuitive combat system that mixes hack and slash action and run and gun gameplay. \nPurchase and upgrade weapons with unique parts that will give bullets devastating abilities. \n \nFull co-op adventure with single Joy-con support and HD rumble to feel each action and help you locate hidden secrets. \nBeautiful hand-drawn cartoon graphics and fluid animation bring the world of Bullet Age to life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mbf.jpg'),(19234,'License To Clone','2025-05-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive a harsh desert with sci fi technology, rampant wild clones and multiple factions. Start off working in a small town for any faction, grow your money and eventually start your own town, complete bounties to earn faster cash and progress.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8xoi.jpg'),(19235,'Spiritfall','2023-04-03','Fighting, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Spiritfall is a fast-paced Action Roguelite inspired by Platform Fighters. Battle against a multitude of enemies using an ever-changing arsenal of divine powers.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b25.jpg'),(19236,'Simp: Leveling Up on a Dating App','2025-02-09','Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','FMV (Interactive Movie)\n\n\"It\'s not that I can\'t date; I just won\'t date just anyone!\"\nMeet Tesu Kang, a simp who\'s never had a girlfriend in his 30 years. Now facing the harsh reality of aging without any prospects for romance. he realizes that if there\'s no path, he must forge his own. Determined to find new love through a dating app, Tesu embarks on what could be the biggest challenge of his life.\n\nJoin in and see how your choices will change his destiny!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dgw.jpg'),(19237,'Necropolis: Brutal Edition','2016-09-06','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','NECROPOLIS: BRUTAL EDITION is a major update featuring a new playable adventurer (The Brute), a completely new outdoor environment (The Black Forest), and lots of new enemies, weapons, armor, traps, potions, scrolls, and other big improvements to the game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co497y.jpg'),(19238,'Untamed Tactics: Humblewood Edition',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Sin plataforma','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co713v.jpg'),(19239,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Splintered Fate','2024-07-17','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','TMNT Splintered Fate - Unleash the Turtles in a rogue-like quest to rescue Splinter from the Foot Clan! Master ninja skills, unite in bodacious co-op gameplay, and conquer iconic NYC locales.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6zbi.jpg'),(19240,'Planet Fights','2023-03-24','Fighting, Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','An online MMO game in which you can have your own virtual life. You can join a nation, buy vehicles, items, properties, open a political party, fight in battlefields, participate in races, take part in agent fights, be a nation senator or president, vote on nation issues and you can do many other activities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6axx.jpg'),(19241,'Marble Mayhem: Fragile Ball','2015-07-07','Puzzle, Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Devilishly difficult but insanely rewarding physics puzzler. Play through 85 levels of diverse and ingenious physics-based challenges. If you like Super Monkey Ball, Marble Madness, or Peggle, this one is for you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jpn.jpg'),(19242,'Live by the Sword: Tactics','2021-06-23','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A loadout based Tactical RPG currently in Early Access. Featuring a Single Player campaign, a roguelike Adventure Mode, local and online multiplayer and a board builder.\n\nBuild your team with 7 unique classes each featuring a different move set of abilities and attacks. Outmanoeuvre your opponent or die on the battlefield.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39yt.jpg'),(19243,'10S','2018-08-24','Sport, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','10S is a sports shmup with a light roguelike bent to it. After tennis-ing your way through a random wave of monsters, you\'ll be asked to pick from one of three upgrades. There\'s bosses to fight, oddly eerie music, and if you don\'t like the look of the game you can hand-pick your own colour palette.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2a97.jpg'),(19244,'Clan monsters','2023-08-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Clan monsters is a game in which you have to use your dexterity and reliable weapons to destroy monsters that appear from portals. Different types of weapons will be given you for completing levels. Fire, monster a lot of levels with different platforms! There is easy controls system.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co98aw.jpg'),(19245,'Loop','2022-07-04','Music, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Loop is a vibrant Contemplative Puzzle Game; where you and your companion travel through a mysterious, ethereal temple. During this Journey, you will traverse many riddles and face the ultimate enigma: can the endless loop be broken?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5jkf.jpg'),(19246,'Nethergate: Resurrection','2012-09-05','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Spiderweb Software\'s classic adventure of treachery and battle in ancient times has returned! Travel back to ancient Britannia for a tale of cunning foes, vicious battles, and a race to rediscover the lost secrets of magic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30p7.jpg'),(19247,'Endor Awakens','2025-06-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Endor Awakens: Dungeon Crawler is a thrilling evolution of Depths of Endor, where chaos reigns in the changing world after the fall of Mordoth. In this Dungeon Crawler, you\'ll venture through procedurally generated dungeons, encountering new challenges and treasures with every step.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9kz4.jpg'),(19248,'We. The Revolution','2019-03-21','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','We. The Revolution is a unique game with a singular art style set in the blood-soaked and paranoid world of the French Revolution, where often you could not tell a friend from an enemy. As a judge of the Revolutionary Tribunal, you will have to trudge through this setting passing sentences, playing a dangerous political game, and doing everything in your power to not to be guillotined as an enemy of revolution. At the end of a day you will also confront your decisions with your family and very often they will see it differently.\n\nWe. The Revolution will put you in morally ambiguous situations in which there are no obvious solutions, and the decisions you make are never unambiguous...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cnl.jpg'),(19249,'Pokémon Bushido','2021-03-15','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pokémon Bushido is a Pokémon fan game. It is not a ROM hack, but rather a game for PC made in RPG Maker XP, using Pokemon Essentials.\n\nThe story of Pokémon Bushido revolves around you, the child of the Royal Samurai.\nAfter training under Sensei Sukiro for years, the time has come for you to get a Pokemon and become an official Kenshi.\nHowever, upon attending the Kenshi Initiation Tournament, you experience an unexpected turn of events, causing your journey to take you throughout the major villages of the Aisho Region! You will challenge all the various clans and earn merit for yourself while stopping the Akui Clan in their tracks. As you travel the region, you will meet new friends, and enemies, who will shape your adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co304d.jpg'),(19250,'The Touhou Empires','2025-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Touhou Empires is a real-time strategy simulation game (RTS) in which you lead Touhou Project characters and fairies with various abilities to fight!\n\nPlayers command Touhou Project\'s catactors and fairies to complete the prepared missions while responding to ever-changing situations!\n\nThe game flow is as follows: players collect resources from the map, construct buildings to expand their own camps, and organize their armies to advance and march.\nThen, organize your army, march forward, and battle the enemy to complete the mission!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4x5j.jpg'),(19251,'Like a Dragon Gaiden: The Man Who Erased His Name - Deluxe Edition','2023-11-09','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Like a Dragon Gaiden: The Man Who Erased His Name is a 2023 action-adventure video game developed by Ryu Ga Gotoku Studio and published by Sega. It is a spin-off of the Like a Dragon series. Taking place during the events of Yakuza: Like a Dragon (2020), Like a Dragon Gaiden focuses on the series\' original protagonist, Kazuma Kiryu, as he embarks on a new adventure in Osaka under the guise of a secret agent.\n\nThe Deluxe edition includes the base game and the Legendary Fighter Pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7cf5.jpg'),(19252,'Against the Storm','2021-10-18','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','A roguelite city builder set in a fantasy world tormented by the everlasting rain. Settle the unknown wilds to discover and rebuild the ruins of a long-forgotten civilization. Develop technologies that will help your citizens tackle destructive storms and extend the frontier of your civilization.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7j13.jpg'),(19253,'Megabyte Punch','2013-10-15','Fighting, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Megabyte Punch is a fighting/beat ‘em up game in which you build your own fighter!\n\nAs you travel through different environments, you battle other creatures to get their parts. Parts have their own powers and bonuses, like gun arms for a shoot ability or powerful hips for a devastating pelvic thrust attack. Then, using the abilities of your customized fighter, you can compete in the tournament or battle against other players in a destructible arena.\n\nThe game takes place in an computer world where you protect the Heartcore of your village against the likes of the Valk Empire and the dreaded Khoteps in 6 different levels with each 3 stages and a boss fight!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24ac.jpg'),(19254,'Dead Island 2: Ultimate Edition','2023-04-21','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Ultimate Edition contains the Dead Island 2 base game, plunging you into the heart of Hell-A, with intense zombie-slaying action, along with both epic story expansions: Haus and SoLA.\n\nUnleash a new level of carnage with special weapons and stylish gear. Included in the Ultimate Edition you’ll find: Kingdom Come: Deliverance II pack, Memories of Banoi Pack, Golden Weapons Pack, Pulp Weapons Pack, Red’s Demise Pack, and each Slayer’s Premium Skin Pack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yos.jpg'),(19255,'Midas Gold Plus','2017-02-01','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','God gave you the ability to turn everything you touch into gold. Take the opportunity to build an empire of unimaginable riches! \n \nTouch stones and they will be transmuted it into gold. Build a town and upgrade it. Select Champions and use their unique Abilities. Manage your kingdom, prepare for war and raid Mythical Cities. \n \nKing Midas, the world is yours!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wgs5snbydbqslly0wvjy.jpg'),(19256,'Merc Tactics','2018-11-23','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Merc Tactics is a top-down tactical turn-based RPG in which you engage in epic tactical shootouts.\nThe game takes place in a region where civil war has left the country in chaos. The Khondo, a vicious band of looting militia have taken control of the country. You lead a small squad of mercenaries, who have vowed to restore order and rid the country of the Khondo.\n\nYou need to carefully plot your way through the region, recruiting mercenaries, upgrading your skills procuring armour and weapons and forming alliances with friendly militia. Each location in the campaign map hosts hostile militia, which you must fight in turn-based squad combat.\n\nWhen your squad is strong enough you can confront the ringleader militia, but it will not be easy.\n\nNearly everything in the game is randomly generated, including the campaign map, enemy and resource locations. Scene layout and buildings are procedurally generated, leading to a huge variety of different scenes which your squad has to fight through.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co94r1.jpg'),(19257,'Space Hoarders Inc.','2021-11-26','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Sci-Fi turn based resource management game.\nMine, craft and ship resources across the galaxy!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49e7.jpg'),(19258,'Shadows Over Loathing','2023-04-19','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','A slapstick-figure comedy adventure-RPG full of mobsters, monsters, and mysteries.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5rue.jpg'),(19259,'Heck Deck','2022-01-11','Shooter, Strategy, Indie, Arcade, Card & Board Game','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Heck Deck is a bullet hell card game where all the bullets are cards and time only progresses as you move. Explore 5 stages full of unique enemies and bosses, discover dozens of cards, and visit shops to buy and sell cards for health!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4293.jpg'),(19260,'Gone Rogue','2023-03-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Get into the role of a thief from the city slums. Your weapons are your dexterous fingers, your skills are your cunning, attentiveness and planning, your motivation is silent disobedience to the will of the ruling party. Lurking in the shadows, slip unnoticed past enemies, get behind any locked doors, and carry off rich loot. But it\'s not just money and valuables you\'re after. In this harsh and unjust world, many need help, and it is in your power to help them.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5weo.jpg'),(19261,'Ascension: The Immortal Alchemist',NULL,'Platform, Puzzle, Racing, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Ascension follows the trials and tribulations of an Immortal Alchemist and his quest throughout time to transmute humans in to gods. Players descend into an ancient labyrinth where their souls are tested by cosmic forces to challenge the limitations of their mortality. Do you have what it takes?\n\nAscension is a modern resurrection of the classic 3D Action Adventure Genre - Inspired by the legendary writings of Hermes Trismegistus - a figure who rose to prominence in the mystery schools of Hellenistic Egypt & Greece, and whose timeless teachings are as relevant today; as they were when they were written.\n\nAction-adventure, puzzle, platforming, atmospheric, difficult, speedrunner, escape room, maze','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8wm5.jpg'),(19262,'Ronin','2015-06-30','Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Tactical, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Ronin (stylized as RONIN) is a 2015 turn-based action platformer video game developed by Polish indie developer Tomasz Wacławek, designer at polish indie studio Flying Wild Hog, and published by Devolver Digital. It was released for Microsoft Windows on May 27, 2015 into Early Access and left it on June 30, 2015.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r6w.jpg'),(19263,'Axegend','2020-03-09','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Axegend VR is a Roguelike strategic action adventure game. You will play as a versatile knight who will gives his all to save the princess. Anything could become a weapon in his hands: umbrella, tires, boomerang, axe, tube, even...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20fs.jpg'),(19264,'Dead Ground','2021-01-12','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Tower defense reimagined! Dead Ground is a procedurally generated tower defense game with rogue-like elements. Each playthrough will offer randomly generated guns, skills and augments. You\'ll have to travel, collect scrap, water, manage your inventory and upgrade your base to survive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ny3.jpg'),(19265,'Hourglass','2022-06-30','Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In Hourglass you can create a time-clone of yourself to solve challenging puzzles. You will play as Aywa, a young adventurer who is traveling to Egypt to find her missing father - an archeologist, who never returned from his latest expedition.\n\nPyramids are the tombs of the pharaohs. This is what most people believe. But more and more studies raise doubts about this thesis. Scientists found indications for ancient egypt being far more technologized than we can imagine. Hourglass is set in a scenario in which those assumptions are actually true..\n\nBesides offering an ancient world to explore, Hourglass is mostly about solving various puzzles with a unique core-mechanic. Your ability allows you to record your actings for a certain amount of time. After that, time winds back to the beginning of the recording and a time-clone of yourself appears, repeating the actions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3199.jpg'),(19266,'Plants vs. Zombies: GOTY Edition','2010-08-09','Puzzle, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Zombies are invading your home, and the only defense is your arsenal of plants! Armed with an alien nursery-worth of zombie-zapping plants like peashooters and cherry bombs, you\'ll need to think fast and plant faster to stop dozens of types of zombies dead in their tracks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9n56.jpg'),(19267,'Polybot-7','2018-03-12','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','You are Polybot-7, the latest in a line of fully-modular robot designs being put through The Gauntlet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qzj.jpg'),(19268,'Gremlins, Inc.','2016-03-11','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Gremlins, Inc. is an intense strategy board game in a steampunk world of corrupt capitalist gremlins who compete for money, political power and prestige. Steal resources, extort bribes, manipulate elections, arrest other players and send them telegrams of misfortune… Unleash your inner gremlin!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41gu.jpg'),(19269,'Valkyria Chronicles 3: Kurt Irving\'s First Mission','2011-01-27','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PlayStation Portable','Kurt Irving\'s First Mission is a pre-order bonus content of Valkyria Chronicles 3. It is also included in the Valkyria Chronicles 3 Extra Edition','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72gr.jpg'),(19270,'Tuebor','2016-09-01','Fighting, Shooter, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Sport, Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Tuebor is an exciting 3rd person hero arena fighter set in the year 7235. \nBiomech, Mutates, Psionics, and The Pure battle in epic 6-16 player PvP, PvE Co-op, and PvEvP battles. \nThe game is a fresh new take on combined genre\'s such as MMO, TPS, MOBA, and RPG. \nLevel up your hero in cool new skins, backpacks, and goggles to outwit, outplay, and out-destroy your opponent. \nTuebor is an amazingly fun, and very beautiful action hero game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/ilklipgazvih8ntwgous.jpg'),(19271,'Alder\'s Blood','2020-04-10','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Alder\'s Blood is a grim, dark and damp turn-based, tactical, strategic, 2D game. Lead a group of Hunters in a world, where nature have lost her mind and repelled the civilisation. Use cold steel and trustworthy rifles or guns to fight back.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m94.jpg'),(19272,'Pokémon Emerald Seaglass','2024-08-23','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Pokemon Emerald Seaglass is a romhack of Pokemon Emerald with many alterations.\n\nNotable features include:\n\n- Complete visual overhaul of all game graphics to fit a cozy, GBC-like aesthetic\n\n- All Pokémon from Generations 1-3 are obtainable, along with cross-generation evolutions (ex: Roserade, Mamoswine, Farigiraf)\n\n- Tweaks to many traditionally “bad” Pokémon to make them more interesting and usable (ex: Ghost/Flying Noctowl, Grass/Dragon Sceptile, Water/Fire Octillery)\n\n- Updated battle engine to most recent games (Physical/Special split, Fairy type, etc.)\n\n- New minigames and events to bring life to Hoenn, such as a Scuba Diving competition in Pacifidlog Town and Pinball games used to unlock rare items and Alolan Eggs!\n\n- Follower Pokemon\n\n- The Rustboro City Wishing Well, using Wishing Star items as a currency in a gacha-like system to get random Pokémon! Great for shaking up repeat playthroughs\n\n- Cheat codes accessible in-game via the Player’s GameCube\n\n- Hard Mode (disabled by default), Soft Level Cap toggle (enabled by default), and more settings accessible by interacting with book on Player’s desk','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9iww.jpg'),(19273,'Clock Tower','1996-12-13','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Clock Tower, known as Clock Tower 2 in Japan, is a PlayStation point-and-click survival horror game and a sequel to Clock Tower: The First Fear.\nOne year after the events of Clock Tower: The First Fear, in late 1996, Jennifer Simpson has been adopted by Helen Maxwell, the assistant of a renowned psychiatrist, Samuel Barton, and is currently undergoing treatment at a university research building in Oslo, Norway, to help her cope with her traumatic experiences in the Clock Tower case and possibly shed some light on the mystery that was the Scissorman.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23s2.jpg'),(19274,'RPGolf Legends','2022-01-20','Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Become the legend in this golf-action-adventure and save golf in the world!\n\nRPGolf Legends is the follow-up title to RPGolf that launched on Android and iOS in 2017, and on PC via Steam in 2018. The game is an action RPG that has players go on a golfing adventure in a world full of monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40e2.jpg'),(19275,'Starminer',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Design and build an interstellar mining fleet to strip space of its invaluable minerals, and sell them for a tidy profit. But beware. Your greed will attract the alien. Use warships and defense platforms to protect your fleet at all costs - in real space, in real time.\n\nStarminer is a space industry and logistics simulation that strives to be at the forefront of space strategy gaming, blending cutting-edge rendering technologies with deep tactical and creative gameplay. It\'s set against backdrops of fully-realized 3D environments, where the beauty of space becomes an integral part of player immersion, setting Starminer apart as a visually stunning and technologically advanced space base-building game. Starminer is built with realism and immersion as core design pillars through the incorporation of Newtonian physics for propulsion and movement. This not only adds a layer of authenticity and complexity to the gameplay but also introduces a rewarding learning curve for players seeking a genuinely advanced spacefaring experience.\n\nIn Starminer, the universe is more than just a pretty backdrop for exploration and conquest—it\'s a playground for players to explore their creativity and long-term ambitions for their fleets. Central to the game\'s creative ethos is the ability to design a variety of space stations that bring them toward their goals; whether it\'s to mine resources, be a defensive power, colonization, energy production, or something else entirely. The dynamic and customizable nature of these different types of stations means that the player doesn’t only decide what their cosmic empire will be; it will become a unique reflection of their strategic prowess and imaginative flair.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ba1.jpg'),(19276,'Dissolved: Chapter One','2022-12-08','Point-and-click, Fighting, Shooter, Puzzle, Sport, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','If there are feel-good games, well Dissolved is a feel-bad game. You play as a girl whose weird psychosis is to turn every ordeal in her life into a video game. It\'s a mix of completely new gameplays, fun and very challenging, parodying old arcade games.\n\nEach control scheme is very simple, often one or two buttons, but unsettling at first. How to fight space gopniks shooting from the sky if you can\'t shoot back? Well, simply strike through their projectiles until your reach them. And if you find yourself unarmed against armies of cops, you can always use their own dead bodies as projectiles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5v7x.jpg'),(19277,'Warriors Orochi 4','2018-10-16','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','WARRIORS OROCHI 4 stars heroes from the DYNASTY WARRIORS and SAMURAI WARRIORS series. 170 playable characters, new magic elements and an all new story enhance the latest entry in this exciting tactical action series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1uun.jpg'),(19278,'Omikron: The Nomad Soul','2000-06-22','Fighting, Shooter, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Dreamcast, PlayStation 2','Responding to the desperate pleas of a mysterious character from another dimension, your soul must enter the dark and futuristic city of Omikron. This is but the beginning of an epic adventure through an increasingly strange and dazzling parallel world. You must solve the ultimate mystery: why are you in Omikron and how can you get out? Think, fight, and interact with awe-inspiring environments to defeat the menacing demons that are trying to stop you. Experience the life in an alternate reality with everything it has to offer--including the secret musical performances by The Dreamers, a band of rebels led by the Omikronian incarnation of David Bowie.\n\nOmikron: The Nomad Soul is a futuristic 3d-action adventure like no other. Combining a deep game plot with adventure, exploration, action, combat and role-playing elements, the Omikron experience will captivate you from the moment you enter the strange and wonderful world beyond our own. Only using all of your combined skills will bring you deliverance from this exotic dimension.\n\nAfter Bowie\'s death in 2016, The Nomad Soul was made available at no cost for one week.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41ao.jpg'),(19279,'Circus of TimTim','2024-03-22','Shooter, Simulator, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Circus of TimTim is a Stealth Horror Survival Game about two siblings trying to sneak inside the most hunted carnival of all time to recover lost items with a metal detector device, however enemies are roaming around and they can hear your every step! TimTim is not happy ..','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ete.jpg'),(19280,'Crush the Industry','2023-03-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Claw your way to the top of a big game studio in this roguelike deckbuilder inspired by classic JRPGs!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zz7.jpg'),(19281,'Scars of Mars','2024-06-19','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Scars of Mars is a new real-time RPG. During combat and exploration, time flows, so you must make split-second decisions, execute precise commands swiftly, and vanquish enemies within a limited time. It\'s a thrilling experience that captures the unique tension and satisfaction of the gameplay.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7430.jpg'),(19282,'Tangledeep','2018-02-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Enter the magical world of Tangledeep, a beautifully polished dungeon crawler inspired by classic 16-bit RPGs! Colorful characters, a unique job system, and beautiful environments meet deep strategic gameplay and adventures that are different every time you play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j2v.jpg'),(19283,'Like a Dragon: Ishin! - Third Division Armament Expansion Kit','2023-02-17','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Third Division Armament Expansion Kit contains a set of additional Trooper Cards to boost the player\'s ranks. This pack of 8 Legendary Troopers and 15 Epic Troopers includes, among others, \"Yakuza: Like a Dragon\" Ichiban Kasuga and Omelette.\n\nIn addition to the Trooper Cards, consumable items to level up your troops and high-value goods are included.\n\nThe Third Division Armament Expansion Kit contains:\n- Legendary Trooper: Kasuga Ichinojo\n- Legendary Trooper: Nishitani Shigeharu\n- Legendary Trooper: Mukoda Sae\n- Legendary Trooper: Makimura Mako\n- Legendary Trooper: Toranosuke\n- Legendary Trooper: Yama-goroshi\n- Legendary Trooper: Karaage\n- Legendary Trooper: Mamezo\n- Epic Trooper: Attack Instructor x3\n- Epic Trooper: Defense Instructor x3\n- Epic Trooper: Medical Instructor x3','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6fbn.jpg'),(19284,'The Legend of Dark Witch Episode 2 -The Price of Desire-','2015-12-17','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Nintendo 3DS','Created by INSIDE SYSTEM, The Legend of Dark Witch 2 is a 2D action story sequel to The Legend of Dark Witch.\n\nTrue to its predecessor, The Legend of Dark Witch 2 retains its simple controls and enough challenges to satisfy the completist.\n\nPlayers have eight stages to choose from and must use SHOTs to make their way through a variety of obstacles to reach the boss enemy.\n\nWithin each stage there are hidden Pura Syega, which are helpful to power up player characters. Use \"Tres\" to adjust your statistics finely, and customise technical skills to not only increase power, but also add new abilities. Using new forbidden items allows for a wider variety of gameplay, too.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3aa7.jpg'),(19285,'VanillaBeast: Ace in the Hole',NULL,'Shooter, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','VanillaBeast: Ace in the Hole - a parody game. Hilarious pixel art action-adventure game that focuses on an open world environment as well as a massive variety in retro-style levels.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ha4.jpg'),(19286,'Tabletop Simulator','2015-06-05','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), SteamVR, Mac','Tabletop Simulator is the only simulator where you can let your aggression out by flipping the table! There are no rules to follow: just you, a physics sandbox, and your friends. Make your own games and play how you want! Unlimited gaming possibilities!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20xe.jpg'),(19287,'Attack Heroes','2017-08-08','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Attack Heroes is a funny-hot blood indie game which requires your abilities to finish all the challenging stages.We mixed the Japanese \'Moe\' style battle scenes and original vocaloid BGMs,for showing the core of acting animes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23om.jpg'),(19288,'TouHou Nil Soul','2020-02-28','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Scarlet Devil Mansion is asking for trouble again. For the sake of convenience, vampire lord Reimilia Scarlet release scarlet mist to blind the sun. No doubt such stupid behavior will definitely result in a tragedy. Look! Reimu and Marisa are coming to teach her a lesson.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44sq.jpg'),(19289,'Magic and Machines','2023-06-09','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','A retro fantasy RPG with turn-based battles, puzzles, and six unique characters. It\'s perfect for players who grew up with turn-based RPGs and are looking for a new adventure, and also accessible for new players as it doesn\'t take itself too seriously.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6he5.jpg'),(19290,'Revhead','2017-03-09','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','Revhead is a car racing simulation game, where you have to build your own race car.\nYou have a friend Charlie, who is busy with building race cars. He would need some help from you and he invites you to Australia. You start your journey somewhere in a small village in Australia, where the only way to get recognised if you are able to build the fastest and best racing car around. You have Charlie, his expertise and his garage. The rest is up to you!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24oy.jpg'),(19291,'Jampack: Volume 14','2006-05-19','Shooter, Music, Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Strategy, Adventure','PlayStation 2','This version of JAMPACK VOLUME 14 includes games rated M and is generally for older gamers, although it does includes games rated E and T. JAMPACK VOLUME 14-M includes demo versions of SHADOW OF THE COLOSSUS, RATCHET: Deadlocked, EYETOY: Operation Spy, OKAMI, HITMAN: Bloodmoney, MLB ?06: The Show, LARA CROFT TOMB RAIDER: Legend, BLACK, DRAKENGARD 2, and DRIVER: Parallel Lines. These games cover several genres, including action, racing, sports, and mission-based adventure. Many of the games included in JAMPACK VOLUME 14-M are from series that gamers probably already know about. RATCHET, TOMB RAIDER, DRIVER, and the EYETOY lines are already very popular, and players can get a sneak peak at the newest games in the series on this volume. For players who want to try out games before the buy them, JAMPACK VOLUME 14-M provides the perfect way to check out a game before spending money on it.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4n0h.jpg'),(19292,'Lost Castle','2019-09-19','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Lost Castle is a super cute, super hard action RPG with roguelike elements and randomized dungeons. Brimming with a host of hand drawn, humorous characters and environments that embrace retro action with modern twists.\n\nPrologue\nIn its glory days, Castle Harwood was the heart of a happy land governed by wise and virtuous nobles. But those days are long gone now. Calamity has befallen these lands, and wicked magics corrupt the castle and all that surrounds it. Demons have claimed this rotten place for their domain and even the might of the empire is thwarted by their dark army... and slowly, the corruption is spreading. Castle Harwood is lost.\n\nYet at the heart of this nightmare, something bright glimmers and fills the hearts of the mighty with the courage needed to invade the castle. The Lost Castle is filled with the treasure of the defeated Earl and it is the promise of riches that calls you. And maybe you can do some good, too.\n\nKey Features:\n- Up to four players online and local!\n- Four player Co-Op or PVP Mode\n- Daily Challenges for you and your fellow Treasure Hunters!\n- Randomly generated dungeons, items, enemies and bosses.\n- Hardcore retro action inspired by classic beat ‘em ups.\n- Gorgeous hand drawn characters and environments.\n- 100+ items and 60+ potions with useful, dangerous or hilarious effects.\n- 190+ weapons and more than 60+ sets of armor.\n- Massive variety of skills and special attacks.\n- Sacrifice dead heroes to gain new abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1iuv.jpg'),(19293,'Protect Sea War','2021-10-05','Racing, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Battle of the Sea is an RTS real-time battle of the sea game - a real battle on your computer!\n\nThe game can be free to operate large cruisers, medium-sized cruisers, mine boats, torpedo boats, submarines, aircraft, tanks, soldiers.\nUse strategy to defeat the enemy and defend the country\'s territorial waters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4026.jpg'),(19294,'Slime Attack: Survivor','2025-01-22','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Slime Attack: Survivor is a roguelike action bullet heaven game where chaos reigns supreme! Dive into intense battles against waves of dynamic slimes and formidable bosses. Customize your character with unique gear and spells, and navigate through thrilling quests to unlock new content. With strategic resource management and heart-pounding action, every run is a new adventure.\n\nThink you have what it takes to take on the slime invasion and become the ultimate survivor? Prove it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bt6.jpg'),(19295,'All Walls Must Fall','2021-01-20','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','All Walls Must Fall is a tech-noir spy thriller set in a Berlin of 2089 where the Cold War never ended. A game in the isometric action tactics genre, you command secret agents using time travel, social stealth and combat. Prevent nuclear annihilation. Bring down the Wall. Love, kill, and remix reality to explore the meaning of freedom in a parable reflecting upon current global issues in the mirror of a fantastic future past.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28tz.jpg'),(19296,'Gladiator: Sword of Vengeance','2003-11-05','Fighting, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox, Nintendo GameCube, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 2','A Warrior Slave… Chosen by the Gods… To restore the glory of an Empire.\n\nIn the Year 106 AD the Roman Empire is in terrible decline. After the untimely death of the much-loved Emperor Trajan, the despotic Emperor Arruntius has bled the once powerful Rome to its knees. Poorly fought wars, famine, and plague are rife in all corners of the Empire, whilst the Emperor and his elite enjoy every excess and vice that the emptying coffers can afford. As herald to this age of degeneration, Arruntius has destroyed large portions of the city of Rome to create the battleground for the bloodiest gladiator event ever staged…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5x7s.jpg'),(19297,'Aksun','2025-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Aksun is an action roguelite based on Korean shamanism and the afterlife.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9cwn.jpg'),(19298,'Klondike Solitaire Kings','2017-08-16','Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Famous Card game also known as Klondike.\nWe kept the game true to the spirit of the classic Solitaire (also known as Klondike or Patience)\nKlondike Solitaire Kings features a beautiful custom designed card set in high resolution with 300+ levels, playing Patience on your desktop never looked this good!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6qbj.jpg'),(19299,'The Eye of Judgment','2007-10-25','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','PlayStation 3','The Eye of Judgment provides a visually stunning experience that adds a third dimension to the trading card game genre.\nPlayers compete by selecting a card and placing the coded card in front of the Playstation Eye for their respective creatures to come to life and battle on screen. Players take turns placing cards as they jostle for control; the winner is the first player to conquer five of the nine squares of the \"9 Fields\" battle mat. The gamers task is to conquer the board by deploying their cards more skillfully than their opponent.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8722.jpg'),(19300,'Mystery Box: Hidden Secrets','2024-02-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A point-and-click puzzle game where you have to solve intriguing riddles around different boxes and discover some cool stories about popular inventions!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5nuo.jpg'),(19301,'The Bookwalker: Thief of Tales','2023-06-22','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','The Bookwalker is a narrative adventure where you play as Etienne Quist, a writer-turned-thief with the ability to dive into books. Use your powers to traverse reality and book worlds, and track and retrieve famous items like Thor\'s Hammer and the Excalibur in exchange for your creative freedom.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lf8.jpg'),(19302,'Wakfu','2012-02-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Wakfu takes place 1,000 years after Ankama\'s previous game, Dofus.\n\nA spin-off game, Islands of Wakfu, was released on Xbox Live Arcade on March 30, 2011. An animated television series based on the game began airing in France from October 30, 2008. The series has also spawned various comics, a trading card game and a board game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co79ku.jpg'),(19303,'Survive Me Miolhr','2015-12-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Basics and Gameplay\nThis is a game about survival. Finding food and clean water while keeping yourself well-rested and in good health will all be challenges you will face.\n{Save the World} of Miolhr from the 6 overpowered DoJo leaders and all other challenges as you make your way through each Biome. However, there are also zombies that you may have to fight against! Thankfully, you are not alone in your plight. There are others in the same situation. Find them, and work together!\nWhen looting and even venturing out you have a Survival chance mechanic that gives you odds of survival. This is helpful for deciding to sleep outside by a fire or looting a large building. Be careful with your choices as making the wrong one can get you or your teammates killed. With over 100 maps and 500 items (150+ items, Armor and Weapons to Craft) there is much to do. It will be a long night!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42r7.jpg'),(19304,'Hidden Cats in Santa\'s Realm','2023-12-18','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','It\'s Christmas time! The Icy Santa\'s Realm is in full steam!! Join in the fun and search for all the Hidden Cats one by one among the elves to reveal the final colored art. With over 970 hidden objects to find, this time we are giving you an EXTRA BONUS SNOWBALL GAME at the park!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7jej.jpg'),(19305,'Battle Mages: Sign of Darkness','2006-04-13','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A thousand years had passed since the great battle between the Lord of Chaos and the forces of the Order. Little by little, life returned back to normal.\n\nThe story begins, when a young neophyte journeys north, to learn from an eccentric wizard, one of the most ancient and powerful Guild’s members. The apprentice doesn’t know yet, that his teacher-to-be is one of the Keepers, and that his destiny is to become a catalyst for the events, that will make Daenmor shudder…\n\nBattle Mages: Sign of Darkness is an enthralling journey to the world of original game. It offers four new campaigns, covering dramatic events that took place in Daenmor long before the Shadow of Warlock spread over the land. The player will discover the mysteries of the Order of the Keepers, confront treacherous plans of the elves, lead vengeful Orcs to the battle, oppose the creatures of Chaos, and of course the darkness will raise its flag over the green hills of Daenmor under his command.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dg0.jpg'),(19306,'Kingdom Under Fire: Heroes','2020-06-24','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kingdom Under Fire: Heroes is an action strategy game where you can command hundreds of soldiers. You also have spells, golems, and catapults at your disposal as you play through more than 50 campaign missions. The experience and gold that you earn during each battle can be used to train and equip your troops. You can also challenge other gamers online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co44i6.jpg'),(19307,'Penny Blood: Hellbound','2024-03-07','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unleash the hounds from hell and fight your way free of this otherworldly prison in a roguelike adventure that explores the world of Penny Blood’s darker side! Can you find the distinction between good and evil…?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wd3.jpg'),(19308,'Rec Room','2020-12-03','Fighting, Shooter, Music, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Arcade','Meta Quest 2, PlayStation 4, PlayStation VR, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, SteamVR, PlayStation 5, Oculus Rift, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch, Oculus Quest','Rec Room is a great place to build and play games together. Party up with friends from all around the world to chat, hang out, explore millions of player-created rooms, or build something new and amazing to share with us all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24pa.jpg'),(19309,'Nioh 2 Season Pass','2020-03-12','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4','The Nioh 2 Season Pass is a bundle that grants access to three major DLC expansions for the action role-playing game Nioh 2, developed by Team Ninja and published by Koei Tecmo. Released alongside the base game in March 2020, the Season Pass includes:\n\n- The Tengu\'s Disciple: The first expansion, taking players to the late Heian period with new story content, missions, enemies, bosses, and the new Splitstaff weapon.\n- Darkness in the Capital: The second expansion, set in the Heian period, introduces new story missions, historical figures, enemies, and combat abilities.\n- The First Samurai: The final expansion, delving into the origins of the protagonist, Hide, with additional story content, missions, and powerful new gear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ipa.jpg'),(19310,'First Queen','1989-12-23','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC-9800 Series, Sharp X68000','First Queen is a Strategy game featuring artwork by Yoshitaka Amano. It was developed and published by Kure and released in Japan in 1988. It was ported to the SNES in 1994.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nx4.jpg'),(19311,'Lords of Xulima: Deluxe Edition','2014-11-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lords of Xulima is a challenging Role-playing game set on the mythical continent of Xulima, where Gods and humans once walked side by side. Experience a genuine RPG featuring over 100 hours of gameplay, and discover one of the most epic sagas ever told.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mfg.jpg'),(19312,'Syrian Warfare','2017-02-21','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Real Time Strategy with a high degree of realism. The game is based on a true story.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24vf.jpg'),(19313,'Unheard','2022-02-16','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Unheard is a narrative-centric detective game.\nPut on your headphones and step back into the past. Use the voices you hear to return to crime scenes, tracking down each individual involved and solving the cases!\nThe game puts players in the role of a time-traveling detective who is only able to use one sense, sound. Also, the game’s story is a non-linear experience. Players must build their own timelines from the clues in conversations they overhear.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co269j.jpg'),(19314,'Bonesaw: The Game','2008-02-14','Fighting, Platform, Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A huge platformer beat em up with over dozens of levels, big boss battles, puzzles, and secrets galore.\nTake control of the last remaining Golden Knight on his quest to save the rest of his hockey team from the grip of a corrupt referee.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4pyd.jpg'),(19315,'The Surge: A Walk in the Park','2017-12-05','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Surge has already dragged players deep into the high-tech CREO industrial complex, overrun by deadly machines, rogue AI, and deranged exoskeleton workers.\nIts first major expansion A Walk in the Park takes players to an environment that\'s more open and colorful, but no less deadly. CREO World is an amusement park built by CREO for its employees and their families. Forget your cravings for cotton candy though - CREO World was not spared from the disaster. The entire park is a deadly trap where roaming rescue teams have gone insane and robotic mascots patrol freely, patiently waiting for new visitors to welcome.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21hg.jpg'),(19316,'Marc Ecko\'s Getting Up: Contents Under Pressure','2006-02-14','Racing, Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), Legacy Mobile Device, PlayStation 2','Play as Trane, a \"toy\" graffiti artist with the street smarts, athletic prowess and vision to become an \"All City King\" - the most reputable of all graffiti artists. Along your quest, uncover the mayor\'s deep, dark secret and use your fighting talents and high-wire graffiti to expose the city\'s leader as a corrupt tyrant. As you struggle to save a neighborhood from an oppressive government, one question stands out: What if graffiti could change the world? Risk your life battling city authorities and rival graf gangs - mere obstacles in your attempt to get your tag up. And in this city, not just any tag will do. You have to \"Get IN, Get UP and Get OUT\".\n\nCombat: master a unique fighting technique and use improvised weapons\nGraffiti: create tags in pressure situations, using multiple skills and styles\nIntuition: follow your sixth sense to find the best spots to tag\nSneak mode: infiltrate areas and avoid capture as you creep silently through the city\nNavigation: utilize a unique guidance system to \"get up\" and tag','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t7s.jpg'),(19317,'Apex Heroines','2024-12-13','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hack&Slash – Beat\'em all! Six heroines, five types of weapons and adrenaline-pumping levels create an adrenaline rush you can\'t resist. Easy to learn and hard to master. 4K/120Hz & SteamDeck-ready. Everyone can enjoy the game!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co73tq.jpg'),(19318,'Mask of Dead II: Shadow Of Pelagius','2025-02-21','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mask of Dead 2: Shadow of Pelagius is a JRPG with an active combat system. A lot of time has passed since the first Adamant War the reapers were able to recover from the damage they received and restore Purgatory, but not for long... Riom Ruri, the son of the High Reaper, has just finished training and has already received his first task - to scout the surrounding area with a small squad of other reapers. But everything does not go according to plan and Riom is forced to face the mistakes of his brothers in the past and save Purgatory from complete destruction.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9i5q.jpg'),(19319,'Alvastia Chronicles','2024-12-19','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','RPG with over 100 companions?! Set out on an adventure in a retro-styled world!After encountering the man who killed their parents ten years prior, Elmia and her brother Alan set out to avenge their deaths as they fight to stem the tide of monsters flooding into the upper world, and restore peace to Alvastia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co996n.jpg'),(19320,'How Much Items: Weapon','2024-12-19','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Game genre find hidden objects.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9op1.jpg'),(19321,'Talisman: Digital Edition - The City','2015-10-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Discover the City Region, one of the four Kingdoms surrounding the land of Talisman. This expansion adds a new board piece to the main Talisman board, taking you into the bustling City filled with shops, Strangers, Merchants and more. For the traveller with some gold to spend, a trip to the City can give them the edge to survive.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bbsgma0y2kqc54do7qig.jpg'),(19322,'Wolfstride','2021-12-07','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Winning the Ultimate Mech Tournament takes tactical skills to defeat opponents in epic GIANT MECH BATTLES and strategic savvy to repair and upgrade your Mech with the shiniest engines the world has seen. But you gotta pay up! Hit the streets to take any jobs the mysterious locals have to offer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vmi.jpg'),(19323,'Myth of Empires','2021-11-18','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Myth of Empires is a multiplayer war sandbox game featuring a high degree of freedom. Players must survive, craft, create, and lead troops in their quest to conquer territory and build their own empire.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7s8l.jpg');
INSERT INTO `games` VALUES (19324,'Artifact','2018-11-28','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A collaboration between legendary card game designer Richard Garfield and Valve, Artifact Classic is a digital card game that combines deeply strategic, competitive gameplay with the rich setting of Dota 2. The result is an immersive and visually stunning trading card game unlike any other.\n\nWield your deck across three lanes of combat, answer every move of your opponent with one of your own. Unlimited hand size. Unlimited number of units you control. Unlimited mana you can employ.\n\nArtifact Classic is free to play! Furthermore, all cards are now available to all players. If you paid for the original Artifact, your cards are promoted to Collector\'s Edition cards. Paid game event tickets have also been phased out.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6b13.jpg'),(19325,'Clock Tower II: The Struggle Within','1998-03-12','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation Vita, PlayStation, PlayStation Portable','Clock Tower II: The Struggle Within, known as Clock Tower: Ghost Head in Japan, is a PlayStation point-and-click survival horror game and the third installment in the Clock Tower series. It was developed and published by Human Entertainment on March 12, 1998 in Japan and later published by Agetec on October 31, 1999 in North America. It was released as a PlayStation Classic on the Japanese PlayStation Network for PlayStation 3 on May 9, 2012.\nThe game is a spin-off story with little to no connection to the story of the Barrows/Burroughs family or Scissorman, nor was Hifumi Kono involved with it.\nIt does not take place in Europe as many of the others do; it takes place in Osaka, Japan. In the North American version, the setting was changed to Salinas, California, and the characters were given Westernized names. However, untranslated Japanese can be seen in the hospital entrance and even in the intro, there are Japanese-styled buildings, including a Shinto shrine. The game also contains various Japanese-styled rooms and samurai armor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wmj.jpg'),(19326,'NeuroVoider','2016-08-31','Shooter, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','NeuroVoider is a twin-stick shooter RPG set in a cyber futuristic world about brains shooting around evil robots with nuclear rocket launchers. Battle through the horde of vigilant robots, boost your character with the smoking remains of your victims, and defeat the master NeuroVoider to end this eternal war. Play it coop with up to 4 friends, or go alone in an adventure of hack\'n\'slash rampage, with a pinch of rogue-lite, and some permadeath.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1n3z.jpg'),(19327,'Demian Saga','2023-04-13','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Android, iOS','Demian Saga: Chrono Pirates is a collectible RPG with a heavy focus on characters. The game features gorgeous character art, flashy cut scenes, and cute 3D models done in a chibi art style.\n\nThe level-sharing system is designed to help characters quickly level up, while the combat system requires players to plan which group of heroes from their pirate crew will engage in battle.\n\nMassive real-time PvP content that allows up to 200 players from four unions (guilds) is also in the works and scheduled to release when the game launches.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6bvw.jpg'),(19328,'Ancient Demon Shadow','2024-08-02','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Set in a vibrant and diverse otherworld, players will navigate through intricate puzzles, collect experience points, and train themselves to become stronger. Utilizing a variety of weapons and magic, they must eliminate massive creatures and monsters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8enh.jpg'),(19329,'Black Geyser: Couriers of Darkness','2022-03-17','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Black Geyser: Couriers of Darkness is an isometric, party and XP based, real-time RPG (with pause option) set in the world of Yerengal. A game that combines immersive graphics and brand-new features with virtues of the classic RPGs we all loved! Solve mysteries, fight epic battles, help beggars and kings alike, outwit swindlers and gods, and never forget: greed has many forms and many names!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pmw.jpg'),(19330,'The Great Whale Road','2017-03-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The Great Whale Road is a story-driven RPG with tactical combat, longships, and axes. Follow the wyrd of a settlement and its heroes as they travel along the North Sea coast - searching and salvaging to prepare for the cold months of winter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co23cm.jpg'),(19331,'Gem Deeps','2020-12-21','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','While chasing a stolen magic crystal, you are stumbling upon an ancient underworld civilization and scripts of even older origin. Explore this realm, fight its armies, and reveal its lore in this hand-painted, action-adventure platforming RPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nbv.jpg'),(19332,'Mr. Goofer’s Mini Game Arcade Party!','2024-11-22','Point-and-click, Fighting, Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Quiz/Trivia, Pinball, Indie, Arcade, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','A collection of over 30 arcade-inspired retro mini games, each with their own unique genre and style! It\'s a back-to-back marathon of playable, pixelated old-fashioned fun! What’s the highest score that YOU can reach?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9aoj.jpg'),(19333,'Pandorex','2025-05-01','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pandorex is a Point & Click Adventure featuring Harry who is on a mission to find his lost dog.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30iu.jpg'),(19334,'Punch Club','2017-01-18','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, Nintendo 3DS, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Train hard, fight crocodiles and find love. Earn your place in the Punch Club ranks, and discover who brutally murdered your father, in this choose your own adventure boxing management tycoon.\n\nPunch Club is a boxing tycoon management game with multiple branching story lines. Your goal is clear, but how you get there depends on whether you want to legitimately climb the rankings, or take the more ridiculous, shady route.\n\nAlong the way you\'ll want to focus your talents. Will you take the Way of the Tiger, the Way of the Turtle, or the Way of the [other one?]? Your strength, accuracy and agility all depends on whichever Way enlightens your path. Do you have stripes, or flippers?\n\nAnd every decision will matter, especially in your social life. You\'ll be juggling friendships, love life, work, recreational time, relationships, and possible stardom, all alongside your gym time and fighting aligators. It\'s not all just pumping iron, you know.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24qz.jpg'),(19335,'Star Trek: Legacy','2006-12-05','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','This game spans the history of Star Trek, following the challenges facing the Starfleet as an Admiral of a task force of warships. Gameplay campaigns play out in all of the Star Trek eras (from the founding days of Enterprise to the adventures of classic Star Trek to the bold unknown of The Next Generation, as well as the trials and tribulations facing Deep Space Nine and Voyager), as the Federation faces an entirely new enemy that has the power to travel through time.\n\nWith full multiplayer support, players can choose from small-scale engagements to all-out war involving multiple star systems in addition to tracking stats and player rankings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e9l.jpg'),(19336,'Isles of Krom',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Isles of Krom is a top-down action roguelike that combines the visceral and demanding combat of a Souls-like games with the deep character-building and progression systems of the best roguelikes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9c8u.jpg'),(19337,'Fiefdom','2026-12-31','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Change the world, one battle at a time in FIEFDOM: a multiplayer action melee game set in a playerbase-driven story. Clash swords, cast spells, rain down arrows & more in in battles of up to 100 players both at land & at sea. Dive into a world where your victories define the outcome of entire wars. Who will you be fighting for?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bwo.jpg'),(19338,'E.V.O. : Search for Eden','1992-12-21','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Super Nintendo Entertainment System, Super Famicom','The storyline of E.V.O.: Search for Eden follows the same patterns as modern Evolution theories. The players first controls a prehistoric sea organism, and fights to gain evolution points with which he can improve his fish\'s body parts and upgrade his attack/defense abilities. The gameplay is not completely linear, which means that certain choices of paths and stages will affect the player\'s success. The game is composed of a series of stages, in which the sea organism slowly evolves into an amphibian, and later a land-only creature. The physical changes are fairly scientifically accurate which gives the game a semi-educational purpose as well.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bcv.jpg'),(19339,'The Adventures of Bertram Fiddle: Episode 1 - A Dreadly Business','2014-12-11','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','There\'s murder afoot in Old London town in this Victorian-styled cartoony 2D point and click adventure, inspired by Victorian novels, Hammer Horror and the Cartoon Network. The only people who can solve this case are Bertram Fiddle and his manservant Gavin, who must explore the mysterious streets and murky alleyways and be on the lookout for elusive serial killer Geoff the Murderer in this award winning and gruesome tale.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co249r.jpg'),(19340,'Creeper World 4','2020-12-03','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The fourth installment of the real-time strategy series again tasks the player with containing the creeper, a destructive fluidlike substance, slowly overtaking the map\'s surface. Creeper World 4 continues the series\' gameplay and favors 3D environments with a focus on fluid dynamics over traditional 2D graphics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2i4x.jpg'),(19341,'Perseus: Titan Slayer','2023-02-13','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Perseus: Titan Slayer is an over-the-top hack and slash, rogue-like adventure that focuses on depth and branching choices which allow for multiple unique runs. Branching choices allow for custom runs and many opportunities to play again and try new builds. Wield a Sword, Dagger, Bow, or Katana, each with their own special abilities. Feel like a real Olympian and explore the secrets of each weapon.\nMeet Zeus, Poseidon, Hermes, and many other Olympians and gain their legendary upgrades.\nHack and slash through hordes of enemies as you make your way into Tartarus on an epic journey to fight Hades and the Titans.\nIt doesn’t matter how you want to play this game or what style you want to use. A shopkeeper system allows players to make unique builds whether you want to be a Tank, Agile, DPS or even a double spell caster on your adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5k3t.jpg'),(19342,'Dream Sketcher','2023-04-26','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','SteamVR','Dream Sketcher is a 1-4 player investigative adventure game. As an investigator of the special agency Dreamland Security, you will form a team and enter the weirdest dreams to conduct brain-diving investigation. Danger is imminent, investigate, make choices, roll the dice, and fight!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6oos.jpg'),(19343,'Hero Survival','2023-10-27','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hero Survival is an action-roguelite where you have to shoot down hordes of monsters from classic horror movies one by one to please the Mad Time God. Choose from a variety of skills, weapons, and items to create a unique build for every bizarre character.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co78bi.jpg'),(19344,'Metal Slug: Attack - Reloaded','2024-06-18','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Metal Slug Attack Reloaded is a remaster of the original Metal Slug Attack. Build the strongest team you can and crush enemy bases with a variety of strategies and hundreds of characters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8dab.jpg'),(19345,'Granblue Fantasy','2016-04-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Android, iOS','The Japanese game got a patch on April 11, 2016 which added an English option in-game instead of it being released internationally. This means the game must be downloaded/installed and started in Japanese before switching to English.\n\nGranblue Fantasy is a Japanese role-playing video game. The game plays as a traditional Japanese role-playing video game with turn-based battles. The game also contains summons and a class system that alters the main character\'s move-set and growth. Characters gain levels and abilities by accruing experience; summons and weapons equipped also confer characters with bonuses on attack power and HP. The characters themselves are gained either via quests (the main story quests or special event quests) or by using in-game currency to receive random crystal fragments, which may contain special weapons that add specific characters to the party. Characters, summons, and weapons are ranked (from best to worst) as SSR, SR, R, or N; each is also of type wind, water, fire, earth, light, or darkness. Voice actors provide voices for all of the characters in battle, and for much of the main and event storylines.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7tux.jpg'),(19346,'Mind Scanners','2021-05-20','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Mind Scanners is a retro-futuristic management game in which you diagnose the citizens of a dystopian metropolis. Locate a host of other-worldly characters and use arcade-style treatment devices to help them. Manage your time and resources to keep The Structure in balance. Remember, you take full responsibility for your patients.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j6m.jpg'),(19347,'Evocreo II','2025-03-01','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Android','Join millions of players in this pocket monster game sequel\nEmbark on an epic adventure in EvoCreo 2, the ultimate monster-catching RPG set in the captivating world of Shoru. Immerse yourself in a land teeming with mythical creatures called Creo. For thousands of years, these collectible monsters have roamed the lands, their origins and evolution shrouded in mystery. Do you have what it takes to unravel the secrets of the Creo and become a legendary Evoking Master Trainer?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9jj0.jpg'),(19348,'Metal Suits: Counter-Attack','2025-02-13','Shooter, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','They should never have ticked him off. Begin a hot-blooded revenge as the protagonist Kevin, who has lost everything and was reborn as a cyborg!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co92k1.jpg'),(19349,'Metaphor: ReFantazio','2024-10-11','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','From the creative minds of the Persona series – Metaphor: ReFantazio marks ATLUS’ first ever, full-scale fantasy RPG, brought to you by director Katsura Hashino, character designer Shigenori Soejima, and composer Shoji Meguro.\n\nWrite your destiny and rise above fear as you step into a fantasy world unlike anything you’ve seen before. Fraught with unsettling mystery, the kingdom stands on a precipice. Now, you must embark on a journey, overcoming obstacles and forging bonds with friends.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8d9t.jpg'),(19350,'Battleship Apollo','2021-02-22','Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Experience fast paced, tactical combat in a game that\'s very easy to get into but takes years to master.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tqq.jpg'),(19351,'MediEvil','2019-10-25','Platform, Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4','MediEvil is a modern reimagining of the 1998 action-adventure game MediEvil. Developed by Other Ocean Emeryville and published by Sony Interactive Entertainment, it was released exclusively for the PlayStation 4 on October 25, 2019.\n\nThe game retains the original’s story, following Sir Daniel Fortesque, a skeletal knight resurrected to defeat the evil sorcerer Zarok and save the kingdom of Gallowmere. The remake features completely overhauled graphics, updated controls, and re-recorded audio, while maintaining the classic gameplay elements, humor, and gothic aesthetic that defined the original.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tjg.jpg'),(19352,'Queen\'s Wish: The Conqueror','2019-12-04','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','At last, the Queen has given you power and freedom! The cost? You must rebuild her Empire. Will you? In this epic, indie fantasy adventure, you are free to explore, fight for fame and power, and shape the world as you choose. Escape into an unpredictable open-ended story and cunning tactical combat.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1q50.jpg'),(19353,'State of Decay: Year-One Survival Edition','2015-04-28','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','State of Decay, along with major Add-Ons Breakdown and Lifeline, is now fully remastered in stunning 1080p. New missions, weapons, and extra content, along with improved lighting, textures, animations and combat mechanics, will pull you even deeper into the post-outbreak world. How will you survive the zombie apocalypse?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2c6r.jpg'),(19354,'Attack at Dawn: North Africa','2022-06-07','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Attack at Dawn: North Africa is an operational level wargame set in WW2 North African theatre. It features 3 campaigns, and 15 scenarios, which can be played in solo or multiplayer modes. It begins with the German troops probing into the Libyan region of Cyrenaica, and finishes either with the total defeat of German-Italian Panzer Armee, or with the British loss of Egypt and their retreat across the Suez Canal.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sx8.jpg'),(19355,'Imperator: Rome','2019-04-25','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"Paradox Development Studio returns to ancient history with Imperator: Rome, a new title set around the growth of Roman power in a threatening Mediterranean. Unify Italy and then the world under the eagles of your legions. Or rule an Eastern monarchy with claims to the mantle of Alexander. Slaves, barbarians and war elephants bring the distant past to life in Imperator: Rome. Can you be a Caesar?\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22lq.jpg'),(19356,'Dicey Elementalist','2021-01-06','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Card & Board Game','Android, iOS','Inspired by a popular dice game called Yahtzee.\n- Five dice are rolled three times, keep the best score.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7mbc.jpg'),(19357,'ViCrew','2025-02-27','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A tactical RPG with turn-based combat in which you build a crew of Vikings to go on glorious raids.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9dz2.jpg'),(19358,'Yu-Gi-Oh! Forbidden Memories','1999-12-09','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','PlayStation','Yu-Gi-Oh! Forbidden Memories is a video game loosely based on the Yu-Gi-Oh! manga and anime series. The storyline takes on a dual setting in Ancient Egypt and current-day Domino City. Players play the Yu-Gi-Oh! Trading Card Game alongside characters that appear in the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ui5.jpg'),(19359,'LEGO Marvel\'s Avengers','2016-01-29','Platform, Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Wii U, PlayStation Vita, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Lego Marvel\'s Avengers is a Lego-themed action-adventure video game developed by Traveller\'s Tales and published by Warner Bros. Interactive Entertainment. It is the spin-off to Lego Marvel Super Heroes and the second instalment of the Lego Marvel franchise. The game is based on the Marvel Cinematic Universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2bvz.jpg'),(19360,'The Artful Escape','2021-09-09','Music, Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','On the eve of his first performance, Francis Vendetti battles with the legacy of a dead folk legend and the cosmic wanderings of his own imagination. In this 2D adventure platformer, Francis, a teenage guitar prodigy, sets out on a psychedelic, multidimensional journey to inspire his stage persona.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2e3n.jpg'),(19361,'HelixMod VR','2019-09-02','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Epic stereoscopic gaming, HelixMod in virtual 3D TV brings your full length 2D games into the 3rd dimension.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co39yf.jpg'),(19362,'Disgaea 2: Dark Hero Days','2010-02-18','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation Portable','In the peaceful world of Veldime, humans rarely encountered monsters. That was until Overlord Zenon cursed the land and all who reside within. With the curse in place, the humans became monsters and ravaged the world. It is up to Adell, the last remaining human, to oppose Overlord Zenon\'s tyranny and restore peace and harmony to Veldime. In Disgaea 2, players will take on the role of a young fighter named Adell and travel the Netherworld to defeat the evil overlord Zenon. Battles will take place on a 3D grid-based field. During combat, players will take turns with the enemy to move and attack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pn4.jpg'),(19363,'The Forever Moon','2020-06-13','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Forever Moon is a puzzle adventure and visual novel doujin game of Touhou Project. It is a love story about Kaguya Houraisan and Fujiwara no Mokou, and a story of Eientei, Bamboo forest of lost and Hakurei Shrine.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co467g.jpg'),(19364,'Phantasy Star Online 2 -Ragol Edition-','2020-05-27','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','This bundle is a special edition release of Phantasy Star Online 2\'s North American release on Xbox One. It contains the base game as well as the following in-game items:\n\n- Ragol Memory×10\n- Premium Set (30 Days)\n- AC Scratch Ticket x12\n- Mission Pass Gold Ticket\n\n\"Ragol Memory\" can be exchanged for costumes based on those from the original Phantasy Star Online.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28yn.jpg'),(19365,'Caffeine: Victoria\'s Legacy','2022-09-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A choice-rich, fantasy adventure visual novel in a steampunk victorian alternate reality, where coffee is all that matters.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wlc.jpg'),(19366,'Mahjong','2024-06-04','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Play a Zen game! Rediscover the famous traditional Chinese game.\n\nFind all the matching pairs of tiles, being careful not to become blocked in, to get to the end of each level. Concentration and perceptiveness are needed to finish the gorgeous boards that we have produced for you.\n\n- Traditional Mahjong with all its depth and captivating beauty.\n- 70 levels with varying difficulty and brand new puzzles.\n- Customise your games with different graphic styles.\n- Compare scores with your friends and players from around the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ido.jpg'),(19367,'Nyassembled!','2025-03-10','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Nyassembled! is a simultaneous turn-based tactical RPG with a plan-action system. Build your modular mechs, command electronic cats, and explore a procedurally generated world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9g1k.jpg'),(19368,'Dungeon Stars','2019-02-15','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Use sword and spell to delve deep and battle through hordes of powerful enemies. Does the next room contain a healing fountain, a rare treasure, or the Toxic Ogre King? You need to keep on your toes as you face unknowns in every room. If you delve deep enough, you may face the legendary eater of light, the Conqueror Worm!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hps.jpg'),(19369,'Infinity Blade','2010-12-09','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','iOS','Infinity Blade is a fighting game developed by Chair Entertainment and Epic Games and released through the Apple App Store on December 9, 2010. It is the first iOS video game to run on the Unreal Engine. In the game, the unnamed player character fights a series of one-on-one battles in a derelict castle to face the immortal God King. When in battle, players swipe the screen to attack and parry, and tap the screen to dodge and block enemy attacks. Upon victory or defeat, the player restarts the game as the character\'s descendant with the same items and experience level.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qes.jpg'),(19370,'Orbital Bullet','2021-04-22','Shooter, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Orbital Bullet is a fast paced 360° action-platformer with rogue-lite elements. Travel to numerous planets, where monsters and dangers await you. Use found ressources to craft new weaponry & upgrades to get stronger. Only a true master of 360° combat will be able to save his home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hxe.jpg'),(19371,'Kingdom Eighties','2023-06-26','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','When the mysterious Greed threatens a small middle-American town, a rag-tag band of brave kids are dragged into an epic struggle of seemingly insurmountable odds to save their families, their neighborhood, and their town.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6voy.jpg'),(19372,'Au-Delà','2022-02-28','Point-and-click, Platform, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Au-Delà is an indie horror puzzle game where the main objective is to find your parents. For this purpose, you will have to explore the entire house, collect information and items, without dying, by solving puzzles or confronting monsters. Au-Delà takes the side of a 2D side view, offering a new experience by making you discover another way to appreciate the dark atmosphere of a horror game. It is especially intended for players who like to explore, solve mysteries and who are not afraid of monsters at night.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4htx.jpg'),(19373,'Mini Mini-Golf','2022-01-26','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Mini Mini-Golf is a minimalistic game about golf in the casual genre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4egd.jpg'),(19374,'Sock Dating Simulator',NULL,'Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A 100% serious game where you turn into a sock... and seduce other socks!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pys.jpg'),(19375,'Realms Beyond: Ashes of the Fallen',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Realms Beyond is a party-based fantasy role-playing game with tactical turn-based combat and full character customization. Explore a huge world and lead your companions into the depth of forgotten dungeons in search for lost treasures. Unveil the ancient mysteries of the Realms Beyond!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1j7i.jpg'),(19376,'Total War Saga: Thrones of Britannia','2018-05-02','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','From the multi-award-winning strategy series, A Total War Saga: Thrones of Britannia combines huge real-time battles with engrossing turn-based campaign, set at a critical flashpoint in history. Anglo-Saxons, Gaelic clans and Viking settlers clash for control. What Kingdom will you build?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wfb.jpg'),(19377,'Shelter Manager','2021-10-08','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','We live in a troubled world. Viruses, military conflicts - you never know what danger the world will face tomorrow. It\'s time to get ready now! Lead a bunker network and start developing society after a global disaster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co410z.jpg'),(19378,'World\'s End Chapter 2','2015-07-15','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The darkly comedic strategy RPG continues. Guide Tevoran and Company and their dubious new allies against bizarre creatures and environmental hazards. Enrage and confuse your enemies, throw exploding obstacles, and roundhouse-kick your way to questionable victory. \n \nFeatures \n4 new playable characters \nMore powerful skills and attacks for veteran characters to learn \nEnemy spawning, survival and four-way free-for-all battle variations \nNew status effects including Contagion, Enraged and HP Regeneration \nOption to continue from Chapter 1 saves \nNew original soundtrack','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2trx.jpg'),(19379,'Ember','2020-01-21','Fighting, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','A passion project 10 years in the making, Ember is a homage to classic role-playing games (RPG). Enter the world of Ember as a resurrected “Lightbringer” summoned to protect the dying Embers as the world is on the brink of collapse. Beginning in the Deep Barrows, traverse vast environments divided between aboveground and underground realms – ranging from lush forests to dry deserts and dark abysses – to reach the City of Light. See how the story unfolds through encounters with strangers by making pivotal decisions about your own destiny.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pv9.jpg'),(19380,'3D Puzzle: Deserted Village','2024-08-15','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Collect a 3D puzzle, transferring things to the right places to create a beautiful place.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8nch.jpg'),(19381,'Bhop PRO','2020-07-05','Platform, Racing, Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','BhopPRO is an amazing game mode where players have to jump on blocks. This game is created to enjoy the gameplay, or to train. There are no victories and winners. Nearly all cards that are used in this mode are designed only for walkthrough. Than the player goes further, moreover, the level becomes more complicated. Here you can play maps on passing with other players, difficulties will cause you interest, and old players will feel nostalgia. Feel new take on the popular bhopping genre.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2umn.jpg'),(19382,'The Expression Amrilato','2017-08-25','Simulator, Quiz/Trivia, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','In \"The Expression Amrilato\", the main character is lost in an alternate world where Juliamo (which in the real world is Esperanto, an existing constructed language.) is the official spoken language.\nTherefore, while enjoying a story between cute girls, you can also learn the Esperanto language!\nThe text in this game has been officially supervised by the National Esperanto Association in Japan.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m2q.jpg'),(19383,'10,000 Player Chess','2025-04-13','Puzzle, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Indie, Card & Board Game','Web browser','Sin descripción','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(19384,'Ironclads: Anglo Russian War 1866','2011-06-21','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Russia sought to seize control of Constantinople. The city controlled the Black Sea straits, an important economic and strategic point of the Black and Mediterranean Sea. This area was the cause of constant conflict with Britain, which was concerned about her Mediterranean interests. The Crimean War had weakened the position of Russia on the Black Sea, but, in the Baltic and North Sea, the Tsar built a new, modern fleet. In 1865, Poland rebelled against Russia. Britain supported the rebels and declared war on Russia. Two objectives of the Royal Navy were to destroy the Russian squadron in the North Sea and the establishment of a full blockade of the North.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xvlo34ucbmx7dds4aqqk.jpg'),(19385,'Infinite Realms',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Discover a blend of 4X Strategy, Deckbuilding, and Roguelite! Find cards and customize them with runes, summon creatures, cast spells, terraform the world and push back Morrigan\'s Corruption!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72zq.jpg'),(19386,'MonsterSoft','2020-10-30','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Manage a game-dev company where your only employees are skillful monsters in this turn-based game. Destroy humans in your free time.\n\nSynopsis:\nMonsterSoft is a game development company that hires only monsters. After personnel reduction, the new CEO appears with a goal to create the game that will knock off the competition. The problem is that he has no idea how to make it... .\n\nNo one said that game creation is an easy task, so hire new employees, kill humans that will appear on your path, and survive in the harsh world of monsters. Your final deadline is B3 Conference in the next few months, so no pressure.\n\nCharacters:\nChoose your dream team from a wide variety of monsters: zombies, vampires, werewolves, ghosts, etc. Each of them has a unique skill-set to kill humans efficiently, scare them off, or follow them till they die from exhaustion.\n\nMultiplayer:\nInvade humans residences with other monsters and check who will get the title of the Employee of the month. Plan your actions carefully and kill humans faster than your coworkers in this rat race. Monster association forbids fights between monsters, but who said that you can\'t do it indirectly?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5lja.jpg'),(19387,'Mighty Switch Force! Collection','2019-07-25','Shooter, Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Switch up the fun with four games in one with Mighty Switch Force! Collection! Take control of cybernetic peacekeeper Patricia Wagon and jump, shoot, and puzzle-solve your way through four fantastic games: Mighty Switch Force!, Mighty Switch Force! 2, Mighty Switch Force! Hyper Drive Edition, and Mighty Switch Force! Academy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co71a2.jpg'),(19388,'Phantom Brigade','2023-02-28','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Phantom Brigade is a cinematic, real-time and turn-based tactical RPG, focusing on in-depth customization and player-driven stories. As the last surviving squad of mech pilots, you must capture enemy equipment and facilities to level the playing field. Outnumbered and out-gunned, lead The Brigade through a desperate campaign to retake their war-torn homeland.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qr3.jpg'),(19389,'Dungeon Explorer','2007-07-06','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Wii, TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine, Wii U, PlayStation Portable','Dungeon Explorer is a multiplayer action/role-playing game where up to five players can play at the same time.\n\nYou, brave soldier, are the last hope of a once-peaceful Oddesia. Yours is a strange world full of magic, hidden dangers and potions. But you have powerful friends. Use them to recover the ORA Stone which was hidden from the conquering evil king, Natas. Deep within the ancient dungeons lies the Stone with powers of life, light, happiness. But where?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yr3.jpg'),(19390,'Transformers: Tactical Arena','2021-11-05','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Card & Board Game','iOS, Mac','Enter the fray in ranked 1-on-1 card-based realtime arena battles against live opponents, a friend or in unranked AI practice battles. This game features nearly 2 dozen characters from Hasbro’s Transformers amongst nearly 50 playable cards each of which can reach level 8 upgraded by currency earned through wins, with cards and other resources awarded randomly by loot crates for the victor.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co49fr.jpg'),(19391,'Endurance: Space Action','2020-09-17','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Endurance: Space Action is a pixel-art top-down shooter with old-school retro vibes. It tells the story of a researcher on a spaceship called Endurance, where one day all the crew members got infected and became insane. Your goal is to survive on this spacecraft and find out what happened to the crew, how this disease spread out around this spaceship, and also rescue your friends that get into a trouble. You’ll be fighting with your former colleagues, as they want you dead now, you’ll be helping you friends who are still sane and haven’t got infection yet.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pwq.jpg'),(19392,'King\'s Bounty: Armored Princess','2012-04-18','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This new world of King\'s Bounty: Armored Princess is full of mysteries and dangers. The new character, the Princess, will encounter horrible creatures, huge monstrous bosses and a new race, the bloodthirsty Pangolins. As in the multi-award winning game on which this expansion is based, the player has many options to resist these new enemies. Various new skills and characteristics of Amelie as well as her chance to fly will help her overcome the hordes attacking the kingdom. The Princess is also accompanied by a tamed dragon, at the very beginning small and amusing, but its abilities develop steadily until it becomes an incredible ally. He will do his best to protect the Princess during the battles, starting with easy blows and treasure hunting and finishing with battle rage and volcano summoning.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j9g.jpg'),(19393,'Cross Country Express - An Oddfellows Mini','2020-04-10','Racing, Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Cross America in a wild goose chase to collect your flock before the annual farm pageant. Leap across a seemingly never-ending assortment of fences, barrels and trees in a deceptively simple runner game. And whatever you do, dont trip.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3nwg.jpg'),(19394,'Machinika Museum','2021-03-23','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to the Museum! Machinika Museum is a mystery game where you discover beautiful and mysterious machines of extra-terrestrial origins in an atmospheric galaxy-spanning 3D puzzle game. Will you be able to understand their stories and discover what happened to their previous owner?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3mqp.jpg'),(19395,'Smash Dungeon',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Smash Dungeon takes inspiration from arcade classics to bring you procedurally generated dungeon mayhem. Fight your way through the dungeons on your own or co-op, killing everything in your path to claim the riches below.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rpb.jpg'),(19396,'Killsquad','2019-07-16','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Hack and slash? Check. Twin-stick-shooter? Check. 4 player coop to slay hordes of aliens & bosses with your friends? Check. Skills, upgrades, weapons, gears, talismans and more to make you stronger? Check. Wake up, bounty hunter. We have a mission for you. Time to clean up the scum of the galaxy.\n\nWelcome to Killsquad: a co-op action game that blends twin-stick shooter, hack and slash and drops in a dash of character customization & progression. Join us on a journey to five planets full to the brim with enemies for you to annihilate. Choose your hero, select your skills, weapons, gears and talismans, and unleash hell through waves of relentless enemies and fearsome bosses.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ssm.jpg'),(19397,'Ash of Gods: The Way','2023-04-27','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','A turn-based tactical story-driven card game set in a fantasy world of Ash of Gods. Two decks, three lines, six factions and a great deal of possibilities to create your own unique strategy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co692t.jpg'),(19398,'Throne of Lies: Medieval Politics','2017-09-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The 3D online multiplayer game of social deduction and mischief, inspired by medieval politics and the Werewolf/Mafia (1986) genre. Gather \'round the tabletop, uniting allies of the realm with strategy to distinguish friend from foe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mzv.jpg'),(19399,'Farland Story Denki: Arc Ou no Ensei','1994-02-10','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC-9800 Series','This is a sequel to the first Farland Story game, released in early 1994. The game looks very similarly to its predecessor. The entire gameplay is dedicated to strategic battles, during which you navigate your large party in turn-based mode over the world map. Once you have issued commands to all your party members, it\'s the enemies\' turn to act. You can attack enemies when they are in range of your weapon, or cast healing and offensive area spells. Your characters level up, can use items, and equip a variety of weapons and armor pieces.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4oxf.jpg'),(19400,'Kamidori Alchemy Meister','2011-04-22','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Adult SRPG with visual novel elements. Gameplay has a heavy focus on item creation, which requires you to kill monsters and get materials to make equipments and items. These can then be sold in your workshop or kept for you and your party members. The story has 9 chapters and 3 routes, as well as New Game+ quests.\n\nSpiritual sequel of Himegari Dungeon Meister, with a heavier focus on item creation.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xhfht5x1e6f7qq1yn3ly.jpg'),(19401,'Jagged Alliance 3: Tactical Edition','2023-07-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Introducing the Jagged Alliance 3 Tactical Edition!\nThis comprehensive kit is housed in a sturdy and waterproof case, ensuring your gear remains safe and dry. The Tactical Belt with a Belt Pouch provides quick and easy access to your essential items, while the A.I.M. pin showcases your allegiance to the cause.\n\nGet to know the characters of Jagged Alliance with a set of 36 character cards, each showcasing their professions and personalities. As you strategize and plan your next move, immerse yourself in the game\'s atmosphere with the official soundtrack on CD. With the Jagged Alliance 3 Tactical Edition, you\'ll be fully prepared to take on whatever challenges come your way!\n\nHere\'s the full overview:\n- The Game on disc in a limited Media Book\n- Outdoor case, 100% water- and dustproof & IP67 certified\n-- Outer dimensions: 258 x 243 x 118 mm\n-- Inner dimensions: 235 x 180 x 106 mm\n- Heavy Duty Tactical Belt for your pants\n- Tactical Belt Pouch for your gadgets\n- A.I.M. Pin\n- Set of 36 Character Cards\n- Original Soundtrack on disc\n\nThis item is worldwide limited to 750 orders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6mbf.jpg'),(19402,'SGS Afrika Korps','2020-11-12','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','The game recreates the campaigns and battles of Erwin ‘Desert Fox’ Rommel’s legendary Afrika Korps, in Libya between 1941 and 1942. Play the Axis forces to conquer the most valuable prize of all: the Suez Canal. Or command the 8th Army soldiers, the famous Desert Rats, to repel the invaders.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47bq.jpg'),(19403,'Dungeon Souls','2016-12-02','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Dungeon Souls is an action-adventure roguelike dungeon crawler which draws heavy inspiration from Nuclear Throne, Risk of Rain, and Overture. Explore vast procedurally generated dungeons, collect loot, and slay hordes of challenging enemies!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1hkt.jpg'),(19404,'Gurk II','2014-03-03','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Android, iOS','The super-charged sequel to the famous 8-bit RPG, Gurk II is a huge new adventure with all of the most requested features added: quests, music, sound, potions, and an improved look! Fans of the original will be shedding tears of joy as they roll for their character\'s stats, board ships, summon monsters and cast powerful area of effect spells. Players not previously familiar with the realm of Gurk will simply stare in slack-jawed wonder at the beautifully pixelated graphics, all the while being serenaded by the lush and authentic MIDI soundtrack. Only the viscerally-compressed sound FX and challenging new combat tactics will snap them back to their senses. This game radiates a pure and unabashed joy of old-school RPGing; your $1 couldn\'t possibly go any further now, or back in 1986 when these kinds of games were actually commercially viable.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/drvllwy3easnbyvnmy73.jpg'),(19405,'Voxie Tactics','2024-04-30','Fighting, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Free-to-play tactical RPG inspired by retro games of the 90s-2000s. Embark on epic quests, battle fierce enemies, earn VOXELs and game items that you truly own.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86sb.jpg'),(19406,'Crossroads Inn','2019-10-23','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Build and manage your tavern, satisfy the wandering hearts and bellies of sinners and sojourners, and, most importantly, send them out throughout the land to make known your fame, near and far. But all of this is merely your first step, as you soon attract the attention of serious political and military forces and slowly become a part of a ruthless race for power.\n\nDare to defy your own fate in an epic campaign or lose yourself in an endless open-world mode. Build your very own tavern, hire and oversee staff, manage your supply chain and specialize your services, research new recipes and encounter a host of unconventional characters. Be smart, be resourceful, and plan ten moves ahead to become the most renowned innkeeper in the realm and one day, as sure as the rising of the sun, you will rise above your station and those who once jeered will look on in wonder.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30yd.jpg'),(19407,'Racine','2024-06-20','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Racine is a strategy, card game that will give you dynamic real time combat with increasing intensity. Quickly use your cards to give your character a chance to survive not only the current fight, but also the ones to come. Everything happens in real time so you need to help your avatar by using your cards before he gets crushed by the relentless attacks of the spirit.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4h2f.jpg'),(19408,'Depths of Ascension',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Depths of Ascension is a turn-based, tile-based traditional roguelike set in a high fantasy world inspired by Sumeria and the early Bronze Age cultures. Explore the twisting corridors of the Maze of Madness and use magic, stealth, diplomacy, brute force, the Gods, anything, to reach the Ascension.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8eoj.jpg'),(19409,'Midnight Protocol','2021-10-13','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A tactical narrative-driven RPG in a digital future. Hack into servers, beat security and steal encrypted data in a world where your identity is just another network address.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3fux.jpg'),(19410,'Wet Girls','2025-02-28','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','WET GIRLS - is an erotic game in the genre of \"Arkanoid\", in which you will have to break the cubes and gradually discover really beautiful and hot images.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ohc.jpg'),(19411,'Gnomes','2025-04-04','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Deploy your gnomes, tend to your garden and prepare your defenses. Every day the map expands further into goblin territory, revealing new threats and resources. Earn gold, invest wisely and carefully combine your upgrades. Survive long enough and face the goblin king. No two runs are the same.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99qb.jpg'),(19412,'Gaia','2020-04-03','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A sci-fi base building survival game, featuring weather system, resource management, human needs, gunplay, agriculture, wave attacks, intelligent AI and more.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zvz.jpg'),(19413,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Danger of the Ooze','2014-11-11','Fighting, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, Nintendo 3DS, Xbox 360','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Danger of the Ooze is a 2.5D platform video game developed by WayForward Technologies and published by Activision . It is the second video game based on the 2012 Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles TV series and features elements from the show\'s second and third seasons. It was released as a sequel to the 2013 game Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles. The game also features gameplay elements and homages to the 1989 Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles NES game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2yj3.jpg'),(19414,'Fushigi no Daibouken: Cirno Kenzan!','2012-06-14','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The Indie game in the long running Fushigi no Dungeon RPG series.\nFushigi no Dungeon RPG series is roguelike, and \"Fushigi no Daibouken: Cirno Kenzan!\" is Toho Project\'s fan game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7gb2.jpg'),(19415,'Ruined King: A League of Legends Story - Deluxe Edition','2021-11-16','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Receive the following downloadable content when purchasing the Ruined King: A League of Legends Story - Deluxe Edition\n- Ruined Skin Variants for all playable Champions: Miss Fortune, Illaoi, Braum, Yasuo, Ahri, & Pyke\n- Lost & Found Weapon Pack\n- Ruination Starter Pack\n\nRise Against Ruin\nUnite a party of League of Legends Champions, explore Bilgewater and set sail for the Shadow Isles to uncover the secrets of the deadly Black Mist.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c6s.jpg'),(19416,'Dolphin Wave','2022-10-19','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','Android, iOS','You control the water machine called \"UMI machine\",\nA new sport, \"Jet Battle\", where you have a chance to shoot energy guns,\nIt has spread around the tropical island, \"wadami\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co522r.jpg'),(19417,'X-COM: Apocalypse','2008-09-05','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','Your mission, as X-COM Commander, is to combat alien aggression and uncover their deadly intentions. But Beware! Alien infiltration into the city and its politics could see you under fire from criminal gangs, religious sects, and even the police! Alien fleets fill the skies, creatures terrorise the city, chaos reigns... Welcome to the war, welcome to the Apocalypse.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g7i.jpg'),(19418,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Mutants Unleashed','2024-10-18','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Embark on an pizza-fueled journey with Leonardo, Raphael, Donatello and Michelangelo to battle an all-new wave of havoc-wreaking mutants as you join forces with familiar faces in thrilling missions across the streets of NYC!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yl5.jpg'),(19419,'Legend of Keepers','2020-03-19','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Google Stadia, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Legend of Keepers is the perfect mix between a Dungeon Defender and a Roguelite. You have been hired as a dungeon guardian by the Dungeons Company. Your job is simple: Protect their dungeons!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xm3.jpg'),(19420,'Aquamarine','2022-01-20','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A quiet survival adventure about perception and discovery in an alien ocean. Explore a planet reclaimed by nature. Cultivate new life to survive. Journey into unknown depths. Find your way home.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ll5.jpg'),(19421,'Rise Eterna','2021-05-13','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Follow the story of Lua and unveil the mysteries surrounding her origins in the tactical RPG, reminiscence of the 16-bit era Japanese strategy games. Recruit up to 14 characters with unique abilities and defeat your worst nightmare in epic fights.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yk7.jpg'),(19422,'Spirit Mancer','2024-11-22','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Slash, Shoot and Break demons, Capture their spirits and summon them out into your battle in the beautiful yet dangerous world of Inferno, Fight against hordes of demons from Ars Goetia and stop the evil queen with the power of the Spirit Mancer.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co932n.jpg'),(19423,'Pixel Mage Quest RPG',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pixel Mage Quest is a single player retro RPG game mixed with modern sandbox gameplay experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w7e.jpg'),(19424,'River City: Rival Showdown','2017-11-21','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Nintendo 3DS','Big Trouble in River City!\n\nMystery is afoot once again for Kunio and his River City pals! One night, Kunio is attacked by two mysterious individuals. On top of that, Riki\'s girlfriend has disappeared, and it\'s up to Kunio to find out the truth! Kunio has just 3 days to unravel the mystery, and he\'ll need your help to take down all who stand in his way!\n\n- Different Story Paths and Different Endings!\n- Bonus Double Dragon Fighting Game Included!\n- 2 Player Local Co-Op Play! Grab a friend and team up together!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4ia1.jpg'),(19425,'Amid the Lines','2021-06-10','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Amid the lines is A beat’em up with amazing fighting mechanics ,and an interesting storyline that will leave you wanting more. join detective Northwood’s journey and fight his fight.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3pyx.jpg'),(19426,'Darkest Dungeon','2016-01-19','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Darkest Dungeon is a challenging gothic roguelike turn-based RPG about the psychological stresses of adventuring. Recruit, train, and lead a team of flawed heroes against unimaginable horrors, stress, disease, and the ever-encroaching dark. Can you keep your heroes together when all hope is lost?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rc4.jpg'),(19427,'The Gristmill',NULL,'Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Sin plataforma','Tactical Deckbuilding Strategy','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(19428,'Realm of the Tempest','2019-05-05','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Realm of the Tempest\" is a new retro inspired fantasy adventure role-playing game from Bramble Gate Studios. The player controls temporal magic, and leads a team of familiar spirits to fight and explore a haunting dreamworld. Searching for resolutions leads to more mystery and doubt, as the player visits ancient kingdoms plagued by black magic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3bz0.jpg'),(19429,'The Imperial Gatekeeper','2019-05-21','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The protagonist Til was a decorated warrior in battle,\nbut ended up being dispatched to work in the \"immigration bureau\" after the war.\nThough feeling very disgruntled, Til made his way to his new work \"station.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zen.jpg'),(19430,'Who Stole My Beard?','2021-08-27','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Inspired by classic point-and-click adventure games of the past, Who Stole My Beard is a casual game suitable for all ages! Your beard has been stolen! You and your loyal dog Leo must investigate the people and places of Beardsville to solve the crime. Uncover conspiracies, find new beards, and don\'t forget to pick up the groceries in this charming town of bearded intrigue.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3fdl.jpg'),(19431,'Heavy Burden','2023-11-29','Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Explore the world in an abstract first-person platformer, immerse yourself in the game\'s philosophical meanings to awaken your desire to think.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5e5s.jpg'),(19432,'Thymesia','2022-08-18','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Thymesia is a grueling action-RPG with fast-paced combat and an intricate plague weapon system. In a kingdom where death spreads, play as a mysterious character known by the code name \"Corvus\". Prey upon your enemies, wield the power of disease and find the truth in your own memories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2w5c.jpg'),(19433,'Jupiter Hell','2025-02-20','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','Jupiter Hell is a classic turn-based roguelike set in a 90\'s flavored sci-fi universe. Rip and tear zombies, demons and unmentionable monstrosities, using shotguns, chainguns and the trusty chainsaw, to the shine of CRT monitors and the tune of heavy metal!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qgw.jpg'),(19434,'Time Loader: First Memories','2020-11-11','Platform, Puzzle, Racing, Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Time Loader: First Memories is a story-driven puzzle-platformer with tiny robots, alternate realities, nostalgic music, and primitive tech from the 90s!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ni0.jpg'),(19435,'Fire Emblem: Eckesachs','2023-10-05','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Game Boy Advance','An FE6 Rom hack starring the villains. The story has been rewritten in its entirety. Follow Zephiel and his jolly cadre of war criminals as they conquer the entirety of Elibe in a tale that is sometimes humorous, sometimes dead serious. Every single playable character from the game has been replaced by a boss and every boss is now a former Elibean playable or ally.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mwv.jpg'),(19436,'River City Girls','2022-01-20','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','River City Girls stars Kyoko and Misako, two street-tough high-schoolers who must fight their way through the six regions of River City to rescue their kidnapped boyfriends, series mainstays Kunio and Riki. Along the way, they\'ll utilize an arsenal of combos, counters, throws, and special attacks; battle an assortment of enemies; accept numerous side quests; level up with experience points; interact with NPCs (including guest stars from past River City games); and shop for a variety of items, food, and gear to boost stats and unlock new abilities. The girls can even wield weapons and recruit defeated foes to join them in combat!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2r5w.jpg'),(19437,'Roots of Tomorrow','2022-05-12','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Legacy Mobile Device','Roots of Tomorrow is a free-to-play, realistic 3D farming simulator where you manage your farm day-to-day using sustainable farming practices. Expand your farm, take care of your animals, upgrade your buildings, invest in research and explore the solutions offered by agroecology.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3zjt.jpg'),(19438,'Fire Emblem: Eligor\'s Spear','2018-12-13','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Game Boy Advance','Long time ago, the remote continent of Amasea was ruled by fearsome warlords. The divine saw no choice but to intervene, and so put an end to the warlords’ tyranny. However, crypts of said warlords still remain scattered throughout Amasea. A collector of rare items and artifacts, Grismond, intends to add one of the warlords’ weapons - Eligor’s Spear, to his collection. This task falls on a trio of thieves: Skylar, Avanni and Camian. Little did they know that obtaining the Spear was the easy part. In doing so, they unknowingly put into motion a cataclysmic chain of events…','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(19439,'Bug Fables: The Everlasting Sapling','2020-05-28','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Bug Fables: The Everlasting Sapling is an adventure RPG following three heroes, Vi, Kabbu, and Leif, as they embark on an epic quest in Bugaria in search of treasure and immortality. The game combines flat objects with 3D physics as the player jumps and utilizes the heroes’ unique abilities to solve puzzles and stun enemies while exploring a variety of unique, colorful areas. Battles are turn-based and with timed button inputs that can enhance your abilities.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6r8x.jpg'),(19440,'Fire Emblem: Sealed Hope','2024-04-30','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Game Boy Advance','Llyr is the tactician of the Cipher Mercenaries, a small group of mercenaries that has accumulated fame over the years. After a successful job, he meets with his best friend, King Mao of Jrablibe who in search of his missing father, Aurlen. He believes his father’s disappearance is related to a object known as the Fire Emblem, and requests Llyr restore it to find further clues to his father.\nUnknowingly to Llyr, his mission would only become a stepping stone into finding out the true meaning behind the world, and his life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mwx.jpg'),(19441,'Deep, In the Forest','2020-04-10','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Game is deck building roguelite card game with RPG elements. Save the forest kingdom from the oppression of the Mad King. The game is developed by a small team of two people - fans of the genre. We want to create our own unique game and we hope you like it!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3oan.jpg'),(19442,'Banners of Ruin','2021-07-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','The Blackfoots have been dealt a mighty blow by the fearsome House Ender - you must infiltrate their defences and cut out the rot.\n\nBuild your deck and fight your way through the city of Dawn\'s Point with card based combat and up to 6 members in your party. Characters loyal to your cause have a set of unique cards and abilities that may augment your deck in powerful, exciting ways. Defeat each of the elite opponents in your path to the city\'s Guard Captain and cripple the Enders at their core. You and your brethren may fall at this attempt, but there will always be others to carry the torch. House Blackfoot will remember, and they will never relent. Encounter a series of scenarios as you travel through the city which may help you, but at the expense of some moral ground.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2g0k.jpg'),(19443,'Hedon: Extra Thicc Edition','2022-02-11','Shooter, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Extra Thicc Edition - A small bonus DLC for those who want to show the developer additional support! The Extra Thicc Edition includes:\n- All Hedon games,\n- Soundtrack,\n- Wallpapers,\n- Avatars,\n- Artworks,\n- The extra thicc in-game HUD cosmetic!\n\nYou get a whole bunch of goodies including wallpapers, avatars, the soundtrack and a special in-game cosmetic HUD designed in the style of an old school dungeon crawler!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t0e.jpg'),(19444,'LEGO Legacy: Heroes Unboxed','2019-07-26','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Windows Phone, Android, iOS','LEGO Legacy: Heroes Unboxed is set in a whole new LEGO world where players will collect classic and modern LEGO minifigures and sets, form a party and engage in epic and fun team battles and adventures. The game will feature iconic, fan favorite universes from yesterday and today, recreated with incredible detail to please players of all ages, from the passionate collectors to those who want to bring back childhood memories.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ll4.jpg'),(19445,'Flooded','2023-04-12','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Flooded is a reversed city-builder, in which you need to optimize your production on an island that shrinks over time. Gather enough resources to flee to safety, while the surrounding world is getting flooded.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6dmy.jpg'),(19446,'Darkest Dungeon II','2024-07-15','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The eagerly awaited follow-up to Red Hook\'s smash hit gothic horror RPG! DDII will test your mettle and drive you to the brink of madness. Armor yourself with purpose and provision your party for the journey ahead. It will be arduous.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6grp.jpg'),(19447,'Pawnbarian','2021-09-24','Puzzle, Strategy, Tactical, Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Pawnbarian is a puzzle roguelike. Use chess moves to control your hero on a tiny dungeon board and learn how to outmaneuver enemies with various traits!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3uwt.jpg'),(19448,'Battle for Wesnoth','2005-09-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Amiga','The Battle for Wesnoth is a turn-based tactical strategy game with a high fantasy theme.\n\nBuild up a great army, gradually turning raw recruits into hardened veterans. In later games, recall your toughest warriors and form a deadly host whom none can stand against! Choose units from a large pool of specialists, and hand-pick a force with the right strengths to fight well on different terrains against all manner of opposition.\nWesnoth has many different sagas waiting to be played. Fight to regain the throne of Wesnoth, of which you are the legitimate heir... step into the boots of a young officer sent to guard a not-so-sleepy frontier outpost... lead a brutal quest to unite the orcish tribes... vanquish a horde of undead warriors unleashed by a foul necromancer, who also happens to have taken your brother hostage... guide a band of elvish survivors in an epic quest to find a new home... get revenge on the orcs by using the foul art of necromancy...\nThere are at least two hundred unit types, sixteen races, six major factions, and hundreds of years of history. The world of Wesnoth is absolutely huge and only limited by your creativity — make your own custom units, create your own maps, and write your own scenarios or even full-blown campaigns. You can also challenge up to eight friends—or strangers—and fight in epic multiplayer fantasy battles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3dg2.jpg'),(19449,'Tombs of Myra','2025-03-29','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Descend into the cursed tombs of Myra and free the souls of ancient warriors.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lhd.jpg'),(19450,'Deltarune: Chapter 1','2019-02-28','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch 2, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','The story follows a human named Kris who lives in a world inhabited by monsters. Kris and a classmate named Susie fall into an unknown place called the \"Dark World\" where they meet Ralsei, who informs them that they are heroes destined to save the world. The trio meets various beings who call themselves \"Darkners\" during a prophesied quest to seal the duplicate Dark Fountain. Mainly through the combat system, the player navigates through different kinds of bullet hell attacks by enemies, which can be resolved peacefully or through violence.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co67zd.jpg'),(19451,'Dissidia Final Fantasy','2009-11-01','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation Portable','Dissidia Final Fantasy is a 3D-arena fighting game with RPG elements featuring 20 characters, heroes and villains, from the first 10 final fantasy games summed by the god of discord and the goddess of harmony to fight over the fate of the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co205i.jpg'),(19452,'The Galactic Junkers','2022-06-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Become the space captain you always wanted to be. There are just a few problems, your ship needs work, there’s a price on your head, and your crew are idiots. Seek your fortune and the truth in The Galactic Junkers, a comedic space combat adventure game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4unk.jpg'),(19453,'F.I.S.T.: Forged In Shadow Torch','2021-09-07','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','It is a metroidvania game that the player will play as a rabbit who can manipulate the big mech-arm on his back, exploring in a vivid diesel punk world and fighting against the evil robot army. There will be a vast world map for the player to explore to meet with friend NPCs and encounter enemies, discover items and weapons and seek for the answers for the secrets hidden behind.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ua0.jpg'),(19454,'Forrader Hero','2024-03-29','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Forrader Hero – turn-based roguelike dungeon crawler where heroes can’t step back and must fight through the end to save their soul in ‘Forgotten Proto.World’ fighting hordes of monsters, undead creatures, and their overlords.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5obi.jpg'),(19455,'Scarf','2023-07-06','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Scarf is a 3D Adventure game, where protagonist Hyke must use his polymorphic scarf to explore a magical environment, solve mysterious puzzles and overcome difficult challenges. Hyke’s scarf morphs into different objects which will help to progress the adventure. Hyke was born in an unknown place, surrounded by other souls. All of them will start a path through the World with the main goal being to meld with it and become part of nature.\n\n\"Mixing walking simulator and 3D platformers, Scarf is an atmospheric and emotional journey about what it means to be a hero. Travel to three beautiful crafted worlds and discover your true destiny.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xt7.jpg'),(19456,'Sei Shoujo Sentai Lakers','1994-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Visual Novel','PC-9800 Series, PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS','Akira Daidōji was just an ordinary teenager until one night he had a strange dream. When he woke up he was contacted by a mysterious stranger from another planet who told him that the Gadram Empire is attacking his homeland because they need the power of the so-called Laker Crystals to survive. Akira was chosen as the next guardian of the crystals. In order to defeat Galvan, the dark leader of Gadram, Akira has to discover five young girls with special powers and assemble a team for the upcoming battle.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3m7x.jpg'),(19457,'Synergy of Serra','2023-06-19','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Synergy of Serra, an upcoming free-to-play PC/MacOS deckbuilding trading card game, promises to revolutionize the card game genre by merging the collectibility of classic Trading Card Games with the infinite replayability of Deckbuilder Card Games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6umh.jpg'),(19458,'Light of Altair','2009-05-04','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Light of Altair is a sci-fi colony building game with a deep plot. Grow colonies from landing pod to metropolis, while sending off new spaceships to expand your territory to other worlds. You are not alone in space, 8 factions from different parts of the world are all following their own agendas in the solar system; diplomacy and orbital-combat are essential to learn.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/jjhyozgeg8ph7eke7yyf.jpg'),(19459,'Conflict of Nations: World War 3','2018-03-15','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Take control of the armed forces of your nation. Become responsible for its military expansion, technological research and economic development. Form alliances and wage total war for global dominance on the battlefields of World War 3.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3ni6.jpg'),(19460,'Knights of Pen and Paper +1 Edition','2013-06-18','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Set out on a grand adventure in this turn-based, retro style, pixel-art RPG, inspired by the great titles of the 90\'s. Take on the roles of in-game players taking on the roles of their characters in a traditional pen and paper RPG session in the ultimate meta roleplaying experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5abq.jpg'),(19461,'Nexomon: Extinction','2020-08-28','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Nexomon: Extinction is a return to classic monster catching games, complete with a brand new story, eccentric characters and over 300 unique Nexomon to trap and tame. The world is on the brink of extinction as mighty Tyrant Nexomon fight for dominion over humans and monsters. Join the guild of tamers and begin an epic journey to restore balance before all hope is lost…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4eq6.jpg'),(19462,'Abandon Ship','2019-10-22','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Take command of an \'Age of Sail\' ship and her crew, exploring a vast, story-filled world that reacts to your decisions. Engage enemy vessels, fortifications and sea monsters in brutal tactical combat, all framed in an art style inspired by classic Naval Oil Paintings.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qfa.jpg'),(19463,'Eternights','2023-09-12','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Eternights is a dating action game where you try to make the most out of life during the apocalypse. Monday: Go on a date. Tuesday: Clear dungeon. Friday: Freak out! The clock is ticking!!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4tg0.jpg'),(19464,'Ember Knights','2022-04-20','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Ember Knights is a fast-paced multiplayer rogue-lite. Build powerful and unique attack synergies on every run by customizing your loadout through weapon upgrade perks, stackable combat and magic skills and game-changing relics. Local and online co-op for 1-4 players!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4osh.jpg'),(19465,'Guile & Glory: Firstborn','2021-10-07','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Turn-based tactical RPG where enemies can only be dispatched by using environmental hazards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41ia.jpg'),(19466,'Blitz Runner','2023-09-08','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In Blitz Runner, you\'ll dash through colorful landscapes, collecting dazzling gems that not only increase your score but also your speed! The more gems you collect, the faster you run, making every game a unique and exhilarating journey.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co72p6.jpg'),(19467,'Die','2019-02-20','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Die is an Adventure-Platform-Horror-Comic-RPG-Arcade Game that takes place in YOUR computer !','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3olr.jpg'),(19468,'I\'m the dirt-for art','2019-09-25','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the name of art, doing obscene things. She is a crush on my junior, she took off a piece of clothes just to become my painting model. She is an amateur model who works part-time in the academy of fine arts. She is cheerful and unrestrained. She has a boyfriend in a relationship. Cheating or being seen as scum.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co43i6.jpg'),(19469,'Soul Tide','2022-03-29','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Android, iOS','Soul Tide is an original title that combines anime girl collection, home simulation, and dungeon exploration. It is set in a fantasy world where witches kindled doom upon the land, and players are destined to turn the tide.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kvm.jpg'),(19470,'Nectar of the Gods','2021-01-27','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Tactical, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','An unquenchable multiplayer real-time strategy game where bugs clash over the sweet nectar of sugary beverages. From Beetle Brigade to Spidey Party, you will artfully master strengths and shortcomings to topple boba shops and coffee bars. The countertop mayhem has begun.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oe6.jpg'),(19471,'Unknown Fate','2021-04-17','Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Unknown Fate is an enigmatic story-driven action adventure set in a surreal world full of mind-twisting puzzles and bizarre creatures.\n\nSet off on an amazing journey through Unknown Fate, a strongly story-driven first-person adventure with many puzzles to solve and enemies to beat. Become Richard, who suddenly passes seamlessly from the real world into a surreal universe. You’ll encounter strange characters, unfamiliar artifacts and scenes resembling Richard’s former life, of which he has lost all memory.\n\nYet, he knows that this is not where he is supposed to be. The world he has come to inhabit is strange and distant. He feels the urge to find out more about this surreal universe and the creatures inhabiting it, in order to find a way out – out and back to his real self, his real life that he knows he has yet to fully recall.\n\nWith no way back and a strong urge for answers beating in your temples, you push on, striving to get a grip on the odd difficulties surrounding you, eagerly awaiting the moment your mind will become untangled when the thread of your journey finally unravels all the way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co249o.jpg'),(19472,'Zombie Rollerz: Pinball Heroes','2022-03-02','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Pinball, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Zombie Rollerz: Pinball Heroes is the ultimate mashup of classic pinball, zombie defense and rogue-like! Shoot, slam and smash your way through hordes of zombies and epic boss fights. Select your hero, it\'s time to become a pinball wizard!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4iho.jpg'),(19473,'Skygard Arena','2024-06-10','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Skygard Arena is a turn-based tactical RPG with a vibrant roster of MOBA-style Heroes. Assemble your squad, equip items and abilities, and outplay your opponents in fast-paced strategic battles. Discover the world of Skygard in a multi-campaign solo adventure, or fight in thrilling PvP matches!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8y24.jpg'),(19474,'Death\'s Door: Digital Deluxe Edition','2021-07-20','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Death\'s Door: Digital Deluxe Edition is a special digital edition of the base game. It includes the full game along with additional digital extras such as a digital artbook and the original soundtrack.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3k80.jpg'),(19475,'Bad North','2018-08-28','Puzzle, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','\"Bad North is a minimalistic real-time tactics roguelite game that combines a charming aesthetic and simple, accessible controls with a surprisingly deep combat simulation.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rg9.jpg'),(19476,'Gu Lady','2020-10-15','Shooter, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Gu Lady is a cartoon style third person action game. In the game, you\'ll have an adventure of nightmares and there are also puzzles for you to solve. You\'ll act Gu JiuXun, a Miao girl, to explore the grave filled with monsters,puzzles and traps,to save her younger...','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j0t.jpg'),(19477,'Warriors of the Nile','2020-08-07','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Choose skill tablets to build your unique squad. Show your tactics in fast-paced battles. Lead the warriors blessed by the Egyptian gods to challenge random levels and powerful bosses. Defeat the Serpent Apophis and bring back the sun.\n\nUnlike most traditional strategy games, Warriors of the Nile provides a faster-paced combat experience. On top of that the roguelite mechanics allow players be able to try different builds each time.\n\n- Ancient Egyptian theme and characters\n- Fast-paced strategy\n- Three unique units\n- Use various tablets to build your elite team\n- Random levels and powerful bosses\n- Rewarding and changeful gameplay','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2h56.jpg'),(19478,'Fallen Legion Revenants','2021-10-28','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Your choices will decide the fates of many in Fallen Legion Revenants! The world is covered in miasma, and the remnants of mankind have taken refuge in a floating castle ruled by a madman. Swap between manipulating events within Welkin Castle as the cunning Lucien and fighting off monsters in the wasteland below as the vengeful Rowena in this real-time action RPG.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nwd.jpg'),(19479,'Bright Memory: Infinite - Ultimate Edition','2022-07-21','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bqk.jpg'),(19480,'Brutal Dinosaur','2021-03-27','Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Brutal Dinosaur is a game that mixes two styles of games, beat em up and shooter in a unique way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30jh.jpg'),(19481,'Dungeon Clawler','2024-11-21','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Arcade','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Dungeon Clawler is a Roguelike Claw Machine Deckbuilder. Build your unique deck, fight enemies by grabbing weapons and items from a claw machine and find special artifacts that help you on your quest to reclaim something you lost... Aim carefully to claw your way through this dungeon!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ygu.jpg'),(19482,'Spacebase DF-9','2014-10-27','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In Spacebase DF-9, you\'ll build a home among the stars for a motley population of humans and aliens as they go about their daily lives. Mine asteroids, discover derelicts, and deal with the tribulations of galactic resettlement in Earth\'s distant future.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2nxm.jpg'),(19483,'VenusBlood Frontier International','2020-02-08','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Loki Muspelheim, an exiled member of demon nobility strives for the throne of the Dark Lord who has wronged him. To succeed the throne and exact his revenge, he must obtain the hidden treasure on the Floating Continent of Yggdrasil, protected by the goddesses of the seasons and their Chief God Odin.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xi1.jpg'),(19484,'Spiritlink Tactics',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Spiritlink Tactics is a story driven, tactical turn-based RPG. Lead your party of mercenaries through strategic battles! Customize each party member with numerous classes and skills!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hz9.jpg'),(19485,'Breach & Clear','2014-03-21','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, PlayStation Vita','Breach & Clear brings deep tactical strategy simulation to PC, Mac and Linux! Build your Special Operations team, plan and execute advanced missions, and own every angle.\n\nChoose your real-world squad -- US Army Rangers, Germany\'s KSK, Canada’s JTF2, UK SAS, and more -- and take on a variety of foes with different skill-sets and abilities. Learn to approach, engage, and dominate your opponents through superior tactics and training.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60pm.jpg'),(19486,'Fire Emblem: The Sacred Stones','2015-01-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Nintendo 3DS, Wii U, Game Boy Advance, Nintendo Switch','In Fire Emblem: The Sacred Stones, you must help protect the nation of Renais from the invading Grado Empire. Plan your strategy, choose your units, and then lead your soldiers in to battle. The more experience your soldiers gain, the more you can upgrade their abilities. This time, your soldiers can gain experience by fighting new monsters in the Tower of Valni.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25q4.jpg'),(19487,'Safire Eshgh','2020-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Safire Eshgh is a third-person action adventure video game made by Iranian center for digital Islamic revolution publishing.\n\nThe story is set in the year 61 AH about \"Mehran\" of Rey an Iranian man who is suffering from past trauma and his meeting with Mukhtar al-Thaqafi.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4hw3.jpg'),(19488,'Deep Sky Derelicts: Station Life',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','Sin plataforma','Station Life, the second expansion to Deep Sky Derelicts, turns the station, your scavenger home and safe haven, into a lively hub! With new bounty contracts, random encounters, station dweller interactions, and the Inventor recruit introduced, players will have plenty to do between raids.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cxb.jpg'),(19489,'Lastfight','2020-04-11','Fighting, Sport, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','LASTFIGHT is bringing 2v2 3D fighting back to your living room! Pick up any available object in one of the 8 stages and teach your opponents a lesson! Play in local multiplayer mode, for up to 4 players, or one-player story mode, with a cast of 10 characters inspired by the comic book LASTMAN.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1s5e.jpg'),(19490,'Airhack',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','You are a secret Agent who begins work for the Airem as Hacker. Hacking servers of global corporations for profit, stealing data, manipulate the stock market, modify peoples academic or criminal records, laundering money, erasing evidence, framing innocent people. Do not trust anyone.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7kvg.jpg'),(19491,'Field of Glory II: Medieval - Sublime Porte',NULL,'Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Sin plataforma','At the end of the thirteenth century, with the Seljuk Sultanate of Rum in terminal decline, Anatolia was divided into several small independent Turkish principalities, called beyliks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ab4.jpg'),(19492,'Fire Emblem: Illuminated','2025-04-22','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure','Game Boy Advance','Fire Emblem: Illuminated is a FE8 romhack that has been in development for over 6 years. The game spans 44 chapters and nearly everything about the game is custom, including story, maps, characters, weapons, music, and much, much more. Follow Jay as he travels around the war-ravaged continent of Ralspar searching for both his place and purpose in the world… While also running from his fate!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9pz2.jpg'),(19493,'Dungeon Punks','2016-08-24','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One','Dungeon Punks is an old-school arcade beat-em-up, packed with new features like tag-team fighting gameplay and an RPG adventure! Nothing beats the thrill of freeze-blasting foes with a genie, as your dwarf tags in to incinerate them with bombs and napalm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q0i.jpg'),(19494,'GrimGrimoire','2007-09-28','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 2','GrimGrimoire allows players to take on the role of Lillet Blan, a young magician who is admitted to a prestigious and mystical magic school; however, on the fifth day of school, everyone mysteriously vanishes. Lillet awakens the next day to discover she is once again living out the first day of school; but her memories from the previous days are intact, giving her the opportunity to solve the mystery behind the disappearances and prevent the tragedy from occurring.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hj5.jpg'),(19495,'AeternoBlade','2017-08-30','Platform, Puzzle, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Nintendo 3DS, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','In the region of Awelsia, vengeful Freyja travels with an unknown weapon called \'AeternoBlade\'. Freyja looks to take revenge on Beladim, the Lord of the Mist who destroyed her village, Ridgerode, and killed her tribe. Her vengeance is helped by Vernia, who has as much merit as Beladim. Vernia taught Freya about the abilities of AeternoBlade. Freya has to venture into many different world dimensions to discover how to annihilate Beladim.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7k1i.jpg'),(19496,'Loopmancer','2022-07-13','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Loopmancer is a 3D horizontal roguelite action game with realistic graphics that takes place in a cyberpunk universe. Players play as a detective who comes back to life after an unexpected death, and battle in this lifelike and futuristic city of the east.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co55xu.jpg'),(19497,'Tortuga: A Pirate\'s Tale','2023-01-19','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','It’s time to see if ye truly have what it takes to become the greatest pirate of the Caribbean! Set sail on the vast and beautiful Caribbean Sea as players commence their journey with their sights on eternal gold and glory. Choose from 18 unique ship types and customize distinct features from the flag and weaponry to the hull and figurehead. It\'s a vast world out there, but you are never truly alone, and players will encounter historical pirate captains who they must decide is friend or foe. Take on trading convoys and settlements in tactical turn-based battles to relieve them of the burden of wealth, and then use your (stolen) riches to upgrade your formidable fleet. With a mighty fleet and enough gold, you might be able to keep your crew happy. But be warned! You are an elected captain, after all, and it is your duty to maintain your crew\'s morale, or else mutiny could be on the horizon…','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60ub.jpg'),(19498,'Fury Unleashed','2020-05-08','Shooter, Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Fury Unleashed is an action platformer where you shoot your way through the pages of an ever-changing comic book. Take advantage of unique combo system to unleash your fury and become a whirling tornado of destruction. Discover why your creator doubted you and prove him wrong.\n\nYour guns are your best friends, and ink is your most valuable resource – collect it from defeated enemies to permanently upgrade your hero. The more dynamic and brave your play style, the greater the rewards! But remember to stay focused at all times, or you will die sooner than you think and lose everything you looted on your way.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2dis.jpg'),(19499,'A Token War','2021-04-28','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','A Token War is a tactical, turn based deck building game where you assemble a unique collection of Tokens and Spells to use in battle across five distinct regions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ysv.jpg'),(19500,'Delivery from the Pain','2022-06-09','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Delivery from the Pain is a survival-themed experience game. You will play a survivor who must explore, fight and gather resources in a world full of zombies. You will make contact with other survivors who you can help or exploit to your own ends. Will you find a way to escape, with or without them?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20z5.jpg'),(19501,'Dogurai','2019-05-27','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dogurai is a retro-styled platormer with animal-like characters, graphics and soundtrack designed with old portable games in mind - down to the limited color ranges and sprite sizes!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co21n6.jpg'),(19502,'Nevaeh','2020-09-17','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','To restore the Village\'s light, the Girl heads to the Tower.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2gee.jpg'),(19503,'Zeno Clash II','2013-04-30','Fighting, Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PlayStation 3, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox 360','Ghat\'s story is far from over: Zeno Clash 2 picks up where the deliciously brazen first game left off. After 4 years of waiting, the sequel to the surreal first-person brawler brings more variety in combat and levels, and even more bizarre storytelling into the beguiling world of Zenozoik. Join forces with your former foe Rimat and battle against scores of angry denizens, preventing their dastardly machinations from being realized.\n\nZeno Clash 2 welcomes new players to the Zeno Clash universe with a new game that will bring them into the universe and fill them in on the backstory. Returning players will delight in the connections between the new settings and the first adventure. All players will thoroughly enjoy playing a first-person brawler that provides a rarity in modern gaming: a truly unique experience.\n\nZeno Clash 2 has beefed up its combat engine with precision punch targeting, blocking, and high-impact hits that only make the bone-crunching, face-rattling fistcuffs more satisfying. The new \"Lock-on\" function gives players a wider range of control for dishing out the damage. New RPG mechanics will allow Ghat and Rimat to punch harder, defend better, and recruit more powerful allies to aid in their quest. Zeno Clash 2 now harnesses the full power of the Unreal III engine to bring the bizarre and beautiful world of Zenozoik to life. ACE Team\'s boundless imagination brings gamers into a universe of surreal foes, fantastic locations, and truly unique visuals that is unlike anything else you will ever play. With the newly added drop-in/drop-out co-op play, Zeno Clash 2 invites you AND a friend to dive once more into the fray!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3l0c.jpg'),(19504,'Harry Potter: Hogwarts Mystery','2018-04-25','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure','Android, iOS','Harry Potter: Hogwarts Mystery is a role-playing video game developed and published by Jam City under license from Portkey Games. Based on J.K. Rowling\'s Harry Potter novels, the game is set in the Wizarding World and situated before the events of the series. Players step into the shoes of a customizable character enrolling in Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry, where they engage in various activities including attending magic classes, learning spells, dueling rivals, dating characters, playing Quidditch, and embarking on quests.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5zp8.jpg'),(19505,'DeathSpank: Thongs of Virtue','2010-11-30','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 3, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360','In his travels DeathSpank has brought justice to the downtrodden, faced the riddle of bacon and defeated evils so horrible they would make just plain evil lose its lunch. DeathSpank: Thongs of Virtue is a hilarious adventure full of violence, sorcery and war-metaphors! And it’s fun! Remember fun? You hit things with swords, blow things up with magical bazookas, zap foes with Tesla Rods or chuck Fire hand grenades at their big stupid dumb heads .\n\nFeaturing the trademark humor found in the original, Thongs of Virtue centers on DeathSpank’s journey through a massive war-torn land; explore the North Pole and the high seas to locate the mystical thongs to bring peace and harmony to the universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3j0b.jpg'),(19506,'Airships: Lost Flotilla','2025-01-23','Fighting, Shooter, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Airships: Lost Flotilla is a steampunk autoshooter where you fight your way through waves of enemies on your way to a safe harbour. Destroy your foes, harvest wreckage, and upgrade your ship.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86v5.jpg'),(19507,'On Any Journey',NULL,'Platform, Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','On Any Journey is an immersive, offline adventure built for two players, demanding tight cooperation and teamwork. With a striking blend of visual styles and inventive co-op puzzle-solving, this game isn’t just about exploring a world—it’s about experiencing a heartfelt story of friendship and self-discovery.\n\nAt its core, On Any Journey is all about the thrill of shared adventure. As Kai, Mateo, and Summer, you’ll embark on an unforgettable quest, encountering the enigmatic magician Bruno, the mysterious, mask-wearing Puka clan, and even a giant rockstar who rules the ocean depths. But no great story is complete without a formidable villain—enter \"Big Man\" and his relentless guards, standing in your way.\n\nThroughout your journey, you’ll face tough choices and thrilling challenges. Confidence will battle self-doubt. Destiny will test your resolve. And when the day comes to an end, will you hold onto who you truly are, or surrender to the fate that seeks to define you?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9nbo.jpg'),(19508,'Gangsta Bean 2','2008-11-06','Point-and-click, Shooter, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Web browser','Gangsta Bean returns, destroying junk food and nastiness where he finds it! More awesome adventures, skills, enemies and powerups. Booyah!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xim.jpg'),(19509,'Disgaea 1 Complete','2018-10-09','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure','PlayStation 4, Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch','A version of Disgaea: Hour of Darkness, including the added content in Afternoon of Darkness and Disgaea PC, was released for Nintendo Switch and PlayStation 4 on October 9, 2018, retitled as Disgaea 1 Complete. Some elements of the game were updated, including adding new higher resolution sprites in the same style as Disgaea 5, changing character art images with the Disgaea 5 artstyle, as well as retroactively replacing some generic humanoid and monster classes that did not appear since Disgaea: Hour of Darkness with classes that do appear in later games in the series.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xcl.jpg'),(19510,'Cats and Seek: Dino Park','2025-03-06','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','John and Emily are on a date to Dino Park. Turns out, not only are there lots of dinosaurs, but there are also many cats playing and hiding there ! Let\'s play hide and seek with the cats in Dino Park! Can you find them all?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7t92.jpg'),(19511,'Survival Revelation: End of Days','2023-07-22','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to this multiplayer survival sandbox game! In this world, you will need to establish your own survival base from scratch, collect materials, make tools, build towns, manufacture weapons, explore unknown fields, and so on. You can team up with other players and survive together, as well as en','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9bes.jpg'),(19512,'Crumbling','2024-03-31','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Meta Quest 2, SteamVR','Who says you’re too old to play with toys? Crumbling is a VR roguelike where you control your character with one hand, just like playing with an action figure! Battle against an onslaught of plastic monsters in thrilling hack’n’slash combat in a romping adventure that’ll take you right back to your childhood.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5d8z.jpg'),(19513,'Wander Hero','2025-01-30','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie, Arcade, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','This is the fantasy of a two-dimensional traverser in a different world. You can take a leisurely and strategically deep adventure. You can also collect beautiful girls without hurting your wallet, and form your own harem... ahem, mercenary group.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5hpb.jpg'),(19514,'Heads Will Roll: Reforged - Threads of Destiny','2024-12-19','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','• French Campaign\nSwitch sides and swear allegiance to the French king, continuing your military career under a new banner - that of kingdom of France. Go on a new ambitious campaign against Paris\' numerous rivals in order to, one by one, bring them all to submission, earning wealth and glory in the process. But don\'t let the glitter of gold blind you as, in the royal service, the cloaks and daggers of maligners and ill-wishers might prove to be way more dangerous than even the sharpest swords and spears of the best enemy knights.\n\n• Bounty Hunting\nAccept the offer of Grace & Glory and abandon the military career in favour of bounty hunting. Accompany your new colleagues on their travels around medieval Europe and complete various contracts, some of which might take you to rather unexpected places. They say that bounty hunters die young — find out if you got what it takes to become an exception from this rule.\n\n• From a peasant to a king\nBetrayal is the worst possible sin. However is it really that bad if the crown of the whole kingdom is at stake? Stop being a pawn in somebody else\'s game and make your own dash for the throne. Seizing the crown will be a challenging task, holding onto it will be even harder. But, if you\'ve got a true monarch\'s ambition, the battle is worth the blood. True greatness is now within your reach — it\'s time to become the king or die trying!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99mn.jpg'),(19515,'Unheard: The Lethal Script','2019-06-13','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Unheard: The Lethal Script is a dlc for Unheard which takes place in The Peak Hotel.\nJoin the investigators as they enter The Peak Hotel and see how this deadly scenario plays out!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5vr8.jpg'),(19516,'The Lord of the Rings: Rise to War','2021-09-23','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical','Android, iOS','In this Geo-strategic Seasonal Wargame, players will embark on new adventures to build armies for conquest and strategically expand their territory in pursuit of the One Ring. Set in the Third Age of Middle-earth, The Lord of the Rings: Rise to War offers an immersive and faithful rendition of the fictional world of Arda and its vast array of characters - from the Ranger of the North, Aragorn, to the Elven Lord of Rivendell, Elrond. Based on their choices to side with good or evil, players can build either Fellowships or Warbands, and collaborate with other members on razor-sharp attack plans and deeply fortified defenses against their rivals.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z9p.jpg'),(19517,'Cthulhu Mythos ADV The Isle Of Ubohoth','2024-06-28','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','A horror dice roll adventure inspired by the Cthulhu Mythos. Much like in a tabletop RPG, \"abilities,\" \"luck,\" and \"dice rolls\" influence the story\'s progression. The protagonist is cursed on an island in the Seto Inland Sea. Investigate the island, uncover the mysteries, and break the curse!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8kxp.jpg'),(19518,'Destropolis','2020-11-27','Fighting, Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Destropolis is a top-down shooter game, inspired by such classic games like “Crimsonland”, “Alien Shooter” or “Nuclear Throne”. It takes place in a futuristic city, filled with red, cube-like enemies. Tear them to pieces with bullets, lasers and nuclear explosions. Play alone or with friends in a local co-op mode. Destroy as many enemies as you can before they overwhelm you.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2tf7.jpg'),(19519,'Danganronpa S: Ultimate Summer Camp','2022-07-20','Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Visual Novel, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Nintendo Switch','Your favorite Danganronpa characters return for a hope-filled Summer!\nWith an all-star dream lineup of characters from each Danganronpa game, gather Hope Fragments at a tropical resort. Explore Jabberwock Island and develop your Dangan characters. Gather money through battle and upgrade your equipment, then defeat bosses and move on to the next island!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xer.jpg'),(19520,'Love Rhythm','2019-11-20','Music, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Behind the hustle and bustle of Seoul City lies many unique stories. It’s revolving love, ambition and even hatred and crime.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co42b3.jpg'),(19521,'Guild of Dungeoneering','2016-07-20','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Quiz/Trivia, Indie, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Guild of Dungeoneering is a turn-based dungeon crawler with a twist: instead of controlling the hero you build the dungeon around him. Using cards drawn from your Guild decks you lay down rooms, monsters, traps and of course loot!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1r24.jpg'),(19522,'AI War: Fleet Command','2009-06-02','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','\"You are outgunned. You are massively outnumbered. You must win.\" These are your orders. \n \nHumanity has already fought its war against the machines -- and lost. AI death squads stand watch over every planet and every wormhole, the few remaining human settlements are held captive in orbiting bubbles, and the AIs have turned their attention outward, away from the galaxy, to alien threats or opportunities unknown. \n \nThis inattention is our only hope: a small resistance, too insignificant even to be noticed by the AI central command, has survived. These are the forces you will command. The AI subcommanders will fight you to the death when they see you -- but your glimmer of opportunity comes from quietly subduing those subcommanders without alerting central processing to the danger until it\'s too late. \n \nYou do have a few things going in your favor. Your ships are much faster. You have safe AI routines to automate defenses and mining outposts. You have production techniques that can churn out fully-outfitted unmanned fighters in seconds. There will never be more than a few thousand of your ships versus tens of thousands of theirs, but through careful strategy you must somehow reach and destroy the heavily-guarded AI cores. \n \nGo forth into the galaxy, steal AI technology, recapture those planets you must in order to achieve your ends, and save what remains of humanity. But draw too much attention to yourself, and the full might of the AI overlords will come crashing down.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/wfbbnuc9ovb2exmwydes.jpg'),(19523,'Vengeance Hunters','2024-10-28','Fighting, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','Neo Geo AES, Xbox Series X|S, Neo Geo MVS, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Vengeance Hunters is an adrenaline fueled Neo-Geo hardware developed beat’em’up that lets you and a friend in local co-op fight mutants, zombies, punks, gangsters, lab techs with bombs (you read that correctly), suited mystery men, cyborgs and more across multiple stages, sub-levels and secret areas.\n\nYou\'ll be focused on fast and frantic action, combos and even a small bit of story. Vengeance Hunters features an amazing OST as well as incredible pixel art. Combat isn\'t the standard era combat that you\'ve seen over and over since the 90\'s. Each playable character has their own Signature Move and style that will greatly change how you play.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8thc.jpg'),(19524,'KardVenture','2023-10-20','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','KardVenture is a survival card game where you play as a legendary hero. Explore mysterious locations, gather resources, build your village and face the challenges ahead, be it a cold blizzard or an orc raid. Stack cards to make combos, craft, build, fight and most important... Survive!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6lrq.jpg'),(19525,'Root','2020-09-24','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Might makes right in the wild wood! The award-winning board game of asymmetrical woodland warfare comes to cross-platform digital play! Combine subtle strategy and bold daring to guide your forest faction to victory!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2myz.jpg'),(19526,'All of Us Are Dead','2023-11-30','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','All of us are not dead. Our school has been infested with zombies, and we are still alive. Every day, our hopes of escaping this school become less and less likely. Follow us as we try to survive and escape our zombie-filled school. A visual novel based on the popular webcomic.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7fnr.jpg'),(19527,'Editor\'s Hell','2024-07-07','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Arcade, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','It’s been two days since you assigned to the editor job on the newspaper. After months of unemployment; you just had to took it. Maybe you have no idea how to do this but; you have a family to look after. Dreams, nightmares, don’t matter anymore; you have a new opportunity in your life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co65rt.jpg'),(19528,'Dead or School','2019-08-29','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Zombies conquered the land of Tokyo.\nWithout hope, in underground shelters, people lived quietly.\n\nHisako, a girl who grew up underground, heard the word “school” from her grandmother.\n\nSchool is where children play and learn. It is a paradise for young people. The best place to spend their youth.\n\nHisako dreamed of this “school”, and one day, she was on an underground train heading above ground. What awaits her? Despair...\n\nDefeat enemies, grow your own character.\nCollect items, create your own most powerful weapons!\nHack and Slash X Girl\'s action','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zje.jpg'),(19529,'Brocula',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One','Embark on an enchanting journey as Brocula, a vampire awakening after centuries. Earn money through part-time jobs, explore the town, salvage your castle, and enhance your vampire skills. Unleash your dark reputation, amass fortunes, and shape your immortal legacy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8786.jpg'),(19530,'Summer Memories','2020-06-15','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','It is the summer break and it has been years since you\'ve last seen your aunt and cousins in the countryside, so you don\'t know what to expect. What could go wrong? Find out in Summer Memories!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co30wm.jpg'),(19531,'Lemuria: Lost in Space','2017-03-17','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Lemuria: Lost in Space is a unique adventure, full of mysteries, puzzles and shocking discoveries. It\'s a combination of point \'n click adventure, RPG and survival game.\" \n \n\"The intriguing story: \nThe Lemuria 7 spaceship has been missing for almost 40 years.  \n \nNow it is back in the Solar System, however there are no crew members on it. It\'s also unclear how the Lemuria 7 has returned and why it has been seriously damaged.  \n \nIn Lemuria: Lost in Space, you play as Abrix - the robot with AI that may operate in extreme temperatures, high levels of radiation and that yields weapon and hacking modules in order to explore the whole ship.  \n \nUnique gameplay : \nAbrix has an ability to overrun security systems. The unique hacking mini-game will challenge your math, geographic and logical thinking skills. There is no time to check Wikipedia - every mistake costs you valuable resources!  \n \nAbrix has a special software that allows him to upgrade himself during the mission. You need to be very careful - if you run out of batteries or an anti-radiation cloak, the mission is aborted and the game is over.  \n \nDangerous exploration: \nIn order to explore over 100 rooms of the spaceship, you\'ll need to solve dozens of puzzles, find valuable resources for the robot and fight with security turrets and other enemies patrolling the ship. \n \nSolving puzzles not only rewards you with priceless resources, but also uncovers the story of the lost crew of Lemuria 7. The level of challenge depends on difficulty - so choose wisely or you\'ll need to start from scratch.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co253k.jpg'),(19532,'Las Vegas Blackjack!','1978-12-31','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Odyssey 2 / Videopac G7000','The computer is the dealer. The object of the game is to get a higher count of cards than the dealer, up to but not over 21. If a player draws cards with a point value over 21, the hand is a BUST, and he loses his bet to the dealer. If the dealer\'s goes BUST, he pays off each of the remaining players. A player may \"draw\" any number of cards until he reaches or exceeds a total of 21. The dealer must \"draw\" a card on 16 or less and \"stick\" with his hand on 17 or more. An ace counts as either 1 or 11 at the player\'s discretion. Kings, queens and jacks count as 10 each. All other cards count as their face value.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/dvk9pngxf0zrxcwhu3wz.jpg'),(19533,'EmergeNYC','2016-11-03','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','EmergeNYC is a genre-bending simulation of New York City\'s Emergency Services. Drive over 30 different firetrucks, police cars, and ambulances alone, or with up to 32 of your friends through busy New York City Streets with blazing sirens and air horns. The game will be set in a fictional dynamic open-world recreation of Manhattan and will give the players the opportunity to step foot in the shoes of a firefighter, police officer, or emergency medical services worker in the Big Apple. They will also be able to act as a dispatcher or incident commander with the ability to manage an emergency scene or operation from above in a real time strategy fashion.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q1o.jpg'),(19534,'Nemesis of the Roman Empire','2004-03-26','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','In the height of its glory Carthage was the greatest power in the ancient world. With trade routes throughout the entire Mediterranean there the was no other nation to dispute its strength. Goods, gold and slaves poured in to the majestic city – the source of its might.\n\nCountless mercenaries armies were constantly bought to ensure that all who threatened Carthage or its interest would be dealt with. However, another Empire was also on the rise. The city of Rome too had begun to gain strength. The Romans soon decided openly to challenge their Carthaginian rivals. The time of the Punic Wars had begun.\n\nThe game is a sequel to Celtic Kings: Rage of War, originally titled Celtic Kings: The Punic Wars.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4vfy.jpg'),(19535,'Sangokushi Taisen Ten','2008-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Card & Board Game','Nintendo DS','A Nintendo DS port of version 3.0 of Sangokushi Taisen, a card-based arcade real-time strategy game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68op.jpg'),(19536,'World\'s End Chapter 3','2017-12-15','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The darkly comedic strategy RPG continues. Will Tevoran and Company find fortune as they plunge deeper into foreign political strife? \n \nFeatures \nAvoid plague spreading corpses, endure poison gas and repel invading zealots \nNew terrain interactions including conveyor belts, hidden switches and more strangeness \nFlying & mounted enemies, remotely detonatable bombs and more new tactical elements \n21 new battles and an original soundtrack \nOption to continue from Chapter 2 saves','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2trq.jpg'),(19537,'Soulash','2019-06-21','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Soulash is a fantasy roguelike where the player takes on the role of a forgotten god set on destroying the world. The main features of the game are consistent open world, perma-death, turn-based tactical combat, a crafting system and a unique inventory system where every item is temporary.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1m2f.jpg'),(19538,'Spotless','2024-07-12','Simulator, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Clean, Clash, and Collect across the crummiest corners of this Single-Player Rogue-Lite. Spend your meager earnings wisely on both permanent and temporary upgrades, so that even the thriving haunts of cute and creepy creatures can’t stop you from cleaning until everything is Spotless!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8t9w.jpg'),(19539,'Drowned God: Conspiracy of the Ages','1996-11-16','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Drowned God: Conspiracy of the Ages is a 1996 science fiction adventure game developed by Epic Multimedia Group and published by Inscape. The game propounds the conspiracy theory that all of human history is a lie and that the human race\'s development and evolution were aided by extraterrestrials. The player attempts to uncover the truth through the course of the game by traveling to a variety of different worlds, interacting with historical and fictional characters, and solving puzzles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7pnu.jpg'),(19540,'Enormosword','2025-04-25','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Web browser, PC (Microsoft Windows)','The prequel to the redeveloped Ginormo Sword. An early showcase of what is to come.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9py0.jpg'),(19541,'Calturin','2022-01-28','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Calturin is a Bullet Hell Boss Rush game where you are resurrected by a necromancer who now holds you in his power. Promised your freedom if you do his bidding, you must traverse the Gauntlet of Portals to unknown lands and conquer deadly beings.\n\n- 10 unique boss fights and 2 paths of pain.\n- A compelling story told through fully voiced NPCs.\n- Choose how to improve your skills as you become stronger.\n- Designed to be suitable for both normal playthrough and speedrunning.\n\nThe Gauntlet of Portals Awaits.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2z69.jpg'),(19542,'Celestian Tales: Old North - Howl of the Ravager',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Sin plataforma','Howl of the Ravager sheds light to events which took place more than twenty years before Celestian Tales: Old North. Glimpse upon the life of young Severin Leroux and witness his first steps to become a hero of the realm.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cdz.jpg'),(19543,'Heroes of Hammerwatch: Pyramid of Prophecy','2019-03-13','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Pyramid of Prophecy, the first expansion to Heroes of Hammerwatch, lets you explore and experience several completely new areas in the world of Hammerwatch - far out in the desert, deep down the pyramid itself, or take your best hero to the arena and see how long you can last!\n\nTons of new enemies, traps and puzzles, gameplay mechanics, items, environments, music and much more!\n\nFeatures:\n- A brand new campaign with 3 new acts and bosses.\n- The new Gladiator class.\n- New upgrades for the town and characters.\n- Several new items, enemies and mechanics.\n- A new survival arena game mode.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sqc.jpg'),(19544,'Chenso Club','2022-09-01','Shooter, Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','It\'s raining aliens! When killed, they leave behind a life force that brings inanimate objects to life. Only the Chenso Club can stop them in this chainsaw-splitting, side-scrolling, brawler/roguelike/platform fighter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vr2.jpg'),(19545,'Grid Force: Mask of the Goddess','2022-09-15','Shooter, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Make a decision and live with it! Grid Force: Mask Of The Goddess is an Action RPG that mixes frenetic real-time grid-based combat with game-changing choices and branching storylines. Recruit, level up, unlock powerful skills and build the ultimate team to take down the goddesses of a decaying world in epic boss fights.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xvb.jpg'),(19546,'Meme Lordz',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Sin plataforma','Meme Lordz is a NFT based blockchain game powered by the BSC network. A top-down RPG, battle, bind and collect as you journey through a mysterious land powered by the collective thought-forms of humanity.\n\nThe Meme Lordz Beta release takes players on a 60+ hour nostalgic, retro journey through Planet Memnon. Players will experience a rich storyline, dynamic combat system, expansive item system & much more!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4q03.jpg'),(19547,'Gamedev Beatdown','2020-04-10','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Live through the life of a developer in Gamedev Beatdown.\n\nHave you ever wondered what goes behind the scenes of games that you love or whose names you never got to hear?\n\nHave you ever been in a meeting that felt more like a war room? With the loudest voice winning arguments and deciding what decision gets implemented?\n\nPlay as a member of a team, making some hard and some not so hard decisions. If you win, your choices get implemented. Lose, and your game and studio might head in a direction you did not sign up for.\n\nWork your way up from arcade-style games to full-fledged AAA releases. Once you start your journey as an Indie developer, move to new studio locations and hire the right people as you work your way up in the industry. There\'s a lot to handle, but you\'ve got this. It was your dream, after all.\n\nDid we tell you how Game Development wasn\'t easy?\n\nFeatures\nProcedural rogue-lite progression.\nPersistent stress tolerance (health) between projects. Think long term instead of battle to battle.\nMove to different locations that unlock some unique games to develop.\nFight over real, real-adjacent, and a few entirely fabricated day-to-day problems game developers face.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wn7.jpg'),(19548,'Climb Challenge: Find Items 4','2024-03-26','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hidden-object adventure game. The player needs to run around the location and look for objects in secret places, climbing into them along walls and ledges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7yh2.jpg'),(19549,'Goodbye Eternity','2021-04-27','Point-and-click, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Goodbye Eternity is a point-and-click, adventure game with elements of visual novel and dating sim.\n\nYou have the possibility to have several paths when you interact with people, especially with women, depending on your actions and answers, the story will be different.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6wg3.jpg'),(19550,'God of War','2022-01-14','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows)','God of War is the sequel to God of War III as well as a continuation of the canon God of War chronology. Unlike previous installments, this game focuses on Norse mythology and follows an older and more seasoned Kratos and his son Atreus in the years since the third game. It is in this harsh, unforgiving world that he must fight to survive… and teach his son to do the same.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1tmu.jpg'),(19551,'Avernum','2000-06-14','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A fantasy role-playing game following the adventures of a group of characters cast down from the surface-world Empire into a prison underworld known as Avernum and their interactions with the society that has formed below.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4prg.jpg'),(19552,'Dungeon & Fighter Mobile','2022-03-24','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','First shown in 2015 by Tencent the game is a port/rebuild of Dungeon Fighter Online for mobile devices being developed by Neople\'s Action Studio.\n\nIt is planned to launch first in China, delayed out of 2020, with a Korean release after.\nReleases in other regions are not currently planned by Nexon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4kn0.jpg'),(19553,'Uno Rush','2009-03-25','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Quiz/Trivia, Card & Board Game','Xbox 360','UNO RUSH is a four-player, social party game that\'s easy to jump into, but hard to leave because you\'ll have so much fun playing. Sort your cards (even off-turn) so you can play them sequentially when it is your turn. The first player to get rid of all their cards wins the round, and scores points based on the remaining cards in opponents\' hands. This fast-paced, family-friendly game is sure to become a hit with you and your friends. UNO RUSH is the sequel to the number-one selling Xbox LIVE Arcade title UNO, and is exclusive to Xbox LIVE Arcade.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2uzp.jpg'),(19554,'Hammer of the Gods','1994-12-31','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','DOS','Hammer of the Gods is a strategy / tactical combat hybrid released in 1994','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/gwvo3ri7tcnl4knxwq8l.jpg'),(19555,'Memoirs of a Battle Brothel','2021-03-22','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Memoirs of a Battle Brothel is an adult, narrative-driven, tactical turn-based RPG inspired by traditional pen-and-paper roleplaying games!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3a1k.jpg'),(19556,'Cats and Seek: Osaka','2024-10-10','Point-and-click, Puzzle, Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Hey, do you have 5 minutes to spare? Let\'s play hide and seek with 100 cats in Osaka! Can you find them all?','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7wzm.jpg'),(19557,'Punk Wars','2021-11-12','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Our civilization has fallen. From the ashes, four new powers emerge. Immerse yourself in a combat-heavy twist on a classic turn-based 4X strategy where steam, steel, atom and diesel-punk corporations clash to spread their technology and the way of life.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40ff.jpg'),(19558,'Shining Force EXA','2007-07-10','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Legacy Mobile Device, PlayStation 2','A bitter war between two world superpowers has raged on for decades with armies of beasts and demons devastating the people and the land. With both sides deadlocked, two young heroes rise up to begin a heroic journey to stop the fighting and unite the divided world. As either Toma, a talented sword fighter boy, or Cyrille, a cunning female sorceress, you\'ll venture into a stunning world of swords and sorcery teeming with a huge variety of tribes. With aggressive offensive and defensive strategies, you\'ll lead your battle party into combat while protecting your home base, the Geo Fortress, from massive attacks.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2j2x.jpg'),(19559,'Aedis Eclipse: Generation of Chaos','2006-05-25','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation Portable','The second Generation of Chaos strategy title on PSP (based on GoC V on PS2) takes place in this world divided into three warring planes. Each world has its own main character and story; therefore, players can experience three different stories at once. Depending on which world the player begins with, the difficulty level will differ. The lower world is regarded as the beginner\'s stage with many tutorials to guide the player through the game. The higher the world you choose to play with, the more difficult it becomes. Battle in each mode using a combination of incredible team customization and item crafting in a multi-unit battle system, with a focus on fast-loading and constant battles to give players a nearly seamless RPG experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ky9.jpg'),(19560,'Das Boot: German U-Boat Simulation','1991-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure','PC (Microsoft Windows), DOS, Amiga','A German submarine simulator partially inspired by the Das Boot movie. The game contains several missions for your submarine, which must be accomplished. There are several battle stations like : torpedo bay, anti aircraft gun, navigation, etc... which must be mastered to succeed.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5xq3.jpg'),(19561,'Reverse Crawl','2019-05-10','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A dungeon crawl where YOU are the dungeon! Lead your minions in tactical turn-based combat against the pesky heroes, and unlock a variety of evil Powers. With a dynamic campaign system and a branching storyline, \"Reverse Crawl\" lets you experience an RPG from a whole new angle!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1l37.jpg'),(19562,'Like a Dragon: Pirate Yakuza in Hawaii','2025-02-21','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','A new legend begins as you step into the steel toe boots of Goro Majima, a man who has lost his memory and reinvents himself as a pirate on the open sea.\n\nEmbark on an over-the-top, modern-day pirate adventure with an ex-yakuza, now pirate captain and his crew as they engage in exhilarating combat on land and sea in the hunt for lost memories and a legendary treasure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8u8o.jpg'),(19563,'From the Depths','2020-11-06','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','In From the Depths you can build and take first-person command of battleships, planes, submarines, space ships, hot air balloons and more! The game contains a wide range of single player content including:\nA creative mode allowing you to push your designs to the limit and ensure the total annihilation of your opponents.\nA strategic campaign waged over hundreds of islands against eight unique factions.\nA Story Mode where you can play missions as each of the eight factions - a fantastic mixture of strategy, design and wild battles! Defend your fleet against waves of enemy forces in a series of extremely tough challenges.\nAdventure mode where you start on a raft and must build up your fleet and travel a dangerous universe fighting or running from enemy fleets\n\nAs well as a wide range of multiplayer content\nDesign with your friends in co-op designer\nPlay a range of adversarial modes\nPlay the entire single player campaign together in co-op','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k0e.jpg'),(19564,'Broken Lines','2020-02-25','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Broken Lines is a war-game with a serious story, told from the perspective of the individual soldiers. A game for people who likes real-time tactics and strategy games, but are too slow to play them. Give orders to you men, while in pause - and total control. Then see the execution in real-time - sometimes resulting in catastrophic failure.\n\nPlay the campaign with randomized missions and non-linear stories. Select and equip your squad. Train them in unique combat skills and perks. Plan your turn in pause mode and see it play out in real-time. Use cover and flanking to overcome the opposition. Rewind the level to avoid casualties and achieve better loot. Manage resources and survive until you either find your way out of the valley or lose your way and your conscience in the process.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xgp.jpg'),(19565,'King of Seas','2021-05-25','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','King of Seas is an Action Role playing game set in a procedural pirate world. An epic adventure awaits you in a fantastic world, dotted with fights, lost islands and treasures. A universe that will keep you anchored as you struggle to become the king of all pirates.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2kjx.jpg'),(19566,'Mario Party DS','2016-04-21','Puzzle, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Card & Board Game','Wii U, Nintendo DS','He\'s captured Mario and his friends in his pursuit of a crystal that the group collected when it fell from the sky, and he doesn\'t hesitate to shrink them to miniature size to get rid of them and get his hands on the other four crystals. The mini-heroes have to find the crystals before he does, making their way through giant environments filled with enormous creatures. The single-player campaign takes place in five different settings, each of them ending with a boss. As usual, players have to collect coins and stars, at the same time escaping dangers such as Piranha Plants and other classic creatures from the Mario universe.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wnx.jpg'),(19567,'Shard of Spring','1987-12-31','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Commodore C64/128/MAX, DOS, Apple II','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/koyguf2dncc3cniu6jvr.jpg'),(19568,'Nioh 2: The First Samurai','2020-12-17','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Nioh 2: The First Samurai is the third and final DLC expansion for Nioh 2, developed by Team Ninja and released in December 2020. The expansion continues the story of the main game, taking players back in time to uncover the origins of the protagonist, Hide, and the legendary first samurai. It introduces new areas to explore, additional story missions, new enemies, and powerful new gear. The First Samurai also expands the game\'s combat mechanics with new skills and abilities, providing a challenging experience for players.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7muv.jpg'),(19569,'Framed Collection','2018-05-17','Point-and-click, Music, Platform, Puzzle, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Nintendo Switch','\"The Framed Collection is the compilation of the the critically acclaimed, multi-award winning, noir-puzzle games Framed and Framed 2, where you re-arrange panels of a comic book to change the outcome of the story.\n\nChange the Order, Change the Outcome.\n\nThe games have been completely overhauled and redesigned for the platform and given extra love and care for our PC players to enjoy the high quality experience that is the Framed universe.\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co216o.jpg'),(19570,'We Heist Too','2024-09-03','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Welcome to the city of Rywadorium! Explore the unique regions of the city and pretend you\'re a regular citizen with no illegal intentions. Enter people\'s homes without permission and immerse yourself into a role of a thief in a unique setting of atomic 1960s fiction, at this regular day at \'work\'.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8bc7.jpg'),(19571,'Hero of the Kingdom','2015-07-06','Point-and-click, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Hero of the Kingdom is casual role-playing game at its best; take to the road and explore a vast and beautiful country full of danger and surprises. Meet and interact with characters to gain knowledge and insight giving you valuable clues. Defend against and attack the enemy, and take it upon yourself to complete quests of varying difficulty. To survive, you must find ways to earn gold by mastering your skills and bartering. You can even collect herbs, hunt for animals, and go fishing.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xnx.jpg'),(19572,'Kingdom Under Fire: The Crusaders','2020-02-28','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','Xbox, PC (Microsoft Windows)','Kingdom Under Fire: The Crusaders is a tactical wargame developed by the Korean studio Phantagram for the Xbox. It is the sequel to the 2001 game Kingdom Under Fire: A War of Heroes, and continues its storyline. Kingdom Under Fire: The Crusaders combines third-person action and role-playing elements in its gameplay, which differs from its predecessor.\n\nIts sequel is Kingdom Under Fire: Heroes. Another sequel is to be released in 2015 entitled Kingdom Under Fire II for PC and PlayStation 4.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2111.jpg'),(19573,'Persona 3 Reload','2024-02-02','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Step into the shoes of a transfer student thrust into an unexpected fate when entering the hour \"hidden\" between one day and the next. Awaken an incredible power and chase the mysteries of the Dark Hour, fight for your friends, and leave a mark on their memories forever.\n\nPersona 3 Reload is a captivating reimagining of the genre-defining RPG, reborn for the modern era.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6z12.jpg'),(19574,'Drakengard 3: Three\'s Prologue','2014-03-13','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3','Play as Zero\'s Sister Three, in this additional level. A prequel to the main chapters of the game about the story of Three. Control Three and find out about her past episodes. (Acquire Ending A to access this DLC).','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5pg6.jpg'),(19575,'Full Gear','2023-03-01','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Engineer your way through a steampunk traditional roguelike. Create drones, use Cogwheels and Tokens, and dismantle many robotic enemies along your way to get all the way to the darkest secret of the dungeon.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co66yi.jpg'),(19576,'Girlfriend Cards','2018-09-20','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hardcore card game. For a limited time, find all the matches. One chance is given.','https://imgur.com/d54MNF7.jpg'),(19577,'Batbarian: Testament of the Primordials','2020-10-15','Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Batbarian: Testament of the Primordials is a snarky action-adventure puzzle game with a good dose of humor. Explore hundreds of secret-filled rooms, fight big bosses, gather companions for your party and use the powers of Pip -your bat buddy- to solve puzzles and escape the eldritch abyss!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2hdz.jpg'),(19578,'Field of Glory II: Medieval - Reconquista','2021-05-20','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Field of Glory II Medieval - Reconquista is a turn-based tactical game set in the High Middle Ages. Developed by legendary designer Richard Bodley Scott it brings the best from the tabletop world into the best digital framework.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3cab.jpg'),(19579,'Usurper: Soulbound','2021-11-02','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Usurper: Soulbound is a tough Rogue-lite Action RPG where players are trapped without a physical body in a horrifying dimension and must possess the bodies of their enemies and other heroes alike as they fight their way back.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3euj.jpg'),(19580,'Druidstone: The Secret of the Menhir Forest','2019-05-15','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','\"Druidstone: The Secret of the Menhir Forest is a fantasy roleplaying game, in which you play the role of a druid who has just been reincarnated. Who are you? How did you die? Your mind is foggy. You only know you are here for a reason. The forest called you here because it needs you.\n\nThe world of Druidstone is a vast procedurally generated forest where you explore ancient ruins, battle monsters with spells and swords, and meet interesting friends and foes. Battles will be fought on a two-dimensional grid using a tactical, turn-based battle system. Using your limited resources wisely is important for surviving in this dangerous world. You start the game barehanded, only clad in a simple cloak but as you discover the secrets of the Menhir Forest you will get more powerful and learn new abilities and battle tactics. At the heart of Druidstone is a gripping story which is told through the encounters and characters you will meet. Perhaps you will team up with an ally or two along the way?\"','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1qup.jpg'),(19581,'Wantless: Solace at World’s End','2023-11-08','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Wantless is a PC turn-based tactical RPG set in a bleak future. Fight woes and nightmares made manifest inside your patients\' procedurally generated minds, craft your own skills with overwhelming freedom, loot, gear up, customize, earn reputation. Leave your mark on a dying world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co47sk.jpg'),(19582,'Master System Plug & Play','2018-12-31','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Plug & Play','Sin descripción','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6pd2.jpg'),(19583,'Shin Megami Tensei: Devil Survivor','2009-01-15','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Visual Novel','Nintendo 3DS, Nintendo DS','Tokyo is in full lockdown, the government\'s swift, coldblooded response to a surprise demon invasion. Trapped within the sprawling metropolis is the city\'s helpless populace, forced to turn on each other in order to survive. A mysterious piece of technology, the COMP, falls into the hands of you and your peers. This device allows you to form contracts, forcing demons to serve you in battle against the otherworldly creatures. There are others with COMPs, so-called demon tamers, who seek to use the demons to satisfy their own whims-be they for justice, peace, or power-in the chaos that was once downtown Tokyo. Where did the demons come from? Why did they appear? Who created the COMPs, and what is their purpose? These questions must soon be answered, for if you fail to solve the mystery, much more is at stake than your own lives.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co26ib.jpg'),(19584,'Dungeon Drafters','2024-03-14','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie, Card & Board Game','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Dungeon Drafters is a mystery dungeon adventure set in a world where magic is cards, and cards are magic. Explore ancient ruins, loot rare cards and employ clever combos to defeat your foes and build the legendary spell deck that could save the world.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bsh.jpg'),(19585,'The Call of Krul\'ar','2022-05-08','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Survive the horrors of the unknown as you expand out to keep from being dragged into the darkness; and devoured by that which lurks inside.\n\nCollect, Combine, Defend, and Expand using the various cards you find in this land.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4r4w.jpg'),(19586,'Zombie Siege City','2024-11-01','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grab your weapon, enjoy the thrill of zombie shooting, and don\'t stop firing until every last zombie is... well and truly dead. Earn rewards for your efforts, unlock new weapons, upgrade existing ones, and exterminate as many walking dead as possible.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9lv8.jpg'),(19587,'Army of Ruin','2022-10-27','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Army of Ruin is an auto-shooter in which you guide legendary heroes on a quest to defeat the Armies of Evil.\n\nGet hold of a deadly arsenal capable of slaying hundreds of enemies in seconds, and you may have a shot at defeating the deadly Army Generals!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ea0.jpg'),(19588,'Prime of Flames','2022-12-15','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Indie, Card & Board Game','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','This is a special strategy game that combines Wargame and Roguelike. As the guider of the former ancestors, you wake up and come. In the name of Star Envoy, you leave for the Human camp, and lead the warriors of different clans with talents and abilities to find the truth of history and disaster.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mmq.jpg'),(19589,'Predynastic Egypt','2017-05-31','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Turn-based historical simulation strategy will lead you through the history of Predynastic Egypt. Starting from 5000 B.C. you will guide the nomadic and humble Egyptian tribe through all the hardships to prosperity and power culminating in the Unification of Lower and Upper Egypt.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vjr.jpg'),(19590,'Atom RPG: Trudograd','2024-02-27','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Atom RPG: Trudograd is a turn-based post-apocalyptic roleplaying game, which continues the story of Atom RPG as a stand-alone sequel/expansion, and follows the traditions set by classic cRPGs such as the early Fallout and Wasteland titles.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2spe.jpg'),(19591,'Zombie Soup','2023-06-06','Shooter, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Zombie Soup is a top-down shooter combined with hack and slash action that follows Ricky, a backpacker who is thrown into an unexpected adventure in an unfamiliar town as he shoots and dodges his way through hordes of bizarre creatures and challenging bosses to save a kidnapped girl!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co46kh.jpg'),(19592,'Snake Pass','2017-03-29','Platform, Puzzle, Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Welcome to Snake Pass; a physical action-puzzle game that sees the player slither, curl and climb their way through increasingly challenging worlds filled with evermore intricate obstacles and fiendishly mind-bending objectives!\n\nSnake Pass is the wriggling brain-child of Seb Liese, who originally came to Sumo from Holland to work on the LittleBigPlanet team. His prototype of ‘real snake physics’ captured the entire studio’s imagination and we’re really proud of the results so far!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co86dd.jpg'),(19593,'BATS: Bloodsucker Anti-Terror Squad','2022-06-07','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A fast and frantic arcade extravaganza with tons of action and gallons of blood! It\'s up to Count Bloodvayne and his vampire powers to rescue his BATS teammates from Scorpion Supreme and Sting\'s evil clutches.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4u0i.jpg'),(19594,'Fairy Tail 2','2024-12-13','Role-playing (RPG), Tactical, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','The sequel to the 2020 \"FAIRY TAIL\" console game has finally arrived! Play as Fairy Tail guild members such as protagonists Natsu or Lucy, and experience first-hand how the dramatic events unfold in the series\' climactic Alvarez Empire Arc. Enjoy epic battles against Zeref, the Emperor of the Alvarez Empire, his team of elites, the Spriggan 12, and the Black Dragon Acnologia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co91x7.jpg'),(19595,'Sir Whoopass: Immortal Death','2022-08-19','Fighting, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5','Meet Sir Whoopass, the hero who due to a series of hilarious and poor life choices manages to bring chaos and disarray to an utopian world. He must find The Villain-Beating Artifact to vanquish The Immortal and stop him from spawning all manner of evil monsters and creatures. Also cheese.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oqe.jpg'),(19596,'Egypt: Old Kingdom','2018-05-24','Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, Mac','Egypt: Old Kingdom is a turn-based strategy, built on the history of the I-VIII dynasties of Ancient Egypt. Take on the role of tjati - the royal viziers, governing the state on behalf of the great pharaohs. Manage resources, assign workers, found new districts, build temples and palaces and discover the amazing history of Ancient Egypt. Become a witness on more than a hundred historical events that occurred from 3150 to 2150 BC. Develop early state on the banks of the Nile to the Greatest Civilization, which created the Wonder of the Ancient World, survived to this day.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co27qt.jpg'),(19597,'Data East Arcade 1','2021-12-08','Platform, Puzzle, Racing, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Arcade','Evercade','Compatible with both Handheld and VS models, the Data East Arcade 1 collection includes the following titles:\n\n- Bad Dudes Vs Dragon Ninja (released as Bad Dudes in North America)\n- Breakthru\n- Burger Time\n- Chain Reaction (released as Magical Drop Plus 1! in Japan)\n- Dark Seal (released as Gate of Doom in North America)\n- Darwin 4078\n- Lock \'n\' Chase\n- Sly Spy (released as Sly Spy: Secret Agent in Europe)\n- TumblePop\n- Wizard Fire (released as Dark Seal II in Japan)','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4bh9.jpg'),(19598,'Undertale: Collector\'s Edition','2018-09-18','Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation Vita, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','A small child falls into the Underground, where monsters have long been banished by humans and are hunting every human that they find. The player controls the child as they try to make it back to the Surface through hostile environments, all the while engaging with a turn-based combat system with puzzle-solving and bullet hell elements, as well as other unconventional game mechanics.\n\nThe Collector\'s edition includes:\n- The complete Undertale soundtrack: Over 100 songs on 2 CDs\n- Undertale sheet music booklet featuring six songs with annotations by Toby Fox\n- A 14k gold-plated brass music box locket\n- A sturdy matchbox-style collector\'s box\n- A standard edition copy of Undertale','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6as4.jpg'),(19599,'Middle-earth: Shadow of Mordor','2014-10-08','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox 360, Xbox One','Middle-earth: Shadow of Mordor is a open world third-person action role-playing video game developed by Monolith Productions and published by Warner Bros. Interactive Entertainment, which takes place in the world of J.R.R. Tolkien\'s Legendarium.\n\nThe game takes place in the 60-year gap between the events of Tolkien\'s The Hobbit and The Lord of The Rings. It is a story of revenge, slaughter, and mystery set entirely in Mordor, the Land of Shadows. At its center is Talion, an ordinary man who loses everything, including his mortal life.\n\nThe game is set in a fully open world, and features various role-playing game elements such as experience points and skills. There are various ways the player can complete their main objective. Aside from the main storyline, there are various side quests and random events the player can complete within Mordor.\n\nThe melee system is inspired by that of the Batman Arkham series. Getting into a good fighting rhythm, using both regular attacks and counter-attacks will improve the player\'s combo multiplier.\n\nA unique feature of Middle-earth: Shadow of Mordor is the Nemesis system. Every enemy in the game has their own name, rank, and memory. These enemies will continue to do their own jobs and tasks even when they\'re off screen. If the player does not kill an enemy in an encounter, this enemy will remember the player and change their tactics and conversations based on the encounter.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co20pd.jpg'),(19600,'Chicago 1930','2003-12-31','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','PC (Microsoft Windows)','The game is a RPG based in Chicago in the 1930s, an era heavily associated with gangsters and mafia.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1zs5.jpg'),(19601,'Grid:Locked',NULL,'Puzzle, Racing, Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Grid:Locked is a city building puzzle game, with an interactive world, varied optional game mechanics - like driving, platforming, collectible hunting - and an engaging narrative.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4b18.jpg'),(19602,'Disciples II: Rise of the Elves','2003-11-20','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Disciples II: Rise of the Elves is an expansion pack to Disciples II: Dark prophecy. It features a new playable race (Elves), a new campaign, new skirmish maps, various new artifacts, terrain types, music and some gameplay enhancements.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28s6.jpg'),(19603,'Secret Kiss is Sweet and Tender','2022-03-11','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Visual Novel','Nintendo Switch','Look at me when you kiss me.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5av9.jpg'),(19604,'The House of Da Vinci 2','2024-05-30','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The long awaited sequel to The House of Da Vinci is finally here. Join more than 1.000.000 players from around the world and dive into the 3D puzzle adventure.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5bft.jpg'),(19605,'Our House','2019-09-07','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Our House, facing huge numbers of soldiers. In theory, there is no winning battle, but there are countless battles in which there are too few to win. It\'s not about strength, it\'s about how to use it and how to distribute it. In OUR HOUSE, weapons will be used to the utmost.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5idt.jpg'),(19606,'The Escapists: The Walking Dead','2015-09-30','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One','Manage your escape from an onslaught of walkers in this cross-over between the time management escape game The Escapists and the blockbuster zombie franchise The Walking Dead. Using the retro graphical style of The Escapists, the game gives you control of Rick Grimes as he tries to secure the safety of a number of familiar characters by seeking out a safe escape route from each area, fending off the zombie hordes and keeping as many of them alive as possible as they escape. The game will faithfully keep to the timeline of the comics, so as you progress you\'ll move through a series of familiar locations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co233x.jpg'),(19607,'Lost to Time','2021-02-12','Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Lost to Time is a metroidvania focused around time manipulation. Play as different Magi (characters you can turn into) in order to overcome otherwise overwhelming challenges.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2sxt.jpg'),(19608,'SC2VN: The eSports Visual Novel','2015-09-22','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Adventure, Indie, Visual Novel','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','SC2VN is a visual novel about the South Korean StarCraft 2 scene. You play as Mach, a foreign semi-pro trying to make it in eSports who soon learns that success in StarCraft takes more than in-game strategy.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wea.jpg'),(19609,'Mad Streets','2021-08-27','Fighting, Simulator, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Indie','Google Stadia, Xbox Series X|S, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','A physics-based couch multiplayer fighter game, casting a wide variety of characters and combat to bring a memorable beat-em-up party experience. Pick up some controllers and settle the score, in Mad Streets!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ia4.jpg'),(19610,'Natural Doctrine','2014-03-19','Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical','PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4, PlayStation Vita','Strategy role-playing gamers be ready, as this game will truly test your ability to conquer the evils that lurk in the sprawling networks of mines and ruins in the areas surrounding the fortress city of Feste. Seasoned explorers and novices alike venture underground into dangerous caves to collect the coveted material known as Pluton. During your first trip down into the depths of one of these mines, you and your new explorer friends quickly realize that things may be more dire than you had imagined as you encounter a brand-new type of evil lurking below the surface. You and your newfound friends must strategically defeat these new difficult foes and warn the kingdom of their presence before it\'s too late.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qt6.jpg'),(19611,'Sovereign\'s Will',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sovereign\'s Will is a turn-based ruler simulator set in the medieval period where each decision you make directly impacts the story. Separate friends from enemies. Accumulate power. Elaborate plans. Keep your eyes peeled. Make a choice.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m0b.jpg'),(19612,'Whispike Survivors: Sword of the Necromancer','2023-07-20','Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Cultivate the strongest monster in this horde survivor farming game! Fight against waves of creatures to beef up your Whispike and use its seeds to create even stronger hybrids!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6spt.jpg'),(19613,'tModLoader','2020-05-17','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','tModLoader (TML) is an open-source, community-driven modification and expansion of the Terraria game that makes it possible to make and play mods.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co48gu.jpg'),(19614,'SmuggleCraft','2019-01-24','Racing, Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Adventure, Indie','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','As a smuggler, your hovercraft is your life. Customize your hovercraft to fit your needs and traverse the dangerous SideWays to increase your reputation. Evade the authorities and aid the many inhabitants of Dirahl to prove you’re the best smuggler around. \n \nHaving no other choice, you agree to his deal and are back on the SideWays, accepting contracts to upgrade your craft and pay back your heavy debt to this mysterious and potentially dangerous character. Dirahl is a beautiful, yet unforgiving world. Will you be the one to save its inhabitants from the reigns of the Auros? Or will you let the Laws of the land be the only deciding factor for freedom? \n \nIn a world where travel, trade, and technology are highly regulated and vitrually inaccessible for most, your deliveries and decisions could decide the fate of your world. As you traverse the unforgiving terrain, you will come to aid or betray the many factions and classes of Dirahl. With over 160 track pieces and over 50 unique hovercraft parts, no two missions will ever be the same. There are no set maps or tracks, so adapt to your opponents and surroundings in order to succeed. Build your hovercraft, make world-changing decisions, and race against your friends to prove yourself to be the fiercest smuggler on Dirahl in this adrenaline-pumping racing game.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/uwmrwtorn3lzgzl3bbdr.jpg'),(19615,'Day D: Tower Rush','2017-07-11','Shooter, Puzzle, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Strategy, Indie','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation Vita, Xbox One','Onwards to the past! Learn the real power of science! Help the professor and his loyal companion deal with hordes of dinosaurs.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co60py.jpg'),(19616,'United Tactics','2017-07-17','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Tactical, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','United Tactics allows you to battle players or bots online. Select from a wide variety of units and design armies that lead you to victory. Use exciting abilities and open new paths with destructible terrain. This tactical turn-based game allows up to 4 players to form teams or fight in an all out free-for-all.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/isglpj4wxkegdn6kx4ck.jpg'),(19617,'Diminutive','2018-12-14','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Diminutive is currently being tested in the Multiplayer Edition of the game, allowing players to fight against one another in vs mode battles, customizing their races, ships, guns and special auras to create a play-style that works for them. We are also allowing players to access Invasion Mode, becoming a cooperative combat unit, fighting off the hoards of cursed ships, trying to take over the galaxies.\n\nThe Multiplayer Edition of the game will offer modes to play ranging from 1 - 4 Players.\n\nVs Mode (2-4 Players): In this mode you will go through the regular multiplayer customization screen listed above, followed by selecting between multiple game modes, such as Deathmatch, Stock Mode and more. You will also have various options of maps and rules to choose from,such as time limits, score points, team battling, etc.\n\nInvasion Mode (1-4 Players): For the \"invasion\" you will once again be able to customize your load-out how you desire and will then have to fight alongside your companions in various locations to find success through defeating waves of enemy/taken over ships. Collect points, upgrade your stats and DON\'T DIE!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1i5b.jpg'),(19618,'Roller Drama','2023-01-26','Role-playing (RPG), Sport, Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS, PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch','Play this story-driven adventure game where you live with five Roller Derby athletes as their coach and hopefully friend... yes it’s a sitcom :-) Also manage real-time full-contact matches on skates: team results and life debacles are all part of the story. Performance is a mindset!?!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3yo0.jpg'),(19619,'Ninja Issen','2023-11-23','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PC (Microsoft Windows), Nintendo Switch','Ninja Issen is Asteroid-J’s game that features hyper ninja action adventure in the cyberpunk world.\nYou, “Kiba,” must use everything in your hands against powerful foes. Look for your chance under the fierce moves of gigantic bosses, and sting like a bee and cut off their limbs!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2oik.jpg'),(19620,'Despot\'s Game: Dystopian Army Builder','2022-09-15','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), PlayStation 5, Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Despot’s Game is rogue-like tactics with turbo-charged battles. Build a team and sacrifice the heck out of them to rush through enemies... and other players!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co401i.jpg'),(19621,'Slash Roll','2020-04-13','Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Card & Board Game','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','After slaying some spire, the taverns of Slash Roll are the ideal place to rest and play this dice pouch-building rogue-like with original mechanics.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co22oh.jpg'),(19622,'Dicey Demons','2024-04-16','Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie, Card & Board Game','Web browser','Do battle against your foes in our newest adventure, Dicey Demons! Choose from an array of enchanted dice to summon adorable (yet killer) demon monsters to do slay your enemies. Make your way through trials and tribulations to earn your freedom through strategic survival and careful planning!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8j9u.jpg'),(19623,'Lucidscape','2021-01-15','Platform, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Lucidscape is a 2D puzzle platformer with elements of exploration and combat. Jump in and conquer the nightmares as you explore fear-centric environments!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2knh.jpg'),(19624,'Lost Judgment: Digital Ultimate Edition','2021-09-21','Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One','Lost Judgment is an action-adventure video game developed by Ryu Ga Gotoku Studio and published by Sega. A sequel to the 2018 game Judgment (a spin-off of the Like a Dragon series), the game focuses on private detective Takayuki Yagami as he investigates a criminal accused of both sexual harassment and murder\n\nJoined by his partner, ex-yakuza Masaharu Kaito, the crime-fighting duo is called on to investigate a seemingly perfect crime whose lead suspect has an airtight alibi. What starts as a tale of revenge reveals a tangled web of conspiracy involving several unlikely factions taking advantage of a broken law system. But as victims pile up and Yagami unravels the truth, he must choose between defending the law or exacting justice.\n\nThe Digital Ultimate Edition includes the following in-game content:\n\n-Lost Judgment base game\n-Detective Essentials Pack\n-School Stories Expansion Pack\n-Character Story Expansion','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3x7k.jpg'),(19625,'Heroish','2022-07-22','Real Time Strategy (RTS), Role-playing (RPG), Strategy','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, iOS, PlayStation 5, Mac, Nintendo Switch','Play as one of six epic heroes, summon troops, sling spells, and destroy enemy towers to achieve victory in this exciting head-to-head castle defense game. Players can enjoy single-player adventures with three campaigns filled with campy storytelling, sweeping musical scores, and hand-crafted environments. Or they can dive into fast-paced battles with friends and family in competitive 1v1 or 2v2 matches. Players can build custom decks and upgrade cards to create monstrous combinations of troops and spells as they aim to defeat their opponents, destroy the Soul Gem that gives them power, and move to the top of the leaderboards.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4xp9.jpg'),(19626,'Troubleshooter: Abandoned Children - White Lion and Black Witch','2020-11-16','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','First extra scenario for Troubleshooter: Abandoned Children, a turn-based strategy SRPG, which adds two new characters with their story and new missions.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2urt.jpg'),(19627,'Time Bandit: Part 1 - Appendages of the Machine','2023-07-24','Puzzle, Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','A darkly comic life sim that unfolds slowly in real time. Manage your money, fuel, and energy while slowly solving puzzles to collect the time crystals and then pull off high-stakes stealthy heists. Steal back time from your employer in this anti-capitalist melodrama, told through lowpoly cutscenes and radio conversations inspired by classic cinematic games.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4x16.jpg'),(19628,'Forma',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Strategy, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Hunt or be hunted in Forma, an immersive sandbox RPG set in a land overrun by living emotions, where every choice shapes a dynamic living world','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97mr.jpg'),(19629,'Blanksword',NULL,'Role-playing (RPG), Turn-based strategy (TBS), Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows)','You’re a fallen Angel, your brain is missing and half of God’s country wants you dead (again!). Battle legions of weird monsters with your smiling sword. Find and customize a large number of skills. Rebuild your brain from scratch and rise against a tyrannical God in this turn-based roguelike RPG!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9mw9.jpg'),(19630,'Essentures','2025-07-01','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Essentures is inspired by the great games of the 90s and late 80s. You will experience a grand story driven adventure through 4 lore rich kingdoms wherein you can catch and collect mysterious creatures, using them as allies or weapons!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rz0.jpg'),(19631,'Towards the Pantheon','2017-10-25','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS), Adventure, Indie','Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac','Join Freyja, Bam, Mishima, and Phenez on their journey Towards The Pantheon! Gone are the rpg cliches of potions and elemental powers; in Towards The Pantheon you dive head first into a simultaneously lighthearted, fun, dark, and painful adventure in this fresh and exciting world!','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28bz.jpg'),(19632,'Warframe: The Sacrifice','2018-06-15','Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PlayStation 4, PC (Microsoft Windows), Xbox One','The Sacrifice is a solo-only main quest that follows the Operator\'s search for the Lotus, who has been taken by Ballas for unknown reasons. The Operator is aided by a new Warframe Excalibur Umbra who possesses unusual anti-Sentient abilities and abnormal memories linked to Ballas and the origin of the Warframes.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/amvm3gsfum6bkhgsnkru.jpg'),(19633,'Ashes of the Singularity: Escalation - Core Worlds',NULL,'Real Time Strategy (RTS), Simulator, Strategy, Indie','Sin plataforma','New worlds are ripe for the conquering in Ashes of the Singularity: Escalation! In Core Worlds, you will face down your enemies on a series of new maps based on real-world geographic locations.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4c6i.jpg'),(19634,'Amatsuki Mahjong','2025-01-20','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Card & Board Game','Android, PC (Microsoft Windows), iOS','Amatsuki Mahjong is a ACG style mahjong game that offers real-time multiplayer online matches. It features four styles of mahjong: Japanese, Sichuan, Taiwanese, and Hong Kong Mahjong. Enjoy a variety of play styles tailored to your preferences.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zr5.jpg'),(19635,'Potion Permit: Complete DLC Bundle','2024-05-30','Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Simulator, Hack and slash/Beat \'em up, Adventure','Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','Customise your room with:\n- Animal Plushies\n- Aquarium\n- Capital Antique Clock\n- Capital Chemist Equipment\n- Christmas Tree\n- Excalibur\n- Giant Noxe Plush Doll\n- Halloween Skull\n- Jack-o\'-lantern Light\n- Lucky Cat Statue\n- Lunar New Year Lantern\n- Lunar New Year Lanterns\n- Miniature Blimp\n- Oriental Folding Wall\n- Pirate Ship Model\n- Potion Permit Poster (F)\n- Potion Permit Poster (M)\n- Red Flower Arrangement\n- Rudolph Plush\n- Santa Sled\n- Seashell Lighting - Desk Lamps\n- Seashell Lighting - Stand\n- Seashell Lighting - Wall\n- Small Fairy Spring\n- Snowman Plush Toy\n- Spooky Ghost\n- Surfboard\n- Vending Machine\n- White Cat\n- Witch\'s Broom\n- Wooden Bear Statue','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8e7v.jpg'),(19636,'Candleman: The Complete Journey','2018-01-31','Platform, Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Candleman: The Complete Journey is a unique puzzle platformer, where light is both a welcome ally and a deceptive foe. Take the role of a little candle who can burn for only 10 seconds, and venture through an unsettling darkness of challenging levels with a smooth difficulty curve. Use your wits to overcome obstacles based on the mechanics of light and shadow, while exploring a wide range of enchanted environments as you seek out the distant glow.\n\nJourney through enchanted worlds, each more mysterious than the last.\nFace innovative challenges rooted in the mechanics of light and shadow.\nBecome immersed in a stunning fairytale, unlike anything you\'ve seen before.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28w2.jpg'),(19637,'Narita Boy','2021-03-29','Platform, Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Adventure, Indie, Arcade','PlayStation 4, Linux, PC (Microsoft Windows), Mac, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch','The retro-futuristic pixel game\n\nExplore and fight in a retro-futuristic world. Swim deep into a oneiric, poetic and unique experience across dimensional planes.\n\nThe aesthetic of the game was inspired by retro pixel adventures (Castlevania, Another World, Double Dragon) with a modern touch (Superbrothers, Sword and Sorcery) and an 80s plot homage (Ready Player One, He-Man, The Last Starfighter), accompanied by the retro synth touch of the old glory days.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2t3i.jpg'),(19638,'Legendary Creatures 2','2023-10-17','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Tactical, Adventure, Indie','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Sequel to the acclaimed Legendary Creatures, created by HideChara, and a fun treat combining both roguelike and auto-battler gameplay. Recruit and evolve a large array of troops, creatures, and an arsenal of weapons, to defeat the demon lord spreading corruption across the land.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co77u6.jpg'),(19639,'Warframe: Rise of the Warlords',NULL,'Shooter, Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat \'em up','PC (Microsoft Windows)','Confront warring factions throughout a sprawling interplanetary system as you follow the guidance of the mysterious Lotus and level up your Warframe, build an Arsenal of destructive firepower, and realize your true potential across massive open worlds in this thrilling, genre-defining third-person combat experience.','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4qd4.jpg'),(19640,'Quar: Infernal Machines','2019-03-15','Role-playing (RPG), Strategy, Turn-based strategy (TBS)','PlayStation VR','Quar: Infernal Machines is the 1st ever turn-based-strategy game available for the PlayStation VR, set in the grimmsical world of Alwyd, based on the Table Top Game system \"This Quar\'s War\".','https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1js8.jpg');
